G["\"Darnassae?\"\n\nThe night elf druid looks at you expectantly, but it is clear you cannot verbally communicate with her.  Undaunted, she points to herself and smiles.  She points at you and smiles once more.  She finally motions several times down the path to the north.\n\nPerhaps she is indicating that there is a druid you can speak to further up the road?"]="\"达纳塞？\"\n\n这位暗夜精灵德鲁伊满怀期待地看着你，但显然你无法与她进行言语交流。她毫不气馁，指了指自己，微微一笑。她又指了指你，再次微笑。最后她朝北面的小路比划了好几次。\n\n也许她是想告诉你，沿着这条路往前走，会有位德鲁伊能与你交谈？"
G["\"Dear Soggy, if you are reading this it means you finally worked up the guts to send someone after the old charter. Well, you're too late.\""]="\"亲爱的湿嗒嗒：如果你正在读这封信，那说明你终于鼓起勇气派人去找那份旧地契了。可惜，你来得太晚了。\""
