G["\"Great job collecting resources for the war,\" they said, \"Have a promotion,\" they said.  What they really meant is \"You're stationed outside a bughive in Silithus with a bunch of sweaty dwarves, Carnes!\"\n\nThanks for the promotion, Captain!"]="\"为战争征集物资干得漂亮，\"他们说，\"给你升个职，\"他们说。他们真正的意思是\"你被派去希利苏斯一个虫巢外头，跟一群臭烘烘的矮人待在一起，卡恩斯！\"\n\n多谢提拔，上尉！"
G["\"Honor,\" Krom'gar, \"No matter how dire the battle... never forsake it.\""]="\"所谓\"荣誉\"，克罗姆加，\"无论战斗多么惨烈……都绝不能舍弃它。\""
G["\"Hope's fire grows when the flames come together.\" - Chi-Ji"]="\"当火焰汇聚一处，希望之火便愈发旺盛。\"——赤精"
G["\"I learned that we work and toil on our little farm, but that the hozen have the whole world as their garden,\" the cub said. \"I learned that we squint by the light of a single candle, but that the hozen enjoy the light of the stars. I learned that I go to school every day, but that the hozen learn by doing.\""]="\"我明白了，我们在自家小农场里辛勤劳作，而猢狲却把整个世界当作他们的园子，\"幼崽说。\"我还明白，我们只靠一支蜡烛的光眯眼过活，而猢狲却享受满天星光。我每天都要去上学，而猢狲却是边做边学。\""
G["\"I will be... The Thunder King.\""]="\"我将成为……雷神。\""
G["\"I'll find you in those clouds, you worm!\" I yelled.  \"And then I'll throw you to Kalimdor!\""]="\"我会在那些云里找到你，你这虫子！\"我喊道。\"然后我就把你扔到卡利姆多去！\""
G["\"Improvise.\" Humph."]="“大展拳脚。”哼。"
