G["\"Iron Eagle.\" Hmph. It's a passenger ship, not a warbird! But hey, a job's a job, and I'll humor Captain \"Bombast\" so long as the prince is paying.\n\nIn any case, welcome aboard."]="\"铁鹰号。\"哼。那是艘客船，又不是战舰！不过嘛，活儿就是活儿，只要亲王还在付钱，我就顺着\"大话”船长点。\n\n不管怎么说，欢迎登船。"
G["\"It is thunder that sends animals cowering and fills the hearts of peasants with dread. Let thunder be my herald, so that my power is felt throughout the land.\""]="\"正是雷霆让野兽瑟缩，让农夫心中充满恐惧。就让雷霆做我的传令官，好让我的力量传遍这片土地。\""
G["\"It is too soon for you to control me, for you have recently left the game.\""]="\"你想操控我还太早，毕竟你最近才刚退出这局游戏。\""
G["\"It's over, Godfrey...\" That's what he told me right before I jumped off of the cliff. NOTHING IS OVER, GREYMANE! I LIVE AGAIN!"]="\"一切都结束了，高弗雷……\"他就是在跳下悬崖之前这么对我说的。什么都没结束，格雷迈恩！我又活了！"
G["\"Khadgar's Mystical Journal, Volume 8.\" I think this is the one I wanted."]="\"卡德加的神秘日志，第八卷。\"我想这就是我要找的那本。"
G["\"Koa,\" they said, \"Go guard the well.\" That's what they said."]="\"科亚，\"他们说，\"去守着那口井。\"他们就是这么说的。"
G["\"Lightning strikes in an instant and is over in a flash,\" he said."]="\"闪电劈下只在一瞬，一闪即逝，\"他说。"
G["\"Lowly\"? I don't care who you are, friend: no one refers to the mighty Millhouse Manastorm as \"lowly\"!"]="\"卑微\"？朋友，我不管你是谁：没人能把强大的米尔豪斯·法力风暴称作卑微！"
G["\"Magic Maladies\", no. \"Magic Matricies\", no. Ahh here we go \"Magic Mysteries\"."]="\"魔法病痛\"，不是。\"魔法矩阵\"，不是。啊，找到了，\"魔法奥妙\"。"
G["\"Magical Flows and How They Effect the World\", by Maginor Dumas. That's the one I was looking for."]="\"魔法洪流及其对世界的影响\"，作者马吉诺·杜马斯。就是这本，我一直在找的。"
G["\"Malty!\"  Hey, \"Malty!\"  I thought you were going to get us shome more booze!  What'sh the hold up?"]="\"马尔蒂！\"嘿，\"马尔蒂！\"我还以为你要去给咱们再弄点酒来呢！磨蹭什么呢？\""
G["\"Nairi, lift this thing!\", they always shout.  Why not \"Nairi, show us your dance moves!\"?  I'm a great dancer."]="\"奈莉，把这东西抬起来！\"他们总是这么喊。怎么就没人说\"奈莉，给我们跳段舞看看！\"呢？我可是个很棒的舞者。"
G["\"Oh Fanny me Fanny, do marry me can ye?"]="\"哦，芬妮我的芬妮，你肯嫁给我吗？\""
G["\"Our backs are hardened by the whips of the mogu,\" he told them. \"Our arms are powerful from building their fortresses. Our minds are sharp from working alongside our enemy. You think the mogu are stronger? I say we are their strength!\""]="\"我们的脊背被魔古的鞭子磨得坚硬，\"他告诉他们。\"我们的臂膀因修筑他们的堡垒而强壮。我们的头脑因与敌人共事而敏锐。你们以为魔古更强？我说，我们才是他们的力量！\""
G["\"Our\" success?  Troll, you played no part in the Horde's victories in Northrend.  While I led our warriors against the Lich King, you merely took back a few scattered islands."]="\"我们\"的胜利？巨魔，部落的诺森德大捷跟你毫无关系。我率领我们的战士对抗巫妖王的时候，你不过是夺回了几座零散的岛屿罢了。"
G["\"Pilgrim's Bounty.\" Hrm. I can understand the tauren's eagerness to express their sense of gratitude and comraderie to the Horde's warchief, but the Forsaken?\n\nI imagined they would have dropped such sentimental traditions long ago."]="\"旅人丰年祭。\"哼。牛头人急于向部落大酋长表达感激与情谊，这我能理解，但被遗忘者？\n\n我还以为他们早就把这种多愁善感的传统丢掉了。"
G["\"Pilgrim's Bounty?\" More like \"Fool's Folly!\"\n\nHundreds of cargo holds full of food given away for free... FREE! It boggles the mind!\n\nStill, I suppose I should shift some of my Poultry Portfolio funds to turkey... I can't believe how big of a bust that chicken investment was. Where did all those Noblegarden eggs COME from?!"]="\"旅人丰年祭？\"不如叫\"蠢人昏招\"！\n\n成百上千个货舱的食物白送出去……白送！简直匪夷所思！\n\n不过，我想我还是该把一部分家禽投资组合的资金转到火鸡上去……真不敢相信那笔鸡的投资亏得那么惨。贵族花园那些蛋到底是从哪儿冒出来的？！"
G["\"Please?\" You have so much to learn... master."]="\"拜托？\"你要学的东西还多着呢……主人。"
G["\"Put the real bolts in,\" he says. \"The kind that won't get us killed,\" he says. Bah."]="\"把真正的弩箭装上去，\"他说。\"那种不会要了我们命的，\"他说。呸。"
G["\"Research?\" Sure."]="\"研究？\"行啊。"
G["\"Security Protocols?\" Ridiculous. Why were the Titans so obsessed with hiding all of their wonderful toys?"]="\"安全协议？\"荒谬。泰坦们为什么这么执着于把他们那些了不起的玩意儿都藏起来？"
G["\"Serve me in life and I will promise to rend the weakness from your soul. To erase it from existence!\" To be chosen... blessed by the Lich King in such a way."]="\"生前为我效力，我便许诺将软弱从你的灵魂中撕裂。将它从存在中彻底抹去！\"能被这样选中……被巫妖王如此赐福。"
G["\"Shalty.\"  That's my name!  Your name should be \"I can't hold onto petsh.\"  I can't believe anyone would trusht you with a beasht."]="\"沙尔蒂。\"那是我的名字！你的名字应该叫\"我连宠物都拴不住\"。真不敢相信竟然有人会把野兽交给你照看。"
G["\"Sincerely, all of us. Even Dog.\""]="\"真诚的，我们所有人。连狗也算。\""
G["\"Something profound.\"\n\nThere. Now whenever someone asks you what Lee Mugfinder said to you at your first meeting, it will always be something profound."]="\"一句意味深长的话。\"\n\n好了。以后不管谁问你，李·马克芬德在初次见面时对你说了什么，答案永远都会是一句意味深长的话。"
G["\"Stash?\""]="\"私藏？\""
G["\"Stay out - no visitors.\" Hah!"]="\"闲人免进——谢绝访客。\"哈！"
G["\"Strength and power are as different as sun and moon.\" - Xuen"]="\"力量与权力，犹如日月之别。\"——雪怒"
G["\"THANK YOU\""]="\"谢谢你\""
G["\"Taurahe?\"\n\nThe tauren druid looks at you expectantly, but it is clear you cannot verbally communicate with her.  Undaunted, she points to herself and smiles.  She points at you and smiles once more.  She finally motions several times down the path to the south.\n\nPerhaps she is indicating that there is a druid you can speak to further down the road?"]="“牛头人语？”\n\n牛头人德鲁伊满怀期望地看着你，但是你显然无法跟她沟通。她微笑着指向自己，然后指着你。最后她向南面的道路指了几下。\n\n或许她是在说那里有能跟你进行交谈的德鲁伊？"
G["\"Thank you for chasing fortune on the distant horizon. Thank you for dreaming. And most of all, thank you for bringing us along.\""]="\"感谢你去遥远的地平线上追寻财富。感谢你敢于做梦。而最重要的是，感谢你带上我们一起。\""
G["\"The Arcanist's Cookbook\" is also gone! This is a disaster!"]="\"奥术师的食谱\"也不见了！这简直是场灾难！"
G["\"The truth shines brightest in clouded times.\" - Yu'lon"]="\"真相在迷雾笼罩之时最为耀眼。\"——玉珑"
G["\"Though blood floods the ground, the mountain is unmoved.\" - Niuzao"]="\"纵使鲜血浸透大地，高山依旧岿然不动。\"——砮皂"
G["\"Thunder quakes the skies long before the lightning strikes, and thunder echoes in the hills long after lightning's power is spent.\""]="\"早在闪电劈落之前，雷霆便已震撼天空；而在闪电之力耗尽之后许久，雷霆仍在山间回荡。\""
G["\"Unscathed,\" indeed."]="\"毫发无伤\"，是吧。"
G["\"Voodoo\""]="\"巫毒\""
G["\"Warchief Vol'jin.\" Does it sound absurd to you, $c? I, for one, certainly won't be taking orders from a troll.\n\n\nBut, he put this little coalition together, and won the day. He's also proven to be impossible to kill - I admire that.\n\n\nTime to test what he's made of..."]="\"大酋长沃金。\"$c，你觉得这话荒唐吗？反正我肯定不会听一个巨魔发号施令。\n\n不过，是他把这么一支小联盟凑到一起，还赢了那一仗。他也证明了自己根本杀不死——这一点我很佩服。\n\n\n是时候试试他到底有几斤几两了……"
G["\"We cannot help you,\" said the Bronzebeard dwarf, \"For if we turn our back on the Dark Irons, they will defeat the Wildhammer and take over Ironforge!\""]="\"我们不能帮你，\"铜须矮人说，\"因为如果我们对黑铁矮人袖手旁观，他们就会击败蛮锤，然后占领铁炉堡！\""
G["\"We cannot help you,\" said the Wildhammer dwarf. \"For if we turn our back on the Dark Irons, they will defeat the Bronzebeard and take over Ironforge!\""]="\"我们不能帮你，\"蛮锤矮人说。\"因为如果我们对黑铁矮人袖手旁观，他们就会击败铜须，然后占领铁炉堡！\""
G["\"We just wanted to say: Thank you.\""]="\"我们只是想对你说：谢谢你。\""
G["\"We know the Mist-Hopper wasn't hired to venture this far beyond the wall. We know it was supposed to be a routine job off the coast of Jade Forest.\""]="\"我们知道跃雾号受雇时并没打算越过那道墙跑这么远。我们知道这本该是翡翠林海岸外一趟例行差事。\""
G["\"We should all be like children, for the world is our elder, and has many things to teach us.\""]="\"我们都该像孩子一样，因为世界是我们的长辈，有许多东西要教给我们。\""
G["\"We'll always be your crew, Soggy. Ship or no ship. We'd follow you anywhere.\""]="\"我们永远是你的船员，湿嗒嗒。有没有船都一样。你去哪儿我们都跟着。\""
G["\"What should have been a week of easy fishing turned into a wild misadventure that ran us aground in the most dangerous place on the continent and nearly got us all killed, because you couldn't stop chasing your hunches.\""]="\"本该是一周轻松的捕鱼，结果却成了一场疯狂的历险，让咱们在这片大陆最危险的地方搁了浅，还差点全军覆没，就因为你不肯停下追查那些预感。\""
G["\"Yaaaaaaaaaarrr... it's driving me insane!\"  Wait... that's not quite how it goes..."]="\"呀啊啊啊啊……我都快被逼疯了！\"等等……好像不该这么说……"
G["\"You dang-blasted rock elementals!\", I said.  \"I'll punch you too!\""]="\"你们这些该死的岩石元素！\"我说。\"我连你们也一块揍！\""
G["$3486W Centrifuge Constructs remain.  We must find and destroy them to disable Varos Cloudstrider's protective shield.  The constructs should be about halfway up The Oculus, on the Band of Acceleration."]="还有$3486W个离心构造体。我们必须摧毁它们，才能破除瓦尔洛斯·云击的护盾。你可以在位于魔环中层的加速之环找到那些构造体。"
