G["$C, Dame Auriferous has conveyed to me her great pleasure in the service that you have done us in the past. She wishes to extend to you her hope that you will continue to be a champion of sin'dorei interests here in the Ghostlands."]="$C，奥莉菲洛丝夫人向我转达了她对你的欣赏之情。她想告诉你，她希望你能继续作为一个辛多雷的勇士，在幽魂之地奋战。"
G["$C, I have something to ask of you."]="$C，我要请你帮个忙。"
G["$C, I need more copper bars! There's a war brewing at the Gates of Ahn'Qiraj and we need supplies! The Alliance has collected $1997w and we need $1998w copper bars in total. If I don't get those copper bars, it's going to be my head on a platter!"]="$C，我需要更多的铜锭！安其拉之战迫在眉睫，我们需要战争物资！联盟已经收集到$1997w块铜锭了，总的需求量是$1998w块。如果我不能完成任务，我就会被砍头的！"
G["$C, I would ask something of you."]="$C，我得请你帮个忙。"
G["$C, I'm going to need a little time to look into this possible business concerning the blood elves. Perhaps you have other tasks that need doing in the meantime?"]="$C，这件事可能跟血精灵有关，我需要一点时间研究下。在此期间，你或许可以做做别的事情？"
G["$C, are you certain you are ready to leave? Take a moment."]="$C, ¿estás $gseguro:segura; de que estás $gpreparado:preparada; para partir? Tómate un momento."
G["$C, back on Azeroth, the Silverwing Sentinels hamper our progress in the woods. We need you there on the battlefront to push them back! You will earn great honor and reputation with the Warsong Outriders for helping us - join us now!"]="$C，回到艾泽拉斯吧， 银翼哨兵妨碍了我们在森林里的伐木工作。我们需要你赶赴那边的前线，将战线推回去！如果你帮助我们，就将获得无上的荣誉，在战歌氏族当中也会积累很高的声望——现在就加入我们吧！"
G["$C, even our hardiest warriors and scouts will need use of the healing arts in the war to come at Ahn'Qiraj. And when there is no magical healing available, they must rely upon our efforts here.\n\nTo date I have collected $2088w runecloth bandages, out of $2090w needed. If you are willing, we should speak further on how you can do your part."]="$C，在即将来临的战争中，即使最勇敢的士兵也需要治疗。当无法运用魔法治疗时，士兵们必须依赖于我们收集的战争物资了。到目前为止，我已经收集了$2088w根符文布绷带，总需求量是$2090w根。\n\n让我们谈谈你能我们做什么吧。"
G["$C, hold your attack, this is just a disguise!  I'm a spy working for the Lower City coalition out of Shattrath City.\n\nI hope you're here to help!"]="$C，不要打了，这只是个伪装！我是沙塔斯城贫民窟的间谍。\n\n我希望你是来这里帮我的！"
G["$C, if you are looking for the Black Prince, you will find him upstairs."]="$C，如果你是来找黑王子的，那他就在楼上。"
G["$C, is it not? Thank you for returning our brothers to us."]="$C是吗？感谢你把我们的兄弟带回来。"
G["$C, look what they've done to our beloved land. The Scourge must be destroyed!"]="$C，瞧瞧他们把我们的家园搞成了什么样子。我们必须消灭天灾军团！"
G["$C, over here."]="$C，这边。"
G["$C, please listen to what I have to say. The Alliance and Horde are preparing for a war with the Silithid and their masters in Ahn'Qiraj. Any assistance that you can lend will be greatly appreciated. As you can see, I am collecting thorium bars here for the war effort. We need to gather $2012w in total, and currently we have $2011w."]="$C，请听我说。联盟与部落正在备战，要同异种虫以及它们安其拉的主人开战。你能提供的任何援助，我们都将万分感激。如你所见，我正在这里为战争收集瑟银锭。我们需要总共收集 $2012w，目前已有 $2011w。"
G["$C, the Horde has gathered all that it needs for the Ahn'Qiraj War! Now we wait for the puny Alliance to catch up. When they do, we'll begin transporting everything to Silithus. It should not be long after the buildup there is completed that the war will begin!"]="$C，部落已经集齐安其拉一战所需的物资了！在等待那帮联盟完成任务之后，我们就可以开始运送物资了。等远在希利苏斯的军队准备就绪时，战争也将拉开序幕！"
G["$C, the cataclysm has crumbled the mountains and the South Sea has rushed in to drown Thousand Needles.\n\nWe need your help, now!"]="$C，这场大灾变震碎了山脉。南海淹没了千针石林。\n\n我们需要你的帮助！"
G["$C, through the efforts of many we have managed to gather up all of the runecloth bandages that the Alliance feels it needs for the upcoming conflict. Were I you, I would ask some of the others here to see if they still have collection tasks that need fulfilling."]="$C，在许多人的帮助下，我们已经设法集齐了联盟所需的战争物资符文布绷带。如果我是你的话，我会问问这儿的其他人，看他们是否需要帮助。"
G["$C, up here! I could use a hand!"]="$c，在这儿！我需要帮手！"
G["$C, we are not ashamed to say that we are in need of all of the assistance that we can get in our fight at Warsong Gulch.  But there is greater honor to be had now than at any time in the past if you so choose to lend us your skills.  As well, the Silverwing Sentinels are sure to look more favorably upon your efforts on our behalf.  Will you join the battle?"]="$C，战歌峡谷迫切需要增援。如果你愿意助我们一臂之力的话，你将获得前所未有的荣誉。银翼哨兵对你的所做所为也会表示敬意。你愿意加入战斗吗？"
G["$C, we have a great need for your help in Warsong Gulch against the Silverwing Sentinels.  And there is even greater honor and reputation with the Warsong Outriders to be gained as well!  Do you have the courage to enter battle?"]="$C，战歌峡谷急需增援，帮助我们对抗银翼哨兵吧。在那里你可以赢得战歌前锋部队的尊敬！你有勇气加入战斗吗？"
G["$C, we need your assistance at Warsong Gulch.  Will you aid us in our fight against the Warsong Outriders?"]="$C，战歌峡谷需要援助。你能帮助我们攻打战歌前锋吗？"
G["$C, you didn't happen to see a courier on your way here? We are awaiting word from Silvermoon City and their messenger is late!"]="$C，你过来的路上有看到一个信使吗？我们正等着从银月城传来的消息，但他们的信使迟迟未到！"
G["$C, you just earned yourself a beating."]="$C，你刚为自己争取到一顿海扁。"
G["$C, you saved me!  I owe you a debt that I can never repay.  I'll go see if I can help the others."]="$C，你救了我的命！你的恩情真是没齿难忘。我最好返回坠毁点，看看有什么需要帮忙的。"
G["$C, you should know the Warchief doesn't trust the undead. Have you heard what happened at the Wrathgate?"]="$C，你应该知道，酋长不信任亡灵。你有没有听说过天谴之门发生的事情？"
G["$C... approach me..."]="$C……靠近我……"
G["$C... you must be the one that's been helping these pitiful mistlurkers."]="$C……$g你:你;一定就是那个一直在帮助这些可怜迷雾潜伏者的人。"
G["$Cs have no respect these days, I tell you."]="我告诉你，现在的$C都不懂礼貌为何物。"
G["$G Brother:Sister;, you are now considered bound by blood to the Netherwing. All of Netherwing will be behind you now! The time to strike at the heart of our enemies is now, friend! We must reclaim our lost heritage."]="$G兄弟:姐妹;，从今往后，你便被视作与灵翼血脉相连。整个灵翼都会支持$g你:你;！朋友，直捣我们敌人心脏的时机就在此刻！我们必须夺回失去的传承。"
G["$G Da-da : Ma-ma;?"]="$G爸爸:妈妈;？"
G["$G He : She; looks pretty powerful. Maybe powerful enough to drive the yaungol back!"]="$g他:她;看上去相当强大。也许强大到能赶走野牛人！"
G["$G Him : Her; look too pretty to be da ruler."]="$g他:她;真是个漂亮的统治者。"
G["$G Him : Her; so tiny!  How $g him : her; rule?"]="¡$g Él : Ella; tan $g pequeño : pequeña;! ¿$g Él : Ella; reinar?"
G["$G King : Queen; $n, me die now."]="$G国王:女王;$n陛下，我现在死了。"
G["$G King : Queen; $n."]="$n$g国王:女王;陛下！"
G["$G King : Queen; not angry with me?"]="¿$g rey : Reina; no $g enfadado : enfadada; conmigo?"
G["$G King : Queen; think... there really is... an Ogri'la?"]="$G国王:女王;陛下，你觉得……世上真的有个……奥格瑞拉吗？"
G["$G Master:Mistress; $n! Master Kang has been asking about you! Perhaps it is your time!"]="$n$g先生:女士;！康恩大人一直在打听你的事情，也许你该去见见他了！"
G["$G Milord : Milady;, $n, we are fortunate to have you here with us."]="$n$G大人:女士;，您能与我们并肩作战，我们感到很荣幸。"
G["$G Mister : Lady; $n, what an unexpected pleasure, $g sir : ma'am;."]="$GSeñor:Señora; $n, ¡qué placer tan inesperado $Gseñor:señora;!"
G["$G Mister:Missy;, if I didn't know better, I'd think you were one of them 'special' peoples. We call em Troggs.\n\nWindsor didn't have no beef with the Dark Irons, after all, his great, great, grand pappy's best friend was a Dark Iron. Which is also probably why that army of Dark Irons didn't kill him on sight."]="$g先生:小姐;，要不是我清楚底细，我还以为你是那种‘特殊’的人呢。我们管他们叫穴居人。\n\n温莎跟黑铁矮人本来就没过节，毕竟他祖爷爷的祖爷爷最好的朋友就是个黑铁矮人。大概也是因为这个，那帮黑铁矮人军队才没一见面就把他宰了。"
G["$G Mr. : Ms.; $n, so very good to see you.\n\nI hope that you are enjoying the Kaja'Cola marketing campaign. We're planning a massive set of explosions for the next phase of the campaign. That always goes over well with our target demographic."]="$gSeñor:Señora; $n, me alegro mucho de verte.\n\nEspero que estés disfrutando de la campaña de marketing de Kaja'Cola. Para la siguiente fase hemos planeando toda una serie de explosiones gigantes. Eso siempre funciona muy bien con nuestro público objetivo."
G["$G Mr. : Ms.; $n, what's wrong with the volcano?"]="$n$g先生:女士;，那座火山发生了什么事？"
G["$G Sir : Ma'am;! I'm here to assist and defend you.\n\nYour orders?"]="$G长官:女士;！我在此协助并保卫$g你:你;。\n\n请下命令。"
G["$G Sir : Ma'am;, yes $g sir : ma'am;! Private Porter reporting for duty and ready to assist you with your medium leather collection needs. The Ahn'Qiraj War is coming and we need to be as prepared as we can be.\n\nAs you can see we have collected exactly $2063w pieces of medium leather, and I have been tasked with gathering a total of $2064w."]="$G长官:女士;，是，$g长官:女士;！列兵波特报到，随时协助你收集中皮。安其拉之战即将来临，我们得尽可能做好准备。\n\n如你所见，我们已经收集了整整 $2063w 块中皮，而我接到的任务是收集总共 $2064w。"
G["$G Sir.:Ma'am.;"]="$G先生:女士;"
G["$G Son : Young lady;, I'm not going to lie to you; things aren't pretty around here.  We're under constant assault by the bugs and our very way of life, our freedom, is at stake!\n\nAre you going to be a responsible citizen and help out?"]="$g孩子:年轻的女士;，我不准备向你撒谎，这里的事情不是那么如意。我们受到了虫子持续的攻击，我们的生活、我们的自由，都受到了威胁！\n\n你愿意尽一位好公民的责任来帮助我们吗？"
G["$GHe's:She's; coming to!"]="¡Se está despertando!"
G["$N, I've come to find out how rampant the effects of Fel Moss are throughout Darkshore. The corruption of Teldrassil and our surrounding lands really concerns the druids of the Cenarian Circle, and all Night elves.\n\nIt is my goal to find out why this has happened and to put an end to it."]="$n，我已经查明魔苔在整个黑海岸的影响有多么的猖獗。泰达希尔和我们周围大地的堕落的确引起了塞纳里奥议会德鲁伊以及所有的夜精灵的关注。\n\n我的目标就是查出为什么会发生这样的事并将其制止。"
G["$P! It is very good to see a friendly face here."]="$P！能在这儿看到一张友好的面孔真是太好了。"
G["$P! Welcome to the Temple of the White Tiger! Xuen runs an amazing tournament that my family has a habit of winning."]="¡$P! ¡$GBienvenido:Bienvenida; al Templo del Tigre Blanco! Xuen organiza un torneo espectacular que mi familia tiene el hábito de ganar."
G["$P, YOU DARE?!"]="$P，你竟敢？！"
G["$R come to look at Orgus?  Take picture, last longer."]="$R来看奥古斯？照相，待久一些。"
G["$R departing Redridge!"]="$R正驶离赤脊山！"
G["$R flesh... must feed!"]="$R的肉……必须吃掉！"
G["$R inbound!"]="$R进入！"
G["$R save me! Thank you! My people thank you too!"]="$r救了我！谢谢你！我的族人同样会感谢你！"
G["$R! Yes, you! Why do you waste time dawdling in this wreck of a city when your rightful place is in Arathi Basin? The League of Arathor is ruthless in its assault; your contribution is needed, and you will be rewarded!"]="$R！对，就是你！你的位置本该在阿拉希盆地，何必在这座破败的城市里虚耗光阴？阿拉索联军攻势凌厉，正需要你的贡献，而你也会得到奖赏！"
G["$R! Your corpse will feed the sea."]="$R！你的尸体会被扔进大海。"
G["$R, I'll have your head."]="$R，我要你的脑袋。"
G["$R, a moment of your time?"]="$R，占用你一点时间好吗？"
G["$R, do not try anything funny. We are watching you."]="$R，别想在这里搞事。我们盯着你呢。"
G["$R, over here! Drive them back!"]="$R，这边！把他们赶回来！"
G["$R, report! What news of significance do you bring? Be quick about your business... Dame Auriferous and I are in the middle of a strategic discussion."]="$R，快说！你带来了什么重要的消息？快点去做你该做的事情……奥莉菲洛丝夫人和我正在进行一次战略讨论。"
G["$R, why would I want to talk to you? Your people probably caused this mess in the first place!"]="$R，我为什么要和你说话？这堆烂摊子很可能就是拜你们所赐！"
G["$R, you are welcome here. Bold Karasshi has already told us of your deeds."]="$R，这里欢迎你。无畏的卡拉希已经跟我们讲过$g你:你;的事迹了。"
G["$R. Have you been sent to speak with me? How long has it been since the master's demise on these very slopes?"]="$R，你要找我？自从主人去世之后，我已经被遗弃多久了？"
G["$c! Zaela said the Horde would provide us with weapons. What do you have?"]="$c！扎伊拉说部落为我们准备了武器。有些什么呢？"
G["$g He's:She's; finally here! The courier is here!"]="$g他:她;终于来了！信使到了！"
G["$g He:She; died in battle. Bow your heads..."]="Ha muerto en combate. Inclinad la cabeza..."
G["$g Hey there cutie, you looking for a ride to Grom'gol? I hear it gets mighty steamy down in those jungles, maybe I could join you for a short vacation, show you a real jungle cat. : Come, take a trip to the wonderful, gorgeous, tropical jungles of Stranglethorn. That's right, you too can be spending your time sunbathing by the crystal blue waters while I stand here in this unbearable heat with nothing to look at but my brother Frezza all day! Enjoy your trip!;"]="$g嗨，帅哥，你想去格罗姆高吗？我听说那里的丛林整日雾气腾腾的，也许我们可以一起度个短假，我让你看看真正的丛林虎怎么样？:来吧，参观一下奇妙绚丽的荆棘谷丛林。你可以在水晶般的蓝色海岸线上惬意地洗日光浴，而我却站在这难以忍受的高温下整天傻看着我的兄弟弗雷萨！尽情享受你的旅程吧！;"
G["$g Magister:Magistrix; $n is a great combatant.  $g Magister:Magistrix; $n must make Prince Kael'thas very proud."]="$g魔导师:女魔导师; $n 是位出色的战士。$g魔导师:女魔导师; $n 一定让凯尔萨斯王子非常骄傲。"
G["$g Poppy:Mama;!"]="$g爸爸:妈妈;！"
G["$g Sir:Ma'am;!"]="$g阁下:女士;！"
G["$g Sir:Ma'am;, my life for the Horde!"]="$g长官:女士;，我的生命属于部落！"
G["$g Sir:Ma'am;, would you sign my weapon? My young ones would be most thankful."]="$g 阁下:女士;，您愿意在我的武器上签个名吗？我儿子一定会开心死的。"
G["$gHe's:She's; one of Krennan's -- King's orders.  Besides, it looks like we have bigger problems coming our way."]="$g他:她;已经是克雷南的人了。这是国王的命令。而且，看样子我们还有更大的问题要处理。"
G["$gHe's:She's; one of our veteran Rank 9 brawlers here in Brawl'gar. It's $n!"]="$g他:她;可是我们搏击竞技场最精锐的9级拳手之一：$n！"
G["$gHe's:She's; one of our veteran Rank 9 brawlers here in the Brawlpub. It's $n!"]="$g他:她;可是我们搏击竞技场最精锐的9级拳手之一：$n！"
G["$gHey there, handsome.  You want to go somewhere after this?  Just you and me?:Back off, skank.  I'm trying to put out a vibe here, and you're ruining it.;"]="$g嘿，帅哥。比赛结束后去别处坐坐怎么样？就我们俩？:滚开，烂货。我正想搞搞气氛呢，都被你搞砸了。;"
G["$gHey there, stranger. I'd brawl with you any day of the week.  And I promise you, it'll last longer than 2 minutes.\n<Helga winks disarmingly.>:I saw you making eyes at Harr back there. That tauren is MINE.\nWhy don't you drag your ugly, gold-digging face to another blimp?;"]="$g嘿，陌生人。我随时都乐意跟你打上一架。我保证，肯定能撑过两分钟。\n\n<赫尔加不经意地眨了眨眼。>:我看见你在后面朝哈尔抛媚眼了。那个牛头人是我的。\n\n你怎么不把你那张又丑又爱攀高枝的脸挪到别的飞艇上去？;"
G["$gHis:Her; name was $n."]="Se llamaba $n."
G["$gRight away, sir:Right away ma'am;!"]="$g马上，阁下:马上，女士;！"
G["$gSir, yes sir:Ma'am, yes ma'am;!"]="$g阁下，是阁下:女士，是女士;！"
G["$gSir:Ma'am;!"]="$g阁下:女士;！"
G["$n - help! The ropes ... please..."]="$n，救命！这绳子……救命……"
G["$n - please see me. I need your help."]="$n，请过来一下。我需要你的帮助。"
G["$n KILL! $G He:She; kill you now! RUN! RUN!"]="$n杀的！$g他:她;现在就要杀了你！快跑！快跑！"
G["$n and $g his : her; comrades in arms have chosen to accept honorable combat within the sacred confines of Valhalas."]="$n y sus compañeros en la lucha han decidido aceptar un combate honorable dentro de los sagrados confines de Valhalas."
G["$n attacking! Help!"]="$n在攻击我！救命啊！"
G["$n brought us booze!  Let's party!"]="$n给我们带酒来了！我们狂欢吧！"
G["$n calls for food!"]="¡$gUn:Una; $n pide comida!"
