G["$n claims the Draenei Ruins!  If left unchallenged, the Horde will control it in 1 minute!"]="$n突袭了德莱尼废墟！如果不赶快采取行动的话，部落将在1分钟内占据它！"
G["$n claims the Fel Reaver Ruins! If left unchallenged, the Alliance will control it in 1 minute!"]="$n突袭了魔能机甲废墟！如果不赶快采取行动的话，联盟将在1分钟内占据它！"
G["$n claims the Fel Reaver Ruins! If left unchallenged, the Horde will control it in 1 minute!"]="$n突袭了魔能机甲废墟！如果不赶快采取行动的话，部落将在1分钟内占据它！"
