G["$n claims the Mage Tower! If left unchallenged, the Horde will control it in 1 minute!"]="$n突袭了法师塔！如果不赶快采取行动的话，部落将在1分钟内占据它！"
G["$n claims the Snowfall graveyard!  If left unchallenged, the Alliance will control it!"]="$n突袭了雪落墓地！如果不赶快采取行动的话，联盟将会占领它！"
G["$n claims the Snowfall graveyard!  If left unchallenged, the Horde will control it!"]="$n突袭了雪落墓地！如果不赶快采取行动的话，部落将会占领它！"
G["$n claims the blacksmith!  If left unchallenged, the Alliance will control it in 1 minute!"]="$n突袭了铁匠铺！如果不赶快采取行动的话，联盟将在1分钟内占据它！"
