G["$n!  Betrayer of Ragnaros!"]="¡$n! ¡$gTraidor:Traidora; de Ragnaros!"
G["$n!  Da crystals sing about you!"]="$n！水晶在为你歌唱！"
G["$n!  I hardly recognized you in your new outfit.  Still have that tunic... or did you take the chausses... or was it the staff?   I can't recall, it was so long ago...\n\nWell, I'm glad you are here to help out again.  We could use all the help we can get.  $n, if you perform the way you did back in Westfall with the People's Militia, we have a chance.\n\nThese are dire times, if we don't win this battle, there may not be a Westfall to return to."]="$n！你换上了这身新行头，我差点没认出你来。那件外衣你还在穿吗……还是说你拿了那条护腿……又或者是那根法杖？我记不清了，那都是好久以前的事了……\n\n总之，很高兴你又来帮忙了。我们现在能多一个人手是一个。$n，只要你能拿出当年在西部荒野跟着人民军时的表现，我们就还有机会。\n\n眼下形势危急，这场仗要是打不赢，可能就没有西部荒野可以回去了。"
G["$n!  I hear you're Ironstock's new little whipping $r.  What's she got ya doin' now?"]="$n！听说你成了铁斯托克手下新收的受气包 $r。她这回又使唤$g你:你;干啥？"
G["$n!  I hope you're ready to get to work, because there is much for you to do here on Sunstrider Isle.\n\nEver since the destruction of the Sunwell by Arthas and the Scourge, we have been a race adrift on a sea of uncertainty.  We teeter on the edge of oblivion.  This will change, $c, and you will learn and aid our recovery at the same time.\n\nThe Outland awaits us!"]="$n！希望你已准备好开工，因为逐日岛上有很多事等着你去做。\n\n自从阿尔萨斯和天灾摧毁太阳之井以来，我们整个种族就像在茫茫大海中漂泊无依。我们摇摇欲坠，濒临湮灭。这一切都会改变，$c，你将在学习的同时协助我们复兴。\n\n外域在等着我们！"
G["$n!  I know where the other emissary went."]="$n！我知道另一个使者到哪里去了。"
G["$n!  I know where the other troll went."]="$n！我知道你要找的那个巨魔去了哪里。"
G["$n!  I remember your hunting prowess all too well.  You might have gotten off to a shaky start in Stranglethorn, but you stuck in there and became one o' the finest when you bagged old Bangalash.\n\nBut listen, $g lad : lass;, the prey out here in the Outland is the real deal.  And I've the scars to prove it!"]="$n！你的狩猎本领我记得清清楚楚。你在荆棘谷开头也许不太顺，但你坚持了下来，还在猎杀老邦加拉什之后成了一把好手。\n\n不过听着，$g小子:丫头;，外域这里的猎物才是真家伙。我身上的疤可以作证！"
G["$n!  I'm finished!"]="$n！我搞定了！"
G["$n!  Our supplies are dwindling and until we get more we can't launch large ground assaults into the Field of Strife!\n\nSpeak with the Stormpike Quartermaster.  He'll tell you what you can do to resupply our assault forces."]="$n！我们的补给越来越少，在拿到更多物资之前，我们没法向征战平原发动大规模地面进攻！\n\n去跟雷矛军需官谈谈。他会告诉你该怎么做才能为我们的突击部队补充物资。"
G["$n!  Prepare to meet your doom!"]="$n！准备迎接你的死亡吧！"
G["$n!  Thanks again for all the help."]="$n！再次感谢你的帮助。"
G["$n!  What are you doing talking to me?  You should be out fighting the Horde!\n\nI have assault orders for one of our field marshals in the Field of Strife, but I need someone I can count on.\n\nPerhaps if your standing with the Stormpike militia were higher, I could count on you..."]="$n！你在做什么？你应该出去为了部落而战！\n\n我需要一名值得信赖的人去征战平原，去找指挥官传达攻击命令。\n\n要是你的声望再高一点，我也许能派你去……"
G["$n!  You're back!  And not a moment too soon!"]="$n！你终于回来了！"
G["$n! $n! $n!"]="¡$n! ¡$n! ¡$n!"
G["$n! Ah, fantastic to see you out and about. Busy as always, hm?"]="$n！啊，见到你真是太好啦。你还是很忙吗？"
G["$n! Brewmast Boof sent me to fetch a vial of pure water from the water spirits but Poppers ate the offering. Now I have no way to convince them to give me one and they don't look very friendly. Do you think you could persuade them for me?"]="$n！酒仙布夫派我从水灵这取一小瓶纯净水，但是波普吃了我们的贡品。现在，我没有办法说服他们给我一瓶，而且他们看上去并不十分友好。你认为你能为我说服他们吗？"
G["$n! CAN YOU HEAR ME? Just checking to see if you're paying attention."]="$n！你听到我的话了吗？噢，我只是确定一下你有没有专心听讲而已。"
G["$n! Come here! Surely you know of the battle that rages within Alterac Valley back on Azeroth. We need every able-bodied fighter we can muster. Fight with the Stormpike Guard and defeat the Frostwolves!"]="$n！过来！相信你肯定听说过艾泽拉斯大陆上著名的奥特兰克山谷吧。我们需要集合所有强壮的士兵，与雷矛卫兵一起击败霜狼氏族！"
G["$n! Come here. I have a ... \"special project\" requiring your assistance."]="$n！过来。我有个……\"特殊项目\"需要你帮忙。"
G["$n! Finally!\n\nYou must take this beacon and plant it in the eastern crater of the central battle grounds. My flight will attack when the beacon beams its coordinates!"]="$n！你总算来了！\n\n你必须带着这个信号灯并把它放置在中心战场东部的凹地中。当信号灯指示出坐标后，我的小伙子们就会进攻！"
G["$n! Get out of the black ooze on the ground!"]="$n！快躲开地面上有黑色污泥的地方！"
G["$n! Great work decoding the message. Let's get to the bottom of this.\n\nAre you ready to fly?"]="¡$n! Hiciste un buen trabajo al descodificar el mensaje. Veamos qué se esconde detrás de este asunto.\n\n¿$gListo:Lista; para volar?"
G["$n! Help!"]="$n！帮帮我！"
G["$n! How are you? I hear things from here and there about your heroics."]="$n！你好啊！到处都在传颂你的英勇事迹。"
G["$n! How can I help you, old friend?"]="$n!我该怎样帮助你，老朋友？"
G["$n! How have ye been $g lad : lass;? Show me what ye've learned since I saw ye last, we'll see if there's anything new I can teach ye."]="$n！$g小子:丫头;，你近来可好？让我看看你自上回见面后学到了什么，说不定我还能再教你些新东西。"
G["$n! How ya doin', hon?"]="$n！你还好吗？"
G["$n! I am delighted to see that you are celebrating the Wanderer's Festival with us!\n\nIt is often said that pandaren are not the adventurous sort. But look around at these faces - ah, you see? The starry eyes of dreamers!\n\nI should think that someday soon, there will be many more pandaren adventurers to speak of, making a difference all over the world. Don't you think?"]="$n！很高兴看到你来和我们一起庆祝云游节！\n\n人们常说熊猫人不是探险的料。但是看看周围的这些人的脸庞，啊，你看到了吗？这些属于梦想家的闪亮眼睛！\n\n我相信不久的将来，就会出现更多被世人传颂的熊猫人冒险家，他们会遍布世界的各个角落并有所作为。你不这样觉得吗？"
G["$n! I'm glad you made it."]="$n！真高兴你做到了。"
G["$n! I'm watching you!"]="$n！我正在看着你！"
G["$n! I've been awaiting your return. What be takin' ya so long, mon?\n\nIt be time to complete da conversion of da Blightbloods.\n\nJoin me and witness the creation of our army!"]="$n！我一直在等你。你怎么去了那么久？\n\n我们可以对荒芜之血进行转换了。\n\n让我们共同见证军队的诞生吧！"
G["$n! I've been wondering how you were. What's kept you?"]="$n！我一直在担心你。有事耽搁了吗？"
G["$n! It's me! Remember? From the Tian Monastery?\n\nIt took me a while, but I've finally graduated! Xiao, too, and... well, everybody else that you see here.\n\nWe're not students anymore. We're on our first quest - the quest to find the Hidden Master."]="$n！是我！还记得我吗？天禅院的！\n\n虽然花了我不少时间，但我终于毕业了！晓也毕业了，还有……嗯，这里的所有人。\n\n我们不再是弟子了。我们正在执行第一个任务——找到隐秘大师。"
G["$n! Ovah he'ah!"]="$n！到这里来！"
G["$n! Please tell me that monster, the Trade Prince, didn't survive?!"]="$n！请告诉我那个混蛋贸易大王已经挂了……"
G["$n! So strange to see you here, far from the green forests of Pandaria.\n\nWhen I first sailed away from the Wandering Isle, years ago, this ragged shore was one of the first places I visited. Ahh! The air still smells the same!\n\nBut times have changed. Back then I helped Thrall, Vol'jin, Rexxar and Rokhan to lay the foundation of Orgrimmar. Today, I hardly recognize the place.\n\n<Chen's face falls.>\n\nSo much needless bloodshed. I just don't understand. Has Pandaria taught us nothing?"]="$n！真没想到，居然能在离潘达利亚的葱郁森林这么远的地方见到你。\n\n许多年前，当我第一次乘船离开迷踪岛时，这片怪石嶙峋的海滩是我最先造访的几个地方之一。啊！这里的空气还是这个味儿！\n\n但时代不同了。那时，我帮助萨尔、沃金、雷克萨和洛坎为奥格瑞玛打下了基石。今天，我差点就认不出这地方了。\n\n<陈的脸沉了下来。>\n\n太多毫无意义的流血牺牲了。我真不明白。潘达利亚给我们的教训还不够吗？"
G["$n! Some of my men are trapped in the basement - there is little time, help me save them!!"]="$n！我手下不少人被困在了地下室。时间不多了，帮帮我救出他们吧！"
G["$n! Still fighting the good fight?"]="$n！你依然是称霸沙场的勇者吗？"
G["$n! Stormwind is under siege by elementals and needs your strength!\n\nWe've evacuated most of the city.  King Wrynn is holding the Trade District while Lady Proudmoore and the Archbishop defend the Mage and Cathedral Districts.\n\nWherever you go, you'll be of great help."]="$n！暴风城已陷入元素的围困，需要你的支援！\n\n我们已疏散了大部分市民。乌瑞恩国王正在守卫贸易区，吉安娜·普罗德摩尔女士与大主教本尼迪塔斯正分别镇守法师区和教堂区。\n\n不论你要去哪儿，你的帮助都是必不可少的！"
G["$n! THIS AREA IS OFF LIMITS!"]="$n！此地区严禁入内！"
G["$n! The Warchief is alive - he was rescued off the coast. Come outside, quickly. The town is ours!"]="¡El Jefe de Guerra! ¡Está vivo! Le rescataron frente a la costa. ¡Sal, rápido! ¡La ciudad es nuestra!"
G["$n! The crystals sing your praises!"]="$n！水晶在赞美你！"
G["$n! What can I do for ya?"]="$n！我能为你效劳吗？"
G["$n! What else have you been up to out there? Let me give you a word of advice; don't accept a promotion that'll take you out of the action."]="$n！你在那里还做了些什么？给你一句忠告；如果晋升会让你退到幕后，不要也罢。"
G["$n! You did it! I can't believe my eyes... the Inferno is gone... What has Aessina done!?"]="$n!你做到了！我无法相信自己的眼睛……烈火消失了……艾森娜做了什么？"
G["$n! You got any humdingers to tell us? I bet you just got all kinds of new stories 'bout your adventures and whatnot."]="$n！你有什么好消息要告诉我们吗？我敢打赌，你肯定又有许多新鲜刺激的冒险故事可说了。"
G["$n! You wanna help me out here with Fizz? He's up to no good again!"]="$n！能帮帮我摆脱菲兹吗？他又要发脾气了！"
G["$n! You're a sight for sore eyes. Get over here and give me a hand, would you?"]="$n！你可真是稀客啊。快过来帮帮我，好吗？"
G["$n! You're alive! Have you heard?"]="$n！你还活着！$g你:你;听说了吗？"
G["$n! You've returned just to talk to me? That's very thoughtful of you, and you look pretty sweet in that outfit, too!\n\nYou don't know how good it makes me feel to see you. It can get pretty lonely up here, what with most of these yahoos not being able to see me, and all. It's a great thing that you did for all of us, and I'll never forget it!\n\nThanks for dropping in and saying hi, and don't be such a stranger."]="$n！你回来陪我说话解闷儿啦？你心肠真好，而且你这身衣服看起来相当不错呢！\n\n你不知道我见到你有多高兴。我呆在这儿真是太寂寞了，这些粗俗的灵魂又没法看见我。感谢你为我们所做的一切，我是永远不会忘记的！\n\n谢谢你过来看我，别拘谨。"
G["$n's concoction is ruined.  A new one must be created from scratch."]="$n的混合剂被毁坏了！必须重做一瓶。"
G["$n's exotic fighting technique throws the Drakerider off-balance."]="$n超乎寻常的作战技巧令龙骑士手忙脚乱起来。"
G["$n's here. Let's go."]="Muy bien. Vamos."
G["$n, $g king : queen; of da ogres here!"]="$n，你就是食人魔的$G国王:女王;！"
G["$n, $g king : queen; of the ogres, is here!"]="$n，你就是食人魔的$G国王:女王;！"
G["$n, $g you handsome devil : you sexy thing;, get over here.  We need to talk about some statues...."]="$n，$g你这帅气的恶魔:你这性感的尤物;，到这儿来。我们得谈谈关于雕像的事……"
G["$n, $n, $n. Next time, try not to die so much."]="$n，$n，$n。拜托你下回别再死那么多次了。"
G["$n, $n. Can I call you $n?\n\nI am hanging from a meathook in the back of an ogre cave.\n\nHow do you THINK my research is progressing, you pompous dirt-sucking ass-$c? C'mere! C'mere you son of a swineherd!\n\n<Kristoff flutters back and forth on his chain, trying desperately to kick you in the face.>"]="$n，$n。我能叫你 $n 吗？\n\n我正被挂在食人魔洞穴后头的一个肉钩上。\n\n你觉得我的研究进展如何，$g你:你;这个自命不凡、只会啃泥巴的蠢货 $c？过来！过来啊，$g你:你;这猪倌的崽子！\n\n<克里斯托夫被链子拴着来回扑腾，拼命想踹$g你:你;的脸。>"
G["$n, Champion of the Bronze Dragonflight, has rung the Scarab Gong. The ancient gates of Ahn'Qiraj open, revealing the horrors of a forgotten war..."]="$n, $gcampeón:campeona; del Vuelo Bronce, ha hecho sonar el gong del Escarabajo. Las antiguas puertas de Ahn'Qiraj se abren, dejando al descubierto los horrores de una guerra olvidada..."
G["$n, Gahk's friend."]="$n，甘克的朋友。"
G["$n, I am in need of your help once again."]="$n，现在我又需要你的帮助了。"
G["$n, I am not surprised to see you here. I always thought you were my brightest pupil. I am honored to fight alongside you, my friend."]="我就知道会在这儿见到你，$n。我一直觉得你是我最出色的学生。很荣幸能和你并肩战斗，朋友。"
G["$n, I am pleased to see you. Our dwarven allies require our assistance in Alterac Valley. Will you help them?"]="$n，看到你很高兴。奥特兰克山谷的矮人伙伴需要我们的援助。你会去帮助他们吗？"
G["$n, I have confirmed that this blood is from the Bonechewer clan of orcs, tainted with demonic power.  I'm afraid, however, that my current equipment can delve no deeper into this mystery..."]="$n，我已经确认了这感染恶魔力量的鲜血是噬骨氏族的兽人们留下的。我担心不管用什么方式，我现有的设备都不能更进一步钻研这个秘密了……"
G["$n, I have created the cleansing totem."]="$n，净化图腾已经做好了。"
G["$n, I have the information you seek..."]="$n，我有一些你想要知道的消息……"
G["$n, I hope that you're staying for a while.  Stop by later if you have the time."]="$n，希望你能多留一阵子。有空的话晚点再过来坐坐。"
G["$n, I implore you to go to the Gate of Winter's Blossom and seek out Shado-Master Maikee as soon as you can."]="$n，我恳求你能否去冬花关，并尽快找到影踪派麦基大师。"
G["$n, I lend you the cold vengeance of the northern winds!"]="¡Te ofrezco la fría venganza de los vientos del norte!"
G["$n, I need your help!"]="$n，我需要你的帮助！"
G["$n, I remember when you first came to see my father after the battle for Ebon Hold. I'm glad you're still with us."]="$n，我记得你第一次来见我父亲，是在黑锋要塞战役结束之后。真高兴你仍与我们同在。"
G["$n, I shall leave before one of these beasts takes a liking to me!"]="$n，我得在这些野兽吃掉我之前离开这儿！"
G["$n, I sure hope somebody finds my dog!"]="$n，我真的希望有人能找到我的狗！"
G["$n, I was wondering if you'd be willing to endorse me come election time?"]="$n，不知你愿不愿意在下次选举时投我一票？"
G["$n, I will attend to the Arch Druid.  Malfurion and Matoclaw have requested your presence immediately."]="Yo me ocupo del Archidruida. Malfurion y Matogarra quieren que vayas a verles inmediatamente."
G["$n, I would have words with you."]="$n，我有些话要和你说。"
G["$n, I'd recognize dem tusks anywhere... What... What have dey done ta you, mon?"]="$n，我认得你的獠牙……他们……他们对你做了些什么，伙计？"
G["$n, I'd recognize that decay anywhere... What... What have they done to you, $n?"]="$n，我认得你的骨头……他们……他们对你做了些什么，$n？"
G["$n, I'd recognize that face anywhere... What... What have they done to ye, $g lad:lass;?"]="$n，我认得你的脸庞……他们……他们对你做了些什么，$g小伙子:小姑娘;？"
G["$n, I'd recognize that face anywhere... What... What have they done to you, $n?"]="$n，我认得你的脸庞……他们……他们对你做了些什么，$n？"
G["$n, I'd recognize those face tentacles anywhere... What... What have they done to you, $n?"]="$n，我认得你的面须……他们……他们对你做了些什么，$n？"
G["$n, I'd recognize those horns anywhere... What... What have they done to you, $n?"]="$n，我认得你的犄角……他们……他们对你做了些什么，$n？"
G["$n, I'll make sure all my friends in the Cartel know that you've saved my life today.  Here - I'm going to need to be able to travel light, so please help yourself to my cache of tailoring and leatherworking supplies!  Thanks again - see ya!"]="$n，我会让我所有的盟友朋友都知道你今天救了我的命。给你——我需要轻装上路，请你帮忙收下我的裁缝和制革物品！再次感谢你——再见！"
G["$n, I'm gifting Sunsong Ranch to you. You're in charge, now!"]="$n，我决定把日歌农场送给你。现在，这里归你管了！"
G["$n, I'm glad that you're here. Maybe I can teach you a thing or two.\n\nWhat do you think, $g sir : ma'am;?"]="$n，很高兴你来了。也许我能教你一两手。\n\n你觉得怎么样，$g先生:女士;？"
G["$n, I'm going to need your help!"]="$n，我需要你的帮助！"
G["$n, I've rescued your equipment for you. I think you've seen all you need to see."]="$n，我已为你找回了装备。我想你已经看到你所需要看到的一切。"
G["$n, Krom'gar's army is no more. Your rank no longer has meaning. If you wish to truly help the Horde, your considerable power could be used in Desolace or in the Southern Barrens."]="$n，克罗姆加的军队不复存在了。你的军阶不再有意义。如果真心希望帮助部落，你的能力可以在凄凉之地或者南贫瘠之地派上用场。"
G["$n, Savior of the Krazzworks!"]="$n，卡拉兹工坊的救星！"
G["$n, a moment of your time, please? There's trouble that we need your help with."]="$n，能占用你一点时间吗？我们有麻烦需要你帮忙解决。"
G["$n, allow me to give you some advice: tuck tail now and fly back down to the safety of the valleys below."]="$n，让我给你点建议：夹起尾巴滚回山谷中的安全地带吧。"
G["$n, along with High Tinker Mekkatorque and Mountaineer Stonegrind, has defeated Razlo Crushcog!"]="$n与大工匠梅卡托克和巡山人石磨一起击败了拉奇诺·碎轮！"
G["$n, can I come and train with you after we're done here?"]="$n，等我们做完这里的事情后，我能来跟你一起训练吗？"
G["$n, can you help me get rid of these virmen?"]="$n，你能帮我解决掉这些兔妖吗？"
G["$n, come on! Get over here!!!"]="$n，快点！到这里来！！！"
G["$n, do you feel the need -- the need for speed?"]="$n，你有在玩极品飞车的感觉吗？"
G["$n, don't just stand there! Kharanos is burning! Go help! Ach, all that brew..."]="$n，不要傻站在那里！卡拉诺斯正在燃烧！快去帮忙！啊，所有的酒……"
G["$n, eh? Oy! Citizen $n, come 'ere. Highlord Bolvar Fordragon has requested that all able bodied heroes o' the Alliance meet with him at Stormwind Keep. You just been recruited, mate! Get a move on!"]="¿$n, eh? ¡Oy! $gCiudadano:Ciudadana; $n, ven aquí. El alto señor Bolvar Fordragón ha pedido que todos los héroes sanos de la Alianza se encuentren con él en el Castillo de Ventormenta. ¡Acabas de ser $greclutado:reclutada;! ¡En marcha!"
G["$n, fun fact: the mogu here at Mogujia weren't always terracotta. They were buried alive with their lord after he died in glorious battle."]="$n，有趣的是，魔古岬这里的魔古族原本并不是陶俑。他们是在自己的君主光荣战死后，被殉葬活埋的。"
G["$n, get into the Ultimate Footbomb Uniform behind you and get down to the docks. Help Thrall kick the Trade Prince's butt!"]="$n，穿上你身后那套终极足球炸弹制服，到下方的码头那里去。帮助萨尔对付贸易大王！"
G["$n, get over here."]="$n，过来。"
G["$n, get these Wildhammer off of my airfield!"]="$n，把这群蛮锤渣滓赶出我的机场！"
G["$n, get to Stormwind. Tell King Wrynn everything. EVERYTHING! GO NOW!"]="$n，前去暴风城。把一切都告诉乌瑞恩国王。一切！现在就去！"
G["$n, get to one of the Krazz Cannons and shoot those Stormtalons down before they bring this whole place down on us!"]="$n，去用卡拉兹加农炮把那些雷爪狮鹫打下来，别让它们把这地方毁掉！"
G["$n, get to the Mechashark X-Steam Controller. Rid us of the Hammer menace!"]="$n，到X型蒸汽机械鲨鱼控制器那儿去。帮我们摆脱巨锤的威胁！"
G["$n, get your crap ready. I'm sending you out into the field."]="$n，把你的东西收拾好。我要派你上战场了。"
G["$n, glad to see you're still in one piece! I saw a rocket fly by earlier and heard your voice screaming, so I was a bit worried.\n\nWe have one last shipment to take care of. Talk to me when you're ready and we'll get going."]="$n，你还活着？这太好了！刚才我看见一支火箭飞上了半天，还听见你在尖叫，不由得有些担心。\n\n我们还有最后一批货要运。准备好以后就来找我，然后我们就出发。"
G["$n, good to see you!\n\nOr is this the first time that we've met?\n\nI'm in so many places and times right now, I sometimes have a hard time keeping track of all of it."]="$n，见到你真好！\n\n又或者，这才是我们第一次见面？\n\n我此刻身处太多地方与时代，有时实在很难理清这一切。"
G["$n, have ye any idea o' what we're up against in Alterac Valley?  Are ye ready to fight the Frostwolf Clan?"]="$n，$g你:你;知道我们在奥特兰克山谷要面对的是什么吗？准备好跟霜狼氏族开战了吗？"
G["$n, have you been back to Orgrimmar?  What news?"]="$n，你回过奥格瑞玛了吗？有什么消息？"
G["$n, help me by activating the three large totems."]="Activa los tres tótems grandes, por favor."
G["$n, hop into one of those B.C. Eliminators and wipe out the pygmies!"]="$n，跳进B.C.消除者，把那些俾格米人消灭干净！"
G["$n, how are you today?"]="$n，今天过得怎么样？"
G["$n, how are you?"]="$n，你好吗？"
G["$n, how many hundreds of demons have you banished?"]="$n，你放逐了多少个恶魔？我猜有成百上千吧！"
G["$n, how may I further your training in the eyes of the Earth Mother?"]="$n，我如何才能在大地母亲的心目中继续你的深造呢？"
G["$n, how may I further your training?"]="$n，我如何才能帮助你继续深造呢？"
G["$n, how's your mount holding up?  Pretty rough up there these days?"]="$n，你的坐骑还撑得住吧？最近情况很艰难吗？"
G["$n, if you have the time later, perhaps you and I could sit and talk over tea?"]="$n，如果你稍后有时间的话，也许我们能坐下来边喝茶边聊聊天？"
G["$n, is it? I have heard your name spoken in the village."]="$n是吗？我在村里听说过你的名字。"
G["$n, is that you? Please free me from these chains."]="$n，是你吗？请帮我摆脱这些锁链。"
G["$n, it is dangerous out there. For your own safety, make use of the totem I gave you!"]="$n，外面很危险。为了你自己的安全考虑，一定要使用我给你的图腾！"
G["$n, it is good to see you again.\n\nRemember to stay focused on your learning.  You represent our future, and should you falter our future will be dark indeed."]="$n，很高兴再次见到你。\n\n记住，要专心学习。你代表着我们的未来，如果你有所动摇，我们的未来必将黯淡无光。"
G["$n, it is good to see you.  Our war with the other elemental lords yet rages, but your efforts help ensure our victory."]="$n，见到你真好。我们与其它的元素之间的战斗正酣，但是你的参与会确保我们的胜利。"
G["$n, it is good to see you. Have you come to help push the front for us?"]="很高兴见到你，$n。你是来帮我们击退敌人的吧？"
G["$n, it's good to see veterans like you in the field!  I'm sorry to report that our supplies are currently too low to launch any large ground assaults against the Horde.\n\nSpeak with our quartermaster; he has supply missions available."]="$n，很高兴能在战场上见到像你这样的老兵！很遗憾地告诉你，我们目前的补给太少，无法对部落发动任何大规模地面进攻。\n\n去跟我们的军需官谈谈，他手上有补给任务。"
G["$n, it's good to see you again!  Are you having fun at the Faire?\n\nWant to arm wrestle?  No, of course not... you want to keep your arm!"]="$n，很高兴再次见到你！在马戏团玩得开心吗？\n\n想比掰手腕吗？不，当然不想……你还想保住你的胳膊呢！"
G["$n, it's very good to see you again!"]="$n，很高兴再次看到你！"
G["$n, it's you! Thanks, $g man : sweetie;!"]="$n，是你！谢谢你，$g兄弟:甜心;！"
G["$n, just between you and me, I never saw the fall of the Lich King. And... well... I've never been to Ulduar. I... well... I am a dungeon explorer. Yes. I prefer exploring dungeons with allies. The pay is excellent and the risk is low."]="$n，这话我只告诉你，我根本没有见到过巫妖王之死。其实……嗯……我从没有去过奥杜尔。我……嗯……我是地下城探险家。是的，我喜欢和朋友们一起探索地下城。这项事业的回报很丰厚，风险又很低。"
G["$n, know that our \"Warchief\" does not speak for us all. There are those among us who hope to see the Dragonmaw great again... and free from corruption."]="$n，你要知道，我们的\"大酋长\"并不代表我们所有人。我们当中有些人希望看到龙喉氏族重振雄风……并且摆脱腐化。"
G["$n, let's go see if this plan will work.  Come along, Buddy!"]="$n，让我们看看这个计划是否有效。过来，巴迪！"
G["$n, let's use the antechamber to the right."]="$n，我们从右边的前厅走。"
G["$n, may I have a moment of your time?"]="$n，能占用一下你的时间吗？"
G["$n, may your death stand as an example to all who challenge the Defias Brotherhood!"]="$n，挑战迪菲亚兄弟会的下场只有死路一条！"
G["$n, my $g boy : girl;!\n\nWant me to teach you any of my thermal palms healing techniques?\n\nNo? How about bandages? Do you want to learn about bandages?"]="$n，我的$g男孩:女孩;！\n\n想让我教你几手热掌治疗术吗？\n\n不想？那绷带呢？想学怎么用绷带吗？"
G["$n, my child, come here, I have something to ask of you."]="$n，我的孩子，过来，我有些事想请$g你:你;帮忙。"
G["$n, my duties are complete and I shall now take my leave.  Luck to you my $gfellow:lady;, and remember to keep the Bell, Wheel and Candle working!"]="$n，我完成了我的职责，我得走啦。祝你好运，$g先生:女士;，记得保持铃铛、书籍和蜡烛一直生效！"
G["$n, my form has now changed! The true strength of my spirit is returning to me now... The cursed grasp of the forest is leaving me."]="$n，我的体形改变了！我的灵魂力量正在回到我的体内……这座森林的诅咒正在从我身上消失……"
G["$n, my good friend! I hope everything is going well for you and Mr. Yoon at the farm."]="$n，我的好朋友！希望$g你:你;和尤恩先生在农场一切顺利。"
G["$n, no hurt A-Me. A-Me, good."]="$n，不要伤害A-Me。A-Me，好。"
G["$n, one of these days I want to buy you a drink."]="$n，哪天我请你喝杯酒吧。"
G["$n, our attack should be ready shortly. Wait here and push up the ramp with them."]="$n，进攻很快就能准备好。请等在这里，届时和他们一起冲上斜坡。"
G["$n, our forces are about to push up the ramp. You should join them."]="$n，我们的部队很快就要向斜坡发起攻击。快去和他们汇合吧。"
G["$n, our forces are pushing up the ramp. You should join them there."]="$n，我们的部队正在向斜坡上推进。你应该去那里和他们汇合。"
G["$n, our forces are pushing up to the tower already. You should join them, quickly."]="$n，我们的部队已经推进到塔下了。你应该去那里和他们汇合，快！"
G["$n, over here if you please."]="$n，请到这儿来。"
G["$n, over here!"]="¡Tú! ¡Sí, tú!"
G["$n, over here."]="¡Tú! ¡Sí, tú!"
G["$n, over here. He's hurt."]="$n，这边。他受伤了。"
G["$n, over here. What do you have to report? Were you followed?"]="$n，你有什么可以报告的？你被跟踪了吗？"
G["$n, pay very close attention to what I do and follow my instructions precisely. To not heed my words is to sign your own death warrant, as Taskmaster Fizzule is VERY well versed in the ways of the warrior and the assassin."]="$n，仔细看我是怎么做的，然后严格按照我的指示办事。否则你只有死路一条，费苏勒可是非常出色的战士和刺客。"
G["$n, please come to me.  I'm here in Zim'Torga now."]="$n，到我这里来。我就在希姆托加。"
G["$n, please listen closely. You MUST go back to Ordo Ragemesa and kill their chief."]="$n，仔细听好。你必须回到怒山大帐，干掉他们的酋长。"
G["$n, please make sure that you tell Gahruj of our success."]="$n，答应我你会把我们胜利的消息告诉加鲁斯。"
G["$n, please stop those pirates before they destroy the Speedbarge!"]="$n，请在那些海盗摧毁赛艇平台前阻止他们！"
G["$n, please take a look at the sample of the Vylestem vine that I took from the caverns, so that you know what to look for..."]="$n，请看看我从洞穴中取出的维雷斯塔姆藤蔓的样本，这样你就知道自己要找什么了……"
G["$n, right? Word of advice: don't let the Trade Prince catch you around here. He knows you're after his job.\n\nEveryone knows."]="$n，是你吗？送你一句话：不要让贸易大王抓住你。他知道你在盯着他的位子。\n\n所有人都知道。"
G["$n, sit on down. The fire's warm and the monkeys don't seem to like it."]="$n，坐下。火已经热了。这可不是给猴子准备的。"
G["$n, slay any dragons today?"]="$n，你今天杀了几条龙？"
G["$n, slay dragon?"]="$n，去杀龙吗？"
G["$n, somehow I feel stronger from Mam'toth's blood."]="$n，犸托斯的鲜血让我变得强壮起来。"
G["$n, stay here and help Taylor recover."]="$n，你留下，帮助泰勒恢复。"
G["$n, summon me again when you need to perform the ritual again."]="$n，如果你需要再次执行仪式，只要再召唤我就可以了。随叫随到。"
G["$n, terror of the skies, how are you doing?"]="$n，天空的统帅，你在干什么？"
G["$n, thank goodness you're here!"]="$n，你在这里！谢天谢地！"
G["$n, thank you again for helping us. We couldn't have achieved any of this without you."]="$n，再次感谢你能帮助我们。如果没有你，我们根本不可能有这样的成就。"
G["$n, thank you for dealing with the mystery of the Shadow Council at Grangol'var Village."]="$n，谢谢你解决了格兰戈瓦村的暗影议会成员。"
G["$n, thank you for helping me today. I knew we could convince my father of the right course. Please, go back to your other duties for now."]="$n，感谢你今天的帮助。我就知道，我们一定可以说服我父亲选择正确的道路。现在，请回到你的岗位上去吧。"
G["$n, thank you for your help. While the world will not know, you've saved them more than they're aware. Kanrethad had to be stopped. I'll see to it that he stays banished."]="$n，感谢你的帮助。虽然全世界或许都不会知道，但你又默默地拯救了他们一次。我们必须阻止坎雷萨德。我会确保他被放逐后无法再回来。"
G["$n, that's it! I have finally figured it out!"]="$n，就是它！我终于想到了！"
G["$n, the Silverwing Sentinels must be crushed!  Are you ready for Warsong Gulch?"]="$n，必须击溃银翼哨兵！$g你:你;准备好去战歌峡谷了吗？"
G["$n, the Sons of Lothar have fought here, on the Hellfire Peninsula, for two decades.  We are beset on all sides by indigenous orcs and hellish demons of the Burning Crusade, and though our hearts still beat fiercely, years of war have reduced our numbers.\n\nYou, and the influx of Azeroth's new generation of heroes, are a welcome sight indeed!"]="$n，洛萨之子已在地狱火半岛奋战了二十年。我们四面受敌，既有本地的兽人，也有燃烧的远征带来的地狱恶魔；虽然我们的心依然跳动得炽烈，但连年征战已让我们人数大减。\n\n你，以及源源不断涌入的艾泽拉斯新一代英雄，真是我们最想见到的！"
G["$n, the Stormpike Guard is in need of your aid in the battle against the Frostwolf Clan in Alterac Valley, now more than ever.  The opportunities for honor and repute are greater than ever as well! Will you join the battle?"]="$n，眼下，奥特兰克山谷的雷矛卫队需要你助战，共同打败霜狼氏族。这是个获得荣誉、提升声望的大好机会！你想要参加战斗吗？"
G["$n, the Twilight slaves you and others have been rescuing from Wolf's Run are wandering into camp, but they can't tell me who they are and they speak in riddles and gibberish.\n\nI thought Twilight's Hammer kept the slaves in line the old fashioned way - you know, whips and chains - but it's clear that there's some brainwashing at work..."]="$n，你和其他人从狼径救出来的那些暮光奴隶正陆续晃进营地，可他们说不清自己是谁，满口胡言乱语和谜语。\n\n我本以为暮光之锤会按老规矩管束奴隶——你懂的，鞭子和锁链——但显然这里还有洗脑的手段在起作用……"
G["$n, the most famous $r $c in all of Pandaria! Get over here and give ol' Chow a hug!"]="¡$n, $gel:la; $r $c más $gfamoso:famosa; de toda Pandaria! ¡Ven aquí y dale un abrazo al viejo Tallarín!"
G["$n, the translation is finished!"]="$n，翻译完成了！"
G["$n, the village of Azure Watch is burning!  Go help fight the fire!"]="$n，碧蓝岗哨的村庄正在燃烧！快去帮忙灭火！"
G["$n, the village of Goldshire is burning!  Go help fight the fire!"]="$n，闪金镇着火了！快去帮忙灭火！"
G["$n, there's something that I need you to do."]="$n，我这里有些事情需要你去做。"
G["$n, this beer... well, it might be the best of Brewfest!"]="$n，这啤酒……好吧，它可能是美酒节上最好的酒了！"
G["$n, this came for you this morning."]="$n，这是今天早上送来给你的。"
G["$n, this last spot's for you and Farmer Yoon. Why don't you do the honors?"]="$n，这最后一块地是给你和农夫老愚的。你何不欣然接受？"
G["$n, underneath the moss, this heart looks like a seed!"]="$n，看苔藓下面，这徽记看上去好像一颗种子！"
G["$n, unlocking the secret of these collars is beyond my skills..."]="$n，以我的能力还无法揭开项圈的秘密……"
G["$n, was it? That is a mighty fine piece of work ye have there. I'll take ye on, train ye how to make armor fit fer King Magni himself."]="$n，这真是你做的吗？真是一件精美的作品。我会继续训练你的，相信总有一天你可以达到皇家铸甲匠的水准。"
G["$n, was it? There'll be a few extra gold for you if you can personally guarantee my safety."]="你叫$n，对吧？如果你能亲自确保我的安全，我会再多给你一些赏钱的。"
G["$n, we have enough supplies to launch ground assaults into the Field of Strife.  If you want to send the orders, and your rank is high enough, then speak with Sergeant Yazra Bloodsnarl in Frostwolf Village."]="$n，我们已经具备了足够的物资来发动对征战平原的地面攻击。如果你想要传递指令，而且你的等级足够高的话，就跟霜狼村的亚斯拉·血矛谈谈。"
G["$n, we have enough supplies to launch ground assaults.  If your standing with the Stormpike Guard is high enough, then speak with Corporal Noreg Stormpike."]="$n，我们已经具备足够的物资来发动地面攻击。如果您在雷矛守卫的声望够高的话，就跟诺雷格·雷矛中尉谈谈吧。"
G["$n, we meet again! You looking for Shang? I think he's in back, polishing his melon."]="$n，我们又见面了！你是来找尚的吗？我想他在后面，正在擦他的瓜。"
G["$n, we must hurry and discover when the North Wind has started distorting the timeline. Only then can we defeat him and correct it."]="$n，我们必须尽快确定北风是从什么时候开始篡改时间流的。然后我们才有可能打败他并纠正历史。"
G["$n, we must speak when the queen is done with you."]="$n，等女王的事情完结之后，你必须和我谈一谈。"
G["$n, we need to escape through the northern tunnel!"]="$n，我们需要从北部隧道逃出去！"
G["$n, what are you still doing here?  Have you spoken with Proenitus down at the crash site yet?"]="$n，你怎么还在这里？你和坠毁点那里的普罗尼图斯说过话了吗？"
G["$n, what are you waiting for?  Find Field Marshal Teravaine in the Field of Strife and give him the assault orders.  Once he gets the orders, he and his troops will charge into the Horde and take no prisoners!"]="$n，你还在等什么？去征战平原找指挥官特拉瓦雷，将攻击指令交给他。一旦他得到指令，他和他的军队就能发动对部落的攻击，不留活口！"
G["$n, what are you waiting for?  Find Field Marshal in the Field of Strife and give him the assault orders.  Once he gets the orders, he and his troops will charge into the Horde and take no prisoners!"]="$n，你还在等什么？去征战平原找指挥官特拉瓦雷，将攻击指令交给他。一旦他得到指令，他和他的军队就能发动对部落的攻击，不留活口！"
G["$n, what's this I hear about trouble at the Gate of Winter's Blossom? Are we looking at a second yaungol invasion even bigger than the first?"]="$n，我听说冬花关有麻烦，究竟是怎么回事？野牛人会发起比第一次进攻规模更大的第二次进犯吗？"
G["$n, with the crane's powers, you can jump over the flames!"]="¡Gracias al poder de la grulla, puedes saltar las llamas!"
G["$n, wonderful to see you. Wonderful."]="$n，见到你真是太好啦。真的。"
G["$n, you above all have earned the right for the Horde to inhabit our ancestral home."]="$n，你赢得了我们的信任，欢迎部落的成员在我们的家乡落脚。"
G["$n, you and Hobart are going to be the death of me!"]="$n，你和霍巴特要害死我啊！"
G["$n, you and I are friends."]="$n，我们是朋友。"
G["$n, you and I should race sometime."]="$n，我们应该找个时间来赛跑。"
G["$n, you and your Alliance did much to aid my people in freeing the Black Temple of Illidan's grasp. \n\nI will help you as a show of mutual trust and repayment of the debt I owe you."]="$n，若非你和其他联盟成员的鼎力相助，我的族人是无法从伊利丹手中夺回黑暗神殿的。\n\n我愿意帮助你，因为我们彼此信任，也因为你帮助过我。"
G["$n, you and your Horde  did much to aid my people in freeing the Black Temple of Illidan's grasp. \n\nI will help you as a show of mutual trust and repayment of the debt I owe you."]="$n，若非你和其他部落成员的鼎力相助，我的族人是无法从伊利丹手中夺回黑暗神殿的。\n\n我愿意帮助你，因为我们彼此信任，也因为你帮助过我。"
G["$n, you are becoming quite a skilled medic. You should continue your first aid training."]="$n，你已经是一个非常熟练的医护兵了。你应该继续接受急救训练。"
G["$n, you are ready for the ultimate task.  The fiery runes etched on the floor of the molten core are conduits to the realm of fire, and their presence is both an affront to us and a source of power for the Firelords.  They must be extinguished!\n\nTo extinguish a rune, take a vial of aqual quintessence.  Pour it on the rune and its flame will go out, rendering it useless and weakening our enemy!"]="$n，$g你:你;已经准备好迎接终极任务了。刻在熔火之心地面的炽热符文是通往火焰位面的通道，它们的存在既是对我们的侮辱，也是火焰领主的力量之源。必须将它们熄灭！\n\n要熄灭符文，就取一瓶水之精华，倒在符文上，它的火焰便会熄灭，符文也就失去作用，我们的敌人也会因此变弱！"
G["$n, you are the Skyguard's best; make us proud!"]="$n，你是天空卫队最优秀的飞行员！你是我们的骄傲！"
G["$n, you are the champion I've long been awaiting. You will be the one to find and reunite the elemental spirits so that we might speak to Shen-zin Su and heal our land."]="$n，$g你:你;就是我期盼已久的勇士。$g你:你;将找到并重新聚合那些元素之灵，好让我们能与神真子对话，治愈我们的土地。"
G["$n, you did it. It looks like they're fleeing."]="$n，你成功了。他们看来在逃窜了。"
G["$n, you did well. I'm going back to camp to take care of the wounded. Check in with the Commander when you're done out here."]="$n，你干的不错，我要回营地去照顾其他伤员了。你要是没事了就到指挥官那里去报个道。"
G["$n, you do not know how to tame a pet."]="$n，你还不会驯服宠物。"
G["$n, you gonna save us from those pirates, or what?!"]="$n，你要从那些海盗手中拯救我们，否则还能怎样？！"
G["$n, you gotta get in there and rescue our people!"]="$n，你一定要去把我们的人救出来！"
G["$n, you gotta get in there and save our people!"]="$n，你一定能拯救我的族人！"
G["$n, you gotta get those teraptor hatchlings before they get us!"]="$n，你必须在那些刺角雏龙逮到我们之前，把它们解决掉！"
G["$n, you have disturbed me from my rest!"]="$n，你打扰我休息了！"
G["$n, you have done a great service for us, restoring some of our honor.  Look for us again in your darkest hour when our enemies are near."]="$n，你帮了我们很大的忙，挽回了我们的荣誉。当我们的敌人逼近时，再来找我们吧。"
G["$n, you have no idea how glad I am to see you. Supervising is hungry work."]="$n，你绝对想象不出我有多高兴见到你。监控这活儿消耗可是很大的。"
G["$n, you have no idea what a relief it is to see you!"]="$n，你不知道看到你给我们带来了多大的安慰。"
G["$n, you have to hunt down the Trade Prince!"]="$n，你必须干掉那个贸易大王！"
G["$n, you have to hurry and break your moolah out of the bank!"]="$n，你必须加紧行动，把你的钱从银行里拿出来！"
G["$n, you have unleashed the wolf ancient and defeated his shadow. Your actions already reverberate across the dream - thank you. But more remains to be done..."]="$n，你释放了狼魂先祖，并击败了他的影子。你的行动已经在梦境中产生了反响，谢谢你。但你还有更多的事要去做……"
G["$n, you look well. I heard the call to arms, which is why I've left our home and come here to join the fight.\n\nI see you have grown much since we last met. I am honored to have taught you. You are a true hero of the Alliance."]="$n，你看起来不错。获悉征召令后我背井离乡，来这里加入战斗。\n\n分别后你长进许多。能教导你我感到十分荣幸。你是联盟真正的英雄。"
G["$n, you return!  The spirits of my last meal said you would come see me and that we would discuss business.\n\nWere they correct?"]="$n，你回来了！我上一顿饭的灵魂们说你会来看我，我们会谈笔生意。\n\n它们说对了吗？"
G["$n, you should know that the last sixteen recruits..."]="$n，你应该知道那最后十六名新兵……"
G["$n, you too shall serve the Master!"]="$n，你也会为主人效力的！"
G["$n, you were slain by Hagara's Ice Wave. \nStart running early to avoid the ice!"]="$n，你被哈格拉的寒冰之潮杀死了。\n请提前移动以躲开寒冰之潮！"
G["$n, you were slain by a Resonating Crystal. Standing closer to the Resonating Crystal reduces the damage."]="$n，你被共鸣水晶杀死了。靠近共鸣水晶可降低伤害。"
G["$n, you're an inspiration."]="$n，你的精神鼓舞着我们。"
G["$n, you're going to want to fly over these giants and stone troggs. Don't try to ride through them."]="$n，你要从这些巨人和石腭怪的头顶上飞过去。不要试图从他们中间穿过去。"
G["$n, you've done it!"]="$n，你做到了！"
G["$n, you've returned! Is that the middle fragment?"]="$n，你回来了！那是中部碎片吗？"
G["$n, your bomber is ready.  Good luck!"]="$n，轰炸机准备好了。祝你好运！"
G["$n, your strength is inspiring."]="$n，你拥有振奋人心的力量。"
G["$n. These shells tell me much, but I fear many more questions are now raised..."]="$n。这些甲壳告诉了我很多事情，但同时也带来了更多谜团……"
G["$n. Zuni. Ya'll find ya trainer in the trainin' grounds to the east. Bring pride to the Darkspear."]="$n。祖尼。你们可以在东边的训练场找到你的训练师。不要给暗矛部族丢脸。"
G["$n... You have served the Horde well.\n\nHurry now... speak with Kadrak....\n\nSave Splintertree!!"]="$n……你为部落做了很大贡献。\n\n快一点……和卡德拉克谈谈……\n\n拯救碎木岗哨！"
G["$n?"]="¿$n?"
G["$n? $G Sir : Ma'am;, you're not a hunter, you're a $c."]="$n？$G长官:女士;，$g你:你;不是猎人，$G你:你;是 $c。"
G["$n? I heard you were dead."]="$n？我听说你已经死了。"
G["$n? It's about time you got here. What kept you? My father's life is in jeopardy!"]="$n？你早就该来了。是什么拖住了你？我的父亲正生命垂危！"
G["$n? Mon?"]="$n？伙计？"
G["$n? What are you doing here? And is that Keegan Firebeard behind you?"]="$n？你在这里干什么？你在听从科甘·焰须的命令？"
G["$n? What are you doing here? We need you up on the Skyfire! Quick, take the portal!"]="$n？你在这里做什么？天火号上需要你！赶快，使用传送门！"
G["$n? What is going on here?"]="$n？这里出什么事了？"
G["$n?! What are you still doing here?\n\nYou have to get off of the island, or better yet, into one of my Town-In-A-Boxes!\n\nDon't wait too long, my $g boy : girl;! The Cataclysm is upon us!"]="$n？！你还在这儿干什么？\n\n你得赶紧离开这座岛，最好是钻进我那些便携小镇里！\n\n别等太久，我的$g男孩:女孩;！大灾变就要来了！"
G["$ndamus, you're a born leader!"]="$n，你天生就是个领袖！"
G["$p - good work. Without your assistance, I'm afraid this whole business would have ended quite nastily."]="$p——干得好。要是没有你的帮助，我们怕是没办法收场。"
G["$p can also teach your villagers to defend themselves."]="$p还能教你们的村民学些自卫的本领。"
G["$p is coming. They can help us get you out of here."]="$p来了。他们能帮忙带你离开这里。"
G["$p!  I am setting up a sobering fire.  If you need a fresh breath come toward me."]="$p！我点了一堆清心焰。如果你想吸口新鲜空气，可以来找我。"
G["$p! Are you okay? Wake up!"]="$p！你还好吗？快醒醒！"
G["$p! Check this thing out!"]="$p！来看看这个！"
G["$p! Come in close and help me pop this big ol' bubble!"]="$p！过来帮我戳破这个大泡泡！"
G["$p! I am... not in control... Get away!"]="$p！我……失去控制了……走开！"
G["$p! Nesingwary and Nesingwary are waiting for you at the Torjari Pit."]="$p！奈辛瓦里和奈辛瓦里二世正在托加尼洼地等着你呢。"
G["$p! Over here!"]="$p！这边！"
G["$p! There are mogu near! Watch out!"]="$p！这附近有魔古族！小心！"
G["$p! We've done it!"]="$p！我们做到了！"
G["$p! You'll help me stop the mantid?"]="$p！你会帮助我阻止螳螂妖吗？"
G["$p! You're here! Assault their leader and we will back you up."]="$p！你在这儿！攻击他们的首领，我们会在后方支援你。"
G["$p! You've saved us! We'll go somewhere safe."]="$p！是你救了我们！我们会到安全的地方去。"
G["$p, Taoshi, help these men get their camp in order.  I'll assess the state of the bridge."]="$p，陶矢，帮他们把营地整理干净。我去看看桥下的战况。"
G["$p, a word before you venture forth."]="$p，在你出发之前听我说上几句。"
G["$p, go speak to Guard Captain Oakenshield. Tell him we need reinforcements!"]="$p，快去通知守卫队长橡盾。告诉他我们急需支援！"
G["$p, help at Farwatch Overlook and then bring Nurong back to us here. Our final confrontation approaches swiftly."]="$p，去远戍哨站帮忙，然后把砮荣带回来。决战在即，刻不容缓。"
G["$p, if the scouts give you any information on the mogu leader, you know what to do."]="$p，如果斥候向你报告有关魔古首领的任何消息，你知道该怎么做。"
G["$p, it is good to see you. It will be an honor to face Lei Shen.\n\nThe lorewalkers of the Wandering Isle told us many stories of the dreaded Thunder King. We must proceed with caution here. If legends are to be believed, he was as clever as he was brutal."]="$p很高兴见到你。挑战雷神是一个莫大的荣誉。\n\n迷踪岛上的游学者跟我们说过很多有关雷电之王的可怕故事。我们必须小心前行。如果传说是真的，此人的狡诈不在其残暴之下。"
G["$p, let me know if you need any help with the village defenses!"]="$p，如果你在村庄的防务方面需要帮助，请告诉我！"
G["$p, meet me at Dawnchaser Retreat. I must see to my brother's remains, and then we must deal with this mantid threat."]="$p，到逐晨者营地来找我吧。我必须照顾好我兄弟的遗体，然后我们再来解决除螳螂妖的威胁。"
G["$p, meet me at the Sentinel Basecamp. I must bring my daughter's body there. We still have the Water of Youth."]="$p，到哨兵营地来找我，我必须把我女儿的尸体带到那里去。我们还有青春之水。"
G["$p, meet me back at Thunder Cleft. I must bring my brother's body back to our people."]="$p，回雷霆裂口来见我吧。我必须把我兄弟的遗体带回去。"
G["$p, my men have been instructed to wait for your arrival before they attack. Do not delay."]="$p，我已经命令我的人等你们到了再发动进攻。不要拖延。"
G["$p, our people have lived the wholes of their lives on this great turtle, Shen-zin Su, but not in hundreds of years has anyone spoken to him."]="$p，我们的人民终生居住在这只巨大的神龟——神真子的背上。但数百年来，没有人与它交谈过。"
G["$p, over here at the exit."]="$p，在出口这里。"
G["$p, over here near the end of the bridge."]="$p，在这边，桥尾附近。"
G["$p, report for duty immediately!"]="$p，立刻过来报到！"
G["$p, take care of those eggs! We'll focus on the big mama!"]="$p，注意那些卵！我们必须专心对付母兽！"
G["$p, watch the corners. I hear something comin'."]="$p，注意四周。我想我听到了什么声音。有东西靠近了。"
G["$p, we could use a champion like you in Stoneplow."]="$p，石犁村正需要$g你:你;这样一位勇士。"
G["$p, we should discuss matters back in Krasarang. For now, thank you for your help. There is a portal that can return you to Lion's Landing whenever you choose."]="$p，我们得讨论一下卡桑琅的情况。多亏了你的帮助，现在我们开通了一座通往雄狮港的传送门。你可以随时用它返回雄狮港。"
G["$p, where's Master Shang?"]="$p，尚师父呢？"
G["$p... To think you'd risked your life to save me - twice now - and I'd only treated you with disdain."]="$p……你竟然冒生命危险来救我——还救了两次，可我却对你不屑一顾。"
G["$p... he's succumbing to the sha..."]="$p……他在煞魔面前屈服了……"
G["$p... you picked that flower like a champion! You're like a... a professional flower-picker! Have you done this before?"]="$p……你摘花的时候就像一个勇士！就像一个……一个专业的摘花者！你以前干过？"
G["%s Takes a Deep Beath"]="%s深深地吸了一口气"
G["%s abandons the block he was holding up in the doorway, and looks towards the bait."]="%s丝毫不理会门口的障碍物，眼睛直勾勾地盯着诱饵。"
