G["%s absorbs the essence of the bear spirit!"]="%s吸收了野熊之魂的精华！"
G["%s absorbs the essence of the dragonhawk spirit!"]="%s吸收了龙鹰之魂的精华！"
G["%s absorbs the essence of the eagle spirit!"]="%s吸收了雄鹰之魂的精华！"
G["%s absorbs the essence of the lynx spirit!"]="%s吸收了山猫之魂的精华！"
G["%s absorbs the fire energy of the attack."]="%s吸收了本次攻击的火焰能量。"
G["%s absorbs the frost energy of the attack."]="%s吸收了本次攻击的冰霜能量。"
G["%s absorbs the holy energy of the attack."]="%s吸收了本次攻击的神圣能量。"
G["%s absorbs the nature energy of the attack."]="%s吸收了本次攻击的自然能量。"
