G["%s accepts the book from Apprentice Boulian and glances at the indicated page."]="%s从学徒波里安手中接过书卷，粗略地翻看着简介。"
G["%s accepts the relics from $n."]="%s从$n手中接过古代遗物。"
G["%s acknowledges your obeisance and then waves dismissively at you."]="%s接受了你的敬礼，然后轻蔑地对你挥挥手。"
