G["%s activates his |cFFFF0404|Hspell:119311|h[Stream of Blades]|h|r trap!"]="%s激活了他的|cFFFF0404|Hspell:119311|h[利刃之流]|h|r陷阱！"
G["%s activates his |cFFFF0404|Hspell:119374|h[Whirlwinding Axe]|h|r trap!"]="%s激活了他的|cFFFF0404|Hspell:119374|h[旋风斧]|h|r陷阱！"
G["%s activates his |cFFFF0404|Hspell:120142|h[Crossbow]|h|r trap!"]="%s激活了他的|cFFFF0404|Hspell:120142|h[战弩]|h|r陷阱！"
G["%s activates!"]="%s活动起来！"
G["%s adds the haze to the Bloodpetal sprouts."]="%s把薄雾喷到了血瓣花的萌芽上。"
G["%s almost collapses as he stumbles towards you."]="%s跌跌撞撞向你走来时几乎要倒下去了。"
G["%s almost falls on his face in excitement."]="%s兴奋得几乎一头栽倒在地。"
G["%s ambushes his helpless prey!"]="%s伏击了无助的猎物！"
G["%s and Investigator Asric glare at each other silently, their eyes narrowed."]="%s和调查员艾斯瑞克怒目而视。"
G["%s and Raider Kerr charge into battle..."]="%s和狼骑兵科尔冲向战场……"
G["%s and Raider Kerr let their wolves rest a bit and drink..."]="%s和狼骑兵科尔让狼群停下来歇息饮水……"
G["%s and Rak'gor Bloodrazor exchange hushed words."]="%s和拉克戈尔·血刃轻声交流了几句。"
G["%s and his invading forces appear amidst a tumultuous conflagration in the northwest of Silithus."]="%s率领入侵的大军突然从希利苏斯西北方的火场中冲出。"
G["%s animates several elementals to |cFFFF0000|Hspell:123250|h[Protect]|h|r her!"]="%s召唤了一些元素来|cFFFF0000|Hspell:123250|h[保护]|h|r她！"
G["%s answers the call of Shy-Rotam."]="%s响应着希洛塔姆的呼唤。"
G["%s appears above your head with an ear-splitting caw!"]="%s俯视着你，发出一阵震耳发聩的嚎叫！"
G["%s appears bored with the whole discussion."]="喋喋不休的讨论令%s感到厌烦。"
G["%s appears lost in contemplation."]="%s似乎陷入了沉思。"
G["%s appears to be speaking with an unseen entity."]="%s好像在和某个看不见的东西说话。"
G["%s appears to be waking up!"]="%s显出要醒过来的样子！"
G["%s appears to be weakening!"]="%s看上去很虚弱！"
G["%s appears to be weeping."]="%s似乎在哭泣。"
G["%s appears unstable."]="%s似乎不太稳定……"
G["%s appears weak!"]="%s显得非常虚弱！"
G["%s appears!"]="%s出现了！"
G["%s applauds lightly, smiling."]="%s面带微笑，轻轻地拍手喝彩。"
G["%s approaches and waits quietly."]="%s慢慢靠近，并安静地等待着。"
G["%s approaches the Nemesis Crystal and cautiously examines it."]="%s靠近涅墨西斯水晶，小心翼翼地检查着它。"
G["%s approaches the moonwell slowly, a familiar, thoughtful look upon its face."]="%s缓步靠近月亮井，一种熟悉的，若有所思的神情出现在它的脸上。"
G["%s arches a brow at Keyanomir, a wry smirk playing about her lips."]="%s弯起眉毛看着克亚诺米尔，露出了迷人的微笑。"
G["%s arches a sculpted brow at the guards, a disapproving scowl on her face."]="%s朝卫兵们生硬地鞠了一躬，他板着脸，心中十分不情愿。"
G["%s arches a sculpted brow at the guards, a disapproving scowl on his face."]="%s朝卫兵们生硬地鞠了一躬，他板着脸，心中十分不情愿。"
G["%s arises to fight once more!"]="%s再次站起来投入战斗！"
G["%s armed."]="%s装配完毕。"
G["%s armed. Aerie Gryphon en route."]="%s已启动。狮鹫准备就绪。"
G["%s arming. T-minus 60 seconds."]="%s正在启动。还剩60秒。"
G["%s arranges the materials on the anvil."]="%s将材料放在铁砧上。"
G["%s arrives!"]="%s到了！"
G["%s asks that you follow him."]="%s叫你跟随他。"
G["%s assembles the runecloth, herbs, and holy water to the barding."]="%s将符文布、草药和圣水装配成马饰。"
G["%s attacks a new target!"]="%s攻击新的目标！"
G["%s attacks from the hillside."]="%s从山坡上发动了攻击。"
G["%s attacks the banner!"]="%s正在攻击旗帜！"
G["%s attacks the pike!"]="%s攻击长矛！"
G["%s attacks with renewed vigor!"]="%s恢复了活力，重新投入了战斗！"
G["%s attacks!"]="%s发起了攻击！"
G["%s attempts to bind the spirit of his fallen comrade."]="%s试着去抓住阵亡战友的灵魂。"
G["%s attempts to cast Death Pact on his servants!"]="%s尝试对他的仆从释放死亡契约！"
G["%s attempts to flee to a nearby ravager."]="%s试图逃向附近的掠食者。"
G["%s attempts to get Landra's attention."]="%s试图引起兰德拉的注意。"
G["%s attempts to get help!"]="%s试图寻求帮助！"
G["%s attempts to hide on the ocean floor!"]="%s试图藏在海底！"
G["%s attempts to run away in fear!"]="%s充满恐惧地想要转身逃跑！"
G["%s attempts to split in two."]="%s试图裂成两块。"
G["%s bares her fangs and hisses menacingly at those around her."]="%s呲着牙发出嘶嘶声，以示威胁。"
G["%s barks a cruel laugh."]="%s发出一阵残忍的笑声。"
G["%s barks in anticipation."]="%s充满期待地叫了起来。"
G["%s barks loudly, calling nearby allies to its aid!"]="%s大声向附近的盟友求救！"
G["%s beams, unaware that she is teasing him, answering in his thickly-accented Common."]="%s完全没有意识到她在嘲笑自己，竟然露出了笑容，用带有重口音的通用语回答了她的问题。"
G["%s becomes dazed"]="%s变得头昏眼花"
G["%s becomes enraged as his shield shatters."]="%s看见手中的盾牌破碎之后，更加恼怒了。"
G["%s becomes enraged at being separated from his Ambercaller!"]="%s因要和他的唤珀者分开而愤怒了！"
G["%s becomes enraged at seeing one of his companions fall!"]="%s看到伙伴死去后被激怒了！"
G["%s becomes enraged from seeing a cub die!"]="%s目睹死去的幼兽，变得极为愤怒！"
G["%s becomes enraged from the death of Fran."]="法兰的死激怒了%s。"
G["%s becomes enraged!"]="%s变得愤怒了！"
G["%s becomes exhausted!"]="%s显得筋疲力尽！"
G["%s becomes impaled on the spike, exposing his head!"]="%s将自己钉在刺上，露出了他的头！"
G["%s becomes increasingly enraged as he sees his allies fall in battle!"]="%s看到他的朋友们在战斗中倒下，变得愈加愤怒了！"
G["%s becomes increasingly enraged!"]="%s变得越来越愤怒了！"
