G["'Talon King' Ikiss is one of the leaders of the Sethekk, along with my brother, Darkweaver Syth.\n\nIt was they who led the exodus of the Sethekk from Skettis to the ruins of Auchindoun. In the beginning, Ikiss was a charismatic leader, but he has descended into madness.\n\nNow, he openly proclaims that he is Terokk reborn! He truly expects the arakkoa to bend knee to him as their ruler. Can you believe his arrogance?"]="利爪之王艾吉斯和我兄弟黑暗编织者塞斯一样，都是塞泰克的领导者之一。\n\n是他们带领塞泰克一族从斯克提斯来到了奥金顿废墟。最初，艾吉斯是一个有着超凡魅力的领袖，但是他陷入了疯狂。\n\n现在，他公然宣称他就是再生的泰罗克！他想让所有鸦人向他屈服，接受他的统治。你能相信他居然如此傲慢吗？"
G["'Til Mighty Firebeard crossed heart and professed"]="直到强大的焰须得到她心灵的皈依"
