G["'Twas a fierce battle, $n! Take a moment to rest and gather yer forces. Who knows what lies beyond that door?\n\nLet me know when yer ready and we'll begin our ascent into the upper reaches of the citadel."]="这一仗打得真凶，$n！先歇一会儿，重整$g你:你;的队伍。谁知道那扇门后头藏着什么？\n\n准备好了就告诉我，我们就开始向堡垒上层进发。"
