G["<*Rumble*Rumble*Rumble*>"]="<*轰隆*轰隆*轰隆*>"
G["<<Event: Lorekeeper Vaeldrin drinks the potion and transfers his life essence to all npcs around him>>"]="<<事件：博学者瓦尔德林饮下了药剂，并将他的生命精华传输给周围所有的NPC。>>"
G["<A cockroach slithers from Calder's mouth and scurries back into his skull through an empty eye socket.>"]="<一只蟑螂从卡尔德的嘴里爬出来，又爬进了他的一只空眼窝。>"
G["<A dream-like vision of Ysera floats before you, her attention divided. After a moment, she addresses you.>\n\nFor many years, Aviana fluttered at the periphery of my dreams. I wondered if she should ever return to us. I fear her spirit has darkened with the passage of time...\n\nBut we have more immediate concerns if we hope to save this mountain."]="<伊瑟拉的幻象如同梦一般飘落在你面前。一开始，她的心思似乎并不在你身上。过了一会儿，她才注意到你。>\n\n许多年以来，艾维娜一直在我的梦境边缘闪动。我想知道，她会不会回来。但我也害怕她的灵魂因为过去那段岁月而变得黑暗……\n\n不管怎样，如果我们真的要拯救这座山脉，就必须关注一些更紧迫的事情。"
G["<A hand-lettered sign reads:>\n\n          Secret Lab Archives\n     X. Nizzlebex, Lab Director\n\n\n<It appears nobody is home right now. Perhaps you should come back later?>"]="<这是一段手写的文字：>\n\n          秘密实验室档案馆\n     X.尼泽柏克，实验室主管\n\n\n<看样子，现在没有人在家。也许你应该稍后再来？>"
G["<A hand-lettered sign reads:>\n\n          Secret Lab Archives\n     X. Nizzlebex, Lab Director\n\n\nPlease ring buzzer for service."]="<这是一段手写的文字：>\n\n          秘密实验室档案馆\n     X.尼泽柏克，实验室主管\n\n\n请按蜂鸣器呼叫服务。"
G["<A hefty tome with a well-worn cover and bits of earth stuck in the bindings. It looks like Yoon has been carrying on tradition and recording the history of Sunsong Ranch in this journal. It lies open to his last entry: a note addressed to you!>\n\n\"Thank you for restoring my family's land to its former glory. I am on to bigger things; It is your turn to fill in these pages now.\""]="<一本厚重的典籍，封面磨损严重，装订缝里还嵌着些泥土。看来尤恩一直在延续传统，用这本日志记录日歌农场的历史。它翻开着，停在他最后一条记录上：一封写给你的字条！>\n\n\"感谢你让我家族的土地恢复了往日的荣光。我要去做更大的事了；现在轮到你在这几页上落笔了。\""
G["<A soothing light fills you as you approach the naaru.  Slow musical chimes echo within your mind and, though a word is not uttered, you feel an assurance of safety.  You are welcome in Shattrath City.>"]="<当你走近纳鲁时，一道柔和的光芒笼罩了你。缓慢的乐音回响在你脑海中，尽管未曾有只言片语，你却感到一种安全无虞的保证。沙塔斯城欢迎$G你:你;。>"
G["<A strange light ignites in Ota Wen's eyes as he stands up straight, roaring at the heavens.>\n\nYES, WE WILL RISE UP! RISE UP AND DESTROY OUR JAILORS!"]="<一道奇怪的光芒在奥塔·旺的眼中闪过。他挺起身子，向天空发出咆哮。>\n\n我们会奋起抗争！摧毁我们的枷锁！"
G["<A whisper escapes Shaldyn's throat as you approach.>\nHelp... please."]="<你走近时，一声低语从沙尔丁的喉间逸出。>\n\n帮帮我……求你了。"
G["<Administer the Healing Salve.>"]="<使用治疗药膏。>"
G["<Administer the condensed nether gas.>"]="<注入浓缩的虚空瓦斯。>"
G["<Administer the draught.>"]="<给予药剂。>"
G["<Administer the restorative draught.>"]="<给病人使用疗伤药膏。>"
G["<Ahlurglgr looks surprised to be able to understand you.>"]="<呀噜咕噜发现自己竟然能听懂你说的话，感到分外震惊。>"
G["<All that remains of Malik the Unscathed, his polearm rests unceremoniously on a weapon rack.>"]="<作为无伤者玛里克仅存的遗留物，他的长矛突兀地挂在武器架上。>"
G["<Allyndia's body bobs gently in the surf. It appears that she's been dead for some time.>"]="<奥琳迪雅的身躯在海浪中微微晃动着。看样子，她死去已经有一段时间了。>"
G["<Altruis turns to face you and smiles.>\n\nI do not.\n\n<Altruis points to his steed, Nethrandamus.>\n\nWe must stop them before these forge camps are able to complete whatever it is that they are building."]="<奥图里斯转向你笑了笑。>\n\n我不行。\n\n<奥图里斯指了指他的坐骑，奈瑟兰达姆斯。>\n\n我们必须在这些铸魔营地有能力完成它们正在建造的东西之前阻止他们。"
G["<Andorov looks at you grimly.>\n\nIf it bleeds, we can kill it."]="<安多洛夫严肃地看着你。>\n\n如果它会流血，我们就能杀了它。"
G["<Anduin sizes you up.>\n\n$n, is it? A few of your triumphs have been the talk of the court.\n\nWhat was it like to serve in Northrend? Have you seen the World Tree? Are the stories about Vashj'ir true? I have so many questions!"]="<安度因打量着你。>\n\n$n，是吧？你的一些壮举已经成了宫廷里的谈资。\n\n在诺森德服役是什么感觉？你见过世界之树吗？关于瓦丝琪尔的那些传闻是真的吗？我有太多问题想问了！"
G["<Anduin's bodyguards edge closer the moment you address the prince.>\n\nIt's okay. I'd just like to have a chat with my friend. We're far from any battlefronts here. Can some part of the world still be safe for civilized conversation?\n\nCome, sit down! Join us!"]="<$g你:你;一开口同王子说话，安度因的卫兵便围拢过来。>\n\n没事的。我只是想跟我的朋友聊聊天。这里离任何前线都很远。这世上总还能有个地方，可以安全地谈些文雅的话吧？\n\n来，坐下！跟我们一起吧！"
G["<Angela coos to the felhunter again before turning her attention to you.>\n\nJir'see's always been smaller than all the other felhunters, but that's never bothered him. And Outland's going to change all that, right Jir'see?\n\nMomma's little angel is going to grow up to be a big, fierce felhunter, yes he is!"]="<安吉拉在地狱猎犬耳边低语着什么，直到她留意到你。>\n\n和其它地狱猎犬相比，基尔西的体型显得娇小许多，但是这并未影响到它。我相信外域会改变这一切的，基尔西，对吧？\n\n妈妈的小天使一定会成长为一头巨大凶猛的地狱猎犬！一定！"
G["<Angela nods.>\n\nAfter the deaths, the Six decided that the best course of action was to seal the staff behind impenetrable barriers of magic and appoint a watcher: A guardian of the staff... I would be that watcher."]="<安吉拉点了点头。>\n\n在他们死后，六人议会做出了决定。他们认为对这根法杖最好的处理方法无非是用牢固的魔力监牢封印起来，并委任一名看守者……原本应该是我。"
G["<Archmage Vargoth favors you with a wry smile.>\n\nPlenty of room at the cursed Violet Tower.\n\nAny time of year, you can find me here."]="<大法师瓦格斯发出扭曲的笑容，对你示好。>\n\n被诅咒的紫罗兰之塔映着明月。\n\n风吹过云影似梦。"
G["<As you approach, you hear Cerellean gasp for breath. He looks to stand a chance if rescued soon.>"]="<你靠近塞瑞利恩，听到他喘息的声音。看样子，如果救治及时，他应该还有机会。>"
G["<As you greet Ambassador Frasaboo in the furbolg language, he smiles.>\n\nYou must be the one spoken of in the prophecy. It is a great honor to meet you.\n\nI am Ambassador Frasaboo, High Chief Stillpine's representative in Blood Watch."]="<你用熊怪语问候大使弗拉萨布，他笑了笑。>\n\n你一定是预言中被提到的那个人了，见到你很荣幸。\n\n我是弗拉萨布大使，止松老酋长派驻秘血岗哨的代表。"
G["<As you place the apexis shards into the nest surrounding the dragon egg, they begin to hum.  A few moments later a crack appears in the rugged shell, and a black dragon whelpling emerges, squalling for its father.>"]="<当你将埃匹希斯碎片放在龙卵附近后，它们发出嗡嗡的蜂鸣声。片刻之后，龙卵粗糙的外壳出现了一道裂缝，一只黑龙幼崽破壳而出，尖叫着呼喊它的父亲。>"
G["<As you place the apexis shards into the nest surrounding the dragon egg, they begin to hum.  A few moments later a crack appears in the rugged shell, and a black dragon whelpling emerges, squalling for its mother.>"]="<当你将埃匹希斯碎片放在龙卵附近后，它们发出嗡嗡的蜂鸣声。片刻之后，龙卵粗糙的外壳出现了一道裂缝，一只黑龙幼崽破壳而出，尖叫着呼喊它的母亲。>"
G["<As you place your apexis shards into the fel crystalforge and pull the lever, the device makes an unworldly sound as it grinds them into dust.  A few moments later your flask pops out of its 'mouth'.>"]="<当你把埃匹希斯碎片放进邪能水晶熔炉并拉下操纵杆时，装置发出一阵诡异的声响，把碎片碾成了粉末。片刻之后，你的药剂瓶从它的\"嘴里\"弹了出来。>"
G["<As you place your apexis shards into the fel crystalforge and pull the lever, the device makes an unworldly sound as it grinds them into dust.  A few moments later your flasks pop out of its 'mouth'.>"]="<当你把埃匹希斯碎片放进邪能水晶熔炉并拉下操纵杆时，装置发出一阵诡异的声响，把碎片碾成了粉末。片刻之后，你的几个药剂瓶从它的\"嘴里\"弹了出来。>"
G["<As you place your apexis shards within the hollow of the Bash'ir crystalforge and pull the lever, the device literally disintegrates them.  A few moments later your flask appears at your feet.>"]="<当你将埃匹希斯碎片放入巴什伊尔水晶熔炉并拉下控制杆后，从熔炉中传来了物体被碾碎的声音。很快一瓶合剂就落在了你的脚旁。>"
G["<As you place your apexis shards within the hollow of the Bash'ir crystalforge and pull the lever, the device literally disintegrates them.  A few moments later your flasks appear at your feet.>"]="<当你将埃匹希斯碎片放入巴什伊尔水晶熔炉并拉下控制杆后，从熔炉中传来了物体被碾碎的声音。很快一瓶合剂就落在了你的脚旁。>"
G["<As you turn Barithras' limp body over in the water, a brutal injury on his head makes it very apparent why he did not make it.>"]="<当你将巴瑞萨斯瘫软的身体在水中翻转过来的时候，他头顶上一个可怕的伤口赫然出现在你眼前。你立刻明白了他没能撑下去的原因。>"
G["<Ask Thisalee to release the harpy.>"]="<要求希萨莉释放鹰身女妖。>"
G["<Attempt to remove Fizzle's Hand, then.>"]="<尝试移开菲兹尔的手。>"
G["<Attempt to remove the orb.>"]="<尝试移除这颗宝珠。>"
G["<Aysa appears to be deeply lost in her excercises.>"]="<艾莎似乎正沉浸在她的功课中。>"
G["<Baron Revilgaz's private stock.  Do not touch under any circumstances!>"]="<大财主里维加兹的私人宝物。任何时候都不要乱动！>"
G["<Begin emergency shutdown.>"]="<启动紧急停机。>"
G["<Behind the warlock's eyes smolders a deep malevolence.>"]="<术士的双眼中积郁着深深的怨毒。>"
G["<Ben scratches his head.>\n\n I'm not the greatest with directions, but I reckon the Redbelly Mandarin are about's here, in the Fields of Niuzao in Townlong Steppes. \n\n<Ben circles a general area on your map.>"]="<本挠了挠头。>\n\n 我认路不太在行，不过我估摸着红腹锦鱼人就在这一带，螳螂高原的砮皂平原里。 \n\n<本在你的地图上圈出了一片大致区域。>"
G["<Big Dan makes a combination of sleepy, fitful grunts and snorts.>\n\nYeah... Stormstout alright..."]="<大丹发出各种声响，夹杂着沉重的鼾声和断断续续的呓语。>\n\n没错……就是风暴烈酒……"
G["<Blackhorn gazes out across the distant inferno, then turns his attention back to you.>"]="<黑角望向地狱的远方，然后又将注意力转回到你身上。>"
G["<Blackhorn strains against his bonds, for the first time visibly upset.>\n\nRedemption! You act as if there's an escape from the Burning Legion. So smug! As though your efforts a decade ago or in Outland have slowed the Legion a single iota! They will come, $r. They will return. And I will be here to welcome them."]="<黑角挣扎了一下。他第一次显露出烦乱的神情。>\n\n算了吧！难道你真能逃出燃烧军团的魔爪吗？不要自鸣得意了！难道你们十年前的所为和在外域的所作所为曾经减慢过燃烧军团的步伐吗？他们一定会回来的，$r。他们会回来。我则会在这里迎接他们。"
G["<Blanche shouts over the commotion of the storm.>\n\nYou made it! The boiler and the brewkegs are in place... now all we need is Mother Nature to work her magic.\n\nWhat do you say? Are you ready for some fireworks?"]="<布兰奇在风暴的喧嚣中高声喊道。>\n\n你成功了！锅炉和酒桶都已就位……现在就差大自然母亲施展她的魔法了。\n\n$g你:你;说呢？准备好来一场烟花盛宴了吗？"
G["<Bloodrose eyes you curiously.>\n\nI cannot help but wonder what makes you worthy of such attention.\n\nNo offense...."]="<血玫瑰好奇地打量着你。>\n\n你这样的家伙也能吸引大家的目光，真是奇怪。\n\n我没有侮辱你的意思……"
G["<Blundy peers up from his cups.>\n\nAye, that's right. The High Shaman is out in the field, fighting to retake the Thundermar Wreckage. I'm whatcha call the \"Low Shaman.\"\n\nWhile he's away, he left me here, to take care of all of Thundermar's Shamanin'in... nin."]="<布伦迪从酒杯间抬起头。>\n\n没错，就是这样。高阶萨满正在外头打仗，要夺回桑德玛尔废墟。而我就是所谓的\"低阶萨满\"。\n\n他不在的时候，就把我留在这儿，照看桑德玛尔所有的萨满事……事务。>"
G["<Bodley looks at you dubiously, but continues...>\n\nThere we are, spellbook in hand, and Kormok, our two-headed ogre necromancer, gets this strange look in all four of his eyes. It was really creepy, because that second set of eyes always kind of looked dead, like a cow's eyes, you know? So, all of a sudden he just reaches out and rips this amulet off that Valthalak was wearing.\n\nThe rest of the company went crazy; some of us telling them to leave it alone, and others who wanted it for themselves."]="<伯德雷满腹疑虑地盯着你，但是他还是继续说了下去……>\n\n我们终于把法术书弄到手了。库尔莫克，这个双头食人魔法师，两双眼睛中闪烁着怪异的光芒，令人毛骨悚然。他有一双毫无生气的眼睛，就像牛眼睛一样，你知道吗？就在此时，他突然伸出手，一把抓住了瓦塔拉克公爵的饰品。\n\n这一举动令大家炸了窝，一些人坚持要夺回饰品，另一些人则劝说他们不要争抢。"
G["<Bossy is busy trying to figure out how to get back downstairs.>"]="<小母牛正在努力思索该怎么下楼。>"
G["<Bossy looks at you with large, liquid black eyes.>"]="<小母牛用大大的、澄澈的黑眼睛望着你。>"
G["<Bossy lowers her head nobly, almost as if she understands the gravity and the meaning of your request.>"]="<小母牛优雅地低下了头，仿佛理解你请求中所包含的重要性与意义。>"
G["<Brann looks at you expectantly.>"]="<布莱恩满怀期待地看着你。>"
G["<Break Longshore's manacles and free him.>"]="<打断朗绍尔的镣铐，解救他。>"
G["<Budd holds very still, pretending not to hear you. Looking closely you see a bit of drool drip from under his mask.>"]="<巴德强作镇静，假装没有听你讲话。你专注地盯着他，发现一滴口水从他的面具下落下。>"
G["<Budd rocks back and forth on his haunches, muttering something that sounds like troll speech.>"]="<巴德来回扭动，用巨魔语念叨着什么。>"
G["<Budd rolls his eyes as he sees you draw near>\n\nAhh, yes, the soon-to-be-famous $n!\n\nTo what do I owe the pleasure of your company?"]="<Budd gira los ojos al ver que te acercas>（巴德见你走近，翻了个白眼）\n\n啊，没错，即将大名鼎鼎的 $n！\n\n是什么风把你吹到我这来的？"
G["<Call forth Darkscreecher Akkarai.>"]="<召唤黑暗尖啸者阿克卡莱。>"
G["<Call forth Gezzarak the Huntress.>"]="<召唤猎手吉萨拉克。>"
G["<Call forth Karrog.>"]="<召唤卡尔洛格。>"
G["<Call forth Terokk.>"]="<召唤泰罗克。>"
G["<Call forth Vakkiz the Windrager.>"]="<召唤风怒者瓦克奇斯。>"
G["<Check for a pulse...>"]="<检测脉搏……>"
G["<Chen acknowledges you with a nod but looks uncharacteristically sullen.>"]="<陈点头表示同意你的观点，但他看上去却一反常态地沉着脸。>"
G["<Chi-Ji's voice fills your mind.>\n\nDo you need help getting to the top of the pedestal, $n?"]="<赤精的声音在你脑内回响。>\n\n你需要我帮你抵达台顶吗，$n？"
G["<Chicken out.>"]="<退缩。>"
G["<Choluna's face darkens.>\n\nTen thousand years ago demons flooded across Azeroth in the War of the Ancients. Aviana called her children to the skies and fought off the demon hordes from the front lines. Her wrath was inescapable.\n\nHundreds fell before the fury of her talons. But ultimately she was surrounded by Doomguards, their barbed lances piercing her sides...\n\nIt is said that her blood itself attacked the demons, searing their flesh, destroying them even as she herself fell from the sky."]="<楚伦娜的脸色暗淡了下来。>\n\n一万年前，恶魔在上古战争期间闯入艾泽拉斯。艾维娜召集她的子嗣集聚天穹，在前线阻击恶魔军团。\n\n愤怒中的她所向披靡，千百个恶魔被她的利爪撕裂。可她最终还是陷入了末日守卫的包围，他们尖利的长矛从她身体两侧齐齐刺入……\n\n据说她的鲜血也仿佛有意志一般，向恶魔发起凶猛的攻击，烧灼他们的血肉，就像是她自己从天而降，把他们一举击溃。"
G["<Chu'a'lor's left head says,>\n\nWe find your zeal to help us most appealing...\n\n<His right head concludes,>\n\n... and we want you to know that we greatly appreciate your efforts!"]="<楚阿洛尔的左头说：>\n\n我们觉得你这股乐于相助的热忱非常讨人喜欢……\n\n<他的右头接话道：>……我们想让你知道，我们非常感激你的付出！>"
G["<Clarice stares over the body, her eyes vacant.>\n\nI rode here from Theramore as soon as the news reached me.\n\nJohn and I had always talked about settling down when the conflict subsided.\n\nI don't think the fighting will ever stop. Do you?"]="<克拉莉斯看着这具尸体，目光显得苍白而空洞。>\n\n我一得到消息，就从塞拉摩岛马不停蹄地赶到这里。\n\n约翰和我一直在讨论，等战争结束以后就定居下来。\n\n我觉得这场战争永远也不会结束，你觉得呢？"
G["<Clay grumbles and sneers.>\n\nDamn kids these days."]="<克莱嘟囔着，冷笑着。>\n\n这个该死的时代。"
G["<Club him unconscious.>"]="<把他敲昏。>"
G["<Continue helping the Rockpool tadpoles.>"]="<继续帮助岩池鱼人蝌蚪。>"
G["<Continue reading...>"]="<继续读……>"
G["<Copy the pattern into my journal.>"]="<将图样记录到我的日记中。>"
G["<Copy the schematic into your engineering notebook.>"]="<将这份结构示意图复制到你的工程学书本中。>"
G["<Corastrasza does a double-take.>\n\nYou!? YOU helped Rheastrasza? And lived to tell about it?\n\nI underestimate you, $r. No wonder Lord Afrasastrasz sent you to me.\n\nNo doubt you remember what happened next: Rheastrasza was killed by Deathwing, but thanks to her sacrifice a single purified black dragon egg was secreted away and hidden."]="<科拉丝塔萨又打量了你一下。>\n\n你！？你帮助过瑞亚丝塔萨？居然还能活到现在？\n\n我真是低估你了，$r。难怪阿弗拉沙斯塔兹指挥官会把你派来给我。\n\n那你肯定还记得后来发生的事：死亡之翼杀害了瑞亚丝塔萨，但由于她的牺牲，那颗净化过的黑龙蛋被秘密地送走并藏了起来。"
G["<Corastrasza steps between you and the nearby corpse, her face wrinkled with concern.>\n\nI'm sorry, $n. This is a private matter for the red flight to resolve.\n\nPlease see if you can help the others outside."]="<考拉斯特拉扎挡在你和附近的尸体之间，满脸忧虑。>\n\n抱歉，$n。这是红龙军团内部要解决的私事。\n\n请去看看外头的人有没有需要帮忙的。>"
G["<Cough.>\n\nHave I... died?"]="<咳嗽。>\n\n我……死了吗？"
G["<Cowlen sobs.>"]="<库雷呜咽着。>"
G["<Crack your knuckles and nod your head.>"]="<摩拳擦掌并点头。>"
G["<Create a sketch of the statue piece.>"]="<绘出雕像碎片的草图。>"
G["<Cyrus's eyes glow brightly>\n\nDo I devour you whole or do I allow you to live?\n\nPerhaps you could still be of some use...\n\nChallenge my minion, $r. Survive and return proof of your victory to me."]="<Los ojos de Cyrus brillan con intensidad>（塞勒斯的双眼亮起光芒）\n\n我是该把你整个吞下去，还是留你一条命？\n\n也许你还有点用处……\n\n去挑战我的仆从，$r。活下来，把你的胜利凭证带回来给我。>"
G["<Dalmond's body looks almost peaceful, buried only slightly in the sand.>"]="<达蒙德的身体埋在浅滩中，神色很安详。>"
G["<Dark magic ripples from the necrolyte.>"]="<通灵师的黑暗魔法泛起了波纹。>"
G["<Deathguard Simmer looks at you expectantly.>"]="<亡灵卫兵希米尔专注地看着你。>"
G["<Demitrian falls to his knees.>\n\nYou have recovered my Master's eternal prison!\n\nOh long have I waited for this day and finally, it is realized.\n\nHe must be released!"]="<德米提恩跪倒在地。>\n\n你已经找回了主人的牢笼！\n\n我期待这一天已经很久很久了，我的愿望终于实现了。\n\n必须解放我的主人！"
G["<Demitrian laughs.>\n\nYour reward is a quick and painful death, fool!"]="<德米提恩笑了。>\n\n愚蠢的家伙，你的奖励就是痛苦地死去！"
G["<Discreetly search the pirate's pockets for Taruk's payment.>"]="<谨慎地翻开海盗的口袋，寻找塔鲁克的欠款。>"
G["<Do the deed.>"]="<行动。>"
G["<Dog looks at you quizzically.>"]="<狗狗疑惑地看着你。>"
G["<Drakuru extends his bleeding hand through the cage and looks at you with anticipation.>"]="<达库鲁将滴血的手掌伸出笼子，满怀期待地看着你。>"
G["<Drawn out on this parchment is the schematic for a field repair robot.>"]="<羊皮纸上画着的是修理机器人的结构示意图。>"
G["<Drool dangles down the side of Jogu's mouth.>"]="<口水从贾古的嘴角淌了下来。>"
G["<Duyi looks at you, beaming with pride.>"]="<杜宇看着你，颇感自豪。>"
G["<Eitrigg laughs.>\n\nYoung one, the world has not always been in such disarray. It was a time before the Scourge had sacked the land. Before those parts of Lordaeron were known as the Plaguelands.\n\nIt was there that Thrall rescued me from death and it was then that I joined the new Horde... but I digress. This is a story for another time. Yes, another time... Perhaps..."]="<伊崔格笑了。>\n\n年轻人，世界不总是这么混乱不堪的。那只是亡灵天灾笼罩大地前的一段时间。在洛丹伦的那些地方在成为瘟疫之地之前。\n\n就是在那里萨尔从死亡之中拯救了我，也是在那里我加入了新的部落…但是我跑题了。这是另外一个时期的事。是的,另外一个时期……或许…"
G["<Eralan appears to be chewing on some deathweed.>\n\nIf you're looking to make a love potion, you've got the wrong place.  Blinding, crippling, and killing is my business and hopefully yours."]="<艾拉兰看上去正在研究着某种毒草。>\n\n如果你在找人帮你制作爱情药水，那么你来错地方了。我的知识全都是关于配制致盲、致残甚至致命的毒药……你也有希望成为我这样的行家。"
G["<Eris nods.>\n\nThe Eye has seen so many horrors and so many wonders.\n\nIt displays what it feels the one looking into it is most suited to see."]="<艾瑞斯点着头。>\n\n这只眼睛见证了许多恐怖和惊奇的事情。\n\n它会显现出观察者理应看到的场景。"
G["<Error retrieving data.... Please see Doc Zapnozzle for further instruction.>"]="<数据错误……请前往扎普诺兹医生处获取进一步指示。>"
G["<Farmer Yoon wipes his brow wearily.>\n\nThis is hopeless! I'll never move these rocks!"]="<农夫老愚疲惫地揉着眉头。>\n\n一点希望都没有！我永远也搬不光这些石头了！"
G["<Feed the grub to the rock falcon.>"]="<喂食岩石猎鹰。>"
G["<Field Marshal Chambers growls.>\n\nSo you're the riff-raff that assisted Didier in getting the supplies here in one piece? Where are the rest of you? I know there's gotta be more. Chickens like you generally roam in huge packs.\n\nBah, just give me the damned writ so I can sign off on it."]="<查博斯元帅咆哮着。>\n\n你们就是那群帮迪迪尔把这些补给运到这鬼地方来的家伙吗？这就是你们的全部人马？还有其他人吗？在哪儿？小鸡一般都是成群结队的。\n\n好吧好吧，给我该死的文件，我签了它，现在就签了它。"
G["<Fiona is rather upset.  She doesn't seem to be in the mood to talk.>"]="<菲奥拉显得非常不安，没有半点说话的心情。>"
G["<Fizzle's body bobs lifelessly.  His orb is clutched tightly in his right hand.>"]="<菲兹尔的躯体晃动着，毫无生命气息，右手却依然紧攥着那颗宝珠。>"
G["<Flaskataur flaps his majestic wings.>"]="<Flaskataur拍打着他巨大的双翼。>"
G["<Floon makes a series of strange clicking and clucking sounds.>"]="<弗鲁恩发出一连串奇怪的唧唧咯咯的声音。>"
G["<Forgotten footman shakes his head.>\n\nWe can't keep this up, friend. If Prince Arthas doesn't return soon we will all perish."]="<被遗忘的步兵摇了摇头。>\n\n我们快要支撑不下去了。阿尔萨斯王子殿下再不回来的话，我们都会没命的。"
G["<Furien groans.>"]="<弗瑞恩呻吟着。>"
G["<Gaze into the crystalline tear.>"]="<凝视着水晶之泪。>"
G["<Gershala rolls onto his side to look at you as you approach and you see a hopeful smile creep onto his face.>"]="<戈沙拉翻滚过来，看着你。你在他的脸上发现了一抹充满希望的微笑。>"
G["<Get in the bomber and return to Scalawag Point.>"]="<Monta en el bombardero y regresa a Cabo Pillastre>（登上轰炸机，返回无赖角）"
G["<Get on the work bench and let Walt put you in the golem suit.>"]="<跳上工作台，让沃尔特将你塞进魔像中。>"
G["<Give up.  This is too scary.>"]="<放弃吧。这太吓人了。>"
G["<Gobber acts tough, but you can tell that deep down, he's scared.>"]="<大胖看起来很凶悍，但可以确认，他心里是害怕了。>"
G["<Gobber grunts.>\n\nMe banker now!"]="<大胖哼哼着。>\n\n俺现在是银行家了！"
G["<Gobber mostly grunts. You're not even certain that he can talk.>"]="<戈伯大多只是哼哼。$g你:你;甚至不确定他到底会不会说话。>"
G["<Goretooth spits.>\n\nI am a warrior of the Horde, $n. It fills me with rage to know that our enemies sit in a fortress, less than a day's ride from Kargath, plotting against us.\n\nHow I long to break free from the bonds of duty and destroy them all in the name of the Warchief.\n\nAlas, we all have roles we must fulfill."]="<血牙啐了一口。>\n\n我是部落的战士，$n。一想到我们的敌人就坐在离卡加斯不到一天路程的堡垒里谋划对付我们，我就怒火中烧。\n\n我多么渴望挣脱职责的束缚，以大酋长之名把他们统统消灭。\n\n唉，可我们每个人都有必须履行的本分。>"
G["<Gormungan emits a good-natured snort.>\n\nHaaarrum! I have never had my personal habits scrutinized so. Your kind never ceases to surprise me. Farewell, friend, and good luck with ... whatever it is you are on about."]="<格蒙刚和善地喷了一下鼻息。>\n\n 哈！我还没有这样细致地考虑过自己的个人习惯呢。你们总是让我感到吃惊。再见，朋友，祝你好运……无论你要找的是什么。"
G["<Gormungan eyes the laxative with suspicion, then sniffs it. With visible irritation, he begins smooshing and molding the laxative into the shape of a goblin.>\n\nI suspect your little green friends are putting you up to no good. Please explain to them that we giants are not to be toyed with.\n\n<To demonstrate his point, Gormungan twists the head off of his chocolaty goblin statue before handing it back to you.>"]="<格蒙刚带着怀疑的神情看着这团软软的东西，然后又嗅了嗅它，便气恼地将它捏塑成一只地精的样子。>\n\n我怀疑你那些小绿人朋友没想让你做好事儿。去告诉他们，我们巨人可不是任人玩弄的。\n\n<为了表达他的意思，格蒙刚在把他刚做成的地精雕像交给你的时候，又用力拧断了它的脑袋。>"
G["<Gormungan's laugh, deep and long, rumbles the ground and causes distant rockslides.>\n\nOh - hah! Harroooo - Ha harum! Little friend, I am sorry. I suppose my kind does not pick up after ourselves as you do."]="<格蒙刚的笑声浑厚而悠长。大地也随着他的声音在颤抖，远处细碎的砾石在不住地滑动。>\n\n哦……哈！哈！哈！小朋友，我很抱歉。我想，我们一族的行为方式和你总会有些区别。"
G["<Gormungan's voice booms deep from within, hurting your ears and reverberating in the very ground beneath your feet.>\n\nHallo, softling.\n\nYour kind dashes about, always running, never stopping. Rest with me a while."]="<格蒙刚的声音发出隆隆的回音，让你感到耳鼓震痛，脚下的地面也在一阵阵颤抖。>\n\n你好，小软人。\n\n你们总是喜欢四处乱窜。来，和我休息一会儿吧。"
G["<Gott sneers contemptuously at you.>\n\nCan you possibly work any slower? I'm surrounded by useless idiots!"]="<多德轻蔑地向你哼了一声。>\n\n你的动作还能再慢一点吗？我身边都是没用的白痴！"
G["<Grease the cannonballs.>"]="<用油涂抹炮弹。>"
G["<Greatmother Geyah laughs weakly.>\n\nOf course not, dear. But it's not me that has to believe...\n\nGarrosh can lead the Mag'har. He is strong and wise. All of the spirits approve of him. He just needs to believe in himself. He fears so much... He fears so deeply that if he lets himself go, his rage will consume him and all that would be near him."]="<Abuela Geyah ríe débilmente>\n\nClaro que no, $gquerido:querida;. Pero yo no soy quien debe creer...\n\nGarrosh puede liderar a los Mag'har. Es fuerte y sabio. Tiene el apoyo de los espíritus. Solo necesita creer en sí mismo. Tiene mucho miedo... Su miedo es tan profundo que si se deja llevar, la rabia lo consumirá a él y a cuantos lo rodeen."
G["<Greatmother Geyah nods, accepting your answer.>\n\nI can no longer fight the spirits, $n. My time has long since passed. Once again, I must thank you for all that you have done. While Garrosh may be unmovable, many of my people have been lifted by your accomplishments. They are now willing to fight for our rights as a united clan."]="<盖亚安祖母点了点头，接受了你的回答。>\n\n我不能再和灵魂战斗了，$n。我的时日已经不多了。我必须再次感谢你所做的一切，虽然你也许无法改变加尔鲁什，但我的很多人民已经由于你的努力而重新树立了信心。他们现在非常希望能为我们氏族的生存而战。"
G["<Greatmother Geyah nods.>\n\nDid you know my son?"]="<盖亚安祖母点了点头。>\n\n你认识我儿子？"
G["<Greatmother Geyah smiles at you.>\n\nYou remind me of my son, $n.\n\nHe was an immovable mountain: A pillar of strength and honor.\n\n<Geyah's eyes well up with tears.>\n\nHe sacrificed himself so that we could survive. So that generations of orcs after him could be born into a world without the blood curse... Without Gul'dan and his dark Horde...\n\n<Geyah stares into the distance, lost in thought.>\n\nOh Durotan, how I wish you could be here. Your people so desperately need you..."]="<盖亚安祖母对你笑了笑。>\n\n你让我想起了我的儿子，$n。\n\n他曾是一座雄伟的山脉，一个代表着力量和荣誉的支柱。\n\n<盖亚安的眼睛里闪烁着泪花。>\n\n他为了我们的生存牺牲了自己，为了让兽人后代们可以出生在一个没有血之诅咒……没有古尔丹和他的黑暗部落的世界。\n\n<盖亚安凝视着远方，发着呆。>\n\n杜隆坦……我多么希望你能在这里啊，你的人民需要你……"
G["<Greatmother Geyah smiles.>\n\nI am old. It is my time. When I pass, my spirit will move on to the spirit realm. It is there that I will stand with my ancestors. It is there that we will watch over our people.\n\nWhen Garad was alive Mother Kashur's duty was the same as my duty now."]="<盖亚安祖母笑了笑。>\n\n我老了，我的时日已经不多了。当我去世以后，我的灵魂会前往灵魂的国度。我会在那里与我的祖先们团聚。那就是我们关注着仍然活着的人民的地方。\n\n当加拉达还活着的时候，卡舒尔宗母的职责就和我现在的一样。"
G["<Greatmother Geyah's violet eyes lock onto yours.>\n\nYes..."]="<盖亚安祖母的那双紫罗兰色的眼睛盯着你。>\n\n而且……？"
G["<Grondal reaches futilely towards you as you approach, but his arm collapses as life slips from him.>"]="<格隆达尔无力地向你伸出手。随着他的生命迅速流逝，他的手臂瘫软了下去。>"
G["<Grumble> Pretty dress indeed! <Grumble>"]="<Queja>（咕哝）好一件漂亮裙子！< Queja >（咕哝）"
G["<Grumbles>  I guess those mountains came out of nowhere...  All five times!"]="<抱怨> 那些山都不知道从哪里钻出来的……五次都是突然出现！"
G["<Grumbles>  You'd think it would be hard to crash a zeppelin into the ocean.  You'd think it'd be even harder to do it four separate times!"]="<抱怨> 你可能会觉得让一艘飞艇撞进海里挺困难的，但是前后发生了四次就更不可思议了！"
G["<Grumbles> I still don't know how we managed to snake through Thousand Needles without a scratch, only to crash and burn in the Shimmering Flats!"]="<抱怨> 我真不知道为什么我们能毫发无损地穿过千针石林的那一大堆石柱，最后却坠毁在闪光平原上！"
G["<Grumbles> I wish I could say we've managed to avoid crash landing into lakes.  I wish I could say we've only crashed into a lake once... but we've managed to crash into four separate lakes, including Lordamere Lake!"]="<抱怨> 我真希望我们能设法避免坠入湖中。我真希望我们只坠入湖中一次……但实际上，我们先后坠入四面湖中，其中还包括洛丹米尔湖！"
G["<Grunt>"]="<哼哼>"
G["<Grunt>\n\nYou need something, $r?"]="<哼哼>\n\n你需要些什么，$r？"
G["<Han is encased in a tomb of amber.>"]="<韩被包围在琥珀的坟墓里。>"
G["<Hawthorne wrinkles his brow.>\n\nI would prefer not to use the term 'sacked,' but yes, the attack went off flawlessly. We removed Taurajo from the equation, confiscated its arms, and destroyed its smithing facilities. The assault gave our forces considerable breathing room and knocked the enemy off balance.\n\nNonetheless, during the assault, I instructed my men to leave a gap open in our lines..."]="<霍桑皱起眉头。>\n\n我更愿意不用\"洗劫\"这个词，但没错，那次突袭执行得天衣无缝。我们把陶拉祖从棋盘上抹掉了，没收了他们的武器，摧毁了他们的锻造设施。这次突袭给我们的部队争取到了相当大的喘息空间，也打乱了敌人的阵脚。\n\n话虽如此，突袭期间，我下令让我的部下在我们的阵线上留了一个缺口……>"
G["<He clutches a handkerchief with the initials, S.S.>"]="<他手里攥着一块手帕，上面绣着一个小字：“娜”。>"
G["<He leans in closer.>\n\nJust between you and me, I'm thinking about 'mustering' out one of these nights.  You know what I mean?"]="<他斜靠了过来。>\n\n就我和你，我想也许哪天晚上我们可以一起出去，你知道我的意思。"
G["<He looks at the rocket and flashes a nervous grin.>\n\nOkay, yeah, so maybe I made a couple rockets for some guys. So what? The gold was good and I was paid for my work. It's not like anyone died. That's about as honest as work gets. What's it to you?"]="<他看了看火箭，咧开嘴紧张地笑了笑。>\n\n好吧，我是给别人做了些火箭。那又怎么样？价格不错，我也得到了酬劳。这不是出不出人命的问题。工作就要实事求是。这跟你有关系吗？"
G["<He looks down the hall intently.>"]="<他专心地俯视大厅。>"
G["<He looks like he was knocked unconscious in all the fighting.>\n\n<He clutches tightly to a leather bag.>"]="<他似乎在战斗伊始就被打晕了。>\n\n<他手中紧紧抓着一只皮包。>"
G["<He looks to you grimly.>"]="<他对你露出了满脸的狰狞。>"
G["<He stares at you blankly.>"]="<他面无表情地注视着你。>"
G["<He wipes the sweat from his brow.>\n\nHello there, $c. You here to help?"]="<他擦了擦额头上的汗水。>\n\n你好啊，$c。你是来帮忙的？"
G["<He's eyes light up as you approach.>"]="<当你靠近的时候，他变得异常兴奋。>"
G["<He's sound asleep.>"]="<他睡得很熟。>"
G["<Help the Rockpool tadpoles.>"]="<帮助岩池鱼人蝌蚪。>"
G["<High Inquisitor Fairbanks lifts up his tabard revealing several gruesome scars.>\n\nBecause I was there... I was the Highlord's most trusted advisor. I should have known... I felt that something was amiss yet I allowed it to happen. Would you believe that there were a thousand or more Scourge?"]="<大检查官法尔班克斯撩起了他的罩袍，并向你展示了伤口>\n\n因为我当时也在那里……我是大领主最信任的幕僚。我应该察觉这一切的……我当时就觉着事情有些不对，可我却还是让一切继续发生了下去。你知道吗？你能想象吗？当时那里起码有一千名以上的天灾军士兵。"
G["<High Inquisitor Fairbanks nods.>\n\nAye, the lesser Mograine, the one known as the Scarlet Commander, through - what I suspect - the dealings of the Grand Crusader. He led his father to the ambush like a lamb to the slaughter."]="<大检察官法尔班克斯点了点头>\n\n是的，就是小莫格莱尼，血色指挥官，我怀疑，他也参与了大十字军的交易。就是他，他将他的父亲引向了死亡之路。"
G["<High Inquisitor Fairbanks shakes his head.>\n\nNo, $r; only one of his sons is dead. The other lives...\n\n<High Inquisitor Fairbanks points to the sky.>\n\nThe Outland... Find him there..."]="<大检察官法尔班克斯摇了摇头。>\n\n不，$r，他的一个儿子死了。但另一个还活着……\n\n<大检察官法尔班克斯抬起手指向了天空。>\n\n外域……去那里找他吧……"
G["<High Inquisitor Fairbanks shakes his head.>\n\nNo... He stood in the background, watching as the legion of undead descended upon us. Soon after, my powers were exhausted. I was the first to fall... Surely they would tear me limb from limb as I lay there unconscious; but they ignored me completely, focusing all of their attention on the Highlord."]="<大检查官法尔班克斯摇了摇头。>\n\n不……他仍旧站得远远的，看着我们被成群的天灾军士兵包围。不久之后，我的能力就耗尽了。我是第一个倒下的人……要不是我失去了意识，看起来像死人一样，天灾士兵们一定会把我彻底撕碎的，我晕了过去，它们彻底忽略了我，全力对付大领主。"
G["<Highlord Darion Mograine nods.>"]="<大领主达里安·莫格莱尼点了点头。>"
G["<Huju glances warily over his shoulder.> Not now. Things be gettin' pretty hot in here lately."]="<胡祖警惕地看了看身后。>现在不行。最近这里的局势非常紧张。"
G["<Isfar sighs.>\n\nA couple of treehouses don't make a home, but it was vast improvement over the Sethekk Halls.\n\nComfortable as it was in Shattrath, I can't bring myself to return to my true home in Skettis without my sister. She's still trapped in the Sethekk Halls, held prisoner by our older brother."]="<伊斯法尔叹了口气。>\n\n几间树屋还算不上是家，但是这已经比塞泰克大厅好多了。\n\n就算和在沙塔斯城一样舒适，我也不会丢下我的妹妹一个人回到老家斯克提斯去。她被我们的长兄抓走了，被困在塞泰克大厅里。"
G["<It looks as if this solider might be feigning to throw off naga suspicion. It likely saved her life.>"]="<看样子，这名士兵靠装死摆脱了纳迦的怀疑。这个举动大概救了她的命。>"
G["<It looks as if this solider might be feigning to throw off naga suspicion. It likely saved his life.>"]="<看样子，这名士兵靠装死摆脱了纳迦的怀疑。这个举动大概救了他的命。>"
G["<It's a giant, armored, saddle-bearing attack cat. Isn't that already silly enough without it talking, too?>"]="<它是一头巨大的、全副武装的、带着鞍具的攻击型猛兽，若是它开口说话的话，就显得更傻了。>"
G["<Jack grunts something about the hammer being his weapon... you think.>"]="<杰克低声嘟囔着。你觉得他似乎是在说，锤子是他的武器。>"
G["<Jaina brushes her hair from her eyes, deep in thought.>\n\nYou're so passionate for your cause and clear in your convictions. Believe me when I say that the Sunreavers are the same. The Horde is their family.\n\nNot all of them support Garrosh. But they're not about to abandon their own people... I couldn't ask them to do so without tearing the Kirin Tor apart.\n\nThe Kirin Tor is sacred to me. We need to stay united."]="<吉安娜轻轻拨弄着眼前的一缕金发，陷入了沉思。>\n\n你对你们的事业无比热忱，并且意志坚定。但相信我，夺日者和你是一样的。部落是他们的家人。\n\n并不是所有的部落都支持加尔鲁什，但他们不会抛弃自己的人民……我不能驱逐他们，这样会让肯瑞托分裂。\n\n对我来说，肯瑞托是一个神圣的词。我们必须团结一致。"
G["<Jaina smiles.>\n\nIf only we all shared your strength and conviction! To be honest, I struggle. Every. Day.\n\nBut you are right. The Kirin Tor is bigger than you, me, Alliance or Horde. I have a responsibility to preserve it, and to use its powers wisely.\n\nYou and I seem to agree. I doubt the King sees it that way. But... do you think we can convince Anduin?"]="<吉安娜露出了微笑。>\n\n要是我们能够分享你的力量和信念就好了！老实说。我每一天都在挣扎。每一天。\n\n但你说的没错，肯瑞托高于你我，高于联盟。我有责任去维持肯瑞托的舷窗，并且明智地使用它的力量。\n\n看上去，你我能达成共识，但我怀疑暴风城国王是否也能认同这一点。不过……你觉得我们能说服安度因吗？"
G["<Jaina warms to you immediately.>\n\nA kindred soul! Thank you, $p, for your honesty. You seem to understand my struggle. Every day, the hard decisions. Every night... the nightmares.\n\nBut I have a responsibility to preserve the Kirin Tor. I'm glad you're with me on this. The King would never see it this way. Do you think we can explain it to Anduin?"]="<吉安娜的语气立马变得热情起来。>\n\n你我有同样的灵魂！感谢你，$p，感谢你的诚实。你似乎能理解我的挣扎。没错，我每一天都在挣扎，这是艰难的决定。每个夜晚都是梦魇……\n\n但我有责任维持肯瑞托的现状。我很高兴，你和我持有同样的观点。但暴风城国王一定不会这样想。你觉得我们能和安度因解释吗？"
G["<Jaina's eyes grow sad.>\n\nSo... you would purge the city? Cast the Sunreavers from their homes? The very same Sunreavers who helped humans discover magic in the first place?\n\nYou and I are obviously very different. I suppose I see my role - and the mission of the Kirin Tor - a little differently. My mind is set. Would you like to hear what I think?"]="<吉安娜的眼神有些悲伤。>\n\n所以说……你要肃清这座城市？你要把夺日者，那些曾经帮助人类洞悉魔法奥秘的人，赶出他们自己的家园？\n\n显然，你我持有不同的观点。我很明白我应该扮演的角色——以及肯瑞托的任务——和你的希望有所不同。我的心意已决。你想听听我的想法吗？"
G["<Jasper doesn't respond. The only sound that fills the room is the faint rustling of breath.>"]="<贾斯珀没有回应。房间里唯一的声音，是微弱的气息声。>"
G["<Jogu squints at you.>\n\nHey, do I know you?"]="<贾古斜睨着你。>\n\n嘿，我认识你吗？"
G["<Kaide hisses at you.>\n\nBe quiet, or you'll bring the orcs and the Alliance down on us, you clumsy oaf!\n\nThat's right, nod your head, and when we're done speaking, you'll walk away and forget you found me here."]="<凯德对你发出嘘声。>\n\n你这个蠢货！小声点，否则你会把那些兽人和联盟全引到我们这里来！\n\n对，就那样，点点头就行了，在我们完成谈话后，走远点，把我们的见面忘了吧。"
G["<Karthog offers you a drink from his waterskin.>\n\nOnce we called this the Gold Road, $c. Today it runs red with blood.\n\nAlliance blood, if I have anything to do with it."]="<卡索格将水袋递给你。>\n\n我们曾经称这里为黄金大道，$c。今天，它却被鲜血染红。\n\n那全都是联盟的血。"
G["<Keep Listening>"]="<Seguir escuchando>（继续聆听）"
G["<Kelsuwa doesn't make eye contact with you.>\n\nI escaped amidst the fighting, but not before freeing all the stabled animals.\n\nI couldn't keep them with me. They scattered into the smoke..."]="<Kelsuwa evita mirarte a los ojos.>\n\nEscapé en medio de la batalla, pero no antes de liberar a todos los animales que tenía en el establo.\n\n$n, no podía llevármelos conmigo. Se perdieron en el humo..."
G["<Khadgar grins to himself>\n\nI convinced A'dal and his brethren to return here with me. I believe that only their power can drive the Legion from this universe. But as you will no doubt find - their power must first live in our hearts.\n\nTo combat the darkness, we must become beacons of their eternal Light."]="<卡德加笑了笑。>\n\n我劝说阿达尔和他们的伙伴们和我一起回到这里。我相信只有他们的力量可以将燃烧军团赶出这个宇宙。但是,毫无疑问，就像你很快就会认识到的那样——他们的力量首先必须在我们的心中扎根。\n\n为了和黑暗进行斗争，我们必须成为他们永恒圣光的灯塔。"
G["<Kharan clears his throat.>\n\nWe made our way through the Searing Gorge tunnel and into the ravaged wasteland comprising the gorge. In retrospect, things were eerily quiet. The only dangers we ran across were the wildlife of the region: Creatures that my men easily dispatched.\n\nWe reached Blackrock Mountain with relative ease and made our way through the stonewrought construction without so much as a hiccup."]="<卡兰清了清喉咙。>\n\n我们艰难地穿过灼热峡谷的隧道，进入了这片饱经蹂躏的荒地。现在回想起来，这事情十分蹊跷。我们所遇到的危险只不过是在这个地区生存的一些野生动物，我们很容易就赶走了它们。\n\n我们轻松地抵达了黑石山，并毫不费力地穿过了这座由巨石砌成的堡垒。"
G["<Kharan sighs.>\n\nI suppose... I suppose you are right.\n\nGor'shak told me that your Warchief has big plans. Plans that may change the way the Alliance and Horde interact. What do you know about this?"]="<卡兰叹了口气。>\n\n我想……我想你是对的。\n\n哥沙克告诉我你的酋长有个大计划，一个可能会改变联盟和部落关系的计划。关于这点你知道些什么？"
G["<Kick him in his big fat face.>"]="<一脚踢在他的肥屁股上。>"
G["<Kilag motions you to keep your voice down.>"]="<基拉格示意你压低声音。>"
G["<Kiryn stares blankly up at the sky and doesn't respond.>"]="<琪麟茫然地凝视天空，没有任何回应。>"
G["<Klaxxi'va Ik regards you with a judging eye.>"]="<卡拉克西瓦·伊克用审视的眼神注视着你。>"
G["<Koltira groans.>"]="<库尔迪拉呻吟着。>"
G["<Kovok chitters happily... you think.>"]="<你觉得……科沃克欢快地叫着。>"
G["<Kovok look at you with concern.>"]="<科沃克关切地看着你。>"
G["<Kovok's eyes widen as he looks at you.>"]="<科沃克睁大眼睛望着你。>"
G["<Kristoff grunts.>"]="<克里斯托弗哼哼着。>"
G["<Ku'ma stares at you.>"]="<库玛瞪着你。>"
G["<L'ghorek's voice booms inside your mind.>\n\nI AM ALMOST... DEAD. YOU MUST HELP... STOP... THE TWILIGHT'S HAMMER.\n\nTHEY DRAIN... MY ENERGY TO... CREATE... THEIR ASCENDANTS. THEY ARE A... GRAVE THREAT IN... THE IMMINENT WAR... VERSUS... NEPTULON."]="<拉葛雷克的声音在你脑中回荡。>\n\n我已经要……死了。你必须帮忙……阻止……暮光之锤。\n\n他们汲取……我的能量……来创造……他们的升腾者。他们在……对抗耐普图隆的……战争中……将是重大的……威胁。"
G["<Lady Prestor glares at you.>"]="<普瑞斯托女士怒视着你。>"
G["<Lantresor glares at you as if he were looking through you.>\n\nPerhaps there is another way... I will agree to your leader's demands, only if you do exactly as I ask.\n\nWith your assistance, we may be able to help each other out greatly."]="<兰特瑞索瞪着你，仿佛目光穿透了你。>\n\n也许还有别的办法……只要你完全照我说的做，我就答应你首领的条件。\n\n有你的协助，我们或许能帮上彼此大忙。"
G["<Lantresor laughs heartily.>\n\nDo you know where you are, fool? This is ogre land. Before orc, before draenei, there was ogre. Yet, you wish to start a war that you will inevitably lose? Boulderfist will crush you. And if Boulderfist does not destroy you, Warmaul will...\n\nBut I think your leaders already know this..."]="<兰特瑞索放声大笑。>\n\n傻瓜，你知道自己在哪儿吗？这是食人魔的地盘。在兽人之前，在德莱尼之前，这里就是食人魔的。可你还想挑起一场你注定输掉的战争？石拳会碾碎你。就算石拳没毁掉你，战槌也会……\n\n不过我想，$g你:你;的首领们早就知道这一点了……"
G["<Learn to bite through nets from the elder raptor.>"]="<从年老迅猛龙那里学习用牙咬穿网的技能。>"
G["<Learn to drop skulls from the elder raptor.>"]="<从年老迅猛龙那里学习丢落头骨的技能。>"
G["<Learn to light fires from the elder raptor.>"]="<从年老迅猛龙那里学习点火的技能。>"
G["<Leave him shackled.>"]="<让他继续被锁着。>"
G["<Leave them to fend for themselves.>"]="<让他们自己保护自己吧。>"
G["<Llane's true wisdom and strength burn bright, even in this likeness of the king.>"]="<即使只是一枚棋子，莱恩国王的力量和智慧仍闪烁着光芒。>"
G["<Lorewalker Cho watches you with a curious anticipation.>"]="<游学者周卓好奇又期待地看着你。>"
G["<Lump shrugs.>\n\nYou bring da war to da Boulderfist. We put it in da stew."]="<拉姆普耸了耸肩。>\n\n你把战争带给石拳。我们就把它炖进锅里。"
G["<Lydros reaches into his robe and presents you with a dull, flat elven blade.>\n\nIn ages past, well before even the War of the Ancients, there existed this blade."]="<莱德罗斯将手伸进他的长袍，拿出一把又盾又扁的精灵刀。>\n\n在过去，在远古战争之前，他们就是用这把刀来求生的。"
G["<Make a series of complicated hand gestures.>"]="<做出一系列复杂的手势。>"
G["<Marion squaks loudly and glares at you.>"]="<玛瑞恩一边大声喘叫一边瞪着你。>"
G["<Mathredis gazes intently at the libram.>\n\nYou come for an amalgamation? Have you done as the libram instructed?"]="<玛瑟迪斯目不转睛地盯着圣契。>\n\n你来寻求融合物的？你按照圣契的指示做了吗？"
G["<Maximillian is deep in prayer, oblivious to your presence.>"]="<麦斯米兰沉浸在祈祷中，忘却了你的存在。>"
G["<Merge with the spirit.>"]="<与这个灵魂融合。>"
G["<Mishi appears ready to leave.>"]="<米师似乎已经准备离开了。>"
G["<Mishi bobs up and down excitedly.>"]="<米师兴奋得上窜下跳。>"
G["<Mishi bobs up and down with glee.>"]="<米师欢快得上窜下跳。>"
G["<Mishi is happy!>"]="<米师很快乐！>"
G["<Mishi is puzzled by your actions.>"]="<米师不明白你为什么这么做。>"
G["<Mishi is very happy with you!>"]="<米师很高兴和你在一起！>"
G["<Mishi looks at you inquisitively.>"]="<米师好奇地看着你。>"
G["<Mishi looks at you with concern.>"]="<米师关切地看着你。>"
G["<Mishi looks expectantly at you.>"]="<米师满怀期待地望着你。>"
G["<Mishi smiles at you.>"]="<米师冲着你笑。>"
G["<Mishi surveys the valley apprehensively.>"]="<米师忧心忡忡地搜索着山谷。>"
G["<Mishi tilts his head curiously at you.>"]="<米师歪着脑袋，好奇地看着你。>"
G["<Mishi watches you.>"]="<米师看着你。>"
G["<Mishi wonders what you are doing.>"]="<米师不明白你在做什么。>"
G["<Miss Fanny looks at you expectantly. Her eye twinkles with anticipation.>\n\n<Miss Fanny's moment for glory has arrived.>"]="<范妮小姐期待地看着你，眼神里充满了希望。>\n\n<范妮小姐的荣耀时刻已经到来。>"
G["<Miss Fanny looks at you expectantly.>"]="<范妮小姐充满期待地看着你。>"
G["<Miss Fanny looks you in the eye and subtly turns her head. Does... does she want to launch YOU?>\n\n<Assuming that you have correctly interpreted her intentions, how hard should Miss Fanny hit you?>"]="<范妮小姐看着你的眼睛，微妙地侧了侧头。她……她是想把你打出去吗？>\n\n<假如你没猜错，那范妮小姐又会用多大的力气呢？>"
G["<Miss Fanny shuffles uncomfortably. Either she's nervous about the nearby combat, or anxious to get into the fray herself.>"]="<范妮小姐显得局促不安。她既为迫近的战斗而紧张，又渴望能够投身战场。>"
G["<Miss Fanny stares forward resolutely. She is dedicated to her job.>"]="<范妮小姐坚定地凝视着前方。她下定决心要完成任务。>"
G["<Morthis glances skyward.>\n\nIn a way, I envy the freedom Rook and Corvax enjoy. To be free of earthbound responsibilities is a great blessing indeed.\n\nThe future will see me on wing once more, but first there's a task I must complete."]="<莫希斯注视着天空。>\n\n从某种程度上说，我很羡慕鲁克和考瓦克斯所享受的自由。摆脱大地的束缚事实上是一种伟大的祝福。\n\n将来我会再次进入天空飞翔的，不过我必须先完成一项使命。"
G["<Mudlump is polishing his boots.>"]="<玛德拉普正在擦着他的靴子。>"
G["<Na Lek smiles at you, and you feel young as though you have not felt in years.>"]="<纳乐对你微笑，你觉得自己焕发了久违的年轻活力。>"
G["<Narain holds an unopened envelope to his forehead.>\n\nWhat is... Mmmm... Velvet!\n\nAm I right?\n\nIf you're here to try and relearn a tradeskill, use the book over there...\n\n<Narain points to \"Soothsaying for Dummies.\">"]="<纳雷恩把一封没拆开的信按在额头上。>\n\n这是……嗯……天鹅绒！\n\n我说对了吗？\n\n如果你是来重新学习某项专业的，就用那边那本书……\n\n<纳雷恩指了指\"《占卜入门》\"。>"
G["<Naturalist Bite growls.> You took my worldly possessions, but you will NEVER take my soul!"]="<博学者拜特咆哮着。>你们夺走了我在世俗间的财产，但是你们永远都夺不走我的灵魂！"
G["<Neltharaku nods.>\n\nKarynaku... She is held prisoner atop Dragonmaw Fortress. I have made many attempts to free her. All have failed... You have battled these beasts before, have you not?"]="<奈尔萨拉库点了点头。>\n\n卡瑞纳库……她被囚禁在龙喉要塞顶上。我试过许多次想救她，全都失败了……你以前跟这些野兽交过手，对吧？"
G["<Niuzao nods approvingly at you.>"]="<砮皂赞许地向你点点头。>"
G["<Nod>."]="<Asentir>（点头）。"
G["<Nuainn Stormwing shakes his head.>\n\nWith the Legion on one side and Illidan's minions on the other, it's going to take everything we've got to defend the stronghold, and defend it we will! Every true Wildhammer would sooner die than surrender our home."]="<努埃恩摇了摇头。>\n\n燃烧军团和伊利丹的随从使我们腹背受敌，我们要做好牺牲一切的准备来防御要塞，绝对不能失败！真的蛮锤矮人宁死也不会抛弃自己的家园。"
G["<Nudge the cork.>"]="<轻推木塞。>"
G["<Offer food.>"]="<施舍食物。>"
G["<Offer the murloc a drink.>"]="<给这个鱼人一些喝的。>"
G["<Offer the ogre a drink.>"]="<给这个食人魔一些喝的。>"
G["<Offer the pirate a drink.>"]="<给这个海盗一些喝的。>"
G["<Offer to pay his debt for him.> Don't worry about it. I will pay your share today."]="<提出替他还债。>别担心。我今天替你还上。"
G["<Offer to pay off her debt.> I'll pay your debt today. It's the least I can do."]="<提出替她还债。>我今天替你还上。我也只能做这么多了。"
G["<Offer to pay off his debt.>\nDon't worry, Jambeezi. I will pay your share today."]="<提出替他还债。>\n别担心，迦姆比兹。我今天替你还上。"
G["<Offer to pay off his debt.> I'll pay your debt today. Next time, try to be more responsible."]="<提出替他还债。>我今天先替你还上。下次，学会有所担当。"
G["<Old Icefin draws in the sand. From the crude pictures he traces you can make out that he wants your help.>"]="<老冰鳞在沙地上画画，希望你能从粗糙的图案上看出他是在企求你的帮助。>"
G["<Old Icefin eyes you warily, his fishy eye blinking as he bobs his head up and down once in a curt dismissal.>"]="<老冰鳞警惕地盯着你，他漫不经心地晃动着脑袋，眨巴着死鱼眼。>"
G["<Omarion grumbles something under his breath.>\n\nBut of course I can help you, dear $g boy:girl;. It is my dying wish... my final desire. Please, take this handbook. The information on its pages are a compilation of all that I know and have learned in the past 30 some-odd years of my miserable life. Give the handbook to that good for nothing apprentice of mine that's probably sitting on his fat duff at Light's Hope Chapel."]="<奥玛里恩一边喘息着一边叙述着什么。>\n\n当然，我可以帮助你，亲爱的$g小伙子:姑娘;。这是我死前……最后一个愿望了。请拿走这本手册吧。上面的信息是我三十年来所继承并学习到的全部家学。把它带给我那个傻得可爱的学徒，他或许还傻傻地坐在圣光之愿礼拜堂门口等我回去呢。"
G["<On seeing you approach, Calder re-hinges his jaw to speak with you.>"]="<一看到你，卡尔德装上他的下巴，准备和你说话。>"
G["<One gets the sense that Oric is here only in a sorry attempt at comic relief and shouldn't be paid attention to, as it will only encourage him.>"]="<有人觉得奥克会来这里只是一种愚蠢的英雄主义思想在作祟，因此不需要理会，那样只会更加鼓励他这样做。>"
G["<Order Thisalee to kill the harpy.>"]="<任由希萨莉处置这只鹰身女妖。>"
G["<Ota Wen's eyes, already dull from his enslavement, glaze over even more at your suggestion. You feel the power of Dartol's Rod begin to course through you and reach out to touch the furbolg.>\n\nRise up?"]="<奥塔·旺的眼睛本已经因为饱受奴役而变得灰暗。听到你的方案，它们重新闪烁出光芒。你感觉到达图尔魔棒的力量通过你传到了这只熊怪的身上。>\n\n你要反抗吗？"
G["<Overlord Mor'ghor salutes.>"]="<莫格霍尔大王向你敬礼。>"
G["<Paint a Portrait of Prince Anduin.>"]="<画一幅安度因王子的肖像画。>"
G["<Paint something abstract.>"]="<画出抽象的图案。>"
G["<Paint something heroic.>"]="<画出英雄的图案。>"
G["<Paint something sexy.>"]="<画出性感的图案。>"
G["<Pay the 10,000 gold.>"]="<支付10,000金。>"
G["<Pick up the orb and shake it vigorously.>"]="<捡起宝珠后用力摇动。>"
G["<Place my hand on the orb.>"]="<把我的手放在宝珠上。>"
G["<Place the food and drink inside the lifeboat.>"]="<把食物和饮料放进救生船里。>"
G["<Place the pawn in the indentation.>"]="<将人偶放在缺口上。>"
G["<Placing the requisite accelerator module within the space on the controller, you give it a final pull.  The module glows for a moment and its power is consumed as the device hums to life.>"]="<你将加速器模组放入控制器上的凹槽中，然后拉下控制杆。模组顿时散发出光芒，它的能量随着机械的蜂鸣声转化为了动力。>"
G["<Ponder the lessons of Malik.> [Klaxxi Enhancement]"]="<思考玛里克的教诲。>"
G["<Pound this chump.>"]="<胖揍这个蠢货。>"
G["<Pour some of the Dreadbrew onto Han's amber. Just to see what happens.>"]="<倒一些恐惧老酒在韩的琥珀上。然后看看会发生什么。>"
G["<Pour the water onto the gunpowder.>"]="<把水倒在火药上。>"
G["<Priestess Il'dinare eyes you suspiciously.>"]="<女祭司伊尔蒂娜怀疑地看着你。>"
G["<Punch him in the mouth.>"]="<抽他一记大耳刮子。>"
G["<Push a random button.>"]="<随便按下某个按钮。>"
G["<Putress looks you over in a very unsettling fashion.>\n\nAren't you a remarkable specimen....\n\nHave you considered making a sacrifice for the greater good?"]="<普特雷斯用令人不安的眼神打量着你。>\n\n你不是英雄的楷模吗……\n\n你是否愿意为伟大的正义事业而献身？"
G["<Quality you can depend upon until the explosive end!>\n\n<Insert moolah for profession training and vending services.>"]="<在爆炸前，质量均可保证！>\n\n<塞入钱款，即可得到专业训练和售卖服务。>"
G["<Reach down and pull the Injured Rainspeaker Oracle to its feet.>"]="<俯下身去扶起受伤的雨声神谕者。>"
G["<Reach out to touch Chi-Ji.>"]="<伸手碰触赤精。>"
G["<Read on, if you dare...>"]="<继续读，如果你敢的话……>"
G["<Rell continues to stare blankly at the mat. His breathing is shallow and labored.>"]="<利尔一直茫然地盯着地板，呼吸困难。>"
G["<Rell does not look up to address you.>\n\n<Judging by his state, you're not certain he even has the energy to move his head.>"]="<雷尔没有抬头回应你。>\n\n<看他的状态，$g你:你;甚至不确定他还有没有力气抬起头来。>"
G["<Rell's forehead is pale and beaded with sweat. He does not look good.>"]="<利尔的额头十分苍白，冷汗直流。他看起来非常不妙。>"
G["<Remove the spear from Orbiss' side.>"]="<拿走奥比斯的矛。>"
G["<Ren tosses about deliriously. His brow is hot with fever.>\n\nWa....water..."]="<任辗转反侧，额头发烫。>\n\n水……水……"
G["<Retrieve a bomb from the dispenser.>"]="<从分配器中取出一枚炸弹。>"
G["<Ride the dragonhawk to Sun's Reach.>"]="<骑上龙鹰前往阳湾港。>"
G["<Rifle through his pockets.>"]="<搜一搜他的口袋。>"
G["<Ring the Buzzer>"]="<Llamar al timbre>（按响蜂鸣器）"
G["<Roars.>"]="<咆哮声。>"
G["<Rosey fights back tears as she speaks.>\n\nMy... my journal. It's gone missin'.\n\nIt's mostly full of memories of my pappy, and his endless search for the perfect place to build his paradise city. It was to be the pinnacle of gnomish engineering!\n\nAnyway, one of his old schematics might actually be useful here. Please let me know if ya find it somewhere in all this thick green grass."]="<罗塞强忍着眼泪，说道。>\n\n我的……我的日记。它不见了。\n\n里面充满了我老爸的回忆，还有他的大量有关建造天堂都市的完美地点的研究。那可是侏儒工程学的巅峰之作！\n\n总之，里面有一副他的旧图纸或许能在这里派上用处。如果你在这附近的草丛里发现了它，请一定要告诉我。"
G["<Ruusk swallows hard.>\n\nI... What do you mean?"]="<卢斯克艰难地咽了口唾沫。>\n\n我……你是什么意思？"
G["<Sal'salabim growls at you, then goes back to drinking his frothy beverage.>"]="<萨萨拉比姆对着你咆哮，然后回头去喝他那起泡的饮料。>"
G["<Search corpse for Issliruk's Totem.>"]="<在尸体上寻找伊斯利鲁克的图腾。>"
G["<Seize control of a Lithe Stalker through the eye.>"]="<通过眼睛控制一只轻盈追迹者。>"
G["<Seize control of an Eidolon Watcher through the eye.>"]="<利用眼睛控制一只幻象观察者。>"
G["<Sergeant Stormpike salutes.>\n\nName, rank, and serial number, soldier! That's the only bit of information you'll ever give those dirty Frostwolf dogs!"]="<雷矛中士向你敬礼。>\n\n姓名，军阶和编号，士兵！这是你唯一需要提供给那些肮脏的霜狼走狗的信息！"
G["<She leans in closer.>\n\nJust between you and me, I'm thinking about 'mustering' out one of these nights.  You know what I mean?"]="<她斜靠了过来。>\n\n就我和你，我想也许哪天晚上我们可以一起出去，你知道我的意思。"
G["<She wipes the sweat from her brow.>\n\nHello there, $c. You here to help?"]="<她擦了擦额头上的汗水。>\n\n你好啊，$c。你是来帮忙的？"
G["<Shu looks at you expectantly.>"]="<涓流期待地看着你。>"
G["<Sigh> I suppose, if I must."]="<Suspira>（叹气）我想，如果非去不可的话。"
G["<Sigh>... \"The Paladin Pals\"."]="<Suspiro>（叹气）……\"圣骑士伙伴\"。"
G["<Snort!>"]="<Bufido>（哼鼻）"
G["<Snort!> That all you got?"]="<Bufido>（哼鼻）你就这点本事？"
G["<Snort> Is this how cowards fight, $r?"]="<Bufido>（哼鼻）胆小鬼就是这么打仗的吗，$r？"
G["<Snort>? <Gurgle>!"]="<Bufido>（哼鼻）？<Gorgoteo>（咕噜）！"
G["<Sobbing> I hate graveyards.  So many dead.  And my sweet Luhanaa...."]="<Sollozando>（抽泣）我讨厌墓地。死了这么多人。还有我亲爱的露哈娜……"
G["<Soften her up.>"]="<说服她。>"
G["<Static>\nIs this thing on?  Hello?"]="<静电噪音>\n这东西连通了吗？喂？"
G["<Static> Come in, $p, this is Sky Admiral Rogers."]="<静电噪音>请回答，$p，我是空军上将罗杰斯。"
G["<Sticky orange fluid oozes from Kil'ruk's mandibles.>"]="<粘稠的、橘黄的液体缓缓地从克尔鲁克的颚骨渗出。>"
G["<Suna rocks back and forth, staring into space. She does not answer.>"]="<孙娜前后摇晃着，凝望着天空。她没有回答。>"
G["<Tai Ho is completely silent.>"]="<泰侯沉默不语。>"
G["<Take this book for the good of Azeroth!>"]="<为了艾泽拉斯，拿上这本书吧！>"
G["<Tarsis grabs you weakly by the collar. Even in death you see power unimaginable in his eyes.>\n\nAm I? Then listen closely, for more nonsense is about to escape my lips. Within this citadel you will find my life's work: The exact location of every fragment of the splintered staff."]="<塔希斯抓住了你的领子，他显得十分虚弱。就算是这样一个虚弱的人，你仍能从他眼中看见令人难以想象的光芒。>\n\n妄想症？仔细给我听好了，更没有意义的妄想就被我说出来了。这座城堡中拥有我毕生追寻的东西，我已经知道了每一块法杖碎片的确切位置。"
G["<Tarsis groans.>\n\nThere may still be time... Listen closely, mortal.\n\nThrough time and across the Nether I have searched. Deals made with a host of evil and villainy so wretched...\n\n<Tarsis coughs blood into his hands.>\n\nWould you... would you believe that even Elune has turned her back on me, $r? To die here, in this manner now..."]="<塔希斯呻吟着>\n\n或许还有时间……听仔细了，凡人。\n\n我穿越了虚空，我探索了未知的世界……我与一个强大的邪恶存在定下了微妙的协议……\n\n<塔希斯咳出了鲜血。>\n\n你……你是否能相信，即使是艾露恩也不再怜悯我，$r？现在我要死在这里了，要以这种方式……"
G["<Tarsis is badly injured.>"]="<塔希斯的伤势非常严重。>"
G["<Tarsis's eyes light up.>\n\nI held it once... I held it despite the warnings of the Kirin Tor. I held it, mortal... Power unending. Power to do what I desired, as I desired. And just as quickly, it was taken from me. But I had tasted... And that taste was all that it took."]="<塔希斯的眼神亮了起来。>\n\n我曾拥有过它……我曾不顾肯瑞托议会的警告而拥有过它。我拥有过它啊，凡人……那无尽的力量。力量就是我追寻的一切，我追寻的……一切。时光稍瞬即逝，但我确实……确实……曾拥有过它，品尝过力量的甘美……"
G["<Taylor is very sick. It is best not to speak to him now.>"]="<泰勒病得很重。现在最好别去打扰他。>"
G["<Tears stream down Greatmother Geyah's face.>\n\nI... I... Durotan survived to have a child? The child Draka told me of before they left... It was their greatest fear... To raise a child in this world. On the other side of that gate was their only hope. I dared not tell Durotan, but secretly, I begged the spirits to watch over them - to protect their child and to give them strength.\n\nI... I must see my grandchild. I must see him. Please, I am too weak. You must tell him. Before I leave this world..."]="<泪水从祖母盖娅的脸颊流下。>\n\n我……我……杜隆坦活了下来，还有了孩子？就是德拉卡在他们离开前跟我提起的那个孩子……那是他们最大的恐惧……在这个世界上养育一个孩子。那道门的另一边是他们唯一的希望。我没敢告诉杜隆坦，但暗地里，我祈求先祖之灵看护他们——保护他们的孩子，赐予他们力量。\n\n我……我必须见见我的孙儿。我必须见到他。求你了，我太虚弱了。你一定要告诉他。在我离开这个世界之前……"
G["<Tenwu yawns.>\nI'm waiting..."]="<滕武打了个哈欠。>\n\n我等着呢……"
G["<Terenthis' eyes stare unblinking into the distance, betraying the sorrow of his last moments.>"]="<特伦希斯的眼睛凝望着远方，眨也不眨，其中流露出哀伤的神情。>"
G["<Thariel closes his eyes and shakes his head gently. When he opens them again, his gaze is wet and heavy with sorrow.>\n\nI held on to hope… the foolish hope of a dreamer. I should have pressed harder, back when I still had the chance. Begged her not to go. Told her to burn that invitation.\n\nYou are a bearer of grim tidings, $C. Yet still, I owe you. I will not forget this debt."]="<塔瑞尔闭上双眼，轻轻摇了摇头。当他再次睁眼时，目光湿润，满是哀伤。>\n\n我曾抱着希望……那是做梦者才有的愚蠢希望。我本该在还有机会的时候更坚持一些。求她不要去。让她把那张请柬烧掉。\n\n$C，你带来的是噩耗。可我依然欠你的。这份人情我不会忘。"
G["<Thayreen's stare is blank.  Cleansing Vordrassil's corruption has taken its toll on the druid.>"]="<塞瑞恩的眼神异常空洞。为了净化沃达希尔，她似乎耗尽了全部精力。>"
G["<The \"voice\" of the construct seems to emanate from the air around you, ringing in your ears while the hairs on your arms stand up. The construct speaks to you in a language you can't understand, with words that sound like multiple voices talking at once.>"]="<那个构造体的\"声音\"仿佛从你周围的空气中传来，在耳边回响，让你手臂上的汗毛都竖了起来。构造体用一种你听不懂的语言对你说话，那些词句听起来像是许多声音同时在说。>"
G["<The Admiral's body is covered with wounds, scratches, bruises, blood, and sweat. He looks feverish.>"]="<上将的身体上伤痕累累、血汗模糊。他好像正在发烧。>"
G["<The Arcane Guardian gestures across the Tier, towards the inn and the stablemaster outside it.>"]="<奥术守护者指了指平台对面的旅店和外面的兽栏管理员。>"
G["<The Arcane Guardian gestures across the Tier, towards the inn.>"]="<奥术守护者指了指平台对面的旅店。>"
G["<The Arcane Guardian gestures down towards the lower city's open market, in the southeast.>"]="<奥术守护者指了指贫民窟的露天市场，就在东南方。>"
G["<The Arcane Guardian gestures down towards the lower city, where a great forge may be found.>"]="<奥术守护者指了指下面的贫民窟，在那里可以找到一座巨大的熔炉。>"
G["<The Arcane Guardian gestures to a place across the Tier, towards the inn and nearby mailbox.>"]="<奥术守护者指了指平台对面的旅店和邮箱。>"
G["<The Arcane Guardian gestures to a place below the Tier, a stairwell southeast of the city's center.>"]="<奥术守护者指了指平台下面，城市中心东南方向的楼梯。>"
G["<The Arcane Guardian gestures to a place east of the city's center.>"]="<奥术守护者指了指城市中心东面的一处地方。>"
G["<The Arcane Guardian gestures to a place southeast of the city's center.>"]="<奥术守护者指了指城市中心东南面的一处地方。>"
G["<The Arcane Guardian gestures to the northwest portion of the lower city, where Shattrath's arakkoa dwell.>"]="<奥术守护者指了指贫民窟的西北部分，沙塔斯城的鸦人居住地。>"
G["<The Arcane Guardian gestures towards Aldor Rise.>"]="<奥术守护者指了指奥尔多高地。>"
G["<The Arcane Guardian gestures towards a place below the Tier, a stairwell northeast of the city's center.>"]="<奥术守护者指了指平台下面，城市中心东北方向的楼梯。>"
G["<The Arcane Guardian gestures towards the Lower City's bazaar.>"]="<奥术守护者向贫民窟的集市指了指。>"
G["<The Arcane Guardian gestures towards the Seer's Library.>"]="<奥术守护者指了指先知的图书馆。>"
G["<The Arcane Guardian gestures towards the city's center.>"]="<奥术守护者指了指城市中心。>"
G["<The Arcane Guardian gestures towards the easternmost portion of the lower city.>"]="<奥术守护者指了指贫民窟的最东面。>"
G["<The Arcane Guardian gestures towards the lower city's open marketplace.>"]="<奥术守护者指了指贫民窟的露天市场。>"
G["<The Arcane Guardian gestures towards the northeastern section of the lower city.>"]="<奥术守护者指了指贫民窟的东北区域。>"
G["<The Arcane Guardian seems to face you, but says nothing.>"]="<奥术守护者似乎面对着你，但是没有说话。>"
G["<The Arcane Guardian silently waits for you to further elaborate.>"]="<奥术守护者静静地等着你的进一步描述。>"
G["<The Arcane Guardian stands motionless, waiting for you to elaborate on which Battlemasters you mean.>"]="<奥术守护者静静地站在那，等着你告诉它你想询问哪个战场军官。>"
G["<The Baron lifts his manacles.>\n\nCome on then, $c. Do ye trust me?"]="<巴隆举起他的镣铐。>\n\n好吧，$c。你信任我吗？"
G["<The Black Prince looks you up and down.>\n\nIt is very good to meet you, $c. You are one of the vanguard, it would seem - an explorer in a strange new land. And how have you been finding the mysterious continent of Pandaria?\n\nYou have the look of someone who gets things done. I want you to return to me once you've gotten the lay of the land.\n\nI will be right here."]="<黑王子上下打量着你。>\n\n很高兴见到你，$c。看来你是先锋之一——一位踏足陌生新大陆的探索者。$g你:你;觉得神秘的潘达利亚大陆如何？\n\n$g你:你;看起来是个能办事的人。等摸清了这片土地的底细，就回来找我。\n\n我会一直在这儿。"
G["<The Engineer slumbers fitfully on the floor.>"]="<工程师一头栽倒在地。>"
G["<The Forsaken female is curled up on the floor, her face in a grimace.  She does not appear capable of getting up on her own at the moment.>"]="<这个女遗忘者痛苦地蜷曲在地上。她看上去已经不能自己爬起来了。>"
G["<The Frostborn Scout appears to have breathed his last breath.>"]="<霜脉斥候咽下了最后一口气。>"
G["<The Frostborn Scout attempts to rise to his feet as you approach, but stumbles back to the ground, clenching an obviously painful wound in his side.>"]="<当你靠近时，霜脉斥候试图站起来；但是他很快就跌倒在地，紧紧地捂住身体上那条明显的伤口。>"
G["<The Hippogryph looks anxious and ready to go!>"]="<这头角鹰兽看上去已经急切地准备要走了！>"
G["<The Injured Rainspeaker Oracle groans in pain.>"]="<受伤的雨声神谕者痛苦地呻吟着。>"
G["<The Lorewalker's kind eyes rest upon you attentively.>"]="<游学者用温和的目光凝视着你。>"
G["<The Major nods curtly.>"]="<少校略点了一下头。>"
G["<The Mullan Gryphon Rider stays still, eyes locked forward, not acknowledging your presence.>"]="<穆兰狮鹫骑士纹丝不动，双目凝视前方，仿佛完全没有意识到你的出现。>"
G["<The Murkblood overseer grunts.>"]="<暗血监工咕哝着。>"
G["<The SI:7 agent is unconscious.>"]="<军情七处的密探失去了意识。>"
G["<The Shadow Warden looks at you silently.>"]="<暗影守望者静静地看着你。>"
G["<The Sky Admiral's face grows hard.>\n\nI grew up in Southshore. My parents are buried there - what's left of them."]="<空军上将变得面色凝重。>\n\n我从小在南海镇长大。我的双亲……的遗骸……都被埋在那里。"
G["<The Stonemother stares down at you. Through you. As if she's peering into your soul.>\n\nMy daughter, Theradras, sequestered herself deep within the Crystal Caverns of Terramok to grieve for her lost love, Zaetar. There, heartless, stoneless beings invaded and slaughtered her amidst her mourning.\n\nIf I had any reason to trust a creature afflicted by the curse of flesh, it was stripped from me that day. And yet in your arrogance, you persist.\n\nOne day, you will outlive your usefulness."]="<石母凝视着你。她的目光仿佛穿过你的肉体，正在望着你的灵魂。>\n\n我的女儿——瑟莱德丝，将自己隔绝在泰拉莫克水晶洞穴深处，终日为挚爱扎尔塔的离去而心伤。就在那里，突然闯进了一群没心没肺的畜生，将正沉浸在哀思之中的她杀死。\n\n要是有任何理由能让我对长着血肉之躯的凡人心存信任，这理由也已在那天消逝。而在你傲慢的态度里，我看到了坚持。\n\n总有一天，你也会变得毫无用处。"
G["<The Tuskarr eyes you suspiciously.>\n\nDo not stay long. You do not understand our people, and I don't want trouble."]="<海象人怀疑地打量着你。>\n\n别在此地久留。你并不了解我们，我可希望招惹什么麻烦。"
G["<The Twilight Servitor gurgles at you, white spittle foaming and bubbling from his mouth.>"]="<暮光仆从向你“嘎嘎”地叫着，白色的泡沫从嘴角边淌了下来。>"
G["<The ancient turns to gaze at you with eyes larger than your entire head. Peering into them is like falling into a deep blue ocean.>"]="<这个上古生物盯着你。那双眼睛比你的头还要大。望着它们就好象坠入了一片深蓝的海洋。>"
G["<The ancient's enormous dark eyes peer at you distrustfully.>"]="<上古半神巨大的黑眼睛盯着你，眼睛里流露出不信任的神情。>"
G["<The ancient's eyes are vast and deep.>\n\n<The creature speaks slowly, in a language you do not understand. Chills run up your spine. You're overwhelmed with feelings of terror and confusion.>"]="<上古半神的眼睛巨大而深邃。>\n\n<它说话的速度很慢。你也听不懂它所说的语言。寒意爬上了你的脊骨，恐惧和困惑占据了你的心灵。>"
G["<The ancient's eyes open slowly, revealing deep pools of pain and fear.>"]="<上古半神缓缓地张开眼睛，那双眼睛如同充满痛苦与畏惧的深潭。>"
G["<The apprentice occasionally looks over his shoulder, apparently responding to sounds that you can't hear.>\n\nGood day, $n. Pardon me if I seem distracted, but I'm in the middle of a job for Farmer Natin. I want to have all of his horses shoed by the time he returns from the town hall. What can I help you with?"]="<学徒不时回头张望，似乎在对一些你听不见的声音做出回应。>\n\n你好，$n。如果我显得心不在焉，请见谅，我正忙着给农夫纳丁干活。我想赶在他从镇公所回来之前，把他所有的马都钉好掌。有什么需要我帮忙的吗？"
G["<The arakkoa favors you with a haunted gaze and alternates between looking at you and looking through you.>\n\nWhat have our efforts wrought, but a greater abomination than we sought to prevent?"]="<鸦人用诡异的眼神上下打量着你。>\n\n我们的努力非但没有结果，怎么反而还招来了一个新的怪物？"
G["<The arakkoa ghost reaches out toward you as though to try to identify you. You get the impression that it cannot see you clearly.>\n\nRokkaram, is that you?"]="<鸦人的幽灵逐渐接近你，仿佛是在辨认你。但你觉得它似乎总是看不清楚。>\n\n罗卡拉姆，是你吗？"
G["<The archmage's image seems to look through you, rather than at you.>\n\nRibbons and currents of arcane energy ebb and flow here as if the area is awash in a sea of magical power. Not even the first cataclysm caused this kind of damage."]="<大法师的影像似乎并没有看着你，而是注视着你的身后。>\n\n奥术能量的洪流使这个区域好像在被不可思议的力量拍打一样，这是日积月累的结果，而不是某一次灾难的产物。"
G["<The beacon hums softly.>"]="<灯塔低声嗡鸣着。>"
G["<The blade hovers in the air in front of you.>"]="<刀刃在你前方的空中盘旋。>"
G["<The blood elf is visibly shaken.>\n\nIt was horrible, just horrible! After we were caught, a mogu took me by the throat. I expected to die then and there, but instead, the mogu made a clutching motion and PULLED. All of a sudden, it was as if all the air were gone from my lungs.\n\nI felt a terrible twisting and ripping. My skin and bones felt as if on fire. Suddenly I was floating out of my own body.\n\nThe mogu laughed in my face, and I knew that my soul would suffer for the rest of eternity.\n\nHave you ever felt complete and utter terror, $c? I have.\n\n<The blood elf shudders and grows quiet.>"]="<这个血精灵显然还在发抖。>\n\n太可怕了，太可怕了！我们被俘之后，一个魔古族捏着我的脖子。我以为自己死定了，可是那个魔古只是一捏然后一拉，我就觉得肺里的空气好像全被挤了出来。\n\n一阵可怕的扭曲和撕裂之痛向我袭来。我的皮肤和骨头就像火烧一样撕心裂肺。突然，我就从自己的身体里飘了出来。\n\n那个魔古对着我哈哈大笑，我就知道自己的灵魂将永远在痛苦中煎熬。\n\n你有没有品尝过纯粹的恐惧，$c？我就试过。\n\n<血精灵又颤抖了一下，便开始沉默了。>"
G["<The blood elf lies limp on the table.  While he's still breathing, he appears to have been the victim of potent sedative toxins.>"]="<虚弱的血精灵躺在桌上。>他气若游丝，似乎毒药已经发作了。"
G["<The blood elf lies on the floor in some manner of induced torpor.>"]="<血精灵慵懒地躺在桌子上。>"
G["<The blood elf quickly regains consciousness as you pour the draught into his mouth.>\n\nI owe you my life, $c.  Without your help I would've succumbed to the Scourge's painful torture."]="<在你把药膏倒入血精灵口中后，他很快恢复了知觉。>\n\n谢谢你救了我的命，$c。没有你的帮助，我早就在天灾的折磨下屈服了。"
G["<The body has been very badly burned and nearly bitten in half.>\n\n<The red dragonflight may be the guardians of all life on Azeroth, but clearly they are not to be crossed.>"]="<这具尸体被烧得面目全非，而且被咬成了两截。>\n\n<红龙军团或许是艾泽拉斯所有生命的守护者，但他们显然也不是好惹的。>"
G["<The bodyguard glowers at you, his fist tightly clenching his sword.>\n\nThe prince wants to have a quiet chat, $c. If you start any trouble, we'll respond in kind."]="<卫士怒视着你，紧紧抓住腰间的佩剑。>\n\n王子只想安静地聊聊，$c。如果你敢惹麻烦，我们一定会加倍奉还。"
G["<The captive crocolisk lets out a low growl as you approach.>"]="<当你靠近时，被俘虏的鳄鱼发出一声低吼。>"
G["<The captured Sunhawk agent eyes you suspiciously.>\n\nI've never seen you before. Who are you?"]="<被俘虏的炎鹰间谍猜疑地盯着你。>\n\n我以前从来没有见过你。你是谁？"
G["<The captured Sunhawk agent smirks.>\n\nDon't worry, new blood, there are many more portal controllers and many more suitable locations for portals. I am certain that Sironas will have a new gate up very soon. These blue skinned dogs are not long for this world. Sironas and the abomination will clean up whatever the Sunhawk forces leave behind."]="<被抓获的炎鹰密探开始傻笑。>\n\n别担心，新人，我们有很多传送门控制者和更多适合打开传送门的位置。我确信希隆娜丝将会很快建起一座新门。这些蓝皮肤的杂种们不会在这个世界上活太久了。无论如何，希隆娜丝和她的畸变者都会帮助炎鹰部队善后的。"
G["<The cauldron bubbles.>"]="<大锅在冒着气泡。>"
G["<The charger stands proud, eager for battle.>"]="<骑兵自豪地站立着，蓄势待发。>"
G["<The chime of A'dal's voice echoes reassuringly through your mind.>\n\nWorry not, child.  Look in your pack and you will find it once more."]="<阿达尔清越的声音在你脑海中回响，令人安心。>\n\n别担心，孩子。翻翻你的背包，$g你:你;会发现它又回来了。"
G["<The cleric stares at you through the corner of its eye.>"]="<牧师用眼角的余光盯着你。>"
G["<The commander stops his lesson and turns, his eyes appraising you, sizing you up.>\n\nI have use for one such as yourself, $c."]="<指挥官停止授课，转过身来打量着你。>\n\n要不要听听，$c？接纳新知识对你来说是很有好处的。"
G["<The complicated schematics are too much for your meager engineering talents to discern.>"]="<依你目前的工程学技能是看不懂这张复杂的结构示意图的。>"
G["<The conjurer stands fierce, its gaze distant.>"]="<召唤师原地矗立，凝视着远方。>"
G["<The console whirrs and buzzes as you approach it.>"]="<当你靠近这座控制台的时候，它发出一阵“嗡嗡”声。>"
G["<The construct gestures to the eastern portion of the Tier.>"]="<这台构造体生物对着平台的东部做了个手势。>"
G["<The crane does not speak, but his words fill your mind.>\n\nGo... while you can...\n\nAll is... lost."]="<那鹤并没有开口，可他的话语却充满你的脑海。>\n\n趁还来得及……快走……\n\n一切都已……无可挽回。"
G["<The creature pecks at your hand.>"]="<岩石猎鹰啄着你的手。>"
G["<The dimensional portal hums.>"]="<次元之门发出“嗡嗡”的响声。>"
G["<The dog raises its head to look at you, and wags its tail weakly.>"]="<那条狗抬起头来看着你，无力地摇着尾巴。>"
G["<The dog's fur is matted with dirt. Its breathing is shallow.>"]="<那条狗全身上下沾满泥污。气若游丝。>"
G["<The dog's ribs are poking out of its sides. It looks at you with pitiful eyes.>"]="<那条狗瘦得皮包骨头。它可怜巴巴地望着你。>"
G["<The dragonhawk appears to be unsettled by the commotion in the surrounding area.>"]="<龙鹰似乎由于附近的骚动而变得狂乱起来。>"
G["<The druid appears to be deep in sleep, oblivious to his surroundings.>"]="<这位德鲁伊似乎陷入了沉睡，全然忘却了他周围的环境。>"
G["<The drunken engineer blinks blearily and waves at you.>"]="<那个喝醉的工程师眨着惺忪醉眼，向你挥手。>"
G["<The dusty journal is missing various entries>"]="<Al diario polvoriento le faltan varias entradas>（这本落满灰尘的日志缺失了不少条目）"
G["<The dwarf is unconscious, but otherwise unharmed.>"]="<这个矮人失去了意识，但并没有受伤。>"
G["<The earth rumbles as Gordawg's movements come to a halt.>\n\nSpeak."]="<大地的隆隆声因为戈达乌暂停移动而停了下来。>\n\n说。"
G["<The elf lets out a laugh, almost as ghastly as her grin, full of sharp yellowed teeth.>\n\nFate, it seems, is not without its irony. Elydna, you say? You arrive on the eve of her communion!"]="<精灵笑了一声，那笑声几乎和她咧开的笑容一样骇人，满口尖锐的黄牙。>\n\n看来命运这东西也少不了讽刺。你说的是艾莉德娜？你来得正是她举行圣餐仪式的前夜！"
G["<The elf looks unsettled, his face shadowed with worry. The nervous glance and disheveled appearance paint a stark contrast against the stillness of Shadowglen. Whoever he is, he has come a long way to reach this place.>"]="<这名精灵神色不安，脸上笼罩着忧虑。他紧张的目光与凌乱的外表，与幽影谷的寂静形成鲜明对比。不管他是谁，他走了很远的路才来到这里。>"
G["<The elf sits in perfect serenity.>"]="<这名精灵静坐不动，安详至极。>"
G["<The elf’s blind gaze pierces through flesh, wood, and stone, then lingers somewhere far beyond, suspended in infinity. His gaunt face betrays no emotion. Were it not for the subtle rise and fall of his chest, you’d think he had suffered the same fate as the Ancient looming behind him.>"]="<这名精灵失明的目光穿透血肉、木石，最终停留在遥远得近乎无限的某处。他瘦削的面孔不露丝毫情绪。若不是胸膛还有微微起伏，你几乎会以为他和身后那株巨大的上古守卫者一样，早已没了气息。>"
G["<The emissary sneers without looking at you.>\n\nGo about your business, $r."]="<密使冷笑着，看都不看你一眼。>\n\n忙你自己的事去吧，$r。"
G["<The enforcer's eyes flash red.>\n\nI hope your pathetic Horde tries to attack us. I am itching to shed some blood, $c!"]="<执行者的眼中闪着红光。>\n\n我倒希望你们这些可怜的兽人来攻击我们。我很久没畅快地挥洒热血了，$c！"
G["<The engine rumbles loudly.>"]="<El motor ruge con fuerza>（引擎发出震耳的轰鸣）"
G["<The enormous ancient remains wary of you, but speaks to you as an ally.>"]="<这位巨大的远古半神仍然对你保持着警惕，但他已经像对待盟友一样和你说话了。>"
G["<The enormous bird shies away from you.>"]="<这只大鸟躲开了你。>"
G["<The enormous black drake, covered with open wounds, stares you down with malice in his eyes. It does not blink.>"]="<黑色的巨龙身上布满了伤口。他一直盯着你，眼睛里闪烁着凶恶的光芒。>"
G["<The enormous giant peers down at your tiny form.>\n\n$n, did you change your hair?"]="<高大的巨人俯视着渺小的你。>\n\n$n，你换发型了？"
G["<The falcon squawks hungrily for a grub.>"]="<猎鹰发出饥饿的叫声，想要吃幼虫。>"
G["<The farmer stares at the floor with a distant look in his eyes.>\n\nThey... took them.\n\nTook them away..."]="<这个农夫漠然地盯着地板。>\n\n他们……抓住了他们。\n\n把他们抓走了……"
G["<The ferocious black drake strains at the chains that bind it. It's best to keep your distance.>"]="<凶恶的黑色巨龙拼命扯拽着捆缚他的锁链。你最好还是离他远一些。>"
G["<The footman stand resolute, muscles tense.>"]="<步兵笔直地站着，全身的肌肉都紧绷着。>"
G["<The furbolg sniffs at you and grunts.>"]="<熊怪闻闻你，哼了两声。>"
G["<The gnome's face is streaked with smoke and burns, but he's alive.>"]="<这个侏儒的脸上烟熏火燎的，但还活着。>"
G["<The great cat barely bats an ear at you, even when you run your fingers through her thick fur.>"]="<当你抚摸这只大猫浓密的皮毛时，她只是冲着你动了动耳朵。>"
G["<The grizzled gladiator speaks in halting Common.> What? You have a problem with me? Take it to the arena. I don't waste my time with your little \"hordes\" and \"alliances.\""]="<头发花白的角斗士用生硬的人类语说。>什么？你对我有意见？去竞技场解决。我可没工夫搭理你们那些小\"部落\"和\"联盟\"。"
G["<The grunt's mouth waters, anticipating bloodshed.>"]="<兽人步兵的嘴里流着口水，期待着一场战斗。>"
G["<The hatchling chirps at you.>"]="<雏龙对你啾啾鸣叫。>"
G["<The hatchling flies around gracefully.>"]="<雏龙优雅地四处翱翔。>"
G["<The hatchling flies around playfully.>"]="<雏龙四处嬉戏飞翔。>"
G["<The hatchling glares at you with a disappointed frown. It sees that you are playing with another hatchling.>\n\n<You can only play with one hatchling at a time. Speak to Elder Anli to return your current hatchling before playing Catch! with this one.>"]="<雏龙失望地瞪着你。它看见你在和其他雏龙玩耍。>\n\n<你一次只能和一条雏龙玩耍。在跟这条雏龙玩接球之前，先去和安离长老谈谈，把你目前的这条雏龙归还给他吧。>"
G["<The hatchling grunts at you.>"]="<雏龙对你咕噜了两声。>"
G["<The hatchling licks you.>"]="<雏龙舔了舔你。>"
G["<The hatchling looks at you as if trying to determine whether or not you're its mother.>"]="<这只幼崽死盯着你，仿佛想分辨出你是不是它的妈妈。>"
G["<The hatchling looks at you inquisitively.>"]="<雏龙好奇地看着你。>"
G["<The hatchling looks at you with a bored expression.>"]="<雏龙百无聊赖地看着你。>"
G["<The hatchling looks at you with a curious expression.>"]="<雏龙好奇地看着你。>"
G["<The hatchling nudges you, almost knocking you over.>"]="<雏龙撞了你一下，差点把你撞倒。>"
G["<The hatchling rubs its scales against your arm.>"]="<雏龙在你的手臂上蹭着鳞片。>"
G["<The hatchling smiles at you.>"]="<雏龙对你微笑。>"
G["<The hatchling watches you.>"]="<雏龙看着你。>"
G["<The high abbot studies you a moment and then smiles.>\n\nVery well, I know a place, child. You just kiss my ring and let me know when you are ready."]="<大院长端详了你片刻，然后笑了。>\n\n很好，我知道一个地方，孩子。$g你:你;只要吻一下我的戒指，准备好之后告诉我一声就行。"
G["<The hollow sockets of Lady Aegya’s eyes fall upon you with a gaze that cuts deeper than any blade.>"]="<艾吉娅夫人空洞的眼窝望向你，那目光比任何刀刃都更刺人。>"
G["<The image's head blurs as it turns to take in its surroundings.>\n\nIf you had seen the Plains of Farahlon, you wouldn't believe this is the same place. Mere months ago, these fields would not have looked out of place in Westfall.\n\nAll that is gone now, but how and why?"]="<影像的头部在环视周围时变得模糊起来。>\n\n如果你曾看到过法兰伦平原，你就不会相信眼下这个地方居然曾经是那种样子。仅仅几个月以前，这些原野看上去并不比西部荒野更糟糕。\n\n但是现在一切都不同了，这是怎么回事？到底为什么？"
G["<The injured soldier appears to still be breathing. Thankfully, her bubble remains intact.>"]="<这名受伤的士兵似乎还有呼吸。谢天谢地，她的魔法气泡还没掉。>"
G["<The injured soldier appears to still be breathing. Thankfully, his bubble remains intact.>"]="<这名受伤的士兵似乎还有呼吸。谢天谢地，他的魔法气泡还没掉。>"
G["<The injured soldier's pained groans are somewhat distorted by the water.>"]="<这名士兵痛苦的呻吟声在水中变得有些扭曲。>"
G["<The light surrounding Xi'ri pulses blue.  The naaru welcomes you as an ally in the field of battle.>"]="<克希利浑身散发着红色的光芒。纳鲁在欢迎你这位盟友。>"
G["<The lord-commander fixes you with a stare before going on.>\n\nI was getting to that. Indeed, when High General Abbendis landed her forces on Northrend, she changed their name to the Scarlet Onslaught.\n\nIt was not long before Admiral Barean Westwind presented himself to her at New Hearthglen in the Dragonblight. From all accounts, she wasn't expecting him. Nor was she expecting that he would undermine her authority and take the reins of command away from her.\n\nLikely you were involved with her demise, but no matter. Once she was dead, the admiral made a mysterious exit and we lost track of him."]="<领主指挥官盯着你看了片刻，才继续说下去。>\n\n我正要说到这个。没错，当高级将领阿比迪斯把部队带到诺森德时，她给他们改了名字，叫血色突袭军。\n\n没过多久，巴利安·西风上将就出现在龙骨荒野的新壁炉谷，前来见她。从种种说法来看，她并没有料到他会来。更没想到他会削弱她的权威，把指挥权从她手中夺走。\n\n她的死大概与$g你:你;有关，不过无所谓了。她一死，上将就神秘地消失了，我们从此失去了他的踪迹。"
G["<The lord-commander flashes a rictus grin, looking you up and down discerningly.>\n\nThat's what I wanted to hear."]="<高级指挥官咧嘴一笑，从头到脚地打量了你一番。>\n\n这正是我想听的。"
G["<The man barely acknowledges your presence. It is clear that he isn't interested in speaking with you.>"]="<那人几乎当你不存在。他显然没兴趣和你多说什么。>"
G["<The mangled body of one of the New Agamand apothecaries lies here.>"]="<地上躺着一具新阿加曼德药剂师残缺不全的尸体。>"
G["<The mantid councilor narrows his enormous eyes on you briefly.>"]="<螳螂妖议员眯着他的大眼睛瞟了你一眼。>"
G["<The mantid emerges from hiding.>\n\nStay back, $r.\n\nThe Empress is not of her right mind. We Klaxxi are gathering our numbers for an assault on her throne, but we are not yet prepared. And neither are you.\n\nThe time to strike is soon... but not yet."]="<螳螂妖从藏身处显身。>\n\n退后，$r。\n\n女皇已经疯了。我们卡拉克西正在召集人马，准备向她的王座发动突袭，但是我们尚未做好准备。你也一样。\n\n进攻的时刻即将到来……但不是现在。"
G["<The massive yeti looks at you expectantly.>"]="<大块头雪人看着你，眼神里充满期待。>"
G["<The mayor can’t help the flicker of a smile when his eyes meet Thalira Conacher’s across the great hall.>"]="<当镇长的目光越过大厅与塔莉拉·科纳彻相遇时，他忍不住露出一丝笑意。>"
G["<The murloc looks at you with thirsty eyes.>"]="<鱼人用饥渴的眼睛看着你。>"
G["<The night elf turns to you as you approach and reaches for your hand.>\nIt is too late for me. We earned our fate with our pride. Go... others may have made it. Save any that you can.\n<Her grip loosens as life slips from her.>"]="<你走近时，这名暗夜精灵转向你，伸手抓住你的手。>\n\n对我来说已经太迟了。我们的骄傲换来了这样的下场。走吧……也许还有人活着。能救几个就救几个。\n\n<随着生命从她身上流逝，她的手渐渐松开。>"
G["<The noble Flaskasaur nods at you in approval.>"]="<高贵的弗拉斯卡萨赞许地对你点了点头。>"
G["<The old yaungol stares at you with hatred in his eyes.>"]="<老野牛人盯着你，眼中充满了仇恨。>"
G["<The orc before you looks greener than usual.>\n\n$C, the goblins have brought \"all you can eat seafood\" to our shores. It is ... *urp* ... like a cataclysm in my belly."]="<你面前的兽人脸色比平时更绿了。>\n\n$C，地精把\"海鲜随便吃\"带到了我们的海岸。这东西……*呃*……简直像一场大灾变在我肚子里闹腾。"
G["<The orc wolf's frozen, snarling mouth shivers your bones.>"]="<兽人座狼的血盆大口让你毛骨悚然。>"
G["<The orc's lifeless body is no longer responsive....>"]="<这具没有了生命的兽人躯体已经不再有任何动作了……>"
G["<The outhouse is silent.>"]="<厕所里一片死寂。>"
G["<The pandaren snores deeply.>"]="<熊猫人响亮地打着呼噜。>"
G["<The pandaren was recently stripped, beaten, and broken. His body is still growing cold.>"]="<这个熊猫人刚刚遭受过殴打和折磨。他的尸体上犹有余温。>"
G["<The peon sweats and twitches.>\n\nI was ... what I meant ... um, bad!"]="<劳工一边流汗一边抽搐。>\n\n我……我是说……呃，真糟！"
G["<The peon's eyes widen in terror.>\n\nNo! You've discovered Sauranok is the new cult leader in Orgrimmar? He told me his secret is safe!"]="<苦工惊恐地瞪大了眼睛。>\n\n不！你已经发现绍拉诺克是奥格瑞玛新的邪教首领了？他跟我说他的秘密很安全！"
G["<The queen's consort nods in acknowledgment of your presence.>"]="<女王的伴侣对你点了点头。>"
G["<The quilboar fixes his beady black eyes on you.>"]="<这头野猪人用他黑珠子一样的眼睛紧盯着你。>"
G["<The quilboar wrinkles his nose at you and snorts.>"]="<这头野猪人抽着鼻子，一边哼哼，一边嗅着你。>"
G["<The raptor peers at you, growls, and slobbers.>\n\n<It appears Subject Nine left behind an un-augmented clone of herself in order to cover her tracks. Clever girl! You ponder over what exactly you've unleashed onto the cosmos...>"]="<这头恐龙紧盯着你，大声咆哮着，嘴里不停地流出口水。>\n\n<看样子，九号实验品留下了一个她的克隆品，只是这个克隆品的智力没有像她一样得到强化。她这样做大概是为了隐藏自己的行迹。聪明的女孩！你在考虑你给这个宇宙带来了什么……>"
G["<The saurok cowers behind its pet.>"]="<这个蜥蜴人躲到了宠物身后。>"
G["<The saurok kneels in silent reverence.>"]="<蜥蜴人沉默而敬畏地跪下了。>"
G["<The scruffy old pandaren snores peacefully. A pile of assorted bottles are strewn about next to him.>"]="<这个脏兮兮的老熊猫人安详地打着呼噜，身边丢满了各种瓶子。>"
G["<The seedling tilts its leaves up towards you, as if looking in your direction.>"]="<秧苗的叶子指向你，仿佛在注视着你所在的方向。>"
G["<The sentinel initiate fixes you with a suspicious look.>\n\nLost, are you?"]="<哨兵新兵用怀疑的目光盯着你。>\n\n迷路了，是吧？"
G["<The shimmering vision does not acknowledge your presence. She is lost in her own world, reacting to events that played out thousands of years ago.>"]="<这个闪烁微光的身影并不知道你的出现。她迷失在自己的世界中，依旧只是关注着千万年以前发生的事情。>"
G["<The shortfang recoils in fear.>"]="<这个短牙种恐惧地瑟缩着。>"
G["<The soldier gasps, his fist barely clenched around the hilt of his sword. His arm dangles useless from a shoulder skewered clean through by an arrow shaft still jutting from the wound.>\n\nNorthshire Valley was supposed to be a quiet post… “a stroke of luck”, they said, to have me stationed here!\n\n<He spits his bitterness to the ground and growls:>\n\nTo hell with that. I’m not dying here."]="<士兵喘着粗气，拳头勉强攥着剑柄。他的肩膀被一支箭杆彻底射穿，箭杆还插在伤口里，整条手臂无力地垂着。>\n\n北郡山谷本该是个清闲的驻地……他们还说，把我派驻在这儿是「走运」！\n\n<他把满腔苦水啐到地上，低吼道：>\n\n去他的。我可不想死在这儿。"
G["<The spider peers at you menacingly.>"]="<这头蜘蛛恶狠狠地瞪着你。>"
G["<The staff pulsates with arcane energies.>"]="<这根法杖充盈着奥术的能量。>"
G["<The starlet stares at you blankly.>"]="<这名演员面无表情地看着你。>"
G["<The stench around Vol'jin's makeshift revolutionary camp is intolerable. The troll leader allows you to speak first, while his guards eye you warily.>"]="<沃金的临时义军营地里散发着令人难以忍受的恶臭。巨魔首领示意你先开口，而他的护卫们则警惕地盯着你。>"
G["<The summoned daemon twitches, fighting against Medivh's rules of play.  He wants your soul!>"]="<被召唤出来的恶魔抽搐着，反抗着麦迪文的游戏规则。他想要你的灵魂！>"
G["<The tauren paladin looks you up and down, as if sizing up your intentions.>\n\nI mean you no hostility, $c. The human prince and I met at the Temple of the White Tiger, and he often seeks me out to talk about my Chieftain, Baine, and to discuss matters of war and peace.\n\n<The paladin and the Prince's bodyguards periodically exchange distrustful glances at one another.>"]="<牛头人圣骑士上下打量着你，好像在猜测你的意图。>\n\n我无意与你为敌，$c。人类王子和我在白虎寺见过，他常常来找我聊我们的大酋长贝恩，并讨论战争与和平那些事。\n\n<圣骑士和王子的卫士不断用疑虑的眼神互相打量着。>"
G["<The trade prince lowers his voice to barely a whisper.>\n\nDon't think for a moment that I've forgotten how much I despise you, $n, rescue or not.\n\nDon't worry your $g simple : pretty; head. I'll get my revenge soon enough, mark my words!\n\nYou'll fare far worse than being my slave. There'll be no escape for you this time."]="<贸易亲王把声音压得几乎成了耳语。>\n\n别以为我忘了自己有多厌恶你，$n，就算你救了我也不例外。\n\n别为你的$g笨脑袋:漂亮脑袋;操心。我很快就会报仇的，你记着我的话！\n\n你的下场会远比当我的奴隶更惨。这一次$g你:你;逃不掉的。"
G["<The troll before you is covered head-to-toe with gashes and scars, including a fresh slice across his face that has fattened his lip.>\n\nHewwo!\n\nAs you know, twolls wide waptors. The pwobwem is cowwecting the wild waptors for twaining! That's where I come in. I'm a waptor twapper."]="<你面前的这个巨魔从头到脚都是伤疤。一道新伤口横亘在他的脸上，豁开了他的嘴唇。>\n\n你好！\n\n巨魔把恐龙当坐骑。但与野生恐龙进行交流，并进一步训练它们是个难题！所以我会到这里来。我是一名恐龙训练师。"
G["<The troll sings to himself and stares into the cauldron.  He appears to be injured.>"]="<巨魔自己唱着歌，眼睛看着锅里。他像是受了伤。>"
G["<The troll sings to himself as he observes the carnage around him.>"]="<那巨魔看着周围成堆的尸体，自顾自地唱着歌。>"
G["<The unfortunate soldier you find at the side of the road has been gutted with what appears to have been long knives. Rolling the body over, you notice teeth marks.>\n\n<Could wild animals have done this?>"]="<你在路旁发现了这名不幸的士兵，他的身上有许多仿佛是用长匕首划开的伤口。你将他的身体翻转过来，注意到一些齿印。>\n\n<这会是野兽干的吗？>"
G["<The veteran gladiator speaks in halting Orcish.> What? You have a problem with me? Take it to the arena. I don't waste my time with your little \"hordes\" and \"alliances.\""]="<老练的角斗士用生硬的兽人语说。>什么？你对我有意见？去竞技场解决。我可没工夫搭理你们那些小\"部落\"和\"联盟\"。"
G["<The warden does not acknowledge you.>"]="<守望者没有理会你。>"
G["<The water elemental is ready to surge.>"]="<水元素准备涌动了。>"
G["<The wolf watches you with wise eyes.>"]="<这头狼用充满智慧的眼睛看着你。>"
G["<The words of Malik echo through your mind.>\n\n\"Heroes never die.\""]="<马利克的话语在你脑海中回响。>\n\n\"英雄永不消亡。\""
G["<There is a a painful looking gash along the soldier's side.>"]="<这名士兵的体侧有一道深得可怕的伤口。>"
G["<These baby Rockpool murlocs look toward the ocean.>"]="<这群岩池鱼人宝宝朝海洋的方向看去。>"
G["<These baby Rockpool murlocs seem to have been abandoned here.  You suspect that they are in trouble, and that Neptool would want you to bring them back to the ocean, where they stand a chance of escaping the naga.>"]="<这些小岩池鱼人似乎是被遗弃在这里了。现在他们的境遇肯定很糟糕。耐普托一定想让你将他们带回到大海去。他们在那里才有可能躲避开纳迦的捕猎。>"
G["<These baby murlocs seem to have been abandoned here.>"]="<这些小鱼人似乎是被遗弃在这里了。>"
G["<This is more than just a chunk of amber - there's a mantid inside!>"]="<这可不仅仅是一块琥珀——里面有一只螳螂妖！>"
G["<This pirate has obviously had too much to drink.  He appears to be out cold for the time being.>"]="<这个海盗显然是喝多了，看上去有点不省人事。>"
G["<This robotic gorilla appears to be damaged.>"]="<这只机器人大猩猩似乎已经损坏了。>"
G["<Though Ysera's physical form stands in front of you, her consciousness appears to shift between this world and another.>"]="<尽管伊瑟拉的肉身就站在你面前，可她的意识却仿佛在两个世界间游移。>"
G["<Thrall laughs.>\n\nNoted... Now pay attention, $n. The Black Dragonflight brood mother, Onyxia, has been flushed out from her position of power in Stormwind. She has escaped, fleeing to her lair in Dustwallow Marsh.\n\nShe cannot be allowed to live in such close proximity to our capital cities. We must strike before being struck!\n\nI want her destroyed, $n."]="<萨尔笑了。>\n\n记下了……现在听好，$n。黑龙军团的母龙奥妮克希亚已经被逐出了她在暴风城的权力巢穴。她逃走了，躲进了尘泥沼泽的巢穴。\n\n绝不能让她就这么待在我们几座主城附近。我们必须先发制人！\n\n我要她死，$n。"
G["<Thrall laughs.>\n\nSo much to learn still, $r.\n\nYou are too young to remember the wars and bloodshed of ages past. Too young to remember the burden of the curse carried by our people.\n\nOur position with the Alliance right now is a tenuous one. Skirmishes and smaller battles do take place, but there is peace - something our people have not known for millennia. Would you give this up and plunge us into the maw of chaos again but against a new foe? One that will not rest until we are all destroyed?"]="<萨尔笑了。>\n\n还有这么多要学的，$r。\n\n你太年轻了，记不得多年前的战争和流血。记不得我们的人民所承受的诅咒的重压。\n\n我们现在与联盟的形势很脆弱。小冲突和小规模战斗时常发生，但是仍有和平--我们的人民数千年来未有过的和平。你愿放弃这个并把我们再次投入这片混沌中去面对一个新的敌人吗？这个敌人在毁灭我们之前是不会停手的。"
G["<Threaten her with violence.> Not my problem. Pay up or face the consequences."]="<用暴力威胁她。>那不关我事。给钱，不然就承担后果。"
G["<Threaten him with violence.>\nA debt is a debt. Let's see the money."]="<用暴力威胁他。>\n欠债还钱。用钱说话。"
G["<Threaten him with violence.> Do you want to get punched in the mouth?"]="<用暴力威胁他。>你想让我一拳打进你嘴里吗？"
G["<Threaten him with violence.> You need to be taught a lesson, kid. Pay up."]="<用暴力威胁他。>看来得有人给你上一课了，孩子。给钱。"
G["<Tickle Time!>"]="<挠痒痒时间！>"
G["<To your astonishment, the Raptor hatchling is able to communicate with you.>\n\n$G Papa : Mama;...?"]="<令你惊讶的是，这头小迅猛龙似乎是想和你说话。>\n\n$G爸爸:妈妈;……？"
G["<To your astonishment, the Raptor hatchling is able to communicate with you.>\n\nGreetings. I recently emerged from an egg. You?"]="<令你惊讶的是，这头小迅猛龙似乎是想和你说话。>\n\n你好，我刚从一颗蛋里爬出来。你呢？"
G["<To your astonishment, the Raptor hatchling is able to communicate with you.>\n\nI hunger... therefore, I am."]="<令你惊讶的是，这头小迅猛龙似乎是想和你说话。>\n\n我饿……是的，我饿。"
G["<To your astonishment, the Raptor hatchling is able to communicate with you.>\n\nIs it true that you cook your meat? Curious."]="<令你惊讶的是，这头小迅猛龙似乎是想和你说话。>\n\n你真的要把你吃的肉烤熟吗？真奇怪。"
G["<To your astonishment, the Raptor hatchling is able to communicate with you.>\n\nThe ends of your fingers are dull and round. Is this why you carry around other implements for use in combat?\n\nHow interesting."]="<令你惊讶的是，这头小迅猛龙似乎是想和你说话。>\n\n你的指头尖又圆又钝。所以你要用别的东西进行战斗吗？\n\n真是有趣。"
G["<To your astonishment, the Raptor hatchling is able to communicate with you.>\n\nThey call you $n. Is this your unique signifier, or is it an honorary title?"]="<令你惊讶的是，这头小迅猛龙似乎是想和你说话。>\n\n他们管你叫$n。这是你特有的名字吗，还是你的一个荣誉称号？"
G["<To your astonishment, the Raptor hatchling is able to communicate with you.>\n\nWhat does \"$c\" mean? Are you the goblin $g patriarch : matriarch;?"]="<让你吃惊的是，这只迅猛龙幼崽竟然能与你交流。>\n\n\"$c\"是什么意思？你就是那个地精$g族长:女族长;吗？"
G["<To your astonishment, the Raptor hatchling is able to communicate with you.>\n\nYou lack a helmet. Does this diminish your intellectual capacities?"]="<令你惊讶的是，这头小迅猛龙似乎是想和你说话。>\n\n你没有戴头盔。这会让你的智力变弱吗？"
G["<Touch the unstable rift crystal.>"]="<触摸这块不稳定的裂隙水晶。>"
G["<Try shaking Hemet.>"]="<试着摇晃赫米特。>"
G["<Try to free Kor Bloodtusk from his bonds.>"]="<尝试解除科尔·血牙的束缚。>"
G["<Try to untie Lyalia.>"]="<给丽娅拉松绑。>"
G["<Turn to the next page.>"]="<翻到下一页。>"
G["<Ulfang howls and sniffs at you, and you can understand what he says.>\n\nThe strange white worg of the north, Garwal, has taken my pack from me. We must rip out his throat so that I will be the alpha worg once again."]="<乌尔芬低声嚎叫，嗅了嗅你身上的气味；接着你就明白了他的语言。>\n\n北方那头名叫迦瓦尔的白色座狼带走了我的狼群。我要割断他的喉咙，重新成为群族的首领。"
G["<Unlock the shackles.>"]="<打开锁铐。>"
G["<Unscrew the flask and offer it to her.>"]="<拧开瓶子，给她递上。>"
G["<Use the Ambermill Dimensional Portal.>"]="<使用安伯米尔次元传送门。>"
G["<Use the stone to teleport back to Valormok.>"]="<使用这块石头传送回瓦罗莫克。>"
G["<Use the transcription device to gather a rubbing.>"]="<使用抄写工具来收集一份拓文。>"
G["<Valdred looks back down at his hands.>\n\nI suppose this is my fate then.  Hah!  Part of an undead army.  Somehow I never considered that I might end up fighting for the Forsaken.\n\n<He looks back up at you.>\n\nWhat do I do now?"]="<瓦德雷看着自己的手。>\n\n我想这就是我的命。哈！成为亡灵大军的一员。我怎么也没想到，自己最终竟然会为被遗忘者战斗。\n\n<他抬头看着你。>\n\n我现在还有什么选择？"
G["<Varnis coughs violently as the restorative draught takes effect.>\n\nThank you for rescuing me.  I must go back to Tranquillien at once!"]="<瓦尼斯剧烈地咳嗽起来，看来治疗药膏生效了。>\n\n谢谢你救了我一命。我必须立即返回塔奎林！"
G["<Vicious gashes line Valdaron's body. You need not check his pulse to know that he has already passed.>"]="<瓦尔达隆身上全都是可怕的伤口。你不需要检查他的脉搏就知道，他已经过世了。>"
G["<Vindicator Aesom salutes you.>\n\nHave you spoken with Admetius? I believe he was inquiring as to your whereabouts."]="<守备官伊索姆向你致敬。>\n\n你和德门图斯说过话了吗？我想他正在找你。"
G["<Vol'jin allows a grim smile to creep across his scowling features.>\n\nNot yet he don't. Maybe he hearin' rumors. Maybe he thinkin', dey ghost stories. Maybe ol' Vol'jin comin' back ta haunt him. Hah.\n\nHe find out soon enough. Too bad I'm not gonna be there ta see da look on his fat, beady-eyed face when he hears ol' Vol'jin is back, an' gonna make good on me promise. Ta end his sad little reign. Ta fire de arrow dat pierces his black heart."]="<沃金愁苦的脸上露出一个冷酷的笑容。>\n\n他还不知道。他可能已经听到了一些流言，也许还想到那些鬼故事，以为老沃金的鬼魂回来纠缠他了。哈。\n\n但他很快就会知道的。真想看看当他听到老沃金回来兑现诺言时，那张绿豆眼的肥脸上会是什么表情。我要终结他那可悲的统治，射穿他的黑心。"
G["<Vol'jin cackles, the stench of his hot breath reeking in your nostrils.>\n\nOh, ya got anudda plan? I got anudda plan, too. I let ya siege Orgrimmar on ya own. See how far ya get. An' once da city be filled wit' corpses, den me shadow hunters come in, we mop up what left, kill Kor'kron an' Alliance alike. Give ya dead ta Sylvanas. Hmm! I save a lot a Darkspear lives wit' dis plan!\n\nMmnn? You don't like? Then, we stay wit' da first plan. We work together.\n\nWe don't even have ta like each other."]="<沃金笑了起来，带着恶臭的灼热呼吸直往你的鼻孔里钻。>\n\n噢，你有其他方案？我这儿正好也有一个备用方案。我就让你们自己去围攻奥格瑞玛。看看你们能打成什么样。等到城里堆满了尸体时，我再派出暗影猎手攻进去，干掉剩下的人，包括库卡隆和联盟，然后把你们的死者交给希尔瓦娜斯。哼！这么一来，我还可以保住许多暗矛部族同胞的性命。\n\n嗯？你不喜欢这个方案？那我们还是来谈谈第一个方案吧。我们合作。\n\n这并不需要我们喜欢彼此。"
G["<Vol'jin lays on the floor unconscious and barely breathing.>"]="<沃金毫无知觉地躺在地上，奄奄一息。>"
G["<Vol'jin runs his three-fingered hand over his scar.>\n\nIt been a long road, friend. Garrosh tried ta take me life wit' a knife in de throat. Left me for dead. I crawl out dat cave, couldn't even speak. It was Chen Stormstout who found me, nursed me back from de brink.\n\nWe travelled to de Shado-Pan monastery, an' dey help me do some soul-searching. Figure out who I was. Who de Horde was. Me father...\n\nI made up me mind. I'm takin' de Horde back. No matter de cost.\n\nDarkspear never die."]="<沃金用只有三根手指的手摸了摸身上的刀疤。>\n\n这就说来话长了，朋友。加尔鲁什的匕首差点要了我的命。他的刺客割破了我的喉咙，把我扔在那儿等死。等我拼命爬出洞穴时，已经连话都说不出来了。是陈·风暴烈酒找到了我，把我从死亡的边缘拉了回来。\n\n我们一同前往影踪禅院，在他们的帮助下，我进行了一次深刻的自省。我看清了自己的立场，部落的立场。我的父亲……\n\n那时，我就下定了决心。我要不惜一切代价将部落夺回来。\n\n暗矛不死。"
G["<Vol'jin sees his opportunity slipping away. He holds up his hands.>\n\nWait now, $r! Orgrimmar be a fortress. My people, we ain't gonna crack dat nut on our own. How long we gonna last out here? Days? Weeks? Vol'jin can't say.\n\nYou keep da supplies comin', an' I promise, more Kor'kron gonna die. Before ya troops even land! The blood bein' spilt ain't even ya own! Surely dat be worth a few crates of meat?"]="<沃金发现自己的机会正在溜走。他举起了手。>\n\n等等，$r！奥格瑞玛是一座坚城。我的人，我们不可能自己啃下这块硬骨头。我们又能在这里坚持多久呢？几天？几周？沃金可说不准。\n\n只要你们能源源不断地提供补给，我保证，我们一定能干掉更多的库卡隆，而且是在你们的部队登陆之前！你们的人甚至都不用流血牺牲！这应该能值几箱肉吧？"
G["<Vol'jin twists his face into a scowl.>\n\nYa wouldn't understand. What's de Horde ta ya, $r? Hm? Diseased? Alien? Betrayers? Demon-blooded? Beasts? I know what ya say 'bout us.\n\nI'll tell ya what de Horde is. De Horde dat me an' Thrall built. It be a family. When de whole world try ta put us down, de family come an' pick us back up.\n\nHellscream, he don't see family. Ain't never had one."]="<沃金的脸愤怒地扭曲了起来。>\n\n你不明白。部落在你们眼里是什么？嗯？一群病夫？怪胎？叛徒？魔崽子？野兽？我知道你们是怎么说我们的。\n\n我来告诉你们部落是什么。部落是我和萨尔一手建立起来的。它是一个大家庭。当全世界都试图消灭我们时，这个家庭向我们伸出了援手。\n\n而地狱咆哮，他不懂这个家庭的意义。所以他也得不到家人的支持。"
G["<Volcor doesn't look at you at all as you get close to him. He seems to be concentrating on keeping his bandages from falling off. After a moment, he looks up at you, a little startled.>\n\nOh, sorry, $c. Now's not a good time. I hope you understand."]="<你靠近沃科尔时，他一点都不理睬你。他好象集中精力关注他的绷带以防脱落。过了一会儿，他抬头看你，有一点惊诧。>\n\n噢，对不起，$c。现在不太合适。我希望你能理解。"
G["<Volcor's body lies motionless.  As you begin to move away, a hand reaches out and grabs your ankle. He's alive!>"]="<沃尔科的身躯纹丝不动。当你抬脚要走开的时候，一只手抓住了你的脚踝。他还活着！>"
G["<Wake Tarsis up.>"]="<将塔希斯唤醒。>"
G["<Warchief Blackhand towers over the field.>"]="<黑手酋长俯瞰着战场。>"
G["<Warden Treelos looks at you funny and then pauses a moment, clearly struggling.>\n\nZangarmarsh... too close to truth.\n\n<His face goes crazy again.>\n\nIs he still watching!?"]="<监护者忒洛斯滑稽地看着你，停了停，看起来似乎很难控制自己。>\n\n赞加沼泽……真相太近了。\n\n<他的脸再次变得疯狂起来。>\n\n他还在监视着吗！？"
G["<Wind howls past the statue as you stand in front of it.>"]="<当你站在塑像面前时，你感觉到一阵风呼啸而过。>"
G["<Wistfully, Kalecgos looks off to the horizon.>\n\nTarecgosa is... special to me.\n\nWhen she was but a hatchling, I was charged with her protection and education. Over the millennia, we have forged a special bond, not unlike what you would call siblings.\n\nTarecgosa was born under a special sign that foretold of a great destiny. If the prophecies are true, then her survival is of vital importance to the blue dragonflight, and to Azeroth itself.\n\nOur affinity for one another is well known within the remnants of our flight. If your vision recounted an event that has actually taken place, she could be in grave danger."]="<卡雷苟斯担忧地望着远处。>\n\n对我来说，泰蕾苟萨……有着非同一般的意义。\n\n当她还是雏龙时，我负责保护并教导她。千年以来，我们之间有着特殊的纽带，类似于你们所谓的手足之情。\n\n泰蕾苟萨甫一降生，就昭示着不凡命运的开始。如果预言是真的，那么她的生死与蓝龙军团和艾泽拉斯休戚相关。\n\n余下的军团成员都知道我们之间的关系。如果你描绘的景象真的已经发生了，那么她可能已危在旦夕。"
G["<Wrathion sits alone, twirling a game piece in his fingers. He is staring intently at the game board but you get the impression that his mind is elsewhere.>"]="<拉希奥独坐一隅，转动着手上的棋子。他专注地凝视着棋盘，但你觉得他的心思已经飞到其他地方去了。>"
G["<Xon'cha looks nervously over his shoulder.> You'll have to go elsewhere if you want to get at your pets, $c. The Kor'kron be watchin'."]="<克苏卡紧张地看了看身后。>如果你想要你的宠物，最好去别处取，$c。库卡隆盯着呢。"
G["<Yank out his belly piercing.>"]="<扯掉他的脐环。>"
G["<Yawn> Is it dawn already? Ah well, all good things... as they say. I don't know about the rest of you, but I'm going inside."]="<Yawn>（打哈欠）已经天亮了吗？唉，好吧，天下没有不散的筵席……人们都这么说。我不知道你们怎么想，反正我要进去了。"
G["<You are well versed in the creation and function of this robot.>"]="<你精通制造和操作这个机器人。>"
G["<You can hear Chi-Ji's voice echoing in your mind.>\n\nI sense that you need my help to get to the top of the dome."]="<赤精的声音在你脑内回响。>\n\n我感觉到你需要我帮你抵达台顶。"
G["<You can't quite make out what Gobber is saying with all of the food that is stuffed in his mouth. You're pretty sure that it's a thanks, however.>"]="<因为大胖嘴里塞满了食物，你听不清他到底在说些什么。不过你可以确信，他一定是在感谢你。>"
G["<You cannot comprehend any of the technical mumbo jumbo on this scroll.>"]="<你无法理解这份卷轴上记载的任何技术。>"
G["<You find Calder idly picking at his ear with a dagger.>"]="<你发现卡尔德正用一把匕首无聊地拨弄着他的耳朵。>"
G["<You grab at the orb, but Fizzle's hand clutches around it even tighter.  The orb glows slightly.>"]="<你抓住那颗宝珠，但菲兹尔的手将它抓得更紧了。这颗球微微闪烁着光亮。>"
G["<You hear Chi-Ji speaking in your mind.>\n\nLet me assist you to get to the top of the pavilion, my friend."]="<赤精的声音在你脑内回响。>\n\n让我帮你登上台顶吧，朋友。"
G["<You may train any of the secondary professions. Please choose from the following selections:>"]="<你可以学习所有种类的辅助专业技能。请从下列专业技能中选择：>"
G["<You may train in up to two primary professions. Please choose from the following selections:>"]="<你可以学习最多两种主要专业技能。请从下列专业技能中选择：>"
G["<You nod slightly but do not complete the motion as the lord-commander narrows his eyes before he continues.>"]="<你微微地点了点头，高级指挥官顿时眯起了眼睛。于是你赶紧停止动作，他这才开口继续说起了故事。>"
G["<You watch in fascination as the creature gracefully carves lines through the air in this cozy cavern. The respite from the violence and turmoil of your last hours is most welcome.\n\nThe being offers no visible acknowledgement of your presence, but a feeling grows within you that he is aware of your every breath.\n\nThinking back to Nazgrim and the others, you consider how best to engage the stranger in conversation.>"]="<你着迷地看着这个熊猫人在洞内宁静的空气中画出一条条优雅的弧线。经历了几个小时的动荡和厮杀后，片刻的休憩无疑是最好的享受。\n\n他似乎并没有察觉你的到来，但你越来越相信，他早就捕捉到了你的每一次呼吸。\n\n想到纳兹戈林和其他人，你开始琢磨怎么才能和这个陌生人搭上话。>"
G["<Your hatchling chirps at you.>"]="<你的雏龙对你啾啾鸣叫。>"
G["<Your hatchling flies around playfully.>"]="<你的雏龙四处嬉戏飞翔。>"
G["<Your hatchling glares at you with a disappointed frown. It sees that you are playing with another hatchling.>\n\n<You can only play with one hatchling at a time. Speak to Elder Anli to return your current hatchling before playing Catch! with this one.>"]="<雏龙失望地瞪着你。它看见你在和其他雏龙玩耍。>\n\n<你一次只能和一条雏龙玩耍。在跟这条雏龙玩接球之前，先去和安离长老谈谈，把你目前的这条雏龙归还给他吧。>"
G["<Your hatchling licks you.>"]="<你的雏龙舔了舔你。>"
G["<Your hatchling looks at you inquisitively.>"]="<你的雏龙好奇地看着你。>"
G["<Your hatchling looks at you with a bored expression.>"]="<你的雏龙百无聊赖地看着你。>"
G["<Your hatchling rubs its scales against your arm.>"]="<你的雏龙在你的手臂上蹭着鳞片。>"
G["<Your hatchling smiles at you.>"]="<你的雏龙对你微笑。>"
G["<Your hatchling watches you.>"]="<你的雏龙看着你。>"
G["<Your serpent flies around gracefully.>"]="<你的翔龙优雅地四处翱翔。>"
G["<Your serpent grunts at you.>"]="<你的翔龙对你咕噜了两声。>"
G["<Your serpent looks at you with a bored expression.>"]="<你的翔龙百无聊赖地看着你。>"
G["<Your serpent looks at you with a curious expression.>"]="<你的翔龙好奇地看着你。>"
G["<Your serpent nudges you, almost knocking you over.>"]="<你的翔龙撞了你一下，差点把你撞倒。>"
G["<Your serpent rubs its scales against your arm.>"]="<你的翔龙在你的手臂上蹭着鳞片。>"
G["<Your serpent smiles at you.>"]="<你的翔龙对你微微一笑。>"
G["<Your serpent watches you.>"]="<你的翔龙看着你。>"
G["<Ysera's image flutters before your eyes, as if in a dream. Nobody else sees her here, yet the vision senses your presence.>"]="<伊瑟拉的影像在你的眼前闪动，仿佛一切都是在梦中。再没有其他人看见她在这里。而那幻象显然也感觉到了你的存在。>"
G["<Zen'tabra closes her eyes and shakes her head.>\n\nWhen Vol'jin called for everyone ta flee, we... we couldn't face de tribe after failing dem so badly. So, we fled south, ta de untamed jungle islands.\n\nDe wilds claimed a few o' us dat first night. We found safety in a deep cave in de center o' de isle, but me dreams dere were not peaceful: I be havin' a vision!"]="<岑塔布拉闭上双眼，摇了摇头。>\n\n当沃金号令所有人逃离时，我们……我们深感无颜面对宗族。于是我们逃向了南方，藏进了那片未开化的丛林群岛。\n\n那里的野兽当晚就夺去了我们几个同伴的生命。我们在岛屿中部的深邃洞穴中找到了栖身之所，但我在那里的梦境并不安宁——我看到了幻像！"
G["<Zen'tabra laughs.>\n\nDe other loa, 'specially Shirvallah, did not much care for dis plan. Dey still be wantin' us ta work just for one o' dem at a time, not wit all de spirits at once. But Gonk had forced dere hands, and dey knew it was de only way ta save de isles while Zalazane still ruled.\n\nI be tinkin' dat Gonk did not care for de other loa much either. He be teasin' de other loa all de time while we be learnin' from dem."]="<岑塔布拉笑了。>\n\n其他神灵，特别是希瓦拉尔，对他的计划颇不以为然。他们仍然希望我们一次只敬拜他们之中的一位，而不是同时与全部神灵沟通。但贡克对他们施加了很大压力。而且他们都明白，这是从扎拉赞恩手中拯救群岛的唯一办法。\n\n我相信，贡克也不很在意其他神灵的意见。当我们在神灵那里进行学习的时候，他一直在嘲笑他们。"
G["<Zen'tabra laughs.>\n\nWe spread dose rumors, mon. Keep'n Zalazane and others off our tails. Don't be believin' everyting ya hear.\n\nNo, we be new ta de craft, only learnin' a few years ago. But in some ways, we spent our lives preparin' ta answer de call...."]="<岑塔布拉大笑起来。>\n\n是我们散播的那些谣言，朋友。目的是要让扎拉赞恩和其它人远离我们。别相信你所听到的任何事。\n\n不，我们刚接触那门艺术不久，几年前才开始学习。但从某种程度上来说，我们毕生都在准备响应召唤……"
G["<Zen'tabra's head snaps back to you, her eyes bright and her smile wide around her tusks.>\n\n'Twas a jungle bigger and wilder dan I ever seen! And before me, de ancient raptor loa only talked about in Zandalari tales-Gonk, de Great Hunter! \n\nDe raptor spirit spoke ta me, told me he had brought me spirit to a place called de Emerald Dream. De spirit had been trapped, like de other loa on de Echo Isles, by Zalazane's magic. But Gonk, bein' an ancient spirit, was able ta reach across and bring me spirit ta him, even through Zalazane's voodoo."]="<岑塔布拉猛地转向你，她的眼睛闪烁着光彩，獠牙外露的大嘴现出微笑。>\n\n这真是我的记忆中最为广袤狂野的丛林！古老的迅猛龙之神，赞达拉传说中伟大的猎手贡克竟然出现在我面前！\n\n那位迅猛龙的英灵同我交谈，将我的灵魂带到了一个被称为翡翠梦境的地方。像回音群岛的其他神灵一样，那位英灵被扎拉赞恩的魔法困住了。但这位古老的英灵还是穿过扎拉赞恩的妖术，将我带到他身边。"
G["<back>"]="<返回>"
G["<cough> <cough> Damsel in distress over here!"]="<咳嗽><咳嗽>这里有个痛苦的年轻姑娘！"
G["<cough> <hack> I have... returned."]="<tos>（咳嗽）<carraspeo>（干咳）我……回来了。"
G["<cough> Ugh..."]="<tos>（咳嗽）呃……"
G["<cough>... you are impudent, impatient, childish. You cannot even... control yourself, your own fear... your own rage."]="<tos>（咳嗽）……你无礼、急躁、幼稚。你连自己都控制不住……控制不了自己的恐惧……自己的怒火。"
G["<hic!> Well... Let's see... By my count, nobody. The whole crew's drunk out of their gourds, admiral... 'cept the sea pups... <hic!>"]="<嗝儿！>嗯……让我们瞧瞧……看来没人例外啊。整船的人都醉得找不着北了，长官……除了那些新兵……<嗝儿！>"
G["<hic>\n\nIt be lonely in here without me mateys, $g lad:lass;."]="<hip>（打嗝）\n\n没伙计们在这儿，$g你:你;会觉得挺冷清的，$g小伙子:姑娘;。"
G["<hic>Lissen here, $r. Spend a day or two wrestlin' with wild trolls and then tell me how you smell!"]="<hip>（打嗝）听好了，$r。你先去跟野生巨魔摔上两天跤，再来跟我谈你身上什么味儿！"
G["<more>"]="<更多>"
G["<sigh> It's always over too soon."]="<suspira>（叹气）总是结束得太快。"
G["<sigh> Seems like I've been at this forever..."]="<suspira>（叹气）感觉我都干这个干了一辈子了……"
G["<sigh>...\n\nA little help here, perhaps?"]="<suspiro>（叹气）……\n\n也许有人能来搭把手？"
G["<sigh>... Do you think we could move out, $c?\n\nI'm losing fluid fast!"]="<suspiro>（叹气）……$c，你觉得咱们能撤了吗？\n\n我的体液流失得太快了！"
G["<sigh>... This is the end of me."]="<suspiro>（叹气）……我完了。"
G["<sigh>... Well, I suppose it could be worse."]="<suspiro>（叹气）……好吧，我想事情本来可能更糟。"
G["<sigh>...Let's get this over with."]="<suspiro>（叹气）……赶紧把这事了结吧。"
G["<sniff's himself, and winces>\n\nThat there be the smell of adventure, $c!"]="<闻了闻身上的气味，然后退了一步>\n\n$c，这就是冒险的味道！"
G["<sniff, sniff> I can smell 'em, mon."]="<嗅，嗅>朋友，我能嗅出他们的气味。"
G["<sob> My uncle served in the Argent Dawn.\n\nHow was he able to face these foul things?"]="<sollozo>（呜咽）我叔叔曾在银色黎明服役。\n\n他是怎么面对这些恶心的东西的？"
G["A $C called $n? You'll make a fine breakfast!"]="¿$gUn:Una; $c $gllamado:llamada; $n? ¡Serás un suculento desayuno!"
G["A $c and $g his : her; friends... how quaint.  This shouldn't take long."]="哟，一位$c和$g他:她;的朋友……真是有趣。这应该不会花太长时间的。"
G["A $c of your caliber is exactly what we need to turn the battle in our favor."]="正需要$g你:你;这样水准的 $c，才能让战局转向我们这边。"
G["A $c? Here? And a Horde no less.\n\nWe could make good use of you if you are willing to help.\n\nWe followed visions and dreams to get here only to find a nightmare waiting for us."]="一个 $c？在这儿？而且还是部落的人。\n\n如果你愿意帮忙，我们能让$g你:你;派上大用场。\n\n我们追随着幻象与梦境来到这里，结果等着我们的却是一场噩梦。"
G["A $c? Most engaging."]="¿$gUn:Una; $c? Qué interesante."
G["A $c?! I hate $cs! <Tasty though.>"]="¿$gUn:Una; $c? ¡$gLos:Las; odio! <Pero están $gricos:ricas;.>"
G["A $n attacks!"]="¡$gUn:Una; $n está atacando!"
G["A $r? I spit on you!"]="$r？你这该死的！"
G["A %s appears above the circle, hazy and indistinct."]="有%s出现在圆环上方，模糊不清。"
G["A %s appears to defend its dinner."]="一只%s突然窜了出来，想要护食。"
G["A %s emerges from the shell!"]="一个%s从壳中钻了出来！"
G["A %s erupts into the waking world from the Emerald Dream!"]="一个%s从翡翠梦境中侵入了现实世界！"
G["A %s has arrived from the center depot."]="一辆来自中央补给站的%s到达了。"
G["A %s senses a potential meal!"]="%s发现了一顿美餐！"
G["A %s spots medical supplies."]="一个%s看到了医用补给品。"
G["A 10? Ha! Maybe in Razor Hill.  In Orgrimmar she'd only be a 6."]="10分？哈！这也就是在剃刀岭了。在奥格瑞玛，她最多也就6分。"
G["A Bataari War Yeti approaches from the Ancient Passage!"]="一只巴塔里战斗雪人从远古之路过来了！"
G["A Bataari War Yeti approaches from the Bridge!"]="一只巴塔里战斗雪人从桥上过来了！"
G["A Bataari War Yeti approaches from the west!"]="一只巴塔里战斗雪人从西边过来了！"
G["A Bountiful Table is laid out with five Pilgrim's Bounty foods, one in front of each chair.\n\nWhile in a chair, you may eat as much of that food as you like, as well as pass servings of that food to the other chairs. Feast and share with friends!\n\nIf you eat enough of any one food, you'll gain benefits unique to that food.\n\nIn addition, if you eat enough of every food, you'll gain the Spirit of Sharing!"]="一张盛宴餐桌上放着五种感恩节美食。每一份都放在一把座椅前面。\n\n坐进这些椅子里，你就能随心所欲地大吃面前的美食，并将这些美食传递给其它椅子中的朋友。能够和朋友共享的快乐才是真正的快乐！\n\n如果你吃足任何一种食物，你就能从这种食物中获得独特的好处。\n\n另外，如果你将每种食物都吃得足够多，你就能得到分享之魂！"
G["A Cooking trainer is it?  Well then, get yerself over to the Bronze Kettle on the northeastern side of The Great Forge.  Daryl Riknussun will teach ye to make a mighty fine dish that's sure to put the life back in ye!"]="一个烹饪培训师？那好吧，你到大熔炉东北方的铜壶铁罐店去。达瑞尔·瑞克努索会教你制作极好的菜肴，那肯定会让你获得新生的！"
G["A Corpse Spider stirs from its sleep in the webs above!"]="一只骸骨蜘蛛从上方的蛛网中苏醒过来了！"
G["A Crypt Guard joins the fight!"]="一名地穴卫士加入了战斗！"
G["A DRAGON!"]="一头龙！"
G["A Darkhatched Sorcerer has put the boat into Stasis!  Kill it to interrupt the spell."]="暗生巫师使船陷入了停滞！杀了它以打断法术。"
G["A Darkmoon Ride Ticket has been consumed."]="消耗了一张暗月木马门票。"
G["A Draining Spirit is draining your soul. Hide from it to break the spell!"]="一个枯竭之魂正在吸取你的灵魂。躲开他，破坏他的法术！"
G["A Drakkari, one of the so-called Scarlet Onslaught, a gnome, a Hyldnir shield-maiden, and now you? Is this a joke?"]="达卡莱巨魔，然后是所谓的血色先锋军，接着是侏儒和海德尼尔持盾女武士，现在轮到你了？这是在跟我开玩笑吧？"
G["A Fel Horde scout! What's he looking for?"]="一个邪部落斥候！他在找什么？"
G["A Ghoul dropped something onto the field!"]="一只食尸鬼把什么东西丢到了地上！"
G["A Guardian of Icecrown enters the fight!"]="寒冰皇冠卫士加入了战斗！"
G["A Hero's Welcome is located right beside the Silver Enclave in southwestern Dalaran.\n\nThe place boasts a beer garden and one of the city's finest cooking trainer in its kitchen."]="英雄之家位于达拉然西南部的银色领地旁边。\n\n那里不仅设有露天啤酒店，还汇集了全城最好的烹饪训练师。"
G["A Horde Commendation Signet is awarded to a $g hero : heroine; who goes above and beyond the call of duty to the Horde.  Various Commendation Officers for the factions of the Horde are located in all of the major cities; speak with the one with whom you'd like to raise your reputation, and give them the number of signets they ask for!\n\nBy the way, during the war effort here, if you'd rather receive a material reward for your signets instead of reputation, seek out Warlord Gorchuk."]="部落荣誉徽章是奖励给那些富于责任感的英雄的。各大主城均设有嘉奖官，跟你想要提升声望的主城的嘉奖官交谈，按照规定的数量缴纳徽章吧！\n\n顺便说一句，在安其拉大战期间，如果你想要用徽章换取实物奖励而不是提升声望的话，可以去找督军格尔库克。"
G["A Horde caravan has been destroyed."]="一辆部落货车已被摧毁。"
G["A Horde caravan needs to be escorted from Ratchet to the Crossroads."]="一辆从棘齿城前往十字路口的部落货车需要护送。"
G["A Horde caravan needs to be escorted from Southern Barrens to the Crossroads."]="一辆从南贫瘠之地前往十字路口的部落货车需要护送。"
G["A Horde caravan needs to be escorted from Stonetalon Mountains to the Crossroads."]="一辆从石爪山脉前往十字路口的部落货车需要护送。"
G["A Horde caravan needs to be escorted from the Grol'dom Farm to Far Watch Post."]="一辆从格罗多姆农场前往前沿哨所的部落货车需要护送。"
G["A Horde caravan needs to be escorted from the Sludge Fen to Durotar."]="一辆从淤泥沼泽前往杜隆塔尔的部落货车需要护送。"
G["A Horde caravan needs to be escorted out of Wailing Caverns."]="一辆准备驶出哀嚎洞穴的部落货车需要护送。"
G["A Horde caravan needs to be escorted out of the Dry Hills."]="一辆准备驶出无水岭的部落货车需要护送。"
G["A Horde caravan needs to be escorted out of the Stagnant Oasis."]="一辆准备驶出死水绿洲的部落货车需要护送。"
G["A Hunter is it?  Well, then you will want to speak with Thorfin Stoneshield over in the Dwarven District.  \nOh, and you be sure to tell him that if I step in his pet's business one more time, he's going to be training other hunters from behind bars in the Stockade!"]="猎人，是吧？那么你该去矮人区找索尔芬·石盾谈谈。 \n\n 哦，还有，你一定得告诉他：要是我再管一次他宠物的事，他就要去监狱里隔着铁栏杆教别的猎人了！"
G["A Kor'kron commander has appeared on the battlefield."]="一名库卡隆指挥官出现在了战场上。"
G["A Kor'kron shipment of lumber has been overturned!"]="一辆满载木材的库卡隆货车倾覆了！"
G["A Kor'kron shipment of meat has been overturned!"]="一辆满载食用肉的库卡隆货车倾覆了！"
G["A Kor'kron shipment of oil has been overturned!"]="一辆满载原油的库卡隆货车倾覆了！"
G["A Kor'kron shipment of stone has been overturned!"]="一辆满载石料的库卡隆货车倾覆了！"
G["A Lion Seal has become alerted to your presence and begins bellowing a warning!"]="你惊动了一头海狮，它立即向同伴发出了警报。"
G["A Lorewalker's sworn duty is to rediscover our history - to rend that shroud, piece by piece."]="游学者的使命就是要让历史重见天日——将迷雾一团一团地驱散。"
G["A Lorewalker's work is ponderous, traveler.\n\nOne must draw upon a wealth of knowledge to see things as they truly are."]="El trabajo de un eremita es lento y pesado, $gviajero:viajera;.\n\nUno ha de recurrir a una cantidad impresionante de conocimientos para ver las cosas tal cual son."
G["A Lost Hen! Bring her back to a chicken coop."]="一只丢失的母鸡！把她带回鸡笼。"
G["A Luckydo? Why it is a person, place or thing of good luck and fortune.\n\nIt is a most high compliment from grummles to be called a luckydo.\n\nUsually a luckydo has special smell to it. Grummle noses are keen for finding luck by its scent."]="幸运符？是指能带来好运和财富的人、地方或物品。\n\n幸运符是土地精给予最高的赞美之词。\n\n通常，幸运符本身拥有独特的气息。土地精灵敏的嗅觉可以通过幸运符的气味找到好运。"
G["A Marmot Disguised in Chicken Feathers! Expose him for the sham he really is!"]="一只披着鸡毛的土拨鼠！让它现出原形！"
G["A Massive Wave of Zombies is Approaching!"]="一大波僵尸正在靠近！"
G["A Mischievous Snow Sprite emerges from the Suspicious Snow Pile."]="从可疑的雪堆里钻出了一只淘气的雪妖。"
G["A Mogu's feet should always be on the ground."]="魔古族就应该脚踏实地。"
G["A Muffin!? A Muffin!? Of all damn things... A Muffin!? Argh."]="一块松饼！？一块松饼！？偏偏是这鬼东西……一块松饼！？呃啊。"
G["A Portal Guardian defends the new portal!"]="传送门守卫者保护着新的传送门！"
G["A Portal Keeper emerges from the portal!"]="一名传送门看护者冲出了传送门！"
G["A Power Spark forms from a nearby rift!"]="附近的裂隙中冒出了一团能量火花！"
G["A Rabid Mastiff growls..."]="一头狂暴猎犬大声咆哮……"
G["A Ravenous Oceanic Broadhead has caught the scent of your clams."]="一只饥饿的海洋锤头鲨嗅到了你的蛤蚌的气味。"
G["A Restless Spirit is after your soul.  Don't let it reach you!"]="一个躁动之魂正在追逐你的灵魂。别让它碰到你！"
G["A Ruby Drake at full power can perform Martyr, which shields friendly targets by redirecting all hostile magic to the Ruby Drake for a short time.  Evasive Maneuvers can still be performed during Martyr."]="拥有终极力量的红玉幼龙可以使用殉难，撑起护盾保护友方目标，短时间内对友方目标的所有魔法伤害将由红玉幼龙承担。使用该技能的同时仍可触发闪避机动。"
G["A SWARM of non-elites!"]="一群非精英！"
G["A Saurok runs down a hidden set of stairs with some of the treasure!"]="一个蜥蜴人抱着一些宝藏逃到了隐藏的阶梯下面！"
G["A Sentry approaches! Hide yourself, quickly!!"]="有个哨兵接近了！快藏起来！！"
G["A Shado-Pan Novice has chosen you for |cFFFF0000|Hspell:106774|h[Honorable Combat]|h|r! They will attack you until they are defeated!"]="影踪派新人将你选作|cFFFF0000|Hspell:106774|h[荣誉之战]|h|r的目标！在落败之前，他们会使出浑身解数来对付你！"
G["A Shado-Pan agent will meet you behind the mines. Good luck!!"]="影踪派的密探就在矿洞后等你。祝你好运！！"
G["A Shado-Pan contact will be waiting to meet you behind the mines. Good luck!!"]="影踪派的密探会在矿洞后等你。别让她久等。祝你好运！！"
G["A Shadron Disciple appears in the Twilight!"]="一只沙德隆的信徒出现了！"
G["A Son of Kor has arrived to assist you, but watch out for his boulders!"]="一个柯尔之子来帮助你了，但你要小心他的大石头！"
G["A Sulfuron ingot?!??! Impossible! I must have it! I must! I must!\n\n$R, I am authorized to make you a grand deal for that ingot. Perhaps you would be interested to know the secrets of the Hand of Ragnaros? Sulfuras, idiot! The legendary hammer of the Firelord."]="萨弗隆铁锭？！？？！不可能！我必须得到它！必须！必须！\n\n$R，我会花大价钱购买铁锭的。或许你会对炎魔拉格纳罗斯之手之谜感兴趣？就是萨弗拉斯，白痴！传说中火元素之王使用的铁锤。"
G["A Tempest Minion appears to defend Emalon!"]="一只风暴爪牙冒出来帮助埃玛尔隆作战！"
G["A Thunderbrew ale and a bit of Gremlock's cooking makes for a nice meal indeed.  Ye really should hit him up for some training if ye want to be a cook."]="一杯雷酒，再加上一点格雷姆洛克做的菜，确实是一顿美餐。$g你:你;要是想当厨师，真该去找他学两手。"
G["A Tonk is taking aim at you!"]="一辆坦克瞄准了你！"
G["A Town-In-A-Box. Are we not the greatest tinkers in the world?"]="一个胶囊镇。难道我们不是这个世界上最伟大的工匠吗？"
G["A Town-In-A-Box. Are we not the greatest tinkers in the world?\n\nNeed any training, my young protege?"]="Una Ciudad de Bolsillo. ¿Acaso no somos los mayores manitas de todo el mundo?\n\n¿Necesitas instrucción, mi joven $gprotegido:protegida;?"
G["A Town-In-A-Box. Nice!"]="一个胶囊镇，太好了！"
G["A Town-In-A-Box. Nice!\n\nNeed any training, $n?"]="便携小镇。不错！\n\n需要学点什么吗，$n？"
G["A Twilight Zealot has evolved!"]="一个暮光狂热者进化了！"
G["A Twilight's Hammer medallion? Guard!"]="暮光之锤的徽章？卫兵！"
G["A Vesperon Disciple appears in the Twilight!"]="一只维斯匹隆的信徒出现了！"
G["A Wanderbrew marrying a Goldendraft? I would be offended but there is a certain amusement to how offended old Peiji is going to be when he hears this.\n\nAt the least you seem to have made my boy happy. Thank you, $p."]="游酒家和金酿家联姻？我当然很生气，不过一想到老佩吉听到这个消息时会多么愤怒，我又有点儿高兴了。\n\n至少你让我儿子高兴了起来。谢谢你，$p。"
G["A Wanderbrew wants to marry an Goldendraft?! Preposterous."]="游酒家的人想跟金酿家联姻？！荒唐。"
G["A Warbringer approaches! Fall back!"]="战争使者来了！退后！"
G["A Wild Prairie Chicken! Kick him out of here!"]="一只野生农场小鸡！把它踢走！"
G["A baby arakkoa must be the cutest thing ever!"]="鸦人宝宝肯定是最可爱的东西！"
G["A banana in hand is worth than two in bush."]="一根香蕉在手，胜过两根香蕉在林。"
G["A bank?  Well, the closest bank around here is The Stormwind Counting House.  It's just up the road in Stormwind not far from the gates."]="银行？哦，这附近最近的银行就是暴风城会计室。沿着暴风城大门不远的那条路向前走就是。"
G["A barrel of grog.  Pirates love this stuff."]="一桶烈酒。正对海盗的胃口。"
G["A barrel of grog.  Pirates love this stuff.\n\nThe cork does not seem to fit too tightly in the bunghole."]="一桶烈酒。正对海盗的胃口。\n\n桶口的软木塞好像塞得不太紧。"
G["A barrel of gunpowder.  Highly explosive."]="一桶火药粉。爆破性极强。"
G["A barrel of gunpowder.  There is a pitcher of water sitting nearby."]="一桶火药粉。旁边还放着一大罐水。"
G["A battle?"]="一场战斗？"
G["A beast emerged from you when I began the ritual. $p slew it!"]="当我开始举行仪式时，从你身体里钻出了一只野兽。$p杀死了它！"
G["A beautiful city, is it not? As was Gilneas, in its time.\n\nBut such things pass, as shall we.  Only the earth and her secrets will remain.\n\nAre you willing to learn, $n?"]="Es una ciudad hermosa, ¿no crees? Gilneas también lo fue, en su época.\n\nPero esas cosas pasan, como pasaremos $gnosotros:nosotras;. Solo quedarán la tierra y sus secretos.\n\n¿Estás $gdispuesto:dispuesta; a aprender, $n?"
G["A beautiful creature has fallen."]="一个美丽的生命消逝了。"
G["A beautiful day, a beautiful Brew, and a beautiful fish, what more could you ask for?"]="风和日丽，醇酒佳酿，肥美鲜鱼，还有什么不满足的？"
G["A being of great power has awoken."]="一股强大的力量已经苏醒了。"
G["A bell cast from the makers' flesh, shaped by stars' fire, and bound by the breath of darkest shadow."]="一口以血肉为坯，以星辰之火锻造，以大地之血熔接而成的大钟。"
G["A big convention, see? To show off all of our inventions. We'll call it GoblinCon. And we'll give away special pets! Except most people will probably sell them for profit on the auction house."]="明白吗？这可是一场盛会。你在这里可以看到我们全部的发明。我们称它为地精嘉年华。而且我们在这场盛会中还会派送特别宠物！只是大多数人可能会把那些宠物在拍卖行里卖掉。"
G["A big day, Firebeard. The Wildhammer united can never be stopped!"]="焰须，这是个大日子。蛮锤的团结不可阻挡！"
G["A big pandaren came and asked me to take you there."]="是一个大块头熊猫人叫我把你带去那里的。"
G["A binary number system. It uses only two numbers. 6 and 11."]="这是一个二进制系统。它只使用两个数字。6和11。"
G["A bit cold out, don't you think?"]="有一点冷，你觉得呢？"
G["A bit ungrateful, aren't we?  The way out is clear, flee quickly!"]="有点不舒服？出去的路很安全，快点跑吧！"
G["A black dragon, through and through. Very well, I will give you my blessing, but also some advice:"]="真不愧是黑龙。很好，我会给你们祝福，但我也有些建议："
G["A blacksmith and his assistant can be found working in the Warrior's Terrace, near the armor and weapon vendors there."]="你可以在战士区找到铁匠和他的助手，就在护甲和武器供应商附近。"
G["A blind dragon. Ridiculous!"]="一头瞎眼的龙。真可笑！"
G["A boat ride to the Badlands, please."]="我需要一艘前往荒芜之地的小船。"
G["A bold move."]="勇敢的一击。"
G["A bold plan.  Let us hope we do not run into any surprises."]="这计划很大胆。但愿我们不会遇到什么意外。"
G["A book by a goblin on gnomish military victories... and all the pages are blank.  Figures."]="地精写的关于侏儒的军事胜利的书……而所有的纸张都是空白的。数字。"
G["A bountiful victory!"]="真是一场大捷！"
G["A bow is a great ting ma friend. Joo jus have to take care of it, and it will take care of joo."]="弓很重要,我的朋友。你只需照顾它，而它就会照顾你。"
G["A box that walks?  I should ask Hondo about this... nah, maybe later."]="一只能走路的盒子？我应该问问宏多这件事……嗯，也许再等一段时间吧。"
G["A brew sure would be nice right now."]="现在要能喝上一杯就好了。"
G["A brewery... my family... my ancestral home!"]="酿酒厂……我的家人……我祖先的家园！"
G["A budding herbalist are we?  Then you should visit with Firodren Mooncaller over in the Temple Gardens.  He may have some tricks of the trade to impart with you."]="一个新手采药师？那你该找神殿花园的菲罗迪恩·唤月聊聊。他或许有些专业诀窍要传授给你。"
G["A budding village is a wonderful place to make a living!  So many goods needed, so many goods to be traded.  I think I could grow fat and happy here indeed!"]="充满生机的村庄是谋生的绝佳去处！这里需要很多物资，所以能进行各种各样的贸易。我想我确实可以在这里过着无忧无虑的生活！"
G["A bunch of thugs and thieves aren't going to get me to leave my land!"]="就凭你们这些歹徒和盗贼是不可能把我从自己的土地上赶走的！"
G["A butt?"]="一只桶？"
G["A challenge in compassion and humility. By helping Merchant Lorvo, it would seem you've passed, $c. Master Shang would be pleased."]="Una prueba de compasión y humildad. Pareces haberla superado al ayudar al mercader Lorvo. El maestro Shang estaría orgulloso."
G["A challenge to tamers, big and small! Can you battle my pets, and best them all?"]="所有驯宠师们的挑战！你敢来我的宠物对战吗？你能把它们全部打败吗？"
G["A challenge!"]="挑战！"
G["A challenge, huh? Let's see what you've got."]="来次挑战，哈？看看你有什么本事。"
G["A challenge?! Stand still so that I can blast your corpse all over the ground."]="挑战？！站直了，看我把你轰成渣。"
G["A challenger approaches."]="Se acerca $gun:una; contendiente."
G["A chance to catch my breath! Thank you."]="终于能喘口气了！谢谢你。"
G["A chest is revealed near the rear entrance!"]="后门附近出现了一只箱子！"
G["A child has found a new toy! Crewman, take this infant's toy away!"]="瞧，小孩发现了新玩具！水手们，把这个小鬼的玩具抢过来！"
G["A child of nature are we? Then you need look no further then the moonwell in the Park."]="我们是大自然的孩子？那你该到花园区的月亮井去。"
G["A chill is in the air."]="空中掠过了一阵寒风。"
G["A chill just went up my spine!"]="它让我毛骨悚然！"
G["A chilly gust encircles the taunka mill, carrying with it soft, resentful mutterings in Kalimag."]="寒冷的狂风环绕着牦牛人的磨坊，用古卡利姆多语低声诉说着它的怨恨。"
G["A class trainer"]="职业训练师"
G["A clean weapon is a sign of one that has never seen combat."]="一件干净的武器表明它的主人并没有经历过战斗。"
G["A clean yak is a lucky yak. A dirty yak is a yeti attack."]="一只干净的牦牛就是幸运的牦牛。一只脏兮兮的牦牛等同于雪人攻击。"
G["A clear voice rises from within the stone...\n\nWhere is your Medallion of Station, little one?  You may not speak with a Duke without proof of title..."]="一个清朗的声音从石头内部响起……\n\n小家伙，你的身份徽章呢？没有身份凭证，$g你:你;不能与公爵对话……"
G["A clear voice rises from within the stone...\n\nYou come to us with title and so we will listen, but do not try our patience, $c.  The council has no time for idle gossip from one such as you."]="从石头中传来清晰的声音……\n\n你带着你的头衔来找我们，我们将会聆听，但是不要试图考验我们的耐心，$c。议会没有时间来和你这样的凡人闲聊。"
G["A cloud of saronite vapors coalesces nearby!"]="一团萨隆邪铁蒸汽在附近聚集起来！"
G["A commission from King Wrynn is always an honor. I'll get to work on it right away."]="能够执行乌瑞恩国王的命令永远都是我的骄傲。我立刻就行动。"
G["A complete waste!"]="真是浪费！"
G["A conducting crystal overloads!"]="一块传导水晶开始过载了！"
G["A cool breeze caresses your face. Gentle, melodic humming resonates throughout the chamber."]="一股冷风吹过你的脸颊，温和的蜂鸣声在大厅中环绕。"
G["A corruption taints our sacred forest."]="一股堕落的力量正在玷污我们神圣的森林。"
G["A cow woman who claims to be a druid has set up camp within Silvermoon. She's no doubt grazing on our planters as we speak."]="有个自称是德鲁伊的母牛在银月城内建立了一处小营地。她现在肯定正在啃我们的植物。"
G["A crack begins to open beneath your feet."]="你的脚下裂开了一道缝隙。"
G["A crawler mine detonated on $n!"]="$n附近的蛛形地雷爆炸了！"
G["A creature emerges from the shadows!"]="一只潜伏在阴影中的生物显身了！"
G["A cunning $c, a proud $r.  We are pleased to present $n to you."]="$gUn astuto:Una astuta; $c, $gun orgulloso:una orgullosa; $r. Estamos orgullosos de presentaros a $n."
G["A curse upon your kind, trespasser!"]="诅咒你的族类，侵犯者！"
G["A cursory examination of the skeletal remains indicates that the flesh was seared off. Quite a grisly sight."]="粗略地检查一下骸骨，上面的肉已经干枯了。真是令人毛骨悚然的场景。"
G["A dangerous device this is, $n.  I am glad you brought it to my attention."]="这是一个危险的东西，$n。我很高兴你能把它带来。"
G["A dark force from within the Dragon Soul reacts violently to the cleansing!"]="巨龙之魂内的黑暗力量对净化产生了强烈的反应！"
G["A dark force grips Stonetalon Peak."]="一股黑暗力量在席卷石爪峰。"
G["A dark power seeks to use you, Medivh!  If you stay, dire days will follow.  You must hurry, we don't have much time!"]="一股黑暗的力量正在利用你，麦迪文！如果你执意留下，可怕的日子就会很快到来。你必须赶快，我们的时间不多了！"
G["A dark time for all."]="这是一个黑暗的时代。"
G["A darkness had fallen over my eyes, but you tore me from my unholy reverie.  You saved me, $n.\n\nAnd now I beg you... to forgive me."]="一片黑暗曾蒙住我的双眼，是你把我从那种邪恶的迷梦中拽了出来。你救了我，$n。\n\n现在，我求你……原谅我。"
G["A day of celebration and of mourning, hero..."]="Un día de celebración y lamento, $ghéroe:heroína;."
G["A deadly wave of ice begins to sweep across the room!"]="一股致命的寒冰之潮开始横扫过房间！"
G["A decade ago, a great battle took place here on the summit of Mount Hyjal. Archimonde the Defiler commanded a swarm of demons to march upon the World Tree and claim its power for his own.\n\nHis defeat signaled the end of the Legion's invasion of Azeroth... But many of his corrupted supporters remained behind."]="十年前，在海加尔山的顶峰爆发了一场旷世之战。污染者阿克蒙德指挥恶魔大军攻占了世界之树，并将其力量据为己有。\n\n他的战败标志着燃烧军团入侵艾泽拉斯计划的终结……但他许多堕落的支持者却仍没有离开。"
G["A decision must be made!"]="你必须马上做出决定！"
G["A deep, bone chilling voice echoes from the %s..."]="%s发出一种低沉、让人毛骨悚然的声音。"
G["A defender has fallen!"]="一个卫士倒下了！"
G["A deft maneuver, outlander."]="身手矫捷啊，外乡人。"
G["A deserved death!"]="死有余辜！"
G["A diary with yellowing pages lies open to the last entry:\n\n\"I don't know what's going to happen now that Harold's turned.  It took everything out of me to drag him into the only place I could find that'd lock him up tight and hold him.  I hid the key on me, and I pray it works...\n\nI hope I can get out of here, but I need money to do that.  Our stuff's all in the cabinet I think... and now that I think about it, doesn't Harold keep the key on him?\n\nI'll rest on it, I'm dead tired now.\""]="一本纸页发黄的日记翻开着，停在最后一条记录：\n\n\"哈罗德变成那样之后，我不知道接下来会怎样。我拼尽全身力气才把他拖进我唯一能找到的、能把他牢牢锁住的地方。我把钥匙藏在自己身上，祈祷它能管用……\n\n我希望能离开这里，可那需要钱。我们的东西应该都在柜子里……现在想想，钥匙不是一直由哈罗德带着吗？\n\n我睡一觉再说吧，我现在累得要死。\""
G["A diligent farmer never loses hope when her crop's in danger."]="当庄稼陷入危险时，勤恳的农夫从不会放弃希望。"
G["A disco ball?! Groovy!"]="一场迪斯科舞会？！真棒！"
G["A discovery!  I need aid with these measurements... I'll send a signal to my colleague!"]="新发现！我需要帮助才能完成测量……我要给同伴们发出信号！"
G["A dishonorable scheme."]="啧啧，卑鄙的阴谋。"
G["A divided Azeroth cannot possibly stand against the darkness."]="四分五裂的艾泽拉斯根本无力对抗黑暗。"
G["A dozen will fall before I am slain!"]="就算是死，也要找人垫背！"
G["A dragon? Hah! Don't be ridiculous.\n\nYou know $r, you're awfully rude. She's standing right here!"]="一头龙？哈！别说胡话了。\n\n你真是个无礼的$r，她就在这里！"
G["A drake swoops down to drop a Twilight Sapper onto the deck!"]="一条幼龙俯冲下来，往甲板上投放了一个暮光工兵！"
G["A drink for friend Sarok and another for myself."]="一杯酒给我的朋友萨洛克，另一杯给我自己。"
G["A druid! How curious... I wonder how it got in there."]="德鲁伊！真奇怪……阴影世界中怎么会有德鲁伊的精神投影呢？"
G["A drunk orc is  a sight to see.  An army of drunk orcs is a sight I wish to never see again."]="一个喝醉的兽人很值得看一看。而一支喝醉的兽人军队则是我绝对不想看到的。"
G["A faction standard-bearer, beloved by the people and feared by their foes."]="这位万众爱戴的英勇先驱，让敌人望风披靡。"
G["A faint whisper is heard from within the stone...\n\nGreetings, little one.  Do you have news for the Templar?"]="石头内部传来一声微弱的低语……\n\n你好，小家伙。$g你:你;有消息要禀报给圣殿骑士吗？"
G["A fair question.\n\nOne might check the perimeter of the hot springs.  Or one might look for signal fires up in the cliffs to the west.  Finally, the path to Silithus, far to the north, is often wrought with danger.\n\nThose would be the places I'd check."]="这是个好问题。\n\n温泉的周围，西边悬崖上的烽火，以及北面通往希利苏斯的小路。\n\n这些都是我要去查看的地方。"
G["A falcon's talon is only as useful as the grace of his flight."]="鹰隼翱翔时的优美身姿甚是养眼，但其利爪的威力也不可小觑。"
G["A far better blacksmith than I am, that's for sure. Though I'll deny it if you tell anyone I said that. You should go speak with Therum Deepforge. If anyone can teach you more, it's him."]="你已经是一个比我好得多的铁匠，那是肯定的。尽管如果你告诉其他人这点我会否认我曾说过。你该去找瑟鲁姆·深炉谈谈。如果有人能教你，那就是他。"
G["A fast learner is what ye are, and a good smith to boot. I would sign off on yer work any day of the week. But I sense ye still have some learnin in ye. Go talk to Bengus Deepforge, he's a hard taskmaster but he's also one of the best."]="你学东西很快，还是个不错的铁匠。$g你:你;的活儿我随时都愿意签字放行。不过我感觉$g你:你;身上还有可学的东西。去找本古斯·深炉谈谈吧，他管教得严，但也是最好的师傅之一。"
G["A feast fit for royalty!"]="一场高贵的盛宴！"
G["A fellow angler I see!  I have a variety of gear from these local fisherman, just let me know what you need!"]="¡Vaya, $gun:una; $gcompañero:compañera; $gpescador:pescadora;! Tengo bastante equipo procedente de los pescadores locales así que si quieres algo solo me lo tienes que decir."
G["A fellow enthusiast, huh? Well, you just wait, we'll make a gearhead out of you in no time!"]="一个热心的朋友，是吗？好吧，你等等，我们会立刻帮你制成一个传动头的！"
G["A fellowship of kindred spirits can be a powerful force.  Krumn will help you to achieve this.  You will find him at the Thunder Bluff Civic Information center on the lower rise next to the lifts."]="一个志趣相投的团体可以成为一支非常强大的力量。克拉姆会帮助你们达到这个目的。你可以在雷霆崖升降梯旁边中部高地的底层的公民信息中心找到他。"
G["A few burns are nothing to the Fel Horde!"]="一丁点的灼伤对邪部落来说算不了什么！"
G["A few days past, I saw a bolt of dark energy crackling through the ground from my tower vigil. It came from the west, fracturing the wall, and very nearly breaking through it entirely.\n\nYou can still see the scars it left. It ruined these farmers' land.\n\nThe mantid scouts followed shortly after. Whether they've had this attack planned or they're just capitalizing on an opportunity, I couldn't say. Maybe they're running away from whatever caused the crack in the first place."]="前几天，我在警戒塔上看到地底爆发出一股黑暗能量。它从西面而来，挤压着城墙，几乎把整个墙体撕裂开来。\n\n你现在还能看到它留下的痕迹。它把这些农夫的土地彻底毁了。\n\n后来，螳螂妖斥候也赶来了。我说不准他们到底是有备而来，还是只想趁火打劫。没准他们也是想逃离那个当初震裂大地的东西呢。"
G["A few monkeys are no match for the Alliance!"]="区区几只猴子，也配跟联盟作对！"
G["A few nights back some guy threw a ball and told me to fetch. In response, I did the same, but with his head.  Needless to say, he didn't have a witty comeback."]="前几天的一个晚上，有人扔了个球过来，还叫我去捡。我照他说的做了，只不过把球和他脑袋一起扔回去了。不用说，他没接着那个球。"
G["A few of our tribe have harnessed the power of thunder.  We use it to defend ourselves against invaders, whether human, orc, or dinosaur.\n\nOur thunder stuns all dinosaurs, you know."]="我们部落中的一些人能够驾驭雷电的力量。我们就是用这种力量来抵抗入侵者，不管是人类、兽人还是恐龙。\n\n要知道，我们的雷电能够震晕任何恐龙。"
G["A few of us here have lived in this land since the Scythe of Elune first passed through it. Most suffered through the fall of Gilneas.\n\nWe have settled in this forest to learn the ways of nature and uphold its balance. In this cursed land, our cursed people have found a new way of life."]="自从月神的镰刀第一次来到这里后，我们之中很少的一部分人住到了这个地方。他们大都承受了吉尔尼斯沉沦的劫难。\n\n我们一直居住在这片森林中，学习自然之道，并致力于维持它的平衡。在这片被诅咒的土地上，我们被诅咒的族人已经找到了一条新的人生之路。"
G["A fierce wind is coming - I can tell by the ache in my exposed knee.  I just hope we don't get caught up in it."]="一场猛烈的风就要来了——我可以通过我裸露膝盖的疼痛判断出来。我就是希望我们不要被狂风困住。"
G["A final vision! Ancestors... could those be... our children? This was his deepest desire... to be a father?"]="最后一个幻象！先祖啊……难道那是……我和他的孩子？他最深的渴望……是成为父亲？"
G["A final warning, mortal; Fail, and you shall fall by my hand!"]="凡人，这是给你们的最后警告；如果你们失败了，我会亲手毁了你们！"
G["A fine display of worthiness. Your instruction may now continue."]="都是些有用的东西。你的教导可以继续进行了。"
G["A fine example of a $g man:woman;, that $n."]="$n是一个好榜样。"
G["A fine meal you will make..."]="你将成为我的腹中餐……"
G["A fine offer, Floyd. I wish to make Hellfire Peninsula my home."]="好主意，弗洛伊德。我想把炉石绑定在地狱火半岛。"
G["A fine trophy your head will make, $R."]="你的脑袋会是一件上好的战利品，$R。"
G["A fine vintage in celebration of our salvation!"]="为我们的得救干一杯！"
G["A fish?  For me?  It's adorable."]="一条鱼？给我的？真是可爱。"
G["A fissure?"]="裂缝？"
G["A fittin' end for so foul a troll. Bwonsamdi; you have my tanks, and dat of all de Darkspear. We will continue to honor you, as is proper."]="这是邪恶巨魔应有的下场。邦桑迪，我们全体暗矛部族都感谢您。我们将继续赞颂您的荣耀。"
G["A fitting end for a traitor. Come, we must free the slaves and see what is within the Lich King's chamber for ourselves."]="叛徒就是这种下场。来吧，我们必须解救那些奴隶，再看看巫妖王的密室中都有什么。"
G["A fitting end for a traitor..."]="对叛徒来说，这是再好不过的结局了……"
G["A fitting meal for my children."]="很合我的小宝贝们的胃口。"
G["A fitting punishment."]="多么恰当的惩罚。"
G["A flame druid... she is dangerous, Malfurion. You know her?"]="烈焰德鲁伊……她很危险，玛法里奥。你认识她吗？"
G["A flaming vortex takes shape."]="一个火焰漩涡显现了出来。"
G["A flare has been spotted. The Boom Boom Brew Defender can now be fired."]="锁定信号弹。布姆布姆佳酿守卫者可以发射了。"
G["A flickering image of a female blood elf commander appears. From the surroundings, you can tell she must be inside Tempest Keep."]="一个忽隐忽显的女性血精灵指挥官影像出现了。从周围的布置来看，她肯定在风暴要塞里。"
G["A follower of the arcane are you?  Hmph!  Very well then... you can find them around the Pools of Vision underneath the Spirit Rise."]="你是魔法的研习者？嗯，好吧……你可以在灵魂高地下的预见之池中找到他们。"
G["A fool who is about to end you, necrolord. There will be nothing left of you for the Lich King to reanimate!"]="通灵领主，你很快就会死在蠢货手中了。我要粉碎你，即便是巫妖王，也无法再复活你！"
G["A foregone conclusion."]="预料之中的结果。"
G["A foreigner. $G He : She; looks very exotic. Don't stare!"]="$GUn extranjero:Una extranjera;. Parece muy $gexótico:exótica;. ¡No te quedes mirando!"
G["A foreigner? And by the look of you, a seasoned $c. Good! Maybe you can get us out of this mess."]="¿$GUn extranjero:Una extranjera;? Y por tu aspecto, diría que eres $gun:una; $c $gveterano:veterana;. ¡Genial! Quizás puedas sacarnos de este lío."
G["A former student of mine by the name of Krixix spent a lifetime attempting to make contact with the chained Gods of the underworld. He pursued that which would spring up from the ravaged earth... That which would form only as a result of the elements clashing in titanic conflict.\n\nElementium as it would be known to mortals.\n\nOne day, nearly a decade ago, Krixix's pursuit lead to a fissure forming in this very gorge."]="克里希克是我以前的一个学生，他耗费了一生的时间尝试与被封锁在地狱中的神灵进行沟通。他研究那些能够让毫无生机的土地上变为沃土的东西……只有通过元素之间的剧烈碰撞才能创造出来的东西。\n\n凡人把这种东西称为源质。\n\n大约在十年前的某一天，克里希克的研究工作使这片峡谷裂开了。"
G["A fortunate attack!"]="幸运的一击！"
G["A foul corruption has crept into Westfall. While I was upholding my duty on the battlefields of Lordaeron these honest farms were overrun and made into hide-outs for thugs and murderers. The People's Militia needs your help."]="一股邪恶的腐化已经悄然渗入西部荒野。当我在洛丹伦的战场上尽忠职守时，这些本分的农场却被人侵占，成了暴徒和杀人犯的藏身之处。人民军需要你的帮助。"
G["A foul trogg if ever I saw one.  Die!"]="$gUn:Una; trogg repugnante donde $glos:las; haya. ¡Muere!"
G["A foul wind blows from the East, $c."]="$c，东方吹来了一阵污秽的风。"
G["A fresh glass of bubbly. Just what the doctor ordered, $n."]="一杯清新的香槟酒。这正是医生所叮嘱的，$n。"
G["A friend and I have come to rescue a young human woman from the clutches of the Legionlord, Kil'jaeden and his vile minions.\n\nWe've discovered that Kael'thas is trying to summon Kil'jaeden from the depths of the Sunwell itself.\n\nFor the sake of this world - this cannot come to pass! I am committed to seeing that it does not."]="我和一位朋友前来，要从军团领主基尔加丹和他那些邪恶爪牙手中救出一名年轻的人类女子。\n\n我们已经查明，凯尔萨斯正试图从太阳之井深处召唤基尔加丹。\n\n为了这个世界——绝不能让此事成真！我决心阻止它。"
G["A friend of the Zandalrian! You have ventured deep into the lair of the Blood God, $c. You will do well to listen to what I have to say.\n\nMany thousands of years ago, while the indigenous trolls of the Zul'Aman empire were battling the invading high elf heathens, great magic was stolen from Zanza. This magic was used by the high elves to enchant their weapons and armor to assist in conquering the trolls of the region."]="赞达拉的朋友！你已经深入血神的巢穴，$c。$g你:你;最好仔细听我说。\n\n数千年前，当祖阿曼帝国的本土巨魔正与入侵的高等精灵异教徒激战时，一股强大的魔法从赞扎那里被偷走了。高等精灵用这股魔法为他们的武器和护甲附魔，借此征服该地区的巨魔。"
G["A friendly face is welcome around here. Happen to bring some rations?"]="有朋自远方来，不亦乐乎。是来送给养的吗？"
G["A furbolg named Tur Ragepaw.  Not one of ours.\n\nThis one came from the southern lands.  He was of the Timbermaw tribe.\n\nHe wanted to see Ursoc.  He seemed to think that Vordrassil's taint could be purified and used to save my father.\n\nIt is foolish to entertain such hopes.  You will agree when you see the darkness that has afflicted him like I have."]="他是一只名叫图尔·怒爪的熊怪。嗯，不属于我们的氏族。\n\n他来自南部的木喉部族。\n\n图尔想见见乌索克。他觉得有希望净化沃达希尔的污染，并借此拯救我的父亲。\n\n抱着这样的希望未免有些天真。等你亲眼目睹我的父亲受到的黑暗污染之后，你就能认同我的看法了。"
G["A furious Orchard Needler appears above you!"]="一只狂怒的果园钉刺者出现了！"
G["A giant worm-like creature just erupted from the earth near Hive'Ashi!"]="一只巨大的虫形生物突然从亚什虫巢附近的土地中钻了出来！"
G["A gift for little old Gina? You are so sweet."]="这是给上了些年纪的吉娜的礼物吗？你真是太好了。"
G["A girl does get hungry after hunting down all those enemies. Thank you."]="一直在追那些敌人，我一个女孩子家还真是有点饿了。谢谢你。"
G["A girl in my line of work gets hungry, you know? I wish I had something delicious to eat."]="干我们这行的女孩常会感到饥饿，你知道吗？我真希望我有好东西吃。"
G["A glass cannon sometimes breaks before it can fire."]="玻璃做的火炮常常在开火前就会碎裂。"
G["A globe that shows the inside of the planet... on the outside. So you know where to dig!"]="一个球，能够在球面上显示出这颗行星的……内部构造……这样你就知道能在哪里进行挖掘了！"
G["A gloom shrouds our lands, young $c.  Will you take up arms to face this flying death?"]="阴影已经笼罩上了我们的土地，年轻的$c。你愿意拿起武器，对抗这些从天而降的亡灵吗？"
G["A glorious kill!"]="华丽的击杀！"
G["A glorious victory!"]="一个光荣的胜利！"
G["A gnome tries to make some friends, and then BAMM... the next thing you know, he's in shackles!"]="你瞧，小侏儒不过是想交几个朋友呀，然后“砰！”地一声……接下来发生的事你都知道啦，他被绑起来了！"
G["A gnome? How pathetic. Face me, demon!"]="侏儒？真可怜。面对我吧，恶魔！"
G["A goblin? I must be seeing things. Throm-Ka and thank you, little one!"]="一个地精？我一定是在做梦。Throm-Ka，谢谢$g你:你;，小家伙！"
G["A goblin? I must be seeing things. Throm-Ka and thank you, little one."]="一个地精？我一定是在做梦。Throm-Ka，谢谢$g你:你;，小家伙。"
G["A golden placard along the side of the shrine reads:\n\n\"Here stands the Shrine of Dath'Remar, a fitting tribute to the most noble of elves.  Let all who gaze on this monument remember his sacrifices to bring us to this land.  All who prosper in Quel'Thalas do so thanks to him.\""]="神龛侧面的一块金色铭牌上写着：\n\n\"此处矗立着达斯雷玛的神龛，是对最高贵的精灵恰如其分的致敬。愿所有凝望这座纪念碑的人铭记他为带领我们来到这片土地所做的牺牲。奎尔萨拉斯所有繁盛之人，都应归功于他。\""
G["A good battle always makes my adrenaline rush."]="一场精彩的战斗总能令我肾上腺素飙升。"
G["A good bout in the arena will keep you strong for future trials."]="赛场上的激烈战斗可以帮助你保持状态，迎接未来的挑战。"
G["A good brew, is a strong brew."]="够劲的啤酒才是好啤酒。"
G["A good club can make all the difference in the world."]="加入上等的俱乐部可以为你的生活增添别样的风采。"
G["A good day... to die."]="结束了……"
G["A good dream brew is VERY powerful. It will require a focused mind to gain any kind of clarity from the visions!"]="优质的洄梦仙酒酒力强劲。你要有高度集中的意识来分辨各种影像！"
G["A good first test may be dealin' with dese cultists.  Da people be scared.  Dey aren't sure what's goin'on."]="就先拿这群邪教徒小试牛刀吧。人们恐慌不已。他们不知道发生了什么事。"
G["A good grummle is a busy grummle!"]="忙碌的土地精才是好土地精！"
G["A good hammer in yer hands makes the world feel safer. Like ye can face even the mightiest of foes with a large hunk of solid metal gripped in yer fists."]="你手中的一把锤头让这个世界感觉安全了许多。有一块巨大的金属抓在你的手中，你感觉能够对付即使是最强大的敌人。"
G["A good start. Return, disciple."]="这是一个好的开始。继续努力吧。"
G["A grand master jewelcrafter, Hamanar, may be found in northern Aldor Rise."]="你可以在奥尔多高地的北部找到宗师级珠宝匠哈曼纳尔。"
G["A grand sacrifice by a noble soul..."]="要有个崇高的灵魂作出牺牲……"
G["A great blight lies across our land! It grows every day. Our need for magic weakens us, and will bring us to destruction, just as it has before!"]="死亡之痕横穿过我们的土地！它每天都在生长。就像以前那样，我们对魔法的需要使得我们脆弱，同样也把我们带向毁灭。"
G["A great darkness? Could he mean that we must trust these strangers... these... Alliance... after all?"]="巨大的黑暗？他是否在告诫我们必须相信这些陌生人…这些…来自…联盟的人？"
G["A great evil stirs, $r. Can you feel it?\n\nBah! Of course you cannot. Hand me your armor and weapons and I shall renew their vigor."]="一股强大的邪恶力量正在蠢蠢欲动，$R。你感觉到了没？\n\n啊！当然你无法感觉到。把你的护甲和武器给我吧，我会让它们恢复活力。"
G["A green dragon in mortal guise! I never thought I would receive the honor of..."]="一头化身成凡人的绿龙！我从没有想过能够得到这样的光荣……"
G["A grinning face from ear to ear..."]="一张充满了笑意的脸……"
G["A grummle can carry five times their own weight. They never sweat. They have an outstanding sense of smell."]="一个土地精可以负担相当于其本身体重五倍的重物。他们从不流汗，还有着超凡的嗅觉。"
G["A ha a ha a ha uh- uh! A ha a ha yeah yeah yeah yeah!\n\nDo you like my song?"]="哟哟哟切克闹！动次打次动次打次！\n\n你喜欢我的歌吗？"
G["A hail of death approaches! Bring them to their fate!"]="死亡已经逼近！让他们偿命吧！"
G["A happy Winter Veil to you, $c!"]="祝你冬幕节快乐，$c！"
G["A happy Winter Veil to you, friend!"]="祝$g你:你;冬幕节快乐，朋友！"
G["A harbinger of death is reborn..."]="死亡的预言者已经重生……"
G["A healthy one! My Lady will be mosst pleased..."]="这个很健康！夫人一定会非常高兴……"
G["A hidden blade up the sleeve can mean the difference between you laying dead in the alley, and your opponent laying face down in his own blood."]="袖子里藏着刀片意味着要么你躺在小巷里死去，要么你的对手卧在他自己的鲜血里。"
G["A hidden hollow? How very interesting. You've served your purpose, Landgren, but I'm afraid there'll be no resurrection for you this time!"]="隐蔽的洞穴？真有意思。兰德雷，你没有利用价值了。恐怕这次你就没有复活的机会了！"
G["A high pitch humming noise emanates in the distance..."]="从远处传来了高音嗡鸣声……"
G["A historian's work is never done, you see. There's always something important happening that we will need to remember.\n\nI'm beginning to collect the history of your people's coming here. What is your name, so that future generations may read your story and know your tale?"]="你瞧，历史学家的工作是永远也干不完的。那些需要我们铭记的重要事件总是层出不穷。\n\n我已经开始收集你们的人来到这片土地的相关史料。你叫什么来着？我得把它记下来，好让我们的子孙后代能读到你的故事，了解你的传说。"
G["A historian's work is never done, you see. There's always something important happening that we will need to remember.\n\nI've written much of your legacy already, but there is still so much to learn! Surely your feats will be remembered for ages to come."]="你瞧，历史学家的工作是永远也干不完的。那些需要我们铭记的重要事件总是层出不穷。\n\n我已经记下了你的大部分事迹，但有待了解的东西还是太多了！你的事迹肯定会流芳百世的。"
G["A hoe is an honest $Gman's:woman's; weapon."]="锄头是忠实的$g男人的:女人的;武器。"
G["A hozen bandit is stealing the brew! Stop him!"]="有猢狲强盗在偷酒！快阻止他！"
G["A hundred crates of barley there ta' be makin' inta' mead!"]="那里有上百箱的大麦会被酿成美酒！"
G["A hunter hunts. An artist... arts.\n\nI am here to capture the ferocity of the hunt through my art.\n\nWe are in strange lands, and few in the known world are familiar with the strange creatures of our hunt.\n\nThrough my art, I prove your success, and the success of the Nesingwarys."]="猎手狩猎。艺术家……则钻研艺术。\n\n我来这里是为了用艺术来表现狩猎的凶残。\n\n我们身处陌生的土地，而且在这世界上也没几个人熟悉我们要猎杀的这种奇怪生物。\n\n通过我的艺术，我能证明你的成功，以及奈辛瓦里远征队的成功。"
G["A just punishment!"]="公正的惩罚！"
G["A kaldorei assassin evades $n's gaze and slips into the shadows."]="一名卡多雷刺客躲避开$n的目光，潜入到阴影里。"
G["A kaldorei assassin leaps from the shadows and attacks $n!"]="一名卡多雷刺客从阴影中跳出来，向$n发动了攻击！"
G["A keg is returned! My humble thanks..."]="你找回了一桶酒！我真是感激不尽……"
G["A kiss would be most appreciated."]="一个吻就可以了。"
G["A large device of unknown origin hums in front of you. Several words are scratched into the side:\n|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_gizmo_02:20|t |cFFDD2222[Goblin-Titan control module]|r\nIt appears to be protected by a voice-recognition module."]="一个来历不明的大型装置在你面前嗡嗡作响。侧面刻着几个字：\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_gizmo_02:20|t |cFFDD2222[地精泰坦控制模块]|r\n\n它似乎受一个语音识别模块保护。"
G["A large humanoid hand print is embedded on the surface of the orb. A soft green glow seems to pulse within."]="这颗宝珠上有一个巨大的人形生物掌印。掌印中似乎还脉动着一种绿色微光。"
G["A large humanoid hand print is embedded on the surface of the orb. Despite what appears to be constant manipulation and handling, the orb remains unmarred."]="一个巨大的人类手印出现在宝珠的表面。除了看上去的那些处理过的痕迹，宝珠并没有损坏。"
G["A large wave of fliers approaches! Take my cannon, $c, quickly!"]="¡Se acerca una oleada de enemigos voladores! ¡Rápido, coge mi cañón!"
G["A legend is born!"]="一个传奇诞生了！"
G["A list... how intriguing.  Ah yes, the shipment of fireworks for Lord Saltheril.  He hasn't paid for them; are you here to purchase them on his behalf, $c?"]="订单……真有趣。哦，这是萨瑟利尔男爵的焰火订单吧。他还没付钱呢。你要替他先付清吗，$c？"
G["A little busy here, $c.  What d'ye want?"]="我有点忙，$c。你要什么？"
G["A little deeper now - almost got it...."]="再深一点——快好啦……"
G["A little help here first, $c?"]="$c，能不能先帮个小忙？"
G["A little help here..."]="过来帮个忙……"
G["A little help here?"]="有人愿意帮忙吗？"
G["A little help here? Or do you need more training, $n?\n\nI'm kinda busy at the moment if you hadn't noticed."]="能来搭把手吗？还是说你需要再多学点，$n？\n\n你要是没注意到的话，我现在挺忙的。"
G["A little help over here! Somethin' is wrapped around the propeller!"]="快来帮帮我！螺旋桨里卷到东西了！"
G["A little help?"]="帮帮忙吧？"
G["A little ice ought to quench the fire in your hearts..."]="这些冰块应该能熄灭你胸中的怒火……"
G["A little left now - no, no, right...."]="再往左一点——不，不，往右……"
G["A little more jade - the jade you helped to acquire - and it will be finished."]="再来些玉石——就是你取回的那种——就大功告成了。"
G["A little paint and it'll be fine!"]="涂上点儿漆，就完事大吉了！"
G["A little rain never hurt anybody... yet."]="这点小雨又不会伤人……起码目前没有。"
G["A little ritual torture can go a long way."]="一个小小的仪式就够你受的了。"
G["A little torture, a pinch of magic, and an ample helping of invasive surgery. She was conscious, of course."]="一点点小魔法，她当然非常关心这些……"
G["A little."]="偶尔会。"
G["A lively spirit for the taking..."]="送上门的灵魂……"
G["A living $r... soon to be a dead like me."]="$gUn:Una; $r... viviente será pronto un muerto como yo."
G["A living legend..."]="一个活生生的传说……"
G["A lone orc against the might of the Alliance???"]="区区一个兽人竟然想与联盟对抗？？？"
G["A long day in the fields makes a man thirsty, you know what I mean, good friend?"]="在地里干上一整天，谁都会渴，$g你:你;懂我的意思吧，好朋友？"
G["A long journey is best traveled one step at a time."]="不积跬步，无以至千里。"
G["A long time ago, during my travels, I met a man that told me, \"Master using it and you can have this.\"\n\nWhat do you suppose that means? I didn't know then, and I still don't now, really..."]="很久以前，在我旅途中遇到过一个人，他对我说：\"等你把它用得出神入化，这东西就归你了。\"\n\n你觉得那是什么意思？当时我不明白，老实说，到现在也还是不明白……"
G["A long time ago, this land was beset by the shadows of doubt, of fear, and hatred."]="很久很久以前，这片土地曾为猜忌、恐惧和仇恨的阴影所笼罩。"
G["A lot of the Tillers came here to watch the fights. Nothing like a good brawl and a cold brew!"]="许多阡陌客都赶来看比赛了。再没有比精彩的战斗和冰镇啤酒更棒的消遣了！"
G["A lot of work goes into training and caring for our animals, but it's all worth it.\n\nI could always use a bit of extra help, though."]="我们花费了大量精力训练和照料我们的动物们，但这一切都是值得的。\n\n尽管如此，有额外的帮手总是好的。"
G["A lot you know...\n\nSome say they're just observing, some think they're altering our sea-life, and then others think they're here to take over Azeroth!\n\nOnce I take one down with my rocket propelled warheads I'll get the answers. You can believe that!"]="你能听到许多关于不明物体的传说……\n\n有人说它们在观测冰洋，有人说它们试图改变海洋的生态系统，还有人认为它们是来接管艾泽拉斯世界的！\n\n等我用火箭推进弹头将它们打得粉碎，就能找到答案了。相信我！"
G["A loud chime sounds as the defense wards detect intruders, alerting the sentries."]="防御结界发现了入侵者，响起了刺耳的警报声。"
G["A low, despairing moan escapes the caged dwarf."]="笼中的矮人发出低沉而绝望的呻吟。"
G["A lowly worm, I'm sure."]="是啊，我是一只低级的爬虫。"
G["A luckydo would be wise to buy my wares. Bad fortune to those who simply walk away."]="聪明的幸运儿会来选购我的货物。只有倒霉蛋才会匆匆走开。"
G["A luckydo would be wise to throw kegs about now."]="幸运儿如果明智的话，就该掷桶了。"
G["A mage... you seek to learn the magic of portals, yes?"]="法师……你想学习传送魔法，是吗？"
G["A mailbox?  You have a letter to send, or perhaps have received one?  I hope it's something good!  There's a mailbox right outside of the Bank in the center of Darnassus."]="一个邮筒？你要发信，或者也许你要收一封信？我希望是个好消息！在达那苏斯中心银行外面就有一个邮箱。"
G["A mailbox? Well is that not the salt on the wounds! Twenty years cut-off from the world and now a mailbox! WONDERFUL!"]="哎哟，这里有个邮箱？啧啧，这算不得往伤口上撒盐！20年来与世隔绝，现在我们终于有邮箱了！棒绝人寰啊！"
G["A major victory, to be sure. We turn our attention now to our Gilnean homeland - ravaged by disease. Wrynn has pledged his help rebuilding my kingdom, but it is difficult to know where to begin."]="毫无疑问，这是一次大捷。现在，我们得将注意力放到我们在吉尔尼恩的家园——那个被瘟疫毁于一旦的地方。乌瑞恩已经保证会帮忙重建我的王国，但该从何处着手依然是个难题。"
G["A man can only live with himself and his shame for so long, $c, before he must take action to undo the mistakes he's made."]="$c，一个人在纠正了他所犯下的错误之前只能生活在羞耻中。"
G["A man must honor his family."]="人必须尊重他的家族。"
G["A mantid bomb?! Are you sure that won't bring down the whole cavern?"]="螳螂妖炸弹？！你确定这不会炸塌整座洞穴吗？"
G["A mantid tried to follow me here.\n\nIt didn't end well for him."]="一只螳螂妖试图跟踪我到这里。\n\n他的下场可不太好。"
G["A map of Darkshore.  I saw this place shortly before I arrived in Rut'theran Village."]="一张黑海岸的地图。在到达鲁瑟兰村之前不久我才见过这些地方。"
G["A massive attack with every able-bodied man would end in needless slaughter. Every soldier lost would rise as the enemy. Azeroth would be left defenseless against the undead threat."]="一场动员所有人参加的大规模攻击只会导致本可以避免的惨重伤亡。而每一名倒下的士兵都会变成敌人再爬起来。到那时候，艾泽拉斯将再没有力量对抗亡灵怪物的威胁。"
G["A massive demonic portal opens nearby!"]="一座巨大的恶魔传送门在附近开启了！"
G["A master of defense, the Illusionary Guardian deflects all attacks from the front. Stay behind it."]="作为防御大师，幻影守卫会偏转来自正面的所有攻击。绕到它背后去！"
G["A masterpiece! Feed it to the troll, Hordum. He'll answer any question truthfully...."]="大功告成！霍杜姆，让巨魔饮下这贴药剂。他会老老实实地回答所有问题的……"
G["A medic's work is never done."]="医生总得忙个不停。"
G["A member of the priesthood whom I've never seen before."]="我从未见过这家伙。"
G["A merciful kill!"]="可怜的家伙！"
G["A mere $C challenges me?  Prepare for the afterlife!"]="¿Acaso me está desafiando $gun:una; simple $c? ¡Prepárate para el más allá!"
G["A mere blip in the eyes of the Makers."]="只是造物主眼中的微小尘埃。"
G["A mere nuisance, I assure you!  Tell the Master his prisoner will not escape while Akama and his Deathsworn watch over her."]="一点小麻烦而已，我保证！请转告主人，阿卡玛和他手下的死誓者会尽心尽职地看守囚犯。"
G["A mere three hundred years ago, a reckless dwarf named Thaurissan summoned the master from his fiery realm. His return to this paltry world devastated the surrounding lands and created this volcanic Core. Mighty Ragnaros has slept under this mountain ever since."]="仅在三百年前，一个叫作索瑞森的鲁莽的矮人从他炽热的领地中召唤出了魔王。他重返这个卑微的世界吞噬了周围的田地并形成了这个火山之核。从那以后，强大的拉格纳罗斯就沉睡在了这座山下。"
G["A mere toy left by the usurper... you, too, are dust."]="不过是篡位者留下的小玩意儿……你们，也就是一小撮尘埃。"
G["A mess, that's what this is!  All of these creatures sprung up out of nowhere, and are running around out of control!  And where've the Magister, and his apprentices, run off to?  Leaving me here all alone without as much as a, \"Hello there Wyllithen, would you like to come with?\"\n\nThe nerve!"]="一塌糊涂，这就是现状！这些生物不知从哪儿冒出来，到处乱跑，完全失控！还有那位魔导师和他的学徒们跑哪儿去了？把我一个人扔在这儿，连句\"喂，威利森，要不要一起来？\"都没有。\n\n真是岂有此理！"
G["A message for anyone that would dare snitch on these criminals."]="用来警告任何胆敢告发这些罪犯的人。"
G["A messenger reached us from Brewnall Village this morning. The dwarves are sending a squad of mountaineers to help us."]="有位来自烈酒村的信使今早抵达了这里。矮人们正派出一支巡山人小队来帮我们。"
G["A mighty Qiraji known as General Rajaxx would command the initial incursion into Silithus. Only one would stand in his way: A night elf known as Staghelm. They refer to him as Khar'sis or 'hand of the earth' in the native Qiraji tongue."]="\"一位名叫拉贾克斯将军的强大其拉虫人将统领对希利苏斯的首轮入侵。唯有一人能挡住他：一位名叫鹿盔的暗夜精灵。在其拉虫人的母语中，他们称他为卡尔西斯，意即\"大地之手\"。\""
G["A mighty blow has been dealt to the Lich King! You have proven yourselves as able bodied champions of the Argent Crusade. Together we will strike against Icecrown Citadel and destroy what remains of the Scourge! There is no challenge that we cannot face united!"]="这是对巫妖王的一次重创！你的实力绝不亚于银色北伐军的勇士。很快，我们将携手攻入冰冠堡垒，消灭天灾军团的残余！只要心齐，我们必将胜利！"
G["A mighty blow!"]="沉重的一击！"
G["A million more await my orders. What chance do you have?"]="我的奴仆何止成千上万。你有什么机会战胜我？"
G["A miner?  Ye don't need to ask if $glad : lass;, only where!  Yarr is who yer looking for, and I think ye can find him hiding out over in Steelgrill's Depot."]="矿工？你不需要问有没有，$g小伙子:姑娘;，只需问在哪里！亚尔就是你要找的家伙，我想他应该在钢架补给站那里。"
G["A minnow? The oceans are filled with minnows! There could be a hundred million minnows out there!"]="米诺鱼？海里到处都是米诺鱼！有上亿条呢！"
G["A minor inconvenience."]="一点小麻烦。"
G["A minor victory..."]="微不足道的胜利……"
G["A minute is all I need. Wait, that came out all wrong."]="再给我一分钟就好。等等，那全错了。"
G["A mirror? How wonderful!"]="镜子？太棒了！"
G["A miserable defense from Light-swollen fools. Xi'ri, I will consume you myself!"]="就凭你这副可怜虫的模样还敢高谈阔论什么守护圣光？蠢货！克希利，我要消灭你！"
G["A mission?"]="任务？"
G["A moment I shall remember for always."]="我永远都会记住这一刻。"
G["A moment ago, you knelt as recruits..."]="不久前，你们还是新兵……"
G["A moment... just give me a moment."]="等一下……给我一点时间。"
G["A momentary flash of awareness fades quickly from the eyes of the %s."]="%s的眼睛里闪过一丝亮光，但很快又黯淡了。"
G["A monk's training never ceases. There is always a higher step to reach with both body and mind."]="武僧的训练永无竭日。总有身心合一的更高境界等待追寻。"
G["A monstrous force pulls you into the twilight realm!"]="一股诡异的力量将你拉入了暮光领域！"
G["A mook?! I don't speak to brutes. How dare you!"]="蠢货？！我可不和如此无礼的人说话。你怎么敢这样！"
G["A mop?  Really?"]="拖把？真的？"
G["A mortal dares peer into the eye! (Brave little plaything.) I see you, little one! You want to see what the Eye sees, do you? (Show it! Show it all!)"]="凡人竟敢偷窥这只眼睛！（勇敢的小玩具。）我看到你了！你想看看这眼睛看到的东西？（看看！给他们看看！）"
G["A mortal possessed of arcane and dark knowledge that none could surpass, he devised a method to enhance his summoning through the capture and use of souls untold.\n\nWhole civilizations were brought to extinction through his soul devices to fuel the ritual through which he and his conspirators would bring Murmur into their world."]="这位侥幸逃生的凡人在黑暗法术上的造诣无人能及。他设计出某种灵魂装置，利用它们捕获灵魂来强化召唤仪式。\n\n这位魔法师和他的同谋们为了将摩摩尔召唤到这个世界，不惜灭绝了数个氏族文明，夺取了他们的灵魂来推进仪式的进程。"
G["A most frustrating occurence."]="真是令人大失所望。"
G["A most productive day, today!\n\nThe chamber is indeed of ancient origin, and houses a magnificent mechanism which seems to be in disrepair.\n\nI will investigate further tomorrow.\n\nThis discovery will surely force Schnottz to take notice of me!\n\nHow could he deny me a promotion after something like this?"]="今天可真是成果丰硕！\n\n这座建筑果然有着古老的起源，里面还有年久失修的宏大装置。\n\n我明天再来详细调查一番。\n\n这个发现肯定会让Schnottz注意到我！\n\n经过这件事，他怎么能不嘉奖我呢？"
G["A mud-stained leaf..."]="一片沾泥的叶子……"
G["A name? Oh, yes, the name! I believe it was Iskalder."]="名字？对，他的名字！我记得是叫伊斯卡德尔。"
G["A nearby Gargoyle comes to life!"]="附近的石像鬼活过来了！"
G["A nearby group of Darkhatched Eggs begins to hatch!"]="附近有一组暗生之卵开始孵化了！"
G["A nearby group of Darkhatched Swarmlings has hatched!"]="附近的一群暗生幼嗣孵化了！"
G["A new Aspect of Magic has already been selected, Kalecgos."]="新的魔法守护者已经选定。"
G["A new age for mortals has dawned, and heroes like you are among the vanguard."]="凡人的新时代开始了，你这样的英雄是这个时代的先锋。"
G["A new continent full of forgotten secrets!  Share what you learn with the Lorewalkers here and me, and I'll let you in on some of my other projects."]="一片充满失落秘密的新大陆！跟这里的游学者和我分享你了解到的一切，我会让你参与到其它的项目中来。"
G["A new day dawns, my children! Soon the undead legions of Azjol-Nerub will rise and take over this world!"]="孩子们，又是新的一天！艾卓-尼鲁布的天灾军团很快就要征服这个世界了！"
G["A new enemy, Illusionary Flamecallers. They cast fireballs and spew lava. Use the lava to your advantage; it will burn the other illusions."]="有新的敌人来了，幻影召焰者。它们会施放火球术并喷吐岩浆。好好利用这些岩浆，它们能烧死其他幻影！"
G["A new host must be found."]="必须找到一个新的宿主。"
G["A new land overrun by evil horrors of this world. A new place for us to save."]="一片全新的土地正在遭受邪恶恐怖的侵蚀。一片全新的土地在等着我们去拯救。"
G["A new land, and you want to hunt boring old wolves?"]="一片全新的土地，可你还想继续狩猎无聊的老狼？"
G["A new student?\n\nYes, of course.\n\nYou come to me all bright-eyed and bob-tailed, thinking to take home a the great cloud serpent of the east.\n\nWell, you should consider the journey carefully.\n\nIt is not an easy path to take.\n\nThe Order only accepts students who have the potential to see their training through to the end."]="一名新学生？\n\n是啊，当然。\n\n你满怀热忱地来找我，一心想着把东方伟大的云端翔龙带回家。\n\n那么，$g你:你;应当仔细考虑这段旅程。\n\n这可不是一条轻松的路。\n\n本教团只接纳有潜力将修行坚持到底的学生。"
G["A new student? Ah yes, very good. Have you spoken to Elder Anli?"]="一名新学生？啊，很好。$g你:你;跟安莉长老谈过了吗？"
G["A new victim! Me was almost don wit dis one anyway."]="又一个白白牺牲的家伙！我几乎已经能让他开口了。"
G["A new world is coming, friends. But it is not the world of their design."]="新的世界即将到来，朋友们，但并不是他们设计的世界。"
G["A newcomer to Shattrath!  Make sure to drop by later.  We can always use a hand with the injured."]="¡$GUn forastero:una forastera; en Shattrath! Pásate más tarde por aquí. Siempre nos viene bien una mano con los heridos."
G["A nice catch it is at that! You bring honor to the Horde boy, we thank you!"]="干得好！你为部落带来了荣耀，我们感谢你！"
G["A noble effort... but it will take more than one of your puny stags to take down Galenges, the UNBREAKABLE!"]="你们的努力值得赞赏……但光凭你们这些小东西是打不倒盖伦格斯的！我是刀枪不入的！"
G["A noble request. It would be an honor, Erothem."]="一个高贵的请求。这是一种荣誉，艾罗塞姆。"
G["A note falls to the floor!"]="一张便笺掉在了地上！"
G["A pack of harpies came up from the valley. A big one named Sirana led them... I didn't have anywhere to escape. They haven't been this aggressive for a long time... I didn't expect it... I let my guard down.... it's my own fault."]="一群鹰身人突然冲出山谷。带领她们的是一只名叫希尔拉娜的鹰身人……我无路可逃。我不明白……她们为何变得如此具有攻击性……我放松了警惕……是我的失误。"
G["A pack of mechanical squirrels could mine faster than you!"]="机械松鼠都比你挖得快！"
G["A package changes hands between Pahu and the Longrunner, who packs it away safely."]="远行者从帕乌手中接过包裹，迅速将它藏了起来。"
G["A pact was made, $g brother:sister;! We vowed vengeance against the Lich King! For what he had done to us! We battled the Scourge as Forsaken, pushing them back into the Plaguelands and freeing Tirisifal! You and I were champions of the Forsaken!"]="我们立下了誓约，$g兄弟:姐妹;！我们发誓要向巫妖王复仇！为了他对我们所做的一切！我们以被遗忘者的身份与天灾作战，把他们赶回瘟疫之地，解放了提瑞斯法！你和我都曾是被遗忘者的勇士！"
G["A pair of Zandalari Trolls burst through the doors ahead of you!"]="两个赞达拉巨魔撞破房门，向你冲了过来！"
G["A pair of skilled miners fled plague-ridden Gilneas and made their way here. You'll find them in the Craftsmen's Terrace."]="有二个熟练的矿工从吉尔尼斯瘟疫中成功逃了出来，来到这里，你可以在工匠区找到他们。"
G["A paladin like Gidwin makes a fine death knight.  Any member of the Scourge powerful enough to defeat him would know that."]="像吉德文那样的圣骑士绝对是死亡骑士的好胚子。天灾军团任何强大到足以将他击败的成员都会看出这一点。"
G["A paladin! Slaying him would please the master. Attack!"]="一个圣骑士！杀死他的话，主人会很高兴的。进攻！"
G["A pandaren enigma, my young prince! A mystery in the mists."]="这是熊猫人的秘密，我的小王子！迷雾中的秘密。"
G["A pandaren legend is born! Sing praises to our new hero, $n!"]="¡Ha nacido una leyenda pandaren! ¡Gloria a nuestro nuevo héroe!"
G["A party? Can you believe it? A party and the whole island is about to explode?! What are they thinking!!!"]="一个聚会？你能相信吗？整座岛都要爆炸了，他们却在进行聚会？！他们到底在想什么！！！"
G["A pathetic hit. More brutality!"]="真是绵软无力。拿出点血性来！"
G["A perfect cut."]="完美的一击。"
G["A pestilence upon you!"]="感受这可怕的热疫吧！"
G["A piece of advice?  Never underestimate your foe, no matter how short, waddly, and heart-meltingly cute they might be."]="你问我有什么建议？永远不要低估你的对手，无论他们有多瘦小，多笨拙，或是多可爱。"
G["A piercing howl echoes through the hallways!"]="门厅中回荡着刺耳的嗥叫！"
G["A piercing warcry echos through the maul!"]="震耳欲聋的战吼在要塞中回荡！"
G["A pinch of dis... A dash of dat... Heh, heh!"]="对了，加一撮这个……放一把那个……嘿嘿，嘿嘿！"
G["A pitiful attempt."]="枉费力气。"
G["A pitiful skirmish! The Alliance fights without conviction."]="一场可笑的小冲突！联盟毫无战斗意志。"
G["A pleasure doing business with you as always, $g Mr. : Ms.; $n.\n\nHave a nice day."]="这么多？好吧，感谢你的光顾，$n$g先生:女士;。\n\n祝你好运。"
G["A pleasure!"]="很荣幸！"
G["A pleasure, $n. What can I do for you?"]="这是我的荣幸，$n。我能为你做些什么吗？"
G["A pleasure."]="你好。"
G["A pleasure... to serve the master."]="我很荣幸……为主人服务。"
G["A pool of dark moonlight appears nearby!"]="附近出现了一泓黑暗月光！"
G["A pool of moonlight appears to the east!"]="东边出现了一泓月光！"
G["A pool of moonlight appears to the north!"]="北边出现了一泓月光！"
G["A pool of moonlight appears to the south!"]="南边出现了一泓月光！"
G["A pool of moonlight appears to the west!"]="西边出现了一泓月光！"
G["A pool of moonlight appears!"]="一泓月光突然出现了！"
G["A pool pony in the nick of time!"]="小马泳圈出现得太及时了！"
G["A portion of this land already be mine, mon, but it only be da beginning!"]="朋友，我已经占领了这里的部分土地，但这仅仅是个开始！"
G["A potion to melt the elves? Maybe you'll need it, Forsaken. I have my mace to crush their skulls!"]="一瓶能够溶解精灵的药剂？也许你会需要这种玩意儿，被遗忘者。而我，会用我的锤子好好的给他们上一课！"
G["A powerful gem."]="一颗强大的宝石。"
G["A powerful human mage is rumored to live to the north; he keeps watch over the land for some unknown reason. I have not traveled there myself, but it is said that visitors are welcome and can even earn favor with him if they are willing to do errands for him."]="一个强大的人类魔法师传闻就在北部生活；他为了某种不为人知的原因一直在看守着那片大地。我自己没有亲自去过，但是据说访问者在那里很受欢迎，如果他们愿意为他办些差事的话甚至可以赢得他的好感。"
G["A precious barrel of Greenstone brew! Hurrah!"]="一桶珍贵的绿石佳酿！好哇！"
G["A presence approaches! Someone out there can hear me! But... it is no Klaxxi."]="有气息在逼近！有人能听见我说话！可……那不是卡拉克西。"
G["A pretty flower for me? Oh stop."]="这朵漂亮的花是给我的吗？噢，等等。"
G["A priestess by the name of Laurna Morninglight calls Dolanaar home.  I believe she can be found just north of the Inn."]="一位名叫劳尔娜·晨光的女祭司住在多兰纳尔，我认为你可以在旅店北面找到她。"
G["A priestess of Azshara! Could she be leading their efforts?"]="一名艾萨拉的女祭司！难道是她在统率他们吗？"
G["A prisoner has escaped!  Slay $g him:her;!"]="¡Ha escapado $gun prisionero:una prisionera;! ¡$gMatadlo:Matadla;!"
G["A product of your own insolence."]="这一切都是因为你的傲慢。"
G["A profession trainer"]="专业训练师"
G["A protector has fallen. The World's Heart lies exposed!"]="保护者倒下了。世界之心暴露了！"
G["A provisioner's work is never done. The Shado-Pan marches on its stomach.\n\nAnd, to some extent, its liver."]="供给官的活儿永远干不完。影踪派正向它的胃部进军。\n\n接着，将进入它的肝脏。"
G["A pure sample would be one that's uncorrupted by unintentional influences. We need to find the creatures in the most basic, normal environment we can.\n\nThat means somewhere devoid of civilization or the effects of the dominant races of Azeroth. Someplace... untouched."]="一个纯净的样品就是在非故意情况下未被腐蚀的样品。我们需要尽可能在最基本，最正常的环境中找到这样的生物。\n\n这意味着某个全无文明痕迹或是未受艾泽拉斯某个种族所影响的地方。某块……处女地。"
G["A quick trip to the underworld for you, and a laugh for me. Sounds like a fair trade!"]="我送你一条通往地狱的捷径，而你让我消遣一番。听上去挺公平的！"
G["A radish for sweet little Ella? Well, I sure can spare one. Here you go."]="可爱的小艾拉要一根萝卜？是的，我肯定能让出一根。给你。"
G["A ramp leads up to just outside Krasus' Landing in the eastern sewers."]="东部下水道有一条直通克拉苏斯平台的斜道。"
G["A ramp leads up to near the Violet Citadel in the western sewers."]="西部下水道有一条通往紫罗兰城堡附近的斜道。"
G["A rare find, indeed.\n\n<Mathredis nods.>\n\n If you wish to continue, I will need the components."]="确实是一项难得的发现。\n\n<玛瑟迪斯点了点头。>\n\n如果你希望继续的话，我会需要相应的材料。"
G["A recent event, obscured by powerful magics, remains masked even to me..."]="一个刚刚发生的事件，掩没于强大的魔法中，即便对我来说也很神秘……"
G["A restful sleep is sure to be had in the beds which Innkeeper Keldamyr keeps at the Inn in Dolanaar."]="你可以在多兰纳尔旅店的老板凯达米尔提供的床上安稳地睡一觉。"
G["A rider approaches."]="有骑兵来了。"
G["A right deadly machine, that is. Best watch yer step down here, heroes."]="真是个暴躁的家伙。你们最好小心点，英雄们。"
G["A rogue bomb from the battle flew towards us. I survived, but...my husband..."]="一枚该死的炸弹朝我们袭来。我没死，可……我丈夫……"
G["A rogue?  Hmmm... well, I've heard that Keryn Sylvius hangs around those shady types.  You might want to talk to her and see what you can learn."]="一个潜行者？嗯……我曾听说过那个科瑞恩·塞尔留斯在那些阴暗的地方游荡。找她谈谈，看看你能学到点什么。"
G["A rogue?  I'm not in the habit of referring people to those types, but I believe Jannok would be the one you're looking for.  You will find him at the Inn in Dolanaar."]="潜行者？我不习惯跟那些家伙打交道，但我相信詹诺克就是你要找的训练师。你可以在多兰纳尔的旅店找到他。"
G["A rune on %s begins to glow brightly!"]="%s身上的符文突然散发出明亮的光芒！"
G["A sacrifice for you, master."]="主人，请收下祭品。"
G["A sacrifice will be due if I am ever called upon, mortal..."]="一旦我被召唤出来，就会有人牺牲，凡人。"
G["A sad tale, that one - a wee bit embarrassin' too.\n\nMy people be know fer havin' a taste fer the ale, ya know. And I be no exception. Seems I been given more than me share of the thirst.\n\nSo I run inta ol' Budd ya see, an' he offers me all the grog I can swallow fer joinin' his crew - a move I've come to regret.\n\nOne night, after drinkin' enough grog to drop a Kodo, I was lured into followin' Budd's band o' misfits into Zul'Aman.\n\nThat be the last I recall before findin' meself in that cage."]="那是个伤心的故事——还有几分尴尬。\n\n矮人嗜酒如命可是众所周知的事。我自然也不例外，而且我对美酒的喜爱程度完全超越了我的想象。\n\n就这样，我遇见了巴德。他说只要我愿意加入探险队，就能尽情享受所有的美酒。我经受不了诱惑，做出了令我后悔至今的决定。\n\n那天晚上，我喝下足以放倒一头科多兽的烈酒之后，跟随巴德的杂牌探险队进入了祖阿曼。\n\n待我清醒时，发现自己已经沦为囚犯了。"
G["A saronite barrier appears around General Vezax!"]="一道萨隆邪铁屏障环绕着维扎克斯将军！"
G["A scout found the remains of your journal in Thor Modan. We've been looking for you ever since."]="有个斥候在索尔莫丹发现了这本日记的剩余部分。从那时起，我们就开始寻找你的下落了。"
G["A screeching cry pierces the air above!"]="一声尖叫直入云霄！"
G["A search of the corpse's clothing and equipment reveals the insignia you need, undamaged by the battle and foul environment."]="翻遍血骑士的尸体之后，你找到了那枚徽章。它并没有因为战争和周围的环境而受到任何损伤。"
G["A secret passage has opened beneath the platform, this way!"]="这台子底下有个秘密通道，来这边！"
G["A self-inflicted wound, friend.  I could not bear to look upon a world where I'd committed so many horrors under the Lich King's grasp.\n\nIt was my first step towards redemption, and if my sins are unforgivable, then I will attempt to atone for them for the rest of my life."]="Una herida que me infligí, $gamigo:amiga;. No podía soportar ver un mundo en el que yo había cometido tantos horrores bajo la presión del Rey Exánime.\n\nFue mi primer paso hacia la redención, y si mis pecados son imperdonables, entonces intentaré compensarlos durante el resto de mi vida."
G["A shadowy figure appears in the ship's cabin!"]="船舱里出现一个模糊的人影！"
G["A shadowy, sinister presence has invaded the Emerald Dream. Its power is poised to spill over into our world, $n. We must oppose it! That's why I cannot accompany you in person."]="一个阴暗而险恶的幽魂正在侵袭翡翠梦境。它的力量正迅速向我们的世界中蔓延，$n。我们必须对抗它，这也是我不能亲自陪伴你们作战的原因。"
G["A shallow and tragic victory. We are weaker as a whole from the losses suffered today. Who but the Lich King could benefit from such foolishness? Great warriors have lost their lives. And for what? The true threat looms ahead - the Lich King awaits us all in death."]="肤浅且可悲的胜利。今天的内耗让我们又一次被削弱了。这种愚蠢的行为只能让巫妖王受益！伟大的战士们就这样白白牺牲，而真正的威胁却步步逼近。巫妖王正计算着我们的死期。"
G["A shaman trainer?  Not here in Goldshire.\n\nBut the Wildhammer dwarves in Stormwind's Dwarven District may be able to help you out."]="萨满训练师？闪金镇可没有这种人。\n\n不过暴风城矮人区的蛮锤矮人也许能帮助你。"
G["A shaman...?\nThere's a rather rough-looking dwarven lass staying in Theramore's inn; I believe she came to visit an old friend of hers here.\nShe might be able to help you."]="萨满……？\n\n塞拉摩的旅店里住着一位看上去挺粗犷的矮人姑娘；我想她是来这儿看望一位老朋友的。\n\n她也许能帮上你的忙。"
G["A shame. I could use a bit of rest.\n\nNo matter. Tell Nazgrim that I will accompany the party."]="真丢人。我得休息一会儿了。\n\n没关系，你去告诉纳兹戈林，我会跟上队伍的。"
G["A ship runs between here and Westguard Keep, sometimes ferrying troops and the occasional passenger but most often carrying much-needed supplies."]="这里与西部卫戍要塞有船运往来，有时军队和商旅队会搭乘船只，但是大多数时候都是运送急需的补给品。"
G["A show of might on these shores will make the pandaren think twice about joining the Alliance."]="在这里展示一下力量，就能让熊猫人对加入联盟产生疑虑。"
G["A similar fate befell all that would die to the Scourge war machine."]="被天灾的战争机器杀死的每个人都遭遇了同样的厄运。"
G["A simple enough task to break this soulstone!"]="击碎这块灵魂石简直是小事一桩！"
G["A simple flesh wound won't keep me from the battle."]="一点皮肉伤而已，轻伤不下火线嘛。"
G["A simple practical joke."]="一个简单而好笑的笑话。"
G["A simple spark can mean the difference between life...and death."]="一个小小的火花就决定了生……或是死。"
G["A single cut should do."]="只需一刀就够了。"
G["A single drop of coconut milk leaks out of A-Me 01's eye as she takes one long, last look at Wooga."]="A-Me 01最后凝望了乌嘎一眼，一滴椰奶从她的眼睛里流出来。"
G["A single general remains. You must make haste!"]="只剩下一名将军了。你们必须赶快！"
G["A single prong. Hardly enough to stop me from slaughtering hundreds more."]="一把叉子可不能阻止我再杀掉成百上千的敌人。"
G["A skunk! Eeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeew! Don't touch me!"]="一只臭鼬！啊…………！不要碰我！"
G["A skunk, rabbit, and a fawn travelling together.  Now that's something you don't see every day.  No matter, I'll be dining on venison tonight!"]="啧啧，臭鼬、小白兔和小鹿结伴出游。这样的场景还真是少见啊。不过我的晚餐倒是有着落了！难得的野味啊！"
G["A slippery tile causes you to lose your footing."]="光滑的地面让你无法站稳。"
G["A small fee for supplies is required."]="为物资支付一些费用是必需的。"
G["A small group of us, druids and sentinels, have come to aid the tauren of Freewind Post with our common enemy: the Grimtotem Clan."]="我们的一些德鲁伊和斥候组成了一支小队伍，前来援助乱风岗的牛头人，对抗我们共同的敌人：恐怖图腾部族。"
G["A small moonwell arises from the droplets of the chalice."]="圣杯的一小滴液体形成了一小口月亮井。"
G["A smart fighter knows when retreat is the best option."]="聪明的斗士知道该在什么时候抽身退出。"
G["A soft hum ceases as the corruption creating new Puddles ebbs away with the death of the final Aqueous Defender."]="随着最后一位液态防御者的死亡，柔和的嗡鸣声停止了，腐化物也不再生成新的软泥怪。"
G["A soldier could get into a lot of trouble in a town like this.\n\nA lot of trouble."]="一位士兵在这样的城镇里能惹上许多麻烦。\n\n许多麻烦。"
G["A soldier's duty is never done."]="战士的责任是永无止尽的。"
G["A song?"]="歌谣？"
G["A sorrowful howling floats through the forest."]="森林中回荡着悲伤的低吼。"
G["A soul fragment merges souls with the Harbinger of Darkness!"]="黑暗先驱吞噬了灵魂碎块，获取了灵魂能量！"
G["A special project... an artifact for Cho'gall."]="那是一件特殊的东西……一件古加尔所需要的东西。"
G["A spirit appears to avenge the Crystalsong Oak!"]="一个灵魂现身了，它要为晶歌森林橡树复仇！"
G["A spring-loaded plunger with blades attached, for processing food. Or people you disagree with."]="一只用弹簧带动的活塞，上面绑着刀刃，用来处理食物。或者是一些和你意见不一的人。"
G["A squire is the right hand of the knight.  As you are already fully aware, hands are especially good at carrying things, and thus your first duty will be to carry my sundries, knickknacks, and other miscellaneous paraphernalia while I dispense justice across the land.  To lug around such etcetera is a job unbefitting of a knight."]="侍从是骑士的左右手。要知道，手应该特别擅长于搬运东西，所以你的第一个任务就是负责搬运我的杂物、小东西和其它各种随身用具。这样我才能放心地在世界各处维护正义。毕竟搬运杂物可不是骑士应该做的事情。"
G["A stack of papers and schematics are strewn here."]="这里散乱着放着一堆堆的图纸和设计图。"
G["A stain is about to ruin the deck!"]="污点会毁了甲板！"
G["A stake has been driven into the rock, and a long braid of rope draped around it.\n\nThis must have some purpose."]="一块肉排被敲进了石头里，周围还垂着一大段绳子。\n\n这肯定有什么用途。"
G["A staple of the Thorium Brotherhood.\n\nArcanite crystals are harvested from rich thorium lodes. Through the alchemical prowess of powerful alchemists, arcanite bars are born.\n\nSeek out a miner, if you aren't one... and find a good alchemist! You'll need both."]="瑟银兄弟会。\n\n奥术水晶是从富瑟银矿脉中采集的。通过强大的炼金师的威力，奥金诞生了。\n\n找出一个矿工，如果你不是的话……还有找到一个出色的炼金术士！你两样都会需要的。"
G["A startled hozen leaps out of a nearby bush!"]="一只受惊的猢狲从附近的灌木丛中跳了出来！"
G["A stick!"]="一根棍子！"
G["A storm approaches."]="风暴即将来临。"
G["A storm is brewing near the Lightning Pillar.  Beware!"]="闪电之柱附近正在酝酿一场风暴。小心！"
G["A strange mood has come over the city, $c. The people are afraid of something and many have gone missing. We must get to the bottom of it."]="$c，这座城市中弥漫着一种奇怪的气氛。人们都在害怕着什么。还有许多人失踪了。我们必须将这些谜团查清楚。"
G["A strange request, $r, but after what you have done for our prince it would be wrong of me to deny you."]="真是个奇怪的请求，$r，但鉴于你为我们的亲王所做的一切，我没理由回绝你。"
G["A stranger? Here? Don't start any trouble in our town."]="¿$GUn:Una; $gforastero:forastera;? ¿Aquí? No armes jaleos en nuestra ciudad."
G["A stranger? Well look at that. I wonder where it came from."]="¿Un $gforastero:forastera;? Fíjate. Me pregunto de dónde viene."
G["A stray bomb from the firefight destroyed my farm. How am I supposed to survive like this?"]="一颗不长眼的炸弹击毁了我的农场。我该怎么生活下去？"
G["A stray jolt from the Foe Reaper has disrupted the foundry controls!"]="死神的晃动干扰了铸造控制装置！"
G["A strong weapon is no good if you don't live long enough to wield it, $c."]="如果你没法保证自己能活下来，那么再强的武器对你来说也毫无意义，$c。"
G["A studious rider is a successful rider."]="一个勤奋的骑士就是一个成功的骑士。"
G["A successful test!  $n, this indurium is some amazing stuff."]="试验很成功！$n，精铁真是一种神奇的原料。"
G["A surprising twist!"]="惊人的转折！"
G["A swarm of Mantid appear from nearby and attack!"]="一大群螳螂妖在附近出现，并开始发动攻击！"
G["A swift slice to the throat, and this one falls like any other."]="见血封喉，一命归西。"
G["A sword is the weapon of a warrior, but patience is the weapon of kings."]="战士的武器是利剑，而国王的武器则是耐心。"
G["A tailor is it?  Well, if you hang out here long enough you'll eventually hear word of mouth about Georgio Bolero.  He's been setting the trends for some months now.  If you wish to learn from him, you can find him over in the Mage Quarter in the outer rim."]="一个裁缝是吗？哦，如果你在这儿呆的时间够长你就会最终听到关于乔吉奥·波利罗的谈论。他现在已经领导潮流几个月了。如果你希望跟他学习，你能在法师区的外圈找到他。"
G["A tailor, eh? Very well. What would you like to learn about, tailor?"]="¿$gSastre:Sastra;, eh? Muy bien. ¿Sobre qué te gustaría aprender, $gsastre:sastra;?"
G["A task presses upon me, but I do not have the time to take care of it myself. Can I entrust you with it?"]="我有一项紧急的工作，但我自己没有时间处理。我可以把它交给你吗？"
G["A taste... just a small taste... of the Spell-Weaver's power!"]="稍微见识见识吧……见识一下织法者的真正力量！"
G["A terrible and costly mistake you have made. It is not my time, mortals."]="你犯下了一个可怕的大错误。这浪费的可不是我的时间，凡人。"
G["A terrible change comes over the %s as he cackles maniacally."]="%s发出狂笑，身体产生了可怕的变化。"
G["A terrible change comes over the %s as she cackles maniacally."]="%s发出狂笑，身体产生了可怕的变化。"
G["A terrible, dark energy emanates from this pile of skulls."]="骨堆中弥漫出一股恐怖的黑暗能量。"
G["A test! A trial of patience. Will the wolf behave as a warrior... or a King?"]="这是一场耐心的试炼。狼群之首究竟是野兽，还是国王？"
G["A thick red slash has been drawn across the words WANTED: Deathclaw.  \"This bounty has been claimed by the heroic $n, who has overcome the fearsome beast,\" declares more writing in the same red ink."]="通缉：死爪这几个字上被粗粗划了一道红痕。同一支红笔还写着：\"这份悬赏已由英勇的 $n 领取，那头可怕的野兽已被制伏。\""
G["A thief!!"]="有贼！！"
G["A thorn?  And I left my tweezers at home."]="一根刺？可我把镊子丢在家里了。"
G["A thousand and one ways that all spell out your demise!"]="无数的征兆都清楚地说明，你死定了！"
G["A thousand curses upon you, $r!  This prison will not hold me for long!"]="无尽的诅咒等待着你，$r！这座监狱再也关不住我了！"
G["A thousand deaths..."]="被无情地杀戮……"
G["A thousand deaths...."]="被无情地杀戮……"
G["A thousand lifetimes ago, I brought the waters here. A gift to the Pearlfin for ancient deeds."]="千次轮回之前，我将水带到了这里。那是一份送给珠鳍锦鱼人的礼物，源自一个古老的约定。"
G["A thousand more like him exist. Ten thousand. Should one fall, another will rise to take the seat of power."]="一千个像他一样的人存在着。一万个。如果一个倒下了，另一个会起来争夺权力的宝座。"
G["A thousand years ago, the immortal elves, demigods of the forest and dragons fought against the Legion on the slopes of Hyjal."]="一千年以前，不朽的暗夜精灵、森林中的半神和巨龙曾并肩在海加尔山上对抗燃烧军团。"
G["A thousand years ago, when the War of the Shifting Sands ended, three of our kin sacrificed themselves and held the Qiraji inside these halls while Anachronos and Staghelm sealed Ahn'Qiraj shut.\n\nEach of us vowed to look for Merithra, Arygos and Caelestrasz should the Scarab Wall ever fall.\n\nAnd fall it did... and so we came."]="一千年前，阿纳克洛斯和鹿盔封印安其拉大门时，三位族人牺牲了自己的性命，将其拉虫人禁锢在这些大墙内，流沙之战宣告结束。\n\n他们曾立下誓言，一旦甲虫之墙开启，他们就将召唤麦琳瑟拉、阿瑞苟斯和凯雷斯特拉兹。\n\n因此……我们来了。"
G["A thousand-thousand lives I will sacrifice for you, my lord."]="主人，我会为你献上成千上万的生命。"
G["A thousand-thousand pardons, Master! I will deal with these intruders myself!"]="我乞求您的宽恕，主人！我一定会亲手解决入侵者的！"
G["A thousand? For one man?"]="一千个？对付一个人？"
G["A thousssand fangsss gonna rend your flesh!"]="你的血肉将被千万颗利齿撕咬！"
G["A thunderous voice bellows from the stone...\n\nGreetings, commander.  What news of Silithus do you bring the Lords of the Council?"]="一个雷鸣般的声音从石头中传出……\n\n你好，指挥官。你给议会领主们带来了希利苏斯的什么消息？"
G["A thunderous voice bellows from the stone...\n\nI sense your Medallion of Station, cultist, but you have no ring of lordship?  Are you truly a commander of the Twilight's Hammer, or do you merely run errands for your betters?"]="一个雷鸣般的声音从石头中传出……\n\n邪教徒，我感应到了你的身份徽章，可你却没有领主之戒？$g你:你;当真是暮光之锤的指挥官，还是只是在给$g你:你;的上司跑腿？"
G["A thunderous voice bellows from the stone...\n\nWhat is this?  I sense a little cultist scurrying about!  Run along, vermin, or face the wrath of the lords of the Council!"]="从石头中传来雷霆般的声音……\n\n这是什么？我感觉到一个小小的信徒在窜来窜去！快点走开，苦力，否则你将面对议会领主的愤怒！"
G["A time consuming, yet rewarding skill.  Speak with Astaia in the Tradesman's Terrace and maybe you'll learn something useful."]="它是一项耗时，但是会很有收获的技能。与贸易区的阿斯坦娅谈谈或许你能学到一些有用的东西。"
G["A total victory! Thanks to your resourcefulness and efficiency, we didn't lose a single soul. Accept this reward, along with my sincere gratitude."]="完胜！多亏了你的机智和高效，我方无一伤亡。接受这份奖励，以及我诚挚的谢意。"
G["A totem is failing! You must reactivate it!"]="一个图腾失效了！你必须重新激活它！"
G["A tradesman, perhaps? You need look no further than I for supplies. My prices are quite fair, friend. These items were difficult to acquire, but what does the source matter, eh? You'll have what you need."]="想找商人？要买补给，找我就够了。我的价钱很公道，朋友。这些东西可不容易弄到手，不过来源又有什么关系呢，对吧？$g你:你;需要什么，我这儿都有。"
G["A treasure hunter's life is a treacherous one. Don't be foolin' yerself."]="财宝猎人的人生中充满了背叛与欺骗。别再犯傻了。"
G["A treasure trove of knowledge, ripe for the taking!"]="知识的宝库，唾手可及！"
G["A trio of ethereal technomancers has set up shop in Orgrimmar, along the eastern Drag.\nLook for the weird machinery and purple lights... you can't miss it.\nThey offer just the sort of services you're looking for."]="三名虚灵奥术技师在奥格瑞玛的暗巷区东侧开了间铺子。\n\n找那些古怪的机械和紫色的灯光……你绝不会错过。\n\n他们提供的正是你要找的那类服务。"
G["A trio of ethereal technomancers has set up shop in Stormwind, along the canal south of Cathedral Square.\n\"The Three Winds,\" it's called. Look for the weird machinery and purple lights... you can't miss it.\nThey offer just the sort of services you're looking for."]="三名虚灵奥术技师在暴风城大教堂广场南面的运河边开了间铺子。\n\n那地方叫\"三风\"。找那些古怪的机械和紫色的灯光……你绝不会错过。\n\n他们提供的正是你要找的那类服务。"
G["A truck that delivers ice-cream. With a catapult."]="投石车冰激淋快送。"
G["A true fighter never enters a battle unprepared."]="真正的斗士决不会鲁莽应战。"
G["A true professional know his limitations, and I'm not ashamed to admit that your skills exceed mine. I want you to pay a visit to Kitta Firewind at the Tower of Azora. She is well-renowned, and with good reason."]="一个真正的专家知道他的局限，而我并不羞于承认你的技能超越了我。我想让你到阿祖拉之塔拜访基塔·费温德。她很有声誉。"
G["A true warrior does not stop in a battle to talk with his allies! Send these monstrosities back to their graves!"]="真正的战士不会停止杀戮！我没功夫和你闲聊！将这些怪物送回坟墓去吧！"
G["A tunnel leads out to the bottom of the city in the western sewers, just north of the Cantrips and Crows Tavern.\n\nSome of the more adventurous sorts use it to fly in and out of Dalaran."]="西部下水道设有通往城市底层的隧道，就在咒语和乌鸦旅店以北。\n\n有些喜欢冒险的旅客会从隧道进出达拉然。"
G["A valiant defense, but this city must be razed. I will fulfill Malygos's wishes myself!"]="真是一群英勇的卫兵，但这座城市必须被夷平。我要亲自执行玛里苟斯大人的指令！"
G["A valiant effort, but not enough.  Speak to me when you are ready to try again."]="一次勇敢的尝试，可还远远不够。等你准备好重试之后，再来与我交谈。"
G["A valuable skill First Aid is.  Our resident trainer, Nissa Firestone, can show ye how it's done.  Look for her on the southern side of The Great Forge at the Ironforge Physician."]="急救是一种有价值的技能。我们的常住的培训师，尼莎·火石，会教你该怎么做。到大熔炉南边的铁炉堡医师协会可以找到她。"
G["A very distinct scent.  There doesn't appear to be anything like it in the direct area."]="一种特别的气味。附近区域里没有东西会发出这种味道。"
G["A very good question, $c. When last I had heard, the Alliance had managed to smelt $1997w out of $1998w copper bars, $2002w out of $2003w iron bars and $2011w out of $2012w thorium bars needed for the war effort."]="问得好，$c。联盟共需要$1998w块铜锭、$2003w块铁锭和$2012w块瑟银锭。到目前为止，他们已经设法收集到$1997w块铜锭、$2002w块铁锭和$2011w块瑟银锭了。"
G["A very sad tale. Thank you, spirit."]="很悲伤的故事。谢谢你，灵魂。"
G["A very strange race, indeed."]="真是个奇怪的种族。"
G["A vicious guard dog appears!"]="一条凶狠的看门狗出现了！"
G["A vision of Ysera materializes before you."]="伊瑟拉的幻象在你面前逐渐变得清晰真实。"
G["A walk always goes faster when you have a friendly $r $c by your side."]="Los paseos siempre se hacen más llevaderos caminando al lado de $gun:una; $r $c."
G["A walk? Sure!"]="走走？好啊！"
G["A war we did not have until you arrived!"]="在你们来之前，我们根本与世无争！"
G["A warlock! He couldn't have ported far - there must be another base."]="是个术士！他不可能传送很远——肯定还有其它基地。"
G["A warlock, eh...  Well, if you've got a mind to be doing that sort of thing around here then ye best keep yer demons on a leash $gboyo : girlie;.  I don't like demons, but I love putting mah axe to them.  Ye get me?  \nNow you just leave me be and go get lost in The Forlorn Cavern.  That's where you'll find that warlock, Thistleheart."]="术士，是吧……要是你打算在这一带干那种事，最好把你的恶魔拴紧点，$g小子:丫头;。我不喜欢恶魔，但我最爱拿斧子劈它们。你明白我的意思吧？ \n\n现在别烦我了，迷路也去荒弃洞穴迷路吧。那个术士蓟心就在那儿。"
G["A warlock?  Well, if I was a warlock, I would probably be in the darkest place around here... which would be the Lion's Pride Inn basement.  That's where you should look first."]="一个术士？好吧，如果我是一个术士，我可能会待在这附近最黑暗的地方……那就是狮王之傲旅店的地下室。你应该先到那里去看看。"
G["A warm tavern and a cold ale. What more could we ask for?"]="暖和的旅店，冰爽的麦酒。我们还能要求什么呢？"
G["A warrior like Garrosh comes to power with something to prove."]="让加尔鲁什这样的战士上台本身就说明了——"
G["A warrior's death."]="一个战士的……死。"
G["A waste of flesh."]="真是对生命的浪费。"
G["A waste of my time."]="真是浪费我的时间。"
G["A waste of my time..."]="只是在浪费我的时间……"
G["A wave of sickness rushed through me. After the ritual was over, I ran home to my children. I gathered what belongings I could carry in my arms and left with my boys. We ran to the hills and hid. There really was no other option...\n\nNot a day goes by that I don't think of the cut. It has taken 20 years to reconnect with the elements. It has taken 20 years for the elements to even begin to heal."]="一股厌恶直涌上我的喉头。在仪式结束后。我跑回了家，回到了我的孩子身边。我带上了可以带上的一切，和我的儿子们一起离开了。我们跑到山上躲了起来。我真的别无选择……\n\n那些日子里，刺痛从没有消失过。二十年后，元素与大地的连接才得以恢复。当元素开始治愈时，又是一个二十年过去了。"
G["A wave of |cFF00dc29Sik'thik Swarmers|r and a |cFF815d18Sik'thik Warrior|r joins the battle."]="一波|cFF00dc29希克提克虫群|r和|cFF815d18希克提克战士|r加入了战斗。"
G["A wave of |cFF00dc29Sik'thik Swarmers|r joins the battle."]="一波|cFF00dc29希克提克虫群|r加入了战斗。"
G["A wave of |cFFB600B8Sik'thik Demolishers|r and a |cFF815d18Sik'thik Warrior|r joins the battle."]="一波|cFFB600B8希克提克毁灭者|r和|cFF815d18希克提克战士|r加入了战斗。"
G["A wave of |cFFB600B8Sik'thik Demolishers|r joins the battle."]="一波|cFFB600B8希克提克毁灭者|r加入了战斗。"
G["A weapon should be an extension of the fighter. Take care of it as you would yourself and it will never let you down."]="武器应该是战士身体的一部分。像爱惜你自己一样，爱惜你的武器，它就不会让你失望。"
G["A wedding, eh? If that doesn't bring this bunch together, I'll eat my hammer!\n\nWe need to make sure this wedding is spectacular, $n, and we're going to need your help. There's an old Wildhammer saying... let me think... how does it go?"]="一场婚礼，是吧？这要是还不能把大伙儿凑到一块儿，我就把我的锤子吃下去！\n\n我们得确保这场婚礼办得风风光光，$n，而我们需要你帮忙。蛮锤有一句老话……让我想想……是怎么说的来着？"
