G["Abandon Wrathguard"]="放弃愤怒卫士"
G["Abandon all hope! The Legion has returned to finish what was begun so many years ago. This time, there will be no escape!"]="放弃所有希望吧！燃烧军团要完成这许多年前就注定的使命。这一次，一切都无可挽回了!"
G["Abandon all hope."]="放弃希望吧。"
G["Abandon the dig? Ridiculous! In my long industrious career, I've never abandoned a site. Not intentionally. Misplaced a few, maybe. Who are you again? What are we doing here?"]="放弃挖掘？这太荒谬了！在我漫长而勤勉的一生中，我还从没有放弃过一个发掘点。也许我有勘探错误的时候，但从不曾有意放弃过任何值得挖掘的地方。你又是谁？我们在这里做什么？"
G["Abandon the port? Has Mor'ghor beaten all the sense out of you? This attack is our best opportunity to take our destiny into our own - wait! Here comes $n from the Horde!"]="放弃港口？莫格霍尔把你的理智都打没了吗？这次攻击是我们夺回命运掌控权的最好机会——等等！让我们先见见来自部落的$n！"
G["Abandoned? Oh heavens no! Uncle Gao is in charge while the others are beyond the wall. Isn't that exciting?"]="没人管？天哪，才不是呢！高老伯是负责人，其他人都在长城那边呢。很了不起吧？"
G["Abbendis is nothing but a harlot and Grand Admiral Westwind is selling her cheap like he sold us out!"]="阿比迪斯就是个臭婊子！海军上将巴利·韦斯温也不过是个皮条客，他以低廉的价格出卖了阿比迪斯，就像出卖我们一样！"
G["Abbendis will return, and I will be waiting for her!  SHE WILL COME BACK FOR US!"]="阿比迪斯会回来的，我会一直等待她的归来！为了我们，她一定会回来的！"
G["Abbendis will see you purged!"]="阿比迪斯大人将会净化你！"
G["Abe, get below deck and hide. Everyone else, keep watch and be ready for an attack."]="埃比，到甲板下面藏好。其他人加强戒备，准备迎战。"
G["Aber?  Is that you...?  Oh...I'm so hungry, Aber!  SO HUNGRY!!"]="亚伯？是你吗？啊……我很饿，亚伯！我饿啊！！"
G["Abomination Guts!"]="憎恶之物！"
G["Abomination spotted! 5th Battalion, let's mount up and engage them!"]="发现憎恶！第5营，让我们去教训教训他们吧！"
G["Abomination, I require your assitance!"]="憎恶，我需要你的帮助！"
