G["About damn time someone came. What took you so long? Ah, nevermind. Cover me, soldier. I gotta make it back to base!"]="你来的真是时候。怎么耽搁了这么久？啊，没关系。掩护我，士兵。我必须返回基地！"
G["About five months ago, the Venture Co.'s Stranglethorn division got their hands on a special poison from a shady merchant in Booty Bay named Crank Fizzlebub. Fizzlebub had apparently stolen the poison from Zanzil!\n\nYes, Zanzil the Outcast - the troll that was exiled from his own tribe due to the nature of his 'experiments' in necromancy.\n\nNaturally, once they had the poison, they proceeded to test it on each other. The results were disastrous."]="大约五个月之前，风险投资公司荆棘谷分公司从藏宝海湾的一个名叫克兰克·菲兹巴布的神秘商人那里买了一瓶特别的毒药。显然，那是从赞吉尔手中偷来的！\n\n没错，我说的就是那个被流放的赞吉尔，他因为研究亡灵巫术而被他的部族赶了出去。\n\n那帮荆棘谷分公司的家伙拿到毒药之后就开始互相实验，结果可想而知。"
G["About that ghost revealer.  Did I happen to leave it here?  I seem to be missing it."]="关于幽灵显形器。我是不是把它放这儿了？要么就是我把它给弄丢了……"
G["About that sparring match you suggested..."]="关于你们提议的比试……"
G["About time someone challenged Zhi-Zhi!"]="总算有人来挑战齐齐了！"
G["About time someone killed the wretch."]="有人杀死了那个可怜的家伙。"
G["About time the guild sent some new blood our way! Too bad you came all this way for nothing. We're not allowed to put on a show for our guests, can you believe it? Moroes has forbidden us from starting a new show, and my backers are going nuts! Something needs to be done about Moroes."]="是时间让公会派点新鲜血液给我们了！真不巧，你们辛辛苦苦来到这里，却什么都看不到。我们被禁止为客人们表演了，你能相信吗？莫罗斯禁止我们进行新的演出，我的支持者们都要发狂了！我们必须对莫罗斯做点什么了。"
G["About time you showed me some results! Now I'll show you results!"]="你那时给我看了某些结果！现在该我给你看看结果了！"
G["About time you showed up!  That forge has been busted for almost an hour!"]="你总算露面了！那座熔炉已经坏掉快一小时了！"
G["About time you showed up, $r!"]="你来得正及时，$r！"
G["About time!"]="时间到！"
G["About time!  Get that lumber and get moving.  The horde won't be up there fighting forever, there's money to be made!"]="趁现在！抬起那根木材就跑吧。部落不会打上一辈子仗，眼下正是赚钱的好机会呀！"
G["About time. We're starting to run out of kegs here."]="是时候了。我们的桶快要用光了。"
G["About twenty years ago, the Alliance launched the first Expedition to this world in hopes of eradicating the orcs forever. It was a... terrible conflict. Many brave souls perished to assure Azeroth's safety.\n\nThank you, $n, for helping those souls find peace."]="大约二十年前，联盟向这个世界发起了第一次远征，希望能永远铲除兽人。那是一段……惨烈的冲突。许多勇敢的灵魂为保障艾泽拉斯的安全而牺牲。\n\n谢谢你，$n，帮助那些灵魂得到了安息。"
G["About twenty years ago, the Alliance launched the first Expedition to this world in hopes of eradicating the orcs forever. It was a... terrible conflict. Many brave souls perished to assure Azeroth's safety.\n\nYet some souls remain...locked in eternal combat."]="大概二十年以前，联盟展开了对这个世界的第一次远征，希望可以永久根除兽人的威胁。那是一场……可怕的战争。很多勇敢的灵魂为保证艾泽拉斯的安全牺牲了。\n\n有些灵魂仍然……滞留在这无尽的战斗中。"
G["About... face!"]="有关于……脸！"
G["Absolutely amazing! We've done it!"]="真了不起！我们成功了！"
G["Absolutely not. We must not place ourselves at risk. With the master away, we are all that is in place to keep the stream intact. Others are due to arrive any moment now. Heroes and adventurers from Azeroth..."]="当然不。我们不能把自己卷入危险中去。主人不在的情况下，我们都要确保时间流完整无缺。艾泽拉斯的英雄们和冒险者们估计马上就要来了……"
G["Absolutely stunning!"]="绝对是震古烁今的作品！"
