G["Accessing... Creators arrived to extirpate symbiotic infection. Assessment revealed that Old God infestation had grown malignant. Excising parasites would result in loss of host--"]="正在检索……造物主曾经亲自回来清除噬主共体生物所造成的感染。根据当时的评估，上古之神滋生所造成的危害非常严重。强行分离被感染部分将导致宿主损毁——"
G["Accessing... In the early stages of it's development cycle, Azeroth suffered infection by parasitic necrophotic symbiotes."]="正在检索……在其发展周期的初始阶段，艾泽拉斯世界遭受到了寄生性噬主共体生物的感染。"
G["Accompany Lady Sylvanas Windrunner across the Battlefront."]="护送希尔瓦娜斯·风行者穿过战斗前线。"
G["According to my calculations, if enough of us bang the gong at once the seal on these doors will break and we can enter."]="根据我的计算，如果我们有足够多的人同时敲锣的话，那么这些门上的封印就会被揭开，这样我们就能进去了。"
G["According to my research, the pandaren long ago made a special mallet that was intended for the Divine Bell."]="根据我的研究，在很久以前，熊猫人专门为这口圣钟制作了一把特别的钟杵。"
G["According to the latest count we have all of the copper bars we're going to need for the war. If I were you I'd check with some of the other collectors here to see if they need your help."]="根据最近一次统计，我们已经集齐了战争所需的铜锭。如果我是你的话，我会跟其他收集者谈谈，看看他们是否需要帮助。"
G["According to the legend, long ago, there were five suns that burned brightly in the sky. When the winds blew, their intense heat caused great wildfires."]="相传在很久以前，天上明晃晃地挂着五个太阳。一旦刮起风来，灼人的热浪总会让大地燃起燎原野火。"
G["According to these readings, we have nothing to fear.  At least nothing in the near future.  We'll need more data to be sure."]="依据这些信息，我们没有什么可害怕的。至少目前是没有，我们还需要更多的数据来确认。"
G["According to this runestone, the mogu were Titan constructs, soulless creatures built of stone. We suspected as much."]="根据这块符文石，魔古是泰坦创造的，没有灵魂的岩石生物。我猜也是。"
G["According to this, the mogu and their master were sent to Pandaria. They were pursuing a great darkness - ah, the fragment is incomplete. We must find others."]="这里提到，魔古族和他们的主人被派来潘达利亚追踪巨大的黑暗——啊，这块碎片不完整。我们得找到剩余部分。"
G["Accuse"]="指控"
G["Ace pilot $n, 12 o'clock!"]="王牌飞行员$n，12点位置！"
G["Ace, Izzy, Gobber, you three make sure you tag along with $n and help $g him : her; take care of those deadbeats!"]="王牌、小静、大胖，你们三个要跟着$n，帮助他处理那些坏家伙！"
G["Ace, you're the best!"]="王牌飞行员，你是最棒的！"
G["Ach!  Everything else looks good, but there's too much thread!"]="啊！万事俱备，可线太多了！"
G["Ach! Thank you so much, $n! I'm free! Finally!"]="啊！太感谢你了，$n！我自由了！终于自由了！"
G["Ach! The light... it hurts our eyes..."]="啊！这光……它闪到我们的眼睛了……"
G["Ach! This'll be harder than I thought."]="啊！这比我想象的更难。"
G["Ach! Toss me a cold frosty, Belm!"]="嘿，伙计，给我来杯酒！"
G["Ach, it's hard enough keeping order around here without all these new troubles popping up!  I hope you have good news, $N..."]="唉，光要管好这边的秩序已经很不容易了，更何况还有这么多的新问题一直冒出来。我希望你带来的是好消息，$N..."
G["Ach, it's hard enough keeping order around here without all these new troubles popping up!  I hope you have good news, $n..."]="啊，就算没有这些新麻烦不断的冒出来，维持这儿的秩序就已经够让人头痛的了！希望你有好消息，$n……"
G["Ach, so much for being good with animals. Now how do these bandages work?"]="哎，我指挥动物的本事也就这样了。这些绷带该怎么用？"
G["Achieve clarity through combat. Enlightenment through engagement. Peace through punching.\n\nSuch is the Tian way."]="以战生慧，以斗促觉，以动得静。\n\n这就是天之道。"
G["Achor she-ki!  Feast, my pet!  Eat your fill!"]="Achor she-ki！吞噬他们的躯体！"
G["Ack!"]="收到！"
