G["Ack!  My beautiful X-52 Nether-Rocket.  We'll have to quadruple our efforts to get this damage repaired!"]="啊！我漂亮的X-52虚空火箭。我们必须加倍努力才能修好它！"
G["Ack!  Somebody help me!"]="啊！有人来救救我吗！"
