G["Ack, get that thing off us!"]="哎呀，甩掉它！"
G["Ack, ye've been busy now haven't ye?!  I canna thank ye enough for bombing them demons and resupplying us with mounts.\n\nYer making our job all the more easier.  Keep up the good work, $g laddy : lassie;!"]="哎哟，你可真是忙得脚不沾地啊？！你炸那些恶魔、又给我们补充坐骑，我怎么谢你都不够。\n\n$g你:你;让我们的活儿轻松多了。继续保持，$g小伙子:姑娘;！"
