G["Acteon, where is the best area to hunt for moongraze stags?"]="艾克提恩，哪里是狩猎月痕雄鹿的最佳区域？"
G["Acteon, where is the best place to hunt moongraze bucks?"]="艾克提恩，哪里是狩猎月痕巨鹿的最佳区域？"
G["Acting on these tenets, these virtues, help make the world a place we all can appreciate. A world of honor and justice."]="只要我们奉行这些原则与美德，这个世界就会变成彼此向往的美好世界。荣耀而正义的世界。"
G["Action speaks louder than intent, stranger. My warriors intend to seek retribution, but only practice will make it so. Now go away. We are busy."]="Los actos dicen más que las palabras, $gforastero:forastera;. Mis guerreros desean vengarse, pero solo lo conseguirán mediante el entrenamiento. Ahora vete. Estamos ocupados."
G["Activate counter-measures. Repel intruder."]="启动反击模式。击退入侵者。"
G["Activate secondary defensive systems."]="激活辅助防御系统。"
G["Activate the Expendable Atomic Defense System: DRIVE FORTH THE TROGGS!!!"]="马上激活一次性原子防御系统：把穴居人都给我派过去！！！"
G["Activate the Ultimate Atomic Protection System."]="激活终极原子保卫系统。"
G["Activate the altars to gain the blessings of the elements, but avoid the deadly shadow altar!"]="启动祭坛，获得元素的祝福，但一定要避开致命的暗影祭坛！"
G["Activate the crystals when we get in trouble, right."]="遇到麻烦时就激活水晶。"
G["Activate the steam valves to free yourself!"]="打开气阀来释放你自己！"
G["Activate your Bravo Company Field Kit now.|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_MISC_ENGGIZMOS_20.BLP:16|t\nStealth your party using Camouflage.|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_NATURE_PROTECTIONFORMNATURE.BLP:16|t"]="现在激活你的B连战地工具。|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_MISC_ENGGIZMOS_20.BLP:16|t\n用伪装使你的小队成员隐形。|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_NATURE_PROTECTIONFORMNATURE.BLP:16|t"
G["Activating"]="启动"
G["Activating Defenses"]="激活防御设施"
G["Activating Dual-Phasic Disruptor Alpha."]="激活二元干涉者Alpha。"
G["Activating Dual-Phasic Disruptor Beta."]="激活二元干涉者Beta。"
G["Activating GB-11010 \"Armageddon\"-class defense systems. Hey, does anybody know if we're zoned for this?"]="激活GB-11010“末日决战”级防御系统。嘿，我们到底有没有给它分区？"
G["Activating Penta-Phasic Disruptor Omega!"]="激活五元干涉者Omega。"
G["Activating Tri-Phasic Disruptor Alpha."]="激活三元干涉者Alpha。"
G["Activating Tri-Phasic Disruptor Beta."]="激活三元干涉者Beta。"
G["Activating aggression modules!"]="启动进攻模块！"
G["Activating defense mode EL-2S."]="启动防御模式EL-2S。"
G["Activating defense mode EL-5R."]="启动防御模式EL-5R。"
G["Activating defense mode EL-7M."]="启动防御模式EL-7M。"
G["Activating extermination protocol."]="激活毁灭协议。"
G["Activating secondary defensive systems will result in the extermination of unauthorized life forms via orbital emplacements.\n\nYou are an unauthorized life form. Please confirm."]="激活辅助防御系统后，轨道炮台将消灭所有未经认证的生命体。\n\n你属于未经认证的生命体。请确认。"
G["Activation Sequence: COMPLETE"]="激活序列：完成"
G["Activation Sequence: Deciphering command parse"]="激活序列：解析指令"
G["Activation Sequence: INITIATED"]="激活序列：初始化"
G["Activation Sequence: Matrixing protocols"]="激活序列：换算协议"
G["Activation Sequence: Plotting your demise"]="激活序列：测定你的死期"
G["Activation Sequence: Repressing urge to activate early"]="激活序列：加快活动速度"
G["Activation Sequence: Rerouting auxiliary power"]="激活序列：重置电源"
G["Activation Sequence: Setting doom level to 15,000 milli-dooms"]="激活序列：将毁灭指数设置为15,000"
G["Activation Sequence: Starting micro suppressors"]="激活序列：启动微波抑制器"
G["Activation Sequence: Successfully dividing by zero"]="激活序列：成功除零"
G["Active."]="启动。"
G["Actually I prefer traditional medicines... leeches, maggots, bonesaws... that sort of thing.  Well to each their own.  You can find the our local Herbalism Trainer, Faruza, standing out front near the stables in Brill."]="实际上我更倾向于传统医学……水蛭，蛆，锯骨……那类东西。你可以看到我们本地的草药医学训练师，法鲁萨，就站在布瑞尔的马厩的附近。"
G["Actually, I agree with Fiona."]="确实，菲奥拉说得没错。"
G["Actually, I saw Benedictus at Wyrmrest. He was the Twilight Prophet."]="事实上，我在龙眠神殿见到了本尼迪塔斯。他就是暮光先知。"
G["Actually, forget it - I don't want to know. I'm going back to my lines."]="其实，算了——我并不想知道。我要回去了。"
G["Actually, shaman, I don't really care what you do.  I'm not even sure why Hellscream brought you here."]="的确，萨满，我并不真的很在意你在做什么。我甚至不明白地狱咆哮为什么要把你带到这里来。"
G["Adamant, could you please take a look at this tablet and try to decipher the runes?"]="阿达曼特，你能看下这块石板，顺便试着翻译一下上面的符文吗？"
G["Adaris!"]="阿达利斯！"
G["Add another orange! Quickly!"]="再加一颗橙子！快点！"
G["Add bananas!"]="更多的香蕉！"
G["Add the unmentionables... uh, I mean, the 'delicates'!"]="加几件儿恶心的…呃，我是说，“棘手的”！"
G["Additional background information on the Earthen must be given to you before this question may be answered properly.\n\nProcessing.\n\nTo understand the anomalies of the Earthen, it is first important to understand what the Earthen represent in their design intent.  The Earthen represent the Creators' attempt at improving the survivability paradigm of the standard subterranean being matrix.  This was done by incorporating a resilient foundation of construction inherent to the world into said matrix."]="在正确回答这个问题之前，需要向你介绍更多关于土灵的背景资料。\n\n资料处理中。\n\n为了理解土灵的变化，首先要了解土灵的设计特征。创世者的目的是要提高标准地下生物母体的存活性，因此他们把与整个世界相联系的弹性构造基础整合在其中，土灵的出现正是为了达到这一目的。"
G["Additional background is relevant to your query: following global combat between Aesir and Vanir--"]="另有后台信息与你的问询关联：在艾塞尔和瓦尼尔的全面战争之后——"
G["Adele Fielder has made a name for herself as a leatherworker around Elwynn.  You can find her working out of her home up by Crystal Lake."]="艾德勒·费欧德的皮革手艺在艾尔文森林已经妇孺皆知了。她的家就在水晶湖旁边。"
G["Adeline, can you not ask any of your friends to come help us at New Thalanaar?"]="艾德琳，你不能请你的朋友来新萨兰纳尔帮助我们吗？"
G["Adella, you will strike out far to the east. Our forces must retake the eastern wilds, and observe the Horde unseen. May your judgement be as keen as your marksmanship."]="艾德娜，你必须出击至遥远的东边。我们的军队一定要夺回东部荒野，并观察那些从未见过的部落。愿你的判断力与你的枪法一样精准。"
G["Adjust the gears! \n\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_EngGizmos_13.blp:64|t"]="调节传动装置！ \n\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_EngGizmos_13.blp:64|t"
G["Administering fists of fury on $n!"]="狠狠地打$n！"
G["Admirably? Hah! I will enjoy watching your weak little champions fail, human."]="感觉如何？哈！我很喜欢看着你们这些弱小的勇士是怎样失败的，人类。"
G["Admiral - I think they mean to surrender. They're not armed - They're just trying not to drown!"]="上将——我想他们是要投降。他们手无寸铁——只是不想淹死！"
G["Admiral Aubrey is expecting you upstairs, $gsir:ma'am;."]="奥布里将军正在楼上等你，$g先生:女士;。"
G["Admiral Keller sent me, Emilune. Please send me to Westguard Keep!"]="艾米鲁尔，是凯勒中将派我来的。请送我去西部卫戍要塞！"
G["Admiral Taylor and I were just speaking about you. How are you, $n?"]="泰勒上将和我刚才还谈到你呢。你好吗，$n？"
G["Admiral Taylor sent us here to look fer the young Prince. Did ya know that they brew BEER here?"]="海军上将泰勒派我们来此寻找年轻的王子。你能想到他们这里也酿啤酒吗？"
G["Admiral they've activated some sort of force field, the control towers all over the island just lit up"]="将军，他们激活了某种力场，岛上的控制塔楼都亮起来了。"
G["Admiral they've activated some sort of force field, the control towers all over the island just lit up."]="将军，他们激活了某种力场，岛上的控制塔楼都亮起来了。"
G["Admiral! It's good to see that you are okay."]="上将！看见你平安真是太好了。"
G["Admiral, I need another tree disguise kit."]="上将，我还要一套树伪装工具包。"
G["Admiral, can I get a ride to the Blackpool?"]="指挥官，我能申请一匹坐骑前往黑弹珠号吗？"
G["Admiral, send the remnants of Theramore's fleet to assist the night elves and issue letters of marque to any captains willing to take up our cause."]="将军，派塞拉摩的残余舰队前去协助暗夜精灵，并向任何愿意分担我们使命的船长颁发私掠许可证。"
G["Admiral, we're seeing a significant native presence here. Ornate structures-"]="上将，我们看见了充满当地风格的景色。华丽的建筑群——"
G["Admiral, your hat."]="长官，你的帽子。"
G["Advance to the front!"]="向着前线进发！"
G["Advanced training? Do you mean the one with the eggs?"]="进阶训练？你是说跟蛋有关的那个训练吗？"
G["Adventurers are such hypocrites!  Like YOU just FOUND your weapon on the side of the road!"]="冒险者都是伪君子！难道你是刚刚在路边拣到了你的武器吗？"
G["Adventurers from all over sell things to Antonio-- come look for yourselves what little treasures he has for you this week."]="世界各地的冒险家都会给安东尼奥供货——快来看看本周的特价商品啦！"
G["Adventurers may be rewarded for their just deeds in the Silver Enclave or Sunreaver's Sanctuary."]="冒险者可以在银色领地或者夺日者圣殿为自己立下的功绩领取公正的奖励。"
G["Adventurers, the door is beginning to weaken!"]="冒险者们，牢门的力量开始减弱了！"
G["Adventurers, you must hurry! The Guardian of Time cannot last for much longer!"]="冒险者，快！时间的守护者坚持不了多久的！"
G["Advisor, what's the latest news?"]="顾问，有什么新消息吗？"
G["Aeire, $n has brought your hides. Please, take them before they make me ill."]="埃恩雷，$n将你要的兽皮带回来了。请你赶快把它们拿走，我真是受不了这玩意儿。"
G["Aerial recon of New Hearthglen! Observe Scarlet Crusade activity!"]="对新壁炉谷进行空中侦察！注意血色十字军的动向！"
G["Aesir and Vanir... Okay, so the Forge o' Wills started makin' new earthen... but what happened to the old ones?"]="艾塞尔与瓦尼尔……好吧，这么说意志熔炉又从头开始创造了新的土灵……那老的怎么样了？"
G["Aessina is the spirit of nature, my everlasting companion in both this world and the dream beyond. Her shrine in western Hyjal is at the forefront of the Twilight offensive, and may be ablaze this very moment.\n\n$n, we will never restore Mount Hyjal without Aessina's help. Save her shrine from the fires, and save the nearby animals threatened by the blaze. We must do this or the entire mountain is lost."]="艾森娜是自然之灵，无论在此世还是在彼端的梦境中，她都是我不朽的伴侣。她在海加尔西部的神龛正处于暮光攻势的最前线，此刻可能已经燃起大火。\n\n$n，没有艾森娜的帮助，我们永远无法让海加尔山恢复原貌。把她的神龛从大火中救出来，也救救附近那些受火势威胁的动物。我们必须这么做，否则整座山都将毁于一旦。"
G["Aethas Sunreaver shifts uncomfortably."]="艾萨斯·夺日者不安地动了动。"
G["Aethas Sunreaver!"]="艾萨斯·夺日者！"
G["Aethas isn't here... they must have moved him. We can continue without him."]="艾萨斯不在……肯定被转移了。没有他我们也得继续。"
G["Aethas! You're alive."]="艾萨斯！你还活着。"
G["Aethas, I want our best archmages studying this device at once. We have so much to learn."]="艾萨斯，让我们最好的法师来研究它。我们有很多东西要学。"
G["Aethas, leave us for a moment."]="艾萨斯，请你回避一下。"
G["Aethas, this way! Into the portal!"]="艾萨斯，这边！进传送门！"
G["Affiliation: Burning Legion"]="所属阵营：燃烧军团"
G["Affirmative, stalker, we are Oscar Mike! Repeat, we are Oscar Mike!"]="明白，猎手。我们正在移动！重复，我们正在移动！"
G["Affirmative.  Timestamp of Prime Designate Loken's destruction coincides with signal activation."]="正确。首席管理官洛肯被毁灭与信号被激活的时间戳相符。"
G["Afraid not, friend.  Here's your sword and shield.  Report to the barracks for duty."]="别害怕，朋友。这是你的剑和盾。去兵营报到吧。"
G["Afraid not. Your days as a sanitation engineer are coming to an end."]="不行。你担任卫生设备工程师的日子到头了。"
G["After Deathwing appeared, they became quite frightened, but I only had room to rescue one of them."]="死亡之翼一出现，她们都被吓坏了，但我只能救走她们之中的一个。"
G["After I dropped ye off last time, I heard there was some kind of sha infectin' our soldiers at the Shrine of Seven Stars."]="自从上次我把你送到之后，我听说一些在七星殿的士兵们被煞能感染了。"
G["After I finish with your friends, you shall be our newest initiate."]="等我解决了你的朋友，你就会成为天灾军团的新兵了。"
G["After a couple of days of silence, I sent a scouting party out to the platform. They never returned.\n\nI sent another group the next day with the same results, and lost a couple of flying machines out on aerial recon.\n\nAt that point I sent someone south to find help, and we hunkered down to prepare for the worst. We turned all of our attention to making armor, weapons and robots so that we could head out there in full force.\n\nWhen we did a few days ago, we couldn't believe our eyes!"]="接连几天都没有泵站的消息，我就派了一支侦察队去查看情况。可是他们再也没有回来。\n\n第二天，我又派出一队，结果他们还是跟蒸发了似的。此外，我们还损失了好几架侦察机。\n\n事情到这一步，我不得不派人去了南边寻求支援，让剩余的队员留下来做最坏的打算。我们全力锻造护甲、武器以及机器人，准备全副武装地进军泵站。\n\n几天前，当我们到达那里时，顿时被眼前的情景惊呆了！"
G["After a high tide in the Gokk'lokk Shallows in Dread Wastes, sometimes the increased fish activity loosens the kelp along the shore. \n \n Shrimp, octopus, and all manner'o'things get tangled up in there. I bet you could get you a small fortune o' Mantis Shrimp if you fished out there a while.\n \n  Let me know if you need help finding it."]="恐惧废土的古克罗克浅滩在迎来大渔汛之后，日益频繁的鱼类活动有时会搅松沿岸的海藻。\n \n大虾、八爪鱼之类的东西就会被这些海藻缠住。我敢打赌，如果你去那里钓钓鱼，肯定能收获许多螳螂虾。 \n \n如果你需要我帮忙寻找渔点，就告诉我一声。"
G["After a moment's pause, the worg resumes the hunt."]="在短暂的停留后，座狼继续往前追踪目标。"
G["After a quick assessment, you determine that this fellow has expired within the last several hours."]="经过一番快速的查看，你确定这个人刚刚死了几个小时。"
G["After all that he did for YOU and YOUR people? MAK'GORA!"]="他犯下了这么多罪孽，你还在犹豫？MAK'GORA！"
G["After all the Alliance has done to the pandaren, they still allow them here!"]="在联盟对熊猫人做出了那些事之后，他们居然还被允许来到这里！"
G["After all the punching, and the kicking, and the eating, and the drinking... someone's got to clean up.\n\nThat's where the groundskeeper comes in."]="经过一阵拳打脚踢，大吃大喝之后……必须得有人来打扫。\n\n现在就该园丁上了。"
G["After all these years of fighting, now everyone's falling in love!"]="无尽的战斗之后，人人都坠入了爱河！"
G["After all these years, can it really be --"]="过了这么多年，难道它真的……"
G["After all this... our brothers and sisters passing, Lin captured by yaungol, my beer gone, I think it's time to move along.\nPerhaps I'll take the fight to the mantid..."]="经历了这一切……兄弟姐妹们死去，林被野牛人抓走，我的啤酒也没了，我想是时候继续上路了。\n\n也许我该去找螳螂妖打一仗……"
G["After all we've been through, we Gilneans have not given up hope."]="我们终于成功了。我们吉尔尼斯人从没有放弃过希望。"
G["After all we've been through?  Well, I didn't like you anyway!!"]="我们就此结束了？好吧，我一点都不喜欢你！！"
G["After countless failures of our agents to secure workable samples of Scourge blight for analysis, I've come up to the front lines myself to oversee the efforts. Like they say, if you want a job done right...."]="我们的密探在搜集可用的天灾军团枯萎样本时经历了很多次失败，现在我亲自到前线来视察工作进度。就像他们说的，如果你希望工作能够干好…"
G["After every storm, comes the calm..."]="每一场风暴过后，都是静寂……"
G["After everything, this is how it ends? Here on Darkcloud Pinnacle?"]="在黑云峰上，一切就这样结束了？"
G["After fighting the mogu, how much stronger could any other foes really be?"]="在与魔古族战斗过之后，其他敌人又能比他们强大多少呢？"
G["After him, quickly!"]="追上他，快点！"
G["After inspecting the statues, we saw a female pandaren emerge from the house."]="调查过那些雕像后，我们看见一个女熊猫人从屋子里走了出来。"
G["After inspecting the statues, we saw this old lady pandaren come out of the house."]="调查过那些雕像后，我们看见一个女熊猫人从屋里走出来。"
G["After intense fighting, our supply route to Booty Bay has been reestablished."]="经过激烈的战斗，我们已经恢复了与藏宝海湾之间的运输线。"
G["After scoutin' the three shrines, I headed back over to camp."]="侦查过三处神龛后，我就返回了营地。"
G["After that Pilgrim's Bounty dinner, I took a huge smelly orc."]="在享用完感恩节大餐后，我美美地拉了坨又大又臭的大便。"
G["After that."]="后面那句。"
G["After the Plaguelands and the Battle for Light's Hope Chapel, I didn't think that we would witness anything more horrible.\n\nI was wrong."]="在目睹了瘟疫之地的凄惨和圣光之愿礼拜堂的血战之后，我以为再也看不到比那些更加恐怖的东西了。\n\n但是我错了。"
G["After the battle, I recovered the sword from the field. I bore it to Northrend in the service of my prince, seeking to avenge our people's defeat."]="战后，我从战场上找回这把剑，为了我的王子，为了替我的族人复仇，我把它带到了诺森德。"
G["After the excavation trip to Mogujia, the Explorer's League brought their findings back to our city in the Vale o' Eternal Blossoms."]="探险者协会在魔古岬完成勘探任务之后，他们把发掘出来的东西都带回了锦绣谷的城市里。"
G["After the fall of Dalaran, I took my leave from the Kirin Tor. I spent years watching over Atiesh, only to have my purpose amongst the Kirin Tor taken from me in one fell swoop. I would find the staff, though it might take a lifetime. That is how I came to join the Argent Dawn and why I am here now."]="在达拉然沦陷以后，我离开了肯瑞托议会，用了好几年的时间来搜寻埃提耶什的下落，只是为了履行我在肯瑞托未尽的责任。我会找到这根法杖，即使这要用去我一生的时间。这也是我加入银色黎明并站在这里的原因。"
G["After the fall of Karazhan, the Kirin Tor dispatched an assembly of mages to search the tower and seize all items of import... for the purposes of \"research.\" It was then that the fabled staff was discovered and brought back to Dalaran."]="卡拉赞陷落之后，肯瑞托派出一队法师搜查那座塔，没收所有重要物品……名义上是\"研究\"。传说中的那根法杖就是在那时被发现并带回达拉然的。"
G["After the fall of the Burning Blade Clan, we blademasters swore to free ourselves and our people from demonic control.\n\nThis may be done, but my honor remains unsatisfied.\n\nI shall fight for the Horde - and train other warriors to do so - until I die gloriously in battle. This is the only path I may tread."]="在火刃部族灭亡之后，我们剑圣就发誓，要从恶魔的统治之下解放我们自己和我们的族人。\n\n这个任务终于完成了，但我的荣誉并没有得到恢复。\n\n我要为部落而战，直到我在战场上光荣牺牲。这是我唯一的道路。"
G["After the fall of the Burning Blade Clan, we blademasters swore to free ourselves and our people from demonic control.\n\nThis may be done, but my honor remains unsatisfied.\n\nI shall fight for the Horde - and train other warriors to do so - until I die gloriously in battle. This is the only path I may tread.\n\nSo. Are you ready to train?"]="火刃氏族覆灭之后，我们剑圣发誓要让自己和族人摆脱恶魔的控制。\n\n这件事或许能做到，但我的荣誉仍未得到满足。\n\n我将为部落而战——并训练其他战士一同战斗——直到我在战场上光荣战死。这是我唯一能走的路。\n\n那么，$g你:你;准备好受训了吗？"
G["After the firework show, they'll put out goblets so we can raise a toast!"]="焰火表演之后，他们会拿出高脚杯，我们就可以喝酒庆祝啦！"
G["After the fireworks, goblets will be put out. We will then toast our comrades!"]="美酒将在烟火表演之后拿出来。我们可以在那时为朋友们干杯！"
G["After the makrura attack, we could see that the Gallant would not survive another.  So I and the few surviving sailors abandoned my ship.\n\nWe are now ashore and will soon strike out for the town of Nijel's Point, but much danger lies between us and sanctuary, and I fear Desolace will consume us.\n\nI write this now in hopes that someone will know our plight, and some day avenge us against the watery fiends who were our ruin."]="在龙虾人的进攻后，我们知道下一次豪侠是无法幸免于难的。于是我和几个幸存的水手弃船逃生。\n\n我们现在上岸了并很快就会向尼耶尔前哨站游去，但是在到达避难所之前我们还有很多危险，而且我害怕凄凉之地会吞噬我们。\n\n我现在写下这些是希望有人能知道我们的困境，有一天能把那些带给我们灭顶之灾的水中魔鬼杀死为我们报仇。"
G["After the race, I'll be sure to show you all my first place prize!"]="比赛结束后，我一定会带你去看看我所有的冠军奖杯！"
G["After the savagery that my people have witnessed and felt, you expect me to accept another burden, dragon? Surely you are mad."]="在我的人民目睹并经历了那场暴行之后，你还指望我能挑起这个沉重的负担？很明显，你疯了。"
G["After these negotiations, I am looking forward to a long and prosperous life."]="经过多次谈判之后，我期待一个长久的繁荣时代即将到来。"
G["After they boarded the ship, I closed my eyes and hid. Please don't make me talk about it..."]="他们上船后，我就闭眼躲了起来。求你别再让我说这个了……"
G["After this mobility test, we'll only have the final weapons check to complete."]="在这次机动性测试以后，我们只剩下最后一项武器检查要做了。"
G["After this, me and some of the boys are going to visit The Dancing Serpent Inn for some brew."]="这里的事结束之后，我一定要和兄弟们去龙舞楼喝几杯！"
G["After we clean this place up, maybe we can start rebuilding it. Maybe they'll give it to Bravo Company. We'll call it: BRAVO KEEP!"]="等我们把这里清理干净，也许我们会开始重建这地方。可能他们会把它交给B连。我们可以管它叫B连要塞！"
G["After we're done here, I think I'll go to Ironforge. Get me a few pints of Ironforge's finest and some friendly dwarven wenches."]="等我们结束这里的事情，我想我会前往铁炉堡。尝尝铁炉堡最富盛名的美酒，再见见那些友善的矮人姑娘。"
G["After what seemed an eternity, the Vindicator lost consciousness. The torture was too much, even for him. The cruel one - Matis as I found out he was called - attempted to wake Saruan by splashing contagion laced water across his ravaged body. But Saruan did not wake."]="过了很长一段时间，守备官失去了知觉。他已遭受太多的严刑拷打。那个残忍的家伙——他的名字似乎是叫玛提斯——竟然往守备官那早已伤痕累累的身体上泼洒腐水。但撒鲁安并没有清醒过来。"
G["After you get his attention - and you can be certain that if he sees you near the tower, you'll have his undue attention - face him and perform the Shattered /Salute. Let me demonstrate...."]="如果你在塔的周围活动的话，一定会引起他的注意，这时你就可以实施碎手军礼了。让我们来练习一下……"
G["After you, my good sir."]="您先请，阁下。"
G["After zhat ritual debacle, you owe me, $r.\n\nAnd I plan on collectink!"]="现在那个仪式完蛋了。你欠我一大笔债，$r。\n\n我会让你还的！"
G["Afterwards, the father asked his cub what he had learned."]="然后，父亲问儿子学到了什么。"
G["Again I strongly disagree with your view of the strategic situation. Your plan will spread our forces too thin. It will leave us with only a small force to assault Deatholme. I cannot in good conscience execute such a strategy."]="我再次强烈反对你在战略形势上的观点。你的计划会让我们的力量过于分散，让我们只有一小部分力量来进攻戴索姆。执行这样的战术，我不放心。"
G["Again with the flames and the hurt."]="再次伴随着火焰和痛苦。"
G["Again!"]="再来一次！"
G["Again, I thank you, $n.  Without your aid we would never have been able to deal with the Shadow Council here at Grangol'var Village."]="再次感谢，$n。没有你的帮助，我们不可能解决格兰戈瓦村的暗影议会成员。"
G["Again, very nice strutting ladies."]="啧啧，步法真优雅，模特们。"
G["Again. We really need better friends."]="又来了。我们真该交些更靠谱的朋友。"
G["Again...? Is this your plot, your scheme?"]="再次失败……？这就是你的诡计，你的阴谋？"
G["Again...we are torn apart...again...to the cold darkness..."]="又来了……我们被撕裂了……又要……回到冰冷的黑暗中……"
G["Again? Make it fast, Komak, I'm sick of this."]="又来？快点，库马克，我讨厌这个。"
G["Again?!"]="还来？！"
G["Against your will, you begin to unleash an |cFFFF0000|Hspell:122398|h[Amber Explosion]|h|r!"]="你很不情愿地开始施放一次|cFFFF0000|Hspell:122398|h[琥珀爆炸]|h|r！"
G["Agamaggan will not rise again without BLOOD! His body demands sacrifice!"]="没有了血，阿迦玛甘将无法再次崛起！他的躯体在渴求祭品！"
G["Agamath, the First Gate and Rohendor, the Second Gate are now destroyed. Only Archonisus, the Third Gate remains."]="第一道门阿加麦斯和第二道门洛希多尔都已经被完全摧毁，只剩下第三道门埃库尼苏了。"
G["Agamath, the First Gate has been breached. Two of Kil'jaeden's most powerful lieutenants, Lady Sacrolash and Grand Warlock Alythess, are now vulnerable to attack."]="第一道门阿加麦斯已经被完全破坏了。基尔加丹手下的两位高级军官萨洛拉丝女王和高阶术士奥蕾塞丝已经暴露在我军的攻势之下。"
G["Agamath, the First Gate is breached and two of Kil'jaeden's lieutenants, Lady Sacrolash and Grand Warlock Alythess, must be destroyed.\n\nGather your friends, $c, and see to it! Rohendor, the Second Gate is our next target."]="第一道屏障阿加麦斯已经被摧毁了，基尔加丹的两个副官——萨洛拉丝女王和高阶术士奥蕾塞丝——必须接受正义的制裁。\n\n召集你的伙伴吧，$c，攻入太阳之井！第二道屏障洛希多尔是我们的下一个目标。"
G["Agara makes me look good, just like I make her look good."]="我跟阿加拉是交相辉映，相得益彰。"
G["Agatha, show the Warchief!"]="阿加莎，让酋长看看！"
G["Age has caught up with me it seems.  I cannot move as I once could, and so I've little left to offer my once friend..."]="真是岁月催人老啊。我的行动已经不如从前敏捷了，所以我也很少去看我的老朋友了……"
G["Agent Connelly, ain't it? That man's got some charm... and some nerve! His sweet words made me blush ten ways out of Ironforge!"]="特工康奈利，对不？那个男的很有魅力……还很有胆量！他的甜言蜜语让我的脸羞得比铁炉堡的铁砧还红！"
G["Agent Skully, I need you to use the banshee's magic mirror on me again!"]="斯古莉探员，请再对我使用一次女妖的魔镜！"
G["Agent Ya-six and I were given a high priority mission from Protectorate command to eradicate all signs of void creature infestation at Ultris. These were to be tactical strikes. Our last hit before returning to the Protectorate Watch Post was to be on a void lord named Arconus who had been getting fat off the fleshlings of the area.\n\nUnfortunately, we arrived a bit late. Ya-six and I got separated in the firefight with the flesh beasts. Now he's trapped inside, pinned down behind enemy lines."]="我和亚六特工接到保护者协会指挥部的一项高优先级任务：铲除乌提斯所有虚空生物侵染的痕迹。这些都是战术打击。在返回保护者协会哨站之前，我们的最后一个目标是名叫阿科努斯的虚空领主，他一直靠这一带的血肉生物养得肥头大耳。\n\n不幸的是，我们到得晚了些。在与那些血肉怪物的交火中，亚六和我走散了。现在他被困在里面，被压制在敌人阵线之后。"
G["Agents of the Cenarion Circle have uncovered disturbing information pertaining to the current situation in Eldre'Thalas.  I am at an impasse as to what to do about it, and I will no doubt soon seek the aid of able bodied beings capable of handling themselves in a fight.\n\nTo properly take action in Eldre'Thalas, however, is to understand the lore of an object known as the Fruit of Fertility."]="塞纳里奥议会的人已经了解到埃雷萨拉斯的近况了。我陷入了僵局，不知如何是好。我很可能要向那些体格强健、善于作战的冒险者寻求帮助。\n\n但是，要对埃雷萨拉斯采取行动，就要了解关于丰饶之果的知识。"
G["Ages ago the demon lord Kil'jaeden subjected the shaman, Ner'zhul, to a seemingly endless torture before sealing his soul in a frozen crystal. It is this prison, forged in the depths of the twisting nether, that we have come to call the Frozen Throne.\n\nIt was not until Arthas smashed the crystal with Frostmourne that he merged with the soul of Ner'zhul and became the Lich King. This breaking of the throne created the frozen fragments of [shadowfrost] that now lie scattered throughout the citadel."]="很早以前，恶魔领主基尔加丹迫使萨满耐奥祖向他屈服，在受尽无尽折磨后，耐奥祖的灵魂被封禁在一块冰封的水晶之中。这是一个在扭曲虚空的深入打造的监牢，我们将它称为冰封王座。\n\n直到后来阿尔萨斯用霜之哀伤击碎了那块水晶，将耐奥祖的灵魂融入自身，便成了巫妖王。王座的碎裂产生了[shadowfrost]冰封碎片，这些碎片现在就散落在冰冠堡垒中。"
G["Aggggh!  I'm hit!  You're going to have to get us back!  Quick, before the plane explodes!"]="啊啊啊！被击中了！你得帮帮忙！快，趁飞行器还没有爆炸！"
G["Aggghh! The powers of the Sunwell... turn... against me! What have you done? What have you done???"]="啊啊啊！太阳之井的能量……开始……对抗我！你们都做了些什么？你们都做了些什么？？"
G["Aggh!"]="啊！！"
G["Aggh!! No longer will I be a slave to Malygos! Challenge me and you will be destroyed!"]="啊！我不再是玛里苟斯的奴隶了！所有挑战我的人都要被消灭！"
G["Agghh!"]="啊！"
G["Agghh!  So many of them!"]="啊——！敌人太多了！"
G["Agghh! Well done! Now this gets... interesting..."]="啊！干得好！现在……有意思了……"
G["Agghh!! Help me before I lose my mind!"]="啊！我要疯了，快帮帮我！"
G["Agghh!! Tharon'ja will have more!"]="啊啊啊！我还要这种感觉！"
G["Agghhhh! Do... not... rejoice! Your victory is a hollow one, for I shall return with powers beyond your imagining!"]="啊！别……高兴得……太早了！你们的胜利空洞而虚无，没有任何意义，我很快就将卷土重来！"
G["Aggra is nearly drowned! Save her!"]="阿格娜快要溺死了！救救她！"
G["Aggra shoots Gavan a disapproving look."]="阿格娜用不满的目光瞥了加文一眼。"
G["Aggra's Fury."]="阿格娜的狂怒。"
G["Aggra, I am ready to travel to Deepholm."]="阿格娜，我准备好前往深岩之洲了。"
G["Aggra, I am ready to travel to the Abyssal Maw."]="阿格娜，我准备好前往深渊之喉了。"
G["Aggra, I am ready. Let us go to Thrall."]="阿格娜，我准备好了。我们去见萨尔吧。"
G["Aggra, I should not be long. The Darkspear are a strong people and I doubt they have much need of my assistance."]="阿格娜，我不会离开很久的。暗矛氏族的人民都很坚强，也许他们并不需要我太多的帮助。"
G["Aggra, I... I can't hold on... AAH!"]="阿格娜，我……我坚持不住了……啊！"
G["Aggra, my heart... you never gave up on me. I owe you my life... everything that I am."]="阿格娜，我的心……你从未放弃我。我的生命，我的一切，都亏欠于你。"
G["Aggra... $n..."]="Aggra... eres tú..."
G["Aggra... I heard your voice... calling me back...\n\nWhere are we?"]="阿格娜……我听到了你的声音……呼唤着我……\n\n我们在哪？"
G["Aggra... it IS you..."]="阿格娜……真的是你……"
G["Aggra... this can't be... this has gone too far..."]="阿格娜……这不可能……这太过火了……"
G["Aggra... though I was not born on Draenor, I have always tried to honor the traditions of our ancestors..."]="阿格娜……虽然我不是在我们的故乡——德拉诺出生，但我总是尽可能去尊重先祖的传统……"
G["Aggra? Aggra! I can't hear-"]="阿格娜？阿格娜！我听不见——"
G["Aggron! Show 'em who's boss!"]="阿格隆！让他们看看谁才是老大！"
G["Agh!"]="啊！"
G["Agh! Damn you, Mal'Ganis! Father... Jaina... I have failed Lordaeron...."]="啊！诅咒你，玛尔加尼斯！父王……吉安娜……我令洛丹伦失望了……"
G["Agh! My wards!"]="啊！我的护罩！"
G["Agh... a chill ran up my spine."]="啊……我的背上感到一股凉意。"
G["Agh... me am...dead."]="Agh... yo... estar... $gmuerto:muerta;."
G["Aghhh!  My sssphere!"]="啊！我的魔球！"
G["Agrant? Nellie? Isn't it a bit dangerous to be outside of the zeppelin?"]="阿加特？奈莉？离开飞艇不是有点危险吗？"
G["Agreed, brother, but the Horde fights many fires these days and the Vanguard are few in number..."]="我同意，兄弟，部落最近征战不断，可先锋战士的数量却不够……"
G["Agreed."]="同意。"
G["Agreed.  So what do you want from me?"]="同意。那么你想让我干什么？"
G["Agreed. Budd's scraped together rif-raf from all over creation.\n\nSeems when there's free booze to be had, there be plenty of folk willin' to set aside their differences."]="说得没错。巴德纠集了形形色色的酒鬼。\n\n似乎只要能喝到免费的美酒，这帮家伙就会抛开彼此的差异与分歧，聚到一起来。"
G["Agreed. Messenger, you may carry word of our plans back to Lord Lor'themar, but make it clear that I will not tolerate any further interference."]="同意。信使，你可以向摄政王洛瑟玛回报我们的计划。但记住，我不希望再受到干扰。"
G["Ah - I've been waiting for a real challenge!"]="啊——给我来一次真正的挑战吧！"
G["Ah - hah! Busted!"]="啊哈！逮到你了！"
G["Ah - here comes Alexstrasza now."]="啊——阿莱克丝塔萨来了。"
G["Ah - oddities and rarities. We specialize in Azeroth's more unique items for the discerning adventurer.\n\nSince you're speaking with me, you must already have an idea of what you're looking for."]="啊——各种珍品都在这里！我们专门为有识别能力的冒险者挑选艾泽拉斯世界的宝贝。\n\n既然你来找我谈话了，我想你肯定已经想好要什么了吧。"
G["Ah - oddities and rarities. We specialize in Azeroth's more unique items for the discerning adventurer.\n\nSince you're speaking with me, you must already have an idea of what you're looking for. So, $n, which item are you interested in?"]="啊——奇珍异宝。我们专为有眼光的冒险者提供艾泽拉斯最独特的物品。\n\n既然你会跟我说话，那你心里肯定已经有想要的东西了。那么，$n，你对哪件物品感兴趣？"
G["Ah I am too busy for a drink now lad."]="No tengo tiempo para tomar una copa, $gchaval:chica;."
G["Ah a visitor! Must be an adventurer, we don't get many tourists down this way. Grab a chair and a drink, make yourself comfortable. Say, you look like you have some meat on your bones. You thinkin about competing in the cage matches?"]="啊，有客人！一定是位冒险者，我们这条路可没什么游客来。搬把椅子，拿杯酒，随意坐。我说，$g你:你;看起来挺结实的。想参加笼中格斗吗？"
G["Ah ah ah..."]="啊哈哈哈……"
G["Ah am very surprised that one wit such a careless nature has gotten dis far...\n\nYah, you may have another charm, but Mau'ari is very displeased wit your actions!\n\nGo, now."]="我很惊讶一个如此粗心的人竟然能走到这里……\n\n是的，你可能还有一个符咒，但是玛艾里对你的行为很生气！\n\n现在赶紧离开。"
G["Ah friend, I only help hunters and their pets."]="啊朋友，我只帮助猎人和他们的宠物。"
G["Ah good! You found the safari. That jungle is a little rough to navigate without some travel sense.\n\nThose mogu kept getting in the way of my hunting."]="啊，很好！你找到远征队了。要是没有点旅行天赋，很容易在丛林里迷失方向。\n\n那些魔古族没完没了地妨碍我狩猎。"
G["Ah good, there $g he : she; is... my future $g master : mistress; of the elements! What kind of training would you like today?"]="Ah, bien, aquí estás... ¡$gEl:La; $gfuturo:futura; $gseñor:señora; de los elementales! ¿Qué clase de instrucción te interesa hoy?"
G["Ah ha ha!  Well done!"]="啊哈哈！干得好！"
G["Ah ken see very well through this haze, but I'd know tha' smell anywhere!  Die ye foul ogre!"]="我眼前朦朦胧胧的，什么都看不清，但我很清楚这股气味！去死吧，肮脏的食人魔！"
G["Ah not a traitor mon! Ya not gonna be shacklin' me again."]="别当叛徒，朋友！你休想再把我锁起来。"
G["Ah ya ta ta! Don't worry, you in the right place. But let's first see if I like what comes out of your face."]="啊哈哈哈！别担心，你来对地方了。但是先让我看看你的面相是不是讨喜。"
G["Ah yes, I can smell it from here!"]="啊，没错，我在这儿都能闻到了！"
G["Ah yes, I have read of you, $n."]="嗯，我读到过你的故事，$n。"
G["Ah yes, I've heard about him. He's down at the brewery, right?\n\nI can take you there when you're ready."]="啊，是的，我听说过他。他好像去了酒坊，对吗？\n\n等你准备好，我们就可以上路了。"
G["Ah yes, I've heard about him. He's visiting Halfhill with Mudmug, right?\n\nI can take you there when you're ready."]="啊，是的，我听说过他。他好像和泥盏一起去了半山，对吗？\n\n等你准备好，我们就可以上路了。"
G["Ah yes, I've heard about him. He's visiting Mudmug's Place, right?\n\nI can take you when you're ready."]="啊，是的，我听说过他。他好像去了泥盏营地，对吗？\n\n等你准备好，我们就可以上路了。"
G["Ah yes, I've heard about him. He's visiting Pang's Stead, over in Thunderfoot Fields.\n\nYou ready to go?"]="啊，对，我听说过他。他正在雷足原野的庞家农庄做客。\n\n$g你:你;准备好出发了吗？"
G["Ah yes, Sironas. I had nearly forgotten that Sironas was here. I served under Sironas back on Outland. I hadn't heard of this abomination, though; those damnable draenei captured me before I even fully materialized on this world."]="啊，对，我几乎忘了希隆娜丝这回事了。我为希隆娜丝效劳的日子可以追述到外域去，不过我从没有听说过这个“畸变者”。那些该死的德莱尼人在我还没有完全走出太阳之门前就抓住了我。"
G["Ah yes, Skinning.  There is no one finer in wielding a skinning knife than Yonn Deepcut.  You can find him in the great tent at the northwest corner of the village."]="啊,是的，剥皮。没有人比姚恩·深刺还善于运用剥皮刀了。你可以在村庄西北角的大帐篷找到他。"
G["Ah yes, and promptly delivered.  As always, it's a pleasure doing business with you, Corbett."]="好的，马上发货。很高兴和你做生意，科贝特。"
G["Ah yes, another who will stoke the fires and forge the weapons of war. Of course I will teach you how."]="啊是的，另一个要烧炉火并锻造战斗武器的人。我当然会教你怎么操作。"
G["Ah yes, it is Seikwa that you must find.  I believe I saw her last standing out in front of the inn."]="啊是的，你必须找到希克瓦。我记得我最后一次见她时她在旅馆前面站着。"
G["Ah yes, our assault on the Horde town of Taurajo. I struggled with the implications of the decision.\n\nTaurajo was admittedly what you might call a 'soft target,' primarily a hunters' camp. Still, it had been used to recruit, equip, and train Horde infantry for many years.\n\nWhen our scouts reported that Taurajo's most dangerous units were out on the hunt, we had to act quickly."]="啊，对，我们对部落城镇陶拉祖的突袭。我曾为这个决定的后果苦苦挣扎。\n\n平心而论，陶拉祖算是所谓的\"软目标\"，主要是个猎人营地。可多年来，它一直被用来为部落招募、装备和训练步兵。\n\n当我们的斥候报告说陶拉祖最危险的部队外出狩猎时，我们必须迅速行动。"
G["Ah yes. I've heard all about those new flarged things. Armor was removed from the casing to decrease weight. Bargh! Nonsense!"]="嗯，我已经听到过关于那新东西的消息了。他们去掉了防弹装甲来减轻重量，简直是疯了！"
G["Ah yes. One does not forget the taste of amber."]="嗯。琥珀的味道让人难以忘怀。"
G["Ah yes... Wakener, doesn't the scent of blood fill you with new strength?"]="啊……唤醒者，鲜血的气味是否让你重新焕发了活力？"
G["Ah!  Cease the incantations, Anchorite!  Cease, or I will show you such pain that your pathetic people have never imagined!"]="啊！停止你的咒语，学者！停下，否则我会让你体会到你们这些可悲的凡人从未想象过的痛苦！"
G["Ah!  Get back over here!"]="啊！回到这儿来！"
G["Ah!  My wounds are too severe.  Defenders, fight on without me!"]="啊！我的伤太严重了。卫士们，我不在你们要继续战斗！"
G["Ah!  Please, if you see a survivor of Darrowshire, tell them I am free!"]="啊！如果你见到一个达隆郡的幸存者，请告诉他们我自由了！"
G["Ah!  There is my ratchet!  Now let's re-attach these scroll fragments."]="哈！就是这些！现在让我们把卷轴的碎片拼起来吧。"
G["Ah!  Umm... hello there.  I was just inspecting this shell, here.  Carry on!  Nothing to see here!"]="啊！嗯……你好啊。我在这儿只是在检查这个壳。继续！这儿没什么好看的！"
G["Ah! $p! My daughter! I... a vision, she... she's in trouble!"]="啊！$p！我的女儿！我……看到了幻象，她……她遇到麻烦了！"
G["Ah! A challenge!"]="啊！一次挑战！"
G["Ah! A fan of potions? The brewmasters work their concoctions but often miss some of the finer notes to a potion or remedy."]="啊！一个药剂爱好者？酒仙们知道如何调配化合物，但却常常遗漏药剂或疗法的精细配方。"
G["Ah! A grummlepack. Most good."]="啊！一个土地精包裹。好极了。"
G["Ah! A luckydo comes to learn? I have many skills to teach."]="你是来学习的？真是个幸运的家伙。我能教给你很多东西。"
G["Ah! A luckydo comes to the great Grummle Bazaar eh? I smell good fortune in our meeting.\n\nI am called the Lucky Eightcoins. I am named for my best luckydo, the one that gives most pungent smelling fortune."]="啊！土地精大集市迎来了一位幸运儿？我感觉我们的会面会带来好运。\n\n我叫好运的八铜钱。我的名字是根据我最好的幸运符起的，它总能给我带来无比的好运气。"
G["Ah! A very bold decision in times like these. Your honesty is refreshing!\n\nTell me, leader of the Kirin Tor, what if the Horde killed your friends? Your family? Destroyed everything you had. Could you maintain your convictions even then, Archmage $p?"]="啊！在这种时候做出这样的决定，真是大胆。你的坦诚令人耳目一新！\n\n告诉我，肯瑞托的领袖，如果部落杀了你的朋友呢？你的家人呢？毁掉你所拥有的一切呢？即便那样，$g你:你;还能坚持自己的信念吗，大法师 $p？"
G["Ah! Champion, we were just talking about you."]="啊！英雄，我们正谈到你呢。"
G["Ah! Don't talk to me! Tank! Tank! Taunt it off me you filthy thing!"]="啊！别跟我说话！坦住！坦住！把他的注意力吸引过去，你这蠢货！"
G["Ah! Facefull of $c!"]="啊！满脸$c！"
G["Ah! Fresh air at last! I never thought I'd see the day..."]="啊！终于呼吸到新鲜空气了！我从没想过还能见到天日……"
G["Ah! Good fortune to one who times a rescue well."]="啊！愿及时出手相救的人能交上好运。"
G["Ah! Good! You made it. It is time to teach these \"pirate\" hozen why they should not raid our villages."]="啊！好！你来了。是时候让这些\"海盗\"猢狲明白，为什么不该来劫掠我们的村庄了。"
G["Ah! Haha - I can see now what your Alliance fights for."]="啊！呵呵--现在我知道你们联盟为何而战了。"
G["Ah! Help! Sprites!"]="啊！救命！林精！"
G["Ah! Here we are. Over 14,000 years ago, this entire land was ruled by a terrible race of warlords called \"the mogu.\""]="啊！我们到了。一万四千多年前，整片土地都被一个可怕的军阀种族统治，他们被称为\"魔古\"。"
G["Ah! Hero, we were just talking about you."]="啊！英雄，我们正谈到你呢。"
G["Ah! I forgot to reverse the bipolar collaboration inverter."]="啊！我忘记反转两极协同转换器了。"
G["Ah! I was sent here to guide you to the Timeless Isle, but I see you have already made the voyage. I fear I have gotten tangled up in the timeways again."]="啊！我是来引导你前往永恒岛的，但我看到你已经抵达了。我恐怕又把时间流搞混了。"
G["Ah! It's comin' right for me!"]="啊！它朝我冲过来了！"
G["Ah! Look! Goregek can start big-tongue necklace!"]="啊！快看！格利基克可以将大舌头怪串起来做项链！"
G["Ah! My cooldowns!"]="啊！我的技能在冷却！"
G["Ah! Needles on my face!"]="啊！我脸上全是刺！"
G["Ah! Now that was a proper smiting. There is hope for you yet."]="啊！刚才那一下很漂亮。看来你还有点希望。"
G["Ah! Quality materials."]="啊！上等的材料！"
G["Ah! Saurok on-board! Saurok on-board!"]="啊！蜥蜴人上船了！蜥蜴人上船了！"
G["Ah! So you seek items of wonder? Well you have come to the right place!"]="啊！你要找神奇的物品？那你可来对地方了！"
G["Ah! That was close! Quick, quick, stand under metal pole thing! That keep us safe, yeah?"]="啊！差一点！快，快站到金属柱子下！它能保证我们的安全，对吧？"
G["Ah! The \"hero\" who stole my spotlight at Stoneplow.\n\nI kid, I kid. That was a great battle. I am honored to have fought by your side."]="啊！$G这位\"英雄\":这位\"女英雄\";抢了我石犁村的风头。\n\n开玩笑的，开玩笑的。那是一场精彩的战斗。能与你并肩作战是我的荣幸。"
G["Ah! The final piece of the puzzle. The Thunder King took on the powers of Ra-Den, the very essence of a Titan. He united the mogu into an empire and tried to continue the Titans' work. Of course he saw himself as a God!"]="啊！最后一块拼图也齐了。雷电之王窃取了莱登的力量，那是泰坦的精华。他统一魔古帝国，并试图继续泰坦的工作。显然他将自己看成了神！"
G["Ah! This ring will do nicely..."]="啊！这枚戒指就很不错……"
G["Ah! This will give me a chance to test out my Tunnel-Tron Mk V! Hold on tight!"]="啊！我正好可以趁机测试一下我的Mk V型掘地机器人！抓紧了！"
G["Ah! Upon this table, you see Spirit-Sage Gaoquan, the oldest member of our monastery."]="啊！这里坐的是灵魂贤者高全，他是这间禅院最年长的成员。"
G["Ah! We can tell him Hagash stumbled into it and fired it accidentally!"]="啊！我们可以告诉他，是哈加什绊倒了它，然后意外地发射了！"
G["Ah! You have a clean spot, $gbrother:sister;. Let me just get that for you..."]="啊！你身上有一块干净的地方，$g兄弟:姐妹;。让我帮你弄脏……"
G["Ah! You wish to learn of our last and greatest emperor, Shaohao? My friend, I do not have the time here to recount all of his adventures, but his actions ten thousand years ago resonate to this very day."]="啊！你想打听我们最伟大的末代帝王少昊？朋友，我可没时间陪你追溯他一生中的冒险奇遇，可他在万年以前采取的行动，直到今天仍然影响深远。"
G["Ah, $c, good to see you. We need assistance here with gathering supplies in preparation for the impending war at Ahn'Qiraj. I've been asked to put together a great many first aid field kits, and the primary component I need is wool bandages. I already have some, $2079w to be exact, but I need to collect $2080w."]="啊，$c，很高兴见到你。我们正在为安其拉之战收集物资，当然，我们需要你的帮助。我得收集大量的急救物品，主要是绒线绷带。我已经收集到$2079w根绷带了，总的需求量是$2080w。"
G["Ah, $gMaster:Mistress; $n, how might I be of assistance?"]="啊，$g主人:女主人; $n，有什么能为您效劳的？"
G["Ah, $gpriest:priestess;, you came along just in time. I appreciate it."]="啊，$g牧师:女牧师;，你来的正是时候。谢谢你。"
G["Ah, $n - it is good to see you again.  I trust your affairs go well."]="啊，$n——很高兴再次见到你。我相信你的事业进展得很顺利。"
G["Ah, $n!  You're just the person I was hoping to see!  We have enough supplies to send a ground assault against the Horde!  Field Marshal Teravaine is waiting in the Field of Strife for orders...\n\nYou're a brave veteran who's proven himself time and again.  Do you want to deliver Teravaine the orders?"]="啊，$n！你正是我盼着见到的人！我们的补给够了，可以向部落发动一次地面进攻！特拉瓦因元帅正在征战平原等候命令……\n\n你是一位勇敢的老兵，一次次证明了自己。你愿意去给特拉瓦因送命令吗？"
G["Ah, $n! A little bird told me you would be coming.\n\nThat's how Aviana sends messages around."]="啊，$n！有只小鸟告诉我你会来。\n\n艾维娜就是这么传递消息的。"
G["Ah, $n! We meet once more. I helped you attain your swift flight form in Outland.\n\n<Morthis tightens his jaw and shakes his head, his withered eyes sad.>\n\nThese young druids today... they have it too easy."]="啊，$n！我们又见面了。我曾经帮助你在外域实现了迅速飞行。\n\n<莫希斯紧咬住牙关，摇了摇头。他衰弱的双眼中充满了哀伤。>\n\n今天这些年轻的德鲁伊……他们太过轻易就获得了这种能力。"
G["Ah, $n, don't cry. Lucky for you, when last you gave me the amulet, I attuned myself to it. I'll just summon it back from wherever you dropped it.\n\nTry looking in your bags now."]="啊，$n，别哭。你运气真好，上次你把饰品交给我之后，我在饰品上做了点手脚。我可以帮你召唤回丢失的饰品。\n\n现在，翻翻你的包裹吧。"
G["Ah, $n, ya heart be a worthy sacrifice!"]="啊，$n，你的心脏会是一件出色的祭品！"
G["Ah, $p! I was searching for the Hidden Master when I came across this big purple thing with a bunch of little purple things inside.\n\nLooks like an old mogu magic trap. Thankfully they don't know how to build these anymore."]="啊，$p！我在找隐秘大师的时候发现了一个紫色的大家伙，里面还有不少紫色的小物件。\n\n看起来像一个古老的魔古族魔法陷阱。谢天谢地，他们现在不知道怎么造这个陷阱了。"
G["Ah, $p! Just the $c I've been looking for.\n\nDo you remember how the Alliance came to Pandaria? You were there, weren't you? But your presence in that part of Pandaria's timeline is... incomplete. You saw only a portion of the events which transpired that day.\n\nMaybe you fled the chaos of war to walk the peaceful valleys of this land. Or perhaps the call of treasure from dungeons exotic and ancient was louder than the call of your king to find his White Pawn.\n\nRegardless, I am not here to judge. I merely offer a second chance.\n\nSay the word, and I will transport you back to that day. Lion's Landing will not yet have been built, and the Skyfire will loom over Jade Forest."]="啊，$p！正是我要找的 $c。\n\n你还记得联盟是怎么来到潘达利亚的吗？你当时在场，对吧？但你在潘达利亚那段历史中的存在……并不完整。你只看到了那天发生的事件的一部分。\n\n也许你逃离了战乱的混乱，去漫步这片土地宁静的山谷。又或许，那些奇特古老的地下城里的财宝，比你的国王寻找白卒的召唤更响亮。\n\n不管怎样，我不是来评判你的。我只是提供一个第二次机会。\n\n你一句话，我就把$g你:你;送回那一天。那时狮王港尚未建成，天火号还高悬在翡翠林上空。"
G["Ah, $p! These \"sunwalkers\" may not be the Hidden Master, but their fighting style is unlike anything I have ever seen.\n\nI intend to learn from them."]="啊，$p！这些\"日行者\"或许不是那位隐世宗师，可他们的战斗风格是我前所未见的。\n\n我打算向他们学习。"
G["Ah, $r, you have returned!"]="啊，$r，你回来了！"
G["Ah, $r... I possess great knowledge a' da world and how ta create charms a' great power."]="啊，$r……我了解很多关于这个世界的知识，以及如何制造巨大能量的符咒的方法。"
G["Ah, $rs are most useful. Should have more $rs for rainy day."]="$gEl:La; $r es una criatura muy útil. Deberíamos tener más para los días lluviosos."
G["Ah, Alterac Valley, I have fine memories I tell ya.  <sigh>  Well, I cannot join ya, but do me proud just the same!  To get there you'll be wanting to speak with Glordrum Steelbeard at the Hall of Arms here in Ironforge."]="啊，奥特兰克山谷，我跟你说，我对那儿可有美好的回忆。  <suspiro>（叹气）  唉，我没法跟你一起去，但还是要让我以你为荣！要去那儿，你得先跟铁炉堡武器大厅的格洛德鲁姆·钢须谈谈。"
G["Ah, Braenna Flintcrag.  She has magic hands, that one.  Braenna is the one to see about Priestly matters.  \nYe'll want to travel north from the gates of Ironforge to the Hall of Mysteries.  That's where ye'll find her."]="啊，布蕾娜·燧石崖。她那双可是有魔力的手。要办牧师相关的事，就得找布蕾娜。 \n\n你得从铁炉堡大门往北走，去秘法大厅。她就在那儿。"
G["Ah, Champion! You should return every tournament. I will make a fortune."]="啊，勇士！$g你:你;每届锦标赛都该回来。我可要发财了。"
G["Ah, Chimaeron, truly a living testament to my scientific prowess. I reworked and twisted his form countless times over the years, and the final result is truly something to behold."]="啊，奇美隆，这是我的科学力量的活证。我对他进行了多年的加工和改造，才有了现在这杰出的成果。"
G["Ah, Deino, mah sistah. Ta'zinni die now."]="啊，迪诺，我的妹妹。塔辛尼要死了。"
G["Ah, I be needin' a new shrunken head...."]="哈，我需要一些新的战利品了……"
G["Ah, I believe Gimble Thistlefuzz is who ye'll be needing if yer looking to learn the Enchanter's profession.  Ye'll find Gimble in his shop, Thistlefuzz Arcanery, right by the Gryphon Master at The Great Forge."]="啊，要是你想成为一名附魔师的话，我想你需要找吉布·草须。他在 大熔炉狮鹫管理人右边的商店草须魔法用品店里。"
G["Ah, I can sense it - you've won the day! I believe I can safely transport you to Stratholme now, provided you've paid my colleague there a visit first. Just step into the circle and be patient..."]="啊，我能感受到——你获胜啦！如果你已经拜访过我在斯坦索姆的同伴，我想现在我能将你安全传送到那儿了。来，走到法阵中来，耐心等待……"
G["Ah, I love the smell of Stonard! It smells like... like... orc sweat. And rot. Still, combined, the effect can be quite pleasant! It's an acquired scent."]="啊，我热爱斯通纳德的气息。就好像……好像……兽人的汗液。还混合着腐烂的味道。你知道，混合的气味总是很好闻的！"
G["Ah, I remember now! I gave the mysterious fossil to Hollee! Check with her."]="啊！现在我记起来了！我把那块神秘的化石交给霍莉了！去问问她吧。"
G["Ah, I see it now in your mind.  This is the work of one of my former students... Mehlar Dawnblade.  It is sad to know that his heart has turned so dark."]="啊，我明白了。是我的学生让你来的……麦拉·黎明之刃。他的心灵竟然变得如此黑暗，这真令我伤心。"
G["Ah, I see what kind of $c you are, $n! Now then, the second verse is all about Fanny and Firebeard getting together.\n\nWhat rhymes with \"Professed?\""]="啊，我看出来你是哪种 $c 了，$n！那么接下来，第二段讲的是芬妮和火须走到一起。\n\n有什么词能跟\"宣誓\"押韵？"
G["Ah, I see you are a friend to the Consortium. Perhaps you would be interested in making a purchase?"]="啊，我注意到你是星界财团的朋友。也许你有兴趣买点东西？"
G["Ah, I see you have found a few of my experiments.  Step closer, and you may witness the full glory of my work here."]="啊，看来你已经见识了我的部分实验。再靠近点儿，我在这里的杰作会让你大开眼界。"
G["Ah, I see you toil with relics of the past."]="啊，你终于带着那些古物回来了。"
G["Ah, I see.  Looks like I'm part of the Horde now."]="啊，我明白了。看样子，现在我已经是部落的一员了。"
G["Ah, I see.  Well, I guess I'm off to work then."]="啊，我明白了。我猜我应该去工作了。"
G["Ah, I see..."]="啊，我明白了……"
G["Ah, I suppose that I am getting ahead of myself. Ras Frostwhisper is the overseer of this school. The being responsible for training all of its Dark Masters. A lieutenant and favored pupil of Kel'Thuzad. He was once a hedge mage of Stromgarde: A rogue wizard that never received his formal training from Dalaran.\n\nWhen Kel'Thuzad opened the Cult, Ras was among the first to join his ranks. Ras knew that through dark magic, he would find immortality."]="啊，我想我说得太快了。莱斯·霜语是通灵学院的管理者，他负责训练所有的黑暗大师，他是克尔苏加德最欣赏的学生和下属。他曾经是激流堡的法师，一个从来没有接受过达拉然正规训练的流浪巫师。\n\n当克尔苏加德开设诅咒神教的时候，莱斯就是首批加入其中的人，因为他知道通过黑暗魔法可以获得不朽。"
G["Ah, I understand.  Off to work!"]="啊，我明白。去工作！"
G["Ah, I'll make him some fresh bread! I need to get some flour from Martha!"]="啊，我烤些新鲜的面包吧！我找马尔萨要面粉去。"
G["Ah, Lieutenant General Orion. I've come to report that casualties are well within acceptable levels for this operation. In fact, the wounded are quite... ah... lively."]="啊，沃雷恩中将。我是来为这次行动作报告的，伤亡人数目前在我们可以接受的范围之内。事实上，伤者还很……精神着呢。"
G["Ah, Maloriak. How gracious of you to finally appear from that quarantine you call a laboratory. What have you got this time?"]="啊，马洛拉克。你可算从那间被你叫做实验室的隔离屋走出来了，你这次有什么成果？"
G["Ah, Nazgrim. A great leader and a fine warrior. He valued his oath to the Warchief more than his life."]="啊，纳兹戈林。他是个好领袖，好战士。他珍视自己的誓言胜过生命。"
G["Ah, Ner'zhul. Not a name that should be uttered lightly, but I did ask you for an answer.\n\nAnd Ner'zhul is the correct one."]="啊， 耐奥祖。这名字不应如此轻松地说出，但是我确实要求你说出一个答案。\n\n耐奥祖是正确的答案。"
G["Ah, Noblegarden. So amusing to watch others throw away their dignity in favor of hunting colored eggs. Still, they do have a curious magical aura to them..."]="啊，复活节。看到人们放下尊严，四处搜寻彩蛋，真是有趣啊。显然，这些彩蛋拥有某种特殊的魔力……"
G["Ah, Private Hendel. A pleasure to meet one of the men who would betray his kingdom for pride."]="啊，亨德尔下士。很高兴能与一个为了自尊而背叛了自己的国家的人见面。"
G["Ah, Stonebrow doesn't leave Ironforge much these days so if ye're looking to learn the tailor's profession ye'll have to go to see him up in Ironforge."]="啊，石眉这些日子不怎么离开铁炉堡的，如果你想要学做一名裁缝的话，就去铁炉堡找他吧。"
G["Ah, The Gilded Rose... with its soft down beds and warm baths... just thinking about that Inn makes me want to... ::yawn:: Lucky you if you're heading over there...  you will find it in the west side of the Trade District.   ...nice soft pillows, warm blankets.  ::yawn::"]="啊，镶金玫瑰……柔软的绒床和温暖的浴池……光是想起那家旅店就让我想……::打哈欠:: $g你:你;要是去那儿可就享福了……它在贸易区西侧。   ……柔软舒适的枕头，暖和的毯子。  ::打哈欠::"
G["Ah, Tortolla! Often misunderstood and always, always underestimated. Creatures who move effortlessly between land and sea look to Tortolla as their patron ancient.\n\nTen thousand years ago the Burning Legion invaded Azeroth, and Tortolla was among the ancients who took to the field of battle alongside Cenarius and the mortal races.\n\nAs the demon hordes crashed against the front lines of the beleaguered defenders, they didn't know what to make of Tortolla. At first they tried to ignore him, but his terrible weight and crushing jaws laid waste to hundreds..."]="啊，托尔托拉！它总是被误解，总是被低估。那些在陆地和海洋之间轻松穿行的生物都会将托尔托拉当作神祗和祖先来崇拜。\n\n一万年以前，燃烧军团入侵艾泽拉斯。托尔托拉与塞纳留斯和其他凡间种族共赴战场。\n\n当恶魔大军对守卫者们的阵线发动冲击的时候，他们拿托尔托拉毫无办法。一开始，他们对它并不在意。但托尔托拉可怕的重量和致命的双颚在转瞬间就杀死了成百上千的恶魔……"
G["Ah, Ysera the Dreamer."]="啊，梦境之神伊瑟拉。"
G["Ah, Zaetar... <Celebras looks away.>\n\nMy father, Remulos, tried to stop him...\n\nZaetar was headstrong, and when he fell for an earthen elemental princess, my father knew that their union was cursed, but Zaetar refused to listen.\n\nThe centaur are the result of his mistake. They were born misshapen and hateful; my uncle Zaetar was killed by his own kin...\n\nThe evil princess, Theradras, still guards his remains here in the crystal caverns."]="啊，扎尔塔……<塞雷布拉斯把头扭了过去。>\n\n我的父亲雷姆洛斯试图阻止他……\n\n扎尔塔太顽固了，当他爱上一位土元素公主时，我父亲就知道他们的结合将受到诅咒，但是扎尔塔拒绝听从父亲的意见。\n\n他因此变成了半人马。他们生下来就带着畸形的躯体，并充满仇恨；我的叔叔扎尔塔被自己的亲戚所杀……\n\n那个邪恶的瑟莱德丝公主，还在水晶洞穴内守护着他的遗体。"
G["Ah, a $r. I haven't killed one of your kind in a while."]="啊，一个 $r。我可有阵子没杀过$g你:你;这种家伙了。"
G["Ah, a brawler are ye'? You'll find your pandaren friend at the Stonefire Tavern."]="啊，你是武僧吧？你可以在石火旅店找到你的熊猫人朋友。"
G["Ah, a chance to use this freshly sharpened blade."]="哈，有机会试试我这把利刃了。"
G["Ah, a fellow Fisherman. Are you perhaps in need of a little training? Maybe I can show you a thing or two?"]="啊，同行钓手。你是不是需要学点什么？也许我能教$g你:你;一两手？"
G["Ah, a fellow ranger. What do you need?"]="啊，一个猎人伙伴。你需要什么？"
G["Ah, a fellow warlock who has proven $ghis:her; worth to some degree.\n\nI am pleased to meet your acquaintance. My name is Menara Voidrender... and not without just cause.\n\nYou seem powerful and well-learned enough that other tools... more powerful tools... would be welcome and not foolishly imparted. If this is true, then speak to me further. If not, well then, you know your way  back to the docks and off into the ocean."]="啊，一位多少证明了自己价值的术士同道。\n\n很高兴认识你。我叫梅娜拉·虚空撕裂者……这名字可不是随便起的。\n\n$g你:你;看起来足够强大、足够博学，足以承受其他的工具……更强大的工具……而不会被白白浪费。若果真如此，就再跟我说下去。若不是，那么，$g你:你;认得回码头、然后出海的路。"
G["Ah, a good question.\n\nIf you prefer hunting in the great outdoors, there are elementals here in the Plaguelands, Azshara, Burning Steppes, Felwood, Silithus, Winterspring, and even Un'Goro Crater.\n\nIf you are the type that laughs in the face of danger, then perhaps you should visit Dire Maul. I have heard that a great many elemental abberations exist within its walls. You would also do well in seeking out the elementals employed by the Dark Iron dwarves of Blackrock Depths."]="啊，这个问题问得好。\n\n如果你喜欢在户外狩猎，那么在瘟疫之地，艾萨拉，燃烧平原，费伍德，希利苏斯，冬泉谷，甚至是安戈洛环形山都有元素生物的存在。\n\n如果你更喜欢直接挑战危险，那么就去厄运之槌吧。我听说大量变异元素都躲在厄运之槌的高墙之后。当然，你也可以在黑石深渊那里找到大量被黑铁矮人所雇佣的元素生物。"
G["Ah, a good stash of things."]="啊，一大堆东西。"
G["Ah, a new arrival. Right this way, sir."]="啊，一个新人。这边走，先生。"
G["Ah, a new challenge, Illusionary Conquerors! When they become enraged, they strike with incredible power."]="一个新挑战：幻影征服者！当它们暴怒时，它们的攻击凶狠异常。"
G["Ah, a new champion to aid our cause? What say you, $n?"]="啊，一个来帮助我们的新勇士？你说呢，$n？"
G["Ah, a new subject? I will take you apart... piece by piece!"]="啊，一个新标本？我要把你撕成……碎片！"
G["Ah, a scrollmaker! You'll be looking for inks and vellum, I suppose? They can be found in the chamber of masters, to the left as you enter the building.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="啊，来了一位绘卷大师！我想你在寻找墨水和羊皮纸，对吗？在师匠大厅里可以找到这些，就位于你进入建筑物时的左侧。\n\n我会在你的地图上标记这个位置。"
G["Ah, a scrollmaker! You'll be looking for inks and vellum, I suppose? They can be found in the crafter's hall, to the left as you enter the building.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="啊，来了一位绘卷大师！我想你在寻找墨水和羊皮纸，对吗？在工匠大厅内可以发现他们，就位于你进入建筑物时的左侧。\n\n我会在你的地图上标记这个位置。"
G["Ah, a seasoned veteran you once were. Kilram can make you this again. I know you are capable, you merely need to ask and I shall teach you the way of the axesmith."]="啊，你曾经是位久经沙场的老兵。基尔拉姆能让你重拾旧业。我知道你有这个本事，你只要开口，我就教$g你:你;斧匠之道。"
G["Ah, a visitor! This is an incredible time for Pandaria - the mists have parted, and we rejoin the world. You come in peace, I hope?"]="一位访客！潘达利亚正在非常时期——迷雾散去，再次现世。你应该是为了和平而来的吧？"
G["Ah, a young warrior to be no doubt!  I take it you are participating in Children's Week, yes?  It warms these weary bones to hear that you are setting the example by which others will be sure to follow.\n\nI'd be delighted to oblige you and the young lad.  Hrmm... what advice should I give to him?  Listen to the spirits, yes... maybe something about eating all of his vegetables too..."]="啊，想必是要成为年轻战士的！我猜你正在参加儿童周，对吧？听说你在以身作则、供他人效仿，真让我这把老骨头心里发暖。\n\n我很乐意帮$g你:你;和这个小伙子的忙。嗯……我该给他什么建议呢？要聆听先祖之灵，对……也许再说说要把他所有的蔬菜都吃完……"
G["Ah, and the fool who freed me shall be among the first to quell my immense hunger."]="¡Ah, $gel insensato:la insensata; que me liberó estará entre los primeros que sacien mi inmensa hambre!"
G["Ah, another $c looking to be a gladiator, eh? Good!\nI sell the arena team charters you'll need to participate in ranking Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit matches."]="啊，$g又一个:又一个;想当$g角斗士:角斗士;的 $c，是吧？很好！\n\n我出售竞技场队伍注册表，这是参加热砂格斗巡回赛排名赛所必需的。"
G["Ah, another Darkspear Warrior sacrificed on my altar. One by one, you shall all perish."]="啊，又一名暗矛战士被放到了我的祭坛上。一个接一个，你们终将彻底毁灭。"
G["Ah, another admirer! My reputation precedes me, I'm sure.\n\nDon't worry, someday perhaps you and I will ride together."]="啊，又一位仰慕者！我的名声想必早已传开了。\n\n别急，也许有一天，$g你:你;我会并肩驰骋。"
G["Ah, another stranger from beyond the mists."]="啊，又一个来自迷雾之外的旅行者。"
G["Ah, as the title states I am an assassin for the Scarlet Crusade. I spend my days exterminating high priority targets and nights at the Gadgetzan discotheque. Dancing is my true calling. Assassination just pays the bills."]="啊，如我头衔所述，我是一名血色十字军的刺客。我每天白天研究着最优先目标的资料，晚上就去加基森的舞厅里放纵一下。好吧，其实跳舞才是我的正业，偶尔出去做点杀手活计赚点钱，付帐单。"
G["Ah, back where it belongs. Thank you!"]="啊，物归原主了。谢谢你！"
G["Ah, beautiful Menethil Harbor, with the best mead this side of Ironforge."]="啊，美丽的米奈希尔港，还有铁炉堡这边最好的蜂蜜酒！"
G["Ah, because you are an actor in this tale!\n\nMuch better than simply reading history from some musty old scroll, wouldn't you agree?\n\nNow go forward, and learn!"]="啊，因为你将是这个故事中的一名演员！\n\n比起从落满灰尘的卷轴上阅读历史，这样会更有趣，你说呢？\n\n现在，快出发吧，好好学习！"
G["Ah, but it is you who intrudes on our master's territory.  He could wipe you out in an instant for that transgression alone!  Arthas does not have much love or patience for his escaped slaves."]="但是，你闯入了主上的领域。就凭僭越入侵这一点，他就有权处决你！阿尔萨斯大人对那些逃跑的奴隶没有任何的怜悯与仁慈！"
G["Ah, but such terrible works!"]="啊，多么可怕的工作！"
G["Ah, but there is a problem with creating a living weapon. Do you see?"]="呃，但是创造一种有生命的武器会出现一个问题，你知道吗？"
G["Ah, but were you expecting this?"]="啊，可你想到这个了吗？"
G["Ah, but which one is da real one?"]="啊，可哪个才是真的？"
G["Ah, but you're no stranger to your past! A Pandaren from the Wandering Isle. I admit, I thought your homeland was just a legend. Pandaren from the Isle are far more adventurous than those on the mainland... it's in your blood!"]="啊，你的过往似曾相识！我承认，我曾以为你的家乡迷踪岛只是个传说。岛上的熊猫人比大陆上的更爱冒险……冒险的精神流淌在你们血液中！"
G["Ah, come on! Dis' deal be a good one and ya know it ya snuffler."]="啊，来吧！这绝对是笔好买卖，你只要一闻就知道。"
G["Ah, crap. You're on your own with this one, $p."]="啊，废物。你要自己对付这个家伙了，$P。"
G["Ah, damn it all! Clever trap. Too bad you'll never live to tell the tale..."]="啊，该死！聪明的陷阱。很可惜，你永远不能活着讲述这个故事了……"
G["Ah, dragon rearing.\n\nOnce these beauties grow up, my fool brother will have nothing on me!"]="啊，驯龙。\n\n等这些美丽的家伙长大后，就能把我那蠢哥哥比下去了！"
G["Ah, empty again!"]="啊，又空了！"
G["Ah, excellent! Let the festivities begin. Let us retire to the terrace. Now, where did I put my drink?"]="啊，太棒了！宴会要开始了。我们回到露台去吧。对了，我把酒放在哪里了？"
G["Ah, feel the magic seep into the cave, my little elves... muhahaha."]="啊，感受渗入洞穴的魔法之力吧，我的小精灵……木哈哈哈！"
G["Ah, finally some action. Lok'tar Ogar!"]="啊，总算能活动了。 Lok'tar Ogar！"
G["Ah, freedom!  Although brief, so sweet it is..."]="啊，自由！虽然短暂，却如此甜美……"
G["Ah, fresh air at last! I need a moment to rest."]="啊，新鲜的空气！我要休息一下。"
G["Ah, fresh air! I can get myself back to the airstrip from here. Be sure to tell Fizzcrank I'm back and safe. Thanks so much, $n!"]="啊，清新的空气！我能自己返回机场啦。记得转告菲兹兰克我已经平安啦。谢谢你，$n！"
G["Ah, fresh meat for the dogs!"]="啊，喂狗的鲜肉送上门了！"
G["Ah, fresh meat for the dogs."]="啊！狗崽子们又有鲜肉吃了。"
G["Ah, fresh meat!"]="啊，新鲜的肉！"
G["Ah, fresh sustenance!"]="啊，新鲜的食物！"
G["Ah, gentle Seriadne.  All animals are safe while in her care.  You can find her just outside the Inn in Dolanaar."]="啊，友善的瑟里亚迪。在她的庇护下，所有动物都很安全。你可以在多兰纳尔的旅馆外找到她。"
G["Ah, good $n.  Now let us see what tale these heads tell..."]="Ah, $gbuen:buena; $n. Vamos a ver qué nos cuentan estas cabezas..."
G["Ah, good of you to come around, Ruusk. Thank you and farewell."]="啊，至少你的脑子还不蠢，卢斯克。多谢，请保重。"
G["Ah, good ol' Brandur Ironhammer.  There's no doubt he'll provide ye with the guidance ye seek, $glad : lass;.  Ye'll find him in the Hall of Mysteries north of the gates of Ironforge."]="啊，布兰度尔·铁锤。毫无疑问，他能为你提供指导，$g小伙子:姑娘;。在铁炉堡大门以北的神秘大厅中能找到他。"
G["Ah, good to see you, my friend!\n\nHungry?"]="啊，很高兴见到你，我的朋友！\n\n饿了吗？"
G["Ah, good, I see you are not easily distracted. We Pandaren are extremely focused on the moment, sometimes to our detriment."]="啊，很好，看来要让你分心并不容易。我们熊猫人总是只关注当下，有时反而是种妨碍。"
G["Ah, good, a $c. We could use more of your kind for some of these tasks."]="啊，好，一位 $c。这些任务里有些正需要更多$g你:你;这样的人。"
G["Ah, good.  These spores have rendered nicely.  Thank you, $n."]="啊，很好。这些孢子相当不错。谢谢你，$n。"
G["Ah, good... more parts!"]="啊，很好……送上门来的零件！"
G["Ah, guests of the Master. I hope you've been watching your step in here."]="啊，主人的贵客。希望您在这里没有到处乱走。"
G["Ah, hello there, $r!\n\nThis is where we keep all our farming history and knowledge.\n\nWe have records of the local weather and resulting harvest, detailed notes on every seed and every plant that grows in the Valley, and even a bank of seeds for all the plants that we may ever need to grow.\n\nThis knowledge is sacred to us. If disaster should ever strike this land, our seeds must be saved."]="啊，你好，$r！\n\n这是保留我们所有耕种历史和知识的地方。\n\n我们记录当地的天气，以及相应的收成，详细到谷里的每一粒种子和每一棵植物，甚至我们可能会不断种植的一堆种子。\n\n这些知识对我们而言是神圣的。即使有一天灾难会降临到这片土地上，我们也必须要保存这些种子。"
G["Ah, hello there, $r. As you can see, I'm not open for business quite yet. Now, if you'll excuse me, I'm very busy."]="啊，你好啊，$r。就像你所看到的那样，我还没开张。对不起，我现在很忙。"
G["Ah, here at last! It's going to feel so good to get rid of these barrels."]="哈，终于到这里了！摆脱了那些木桶的感觉真好。"
G["Ah, here he is."]="啊，他在这儿呢。"
G["Ah, here is the boy. Doesn't he look special? My late husband and I always wanted children."]="啊，这孩子在这儿。他看起来很特别吧？我和我的亡夫一直都想要个孩子。"
G["Ah, here it is."]="哈，就是它了。"
G["Ah, here we are!  Well let's get to work, shall we...?"]="啊，我们到了！让我们开始工作，好吗……？"
G["Ah, here we are. Oh - oh, these old bones are tired. More than you can imagine."]="啊，到了。唉，我这把老骨头可累惨了，绝对超出你的想象。"
G["Ah, here's one."]="哈，这里有一个。"
G["Ah, here's the $c I was telling you about."]="Ah, aquí está quien te había mencionado."
G["Ah, here's the $g hero : heroine; of the hour now! Good to see you again, $n! I trust that you're still destroying the Scourge wherever you find them?"]="啊，我们的大$g英雄:女英雄;登场了！很高兴再次见到你，$n！我相信你还在哪儿见着天灾就灭在哪儿吧？"
G["Ah, hits the spot!"]="啊，太棒了！"
G["Ah, if it isn't my favorite master assassin! I was hoping I would find you here in Pandaria."]="啊，这不是我最仰慕的刺客大师吗！我一直希望能在潘达利亚找到你呢。"
G["Ah, it is good to be free of my bonds! Have you freed Tog'thar yet? The humans split us up after our capture."]="哈，自由了，感觉真好！托格萨也被救出来了吗？在我们被俘后，人类就把我们给分开关押了。"
G["Ah, it is not yet over. From what I see, we face the trial of the yaungol. Let me shed some light..."]="啊，还没完呢。看来，我们正面临野牛人的挑战。让我解释一下……"
G["Ah, it was a difficult battle. So sad to have lost friends.\nThough, I am glad I had them build the battlefield refreshment device.\nWithout it, and without the power of my stout brew, who knows how many more would have been lost..."]="啊，那一仗打得很艰苦。失去了朋友，真是令人悲痛。\n\n不过，幸好我让他们造了那个战场提神装置。\n\n没有它，再加上没有我那烈性麦酒的力量，谁知道还会多损失多少人……"
G["Ah, it's about time. Will you free me, or did you have... other ideas?"]="啊，总算到时候了。你要放我出来，还是另有……别的打算？"
G["Ah, it's you, $n! Welcome into our sanctuary. Rest and refresh yourself; you have more than earned it."]="啊，是你，$n！欢迎来到我们的圣所。好好休息、恢复精神吧；这完全是$g你:你;应得的。"
G["Ah, just in time for your cleansing, $r. I shall wax the impurities from your soul."]="啊，你来得正是时候，正好做净化，$r。我要把你灵魂中的杂质彻底清除。"
G["Ah, let me see. Yes probably nearing a hundred times now I'd wager!"]="嗯，让我看看。我敢打赌，足有一百次了！"
G["Ah, liquid gold. Gather up every last drop!"]="啊，液体黄金。每一滴都要收集好！"
G["Ah, look at the time! I must return to my post... up over there."]="啊，看看时间！我必须返回那边的哨岗去了……"
G["Ah, look. Here comes $n, escorting your bride!"]="看啊，$n来了，还送来了你的新娘！"
G["Ah, many apologies young master. You must be at least this high to utilize a teleportation spell.\n\n<Maltrake makes an approximation of height with his right hand, hovering it at about knee length.>\n\nCome back when you've grown up."]="啊，非常抱歉，小主人。$g你:你;得至少有这么高才能使用传送法术。\n\n<马尔特雷克用右手比了个大概的高度，停在差不多膝盖的位置。>\n\n等$g你:你;长大点再来吧。"
G["Ah, many apologies young master. You must be at least this high to utilize a teleportation spell.\n\n<Peoreth makes an approximation of height with his right hand, hovering it at about knee length.>\n\nCome back when you've grown up."]="啊，非常抱歉，小主人。$g你:你;得至少有这么高才能使用传送法术。\n\n<佩奥瑞斯用右手比了个大概的高度，停在差不多膝盖的位置。>\n\n等$g你:你;长大点再来吧。"
G["Ah, mistletoe..."]="啊，槲寄生……"
G["Ah, more essence to capture..."]="啊，我要吸取更多的精华……"
G["Ah, more lambs to the slaughter!"]="啊，又来了一群小绵羊！"
G["Ah, more of Vol'jin's revolutionaries. You've made it."]="啊，是沃金的起义军。你们来了。"
G["Ah, much appreciated, Corbett.  We'll get these on the racks immediately."]="太感谢你了，科贝特。我马上就把这些货物放到柜上出售。"
G["Ah, much better. Those bindings were so tight."]="啊，这下好多了。那些玩意儿缠得太紧了。"
G["Ah, much improved."]="啊，这下好多了。"
G["Ah, my back!"]="啊，我的背！"
G["Ah, my sweet Brandy, I miss her so!"]="啊，我心爱的白兰地，我太思念她了！"
G["Ah, new customers. Welcome!"]="啊，有新客人来了，欢迎欢迎！"
G["Ah, new slaves have arrived. Taskmistresses, see that they are properly outfitted and set to work!"]="啊，新的奴隶来啦。瓦格里工头们，给他们分配工作，让他们马上开工！"
G["Ah, noble is your lineage! Your people possess GREAT power, and all the terrible burdens that come with it. Equally great has been your suffering. Now I see why you call yourself  'Blood' elves."]="啊，你的血统很高贵！你的族人拥有强大的力量，以及随之而来的一切可怕重负。你们所受的苦难同样深重。现在我明白你们为什么自称\"血\"精灵了。"
G["Ah, nothing better than a priest to cure what ails ye.  Of course a nice tall pint cures a lot of what ails ye too, but I don't think Braenna Flintcrag teaches brewing.  I guess ye'll have to settle for some priest training over in the Hall of Mysteries instead."]="啊，没有谁比牧师更擅长治疗病痛了。当然喝得酩酊大醉也能解除痛苦，但是我想布莱纳·火崖并不懂得酿酒。我认为你该在神秘大厅进行一些牧师的培训。"
G["Ah, nothing like a good drink!"]="啊，没有什么比畅饮一通更好的了！"
G["Ah, nothing quite like a ride on a gryphon, is there?  The night elves can keep those hippo's of theirs, just give me a gryphon and the wind in me hair!  \nWell now, I won't keep ye any longer, just head over to Gryth Thurden on the east side of The Great Forge and he'll get ye on yer way."]="啊，没有什么比骑狮鹫飞行更痛快的了，对吧？暗夜精灵就留着他们那些河马吧，我只要一头狮鹫和吹过发间的风！ \n\n好了，我不再耽搁你了，去大锻炉东侧找格里斯·瑟登，他会帮你上路。"
G["Ah, of course! My old friend from the Jade Forest!"]="啊！我来自翡翠林的老朋友！"
G["Ah, one of my favorite customers. You look to be of a warlock of some power, $n. I am pleased to meet you. If there is anything I can do for you, please, just ask.\n\nMy brother and I feel that it will be your kind who lead us into the next great era. One with such power... such control... it's only a matter of time before the Legion itself bends to your will.\n\nI am but a little envious."]="啊，我最喜欢的顾客之一。你看起来是位颇有权能的术士，$n。很高兴认识你。如果有什么我能为你效劳的，请尽管开口。\n\n我和我兄弟都认为，将带领我们进入下一个伟大时代的，正是你这样的人。拥有那样的力量……那样的掌控力……燃烧军团本身向你屈膝，也只是时间问题。\n\n我都有点羡慕了。"
G["Ah, one of our own. It is good to see our numbers are growing so rapidly that I can no longer keep track of the faces of our members.\n\nThat fool Thrall thinks I am working hard to cleanse the image of warlocks and prove we are his servants. Idiot! The Burning Legion will make ash of this entire world after it drains it completely."]="啊，是我们的人。很高兴看到我们的队伍增长如此迅速，以至于我都记不清每个人的容貌了。\n\n萨尔那个傻子认为我正努力改善术士的形象并为他服务呢。白痴！燃烧军团在耗尽这世界的资源后会将它化为灰烬的。"
G["Ah, our esteemed guests have arrived!"]="啊，我们尊敬的客人来了！"
G["Ah, our first enemy! Illusionary Rippers are but simple warriors. Now, let us do this!"]="第一个敌人！幻影撕裂者只是普通战士。来干掉他们吧！"
G["Ah, perhaps one of your skills can make our sparring sessions more interesting. Protect the temple healers from assailants for as long as you are able."]="呃，或许你有个技能能让我们的训练课程变得更加有趣。尽你所能，保护寺院的治疗者免受入侵者的攻击。"
G["Ah, reinforcements!"]="啊，援军来了！"
G["Ah, seeking the masters of the arcane? You can find Quithas and the other magisters within the Sunfury Spire."]="啊，你在找传授神秘魔法的导师吗？你可以在日怒之塔找到奎恩萨斯和其他的魔导师。"
G["Ah, seeking training, are you? There are several instructors who are camped in Azure Watch... what are you after?"]="啊，你是想要训练吗？有几个导师在碧蓝岗哨那里……你想学什么？"
G["Ah, so it's a duel you want?  Then a duel you shall have!"]="啊，这么说你想决斗？那就如你所愿！"
G["Ah, so my minions from the Burning Steppes have brought the dragons..."]="啊，我在燃烧平原的仆从带来了龙……"
G["Ah, so that is how they pushed the Dark Iron to the lower parts of the Spire."]="啊，他们就是这样将黑铁驱逐到黑石塔下部的。"
G["Ah, so that's who you are. I've already heard stories of your deeds, $N. I will write stories about you so that you will be remembered, you have my word."]="哦，原来就是你啊。我听说过你的事迹，$n。我一定会把你的故事写下来，让你名留青史，我说到做到。"
G["Ah, so there is one who wishes to taste the might of the Metal Brew?"]="啊，有人想知道金铁酒有多带劲儿？"
G["Ah, so very close. But you must remain CENTERED. Inner harmony is crucial to your survival on this land. Come, let us try again!"]="啊，只差一点。你得守住本心。要在这里生存下去，平和的心态是关键。来，再试一次！耐心也是熊猫人的美德。"
G["Ah, so you're an up and coming chef, are you? You can find everything you need from Barleyflower. She sells her wares in the keggery.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="啊，看来你是位崭露头角的厨师？$g你:你;需要的一切都能从大麦花那里找到。她在一家酒桶铺里卖货。\n\n我会把位置标在$g你:你;的地图上。"
G["Ah, so you've left your hole?  The Lady will claim you soon enough."]="啊，你离开了你的藏身洞？女士很快就会取你性命的。"
G["Ah, so... you have found it.\n\n<Mathredis points to the book in your possession.>\n\nHave you collected the necessary components?\n\nThe manifestations listed in the libram, imbecile!"]="啊，这么说……你已经找到了。\n\n<玛瑟迪斯指着你手中的书。>\n\n你收集到所需要的材料了吗？\n\n那些材料都已经在书中列出来了，笨蛋！"
G["Ah, speak of the devil..."]="啊，说到就到了……"
G["Ah, such an odd place to find potential customers!"]="啊，在这么个奇怪的地方居然也有潜在的顾客！"
G["Ah, such troubling thoughts. Our last emperor advised us not to live in the shadow of fear. Do you see now why we love to drink and celebrate?"]="啊，这想法真令人不安。我们的末代皇帝建议我们不要活在恐惧的阴影里。现在你明白为什么我们喜欢喝酒和欢庆了吗？"
G["Ah, sure."]="啊，当然。"
G["Ah, sweet, sweet bloodthistle... Probably left behind by one of those filthy addicts at Eclipse Point."]="啊，好棒的血蓟……也许是日蚀岗哨那里的某个瘾君子留下来的。"
G["Ah, thank you Tong."]="啊，谢谢你，童福。"
G["Ah, thank you kindly. I will leave you to the library while I tend to this small matter."]="啊，非常感谢。当我料理好这件小事之后就去图书馆。"
G["Ah, thank you! I'll be sure to go get them soon."]="啊，谢谢你！我一会就去。"
G["Ah, thank you! Suffice it to say... Negotiations did proceed as planned."]="啊，感谢你！应该说……谈判是按照计划进行的。"
G["Ah, that sure does hit the spot!  I think I'll get myself a couple more...can you watch these barrels for me, $n?"]="啊，真妙！我想要再来两杯……你能帮我照看一下这些桶吗，$n？"
G["Ah, that's sweet of you mon, but we already got all the heavy leather that we need. And here I'm sure that your knife is still sharp. Maybe you can put it to use helping the others with their collections, no?  Have a good one!"]="啊，你心肠真好，但是我们已经集齐备战所需的重皮了。我想你的剥皮小刀还很锋利吧，或许你可以四下看看其他人是否需要帮助。祝你好运！"
G["Ah, the Horde... meddling, as always. I suppose a welcome is in order. So welcome, insects. Welcome to my world."]="啊，部落……还是这么爱管闲事。我觉得应该好好欢迎一下你们。那么，欢迎，蝼蚁们。欢迎来到我的世界。"
G["Ah, the Illusionary Banana-Tosser! It will rapidly toss bananas toward you. Move to avoid them. Prevent it from running away from you, if you can."]="啊，幻影掷蕉兵。它会向你快速投掷香蕉，你可以通过移动来躲避。你要尽量避免让它拉开距离。"
G["Ah, the Promised One has arrived. Welcome to Stillpine Hold."]="Ah, $gel Prometido:la Prometida; ha llegado. $gBienvenido:Bienvenida; al Bastión Semprepino."
G["Ah, the Winter Wondervolt. What will we think of next?"]="啊，冬幕欢乐制造器。下一次我们该想点什么？"
G["Ah, the ancient Vaults of the Kings of Mogu'shan. What might this button do...?"]="啊，魔古山帝王的宝库。这个按钮有什么用…?"
G["Ah, the beauty of Shadowglen never ceases to delight my senses!"]="啊，幽影谷的美景永远使我感到快乐！"
G["Ah, the dragon child and the hero. Together you will achieve great things."]="啊，巨龙之子和他的英雄。你们俩必将成就伟大的事业。"
G["Ah, the entertainment has arrived!"]="啊，娱乐节目要开始了！"
G["Ah, the entertainment has arrived."]="啊，娱乐要开始了！"
G["Ah, the familiar embrace of the storms...."]="啊，久违的风暴之拥……"
G["Ah, the food be arrivin'."]="啊，食物自己送上门了。"
G["Ah, the hand of the Ebon Blade has finally come to claim me. I tremble in fear."]="哎呀，黑锋骑士团派人来杀我了。我害怕得发抖啊。"
G["Ah, the hero. Your little friends said you would come. This certainly saves me the trouble of hunting you down myself."]="啊，英雄。我听你的小伙伴说，你会来的。这样挺好的，省去了我亲自搜寻你的麻烦。"
G["Ah, the lair of the beasts. While I admire the Zandalari skill with beasts I am more impressed with their ability to endure this foul odor.\n\nKeep a devilsaur upwind of you and it will never catch you off guard."]="啊，兽栏。虽然我很欣赏赞达拉的驯兽技巧，但我更佩服他们忍受恶臭的本事。\n\n只要让魔暴龙处在你的逆风方向，它就休想偷袭到你。"
G["Ah, the protective layer is nearly gone. Do you hear that, heroes? That... That is the sound of inevitability. Of your hopes and dreams being crushed under the weight of my being."]="啊，保护屏障就要消失了。英雄，你们听见了吗？那……那就是不可避免的宿命。你的希望和梦想在我面前是那么不堪一击。"
G["Ah, the sweet salt air of Ratchet."]="啊，棘齿城！清新的海风！我回来了！"
G["Ah, the tower of Krolmir. It is said that the power of Thorim has been used only once... and that it turned an entire continent to dust."]="啊，科洛米尔之塔。据说托里姆的威力只展现过一次……结果就是整整一块陆地变成了灰尘。"
G["Ah, the true sign of the hunter!  To stalk one's prey in the never-ending game of life.  Look to Drayl on the Hunter Rise for your answers."]="啊，猎人的真正标志！在永无止境的生命游戏中追踪猎物。去猎人高地寻找德拉伊吧。"
G["Ah, the winds spoke of newcomers to our village. I feel that we will learn much from each other, so long as our minds are open and our spirits pure.\n\nPerhaps your people will be more respectful of mine than the Horde was."]="啊，清风传达了贵客来访的消息。只要我们能保持开放的心胸，纯净的灵魂，就一定能从彼此身上获益良多。\n\n跟部落比起来，也许你的族人能给予我们更大的尊重。"
G["Ah, the young black dragon graces my temple. The deeds of you and your champion are quickly becoming Pandaren legend."]="啊，年轻的黑龙光临了我的寺院。你们俩的事迹已成了广为流传的潘达利亚传奇了。"
G["Ah, there it is!"]="啊，它在那儿！"
G["Ah, there it is. Follow me, fleshling."]="啊，就是那里。跟我来，肉人。"
G["Ah, there you are! Remember me? Of course you do! Wait right there, I'm coming down."]="啊，是你！还记得我吗？我相信你记得！等着吧，我这就下来。"
G["Ah, there you are. I had hoped to accomplish this with a bit of subtlety, but I suppose direct confrontation was inevitable. Your future, Thrall, must not come to pass and so... you and your troublesome friends must die!"]="啊，你来了。我原本希望以比较隐秘的方式解决问题，但是现在看来正面冲突是在所难免的了。你的命运之路在此终结，萨尔。你和你那些爱管闲事的朋友全都得死！"
G["Ah, there you are. I was told to expect help, so please listen closely. The situation is this: I've been tasked with gathering $2055w purple lotus in preparation for the coming war in Ahn'Qiraj. To date we have $2054w.\n\nActually going into the field and collecting the flowers will be up to you and those like you. I am needed here to see that they are properly maintained and to find new, creative applications for their use against the silithid and whatever else awaits us there."]="啊，你来了。我接到通知说会有人来帮忙，所以请仔细听。情况是这样：我奉命收集 $2055w 紫莲花，为即将到来的安其拉之战做准备。到目前为止我们已经有 $2054w。\n\n实际到野外采花，就得靠你和像你这样的人了。我必须留在这里，确保它们得到妥善保存，并研究出用它们对付异种虫以及那里等着我们的一切的新奇法子。"
G["Ah, there you are..."]="啊，你在那儿……"
G["Ah, there's one!"]="哈，那里就有一个！"
G["Ah, there's our target. I can smell him from here."]="啊哈，这就是我们的目标了，我在这里就能闻到他的气味了。"
G["Ah, these kids never run out of energy!"]="啊，这些孩子永远是精力旺盛！"
G["Ah, this Darnassian fabric is the finest!"]="啊，这件达纳苏斯织品质量最好！"
G["Ah, this gate is locked, but I think I have something that'll open it."]="啊，大门锁住了，但我想我有办法弄开它。"
G["Ah, this is a special place. My great grandparents called this part of the forest their home. Come, this will take only a moment."]="啊，这是个特别的地方。我的祖辈们曾把这片林子当做家。来吧，我们很快就好。"
G["Ah, this must be him now... no?  Bah!"]="啊，一定是他……不是？呸！"
G["Ah, this was from Private Denning.  I remember when he fell..."]="啊，这是德宁下士的东西。我还记得他倒在血泊中的情景……"
G["Ah, to be back in Stranglethorn.  The screeching raptors, the troll wars, jungle creatures as far as the eye see, just ASKING to be killed...\n\n<Bort sighs.>"]="啊，要是再回到荆棘谷。那些发出尖啸的迅猛龙，巨魔间的战争，目力所及处各式各样的丛林生物，就等着人们的捕杀……\n\n<博特叹了口气。>"
G["Ah, to be finally free of that cage..."]="啊，终于摆脱了牢笼……"
G["Ah, to be pulled from the dreaded nightmare! I thank you, my loyal Disciple, along with your brave companions."]="啊，我终于从可怖的噩梦中被拉回来了！谢谢你，我忠诚的信徒，还有你勇敢的同伴。"
G["Ah, to be young again, and to have discovered potions for the first time. Thank you for refreshing my memory, $n. Now go share that youthful enthusiasm with Milla Fairancora over there."]="啊，又回到年轻的时候了，还有第一次发现药剂的时候。谢谢你恢复我的记忆，$n。去跟那边的米拉·法拉科纳分享那份年轻的热情吧。"
G["Ah, to soar with the great birds of the sky.  Seek out Tal at the top of the Winder Rider Roost.  He will steer you toward where you're going."]="啊，和天空中的巨鸟一同翱翔。去双足飞龙巢穴顶端找塔尔吧。他会指引你完成你的梦想的。"
G["Ah, um, yes $g sir : ma'am;. It would appear that we have collected all of the medium leather that the Alliance feels is necessary for the war. I'm told that there may be others here though that still need your assistance with their collection efforts."]="啊，呃，是的，$g先生:女士;。我们已经集齐联盟在战争中所需的所有中皮了。我听说这儿的其他人需要你的帮助。"
G["Ah, very good. I am satisfied that you are a worthy student. Now, your training with me may begin..."]="啊，很好。我确信你是个值得教的学生。现在，$g你:你;对我的修行可以开始了……"
G["Ah, we adventure together again, except this time I am afraid that the circumstances are much more dire."]="啊，我们又要一起冒险了，但是，这次的局势恐怕会更加危险。"
G["Ah, we're almost there, whos-yer-face! The camp where I left my notes is just around the corner!"]="啊，清醒一点，我们就要完成了！我放置记录的那座帐篷就在附近！"
G["Ah, welcome back, hero. You have returned to protect the Guardian once more? Do not forget to take a chrono-beacon with you!"]="啊，欢迎回来，英雄。你是再次回来保护麦迪文的吗？不要忘记带上一个时空道标！"
G["Ah, welcome. Are you here to buy spices? Strange, rare, exotic spices?\n\nYou've come to the right place... neighbor."]="啊，欢迎。你是来买香料的吗？稀奇、罕见、异域的香料？\n\n$g你:你;来对地方了……邻居。"
G["Ah, welcome. You are here to join us in the coming celebration? No? A pity."]="啊，欢迎。你们也是来参加庆祝仪式的？不是？真可惜。"
G["Ah, what a beautiful day to blow something up!"]="啊，多么美好的一天啊！真该炸点什么东西。"
G["Ah, what a waste... next!"]="啊，多么浪费啊。下一个！"
G["Ah, what quartermaster are you searching for? Perhaps I can help you find them."]="啊，你在找什么军需官？也许我能帮你找到他们。"
G["Ah, wonderful. It was all just a dream..."]="啊，太好了。那一切只是场梦……"
G["Ah, ye're an inquisitive one, are ye'? Excellent! Pay close attention, this just might save yer skin when the goin' gets rough!"]="啊，你是个爱刨根问底的家伙，是吧？太好了！仔细听好，等日子难熬的时候，这说不定能救$g你:你;一命！"
G["Ah, yer a lifesaver, lad!"]="啊，你是我的救星，朋友！"
G["Ah, yes, I see what you were talking about now. Thank you, Boulian."]="啊，是的，我明白你在说什么了。谢谢你，波里安。"
G["Ah, yes, it is almost time for the master's dinner..."]="啊，主人的用餐时间快到了……"
G["Ah, yes, that... the name. Well... as they say, a good name, like good will, is got by many actions and lost by one. No need to go into the hows or whys; suffice to say, that is how I am named by some."]="啊，是啊……这个名字。嗯……人们常说，好名字就像美好的愿望，你需要用心经营，却很可能因一次失误前功尽弃。至于我的名字的由来嘛，不用说也知道为什么别人这么称呼我吧……"
G["Ah, yes. Loken is well known to me."]="啊，是的。我对洛肯非常了解。"
G["Ah, yes... I know about the forgemaster!  I just overheard that he's not in the camp right now."]="啊，是的……我知道铸炉之主！我刚才不小心听说他现在不在里边。"
G["Ah, yes... Private Guarding.  He always was quick to laugh... until a Bleeding Hollow Raid tore out his throat!"]="啊，是……加丁下士。他的脸上总是挂着笑容……直到那次被血环士兵割开了喉咙！"
G["Ah, yes... watch it burn!"]="啊，对……看着它烧个精光！"
G["Ah, you are new. These devices are a part of our master's plan to bring about the transformation of the world. They will unleash the fires of judgment and allow us to ascend to immortality. This is the master's promise."]="哦，看来你是个新人。这些装置是我们主人改造世界计划的一部分。它会向整个世界释放出审判的烈火，并让我们得到永恒的生命。这是主人对我们许下的承诺。"
G["Ah, you did it! Excellent work."]="啊，你做到了！实在是漂亮。"
G["Ah, you have done it!  The waters are pure once more."]="啊，你成功了！水流恢复了洁净。"
G["Ah, you have raised your pets well, and beaten some of Pandaria's most seasoned and charismatic trainers.  But the trial is not over, oh no!"]="啊，你把宠物养得很好，还击败了潘达利亚最老道、最杰出的驯宠师。但试炼，还远未结束！"
G["Ah, you have returned! One thousand thanks. Please, take this, our most potent creation: Volatile Greenstone Brew."]="啊，你回来了！太感谢你了。拜托，请你一定要收下这个。这是我们这儿最烈的酒：烈性绿石佳酿。"
G["Ah, you must be the $glad : lass; assigned to show me around the Eversong Woods.  Took your sweet time getting here, didn't you?\n\nVery well, off we go.  Let us not waste one more minute."]="啊，你一定就是被派来带我逛永歌森林的$g小伙子:姑娘;。$g你:你;可真是慢悠悠地才到，对吧？\n\n好吧，我们走。别再浪费一分钟了。"
G["Ah, you must be the outsider. Sadly, I am making weapons for war. Once, not long ago, I made instruments for prayer and celebration. It is this war that makes everyone stand on edge."]="啊，$g你:你;一定就是那个外乡人。可惜，我正在打造战争用的武器。不久以前，我做的还是祈祷和庆典用的器具。正是这场战争让每个人都绷紧了神经。"
G["Ah, you must go to the great heights of Thunder Bluff to visit one of those.  Follow the path north out of Bloodhoof Village.  At the base of the bluffs is an elevator that will take you to the top.  When you get there ask for further directions from one of the Bluffwatchers."]="啊，你必须去雷霆崖最高处拜访他们中的一人。沿着血蹄村北面的道路走。雷霆崖底有升降梯可达顶部。当你到达那儿时，可以询问雷霆崖守卫。"
G["Ah, you seek Dark Cleric Beryl.  He's now resides in the eastern building."]="啊，你在寻找黑暗牧师贝里尔。他就住在东边的那幢房子里。"
G["Ah, you seek Dark Cleric Beryl.  He's upstairs in the reading room at the Gallows' End Tavern.  Reading, praying, who knows what he's up to, and who would dare to ask?"]="啊，你是在找黑暗牧师贝里尔。他在恐惧之末旅店楼上的阅读室。他一直在阅读、祷告，没人知道他在干嘛，也谁敢去问他啊？"
G["Ah, you seek Jaluu the Generous! He can be found walking around the steps of Mogu'shan Palace, here in the Vale of Eternal Blossoms.\n\nI will mark his location on your map for you."]="啊，你要找宽仁的贾鲁！他就在锦绣谷魔古山宫殿的台阶上徘徊。\n\n我会为你在地图上标出他的位置。"
G["Ah, you seek Jaluu the Generous! He is right next to me."]="啊，你要找宽仁的贾鲁！他就在我身旁。"
G["Ah, you seek one of the returned Highborne.\n\nOne of their Arcane Reforgers has been spending time with Taladan, the enchanter.  Seek them out in the Craftsmen's Terrace."]="啊，你是在找那个归返的上层精灵。\n\n有位奥术重铸师正和附魔师塔兰丹一起工作。可以在工匠区找到他们。"
G["Ah, you seek the Silverdews in the Craftmen's Terrace. They've only recently set up shop, near the enchanter's."]="你是要找工匠区的银露一家人吗？他们最近才在附魔商店附近开起了自己的小店。"
G["Ah, you seek the wisdom of Ansekhwa.  Look for him on the lower rise at Thunder Bluff Weapons."]="啊，你是在找安塞瓦。去雷霆崖武器店中部高地的底层找他吧。"
G["Ah, you want to play hardball, eh? That's just my game!"]="嘿，破机器，怎么样？你想跟我来硬的？太可惜了，这是属于我的游戏！"
G["Ah, you wish to train abroad? I will direct you. Tell me which weapon has sparked your interest."]="啊，你希望去其他地方训练？我会指引你的。告诉我你对什么武器有兴趣。"
G["Ah, you'll make a fine rock-breaker I think!"]="哈，你会变成一把很不错的敲石锤！"
G["Ah, you're here already? I'm not quite finished with my preparations... and neither are you.\n\nHonor the shrines and come back to me - we mustn't disrespect the mountain in our haste."]="啊，你已经到了？我这边还没准备好呢……你也是。\n\n先去祭拜神龛，回头再来找我吧——我们不该匆匆忙忙，这样显得对大山不敬。"
G["Ah, you're just in time. The rituals are about to begin!"]="啊，你们来的正是时候。仪式就要开始了！"
G["Ah, you're looking for Lucan Cordell.  He runs a shop on the outside of the Magic Quarter on your way to the Stockade."]="啊，你是在找鲁坎·考迪尔。他在魔法区外开了一家商店，你前往监狱时会经过那儿的。"
G["Ah, you're the one who found the letter. Thank you for the... news, I suppose, about my family. You're welcome to what food and drink I can offer."]="啊，就是你找到那封信的吧。感谢你带来这个……关于我的家人的消息。如果我这里的食物和饮料有什么你喜欢的，请别客气。"
G["Ah, you've finally arrived Prince Arthas. You're here just in the nick of time."]="啊，是阿尔萨斯王子。您来的正是时候。"
G["Ah- hah hah hah hah haaa!"]="啊哈哈哈哈！"
G["Ah-ha! I've got you right where I want you!"]="啊哈！我就是想把你引到这儿来！"
G["Ah-hah! Another chance to test my might."]="啊——哈！检验我力量的机会又到了。"
G["Ah-hah! The lot of you will soon wish you hadn't come this way..."]="哈哈！你们很快就会后悔选了这条路……"
G["Ah-hah! There are no guards back here. Maybe you can find a way up onto the roof?"]="啊哈！这里没有守卫！看看你能不能找到一条上屋顶的路？"
G["Ah.  I was merely jesting..."]="啊。我只是在开玩笑……"
G["Ah.  Welcome $gsir:my lady;!"]="啊，欢迎您，$g先生:我亲爱的女士;！"
G["Ah. That might be a problem."]="呃，这倒是个问题。"
G["Ah. The smell of a proper battlefield. We have been on our own for far too long. Now, the full might of the Horde is unleashed! And we are the ones who direct where the next blow will land."]="啊。这才是真正的战场的味道。我们孤军奋战的时间太长了。现在，部落将释放出全部的力量，而我们，将指引部落之力进攻的方向！"
G["Ah. The taste of victory is sweet."]="啊。胜利的味道真甜美。"
G["Ah. Well. That was even easier than I thought!"]="哼。好吧。这比我想象中的还要容易！"
G["Ah.. noodle soup always refreshes both my body and my soul."]="啊……美味的汤面总能让我身心舒畅。"
G["Ah... Gamon... you have finally learned... I am proud... to have died... at your hands..."]="啊……加摩尔……你终于变强了……能死在……你的手上……是我的荣幸……"
G["Ah... I do not have many visitors here.\n\nPlease, sit a while."]="啊……来这里拜访我的人并不多。\n\n请多坐一会儿吧。"
G["Ah... It be Kilnara.  I shoulda known she be involved here."]="啊……是基尔娜拉。我就知道她与此有关。"
G["Ah... Malfurion Stormrage.  I'd hoped to keep you occupied for a little longer.  It was my goal to keep you away from Hyjal while my allies attacked.  It would seem I have succeeded."]="啊……玛法里奥·怒风。我原本希望能再把你多拖住一会儿。我的目标是要保证在我的盟友出击时，让你远离海加尔。看来我已经成功了。"
G["Ah... a challenge."]="啊……一场挑战。"
G["Ah... a customer! Talk to my greatest invention, the Vendor-Tron 1000. He has all your needs... some of the rarest items you will ever find on the market anywhere in Kalimdor... not to mention that his programming will not allow any bargaining, so the price you see is the price you pay."]="啊……一名顾客！看看我最伟大的发明，贸易机器人1000型！它拥有你所需的一切商品……其中的一些稀有物品更是在卡利姆多的其它任何市场上都找不到……更不用说它的设计不支持任何讨价还价的废话了，因此你看到的价格就是你要支付的价格。"
G["Ah... another shaman seeks enlightenment, perhaps? Are the spirits speaking unclearly? Do you wish my help in seeing what lies before you?"]="啊……另一位寻求启迪的萨满祭司，我说得对吗？灵魂们说得不够清楚吗？你要我帮你指明命运之路的方向吗？"
G["Ah... nah, man. Don't wanna get the merchandise all messy, ya know?"]="啊……不，朋友。别把货物搞乱了，行吗？"
G["Ah... you have learned much... and learned well... an honorable battle."]="啊……你学会了很多……学得很好……光荣的战斗。"
G["Ah... you're smarter than you appear, I see."]="啊……你比看上去要聪明多了，我明白了。"
G["Ah... your grace?"]="啊……陛下？"
G["Ah...the heroes. You are persistent, aren't you? Your ally here attempted to match his power against mine - and paid the price. Now he shall serve me...by slaughtering you."]="啊……英雄们。你们都会坚持不懈的，是不是？你们这群凡人想要与我的力量相抗衡——那么你们就要付出代价。现在他将为我而战……他的任务就是干掉你们。"
G["Ah...the wondrous sound of kodos.  I love the way they make the ground shake... inspect the beast for me."]="啊……科多兽令人惊奇的声音。我喜欢它们震动地表的方式……帮我照看这些野兽。"
G["Aha!  It opened!  I expected that to be harder.  Thanks for your help, $n!"]="啊！它打开了！比我想象中要容易得多。谢谢你的帮助，$n！"
G["Aha!  That's it!"]="哈！就是它了！"
G["Aha!  There it is."]="啊哈！搞定了。"
G["Aha! Here's the sketch I was looking for..."]="哈哈！我要找的草图在这里……"
G["Aha, I understand now.  Thank you for waking me."]="啊，我现在明白了。感谢你唤醒我。"
G["Ahah! Fresh air at last!"]="啊哈！终于呼吸到新鲜空气了！"
G["Ahaha! You're gonna love this stuff!"]="啊哈哈！你会喜欢上这个的！"
G["Ahaha, get a load 'a me, mon!\n\nGriftah be back again! New stall, and brand new wares, and ready to pass on the deals to ya!\n\nWant more luck for deh mountains? Want tah buy the best \"luckydo\" ya ever smelled? Well step right up and don' be talkin' to grummles. Just let your good ol' friend Griftah lead ya right.\n\nThese miraculous baubles be cheap at tripple the price!"]="啊哈哈，瞧瞧我，老兄！\n\n格里夫塔又回来啦！新摊位，全新的货品，准备把好买卖都传给你！\n\n想要山里的更多好运？想买你闻过的最棒的\"幸运符\"吗？那就快过来吧，别去搭理那些格鲁姆勒。就让你的老朋友格里夫塔给你指条明路。\n\n这些神奇的小玩意儿，就算价钱翻三倍也便宜！"
G["Ahaha, get a load 'a me, mon!\n\nGriftah be back again! New stall, and brand new wares, and ready to pass on the deals to ya!\n\nWant to be better, stronger, faster? Each one of these amulets be guaranteed to do just what I say they be doin'. Step up and buy one of these miraculous baubles! Cheap at twice the price!"]="啊哈哈，大家听好了！\n\n格里伏塔又回来啦！新的摊位，崭新的商品，已经做好再次开张的万全准备啦！\n\n你想变得更快、更高、更强吗？我卖的每一个护身符都绝对有效！过来买一个神奇的小玩意吧！性价比超乎想象！"
G["Ahaha, ya see this? Griftah's BACK! Back in my stall, back with my old wares, and ready to pass on the deals to ya!\n\nWant to be better, stronger, faster? Each one of these amulets be guaranteed to do just what I say they be doin'. Step up and buy one of these miraculous baubles! Cheap at twice the price!"]="啊哈哈哈，瞧见了吗？格里伏塔回来了！我带着一堆古董回到了熟悉的货摊前，而且我已经准备好和你做买卖了！\n\n想要变得更健壮更强大更矫健吗？我出售的护身符都具备这些功能哟。来吧，掏钱买个绝世珍宝吧！破盘价啦！"
G["Ahahaha!"]="啊哈哈哈！"
G["Ahahaha!  Zanzil is the winner this time!  And look who came to celebrate!"]="啊哈哈哈！这次的赢家是赞吉尔！而且快看看是谁来庆祝！"
G["Ahahaha! I must find the secrets!"]="啊哈哈哈哈！我要挖掘出真相！"
G["Ahahaha! Such a pitiful creature!"]="啊哈哈哈！可怜的生物！"
G["Ahahaha, that was a good one!"]="阿哈哈，这个不错！"
G["Ahahaha, the great Niuzao, strength of the west, divine celestial, protector of the weak..."]="啊哈哈，伟大的砮皂。西方之力。神圣之神。弱者的保护神。"
G["Ahahaha... Oh, I'm holding my sides at that one!"]="啊哈哈哈……噢，我喜欢这个！"
G["Ahahaha... you pitiful weaklings!"]="啊哈哈哈……可怜的爬虫！"
G["Ahahahaha! I've always been with the Grimtotem! You fools are all going to die!"]="哈哈哈！我与恐怖图腾同在！你们这些傻瓜全都要死！"
G["Ahahahaha! More than filth like you deserved."]="啊哈哈哈哈！罪有应得，肮脏的东西。"
G["Ahahahaha, that's the last of their runes! Twilight Suckers, no more elemental power for you!"]="啊哈哈哈，这是他们最后的符文了！暮光崽子们，你们的元素之力都完蛋了！"
G["Ahahahaha, you've fallen into my trap, $n!"]="啊哈哈哈哈，你落进了我的陷阱，$n！"
G["Ahahahaha... hahahahahaha!"]="啊哈哈哈……哈哈哈哈哈哈！"
G["Ahahahaha... so in the end, it is not Varian, but his whelp who comes to face me. You run bravely to your death, young one."]="啊哈哈……最后来的居然不是瓦里安，而是他的小崽子。你这是送死，小鬼。"
G["Ahahahahahaha!"]="啊哈哈哈哈哈！"
G["Ahahahahahaha! It is done. Return to my cave. We have much to discuss!"]="哈哈哈哈！好啦。回到我待的洞穴去吧。我们还有很多要事要商量呢。"
G["Ahahhhaahaa... was that supposed to hurt?"]="啊哈哈哈哈哈……这样疼不疼？"
G["Ahead hides our foe. Worshippers of chaos who seek to remake the world."]="敌人近在眼前。混沌的信徒正图谋重铸这个世界。"
G["Aheh... heh... heh..."]="呵呵……呵……呵……"
G["Ahem!  I, ah, appreciate the ride, Madam Fiona.  It's nice to get off my feet for once."]="啊咳！我，啊，很感谢你能让我搭便车，菲奥拉女士。偶尔歇歇脚也不错。"
G["Ahem! Well... ah, next week: \"Tanaris.\" Starting with the excavation of Broken Pillar by Marvon Rivetseeker in Year 22."]="咳咳！那么……啊，下周讲：\"塔纳利斯\"。从第 22 年马文·里维特西克发掘断裂石柱开始讲起。"
G["Ahem, Mister Kyle, I'm trying to move across the room as hard as I can... please fix me!"]="哎咳，凯雷先生，我正在努力穿越这个房间……请帮帮我吧！"
G["Ahem.\n\n\"I reckon there just ain't enough hours in the day!\"\n\nHow did that sound? Too forced? You think it would fly at the market?"]="咳咳。\n\n\"我寻思这一天的时间根本就不够用！\"\n\n听着怎么样？太做作了？你觉得拿到集市上能行得通吗？"
G["Ahem. Don't forget about the bomb, Aldo."]="嗯哼。别忘了炸弹，阿尔多。"
G["Ahem... so, I most certainly don't blame you for taking your time and catching your breath and congratulating yourselves for such heroism after such a long and hard-fought battle with that horrible monster just so long as when you're finished you don't forget about me over here because even though I'm small I think I can still find some way to repay you for your amazing bravery...."]="哎咳……我觉得吧，在和那个恐怖的怪物艰难地打斗了这么久之后你花上点时间休息兼庆祝一番我绝对没有任何意见啊不过呢你最好别忘记我还在这里呢虽然我看上去个子玲珑不过我还是有能力报答你的恩情的……"
G["Ahglrglglrglgrrr!"]="啊咕噜咕噜咕噜咕噜！"
G["Ahh - my fearless assistants, I assume."]="啊，我无畏的协助者，对吧？"
G["Ahh Jogu...he's probably passed out behind the still. Just go a few yards to the south to the watering hole and you can't miss him.\n\nHe came wandering through town a while back and hasn't ever left.\n\nThe locals love him. He's got quite the knack for predicting the harvest."]="啊，贾古……他很有可能醉倒在摊位后面了。只要往酒吧南边走上几步就能找到他。\n\n他不久前流浪至此，然后再也没离开过。\n\n这里人人都喜欢他，他可是个预测收成的行家。"
G["Ahh the Glustewelt twins!"]="啊啊！"
G["Ahh there it is."]="啊，在这里。"
G["Ahh yeah, mon! Dere be great glory ta be had here!"]="朋友！瞧瞧，这片土地承载了多少荣耀！"
G["Ahh yes, I remember the first time I fought against the Dark Summoner.  And the second time... and the third..."]="啊，没错，我还记得我第一次跟黑暗召唤师战斗的情况。然后是第二次……第三次……"
G["Ahh yes, now I remember, your wedding night wasn't it?"]="啊，对，现在我记起来了，是在你的新婚之夜吧？"
G["Ahh yes, the first kill of the morning. Continue!"]="啊，不错，早晨的第一次击杀。继续！"
G["Ahh!  Get away from me, you fiend!"]="啊！滚开，魔鬼！"
G["Ahh!  I... I can't move!"]="啊！我……我动不了了！"
G["Ahh! Ahhhhhhhhhhh!"]="啊！啊啊啊！"
G["Ahh! Hawks!\n\nAHHHH! WOLVES!"]="啊啊！老鹰！\n\n啊啊啊啊！狼来了！"
G["Ahh! Help! What is that thing!? It doesn't matter, nothing will stop me now, not when I'm so close! Maybe if I don't look at it...?"]="啊！救命！那是什么！？没关系，谁也阻止不了我，我就要成功了！如果我不看的话……？"
G["Ahh! I hate you puppy-face! So mean!"]="啊啊啊！我讨厌狗狗人！太坏了！"
G["Ahh! It all safe now?"]="啊啊！看来安全了？"
G["Ahh! It's coming right for us!"]="啊啊！它直冲着我们来了！"
G["Ahh! So returns my conquering hero."]="啊！我的英雄回来了。"
G["Ahh! There you are, $n.\n\nI must speak with you at once."]="啊！是你啊，$n。\n\n我必须马上和你谈谈。"
G["Ahh! What is the meaning of this!?"]="啊啊！这是什么意思？！"
G["Ahh!!!"]="啊！！！"
G["Ahh,  Back in Drak'Tharon at last!"]="啊，终于回到了达克萨隆要塞！"
G["Ahh, \"Mystical Conjurings of the Archmages of Dalaran.\" Perfect."]="啊，\"达拉然大法师的神秘咒法\"。就是它了。"
G["Ahh, I cannot heal through that much damage! Did you forget to equip your heaviest armor?!"]="啊，我治疗不了那么高的伤害！你忘记换坦克装了吗？"
G["Ahh, Illusionary Tunnelers! Speedy and I have faced these foes before. Beware, they may burrow into the ground and then suddenly pop up under a new target, and CHOMP! Hah ha hah ha."]="啊，幻影隧道工。我和飞毛腿对付过这种敌人。小心，它们会钻洞，然后突然从新目标脚下冒出来狂啃！哈哈！"
G["Ahh, another powerful traveler. The nether can be dangerous; you'll want the most potent spells at your disposal. I carry the finest reagents, common and exotic. Come, buy - you won't be sorry!"]="啊，又一位强大的旅行者。虚空很危险；你总希望手边有最强劲的法术。我这儿有最好的施法材料，无论常见还是珍稀。来吧，买点吧——$g你:你;不会后悔的！"
G["Ahh, at last... Time for a little break."]="啊……总算可以休息一下啦。"
G["Ahh, blast it. C'mon, c'mon already!"]="啊，该死的。动起来，动起来啊！"
G["Ahh, dere be our destiny... Gundrak!"]="啊，这就是我们的命运之城……古达克！"
G["Ahh, dere you are!  We been searching da entire jungle for ya!"]="啊，你在这里！我们翻遍整个丛林在找你呢！"
G["Ahh, freedom!"]="啊，自由了！"
G["Ahh, get these things away from me!"]="啊，把这些东西弄走！"
G["Ahh, gnomish ingenuity! The Horde won't know what hit 'em."]="啊，侏儒科技！肯定能让部落死得不明不白。"
G["Ahh, good to finally see a friendly face, mon.\n\nWould be good, dat is, if I could, you know, see..."]="啊，总算让我看见一个和善人了，伙计。\n\n你瞧，如果我能看见……那就好了……"
G["Ahh, here we are. Be careful - I've had trouble in this area before."]="啊，我们到了。小心——我曾经在这个地方遇到过麻烦。"
G["Ahh, if I could just get my hands on you! You would make a very nice experiment!"]="啊，要是让我抓住你就好了！你肯定是个绝佳的实验品！"
G["Ahh, it feels good to get salt in the old fur again."]="啊，再次把盐放进旧皮草的感觉很好。"
G["Ahh, it is good to see you again, $r."]="啊，能再次见到你真好，$r。"
G["Ahh, life is good."]="啊,生活真美好。"
G["Ahh, many thanks, friend. I needed that."]="啊，非常感谢你，朋友。我正需要那个。"
G["Ahh, much better.  I owe ya one."]="啊，这下好多了。我欠你一个人情。"
G["Ahh, my precious Ameenah! How wonderful to see you again."]="啊，亲爱的埃门纳！咱们又见面了，我真是开心。"
G["Ahh, nothing like a job well done!"]="哈，还有什么比出色地完成任务更棒的呢！"
G["Ahh, the Battle Scar. Pretty hairy out there, I hear."]="啊，战斗之痕。我听说那地方相当危险。"
G["Ahh, the jungle.  It's good to get out of town every once in a while, you know?"]="啊，丛林。知道吗，能够偶尔离开城市真是一件好事情。"
G["Ahh, them - a sad tale, that one.\n\nThey have disappeared behind the walls of Zul'Aman. I haven't heard from them in days.\n\nI've seen it a hundred times; that overeager itch for fame and fortune. I tried to hold them back, told them they weren't prepared, but in the end they chose to face their peril...."]="啊，他们呀——悲惨的结局。\n\n探险队进入祖阿曼已有数日，至今音信全无。\n\n类似的情形我也见得多了，这帮被名誉和财富冲昏了头脑的蠢货。我警告过他们，没有做好充分的准备就别贸然涉险，可惜他们压根儿没听进去……"
G["Ahh, there she is. The battle-maiden of the Dragonmaw. Let me see your face."]="啊，是龙喉氏族的女武士。让我好好看看你的脸。"
G["Ahh, there we go. Now, Keever must try this vial and see if it works."]="嗯，搞定了。现在让基佛试试看。"
G["Ahh, there we go. Told you I had it!"]="哈，出来了。我就说了我能行！"
G["Ahh, there you are.  Hello!  I figured that, while you're flying to Kharanos, I'd give you some data about what's going on outside of Coldridge Valley."]="啊，你在这里。你好！我想，既然你飞去了卡拉诺斯，我应该告诉你一下寒脊山谷外都发生了什么事。"
G["Ahh, turnip! Get out of here!"]="啊，芜菁！我们快离开这儿！"
G["Ahh, visitorsss!"]="啊，有客——人！"
G["Ahh, ya couldn't resist, could ya? Want to be better, stronger, faster? Each one of these amulets be guaranteed to do just what I say they be doin'. Step up and buy one of these miraculous baubles! Cheap at twice the price!"]="啊，$g你:你;还是忍不住了，对吧？想变得更好、更强、更快？这些护符每一件都保证做到我说的效果。快过来买一件这神奇的小玩意儿吧！就算价钱翻倍也划算！"
G["Ahh, yes. Any last vords? Hmm?"]="啊，是的。还有什么话要说吗？嗯？"
G["Ahh, yes. How have you been enjoying your time here?"]="啊，是的。在这里的时光你是怎样渡过的？"
G["Ahh, yes. I know just the thing..."]="啊，没错。我就知道……"
G["Ahh, you will need to make your way over to the Hunter's Hall then. Several great hunters like Holt Thunderhorn can be found there on the Hunter Rise."]="啊，那你就要去猎人高地上的猎手大厅了。你可以在那里找到像浩特·雷角那样伟大的猎人。"
G["Ahh... My experiments never seem to work out right. Maybe I should go back downstream."]="啊……我的实验似乎从来没有成功过。或许我该从头再来。"
G["Ahh... beer. Just what my men needed. Thank you, $p."]="啊……啤酒，弟兄们正需要它们。谢谢你，$p。"
G["Ahh... food It's 'bout time."]="啊……该吃饭了。"
G["Ahh... it's good to be home."]="啊……回家的感觉真好。"
G["Ahh... just what I needed."]="啊……真是太及时了。"
G["Ahh... much better."]="啊……感觉好多了。"
G["Ahh... not so fast my friend.  The freedom you seek is behind you."]="Ahh... no tan rápido, $gamigo:amiga;. La libertad que buscas está tras de ti."
G["Ahh... so it is, so it is.  Carry on then.  Carry on t'yer death."]="啊……原来如此，原来如此。你就这样继续吧，直到你一命呜呼。"
G["Ahh... there you are. The master told us you'd be arriving soon."]="啊……你来了。主人说过，你很快就会到的。"
G["Ahh... welcome to my parlor."]="啊……欢迎来到我的大厅。"
G["Ahh.... better."]="啊……感觉好多了。"
G["Ahhh $n, it be good to see ya once agin. Da threat to dese lands be grave, and I come to join da fight. I see ya grown in your own. Good. You mek me, an' all your tribe, proud."]="啊，$n。真高兴，我们又见面了。这儿危机重重，所以我也加入了战斗。我发现你也成长了不少。很好。我和你的族人都为你感到自豪。"
G["Ahhh - the heart of a King. The powers of a God."]="啊——君王之核。神明之力。"
G["Ahhh ha ha ha! So much blood! Nice."]="啊哈哈哈！太厉害了！很好。"
G["Ahhh!"]="啊！"
G["Ahhh! What be happenin' to me, mon?"]="啊！！发生了什么事？"
G["Ahhh!!"]="啊！！"
G["Ahhh, Stormwind Visitor's Center is what you are looking for then. It's the first building on the left as you walk through the front gates from the Valley of Heroes."]="哈，你要找的是暴风城访客中心。从英雄谷走到贸易区后左手边的第一座建筑就是了。"
G["Ahhh, another soul for the taking."]="啊，又一条灵魂送上门了。"
G["Ahhh, dat feel guud!"]="啊，感觉不错！"
G["Ahhh, finally!"]="啊，终于！"
G["Ahhh, guud stuff!"]="啊，好东西！"
G["Ahhh, here's a nice one. Yes, this egg will do. Not this one. Too small! Perhaps this one could pass the bill..."]="啊，这个蛋很不错。嗯，这个应该可以。这个不行，太小了。这个应该能通过检查……"
G["Ahhh, just in time! My stomach was rumblin' loud."]="啊哈，正好！我的肚子已经开始叽里咕噜乱叫了。"
G["Ahhh, look who has joined us."]="啊，看看是谁加入我们了。"
G["Ahhh, our guests have arrived, just as the master promised."]="啊，我们的客人到了，主人说的果然没错。"
G["Ahhh, so the grand lady of the Kirin Tor wants a fight, does she?"]="啊，肯瑞托那位了不起的女士想打一仗，是吗？"
G["Ahhh, you are looking for Dungar Longdrink. He has some of the fastest gryphons this side of Khaz Modan! You can find him up on the ramparts in the Trade District."]="啊，你在找杜加尔·朗德瑞克。他那里有卡兹莫丹飞得最快的狮鹫！你可以在贸易区的外墙上找到他。"
G["Ahhh..."]="啊……"
G["Ahhh... Hah!"]="啊……哈！"
G["Ahhh... I shall add a new blade to my collection today..."]="啊……今天我又能多收藏一把利刃了……"
G["Ahhh... Ironfoe."]="啊……反对者。"
G["Ahhh... RAAAAAGH! Never thought... I would be free of him...."]="啊……啊啊啊！从没有想到……我还能摆脱……他的魔掌……"
G["Ahhh... this test is simple. All you need to do is strike the bamboo, until it breaks."]="这个测试很简单。你要做的就是击打竹子，直到它破裂。"
G["Ahhh.... Hah!"]="啊……哈！"
G["Ahhh.... Yes, the blood of the exiles fills me with power! Beware, Bloodmyst!"]="啊……流放者之血赐予了我力量！秘血岛，我来了！"
G["Ahhhh ha ha ha ha! It barely even go halfway down the hill!"]="啊哈哈哈哈！都还没下到半山腰呢！"
G["Ahhhh! Or maybe it does. I better, um, go check on the others."]="看来还有点本事。我最好……呃……去看看其他人。"
G["Ahhhh!!! What is that thing?!"]="啊！！！那是什么东西？！"
G["Ahhhhggg... this pain in my head is killing me.\n\nThey must've sent you to rescue me.  Took them long enough!  Do you have any idea of the things they do to prisoners here?"]="啊啊啊……头痛欲裂！\n\n肯定是他们派你来救我的。拖了太久了！你知道他们都对这里的战俘做了些什么吗？"
G["Ahhhhh ha ha haa!"]="啊，哈哈，哈哈哈！"
G["Ahhhhh!"]="啊——！"
G["Ahhhhh!!!"]="啊！！！"
G["Ahhhhhhh!"]="啊啊啊！！"
G["Ahhhhhhh! The sky is falling!"]="啊！天都要塌下来了！"
G["Ahhhhhhhh!"]="啊——！"
G["Ahhhhhhhhhhhh!"]="啊啊啊！！！"
G["Ahhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhh!"]="啊啊啊啊啊！"
G["Ahoy matey!  Hoist anchor, trim the mainsail, batton down the hatches and set to sea!  Today we scuttle the Venture Company's blasted contraptions and send 'em all to feed the fishes!  Now hop to, before I put the black spot on ye!"]="嗨朋友！升锚整帆，放下舱口盖准备出海！今天我们要毁掉风险投资公司那些该死的装置，把它们统统丢进海里喂鱼！赶紧行动，别让我对你动手！"
G["Ahoy there!"]="嗨，你好！"
G["Ahoy there, captain."]="指挥官，这边。"
G["Ahoy!"]="啊哈！"
G["Ahoy!  I see more o' those goblins over there!"]="喂！我在那边看见更多地精！"
G["Ahoy! It's Pirates' Day, ye know... and 'til the sun rises on the morrow, Booty Bay is MINE."]="嘿！今天是海盗节，你知道的……在明天的太阳升起之前，藏宝海湾是我的。"
G["Ahoy! Ye be lookin' to book passage board the Sister Mercy, matey? Ye've come to the right place..."]="喂！伙计，你想要预订慈悲修女号的座位？你找对地方啦……"
G["Ahoy, $n! Not a pretty picture, is it?\n\nThe Horizon Scout at the bottom of the sea, my crew in shambles, and our cargo and passengers strewn about like so much debris that you'd think this was one of Stormwind's canals after a festival.\n\nAnd that's not where the trouble ends..."]="¡Ah del barco, $n! ¿A que la imagen no es muy buena?\n\nEl Explorador del horizonte en el fondo del mar, mis hombres arrastrándose y nuestra carga y los pasajeros desperdigados por todas partes, que cualquiera diría que esto es uno de los canales de Ventormenta después de un festival.\n\nY aquí no es donde terminan los problemas..."
G["Ahoy, me hearty!\n\nToday's OUR day, ye know... PIRATES' DAY!\n\nOl' Chumbucket and I came up with the idea, and once the Dread Captain heard of it... well, here we are!"]="喂，伙计！\n\n今天是我们的节日，你知道啦……是海盗节！\n\n我和查姆巴克想出了这个主意，而恐怖船长立即同意了……所以，我们就来啦！"
G["Ahoy, mon!  What be happenin', ye salty 'at steppa!\n\nDis place be all chacka-chacka, ye scallywag!"]="喂，你！干嘛呢，勤快点！\n\n没看到这里人人都忙着么，你这个饭桶！"
G["Ahoy, umm.... \"matey!\"  This is the $g fellow : gal; I was telling you about, \"me bucko!\"  $g He : She;'s a real \"terror of the seas!\""]="¡Ah del balco, umm... \"bucanero\"! $gEste es el compay:Esta es la chama; $gdel que:de la que; te hablaba. ¡Es un auténtico \"terror del mar\"!"
G["Ahunae's axe will be the end of the Drakkari.\n\nYou be takin' care of any that get past my axe!"]="埃霍奈的斧头就是达卡莱巨魔的末日。\n\n即便有一些漏网之鱼从我的斧下逃脱，你也会干掉他们！"
G["Ahune Retreats.  His defenses diminish."]="埃霍恩退却了。他的防御变弱了。"
G["Ahune will soon resurface."]="埃霍恩很快就会重新出现。"
G["Ahune, your strength grows no more!"]="埃霍恩，你的力量再也不会增强了！"
G["Aid in the construction of at least two of the five defenses."]="帮助建造五座防御工事中的至少两座。"
G["Aid me brethren!"]="帮帮我，同胞们！"
G["Aid me in destroying these tortured souls! Together we will loosen Frostmourne's hold and weaken the Lich King from within!"]="帮我摧毁这些痛苦的灵魂！我们合力就能弱化霜之哀伤的控制，从内部削弱巫妖王！"
G["Aid me my brood!"]="来为我作战吧，我的孩子们！"
G["Aid me! $n draws near!"]="帮帮我！$n过来了！"
G["Aid me, friends. Let us call upon the spirits for vision."]="朋友们，帮帮我。让我们召唤卡尔加的幻像。"
G["Aid me, you fools, before it's too late!"]="赶快来帮帮我，你们这群蠢货！"
G["Aid us, Bwonsamdi! Help us regain our home! Return de Darkspear to de Isles, and hear your drums again! Drink your ritual offerings once more! Dis, as de Son of Sen'jin, I swear."]="邦桑迪！请帮助我们！让暗矛部族回到岛国故土，让您的鼓声再次响起！请再次饮下我们的献祭！倾听我，森金之子的誓言！"
G["Aid your children in this time of need!"]="在这危难的时刻帮助你的孩子们！"
G["Aid your companions little one; the battle is joined!"]="Ayuda a tus compañeros, pequeñ$go:a;, ¡la batalla ha empezado!"
G["Aided by the Alliance, my forces will hold the line here, but I need you to deliver my report to General Krakork in Thrallmar. With his help, we'll be able to drive these demons back into the abyss that spawned them! Speak to Vlagga Freyfeather who stands on the platform behind us. She'll speed you on your way."]="有了联盟的帮助，我的部队会守住这条阵线，但是我需要你帮我送一份报告给萨尔玛的克拉库克将军。有了他的帮助，我们就能把这些恶魔送回到他们的深渊去！去和我们身后平台上的维拉加·乱羽聊聊吧，她会给你一些必要的指引。"
G["Aiiieeee!"]="哎呀！"
G["Aim Your Light of Souls at the Spirits to Banish Them!"]="将灵魂之光对准鬼魂来驱散他们！"
G["Aim fer tha jimmies!"]="瞄准点！"
G["Aim for the bow, the port and starboard buoyancy sacs, and the stern..."]="瞄准前部、左侧、右侧浮力囊，以及后部……"
G["Aim for the eye!"]="瞄准眼睛！"
G["Aim for the keester!"]="瞄准，往死里打！"
G["Aim for those amber bombs, they'll cause a huge explosion if we manage to set one off!"]="瞄准那些琥珀炸弹。只要点着一个，它们就会产生大爆炸！"
G["Aim for those amber bombs, they'll cause a huge explosion if you manage to set one off!"]="瞄准那些琥珀炸弹，只要设法把其中一个引爆，它们就会造成剧烈的爆炸！"
G["Aim true! Send them limping back to Stormwind!"]="瞄准射击！把他们赶回暴风城！"
G["Aim!"]="瞄准！"
G["Aimee is very nice."]="艾美可真是个好人。"
G["Aimee's cart can usually be found in northern Dalaran, near the Bank of Dalaran."]="艾美的货车通常停在达拉然北部，就在达拉然银行附近。"
G["Ain't NO ONE gonna escape Zul'Gurub!  Not with Jin'do in charge!"]="谁也别想从祖尔格拉布逃出去！只要金度在，就别想！"
G["Ain't NO ONE gonna stop Jin'do!"]="没人能阻止金度！"
G["Ain't gonna be nothin' left after this!"]="这之后，一切都将灭亡！"
G["Ain't much to it!\n\nThere are five rare treasures that you can find in the Dark Soil around Pandaria: Ruby Shards, Lovely Apples, Jade Cats, Blue Feathers, and Marsh Lilies.\n\nAs long as you have one of those items in your bags, you'll see who around here is willing to accept them.\n\nFind one of those and give them to someone you like, and chances are they'll like you a little back! Everyone has a favorite item out of the five, so talk to folks to learn what they prefer.\n\nAlso, the folks 'round here love food! I mean, who doesn't? If you know how to cook, you might just profit!\n\nThat's about all I know about gifts. Good luck!"]="这还远远不够！\n\n在潘达利亚的黑色泥土里埋藏着五件稀世珍宝：红宝石碎片、可爱的苹果、玉猫、蓝色羽毛以及泽地百合。\n\n只要你能将其中一件收入囊中，就能在附近找到愿意接受它们的人。\n\n找到其中一件并交给你喜欢的人，就有机会赢得他们的好感！每个人都会有他们最喜欢的东西，所以要跟他们多聊聊才能知其喜好。\n\n还有，这儿的人都很爱美食！说实话，谁不爱呢？如果你会做菜，那就再好不过了！\n\n关于礼物我就知道这些了。祝你好运！"
G["Ain't no messin' with Cayden Dunwald!"]="不要惹凯登·顿沃德生气！"
G["Ain't no other way, mon. We gotta stop Garrosh here an' now, else we be runnin' the rest of our lives."]="没办法了，伙计。我们必须马上阻止加尔鲁什，否则大家只能白白送死。"
G["Ain't she a beauty? Want to take her for a spin?"]="瞧，她多漂亮呀！想带她出去兜兜风吗？"
G["Air guard, attack!! Strafe them now, while they cannot maneuver!"]="空军部队进攻！！趁他们动弹不得的时候，狠狠地打！"
G["Air raid on Icemist! Let the Anub'ar feel the power of our air strikes!"]="空袭冰雾村！让阿努巴尔见识空军的力量！"
G["Air superiority."]="空中优势。"
G["Ajamon took her maiden name again. Despite everything, I kinda miss her, you know?"]="阿加蒙再一次使用了她的娘家姓。不管怎样，我会想念她的。你明白吗？"
G["Ajark, you standing like rock. Rakat move more. You move or you get hurt by wasp sting or bristlepine tusk, you see. Move more!"]="阿亚克，别像块石头似的矗在那儿啊。拉卡特就比你活跃。跑动起来啊，不然你就会被巨蜂蛰到，要不就是被钢刺野猪的獠牙戳伤。跑动起来！"
G["Ak'agthshi ma uhnish, ak'uq shg'cul vwahuhn! H'iwn iggksh Phquathi gag OOU KAAXTH SHUUL!"]="¡Ak'agthshi ma uhnish, ak'uq shg'cul vwahuhn! ¡H'iwn iggksh Phquathi gag OOU KAAXTH SHUUL!"
G["Ak-a-ra-k! No escape for -- caw -- you!"]="咕呱——嘎！休想逃走！"
G["Aka'Magosh, brave warriors. The alliance is in great number here."]="Aka'Magosh，勇士们。联盟在这里驻有重兵。"
G["Aka'Magosh, goblin!"]="你好，地精！"
G["Akama has no master.  Not anymore."]="阿卡玛没有主人了。再也没有了。"
G["Akama has no master. Not anymore."]="阿卡玛没有主人了。再也没有了。"
G["Akama, lead the way!"]="带路吧，阿卡玛！"
G["Akama, my friend!  Have you been informed?  I was found out by Vashj's followers.  Our secret is in peril!"]="阿卡玛！你听到消息了吗？我被瓦丝琪的人跟踪了。我们的秘密就要暴露了！"
G["Akama. Your duplicity is hardly surprising. I should have slaughtered you and your malformed brethren long ago."]="阿卡玛。你的两面三刀并没有让我感到意外。我早就应该把你和你那些畸形的同胞全部杀掉。"
G["Akil'darah, return me to my allies."]="阿基尔达拉，把我送回盟友那里。"
G["Akil'zon, the invaders approach!"]="埃基尔松，入侵者靠近了！"
G["Akkolon has entered the battlefield!"]="阿卡隆已经进入了战场！"
G["Aku'mai demands more sacrifices, now you must die!"]="阿库麦尔需要更多的祭品，所以你现在必须死！"
G["Aku'mai is dead! At last, I can leave this wretched place."]="阿库麦尔死了！我终于可以离开这块伤心地了。"
G["Aku'mai is sure to summon the old gods for us.  If only we can provide enough innocents to satisfy his hunger."]="阿库麦尔肯定会为我们召唤上古之神的，只要我们能够提供足够多的祭品！"
G["Aku'mai needs more innocents to be satisfied."]="阿库麦尔需要更多的祭品。"
G["Al'Akir grant my enemies a cold, swift death!"]="风之领主，让我的敌人迅速死去吧！"
G["Al'Akir, your servant calls for aid!"]="奥拉基尔，你的仆从请求你的帮助！"
G["Al'golath mal shal'nel... darkness consumes..."]="Al'golath mal shal'nel……黑暗吞噬……"
G["Al'tabim, I have lost my Zandalar Demoniac's Mantle. Can you help?"]="阿塔比姆，我搞丢了我的赞达拉恶魔师衬肩。你能给我一件新的吗？"
G["Al'tabim, I seem to have misplaced my Zandalar Illusionist's Mantle. Can you supply me with a replacement?"]="阿塔比姆，我搞丢了我的赞达拉幻术师衬肩。你能给我一件新的吗？"
G["Al'tabim, my Zandalar Confessor's Wraps have gone missing. Can you replace them?"]="阿塔比姆，我的赞达拉忏悔者裹布找不到了。你能给我一付新的吗？"
G["Al'tha, Al'tha bormaz. Ni bormaz ta'thall? It comes, it walks in flames, $r!"]="Al'tha， Al'tha bormaz， Ni bormaz ta'thall？它来了，它行走在火焰中，$r！"
G["Alamar, I'd  like to introduce you to $n, a recent escapee from Gnomeregan."]="阿拉玛尔，请允许我向你介绍$n，他刚从诺莫瑞根逃出来。"
G["Alana be'lendor!"]="¡Alana be'lendor!"
G["Alanna Raveneye attributes part of her talent in enchanting to her communion with the spirits at the Oracle Glade.  You should be able to find her there now."]="奥兰纳·鸦眼将她的天赋部分归结为与神谕林地的灵魂进行了交流。你应该能在那儿找到她的。"
G["Alanna spends most of her day at the Oracle Glade where she practices her profession.  Should you wish to learn the Enchanter's profession you will need to go there to find her."]="阿兰娜大部分时间都在神谕林地练习技能。如果你想学做一名附魔师的话，就去那儿找她吧。"
G["Alarm! Trespassers have entered the temple!"]="警报！入侵者已经进入了寺院！"
G["Alarm, my masters! INTRUDERS!"]="警报，大师！入侵者！"
G["Alarm, oh great masters! ALARM!"]="警报，大师！警报！"
G["Alarm-a-bomb unit 2600 has failed. Self-destruct override [ACTIVE]. Cooldown [ACTIVE]."]="警报炸弹2600型失效。自毁系统过载[激活]。冷却中[激活]。"
G["Alas $c, you are not considered to be a true friend of Darnassus and the night elves of Teldrassil.  Only when you prove yourself to be friendly to us through deeds - not just mere words - will I then make available my selection of mounts for your perusal."]="Por desgracia, $c, no eres $gconsiderado:considerada; $gun auténtico amigo:una auténtica amiga; de Darnassus y de los elfos de la noche de Teldrassil. Solo cuando demuestres ser $gamistoso:amistosa; con nosotros a través de los hechos (y no solo con las palabras) pondré a tu disposición mi selección de monturas, entonces podrás examinarlas."
G["Alas $c, you are not considered to be exalted to Darnassus and the night elves of Teldrassil.  Only when you prove yourself to us through deeds - not just mere words - will I then make available my selection of mounts for your perusal."]="¡Oh, $c! No te consideran $gexaltado:exaltada; en Darnassus ni tampoco los elfos de la noche de Teldrassil piensan así. Solo cuando demuestres tu valía mediante actos, no con simples palabras, tendrás a tu disposición mi selección de monturas."
G["Alas $n, I am much too busy to talk.  As I mentioned, I need time to think on the situation at hand.\n\nI wish you luck in your travels.  Good day."]="Desgraciadamente, $n, estoy demasiado ocupado para hablar. Como mencioné, necesito tiempo para pensar acerca de la situación que tenemos entre manos.\n\nTe deseo suerte en tus viajes. Que tengas un buen día."
G["Alas! Too soon."]="唉！真没意思。"
G["Alas, I have grown too weak to see the strands of fate."]="唉，我变得越来越虚弱，已经看不清命运的织线了。"
G["Alas, I'm in no condition to go on. If only our entire supply of Greenstone Brew hadn't been stolen!"]="唉，我无法继续前行了。要是我们的绿石佳酿没被偷光就好了！"
G["Alas, brave, brave adventurers, your meddling has reached its end. Do you hear the clatter of bone and steel coming up the tunnel behind you? That is the sound of your impending demise."]="唉，勇敢的冒险者，你们的路已经到头了。难道你们没有听到身后隧道里钢铁撞击的声音吗？那就是末日降临的乐章。"
G["Alas, hero of Azeroth, you give me a greater gift than you know."]="艾泽拉斯的英雄们，你们对我的恩泽远超想象。"
G["Alas, it always seems like it does.  I - as did the rest of the Cenarion Circle - had assumed that Milli's creation was destroyed during the War of the Ancients.  This, as I have come to learn, is far from correct.\n\nThe Fruit of Fertility survived... though now it is known as the Felvine.  It is being corrupted by the demonic lord of that section of Eldre'Thalas, Alzzin the Wildshaper."]="唉，事情似乎总是这样。和塞纳里奥议会的其他人一样，我也认为米琳的杰作在上古战争时就被毁掉了。但是我最近认识到，这种观点是错误的。\n\n丰饶之果并未被摧毁……尽管现在它被称为魔藤。它被埃雷萨拉斯的恶魔领主，荒野变形者奥兹恩污染了。"
G["Alas, only champions of Darnassus may purchase what I have to offer."]="哎呀，只有达纳苏斯的勇士才有资格从我这里购买物品。"
G["Alas, only the esteemed champions of Silvermoon City may purchase what I have to offer."]="哎呀，只有银月城的勇士才有资格从我这里购买物品。"
G["Alas, sometimes one must take matters into one's own hands. Balamore shanal!"]="唉，有些时候，有些事情，必须得亲自解决才行。Balamore shanal！"
G["Alas, the Zandalari trolls have already claimed and fortified it."]="可惜，赞达拉巨魔已经占据了那里。"
G["Alas, the only way to defeat the Lich King is to destroy him at the place where he was created."]="唉，击败巫妖王的唯一方法就是在他的诞生地摧毁他。"
G["Alas... I am sorry to say I cannot currently give you your fortune, as you have recently received a fortune reading from me.\n\nReturn to me several hours from when you first received your fortune.  The forces of Fate will have properly recalibrated themselves, and I will be able to see into your future."]="唉……很抱歉，我现在还不能告诉你什么，你近来刚从我这儿获得了关于命运的信息。\n\n过几个小时你再来找我吧。命运的力量或许会有所改变，我会洞察你的未来。"
G["Alchemist Narett and Brant Jasperbloom teach Alchemy and Herbalism out of a small shop here; they'll be able to help you."]="炼金师纳瑞特和布兰特·加斯布鲁姆就在小作坊外面，他们可以教你炼金术和草药学，也许能帮上你。"
G["Alchemist, I am covered with living blight!"]="炼金师，我沾到了活的枯萎！"
G["Alchemy"]="炼金术"
G["Alchemy Goods"]="炼金商品"
G["Alchemy Lab"]="炼金实验室"
G["Alchemy allows you to use herbs and other materials to create a wide variety of useful elixirs, potions, oils, flasks and cauldrons. You'll also gain greater, longer-lasting benefits when using your own elixirs and flasks.\nHighly skilled alchemists may also transmute elemental materials and certain minerals for use by other production professions.\nAlchemy pairs well with Herbalism as it allows you to gather your own herbs."]="La alquimia te permite utilizar hierbas y otros materiales para crear una gran variedad de elixires, pociones, aceites, frascos y calderas. También obtendrás beneficios mayores y de mayor duración al utilizar tus propios elixires y frascos.\n\nLos alquimistas más avanzados también pueden transmutar materiales elementales y ciertos minerales que se usan en otras profesiones de producción.\n\nLa alquimia se compagina bien con la herboristería, ya que te permite recolectar tus propias hierbas."
G["Alchemy is a bit like magic, don't you think? With the change of a single ingredient a simple drought can either heal you, or kill you."]="炼金跟魔法有点像，不是吗？只要略作增减，其效果就会从妙手回春，变成杀人不眨眼。"
G["Aldor Bank"]="奥尔多银行"
G["Aldor Gem Merchant"]="奥尔多宝石商人"
G["Aldor Inn"]="奥尔多旅店"
G["Aldor Stable"]="奥尔多兽栏"
G["Alegorn is a masterful chef who has had centuries with which to perfect his cooking.  You should consider yourself blessed should he decide to teach you.  If you believe you are worthy, you can find him in the Craftsmen's Terrace."]="Alegorn es un maestro chef que lleva perfeccionando su cocina desde hace siglos. Deberías considerarte tremendamente afortunado en el caso de que decidiera enseñarte. Si crees que eres $gdigno:digna; de ser su aprendiz, lo encontrarás en el Bancal del Artesano."
G["Alert! Alert! Construct senses that enemies have breeched our defenses. Increase pace."]="警报！警报！构造体检测到敌人已经越过了我们的防线。加速。"
G["Alert! You are marked for extermination."]="警报！消灭入侵者。"
G["Alert. You are combusting. Please execute safety procedures."]="警告。你正在燃烧。请执行安全程序。"
G["Alert: security fail-safes deactivated. Beginning memory purge and..."]="警告：安全系统自动修复装置已被关闭。立刻消除化全部存储器内容并……"
G["Alestus is a master at the... messier way of mending wounds.  If learning first aid is your aim, seek him out on the Walk of Elders, near the entrance to the Royal Exchange."]="埃雷图斯是个……处理各种伤口的大师。如果学习急救是你的目标，就去长者步道找他吧，他就在皇家贸易区的入口附近。"
G["Alexstrasza grant me the resolve to drive our enemies back!"]="阿莱克丝塔萨，赋予我坚定的信念，让我击退敌人！"
G["Alexstrasza has chosen capable allies.... A pity that I must END YOU!"]="阿莱克丝塔萨选对了盟友……很可惜，你们都将死在这里！"
G["Alexstrasza is  my answer."]="我的答案是阿莱克丝塔萨。"
G["Alexstrasza is already engaged with Deathwing! If you hurry, there may still be time to help!"]="阿莱克丝塔萨已经在和死亡之翼交战了！如果你动作够快，也许还来得及帮忙！"
G["Alexstrasza is hurt. Keep the beams red by killing Twilight Corruptors, or she will lose the fight!"]="阿莱克丝塔萨受伤了。消灭暮光腐蚀者以保持红色光束，否则她将落败！"
G["Alexstrasza will be here shortly. Come, we will prepare the sanctuary."]="阿莱克丝塔萨很快就会到来。来吧，让我们做好准备。"
G["Alexstrasza winches in pain."]="阿莱克丝塔萨痛苦的喘息着。"
G["Alexstrasza's Drakes will pick us up on the other side of this abandoned excavation site. Check your weapons, this place stinks of an ambush.\nLet me know when you're ready to move out."]="Los dracos de Alexstrasza nos recogerán al otro lado de esta excavación abandonada. Pon a punto tus armas, este lugar apesta a emboscada.\n\nCuando quieras que nos movamos, avísame."
G["Alexstrasza's drakes should meet us here..."]="阿莱克丝塔萨的幼龙应该就在这里……"
G["Alexstrasza, another of your brood falls!"]="阿莱克丝塔萨，又有一个你的孩子倒下了！"
G["Alexstrasza, can you show me what happened here?"]="这里发生了什么事，阿莱克丝塔萨？"
G["Alexstrazsa, the Life-Binder. A magnificent creature."]="阿莱克丝塔萨，生命的缚誓者。巨大的生物。"
G["Algalon diagnostics assess danger of systemic Old God corruption in planetary vital functions.  Calculating chance of Omega Reply-code..."]="奥尔加隆检测到了侵入关键行星功能的系统级上古之神污染。正在计算产生欧米迦回复代码的几率……"
G["Algalon the Observer, herald of the titans, has been defeated by our brave comrades in the depths of the titan city of Ulduar."]="我们勇敢的伙伴们深入泰坦之城奥杜尔，击败了观察者奥尔加隆，泰坦派来的使者！"
G["Algalon was sent here to judge the fate of our world."]="奥尔加隆前来决定我们这个世界的命运。"
G["Algar the Chosen is at the Reliquary of Pain to the northeast.\nPrince Navarius is on the other side of the Dead Fields to the east."]="Algar el Elegido está en el Relicario de Dolor al noreste.\n\nEl príncipe Navarius está al otro lado de los Campos Muertos al este."
G["Alive the dispossessed..."]="令被逐者生机犹存……"
G["Alizabal skewers $n to the ground."]="阿丽萨巴尔将$n困在了地上。"
G["All Hail $n, slayer of Hakkar, and hero of Azeroth!"]="向你致敬，$n，杀死哈卡的勇士，艾泽拉斯的英雄！"
G["All I be needin' is your heart."]="我只需要你的心脏。"
G["All I ever wished for was to serve my king once again.  For humanity, against a common enemy.\n\nInstead, I find that our numbers have been infiltrated by cultist scum.... and all signs point to Naxxanar as the origin of this rot."]="我一直希望能再次为国王效劳。出于人道精神，一起对抗共同的敌人。\n\n但是我发现有教徒混进了我们中间……而所有证据都表明，纳克萨纳尔就是这场灾难的源头。"
G["All I have to do is resequence the oscillating coolant pressure valves..."]="我要做的就是重新设定震荡冷却阀门……"
G["All I need now is a golden lasso."]="我现在需要的是一副金套索。"
G["All I need to prove myself here are my claws!"]="我在此需要用来证明自己的，就是我的爪子！"
G["All I wanted to do today was harvest my crops. Instead, I'm wrangling prowlers!"]="我今天原本只想收割庄稼。结果却跟小偷纠缠不休！"
G["All I wanted was a little peace and quiet!"]="我只想得到一点平静与安宁！"
G["All I wanted was to visit some friends in the city. I never wanted this! Why is the Horde doing this to us?"]="我只不过想要进城造访几位朋友。从没想到会遇见这种事！部落为何要这么对我们？"
G["All I'm saying is don't be caught dead in those outdated fashions!"]="千万不要再执迷于那些过时的风格了！"
G["All Kor'kron... under my command... kill them... NOW!"]="库卡隆，听我的命令，杀了他们！"
G["All a part of my plan."]="一切都在我的计划之内。"
G["All aboard the gunship! Man the guns!"]="全体登上飞行战舰！做好开火准备！"
G["All across the wastes, the kypari are dying.\n\nI fear that this... sha... is the cause."]="放眼整片废土，凯帕圣树正在凋零。\n\n我恐怕……煞……就是这一切的罪魁祸首。"
G["All ahead full. Everything depends on our speed! We can't let the Destroyer get away."]="全速前进。一切都取决于我们的速度了！不能让灭世者跑了。"
G["All around you, the mist grows denser."]="你周围的雾气愈发浓密了。"
G["All attack now!"]="都给我上！"
G["All barriers are now down, $n! Only Sindragosa stands between the Lich King and us. Justice comes soon..."]="所有的屏障都被击破了，$n！只有辛达苟萨还挡在我们和巫妖王之间。审判即将开始…"
G["All brawn. No brains. A recoverable loss."]="没脑子的废物。这点损失不算什么。"
G["All bugs gone. Badness here... we not be with badness."]="虫虫都不见了。这里是个坏地方……我们不要呆在这里。"
G["All but one."]="除了一个，其他都在。"
G["All cannons!  Open fire on the Crimson Veil!"]="所有火炮！对准红雾号开火！"
G["All cannons, ready."]="所有炮台，准备。"
G["All clear on Sentinel Hill, Lord Stoutmantle.  Heavy Defias movement reported in Moonbrook, however."]="斯托曼大人，哨兵岭的警报已经解除。但有报告称月溪镇地区出现了大量的迪菲亚盗贼。"
G["All clear!"]="警报解除！"
G["All clear, you can go."]="没有任何问题，你可以走了。"
G["All clear.  Looks like the colossi attack has been repelled."]="都解决了。看上去巨人的进攻被击退了。"
G["All creation will be devoured."]="一切都将被吞噬。"
G["All creatures have their uses, Wakener, but you must kill them to find out!"]="万物皆有用处，唤醒者，可你必须得杀了它们才能找到！"
G["All day, surrounded by the stench of bad feet."]="整天，都沉浸在脚臭味中……"
G["All dis bloodshed make everyone tink twice 'bout joinin' da Horde."]="这些杀戮只会让别人对加入部落产生疑虑。"
G["All done!"]="都完成了！"
G["All done! Let's get back and see if Aysa's come up with anything during her meditation. [Removed?]"]="大功告成！我们回去看看艾莎在冥想时有什么收获。[移除？]"
G["All done! The modifications should give us a little boost in speed, but I don't think she'll hold up to too much bumping."]="搞定！这次改装将会提高我们的速度，但我不认为她能经得起过多的冲撞。"
G["All done. Did I miss anything?"]="都完成了。我错过什么了吗？"
G["All enemies of the Redfang are welcome in our den!"]="红牙熊怪的敌人，就是我们的朋友！"
G["All enemies of the Shado-Pan will fall before Tenwu the Red Smoke!"]="影踪派的所有敌人都将倒在“赤烟”腾武面前。"
G["All for one! And one for Ook!"]="人人为我！我为乌克！"
G["All for what? Trinkets? You are too late. The preparations have already begun. Soon the master will make his return."]="这一切都是为了什么？几样无关紧要的小玩意？太迟了。迎接主人归来的准备工作早就开始了。很快，他就会重返这个世界。"
G["All four prisoners saved! You are teh uber!"]="四名囚犯都得救啦！你很强大！"
G["All goes exceedingly well, my lord.  Testing of the smaller prototype at the Cenarion Thicket was a complete success.  The second bomb is being ritually fueled in the courtyard below even as we speak.  And, I've sent a courier to Tuurem to bring the rest of the parts to us here."]="一切都进展得非常顺利，我的大人。塞纳里奥树林的小型样本测试非常成功。与此同时，第二个炸弹正在下面的院子里添加燃料。还有，我已经派了个信使去图雷姆把剩余的部分带回这里了。"
G["All good girls listen to their daddies!"]="所有好女孩都听爸爸的话！"
G["All good things must come to an end."]="天下没有不散的筵席。"
G["All hail $n, a $c of worth!"]="¡Ave $n, un $c de valor!"
G["All hail $n, savior of Azuremyst and Bloodmyst. Hero of the Hand of Argus, champion of the draenei people!"]="Aclamad todos a $n, $gsalvador:salvadora; de Bruma Azur y Bruma de Sangre. ¡$gHéroe:Heroína; de la Mano de Argus, $gcampeón:campeona; de los draenei!"
G["All hail $n, savior of the Vale! Conqueror of the Shao-Tien, and defender of the people! May the stars sing your name!"]="¡Tres hurras por $n, $gsalvador:salvadora; del valle, $gconquistador:conquistadora; del Shao-Tien y $gdefensor:defensora; del pueblo! ¡Que las estrellas canten tu nombre!"
G["All hail $n, the mighty conqueror of the yaungol and champion of Easterly Rest!"]="¡Aclamad a $n, gran $gconquistador:conquistadora; de los yaungol y $gcampeón:campeona; del Reposo Oriental!"
G["All hail King Stormheart!"]="向雷心国王致敬！"
G["All hail Lord Illidan!"]="伊利丹大人万岁！"
G["All hail Samophlange!"]="为主动式负载平衡器欢呼！"
G["All hail our glorious king, Ymiron!"]="尊贵的伊米隆国王，万岁！"
G["All hail the King of Gilneas, Genn Greymane!"]="向吉尔尼斯国王，吉恩·格雷迈恩致敬！"
G["All hail the exalted hero!"]="为我们尊贵的英雄欢呼吧！"
G["All hail the great creator!"]="为伟大的创造者欢呼吧！"
G["All hail the great creator."]="向我们的创造者欢呼。"
G["All hail the greatest trade prince on Azeroth... me!"]="所有人为我——艾泽拉斯最伟大的贸易大王——欢呼！"
G["All hail the savior of Binan Village!"]="¡Aclamad todos $gal salvador:a la salvadora; de Aldea Binan!"
G["All hail, $n!"]="为$n欢呼！"
G["All hail, $n! Defender of The People!"]="¡Salve, $n! ¡$gDefensor:Defensora; del Pueblo!"
G["All hail, $n! Huzzah!"]="全体向$n欢呼！万岁！"
G["All hail, $n, a true champion and protector of Ironforge!  Let no one forget the brave deeds performed by, $n!"]="向你致敬，$n，真正的勇士，铁炉堡的守护者！每个人都该永远铭记$n的英勇事迹！"
G["All hail, $n, a true champion and protector of Thunder Bluff!  Let no one forget the brave deeds performed by, $n!"]="向你致敬，$n，真正的勇士，雷霆崖的守护者！每个人都该永远铭记$n的英勇事迹！"
G["All hail, $n, the new $G King : Queen; of the ogres!!!"]="¡Saludad a $n, $g Nuevo:nueva; $g rey:reina; de los ogros!"
G["All hands on deck! The Barnacle's under attack!"]="全体上甲板！藤壶号遭到攻击啦！"
G["All hands on deck! We're losin' men fast!"]="全员都到甲板上集合！我们正迅速损兵折将！"
G["All hands to battle stations! Naga incoming!"]="所有参与作战的人都各就各位！纳迦来了！"
G["All hands to battle stations; get those monsters away from the ship!"]="全员备战，让那些怪物离我的船远一点！"
G["All hands topside! Run 'em through!"]="全体上甲板！把他们赶走！"
G["All has been gathered and is being sent to Silithus, $c. It should get there within $2113w days. I can only hope that after the gong is rung, and the gates opened, that our efforts here will make an impact and save many lives."]="$c，所有的战争物资都已经收集完毕，并且在运往希利苏斯的途中了。预计货物将在$2113w天内抵达。我只希望铜锣敲响，安其拉之门打开后，我们的努力会有所回报，挽救更多的生命。"
G["All has been gathered and is being sent to Silithus, $c. The last of it should get there within a day. I can only hope that after the gong is rung, and the gates opened, that our efforts here will make an impact and save many lives."]="$c，所有的战争物资都已经收集完毕，并且在运往希利苏斯的途中了。预计货物将在1天内抵达。我只希望铜锣敲响，安其拉之门打开后，我们的努力会有所回报，挽救更多的生命。"
G["All henchmen of da boss - Stomper Kreeg, all three of da Guards, Captain Kromcrush, and da Observer - give tribute to da new boss.  If you kill a henchman, then that henchman can't give tribute!  Each one you keep alive will give you more tribute.  Keep all of them alive and you get da BIG tribute!\n\nYeah!"]="Todos los esbirros del jefe: el vapuleador Kreeg, los tres guardias, el capitán Kromcrush y el observador, dar tributo $gal nuevo jefe:a la nueva jefa;. Si te cargas a un esbirro, ese esbirro no podrá darte un tributo. Por cada uno que mantengas con vida, más tributo recibirás. ¡Mantenlos a todos con vida y tú recibir el GRAN tributo!\n\n¡Sí!"
G["All hope is lost!"]="所有的希望都破灭了！"
G["All hope is not lost, $p."]="希望还没完全破灭，$p。"
G["All in good time, mon. I be havin' more work for you to do soon...."]="朋友，你来得正是时候。很快我就会给你安排更多的任务了……"
G["All in my path shall be destroyed!"]="挡我道者必死无疑！"
G["All inquiries regarding Medivh should be directed to Moroes, the Tower Steward. I myself know very little about the Master's business. I believe several nobles are currently having an audience with Moroes in the Banquet Hall, if you wish to inquire further."]="所有关于麦迪文的事都应该直接去问这里的管家莫罗斯，我几乎完全不知道主人在干些什么。如果你想知道更多的事情的话，我想现在正有一些贵族在宴会厅里和莫罗斯会面。"
G["All is as it should be."]="一切都恰到好处。"
G["All is completed, young $c. Even as we speak, both the Horde and the Alliance are in the process of transporting all final goods for the war into Silithus near Cenarion Hold, which should be complete in less than $2113w days. After that, the gong near the gates of Ahn'Qiraj can be rung, and the war will begin."]="任务都完成了，年轻的$c。就如我们先前约定的那样，部落和联盟必须将所有的战争物资都运往希利苏斯的塞纳里奥要塞附近，货物将在$2113w天内运达。在那之后，安其拉大门的铜锣将被敲响，战争也就拉开序幕了。"
G["All is completed, young $c. Even as we speak, both the Horde and the Alliance are in the process of transporting all final goods for the war into Silithus near Cenarion Hold, which should be complete in less than a day. After that, the gong near the gates of Ahn'Qiraj can be rung, and the war will begin."]="任务都完成了，年轻的$c。就如我们先前约定的那样，部落和联盟必须将所有的战争物资都运往希利苏斯的塞纳里奥要塞附近，货物将在1天内运达。在那之后，安其拉大门的铜锣将被敲响，战争也就拉开序幕了。"
G["All is gathered, $c. All is being transported for final preparation to Silithus and should arrive within $2113w days. All of our combined forces await the $g hero : heroine; that will complete the reunification of the Scepter of the Shifting Sands, ring the gong and begin the Ahn'Qiraj War."]="Ya lo tenemos todo, $c. Está de camino a Silithus para que le demos los últimos retoques y debería llegar en $2113w días. Todas nuestras tropas conjuntas aguardan $gal:a la; valiente que consiga reconstruir el cetro del Mar de Dunas, hacer sonar el gong y dar comienzo a la guerra de Ahn'Qiraj."
G["All is gathered, $c. All is being transported for final preparation to Silithus and should arrive within a day. All of our combined forces await the $g hero : heroine; that will complete the reunification of the Scepter of the Shifting Sands, ring the gong and begin the Ahn'Qiraj War."]="Ya lo tenemos todo, $c. Está de camino a Silithus para que le demos los últimos retoques y debería llegar en menos de un día. Todas nuestras tropas conjuntas aguardan $gal:a la; valiente que consiga reconstruir el cetro del Mar de Dunas, hacer sonar el gong y dar comienzo a la guerra de Ahn'Qiraj."
G["All is lost!"]="一切都完了！"
G["All is lost, Anchorite!  Abandon what hope remains."]="一切都失败了，学者！放弃残存的希望吧。"
G["All is lost."]="一切都完了。"
G["All is lost..."]="一切都完了……"
G["All is lost....  Forgive me, my Queen...."]="一切都失败了。请原谅我，我的女王……"
G["All is not lost! Battle these beasts without fear. Your wounds I shall heal, bones I shall mend. Be renewed, heroes!"]="我们并未丧失一切！毫无恐惧地跟这些野兽交战吧。我能为你医治伤口的，安抚痛苦。英雄们，振作起来吧！"
G["All is not lost, Kharan!"]="我们还没有失去一切，卡兰！"
G["All it needs is a hero like you to plant the seed."]="所需要的就是一位像你这样的英雄，来播下种子。"
G["All kinds of bread here! Made fresh today. Get'em while they last!"]="各种各样的面包！都是新鲜出炉的啊，走过路过不要错过！"
G["All lesser races are enemies of the true Horde!"]="所有下等种族都是正统部落的敌人！"
G["All life must be eradicated!"]="所有的生命都将被根除！"
G["All life must perish!"]="所有的生命都将灭亡！"
G["All manner of strange creatures are just ... falling from the sky!"]="各种各样的诡异生物……从天而降！"
G["All members of the Horde are equal in my eyes, $n. We have all suffered many burdens, and if it were not for wisdom and honor, then we would be no better than the Scourge or my people while our blood was tainted by the demon Mannoroth.\n\nIt is your duty to aid the Horde and to defend our way of life. But it is also your duty to know when quarter and compassion should be given to friend and foe alike.\n\nUnderstand this well. This is the new Horde, not some demon-spawned army who lack freewill."]="Todos los miembros de la Horda son iguales ante mis ojos, $n. Todos hemos sufrido innumerables cargas y si no fuera por la sabiduría y el honor, no seríamos mejores que la Plaga o que mi propia gente cuando nuestra sangre estaba manchada por el demonio Mannoroth.\n\nEs tu deber ayudar a la Horda y defender nuestro modo de vida. Pero también lo es saber cuándo dar clemencia y compasión a amigos y enemigos por igual. Esto es la nueva Horda, no una prole de demonios sin voluntad propia."
G["All mortals will perish!"]="所有的凡人都将灭亡!"
G["All muscle and no brain, that's what peons are! They're great when you can motivate them, but they have to be 'kick' started, if you know what I mean."]="¡Mucho brazo y poco seso! Así son los peones. Trabajan bien cuando eres capaz de motivarlos, pero de vez en cuando necesitan un poco más de \"motivación\", ¿entiendes?"
G["All my bags are packed, I'm ready to go."]="我已经整装待发。"
G["All my plans have led to this!"]="我所有的计划都是为了这一刻的到来！"
G["All my sweet delicious ale... gone... the horror..."]="我甜美的啤酒啊……都没了……太恐怖了……"
G["All my work... undone!"]="我的工作……还没结束！"
G["All new Kaja'Cola! Now with 100 percent more ideas!"]="全新的卡亚可乐！喝下一口，灵感翻倍！"
G["All o' this shootin' at Skorn and other places o'er the horizon, and what do ya think it's gotten me?\n\nCannonball recovery duty!\n\nNot exactly what I signed up fer, ya know?"]="这些炮弹每天都会被打到斯克恩或是地平线那边的某些地方去，但你知道为什么晚上又会回到这里吗？\n\n炮弹回收任务！\n\n但这工作跟我的合约完全不对口，你知道吗？"
G["All of Azeroth will run red with the blood of the lesser races."]="下等种族的鲜血将染红整个艾泽拉斯。"
G["All of Azeroth, prepare! The age of the Burning Blade is nigh!"]="全体艾泽拉斯的生灵们，做好准备吧！火刃氏族的时代即将到来！"
G["All of Darnassus will know what you have done for us."]="达纳苏斯的所有人都会知道你为我们所做的。"
G["All of Draenor shall quake beneath my feet!  I will destroy this world and reshape it in my image!"]="整个德拉诺都会在我脚下颤抖！我会摧毁这个世界，并以我的喜好来重铸它！"
G["All of Illidan's lieutenants have fallen, $n.  The way forward is open, if you're ready."]="伊利丹的将领已经全部被打败了，$n。如果你准备就绪，就勇敢地前进吧。"
G["All of Nature's might is at my disposal, puny mortals. Let us see which of my many forms it will be that ends your suffering!"]="卑微的凡人，所有的自然力量都由我支配。我的任何一种形态都能了结你的性命！"
G["All of Northrend is colder than a witch's heart; yet here we are...  There must be some explanation!  Quite possibly one related to the crystal pillars!"]="诺森德的大部分区域比女妖的心还要寒冷。不过，这里却……嗯，一定有什么特殊的原因！很有可能跟这些水晶柱有关！"
G["All of Pandaria will fall beneath the Wings of the Empress!"]="全潘达利亚都将拜倒在女皇之翼下！"
G["All of a sudden they were everywhere."]="突然之间，到处都是那帮家伙了。"
G["All of a sudden you're a 'Defender of the Alliance' are you?! Well, I suppose you'll be wanting to head to the Champions' Hall now. It's over in Old Town."]="¿Así que ahora, de pronto, eres $gun 'Defensor de la Alianza':una 'Defensora de la Alianza';? Bueno, supongo que querrás ir a la Sala de los Campeones. Está en el Casco Antiguo."
G["All of a sudden, I heard a noise. Kiryn was trapped! In jinyu nets!"]="突然，我听到一阵声响。琪麟被困住了！是锦鱼人的网！"
G["All of my people, dead. Maybe I should build a new manor in Binan Village?"]="我所有的家人都死了。也许我应该在滨岸村建一座新庄园？"
G["All of our collections are completed, $c. That which we have assembled is in the process of being transported to Cenarion Hold in Silithus, and the last of it should take no more than a day to arrive. The Ahn'Qiraj War can then start once that is done and someone brave and foolish rings the gong right outside of the gates down there."]="$c，所有的战争物资都已经收集完毕，并且在运往希利苏斯塞纳里奥要塞的途中了。预计货物将在1天内抵达。一旦有人使用流沙节杖敲响铜锣，安其拉一战也就拉开序幕，孰喜孰悲啊……"
G["All of our collections are completed, $c. That which we have assembled is in the process of being transported to Cenarion Hold in Silithus, and the rest of it should take no more than $2113w days to arrive. The Ahn'Qiraj War can then start once that is done and someone brave and foolish rings the gong right outside of the gates down there."]="$c，所有的战争物资都已经收集完毕，并且在运往希利苏斯塞纳里奥要塞的途中了。预计货物将在$2113w天内抵达。一旦有人使用流沙节杖敲响铜锣，安其拉一战也就拉开序幕，孰喜孰悲啊……"
G["All of our explosives are missing!? $n, something sinister is definitely happening here."]="我们所有的炸药都不见了？！$n，这里一定正在酝酿着什么邪恶的事情。"
G["All of pandaria will bow to the empress!"]="潘达利亚的子民都要臣服于女皇陛下！"
G["All of that just to wake you up? I'm sure I have several weapons that could have managed that fine."]="所有这些只是为了叫醒你？我相信我有好几种武器都能做到这一点。"
G["All of the Horde's war effort tasks are completed, young $c. Now we need but wait for the Alliance to also finish theirs and all will be ready for the Ahn'Qiraj War. Except perhaps for the gathering and reunification of the pieces to the Scepter of the Shifting Sands?"]="年轻的$c，部落已经完成了收集工作。我们只需等待联盟完成任务，安其拉一战的准备工作也就差不多了，当然，除了修复流沙节杖的事儿。"
G["All of the barriers blocking you from reaching the Sunwell have been destroyed. Enter the Sunwell and stop Kil'jaeden from entering this world!"]="所有挡在你前往太阳之井路上的魔法屏障都已经被摧毁了。前往太阳之井吧！立刻阻止基尔加丹进入这个世界！"
G["All of the collecting is done and the finished goods are being shipped over to Silithus as they're being completed. Looks like less than $2113w days until all of it is over there. After that we just need to get someone to ring that gong and open the gates to Ahn'Qiraj. Then the real fun begins."]="所有的收集工作都完成了，战争物资将被运往希利苏斯。似乎在$2113w天内货物就可全部抵达。然后，我们需要有人敲响铜锣，打开安其拉的大门。那时，真正的乐趣便开始了。"
G["All of the collecting is done and the finished goods are being shipped over to Silithus as they're being completed. Looks like less than a day until all of it is over there. After that we just need to get someone to ring that gong and open the gates to Ahn'Qiraj. Then the real fun begins."]="所有的收集工作都完成了，战争物资将被运往希利苏斯。似乎在1天内货物就可全部抵达。然后，我们需要有人敲响铜锣，打开安其拉的大门。那时，真正的乐趣便开始了。"
G["All of the fish and everything else is on its way to Silithus, and should be there in less than $2113w days. After that someone's going to have to ring that gong with the Scepter of the Shifting Sands to start the war."]="所有的战争物资都已经收集完毕，并且在运往希利苏斯的途中了。预计货物将在$2113w天内抵达。一旦有人使用流沙节杖敲响铜锣，安其拉一战也就拉开序幕。"
G["All of the fish and everything else is on its way to Silithus, and should be there in less than a day. After that someone's going to have to ring that gong with the Scepter of the Shifting Sands to start the war."]="所有的战争物资都已经收集完毕，并且在运往希利苏斯的途中了。预计货物将在1天内抵达。一旦有人使用流沙节杖敲响铜锣，安其拉一战也就拉开序幕。"
G["All of the food and war materiel we gathered is on its way to Silithus. It should be there in less than $2113w days. Someone told me that once it's all assembled over near Cenarion Hold, someone's going to have to go ring the gong at the Scarab Dais to open the gates to Ahn'Qiraj and start the war."]="我们收集的所有食物和战争物资都在运往希利苏斯的途中。似乎在$2113w天内货物就可全部抵达。有人告诉我说物资一旦到达塞纳里奥要塞，就会有人敲响甲虫墙上的铜锣，打开安其拉的大门，战争也将拉开序幕。"
G["All of the food and war materiel we gathered is on its way to Silithus. It should be there in less than a day. Someone told me that once it's all assembled over near Cenarion Hold, someone's going to have to go ring the gong at the Scarab Dais to open the gates to Ahn'Qiraj and start the war."]="我们收集的所有食物和战争物资都在运往希利苏斯的途中。似乎在1天内货物就可全部抵达。有人告诉我说物资一旦到达塞纳里奥要塞，就会有人敲响甲虫墙上的铜锣，打开安其拉的大门，战争也将拉开序幕。"
G["All of the highlands belong to the Dragonmaw, even this pit!"]="这片高地全都属于龙喉氏族，这个大坑也不例外！"
G["All of the material necessary for the Alliance's contribution to the war effort has been satisfied, $c. We await the Horde's labors to be finalized and then shall move on to transporting the war materiel to Silithus."]="联盟所需的所有战争物资都已经收集完毕，$c。我们就等着部落的劳工完成任务了，然后我们就开始所有物资运往希利苏斯。"
G["All of the nearby arokkoa face east and whistle a long, low note of devotion. [PH]"]="Todos los arokkoa cercanos dan al este y silban con una nota grave de devoción. [PH]"
G["All of the preparations are complete now, $c. We await the last of the materiel to be sent to Silithus, which should be in less than $2113w day's time. Then once the organization there is done with, someone will have to come forward and ring the gong on the Scarab Dais with the Scepter of the Shifting Sands. That is when the Ahn'Qiraj War will begin. May the Earth Mother watch over all of us then."]="所有的收集工作都结束了，$c。这些物资将在$2113w天内运抵希利苏斯。一旦准备工作就绪，就会有人使用流沙节杖敲响甲虫墙上的铜锣，打开安其拉的大门。愿大地之母守护我们。"
G["All of the preparations are complete now, $c. We await the last of the materiel to be sent to Silithus, which should be in less than a day's time. Then once the organization there is done with, someone will have to come forward and ring the gong on the Scarab Dais with the Scepter of the Shifting Sands. That is when the Ahn'Qiraj War will begin. May the Earth Mother watch over all of us then."]="所有的收集工作都结束了，$c。这些物资将在1天内运抵希利苏斯。一旦准备工作就绪，就会有人使用流沙节杖敲响甲虫墙上的铜锣，打开安其拉的大门。愿大地之母守护我们。"
G["All of these mouths to feed, and who has to do it? Me!\n\nAll the cooking, and the cleaning, and everything else!"]="这么多张嘴要喂，谁来喂？我！\n\n做饭、洗碗，还有买菜什么的全都是我在做！"
G["All of this for a piece of the World Pillar?  What exactly, shaman, do you intend to do with it?"]="你做的这些就只是为了世界之柱的碎片？你们这些萨满究竟想拿它做什么？"
G["All of this posturing, all of this dancing about in rings... it seems pointless. What's the use?"]="赛场上这种装腔作势的打斗……根本毫无意义。有什么用呢？"
G["All of us gathered here have a concept of honorable combat. Conducting yourself with honor and treating your opponent as you wish to be treated shows respect."]="在场诸位都懂得荣誉之战的概念吧。对战时光明磊落是谓尊重，公平地对待敌人是谓尊重。"
G["All of us, working collectively, have accomplished a great task. Now an even greater one confronts us. We only await the completion of the Horde's gathering efforts and then we shall all confront the Silithid and their masters together."]="我们所有人共同努力，终于完成了一项伟大的任务。现在我们需要面对更艰巨的挑战。只等部落完成他们的收集工作，我们就要全力抗衡异种虫类和它们的主人了。"
G["All of you fan out and search the chamber. If Garrosh is behind this, we're going to need proof."]="全体散开，搜索这座大厅。如果幕后黑手是加尔鲁什，那我们就需要证据。"
G["All of you fought hard and valiantly. It makes me proud to see the warriors you have become."]="你们在战斗中都表现得很勇敢。这令我十分骄傲，你们都已经成为了真正的战士。"
G["All of you have my deepest thanks. With the Focusing Iris removed, this lifeless bomb is merely a sickening testament to Garrosh's brutality. The winds of change blow fiercely; Azeroth is on the brink of war. My apologies, but you must excuse me... I have much to consider. Farewell."]="请接受我最诚挚的谢意。聚焦之虹已被移除，这个失去能量的炸弹现在只是加尔鲁什暴行的邪恶佐证。变幻之风猛烈刮过，艾泽拉斯处在战争的边缘。抱歉，请你们原谅我……我总是有许多顾虑。再见。"
G["All of you must work to aid in the great revival of our Master. Only through Him may we usher in eternal peace for all!"]="你们所有人都必须帮主人实现伟大的复活。只有凭借他的力量，我们才能迎来永久的安宁！"
G["All of your efforts have been in vain, for the draining of the World Tree has already begun!  Soon the heart of your world will beat no more!"]="你们所有的努力全都是白费力气，我已经开始吸取世界之树的力量了！很快，你们这个世界的将失去活力。"
G["All of your friends are dead."]="你的朋友们都死了。"
G["All officers should check in with me when their squads are ready. We'll enter Stratholme on my order."]="全军列队待命，各指挥官报到！听我的号令，准备进入斯坦索姆。"
G["All our items are carefully inspected and shipped with precision!  If this wasn't signed by the king himself you'd never see a dime."]="我们所有的物品都经过了仔细的检查，运送环节也十分严谨！如果这不是由国王本人签署的，你一分钱也别想拿到。"
G["All part of the Master's plan.... Your end is inevitable...."]="这全是主人的计划……你的结局是必然的……"
G["All places, all things have souls. All souls can be devoured."]="所有的地方，所有的事物都有灵魂。所有的灵魂都能被吞噬。"
G["All praise Deathwing, THE DESTROYER!"]="赞美伟大的灭世者，死亡之翼！"
G["All present and accounted for, SIR!"]="集合完毕，长官！"
G["All quiet."]="都安静下来。"
G["All reactions begin with the proper catalyst."]="所有的反应都需要恰当的催化剂。"
G["All realities, all dimensions are open to me!"]="所有的世界都向我敞开大门！"
G["All requests for my work must be made in person by the buyer. Orwin often asks me to reconsider, but my priorities lie here. Look around you: many of these fighters rely upon me for their armor."]="我所有的作品都必须由买主亲自来订购。奥尔文常常要我改变这个习惯，但是我就是不改。看看你周围吧，无数战士还指望我给他们打造装甲呢。"
G["All rewards for services rendered to be dispensed by Warcaller Beersnout.\n\nPost no bills."]="所有悬赏的奖励品都由战争召唤者比尔斯诺特分配。\n\n张贴悬赏令不需支付金币。"
G["All rewards for services rendered to be dispensed by Warcaller Sardon Truslice.\n\nPost no bills."]="所有悬赏的奖励品都由战争召唤者萨尔东·图斯莱分配。\n\n张贴悬赏令不需支付金币。"
G["All rewards to be paid by High Executor Wroth upon verification.\n\nSerious-minded individuals inquire within.\n\nNO SOLICITORS!"]="高级执行官乌洛斯负责发送悬赏令的奖励。\n\n有诚意者请入内咨询。\n\n谢绝中介！"
G["All right Riko, I think $n has heard enough. Kiryn can tell the next part."]="Ya vale, Riko, creo que hemos oído suficiente. Kiryn puede contar la parte siguiente."
G["All right everyone, listen up. We're entering hostile uncharted territory, far from the Alliance chain of command."]="好，大家听好了。我们正在进入未知的敌方领土，远离联盟控制地区。"
G["All right now. Aside from the obvious distractions a minion like this will provide against your more masculine foes, she is also capable of dealing out impressive amounts of damage. However, her fragile endurance makes her almost useless as a shield."]="好了。除了和前面那两种召唤生物的外形有着明显的差异之外，魅魔的攻击能力也非常可观。然而，她的防御力很差，所有很难作为肉盾来使用。"
G["All right people, look alive!"]="好了，伙计们，振作些！"
G["All right team, all systems are go! It's morphin' time!"]="好了，全队准备完毕！进攻！"
G["All right then... I know the way to and from Gadgetzan.  What I need for you to do is to keep the beasts off of us.  I've trained Dadanga how to defend herself pretty well, but we can't handle the overgrown madness out there for long.  Let me know when you're ready to go, $n."]="De acuerdo... Conozco el camino de ida y vuelta a Gadgetzan. Lo que necesito que hagas es que mantengas a las bestias alejadas de nosotros. He entrenado a Dadanga para que se defienda sola, pero no podemos controlar por mucho tiempo la locura que crece allí fuera. Dime cuándo estás $glisto:lista; para partir, $n."
G["All right!  Party time!"]="哈哈！开始庆祝吧！"
G["All right, $c. You think you have what it takes to make it in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit's arena battlegrounds?"]="好吧，$c。你觉得你符合参加热砂港搏击会的竞技场参与条件了吗？"
G["All right, Aponi. I've enough on my mind to share. Have you ever spoken to the elves of Moonglade?"]="好的，奥伯妮。我有很多事情要说。你有没有和月光林地的精灵们交谈过？"
G["All right, I think I can make it on my own from here.  I don't know who you are... but I owe you one.  Thank you!"]="好吧，我想我自己可以照顾自己了。我不认识你……但是我欠你一个人情。谢谢你！"
G["All right, I'll take this mixture of yours."]="好吧，我试试这瓶药剂。"
G["All right, Kiryn."]="好吧，琪麟。"
G["All right, Reavers!  The orders are here!  To battle!"]="好啦，入侵者们！攻击吧！"
G["All right, all right... but you didn't get these from me!"]="好吧，不喝就是了……但是你别想抢走这些酒！"
G["All right, boss. You sure though? Just seems like a waste of good practice."]="好罢，老大。不过你确定吗？浪费了一个挺好的练习机会……"
G["All right, fellas!  Who ordered the spiced rum?  Was it you, Jackie boy?"]="好吧，伙计！谁点了风味朗姆酒啊？小杰克，是你吗？"
G["All right, ladies! Watch this!"]="好吧，女士们！看好了！"
G["All right, let's do this!"]="好的，让我们开始吧！"
G["All right, look sharp. We're There should be a land mass nearby where the survivors landed."]="好了，都看仔细。这附近应该会有大陆块，幸存者可能就在上面。"
G["All right, so maybe the arenas ain't for you, right? Right. Turns out Vixton had some leftover armor from the first season, and we gotta get rid of it somehow. But nothing's free, know what I'm sayin'?"]="好吧，或许竞技场并不适合你？维克斯顿还有些第一季的存货，我们正想处理掉呢。不过天下没有免费的大餐，你懂我的意思吧？"
G["All right, stay close.  These fiends will jump right out of the shadows at you if you let your guard down."]="准备好，靠近点。要是你放松戒备的话，那些恶魔会从暗处跳出来偷袭你的。"
G["All right, step right up, $r. Right up there on the teleporter."]="很好，过来吧，$r，站到传送器上来。"
G["All right, sunshine.  Time to spill your guts before I spill 'em for ya!"]="好了，宝贝儿。快把你知道的都说出来，别逼我动手！"
G["All right, troops. Look alive! Is everyone ready?"]="好了，全队注意！大家都准备好了吗？"
G["All right, watch my back while I get you some of this ore."]="嗯，我帮你采矿的时候，你要帮我望风。"
G["All right, you guys! Time to get up"]="弟兄们，该起床了！"
G["All right, you lazy bums, time to get up and get started. That bridge isn't getting built on its own."]="好了，你们这些懒虫，该起床干活了。桥是不会自己造好的。"
G["All right, you twisted mess of broken gears, let's get to work!"]="好啊，你真有让机器起死回生的能力。让我们开始工作吧！"
G["All right, you win! I surrender! Just don't hurt me!"]="好吧，你赢了！我投降！不要伤害我！"
G["All right.  It's made!"]="好了。搞定了！"
G["All right. Let us make haste to the village!"]="好吧。我们赶快前往村庄！"
G["All serve the master in death."]="死后仍为主人效命。"
G["All services and shops are to remain closed until further notice! That is all!"]="在没有进一步的通告前，所有的服务设施和商店都不得开业！就是这样！"
G["All soldiers of Lordaeron should immediately report to the entrance of Stratholme, and await further orders from Prince Arthas."]="洛丹伦的士兵都听着！立即前往斯坦索姆入口处集合，等待阿尔萨斯王子的进一步指示。"
G["All systems on-line.  Prepare yourself, we leave shortly."]="所有设备已经开启，准备好，我们很快就要离开了。"
G["All systems online and functional!"]="所有系统已上线，可以使用！"
G["All that awaits you is nothingness.  Emptiness."]="等待你的只有虚无。无尽空虚。"
G["All that is yours? Mine!"]="那都是你的？是我的！"
G["All that matters is what you do with it."]="关键在于，你如何利用它。"
G["All that matters... is this moment."]="最重要的是……此时此刻。"
G["All that official business is handled up in Stormwind these days.  You could stop by the Stormwind Visitor's Center if you want to start a guild."]="这些日子以来，所有的官方事务都是在暴风城处理的。如果你想要组织公会的话，就去暴风城接待中心吧。"
G["All that stands in our way... is pride."]="而最大的阻碍……就是骄傲。"
G["All that we have fought for in this world is lost. The hopes and dreams carried by my father and mother... by Doomhammer... Gone..."]="我们追寻的梦想破灭了。我的双亲……还有奥格瑞姆……他们的期望和梦想……破灭了……"
G["All that you know will fade."]="你所知的一切都将消逝。"
G["All that you know... will be undone."]="你所知道的一切……都会被撤销。"
G["All that's left now is the head. And it can't have gotten far."]="现在只剩下头了，它应该在不远的地方。"
G["All that's left of $n is a red stain on the floor!"]="$n留下来的只不过是地上的一大块红色污点！"
G["All that's left of the challenger is a red stain on the floor!"]="挑战者只留下了一滩血迹！"
G["All the arcane power in the world, and here I am, summoning more food and water."]="我拥有无与伦比的奥术力量，却待在这里不停地召唤食物和水。"
G["All the booty ish mine!"]="所有战利品都是我的！"
G["All the bottles on this table are potions I brewed today. And they say a watched pot never boils. Ha!"]="桌上的所有瓶子中都盛有今天配制好的药水。心急吃不到热豆腐。哈哈！"
G["All the brew... gone..."]="所有的酒……都没了……"
G["All the fisherman have moved to Darnassus with the recent attacks around Lake Al'Ameth.  You should try looking for someone to train you there."]="奥拉密斯湖近来遭受袭击，所有的渔夫都已经搬迁到达纳苏斯了。你应该去那儿看看。"
G["All the hozen gotta listen now..."]="所有猢狲都听好了……"
G["All the kids are just dying for some Brivelthwerp's ice cream!"]="孩子们全都无法抵挡布里维普牌冰淇淋的诱惑！"
G["All the lives he has taken... Such misery and pain inflicted on the innocent. And for what?"]="他夺走了多少鲜活的生命……给无辜的民众带来了多少痛苦。为了什么？"
G["All the more reason to purify it."]="那就更该净化它了。"
G["All the more reason we need to reach the bottom of this.  This tablet from Ulduar will lead us in the right direction.  Brann is sure of it.  And if Brann is certain, then I am certain."]="所以我们更有理由对此追根究底。来自奥杜尔的石板将为我们指出正确的方向。布莱恩对这一点非常坚信。如果布莱恩坚信，那我也一样。"
G["All the oceans shall be ours, and then we shall look beyond."]="海洋将完全属于我们，远大征程才刚刚开始。"
G["All the other trainees are such good riders. I hope to be as good as them someday. In the meantime, I just have to keep practicing!"]="其他弟子都是非常优秀的骑士。但愿有一天，我也能像他们那么出色。在那之前，我只要不懈地练习就行了！"
G["All the resources have been gathered.  Yippee!"]="所有的物资都准备妥当了。哈哈！"
G["All the rest of our people are down there!"]="我们其余所有人都在那下面！"
G["All the roguish types hang out in The Forlorn Cavern, north of the gates of Ironforge.  I'd wager ye'll find Fenthwick there, no doubt counting the coin of another cut purse.  I'll catch him one of these days!  \nIn the meantime I'll have my eye on you as well, $glad : lass;."]="Todos esos pícaros matan el tiempo en La Caverna Abandonada, al norte de las puertas de Forjaz. Apuesto a que allí encontrarás a Fenthwick, contando las monedas de otro monedero robado. ¡Uno de estos días lo cogeré! \n\nMientras tanto, no te quitaré los ojos de encima a ti tampoco, $gmuchacho:muchacha;."
G["All the stuff here... It's so... so... different!"]="这里所有的东西……都那么……那么……不同！"
G["All the supplies flowing north to Ashenvale stop here to rest and re-fuel. It's important to keep our operations running smoothly."]="全部前往北方灰谷的运输队都会在这里停留，休息并补充食水。确保这里一切工作正常是非常重要的。"
G["All these dead Tauren got on 'em is beads and junk. Did you score anything good?"]="所有这些牛头人的身上都只有一些念珠和垃圾。你有没有找到什么有用的东西？"
G["All these folks are keeping me busy.  Take this horse over to your stables."]="我整天都忙得不可开交。来，将这匹马牵到你的马厩去吧。"
G["All these folks comin' and goin' these days. It really gets you thinkin' about life.\n\nLike, maybe... I should be comin' and goin' somewhere, too."]="看着如今这些来来往往的人。真会引发你对人生的思考。\n\n比如，也许……我也应该到别的地方来来往往一把。"
G["All these poor souls... here, this will lead you home."]="这些可怜的灵魂……这边走，它会带领你们返回故乡的。"
G["All these sad pandas making Ken-Ken a sad hozen."]="看着这些熊猫人如此悲伤，肯肯也快变成悲伤的猢狲了。"
G["All they be doin' is a little huntin' and gatherin'. Where's the harm in that??"]="他们所做的一切只是打打猎，收集些东西。他们究竟做错了什么？？"
G["All things for sale, my friend!  Large and small, whatever you need, Hazzin will provide.\n\nIf you value your life, do not approach Manaforge Ultris without a resupply.  Hazzin is the last chance that you have."]="¡Todo en venta, $gamigo:amiga;! Grande y pequeño, sea lo que sea lo que necesitas, Hazzin te lo proporcionará.\n\nSi valoras tu vida, no te acerques a la forja de maná Ultris sin reabastecerte. Hazzin es la última oportunidad que tienes."
G["All things in nature exists in an interconnected web; an ecology.  If we're careful not to disturb it, and simply observe, we may be fortunate to piece together the complex relationship between the diverse organisms around us.\n\nOnce we have that understanding, we can take the appropriate actions to ensure the wellbeing of all creatures.  Interfere without that knowledge, and we'll surely cause destruction.\n\nI am here to observe the complex interactions between the sporelings and the bog lords."]="在大自然中存在的所有东西都有着相互的联系，这被称作生态系统。如果我们小心地不去打扰它，通过简单的观察便可以了解到我们周围不同的生物体之间的复杂关系。\n\n一旦我们理解了这些，就可以采取适当的行动来保证所有生物的生存。反之，在没有这种认识的情况下去干预的话，就会引起破坏。\n\n我在这里观察孢子人和沼泽领主之间的复杂关系。"
G["All this electricity in the air is wreaking havoc on my hair."]="空气中的电流把我的头发都弄坏了。"
G["All this equipment just to examine ice?"]="这艘船……仅仅是为了检查浮冰？"
G["All this fighting is finally getting to you, $n.  Do not worry, I will not divulge your little secret -- lest the others think you're mad.\n\nGet some rest.  It'll do you good."]="Tanta batalla está acabando contigo, $n. No te preocupes, no divulgaré tu secretito… no sea que el resto piense que estás $gloco:loca;.\n\nDescansa un poco. Te vendrá bien."
G["All this fighting is such a waste. How do your people do it all the time? When do you find time to celebrate and enjoy the simple things?"]="战斗简直是浪费生命。你们这些人怎么整天打打杀杀的？什么时候才能让自己享受简简单单的快意人生？"
G["All this free candy is just bad business, I tell you. Or... maybe it's just a loss leader... they get you in the inn, and then gouge you on the meat. It's brilliant!"]="我说，免费的糖果真是个赔钱的买卖。呃……或许它们只是招揽顾客的减价货呢……糖果诱使你进入旅店，接下来你就要花钱吃肉啦。太棒了！"
G["All this fuss just for me?"]="这些忙乱都是因为我吗？"
G["All this running make Dajik not hungry for chicken anymore."]="跑来跑去的……弄得达伊克再也不想吃鸡肉了。"
G["All this talk about food is making me hungry!"]="这些关于食物的话题让我更饿了！"
G["All those barrels... some of my finest brew. At least it went out in a blaze of glory!"]="这些桶……有些是我最珍爱的好酒。至少它们曾焕发出荣耀！"
G["All those dragon essences I've collected... the power... is exhilerating!"]="我已经收集了这么多龙类的精华……这种力量……真让人激动不已！"
G["All those official types reside in Ironforge.  Ye'll be wanting to check out the Ironforge Visitor's Center for guild creation papers."]="所有的官员都居住在铁炉堡。你得去铁炉堡访客中心领取公会登记表。"
G["All those who betray Ragnaros must die!"]="背叛拉格纳罗斯的人都得死！"
G["All those years in stasis followed by sudden, rapid growth."]="多年来一直出于休眠停滞的状态，现在又突然快速增长。"
G["All those years of research... and for nothing! Perhaps they were right, perhaps this is something we must learn to live with."]="这么多年来的研究……结果却是一场空！也许他们是对的，也许这是我们必须与之斗争一生的东西。"
G["All three barriers are fully operational. Consult with Archmage Ne'thul in Sun's Reach Harbor to aid the effort in unlocking the gates."]="所有三道屏障都在运转中。你可以去阳湾港口找大法师奈苏尔，协助他来解除这些屏障。"
G["All three of the gates at the Sunwell Plateau have been brought down, $n.\n\nYou must marshal your forces and stop Kil'jaeden from entering Azeroth before all is lost!"]="Las tres puertas de la Meseta de La Fuente del Sol han sido derribadas, $n.\n\n¡Has de organizar tus tropas y evitar que Kil'jaeden entre en Azeroth antes de que sea demasiado tarde!"
G["All too easy."]="太简单了。"
G["All units cleared for deployment. Execute scenario delta. Casualties not a concern."]="所有单位等待部署。执行代号德尔塔方案。不计人员伤亡。"
G["All we ask is help in finding Prophet Khar'zul. You know the surrounding islands better than we do. Your knowledge would be invaluable."]="我们唯一的要求，就是请你们帮忙寻找先知克哈祖尔。你们对这周围的岛屿更加熟悉。你们的知识是无比宝贵的。"
G["All we had to do was deploy the Krazzworks airfield-in-a-box and begin a routine surveying mission.\n\nI'm surrounded by idiots!"]="我们要做的，就是部署卡拉兹工坊微型机场，然后开始例行考察任务。\n\n我被白痴包围了！"
G["All we have is our land. And that commander wants us to give it up to the mantid?"]="除了土地，我们一无所有。那位指挥官却想让我们把它拱手让给螳螂妖？"
G["All we know of this timeway is that it leads to Mount Hyjal. The Infinite Dragonflight have gone to great lengths to prevent our involvement. We know next to nothing, mortal. Soridormi is currently attempting to break through the timeway's defenses but has thus far been unsuccessful. You might be our only hope of breaking through and resolving the conflict."]="这个时间流通向海加尔山，我们只知道这些。永恒之龙不顾一切地阻止我们的介入，因此我们对其它的事情丝毫没有头绪，凡人。索莉多米正在尝试着突破时间流的防守，但是迄今都没有成功。你或许是我们突破和解决这个冲突的唯一希望。"
G["All we need is just a little patience."]="我们都需要忍耐。"
G["All who conspire with the Darkspear face punishment by death!"]="暗矛部族的同谋犯都将被处死！"
G["All who slay Frostpaw are our allies!"]="霜爪熊怪的敌人就是我们的盟友！"
G["All who venture here belong to me, including you!"]="所有胆敢冒险进入这里的家伙都会成为我的财产，你也一样！"
G["All will be ash."]="一切都将化成灰烬。"
G["All will be reduced to ash!"]="一切都将化为灰烬！"
G["All will be well children.  The Light shall see to that!"]="孩子们，一切都会好起来的。光明会庇佑我们的！"
G["All will fall before the might of the Scarlet Crusade!"]="所有人都将屈服于血色十字军的力量！"
G["All will fall before us!!"]="万物都将臣服于我们！！"
G["All will fall in the name of Hellscream!"]="以地狱咆哮之名，毁灭一切！"
G["All will fall to the master's call...."]="万事万物都将服从主人的召唤……"
G["All will know of what has transpired here in this accursed temple, hero. It will be written about in history books - the tales told as legend from Azeroth to the far reaches of the Nether itself!"]="Todos sabrán lo que ha acontecido en este templo maldito, $ghéroe:heroína;. ¡Esta gesta formará parte de los libros de historia: las aventuras convertidas en leyenda desde Azeroth hasta los mismos límites del Vacío!"
G["All work and no play makes... I'll just shut up and keep hammering."]="都给我工作，不要再开玩笑了……我会闭上嘴，继续敲。"
G["All you $R want is my weed."]="你们这些$R要的只是我的烟草。"
G["All you be doin' is wastin' me time!"]="你们所做的一切不过是浪费我的时间！"
G["All you gotta do is learn Shadow Word: Pain and use it on some of the training dummies around here!"]="你所要做的就是学习暗言术：痛，并使用在附近的训练假人身上！"
G["All you gotta do is learn how to cast Corruption, and then go use it on these training dummies that Bamm is shooting at. Corrupt 'em!"]="你要做的就是学会如何施放腐蚀术。然后，对巴姆正在射击的那些训练假人使用这个法术，腐蚀它们。"
G["All you gotta do is learn how to cast Frost Nova. Then, head over to the training dummies that Bamm is shooting at and let 'er rip."]="你要做的就是学会如何施放冰霜新星。然后，到巴姆正在射击的那些训练假人那里去，冻裂它们。"
G["All you gotta do is let me teach you how to do a Steady Shot and then use it on these training dummies right here."]="我会教你如何进行稳固射击，然后你就要在这些训练假人上练习这种技能了。"
G["All you gotta do is let me teach you how to do an Eviscerate. Then, head over to one of those training dummies that Bamm is shooting at and attack it with a Sinister Strike. Once you've done that, finish it off with the Eviscerate."]="我会教你如何施展刺骨技能。然后，你可以到巴姆正在射击的那些训练假人那里去，用影袭技能攻击其中的一个，再用刺骨技能干掉那个假人。"
G["All you gotta do is let me teach you how to perform a Primal Strike and then use it on these training dummies that Bamm is shooting at."]="我会教你如何进行根源打击。然后，你可以到巴姆正在射击的那些训练假人那里去，实践这个技能。"
G["All you seek to conquer is each other!"]="你们想战胜的，只是彼此！"
G["All you slaves better step it up!"]="你们这些奴隶最好再卖力一些！"
G["All your fault!"]="都是你的错！"
G["All yours. Make good use of her!"]="交给你啦。好好利用它吧！"
G["All's clear, $n. Don't let down your guard, though. Those virmen can tunnel faster than you can say \"Virmen a hole!\""]="Todo despejado, $n. Pero no bajes la guardia. Esos mures pueden cavar un túnel en menos que tú dices \"¡Mur al hoyo!\"."
G["Alley-OOP!"]="接着！"
G["Alliance \"hero.\" Let's see how you fight without a flying warship to cover your back!"]="\"Orgullo\" de la Alianza. ¡A ver cómo luchas sin una nave que te cubra las espaldas!"
G["Alliance - they've surrounded the camp! What are they doing here? Why are they attacking Taurajo? Get the children - run! RUN!"]="联盟已经包围了这座营地！他们到这里来干什么？为什么他们要攻击陶拉祖？赶快带孩子们逃走，快！快！"
G["Alliance Battlemasters"]="联盟战场军官"
G["Alliance Defense Victory Calculation Here."]="联盟防御胜利计算。"
G["Alliance Hit!"]="我被联盟击中了！"
G["Alliance Inn"]="联盟旅店"
G["Alliance and jinyu... fight side by side?"]="联盟和锦鱼人……一起打我们？"
G["Alliance are here!"]="联盟来了！"
G["Alliance bloods spills. This pleases me, General."]="联盟血溅四野。真是大快人心啊，将军。"
G["Alliance bonfire."]="联盟篝火。"
G["Alliance dogs will find no refuge in this land!"]="联盟狗在这片土地上没有立足之地。"
G["Alliance dogs!\nLook at my poor wyverns..."]="¡Perros de la Alianza!\n\nMira a mis pobres dracoleones..."
G["Alliance dogs! Where are your teeth?"]="联盟狗！你的爪牙呢？"
G["Alliance dookers! We part of Horde now!"]="联盟坏蛋！我们现在是部落的一员啦！"
G["Alliance horns? Stay on guard!"]="联盟的号角声？保持警惕！"
G["Alliance idiots! Don't they realize their efforts are futile?"]="联盟这帮蠢货！他们没有意识到所有努力都是白费的吗！"
G["Alliance nearby."]="附近有联盟。"
G["Alliance reinforcements have arrived."]="联盟援军到了。"
G["Alliance scum!"]="联盟的渣滓！"
G["Alliance ship! Portside!"]="联盟舰船！左舷方向！"
G["Alliance soldiers! So bold, so cavalier. (Scurry, scurry, scurry, mortals.) Your numbers are small, and you are too late. (Helpless and hopeless, helpless and hopeless.)"]="联盟士兵！非常大胆，非常傲慢。（匆忙，匆忙，匆忙的凡人。）你们势单力孤，而且来得太迟了。（无助而无望的，无助而无望的。）"
G["Alliance to our south, mogu to our east and west, and cliffs to the north. We are hemmed in on all sides."]="我们的南面是联盟，东面和西面有魔古族，北面是悬崖。这还真是四面楚歌啊。"
G["Alliance witch!"]="联盟女巫！"
G["Alliance... near..."]="联盟……在逼近……"
G["Allies of Nature have appeared!"]="自然的盟友出现了！"
G["Allies present in the field of battle are likely to provide synergies and minimize combat duration."]="与盟军协同作战可以提高战斗力，使战斗时长降到最短。"
G["Allow me a moment to rest. The journey taxes what little strength I have."]="请让我休息一会，我已经非常累了。"
G["Allow me ta show you something I discovered. Now where'd I see dat satchel?"]="让我给你看些我找到的东西。咦，背包哪去了？"
G["Allow me to ask a simple question: Is a man allowed - entitled even - the sweat of his brow?"]="请允许我问一个简单的问题：一个男人是否有资格靠自己的血汗为生？"
G["Allow me to catch you up on... current events."]="让我给你讲解一下……当前的情况。"
G["Allow me to gather up my things, and I will meet you there."]="请允许我收拾一下东西，然后我会前去找你。"
G["Allow me to get some water for the inking reagent."]="让我拿点东西……"
G["Allow me to introduce myself - I am Ya Firebough, illustrious leader of this formerly maginificent hamlet.\n\nClearly, you are an upstanding citizen of the world.\n\nI wonder if I could trouble you to help me out of this rather sticky situation? I'm certain that the Shado-Pan at the nearby retreat will be more than happy to recompense you for any inconvenience."]="Permíteme que me presente, soy Ya Tallo Ardiente, ilustre líder de esta antiguamente magnífica aldea.\n\nEstá claro que eres $gun honesto ciudadano:una honesta ciudadana; del mundo.\n\n¿Me ayudarías a salir de esta situación tan embarazosa? Estoy seguro de que el Shadopan del refugio más cercano te recompensará por las molestias."
G["Allow me to introduce myself. I am Randolph Moloch, and I will be killing you all today."]="请让我做一下自我介绍。我是兰多菲·摩洛克。今天，我会把你们杀光。"
G["Allow me to make your underwater experience a little more... pleasant."]="请允许我让你的水下之旅变得更加……愉悦。"
G["Allow me to shine your shoes! Only one copper for the service!"]="让我擦亮你的鞋吧！只要一个铜币！"
G["Allow me to show you the power of amber alchemy..."]="让我给你们展示一下琥珀炼金术吧……"
G["Allow me to speed up the process a bit!"]="让我把进程速度加快一点！"
G["Allow me to take care of the intruders, lord.  I will feed their entrails to the maggots."]="让我来对付这些入侵者吧。我会将他们的内脏拿去喂蛆。"
G["Allow the orb to take you where it will...."]="让宝珠引导你的思绪……"
G["Almost all of da troops be here now."]="几乎所有的部队都在这儿了。"
G["Almost back to Ratchet! Let's keep up the pace..."]="就快回到棘齿城了！再加把劲……"
G["Almost done! Just a little longer!"]="快完成了！再给我一点点时间！"
G["Almost done."]="就要完成了。"
G["Almost done..."]="快完成了……"
G["Almost finished! We still need..."]="就快大功告成啦！只需要……"
G["Almost got it!"]="就快了！"
G["Almost perfect shot! It's a bit off but I can see where Grumlar would miss with it. He couldn't hit the broad side of a barn."]="完美的射击！格鲁姆拉根本就没这个准头，他就是用枪顶着目标也不一定能打中！"
G["Almost there!\n\nThere's a cold mug of relief waiting for me at the Tavern in the Mist. I can almost taste it already..."]="就快了！\n\n在迷雾酒肆里有冰镇美酒等着我呢。我仿佛已经尝到了……"
G["Almost time to attack!"]="进攻的时刻即将到来！"
G["Almost."]="快喝完了。"
G["Almost... got... it..."]="马上……就……好……"
G["Alms for the poor?"]="救济一下穷人吧？"
G["Along the southeast end of the Walk of Elders, Lynalis has set up a fine leatherworking stand. She'll train you... for a fee."]="沿着长者步道走到东南方的尽头，莱纳里斯在那里开了一家制皮点。她会教你的，只要你肯付钱。"
G["Along with the budding staves of all the elders who came before us, growing now into giant trees."]="那些在我们之前到来的长者，他们的禅杖也已生根发芽，那里已经长出参天密林。"
G["Along with the naga's ore, the cleansed metal that you provide will form a nigh-invulnerable alloy."]="有了纳迦的矿石和你提供的纯净金属，就可以铸造出一种几乎无懈可击的合金了。"
G["Alright $n!"]="干得好，$n！"
G["Alright Ben. We've retrieved the amberseeds again. You know the drill."]="很好。我们已经找到了琥珀种子。你知道该怎么做了吧。"
G["Alright Bessy, let's get 'cha out for a walk here. Hut, hut!"]="很好，贝希，我们出去散散步吧。来，来！"
G["Alright Brownstone, time to get to work!"]="好了，褐石，该干活儿了！"
G["Alright I'm going! Stop yelling!"]="好好好，我知道了！别喊了！"
G["Alright boys! Come get some slickies fresh off the grill!"]="¡Venga, chicos! ¡Venid a por un poco de \"manduka\" recién sacada de la parrilla!"
G["Alright boys, let's do this!"]="小伙子们，咱们动手吧！"
G["Alright boys, lets go nuts."]="好吧，伙计们，让我们疯狂一把吧。"
G["Alright boys, shake 'em down!"]="好了，小子们。搅个天翻地覆吧！"
G["Alright boys, we got a challenger!  Time to show the general what our little captive can do!"]="好吧兄弟们，我们有挑战者了！是时候让将军见识下我们小俘虏的本事！"
G["Alright den... you just take de bits here, any bits, it don' matter, livin' or stone or what..."]="好吧…………这里的全都属于你。没关系，无论是有生命的、岩石的，还是……"
G["Alright everyone. Follow me and uhh... just act natural."]="好吧大家。跟我来，而且，呃……自然点儿。"
G["Alright everyone. Make preparations to take the prisoner back to the Vale. We'll be handing him over to Hellscream once he's had some time to cool off."]="好了，所有人听好。准备把这名囚犯带回锦绣谷。当地狱咆哮冷静下来之后，我们再将他移送过去。"
G["Alright i'm sweating now, Twilight's Hammer get in here and defend me!"]="好吧，现在我出汗了。暮光之锤竟然会到这里来保护我！"
G["Alright now, let's get those rifles sighted in..."]="好吧，让我们瞄准……"
G["Alright then, lets go tie them up!"]="好吧，把他们绑起来！"
G["Alright then. Make ready everyone... here we go!"]="好，大家坐稳啦……我们出发！"
G["Alright you sorry sacks of bones. Let's see what you've got. Strike your opponent, and don't stop till I say so."]="好了，你这堆可怜的烂骨头。让我们看看你有什么本事。攻击你的对手，我说停的时候你才能停止。"
G["Alright!"]="好啊！"
G["Alright!  Let's head down to the Swamp of Sorrows!"]="好了，我们去悲伤沼泽！"
G["Alright! Alright! We surrender... Just put your weapons down, I'll cooperate!"]="好了，好了！我们投降……不过请放下你的武器，我会合作的！"
G["Alright! Back to Uncle Chen at Halfhill! Race you there, $n!"]="¡Muy bien! ¡Volvamos a por Chen a El Alcor! ¡Te echo una carrera!"
G["Alright! I am beaten. Your precious archmage is held in a prison, elevated and sealed. Even if you manage to reach her, Salrand herself holds the key. Your mission is folly!"]="告诉你吧，我们已经封印了那位尊贵的大法师。就算你能找到她，可钥匙在莎尔兰德手中。你不过是在白费力气！"
G["Alright! It's time to kill some skreekin' jinyu!"]="好吧！去杀几个恶心的锦鱼人吧！"
G["Alright! Let's get down to business!"]="好了！让我们开始干正事吧！"
G["Alright! Let's go smush that water varmint!"]="很好！让我们痛扁这个水鬼吧！"
G["Alright! Now I'm gonna whup yer butt!"]="很好！我要踢爆你的屁股！"
G["Alright, $n, your transponder is ready!"]="好了，$n，你的传送器已经准备好了！"
G["Alright, $n. Follow me!"]="$n，跟着我！"
G["Alright, $n. I'm ready to go."]="好了，$n。我准备好出发了。"
G["Alright, $n. Time to see what this staff of yours has to show us."]="好的，$n。让我们看看你到底有怎样的能力。"
G["Alright, $p, let's take this one out!"]="好，$p，让我们来干掉这个！"
G["Alright, $p... we are now RIVALS. You haven't seen the last of me."]="好吧，$p……我们棋逢对手。你还没见识我的真正实力。"
G["Alright, Becca, just leave them in the garden next to the bush. Watch out for wolves!"]="好吧，贝卡，把它们放在树丛旁的花园里就行了。要小心狼！"
G["Alright, Bite, I'll let you out."]="好吧，拜特。我会让你出来。"
G["Alright, Blaze, let's roast 'em!"]="来吧烈焰，让我们烧焦他们！"
G["Alright, Gidwin... deep breaths..."]="好了，吉德文……深呼吸……"
G["Alright, I admit it, you've proven yourself and then some, $n.\n\nIf I was hard on you before it was because I saw the spark of a true Skyguard within you.  I dare say that you're the finest ace that we have!\n\nAnytime that you want to help out, I'll be more than proud to hand you another set of bombs."]="Vale, lo admito, has demostrado lo que vales y más, $n.\n\nSi antes he sido dura contigo, ha sido porque he visto la chispa de un auténtico Guardia del cielo en ti. ¡Me atrevería a decir que eres el mejor as que tenemos!\n\nCuando quieras ayudar, estaré más que orgullosa de entregarte otro montón de bombas."
G["Alright, I think I know what our next move's gotta be."]="好吧，我想我知道接下来该做什么了。"
G["Alright, I'll go. But this is the last time I'm going to infiltrate the Horde! And I mean it."]="好吧，这次我去。但这是我最后一次潜入部落！我说真的。"
G["Alright, I'll sign writs now. Bring 'em to the front, maggots."]="好的，我马上就会签署书面命令的。把它们带去前线吧。"
G["Alright, I'll tell her."]="好吧，我去叫她。"
G["Alright, I'm ready to get back to the front."]="好吧，我已经准备好重返前线了。"
G["Alright, I'm ready."]="好的，我准备好了。"
G["Alright, Leza, I need you to push. Are you ready?"]="好了，莱莎，我需要你用力推。你准备好了么吗？"
G["Alright, Mk. I, that should just about do it.  Let's just flip your switch here..."]="好吧，麦克斯米林I型，快要开始了。我们打开你的这个开关……"
G["Alright, Shanna. You're up."]="好吧，莎娜。你上。"
G["Alright, Tenjiyu.  I'll go get you some food from the sleeping trolls."]="好吧，特基乌。我去从那些熟睡的巨魔身边帮你偷些吃的。"
G["Alright, agents. Listen up."]="好了，特工们。听好了。"
G["Alright, alright already! Enough with the shoving!"]="好了，好了！别再刨根问底了！"
G["Alright, alright! I think I can figure out how to operate this thing..."]="好吧好吧！我想我能找出操作这个东西的办法……"
G["Alright, alright, you win."]="好吧，好吧，你赢了。"
G["Alright, alright. Anyhow, so I sorta slipped into the shadows.\n\nThat didn't sit too well with Windsor, seeing as how he was already extra cranky. Well he started spinnin' old Ironfoe around and screaming like a mad man at the orcs."]="好吧，好吧。总之，从某种意义上说，我退到了一个不起眼的角落里。\n\n温德索尔似乎并不安分，看看他那歇斯底里的样儿。他拿着反对者战锤没命地乱挥，像发了疯一样对兽人咆哮着。"
G["Alright, alright. We've got a line going out here, you know."]="好吧，好吧，有观众离场了，你懂的。"
G["Alright, alright. You two can go play just stay in town. No sneaking off to bug Warg and Khara down by the water."]="好吧。你们两个可以去玩，但不许跑出镇子去。不要偷偷溜出去打扰水边的瓦格和卡拉。"
G["Alright, boys. Let's show 'em how Blackfuse Company fights."]="好吧，伙计们，让他们看看黑索公司的战斗力！"
G["Alright, done with the little guys! Let's move on to this \"horrible silk monster\"!"]="¡Muy bien, ya hemos acabado con los pequeñajos! ¡Ahora a por el \"horrible monstruo de seda\"!"
G["Alright, enough, enough! STOP HITTING ZHI-ZHI!"]="够了，够了！别打齐齐了！"
G["Alright, everything looks in order. Let's get this show on the road."]="好吧，一切看起来都井然有序。让我们一路看戏吧。"
G["Alright, folks... Once task 37066 is implemented, the boat will arrive 'now-ish'. In the meantime, I invite you to join us in a little dance to fill the time..."]="好吧，兄弟们……等37066号任务一执行，船就会“即刻”抵达。在此期间，我邀请你们一起来跳段小舞消磨时光……"
G["Alright, give me a second to get my bearings..."]="好吧，等我一会儿，我去拿轴承……"
G["Alright, here I go!"]="好了，出发！"
G["Alright, here we go!"]="好了，我们出发！"
G["Alright, here's another. Try not to lose this one!"]="好吧，再给你一枚。这次千万别再弄丢了！"
G["Alright, it looks safe. Get in there, engineer!"]="好吧，看上去安全了。进去吧，工程师！"
G["Alright, j... just let me... let me st... stand up."]="好，让我……让我……站……起来。"
G["Alright, keep me protected while I plant this disruptor. This shouldn't take very long."]="好吧，在我放置这干扰器的时候好好保护我。这不会花费太长时间的。"
G["Alright, kid. Stay behind me and you'll be fine."]="Bien, $gchico:chica;. Quédate detrás de mí y estarás a salvo."
G["Alright, let me take a look at that tablet."]="嗯，让我看看那块石板。"
G["Alright, let's check the ol' programming... SELF DESTRUCT?!"]="好吧，让我们看看这些程序……自爆？！"
G["Alright, let's do this!"]="好吧，我们出发吧！"
G["Alright, let's get a move on!"]="好吧，我们继续！"
G["Alright, let's get back to shore."]="好吧，我们回海岸上去。"
G["Alright, let's get going."]="好吧，我们行动吧。"
G["Alright, let's get this match started!"]="很好，比试开始吧！"
G["Alright, let's go up to the monastery."]="好了，我们去禅院吧。"
G["Alright, let's go."]="好吧，我们走。"
G["Alright, let's move."]="好吧，我们走。"
G["Alright, let's see if this ol' ritual will work."]="好吧，让我们看看这古老的仪式能不能起作用。"
G["Alright, let's see what makes this tech tick!"]="好吧，让我们看看这技术的诀窍！"
G["Alright, let's try cracking this thing open!"]="好吧，让我们试着把这东西砸开！"
G["Alright, lizard lips, one more chance: where are your patrols?!"]="好了，蜥蜴嘴，我再给你一次机会——你们的巡逻队在哪儿？！"
G["Alright, men! Move out!"]="好，兄弟们！出发！"
G["Alright, mon. A deal be a deal. But first, just a little question...."]="好吧。我同意。但首先，我有个问题……"
G["Alright, muffin man, show me your muffins!"]="好吧，松饼人，给我看看你的松饼！"
G["Alright, my first fight!"]="好吧，你逼我出手的！"
G["Alright, naga leader, come on out from hiding and surrender in the name of $n and the Bilgewater Cartel!"]="好吧，纳迦头领，从你的藏身之地钻出来，向$n和锈水财阀投降吧！"
G["Alright, now fetch me some..."]="很好，再给我拿些……"
G["Alright, now follow me, girl."]="跟着我，小姑娘。"
G["Alright, now we need someone to test this on..."]="好了，现在我们得找人来试试这个……"
G["Alright, people, hold that line!"]="大家听好，守住阵线！"
G["Alright, pylon two down.  Now for the heat manifold."]="很好，二号塔也解决了。现在去热能导管那里。"
G["Alright, quiet down. We have a lot to do and very little time to do it in, people."]="好吧，安静。我们有很多事需要做，但时间只有那么一点。"
G["Alright, recruits! Thanks to $p, we're going to reclaim Kun-Lai summit from the Yaungol and make it safe again. For the Horde!"]="好了，新兵们！多亏了$p，我们能从野牛人手里夺回昆莱山，让它重获安宁了。为了部落！"
G["Alright, so you're just going to head through this tunnel and whaaaaa....?"]="那么，你打算钻进这条隧道……？"
G["Alright, that's enough. Switch!"]="好吧，够了。换！"
G["Alright, this is far too much mud.  Your disguise will be too dark and gloppy."]="好吧，软泥实在太多了。你的伪装服一定会又黑又粘。"
G["Alright, this is where we really have to be on our paws. Be ready!"]="好了，我们要在这儿真刀真枪地干一场。准备好！"
G["Alright, throw the Life-Rocket packs down to the survivors, and drop the bombs on the pirates. Try not to mix those up, okay?"]="好吧，快把救生火箭包扔给下面的幸存者，把炸弹扔给海盗。可别搞混了，知道吗？"
G["Alright, time for the good stuff.  This is my special stout... of suffering!"]="好了，该动真格的了。这是我特别酿制的……痛苦烈酒！"
G["Alright, we give up! Don't hurt us!"]="好吧，我们投降！不要伤害我们！"
G["Alright, we have the handle, the head, and the ointment like you asked for. Can you re-assemble the mallet?"]="好了，我们现在拿到了你要的杵柄，杵头和药膏。你能帮我们将钟杵组合起来吗？"
G["Alright, we just add this in here..."]="好了，我们把这个加在这里……"
G["Alright, we're getting close to the excavation site, so we have to proceed carefully. Engage underwater breathing apparatus..."]="我们已经接近挖掘场了，注意小心行事。现在准备好你的水下呼吸装备……"
G["Alright, we're ready to get started."]="好了，我们已经准备好开始了。"
G["Alright, we've just gotten word that a caravan is leaving from Thelsamar. It's time to move! Go go go!"]="好了，我们刚得到消息，有一个商队已经从塞尔萨玛出发了。该行动了！出发！"
G["Alright, who's in?"]="好，还有谁参加？"
G["Alright, you can stop now."]="好了，你现在可以停下来了。"
G["Alright, you in?\n\nQuick quick, who d'ya think's gonna win this one, bucko?"]="好吧，你也想参加？\n\n快点，快点，你觉得谁会赢，菜鸟？"
G["Alright. I need some help... I'm lookin' for my body. It's somewhere in this cave, but you can only see it if you're in the spirit world. If you want to help me find it, let me know.\nBe warned, though. The timeless spirits can kick us out of the spirit world, and I don't think I'm strong enough to get you back in there for a while if they do."]="Verás, necesito ayuda... No encuentro mi cuerpo. Está en algún lado de esta cueva, pero solo se ve desde el mundo de los espíritus. Si quieres ayudarme, avísame.\n\nPero ten clara una cosa: los espíritus intemporales pueden echarnos del mundo de los espíritus, y si lo consiguen, no podremos volver a entrar hasta pasado un rato."
G["Alright. I suppose we have stayed here long enough."]="好了！我们在这儿待得够久了。"
G["Alright. Let's go."]="好。我们走吧。"
G["Alright. Where?"]="好吧。在哪儿？"
G["Alright... I give up... sniff..."]="好吧……我放弃……"
G["Alrighty then! So I was down at the lava pits of the Molten Span, testing out my lava suit. Everything was going great. I was even able to swim around in that stuff without suffering a single injury!\n\nSo there I am, minding my own business, doing a few backstrokes, when out of nowhere this thing swallows me up whole! Had it not been for my lava suit and built in food pellet dispenser, I would have been done for!"]="好吧！我在熔岩大桥的熔岩坑测试熔岩服。一切进展顺利。我甚至能在熔岩中毫发无损地游泳！\n\n我在那儿做自己的事，有时仰泳一会，突然之间它把我一口吞没！若不是有了熔岩服和便携式食物机，我一定会就此交待了！"
G["Alrighty then, $n, here we go: one illusory-enhanced, Warsong orc disguise, complete with Smell-A-Vision!"]="$n，好啦。你瞧，这套战歌兽人伪装是不是很棒呢！它拥有完美的幻象效果，还散发着兽人那特有的气味！"
G["Alrighty! I think we are going to need to call in some air support for this one."]="好吧！看来我们得呼叫空中支援了。"
G["Also entering the arena: Battletron! Sure, it's not goblin-engineered... but it still might kill you!"]="同时进场的还有——巴特隆！当然，他不是由地精制造的……可他依然有着致命的威胁！"
G["Also entering the arena: Battletron! This hunk o' junk is just waiting to explode all over you!"]="另一位进入竞技场的是：巴特隆！这块破铜烂铁会把你们全炸飞！"
G["Also entering the arena: Bruce, a crocolisk that we found!"]="同时进场的还有布鲁斯，它是我们特意找来的一条巨鳄！"
G["Also entering the arena: Destructobyte... and his ridiculous gnomish holographic machinery!"]="同时进场的还有——位元毁灭者……以及他那滑稽的侏儒全息投影仪！"
G["Also entering the arena: Destructobyte... and his special surprise!"]="另一位进入竞技场的是：位元毁灭者……和他的特别惊喜！"
G["Also entering the arena: Everybody's favorite magical 12-foot-tall corpse, Fjoll! Am I pronouncing that right?"]="同时进场的还有——大家最喜爱的、12英尺高的神奇僵尸，弗琼！我没读错吧？"
G["Also entering the arena: Goredome! He WILL attempt to gore you. With his dome."]="另一位进入竞技场的是：血角！他会用你的鲜血染红他的角！"
G["Also entering the arena: Goredome! So-named because he will gore you. With his dome."]="另一位进入竞技场的是：血角！他会用你的鲜血染红他的角！"
G["Also entering the arena: Kirrawk, wind-wielding arakkoa of the Terokkar Forest!"]="同时进场的还有来自泰罗卡森林的驭风鸦人，奇拉瓦克！"
G["Also entering the arena: The Dark Summoner. Wow, he doesn't even have a real name. Spooky!"]="同时进场的还有：黑暗召唤师。哇，他连真名都没有。真恐怖！"
G["Also entering the arena: the hozen with the box of bombs! It's Master Boom Boom, the dynamite throwing monkey monk!"]="同时进场的还有：带着大箱炸弹的猢狲！他就是扔炸药的猢狲武僧，布姆布姆大师！"
G["Also entering the arena: the magnanimous Master Boom Boom, the dynamite throwing monkey monk!"]="同时进场的还有：豪爽的布姆布姆大师！就是那位扔炸药的猢狲武僧！"
G["Alsudar the Bastion and the other warrior trainers may be found overlooking Farstriders' Square, from near the foundry."]="捍卫者阿尔苏达和其他战士训练师都在那个能俯瞰远行者广场的地方，就是靠近锻造师所在的那个地方。"
G["Alterac Valley"]="奥特兰克山谷"
G["Alterac Valley - Alliance Quatmaster Greeting Option Default"]="奥特兰克山谷——联盟军需官问候默认选项"
G["Alterac Valley has been home to the Frostwolf Clan for years; we will not let the dwarves and their Alliance trespass!  And so we battle!\n\nTo win back Alterac, defeat their general Vanndar Stormpike, in Dun Baldar.\n\nFor the Horde!"]="奥特兰克山谷很久以前就已经成为霜狼氏族的家园了，我们不会让矮人和他们的联盟侵犯这片土地！因此我们不断地战斗！\n\n要赢回奥特兰克山谷，就必须打败他们的首领范达尔·雷矛。\n\n为了部落而战！"
G["Alternative measure commencing..."]="备用方案启动……"
G["Althea, there are reports of strange happenings at the graveyard.  Ello believes it portends an attack on Darkshire."]="阿尔泰娅，有报告说墓地里有异常情况。艾尔罗认为这是夜色镇即将遭到攻击的前兆。"
G["Although I am flattered by your confidence in my abilities, teaching you is beyond my skill. You must go to the Craftsmen's Terrace in Darnassus, and speak with the night elf Ainethil. She can help you."]="虽然我很高兴听到你对我的能力充满信心，但我真的没法再教你了。你必须到达纳苏斯的工匠区去找暗夜精灵安尼希尔谈谈。她可以帮助你。"
G["Although the coast of Darkshore is more dangerous than that of Teldrassil, many fishers find profit here."]="尽管黑海岸比泰达希尔更危险，但是很多渔夫都在此谋生。"
G["Although we are enemies, I will thank you. Just this once."]="虽然我们是敌人，但我还是要谢谢你。只此一次，下不为例。"
G["Although we call this land the Barrens, to one who knows where to look this place teems with life."]="虽然我们把这块土地称作贫瘠之地，但对于睿智者来说，这里到处都是生命。"
G["Altruis sent me. He said that you could help me."]="奥图里斯派我过来的。他说你能帮我。"
G["Always a good skill to have that Survival is.\nKaerbrus is who you are looking for. He's usually around the moonwell in the Park."]="Siempre es bueno aprender las técnicas de la supervivencia.\n\nKaerbrus es entonces a quien buscas. Suele estar cerca de la Poza de la Luna, en el parque."
G["Always be room in de pot for more!"]="多少炖肉也装不满我们的大锅！"
G["Always consider the consequences of your actions!"]="考虑好行动的顺序！"
G["Always double-check your measurements before you begin to cut the leather. We cannot afford to waste materials."]="在你开始切割皮革之前一定要仔细检查尺寸。我们可不能浪费材料。"
G["Always good talking to you."]="和你聊天总是很惬意。"
G["Always good to see you, $n. How have you been?"]="见到你总是很高兴，$n。近来好吗？"
G["Always good to see you, friend!"]="¡Siempre me alegro de verte, $gamigo:amiga;!"
G["Always knew... someday I would become... the hunted."]="我就知道……总有一天……猎人会变成猎物。"
G["Always know that you have allies in Deepholm, if you be needin' us."]="请记住，你在深岩之洲有朋友。如果有需要，就请来找我们。"
G["Always look forward, never back."]="凡事向前看，不要回头。"
G["Always nice to get a gift hand delivered by the second-in-command. I'll unwrap this right now!"]="副总亲自送礼物来，真是让我感到荣幸。我马上就要打开它！"
G["Always on the go, that girl."]="那个女孩总是忙个不停。"
G["Always pumping, always pumping!"]="血流不止，血流不止！"
G["Always so impatient, young one. There is no knowledge that is not power. This artifact dates back to the same era as the Divine Bell. To know its secrets is to bring us closer to Garrosh's prize."]="你总是这么毛躁，年轻人。没有什么知识是无用的。这件神器的历史能与圣钟相媲美。只要解开它的秘密，我们就能一进步了解加尔鲁什的战利品。"
G["Always so negative. The chances of that happening are between zero and none."]="别扯了，你那种方法成功的或然率小过零啊。"
G["Always strive ta understand the balance maintained by our world's elemental spirits."]="永远努力理解，由这个世界上元素之魂所保持的平衡。"
G["Always strive to achieve the impossible."]="永远努力成就不可能的事。"
G["Always wear head protection while on the job! You never know when Miss Darla might have to smack you in the face!"]="工作时一定要戴上护头设备！没有人知道达尔拉小姐什么时候会给你的脑袋来一下！"
G["Always with the speeches."]="生命不息，交谈不息。"
G["Always you speak. Never do you listen! You ignore the lessons of Pandaria!"]="你只知道说，却从不倾听！你忽略了潘达利亚的教训！"
G["Aly... Alynna is in command."]="阿……阿丽娜在负责指挥。"
G["Alysra takes a deep breath. Get behind cover!"]="奥利瑟拉深深地吸了一口气。快躲到掩体后面！"
G["Alysrazor begins to fly in a rapid circle!  The harsh winds will remove Wings of Flame!"]="奥利瑟拉佐尔开始高速盘旋！狂风将移除火焰之翼的效果！"
G["Alysrazor is unable to fully re-ignite!  Kill her quickly!"]="奥利瑟拉佐尔不能重燃了！快击败她！"
G["Alythess directs Conflagration at $n."]="奥蕾塞丝向$n施放燃烧。"
G["Alythess! Your fire burns within me!"]="奥蕾塞丝！你的火焰会在我心中燃烧下去！"
G["Am I a murderer, Krom'gar?"]="我是个杀人狂吗，克罗姆加？"
G["Am I busy? What's that supposed to mean? Do you think I just stand here all day, twiddling my thumbs? If you're here to buy something, talk to Handor."]="我忙吗？这话什么意思？你觉得我只是成天站在这儿玩弄手指吗？如果你想买些什么的话，跟罕杜尔谈谈。"
G["Am I carrying any letters addressed to $n? Why, no!  Looks like it's time for you to die!"]="我要捎信给$n吗？当然！你的死期到了！"
G["Am I clear? Do you understand what I'm sayin'? I don't wanna have to send any more coffins or letters home."]="我说得够清楚了吧？你们听明白没？我可不想再送更多的棺材或者阵亡通知单回去了。"
G["Am I fast? I wanna be a $c like you!"]="¿A que soy rápido? ¡Quiero ser $gun:una; $c como tú!"
G["Am I going to have to deal with this intrusion myself?"]="难道要我亲自解决这些入侵者？"
G["Am I hearing things?"]="什么动静？"
G["Am I hitting him?"]="我打到他了吗？"
G["Am I needed?"]="需要我帮忙吗？"
G["Am I released from my duties?"]="我可以下班了吗？"
G["Am I still bleeding? I can't ... I can't keep this up much longer. Have you seen any of the archmages?"]="我还在流血？我不能……不能坚持下去了。你有没有见到任何一位大法师？"
G["Am I surrounded by amateurs?  I want a full analysis of the new strain by tomorrow morning!  Get on it, Ravien!"]="你们都是业余的吗？明天早上，我要见到一份完整的分析报告！拉维恩，给我做事去！"
G["Am I, mm, talking to myself? I am? See there, I'm right again."]="我是不是，唔，在自言自语？是吗？你看，我又说中了。"
G["Amakkar, where do you think Warlord Goretooth is going to send us? I don't think I can handle another tour in the Steppes."]="阿玛卡尔，你认为高图斯会把我们派到哪儿去？我可不想再去燃烧平原了。"
G["Amani Dragonhawk"]="阿曼尼龙鹰"
G["Amani forces pour from the Amani Tribal Door!"]="阿曼尼大军从阿曼尼部族之门中涌出！"
G["Amani tribe, avenge ye fallen warlords, in the name of Zul'jin!"]="阿曼尼部族，以祖尔金之名，为陨落的领主复仇吧！"
G["Amani tribe."]="阿曼尼部族。"
G["Amateurs! You are far beyond your depth!"]="门外汉！你太自不量力了！"
G["Amazing amulets! Incredible curios! The newfangled jewelcrafters be havin' nothin' on the tried and true mystical methods of ol' Griftah! Improve yerself through these magical talismans for a bargain price!"]="多棒的护身符啊！难以置信的古董！那些新来的珠宝工匠们从未尝试过的、格里伏塔的神秘物品！买下这些魔法护身符，提升你的能力吧！很便宜的！"
G["Amazing amulets! Incredible curios! The newfangled jewelcrafters be havin' nothin' on the tried and true mystical methods of... the... uh... the newly relocated Griftah! Improve yerself through these magical talismans for a bargain price!"]="神奇的护身符！惊人的古玩！格里伏塔……最新……进货的，由经过时间考验的神奇材质做成的新奇珠宝制品！用这些不可思议的法宝来让你自己变得更强大吧，破盘价出售啦！"
G["Amazing materials down here. Amazing! Substitutes for everything. Substitutes for substitutes. Everything's possible!"]="这里有令人惊叹的材料。任何工程材料和替换件都能找到代用品。一切皆有可能！"
G["Amazing to see little flowers persist in the cold of Dun Morogh...  but ye won't find any herbalists out here.  Ye'll have to go to Ironforge to get some training in that profession."]="有些弱小的植物竟然能在丹莫罗的寒风中开花，这真令人惊奇……但是这儿没有草药师。你得去铁炉堡接受草药师的训练。"
G["Amazing!"]="真是令人震惊！"
G["Amazing!  It worked!  $n, I have your armor."]="太令人惊讶了！成功了！$n，你的护甲做好了。"
G["Amazing!  There are passages in here that I have never seen before.  This must have taken quite a while for you to track down.  If you ever find anymore books like this, I would like to be notified immediately.\nPlease take one of my Kirin Tor Familiars with you just in case you stumble across anything."]="¡Fascinante! Hay pasajes que nunca antes había visto. Ha debido llevarte un rato localizarlo. Si vuelves a encontrar un libro como este, me encantaría que me notificases inmediatamente.\n\nLleva contigo uno de mis familiares del Kirin Tor por si te topas con algo."
G["Amazing! Anatheron's defeat at your hands has delayed Archimonde from his objective, and brought us that much closer to victory. My forces cannot stay here, however. My troops and I are exhausted, and now is the time for retreat. If your strength has not waned, head east to Thrall's encampment. That is where we make another stand. Be well."]="太棒了！你打败了安纳塞隆，延缓了阿克蒙德的计划，让我们离胜利更近了一步。但是，我的部队不能留在这里。他们都已经非常疲倦，现在是撤退的时候了。如果你还能支撑下去的话，就到东面去，找到萨尔的营地吧。那是我们的另外一个据点。保重。"
G["Amazing! How did you manage a permanent dominate?"]="真让人感到惊讶！你是怎么实现恒定控制的呢？"
G["Amazing! I feel... renewed. My strength returns!"]="太神奇了！我感觉就如同获得了重生一般。我的力量又回来了！"
G["Amazing! I think I have found it, $n!"]="太不可思议了！就是它了，$n！"
G["Amazing! I've never spoken to a ghost. I wish to learn!"]="不可思议！我从未跟鬼魂交谈过。我想要了解一下！"
G["Amazing! You're much stronger than you look."]="太棒了！你比看上去还要强壮得多。"
G["Amazing, Dornaa.  Truly amazing!"]="太令人吃惊了，多尔南。真的太令人吃惊了！"
G["Amazing, aren't they? All these artifacts and remains.\n\nI'm not sure what I'm more impressed by, their size, or the stories that go along with them. There's so much to study and learn. And the connections we can make...\n\nDid you know rumor has it that many races have the same heritage as Night elves?"]="不可思议，不是吗？所有这些神器和残骸。\n\n我不清楚是什么给我留下了更为深刻的印象，它们的规模，还是它们背后的故事。要学习的东西还很多。我们能找到其中的关联……\n\n你知道那个传闻吗，听说许多种族与暗夜精灵有着相同的遗产。"
G["Amazing. Prospector Remtravel's done it again! We'll see if Ironforge can make sense of this."]="真是令人震惊。勘察员雷塔维又成功了！我们要看看，这对铁炉堡将有什么意义。"
G["Ambassador Dawnsinger and I represent the Court of the Sun here in Orgrimmar.\n\nThe ambassador handles civil matters, while I advise Thrall on military campaigns and the unique, err... advantages conferred by the Blood Knights."]="我和银月大使帕拉·晨歌代表逐日王庭来到奥格瑞玛。\n\n大使负责处理各种民事问题，而我则对萨尔提出军事建议，以及宣扬与血骑士合作的……呃，独一无二的优势。"
G["Ambassador. We have been expecting you."]="大使，我们一直在等您。"
G["Amber drakes excel at dealing damage by manipulating time to their advantage.\nUsing shock lance, they can disrupt the flow of time around an enemy target, instantly damaging it.  The power of this effect is dramatically increased by shock charges on the target.\nWhen threatened, an amber drake can briefly stop the flow of time for its enemies.  This time disruption stores a large amount of shock energy on affected targets in the form of shock charges."]="Los dracos ámbar destacan en causar daño gracias a que pueden manipular el tiempo a su favor.\n\nAl utilizar la Lanza de choque pueden interrumpir el flujo del tiempo alrededor de un enemigo, haciéndole daño instantáneamente. El poder de este efecto aumenta enormemente dependiendo de las Cargas de choque en el objetivo.\n\nCuando se ve amenazado, un draco de ámbar puede detener brevemente el flujo del tiempo de sus enemigos. Esta interrupción del tiempo almacena una gran cantidad de Energía de choque en los objetivos afectados en la forma de Cargas de choque."
G["Amber, find a good perch and give Sully some covering fire. We'll rendezvous back here."]="安玻，去找个好位置，用火力掩护苏利。我们稍后回来汇合。"
G["Amberseed!"]="琥珀种子！"
G["Amberwing, get in there! Lay siege to the holdouts!"]="琥珀之翼，快去！围歼那些抵抗者！"
G["Ambush!"]="有埋伏！"
G["Ameer might be worried about what the Ethereum are doing but I'm squarely focused on the real danger here: Dimensius."]="阿米尔可能在担心复仇军有所动作，但是我仍然把注意力集中在迪门修斯那里，它才是真正的危险。"
G["Ameer, over and out."]="阿米尔，通话结束。"
G["Amidst the tragedy and chaos, this place stands defiantly against the Scourge! It is good to be Horde."]="时局动荡不安，我们却顽强地抵御了天灾军团猛烈的攻势！能成为部落的一员真是荣幸。"
G["Amidst the wretch, a champion has been found."]="在这样一群可怜虫里，总算有位勇士脱颖而出。"
G["Ammunition for the main unit must be regularly reloaded.\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Ammo_Bullet_02.blp:32|t"]="主炮必须定时装填弹药。\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Ammo_Bullet_02.blp:32|t"
G["Among ethereals, certain members deal specifically with flesh and beings of flesh. Those individuals are known as flesh handlers."]="在虚灵中，一部分会员负责处理血肉兽。他们被称为驯兽者。"
G["Among the Twilight cult are magics that threaten us greatly.\n\nWe have every desire to wipe their existence from our home.\n\nWe are divided, and so we cannot.\n\nAnd so I watch...\n\nAnd wait..."]="暮光教派中存在着对我们具有严重威胁的法术。\n\n我们恨不得马上让他们滚出我们的家园。\n\n我们被分开了，所以我们不能这么做。\n\n于是我在观望着……\n\n等待着……"
G["Among the items you found in the keep is one that will serve as a powerful focus for your new staff."]="在你从那座城堡中取得的物品里，有一件很适合做成强大的魔力核心，镶嵌在你的新法杖上。"
G["Among these crystals we have seen a new path, a path of peace."]="但是如今，在这些水晶之间，我们找到了一条新的道路，一条和平之路。"
G["Amongst the Kirin Tor, it is my duty to see to the strategic interests of the magocracy.\n\nThere is much yet to be done this week. Will you assist me, $n?"]="Dentro del Kirin Tor, es mi labor asegurar los intereses estratégicos de la magocracia.\n\nAún queda mucho por hacer esta semana, $n. ¿Quieres ayudarme?"
G["Amongst the various pieces of parchment containing checklists and other information from the Farstriders, one stands out. It is a drawing of a hideous troll, perhaps the most fearsome creature that you have ever seen!"]="在各种由羊皮纸拼凑起来的名单和其它信息之中，有一条特别醒目。这是一个丑恶的巨魔的画像，也许是你曾经看到过的最可怕的生物！"
G["Amusing. You really thought you could win."]="有意思。你们真以为自己能赢。"
G["An %s attacks the treekiller."]="一个%s开始攻击伐树者。"
G["An %s emerges from the dying Crystalsong Oak!"]="一个%s从濒死的晶歌森林橡树中现身了！"
G["An Ahn'kahar Guardian hatches!"]="一只安卡哈守护者孵化了！"
G["An Alchemy trainer is what you need?  Well, I just came from there, I did.  Ye'll find Ms. Berryfizz over in Tinker Town where the gnomes gather."]="你想要炼金训练者吗？嗯，我刚从那儿过来呢，真的。你可以在侏儒的聚集地侏儒区找浆泡小姐。"
G["An Alliance Commendation Signet is awarded to a $g hero : heroine; who goes above and beyond the call of duty to the Alliance.  Various Commendation Officers for the factions of the Alliance are located in all of the major cities; speak with the one with whom you'd like to raise your reputation, and give them the number of signets they ask for!\n\nBy the way, during the war effort here, if you'd rather receive a material reward for your signets in lieu of reputation, seek out Field Marshal Snowfall."]="联盟荣誉徽章是奖励给那些富于责任感的英雄的。各大主城均设有嘉奖官，与你想要提升声望的主城中的嘉奖官交谈，按照规定的数量缴纳徽章吧！\n\n顺便说一句，在安其拉大战期间，如果你想要用徽章换取实物奖励而不是提升声望的话，可以去找大元帅斯诺·落雪。"
G["An Alliance caravan has been destroyed."]="一辆联盟货车已被摧毁。"
G["An Alliance caravan needs to be escorted off of Dreadmist Peak."]="一辆准备驶出鬼雾峰的联盟货车需要护送。"
G["An Alliance caravan needs to be escorted out of Thorn Hill."]="一辆准备驶出荆棘岭的联盟货车需要护送。"
G["An Alliance caravan needs to be escorted out of the Dry Hills."]="一辆准备驶出无水岭的联盟货车需要护送。"
G["An Alliance caravan needs to be escorted out of the Forgotten Pools."]="一辆准备驶出遗忘之池的联盟货车需要护送。"
G["An Alliance caravan needs to be escorted out of the Sludge Fen."]="一辆准备驶出淤泥沼泽的联盟货车需要护送。"
G["An Alliance caravan needs to be escorted out of the Stagnant Oasis."]="一辆准备驶出死水绿洲的联盟货车需要护送。"
G["An Alliance caravan needs to be escorted out of the Wailing Caverns."]="一辆准备驶出哀嚎洞穴的联盟货车需要护送。"
G["An Amber Growth seeps into %s's wounds, replenishing its vitality."]="琥珀增生影响到了%s的伤口，正在补充它的活力。"
G["An Amorous Rooster! Dip him in the water to cool his passions."]="一只发情的公鸡！把他浸在水里，冷却下他的热情。"
G["An Aqua Bomb has detonated! Dispel it faster, next time."]="刚才是水爆弹爆炸了？！下次快点驱散它！"
G["An Ash'ari Crystal has been restored!"]="阿莎利水晶已经修复！"
G["An Ash'ari Crystal has been toppled! Restore the ziggurat before the Slaughterhouse is vulnerable!"]="一块阿莎利水晶已经被摧毁了！趁屠宰场处于易受攻击状态，赶快修复通灵塔！"
G["An Ash'ari Crystal has fallen! Stay true to the Lich King, my brethren, and attempt to resummon it."]="阿莎利水晶已经被摧毁了！我的兄弟们，忠诚于巫妖王,重新召唤它！"
G["An Automated Shredder draws near!"]="一台自动伐木机正在靠近！"
G["An Avatar of Terokk!! To arms!"]="泰罗克的化身！！准备战斗！"
G["An Azsh'ir Monitor calls for help!"]="艾萨尔监控器发出了求援信号！"
G["An Azsh'ir Monitor has spotted you!"]="你被艾萨尔监控器发现了！"
G["An Essence of Storms erupts from the embedded spear and fixates on you!"]="刺入的长矛上生成了一个暴风精华并锁定了你！"
G["An Illusionary Banshee! Kill it, quickly, before it explodes!"]="幻影女妖！杀了它，快，别让它爆炸！"
G["An account of all the fractions of copper we round off... brilliant."]="我们赚的所有钱都在这儿了……真棒。"
G["An adventurer like you has probably won many battles!"]="¡$gUn aventurero:Una aventurera; como tú habrá ganado muchas batallas!"
G["An adventurer saves the village, but a HERO returns the brew!"]="一位冒险家挽救了村庄，而一位英雄将美酒物归原主！"
G["An agent of destruction, forged by my will to forever change the face of Azeroth."]="我亲手造就的毁灭使者，他将永远改变艾泽拉斯的面貌。"
G["An alchemist is able to work miracles with ordinary herbs, converting them into stable potions that range in effect from healing to breathing underwater and everything in between."]="炼金师可以用普通的药草来创造奇迹，把它们转换成各种稳定的药水，比如治疗或者水下呼吸之类。"
G["An alchemist?  No trouble at all $c.  Ainethil, in all her labor and toil, has become the most accomplished alchemist in the Craftsmen's Terrace.  I would head over there on the double if I were you. On the double!  Now off with you!"]="炼金师？这没什么$c。安尼希尔通过不懈地努力，成为了工匠区技艺最纯熟的炼金术士。如果我是你的话，我会马上赶去那儿的。马上！出发吧！"
G["An ally always!"]="¡Siempre un $galiado:aliada;!"
G["An amazing discovery you have made. I would love an opportunity to look at all of the failed experiments."]="这绝对是一个令人惊讶的发现。我很想看看你失败了的那些试验品。"
G["An amber drake at full power can perform temporal rift, which creates a bubble of compressed time around an enemy.  Spells that pass through the bubble deal double damage and can generate shock charges on the target."]="全盛状态的琥珀幼龙可以使用时间裂隙，制造出压缩时间结界包围敌对目标。穿过结界的法术将对该目标造成双倍的伤害，还能在目标身上叠加震击能量。"
G["An ambush. Return them to their rest!"]="发动伏击。让他们重新安息吧！"
G["An ancient beast stirs within the mists!"]="迷雾中出现了一头远古巨兽！"
G["An ancient being awakens in the distance..."]="一个远古的生物在远处被唤醒了……"
G["An ancient score is settled today."]="古老的仇恨在今天得以消弭。"
G["An anguished howl echoes in the twilight."]="痛苦的哀嚎在暮色中回荡。"
G["An apple for me? Thanksh!"]="这个苹果是给我的吗？谢谢！"
G["An arcanic oubliette. Thankfully the walls of this ruin have collapsed away otherwise we would have been trapped in this one spot without food or water.\n\nSeems whoever built these ruins designed them to be a prison for anyone attempting to portal to the coordinates we were travelling to.\n\nIt also is lethal to any mages that pass through it. Look what it did to our poor arcanist.\n\nThe good news is we can still communicate with the other side and were able to warn them not to send anyone else through. The bad news is we are stuck on the wrong side of what is now a one way portal."]="一座奥法地牢。幸亏这座废墟的墙壁早已倒塌，否则我们就会无粮无水地被困在此处。\n\n看起来，这片废墟的建造者原是想要建造一座监狱，用来囚禁任何想要传送到脚下这个坐标的人。\n\n这对穿越它的法师来说也是致命的。看看它对我们可怜的奥术师都做了些什么。\n\n好消息是，我们还能与那边联系上，而且还能够警告他们不要再派人过来。坏消息是，因为传送门只能单向通行，所以我们被困在这一侧了。"
G["An aspiring angler... well, Diktynna lives on the shore of Ammen Ford, using her net and pole to keep us all supplied. I am certain she could use the help."]="$gUn:Una; aspirante a pescador... bueno, Diktynna vive en la costa del Vado Ammen, y usa su red y su palo para mantenernos abastecidos a todos. Estoy seguro de que tu ayuda le iría bien."
G["An assassin! Did the little whelpling send you after me? Come, rogue. Let's dance."]="¡$gUn asesino:Una asesina;! ¿Te ha enviado ese minúsculo vástago? Ven, $gpícaro:pícara;. Bailemos."
G["An assassin! Quickly, ready yourselves for battle!"]="是刺客！快，准备战斗！"
G["An aura of necrotic energy blocks all healing!"]="死灵能量形成的光环屏蔽了一切治疗法术！"
G["An easy kill!"]="轻而易举！"
G["An easy task!"]="真是简单的工作！"
G["An electrical storm appears!"]="一道电能风暴出现了！"
G["An elite Blue Dragonflight squad appears from the portal!"]="一队精英蓝龙冲出了传送门！"
G["An emerald drake at full power can perform dream funnel, which transfers the drake's own life energy to a friendly target, healing it.  Leeching poison can be used to restore health lost when using this ability."]="全盛状态的翡翠幼龙可以使用梦境通道，将自身的生命能量转移到友方目标身上，以此进行治疗。使用该技能的同时仍可利用吸血之毒恢复生命值。"
G["An empty crate waits to be filled and prepared for delivery."]="等待装货与递送的空箱子。"
G["An endless army of soulless abominations...I shudder to think of the violence that would erupt from such a machine."]="无数没有灵魂的、畸形的怪物，浩浩荡荡……想到这机器中会涌出怎样的邪恶，我就打寒颤。"
G["An enemy sapper's breached the engine room!"]="一个暮光工兵闯入了引擎室！"
G["An engraving reads: \"Spill No Evil!\""]="Tiene un grabado que reza: \"¡No derramarás!\"."
G["An enormous crate, filled to the brim with cannonballs."]="一个巨大的箱子，里面装满了炮弹。"
G["An enormous crate, filled to the brim with cannonballs.  There is a can of cooking grease sitting innocently nearby."]="一个巨大的箱子，里面装满了炮弹。旁边还放着一罐看似毫不相干的烹饪用油。"
G["An enormous thundering cloud serpent bars our entrance into Lei Shen's domain."]="一头巨型雷霆云端翔龙挡在了雷神领域的入口。"
G["An enormous, unforgiving expanse of pounding grey waves, freezing temperatures, and ravenous sea life."]="这是一个辽阔而残酷的世界，充斥于其中的是灰色的惊涛骇浪，极度凛冽的寒风，还有各种庞大的海洋怪兽。"
G["An epic battle, how exciting!"]="一场史诗般的战斗，多么激动人心啊！"
G["An excellent question! We have many things for sale here at the faire. If you are interested in food or drink, then visit Stamp or Sylannia's booths.\nIf you'd rather purchase something more exotic, then Lhara may have just the thing for you. She specializes in rarities from all over the world.\nAnd then there is Flik running around here somewhere. If you can grab him he sells balls for throwing and frogs to keep as pets."]="¡Excelente pregunta! Tenemos muchas cosas en esta feria. Si quieres comida o bebida, dirígete a la barraca de Stamp y Sylannia.\n\nSi por el contrario prefieres comprar algo más exótico, Lhara seguro que tiene lo que buscas pues su especialidad son las rarezas de todas las partes del mundo.\n\nY luego está Flik, que andará por ahí en alguna parte. Si lo encuentras verás que vende pelotas para lanzar y ranas para tener como mascotas."
G["An excellent strike."]="这拳漂亮。"
G["An external influence, under illusory guise of Thorim's deceased mate, Sif, has been detected."]="检测到外部影响。其存在方式是伪装成托里姆已故的配偶西芙。"
G["An honest mistake!"]="这是一个无心之过！"
G["An honor to see you again, $n."]="很荣幸再次看到你，$n。"
G["An honorable end to the noble Maki... I'm sure his clan would be proud, if he hadn't been the last of them!"]="高贵马基的光荣结局……如果他不是他们当中的最后一个，我敢肯定，他的部族会感到自豪！"
G["An honorable meeting, $c. I have heard rumblings from my brothers here on Pandaria. Dark rumblings of dissent, and worry.\n\nI have come myself to support the Horde's efforts, but also... to make sure that things don't get too out of hand."]="幸会，$c。我从在潘达利亚的兄弟们那里听到了一些传言。一些负面的抱怨和忧虑。\n\n我本人很支持部落的事业，可同时……也不希望事态过于失控。"
G["An honorable... death."]="光荣地……战死……"
G["An ill wind blows here in Kun-Lai. I fear a presence unseen for many years may be returning, and these yaungol are just a symptom of it."]="一股邪风在昆莱肆虐。我担心有一股沉寂多年的力量即将归来，而这些野牛人只是前兆而已。"
G["An ill-wind blows from the southern shores. Are you ready?"]="Un viento de enfermedad viene de las costas del sur. ¿Estás $gpreparado:preparada;?"
G["An impressive display..."]="令人印象深刻……"
G["An inconspicuous marble slab."]="一块不显眼的大理石板。"
G["An inconspicuous stone slab."]="一块不显眼的石板。"
G["An interesting commonality, now to exploit it!"]="有趣的共性，让我来利用一下吧！"
G["An interesting response to my question... and the wrong one."]="这个回答很有意思……可惜答案错误。"
G["An interesting turning of events."]="事情发生了有趣的转变。"
G["An intruder!  Begone!"]="¡$gUn intruso:Una intrusa;! ¡Largo!"
G["An island has emerged from the depths... just off the coast of Stormwind."]="一座岛屿从深渊里升了起来……就在暴风城的海岸边。"
G["An island rose up from the sea... within striking distance of Stormwind?"]="一座岛屿从海里冒出来……暴风城在它的攻击范围内？"
G["An island, lost in time, where the sun never sets. What could it mean?"]="一座失落在时间长河中，永不日落的海岛。这意味着什么呢？"
G["An me as well. We dun know what Garrosh been plannin this whole time.  What he's got in store for us."]="我也是。我们完全不知道加尔鲁什到底有什么阴谋，也不知道究竟有什么在等着我们。"
G["An occasion like this calls for a drink!"]="这种场合怎么能少了美酒呢！"
G["An odd choice... but I suppose I'm not one to judge. Danwe is the one you're after; her engineering stand lies near the Court of the Sun, on the path to Farstriders' Square."]="一个奇怪的选择……但是我想这并不是我该评判的。你应该去找丹文，她的工程台就在逐日王庭附近，通往远行者广场的那条路上。"
G["An old friend of mine named Frokle was supposed to be heading in to Gadgetzan, but him and the rest of the Bilgewater crew manning the ship never arrived.  I've heard rumors of a crazy goblin that hangs out near a downed flying machine in the far south, could it be...?"]="我一位名叫Frokle的老友原本是要前往加基森，可他和船上的所有锈水船员却从来都没有抵达。我听说在遥远的南边，有一伙疯狂的地精潜伏在一架被击落的飞行器附近，会不会是……？"
G["An old legend, aye. Everyone tells stories about them. They say they are the guardian spirits of the Swiftwater; protectors of Scadeald. According to the songs, they dwell by the river's waterfalls; which are three, like them. In winter, when the water runs low, people say “it's so cold the sisters are silent.” In spring, when the river thaws, the villages celebrate the Song of March, and they say the Three Sisters come out to sing. At least, that's how it was when I was a little girl. Back then we would dress up as maiden, mother, and crone to honor them.\n\nAmong the witches, they're known as Ekatia. They say Morgwena learned her craft at their feet before she turned against them. If there's truth in it, it happened a long time ago. Today, the Three Sisters are just a whisper in the wind."]="Una vieja leyenda, sí. Todo el mundo cuenta historias sobre ellas. Dicen que son los espíritus guardianes del Swiftwater; protectoras de Scadeald. Según las canciones, moran junto a las cascadas del río, que son tres, como ellas. En invierno, cuando el agua baja escasa, la gente dice: «hace tanto frío que las hermanas callan». En primavera, cuando el río se deshiela, las aldeas celebran el Canto de Marzo, y dicen que las Tres Hermanas salen a cantar. Al menos, así era cuando yo era niña. Por entonces nos disfrazábamos de doncella, madre y anciana para honrarlas.\n\nEntre las brujas se las conoce como Ekatia. Dicen que Morgwena aprendió su arte a sus pies antes de volverse contra ellas. Si algo hay de cierto, ocurrió hace mucho tiempo. Hoy, las Tres Hermanas no son más que un susurro en el viento."
G["An old scroll covered in various pandaren pictograms. You suspect that unless the sha corruption in the temple is cleansed you won't be able to peruse the contents further."]="一个写满了熊猫人象形文字的古老卷轴。你怀疑只有在净化了寺院中煞能腐蚀之后，才能继续研究里面的内容。"
G["An opportunity presents itself! I believe the Timeless Isle holds the key to unlocking the full potential of your cloak."]="大好的机会送上门来了！我敢肯定，激发你斗篷潜力的关键就在永恒岛。"
G["An oracle needsh food to foreshee the future. Thanksh!"]="一个神谕者需要食物才能预见未来。谢谢！"
G["An orb of |cFFF00000|Hspell:117227|h[Corrupted Water]|h|r forms!"]="一滴|cFFF00000|Hspell:117227|h[腐蚀之水]|h|r形成了！"
G["An orc - a true orc warrior - wishes for one thing: To die in the glory of battle against a hated enemy."]="一个兽人，一个真正的兽人战士，他一生的追求只有一个：在与敌人的决战中光荣地战死沙场。"
G["An orc...\n\n<Lantresor scoffs.>\n\nI am a blademaster of half-orc descent."]="一个兽人……\n\n<兰特瑞索露出轻蔑的表情。>\n\n我是个拥有一半兽人血统的剑圣。"
G["An order is whispered upon the nether winds and Mah'duun hears.\n\nA $g man : woman; comes before Mah'duun, and they speak of those which the winds demand be slain today."]="Una orden es susurrada por los vientos abisales y Mah'duun escucha.\n\n$g Un hombre:Una mujer; se presenta ante Mah'duun y hablan sobre aquellos a los que el viento quiere que maten hoy."
G["An outsider, from beyond the mists!"]="一个来自迷雾之外的陌生人！"
G["An outsider... saved me?"]="Me ha salvado... ¿$gun forastero:una forastera;?"
G["An understandable expenditure, as I see it. Show everyone, enemies and allies alike, that you're not afraid to use your power."]="我可以理解你们的良苦用心。你们让所有人，不管是敌人还是同盟，都知道你们不再害怕使用你们的力量了。"
G["An unexpected move."]="真是出人意料。"
G["An unexpected twist."]="出乎意料的转折。"
G["An unfavorable verdict..."]="令人不快的裁决……"
G["An unforeseen... contingency."]="一个意料之外的……偶然。"
G["An unfortunate business expense."]="一笔不幸的业务开支。"
G["An unseen enemy is perhaps the most dangerous of all."]="看不见的敌人或许才是最危险的敌人。"
G["An unspeakable horror dwells here, mortal.  C'Thun and his worshippers are not just an affront to nature, their existence presages destruction for Azeroth as we know it.\n\nMerithra sacrificed herself a thousand years ago along with Caelestrasz and Arygos because they knew this as well.  We're here because of our oath to return for them, but we're also here because C'Thun must be stopped!"]="凡人，这儿充斥着一种难以言说的恐怖。克苏恩和他的追随者们不仅公然藐视自然的力量，他们的存在更预示着艾泽拉斯的毁灭。\n\n一千年前，麦琳瑟拉、凯雷斯特拉兹和阿瑞苟斯都牺牲了自己以保全这个世界。我们来这里不仅仅是要报仇，还因为我们必须阻止克苏恩！"
G["An unstable source.... but its warmth beckons me!"]="一种不稳定的资源……不过它在热情地召唤我！"
G["An was being a meanie when she double hozen dared me. But I wasn't about to run away from a dare."]="安这个刻薄鬼，故意说我没胆子。而我是从不逃避挑衅的。"
G["An' if you cross ya eyes, an' hold ya thumbs toward de sky, an' press REAL hard..."]="如果你让两只眼睛对起来，将拇指伸向天空，用力按过去……"
G["An' last but certainly not least, one enormous bag! Big enough to fit eight whole apples! Eight, Ed! Can ye believe it!?"]="还有，一个巨大的包！足够装下八个苹果的包！八个啊，艾德华！你能相信吗！？"
G["An' most of all, we be showin' Zalazane dat his time be at an end! Dat he will give back what be rightfully ours!"]="最重要的是，我们要让扎拉赞恩明白，他的末日到了！他将把从我们这里夺走的一切归还给我们！"
G["An' once you dead, den you serve da Gurubashi."]="你们死后都要服侍古拉巴什。"
G["An' stay down dis time!"]="这次，你就给我乖乖躺下吧！"
G["An' surrounded by the Lich King's beasts, what could old Duggan do?"]="老杜甘被巫妖王的爪牙包围了，老杜甘能做些什么？"
G["An' then you tunneled from the channel straight into a dining hall!"]="然后你就会从这条隧道一直冲进饭厅！"
G["An' this one's for Gizmo and Socks, you bastards!!"]="这个是为吉兹莫和袜子报仇，你们这些混蛋！"
G["An' when he did arrive there, what'd his dwarf eyes see?"]="当他到了那里的时候，他的矮人眼睛会看到什么？"
G["An' where you think you're goin', sonny?!"]="你要到哪里去，小家伙？！"
G["Ana, how would you like to go down to the harbor in a little while?"]="安娜，想不想去港口玩会儿？"
G["Ana, ten more minutes, then you need to wash up. We're having your favorite. Mac and cheese."]="安娜，再给你10分钟，然后快点洗漱。我们为你准备了你最爱吃的——通心面与奶酪。"
G["Anachronos, I have lost the signet ring. Could you supply me with a replacement?"]="阿纳克洛斯，我把徽记之戒给弄丢了。你能再给我一个吗？"
G["Anachronos, this diversion will give you and the young druid time enough to seal the gate. Do not falter. Now, let us see how they deal with chaotic magic."]="阿纳克洛斯，声东击西的战术能让你和年轻的德鲁伊有足够的时间来封印大门。不要犹豫。现在，让我们看看它们如何对付这些混乱的魔法。"
G["Anakh Kyree!"]="¡Anakh Kyree!"
G["Anakh kyree!"]="¡Anakh kyree!"
G["Analysis complete. There is partial corruption in the planet's life-support systems as well as complete corruption in most of the planet's defense mechanisms."]="分析完成。这个星球的生命支持系统受到了部分腐蚀，而防御机制则完全被腐蚀了。"
G["Analyzing Elder Brightleaf enhancement.... Persistent area defenses powered by solar amplification."]="正在分析明叶长老的强化效果……太阳能增效提供了永久的区域性防护力增强。"
G["Analyzing watcher status. Please wait."]="正在分析守护者的状态。请稍候。"
G["Anar'alah belore!"]="¡Anar'alah belore!"
G["Anar'alah belore, hero. Good luck."]="Anar'alah belore，英雄。祝你好运。"
G["Anar'alah! The skies betray us - we are not safe up here!"]="Anar’alah！天空背弃了我们——这里不安全了！"
G["Anar'alash denal! Will someone tell me WHAT is going on in Dalaran?"]="Anar’alash denal！谁来告诉我达拉然怎么了？"
G["Anar'anel belore!"]="¡Anar'anel belore!"
G["Anar'endal dracon!"]="¡Anar'endal dracon!"
G["Anarchy! Bedlam! Oh, you are so wise! Yes, I see it now, of course!"]="混乱！疯狂！啊，您真是太睿智了！是的，我明白了，当然！"
G["Anastasia, stay close please. We'll go do something fun soon."]="靠近点儿，安娜斯塔西娅。我们一起找点儿乐子。"
G["Anathera and Latherion fought back to back where the battle was thickest. Two lovers determined to survive the war together."]="在战斗最激烈的时候，安娜瑟拉和拉瑟里安背靠背地战斗着。两个恋人决心在这场战争中一起活下来。"
G["Anathera!"]="安娜瑟拉！"
G["Anathera... I cannot bear to face the rest of eternity without you by my side... If you are taken from me, then let this be the day I also return to the earth..."]="安娜瑟拉……没有你，我怎么能独自忍受永生的煎熬……如果你就此离去，那么就让我也魂归大地吧……"
G["Anaya...? Do my eyes deceive me? Is it really you?"]="安娜雅……？我的双眼没有欺骗我吗？真的是你吗？"
G["Ancestors be beside me, let 'dem hear yo' voice!"]="先祖与我同在！让他们听到你的声音！"
G["Ancestors be with you, hero. Farewell!"]="愿先祖与你同在。再见！"
G["Ancestors forgive me. I have failed..."]="先祖，请原谅我。我败了……"
G["Ancestors watch over you, kind one..."]="先祖们保佑着你，善良的人……"
G["Ancestors, give me strength! The vortex's pull is increasing! It's pulling me in! The power of his longing... it's overwhelming!"]="先祖们，赐予我力量！漩涡的引力在增加！他的渴求之力……太强大了！"
G["Ancestors, hear me! I call you back from the beyond, to bind this spirit to my will!"]="先祖之灵，请听从我的召唤！从遥远的彼岸归来，让这灵魂服从我的意志！"
G["Anchorite Nindumen, I have a request to make of you."]="学者尼度门，我有一事相求。"
G["Anchorite, I need another Extract of the Afterlife."]="学者，我还需要一份灵魂精萃。"
G["Anchorite, we are honored that you are here, but I am curious as to what you truly believe you can accomplish?"]="你在这里，我们很荣幸，但是我想知道的是，你究竟认为自己可以获得什么样的成果？"
G["Ancient Onu, where may I find a Seed of the Earth?"]="古老的安努，我能在哪里找到一颗大地之种？"
G["Ancient Pandaren heroes freed the grummles from slavery."]="古代熊猫人英雄们解放了被奴役的土地精。"
G["Ancient forces stir - forces that have not been seen or felt for thousands of years. The world weeps, $r. Perhaps a new sundering comes. A sickness born from within...\n\nThe foulness has begun to seep into our lands. From the Dream come nightmares. Nightmares to befoul us in our waking hours..."]="上古的力量被数千年来从未活动过的虫子所震撼。世界在哭泣，$r。也许一次新的灾变正在开始。其中孕育的是痛苦……\n\n那些可恶的家伙开始渗透入我们的土地。噩梦来自于睡眠。噩梦开始在我们醒着的时候纠缠我们……"
G["Ancient magic swirls within the depths of the eye. It gives you a feeling of vertigo, as if you might accidentally tumble into its iris and fall forever."]="远古的魔法在眼睛深处旋转，令你感到一阵眩晕，仿佛自己被吸入了虹膜之中并永远地陷落了。"
G["Ancient ones guide my hand... Wake from your slumber! WAKE AND SEAL THIS CURSED PLACE!"]="远古的神灵，指引我……从沉睡中苏醒吧！醒来，封印这片被诅咒的地方！"
G["Ancient spirit, you honor the Earthen Ring. What troubles you so?"]="远古的灵魂，大地之环为你感到骄傲。你有什么麻烦吗？"
G["Ancient spirits of water!"]="远古水灵！"
G["Ancient spirits of water."]="来自远古的水灵。"
G["Ancient wisdoms tell of speaking to Shen-zin Su through the voice of the four elemental spirits, but the spirits have fled our great temple and their powers are fading."]="古代的智慧告诉我们，必须通过四位元素之灵之口，才能与神真子交谈。可是元素之灵们都离开了五晨寺，他们的力量正在衰减。"
G["Ancients be praised!"]="赞颂远古神灵！"
G["Ancients of Zandalar, grant dis one da power ta' mock death itself!"]="赞达拉的先祖，赐予我藐视死神的力量吧！"
G["Ancients of Zandalar, mark 'dem for de black road."]="赞达拉的先祖，标记他们，让他们走向不归之路！"
G["Ancients of fire and earth, I have prepared the way for you. Come forth and raze Orgrimmar."]="烈火与大地的远古之力，我已经为你们打通了道路。来摧毁奥格瑞玛吧。"
G["Ancients of flour and earth, I have peppered the way for you. Come forth and glaze Orgrimmar!"]="面粉与大地的远古之力，我已经为你们打通了道路。来摧毁奥格瑞玛吧。"
G["Ancients of wheat and water, I have peppered the way for you. Come forth and glaze Stormwind!"]="小麦与水的远古之力，我已经为你们打通了道路。来摧毁暴风城吧！"
G["Ancients of wind and water, I have prepared the way for you. Come forth and raze Stormwind."]="疾风与洪水的远古之力，我已经为你们打通了道路。来摧毁暴风城吧。"
G["Ancients, rise!"]="强大的古树，出现吧！"
G["And \"Fanny,\" a most fitting name."]="Y se llamaba \"Fanny\", la de pelo zanahoria."
G["And $gbrother:sister;, be wary of scourge ambushes."]="Y $ghermano:hermana;, ten cuidado con las emboscadas de la Plaga."
G["And $n, you shall be the hand that guides us all. Speak with me for a moment before you join Aysa at the Singing Pools to the east."]="Y tú serás la mano que nos guíe a todos. Habla conmigo antes de reunirte con Aysa en Las Pozas Cantarinas del este."
G["And Fahrad?"]="嗯，法拉德？"
G["And Garrosh is losin' patience over findin' that ookin' bell. Those mogu hide it good!"]="加尔鲁什找不到那口该死的钟，他已经快没耐心了。魔古族可真会藏东西！"
G["And I MUST have a carafe of sweet nectar in my dressing room. It's right there in my contract!"]="另外我的更衣室里面必须时刻准备一瓶好酒。这是写在我的合同里的！"
G["And I am determined to find out more... So if you need my help again, you know where I'll be."]="而我下决心要找出更多相关的东西……如果你还需要我的帮助，你知道我会在哪里。"
G["And I am just saying, Dissector, that you do not appear to possess any resistance to sonic manipulation."]="我也只是随口说说，切割者，看来你对声波操控不具有任何抵抗力。"
G["And I don't know anything about this fire of yours..."]="我对你的这些火并不了解……"
G["And I don't want our land to have any of those horrible wolves, or giants, or ugly rams!"]="我可不希望在咱们的土地上遇见恐怖的狼、巨人或是丑陋的山羊。"
G["And I have come for you, Leyara."]="我为你而来，莱雅娜。"
G["And I have seen the mightiest of emperors laid low by the perseverance of the smallest of enemies."]="我还见过最强大的皇帝被渺小而坚忍不拔的敌人打倒。"
G["And I invite you to take part in its creation."]="我邀请你参加它的建成工作。"
G["And I knew you'd say that."]="Y sabía que dirías eso."
G["And I take it you're going again..."]="我以为你又要走了……"
G["And I think he lived a very very good life. We owe everything we have to Liu Lang, the first pandaren explorer."]="在我看来，刘浪的人生无比精彩。我们的一切都得益于刘浪——这位熊猫人探险者始祖。"
G["And I thought I might get a bit of rest. Silly me."]="我想我恐怕得稍微休息一会儿。我可真没用。"
G["And I was suited to see this?"]="是说我吗？"
G["And I wish I could join you $n. Head over to Stormwind Keep. You'll find Thelman Slatefist in the King's audience chamber. He will aid you in getting to Alterac Valley."]="真希望与你同行，$n。去暴风要塞吧，跟国王觐见室的塞尔曼·岩拳谈谈，他会帮助你前往奥特兰克山谷的。"
G["And I'm beginning to get HELMET HAIR. This is a travesty!"]="而且我的发型都被头盔压扁了。真是太滑稽了！"
G["And I've got just the brew to celebrate with. First round is on me. Thank you, friends!"]="而我也带了美酒来庆祝。第一轮我请。谢谢，朋友们！"
G["And STAY dead!"]="站着别动！"
G["And Shindigger Stout too!  Thank the Light!  I was parched!"]="还有美酒！感谢圣光！我几乎都要被烤干了！"
G["And Socks!"]="还有袜子！"
G["And THEN what happened?"]="然后发生了什么事？"
G["And WHAT are our soldiers supposed to do with that shoddy piece of junk?"]="这种劣质货对我们的士兵有用吗？"
G["And YOU! We will FEAST on your ashes! Now, DIE!"]="而你，你的灰烬将成为我们的盛宴！现在，受死吧！"
G["And a good day to ya, brave $c.  I know ya be lookin' for a fine steed.  There's no finer steed than a raptor under your reigns, lemme tell you $g mon : sis;!  Take a look at the ones I got to offer - bred from the fiercest stock anywhere."]="Que tengas buenos días, valiente $c. Me he enterado de que buscas un buen corcel. No hay nada mejor que tener un raptor a tus órdenes, ¡deja que te enseñe colega! Mira los que tengo para ofrecerte, criados de entre los más fieros."
G["And a great deal of honor you shall have, I am sure.  Speak with Martin Lindsey at the Pools of Vision.  It is a cave located in the side of the Spirit Rise."]="你一定能获得无上的荣耀。跟预见之池的马丁·林塞谈谈，就在灵魂高地旁的洞穴中。"
G["And above it all, I somehow find myself saddled with you, the very man who caused me to lose my job in the first place!"]="更要命的是，我居然还和你搅和在一起！就是你害我丢了沙塔斯城的工作！"
G["And as I drifted towards nothingness, a brilliant light appeared, then another, and another... My dear val'kyr."]="正当我朝着虚无漂移时，一道亮光出现了，然后又一道，再一道……我亲爱的瓦格里。"
G["And as for you, $n, disappointing. You are a disgrace to the Horde!"]="至于你——$n，可真令人失望。你简直是部落的耻辱！"
G["And as one of the fiercest tests put upon a warrior of the frostborn, we are made to face a creature far larger than ourselves--giants, dragons, jormungar--as a testament to the fact that size will never be our weakness."]="作为霜脉战士最严厉的试炼之一，就是战胜比自己高大许多的敌人，比如巨人、龙或是冰虫——由此证明体型并不是我们的弱点。"
G["And as your limp body dangles from the rafters, I shall take pleasure in knowing that a mad man has been put to death. After all, what proof do you have? Did you expect to come in here and point your fingers at royalty and leave unscathed?"]="当你瘫软的尸体在绞刑架上摇摆的时候，我会为一个疯子的性命终于得到终结而高兴。毕竟，你有什么证据呢？你难道想要到这里来挑衅一个贵族，然后毫发无伤地离开？"
G["And bowing to the Warchief is any better? Garrosh's obsession with these mogu artifacts is such that I haven't seen since Kael'thas walked amongst us."]="可向酋长低头就对了吗？加尔鲁什对这些魔古神器的痴迷程度简直让我想起了凯尔萨斯。"
G["And countless more to come, Klaxxi'va. It is my honor to serve in our time of need."]="还有数不尽的敌人正在涌来，卡拉克西瓦。我很荣幸能在困难之时为大家而战。"
G["And crossing the line is the gnome car! The gnomes win!"]="侏儒的赛车冲线了！侏儒获胜！"
G["And death..."]="还有死亡……"
G["And did he?"]="他帮忙了么？"
G["And did the good King Varian send you as well to bid for our aid?"]="你也是亲爱的瓦里安国王派来请求协助的吗？"
G["And dis is da recipe for da bestest Broken chowder!"]="这是做破碎者杂烩的最棒的配方！"
G["And don't come back!"]="永远别再回来！"
G["And don't worry about the trolls underfoot while you're up there. They'll be trampled into the ground by the ancients' strides."]="不要担心脚下的那些巨魔。他们将被古树深深地踩进泥土之中。"
G["And drop your dooker to the ground!"]="尽情狂欢吧！"
G["And every foe that falls, energy sapped and stolen, only further fuels our assault."]="敌人倒下后，我们能窃取并利用他们残余的所有能量继续展开攻击。"
G["And fer dessert we be havin' cheesecake, flown in fresh from Stormwind on the wings o' angels..."]="而且我们有从暴风城空运过来的奶酪蛋糕作为餐后甜品。"
G["And finally the candle... to burn those who would thwart you!"]="最终，蜡烛……烧死那些碍手碍脚的家伙！"
G["And finally, this is Master Cheng.  Master Cheng focuses on reflex and swift motion and will help you begin your training."]="最后要介绍的是程大师。程大师专攻反应和速度，会帮你开始你的训练。"
G["And find it he did. After quickly advancing through the ranks of the Cult, the Lich King himself granted Ras immortality. Thus was born Ras Frostwhisper, the lich.\n\nNow do you understand?"]="他真的获得了不朽之身。他很快从众多信徒中脱颖而出，巫妖王随即授予了他永生的权力。巫妖莱斯·霜语因此而诞生。\n\n你明白吗？"
G["And fire!"]="烈焰！"
G["And for our gods?"]="我们会为自己的神明做些什么？"
G["And for the ladies, roast baby boar. Enjoy!"]="女士们，尽情享用烤乳猪吧！"
G["And for what? What did the Horde gain from such actions?  Garrosh is a fool, and a betrayer.  I should have killed him long ago, when he betrayed my father."]="这有什么意义呢？部落到底能从中得到什么？加尔鲁什是个蠢货，叛徒。我早就该杀了他，就在他背叛我父亲时。"
G["And from the Red Crane, a shining beacon of hope for a better world!"]="还有朱鹤的，对一个更美好世界的希望寄托！"
G["And get this damn thing out of my sight! Hellscream bought his treasure with the blood of my people. I hope it destroys him."]="把这该死的玩意拿走！地狱咆哮用血精灵的鲜血换取他的宝物。真希望这钟把他毁了。"
G["And go where? It was all that we knew; all that we had known and all that we would ever know.\n\nEventually, we lost contact with the Barovs and ultimately, were separated from the household. We knew not what happened to the other servants, only that there were screams. Tortured screams.\n\nKnowing that we had nowhere to go, Lucien and I were forced to hide in our quarters. During the day, when the school was relatively quiet, Lucien would sneak out to scrounge up food and drink."]="去哪里？我们过去、现在和将来所知道的全部就是这些。\n\n最终，我们与巴罗夫失去了联系，并从房子里被赶了出来。我们不知道其他仆人出了什么事，只听到有尖叫声,痛苦的尖叫声。\n\n知道我们无路可逃，卢森和我被迫藏在了我们的住处。在白天，当学校相对安静时，卢森会溜出去弄点食物和喝的东西。"
G["And have you heard? Have you heard the preposterous claims? Alliance and Horde supporting peace? Why the very thought of such things makes my blood boil!"]="你听说了吗？关于那些荒谬的声明？联盟和部落倡导和平？这种言论真让人气不打一处来！"
G["And having seen what Grand Empress Shek'zeer is doing to our land... I need no convincing."]="所以在看到大女皇夏柯希尔在我们土地上的所作所为之后……我就已下定决心。"
G["And he's down for the count! Good going."]="解决掉他了！一切顺利。"
G["And here we are!  Welcome to Kharanos!  Watch your step on the way out."]="我们到了！欢迎来到卡拉诺斯！出去时请小心脚下。"
G["And here we are. Help me with a couple small tasks while I prepare, if you would."]="我们到了。如果你愿意，可以在我做准备时帮我几个小忙。"
G["And heroes... I hold that which you seek. May it once more see the evil dissolved. Remulos, see to it that our champion receives the shard of the Green Flight."]="英雄……我有你要找的东西。愿它能再次为净化邪恶的力量而效劳。雷姆洛斯，请确保我们的勇士得到绿龙军团保管的碎片。"
G["And his visions DID come to pass."]="他的预言真的实现了。"
G["And how committed the Alliance is to the Wildhammer cause!"]="而如何效忠于联盟是蛮锤的事情！"
G["And how have you been enjoying our land? Have you been learning?"]="你觉得我们的土地怎么样？你学到什么了吗？"
G["And how many do YOU perform?"]="*你*每天会练多少次呢？"
G["And if I hear that you palookas complained to Nazgrel again, it'll be one of ya's that I serve up next time..."]="要是我再听说你们这些差劲的家伙向纳兹格雷尔抱怨的话，那么下次我就会用你们中的一个来做菜……"
G["And if that answer is no, then could it be possible that because this artifact exists, its polar opposite must also exist?"]="如果答案是否定的，那么这很可能就是它存在的原因，这个东西的另一个极端是否也必然存在呢？"
G["And if that weren't crazy enough, that big demon gets killed by a bunch of little floating light things... Oh, I was also a female elf in that one... Yep..."]="听起来很疯狂吧？更疯狂的还在后面呢。那个巨大的恶魔被一群飘在空中的小光球给炸死了……哦，我在梦中是一个女精灵……对……"
G["And if we find ourselves surrounded and disarmed... wounded and overwhelmed... we will lift our heads in defiance and spit in their faces."]="即使我们被包围，失去武器……身受重伤，孤立无援……我们也会带着轻蔑的神情高昂起头，将唾沫啐在敌人的脸上。"
G["And if we find ourselves surrounded and disarmed... wounded and without hope... we will lift our heads in defiance and spit in their faces."]="即使被包围，失去武器，身受重伤，毫无希望……我们也会高昂着头，将唾沫啐在敌人的脸上。"
G["And if you do not, then I am truly lost."]="如果你不爱我了，那么我就真的被遗忘了。"
G["And if you don't obey, we're cutting you up for parts."]="要是你不听话，我们就把你砍成碎片。"
G["And if you'll look to your left, you'll see that the gnomes have retaken Gnomeregan.  Hooray for us!"]="要是你往你的左边看看，就会发现侏儒们已经夺回了诺莫瑞根！我们真是太伟大了！"
G["And if you'll look to your right, you'll see... my friend, about to get killed!"]="而且要是你往右侧转一转头，你会看见……我的朋友，就要被杀死了！"
G["And if your Farstriders were here to reinforce us, I might agree. But, they are busying themselves instead with the Shadowpine trolls on your eastern border. The longer we wait for them, the stronger the Scourge will become."]="如果你们的这帮远行者是来增援的，我当然欢迎。可他们丝毫不理会东部边界的暗松巨魔，总是忙着各自的闲事。要是我们一直耗下去，亡灵天灾只会变得更强。"
G["And in the other corner, we have the many eyes of Zen'shar! What's next, a fighting nose?"]="另一边进场的是，长着无数眼睛的兹恩沙尔！下次还会有什么呢，一个会打架的鼻子吗？"
G["And in the other corner, we have... a big cloud of scary floating eyes? This doesn't look good."]="在竞技场的另一侧……什么？一只漂浮的巨眼？这可不妙。"
G["And in the vision... the High Council did not make this decision for you, Phaoris."]="在那里面……高阶议会没有做出你想要的决议，法奥瑞斯。"
G["And in this corner! He's angry. He's deadly. He's a little bit adorable. Straight out of Neverest, it's Crush!"]="再看这边！他怒气冲冲。他所向披靡。他还有点小可爱。他就是来自不息山的压路者！"
G["And in times since, the people have cared for Huo, knowing that they and he were intimately tied."]="从那时起，人们就开始供奉燧焰。因为他们明白，自己和燧焰是紧密相连的。"
G["And it looks like he's got reinforcements comin' from Nazjatar!"]="看上去他得到了纳沙塔的增援！"
G["And it looks to me like you made a new friend."]="看来你交到了一位新朋友。"
G["And it very nearly didn't remember you. $n fought bravely against the North Wind to protect your story."]="你的存在差点就被抹杀了。$n勇敢地与北风作战，保护了关于你的历史。"
G["And it's kind of scary, too."]="而且这也挺吓人的。"
G["And it's the $n coming through turn one!"]="$n驶过来了，第一个进入弯角！"
G["And just for good measure..."]="不仅如此……"
G["And just like that, you're dead!"]="对，就像那样，你死定了！"
G["And just what do you think you are doing?  You dare to interfere with my master's experiment?"]="那么你觉得你正在干什么？你胆敢妨碍主人的实验？"
G["And justice is served!"]="正义得以伸张！"
G["And keep the change you filthy animal!"]="不用找零了，你这恶心的生物！"
G["And keep the change, ya filthy animal!"]="卑鄙的家伙，你这是自作自受！"
G["And last, we put in da Corki!"]="最后，我们把考尔奇放进去！"
G["And let the Wildhammers unite!"]="蛮锤团结一致！"
G["And let's set these whole Highlands alight!"]="让我们点亮整座高地！"
G["And lo, how the mighty fell trembling at its feet, fearful that it might direct its words upon them.\n\nBut still did these charlatans, these worshipping pretenders to a non-existent religion, rail against the inevitable in a vain attempt to control their 'god.'  Uncaring, and likely not even noticing them, Murmur yawned and they knew oblivion.\n\nYet one somehow managed to survive, and in his insanity found a way to bring Murmur into the world."]="瞧，所谓的强者战栗着跪拜在它面前，惟恐摩摩尔催动音波，令他们粉身碎骨。\n\n那些狂妄的家伙则假借崇拜之名组成了宗教组织，暗地里策划着如何控制他们的“神”，却不知道他们的野心注定会落空。摩摩尔对它的崇拜者毫不在意，不经意间打了个哈欠，他们就灰飞烟灭了。\n\n只有一人得以幸存，虽然这场浩劫令他神志有些错乱，但他却偶然发现了将摩摩尔召唤到这个世界的方法。"
G["And me, Tak-Tak, me is your friend! Bam!"]="还有我，泰克泰克，我是你的好朋友！赞！"
G["And might I add, that dress is lovely! You must tell me where you got it from."]="我不得不说……这件礼服太漂亮了！你一定要告诉我，你是从哪里买到它的。"
G["And miss out on wearing my awesome custom-made helmet? Not a chance."]="然后放弃我帅气的特制潜水头盔？没门。"
G["And modest too... Perhaps it is your time, then, $n.\n\nAre you prepared to enter the fortress of the Blackrock orcs? To wreak havoc? To tear asunder the foundation of the mountain citadel?"]="Y también haces gala de modestia... Quizás haya llegado tu momento, $n.\n\n¿$GListo:Lista; para entrar en la fortaleza de los orcos Roca Negra? ¿Para sembrar el caos? ¿Para destrozar los mismísimos cimientos de la ciudadela de la montaña?"
G["And more importantly, what are those Scourge fiends doing here?"]="更重要的是，那些天灾恶魔在这儿干什么？"
G["And my people have not always been the Forsaken."]="我的人民也并非一直是被遗忘者。"
G["And my soul... my soul belongs to the Scourge!"]="我的灵魂……我的灵魂属于天灾！"
G["And neither, Avartu, will yours."]="你也不会白死的，阿瓦图。"
G["And not a very good one! Remember what you did to my tabard?"]="还是个不合格的洗衣工！记得你把我的战袍洗成什么样了吗？"
G["And now all your goblin friends are safe and happy again and there's no more pirates to blow up your ships!"]="现在你所有的地精伙伴都再次迎来了安全与快乐的生活，也不会再有海盗想要炸碎你们的船！"
G["And now enough of this deception."]="欺骗到此为止吧。"
G["And now for a quick look at these gems."]="现在先看一下这些宝石。"
G["And now for the moment of truth."]="关键时刻到了。"
G["And now it falls to you, champions, to avenge us all. The task before you is great, but I will lend you my aid as I am able. You must prevail."]="现在，为我们复仇的重任落到了你们的肩膀上，勇士们。前方的路途依然无比艰险，但我会鼎力相助。你们必须取得胜利。"
G["And now my first decree upon the Vrykul! All malformed infants born of Vrykul mother and father are to be destroyed upon birth! Our blood must remain pure always! Those found in violation of Ymiron's decree will be taken to Gjalerbron for execution!"]="现在，我颁布第一道法令！所有维库人畸形婴儿一出生就要立即被处死！我们必须保证血统的纯正！违抗伊米隆国王的法令的维库人将被带往亚勒伯龙处决！"
G["And now the war, it be comin' soon. All that be left is the sendin' of all these goods and weapons to the Cenarion Hold in Silithus, and that is gonna be done within $2113w days. Then some brave soul is gonna have to be ringin' the gong near those Ahn'Qiraj gates to open 'em and start the war."]="战争迫在眉睫。我们只需要将所有食物和武器运往希利苏斯的塞纳里奥要塞，货物将在$2113w天内全部抵达。然后会有一位勇敢的人敲响铜锣，打开安其拉的大门，战争也就开始了。"
G["And now the war, it be comin' soon. All that be left is the sendin' of all these goods and weapons to the Cenarion Hold in Silithus, and that is gonna be done within a day. Then some brave soul is gonna have to be ringin' the gong near those Ahn'Qiraj gates to open 'em and start the war."]="战争迫在眉睫。我们只需要将所有食物和武器运往希利苏斯的塞纳里奥要塞，货物将在1天内全部抵达。然后会有一位勇敢的人敲响铜锣，打开安其拉的大门，战争也就开始了。"
G["And now this... folly... would cost my daughter her life."]="而现在……这蠢事……让我女儿付出了生命的代价。"
G["And now to do what I should have done a hundred years ago."]="开始做我几百年前就应该完成的事吧！"
G["And now to make sure he doesn't get back up..."]="千万别让他再站起来……"
G["And now to quickly use the Orb of Domination, before the pit lord turns on us."]="赶快使用统御宝珠，不要让那个深渊领主来打我们。"
G["And now we part company."]="恕不远送。"
G["And now you die!"]="你去死吧！"
G["And now you know all that there is to know, mortal..."]="凡人，现在你已经知道一切了……"
G["And now you know why I live in a crater."]="现在你应该知道我为什么住在这里了。"
G["And now, Akali, my master will have your blood and I will take some of your power as well!"]="阿卡里，我的主人需要你的鲜血，我也要夺取你的一部分力量！"
G["And now, Garrosh has the Divine Bell. He could attack us any day!"]="现在加尔鲁什已经得到了圣钟。他随时就会对我们发动攻击！"
G["And now, I cut you!"]="去死吧！"
G["And now, I must rest. Thank you for all that you have done."]="我得好好休息了。感谢你给予我的帮助。"
G["And now, I must return to the waters of the lake."]="现在，我必须返回湖泊了。"
G["And now, I run!"]="我跑！"
G["And now, Shaman, you will give the Dragon Soul to ME."]="萨满，你会把巨龙之魂交给我。"
G["And now, even those nations that you would have called allies have recoiled and joined forces with us... Yes, old one, do not look so surprised."]="Y, ahora, hasta esas naciones que habrías llamado aliadas han retrocedido y han unido fuerzas con nosotros... Sí, $gviejo:vieja;, no pongas cara de sorpresa."
G["And now, it looks like they found where the mogu hid that bell."]="好像他们现在已经知道魔古族把那口钟藏在哪里了。"
G["And now, the Klaxxi call us to battle. Now, I am awakened."]="现在，卡拉克西号召我们战斗。现在，我已从沉睡中苏醒。"
G["And now, the malignance of the Old God has manifested itself within the waters."]="而现在，邪恶的上古之神寄生在这些水中。"
G["And now, the war begins."]="战争，已经打响了。"
G["And now, we spring the trap on our attackers..."]="现在，我们触动进攻者周围的陷阱机关……"
G["And now, your sad tale comes to an end."]="现在，你的可悲传说即将落幕。"
G["And now... let the Rumpus start!"]="现在……战斗开始！"
G["And now... the final step!"]="现在……最后一步！"
G["And now?"]="现在呢？"
G["And of course I'll need some mana. You guys are gonna love this; just wait...."]="当然，我得先补充法力值。你们会看到我发威的，再等一会就行了……"
G["And on this very soil that we now touch, our greatest heroes once hunted."]="就在我们脚下的这块土地上，我们最伟大的英雄曾在这里狩猎。"
G["And once the new order is established? My place will be secure, yes?"]="一旦新的秩序建立，你将确保我的地位，是吗？"
G["And once we do, Stormwind's days are numbered."]="一旦我们成功，暴风城就没几天好日子了。"
G["And one time, at camp, I caught a fish that was bigger than I am!!"]="有一次，在野营的时候，我抓住了一条比我还大的鱼！"
G["And our lack of answers only fuels the confusion."]="而我们找不到答案，这只会激起人们更大的困惑。"
G["And people from all over the world come to me to pay homage... and learn to fish."]="从世界各地来的人们走到我面前对我表示敬意……在我这里学习钓鱼。"
G["And perhaps the best part, I now have a hungering for the flesh of other humanoids. Cannibalizing their rotting corpses grants me power. Yes, DE-LI-CIOUS..."]="也许，最好的一件事就是我开始渴望其他人形生物的血肉了。吃掉他们腐烂的尸体能够让我获得力量，而且那种东西非常好吃……"
G["And please. Pay no heed to the... uhh... diversity of our crew."]="请不要太在意……呃……我们船员的多样性。"
G["And remember this, mortal: for now, I give you the choice. I allow you to pick your allegiance, but in the end, you will be mine - one way or another."]="记住，凡人：现在，我会给你选择的机会，我将允许你选择为谁效忠。但，殊途同归，你终将属于我。"
G["And remember, $n, the bloodspore powder can be used to weaken all magnataur in Gammoth."]="$n，血孢花粉能削弱犸格莫斯所有猛犸人的力量。"
G["And right when we finally finished building that damned bridge! What hope is there, $n?"]="我们刚刚建好了那座该死的桥！$n，我们还有什么希望？"
G["And serve you shall. Arm yourself at the quartermaster. The drones here are at your disposal."]="而你也要效力。去军需官那把自己武装起来吧。这里的虫群听你调遣。"
G["And should one die, two shall rise!"]="倒下一个，还会来更多！"
G["And so Arthas's armies break into the last untouched land in Northrend..."]="阿尔萨斯的军队已经侵入诺森德的最后一片净土……"
G["And so I see that you have appealed to Diamant. I have been bidden to abide your passing, fleshling. But that shall be the extent of the welcome you shall receive from me.\n\nDo not forget our first conversation. My trust for you is shallow. You have much to prove.\n\nYou would do best to leave. I grow tired of being wary of where my feet fall."]="所以我看到你已经向岱亚曼塔发出了诉求。我接受的命令是容忍你的出现，凡人。但我对你的接受程度也仅限于此。\n\n不要忘记我们的第一次交谈。要得到我的信任，你还需要做很多事。\n\n你最好先离开吧。我已经厌倦了每迈出一步都必须小心不要踩到你这种事。"
G["And so Moira and the High King set out into the snow to save the city, leaving the others to think about their actions."]="于是茉艾拉和国王深入雪山去拯救铁炉堡，留下其他人反思自己的行为。"
G["And so ends the Nexus War."]="魔枢战争就此结束了。"
G["And so ends your story."]="而你的故事也结束了。"
G["And so it begins."]="那就开始吧。"
G["And so it begins..."]="开始了……"
G["And so it falls to us, Her chosen voice."]="就让我们——女皇钦点的声音，来执行使命。"
G["And so it is done."]="这样就可以了。"
G["And so it was a human king who helped to unite the dwarven clans so long divided."]="就这样，一位人类国王将分裂已久的矮人部族团结了起来。"
G["And so our path lays before us. Speak to Master Shang Xi, he will tell you what comes next."]="我们的前路已经显现。快去找尚喜师父，他会告诉你下一步该怎么做。"
G["And so the \"champion\" arrives."]="Y ahí llega el \"campeón\"."
G["And so the Golden Lotus arrive..."]="这么说，金莲教也来了……"
G["And so the circle of life is complete. All is prepared."]="生命的循环已经完成。一切都已就绪。"
G["And so the knights stood before the charging Horde and held their ground as a thousand berserk orcs came through the valley."]="当数以千计的狂暴兽人涌入山谷的时候，骑士们紧握手中的武器，巍然面对部落的冲锋。"
G["And so then he says \"I was talking to the chicken!\""]="Y entonces dice \"¡Estaba hablando con el pollo!\""
G["And so they are washed away with little trace of what once was."]="他们连同那一点可怜的痕迹都被一起冲刷掉了。"
G["And some will preach unity!  But does unity prevent a chain from breaking at its weakest link?"]="总是有人鼓吹团结！难道团结就能阻止锁链中最弱的一环断开吗？"
G["And sometimes you have to ask yourself: \"Is it worth it?\"  And the answer is plain: \"Pain is not the cost, but the reward!\""]="¡Y a veces debéis haceros la siguiente pregunta: \"¿Merece la pena?\" Y la respuesta es bien simple: \"El dolor no es el precio, sino la recompensa!"
G["And stay down!"]="蹲下来！"
G["And stay out!"]="出去！"
G["And summon forth Murmur they did.\n\nPowerful magics of containment and silencing were employed, held together by the constant supply of souls being fed into them.  Yet still they could not control the beast, could not bend it to their will.\n\nThese mortals began to devise different strategies, and one after the other they all failed.  And in so doing, they weakened the rituals, accidentally giving Murmur the slightest modicum of freedom.\n\nIt was all that was needed."]="他们果真召唤出了摩摩尔。\n\n魔法师企图利用强大的法术来抑制摩摩尔之音，并不断地夺取灵魂来维系法术的有效性。尽管如此，他们依然无法控制这个野蛮的生物，无法令它屈从于他们的意志。\n\n他们想出了各种方法想要制服摩摩尔，却无一例外地失败了。在试验这些方法的过程中，他们弱化了仪式的效果，意外地使摩摩尔看到了一丝自由的曙光。\n\n而这一丝曙光对摩摩尔来说已经足够了。"
G["And thank YOU, hero. It will be difficult to hold the forge, but think of what we can learn here!"]="还有你，英雄。要守住熔炉很困难，但是想想我们能学到的东西吧！"
G["And thank you, $n.  Without your aid I may never have found my way to the Forsaken."]="谢谢你，$n。没有你的帮助，我永远无法成为被遗忘者的一员。"
G["And thank you... thank you for freeing me from the shackles of the damned.  You are a hero... I know you will go on to great deeds."]="谢谢你……谢谢你将我从被诅咒的枷锁中解救出来。你是个英雄……我知道你还会干出惊天动地的大事来的。"
G["And that is the lesson of Liu Lang, my friend. Everyone always laughs at the explorer. They always laugh... until he returns."]="那就是刘浪给我们的启示，朋友。人们总爱嘲笑探险家。他们笑啊，笑啊……等他回来就不笑了。"
G["And that's how Lothar killed thirty six orcs with his bare hands!"]="洛萨就那样空手杀死了三十六个兽人！"
G["And that's that, folks! This conflict's been settled the proper way, with VIOLENCE! Let's hear it for our contestants!"]="就是这样。听好了！这场冲突已经被我们用暴力引入了正轨！让我们看看敌人会有怎样的反应吧！"
G["And that's where we find ourselves now, $n.\n\nWe can't possibly deal with all of this by ourselves, and quite frankly, I feel a little out of my depth. Jinky knows what needs to be done. You should go see her now.\n\nI just hope you'll be able to get us out of this mess with our bodies intact."]="Eso explica nuestro estado actual, $n.\n\nNo podemos encargarnos de esto nosotros solos y, para serte sincero, me siento un poco perdido en este asunto. Jinky sabe lo que hay que hacer. Deberías ir a verla ahora.\n\nSolo espero que seas capaz de sacarnos de este lío con nuestros cuerpos intactos."
G["And the Alliance wasn't supposed follow the same visions your wife was having."]="联盟也不该照搬你妻子所设想的远景。"
G["And the Kirin Tor? What have they to say of necromancy?"]="肯瑞托呢？他们对通灵术有什么看法？"
G["And the Tastyfish have gone for the week!   I will remain for another hour to allow you to turn in your fish!"]="本周的钓鱼比赛已经结束！在我逗留的一小时内，你们可以用可口鱼跟我交换物品！"
G["And the answer is nothing... For it is the titans that have cursed us!"]="没有……是泰坦诅咒了我们！"
G["And the cub concluded, \"I should very much like to live like a hozen!\""]="Y el cachorro concluyó: \"¡Me encantaría vivir como un hozen!\"."
G["And the delivery is not for ME, Hao! The honorable Lorewalker has been waitin- oh..."]="还有这车玉石并不是给我的，豪！尊敬的游学者一直在等——噢……"
G["And the flame of our vengeance draws near. Be ready."]="我们复仇的烈焰已经逼近了。准备好吧"
G["And the greatest losses."]="也可能是最惨重的失败。"
G["And the kaldorei vessel?"]="卡多雷的船呢？"
G["And the other half?"]="那么另一半是什么？"
G["And the wisdom of those you've outsmarted."]="向不如你聪明的人学习智慧。"
G["And their shamans have laid out a network of sentry totems."]="他们的萨满用岗哨图腾拉起了一张警戒网。"
G["And their skulls are harder than granite. Curiously, they all appear to be related."]="他们的脑袋比花岗岩还要坚硬。而最奇怪的是，他们好像统统都是亲戚。"
G["And their torment at your hands is at an end. By my name, I shall put an end to your life."]="他们所承受的痛苦就要结束了。以我的名义，我会在此终结你的生命。"
G["And then I'll throw you to Kalimdor!"]="然后我就会把你丢到卡利姆多去！"
G["And then came Huo, the spirit of fire, to the land of Shen-zin Su."]="此时，上古火灵燧焰降临到了神真子的背上。"
G["And then gnomes are even worse!  They are always saying stuff like..."]="侏儒们更糟！他们一直在说一些……"
G["And then the Old One will remake this world for the Mantid!"]="然后，上古尊者会将这个世界赐予螳螂妖！"
G["And then the Tauren said, '13 INCHES!'"]="Y entonces va el tauren y dice: \"¡39 CENTÍMETROS!\"."
G["And then the rabbit just bit his head off... I swear."]="然后那兔子就一下子咬掉了他的头……事情就是这样，我发誓。"
G["And then use it to KILL ALLIANCE!"]="用它去干掉联盟吧！"
G["And then we met!"]="然后我们相遇了！"
G["And then we saw her, the fearsome beast!"]="接着，那只恐怖的野兽进入了我们的视线！"
G["And then what happened?"]="后来怎么样了？"
G["And then, forever on, yer soul be my plaything...."]="从此以后，你的灵魂将永远是我的玩物……"
G["And then, my brothers and sisters, we shall shed these frail forms and ascend to immortality!"]="我的兄弟姐妹们，我们应该抛弃这副脆弱的躯壳，升华为不朽之身！"
G["And there ... they remained."]="可是……它们依然存在。"
G["And there are Virmen in the main store!"]="而且仓库里到处都是兔妖！"
G["And there goes the other one."]="另一个也完蛋了。"
G["And there is no hope!  There is no hope but in the loss of all hope.  That's right, brothers and sisters.  Only hopelessness can grant true hope!"]="已经没有希望了！但兄弟姐妹们，只有当我们失去一切希望的时候，真正的希望才会显现！"
G["And there is nothing you or that fool, Illidan, can do to stop me! You have both served me in your own right - unwittingly."]="你，或是伊利丹那个蠢货，都根本不能阻止我！你们一直扮演着我的仆从的角色，只是你们对此一无所知罢了。"
G["And there is this..."]="就是这个……"
G["And there she is, the Spirit of Gnomeregan!"]="你看，诺莫瑞根之魂！修好啦！"
G["And there we have it, just add water! Wish I would have thought of that one a little sooner."]="有办法了，浇水！我怎么没早点想到这主意。"
G["And there's Orgrimmar, huge and menacing like always. Take a quick break, boys, then it's back to the Bluff!"]="奥格瑞玛还是那么的巍峨和险峻。赶快休息一下吧，孩子，一会就要返回雷霆崖了！"
G["And these incidents... these divisive acts of hate against other members of our organization.  They were cowardly and ugly, yes.  But maybe... they were NECESSARY!"]="所有这些事件……这些充满了仇恨的，针对我们组织中其他成员的行动。的确，它们懦弱而丑陋。但也许……它们也是必需的！"
G["And they created a magical cradle of life in a hidden valley that we now call the Vale of Eternal Blossoms."]="他们在今天被我们称为锦绣谷的隐秘山谷建立了生命的魔法摇篮。"
end)(AscensionCN.GossipEN2ES)
;(function(G)
G["And they're off!"]="他们出发了！"
G["And this is Comar Villard. Two weeks married, his wife was spirited away from the safety of Menethil Harbor."]="这位是科马·韦拉德。结婚不到两个星期，他的妻子就为了米奈希尔港的安全而献出了生命。"
G["And those aren't pandaren down there.  They've got no fur."]="而且那些不是熊猫人。他们身上不长毛。"
G["And those in Azeroth now a-bed shall think themselves accursed they were not here,  And hold their valor cheap whiles any speaks that fought with us upon this dark day."]="那些畏缩在艾泽拉斯世界各个角落中的懦夫们，当有人谈起这个黑暗的日子时，他们必定会为自己的胆怯感到羞愧。"
G["And those that did know how dangerous these earthquakes can be.  To this day, the Exodar is still shaking from our rather abrupt arrival."]="还有那些对这些地震的危险性了解得一清二楚的人。我们唐突的着陆让埃索达时至今日都还在震颤。"
G["And though I am leaving soon, I can also instruct you."]="而且尽管我很快就要离开，我也可以指点你一些。"
G["And though the hour of his atonement had come, the worm managed to escape his fate, returning to the frozen wastes of Northrend."]="阿尔萨斯赎罪的时刻眼看就要到来，但那只蛆虫逃脱了命运的制裁，回到了诺森德的冰冻废土。"
G["And through that hope, strengthen our side in the fight?"]="借助这个希望来加强我们的力量？"
G["And thus... the spark of life... fades..."]="生命之火……就此……熄灭了……"
G["And to think, my friends say I \"troll\" too much. I must show them you, Griftah."]="Y pensar que mis amigos dicen que hago demasiado el \"trol\". Tengo que presentártelos, Griftah."
G["And to think, one day you might be the one that the stories of legend are about!"]="想想吧，有一天你也许可以成为传说中故事的主人公！"
G["And to those who call for harmony among our ranks... to them I ask: \"Does not ALL strife please our masters?  Does not ALL bloodshed feed their thirst?\""]="Y a aquellos que predican la armonía entre nuestras filas... a ellos les pregunto: \"¿No es cierto que a nuestros amos les complacen todos tipo de conflictos? ¿No es cierto que TODO derramamiento de sangre calma su sed?\""
G["And to which battleground do you wish to journey?"]="你想要加入哪个战场？"
G["And to yours, brat."]="干，小鬼。"
G["And try not to get lost this time...."]="这次不要再迷路了……"
G["And ultimately, it was Ragnaros that named me when I was reborn as an acolyte of fire: Lathoric... Lathoric the Black."]="最终，是拉格纳罗斯在我重生的时候为我命名，我是火焰的侍奉者，黑衣拉索里克。"
G["And upon the dawn of the first day the Samophlange beheld what it had wrought, and lo, it was good."]="在第一天的黎明到来之时，主动式负载平衡器就看到了它所引发的一切，瞧瞧，多好。"
G["And we are not about to let that change."]="这决不会被改变。"
G["And we don't appreciate you refering to our friends as a 'ball and chain,' doc."]="Y no nos gusta que te dirijas a nuestros amigos como \"una bola y una cadena\", doc."
G["And we would not see those mistakes repeated. Return to your exile."]="我们不应该再次犯错。回到你的流亡族人中去吧。"
G["And we're going to dig them up."]="我们要把他们挖出来。"
G["And what are they telling you now, Fahrad? What do your dark masters whisper?"]="他们在和你说什么，法拉德？你的黑暗主人在低语着什么？"
G["And what are you? I've seen many things in my day but you are certainly a first. Has the turtle returned? I always thought that was a myth."]="你是什么东西？我这辈子见过不少稀奇事儿，可像你这样的人还是第一次见。那只乌龟回来了吗？我一直以为那只是个传说。"
G["And what depraved reason is that...?"]="你究竟有什么邪恶的目的……？"
G["And what do you say?"]="你说了什么？"
G["And what do your people want of Lantresor, $r?"]="那么你的人民想从兰特瑞索这里得到什么，$r？"
G["And what exactly do you think that you are going to do about it?  Your threats are hollow.  Go slink away with the rest of your kind to the slums, I will endure your filth in my throne room no longer."]="你觉得你到底能做什么？你的威胁是空洞的。和你的同类一起滚到贫民窟去吧，我已经无法容忍你这种渣滓继续留在我的王座旁边了。"
G["And what is it exactly that you think I can do for you?  Can't you see that I'm very busy here discussing matters of import with our illustrious leader?\n\nBe quick about your business or I'll have you beaten, dog!"]="你觉得我能为你做些什么吗？没看到我正在讨论关于我们杰出领袖的重要事情吗？\n\n有话快说！"
G["And what is this filth you've brought to our sanctuary?"]="你给我们的圣地带来了什么脏东西？"
G["And what possessed them to strike out against the red dragonflight? Madness. We must learn more!"]="他们到底是着了什么魔，竟敢和红龙军团作对？真是疯了。我们必须了解真相！"
G["And what then? Will you leave Deepholm to its denizens?"]="然后呢？你们就会安静地离开深岩之洲？"
G["And what's wrong with that? A woman enjoys turning heads now and again."]="难道这有什么问题吗？那个女人在不停地回头看我。"
G["And when tha time comes dat ya failure is complete and ya \"power\" is meaningless, I will be dere to end ya rule swiftly and silently."]="Y cuando llegue el momento de tu fracaso y tu \"poder\" no tenga senti'o, yo eh’taré ahí pa' terminar con tu liderazgo de forma eficiente y silenciosa."
G["And when the brew's all missin'\nTa Shadowforge we'll hop,\nA bitter toast ta Ragnaros...\n... but bring him not a drop!"]="Y cuando no quede cerveza\nsaltaremos a Forjatiniebla,\n¡brindaremos con una amarga por Ragnaros...\\pero no le daremos ni una gota!"
G["And when the soap's gone, you'd have a new axe!"]="当肥皂褪去的时候，你就会拥有一把崭新的斧头了！"
G["And when the soap's gone, you'd have a new fork!"]="肥皂消退的时候，你就拥有一把崭新的叉子了！"
G["And when they rose... they rose as warriors."]="而当他们起身时……他们已成为战士。"
G["And where did you come from I wonder? Some place that lacks for quality beverages? Hmm?"]="能告诉我你来自哪里吗？某个美酒欠奉的地方？嗯？"
G["And where is that?"]="他应该站哪儿？"
G["And wheresoever did you find the module to activate that controller?  No matter, you won't be doing that again."]="你是在什么地方找到激活控制器的模块的？不过无所谓，反正你没有机会再来捣乱了。"
G["And while Grom died a glorious death - freeing us all from the blood curse - he could not wipe away the terrible memory of our past."]="格罗姆付出了生命的代价，将我们从诅咒中解放出来，但他无法让我们忘记那段可怕的岁月。"
G["And while such things can never be forgotten, we must remain vigilant in our cause!"]="我们永远不会忘记这一幕，我们仍然需要保持警惕！"
G["And while we, as druids, are guardians of nature, I wonder if we've overlooked a key aspect of balance in all things."]="当我们这些德鲁伊全力守护自然的时候，我怀疑我们是否忽略了一把维持世界万物平衡的钥匙。"
G["And who are you to stop us?"]="你是谁，竟敢阻止我们？"
G["And who do we have here?  No doubt th... crzzzk ...ade this communication possible?  I give you greetings fro... psshzzzk... Azure Watch."]="情况怎么样？毫无疑问……嗞嗞……这通讯设备行不行啊？我代表……嗞嗞……碧蓝岗哨……问好。"
G["And who do you think you are? I'll use as large a weapon as I please!"]="别想吓唬我！我随便用多么大的武器都可以！"
G["And who forgot tae grab the ale on the way up? Not me! Hahahaha!"]="是谁在上来的时候忘记拿啤酒了？可不是我！哈哈哈哈！"
G["And who will save Azeroth from his hungering gaze? You? Your monkeys?"]="他的双眼中折射出欲望的光芒，谁能从他的凝视下拯救艾泽拉斯世界？你？就凭你？还有这些帮你打杂的猴子？"
G["And why is that, exactly?"]="那么请问这是为什么呢？"
G["And why would I speak with you, $r?"]="我为什么要和你说话，$r？"
G["And with AUTHORITY, $n dominates the magnataur lord! Stinkbeard's clan is gonna miss him back home in the Dragonblight!"]="$n以绝对优势战胜了猛犸人领主！龙骨荒野的猛犸人氏族会怀念恶臭之须的！"
G["And with his return came Alexstrasza and Ysera, to at long last offer their blessings upon Teldrassil."]="当他回归时，阿莱克丝塔萨和伊瑟拉也一同到来，并最终将他们的祝福赐予泰达希尔。"
G["And with that, I must depart.  Good luck with your training."]="那么，我得走了。祝你训练顺利。"
G["And with that, I shall return to my research."]="这样，我就能回到我的研究中去了。"
G["And with the powers of the South Wind, we will reclaim this city and seal it from those who would trespass upon our territory!"]="借助南风的力量，我们将夺回这座城市，让那些入侵我们国土的敌人再无法染指于它！"
G["And with them, I will crush the Golden Lotus and retake the vale in the name of the Thunder King!"]="而有了他们，我将以雷电之王的名义碾碎金莲教，夺回锦绣谷！"
G["And yes, Cho'gall might have founded the Twilight's Hammer, but who made it what it is today?  Who preached the truth and faced persecution in the orc and human cities?"]="是的，暮光之锤也许是古加尔建立的。但是谁让它有了今日的地位？是谁在兽人和人类的城市中成功地揭露了真相，散播了混乱？"
G["And yet we see only doom in your future. It is your destiny that you do this, $n, but we fear that the prophet is too powerful for you and your friends. Still, you must try."]="未来仍然笼罩着阴霾。$n，这是你的命运。虽然你和你的伙伴或许不是先知的对手，但是，你必须尝试。"
G["And you are certain that Granny Smith has left her apples in our stall all this time?"]="而你敢确定，那个史密斯奶奶一直把她的苹果放在我们的货摊上？"
G["And you are?"]="对了，你是……？"
G["And you call yourself a crafter, you son-of-a-gnome?"]="你还敢自称是技师，你这侏儒杂种？"
G["And you cling to caution as if it will save you. Did your caution save your brother?"]="而你却死抱着你的谨慎不放，好像它能救你似的。谨慎能救出你的兄弟吗？"
G["And you did..."]="你成功了……"
G["And you fleshling, consider for a moment that you are entirely surrounded by rock in this place.  The very earth you walk on bends to my will."]="至于你，血肉之躯。考虑一下你现在的处境吧。你的身躯被重重岩石所包围，你脚下的大地屈从于我的意志。"
G["And you have mine, Varian. Your words rang true in the throne room..."]="我也要多谢你，瓦里安。你在大厅上的话很有道理……"
G["And you know what pisses me off more than anything, Skrotee? No, not that we've been made into a living cuckoo clock for the amusement of the Forsaken. And not that we have to endure being spat upon and mocked every waking minute of our time here... What pisses me off the most is being made to wear these damned short-shorts..."]="你知道最让我厌烦的是什么吗，斯克罗提？虽然我们不得不定时报钟，供被遗忘者消遣；虽然我们必须时刻忍受他们的口水和讥笑……但是这些都比不上那些该死的超短裤……穿上这样的玩意儿真是令我抓狂！"
G["And you make beer out of it."]="而你用它酿酒。"
G["And you mentioned an imprisoned entity? What is the nature of this entity and what is its status?"]="被囚禁的实体？是什么实体？目前它处于什么样的状态？"
G["And you think you can just eat anything you want? You're obviously trying to eat the Broken of Telaar."]="你以为你可以想吃什么就吃什么吗？你肯定是想去吃塔拉的破碎者。"
G["And you two have shown quite the knack for growing delicious fruits and vegetables."]="而且你们两个还种出了美味的水果和蔬菜，展现出了过人的天赋。"
G["And you will be rewarded!  If you fall in battle, yours will be a virtuous death!  You will be at HIS side when he rises again!  You will share in HIS glory!"]="你将得到奖励！如果你在战场上倒下，你的死亡也将彪炳史册！当他再次在世间崛起的时候，你将站立在他身边！你将分享他的荣耀！"
G["And you will be rewarded!  If you fall in battle, yours will be a virtuous death!  You will be at his side when he rises!  You will share in his glory!"]="你将得到奖励！如果你在战场上倒下，你的死亡也将彪炳史册！当他再次在世间崛起的时候，你将站立在他身边！你将分享他的荣耀！"
G["And you wish for me to steal it. Why?"]="你想让我偷取它。为什么？"
G["And you would be?"]="你是……？"
G["And you yours, \"Warchief.\""]="Y tú el tuyo, \"Jefe de guerra\"."
G["And you're entrusted with keeping the city safe! How am I supposed to perform my \"simple task\" if the streets are thick with lowlifes? I can't spit in Shattrath without hitting some grubby burglar."]="¡Y a ti se te ha encomendado que la ciudad sea segura! ¿Cómo quieres que lleve a cabo mi \"simple tarea\" si las calles están llenas de indeseables? No puedo escupir en Shattrath sin que le caiga a algún mugriento ladrón."
G["And you, $n, I will spare your life. You have done much to help our cause, albeit unwittingly, but the next time we meet it will be as enemies."]="至于你，$n，我会饶你不死。你帮了我们不少忙——尽管是在不经意间，但下一次我们再见面时，就只能用武器说话了。"
G["And you, $r!"]="还有你，$r！"
G["And you, Jenny? I thought we had a connection. You've broken my heart for the last time."]="你呢，珍妮？我原以为在我们之间存在着某种联结。这是你最后一次伤我的心。"
G["And you, my dear friend, you've done a great thing for us this day."]="至于你，我亲爱的朋友，今天你可帮了我们一个大忙。"
G["And you, my dear worgen, you've done a great thing for us this day."]="还有你，我亲爱的狼人，今天你可帮了我们一个大忙。"
G["And you, my young student? Where will you go?"]="至于你，我年轻的徒儿，你将去往何处？"
G["And you, what's your interest in this? Let's have a word..."]="还有你，你干嘛要对这些事情有兴趣？让我们单独聊聊……"
G["And you, with your heroic features. My husband's shrine needs guardians of your... stature."]="而你，有着英勇的品质。我丈夫的神龛……正需要像你这样出色的守卫。"
G["And you.  You've interfered with my plans for the last time."]="还有你。你这是最后一次破坏我的计划。"
G["And you... are next!"]="而你……是下一个！"
G["And your daughter? You could have saved her... You could have offered her your blood, yet you did not. Why?"]="那你的女儿呢？你本可以救她……你本可以为她献出你的鲜血，可是你没有。为什么？"
G["And your hair looks wonderful."]="而且你的发型看起来很棒。"
G["And your own preparations? Will the Frost Lord have a path to the portal?"]="那么你们自己的准备做得怎么样了？冰霜之王会打开通往传送门的道路吗？"
G["And, armed with gnoll-forged weapons of indestructible copper, you murlocs will be unstoppable!"]="并且，装备上出自豺狼人之手、由无坚不摧黄铜所铸造的武器，你们这些鱼人定将势不可挡！"
G["And, for my next trick..."]="那么，我的下一个戏法……"
G["And, we're off!"]="我们要出发了！"
G["And... I'm OUTTA HERE!"]="我……得走了！"
G["And... Meatball."]="另一位是……肉弹！"
G["And... and I will protect Kiryn from danger."]="那……那我就来保护琪麟。"
G["And... do you expect to defeat the Primal Gods?"]="嗯……你想要打败狂野之神吗？"
G["And... done! A self-propelled saurok-slaying machine."]="啊……完成了！自行式蜥蜴人宰杀机。"
G["And... if we do not?"]="那么……如果我们不这样呢？"
G["And... the battle we lost. I... I'm sorry, Arator. It was my fault..."]="但是……我们输了那场战争。我……我很抱歉，阿拉托尔。是我的错……"
G["And...done! A self-propelled saurok slaying machine."]="啊……完成了！自行式蜥蜴人宰杀机。"
G["Andu-falah-dor!"]="¡Andu-falah-dor!"
G["Anduin Wrynn... a fitting reward for the trials we've endured! $p, come, speak with me."]="安度因·乌瑞恩……我们吃的苦终于得到回报了。 $p，过来，和我谈谈。"
G["Anduin went on ahead. That cheeky, light-spoutin', clod-brained fool!"]="安度因已经先走一步了。那个冒冒失失、莽撞性急的小笨蛋！"
G["Anduin!"]="安度因！"
G["Anduin, I know exactly what he's asking. Oh - look who's arrived."]="安度因，我知道他想要什么。噢，看看谁来了。"
G["Anduin, what were you thinking? I should've sent you back to Stormwind!"]="安度因，你到底在想什么？我真该把你送回暴风城！"
G["Anduin, why are we here?"]="安度因，我们来这里干什么？"
G["Anduin, will you join me? With the saurok threat at bay for now, it is time we discuss our next move."]="安度因，一起行动吗？蜥蜴人的威胁已经暂时解除，我们该讨论下一步行动了。"
G["Anduin, you know more than anyone, it's important to separate the Horde from its people."]="安度因，你比别人更清楚，应该将部落及其人民区别开来。"
G["Anduin..."]="安度因……"
G["Anduin... run..."]="安度因……快跑……"
G["Anduin... you're safe..."]="安度因！你还活着！"
G["Anger is a part of us all, yes. But we value control. The orcs were once driven solely by anger - they lived in a state of bloodlust - but they conquered it."]="没错，愤怒在我们周身流淌。可我们懂得控制。兽人曾被愤怒驱策——终日活在对鲜血的渴望中——但还是战胜了它。"
G["Anger. Hatred. Fear!! They are weapons of war - the tools of a Warchief!"]="愤怒、仇恨、恐惧！这是战争的武器——酋长的工具！"
G["Anger...hate... These are tools I can use."]="愤怒……仇恨……我可以利用的工具。"
G["Anglers"]="垂钓翁"
G["Angry, want kill gong plz."]="愤怒，渴望杀戮。"
G["Anguish Ale!  Cold Anguish Ale here!"]="痛苦啤酒！来买点冰镇的痛苦啤酒吧！"
G["Anguished water, stagnant and poisonous!"]="苦痛之水，流毒无穷！"
G["Angus, I'm here to lead the Wildhammer squad and drop off the SI:7 agents."]="安古斯，我来这里是为了领导蛮锤小队，空降军情七处的人员。"
G["Animators, bring this magma to life!"]="塑能者，为这些熔岩注入生命！"
G["Annalise... You're right. I-I can't do this. I must find another way."]="安娜利丝……你是对的。我……我办不到。我得另想办法。"
