G["Anveena I love you! Focus on my voice! Come back for me now! Only you can cleanse the Sunwell!"]="安薇娜，我爱你！仔细聆听我的声音！回到我的身边来！只有你才能净化太阳之井！"
G["Anveena is no mere mortal, $r. Those who recognize her true nature stop at nothing to possess her.\n\nShe once rescued me, and now I intend to return the favor."]="$r，安薇娜绝不是“普通”的凡人。那些家伙一旦感知到蕴藏在她体内的强大能量，就会不择手段地想要将她占为己有。\n\n安薇娜曾经救过我，现在是我报恩的时候了。"
G["Anveena's sacrifice has given us all a new hope for the future."]="安薇娜的牺牲为我们带来了新的希望。"
G["Anveena, you must awaken! This world needs you!"]="安薇娜，你必须觉醒过来！这个世界需要你！"
G["Any Ladies and Gentlemen present should LEAVE NOW...for only REAL MEN AND WOMEN will be able to handle the gory spectacle about to unfold! Introducing the first fighter, the warrior of the Wastewander, the Ayatollah of Kaja-Cola...THE GINORMUS!"]="在场的每一位绅士和小姐现在都可以离开了……因为只有真正的男女勇者才能面对这即将出现在你们眼前的血腥场面！让我们欢迎第一位斗士——废土战士——卡亚可乐教派的伟大象征……巨又霸！"
G["Any assistance getting the wounded back on their feet would be appreciated."]="不管你做什么，只要能够帮伤员重新站起来，我们都感激不尽。"
G["Any chance to fight against the Horde, especially orcs, is a good time if you ask me. You'll find plenty of battle in Warsong Gulch, that you will. Head on over to the Hall of Arms and speak with Lylandris. She'll set you on your way."]="任何与部落——特别是兽人——交战的机会都是不容错过的。你可以在战歌峡谷中得到充分的历练，到武器大厅去找莱兰迪斯谈一谈吧，她会送你去战歌峡谷的。"
G["Any friend of Anduin's is a friend of ours, $c. My father would not be here without him."]="安度因的朋友就是我们的朋友，$c。要不是他，我父亲也不可能站在这里。"
G["Any friend of SI:7 is a friend of mine. Wouldn't want to end up on the wrong side o' me own blade, now, would I?"]="任何军情七处的朋友也就是我的朋友。你大概不会想要站在我的刀锋所指的地方吧？"
G["Any friend of the Shado-Pan is a friend of mine."]="影踪派的朋友就是我的朋友。"
G["Any friend of the animals is a friend of mine.  The Hunter's Hall is what you seek.  It sits atop the Hunter Rise."]="动物的朋友就是我的朋友。你要找的猎人大厅就在猎人高地的顶部。"
G["Any hope for the future of our world has grown much bleaker."]="我们世界未来的希望，变得渺茫了。"
G["Any idea on how I could get him to answer some questions?"]="有什么办法能让他回答我的问题？"
G["Any idea where they're keeping Deathguard Schneider?"]="知道他们把亡灵卫兵斯克尼德关在哪儿了吗？"
G["Any intruders must be eliminated!"]="任何入侵者都必须被消灭！"
G["Any last words you impure mongrel?"]="你这肮脏的杂种，还有什么遗言吗？"
G["Any last words?"]="还有什么遗言吗？"
G["Any luck out there?"]="运气如何？"
G["Any luck out there? Just trying to hold a conversation with the freed slaves makes my head hurt.\n\nThey straddle the line in discord and rhyme."]="¿Has tenido suerte? El mero intento de mantener una conversación con los esclavos liberados hace que me duela la cabeza.\n\nEstán justo en la frontera entre la discordancia y la rima."
G["Any luck today?"]="今天运气如何？"
G["Any luck today?  You haven't brought any back yet."]="今天有收获吗？你还是什么都没带回来呢。"
G["Any luck tracking down that box in Tuurem?"]="找到图雷姆的那只箱子了吗？"
G["Any luck with Therazane?"]="找到塞拉赞恩了吗？"
G["Any luck, Samuel?"]="有什么收获吗，萨缪尔？"
G["Any luck?"]="怎么样？"
G["Any news from home, $c?"]="有什么家乡来的消息吗，$c？"
G["Any one else ready to feel the wrath of the Defias Brotherhood?"]="还有人想要挑战迪菲亚兄弟会吗？"
G["Any one of us would lay down our life to protect this land."]="我们任何人都甘愿放弃生命，以守护这片土地。"
G["Any questions you have about the Wardens can be answered on the field of battle."]="你关于守望者的一切疑问，都将在战场上找到答案。"
G["Any report from Lion's Landing, $c?"]="雄狮港有什么消息吗，$c？"
G["Any savage can win a war. The true hero aims not merely for victory on the battlefield, but to attain a lasting peace after the final arrow falls."]="任何野蛮人都可能赢得一场战斗。但真正的英雄所关注的并不是战场上的胜利，而是在最后一支羽箭落下之后去维系长久的和平。"
G["Any sign of the flagship down there?"]="下方有旗舰的线索吗？"
G["Any spare copper?"]="请施舍一点铜币吧？"
G["Any tamer worth their weight in gold comes prepared!"]="任何身价不菲的驯宠师都会有备而来！"
G["Any time any of you peons want to take a break, the graveyard is right over there."]="无论什么时候，你们这些苦工要是想休息的话，那边的坟地等着你们呢。"
G["Any time, neighbor. Any time."]="Cuando quieras, $gvecino:vecina;. Cuando quieras."
G["Any who yet doubt my strength are simply foolish."]="任何胆敢质疑我力量的人，都是蠢货。"
G["Any word from Mennu on the relief we requested?"]="门努对我们要求的援助有任何答复吗？"
G["Any worker who doesn't make his quota will be ingots before the day is out!"]="没有完成当日额定工作量的工人将被扔进熔炉！"
G["Anya Maulray at inn on upper ring of Trade Quarter."]="安雅·玛尔雷在贸易区上层的旅馆中。"
G["Anya!!  You're all right!"]="安娅！！你平安无事！"
G["Anybody out there?"]="外面有人吗？"
G["Anyhow, I turned around, took his blade, his life, his head, and his mount."]="我去那里转了一圈，拿回了他的剑，他的头，还有他的坐骑。"
G["Anyone have any questions?"]="还有谁对此有疑问吗？"
G["Anyone hear from my girl? Darcy?"]="谁有我女儿达希的消息？"
G["Anyone home?"]="有人在家吗？"
G["Anyone not already standing is dead. Bloodhilt has all the fighters he'll get.\nSo... I'm ravenous. Shall we go find something to eat?"]="Todo aquel que no esté ya en pie está muerto. Sangrastil tiene todos los efectivos posibles.\n\nBien... Me muero de hambre. ¿Buscamos algo de comer?"
G["Anyone see anything? What happened?"]="有没有人看到了什么？到底发生了什么事情？"
G["Anyone suspicious is to be taken down quickly. Get to your posts as quickly as possible!"]="任何可疑的人都要迅速拿下。各就各位！"
G["Anyone up for a barbeque?"]="有人想去野营烧烤吗？"
G["Anyone want to take a break?  Well too bad!  Get to work you oafs!"]="谁说要休息？想都别想！赶快去干活，你们这些蠢货！"
G["Anyone who can still fight, come wit' me!"]="还能继续战斗的人，跟我来！"
G["Anyone with such a talented green thumb needs to be a Tiller. I don't care what that hare-brained grandson of mine says! Haohan is wrong about Farmer Yoon. You have my vote, $n."]="任何在园艺方面显示出如此高超天赋的人，都理应成为阡陌客的成员。我才不在乎我那浮躁的孙子说什么！郝瀚对农夫老愚的看法是错的。我投你一票，$n。"
G["Anyone, ah, hear that? It's ah, it's ah, an impact tremor."]="有人，呃，听到了吗？那个，那个，那个震动。"
G["Anythin' for Vol'jin!"]="一切为了沃金！"
G["Anything could happen..."]="任何事情都可能发生……"
G["Anything else I can do?"]="我还能做些什么吗？"
G["Anything else I should know about the Earthen?"]="还有关于土灵的其它信息吗？"
G["Anything else you need help with before I go? Right, I thought not..."]="在我离开之前，你还需要什么帮助吗？好吧，我不认为……"
G["Anything else?"]="还有什么可说的吗？"
G["Anything for King Mekkatorque!"]="一切为了梅卡托克国王！"
G["Anything for you, $n!"]="没问题，$n！"
G["Anything new, Dusking?"]="有什么新消息吗，达斯金？"
G["Anything our zeppelins cannot haul must be brought in by ship and travel the length of Northrend to reach us."]="无法用地精飞艇运送的物资必须通过航运，横穿整个诺森德才能到我们这里。"
G["Anything outside of that circle around you will not be able to see you, but the illusion will fade if you attack or take damage.\n\nI suggest you remain hidden until I say otherwise, these demons are too powerful to face head on and in full force."]="Todo lo que esté fuera de ese círculo no podrá verte, pero la ilusión desaparecerá si atacas o recibes daño.\n\nTe aconsejo que permanezcas $goculto:oculta; a no ser que te diga lo contrario. Esos demonios son demasiado poderosos como para plantarles cara mediante la fuerza bruta."
G["Anytime now..."]="随时待命……"
G["Anytime, lass. Anytime."]="随时为你效劳。"
G["Anyway, Agent Connelly sent me word to bring ya to him in Kun-Lai Summit."]="不管怎样，特工康奈利托口信让我送你到昆莱山去见他。"
G["Anyway, I just came by to thank you for those cabbages. Couldn't have grown better myself!"]="不论如何，我只是来为那些卷心菜向你致谢。比我种的还要好！"
G["Anyway, I just came by to thank you for those carrots."]="不管怎样，我只是来为那些胡萝卜向你道谢。"
G["Anyway, I know right where the Prince is hidin', so I'll take ye right to 'im."]="不管怎样，我知道王子躲藏在哪里，我会把你送到他那儿去的。"
G["Anyway, I met that SI:7 agent that you brought back outta retirement."]="不管怎样，我遇到了那个退役的军情七处特工。"
G["Anyway, I saw some more pretty elves headin' north earlier. Lots of elves."]="不管怎样，我又看到许多漂亮的精灵往北边儿去了。很多很多精灵。"
G["Anyway, Tak-Tak hear a lot of stuff goin' on at the camp. I heard that your Warchief Garrosh was lookin' around the Vale o' Eternal Blossoms."]="不管怎样，泰克泰克在营地里听到了许多信息。我听说你的酋长加尔鲁什正在调查锦绣谷。"
G["Anyway, big elf leader, Lor'them-somethin'... he's real mad!"]="不管怎样，高个子精灵首领，那个洛瑟姆……什么的，他简直气疯了！"
G["Anyway, we needed to pump up lots of sand and oil for the machinery. The nearby pools proved to be perfect for that.\n\nSome of the sand even proved to have magical properties... can you say possibilities!? But that's a different tale.\n\nSo, we drained most of the water out and built the pumping station smack dab in the middle. Everything was going swimmingly until one day the main suction pipe got clogged."]="嗯……为了确保机场的正常运转，我们需要抽取大量的沙砾和石油。这附近的池塘恰好有丰富的储量。\n\n某些沙砾甚至具有魔法属性……你能想象其中的潜在利润吗！？好吧，我就不扯远了。\n\n于是我们抽走大部分池水，在池塘中央修筑了泵站。本来一切都进展得挺顺利的，直到有一天，主管道突然堵塞了。"
G["Anyway, we're almost to Binan Village. You mus' be doin' somethin' real ookin' important."]="不管怎样，我们就快到滨岸村了。我想你一定是在做一件非常重要的事情。"
G["Anyway, you goin' that way."]="不管怎样，你得做你该做的。"
G["Anyways, those crazy mogu using ikk juju."]="不管怎样，那些疯狂的魔古族会使用伊克魂能。"
G["Anywhere but here..."]="任何地方，除了这里…"
G["Apologies, $r, but only champions of Thunder Bluff may purchase what I have to offer."]="很抱歉，$r。只有雷霆崖的勇士才有资格从我这里购买物品。"
G["Apologize."]="道歉。"
G["Apothecaries! Give your life for the Crown!"]="药剂师们！把你们的生命献给皇冠药剂公司吧！"
G["Apothecary, may I have some more of your Dit Da Jow?"]="药剂师，能再给我来点跌打酒吗？"
G["Apparently a hozen found himself a crate of bombs and thinks he's a monk now."]="显然，一个猢狲找到了一箱炸弹，然后就认为自己是武僧了。"
G["Apparently my reputation with you people is hostile."]="显然我和你的人民是敌对的。"
G["Apparently you flubbed this batch of blight. What do you have to say for yourself?"]="你把这批样本完全搞砸了！你还有什么可辩解的？"
G["Applebough's fruit cart is usually in southwest Dalaran, near the Silver Enclave."]="苹果树的水果货车通常停在达拉然的西南部，就在银色领地附近。"
G["Apples, get yer fresh apples!"]="卖苹果！卖新鲜的苹果！"
G["Apply the Gordok war paint!"]="绘制戈多克战争之画！"
G["Appreciated, Lord Zhu.  Good luck in your hunt."]="非常感谢，祝掌门。祝你好运。"
G["Appreciated."]="非常感谢。"
G["Approach! Feel the power of the titans!"]="过来！感受泰坦的力量！"
G["Approach... your death awaits."]="靠近点儿……离死亡再近点儿。"
G["Approaching Stonetalon. Prepare for heavy resistance!"]="向石爪山脉进攻。做好准备，敌人可能会发动猛烈的抵抗！"
G["Approaching the Thandol Span, sir."]="接近萨多尔大桥，长官。"
G["Aquanos can hardly keep up!"]="阿夸诺斯要忙不过来了！"
G["Aquanos, stop sending the clothes so high! You didn't have to see the look on Aethas Sunreaver's face when he found his pants in the fountain!"]="阿夸诺斯，别把衣服扔那么高了！我知道你不用看艾萨斯·夺日者在喷泉找到自己裤子时的脸色！"
G["Ar'tor's lifeless body remains suspended in mid-air by demonic magic. They take from him, even in death..."]="阿托尔的尸体被恶魔的法术悬挂在半空中。即使他已经死去，恶魔也没有放过他。"
G["Arak-ha!"]="¡Arak-ha!"
G["Aran has been defeated? Yes... I can sense his grip has loosened - if only just a little. But just enough to allow me to do my job as the doorman! Would you like me transport you to the Guardian's Library, $n?"]="埃兰被打败了？啊……我能感觉到他的控制已经被解开了——虽然感觉很微弱。但是这足够让我继续履行看门人的工作了！你愿意被传送到守护者的图书馆吗，$n？"
G["Aranal, ledel! Their fate shall be yours!"]="Aranal ledel! 他们的命运归你们处置！"
G["Arathi Basin"]="阿拉希盆地"
G["Arathi Basin has been overrun by The Defilers.  Will you help us, $n?"]="阿拉希盆地被污染者侵占了。你会帮我们作战吗，$n？"
G["Arathi Basin place to take from soft humans.  Sir Malory Wheeler send you there."]="阿拉希盆地是从人类手中夺来的。玛洛维尔爵士会把你送到那儿的。"
G["Arathi Basin was once our home, and will be again with your aid!  Will you help us $c?"]="阿拉希盆地曾经是我们的家园，有了你的帮助，我们会收复失地的！你愿意帮助我们吗，$c？"
G["Araxes! Send help! I'm pinned down in the mines. I... I'm not sure where I am exactly but I had the presence of mind to drop tracers on the ground behind me."]="阿拉克塞！快来帮忙！我被困在矿洞里了。我……我不确定我到底在哪里，但我在来的路上放了追踪器。"
G["Araxes, come in... Are you there Araxes? Visibility is nil. Warp storms blocking us."]="阿拉克塞，呼叫……你在吗？阿拉克塞？可见度为零。扭曲风暴阻挡了我们的视线。"
G["Arcane Reforgers can modify the magical effects of a item; this magically complex process is known simply as reforging.\n\nThrough reforging, a secondary attribute of any piece of weaponry, armor, or jewelry may be reduced in order to add an additional secondary attribute. In this manner one may customize their equipment to best match their role and skills.\n\nFor example, if an item afforded you a bonus to strike your enemies but you'd rather it made you attack more quickly, an Arcane Reforger could, for a price, reforge the item to have less Hit but increase your Haste."]="奥术重铸师能更改一件物品的魔法效果，这种奇术就叫重铸。\n\n通过重铸，武器、防具或珠宝原有的某种次要属性将被移除，以为其添加新的次要属性。通过这种方式，使用者可以对其装备进行自定义，以更好地与其角色和技能相匹配。\n\n例如，如果某样物品可使你更准确地命中敌人，但你却更想获得更快的攻击速度，则可花费若干费用，通过奥术重铸师重铸这件物品，降低命中而提高急速。"
G["Arcane magic twists the boundaries of our world. It weakens the laws of this realm to allow the impossible to happen, if only for a moment."]="奥术魔法扭曲了我们世界的边界。它弱化了这个空间的自然定律，使原本不可能发生的事情变为了可能——就算只是在片刻。"
G["Arcanist Tybalin said you might be able to lend me a certain tabard."]="奥术师泰拜林说你会借我一件战袍。"
G["Arcanist Vandril, what are the Forsaken doing here?"]="奥术师范迪瑞尔，被遗忘者在这儿做什么？"
G["Arcanotron unit activated."]="奥能金刚单位已激活。"
G["Arcanotron unit shield systems online."]="奥能金刚单位防护系统已就绪。"
G["Arcanum? That sounds very familiar."]="秘药？听起来很耳熟呢。"
G["Arcanus, show them our endless power!"]="阿卡努斯，让他们见识下我们无尽的力量！"
G["Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm roused the druids and convinced the Circle of Ancients in Darkshore that it was time for our people to rebuild."]="大德鲁伊范达尔·鹿盔唤醒了德鲁伊，并说服黑海岸的古树议会，让他们相信现在正是吾族重建之时。"
G["Arch Geomancer, I am ready for the ritual."]="高阶地占师，我已为仪式做好了准备。"
G["Archaeology"]="考古学"
G["Archaeology is the search for fact. Not truth."]="考古学探究的是事实，而非真理。"
G["Archbishop Landgren must know! Aaaaaagggghhhh.....!"]="我要告诉大主教兰德雷！啊……"
G["Archdruid."]="大德鲁伊。"
G["Archers at the ready!  Hold your fire!"]="弓箭手准备！瞄准！"
G["Archers! Shoot down the airborne mantid!"]="弓箭手！把那些飞行螳螂妖射下来！"
G["Archers, attack!"]="弓箭手，放箭！"
G["Archers, attack! Make him burn!"]="弓箭手，放箭！让他燃烧起来！"
G["Archers, form ranks! On my mark!"]="弓箭手！就位！看我的标记……"
G["Archibald da master of da crossbow. He da weapon master of da Undercity, located in da War Quarter."]="阿基巴德是弩类武器的教师。他是幽暗城的武器大师，就在军事区。"
G["Archibald is da master of da crossbow. He da weapon master of da Undercity, located in da War Quarter."]="阿基巴德是弩类武器的教师。他是幽暗城的武器大师，就在军事区。"
G["Archibald is the master of the crossbow. He's the weapon master of the Undercity, located in the War Quarter."]="阿基巴德是用弩的大师。他是幽暗城的武器大师，就居住在军事区。"
G["Archibald who you look for.  He outside weapon merchant shop on inner ring of War Quarter."]="你要找的阿基巴德在战争区内环的武器商店外。"
G["Archimonde the Defiler."]="污染者阿克蒙德。"
G["Archimonde's use of the ered'ruin was brilliant. Their command of the dark energies is unparalleled."]="阿克蒙德聪明地利用了埃雷杜因。他们对黑暗能量的掌控无人能及。"
G["Archmage Alvareux once wrote a treatise exploring a fascinating theory.  He proposed the existence of an exact copy of Karazhan in a world other than our own and that both somehow shared the same space.\n\nHe went mad soon after.  A real pity."]="大法师奥瓦鲁克斯曾经写过一篇论文，探讨一个非常迷人的理论。他提出在另外一个世界有个原样复制的卡拉赞，而且两个卡拉赞之间由于某种未知原因共享着相同的空间。\n\n他不久以后就疯了。多遗憾啊。"
G["Archmage Modera is taking a straightforward strategy - defeat the mogu by force. I believe that with further research, we may be able to discover the mogu's weaknesses."]="大法师茉德拉采用了一种直截了当的策略——武力击败魔古族。我相信随着进一步的研究，我们或许就能发现魔古族的弱点。"
G["Archmage Pratt, an Arcane Reforger recently from Dalaran, is usually working with Lavinia Crowe, the local enchanter. They're both in the Apothecarium."]="奥术重铸师，大法师普拉特最近刚刚从达拉然来到这里，他通常和本地的附魔师拉文尼亚·克洛文一起工作。在炼金房里可以找到他们。"
G["Archmage Vargoth enstrusted me with his staff when he told me to flee from the blood elf attack on Violet Tower. I did as he told me, hoping to take refuge in the old draenei settlement of Arklon.\n\nThere was to be no respite. I had walked right into the leading edge of a Burning Legion force. The demons wrested the staff from me, but I managed to escape with my life.\n\nThough my master knows nothing of my failure, it still shames me."]="在血精灵攻打紫罗兰之塔时，大法师瓦格斯让我逃出了那里，并把他的法杖托付给了我。我按照他的指示前往阿尔科隆，希望能在那处古老的德莱尼人的殖民地避难。\n\n然而，那里情况反而更糟，我来到了燃烧军团力量的风口浪尖。恶魔们把法杖夺走了，不过幸运的是，我留住了性命。\n\n尽管老师还不知道我的失败，但这仍然让我觉得非常羞愧。"
G["Archmage Xylem does not bargain with the likes of you, ruffian. There shall be no payment!"]="大法师克希雷姆可不会跟你这种人讨价还价，恶棍！不给就是不给！"
G["Archmage Xylem? Where can I find this Archmage, Ergll?"]="大法师克希雷姆？厄格尔罗，我在哪里能找到这位大法师？"
G["Archonisus is no more. Alas, we are... we are too late...\n\nKil'jaeden is unleashed! The heroes of the world are now our only hope."]="埃库尼苏已经不复存在，但是，我们……太迟了……\n\n基尔加丹被释放了！我们唯一的希望只剩下这个世界的英雄们了！"
G["Arconus is close. I can feel him. Take the northwest passage. He should be just up and around the corner. Be ready to battle!"]="阿克努斯就在附近。我能感觉到他的气息。穿过西北面的那条小道。他应该就在那角落附近。准备战斗！"
G["Arctanus, I am ready to lead one of your freezing surgers into battle."]="阿克塔努斯，我已经准备好率领你的严寒狂潮进入战场。"
G["Arcurion begins to freeze Thrall in a block of ice."]="阿奎里恩开始将萨尔禁锢到冰块之中。"
G["Are YOU the one who interrupted my dinner? Well, are you?"]="你就是那个打扰我吃晚餐的家伙吗？是你吗？"
G["Are all men this slow at asking women out?"]="怎么所有的男人都不急着约女人出来？"
G["Are all you citypaws this impatient?"]="你们这些城里人都这么没耐心？"
G["Are deserts lush?"]="沙漠难道能生出绿草吗？"
G["Are slaves free?"]="奴隶怎可能获得自由？"
G["Are the Blasted Lands currently under attack?"]="诅咒之地现在遭到袭击了吗？"
G["Are the Burning Steppes currently under attack?"]="燃烧平原现在遭到袭击了吗？"
G["Are the Eastern Plaguelands currently under attack?"]="东瘟疫之地现在遭攻击了吗？"
G["Are the oceans filled with water?"]="海洋是不是充满了水？"
G["Are the others okay?"]="其他人还好吗？"
G["Are the preparations complete?"]="准备工作完成了吗？"
G["Are the refugees still gathering at Camp Una'fe?"]="难民们是不是还聚集在乌纳菲营地？"
G["Are the rumors true? Does he truly carry the Greatmother's bloodline?"]="传言是真的？他真的有盖亚安祖母的血统吗？"
G["Are the sha approaching?"]="煞魔逼近了？"
G["Are the sha going to come in here?"]="煞魔会冲进来吗？"
G["Are there Wyrmcult ahead?"]="拜龙教就在前面？"
G["Are there any areas you can think of that would be so untouched?"]="你认为还有这样一块处女地吗？"
G["Are there any more inns we can visit for treats?"]="还有其它的旅店可以捣乱的吗？"
G["Are there any other defenses?"]="还有其他防御吗？"
G["Are there any others who would dare to challenge the might of Valhalas?"]="还有谁想要在瓦哈拉斯一展实力？"
G["Are there any teeny tiny animals in need of my aid?\n\n<Mylune's eyes glisten at the thought.>\n\nI need to hug a bunny right now!"]="¿No hay ningún animalillo achuchable que necesite mi ayuda?\n\n<Los ojos de Mylune brillan de solo pensarlo.>¡Necesito abrazar un conejito ahora mismo!"
G["Are there any weaknesses we can exploit? Any holes in the naga defenses?"]="有没有什么弱点可供我们利用？纳迦的防御是否有什么漏洞？"
G["Are there more like you?"]="你还有同类吗？"
G["Are there other grummles coming?"]="还有其他土地精也来了吗？"
G["Are there rewards for helping brewmasters?"]="帮助酒仙有奖励吗？"
G["Are there tonks?"]="那些就是坦克吗？"
G["Are there very many of them, up there?"]="他们有很多人吗？"
G["Are these going to be enough to take out those pterrorwings?"]="这些足够消灭那些飞翼龙了吗？"
G["Are these guys Alliance or Horde?"]="这些家伙是联盟还是部落？"
G["Are these lands not beyond healing? They look pretty beat up."]="难道这片土地还有救吗？它们已经遭受了如此严重腐化与侵蚀。"
G["Are these serpent hatchlings suitable for pet battles?"]="这些翔龙幼龙可以参加宠物战斗吗？"
G["Are they all there?"]="他们都在这儿吗？"
G["Are they all... dead?"]="他们都……死了？"
G["Are they cowardly pigs, popo?"]="他们是胆小的猪？"
G["Are they gone yet?"]="他们走了吗？"
G["Are they..."]="他们还……"
G["Are those dock workers on break again?! I need those supplies!"]="这些码头工人又闹罢工了？！我需要那些补给物资！"
G["Are those ingredients chopped up and cooked?  What's the hold up?!"]="你把那些材料都切好并扔下锅了吗？你在磨蹭什么呢？！"
G["Are those refugees? What's going on over there? Do I hear fighting?"]="那些是难民吗？那边发生什么事了？我听见的是战斗的声音吗？"
G["Are those winter hyacinths? For me?"]="这些是冬水仙？给我的？"
G["Are we done yet?"]="挖够了没有啊？"
G["Are we finished yet?"]="事情到底有完没完啊？"
G["Are we going to hide in our mountain and let those swill-peddlers have their little shindig without us?!"]="难道我们就这样躲藏在深山里，任由那帮嗜酒的狂徒在拒绝邀请我们的情况下举办庆典？！"
G["Are we going to let those soft-skinned, tail-less cowards cut down our forest and kill our clan brothers?"]="难道我们要看着这些不长尾巴的软蛋砍伐我们的树林，杀害我们的同胞手足吗？"
G["Are we gonna let them make a bunch of monkeys out of us? NO!"]="难道我们要让那群猴子为所欲为吗？绝不！"
G["Are we gonna see a shark?"]="我们会看到鲨鱼吗？"
G["Are we just going to let $ghim:her; through?"]="¿Vamos a dejarle pasar y ya está?"
G["Are we not going to have more witnesses?"]="我们不需要再多找点儿见证人吗？"
G["Are we ready?"]="我们准备好了吗？"
G["Are we really finally going to Azshara? Is there a volcano there, too?"]="我们真的要去艾萨拉吗？那里是不是也有一座火山？"
G["Are we still alive?"]="我们还活着吗？"
G["Are we taking the scenic route?"]="我们走的是观光路线吗？"
G["Are we there yet?"]="还没到吗？"
G["Are we there, yeti?"]="我们到了吗，雪人？"
G["Are we under attack?"]="我们受到攻击了吗？"
G["Are ya sure, $g laddy : lassie;?  Once I trade ya, I ain't gonna trade it back."]="¿Estás $gseguro chico:segura chica;? Una vez que comerciemos, no la vas a recuperar."
G["Are ye really askin' me where the Blacksmith is?  Have ye not heard of The Great Forge!?  All our best blacksmiths gather there to craft their weapons and armor!  \nIt's dead smack in the middle of Ironforge, and that's where you'll find one of our most brilliant blacksmiths, Bengus Deepforge."]="¿De verdad me estás preguntando dónde está la herrería? ¿No has oído hablar de La Gran Fundición? ¡Nuestros mejores herreros se reúnen allí para crear sus armas y armaduras! \n\nEstá justo en el centro de Forjaz, allí encontrarás a uno de nuestros herreros más brillantes, Bengus Forjahonda."
G["Are ye sure that ye want to face the might of dragons?"]="你确定想要面对巨龙之力吗？"
G["Are ye sure, $g lad:lass;? Ye don't need another minute or two?"]="¿Estáis seguros? ¿No necesitáis unos minutos más?"
G["Are you Shao's friend? Is he still alive?"]="¿Eres $gel amigo:la amiga; de Shao? ¿Aún está vivo?"
G["Are you a $c?"]="¿Eres $gun:una; $c?"
G["Are you a fighter? Can you teach me how you fight?"]="¿Eres $gun:una; $gluchador:luchadora;? ¿Me puedes enseñar a luchar?"
G["Are you a grummle? Where's your backpack?"]="¿Eres $gun:una; grúmel? ¿Dónde está tu mochila?"
G["Are you a mogu?"]="你是魔古族吗？"
G["Are you a sprite?"]="你是胡子精吗？"
G["Are you a student of the medical sciences?"]="你是来学习医疗知识的吗？"
G["Are you a troll? Like from the storybooks?"]="你是巨魔吗？故事书里的那种？"
G["Are you a troll?! I heard trolls are evil."]="你是巨魔吗？！我听说巨魔都很邪恶。"
G["Are you a yaungol? I heard yaungol are bad."]="你是野牛人吗？我听说野牛人坏得很。"
G["Are you afraid of spiders? Some feel them crawling on their skin as they wander through the endless woods."]="你怕蜘蛛吗？据某些在这片无尽森林中往来的旅者说，他们老觉得身上有蜘蛛在爬。"
G["Are you afraid to fight?"]="你们是害怕战斗吧？"
G["Are you alone because puppy-men killed your parents too?"]="你也是因为狗狗人才变成孤儿了吗？"
G["Are you an adventurer? We don't hear about many adventures around here except the stories Tzu tells us."]="¿Eres $gun aventurero:una aventurera;? Por aquí no se escuchan muchas aventuras, aparte de las historias que nos cuenta Tzu."
G["Are you blind as well as insane?\n\nI am a ghost - a cruel reminder of a civilization that has long since ceased to exist - anchored to a land that I failed to protect.\n\nLong ago - ten-thousand years past - I was flesh and bone, just like you. I was prince of this land and a dragon rider, blessed by Ysera of the Dream."]="¿Estás $gciego:ciega; además de $gloco:loca;?\n\nSoy un fantasma - un cruel recuerdo de una civilización que hace mucho que dejó de existir – anclado a una tierra que no supe proteger.\n\nAntaño – hace diez mil años – era de carne y hueso, como tú. Era Príncipe de esta tierra y jinete de dragones, bendecido por Ysera del Sueño."
G["Are you blind youngling? Shayis is standing right outside."]="¿Estás $gciego:ciega;, joven? Shayis está ahí fuera."
G["Are you blind? They're right there. Kill them!"]="你瞎了吗？他们就在那儿。杀光他们！"
G["Are you certain of that, demon hunter? Are you certain your will is your own?"]="你确定，恶魔猎手？你确定自己拥有独立的意志？"
G["Are you certain you should be helping these mortals in their quest for the sword?"]="你确定你应该帮助那些凡人取得那把剑吗？"
G["Are you certain you want my help in the battle against Yogg-Saron?"]="¿Estás $gseguro:segura; de que quieres mi ayuda en la lucha contra Yogg-Saron?"
G["Are you certain you wish to start gaining experience again?"]="你确定想要再一次开始取得经验？"
G["Are you certain you wish to stop gaining experience?"]="你确定想要停止获取经验？"
G["Are you certain?\n\nThere is no turning back once I wipe the knowledge of the talents you have learned from your mind."]="¿Estás $gseguro:segura;?\n\nUna vez que haya eliminado el conocimiento de los talentos de tu mente, no habrá vuelta atrás."
G["Are you certain? The trainers would love to meet an experienced $r $c like you."]="¿Estás $gseguro:segura;? A los instructores les encantaría conocer a $gun:una; $r $c con experiencia como tú."
G["Are you certain? This is a dangerous place, and our initial researchers have not yet returned from their expedition. If we disable the dampening field, we will leave until the ruins are safely secured, and cannot reactivate the devices.\n\nI ask again: Are you certain?"]="你确定吗？这地方很危险，而且我们的首批研究人员都还没能安然返回。如果我们禁用了弱化力场，我们就要离开，直到遗迹被安全守住后才能回来，而且不能再次激活装置。\n\n我再问一次——你确定吗？"
G["Are you certain? You are filled with doubts and fears, young Prince."]="是吗？你心中充满了疑虑和恐惧，年轻的王子。"
G["Are you challenging me, $g brother:sister;?"]="¿Me estás retando, $ghermano:hermana;?"
G["Are you coming?"]="你要来吗？"
G["Are you crazy? They'll see you if you go flying around in there!"]="你疯了吗？如果你到处乱飞，会被他们发现的！"
G["Are you crazy? You're about to blow us sky high! I'll take care of this wreck once everything else is finished."]="你疯了吗？你差点把我们炸上天！等我搞定其他事情再来处理这堆残骸吧。"
G["Are you daft? Did you miss the BONY SKELETAL CREATURES littering the landscape on your way over here?\n\n<Rohan sighs.>\n\nIf you're the outdoor type, you'll find skeletal creatures all over both the Western and Eastern Plaguelands. Trust me, you can't miss 'em - they certainly won't miss you if they get the chance.\n\nIf you're a dungeon type, Stratholme and Scholomance are definitely the place to be for bone fragments."]="¿Eres $gtonto:tonta;? ¿Te has olvidado de las CRIATURAS ESQUELÉTICAS que ensombrecían el paisaje en tu camino hasta aquí?\n\n<Rohan suspira.>\n\nSi prefieres el aire libre, encontrarás criaturas esqueléticas por todas las Tierras de la Peste tanto del Este como del Oeste. Créeme, no puedes dejarlos escapar. Ellos no lo harán contigo si tienen la oportunidad.\n\nSi por el contrario prefieres las mazmorras, has de ir sin duda a Stratholme y Scholomance en busca de trozos de hueso."
G["Are you daft? Who else would I be talking about? Yes, the girl - Mistress Mar'alith. Anyhow, she was back and not in too good of a mood. That's when the demands started flowing."]="¿Eres $gtonto:tonta;? ¿De quién iba a estar hablando si no? Sí, la chica, la maestra Mar'alith. En cualquier caso, ella estaba de vuelta y no de muy buen humor. Y entonces comenzaron las exigencias."
G["Are you deaf? We aren't allowing anybody in the brewery right now."]="你聋了吗？我们现在不会让任何人进酒厂的。"
G["Are you deaf?! I'll be there when Captain Adams is flogging you for holding up the Alliance's advance!"]="你聋了吗？你这是在拖延联盟的军事行动，如果亚当斯上尉为此责罚你的话，我也脱不了干系！"
G["Are you dumb? I'm a freaking bear. Back off, punk. (Temp text)"]="你是哑巴吗？我可是一头反复无常的熊。后退，废物。"
G["Are you eating enough, $r? Please remember to take care of yourself."]="你吃饱了吗，$r？请记得要好好照顾自己。"
G["Are you enjoying Pilgrim's Bounty, $n?  Let me know if you need help finding anything."]="你感受到弥散在感恩节空气中的幸福了吗，$n？如果你需要帮助，可以来找我。"
G["Are you eyeing my cat?"]="你在看我的猫？"
G["Are you familiar with the War of the Ancients, $n? That is what we call the period of time 10,000 years ago, when the demons of the Burning Legion first breached the realm of Azeroth and attempted to devour this entire world as they have countless others. The ancient capital of Azshara, a city that once dominated this landscape, was ground zero for the invasion. The ancient wreckage you'll find scattered throughout the area stands in broken testament to the egotism of our forebears."]="你了解上古战争吗，$n？那是在万年以前发生的事情。那时，燃烧军团的恶魔第一次到达艾泽拉斯。他们打算将这个世界彻底吞噬，就如同他们吞噬无数个其它世界一样。在这次入侵中，这片土地曾经的心脏——艾萨拉的古老首都被夷为平地。你会在这一地区的各个角落找到古老的废墟遗迹，它们就是祖先曾经自负的证据。"
G["Are you familiar with the late dragon Rheastrasza? A little off, that one. She often lurked about the Badlands in the form of a mortal goblin.\n\nRheastrasza came up with a scheme to steal and purify a black dragon egg, severing its tie with the black dragonflight and the corrupted Earth Warder, Deathwing."]="你和已故的巨龙瑞亚丝塔萨熟悉吗？那家伙有点不正常。她经常以普通地精的形象在荒芜之地出没。\n\n瑞亚丝塔萨提出了窃取一颗黑龙蛋，并将之净化的计策，以切断它与黑龙军团，以及堕落的大地守护者，死亡之翼间的联系。"
G["Are you fascinated by the wonders of metallurgy? The artistry of smelting? The beauty of mixing metals and alloys?"]="你喜欢神奇的冶金技术、奥妙的熔炼技艺、优美的合金秘法吗？"
G["Are you finding everything well, $n?"]="一切都还顺利吗，$n？"
G["Are you finding everything you need at the Temple?"]="你在青龙寺里找到需要的东西了吗？"
G["Are you friends with Admiral Taylor? If so, then I must test your strength in battle later."]="你们是海军上将泰勒的朋友吗？如果是的话，我就要在稍后的战斗中试试你们的实力了。"
G["Are you from Kun-Lai?"]="你是从昆莱来的吗？"
G["Are you from beyond the wall?"]="你是来自长城的另一边吗？"
G["Are you from the Turtle?"]="你是从龟背上来的吗？"
G["Are you going in there? I'm not going back in there!"]="你要到那里去？我可不打算回去了！"
G["Are you going to be doing this for much longer?"]="你打算一直这样是吧？"
G["Are you going to find them? Can you really?"]="你要去找他们吗？你真的可以吗？"
G["Are you going to let an injured dwarf do all the work for you?"]="你难道要让一个受伤的矮人把一切都给你搞定么？"
G["Are you going to take me back to Valiance Keep?"]="你打算带我回无畏要塞吗？"
G["Are you going to try a sip of the water of youth?"]="你想尝尝青春之水吗？"
G["Are you gonna help?"]="你要帮忙吗？"
G["Are you having a good time during Brewfest, $c?"]="这个美酒节你是否过得畅快淋漓，$c？"
G["Are you here for a fight?"]="你是来挑战我的吗？"
G["Are you here for more training, $n?"]="你是到这儿来深造的吗，$n？"
G["Are you here for the Elder Crone, Magatha Grimtotem? They're holding her to the east."]="你们是来找巫婆长老玛加萨·恐怖图腾的吗？他们把她关在东边了。"
G["Are you here for the confessor's sermon? Good luck findin' a place to sit..."]="你是来听神官布道的吗？但愿你还能找到座位……"
G["Are you here for training?  Or are you just here to waste a warrior's time?"]="你是来接受训练，还是来浪费一个战士的时间的？"
G["Are you here to aid da Darkspear, $c?"]="你是来帮助暗矛部落的吗，$c？"
G["Are you here to celebrate Pilgrim's Bounty with us?"]="你来到这里是为了和我们一起庆祝感恩节吗？"
G["Are you here to enjoy the view?"]="你是来享受这里的美景的吗？"
G["Are you here to fight for us at Warsong Gulch?  Lok'tar Ogar $c!"]="你是来帮助我们在战歌峡谷作战的吗？为了部落，$c！"
G["Are you here to fight?"]="你是来习武的吗？"
G["Are you here to give me my break? It feels like I've been working forever!"]="你是来让我休息的吗？我好像已经连续工作几辈子了！"
G["Are you here to help Ironforge, or just gawk at me all day?"]="你是来帮助铁炉堡的吗，还是要整天看着我发呆？"
G["Are you here to help the Dragonmaw reclaim our freedom?\n\nSpeak with Zaela - she's coordinating our resistance!"]="你是来帮龙喉重获自由吗？\n\n去和扎伊拉谈谈——她在协调我们的反抗行动！"
G["Are you here to help the cause? Mount Hyjal burns!"]="你是来这里助战的吗？海加尔山必将燃起熊熊大火！"
G["Are you here to help with the delivery? Miran's just about ready."]="你是来帮助投递物品的吗？米兰就快准备好了。"
G["Are you here to help, $c? This valley serves as a natural chokepoint. If we can strangle this supply line, we buy our companions at the World Tree time to mount a counter-attack."]="你是来帮忙的吗，$c？这个山谷就是个天然的阻塞点。要是我们能扼住这条补给线，就能为我们在世界之树的同伴争取时间来发起反击。"
G["Are you here to help?"]="你是来帮忙的吗？"
G["Are you here to lead a tour or gawk at us?  Be gone."]="你是来带我们参观的还是来参观我们的啊？滚开。"
G["Are you here to lead the tour?"]="你是来带我参观的吗？"
G["Are you here to prove yourself to the Lich King as well?\n\nIt's kind of archaic, don't you think? Having to fight and survive?"]="你也想向巫妖王证明自己的实力吗？\n\n你不觉得这样的方式有点过时吗？非要争个你死我活吗？"
G["Are you here to relieve me? I'm certain it's almost time. Well, if you want to relieve me anyway, let me know. I could use a drink or three."]="你是来换班的吗？时间刚刚好呢。如果你愿意换班的话，我就能喝上两杯啦。"
G["Are you here to save us, $c?"]="你是来救我们的吗，$c？"
G["Are you here to see the Jade Serpent?"]="你是来看青龙的吗？"
G["Are you here to train in Archaeology?"]="你是来这儿学习考古的吗？"
G["Are you here to train, hunter?"]="¿Has venido para entrenar, $gcazador:cazadora;?"
G["Are you hiding in this cloud?"]="你藏在这团云里吗？"
G["Are you hungry?  I'm hungry.  I just can't stand the thought of cured ham steak from Thultash again.  If only we could get some of that succulent roasted quail!"]="你饿了吗？我饿了。我一想起索尔塔什的烤火腿就忍不住了。啊！要是再来一些味美多汁的烤鹌鹑……"
G["Are you hurt? Do you need something?"]="你受伤了吗？你需要什么吗？"
G["Are you insinuating that you sell devices which hold sway over others' minds? That is a very dangerous claim..."]="你是不是在暗示你出售的设备可以控制他人的心灵？那可是非常危险的……"
G["Are you insulting our citizens?"]="你是在侮辱我们的市民吗？"
G["Are you interested in bell and gong lore?  Not as many young ones are willing to take such a fascinating intellectual journey these days."]="你对钟和锣的知识有兴趣吗？这年头，像你这样乐意来一场神奇的知识之旅的年轻人可不多了。"
G["Are you interested in exploring one of these dungeons?"]="你有兴趣探索这些地下城中的一个吗？"
G["Are you interested in joining our caravan?  We're headed to Light's Hope Chapel."]="想要与我们同行吗？我们正要去圣光之愿礼拜堂。"
G["Are you interested in learning the intricacies of Jewelcrafting?"]="你对学习复杂的珠宝加工感兴趣吗？"
G["Are you interested in making some money?"]="对赚钱有兴趣吗？"
G["Are you joking?  I'm a Scryer, I always watch what I say.  More enemies than allies in this city, it seems."]="你在开玩笑吗？我是个占星者，我一直很注意我的言辞。看上去这个城市中的敌人比朋友多得多。"
G["Are you kidding me? Look at all this crap! There's like a million wires. I'm a three wire kind of guy..."]="你在开玩笑吗？看看这东西！它里面一定有上百万根线。对我来说，三根线就已经足够了……"
G["Are you kidding me? You must be kidding me! Either that or you think I'm a clown here to amuse you. Is that what you think? That I'm a clown? Huh, is it! You think I'm a clown don't you!"]="你是在开玩笑吧？你一定是在开玩笑！你认为我是个取悦于你的小丑，是吗？我是小丑？嗯，是的！你认为我是小丑，是吧！"
G["Are you leaving the camp?\nThe August Celestials have requested that we not push our forces any further into the island, so we're staying here to secure this landing point.\nWatch yourself out there. The enemy has taken an interest in this place, too. Their camp is on the other end of the beach, and well-guarded."]="¿Vas a salir del campamento?\n\nLos Augustos Celestiales nos han pedido que no despleguemos tropas en el interior de la isla, así que nos quedaremos aquí para asegurar el desembarco.\n\nTen cuidado ahí fuera. El enemigo también se interesa por este lugar. Han montado un campamento en el otro extremo de la playa, y está bien vigilado."
G["Are you lecturing me? You're what - two years old?"]="你是在对我说教吗？你才多大——两岁？"
G["Are you listening to me, turtle?"]="在听我讲话吗，缩头乌龟？"
G["Are you lookin' to hear a secret about where to fish?"]="想听听关于该去哪儿钓鱼的秘密吗？"
G["Are you looking at me? Yes, look at me. You should be looking at me. Are you? Looking at me? Good."]="你是在看我吗？很好，看着我，就该看着我。你还在看我吗？很好。"
G["Are you looking for reagents or poison supplies? If so, you've come to the right place!"]="你在找毒药和施法材料的供应商吗？如果是的话，那么你来对地方了！"
G["Are you looking for some food and drink? If so, then Mifan in summer's rest has a fantastic selection.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="你在寻找食物和饮料吗？如果是的话，夏之眠的米凡那儿有你要寻找的东西。\n\n我会在你的地图上标记这个位置。"
G["Are you looking for some food and drink? If so, then the Sway Dish Chef in the inn has exactly what you're looking for.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="你在寻找食物和饮料吗？如果是的话，客栈的晃碟大厨那儿有你要寻找的东西。\n\n我会在你的地图上标记这个位置。"
G["Are you lost? Most of the town's vendors are situated near the center of town."]="你迷路了吗？这里大部分的商人都居住在城镇中心。"
G["Are you mad? Do you know what manner of beast inhabit that place? The worst that can happen is that we'll have to scoop up your remains with a shovel. We've lost some good dwarves to those awful monsters.\n\nSo the answer is no. If you're bent on getting to the Searing Gorge, you'll have to find another way."]="¿Has perdido la cabeza? ¿Sabes qué clase de bestia vive en ese lugar? Lo peor que puede pasar es que tengamos que recoger tus restos con una pala. Hemos perdido a excelentes enanos en las garras de aquellos terribles monstruos.\n\nAsí que la respuesta es no. Si estás $gdecidido:decidida; a entrar en la Garganta de Fuego, tendrás que ir por otro camino."
G["Are you mad? Look around you, mortal. Do you not see that you stand upon sundered earth? Leave this place lest you suffer as my people and I have..."]="你疯了吗？看看你的周围，凡人。你没看到你正站在崩裂的大地上吗？离开这个地方，免得遭受我和我们的人民所遭受的痛苦……"
G["Are you making fun of me?"]="你在拿我寻开心么？"
G["Are you my pal, Danny?"]="你是我的朋友吗，丹尼？"
G["Are you my tour guide?"]="你是我的向导吗？"
G["Are you nearly recovered from the last time? Let's try again..."]="你是不是已经完全恢复了？我们再试一次……"
G["Are you new here?  Well, tell me what you're looking for then."]="¿Eres $gnuevo:nueva; por aquí? Bien, dime qué es lo que buscas."
G["Are you of beard-sprite?"]="你是胡子精吗？"
G["Are you often sent to gather things for people? I suppose a hero's work is never done."]="你经常替人找东西吗？我以为英雄的时间总是很宝贵呢。"
G["Are you okay?"]="你还好吗？"
G["Are you okay? I've come to take you back to Frosthold if you can stand."]="你还好吧？如果你能站起来的话，我会送你返回冰霜堡。"
G["Are you one of the good worgen, $g mister:ma'am;?  Did you see Cynthia hiding in the sheds outside?"]="你是那种好狼人吗，$g先生:女士;？你有没有见到藏在外面棚屋里的辛西娅？"
G["Are you part of the rescue team? Are we saved?"]="你是搜救队的成员吗？我们得救了吗？"
G["Are you perhaps confused, mortal? The metal end is for stabbing, not pricking! Sharpen it again!"]="你是不是没搞清楚？这把武器是用来捅人的，不是挠痒痒的！重新打磨！"
G["Are you piggies hungry? I have some food for you..."]="你饿了吗？我这儿有食物……"
G["Are you prepared for war, $r?"]="¿Estás $gpreparado:preparada; para la guerra, $r?"
G["Are you prepared to fight a valiant of the Argent Crusade?"]="你做好和银色北伐军勇士作战的准备了吗？"
G["Are you prepared, $n?"]="¿Estás $gpreparado:preparada;, $n?"
G["Are you prepared? The challenge begins on my mark!"]="你准备好了吗？听我的指令！"
G["Are you quicker than lightning?"]="你比闪电更快吗？"
G["Are you ready for battle, $c?"]="¿$gPreparado:Preparada; para la batalla, $c?"
G["Are you ready for me to start up the Thunder Forge?  Things could get a bit hairy."]="你做好帮我开启雷霆熔炉的准备了吗？这可能有点危险。"
G["Are you ready for the first challenge, then?"]="那么，你是否准备好了接受第一个挑战？"
G["Are you ready for your final test, $n?"]="¿Estás $glisto:lista; para la prueba final, $n?"
G["Are you ready for your first challenge, $c?"]="¿Estás $gpreparado:preparada; para tu primer reto, $c?"
G["Are you ready to accept the Master's gift? Will you be blessed by his loving wrath, or consumed by it like all of the others?"]="你准备好接受主人的馈赠了吗？你将被他慈爱的怒火庇佑，还是会像其他人那样被吞噬殆尽？"
G["Are you ready to be shrunkified? This may sting a little. And burn. The agony and convulsions will pass quickly, however."]="你准备好被缩小了吗？这也许有一点痛，还有一点烧灼感。不过疼痛和抽搐很快就会过去的。"
G["Are you ready to begin the assault and win back the Undercity for the Horde, $n?"]="¿Estás $gpreparado:preparada; para comenzar el asalto y recuperar Entrañas para la Horda, $n?"
G["Are you ready to begin the procedure?"]="¿Estás $glisto:lista; para comenzar el proceso?"
G["Are you ready to begin the trials?"]="¿Estás $gpreparado:preparada; para comenzar las pruebas?"
G["Are you ready to change the world, $n?"]="¿Estás $glisto:lista; para cambiar el mundo, $n?"
G["Are you ready to continue?"]="我们要继续前进了，准备好了吗？"
G["Are you ready to die, dragon?"]="准备好去死了吗，龙？"
G["Are you ready to display your martial prowess here, in the eye of The Tiger?"]="你做好在猛虎之眼展示武艺的准备了吗？"
G["Are you ready to do this, $n?"]="¿Estás $gpreparado:preparada; para esto, $n?"
G["Are you ready to do whatever must be done to protect Lordaeron?"]="¿Estás $gdispuesto:dispuesta; a hacer lo que haga falta para proteger Lordaeron?"
G["Are you ready to face Mal'Ganis with me?"]="¿Estás $gpreparado:preparada; para enfrentarte a Mal'Ganis junto a mí?"
G["Are you ready to face Nemesis? I hope you have your totem ready.\n\nLet me know when you want to summon him."]="你准备好面对涅墨西斯了吗？我希望你能善用你的图腾。\n\n当你需要召唤他的时候跟我说一声。"
G["Are you ready to face your next challenger?"]="¿Estás $glisto:lista; para enfrentarte a tu nuevo contendiente?"
G["Are you ready to fetch, boy?"]="你准备好了吗，孩子？"
G["Are you ready to fight for the Alliance, $c?"]="¿Estás $gpreparado:preparada; para luchar por la Alianza, $c?"
G["Are you ready to fight for the Horde, $c?"]="¿Estás $gpreparado:preparada; para luchar por la Horda, $c?"
G["Are you ready to fight the Stormpike Guard in Alterac Valley, $n?"]="¿Estás $glisto:lista; para luchar contra la Guardia Pico Tormenta en el Valle de Alterac, $n?"
G["Are you ready to fight, $c?"]="¿$gListo:Lista; para el combate, $c?"
G["Are you ready to go?"]="¿Estás $glisto:lista; para salir?"
G["Are you ready to go? I think we're just about done here..."]="¿Estás $glisto:lista; para partir? Creo que ya hemos acabado por aquí..."
G["Are you ready to hear the story of the Cipher of Damnation, $n?"]="¿Estás $glisto:lista; para escuchar la historia de la Clave de Condenación, $n?"
G["Are you ready to laugh!"]="你准备好开怀大笑了吗？"
G["Are you ready to leave Stranglethorn Vale?"]="¿Estás $glisto:lista; para abandonar Vega de Tuercespina?"
G["Are you ready to ride to Desolation Hold as my Vanguard, $n?\n\nGar'dul may try to give you the runaround. Let him know his judgement is coming."]="$n，你是否准备好了作为我的先锋赶赴凄凉要塞？\n\n加杜尔也许想要从你面前蒙混过去。要让他知道，他的审判已经到了。"
G["Are you ready to rock? Then head over to the World's End Tavern! The Tauren Chieftains start their show at the top of the hour."]="你准备好进行一场狂欢了吗？那么就去天涯旅店吧！牛头人酋长乐队将在整点之后的十分钟开始演出！"
G["Are you ready to train, warrior?"]="¿Estás $glisto:lista; para la instrucción, $gguerrero:guerrera;?"
G["Are you ready to try again?"]="你做好再试一次的准备了吗？"
G["Are you ready to witness history, wakener?"]="¿Estás $glisto:lista; para ser testigo de la historia, heraldo?"
G["Are you ready, $n?"]="¿Estás $glisto:lista;, $n?"
G["Are you ready, Mr. Floppy? Stay close to me and watch out for those wolves!"]="小毛球，准备好了吗？靠近我，小心这些狼！"
G["Are you ready?"]="准备好了吗？"
G["Are you ready? You will have to act quickly, $n. I do not know how long I can hold them all off for! Get the plans and get out!"]="准备好了么？你必须马上行动，$n。我不知道还能挡住他们多久！拿上计划，快走！"
G["Are you ready?! TIGER WIND!"]="你准备好了？！风从虎！"
G["Are you really as strong as the others say?"]="你真有别人说的那么强吗？"
G["Are you really called Fish? That's an unusual name."]="你真的叫玉儿吗？这个名字好特别。"
G["Are you really here to rescue me?  Great, lets go!"]="你真的是来救我的？太棒了，我们走！"
G["Are you really surprised? Is it hard to believe that the power of an Old God could reach even inside the Dream? It is true - Eranikus, Tyrant of the Dream, wages a battle against us all. The Nightmare follows in his wake of destruction."]="你真的很吃惊吗？是不是很难相信上古之神的力量居然能穿越翡翠梦境？这是真的——伊兰尼库斯，梦境之暴君，已经向我们发起挑战了。随他而来的，是毁灭的力量。"
G["Are you reporting for duty, $c? All of the war materiel for both the Horde and the Alliance is completed and being shipped to Silithus as we speak. It should all arrive in less than $2113w days. I hope that someone has found the different pieces of the Scepter of the Shifting Sands and put them all together."]="你是来这儿报到的吗，$c？部落和联盟所需的所有战争物资都已经收集完毕，如约运往希利苏斯了。货物在$2113w天内就会抵达。希望有人能找到流沙节杖的碎片，将它们组合到一起。"
G["Are you reporting for duty, $c? All of the war materiel for both the Horde and the Alliance is completed and being shipped to Silithus as we speak. It should all arrive in less than a day. I hope that someone has found the different pieces of the Scepter of the Shifting Sands and put them all together."]="你是来这儿报到的吗，$c？部落和联盟所需的所有战争物资都已经收集完毕，如约运往希利苏斯了。货物在1天内就会抵达。希望有人能找到流沙节杖的碎片，将它们组合到一起。"
G["Are you seeing all this stuff? This place is great!"]="你瞧见这些东西了吗？这地方真是太棒了！"
G["Are you seeing this, $p?"]="你在看这个吗，$p？"
G["Are you seeing what I'm seeing?!  Is that a boat?!"]="我该不会是眼花了吧？！那是一艘船？！"
G["Are you seeking ammunition or other supplies? I've also some extra food I gathered for Beibei, here, should you require any."]="你在寻找弹药或其他供给吗？我这里有些为贝贝收集的多余的食物，你应该也有需要的。"
G["Are you serious? He already killed me! What more could he want?"]="你开玩笑吧？他已经把我杀了！他还想要什么？"
G["Are you so blind that you would continue this war?"]="你眼瞎了吗，竟然要延续这场战斗？"
G["Are you so eager to die? I will be happy to accommodate you..."]="你这么想死吗？我很乐意满足你的愿望……"
G["Are you suggesting I provide you with people for Zul'jin's sacrifices?"]="你是在暗示我给祖尔金送去活人祭品吗？"
G["Are you sure Muradin? I just got you back after years of thinking you were dead. I do not want to lose you again."]="你是认真的吗，穆拉丁？这些年来，我一直以为你已经死了，现在好不容易才找到你，我不想再失去你。"
G["Are you sure that you are ready? If we do not have a group of your allies to aid us, we will surely fail."]="¿Seguro que estás $gpreparado:preparada;? Si no tenemos un grupo de tus aliados que nos ayude, perderemos."
G["Are you sure that you no longer want the Codex of Xerrath?"]="你确定不再想要克萨雷斯魔典了吗？"
G["Are you sure there is nothing more we can do Neeka?"]="真的没什么需要我们帮忙了吗，尼卡？"
G["Are you sure this is the right way? Maybe we should go this way instead..."]="你确定这条路正确吗？也许我们该走那条路……"
G["Are you sure you are ready for mounted combat?"]="你准备好骑乘作战了吗？"
G["Are you sure you are ready to fight a champion?"]="你做好与冠军作战的准备了吗？"
G["Are you sure you are ready to fight a valiant?"]="你做好和勇士战斗的准备了吗？"
G["Are you sure you are ready to fight me?"]="你做好与我交战的准备了吗？"
G["Are you sure you can't choose a side?"]="你真的没法选择其中一方吗？"
G["Are you sure you don't want first aid training?  If you use that machine, I may get a chance to practice my skills on you, $c."]="你确定不想进行急救训练？如果你真的用了那台机器，也许我能有机会在你身上实践一下我的技巧，$c。"
G["Are you sure you don't want to come with me?"]="你确定不想跟我一起去吗？"
G["Are you sure you don't want to keep wading in this gross water?"]="你终于不用再继续站在这恶心的水里了吗？"
G["Are you sure you know how to fly this thing? Feels a little wobbly."]="你真的懂得如何驾驭狮鹫吗？我怎么觉得有点晃悠悠的？"
G["Are you sure you want to change your phase?"]="你确定想要改变你所处的相位吗？"
G["Are you sure you want to give this hobo money?"]="你确定要给这流浪汉钱吗？"
G["Are you sure you want to pay to abandon your minion?"]="你确定想要付钱以放弃你的仆从？"
G["Are you sure you want to pay?"]="你确认想要支付？"
G["Are you sure you want to take the portal to Orgrimmar?"]="确定要传送到奥格瑞玛吗？"
G["Are you sure you want to take the portal to Stormwind?"]="确定要传送到暴风城吗？"
G["Are you sure you want to walk with Kil'ruk?"]="你确定要与克尔鲁克同行么？"
G["Are you sure you weren't followed here? I have a very bad feeling all of a sudden..."]="¿Estás $gseguro:segura; de que no te han seguido hasta aquí? Tengo un mal presentimiento de repente..."
G["Are you sure you would like to purchase Dual Specialization?"]="你确定要购买双天赋专精吗？"
G["Are you sure you're ready to head out?"]="你确定已经准备好出发了？"
G["Are you sure you're ready to join the Alliance?"]="¿Estás $gseguro:segura; de que estás $gpreparado:preparada; para unirte a la Alianza?"
G["Are you sure, $n? We must face the Scourge at full strength if we are to succeed. If you do not require more rest, we will begin."]="你能肯定吗，$n？要想战胜天灾军团，我们必须全力以赴。如果你休息得差不多了，我们就开始吧。"
G["Are you sure?"]="你确定吗？"
G["Are you surprised to see me here? Everyone needs clean laundry, and what better way to do it than with your own water elemental?\n\nSimply bring your laundry, pay a nominal fee, and before you know it, everything will be fresh and clean!"]="在这见到我吃惊吗？每个人都需要干净衣服，除了找你的水元素帮忙，还有更好的办法吗？\n\n只需把你的衣服拿来，象征性的付点钱，不知不觉中你的衣服又变得清爽、干净！"
G["Are you the $c, $n? I've heard so many stories about you, but never expected to meet you in person."]="¿Eres $gel:la; $c, $n? He oído muchas historias sobre ti, pero nunca me imaginé que te conocería en persona."
G["Are you the Earthshaper capable of creating Elementium?"]="你是能制造出源质的塑地者吗？"
G["Are you the agent that is following Connelly?"]="你就是那个跟着康奈利的探子？"
G["Are you the correspondent from the Gadgetzan Times? If you just follow me, I'll show you my experimental apparatus...\n\n<You tell the magus that you're not the reporter she's expecting.>\n\nOh, you're not? Well then, if you need reagents, find what you need and don't tarry. I'm expecting someone."]="¿Eres el corresponsal de la Voz de Gadgetzan? Si me sigues, te enseñaré mi nuevo invento...\n\n<Le dices a la maga que no eres el corresponsal que esperaba.> Está bien. Si necesitas componentes, búscalos. Rapidito. Estoy esperando a alguien."
G["Are you the mortal on which so much depends?"]="你就是那个能肩负重担的凡人吗？"
G["Are you the reinforcements? The night elves have been routed!"]="你是来增援的吗？"
G["Are you there, Mr. D?"]="你在吗，气泡先生！"
G["Are you there, Mr. P?"]="你在吗，水泡先生？"
G["Are you thinkin' what I'm thinkin', $n?"]="咱俩想到一块去了吗，$n？"
G["Are you trying to make me look bad? That's the only thing that you're good for today!"]="你想让我丢脸是吗？这就是你唯一的能耐！"
G["Are you trying to meet the real me?"]="你是想看看我的真面目吗？"
G["Are you two going to order anything?"]="你们俩要不要来点儿什么？"
G["Are you up to the challenge? I will not hold back."]="你们准备好了吗？我会全力以赴。"
G["Are you using the crystal to hide?  Is that it?  You should know that you cannot possibly mask such power!"]="你在用水晶隐藏自己吗？是不是？你应该知道这种力量不可能被掩盖！"
G["Are you with me, $n?"]="你会帮我吗，$n？"
G["Are you with the Neferset scum?  Did they send you to do their dirty work?  Speak!"]="你和那些尼斐塞特 杂碎是一伙的？是不是他们派你来干什么肮脏的勾当？快说！"
G["Are you working with the Shado-Pan? I can't believe they'd let an outsider help them!"]="你一直在为影踪派效命？我无法相信他们居然还让一个外人帮助他们！"
G["Are you... afraid?"]="你……怕了吗？"
G["Are you... frightened?"]="你……害怕了？"
G["Are you... here to save me?"]="你……是要救我吗？"
G["Are you?"]="你会怎么做呢？"
G["Are your thumbs turning green yet?\n\nMine look pretty much the same."]="你的拇指已经变绿了？\n\n我的看起来也差不多一样。"
G["Are your trophies shrinking, Pop? Or are you hunting smaller game?"]="你的战利品缩水了吗，爸爸？还是说你的狩猎规模变小了？"
G["Are... Are they dead? The assassins?"]="那……那些刺客死了吗？"
G["Are... are they all dead?"]="他们……他们全都死了？"
G["Area trigger works."]="El activador de área funciona."
G["Aren't the patterns beautiful? Each one speaks with its own voice."]="这些图案难道不漂亮吗？每一个都有自己的风格。"
G["Aren't the thunderbirds beautiful? Majestic. Terrifying.\n\nThey are more worthy of this land than any of us.\n\nThis is where I shall wait. When they are ready, they will take me."]="这些雷鸟不美吗？简直堪称壮丽。令人生畏。\n\n它们在这片土地上比我们任何人都要珍贵。\n\n我要在这里等着。等他们准备好，就会带我走了。"
G["Aren't they great? I'm their number one fan!"]="他们是不是很伟大？我是他们的头号粉丝！"
G["Aren't you $n? I'd heard you were dead."]="你是$n？我听说你已经死了啊。"
G["Aren't you a little short for your kind?"]="¿Acaso no eres un poco $gbajito:bajita; para los de tu especie?"
G["Aren't you a sight for sore eyes!\n\nThere's work to be done and not much time."]="真高兴见到你！\n\n要做的工作还有很多，我们的时间偏偏不多了。"
G["Aren't you a sorry sight!  I suppose you're a little better than yesterday's bunch.  Formations, now!  Report for duty!"]="瞧瞧你们这蓬头垢面的模样！我还以为你们会比昨天那批新兵好一点呢。列队！去报到！"
G["Aren't you feeling it right now?"]="你难道现在没有感觉到吗？"
G["Aren't you hungry? Thirsty? I can arrange for food and drink -- all you need to do is tell me what I want to know."]="你饿吗？渴吗？我可以帮你准备吃的和喝的——你所需要做的就是告诉我一些我想知道的情报。"
G["Aren't you just a sugar $Gdaddy:pie;?"]="Eres una auténtica monada."
G["Aren't you the least bit curious why the Barrens are suddenly in bloom, seemingly overnight?"]="贫瘠之地仿佛在一夜之间就变得林木茂盛，郁郁葱葱，难道你对此一点也不感到奇怪吗？"
G["Aren't you tricky? I have a few tricks of my own..."]="你们好像有两下子啊，那么就让你们看看我的招数吧……"
G["Aren't you worried about what's IN that?"]="你就不担心那东西里放了什么吗？"
