G["Arena Battlemasters"]="竞技场管理员"
G["Arf!"]="嗷！"
G["Arg!"]="啊！"
G["Arg! My archers should have stopped you! Sentinels! Now!"]="啊！我的弓箭手应该阻止你的！哨兵！进攻！"
G["Argent Dawn! We go to gather more aid!  Fight on, brothers and sisters.  And know that you will not long fight alone!"]="银色黎明！我们需要召集更多的援手！继续战斗，兄弟姐妹们！你们不是孤军奋战！"
G["Argghhhh!"]="啊啊！"
G["Argh!"]="啊！"
G["Argh!  I will shred your soul and grind it to dust!"]="啊！我要撕碎你的灵魂！"
G["Argh! What was that? It's not supposed to work like this!"]="啊！那是什么？它不应该像这样运作的！"
G["Argh! You're hopeless!"]="啊哈！你没戏了！"
G["Argh!! It stings!"]="啊！痛死了！"
G["Argh, I need help here!"]="啊，我需要帮助！"
G["Argh, I'm pinned! Watch yourselves!"]="我动不了了！你们小心！"
G["Argh, just now getting number 48. This is getting tough."]="啊，才到48。越来越困难了。"
G["Argh, the pain. Will it ever leave me?"]="啊，这无尽的痛苦何时才能不再困扰我？"
G["Argh. They told me those crystals would work properly!"]="唉唷。他们告诉我这些水晶可以完美运转！这帮奸商！"
G["Argh... The pain... The pain is almost as unbearable as the lashings I received in grammar school when I was but a child."]="啊……痛……差点就赶上我小时候在学校里受过的鞭刑了。"
G["Argh... please... take care... of Speedy!"]="啊啊……请照顾好……飞毛腿。"
