G["Argus is the resident blacksmith of Goldshire.  I'm sure he could teach you the Blacksmith's profession."]="铁匠阿古斯居住在闪金镇。我想他能教你如何做一名铁匠。"
G["Aright *hic*... Say, you look familiar *hic*. Have I ever told you about the time me and Windsor fought off thir, er... a thous... a million orcs?\n\nOh settle down friend, this is a good one!"]="好吧*嗝儿*……嗯，你看起来很眼熟*嗝儿*。我有跟你说过我和温德索尔一起跟，呃，一，一百万个兽人战斗的事儿吗？\n\n哦，坐下来吧，朋友，这个故事非常棒的！"
G["Aright, $r, just keep us safe from harm while we work. We'll pay you when we return."]="好吧，$r，你只需要在我们工作的时候保护我们不被伤害。等我们回去以后会付给你酬劳的。"
G["Aright, listen up! Form a circle around me and move out!"]="好吧，听好了！在我周围排成圆圈，然后出发！"
G["Arise and serve your eternal master!"]="复活吧，为你永恒的主人效劳！"
G["Arise from the earth, my brothers!"]="兄弟们，复活吧！"
G["Arise minions.  Do not let them pass."]="苏醒吧，奴仆们。拦住他们。"
G["Arise my, uh... what shall I call you? How about 'multi-bot'? Arise, my multi-bot!"]="起来吧，我的……我该叫你什么好呢？叫你“多功能机器人”怎么样？起来吧，我的多功能机器人！"
G["Arise, Melt!"]="现身吧，熔尸！"
G["Arise, Nalak! Protect our beloved emperor."]="来吧，纳拉克！保护陛下！"
