G["Arise, and exult in your pure form!"]="来吧，为纯粹的形态欢喜吧！"
G["Arise, brothers of the earth! Watch as Erathius destroys the mortals!"]="站起来吧，大地的兄弟们。伊拉修斯要消灭这群凡人！"
G["Arise, friend. We have no time to lick our wounds!"]="站起来，朋友们。没时间处理伤口！"
G["Arise, my champion!"]="复活吧，我的勇士！"
G["Arise, servants of fire, consume their flesh!"]="起来吧，烈焰的奴仆，吞噬敌人的血肉！"
G["Arise, soldiers of the iron crucible! The Maker's will be done!"]="觉醒吧，钢铁熔炉中的兵士！执行造物者的意志！"
G["Arm the cannons! Ready...aim...fire!"]="装弹！预备……瞄准……开火！"
G["Armand Cromwell always on dock in Magic Quarter.  Fish in green goo taste extra good.  You try."]="阿曼德·克伦威尔在魔法区的码头附近垂钓。试试去那儿找他。"
G["Armed and ready."]="武装完毕，随时待命。"
G["Armies of iron will smother the world!"]="钢铁的大军将令整个世界窒息！"
G["Armies of the Scourge, hear my call! The scarlet apocalypse has begun! Tear this land asunder and leave only death in your wake!"]="天灾军团，听我的号令！血色十字军的末日已经降临！攻占这片土地吧！"
G["Armies of the depths, wash over our enemies as a tide of death!"]="深渊的大军，化为死亡的狂潮，吞没我们的敌人！"
G["Arming"]="准备武器"
G["Arming the wards at the sanctum will help us secure it faster.  We don't want any Wretched getting in our way when we unleash a full scale attack on the Legion and Kael.\n\nWe are $3244w percent done with our goal."]="Armar los resguardos en el sagrario nos ayudará a asegurarlo antes. No queremos que ningún desdichado se interponga en nuestro camino cuando desatemos un ataque a gran escala contra la Legión y Kael.\n\nHemos completado el $3244w % de nuestro objetivo."
G["Armor"]="护甲"
G["Armor like the kind you make could stop even the sharpest axe. I'm impressed $n, that doesn't happen often. Seek out an Orc named Shayis Steelfury, she makes the best armor outside of that cursed Dwarven stronghold."]="你所锻造的护甲能够抵挡最锋利的刀刃。$n你给我留下了深刻的印象，这可不容易。去找一个名叫莎伊斯·钢怒的兽人吧，她是除了那些该死的矮人之外最好的铸甲匠。"
G["Armor unit malfunction. System offloading."]="防护块故障。正在卸载系统。"
G["Armor, weapons, whatever you may need, you will find at the supply depot behind me. Go now."]="盔甲、武器，你所需要的一切都能在我身后的供给站找到。现在，行动吧。"
G["Arms and armor repaired!"]="修理武器护甲了！"
G["Arms and legs are in short supply! Thanks for your contribution!"]="我们正缺胳膊和腿呢！感谢你们的大力援助！"
G["Arms ready!  Here they come!  HERE THEY COME!!!"]="准备武器！他们来了！他们来了！！"
G["Arnok makes good bandages.  Find him at the Survival of the Fittest hut on the shore of the lake next to Spirit Lodge in the Valley of Spirits.  It's above and to the west of the Valley of Strength."]="阿诺克能制作很好的绷带。他住在精神山谷灵魂归宿旁边的湖畔，就在适者生存小屋。沿着力量山谷向西走便可抵达。"
G["Around this reindeer's neck is a tag with the Smokywood Pastures logo on it and a name - \"Metzen\".\n\nMetzen looks at you with sad, forlorn eyes.  It is almost as if the reindeer has been immobilized by some unseen force."]="\"En el cuello de este reno se encuentra una marca con el logotipo de Pastos Bosquehumeante y un nombre: \"Metzen\"\n\nMetzen te mira con ojos de tristeza y desamparo. Parece como si algo, una fuerza oculta, hubiera inmovilizado al reno\"."
G["Arr!"]="啊！"
G["Arr!   There be nothin I like to see better than folks fightin to the death in the arena.   If you be here at the right time maybe you can be one of them!"]="啊！没有比看人们在竞技场中互相厮杀更好看的东西了。如果你来得是时候的话，那你也将是他们中的一员！"
G["Arr!  Get back here, ye swill-swallowin' swabbie!"]="啊！给我回来，你这喝泔水的小崽子！"
G["Arrggghhhhh!"]="啊啊啊啊！"
G["Arrggh, outsiders - this is not your realm!"]="啊，外来者——这不是你们的领地！"
G["Arrghhhhh!"]="啊！！！"
G["Arrite then! Follow me!"]="好吧！跟我走！"
G["Arrite! Fuses exposed! Now which one ta break? Red? Or blue...?"]="好了！看到导爆线了！该切断哪根呢？红色？还是蓝色……？"
G["Arrite, $r.\n\nEverything looks ta be in its proper place."]="好吧，$r。\n\n看起来一切都还不错。"
G["Arrite, here goes nuthin'!"]="好吧，只能这样了！"
G["Arrite, now... Let's see here."]="来吧……让我们瞧瞧。"
G["Arrite, troll. Down the hatch!"]="来吧，巨魔。喝下它！"
G["Arrogant little creatures, to challenge powers you do not yet understand."]="一群自大的低等生物。来挑战一下你们永远也无法理解的强大力量吧。"
G["Arrogant."]="獐头鼠目。"
G["Arrr, Ed! She definitely be seaworthy!"]="啊，艾德华！她看上去的确很适合航海啊！"
G["Arrr, Me Hearties!   I be havin' some extra Treasure that I be givin' away at the Gurubashi Arena!  All ye need do to collect it is open the chest I leave on the arena floor!"]="啊，我亲爱的朋友们！我在古拉巴什竞技场放了一些宝贝！你们要做的只是去竞技场中央，打开箱子，然后拿到里面的财宝！"
G["Arrrgh!"]="啊哈！"
G["Arrrgh! This isn't right!"]="啊啊啊！不对！"
G["Arrrrggggggggggh!!!!"]="啊啊啊！！！"
G["Arrrrggggghhh!"]="啊啊啊！！！"
G["Arrrrrrgh!"]="啊啊啊！"
G["Arrrrrrrrrrrr... wikkets!"]="杀啊……冲锋！"
G["Arthas and Muradin have been gone a long time. I hope they aren't in danger."]="阿尔萨斯殿下和穆拉丁殿下离开这里很长时间了。希望他们平安。"
G["Arthas clearly failed when he created his death knights.  You are still weak."]="阿尔萨斯在创造死亡骑士的时候就已经必败无疑了。你还很软弱。"
G["Arthas gave the order to cull Stratholme, killing every single human within its walls.\n\nHe discovered evidence that the Scourge had infected the city with their insidious plague, and the disease doesn't just kill people.\n\nThose who die to this plague rise up as mindless zombies, further fueling the Scourge's war machine."]="Arthas ordenó arrasar Stratholme, matando a todos los humanos que hubiera dentro de sus murallas.\n\nDescubrió pruebas de que la Plaga había infectado la ciudad con su insidiosa peste y la enfermedad no solo mata a la gente.\n\nLos que mueren debido a esta peste se vuelven a despertar convertidos en zombis descerebrados que alimentan la máquina de guerra de la Plaga."
G["Arthas is here? Maybe I..."]="阿尔萨斯在这里？也许我……"
G["Arthas is prepared to offer you power beyond your imagination.  The puny army you lead here would pale in comparison to the phalanxes at your command if you returned to the Scourge's embrace."]="阿尔萨斯准备赐予你力量，超乎你想象的力量。比起以后你将领导的天灾军团来说，眼下你手中的军队简直脆弱得可笑。"
G["Arthas once mustered strength... of the very same sort... perhaps his is the path that you will follow."]="阿尔萨斯也曾拥有……同样的力量……或许你应该沿着他的足迹追寻力量。"
G["Arthas save us - we're doomed!"]="阿尔萨斯救了我们——我们完了！"
G["Arthas shattered our forces and took the most powerful of us into his service as the San'layn."]="阿尔萨斯粉碎了我们，将我们最强大的战士变成他的爪牙，萨莱因。"
G["Arthas thinks a few of his undead bugs are going to send us running back to the Eastern Kingdoms... he's got another thing coming."]="阿尔萨斯以为他手下的几名亡灵渣滓就能将我们赶回东部王国……他会尝到后果的。"
G["Arthas was once a human prince.  The army he led into Northrend suffered a horrible fate.\n\nMy brother, Thassarian, was a part of that army."]="阿尔萨斯曾是万民敬仰的人类王子。他所率领的诺森德远征军遭遇了可怕的命运。\n\n我的哥哥萨萨里安就是军中的一员。"
G["Arthas! You are hopelessly outnumbered! Lay down Frostmourne and I will grant you a just death."]="阿尔萨斯！你已经孤立无援了！放下霜之哀伤，我会让你死个痛快。"
G["Arthas! You can't just--"]="阿尔萨斯！你怎么能……"
G["Arthas's weakness is his pride. That weakness only grows as his power does. The Ebon Blade will have its chance to strike at the once-prince - of that I have no doubt."]="阿尔萨斯的弱点就是骄傲。随着他的力量日益强大，这个弱点也越来越明显。我相信，黑锋骑士团一定能找到机会击败这位前王子。"
G["Arthas... I spit on Arthas."]="阿尔萨斯……我呸！"
G["Arthas... even saying his name makes my body quiver in rage."]="阿尔萨斯…单是说出他的名字就会让我的身体因愤怒而颤抖。"
G["Arthur Moore in Rogues' Quarter inner ring is one who teach leatherworking."]="盗贼区内环的亚瑟·摩尔能教你制革技能。"
G["Arthur Moore is the leatherworker. He tends the trainees over in the Rogues' Quarter, on the inner ring."]="亚瑟·摩尔是这里的皮匠。他在盗贼区的内环区域传授制皮技能。"
G["Artillery will scorch the ground, leaving nothing!"]="火炮会烧灼大地，什么都不会留下！"
G["Artists need to be reminded to eat once and a while."]="艺术家嘛，废寝忘食是常有的事。"
G["Artruis is shielded. You must choose your side quickly to break his spell."]="阿图里斯升起了护罩。你必须迅速打断他的法术。"
G["Arzule will have this land in the name of our master!"]="以我们主人之名，阿苏勒将占有这块大陆！"
G["As %s falls, the altar set into the floor on his balcony begins to glow faintly."]="当%s倒下时，平台上的祭坛开始发出微弱的光芒。"
G["As Anub'arak commands!"]="遵照阿努巴拉克的命令！"
G["As Azeroth has fought the legion and survived, you have faced the darkness within yourself and controlled it."]="艾泽拉斯击退了燃烧军团，你也战胜了你内心的黑暗并控制了它。"
G["As Druids, we are tasked with protecting the balance of nature. My life's work has gone against this. In my folly, I have sewn chaos, and this deviant crop must be reaped before it spreads further."]="作为德鲁伊，我们的任务就是维护自然的平衡。但我的努力却与此背道而驰。我的愚蠢造成极为巨大的混乱。必须在这种异常的作物进一步扩散之前将它收割。"
G["As I always say - Victory to the bold!"]="正如我所说——勇者无敌！"
G["As I am the strongest wind, it shall be I that tears the invaders apart!"]="我是最猛烈的风暴，撕碎入侵者的应该是我！"
G["As I expected. You are not yet skilled enough to defeat me."]="如我所料。你还没本事打败我。"
G["As I expected..."]="我就知道……"
G["As I live and breathe - an actual troll! You look just as the stories describe. You've taught the Hozen quite the lesson."]="天呐——一个活的巨魔！你跟故事里讲的完全一样。你已经狠狠教训过那些猢狲了。"
G["As I live and breathe! \"Little\" Arator? Is that you?"]="¡Por mi vida y mi aliento! ¿\"Pequeño\" Arator? ¿Eres tú?"
G["As I purify these waters, the servants of filth will surely be stirred. Beware!"]="在我净化这片水域时，那些污秽的仆从定会拼命阻挠我。小心！"
G["As I said, the cipher was found by Illidan when he took over the Black Temple. He divided the tome into three parts and charged their care to his minions.\n\nMy boys... My boys are grown now. When I got word of what Illidan had done with the cipher, I sent my boys to recover the pieces.\n\nYou must find my boys, $n. You must find them and recover the Cipher of Damnation."]="Como dije, Illidan encontró la clave cuando tomó el Templo Oscuro. Dividió el tomo en tres partes y se lo entregó a sus esbirros para que lo protegieran.\n\nMis hijos... Mis hijos han crecido. Cuando supe lo que había hecho Illidan con el código, les pedí que fuesen a recuperarlo.\n\nEncuéntralos, $n. Encuéntralos y recupera la Clave de Condenación."
G["As I said, we lost track of him, but this is something that I'm sure you will be able to figure out for me. My suspicion is that he's down there somewhere, but my spies that have returned haven't been able to place him anywhere on the island.\n\nThe Forsaken at Venomspite did a good job of sabotaging New Hearthglen, but the Onslaught forces that are present down there are the battle-hardened remnant from that place. Unfortunately, they picked up better equipment along the way, as well as gryphons taken from fools somewhere.\n\nWhat I'm trying to say is that this isn't going to be a stroll in the countryside, $n, even for you."]="Como he dicho, le perdimos el rastro, pero sin duda es algo de lo que podrás encargarte por mí. Sospecho que está ahí abajo, en alguna parte, pero los espías que han vuelto no han sido capaces de localizarlo en la isla.\n\nLos Renegados en Rencor Venenoso hicieron un buen trabajo saboteando la Nueva Vega del Amparo, pero las fuerzas del Embate que están presentes ahí abajo son los veteranos de ese lugar. Por desgracia han conseguido mejor equipo por el camino y unos grifos que les habrán quitado a algunos idiotas.\n\nLo que intento decir es que esto no va a ser un paseo por el campo, $n, ni siquiera para ti."
G["As I shall consume your flesh, so too shall the Burning Legion consume your people!"]="我要吞噬你的肉体！同样，燃烧军团也将毁灭你的族人！"
G["As I suspected. Thank you, Ogos. $p - I will meet you in the catacombs."]="跟我想的一样。谢谢你，奥戈斯。$p——我会到墓穴与你会合。"
G["As I understand it dear, everything has been gathered and the final materiel is being assembled and shipped off to Cenarion Hold. The last of it should arrive in less than $2113w days. Once our equipment and forces are all there, the bearer of the Scepter of the Shifting Sands can ring the gong near Ahn'Qiraj to open the gates. Then the war will begin."]="我听说所有的物资都已经收集完毕并且运往塞纳里奥要塞了。货物将在$2113w天内抵达。一旦我们的装备和军队准备就绪，流沙节杖的持有者就可以敲响安其拉附近的铜锣，打开大门。那时，战争也就开始了。"
G["As I understand it dear, everything has been gathered and the final materiel is being assembled and shipped off to Cenarion Hold. The last of it should arrive in less than a day. Once our equipment and forces are all there, the bearer of the Scepter of the Shifting Sands can ring the gong near Ahn'Qiraj to open the gates. Then the war will begin."]="我听说所有的物资都已经收集完毕并且运往塞纳里奥要塞了。货物将在1天内抵达。一旦我们的装备和军队准备就绪，流沙节杖的持有者就可以敲响安其拉附近的铜锣，打开大门。那时，战争也就开始了。"
G["As I warned you before, dragons are known for their deadly attacks."]="我早就警告过你，龙是以其致命的攻击而著称的。"
G["As I was saying, I held onto that scepter shard for a good five-hundred years and it was nothing but trouble. It attracted all kinds of attention - the wrong kind of attention. I want to be left alone to my studies not babysit some would be hero's ticket to glory. So... I gave it to the fish."]="正如我所说的，我保存节杖碎片已经有500年了，这东西真麻烦。所有生物都不怀好意地觊觎这块碎片。我希望能专心研究，不受打扰。因此……我把它扔给了一条鱼。"
G["As I was saying, what we saw out there defied explanation.\n\nMy people were nowhere to be found, but in their place was a veritable army of robots and androids going about their business!\n\nThe droids all looked like gnomes and they said that they'd been expecting us. In fact, in their own strange way, they acted like they knew us. We were surrounded and quickly taken to the top of the pumping station.\n\nThat's where we saw their leader and what he was doing to the surviving gnomes!"]="确实如此，那场面真是难以形容。\n\n泵站的工作人员都不见了踪影，取而代之的是一支名副其实的机器人大军！\n\n他们和侏儒的外形相似，还说什么一直在等我们呢。诡异的是，那些机器人好像真的认识我们。我们被包围了，接着就被拖到了泵站的顶层。\n\n在那里我们见到了他们的首领，并目睹了他对幸存的侏儒所做的坏事！"
G["As Quel'Serrar was forged by the dragons and given to the kaldorei, its twin, Quel'Delar, was given to my people."]="巨龙铸造出奎尔塞拉，送给了卡多雷；而将奎尔德拉，送给了我们。"
G["As Tharon'ja predicted!"]="正如萨隆亚所料！"
G["As Waterspeaker, I performed many rituals. There is one, though, that I have never performed - to purify mental corruption.\nIt is an ancient ritual, one which we have not needed since days of legend, when Shaohao walked Pandaria.\nI fear we need it now..."]="Como orador del agua, realicé muchos rituales. Sin embargo, hay uno que nunca he realizado: purificar la corrupción mental.\n\nEs un ritual ancestral que no hemos necesitado desde días legendarios, cuando Shaohao transitaba por Pandaria.\n\nMe temo que ahora lo necesitamos..."
G["As a culture we believe in letting nothing go to waste.  When we are forced to slay a creature we take what we can to make sure its sacrifice was not in vain.  \nIf you wish to learn the proper way to take the skin of a slain beast, then seek out Eladriel in the Craftsmen's Terrace."]="De acuerdo a nuestra cultura creemos que no puede desperdiciarse nada. Si nos vemos obligados a dar caza a una criatura, hacemos todo lo posible para que su sacrificio no sea en vano. \n\nSi deseas aprender el modo de quitarle la piel a una bestia a la que se ha dado muerte, busca a Eladriel en el Bancal del Artesano."
G["As a final act of revenge, Baron Geddon has made you a living bomb!  Move away from your allies!"]="作为复仇计划的最后一步，迦顿男爵把你变成了一枚活动炸弹！离你的同伴远一点儿！"
G["As a mage, you are one of a select group that can conjure a portal to transport you back to this very place.  I can teach you if you are ready."]="作为一个法师，你是极少数可以操纵传送门魔法来帮助你回到这里的$r之一。如果你准备好了，我现在就可以教你。"
G["As a mage, you are one of a select group that can conjure a portal to transport you back to this very place.  I can teach you if you are ready.\n\nAnd remember that you can always use the crystal behind me to teleport down to the ruins beneath Dalaran in Crystalsong Forest."]="Como mago, formas parte de un selecto grupo que puede invocar un portal para transportarte de vuelta a este lugar. Puedo enseñarte a hacerlo, si estas $gpreparado:preparada;.\n\nY recuerda que siempre puedes usar el cristal que se encuentra detrás de mí para teletransportarte a las ruinas que hay bajo Dalaran, en el Bosque Canto de Cristal."
G["As a matter of fact, I did. I was going to frame it and show it to the guys in Ironforge for a laugh, but you're welcome to it."]="实际上，我有。我正准备把它裱起来，以博得铁炉堡的那些家伙们一笑，但是你想要的话，就给你吧。"
G["As a matter of fact, I do want to make Hellfire Peninsula my home."]="事实上，我想让地狱火半岛成为我的家。"
G["As a member of the Argent Crusade, I've sworn an oath to set aside past grudges in the name of... gah - ungh...."]="作为银色北伐军的成员，我曾以……嗯……那什么……的名义起誓，绝不计较他人的言行过失……"
G["As a monk, your reflexes are among your greatest resources.  Often, the ability to think and move quickly can save your life."]="作为武僧，反应力就是你最可宝贵的资源之一。迅速思考和行动的能力，常常能助你转危为安。"
G["As a race, we Forsaken are unable to procreate."]="作为一个种族，我们被遗忘者没有繁衍后代的能力。"
G["As a relative newcomer to Ogri'la, you don't have enough exposure to the crystals here to reap their full benefits.  Besides, you only have one head.\n\nWe, on the other hand, have been here a very long time.  So, as you can imagine, we're fairly well-versed in a great many things.\n\nOf late, we've taken a keen interest in the demons of the forge camps.  More specifically, we've devised a way to rid us of them for good.\n\nAt least, that's the theory."]="你刚来奥格瑞拉不久，这些水晶簇的好处你还没有完全体会到呢。何况，你只有一个脑袋。\n\n而我们就不同了。我们在这里住了很长一段时间了。因此，你可以想象我们聪明的头脑精通多少事情。\n\n最近，我们对铸魔营地的恶魔挺感兴趣的。具体来说，我们设计出了一个彻底摆脱他们的好办法。\n\n至少，理论上是那样。"
G["As a representative of the Consortium, I am always mindful of the ramifications that my interactions have upon our business dealings.\n\nIt is unfortunate that the blood elves do not treat their partnerships with such respect."]="作为星界财团的代表，我一直留意生意伙伴与我们的关系。\n\n不幸的是，血精灵并没有给他们的伙伴以足够的尊重。"
G["As a representative of the Lower City, I'm here to put forward our case that Auchindoun must be cleared of its Shadow Council infestation.  That is, if we're to have any hope for a future and stave off the possibility of a cataclysm greater than the creation of the Bone Wastes!\n\nAll of our peoples have suffered too much already.  I am here to see to it that the suffering stops!"]="作为贫民窟的代表，我要在此提出我们的建议，那就是：必须扫清在奥金顿横行的暗影议会成员。这关系到我们是否能在未来阻止他们再次创造一个新的白骨荒野，制造一次更大的灾难！\n\n我们的人民已经承受了太多的痛苦。我在这里盼望着那些痛苦立刻停止！"
G["As a reward for his years of service, Illidan allowed Kael'thas to send him five warriors to train under him.  It would be the first time blood elves would be allowed to train as demon hunters.\n\nThe training was brutal.  Illidan put Kael's warriors through trials that would defeat most fully capable demon hunters.\n\nThree of Kael's elves died in training - another went mad.\n\nOne succeeded."]="作为多年效忠的奖励，伊利丹允许凯尔萨斯将五名战士送到他那里进行特训。这应该是有史以来第一次有血精灵被允许参与恶魔猎手的训练。\n\n训练是严酷的，凯尔萨斯的战士所经受的考验足以难倒大部分的训练有素的恶魔猎手。\n\n三个凯尔萨斯的血精灵在训练中死去——另一个疯了。\n\n只有一个成功了。"
G["As a reward, I will allow you to live."]="作为回报，我会饶你一命。"
G["As a shortfang, I must wait until the stronger saurok have had their share of meat."]="作为一个短牙种，我必须等更强壮的蜥蜴人先享用完他们的肉食。"
G["As a stranger to these lands, you may not be familiar with the Shado-Pan."]="作为刚刚抵达这片土地的陌生人，你也许还不熟悉影踪派。"
G["As a tax-paying subject, I have a right to visit the city!"]="作为一名纳税公民，我有权利访问这座城市！"
G["As a young night elf in Darkshore, I crossed paths with a group of unsavory individuals known as the Twilight's Hammer. A group of them befriended me and shamefully, I ended up eschewing my faith in Elune and embracing the vitriol of the Twilight's Hammer.\n\nIt was not until a vision came to me from Elune, that I woke up from the malaise that I had fallen into as a follower of the old gods.\n\nIn repentance, I began work on my prayer to Elune."]="Cuando era un joven elfo de la noche en Costa Oscura, me crucé con un grupo de individuos desagradables conocidos como el Martillo Crepuscular. Unos cuantos de ellos entablaron amistad conmigo y, vergonzosamente, terminé perdiendo la fe en Elune y abrazando el rencor del Martillo Crepuscular.\n\nNo fue sino hasta que tuve una visión procedente de Elune, que desperté del malestar en que había caído como seguidor de dioses antiguos.\n\nArrepentido, empecé a rezar invocando a Elune."
G["As acting Taskmaster of this here compound, it is my duty to make sure that there is a certain level of tedium involved with all forms of business, work, rest, and relaxation that may take place here.\n\nIf you find anything that you are asked to do to be too easy and hassle free, report to me immediately."]="作为驻扎在这里的工头，我的职责就是确保在这里所进行的所有事情，从工作到休息和放松都包含着一定的令人厌烦的成分。\n\n如果你发现某件你被要求去做的事情过于简单或者没有什么好抱怨的话，请立即向我报告。"
G["As before, defeat each wave of illusions before time runs out. This time, you will encounter more difficult illusions."]="和以前一样，请在时间用尽前击败所有的幻影。但这次，你所面对的幻影将更强大。"
G["As custodians of time, we watch over and care for Nozdormu's realm. The master is away at the moment, which means that attempts are being made to dramatically alter time. The master never meddles in the affairs of mortals but instead corrects the alterations made to time by others. He is reactionary in this regard."]="作为时间的管理者，我们看管和照顾着诺兹多姆的领地。主人目前不在这里，这就意味着他正在尝试着剧烈地改变时间进程。主人向来不理会凡人的闲事，除了纠正其他人对时间的改变。他是非常反对这种行为的。"
G["As da Warchief commands..."]="如酋长所愿……"
G["As dark as things seem, I must not give up hope. We must not be cowed by the violence of the Yaungol.\nYou... have you come to help us?"]="Aunque la situación parezca nefasta, no debo abandonar la esperanza. No debemos dejar que la violencia de los yaungol nos acobarde.\n\n¿Has... has venido a ayudarnos?"
G["As deadly as the silithid seem, they are but tame creatures compared to their Qiraji overlords."]="异种虫看起来已经够可怕的了，可是和它们的其拉主人比起来，它们可以算是温顺的了。"
G["As disciples of blood, you strive to master the very lifeforce of your enemies."]="作为鲜血学徒，你们必须懂得如何掌控敌人的生命。"
G["As do ours. Do you not see the number of our injured? Do you forget how many have been taken prisoner?"]="可我们也一样。难道你忘记我们有多少伤员吗？多少人成了俘虏吗？"
G["As each rune bursts, a bolt of fire will travel to one or more nearby runes, triggering it to be one of the next runes to burst."]="每个爆炸的符文都会射出一股火焰箭，击中附近的一个或多个符文，使其成为下一批爆炸的符文。"
G["As expected, the Horde has completed all of their preparations well in advance of you and your so-called Alliance. You are all holding us up as we cannot take final measures to begin the war until you finish your promised responsibilities.\n\nNow go and pull your weight, $r."]="不出所料，部落比你们这帮所谓的联盟提前完成了收集任务。只有等你们集齐物资，我们才能进行最后的装运工作，是你们拖累了我们。\n\n现在，快去做好你的本职工作吧，$R。"
G["As expected."]="早有预料。"
G["As expected.  Very well, dismissed."]="正如我预期的那样。非常好，解散。"
G["As fodder for the swarm, perhaps!"]="或许，可以成为虫群的食物！"
G["As for YOU, little $c."]="Y en cuanto a TI, $gpequeño:pequeña; $c."
G["As for not endangering the sigils during this process, I can analyze each watcher's status and make that information available to you upon completion of calculations."]="为了在这一过程中不对徽记造成损伤，我可以分析每位守护者的状态，并根据计算结果给出具体建议。"
G["As for the rest of you grunts, suit up! We got some killin' to do."]="其余的步兵立刻整装出发！我们要战斗了。"
G["As for the rest of you, seek me if you dare. Like the others, you will all die screaming."]="至于你们其余的人，如果有胆量就来找我吧。和其他人一样，你们都将惨叫着死去。"
G["As for the smell... *Balinda sniffs at the air* I think it's coming from over there..."]="这股气味……*巴琳达用力抽抽鼻子*，我想它应该是从那里来的……"
G["As for you..."]="至于你……"
G["As for your life, mortal.  I will be generous.  After all... why would I destroy my most useful servant?  I waited for you for weeks inside that Hyldnir mine."]="凡人，我会考虑饶恕你的性命的。毕竟……我为什么要杀掉最得力的仆从啊？我在海德尼尔矿洞里等了你好几周呢。"
G["As good as I told you it would be, yes?"]="和我告诉你的一样棒，是吗？"
G["As if I ain't got enough on me hands, those dwarves at the mines've gotten all crazy recently about some new drink called kafa.\n\nThey're insistin' I bring 'em fresh cups o' kafa every mornin'!\n\nDo they know wot I 'ave ta do to get those kafa beans? Honestly!"]="好像嫌我手头的麻烦事儿还不够多似的，那帮矿洞里的矮人最近迷上了一种叫咔啡的新饮料。\n\n他们一定要让我每天早上给他们带去新鲜的咔啡！\n\n他们知道我应该上哪儿去弄那些咔啡豆吗？行行好吧！"
G["As if I could forget. Listen, Uther, there's something about the plague you should know..."]="我自然不会忘记这一点。听着，乌瑟尔，现在我来告诉你关于天灾的事……"
G["As if I don't have better things to do in my old age than carry buckets of water."]="我这么多年来好像都没干过比打水更有意义的事情似的！"
G["As if I had all eternity."]="好像我已经获得永生一样。"
G["As if I'm going to listen to anyone dressed up in that outfit!"]="穿成这个德行还想让我听你的？"
G["As if in a daze, Salandria moves toward whatever it is she is sensing."]="萨兰蒂亚似乎很迷惑，缓缓地走到了这个给她带来奇妙感觉的东西前。"
G["As if we don't have enough problems, you go and create more!"]="难道我们的麻烦还不够多吗？你还要火上浇油？！"
G["As if you weaklings pose any threat to us. We will devour you."]="好像你们这些脆弱的家伙真能对我们造成威胁似的。看我们生吞活剥了你！"
G["As is his will.  It is our sworn duty to see you confined, and he sees it done."]="这便是他的意愿。我们的职责就是将你封印，而他会见证这一切。"
G["As it is, there are barely enough of us to keep them from taking everything."]="我们的人数严重不足，很难抵挡他们的侵掠。"
G["As it should be."]="本该如此。"
G["As it should be...."]="本该如此……"
G["As it was written!"]="正如预言所说！"
G["As long as I stand, this temple will never fall."]="只要我还没倒下，寺院就不会陷落。"
G["As long as he remains unfound, I will search. I know that he lives. And I know that I must find him. I am thankful for what you have done, Commander. As my father called upon you, a brother in arms, know that you may call upon me. I am at your service, my Lord."]="只要他还没有被找到，我就会继续寻找。我知道他还活着，我知道我必须找到他。谢谢您所做的一切，长官。因为我父亲曾与您并肩作战，您也同样可以随时命令我上阵厮杀。我随时为您效劳，大人。"
G["As long as the sha stay outside, I'll be fine."]="只要煞魔还待在外面，我就不会有事。"
G["As long as those dwarves stay over there we'll have no trouble.  Where are you heading $n?"]="只要那些矮人一直待在那里，我们就不会有麻烦。你现在要去哪里，$n？"
G["As long as we stay above the war, then there's hope for the world as a whole."]="如果我们穷兵黩武，整个世界的希望就将破灭。"
G["As long as we're going with a new plan, I may as well pick up a weapon and some armor."]="在我们出发之前，我最好装备一些武器和护甲。"
G["As long as you've got my back..."]="只要有你在背后支援……"
G["As masters of blood, we are masters of life and death itself.  Against us, even hope falls drained and lifeless."]="鲜血大师掌控着生命与死亡。胆敢与我们为敌的家伙，会被抽干所有的能量，沦为毫无生气的死尸。"
G["As masters of blood, we know battle without end..."]="对鲜血大师来说，战斗是永无止境的……"
G["As members of the Horde, we must contribute to our community to ensure that it continues to thrive. Thus, I am certain you will gladly aid us by undertaking a small task I have for you."]="作为部落的成员，我们必须为我们的社会做出贡献，以保证它的繁荣兴旺。因此，我相信你会很高兴能帮助我们完成一项小小的任务。"
G["As mistweavers, we must always protect those in need."]="作为织雾者，我们必须始终为需要帮助的人提供保护。"
G["As most of you know, we're about to begin another intensive round of demolitions testing."]="就像你们所知道的那样，我们就要开始下一轮密集毁坏测试了。"
G["As much as I expected from a troll."]="不出我所料。"
G["As my emperor wills!"]="谨遵陛下旨意！"
G["As my lovely companion may have already enlightened you, we are in pursuit of something mysterious and powerful. All of our clues point to the Masters' Gate.\n\nUnfortunately, the nihilistic cultists known as the Twilight's Hammer have prevented our attempts to research the area. Surely a $c with your reputation can assist the Reliquary in its time of need?"]="Como te habrá contado mi encantadora compañera, buscamos algo misterioso y poderoso. Todas nuestras pistas apuntan a la Puerta de los Maestros.\n\nPor desgracia, los cultores nihilistas que conocemos como el Martillo Crepuscular han rechazado nuestros intentos de registrar la zona. ¿Seguro que $gun:una; $c de tu reputación puede ayudar al Relicario en esta hora de necesidad?"
G["As my master once said, \"You cannot truly know someone until you fight them.\""]="Como decía mi maestro: \"No conoces de verdad a alguien hasta que has luchado contra él\"."
G["As my most recent gift to the lowly inhabitants of Azeroth, the evil Zul'jin is no more!"]="艾泽拉斯世界的凡人们，接受我的赐福吧！邪恶的祖尔金已经死啦！"
G["As nice as Gadgetzan is compared to Un'Goro, I have some good folks counting on us to bring them some supplies.  If you're ready to go, then so are Dadanga and I.  Let's mount up!"]="虽然加基森跟安戈洛相比还不错，我有些伙计还指望我们给他们带来些补给。如果你准备好出发了，那达丹加和我也是。我们上马吧！"
G["As often as I can.  It's great exercise and it keeps me informed on what they're up to--which, from my experience, is always no good."]="我一有空就会这么做。感觉非常不错，同时也能让我把握他们的心思——照我的经验来说，通常没什么好事。"
G["As one of the greatest of the Highborne, he will succeed where others have failed."]="作为上层精灵中最强大的一员，他绝不会像别人那样惨遭失败。"
G["As representatives of the Explorers' League, Bronwyn and I are here at the Alliance's behest to study these mountains.\n\nBut between you and me, after an extended stay in Silithus, we just needed a vacation.  This seems like a nice enough spot."]="作为探险者协会的代表，布隆薇和我按照联盟的要求来调查这些山脉。\n\n不过我们之间有个秘密，在希利苏斯进行了长时间的逗留后，我们需要度假。这里看上去是个不错的地方。"
G["As resident doctor, I am compelled to warn the rest of you that fire can be hazardous to your health."]="作为住院医师，我必须警告你们这些剩下的人，火焰对你们的健康有害。"
G["As soon as I awakened, the Klaxxi sensed my presence and relayed as much as they dared.\n\nThey confirmed my own suspicions. The Empress is no longer fit to rule the empire. She must be... cleansed."]="我一苏醒，卡拉克西就感觉到了我的存在，把敢于透露的一切都告诉了我。\n\n他们证实了我的怀疑。女皇果然不再适合统治帝国。她必须被……荡除。"
G["As soon as I... can get up, I'm going to crush you!"]="等我……站起来，我就揍扁你！"
G["As soon as all of our reinforcements arrive, we will begin pushing further south."]="一旦援军全部就位，我们就继续向南推进。"
G["As soon as we have some news we will let you know."]="一旦有消息，我们会即刻通知你。"
G["As soon as you stop yapping..."]="别唠叨了，动手吧……"
G["As such, knowledge is my armor, and I carry a quill in place of a sword."]="也可以说，知识是我的护甲，羽毛笔就是我的利剑。"
G["As the Legion's final defeat draws ever-nearer, stand proud in the knowledge that you have saved worlds without number from the flame."]="燃烧军团彻底灭亡的日子又更近了一步，你们再一次将这个世界从火焰中拯救下来，你们应当为此而自豪！"
G["As the Light wills."]="以圣光之名。"
G["As the Molten Colossus weakens, a single ominous word rumbles through the air like rolling thunder: \"BURN\""]="Mientras el coloso fundido se debilita, una única y ominosa palabra resuena en el aire como un trueno: \"ARDE\""
G["As the combined Horde and Alliance forces began their assault upon the Wrath Gate, an uprising broke out in the Undercity. Varimathras and hordes of his demonic brethren attacked. Hundreds of my people were slain in the coup. I barely managed to escape with my life."]="自从联盟和部落进军天谴之门以来，幽暗城就发生了暴乱。瓦里玛萨斯和他的恶魔同党叛变了，残忍地杀害了数百名无辜的平民。我是好不容易才逃出来的。"
G["As the empire grew, the mogu began to experiment with the secrets of the Vale. They crafted terrible weapons of living flesh and stone. And my people were afraid."]="帝国羽翼渐丰，魔古族窥探谷中的秘密，进行实验。他们用活人的血肉和石头造出了可怕的武器。我的族人惶恐不已。"
G["As the great explosion filled the region, my father cast a rune at the great hammer that it might not be had by our enemies. It was his final act..."]="大爆炸来临时，我的父亲对锤子施放了符文，绝不能让它落入敌人之手。这是他做的最后一件事……"
G["As the hammer lands, more rust shakes free from the Iron Watcher's frame and its pace quickens."]="钢铁观察者一锤砸下，身上的铁锈纷纷散落，它的步伐也越来越快了。"
G["As the last remnants of the %s seep into the ground, the altar set into the floor nearby begins to glow faintly."]="随着%s最后的残骸渗入地下，附近的祭坛开始散发出微弱的光芒。"
G["As the leader of the Sunreavers, it is with great pride that I present $n as the new bearer of Quel'Delar!"]="¡Como líder de los Atracasol, es un honor para mí presentar a $n como $gnuevo portador:nueva portadora; de Quel'Delar!"
G["As the naaru approached him, Voren'thal kneeled before him and uttered the following words: \"I've seen you in a vision, naaru. My race's only hope for survival lies with you. My followers and I are here to serve you.\""]="当纳鲁走近他时，沃雷塔尔跪在他的面前，说道：“我在我的梦境里看到过您，纳鲁。您是我的族群唯一的生存希望。我和我的部下愿意为您效劳。”"
G["As the name suggests, it can be found near ruins. Loreth'Aran holds the answer.\n\nActually, the name doesn't really suggest that -- I was just trying to be clever in naming the fungi."]="顾名思义，你可以在洛雷萨兰废墟周围找到这东西。\n\n确切地说，这名字其实是我起的……很棒吧。"
G["As the neutralizing agent mixes into the waters of the lake, the water that was irradiated by the crystal seems to clear."]="随着中和剂与湖水混合起来，被水晶映射的湖面开始变得清澈了。"
G["As the only apparent surviving 'Broken', it is both my duty and honor to carry on the shamanistic teachings of Farseer Nobundo."]="作为唯一幸存的破碎者，将预言者努波顿的萨满教义传播下去是我的荣幸和职责。"
G["As the regiment of blood elves crossed this very bridge, the Aldor's exarchs and vindicators lined up to defend the Terrace of Light.  But then the unexpected happened."]="当时一大群血精灵跨过了这座桥，奥尔多的主教和守备官们筑起了人墙，保卫圣光广场。就在这时，意想不到的事情发生了。"
G["As the tale goes, Zao battled furiously... shooting his arrows high into the sky, until only one sun remained."]="如传说所言，赵勇猛抗争……朝天空射出箭矢，直到只剩下一个太阳。"
G["As the tale goes, the yaungol was traveling across the Kun'lai plains when suddenly he was ambushed by two strange creatures!"]="相传，那野牛人正在穿越昆莱平原，突然遭到两个奇怪生物的伏击！"
G["As the toxins lurking within Maraudon seeped into my mind, I began to lose my grip on reality. Worried that it would be used for evil, my dryad sisters secretly took the scepter from me, breaking it into two parts and hiding it within the caverns.\n\nSoon they fell victim to the madness as well, and the two parts of the scepter, left unguarded, came to be in the possession of Vyletongue, himself. The satyr entrusted one part to Noxxion, an evil elemental, and the other he still has to this day."]="潜伏在玛拉顿的毒素开始渗入我的头脑，我逐渐丧失对事实的判断力。我的树妖姐妹们担心我会被恶魔利用，她们悄悄地拿走了我的节杖，将节杖断成两截，藏在洞穴中。\n\n很快，她们也丧失了理智，两段节杖也因无人看守，成了维利塔恩的囊中之物。那个萨特将一截节杖交给邪恶的元素诺克赛恩看管，另一截则由他自己保管至今。"
G["As the wardens of time, we of the bronze dragonflight observe their infinite combinations."]="作为时光守护者，我们青铜龙军团一直在观察它们无尽的组合。"
G["As the waters foretold."]="水流早有预言。"
G["As the wind on the plains, you are always welcome here."]="Al igual que el viento de las llanuras, siempre eres $gbienvenido:bienvenida; aquí."
G["As to your warning - worry not. Our troops are all aware of the chain of command. We fight united. Let us hope your own troops remember that..."]="至于你的提醒……不要担心。我们的部队都已经明确了指挥关系。我们会并肩作战。希望你自己的部队也记得这一点……"
G["As tough as you were, you were always soft in my arms."]="不论你有多坚强，你在我的臂弯中却始终软弱。"
G["As trying as these times are, we must control our emotions, lest they be used by the Sha."]="在眼下这般黑暗的时期，我们必须控制好自己的情绪，以免被煞利用。"
G["As was fated a lifetime ago in Karazhan, monster - I come - and with me I bring justice."]="就像很久以前在卡拉赞注定的那样，怪物。我来了，带着公正的裁决而来！"
G["As water cracks stone, so shall we be your undoing."]="就像水滴能令石穿，我们也将成为你的终结者。"
G["As we attempt to gain the help of the peoples of this world against the Burning Legion, we must also learn to live peaceably amongst them.\n\nPlease keep this in mind as your journey takes you throughout Azeroth.  May the Light guide you."]="我们试着取得这个世界的人民的认同和帮助来抵抗燃烧军团，因此我们必须同样学会和他们和平相处。\n\n当你游历整个艾泽拉斯的时候，请铭记这一点。让圣光指引你吧。"
G["As we were making our way across the Burning Steppes, we were ambushed. It must have been a hundred of them... Dark Iron dwarves! They were shifting out of the walls, from the rocks in the Steppes; out of every crevice, nook, and cranny in sight. They swarmed us, overwhelming the guards and the few brave heroes that had agreed to assist us on this mission.\n\nOne thing was clear: This was a highly orchestrated ambush. It was as if they knew every move we would make before we made them..."]="在我们穿越燃烧平原时遭到了敌人的伏击，有上百个黑铁矮人！他们从城墙内、平原上的岩石后面、还有岩石的裂缝中突然出现。他们包围了我们，很快就解决了那些答应帮助我们完成任务的英雄和守卫。\n\n很明显：这是一次早有预谋的伏击。他们似乎知道我们的每一步计划……"
G["As will we all."]="我们都会如此。"
G["As would I! The presence of the Timeless Isle is proof that many things are possible beyond the boundaries of linear thinking."]="我也是！永恒岛的存在证明许多原本被视为疯狂的设想是完全有可能实现的。"
G["As you all know, first prize is a Turbo-Charged Flying Machine. Anyone want to see second prize?"]="如你们所知，头等奖是一架涡轮加速飞行器。有人想知道二等奖是什么吗？"
G["As you all well know, the path of our people has not been an enviable one. Blood elf and draenei alike have been tested."]="就像你们都熟知的那样，我们人民所走的道路并不是一帆风顺。血精灵和德莱尼人都同样经历了试炼。"
G["As you approach the console the access crystal you have with you begins to hum softly and pulse with light.\n\nA rush of information flows into your mind and all of a sudden you're aware of the manaforge's energy production levels, its stability and its output to different pipelines.  The console awaits your command."]="当你靠近控制器时，你带着的那块控制水晶开始慢慢地发出蜂鸣，光芒在水晶上面跳动。\n\n突然在你的脑海里浮现出了法力熔炉的各种能量生产标准，它的稳定性和它到不同管道的输出量。控制器正等待着你的命令。"
G["As you approach the contract board, you rub your eyes for a moment, staring at the board in awe. Most of the requests on this board require you to perform acts that, even just thinking about could make a hardened criminal's stomach turn. You are, however, able to find a few \"normal\" requests..."]="Al acercarte al tablero de contratos, te frotas los ojos durante un momento, mirando el tablero con asombro. La mayoría de las solicitudes en este tablero requieren que realices actos que, incluso solo pensándolos, podrían hacer que hasta un criminal curtido se le revolviera el estómago. Sin embargo, eres capaz de encontrar algunas \"solicitudes normales\"..."
G["As you approach the crystal, you can feel its potent energy. Some nearby sprites glare dubiously in your direction."]="当靠近水晶时，你感受到了其中潜在的能量。附近的一些幽灵怀疑地向你看了过来。"
G["As you can see, I am but one man with a lumbering oaf of a squire. The might of the Dark Iron dwarves and the beasts held in the grip of Ragnaros would surely overwhelm me alone, but I have the utmost confidence that such a brave and ambitious adventurer such as you would have no problem handling the denizens of the cauldron. Should you choose to assist me, I shall reward you with riches and wealth beyond your wildest dreams."]="正如你所见的一样，我只不过是单枪匹马。黑铁矮人和拉格纳罗斯的爪牙可以轻松把我摆平，但是我对于像你这样勇敢的冒险者充满了信心，你一定可以把大熔炉里的那些东西全部搞定的。如果你愿意帮助我，我会给予你丰富的奖励，那些奖励将是你做梦也想不到的。"
G["As you can see, I have but little after these savages got hold of me, but you're welcome to what I have. Come, have a look."]="你也看到啦，被这帮野蛮人洗劫后我身上也没多少值钱货了。但是我愿意与你分享我仅有的一切。来瞧瞧吧。"
G["As you can see, this is a defective yak. Go ahead, $r. Try to pet it."]="正如你所见，这并不是一头完美的牦牛。去吧，$r。去摸摸它。"
G["As you can see, we've cleared out the rockslide.  The tremendous loss of life was regrettable, but you can now pass freely through the trogg-infested tunnel.\n\nYou're welcome!"]="就像你看见的那样，我们清理了这片山岩中的敌人。我们损失了许多兄弟，但现在你能安全地通过这条曾经被穴居人占据的隧道了。\n\n不用谢！"
G["As you can see, your people are now mine. I will now turn this city household by household, until the flame of life has been snuffed out... forever."]="如你所见，你的子民现在已经属于我了。我已经将城中的居民统统变成了我的奴仆，让斯坦索姆的生命之火……永远熄灭了。"
G["As you command, Sir!"]="遵命，长官！"
G["As you command, Warchief!"]="遵命，酋长！"
G["As you command, instructor!"]="遵命，教官！"
G["As you command, master!"]="如您所愿，主人！"
G["As you command, sir."]="遵命，长官！"
G["As you desire, Lord Illidan."]="如您所愿，伊利丹大人。"
G["As you fall in battle, we grow in strength. There is only one inevitable outcome. Prepare for your end!"]="你们当中不断有人倒下，而我们的力量却在战斗中日益庞大。毁灭的结局已经不可避免。准备迎接末日吧！"
G["As you gain renown with our town, I can make more goods available to you, $n.  With equipment in such short supply we can only afford to provide it to those we trust."]="A medida que te vayas ganando un nombre en nuestra ciudad podré ofrecerte más artículos, $n. Disponemos de pocas reservas de equipo y solo podemos permitirnos ofrecérselas a gente en quien confiemos."
G["As you inspect the cage and the Night elf inside, you get an odd sense of deja vu. For some reason she does not make eye contact with you--it is almost as if you are not there to her."]="当你检查牢笼和关在里面的暗夜精灵时，你有一种奇怪的似曾相识的感觉。不知为什么原因，她的目光从未与你接触——好像你对她来说并不存在一样。"
G["As you jump into Nergeld, the rotting flesh of the construct comes to life."]="当你跳上尼尔盖德时，构造体上腐烂的血肉突然活了起来。"
G["As you know, Black Dragons frequently disguise themselves as humanoids in order to tamper with mortal affairs."]="如你所知，我们黑龙经常会假扮成形色各异的人，去插手凡人的事务。"
G["As you know, Hallow's End is a celebration of transition... of change."]="万圣节是一场关于转变……关于变革的庆典。"
G["As you know, air weighs nothing. So to create a lighter-than-air vessel, we had to bend a few rules."]="大家都知道，空气的重量极小。所以，为了建造一艘比空气还要轻的飞船，我们就必须改变一些规则。"
G["As you near the portal, you are struck by intense heat radiating out. The sound of hammers echoing through a canyon create a faint steady rhythm all around.  Where does this portal go?"]="当你靠近传送门时，你感到了自门内侵散而出的热浪。锤子敲击声自峡谷回响而来，在四周环绕着微弱而坚实的节奏。这传送门究竟是通往哪里的？"
G["As you peer into the orb, you feel a familiar force tugging at your mind."]="当你凝视宝珠时，你感到一股熟悉的力量正在影响你的思绪。"
G["As you requested."]="如你所愿。"
G["As you say!"]="就像你说的那样！"
G["As you say, ambassador. We can wait."]="没关系，大使。我们可以等。"
G["As you say, my dear, as you say."]="当然，亲爱的，当然。"
G["As you say, my lady."]="如您所愿，女士。"
G["As you say, sir!"]="遵命，长官！"
G["As you say, sir."]="遵命，长官。"
G["As you say, sir.  It would appear that someone failed to mention to me that the druids at the Cenarion Thicket have been wiped out!"]="就像你说的那样，长官。看来有人没能及时通知我，塞纳里奥树林的德鲁伊们全都被消灭了！"
G["As you say. They are restless creatures."]="就像你说的那样，它们是永远也不会止歇的怪物。"
G["As you say... Warchief."]="如你所说……酋长。"
G["As you see, I have many weapons in my arsenal...."]="你们看，我的个人收藏中有许多武器……"
G["As you stand before me, I pray you cast your burdens behind me."]="请站到我面前来，将你的一切烦恼抛诸身后。"
G["As you supply our camp, strive to keep the benefits from wearing off."]="为我们的营地提供补给之后，请保持补给品的存量，不要让特效消失。"
G["As you undergo these trials, you and your serpent will strengthen your bond."]="在你通过这些考验后，你和你的翔龙之间的羁绊将会变得越来越稳固。"
G["As you were!"]="原地就位！"
G["As you were, orcs.  Let's make Hellscream proud."]="兽人们，记住自己的荣耀。我们要让地狱咆哮为我们感到自豪。"
G["As you wish sir."]="如你所愿。"
G["As you wish!"]="如你所愿！"
G["As you wish, $c."]="如你所愿，$c。"
G["As you wish, $n."]="如你所愿，$n。"
G["As you wish, $n. The spirit hunter is ready."]="如你所愿，$n。灵魂猎人已经准备好了。"
G["As you wish, Banshee Queen."]="服从您的命令，女妖之王。"
G["As you wish, Daddy!"]="如你所愿，爸爸！"
G["As you wish, Drakuru."]="如你所愿，达库鲁。"
G["As you wish, Eitrigg."]="如你所愿，伊崔格。"
G["As you wish, Thrall, son of Durotan."]="如你所愿，萨尔，杜隆坦之子。"
G["As you wish, Vaelan."]="如你所愿，维埃兰。"
G["As you wish, commander."]="如你所愿，指挥官。"
G["As you wish, master."]="遵命，我的主人。"
G["As you wish, my lord."]="如您所愿，大人。"
G["As you wish, my queen. I will not stand in their way, but I will keep a close watch."]="遵从您的意愿，我的女王。我不会阻拦他们，但我会对他们紧密监视。"
G["As you wish, sir."]="如你所愿，长官。"
G["As you wish."]="如你所愿。"
G["As you wish.  Just make sure they don't come to no harm."]="如你所愿。只要确保它们不受到伤害。"
G["As you wish. A toast, to our honored guest, $n!"]="Como desees. ¡Un brindis por $gnuestro:nuestra; honorable $ginvitado:invitada;, $n!"
G["As you wish. We will find your artifact. $p - I will meet you at the Sra'thik Incursion."]="如你所愿，我们会找到你的神器的。$p——我会在瑟拉提克入侵地与你会合。"
G["As you wish..."]="如你所愿……"
G["Ash can get me back to the Incursion. Please, $p, bring those poisoned blades."]="灰烬会把我带回先遣营地。拜托了，$p，带上那些毒刃。"
G["Ash nuzzles Sentinel Commander Lyalia."]="灰烬用鼻子蹭了蹭哨兵指挥官丽娅拉。"
G["Ash... to ash..."]="尘……归尘……"
G["Ashbringer defies me..."]="灰烬使者正在抗拒我……"
G["Ashbringer!"]="灰烬使者！"
G["Ashbringer."]="灰烬使者。"
G["Ashbringer..."]="灰烬使者……"
G["Ashenvale belongs to the Kaldorei!"]="灰谷属于卡多雷！"
G["Ashenvale is ours!"]="灰谷是我们的！"
G["Ashes and charred bones, most unsettling. I must take a sample."]="灰烬与枯骨，就这么散落着。我必须取一份样品。"
G["Ashes from the plane below, scattered by the hand of foe..."]="灰烬燃自位面深渊，烧尽敌人散布梦魇……"
G["Ashes to ashes!"]="尘归尘，土归土！"
G["Ashes to ashes, dust to dust!"]="尘归尘！土归土！"
G["Ashes to ashes."]="土归土。"
G["Ashes! Smoking craters! AHAHAHAHA!"]="灰烬！冒烟的火山口！啊哈哈哈哈！"
G["Ashes, ashes, we all fall down!"]="灰飞烟灭，跟我一起堕落吧！"
G["Ashes...to ashes..."]="尘……归尘……"
G["Ask Cavin to summon the Black Knight."]="让加文召唤黑骑士。"
G["Ask Kibler about the treasure! SQUAWK!"]="问问基布雷尔关于宝藏的事情！哇！"
G["Ask Super Dooker Rik-Rik."]="询问超霸里克里克的事迹。"
G["Ask about the orphans."]="询问那些孤儿的事情。"
G["Ask for Marie Holdston at the smithy."]="到铁匠铺去找玛蕾·霍斯顿。"
G["Ask for anything and you shall have it! Just spare my life!"]="我绝不会在敌人面前屈服的！"
G["Ask him how he wants to proceed, then come right back!"]="去问问他，接下来他想怎么着，然后回来告诉我！"
G["Ask me again later - I'm trying to scratch my nose and it's hard to concentrate."]="过会再问我，我忙着抓鼻子呢，精神很难集中。"
G["Ask me for help and advice... just don't ask me for money, okay?"]="你可以向我寻求帮助和建议……只是别向我要钱，好吗？"
G["Ask me how to get a free drink at the Blue Recluse!"]="快来问我怎样才能在蓝色隐士获得免费的饮料吧！"
G["Ask not for mercy. My blade will not grant it."]="别想求饶了。我的剑是不会宽恕敌人的。"
G["Ask the streams? You're no elder, Ashyo. You're not even a jinyu grown yet. It would be a waste of your time."]="向河流发问？阿西约你又不是长老。你还没有成年。这是在浪费你的时间。"
G["Ask yourself, $n: is this good for the Venture Company?"]="问问你自己，$n——这对风险投资公司有利吗？"
G["Ask yourself: what good is a \"safety\" valve if it keeps going off? That doesn't sound very safe to me."]="Hazte esta pregunta: ¿para qué sirve una válvula \"de seguridad\" si no deja de saltar? A mí no me suena muy seguro."
G["Aspects! Aid the heroes as best you can!"]="守护巨龙！请尽力帮助这些英雄。"
G["Aspects! Aid the heroes as best you can."]="守护巨龙！请尽力帮助这些英雄。"
G["Aspiring to join our ranks one day?  Sark Ragetotem can help you on your way.  He's in the Hunter's Hall."]="想要加入我们的行列？萨尔克·暴怒图腾可以指引你，他就在猎手大厅里。"
G["Assassin, eh? Who sent you? Speak, or I will carve the answer from your skull!"]="嗯，一个刺客？谁派你来的？快老实交代，不然我就把答案从你脑袋里挖出来！"
G["Assassins from that cult you found... Let's get moving before someone else finds us out here."]="刺客……最好在他们找到我们之前快点离开这里。"
G["Assassins! Guards! Guards!"]="刺客！来人啊！来人啊！"
G["Assassins... save... th... Magistraaa..."]="有刺客……去救……镇长……"
G["Assassins? What we need ta do is drop some firebombs on dem!"]="刺客？我们只需要在他们头顶上丢几颗火焰炸弹！"
G["Assemble a company! March on Forest Song!"]="召集战友！向林歌神殿进发！"
G["Assemble the Mallet."]="将钟杵组合起来。"
G["Assemble the schools. We will wash away even the memories of the Alliance and the Horde from Ashenvale!"]="召集军队。我们将从灰谷清除掉一切联盟和部落的痕迹！"
G["Assessing database integrity ..."]="评估数据库的完整性……"
G["Assist me slaves!"]="奴隶们，来帮我！"
G["Assist me! There are too many!"]="协助我！他们的数量太多了！"
G["Assist me, $n. The Trade Prince has become far more powerful!\n\nI do not know how much longer I can hold out."]="Ayúdame, $n. ¡El Príncipe mercante se ha vuelto más poderoso!\n\nNo sé cuánto tiempo más podré resistir."
G["Assume flight form in 3..."]="准备进入飞行形态，倒数3秒……"
G["Assume your druidic bear form, Tur."]="图尔，变成熊形态吧。"
G["Assuming there's a world left for your legion to conquer. The Twilight's Hammer seeks to destroy everything."]="如果真的有一个世界等待着你的军团去征服，暮光之锤也会把那里的一切都摧毁。"
G["Assuming this works, I'll need a name for my invention. How 'bout... Grookin Grenade?"]="这是一件杰作，我给我的发明起个名字……古鲁金手雷怎么样？"
G["Assuming we make it through this, it'll take a month to clean the brains off my brasswork."]="即使我们能取得胜利，我也要用一个月的时间才能把甲板上的脏东西清理干净。"
G["Astaia has fished up some curious treasures over the ages she has spent fishing.  Why don't you go see her over in the Tradesman's terrace and have her show you some of them."]="阿斯坦娅在她经常垂钓的地方钓起了一些古怪的财宝。去贸易区找她吧，让她给你看看。"
G["Astor? Taken your bloody time getting here, so let's not waste any time, shall we?"]="阿斯托？你来一趟真不容易啊，那我们就不要浪费时间了，好吧？"
G["Astounding!  So then indurium is the key!"]="难以想象！看来精铁才是关键！"
G["Astounding! A lineage of great warriors... From a different world, no less! It is rare for a Pandaren to leave his or her homeland. You are rightfully proud of who you are."]="真令人震惊！世代都是伟大的战士……来自全然不同的世界！熊猫人很少会离开自己的家园。你真该为自己的身份感到骄傲。"
G["Astounding! An actual, functional Mogu construct machine."]="难以置信！一台真真切切的魔古建造机器。"
G["Astounding! Another chamber that looks to originate from these \"Titans.\""]="¡Impresionante! Otra cámara que parece proceder de esos \"titanes\"."
G["Astounding! It says here that Brann discovered a mysterious runic plate deep in Thor Modan!"]="天哪！日志中提到布莱恩在索尔莫丹深处发现了一块刻有神秘符文的石板！"
G["Astounding. You managed to dominate her, yet she retains self awareness and function. How did you do it?"]="真令人惊讶。你在控制她，但她还能保持自己的意识。你是怎么做到的？"
G["At LAST! I'm parched!"]="终于！我被烤干了！"
G["At dis point you know as much as I do, mon. Maybe you go see Magar in Orgrimmar. He not be da happiest tailor around, but he help you anyway."]="你所掌握的知识已经跟我差不多啦。或许你可以去奥格瑞玛找玛加尔。他虽然不是最好的裁缝，但是他一定可以帮助你。"
G["At ease marines!"]="放松点，陆战队员！"
G["At ease soldiers!"]="稍息，士兵们！"
G["At ease, $C. If you are just passing through I suggest you stick to the roads and only travel by day. If your business is here in Darkshire, consider lending your abilities to The Night Watch. Our skill is unquestionable but our numbers are small."]="Descansa, $C. Si solo estás de paso, te sugiero que no te apartes de los caminos y viajes solo de día. Si tus asuntos te traen a Villa Oscura, considera prestar tus aptitudes a la Ronda Nocturna. Nuestra destreza es incuestionable, pero somos pocos."
G["At ease, Farstrider Dusking. What news do you have for me?"]="稍息，远行者达斯金。你有什么消息要告诉我？"
G["At ease, Private. I have a mission for you. The last messenger I sent to Nethergarde didn't make it. We found his entrails scattered about the bone road a few hours ago. We suspect it may have been Legion or fel orc, maybe even Horde..."]="稍息，下士。我有个任务要交给你。上次被派往守望堡的信使没能完成任务。几小时前，我们在荣耀之路附近发现了他破碎的尸体。我们怀疑可能是燃烧军团或是邪兽人干的，甚至可能是部落……"
G["At ease, lad. The Prince will be back soon and we'll be on our way back to Lordaeron."]="别紧张。王子很快就要回来啦，到时候我们就能返回洛丹伦了。"
G["At ease, lieutenant.  Go on."]="稍息，中尉。继续。"
G["At ease, men."]="放松点。"
G["At ease."]="放松。"
G["At first we repaired them to harvest the forests here, but ever since the alliance arrived and the fighting broke out we've been using them as war machines.\n\nBelieve me, $c. If you've got a key, you'd be crazy not to use it."]="Al principio las reparamos para cosechar estos bosques, pero desde que llegó la Alianza y comenzó la lucha las usamos como máquinas de guerra.\n\nCréeme, $c. Estarías $gloco:loca; si tuvieras una llave y no la usaras."
G["At first, my deference and respect for Taran Zhu prohibited me from questioning his decision to close the monastery to outsiders.\nThen, when the yaungol first attacked, my focus on the battle at hand prevented me from leaving the front lines to question his inability to send reinforcements.\nNow, three Shado-Pan lie dead, one is captured, and my patience is beyond worn thin - it is gone. I plan to go to the monastery and demand an audience with Taran Zhu."]="Al principio, mi deferencia y respecto por Taran Zhu me prohibían cuestionar su decisión de cerrar el monasterio a los forasteros.\n\nLuego, cuando los yaungol nos atacaron por primera vez, mi concentración en la batalla me impidió abandonar las líneas del frente para cuestionar su incapacidad para enviar refuerzos.\n\nAhora, tres Shadopan yacen muertos, uno ha sido capturado, y mi paciencia está más que al límite... se ha agotado. Pienso ir al monasterio y exigir audiencia con Taran Zhu."
G["At last - one among you is worthy of my knowledge. Worry not - I have probed your thoughts, no harm will come to you."]="终于……终于有人值得学到我的知识了。别担心——我已经了解你的想法，我不会伤害你的。"
G["At last I am liberated. It has been too long since I have tasted true freedom!"]="我终于解放了。很久都没有感受到真正的自由了！"
G["At last I am released! Thank you, gentle $r. I must return to the expedition at once! They will know of your deeds. This I vow."]="我终于自由了！谢谢你，高尚的$r。我必须马上回到远征队去！我发誓一定会把你的事迹告诉他们的。"
G["At last I will have my revenge!"]="我终于可以复仇了！"
G["At last it has come to pass. The moment of my demise. The loop is closed. My future self will cause no more harm."]="最终的时刻到来了。我将在这一刻消亡。轮回结束了。未来的我再也不能作恶了。"
G["At last it is here! Mourn and lament the passing of all you have ever known, and all that would have been! Hach min corai!"]="终于结束了！一切都终结了！为你们的世界默哀吧！Hach min corai！"
G["At last it is time for the exiled gnomes to return.\n\nOnce again Gnomeregan will be our home!"]="侏儒夺回家园的时候终于到了。\n\n诺莫瑞根将再次回到我们的手中！"
G["At last my noble brothers and sisters, our time is at hand!"]="时机终于来临了，我高贵的兄弟姐妹们，命运就在我们手中！"
G["At last peace can be restored!"]="终于能重获和平了！"
G["At last some good luck. Market Row has not caught fire yet. Mal'Ganis is supposed to be in Crusaders' Square, which is just ahead. Tell me when you're ready to move forward."]="圣光在上。市场小径还没有着火。玛尔加尼斯应该就躲藏在前面的十字军广场。你们准备好继续前进的话，就告诉我。"
G["At last the nightmare is over..."]="终于……噩梦结束了……"
G["At last!  The information we seek!  Gather quickly, skyguard.  We must soon return to headquarters with our findings!"]="终于！我们寻找多时的信息！天空卫队，迅速集合。我们必须立即返回总部，通报这一消息！"
G["At last! A challenge! Let us test your mettle, \"champion\"."]="¡Por fin, un desafío! Veamos de qué material estás hecho, \"campeón\"."
G["At last! A proper challenge for my power."]="总算让我遇到一个像样的对手了！"
G["At last! A warm-up! <Tiny Alliance person!>"]="总算可以热热身了！<联盟的小家伙！>"
G["At last! An up close fight!"]="总算来了！一场势均力敌的战斗！"
G["At last! Free from Northwatch Hold! I need a moment to catch my breath...."]="终于从北方城堡出来了！给我一点时间，让我好好呼吸一下这自由的空气……"
G["At last! I am finally free from this cell!\n\nThe Kirin Tor sent me from Dalaran to investigate Arugal's progress with the undead here in Silverpine Forest. Little did we know that the wizard had lost his grasp on sanity.\n\nI must report this mess at once! But before I leave, allow me to undo the magical lock on the courtyard door.\n\nYou defeated Rethilgore, perhaps you will survive what lies beyond...."]="终于！终于从这破牢房里逃出来了！\n\n肯瑞托将我从达拉然派到这个银松森林里来，要我调查阿鲁高和他的亡灵仆从们的活动，可我们却一点也不知道那个巫师已经完全失去了理智。\n\n我必须立刻把这个消息汇报上去！可在我离开之前，让我先把庭院门上的魔法锁给打开。\n\n既然你能击败雷希戈尔，或许也能从前面的层层埋伏中杀出一条血路……"
G["At last! I'll light the lamps."]="终于！我去把灯点亮。"
G["At last! Naralex awakes from the nightmare."]="纳拉雷克斯终于从噩梦中醒过来了！"
G["At last! Naralex can be awakened! Come aid me, brave adventurers!"]="终于可以唤醒纳拉雷克斯了！过来帮帮我，勇敢的冒险者！"
G["At last! Someone to free me from this cell!\n\nHigh Executor Hadrec sent us to gather information on the Keep so that a plan could be formulated to overthrow Arugal once and for all.\n\nBut the old wizard has many tricks up his sleeve and we were detected by a magical ward. I was thrown in this prison. Vincent was not so lucky.\n\nI must return to Hadrec to debrief him at once. But first I will pick the lock to the courtyard door for you. Perhaps you can try your luck against the foes that lurk beyond."]="¡Al fin! ¡Que alguien me saque de esta celda!\n\nEl sumo ejecutor Hadrec nos envió para recoger información sobre la fortaleza, así que se podría idear un plan para derrocar a Arugal de una vez por todas.\n\nNo obstante, este viejo zahorí tiene muchos trucos ocultos y nos ha detectado a través de una sala mágica. Me confinaron en esta prisión. Vincent no tuvo tanta suerte.\n\nTengo que volver con Hadrec para rendirle informe de inmediato. Pero antes te abriré el cerrojo de la puerta del patio. Quizás puedas probar suerte contra los enemigos que acechan desde el otro lado."
G["At last, $n, here is your staff. Wield it proudly in service to the Alliance."]="终于完成了，$n，这是你的法杖。骄傲地挥舞它，为联盟而战吧。"
G["At last, $p, we get to face each other in battle!"]="终于，$p，我们要在战斗中一决高下了！"
G["At last, I am able to lay my eyes upon you again."]="终于，我能够重新见到你了。"
G["At last, I am free of the Soulflayer!"]="我终于摆脱了夺灵者的束缚！"
G["At last, I am free of the corruption that once bound me to this place..."]="最后，我从将我禁锢在此的腐化中解脱了……"
G["At last, I be free!"]="终于，我自由了！"
G["At last, I have caught up with you, Nefarian. Surely you did not think you would escape the might of the other Aspects?"]="我终于能够与你抗衡了，奈法利安。你认为自己能躲过其他守护巨龙的力量吗？"
G["At last, Norkani is free!"]="洛尔卡尼终于自由啦！"
G["At last, a target for my frustrations!"]="终于有个发泄怒气的目标了！"
G["At last, a worthy opponent."]="终于有个像样的对手了。"
G["At last, an end to the horror..."]="终于，灵魂不再惶恐……"
G["At last, it ends...."]="终于结束了……"
G["At last, it's finished."]="终于，完成了。"
G["At last, my soul is free!"]="我的灵魂终于自由了。"
G["At last, my work is done."]="终于，我的工作完成了。"
G["At last, the agony ends. I have failed you my Queen. I have failed us all..."]="终于，痛苦结束了。我让你失望了，我的女王。我让你们都失望了……"
G["At last, the curse is lifted. Thank you, hero."]="终于，诅咒解除了。谢谢你，英雄。"
G["At last, the serum is complete, $n. Now, come closer. We must talk."]="哈，血清完成了，$n。过来，靠近点，我们得谈一谈。"
G["At last, the tablets are ours!"]="石板终于是我们的了！"
G["At last, the time for justice is at hand. This monster will answer for each and every Alliance life that we have lost in this war."]="复仇的时刻终于到来了。这个怪物将为我们所牺牲的每一位联盟战友而受到惩罚。"
G["At last, the tyranny of the stormforged is at its end!"]="雷铸铁矮人的暴政终于走到头了！"
G["At last, we have arrived!"]="我们终于到了！"
G["At last, you're back! We were beginning to worry that you'd been arrested."]="你终于回来了！我们已经开始担心你被逮捕了。"
G["At last, you're here. We have to get this tome to Icecrown as quickly as we can."]="你终于来了。我们必须尽快把这本宝典带到冰冠冰川。"
G["At last, you've driven them off. Take the tablets to Earthmender Norsala in the Valley of Strength at once! Tell her that I'll be along once I've had some time to recover."]="你终于将他们赶走了。马上带着这些石板到力量谷去找大地治愈者诺莎拉。告诉她，等我恢复过来就会回去。"
G["At last... Freed from his cursed grasp!"]="终于……从他邪恶的魔爪下逃脱了！"
G["At last... now I can rest."]="终于……现在我能够休息了。"
G["At least enough so that you can prove yourself."]="这至少能让你得到证明自己的机会。"
G["At least make me work for it next time."]="下次至少让我多花点力气吧。"
G["At least my pet died fighting valorously."]="至少我的宠物是英勇战死的。"
G["At least now we have a fighting chance, thanks to you."]="感谢你，至少我们现在有了战斗的机会。"
G["At least one Gilnean engineer works out of the Craftsmen's Terrace. She should be able to help you."]="起码还有一个吉尔尼斯工程师在工匠区工作，她应该能帮上你。"
G["At least the human prince is dead. King Wrynn now knows the price of his continued defiance."]="至少人类王子死了。这下，瓦里安为他的挑衅付出了代价。"
G["At least there are no electrified fences. Or trolls."]="至少那里没有通电的铁丝网，或者巨魔。"
G["At least we know that Anduin is alive. Well done, $n. Now go speak to Elder Lusshan. He has been asking for you."]="至少我们知道安度因还活着。干得好，$n。现在，去找长老卢山吧。他已经问起你好几次了。"
G["At least we wouldn't be around to have to clean it up."]="至少我们不用费神去打扫现场……"
G["At least ye didn't have to leave a wife back in Ironforge.  I can't imagine what she's up to without me around.  Ya ken how ladies are around ore."]="至少你不必把老婆丢在铁炉堡。我真无法想象，没有我在身边，她到底会怎么样。你对女人永远无法像对矿石那样了解。"
G["At least you didn't screw this batch up."]="至少你还没有弄坏这一批。"
G["At least... I die... with honor..."]="至少……我是光荣地……战死……"
G["At least... Theralion dies with me..."]="至少……瑟纳利昂和我一起倒下……"
G["At level 10 you will choose a Class Specialization.\nIf you later decide to choose a different Class Specialization, you may reset your previous choice here for a price.\nThis will become more expensive each additonal time you do so."]="Al nivel 10 debes elegir una especialización de clase.\n\nSi decides más tarde cambiar de especialización de clase, puedes hacerlo aquí a cambio de un módico precio.\n\nCada vez que repitas esta operación, será más caro."
G["At level 15 you will choose your first Talent.\nIf you later decide to choose different Talents, you may reset your previous choices here for a price.\nThis will become more expensive each additonal time you do so."]="Al nivel 15 debes elegir tu primer talento.\n\nSi decides más tarde cambiar de talentos, puedes hacerlo aquí a cambio de un módico precio.\n\nCada vez que repitas esta operación, será más caro."
G["At level 25 you will begin to use Glyphs.\nIf you later decide to replace your chosen Glyphs, you may reset them here for a price.\nThis will become more expensive each additonal time you do so."]="Al nivel 25 puedes empezar a usar glifos.\n\nSi más tarde decides reemplazar tus glifos, puedes hacerlo aquí a cambio de un módico precio.\n\nCada vez que repitas esta operación, será más caro."
G["At level 30 you can learn Dual Specialization, which allows you to keep two active Class Specialization, Talent, and Glyph sets and easily switch between them.\nYou also will have separate glyph panes and action bars for each set.\nSwitching between the two sets cannot be done while in combat and will consume your available resources."]="A nivel 30 puedes aprender la doble especialización que te permite mantener activas dos especializaciones de clase, talentos y glifos. Podrás cambiar fácilmente entre estas dos especializaciones.\n\nTendrás acceso también a un segundo panel de glifos y a un segundo conjunto de barras de acción.\n\nEl cambio no puede efectuarse en combate, y consumirás tus recursos disponibles."
G["At long last we have an opportunity to study the ruins that dot this landscape... Provided these moneygrubbers don't level the place first."]="这么长时间里，我们终于有机会研究散布在这里的废墟了……希望这些财迷不会先把这个地方毁掉"
G["At long last, I am home..."]="我终于……回家了……"
G["At night, I see the faces of all those I have slain. Where do our spirits go after our bodies lay cold? I fear... death."]="每晚，我都梦见手下的亡魂。当我们的身躯变冷，灵魂将去向何方？我…… 我怕死。"
G["At once, Lord Zhu."]="遵命，祝掌门。"
G["At once, my lady!"]="我立即去办！"
G["At once, my lady."]="马上，女士。"
G["At once, sir!  For the Horde!"]="马上，大人！为了部落！"
G["At once."]="立刻。"
G["At the appointed time, they will unleash fire elementals, consuming the city in flame and setting the stage for our master's glorious return!"]="等那个时刻一到，它们就会释放出火元素，让这座城市被熊熊烈火吞噬！为我们主人荣耀的恢复而做好准备！"
G["At the appointed time, they will unleash storm elementals, washing away the city and setting the stage for our master's glorious return!"]="等时刻一到，它们就会释放出暴风元素，彻底冲刷这座城市，为我们主人的荣耀回归而铺平道路！"
G["At the appointed time, they will unleash wind and water elementals, engulfing the city in a tempest and setting the stage for our master's glorious return!"]="届时，他们将放出风水两种元素，用狂风暴雨吞没整座城市，为我们主人的荣归搭设舞台！"
G["At the bell's toll it will be 10:00am. It's looking like there's gonna be more of the green poisonous cloud of death in today's weather forecast."]="钟声敲响，上午10点整。今天的天气预报称，空中可能出现更多绿色的致命毒云团。"
G["At the bell's toll it will be 11:00am. I want to take this opportunity to welcome all you new murderous, twisted Horde to Venomspite! So welcome, on behalf of me and my brother, Brote."]="钟声敲响，上午11点整。让我借此机会欢迎你们这些心理扭曲的部落成员吧，欢迎你们来到怨毒镇！我代表我和我兄弟布鲁特向你们致意。"
G["At the bell's toll it will be 12:00am. Midnight to all you scary Forsaken! OOoooo..."]="钟声敲响，午夜12点整。可笑的被遗忘者，你们的午夜降临啦！喔喔喔……"
G["At the bell's toll it will be 12:00pm. Noon for those of you that can't count. That's right, I'm looking at you, orcs."]="钟声敲响，正午12点整。瞧你们这帮连数都不会数的家伙，现在是正午时分。说的就是你们，兽人。"
G["At the bell's toll it will be 1:00am. If I ever break free, I will tear this town apart!!!"]="钟声敲响，凌晨1点整。如果我能逃出去的话，我会将这个镇子撕成碎片！！！"
G["At the bell's toll it will be 1:00pm. We're right in the middle of the lunch time rush! Your poisons, plagues, and noxious gases are delivered in 60 seconds or your order is free!"]="钟声敲响，下午1点整。现在是午餐高峰时间！你们预订的货物将在60秒后送到；如果未能准时送达，就免去订单费！"
G["At the bell's toll it will be 2:00am. Coincidentally, a perfect time to kill me and end my misery."]="钟声敲响，凌晨2点整。这正是杀死我的最佳时刻啊，来吧，让我解脱吧！"
G["At the bell's toll it will be 2:00pm. I want to take this opportunity to let you all know that Middleton's got a 2 for 1 sale going on right now! Buy 1 canister of his world famous poisonous biological agents and get the second free!"]="钟声敲响，下午2点整。请允许我借此机会做做宣传：米德尔顿正在举办买一赠一活动！购买一罐闻名于世的有毒生物制剂就能再免费获赠一罐！"
G["At the bell's toll it will be 3:00am. Time for bed!"]="钟声敲响，凌晨3点整。该睡觉了！"
G["At the bell's toll it will be 3:00pm. I think I soiled myself."]="钟声敲响，下午3点整。我好像尿裤子了。"
G["At the bell's toll it will be 4:00am. Don't you people ever sleep?"]="钟声敲响，凌晨4点整。被遗忘者不用睡觉的吗？"
G["At the bell's toll it will be 4:00pm. That's HAPPY HOUR at Middleton's Apothecarium! Come on inside and get poisoned or gased or both for a mere 35 silver!"]="钟声敲响，下午4点整。现在是米德尔顿炼金房的“欢乐时光”！只需35银币，就能享受到吞食毒药或是吞服毒气的乐趣哦，两种一起来也可以哟！"
G["At the bell's toll it will be 5:00am. End me!"]="钟声敲响，凌晨5点整。杀了我吧！"
G["At the bell's toll it will be 5:00pm. To those that may have been keeping score, I did - in fact - soil myself."]="钟声敲响，下午5点整。我知道你们还惦记着刚才的事儿呢，好吧，我确实——尿裤子了。"
G["At the bell's toll it will be 6:00am *yawn*. Rise and shine."]="钟声敲响，凌晨6点整*打哈欠*。起床啦，太阳晒屁股叻。"
G["At the bell's toll it will be 6:00pm. Please kill my brother!"]="钟声敲响，下午6点整。杀死我的兄弟吧！"
G["At the bell's toll it will be 7:00am. Good morning to all you early risers!"]="钟声敲响，早上7点整。早上好，你们都起得很早啊！"
G["At the bell's toll it will be 7:00pm. Another productive day at Venomspite comes to a close as night falls upon us."]="钟声敲响，晚上7点整。夜幕降临，怨毒镇充实的一天结束了。"
G["At the bell's toll it will be 8:00am. I'm sure you're all getting back from your morning jogs by now."]="钟声敲响，早上8点整。你们都结束晨跑了吧。"
G["At the bell's toll it will be 9:00am. It looks like another beautiful day in Dragonblight!"]="钟声敲响，上午9点整。龙骨荒野似乎又迎来了美好的一天！"
G["At the bell's toll it will be 9:00pm. Break time for me! I'll see you all in 4 hours. Unless one of you kills me in my sleep (please)."]="钟声敲响，晚上9点整。我该休息啦！4小时之后我还会来报钟的，除非你们趁我睡觉时杀了我（请一定要这么做）。"
G["At the bottom of the ocean even light must die."]="在深邃的洋底，就连圣光也必将熄灭。"
G["At the cost of your soul? You are no brother of mine! Begone from this place, and never set foot in our lands again!"]="以你的灵魂为代价？你再也不是我的兄弟了！离开这里，永远不要再踏上我们的土地！"
G["At the dawn of the world, when the mortal races were young, they did not yet possess the secrets of fire."]="在世界破晓之初，凡人种族还很年轻，他们尚未掌握火的秘密。"
G["At the dawn of the year, we elders visit briefly to offer counsel to the living and welcome those who have joined the ancestors."]="在新年的伊始，我们的先祖们会暂时降临，为生者指点迷津，并欢迎后来者加入他们的行列。"
G["At the northern shrine, I found him: a scrawny-looking human soldier."]="我是在北部神龛找到他的：一个骨瘦如柴的人类士兵。"
G["At the rate this is going, we're not going to finish on time."]="照目前的速度，我们肯定完不成任务。"
G["At the southeast edge of town is the Gallows' End Tavern.  Go there and head upstairs, and you'll find Dark Cleric Beryl inside the reading room."]="去镇子东南角的恐惧之末旅店，你可以在旅店楼上的阅览室中找到黑暗牧师贝里尔的。"
G["At them, my sisters! For Kalimdor!"]="姐妹们，进攻！为了卡利姆多！"
G["At this point, I will summon someone to examine the pendant, and find a hidden compartment..."]="现在，我会找一些人去检查这个坠饰，看看其中有什么隐藏的东西……"
G["At this rate I could have gathered them myself!"]="照这样的速度，我自己都能收集到足够的数量！"
G["At this rate I would die faster of natural causes."]="按照这个速度，我很快就要自然死亡了。"
G["At this rate I'm going to pace a rut into the road. I hope the messenger from Kalecgos arrives soon."]="真是急死人了，希望卡雷苟斯的信使快点到。"
G["At this rate you will not survive."]="这样的话你很难活下来。"
G["At this rate, our men and women will be the finest equipped in no time."]="照这样下去，我们的人很快就会有最好的装备了。"
G["At times, their corpses can prove more useful than the ghouls were themselves."]="有时候，食尸鬼的尸体比他们本身更有用。"
G["At what cost? The Brewery is trashed! Infested!"]="那代价呢？酒厂被毁了！都毁了！"
G["At what point are our hearts as full of darkness as the great evil we so tirelessly try to subdue?"]="我们的内心何时变得跟我们竭力压制的巨大邪恶一样充满黑暗？"
G["At your beck and call, horseman!"]="天启骑士，我愿意听从你的号令！"
G["At your command, my liege..."]="遵命，我的君主……"
G["At your command."]="服从您的命令。"
G["At your service, sir, as always."]="为您效劳，大人。"
