G["At... last... my time has come."]="终……于……我的时代来临了。"
G["Atennnn ... SHUN!"]="立……正！"
G["Athrikus came to us. He told us that he could save us from harm. He cast a spell upon us to protect us from harm."]="埃瑟里克斯来到我们面前，他声称能把我们从痛苦中解救出来。他给我们施了魔法，让我们免受伤害。"
G["Athrikus points at you as he bellows forth words that scrape apart the inside of your ears. They are the last thing you hear."]="埃瑟里克斯指着你大声咆哮，言语实在是不堪入耳。这是你听到的最后的话。"
G["Atiesh, Greatstaff of the Guardian. The staff handed down through the ages to each of the Guardians of Tirisfal. The staff corrupted by Sargeras. The staff of the last Guardian. The staff of Medivh."]="阿泰丝，守护者之杖。那个法杖一直以来都在每个提里斯法的守护者间流传着。法杖後来被萨格拉斯腐败。最後一名守护者的法杖。麦迪文的法杖。"
G["Atop the pillar, I saw him: Deathwing.  The time for the ultimate confrontation had arrived."]="在那里，我看见了：死亡之翼。最终的决斗到来了。"
G["Atramedes! Your master beckons."]="艾卓曼德斯！主人在召唤你。"
G["Atramedes, are you going deaf as well as blind? Hurry up and kill them all."]="艾卓曼德斯，难道你不光瞎了，还是聋子？快干掉他们！"
G["Atramedes, the heroes are right THERE!"]="艾卓曼德斯，那些英雄就在那边！"
G["Attach two vehicles to a bigger vehicle, and then have the passengers jump from one vehicle to the other!"]="将两辆车组合成一辆更大的车，然后让乘客从一辆车跳到另一辆车上！"
