G["Auch! Zhis is an outrage!"]="混蛋！太过分了！"
G["Auchindoun is home to my ancestor's spirits.  We might not look it, but all Broken were once draenei... our spirits are all the same."]="奥金顿是先祖灵魂的家园。或许那里是破碎者的禁地，但是所有的破碎者都曾是德莱尼人……我们的灵魂是一样的。"
G["Auckh!!!"]="¡¡¡Auckh!!!"
G["Auction House"]="拍卖行"
G["Auction House services can be found in your home city."]="你可以在自己的主城里使用拍卖行服务。"
G["Augh - smooshy little pests, look what you've done!"]="啊——讨厌的小害虫，瞧瞧你们都干了些什么！"
G["Augh appears from the distance!"]="奥弗在远处出现了！"
G["Augh da boss! Oh yeah!"]="奥弗是老板了！哦耶！"
G["Augh smart! Augh already steal treasure while you no looking!"]="奥弗很聪明！奥弗在你不注意的时候拿走了财宝！"
G["Augh sounds like a name I can trust. Lead the way!"]="奥弗这名字听起来值得信任。带路吧！"
G["Augh steal your treasure. Uhn uhn uhnnn!"]="奥弗拿走了你的财宝。呃，呃，呃！"
G["Augh! Don't sneak up on a pandaren like that!"]="啊！熊吓熊会吓死熊的！"
G["Augh! I must rest for a moment."]="啊！我必须休息一下了。"
G["Augh! No more hurt!"]="啊！不要再打了！"
G["Augh! Suna..."]="噢！孙娜……"
G["Augh! Their deaths hurt us, but they will hurt him, too! Bring them close to him!"]="嗷！它们死掉时炸伤了我们，不过它们也会伤害到他的！把它们弄到他身边去！"
G["Augh! Too... much... It's too much!"]="嗷！太……多了……太多了！"
G["Augh... Their filthiness stains me!"]="啊……他们的污秽玷污了我！"
