G["Auugh - kill him. Quickly!"]="啊——杀了他。快！"
G["Auum na-l ak-k-k-k, isshhh. Rise, minions. Devour..."]="Auum na-l ak-k-k-k, isshhh。起来，奴仆们，吃吧……"
G["Auuugghhh! That hurt!"]="啊啊！好疼！"
G["Auuugh! Looks like we're taking an unexpected detour! Hold on tight!"]="啊！看样子，我们发现了一条意想不到的捷径！抓紧！"
G["Auuugh... Auuuuuugggghhhhh! This pain! I cannot control it!"]="啊……啊啊啊！好痛苦！我控制不了了！"
G["Auuughh! Yeti on the trail!"]="噢！雪人跟来了！"
G["Auuughh! Yeti on the trail! Go yak! Faster, faster!"]="噢！后边有雪人！快走，牦牛！快点，再快点！"
G["Auuughh! Yeti on the trail! Go yaks! Faster, faster!"]="噢！后边有雪人！快走，牦牛！快点，再快点！"
G["Auuughh! Yeti on the trail! Looks like we aren't in the clear yet!"]="噢！雪人跟来了！看来我们还没有摆脱这些麻烦呢！"
G["Avast ye, matey. Cookie is me name, cooking is me game. The McWeaksauce bloodline be a long line of cooks and tradesmen that work to please the more delicate senses o' man and woman."]="$gQuieto:Quieta;, $gcompañero:compañera;. El Cocinitas soy yo, y lo que me va es cocinar. Los MacSalsafloja somos una familia con una larga tradición cocinera y mercader. Sabemos como satisfacer los más delicados paladares."
G["Avast!"]="停！"
G["Avast, Ed! Lemme show ye me ship! *hic*"]="等等，艾德华！让我给你看看我的船！*嗝*"
G["Avast, land lubbers be attackin'! Man the harpoons!"]="停，陆地上的傻大个们发起攻击了！准备鱼叉！"
G["Avast, these Alliance scallywags have made their way onto our ship.  Take care of them!"]="停下，这些联盟恶棍爬到我们船上来了。去解决他们！"
G["Avast, these Horde scallywags have made their way onto our ship.  Take care of them!"]="停下，这些部落恶棍爬到我们船上来了。去解决他们！"
G["Avast, these scallywags have made their way onto our ship.  Take care of them!"]="停下，这些恶棍爬到我们船上来了。去解决他们！"
G["Avast... dookers!"]="且慢……蠢货！"
G["Avenge me!"]="为我报仇！"
G["Avenge me, $g brother:sister;...."]="为我报仇，$g兄弟:姐妹;……"
G["Avenge me, $n."]="为我报仇，$n。"
