G["Avoid the lava waves!"]="躲开熔岩！"
G["Avoid the rotating frost burn effects, or you will take damage and lose a stack of Essence of Ice."]="避开旋转的冰霜烧灼效果，否则你就会受到伤害，并失去一层冰之精华。"
G["Avoid the shadow runes!"]="别碰那些暗影符文！"
G["Avruu's magic is broken!  I'm free once again!"]="亚维鲁的魔法失效了！我又自由了！"
G["Avruu's magic... it still controls me.  You must fight me, mortal.  It's the only way to break the spell!"]="亚维鲁的魔法……仍然控制着我。你必须与我战斗，凡人。这是唯一可以解除那个魔法的办法！"
G["Avuun dares to oppose me?!  I will crush him!  When I am done with the draenei, they'll wish that they were Lost Ones!"]="阿弗恩敢跟我对着干？我要让他死无葬身之地！当我解决了德莱尼人之后，他们会后悔自己当年没有变成失落者！"
G["Aw shoot, aw shoot, aw shoot..."]="射击，射击，射击……"
G["Aw shucks, you are going to spoil me rotten!"]="胡说什么，你要宠坏我了！"
G["Aw! But the Wrestler was gonna fight soon."]="噢！但摔跤手很快就要上场了。"
G["Aw! The captured sprite darters didn't make it. What will we do?"]="啊！那些精灵龙没能逃脱，我们该怎么办？"
G["Aw, don't want to train with me? What other weapon catches your eye?"]="你想要学习哪种武器？"
G["Aw, heck no. That's just how I make my beer.\n\nMuddy water, you see... it's got little bugs in it, that ferment your ale for you. Some folks use real yeast, grown in a fancy brewery under controlled conditions and what have you. I use muddy water.\n\nIt's kind of my thing.\n\nI guess I'm just not what you'd call \"cultured\"."]="Oh, claro que no. Así es como hago la cerveza.\n\nCon agua y caolín, ¿sabes? Tiene unos bichitos que fermentan la cerveza. Hay quien usa levadura de verdad, cultivada en una cervecería lujosa en condiciones controladas y todo eso. Yo uso agua sucia.\n\nEs mi estilo.\n\nSupongo que no soy lo que se dice \"cultivado\"."
G["Aw, hell's hangover. They trashed the place!"]="哦，那些地狱的渣滓。它们把这个地方全都毁了！"
G["Aw, me not think it work out between us."]="啊，我不觉得我们两个合适。"
G["Aw, sweety, you know that I can't let you go up there.  Rules are rules."]="啊，甜心，你知道我不能让你去上面。命令始终是命令。"
G["Aw. Careful not to bleed on the rug please, dear."]="噢，小心点，别把血滴在地毯上了，亲爱的。"
G["Awaiting further instructions from Keeper Mimir."]="等待守护者米米尔的下一步指令。"
G["Awaiting orders from my superiors!"]="等待上级命令！"
G["Awaiting orders from my superiors."]="等待上级命令。"
G["Awaiting orders!"]="整装待命！"
G["Awaiting orders, sir. On your command, I shall unleash hell upon them!"]="等待指令。我将听从你的命令，让那些家伙命丧黄泉！"
G["Awaiting your orders."]="等待你的命令。"
G["Awake, ye servants! Defend the Disks!"]="醒来吧！我的奴仆！保护圆盘！"
G["Awaken from the great waters beyond."]="从彼岸无边大水中苏醒。"
G["Awaken from ya slumber, my mogu friends. Together, we crush these lands."]="从休眠中醒来吧，我的魔古朋友们。让我们一起粉碎这片土地。"
G["Awaken from your slumber, $n!"]="从你的睡眠中醒来吧，$n！"
G["Awaken my pets! Feast on their flesh!"]="起来吧，我的宠物们！去吃了他们！"
G["Awaken, Hu'seng! The docks are your responsibility. See that none pass his majesty's gates."]="醒来吧，虎申！你来负责码头。不要让任何人通过陛下的大门。"
G["Awaken, Ymiron, the time of your continued reign is nigh."]="苏醒吧，伊米隆国王。时机已经成熟，你很快就能重掌统治权。"
G["Awaken, my children and assist your master!"]="醒来吧，我的孩子，来帮助你们的主人！"
G["Away from me, lowborn scum! Perhaps you did not notice my boot in your face the first time!"]="离我远点，下贱的渣滓！否则小心我的靴子踹到你的脸上！"
G["Away from me, mongrel!"]="离我远点儿，杂种！"
G["Away to Thunder Bluff to the north is where your journey takes you then friend.  Once there seek out the wisdom of one of the Bluffwatchers who can tell you directly where to find whom you seek."]="去北面的雷霆崖吧，从那儿开始你的旅程，朋友。一旦你到达雷霆崖，那儿的守卫会直接告诉你你要找的东西在哪儿。"
G["Away with you, $c!\n\nOnly champions of Undercity may purchase what I have to offer."]="¡Largo de aquí, $c!\n\nSolo los Campeones de Entrañas pueden comprar lo que tengo en venta."
G["Away! Leave us to suffer!"]="滚开！让我们继续痛苦下去吧！"
G["Away, creature of the depths!"]="走开，深渊的怪物！"
G["Away, vermin!"]="滚开，渺小的凡人！"
G["Away, you fiends! Help!"]="滚开，你们这些恶魔！救命啊！"
G["Away, you mindless parasites! My blood is my own!"]="滚开，你们这些寄生虫！我的血是我自己的！"
G["Away... go..."]="走开……滚……"
G["Awe inspiring, master. Your ineptitude is awe inspiring."]="主人，你令人感到敬畏。你的不称职令人敬畏。"
G["Awed by its power, the Thunder King described the instrument as \"the voice of the gods,\" and named it the Divine Bell."]="Maravillado por su poder, el Rey del Trueno la describió como \"la voz de los dioses\" y le dio el nombre de Campana divina."
G["Awesome!"]="真棒！"
G["Awright then! My place is just around the corner."]="那好吧！我就住在附近。"
G["Awtgsshu LWHUK iilth!"]="¡Awtgsshu LWHUK iilth!"
G["Aww Ruby, you're the best pet ever!"]="哦，露比，你真是最好最好的宠物！"
G["Aww yeah..."]="噢耶……"
G["Aww! So scared!"]="啊！吓坏了吧！"
G["Aww, Blanchy, don't worry, my brother in Westfall will take good care of you. I hear he's got a beautiful farm with lots of space for you to roam."]="啊，布兰契，别担心。我兄弟就住在西部荒野，他会好好照顾你的。我听说他拥有一座漂亮的大农场，你可以随意在农场里闲逛。"
G["Aww, Budd. Now what'd ya go an' do that for?"]="噢……巴德。你这是又要干嘛？"
G["Aww, I told you take care of her. I poured my heart and soul into that thing, you know? Take it easy this time around."]="啊，我说过让你好好照顾她的。你知道我在她身上倾注了多少心血吗？这次你可得小心点。"
G["Aww, c'mon Beak. It weren't nothin' but a big ... tentacle thing. Donnelly will keep ya safe!"]="啊，别怕尖喙。那只不过是个大大的……触手。东尼利会保护我们的！"
G["Aww, dooker..."]="噢，知道了……"
G["Aww, man..."]="噢，天哪……"
G["Aww, no... what have dey gone an' done to me rifle, mon!?"]="噢，不……他们对我的步枪干了什么，伙计！？"
G["Aww, not a snake!"]="啊！！蛇！"
G["Aww, nuts! You've ruined everything!"]="啊，蠢货！你毁了一切！"
G["Aww, what rotten luck! My skills aren't good enough to be of any use to you. Oh well. Talk to Fimble Finespindle over there by the loom. He's been working with leather for longer than I have."]="啊，运气真坏！我的技能对你来说一无是处。呃。跟那边的费布·钢轴谈谈吧。他接触皮革的时间比我长多了。"
G["Aww, you two going be friends? Maybe find nice place in swamp and have very own medium-tongues? So sweet... stop being dumb now."]="啧啧，你们俩要做朋友吗？要不要在沼泽里安个窝再生一堆不大不小的中舌头怪啊？真浪漫啊……省省吧，别犯傻了。"
G["Aww..."]="啊……"
G["Aww... look at the cute little snake, Nibbleh! Go ahead, let him nibble on your toes. Let's see what happens."]="噢……看看这条可爱的小蛇，噬人蛇！上啊，让它咬一口你的脚趾。让我们看看会发生什么事。"
G["Awww Mom! It's hardly dark yet! Can we play for a bit longer please?"]="啊，妈妈！天还没黑！我们可以多玩一会吗？"
G["Awww man not again."]="天哪，又来了。"
G["Awww shucks, I was gonna eat these! Well, if Ella needs 'em, I ain't gonna no more. Here, take 'em!"]="哎呀，我自己正要吃呢！好吧，要是艾拉想要，我就不能不给。接着，拿去吧！"
G["Awww shucks. At this rate, I'll never get to join the Tiller's Union. Well, let me know if you ever change your mind."]="噢，见鬼。照这个速度，我永远也进不了阡陌客。好吧，如果你改主意了，通知我一声。"
G["Awww! No fair!"]="噢！不公平！"
G["Awww, I knew you'd win! I'd better practice some more..."]="噢，我就知道你会赢！我还得多加练习……"
G["Awww, we were just playing!"]="喔，我们只是在玩！"
G["Awww, you should have won that one, Ace!"]="哎呀，你应该能赢的，王牌飞行员！"
G["Awww..."]="噢……"
G["Awww...  They are hurt."]="哦……好痛啊。"
G["Awww... look at da purty lil' gool.\n\nJump, lil' gool! Jump!\n\nHa, ha, ha.... Attsa guud lil' gool."]="嗷嗷……瞧那只食尸鬼。\n\n跳一下呀！跳一下！\n\n哈哈哈……真是一只可爱的食尸鬼。"
G["Awww.... Hello little baby!"]="啊……你好啊，小宝贝！"
G["Axe"]="斧"
G["Axe too weak. Garfrost make better and CRUSH YOU."]="斧子太弱了。看我弄好他，然后……然后砸扁你。"
G["Axes ready! The enemy approaches!"]="准备好战斧！敌人靠近了！"
G["Axes, picks, seed, nails, food, blankets, water... it's all there, waiting for you. I think you'll find my prices quite reasonable, too."]="斧头、锄头、种子、钉子、食物、毯子、水……任凭你们挑选。价格非常合理哟。"
G["Axethrowers, hurl faster!"]="飞斧手，加速掷斧！"
G["Aye $g lad : lass; are ye ready to head to Alterac Valley and give the Horde a taste o' what they been asking for?"]="Y bien $gmuchacho: muchacha;, ¿$glisto:lista; para dirigirte al Valle de Alterac y darle a la Horda lo que está pidiendo a gritos?"
G["Aye and thanks for letting me carry my own hand back to the priests that night."]="嗯，谢谢你那天晚上让我能把自己的手捡回去。"
G["Aye aye sir! Immediately, sir!"]="是，长官！马上，长官！"
G["Aye aye!"]="好啊，好啊！"
G["Aye aye, Mr. Kowalski."]="是，是，科瓦斯基先生。"
G["Aye aye, sir!"]="遵命，长官！"
G["Aye aye, sir."]="遵命，长官。"
G["Aye sure, just as long as we get to hit the arena right after!"]="没问题，过一会咱们就去比一比！"
G["Aye there you go lad, your favorite brew."]="嘿，伙计，你的酒。"
G["Aye! We're here to rescue you!"]="是的！我们是来救你的！"
G["Aye, $g lad:lass;. What can we be doin' fer yeh?"]="嘿，$g小伙子:小姑娘;。有什么能为你效劳的？"
G["Aye, $gladdie:lass;, that be some fine gatherin' ye been doin. Keep it up!"]="干得好，$g小伙子:妹子;，你找到了些不错的东西。加油！"
G["Aye, Broland Galebeard, here in Kharanos, can get ya where ya want ta go."]="嗯，在卡拉诺斯，布洛兰·风须能送你去你想去的地方。"
G["Aye, Commander; but I am little no more. I have come to find my father. Have you any news as to his whereabouts? I know that he still lives. I have seen it in my dreams..."]="是的，长官。但是我已经不再是那个小孩子了。我要找到我的父亲。您有任何有关他的消息吗？我知道他还活着。我在我的梦里见到过他……"
G["Aye, Fandral, remember these words: Let not your grief guide your faith. These thoughts you hold... dark places you go, night elf. Absolution cannot be had through misguided vengeance."]="范达尔，记住我的话：别让悲痛动摇了你的信念。你的思想……将把你引入黑暗，暗夜精灵。误入歧途的复仇是不能被赦免的。"
G["Aye, Genn.  It is not law that binds us.  It is something far stronger.  My men are ready to give their lives under your command."]="遵命，吉恩。约束我们的不是法律，而是某种更为牢固的东西。我的人将服从你的命令，至死方休。"
G["Aye, I could tell just by looking at you, $n. You remind me very much of myself as a young warrior of the Horde.\n\nYou will undoubtedly go far in life and even further in death.\n\n<Goretooth salutes.>"]="Sí... podría decir mucho con solo mirarte, $n. Me recuerdas a mí mismo cuando era un joven guerrero de la Horda.\n\nSin duda llegarás muy lejos en vida y mucho más lejos en muerte.\n\n<Dientegore saluda.>"
G["Aye, I did. Much to the dismay of the lesser Mograine, I made my way back to the Scarlet Monastery. I shouted and screamed. I told the tale to any that would listen. And I would be murdered in cold blood for my actions, dragged to this chamber - the dark secret of the order. But some did listen... some heard my words. Thus was born the Argent Dawn..."]="是的，我成功了，为了让小莫格莱尼的罪行得到惩罚，我徒步走回了血色修道院。我在大厅里高声说出了一切，我向所有关心事实的人宣布了真相。随后我就被灭口了，尸体被拖进了这个组织内无人知道的秘密房间。但有一些人听了我的话，他们理解了一切的真相，于是就有了银色黎明……"
G["Aye, I know. I watched him turn... I watched him give up all that was right and I didn't lift a hand... I didn't even consider it until it was too late."]="嗯，我知道。我亲眼目睹了他的转变……我看着他抛弃正义，而我却没有伸出援手……等我意识到事情的严重性时，一切都晚了。"
G["Aye, I seen 'im fight. He's an orc - big as they come. Lost a week's wages bettin' against that one. Won't make that mistake again!"]="是的，我看他打过。他是个兽人——就像其他兽人一样壮。我一周的工钱就输在那场上面。我不会再犯那样的错误了！"
G["Aye, I will gather my pack... we..."]="是，我将收拾行装……我们……"
G["Aye, I would love ta teach ye a thing or two about smithing. Grab an apron and a hammer and let's see what we can accomplish shall we?"]="是的，很高兴能教你如何锻造。系上围裙，拿起铁锤，看看我们能锻造出什么来？"
G["Aye, I'll go, but I'll go when I'm good an' ready..."]="好吧，我会去，可得等我准备好才行……"
G["Aye, I'll try it."]="好吧，我会尝尝的。"
G["Aye, I'm ready to smash some Horde ships to splinters!"]="是，我已经准备好要把兽人的舰船砸得稀巴烂了！"
G["Aye, I've battled them as well. We are ill-prepared as a kingdom to withstand such an assault."]="是的，我也和他们交手过。我们的王国还没有准备好抵挡这种进攻。"
G["Aye, Remulos. Prepare the mortal races."]="嗯，雷姆洛斯。让人类准备就绪吧。"
G["Aye, an no squealing youngster to upset the peace of a man and his fish..."]="啊，你这喋喋不休的小家伙！没看见我正在享受钓鱼的乐趣吗？别打扰我……"
G["Aye, and a damn fine job she did of it! But not as good as the Admiral."]="哈，她干得可真漂亮！但和将军还没法比。"
G["Aye, and it runs in the family.  The Digsongs have always had buoyancy issues, I'm afraid."]="哎，家族遗传问题。恐怕掘歌家的人总是被浮力问题困扰。"
G["Aye, and so will we!"]="没错，我们也一样！"
G["Aye, and which battleground be ye looking for?"]="嗯，你在找哪个战场？"
G["Aye, as will I."]="好的，我也要。"
G["Aye, aye, sir!"]="遵命，长官！"
G["Aye, aye, sir.  Right away!"]="遵命，长官。马上去办！"
G["Aye, be safe Muradin. I'd join you, but I'm on top of the most amazing discovery the world has yet seen. I can't abandon it now."]="穆拉丁，保重。我很想与你同行，但是我正在发掘一个足以震惊世界的秘密。我不能半途而废。"
G["Aye, but I know it by its true name - Eldre'Thalas.  It was a bastion of magical power for the night elves many, many years ago.\n\nYou know of Eldre'Thalas, young one?  One might say that is coincidental to my current plight... but I am one not to believe in coincidence."]="Sí, pero lo conozco por su verdadero nombre: Eldre'Thalas. Fue un bastión de poder mágico para los elfos de la noche durante muchos, muchos años.\n\n¿Habías oído hablar de Eldre'Thalas, joven? Se podría decir que coincide con mi situación actual... Pero no creo en las coincidencias."
G["Aye, captain!"]="是，船长！"
G["Aye, everyone wants to ride the tram, it's a real hoot and a half.  Well, if ye want to find the tram, it's located over in Tinker Town just east of the gates of Ironforge."]="是的，每个人都想坐矿道地铁，那真是酷毙了。嗯，你可以去铁炉堡大门以东的技工区找矿道地铁。"
G["Aye, friend. How fare the Wildhammer clans? We've much to discuss!"]="朋友，蛮锤部族的情况如何？我们有很多事情要谈！"
G["Aye, general!"]="是，将军！"
G["Aye, he had done what was thought to be impossible. Out from the fissure sprung an agent of Therazane!\n\nFrom my vantage point, I could see the goblin holding conversation with the agent of the Old God. What happened after that was terrible..."]="是的，他完成了几乎不可能完成的任务。塞拉赞恩的使者从裂缝中跳了出来！\n\n在我看来，那个地精已经能够和上古之神的使者交谈了。此后发生的事情非常恐怖……"
G["Aye, if only every day was just like today...."]="是啊，如果每天都像今天那样……"
G["Aye, it appears as if ye have learned quite a bit, I'm impressed. But do ye know how many I have that seek to be my apprentice? Tell ye what, do a small task fer me and I'll take ye on."]="是的，似乎你已经学到了很多知识，你给我留下了深刻的印象。但是你知道想做我学生的人有多少吗？这样吧，帮我完成一项任务，我就教你。"
G["Aye, it's a cold one today, but ne'er too cold to offer you my fine wares!"]="啊，今天好冷啊，但是无论多么寒冷的天气都无法驱散我款待你的热情！"
G["Aye, its still broken. Can't afford to buy a new one though."]="啊，修不好。我哪儿有钱买辆新的。"
G["Aye, lad. He tried to use an old titan ritual to keep his people safe, but this is what it did to him."]="是啊，孩子。他曾经想借助一个古老的泰坦仪式保护他的人民，但这也让他自己变成了这种样子。"
G["Aye, lads!  Things are about to get quite ugly."]="伙计们！情势开始变得相当险恶。"
G["Aye, let's teach this addle-brained gnome a lesson!"]="对，让我们给这脑筋错乱的侏儒上一课！"
G["Aye, my brawlin' days are over.  Nowadays, I fill my time with fancy ale and not-so-fancy lasses."]="没错，我打拳的日子已经过去了。现在，我全靠美酒和三流美女打发日子了。"
G["Aye, protect the tank while the boys make repairs! I'll try to get her moving again..."]="嘿，在孩子们进行修理的时候一定要保护好坦克！我会努力让她动起来……"
G["Aye, she's a beaut alright. And you parked her right next to my frigate! *hic*"]="是的，她真漂亮。而且你还把她停在了我的护卫舰旁边！*嗝*"
G["Aye, sir!"]="遵命，长官！"
G["Aye, solja! Lift off time!"]="嘿，士兵！准备出发！"
G["Aye, tell your friend there Tongus if he dont take care of his tab here, i'll be making an appearance with old Steelhead!"]="告诉你的朋友，如果他不把他的债处理掉，我就和老钢手一起去找他麻烦！"
G["Aye, that'll do it! They'll come runnin' once they see the reward we've put up!"]="没错！要是他们看到了我们提供的奖励，肯定会过来的。"
G["Aye, that's her name, and a fine ship she is.\n\nThere's much to learn from such vessels, you know. A great poet once said: Ships that pass in the night, and speak each other in passing, only a signal shown, and a distant voice in the darkness; So on the ocean of life, we pass and speak one another, only a look and a voice, then darkness again and a silence."]="是呀，梅蕾女士号，她是一艘很漂亮的船。\n\n你知道，呆在船上能学到很多知识的。有首诗说得好：苍茫黑夜中两只落寞行船，擦身而过时互相道安，风笛长鸣，堪堪见到模糊的形，片刻后却只余远去的影；人生亦如这广阔的洋，你我的船不期中徜徉而遇，彼此仅是浅烙下容与音，即又遁入黑暗与寂静。"
G["Aye, that's how the hammer falls, gents!"]="没错，锤子就应该这样挥舞，先生们！"
G["Aye, that's true. Uther - now there's a real hero for the people."]="对，没错。乌瑟尔，他才是人民的真正英雄。"
G["Aye, the Highlord Mograine: A founder of the original order of the Scarlet Crusade. A knight of unwavering faith and purity; Mograine would be betrayed by his own son and slain by Kel'Thuzad's forces inside Stratholme. It is how I ended up here..."]="是的，莫格莱尼，大领主莫格莱尼：血色十字军最初的建立者之一，一位一生忠诚于其信仰，致力于净化世间一切罪恶的骑士。他被自己的亲生儿子背叛，并被克尔苏加德的军队杀死在了斯坦索姆城内。这也是我现在横在?里的原因……"
G["Aye, the quilboar are a foul lot."]="嘿，那些野猪人真是脏得要命。"
G["Aye, they was getting' a wee handsy, so I took care of it. C'mon then, I'm done here."]="他们有些不安分，所以我要处理一下。好了，我已经忙完了。"
G["Aye, what need ye?"]="啊，你需要什么？"
G["Aye, ya never know who's gunna join next, or who be dyin' next for that matter.\n\nMy advice? Don't be gettin' too attached to anyone."]="是啊，你永远不会知道下一个入伙的家伙是谁，也不会知道下一个因此事而丧命的家伙是谁。\n\n我的建议么，就是不要和任何人扯上关系。"
G["Aye, you look the type to be a leader.  Here to organize a guild to fight for the Alliance?"]="是的，你看起来是个领导者。你是来这里组织公会与联盟作战吗？"
G["Aye, you mean the one you caused?"]="你的意思是，这是你造成的？"
G["Aye, you there!  If you want to earn the respect of the Darkspear, then you can start by donating valuable resources for those in need!  Textiles and bandages don't grow on trees, ya know.\n\nRather than cash in various cloth pieces you find adventuring, donate them!  Doing so will earn you the recognition of the Darkspear!"]="啊，你！如果你想要赢得暗矛部族的尊重，那你可以向我们捐赠那些急需的资源！你要知道，布料和绷带不会从树上长出来。\n\n我们需要你在冒险中得到的那些布料，把它们捐给我们吧！这样你就可以得到暗矛部族的青睐！"
G["Aye, you there!  If you want to earn the respect of the dwarves of Ironforge, then you can start by donating valuable resources!  Ironforge finds itself running low on cloth piece; textiles and bandages don't grow on trees, ya know!\n\nRather than cash in various cloth pieces you find adventuring, donate them!  Doing so will earn you the recognition of the dwarven people of Ironforge!"]="啊，你！如果你想要赢得铁炉堡矮人的尊重，那么你可以为我们捐赠有价值的资源！铁炉堡现在的布料和绷带的存储量很低！\n\n你可以捐赠各种你在冒险中得到的布料！这样一来，你就可以赢得铁炉堡矮人对你的尊重！"
G["Aye-aye, sir!"]="遵命，长官！"
G["Aye-aye, sir.  Heavin' to and returnin' back t' shore."]="遵命，长官。正在逆行返回海岸。"
G["Aye."]="嗯。"
G["Aye. ARRRRRRGHHHH... He... He is coming. You... You must..."]="啊……他……他来了。你……你必须……"
G["Aye. I am loath to send my men into that. It reeks of ambush and bloody disaster."]="没错。我真不想派人过去，那儿净是埋伏和腐臭。"
G["Aye. I was here when the dragon attacked."]="是啊，那只龙发动攻击时我正巧在那儿。"
G["Aye. It's been twisted and turned by too many spells. The fuss we - especially you - made with the portal was too much! The same spell that sent the Burning Legion back into their foul realm now works on the well! It's devouring itself and taking its surroundings with it! Fascinating, isn't it?"]="没错。滥用魔法导致了它的扭曲。我们——特别是你——处理传送门时做得太过火了！将燃烧军团送回扭曲虚空的力量现在影响到了永恒之井！它正在自我吞噬，并吸收周围的一切东西！真壮观，是吧？"
G["Aye. Thank you, Kurdran."]="谢谢你，库德兰。"
G["Aye. Tonight."]="是。就在今夜。"
G["Ayep! She's all mine... I'm gonna sail her around the world. Across the sea!"]="是的！她是我的……我准备用她穿越大海，穿越整个世界！"
G["Aysa and Ji have retrieved the spirits and brought them here. You are to go with them, speak to the great Shen-zin Su, and do what must be done to save our people."]="艾莎和季已经把元素之灵接来了。你要跟他们一起去觐见伟大的神真子，并尽你所能拯救我们的人民。"
G["Aysa sighs."]="艾莎叹了口气。"
G["Aysa, I want you to go to the Singing Pools to find Shu, the spirit of water."]="艾莎，你立即去咏之池寻找上古水灵涓流。"
G["Aysa, this is our only option. We blow the ship free, then we heal his wound. We have no other solution."]="艾莎，这是我们唯一的选择。把船炸掉，然后治愈他的伤口。我们没其他办法了。"
G["Aysa? I don't know what to say to her. Should I tell her she's gorgeous, or would she find that creepy? Maybe I could tell her I admire her poise - but then she might think I don't have any personality!"]="艾莎？我不知道该和她说些什么。也许我应该说“你长得很迷人”，但她会不会觉得我这样很怪？或许我可以告诉她我很钦慕她那从容不迫的姿态 ——但我又怕她觉得我这个人缺乏个性！"
G["Ayup! Silly youngin, just put rod in hole. And the mallet shall again be whole."]="没错！笨小子，杵柄入杵头，钟杵重现世。"
G["Ayup, word got around fast and soon the whole of Menethil gathered around to see it through, with bettin' and fruit vendors and the like, an' there were some consternation over the rules that had to be ironed out with a big rigamarole, 'til the mayor hisself agreed that weepin' blood tain't count fer nothin'.\n\nSo Chuck kneels down an' she gets up on a stool and REARS back with that big 'ol thick leg of hers and - but I'm digressin'. Point is, I shoulda taken the deal, 'cuz this gun's a bit dodgy."]="唔，这消息以惊人的速度传播。没过多久，米奈希尔港的所有人都聚集了起来，有些人开始打赌，水果小贩则干脆就地做起了生意。他们就具体的规则进行了冗长的争论，直到镇长亲自出面他们才达成了共识：擦血不算输。\n\n就这样，查克跪倒下去，她则在一只凳子上挺起身，扬起她的那条大粗腿——我好像扯远了。重点是，我当时真应该接受那提议，因为这把枪现在有点儿不灵光了。"
G["Azeroth has been assaulted from forces beyond this plane of existence..."]="艾泽拉斯遭到了进攻，而入侵者来自于现实位面以外的空间……"
G["Azeroth has cowered too long under our shadow!  Now, feel the power of the Burning Crusade and despair!"]="艾泽拉斯已经在我们的阴影下畏缩得太久了！现在，感受燃烧的远征给你们带来的绝望吧！"
G["Azeroth has many strange traditions. This one, I like."]="艾泽拉斯世界有很多奇怪的传统。我就喜欢万圣节这个传统节日。"
G["Azeroth has no place for the likes of you."]="艾泽拉斯可不是你们能来的。"
G["Azeroth has no place for you!"]="艾泽拉斯不欢迎你！"
G["Azeroth is coming to an end. Make your peace now!"]="艾泽拉斯即将完结。赶快忏悔吧！"
G["Azeroth lives to see another day!"]="艾泽拉斯又逃过了一劫！"
G["Azeroth will be reforged under a single banner!"]="艾泽拉斯世界将会重新臣服同一面旗帜之下！"
G["Azeroth will burn!"]="艾泽拉斯将会毁灭！"
G["Azsharite Core at 60 percent integrity..."]="El núcleo de azsharita está al 60 por ciento de integridad..."
G["Azsharite? You soft ones come up with new names for everything. What is this \"azsharite?\""]="¿Azsharita? Vosotros, blanditos, tenéis nombres para todo. ¿Qué es \"azsharita\"?"
G["Azure Dragonshrine"]="碧蓝巨龙圣地"
G["Azure Templar!  I hold your crest of beckoning.  Heed my summons!"]="碧蓝圣殿骑士！我手中握着你的召唤纹章。响应我的召唤吧！"
G["Azuregos! I remember him. Tall, blue, big fangs. Nice sort really, if a little loopy. Haven't seen him in weeks."]="艾索雷葛斯！我记得他。又高又蓝，大牙齿。真是个好家伙，虽然有点怪癖。有几个星期没见他了。"
G["Azzaga choogo zinn!"]="¡Azzaga choogo zinn!"
G["B-but it's my family farm. I can't just sell it."]="但……但这是我们家传的农场，我不能卖。"
G["B-gawkk!!"]="嘎嘎！！"
G["BACK to the earth with you!"]="回到尘土中去！"
G["BAD WORM! THAT'S A BAD BAD BAD WORM!"]="坏虫子！那是个非常非常非常坏的虫子！"
G["BAD, BAD, ALLIANCE!"]="可恶，可恶，可恶的联盟！"
G["BAD, BAD, HORDIE!"]="可恶，可恶，可恶的部落！"
G["BAH! You gnats actually hurt me... Perhaps I've toyed with you long enough... Now - taste the VENGEANCE OF THE GRAVE!"]="哼！这些蛆虫居然让我受伤了！… 也许戏弄该结束了……现在－－感受大墓地的复仇吧！"
G["BAH! Your shadows frighten no one, Bastoon. This one is mine."]="呸！你的影子吓唬不了任何人，巴斯东。这家伙是我的了。"
G["BAM!"]="砰！"
G["BAM! BOOM! A-hahahahaha!"]="嘭！轰！啊哈哈哈哈！"
G["BAM! Look at dat gristle sizzle!"]="哈哈！听那烤软骨的滋滋声！"
G["BANG! BANG! BANG!  I'm beefing up the car!!!"]="哐！哐！哐！我正在加固我的战车！"
G["BAR FIGHT!"]="酒吧斗殴！"
G["BE BATHED IN FLAME!"]="被烈焰吞没吧！"
G["BEAT THEM DOWN THEN KILL! THEN SHACKLE!"]="把他们打倒，消灭他们！给他们戴上镣铐！"
G["BEES! Jump in water to get them off!"]="蜜蜂！快跳进水里把它们甩掉！"
G["BEGONE!"]="滚开！"
G["BEHIND US! They've taken the ships!"]="他们就在后面！已经占领了船只！"
G["BEHOLD MY POWER!"]="见识一下我的力量！"
G["BEHOLD YOUR DOOM!"]="面对你的末日！"
G["BEHOLD! I have truly mastered the fel energies of this world! The demonic power I now command... It is indescribable, unlimited, OMNIPOTENT!"]="看呐！我真的掌握了这个世界的魔能！现在，我掌握着恶魔之力……它难以名状，无穷无尽，无所不能！"
G["BEHOLD, MY GLORIOUS DESTINY!"]="见证我充满荣耀的命运吧！啊哈哈哈！"
G["BEST! WEDDING! EVAR! *Hic*"]="无与伦比的！婚礼！（嗝儿）"
G["BETRAYER!"]="叛徒！"
G["BEWARE!\n\nMyzerian can see through your disguise!"]="小心！\n\n麦泽利安能看穿你的伪装！"
G["BLASTED DEAD END! So this is how it ends. Prepare yourselves, heroes, for today we make our final stand!"]="天杀的死路！看来真的无路可走了。准备战斗，英雄们，让我们放手一搏！"
G["BLAZE OF DEATH!"]="死亡之焰！"
G["BLECCHH!!"]="呕……"
G["BLEEAAAGGHHH! I'm a monster, don't look at me!"]="啊！！我是个怪物，别看我！"
G["BLLAAAGGGGHHHHH!"]="嘎啊啊啊啊！"
G["BLOOD AND TERROR!"]="鲜血与恐怖！"
G["BLOOD AND THUNDER, RIGHT!?"]="鲜血与雷鸣，对吧？！"
G["BLOOD! DELICIOUS! You shall feed me!"]="鲜血！可口的鲜血！你将成为我的美餐！"
G["BOAR'S DUNG! Why must I stay here to guide others to Alterac Valley, when I could be fighting there myself? You! Have you come to fight the Alliance?"]="野猪粪！为什么当我自己可以上阵杀敌的时候，却让我站在这里指引别人去奥特兰克山谷？你！你去跟联盟打过仗了吗？"
G["BOMB! IT'S A TRAP! RUN!"]="炸弹！这是陷阱！快跑！"
G["BONE STORM!"]="白骨风暴！"
G["BOOM shakalaka!"]="轰！噼里啪啦！"
G["BOOM!"]="砰！"
G["BOOM!\n\nThat's the last thing I remember..."]="砰！\n\n我只记得听见一声巨响……"
G["BOOM! Explosion! Overpowering!"]="轰！爆炸！全炸飞！"
G["BOOM! Hahahahah..."]="砰！哈哈哈哈哈……"
G["BOOM! That so good! More! More!"]="砰！真棒！再来！再来！"
G["BOOO!  Did I scare you?\n\nHallow's End is all about two things, tricks and treats!  Some adults think it's more.  They tried to tell me, but I got bored, until things got set on fire.  That was cool!\n\nBut still, even fire can get boring.  I can tell you what doesn't get boring... Tricking people and eating candy!\n\nBut I only want one kind of candy, Candy Coins!  They are the best.  They look like real gold coins!  Also, if you have too many coins, you can eat them!  It's like being rich and eating your money!  It's crazy!\n\nSo... Do you have some coins you want to trade?"]="嘭！我吓到你了没？\n\n万圣节只有两件事最重要：糖果和捣乱！大人们觉得还有别的更重要的事情，他们想向我灌输他们的想法，但我觉得除了点火以外都太无聊了，那真的很酷！\n\n但话说回来，就算是点火也会无聊的。你知道什么永远不会无聊吗？给别人捣乱和吃糖果！\n\n但我只想要一种糖果，就是糖果硬币！那是最棒的糖果，看起来像真的金币一样！而且如果你嫌硬币太多的话，你可以吃掉它们！感觉就像钱多得可以当饭吃一样！那太疯狂了！\n\n你有想要交易的硬币吗？"
G["BOOORING!!"]="无聊死啦！！！"
G["BOW DOWN BEFORE THE GOD OF DEATH!"]="在死亡之神的面前屈服吧！"
G["BOW DOWN BEFORE THE SAN'LAYN!"]="向萨莱因屈服吧！"
G["BOW DOWN TO THE ALMIGHTY! BOW DOWN BEFORE MY INFERNAL DESTRO... chicken?"]="向全能的主鞠躬吧！满怀敬畏之情看着我所召唤出来的毁灭一切的地狱……小鸡？"
G["BRAIIIIINS!!!"]="食物！！！"
G["BRAINNNS!"]="鲜美的脑！"
G["BREAK!"]="击垮！"
G["BRING IT, PIPSQUEAK!"]="来啊，小矮子！"
G["BRRRRRR!"]="啊！"
G["BRUCE!"]="布鲁斯！"
G["BRUUUUUUUUCE!"]="布——鲁——斯！"
G["BRUUUUUUUUUUUUCE!"]="布——鲁——斯——！"
G["BURN BEFORE ME!"]="在我面前燃烧吧！"
G["BURN IN HELLFIRE!"]="在地狱之火中煎熬吧！"
G["BURN IN HOLY FIRE!"]="在圣火中化为灰烬吧！"
G["BURN IN LIQUID FLAME!"]="在烈焰之流中燃烧！"
G["BURN IN MY HATRED!"]="被我的仇恨吞噬吧！"
G["BURN IT DOWN!"]="把这里夷为平地！"
G["BURN THEIR FLESH AND SEAR THEIR BONES!"]="烧尽他们的血肉筋骨！"
G["BURN!"]="燃烧！"
G["BURN! Burn in the Maker's fire!"]="燃烧吧！在造物者的烈火中燃烧吧！"
G["BURN! You wretches! BURN!"]="燃烧吧！你们这些悲惨的家伙！燃烧吧！"
G["BURN, BABY, BURN!"]="燃烧吧，宝贝儿，燃烧吧！"
G["BURNINATE!"]="燃烧殆尽！"
G["BURNS! IT BURNS!"]="啊！火焰般的光芒！！！"
G["BUT STAY AWAY FROM THE  BIG VILLAGE! There's dozens o' mad ice trolls in there! Oh, that Zandalari priest has 'em whipped up into a great frenzy."]="但别靠近那座大村子！那里全是发疯的冰巨魔！唉……那个赞达拉祭司让他们都发了疯！"
G["BUTCHER! DIE!"]="刽子手！去死吧！"
G["BUY NOODLES!"]="卖面啦！"
G["BWAH HAH HAH HAH HAH!"]="喔，哈哈哈哈！"
G["BY FIRE BE PURGED!"]="让火焰净化一切吧！"
G["BY FIRE BE PURGED! Hey what's up?"]="让火焰净化一切吧！嗨，怎么了？"
G["BY FIRE BE PURGED!!!!"]="让火焰净化一切！！！！"
G["BY FIRE BE... BURNED!"]="让烈焰……烧尽一切吧！"
G["BY THE LIGHT BE RENEWED!"]="在圣光的照耀下焕发新生！"
G["BY THE LIGHT OF ELUNE! Eredar! Cursed demons, what have you done to me? I have not come alone, we will fight you as we have in the past! I..."]="以艾露恩之光的名义！艾瑞达人！你们这群被诅咒的恶魔，你们对我做了什么？我并不是独身一人，我们会像以前那样和你们战斗到底！我……"
G["BY THE LIGHT! Could it be? Could this be it?"]="以圣光的名义！真的是这样吗？这就是我们所需要的东西吗？"
G["BY THE LIGHT! Those damned monsters! Look at what they've done to our people!"]="天啊！该死的怪物！看看它们对我们的人民做了些什么！"
G["BY THE LIGHT!!"]="以圣光的名义！"
G["BY THE MIGHT OF THE LICH KING!"]="以巫妖王的力量为名！"
G["BYE, BYE, DADDY!"]="再见，爸爸！"
G["Ba'anthalso-dorei!"]="¡Ba'anthalso-dorei!"
G["Ba-Bam still up and Bammin' Brews!"]="巴巴姆还没醉，巴巴姆还能喝！"
G["Ba-ba-ba-ba BAM!"]="啪啪啪啪，嘭！"
G["Babba booey...."]="$gTontorrón:Tontorrona;..."
G["Baby Gorilla Pet"]="猩猩宝宝"
G["Baby wants her dolly!"]="把洋娃娃还给她！"
G["Baby wants his dolly!"]="小囡囡想要他的娃娃了！"
G["Back at the barracks, I heard murmurings of this \"sha.\"\n\nYou should have heard the crazy stories - sha possessing our strongest troops? Simply tales to scare children.\n\nThe sha are nothing that I and my sisters cannot handle."]="En el barracón, oí hablar de los \"sha\".\n\nNo sabes qué locuras... ¿sha que poseen a nuestros soldados más fuertes? No son más que cuentos para asustar a los niños.\n\nLos sha no son nada que mis hermanas y yo no podamos manejar."
G["Back behind me, where you first came in, there is a large thermal vent, blowing hot air up and out of this place. Stand on top of the vent, and then... jump! The momentum from your leap should be enough to propel you up to the top.\n\nOh, one more thing - based on some reports I'm hearing from fellow druids, make sure you watch your head on the way out."]="在我身后，就是你刚进来的地方，有一个很大的排气口，里面喷出的热气流能够一直升腾到外面。你只要站在排气口上，然后……这么一跳！你跃起的动能就足以把你送到顶上去了。\n\n噢，还有一件事——根据我从其他德鲁伊那里打听来的情况看，你出去的时候，最好小心你的脑袋。"
G["Back for more? Fights are only going to get tougher from here on out."]="又回来了？往后的战斗只会越来越难。"
G["Back from a long journey? Rest and relax at the Pig and Whistle!"]="刚刚长途旅行归来？在猪和哨声旅店休息放松一下吧！"
G["Back in business! Now, to execute an exit strategy."]="快去干活！现在是时候实施我们的越狱计划了。"
G["Back in my day, we fought demons! Real ones!"]="想当年，我们和恶魔战斗！真正的恶魔！"
G["Back in the day 'afore the day, me and me mates didn't have much in the way of drinkin' money, as is we spent our pay on booze an' that didn't leave none left over for more casual drinkin'.\n\nSo we decide we're gonna comm-an-deer one of them epic-sized kegs of ol' Barkerstout from the loft of Barky's Brewpub.\n\nWe chopped the supports out with hatchets and that ol' boy just up an' ROLLED on out through the side of the thatch roof like a baby bird leavin' the nest, but some sort of big round beer bird, that could crush a man."]="在很久以前，我和我的同伴根本没有几个钱喝酒。几番豪饮之后，我们就花光了所有的铜板，搞得连每天的日常酒钱都没了着落。\n\n于是我们决定上老巴克的啤酒馆去，从他堆在酒馆顶楼上那些硕大的啤酒桶里“征收”一桶来。\n\n说干就干，我们用短柄斧砍断了支撑酒桶的架子，好家伙，那满满装着啤酒的酒桶就这么从茅草屋顶上滚了下去，就好象一只从巢里掉出来的鸟崽，呃，应该是只大胖鸟，能轧死人的那种。"
G["Back in the war - not that one, the udder one - when them orcs rode dragons? Me and Whistler set out to cross from Southshore to Menethil Harbor inna rowboat we'd built outta knotty pine while soused to our eyeballs on Cherry Grog.\n\nAn' we got about a third the way by my reckoning, which were mostly far judgin' by the fact that there were nothing all around us but the sea, when my feet got to start feelin' wet."]="在那场战争中——我说的是很早以前的那场战争。那时兽人好似都还骑着龙打仗？总之，我和威斯利从南海镇出发，前往米奈希尔港。我们只乘着一艘用多节的松木做成的独木舟，肚子里灌满了樱桃酒。\n\n因为周围只有海水，所以我们很难判断走了多远的路。不过，应该是在走完三分之一路程的时候，我感到我的脚被打湿了。"
G["Back into the lava with you..."]="和你一起回岩浆里去……"
G["Back off or I'll cut you in half."]="退后，否则我会把你一下子砍成两半的。"
G["Back off!"]="后退！"
G["Back off! Dip-slithers!"]="后退！爬行动物！"
G["Back off, flower-head. That's MY $c you're talking about!"]="Cuidado, cabeza flor. ¡Nadie habla así de mis amigos!"
G["Back off, pup!"]="退后，小崽子！"
G["Back so soon, $n? Did you learn anything from the dockworkers?"]="$n，这么快就回来了？有没有从码头工人那里得到什么消息？"
G["Back so soon?"]="这么快就回来了？"
G["Back to Teldrassil for me. Farewell, everyone!"]="就算是为了我，一定要回到泰达希尔啊。大家，再见了!"
G["Back to being an old rust bucket."]="又变成一堆废铜烂铁了。"
G["Back to de plaguelands!"]="返回瘟疫之地！"
G["Back to learn more, $n? Come over here and show me you are ready."]="¿Has vuelto para aprender más cosas, $n? Ven aquí y demuéstrame que estás $glisto:lista;."
G["Back to square one, I guess. What's it going to take to get this thing off the ground?"]="恐怕要从头来过了。到底要怎么样这玩意儿才能飞起来？"
G["Back to the cold dark with you!"]="回到寒冷的黑暗中去吧！"
G["Back to the drawing board."]="回到制图板的后面。"
G["Back to the earth with you!"]="回到尘土中去！"
G["Back to the fight!"]="我又能重新投入战斗了！"
G["Back to the fightin'!"]="重新投入战斗！"
G["Back to the sands with you, wretch!"]="回到沙子里去吧，渣滓！"
G["Back to the ship!"]="回到船上去！"
G["Back to the temple. I will pick up the slack here."]="你先回圣殿。我留下收拾烂摊子。"
G["Back to the topic...  we should focus our attention on these manaforges.  We need to learn what the enemy is doing with them and why."]="话过三句必跑题……我们应当把注意力放在这些法力熔炉上。我们需要知道敌人正在用它们做什么，以及为什么要这么做。"
G["Back to the void with you!"]="滚回虚空中去吧！"
G["Back to work Cultists!"]="教徒们，回去工作！"
G["Back to work for me. I'm a busy goblin!"]="快回来为我工作。我是个忙碌的地精！"
G["Back to work you lazy dead cur!"]="回去工作，你这个懒家伙！"
G["Back to work!"]="回去工作！"
G["Back to work! I've dealt with our little distraction."]="回去做事！我已经摆平了来惹事的家伙。"
G["Back to work, dog!"]="狗东西，回去工作！"
G["Back to work, dogs! We're behind schedule!"]="回去工作，废物！我们的进度已经落后了！"
G["Back to work, you pathetic grunts! A bunch of rebels and Alliance weaklings aren't going to stop us!"]="快回去干活，你们这些可悲的畜生！一小撮叛徒和联盟懦夫阻挡不了我们！"
G["Back to your maker!"]="去和你的造物主团聚吧！"
G["Back to your patrol, worm! That shield is more valuable to me than a hundred of you..."]="你这垃圾，回到巡逻队中去！对我来说，那护盾比一百个你都要有价值……"
G["Back to your post, soldier! We'll find this land, or die trying."]="坚守岗位，士兵！就算死也要找到那片陆地。"
G["Back to your studies, boy!"]="回去学习吧，孩子！"
G["Back up is on the way.  Keep up the fight!"]="增援就在路上。继续战斗！"
G["Back when the world was still young, the first kypari trees bloomed."]="遥想混沌初开之时，第一批凯帕圣树花开如锦。"
G["Back you mindless wretch! Back to the pit!"]="没脑子的蠢货！滚到坑里去！"
G["Back!"]="回去！"
G["Back!  I cast you back... corrupter of faith!  Author of pain!  Do not return, or suffer the same fate as you did here today!"]="退散！我命令你退散……信念的腐蚀者！痛苦的创造者！不要再回来，否则你会遭受到和今天同样的失败命运。"
G["Back, I say!"]="给我回去！"
G["Back, foul beings of darkness!  You have no power here!"]="退却吧，肮脏的黑暗！你在这里没有力量！"
G["Back, hold them back!"]="顶住！给我顶住！"
G["Back, vermin! (Insects! Weak and small!)"]="回去，蛆虫！（软弱，渺小的虫子！）"
G["Back... to work..."]="回去……工作……"
G["Backhands $n solidly across the face."]="回手一拳结结实实地打在$n的脸上。"
G["Backup! We need backup!"]="增援！我们需要增援！"
G["Bad fortune for you!"]="倒霉去吧！"
G["Bad fortune for you."]="祝你倒霉。"
G["Bad fortune to be here."]="来这里真是倒霉。"
G["Bad hang nail"]="坏的悬钉"
G["Bad juju ain't got nothin' on you, $gsweetie:girl;."]="不要害怕坏魂能，$g甜心:女孩;。"
G["Bad light... hurt..."]="该死的光……好痛……"
G["Bad mojo."]="啊……糟糕。"
G["Bad news, daddy..."]="真是糟糕……"
G["Bad news, everyone... I don't think I'm going to make it..."]="噩耗，各位……我觉得我要失败了……"
G["Bad news, sire."]="坏消息，陛下。"
G["Bad news.  We've been hit again.  They're gone, but the front sentry tower is on fire."]="坏消息。我们又遭到了袭击。他们跑了，但是前面的哨塔着火了。"
G["Bad plan to come here... many more adventures to be had before I risk this place. Be safe... I meet you later."]="真不该来这里……我还有很多冒险计划呢，干嘛要来这个鬼地方玩命。小心点……我们待会见。"
G["Bad slickies..."]="这些坏东西……"
G["Bad, $n. $n, bad!"]="坏，$n。$n，坏！"
G["Badmoon?  You mean Bloodmoon?"]="邪月岛？是血月岛吧？"
G["Bael Modan... the dwarves..."]="巴尔莫丹……那些矮人……"
G["Bagel-holes!"]="面包圈！"
G["Bagh! Back to work for me! Thank you kindly Belm."]="嘿！给我回去工作！多谢你，贝尔姆。"
G["Bagh! Your magic is weak!"]="哈哈哈！你的魔法太脆弱太可笑了！"
G["Bah!  <cough>  Far too smoky!  <cough>   Looks like you put in too much terrapin oil!  Try again!"]="¡Bah! <tos> ¡Demasiado humeante! <tos> ¡Parece que le has puesto demasiado aceite de tortuga de agua dulce! ¡Inténtalo de nuevo!"
G["Bah!  Do I look like I have time for idle chit-chat?\n\nDo I?\n\nBe quick about your business.  There are ogres to be killed!"]="呸！你看我有时间闲聊吗？\n\n有吗？\n\n快点去做你的工作。这里还有很多食人魔要杀呢！"
G["Bah!  Mailboxes...  all I get is junk mail lately!  \nIncrease the size of this... decrease the size of that... act now for your free Sword of Dragonslaying.  I have to change my mailbox number every other month!  \nWell, ye can't say I didn't warn ye.  If you're looking for the mailbox it's just outside the Stonefire Tavern."]="¡Bah! Buzones... ¡últimamente no recibo más que basura! \n\nAumenta el tamaño de esto... reduce el tamaño de eso otro... consigue gratis tu Espada Cazadragones. ¡Tengo que cambiar mi número de buzón todos los meses! \n\nBien, después no digas que no te lo advertí. Si buscas el buzón, lo encontrarás a las puertas de la Taberna Roca de Fuego."
G["Bah!  Mere luck!  My pets will make mincemeat out of you yet!"]="呸！只是运气好而已！我的宠物会把你撕个粉碎！"
G["Bah!  Suit yourselves.  We're leaving!"]="哈！可笑，我们要走了！"
G["Bah!  This just looks like a dead end.  Let's head back the other way."]="啊！这好像是死路。我们走另一条路试试看。"
G["Bah! Bested by de likes of you! What a shame for a Zandalari Priest ta endure."]="呸！被你这种人打败！对赞达拉祭司来说简直是耻辱。"
G["Bah! By the time you got in range of old Trollplow you would be in reduced to rubble!"]="哈！只要你一进入我的射程，包你马上粉身碎骨！"
G["Bah! Cowards and fools! Return to my platform if you dare to face me!"]="呸！胆小鬼，蠢货！如果你们够胆的话，就回到我的平台上来跟我较量！"
G["Bah! Dere's got to be some here somewhere..."]="呸！这里应该有一些的……"
G["Bah! Failed again!"]="啊！又失败了！"
G["Bah! I do not want to talk about it."]="哼！我实在不想说这件事。"
G["Bah! I had my whole paycheck riding on that one!"]="啊！我把我的家当都压在那个上面了！"
G["Bah! I will crush you myself. Let us see how you fare against Lightning."]="呸！我要亲自动手。看看你们要怎么抗衡闪电吧。"
G["Bah! If I ever be in charge'a dis place, da first t'ing I be doin' is stoppin' alla dat. Ja be markin' my words."]="哎！如果我可以掌管这个地方，我要做的第一件事情就是停止这些花哨的东西。你记住我的话。"
G["Bah! Incompetent!"]="唉！废物！"
G["Bah! Leave an old man be!"]="呸！让老头我清静清静！"
G["Bah! Muradin, secure the deck and prepare our soldiers for an assault on the upper citadel. I'll send out another regiment from Stormwind."]="穆拉丁，守住甲板，组织士兵向城堡上层发动进攻。我会带另一支暴风城部队过去。"
G["Bah! My power rules here!"]="哈！我的力量统治着这里！"
G["Bah! Now pet eat you!"]="哈！我的宠物要吃了你！"
G["Bah! Pain don't hurt!"]="哈！不痛不痒！"
G["Bah! Perhaps I WANT to be seen? I tire of skulking."]="呸！我想要被看见？我只是努力想要藏起来。"
G["Bah! Rowdy tauren don't scare me none."]="呸！吵闹的牛头人吓不住我。"
G["Bah! That's no fun!"]="呸！这一点都不好笑！"
G["Bah! Unless he wants his home overrun by these serpents, he'd better show himself..."]="呸！除非他想让他家里塞满这些纳迦，否则他最好赶紧出现……"
G["Bah! You wouldn't know a great steam engine if it smacked you upside the head!"]="呸！你这没开过蒸汽坦克的乡巴佬懂什么！"
G["Bah! You're as dumb as a rock! I hope the worms eat all of you."]="呸！你这蠢货！我真想把你扔去喂虫子！"
G["Bah, I'm not gettin' paid enough for this."]="呸，挣这点钱可不够我花的。"
G["Bah, another splinter from my hoe!"]="呸，我锄头又崩掉了一个角！"
G["Bah, couldn't you have dragged it out a bit! People don't pay me when you make it look that easy! Add some theatrics to it, will ya?!"]="呸，你就不能拖拖他的后腿？如果你让这一切显得太容易，人们就不会给我钱了！再加一些戏剧效果吧，好吗？！"
G["Bah, it isn't here.  Where did I have that blasted thing at last?"]="唉，它不在这里。我到底把那个东西丢在哪里了？"
G["Bah, it's an improvement."]="呸，还是有进步的。"
G["Bah, it's not here.  I wonder where I left it last..."]="呸！不在这儿。让我想想上次把它放在哪儿了……"
G["Bah, let a pandaren hope, would you?  I'm going to miss the old man."]="唉，就不能让我心存侥幸吗？我会想念那老头儿的。"
G["Bah, predictable! They'll see it comin'!"]="呸，不出所料！他们会看到的！"
G["Bah, real fishermen take on the fiercest rains!"]="啊，真正的渔夫会出现在瓢泼的大雨中！"
G["Bah, rogues have done nothing but make our job here in Stormwind harder. I wish I could drag both Osborne and Mathias both out of Old Town and right to the Stockade."]="哎，潜行者只会影响我们在暴风城的工作。我真希望能把奥斯伯和马迪亚斯直接送到暴风城监狱去。"
G["Bah, that's goblin work!  Still, we have an orc here in Razor Hill that will teach you of such things.  Look for Mukdrak over near the forge."]="呸，那是地精的东西！在剃刀岭有一个兽人可以教你如何制作这些物品。去熔炉附近找穆德拉克吧。"
G["Bah, this just looks like a dead end.  That bed does look comfy though.  Let's try the other way."]="啊！这好像是死路。尽管这张床看上去无比舒适。我们走另一条路看看。"
G["Bah, useless! There must be another way..."]="唉，没用！肯定还有其它的办法……"
G["Baine wonderin' if Garrosh might not be fit for chief."]="贝恩则怀疑加尔鲁什是否合适当酋长。"
G["Baine! You've shown yourself! GET HIM!"]="贝恩！你暴露了！去干掉他！"
G["Baine, you and your warriors hold this junction. These heroes should forge ahead an' flush the Warchief out of hiding."]="贝恩，你和你的战士们守住这里。这些英雄们要继续前进，找到加尔鲁什的踪迹。"
G["Baine. We be needin' ya support. Razor Hill be but an outpost - the walls of Orgrimmar be fortified since da Cataclysm."]="贝恩。我们需要你。剃刀岭只是一处前哨——大灾变之后，奥格瑞玛的城墙更加坚固了。"
G["Bal, lamer zhita!"]="¡Bal, lamer zhita!"
G["Balai Lok'Wein of Brackenwall Village in Dustwallow Marsh sells a manual that you will need to study in order to improve your skills!"]="尘泥沼泽蕨墙村的格鲁克卡恩在卖指南书，你需要好好研究它来提高自己的技能！"
G["Balance has been restored!"]="平衡已经恢复了！"
G["Balance must be restored!"]="平衡必须得到恢复！"
G["Balandar sent me to get you out of here and reclaim his cargo. He's waiting for you in Brackenwall Village."]="巴尔兰达派我到这里来救你出去，顺便拿回他的货物。他在蕨墙村等着你。"
G["Bale can teach you the ways of survival.  Look for him on the Hunter Rise."]="拜尔可以教你学习生存技能，到猎手大厅去找他吧。"
G["Baleflame! Your tender flesh shall be an appropriate meal for my whelps!"]="烽焰！你软弱的肉体将成为我的幼崽们最好的食物！"
G["Balgaras?! And the others...you were all dead! What foul trick is this?"]="巴尔加拉斯？！还有其他人……你们全都死了！这到底是什么邪恶的伎俩？"
G["Balgor! No!"]="巴尔格！不！"
G["Ballad of Liu Lang."]="刘浪之歌。"
G["Ballyhoo hip hip hooray!"]="让我们欢呼，万岁，万岁，万岁！"
G["Baltharus leaves no survivors!"]="巴尔萨鲁斯从不留活口！"
G["Balthus Stoneflayer is the one to see about Skinning.  If it can be skinned, he can teach ye how.  Just walk yerself over to Finespindle's Leather Goods on the northern side of The Great Forge."]="巴尔萨斯·裂石是一名剥皮师，他会教你如何剥皮的。去大熔炉北边的皮甲用品店找他吧。"
G["Bam ba-ba-BAM!"]="砰！叭叭——碰！"
G["Bam bam BOOM!"]="啪啪，砰！"
G["Bam!"]="砰！"
G["Bam! Hah! Got it good!"]="啪！哈哈！击中啦！"
G["Ban is a great strategist, but he fails to see the most obvious solution."]="班是个伟大的战略家，但他没能看清最明显的解决方法。"
G["Ban is to blame for this. That old, blind fool."]="这都要怪班。那个瞎了眼的老蠢货。"
G["Ban should have arrived by now... Look for him at the edge of the camp."]="班应该已经到了……到营地外围去找他吧。"
G["Ban, would you please give me more explosives?"]="班，能再多给我一些炸药吗？"
G["Ban, you look worried."]="班，你看起来很担心。"
G["Bananas for everyone!"]="人人都得吃香蕉！"
G["Band'or shorel'aran!"]="¡Band’or shorel’aran!"
G["Bandages you say? Yes, well, if memory serves from the last time I was told, it would appear that the Alliance has created $2076w of $2077w linen bandages, $2082w of $2083w silk bandages and $2088w of $2090w runecloth bandages."]="你是说绷带吗？哦，如果我没有记错的话，联盟已经收集到$2076w根亚麻绷带、$2082w根丝质绷带和$2088w根符文布绷带了，而总的需求量分别是$2077w、$2083w和$2090w。"
G["Bandages, anti-venoms and such things, these are the inevitable necessities of life on the plains.  Vira Younghoof can teach you this knowledge.  You can find her in the long house on the west side of Bloodhoof Village."]="绷带、抗毒药品这些东西在草原生活中是不可缺少的必需品。维尔拉·幼蹄能教你如何制作它们。你可以在血蹄村西边的房子中找到她。"
G["Bandages? Why, do you intend to survive long enough to need them? Har! Very well, $r, I will tell you. Of the $2080w wool bandaged needed, we have collected $2079w. Also to date, we have taken in $2085w out of $2086w mageweave bandages, and $2089w of $2090w runecloth bandages asked for."]="绷带？为什么，你需要绷带救命吗？哈哈！很好，$R，我会告诉你的。我们已经收集到$2079w根绒线绷带了，总的需求量是$2080w根。另外，到目前为止，我们拥有$2085w根魔纹绷带和$2089w根符文布绷带，总的需求量分别是$2086w和$2090w。"
G["Bandits and emperors; we both take what we want!"]="做强盗和做皇帝一样，都是各取所需！"
G["Banish <PH>"]="Desterrar <PH>"
G["Banished to the Nether!"]="被逐入虚空吧！"
G["Bank"]="银行"
G["Bank in Trade Quarter central tower.  You not miss it."]="银行就在贸易区中心的塔中。你不会找不到的。"
G["Bank of Ironforge"]="铁炉堡银行"
G["Bank of Stormwind"]="暴风城银行"
G["Banker option"]="银行选项"
G["Bar the gates. The Zandalari have failed to hold the wall."]="堵上大门。赞达拉守不住城墙了。"
G["Barber"]="理发师"
G["Barber? That is Naznik! He on top floor of Trade Quarter, near bank."]="理发师纳兹尼克在贸易区的上层，紧邻银行。"
G["Bare your soul to me, mortal."]="向我敞开灵魂，凡人。"
G["Barely a scratch on you! Way to go!"]="你身上连个刮痕都没有！干得好！"
G["Barely hit the target that time. Hmmm,... maybe I need to adjust back to the right."]="这次几乎射中目标了。嗯……也许我该再往右边瞄瞄。"
G["Barely. He needs a medic and soon!"]="他快死了，需要马上送医！"
G["Baristolth, I have lost my badge and require a replacement."]="巴里斯托尔斯，我把我的勋章弄丢了，我需要一个新的。"
G["Barkeep!  Bring out your strongest ale.  We're off to the front."]="老板！把你们最烈的麦酒拿上来。我们就要上前线了。"
G["Barkley, we do NOT aim with our eyes closed!"]="巴克利，我们闭上眼睛就没法瞄准了！"
G["Barleybrew brew!  Won't fill you up, won't kill you...  The Thunderbrews can't say the same."]="麦酒是不会让你感到腹胀，也不会上头……的美酒。雷酒可不敢这么说。"
G["Barleybrew will treat you right!  Check out the Barleybrews at Brewfest!"]="麦酒是你的最佳选择！去美酒节尝尝麦酒吧！"
G["Barleybrew, finest brewery in Azeroth!"]="麦酒，艾泽拉斯最好的酒！"
G["Barleybrew, finest brewery in Azeroth!  Check them out at Brewfest!"]="麦酒，艾泽拉斯最好的酒！来美酒节尝尝吧！"
G["Barnil, I seem to have misplaced Chapter I."]="巴尼尔，我好像把第一章给弄丢了。"
G["Barnil, I seem to have misplaced Chapter II."]="巴尼尔，我好像把第二章给弄丢了。"
G["Barnil, I seem to have misplaced Chapter III."]="巴尼尔，我好像把第三章给弄丢了。"
G["Barnil, I seem to have misplaced Chapter IV."]="巴尼尔，我好像把第四章给弄丢了。"
G["Baron Sablemane. It will be on your lips as you gasp your dying breath."]="我是萨博迈恩男爵。你很快就要呼出生命中的最后一口气息了。"
G["Barrel smell like gunpowder..."]="桶子闻起来像火药……"
G["Barrels like these are unique in this region. Short, round...."]="这些是祖阿曼特有的桶吧。桶身很短、很圆……"
G["Barring stray boulders from those giants, we should be clear... it seems a mess down there though."]="只要别被巨人扔下的石块砸到，我们就很安全……虽然下面已经被砸得一团糟了。"
G["Bartlett the Brave has set up gryphon roosts here in town.  If you're looking to take a ride, then talk to him."]="勇敢的巴特利在这个镇子里建立了狮鹫栖息地。如果你要骑乘狮鹫，就去找他吧。"
G["Based on the sample of the toxin you provided for us, we think you will need the following: an arcane quickener, five somatic intensifiers, and and four pieces of runecloth.  With the vitreous focuser in tow, acquire the intensifiers from zombie or ghoul undead here in the Plaguelands!\n\nOnce you have these items, you should be able to load the counter agent into that cauldron."]="根据你提供的样本，我们认为你需要下面这些东西：一份奥术催化剂、五份细胞增强剂和四块符文布。你可以使用玻璃放大镜从瘟疫之地的僵尸或食尸鬼身上获取细胞增强剂！\n\n一旦你获得了这些物品，就可以把它们放进天灾之锅里了。"
G["Based on the sample of the toxin you provided for us, we think you will need the following: an arcane quickener, four ectoplasmic resonators, and four pieces of runecloth.  With the vitreous focuser in tow, acquire the resonators from wraith and ghostly undead here in the Plaguelands!\n\nOnce you have these items, you should be able to load the counter agent into that cauldron."]="根据你提供的样本，我们认为你需要下面这些东西：一份奥术催化剂、四份外膜震荡体和四块符文布。你可以使用玻璃放大镜从瘟疫之地的鬼魂或怨灵身上获取外膜震荡体！\n\n一旦你获得了这些物品，就可以把它们放进天灾之锅里了。"
G["Based on the sample of the toxin you provided for us, we think you will need the following: an arcane quickener, six osseous agitators, and four pieces of runecloth.  With the vitreous focuser in tow, acquire the agitators from skeletal undead here in the Plaguelands!\n\nOnce you have these items, you should be able to load the counter agent into that cauldron."]="根据你提供的样本，我们认为你需要下面这些东西：一份奥术催化剂、六份骨质分离素和四块符文布。你可以使用玻璃放大镜从瘟疫之地的骸骨亡灵身上获取骨质分离素！\n\n一旦你获得了这些物品，就可以把它们放进天灾之锅里了。"
G["Bash it!"]="扁它！"
G["Bash'ir sends his regrets that he could not make it, but he sent me along to salve your disappointment."]="巴什伊尔对他不能与你交手表示遗憾，不过他派我来舒缓你失望的情绪。"
G["Basilisk"]="蜥蜴"
G["Bask in his power! Rise as an agent of the master's rage!"]="浸沐在主人的力量中！化作主人怒火的使徒！"
G["Bask in my radiance!"]="沐浴我的光辉吧！"
G["Bask in the glory of the Alliance, $r. Know today that you stand no chance of defeating me!"]="沐浴在联盟的荣光下吧，$r。今天你应该明白，你根本不可能打败我！"
G["Bask in the opulence of my people! Let yourself taste the fineries of living, if only this one time. Perhaps then may you die with finality, knowing that you have been touched by the hands of a god!\n\nMay you drink in the spittle that is sure to fly in your direction from disapproving blood elf - man, woman and child alike. Drink it down! Drink. It. DOWN!\n\nTo Silvermoon with you, barbarian!"]="享受血精灵富庶的生活吧！领略世间最奢华的装饰，哪怕一次也好。或许你走到生命尽头之时，还能回忆起今天这个被神灵眷顾的幸运日！\n\n饮下这杯酒吧，化解所有对血精灵的指责。饮下它吧！\n\n野蛮人，为了银月城干杯！"
G["Bastard."]="混蛋。"
G["Bastia, let's ride!"]="巴斯蒂亚，我们上吧！"
G["Bastoon! Humiliate the interlopers."]="巴斯东！击退闯入者。"
G["Bat"]="蝙蝠"
G["Bat Handler"]="蝙蝠管理员"
G["Bat gizzards again for the gnomes tonight..."]="侏儒们今晚又有蝙蝠胃囊吃啦……"
G["Bat man on upper level of Trade Quarter."]="贸易区上层的蝙蝠管理员。"
G["Bathe in the flaming blood of the earth!"]="沐浴在大地的烈焰之血中吧！"
G["Bathrobes with integrated shower-nozzles."]="带有喷水花洒的浴袍。"
G["Battle Goats GO!"]="作战山羊，冲吧！"
G["Battle Goats! Hooooooooozen!"]="作战山羊！猢——狲！"
G["Battle Goats! Jib-it!"]="作战山羊！停下！"
G["Battle Stance! Prepare for an offensive rush!"]="战斗姿态！准备发动冲锋！"
G["Battle forms, go!"]="作战形态，出发！"
G["Battle hard, brothers! Rouse our sleeping kin with the echoes of war!"]="努力战斗，兄弟们！用战斗的回响让同胞们觉醒吧！"
G["Battle here been going on for a while... these spark big-tongues have a lot more fight than the other ones."]="冲突已经持续好一阵子了……这里的大舌头怪似乎很有斗志。"
G["Battle is upon us. Crush them!"]="战斗打响了。粉碎他们！"
G["Battle result: embarrassing failure.  Incorporating new methods into battle regimen."]="战斗结果：可耻的失败。正在将新策略整合进战斗方案中。"
G["Battle!  I can smell your fear, $c!"]="杀啊！我能感受到你的恐惧，$c！"
G["Battlemaiden! You are needed on the battlefield. The Kvaldir have broken through our lines!"]="女武士！立即赶赴战场。克瓦迪尔已经突破了我们的战线！"
G["Battlemaiden, I have a task that requires your attention."]="女武士，我有一个任务需要你去完成。"
G["Battlemaiden, you honor me with your presence. Is it time for the ritual to commence?"]="女武士，你的出现使我倍感荣幸。现在可以开始仪式了吗？"
G["Battlemaster"]="战场军官"
G["Battlemasters"]="战场军官"
G["Battling that band of Twilight Hammer in the Morass, I could think of better places for a war."]="与沼泽中的暮光之锤信徒战斗，那感觉真是糟透了。"
G["Batton down the hatches, mateys!"]="放下舱口盖，伙计们！"
G["Bawk, bawk, bawk!  Happy Hallow's End, $n!"]="哈哈哈！万圣节快乐，$n！"
G["Baxter! Get in here and help! NOW!"]="巴柯斯特！到这儿来帮帮我！快来！"
G["Be Gone."]="走开。"
G["Be advised, $g Jackson : Princess; - I am in no mood for any comment that you think is cute or funny.  I am here to make sure that the Arch Druid's research proceeds as planned, and my orders are to weed out all non-hackers who do not pack the gear to serve in my beloved Cenarion Circle."]="考虑清楚，$g小子:姑娘;——我可没心情听你废话。我在这里的工作是确认大德鲁伊的研究工作正在按计划进行，而不是跟那些不愿为塞纳里奥议会效劳的家伙聊天。"
G["Be afraid no more, $n!"]="不用再害怕了，$n！"
G["Be alert!  The orcs and their allies are close!"]="保持警惕！兽人和他们的同伙过来了！"
G["Be alert, $n! We are surrounded!"]="小心，$n！我们被包围了！"
G["Be alert, you lazy mules!"]="保持警惕，你们这些没用的东西！"
G["Be at ease, mortal. Our time together here must be productive, and unclouded by tension.\n\nMuch depends on your ability to think clearly and reason well."]="轻松点，凡人。我们必须在不紧张的情况下有效交流。\n\n当然这主要取决于你是否思路清晰且明辨事理。"
G["Be at ease."]="安心的去吧。"
G["Be at peace, child."]="安息吧，孩子。"
G["Be at peace, dear friends."]="安息吧，我的朋友们。"
G["Be at peace, my sweet, sweet, Luhanaa."]="安息吧，我的爱，我的心，我的鲁哈娜。"
G["Be at peace, spirit."]="安息吧，灵魂。"
G["Be at peace."]="安息吧。"
G["Be aware of your serpent's movements. Focus, then strike as one!"]="留意翔龙的动作。你必须集中精神，做到人龙合一。"
G["Be aware of your surroundings."]="注意周围的环境。"
G["Be bathed in my power! Drink in my might! Battle for the glory of the Horde!"]="沐浴在我的力量中吧！吸取我的力量！为了部落的荣耀而战！"
G["Be bathed in the power of the Warchief! Drink in his might! Battle for the glory of the Horde!"]="沐浴在酋长的力量中吧！吸取他的力量！为了部落的荣耀而战！"
G["Be brave, friends. The reptile will thrash wildly. It is an act of desperation. When you are ready, give me the word."]="朋友，勇敢些。这只爬虫会剧烈地翻滚起来。那是绝望的表现。你准备好了就跟我说一声。"
G["Be brave, heroes."]="一定要勇敢，英雄们。"
G["Be careful - he is coming for you!"]="小心——他朝你去了！"
G["Be careful among the ruins, $c. The Kirin Tor spirits you find there will not recognize you as a friend.\n\nThe custodian and I are the only ones whose spirits retained a strong enough tie to this place to preserve our full identities in death."]="Ten cuidado en las ruinas, $c. Los espíritus del Kirin Tor que encontrarás, no te reconocerán como $gamigo:amiga;.\n\nEl custodio y yo somos los únicos cuyos espíritus mantenían un vínculo tan fuerte con este lugar como para conservar nuestra identidad en la muerte."
G["Be careful around my hawk. She's a biter."]="小心我的雄鹰。她会咬人的。"
G["Be careful around these parts, $r. The natives are ruthless."]="$r，处处小心啊。血孢平原生活着许多残忍的生物。"
G["Be careful de side you choose, bruddah."]="小心选择你的阵营，兄弟。"
G["Be careful going into the thicket, $c.  There is a harmful aura lingering about the place.  It must be the residue from whatever destroyed my fellow druids."]="进入这片树林的时候小心点，$c。这地方被一个邪恶的光环笼罩着，肯定是那些杀害我的德鲁伊同胞的家伙留下的。"
G["Be careful in the vale, $n. Enemies abound!"]="在谷地里要多加小心，$n。四周到处都是敌人！"
G["Be careful in there and come back in one piece!"]="小心点，一定要活着回来啊！"
G["Be careful out here. It's far more dangerous than it first seems."]="在这儿你要小心点。这里远比看上去更危险。"
G["Be careful out in the desert, $c."]="在沙漠里要多加小心，$c。"
G["Be careful out there, $n.  You don't want to be on that ship too long... a few more cannonballs and she'll be sunk."]="在外多加小心，$n。你不会想要在那艘船上待很久……再来几发炮弹她就会沉了。"
G["Be careful out there.\nAside from all the gigantic beasts, there's an enemy camp on the other end of this beach."]="Ten cuidado ahí fuera.\n\nAdemás de las bestias gigantes, hay un campamento enemigo en el otro extremo de esta playa."
G["Be careful out there. I heard that there are Southsea pirates in the bay.\n\nHmm, maybe I should go check for myself..."]="小心。我听说这片海湾里有南海海盗。\n\n嗯，也许我应该亲自去查看一下……"
G["Be careful what you wish for."]="当心你所期望的东西……"
G["Be careful with that thing, Jun-Jun! One strong gust of wind could carry you into the sea!"]="小心那东西，军军！一阵狂风就能把你卷到海里去！"
G["Be careful with yourself, $n. I might actually hesitate for an instant if I saw your undead husk on the field."]="好好保护自己，$n。如果让我看见你曝尸荒野，我大概会停留片刻向你致哀的。"
G["Be careful!"]="小心！"
G["Be careful! Da roof be comin' down!"]="小心！洞顶塌了！"
G["Be careful! The moment it pierces his hide, you will be assaulted by his power."]="注意！当长矛刺穿他的外皮时，你会受到他的反击。"
G["Be careful! They may be dead, but the pandriarchs are still dangerous."]="小心点！他们或许是死了，可这些族长还是很危险的。"
G["Be careful, $n.  Those wolves like to hide among the trees."]="小心，$n。那些狼喜欢隐藏在树林里。"
G["Be careful, $n. We can't risk being caught."]="小心点，$n。我们绝对不能被抓住。"
G["Be careful, Agrant!"]="小心点，阿加特！"
G["Be careful, Avuun.  One of the merchants that I trade with in Stonard has heard her raving about some horrible disease she's trying to perfect.  They say it's for use against the draenei!"]="小心一点，阿弗恩。有一个跟我们做过生意的斯通纳德商人说，瑟尔希喃喃自语着一些有关“她正在努力完善的疾病”的话。他们说那是为了对付德莱尼人而研究出来的东西！"
G["Be careful."]="小心点。"
G["Be careful. I would not want you to fall into the arena."]="小心。我可不想让你摔到赛场里去。"
G["Be cast into darkness!"]="堕入黑暗吧！"
G["Be cautious, but return quickly. We cannot afford to be blind."]="小心，快去快回吧。我们不能再盲目行事了。"
G["Be caweful with the waptors, they can be wewy wewy smawt.\n\nLast week two hewd me down while a thiwd beat me with a stick."]="小心那些恐龙，它们可能非常非常聪明。\n\n上个星期，两头恐龙吸引了我的注意力，而第三头恐龙却用一根棒子偷袭我。"
G["Be certain there aren't, Schnottz. Deathwing's patience wears thin."]="最好不会再有，司克诺兹。死亡之翼的耐心就快消磨殆尽了。"
G["Be cleansed by blade, filth!"]="让刀刃清洗你这个污秽吧！"
G["Be cleansed with Light, human!  Let not the demonic corruption overwhelm you."]="¡Purifícate con la Luz, $ghumano:humana;! No dejes que la corrupción demoníaca te abrume."
G["Be cleansed!"]="净化吧！"
G["Be cleansed, spirit."]="净化吧，灵魂。"
G["Be consumed by flame!"]="烈焰吞噬你们！"
G["Be consumed by the mist!"]="让迷雾吞噬你的躯壳吧！"
G["Be dat way den!"]="那就这样吧！"
G["Be diligent! One word from me and  you'll be fed to the warlocks' demons."]="用功点！我只想说，你早晚要被丢去喂术士的恶魔。"
G["Be filled with my power!"]="注入我的力量吧！"
G["Be flung!  To safety!"]="快走吧！到安全的地方去！"
G["Be free from da voodoo!"]="从巫毒中解脱吧！"
G["Be free of doubt, priestess..."]="摒弃疑虑吧，祭司……"
G["Be freed, insects. I will deal with you another time."]="滚吧，虫子们。下一次我再对付你们。"
G["Be gentle - I'm still a bit bruised from the last fight I lost... er... won."]="轻点——我还没从上一次失败……呃……胜利中恢复过来。"
G["Be glad I didn't marry you for your fishing skills..."]="还好我当初不是因为你的钓鱼技术才嫁给你的……"
G["Be glad I only gave you a bomb. Ingrate."]="我只给了你一颗炸弹，你就偷着乐吧。忘恩负义的家伙。"
G["Be gone filthy creature!  Why anyone would tolerate your filth is beyond me."]="去死吧，肮脏的东西！滚远点！"
G["Be gone!"]="滚吧！"
G["Be gone!  I hold counsel with Dreadlords, and the matters we discuss are not your concern!"]="滚！我只和恐惧魔王打交道，你没资格来跟我说话！"
G["Be gone! In the Name of the Light, the Goodness, and the All that is Just!"]="滚开！以善良的名义！以正义的名义！以圣光的名义！"
G["Be gone, $c!  Leave us be, or we will enter you next and show you true despair!"]="滚开，$c！离我们远点，否则我们会让你知道什么是真正的绝望！"
G["Be gone, $c.  I have no need of you in my hunt."]="滚吧，$c。我的狩猎不需要你。"
G["Be gone, infidel!  May the power of the Abyss smite you down!"]="受死吧，异教徒！愿深渊的力量毁灭你！"
G["Be gone, mortal! Your kind is unwelcome here..."]="滚开，凡人！你在这里不受欢迎……"
G["Be gone, trifling elf.  I am in control now!"]="滚开吧，脆弱的精灵。现在我说了算！"
G["Be gone, you soulless wretch!"]="滚出去，你们这些没有灵魂的爬虫！"
G["Be gone... from this creature of Light!"]="滚开……从这个皈依圣光的人身上滚开！"
G["Be healed!"]="痊愈吧！"
G["Be healed, $g brother:sister;!"]="痊愈吧，$g兄弟:姐妹;！"
G["Be healed, my pets!"]="快点痊愈吧，我的宠物！"
G["Be humble."]="保持谦卑。"
G["Be it by blade or incantation, blood feeds our attacks and weakens our foes."]="借助武器或咒术，鲜血能提高我们的攻击力，同时削弱敌人的力量。"
G["Be judged by the Light!"]="接受圣光的制裁吧！"
G["Be lifted by $n's accomplishment! Revel in $g his:her; rallying cry!"]="¡Sentíos elevados por el logro de $n! ¡Deleitaos en su grito de llamamiento!"
G["Be mindful of what you say, this one's being shown around by Khadgar's pet."]="注意你的言辞，卡德加的宠物正陪着这个人呢。"
G["Be more careful out there, $n!"]="$n，一定要时刻保持谨慎！"
G["Be nice puppy-man. We nice, so you be nice too."]="别乱来，狗狗人。我们不会乱来的，你也不要乱来啊。"
G["Be nimble, think ahead, and give dangers a wide berth, and gather 20 stacks of Essence of Ice to complete this trial."]="一定要动作敏捷，考虑周全，远离危险，收集20层冰之精华，完成此次试炼。"
G["Be not afraid of his traps, champion. Your healing is more powerful than his magic!"]="不要害怕陷阱。你的治疗比他的法术更强大！"
G["Be on alert.  The portals must not be sealed."]="保持警惕。传送门绝不能被封印。"
G["Be on guard... Arnak has some strange power over the Grimtotem... they will not be happy to see me escape."]="警惕些……阿纳克对恐怖图腾有一种奇怪的能力……他们看到我逃跑了是不会开心的。"
G["Be on the alert! The Blackwood furbolgs are numerous in this area..."]="保持警惕！这一带有许多黑木熊怪……"
G["Be on the lookout for Alliance."]="要留心联盟的人。"
G["Be on the lookout! Mole machines will be surfacing soon with those nasty Iron dwarves aboard!"]="保持警惕！钻探机即将冒出地表，讨厌的铁矮人就要来了！"
G["Be on your guard!"]="提高警惕！"
G["Be on your guard! The clouds move in and the wind picks up! Seek shelter!"]="做好防卫！云团滚滚而来，狂风骤起！快躲起来！"
G["Be on your guard! The enemy is on the prowl."]="小心点！敌人就在附近徘徊。"
G["Be on your guard! The weather worsens, and the elementals are soon to follow! Seek shelter!"]="保持戒备！天气越来越糟，元素生物就快追来了！找掩护！"
G["Be on your guard! There are reports of a humungous worm close to Hive'Zora!"]="保持警惕！报告说佐拉虫巢附近有巨大的沙虫出没！"
G["Be on your guard, $c."]="时刻保持警惕，$c。"
G["Be on your guard, $n!"]="保持警惕，$n！"
G["Be on your guard. The Unga Ingoo Pirates are a fearsome lot. But they make a fine brew!"]="多加小心。盎迦猴岛的海盗非常可怕。可他们酿的酒不错！"
G["Be on your guard. We are Theramore's first line of defense against its many enemies in the marsh."]="保持警惕。尘泥沼泽中强敌四伏，我们担负着构筑塞拉摩岛第一道防线的重任。"
G["Be one with your serpent, $n. Perceive your serpent's experiences as your own and strengthen your bond."]="要与翔龙合为一体，$n。与它感同身受，加强你们之间的联系。"
G["Be patient with Shu. He acts as if a child, but he is quite ancient, and quite powerful."]="对涓流要有耐心。他的行为举止也许像个孩子，实际上却是古老而强大的生灵。"
G["Be patient, $n. The torch is almost complete."]="耐心一点，$n。火炬就要完成了。"
G["Be patient, Li Li. If we explore Pandaria too quickly, we will quickly run out of Pandaria to explore."]="耐心点儿吧，丽丽。如果我们那么快就把潘达利亚逛个遍，那我们很快就没得玩了。"
G["Be patient, citizens. Yelling at us won't change anything."]="耐心一些，公民们。冲我们叫嚷不会让情况有任何改善。"
G["Be prepared. Today, we will teach the quilboar much regret, sorrow, and fear, in the name of our Greatmother."]="准备好。今天，我们将以我们伟大的大地之母的名义，教导这些野猪人学会懊悔、悲哀和恐惧。"
G["Be proud, dragon. Today you fall to the blade of Azeroth's greatest hero. And also to my blade."]="自豪吧，恶龙。今天，你将死于艾泽拉斯最伟大的英雄剑下。也将死在我的剑下。"
G["Be proud, your brain will be put to good use in one of my abominations."]="Puedes sentirte $gorgulloso:orgullosa;, tu cerebro tendrá buen uso en una de mis abominaciones."
G["Be purified by steel!"]="钢铁的利刃将你净化！"
G["Be purified in the light!"]="在光明中得到净化吧！"
G["Be quick about it."]="快一点。"
G["Be quick on your feet - that is no ordinary Zandalari!"]="快行动——那可不是普通的赞达拉巨魔！"
G["Be quick with those charges.  Some of those demons are going to take more than one direct hit to bring down."]="加快填弹速度。有些恶魔已经是风一吹就要倒了。"
G["Be quick! We must not be seen together."]="快点！不能让人发现我们在一起。"
G["Be quiet 'bout what you hear and see around here, $r."]="你在这里听到和看到的一切都要保密，$r。"
G["Be quiet!  Can't you see the master is speaking?"]="安静！你没听见主人在讲话吗？"
G["Be quiet."]="安静。"
G["Be ready for anything, $n."]="做好准备，$n。"
G["Be ready for anything, $n. We may have to use force against our own men."]="做好心理准备，$n。也许我们不得不把矛头指向我们自己人。"
G["Be ready my brothers!  We shall make our way thru the Dark Portal and all of Azeroth shall fall!"]="准备好，弟兄们！我们马上就可以成功地穿越黑暗之门，整个艾泽拉斯世界也将被我们践踏在脚下！"
G["Be ready to advance on the enemy.  We will soon launch an all out assault on the Betrayer."]="准备向敌人推进。我们很快就会对背叛者发动全面进攻。"
G["Be ready to dogfight in the air. Jump from mount to mount if you have to!"]="做好空战的准备。必要时，你可以跳上别的坐骑！"
G["Be ready to fight if we draw too much attention."]="万一引发骚动，你要做好战斗准备。"
G["Be ready! The ground shakes and the fires burn hotter! Get out if ya still can!"]="做好准备！大地在震颤，火焰也燃烧得更猛烈！要是你还能逃脱，就赶紧走！"
G["Be ready! They'll charge any moment now."]="准备好！他们随时都有可能发起进攻。"
G["Be ready, $n. I hear the council returning. Prepare to ambush!"]="准备好，$n。议员们就要回来了，准备进行伏击！"
G["Be really careful, Mr. D. If you see a big group of gnomes, use your magnetic pull! Once you've got 'em all sucked up, launch 'em to their death! YAY!"]="千万要多加小心，气泡先生。要是你看见大批侏儒，记得用磁性拉住他们！等把他们全都吸住，就送他们归天！耶！"
G["Be really careful, Mr. P. If you see a big group of goblins, use your magnetic pull! Once you've got 'em all sucked up, launch 'em to their death! YAY!"]="一定要多加小心，水泡先生。要是你看到一大群地精，就用你的磁力对付他们！等你把他们全都吸过来之后，就送他们上西天！吖！"
G["Be reasonable! You cannot hope to stop the Burning Legion! Let us discuss this in a civilized manner. I can offer you power beyond your wildest dreams!"]="理智点！想要阻止燃烧军团？别做白日梦了！让我们用文明的方式来探讨这个问题。我能赐予你连做梦都不敢想的强大的力量！"
G["Be right with ya, mon..."]="我马上就来，伙计……"
G["Be safe, $n."]="保护好自己，$n。"
G["Be safe, $n. Remember, the Horde are also seeking the dragon bones. It might be easier to kill them than to kill the shades."]="当心，$n。记住，部落也在搜集龙骨。杀死他们或许比杀死幽灵容易一些。"
G["Be safe, Antonio."]="路上小心，安东尼奥。"
G["Be seared with the shadow!"]="让暗影灼烧着你的躯体吧！"
G["Be seein' ya back at Crushblow."]="我们粉碎者据点见。"
G["Be silenced, Sunreaver!"]="安静受死吧，夺日者！"
G["Be silent!  Do you think our plagued dragons will hatch and train themselves?"]="肃静！你认为那些被感染的龙会自己孵蛋并哺育幼龙吗？"
G["Be silent!  I cannot afford to miss even a moment of this lecture!"]="肃静！我不能漏掉这次讲座任何一句话！"
G["Be silent! Damn you, spirits!"]="安静！该死的灵魂！"
G["Be silent! The shattering is soon to come!"]="安静！大地的崩溃很快就要来临了！"
G["Be slain by me, villainous cretin!"]="死在我手中吧，卑劣的白痴！"
G["Be steadfast, champion. I know why it is that you are here and I know what it is that you seek. Eranikus will not give up the shard freely. He has been twisted... twisted by the same force that you seek to destroy."]="要保持镇定，勇士。我知道你来这里的目的，我也知道你要寻找的东西。伊兰尼库斯不会轻易交出碎片的。他的心灵被某种力量扭曲了，那力量正是你想要打败的东西。"
G["Be still!"]="不许动！"
G["Be still, friend, and behold da truth of things!"]="朋友，现在来安静地领悟真相吧！"
G["Be still, little one, and you can hear this ancient land speak. It cries out in pain."]="Estate $gquieto, pequeño:quieta, pequeña;, y podrás escuchar a esta ancestral tierra hablar. Llora de dolor."
G["Be still, mortals, and hearken to my words."]="等等，凡人，我有话和你说。"
G["Be still, my love. Calm your mind. You became a slave to your duty. But being true to your heart is how you'll fulfill that duty... to your people... and to me."]="平静下来，我的爱人。冷静心绪。你成了使命的奴隶。但只有直面内心，你才能继续履行使命……为了你的人民……也为了我。"
G["Be still."]="别动。"
G["Be strong, $n!"]="$n，坚强点！"
G["Be strong, Fizzule!"]="坚强一点，费苏勒！"
G["Be strong, Neeka. I will watch over you..."]="坚强些，尼卡。我会注视着你……"
G["Be strong, friend. Do what must be done..."]="坚强点，朋友。去做你该做的事吧……"
G["Be strong, warriors! Keep the hozen at bay!"]="坚强点，战士们！挡住这些猢狲！"
G["Be strong.\n\nBe vicious.\n\nKill more than you can eat.\n\nMake no friends, and take no pets.\n\nDie fighting.\n\nThese, and many more, are lessons we can learn from Kroshik."]="保持强壮。\n\n保持邪恶。\n\n屠杀吃不完的猎物。\n\n不要交朋友，不要养宠物。\n\n战斗到死。\n\n这些，以及其他许多真理，都是考什克的教诲。"
G["Be strong. Kael'thas has betrayed us and what we know is in flux, but do not lose heart. We will endure, as we always have. Arthas did not crush our spirit when he swept through our land, and neither will Kael'thas. Let it serve as a lesson to us all as we move forward to our prosperous future."]="坚强一些。凯尔萨斯背叛了我们，我们的希冀变成了泡影，但是不要失去信心。我们会坚持到底，就像以前一样。阿尔萨斯的铁蹄没有摧毁我们的精神，凯尔萨斯也绝不可能让我们毁灭。就让这变故成为我们永远铭记的一课吧。"
G["Be sure to catch all the amazing sights and wonders of the Darkmoon Faire when it comes to town!"]="一定要来看看暗月马戏团为你带来的各种千奇百怪的东西！"
G["Be sure to check in with my son Marley at the digsite. He's a good kid - my eyes and ears over at Bael Modan."]="一定要去那片挖掘场和我的儿子马尔雷谈一谈。他是个好孩子。我必须以全部的精力监视巴尔莫丹。"
G["Be sure to fill out all included paperwork during your flight!"]="请一定在飞行过程中填写好全部的相关文件！"
G["Be sure to go through the southern canyon when entering and exiting the shrine, $n. You will know the canyons where the battle is waged by the abominations that guard them... keep your distance."]="$n，记得从南面的峡谷进出神殿。原本驻守在其他峡谷的憎恶正打得不可开交呢……你最好别自找麻烦。"
G["Be sure to keep an eye out for recruitment posters in Gobland. Once we get that operation under way, it would be good to have you on board again."]="一定要注意一下哥布兰的征兵布告。一旦我们的行动顺利展开，很希望你能再次加入我们。"
G["Be sure to read over the notes in my journal, $n. You will find them to be invaluable in overcoming the tower's defenses."]="$n，你一定要读读我的日记。里面的内容对于你攻破那座塔的防御体系非常有帮助。"
G["Be sure to speak with the Lord Regent. He's waiting for you at the prow."]="记得去跟摄政王谈谈。他就在船头等你。"
G["Be sure to stick around for the next firework show!  Starting at 6PM, they're every hour on the hour!"]="别忘了观看下一场焰火表演！每天下午6点开始，每小时整点都会有一次！"
G["Be sure to stop by again soon!"]="常回来看看！"
G["Be sure to stop by and see me again, $c!"]="一定要再回来看我哦，$c！"
G["Be sure to stop by the bridges southeast of town. You should be able to secure a nightsaber to get you down to the ruins."]="一定要到城东南的桥那里去看看。你应该能在那里得到一头夜刃豹，载你到废墟那里去。"
G["Be sure to talk to the MacGraffs, inside the sanctuary. They'll be orchestratin' the ceremonies."]="一定要迈格拉夫一家人谈谈。他们就在庇护所里。他们会在那里安排这场仪式的。"
G["Be sure to tell Greatfather Winter what secret surprise you'd like to get this Winter Veil!"]="请告诉冬天爷爷是什么秘密让你想要得到冬幕！"
G["Be sure to try our Dark Iron Ale.  I hear the dwarves around here can't get enough of it."]="你一定要尝一下我们的黑铁啤酒。我听说附近的矮人总是有多少喝多少。"
G["Be sure to visit Vixton Pinchwhistle in Netherstorm's Area 52. As the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit's official Arena Vendor, he has all sorts of incredible items for sale to those with enough Arena Points."]="别忘记去拜访虚空风暴52区的维克斯顿。作为热砂港搏击会的官方竞技场商人，他出售各种不可思议的物品给那些有着足够竞技场点数的家伙。"
G["Be swallowed by a sea of flame!"]="淹没在烈焰之海！"
G["Be swift, $c. The stone dragons will not give up easily."]="Sé veloz. Los dragones de piedra no se rendirán tan fácilmente."
G["Be thankful that I am locked inside this cage, $r."]="我被锁在这个笼子里，你应该感到庆幸，$r。"
G["Be the first on your block to own the incredible Electrostatic Maculation Blaster!"]="来率先体验一下超级无敌的静电除污器吧！"
G["Be very, very quiet.  There's worgen everywhere."]="一定要非常、非常安静。这里到处都是狼人。"
G["Be vigilant, troops. A surprise attack could mean the difference between life and death."]="全军警戒。如果遭遇偷袭，那就是生死立判了。"
G["Be vigilent in your stand, or you will never achieve your goals."]="想要达到目标，你必须寸步不让。"
G["Be warned that even your creators are fallible."]="注意，即使是创物之神也可能犯错。"
G["Be warned, Belmont. If I find out that you're lying..."]="我警告你，贝尔蒙特。如果我发现你在说谎……"
G["Be warned, mortal, it is exceptionally rare that one of the lesser clans in this citadel would hold such an item. Your search could take decades. I recommend you destroy these beasts without impunity."]="你要知道，这样的物品是非常罕见的。你可能需要进行数年的搜索才能找到一枚印章。我建议你对这些邪恶的生物毫不留情，把他们全都杀掉。"
G["Be warned, this recipe has been handed down from generation to generation, tought to my family by the great Monkey King himself."]="你可得小心了，这配方可是由美猴王传授给我们家族，然后代代相传，流传至今的。"
G["Be warned..."]="但你记住……"
G["Be wary beyond the wall."]="危险潜藏于长城之外。"
G["Be wary of intruders."]="注意入侵者。"
G["Be wary of taking to the sky above these ruins, $glad:lass;. The Twilight drakes have a taste for things that fly."]="在这片废墟上空飞行可要多加小心，$g年轻人:小姑娘;。暮光飞龙尤其喜欢会飞的东西。"
G["Be wary of the Ethereum that surround us on all sides."]="提防那些包围我们的复仇军。"
G["Be wary, $c. The forest is full of hidden dangers and potential enemies."]="机警点，$c。这片森林中充满隐藏的危险和潜在的敌人。"
G["Be wary, $r.\n\nThis is no place for the meek."]="保持警惕，$r。\n\n这里不是弱者的游乐场。"
G["Be wary, allies. There are bound to be traps to protect the Firelord from our incursion."]="小心，朋友。炎魔之王有结界保护，让我们无法对他发动攻击。"
G["Be wary, for the plagued tendrils of the Lich King lurk close."]="小心，周围可能有那些传播着巫妖王诅咒的爪牙。"
G["Be wary, friends. The Betrayer meditates in the court just beyond."]="当心点，朋友们。背叛者就在那边的大厅中冥想。"
G["Be wary. There are deadlier things in this jungle than these plants!"]="小心。这片丛林中能要你性命的东西比这些树还多！"
G["Be washed from my sight!"]="从我眼前消失吧！"
G["Be welcome amongst us, $c."]="Sé $gbienvenido:bienvenida; entre nosotros, $c."
G["Be welcome, friends!"]="欢迎你，朋友！"
G["Be well, $n."]="保重，$n。"
G["Be with you in a moment, $gsir:ma'am;."]="Ahora mismo te atiendo."
G["Be'lanen dalorai!"]="¡Be'lanen dalorai!"
G["Be'lemer an-delei!"]="¡Be'lemer an-delei!"
G["Beacons of light, bestow upon me your aegis!"]="光之信标啊，将你的庇护赐予我！"
G["Beak device overloaded. Unit deactivating."]="喙部设备过载。正在关闭装置。"
G["Beak squeaks in joy at the sight of Donnelly!"]="看到东尼利，尖喙发出欢快的叫声！"
G["Beak! Come back to Donnelly. Donnelly keep you safe!"]="尖喙！到东尼利这里来。东尼利会保护你！"
G["Beak! Get down here, Beak!"]="尖喙！到这儿来，尖喙！"
G["Beak! No more hiding. Come out right now!"]="尖喙！不要再躲着了。现在就出来！"
G["Beak! Where are ya Beak?"]="尖喙！你在哪里，尖喙？"
G["Beak. Beak!"]="尖喙。尖喙！"
G["Bear"]="熊"
G["Bear Mount"]="熊坐骑"
G["Bear witness to the agent of your demise!"]="你们的死期到了！"
G["Bear witness to the undeniable power of our dark master!"]="亲眼看看黑暗主宰那势不可挡的力量吧！"
G["Bear witness to the undeniable power of your Warchief! Be lifted by the rallying cry of your dragon slayers!"]="见证酋长的勿庸置疑的能力吧！在屠龙大军的战斗口号声中精神抖擞地前进吧！"
G["Bears are beautiful creatures.  Wild, strong and fierce in battle... much like us, sister."]="熊是美丽的生物。野性、强壮、凶猛……就像我们一样。"
G["Bears??"]="熊？？"
G["Beast! Obey me! Kill them at once!"]="听从我的命令！马上把他们都杀掉！"
G["Beat it, Mack! Else I'll have Budd cook ya fer my hounds...."]="滚远点！否则我就让巴德把你做成狗粮……"
G["Beat it, Schnottz!"]="躲开，司克诺兹！"
G["Beat it, kid. I got business to attend to..."]="¡Dale caña, $gchico:chica;! Tengo asuntos que atender..."
G["Beat it, pal, before I give you the ol' Chip Endale fist to the face!"]="快滚开，否则奇普·英代尔的老拳可就要砸在你脸上了！"
G["Beat me to it, I see. Your exit awaits..."]="哦，原来是你抢在我前面了。通过这个传送门离开吧……"
G["Beat or be beaten! This is the way of the Legion!"]="要么胜利要么死亡！这就是军团的行事风格！"
G["Beat that wikket like it owes you money!"]="痛扁那个蠢蛋，就像讨债一样！"
G["Beat them to a pulp, Ace!"]="把他们打得落花流水，王牌飞行员！"
G["Beat this filth until it speaks..."]="揍到这个混蛋开口为止……"
G["Beatdown received.  Optimizing strategy for next battle..."]="溃败信息已接受。正在优化下一战策略……"
G["Beats me, kid. I'm new to the crew.\n\nI've had my fill of troll-killin' and grog drinkin, I can tell ya that. Only thing left to see is the treasure Budd keeps promisin'...."]="Me supera, chico. Soy nuevo en el equipo.\n\nPuedo decirte que he matado montones de trols y bebido mucho grog. Lo único que me falta por ver es el tesoro que Budd está venga a prometer..."
G["Beautiful day for fishing, don't you think?  You a fisherman, $n?  I've got this old fishing lure if you'd like it, works wonders in the waters here."]="Un día precioso para pescar, ¿no te parece? ¿Eres $gun pescador:una pescadora;, $n? Tengo este viejo cebo de pesca, si lo quieres. En estas aguas funciona de maravilla."
G["Beautiful day, isn't it?"]="多么美好的一天啊，不是吗？"
G["Beautiful flowers for your loved ones! Get your flowers!"]="美丽的鲜花送给你爱的人！拿好你的鲜花！"
G["Beautiful, isn't she? Fished it up a few years go - it looks just like her... Ask me about it some time."]="她真漂亮，不是吗？几年前它被捞出来，它看起来就像她一样……改天问我关于它的事情。"
G["Because I won our bet.  And because I called shotgun."]="因为我赢了我们的打赌。也因为我喊了“射击”。"
G["Because Uncle Chen made me promise not to!\n\nListen. Chen may be a stupid, boring, lazy, fat old uncle, but that doesn't mean that I don't respect him. He told me not to get into any trouble, and I'm not about to ignore him.\n\nBesides, you seem to be doing just fine on your own. You don't need a little girl to help you kill things."]="这可是陈叔逼我保证不这么做的！\n\n听着，陈叔或许是一个笨笨的、无聊的、懒散的、肥肥的老叔，但这并不意味着我不尊重他。他叫我不要卷入任何麻烦中，我也一直都是这么做的。\n\n话说回来，你看上去一个人就能搞定了。你不会要一个小姑娘去帮你打打杀杀吧。"
G["Because despite what you think, there may be people in this world who would mourn your passing."]="无论你是否在意，但这个世界里终究还是有人会因为你的死而伤心。"
G["Because he didn't want it to be smarter than he was!"]="因为他不想让武器变得比他聪明！"
G["Because my will..."]="因为我的意志……"
G["Because pants never drop when they're around!"]="他们的黑手总摸不出裤子！"
G["Because sea turtles always return to the beach where they were born!"]="因为海龟总会返回他们出生的海岸！"
G["Because someone said, 'Let's take the scenic route!'"]="Porque alguien dijo, '¡Vamos por el camino panorámico!'"
G["Because the blade can never be too sharp nor the armor too tough a talented enchanter will always be needed.  Such an enchanter is Taladan, who can show you how to properly weave enchantments to improve your weapons and armor.  Seek him out in the Craftsmen's Terrace."]="没有具备天赋的附魔师，刀刃不可能如此锋利，护甲也不可能如此坚固。塔兰丹就是这样的附魔师，他可以教你如何给武器和护甲附魔。去工匠区找他吧。"
G["Because these guys made it past them!"]="因为这些家伙竟让它过去了！"
G["Because they are planted in the spring!"]="因为它们是在春天种植的！"
G["Because they get to spend so much time with that foxy spirit healer!"]="因为他们能在那个妩媚的灵魂医者身边待那么久！"
G["Because they're made of iron ya big dummy! Ya ain't got none of da senses pappy left me with - that's for darn sure!"]="因为他们是铁制的啊，你这个大笨蛋！看来你一点都没有继承爸爸的聪明才智！"
G["Because those two guys make you feel skinny."]="因为那两个家伙让你感觉自己很苗条。"
G["Because you are still alive and my hands aren't gripped firmly around your stubby little neck."]="因为你还活着，我的手也没有卡在你结实的短脖子上。"
G["Because you have aided me, I will tell you what I know of this land and of the things there are to see. My knowledge is not vast, but perhaps I can point out some things that might interest one such as yourself."]="你帮助了我，我会告诉我所知的这片土地和生物的情况。我所了解的并不多，但是我可以告诉你一些你可能感兴趣的事儿。"
G["Because you're short."]="因为你个子矮。"
G["Because you're talkin' about what? Talkin' about the arclight spanner, whining about the smelting requirements of hardened adamantite, cryin' about some gnome that ripped you off..."]="你喋喋不休地在讲什么呢？你在谈论扳手，在抱怨硬化精金锭的熔炼标准，还在因为被别的侏儒敲诈了一笔而哭泣……"
G["Because you're the bravest, dear."]="因为你最勇敢，宝贝儿。"
G["Because you've managed to replenish some of our supplies I can get back to cooking.  Now, what can I do for you?"]="谢谢你送来了一些补给物资，这样我又能拿起厨具啦。我能为你做什么呢？"
G["Because..."]="因为……"
G["Become a mentor for one of our orphans during the Week of the Wardens!  For the Horde!"]="Conviértete en $gun mentor:una mentora; para uno de nuestros huérfanos durante la Semana de los Celadores! ¡Por la Horda!"
G["Become a mentor for one of our orphans during the Week of the Wardens!  Huzzah!"]="Conviértete en $gun mentor:una mentora; para uno de nuestros huérfanos durante la Semana de los Celadores! ¡Genial!"
G["Become an apprentice I suppose. Pretty high turnover really.\n\nI've met maybe a dozen washed up apprentices this last month alone. He leaves them kind of damaged. They keep coming though. I guess there aren't many options in the Archmage racket.\n\nI met another one just today. He was heading over to the west, to that big pillar that's being built."]="成为大法师的学徒，我猜，大概是件很费周折的事。\n\n光是上个月，我就遇上了十多个被淘汰的学徒。尽管那些气馁的学徒满身伤痕，但却总是会不停地回来继续尝试。我猜，成为大法师的机会并没那么多。\n\n今天我刚刚又遇到一名学徒，他去往了西边，到那座正在建造的巨大石柱那儿去了。"
G["Become ashes in the mist!"]="在迷雾中化为灰烬吧！"
G["Become one with the fire!"]="和这火焰融为一体吧！"
G["Been a tough day? A nice ale should loosen those worries right up."]="劳累了一整天？上好的啤酒可以为您解除疲劳。"
G["Been a while since I had a taste of this dish. This'll hit the spot."]="我有一阵子没吃过这道菜了，这回可要过瘾了。"
G["Been in Westfall all my life, $g brother:sister;. I can remember a day when Westfall was the lushest land this side of Stranglethorn Vale. Those days are long gone.\n\nWhile we no longer have Defias causing problems, the fallout from their reign of terror can still be felt. To make matters worse we're in the worst economic downturn in history. All that gold we spent on fighting the Scourge left anyone not in a military related occupation jobless and eventually homeless.\n\nGuess where all those people ended up?"]="我这辈子都没离开过西部荒野，$g兄弟:姐妹;。我还记得西部荒野曾是荆棘谷这一侧最富生机的地方。那些日子已经一去不复返了。\n\n尽管我们摆脱了迪菲亚制造的麻烦，但他们恐怖统治的影响至今犹存。更糟糕的是，我们现在正面临有史以来最严重的经济危机。由于我们将所有的积蓄都拿去对付天灾军团，所以那些不在军中任职的普通百姓全都陷入失业与最终无家可归的境地。\n\n你猜这些人最后怎么办了？"
G["Been waitin' for ya, $n. Glad to see you've come through. Do you have the shipment?"]="我一直在等你，$n。很高兴看到你。你把货带来了吗？"
G["Been working for the anglers?  Check out these rewards!"]="一直在为钓鱼者效劳？这些奖励是给你的！"
G["Beer an' haggis, now that'll put hair on yer chest!"]="啤酒和羊杂馅饼，纯爷们就该这么吃！"
G["Beer before liquor, never fought quicker."]="先淡啤，后烈酒，拳速疾，无影手。"
G["Beer delivery, in the middle of a battlefield? Maybe Pandaria will make a good home after all..."]="递送啤酒，去战场中央？也许潘达利亚最终会成为一片乐土……"
G["Beer delivery, in the middle of a battlefield? Perhaps Pandaria will make a good home after all..."]="递送啤酒，去战场中央？也许潘达利亚最终会成为一片乐土……"
G["Beer made with sap? That sounds..."]="用树脂酿的酒……那听起来……"
G["Beer! Mere beer!"]="啤酒！只是啤酒而已！"
G["Beetle"]="甲虫"
G["Before I leave this place, I make one final offering to you, Lord Staghelm. Should a time arise in which you must gain entry to this accursed fortress, use the Scepter of the Shifting Sands on the sacred gong. The magic holding the barrier together will dissipate and the horrors of Ahn'Qiraj will be unleashed upon the world once more."]="在我离开之前，鹿盔，我还要再送一件东西给你。如果有一天，因为某些原因，你必须进入这座被诅咒的堡垒，就在神圣的铜锣上使用流沙节杖。屏障上的魔法将被驱散，而安其拉的恐怖气息也将再次传遍世界。"
G["Before I take my leave, you must be told that it is not by my fault that you lay stretched on the ground, but by the fault of my squire."]="在我离开之前，我要告诉你，你会躺在地上不是我的错，而是我的侍从的错。"
G["Before I was cast in amber, I made a great gamble.\n\nI realized the amber could perform a miracle that I would never achieve, not even with a thousand years of careful experimentation.\n\nBefore I became a paragon, I injected myself with a dozen lethal poisons. The life-giving properties of amber protected me as I guessed, and time did the rest.\n\nAnd now, I can handle any poison I desire without fear."]="在我被封进琥珀之前，我孤注一掷地赌了一把。\n\n我意识到琥珀能创造出令我望尘莫及的奇迹，哪怕我在再实验室里精心研究一千年也赶不上。\n\n在我变成英杰前，我往自己体内注入了大量致命毒素。我想是琥珀维持生命的特性令我免于一死，剩下的都是时间的功劳。\n\n现在，我已经能无所畏惧地应对我想要的任何毒素。"
G["Before I was stationed out here, I'd only heard about the rejuvenating effects a mudbath can have on skin. When I first tripped over a tree root, I was exposed to the full benefits! Amazing what nature can do, even without a bit of magic to help it along."]="在被指派到这里之前，我只是听说过泥巴浴的保健效果而已。当我被一条树根绊倒在地后，我才真正体会到了它的好处！大自然真是奇妙啊，不借助魔法也可以产生如此奇妙的效果！"
G["Before beginning a hunt, it is wise to ask someone what you are looking for before you begin looking for it."]="在狩猎之前最好问问你要找什么猎物。"
G["Before his banishment, Deathwing was attempting to create impure offspring. Half breeds that would not only be immune to the innate natural powers and abilities of their Aspects but also under the complete control of Deathwing.\n\nIt seems that where his father failed, Nefarian may have succeeded - at least partially.\n\nIt was Ysera, Aspect of Dreams, who saw the abominations and forced us to act. If these 'Chromatic' dragonkin exist, they must be destroyed."]="在被放逐之前，死亡之翼曾试图产下混血的后代。混血的龙不仅无法获得守护巨龙天生的力量，也无法被死亡之翼控制。\n\n似乎奈法利安在他父亲失败了的事情上取得了成功——至少是一些进展。\n\n梦境之神伊瑟拉预见到了这种混血龙类的存在，我们必须杀死那些“彩色”的龙。"
G["Before it boils over, I need..."]="趁它沸腾之前，我还需要……"
G["Before it thickens, we must add..."]="在它变浓之前，得加点……"
G["Before my death, I was a librarian; I had nothing to do with wars and plagues. I never asked to become this. On the other hand, now that my mind is my own again, I'm not about to surrender without a fight."]="我生前是一名图书管理员，与战争和灾难无缘。我从未想过要变成现在这样。另一方面，现在我能主宰自己，我是不会不战而降的。"
G["Before the Scourge came, I had a great business.  I bought and sold everything.  Everything!\n\nAnd my prices were INSANE!\n\nJust ask anyone.  Anyone who's not dead."]="在亡灵天灾来临之前，我是一名大商贩。我出售所有商品。所有！\n\n价钱都极其便宜！\n\n你随便问问那些没死的人，看看我说的是不是真的。"
G["Before the day is done, you will all be slaves and corpses!"]="今天，你们要么成为奴隶，要么粉身碎骨！"
G["Before the plague came, I knew nothing about leather. Now I know enough to teach others. Death's left me with a lot of time on my hands."]="在瘟疫来之前，我对皮革一无所知。现在我的知识可以传授别人了。死亡让我有了很多时间供自己支配。"
G["Before they laid me to sleep in amber, I heard a million voices of the swarm shouting my name. Now, I hear only silence."]="在他们让我沉眠于琥珀之前，我曾听过数百万计的虫群呼喊着我的名字。而现在，我什么都听不见。"
G["Before we can join the final battle, we must ensure that whatever's happening inside of that Ancient across from us is put to an end. Otherwise, we will not stand a chance.\n\nLend Erunak your full assistance, $n."]="Antes de que podamos unirnos a la batalla final, debemos asegurarnos de poner fin a lo que sea que sucede en el interior de ese ancestro de ahí enfrente. De lo contrario, no tendremos ni una sola oportunidad.\n\nDebes prestar a Erunak toda tu ayuda, $n."
G["Before we can overcome external obstacles like the Scourge and the Amani trolls, we must overcome obstacles from within.  The Wretched have been a nuisance for long enough; it is time we vanquished them."]="要打败亡灵天灾和阿曼尼巨魔这样的外敌，首先必须解决我们内部的纷争。长期以来，失心者都在不断骚扰滋事，现在是消灭他们的时候了。"
G["Before we can set sail to Northrend, we've got to eliminate our pest problem aboard the Assurance."]="在开往诺森德之前，我们必须解决自信号上的虫害问题。"
G["Before we join the final battle at the Abyssal Breach, we must stop whatever's happening inside of that Ancient across from us. Otherwise, we will fail.\n\nLend Erunak all of your might, $n."]="Antes de que podamos unirnos a la batalla final en la Brecha Abisal, debemos detener lo que sea que suceda en el interior de ese ancestro de ahí enfrente. De lo contrario, fracasaremos.\n\nDebes prestar a Erunak toda tu ayuda, $n."
G["Before we knew it they was everywhere!"]="还没等我们反应过来，他们就已经无处不在了！"
G["Before you ask: no, we are not there yet."]="再你开口发问之前先回答你——没到，还远着呢。"
G["Before you is the Cache of the Aspects: Take from it what you will, for you have more than earned the right."]="在你面前的就是我们守护巨龙的宝箱：挑选你的奖励吧，这是你应得的。"
G["Before you make your way into Fel Rock, be sure to speak to Tallonkai Swiftroot at the top of the tree. He has a task he would ask of you as well."]="在你进入地狱石之前，一定要同这棵树顶上的塔隆凯·捷根谈一谈。他也有一个任务要交给你。"
G["Before you sits Instructor Myang. She will be responsible for teaching you the most practical fighting techniques."]="坐在你面前这位是孟教头。她会教你用于实战的功夫。"
G["Before your history began, our empire was vast. We shared this world with our sister kingdoms, Ahn'Qiraj and Azjol-Nerub."]="在你们之前，我们的帝国早已广大无边。我们与姐妹王国安其拉和艾卓-尼鲁布平分这个世界。"
G["Before your learning may begin, I must ask of you a favor..."]="在你开始学习之前，我得让你帮我个忙……"
G["Befriending the Sunstriders has paid off; I get to conduct research with subjects I can only find in Outland and they get... my charming personality and rugged good looks."]="与逐日者合作对大家都有好处，我得到了只能在外域进行的研究课题，而他们得到了……我迷人的魅力和独特的好眼光。"
G["Beg all you want, I am keeping the crystal for myself.  All of Outland will soon fall beneath my step!"]="乞求你想要的一切吧，但水晶是我的。整个外域很快就会被我踏在脚下！"
G["Beg and tremble before my power!"]="为你们低贱的生命求饶吧！"
G["Beg for life!"]="求饶吧！"
G["Beg for life."]="求饶吧。"
G["Beg for mercy now, and I may yet allow you to live. Well, \"heroes?\" What is your answer?"]="Suplicad clemencia y quizá os permita vivir. ¿Y bien, \"héroes\"? ¿Qué respondéis?"
G["Beg for mercy!"]="乞求宽恕吧！"
G["Beg for mercy."]="乞哀告怜吧。"
G["Beg for your life. Plead. It will do you no good!"]="尽情告饶吧。我是不会心软的！"
G["Beg for your life..."]="求饶吧……"
G["Beg for your miserable life!"]="为你可悲的性命乞求吧！"
G["Beg for your pitiful life!"]="为你那可怜的生命求饶吧！"
G["Beggars and usurpers, we will burn you and your pandaren allies to ash."]="乞丐和逆贼，我们要把你和这群熊猫人盟友烧成灰烬。"
G["Begging your pardon, Lady Prestor. That was not my intent."]="普瑞斯托女士，请你原谅。这并非我的本意。"
G["Begin pet battle."]="开启宠物对战。"
G["Begin the Assault!"]="攻击开始！"
G["Begin the battle."]="开始战斗"
G["Begin the ritual, my servants.  We must banish the heart of Hakkar back into the void!"]="开始仪式，我的仆从们。我们必须把哈卡完全打回扭曲虚空中！"
G["Begin uplink: Reply Code: 'Omega.' Planetary re-origination requested."]="启动上行通讯：回复代码“欧米迦”。请求启动行星组织重构。"
G["Begin your search to the north, $n. Our scouts have spotted the Warp Piston near the shoreline."]="从北面开始寻找，$n。我们的斥候说跳跃引擎在海岸线附近。"
G["Begin!"]="开始！"
G["Beginning analysis ..."]="开始分析……"
G["Beginning the distillation in 5 seconds."]="5秒后开始蒸馏。"
G["Begone forever!"]="去死吧！"
G["Begone foul creatures!  Go back to the void your master shaped you from!"]="你这污秽的家伙，滚！回到你主人身边去！"
G["Begone foul creatures!  Your kind has no place in this world."]="死吧！你们这些邪恶的生物必将被全部消灭！"
G["Begone foul demon!"]="滚开，肮脏的恶魔！"
G["Begone from here, Horde filth!"]="从这里滚开，肮脏的部落！"
G["Begone from here, trespassers!"]="离开这里，闯入者！"
G["Begone from my realm, insects."]="滚出我的王国，虫子。"
G["Begone from my sight!"]="从我的眼前滚开！"
G["Begone from these lands, invader!"]="滚出这片土地，入侵者！"
G["Begone from this place!"]="滚出这里！"
G["Begone infidels, you are not welcome here!"]="离开这里，异教徒！这里不欢迎你们！"
G["Begone to your eternal torment."]="享受永恒的折磨吧。"
G["Begone!"]="滚开！"
G["Begone! Isn't it enough that you have taken my husband? What more do you want?"]="滚开！你们夺走了我的丈夫，这还不够吗？还想怎么样？"
G["Begone, Alliance thief!"]="滚开，联盟渣滓！"
G["Begone, Horde thief!"]="滚开，部落的毛贼！"
G["Begone, insect. You do not belong in these lands. Do not provoke my ire."]="滚开，虫子。你不属于这个地方。不要激怒我。"
G["Begone, minions of doubt!"]="滚开，疑惧的爪牙！"
G["Begone, mortal. You are not worthy of my knowledge."]="Márchate, mortal. No eres $gmerecedor:merecedora; de mis conocimientos."
G["Begone, outsider!"]="¡Vete, $gextranjero:extranjera;!"
G["Begone, overseer!  We've already spoken.\n\nStop dragging your feet and execute your orders at Ruuan Weald!"]="滚开，工头！我们已经谈过了。\n\n别再磨蹭了，去卢安荒野执行命令吧。"
G["Begone, uncouth scum!  The Alliance shall prevail in Alterac Valley!"]="去死吧，渣滓！联盟会获得胜利的！"
G["Begone. I have neither the ability nor the inclination to instruct you."]="走开。我没能力也没兴趣教你什么。"
G["Behave yourselves inside Stormwind, pandaren. You're in Alliance territory now."]="进了暴风城可得注意你的言行，熊猫人。你现在站在联盟的领土上。"
G["Behind me is the Altar of Zanza, a sacred place for us Zandalar.  We pray here to bolster our resolve in preparation for war against the Blood God, Hakkar.\n\nProve yourself to the tribe by using the altar to destroy any of the Hakkari Bijous you might find inside Zul'Gurub.  Also, I will trade you Honor Tokens our tribe uses for sets of coins you may find in Zul'Gurub.  Bring me the coins that I seek, and you will be rewarded!"]="在我身后是赞扎祭坛，赞达拉部族的神圣之地。我们在此祷告，希望能充分做好对抗血神哈卡的准备工作。\n\n利用祭坛摧毁你在祖尔格拉布找到的任何哈卡莱宝石，以此证明你对部族的价值。我会用赞达拉荣誉硬币跟你交换祖尔格拉布的硬币。找到我需要的硬币，你将获得丰厚的奖励！"
G["Behind the print is the long impression of a prehensile tail."]="在这印痕后面，有卷尾留下的长长痕迹。"
G["Behind you lies the body of my only son. Nothing will keep me from him."]="躺在那里的是我唯一的儿子。无论什么也不能把我和他分离。"
G["Behind you, $n! Look out - incoming!"]="$n，注意背后！小心！"
G["Behold His power!"]="见证他的力量！"
G["Behold Ragnaros - the Firelord! He who was ancient when this world was young! Bow before him, mortals! Bow before your ending!"]="拉格纳罗斯，炎魔之王！他比这个世界本身还要古老，在他面前屈服吧！在你们的末日面前屈服吧！"
G["Behold as Huo brings warmth back to the temple, and passion to its people."]="看呐，燧焰不仅将温暖带回了寺中，更让他的人民恢复了激情。"
G["Behold as infinite darkness befalls your world!"]="看啊！无尽的黑暗降临到你们的世界了！"
G["Behold my perfect creation!"]="瞧，完美的作品！"
G["Behold now: terror absolute!"]="看吧，绝对的恐怖！"
G["Behold the Flames of Azzinoth!"]="让埃辛诺斯的烈焰吞噬你们！"
G["Behold the Gong of Hope!  Though really we replaced the gong with a bell many centuries ago.  The old gong was quite small and did not provide the proper level of hope infusion to our people."]="看，希望之锣！好吧，没错，这其实是一口钟，几百年前，我们就把原来那面锣给换掉了。那面小锣发出的声音不够洪亮，没办法给我们提供足够的希望之声。"
G["Behold the VX-001 Anti-personnel Assault Cannon! You might want to take cover."]="看呀，VX-001反步兵突击炮，你们也许应该找掩护。"
G["Behold the Vrykul!   A race that has perfected war and destruction to the point of an art form.  Already they've cast their lot with the Lich King!  Their dwellings surround you and their numbers are easily five times yours."]="千万小心那些维库人！这是一个嗜血而凶残的种族，每日所想不过是征伐与杀戮。更何况，他们已经向巫妖王宣誓效忠！维库人在附近建立了多处定居点，他们的人数几乎是你们的5倍。"
G["Behold the brood mother, Onyxia, REBORN! Perhaps my finest work."]="见证龙巢之母——奥妮克希亚的重生！这也许是我最高的杰作。"
G["Behold the chaos to come. (Madness, madness, bliss!) Do you like what you see mortal?"]="见证混沌的降临吧。（疯狂，疯狂，疯狂！）喜欢你看到的吗，凡人？"
G["Behold the destiny of your fragile world!"]="看看你们这脆弱世界的命运！"
G["Behold the hand behind all the evil that has befallen Ulduar, left my kingdom in ruins, corrupted my brother, and slain my wife."]="看吧，这隐藏在一切罪恶幕后的黑手，它覆灭了奥杜尔，将我的王国夷为废墟，腐蚀了我的兄弟，杀害了我的妻子。"
G["Behold the might of the Alliance! The dread lady, Onyxia, hangs from the arches! Let the rallying cry of the dragon slayer lift your spirits!"]="看看强大的联盟吧！奥妮克希亚的徽记悬挂在拱门之上！让我们为屠龙大军高声欢呼吧！"
G["Behold the might of the hammer!"]="见证暮光之锤的力量！"
G["Behold the might of the swarm!"]="见证虫群的力量吧！"
G["Behold the might that is Gurgthock!"]="见识古尔戈索克的力量吧！"
G["Behold the power of pure water!"]="见证这纯水之力吧！"
G["Behold the power of the Light! Grace and glory to the Alliance!"]="荣耀属于联盟！"
G["Behold the power of the void."]="看看虚空的力量吧！"
G["Behold the power of torrential waters!"]="看那湍流之水的力量！"
G["Behold the power... of the demon within!"]="感受我体内的恶魔之力吧！"
G["Behold the powers of the master!"]="见证主人的力量吧！"
G["Behold the rage of the Firelands!"]="看吧，这是火焰之地的愤怒！"
G["Behold the sheer size of it!  Are you not afraid, mortal?  Have you ever witnessed doom of this magnitude?"]="看看它有多么巨大！你不害怕吗，凡人？你是否见到过如此伟大的毁灭之力？"
G["Behold the tools of creation!"]="看吧，这创世的神器！"
G["Behold the voice of Her divine wrath."]="聆听女皇神圣怒火的声音吧。"
G["Behold the wonders of our fair city."]="看吧，我们美丽的城市。"
G["Behold the wrath of the new Empire!"]="感受新帝国的愤怒吧！"
G["Behold your weakness."]="承认你的虚弱。"
G["Behold!  The Blue Recluse holds a feast in $g his:her; honor!"]="注意！蓝色隐士旅店正在举行一次聚会！"
G["Behold! I've reserved my favorite pets for just such an occasion."]="看！为了这个时刻，我特地留下了我最喜欢的宠物。"
G["Behold! Latent titan power, imbued with my own draconic essence, tempered by the wisdom of the pandaren celestials."]="看呐！它暗藏泰坦之力，注入了我的巨龙精华，由睿智的熊猫人天神淬炼。"
G["Behold! Sul'thraze the Lasher be rejoined!"]="小心！鞭笞者苏萨斯要复活了！"
G["Behold! The Scythe of Antiok!"]="瞧！安提沃克的镰刀！"
G["Behold! The binding of sacred and corrupt; the forging of Shadow's Edge, a weapon of untold potential!"]="看啊！神圣与堕落的结合，那就是影锋，一把潜能无限的武器。"
G["Behold! The world you see before you has been judged. (Fire, water, earth, air!) All shall perish before the elements! (Burn and drown and crush and suffocate!)"]="看吧！你面前的世界已经受到了裁决。（火、水、土、风！）元素必将毁灭一切生命！（烧灼、溺死、碾碎、窒息！）"
G["Behold, Master Greenpaw, known throughout the lands as the Jade Fist Monk.\n\nThrough skill, determination, and chi, he mastered the form now known as the dreaded Jade Strike, a blow that would transmute foes into statues of jade.\n\nIt was his heroism and sacrifice that saved the Jade Forest in a time of great need, and his like is not to be seen in this world again.\n\nMay this statue forever stand as a reminder of the price of peace, and may his sacrifice never be forgotten."]="看，绿爪大师，他就是这片土地上远近闻名的玉拳武僧。\n\n通过高超的武艺、坚定的意志和强大的气，他创出了一种名叫“碎玉打击”的绝招，能将敌人直接变成玉雕。\n\n是他的英勇与献身精神，在危急时刻拯救了翡翠林，在这个世界上再也找不到像他这样的人了。\n\n愿这座永不倒下的雕像能不断提醒人们和平是多么来之不易，愿他的牺牲将被人们永远铭记。"
G["Behold, Muradin, our salvation, Frostmourne."]="看，穆拉丁，我们最后的希望，霜之哀伤。"
G["Behold, Noth the Plaguebringer. Responsible for the creation of the process that distills the souls of the living and places them within the cold cage of undeath, Noth was observed to be refining this process even now."]="这是药剂师诺斯。天灾军团将人们囚禁在冰冷的死灵牢笼的计划，便是他提出的创意。至今，诺斯仍然负责监督并完善这一流程。"
G["Behold, Patchwerk. When word of his existence first reached the ears of the Brotherhood, none believed the tales of an abomination with such immense speed and strength. Fewer still believed it when he fell the first time..."]="这是帕奇维克。圣光兄弟会第一次听闻他的传言时，没有谁相信憎恶也能拥有如此迅捷的速度和可怕的力量。当帕奇维克初战告捷后，大家便不再认为那是谣言了……"
G["Behold, mon! We be creatin' da greatest Scourge army ever seen!"]="看！我们正在创建一支最强大的天灾部队！"
G["Behold, the Flames of Summer!"]="看，夏日的烈焰！"
G["Behold, the potent power of Cogspin!"]="看着，这就是克斯宾的实力！"
G["Behold, yet another terrifying creature of incomprehensible power!"]="看吧！又一个拥有深不可测的力量的恐怖生物！"
G["Behold: The Samophlange."]="来见证——主动式负载平衡器。"
G["Behold: The power of the foes you've vanquished."]="向你的手下败将学习力量。"
G["Being Forsaken has its benefits. Let me see... I am able to practically live underwater. I can stay submerged 233% longer than any fleshy mortal. Yes, count it, 233%."]="Ser un Renegado tiene sus ventajas. Déjame pensar... Prácticamente puedo vivir bajo el agua. Puedo permanecer sumergido un 233% más de tiempo que un mortal de carne y hueso. Sí, puedes contarlo, un 233%."
G["Being a legendary explorer is hard work!"]="当个传奇探险家可真不容易！"
G["Being a mage has its advantages, but the laundry bills are hell to pay."]="当法师有当法师的好处，可那高昂的洗衣账单可真让人头痛。"
G["Being a paladin is rough. The Light behaves so erratically. Some days I wake up and it feels like all of my powers have been weakened."]="作为圣骑士可真不是件容易的事情。圣光是如此难以驾驭。有些天当我醒来时，感觉就像我所有的能量都被弱化了。"
G["Being a powerful warlock must be hard. Do you ever worry you'll lose control of one of your demons?"]="成为一名出色的术士想必很难。你有没有担心过，要是你的恶魔失控了怎么办？"
G["Being able to study and learn from the Underbog is a once in a lifetime opportunity.\n\nTo think I was practically dead not long ago sitting in a crate in the Slave Pens..."]="去幽暗沼泽进行研究和学习的机会一生只有一次，非常难得。\n\n尤其是想到我不久前还坐在奴隶围栏的笼子里，那时我和死人也没什么差别……"
G["Being part of the Explorers' League, I've been hunting for artifacts in the area. Winterspring is said to contain very magical items... Most are highly guarded."]="作为探险者协会的一员，我曾在这片区域搜寻古代器物。据说冬泉谷有许多不可思议的物品……很多物品都受到严密的保护。"
G["Being resourceful can often sway a battle in your favor.\n\nI've put together this remedy using plants from the forest around us. Hopefully it will be enough. We need every available fighter in the field."]="充分的储备常常能扭转不利的战局。\n\n我已经把从林子里采来的草药调好了，但愿这些能够用。在战场上，我们需要所有能够战斗的人全部上场。"
G["Being small has its advantages. I can sneak just about anywhere."]="小个子也有小个子的优势。我能潜入任何地方而不被发现。"
G["Belay yer lime-stealin' ways, ye scurvy scallywag!"]="再练练偷酸橙的本事吧，你这下流的无赖！"
G["Belay your attack orders, men!"]="大家暂停攻击！"
G["Belay your attacks!  We're movin' on!"]="暂停攻击！我们撤！"
G["Belesa menoor!"]="¡Belesa menoor!"
G["Belgaristrasz speaks the truth; the situation is grave indeed.  \nI can grant you the power to call upon a drake from the green flight.  Speak to Belgaristrasz or Eternos if you prefer to draw on the power of the red or the bronze."]="Belgaristrasz dice la verdad; es cierto que la situación es grave. \n\nPuedo otorgarte el poder de invocar un draco del Vuelo Verde. Habla con Belgaristrasz o con Eternos si prefieres aprovechar el poder del Rojo o del Bronce."
G["Belgaristrasz speaks the truth; the situation is grave indeed.  \nThe full power of your drakes has been unlocked.  Use their power to defeat Eregos!"]="Belgaristrasz dice la verdad, la situación es en efecto grave. \n\nSe ha desbloqueado todo el poder de tus dracos. ¡Úsalo para derrotar a Eregos!"
G["Belgaristrasz speaks the truth; time is running out!\nI can grant you the power to call upon a drake from the bronze flight.  Speak to Belgaristrasz or Verdisa if you prefer to draw on the power of the red or the green."]="Belgaristrasz dice la verdad; ¡el tiempo se agota!\n\nPuedo otorgarte el poder de invocar un draco del Vuelo Bronce. Habla con Belgaristrasz o con Verdisa si prefieres aprovechar el poder del Rojo o del Verde."
G["Belgaristrasz speaks the truth; time is running out!\nThe full power of your drakes has been unlocked.  Use their power to defeat Eregos!"]="Belgaristrasz dice la verdad; ¡el tiempo se agota!\n\nEl poder completo de tus dracos ha sido desbloqueado. ¡Usa su poder para derrotar a Eregos!"
G["Belgrom sent us here from Orgrimmar to aid him in an unwise Alliance, but if his gamble pays off, then it will be to the great benefit of all the Horde.\n\nToo many orcs have already perished because of his desire to please women, but he still commands us, and our honor dictates we make the best of this situation."]="贝尔戈洛姆派我们从奥格瑞玛到这里来帮助他，不过如果他成功了，那样整个部落就有了希望。\n\n虽然由于他一直以来都喜欢取悦女人，无数的兽人已经因此而丧生，但是他仍然是我们的指挥官，为了荣耀，我们只能尽力去做好。"
G["Believe in one another, and let others carry hope for you!"]="相信彼此，让别人为你带来希望！"
G["Believe in your own strength."]="相信你自己的力量。"
G["Believe in your strength!"]="相信你自己的力量！"
G["Believe it or not, her plan DID work. She acquired an egg - I'm still not certain by what means - and claimed to have severed its link to the tainted flight.\n\nThen Deathwing found out about it.\n\nHe cornered Rheastrasza in a cave in the Badlands, destroying her and all of her work. Or so he thought. Rheastrasza had sacrificed her own eggs to fool the Aspect of Death.\n\nThe single, purified black dragon egg was secreted away and hidden!"]="不管你信不信，她的计划真的成功了。她弄到了一颗蛋——我现在都不知道她到底用了什么办法——而且她声称已经切断了这颗蛋和那个堕落的军团之间的联系。\n\n死亡之翼发现了这件事。\n\n他将瑞亚丝塔萨困在荒芜之地的一个洞穴里，杀害了她，并且毁掉了她的一切努力。至少他是这么认为的。其实，瑞亚丝塔萨是牺牲了她自己的蛋，骗过了死亡的化身。\n\n那颗净化过的黑龙蛋已经被秘密地送走并藏了起来！"
G["Believe me - what Garrosh Hellscream achieved in Theramore is nothing compared to the horrors that are even now bearing down on our fragile home."]="相信我——加尔鲁什·地狱咆哮在塞拉摩的所作所为，跟现在降临于我们脆弱家园的浩劫相比，根本算不了什么。"
G["Believe me when I tell you this: You're gonna wish you weren't born, sissy!"]="说真的，你等一下就会情愿自己根本没生出来，混蛋！"
G["Believe me when I tell you, $p, you're in on the ground floor of something big!"]="相信我的话，$p。你正处于一个宏大无比的地方。而这里是它的第一层！"
G["Belm says pay your bill or he'll break your face."]="贝尔姆叫你赶快付账，否则他就会揍扁你。"
G["Below is the aptly named Deathforge. If left to their own devices, the Shadow Council would supply the Legion with an endless stream of infernals."]="下面就是死亡熔炉，死亡……这个名字取得真是恰当。如果任由他们运转死亡熔炉，暗影议会就可以源源不断地为燃烧军团提供地狱火大军。"
G["Bemarrin teaches the trade of blacksmithing in Farstriders' Square. While a somewhat... dirty trade, I suppose it has its merits."]="波玛尔在远行者广场传授铁匠的技术。虽然这是个……脏活，但我想它还是有一些优点的。"
G["Bena works like one possessed. Day and night I have seen her bent over these potions, often going without sleep or food. I know our undead allies need help, but I begin to fear she will do herself an injury."]="本娜就像着魔一样工作。她日以继夜地调制这些药剂，不吃不睡。我知道我们的亡灵盟友需要帮助，但是我担心她这样会伤身体的。"
G["Bend before me!"]="屈服于我！"
G["Bend it to your will, and you shall wield unspeakable power!"]="让它服从你，你就能获得无法想象的力量！"
G["Bend the wind to the task of keeping the mill turning, spirit!"]="操纵风力让磨坊保持运转，灵魂！"
G["Bend to our will!"]="听从我们的命令！"
G["Benevolence is a luxury for the strong, young prince. No great empire was ever built with kindness."]="对强者而言，仁慈是种奢望。没有哪个伟大的帝国是靠仁慈建立的。"
G["Benjamin Foxworthy and his pet, Sly, can be found just behind the smithy, here in Goldshire.  Maybe you should go see if he could help you."]="本杰明·福柯沃斯和他的宠物“狡猾”就在闪金镇铁匠铺的后面。也许你应该去看看他能不能帮你。"
G["Benjamin, my old friend, think you could spare an apple for Bessy today?"]="嗨，老朋友本杰明，我拿个苹果给贝希吃，你不介意吧？"
G["Berserker Stance! Attack them recklessly!"]="狂暴姿态！无情地攻击他们！"
G["Berte! Evalyn! It's getting dark. Come inside."]="波尔特！伊瓦琳！天黑了，快回屋里来。"
G["Besides the Grunts outside, my brothers and I fought at the battle of Hyjal. Any who seek to steal from the bank must face us first."]="先不说外面的那些卫兵，我和我的兄弟们可都参加过海加尔山之战。谁想要在银行里面行窃，那就先过我们这一关。"
G["Besides, I've been busy dealing with other issues.  Dozens of my dragons died when those two enemies swept through the front lines."]="而且，我还在忙着处理其它问题。当那两个敌人横扫前线的时候，我的几十头龙都死了。"
G["Besides, once I've gotten the hang of this, I want to be a Tiller like the rest of you!"]="另外，等我掌握窍门之后，我也想跟你们一样，做个阡陌客！"
G["Besides... isn't it THEIR job to pick the flowers?"]="另外……摘花不是他们的活儿吗？"
G["Besides... while an axe can be a valuable tool in war, lances have their uses as well."]="而且……战斧的确很有杀伤力，但是长枪也不赖啊。"
G["Bessy is a hungry girl today, isn't she? Let me go get you an apple."]="贝希今天很饿呢，不是吗？我来喂你一个苹果吧。"
G["Bessy whinneys happily."]="贝希欢快地嘶叫起来。"
G["Bessy, you're home. Thank the Light!"]="贝希，你回来了。感谢圣光！"
G["Best ale in Stormwind, Langston. Thanks."]="暴风城最好的麦酒，朗斯顿。多谢。"
G["Best bait for the biggest fish? Put a wedding ring on your hook."]="钓最大的鱼要用的最好鱼饵？把结婚戒指挂到你的鱼钩上。"
G["Best be on my way. Khara will be expecting me soon. See ya tomorrow X."]="我想我最好现在就回去，卡拉也一定盼着我快点回去。明天见啦。"
G["Best be takin' your business elsewhere, $r. Don't wanna be causin' suspicion."]="你最好去别处做生意吧，$r。我可不想惹麻烦。"
G["Best deals in all of Stormwind my friend, won't find any better. Now, what can I help you with?"]="暴风城最好的货物啊，朋友，你绝对不应该错过。看看有什么你需要的东西吗？"
G["Best drinks in Stormwind!"]="暴风城最好的饮料！"
G["Best keep yer head down, \"matey!\"  If ye know what I mean!\n\nYarrrr!"]="Será mejor que mantengas la cabesa gacha, \"asere\". Si entiendes lo que quiero desir.\n\n¡Yarrrrr!"
G["Best move quickly through this area, stranger."]="Es mejor moverse rápidamente por esta zona, $gforastero:forastera;."
G["Best of all, we will continue to exalt in the glory of bloodshed. A race called 'humans', the enemy of our ally, will try to stop us from taking their lands."]="Lo mejor es que seguiremos exaltándonos en la gloria del derramamiento de sangre. Una raza llamado \"los humanos\", el enemigo de nuestro aliado, intentará evitar que tomemos sus tierras."
G["Best of all, you've forever disabled his infernal machine, leaving nothing for the Horde to claim as their own."]="尤其是，你彻底破坏了雷电之王的恐怖机器，没有让部落将它们据为己有。"
G["Best of luck, $n!"]="好运相伴，$n！"
G["Best of luck, rogue. Whatever the outcome, you are truly a champion."]="祝你好运，潜行者。无论结局如何，你都是一个真正的勇士。"
G["Best pray I don't get out of here, scum."]="你最好祈祷这笼子能永远关着我，渣滓。"
G["Best two out of three!"]="三局两胜！"
G["Best views in all Goldshire, believe me! Well… except for the town hall clock tower."]="Las mejores vistas de toda Goldshire, créeme ¡Bien... excepto por la torre del reloj del ayuntamiento!"
G["Best weapons in the Barrens here!"]="贫瘠之地最好的武器！"
G["Best wishes from the Bravo Company."]="B连为你带来最美好的祝愿。"
G["Best. Noodles! EVER!"]="最好吃、最好吃的面啦！"
G["Best. Workout. Ever."]="最好的永远是最有效的。"
G["Best... Party... Evar!"]="这是……最好的……聚会！"
G["Bested... by the likes of..."]="被这种……打败了……"
G["Bet you didn't know that a kodo can eat its own weight in grass each day. Sure is a lot to shovel when it comes out the other end."]="你也许还不知道，科多兽每天可以吃下相当于自身体重的草食。所以，每天从它们的另一头排出的东西也需要打扫很久。"
G["Bet you not seen a puppy riding a dragon before? Hah! And not again I think."]="我打赌你没有见过狗狗人骑在龙背上的情景吧？哈哈！你以后也不会见到。"
G["Bet you wish you not dead! Too late though, can't wish when you dead! Hah!"]="你肯定不想死吧！太迟啦，死人是不能许愿的！哈哈哈！"
G["Bethekk, your priestess calls upon your might!"]="贝瑟克，你的祭司在召唤你的力量！"
G["Bethod was a great warrior, but apparently not great enough. Find me a new champion. We cannot afford this dishonor now!"]="贝索德是个伟大的战士，但显然他还不够强大。为我找一个新勇士吧。我们不能忍受这种耻辱！"
G["Bethod's Sword?!! Very well, $r, I accept your challenge. But first, you must best my champions. Volgur! Squash this insect!"]="贝索德的剑？！！太好了，$r，我接受你的挑战。但首先，你必须打败我的勇士们。沃尔格！给我碾碎这只爬虫！"
G["Betina, I'd like a replacement Rune of the Dawn please!"]="贝蒂娜，我想要黎明符文的替代物品！"
G["Betina, I'd like a replacement Seal of the Dawn please!"]="贝蒂娜，我想要黎明之印的替代物品！"
G["Betrayal of the Guardian"]="守护者的背叛"
G["Betrayed by one of our own we were. Disgraced...."]="被我们的族人背叛。真是莫大的耻辱……"
G["Betrayed! We came here every week. They seemed to be simple traders. \nNow these... fish-men greet us with one webbed hand, all the while with the other behind their back, holding their knives, waiting for us to turn around so they can plunge them in!"]="¡Traición! Venimos aquí cada semana. Parecían simples comerciantes.\n\nAhora estos... hombres pez nos saludan con una mano palmeada mientras esconden un cuchillo en la otra, esperando a que nos descuidemos para apuñalarnos por la espalda."
G["Betrayers! The day of reckoning comes and with it comes your end! See then if your Lich King saves you from the ancient one's judgement! Now you die!"]="叛徒！审判之日已经来临，你的死期也到了！我倒要看看你效忠的巫妖王能否让你逃脱命运的审判！死吧！"
G["Betsy! Give me Betsy back!"]="伊丽莎白！把我的伊丽莎白还给我！"
G["Better get out of here before he comes by again!"]="在他回来之前，我们最好离开这儿！"
G["Better hurry it up! We don't wanna be here when the fighting starts."]="最好能快点！我们可不想等战斗开始后还呆在这儿。"
G["Better hurry up, $n. I think that Thrall has news on where our people are being held."]="最好快一点，$n。我觉得那个萨尔应该知道大家都被囚禁在哪里。"
G["Better luck next time!"]="祝你下次走运！"
G["Better luck next time! BWAHAHAHAH!"]="祝你下次好运！挖哈哈哈哈哈！"
G["Better luck next time, $n."]="祝你下次好运，$n。"
G["Better luck next time, $n. Try using some abilities that hit more than one enemy at a time!"]="祝你下次好运，$n。你可以试着用一些能够同时打击多名敌人的技巧！"
G["Better luck next time, landlubber!"]="¡Que tengas más suerte la próxima vez, $gmarinero:marinera; de agua dulce!"
G["Better make that a rocket scientist."]="最好弄成个火箭专家。"
G["Better not get in Goregek's way!"]="别挡格利基克的道！"
G["Better not say that too loudly!"]="最好不要说得那么大声！"
G["Better sharpen up, laddie! I may not be there to pull yer bacon outta the fire next time."]="最好小心点儿，小伙子！下一次也许就没那么幸运正巧被我赶上了。"
G["Better than you have tried!"]="我要让你输得心服口服！"
G["Better they're grateful for the clansmen spared death on this miserable hillock. We sought to protect and impress, not to shame."]="还是庆幸他们不用派族人来这里送死吧。我们只想守护家园，表达忠诚而已。"
G["Better to die than to sssubmit..."]="死也不会屈服……"
G["Better to rot in this cell than live as a dishonorable traitor."]="就算是烂在这座牢房里，也比作为耻辱的叛徒活下去更好。"
G["Better watch out!"]="最好小心一些！"
G["Better, much better."]="感觉好多了。"
G["Between Bixi and Buliwyf, there ain't many weapons they haven't had the pleasure of slashing or smashing an orc with.  You can find them hanging out at the Timberline Arms weapon shop if ye need some training."]="比克斯和布里维夫的武器沾满了兽人的鲜血。如果你想学习的话，就去密林武器店找他们吧。"
G["Between a Saurok and a Hard Place."]="蜥蜴人与困境。"
G["Between mantid, soren, mogu, fever, and countless beasts of this jungle, I refuse to let my children out of my sight."]="在这个螳螂妖、蜥蜴人、魔古族、热疫和无数的丛林野兽横行的地方，我绝不会让我的孩子离开我的视线。"
G["Between the colors, a path.\n\nBlink across in light.\n\nFrom the water, you emerge."]="在繁复的色彩中出现一条小路。\n\n被光线映衬得闪闪发光。\n\n你从水底浮上来。"
G["Between the light and the dark, there is shadow... and those shadows have powers you have yet to see."]="在光明与黑暗之间，还有阴影……而那些阴影有些你未曾见过的力量。"
G["Between the orange and the purple passageways near the doors to Maraudon, you will find a third path.\n\nThe scepter you hold in your hands is the key."]="在玛拉顿大门附近的橙色和紫色通道之间还有一条道路。\n\n你手中的节杖便是钥匙。"
G["Between the orchids and the cleaner waters I might have constructed a recipe for the ultimate brew.  I may need to get at Brewmaster Shadowpour's still in order to make it work.  To do that, we'll need to beat him at his own game."]="我或许可以用兰花和净水开发出一种终极佳酿的配方。但我们必须去酒仙影斟的蒸馏室才能把他酿造出来。为此，我们必须在他的强项上打败他。"
G["Between you and me, $n, these Kun-Lai guys are kinda slow. Nothin' like us!"]="这话只对你说，$n，这些昆莱人似乎慢了些。不像我们！"
G["Between you, me, and the tree, murlocs killed the Furlbrows. Yep, saw 'em with my own two eyes. Think they'd been casin' the joint for days, maybe months. They left in a hurry once they got wind of \"Johnny Law\" and the idiot brigade over there..."]="你知，我知，树知——是鱼人杀死了法布隆一家。没错，是我亲眼看见的。我想他们已经蓄谋了好几天，甚至是好几个月了。后来当他们听到与“约翰尼警员”和那白痴编队有关的风声时，就仓皇逃走了……"
G["Beware Marduk!  Beware, or your strength will wither."]="马杜克，小心！否则你的力量将逐渐消弱。"
G["Beware his gaze! Do not look into his eyes!"]="当心他的视线！不要直视他的眼睛！"
G["Beware of Wolpertingers!  They like to bite when you least expect it."]="小心那些鹿角小飞兔！它们总会趁你毫无防备的时候冲出来咬你一口。"
G["Beware of entering Frostwolf territory, soldier. The whole damn place is booby trapped! Landmines galore! Speak with our explosives expert in the first tower on the front lines for more information. I am certain that he could teach you how to diffuse the situation."]="进入霜狼领土时要当心，士兵。这儿到处都是陷阱！还有无数的地雷！跟前线第一座塔楼的爆破专家谈谈。我想他会教你如何处理这些情况的。"
G["Beware of pride! Be humble! The world is plunging into chaos. Old enemies must work together. Proud races must admit they need help."]="警惕骄傲，保持谦卑！世界日渐混乱，宿敌当前必须同心协力。骄傲的种族要承认自己需要帮助。"
G["Beware the Dragonmaw Skybreakers and ascendants as they are not fooled by our magic! Always keep your distance from those entities!"]="小心龙喉碎天者和升腾者，他们能识破我们的魔法！和那些家伙保持距离，切记！"
G["Beware the crane's song, mate. You just might find yourself too distracted to fight."]="小心仙鹤的啼鸣声，伙计。它会让你无法专心战斗的。"
G["Beware the dangers that lie ahead... and do try to remain in one piece."]="小心前面潜伏的危险……就是死也要留个全尸。"
G["Beware the shadow!"]="阴影在弥漫！"
G["Beware!  A $n is upon us!"]="¡Cuidado! ¡$gUn:Una; $n viene hacia nosotros!"
G["Beware!  Beware!  A threat lurks in the wild!  Night Watchers, be on the alert!"]="注意！注意！夜色镇面临巨大的威胁！守夜人，保持警戒！"
G["Beware!  I am under attack!"]="小心！我遭到了攻击！"
G["Beware!  More cultists come!"]="小心！更多信徒来啦！"
G["Beware!  The $r $n attacks us at Winterax Hold!"]="¡Cuidado! ¡$gEl:La; $r $n nos ataca en el Fuerte Hacha Invernal!"
G["Beware!  The Kolkar attack!"]="小心！科卡尔半人马开始攻击了！"
G["Beware!  We are attacked!"]="小心！我们受到攻击了！"
G["Beware! Illusionary Wind-Guards can use their wings to knock you back. When they do, they will likely switch to attacking me instead."]="小心，幻影风卫士会用翅膀击退你，然后再转过头来攻击我！"
G["Beware, $n!"]="$n，小心！"
G["Beware, $n!  Look to the west!"]="小心，$n！看西边！"
G["Beware, coward!"]="当心点，懦夫！"
G["Beware, mortal, beyond this hall lies dangers unheard of in your world. Tread carefully..."]="小心，凡人。穿过这座大厅之后，你将面对在你的世界里从未听说过的危险。小心点……"
G["Beware, mortal.\n\nOnly the most experienced heroes should accompany me in the Nexus."]="当心点，凡人。\n\n只有最老练的英雄才能和我一起进入魔枢。"
G["Beware. Enemies approach!"]="小心，敌人靠近了！"
G["Beware..."]="当心……"
G["Beware... the upper reaches."]="小心……上面的危险。"
G["Beware: I live!"]="当心吧，我复活了！"
G["Beware: straying from the runes for too long or getting hit by multiple bursts in a row will require you to start over."]="注意：离开符文太长时间，或者连续被多重火焰击中，会让你重新开始这场试炼。"
G["Beyond the Elders' Path lies the Wood of Staves, a sacred place that only the worthy may enter."]="长者之路的尽头就是禅杖林，只有最杰出的熊猫人才能进入这片圣地。"
G["Beyond these reaches, the Scourge continue their work, destroying more and more of what we've built. The fight should be there. I should be there."]="在赛场之外，天灾军团仍在肆意破坏着我们的家园。那里才是真正的战场。而我，应该前往真正的战场。"
G["Beyond this corridor, Naralex lies in fitful sleep. Let us go awaken him before it is too late."]="纳拉雷克斯就在这个走廊的尽头沉睡着。我们要赶快唤醒他，否则就太晚了。"
G["Bg'grrml brgl brm!"]="¡Bg'grrml brgl brm!"
G["Biding my time, building my forces, studying the minds of my enemies."]="等待属于我的时机，建立我的军队，分析敌人的心理。"
G["Big Chief Kah Kah, we will be exploring your lands and could use a good guide. Will you help us?"]="伟大的酋长卡哈卡哈，我们将探索您的领地，并且需要一名好的向导。您能帮我吗？"
G["Big comfy tree. Good home."]="大树。温暖的家。"
G["Big guy will save us!"]="主人会救我们的！"
G["Big ones?"]="大家伙？"
G["Big red suckers! Bigger than any orc I'd ever seen. Muscles out to here, tusks out to here..."]="巨大的红色混蛋！比我看到过的任何兽人都要大。肌肉有这么大，獠牙一直到这儿……"
G["Big talk from a blue birdie! How about you come down and see if you can pluck this maggot from the dirt!"]="小蓝鸟又在说大话了！你不如下来看看能不能把我这条虫子从泥土里啄出来！"
G["Big yeti beast can't catch us! We way too fast."]="大雪怪抓不到我们！我们跑得快如飞！"
G["Big, sparkly, magic book help make Glyphs for spells and abilities. Always find near inscription trainer, in The Apothecarium."]="炼金房的铭文训练师身旁有一本巨大的，闪闪发光的魔法书，能够帮助你制作强化法术和技能的铭文。"
G["Big-tongues don't usually come down here anymore... I had a big fight and killed lots."]="大舌头怪通常不敢来这里……我曾在这里和它们交过手，杀死了很多大舌头怪。"
G["Big-tongues here worship shrine, like at other places, but this shrine sometimes have a guardian. Careful if it shows up."]="这里的大舌头怪也供奉祭坛，但这座祭坛有一个守护者。如果它出现的话，你就要当心。"
G["Big-tongues like crystals for shrine things a lot. They not like when we smash them."]="大舌头怪非常宝贝那些用来供奉祭坛的水晶。我们砸碎水晶的话，它们就会发火。"
G["Bijou knows where treasures are hidden."]="比修知道宝藏被藏在哪儿了。"
G["Bijou lost! SQUAWK! *cough*"]="比修失败了！啊！*咳嗽*"
G["Bilgewater Buccaneers for life!"]="加油！锈水海盗队！"
G["Bilgewater engineers have taken advantage of its inherent high-altitude instability and resultant low-cost."]="锈水工程师们充分利用了这种气体固有的高度不稳定性和低成本优点。"
G["Billowing clouds of white smoke... Is that by design?"]="翻滚的白烟……这是预先计划的吗？"
G["Billy says Fizzles used to be a great wizard. But he got turned into a rabbit when one of his spells went bad."]="比利说费索曾是个伟大的巫师。但是当他的某一个法术失败了之后，他就被变成了一只兔子。"
G["Bin dorei am'ovel!"]="¡Bin dorei am'ovel!"
G["Bind Here"]="绑定炉石"
G["Bind at this location."]="将炉石绑在此处。"
G["Bingo!  Look at this!"]="好了！看看这个！"
G["Bingo... I see a Horde crate! Cover me, I'm going out in the open!"]="啊哈……我看见一个部落的箱子！掩护我，那附近没有掩体！"
G["Bip!"]="吡！"
G["Bipsi, this is $n, one of the most recent survivors to emerge from Gnomeregan."]="Bipsi, te presento a $n, $guno:una; de $glos últimos:las últimas; supervivientes en salir de Gnomeregan."
G["Bird of Prey"]="猛禽"
G["Bird spell not working. Me is free!"]="鸦人的法术失效了。我自由了！"
G["Bird, you hurting me!"]="鸟人，你把我弄疼了！"
G["Birds too?! How'd they even learn to tame the birds?!"]="还有鸟？他们是怎么学会驯鸟的啊？！"
G["Bishop threatens pawn..."]="象威胁着卒……"
G["Bite your tongue, $r, lest I rip it from your skull case and use it as a horn warmer."]="咬住你的舌头，$r，以免我把它拽下来用来擦拭我的犄角。"
G["Bite your tongue, $r. I have seen things in my lifetime that you have only heard about in legends. I have killed man, woman, and child without remorse. Under the banner of two Warchiefs of the Horde I have served... And now, I rule Boulderfist."]="闭嘴，$R。我所经历过的一切，你只有在传说中才听说过。我无情地杀死过男人、女人，甚至是孩子。我为两任部落酋长效力过……而现在，我统治着石拳氏族。"
G["Bite's spell isn't going to last forever."]="拜特的法术不可能永远持续下去。"
G["Biting... clawing... clutching... tearing..."]="戳刺……抓扯……紧攥……撕裂……"
G["Bitsy help. Buy meat, rest in tent."]="小小胖为您服务。请吃好住好。"
G["Bixi Wobblebonk in this very shop can train ye in daggers. If ye're still looking abroad, anyone else - Woo Ping in Stormwind, Handiir in the Exodar, and Ilyenia Moonfire in Darnassus - can show ye a thing or two. Me, I was never one fer knife fights."]="这家店里的比克斯可以教你使用匕首。如果你还想认识其他人的话，暴风城的吴平、埃索达的韩迪尔和达纳苏斯的伊琳尼雅·月火也都能教你。至于我，我一直不喜欢用匕首战斗。"
G["Bixi here can teach ye how to lob throwin' weapons.  If Darnassus is more yer speed, talk to Ilyenia Moonfire on the Warrior's Terrace there."]="这里的比克斯能教你怎么使用投掷武器。要是你去达纳苏斯更方便的话，也可以去找那里战士区的伊琳尼雅·月火学习。"
G["Bjorn of the Black Storm! Honor me now with your presence!"]="黑色风暴之王布约恩！应我的召唤前来协助我！"
G["Black Prince, you are very strong. But what good is strength without the vision to guide it?"]="黑王子，你很强大。可是失去指引的力量又有什么用呢？"
G["Black, grey and dark purple are the prescribed colors.  See to it that you don't stray onto the wrong side of fashion street friend.  Bowen Brisboise can help to see that you don't.  You'll find him inside Cold Hearth Manor on the other side of the bridge to the southwest of town."]="黑色、灰色和深紫色是规定的颜色。朋友，看仔细了，可别迷失方向。博文·布里斯博埃斯可以帮助你。你可以穿过镇子西南的桥梁，去炉灰庄园找他。"
G["Blackfathom Deeps"]="黑暗深渊"
G["Blackfathom Deeps can be found at the north end of Zoram Strand along the coast of Ashenvale."]="黑暗深渊位于灰谷海岸佐拉姆海岸的最北部。"
G["Blackheart! Vorpil! Your time has come!"]="布莱卡特！沃匹尔！你们死期将至！"
G["Blackhoof will pound you into dust!"]="黑蹄会把你碾成尘土！"
G["Blackhorn is a demon?"]="黑角是魔鬼？"
G["Blackmoore has much to answer for!"]="布莱克摩尔要为此付出代价！"
G["Blackmoore will have... your head!"]="布莱克摩尔会……抓住你的！"
G["Blackrock Caverns, a level 79-81 dungeon on Blackrock Mountain, is now available for testing. Please be in your full group before teleporting to the dungeon. Meeting Stones are not available for this dungeon yet.\nTo leave the Halls of Stone, simply exit through the normal exit inside the dungeon and you will be teleported to Dalaran. If you die and release, you should teleport back from this NPC."]="Las Cavernas Roca Negra, una mazmorra de nivel 79-81 en la Montaña Roca Negra, ya está disponible para pruebas. Antes de teletransportarte a la mazmorra, asegúrate de que el grupo está formado. Las rocas de encuentro para esta mazmorra todavía no están disponibles.\n\nPara abandonar las Cámaras de Piedra, simplemente sal por la salida normal dentro de la mazmorra y serás teletransportado a Dalaran. Si mueres y liberas espíritu, puedes teletransportarte de nuevo con este PNJ."
G["Blackrock Depths"]="黑石深渊"
G["Blackrock Mountain lies between Searing Gorge in the north and Burning Steppes in the south."]="黑石山脉位于灼热峡谷和燃烧平原的中间。"
G["Blackrock Spire"]="黑石塔"
G["Blackrock take forest!"]="黑石夺取森林！"
G["Blackrocks all over the damned place, Johnny. One main tower at the choke and two smaller huts. It's a death trap."]="Hay Roca Negra por todas partes, Johnny. Una torre principal en el desfiladero y dos cabañas más pequeñas. Es una ratonera.\\"
G["Blacksmith."]="铁匠。"
G["Blacksmith?  Nope, our last one turned back into one of those mindless Scourge.  There's one in the Undercity though to the south of town though.  Undercity is underneath the Ruins of Lordaeron, clever name, huh?  Just take the elevators down at the back of the ruins and then you can talk to one of the Undercity Guardians.  They should be able to point you in the right direction."]="铁匠？不，我们最后一名铁匠都转变成毫无头脑的亡灵天灾士卒啦。但是镇子南边的幽暗城中还居住着一名铁匠。幽暗城在洛丹伦废墟下面，好听的名字，是吗？乘坐废墟后面的升降梯抵达幽暗城，去跟那儿的守卫谈谈，他们会为你指明方向的。"
G["Blacksmithing"]="锻造"
G["Blacksmithing Supplies"]="锻造补给品"
G["Blacksmithing allows you to forge items from metals, minerals and stones: melee weapons, mail and plate heavy armor, raw materials used by other production professions, and upgrades to pieces of equipment such as sharpening stones and shield spikes.\nHighly skilled blacksmiths can add a gem slot to their own bracers and gloves, as well as to their own or others' belts. These gem slots may then be filled with magical gems that make the gemmed item more powerful.\nBlacksmithing pairs well with Mining as it allows you to gather your own ore and minerals."]="La herrería te permite forjar objetos a partir de metales, minerales y piedras: armas cuerpo a cuerpo, armadura pesada de malla y placas, materias primas para otras profesiones de producción y mejoras para equipo como piedras de afilar y puntas de escudo.\n\nLos herreros más avanzados pueden añadir una ranura de gema a sus propios brazales y guantes, además de sus cinturones o los de otras personas. Estas ranuras se pueden llenar con gemas mágicas que hacen que el objeto que las lleva sea más poderoso.\n\nLa herrería se compagina bien con la minería, ya que te permite recolectar tus propios minerales y menas."
G["Blade Lord Ta'yak marks $n for |cFFFF0000|Hspell:122949|h[Unseen Strike]|h|r!"]="刀锋领主塔亚克把$n标记成了|cFFFF0000|Hspell:122949|h[无影击]|h|r的目标！"
G["Bladedancers."]="刃舞者。"
G["Bladefist Bay is fortified -- by the Sunwell, we're getting slaughtered!"]="刃拳海湾的防御增强了——这简直是屠杀！"
G["Blades are drawn, and blood runs red..."]="Las espadas se desenvainan, y la sangre corre roja..."
G["Blades at the ready men!"]="准备好就接刀！"
G["Blades of light!"]="光明之刃！"
G["Blades sharpened! Armor mended!"]="修护甲磨武器了！"
G["Blades, cut them to pieces!"]="宝贝儿…把他们切成碎片！"
G["Bladespire clan not fight fair.  Have gronn to help dem.  You go to Blade's Edge Mountains.  Talk to Mog'dorg the Wizened.  Kill gronn."]="刀塔氏族没有公平地战斗。他们有戈隆帮忙。你去刀锋山，和枯瘦的莫戈多格谈谈。去消灭戈隆吧。"
G["Blam! Right between the eyes!"]="砰！正中眉心！"
G["Blame your companions!"]="要怪就怪你的同伴吧！"
G["Blanche senses there are no longer allies nearby and retreats!"]="布兰琪发现附近没有盟友，因此撤退了！"
G["Blaspheme!"]="亵渎！"
G["Blasphemy! You are not one of the swarm!"]="亵渎！你不是虫群的一员！"
G["Blast 'em!"]="消灭他们！"
G["Blast it, lads. Looks like we've got a fight ahead of us."]="真要命啊，伙计们。看来我们有一场硬仗要打了。"
G["Blast it, this isn't the time for talk! Scourge forces are pressing down upon our war ships. Take up your weapon of choice and protect those boats! If they are destroyed, our war effort will be set back months!"]="现在不是聊天的时候！天灾军团正在攻击我们的战舰。拿起武器，保护那些船只！如果它们被毁了，那我们数月的心血就会付诸流水！"
G["Blast them! Destroy them!"]="炸死他们！摧毁他们！"
G["Blast these beasts back to hell!"]="把这些畜生打回地狱！"
G["Blast these rocky Durotar roads!  I've got places to be, and this isn't one of them."]="炸毁那些杜隆塔尔的岩石大道！我已经确定了几个需要炸毁的地方。但这里并不是其中之一。"
G["Blast those stupid centaurs! Sigh - well, it seems you kept your bargain. Up the road you shall find Smeed Scrabblescrew, he has your money."]="杀死那些愚蠢的半人马！唉——嗯，似乎你信守承诺。沿着这条路走，去找斯米德·瑟卡布斯库，他会付钱给你的。"
G["Blast! You have failed me!"]="该死！你太令我失望了！"
G["Blast... ogres.  I forgot about these buffoons.  There's no easy way around them, so expect plenty of fighting.  Look sharp!"]="Maldita sea... ogros. Me olvidé de esos bufones. No es fácil esquivarlos, así que prepárate para luchar. ¡Estate $gatento:atenta;!"
G["Blast... the Silver Covenant's here."]="该死……银色盟约的人也来了。"
G["Blasted Horde!"]="该死的部落！"
G["Blasted geists! They've practically devoured this one whole..."]="该死的恶鬼！他们几乎吞掉了这具尸体……"
G["Blasted lands - what a fitting name.  Blast this place, blast this keep, and blast the other identical keep."]="诅咒之地——真是个合适的名字。诅咒这个地方，诅咒这座城堡，我还要诅咒另一座一模一样的城堡。"
G["Blasted scrying crystal!  I'm not getting anything over here."]="该死的占卜水晶！我什么都看不到。"
G["Blasted titans... Why do they use a different set of mechanisms at each of their installations?"]="该死的泰坦……为什么他们的每一套设备中都要使用不同机械装置？"
G["Blathering idiot. You incomprehensibly incompetent buffoon..."]="你给我闭嘴，白痴。你真是个不可理喻的蠢材……"
G["Blazcowiz, you'd better get those recoil cylinders greased. Or I will grease them with your FACE."]="布拉科维兹，你最好给这些反冲设备涂好油，否则我就把油涂到你的脸上。"
G["Blaze bright and fade away, $r."]="$r，耀眼的闪电总是会在转瞬间便消失。"
G["Blaze of Glory!"]="荣耀之焰！"
G["Blazing Hippogryph"]="炽焰角鹰兽"
G["Blazing rays of light, take me!"]="炽热之光……请接纳我。"
G["Bleat, come face this foe."]="咩咩，来面对这位敌人吧。"
G["Blech!"]="呸！"
G["Blech! Don't even say it. Of course it was, those were so undercooked...what'd you think poisoned me?"]="呸！不用说。这是当然了，那些东西完全没煮熟……你认为是什么使我中毒的？"
G["Bleed!"]="流血吧！"
G["Bleed, in the snow!"]="让鲜血染红雪地吧！"
G["Bleeeeeed..."]="流血吧……"
G["Bleh! Clearly built by gnomes."]="啧！这肯定是侏儒建造的。"
G["Blerch! I'd rather jump off this bridge."]="得了！我宁可从这桥上跳下去。"
G["Bless the waters for bringing you to my shore, weary traveler. Please rest yourself in the calming mists of my inn."]="Benditas sean las aguas que te arrastraron hasta mi orilla, $gfatigado viajero:fatigada viajera;. Descansa entre el vaho relajante de mi posada."
G["Bless us with tolerance for our elven visitors."]="愿我们能以一颗包容的心来看待那些精灵访客。"
G["Bless yer heart, soldier! Just put 'em in the back room."]="祝福你，士兵！就把它们放在后面吧。"
G["Bless you, friend."]="祝福你，朋友。"
G["Bless you, friend. I nearly expired...."]="$gBendito:Bendita; seas, colega. Casi muero..."
G["Bless you, hero!"]="祝你好运，英雄！"
G["Bless you, mortals, for this release...Hakkar controls me no longer!"]="我祝福你，凡人。你给了我自由……哈卡再也无法控制我了！"
G["Blessed Light! Free of my confines at last... Thank you, hero. A'dal will be told of your heroics."]="感谢圣光！我终于又获得了自由……感谢你，英雄。我会把你的英雄事迹告诉阿达尔。"
G["Blessed Light! She's siphoning energy right out of the Vector Coil!"]="圣光在上！她正在吸取矢量感应器的能量！"
G["Blessed Light! They are all dying!"]="圣光啊！他们快死了！"
G["Blessed ancestors! I feel it... so much love... so much grace... there are... no words... impossible to describe..."]="多么神圣的灵魂！我感觉到……那么博爱……那么高贵……这……不是语言可以形容的……"
G["Blessed spirits! For twenty years, all we knew was that Grom was the first to drink from the cursed chalice and bring damnation down upon our people... It is the only truth his son, Garrosh has ever known."]="天哪！二十年以来，我们只知道是格罗姆第一个喝下诅咒之杯内的东西，把诅咒带给了我们的人民……那是他儿子加尔鲁什唯一知道的事实。"
G["Blessing of the Earth Mother be upon them."]="愿大地母亲祝福他们。"
G["Blessings of the Earth Mother upon you."]="愿大地母亲祝福你。"
G["Blessings of the Naaru. What can I help you find?"]="纳鲁的祝福。我能帮你什么忙吗？"
G["Blessings of the Pandriarchs."]="族长的祝福。"
G["Blessings of the four winds upon you, stranger."]="愿四风庇佑你，陌生人。"
G["Blessings of the naaru upon you, my friend."]="纳鲁祝福你，我的朋友。"
G["Blessings of the spirits of the land and air upon you."]="愿天地间的精魂永远保佑你。"
G["Blight Crystal!"]="荒芜水晶！"
G["Blight, Blight, Blight... that's all I hear about around here. I miss the diversity!\n\nHere, here. You have pets, yes? Of course you do. Of course. Little pets. I have a mixture for them. It will make them ca-- ah, clever and strong creatures, yes. Yes. Strong.\n\nTry it!"]="样本……样本……除了样本，就不能谈点别的吗？生活应该丰富多彩才对啊！\n\n我说，你的宠物呢？你肯定带着小宠物的吧。喏，这瓶药剂能让它们变得……呃，变得既聪明又强壮！我不骗你啦！\n\n试试吧！"
G["Blind fool! You have no idea what you are doing!"]="盲目的蠢货！你根本不知道自己在干什么！"
G["Blinding white light, and then silence!"]="令人目眩的白光，然后就是一片死寂！"
G["Blizzy, knock 'em out cold!"]="眩光，击倒他们！"
G["Block their retreat, Liam!  We've got them right where we want them!"]="封锁退路！利亚姆，把他们赶到计划中的地点去！"
G["Blonde hair, green skin, horn head, blue skin - all it means to us are new markets for our excellent goblin engineering! Even the prospect of another war against the Legion means more sales for us!"]="金发，绿皮肤，带角的脑袋，蓝皮肤——所有这些家伙都给我们伟大的地精工程学带来了新的市场！即使是与燃烧军团的第二次战争展望都会提高我们的销量！"
G["Blood Elf"]="血精灵"
G["Blood Elves are the masters of the universe. There is no questioning it."]="血精灵是宇宙的主宰。这毋庸置疑。"
G["Blood Knight Noellene awaits young trainees within the northeast building of the square."]="血骑士诺尔蕾妮正在广场东北方的建筑里面等着年轻的新兵们。"
G["Blood and Thunder!"]="鲜血与雷鸣！"
G["Blood and Thunder, $n!"]="鲜血与雷鸣,$n!"
G["Blood and honor, $c."]="鲜血与荣耀，$c。"
G["Blood and honor, hero. The Horde welcomes you. Your people will be put to the test as we obliterate Twilight's Hammer and lay claim to this distant shore. But first... some unfinished business."]="鲜血与荣耀，英雄。部落欢迎你。你们的能力将在消灭暮光之锤，夺取这片海岸的战争中受到考验。但首先……还有些事情要处理。"
G["Blood and souls for Hakkar!  HAHAHAH!"]="鲜血和灵魂，为了哈卡而战！哈哈哈！"
G["Blood and souls for my King!"]="献给王的鲜血与灵魂！"
G["Blood and terror, harvester!"]="鲜血与恐怖，收割者！"
G["Blood and thunder!"]="鲜血与雷鸣！"
G["Blood and thunder! Challengers, your death comes for you!"]="鲜血与雷鸣！挑战者，你的死期到了！"
G["Blood and thunder!!"]="鲜血与雷鸣！！"
G["Blood and thunder, $r!"]="鲜血与雷鸣，$r！"
G["Blood and thunder, champions of the Horde! We fight on this day for our fallen brothers and sisters! Mourn them not for they all died with honor in their hearts!"]="鲜血与雷鸣，部落的勇士们！今天，我们要为死去的兄弟姐妹而战！不要悲伤，因为他们都是心怀荣耀的勇者！"
G["Blood as a power source - a very powerful form of life magic. The work of the titans, perhaps? How does it work?"]="以鲜血为源——这种魔法很强大。或许是泰坦的杰作？它是怎么运转的？"
G["Blood blood blood BLOOD BLOOD!!"]="血，血，血，血，血！！"
G["Blood elf treasure's unlike any other.  It's not just the gold or the silk or gems used as materials, sin'dorei craftsmanship is valuable in and of itself."]="与其他种族不同，血精灵的财富不仅仅局限于金币、丝绸或是宝石之类的原材料。辛多雷精妙的工艺本身就是无价的财富。"
G["Blood flow around me!"]="鲜血！在我身边流淌吧！"
G["Blood for blood!"]="血债血还！"
G["Blood for my blade!"]="我的刀渴望鲜血！"
G["Blood for the Thunder King!"]="誓死追随雷电之王！"
G["Blood guard, you have to help me find him. He just went missing!"]="血卫士，你必须帮我找到他。我完全找不到他！"
G["Blood is a pure offering to those who give us these vast powers.  And the blood of an innocent is purer still.  With the life fluid of our enemies, we will open the portal and step into a glorious new world - a new page in the history of the Horde!"]="血是献给那些赐与我们巨大力量的神明的最完美的祭品。无辜者的血是最完美的。随着我们敌人的生命之血流淌出来，我们将打开传送门，步入一个光荣的新世界，步入部落历史上崭新的一页！"
G["Blood magic is shunned by many as a dark and forgotten art.  In that and many other ways, it shares some distinct characteristics with demonic magic.  Here, in the demon-scourged remains of the Black Morass, we believe that our blood studies will flourish."]="许多人把血魔法当作一门黑暗与失落的艺术，对其避之不及。从那以及许多其它方面来说，它与恶魔的法术有着某种共通的鲜明特性。在这里——在黑色沼泽恶魔肆虐的遗迹中，我们相信我们的血魔法一定能焕发光华。"
G["Blood mushrooms are more common than the other fungi varieties and can be found mostly anywhere in the woods around Bloodmyst. Keep your search south of the road dividing Bloodmyst if you value your life."]="血蘑菇和其它蘑菇比起来就普通多了，几乎可以在秘血岛周围森林中的任何地方找到。如果你不想丢了小命，就到秘血岛上的大道南边找找。"
G["Blood of Gladiators"]="角斗士之血"
G["Blood of War"]="战争之血"
G["Blood pox."]="血色天灾。"
G["Blood will be true. We can trust in none but our own!"]="流血是真实的。我们只能相信自己！"
