G["Bloodcleave."]="血斩。"
G["Bloodfang? When the attacks upon Gilneas first occurred, it was Bloodfang's worgen that lead the charge. This monster and his pack have been terrorizing these lands for years."]="血牙？首先对吉尔尼斯发动攻击的正是血牙的狼人。那个怪物和他的爪牙们已经在这片土地上横行肆虐了许多年。"
G["Bloodfeast summons Blood Maggots to his aid!"]="食血者召唤出血蛆帮忙！"
