G["Bloodlord, you gonna take better care of your possessions?"]="血领主，你要更用心地照看你的财产吗？"
G["Bloodmaul Brew? Me favorite!"]="血槌啤酒？我的最爱！"
G["Bloodscalp, Sandfury, Skullsplitter, Vilebranch and Witherbark. They all pledge their allegiance to Jin - their souls to Hakkar. You have lost."]="血顶、沙怒、劈颅、邪枝和枯木。他们都发誓效忠我们——他们的灵魂与哈卡同在。你已经输了。"
G["Bloodseeker, your regenerative powers fascinate me. I wonder if you would consent to a few tests."]="觅血者，你的再生能力让我着迷。我不知道你是否愿意做一些测试。"
G["Bloody Forsaken!  They'll pay for what they've done!"]="该死的被遗忘者！他们要为他们所做的一切付出代价！"
G["Bloody... Must have been the goblins... Let's see how bad the damage is."]="该死的……一定是地精干的……让我们去看看损失有多大。"
