G["Bluegill Marsh north of Menethil Harbor in the Wetlands holds many locked boxes from the wrecks offshore that have washed ashore."]="海浪将船只残骸中的许多上锁的箱子冲到了位于湿地米奈希尔海湾以北的蓝腮沼泽中。"
G["Blurg awrurgle mrr?"]="¿Blurg awrurgle mrr?"
G["Blurglgr murbrgl... just kidding, I can understand you."]="Blurglgr murbrgl……开个玩笑，我能听懂你的话。"
