G["Bold Karasshi mentioned a $r would pass through. That person must be you."]="Karasshi el Audaz mencionó que $gun:una; $r pasaría por aquí. Tú debes ser esa persona."
G["Bold flavor, bold heat! No other noodles come close!"]="又鲜又辣！无与伦比的美味！"
G["Bold of you, to strike a queen. A lesser monarch might be enraged."]="真大胆，竟敢攻击女王。幸好我宽宏大量。"
G["Boldly said. But I remain... unconvinced."]="说得好。但是这毫无意义。"
G["Bolster my defenses! Hurry, curse you!"]="协助防御！快点，废物们！"
G["Bolvar was like a brother to him. In the King's absence, Bolvar kept the Alliance united. He found strength for our people in our darkest hours. He watched over Anduin, raising him as his own."]="伯瓦尔和他情同手足。国王离开期间，是他维系着联盟的团结。在最艰难的日子里，他是人民的支柱，他监护着安度因，将其视如己出。"
G["Bolyun, is Kariva still about?"]="波尔温，卡丽瓦还在附近吗？"
G["Bom'bay found a volunteer!"]="波贝找到了一个志愿者！"
G["Bomb Condition: 40 Percent!"]="炸弹状况：百分之40！"
G["Bomb Condition: 60 Percent!"]="炸弹状况：百分之60！"
G["Bomb Condition: 80 Percent!"]="炸弹状况：百分之80！"
G["Bomb Condition: Critical!"]="炸弹状况：危急！"
G["Bomb Condition: Fully Repaired"]="炸弹状况：完全修复！"
G["Bomber went down!  The pilot's out safe though!"]="轰炸机已经坠毁！但是飞行员安全跳伞啦！"
