G["Bombs away!"]="投弹！"
G["Bonelashers, I hate them all!\n\nIf it weren't for the loss of my eye, and the fainting spells that I get sometimes, I'd be out there shooting them down all the time!"]="白骨秃鹫，我恨他们！\n\n要不是我失去了眼睛，要不是我那时灵时不灵的法术，我早就出去把他们全部轰成渣了！"
G["Bones... flesh... muscles... tendons... cartilage... it all comes together here under my hacksaw."]="小心我的钢锯，它会让你看到很多内在的东西，不是吗？"
G["Bones?"]="骨头？"
G["Bonesunder begins to cast Crack Bone!"]="裂骨者开始施放裂骨！"
G["Bonk! Yes sir!"]="哈！听命！"
G["Boo-hoo! I'm a poor little gnome, and I don't have a capital ci... oh, wait."]="噗嗤！我是一个小侏儒！而且……，我没有主……呃，算了……"
G["Boogaloo of the boom boom!"]="轰轰大狂欢！"
G["Books have been disappearing as of late. The Lorekeeper and his assistants are in a frenzy. They suspect foul play within Eldre'Thalas."]="最近书本丢失甚多。博学者和他的助手非常恼怒。他们怀疑在埃雷萨拉斯有人妄图不轨。"
G["Boom boom for you!"]="给你来点儿轰轰！"
G["Boom boom too small! Wikket being sticky with the boom booms."]="轰轰太小啦！有轰轰的蠢蛋好难缠！"
G["Boom! Nice one!"]="砰！打得好！"
G["Boom, baby!"]="炸啊，宝贝儿！"
G["Boosh!"]="嘭！"
G["Booster rockets for cages. What will I think of next? I am a genius!"]="在笼子上安装推进火箭。我的下一个构想又会是什么？我真是个天才！"
G["Boot-up protocol completed.  Scanning for objective..."]="启动程序完毕。扫描目标……"
G["Boots, what do you have back there that goes down smooth?"]="布兹，酒单给我。"
G["Bor's Anvil is engulfed in tuskarr fire!"]="伯尔之砧被烈焰吞没了！"
G["Bor's Hammer is engulfed in tuskarr fire!"]="伯尔之锤被烈焰吞没了！"
G["Borak, I need another bundle of bloodthistle."]="伯拉克，我需要另一捆血蓟。"
G["Borean Tundra"]="北风苔原"
G["Bored now!"]="真无聊啊！"
G["Bored.  You die now."]="无聊。你该死了。"
G["Bored? He was almost dead!"]="烦了？他都快死了！"
G["Borgosh! $n is ready to be trained."]="伯古什！$n已经准备好接受训练啦。"
G["Borgrim might be correct.  Maybe we do need to take a break.\n\nBut now that we're here, I'm eager to get my hands dirty and study what this land has to offer."]="伯格瑞姆可能是对的，也许我们确实需要休息一会儿。\n\n不过现在我们既然在这里了，我很想立刻着手研究这个地方会给我们带来什么。"
