G["Borgus used to work at the Great Forge but I hear he moved down to Stormwind when they finished rebuilding. Rumor holds that he started a shop in the Dwarven District with a man named Kathrum Axehand."]="博古斯以前据说是在大煅炉旁边工作的，但是当暴风城的重建工作完成之后，他就搬到了暴风城。有传言说他和一个叫卡斯鲁姆·斧拳的家伙一起在暴风城的矮人区开了一家店。"
G["Boring..."]="真没意思……"
G["Bork, bork, bork!"]="炒，炒，炒！"
G["Born to be Wi-i-ild!"]="天生狂野！"
G["Boss Bazzelflange wants more people fighting, and she wants 'em fighting better.\n\"Incentives!\", she says.  \"We need to give 'em a better reason to brawl!\"\nSo she has us build this zeppelin, see. Glorious views of the fight, all the fancy alcohol you can buy, and the satisfaction of bragging to your mates that you can go to a place that they can't go to. Y'see - she only lets you up if you're Rank 8 or higher.\nYou want to get up on the zep? Keep winning your fights, bucko."]="La jefa Zumbarriel quiere a más gente luchando, y quiere que lo hagan mejor.\n\n\"¡Incentivos!\", dice ella. \"¡Tenemos que darles mejores razones para pelear!\"\n\nAsí que nos ha hecho construir este zepelín, ¿ves? Con vistas maravillosas de la pelea, todo el alcohol fino que puedas comprar y la satisfacción de fanfarronear con tus amigos sobre que puedes ir a un sitio al que ellos no pueden ir. Porque solo te deja subir si tienes rango 8 o superior.\n\n¿Quieres subir al zepelín? Pues sigue ganando tus peleas."
G["Boss Bizmo said no nobodies allowed!"]="比兹莫老板说了，谁也不准进！"
G["Boss Cho'gall not gonna be happy 'bout dis!"]="古加尔老板可不会喜欢这样！"
G["Boss says there's at least fifty people in line in front of you.\n\nIt's packed in here."]="El jefe dice que hay como mínimo cincuenta personas en la cola antes que tú. Esto está hasta la bandera."
G["Boss, one of the boys is causing some trouble outside."]="头领，有个小子正在外面惹麻烦。"
G["Boss, tell Sassy that I'll get her more Kaja'Cola just as soon as production resumes."]="$gJefe:Jefa;, dile a Sassy que le llevaré más Kaja'Cola en cuanto se reanude la producción."
G["Boss, we gotta get you a bazillion macaroons by any means possible!"]="$gJefe:Jefa;, ¡tenemos que conseguirte un bazillón de macarrones como sea!"
G["Boss-Lady is nuts if she thinks I'll just eat this grub!"]="要是女工头以为我会吃这种垃圾，那她就是个白痴！"
G["Boss... this is real nice. Thank you."]="$gJefe:Jefa;... está muy bien. Gracias."
G["Bossy, I need to ask something great of you.  I need to cut off your head to prove my loyalty to the Bloodsail Buccaneers, so they will allow me to infiltrate their ranks and hopefully discover their true intentions.\nBooty Bay needs you, Bossy... now more than ever."]="Mandona, necesito pedirte un gran favor. Tengo que cortarte la cabeza para probar mi lealtad a los bucaneros Velasangre, de modo que me permitan entrar a formar parte de ellos; y así podré descubrir cuáles son sus verdaderas intenciones.\n\nBahía del Botín te necesita, Mandona... Ahora más que nunca."
G["Botanist Nathera has a keen eye for finding herbs, and I imagine she might impart her wisdom to the likes of you. You'll find her with the alchemists in an alcove of the Court of the Sun."]="植物学家娜萨兰有着一副寻找药草的敏锐眼睛，我想她可能会把她的智慧传授给像你这样的家伙吧。你可以在逐日王庭那里的亭子中找到她和炼金师们。"
G["Both Garrosh's Landing and Pal'ea were wiped out by the mist. We're the only ones crazy enough to stay here, buddy!"]="迷雾已经蔓延到了加尔鲁什码头和帕尔依。我们却还留在这里，真是疯了！"
G["Both Hanashi and Sayoc can train you in the use of one and two-handed axes. They can be found in the Valley of Honor in Orgrimmar."]="哈纳什和塞尤克可以教会你如何使用单手斧和双手斧。你可以在奥格瑞玛的荣誉谷找到他们。"
G["Both Handiir and Buliwyf can show you how to swing a mace properly, no matter the size. You can find Buliwyf within the Timberline Arms in Ironforge. Handiir spends his days in the Exodar, training draenei on the Trader's Tier."]="韩迪尔和布里维夫都能指导你怎么挥舞锤子，无论大小。你可以在铁炉堡的密林武器店内找到布里维夫，而韩迪尔则整天待在埃索达的贸易阶梯训练着德莱尼人。"
G["Both Ilyenia Moonfire on the Warrior's Terrace of Darnassus and Bixi Wobblebonk of the Timberline Arms in Ironforge can show you how to use throwing weapons properly."]="达纳苏斯战士区的伊琳尼雅·月火和铁炉堡密林武器店的比克斯都能指导你怎么适当地使用投掷武器。"
G["Both Lost Rigger Cove in Tanaris and the Bay of Storms in Azshara have boxes that can be picked to improve your skill."]="塔纳利斯的落帆海湾和艾萨拉的风暴海湾都有许多上锁的箱子，打开之后即可提高你的技能。"
G["Both are places of great evil.  This is the leg of my journey that I shun the most."]="这两个地方都被强大的邪恶气息所笼罩。是我最不愿意去的地方。"
G["Both da alliance and da horde got ships sailin for da harbor.  We gonna split der forces an assault da front gate."]="联盟和部落都已经向港口派出了舰队。我们得分出一些部队来进攻前门。"
G["Both of you know I would never order such a thing! Why would I set one half my son's inheritance against the other?"]="你们都知道我决不会下这种命令！我为什么要把我儿子的遗产分一半给别人？"
G["Both our peoples have suffered greatly at the hands of Kael'thas and his agents, Lady Liadrin. Your people were not the authors of their own fate, but they will die if they do not change."]="女伯爵莉亚德琳，我们的人民都遭受着凯尔萨斯和他的手下所带来的巨大痛苦。你的人民并不应该为他们曾做过的事情负责，但是如果不做出改变的话，他们必将因此灭亡。"
G["Both sides defended the keep! Draw!"]="双方都守住了要塞！平局！"
G["Both students close their eyes, straining to hear the voices."]="每个学生都闭上了眼睛，竖着耳朵听着声音。"
G["Both the Horde and Alliance captains have fallen!  Defeat Drek'Thar before it's too late!"]="¡Los capitanes de la Horda y la Alianza han caído! ¡Acabad con Drek'Thar antes de que sea demasiado tarde!"
G["Both the Horde and Alliance captains have taken to the field.  Our Captain Balinda Stonehearth directs the Stormpike forces from the Stonehearth Outpost, and the enemy Captain Galvangar barks orders from within Iceblood Garrison.\n\nTo battle!"]="Los capitanes de la Horda y la Alianza han entrado en el campo. Nuestra capitana, Balinda Piedrahogar, dirige a las tropas Pico Tormenta desde la Avanzada Piedrahogar y el capitán enemigo, Galvangar, ladra órdenes desde el interior del Baluarte Sangrehielo.\n\n¡A la batalla!"
G["Both the Horde and Alliance captains have taken to the field.  Our Captain Galvangar directs the Frostwolves from Iceblood Garrison, and his rival, Captain Balinda Stonehearth, hides in her Stonehearth Outpost.\n\nThe battle has begun!"]="Los capitanes de la Horda y la Alianza han entrado en el campo. Nuestro capitán, Galvangar, dirige a los Lobo Gélido desde el Baluarte Sangrehielo y su oponente, la capitana Balinda Piedrahogar, se esconde en la Avanzada Piedrahogar.\n\n¡La batalla ha comenzado!"
G["Boulderfist hungry! Need food! Warmaul ogre tribe kick Boulderfist out of mound to north. Many more Boulderfist to feed now."]="石拳氏族好饿！要吃东西！战槌氏族把石拳氏族赶到了北面。石拳需要更多食物。"
G["Boulderfist strong. Witherbark strong. Together we smash enemies!  Roaaarrrr!"]="石拳很强大。枯木很强大。我们在一起，打碎一切敌人！吼！！"
G["Bouldergut, you coward! Fight someone your own size!"]="石胆，你这懦夫！找个和你体型一样大的人交手吧！"
G["Bouncy, bouncy!"]="再来，再来！"
G["Bound by bone!"]="白骨的束缚！"
G["Bounties for notorious criminals and vicious animals are posted here. It would be much too dangerous for you to pursue the bounty posted here right now, but check the board again as you gain strength."]="那些声名狼藉的罪犯与凶兽的悬赏被张贴在这里。对现在的你来说，这些悬赏实在太危险了，当你变强后再回来看看吧。"
G["Bout time they sent some heroes from HQ. Get out there and fight, $c!"]="他们也该从总部派几个英雄过来了。出来战斗吧，$c！"
G["Bow"]="弓"
G["Bow Hit!"]="击中前部！"
G["Bow before our might!"]="屈服于我们的力量！"
G["Bow before the Zandalari!"]="臣服于赞达拉吧！"
G["Bow before your king!"]="向你们的王致敬！"
G["Bow before your new master!"]="向你的新主人俯首致敬吧！"
G["Bow before your terrestrial overlord as fire rains down upon you!"]="当火雨从天而降，臣服于你们陆上的霸主吧！"
G["Bow down before your lord and master!"]="跪拜你的主人和首领吧！"
G["Bow down before your superiors, and you may yet survive the destruction of this puny world!"]="拜服于强者脚下，你也许还能在这个渺小世界的毁灭中逃过一死！"
G["Bow down!"]="鞠躬！"
G["Bow down! Kneel before the Ashbringer! A new dawn approaches, brothers and sisters! Our message will be delivered to the filth of this world through the chosen one!"]="鞠躬！在灰烬使者的面前叩首！兄弟们，姐妹们，新的黎明已经到来！我们的意志将被这位天选之人送达世界的每一个角落！"
G["Bow in my presence, insect! Surely you can feel the power I hold over you."]="卑微的家伙，在我面前鞠躬吧！你能感受到我那强大的力量。"
G["Bow to me and we shall begin."]="对我鞠躬，我们就开始。"
G["Bow to my will!"]="服从我的意志！"
G["Bow to my will."]="屈服于我的意志吧。"
G["Bow to the Shao-Tien!"]="向韶天鞠躬行礼！"
G["Bow to the might of the Doom Lord! You stand no chance!"]="¡Inclínate ante el poder del Señor Apocalíptico! ¡Estás $gacabado:acabada;!"
G["Bow to the might of the Scourge!"]="臣服于天灾军团的力量吧！"
G["Bow your heads!"]="低下你们的头！"
G["Bow your heads! $n walks among us!"]="低头行礼！$n正从我们身边走过！"
G["Bowing out so soon? I knew you weren't up to the challenge!"]="这么快就认输了？我早知道你不是我的对手！"
G["Bows ready..."]="拉弓……"
G["Box stupid. Lumurk sleepy."]="箱子真蠢。拉穆尔克要睡觉。"
G["Boy I wish I had a ride like this!"]="孩子，真希望我也有这样的座驾！"
G["Boy howdy! Look at this pretty little pool!"]="好家伙！看看这个可爱的小池子！"
G["Boy's naive enough ta think he can change the Horde 'an save the world... but... he's still just a child."]="这孩子天真的以为他可以说服部落，拯救世界……可是……他只是个孩子。"
G["Boy, I could really use one of those gryphons right about now..."]="亲娘哎，要是可以骑狮鹫就好了……"
G["Boy, what I wouldn't give for a bowl of old Salma Saldean's Westfall stew right about now."]="伙计，我愿意用任何东西来换一碗老萨尔玛·萨丁的杂味炖肉。"
G["Boy, you couldn't fix a sandwich without someone tellin' ya how to do it."]="伙计，没有人教你的话，你是不会知道该如何处理这块三明治的。"
G["Boys and girls - children of all ages - the Darkmoon Faire has arrived!  Huzzah!"]="男孩们女孩们——所有的孩子们——暗月马戏团已经到啦！哈哈！"
G["Boys have cooties and girls have beauty!"]="男孩有虱子女孩有美貌！"
G["Boys, go see who's doing that."]="孩子们，去看看是谁在捣鬼。"
G["Brace yourself for the glorious impact, Impsy!"]="振作起来，迎接挑战！"
G["Brace yourself!"]="振作点！"
G["Brace yourself, $n!"]="打起精神——另一波又来了！"
G["Brace yourself, $r.\n\nThe naga could attack again any moment."]="坚持住，$r。\n\n纳迦随时有可能再次发动攻击。"
G["Brace yourself. The Firelands are a dangerous place... even for a formidable $r such as yourself.\n\nLet me know when you are ready."]="Prepárate. Las Tierras de Fuego son un lugar peligroso... Incluso para $gun:una; $r tan fuerte como tú.\n\nAvísame cuando quieras partir."
G["Brace yourselves!"]="振作起来！"
G["Brace yourselves, men!"]="大家坚持住！"
G["Brace yourselves, they're coming back around!"]="坚持住，他们又回来了！"
G["Braggart."]="目中无人。"
G["Brahaha! Tha look on their faces as old Trollplow's gun came swiveling around to meet them! Their saws couldn't even touch me!"]="啊哈哈哈哈哈！我用枪指着他们鼻子的时候，那些家伙脸上的表情别提有多搞笑了！他们的锯子甚至都没能碰到我！"
G["Brain encaved... mortar... bas... hed... leaking... dyin... g..."]="头脑不听使唤……失去意识……死亡迫近……"
G["Brains..."]="食物……"
G["Brains... braaaiiins!"]="大脑……大脑脑脑！"
G["Bramblestaff, do something!"]="棘杖，快做些什么！"
G["Brandur Ironhammer would be the one ye'd want to see.  Ye can find him in the Hall of Mysteries north of the gates of Ironforge."]="布兰度尔·铁锤就是你想找的人。你可以去铁炉堡大门以北的神秘大厅找他。"
G["Brann doesn't record the translations, but it says he committed them to memory before fleeing the battle."]="布莱恩并没有记录译文，日志中只提到他在躲避战乱前背下了所有的符文。"
G["Brann taught me everything I know about exploring."]="我所知道的关于探险的知识，都是布莱恩教给我的。"
G["Brann writes that he was working on a guide to these runic symbols when the giants and their allies attacked."]="布莱恩写道，正在他尝试破译符文内容时，遭到了巨人和他们的盟友的袭击。"
G["Brann! $n just activated the orbital defense system! If we don't get out of here soon, we're going to be toast!"]="布莱恩！$n激活了轨道防御系统！我们必须立即离开这里，不然会被烤熟的！"
G["Brann!? Wha?! How..."]="布莱恩？！什么？！怎么会……"
G["Brann's beard, just STOP!"]="以布莱恩胡子的名字，停！"
G["Brann, it would be our honor!"]="布莱恩，能帮助你是我们的荣幸！"
G["Brash. Master Ravenholdt does not like brash."]="鲁莽的家伙。拉文霍德公爵可不喜欢这样的人。"
G["Brashly you have attacked my children, Illidan! The pact is broken. Giant will never side with elf! NEVER!"]="啊啊啊！你居然袭击了我的孩子，伊利丹！我们之间的盟约完了，巨人与精灵誓不两立！誓不两立！"
G["Brashly, you have come to wrest the secrets of the Living Flame! You will soon regret the recklessness of your quest."]="你们要不顾一切地揭开烈焰之子的秘密，你们会为这鲁莽的行为付出巨大的代价！"
G["Brashtide and Bloodsail be damned!  The Blackwater Raiders hold Booty Bay!"]="“急浪船帮”和血帆海盗死定了！藏宝海湾是黑水强盗的！"
G["Brave Liu Lang set out to explore the world on the back of a sea turtle."]="勇敢的刘浪骑在海龟背上，出发去探索这个世界。"
G["Brave adventurer, thank you for rescuing me! I am sure Marshal Marris will reward your kind deed."]="勇敢的冒险者，谢谢你救了我！我保证马瑞斯大人会重赏你的。"
G["Brave champions, we owe you our lives, our freedom.... Though it be a tiny gesture in the face of this enormous debt, I pledge that from this day forth, all will know of your deeds, and the blazing path of light you cut through the shadow of this dark citadel."]="勇士们，你们救了我们，还我们自由……这种大恩大德我们无以为报。但我发誓，从今往后所有人都会知道你们的事迹，知道你们如何在这座黑暗的城堡中劈开一条光明之路。"
G["Brave soldier of the Horde, I salute you! We would have surely been destroyed by the Alliance gunship had it not been for you and your allies.\n\nTake a moment to rest before we begin our assault upon the upper reaches of the citadel."]="部落勇敢的战士，我向你致敬！如果没有你和你盟友的帮助，我们一定会死在联盟炮艇的火力下。\n\n请稍事休息，随后我们会展开针对敌人堡垒上游的袭击。"
G["Brave soldier, I shall see to it that your noble sacrifice is not forgotten."]="勇敢的士兵，你高贵的牺牲绝不会被忘记。"
G["Brave the brew that's truly unique! Invigorating, satisfying... amber-brew!"]="快来尝尝真正的独家美酒吧！绝对提神、过瘾的……琥珀酒！"
G["Brave words, mage.  I'll SPIT in your FACE when you beg for mercy."]="真是豪言壮语啊。等你乞求怜悯时，我会把口水吐你脸上。"
G["Bravely fought Narrisha. We will get you next time Red Team!"]="娜里莎战斗得很勇敢。我们下次肯定能打败你们红队！"
G["Braving these wastes has made my pets undefeatable."]="勇闯这片荒野，已经让我的宠物变得战无不胜。"
G["Bravo Company Field Kit ACTIVE. New abilities are now available on your action bar.\nToggle Bravo Company Field Kit to DEACTIVATE."]="Paquete de campo de la Compañía Bravo ACTIVADO. Hay nuevas facultades disponibles en tu barra de acción.\n\nAcciona el paquete de campo de la Compañía Bravo para DESACTIVARLO."
G["Bravo Company Field Kit ACTIVE. Plant Seaforium is now available on your action bar.\nToggle Bravo Company Field Kit to DEACTIVATE."]="Paquete de campo de la Compañía Bravo ACTIVADO. Ahora Plantar seforio está disponible en tu barra de acción.\n\nAcciona el paquete de campo de la Compañía Bravo para DESACTIVARLO."
G["Bravo! Bravo! Good show. What? You thought I was dead?"]="太好了！太棒了！完美的演出。你说什么？你以为我死了？"
G["Bravo! Bravo! Good show... I couldn't convince you to work for me, could I? No, I suppose the needless slaughter of my employees might negatively impact your employment application."]="好啊！好啊！表现得真好……我不能劝你为我工作，我能吗？不，我想我手下的那些屠夫会影响到你的签约。"
G["Bravo, $n! It wasn't pretty, but it worked."]="好啊，$n！这不中看，但是很中用。"
G["Bravo, Gerard, you have exceeded yourself, yet again."]="妙极了，杰勒德，你们超越了自己，再来一次。"
G["Brawl'gar veterans may remember Blat, the self-replicating ooze. Today, we meet his meaner, uglier, older sister: Splat!"]="搏击俱乐部的老手们可能还记得那个能自我复制的软泥怪，布拉特。今天，我们将迎来他这位更卑鄙、更丑陋的姐姐：斯普拉特！"
G["Brawl... with Rook."]="跟鲁克……打一架。"
G["Brazenly you have disregarded powers beyond your understanding."]="你们正在挑战一个无比强大的存在。"
G["Bread"]="面包"
G["Bread here! Loaves of your favorites! Nice and fresh!"]="面包，卖面包啦！保证新鲜！快来买啊！"
G["Break any of these supplies, and I'll break your skull!"]="要是敢弄破一件货物，我就打碎你的脑袋！"
G["Break free of your shackles, $n!"]="$n，冲破束缚，重获自由吧！"
G["Break his legs."]="打断他的腿。"
G["Break it up! The Brute Squad is coming!"]="住手！大块头保安来了！"
G["Break out the gatestone. Open this thing up."]="打破门石。把它打开。"
G["Break their bones!"]="斩断他们的骨头！"
G["Break their bones, papa!"]="打碎他们的骨头，水泡先生！"
G["Break them!"]="干掉他们！"
