G["Breath of the Dragon!"]="巨龙之息！"
G["Breath of the empress, bring mighty Garalon to us!"]="女皇之息，带来强大的加拉隆吧！"
G["Breath, damn it!"]="喘气啊，该死的！"
G["Breathe deep, friends! Breathe it all in!"]="深呼吸，朋友！全吸进去！"
