G["Brek Stonehoof can be found at Stonehoof Geology on the lower rise and can teach you the proper way to harvest precious ores and gems."]="去中部高地的石蹄地质学会找布瑞克·石蹄，他会教你如何采集矿石和宝石。"
G["Brew coming through!"]="美酒来了！"
G["Brew for the Horde! Drink for the Horde!"]="为了部落，酿！为了部落，喝！"
G["Brew here!"]="在这里酿造！"
G["Brew of the Month Club"]="本月美酒俱乐部"
G["Brew of the Month Club?"]="本月美酒俱乐部？"
G["Brew run!"]="倒酒！"
G["Brew something delicious and defend from yaungol attackers."]="酿造一些美酒，抵挡野牛人的袭击。"
G["Brewfest has called down the thunder!  Thunderbrew, that is!"]="美酒节上就要喝真正的酒，雷酒！"
G["Brewfest has undergone some changes since its first year.  We now issue Brewfest tokens instead of tickets.  If you have old tickets, I can exchange them for you."]="与第一届相比，美酒节已经发生了一些变化。今年，我们发行的是美酒节奖币，而不是奖券啦。如果你手里还有旧的奖券，我可以帮你兑换。"
G["Brewfest is a non-stop party.  Setting up for it, though, is non-stop work!"]="美酒节是一场永不停止的盛宴！不过，准备这场盛宴也是个永无止境的工作……"
G["Brewfest is all about enjoying the very best food and drink in the lands, and that's no exaggeration! Just take a gander at the many invigorating hand-crafted beers and holiday sausages, pretzels, and cheeses available. You'll find nothing better, and for so little coin!"]="美酒节就是个享受这个世界中最好的食物和美酒的盛典，一点都不夸张。过来看看这么多清爽的手工啤酒、节日香肠、椒盐卷饼和奶酪。还有什么比这更好的呢？而且你只需要花那么一丁点钱。"
G["Brewfest is all about the beer and the eats, and it don't get any better than what we're serving up. Think I'm lying? Just check out all the tasty brews, sausages, pretzels, and cheeses we got. You'll see: Best chow around, and it don't get any cheaper!"]="美酒节的意义就在于美食和美酒，而且我们所提供的就是最好的！你觉得我在撒谎？看看我们的那些美酒、香肠、椒盐卷饼和奶酪吧。你会发现，你周围都是最棒的美食，而且你找不到比这更便宜的了！"
G["Brewfest is almost here!"]="美酒节就要开始啦！"
G["Brewfest is the perfect holiday!  But it's got one catch, Dark Iron dwarf attacks.  They happen nearly every half-hour!\n\nThe attackers target the kegs that dispense the FREE brew!  And it's really good brew that the brewmasters are giving out!\n\nLook, if you're around when the Dark Iron dwarves show up, lend a hand and protect the FREE brew."]="美酒节是个完美的节日！不过万事无绝对，黑铁矮人就是这个节日中的一个小麻烦。他们几乎每个小时都要来一次！\n\n他们的目标是提供免费啤酒的酒桶，而且那些啤酒还都是最棒的上等啤酒！\n\n你看，如果你正好遇到黑铁矮人破坏酒桶，别忘了帮我们保护这些免费的美酒！"
G["Brewly keeps drinking Uncle's brew.  Hope it makes him strong in the fight!"]="小酒灵一直在喝叔叔的酒。但愿这能让它在战斗中凶猛一点！"
G["Brewmaster Blanche is probably up on Thunderpaw Overlook. She's convinced a storm is on the way, so I'd better make sure her equipment is ready.\n\nI can't imagine I'll ever be half the Brewmaster she is - she once casked a Spring breeze. When they uncorked it a year later at the Jade Temple, you could still smell the blossoms!"]="酒仙布兰琪可能在雷掌台上。她确信一场风暴即将来袭，所以我得确保她的设备都已准备就绪。\n\n我无法想象，自己有朝一日能具备她五成的酿酒功力——她曾经将春风封存在了一只酒桶里。一年过后，当他们在青龙寺将桶塞拔出时，你仍能闻到那股芳香！"
G["Brewmaster Blanche is trying to make Boomer Brew in the middle of a storm, but some formidable enemies are getting in her way."]="酒仙布兰彻努力在暴风雨中制造闪电陈酿，但是受到了一些难缠敌人的阻碍。"
G["Brewmaster Wanderbrew, at your service.\n\nI travel the Jade Forest in search of only the finest of ingredients for my brews.\n\nUnlike the high and mighty Goldendrafts of Dawn's Blossom.\n\nThey have their big brewhouse for mass producing. Which is fine, you know, if you enjoy drinking swill."]="酒仙游酒愿意为你效劳。\n\n我游历翡翠林，只是为了寻找最好的酿酒材料。\n\n我可不像晨芳园里那个傲慢自大的金酿家族。\n\n他们只会用他们大型的酿酒厂进行批量生产。其实他们的酒也还行啦，如果你爱喝泔水的话。"
G["Brewmaster! Bataari scouting parties have been sighted outside the village!"]="酒仙！在村外发现了巴塔里侦察小队！"
G["Brewmasters"]="酒仙"
G["Brews"]="美酒"
G["Brggl-brggl Mrgl-Mrgl! Gluk!"]="¡Brggl-brggl Mrgl-Mrgl! ¡Gluk!"
G["Briaw Shan is a champion brew tosser, $n. He could toss a barrel into the air and then have it come crashing down on these yaungol! I saw him over by the inn earlier today. Go see if he can help!"]="布莱瓦·肖是投掷啤酒桶的高手，$n。他可以把酒桶扔到空中，然后让酒桶在野牛人中间摔碎！我今天上午在旅馆附近看到过他。去看看他是否愿意帮忙吧！"
G["Bribe who you must, but I need some inside information this week if I'm to make a profit and keep your lot employed.  Off with you!"]="贿赂你必须贿赂的人，但是，如果我这周还想继续获得利润，你们这一大票人还想找活干的话，就给我弄点内部信息来。滚吧！"
G["Bridle your enthusiasm, $r.\n\nYou embark upon a fool's errand that will likely be your undoing. Forces that have corrupted the most noble among us will relentlessly assault you.\n\nKnow this; succumb and I shall have no choice but to deliver you from this world."]="收起你的激情吧，$r。\n\n你正在进行一项徒劳的任务，并且这任务很可能会毁了你。那些使我们最高贵的同伴变得堕落的力量会向你无情地袭来。\n\n相信这一切吧；屈服吧，我将不得不把你逐出这个世界。"
G["Brill's only chef is in the middle of town.\n\nWe don't know why he's out there; he won't sell anything he makes. We also don't know where he's getting that fresh raw meat.\n\nWell, no matter. Good luck."]="布瑞尔唯一的厨师就在这个镇子的中心位置。\n\n我们不知道他为什么会在那里。而且他不出售任何他烹制的东西。我们也不知道他用来烹调的生肉都是从哪里来的。\n\n嗯，这些都是小事。祝你好运。"
G["Brilliant victory, $n! Now get back in line."]="辉煌的胜利，$n！现在请回去排队。"
G["Brilliant!"]="真精彩！"
G["Bring back good meat and the camp treat you like high-shaman for a day. Good deal."]="只要你能带回上等的肉，我们就把你当作高阶萨满祭司那样伺候一天。很不错的交易吧。"
G["Bring back my sheep!"]="把我的羊还给我！"
G["Bring down the halls! NOW!"]="摧毁大厅！快！"
G["Bring elevator to first floor."]="将升降梯降至底层。"
G["Bring elevator to second floor."]="将升降梯升至第二层。"
G["Bring elevator to third floor."]="将升降梯升至第三层。"
G["Bring forth the blood elf."]="把血精灵带上来。"
G["Bring forth the first challenge!"]="开始第一场挑战吧！"
G["Bring forth the imps!"]="把小鬼放出来！"
G["Bring her down quick so I can wrap my fingers around her neck."]="快把她打下来，然后我要活活掐死她。"
G["Bring her, Godfrey!"]="把她带上来，高弗雷！"
G["Bring him on!"]="把他带上来！"
G["Bring it on!"]="来吧！"
G["Bring it on, Rocco."]="开始吧，罗克。"
G["Bring it on, hot stuff!"]="来吧，宝贝儿！"
G["Bring it on, jerk."]="来吧，蠢货。"
G["Bring it on, you son of a mangy ogre!"]="来吧，你这个食人魔养的！"
G["Bring it, uglies!"]="来吧，丑八怪！"
G["Bring me another plaything to launch!"]="再给我带个玩具来！"
G["Bring me another toy!"]="给我再弄一个玩具过来！"
G["Bring me his cruel, black heart. We will be doing the Pandaren a favor, and the powers that we liberate will once again be put to the service of Azeroth."]="将他的黑暗之核带给我。这不仅能帮熊猫人一把，解放出的力量也将再次造福艾泽拉斯。"
G["Bring me more prisoners! Do not rest until Azeroth has been cleansed of its reckless magic-users!"]="我需要更多的俘虏！将艾泽拉斯世界那些毫无节制的施法者都干掉！别停手！"
G["Bring me the skulls of our enemies!  Go now and kill them all! [PH]"]="¡Traedme el cráneo de nuestros enemigos! ¡Marchaos ahora y matadlos a todos! [PH]"
G["Bring me their corpses!"]="把他们的尸体带回来！"
G["Bring me their flesh..."]="把尸体带过来……"
G["Bring me their heads!"]="把他们的头给我带来！"
G["Bring me your weapon, champion, that I might feed it the soul of its master!"]="带上你的武器，勇士，它会尝到自己主人灵魂的鲜美！"
G["Bring on any opposition! The Burning Blade shall make a feast of your soul!"]="要战斗就过来吧！火刃氏族将饱餐你的灵魂！"
G["Bring on the naga! I'm hungry for battle!"]="让纳迦过来吧！我正想打一仗哪！"
G["Bring on the sha!"]="让煞魔过来吧！"
G["Bring out the gladiator!"]="把角斗士带出来！"
G["Bring that back up to Yancey, by the waterfall.  The ignorant human'll have no idea that it's not me."]="把那个带给扬希——就在瀑布边上。那个无知的人类不会知道那不是我。"
G["Bring the Flenser the fallen Horde! They will be reanimated as soldiers of the Lich King!"]="把部落成员的尸体交给残忍的瓦雷杜斯吧！他们将被转化成巫妖王的士兵！"
G["Bring the fight to me and pay with your lives!"]="跟我交战的代价就是死亡！"
G["Bring the fight to me!"]="来呀，挑战我吧！"
G["Bring the fight to the enemy, men!"]="与敌人开战吧！"
G["Bring the sacrifices to the master's flesh and blood within the other hives. (They hunger...)"]="将这些祭品送到其它巢穴中主人的血肉那里去。（它们已经饥渴难耐……）"
G["Bring them before the chapel!"]="带到礼拜堂前！"
G["Bring them within reach of my blade!"]="把他们引到我的剑下来！"
G["Bring these invaders a swift death, $n!"]="把这些入侵者立即处死，$n！"
G["Bring this whelp more food!"]="多给这条龙崽一点食物！"
G["Bring up the grunts. Attack!"]="让步兵上。进攻！"
G["Bring us in closer!"]="让我们再靠近点！"
G["Bring us into port, please, Mr. Mehran."]="梅拉先生，请你驶向港口。"
G["Bring us victory, $n, and we shall grant you the honor you deserve! Fight for the Alliance!"]="帮助我们取得胜利吧，$n。你会得到应得的荣耀！为联盟而战！"
G["Bring us wood to graft into our saplings, $p. We shall make do with the roots in the region."]="请为我们带一些木材回来，我们可以用来强化基地里的树苗，$p。这片区域里的根茎能够派上用场。"
G["Bringing our war to these natives is wrong. We should be teaching them the best of ourselves not the worst..."]="把这些当地人卷入我们的战争是不对的。我们应该把最好的一面展现给他们，而不是最坏的一面……"
G["Bristlepine harder hunt than this! Dumb big-tongues."]="猎杀钢刺野猪的难度大得多！愚蠢的大舌头怪。"
G["Brita, create a pincushion of this puny $c!"]="¡Brita! ¡Haz un acerico de $geste:esta:c; endeble $c!"
G["Brittle bones and stringy flesh. Come, come! Feed the flames!"]="脆弱的骨头和纤细的肌肉。来吧，来吧！被火焰吞噬吧！"
G["Brivelthwerp's Ice Cream Empire. Now offering TWO flavors!"]="布里维普的冰淇淋帝国。现有两种口味！"
G["Brivelthwerp's, it's what's for dessert!"]="布里维普牌冰淇淋，甜点的完美诠释！"
G["Bro, my pet is going to incinerate you!"]="老兄，让我的宠物把你烧成灰吧！"
G["Brock. Torren. I am going inside for an ale and to warm myself by the fire."]="布洛克，托瑞恩，我要进去喝杯麦酒，烤烤火暖暖身子。"
G["Brogg is glad Mudsprocket goblins have let him stay here, but sometimes thinks he hears them laughing at him."]="布洛格很感激收留他的泥链镇地精，不过有时他觉得地精们在嘲笑自己。"
G["Brogg, I beseech you to send some of your goblins to Westreach Summit now, before it is too late."]="布洛格，我请求你立刻派些地精前往西岸峰，趁现在还来得及。"
G["Brogg. You don't mind me calling you that, right? Wait, which head am I talking to?"]="布洛格。你不介意我这样称呼你吧？等等，我是在和哪个头说话？"
G["Broke both me legs that night. How could I forget?"]="那天晚上我断了两条腿。我怎么会忘记呢？"
G["Broken of the Ashtongue tribe, your leader speaks!"]="灰舌破碎者们，你们的首领有话要说！"
G["Broken pillar not safe place. Dajik go now, you need go too."]="这根倒塌的柱子看上去很不安全。达伊克要走了，你也赶紧跟上吧。"
G["Broken. Mnngghhh... broken..."]="碎掉了。呃……碎掉了……"
G["Brokentoe prepares to charge."]="断蹄准备冲锋。"
G["Broketooth need food. Wikkets have food. Ravage!"]="断牙需要食物。蠢蛋有食物。抢啊！"
G["Brom Killian teach you how dig up shiny for me.  Him on inner ring of War Quarter."]="布罗姆·基里安教你如何为挖掘出闪光的东西。他在军事区的内环。"
G["Bron! 'Ey, Bron! Hit me!"]="布隆！嗨，布隆！打我！"
G["Bronco bucks %s from its back and escapes into the wild!"]="布隆库猛然一跃，将%s摔了下来，然后逃进了荒野中！"
G["Bronco? That sounds like a good one!"]="布隆库？听上去不错！"
G["Brontes sees all."]="什么都瞒不过布隆特斯。"
G["Bronze Dragonshrine"]="青铜巨龙圣地"
G["Bronze dragonflight."]="青铜龙军团。"
G["Bronzebeard's gone missing again! That dwarf sure didn't get any of his brother's good senses."]="铜须再次失踪了！那家伙跟他的兄弟不一样，一点判断力都没有。"
G["Brood Guardians reporting in!"]="龙群卫士报告！"
G["Brood of the Earth-Warder... you answer to a black dragon? Give me a name!"]="大地守护者的子嗣……你听命于一只黑龙？告诉我名字！"
G["Broodmaster Noshi begins to cast a massive Death Nova.  Get inside the Big Bad Voodoo!"]="孵化大师诺什开始施放大规模的死亡新星。赶快躲进终极巫毒术的效果范围内！"
G["Broodmaster Noshi begins to drain power from everything around him!"]="孵化大师诺什开始向四周所有物体汲取能量！"
G["Broodmaster Noshi begins to hatch a group of Darkhatched Swarmlings!"]="孵化大师诺什开始孵化一群暗生幼嗣！"
G["Broodmaster Noshi is stunned by the stalactite!"]="孵化大师诺什被钟乳石击晕了！"
G["Brother Brokendice is taking all of my hard earned gold and goods! I should have known not to trust a grummle. Never trust something half your size..."]="堂弟破烂骰在搞走我所有辛苦挣来的钱和货物！我早该知道不能相信一个土地精的。绝不能相信任何只有你一半高的东西……"
G["Brother Rabbitsfoot may be smart and tall, and smells of luck and good fortune. But he snores and makes bad jokes about my luckydo yakshoe."]="堂弟兔子脚也许又高又聪明，还浑身散发着好运与福气。但他却对我的幸运符牦牛鞋冷嘲热讽。"
G["Brother Wilhelm often trains with Lyria Du Lac out in back of the smithy in Goldshire.  You could probably learn a thing or two about being a paladin from him."]="威尔海姆修士经常在闪金镇的锻冶场后面培训里瑞亚·杜拉克。你可能会从他那里学到一些圣骑士的知识。"
G["Brother!"]="兄弟！"
G["Brother! There you are! I can barely believe my eyes... you're alive!"]="我的兄弟！真的是你！我几乎不敢相信自己的眼睛……你还活着！"
G["Brother, I see great darkness looming before you."]="兄弟，我看到你的前路潜伏着巨大的黑暗。"
G["Brother, it cannot be... (Destiny has come!) My strength... (Too proud! He speaks in blood! Listen!) My mind... (It is for His glory we serve!) What... is happening... (Gone is the dawn. Come shades of Twilight. Come madness, come havoc, come Infinite Night!)"]="兄弟，这不可能……（定数已到！）我的力量……（多么骄傲！他在用鲜血昭告！快听！）我的精神……（我们为他的荣耀而效忠！）究竟……是怎么了……（黎明已逝，迎来了暮光之影。来吧疯狂，来吧浩劫，来吧，无尽的黑夜！）"
G["Brother, we are shattered. (But the Master... I still hear... so angry... Master...?)"]="兄弟，我们败了。（可主人……我还能听到……愤怒……主人……？）"
G["Brother, we are shattered. Let her finish them. (The Master does not want them near her... Brother?  The Master seethes...)"]="兄弟，我们败了。让她解决他们。（主人不想让他们靠近她……兄弟？主人怒不可遏……）"
G["Brother, we must look to our defenses. The Alliance are encroaching on us from the east."]="兄弟，我们必须留心保护自己。联盟正从东面步步逼近。"
G["Brother. A timely arrival..."]="哥哥……你来得真及时……"
G["Brothers and sisters of the Horde! Enemies surround us on all sides! Your courage in weeks to come will be the difference between victory and defeat."]="部落的兄弟姐妹们！我们如今群敌环伺！你们的勇气将是未来几周内决定胜败的关键。"
G["Brothers and sisters of the Horde, Orgimmar is under attack!  Take up your arms and defend our capital!  If you are unable to wage war against the intruders, then help place barricades to fortify our city!  LOK'TAR OGAR!"]="部落的兄弟姐妹们，奥格瑞玛正受到攻击！拿起你们的武器，保卫我们的首都！不能与入侵者正面作战的人，就来修筑工事，加固我们的城防！LOK'TAR OGAR！"
G["Brothers and sisters, I have been to the promised land. I have tasted in the sublime energy. I have felt bliss - bliss so engrossing and all encompassing that I was left wondering if I had stumbled upon the dreams of gods."]="兄弟姐妹们，我曾去过理想中的乐土。我感受过令人心生敬畏的强大力量。那种被赐福的感觉紧紧环绕，我竟然产生了步入神灵梦境的错觉。"
G["Brothers and sisters, I have called you here today to discuss the fate of Lordaeron."]="兄弟姐妹们，今天我把你们召集到这里，是为了讨论洛丹伦的命运。"
G["Brothers and sisters, Ironforge is under attack!  Take up your arms and defend our capital!  If you do not want to answer the call of battle, then grab some fortifications and line help keep the walls from collapsing on us!"]="兄弟姐妹们，铁炉堡遭到了攻击！拿起你们的武器，保卫我们的主城！要是你不想回应战斗的召唤，也可以帮忙部署防御工事，确保城墙不会倒塌！"
G["Brothers and sisters, tonight we hunt! A blood elf known as Matis must be brought to justice! The first to find him gets one week's vacation aboard the Exodar!"]="兄弟姐妹们，今晚我们要搜索一个名叫玛提斯的血精灵，把他带来接受审判！第一个找到他的人可以得到在埃索达的一星期休假！"
G["Brothers and sisters, we must remain united! The Lich King will never fall to a world divided!"]="兄弟姐妹们，我们必须保持团结！如果我们闹起了内部分裂，还怎么战胜巫妖王！"
G["Brothers in chaos, the Twilight has come! (Shadows lengthen, endless night.) Deathwing has sundered this world. (Doors once opened never close.) So that its true Lords may return. (The Master comes, He comes He comes.)"]="混沌的兄弟们，暮光已至！（暗影延伸，无尽的黑夜。）死亡之翼割裂了世界。（门一打开就无法关闭。）以便让真正的主人返回。（主人来了。他来了，他来了。）"
G["Brothers of Twilight! The Hammer calls to you! (Fire water earth air). Leave your mortal shell behind. (Fire water earth air). Embrace your new forms for here and everafter! (Burn and drown and crush and suffocate). And use your gifts to destroy the unbelievers. (Burn and drown and crush and suffocate)!!"]="兄弟们！暮光之锤在呼唤你们！（火、水、土、气）蜕下你凡人的躯壳。(火、水、土、气）在此拥抱新的形态，直到永远！（燃烧、淹溺、碾压、窒息）用你们获得的恩赐消灭那些无信者。（燃烧、淹溺、碾压、窒息）！！"
G["Brothers of the Hammer, to me! (Their will is still their own.) The unbelievers still stand. Destroy them! (Crush their bodies, crush their will.)"]="暮光之锤的兄弟，来吧！（他们的意志仍属于自己。）无信者还没倒下。毁灭他们！（粉碎身体，粉碎意志。）"
G["Brothers! Dispose of these insolent outsiders!"]="弟兄们！赶走这些傲慢之徒！"
G["Brothers! Strike now!"]="兄弟们！攻击！"
G["Brothers, Vol'tar has fallen!"]="兄弟们，沃塔倒下了！"
G["Brothers, beware! These mortals are dangerous. I must pause and gather my strength."]="兄弟们，小心了！这些凡人非常危险。我必须暂停一下，积聚力量。"
G["Brothers, prepare yourselves! Take up defensive positions along the ramp and make way to let the vehilces through. Born from the earth, to the earth shall we return. Let the might of the Makers burn deep within you!"]="兄弟们，准备出击！尽量占领坡道上的防御点，开辟出一条安全的道路让攻城车辆通过。我们生于大地，终将回归大地。让创造者的力量在你们体内燃烧吧！"
G["Brothers, sisters, Arygos speaks of our troubled past."]="兄弟们，姐妹们，阿瑞苟斯谈到了我们坎坷的过去。"
G["Brothers, we must take what is ours."]="兄弟们，我们必须夺回属于我们的力量。"
G["Brothers. Sisters. We are ABANDONED - the orphaned children of Stormwind."]="兄弟们。姐妹们。我们是被遗弃的——我们是暴风城的孤儿。"
G["Browse my wares to your hearts content! From the finest in enchantments, to the latest in fashion, you can find it all here."]="尽情观赏我的各种器具吧！从最精巧的魔法器皿，到最时髦的先锋派风格，你在这里全都能看到。"
G["Brrrr... It's cold up here."]="啊……好冷啊。"
G["Bruce! Why!?!"]="布鲁斯！怎么会这样！？！"
G["Brutal!"]="残忍！"
G["Brutish though they seem, these iron-stitched horrors are exceedingly brilliant engineers and forge-smiths."]="尽管他们看上去很野蛮，但这些用铁缝合起来的可怕生物其实是非常聪明的工程师和铸造匠。"
G["Brutusk is out watering the bushes right now.\n\nStay close though, $n. He should be ready for our ride to Splintertree very soon."]="蛮角正在外面给那些矮树丛浇水。\n\n不过不要走太远，$n。他应该很快就会为我们前往碎木岗哨的旅程做好准备。"
G["Brutusk roars as he leaps into the ambush!"]="蛮角怒吼着冲入伏兵之中！"
G["Brutusk... NOOOOOO!!"]="蛮角……不！！！"
G["Brzt... click... whir..."]="啪嗒……咔咔……"
