G["Buckets! Where's my laundry?"]="水桶！我要洗的衣服呢？"
G["Budd! Noooo!"]="巴德！不——！"
G["Budd's crew, ye mean?\n\nAye, he be no respecter of persons. He'll take on anyone who can work a shovel\n\n...'cept them undead. Budd hates 'em. Personally, I think he's scared of 'em."]="你是说巴德手下的探险队？\n\n他对任何人都一视同仁的。只要你会用铁铲，他就会雇佣你。\n\n呃……除非你是亡灵。巴德讨厌他们。不过我认为他是害怕亡灵。"
G["Budd's crew, ye mean? Aye, he be no respecter of persons. He'll take on anyone who can work a shovel.\n\n'cept them undead. Budd hates 'em. Scared of 'em, likely as not."]="¿Te refieres al equipo de Budd? Sí, no respeta a las personas. Cogería a cualquiera que supiera usar una pala.\n\nAcepta no-muertos. Budd los odia, es probable que les tenga miedo."
G["Buddy, did you know that every farmer worth his dirt is a member of the Tiller's Union?"]="哥们，你知不知道每位风尘仆仆的农夫都是阡陌客的一员？"
G["Buddy, ye know... sometimes it's nice to see you around."]="哥们，你知道某些时候……还是很高兴见到你的。"
G["Buddy, ye sure got a big mouth. Does it ever stop yappin'?"]="哥们，你可真是个话痨。你嘴巴啥时候闲过？"
G["Build at least 3 Sunflowers to survive this mission."]="种植3株以上的向日葵来确保完成任务。"
G["Build some defenses before Warden Stillwater arrives!"]="在看守者斯蒂沃特到来之前建立起防御！"
G["Built twelve thousand years ago by a covert sect of night elf sorcerers, the ancient city of Eldre'Thalas was used to protect Queen Azshara's most prized arcane secrets. Though it was ravaged by the Great Sundering of the world, much of the wondrous city still stands as the imposing Dire Maul. The ruins' three distinct districts have been overrun by all manner of creatures - especially the spectral highborne, foul satyr and brutish ogres."]="埃雷萨拉斯古城是在一万二千年前由当时的一批暗夜精灵法师秘密地建造的，它被用于保护艾莎拉皇后最宝贵的奥法秘密。虽然受到了世界大分裂的影响，这座伟大的城市基本屹立在那里，现在其被称为厄运之槌。这座遗迹城市分为三个部分，分别被不同的生物所占据——包括幽灵般的高等精灵，邪恶的萨特和鲁莽的食人魔。"
G["Buliwyf here will happily teach you everything there is to know about guns!"]="布里维夫会很高兴把他所知道的一切关于枪的知识都教给你的！"
G["Bull's-eye!"]="正中靶心！"
G["Bullheadedness? It is my perseverance that has gotten us this far, dandy. You wouldn't last five seconds."]="武勇？没有我的坚持不懈，咱们能有今天吗，你这种绣花枕头上去5秒就得趴下。"
G["Bullseye!"]="正中靶心！"
G["Bullseye! That blasted dwarf doesn't know what he is talking about. Only thing wrong with Grumlar's gun is Grumlar's aim."]="可笑！那个该死的矮人根本不知道他在说什么，格鲁姆拉的准头太差了。"
G["Bully!"]="啊！"
G["Bunnies and fawns? Yes, we have those. Will you now come and help us at New Thalanaar? Wait... why do you want to know?"]="兔子和小鹿？是的，我们有那些动物。你现在能来新萨兰纳尔帮我们了吗？等等……你为什么会问这个问题？"
G["Burn beneath my molten fury!"]="我的熔岩之怒会烧尽你们！"
G["Burn beneath my molten fury."]="我的熔岩之怒会烧尽你们。"
G["Burn dem all ta cinders!"]="全都烧成灰烬！"
G["Burn everything. Leave no survivors."]="烧尽一切。不留活口。"
G["Burn in hate, $r."]="在仇恨中燃烧吧，$r。"
G["Burn in righteous fire!"]="让正义的火焰吞噬你吧！"
G["Burn in the fires of my fury!"]="在怒火中煎熬吧！"
G["Burn in the liquid heat of the Firelands!"]="在火焰之地的流火中被烧毁吧！"
G["Burn in the master's flame!"]="在主人的烈焰中燃烧吧！"
G["Burn it down, boys. Burn it all down."]="烧死它们。烧毁这一切。"
G["Burn it to the ground!"]="将它烧成平地！"
G["Burn their bodies, shred their skins, crush their creaking carapaces!"]="烧死他们！把他们碎尸万段！"
G["Burn their ships. Butcher their flight master. Sabotage their war machines. And rescue our spy!"]="烧毁他们的船只，杀掉飞行管理员，破坏战争机器。同时保证我方间谍的安全！"
G["Burn them all! Burn them to ash!"]="烧死他们！把他们烧成灰！"
G["Burn!"]="燃烧吧！"
G["Burn! BURN AND SUFFER!"]="燃烧吧！燃烧吧，痛苦吧！"
G["Burn! BURN!"]="燃烧吧！燃烧吧！"
G["Burn! Burn! Burn!"]="烧吧！烧吧！烧吧！"
G["Burn! Burn, you wretches!"]="烧吧！烧吧，你们这群可怜虫！"
G["Burn!!"]="烧吧！"
G["Burn, Alliance scum! BURN!"]="燃烧吧，联盟渣滓！燃烧！"
G["Burn, baby, burn!"]="燃烧吧，宝贝儿，燃烧吧！"
G["Burn, burned, burnt! Hahahahaha!"]="燃烧，燃烧，燃烧！哈哈哈哈哈！"
G["Burn, land dweller! BURN!"]="燃烧吧，旱鸭子！燃烧吧！"
G["Burn, mutants, BURN!"]="烧死你们，异形，烧死你们！"
G["Burn, tauren!  BURN!!"]="烧吧，牛头人！烧吧！"
G["Burn, you fiends!"]="燃烧吧，恶魔！"
G["Burn, you hellish fiends!"]="燃烧吧，地狱的恶魔！"
G["Burn, you miserable wretches!"]="燃烧吧，你们这些可怜虫！"
G["Burn."]="燃烧吧。"
G["Burn...my corpse...do not let me join them..."]="燃烧吧……我的躯体……不要让我成为它们的一员……"
G["Burned down to their frames! No one goes home until our job here is done!"]="全都烧成灰烬！我们事业未尽，谁也不能提前回家！"
G["Burninate's the name, smithin's my game... and, erm... I sell a little food and water on the side. Care for some meat?"]="博恩奈特是我的名字，我把铁匠作为我的兴趣……另外，呃……我还卖一些食物和水。来点肉类怎么样？"
G["Burning"]="燃烧"
G["Burning Ice!"]="燃冰！"
G["Burning Steppes - Tablet of the Seven"]="燃烧平原 - 七贤石板"
G["Burning Treants erupt from the ground to aid the Protector!"]="烈焰树人从地下涌出，来协助保护者了！"
G["Burning eyes within the prism fill your mind with a sense of dread..."]="棱柱中燃烧的眼睛让你感到恐怖……"
G["Burning eyes within the prism fill your mind with a sense of dread... especially knowing that you don't have the thirty-five apexis shards needed to summon forth its demon."]="棱柱中燃烧的眼睛让你感到恐怖……召唤它需要35块埃匹希斯碎片，而你身上没有足够的水晶。"
G["Burning up the dance floor!"]=" 燃烧吧！这是我的舞台！"
G["Burnnnnnnn..."]="烧吧……"
G["Burp! Hon, that was really good. Not only do you know how to catch a fish but you sure do know how to cook one."]="吃饱了！真好吃。你不仅是个钓鱼高手，烧菜的手艺也很不错嘛。"
G["Bury me with me shovel...\nLiterally..."]="用我的铲子把我埋了吧……\n我是说真的……"
G["Bury this place! Your master demands it!"]="把这里埋了！这是主人的命令！"
G["Business been bad lately, Sudsy?"]="最近生意不好做吧，萨德希？"
G["Business concluded."]="纯粹是为利益而已。"
G["Business must be good down at the bazaar.  I'll get him resupplied right away!"]="他的生意似乎挺火爆的！我马上就给他补充货物！"
G["Busy day today. I show at least ten people in line in front of you. Not too many more than that, though."]="今天人很多。你前面至少还有十个人。不过应该不会更多了。"
G["Busy day today. There's at least ten people in line in front of you. Not too many more than that, though."]="今天人很多。你前面至少还有十个人。不过你应该不用等很久。"
G["Busy times friend, busy times...\n\nI can't stop for an idle chat I'm afraid - the Southshore Militia need more armor pronto. If you want to lend a hand however, you're more than welcome to."]="Tiempo ocupado amigo, tiempo ocupado...\n\nNo puedo detenerme para una charla inútil, temo que la Milicia de Surshore necesita más armadura pronto. Si deseas ayudar sin embargo, estás más que bienvenido."
G["Busy, busy!  So much to do, so little time!\n\nNow where did I put that pyrospanner?  I know it's around here somewhere... I burned my fingers on it just a moment ago!"]="忙啊，太忙了！事情太多，时间太少！\n\n我把那个合金扳手放哪了？我知道就在这里的某个地方……我刚才还被那东西烫了手指！"
G["But $n has thwarted his plans at every turn, and the dwarves of Ironforge stand with us!"]="¡Pero nuestro valiente campeón ha frustrado sus planes continuamente y ahora los enanos de Forjaz están con nosotros!"
G["But -"]="但是——"
G["But Arthas was not invincible! With each passing day his power waned - his grip over the will of the damned loosening."]="但阿尔萨斯并非不可战胜！他的力量日渐衰竭，他对受诅者意志的掌控也弱化了。"
G["But Brend, yer always drinkin'!"]="但是，布伦德，你不是一直在喝么？"
G["But I always excelled at poisons."]="但我总是擅于施毒。"
G["But I am certain that Shen-zin Su knows we are here. And he cares for every one of us!"]="可我相信，神真子知道我们在这儿。而且他在乎我们每一个人！"
G["But I am certain that the mists parted for a reason. YOU are that reason. Find your purpose here."]="但我能肯定你就是迷雾分开的原因。弄清你来这里的意图吧。"
G["But I am not yet finished. Death to the king!"]="我还没有完蛋呢。要死的是国王！"
G["But I can still sense them. My cowardly brothers and sisters will cause untold suffering if we allow them to stay in the shadows."]="但是，我还是能感觉到他们。如果任由他们藏在阴影里，我那些懦弱的兄弟姐妹们指不定会掀起怎样的波澜。"
G["But I didn't get you anything. Aww shucks, thanks anyway."]="但是我没有什么可以给你的。哪里哪里，还是要谢谢你。"
G["But I do know this - love makes the heart and body weak. It can be exploited. Without your love, I have only my work, Annalise."]="但是我知道，爱情让心灵和身体变得脆弱。没有你的爱，我只剩下了工作，安娜利丝。"
G["But I drove my mole machine all the way down here..."]="你瞧，我都把挖掘机器开到这里来了……"
G["But I guess I just feel... I feel a little piece of my life is missing.  Faded.  Like waking from a dream."]="但我总觉得……觉得我生命中的某些东西不见了，消逝了。仿佛梦境终于醒来。"
G["But I held on to one vice. The one sha I never conquered. PRIDE."]="但我仍有一个缺点，而且从未能征服它。那就是骄傲。"
G["But I suppose it's the only plan we've got."]="可这恐怕是我们唯一可用的计划。"
G["But I think that bell has got some power... and it's bad."]="但我觉得那口钟有股力量……不好的力量。"
G["But I want you to imagine standing in this very valley on the day he returned from his journey. Imagine being here when the gates opened for him. By then our emperor was a creature of pure light: No doubts, no fears, no hatred..."]="但请你想象一下，他归返的那一天，置身于这个山谷中。那一刻，大门为他缓缓开启，我们的皇帝成为了焕发纯净之光的造物——胸中无疑无惧亦无恨……"
G["But I would contend that we are at least partly to blame for the scars we bear."]="但我想说的是，我们也要对自己的伤痕担负起责任。"
G["But I'd still rather be there on the front lines helping it happen rather than trying to placate myself with belief. We can't just sit around and hope it happens."]="与其在空洞的信仰中寻求自我安慰，我宁可冲上前线。我们不能只是坐等希望变成现实。"
G["But I'm da best at watchin' da door."]="但我才是最好的看门卫兵。"
G["But I'm in charge here..."]="我才是主人……呦，哦……哦……"
G["But I'm one-of-a-kind! A black dragon raised free from the taint of my father's corruption. And that's how I intend to stay: free."]="可我是族群的最后一员了！凡人。作为仅存的一条没有受到父亲堕落污染的黑龙，我要保持我的自由。"
G["But I'm... lost. I cannot find my way back."]="但我似乎迷失了……，我找不到回去的路。"
G["But Kalecgos is already out there trying to stop them. He needs your help."]="但卡雷苟斯正竭尽全力要阻止他们。他需要你的帮助。"
G["But Lei Shen did not agree."]="但雷神并不满意。"
G["But Lin is down there!"]="可林在他们手上！"
G["But Nozdormu, Lord of Time, refused to give his blessing, chiding the druid for his arrogance."]="时光之王诺兹多姆拒绝给予他的祝福，并谴责了德鲁伊的傲慢。"
G["But Tak-Tak know a lot about things!"]="但是泰克泰克知道的可不少！"
G["But Uther, if there's any hope of reaching Arthas. I... I must try."]="但是，乌瑟尔，哪怕有一丝见到他的可能，我……我也要去。"
G["But a bitter stench blows into our ranks. The answer is to purge! PURGE! Purge until the Twilight's Hammer is pure again!"]="一股苦涩的臭气正在我们的队列中蔓延。我们的回答就是净化！净化！净化到暮光之锤再次纯洁！"
G["But a pebble against the avalanche..."]="不过是挡在雪崩面前的一枚石子……"
G["But after what I have seen today, I have faith in you."]="但以我今天的所见所闻，我对你有信心。"
G["But always remember that our movement cannot stay pure if some traitors among you still draw breath. You know who I mean."]="一定要记住，只要还有叛徒在呼吸，我们的行动就不可能保持纯洁。你们知道我说的是谁。"
G["But as the centuries passed, one young explorer decided to see what was out there. His name was Liu Lang. And he set out to discover the world... on the back of a turtle!"]="然而在几个世纪之后，有位名叫刘浪的年轻探险家决定出去看看。他开始了对世界的探索……而他骑的竟是一只海龟！"
G["But as your war-fleets crashed upon our shores, all of my old doubts and fears rose up, to torment the land once again."]="可当你们的舰队抵达我们的海岸，我昔日的猜忌和恐惧再次袭来，又一次在这片土地上肆虐。"
G["But at the same time, there is no choice. We need food, water. We must go through this portal."]="但是，我们没有选择。我们需要食物和水。我们必须穿越这黑暗之门。"
G["But at what cost? You've all been blinded. We have all been blinded."]="但是那代价呢？你完全被蒙蔽了。我们都完全被蒙蔽了。"
G["But be knowin' this, little man - no matter where ya be hidin', when me pyres grow dim, I'll be feedin' them with yer bones!"]="你给我听着——如果篝火堆旺不起来，无论你躲在何处，我都会把你揪出来，用你当燃料！"
G["But be warned, Arygos, son of Malygos. Do not make the mistakes of your father."]="但我警告你，阿瑞苟斯，玛里苟斯之子，不要重蹈你父亲的覆辙。"
G["But beneath the earth, child, there always be fire."]="但孩子，在那片大地之下，燃烧着永恒的烈火。"
G["But beware, for not all love stories end happily, as you may find out. Sometimes, love pricks like a thorn!"]="但是，大家知道，并非所有的爱情故事都有完满的结局。有些时候，爱情就像荆棘一样危险！"
G["But blood of brother kingdom keeps..."]="可兄弟王国的鲜血……"
G["But can it be? Is this really --"]="怎么可能？难道真的……？"
G["But can you find me again?"]="你还能找到我吗？"
G["But dese be worries for older minds.  Ya still have much to learn.  Go help tha people of tha Darkspear.  I am sure we'll be speakin' again real soon."]="把这些担忧留给老家伙们。而你还有很多东西要学。去帮助暗矛的族人吧。相信我们很快就会再见面的。"
G["But dis place be OURS! Dis be da land of de ogres and da trolls!"]="这是我们的地盘！这是食人魔和巨魔的地方！"
G["But do not despair, ogre. I will continue to aid you and your... cult."]="不过不必失望，食人魔。我会继续帮助你和你的……教派。"
G["But do not despair, people of Orgrimmar! Join us and learn the truth."]="奥格瑞玛的人们，不要绝望！加入我们，来了解这个世界的真相吧。"
G["But don't let me pull the wool over your eyes! See for yourself what lies beneath those covers! And now... on with the show!"]="但是我不能说得太多！你们必须自己看清隐藏在伪装下面的真相！现在——演出开始！"
G["But don't take it from me; see for yourself what tragedy lies ahead when the paths of star crossed lovers meet! And now... on with the show!"]="耳闻为虚眼见为实，当两个彼此相爱的人在今晚见面时，又将会上演什么样的悲剧？大家拭目以待吧！现在——演出开始！"
G["But don't underestimate our enemies.  We are invading them.  We are taking the fight to them.  We have them backed into a corner and they will strike back."]="别低估我们的敌人。我们是主动挑衅的入侵者，他们已经被逼得无路可走了。这帮家伙必定会奋起反抗的。"
G["But enough prattling! You wish to reclaim your city? Come then, heroes! Your souls will fuel the host! You will have this place back in pieces!"]="真是天真！你们想夺回这座城市？那就来吧，英雄们！你们的灵魂会让我更强大！而你们只能夺回一片废墟！"
G["But enough talk... You have fought hard and come from the distant reaches of this world to face the Duskbringer. I shall not disappoint..."]="到此为止吧……你历经万难，终于站到了黄昏使者面前。我不会令你失望的……"
G["But enough words, comrades!  This is a call to action!  We will not let these \"chosen ones\" take what is ours!  We captured this prisoner and offer him to the Old Gods ourselves!!"]="¡Ya basta de hablar, camaradas! ¡Esto es una llamada a la acción! No permitiremos que esos \"elegidos\" se lleven lo que es nuestro! ¡¡Fuimos nosotros los que capturamos a este prisionero y seremos nosotros los que se lo ofrezcamos a los dioses antiguos!!"
G["But even Thalorien's skill and Quel'Delar's magic could not save Silvermoon from the might of the Scourge."]="但即使是萨洛瑞安的力量和奎尔德拉的魔力也无法从天灾手中拯救银月城。"
G["But even we are not sure of all that is happening.  Should we capture these cultists and force their silence?  But that may anger the rest of the people... Still, we cannot allow the cult to spread fear and lies..."]="可就连我们也不知道这究竟是怎么一回事。我们该不该把这些邪教徒抓起来，让他们闭嘴？但那会激怒剩下的人……尽管如此，我们决不允许教派恣意散播恐惧与谎言……"
G["But eventually the titans fell silent. And their creations were cursed with flesh."]="可是，泰坦逐渐沉寂，他们的造物受到血肉的诅咒。"
G["But father-"]="可父亲——"
G["But first!"]="但首先！"
G["But first, you must bring down the protective wards of Azshara's Highborne lackeys. You will find them within the palace. I will scout on ahead."]="但首先，你们必须先破坏艾萨拉的上层精灵布下的防护结界。他们就在宫殿里。我会先行一步。"
G["But for now, your death will have to suffice..."]="但是现在，你必须死……"
G["But give what aid you can to the southern peoples, for they are the champions of Silap Inua."]="与此同时，我们应该竭尽全力帮助来自南方的人们，因为他们就是“希拉伊努亚”的勇士。"
G["But his son is dead."]="但他的儿子已经死了。"
G["But how much blood must be shed? There are both clever ways and foolish ways."]="可那要白流多少鲜血？战术也是有明智和愚蠢之分的。"
G["But how, chief? I thought the curse was lifted..."]="但是怎么会这样，头儿？诅咒不是已经被消除了吗……"
G["But how?"]="但是怎么样才能……"
G["But if my presence is required in these games to gain your support in the battle, then I will remain.  For now."]="但如果我出席这些比赛能换来你在战争中的协助。那我暂时，会留下来。"
G["But if we stabilize it with an anchor thread at the appropriate energy crux then it should work."]="但是如果我们在恰当的能量点使用定位魔法来稳定它，那么它就可以正常运作了。"
G["But in death... We are the children of the damned. The orphaned sons and daughters of the Scourge."]="但在死后……诅咒的种子在我们心中扎根，我们都沦为了天灾军团的孤儿。"
G["But in his place, Shan'do Stormrage awoke from the dream and returned to his beloved Tyrande Whisperwind."]="而大德鲁伊怒风已经从梦境中醒来，回到了他所钟爱的泰兰德·语风身边。"
G["But instead of fighting as my people would, as my people should, I find myself with a long, unwieldy pole, attempting to coax my wolf into charging my opponent without attacking."]="我却不能像同胞们一样浴血奋战。我能做的，只是端着一根笨重的长枪，哄着座狼朝对手发起冲锋，根本就不是真正的攻击。"
G["But is your bark..."]="可你的吠叫……"
G["But isn't Pandaria hidden somewhere? Nobody can find it!"]="可潘达利亚不是被藏起来了吗？没人能找到它！"
G["But isn't that what caused the initial problems with Adept Syleria's magical formulae?"]="那不就是让萨蕾莉亚的魔法方程出问题的原因么？"
G["But it ain't no ting. Take your trinkets; you'll be needin' dem."]="……但这也没什么。拿上战利品，当心你们的小命。"
G["But it is not too hard. You are ready for this, $n."]="No es difícil. Tienes la capacidad necesaria."
G["But it is over. We can work now to bottle up the horrors he has unleashed."]="但是都结束了，终于可以将他带来的恐惧尘封起来了。"
G["But it was not to be. As their foes pressed close, Anathera's armor was pierced by a demon's tainted blade. In the thick of battle, there would be nothing to save her."]="但事实却是残酷的。在与敌人作战时，安娜瑟拉的护甲被恶魔的利刃穿透了。在如此激烈的战争中，没有什么能拯救她。"
G["But know this, \"Blood\" Elf: There can be no peace while Hellscream is Warchief of the Horde."]="Pero has de saber, elfo \"de sangre\", que no habrá paz mientras Grito Infernal sea Jefe de Guerra de la Horda."
G["But know this, the Horde IS family, even if some of its leaders have forgotten that fact. To prove this, I shall remain with you and lend what strength I can to your chosen leaders until Vol'jin returns."]="但记住这一点，部落是所有部落人民的家，这个事实不会因为某些部落领袖忘记了它而改变。为了证明这一点，我会留在你们身边，并将我的力量借给你们挑选的领袖，直至沃金回归。"
G["But look who has arrived! Mrs. Mann, there's someone I would like you to meet."]="看看谁来了！孟太太，我想给你引见个人。"
G["But many druids of the Cenarion Circle stand firm that he wants only what is best for all of the Kaldorei, and serve him unerringly towards that end."]="但许多塞纳里奥议会的德鲁伊仍然坚信，范达尔在全心全意为卡多雷的福祉而努力。他们全都会不惜一切代价地效忠于他。"
G["But mistress, the admiral is sti..."]="可是女主人，将军仍然……"
G["But most of all... thank you, Wooga, for teach A-Me how to love."]="但最重要的是……感谢你，乌嘎，是你教会了A-Me该如何去爱。"
G["But my dad says I'm too little to drink."]="可我爸爸说我太小了，不能喝酒。"
G["But my protection money is all paid up!"]="但我已经付过保护费了！"
G["But never again."]="以后再也不会了。"
G["But nobody else wanted to go exploring with him. So he left."]="但却没有其他人愿意和他一同探险。于是他离开了。"
G["But none may enter the Firelord's abode!"]="但从未有人能进入炎魔之王的居所！"
G["But none of you could possibly have anything to worry about, right?"]="但是你们并没有什么值得担心的啊，对吧？"
G["But nothing! Finish them! DO NOT FAIL ME, BALARGARDE!"]="但是什么！杀了他们！别让我失望，BALARGARDE！"
G["But now that I have the items, I can sense the power Loganaar spoke about. They will make a fitting weapon for you."]="当我看到这些物品的时候，我就感觉到了洛甘纳尔所说的那种强大力量。它们可以被做成一件适合于你的精良武器。"
G["But now, many years later, the wildkin have grown more feral, and without the guidance of the goddess, they are confused..."]="但是现在，枭兽已经变得更加凶猛，而且由于失去了女神的指引，它们很迷茫……"
G["But now, witness true power..."]="现在，见证真正的力量吧！"
G["But now... she hates me."]="可现在……她肯定很恨我。"
G["But of course I love you, Staffron. And it pains me to see you suffer so."]="我当然爱你，斯塔弗隆。看到你这样痛苦，我也心如刀割。"
G["But of course it is dangerous. This artifact's secrets would be useless to us otherwise."]="当然，它还是很危险的。否则，这件神器的秘密对我们就毫无价值了。"
G["But of course. We have the Horde's best interests in mind, sir. These heroes were just about to continue on and kill Springvale for us."]="当然，长官。我们有最让部落感兴趣的东西。这些英雄刚刚要继续进军，为我们消灭斯普林瓦尔。"
G["But once ol' $p here blasts through their bulkhead in a hail of splintered wood, blood, and phlegm then starts crawlin' across the deck with both legs broken, oh aye, they'll not see THAT comin' by a sweet mile, no sir!"]="老$p曾经一下子轰碎了他们的船舱。让他们只能在硝烟、碎木和残骸中爬行。唉，他们可不会喜欢这样，绝对不会，长官！"
G["But one thing is for certain: this plate's size, thickness, and bolt holes point to a use as armor for a colossal structure."]="我敢肯定的是：从护甲板的尺寸、厚度以及螺丝孔的位置来看，它肯定是某个巨型装置的护甲。"
G["But our orders stand - Hellscream will have his foothold here. We will NOT allow the Alliance to lay claim to this new world!"]="但我发誓——地狱咆哮一定会在这里站稳脚跟。我们决不允许联盟霸占这片新大陆！"
G["But papa said I fed him too much, so he got fat."]="可爸爸说我把它喂得太饱了，于是它越长越胖。"
G["But perhaps I will make an exception for you.  Let the crocs out!  IT'S FEEDING TIME!"]="但也许我会给你一个例外。放鳄鱼出来！喂食时间到了！"
G["But please, leave me now. I must tend to my son... and prepare for our next battle."]="现在请你走吧，英雄。我要照顾我儿子……并准备下一场战斗了。"
G["But popo, what are they afraid of? Why are they here?"]="可是他们在怕什么呢？他们到这儿来做什么？"
G["But praise alone will not suffice."]="但只有称赞是不够的。"
G["But she is chained. A way must be found to free her."]="不过她被锁住了。必须设法搭救她。"
G["But she is pursued... by a wicked, malevolent crone!"]="但是……一个邪恶的老巫婆正在追赶着她！"
G["But sir, there ain't any record of land in that region. Where are they?"]="但是长官，这片区域的地图没有记录这座岛屿啊。他们在哪儿呢？"
G["But some human lady... Jana or somethin'... she got real mad!"]="但是那个人类女人……吉娜什么的……她被气疯了！"
G["But something is on your mind, right?"]="你心里有事情，对不对？"
G["But something went wrong, didn't it?"]="但是，有些事情好像出了差错，是吗？"
G["But surely you cannot think that those children were born into innocence? They would have grown up and taken arms against us!"]="你总不会认为那些孩子会永远单纯吧？他们长大之后，就会拿起武器来对付我们了！"
G["But surely you heard, Greatmother."]="但是您肯定听说了，祖母。"
G["But tha' mead was cursed with th' plague o' death, and now old Duggan, too."]="但那些美酒受到了死亡的诅咒，现在，老杜甘也被诅咒了。"
G["But that honor is no longer yours. Soon, I will have a new champion."]="不过这份荣誉已经不再属于你。很快，我就会拥有一名新的勇士。"
G["But that idiot, IDIOT Wrynn! \"High King\" indeed!"]="¡Pero ese idiota de Wrynn! ¿\"Gran Rey\"? ¡Ja!"
G["But that is not part of the vision I was granted... that is not... how my people will be freed."]="但那不是纳鲁在我的梦境中给予我的指示……那不是……我解救同胞的方式。"
G["But that is the real Monkey King."]="但那确实是真的美猴王啊。"
G["But that will all change one day, $n. And when it does, those with vision will be prepared."]="但终有一天，这一切都会改变，$n。当那一天到来的时候，那些看到幻象的人才会有所准备。"
G["But that's not the worst of it. Before I could pull us back, a group of 'em spotted us and attacked."]="但那还不是最糟糕的。我们还没来得及撤退，他们就发现了我们，并且发起了进攻。"
G["But the Alliance does not recognize our rights. They claim this land is their own while attempting to invalidate the claims of the founders of this kingdom."]="但联盟不承认我们的主权。他们声称这片土地属于他们，妄图将它从王国的创立者们手中夺走。"
G["But the Forsaken. *cough* What do they feel?"]="但那些被遗忘者。*咳嗽*他们是怎样做的？"
G["But the Horde has assembled an enormous host! A vast fleet of war machines and hardened veterans. Hellscream would as soon crush you as-"]="可部落已经集结了一支所向披靡的大军！这支规模庞大的舰队满载着精锐老兵和战争机器。地狱咆哮会把你碾碎，只要——"
G["But the Light showed me that I was not lost. It helped me to find the strength to survive in spite of all that had happened and all the evil I had wrought."]="但圣光使我明白我并没有迷失。它帮助我找到力量，使我在经历许多后仍可幸存，即使我曾犯下如此重罪。"
G["But the North Wind did not silently accept defeat. Instead, it gathered power and bided its time, deciding the best revenge was to destroy your memory, and with it, your village."]="但是北风不甘心就此落败。相反，它一直在积聚力量，等待时机，意图摧毁你的历史和这座村庄。"
G["But the cost... such a terrible cost."]="可这代价…这惨痛的代价…"
G["But the mantid have overrun the area. There's no clear path!"]="可这儿全是螳螂妖。没有一条安全的道路！"
G["But the ookin' bell it was meant for could never be mine."]="但它只是用来敲钟的，我才不想要呢。"
G["But the question still remains... why do we fight?"]="但你是否仍有困惑：吾辈何以为战？"
G["But the unavoidable outcome is plain:"]="但是，这注定的结果已经很清楚了："
G["But the war deeply troubles me. Do you see my concern?"]="可战争深深困扰着我。你理解我的顾虑吗？"
G["But their empire fell. Perhaps to the sha, perhaps to the pandaren, or perhaps... to their own pride."]="可他们的帝国最终衰亡了。也许是由于煞魔，也许是由于熊猫人，或者是……由于他们自身的傲慢。"
G["But then the Monkey King one day decided to steal the mallet and hide it as a prank. There is no record of the mallet after that."]="不过，有一天美猴王决定偷走这把钟杵，并把它藏了起来。这个恶作剧令钟杵彻底失传了。"
G["But then, the dark evil spiders rose from their evil layers with eyes full of evil and legs full of evil."]="可是，黑暗的邪恶蜘蛛从它们的巢穴中爬了出来，个个长着邪恶的眼睛和狞恶的长腿。"
G["But there are a number of things I need to make clear to you."]="但是，我希望你们要明白一些事情。"
G["But there is a yawning chasm of darkness beneath you, mortals. Vast, endless, and all-consuming. I do not believe that you can correct this doomed course."]="可你们脚下就是黑暗的深渊，凡人。巨大的，无止尽的，吞噬一切的深渊。我不信你们能改变毁灭的结局。"
G["But there is another threat to the tusked people."]="但是，海象人氏族即将面临新的威胁。"
G["But there is yet one path, one river, that may carry you through these difficult times."]="但仍然有一条出路，一条河流，能带你们走出这艰难的时代。"
G["But these cultists are determined to bring Stormwind to ruin. Men, we must remain vigilant for our city and our king, as $n as done!"]="这些邪教徒已经决意要毁灭暴风城。我们必须时刻保持警惕，守卫我们的城市和国王，就像$n所做的那样！"
G["But these terrible things that I have done and the people that I have harmed - I know them... I face them... and I feel remorse for them."]="对于我做过的那些事，我伤害过的那些人——我认识他们……我必须面对他们……带着我深深的自责。"
G["But they could have been so much more."]="可他们原本可以更加伟大。"
G["But they've, ah, they've gotten reinforcements! From the Eastern Kingdoms. Whereas I've been, ah, cut off -"]="但他们，呃，他们得到了援军！东部王国来的援军。然而我的部队却，呃，被包围了-"
G["But this can't be right. Where did I put that other book?"]="但这个肯定不对。我把那本大书放哪里去了？"
G["But this is a different sort of honorable combat. Difficult to adapt to, perhaps, but with your prowess I'm sure you'll show everyone the strength in your people."]="但是这依然是另一种形式的荣耀之战。你或许并不认可，但是我相信大家都目睹了你所表现出来的强大力量。"
G["But this is no task to be taken lightly."]="这可不是一个轻松的任务。"
G["But this place reeks of death!"]="可这里散发着死亡的恶臭！"
G["But this the only building that fit Brogg! Goblins make buildings too small!"]="但这是唯一适合布洛格的房子，地精的房子都太小太小啦！"
G["But this time, we're a step ahead."]="可这次，我们领先了一步。"
G["But though I feel the plague within, my hopes 'ave not yet sunk."]="虽然我感觉到了体内的诅咒，但是我的希望并没有泯灭。"
G["But to be perfectly frank, I do not give a damn what the Kirin Tor think! They are fools, set in their archaic ways."]="但是老实说，我对肯瑞托的想法一点也不感兴趣！他们是群蠢货，一群沉迷在他们古老腐朽的习惯中的蠢货。"
G["But together we have delivered a terrible blow to the Thunder King!"]="但是至少，我们一起重创了雷电之王！"
G["But tragically, Arthas is consumed by the evil and becomes evil himself..."]="不幸的是，阿尔萨斯被邪恶吞噬了，最终变成了邪恶本身……"
G["But true wisdom comes from KNOWING what is right. And sometimes, DOING nothing at all."]="但真正的智慧源于了解何为大义。有时，无为也是种智慧。"
G["But try they must or all will be lost. The Drakkari will be the death of both themselves and their gods!"]="但是他们必须尝试，否则一切都完了。达卡莱巨魔很可能将自己和他们崇拜的神灵送上绝路！"
G["But wait..."]="不过，我必须指出……"
G["But wait... I remember now.  You taught me to only kill the undead.  So do you want me to kill myself, daddy?"]="但，等一等……我现在记起来了。你教过我只能杀亡灵。那么你想让我杀掉我自己吗，爸爸？"
G["But war, waged by a leader reluctantly following protocol, brought an even swifter demise to our nation."]="但是战争，一场由不愿遵循协议的领袖发动的战争，会让我们的国家更快地灭亡。"
G["But we are family. I am a Stormstout! From the Wandering Isle..."]="可我们是一家人啊！我也姓风暴烈酒！从迷踪岛来……"
G["But we don't explore very much anymore, do we?"]="可我们现在不怎么探险了，对吧？"
G["But we gotta feed dis war machine. Stone, wood, oil, meat - we be needin' 'em in large supply."]="但我们必须为这架战争机器提供补给。石料、木材、原油和肉食——我们需要大量物资。"
G["But we have our own reasons for assisting them. I will allow Lor'themar to explain."]="而我们自有协助他们的理由。还是让洛瑟玛来解释吧。"
G["But we have returned, spirit! We have returned to honor you again. Favor us with your presence once more."]="但是我们回来了，灵魂！我们再次向你致敬。请再次显身，赐我们以恩泽。"
G["But we know..."]="但我们知道……"
G["But we must hurry back to the World Tree! The Dragon Aspects are waiting..."]="但我们必须尽快回到世界之树！守护巨龙在等待……"
G["But we will not participate in this... genocidal... bloodbath of yours."]="但我们不想卷入这场生灵涂炭……血流成河的屠杀。"
G["But we will not participate in this... race war... bloodbath of yours."]="但我们不想卷入这场……血流成河的种族纷争。"
G["But we will... NEVER SURRENDER!!!!!"]="但是我们……决不投降！！！"
G["But we're nothing if not people who strive for balance. Our warriors fight only when there is need. Our hunters take only what the tribes require to live, and use all they can when they do. The shaman stand as guide and mediator to the elemental spirits."]="但如果不全力维持世界的平衡，我们就没有任何存在的意义。我们的战士只有在需要的时候才会奔赴战场。我们的猎人只猎取族人生存所必需的野兽。而且每一头猎物身上的一切都会被我们妥善利用。我们的萨满则担负着引导与调和元素之力的重任。"
G["But what does it matter.  It is time for this to end."]="但这有什么关系。到了该结束的时候了。"
G["But what he and his Twilight Masters never understood is that the elements do not exist to rage and war... they exist to bring harmony. Within the world... and within us."]="但他和他的暮光主子永远不明白的是：愤怒与争斗并非元素存在的意义……他们为协调而生：与世界的协调，与我们的协调。"
G["But what if the resulting frequency shift were to send magical feedback up the flows?"]="但是如果频率转换的结果是将魔法流反馈回去，那会怎么样呢？"
G["But what is this?"]="但这是什么？"
G["But what now, hero? What of those freed from his grasp, but still shackled to their mortal coils?"]="但现在呢，英雄？那些摆脱了他的束缚，却无法摆脱凡尘俗世的人呢？"
G["But what of Go'el?"]="但古伊尔怎么办？"
G["But what the king did not realize is that the dwarves did not trust one another!"]="可国王没有想到，矮人们竟然对彼此毫不信任！"
G["But what's this? Something else is happening to the land south of the fissure."]="这是什么？看来这道裂缝南边发生了另一些事情。"
G["But what?"]="可是什么？"
G["But when war comes to these shores, you and I will be ready for it!"]="但当战火烧到这片海岸时，你和我都会做好准备！"
G["But where could I ever find a suitable test subject?"]="但是我在哪里才能找到合适的实验品呢？"
G["But why do I sense no life emanating from within? Why do I sense no amber sap running through its veins?"]="为什么我在其中感觉不到生命的迹象？在其根茎叶脉间为什么没有琥珀树脂在流动？"
G["But why?"]="这一切都是为什么？"
G["But why? Dragons big and powerful. Elf-lady weak. Kekek want to see dragon queen's real form."]="但这到底该怎样解释？龙巨大而强猛。精灵女士却弱不禁风。科科想要看到红龙女王真正的样貌。"
G["But why?! How could you?"]="可是为什么？！你怎么可以？"
G["But with heroes like you in his pack, there is little your Alliance cannot accomplish."]="然而，有你这样的英雄在，联盟就没有什么做不成的事。"
G["But wouldn't that mean crossing the streams? Isn't that really bad?"]="你是说交叉魔法流？那就太糟糕了。"
G["But you are a Black Dragon. And you share the corruption of all my brothers and sisters."]="但你是一条黑龙。我所有兄弟姐妹所受到的腐蚀也影响着你。"
G["But you are dragons! How could orcs do this to you?"]="但你们是龙啊！这些兽人怎么敢这样对待你们？"
G["But you are right, Irulon. The price of our freedom will undoubtedly cost thousands more of their lives."]="伊鲁伦，你说得对。自由的代价是沉重的，毫无疑问还会有上千名骑士为此牺牲。"
G["But you must be aware, Koltira: we are brothers no longer.  You are a member of the Horde now, and I of the Alliance."]="可你必须清楚，库尔迪拉——我们的兄弟情已尽。你现在是部落的一员，而我效忠于联盟。"
G["But you said-"]="可你说——"
G["But your farm is lookin' pretty good. You know if you make friends with the folks around here, they might give you stuff to fancy it up even more."]="但你的农场看起来还不错。知道吗，要是你能跟这里的人交上朋友，他们也许会给你些好东西，更让农场增色。"
G["But your real punishment lies ahead."]="但是真正的惩戒还在后面呢。"
G["But your time will come soon enough. Yes, mortal. Soon enough..."]="但你的时间已经不多了。是的，凡人。不多了……"
G["But your trespass ends here. None may enter my forbidden stronghold. I shall rebuild this bridge with your bones for bricks."]="但也只能到此为止了。你们以为我会让你们长驱直入吗？这座桥还可以重建，可你们的骨头…哼…"
G["But, I am a master fighter, with extensive knowledge of this world's flora and fauna. Surely I can help?"]="可是，我是一个战斗大师，对这个世界的植物和动物都有着丰富的知识。我的这身本事难道帮不上忙吗？"
G["But, I can see it in your eyes, hear it in your pulse rate. You would destroy me despite my offer of immortality!"]="你的眼神和心跳骗不了我，虽然我能让你永生，但是你还是会杀了我！"
G["But, ah, supplies have been tight. I've got, ah, a manpower shortage. Tell Bloodhilt that, ah -"]="但是，啊，目前的供给非常紧张。而且，呃，我这里的人力也很短缺。告诉血柄，啊-"
G["But, do not give into despair. You have the spirit to overcome this. Try again - I believe in you!"]="但是，不要绝望。你有克服它的能力。再试一次——我相信你！"
G["But, elf..."]="但是，精灵……"
G["But, here comes another survivor. Seems good with their hands... maybe you can teach them your fighting skills?"]="但是，又来了一个幸存者。 看起来他们身体很健康……或许你可以教授他们一些战斗技巧？"
G["But, in defeating him, we must seek out the source of his great power. We must claim it for ourselves, as leverage against our \"Warchief.\""]="Al tiempo que lo derrotamos, debemos encontrar la fuente de su gran poder. Con ella podremos negociar con nuestro \"Jefe de Guerra\"."
G["But, in the end, $n and I prevailed through our wits and teamwork. And now we have this glorious trophy as a memento of our victory."]="但是，我，还有$n凭借卓越的智慧和完美的合作，最终取得了胜利。喏，这就是我们的战利品。"
G["But, my lord...?"]="陛下，但是……？"
G["But, no matter. Mister Clementine's... err, 'contribution' notwithstanding, this seems to be the journal of a man named Nolkai. The entries toward the end describe a brutal battle."]="Bueno, no importa. A pesar de la... eeeh... \"contribución\" del señor Clementina, este parece ser el diario de un hombre llamado Nolkai. Los pasajes que se encuentran hacia el final describen una batalla brutal."
G["But, sire!  You have misjudged my actions... I do have knowledge of someone close to you who plans to betray you.  It is that dog, Kael'thas!  He has allied with Kil'jaeden and intends to replace you as Lord of Outland!"]="但是，大人！您误解了我的行动……我确实知道有个您非常信任的人想要背叛您，他就是凯尔萨斯那条狗！他现在投靠了基尔加丹，想要取代您，统治外域！"
G["But, sweetie...?"]="可是，宝贝儿……？"
G["But, you will not be alone out there. My men and I have prepared pack mules carrying the supplies you'll need most."]="你们并不孤单。我们特意准备了一群骡子，运送你们所需的补给物资。"
G["But..."]="但是……"
G["But... But Deathwing's minions may have you killed..."]="但……但死亡之翼的爪牙可能会杀了你……"
G["But... I don't think I'll have time to work for the council, AND run Sunsong Ranch."]="可是……我恐怕无法在承担议会工作的同时管理日歌农场了。"
G["But... I followed your instructions precisely! Sorry?"]="但是……我是严格按照你的指令做的！我该说对不起吗？"
G["But... I was... who will...?!"]="不……我是……谁还能……？！"
G["But... I... yes, my lady.  As you wish."]="但…我…是的，我的女士，如你所愿。"
G["But... It is not yet your time to serve the Lich King. Yes, a greater destiny awaits you. Power... You must become more powerful before you are to serve me."]="但……现在还不是让你为巫妖王效力的时候。是的，更伟大的命运还在等待着你。力量……在你为我效劳之前，你必须获得更多的力量。"
G["But... Malfurion, Cenarius, Ysera... they still fight. They need me. I must return to the Dream at once."]="但是……玛法里奥、塞纳留斯、伊瑟拉……他们还在坚持。他们需要我。我必须马上返回翡翠梦境。"
G["But... My lord, I do not understand. $n... He is the orc that has..."]="但是……大人，我不明白。$n……这个兽人曾经为我们……"
G["But... but..."]="但……但……"
G["But... but... I needed that gear..."]="但是……但是……我需要那个装备……"
G["But... but... I was perfect!"]="啊……可是……之前的我很完美！"
G["But... he has learned of your victory over Stormwind's North Fleet and thinks you have potential.  Potential to see reason and abandon Sylvanas' childish rebellion."]="但是……他已经得知了你们战胜暴风城北方舰队的消息，并且相信你们有足够的潜力，能够明察事理并抛弃希尔瓦娜斯幼稚的复仇理论。"
G["But... my legend!"]="可是……我的传说！"
G["But... we could have found wild yaks back in Kun-Lai..."]="但是……我们本可以在昆莱找到野牦牛的……"
G["But... we were getting along... so... well..."]="真是的……我们相处得……那么……好……"
G["But... you have earned the right to try. Farewell."]="可……你们赢得了尝试的权利。再见。"
G["But...!"]="但是……！"
G["But...but...I am...Ul...trax...ionnnnnn..."]="可……可……我是……奥卓……"
G["Butcher you say?  Oh, First Aid Trainer!  Same thing.  When you see Nurse Neela standing just inside the Gallows' End Tavern on the southeast side of town you'll know why."]="你说屠夫？哦，急救训练师！一个样。当你看到护士妮拉站在城镇东南面的恐惧之末旅店里面时你就会明白为什么。"
G["Butcherbot will harvest meat, tra la la la la."]="收集机器人要有大收获啦，哈哈哈哈。"
G["Buuurrnnnn!"]="烧吧！！！"
G["Buuurrrnn!"]="烧吧！"
G["Buuuurrp..."]="咕噜咕噜……"
G["Buuuuuuuuuurrrppp!"]="嗝……嗝！"
G["Buy a fish a drink?"]="给鱼买杯酒？"
G["Buy me a drinksh will ya?"]="能请我喝一杯吗？"
G["Buy some apples! An apple a day keeps the priests away!"]="来买苹果喽！每天都闻苹果香，不用牧师开药方！"
G["Buy somethin', will ya?"]="我想买点东西，行吗？"
G["Buzz the landing pad lately, $n?"]="最近你去过巴什伊尔码头帮忙吗，$n？"
G["Bwaaaah! You no take da treasure!!!"]="啊！不许拿走那宝物！！！"
G["Bwagauugh!!! Augh feed you to da crocs!!!"]="啊呀！！！把你喂鳄鱼！！！"
G["Bwemba be watchin' you, young one."]="布温巴正在盯着你，年轻人。"
G["Bwemba, is dat you?  Tanks for da save."]="布温巴，是你吗？多谢相救。"
G["By Brann's brittle bananas! What is it!? It... It looks like a drum."]="以布莱恩喜欢吃的烂香蕉的名义！这是什么？看上去……像只鼓。"
G["By Bronzbeard's... um, beard! What are you talking about?"]="你究竟……在说什么……？"
G["By Bronzebeard's beard!  What a drink!"]="天啊！真是好酒！"
G["By Elune!  They were all ambushed... betrayed..."]="以艾露恩之名！他们都遭到了伏击…这是背叛…"
G["By Elune, I shall show you a quick death."]="以月神的名义，我会给你个痛快的。"
G["By Firallon's beard, what is that thing? Kill it!"]="菲尔拉伦的胡子啊，那是什么？杀了它！"
G["By Hellscream's axe!"]="以地狱咆哮战斧的名义！"
G["By Khaz'goroth's hammer, we will break them!"]="以卡兹格罗斯的铁锤起誓，我们一定要消灭他们！"
G["By Kroshik's teeth, how did you get here?!"]="考什克之牙在上，你怎么进来的？！"
G["By Kurzen's sword!"]="以库尔森之剑的名义！"
G["By Light be purged!"]="圣光净化！"
G["By Lothar, you Defias scum will pay!"]="以洛萨的名义，你们这些迪菲亚渣子会付出代价的！"
G["By Magni's beard, we've got to reconstruct the runic key he used to read the plate. We could be right on his heels!"]="以麦格尼·铜须的名义，我们必须完成他未竟的工作，重铸解读石板的符文钥石！"
G["By Muradin's beard, $c. This land is on the brink of annihilation. I cannot imagine anyone survived here since the end of the second war."]="以穆拉丁的胡须之名，$c，这个地方已经濒临毁灭了。我无法想象居然有人可以在第二次战争结束后一直活到现在。"
G["By Nazjatar's Depths!"]="以纳沙塔尔的名义！"
G["By Orgrim!  This indurium can withstand massive heat!"]="我的天啊！精铁居然可以承受如此高的温度！"
G["By Thaurissan's beard! Slay them!"]="以索瑞森胡子的名义！杀死他们！"
G["By Thorim's beard, this should be good sport!"]="以托里姆胡须的名义，这将是一场精彩的比赛！"
G["By Zandalari blood he will be taken..."]="赞达拉的鲜血将带他归返……"
G["By a girl. Ouch."]="是个女孩，唉呦。"
G["By all means, don't assess the situation, you halfwit! Just jump into the fray!"]="行了，别再估计什么形势不形势的了，蠢货！赶紧给我加入战斗！"
G["By all means, enlighten me."]="当然可以，我洗耳恭听。"
G["By all the gods... it can't be... Muradin?!"]="天啊……这不是……穆拉丁吗？！"
G["By any chance do you have another one of those super rare, hard to find, amulets?"]="你那里还有那种超级稀有、很难找到的护符吗？"
G["By closing the monastery - for whatever reason - Taran Zhu has jeopardized that eternal charge."]="祝踏岚不知出于何种原因关闭了禅院，这已经危及到我们永恒的使命。"
G["By defending the four temples, you will earn great standing with the August Celestials. You will be granted the ability to purchase items of great power.\n\nIn addition, you will help defend this land against some of our greatest enemies."]="保护这四座寺庙，你就会受到至尊天神的褒奖，得以购买功能强大的物品。\n\n此外，你还可以提供帮助，保护这片土地免受强敌的攻击。"
G["By dusk, the flames towered into the sky. I lost everything. Everything.\n\nWhy would they burn an inn?"]="到黄昏时分，火舌已经照亮了天空。我失去了一切。一切。\n\n为什么他们要烧掉一家旅店？"
G["By extracting agents from the blood of various dragonflights I have created a salve that will bestow the wearer sight beyond sight!"]="我从各种巨龙军团成员的血液里精炼出萃取物，制成药膏，可以使涂抹者获得视野之外的视野！"
G["By feeding upon this place's power, they were broken free from their addiction to the Legion's magic."]="在这股能量的滋养下，它们能够摆脱对燃烧军团魔法的依赖。"
G["By feeling and understanding compassion in enemy and ally alike, you reaffirm your connection with the world."]="一旦感受并理解这种对敌对友一视同仁的同情，你们就重申了自己与世界的联系。"
G["By fire be purged!"]="让火焰净化一切！"
G["By me own beard! HORDE SAILIN' IN FAST 'N HOT!"]="以我的胡子起誓！部落的速度真快啊！"
G["By my right as Warchief, I hereby relieve you of duty."]="以部落酋长之名，我现在解除你的职务。"
G["By order of Duke Lankral, Commander of the Knights of the Ebon Blade, Vanquisher of the Scourge and Conqueror of The Shadow Vault, you are ordered to stand down. What is your answer?"]="黑锋骑士团指挥官、天灾军团征服者以及暗影拱顶征服者——兰克拉尔公爵命令你束手就擒。你接不接受这份裁决？"
G["By order of King Varian Wrynn we must prepare your defenses, Jinyu."]="锦鱼人，瓦里安·乌瑞恩国王有令，我们必须准备好防御工事。"
G["By order of the Warchief this \"city\" is now under Martial Law. Any who refuse the will of the Warchief shall be branded as traitors!"]="Por orden del Jefe de Guerra, esta \"ciudad\" se encuentra bajo la ley marcial. ¡Todos los que desafíen la voluntad del Jefe de Guerra serán declarados traidores!"
G["By order of the grand admiral, stay away from the southern side of the island upon pain of death. Spread the word."]="元帅有令，禁止进入岛屿南端，违者处死。把这个命令传下去。"
G["By orders of the Queen, all possessions must be inspected before entry into the city is permitted."]="根据女王的命令，一切物品都要经过检查才能进城。"
G["By our sweat and your blood, this land WILL be ours!"]="我们付出了汗水和鲜血，这片土地属于我们！"
G["By recovering the artifacts of our clan, by taking up the fight against our ancient enemy, the Bladespire ogres, and their gronn masters, by returning the Thunderspike to my hand, you have secured the blessing of the Thunderlord clan."]="你寻获了氏族的神器，你与我们的宿敌——刀塔食人魔和他们的戈隆主人交战，你又将雷霆之刺交回到了我的手中，你的义举捍卫了雷神氏族的赐福。"
G["By royal edict, you men are to return to Lordaeron immediately. Lord Uther has convinced the king to recall this expedition."]="根据皇家敕令，部队立刻返回洛丹伦。乌瑟尔大人已经说服国王陛下召回这支远征军。"
G["By th' Light, it worked! Grimnur's brilliant... oh, I hope all the pinchin' didn't hurt ye too much... But when ye taste the meat, ye'll know it's worth it!"]="以圣光的名义，成功了！格瑞诺尔太聪明了……喔，希望没把你捏疼……不过当你尝到那肉的味道时，就知道一切都是值得的！"
G["By the Firelord's command, you, too, shall perish!"]="秉承炎魔之王的命令，你也会被毁灭！"
G["By the Goddess. It's as if Nature can't touch it!"]="女神在上。自然的力量也无法撼动它！"
G["By the Light - what did they DO to that thing?"]="圣光在上——他们做了什么？"
G["By the Light be cleansed!"]="接受圣光的洗涤吧！"
G["By the Light you will leave this tomb!"]="以圣光的名义，离这座陵墓远一点！"
G["By the Light!"]="以圣光的名义！"
G["By the Light!  This cursed spy was a good one!  I'm glad he's dead."]="以圣光的名义！这个该死的间谍的确厉害！我很高兴他死了！"
G["By the Light!  This must be the end of the world!"]="圣光在上！这一定是世界的尽头！"
G["By the Light! It is a blessing to have one who cares about the well-being of others. At a time like this we need all the help we can get. Nus can train you in the ways of first aid. She is near the crystal cave in the Crystal Hall. Light be with you."]="以圣光之名！有人愿意关心其他人的安宁真是一种幸福。在这种时候，我们就是应该互帮互助帮助。努丝可以教你急救技能，她就在水晶大厅的水晶洞附近。圣光与你同在！"
G["By the Light! So this is why you look familiar. Is this fate? Destiny perhaps? Arator, your father and I were the best of friends. It is I who kept him in good health... Oh the battles we fought... And..."]="以圣光的名义！难怪你看上去那么眼熟，难道这就是命中注定的吗？也许这就是命运？阿拉托尔，你的父亲和我曾经是最好的朋友，我是他的医生……啊，那些我们一起战斗过的岁月……"
G["By the Light! This is not good. There's something you don't understand, $n."]="以圣光的名义！这绝不是个好消息。有些东西你可能不能理解，$n。"
G["By the Light! What is it?"]="以圣光的名义！这是什么？"
G["By the Light! What is that thing?"]="以圣光的名义！那是什么东西？"
G["By the Light, Brann's alive? I'd never help you capture him!"]="圣光在上，布莱恩还活着？我死也不会帮你追捕他的！"
G["By the Light, I will defeat you!"]="圣光在上，我要打败你！"
G["By the Light, I'm alive again..."]="圣光在上，我又活过来了……"
G["By the Light, I'm hungry today. Did you all see Darcy today? She looked great."]="以圣光的名义，我今天真的很饿。你们今天看到达希了吗？她看上去精神不错。"
G["By the Light, it must be so!"]="圣光在上，胜利属于我们！"
G["By the Light, may he at last find rest, free from the icy grip of that terrible blade."]="圣光啊，愿他摆脱那把魔剑的寒冷束缚，魂归故里。"
G["By the Light, that hurts!"]="圣光在上，真疼啊！"
G["By the Light, you killed Limpy Joe and took the meat! How did you know where to find us?"]="圣光在上！你杀死了乔伊，还抢走了肉！你是怎么找到我们的？"
G["By the Light... Theramore! What has happened here?!"]="以圣光之名……塞拉摩！这里究竟发生了什么事？！"
G["By the Naaru, may it be so."]="以纳鲁的名义，愿我们的愿望能够实现。"
G["By the Naaru, you are no mage! If you are looking for training, you must seek out a $c trainer."]="以纳鲁的名义，你不是个法师！如果你在寻求训练，你必须找$c训练师才行。"
G["By the Sunwell, you've a thick skull! You'll not bully me into leaving, Taleris. Now, begone from my sight!"]="以太阳之井的名义，你太绝情了！你别想把我吓跑，塔雷里斯。现在从我的眼前滚开！"
G["By the blood of Kros!"]="克洛斯之血在上！"
G["By the blood of the Highborne!"]="以上层精灵之血的名义！"
G["By the elements, this one is even bigger than the last!"]="以元素的名义，这个比之前的还要大！"
G["By the elements... that one... just wouldn't die..."]="以元素之名……那家伙……就是死不了……"
G["By the forehead signet of Velen, I am saved!"]="以维伦的名义，我得救了！"
G["By the foul teat of Kil'Jaeden's rotted torso, the entire backside is blown out! How can someone be expected to live in here? I've seen enough!"]="亲娘唉，整个后墙都被炸开了！怎么有人会想要生活在这里？我看够了！"
G["By the fury of the Sunwell, I am released!"]="感谢太阳之井，我自由了！"
G["By the grace of Elune, I am pleased to offer you the finest steed found anywhere in Teldrassil, and perhaps the world - the nightsaber.  For years, the Sentinel Army has relied on the value of these companions.\n\nTake your time friend and examine each one to your satisfaction.  I am sure you will not be disappointed."]="Por la gracia de Elune, estoy encantado de ofrecerte el mejor corcel que podrás encontrar en Teldrassil, y quizás en todo el mundo... el sable de la noche. Durante años, el ejército de los centinelas ha confiado en su valor.\n\nTómate tu tiempo para examinarlos cuanto desees. Estoy seguro de que no quedarás $gdecepcionado:decepcionada;."
G["By the grace of Prince Anduin I shall achieve victory this day."]="承蒙安度因王子的恩惠，我将在今天迎来胜利。"
G["By the hammer of me father, I shall defeat ye!"]="以吾父黑锤之名，我要打败你！"
G["By the light - what did they DO to that thing?"]="圣光在上——他们做了什么？"
G["By the light! What have they done to you?"]="以圣光的名义！他们对你做了什么？"
G["By the light, is that a sha?"]="圣光在上，那就是煞魔？"
G["By the light, the transporter worked!"]="圣光万岁，传送器工作了！"
G["By the looks of that thing, I might take my chances swimming with the sharks!"]="看这东西的样子，我宁可试着和鲨鱼一起游泳！"
G["By the might of King Varian's throne, I shall defeat you!"]="以瓦里安国王的王权之力，我要打败你！"
G["By the might of Mograine!"]="赞美莫格莱尼！"
G["By the naaru, may it be so."]="以纳鲁的名义，愿我们的愿望能够实现。"
G["By the name of Chi-Ji, I smite you down!"]="以赤精之名，我要击垮你！"
G["By the order of lord Taran Zhu, none shall pass."]="祝踏岚掌门有令，任何人都不能通过。"
G["By the power of Zandalar, I command that ya rise!"]="以赞达拉之力，我命令你站起来！"
G["By the power of the sun!"]="以太阳之名！"
G["By the seas... look at the sssize of that thing!"]="以海洋的名义……看看那家伙的个头！"
G["By the second sun of K'aresh, look at this place! I can only imagine what Salhadaar is planning. Come on, let's keep going."]="以卡雷什的第二个太阳之名，看这个地方！我只能认为萨哈达尔正在计划着什么。加油，我们继续。"
G["By the seven Ata'mal crystals!  Others have survived the crash!  Zhanaa, is that you?  It is so good to see you again!"]="七块阿塔玛水晶在上！发现其他幸存者了！沙娜安，是你吗？真高兴可以再次看到你！"
G["By the skin of our teeth, we made it! I haven't seen shooting like that since...well...ever! I wish we could ride together again, but Kadrak has more important work for you. Thank you for delivering us safely, my friend."]="刚才真是死里逃生，但我们成功做到了！我从来没有这样射击过……从来没有！我希望我们可以有机会再次一同骑乘，但卡德拉克有更重要的任务交给你。谢谢你把我们安全送达目的地，我的朋友。"
G["By the stars! A spirit has been summoned!"]="以群星的名义！"
G["By the strength of the earth, the power of storms, and..."]="以大地和风暴的力量，以及……"
G["By the sunwell! The skies betray us - we are not safe up here!"]="太阳之井在上！天空背叛了我们——这里不安全了！"
G["By the three hammers, will you look at that! More ruins!"]="以三锤部族之名，你好好看看！这里只有废墟！"
G["By the tides!"]="以潮汐的名义！"
G["By the time the Burning Legion began its assault, the mages at the Mennar Academy had fallen far from the Queen's graces. They would've been a powerful asset in the war to come, but they refused to fall back when the rest of the city fell.\n\nInstead of regrouping outside the city to join in the counter-assault, they stayed behind, erecting magical barriers and turning their once quiet home into a fortress. Refugees streamed to the Mennar Academy in the first terrible days of the invasion, and survivors rallied to mount a defense."]="当燃烧军团发动攻击时，门纳尔学院的贤者法师们已经远离了艾萨拉女王。他们本应该在那场战争中发挥巨大的力量，但当精灵的都市毁灭时，他们拒绝撤退。\n\n他们没有在城外重新集结，加入到反击燃烧军团的队伍中，而是留了下来，竖起魔法屏障，将他们曾经静瑟安详的家园变成一座堡垒。在恶魔入侵刚刚开始的那段恐慌日子里，难民不断涌入门纳尔学院，幸存者们开始在那里建立防御。"
G["By the time the ritual is complete, Marnal will arrive, and my men will help carve up this grotesque creature."]="等到仪式完成的时候，玛尔纳就会到来。我的人会帮忙塑造出这个奇异的怪物。"
G["By the time we are done here, the Alliance will wish they had never set foot on this land."]="等我们完成这里的事之后，联盟一定会后悔踏上这片土地。"
G["By the time you realize the truth, it will be too late."]="当你察觉到真实情况的时候，一切都已经太晚了。"
G["By the titans' command, they fought the terrible servants of the old gods. They shaped the mountains and carved the rivers of the land."]="他们按泰坦的指令与古神的可怕仆从战斗。他们垒起高山，挖开河流。"
G["By the very edge..."]="他在井水旁……"
G["By the watchers, look at him fight. I've never seen a more vicious warrior... I'm glad to call him my king."]="天啊，看看他战斗时的英姿。我从未见过比他更凶狠的战士……能有这样一位国王真是我的荣幸。"
G["By the way, if any of you need anything repaired, let me know.  I am at your service."]="顺便说一句——要是你们需要修理工的话，记得通知我。我随时愿意效劳。"
G["By the way, my name is Coppernut, sir!"]="顺便说一声，我的名字是考伯纳特！"
G["By the way, thanks for watching my back."]="顺便说一下，谢谢你帮我望风。"
G["By the way, you're welcome to borrow any supplies you find inside the caravan... as long as you bring them back when you're done!"]="顺便说一句，马车里的物资随你使用……只要你在用完之后把它们拿回来！"
G["By the will of Sylvanas, our enemies will fall."]="希尔瓦娜斯的意志在上，我们的敌人终将失败。"
G["By the will of the Celestials!"]="天神的意愿！"
G["By wearing, holding, or otherwise using this Bilgewater Cartel Life Rocket, you agree to be bound by the terms of the end user license agreement!"]="为佩戴，握持或以其它方式使用锈水财阀求生火箭，你同意接受此最终用户协议的全部条款！"
G["By wind and wave, by earth and fire... To Stormwind we go, $n!"]="以风、水、地、火之力……我们将前往暴风城，$n！"
G["By your command!"]="听你的！"
G["By your command."]="遵命。"
G["By your hand, this mountain will bloom again. It is yours to protect and defend."]="由你之手，这座圣山将再次繁茂。守卫它，便是你的责任。"
G["By your leave, I will do what I can."]="我会竭尽全力投身战斗！"
G["By your leave, Lord Torvos. I must prepare the next troops for your review."]="对不起，托沃斯男爵。我必须集合下一批士兵，以便您的检阅。"
G["By your leave, sir, I have pressing matters to attend to."]="对不起，长官，我有紧急事件需要禀报。"
G["By your leave, sir."]="遵命，长官。"
G["By your order, master!"]="遵命，主人！"
G["By your order."]="听从命令。"
G["Byancie has often lent her services to the sentinels who patrol the local wilds.  You should talk to her if you desire to learn First Aid."]="拜恩希经常为在野外巡逻的哨兵服务。如果你想学习急救的话就该找她谈谈。"
G["Byancie's skill in First Aid has proven useful on numerous occasions.  You can find her just north of the Inn in Dolanaar if you wish to learn from her."]="拜恩希在急救方面的技巧已经很知名了。如果你想向她学习的话，你可以到多兰纳尔旅店的北面去找她。"
G["Bye for now."]="现在该说再见了。"
G["Bye!"]="再见！"
G["Bye!  Better luck next time!"]="再见！祝你下次好运！"
G["Bye, bye, tiny little $r. Raze go now."]="Adiós, $gpequeño:pequeña; $r. Arrasa irse ahora."
G["Bye, hon. See you later tonight."]="再见，阁下。今晚再见。"
G["Bye-bye now!"]="再见啦！"
G["Bye-bye."]="再见。"
G["C'Thun will retake this world!"]="克苏恩将会重新夺取这个世界！"
G["C'mere! Here boy!"]="孩子！到这里来！"
G["C'mere! I'mma give you a pounding, orc!"]="来吧！让我狠狠给你一下子，兽人！"
G["C'mere, $r. Ya don't want to be riskin' yerself in a dungeon, do ya? Filthy work, and for what? Some worthless trinket? Nah, what ya need be one of my amulets. Guaranteed to work!"]="过来，$r。你不想让你自己在地下城里受到伤害吧，对吗？努力工作，为了什么？一些毫无价值的饰品？不，你所需要的就是一个我制作的护身符。保证有用！"
G["C'mon - you sound like a grumpy old man."]="拜托，你听上去就像个脾气暴躁的老人。"
G["C'mon an' fight ye wee ninny!"]="来呀，放马过来呀！"
G["C'mon boy, let's get you away from all this noise."]="来呀，我带你去个安静的地方。"
G["C'mon boys, let's take back our homes!"]="好了，孩子们，我们要夺回自己的家园！"
G["C'mon mates! Take the ship and give no quarter!"]="来吧，伙计！攻占那艘船，绝不留情！"
G["C'mon then lads, set up a perimeter. We hold 'em here or Thundermar is next!"]="来吧，小子们，在这里组织防御。我们要把敌人挡在这里，否则桑德玛尔就危险了！"
G["C'mon, $p! We need resources if we're gunna get this job done! Food, wood, iron... whatever you can find!"]="嘿，$p！如果我们想要快点完工，各种资源可少不了！食物，木材，铁矿……把你能找到的东西都给我带来！"
G["C'mon, Fluffy! I just want to give you a bath!"]="过来，小兔子！我只是要给你洗澡！"
G["C'mon, let's get you another ale."]="好了，再来一杯啤酒吧。"
G["C'mon, let's try somewhere else."]="我们到别的地方去试试吧。"
G["C'mon, you guys. We can do this. Fly!"]="来吧，伙计们。我们能行。起飞！"
G["C-c-c-cowards..."]="懦——懦——懦夫……"
G["C-c-cold..."]="真……真冷……"
G["C-c-come back here! That's my sheep!"]="回来！那是我的羊！"
G["C... can't we work this out somehow?"]="我们……我们不能想想办法吗？"
G["CAIRNE WAS MY BROTHER!!!!!!!!!"]="凯恩是我的兄弟！！！"
G["CAN NO SEE! WHERE TO GO!? WHAT DOING?!"]="看不见了！往哪边走？！要干吗？！"
G["CAN YOU DIG IT?!?"]="你能挖到它吗？！？"
G["CAN YOU SMELL WHAT THE LOK'TAR IS COOKIN'?!"]="你能闻出那个家伙在烧什么吗？"
G["CANNONBALL!!"]="炮弹！！"
G["CAPTAIN RO-GU?! Impossible! To think that you would falter now..."]="统领容古？！不可能！你现在居然退却了……"
G["CAREFUL! Vanndar, Balinda and Bloodfang are right there also."]="小心！范达尔、巴琳达和血牙也在那里。"
G["CARNAGE!"]="杀！"
G["CARRIER HAS ARRIVED."]="货物已经抵达。"
G["CATACLYSMIC POWER!"]="毁灭之力！"
G["CHAOS!"]="混乱！"
G["CHAOS! DOOM! DESTRUCTION! This one will claim them all!"]="混乱！厄运！毁灭！它将拥有一切破坏性的力量！"
G["CHRIS METZEN!"]="¡CHRIS METZEN!"
G["CLIMB."]="攀爬。"
G["CLUCK!"]="咯咯！"
G["CLUCK!  Sensors detect spatial anomaly -- danger imminent!  CLUCK!"]="咯咯嗒！探测到空间异常——危险临近！咯咯嗒！"
G["COGWRENCH, YOU WERE SMALL AND I MISS YOU."]="轮钳，你可真小，我很想你。"
G["COILSSSKARRR!"]="库斯卡……！"
G["COME AT ME, BROKKERS!"]="冲我来，混蛋！"
G["COME FORTH, MY SERVANTS! DEFEND YOUR MASTER!"]="出现吧，我的奴仆！保卫你们的主人！"
G["COME ON!"]="尝尝这招！"
G["COME OUT TO JANEIRO'S POINT.  I'M WAITING FOR YOU, SMOTTS..."]="出来，到加尼罗哨站来。我等着你，斯莫特……"
G["COME, HUMANS! LICK THE STAINLESS STEEL BOOTS OF YOUR NEW GOD!"]="来吧，人类！来舔舔你们的新神的不锈钢靴子！"
G["COWARD!"]="懦夫！"
G["COWARD! You think to stop the Warchief of the Horde with pebbles? I will show you the true power of the elements!"]="懦夫！你以为投掷小石块就能阻止部落的酋长吗？我会让你见识到元素的真正力量！"
G["COWER, DWARFSSSESS!!"]="颤抖吧，矮人！！"
G["CRASH REPORT XX1-017\n\nCHECKSUM ERROR 0081\n\nFLUID LEVELS DANGEROUSLY LOW\n\nMISSION FAILURE\n\nNEVER GOT A CHANCE TO SEE OUTLANDS"]="坠毁报告XX1-017\n\n校验和数错误0081\n\n流体水平过低，危险\n\n任务失败\n\n未曾有机会看到外部世界"
G["CRUSH!"]="粉碎！"
G["CUT IT OUT! You're getting blood all over my robe."]="够了！你把血弄得我全身都是。"
G["Cage stink of bad fortune. Hozen stink of more bad fortune."]="牢笼散发着暗示厄运的臭味。猢狲散发的臭味更糟糕。"
G["Cage the pygmy!"]="把那个俾格米关起来！"
G["Cairne has brought us to a land rich with possibilities for the future. We have been fortunate, and so in turn we pass on our good fortune to others. That is why I began teaching, $n."]="凯恩把我们带到了一片充满希望的大地。我们很幸运，因此我们再把好运带给别人。这就是我为什么开始教学的原因，$n。"
G["Cairne himself lives here, they say. Once I have finished crafting a fitting gift, I will seek him out. Perhaps he will have words of wisdom for me."]="凯恩自己住这儿，他们说。一旦我完成了制作一件合适的礼物，我就会把他找出来。或许他会有智慧的话要对我说。"
G["Cakes, pastries, even bread - anything but cheese!"]="蛋糕，馅饼，甚至是面包——除了奶酪什么都行！"
G["Calculating force parameters..."]="计算力量参数……"
G["Calculating route..."]="计算路径……"
G["Calculating trajectory..."]="弹道计算中……"
G["Calder Gray, reporting for mayhem... er, duty."]="卡尔德·格雷，报丧……呃，报到。"
G["Calder said that if I kill you, I get to have your parts!"]="卡尔德说，如果我杀了你，我就能得到你的零件！"
G["Calen, no!"]="凯伦，不！"
G["Calf killer! Murderer! You will pay for this!"]="屠夫！凶手！你会付出代价的！"
G["Calibrating fuse..."]="校准引信……"
G["Calissa is dying!"]="卡莉莎快要死了！"
G["Calissa...I am so sorry..."]="卡莉莎……我很抱歉……"
G["Call for aid and the Shadow Wardens will answer. I am ready for anything."]="只要开口求援，暗影守望者就会出现。我已经做好一切准备了。"
