G["Call for the people. I wish to speak to them one last time before the dawning."]="叫来我的人民。我想在黎明到来之前再对他们讲最后一次话。"
G["Call for your king, $rt! Draw him in!"]="向你们的国王求救吧，$r！把他拖进来！"
G["Call in a Banshee with the Banshee Mirror!"]="用女妖之镜召唤来一个女妖！"
G["Call in all of our favors then. See to it that whatever they're up to, we know of it before it occurs. Then we shall see who strikes first!"]="那就把我们的人都召集起来。一定要保证我们能在他们行动前得到消息。我倒要看看到底是谁先发动进攻！"
G["Call in the clowns! It's turned into a circus in there!"]="不如叫些小丑来！神圣的斗兽场已经沦为马戏团了！"
G["Call it a day, men!"]="收工了，伙计们！"
G["Call me \"Boss\".  What have you got for me!"]="Llámame \"jefe\". ¿Qué tienes para mí?"
G["Call me Lilly, please."]="请叫我莉莉。"
G["Call me Twin. That's what Mowi calls me.\n\nNo, we don' look alike. Are ye blind? She's a gnome fer the Light's sake! We act alike. 'specially when we're fightin'.\n\nAs fer my name... have ya na heard o' the storied Wildhammer Brewers? Care fer a pint?"]="Llámame Gemela. Así es como me llama Mowi.\n\nNo, no nos parecemos en nada. ¿Es que estás $gcegato:cegata;? ¡Ella es una gnoma, por la Luz! Actuamos bastante parecido. Sobre todo cuando luchamos.\n\nEn cuanto a mi nombre... ¿Es que nunca has oído hablar de los famosos cerveceros Martillo Salvaje? ¿Te apetece una pinta?"
G["Call me crazy, but I love this warm weather!  I always felt like an outcast back in Borean but I think this new climate is going to work out great for me!"]="你就当我疯了吧，我简直爱死这温暖的好天气了！我总觉得自己在苔原时像个流浪儿，可我觉得这新气候真是帮了我大忙！"
G["Call off your men. Lor'themar's own foolishness caused his injuries. Quel'Delar is not chosen; it chooses its master."]="叫你的人停手。洛瑟玛·塞隆受伤只能怪他自己愚蠢。没人能驾驭奎尔德拉；它只听从自己认定的主人。"
G["Call on me anytime, $n."]="随时为你效劳，$n。"
G["Call the Gryphons!"]="召集狮鹫！"
G["Call the Headless Horseman."]="召唤无头骑士。"
G["Calm down! I'd hardly call that a fire!"]="冷静点儿！这根本算不上是火嘛！"
G["Calm down! We'll get to everybody in time..."]="镇定！我们要尽快查清楚每一个人……"
G["Calm down, Mudmug. Let's go."]="冷静点，泥盏。出发。"
G["Calm down, Valdred.  Undertaker Mordo probably sewed some new ones on for you."]="别激动，瓦德雷。这可能是送葬者摩尔多为你缝上的新手。"
G["Calm down, friends. There will be plenty of time to answer all your questions."]="镇定，朋友们。你们的问题都会得到解答，不必着急。"
G["Calm down, lad, it's just birdshot!"]="¡Calma, $gmuchacho:muchacha;, es solo un tiro de salva!"
G["Calm down. I want to you ask you about the iron dwarves and Loken."]="冷静。我是想问你关于铁矮人和洛肯的情况。"
G["Calm yaself. Let yaself get lost in tha flames."]="让心情平静。让自己沉浸在火焰中。"
G["Calm yourself, Arygos. Your barrier will buy you all the time you need."]="冷静，阿瑞苟斯。你的屏障能为你争取足够的时间。"
G["Calm yourself, Idonis.  Brash actions will get us nowhere!  Take a break, tap into some mana crystals.  You'll feel better."]="冷静，伊东尼斯。鲁莽的行动会让我们没有退路的！休息一会，吸取些魔力水晶。你会感觉好些的。"
G["Calm yourself, Ishi. The Lord Regent may speak his mind."]="冷静点，伊什。让摄政王说出他的想法。"
G["Calm yourself, Sentinel. I do not seek to use it. I am merely... remembering."]="冷静，卫兵。我不是要试图使用它。我只是……在记忆。"
G["Came to the wrong place, ya did."]="你来错地方了。"
G["Can I bring my wrench?"]="我能带上我的扳子吗？"
G["Can I buy some hops from you?"]="你能卖给我一些啤酒花吗？"
G["Can I catch a ride to Razor Hill?"]="能载我前往剃刀岭吗？"
G["Can I eat it? I guessh only one way to find out..."]="我可以吃吗？我想只有一个办法才知道答案……"
G["Can I enter the tournament?"]="我能参加比武大会吗？"
G["Can I get a buff? I'm dying up here."]="能给我个增益魔法吗？我快死在这里了。"
G["Can I get a ride back to ground level, Lord Afrasastrasz?"]="阿弗拉沙斯塔兹，能让我返回神殿底层吗？"
G["Can I get a ride back to the fleet?"]="能给我一艘船返回舰队么？"
G["Can I get another parachute?"]="我能再领一顶降落伞吗？"
G["Can I get any of you another drink?"]="你们哪位还要再来一杯么？"
G["Can I get some food, please??? This is outrageous!"]="请给我点食物吧？不要太过分！"
G["Can I get you a refreshment?"]="你要不要吃点什么？"
G["Can I get you anything?  My selection is a little limited, but that's to be expected... all things considered."]="想要点什么吗？可想而知……能供你挑选的东西也不多。"
G["Can I get you something to drink, $r?"]="你需要喝点什么，$r？"
G["Can I get you something to drink?"]="我能要点喝的吗？"
