G["Can I have your attention for a moment!"]="能专心听我说两句吗！"
G["Can I help ye with somethin'?"]="我能帮你些什么？"
G["Can I help you with something?"]="我能帮助你吗？"
G["Can I help you with the Twilight's Hammer investigation? We don't have to tell my father..."]="我能帮你调查暮光之锤吗？我们不必告诉我父亲……"
G["Can I help you, $c?"]="我能帮你什么忙吗，$c？"
G["Can I help you?"]="我能帮忙吗？"
G["Can I help?"]="我能帮什么忙吗？"
G["Can I hire someone to help me on my farm?"]="我能雇人帮忙打理农场吗？"
G["Can I interest you in a new weapon, $c?"]="对新武器有兴趣吗，$c？"
G["Can I offer you a drink? I promise you its aged like none other!"]="我可以请你喝一杯吗？我保证这是真正的陈年老酒！"
G["Can I play?"]="能算我一个吗？"
G["Can I provide you with anything, $n?"]="我能为你提供些什么，$n？"
G["Can I purchase one of your traps?"]="我能向你买个陷阱吗？"
G["Can I replace something I've already planted?"]="我可以替换已经种下去的作物吗？"
G["Can I show you what I have for sale?"]="想看看我出售的货物吗？"
G["Can I take your test again, Vex'tul?"]="我可以再次接受你的测试吗，维克斯图？"
