G["Can Zamja help you, $r?"]="扎姆沙能帮你吗，$r？"
G["Can Zen'Kiki get a little nudge?"]="有人能来帮帮赞吉吉吗？"
G["Can a lady get a ride?"]="一位淑女能够上马驰骋一番吗？"
G["Can anybody hear me?"]="有人听见我说话吗？"
G["Can anyone give my adorable, extra little kitty a home?"]="谁能收养我可爱的小猫咪啊？"
G["Can anyone hear me? I need help! This creature is going to kill me!"]="有谁能听到我的话吗？我需要帮助！我快要被干掉了！"
G["Can anyone hear me? I'm being attacked!"]="来人啊！我被袭击了！"
G["Can it be...? Oh no, no no no no no."]="这不是……？噢，不不不。"
G["Can it be?"]="可以吗？"
G["Can it really be? Free after all these years?"]="这是真的吗？经历了多年的磨难，我竟然还能重获自由？"
G["Can me eat you? Me be quick."]="我能吃了你吗？我的速度会很快的。"
G["Can never have too many shiny crystals! Nope!"]="亮闪闪的水晶怎么都不嫌多啊！不嫌多！"
G["Can one of your gryphons get me to the Digsite?"]="你的狮鹫可以送我到挖掘场吗？"
G["Can someone let me out of here? I need to get back to Venomspite and finish my shift."]="谁放我出去呀？我还要返回怨毒镇换班呢。"
G["Can that be The Razza down there in the Maul?  This is going to be exciting!"]="在厄运之槌那儿的是拉扎尔吗？这可真令人激动！"
G["Can that really be Quel'Delar?"]="那真的会是奎尔德拉吗？"
G["Can the Kirin Tor really kick us out like this?"]="肯瑞托怎么能这样把我们赶出去？"
G["Can this be... the end, at last...?"]="一切……终于……结束了吗？"
G["Can we buy something? I'm hungry."]="我们买点儿什么吧？我饿了。"
G["Can we fire some more cannons? I dunnae think we're firin' nearly enough cannons."]="我们能再用大炮轰击一下吗？我觉得我们的炮火轰击还不够。"
G["Can we go on a nice, romantic picnic on top of Mount Kajaro?\n\nMake sure you pickup my favorite champagne!"]="我们能在卡亚罗山的顶端渡过一个美好、浪漫的野餐日吗？\n\n一定要带我喜欢的香槟来！"
G["Can we go play with the goblins? I'm taller than them!"]="我们可以和地精玩耍吗？我比他们高！"
G["Can we go see the serpents?"]="我们可以去看看青龙吗？"
G["Can we go see the undead lady? She looks funny."]="我们可以去看看亡灵女士吗？她看起来很有趣的。"
G["Can we go yet, Tarenar?  I want to join the Crusade!"]="我们能走了吗，塔伦纳？我想要加入北伐军！"
G["Can we go yet? Are you done with your beer?"]="能走了吗？啤酒喝完了吗？"
G["Can we got back to Kun-Lai? The air smells funny here."]="我们可以回到昆莱吗？这里的空气闻着很奇怪。"
G["Can we have some of your pets, Miss Finkleswitch? Please?"]="能给我们一些宠物吗，芬克斯维奇小姐？拜托了。"
G["Can we maybe, please go now? Little scary."]="我们离开这里好不好啊？我有点害怕。"
G["Can we pull yet? Can we? Can we?"]="我们可以开拉了吗？可以拉了吗？可以拉了吗？"
G["Can we ride some kites, Connor?"]="康诺，我们能乘坐风筝吗？"
G["Can we see the tauren? They look like yaungols."]="我们可以去看看牛头人吗？他们看起来像野牛人。"
G["Can we slow down just a bit?"]="我们的速度能慢一点吗？"
G["Can we start with something easier?"]="我们能从简单些的东西开始吗？"
G["Can we stop running now?"]="我们可以停下来了吗？"
G["Can we take a break? My feet are killing me and those ... those things down there are creeping me out."]="我们能休息一下吗？我的脚很痛……"
G["Can ya believe Onyxia just left these sitting around in her egg pit? I'm going to make a fortune!"]="你能相信吗，奥妮克希亚竟然任由这些留在她的巢穴里？我要发大财了！"
G["Can ye hear it, stranger? The humming is gettin' louder with each passing day. These crystals must be what's driving these bugs crazy."]="¿Puedes oírlo, $gforastero:forastera;? Cada día que pasa, el zumbido se hace más fuerte. Estos cristales son los que están volviendo locos a esos bichos."
G["Can ye keep a secret, Ed? Arr, dead men tell no tales!"]="你能保密吗，艾德华？啊，死人是不会说话的！"
G["Can you believe it?  This ethereal does not have a single basilisk eye on him!\n\nAnd his leader has the gall to call himself \"the Smuggler Prince!\""]="你能相信吗？这个虚灵身上竟然没有一只蜥蜴眼！\n\n然而他们的首领竟然还有胆子自称为“走私大亨！”"
G["Can you believe it? They finally opened this place up for us to fly a zeppelin through here! No fly zone no more, am I right? We only crashed one zeppelin into a cliff on the test run. I don't see why they were so worried."]="你相信吗？他们终于解除了这个地方的禁制，让我们的飞艇能够穿越这里的天空了！这里不再是飞行禁区了。毕竟，我们在测试飞行中只不过让一艘飞艇撞上了崖壁。我完全不明白他们到底在担心什么。"
G["Can you believe that they won't let me in? Me, of all people?"]="你能相信他们竟然不放我进去么？在所有人当中偏偏是我？"
G["Can you believe the nerve of that Elisara Sunstriker?  Thinking that she can catch the eye of Lord Saltheril?  And did you see what she's wearing?  So last season.  It's sad, really."]="你能相信那个埃莉萨拉·射日者的勇气吗？她居然认为自己可以引起萨瑟利尔男爵的注意，还有，你看到她都穿了些什么吗？太落伍了。真令人伤心，真的。"
G["Can you believe the nerve of this little grummle? This shrewd little negotiator will have me bankrupt with his prices in no time."]="你能相信这个小土地精的胆量吗？这个精明的小谈判者马上就能以他的价格把我搞破产。"
G["Can you believe these monkeys, $n?"]="你能相信这些猴子吗，$n？"
G["Can you believe these people just set out free food? This place is amazing!"]="你相信吗？这儿的人居然免费发放食物！这地方真是太棒了！"
G["Can you believe this ethereal technology?!\n\nI'm sure glad they let me stay out here with them.  I'm gonna learn a lot... and maybe get some of it for myself, too!"]="你能相信虚灵的科技吗？！\n\n我当然愿意和他们待在这里。我会学到很多……也许还能给我自己弄一点！"
G["Can you believe this place?  'Course, it's a mite stuffy up here if you ask me."]="你觉得这地方怎么样？当然，如果你问我的话，我觉得挺乏味的。"
G["Can you believe this place?  There's so much to learn and discover!  I'm going to fill up books and books with all my findings here.\n\nBut it's just so much information, I don't know how anyone could possibly read through it all.  Chadrik thought we could write it up as a song, but that's silly... right?"]="你能相信吗？世上居然有这种地方的存在！这里有太多需要学习和发现的东西了！在这里的发现绝对能让我著作等身。\n\n但它们的信息量太大了，我不知道有谁能读完它们。查德里克觉得我们该把它们写成歌谣，但这太蠢了……对吧？"
G["Can you believe this? These Silver Covenant goons are trying to shake us down."]="这些银色盟约的家伙们想要打垮我们，你能相信吗？"
G["Can you believe those Reliquary blood elves beat us here? We can't let them go on excavatin' our artifacts!"]="你相信吗？那些神圣遗物学会的血精灵居然在这儿击败了我们？我们不能让他们继续挖掘属于我们的遗物！"
G["Can you carry me, daddy?"]="爸爸，你能抱我吗？"
G["Can you cast the spell to help me breathe and move underwater?"]="你能对我施放让我可以在水下呼吸和移动的魔法吗？"
G["Can you charge my Cryptomancer's Decoder Ring?"]="你能帮我的地火操纵者的解码环充能吗？"
G["Can you close the portal, brother?"]="你能关闭这座传送门吗，哥哥？"
G["Can you defeat my Double Claw Xuen Style?"]="你能破解我的双爪白虎式吗？"
G["Can you detail the nature of these defense systems?"]="你能详细描述一下防御系统的性能吗？"
G["Can you enchant my axe?  I'll want a permanent.  Maybe later then.  Find Godan's Runeworks on the west end of The Drag near the Valley of Wisdom."]="你能给我的斧头附魔吗？我需要永久性的。或许晚些。到智慧谷附近的暗巷区西端找到古丹的符文工艺店。"
G["Can you even hear me???"]="你能听到吗？"
G["Can you face the living waters and evade defeat?"]="你能在活水面前赢得胜利吗？"
G["Can you feel a chill wind blow? The storm is coming..."]="你感觉到劲吹的寒风了吗？风暴将至……"
G["Can you feel it, pathetic creatures? The pall over this land is but a precursor. Soon your precious holdings will be in our grasp! You will fall before the might of the Lich King!"]="你们能感觉到吧，可怜虫？现在的侵攻只是一个开始，很快你们所珍视的一切都将成我们的所有品！你们所有人会败倒在巫妖王面前！"
G["Can you feel it?\n\nThe spirit world draws close during the Day of the Dead. This is why we decorate the graves of our dearly departed with flowers and candles and offerings: To welcome them back, even if only for a time.\n\nSo come! Dance with me! Let us cherish and honor those we have lost in their ghostly presence, so that they might eat and drink and smile and know that they are loved."]="你能感觉到吗？\n\n灵魂世界在悼念日中距离我们更近了。所以我们要用鲜花和蜡烛装饰逝去亲友的坟墓，并告诉他们：欢迎回来，虽然只有片刻。\n\n所以，来吧！和我一起跳舞！让我们纪念那些已经和我们天人永隔的亲人。让逝者同我们一起享用美食，一起微笑。让他们知道，关爱永不逝去。"
G["Can you feel it? Da Thunder is getting closer..."]="你能感觉到吗？雷电之王离我们越来越近了……"
G["Can you feel it? The blessed warmth of the sun?"]="你能感受到太阳温暖的祝福吗……？"
G["Can you feel that tingling sensation? It may be your last."]="感到刺痛吗？这也许是你最后的感觉。"
G["Can you feel the burn?"]="能感到那灼热吗？"
G["Can you feel the cold hand of death upon your heart?"]="你能感受到死神之手的那股寒意吗？"
G["Can you feel the evil all around us, $c? By the Hand, it must be cleansed!\n\nThe demons destroyed our homeworld, Argus. I will NOT countenance their presence here on our new home, Azeroth!"]="你能感觉到弥漫在我们周围的邪恶气息吗，$c？以阿古斯之手的名义，它必须被消灭掉！\n\n那些恶魔摧毁了我们曾经的家园阿古斯。我绝不会容忍他们蹂躏我们新的家园——艾泽拉斯！"
G["Can you feel the evil that taints the very ground, $c? It comes from deep down within the Shadow Hold. Unchecked, it will swallow everything in its path.\n\n<The night elf coughs, revealing a bloody wound at his side.>"]="¿Sientes el mal que mancilla esta tierra, $c? Procede de lo más profundo de la Guarida Sombría. Si no nos oponemos, devorará todo lo que se interponga en su camino.\n\n<El elfo de la noche tose y muestra una herida sangrante en su costado.>"
G["Can you feel the magic in the air, $c?"]="感觉到空气中的魔法能量了吗，$c？"
G["Can you feel the magic?  Thunderbrew brewmasters are on the loose!  Check them out at Brewfest!"]="你能感觉到这魔力吗？雷酒酿造师所释放的魔力！去美酒节看看吧！"
G["Can you feel the power, $n??? It's time to ROCK!"]="你能感受到这力量吗，$n？让我们舞动起来吧！"
G["Can you feel the warmth here, my children?"]="你能感受到这里的温暖吗，我的孩子们？"
G["Can you feel their life-giving energies flow through you?"]="感受到它们所蕴含的生命活力了吗？"
G["Can you figure out which is real?!"]="你能弄清哪个是真的吗？！"
G["Can you fly?"]="会飞么？"
G["Can you follow my blade?"]="你能抵御我的刀法？"
G["Can you get this $n off me?"]="你能不能帮我搞定这个$n？"
G["Can you give me directions?"]="你能帮我指指路吗？"
G["Can you handle this?"]="你受得了吗？"
G["Can you hear it speaking in your mind?"]="你听见了吗？它正在你的脑海中低语。"
G["Can you hear it, $c? The elements cry out that this land is almost dead. The Drakkari are stealing the power of their gods by killing them just to defend themselves against the Scourge.\n\nThey are short-sighted and will be their own undoing in the end."]="你听到了吗，$c？元素们哭喊着说，这片土地已经濒临死亡了。达卡莱巨魔正在窃取自己神灵的力量，用以抵御天灾军团。\n\n他们的鼠目寸光终将导致他们自身的毁灭。"
G["Can you help me clense the lake?"]="你能帮我净化这座湖吗？"
G["Can you help me find my amulet Mishi?"]="你能帮我找到护符吗，米师？"
G["Can you help me find the White Pawn?"]="你能帮我找到白卒吗？"
G["Can you help me get down from here, Stefan?"]="你能帮我下去吗，斯特凡？"
G["Can you help me get down?"]="你能帮我下去吗？"
G["Can you help me get out on the water, Tart?"]="你能让我不掉进水里吗，塔蒂？"
G["Can you help me with some directions?"]="你能帮我指一下路吗？"
G["Can you help us? Our friend is injured."]="你能帮帮我们吗？我们的朋友受伤了。"
G["Can you hurry? I have to be somewhere."]="你能快一点吗？我还要赶路呢。"
G["Can you imagine the life of a machine?"]="你能想象一台机器的生命吗？"
G["Can you imagine?"]="你能想象吗？"
G["Can you increase my swim speed again?"]="你能再次帮我提高游泳速度吗？"
G["Can you lead me to the exit?"]="你能带我去出口吗？"
G["Can you lead us to the prisoners?"]="你能带我们去找那些俘虏吗？"
G["Can you make anything of these clues?"]="你可以找到什么线索吗？"
G["Can you not feel it? Your sprits lifting?"]="你感觉到了没？你的精神振奋了吗？"
G["Can you not see that I am busy here?"]="你没看到我现在很忙吗？"
G["Can you not see that you play right into the Lich King's hands? He wants you to kill each other!"]="难道你们没有发现自己中了巫妖王的圈套？他就是希望你们自相残杀啊！"
G["Can you not see what is happening? Open your eyes. It is laid bare for all to see. What is this new alliance? Why have we betrayed our allies of old, only to take up with the enemies of all that live?"]="你们看不到眼前正在发生些什么事情吗？睁开你们的眼睛，一切都明明白白展现在你们眼前。我们的新同盟是什么？为什么我们背叛了过去的盟友，却要与所有生命的大敌亲密相处？"
G["Can you not sense the anguish of the Earth Mother for her lost children, the undead? Speak quickly, $n. Every second costs me dearly. We must help them find their way back to her!"]="你难道感觉不到大地母亲为了她所丢失的孩子，也就是亡灵们，而出现的苦恼吗？快些说，$n。每一秒对我都很珍贵。我们必须帮他们找到回归她身边的路！"
G["Can you open a portal to your tower for me, Archmage Xylem?"]="大法师克希雷姆，你能为我打开一个前往你的高塔的传送门吗？"
G["Can you open this, Ticker?"]="你能打开它吗，钟摆？"
G["Can you play me a song?"]="你能为我演唱一曲吗？"
G["Can you re-stealth me?"]="你能让我再隐身一次吗？"
G["Can you read me Alicia's poem again?"]="你能再为我读一次奥利卡的诗吗？"
G["Can you really hear the ocean from one of these shells?"]="你真的能从这些海螺里面听到大海的声音吗？"
G["Can you remove the sword?"]="你能取出那把剑吗？"
G["Can you repair equipment?"]="你能修理设备吗？"
G["Can you repair my gear?"]="你能修好我的设备吗？"
G["Can you see them, mortal? No... I did not think you could. Sighted but sightless - it is your gift and your curse."]="你看到他们了吗？当然没有……我认为你是看不到的。以你的资质，即使有眼睛也和瞎了没有什么区别。"
G["Can you see yourselves? That is the most pathetic excuse for sword slinging I've ever seen!"]="你们知道自己看起来有多烂吗？这是我见过的最可笑的战斗！"
G["Can you send me to Theramore? I have an urgent message for Lady Jaina from King Wrynn."]="能替我捎个信吗？乌瑞恩国王有一封紧急信件要交给塞拉摩岛的吉安娜女士。"
G["Can you sense it, $p? This is where the Sha of Fear was held."]="你能感觉到吗，$p？这就是惧之煞的藏身之处。"
G["Can you show me the chamber beneath Klaxxi'vess again?"]="你能再给我看看卡拉克西维斯下方的内室吗？"
G["Can you sing for us the song of Liu Lang?"]="你可以为我们唱刘浪之歌吗？"
G["Can you smell the winds, stranger? They bring change."]="¿Percibes el aroma del viento, $gforastero:forastera;? Traen cambio."
G["Can you sneak up on zombies? Don't they smell your brains when you get close?\n\nHalf the people around here have nothing to worry about then."]="¿Puedes acercarte sigilosamente a los zombis? ¿No huelen tu cerebro nada más acercarte?"
G["Can you sneak up on zombies? Don't they smell your brains when you get close?\n\nHalf the people around here have nothing to worry about then.\n\nNeed any training, $n?"]="你能不能在暗中靠近僵尸？难道当你靠近的时候，他们闻不到你脑子的气味ie？\n\n不过，这里大概有半数人已经不必担心这种事了。\n\n需要进行训练吗，$n？"
G["Can you spare a drake to take me to Lord Afrasastrasz in the middle of the temple?"]="能让我搭乘幼龙前往龙眠神殿中层，与阿弗拉沙斯塔兹会面吗？"
G["Can you spare an orange?"]="能给我一颗橙子吗？"
G["Can you spread the reflective dust again?"]="你能再撒一次反光粉吗？"
G["Can you stand on the tallest peak, winds and sleet buffeting your skin, until the trees wither and the mountains fall into the sea?"]="你能否独立山巅，任由风霜侵袭，直至沧海变为桑田，高山沉入海底？"
G["Can you still lead your troops?  Do you need to promote one of your sergeants?"]="你还能指挥你的部下吗？是否需要暂时把指挥权交给你的一名副官？"
G["Can you survive with what remains?"]="你还能靠剩下的宠物反败为胜吗？"
G["Can you survive? TIGER BOMB!"]="你能撑住吗？猛虎之雷！"
G["Can you take me to the Chapel?"]="能送我去礼拜堂吗？"
G["Can you take me to the Great Hall?"]="能送我去大厅吗？"
G["Can you take me to the Laboratory?"]="能送我去实验室吗？"
G["Can you take me to the Ramparts?"]="能送我去城墙吗？"
G["Can you tell me anything about your village?"]="你能告诉我一些关于你村子的事吗？"
G["Can you tell me how I can get a Videre Elixir?"]="你能告诉我怎样才能得到一份视灵药剂吗？"
G["Can you tell me more about this place?"]="告诉我更多关于这个地方的信息？"
G["Can you tell me of the time when the Darkspear left Orgrimmar, Vol'jin?  I need to see Garrosh's actions for myself."]="沃金，能否告诉我暗矛部族在何时离开奥格瑞玛？我需要亲眼见证加尔鲁什的行为。"
G["Can you tell me what became of Sif?"]="你能把西芙的事告诉我吗？"
G["Can you tell me where Brine is?"]="你能告诉我布瑞恩在哪里吗？"
G["Can you tell me where they have Chancellor Amai caged?"]="你能告诉我他们把司法官亚麦关在哪里了吗？"
G["Can you tell me your fable, Shin?"]="希恩，能给我讲讲你的预言吗？"
G["Can you train me how to use rogue skills?"]="你能训练我使用潜行者技能吗？"
G["Can't ... give up..."]="不能……放弃……"
G["Can't a girl just get a drink without being hassled?"]="难道妹子就不能顺顺利利地拿到自己的酒？"
G["Can't be me, I took a bath 3 days ago!"]="不对呀，我3天前才洗过澡！"
G["Can't believe the forsaken wagon broke down.  Ain't no luck to be had in this land. . . ."]="这辆该死的马车居然坏了。倒霉啊……"
G["Can't believe we're putting the old team back together. All thanks to you, $n."]="真是难以置信，我们居然又把过去的队伍集结在一起了。这都要感谢你，$n。"
G["Can't complain about the materials down here. Substitutes for everything. Substitutes for substitutes. Gimme a few days and I'll build a aquatic hotrod out of kelp and shells!"]="这些水下的资源真是让人无话可说。任何工程材料和替换件都能找到代用品。给我几天时间，我就能用水藻和贝壳做出一辆水下改装跑车！"
G["Can't fix somethin' as complicated as a tank without the proper equipment, buddy!"]="没有合适的工具，我可没办法修理坦克这类构造复杂的装置！"
G["Can't help ya, $n. I only train rogues."]="我帮不了你，$n。我只训练潜行者。"
G["Can't help you. You know more about potions than I do. Besides, I have pots to watch. Talk to Yelmak over there. He knows a lot about potions."]="不能帮你。你比我更懂药剂。还有，我还要看着罐子。去找那边的Yelmak谈谈。他懂得很多药剂的知识。"
G["Can't let you back in.\n\nThey're still fighting in there."]="不能让你回去。\n\n他们还在里面战斗。"
G["Can't make water boil any faster, genius!"]="天哪，你就不能快点把水煮沸吗！"
G["Can't say I approve o' the boy roamin' round by himself, but I can understand his thinkin'."]="虽然我不赞成让那个男孩子到处自个儿乱跑，但我能理解他的想法。"
G["Can't say I didn't warn you...."]="我可警告过你……"
G["Can't smash us all!"]="你压不垮我们！"
G["Can't take the heat? Then get out of my way!"]="忍受不了这热浪？那就走远点儿！"
G["Can't talk now. Must... focus."]="现在不能说话。必须……集中精神。"
G["Can't thank ya enough fer helpin' with the mines. Now, it's just a matter of convincing the miners to get back to work."]="我不知道该怎么感谢你对我的帮助了。现在，唯一的问题就是说服那些矿工回来工作。"
G["Can't they go a little slower?"]="他们就不能放慢速度吗？"
G["Can't wait to get back home."]="我想马上回家去。"
G["Can't wait to try this beer that Chen's thinkin' about.\n\nHe talks a big game, that one."]="我都等不及想试试陈构想中的啤酒啦。\n\n那家伙可是说了大话的。"
G["Can't we get one night of peace?"]="我们就不能消停一晚上吗？"
G["Can't we just sleep a while longer?"]="我们就不能多睡一会儿吗？"
G["Can't we work in peace?"]="我们就不能安静地工作吗？"
G["Can't ya see I'm workin' here, $glad:lass;? Off with ya, afore Kowalski sees me jawin.'"]="¿No ves que estoy trabajando $gchico:chica;? Lárgate antes de que Kowalski me vea charlando."
G["Can't ye see I'm busy? This had better be good."]="难道你看不出我现在很忙吗？有什么事？"
G["Can't you at least put up a fight?"]="你能不能使出点真本事来？"
G["Can't you just see me for me, doc? Why does it always have to be about Teddy?"]="你就不能从我的角度想想吗，医生？为什么总是关于泰迪？"
G["Can't you read, pal? Probably not, huh?"]="你不认字吗，伙计？看来是的，哈？"
G["Can't you see I want to be alone? What's the meaning of this disturbance?"]="你没看出来我想要自己待会吗？究竟为什么要来打扰我？"
G["Can't you see I'm a little busy here?"]="你没看到我正忙着吗？"
G["Can't you see I'm busy here?  Go north up the road to Orgrimmar and ask one of the grunts there.  You can't miss it."]="你没看到我很忙吗?沿着路向北走到奥格瑞玛并询问那里的步兵。你不会错过的。"
G["Can't you see I'm busy over here!"]="你没看见我正忙着吗！"
G["Can't you see I'm busy?"]="你没看见我正忙着吗？"
G["Can't you see I'm busy? Got things I'm working at, stranger."]="¿Es que no ves que estoy ocupado? Tengo mucho trabajo que hacer, $gforastero:forastera;."
G["Can't you see I'm fishing here!"]="你没看到我在这里钓鱼吗？"
G["Can't you see I'm partaking in a staring contest right now?"]="你看不见我正在参加瞪眼大赛吗？"
G["Can't you see I'm trying to build ships here? Between you and those night elves, we'll never get this project done!"]="你看不出来我正在努力建造船只吗？一会是你，一会是那些暗夜精灵，我们永远也干不完了！"
G["Can't you see I've got work to do here?"]="你没看到我这儿正忙着呢！"
G["Can't you see that I'm busy! We'll never have this base ready in time for the Prince's return!"]="你没看见我正忙着吗！再这样拖沓，我们是不可能在王子殿下归来之前修好这座基地啦！"
G["Can't you see that I'm busy?"]="你看不到我很忙么？"
G["Can't you see that I'm trying to have a conversation with the lady?  Oh, very well, she seems preoccupied anyway.\n\nI deal in only the finest drinks, both local and exotic in vintage.  Care to have a look?"]="没瞧见我正准备跟这位女士讲话吗？哦，好吧，她似乎很忙。\n\n我出售来自本土和异域的葡萄酒。要看看吗？"
G["Can't you see that I've got places to go and people to see! Step aside, peasant!"]="你没看到我有好多事情要忙吗？走开点，农夫！"
G["Can't you see we're trying to prepare for Uther's visit? Now get out of my way, I have much work to do!"]="你没看到我们正在准备迎接乌瑟的访问吗？现在别妨碍我，我有许多工作要做！"
G["Can't... breathe..."]="喘……喘不过气来……"
G["Can't... control... form."]="不能……控制……形态。"
G["Can't... control... the RAGE!"]="无法……控制……怒火！"
G["Can't... focus..."]="没法……集中精神……"
