G["Candy! That's what I'm talking about; I just wish I didn't have to run around finding it!"]="糖果！这正是我想要的；希望我不用为了找糖果而东奔西跑！"
G["Cannon blast!  Who wants to get shot out of a cannon?"]="炮弹飞人！有人想试试被大炮打飞的滋味吗？"
