G["Cannonfire rings off in the distance, followed by the sound of a whistling cannonball coming from above."]="空中传来炮弹划过的声音，远处的火光忽隐忽现。"
G["Cannot control... It draws me in... The void grows..."]="我控制不了……它在拉我进去……虚空在扩大……"
G["Cannot... sstop!"]="无法……停止！"
G["Cansis, hold still. I'm going to try to use this crystal."]="坎希斯，待在这儿。我去试用这块水晶。"
G["Cansis. You are a chicken."]="坎希斯，你是个胆小鬼。"
G["Cap it!"]="压住它！"
G["Cap'n Garvey will hear of this!"]="嘉维伊船长会知道的！"
G["Cap'n Samir is navigatin' this here ship non-stop to that there ocean over yonder..."]="萨米尔船长将指引这艘船直达大洋彼岸……"
G["Cap'n Stash is the BEST!"]="托格雷船长是最棒的！"
G["Cap'n, sir, we have a slight problem."]="长官，我们有个小问题。"
G["Cap'n, the Virtue hasn't set sail in years. It was just sittin' there."]="船长，处女号已经许多年没有航行过了。它就被安放在那里。"
G["Capernian will see to it that your stay here is a short one."]="卡波妮娅会很快解决你们的。"
G["Capital Portals"]="主城传送门"
G["Capitalizing on your enemy's weaknesses is key."]="利用敌人的弱点，是制胜要诀。"
G["Captain  Muradin is waiting aboard the Skybreaker. We'll secure the area until you are ready for take off."]="穆拉丁大人正在破天号上等着呢。我们会守住这里，等你起飞。"
G["Captain Adams sent me out here to investigate what's happening at Halgrind. This is as close as I've been able to get, however; the abandoned Vrykul tower affords me some amount of cover from prying eyes.\n\nThe Forsaken are up to no good over there. I can feel it!"]="亚当斯上尉派我来调查哈尔格林德到底发生了什么事。我以这座被废弃的维库人哨塔为掩护，费了好大的工夫，最多只能靠到这么近了。\n\n被遗忘者一定在秘密策划着什么。我感觉得到！"
G["Captain Balinda Stonehearth has fallen!\n\nAttack the Horde!  Claim vengeance for Captain Stonehearth!"]="巴琳达·斯通赫尔斯已经倒下啦！我们的将军范达尔·雷矛现在正领导着来自丹巴达尔的军队。\n\n攻击部落！为斯通赫尔斯报仇！"
G["Captain Balinda Stonehearth is dead!  Defeat Vanndar and the battle will be ours!"]="¡La capitana Balinda Piedrahogar está muerta! Derrota a Vanndar y la batalla será nuestra."
G["Captain Balinda Stonehearth leads the front line Alliance forces.  She is based in the Stonehearth Outpost, in the northern section of the Field of Strife.\n\nBalinda has been slain."]="La capitana Balinda Piedrahogar lidera a las tropas de la Alianza de la primera línea. Está en la Avanzada Piedrahogar, en la sección norte de la Tierra de Disputa.\n\nBalinda ha sido asesinada."
G["Captain Balinda Stonehearth leads the front line Alliance forces.  She is based in the Stonehearth Outpost, in the northern section of the Field of Strife.\n\nBalinda has not yet reentered the battle."]="La capitana Balinda Piedrahogar lidera a las tropas de la Alianza de la primera línea. Está en la Avanzada Piedrahogar, en la sección norte de la Tierra de Disputa.\n\nBalinda todavía no ha vuelto a entrar en combate."
G["Captain Balinda Stonehearth leads the front line Alliance forces.  She is based in the Stonehearth Outpost, in the northern section of the Field of Strife.\n\nBalinda is currently in Stonehearth Outpost."]="La capitana Balinda Piedrahogar lidera a las tropas de la Alianza de la primera línea. Está en la Avanzada Piedrahogar, en la sección norte de la Tierra de Disputa.\n\nActualmente Balinda está en la Avanzada Piedrahogar."
G["Captain Ballinda Stonehearth will soon arrive at her garrison.  A new battle will soon be joined!"]="巴琳达·斯通赫尔斯马上就会到位，新的战斗马上就要开始了！"
G["Captain Bartlett, get us out of here! We're taken too much damage to stay afloat!"]="指挥官巴雷特，离开这里！我们受到重创，难以漂浮了！"
G["Captain Brightsun, $n here has freed me! $n, I am certain the Captain will reward your bravery."]="沙罗萨斯船长，这位$n帮助我重获了自由！$n，我相信船长会因你的勇敢而奖励你的。"
G["Captain Elendilad conceals himself on the island ahead, cowardly issuing orders to his underlings."]="胆小的艾伦迪拉德船长就藏在前方的那座岛上，向他的部下发出各种命令。"
G["Captain Galvangar has been slain!  Honor our fallen captain, and unleash yourself again the Alliance!"]="¡El capitán Galvangar ha sido asesinado! Honra a nuestro capitán caído y desata toda tu ira contra la Alianza."
G["Captain Galvangar is the trusted aid to Drek'Thar.  He leads the Horde forces from the Iceblood Garrison, in the southern section of the the Field of Strife.\n\nCaptain Galvangar has been slain."]="El capitán Galvangar es la mano derecha de Drek'Thar. Lidera a las tropas de la Horda desde el Baluarte Sangrehielo, en la sección sur de la Tierra de Disputa.\n\nEl capitán Galvangar ha sido asesinado."
G["Captain Galvangar is the trusted aid to Drek'Thar.  He leads the Horde forces from the Iceblood Garrison, in the southern section of the the Field of Strife.\n\nCaptain Galvangar has not yet entered the battle."]="El capitán Galvangar es la mano derecha de Drek'Thar. Lidera a las tropas de la Horda desde el Baluarte Sangrehielo, en la sección sur de la Tierra de Disputa.\n\nEl capitán Galvangar todavía no ha entrado en combate."
G["Captain Galvangar is the trusted aid to Drek'Thar.  He leads the Horde forces from the Iceblood Garrison, in the southern section of the the Field of Strife.\n\nCaptain Galvangar is currently in the Iceblood Garrison."]="El capitán Galvangar es la mano derecha de Drek'Thar. Lidera a las tropas de la Horda desde el Baluarte Sangrehielo, en la sección sur de la Tierra de Disputa.\n\nEl capitán Galvangar está en el Baluarte Sangrehielo."
G["Captain Helios, I've been rescued from the Amani Catacombs. Reporting for duty, sir!"]="赫里奥斯中尉，我从阿曼尼墓穴逃出来了。报告，长官！"
G["Captain Joseph Redpath has been corrupted!  Kill him quickly!"]="约瑟夫·雷德帕斯队长被腐蚀了！快杀死他！"
G["Captain Muradin is waiting aboard the Skybreaker. We'll secure the area until you are ready for take off."]="穆拉丁大人正在破天号上等着呢。我们会守住这里，等你起飞。"
G["Captain Ook is comin' down with the scurvy! Keep the orange away from him!"]="乌克头领正在传播败血症！别让他靠近橘子！"
G["Captain Ook's got the full blown scurvy!"]="乌克头领获得了完全型败血症！"
G["Captain Redpath has appeared on the battlefield!  Protect him!"]="雷德帕斯队长出现在战场上了！保护他！"
G["Captain Redpath is slain!"]="雷德帕斯队长被杀了！"
G["Captain Redpath!  How could you forsake us!"]="雷德帕斯队长！你怎么能抛弃我们！"
G["Captain Saurfang will be pleased to see you aboard Orgrim's Hammer. Make haste, we will secure the area until you are ready for take-off."]="萨鲁法尔大王会在奥格瑞姆之锤号欢迎你们。我们会守住这里，等你们做好起飞准备。"
G["Captain Selana has instructed me to assist you with your efforts here on the Sunwell Plateau."]="塞拉娜上尉命令我协助你们在太阳之井高地一带的行动。"
G["Captain Stash! We'll be arriving shortly, sir!"]="托格雷船长！我们即将抵达目的地，长官！"
G["Captain Tharran wants you to deploy your remote observation bots and withdraw to Kharanos."]="萨兰恩队长希望你放置好观察机器人以后撤退至卡拉诺斯。"
G["Captain is dead."]="船长死了。"
G["Captain!  Lieutenant Stouthammer requests your presence!  The enemy is approaching, sir!"]="上尉！中尉要您过去！敌人正在接近我们，长官！"
G["Captain! Please keep your crew safely on board. We'll defend the ship if it's attacked."]="船长！请让船员安全待在船上。一旦遭到攻击，我们会保护舰船！"
G["Captain! Shipwreck off the starboard bow! There appear to be survivors!"]="船长！右舷下方发现船骸，好像还有幸存者！"
G["Captain! The naga! They've followed $n back to the ship!"]="船长！是纳迦！他们跟着$n到船上来了！"
G["Captain's not gonna like this."]="这可不太好。"
G["Captain, I need a ride back to Northwatch Hold."]="队长，我需要坐骑返回北方城堡。"
G["Captain, I've somehow lost my command insignia."]="上尉，我弄丢了指挥官徽记。"
G["Captain, here they come! The naga are coming!"]="船长，他们来了！纳迦来了！"
G["Captain, pup need help!"]="船长，我需要帮助！"
G["Captain, sir! Alliance naval fleet sighted off the port bow."]="船长！船首左舷发现联盟海军舰队。"
G["Captain, why are the guards not at their posts?"]="上尉，卫兵怎么都不在自己的哨位里？"
G["Captain... Nerub'ar flyers! Hundreds of 'em! Coming... Coming from the south! Over our defenses!"]="上尉……尼鲁巴尔蛛怪发动了空袭！有好几百只！他们来了……从南面扑向我们的防御线！"
G["Captains, send forth your first combatants."]="队长，派出你的第一名队员吧。"
G["Captured five years ago by a battalion of filthy, pig sucking Blackrocks, five clicks out from the southern DMZ."]="在五年以前，他被一支肮脏下贱的黑石部队俘虏。他被俘的地方距离南部非军事区只有五分钟路程。"
G["Capturing"]="夺取中"
G["Capturing the Sun's Reach Sanctum was the first step in our battle plan.  Our orders are to take control of the armory next.\n\nWe are $3233w percent done with our goal."]="占领阳湾圣殿是我们战斗计划的第一步。下一步是要控制军械库。\n\n我们的目标完成率已经达到百分之$3233w了。"
G["Care for a bite to eat, traveler?"]="旅行者，你想吃点什么吗？"
G["Care to join our dance?"]="想加入我们的舞蹈吗？"
G["Care to lay down and rest for a time? Surely that sounds better than fighting."]="想不想躺下歇会儿？那听起来当然比战斗要好。"
G["Care to purchase some piratey items?"]="想要购买什么海盗物品吗？"
G["Care to take this somewhere private?"]="小心地将这个带到隐蔽处？"
G["Care to try Grimbooze Thunderbrew's new jungle punch?"]="想尝尝葛瑞姆·雷酒新酿的丛林果酒吗？"
G["Careful here, $c. These trolls killed their own snake god!"]="千万小心，$c。那些巨魔连他们崇拜的蛇神都敢杀！"
G["Careful of big mistcaller guy... Zepik fought him once and barely got away. He lot stronger than rest of big-tongues here."]="小心那只大个子的唤雾者……瑟匹克曾和他打过一次，根本不是他的对手，只能狼狈地逃掉了。他远比其他的大舌头怪厉害。"
G["Careful of big scary beast thing! It try to eat us!"]="当心那只大怪兽！它会吃掉我们！"
G["Careful out here, they don't stop coming."]="多加小心，他们不会就这么停手。"
G["Careful slave thing, the big bad softnuckles might eat you! Hah!"]="当心点，坏心肠的软皮猩猩能一口吃掉你！哈哈！"
G["Careful there, $gladdie:lass;. Between the worg down below and the orcs lurking in the pass, a $c could get $ghisself:herself; killed up here."]="Cuidado $gmuhacho:muchacha;. Entre los huargos de ahí abajo y los orcos que acechan en el paso, $gun:una; $c podría acabar bien $gmuerto:muerta;."
G["Careful there, friend - food’s still hot. It took me three hours to get it just right.\n\nIf good meals and large muscles don’t win her heart, I’m not sure what will."]="Cuidado ahí, amigo, que la comida todavía está caliente. Me ha llevado tres horas dejarla en su punto.\n\nSi las buenas comidas y unos músculos grandes no conquistan su corazón, no sé qué lo hará."
G["Careful who you talk to.  The teromoths have ears."]="说话要小心，蛾子们有耳朵。"
G["Careful with it. It's unstable and loses its potency quickly. Use it soon! And... preferably within eyesight, yes..."]="要当心哦。它不是很稳定，药效随时可能消失。动作要快！最好……现在就用……"
G["Careful with that fuse!"]="小心引线！"
G["Careful with that there vial. She's a bit leaky."]="当心那个小瓶子，它有点儿漏。"
G["Careful with that! If I see a single scratch on my new ship, it'll be your head!"]="小心点！要是我在新船上发现一道划痕，就等着掉脑袋吧！"
G["Careful with the scorpion, he may look friendly but he is a beast in battle!"]="小心那蝎子，他看起来也许很友善，可真打起来简直是头野兽！"
G["Careful with those shots. Don't hit $n!"]="射击时小心点。别打到$n！"
G["Careful! Avoid his breath at all costs!"]="当心！无论如何都要避开他的吐息！"
G["Careful! Don't burn the chops..."]="小心！别烧着我……"
G["Careful! If they see you, they'll raise the alarm.\n\nDid the Golden Lotus send you to rescue us? I'm the only one not dead or captured..."]="小心！要是让他们看见你，他们就会发出警报的。\n\n是金莲教派你来救我的吗？除了我，别人都被杀死或抓走了……"
G["Careful! No let it scratch you like last time."]="当心！别像上次那样被它抓伤了。"
G["Careful! That one might call for his mommy when you hit him. Hahaha!"]="小心！你打那家伙的时候，他可能会叫他的妈妈。哈哈哈！"
G["Careful! The front door is too heavily guarded. Hmmm - Circle around the back of the manor and maybe we can find another way in."]="小心！前门的守卫太森严了。唔……绕到庄园后头去看看，我们或许能找到其他道路。"
G["Careful! This isn't a toy!"]="小心！这可不是玩具！"
G["Careful, $n! Warlord Roktrog is near. He should be back any minute!"]="小心，$n！督军罗克托克就在附近。他随时都会出现！"
G["Careful, $n.  Where are your cultist robes?"]="当心，$n。你的教徒长袍呢？"
G["Careful, $p! Methane labs like these can be extremely volatile."]="小心，$p！这些沼气室可能极不稳定."
G["Careful, $p! You do not want to hurt your new king..."]="当心，$p！别把你的新国王打伤了……"
G["Careful, $r.\n\nSchnottz is in a foul mood after the failed ritual incident."]="小心点儿，$r。\n\n仪式失败以后，司克诺兹的脾气一直非常糟糕。"
G["Careful, don't get burned!"]="小心，不要被烧着了！"
G["Careful, girl. I've heard talk of that cursed blade saving us before. Look around you and see what has been born of Frostmourne."]="小心，女孩。我听说这把被诅咒的剑救过我们。注意周围，看看霜之哀伤都创造了些什么。"
G["Careful, tauren, your words could be construed as treason."]="小心点儿，牛头人，你的话可以会成为背叛的证据。"
G["Careful, you don't want to end up like the last $r that used that machine."]="Cuidado, no querrás terminar como $gel:la; $r que utilizó la máquina."
G["Careful. CAREFUL! Did I feel a shudder? You're going to knock that tower down, oaf!"]="小心。小心！我已经感到颤动了！你差一点就要把那座塔撞塌了，呆子！"
G["Careful. Get stuck in that and it will drain your life to power itself."]="多加小心。要是你被困住了，它就会汲取你的生命，来为自己赋能。"
G["Carefully Collecting"]="小心收集"
G["Carefully now, we don't need any more mista-"]="小心点，我们不能再犯任何错——"
G["Carlin, do you have the extended Annals of Darrowshire?"]="卡林，你有达隆郡全史吗？"
G["Carnage is coming!  Remember, no matter what you do, do NOT leave the battle ring or I will disqualify you and your group."]="卡纳基来啦！记住，在任何情况下，都不能离开比武场，否则就取消你们的参赛资格。"
G["Carnage!  May I spill blood in His name!"]="杀啊！我要以他的名义奋勇作战！"
G["Carpenter, sir."]="木匠，长官。"
G["Carpenter."]="木匠。"
G["Carpet bomb the platform! Send in the Amberwing!"]="对平台进行地毯式轰炸！派遣琥珀之翼！"
G["Carpet bombing is for me. I'm ready to fly!"]="让我去执行地毯式轰炸吧，我已经做好起飞准备了！"
G["Carpet bombing refers to dropping a very large number of bombs on an area, essentially carpetting the region with bombs.\n\nBombers often use several light bombs on a region and then use heavy bombs to clean up whatever might still be standing."]="地毯式轰炸是指在一个地区空投大量的炸弹，就像用炸弹在那个区域铺上一层地毯那样。\n\n投弹者一般在一个区域投放多枚轻型?弹，然后用重磅炸弹来清扫剩余的目标。"
G["Carrier has arrived."]="轰炸机已抵达。"
G["Carrion Bird"]="腐食鸟"
G["Carrot appeared!"]="出现了一个胡萝卜！"
G["Carrot grow right in front of us!"]="胡萝卜就种在我们的前面！"
G["Carrot was turnip! Run!"]="这个胡萝卜其实是芜菁！快跑！"
G["Carrot? For US?!?!"]="胡萝卜？给我们的？！？！"
G["Carrots every day for a year if you stop!"]="如果你停下来，那我就每天喂你吃胡萝卜！"
G["Carrots never bad!"]="胡萝卜都是好东西！"
G["Carrots this big just ain't practical."]="这么大个的胡萝卜显得真不实际。"
G["Carry on the fight!"]="坚持战斗！"
G["Carry on!\n\nThe attack will commence once two defenses are constructed."]="继续建造！\n\n一旦两座防御工事完成，进攻就将开始。"
G["Carry on! Victory at all costs!"]="坚持！不惜一切代价取得胜利！"
G["Carry the sword back to Dalaran through that portal, $n. You have done what many quel'dorei have dreamt of for years. Quel'Delar has been restored at last."]="$n，带着剑穿过那道传送门返回达拉然。你完成了众多奎尔多雷人许多年来梦寐以求的伟业。终于夺回了奎尔德拉。"
G["Cart!"]="我的车！"
G["Carving power into living flesh demands unwavering dedication, $C. You lack such resolve."]="Tallar poder en carne viva exige una dedicación inquebrantable, $C. Careces de tal resolución."
G["Cast another spell on me that uses the exact same implicit target but has a different effect -- like death touch."]="Lánzame otro hechizo que utilice exactamente el mismo objetivo implícito, pero tenga un efecto diferente – como el toque de la muerte."
G["Cast down the enemies of the Burning Legion, rain down destruction upon those who would oppose us!"]="消灭燃烧军团的敌人，毁灭那些和我们作对的蠢货！"
G["Cast down the oil!"]="把油倒下去！"
G["Cast faster!"]="快点施法！"
G["Cast off your lives of war and drudgery, be reborn in elements and claim your rightful place in this new world!"]="抛弃战斗和苦役的生活，在元素中重生，在新世界中取得你的一席之地吧！"
G["Cast out your corrupt thoughts."]="抛弃一切堕落的杂念。"
G["Cast the frost trap."]="施放冰霜陷阱。"
G["Cast with string ID in spell..."]="Lanzar con string ID en hechizo..."
G["Cast with string ID on Action..."]="Lanzar con string ID en acción..."
G["Casting kill credit at $n."]="Lanzando un crédito de muerte a $n."
G["Casting kill credit on $n"]="Lanzando kill credit sobre $n"
G["Cat"]="豹"
G["Catch Impsy in the sack!"]="把伊普斯装进袋子里！"
G["Catch!"]="接到了！"
G["Caught like a fish out of water!"]="如同落网之鱼！"
G["Caught one! I'll see if any of the guards are hungry. Come on Fang!"]="抓住一个！不知道有没有守卫快要饿扁了。来吧，鱼儿！"
G["Caught three chickens for lunch. Bet you couldn't catch any."]="抓三只小鸡来当午饭。不过我赌你连毛都碰不到。"
G["Caught unaware? How?"]="在毫无觉察的情况下碰到的？怎么会？"
G["Caught you in the nick of time, $n!"]="在这里遇到你真是恰逢其时啊，$n！"
G["Cause I'm just going to watch and laugh as they toss you in."]="如果他们还活着的话，肯定会将你扔进雷区。到时候我只会在一旁偷笑。"
G["Cavalry, let's roll out!"]="骑兵们，让我们杀出去吧！"
G["Cave is too filthy! Put filth in filth piles marked with flag."]="洞里太脏了！把污物放在标有旗子的污物堆上吧。"
G["Cavern Burrower alerted nearby Shale Stalkers to your presence with |cFFF00000|Hspell:140600|h[Sonic Call]|h|r!"]="洞穴钻地者用|cFFF00000|Hspell:140600|h[声波警告]|h|r向附近的页岩追猎者警告了你的到来！"
G["Cavern Burrower begins to call nearby Shale Stalkers to aid it."]="洞穴钻地者开始召唤附近的页岩追猎者来协助作战。"
G["Caw!"]="嘎！"
G["Cayden's got an axe with your name on it!"]="凯登弄到了一把刻着你的名字的斧头！"
G["Caza'rez was not as lucky as I was, $n. He rests with the spirits now."]="卡萨雷兹没有我这么走运，$n。他已经和幽灵为伴了。"
G["Cease fire, men! Wait out the shield."]="停火，伙计们！等护盾消失！"
G["Cease your crying! STOP!"]="不要再哭了！停下！"
G["Cel's got what you need, friend."]="朋友，我这里有你需要的东西。"
G["Celebras, I lost my Scepter..."]="塞雷布拉斯，我丢了我的节杖……"
G["Celebrate Brewfest with orcs that know what a good drink really is!  Check out Drohn's Distillery at Brewfest!"]="同知道什么是真正美酒的兽人一起庆祝美酒节吧！来美酒节尝尝德罗恩的佳酿！"
G["Celebrate the life you are given on this earth."]="珍惜让你来到这尘世的生命。"
G["Celoenus is our resident expert on the summoning of demons. He resides in the Falconwing Square Inn, no doubt on the second floor."]="塞罗努斯是召唤恶魔的专家。他居住在鹰翼广场旅店，就在二楼。"
G["Cemetery"]="墓地"
G["Cenarion Circle."]="塞纳里奥议会。"
G["Cenarius fights at my side. Illidan sits atop his throne in the Outland - brooding. I am afraid that the loss to Arthas proved to be his breaking point. Madness has embraced him, Remulos. He replays the events in his mind a thousand times per day, but in his mind, he is the victor and Arthas is utterly defeated. He is too far gone, old friend. I fear that the time may soon come that our bond is tested and it will not be as it was at the Well in Zin-Azshari."]="Cenariuslucha en mi bando. Illidan permanece en lo alto de su trono en Terrallende, cavilando. Me temo que la derrota ante Arthas resultó ser la gota que colmó el vaso. Ha caído en la locura, Remulos. Reproduce los acontecimientos en su cabeza mil veces al día, pero en su cabeza, él es el vencedor y Arthas está al borde de la derrota. Su estado es preocupante, $gamigo mío:amiga mía;. Me temo que llegará el momento en el que se ponga a prueba nuestro vínculo y no será como en el Pozo de Zin-Azshari."
G["Cenarius has fallen!"]="塞纳留斯死了！"
G["Cenarius!  Excellent!  With the portal active, we can move our forces to the frontlines unfettered."]="塞纳留斯！太棒了！传送门一旦激活，我们就能畅通无阻地把军队送往前线。"
G["Center cannon, ready."]="中央炮台，准备。"
G["Central ring.  You go!"]="中部区域，南侧。去吧！"
G["Centrifugate..."]="离心分离……"
G["Centuries ago, this land was still part of the wilds. Reaching the coast was a perilous journey, and many pandaren were lost to the beasts which roam Krasarang, nest of the great crane.\n\nThat is, until the famous hunter Zhu Longbrow came along. Tired of the needless loss of life, Zhu, along with his wife Rin and their son Po - both formidable hunters in their own right - carved out and settled a corner of the wilds.\n\nZhu did not want to settle the wilds entirely, though many begged him to do so. In his wisdom, he understood that they, too, served a purpose: protecting the great crane.\n\nThus Zhu Province was born, and Zhu's Watch to protect it."]="几个世纪以前，这片土地还是荒野。前往海岸是危险之旅，在神鹤之巢卡桑琅附近有野兽出没，许多熊猫人都因此下落不明。\n\n这种情况一直持续着，直到有一天，大名鼎鼎的猎手朱·长眉来到了这里。厌倦了生活的无谓得失，朱带着妻子林和儿子波——他的妻儿也都是强大的猎手，历尽艰辛，在这片荒野的一隅安居下来。\n\n朱不想彻底定居荒野，尽管许多人求他这么做。他的智慧让他明白，他们同样肩负着另一项使命——保护神鹤。\n\n于是就有了朱家界，以及用作守备之用的朱家堡。"
G["Cerellean! You made it!"]="塞瑞利恩！你还活着！"
G["Certainly I'm allowed to have SOME secrets. Wouldn't you agree, $n?\n\nI arrived shortly after the mists collapsed - I was able to fly here after my Ravenholdt colleagues learned of a naval battle off of these shores.\n\nThis land has been hidden for ten thousand years. I've only just begun to plumb its depths!"]="我当然可以有一些秘密。你不同意吗，$n？\n\n迷雾散去后不久，我就到达了……在我的同事拉文霍德了解了一次远离海岸的海战后，我可以飞到这里。\n\n这里已经被隐藏了一万年。我才刚刚开始探索之旅！"
G["Certainly not!\n\nI mean, I do have my entire fortune at risk here... and honestly, what good would a public crisis do anyone?"]="当然不是！\n\n我的意思是说，我确实把全部家当都押在了这儿……可老实说，一场公共危机对大家都没好处吧？"
G["Certainly there's an easier way - oh. Ah! There we go!"]="肯定有更简单的办法——噢。哈！好了！"
G["Certainly!"]="当然！"
G["Certainly, $g sir:miss;. We were once servants of the house Barov: What is now known as the Scholomance.\n\nI was the head maid and Lucien was Master Barov's butler.\n\nWe had worked for the Barovs for decades, until...\n\n<Eva weeps.>"]="当然，$g先生:小姐;。我们曾是巴罗夫家里的仆人：现在那里被称作通灵学院。\n\n我那时是女仆的领班而卢森是主人巴罗夫的男管家。\n\n我们为巴罗夫家族工作了数十年，直到……\n\n<艾瓦哭了。>"
G["Certainly, $n.\n\nAdventurers that the Dawn views as exalted must submit a combined total of 12 insignias to access superior items. To access items of even greater power, they would be required to submit a total of 54 insignias.\n\nThose exalted in the eyes of the Dawn receive the greatest discounts."]="Por supuesto, $n.\n\nLos aventureros que el Alba cataloga de exaltados deben entregar un total de 12 insignias para acceder a objetos excelentes. Para tener acceso a objetos de un poder mayor, tendrán que entregar un total de 54 insignias.\n\nAquellos que el Alba tiene por exaltados se benefician de mayores descuentos."
G["Certainly, $n.\n\nAdventurers that the Dawn views as friendly must submit a combined total of 60 insignias to access superior items. To access items of even greater power, they would be required to submit a total of 220 insignias.\n\nI must admit, the price is quite high for adventurers not favored by the Dawn."]="Por supuesto, $n.\n\nLos aventureros que el Alba cataloga de amistosos deben entregar un total de 60 insignias para acceder a objetos excelentes. Para tener acceso a objetos de un poder mayor, tendrán que entregar un total de 220 insignias.\n\nDebo admitir que el precio es bastante alto para aquellos que cuentan con el favor del Alba."
G["Certainly, $n.\n\nAdventurers that the Dawn views as honored must submit a combined total of 40 insignias to access superior items. To access items of even greater power, they would be required to submit a total of 150 insignias.\n\nI must admit, the price is high even for those honored amongst the Dawn."]="Por supuesto, $n.\n\nLos aventureros que el Alba cataloga de honorables deben entregar un total de 40 insignias para acceder a objetos excelentes. Para tener acceso a objetos de un poder mayor, tendrán que entregar un total de 150 insignias.\n\nDebo admitir que el precio es alto incluso para aquellos que el Alba considera honorables."
G["Certainly, $n.\n\nAdventurers that the Dawn views as revered must submit a combined total of 14 insignias to access superior items. To access items of even greater power, they would be required to submit a total of 90 insignias.\n\nThose that are revered by the Dawn will find the cost of superior items quite reasonable! The cost for the more powerful items is still high."]="Por supuesto, $n.\n\nLos aventureros que el Alba cataloga de venerados deben entregar un total de 14 insignias para acceder a objetos excelentes. Para tener acceso a objetos de un poder mayor, tendrán que entregar un total de 90 insignias.\n\nAquellos que el Alba considere venerados encontrarán este precio bastante razonable.\n El precio de los objetos todavía más poderosos es aún mayor."
G["Certainly, $n. You only need to tell me what reputation you would like to know about."]="当然，$n。你只需要先告诉我你想知道关于哪个声望等级的信息。"
G["Certainly, strength can benefit one's allies."]="当然，力量也能帮助盟友。"
G["Certainly."]="当然。"
G["Certainly.  I don't make it out to Light's Hope very often anymore, but when you arrive, tell Max Tyrosus that I sent you."]="没问题。虽然我现在不常去圣光之愿礼拜堂了，但你们到那儿之后，可以告诉玛克斯·泰罗索斯是我派你们去的。"
G["Certainly. If you brought me some meat - which you have not - then I would be able to grill it for you."]="当然了。如果你给我带些肉回来——尽管你现在没有——我会帮你烤的。"
G["Certainly. Kill a few virmen, earn a few bushels of hops. I'll have Mung-Mung send them to Halfhill."]="当然愿意了。你去杀几个兔妖，就挣到一些啤酒花。我会叫蒙蒙把啤酒花送去半山的。"
G["Ch-ch-Cho'gall gives us...orbs...Twilight's Hammer clan makes us strong..."]="古……古加尔给我们……魔球……暮光之锤部族让我们强大……"
G["Chabal, I was hunting Zanzil and I lost track of what I was doing.  Can remind me where to go next?"]="查巴尔，我光顾着追踪赞吉尔，忘了自己该干的事儿了。你能提醒我接下来要去哪儿吗？"
G["Challenge accepted!"]="我接受你的挑战！"
G["Challenge accepted! Hit for hit, drink for drink."]="接受挑战！以拳还拳，以酒还酒。"
G["Challenge and defeat another Bloodpetal in one-on-one combat."]="在一对一的战斗中挑战并击败另一个血瓣花。"
G["Challenge the Pandriarch."]="挑战族长。"
G["Challenge to a tasters' duel."]="向一名品酒师发起挑战。"
G["Challenger defeated. Uploading report for analysis and verbal harassment."]="击败挑战者。正在上传报告以供分析及语言骚扰。"
G["Challenger is down!"]="挑战者输了！"
G["Challenging me was a mistake."]="挑战我真是个错误。"
G["Champion $n fights alongside us! We cannot lose!"]="勇士$n与我们并肩作战！我们将战无不胜！"
G["Champion $n!"]="勇士$n！"
G["Champion $n, it is good to see you again.\n\nHave you returned to Valhalas to assist a friend with their challenges?"]="$gCampeón:Campeona; $n, me alegro de volver a verte,\n\n¿Has regresado a Valhalas para ayudar a algún amigo en sus desafíos?"
G["Champion Lightrend, make me proud!"]="勇士莱伦德·光痕，让我为你而骄傲吧！"
G["Champion units are entering the battle!"]="勇士部队正开入战斗！"
G["Champion! Again you are at the forefront of a Horde triumph. And once more I am in your debt."]="勇士！你又冲在了为部落夺取胜利的最前线。我又欠你一份人情。"
G["Champion! Behold the fruits of your labors!"]="勇士！看看你的劳动成果吧！"
G["Champion! Our campaign is reaching a climax: We are at the very threshold of the Thunder King's palace. It is time to knock down his front door."]="勇士！战局已经处于白热化状态：我们推进到了雷电之王的宫殿门口。现在该去打破他的前门了。"
G["Champion! Without your pioneering efforts on Pandaria, this foothold wouldn't have been possible."]="勇士！没有你对潘达利亚的开拓，这座要塞是不可能建成的。"
G["Champion, I know that our people are at war, but if you blindly trust this black dragon in the pursuit of power, are you any better than your warchief? Please - just be careful."]="勇士，我知道我们正在交战，可如果你盲目信任这头追逐力量的黑龙，那你又能比你的酋长强多少呢？请你三思。"
G["Champion, I need time to... \"digest\" what I have learned.  But soon, we will take action."]="Necesito... tiempo para \"digerir\" lo que he presenciado. Pero pronto pasaremos a la acción."
G["Champion, I need you to lead a ground assault and shatter that barrier from within!"]="勇士，你要率领一支突击小队，从内部瓦解这道屏障！"
G["Champion, I need you to lead a ground assault and take down that barrier from within!"]="勇士，我要你带领一支突击小队，从内部瓦解这个屏障！"
G["Champion, are you all right?"]="勇士，你还好吧？"
G["Champion, hear me out: We strike the shipyard at night, using this magnificent beast you have tamed."]="勇士，听我说：我们将在夜里，利用你驯服的这头神奇的野兽袭击船坞。"
G["Champion, may I have a word with you? In private... ?"]="这位勇士，我能和你…… 私下谈谈吗？"
G["Champion, please don't go - we need to talk!"]="勇士，请别走——我们谈谈！"
G["Champion, predict your foe's movements, and always stay a step ahead. Victory is within you!"]="勇士，你要预判敌人的动作，并始终抢先一步。胜利就在你手中！"
G["Champion, return now to the Isle of the Thunder King. I will meet you at the forge, where together we will create an instrument of legendary power."]="勇士，我们现在快回雷神岛去吧。我在熔炉那里等你，我们将共同制作一件传奇武器。"
G["Champion, this cease-fire may not last, but remember what you have seen today."]="勇士，这次停战也许持续不了多久，但请记住这一切。"
G["Champion, turn your foe's strength and confidence against him. I believe in you."]="勇士，你应该利用敌人的力量和自信来对付他。我相信你。"
G["Champion, with me. We must press forward while your comrades cover the rear."]="勇士，跟我来。我们得继续前进，让你的同伴殿后。"
G["Champion, without your help I would've died in that swamp. I owe you my very life."]="勇士，要不是你，我已经死在沼泽里了。我欠你一条命。"
G["Champion, you and Anduin thwarted the Warchief today and won the Alliance a critical victory."]="勇士，今天你和安度因挫败了部落酋长，为联盟赢得了关键的胜利。"
G["Champion, you have been here for many weeks, and know this land well. Come with me."]="勇士，你已经来了很久，很了解这里。跟我来。"
G["Champion, you have brought glory to the Horde. Your unshakable will has secured our position here. Now, the true work begins."]="勇士，部落以你为荣。你坚定的意志是我们立足的关键。现在，真正的任务即将开始。"
G["Champion, you have earned the honor. Signal our fleet."]="勇士，这份殊荣该归你。给舰队发信号吧。"
G["Champion, you have exceeded my expectations. Our position on the isle is secured, thanks to your courage and your will. Now, the true work begins."]="勇士，你的成就已经超出了我的预期。你所表现出的勇气与决心巩固了我们的根基。现在，真正的工作开始了。"
G["Champion, you have your reward. But there is one final dragon we need to slay."]="勇士，请收下这件奖励。但我们还要对付最后一条龙。"
G["Champion, you know this land better than anyone. You're with me. Let's go find Troteman."]="勇士，你对这片土地最为了解。跟我来，我们去找托德曼。"
G["Champion... I would think twice before putting that thing on your head."]="勇士……如果我是你，一定会三思而行。"
G["Champion... you've done it..."]="勇士……你成功了……"
G["Champions on the tournament grounds speak highly of this $c.  Today we present, $n."]="Los campeones en las pistas del torneo hablan maravillas de $geste:esta; $c. Hoy presentamos a $n."
G["Champions! I cannot hold her back any longer."]="勇士们！我就要挡不住她了。"
G["Champions! My children, blessed with my power, shall aid you in your fight!"]="勇士们！我将派出得到我祝福的孩子，帮助你们进行战斗！"
G["Champions! My shield grows weak!"]="勇士们！我的护盾正在减弱！"
G["Champions' Hall"]="勇士大厅"
G["Champions, I need ya."]="勇士，我需要你。"
G["Champions, come with me. It's time to settle grievances with our... \"Warchief.\""]="Campeones, conmigo. Llegó la hora de saldar cuentas con nuestro… \"Jefe de Guerra\"."
G["Champions, hold on while I fly you back to Khardros' Anvil!"]="勇士们，抓紧，我们要飞回卡德罗斯的铁砧了！"
G["Champions, hold on while I fly you back to the Scarred Terrace!"]="勇士们，抓紧，我们要飞回焰痕平台了！"
G["Champions, meet me at the Town Hall at once. We must take the fight to Mal'Ganis."]="立即与我在市政厅会合，勇士。我们必须直接挑战玛尔加尼斯。"
G["Champions, you're alive! Not only have you defeated every challenge of the Trial of the Crusader, but also thwarted Arthas' plans! Your skill and cunning will prove to be a powerful weapon against the Scourge. Well done! Allow one of the Crusade's mages to transport you to the surface!"]="勇士们，你们还活着！你们不仅克服了十字军试炼的每一场挑战，还直接阻挠了阿尔萨斯的计划！你们的技巧和机智在对抗天灾军团的战斗中一定能发挥极为强大的作用。干得好！请让我的一名法师将你们传送回地面吧！"
G["Champions, you've defeated the Trial of the Grand Crusader! Only the most battle tested adventurers could ever hope to complete this Trial. I present to you this tribute chest as a well deserved reward! May the contents serve you well in our upcoming campaign against Arthas in the heart of Icecrown Citadel!"]="勇士们，你们已经完成了大十字军的试炼！只有真正身经百战的冒险者才有可能完成这个试炼。我将这个嘉奖箱交给你们。这是你们应得的奖励！愿箱中的宝物在未来的战斗中能够协助你们直捣冰冠堡垒的核心，战胜阿尔萨斯！"
G["Change is coming to Ihgaluk. The saurok are turning on one another. Some think that there are intruders among us."]="伊瓜鲁克正在改变。蜥蜴人们正在互相争斗。有人认为我们中间出现了入侵者。"
G["Change is inevitable, even for those as stubborn as Doshu."]="改变是难以避免的，即便是对于像杜术这样的老顽固来说也是一样。"
G["Changed your mind? I'll wait for you at the entrance to Ruins Rise when you're ready."]="¿Has cambiado de idea? Te esperaré en la entrada al Alto de las Ruinas cuando estés $gpreparado:preparada;."
G["Channel your energies into the Altar!"]="把你的能量引导到祭坛里！"
G["Chaos beckons."]="混沌已降临。"
G["Chaos is order unrecognized by a lesser mind!"]="下等头脑理解不了混沌的秩序！"
G["Chaos will reign."]="混乱将统治一切。"
G["Chaos!"]="混乱！"
G["Chaos..."]="混乱……"
G["Chaotic energy will destroy you."]="混乱之力将毁灭你。"
G["Chaotic magic always has the potential for unexpected results."]="混乱魔法总是有可能导致出人意料的后果。"
G["Chapter on Arcane Crystals and Arcanite."]="关于奥术水晶和奥金的章节。"
G["Chapter on Enchanted Scarlet Thread."]="关于魔化红线的章节。"
G["Chapter on Frayed Abomination Stitchings."]="关于磨损的憎恶缝合线的章节。"
G["Chapter on Frostwhisper's Embalming Fluid."]="关于莱斯·霜语的防腐液的章节。"
G["Chapter on Skin of Shadow."]="关于暗影之皮的章节。"
G["Charge!"]="冲锋！"
G["Charge!!!"]="冲锋！！！"
G["Charge!!! Run 'em through!"]="冲啊！！！杀死他们！"
G["Charges are set. Might want to get clear!"]="炸药已经准备好了。足够的力量能摆平一切！"
G["Charog likes to spend his coin at the Busted Drum. Let's go pay him a visit, $n."]="那家伙喜欢在旅店里花天酒地，让我们去拜访他一下，$n。"
G["Chart a course east with all possible speed. We'll rendezvous with the main fleet."]="设定航路向东，全速前进，与主力舰队汇合。"
G["Chase me if you dare! I run without a care!"]="如果你敢的话就来追我吧！我会毫不犹豫地奔跑的！"
G["Chase the hatchlings! Chase the hatchlings! So fast!"]="追赶幼体！追赶幼体！快跑！"
G["Cheap beer!  Get your cheap beer right here!"]="便宜的啤酒！到这儿来买啊，物超所值！"
G["Check $g his:her; pockets!"]="¡Regístrale los bolsillos!"
G["Check around Old Town at the Barracks or the Pig and Whistle Tavern. If you go to the tavern, be sure to sample some of the fine brews. Puts the dwarven ales to shame, I tell ya."]="去兵营或者猪和哨声旅店逛逛吧。如果你去旅店的话，别忘了尝尝那里的好酒，那些酒绝对能让矮人的酒相形见拙。"
G["Check out Dawnstrider Enchanters on the middle rise then.  Teg will be more than happy to help you in whatever way he can."]="到中部高地的附魔店去看看吧。泰戈会很乐意帮助你的。"
G["Check out all the cool silk!"]="看看这些上好的丝绸！"
G["Check out the 3-B entertainment! Brewfest's Barleybrew Brewmasters!"]="来3-B展位看看！美酒节的麦酒！"
G["Check out the comedy stylings of Perry Gatner in just a few minutes!"]="很快就可以看到派瑞·加奈尔的喜剧表演了！"
G["Check out the modified leg articulation!  Perfect for off-roading!"]="检测修正的腿部关节！完美适应各种路况！"
G["Check that cell, $n. If someone is alive in there, we need to get them out."]="检查那间牢房，$n。如果那里还有人活着，我们就得把他们救出来。"
G["Check the bulletin board if you're looking for work, $r."]="$r，如果你在找活干的话，去看下公告板吧。"
G["Check this out guys!  I can rock like you guys!"]="瞧，伙计们！我也能摇滚起来！"
G["Check this out, $r! Ya know what $G ya:yer sweetheart; be needin'? One of these flowers. Lilacs, right outta the mystical forest of Terokkar! Rare! So rare! Ya don't see any of 'em around me, do ya? A pretty flower for a pretty lady, right? Right?"]="看看这个，$r！你知道你的爱人需要些什么吗？一朵这样的花，一朵只生长在神秘的泰罗卡森林的丁香花。稀有！如此稀有！你在别处可找不到这样的花？名花配美人，不是吗？难·道·不·是·吗？"
G["Check this place out!"]="瞧瞧这个地方！"
G["Check those crystals over there!"]="检查那里的水晶簇！"
G["Check your tracks!"]="检查一下你们的脚印！"
G["Check!"]="将！"
G["Checking out the datas, hold on a second will ya."]="正在检查数据，请稍等，好吗？"
G["Checkmate."]="将军。"
G["Chee Chee got big problem. Big, big problems."]="吱吱有大麻烦了。很大、很大的麻烦。"
G["Chee Chee got big problem. Big, big problems. Buddy help Chee Chee?"]="吱吱遇到大麻烦了。很大、很大的麻烦。你能帮帮吱吱吗，哥们？"
G["Chee Chee is a hozen sheep-herder who works on the terrace to the west."]="吱吱是位猢狲牧羊人，就在西边的梯田上工作。"
G["Chee Chee is only hozen with own farm!\n\n<Chee Chee thumps his chest proudly.>\n\nYou, friend, come visit me at my farm sometime, okay?"]="¡Chee Chee es el úniko hozen con granja propia!\n\n<Chee Chee se golpea el pecho con orgullo.>\n\nTú, $gamigo:amiga;, viene a visitarme a mi granja alguna vez, ¿vale?"
G["Chee Chee is your acquaintance."]="你和吱吱成了熟人。"
G["Chee Chee is your best friend. Perhaps you could speak to him and see if he'd help out on the farm."]="你和吱吱已经成了挚友。也许你可以和他聊聊，看他是否愿意为农场帮帮忙。"
G["Chee Chee is your buddy."]="吱吱是你的哥们了。"
G["Chee Chee is your friend."]="吱吱是你的朋友了。"
G["Chee Chee is your good friend."]="你和吱吱已经成了好友。"
G["Chee Chee like to look at sky. So pretty... so blue..."]="吱吱喜欢看天空，那么美……那么蓝……"
G["Chee Chee love to eat Valley Stir Fry. You find any, you bring to me!"]="吱吱爱吃谷地小炒。你要是找到了，就带给我！"
G["Chee Chee loves gifts! Thank you!"]="吱吱喜欢礼物！谢谢你！"
G["Chee Chee raise only sheep in the fields!\n\nAnyone want sheep, they come to Chee Chee."]="吱吱的农场只有羊！\n\n谁想要羊，就来找吱吱。"
G["Chee Chee work hard for farm. Buddy understand, right?"]="吱吱为农场付出很多，你能明白的，对吗哥们？"
G["Chee Chee work hard for farm. Now bad monkeys come take away!"]="吱吱为农场付出很多，现在被坏猴子夺走了！"
G["Chee Chee's got his own farm to the northwest, just up the mountain some.\n\nThat poor fella's been plagued by one ill turn after another."]="吱吱的农场在西北边，就在山上不远处。\n\n那个可怜的家伙总是被疾病缠身。"
G["Chee Chee's sheep sheep are so scared... bad monkeys on hill! Bad monkey!"]="吱吱的羊羊好怕怕……山里的坏猴子！坏猴子！"
G["Cheeky little bugger! Didn't think he had it in him!"]="这个小骗子！真没想到他敢这么做！"
G["Cheers!"]="干杯！"
G["Cheese it! It's the fuzz!"]="试试这个！这个不错！"
G["Cheese, eh? Is it perhaps... aged cheese?"]="奶酪，嗯？那会不会是一块……陈年的奶酪了？"
G["Chef, could you grill this plainshawk leg for me?"]="大厨，你能帮我烤一下这个平原鹰腿吗？"
G["Chef... if I brought you a plainshawk leg, could you grill it for me?"]="大厨……如果我带一个平原鹰腿给你，你能帮我烤一下吗？"
G["Chelon has been engaged by $n the $r $c."]="蛰龙被$r$c$n吸引了。"
G["Chelsea, baby, please drink this. It'll make you feel better."]="切尔西，孩子，请喝下这个。这会让你好受些。"
G["Chelsea, baby, sit up! I've got it! This is gonna cure you!"]="切尔希，孩子，快起来！我得到它了！它一定能治愈你！"
G["Chelsea, baby, that's crazy talk! You're delirious! Just hold on a while longer..."]="切尔西，孩子，你在说胡话！你一定是神志不清了！再坚持一下……"
G["Chen! It's a giant dang ol' hozen!"]="陈！那是只该死的大猢狲！"
G["Chen, I think I know why you like it here so much."]="陈叔，我知道你为什么喜欢这儿了。"
G["Cherry pie is my favoritist food in all of Azeroth."]="樱桃馅饼是我在整个艾泽拉斯最喜欢的食物。"
G["Chezin lay dead with grievous wounds both physical and magical."]="切森倒地死去，身上遍布着物理和魔法攻击造成的伤口。"
G["Chi-Ji watches over the Temple of the Red Crane to the south.\n\nShe is trying to regain order after the sha eruption created chaos across the land.\n\nIf you wish to help her, travel to the Cradle of Chi-Ji in the Krasarang Wilds."]="赤精看守南方的朱鹤寺。\n\n在煞魔喷发造成地区混乱之后，赤精试图重新获得主宰权。\n\n如果你想帮助他，就去卡桑琅丛林中的赤精栖木。"
G["Chicken! So delicious!"]="鸡！好吃！"
G["Chicks dig scars, so you can see why I'm such a hit with the ladies."]="小鸡就喜欢啄伤疤，所以你知道为啥我这么受女士们欢迎了吧。"
G["Chief Ashtotem, I have misplaced the token that you gave me."]="灰烬图腾酋长，我弄丢了你给我的徽章。"
G["Chief Bloodhoof, this may sound like an odd request... but I have a young ward who is quite shy.  You are a hero to him, and he asked me to get your hoofprint."]="血蹄酋长，也许这请求听起来有些奇怪……但是我正在照顾一个非常害羞的孩子。对他来说，你就是个英雄，是他请求我来拿到你的蹄印。"
G["Chief Gukgut say you gotta go!"]="酋长咕克嘎克说你该上路了！"
G["Chief Spirithorn, I beseech you to send aid to Westreach Summit now, before it is too late."]="魂角酋长，我恳求你立刻向西岸峰派出援军，否则一切都将无法挽回。"
G["Chief Yip-Yip is about to charge forward! Throw a melon now!"]="酋长伊普伊普要发起冲锋了！快扔甜瓜！"
G["Chief say ravage, so hozen ravage!"]="酋长下令掠夺，猢狲们遵命！"
G["Chief, I've somehow misplaced my X-52 Rocket Helmet!!!!"]="长官，我不知道怎么回事，把我的X-52火箭头盔给弄丢了！"
G["Chieftain Spirithorn must send help to Freewind Post soon."]="魂角酋长必须立刻向乱风岗派出援军。"
G["Children if you would please follow me, we will now be going to see the keep where King Varian Wrynn himself sits on his throne."]="孩子们，跟上，我们马上就能看到瓦里安·乌瑞恩国王陛下和他的王座了。"
G["Children of Madness - I release you upon this world!"]="疯狂的种子——我将你释放到这个世界！"
G["Children of Nozdormu, hear me!  The folds of time are innumerable, and we are many!  You will not, can not, defeat us all!"]="诺兹多姆的子嗣们，听我说！时间的层面无穷无尽，我们的兵力无法计数！你无法、也不可能击败我们所有人！"
G["Children of Pandaria. The mists have fallen. For good or for ill, our land is open to all."]="潘达利亚的子民们，迷雾已经散去。无论如何，这片土地都将对外开放。"
G["Children of iron, lend me your blades!"]="钢铁之子，助我一臂之力吧！"
G["Children of the grave, heed my call!"]="墓穴的孩子们，响应我的召唤吧！"
G["Children of the watery depths, lay waste to those who foul your realm!"]="流水深渊之子，清除玷污了你们家园的恶人吧！"
G["Children's Week is not yet over... may I have another Blood Elf Orphan Whistle?"]="儿童周还没有结束……我能得到另一个血精灵孤儿哨吗？"
G["Children's Week is not yet over... may I have another Draenei Orphan Whistle?"]="儿童周还没有结束……我能得到另一个德莱尼孤儿哨吗？"
G["Children's Week is not yet over... may I have another Orphan Whistle?"]="看护者之周还没有结束……我能再拿一个孤儿哨吗？"
G["Children, $n has brought a gift for you! Why don't you come take a look?"]="孩子们，$n给你们带来了一件礼物！来看看吧！"
G["Children, $n has brought a surprise for you! Come and take a look at your gift!"]="孩子们，$n给你们带来了惊喜！快过来看看你们的礼物是什么！"
G["Children, assist me!"]="孩子们，帮帮我！"
G["Children, come to me!"]="孩子们，来帮助我！"
G["Children, please behave yourselves! No one will want to adopt you if you keep acting like that!"]="孩子们，请注意你们的行为！如果再这样胡闹，永远也不会有人收养你们的！"
G["Chilled Serpent Mucus!"]="冰冷的毒蛇粘液！"
G["Chilly tickles!"]="冰凉乐趣！"
G["Chimaera"]="奇美拉"
G["Chin did not earn his title lightly. There was a fierce championship of noodle makers gathered from all four corners of the village.\n\nIt was here they battled with great ferocity over barrels of boiling water to forge only the finest noodles ever made within a days travel.\n\nGlorious I tell you!\n\nOnly Flourfury emerged victorious, crafting a noodle so astounding it shook the very foundation of my taster's bowl."]="秦可不是浪得虚名。曾经有过一场竞争非常激烈的面条大赛，汇集了全村的行家里手。\n\n他们在一桶桶煮沸的面汤前大展身手，只为在一天之内制作出最上乘的面条来。\n\n别提有多精彩啦！\n\n最终他技压群雄，做出来的面条好吃到连我这个美食家都为之震惊。"
G["Cho said you were a \"hooman\". Is that like a hozen?"]="\"Cho dijo que eres un \"umano\". ¿Es como un hozen?"
G["Cho'Rush die! NOW YOU DIE!"]="克鲁什死啦！现在你也去死吧！"
G["Cho'gall beckons and casts |cFF006EFD|Hspell:91303|h[Conversion]|h|r!"]="古加尔开始施展|cFF006EFD|Hspell:91303|h[变节]|h|r！"
G["Cho'gall begins casting Flaming Pillar of Certain Doom!"]="古加尔开始施放末日之烈焰轴心！"
G["Cho'gall once held sway over my mind with the simple utterance of a magic word. He made me do a lot of things that I'm not proud of. I'm going to repay him tenfold, and you're going to help me do it, $n!"]="古加尔曾经用一个魔法咒语控制了我的心神，让我做了许多令我深感羞耻的事情。我要让他付出十倍的代价。而你要帮助我，$n！"
G["Cho'gall will have your heads! ALL OF THEM!"]="古加尔想要你们全部的脑袋！"
G["Cho'gall will rip your heart out of your puny, little body and laugh while he eats it!"]="古加尔会大笑着把你生吞活剥！"
G["Cho'gall will...rip you...to pieces..."]="古加尔会……把你……撕成碎片……"
G["Cho'gall!"]="古加尔！"
G["Cho'gall's keeping himself hidden inside of the Bastion of Twilight. I hope he decides to come out and play."]="古加尔一直藏在暮光堡垒里。真希望他能出来，好好和我们玩一玩。"
G["Cho'guana, teach them a lesson."]="虫蜥，给他们上一课。"
G["Cho... the outsiders... THEY did this... we should never have let them in..."]="周卓……外来者……这都怪他们……真不该让他们进来……"
G["Chocolate-flavored vanilla!"]="巧克力香草！"
G["Choke on your final breath!"]="这是你的最后一口呼吸！"
G["Choke on your suffering!"]="痛苦的窒息吧！"
G["Choke upon the sands of the Kvaldir!"]="窒息于克瓦迪尔之沙！"
G["Choluna and Thisalee have both given me their reports. It's all very clear to me now...\n\n$n, I believe Aviana may soon return to us, but only if we can stop the black dragon Sethria!"]="Tanto Choluna como Thisalee me han informado. Ya lo veo todo claro...\n\n$n, creo que Aviana volverá a nosotros dentro de poco, ¡pero solo si logramos detener a la dragona negra Sethria!"
G["Choluna told me of your vision. Very puzzling. Is our beloved ancient to be reborn? If so, where is she now?\n\nWe need to know more! Please help Thisalee gather more information for us, then we will act."]="楚伦娜告诉了我你所看见的情景。那非常令人困惑。我们珍爱的古树将要重生吗？如果是这样，现在她在哪里？\n\n我们需要得到更多的信息！请帮助希萨莉进一步收集信息，这样我们才能采取行动。"
G["Chomp chomp chomp!"]="咬他！咬他！咬死他！"
G["Chomps, it is your turn to demonstrate your power."]="嚼嚼，该你展示自己的力量了。"
G["Choose a Primary Stat to receive equipment with that stat."]="Elige una estadística principal para recibir equipo con esa estadística."
G["Choose a destination."]="选择目的地。"
G["Choose a pet to fight for you in battle!"]="选择一只宠物，为你战斗！"
G["Choose the challenge most appropriate for your unique talents."]="所以，选择最适合你天赋的挑战吧。"
G["Choose wisely, $n."]="你一定要谨慎选择，$n。"
G["Choose wisely, young one."]="作出明智的选择吧，年轻人。"
G["Choose your champion."]="选择你的勇士。"
G["Choose your next words wisely, Crowley. Deny me and she will serve me in undeath - forever."]="仔细想想再回答我，克罗雷。如果你拒绝我，那么她就将变成我不死的奴仆——直到永远。"
G["Choose your reward!"]="挑选奖励吧！"
G["Choose your words wisely, death knight. You stand amidst the company of the devoted."]="说话小心点，死亡骑士。你身边的人都是圣光虔诚的信徒。"
G["Choosing the path of a mage is to choose a path of great difficulty. Many do not understand us. Our own people struggle to accept our arts."]="选择成为法师就是选择走上一条布满荆棘的险途。许多人都不理解我们。就连我们自己人都在艰难地接受我们的艺术。"
G["Chop chop chop!"]="收集收集收集！"
G["Chop faster!"]="快点砍！"
G["Chopper rentals are free in honor of Children's Week. Just hop onto one and cruise beautiful Westfall!"]="儿童周期间大家可以免费租用摩托车，赶快挑一架到美丽的西部荒野兜风吧！"
G["Chosen of the Elder Crone! You don't realize yet, do you? I'll put an end to you first! You and your friend!"]="¡$gElegido:Elegida; de la bruja anciana! Aún no te das cuenta, ¿verdad? ¡Acabaré contigo primero! ¡Contigo y con tu compinche!"
G["Chromie said that if I don't do this just right, I might wink out of existence.  If I go, then you go!"]="克罗米说如果我不能完成任务，我就会从历史上消失。如果我消失了，那么你也就不存在了！"
G["Chromie, you and I both know what's going to happen in this time stream. We've seen this all before. Can you just skip us ahead to all the real action?"]="克罗米，你和我都知道在这个时间流中会出什么事。我们以前都遇到过这种情形。你能不能略过这些部分，直接进入真正的行动？"
G["Chu'a'lor's been saying good things about you, $n.  If you want, we have a couple of special ogre brews for sale.\n\nThey're really tasty!"]="Chu'a'lor ha estado hablando bien de ti, $n. Si te interesan, tenemos un par de brebajes especiales ogros en venta.\n\n¡Están muy ricos!"
G["Chubis Chubisimo!  Get those things fixed... we haven't got all day!"]="库比斯，库比斯！把那些东西修好……我们时间不多了！"
G["Chubis, after you're done there, make sure that you put another coat of wax on the Wheeler mobile.  I want to take mama out for a spin tonight."]="库比斯，当你完成了那边的工作以后，记得在维勒旅行器上再打一层蜡。今晚我想带维勒老妈出去兜兜风。"
G["Chuck the Bear Cub!"]="抛下熊崽！"
G["Chug and chuck!  Chug and chuck!"]="丢酒杯！"
G["Chugga-chugga, woo-woo!  Happy Hallow's End, $n!"]="恰－恰，喔－喔！万圣节快乐，$n！"
G["Chut will protect us if we are further endangered. He always has."]="要是我们陷入更大的危机，楚一定会挺身而出。他向来如此。"
G["Cianz comes to bless our festival each year, $n. He will not fight in battle but maybe there is something he can do to help us. Ask if there is anything he can do."]="齐延姿每年都来祝福我们的节日，$n。他不会参加战斗，但或许可以帮我们做一些其他事情。问问他是否能帮我们做些事情。"
G["Ciao, babe. Let me know if you'd like to do lunch sometime. We'll work something out now that you've learned some manners."]="再见了，宝贝儿。要是你想要找个时间共进午餐，记得告诉我一声。既然你已经学会了一些礼节，我们会想出办法来的。"
G["Cinderweb Spinners dangle from above!"]="烬网织网蛛爬下来了！"
G["Cinematic will happen here..."]="此处将播放影片……"
G["Circling Valhalas, Sigrid Iceborn approaches to seek her revenge!"]="齐格莉德·冰魂在瓦哈拉斯上空盘旋，她是来复仇的！"
G["Citizens and allies of Stormwind, on this day, history has been made. $n has laid waste to that which had attempted to usurp the rule of the kingdom. Gather round and join me in honoring our heroes."]="暴风城的城民和盟友们，今天，有人创造了历史。$n已经杀死了那个妄图篡夺王权的家伙。都聚过来吧，跟我们一起庆祝英雄的诞生。"
G["Citizens and friends of Gnomeregan!"]="诺莫瑞根的居民和朋友们！"
G["Citizens and guests of Stormwind.  Our city is under attack!  Take up your arms and defend our capital!  If you do not want to answer the call of battle, then grab sandbags and line the streets to prevent flooding!"]="暴风城的市民和客人们。我们的城市正在遭受攻击！拿起武器，保卫我们的首都！如果你不想参加战斗，就用沙包在街道上筑起堤坝，阻挡即将到来的洪水吧！"
G["Citizens of Dalaran! Raise your eyes to the skies and observe!"]="达拉然的公民们！抬起你们的头，仰望天空吧！"
G["Citizens of Ironforge! Begin the evacuation!"]="铁炉堡的市民们！开始撤离！"
G["Citizens of Orgrimmar, as you know, a dangerous cult threatens to tear our city apart. Until this cult has been destroyed, Warchief Garrosh Hellscream, hero of Northrend, champion of the people, decrees that all who wish to enter Orgrimmar must submit to searches and questioning."]="奥格瑞玛的市民们，如你们所知，一个危险的邪教正在图谋分裂我们的城市。诺森德英雄，兽人的勇士，加尔鲁什·地狱咆哮酋长下达命令，在彻底摧毁那个邪教之前，要进入奥格瑞玛的人必须接受搜查和询问。"
G["Citizens of Orgrimmar, rejoice! Deathwing is no more! The Cataclysm is over! A band of valiant heroes lashed out at the Destroyer with deadly precision and overwhelming might, granting the Dragon Aspects the opportunity to sacrifice their powers into one final strike. The last remains of Deathwing now reside here in Orgrimmar to serve as a beacon of hope for the future!"]="奥格瑞玛的居民们，欢呼吧！死亡之翼已经被消灭了！灾难结束了！一群勇敢的英雄们冒死突袭灭世者，为守护巨龙们争取到了对死亡之翼发起致命一击的机会，虽然这也让他们牺牲了所有的力量。现在，死亡之翼的最后一段残骸就被保存在奥格瑞玛，成为了未来希望之光的象征！"
G["Citizens of Stormwind! Begin to evacuate the city!"]="暴风城的市民们！开始撤离城市！"
G["Citizens of Stormwind, as you know, a dangerous cult threatens to tear our city apart. Until this cult has been destroyed, King Wrynn decrees that all who wish to enter Stormwind must submit to searches and questioning."]="暴风城的公民们，就像你们知道的那样，一个危险的邪教正在图谋颠覆我们的城市。乌瑞恩国王下达命令，在彻底摧毁那个邪教之前，要进入暴风城的人必须接受搜查和询问。"
G["Citizens of Stormwind, rejoice! Deathwing is no more! The Cataclysm is over! A band of valiant heroes lashed out at the Destroyer with deadly precision and overwhelming might, granting the Dragon Aspects the opportunity to sacrifice their powers into one final strike. The last remains of Deathwing now reside here in Stormwind to serve as a beacon of hope for the future!"]="暴风城的居民们，欢呼吧！死亡之翼已经被消灭了！灾难结束了！一群勇敢的英雄们冒死突袭灭世者，为守护巨龙们争取到了对死亡之翼发起致命一击的机会，虽然这也让他们牺牲了所有的力量。现在，死亡之翼的最后一段残骸就被保存在暴风城，成为了未来希望之光的象征！"
G["Citizens of Thunder Bluff! Evacuate the city!"]="雷霆崖的市民们！撤离城市！"
G["Citizens of the Alliance, the Lord of Blackrock is slain! Nefarian has been subdued by the combined might of $n and $g his:her; allies!"]="¡Ciudadanos de la Alianza, el Señor de Roca Negra está muerto! ¡Nefarian ha sido vencido gracias a la combinación del poder de $n y sus aliados!"
G["City life changes a druid.  I used a flight path for the first time last week... and it was great."]="城市生活会改变一名德鲁伊。上周我生平第一次使用了公共飞行路线……感觉真是不错啊。"
G["Civilians..."]="平民…"
G["Claim a body, and wreak terrible vengeance!"]="夺取一具肉身，然后复仇！"
G["Clam skin dress shirt here I come!"]="贝壳礼服到手啦！"
G["Clan Gurthan is right! Only the honorless Clan Harthak could bring in a lesser race to do their bidding. You must be traitors!"]="格尔桑氏族说得对！只有卑贱的哈飒克氏族才会让下等种族帮忙做事。你们一定是叛徒！"
G["Clan Gurthan will show our King and the rest of you power-hungry imposters why we are the rightful ones at his side!"]="格尔桑氏族会向王上和其他像你们这样利欲熏心的骗子证明，我们才是王上真正的拥护者！"
G["Clan Harthak will show all why they are the truest of Mogu!"]="哈飒克氏族会向所有人证明，我们才是血统最纯正的魔古！"
G["Clan Kargesh will demonstrate why only the strong deserve to stand at our King's side!"]="克尔格西氏族会让你知道，为什么只有强者才配站在我们国王的身边！"
G["Clan Kargesh will not suffer these insults! We will have your heads to offer to the king as proof of our might soon enough!"]="克尔格西氏族不会容许这等侮辱！我们很快就要把你们的头颅献给国王，证明我们的力量！"
G["Clap your hands everybody, and everybody clap your hands!"]="所有人鼓掌，所有人鼓掌！"
G["Clara Henry carries enchanting supplies. She can be found in the crafter's hall, to the left as you enter the building.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="克拉拉·亨利携带着附魔物资。你可以在工匠大厅内找到她，就位于你进入建筑物时的左侧。\n\n我会在你的地图上标记这个位置。"
G["Class Trainer"]="职业训练师"
G["Class dismissed."]="下课。"
G["Class is now in session."]="讲课开始了。"
G["Class trainers may be found in the various ground-floor wings of the Terrace of Light's central structure.\n\nAldor, Scryer or otherwise, someone will be able to help you."]="职业训练师都在圣光广场中心建筑物一层的各翼区中。\n\n无论是奥尔多，占星者还是其他什么人，总有人能帮助你的。"
G["Class... dismissed."]="课程…结束了。"
G["Clayton is AWESOME!"]="克雷顿太帅了！"
G["Clayton is NOT AWESOME!"]="克雷顿不帅了！"
G["Clean and tidy!"]="干净整洁！"
G["Clean them up, Foe Reaper 800!"]="干掉他们，死神800型！"
G["Clean this place up! We will not live in such squalor."]="把这儿打扫干净！我们可不能生活在这么糟糕的地方。"
G["Cleaning"]="清理中"
G["Cleanse your hands before you begin any project. Staining the leather with blood or dirt would take away from its natural beauty."]="在你开始任何工作之前都要洗净双手。皮革被血或尘土玷污了会带走它的自然美。"
G["Cleanse your soul in the flames of the abyss!"]="在这深渊的火焰中净化你的灵魂吧！"
G["Cleansed by the righteous waters!"]="让正义之水净化你吧！"
G["Cleansing"]="净化"
G["Cleansing the world of impure scum isn't an easy job, Nancy. Someone's got to do it."]="净化这个世界上的污秽并不是一件容易的事，南希。但是总是要有人去做这样的事情的。"
G["Clear a path from the ship to the gate at the upper level - we will need to cross on foot."]="在船只和上层大门间清出一条路来——我们得步行通过。"
G["Clear me for the teleporter, I'm ready to go!"]="开始传送吧，我准备好了！"
G["Clear out the rabble, would you?"]="解决那些乌合之众吧。"
G["Clear the area!"]="清理一下这个地方！"
G["Clear the paths! Stay away from the sides of the bluff!"]="清空道路！别待在绝壁两侧！"
G["Clear the roads, the brew runner is coming!"]="让开，送酒员来了！"
G["Clear the streets!"]="清空街道！"
G["Clear the streets!  The skies darken and elementals will soon attack.  Be on your guard!"]="清理街道！天色开始阴沉，元素生物很快就要发动袭击了。保持警惕！"
G["Clear the terrace for landing!  Shoot at Cauldron Defenders!"]="清理着陆场！向熔炉守卫射击！"
G["Clear your mind, $n."]="集中精神，清除杂念，$n。"
G["Clear your mind."]="约束你的思想。"
G["Clear!"]="好啦！"
G["Clearly a different approach is required."]="看来要换个策略了。"
G["Clearly annoyed, %s swats Naturalist Bite with deadly force."]="%s很明显被惹怒了，用尽全力击打博学者拜特。"
G["Clearly my pets failed. Perhaps another demonstration is in order."]="显然，我的宠物们失败了。看来还得另外安排一次示范。"
G["Clearly on to something, the worg bares its fangs and follows the scent."]="座狼显然有所发现。它露出獠牙，循着气味前进。"
G["Clearly the Kirin Tor has no clue about the power of this island. They are just here to stop us out of spite. Those ignorant amateur mages must be taught a lesson."]="显然肯瑞托对这座岛的力量一无所知。他们纯粹是为了报复才来这里阻挠我们的。我们一定要好好教训这些傲慢无礼的法师一顿。"
G["Clearly this is getting us nowhere. We need to get this saronite to Highlord Fordring for further study."]="好吧，事情毫无进展。我们还是将这块萨隆邪铁交给大领主弗丁研究吧。"
G["Clearly, I was wrong about you."]="显然，我对你的评价是错误的。"
G["Clearly, this group is not ready for weapons exercises."]="很明显，这组还没准备好武器练习。"
G["Clever Shado-Pan... I underestimated you.  But your leader is mine now.  You cannot free him without freeing me as well."]="狡猾的影踪派……我低估了你们。可你们的领袖已经是我的了。谁想要救他，就必须同时释放我。"
G["Clever fleshling... soaring in-between the winds of fate. Yes, I know the one you seek... the orc-father... Earthbinder...\n\nI sense him nearby - raging within a tempest of his own fear. You may go to him... at your peril."]="聪明的血肉之躯，懂得在命运之风中翱翔。是的，我知道你要找的人——兽人先知，缚地者……\n\n我感到他就在附近，他内心的恐惧掀起了一场风暴。你可以去找他……但后果自负。"
G["Clever girl..."]="你真聪明……"
G["Clever tricks, but do you really assume I only have one set of weapons to fight you with? I have been waiting for a worthy opponent to use my poison coated swords against."]="真是高明的把戏，可你真以为我就带一套武器来与你交手吗？我等了这么久，终于迎来了旗鼓相当的对手，总算能试试我这浸毒的利剑了。"
G["Clever, hiding out up here - using the elements to shield your tracks. But my quilen hounds could sense the Tongue even here."]="聪明，竟然想到藏在这上面——用元素掩盖踪迹。但我的魁麟猎犬的鼻子灵得很，即便是躲在这儿，也一样会被发现。"
G["Clever, mortals - but I am not so easily lured away from my sanctum!"]="你们很聪明，凡人——但是我不会那么轻易地离开我的圣地！"
G["Click here to remove res effects and repair all gear"]="单击此处消除复活效果并修理所有装备"
G["Click here to repair your gear"]="单击此处修理装备"
G["Click on Eddy's weakened |cFFFF0000|Hspell:110198|h[Watery Shield]|h|r to pop it!"]="点击涡流被削弱的|cFFFF0000|Hspell:110198|h[水体护盾]|h|r来戳破它！"
G["Click on a Bone Pile to protect yourself from Bone Spike!"]="点击骨堆以保护你免遭骨针的伤害！"
G["Click on a patron who is waiting in line. You should see them wave to you when you have successfully interacted with them."]="点击一名排队的客人。如果点击成功，他们就会向你招手。"
G["Click on marmots to stomp them!"]="点击土拨鼠，踩上去！"
G["Click on monks to knock them back."]="点击武僧以击退他们。"
G["Click on weeds to pull them!"]="点击杂草将其拔掉！"
G["Cliffspring Falls lies along the mountains to the east and north."]="峭壁之泉在东边和北边的山脉之间。"
G["Climb the guard towers!"]="爬上哨塔！"
G["Climb to the Tree Top"]="爬到树顶。"
G["Cling to your hope, mortal!"]="抱定最后的希望吧，凡人！"
G["Cling while you can, \"heroes.\" You and your world are doomed."]="Aferraos mientras podáis, \"héroes\". Estáis todos condenados."
G["Close sir..."]="先生，你差点就把我的名字叫对了……"
G["Close your eyes, kid. This ain't gunna be pretty..."]="闭上你的眼睛，孩子。这可不会很好看……"
G["Close your eyes, my children, and listen to the water within these halls."]="闭上你的眼睛，孩子们。聆听大厅内的潺潺水声。"
G["Close your eyes. Sleep."]="闭上双眼，长眠吧。"
G["Close your mouth and take a knee, fool. Kroshik is near."]="闭上你的嘴，立刻跪下，蠢货。考什克就在附近。"
G["Close!"]="就差一点！"
G["Close, but no cigar! I'm afraid you'll have to talk to my sis, Jemma first. After she's gone over the basics with you, come see me and I'll show you the juicy stuff!"]="靠近点，但是不要抽雪茄！我恐怕你必须得先跟我的妹妹洁娜谈谈。当她领你复习完基础知识再回来找我，我那时就会让你见识真正有趣的东西！"
G["Close... enough."]="别……过来。"
G["Closer now. Tasty morsels. I've been too long without food, without blood to drink."]="哦，小点心终于来了。我好久都没有吃肉和饮用鲜血了。"
G["Closer! Come closer... and burn!"]="靠近点！再近点……燃烧吧！"
G["Closer... Come closer... See what the void brings!"]="靠近点……再靠近点……看看虚空给我们带来了什么！"
G["Closer... come closer..."]="过来……再过来点……"
G["Cloth Armor"]="布甲"
G["Cloth is okay. Personally I prefer to work with human skin."]="布料也可以。就我个人来说我更喜欢使用人皮。"
G["Clothing"]="裁缝供应"
G["Clothing the tribe is as important a job as any other.  You should look for Tepa inside Thunder Bluff Armorers.  She has a natural way with the needle."]="给部落做衣服与其余的工作同样重要。你该到雷霆崖防具店里面寻找坦帕。她对针线活有自己的天赋。"
G["Clothing!?  That won't help you against good steel!  Bah, if you're sure you want to be a tailor go find Magar's Cloth Goods in The Drag."]="布衣！？那不会帮你抵挡住好钢做成的武器的！哈，如果你确定你想当个裁缝的话到暗巷区的玛加尔布品店那儿去吧。"
G["Cloud tile good.  Other tiles bad.  There was a tile at the bottom of the entrance stairs that tipped me off.  My sharp eyes have saved my delicate features yet again!"]="云瓷砖不错。其他瓷砖不好。在入口楼梯的底部有一块瓷砖差点害我摔跤。我敏锐的目光又一次挽救了我美好的形象！"
G["Cloudrider Hatchling flies in a loop."]="腾云雏龙在绕圈飞翔。"
G["Cloudrider Hatchling is very glad to see you!"]="腾云雏龙很高兴见到你！"
G["Cloudrider Hatchling is very happy!"]="腾云雏龙很开心！"
G["Cloudrider Hatchling licks you affectionately."]="腾云雏龙亲昵地舔了舔你。"
G["Cloudrider Hatchling nuzzles your hand."]="腾云雏龙拱了供你的手。"
G["Cloudrider Hatchling wants to play!"]="腾云雏龙想要玩！"
G["Cloudrunner Leng can teach you how to fly in Pandaria. He rides his cloud serpent on the main terrace. I will mark his location on your map."]="穿云行者凌大师能教你如何在潘达利亚飞行。他正骑着云端翔龙停在主露台上。我会在你的地图上标出他的位置。"
G["Clowns. Except instead of making you laugh, they're there for beating."]="小丑，除了让你发笑之外，你还可以暴打他们。"
G["Clubnik? I hope you die. In a fire."]="克拉伯尼克？我希望你死了。被烈火烧成灰烬。"
G["Clumsily interferink vizh my operation..."]="笨手笨脚地给我添乱……"
G["Clyde Kellen, the local bass master, has his favorite fishing spot just east of Brill at Brightwater Lake."]="克莱德·凯林，当地的钓鲈鱼高手，有他自己最喜欢的钓鱼地点，就在布瑞尔东部的澈水湖。"
G["Coach is here?! He'll have a plan."]="教练在这里？！他一定有办法的！"
G["Coach, can I get some rocket boots?"]="教练，我能再用一下火箭靴吗？"
G["Coach, get me back into the game!"]="教练，让我重新开始比赛吧！"
G["Coax Taldan's corpse to give up its spirit."]="说服塔尔丹的尸体，让他放弃自己的灵魂。"
G["Coax Thundris Windweaver's spirit."]="说服桑迪斯·织风的灵魂。"
G["Coax the spirit out of Caylais Moonfeather's still corpse."]="说服那个灵魂，让它离开凯莱斯·月羽的尸体。"
G["Coax the spirit out of Sentinel Elissa Starbreeze's corpse."]="说服那个灵魂，让它离开哨兵艾莉萨·星风的尸体。"
G["Cock-a-doodle-DIE!"]="咕咕咕——去死吧！"
G["Codes accepted. Activating mechanism."]="密码接受。系统激活。"
G["Cogspin searches his \"Gigantique\" bag looking for the items."]="Rotadiente hurga en su bolsa \"gigantesca\" en busca de objetos."
G["Coilfang Reservoir."]="盘牙水库。"
G["Coilskar Key"]="库斯卡钥匙"
G["Cold Weather Flying Trainer"]="寒冷天气飞行训练师"
G["Cold feet, I assume. Probably better this way - nothing but death in there for the likes of you...."]="我承认我害怕了。也许这样更好——只有死亡在那里等待着像你们这样的人。"
G["Cold logic deemed our world not worth saving. Cold logic, however, does not account for the power of free will. It's up to each of us to prove this is a world worth saving."]="冷酷的逻辑推论出：我们的世界不值得拯救。但是，它并没有考虑到自由意志的力量。我们每一个人都有责任证明，这是一个值得拯救的世界。"
G["Coldarra is no place for mortals now."]="凡人可不该来考达拉。"
G["Coldbite Matriarch begins to summon Coldbite Hatchlings."]="寒噬主母开始召唤寒噬幼雏。"
G["Colin is massing the Thundermars for a full-on assault of Glopgut's Hollow."]="科林正在集结桑德玛尔部众，准备对黏肠的洞窟发起全面攻击。"
G["Collect Solar Power and place Spitters in the center lane to fight the zombies!"]="收集太阳能并在中间那条路上放置喷酸草以抗击僵尸！"
G["Collect meat from the local wildlife or rations from the orcs. We're not picky eaters."]="你可以从野生动物身上找到肉，或者从兽人身上找到军粮。我们从不挑剔食物。"
G["Collect the wyrmcult blackwhelp."]="收集拜龙教黑色龙崽。"
G["Collecting"]="收集中"
G["Collecting \"distilled\" fuel."]="收集“纯化”燃料。"
G["Collecting Honeybrew Barrel"]="收集蜜露酒桶"
G["Collecting Supplies"]="收集补给品"
G["Collection of bandages is proceeding according to schedule. As far as linen bandages are concerned, we've gathered $2076w of $2077w. Silk bandages have been tallied at $2082w out of $2083w, and we have $2088w out of $2090w runecloth bandages needed."]="收集绷带的工作正有条不紊地按计划进行着。我们已经收集到$2076w根亚麻绷带、$2082w根丝质绷带和$2088w根符文布绷带了，总的需求量分别是$2077w、$2083w和$2090w。"
G["Color.  It gives us contrast, depth, value, and tone.  The simple shift of a hue can move a person to laughter or tears."]="色彩。它赋予了我们反差、深度、浓淡和色调的变化。稍微调整一下色彩，就能让欢笑中的人们潸然泪下。"
G["Colossals on the rise! At least 10 units strong! INCOMING FROM THE SOUTH!"]="目标出现！至少10个单位才能应付它！它从南线冲过来了！"
G["Combat matrix enhanced. Behold wonderous rapidity!"]="战斗矩阵已强化。全速突击！"
G["Combat matrix overload. Powering doooow..."]="作战矩阵超载。正在关机……"
G["Combatants of the Alliance and Horde! You are welcome under the banner of the Argent Crusade."]="参加联盟和部落之间的战斗吧！欢迎你加入到银色十字军的麾下。"
G["Combatants ready... FIGHT!"]="各就各位……开始作战！"
G["Combined with evil's ointment, the bell's evil can be undone."]="再配上一点药膏，就能驱除这口钟的邪恶。"
G["Come $p, let me show you."]="来，$p，我指给你看。"
G["Come ... closer ... $c. They are ... pulling me away ..."]="靠……近点……$c。他们……在把我拉远……"
G["Come Midnight, let's disperse this petty rabble!"]="来吧，午夜，让我们解决这群乌合之众！"
G["Come ON, Uncle Chen! What are we waiting for?"]="走吧，陈叔！我们还等什么呢？"
G["Come Stormrage, and I will show you what happens to those that betray the lord of the Legion!"]="来吧，怒风，我要让你看看，敢于背叛军团之主的人会有什么下场。"
G["Come aboard, now. Step on up!"]="快上船来，快点。踩上来！"
G["Come aboard, now. Step right up!"]="上船来吧，快上来！"
G["Come again."]="再说一遍？"
G["Come an' get it!"]="快来尝尝！"
G["Come and I will show you how to ride the finest beasts you have ever seen. You... do have enough gold to cover the cost, I trust?"]="过来，我会教如何骑乘这些坐骑。不过，你……带了足够的钱来付这笔费用吧？"
G["Come and face me! *snort* I can smell your $r stench from here."]="来吧！*哼哼*我在这里就能闻到你的$r臭气。"
G["Come and face me, $p!"]="放马过来吧，$p！"
G["Come and get it!"]="来啊！"
G["Come and get us, you motherless beasts!"]="来追我们，你们这些可恶的野兽！"
G["Come and get your pain!"]="来承受你的痛苦吧！"
G["Come and have a talk with me if you're going to go to Gnomeregan, $n!"]="$n，如果你想去诺莫瑞根，那就和我谈谈。"
G["Come and take a look at my wares while you still can.  We're here all week, and then we're off to some far off land."]="趁现在还有机会，过来看看我的货物吧。我们要在这儿呆上一周，然后就要动身去远方啦。"
G["Come any closer ya wee bear and I'll punch ya in the face!"]="再靠近一点，我就一拳砸在你的脸上！"
G["Come any closer, and I'll scream."]="再靠近我的话，我就要大叫了。"
G["Come at me!"]="放马过来吧！"
G["Come back again when you have achieved success in the Trial of the Crusader."]="当你在十字军的试炼中赢得胜利的时候再回来。"
G["Come back before you get hurt!"]="趁你还没受伤，赶快回来！"
G["Come back here with me guts, $r!"]="不许拿我的东西，$r！"
G["Come back here, you coward!"]="回来，你个胆小鬼！"
G["Come back next year for a new surprise!"]="明年会有更多新惊喜！"
G["Come back soon!"]="快点儿回来！"
G["Come back to camp when you are finished. We have much to discuss."]="结束之后返回营地……我们有很多事情要讨论。"
G["Come back to me when you've had more training. Randal Worth over there can help you with that."]="当你接受更多训练以后再回来找我。在那边的兰达尔·沃斯可以帮你。"
G["Come back when you actually deserve to go up to the Boom Room!"]="等你得到贵宾资格再来吧！"
G["Come back when you're better prepared."]="等你准备充分再回来吧。"
G["Come back, $n. If you're out of your body for too long, you run the risk of not being able to return. We have much to discuss."]="回来吧，$n。如果你的灵魂离开肉体太久的话，可能会回不去的。我们需要好好谈一谈。"
G["Come back, Beak! Don't get hurt!"]="回来，尖喙！不要受伤了！"
G["Come back, Fluffy!"]="快回来，小兔子！"
G["Come back, Mr. Bronco! We're gonna be in the Skyguard together!"]="回来吧，布隆库先生！让我们一起加入天空卫队！"
G["Come back, stupid vermin!"]="回来，笨蛋恶棍！"
G["Come back; we're not open!"]="回去吧，我们不会让你们进来的！"
G["Come be perfect with us, $g brother : sister;."]="Ven a alcanzar la perfección con nosotros $g hermano:hermana;."
G["Come brothers and sisters. It is time to take this foul tower from the hands of our enemies."]="来吧，兄弟姐妹们。是时候将这座污秽的塔从敌人手中夺过来了。"
G["Come chat with Martar!"]="来跟马尔泰聊聊吧！"
G["Come child. We have one final journey to take together before your training is complete."]="来吧，孩子。在你完成训练之前，我们还要同行最后一段旅程。"
G["Come children of the Titans, you face the Paragons."]="来吧，泰坦之子，来面对英杰的挑战。"
G["Come children. May Elune guide our deeds this day."]="来吧孩子们。愿艾露恩指引我们今日的行动。"
G["Come closer, demon!  Death awaits!"]="来吧，恶魔！死亡正等待着你！"
G["Come closer, friend.  Do not let my eyes startle you.\n\nI might have lost my sight many years ago but I never needed it to see the things that really matter."]="Acércate, $gamigo:amiga;. No dejes que mis ojos te asusten.\n\nPuede que perdiera la vista hace muchos años, pero nunca la necesité para ver las cosas que importan de verdad."
G["Come closer, grandson. Sit by your Greatmother."]="靠近点，孙子。坐在你祖母的身边。"
G["Come closer, love.  I have a point to make."]="靠近点，亲爱的。我有些小小的看法。"
G["Come closer, young one.  In my time I could hear the flutter of a prey's beating heart, but now you must speak up if you want your words heard."]="Acércate, joven. En tiempos, era capaz de escuchar los latidos del corazón de una presa, pero ahora tienes que hablar alto si quieres que te oiga."
G["Come closer, young one. There's nothing to fear from me or $n."]="靠近点，年轻人。完全不用害怕我和$n。"
G["Come closer, young one; my ears aren't what they once were, and I care not for raising my voice."]="过来点，年轻人，我的耳朵已经不那么好用了，说话声音也不如以前洪亮了。"
G["Come closer. I will make it quick."]="靠近点。我立刻送你们归天。"
G["Come closer. Just a little cut, I promise!"]="靠近点。我只轻轻割一刀，我保证！"
G["Come down and face me, insect!"]="来和我较量较量吧！"
G["Come down from there!"]="下来吧！"
G["Come down to da shrine with Tiev. We'll put da sapta magics to work there."]="和提夫到神庙去。我们将在那里施展灵契魔法。"
G["Come down! I tear your wings from your shoulders and feed you to the dirt. Then YOU be the maggot, dragon!"]="有种就下来啊！我会撕下你的翅膀，把你的尸首埋在泥土里。咱们看看谁会变成土里的蛆虫，你这条没用的龙！"
G["Come fight, Crusher."]="来战斗吧，碎石蟹。"
G["Come fill belly with noodle, yes! Very good!"]="快来吃碗面垫垫肚子吧！好吃的面！"
G["Come fools, meet your doom! I'm waiting."]="蠢货，死神的脚步已经临近！我等你很久了。"
G["Come fools. Come to your doom. The end of days is here!"]="来吧蠢货们。拥抱死亡吧。你们的末日到了！"
G["Come for some blacksmithing supplies, have ya?"]="需要一些锻造物资吗？"
G["Come for the beer, stay for the atmosphere!"]="过来喝杯啤酒，享受一下这里的欢乐气氛！"
G["Come for training, have you?"]="你是来接受训练的吗？"
G["Come forth, Taerar! I stand before you!"]="走上前来，泰拉尔！我就站在你面前！"
G["Come forth, acolyte of earth!"]="出来吧，地之侍僧！"
G["Come forth, children of twilight...."]="来吧，暮光之子！"
G["Come forth, my brethren! Feast on their flesh!"]="来呀，我的子民！吞噬他们的血肉吧！"
G["Come forth, my servants! Defend your master!"]="出来吧，我的仆从！保卫你们的主人！"
G["Come forth, sister! Your master calls!"]="前进！这是主人的命令！"
G["Come forth, ye Dreamers - and claim your vengeance!"]="来吧，梦游者——复仇！"
G["Come forward! I will give you my blessing."]="来吧！我将给你们我的祝福。"
G["Come forward, so that we may be properly introduced."]="快上前来，我们可以好好认识一下。"
G["Come friend, the Horde awaits."]="来吧，朋友。部落在等着我们！"
G["Come get some!"]="¡Ven a $gcogerlos:cogerlas;!"
G["Come get some, you horsefaced maggot farms!"]="来吧，你们这些长着马脸的怪物们！"
G["Come get yer fresh bread!"]="快来买新鲜的面包啦！"
G["Come here, $p! Give that bubble a good poke!"]="快来，$p！狠狠地戳那个泡泡！"
G["Come here, $r. I wish to speak with you. Our secret can remain hidden no longer."]="过来，$r，我想和你谈谈。我们的秘密再也藏不住了。"
G["Come here, pretty. You have what I need!"]="Ven aquí $gbonito:bonita;. ¡Tienes lo que necesito!"
G["Come heroes, through the portal! The siege of Orgrimmar begins!"]="英雄们，穿过传送门！围攻奥格瑞玛的战役开始了！"
G["Come in by the fire and rest, $r. I hope you don't mind the smell of fish."]="进来坐在火堆旁休息一下吧，$r。希望你不要介意鱼腥味儿。"
G["Come in out of the ash and muck. Dry yourself a spell."]="进来休息一会儿吧，远离灰尘和泥沼吧。"
G["Come in out of the cold and rest your weary bones a while. Our hospitality is yours."]="过来暖和暖和，让你那一身疲倦的骨头歇歇。我们很好客的。"
G["Come in out of the cold friend and make yourself comfortable!"]="¡Entra, ponte $gcómodo:cómoda; y deja el frío atrás!"
G["Come in, come in! One at a time."]="进来，进来！一次一个。"
G["Come in, come in. Just don't sit too close to the stove. It hasn't exploded yet today, but just to be safe I think you should sit elsewhere."]="请进，请进！不要坐得离火炉太近。它今天还没爆炸，但是为了安全起见，我想你还是坐在别的地方比较好。"
G["Come in, mon... forget yer cares for a while!\n\nRest de body, rest de soul."]="进来，朋友……暂时把你的担忧放到一边去吧！\n\n让自己的灵魂和躯体都好好休息一下。"
G["Come in, the water's fine!"]="来吧，沐浴在流水之中！"
G["Come inside, $r. I must repay your kindness."]="请进来，$r。我必须报答你的恩情。"
G["Come inside, and have a seat. Get off your feet... I'm sure you've been running around all day.\n\nNow, what can I do for you?"]="进来坐坐，别老站着……我肯定你在外面跑了一整天了。\n\n那么，我有什么可以效劳的？"
G["Come intruders...."]="入侵者来了……"
G["Come learn the ways of the hunter. Pride, honor, and tradition."]="来学习猎人之道吧。骄傲，荣誉，还有传统。"
G["Come little Kunchongs, it's feeding time!"]="来吧，小恐虫们，喂食时间到了！"
G["Come little guy, let's get out of here."]="来吧小家伙，让我们离开这儿。"
G["Come near, $c. I haven't got much time...."]="到这里来，$c。我没有太多的时间……"
G["Come now, friend. You chop and I will protect you from the elves, ok?"]="来吧，朋友。让我来保护你免受精灵的偷袭，好吗？"
G["Come off it, Jadaar. That's all I've heard out of you for months. No matter what happened, the point is we're free agents now! No longer tied to politics or duties, able to roam where we will!"]="你给我闭嘴，亚达尔。你已经抱怨了好几个月，烦不烦啊。不管怎么样，我们现在自由啦！你想想，我们再也不用当差，不用面对政治纷争，乐得消遥自在！"
G["Come on $n!  I've got good money riding on you!"]="加油，$n！我靠你才赚了大钱啊！"
G["Come on $n!  You can do it!"]="加油，$n！你能获胜的！"
G["Come on Bruce, get it together!"]="拜托，布鲁斯，起来！"
G["Come on Dadanga!  March girl, march!"]="快点达丹加！女孩快跑，快跑！"
G["Come on Mister Flabbypants! Punch like you mean it!"]="来啊，软脚先生！用力出拳啊！"
G["Come on Peiji. I don't like it any better than you do but there is honor in the Pandriarchs' blessings."]="算了吧，佩吉。我跟你一样不情愿，可族长的祝福是一种荣誉。"
G["Come on already!  Let's go!"]="来吧，我们走！"
G["Come on and get your Ook on!"]="都给乌克闹起来吧！"
G["Come on boy, there's no mistak'n it - it's definitely you. Don't ya recognize your younger brother?!"]="哥们儿，我怎么会搞错啊——肯定是你。你不认识自己的弟弟了吗？！"
G["Come on boy, you're stronger 'an this thing."]="加油，小子，你比这家伙强大得多。"
G["Come on boys, let's eat!  My favorite soldier brought enough worg for everyone!"]="来，孩子，我们吃吧！我最喜欢的战士为大家带来了足够的狼肉！"
G["Come on boys, let's leave him to his \"farming.\"  Ho ho ho!"]="Venga, chicos. Dejémoslo con sus \"labranzas\". ¡Jo, jo, jo!"
G["Come on boys, we've got to get this bridge rebuilt."]="快点，伙计们，我们要尽快重建这座桥。"
G["Come on champ! Give Rok Rok a roar!"]="来吧，勇士！冲洛洛来声咆哮！"
G["Come on in, $r."]="来吧，$r。"
G["Come on now commander.  Let's get you out of here.  $n, meet us at the Gates of Sothann -- Ysera awaits!"]="快点，指挥官。我们要把你带出去。$n，我们在索萨恩之门碰头——伊瑟拉正在那儿等着。"
G["Come on now, mon!\n\nI be leakin' like a sieve, here! I don' be havin' much time..."]="快点，伙计！\n\n我就像个筛子一样在往外飙血，就在这！我的时间可不多了……"
G["Come on out, Croaker!"]="出来吧，鸣蟾！"
G["Come on then, Nancy! Let's go!"]="来吧，南希！我们走！"
G["Come on through. The Warchief's expecting you."]="快去吧。大酋长在等着你们呢。"
G["Come on you apes. You want to live forever?"]="给我上，你们这帮猿人，想老不死活一辈子吗？"
G["Come on!"]="快！"
G["Come on!  Clear!"]="拜托！让开！"
G["Come on!  Our boys are out there and they need these supplies ready!"]="加油！小伙子们就在外面，我们要把这些补给物准备好！"
G["Come on!  These jokes are epic!"]="哈哈哈！这些笑话真是太棒了！"
G["Come on! Clear!"]="拜托！快醒过来！"
G["Come on! If we band together, we can take them! Aaaagh!"]="来吧！只要齐心协力，我们就能打败他们！啊！"
G["Come on! Let's brawl!"]="来啊！打个过瘾！"
G["Come on! Let's get to that critter-whompin'!"]="来吧！一起去消灭那些畜生！"
G["Come on! Let's keep going!"]="来吧！让我们继续前进！"
G["Come on! We need to save my boy!"]="来吧！我们得救救我的孩子！"
G["Come on! You people are laborers! You are supposed to be laboring!"]="得了吧！你们就是工人！你们就该干活！"
G["Come on, $n!  Don't let me down!"]="加油，$n！别让我失望！"
G["Come on, Bruce!"]="布鲁斯，上！"
G["Come on, Budd. Time to play with the ice trolls!"]="来吧，巴德。和冰巨魔较量的时刻来临了！"
G["Come on, Goodie, lets go scout the area."]="来，谷迪，我们去探险吧。"
G["Come on, Kiryn! Let's get the ook outta here!"]="来吧，琪麟！我们离开这儿！"
G["Come on, Kiryn. Let's go do girl stuff."]="来吧，琪麟。去解决点女士的私事。"
G["Come on, Mina. Let's get you out of here."]="快来，米娜。我们离开这儿。"
G["Come on, Olon! Brew-ty calls!"]="来吧，吴龙！ 美酒在召唤！"
G["Come on, Poppers. Let's go!"]="快点，波普，我们走！"
G["Come on, Socks. Let's get out of here before you get sniped."]="来吧，袜子。趁你还没被打死，我们离开这儿。"
G["Come on, Zin'Jun, there's vengeance to be had!"]="来吧，金祖恩，我们还要报仇呢。"
G["Come on, come on, come on! They'll be here any moment!"]="快，快，快！他们随时可能出现！"
G["Come on, don't break down on me now!"]="快点，不要停！"
G["Come on, girls. You've had your share of meat for the day."]="来吧，姑娘们。这是你们今天的肉。"
G["Come on, help me pull this cart."]="来，和我一起拉货车。"
G["Come on, is that all you've got?"]="来吧，你就这点能耐？"
G["Come on, just do it."]="拜托，叫她来呀。"
G["Come on, let's get out of here!"]="来吧，让我们离开这里！"
G["Come on, let's go check it out!"]="过来，我们去看看！"
G["Come on, let's go kill some of those little guys first."]="来吧，我们先杀几个那种小家伙。"
G["Come on, let's go."]="来吧，我们走。"
G["Come on, pandaren! HIT ME!"]="来啊，熊猫人！打我啊！"
G["Come on, show me a real fight!"]="来吧，让我看看你们真正的实力！"
G["Come on, stop trying to hit me and hit me already!"]="来呀，你倒是给我一拳啊！"
G["Come on, you lollygaggers! Let's pick up the pace!"]="来啊，你们这些懒骨头！加快脚步！"
G["Come on, you slow poke!"]="来呀，瞧你慢的！"
G["Come on, you two. I want another dozen barrels full before we're done!"]="你们两个快一点。在一切完成之前，我还想再装满十二只桶呢！"
G["Come on.  There is nothing more to be done here."]="来吧。这里没别的事要做了。"
G["Come on. I think it's time to go home."]="来吧。我们该回家了。"
G["Come on... Let's get this over with!"]="来吧……结束这场噩梦！"
G["Come on... please?"]="拜托……"
G["Come on... right between the eyes... no.  I suppose not this time."]="加油……瞄好准星……不。我想这次又失败了。"
G["Come one! Come all! Perelli's elixirs will dazzle!"]="来看看吧！皮雷利的万能药会让你看得眼花缭乱的！"
G["Come one, come all!  Welcome to the Darkmoon Faire!  Do you crave adventure?  Do you seek exotic and mysterious treasures?  Then look no further!  You, my friend, have come to the right place!  Dive right in and take part in all that the Faire has to offer!  We'll be at this location all week, so be sure to tell your friends and loved ones!"]="来吧！欢迎来到暗月马戏团！你想要冒险吗？你想找寻奇珍异宝吗？那就不要只是观看啦！我的朋友，你来对地方啦！来吧，亲身参与到狂欢节中来，尽情享受吧！我们这周都会呆在这儿，记得把这消息告诉你的朋友和爱人！"
G["Come one, come all! Antonio's wares are for sale. I may not return for a great deal of time, so come one, come all."]="大家都过来看啊！安东尼奥又开始卖他的宝贝啦。下次我再来就可能是很久之后的事情了，大家都过来看看啊。"
G["Come one, come all.  Welcome to the Darkmoon Faire!  Don't be shy.  Step right up to Lhara and buy yourself an exotic artifact from far off lands.  If you're one of the lucky few who have found Darkmoon Cards, have a word with Professor Paleo.  Hungry?  Thirsty?  You're in luck!  Refreshments are available right here from Sylannia and Stamp.  I recommend the Darkmoon Special Reserve to wash down some Red Hot Wings.  And if the future is what you seek, then run, don't walk, to speak with Sayge."]="来啊，大家都来啊。欢迎来到暗月马戏团！不要害羞。到兰拉这里购买来自遥远大陆的奇特东西。如果你是个拥有暗月卡片的幸运儿，那么就去找萨杜斯·帕雷教授吧。渴了？饿了？你很幸运！你可以从塞兰妮亚和斯塔姆那里获得让你倍感清新的食物和水。我建议你去尝尝暗月特殊储备那里的热辣烤翅，绝对不容错过！如果你想要了解自己的未来，那么快点去找塞格谈谈。"
G["Come out and count them, coward!"]="自己出来数数啊，懦夫！"
G["Come out and play."]="出来玩玩吧。"
G["Come out from the shadows!  I've returned to lead you against our true enemy!  Shed your chains and raise your weapons against your Illidari masters!"]="从阴影中解脱吧！我将领导你们对抗真正的敌人。脱下你们的镣铐，拿起武器，去对抗你们的伊利达雷主人吧！！"
G["Come out, little birdies! Mug'gok want to play!"]="出来，小家伙们！穆格高克要跟你们玩！"
G["Come out, soldier! I'll cover you!"]="快出来！我会掩护你的！"
G["Come outsider! Fight me if you dare!"]="¡Ven, $gforastero:forastera;! ¡Enfréntate a mí si te atreves!"
G["Come outta ya holes, cowards!"]="从洞里出来，胆小鬼！"
G["Come over here time traveller, we need to talk!"]="时间的旅者，过来。我有话和你说！"
G["Come play a game so simple that even a $c can do it!"]="来玩玩吧，这么简单的游戏，连$c都能玩！"
G["Come play with Patchwerk! Patchwerk lonely!"]="帕奇维克跟你玩！帕奇维克很孤单！"
G["Come play with me!"]="过来和我玩玩吧！"
G["Come quickly!  Wouldn't want to miss out on the fun, would ya?"]="快过来！你不想错过这么有趣的事吧？"
G["Come quickly. There is a gap in their defenses."]="快来！他们的防线上有道缺口。"
G["Come quietly, now."]="悄悄跟着我，快。"
G["Come rest for a while in the shade!"]="快来树荫下歇歇吧！"
G["Come rest your weary feet, adventurer!"]="来歇歇脚吧，冒险者！"
G["Come rest. You will need your strength later in the battle."]="休息一下吧。保存体力，应对接下来的战斗。"
G["Come ride with me, little one. There is something I wish you to see."]="跟我来，小家伙。我想给你看一样东西。"
G["Come see me when you are finished, $n. I live in the small farmhouse, just down the road."]="完成了就来找我，$n。我就住在路那头的小农舍里。"
G["Come see me whenever you are weary."]="如果累了，就来我这里。"
G["Come sister, it is time to end this. We will cleanse the Dragon Soul of the Old Gods' dark influence!"]="来吧，妹妹，该做个了结了。我们将净化上古之神对巨龙之魂造成的黑暗污染！"
G["Come speak with me if you have any Darkmoon Faire Cards."]="如果你有暗月马戏团卡片的话，就来找我。"
G["Come speak with me, and what once was cloudy shall become crystal clear."]="过来跟我谈谈，我会为你拨开疑云的。"
G["Come ta finish da job, mon?"]="你是来执行任务的吧？"
G["Come ta finish the job, mon?"]="你是来执行任务的吧？"
G["Come take a seat and eat! It's never a bad time for a hearty meal!"]="快来坐下吃点东西吧！任何时候都该畅享美餐！"
G["Come then, $r $c, I do not have all day!"]="动手吧，$r$c，我没时间跟你干耗！"
G["Come then, champions. Feed me your rage!"]="来吧，勇士们。释放你们的怒火吧！"
G["Come then, death knight!"]="来啊，死亡骑士！"
G["Come then. You'll find that we're evenly matched."]="好吧。你会发现，我们势均力敌。"
G["Come to Kraz. Accept my thanks."]="到克拉斯这里来吧，接受我的感谢。"
G["Come to buy from Hargus, you have?"]="你是来找哈古斯买东西的吗？"
G["Come to die, have you?"]="你是来找死的吗？"
G["Come to finish the job, have ye?"]="你是来执行任务的吧？"
G["Come to finish the job, have you?"]="你是来执行任务的吧？"
G["Come to learn from the master eh?"]="你是来学习的吗？"
G["Come to learn have ya, mon?"]="你是来学习的吗，伙计？"
G["Come to learn, eh? Well I just might have some work for you, scrub."]="你是来学习的？嗯，我或许会给你一些事儿做的。"
G["Come to make yourself useful?"]="你是来帮忙的吗？"
G["Come to me Kovok."]="到我这里来科沃克。"
G["Come to me again with such pathetic work and I will send you home in a small iron box that I tempered in goat urine. Now go see that idiot Ug'thok, he is better suited to your needs."]="再次给我带来这种劣质货我就把你装在用山羊尿回过火的小铁盒里送回家。现在去见见那个傻瓜乌格索克，他更加适合你的需要。"
G["Come to me aid, pets."]="快来帮忙，我宠物们。"
G["Come to me and see what the future holds for you!"]="到我这儿来吧，看看你的未来如何！"
G["Come to me now, $n. I must be speakin' wit ya."]="来见我吧，$n。我必须和你谈谈。"
G["Come to me, $n."]="到我这里来，$n。"
G["Come to me, Crusaders. I will remake you!"]="来呀，十字军。接受改造吧！"
G["Come to me, champion! Collect your well-earned reward!"]="过来，勇士！来接受你应得的奖励吧！"
G["Come to me, my children!"]="过来，我的孩子们！"
G["Come to me, pretender! Feed MY blade!"]="狂妄之徒！来祭我的剑吧！"
G["Come to me, serpent!  Together we will destroy these intruders."]="来我这里，翔龙！让我们一起消灭这些入侵者。"
G["Come to me."]="过来。"
G["Come to my aid! Heed your master now!"]="快来帮我！帮助你们的主人！"
G["Come to my aid, Drake!"]="龙啊，来帮助我！"
G["Come to my lair, whelp!  Come to me and pay for your insolence!"]="到我的巢穴来吧，小崽子们！到我这里来，为你们的傲慢付出代价吧！"
G["Come to play?"]="要玩玩吗？"
G["Come to share in some of Tenwu's fine company?"]="来和腾武做好伙伴吗？"
G["Come to the top of the inn! They have me chained up!"]="到旅店顶上来！他们把我锁起来了！"
G["Come to think about it, most everyone involved is dead.  I'll understand if you don't want to be involved in any of this, $n."]="动点脑子想想吧，涉及此事的人差不多都死了。我能理解你想置身事外的心情，$n。"
G["Come to train with the Theramore guard have you?"]="你与塞拉摩卫兵一起训练过吗？"
G["Come try our Barleybrew Dark!"]="过来试试我们的黑麦酒吧！"
G["Come try your luck!"]="来呀，试试你们的运气吧！"
G["Come walk with me, $n. I would like to pay Farmer Yoon a visit."]="随我走走吧，$n。我想去看看农夫老愚。"
G["Come winds, whisper whisper... Blows it, blows it, blows it away!"]="风啊，悄悄地，悄悄地……吹它，吹它，将它吹飞！"
G["Come with me *crackle* if you want to live."]="想活命的话*噼啪*就跟着我。"
G["Come with me - look around you a moment."]="跟我来——四处看看吧。"
G["Come with me if you want to live."]="如果你不想死就跟我来。"
G["Come with me if you'd like to live long enough to see me save this world!"]="如果你想活着看到我拯救这个世界的话，就跟我走！"
G["Come with me, Zin'Jun, let's find your missing... belongings."]="跟我来吧，金祖恩，我们要去找你丢失的……财物。"
G["Come with me, brothers and sisters, and learn the truth!"]="跟我来，兄弟姐妹们，去了解这个世界的真相吧！"
G["Come with me, hero. Let us return to the Vale. There is someone I think who would be particularly interested in this turn of events, if we can get his attention."]="跟我来，英雄。我们回到山谷中去。有个人现在一定非常想知道事情的起承转合，如果他愿意搭理我们的话。"
G["Come with me, your highness."]="请跟我来，殿下。"
G["Come with me."]="跟我来。"
G["Come with me. It is not safe here."]="跟我来。这里不安全。"
G["Come with me. We need to talk."]="跟我来。我们得谈谈。"
G["Come with us, fool. You don't want this to get bloody."]="跟我们走，笨蛋，如果你不想见血的话。"
G["Come wolvar! Your death beckons!"]="来吧，狼獾人！你的末日到了！"
G["Come! Come face your doom!"]="来吧！你难逃一死！"
G["Come! Come to your deaths--if you dare!"]="来吧！你是在自寻死路！"
G["Come! Walk with me, $n."]="来！跟我走，$n。"
G["Come! We cannot allow them to harm the Lorewalker!"]="来吧！我们不能让他们伤害游学者！"
G["Come'n get it!"]="上啊！"
G["Come, $n!  Let's go over there and collect it!"]="过来，$n！让我们到那里仔细找找看！"
G["Come, $n! Into zhe siege tank! NOW!"]="过来，$n！到攻城坦克里来！马上！"
G["Come, $n. Let us move swiftly."]="¡Venga! Démonos prisa."
G["Come, $n. Let us see the fruits of our efforts."]="跟我来，$n。让我们瞧瞧目前取得的成果。"
G["Come, $n. Lord Stormrage awaits."]="过来，$n。伊利丹大人在等你。"
G["Come, $n. See what the Nightmare brings..."]="来吧，$n。看看梦魇给你带来了什么……"
G["Come, $n. The lake is just around the bend."]="来吧，$n。湖泊就在拐弯处。"
G["Come, $p, let's push these insects back!"]="来吧，$p，让我们击退这些虫子！"
G["Come, $r. What formula interests you today?"]="嗨，$r。今天你对什么感兴趣呀？"
G["Come, Battle-Sister.\n\nFeast, sleep, so that you may fight with all your strength!"]="进来吧，我的姐妹。\n\n好好地吃上一顿，再睡个安稳觉，这样才能养足精力，全力备战！"
G["Come, Cloudwing. Let's do a lap."]="来吧，云翼。我们来飞一圈。"
G["Come, Helcular, let me give you a small taste..."]="过来，赫尔库拉，让我给你展示一下……"
G["Come, Landgren, cough up your soul so that I can ask you a very important question."]="过来，兰德雷。我有很重要的事情要问你，你最好老实交代。"
G["Come, Lord of Magic, and recover your precious consort...."]="来吧，魔法之王，夺回你亲爱的配偶……"
G["Come, Mankrik. Sit beside me and rest."]="来吧，曼科里克，坐到我旁边来休息一下。"
G["Come, Scourgebane. I'll show the master which of us is truly worthy of the title of \"Champion\"!"]="Ven, Finiquiplaga. ¡Le mostraré al maestro quién de nosotros merece realmente el título de \"Campeón\"!"
G["Come, Squire $n, for adventure awaits us!"]="¡Ven, $gescudero:escudera; $n, pues nos esperan aventuras!"
G["Come, Vazuvius, rise from the depths!"]="来啊，瓦祖维斯号，从深海归来吧！"
G["Come, Voss, your fate awaits you."]="来吧，沃斯，你的命运在召唤你。"
G["Come, Wakener. Let us meet our enemies."]="来吧，唤醒者。我们去会会敌人。"
G["Come, Zeliek, do not drive them out. Not before we've had our fun!"]="嘿，瑟里耶克，别把他们赶跑了。等我们玩够了再说！"
G["Come, and face the impeccable tactics of a blood knight!"]="来吧，面对血骑士的完美战术吧！"
G["Come, brave ones! We'll slick the sand with their gore and return home triumphant."]="来吧，勇士们！我们要用他们的污血点缀这片沙地，凯旋而归！"
G["Come, brothers."]="来，兄弟。"
G["Come, children of Azshara! At last, we lay claim to the Plane of Water!"]="集结起来，艾萨拉的孩子们！我们终于要夺取水元素位面了！"
G["Come, children, feast on their flesh!"]="来吧，孩子们，享用他们的血肉吧！"
G["Come, citizens of Stratholme! Meet your \"saviors.\""]="¡Vamos, ciudadanos de Stratholme! Conoced a vuestros \"salvadores\"."
G["Come, come. If you've properly prepared your leather for once, I'll show you how to fashion serviceable items."]="过来，过来。要是你已经准备好了上好的皮革，我会让你看看怎么制作有用的物品。"
G["Come, cowards! FACE THE HORDE!"]="来吧，懦夫！尝尝部落的厉害！"
G["Come, face me. Give in to your pride. Show me your \"Greatness.\""]="Venid. Dejaos llevar por el orgullo. Mostradme vuestra \"grandeza\"."
G["Come, face your death."]="来，面对死亡吧。"
G["Come, fodder, and meet your end."]="来吧，杂碎，你们死到临头了。"
G["Come, followers of Kael, let us destroy our enemies! Let us show them that there is no escape from the Eredun!"]="过来，凯尔萨斯的追随者们，消灭我们的敌人！让他们知道没有人可以从我们手中逃走！"
G["Come, fools. Fill ma empty cages...."]="来呀，蠢蛋们，来把我的笼子塞满吧……"
G["Come, friend! The fighting's this way!"]="这边走，朋友！战斗在等着我们！"
G["Come, friend.\n\nWalk with me a while. There is something I want to show you."]="Ven, $gamigo:amiga;.\n\nCamina conmigo un rato. Hay algo que quiero enseñarte."
G["Come, friend.  Quickly!"]="过来，朋友，赶快！"
G["Come, friends! Let us all enjoy a fine brew."]="来吧，朋友们！我们都来美美地喝一杯。"
G["Come, friends. Glory awaits us."]="来吧，朋友。荣耀在等着我们。"
G["Come, friends. Your bodies gonna feed ma hatchlings, and your souls gonna fill me with power!"]="过来，朋友们。你们的尸体将是孩子们最好的食物，而你们的灵魂则将壮大我的力量！"
G["Come, gentle night; and give me back my Romulo!"]="来吧，可爱的黑颜的夜，把我的罗密欧给我！"
G["Come, have a drink. The prince here is showing me how to play one of the local games."]="来喝一杯吧。这位王子正在教我玩一种当地的游戏。"
G["Come, hero! Let us shape a new Azeroth together!"]="来吧，英雄！我们将打造全新的艾泽拉斯！"
G["Come, hero. The Light will guide and protect us."]="来吧，英雄。圣光将指引我们前进并一路保护我们。"
G["Come, heroes... By the will of the Lich King, you shall be destroyed."]="来呀，英雄们……巫妖王命令已下，你们就都要死。"
G["Come, join my minions. Serve me as I serve the Lich King!"]="来吧，成为我的仆从吧。向我效忠，如同我对巫妖王效忠一样！"
G["Come, kindling!  Nordrassil's power WILL be mine!"]="来吧，飞蛾们。诺达希尔的力量是我的！"
G["Come, lambs... come and face your demise!"]="来吧，羔羊们……来面对死亡吧！"
G["Come, land-dwellers, face the fury of tusk and whisker!"]="来吧，旱鸭子。面对我的怒火吧！"
G["Come, let us engage in fisticuffs, like civilized folk."]="来，让我们击掌为盟，就像文明人那样。"
G["Come, let us see what other horrors Garrosh has unleashed upon our land."]="来，让我们看看，加尔鲁什还引来了哪些噩梦。"
G["Come, little one. Let us return to camp and forget this fruitless task."]="来吧，小家伙。我们回营地了，忘了这个徒劳的任务吧。"
G["Come, little ones."]="来吧，小家伙们。"
G["Come, little ones. Face me!"]="来吧，小家伙们。面对我！"
G["Come, minions! Your master calls!"]="侍从们，过来吧！主人在召唤你们！"
G["Come, monsters! We will crush you!"]="来吧，怪物们！我们将把你们粉碎！"
G["Come, mortals, face the lord of fire!"]="来吧，凡人，面对炎魔之王！"
G["Come, my acolytes. Take the rods of channeling and create the greater summoning circle."]="过来，我的侍僧。拿好法杖，准备创建召唤法阵。"
G["Come, my apprentice! You ARE my apprentice, right...?"]="来吧，我的学徒！你是我的学徒，对吧……？"
G["Come, my children!  Defend me!"]="来吧，我的孩子们！保卫我！"
G["Come, my children! Awaken and feast upon their flesh!"]="来吧，我的孩子们！苏醒过来，享受这丰美的血肉吧！"
G["Come, my minions. Deal with this traitor as he deserves!"]="来吧，我的手下。让这个叛徒付出代价！"
G["Come, now! Join in de liberation of de Echo Isles! Zalazane will FALL!"]="来吧！我们将解放回音群岛！扎拉赞恩必将失败！"
G["Come, protectors! We lend the strength of the ancients to this battle! And we shall not fall!"]="保护者们，集合起来吧！我们要运用古树的力量赢得这场战争！我们决不能失败！"
G["Come, puny mortals. Come and face your end. The secrets of Ahn'Qiraj will die with Roman'khan!"]="来吧，渺小的凡人。来面对你们的死亡。安其拉的秘密将与洛曼卡恩一起永远消失！"
G["Come, shan'do - certainly you recognize your former pupil?"]="看看我，大导师——想必你还认得你从前的学生吧？"
G["Come, sit down, enjoy a meal!"]="快请坐，好好享用一顿美餐吧！"
G["Come, speak to me at your leisure. Let us discuss matters in a civil manner."]="来和我聊聊吧。让我们以文明的方式讨论一些事情。"
G["Come, speak with me! Let's sit down and talk. Have a beer together..."]="来，跟我谈谈吧！我们坐下来好好聊聊。一起喝一杯……"
G["Come, spirits - attend your master!"]="来吧，帮助你们的主人！"
G["Come, squire.  Adventure waits not!"]="Ven, $gescudero:escudera;. ¡La aventura no aguarda!"
G["Come, sssoftsskin. We have work for you to do!"]="来吧，软皮肤的。还有很多工作要做呢！"
G["Come, strangers. The spirit of da dragonhawk be hungry for worthy souls."]="过来，陌生人。龙鹰之圣魂已经饥渴太久了。"
G["Come, suffering... enter, chaos!"]="来吧，受苦吧……进入，混沌！"
G["Come, try again!"]="来吧，再试一次！"
G["Come, try your luck! Ha ha haaa..."]="来试试你的运气吧！哈哈哈哈哈……"
G["Come, user.  We prepare for escape protocol.  You use mount now, if you have one."]="来吧，用户。我们准备好了逃亡方案。如果你有坐骑，现在就使用它吧。"
G["Come, vrykul dogs. I will fight you!"]="来啊，维库人的走狗。我要把你们统统打趴下！"
G["Come, we've done enough damage here. Let's prepare another ambush."]="好了，我们已经在这里造成了足够的破坏。我们要准备进行另一场伏击了。"
G["Come, weakling! Strike me down!"]="过来，懦夫！来打败我啊！"
G["Come, you dwellers in the dark! Rally to my call!"]="来吧，黑暗中的潜伏者！听从我的召唤！"
G["Come."]="来吧。"
G["Come.  Let's put down these crude instruments and walk away from all of this.  It isn't why we came to Outland."]="过来。让我们放下这些拙劣的器械，然后远离这一切。这不是我们来外域的理由。"
G["Come. Let us go."]="来吧，我们走。"
G["Come. There is more to study than the secrets on the wind."]="过来。比起风中的秘密，我们还有更多的东西需要学习。"
G["Come. There's more havoc elsewhere on the ridge."]="来吧。这座山脊上的战斗还没结束呢。"
G["Come. We must continue. There is much to be done before we can pull Naralex from his nightmare."]="过来，我们一定要继续下去。在我们把纳拉雷克斯从噩梦中拯救出来之前还有很多事情要做。"
G["Come.... and die."]="来了……就得死。"
G["Comin' right up, yer highness! Is there anythin' else you'll be needin'? Perhaps yer hat cleaned or yer nails trimmed?"]="嘿，殿下！有什么事情可以为您效劳吗？帮您整理帽子或者修修指甲？"
G["Coming along nicely, but still needs..."]="进展顺利，但是还需要一些……"
G["Coming or going?"]="如何是好？"
G["Coming out of the gate is Colosos, the towering Grand Champion of the Exodar!"]="从大门中走出来的是克罗索斯，埃索达强大的总冠军！"
G["Coming out of the gate is Eressea Dawnsinger, skilled mage and Grand Champion of Silvermoon!"]="从大门中走出来的是埃蕾希·晨歌，强大的法师！银月城总冠军！"
G["Coming right up!"]="马上就来了！"
G["Coming through!"]="来了！"
G["Coming up on the Twilight Highlands, Captain."]="即将到达暮光高地，船长。"
G["Coming, momma!"]="过来了，妈妈！"
G["Command me, harvester!"]="收割者，我愿意听从你的吩咐！"
G["Commandeer those towers! Turn the anti-air batteries around and blast her from the sky!"]="占领那些塔楼！调转炮口，把她给我从天上打下来！"
G["Commander Scargash is filled with rage! Avoid his melee attacks!"]="指挥官斯卡格尔变得狂怒无比！避开他的近战攻击！"
G["Commander Shadowsong, what are the Marks of the World Tree?"]="影歌指挥官，什么是世界之树的印记？"
G["Commander Skyglaive is already workin' with a team of Explorer's League archaeologists at the dig site."]="指挥官天剑已经在挖掘场和一小队探险者协会的考古学家开展工作了。"
G["Commander Springvale is down that hall, heroes."]="指挥官斯普林瓦尔就在那座大厅里，英雄们。"
G["Commander! This fleshling rescued me!"]="长官！这个肉乎乎的人救了我！"
G["Commander, I lost my diving helmet."]="指挥官，我把潜水头盔弄丢了。"
G["Commander, behind you! Gnomeregan paratroopers!"]="长官，你身后！诺莫瑞根伞兵！"
G["Commander, sir! Cadet Torkus Jr. reporting for duty, sir!"]="指挥官阁下！托尔库斯二世向你报告！"
G["Commander, the time has come for the wolf riders to charge the enemy lines. Send the order."]="指挥官，是狼骑兵攻击敌人的时候啦。发出指令吧。"
