G["Commander, we're picking up an Alliance distress signal ahead."]="指挥官，前方收到联盟发出的呼救信号。"
G["Commander.  Move all forward regiments westward."]="指挥官，让所有前锋军团向西移动。"
G["Commander... I am not long for this world... Taken to a holding pen... hundreds... thousands... beings from other worlds... Imprisoned... Imprisoned by Ethereum. Many of them our allies. Must... Must save the others... It... It's not too late..."]="指挥官……我在这个世界中的时间不多了……监狱……成百……上千……从其它世界来的生物……被……被复仇军关押在那里。他们大部分是我们的朋友。必须……必须拯救他们……现在……现在还来得及……"
G["Commence Fire!"]="开始射击！"
G["Commence location defense."]="开启本地防御。"
G["Commencing decontamination sequence..."]="净化程序启动……"
G["Commencing transport. Destination, Windshear Crag."]="开始传送，目的地，狂风峭壁。"
G["Commencing watcher Freya status analysis."]="开始分析守护者弗蕾亚的状态。"
G["Commencing watcher Hodir status analysis."]="开始分析守护者霍迪尔的状态。"
G["Commencing watcher Mimiron status analysis."]="开始分析守护者米米尔隆的状态。"
G["Commencing watcher Thorim status analysis."]="开始分析守护者托里姆的状态。"
G["Commerce!  I crave it!"]="商业！我需要它！"
G["Common... such a crude language. Bandal!"]="通用语……多么粗俗的语言。Bandal！"
G["Commonly found on the lesser chromatic flight: Whelps, broodlings, lesser wyrmkin."]="通常在较小的多彩飞龙身上找到：幼龙，龙崽，较小的龙人。"
G["Company! Stay in sight, love, so that I can welcome you properly."]="嗨！别躲起来，可爱的家伙，让我好好地欢迎你。"
G["Company.. HALT!  ... Fall IN!"]="全队……立正！……集合！"
