G["Completion Event Forthcoming"]="最终结局即将到来。"
G["Compress the patient's chest to steadily improve their vitals."]="按压病人的胸膛以增强他们的生命体征。"
G["Compromise of complex detected, security override enabled - query permitted."]="检测到威胁，已启动安全控制 － 允许查询。"
G["Con...sume."]="吞……噬。"
G["Concentrate (on releasing me from this infernal prison) and try again later."]="集中注意力（把我从这个牢笼里放出来）然后再试试看。"
G["Concentrate everything on the armored drake!"]="集中火力攻击装甲巨龙！"
G["Concentrate your attacks on the weak!"]="集中攻击弱者！"
G["Concentrate your attacks upon the healer!"]="集中攻击那个医疗者！"
