G["Conduits offline."]="导管断线。"
G["Confess and we shall set you free."]="坦白交待了，我们就放你走。"
G["Confess your sins, and be forgiven!"]="忏悔你的罪行，求得宽恕吧！"
G["Confidence in your abilities will go a long way. Overconfidence will quickly get you killed."]="对自己的能力要有信心，这会让你一往无前。但过度自信会很快给你招来杀身之祸。"
G["Confirm Unlearn Talents"]="确认遗忘天赋"
G["Confirm Untrain Pet"]="确认遗忘宠物天赋"
G["Confirmed kill. Nice shooting."]="击中目标。打得真准。"
G["Confirmed."]="已确认。"
G["Conflict and strife have been our constant companions for as long as any of us can remember."]="在我们的记忆中，冲突和斗争一直如影随形。"
G["Confounded beasts! You'll pay for what you did to our fleet!"]="该死的怪物！你们对我的舰队所做的一切，我都会让你们十倍偿还！"
G["Cong siwang shangsheng, mogu!"]="[魔古语]Cong siwang shangsheng，mogu！"
G["Congratulations and may you be prosperous, $c."]="恭祝你春节快乐，并愿你一切顺利，$c。"
G["Congratulations on your lucky win.  May your gift packages be filled with dead moles."]="你赢了，算你走运。但愿你的礼物盒里装满死老鼠。"
G["Congratulations on your victory, Champion!"]="¡Enhorabuena por tu victoria, $gcampeón:campeona;!"
G["Congratulations to $n, victor of the Rumpus!"]="祝贺$n赢得这场战斗！"
G["Congratulations!"]="恭喜！"
G["Congratulations! A great victory has been won today."]="祝贺你！今天你赢得了一场伟大的胜利。"
G["Congratulations! Allow me to grant you a title befitting the amazing achievement you just performed. Henceforth you shall be known as the \"Slayer of Stupid, Incompetent, and Disappointing Minions.\""]="¡Enhorabuena! Permitidme que os conceda un título acorde con vuestra asombrosa proeza. A partir de ahora os conocerán como los \"Destripadores de esbirros estúpidos, incompetentes y decepcionantes\"."
G["Congratulations, $n! Try not to leave any bloody footprints outside of the arena."]="祝贺你，$n！请不要在场外留下血脚印。"
G["Congratulations, adventurer."]="Felicidades, $gaventurero:aventurera;."
G["Congratulations, please take the portal to Dalaran when you're ready!"]="祝贺，请在准备好之后进入这个通向达拉然的传送门！"
G["Congratulations, tamer!"]="恭喜你，驯宠师！"
G["Congratulations.  I've wanted to do that for years."]="恭喜。我想干掉他已经很久了。"
G["Congratulations. It smells worse in here than in the ruins."]="祝贺你，这里比废墟那里闻起来更糟。"
G["Congratulations. Today you will have the honor of fighting alongside me."]="祝贺你，今天你将得到与我一同作战的荣耀。"
G["Conjure the Torch of Retribution, Kalaran."]="制作惩戒火炬吧，卡拉然。"
G["Connor, I'm hungry."]="康诺，我饿了。"
G["Conquering a strange new land!"]="征服了陌生的新大陆！"
G["Conquest Quartermaster"]="征服军需官"
G["Conscripted from the mo'arg race, these warriors serve as the Legion's rank and file soldiers."]="他们是从莫尔葛种族中征募而来的战士，作为燃烧军团普通的士兵服役。"
G["Conserve your anger. Harness your rage. You will all have outlets for your frustrations soon enough."]="保留你的愤懑，压抑你的怒火吧，很快你们就只能体会到挫折感了。"
G["Consider all of the suffering that the Scarlets have caused over the years. The torture, the zealotry, the murder.\n\nI won't allow that to continue. Will you?"]="多年来，血色十字军酿造的惨剧简直不尽其数。他们沦为了痛苦、狂热与谋杀的代名词。\n\n我不能再让这样的悲剧继续重演。你觉得呢？"
G["Consider it done, Jeztor. Give me a beacon."]="没问题，杰斯托。给我一盏信号灯。"
G["Consider it done, sir."]="包在我身上，长官。"
G["Consider this a warm up!  Your real training will be far harsher!"]="把这当成热身运动好了！真正的训练远比这来得艰苦！"
G["Consider yourself fortunate that I was so merciful."]="你可真走运，我竟然如此心慈手软。"
G["Consider yourself lucky, mortal. At least your corpse is still somewhat presentable."]="你已经算幸运的了，凡人。至少你的尸体还比较完整。"
G["Consider yourselves lucky to be alive, Gilnean dogs!  Now get to work before we change our minds!"]="你能活着是你的运气，吉尔尼斯败狗！现在去工作吧，不要等我们改变主意！"
G["Conspiracies abound, I say.  There are those who lack vision in understanding what I do, and would seek to keep me shackled to obscurity!\n\nDon't step in the dirt."]="我感觉到处都是阴谋。还有那些对我所做的事情缺乏理解的家伙，他们想要把我关起来！\n\n你最好不要牵扯进来。"
G["Constant bickering will get us nowhere.  We need to take action."]="争吵不休对我们一点用都没有。我们需要的是实际行动。"
