G["Construct going offline *beep*"]="构造体即将关闭*哔*"
G["Construct is not authorized to communicate with lesser beings. Being must double their efforts."]="构造体不得与低等生物交谈。低等生物必须努力工作。"
G["Construct must not be questioned by iron dwarf servant. Commence deconstruction."]="构造体不解答铁矮人提出的任何问题。启动摧毁程序。"
G["Constructing defense mechanism."]="构建防御系统。"
G["Constructs, defend the capital at all costs!"]="构造体，要不惜一切代价保住我们的主城！"
G["Consume $n, my children!"]="我的孩子们，消灭$n！"
G["Consume..."]="吞噬……"
