G["Control yourselves! We're here for Godfrey's head above all else. Relish in the spoils of war later!"]="控制住你们自己！我们在这里唯一的目标是高弗雷的脑袋！其它战利品以后再拿！"
G["Convey my thanks to Lady Jaina and let her know that we will pursue the Defias and their backers until our liege is safely returned!"]="代我向吉安娜女士致谢。请转告她，在国王安全归来之前，我们不会停止对迪菲亚兄弟会及其支持组织的攻击。"
G["Coo Yah! There ya be!"]="耶！你在这里！"
G["Cook, sir."]="厨师，长官。"
G["Cook."]="厨师。"
G["Cooking"]="烹饪"
G["Cooking Supplies"]="烹饪补给品"
G["Cooking all of the things."]="把所有东西都给我煮了。"
G["Cooking for the King is an honor, not a job.  Do you have time to help me on some errands?"]="为国王料理膳食是份荣耀，可不是工作。你有时间帮我跑跑腿儿吗？"
G["Cooking is a lifelong pursuit and I see we share the same passion!"]="烹饪是我一生的追求，我觉得我们俩有共同的爱好！"
G["Cooking time with Ookie!"]="和乌克一起去烹饪！"
G["Cooking trainers are located in the kitchens of the Alliance and Horde inns in their respective quarters."]="你可以在联盟区和部落区旅店的厨房里找到烹饪训练师。"
G["Cooks are always looking for fresh vegetables. Anything you grow on your farm, you can use for cooking or sell to other cooks."]="厨师总在寻觅新鲜的蔬菜。不管你在农场上种了什么，都能用于烹饪，或是出售给其他厨师。"
G["Cool stuff will happen here! Explosions!"]="好戏即将上演！爆炸！"
G["Cool your heels!\n\n<Bodley grumbles something under his breath about the impatience of the living>\n\nAs I was saying, Lord Valthalak's spirit and spectral assassins, summoned forth through his necromantic dabbling, started to assail us. Let me tell you, at that point we weren't in any condition to fight back, so we ran. I can still remember Mor Grayhoof, one of our druids, slip and fall at one point into the lower reaches of the spire.\n\nThe rest as they say, is history."]="¡Para el carro!\n\n<Bodley se queja por lo bajo de la impaciencia de los vivos>\n\nComo iba diciendo, el espíritu de Lord Valthalak y los asesinos espectrales que este invocó a través de prácticas de nigromancia, empezaron a atacarnos. Créeme, en ese momento no estábamos en condiciones de seguir luchando así que huimos. Todavía recuerdo cómo Mor Pezuña Gris, uno de nuestros druidas, resbaló y cayó montaña abajo.\n\nLo demás, como suelen decir, ya es historia."
G["Cool!"]="真酷！"
G["Cool."]="酷。"
G["Copy that, Araxes. Backup is on the way. Hold your position. I repeat, hold your position."]="收到，阿拉克塞。增援正在赶来。守住你的位置。我重复一遍，守住你的位置。"
G["Copy. Status report, soldier."]="收到。状况报告，士兵。"
G["Corastrasza is understandably upset. Under her care was the one black dragon egg that we believe was free of the taint of Deathwing's corruption..."]="科拉丝塔萨的焦虑也是可以理解的。毕竟她照料着唯一一枚没有被死亡之翼的堕落所腐蚀的黑龙蛋……"
G["Corbett, dear.  Harlan needs a load of knitted shirts and pants as soon as we can manage."]="亲爱的科贝特，哈兰要我们尽快给他送些衬衣和短裤过去。"
G["Corbett, you there?  Harlan needs another load of knitted goods.  Can you take it to him?"]="科贝特，你在吗？哈兰还需要一些针织品。你能给他带一些过去吗？"
G["Core Hound"]="熔岩犬"
G["Core Spiders appear from the lava!"]="地核蜘蛛从熔岩中爬出来了！"
G["Core overload detected. Recharging..."]="核心超出负荷。检测到系统故障……"
G["Core overload detected. System malfunction detected..."]="核心超出负荷。检测到系统故障……"
G["Corpse Scarabs appear from a Crypt Guard's corpse!"]="地穴卫士的尸体上爬出了死尸甲虫！"
G["Corpse go boom!"]="要爆炸啦！"
G["Corpse-men take Koroth's banner!  Corpse-men get smashed to bitses!!!"]="丧尸人抢了克洛斯的旗帜！丧尸人要被打成碎片了！！！"
G["Correct!"]="正确！"
G["Correct. Creators neutralized parasitic threat and contained it within the host. Forge of Wills and other systems were instituted to create new earthen. Safeguards were implemented, and protectors were appointed."]="正确。造物主决定中和寄生体的威胁，并将其封锁在宿主内部。之后，包括意志熔炉在内的各系统受命开始创造新的土灵。植入了新的安全机制，并任命了守护者。"
G["Correct. You've been listening! This minnow is really quite a terrible creature of my own creation. When I am relaxing I like to think of the unlucky fishermen who have run into this minnow and been devoured whole. I bet they were quite surprised!\n\n<Azuregos laughs.>"]="没错。你一直在认真听我说话！在我创造的生物当中，这条米诺鱼算得上是一个相当可怕的家伙了。每当我放松休息的时候，我就喜欢想象那些不幸的渔民，想象他们碰到这条鱼，然后被完全吞掉的样子。我敢打赌他们会对此惊讶万分的！\n\n<艾索雷葛斯大笑起来。>"
G["Correction. We're gonna do TWO things:"]="更正一下。我们要做两件事："
G["Corrupted Hippogryph"]="堕落角鹰兽"
G["Corruption CONSUMES you!"]="让腐蚀吞噬你！"
G["Corruption found. External influence gaining control over watchers. Sigils compromised."]="检测到腐蚀。外部影响已经控制了守护者。徽记受到威胁。"
G["Corruption this deep could not have come from outside."]="如此程度的腐化不可能源自外部。"
G["Could I get a boat ride to Eastern Plaguelands, please?"]="我能乘船去东瘟疫之地吗？"
G["Could I have a Fuzzy Peach for Ella?"]="我能帮艾拉拿个毛桃吗？"
G["Could I have a copy of \"The Feast of Winter Veil\" to read?"]="Me gustaría leer un ejemplar de \"El festín del Festival de Invierno\", si es posible."
G["Could be worse, your wife coulda ran off to Stormwind with some cheese merchant!"]="可能更糟，你的妻子可能会和什么奶酪商人私奔去暴风城！"
G["Could it be, Lord Fordring? If Bolvar lives, mayhap there is hope fer peace between the Alliance and the Horde. We must reach the top o' this cursed place and free the paladin!"]="弗丁领主，这是真的？如果伯瓦尔还活着，也许联盟和部落之间还有和平的希望。我们必须冲到堡垒顶层，救出圣骑士！"
G["Could it be? Can the jinyu really tap into the water's power that easily?"]="可能吗？锦鱼人难道真能轻易接触到水的力量？"
G["Could it be? One that passes through these halls with a purpose? Aye, a righteous fire burns in your belly, $r.\n\nMy life may soon end, but the knowledge I hold must be shared with the world. It is, after all, why I am here now.\n\nAre you a master of a trade?"]="真的吗？某个带着理想穿过这些大厅的$r？啊，正义之火正在你心中熊熊燃烧着。\n\n我的生命很快就要终结了，但我家世代传承下来的智慧必须延续下去。这就是我来这里的所有原因。\n\n你有精通任何制造技巧吗？"
G["Could it really be? The son of Durotan?"]="真的是杜隆坦的儿子？"
G["Could night elf saboteurs be behind this?  I doubt it.  With the load we've been putting on the West Sanctum it was only a matter of time until something went wrong."]="是不是暗夜精灵破坏者在捣鬼？很难说。我们施加在西部圣殿的流量如此大，发生故障只是时间问题而已。"
G["Could the waters of this vale be the fabled \"Pools of Youth?\" Perhaps immortality is within our grasp once again..."]="¿Podría ser que las aguas de este valle fueran las legendarias \"Pozas de la Juventud\"? Quizá podamos disfrutar de la inmortalidad de nuevo..."
G["Could they have been saved?"]="他们没救了吗？"
G["Could use a little..."]="可以考虑加点……"
G["Could we fly higher?"]="我们能飞得更高一些吗？"
G["Could ya imagine such a thing, Hal? Could ya?"]="你能想象这件事吗，哈尔？你能吗？"
G["Could ye spare some coin?"]="你能不能施舍一些硬币？"
G["Could you come back later? I am busy training my cloud serpent right now. I must work harder if I wish to beat the others."]="你能稍后再来吗？我正在忙着训练我的云端翔龙。要是我想击败对手，就必须得加把劲。"
G["Could you forsee this, fool?"]="你能预料到吗，傻瓜？"
G["Could you go get me a drink? I'd do it myself, but I'm working on my tan."]="能给我拿些喝的来吗？我正在晒日光浴，没法去拿饮料。"
G["Could you help with this please? I don't have unlimited mana."]="你能帮帮我吗？我的法力是有限的。"
G["Could you help with this please? I don't have unlimited mana.\n\nOf course, if you need some training...."]="¿Podrías ayudarme con esto? No tengo maná ilimitado."
G["Could you imagine what his empire would be like today if it had not been overthrown and hidden by the pandaren?"]="要不是被熊猫人推翻并掩盖起来，他的帝国到今天会变成什么样子呢？"
G["Could you imagine what the material manifestation of the Light could do against the undead?"]="你们能否想象圣光的实体会对亡灵造成什么样的破坏？"
G["Could you please resummon the Un'Goro Examinant?"]="你能重新召唤安戈洛测试者吗？"
G["Could you please send me to Moonglade, Emissary?"]="能不能派我去月光林地，使者？"
G["Could you repair my gear, Argus?"]="你能修好我的设备吗，阿古斯？"
G["Could you show me around?"]="你能带我四处转转吗？"
G["Could you sing it once more, for the students who just arrived?"]="你能再唱一遍吗，唱给那些刚刚到来的弟子听？"
G["Could you spare a gold?"]="你能给我一枚金币吗？"
G["Could you spare two of your fine tents, Asaq?"]="你愿意让出两个优质帐篷吗，阿萨克？"
G["Could you transport me to the pylon up above?"]="你能把我传送到上面的水晶塔那儿去吗？"
G["Could you try to be a little quieter?"]="你不能稍微安静一点吗？"
G["Could... Could it be over? Is he destroyed?"]="这……这一切都结束了？他被消灭了？"
G["Couldn't ask for a nicer day!"]="没有比这更好的天气了！"
G["Couldn't deal with our explosive tempers, huh?!"]="受不了我们的火爆脾气了，嗯？！"
G["Couldn't get enough, could ya?"]="欲罢不能，对吧？"
G["Couldn't have done better myself, my $g boy : girl;! Now, let's get down to business."]="换我自己做也不过如此了，我的$g小男孩:小姑娘;！我们现在做正事吧。"
G["Couldn't have done that better myself.\n\nWell, probably not."]="我自己没法做得更好。\n\n嗯，也许不能。"
G["Couldn't have said it better myself."]="在我看来，已经非常完美了。"
G["Couldn't wait for me to be out of the way so that you could sieze control?"]="你迫不及待地想要除掉我，然后独揽大权是吗？"
G["Couldn't you have just used a crowbar?"]="你就不能用一下撬棍么？"
G["Couldn't you raise them?"]="你不能养育他们吗？"
G["Count yourself blessed that I fear the wrath of Kael'thas more than death, else I would break from this channel and disintigrate you."]="你应该为自己感到庆幸，比起死亡来，我更畏惧凯尔萨斯的愤怒，否则我就会从这里面出来，把你撕成碎片。"
G["Countdown to February 16th, 2007: $4262d\nRaw number: $4262e"]="Cuenta atrás hasta el 16 de febrero de 2007: $4262d\nNúmero en bruto: $4262e"
G["Countermeasures successful."]="反制成功。"
G["Counting is fun!"]="数数最好玩了！"
G["Countless threads are woven to create the fabric of our timeline."]="无数的时间线编织成了我们的时光之网。"
G["Countless... countless lives... *cough*"]="数不清的……数不清的……*咳嗽*"
G["Couple more minutes and I'll--"]="再给我几分钟，马上就能……啊噢……"
G["Courage, Teng! The Applebloom family cider is at stake!"]="拿出勇气来，邓！苹花家的甜酒危在旦夕！"
G["Courage, brothers! Press on!"]="勇敢点，兄弟们！前进！"
G["Course I can show ye where Myolor is. Right over there near the anvil of the Great Forge, that's where he does his work. Listen to his words well $g lad:lass;, Myolor is as skilled as they come."]="Por supuesto que te puedo decir dónde encontrar a Myolor. Justo allí, cerca del yunque de la Gran Fundición, ahí es donde trabaja. Pon mucha atención a lo que dice $gmuchacho:muchacha;, Myolor es un gran experto."
G["Course I remember that night. Two inches to the left and you'd be drinking with that elf, Morris. That was my best shirt, too."]="我当然记得那晚的情形。你就在我左边两英尺左右的地方，一直和那个名叫莫里斯的精灵在喝酒。那晚我还穿着我最好的衬衫哪。"
G["Course complete!"]="路线完成！"
G["Course she's goin' ta feel upset. Course she's got a right to throw those nasty Sunreavers out o' Dalaran."]="她当然会感到气愤啦。她当然有权利把那些卑鄙的夺日者赶出达拉然。"
G["Cousin Bluesaddle... you are too persistent. And you are being mean to the $r."]="Primo Sillín Azul... Eres demasiado persistente. Y te estás portando mal con $gel:la; $r."
G["Cousin! You are well?"]="表哥！你还好吗？"
G["Cover fire, now!"]="掩护射击！"
G["Cover me!"]="掩护我！"
G["Cover me, I'm making a break for it!"]="掩护我，我在趁机逃跑！"
G["Cover me, soldier! I have to make it back to our base and get the fleet prepped for an aerial assault!"]="掩护我，士兵！我必须返回基地并让空军做好战斗准备！"
G["Cover me, we have to do this quickly. Once I blow the support on this side, it will disrupt the energy beams and she'll break out! I doubt very much that she'll be happy to see us."]="掩护我，我们必须再快点。一旦我炸开了这边，就会破坏能量光束，她一定会冲出来的！我想她不会很高兴见到我们的。"
G["Cover my butt in case we're ambushed."]="万一我们遭到伏击，记得掩护我。"
G["Cover one another! Stand your ground!"]="互相掩护！坚守阵地！"
G["Cover the door - we've got him!"]="守住门——我们抓到他了！"
G["Cover the rear! Alexstrasza's brood decimate our ranks!"]="掩护后方！阿莱克丝塔萨的爪牙正在杀死我们的士兵！"
G["Coward!"]="懦夫！"
G["Coward! You cannot run!"]="懦夫！你逃不掉！"
G["Cowardly dog. Run back to your mommy and hide."]="懦弱的狗子。回到你妈妈那里去，好好地躲起来吧。"
G["Cowardly dogs!"]="胆小鼠辈！"
G["Cowardly dogs! Ye blindsided us!"]="卑鄙的家伙！竟敢偷袭我们！"
G["Cowards don't get to return home."]="懦夫不应该回家。"
G["Cowards!"]="胆小鬼！"
G["Cowards!  I will not fall so easily into your trap!"]="懦夫！我可不会这么容易就掉进你们的陷阱！"
G["Cowards! Face the brood mother or face DIRE consequences!"]="懦夫！面对龙巢之母或是万劫不复！"
G["Cowards! Wretches!"]="懦夫！胆小鬼！"
G["Cowards! You pack of weakling... dogs..."]="懦夫！你们这群懦弱的……走狗……"
G["Cowards! You'll never draw me into the shadows!"]="懦夫！你们休想把我拉进阴影中！"
G["Cowards. Weaklings. Come down and fight, or I will bring you down."]="懦夫。弱者。下来与我一战，否则我就“送”你们下来。"
G["Cower as the very ground reaches up to swallow you!"]="在即将吞噬你的大地之前畏缩吧！"
G["Cower at the sight of your own doom!"]="在死亡面前畏缩吧！"
G["Cower at your own folly!"]="愚不可及，自作自受！"
G["Cower before me, runt!"]="颤抖吧，鼠辈！"
G["Cower before me, supplicant!"]="在我面前颤抖吧，懦夫！"
G["Cower before my might!"]="屈服于我的力量！"
G["Cower before my terrible creations!"]="在我的恐怖造物面前颤抖吧！"
G["Cower before my true form."]="在我的真正形态面前颤抖吧。"
G["Cower before our might! Flee! There will be no victory for the living!"]="臣服在我们的力量面前吧！活人永远不可能取得胜利！"
G["Cower before the Horde!"]="在部落的力量面前颤抖吧！"
G["Cower before the tempest storm!"]="在风暴中颤抖吧！"
G["Cower in hiding, heh."]="在角落里发抖吧，哼。"
G["Cower, heathens, for a Scarlet Lord has joined the battle!"]="颤抖吧，异教徒！一名十字军领主加入了战斗！"
G["Cower, little worms!  Your feeble heroes are nothing!  Your saviors will be our first feast!"]="逃吧，蠕虫们！你们软弱的英雄不值一提！你们的救星将会成为我们的开胃菜！"
G["Cower, monster, as I summon a veritable army of Wolfoids!"]="战栗吧，怪物，看我召唤出一支机械狼人的大军！"
G["Crab"]="螃蟹"
G["Crackling... howling... the screams... always screaming..."]="爆裂……吼叫……哀嚎……永远的哀嚎……"
G["Crafted from the same vines as Razorfen Kraul, Razorfen Downs is the traditional capital city of the quilboar race. The sprawling, thorn-ridden labyrinth houses a veritable army of loyal quilboar as well as their high priests - the Death's Head tribe. Recently, however, a looming shadow has fallen over the crude den. Agents of the undead Scourge - led by the lich, Amnennar the Coldbringer - have taken control over the quilboar race and turned the maze of thorns into a bastion of undead might."]="剃刀高地和剃刀沼泽一样由巨大的藤蔓组成，剃刀高地是野猪人的传统都城。在那错综复杂的荆棘迷宫中居住着大群忠诚的野猪人军队，以及他们的高等祭司——亡首部族。然而最近，一股黑暗的力量笼罩了这座原始的洞穴。天谴军团的爪牙在巫妖寒冰之王亚门纳尔的带领下控制了野猪部族，并将布满荆棘的迷宫变成了亡灵力量的堡垒。现在野猪人正在奋力战斗来夺回他们的城市，并阻止亚门纳尔继续控制贫瘠之地。"
G["Crafty, I lost my Warsong orc disguise."]="沃比斯波基，我弄丢了战歌兽人伪装。"
G["Crafty, I need another Warsong banner."]="沃比斯波基，我需要一面战歌旗帜。"
G["Craig Nollward works the inn's kitchen. He'll be able to help you."]="克莱格·诺瓦德就在旅店的厨房里工作。他可以帮你。"
G["Crane"]="仙鹤"
G["Crap!"]="见鬼！"
G["Crap!  That was my last lock pick!"]="该死！那是我最后一把开锁器了！"
G["Crash imminent *clunk*"]="即将坠毁*咣*"
G["Crash, get out of there!!!  Oh no!!!  Not another of my proteges!!!"]="克拉，离开那里！！！不！我的又一个保护人！！"
G["Crate? I didn't send you a crate, Jovaan. Don't you have more important things to worry about? Go see to them!"]="箱子？我没有给你箱子啊，约瓦安。你是不是应该去关心点别的？去工作！"
G["Craven."]="人穷志短。"
G["Craven?! I am most certainly not! Are we not in the middle of a war z... ah."]="你才人穷志短呢？！玩文字接龙的时候干嘛提这个……啊。"
G["Craziest thing - No matter how many bottles I take from the stockpile, the quantity on hand never decreases. It's like I'm stuck in some endless loop of actions..."]="最疯狂的是，无论我从库存里面拿出多少瓶子，那边的数量永远不会减少。好像我陷在某个无尽的循环中无法脱身了……"
G["Crazy nibblers! Give them a whoopin' , $p!"]="这些发疯的蜘蛛！给它们点颜色瞧瞧，$p！"
G["Crazy, isn't it?"]="太疯狂了，不是吗？"
G["Creaking echoes off of the nearby structures as the Iron Watcher comes to life."]="钢铁观察者苏醒时，附近的建筑物嘎吱作响。"
G["Create Rubbing"]="制造拓片"
G["Create a distraction so that you and Jorgensen can slip by unnoticed.|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_ROGUE_BLOODYEYE.BLP:16|t"]="分散敌人的注意力，以便使约根森和你能悄悄过去。|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_ROGUE_BLOODYEYE.BLP:16|t"
G["Create the destiny you seek!"]="去创造你想要的命运吧！"
G["Created by the titans themselves, Val'anyr was given to the first earthen king, Urel Stoneheart. With the hammer he was to create and give life to the rest of his brethren."]="泰坦亲自铸造了瓦兰奈尔，并将其交给了第一位土灵之王，尤雷尔·石心。通过这柄圣锤，他可以制造新的土灵，并赐予他们生命。"
G["Creation of Jewelry and Gems is what I live for. Can I share my passion with you?"]="制造珠宝和雕琢宝石是我生存的理由。想让我把这种激情分享给你吗？"
G["Creepy, aren't they? Never seen 'em before, but I've been pulling 'em in all day."]="他们让人不寒而栗，你说呢？我从来没有见过他们，但我一直在追捕他们。"
G["Crewman, show this ant the might of the Kvaldir!"]="水手们，让这只蝼蚁见识一下克瓦迪尔的强大力量！"
G["Crewman, tear this land walker apart!"]="水手们，把这只旱鸭子撕成碎片！"
G["Crimson Ring."]="深红之环。"
G["Crimson Templar!  I hold your crest of beckoning.  Heed my summons!"]="赤红圣殿骑士！我手中握着你的召唤纹章。响应我的召唤吧！"
G["Crimson fever."]="血红热。"
