G["Crocolisk"]="鳄鱼"
G["Cromush! What happened?"]="克鲁姆什！出了什么事？"
G["Cromush! What're you doing here? This is a covert operation!"]="克鲁姆什！你在这里干什么？这是一次秘密行动！"
G["Cromush, you stay behind and make sure the Banshee Queen is well \"guarded.\" I will be expecting a full report when next we meet."]="Cromush, tú quédate atrás y asegúrate de que la Reina alma en pena está bien \"custodiada\". La próxima vez que nos veamos, quiero un informe completo."
G["Crops wilted, villages burned, and families wandered endlessly to seek refuge from the flames..."]="庄稼枯萎，村庄燃烧，家家户户背井离乡，不断地躲避着烈焰的侵扰……<爆炸打断了他的话>"
G["Cross me, and your punishment shall be far greater than the madness he suffered."]="如果与我作对，你受到的惩罚将比你父亲的更可怕。"
G["Crossbow"]="弩"
G["Crossing the Shado-Pan was a bad idea."]="招惹影踪派可不太明智。"
G["Crowley is a disgrace to our kind for giving in to the Forsaken. My pack will show them the true face of the worgen and the relentless fury that comes with our presence!"]="克罗雷竟然向被遗忘者屈服了。他真是我们一族的耻辱。我们要让他们看看什么才是真正的狼人，要让他们尝尝我们无情的怒火！"
G["Crowley!  You and your elven allies are hereby ordered to serve along the king's army.  Cursed or not, you are still bound by Gilnean law!"]="克罗雷！你和你的精灵盟友将与国王的军队并肩战斗。不管你是不是受到了诅咒，你仍然受到吉尔尼斯法律的约束！"
G["Crowley!  You've done enough.  I cannot allow you to stay behind again..."]="克罗雷！你付出的已经太多了。我不能再把你丢下……"
G["Crowley's troops are up ahead!  Press on!"]="克罗雷的部队就在前面！继续前进！"
G["Crowley, your forces have fallen before my mighty army. You have lost!"]="克罗雷，你的部众已在我强大的军队面前落败了。你输了！"
G["Crowley? I knew him. He was nothing more than a criminal before the curse took hold of our land. Now he's a great worgen hero? Sickening..."]="克罗雷？我认识他。在我们的国土遭受诅咒之前，他只不过是一名罪犯。而现在，他成为了伟大的狼人英雄？真令人作呕……"
G["Crown of Heaven"]="苍穹之冠"
G["Crudbeard? You are one ugly little girl. I didn't even know they let little girls become death knights. Was the Lich King trying to meet his quota when he made you or something? I would have thrown you back."]="渣胡？你只是个丑陋的小女孩。我还不知道他们会让小女孩也能成为死亡骑士。难道巫妖王这么着急扩充队伍吗？我要让你明白，你到底是个什么货色。"
G["Crumble and rot!"]="崩溃吧！腐烂吧！"
G["Crumbling earth, plagued with rust!"]="崩解之地，锈蚀万物！"
G["Crunchy bugs so delicious. Want?"]="这些虫虫又脆又美味。要不要来点？"
G["Crusader! Take this wood and light a fire for the troops."]="北伐军！点燃这截木头，为军队提供照明。"
G["Crusaders and combatants, a true hero stands before you this day! $n, of the Silver Covenant, has restored the ancient blade of Quel'Delar as a symbol of our resolve to defeat the Lich King!"]="¡Cruzados, combatientes, hoy se alza $gun gran héroe:una gran heroína; ante vosotros! ¡$n, de El Pacto de Plata, ha restaurado la antigua espada de Quel'Delar como símbolo de nuestra determinación de vencer al Rey Exánime!"
G["Crusaders and combatants, a true hero stands before you this day! $n, of the Sunreavers, has restored the ancient blade of Quel'Delar as a symbol of our resolve to defeat the Lich King!"]="¡Cruzados, combatientes, hoy se alza $gun gran héroe:una gran heroína; ante vosotros! ¡$n, de los Atracasol, ha restaurado la antigua espada de Quel'Delar como símbolo de nuestra determinación de vencer al Rey Exánime!"
G["Crusaders...\n\n<Rivendare shakes his head.>\n\nI am convinced that they are a unique lot amongst the humans. My theory is that they lack higher brain function, unable to logically assess a situation and calculate an outcome. One has only to make mention of the Light to get them frothing and battle ready - at which point they will rush headlong into any engagement with complete disregard for their own well being."]="十字军……\n\n<瑞文戴尔男爵摇了摇头。>\n\n他们是一群特殊的人类。在我看来，十字军似乎不具备高等智慧，他们无法理智地评估局势并计算得失。只要提到圣光，就能让他们群情激昂——接着，这帮家伙会完全无视自己的利益，盲目地投身战斗。"
G["Crush and clobber! Bobber slobber!"]="痛快痛快！口水横流！"
G["Crush anything that stands in your path!  For the Lich King!"]="毁灭所有阻挡你们前进的生物！为巫妖王而战！"
G["Crush the children of stone, my iron brethren!"]="同胞们，消灭岩石的子嗣！"
G["Crush the intruders. The barrier must not fall."]="碾碎入侵者。别让屏障关闭。"
G["Crush the small one!"]="碾碎这些小矮子！"
G["Crush them all!"]="把他们全都干掉！"
G["Crush them with iron! Drown them in blood!"]="用钢铁碾碎他们！用血海湮没他们！"
G["Crush them!"]="毁灭他们！"
G["Crush them!  Crush their faces!"]="把他们打成肉酱！把他们的脸打扁！"
G["Crush them! Bleed them!"]="碾碎他们！撕裂他们！"
G["Crush them! I take fragment to Stone Mother."]="碾碎他们！我去把碎片送到石母手里。"
G["Crush them!!!"]="干掉他们！"
G["Crush these Nethergarde maggots!"]="碾死这群守望堡蛆虫！"
G["Crush these elementals, $n!  Drive them from our land!"]="碾碎这些元素，$n！把它们从我们的土地上驱逐出去！"
G["Crush these invaders, and hurl them from the wall!"]="碾碎入侵者，把他们从城墙上丢下去！"
