G["Crush your bones!"]="碾碎你的骨头！"
G["Crush!"]="死吧！"
G["Crush, crush... crush."]="碾碎，碾碎，碾碎！"
G["Crush... maim... DESTROY!"]="碾碎你……毁灭！"
