G["Crybaby! Crybaby!"]="娇气包！娇气包！"
G["Crystal Restore is a difficult item to acquire.\n\nI believe that it comes from Un'Goro Crater, so you'd best head there."]="恢复水晶很难入手。\n\n我相信它来自安戈洛环形山，你最好去那儿看看。"
