G["Cult? I don't know. Seen some suspicious types lingering around the south zeppelin tower, though."]="教派？我不知道。不过似乎有些可疑分子在南飞艇塔附近晃来晃去。"
G["Culuthas where have you gone?!"]="库鲁萨斯，你去哪儿了？！"
G["Culuthas, deliver the crystal to me now!"]="库鲁萨斯，现在把水晶给我！"
