G["Culuthas, you will return the crystal to me at once!"]="库鲁萨斯，你会马上把水晶还给我的！"
G["Cunning Pet"]="狡诈宠物"
G["Cunning and precise, the Wrathguard often protect the Legion's eredar masters."]="狡猾而纪律严明的愤怒卫士一直在保护着燃烧军团的艾瑞达主人们。"
G["Curator is no longer operation-a-l."]="馆长无法继续运……作……"
G["Curious weapons you wield... such power."]="你的武器很特别……很强大。"
G["Curious. A Servitor of Rastakhan that does not know the Hakkari do not converse in the old tongue?"]="奇怪。一个对哈卡一无所知的拉斯塔哈的仆从竟然不用古语交谈？"
G["Curious... Windsor, in this vision, did you survive? I only ask because one thing that I can and will assure is your death. Here and now."]="我好奇的是……温德索尔，在那个幻象中，你最终有没有活下来？我之所以这样问，是因为我可以确保你今天死定了。就是现在。"
G["Curiously the bird does not become flame and ash.  A phoenix that does not become flame and ash 'pon its slaying is a dire omen indeed."]="奇怪的是，那只鸟并没有变成火焰和灰烬。一只凤凰在死亡时没有变成火焰和灰烬，这是一个可怕的预兆。"
G["Curse my dwarven luck!"]="我这该死的运气！"
G["Curse that frog!  Yes, I joined the Southsea crew - you want to make something of it, mate?  I'll cut you down here and now!"]="¡Maldita rana! Sí, me uní a la tripulasión del Mar del Sur; ¿tienes algo que decir tú, $gcompadre:chama;? ¡Te rajaré aquí y ahora!"
G["Curse the Dragonmaw!\n\nThey kill our birds, attack our families, take our land. Even as the world crashes down around us, still they assault our homes.\n\nIf your Alliance wants the help of the Wildhammer, there's only one way to win us over: Stop. The. Dragonmaw."]="该死的龙喉渣滓！\n\n他们屠戮我们的鸟禽，攻击我们的亲人，夺取我们的土地。就在这世界分崩离析之时，他们还在袭击我们的家园。\n\n要是你们这群联盟想要获取蛮锤的帮助，就只有一条途径能让我们颔首——阻——止——龙喉。"
G["Curse the wretched Horde! I would have died without you!"]="诅咒该死的部落！要不是有你在，我早就死了！"
G["Curse these mantid! All remaining air units, get to those towers and take them out!"]="这些该死的螳螂妖！所有空中作战单位，摧毁那些塔楼！"
G["Curse this chitinous shell, I was not fast enough!"]="这该死的甲壳，我还不够快！"
G["Curse this foul cage..."]="诅咒这个肮脏的笼子……"
G["Curse this frozen land!  We'll never move these meatwagons to the front!"]="诅咒这片冻土！我们的绞肉车还怎么上前线！"
G["Curse this land.  We can't stay here."]="诅咒这片土地，我们不能留在这里。"
G["Curse this twisting of the night. The candy's good, though."]="让这个变态的夜晚去见鬼吧。不过，糖倒是真不错。"
G["Curse you!"]="诅咒你！"
G["Curse you!  You will not treat me like a beast!"]="该死的！你不能把我当牲口一样对待！"
G["Curse you, $n!  One day, vengeance will be mine!"]="我要诅咒你，$n！总有一天我会复仇的。"
G["Curse you, $r vermin! This forest belongs to the Kaldorei..."]="¡$gMaldito:Maldita; seas, alimaña $r! Este bosque pertenece a los kaldorei..."
G["Curse you, Akama!  I am not a pawn in your game... my will is my own.  When I unleash my wrath upon Illidan it will have nothing to do with your foolish scheme!"]="我诅咒你，阿卡玛！我不是你的棋子……我有我自己的意志。当我对伊利丹倾泻我的愤怒时，那必定和你愚蠢的阴谋没有任何关系！"
G["Curse you, Halyndor!  You led us to our doom!"]="哈林多尔，我诅咒你！你把厄运带给了我们！"
G["Curse you, coward..."]="我诅咒你，懦夫……"
G["Curse you, mortal."]="诅咒你，凡人。"
G["Curse you, mortals! Such a callous disregard for one's possessions must be met with extreme force!"]="诅咒你们，凡人！你们丝毫不尊重他人财产的行为必须受到严厉处罚！"
G["Curse your eyes, $r!"]="诅咒你的眼睛，$r！"
G["Curse? What's going on here, Fairbanks?"]="诅咒？这里究竟发生了些什么，法尔班克斯？"
G["Cursed giant-men!  If they want a fight, a fight they'll get!"]="该死的巨人！如果他们想打仗，那就打吧！"
G["Cursed scum!"]="你们这群被诅咒的蠕虫！"
G["Cursed spirits! Let go of the past! The Crystal of Zin-Malor no longer binds you!"]="被诅咒的灵魂！忘记过去吧！辛玛洛水晶已经不再束缚你们了！"
G["Cursed to roam the earth forever...not even poor Fitzsimmons could escape."]="被诅咒者只能永远在这里徘徊……就连可怜的菲兹莫斯也无法逃脱。"
G["Curses!"]="该死！"
G["Curses!  More data lost to an untimely death."]="该死！早夭导致数据丢失了。"
G["Curses!  We might as well dismantle these for parts!  They're useless to us."]="见鬼！还不如把这些东西拆成零件好了！它们根本毫无用处。"
G["Curses!  Who killed the human!?  This is not good!"]="该死的！是谁杀死了那个人类？这可不好！"
G["Curses! We had to fall back. But Thermaplugg's lost, and he knows it...he's only bought himself time."]="见鬼！我们必须撤退。但瑟玛普拉格已经失败了。他清楚这一点……现在他只是在垂死挣扎。"
G["Customers will line up and wait for you to tell them to sit down. They will only wait for a short while before leaving so be sure to get them to a seat before they leave."]="客人们会排队等待你的招呼。但他们只愿意等一小会儿，所以你必须在他们离开之前招呼他们入座。"
G["Cut down in its prime..."]="见好就收……"
G["Cut down the forest! Flush the elves out!"]="砍倒那片森林！把精灵赶出来！"
G["Cut it out guys!  Quit interrupting!"]="闭上嘴！别打断我！"
G["Cut it out!"]="快停下！"
G["Cut the chatter, kid. I need to stable my pet."]="别罗嗦了，孩子，我要寄存我的宠物。"
G["Cut the chatter, people. Eyes on the target!"]="别啰嗦了，伙计们。瞄准目标！"
G["Cut them down, Battlemaiden!"]="消灭他们，女武士！"
G["Cut them down. Show them our might!"]="消灭他们。让他们看看我们的力量！"
G["Cut this one down from the shadows."]="从阴影中突袭，干掉他。"
G["Cut, bruised, and covered with blood - looks like we have a new winner!"]="这家伙全身都是割伤、瘀伤和血污。看样子，我们有了一个新的胜利者！"
G["Cuz there's a new Ook in town..."]="镇上出了位新乌克……"
G["Cyndra's knowledge in alchemy is somewhat limited, but I'm sure it would be sufficient to get you started.  She practices her craft just east of the Inn in Dolanaar."]="塞恩德拉在炼金术方面的知识有些局限，但是我相信那也足够领你入门了。她就在多兰纳尔旅店的东面。"
G["Cyrukh comes for you!"]="森卢肯来取你们的性命了！"
