G["D'ye hear it, $n? The beating of great leathery wings over the treetops... Narkrall is closing in."]="你听到了吗，$n？树梢上传来了拍击翅膀的声音……纳克拉尔来了。"
G["D'you think it's from a dragon? Or maybe a giant!"]="你猜，它会不会来自一条巨龙？或者是一个巨人？"
G["D-don't come any closer!"]="别过来！"
G["D... Dying..."]="快……快死了……"
