G["DAMN RIGHT! We'll show 'em why you don't cross the Dark Iron dwarves!"]="对极了！我们得让这帮家伙明白，和黑铁矮人作对没什么好下场！"
G["DAMN ROCK WON'T BUDGE!"]="该死的石头，就是不动！"
G["DARKSHIRE...I HUNGER!!"]="夜色镇……我饿了！！"
G["DEATH FROM ABOVE!"]="死从天降！"
G["DEATH WAS TOO GOOD FOR BLACKMOORE. ANYONE WHO WOULD ENSLAVE ANOTHER... DESERVES WORSE THAN DEATH!"]="死亡对布莱克摩尔太仁慈了。奴役他人者的下场应该比死亡更可怕！"
G["DELICIOUS!"]="真好喝！"
G["DESTROY THEM ALL!"]="把他们全都干掉！"
G["DESTROY!"]="毁灭！"
G["DESTROY..."]="毁灭……"
G["DESTROYED! DOMINATED! DECIMATED! DELICIOUSLY DISMEMBERED! You do it just like I like it!"]="摧毁！统治！征服！美妙的胜利！你所做的正是我的最爱！"
