G["Dajik been seeing a lot more furless things like you. Frenzyheart not like giving up land, so you things better be careful."]="达伊克见过很多象你这样不长毛的家伙。狂心氏族不会放弃自己的领地，你还是小心点比较好。"
G["Dajik forget what he doing, where he at... sometime even forget his own name. Make him not so good teacher sometimes."]="达伊克经常会忘记他在做什么，忘记他在哪儿……甚至会忘记自己的名字。有时候，他还真算不上是个好老师。"
G["Dajik going to rest for a bit... hurt all over."]="达伊克要休息一会儿……全身都是伤。"
G["Dajik not think he seen you eat anything. You eat sometimes, yeah?"]="达伊克从来没有见你吃过东西。你也要吃东西的，对吧？"
G["Dajik train pups that kill stuff faster than you. You got lot more learning left."]="达伊克训练出来的幼崽杀得都比你快。你要学的东西还很多啊。"
G["Dajik tried to show me ways of hunt, but I do better when I do things my way."]="达伊克一直想教我狩猎的技巧，事实上，我按自己的方式来做，效果反而更好。"
G["Dajik's last learner eaten by sand-thing. We do better this time though!"]="达伊克的上一个学徒就是被躲在沙里的怪物给吃掉的。我们最好别落得同样的下场！"
G["Dalaran WILL fall!"]="达拉然即将沦陷！"
G["Dalaran has no auction house of its own. You must take a portal back to one of your capitals.\n\nThey can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary."]="达拉然没有拍卖行。你必须通过传送门返回各大主城才能使用拍卖行。\n\n传送门位于达拉然的联盟和部落区：银色领地和夺日者圣殿。"
G["Dalaran is a better place without your kind."]="没有你们，达拉然会更好。"
G["Dalaran must fall!"]="必须攻陷达拉然！"
G["Dalaran will burn!"]="达拉然将会陷入火海！"
G["Dalaran's arena and those who service it are found beneath the city, in the sewers.\n\nThere are at least three ways in: Entrances in the east and west, and a well in the north."]="达拉然的竞技场和管理员都在这座城市的下水道里。\n\n至少有三条地下通道可以抵达那里：东部和西部下水道的入口，还有北部的水井。"
G["Dalaran's guild master is found in the visitor center, just south of the city's center."]="达拉然的公会注册员就在市中心以南的旅客中心。"
G["Dalaran's only class trainers are mages. You must take a portal back to one of your capitals for others.\n\nThey can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary."]="Los únicos instructores de clase de Dalaran son magos. Tienes que atravesar un portal que te lleve a una de tus capitales si buscas otro.\n\nLos puedes encontrar en los cuarteles de la Alianza y la Horda: El Enclave de Plata y el Santuario de los Atracasol."
G["Dalaran's stable master is located inside the Magical Menagerie in northeast Dalaran."]="你可以在达拉然东北部的魔法动物店找到兽栏管理员。"
G["Dalronn! See if you can muster the nerve to join my attack!"]="达尔隆！你有没有勇气和我一起上啊！"
G["Dam'ren!  Freeze them to oblivion!"]="玳刃！冻死他们！"
G["Damage control! Put those fires out. You haven't seen the last of the Horde!"]="把火扑灭，控制损伤！让你们见识一下部落的坚强！"
G["Dame Auriferous, we are the reinforcements. It may come to pass that The Lady will send more men in time. Better that you convince Silvermoon City to muster all of its forces and put them at our disposal here."]="奥莉菲洛丝夫人，我们是增援部队。女王会及时派遣更多的增援过来。你最好说服银月城将所有的军队集合起来，并交给我们统一调遣。"
G["Dammit, Boots, I'm a doctor not a priest!  Clear!!!"]="该死的，布兹，我是个医生，不是个牧师！让开！！"
G["Damn Hellscream.  His ambition tore our Horde apart."]="该死的地狱咆哮。他的野心令部落四分五裂。"
G["Damn all these vermin! I don't suppose you could help me with this situation?"]="这些该死的歹徒！我能指望你助我一臂之力吗？"
G["Damn it! You'd better not die on me, human!"]="该死！你最好不要死在我手上！"
G["Damn it, Jitters, I said HOLD!"]="该死的，基特斯，我说了，抓住！"
G["Damn it, Olakin, get your arse back here! There's work to be done!"]="欧尔拉金，你给我滚回来！这里还有很多工作要做呢！"
G["Damn it, Uther! As your future king, I order you to purge this city!"]="乌瑟尔，大胆！我是你未来的国君，我命令你清理这座城市！"
G["Damn it..."]="见鬼……"
G["Damn right!"]="该死的，没错！"
G["Damn shame what they did to Old Blanchy..."]="他们居然对老马布兰契做出这种事……"
G["Damn shame what they did to that rug."]="他们竟然如此对待那条地毯，可耻！"
G["Damn straight ya can!"]="啊哈哈！你一定能做到的！"
G["Damn straight!"]="说得太好了！"
G["Damn the Crusade! I think my ribs are broken and I might be bleeding internally."]="该死的十字军！我的肋骨折断了，似乎有内出血的症状。"
G["Damn the men! Nothing shall prevent me from having my revenge, old friend. Not even you."]="该死！无论是谁，都无法阻止我的复仇，老朋友。你，也不行。"
G["Damn the titans for cursing us so! Ymiron, my king, open your eyes!"]="该死的泰坦诅咒了我们！伊米隆，我的国王，张开双眼吧！"
G["Damn the... luck."]="这该死的……运气。"
G["Damn their hides. Rangers! Hold this position!"]="该死的家伙。游侠们！守住这里！"
G["Damn these orcs."]="这些该死的兽人。"
G["Damn those blood elves and their reckless magic!"]="该死的血精灵和他们不顾后果的魔法！"
G["Damn those ogres. Damn them to the Nether. Won't someone save us from these savages! This is the fifth kidnapping in as many days."]="那些该死的食人魔。他们应该被推到虚空里。有人能从这些野人手里拯救我们吗？这已经是最近第五次绑架了！"
G["Damn you mortals! All my plans of revenge, all my hate...I will be avenged..."]="你们这群该死的凡人！我所有的复仇计划，我所有的仇恨……我一定会报仇……"
G["Damn you!  Damn all of you bleeding fel orcs!  May your souls rot in the belly of whatever Dark Power that fuels you!"]="¡$gMaldito:Maldita; seas! ¡Malditos sean todos tus puñeteros orcos viles! ¡Que vuestras almas se pudran en la barriga del poder oscuro que os impulse!"
G["Damn you, Fandral! What have you gotten us into with this cursed \"World Tree?\""]="¡Maldito seas, Fandral! ¿Dónde nos has metido con todo eso del maldito \"Árbol del Mundo\"?"
G["Damn you, Go'el - WAKE UP! Don't let it end like this! We've come too far to fail now!"]="该死，古伊尔，快醒过来！一切不能就这样结束！我们绝不能失败！"
G["Damn you, Pulroy! Where'd you put those ciphers!"]="该死，普罗伊！你把密码表放到哪去了！"
G["Damn, I'm good!"]="哇，我真厉害！"
G["Damn, another jinyu net! We were so close, too..."]="该死，又是锦鱼人的网！我们差一点就成功了……"
G["Damn, stone troggs! Over there!"]="该死的石头穴居人！在那儿！"
G["Damnation!"]="去死吧！"
G["Damned hozen move through the trees like ghosts!"]="这些该死的猢狲在树林里就像幽灵一样神出鬼没！"
G["Damned stinking stone trogg! You'll never get the World Pillar fragment!"]="不得好死的臭气熏天的石头穴居人！你们永远别想知道我把世界之柱的碎片藏在哪儿！"
G["Damnit. How are we ever going to get through their security measures?"]="该死，我们应该怎样穿过他们的安全措施？"
G["Dampwick's at the cave entrance just to the southeast."]="戴姆维克就在东南方的洞穴入口处。"
G["Dampwick, I need a ride back to headquarters, pronto!"]="戴姆维克，我立马赶回总部，马上！"
G["Dance around Shan Bu's attacks. We are faster! We are smarter!"]="躲开山怖的攻击。我们比他更快，更聪明！"
G["Dance for the Eternal Court."]="为永恒王庭跳支舞吧。"
G["Dance, Johnson, dance!"]="跳舞吧，强森，跳舞吧！"
G["Dance, wikkets! Dance!"]="跳吧，蠢货！跳吧！"
G["Dancin' like a monkey!"]="来跳支猢狲舞吧！"
G["Dane awaits you in the next chamber."]="丹恩在旁边的房间里等着你。"
G["Danforth, report."]="丹弗斯，报告。"
G["Dang nibblers are tearin' the place down in there!"]="这些该死的利齿蛛快把这儿全毁了！"
G["Dang ol' croc nearly took off my hand!"]="该死的鳄鱼，差点咬掉我的手！"
G["Dang! Fish aren't biting here either. I am gonna go back to my ol' fishin' hole!"]="该死！这里的鱼也不上钩。我要回到原来的地方去。"
G["Danger ahead."]="前方危险。"
G["Danger. Danger! $n try hurt A-Me."]="危险。危险！$n要伤害A-Me。"
G["Danger? Ha! I scoff at danger!\n\nDon't you know that the most delicious foods are also the most dangerous to acquire?"]="危险？哈！我才不怕什么危险！\n\n难道你不知道最美味的食物也是最难获得的吗？"
G["Dangerous out there, innit? Know what ya need? Protection. I can help ya defy death itself! Ya wear this madstone 'round yer neck, see, and then ya be able to come back if ya find yerself in the spirit world! Just a quick jaunt to yer corpse and up ya come, fresh and new!"]="¿Un poco revuelto ahí fuera, eh? ¿Sabes lo que necesitas? Protección. ¡Puedo ayudarte a desafiar a la mismísima muerte! Ponte este fetiche en el cuello, ya verás, ¡y después podrás volver si te encuentras en el mundo de los espíritus! Una pequeña excursión a tu cuerpo, ¡y ya tás, $gfresco:fresca; como una lechuga!"
G["Daniel, that patient is in shock. Stay with him and monitor his heart rate, let me know if anything changes."]="丹尼尔，那位病人休克了。待在旁边观察他的心率，要是有异常，马上通知我。"
G["Dar'Khan thinks we'll roll over for the Scourge without putting up a fight.  We shall prove him wrong, $n."]="达尔坎认为亡灵天灾不费吹灰之力就能击败我们。他错了，$n。"
G["Dare ta drink a Dragon P.I.E.! It'll put hair on yer chest, and then hair on THAT!"]="快来喝一杯巨龙P.I.E.吧！它能让你身体强健，龙精虎猛！"
G["Darianna shows promise, but she is so full of energy that it is hard for her to stay still and listen. With her strength and agility, I fear it won't be long before she is called to fight. We must teach her quickly."]="达丽亚娜答应了，但是她的精力如此充沛，很难让她安静下来仔细的聆听。她气力十足又机灵敏捷，我恐怕她不久就会被叫去参加战斗。我们必须快点教她。"
G["Darion Mograine, you are barely of age to hold a sword, let alone battle the undead hordes of Lordaeron! I could not bear losing you. Even the thought..."]="达里安·莫格莱尼，你还没有到可以握剑的年龄呢，更不用说去跟肆虐洛丹伦的亡灵作战了！我不能失去你，想都不敢想……"
G["Darion, my son."]="达里安，我的孩子。"
G["Darius!  The Dark Rangers have the Scythe!  They got to it before we were able to reach it."]="达利乌斯！黑暗游侠得到了那把镰刀！他们抢在我们之前得到了它。"
G["Dark Heart of the Mogu."]="魔古的黑心。"
G["Dark Iron Dwarf Attacks"]="黑铁矮人进攻"
G["Dark Iron activity. Even that some of the shipments have been hijacked--"]="黑铁矮人的活动越发频繁，甚至已经开始掠夺我们的货物——"
G["Dark Iron dwarves!!!"]="黑铁矮人！！！"
G["Dark Lady watch over you."]="黑暗女王在注视着你。"
G["Dark Lady, I think I hear Arthas coming. Whatever you're going to do, do it quickly."]="黑暗女王，我想我听到了阿尔萨斯的临近。不管您有什么样的计划，请快些执行。"
G["Dark Lady, join me! You have fought hard and spilled much blood for this right. The Royal Quarter belongs to you!"]="黑暗女王，来吧！你曾为登上王座倾尽心力、浴血奋战。现在，皇家区属于你了！"
G["Dark Portal Heartstone"]="黑暗之门炉石"
G["Dark days are upon us, $n. What are we to do when even our greatest heroes fall before the might of Illidan?"]="黑暗的日子已经降临在我们头上，$n。如果我们最强大的英雄也倒在了伊利丹的面前，我们又该怎么办？"
G["Dark energies embrace this land. Anger, Hatred, Fear, Doubt..."]="黑暗能量笼罩着这片土地。愤怒、仇恨、恐惧、猜疑……"
G["Dark energy courses through me... Such power! I hunger for more!"]="黑暗的能量在我体内涌动……强大的力量！我渴求更多的力量！"
G["Dark forces are at work in this land, $n.  Keep your eyes open and your courage strong."]="黑暗的力量正在这片土地上蔓延。$n，睁大眼睛，鼓起勇气吧。"
G["Dark is de jungle, but fertile is its soil.\n\nMay de spirits of de earth watch over ya, $c."]="丛林中暗影重重，但它的土地肥沃丰茂。\n\n愿大地之灵眷顾你，$c。"
G["Dark times loom ahead, stranger..."]="Se avecinan tiempos oscuros, $gextranjero:extranjera;..."
G["Dark times make for strange friendships. It may be worth visiting old Lordaeron to watch the Forsaken burn their little man of wicker."]="黑暗的岁月可以促成奇怪的友谊。如果能去旧洛丹伦，观看被遗忘者们烧毁稻草人的话也挺不错的。"
G["Darkfire -- avenge us!"]="黑暗之火——为我们复仇吧！"
G["Darkhatched saurok are very dangerous, and very powerful."]="这些在黑暗中成长的蜥蜴人非常危险，也非常强大。"
G["Darkmoon Adventurer's Guide?"]="暗月冒险者指南？"
G["Darkmoon Cards?"]="暗月卡片是什么？"
G["Darkmoon Dogs fresh off the grill.  Come and get 'em while they're hot!"]="现烤现卖的暗月热狗，新鲜热烫！大家赶快趁热来买啊！"
G["Darkmoon Faire Cards?  See the Professor here for those."]="暗月卡片？去找教授问问吧。"
G["Darkmoon Faire Prize Tickets?"]="暗月马戏团奖券？"
G["Darkmoon decks! Turn them in here!"]="暗月套牌！快来兑换暗月套牌了！"
G["Darkness awaits..."]="黑暗在等着你呢……"
G["Darkness comes. I can feel it within my bones."]="黑暗降临了。我能感受到骨子里的寒意。"
G["Darkness comin' for you...."]="黑暗已经来临……"
G["Darkness grows..."]="黑暗滋长……"
G["Darkness waits."]="黑暗在等着你呢。"
G["Darkness..."]="黑暗……"
G["Darkness... consumes all."]="黑暗……吞噬一切。"
G["Darkspear Champion's Pennant"]="暗矛冠军的旗帜"
G["Darkspear animals will be put down like the filth they are!"]="暗矛部族的畜生都将卑贱地死去！"
G["Darkspear trolls 'ave age old connections wit' nature, but only lately 'ave we come ta know the druidic arts. Try ta keep an open mind, $n."]="暗矛巨魔在很久以前就和自然有着密切的联系，但直到最近，我们才了解到德鲁伊的技艺。 $n，你要尽量保持谦虚的态度。"
G["Darkspear, with me! We ride! No sleep 'til Orgrimmar!"]="暗矛巨魔，跟我来！日夜兼程赶往奥格瑞玛！"
G["Darkspear...  it been a long time since I heard de drums...  since I drank de ritual offerings. I be watchin' over your dead, Vol'jin, and for NOTHIN'. Why have de Darkspear forsaken Bwonsamdi, eh?"]="暗矛……我已经很久没有听到这种鼓声……没喝过你们的祭品了。我很想见证你的死亡，沃金，你这个混帐。为什么暗矛要背弃邦桑迪？"
G["Darkspears, we consult de spirits! Drummers, take your places!"]="暗矛的成员们，我们要向祖灵寻求答案！鼓手，立刻就位！"
G["Darling, those shoes are to die for!  I mean that literally.  Who did you kill for them?"]="亲爱的，那些漂亮的鞋子简直值得你为它们而死啊！说真的啦。你从谁手中抢来的啊？肯定免不了一场血腥吧。"
G["Darling, you simply can't complete your look without the right shoes.  Don't you agree?"]="亲爱的，没有合适的鞋子来搭配你这身装束，总觉得不顺眼呢。你觉得呢？"
G["Darmuk must die, mon!"]="达穆克必须死！"
G["Darmuk's incompetence be hinderin' us no more! Patience, mon. Dere soon be more for you to do...."]="达穆克这个饭桶再也不能惹麻烦了！耐心点，朋友。很快就会有更多的工作交给你做了……"
G["Darn, and I kind of liked you."]="该死，我有些喜欢你了。"
G["Darn, you got me!"]="该死，被你逮到了！"
G["Darnassus Champion's Pennant"]="达纳苏斯冠军的旗帜"
G["Darnit, I lost! Oof... I feel tired..."]="该死，我输了！哎呦……真累啊……"
G["Darrowshire is defeated!  Soon, all of Lordaeron will fall!"]="达隆郡被击败了！很快，整个洛丹伦就会陷落！"
G["Darrowshire will fall!"]="达隆郡必将陷落！"
G["Darrowshire!  You are doomed!"]="达隆郡！这是命中注定的！"
G["Darrowshire, to arms!  The Scourge approach!"]="达隆郡的勇士们，拿起武器吧！亡灵天灾就要来了！"
G["Dat $R look gud to eat!"]="¡$gEse:Esa; $r está pa comérselo!"
G["Dat I was. Da Zandalari called a meeting  o' all da troll tribes includin' da Darkspears."]="是的。赞达拉召集了包括暗矛在内的所有巨魔氏族举行了一次集会。"
G["Dat be da plan. My men be infiltratin' da city and learnin' what dey can about da new Zandalari warlord."]="那就这样计划，我的手下将潜入那座城市，尽可能探查赞达拉新督军的底细。"
G["Dat be da will o' Drakuru!"]="执行达库鲁的意志！"
G["Dat be enough for now!"]="暂时够了！"
G["Dat be so much better. I be weak, but I remember hearin' da Amani and da Zandalari talkin' about treasure hidden in dis very room."]="这样好多了。我很虚弱，但我记得听到阿曼尼和赞达拉的人提到有财宝就藏在这个房间里。"
G["Dat came from da ship! Let's go!"]="它从船上过来了！我们走！"
G["Dat cloud look like da Warchief."]="那团云看上去就像是个大酋长。"
G["Dat me liver you be squeezin, mon!"]="你弄疼我了！"
G["Dat no bodda me."]="我不在乎！"
G["Dat not good."]="那可不太好。"
G["Dat not true. Me just want to nibble. I don't eat all. Ok, maybe I eat da little ones.\n\nDey so delicious!"]="No cierto. Mí solo querer mordisquear. Yo no comer todo. Bueno, quizás comer los pequeños.\n\n¡Son deliciosos!"
G["Dat should do it good..."]="这样应该可以了……"
G["Dat was poop! Mogor could put up much better fight den dat!"]="真没劲！穆戈尔更厉害！"
G["Dat'll fix dem."]="这会治好他们的。"
G["Dat's all of dem! Dese Warmaul be so mad! Hooray!"]="杀啊！战槌食人魔看上去很生气了！哈哈！"
G["Dat's betta. Now let's get to huntin' dem monkeys, mon."]="这下好多了。现在，我们去追那些猴子吧，伙计。"
G["Dat's da attitude! Grab a needle and thread and let's get jammin'!"]="这就对了！拿起针线让我们开始吧！"
G["Dat's de end of Hellscream.\n\n<Vol'jin eyes you warily.>\n\nWhat next, $r?"]="地狱咆哮已经完蛋了。\n\n<沃金警惕地看着你。>\n\n接下来呢，$r？"
G["Dat's what you get! Noting!"]="这就是你的下场！死吧！"
G["Dat's where we need you, $Gbruddah:sistah;."]="Ahí es donde te necesitamos, colega."
G["Data access granted.  Have a nice day!\n01001110 01100001 01110100 01100001 01101100 01101001 01100101 00100000 01010000 01101111 01110010 01110100 01101101 01100001 01101110 00100000 01010010 01101111 01100011 01101011 01110011"]="Concedido el acceso a los datos. ¡Que tengas un buen día!\n\n01001110 01100001 01110100 01100001 01101100 01101001 01100101 00100000 01010000 01101111 01110010 01110100 01101101 01100001 01101110 00100000 01010010 01101111 01100011 01101011 01110011"
G["Dats dangerous."]="这真危险。"
G["Daughter!"]="女儿！"
G["Daughter! You have returned!"]="我的女儿！你终于回来了！"
G["Davil Lightfire has succumbed to his wounds!"]="达维·莱法尔死于重伤！"
G["Davil Lightfire is defeated!  Darrowshire is lost!"]="达维·莱法尔死了！达隆郡沦陷了！"
