G["Deathblade ... activated! System integrity check: 57 percent nominal."]="死亡锯刃……被激活！系统完整性检测：百分之五十七正常。"
G["Deathforge Mine will detonate in 3 seconds!"]="死亡熔炉地雷将在3秒后爆炸！"
G["Deathforge Mine: Detonating!"]="死亡熔炉地雷：引爆！"
G["Deathstalker Command Belmont grins."]="死亡猎手指挥官贝尔蒙特咧嘴一笑。"
G["Deathwing - he lives!"]="死亡之翼——他还活着！"
G["Deathwing came here and didn't slay you all?"]="死亡之翼来到了这里，却没有把你们都杀光？"
G["Deathwing had unstoppable power. And now, it is MINE."]="死亡之翼曾拥有无可匹敌的力量。现在，它属于我了。"
G["Deathwing has prepared me to face the vessel of Tarecgosa, your fools journey ends here!"]="死亡之翼命我对付泰蕾苟萨的容器。你愚蠢的旅程到此结束了。"
G["Deathwing has returned. He's seized Grim Batol and much of the highlands, and I feel near powerless to stop him.\n\nSoon, our queen shall arrive, and together we shall put the once Earthwarder in his place."]="死亡之翼回来了，他已经控制了格瑞姆巴托和这片高地的很大一部分。我已经无力阻止他了。\n\n我们的女王很快就会到来，我们将齐心协力，把那个曾经的大地守护者赶回他应在的位置上。"
G["Deathwing is conjuring the final Cataclysm; even the Emerald Dream trembles. If we are to stop the spell, we must attack him together."]="死亡之翼正在引导最后的大灾变，连翡翠梦境都在颤抖。要想阻止他，我们必须联手进攻。"
G["Deathwing is victorious! Try again once Alexstrasza recovers."]="死亡之翼胜利了！等阿莱克丝塔萨复原后再次尝试吧。"
G["Deathwing shall bring destruction upon your entire order.  And this day, I shall be his blade!"]="死亡之翼会给尘世的所有秩序带来毁灭。到那一天，我将成为他的利刃！"
G["Deathwing will have his way with your Stonemother."]="死亡之翼自会对付你的石母。"
G["Deathwing will pay for this."]="死亡之翼会为此付出代价的。"
G["Deathwing!  I have fallen....  The brood... is lost."]="死亡之翼！我失败了……血脉……保不住了。"
G["Deathwing's brood... Ysera's benevolence raised the ire of Deathwing - patron of the black dragonflight. They attacked us in our sleep! Many died on the initial surge but the greens rose to protect us.\n\n<Prince Toreth points around the island.>\n\nThe bones are all that remain of the once great dragons. None were spared."]="死亡之翼的子孙们……伊瑟拉的仁爱激起了死亡之翼——黑龙军团的首领的怨恨。他们在我们睡觉时发起了攻击！许多人死在第一次攻势中，但绿龙勇敢地前来保护我们。\n\n<托雷斯王子指了指岛屿的周围。>\n\n那些骸骨就是绿龙们的残骸。黑龙没有给他们留下任何活口。"
G["Deathwing's entry into our world opened a rift between it and Deepholm.\n\nRebuilding the World Pillar is the only way to stabilize the rift."]="死亡之翼的侵入在我们的世界和深岩之洲之间打开了一道裂隙。\n\n重建世界之柱是唯一控制住裂隙的方法。"
G["Deathwing's escape didn't just damage our world.  A powerful stone created by the Titans used to be in this room before the breach shattered it.  It was known as the World Pillar."]="死亡之翼离开这里的时候不仅仅伤害了我们的世界，在这个神殿里原本存放着的一块泰坦制造的魔法巨石也随之破碎了。"
G["Deathwing's madness overcomes him, and we, the red dragons, must take this opportunity to steal his black dragons from beneath him.  We will remake the black dragons as they were intended to be: the warders of the earth."]="死亡之翼已经彻底被自己的疯狂征服了。而我们红龙必须趁这个机会把黑龙从他的眼皮底下偷走。我们要让黑龙恢复他们往日的样子，成为大地的守护者。"
G["Deathwing's minions should be afraid of ME. Get him out of here."]="死亡之翼的爪牙应该会害怕我。让他滚出这里。"
G["Deathwing's return to Azeroth caused a major rift within the two worlds.  This breach is the force largely behind the cataclysm that threatens to destroy our lands."]="死亡之翼重返艾泽拉斯时给两个世界留下了巨大的裂隙。这道裂口是造成大灾变的主要原因，威胁了我们世界的存亡。"
G["Deathwing's shadow settles over you."]="死亡之翼的阴影笼罩着你。"
G["Deathwing's taint shall be wiped from Deepholm, and his Twilight cultists with it."]="死亡之翼的污染，连同他的暮光教徒都将被彻底从深岩之洲中清除干净！"
G["Deathwing, or Neltharion as he was once known, was the Aspect that embodied the strength of the world - granted almost limitless power over this mortal realm by the Titan shaper known as Khaz'goroth: Forger of the world.\n\nThrough treachery and deceit, the foul one convinced the four other Aspects to imbue an item, known as the Demon Soul, with their powers - greatly weakening them, forcing a division among the once great Aspects."]="Alamuerte, anteriormente conocido como Neltharion, fue el Aspecto que encarnó la fuerza del mundo: concedía poder casi ilimitado en este reino mortal a través del creador de titanes conocido como Khaz’goroth: Forjador del mundo.\n\nMediante la traición y el engaño, este ser inmundo convenció a los otros cuatro Aspectos para que transmitieran sus poderes a un elemento, conocido como el Alma demoníaca, debilitándolos enormemente y provocando su división."
G["Deathwing?! The Cataclysm?! We're doomed!! We have to get off of Kezan before Mount Kajaro blows for good!!!"]="死亡之翼？！大灾变？！我们完蛋了！！我们必须在卡亚罗山爆炸之前离开科赞！！！"
G["Debug message, Thelrin has been summoned."]="调试信息，Thelrin已经被召唤出来了。"
G["Deceit is no match for true strength! This one is more powerful than you!"]="在真正的实力面前，谎言毫无用处！我比你更强大！"
G["Decided to go for a swim, did you?  Well, you're still in one piece, so no harm done I suppose."]="决定去游泳了，是吧？嗯，看你毫发无伤的样子，我就知道你一切平安。"
G["Decipher this!"]="破译这个看看！"
G["Deck Boss said you needed some help."]="甲板长官说你需要帮助。"
G["Decontamination complete. Standby for delivery."]="净化已完成。等待送交。"
G["Decrypt the final instructions. We activate the Waygate within the hour!"]="正在解读最后的指令。我们很快就能激活界门！"
G["Dedicated to those that fell to the Scourge during the war in the frozen wastes."]="献给那些在冰封荒原上为了对抗天灾军团而英勇牺牲的战士们。"
G["Dedlow Wormwood's the corpse you want. He's usually around the south end of town."]="戴德洛·沃姆伍德就是你想要找的那具尸体。他经常会在这个镇子的南端。"
G["Deep breaths... deep breaths!"]="深呼吸……深呼吸！"
G["Deep doom"]="厄运的深渊"
G["Deep truths may only be learned through deep questioning."]="只有刨根问底，才能明察秋毫。"
G["Deep within his soul, the one thing he feared most of all was...himself."]="在他的灵魂深处，令他最为惧怕的就是……他自己。"
G["Deepholm has changed much in recent years. It's hardly recognizable.\n\nStill... here I am free from corruption. Free from the tainting influence of ancient gods. It seems that sometimes your freedom must be stripped away for you to truly appreciate its value."]="深岩之洲近年来改变了许多。都快认不出来了。\n\n但是……我并没有被腐化。并没有受到远古之神的影响。看来有时只有在自由被剥夺的情况下，人们才能真正意识到它的珍贵。"
G["Deepholm is the realm of earth.  It is here that Deathwing retreated when he was first defeated."]="深岩之洲是大地的国度。死亡之翼在第一次被击败之后逃到了这里。"
G["Deepholm shall collapse upon you!"]="深岩之洲会塌在你们身上！"
G["Deepholm was a slow, quiet place. Always alive. Steadily moving. Never rushed. In this time, I strived to become one with the earth, and to a large degree, I succeeded.\n\nLater, the Earthwarder returned, injured. He did not upset the balance at first. He'd stayed here before, and we knew of him. The shift did not truly begin until the Twilight cult joined him."]="深岩之洲是个平静而节奏缓慢的地方。永远都充满生机，平稳改变，有条不紊。我一度努力与大地融为一体。在很大的程度上，我成功了。\n\n后来，大地的守卫者回来了，身上带着累累伤痕。起初他并没有扰乱平衡。他曾经在这里生活过，我们了解他。直到暮光教派开始和他打交道以后，他才真正开始发生了变化。"
G["Deepholm? I hate this place. Wait... you're not Initiate Goldmine!"]="深岩之洲？我痛恨这个地方。等等……你不是见习萨满金矿！"
G["Deeprun Tram"]="矿道地铁"
G["Deethuk, you're a little snot! Wait... what's wrong with your code device?"]="迪萨克，你这讨厌鬼！等等……你的编码装置出什么问题了？"
G["Default."]="默认。"
G["Defeat all the Expired Test Subjects to escape!"]="击败所有作废的试验样本来逃脱！"
G["Defeat enemy commanders to earn bonus Kor'kron supplies!"]="击败敌方指挥官以获取额外的库卡隆补给品！"
G["Defeat has never tasted so bitter..."]="失败的滋味从未如此苦涩……"
G["Defeat him in the name of Lady Vashj!"]="以瓦丝琪之名，打败他！"
G["Defeat is merely a lesson masked by disappointment."]="失败只是一个被失望所掩盖的教训。"
G["Defeat me and take from me the deathcharger I ride. That is the only way to win and return to the world of the living, death knight. Are you ready?"]="Vénceme y arrebátame el destrero de la muerte que cabalgo. Esa es la única manera de vencer y regresar al mundo de los vivos, caballero de la Muerte. ¿Estás $gpreparado:preparada;?"
G["Defeat that creature so we can free our own!"]="快击败那个家伙，我们才能获得自由！"
G["Defeat the Boneweavers to aid Lilian Voss!"]="击败白骨编织者以帮助莉莉安·沃斯！"
G["Defeat the Great White Plainshawk!"]="打败巨型白色平原鹰！"
G["Defeat the Guardian of the Elders, and we may pass."]="击败长者的卫士，我们才能通过。"
G["Defeat the Magic Hunters and find Tarecgosa!"]="击败魔法追猎者，找到泰蕾苟萨！"
G["Defeat the Shadow of the Golden Lotus to escape!"]="击败金莲之影以脱身！"
G["Defeat the fire elementals attacking %s!"]="击败正在攻击%s的火元素！"
G["Defeat these foul beasts!"]="击败这些邪恶的野兽！"
G["Defeat these sons of Ragnaros so that I can aid Cenarius!"]="击败拉格纳罗斯之子，我才能协助塞纳留斯！"
G["Defeat! The defenders couldn't hold the hill."]="失败了！防御部队无法守住那座山丘。"
G["Defeat! The flameward has been destroyed."]="失败了！防火结界被摧毁了。"
G["Defeated my minions? Then face me, mortals!"]="打败了我的手下？来跟我打打看吧，凡人！"
G["Defeated!"]="失败！"
G["Defeated.  Shame level: High.  Adjusting strategy for future battles."]="战败。可耻等级：高。正在调整未来战斗的作战策略。"
G["Defeating Kael'thas is a task worthy of your undivided attention. \n\nBeyond that, if you are capable of organizing an army, there are many wrongs in the Sunwell to be addressed.\n\nPerhaps we shall meet again there."]="打败凯尔萨斯是一件值得你专心去做的事情。\n\n除此之外，如果你能组织一支军队的话，太阳之井里面还有许多邪恶的家伙需要你去处理。\n\n也许我们会在那里再次相遇。"
G["Defeating the Lingering Doubts will take a level head and steady emotions, $c. With them under control the rebuilding process can begin."]="击败徘徊之疑需要冷静的头脑和坚定的信念，$c。只要控制住这些怪物，重建工作就可以开始了。"
G["Defective elekk turd."]="残次的雷象粪便。"
G["Defend Nighthaven, hero..."]="保卫永夜港，英雄……"
G["Defend da' siege, $n! Smash dem walls!"]="保护我们的攻城器械，$n！摧毁他们的城墙！"
G["Defend me!"]="保护我！"
G["Defend our cannons at all costs!"]="不惜一切代价，保住我们的大炮！"
G["Defend the Caravan Kodo!"]="守卫科多兽商队！"
G["Defend the Cart!"]="保护马车！"
G["Defend the Egg!"]="保护好这只卵！"
G["Defend the Hyjal Wisp as it closes the attacker's portal!"]="保护好海加尔小精灵，让它关闭入侵者的传送门！"
G["Defend the Siege Tank!"]="守卫攻城坦克！"
G["Defend the Temple with your life!"]="誓死保卫神殿！"
G["Defend the barricade!"]="坚守阵地！"
G["Defend the bunkers!"]="保卫碉堡！"
G["Defend the captured prize"]="守卫夺取的战利品"
G["Defend the flameward!"]="守卫防火结界！"
G["Defend the gate!"]="守住大门！"
G["Defend the gates!"]="守卫大门！"
G["Defend the hill!"]="守住山丘！"
G["Defend the inner sanctum at all costs!"]="要不惜一切代价守住内部圣殿！"
G["Defend the pools!"]="保卫池塘！"
G["Defend the temple at all costs."]="不惜一切代价，守住神殿！"
G["Defend us until the teleporter is ready!"]="在传送器准备就绪前，保护好我们！"
G["Defend yourself!"]="准备接招吧！"
G["Defend yourself, for all the good it will do!"]="接招吧，让你看看我的厉害！"
G["Defend yourself, for all the good it will do...."]="尽量保住自己的小命吧……"
G["Defend yourself, friend. Our attackers are formidable."]="保护好自己，朋友。那些进攻者很难缠。"
G["Defend yourself, soldier! Blow 'em out of the sky with the fiery lance! Give 'em a taste of their own medicine!"]="士兵，学会自我保护！用长枪将他们从空中打下来！以牙还牙！"
G["Defend yourself, youngling! We'll see if there's a Blood Knight in you, yet."]="多加小心，年轻人！让我们看看你是不是个够格的血骑士。"
G["Defenders of Darrowshire!  Rally!  We must prevail!"]="达隆郡的守护者们！集合起来！我们必须战胜他们！"
G["Defenders of the Argent Dawn!  We are with you!"]="银色黎明的卫士们！我们和你们并肩作战！"
G["Defenders of the Vale, we require your return to the Golden Pagoda in 30 minutes!"]="山谷的防御者们，你们必须在30分钟之内返回鎏金亭！"
G["Defenders, show these mongrels the fury of a Scryer!"]="防御部队，让这帮渣滓尝尝占星者的愤怒！"
G["Defenders, you have 15 minutes to clear the western vale!  Mogu raiding parties are leaving their camps!"]="防御者们，你们还有15分钟的时间来扫清西部山谷！魔古的突袭部队已经离营出发了！"
G["Defenders, you have 5 minutes before you are recalled to the Golden Pagoda!"]="防御者们，你们将在5分钟后被召回鎏金亭！"
G["Defense systems obliterated. Powering down..."]="防御系统瘫痪。能源衰减……"
G["Defensive Stance! Shield yourself against their blows and strike back!"]="防御姿态！用盾牌挡住攻击，然后迅速反击！"
G["Defiance... a flaw of mortality."]="反抗……凡人性的瑕疵。"
G["Defias activity reported on the costal horizon.  All clear on Sentinel Hill."]="据报告，迪菲亚兄弟会正在海岸附近活动。哨兵岭警报解除。"
G["Defias? This is not good. Not good at all. Please continue."]="迪菲亚兄弟会？这可不是个好消息。简直是太糟了！请继续说下去。"
G["Defiler!"]="亵渎者！"
G["Defiler... you will be punished for this incursion. <A symbol of flame radiates from the relic before it crumbles to the earth.>"]="污染者……你会因贸然入侵而遭受惩罚。<一团火焰印记从古物里放射出来，然后消失在大地之中。>"
G["Defilers!"]="污染者！"
G["Defilers! Wretches! Fiends! Begone from here!"]="亵渎者！恶棍！魔鬼！离开这座神殿！"
G["Definitely."]="显然。"
G["Deforestation is such a nasty word. I prefer to think of it as clearing the view!\n\nHow could anyone see the ocean through all those trees?!"]="\"Deforestación\" es una palabra muy fea. Yo prefiero pensar que lo que hacemos es \"despejar la vista\".\n\n¡Nadie podía ver el océano con tanto árbol!"
G["Defragmenting swap file ..."]="整理交换文件……"
G["Deirom is alive! I can make out an arakkoa pacing back and forth in front of him, asking him the same questions over and over. There is another, too, an orc..."]="迪鲁姆还活着！我看到一个鸦人在他的面前来回走动，反复地问着他相同的问题。还有另一个人，一个兽人……"
G["Deja vu.  For a moment, I thought I was back home... before the plague..."]="有那么一小会儿，我以为自己回家了……在亡灵天灾到来之前的那个家……"
G["Dela Runetotem's brow furrows, but she remains silent."]="德拉·符文图腾皱了下眉毛，但她还是继续保持沉默。"
G["Dela Runetotem."]="德拉·符文图腾。"
G["Delaniel keeps a delightful cook named Quarelestra on staff. You'll do well to learn from her. Naturally, you'll find her in the Falconwing Square inn."]="德兰妮尔一直提供着一种被称为奎尔雷斯塔什么的美食。如果你想从她那里学手艺的话，应该去鹰翼广场旅店找她。"
G["Delaniel keeps her inn well in the southeastern corner of Falconwing Square. Good food, fine wine, soft beds... what more could one ask for?"]="德兰妮尔经营着她那个设在鹰翼广场东南角的旅店。美酒佳肴，还有柔软的床……夫复何求？"
G["Delays, delays, and more delays. The Trial of the Crusader has currently been placed on hold, pending the results of an investigation into the actions of Wilfred Fizzlebang. Next week the trial will continue, so be ready to fight the best knights of the Argent Crusade!"]="延迟，延迟，还是延迟。十字军的试炼已经陷入了停顿。只有对威尔弗雷德·菲兹班行为的研究得出结果之后，试炼才能继续进行。下一周，试炼应该能够继续，准备好在那时与银色十字军最优秀的骑士作战吧！"
G["Delber and his men are working overtime, captain. He has devised a means of delivering an assault team to the rear flank of the battle."]="戴博和他的人正在没日没夜地工作，队长。他已经设计出一种手段，能够将进攻部队送到战场的侧后方。"
G["Deldren, Shalis, these men are yours to lead. Take the tower."]="德尔德伦、萨莉斯，这些人归你们。一定要攻下塔楼。"
G["Delicious dishes and fresh-made island delicacies!"]="美味的食物，刚出锅的海岛佳肴！"
G["Delicious food and drink at  reasonable prices!"]="好酒好菜，物美价廉！"
G["Delicious morsels have come to visit! Shall I use your bombs to cook you?"]="美味的点心自己送上门来了呀！我能用炸弹把你烤熟吗？"
G["Delicious!"]="真是美味！"
G["Delicious, Cookie... You've really outdone yourself this time, old-timer. I've never tasted horse this good."]="太好吃了，曲奇……你这次完全超越了你原有的水平。我从未吃到过味道这么好的马。"
G["Delight in the pain!"]="享受痛苦吧！"
G["Deliver justice for our dead, $n."]="为我们报仇，$n。"
G["Deliver the footbomb uniform to the Slave Pits. Hurry, $n!"]="把这件足球炸弹制服送到奴隶营去，快一点，$n！"
G["Deliver these results to our apothecaries in the Undercity. And please, try not to digest the message this time?"]="将这些试验结果报告带去幽暗城，交给我们的药剂师。还有，别再把信吃了行不行？"
G["Delivered as promised, Torp!"]="托普，如期送达！"
G["Delivered?  Woke up?  What are you even talking about?  Were you attacked by flamekin?"]="送来的？醒过来了？你在说什么啊？你是被小鬼袭击了吗？"
G["Delivering these barrels to the excavation site is hard work, but there are so many depending on us to get the blast powder there.\n\nWe must do what we can against the Dark Irons!"]="要将这些桶运送到挖掘点非常困难，但是要获得火药，还得靠我们自己。\n\n我们必须竭尽所能地对抗黑铁！"
G["Dem Kor'kron be gatherin'."]="那些库卡隆正在集结。"
G["Dem Kor'kron not be catchin' us off guard dis time."]="这次，那些库卡隆休想再偷袭我们了。"
G["Dem Saurok be guardin de cave.  Let's take care of 'em."]="那些蜥蜴人守着洞穴。我们得先对付他们。"
G["Dem other ogres was dumb to attack you, boss!  Dat's why I'm still alive - I'm smart and stuff!"]="¡Los otros ogros fueron tontos por atacarte, $gjefe:jefa;! Por eso yo seguir con vida, ¡soy listo y todo eso!"
G["Dem tauren, dey be KNOWIN' how ta cook. Have ya SEEN all de food dey be servin'?\n\nI'm gonna eat 'til I die... an' den come back from de grave ta be eatin' some more!"]="那些牛头人真的很懂得什么叫美食！你有没有看见过他们做的那些菜？\n\n我要一直吃到把自己撑死……然后再从坟墓里爬出来，重新开始吃！"
G["Dem trolls wanna fight?"]="巨魔想找架打吗？"
G["Demand?! You DEMAND?!"]="说法？！你们想讨说法？！"
G["Demolishers are carrying explosives! Any direct hit will blow them up!"]="毁灭者身上有炸药。直接攻击会导致他们自爆！"
G["Demolishers, get in there!  Leave nothing but a pile of ash!"]="毁灭者，去吧！把一切化为灰烬！"
G["Demolishers? Nothing a little gnomish enginuity can't overcome. Send in the copters!"]="歼灭者？没有侏儒技术搞不定的东西。呼叫直升机！"
G["Demon Hunter's Aspect"]="恶魔猎手的守护"
G["Demon Soul?"]="恶魔之魂？"
G["Demon filth!"]="这些恶魔渣滓！"
G["Demon!  I have returned from beyond the grave to destroy you!"]="恶魔！我从坟墓中回来，就是为了毁灭你！"
G["Demons are the future of this world. The sooner you embrace that, the sooner you join the winning team."]="恶魔是这个世界的未来。你越早接受这一点，就能越早加入胜利方。"
G["Demos will flense the flesh from your bones!"]="恶魔会把你们碎尸万断！"
G["Den dat be where we go next.  We gonna stop dis uprising at da source."]="那将是我们下一步应当去的地方，我们必须在源头遏止这次暴动。"
G["Den find him, wise one. Go!"]="聪明的战士，马上去找到他！"
G["Den we go! First, to Bwonsamdi... if we gonna win dis, we need his mojo on our side."]="出发！我们先要去找邦桑迪……我们需要他强大的魔精力量。"
G["Den you put da pepper in da pot..."]="把胡椒扔进锅里……"
G["Denizens of flame, come to me!"]="烈焰的子民，来我身边！"
G["Denizens of the sky, attack!"]="天空之子，进攻！"
G["Denman Family Jewelers, between the northern Trade District and The Canals, should have everything you're looking for."]="位于贸易区与运河间的登曼家族珠宝，你在那里应该可以找到所有想要找的东西。"
G["Denni'ka can show you how to keep warm.  Look for her at Survival of the Fittest, a hut on the shore of the lake next to the Spirit Lodge.  Head up above and west of the Valley of Strength."]="德尼卡能教你如何保持温暖。去适者生存小屋，就是灵魂小屋附近湖畔边的那件房间里可以找到她。先往上然后往力量谷的西边走就可以到了。"
G["Deploy mobile rocket platform pods! .... Oh yes."]="移动火箭平台展开！……好啊。"
G["Deploy the gear! Establish a perimeter!"]="部署设备！建立防御带！"
G["Deploying an urban setting in the middle of the wild. I love it!"]="荒野之中的城镇。我喜欢这样！"
G["Deploying an urban setting in the middle of the wild. I love it!\n\nNeed any training, $n?"]="荒野之中的城镇。我喜欢这样！\n\n需要进行训练吗，$n？"
G["Deployment successful.  Trespassers will be neutralized."]="命令接受成功。入侵者将被消灭。"
G["Depravity...hatred...chaos. These are the pillars."]="背叛……憎恨……混乱，这是一切的支柱。"
G["Depths take you!"]="深渊会吞噬你！"
G["Deputy Clunky wants all his buckaroos to stay safe, and have a good ol' fun time, assumin' you meet your contract-stipulated servitude quota! Gosh!"]="克朗奇警官希望能确保部下的安全和心情愉悦，他以为这样就能让他的部下按照合同的规定，对他唯命是从了！天哪！"
G["Der ain't no escapin' Zen'tabra. Not while he on dese islands."]="只要他在群岛上，就逃不出岑塔布拉的手心。"
G["Der ain't notin anybody can do about it!"]="谁都不能阻止我们！"
G["Der be no stoppin' us!"]="我们是不可阻挡的！"
G["Der... Der's no more time for me. I be done for. Finish me off, $n. Do it or dey'll kill us both. $n... Remember Sen'jin Village, mon! Dis world be worth saving!"]="我……我支撑不住了。这是注定的命运。杀了我吧，$n，否则我们俩都难逃一死。$n……想想森金村，朋友！这个世界值得你去拯救。"
G["Derak Nightfall, at your service!"]="德拉克·奈特弗，等候你的吩咐！"
G["Dere be a bird!"]="那里有一只鸟！"
G["Dere be a bug."]="那里有一只虫子。"
G["Dere be no hidin' from da eagle!"]="没人能逃过猎鹰的眼睛！"
G["Dere be no question why, Garrosh.  He gave ya tha title because ya be Grom's son and because tha people be wantin' a war hero."]="这没什么好想的，加尔鲁什。他之所以给你这个头衔，是因为你是格罗姆的儿子，因为人们想要一位战争的英雄。"
G["Dere be nothin' chaotic about dis attack. Da elementals and giants be organizin' against us. It be seemin' dat somehow we've earned da ire of Therazane, da Stonemother herself."]="关于此次攻击没什么混乱的。元素和巨人们有组织地前来对付我们。看来我们在不经意间引起了石母本人——塞拉赞恩的愤怒。"
G["Dere be others."]="又来了。"
G["Dere be somethin' in dat one. Go take look."]="那里面有东西，快去看看。"
G["Dere it be, mon. My huntin' eye! I'll be able ta rest in peace wit' my ancestors..."]="在那边，伙计。我的猎鹰之眼！我总算能安心地去见我的祖先们了……"
G["Dere was a shrine to serpents just to da east of Bambala, I need ya to toss some sticks into da bonfire in front of dat shrine.  Den Bwemba can handle da rest."]="在邦巴拉东面有一座祭祀毒蛇的神殿，我需要你去扔一些木棍到神殿前面的火堆中。剩下的就交给布温巴处理吧。"
G["Dere we go, mon. Now I be goin' off ta be wit Snuff..."]="这就好，伙计。现在我可以去找呼呼了……"
G["Dere's nothin' bettah dan flyin' ovah ya enemies an' droppin' dey boom-boom bombs on dem!\n\nDat, or droppin' two-hundred, fifty pound orcs on dere heads. Right, mon?"]="没有任何事情能比飞到敌人头顶上，向他们“轰隆轰隆”地扔炸弹更痛快的了！\n\n把两百五十磅的兽人扔到敌人头顶上也不错。对不对，朋友？"
G["Dere's only one with tha answers I seek. Ya can stay and watch if ya like."]="有一个人能为我解惑。如果你愿意，就留下来看看。"
G["Derenda Enkleshin carries enchanting supplies. She can be found in the chamber of masters, to the left as you enter the building.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="德兰达·安克辛携带着附魔物资。在师匠大厅内可以找到她，就位于你进入建筑物时的左侧。\n\n我会在你的地图上标记这个位置。"
G["Derived from cutting edge Shattered Sun Offensive military technology, it blasts away stubborn stains with ease!"]="源自破碎残阳的军用高端技术，轻松去除各类顽固污渍！"
G["Deriz is the one you should speak with if you wish to learn the basics of alchemy."]="如果你想要了解炼金术的基础知识，就和迪里兹谈谈吧。"
G["Derpa Derpa wanders into town every now and then and tries to sell us strange gadgets that he's found rummaging around Kun-Lai Summit. Talk to him and see if he has anything that we could use as a weapon."]="迪嘭迪嘭时不时地来到镇上，向我们出售在昆莱山附近搜集到的奇怪的小玩意儿。和他谈一谈，看他有没有可以给我们当做武器的东西。"
G["Des fools thought they beat me once before. Dey only make me stronger. Now we show dem da true power of the Zandalari!"]="这些蠢货自以为曾击败过我。这只会让我更加强大。现在，看看赞达拉真正的力量吧！"
G["Describe this vrykul. What does he look like?"]="描述一下这名维库人吧。他长什么模样？"
G["Dese Gurubashi mean business.  We gotta help dese people."]="这些古拉巴什巨魔来真的了，我们必须帮助这些人。"
G["Dese be dark times, but our people will be stayin' with tha Horde for tha good of all."]="这是一个艰难的时代，但是为了所有人的利益，我们会继续帮助部落。"
G["Dese be strange times... Thanks, $r. We gonna spill a lot of Kor'kron blood wit' dis."]="这真是个诡异的时代……谢谢你，$r。有了这些东西，我们就能让更多的库卡隆血洒疆场。"
G["Dese caves be haunted, mon. Filled with the worst juju.\n\nIn days when de Twilight's Hammer be settin' up atop de mountain, the unworthy were tossed into dese caverns. Into de Gullet. Food for de black drakes dat once nested here.\n\nDem people, dey never come out. Not even de spirits."]="这些洞可都是鬼窟，伙计。里面全都是最可怕的魂能。\n\n当暮光之锤盘踞在这座山顶的时候，那些被他们淘汰的人都被扔进了这些山洞。成为了以这些山洞为巢穴的黑龙的食物。\n\n这些洞里从没有活人走出来，就连那些灵魂也逃不出来。"
G["Dese spirits don't belong!"]="这些灵魂将不复存在！"
G["Designation: Old Gods. Old Gods rendered all systems, including earthen, defenseless in order to facilitate assimilation. This matrix destabilization has been termed \"the Curse of Flesh\". Effects of destabilization increased over time."]="Designación: Dioses antiguos. Los dioses antiguos inutilizaron todos los sistemas, incluyendo los terráneos, para facilitar la asimilación. Esta matriz de desestabilización ha sido denominada \"la maldición de la carne\". Los efectos de la desestabilización aumentaron con el paso del tiempo."
G["Designations: Aesir and Vanir. Or in the common nomenclature, storm and earth giants. Sentinel Loken designated supreme. Dragon Aspects appointed to monitor evolution on Azeroth."]="名称：艾塞尔与瓦尼尔。如果用通用语命名，则是风暴巨人与岩石巨人，最高领袖为哨兵洛肯。守护巨龙受命监管艾泽拉斯世界的进化过程。"
G["Despair, mortals! Your doom has come!"]="绝望吧，凡人！你们的末日来临啦！"
G["Despair..."]="绝望……"
G["Despair... so delicious..."]="绝望……如此甘甜……"
G["Desperate times call for desperate measures, $c."]="$c，在这个黑暗的时代，我们必须铤而走险。"
G["Despite our efforts to become enlightened beings, we have repeated the mistakes of our past.\n\nThe sha threaten this land once again."]="尽管我们一直努力想要塑造更加进步的文明，可我们总是重复过去的错误。\n\n煞魔又一次威胁到了这片土地。"
G["Despite our losses here, the king will be pleased to know that the naga general was defeated."]="尽管我们的许多战士牺牲了，但国王如果知道我们击败了纳迦将军，一定会很高兴的。"
G["Despite our success in Northrend, we face serious problems that cannot be solved simply by axe and sword.  Earthquakes shake every region.  Elementals ravage the countryside.  I can hear our land, Azeroth, cry out in pain."]="尽管我们在诺森德取得了成功，我们却面临着无法用刀剑解决的更大难题。地震使各地战栗不已。元素在乡间肆虐妄为。我能听见我们的大地——听见艾泽拉斯，在痛苦地哀号。"
G["Despite the hardships we've had to go through in this wasteland, I believe that the young prince will see us to victory. I pray each night for his safety."]="尽管这片冰霜废土给我们留下了痛苦的回忆，但我相信，年轻的王子殿下终将领导我们走向胜利。我夜夜祈祷，希望他能平安归来。"
G["Despite their tragedy the Undead have come all this way to aid us.  I only hope that we can be as helpful to them.  Seek out Father Cobb near the Pools of Vision under the Spirit Rise."]="虽然亡灵受到重创，但是他们还是赶来帮助我们。我只希望我们也能对他们有所帮助。去灵魂高地下面的预见之池附近寻找柯布神父。"
G["Despite what I may have said in the past, I never doubted your abilities!"]="不管我以前说过什么，我从没怀疑过你的能力！"
G["Despite your obvious weaknesses, I have grown fond of you, Wakener. I was made a paragon because of my prowess on the battlefield. It was said that I could cheat death itself. I shall lend you this very ability, Painkiller, to protect you during the task ahead."]="尽管你有一些明显的缺点，但我越来越喜欢你了，唤醒者。 我之所为能成为英杰，是因为在战场上勇猛善战。人们说我甚至能骗过死神。我现在就把这个起死回生的本领教给你，让你能在未来的任务中保住性命。"
G["Dessstroy them!"]="毁灭他们！"
G["Destination reached - engaging in scouting mission."]="顺利抵达目的地——这里就是本次侦察任务的目标地点。"
G["Destiny will not wait. Your craftsmen must increase their production of the war golems before the stone giant leader and his army reach Ulduar."]="命运不会为谁停留。在石巨人大军抵达奥杜尔之前，你必须监督工匠提高作战魔像的产量。"
G["Destiny... awaits."]="命运……在等待。"
G["Destroy $ghim:her;!"]="干掉$g他:她;！"
G["Destroy Arcane Fiends near Archmage Ataeric to overload the shield!"]="摧毁大法师阿塔瑞克身边的奥术魔，让防护盾过载！"
G["Destroy Zoram'gar Outpost! Destroy the Blackfathom Camp! We march on Maestra's Post and by nightfall Astranaar will lie in ruins!"]="摧毁佐拉姆加前哨站！摧毁黑渊营地！我们要向梅伊瑟娜岗哨进军。到日落时分，阿斯特兰纳就会成为一片废墟！"
G["Destroy all who stand against us!"]="消灭所有和我们作对的家伙！"
G["Destroy earthen infestation."]="消灭土灵入侵者。"
G["Destroy our raw materials, will you? Well, the master has a special plan in mind for you..."]="你想销毁我们的原料是吧？呃，主人已经想到了一项特殊的计划……"
G["Destroy the Drakkari! Destroy the Argent Crusade! Make Scourge of them all!"]="消灭达卡莱巨魔！消灭银色北伐军！将他们统统变成天灾军团的爪牙！"
G["Destroy the Firelands Eggs!"]="摧毁火焰之地龙卵！"
G["Destroy the Mana Void to regain lost mana!"]="快摧毁法力虚空来补充流失法力！"
G["Destroy the Obsidian Colossus!"]="摧毁黑曜石巨像！"
G["Destroy the Piles of Corpses to stop the Zombified Corpses!"]="摧毁尸体堆以阻止僵尸化的躯体！"
G["Destroy the Scourge invader now, before it's too late!"]="现在还来得及，消灭全部天灾入侵者！"
G["Destroy the bomb!"]="摧毁炸弹！"
G["Destroy the crystal so we can move on."]="摧毁水晶，我们就能继续前进了。"
G["Destroy the crystal."]="摧毁水晶。"
G["Destroy the eggs before they hatch!"]="在蛋孵化前摧毁它们！"
G["Destroy the elves!"]="毁灭精灵！"
G["Destroy the portal energy focus!"]="摧毁传送门的能量核心！"
G["Destroy the records before the bastion falls!"]="在堡垒倒塌之前毁掉所有文件！"
G["Destroy the spirit mask to bring down the barrier!"]="快摧毁灵魂面具，解除屏障！"
G["Destroy the temple!"]="摧毁寺庙！"
G["Destroy the vermin!"]="消灭这些寄生虫！"
G["Destroy their camp. Burn their tree to ash."]="毁掉他们的营地。烧光他们的树。"
G["Destroy their foul machines of war, $n!"]="毁掉那些邪恶的战争机器，$n！"
G["Destroy their rocket launchers and achieve total air superiority!"]="摧毁火箭发射器，完全取得制空权！"
G["Destroy them all!"]="把他们全部消灭！"
G["Destroy them all, but bring the Shaman to me!"]="杀光他们，除了那个萨满。带他来见我！"
G["Destroy them!"]="消灭他们！"
G["Destroy them! Destroy them all!"]="消灭他们！一个不留！"
G["Destroy them! FOR THE HORDE!"]="消灭他们！为了部落！"
G["Destroy them, I command you! No, stop, stop!"]="我命令你，消灭他们！不，住手！住手！"
G["Destroy them, Torloth. Let loose their blood like a river upon this hallowed ground."]="消灭他们，托洛斯。让这处神圣之地血流成河吧。"
G["Destroy them, me brothers!"]="兄弟们，消灭他们！"
G["Destroy them, minion! Your master commands it!"]="我的奴仆，快去毁灭他们！这是主人的命令！"
G["Destroy them, my minions!"]="我的奴仆们，毁灭他们！"
G["Destroy them, my subjects!"]="我的仆从，干掉他们！"
G["Destroy these Aldor dogs!"]="消灭这些奥尔多狗！"
G["Destroy these intruders! Leave them for the great dark beyond!"]="毁灭这些入侵者！将他们丢进无尽的黑暗之中！"
G["Destroy those who seek to stop us from retakin' these lands."]="消灭那些胆敢阻止我们重夺这片土地的人。"
G["Destroy zhe - Vait... vhat is ZHAT?!"]="消灭那——等等……那是什么？！"
G["Destroy!"]="都将在我们的剑下屈服。"
G["Destroy."]="摧毁。"
G["Destroyed? Yes, that's possible. At night I am haunted with visions of this world being torn asunder from within. I feel neither sorrow nor rage. Merely... curiosity.\n\nI served my master in exchange for power, $c. But those you fight... they strive for oblivion. A strange motivation."]="被摧毁了？好吧，这也有可能。深夜里，我常常会受到同一个噩梦的困扰——这个世界从内部被撕成了碎片。但我并不觉得哀伤，也没有愤怒。只是……好奇。\n\n$c，我侍奉我的主人，从而换取力量。但你与之战斗的这些家伙……他们想要的只有灭亡。这真是一个奇怪的动机。"
G["Destroying"]="摧毁"
G["Destroying the pipes leaks |cFFFF0000|Hspell:116779|h[Titan Gas]|h|r into the room!"]="管道被摧毁了，|cFFFF0000|Hspell:116779|h[泰坦寒气]|h|r漏进房间里来了！"
G["Destruction of elder servants will result in loss of enhancements on watcher Freya. However, permanent damage to Freya's person and possessions, including her watcher sigil, highly probable."]="摧毁古树仆从可以导致守护者弗蕾亚失去这些增强效果。但是也极可能对弗蕾亚自身及其携带的物品，包括她的守护者徽记，造成永久性的伤害。"
G["Destruction!"]="毁灭！"
G["Destructive forces corrupt you from the inside."]="毁灭之力将从内部侵蚀你。"
G["Details, details."]="小事，小事。"
G["Deth'tilac asserts his Molten Will!"]="德丝缇拉克保住了他的熔火意志！"
G["Detonating"]="引爆中"
G["Detonation imminent."]="即将爆炸。"
G["Detonation in 5..."]="爆破倒计时，5……"
G["Detonation in thirty seconds."]="30秒后爆炸。"
G["Devilsaur"]="魔暴龙"
G["Devlin Agamand!  Listen to my voice!"]="代弗林·阿加曼德！听我说！"
G["Devour Scarlet Crusaders to replenish your energy!"]="吞噬血色十字军，补充你的能量！"
G["Devour their hearts! Siphon their souls!"]="吞噬他们的灵魂！"
G["Devour them!"]="吞了他们！"
G["Devout and exceedingly charismatic, these priestesses live only to evangelize the power of Sargeras' dread vision."]="这些女祭司非常虔诚，并拥有非凡的魅力，她们生存的意义就是传播萨格拉斯的意志。"
G["Dey be heroes, no doubt about dat."]="不用怀疑，他们是英雄。"
G["Dey be holed up inside da ruined city, regroupin'."]="他们躲在城市的废墟中集结部队。"
G["Dey be on top of de tall building in de southeast end of de valley."]="他们在这座山谷东南端那座高大建筑的顶上。"
G["Dey be stronger then I expect mon, attack dem!"]="朋友，他们比我想象的更强壮。进攻！"
G["Dey be waitin' for us, all. We fight now for our old home... we gonna reclaim what be OURS!"]="他们正等在那里。我们将为古老的家园而战……我们要夺回我们的岛国！"
G["Dey came at us from everywhere, mon!"]="他们从各个方向朝我们发动攻击，朋友！"
G["Dey come! Hellscream tink his own people gonna roll right over."]="他们来了！地狱咆哮以为他的人能横扫一切。"
G["Dey comin, dey comin!"]="他们来了，他们来了！"
G["Dey gonna make a fine stew outta ya, mon."]="你是个好猎物，朋友。"
G["Dey must have taken da docks!  Ha ha!  Welcome to da' fields of slaughter."]="他们一定攻占了码头！哈哈！欢迎来到修罗场。"
G["Dey tink dey can stop da Farraki?"]="他们自以为能阻止法拉基部族？"
G["Dey were too many, mon!"]="他们数量太多了，朋友！"
G["Dey've done something to me! I be needin' help!"]="他们对我做了手脚！我需要帮助！"
G["Dey've returned!  To arms!"]="他们回来了！准备战斗！"
G["Dezco is a great chieftan, though I'm beginning to doubt how well we can survive in this land he led us to."]="德兹科是一位伟大的酋长，是他把我们带到了这里，但我开始有点怀疑我们能否在这片土地上存活下来。"
G["Dezco sent us ahead to scout this region. We may have found a path to the great healing in Leza's vision."]="德兹科派我们来侦察这片地区。我们也许已经找到了莱莎幻像中出现的伟大治疗之力。"
G["Dezco, this is a weapon of the horde. You should unleash it on the Alliance."]="德兹科，这是一件部落的武器。用它来狠狠的教训联盟。"
G["Dezco, we must strike at the mogu now while they think us weak. Let us unleash this $c on them."]="Dezco, debemos atacar a los mogu ahora que piensan que estamos débiles. Dejemos que $p se encargue de ellos."
G["Dezco, we should keep pressing westward. We are vulnerable here."]="德兹科，我们必须向西方推进。我们留在这儿很容易受到攻击。"
G["Dezco, where are you?!"]="德兹科，你在哪？！"
G["Dezco... it hurts... it... AAAHHH!"]="德兹科……好疼……好……啊啊啊！"
G["Dhugru Gorelust is hiding behind the barracks on the east side of town.  Don't let me find out that you're in league with the Burning Legion!"]="杜格鲁·血怒在城镇东边的兵营后面。不要让我发觉你跟燃烧军团是一伙的！"
G["Did $n tell you about how we found Danforth, Johnny? I think the orcs may have touched him inappropriately."]="$n告诉过你我们是怎么找到丹弗斯的吗，约翰尼？我想那群兽人也许对他做过不恰当的事。"
G["Did 'King Mrgl-Mrgl' send you? I know what he truly is!"]="是“姆嘎姆嘎国王”派你来的？我知道他的真面目！"
G["Did Balandar Brightstar send you to rescue me?"]="是巴尔兰达·新星派你来救我的吗？"
G["Did Brak say this teleporter thing was tested? Well, if you're ready to go back to Nozzlepot's Outpost, just say the word! I hope you get there in one piece."]="布拉克有没有说过，这个传送器是否进行过测试？嗯，如果你准备好了要返回诺兹波特的哨站，就说一句！希望你能完整无缺地到达那里。"
G["Did Crest send you?"]="是谁派你来的？"
G["Did Garrosh send you?"]="是加尔鲁什派你来的吗？"
G["Did I ever tell you about the time I met Varok Saurfang? I asked him to sign my massive pectoral muscles. He backhanded me instead, which is why I sometimes forget things now. It was totally worth it."]="我有没有和你说过我和萨鲁法尔相遇时的情景？那时我要他在我硕大的胸肌上签字。他却只是反手给了我一个巴掌，所以我现在经常会记不住事情。但这是值得的。"
G["Did I ever tell you soldiers about the time I destroyed the Thandol Span? Yep, weren't no dark irons destroyed that bridge! Was me!"]="萨多尔大桥是我炸毁的！我难道没有告诉你们？真的，所谓黑铁矮人破坏了大桥，那都是谣传！我才是真凶！"
G["Did I ever tell you that I was a mid-level accountant with the company back on Kezan? I worked for you for years. Do you even know my name?"]="我有没有告诉过你，我在科赞的公司里曾经是一名中级会计？我为你工作了好几年。你知道我的名字吗？"
G["Did I forget to mention that I'm injured?"]="我有没有跟你说我受伤了？"
G["Did I hear right, Omnuron? We're going to join the fight?"]="我没听错吧，欧穆隆？我们要参战了？"
G["Did I mention that I have money and jewels? Don't kill me!"]="我给你钱，还有珠宝！别杀我！"
G["Did I miss anything?"]="我错过什么了吗？"
G["Did I miss anything? Oh WOW!"]="我错过什么好戏了吗？噢，哇！"
G["Did I not say that my wings were swift? You move most slowly, Wakener."]="我没说过我能神速翱翔么？你移动得可真慢啊，唤醒者。"
G["Did I not yell at them? Pull back! Pull back and regroup with suppressing fire!!"]="我没有对他们吼叫吗？撤退！撤退，然后进行火力压制！"
G["Did I tell you about the time when the Twilight's Hammer actually tried to recruit me? True story."]="我有没有告诉过你，暮光之锤曾经想要征募我？千真万确。"
G["Did I win? [PH]"]="¿Gané? [PH]"
G["Did Ji send you?  I like Ji!  She is happy face.  The Mad Brewer though, he is a big fat dry face meany!\n\nCan you help make my water friends better?  The dry faced meany put a bunch of nasty stuff in there."]="是季派你来吗？我喜欢季！她有一张快活的脸。而疯酒师呢，他是一个刻薄鬼，那张干巴巴的丑脸又大又肥！\n\n你能帮我去安抚我那些水灵朋友吗？那个皱脸的刻薄鬼在水里放了恶心的东西。"
G["Did all of the jinyu and the hozen perish in that battle? Were there survivors?"]="所有锦鱼人和猢狲都在那次战斗中灭亡了吗？有幸存者吗？"
G["Did everyone else make it? Did the attack succeed?"]="其他人都成功了吗？进攻胜利了吗？"
G["Did he just...? Go'el, can you hear me? We need your help! Do something!"]="刚才是他——？古伊尔，你能听见吗？我们需要你的帮助！动手吧！"
G["Did he say \"horrible monster\"?"]="刚才他说“恐怖的怪物”？"
G["Did it give you much trouble? My poor little baby, $r are such nasty company."]="¿Te ha dado muchos problemas? Mi pobre $gqueridito:queridita;, $r son una compañía tan desagradable."
G["Did it work?"]="成功了吗？"
G["Did my son send you? There's plenty of stew to go around. Please, help yourself."]="是我儿子让你来的吗？我炖了很多菜，足够分的。请自己拿吧。"
G["Did my sweet lass Kali send you down to me? The apple of my eye, she is."]="是我亲爱的恋人卡利派你来找我的？她可是我的宝贝。"
G["Did somebody call for a paladin?"]="有人需要圣骑士吗？"
G["Did somebody say Grapplehammer? No? Oh well, here I am."]="有人提到钩锤吗？没有？好吧，我在这里。"
G["Did someone order a portal to Orgrimmar? No? TOO BAD!"]="有人预定了通往奥格瑞玛的传送门吗？没有？怎么可能！"
G["Did someone say Yak Attack?! It's ax-master Chagan Firehoof, wandering warrior of the Townlong Steppes!"]="刚有人说牦牛攻击了吗？这是斧头大师查干·焰蹄，螳螂高原上游荡的战士！"
G["Did someone say they needed jade?"]="好像有人说过想要玉石？"
G["Did someone say, \"Free Brew\"?"]="¿He oído a alguien decir \"cerveza gratis\"?"
G["Did someone say, party?"]="¿Alguien ha dicho \"fiesta\"?"
G["Did that seem okay?"]="看上去还好吧？"
G["Did the Horde do this?!\n\nLight save us all..."]="是部落干的吗？！\n\n圣光啊，救救我们……"
G["Did the Order of the Cloud Serpent send you? Bless them. Please help the others!"]="是云端翔龙骑士团派你来的吗？祝福他们。请帮帮其他人吧！"
G["Did the Scourge beat all the courage from your people, blood elf? We are the HORDE. Where there is power, we SEIZE it. My Horde has no place for the weak!"]="天灾军团把你们族人的勇气都吸干了吗，血精灵！我们是部落。只要有机会能获得力量，我们就要抓住它。在我的部落里，弱者没有发言权！"
G["Did the Scryers send you to contact me?  You do not look like a Scryer at all."]="是占星者派你来联系我的吗？你看上去一点也不像个占星者。"
G["Did the Serpent Riders send you? Their serpents keep stealing our best catches."]="是翔龙骑士派你来的吗？他们的翔龙不断偷取我们最好的渔获物。"
G["Did the Silver Covenant send you? Thank you for the well-timed rescue."]="是银色盟约派你来的吗？感谢你的及时搭救。"
G["Did the Sunreavers send you? Thank you for the well-timed rescue."]="是夺日者派你来的吗？感谢你的及时搭救。"
G["Did they bother to tell you who I am and why I am doing this?"]="他们顾得上告诉你我是谁或者我在做些什么吗？"
G["Did they leave yet?"]="他们走了吗？"
G["Did they prop this door up against a boulder?  It won't budge!"]="他们在门后面放了石头吗？它动都不动！"
G["Did they send you to find me? Well I'm not going back without my men."]="是他们派你来找我的吗？我不会丢下伙伴独自回去的。"
G["Did they send you?  They wouldn't dare!  Would they?"]="他们派你来的？他们不敢！不敢的……"
G["Did ya think ya could just fly ova' hea' unnoticed?!"]="你以为自己能神不知鬼不觉的从我们头上飞过去？！"
G["Did you and the pretty elves find somethin' while you was there?"]="你和你的漂亮精灵们在那儿的时候有什么发现吗？"
G["Did you bring your text books?  Can I look on with you?"]="你带来了课本吗？我能和你一起看吗？"
G["Did you call on me?"]="你刚才叫我？"
G["Did you come from the turtle?"]="你是从龟背上来的吗？"
G["Did you come to see my pretty face, or are you looking for a fight?"]="你到底是来欣赏美女还是来打架的？"
G["Did you cook these yourself?"]="¿Las has cocinado tú $gmismo:misma;?"
G["Did you enjoy my minion's terrible creation? Potent, is it not?"]="你喜欢我的那些恐怖的造物吗？很厉害，不是吗？"
G["Did you ever see the big wall in the west?"]="你见过西边的那道长城吗？"
G["Did you feel that?"]="你感觉到了吗？"
G["Did you find something fun to chase around, Twinkle?  I bet you did!"]="你是不是找到可以追逐的玩具了，咪咪？我打赌肯定是的！"
G["Did you finish yesterday's assignment?  If so, then sit by me!"]="你完成了昨天的作业吗？要是完成了，就过来跟我坐一块吧！"
G["Did you forget who you're messing with?!"]="你忘了你是和谁在对着干吗？"
G["Did you forget your student's attire?  Do you think fashion is more vital than the Scourge's domination?"]="你忘记自己的学生服了吗？你认为时尚比亡灵天灾的统治更重要吗？"
G["Did you forget, girl? I am the Darkmaster! I command the undead!"]="你忘了吗，小女孩？我是黑暗院长！我统御着亡者！"
G["Did you get the codex?"]="你拿到书典了吗？"
G["Did you get wet? I'm soaked! Okay, what do you want to bet the next rune is attuned to air?"]="你身上湿了吗？我简直湿透了！好吧，你觉得下一个风之力的符文会是什么样子？"
G["Did you get your business done?"]="你把该干的事干完了吗？"
G["Did you have to house train her, Gerard?"]="杰勒德，你有训练她的场地吗？"
G["Did you hear something?"]="你听到什么声音没有？"
G["Did you hear that Tina Mudclaw is here?\n\nI wonder if Farmer Yoon or Farmer Fung have noticed..."]="你听说了吗？迪娜·泥爪也来了。\n\n不知道农夫老愚和农夫老方发现没有……"
G["Did you hear that crack?!"]="你听到那声音了吗？！"
G["Did you hear that they lost total control of Murmur in the Shadow Labyrinth?!"]="你有没有听说他们在暗影迷宫里完全失去了对摩摩尔的控制？！"
G["Did you hear that!? The Hidden Master, to the north of here!?"]="你听到了吗！？隐秘大师，是在北边吗！？"
G["Did you hear that, $n?  Sylvanas is headed to the cathedral.  Let's hurry!"]="$n，你听到了吗？希尔瓦娜斯正赶往那座教堂。我们要立刻采取行动！"
G["Did you hear that, Clubnik? Those that died defending Lake Mennar are heroes. Their selfless actions may have even saved this entire world! A memorial should be erected."]="克拉伯尼克，你听到了吗？那些在门纳尔湖保卫战中牺牲的战士都是英雄。他们的无私也许拯救了全世界！我们应当郑重地纪念他们。"
G["Did you hear that?"]="你听到那个声音了吗？"
G["Did you hear that?  I thought I just heard Mauti over there..."]="你听见了吗？我好像刚刚听到了那边有玛乌提的声音……"
G["Did you hear that? Have a look around, $n, to see if any are trying to sneak up on us."]="你听到了什么吗？注意周围的动静，$n，小心有人偷袭我们。"
G["Did you hear that?! Those Ashtongue dogs are coming. Let's hurry up and start the ritual!"]="你听到了吗？！那些灰舌恶狗要过来了。我们快点开始仪式吧！"
G["Did you hear the matriarch growling up on the cliff? Steer clear of her!"]="你听到龙母在峭壁上的咆哮声没有？绕开她！"
G["Did you hear what those Tillers said about me being a citypaw?\n\nSure I grew up in Dawn's Blossom, but I visited my grandpa a few times. I know the difference between a carrot and a turnip! One's orange and one's white, after all!\n\nAfter Grandpa passed, he left the farm to me, so I'm going to do my best for him! But how can I prove that to those Tillers?"]="¿Has oído a los Labradores que me llaman \"zarpa urbanita\"?\n\nSí, crecí en Floralba, pero visité a mi abuelo varias veces. ¡Sé distinguir una zanahoria de una naba! ¡Una es naranja y la otra es blanca!\n\nCuando el abuelo falleció, me dejó la granja, ¡así que lo haré por él! ¿Pero cómo puedo demostrárselo a los Labradores?"
G["Did you hear?  |TInterface\\Icons\\ability_whirlwind.blp:10|t OMG I'm casting |cFFFF0000|Hspell:88481|h[Overdrive]|h|r!  That's Crazy!"]="听到了吗？|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_whirlwind.blp:10|t天哪，我要施放|cFFFF0000|Hspell:88481|h[超速]|h|r了，这太疯狂了！"
G["Did you hear? Dezco named one of the twins \"$p\"."]="¿Has oído? Dezco ha llamado a uno de sus gemelos \"$p\"."
G["Did you hear? They're safe somewhere!"]="你听到没？他们正安全地待在某个地方！"
G["Did you honestly think an agent of the Lich King would be bested on the field of your pathetic little tournament?"]="你们真以为，巫妖王的战士会败在你们那可怜的比武场上？"
G["Did you just come out of a dungeon?  Did you get me anything?"]="你刚从地下城出来吗？有什么东西给我的吗？"
G["Did you just say \"hello\"?"]="¿Acabas de decir \"Muy buenas\"?"
G["Did you just..?"]="你刚才……？"
G["Did you know about our \"Charitable Charms\" program?\n\nOfficial Crown event mascots like myself are authorized to distribute Lovely Charm Collector's Kits.\n\nYou can then use the Lovely Charms you gather to create Lovely Charm Bracelets for friends and loved ones, or turn them in to Lovely Merchants for Love Tokens!\n\nOne popular activity is making bracelets for your favorite leaders to let them know they're appreciated and adored..."]="¿Has oído hablar de nuestro programa \"Talismanes caritativos\"?\n\nLas mascotas oficiales de eventos de La Corona, S.L. como yo podemos distribuir Juegos de coleccionista de talismanes preciosos.\n\nPuedes usar los talismanes preciosos para crear pulseras de talismanes preciosos para tus amigos y amados, o entregárselas a mercaderes preciosas a cambio de pruebas de amor.\n\nUna actividad popular es crear pulseras para tus líderes preferidos para que sepan que se les valora y adora..."
G["Did you know that Lin found the Hidden Master? He's in Paoquan Hollow."]="你听说林找到隐秘大师了吗？他在抱拳林。"
G["Did you know that alchemists can transmute certain gems?  Mar'nah and I have been talking about this.\n\nI'm convinced that given her prowess, once her lab is complete, she and I will be able to create gems that were thought to be lost in time."]="你知道炼金师可以转化特定的宝石吗？玛尔娜和我讨论过这个问题。\n\n我深信只要能给她造好炼金台，就可以让她发挥自己的才干。这样一来我和她也就可以去制造那些被认为已经失传的宝石了。"
G["Did you know that the Barrens was once a lush forest? Thousands of years ago, before the first Sundering, it was verdant and thriving, watched over by the Kaldorei. But when the continents were torn apart, and this land became separated as what we call Kalimdor, this valley of nature became a harsh, sun-scorched plain.\n\nWhen I first learned this, I saw it as a great tragedy. I decided I would find a way to regrow the forests once more."]="你知道吗？贫瘠之地曾经是一片青葱茂密的森林。几千年以前，那时第一次大崩裂还没有发生。卡多雷照料着这片繁荣富饶之地。但随着大陆分崩离析，这一片被撕裂的陆地成为了现在被我们称为卡利姆多的地方，昔日的绿地成为了一片被阳光炙烤的荒芜平原。\n\n当我第一次听说这场恐怖的悲剧时，我就决定要找到办法，让森林重新生长在这片土地上。"
G["Did you know that there are two ways into Gina's heart? One is being a good customer at my market, and the other is Swirling Mist Soup!"]="有两种方式可以赢得吉娜的芳心，你知道是什么吗？一个是成为我市集的常客，另一个是迷雾汤！"
G["Did you know that turnips make quite a tasty brew?"]="你知道吗？用芜菁酿出来的酒味道可好了。"
G["Did you know that you can sometimes find rare onyx eggs on Windward Isle? If you bring one to a Serpent Master, you will gain great respect within the Order."]="你知道吗，在临风岛上有时能找到稀有的玛瑙翔龙蛋。要是你将它带给翔龙大师，就能赢得骑士团的尊重。"
G["Did you know, he was once a gladiator? Oh yes, I've been doing my research."]="你知道吗？他曾做过角斗士。没错，我调查过。"
G["Did you lose this, General?"]="这是你掉的吗，将军？"
G["Did you lose your wallet? Construct has found wallet with overabundance of currency."]="你丢了钱包？构造体找到了装满金币的钱包。"
G["Did you make that Swirling Mist Soup yourself? It smells delicious."]="你会自己做迷雾汤吗？它闻起来很香。"
G["Did you make this Twin Fish Platter yourself?"]="¿Has hecho tú $gmismo:misma; esta fuente de peces gemelos?"
G["Did you manage to see their show in Terokkar Forest? It was amazing!"]="你有没有看过他们在泰罗卡森林的表演？太精彩了！"
G["Did you need something?"]="你需要什么吗？"
G["Did you really believe that you could defeat me? Your friends are soon to join you, Taelan."]="你真的认为自己能打败我吗？你的朋友很快就会随你去的，泰兰。"
G["Did you really save my brother? That idiot got himself captured by the hozen. He's lucky he met you."]="你真把我兄弟救出来了？那个白痴居然成了猢狲的俘虏，幸好他遇见了你。"
G["Did you really think I would come to this fight alone?"]="你真以为我会只身一人前来作战？"
G["Did you really think all of your pets would survive?"]="你真以为你所有的宠物都能活下来？"
G["Did you really think that by facing me, you have any hope of saving your friends?"]="你真的认为能击败我，救出你的朋友吗？"
G["Did you really think that you could fool my master into falling for your sad, little trap, $n?"]="你还真以为我的主人会落入你设计的小圈套，$n？"
G["Did you really think you could corner me this easily?"]="你真以为我这么容易就会被你困住？"
G["Did you really think you would leave here alive?"]="你真以为自己可以活着离开这里？"
G["Did you really zhink you vould get avay vizh it, $p? Hmm?"]="你真以为你能全身而退吗，$p？嗯？"
G["Did you say something?  I'm sorry, I tend to not pay attention to conversation when things are being killed for my amusement."]="你刚才说话了吗？抱歉，每次有人被干掉时，我总会兴奋过头，从而忘了听别人说话。"
G["Did you see Captain Taylor and his men?"]="你有没有见到泰勒上尉和他的部下？"
G["Did you see Lord Taran Zhu earlier? His prowess is legendary."]="你之前见到祝踏岚掌门了吗？他的强大力量简直可以媲美神话中的英雄。"
G["Did you see Nazgrim and his troops?"]="你有见到纳兹戈林和他的部队吗？"
G["Did you see da eyes of Mauti?  Dey were glowing bright!  I shoulda know den dat Kilnara be behind da panther attacks."]="你看到玛乌提的眼睛吗？它们闪烁着光芒！我早该猜到基尔娜拉是猎豹袭击的幕后黑手。"
G["Did you see face? Looked so scared, \"Ah, big thing going to smash me!\" Hah."]="¿Has visto su cara? Parecía tan asustado, \"¡Ah, la cosa grande va a aplastarme!\" Ja."
G["Did you see his feet?"]="你看见他的脚了吗？"
