G["Dis place be huge. Why ja be needin' all dis space?"]="这地方真大。你们要这么大的地盘干啥？"
G["Dis place be too bright fa my tastes."]="这个地方对我来说太亮了。"
G["Dis place not be so bad if only dere weren't so many Amani 'ere."]="要是没那么多阿曼尼巨魔的话，这个地方也不算糟糕。"
G["Dis shattered world not done breakin, mon."]="这片支离破碎的大地还将继续粉碎下去，朋友。"
G["Dis ship is unda new management! Anybody not pullin' dey weight is gonna have dey spirit re-assigned to a golem."]="这艘船得有个新规矩了！所有不卖力干活儿的人，他们的灵魂将被注入魔像。"
G["Dis the kind of trainin Bom'bay needs."]="这正是波贝所急需的训练。"
G["Dis troll gonna stand for da..."]="我是来……"
G["Dis troll tink you got a crush on he! Come on over!"]="这个巨魔以为你喜欢上他了！哈哈！"
G["Dis was a mistake fo' you."]="你犯了一个的错误。"
G["Dis whole place gonna belong to da Scourge!"]="这片土地将属于天灾军团！"
G["Dis will help."]="这会有所帮助。"
G["Dis' be our home, mon. If ya be tinkin' we goin' quietly ya mistaken."]="这里是我们的家园。如果你认为我们会默默忍受，你就大错特错了。"
G["Dis'll help Bom'bay's Witch Doctorin."]="这有助于提高波贝的巫医水平。"
G["Disable?!"]="废止？！"
G["Disabling"]="破坏"
G["Disabling the shadow cloak reveals Aviana's Egg!"]="关闭暗影遮罩之后，艾维娜的卵显现了出来！"
G["Disabling the shadow cloak reveals one of Sethria's hatchlings!"]="关闭暗影遮罩之后，一只塞西莉亚的雏龙出现了！"
G["Disagree with me all you like, High Executor. I will weigh your counsel, and then we will take the steps to free all of Quel'Thalas as I deem necessary. We shall continue this discussion anon."]="你是否同意我的看法，悉听尊便，高级执行官。我会考虑你的忠告，然后采取我认为必要的手段解放整个奎尔萨拉斯。我们会继续就这个问题讨论下去的。"
G["Disappointing."]="令人失望。"
G["Disarm him if you can. Use every advantage."]="多使用缴械，利用每一点优势。"
G["Disarming"]="缴械"
G["Disciples... you will find with time that many healing spells fall victim to the degeneration of our strikes."]="不过正好……看清楚，这就是我们的敌人，这就是死亡骑士的敌人。我们是孤独的死亡骑士，我们必须战斗。"
G["Discipline is the key to perfection. Defeat your sloth! Master your laziness!"]="纪律是臻于完美的关键。你必须打败你的惰性！管好你那把懒骨头！"
G["Disco Ball"]="跳舞球"
G["Discovering the power in these shards gave me the will to drag myself out of the gutter and get my life together.\n\nOh, and also I was kicked out."]="发现这些碎片中能量使我看到了走出困境，重获新生的希望。\n\n噢，而且我也被开除了。"
G["Discretion is the better part of valor, after all."]="毕竟，慎重比勇气更重要。"
G["Disguise Failing! Avoid Scourge Contact!"]="伪装失效了！避开天灾兵！"
G["Disguised as \"nifty nibs\", never to fall into mogu hands."]="digo ke son \"rukos\", así están en buenas manos."
G["Disgusting big-tongue friend, you no belong here. Go from Frenzyheart land or I call magic stuffs to kill you!"]="你居然和大舌头怪交朋友，真恶心！你不属于这里。赶紧滚出狂心氏族的土地，不然我就召唤魔法生物干掉你！"
G["Disgusting big-tongue thing! What it doing here?!"]="恶心的大舌头怪！它在这里干什么？！"
G["Disgusting!"]="恶心！"
G["Disgusting! We'll have to slash and burn our way to Forward Command."]="可恶！我们只能连砍带烧地向前线指挥站前进了。"
G["Disgusting, I agree."]="是啊，我也很厌倦目前的生活。"
G["Disgusting. They're of no use to us without their heads."]="真恶心。这些没有头的家伙对我们毫无价值。"
G["Dismiss me... I wish to return to the void."]="放我走吧……我想回到虚空中去。"
G["Dismissed!"]="解散！"
G["Dismissed."]="解散。"
G["Disperse."]="消散。"
G["Dispose of it..."]="消灭入侵者！"
G["Disrespect me again, and I'll have your head on a pike outside the gates of Orgrimmar."]="如果你再敢对我不敬，我会把你的脑袋砍下来，插在奥格瑞玛的城门外。"
G["Disruptor Field calibration success, subject terminated."]="干扰力场校正成功，进程终止。"
G["Disruptron Mk. 3R-Alpha initiating perpendicular disruptor beams."]="干涉者Mk.3R-Alpha型正在初始化垂直干涉光束。"
G["Disruptron Mk. 3R-Alpha ready for combat testing."]="干涉者Mk.3R-Alpha型准备进行战斗测试。"
G["Disruptron Mk. 3R-Alpha shutting down, combat test: successful."]="干涉者Mk.3R-Alpha型正在关闭。战斗测试：成功。"
G["Disruptron Mk. 3R-Alpha shutting down, reccommend recalibration of combat test."]="干涉者Mk.3R-Alpha型正在关闭，建议重校战斗测试。"
G["Distilling Kaja'Cola out of kaja'mite was a stroke of pure genius on your part, $n. The Trade Prince has got to be worried that you're going to take his title!"]="能想到用卡亚矿石蒸馏出卡亚可乐，你可真是个天才啊，$n。贸易大王这下要担心你要抢他的位子了！"
G["Distilling the juice out of kaja'mite to make a delicious, carbonated beverage that will give people IDEAS! Hey, wait a minute..."]="从卡亚矿石里蒸馏出的汁水能做成可口的碳酸饮料，让人的脑袋里充满灵感！嘿，等一下……"
G["Disturb the stone and summon Lord Ahune."]="用这块石头召唤埃霍恩大人。"
G["Disturbin' prospects. And there be little we can be doin' about it witout more men."]="前景真是令人堪忧。可如果没有更多的人手，我们几乎什么都做不了。"
G["Disturbing"]="打断"
G["Dive!  Dive!  Dive!"]="俯冲！俯冲！俯冲！"
G["Do Great Ones ever run out of bag space for shinies?"]="难道连造物主的包包也满了吗？"
G["Do I detect a bit of jealousy, Dorian?"]="多里安，怎么你看上去有点嫉妒啊？"
G["Do I detect a hint of cinnamon? Or is that nutmeg? Whatever it is, one thing's for sure - nobody cooks a donkey like you, Cookie."]="我是不是尝到了肉桂？还是肉豆蔻？不管是什么，有一件事是肯定的——没有人会像你那样烹驴肉的，曲奇。"
G["Do I frighten you, $r?"]="我吓到你了吗，$r？"
G["Do I get a free mount?"]="我能免费得到一匹坐骑？"
G["Do I have to come in there and show you how it's done?!"]="难道我必须亲自告诉你该怎么做吗？！"
G["Do I know you?"]="我认识你吗？"
G["Do I know you?  If you're interested in joining the Cenarion Expedition step right in."]="我认识你吗？如果你对加入塞纳里奥远征队感兴趣的话，就靠近点。"
G["Do I know you?  Look, I don't want any trouble.  I just fix things around here."]="我认识你吗？听着，我不想找麻烦。我只是在修理东西。"
G["Do I know you? No? Welcome to the Twilight's Hammer."]="¿Te conozco? ¿No? $gBienvenido:Bienvenida; al Martillo Crepuscular."
G["Do I look angry? Well it's because I AM! \n \n My arch nemesis, Wizak Blastbait, is encroaching pretty close onto my turf. He's a nasty little goblin, who uses... non-conventional means of fishing.  \n \n Last I saw him, he was at Krasari Falls. You should fish there today if you want Krasarang Paddlefish, I bet he's scaring them up left and right. Maybe if he sees other people fishing there, he'll deem the area overcrowded and leave. \n \n Oh, and if you can,  make a rude gesture at him. Tell'm old Ben sent'ya.\n\n<Ben smirks to himself.>"]="¿Parezco enfadado? ¡Porque LO ESTOY!\n\nMi archienemigo, Wizak Bombacebo, está allanando mi terreno. Es un horrible goblin que utiliza métodos... poco convencionales para pescar.\n\nLa última vez que lo vi estaba en las Cataratas Krasari. Si quieres poliodóntidos de Krasarang, deberías pescar allí; seguro que Wizak los está asustando. A lo mejor si ve a más gente pescando en la zona se cree que hay demasiada competencia y se va.\n\nAh, si puedes, hazle un gesto grosero. Dile que te envía el bueno de Ben.\n\n<Ben sonríe para sus adentros.>"
G["Do I look like I have the time or energy to coddle every tourist that wanders through my door? Tell me what you need, and make it quick."]="我看上去像是那种闲得可以招待每个旅行者的人吗？快点告诉我你需要什么，我可没有时间和你慢慢磨蹭。"
G["Do I look like I have the time to spend jawin?"]="我看上去像是有时间和你闲谈的样子吗？"
G["Do I look like a $c to you? Now run along before I feel the need to oil my blade... in your blood."]="你看我像是个$c吗？在我决定用你的血洗我的刀之前，赶紧逃吧。"
G["Do I look like a fool, mortal? Because only a fool would remain here and do battle with you and all of your allies. Perhaps another time... Should you ever find the courage to back up your banter."]="我看起来像个傻子吗，凡人？因为只有傻子才会留在这儿，跟你和你的盟友交战。或许下一次……你会有勇气收回嘲讽的话。"
G["Do I look like a guide to you?  Fine, what do you need?"]="你看我像个向导吗？好极了，你需要什么？"
G["Do I look like a transmatter-tech to you?! At least we have incoming... sort of."]="我看上去像是修理转换器的专家吗？！至少这玩意儿的输入装置……还能用。"
G["Do I look stupid to you, $r? I may as well sign her death warrant myself! Why should I trust you?"]="你看我像个傻子吗，$r？我可以签署她的死亡证明书！我为什么要信任你呢？"
G["Do I look to you like I cast spells?  Well, I did hear that Cain Firesong now hangs out in the laboratory, always working on something unsavory."]="你觉得我像是懂法术的样子吗？不过，我听说凯恩·火歌就在那间实验室里，他总是喜欢鼓捣些让人不舒服的东西。"
G["Do I look to you like I cast spells?  Well, I did hear that Cain Firesong was hanging out on the upstairs landing of the Gallows' End Tavern at the southeast end of town.  Odd how he just stands there outside of Gretchen's room like that."]="你看我像个会施魔法的人吗？嗯，我确实听说 凯恩·火歌居住在城镇东南部的恐惧之末旅店的楼上。他那样站在格雷彻的房间之外可真奇怪。"
G["Do I make myself clear?"]="我说得够清楚了吗？"
G["Do I need to come over there and show you how it's done?"]="是不是需要让我过来教你该怎么做？"
G["Do I need to go into all the gory details? I think we are both well aware of what Lord Illidan does with those that would oppose his word. Now, I must be going! Farewell, Ruusk! Forever..."]="我需要去考虑所有的细节吗？我想我们都很清楚伊利丹大人对那些反对者做了什么，我必须走了。再见，鲁斯克，永远…………"
G["Do I see them with weapons still?  Why you let them keep their weapons?!"]="为什么他们身上还有武器？你为什么不拿走他们的武器？！"
G["Do I smell bacon?"]="我闻起来像不像火腿？"
G["Do I want to know where this stuff is from?"]="我想要知道这东西是从哪儿来的？"
G["Do NOT let him go!"]="别让他逃走了！"
G["Do NOT let the spy escape!"]="不要让间谍逃跑！"
G["Do any of you other ogres want to join your friend?"]="¿Alguno de vosotros, ogros, quiere unirse a $gvuestro amigo:vuestra amiga;?"
G["Do as I say, Fly!"]="照我说的做，飞吧！"
G["Do as I taught you!"]="按我教导的去做！"
G["Do as the master commands, Theralion! Kill them!"]="照主人说的做，瑟纳利昂！杀了他们！"
G["Do as you please, city boy, but I wager you won't last a week. I mean, just look at this dump!"]="随你的便吧，城里人。但我赌你撑不过一个星期。我是说，瞧瞧这烂摊子！"
G["Do as you will with me. I am not afraid. That halfbreed runt will never be my emperor! Long live Twilight's Hammer!"]="要怎样尽管来。我不怕。那个杂种永远别想成为我的帝王！暮光之锤万岁！"
G["Do as you're told and no one gets hurt!"]="只要乖乖听话，就不会有人受伤！"
G["Do dem proud! Show dem your bravery and your ferocity! Bring honor to their spirits!"]="要让他们为我们而骄傲！让他们看到你们的勇敢和强大！为祖先的英灵夺取新的光荣！"
G["Do dogs bark?"]="狗会叫吗？"
G["Do enjoy yourssselves!"]="尽情享乐吧！"
G["Do exercise caution.  Don't expect anyone to invite you to their homes just yet.  But at least they won't shoot you outright."]="一定要万分小心。没人会邀请你去他们家里。但至少他们也不会公开向你射击。"
G["Do fish ever get thirsty?"]="鱼不会口渴吗？"
G["Do giants tread lightly?"]="巨人会轻轻走路吗？"
G["Do it while I'm standing..."]="趁我还站在这儿，赶快动手……"
G["Do it!"]="做到了！"
G["Do it!  Give him de raptor!  I don't like havin' this sword in my face!"]="照做！把迅猛龙给他！我不喜欢他把剑指在我脸上的感觉！"
G["Do it! Once the area is clear we will make landfall. Champions, I'm counting on you."]="去吧！等我们肃清这里，就能顺利登陆了。勇士们，我就指望你们了。"
G["Do it, $c...Then... avenge me!"]="动手吧，$c……然后……为我复仇！"
G["Do it, $n!"]="动手吧，$n！"
G["Do it, $n! Put me out a me misery!"]="动手吧，$n！让我解脱吧！"
G["Do it, $n! Put me out of my misery!"]="动手吧，$n！让我解脱吧！"
G["Do it."]="按我说的做。"
G["Do it... Do it now."]="做吧……现在就做。"
G["Do keep out of sight, will you? I'm trying to pretend that I'm still under the Lich King's control!"]="你千万不能败露自己的行踪。我要继续装出臣服于巫妖王的模样！"
G["Do liars speak the truth?"]="骗子会说真话吗？"
G["Do maggots feast on corpses?"]="蛆虫会吃尸体？"
G["Do me a favor and silence those things. I am otherwise engaged."]="帮我个忙，让他们闭嘴。我还有别的事要做。"
G["Do me a favor: deposit your extra filth into the filth-pool."]="帮我个忙：把你多余的污物丢到污水池里。"
G["Do me know you? No matter. Me crush your bones!"]="我们认识吗？不要紧。我会压碎你的骨头！"
G["Do me this courtesy, $p, and do not share with Garrosh what has transpired here today. I could confront him directly, but I see now not all orcs share my view of the Horde.\n\nWho am I to command their allegiance if I must become another dictator to do so?\n\nWhat I can do is aid the Darkspear in fortifying their home while their heroes are abroad for the war. When Vol'jin returns, we will plan our next move."]="请帮我个小忙，$p，不要让加尔鲁什知道今天在这里发生的事。我不是不能直接挑战他，但我发现如今并不是所有的兽人都和我的想法一致。\n\n如果我需要成为另一个暴君才能赢得他们的忠诚，那我和加尔鲁什有什么区别？\n\n我能做的只有帮助暗矛部族防御他们的家园，直到他们的英雄归来。当沃金回来之后，我们再进行下一步计划。"
G["Do murderers kill?"]="杀手会杀人？"
G["Do my eyes deceive me? Am I truly free?"]="我不是眼花了吧？我真的自由了？"
G["Do my eyes deceive me? Is that really you, Brother Rokkaram, after all this time?\n\nIf you are looking for Sai'kkal, he walks among the crystals in the western part of the Vortex Pinnacle. He seems preoccupied with what he calls a brutish, primitive presence there, although nothing seems amiss."]="我眼花了吗？我们很久没有见过面了，罗卡拉姆兄弟，真的是你吗？\n\n你在找塞克卡尔？他就在漩涡峰西部的水晶田中。他说自己可以在那里感受到某种原始的、未开化的超自然力量，并为此神魂颠倒；但是在旁人看来，那片水晶田并没有什么异常现象。"
G["Do my eyes deceive me? What is that wall in the distance?"]="我的眼睛欺骗了我？远处的城墙是怎么回事？"
G["Do not EVER bring cyclopean demonic octopi into the cove again!"]="别再把那么大个儿的恶魔章鱼弄进来了！"
G["Do not allow Kaskala to forget what has happened here."]="卡斯卡拉会铭记你的恩情。"
G["Do not allow the elements to engage you!"]="别让元素缠住你！"
G["Do not allow these wretches a moment of rest!  If there's an Ata'mal crystal here then we shall find it!"]="不要让这些可怜虫有一点点喘息的时间！如果这里真的有一颗阿塔玛水晶的话，那么我们会找到它的！"
G["Do not allow your foe to complete his attack."]="不要让你的敌人完成攻击。"
G["Do not anger me!"]="不要激怒我！"
G["Do not ask for mercy, after such an act."]="犯下了此等罪行，你休想得到宽恕。"
G["Do not ask needless questions, wallwalker. Focus on the task at hand."]="别问那么多无聊的问题，城墙行者。把注意力集中在当前的任务上。"
G["Do not attempt to deceive me, demon!"]="别想欺骗我，恶魔！"
G["Do not back down. We are winning this!"]="别放弃。我们就要胜利了！"
G["Do not be afraid to lose one battle if the war is won."]="如果胜局已定，就不必惧怕区区一场战斗的失败。"
G["Do not be afraid, $c. We embrace all who seek the truth."]="不要害怕，$c。我们全心接受所有寻觅真相的人。"
G["Do not be afraid. I will not let you fall."]="不必害怕。我不会让你掉下去的。"
G["Do not be alarmed, $n.\n\nI am projecting my dream self here in order to aid your efforts against the mogu."]="不要惊慌，$n。\n\n我将梦中的自我投射在这里，以便帮助你对抗魔古族。"
G["Do not be alarmed. I am not as I appear.\n\nMy name is Acridostrasz, though you may call me Acride. My Queen sent me here to stop Nefarian, and I will not rest until my task is complete. However, there are other foes here guarding his lair that I cannot take on alone.\n\nHelp me dispose of them, and you will be in the favor of Alexstrasza. You may not know that name, but you will one day be thankful you do, of this I am certain."]="别害怕。我其实并不像外表显示的这样可怕。\n\n我的名字是阿克莱多斯塔兹，你可以称呼我阿克莱德。我的女王派我到这里来阻止奈法利安。在任务完成之前，我绝不会休息。但这里还有一些敌人守卫着他的巢穴。仅凭我的力量是无法战胜他们的。\n\n请帮我消灭掉他们。阿莱克丝塔萨一定会因此而感激你。也许你还不知道这个名字，但我相信，你总有一天会因为今天帮助了我而感到庆幸。"
G["Do not be disheartened. Silvermoon will remain strong through this course of events."]="别灰心丧气。即使是发生了这样一系列事件，银月城依然会保持强大的。"
G["Do not be fooled by my calmness. I will defeat you."]="别被我的平静给骗了。我会打败你。"
G["Do not be fooled by the ruins surrounding us, $c.  Dalaran is as powerful as ever."]="不要被我们周围的废墟所蒙蔽，$c。达拉然仍然像以前那样强大。"
G["Do not be fooled by their diminutive size, $n, they are disciplined and quick."]="别被他们娇小的体型给骗了，$n，他们可都是训练有素，行动敏捷的家伙。"
G["Do not be frightened child... welcome the cold embrace of death..."]="别害怕……接受死亡的冰冷拥抱吧……"
G["Do not be frightened, $r. Our ends are the same."]="不要害怕，$r。我们有着相同的目标。"
G["Do not be lured into the mortals' trap.  Bathe in my power!  Be renewed and destroy the heretics!"]="No caigas en la trampa de los mortales. ¡Báñate en mi poder! ¡Siéntete $grenovado:renovada; y destruye a los herejes!"
G["Do not be saddened. The cycle is clear - it neither begins nor ends with me."]="不要难过。这就是轮回——我非起点，亦非终点。"
G["Do not be so easily taken, $n! It is a trick!"]="不要这么轻易地被吸引，$n！这是个骗局！"
G["Do not be so harsh on the child, Alturus.  Remember that Cedric himself assigned him to you."]="不要对孩子这么刻薄，奥图鲁斯。记住是塞德瑞克亲自把他指派给你的。"
G["Do not be too hasty, Li Li. This is how I traveled Kalimdor: one stop at a time."]="别那么急，丽丽。我就是这么游历卡利姆多的：一次一站。"
G["Do not beat the Coilsssskaarrr commander anymore, orc! I will tell you! The cipherrr... It is hidden in one of the chests at Coilssskarrr Point... The naga there hold the keysss..."]="不要再殴打库斯卡司令官了，兽人！我说！密码……藏在库斯卡岗哨的一只箱子里……那里的纳迦身上有钥匙……"
G["Do not bother me, pest. I am studying the inept fighting of these so-called combatants.\n\nI will best them all, and then I will be elevated to serve the Lich King."]="别来打扰我。我正在研究那些“格斗者”的笨拙动作。\n\n我要将他们统统击败，然后我就会被提拔为巫妖王的部属了。"
G["Do not bow to Mog'dorg's puppet!  He would replace our gronn overlords with a liege of lesser stock.  Why should we replace one master with another?"]="不要向莫戈多格的傀儡低头！他不过是想以此取代戈隆大王的统治。为什么我们要不停地更换主人呢？"
G["Do not bring it any closer, mortal. I can sense the evil coursing through the seal from where I stand.\n\nGive me a moment to inspect the item - hold it firmly."]="No te acerques más, mortal. Puedo sentir el mal en el sello desde donde estoy.\n\nDame un momento para identificar el objeto... sujétalo con fuerza."
G["Do not burden A'dal with mundane questions, $r.  This being's will is all that keeps our enemies from crushing this city."]="不要用太多问题来麻烦阿达尔，$r。这个生物的意志是让我们的城市远离伤害的关键。"
G["Do not consume the entire corpse just yet, children! Save room for dessert!"]="孩子，别把整个尸体都吃了！留着肚子吃些甜点吧！"
G["Do not continue! Turn back while there's still time!"]="不要继续了！撤退，趁还有时间，你们应该立刻撤退！"
G["Do not cross a Klaxxi."]="不要跟卡拉克西作对。"
G["Do not dare..."]="你竟敢……"
G["Do not despair the damage that was done here."]="不要因为这儿的满目疮痍而绝望。"
G["Do not despair! All is not lost! Not yet!"]="不要丧失信心！我们还没一无所有！还没！"
G["Do not despair! Turn away from the false Light, and instead embrace the hope and truth I offer you!"]="不要绝望，离开那虚伪的圣光吧，拥抱我给予你们的希望和真实！"
G["Do not despair, young prince. You are not your father."]="不要绝望，年轻的王子。你不是你父亲。"
G["Do not die on me, vindicator!"]="不要死在我面前，守备官！"
G["Do not disturb the investigation protocol."]="不要干扰调查工作。"
G["Do not disturb the serenity of the city. Peace must be upheld."]="不要破坏城市的宁静。必须维护和平。"
G["Do not do anything that would incite the Horde, $n. The Warchief has agreed to see us on good faith."]="千万不要激怒部落，$n。酋长已经同意与我们坦城相见。"
G["Do not do this, Gul'dan! The elements will never forgive us!"]="不要这么做，古尔丹！元素们永远都不会原谅我们的！"
G["Do not doubt my comrades and I, spirit. Tell us how to conjure the fire lord. My allies will destroy him."]="不要怀疑我和我的朋友，灵魂。请告诉我们怎样才能召唤炎魔之王。我的朋友们会消灭他的。"
G["Do not dwell on lost friends and companions for too long.  Perhaps it is best to feel honored that you had the privilege of sharing an experience with them."]="不要过于怀念逝去的朋友和同伴。也许最好的解决办法就是为你能与他们有过一段交情感到荣幸。"
G["Do not eat clean meat. The Skumblade are just as strong on the inside as they are on the outside."]="不要吃干净的肉。邪刃蜥蜴人的强壮必须表里如一。"
G["Do not even ask."]="问也别问。"
G["Do not even think of fleeing, Broken wretches!  I promise you a fate worse than death if you don't slay these intruders!"]="不要妄想逃跑，可怜的破碎者！不消灭这些入侵者，我就让你们生不如死！"
G["Do not even think of letting up, $n!"]="千万别松懈，想都别想，$n！"
G["Do not expect mercy, tamer. I will show none."]="别妄想我会手下留情，驯宠师。我不会手软。"
G["Do not expect to defeat me."]="休想打败我。"
G["Do not expect your sacrilege... to go unpunished."]="别以为你们亵渎了这里……还能安然无恙。"
G["Do not expose your weaknesses."]="不要暴露你的弱点。"
G["Do not fail me, San'layn.  Return to Icecrown with this fool's head or do not bother to return."]="别让我失望，萨莱因。把这个蠢货的首级带回冰冠冰川，否则就不用回去见我了。"
G["Do not fail us!"]="别让我们失望！"
G["Do not falter! We will soon unite with our ancient mogu allies!"]="不要动摇！我们很快就能和古老的魔古同伴们团结在一起了！"
G["Do not falter, for Hellscream's eyes are upon you all!"]="不要退缩——地狱咆哮的双目在注视着你们每一个人！"
G["Do not fear defeat. It is a catalyst for later triumph."]="不要惧怕失败。那是酝酿成功的催化剂。"
G["Do not fear the heights, as I did when I was young. Fear can drive us to terrible deeds. Ah, but I see that like me, you have learned the lessons of courage!"]="别像我年轻时那样恐高。恐惧会驱使我们做出可怕的事情。啊，但我看得出来，你和我一样，都学会了勇敢！"
G["Do not fear, Tai-Feng. Yu'lon is strong. She will break free of the sha's corruption, I know it."]="别担心，泰峰。玉珑很强大。我相信，她一定能摆脱煞的腐化。"
G["Do not fear, little ones. Come shadow or light, the waters will always flow."]="别害怕，小家伙们。无论光明还是黑暗，流水不腐。"
G["Do not fear."]="不要害怕。"
G["Do not fight me, fiend! The time of your atonement is now!"]="别抵抗了，恶魔！赎罪的时候到了！"
G["Do not fight the enemy unprepared, $n.  I can provide you with very powerful items... provided you have proven yourself to us."]="不要在还未准备好的时候就去战斗，$n。倘若你已经向我们证明了自己的能力……我就可以给你提供一些非常强大的装备。"
G["Do not force me to call upon the lightning!"]="别逼我召唤闪电！"
G["Do not force my hand, children! I shall use your hides to line my boots."]="孩子，别推我的手！我将用你的兽皮装饰我的靴子。"
G["Do not forget the sacrifices made on this day, night elf. We have all suffered immensely at the hands of these beasts."]="暗夜精灵，不要忘记今天牺牲的人们。这些野兽让我们蒙受了巨大的损失。"
G["Do not forget to speak to Fei Li before you depart. You will find her skills useful against our enemies."]="出发前别忘了跟非离谈谈。她的技能会有力地帮你对付我们的敌人。"
G["Do not forget your task here! Continue the rituals while the meddlesome heroes of the world turn a blind eye to this desolate wasteland."]="不要忘记在这里的任务！当那些爱管闲事的英雄们仍然对这片荒凉废土视而不见的时候，你们必须将仪式进行下去。"
G["Do not forget, $c, battles still rage in Azeroth. Will you return to help the Horde in Alterac Valley?"]="不要忘记，$c，战斗仍然在艾泽拉斯进行着。你会回奥特兰克山谷帮助部落吗？"
G["Do not forget..."]="不要忘记……"
G["Do not fret. You are one of many I've defeated."]="别担心。你只是我的手下败将之一。"
G["Do not get too close. I laid a hand upon it once... Only once and never again. The memories of that day still linger."]="不要太靠近了。我曾经把手放在上面……就那么一次。那天的记忆至今仍然在我脑海里浮现。"
G["Do not get... too comfortable."]="不会让你们好过的。"
G["Do not give an inch of ground!"]="坚守每一寸土地！"
G["Do not give in to the curse!  You were men and women of Gilneas once... you can be men and women of Gilneas again!"]="不要屈服于这个诅咒！你们曾是吉尔尼斯人……你们能够再次成为吉尔尼斯人！"
G["Do not give up hope, friends!"]="不要放弃希望，同胞们！"
G["Do not give up on yourself!"]="不要放弃自己！"
G["Do not give up!"]="别放弃！"
G["Do not give up!  Shed your blood for Darrowshire!"]="不要放弃！为达隆郡而战！"
G["Do not give up, $n!"]="别放弃，$n！"
G["Do not harbor false hope! You cannot win!"]="别再抱有幻想了！你们不可能赢！"
G["Do not hesitate."]="不要犹豫。"
G["Do not hold back! Destroy them!"]="不要退缩！干掉他们！"
G["Do not incite violence on my temple grounds, $p. Be patient."]="不要把暴力带到我的寺庙和土地上来，$p。耐心点。"
G["Do not interrupt Niby, fool! I shall rend the flesh from your bones and use your skeletal remains as a coat rack. Now where was I? Oh yes, so, Kroshius lasted nearly ten times longer than any ordinary infernal. I am not sure why but I am confident that with enough study, I could find out.\n\nI need you to recover Kroshius' Infernal Core."]="别打断我，你这个蠢货！我会把你身上的肉刮下来，把你的骨头做成衣架。我说到哪儿了？哦，对，克罗苏斯的存活时间是普通地狱火的10倍。我不知道为什么会这样，但是我想只要进行足够的研究，我一定可以查明真相。\n\n你必须帮我找到克罗苏斯的火焰核心。"
G["Do not lament. Continue your training, and you shall achieve greatness."]="别难过。继续训练，你一定能成就大业。"
G["Do not let it consider its next spell so freely, disciple... freeze its mind."]="别让它轻易地放出下一个法术……冻结它的思维。"
G["Do not let it pass!"]="不要让它过去！"
G["Do not let others fool you. Dragons are weapons of war; nothing more."]="不要相信别人的鬼话。龙只是战争的武器，别无它用。"
G["Do not let prejudice or ancient grudges interfere with our mission here, Kaldorei. There will be plenty of time for squabbling and distrustful looks when we are done here."]="不要让偏见和古老的仇恨干扰我们的任务，卡多雷。等到我们把这里的事情做完，会有足够的时间争吵和怀疑。"
G["Do not let the crab stand still. Its shell has hardened with age, but its joints are weak."]="千万别让螃蟹静立不动。它的甲壳历久弥坚，但它的关节却很脆弱。"
G["Do not let the fear consume you!"]="别让恐惧吞噬你！"
G["Do not let the ice in your blood slow your step. Prove your prowess, disciple."]="不要因为血液被冻结就放慢了攻击速度。来吧，鼓起勇气。"
G["Do not let the stone intimidate you. It is stone, you are $r."]="不要害怕那块石头。"
G["Do not let them pass, minions!"]="奴仆们，阻止他们！"
G["Do not let them wear you down! Focus!"]="别和他们打持久战！集中注意力！"
G["Do not let your eyes deceive you."]="别让你的眼睛欺骗了你。"
G["Do not let your judgement be clouded in trying times!"]="审时度势，别让危机干扰你的判断！"
G["Do not listen to Mog'dorg's lies!  Ogri'la is a myth!  We make our own heaven here with the blood of any that would divide and subjugate us!"]="不要听信莫戈多格的谎言！奥格瑞拉是个神仙般的圣地！我们铲除了那些企图分化奴役我们的敌对势力，在这里建立起自己的天堂。"
G["Do not listen to the creature's lies. Get back to your work!"]="别相信这怪物的谎言。快回去干活！"
G["Do not loiter."]="不要到处闲逛。"
G["Do not loiter; we've work to do here."]="别闲逛了，我们在这里还有工作。"
G["Do not look at me, $r. I have disgraced the Horde. I am done."]="不要看我，$r，我让部落蒙羞，我彻底完蛋了。"
G["Do not lose faith."]="不要丧失信仰。"
G["Do not lose hope, Darrowshire!  We will not fall!"]="达隆郡，别放弃希望！我们不会失败的！"
G["Do not lose hope, my $gson:daughter;.  With faith, we will march  through this darkness and once again see the dawn."]="No pierdas la esperanza, $ghijo mío:hija mía;. Con fe lograremos caminar a través de esta oscuridad y ver otro amanecer."
G["Do not lose hope, my $gson:daughter;.  With faith, we will march through this darkness and once again see the dawn."]="No pierdas la esperanza, $ghijo mío:hija mía;. Con fe lograremos caminar a través de esta oscuridad y ver otro amanecer."
G["Do not lower your guard, $n!"]="别放松警惕，$n！"
G["Do not make me come there and destroy you!"]="不要逼我亲手杀了你！"
G["Do not make me laugh.  Is this the mighty Aldor army that's come to defeat me?"]="真是可笑。这就是前来消灭我的“强大的奥尔多军队”吗？"
G["Do not miss any opportunity to heal the Black Prince."]="不要错过任何治疗黑王子的机会。"
G["Do not mistake me for your friend. Over time, my people have learned that trust is too easily broken."]="可别把我当成你们的朋友了。经过漫长的岁月，我们的族人都已经明白信任是多么脆弱。"
G["Do not mistake the power that darkness offers for true strength!"]="不要把黑暗之力错当成真正的力量！"
G["Do not mourn Orkus. He died with honor... with pride. He died a hero of the Horde."]="不要为奥尔库斯哀伤。他带着荣誉与自豪……而死。他是部落的英雄。"
G["Do not presume to speak to me as though you are my equal, $c. Sylvanas is my queen, and I will do as she bids.\n\nIf you do not show the proper respect, I assure you, we can find a more than suitable place for you in the Nether.\n\nBut there is no reason we cannot have words if you wish to aid the Dark Lady..."]="别把自己当我的同辈来跟我讲话，$c。希尔瓦娜斯是我的女王，我听从她的命令。\n\n要是你不表现出适当的尊重，我敢说我们将为你在扭曲虚空选个更为合适的位置。\n\n但是要是你愿意帮助黑暗女王的话，我们便无话可说了……"
G["Do not proceed. You will be eliminated."]="停止前进。否则你们将被消灭。"
G["Do not push it citizen!"]="不要找茬，公民！"
G["Do not push me, or I will impale you on my horns!"]="别惹恼了我，否则我会用角刺穿你的！"
G["Do not question my loyalty, Warchief. We came across an ocean to fight for you."]="不要质疑我的忠诚，酋长。我们可是远渡重洋来为你作战。"
G["Do not question what the Holy Light has put before you. Only those that sacrifice all will be delivered into its presence."]="不要怀疑圣光所给予的指示。只有甘愿奉献一切的人才能感受到它的存在。"
G["Do not relent! He is weakening!"]="别松懈！他正在变弱！"
G["Do not rest until those wards are functional. We must not be disturbed."]="在那些守卫运转起来之前不准休息。我们决不能受打扰。"
G["Do not return, draenei scum.  Next time we won't spare your life, unarmed or not!"]="不要回来，德莱尼渣滓。下次我们不会留下你的小命，不管你是不是拿着武器！"
G["Do not run, it only delays the inevitable."]="别跑了，这不过是苟延残喘。"
G["Do not shirk, friend. Keep us well supplied and our work will be completed sooner."]="No flaquees, $gamigo:amiga;. Mantén nuestro nivel de suministros y terminaremos el trabajo antes."
G["Do not speak to me of consequences, old one."]="别跟我谈什么后果，老家伙。"
G["Do not stop!  I promise you a thousand deaths if you even think about putting down that pick!"]="不要停下来！如果你敢有哪怕一秒钟放下锄头的念头，我保证会让你明白什么叫死去活来！"
G["Do not stop!  The hour of our glory draws near!"]="不要停！我们的荣光就要来临了！"
G["Do not stray too close to the chilled ground or you will find moving significantly more strenuous."]="不要靠那片寒冰之地太近，否则你会发现自己移动起来非常艰难。"
G["Do not stray too far down the pass, $n. Stay with the captain and his men... you're no use to us dead."]="$n，别和大部队走散了。你最好待在上尉和他手下的士兵身边……你死了的话事情就不好办了。"
G["Do not summon me again unless you have a real question to ask, ok?"]="除非你真有问题要问，否则就别召唤我，好吗？"
G["Do not taint these ruins, mortal. <You are engulfed in a blinding flash of light. A creature composed entirely of flame is the only thing you can remember seeing.>"]="凡人，不要玷污这些遗迹。<你全身笼罩在炫目的光芒中。你只记得自己看到了一只完全由火焰组成的生物。>"
G["Do not take offense, $r.\n\nI simply haven't the time for distractions."]="不要生气，$r。\n\n我只是没时间分心而已。"
G["Do not take the practice of spirit-binding lightly. If the mogu are creating simulacra, you can be certain they're preparing for war."]="可别小看了这些缚灵仪式。一旦魔古族开始大量制造灵俑，就说明他们已经在策划战争了。"
G["Do not tarry here, wench!\n\nThere's fighting to be done!"]="别再耽搁时间了！\n\n激烈的战斗在等待！"
G["Do not tell me what it is like to be a $c. Show me."]="No me cuentes cómo es ser $gun:una; $c. Demuéstramelo."
G["Do not test me, scurvy dog!  I'm trained in the way of the Blood Knights!"]="别惹我，败狗！老子是接受过血骑士正统训练的强者！"
G["Do not think for a second that your past accomplishments entitle you to anything, $n.  They don't.\n\nIf you want my respect you're going to have to earn it.  This means following my orders without question and fulfilling them... without exceptions."]="No pienses ni por un momento que tus logros pasados te dan derecho a hacer lo que sea, $n. Porque no es así.\n\nSi quieres mi respeto, tendrás que ganártelo. Tendrás que seguir mis órdenes sin cuestionarlas y cumplirlas... sin excepción."
G["Do not think it is luck that brought you here.  Luck had nothing to do with it.  Our MASTERS' WILL brought us here!"]="别以为是运气帮了你们的忙。这和运气一点儿关系也没有。是我们主人的意志把我们带到了这里！"
G["Do not think that I shall permit you entry into my master's sanctum so easily. Pursue me if you dare."]="不要以为我会那么容易让你进入主人的密室。有本事放马过来吧。"
G["Do not think you can win!"]="你没有胜算！"
G["Do not touch the displays."]="不许触摸展品。"
G["Do not trifle with me, $r."]="别和我开玩笑，$r。"
G["Do not trouble yourself, little tauren. Neither Stormhoof, nor you and your ally will stand in my way."]="别自找麻烦了。无论是雷蹄，还是你和你的盟友，谁都不能阻止我。"
G["Do not try to force your will upon the leather. Rather, let its natural tendencies dictate what form and function it will take. This is not a battle to be won. Work with the leather, not against it."]="别试图将你的意愿强加到皮革上。而是让其天然的特性显示出自身的形状和功能。这不是一场战役。与皮革协同工作，而不是与其作对。"
G["Do not turn your back on the Light, $c, it may be the one thing that saves you some day."]="别与圣光作对，$c，或许有一天它能拯救你。"
G["Do not underestimate me."]="别低估了我的实力。"
G["Do not wait long, Kilag. We will scout ahead."]="不要耽误时间，基拉格。我们将向前搜索。"
G["Do not waste my time, $c."]="别浪费我的时间，$c。"
G["Do not waste my time.  What is it you want?"]="不要浪费我的时间。你需要什么？"
G["Do not waver. Soon we shall sit within the hallowed presence of the Light."]="不要动摇。我们很快就会沐浴在圣光中。"
G["Do not worry about Orkus, $n. I... I will be fine."]="不要担心奥尔库斯，$n。我……我会好起来的。"
G["Do not worry about my fate, Bronzen. If the signal is not transmitted in time, re-origination will proceed regardless. Save... your world..."]="不用担心我的命运，布隆赞。如果信号没有及时发射出去，行星结构重组仍然会自行启动。拯救……你们的世界……"
G["Do not worry, $p, I will heal you!"]="别担心，$p，我会治疗你的！"
G["Do not worry, Arthas.  Soon you will not need your heart."]="阿尔萨斯，别担心。很快你就不再需要那颗心了。"
G["Do not worry, I will go easy on you."]="别担心，我会手下留情的。"
G["Do not worry, Leryssa.  I will come back to you when I am done.  Nothing in the world will stop me from coming home to the only family that I have left."]="别担心，莉蕾萨。我完成使命后就回去找你。那时，世界上就再也没有任何东西能阻挡我回家的脚步了。"
G["Do not worry, young one. I knew that our arrangement was... temporary. I will be fine.\n\nYou though, you do not belong here. It is not yet your time. I shall aid your journey back to the realm of the living.\n\nThis one is on me."]="不必担心，年轻人。我知道我们的安排只是……暂时性的。我会没事的。\n\n但是你，你不属于这里。现在你的时候还没有到。我会帮助你返回生命世界。\n\n这是我的责任。"
G["Do not worry.  Like I said, our men are almost done unearthing the Slithering One.  They will make for a suitable -- and even voluntary -- sacrifice.  Soggoth will rise!"]="别担心，就像我说的那样，我的部下即将完成伟大的深渊滑行者的挖掘工作。他们甚至可以成为最虔诚最完美的祭品。索苟斯必将崛起！"
G["Do not worry. I will keep the Crimson Lasher safe with me. Until we learn more about its behavior, I'm afraid it must stay here in the Firelands."]="别担心，我会保护好火红鞭笞者的。但在我们熟悉它的习性之前，它恐怕只能留在火焰之地了。"
G["Do not!"]="住口！"
G["Do not... bring Terokk into our world, $n...  That would be... madness..."]="别……别将泰罗克召唤到我们的世界，$n……那样做……很愚蠢……"
G["Do not... despair."]="不要……绝望。"
G["Do not... grow... overconfident, mortal."]="不要……得意，凡人。"
G["Do not... resist."]="不要……抵抗。"
G["Do nothing.  Betina said only one drop was needed."]="什么都不做。贝蒂娜说过，只需要一滴就够了。"
G["Do other decks exist?"]="还有其它套牌吗？"
G["Do rivers flow upstream?"]="水会往高处流吗？"
G["Do rocks float on water?"]="石块会漂在水上吗？"
G["Do something cool!"]="来点儿酷的！"
G["Do something, you useless $r. My allies are giving their lives for you!"]="快做点儿什么，你这没用的$r。我的盟友在为你献出生命！"
G["Do something."]="采取行动。"
G["Do the instructions clarify how much mana these crystals will require? I do not want to get converted to a wretched by using this thing."]="说明书上写明这些水晶需要多少法力了吗？我可不想在用了它之后就变成任人宰割的可怜虫。"
G["Do these blades look sharp to you?  DO THEY, OVERSEER?"]="这些刀刃在你看来够锋利吗？锋利吗，监工？"
G["Do they never rest?!\n\nIf we're to secure a future for the people of the Lower City, we must deal with the Shadow Council before they cause an even greater cataclysm than the Bone Wastes!\n\nBecause the leadership of Shattrath City will not move quickly, we the free people of the Lower City have taken matters into our own hands.\n\nBut our spies have been discovered.  We will hold off the Shadow Council's agents while you slip into the labyrinth and see what you can uncover."]="他们从不休息吗？！\n\n如果我们要保障贫民窟人民的未来，我们就必须在暗影议会制造另一个白骨荒野之前解决掉他们！\n\n沙塔斯城的领导者是不会迅速决断的，所以我们贫民窟的自由民必须用自己的力量来解决这个问题。\n\n但是我们的间谍已经被发现了。当你潜入迷宫的时候，我们会拖延暗影议会的行动，希望你能发现一些什么。"
G["Do they think a wall can stop us? Do they believe that stone can stand against those who ride upon the wind?"]="他们真以为用一道石墙就能挡住我们？挡住御风而来的骑士？"
G["Do try and be more careful, $n."]="再试一次，记得小心点，$n。"
G["Do watch your step in the garden of Ysera, mortal. Things are not always as they seem."]="凡人，当你在伊瑟拉的花园中走动时，请随时保持警惕。别轻易相信你所看到的一切。"
G["Do we even have ammunition for these?"]="我们有给这东西用的弹药吗？"
G["Do we have Mining trainers here?  Where do ye think ye are!?  \nWhy you'll find one o' the best miners in all Dun Morogh at Deepmountain Mining and Jewelcrafting on the northern side of The Great Forge.  There, Geofram Bouldertoe will show ye the true art of mining."]="¿Qué si aquí tenemos instructores de minería? ¡¿Dónde crees que estás?! \n\nBueno, encontrarás a uno de los mejores mineros de todo Dun Morogh, en Minería y joyería de Montehondo, al norte de La Gran Fundición. Allí, Geofram Dedorroca te enseñará el verdadero arte de la minería."
G["Do we have much further to go?"]="我们还要走更远吗？"
G["Do what must be done."]="完成我们应尽的使命。"
G["Do what you must to quell the restless spirits, Ragefist."]="怒拳，尽你所能地镇压那些骚动的灵魂。"
G["Do what you will, $p. I'm going after Erunak!"]="Haz lo que quieras, $n. ¡Yo iré a por Erunak!"
G["Do what you will. My new masters will carve my name into your flesh before they execute you."]="想做什么尽管去做。我的新主人将会在他们处死你之前，把我的名字刻进你的血肉里。"
G["Do wolves howl?"]="狼会嚎叫？"
G["Do ya want it, monkey? Do ya??"]="你想要吗，猴子？要不要啊？"
G["Do ya want me to call a medic? Maybe a priest? It's been over an hour, mate!"]="要我叫医生来吗？要不我去找个牧师？亲爱的，这种情况已经持续一小时了！"
G["Do ye have some new treasures that ye want to keep safe n' sound?  Then ye'll be wanting to store them at The Vault with the Stonemantles.  \nYe'll find The Vault just a hammer's throw northeast from the entrance to Ironforge."]="¿Tienes nuevos tesoros que desees conservar sanos y salvos? De ser así debes guardarlos en Las Arcas con los mantopétreos. \n\nLas Arcas se encuentran a un tiro de martillo en dirección nordeste desde la entrada de Forjaz."
G["Do ye have some new treasures that ye want to keep safe n' sound?  Ye'll be wanting to store them at The Vault with the Stonemantles.  Ye'll find The Vault just a hammer's throw northeast from the entrance to Ironforge."]="¿Tienes nuevos tesoros que desees conservar sanos y salvos? Debes guardarlos en Las Arcas con los Mantopétreo. Las Arcas se encuentran a un tiro de martillo en dirección nordeste desde la entrada de Forjaz."
G["Do ye have the potential to be a skilled hunter?  Well $gladdie : lassie;, only time will tell.  Just don't ye go shooting at apples atop peoples' heads till ye've spoken with Regnus o'er in the Hall of Arms."]="你具有成为一名熟练猎人的潜质吗？嗯，$g年青人:姑娘;，时间会告诉我们一切的。在与军事区的雷格努斯交谈之前，别对着别人的眼睛射击。"
G["Do ye know how hard it was to find a set of weapons that matched me armor?"]="你知道，想要找到一套能配上我的护甲的武器有多难吗？"
G["Do ye need some help finding something?"]="你需要我帮助你寻找什么东西吗？"
G["Do ye pester everyone this much? Sheesh."]="你总是这么烦人吗？真是的。"
G["Do ye want ta live forever?"]="你想获得永生吗？"
G["Do yer part in keepin' the Deeprun Tram clean!"]="你参与矿道地铁的保洁工作了吗？"
G["Do you EVER cease prattling?"]="你什么时候才会停止瞎扯淡？"
G["Do you HAVE to flail around like such an idiot?!"]="别像个白痴一样的摇晃袋子行吗？！"
G["Do you actually sell anything?"]="你真的有卖东西吗？"
G["Do you always talk so much when there's stuff to kill?"]="当有东西给你杀时，你总是话那么多吗？"
G["Do you ask this question to everything that's trapped in a ball?"]="是不是无论什么东西困在球里，你都会这样向它发问？"
G["Do you believe that?"]="您相信吗？"
G["Do you bring news of battle, $r?"]="你带来了最新的战况情报吗，$r？"
G["Do you bring word from the creator?"]="你是替创造者传话的吗？"
G["Do you come to see Mama? Oh, sit for a while!\n\nLet me tell you, I hear some gossip the other day.\n\nI heard that Gina Mudclaw and her father, Haohan Mudclaw, don't get along!\n\nHe wanted to marry her to Farmer Fung up by the Belt, but she wouldn't have it! Wanted to run her market, she said.\n\nAi-ya! What has become of the young girls these days? Don't want to marry handsome young man and raise a family?\n\nEspecially that Fung... he's such a catch! So good-looking, and grows such big vegetables too.\n\nWhy I not have handsome young son like that?!"]="你来看妈妈吗？噢，坐一会儿！\n\n我告诉你，几天前，我听到一些流言。\n\n我听说吉娜·泥爪和她的父亲郝瀚·泥爪合不来！\n\n他想把她嫁给农夫老方，但她不愿意！她说她想经营她的市集。\n\n唉呀！现在的年轻姑娘们是怎么了？不想嫁给英俊的小伙子，不想成家吗？\n\n特别是老方……他这么抢手！人长得好看，又种出这么大棵的蔬菜。\n\n我的儿子怎么就没那么年轻英俊？！"
G["Do you deny it? The dark visions? The voices in your head?"]="你敢否认吗？那些黑暗的幻象？那些你脑中的黑暗之声？"
G["Do you dream while you sleep or is it an escape from the horrors of reality?"]="你在沉睡时做梦吗，或者是一种对现实恐惧的逃避？"
G["Do you each have the crystals?"]="你们每个人都拿到水晶了吗？"
G["Do you even know how to walk? Move those legs of yours you worthless golden scrap heap!"]="你是不是连走路都不会了？赶紧动动腿，你这一无是处的废物！"
G["Do you even know what you're doing?"]="你知道你在干什么吗？"
G["Do you even know what you're doing?!"]="你知道自己在干什么吗？！"
G["Do you even lift, bro?"]="你搬过东西吗，兄弟？"
G["Do you ever think about anything other than fighting? I could circle you down on the stretch course!"]="你除了打架还知道什么？我轻而易举就可以把你骗得团团转！"
G["Do you expect me to cower before the mighty legion of $n?\n\nYou are nothing to me. Less than nothing. Had I desired your head, it would have been presented to me on a pike.\n\nYou have made the mistake that all mortals make.\n\n<Lord Victor Nefarius sighs.>\n\nTime does strange things to those that use it as a form of currency."]="¿Esperas que me encoja de miedo ante la poderosa legión de $n?\n\nNo eres nada para mí. Menos de nada. Si hubiera deseado tu corazón, lo habría tenido, clavado en una pica.\n\nHas cometido el mismo error que cometen todos los mortales.\n\n<Lord Víctor Nefarius suspira.>\n\nEl tiempo hace cosas extrañas con aquellos que lo utilizan como moneda."
G["Do you fear death?"]="你怕死吗？"
G["Do you feel it, $n? The darkness surrounds us."]="你感觉到了吗，$n？黑暗在席卷我们。"
G["Do you feel it, Mulv? The need? You have to want it before I can give you the command. Who am I kidding. Get out there!"]="穆维里克，你感觉到了吗？需求？在我下达命令之前你就该有所需求了。我可没跟你开玩笑。滚出去！"
G["Do you feel it, mortal? Death seeps through me, enveloping all that I touch. With just a snap of my finger your soul will languish in damnation for all eternity."]="你感觉到了吗，凡人？死亡之力从我的每一寸皮肤上渗透出来，覆盖了所有我碰触过的事物。只要我的手指轻轻一触，你的灵魂就将在诅咒中永远地凋零消逝。"
G["Do you feel it? It's almost like Arthas is still here right in this room! But he's gone, right? This place still feels like evil..."]="有没有感觉到？阿尔萨斯仿佛还在这个房间里！但他已经不在了，对不对？只是这个地方还是让人感到邪恶……"
G["Do you feel something?"]="感觉到什么了吗？"
G["Do you feel that chill running up your spine?"]="感觉到脊背上的刺骨寒意了吗？"
G["Do you feel that folks? The air is crackling with energy! That can only mean one thing..."]="你们感觉到了吗？能量在空气中沸腾！这只能说明……"
G["Do you feel that...?"]="你们感觉到了吗……？"
G["Do you feel that?"]="你感觉到了吗？"
G["Do you find me imposing?  Be honest.  I'm going for imposing."]="你觉得我很强大？听着，精彩的还在后面。"
G["Do you happen to have any fishing supplies?"]="你这里有钓鱼用品吗？"
G["Do you hate me, my love? That I was forced to destroy your living form, that your spirit be released from unhappy bondage."]="我的爱人，你恨我吗？我在万般无奈之下摧毁了你的躯壳，因为只有这样才能让你从痛苦中永久地解脱。"
G["Do you hate me? Good."]="你恨我吗？很好。"
G["Do you have a few moments to spare?"]="你有时间吗？"
G["Do you have a report for Kor and Dezco?"]="你有什么事要报告给科尔和德兹科吗？"
G["Do you have a spare Sweet Lakemelon?"]="你有多余的甘甜湖瓜吗？"
G["Do you have a spell that can take me as far away from here as possible?"]="你有那种可以让我尽可能远离这里的法术吗？"
G["Do you have a story for me?"]="故事？"
G["Do you have any Black Cherries?"]="你这里有黑樱桃吗？"
G["Do you have any fizzy energy drinks?"]="你这有没有什么冒气泡的能量饮料？"
G["Do you have any gooseberries for sale?"]="你这有醋栗卖吗？"
G["Do you have any hops you can spare?"]="你有多余的啤酒花给我吗？"
G["Do you have any idea how much time and moolah you've saved us, $n? This could have been a complete disaster and you've single-handedly saved the entire cartel.\n\nToo bad that you and Thrall spared Gallywix. I think that you would make an excellent Trade $g Prince : Princess;!"]="¿Tienes idea de todo el tiempo y la pasta que nos has ahorrado, $n? Esto podría haber terminado en un gran desastre, pero tú, sin ayuda alguna, has salvado al cártel entero.\n\nEs una pena que Thrall y tú hayáis permitido vivir a Gallywix. ¡Creo que sería un $gpríncipe:princesa; mercante de primera!"
G["Do you have any idea how neat it is to hop that far?"]="你觉得它能跳多远？"
G["Do you have any idea where you are going?"]="你有明确的目标吗？"
G["Do you have any items I can test?"]="有什么我可以尝试的玩意儿吗？"
G["Do you have any mithril casings?"]="你有秘银外壳吗？"
G["Do you have any news from afar, $n? Has the war against the yaungol finally been won?"]="你带来远方的消息了吗，$n？对抗野牛人的战斗打赢了没有？"
G["Do you have any sons, $c?\n\nLet us tell you something, we think we were much happier before we came to Ogri'la and the crystals made us more aware.  Before, we would have just bashed them over the head to get them to shut up.  Now all they do is bother us about the Sha'tari Skyguard.\n\nIgnorance is bliss!"]="你有孩子吗，$c？\n\n听我说，来到奥格瑞拉之后，我们都觉得没有以前快乐了。那些水晶让孩子们变得聪明了许多。从前，我们只需要敲打他们的小脑瓜就能让他们闭嘴。而现在，他们却整天吵着问我们各种各样关于天空卫队的事情。\n\n无知真是幸福！"
G["Do you have any spiders or beetles, $c?  They scurry fast, but if you're faster then you'll find them quite a treat!"]="¿Tienes arañas o alfazaques, $c? Son muy escurridizos, pero si eres más $grápido:rápida;, ¡descubrirás que son todo un manjar!"
G["Do you have any supplies?"]="你这儿有什么补给品吗？"
G["Do you have enraging incense?"]="你有激怒熏香吗？"
G["Do you have everything? Very good! Come with me."]="东西都弄到了吗？很好！跟我来"
G["Do you have healing incense?"]="你有疗伤熏香吗？"
G["Do you have reservations?"]="你有预定吗？"
G["Do you have steel that needs shaping?"]="需要我为你铸造钢铁武器吗？"
G["Do you have the eye of a tiger?"]="你有猛虎的眼睛吗？"
G["Do you have the required pumpkins?"]="预订的南瓜到了吗？"
G["Do you have the understanding to continue, shaman?  Do you know why you are here?"]="你有足够继续下去的理解力了吗，萨满祭司？你知道我们为什么在这里吗？"
G["Do you have the witchberries?"]="你这儿有女巫浆果吗？"
G["Do you have those evacuation papers?"]="你收到疏散令了吗？"
G["Do you have to be so chippery?"]="你一定要这样喋喋不休吗？"
G["Do you have to stay here?"]="你一定要待在这吗？"
G["Do you have what it takes to stay in my kitchen?"]="你够格待在我的厨房里吗？"
G["Do you hear it, $r? Place your ear to the ground. Can you hear the echoing drums of war? The earth trembles in anticipation, yet I have heard it coming all along. We must prepare ourselves, young one - for this shall be a war to end all wars. It will be an honor to serve with you on the battle field. I trust that you will stand ready."]="¿Lo oyes, $r? Pega la oreja a la tierra. ¿Puedes oír el eco de los tambores de guerra? La tierra tiembla de expectación, sin embargo yo hace tiempo que les oigo venir. Debemos prepararnos, joven, porque esta será la guerra que terminará con todas las guerra. Será un honor servir contigo en el campo de batalla. Confío en que estarás $gpreparado:preparada;."
G["Do you hear me, Arthas? The Argent Crusade comes for you! Your kingdom shall crumble beneath the weight of justice! By the Light!"]="阿尔萨斯，你听见了吗？银色北伐军来了！你的王国将被正义的审判彻底毁灭！我以圣光之名起誓！"
G["Do you hear something?"]="你听到了什么？"
G["Do you hear that brothers?"]="你听见了吗，兄弟？"
G["Do you hear that?  What is that noise!"]="你听到了吗？那是什么声音！"
G["Do you honestly believe you can defeat me?"]="你真以为你能打败我？"
G["Do you honestly think death can stop me? I am death itself!"]="你真以为死亡能阻止得了我吗？我就是死亡的化身！"
G["Do you know any good jokes, $r?"]="你知道什么好笑话吗，$r？"
G["Do you know anything about azsharite?"]="你知道艾萨莱特水晶的情况吗？"
G["Do you know anything about this, beast? Who is the admiral? Speak!"]="关于这件事你到底知道些什么，怪物？谁是首领？快说！"
G["Do you know how many supplies it takes to support an army, $n? We need weapons, food, shelter, bandages...and that's just to start.\n\nThe supplies will not stock themselves. Ask Matoclaw if you're looking for ways to help. She will put you to use."]="¿Sabes cuántos suministros hacen falta para mantener un ejército, $n? Necesitamos armas, comida, cobijo, vendas... y eso es solo el principio.\n\nLos suministros no se van a almacenar solos. Si quieres ayudar, habla con Matogarra. Te dirá lo que puedes hacer."
G["Do you know how to pick up a female jinyu in a tavern? Just drop your line!"]="¿Sabes cómo llamamos a casarse con una jinyu? ¡\"Echarle el anzuelo\"!"
G["Do you know how to say 'Crackling Jade Lightning' in Taur-ahe? How about Thalassian? Nazja?"]="¿Sabes cómo se dice \"Relámpago crepitante de jade\" en taurahe? ¿Y en thalassiano? ¿Y en nazja?"
G["Do you know my dad?"]="你认识我父亲吗？"
G["Do you know of the Gryphon Roost off the Trade District, where the Flight Master may be found?\n\nA pair of Wildhammer dwarves raises and sells gryphons there, and can even train you to ride the beasts."]="你知道贸易区那边的狮鹫栖息地吗，就是飞行管理员所在的地方？\n\n有几个蛮锤矮人正在那儿饲养和贩售狮鹫，他们还能教你学会骑乘这种坐骑。"
G["Do you know of the Highborne? The Shen'dralar?"]="你知道上层精灵吗？你知道辛德拉古吗？"
G["Do you know someone... or something, rather, by the name of Eranikus?"]="你知道有关伊兰尼库斯的事吗？"
G["Do you know that you are very strong?"]="你知道你很强壮吗？"
G["Do you know the history of the Serpent Riders? It is quite an interesting study."]="你了解翔龙骑士的历史吗？那是个非常有趣的故事。"
G["Do you know what I like, $n?"]="知道我喜欢什么吗，$n？"
G["Do you know what I see? A precursor to invasion.\n\nAye, the master was wise in sealing the portals but has since lost his... how shall I put this? The master has lost his focus. Yes... Focus.\n\nWith this loss, the Legion has seized opportunity. They seep out now, growing in number day by day."]="你知道我看到了什么？一个入侵的先兆。\n\n虽然主人非常睿智地封印了传送门，但他失去了他的……我该怎么来表达这个？他的专注。是的……专注。\n\n因此，军团抓住了这个机会。他们现在渗透了进来，数量在一天天地膨胀。"
G["Do you know what happens if you slack off in all of your monastery classes? You become a groundskeeper, that's what happens.\n\nIt's not all bad though. I get my own broom.\n\n<Wu sighs.>"]="你知道总在禅院的日课上偷懒会有什么后果吗？你会沦为园丁！就像我这样。\n\n不过这也不算太糟。我总算有了一把自己的扫帚。\n\n<老吴叹了口气。>"
G["Do you know what that thing is?"]="你知道那是啥东西吗？"
G["Do you know what you're playing with, $n?  Here, allow me to educate you and your friends."]="你知道你正在干什么吗，$n？过来，让我好好教育一下你和你的朋友们。"
G["Do you know where I may find the Half Pendant of Aquatic Agility?"]="你知道在哪儿能找到水兽敏捷坠饰吗？"
G["Do you know where I may find the Half Pendant of Aquatic Endurance?"]="你知道在哪儿能找到水兽耐力坠饰吗？"
G["Do you know where you are?  This is Honor Hold, sweetheart!  Love it or get out!"]="你知道这是哪儿吗？这是荣耀堡，甜心！爱上它，或者滚出去！"
G["Do you know who I am, zealot?"]="你知道我是谁吗，狂热者？"
G["Do you know who I am? Do you know who I am?!"]="你知道我是谁吗？你知道我是谁吗？！"
G["Do you know who I am?! I'm a very important person! You're supposed to be protecting me from the Scourge, not dilly-dallying with pointless conversation!\n\nI'm no fighter, but you are. So get out there!"]="你知道我是谁吗？！我是个大人物！你应该保护我免遭天灾军团的袭击，而不是扯一些无意义的鬼话！\n\n我不是战士，而你是。出去迎敌吧！"
G["Do you know who we are, stranger? We are Mag'har - brown orcs, as I have heard your kind call us. The Mag'har are survivors: Survivors of a fallen dynasty; Survivors of the Red Pox; Survivors of a shattered world...\n\nI am Jorin, son of Kilrogg; last of the lineage of Deadeye: Warchief of the Bleeding Hollow Clan."]="¿Sabes quiénes somos, $gextranjero:extranjera;? Somos Mag'har – orcos marrones, según he oído que tu especie nos llama. Los Mag'har son supervivientes: supervivientes de una dinastía caída; supervivientes de la enfermedad roja; supervivientes de un mundo destrozado...\n\nSoy Jorin, hijo de Kilrogg; el último del linaje de Mortojo: Jefe de Guerra del clan de Foso Sangrante."
G["Do you know why the pandaren love philosophy? Because for them, things are not just black and white."]="你知道为什么熊猫人爱好哲学吗？因为对于他们来说，世事并不是非黑即白的。"
G["Do you like fish, $r? I have fish here. If you like fresh fish, the freshest, come and sample my wares."]="你喜欢鱼吗，$r？我这里有鱼，最新鲜的鱼，过来看看我的货物吧。"
G["Do you like gifts?"]="你喜欢礼物吗？"
G["Do you like kitties? I love them!\n\n<Ella looks surprised at her sudden outburst and smiles shyly.>"]="你喜欢猫咪吗？我喜欢！\n\n<艾拉为她的冒失愣住了，害羞地笑了笑。>"
G["Do you like my outfit today?"]="你喜欢我今天这身打扮吗？"
G["Do you like my outfit?  It's for the party. I charged it to your account."]="你喜欢我的这身打扮吗？这可是为聚会准备的。我用你的帐户买的。"
G["Do you like my snakes? I get the feeling they don't like you!"]="你喜欢我的蛇吗？我感觉它们不喜欢你！"
G["Do you like the new home that I've carved out for my so-called worshippers?\n\nIn the throes of my death, I cursed them all and dragged them along with me into this special underworld of my own creation.\n\nI think that I shall delight in their eternal torment, but what I really want is to exact revenge upon my former prophet!"]="你喜欢我为那些所谓的崇拜者创造的新家吗？\n\n临死前，我强忍着莫大的痛楚诅咒了他们，并将他们一同拖进了我所创造的异界。\n\n我可以随心所欲，这固然不错；但我真正希望的，是向先知寻仇！"
G["Do you like this color on me?"]="你觉得这颜色衬我吗？"
G["Do you like to cook? Well you're in luck, because I like to help aspiring chefs."]="你喜欢烹饪？那你可走运了，因为我愿意帮助志向远大的厨师。"
G["Do you like what we've done here?  Perhaps we will drop these crystals from the sky all over Outland."]="你喜欢我们的成果吗？也许我们应该把这种水晶撒满整个外域。"
G["Do you like your tree? I picked the sapling myself."]="你喜欢这颗树吗？树苗可是我亲自挑选的。"
G["Do you like... turnips?\n\n<Ella turns pink and shakes her head.>"]="你喜欢……芜菁吗？\n\n<艾拉脸红了，摇了摇头。>"
G["Do you mean the Silvermoon City Inn, or the Wayfarer's Rest tavern?"]="你是指银月城旅店，还是旅者的梦乡？"
G["Do you mind?"]="你介意吗？"
G["Do you mind? We're trying to get a picture, here."]="你不介意吧？我们打算在这里拍张照片。"
G["Do you mock me while I am unable to defend myself, bound to this ball of iron?"]="当我因为绑着这个大铁球而不能保护自己的时候，你会嘲笑我吗？"
G["Do you need assistance?"]="你需要帮助吗？"
G["Do you need something, $c?  Perhaps I can assist you."]="你需要什么东西吗，$c？也许我可以帮助你。"
G["Do you need something?"]="你需要什么吗？"
G["Do you need something? I'm a little... busy.\n\n<Koro tightens his grip on the wriggling saurok's neck.>"]="你需要什么吗？我这会有点儿……忙。\n\n<科洛捏紧了正在挣扎的蜥蜴人的脖子。>"
G["Do you need to return to Vashj'ir?"]="你需要返回瓦丝琪尔吗？"
G["Do you need to stable your pet?"]="你需要寄放你的宠物吗？"
G["Do you normally walk these roads alone?"]="你经常一个人走在这些路上吗？"
G["Do you not feel the master's gaze?! It watches us all!"]="难道你没有感觉到主人的注视吗？！他的眼睛不会放过我们之中的任何一个！"
G["Do you not have eyes? Did you not see the demons on our very doorstep? I do not have the soldiers to spare!"]="你瞎了吗？你没看见恶魔已经打到家门口了吗？我没有人手给你！"
G["Do you not see how magic has made our city great?"]="你们没有看到魔法是怎样把我们的城市变得如此美好吗？"
G["Do you not see the light of Kros? He has been defiled!"]="你们还不理解克洛斯之道吗？他被亵渎了！"
G["Do you often squeeze gnomes?"]="你经常捏侏儒吗？"
G["Do you plan on leaving the area soon if we have further questions?"]="如果我继续问下去，你是不是打算扭头就走？"
G["Do you possess the courage to face Malygos' elite drakes in their own realm, $r?"]="你敢于进入玛里苟斯的王国，面对他手下的精英侍卫吗，$r？"
G["Do you prefer guns or bows?"]="你是喜欢枪支还是弓箭？"
G["Do you realize what you've done?"]="你知道你在干什么吗？"
G["Do you really need to ask? Can you not feel him? Has the almighty King Rastakhan sent his Servitor and Hand here on a mission of diplomacy?"]="这还需要问吗？你感觉不到他吗？万能的拉斯塔哈派遣他的仆从来此是执行外交任务的吗？"
G["Do you really think we are going to make it out of here alive?"]="你真觉得我们能活着离开这里吗？"
G["Do you really want to bribe Olga?"]="你真的想收买欧尔嘉？"
G["Do you really want to unlearn your Gnomish Engineering specialization and lose all associated recipes?"]="你真的想要忘掉侏儒工程学分支的知识，并失去所有与之相关的配方吗？"
G["Do you really want to unlearn your Goblin Engineering specialization and lose all associated recipes?"]="你真的想要忘掉地精工程学分支的知识，并失去所有与之相关的配方吗？"
G["Do you really want to unlearn your blacksmithing specialty and lose all associated recipes?"]="你真的想遗忘你的锻造专精并失去所有相关的图样吗？"
G["Do you really want to unlearn your leatherworking specialty and lose all associated recipes?"]="你真的想遗忘你的制皮专业并失去所有相关的图样吗？"
G["Do you recall our earlier conversation?"]="还记得我们之前的谈话吗？"
G["Do you require an illusion?\n\nShould your illusion falter in the midst of your quest, return to me and I shall reapply the guise.\n\nShould you fail in your endeavors, do not give up! Return to me. I shall assist you until you have completed your objectives."]="你需要幻象吗？\n\n要是在执行任务的过程中幻象失效，回到我这儿来，我将重新对你进行伪装。\n\n如果你尽力而为还是失败了，别放弃！回到我这儿来。我将助你完成目标。"
G["Do you require anything?"]="你需要什么东西吗？"
G["Do you require guidance to your destination?"]="你需要有人指引你到达目的地吗？"
G["Do you see Lin down there? There are so many prisoners, but I cannot spot my husband."]="你在那儿见到林了吗？俘虏太多了，可我找不到我丈夫。"
G["Do you see NOW the power of the Darkfallen?"]="见识到黑暗堕落者的力量了吧？"
G["Do you see it? Everyone in my Horde earns their keep. You and your friends will be no exception."]="看见吗？在我的部落里，每个人都有用武之地。你和你的朋友们也不例外。"
G["Do you see me now, Cho'gall? I'm coming for you! I'm going to rip off your head while the other watches!"]="看到我了吗，古加尔？我是来找你的！我要在你眼前砍掉你的头！"
G["Do you see our enemies?"]="你看到我们的敌人了吗？"
G["Do you see that big fish down there, $n?"]="你看到那边的大鱼了吗，$n？"
G["Do you see the central tower? Lightning strikes it continuously. Aethas suspects that the storms originate from the heart of the palace itself."]="你看到中央那座塔了吗？闪电一直在击打它。艾萨斯怀疑这场风暴就是源自于宫殿的中心。"
G["Do you see the central tower? Lightning strikes it continuously. We suspect the storms originate from the heart of the palace itself."]="看到中央那座塔了吗？闪电一直在击打它。我们怀疑这场风暴就源自于宫殿内部。"
G["Do you see the great statue in the distance?"]="看到远处那宏伟的雕像了吗？"
G["Do you see the gyrochoppa on the far side of the beach, $n?!"]="看到海滩那边的旋翼机了吗，$n？！"
G["Do you see the hanging pennants above our heads? These flags mark the race course. If you ever get lost, you can use these flags as a guide."]="你看见我们头顶上方的那一串三角旗了么？我们用这些旗帜标出了赛道。要是你迷了路，可以根据这些旗帜找到方向。"
G["Do you see the massive spired tower in eastern Dalaran? That is the majestic Violet Citadel."]="看见达拉然东部的巨塔了吗？那就是宏伟的紫罗兰城堡。"
G["Do you see the size of this beast? It took nearly six of us to overpower him."]="你看到这畜生的体格了吗？我们要将近六个人才能制得住他。"
G["Do you see this burning candle? You have until it burns out to tell us about the Pandaren artifacts! Now start talking!"]="看到这根蜡烛了吗？你最好在它烧完之前，说出熊猫人神器的秘密！快点说出来！"
G["Do you see what I did there?"]="你看到我干了什么吗？"
G["Do you see, champion? There is little my Horde cannot accomplish. What is this?"]="你看到了吗，勇士。我的部落无所不能。这是谁啊？"
G["Do you see? From their graves, trees grow. May these trees always stand for the sacrifice they made, and the honor you have done them."]="看见了吗？在他们的坟冢上，长出了新的树苗。愿这些树木长盛不衰，永远见证着逝者的牺牲，还有你为他们赢得的荣光。"
G["Do you see? Power without vision causes only random chaos and destruction."]="看到了吗？缺乏指引的力量只会带来混乱和毁灭。"
G["Do you seek enlightenment?"]="你想要寻求突破吗？"
G["Do you seek further training in the ways of the warrior?"]="你想要学习更多的战士技能吗？"
G["Do you seek to join us? We have messengers in the city who will tell you what you must do, seeker."]="你想要加入我们？我们在这座城市中的信使将告诉你必须怎样去做，寻觅者。"
G["Do you seek training?"]="你想要进行训练吗？"
G["Do you sell any of this stuff?"]="你卖这类东西吗？"
G["Do you smell smoke?"]="你闻到烟味了吗？"
G["Do you smell that?  Fresh meat has somehow breached our citadel.  Be wary of any intruders."]="你闻到了吗？好像有新鲜的肉进入了我们的堡垒。警惕那些入侵者。"
G["Do you smell the burning?  Do you see the shoes? Can you piece this puzzle together, $c?"]="你闻到那股烧焦的气味了吗？有没有看到那双鞋？你能把这些线索拼合起来吗，$c？"
G["Do you speak the truth, Garrosh? Can the Horde truly survive another war?"]="真的吗，加尔鲁什？部落能撑过这场战争吗？"
G["Do you still need some help moving kegs from the crash site near Razor Hill?"]="你仍然需要帮忙从剃刀岭附近的坠毁点那里搬运酒桶吗？"
G["Do you still need some help shipping kegs from Kharanos?"]="你还需要找人从卡拉诺斯运回酒桶吗？"
G["Do you still question the might of the Horde, paladin? We will take on all comers!"]="圣骑士，你还在怀疑部落的力量吗？我们战无不胜！"
G["Do you that dare challenge the Horde? Then come..."]="你竟敢挑战部落？那就来吧……"
G["Do you think I can make it to Theramore on foot?"]="你以为我会走着去塞拉摩？"
G["Do you think I could take a ride on one of those flying machines?"]="我能不能搭乘飞行器呀？"
G["Do you think I need more pieces of Flair?"]="你觉得我的资格还不够？"
G["Do you think I should go to one of those monasteries and train to become a monk? You know, to impress her?"]="难道你觉得我应该去那些禅院中受训做一名武僧？你知道的，为了让她留下深刻的印象。"
G["Do you think I'll make a good cook eventually?"]="你觉得我会成为一名好厨师吗？"
G["Do you think I'm messin' with you? I am not messin' with you. I'm here from Orgrimmar. I'm here from Nogg's Machine Shop and I'm here on a mission of mercy."]="你以为我是来找麻烦的？拜托，我才没那么闲。我从奥格瑞玛的诺格机械店出发，走了好远的路才到这里。我是来帮忙的哦。"
G["Do you think Shomi will show me her fighting skills?"]="你觉得朔弥能向我展示她的战技吗？"
G["Do you think all of this fighting is educational for this group?"]="你觉得这组选手能从这场战斗学到什么吗？"
G["Do you think he took her that unaware?  Even though she thought she had his trail?"]="你认为那个杀手偷袭了她？即使她认为她发现了他的踪迹？"
G["Do you think he was kidnapped? Will I ever see him again?"]="你认为他被绑架了？我还能再见到他么？"
G["Do you think his teachings are wrong?"]="你觉得他的教导错了吗？"
G["Do you think it will work, Go'el? The druids and shaman uniting to restore the World Tree... Could it actually heal this broken world?"]="你认为这会有用吗，古伊尔，德鲁伊与萨满联手治愈世界之树？这能治疗这个崩坏的世界？"
G["Do you think it would hesitate to kill you? A monster like you?"]="你觉得它会对你心慈手软吗？对怪物一样的你？"
G["Do you think pandaren are dark with white spots, or white with dark spots?"]="你觉得熊猫人身上是黑底白斑，还是白底黑斑？"
G["Do you think she could ever have feelings for someone like me? I'm so... unfurry!"]="你觉得她可能对我这样的人来电吗？我很……不赞同！"
G["Do you think that demons will play fair? These beasts are more savage than orcs and more cunning than the undead. Do not attempt to engage Legion by normal standards of war."]="你们觉得这些恶魔会跟我们公平地交战吗？它们比兽人更野蛮，比亡灵更狡猾。千万不要试图以普通的战争标准来评判燃烧军团。"
G["Do you think that they really get this stuff from the silkworms' rear end?"]="这东西真是从蚕的屁股里出来的吗？"
G["Do you think that undead party made it through in one piece?"]="你认为那组亡灵全身而退了吗？"
G["Do you think that we can return to life after death?"]="你觉得我们死后还能复活吗？"
G["Do you think that will get some answers?"]="你觉得我们能得出什么结论吗？"
G["Do you think the pandaren realized what they were sitting on here?"]="你觉得熊猫人明白自己在这里的处境吗？"
G["Do you think the rumors about the Infinite Dragonflight are true?  I've sensed it... the familiarity."]="你觉得关于永恒龙族的传言是真的吗？我觉得听上去……挺耳熟的。"
G["Do you think they will let me keep my uniform when I'm done?"]="我完成任务以后，你觉得他们还会让我保留我的制服吗？"
G["Do you think they'll have this on the, ah, tour? Hm?"]="你说他们会在，呃，旅途中带上这个吗？嗯？"
G["Do you think this to be pain? To be suffering? HAH! Destroy this mortal shell so that I may ascend to the heavens!"]="你以为自己下手很重？我难以忍受这痛苦？哈哈！摧毁这凡人的躯壳，我就能升入天堂！"
G["Do you think us fools! You're covered in animal blood!"]="你把我们当傻子吗！你身上沾满了动物的鲜血！"
G["Do you think we can pull off a passable disguise?"]="你觉得我们能制作一个看过得去的伪装吗？"
G["Do you think we will ever find a way home?"]="你说，我们会不会永远也回不了家了？"
G["Do you think you can ride it?"]="你能试着骑上它吗？"
G["Do you think you've won? So easily? The legion has only just begun its march. The armies of C'Thun will raze this world."]="你认为你赢了吗？这么简单就赢了吗？军团的远征才刚刚开始。克苏恩的大军会将这个世界夷为平地的。"
G["Do you truly believe you are doing well? Hah! My forces are limitless!"]="你们该不会以为自己做得不错吧？哈哈！我们的数量是无穷无尽的！"
G["Do you truly believe you can win against the armies of the Lich King? No army of the living, no power you could possibly bring to bear can destroy my ranks!"]="你们真的认为自己可以与巫妖王的军团相抗衡吗？没有任何生者的军队，没有任何你可以聚集起的力量能与亡者为敌！"
G["Do you truly believe you're making progress? You can never defeat my Scourge!"]="你真的认为事情在朝你所推动的方向进展吗？你永远不可能击败天灾军团！"
G["Do you understand me? We should be able to understand each other now."]="你能听懂我的话吗？现在，我们应该能沟通了吧。"
G["Do you understand now, $n?"]="你现在明白了，$n？"
G["Do you understand now?"]="你现在醒悟了吗？"
G["Do you understand this, pandaren?"]="你们明白我的话吗，熊猫人？"
G["Do you want a dolly, little girl? Would that make it better?"]="你想要个洋娃娃吗，小女孩？那样会不会好一点儿？"
G["Do you want me to get the grunts?"]="你想惹我发火吗？"
G["Do you want to end up like one of the Wretched? No?! Then put your hearts into it this time!"]="你想得到失心者那样的下场吗？不想吧？！那么现在就给我努力一点！"
G["Do you want to live forever?"]="你想要永生不死吗？"
G["Do you want to play a game, stinky?"]="¿Quieres jugar a un juego, $gapestoso:apestosa;?"
G["Do you want to see the utter destruction of what's left of Thousand Needles?\n\nNo?\n\nThen do exactly as I command."]="你想看着千针石林彻底毁灭吗？\n\n不想？\n\n那就照我说的做。"
G["Do you want to start the encounter?"]="你想要开始这场首领战吗？"
G["Do you want to stay stuck in the tree?!"]="你愿意继续卡在树上吗？！"
G["Do you wish to begin the Norushen Encounter?"]="确定要开启诺鲁什之战吗？"
G["Do you wish to expand your mind and body beyond the boundaries it is currently confined to?"]="你想拓展你的思维，强健你的身心，突破现在的极限吗？"
G["Do you wish to learn the blacksmithing profession or is there something else you wish to tell me?"]="你想学习锻造专业还是有什么其它事情想告诉我？"
G["Do you wish to see the island from the sky? Glide upon a golden kite!"]="想从天空俯瞰永恒岛吗？快来买金色滑翔机吧！"
G["Do you wish to test the edge of my blade?"]="你想试试我利刃的刀锋吗？"
G["Do you yet grasp the futility of your actions?"]="你还不明白自己的徒劳吗？"
G["Do you yield?"]="确定要认输吗？"
G["Do you, Keegan and Fanny, accept one another into your lives, that two become as one, in union everlasting?"]="科甘，范妮，你们是否愿意接受对方进入自己的生活，两个人成为一体，再不分开？"
G["Do you? Perhaps you should tell me what it is that is bothering you."]="是吗？或许你该告诉我是什么让你烦恼。"
G["Do your celestial brothers and sisters lend you their aid? No, they do not."]="你那些同为天神的兄弟姐妹来帮助过你吗？不，没有。"
G["Do your job, scum."]="做你的事去。"
G["Do your part in keeping the Scourge at bay, soldier! Report all suspicious activity and kill first, ask questions later!"]="士兵，阻止天灾军团的行动！随时向我汇报情况。一旦你发现可疑的人物，不管是谁，先杀了再说！"
G["Do your worst, demonspawn!"]="放马过来吧，杂种！"
G["Doc!"]="医生！"
G["Doc! Help!"]="医生！救命！"
G["Doc, this is $n, who helped Nevin's team get a number of survivors out of Gnomeregan."]="医生，请允许我为你介绍$n，他帮助内温的队伍从诺莫瑞根救出了许多幸存者。"
G["Doctor Draxlegauge will give you further instructions, $n. Many thanks for your help!"]="德拉克里格博士将会给你进一步的指示，$n。很感谢你的帮助！"
G["Doctor FIST!"]="铁拳医师！"
G["Doctor FIST!!"]="铁拳医师！！"
G["Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen works on the ground level of the barracks."]="古斯塔夫·范沃森医生就在兵营的底层工作。"
G["Doctor Herbert Halsey in The Apothecarium where us was born.  Him could sew you back together better like us."]="在我们出生之地炼金房的赫伯特·哈尔希医生的医术高于我们，他会医好你的背部的。"
G["Doctor Herbert Halsey is who you want. Just don't try anything funny. Any more of that plague nonsense and you'll find an axe in uncomfortable places."]="赫伯特·哈尔希医生就是你要找的人。别干傻事。再搞那种无聊的瘟疫，你的脑袋就得搬家。"
G["Documents such as guild creation papers can be acquired from the Guild Master in the city of Darnassus."]="官方事宜只能送交达纳苏斯处理。你必须前往那儿去创建自己的公会。"
G["Dodge his attacks. Use his strength against him!"]="躲开攻击。利用他的力量对付他！"
G["Dodge this!"]="闪开！"
G["Does $g he:she; have boots? Get 'em!"]="¿Lleva botas? ¡Quítaselas!"
G["Does Cho'Gall lead the Twilight's Hammer?"]="古加尔是暮光之锤的领袖吗？"
G["Does Garrosh know you're alive?"]="加尔鲁什知道你还活着吗？"
G["Does King Wrynn even care our plight?"]="乌瑞恩国王会管我们的死活吗？"
G["Does a naaru turn off the Light when it wants to sleep?"]="纳鲁睡觉的时候是不是要把圣光关掉的？"
G["Does all of this farmland belong to you?"]="这些农田都是你的吗？"
G["Does anyone else remember how we got here? Is it just me...?"]="还有谁记得我们是怎么到这里的？难道说只有我……？"
G["Does anyone have a repair bot?"]="有谁带修理机器人了吗？"
G["Does anyone hear something strange?"]="有人听到什么奇怪的声音了吗？"
G["Does anyone hear that voice? Make it stop!"]="有人听得见那声音吗？快让它停下来！"
G["Does anyone know how often Liu Lang went back to Pandaria?"]="有人知道刘浪多久回潘达利亚一次吗？"
G["Does anyone need supplies to hunt down the trolls?  Any troll will do."]="有人需要帮忙去追捕那些巨魔吗？任何巨魔都可以。"
G["Does anyone remember how Liu Lang was always able to find it? Nan?"]="有人记得刘浪总是如何找到它的吗？楠？"
G["Does anyone remember the turtle's name? Yin?"]="有人记得那只海龟的名字吗？尹记得吗？"
G["Does being in the presence of a Black Dragon make you nervous?\n\nGood. It should. It makes these dragons nervous too. They cling to their ancient virtues though - they wouldn't dare attack me here.\n\nFools."]="面对黑龙令你感到不安吗？\n\n很好。的确如此。在黑龙面前，其他龙族也会心生胆怯。这一点倒是继承了他们的祖先的美德——瞧，他们根本不敢攻击我。\n\n一帮蠢货。"
G["Does fire consume stone?"]="火焰会烧掉石头吗？"
G["Does it LOOK like the Feast of Winter Veil to you? Colored lights, decorations? No? Well, you know who has to MAKE all of that stuff, right?!"]="你觉得这像是冬幕节吗？彩灯，装饰？不像？很好，那你也知道这些东西是谁做的，不是吗？！"
G["Does it frighten you to know that there are those that would serve the Legion with such devotion as to remain unwavering citizens of your pointless civilizations until called upon?"]="在你们这种毫无意义的文明中，竟然出现了那么多为燃烧军团全心全意效力却又隐藏得毫无破绽的人，你们不觉得可怕吗？"
G["Does it have pain??"]="它们会觉得痛吗？？"
G["Does it hurt being as dumb as you are?"]="¿Duele ser tan $gestúpido:estúpida; como tú?"
G["Does it leash?"]="停下来了吗？"
G["Does it matter who we are? We are here to help you."]="何必管我们是谁？我们是来帮你的。"
G["Does it really matter?"]="这重要吗？"
G["Does my name sound familiar to you? Maybe we knew each other a long time ago...\n\nI think I'm named after someone important..."]="你听说过我的名字吗？或许我们俩很早就相识了……\n\n我认为我得名于某个重要人物……"
G["Does not compute. Unit malfunctioning. Directive: shut down."]="无法计算。单元发生故障。指令：关闭。"
G["Does our cult serve the Old Gods?"]="我们的教派是效忠于上古之神吗？"
G["Does she really make fireworks?"]="她真的制作烟花吗？"
G["Does that heart mean you're looking for love?"]="你是在寻找爱情吗？"
G["Does that make you angry?"]="这让你生气吗？"
G["Does that mean our moms and dads and grandparents were all explorers, too?"]="那是不是说，我们的爸爸妈妈爷爷奶奶也都是探险者？"
G["Does that mean we can stop coming here now?"]="那我们是不是可以不用来了？"
G["Does that satisfy you, Tormak?"]="托尔玛克，你对此满意吗？"
G["Does the agony ever stop?"]="这痛苦何时才能终结？"
G["Does the fruit vendor think that I am blind?  Do they think I wouldn't see his ogre reinforcement?"]="难道那水果贩以为我瞎了吗？我怎么可能看不到他的食人雇佣兵？"
G["Does the turtle know we're here?"]="海龟知道我们在这儿吗？"
G["Does this armor look a little tight on me?"]="这身铠甲对我来说是不是有点紧了？"
G["Does this dress make me look fat?"]="我穿这条裙子是不是看起来比较胖？"
G["Does this drink belong to you?"]="这杯酒是您的吗？"
G["Does this feel like a wild goose chase to you? These workers don't know anything!"]="你不觉得这是在浪费时间吗？这些工人一无所知！"
G["Does this fruit vendor not value his life? YOU ARE RUNNING OUT OF TIME FRUIT VENDOR!!"]="这个水果商人不要命了吗？你快没时间了！水果商人！！"
G["Does this toad speak for you, Genn?  Do you come to our dwelling as a friend?  Or do you come as a tyrant?"]="这只癞蛤蟆是你的代言人吗，吉恩？你是以朋友的身份，还是暴君的身份来的？"
G["Does yak tail assist in maintaining balance?"]="牦牛尾巴对保持平衡有帮助吗？"
G["Doesn't anybody KNOCK anymore???!"]="你不会敲门吗？？！"
G["Doesn't feel like it's been that long since last we talked."]="距离我们上一次交谈，竟然已经过去那么多时间了。"
G["Doesn't look good, rookie."]="No tiene buena pinta, $gnovato:novata;."
G["Doesn't say a damn thing about dog-ugly ogres."]="别胡扯那些有关脏垢食人魔的事。"
G["Doesn't she realize I wanted her to come with me? I'm young; I don't want to die. We should have many good years ahead of us and this is the only way. Tell her these things. Make her understand."]="难道她不明白？我希望她能到我身边来。我很年轻，我还不想死。我们还要共渡许多美好的岁月。而这是唯一能让我们活下去的办法。把这些告诉她，请一定让她明白。"
G["Dog"]="狗"
G["Dog food!"]="一文不值！"
G["Dogs of the Cenarion Circle.  Slay them all!"]="塞纳里奥议会的走狗！杀光他们！"
G["Doh!"]="啊！"
G["Doing THIS risks everything!"]="你炸船才是最危险的！"
G["Doing so required the removal of a number of safety valves that kept erupting."]="为了实现这一点，我们还去掉了一些总是让气体喷出去的安全阀。"
G["Dolt."]="短……短吃少穿。"
G["Domination Point thanks you!"]="统御岗哨感谢你！"
G["Don' be underestimatin' Zalazane... he be a tricky foe, cunnin' and strong with de voodoo. Are ya ready? MOVE ON!"]="不要低估扎拉赞恩……他是一个可怕的敌人，狡诈而且拥有强大的法力。准备好了吗？出发！"
G["Don' worry, child.  Grik'nir gonna help us get through this."]="孩子，别担心。格瑞克尼尔会帮助我们。"
G["Don't - don't touch me...\n\nWhat's happening?!"]="别……别碰我……\n\n出了什么事？！"
G["Don't I owe you a drink, $g handsome : lady;?"]="能请你喝一杯吗，$g帅哥:美女;？"
G["Don't ask how we know what they taste like."]="不要问我们怎么会知道它们的味道。"
G["Don't ask me how to fight a warlock. I a-VOID them. Hahahaha!"]="不要问我怎么对付术士。我避开他们。哈哈哈哈！"
G["Don't ask me what you actually brought me, $c. You're better off forgetting this ever happened."]="别问我你究竟给我带来了什么，$c。你最好忘记这件事曾经发生过。"
G["Don't ask..."]="不要多问……"
G["Don't attack it while the shield is up!"]="当护盾升起来的时候不要攻击！"
G["Don't be a hero. Just walk away."]="别作英雄了。走吧。"
G["Don't be afraid of the sword, nubling. It's the mutton that gets ya!"]="剑而已，不用害怕。要小心羊肉才是真的！"
G["Don't be afraid; we're here to aid you. We're grateful for the defense you've granted us within our former home, and as a measure of thanks, we've come to help you return quickly to the Plaguelands should you need it. My compatriot can explain the process further; you'll find him where the arcane energies are strongest within this city."]="别害怕；我们是来帮你的。在我们的家园保卫战中，你曾经慷慨地伸出援手；你想要迅速返回东瘟疫之地是吧，这点我们可以做到的。我的同伴会向你解释要怎么做；去城内的魔法区域找他吧。"
G["Don't be alarmed... while my gryphons may not be entirely alive, they will still carry you faithfully to your destination. Tell me... which tower do you seek?"]="别紧张……我的狮鹫虽然看起来死气沉沉，但是它们仍然能把你安全地送往目的地。告诉我……你想要去哪座哨塔？"
G["Don't be caught unprepared! Let Crafter Kwon see to your gear!"]="不打无准备之仗！让工匠郭婉看看你的装备吧！"
G["Don't be fooled, $r. They're very elusive. One moment they're there, the next they're gone - virtually inexplicable!\n\nBetween you and me, I actually held a piece of one in my hand once! Sadly, before I could conduct any measurements it was gone! Just disappeared...."]="$r，别被假象蒙蔽了双眼。那些不明物狡猾着呢。前一秒你还能看见它们，转瞬之间就消失得无影无踪——简直是匪夷所思！\n\n我告诉你一个秘密，不许说出去哦。我曾经搞到过一块碎片！可惜在我进行测试实验之前，它就莫名地消失了！就像蒸发了似的……不见了……"
G["Don't be foolish, Vol'jin! You have no siege weapons left! You cannot win this battle!"]="别傻了，沃金！你们没有攻城武器了！你是赢不了的！"
G["Don't be forgettin' about me!"]="不要忘了我！"
G["Don't be frightened, $r. We will keep everyone safe."]="别害怕，$r。我们会保证所有人的安全的。"
G["Don't be late, the next ship to Stranglethorn departs in only a minute!"]="快，下一班去荆棘谷的飞艇马上就要出发了！"
G["Don't be lettin' up, $n!"]="不要松懈，$n！"
G["Don't be lookin' so surprised. Your shaman friend has sharp eyes, or should I say, sharp frogs."]="不要这么惊讶。你的萨满朋友有着明察秋毫的眼睛，或者说，有着明察秋毫的青蛙。"
G["Don't be makin' da big one mad, mon!"]="别惹恼了大块头，伙计！"
G["Don't be ridiculous. It's just a jar full of bugs. It's gross if you ask me."]="别搞笑了。那只是一罐虫子。对我来说简直不堪入目。"
G["Don't be ridiculous. Of course it's my drink!"]="别搞笑了。这当然是我的酒！"
G["Don't be ridiculous. Where would you even go if I did spare you? We just finished up eradicating your civilization. Remember?"]="别可笑啦。就算我饶了你，你又能去哪里呢？我们已经灭绝了你们的文明。你忘了吗？"
G["Don't be shy now, we're all friends here..."]="别不好意思了，这里都是自己人……"
G["Don't be shy, $c. Plenty of yaungol to go around!"]="No seas $gtímido:tímida;, $c. ¡Hay yaungol de sobra!"
G["Don't be shy, buy a round for everyone!"]="别害羞，请这儿的每个人喝上一杯吧！"
G["Don't be shy, elfy. Don't you feel dis burnin' love formin' between us?"]="别害羞啦。你难道感觉不到爱情之火在燃烧吗？"
G["Don't be shy, now. Help yerselves. If it weren't fer yer help, them basterds'd be shrinkin' me head right about now."]="别不好意思。随意挑吧。要不是你帮忙，我早就完了。"
G["Don't be shy."]="不要害羞。"
G["Don't be shy. Thousands have come before you. Ya not be alone in your service."]="别害怕。你们之前有千百人尝试过，你们并不孤独。"
G["Don't be so quick to escape! I have a parting gift...."]="别急着逃走呀！我还有份“饯别”礼物呢……"
G["Don't be so sure of yourself."]="先别高兴得太早。"
G["Don't be sour when you lose to me!"]="要是你输了，别说酸话！"
G["Don't be steppin' on my goods, there."]="别踩到我的货物，小心。"
G["Don't be stupid! The sha are dangerous!"]="别犯傻！煞魔危险得很！"
G["Don't be such a fool, Bolvar!"]="伯瓦尔，别犯傻了！"
G["Don't blame you for taking up fishing.  Mulgore has some the best fishing spots in Southern Kalimdor and Mountaintop Bait & Tackle on the high rise has all of the gear you'll need to take advantage of it.\nTell Kah Mistrunner that I sent ya!"]="No te mortifiques por haber elegido la pesca. Mulgore tiene los mejores rincones de pesca en el sur de Kalimdor. En Anzuelos y Aparejos La Cumbre, que está en la gran pendiente, encontrarás todo el equipamiento que necesitas para aprovechar toda la pesca.\n\nDile a Kah Correbruma que te he enviado yo."
G["Don't bleed on me! Filthy! Disease!"]="别把血溅到我身上！肮脏！恶心！"
G["Don't botch this - I'm angling for Sr. Grade by the end of the year."]="不用在乎这个了——等到今年底，我就会成为高级勘测员了。"
G["Don't bother me while I'm partying..."]="在我参加聚会时别骚扰我……"
G["Don't bother me with trifles!"]="别拿琐碎的小事打扰我！"
G["Don't bother me, $c!  I have two whole cauldrons of bubbling brew here and I must ensure they taste just right!\n\nIf they don't, then Master Coren Direbrew will flay and boil me!"]="别来烦我，$c！我要照看整整两大锅起泡酒呢，不能让它们变味儿！\n\n要是这些酒出了一点差子，科林·烈酒大人会把我剥来煮了！"
G["Don't bother me."]="别烦我。"
G["Don't call me dummy, dummy!"]="不许叫我呆瓜，你这呆瓜！"
G["Don't charge in. Let them make the first mistake."]="不要进攻。让他们犯错误。"
G["Don't come any closer, monkey! I'm a trained SI:7 agent."]="别过来，死猴子！我可是个训练有素的军情七处特工。"
G["Don't come crying to me when you fall and scuff your knees!"]="要是摔倒了，擦破膝盖，可别跑来对着我哭鼻子！"
G["Don't come out of the shadows like that. Next time give a girl some warning."]="不要那样从阴暗中走出来。下次你要先给女生一点警示。"
G["Don't crowd me, people!"]="别挤我！"
G["Don't cry mommy.  I'm right here, see?"]="不要哭，妈妈。我就在这里，看！"
G["Don't cry, $n.  It will all soon be over.  I promise not to spit upon your corpse."]="别哭啊，$n。很快就会结束了。我保证不往你的尸体上吐口水。"
G["Don't cry, Mommy. Greatfather says not to worry."]="不要哭，妈妈。爷爷说没什么可以担心的。"
G["Don't delay, he's - ah - he's almost here!\n\nMeet me at the top of the northernmost tower."]="不要再耽搁了，他——啊——他就快到了！\n\n到最北边塔的塔顶找我"
G["Don't die!"]="别死！"
G["Don't disturb the magistrate, please!"]="请大家不要打扰镇长！"
G["Don't do that! That makes me lose!"]="别这样！我会输的！"
G["Don't do this, Tarenar."]="别这样，塔伦纳。"
G["Don't drop off!"]="别掉下去！"
G["Don't eat my head!"]="别吃掉我的头！"
G["Don't even ask about the raptors. Just don't."]="别提那些迅猛龙。提也别提。"
G["Don't even try, $r.\n\nGet out of here while you can...\n\nThere are too many... certain death..."]="试都别试，$r。\n\n趁还来得及，赶快离开这儿……\n\n有太多人都将……必死无疑……"
G["Don't fall back. Don't give them an inch!"]="不要后退，我们寸步不让！"
G["Don't fall!"]="别掉下去！"
G["Don't feel... so good."]="不要感觉……太好。"
G["Don't fight in broken weapons and armor! Expert armor and weapon repairing done here - while you wait!"]="不要使用破碎的武器和护甲参加战斗！我这里可以在你等待的时候进行专家级的武器和护甲修理！"
G["Don't fight it."]="不要抵抗。"
G["Don't fight it..."]="别再挣扎了……"
G["Don't force me hand, orc. We can't let ye pass."]="别逼我，兽人。我不能让你过去。"
G["Don't forget that disguise!"]="不要忘记伪装！"
G["Don't forget the orphans of Stormwind!"]="请不要忘记暴风城的孤儿！"
G["Don't forget to buy refreshments and souvenirs!"]="别忘记买点饮料和纪念品！"
G["Don't forget to check near the bridges southeast of town for a ride up to our forward post."]="不要忘记在城东南的桥附近看看，你能在那里找到坐骑，前往我们的前哨站。"
G["Don't forget to command your pet to follow you! |TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_TRACKING.BLP:24|t"]="别忘了命令你的宠物跟着你！|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_TRACKING.BLP:24|t"
G["Don't forget to get my bell out of the chest here. And remember, if do happen to wander off, just ring it and I'll find you again."]="不要忘了从箱子里拿上我的铃铛。记住，如果我迷路了，你就摇响铃铛，这样我就能找到你了。"
G["Don't forget to get some Flame in a Bottle from the box here.  You're going to need it to destroy their command tent."]="别忘记从箱中的瓶子里面取出瓶中火。你必须用它来破坏他们指挥官的帐篷。"
G["Don't forget to get some of that extra pyrite if your friends can shoot it down."]="如果你的朋友们能击落它，别忘记多弄点蓝铁。"
G["Don't forget to grab a war guardian, $n."]="别忘了抓个战争卫士，$n。"
G["Don't forget to keep your goggles on, $n. That's the only way we'll spot them before they can jump us."]="不要忘记带上你的护目镜，$n。只有这样，我们才能在他们扑到我们身上之前发现他们。"
G["Don't forget to put on that disguise!"]="别忘了穿上伪装服！"
G["Don't forget to replace your main weapon!"]="不要忘记更换你的主武器！"
G["Don't forget to set your worldstate area!"]="¡No olvides establecer tu zona del estado del mundo!"
G["Don't forget to stock up on wrapping paper this holiday season!  Nothing says \"Wondrous Winter Veil\" like wrapped armors and weapons for your friends and family."]="¡No te olvides de comprar mucho papel de regalo para las vacaciones! Nada dice \"Feliz Festival de Invierno\" como armas y armaduras envueltas en papel de regalo para tus amigos y tu familia."
G["Don't forget to take a break between battles. A good $c knows when not to fight."]="Acuérdate de tomarte un descanso entre un combate y otro. $gEl:La; $c $gsabio:sabia; es $gaquel:aquella; que sabe cuándo no le conviene luchar."
G["Don't forget to take it all in while you're here.  The Peak of Serenity has a wonderful view of beautiful Kun-Lai summit."]="趁你在这里，别忘了四处看看。在晴日峰上能饱览昆莱山的美景。"
G["Don't forget to take some time out to fish while you're in Zangarmarsh. You never know when you'll see water again."]="不要忘记当你在赞加沼泽的时候花点时间钓鱼。你从不知道什么时候你会再次看到水。"
G["Don't forget to take some time to just enjoy the scenery!"]="别忘了花点时间去欣赏风景！"
G["Don't forget to talk to that jinyu, down there by the river."]="别忘了和那个锦鱼人聊一聊，就是河边的那个。"
G["Don't forget to use your stealth!"]="别忘了使用潜行！"
G["Don't forget your helmet, $n. Rookies..."]="别忘了你的头盔，$n。新丁……"
G["Don't forget your totems!"]="别忘了你的图腾！"
G["Don't forget, $n - you can now use the summoning stone to port yourself back to my location in Valormok!"]="$n，不要忘记，现在你就能使用召唤石将自己传送回我在瓦罗莫克的所在地了。"
G["Don't fret, we'll be outta here soon."]="不要着急，我们很快就能出去。"
G["Don't get any ideas or I'll see that you join them!"]="不要动歪念头，否则就送你去见他们！"
G["Don't get burned..."]="别被烧焦了……"
G["Don't get caught in Big Bessa's sights."]="别被大贝莎发现。"
G["Don't get caught in the demolisher's sights."]="不要被攻城车发现。"
G["Don't get cold feet, now."]="不要临阵脱逃。"
G["Don't get me wrong, $n, I like Thrall. He was a strong leader, but I don't think he was cut out to lead the Horde. Not in a time of war!"]="不要误会我，$n。我喜欢萨尔。他是一位强有力的领袖。但我不认为他适合领导部落，尤其是在一个战争的时代！"
G["Don't get me wrong, $n. I very much appreciate the resurrection, but I think this is the last time I'll perform this particular duty. Maybe a goblet or two of wine will help with this headache."]="不要误解我，$n。我非常感激你救了我，不过我想这是我最后一次执行这个任务了。也许一两杯酒可以帮我减轻头痛。"
G["Don't get me wrong, I'd rather not be in a tunnel filled with silithid day in and day out, but if hiding here and watching these creatures' movements is going to help us win the war then I'll do it for as long as it takes."]="别误解我的意思，我可不想没日没夜地跟异种虫类呆在一起，但是如果隐藏在此地监视这些生物的动静对我们有帮助的话，我会一直呆下去的。"
G["Don't get me wrong... I'm grateful to have Shando Stormrage back, but this is all really suspicious. What happened to Fandral?"]="不要误会我的意思……我很高兴玛法里奥能回来，但这实在太令人怀疑了。范达尔出了什么事？"
G["Don't get soft on me, Varian."]="不要劝我了，瓦里安。"
G["Don't get stepped on."]="别被踩死。"
G["Don't get too close, $n. I'm liable to fumble and bash your brains open with the face of my hammer."]="不要靠得太近，$n。我手中的铁锤可能会敲到你。"
G["Don't get too close, Maia! It's going to bite your head off!"]="马亚，不要太靠近！它会咬掉你的头！"
G["Don't get too comfortable here, pal.\n\nThe general says these digs is only temporary."]="No te acomodes mucho, $gcompañero:compañera;.\n\nEl general dice que este sitio es temporal."
G["Don't get too excited, hero, that was the easy part. The challenge lies ahead! Let's go."]="不要过于兴奋，英雄，这只是最简单的部分。真正的挑战正在等着我们呢！走吧。"
G["Don't give 'em an inch, soldier! Harpoon 'em out of the sky!"]="不要给他们任何机会！将他们从空中击落！"
G["Don't give away our position, $n! That tower is crawling with bodyguards."]="不要暴露了我们的位置，$n！那座塔里塞满了保镖。"
G["Don't give me any armor. Just gimmie a blade and tell me who to kill."]="不用给我盔甲。一把刀就够了，告诉我要杀谁。"
G["Don't give up! Fight to the death!"]="不要放弃！誓死奋战！"
G["Don't give up! Fight! Fight for the Alliance!"]="不要放弃！为联盟而战！"
G["Don't give up! We are counting on you to push Deathwing back."]="别放弃。击败死亡之翼的希望寄托在你们身上了。"
G["Don't give up! We must prevail!"]="不要放弃！坚持到底！"
G["Don't give up, thunderbirds! Come back for me!"]="别放弃，雷鸟！回来找我！"
G["Don't give... up!"]="不要……放弃！"
G["Don't go close to the lake! It's haunted!"]="不要靠近那片湖泊！那里有鬼魂出没！"
G["Don't go easy on me!"]="千万别对我客气啊！"
G["Don't go in there!"]="不要走进那里！"
G["Don't go leavin' the job half done, now. Come an' tell me if it be safe to make my escape!"]="别半途而废啊。告诉我，我能安全逃离此地了吧？"
G["Don't go leavin' the job half done. Come an' tell me if it be safe to make my report!"]="做事别做一半。如果安全了就告诉我一声，我好回去汇报！"
G["Don't go out there. The pools are crawling with robots and mechagnomes!"]="千万别进入池塘，那里到处是机器人和机械侏儒！"
G["Don't go too far away Seth.  You know mommy doesn't like it when she can't hear you."]="不要走太远了，塞瑟。你知道妈妈不喜欢你走得太远。"
G["Don't go toward the light, Mr. Floppy!"]="别朝有光的地方跑，小毛球！"
G["Don't go wanderin' off too far, $p. We're darn near defenseless without the likes of you."]="别离开太远，$p。没有你的帮助，我们这里和不设防也没什么区别了。"
G["Don't have to tell me twice - I've got debts in this city I'd like to leave behind."]="你不用告诉我两次。在这城里我欠了许多债，我不想还了。"
G["Don't hesitate, these dummies won't fight back, but the Blackrock sure will."]="No lo dudes: estos muñecos no se defienden, pero los Roca Negra ya te digo que sí."
G["Don't hold back now! Let's have it!"]="别这么快退缩！好好打一场！"
G["Don't hold back."]="全力以赴。"
G["Don't hurt Betsy, you meanie!"]="不要伤害伊丽莎白，你这个坏蛋！"
G["Don't hurt me!"]="不要伤害我！"
G["Don't hurt me!  I was just looking for my sisters!  I think Ashley's inside that house!"]="不要伤害我！我只是在寻找我的姐妹！我想阿什莉就在这幢房子里！"
G["Don't interrupt me."]="不要打断我。"
G["Don't ja start..."]="闭嘴……"
G["Don't jump! I am sure there are people who love you. Or at least tolerate you..."]="别跳！我肯定会有人爱你，或至少会有人讨厌你……"
G["Don't jump! Life is worth living!"]="别跳！珍惜生命！"
G["Don't just attack him one at a time, you idiots! Surround him now!"]="别一个一个上，你们这些蠢货！给我一起上！"
G["Don't just sit there! Attack!"]="别傻看着。杀光他们！"
G["Don't just sit there! Kill them!"]="别傻看着。杀光他们！"
G["Don't just stand around $g boy:girl;! The Crusade needs your help!"]="No te quedes mirando, $gchico:chica;. ¡La Cruzada necesita tu ayuda!"
G["Don't just stand around, $r...\n\nThere's work to be done!"]="不要这样傻站着，$r……\n\n还有很多工作要做呢！"
G["Don't just stand there! Help $g him:her; out!"]="不要就这么站在那里！帮帮$g他:她;！"
G["Don't just stand there; kill him!"]="不要只是傻站在那里，干掉他！"
G["Don't just use the blade. Use the butt of your weapon. Break his nose!"]="别只知道用武器的锋刃部分。用用武器的柄，砸扁他的鼻子！"
G["Don't kill me! I only took this job for the benefits!"]="别杀我！我只是想赚点钱！"
G["Don't know how long we're gonna be able to hold them off, $g bud : lady;. Hope you have a plan!"]="不知道我们能将他们拖延多久，$g小子:姑娘;，希望你知道该怎样做！"
G["Don't know why you would need a skill like that? Only dishonest folk would want to learn how to pick locks.\nI guess if you wanted to learn, the best place to look would be over in Old Town. Probably in one of those back alleys."]="¿No sabes para qué te puede servir un oficio como ese? Solo los estafadores querrían aprender a forzar cerraduras.\n\nSupongo que si quisieras aprender a hacerlo, el mejor lugar en el que buscar sería el Casco Antiguo. Quizás en uno de esos callejones de atrás."
G["Don't leave me again!  You want to fight for your country, but they don't even want you!  They sent you here to die!"]="别再离我而去了！你想为你的祖国而战，可你的祖国根本不愿意接纳你！他们派你来送死！"
G["Don't leave me alone!"]="不要留下我一个人！"
G["Don't leave me in here!  Cause if you do, I will find you..."]="不要把我留在这里！要是你这么绝情，我做鬼也不会放过你……"
G["Don't let Maikee know, but I kinda love him even if he is a grump."]="别让麦基知道，可就算他脾气很坏，我还是有点儿喜欢他。"
G["Don't let a little elf attack get in the way of your work!"]="不要让小小的精灵进攻干扰你的工作！"
G["Don't let a single one of them live."]="不要放走任何一个。"
G["Don't let any of them escape, you dogs!"]="一个也别让他们跑了，你们这群狗！"
G["Don't let anybody tell you that the Scourge is defeated.  Look... do they not still roam the Plaguewood?  They cling to their corrupted land like a child's blanket.\n\nI have no choice but to fight.  Until my last breath, I will fight them."]="如果有人告诉你天灾军团被打败了，不要信他的话。看看吧……难道他们不是仍然在病木林横行肆虐吗？他们死守着他们的腐蚀之地，如同儿童拼命抓住自己的小床。\n\n我别无选择，只能战斗。在我呼出最后一口气之前，我绝不会停止和他们的战斗。"
G["Don't let him get away!"]="不要让他跑了！"
G["Don't let him get close to you!"]="别让他靠近你！"
G["Don't let it get to Stonetalon!"]="不要让它到达石爪山！"
G["Don't let it grab you!"]="别让它抓住你！"
G["Don't let it touch you!"]="别让它碰到你！"
G["Don't let me catch you stealing anything!  Look for Shenthul and his Shadowswift Brotherhood in the underground Cleft of Shadow.  Find the tunnel leading down into it south of the Valley of Wisdom."]="别让我发现你盗窃了任何东西！去暗影裂口地下寻找申苏尔以及他的 迅影兄弟会。在智慧谷以南能找到通向那儿的通道。"
G["Don't let me die!"]="别让我丧命！"
G["Don't let me down again, $n. Make sure this evacuee reaches safety."]="别再让我失望了，$n。你要保证带领这位村民安全撤离。"
G["Don't let my death go unavenged, stranger... give... them... hell..."]="为我复仇，陌生人……让他们……下地狱……"
G["Don't let stains sit for too long!"]="别让污点存在太久！"
G["Don't let that dragonhawk through!  Open fire!"]="不要让那龙鹰通过这里！开火！"
G["Don't let that panther drag me off... Put me down if it comes to that."]="别让猎豹把我拖走……那样的话我宁愿去死。"
G["Don't let the $Rs in the Bazaar fool ye lad, with the subway those gnomes built it's easier than ye might think to transport goods from Ironforge. If they try to tack on import fees just tell them yer gonna buy yer gear from me."]="No te dejes engañar por los $Rs en el Bazar, con el metro que esos gnomos construyeron es más fácil de lo que crees transportar mercancías desde Forjaz. Si intentan cobrarte aranceles simplemente dile que vas a comprar tu equipo a mí."
G["Don't let the beady eyes and bushy beard fool you. Vosur's a talented apprentice and a good friend, even if I do get a crick in my neck when I talk to him."]="别被沃萨亮晶晶的眼睛和浓密的胡须愚弄了。他是个很有才能的学徒，也是个很好的朋友，即使我在跟他谈话时颈部有些痉挛。"
G["Don't let the horde scum through!"]="别让部落渣滓通过！"
G["Don't let the humans in the Bazaar fool ye $g lad : lass;, with the subway those gnomes built it's easier than ye might think to transport goods from Ironforge. If they try to tack on import fees just tell them yer gonna buy yer gear from me."]="不要让市场上的人类愚弄了你，$g小伙子:姑娘;。有了侏儒建造的那条地铁运输线，你可以很轻松地把货物从铁炉堡运送过来。如果那些家伙要收你运费的话，那么就告诉他们你要到我这里来买东西。"
G["Don't let the jingle of the bells take away from the jingle in your pocket!  Buy Smokywood Pastures treats for your Winter Veil festivities!"]="别花钱购买那些铃当！为了你的冬幕盛宴，把烟林牧场买下吧！"
G["Don't let the levels get too low."]="水平面不要过低。"
G["Don't let them break the line!"]="别让他们突破阵线！"
G["Don't let them catch you!"]="别让他们抓住你！"
G["Don't let them eat me!"]="不要让它们吃掉我！"
G["Don't let them escape!"]="不要让他们逃走！"
G["Don't let them escape! Kill the strong one first!"]="不要让他们跑了！先杀掉那个强壮的家伙！"
G["Don't let them hurt us Tito! Oh, you won't, will you?"]="托托，你不会让这些家伙伤害我们的，对吧？"
G["Don't let them make off with any of the artifacts!"]="不要让他们把宝物偷走！"
G["Don't let them make... a mattress outta' me."]="别让他们把我……做成草垫。"
G["Don't let them out of sight! Quickly - come with me!"]="别让他们离开视线！快——跟着我！"
G["Don't let them overpower us!"]="不要让他们冲破防线！"
G["Don't let them take the Windrunner you worthless mutts!  Stand your ground!"]="你们这群蠢货，不能让风行者号落入敌人手中！给我顶住！"
G["Don't let them through!  Look, over there!"]="不要让他们通过小径！瞧，他们在那里！"
G["Don't let them turn me into one of those aberrations!"]="别让他们把我变成那种畸形的怪物！"
G["Don't let those big, innocent eyes fool ye. Tally's an expert, all right: I learn something new every day. Why d'you think I'm here in Tinker Town? Do I look like an engineer to you? Aye, I didn't think so."]="别被那些天真的大眼睛欺骗了。塔雷是个专家，我每天都在学习新知识。你认为我为什么会在侏儒区？你看我像个工程师吗？啊，我可不这么想。"
G["Don't let those dirty orcs take the harbor!"]="别让那些肮脏的兽人占领港口！"
G["Don't let those fiends breath through!  Our wounded are here behind me!"]="不要让那些恶魔冲过来！我们的伤员在后面！"
G["Don't let those monsters through the gate! Stand firm, soldiers!"]="别让这些怪物冲进城门！士兵们，坚守防线！"
G["Don't let those spiders eat the Elementium!"]="不要让那些蜘蛛把源质吃掉！"
G["Don't let up! No mercy!"]="继续！决不手软！"
G["Don't let up, $n!"]="别放松，$n！"
G["Don't let up. No mercy!"]="不要松懈，毫不留情！"
G["Don't let vrykul come through!  Kill all!"]="别让维库人冲过去！杀光他们！"
G["Don't listen to anything Alexi says. He was a fool to stay during the plague and now look at him - he's no better than the other abominations in this place.\n\nDon't fret, we will reclaim Scholomance and the surrounding lands for the last living son of Barov - the rightful heir."]="不要听阿莱克斯瞎说。瘟疫袭来的时候他却不知道逃走，那只能说明他的愚蠢。看看他现在的样子——和这里的其他憎恶没有两样。\n\n别担心，我们会夺回通灵学院和它周围的土地。把它们交给巴罗夫最后一个活着的儿子。他才是这里的合法继承人。"
G["Don't listen to her voice!"]="不要听她的声音！"
G["Don't listen to him.  We've got work to do."]="别听他的。我们还有事要做呢。"
G["Don't listen to that old fool, kid. He's like that with everyone. I've been watching you, though; you got real talent. Come have a talk with me."]="No escuches a ese viejo idiota, $gniño:niña;. Es así con todo el mundo. Pero te he estado observando y tienes auténtico talento. Ven a hablar conmigo."
G["Don't listen to the hearts of the world - the answer lies within.  You know the truth."]="别聆听来自世界的心声——答案就在你心中，你知道真相的。"
G["Don't look at her... ruby red... soft... sensual lips! Oh..."]="不要看她那……红宝石般的……柔软的……肉欲的双唇！哦……"
G["Don't look into their eyes!  They're not the people you once knew!"]="别看他们的眼睛！他们已经不再是你曾经熟悉的那些人了！"
G["Don't look so smug! I know what you're thinking, but Tempest Keep was merely a setback. Did you honestly believe I would trust the future to some blind, half-night elf mongrel?"]="别拿那种眼神看着我！我知道你们在想些什么，但风暴要塞的失败早就过去了。你们真以为我会把命运交给一个又瞎又粗野又下贱的暗夜精灵杂种？"
G["Don't look so surprised to see me here, $r. The coming of the draenei and their alliance with my people was foretold by Kurz the Revelator."]="不要用惊讶的眼光看着我，$r。德莱尼人的到来和与我们的结盟都已经被启示者库尔兹言中了。"
G["Don't look so surprised! We dragons are conscious, even within our shells. As I grew, I could hear the plotting and scheming. I was to be born a prisoner."]="别这么惊讶！我们龙族即使在蛋壳里也是有意识的。在成长过程中，我听到的全是诡计和阴谋。我生来就是个囚徒。"
G["Don't look up!"]="别抬头！"
G["Don't make me angry! You wouldn't like me when I'm angry!"]="别惹我发火！我发起脾气来可不是说着玩儿的！"
G["Don't make me come in there with my brutes!"]="我可不想和这些蛮子混在一起！"
G["Don't make me get my pappy to catch you! He likes to catch bunnies using his rifle!"]="不要逼我叫我爸爸来抓你！他喜欢用步枪打兔子！"
G["Don't make me go medieval on you."]="别让我对你动武。"
G["Don't make me jump off of this crate! I will beat your head in, orc."]="别逼我从箱子上跳下来！我会把你痛打一顿的。"
G["Don't make me kill you!"]="不要让我杀了你们！"
G["Don't make me laugh."]="别逗我笑了。"
G["Don't make me stand up!"]="别逼我站起来！"
G["Don't make them angry!"]="不要激怒他们！"
G["Don't mind Skuerto, $n. He doesn't mean to be rude, he's just terribly busy. While we wait for him to finish scouting, why don't we work on something more productive?"]="别担心斯奎尔图，$n。他不想这么粗鲁的，他只是非常繁忙。我们不如趁着等他完成侦察任务的时候做些更有用的事情？"
G["Don't mind if I do. Maybe it'll get rid of this headache."]="请不要介意，也许这样能驱除头痛。"
G["Don't mind me, or my smell...because I sure don't!"]="别介意我的气味……连我自己都不介意！"
G["Don't mind me. I'm just an old man, waiting on an old... friend."]="不用管我。我只是个糟老头，让我静静地等待那位老……朋友。"
G["Don't mind the mess, we're still settin' up.\n\nDon't let that stop you from enjoying yourself, though! Relax, spend some coin... we've got everything from money changers and laundry services to exotic drinks and fishing trainers.\n\nAnd if anyone gives you any trouble? You just let ME know, and I'll handle it.\n\nI'm Mida... the boss."]="这里还有点乱，我们还在收拾，请别介意。\n\n你可以尽情在这里享受！放松放松，消费一下……我们这里什么都有——兑钱商、洗衣店、异国美酒、钓鱼训练师，你可以享受到一流的服务。\n\n如果有人给你麻烦，就来找我，我会为你处理的。\n\n我是米达……大老板米达。"
G["Don't mind those two idiots outside - they're caught up in some fad called \"sharking.\"\n\nI'd wager they feel pretty dumb about that picture in a couple of months."]="No hagas caso a esos dos idiotas de fuera. Están siguiendo una moda llamada \"tiburonear\".\n\nApuesto que dentro de un par de meses les dará vergüenza ver esa foto."
G["Don't mind us. We're just mopping up the last of them now. Shouldn't be much longer."]="不用管我们。我们正在清理最后的余孽。应该用不了多久了。"
G["Don't move, $r!"]="别动，$r！"
G["Don't move, human. I've got you cornered."]="别动，人类。你逃不了了。"
G["Don't move, little adventurer. I have the death you seek."]="不要乱动，小冒险者。我这里有你正在寻找的死亡。"
G["Don't need Goob's help?"]="不要古布帮忙了？"
G["Don't pay Budd no nevermind... poor fella's got a few screws missin'."]="别去理会巴德……那伙计的脑子里少了几根筋。"
G["Don't play stupid with me, Jack. I know that you have the moolah!"]="不要愚弄我，杰克。我知道你有钱！"
G["Don't preen just yet, little pups. We'll cleanse this world of your kind."]="别得意，小崽子。我们会把你们从这个世界上清除掉。"
G["Don't pull own tail when there are other tails to pull."]="可以扯别人的尾巴时，绝对不扯自己的。"
G["Don't put seeds in your nose. That makes paw-paw real mad!"]="别把种子塞进鼻子了。爸爸会很生气的！"
G["Don't question my genius!"]="不要质疑我的天才！"
G["Don't resist... I'm only trying to change you back into a man."]="别抵抗了……我只是想要把你变回人形。"
G["Don't roll in own poo unless want to smell like poo all day."]="别在自己的粪便里打滚，除非你想臭上一整天。"
G["Don't rule me out be just 'cause I'm a country boy! I got freakish strong arms, you know."]="别因为我是乡下来的就排挤我！我胳膊肘可粗了，你瞧。"
G["Don't say I didn't warn ya when I thrust my fist into the back of yer head. It'll feel just like home, back in the Valley of Trials."]="不要以为我没有警告过你，当我一拳击中你的后脑时，那感觉就像回家，就像回到试炼谷一样。"
G["Don't say I didn't warn ya!"]="别说我没有警告你！"
G["Don't say I didn't warn ya, scoundrels! Onward, brothers and sisters!"]="我早就警告过你，恶棍！兄弟姐妹们，前进！"
G["Don't say a word. Allow your image to speak. We pandaren prize beauty, and we find it all around us:"]="不必说话。你的存在即是表达。我们熊猫人崇尚至美，而至美就存在于我们身边："
G["Don't say much, do yeh?"]="不喜欢说话？"
G["Don't see many Blacksmiths this far from Ironforge. What can I do for ye?"]="铁匠？真少见啊。我能为你做什么吗？"
G["Don't see many a' your kind 'round here, mon.\nWhat can I be helpin' ya find?"]="No suelo ver a muchos como tú por aquí, colega.\n\n¿En qué pue'o ayudah'te?"
G["Don't see what you need in the city?\n\nWhat are you looking for? Maybe I can help you find it."]="你在城里没能找到需要的东西吗？\n\n你在找什么？也许我能帮你找到它。"
G["Don't settle for anything but the best. Brivelthwerp's!"]="只求最好，决不将就。认准布里维普牌！"
G["Don't shoot!  Apothecary coming through!"]="别动手！是药剂师！"
G["Don't shoot! Let 'em burn!"]="这是部落的胜利！"
G["Don't show 'em any mercy $n!"]="不要心软，$n！"
G["Don't sleep easy, 'cause we'll be back. And next time, we'll destroy you for good!"]="哼，我们会趁你们睡着的时候反攻。下一次，你们就死定了！"
G["Don't speak, friend, I will take you to the healers."]="别说话，朋友，我马上送你去找大夫。"
G["Don't stand in the fire ya git."]="不要站在射击范围内。"
G["Don't stand in the fire!"]="别傻站在火里！"
G["Don't stay out here too long, there will be more on top of you any second."]="别待在这儿太久，随时会有更多敌人出现。"
G["Don't stay out here too long."]="别在野外逗留太久。"
G["Don't stir the potion like that, you ham-handed farmer! No, don't stop stirring it, either! Forget it--just give me that ladle before you start a fire. I'll salvage what I can. Now, pay attention."]="¡No agites así la poción, torpe $ggranjero:granjera;! ¡No, pero tampoco pares de agitarla! Olvídalo... Dame ese cazo antes de que provoques un incendio. Salvaré lo que pueda. Y ahora, presta atención."
G["Don't stop moving! Water those Sugar Beets!"]="别停！给那些甜菜浇水！"
G["Don't stop now, I've almost broken a sweat."]="别停手啊，我就快出汗啦。"
G["Don't stop now.\n\nYou still have time left to play!"]="不要停。\n\n你还有时间！"
G["Don't take it from me what a bargain this is. Come see for yourself!"]="三分叫卖七分货啊。都来看看吧！"
G["Don't take your eyes off of these filthy Broken. I don't trust them."]="给我时刻盯着这些破碎者，我根本不信任它们。"
G["Don't talk about me like I'm not here! All I know is I'm hungry and I need to get out of these hideous, smelly clothes!"]="别把我当空气！我只知道我现在饥肠辘辘，我还要脱掉这身又臭又脏的衣服！"
G["Don't talk back to me, troll.  You know who was left in charge here.  Haven't you stopped to ask yourself why Thrall chose me instead of you?"]="别跟我顶嘴，巨魔。你清楚现在掌权的是谁。难道你没有自问过，为什么萨尔选择了我，而不是你？"
G["Don't tase me, mon!"]="我这就去干活儿，老大！"
G["Don't tell Tirth I'm still here.  If he finds out I haven't left the Shimmering Flats, I'll be running his errands and cleaning his dirty laundry forever!"]="不要告诉提尔斯我还在这里。如果他发现我还没离开闪光平原，我就要永远帮他洗衣服了！"
G["Don't tell anyone else I said this, but even I don't know everything! If you want to keep learning, you should talk to the owner of the shop, Springspindle Fizzlegear."]="不要告诉任何人我说过，就当我什么都不知道！如果你还想学习，你应该与店主宾斯匹德谈谈。"
G["Don't tell anyone where you're goin', he said!"]="他说别把你的行踪告诉任何人！"
G["Don't tell her I said this, but I think Shomi did a great job defending the village."]="别让她知道我说过这些，可我认为朔弥确实将村庄守得很好。"
G["Don't tell me! Shhh! You are here about the Ashbringer?!? Yes... Yes... No! My bad.\n\nWhat can I help you with, $r?\n\nIf you're here to try and relearn a tradeskill, use the book over there...\n\n<Narain points to \"Soothsaying for Dummies.\">"]="¡No me lo digas! ¡Shhh! ¿Estás aquí por la espada Crematoria? Sí... Sí... ¡No! Me he equivocado.\n\n¿En qué puedo ayudarte, $r?\n\nSi estás aquí para intentar volver a aprender un oficio, usa ese libro de ahí...\n\n<Narain señala \"Adivinar el futuro para torpes\"."
G["Don't tempt me! Do you even know what's in those things?"]="别试探我！你根本不知道那些东西里究竟有什么吧？"
G["Don't these guys ever give up?"]="这些家伙都是一根筋吗？"
G["Don't they teach you new recruits anything?  These manaforges were built from parts of Tempest Keep designed to siphon energy from the nether.\n\nThe naaru used this technology to power their vessel during its travels.  Some said the technology might not be safe to use on land.  They were promptly silenced."]="他们没有教你们这些新来的家伙任何东西吗？这些法力熔炉是作为风暴要塞的一部分而建造的，用来吸取虚空中的能量。\n\n纳鲁用这个技术在旅途中给他们的飞船供给动力。有人说那技术在陆地上使用可能不安全，然而他们很快就沉默了。"
G["Don't think I can't see you back there, hiding in the shadows..."]="不要以为你藏在暗影下我就看不到你……"
G["Don't think I'm letting you off the hook next time."]="下一次你可没那么容易全身而退了。"
G["Don't think this'll help much, but here's my petition."]="也许于事无补，但这是我的请愿书。"
G["Don't think we're here to save you, troll. We're here for Kalimdor.  Get forces inside the gates while we distract the enemy!"]="我们可不是来救你的，巨魔。我们是为卡利姆多而来。我们来引开敌人，让你的部队趁势杀进去。"
G["Don't think you've won."]="不要以为你们已经赢了。"
G["Don't think, $c.\n\nJust... do it...."]="别犹豫，$c。\n\n动……动手吧……"
G["Don't throw banana peel where going to walk."]="不要在路上乱扔香蕉皮。"
G["Don't throw me in the fire, hozen!"]="别把我丢进火里，猢狲！"
G["Don't touch the big tiger, Maia! It's going to eat you for dinner!"]="马亚，不要触摸大老虎！它会把你当美餐！"
G["Don't touch those boots!  I'm waiting for the authorities to show up and collect the evidence."]="不要碰这些靴子！我正在等待权威人士来此收集证据。"
G["Don't trust this one, your highness - no one is that good."]="别相信他，王子殿下，他不值得信任。"
G["Don't try anything funny, $c.\n\n<The enforcer tenses his fingers near the hilt of his blade, eager for you to make a scene.>"]="不要自取其辱，$c。\n\n<执行者握住剑柄的手指又紧了紧，就等你先动手了。>"
G["Don't try to teleport to one of your enemies' cities.  It won't work - we may all be friendly here, but back home old grudges remain..."]="别想要传送到你的敌人的城市去……那根本不可能。我们可能在这里是朋友，但出了月光林地就不好说了……"
G["Don't try to weasel out of this!"]="别狡辩！你脱不了干系的！"
G["Don't underestimate my father. Even if you were to crush his body, the core of his madness and rage will still struggle to destroy you."]="别低估我的父亲。即使你摧毁了他的身体，他那颗充满疯狂与愤怒的心仍然能毁掉你。"
G["Don't underestimate the Mechachicken, $n. After all, it is a Hobart Grapplehammer invention!"]="别小看那机动战鸡，$n。那毕竟是霍巴特·钩锤的发明！"
G["Don't value your life very much, do you?"]="不要把自己的生命看得太有价值。"
G["Don't wait! Order now and receive my Ultra-Kinetic Waffle Iron at no additional charge!"]="不要犹豫了！现在订购还能得到我免费赠送的超导聊天铁！"
G["Don't wander too far. I'm sure there are more of them out there."]="不要走得太远。我相信他们大部分人都在那里。"
G["Don't waste my time."]="不要浪费我的时间。"
G["Don't waste my time. I have research projects older than you. Go talk to Doctor Martin Felben in the Apothecarium of the Undercity. He's a Forsaken who can probably manage to teach you the basics."]="别浪费我时间。我从事研究的时间比你的年纪还要大。去跟幽暗城炼金房的亡灵马丁·费尔本谈谈。他或许能传授给你一些基础知识。"
G["Don't waste your time on that one, he's weak!"]="别在他身上浪费时间了，他是个没用的东西。"
G["Don't we have ANY coffee left?"]="我们一点咖啡都没有了？"
G["Don't worry - I've got you."]="别担心——有我在。"
G["Don't worry - if they try to pretend they didn't see it, I'll swim over there and drag them off of their ships myself."]="别担心——要是他们敢装没看见，我会亲自游过去把他们从船上拽来。"
G["Don't worry about Hobart, boss. He's just having a bit of a breakdown right now.\n\nThe Cataclysm couldn't have come at a worse time for him. He was so close to being done with the Micro Mechachicken."]="No te preocupes por Hobart, $gjefe:jefa;. Ahora mismo está en medio de un ataque de nervios.\n\nEl Cataclismo no ha podido llegar en un peor momento para él. Estaba a punto de dar por terminado el micromecapollo."
G["Don't worry about me none.\n\nHNNGGHHH!!\n\nI'll be fine, really."]="你完全不用担心我。\n\n啊啊啊啊！！\n\n我很快就能搞定，真的。"
G["Don't worry about me!  Slay this dreadful beast and cleanse this world of his foul taint!"]="别担心我！杀死这头可怕的野兽，净化被他的邪恶力量所玷污的世界！"
G["Don't worry about me. Stop the Destroyer! Enshu-falah-nah, dorini."]="别担心我。去阻止灭世者吧！Enshu-falah-nah, dorini。"
G["Don't worry about me. We have to rescue the king!"]="别担心我。我们快去救国王！"
G["Don't worry about me; kill that worthless dullard instead!"]="先不要管我，去杀了那个毫无价值的蠢货！"
G["Don't worry about that. I've increased production at the Deathforge. You'll have all the infernals you need to carry out your orders. Don't fail, Jovaan."]="不要担心。我已经提高了死亡熔炉的产量，你会拥有足够的地狱火的。不要让我失望，约瓦安。"
G["Don't worry about the trees. It's the circle of life! They grow, we chop 'em down, and then we use 'em to build things!\n\nI guess that's less of a circle, and more of a line..."]="别为这些树木担心。这就叫生命循环！它们长，我们砍，然后再用它们建造东西！\n\n好像这不叫循环，这叫流水线……"
G["Don't worry about us, $n. You just get over there and make sure that the Trade Prince gets dealt with."]="别担心我们，$n。你只要过去那边，确保解决掉贸易大王就可以了。"
G["Don't worry about your weight, this cannon can handle any payload!"]="别担心你的体重，不管你有多重，这门大炮都能够承受！"
G["Don't worry one bit, we had replacements ready. Can't expect to always get it first go, you know."]="别担心，我们已经备好了替换器械。你也知道，这种任务很难一次成功的嘛。"
G["Don't worry too much. By the time I went off duty, we hadn't found a scrap of befouled grain here."]="别太担心。直到我下班的时候，这里还没有发现一颗被污染的谷物。"
G["Don't worry! I can make it!"]="别担心！我能行！"
G["Don't worry! Ol' Brann's got yer back! Keep that metal monstrosity busy, and I'll see if I can't sweet talk this machine into helping ye!"]="嘿！别担心！老布莱恩在后面给你们加油呢！把这些该死的金属疙瘩给我挡住，让我来好好跟这台可爱的大机器谈谈，让它帮帮你们！"
G["Don't worry, $r. They will not get past me."]="别担心，$r。他们过不了我这关。"
G["Don't worry, I'll be rooting for you even if you come in last!"]="别担心，就算你最后一个冲过比赛终点，我也会为你呐喊助威的！"
G["Don't worry, I'll find a good home for ya."]="不要担心，我会给你找个好心人的。"
G["Don't worry, I'll fix you right up!"]="别担心，我马上就治好你！"
G["Don't worry, I'm sure the next one will do great!"]="别担心，我相信下一个会做得更好！"
G["Don't worry, Maia, I'll protect you."]="不要担心，马亚，我会保护你。"
G["Don't worry, Old Blanchy, we'll get you something to eat soon. . ."]="不要担心，布兰契，我们很快就有东西给你吃了……"
G["Don't worry, it'll all be over soon."]="别担心，很快就过去了。"
G["Don't worry, kid. Riding's not as hard as it looks.\n\nYou should get a few more notches on your belt before attempting this, though."]="No te preocupes, $ghijo:hija;. Ser jinete no es tan complicado como parece.\n\nAunque, antes de probar, deberías hacerte unos cuantos agujeros más en el cinturón."
G["Don't worry, number two. We'll get another chance. And we'll be ready."]="别担心，二号，我们还会有机会。下次我们会准备周全的。"
G["Don't worry, sister... no one can hurt you now."]="别害怕……现在你安全啦。"
G["Don't worry, soldier. Yazmina is going to take care of you."]="别担心，士兵。亚米娜会照顾好你的。"
G["Don't worry, the hatchlings are quite safe here."]="别担心，雏龙在这里会很安全的。"
G["Don't worry, we've got your back!  Forge ahead, brave heroes!"]="别担心，我们会支援你们的！前进吧，英雄们！"
G["Don't worry, we've got your back! Forge ahead, brave heroes!"]="别担心，我们会支援你们的！前进吧，英雄们！"
G["Don't worry, you'll be fine. You look like a natural!"]="不用担心，你会没事的。你看上去很自然！"
G["Don't worry, your hatchling's got it!"]="别担心，你的幼龙已经接住了！"
G["Don't worry, your money is safe with us."]="别担心，你的钱在我们这里很安全。"
G["Don't worry.  Shatter Point is as sturdy as they come!  But just in case, be ready to jump on a gryphon if the base starts to break apart..."]="不要担心，破碎岗哨固若金汤！不过为了以防万一，如果基地开始碎裂的话，你要马上跳上狮鹫……"
G["Don't worry. I will be honorable in victory."]="别担心。我会光荣取胜。"
G["Don't worry. I'll get Anduin back to Lion's Landing safely. We'll meet ye there."]="别担心。我会把安度因平安送回雄狮港。我们回雄狮港见。"
G["Don't worry. I've got you."]="别担心。我抓住你了。"
G["Don't worry. It's an improvement!"]="不要担心。这是个进步！"
G["Don't worry. The zombies are looking for brains. You're safe."]="别担心。僵尸喜欢有脑子的人，所以你是安全的。"
G["Don't worry. You can cry on my shoulder if you lose."]="别担心。如果你输了，我可以把肩膀借给你哭。"
G["Don't worry. Zanzil won't leave you dead for long..."]="别担心。赞吉尔不会让你死得太久……"
G["Don't worry; I'll make good use of you!"]="别担心，我会好好利用你的！"
G["Don't ya be hurtin' me, mon!"]="朋友，别伤害我！"
G["Don't ya have something better ta do, $g lad : lass; than jaw with me?\n\nNow get out there and prove yer mettle!"]="¿No tienes nada mejor que hacer que molestarme, $Gchico:chica;?\n\n¡Ahora vete de aquí y demuestra tu entereza!"
G["Don't ya let up now, $n!"]="现在决不能松懈，$n！"
G["Don't ya worry, mon. Just leave it to Rokhan. She be comin'."]="朋友，别担心。这件事就交给洛坎吧。"
G["Don't you \"snow lily\" me! I was- WE- were worried sick about you."]="¡No me vengas con \"lirio de las nieves\"! Estaba... Estábamos preocupadísimos por ti."
G["Don't you beasts know when to give up?"]="你们这群畜生不懂放弃吗？"
G["Don't you dare follow her, Riko. I don't want you messing things up again."]="你不要跟过去，里克。别再把事情搞砸了。"
G["Don't you dare talk about my father, monster.  He was twice the man you'll ever be."]="你居然敢侮辱我的父亲。他比你勇敢得多。"
G["Don't you die on me!"]="你可别死在我这儿！"
G["Don't you have business elsewhere?"]="你没其它事情可做了吗？"
G["Don't you have some packages to move?"]="你没什么东西要搬吗？"
G["Don't you just love watching the birds? I wish I could fly, too."]="难道你只喜欢看着鸟儿吗？我真想我也能飞。"
G["Don't you know what I am? I'm a fierce predator! I'll cut you!"]="你难道不知道我是做什么的？我是一个凶猛的掠食者！我要剁了你！"
G["Don't you people ever check the mail?"]="你们从来都不看信箱的吗？"
G["Don't you people get tired of repeating the same thing over and over?"]="难道你们还没有厌倦这样一遍又一遍地重复同一件事吗？"
G["Don't you remember?  You died."]="你不记得了吗？你死了。"
G["Don't you start with me!"]="闭嘴！"
G["Don't you start with me, Sid! Have it sent to my quarters in the tower instead! Your inn has become a zoo!"]="少来了，希德！把那东西送到我在塔里的住处！你的旅店已经变成了动物园了！"
G["Don't you think that Farmer Fung is just... dreamy?"]="你不觉得农夫老方很……迷人吗？"
G["Don't you try to sneak up on me! My pappy always said I got eyes in the back o' my head!"]="你不要试图接近我！我的朋友总说我的脑后门上长着眼睛！"
G["Don't you wanna go home, peasant? These things aren't gonna rebuild themselves!"]="你是想滚回家吗？你以为这些建筑物能自动复原是不是！"
G["Don't you want to know what happened to the man?"]="你不想知道那人怎么了吗？"
G["Don't you wish there was some water around here?"]="你不希望这附近有水吗？"
G["Don't... let Finklestein use me... for his potions..."]="不要……让芬克斯坦拿我……做药……"
G["Don't... think you've won..."]="别……以为你们赢了……"
G["Don't... worry... about me..."]="不要……担心……我……"
G["Don't.... move..."]="别……动……"
G["Don'tcha make me get rough wit yeh, troll."]="别逼我对你动粗啊，放乖点。"
G["Donate...my body...to science..."]="将我的……身体……献给科学……"
G["Done! Back up! Back up!"]="完成了！后退！后退！"
G["Done, done, and done."]="完成了，全部完成了。"
G["Dook if I know."]="要让我知道，一定得教训教训他们。"
G["Dook's got real since last time."]="我听到的都是真的。"
G["Dook..."]="该死的……"
G["Dooker OOKED!"]="蠢货被打中了！"
G["Dookers die quick!"]="死吧，坏蛋！"
G["Dookers is doin' ookin' things!"]="坏蛋来干坏事了！"
G["Dookin'..."]="混蛋……"
G["Doom Lord Kazzak will be pleased. You are to increase the pace of your attacks. Destroy the orcish and dwarven strongholds with all haste."]="末日领主卡扎克会高兴的。你最好加快你进攻的步伐，用最快的速度消灭这些兽人和矮人的要塞。"
G["Doom Lord Kazzak will soon unleash our full might on these pitiful Orcs and Humans!"]="末日领主卡扎克很快就会在这些可怜的兽人和人类身上倾泻我们全部的力量。"
G["Doom doom from the boom boom!"]="轰轰飞，末日到！"
G["Doom upon you... wretched mortals!"]="厄运就要降临在你的身上了……可怜的凡人！"
G["Doomed for eternity!"]="彻底毁灭吧！"
G["Doomguard"]="末日守卫"
G["Doomguard pour forth from the demon portal!"]="恶魔传送门里涌出了大量末日守卫！"
G["Doomsday cultists? Just what we need after all the trouble with those Defias thugs."]="末日教信徒？在那些迪菲亚暴徒之后，我们又有新的麻烦了。"
G["Doomsday cultists? Well, the orcs have already survived the end of one world, so what's another?"]="末日教信徒？兽人已经经历过一次世界末日了，再来一次又能怎样？"
G["Door-to-door kodo delivery!"]="科多兽送货上门！"
G["Dor the Wall, please join us on the battlefield."]="铁壁龟，请来战场上加入我们。"
G["Doren just needs a little more time. Hold the line!"]="再给多伦一点时间。坚持住！"
G["Dornaa begins to examine the stone edifice, and then touches it."]="多尔南开始观察起这座石质建筑，并轻轻触摸起它的柱子来。"
G["Dornaa gives her brother a big hug, and the two children begin to talk."]="多尔南给了她哥哥一个深情的拥抱，然后两个孩子开始唧唧喳喳地聊起天来。"
G["Dornaa stands and gapes in awe at the immense Dark Portal."]="多尔南站在巨大的黑暗之门前，满怀敬畏地张大了嘴。"
G["Dornaa walks slowly and turns in reverence as a blessing is bestowed upon her by O'ros."]="多尔南缓缓走远。突然，她转过身来，带着敬畏的神情注视着对她施放了祝福的沃洛斯。"
G["Dornaa!!!"]="多尔南！！！"
G["Dornaa's jaw nearly hits the ground at the sight of Zaladormu."]="多尔南在看到扎拉多姆时，下巴几乎都要碰到地上了。"
G["Double Pelt!"]="双中！"
G["Double fortune to you, $r.\n\nIf you are looking for a lucky charm, I can help set you right up."]="祝你好运连连，$r。\n\n如果你在找好运符，我马上就能让你如愿以偿。"
G["Double or nothing on the next group?"]="给下一组双倍加注？"
G["Double or nothing!"]="双倍加注！"
G["Double time!"]="快跑！"
G["Double your efforts! Get this wood piled up and ready for shipment to New Avalon!"]="加把劲儿！将木材堆放入舱，准备运往新阿瓦隆！"
G["Double your efforts! King Ymiron will awaken and then he will ascend!"]="加倍努力！伊米隆国王很快就要苏醒了，接着他将登上王座！"
G["Double your efforts! The final assault draws near!"]="再加把劲儿！总攻就要开始了！"
G["Doubt is for the weak! Do not question your strength, Ishi. We will survive because we must! The Horde will prevail!"]="弱者的猜忌！不要怀疑你的力量，伊什。我们必须撑过去！部落必胜！"
G["Doubtless they are incensed by my meddling with their fragile little homes."]="毫无疑问，他们生气了，因为我碰了一下他们脆弱的小家园。"
G["Down goes Frazier!  Down goes Frazier! Down goes...huh?  That Wasn't Frazier?"]="弗雷瑟倒下去啦！弗雷瑟倒下去啦！弗雷瑟……嗯？那不是弗雷瑟？"
G["Down goes Frazier!  Down goes Frazier! Down goes...huh?  That wasn't Frazier?"]="弗雷瑟倒下去啦！弗雷瑟倒下去啦！弗雷瑟……嗯？那不是弗雷瑟？"
G["Down the free brew and pelt the Guzzlers with your mug!"]="如果你想要更多的啤酒，把酒杯丢给黑铁酒鬼就行啦！"
G["Down this way. Use caution, friends. I sense Naralex stirs in his troubled sleep...."]="这边走。小心点，朋友。我感觉到纳拉雷克斯正在被噩梦折磨……"
G["Down wit de Kor'kron!"]="给库卡隆陪葬吧！"
G["Down with the king!"]="打倒国王！"
G["Down you go!"]="躺下吧！"
G["Down! Everybody down!"]="降落！全体降落！"
G["Down! Everyone, down!"]="降落！全体降落！"
G["Down, pup."]="躺下吧，小崽子。"
G["Doyo'da places a Resistance Totem to aid you!"]="多尤达放置了一个抗性图腾来协助你！"
G["Dozens of pilots were shot down further to the north, including one of our own SI:7 agents.\n\nWe've got to help all of 'em, but we've got to deal with the Horde, first."]="有许多飞行员都被击落在北方，其中一位是我们军情七处的特工。\n\n我们必须帮助他们，但首先得解决这些部落。"
G["Dr. Boom's Bots are attacking!  Stop them!"]="砰砰博士的机器人开始进攻了！阻止他们！"
G["Draenei dog! Did you know that the one you call Saruan wept like a babe as I beat him? A feeling of euphoria coursed through me, knowing that I had a member of high rank in my grasp. Were it not for Sironas' plans for him, I would have tortured him to death... As I do to all draenei that I capture. Alas, I am certain that you will see him again soon..."]="德莱尼败狗！你们知不知道，你们那个叫撒鲁安的同伴，当我痛打他的时候，他就像个婴儿一样哭泣？一种快乐的感觉传遍我的全身，因为我可以随意处置一个高阶的德莱尼人！若不是为了希隆娜丝的计划，我早就把他折磨至死了……就像我对所有德莱尼俘虏所做的那样。哈，但我相信你们很快就能再见到他……"
G["Draenei filth will not last on this world..."]="肮脏的德莱尼人不会在这个世界上活太久了……"
G["Draenei forces and their Alliance allies are engaged with the Horde in the Eye of the Storm in Outland. Will you join them in an effort to turn the tide of battle in our favor?"]="德莱尼部队和联盟友军正与部落在外域的风暴之眼交战。你会加入他们，为我们扭转战局吗？"
G["Draenei have come back! This group jumped two of my best wolf riders as they were out patrolling the western roads. Needless to say, we were victorious in that skirmish.\n\nNow I'm not sure what's going on but from what my scouts tell me, there are blood elves and draenei all over Halaa. I'm no blood elf lover but if it's one thing I hate it's a draenei. If you see draenei or any of their allies at Halaa, be sure to put a boot in their backsides for me.\n\nHalaa's to the west... In case you want to go now."]="德莱尼人又来了！他们偷袭了我们两名正在西边道路上巡逻的狼骑兵。不用说，我们赢了。\n\n现在我不确定发生了什么，但据我的斥候说，哈兰到处都是血精灵和德莱尼人。我不喜欢血精灵，至于德莱尼人，我恨死他们了。如果你在哈兰看到德莱尼人或是任何他们的盟友，就帮我狠狠教训他们。\n\n如果你现在就要去……哈兰就在西面。"
G["Draenei... And because of this, I am neither. Not orc, not draenei. My own kind are a rare breed. Most having been killed decades ago... I live because of my strength of will."]="德莱尼人……因为这个，我既不是兽人又不是德莱尼人。我的血统是非常稀有的，同族们大部分在十年前都已经被杀了……我凭借我的意志活了下来。"
G["Dragon filth! Guards! Guards! Seize this monster!"]="龙！卫兵！卫兵！抓住这个怪物！"
G["Dragon!  Hear me out!  I am Maximillian of Northshire, and I have come to deliver you.  Your blood shall fill..."]="恶龙！听我说！我是北郡的麦斯米兰。我将对你进行正义的审判。你必死无疑……"
G["Dragon's Mouth was established to give the Alliance their first real foothold here in the Badlands.  Despite its position between Stormwind and Dun Morogh, the Badlands have traditionally been Horde territory.\n\nIf that's ever to change, we need to start asserting ourselves.  Of course, the dragon attacks on New Kargath don't hurt our cause either."]="巨龙峡口是联盟在荒芜之地建立的第一个立足点。虽然荒芜之地位于暴风城和丹莫罗中间，但在传统上，它一直是部落的势力范围。\n\n现在这一情况已经发生了改变，我们需要确立自己的权属地位。当然，那头龙对新卡加斯的进攻也不会干扰我们的计划。"
G["Dragon, you will do as I command! Catch me!"]="巨龙，听从我的命令！接住我！"
G["Dragonhawk"]="龙鹰"
G["Dragonhawk Master"]="龙鹰管理员"
G["Dragonhawk incoming from the west!  Shoot that $c down!"]="¡Dracohalcón acercándose por el Oeste! ¡Derribad a $Gese:esa:c; $c!"
G["Dragonhawks, if raised properly, are really quite tame.  Don't you think that is fascinating?  To be so friendly and companionable if raised right and so vicious and deadly in the wild...I just love them so much."]="龙鹰在适当饲养的情况下是非常容易被驯服的。你不觉得那是十分迷人的吗？饲养正确的话是如此的友好，而野生龙鹰又是如此的凶猛和致命……我太喜欢它们了。"
G["Dragonmaw attack! Protect the High Shaman."]="龙喉兽人进攻了！保护高阶萨满祭司。"
G["Dragonmaw clan, retake the docks and push them into the sea!  In the name of Hellscream and the True Horde!"]="龙喉氏族，夺回码头，把他们赶到海里去！以地狱咆哮和正统部落的名义！"
G["Dragonmaw reinforcements have arrived!"]="龙喉援军到了！"
G["Dragonmaw, advance!"]="龙喉氏族，前进！"
G["Dragonqueen... Life-Binder... preserve... me."]="女王陛下……生命的缚誓者……请保护……我。"
G["Dragonriders mount up!"]="龙骑士，准备起飞！"
G["Dragons are dangerous at any size, as I'm sure you'll find out."]="龙无论大小都是非常危险的，我一定会让你明白这一点的。"
G["Dragons are no mere beasts, like hogs or cattle. They are a force of nature. Powerful... Primal.\n\nTo bend them to your will is to harness the world.\n\nTo take up their reigns is to take destiny into your hands."]="龙并不是猪和牛那样简单的野兽。他们是一种自然的力量。强大……原始的力量。\n\n让他们服从你，就是要驾驭这个世界。\n\n能够支配他们，你也就支配了命运的力量。"
G["Dragons controlling orcs!? SQUAWK!"]="龙控制着兽人！？不会吧！"
G["Drain the girl! Drain her power until there is nothing but a vacant shell!"]="抽取她的力量！抽空她，直到她只剩下一具空空的躯壳为止！"
G["Drain... life!"]="抽取……生命！"
G["Drak'Tharon be lost, mon!"]="达克萨隆要塞失守了！"
G["Draka's Fury."]="德拉卡的狂怒。"
G["Drake incoming! OPEN FIRE!"]="龙来了！开火！"
G["Drakes is my business, $n. I'm authorized to sell them to our highest ranking officers."]="我是做幼龙生意的，$n。我得到授权，向最高阶的军官们出售虚空幼龙。"
G["Drakkari Empire gunna prevail! Da Scourge gunna die... again."]="达卡莱帝国必胜！天灾军团将再次……全军覆没。"
G["Drakkari Warrior, huh?  We'll see how much of a warrior you are when you fight Ironhide."]="达卡莱战士，嗯？让我们瞧瞧你在面对铁皮时，能展现出怎样的英勇气概。"
G["Drakkari forces pour from the Drakkari Tribal Door!"]="达卡莱大军从达卡莱部族之门中涌出！"
G["Drakkari gonna kill anybody who tressspasss on these landsss!"]="一切胆敢践踏这片土地的入侵者都将被达卡莱巨魔消灭！"
G["Drakkari tribe, show them the might of the frozen North!"]="达卡莱部族，让他们看看北地的冰封之力！"
G["Drakkari, this will not stop us from stealing the power of your wild gods. We will take it from them directly, or from you if you've already killed them; it matters not."]="达卡莱巨魔，别以为这样就能阻挠我们攫取狂野之神的力量。除非你们早已杀掉了这些所谓的神灵，否则他们的力量终将归我们所有。"
G["Drakuru casts his gaze down on Drak'Tharon Keep."]="达库鲁凝视着达克萨隆要塞。"
G["Drakuru casts his gaze down on Drak'Tharon Keep...."]="达库鲁将目光投向达克萨隆要塞……"
G["Drat!  This bloodthistle extract doesn't seem to want to combine properly with my poison.  I'll not be deterred - those trolls will be dealt with!  Perhaps a different mixture?"]="该死的！这些血蓟看上去没法完美地与我的毒液混合。我不会就此停止的，那些巨魔们一定会被解决掉的！也许需要换一种混合方式？"
G["Drat, how am I supposed to run the family noodle cart if I don't know our family recipe?"]="真该死，没有了祖传秘方，我要怎么把祖传的面摊经营下去啊？"
G["Draw out their suffering, death knight!"]="让他们从痛苦中解脱吧，死亡骑士！"
G["Draw them back to us, and we'll assist you."]="把他们引到这里来。我们会支援你。"
G["Draw yer own steel, ye harpy-lovin' scoundrel!"]="管好你自己吧，你这专爱鹰身人的无赖！"
G["Draw! No winner."]="平局！不分胜负。"
G["Drawing from reserve power."]="抽取备用能量。"
G["Dread rises! It seeks the light. It hungers."]="恐惧升腾！它循光而去。它在渴望。"
G["Dreadguard, hold your line.  Halt the advance of those Scourge!"]="恐怖卫士，守住防线！阻止天灾军继续前进！"
G["Dreadlord"]="恐惧魔王"
G["Dreadlords?  Perhaps you mean Lord Banehollow.  He sends his regards, and has a message for you..."]="恐惧魔王？你是说魔王贝恩霍勒。他向你问好，并有消息给你……"
G["Dreadmaw! You shall pay dearly, trespasser..."]="恐惧之喉！你会付出昂贵的代价，入侵者……"
G["Dreams?"]="是梦境吗？"
G["Drek'Thar is defeated!  The Alliance is victorious... for now.\n\nSpeak with our quartermaster and aid in our reconstruction."]="德雷克塔尔被击败了！联盟胜利了……至少现在是胜利了。\n\n和我们的军需官谈谈兵帮助我们的重建。"
G["Drek'Thar is the military and spiritual leader of the Frostwolf Clan in Alterac, leading his brethren from Frostwolf Keep.\n\nIf he is defeated then the Horde forces in Alterac will crumble."]="Drek'Thar es el líder militar y espiritual del clan Lobo Gélido en Alterac, lidera a los suyos desde el Bastión Lobo Gélido.\n\nSi le derrotamos, las tropas de la Horda en Alterac se desmoronarán."
G["Drek'Thar is the military and spiritual leader of the Frostwolf Clan in Alterac, leading his brethren from Frostwolf Keep.\n\nIf he is defeated then the Horde forces in Alterac will crumble.\n\nDrek'Thar has been slain."]="德雷克塔尔是奥特兰克霜狼氏族的军事和精神领袖。在奥特兰克的时候他领导着霜狼城堡的兄弟们作战。\n\n如果他被打败，奥特兰克的部落军队将溃不成军，但是现在他只会在下属加尔范上尉死后露面。\n\n德雷克塔尔现在在霜狼城堡里。"
G["Drek'Thar is the military and spiritual leader of the Frostwolf Clan in Alterac, leading his brethren from Frostwolf Keep.\n\nIf he is defeated then the Horde forces in Alterac will crumble.\n\nDrek'Thar is not currently in Alterac Valley."]="德雷克塔尔是奥特兰克霜狼氏族的军事和精神领袖。在奥特兰克的时候他领导着霜狼城堡的兄弟们作战。\n\n如果他被打败，奥特兰克的部落军队将溃不成军，但是现在他只会在下属加尔范上尉死后露面。\n\n德雷克塔尔已经被杀死了。"
G["Drek'Thar, I'm coming for you!"]="德雷克塔尔，我来了！"
G["Drek'Thar, forever loyal to our people. Spirits bless you, old friend. This is your home too, please make yourself comfortable."]="Drek'Thar, siempre fiel a nuestro pueblo. Que los espíritus te bendigas, viejo amigo. Haz como en tu casa. Eres $gbienvenido:bienvenida;."
G["Drink Kaja'Cola!"]="喝点卡亚可乐吧！"
G["Drink and be merry!"]="喝吧，喝了以后一切都会变美好的！"
G["Drink deep my brothers!"]="兄弟，干杯！"
G["Drink for the Horde!"]="为了部落，干杯！"
G["Drink from this vial, and the fog will be cleared for a short time. Go with the spirits, my friend."]="Bebe de este vial y la niebla se disipará durante un rato. Ve con los espíritus, $gamigo:amiga;."
G["Drink in moderation, then, my dwarven friend, but you may want to turn in your lance and reins for the time being. Go with the Light."]="Bebe con moderación entonces, amig$go:a; enan$go:a;, aunque quizás quieras devolver tu lanza y tus riendas de momento. Ve con la Luz."
G["Drink in my blood and be reborn as worgen, immune to the depravity of the Forsaken."]="喝下我的血，作为狼人重生，只有这样才不会堕落成为被遗忘者。"
G["Drink in their misery, brother!"]="以他们的痛苦为乐趣吧！"
G["Drink it all boys!"]="孩子们，喝光它！"
G["Drink or be gone!"]="要么饮酒，要么滚开！"
G["Drink this, Zahlia.  It is not as potent as I'd hoped, but perhaps it will help."]="喝下这个，萨恩莉亚。那不像我希望的那样有效，但也许会有点帮助。"
G["Drink this, it will help."]="把这个喝了，它对你有好处。"
G["Drink this, you blue brute!  Disobey me and I promise you a slow, painful death!"]="喝下这个，你这个蓝色的野蛮人！否则我保证会把你折磨致死！"
G["Drink this. It has a bit of a kick."]="把这个喝下去。后劲儿有点大。"
G["Drink time!"]="畅饮的时刻到了！"
G["Drink up to begin, friend."]="先把酒喝了，朋友。"
G["Drink up!"]="干杯！"
G["Drink up!  There's more where that came from!"]="喝光它！我们还有很多酒！"
G["Drink up, $p. I wanna see that vial empty before you so much as dip a toe into the sea."]="喝下去，$p。在你把脚趾头伸进海里之前，我要看那瓶子变空。"
G["Drink up, boys!"]="干杯，伙计们！"
G["Drink up, ye scurvy mongrels!"]="喝光啊，你真不够意思！"
G["Drink your blood. Eat your flesh."]="喝你的血。吃你的肉。"
G["Drink, Tink! Drink, Tink! Drink, Tink!"]="喝呀，一口干！喝呀，一口干！喝呀，一口干！"
G["Drink, mortals!  Taste my blood!  Taste your death!"]="喝吧！尝尝我的鲜血！尝尝死亡的滋味！"
G["Drinking"]="喝水中"
G["Drinking a healing potion!  I won't be able to use another one for a while!"]="我刚喝下一瓶治疗药水！暂时无法再使用药水了！"
G["Drinking ain't so nice on an empty stomach. Give a jinyu something to eat, eh?"]="胃里空空，光喝可不解饱。给锦鱼人来点吃的吧，好吗？"
G["Drinking is not guarding."]="喝酒可不是守卫的职责。"
G["Drinking is tiring work... Time to fish!  Wait, that's not right... Fishing is boring work, time to drink!"]="喝酒是个累人的活儿……快来钓鱼吧！等等，我说反了……钓鱼是个无聊的活儿，快来喝几杯吧！"
G["Drinks!"]="干杯！"
G["Drinks, here! Delicious drinks! From snowplum brandy to Westfall bourbon... get your drinks!"]="美酒应有尽有！从雪梅白兰地到西部荒野威士忌，快来买啊！"
G["Dripping and pouring and clotting!"]="滴血吧，飙血吧，凝血吧！"
G["Drive some circles around'm!"]="围着他们转圈！"
G["Drive the invaders out!  For Queen Angerboda!"]="将入侵者驱逐出去！为安格博达女王而战！"
G["Drive them back!"]="把他们赶回去！"
G["Drive them back! Back to Darnassus!"]="把他们赶回去！赶回到达纳苏斯！"
G["Drive them out! We take none alive!"]="把他们干掉！不要留下一个活口！"
G["Drive these brutes from the vale!"]="把这些畜生从山谷里赶出去！"
G["Drive this scum back into the woods!"]="把这个混蛋赶回到森林里去！"
G["Drive this scum from the Vrykul homeland!"]="把这些蝼蚁赶出维库人的家园！"
G["Driver, I hear you single handedly airlifted our villagers out of this hell-hole. Is that true?"]="听说你独自一人就将村民们空运到安全地带，使他们免受苦难的折磨。是真的吗？"
G["Drogar, destroy them!"]="卓戈，消灭他们！"
G["Drohn's Distillery has the best brew money can buy!  They were voted \"Outstanding Brew\" by Monthly Goblin Brew!"]="¡La Destilería de Drohn tiene la mejor cerveza que el dinero puede comprar! ¡Fueron elegidos \"cerveza excepcional\" por el suplemento cervecero goblin!"
G["Drohn's Distillery knows how to party hard!  Check them out at Brewfest!"]="德罗恩的酿酒厂可以让你尽享欢乐！来美酒节尝尝吧！"
G["Drohn's brew is the stuff legends are made of!  Come taste the legend!"]="德罗恩的美酒简直是个传说！过来尝尝传说中的美酒吧！"
G["Drone things not as tough as they look. Wasp things a bit nastier."]="雄蜂只是外表凶悍而已，其实很容易对付的。巨蜂就比较麻烦一点。"
G["Drop point check commencing!"]="开始检查投掷点！"
G["Drop the hammer!"]="制胜锤拳！"
G["Drop your weapon and surrender, traitor."]="Suelta el arma y ríndete, $gtraidor:traidora;."
G["Dropping a coin down the well, Lissan looks around to see if anyone noticed."]="莉丝安向井中扔下一枚硬币，然后环顾四周观察着是否有人注意到她。"
G["Dropping. Good luck, boys!"]="我下去啦。祝你们好运！"
G["Drown in Shadow!"]="被暗影淹没！"
G["Drown in fear!"]="湮没在你的恐惧中吧！"
G["Drown in terror."]="淹溺在恐惧中吧。"
G["Drown in your own failure."]="溺死在你的失败中吧。"
G["Druid"]="德鲁伊"
G["Druid?  Ah... Shalannius, you seek Shalannius.  You shall find this night elf outside of the Exodar, near Valaar's Berth."]="德鲁伊？啊……沙兰尤斯，你在找沙兰尤斯吧。你可以在埃索达的外面找到这个暗夜精灵，就在瓦拉尔港口附近。"
G["Druid? No one here follows that path... but I believe I heard of someone matching that description near the Exodar. Shalannius, I think?"]="德鲁伊？这里没人学习那种知识……但是我听说埃索达附近有些人很符合你的描述。好像是叫沙兰尤斯？"
G["Druids and your silly shapeshifting. Lets see it in action!"]="德鲁伊和你们愚蠢的变形法术。让我们看看有什么事情会发生吧！"
G["Druids are very sensitive to the plight of all creatures of the world. When it was found that these birds were in danger, we set up a system of rescuing them from the corruption of Feralas.\n\nA gnome named Curgle Cranklehop leads the affair; she collects the eggs and has them sent here, where I care for them.\n\nWe could always use more help for our cause, $n. Maybe you should head over to Gadgetzan and look for Curgle."]="Los druidas son muy sensibles a las dificultades que padecen todas las criaturas del mundo. Cuando se descubrió que estas aves corrían peligro, ideamos un sistema para rescatarlas de la descomposición de Feralas.\n\nUna gnoma llamada Curgle Saltamanivela se ocupa del asunto. Recoge los huevos y los envía hasta aquí y yo me encargo de cuidarlos.\n\nPodríamos buscar más ayuda para nuestra causa, $n. Tal vez deberías dirigirte a Gadgetzan y buscar a Curgle."
G["Druids can sometimes be so serious, but I'm a real party animal.  Yes, that was a joke.  You should laugh.  Now."]="大多数德鲁伊都很古板，不过我是个例外，我是个真正的聚会动物。我的笑话说完了。你该笑了。"
G["Druids, hold your fire! She is unarmed!"]="德鲁伊们，停止攻击！她没有武器！"
G["Druids?  I haven't seen any druids around here.  Although I am sure that in Stormwind you could find one.  You should ask a guard in Stormwind."]="德鲁伊？我在这里从没有见过德鲁伊。不过我相信，你能在暴风城找到他们。你应该问问暴风城的卫兵。"
G["Druids?  I haven't seen any druids around here.  Although there is a district in Stormwind that the night elves have made their own."]="德鲁伊？我没看到过任何德鲁伊。不过在暴风城中有一块属于暗夜精灵的区域。"
G["Drums of War"]="战争之鼓"
G["Dual Specialization allows you to keep two active Class Specialization, Talent, and Glyph sets and easily switch between them.\nYou also will have separate glyph panes and action bars for each set.\nSwitching between the two sets cannot be done while in combat and will consume your available resources."]="La doble especialización te permite mantener activas dos especializaciones de clase, talentos y glifos. Podrás cambiar fácilmente entre estas dos especializaciones.\n\nTendrás acceso también a un segundo panel de glifos y a un segundo conjunto de barras de acción.\n\nEl cambio no puede efectuarse en combate, y consumirás tus recursos disponibles."
G["Duarn - excellent work.  Do not dally long within Nespirah's shell.  You know as well as I do the dangers posed by an angry demigod."]="达鲁——做得好。别在奈瑟匹拉的壳里耽搁太久。你跟我都清楚由愤怒的半神带来的危险。"
G["Duck!"]="蹲下！"
G["Due to incompatibility on your class specification, I am unable to help you rectify any situation you have with lack of ability."]="由于职业的不同，因此我对你缺乏技能的现状无能为力。"
G["Due to the, ah, \"misunderstanding\" in Dragonblight, we've had to relocate our facilities to this decrepit mess of a castle.\n\nStill, we've now plenty of space and time to work on various new and lovely... products..."]="Debido a un, eh, \"malentendido\" en el Cementerio de Dragones hemos tenido que trasladar nuestras instalaciones a este castillo decrépito.\n\nAunque ahora tendremos espacio de sobra para trabajar en nuevos y encantadores... productos..."
G["Dugar is alive! I can make out an arakkoa pacing back and forth in front of him, asking him the same questions over and over. There is another, too, a human..."]="杜加尔还活着！我看到一个鸦人在他的面前来回走动，反复地问着他相同的问题。还有另一个人，一个人类……"
G["Duglas send you over to get roughed up?"]="道格拉斯就派你过来挨揍了？"
G["Duke of Cynders! I hold your signet!  Heed my call!"]="灰烬公爵！我手中握着你的徽记！响应我的召唤吧！"
G["Duke of Fathoms! I hold your signet!  Heed my call!"]="深渊公爵！我手中握着你的徽记！响应我的召唤吧！"
G["Duke of Shards! I hold your signet!  Heed my call!"]="碎石公爵！我手中握着你的徽记！响应我的召唤吧！"
G["Duke of Zephyrs! I hold your signet!  Heed my call!"]="微风公爵！我手中握着你的徽记！响应我的召唤吧！"
G["Dulvi is the woman you want. She trains new prospects in the middle of the Watch."]="去找杜尔维。她在岗哨的中间传授着勘测矿藏的技能。"
G["Dumb big-tongue lover! You not friend of Frenzyheart no more. Frenzyheart will get you good."]="你竟然和大舌头怪搅和在一起！你不再是狂心氏族的朋友了。狂心狼獾人要让你尝尝厉害！"
G["Dumb puppy-men messed up the shrine! Boo! Make it stop!"]="狗狗人把祭坛搞得一团糟！讨厌！快阻止他们！"
G["Dumb puppy-men! We tried to be nice! You got it coming now!"]="愚蠢的狗狗人！我们不想打架的！你们却偏偏跑来送死！"
G["Dumb slave thing keep fighitng... Goregek going to not get butt kicked more now."]="愚蠢的奴隶，继续战斗……格利基克不想再挨打了。"
G["Dumb slave thing supposed to kill things, not let things kill Goregek!"]="愚蠢的奴隶应该消灭敌人，确保格利基克的生命安全！"
G["Dumb! Don't shoot at it! Gekgek want trophy in one piece!"]="笨蛋！停止射击！格利基克想要完整的战利品！"
G["Dumpling presser.\n\n<Vu sighs.>"]="滚汤团啊。\n\n<吴暮叹息着。>"
G["Dun Baldar is in very bad shape, and we're very low on supplies to rebuild it.  The Alliance needs your help gathering supplies!"]="丹巴达尔破坏严重，要修复的话，我们还需要大量物资供给。联盟需要你的帮助！"
G["Dun Baldar is the strongest point of Alliance power in Alterac Valley.  Nestled in the northern reaches of the valley, Dun Baldar is the staging ground  for all advances to the south.\n\nDun Baldar was razed and is under reconstruction."]="丹巴达尔是联盟在奥特兰克军力最强的地方。位于山谷北部的丹巴达尔是通往南部的军事要塞。\n\n丹巴达尔已经被夷为平地，正在重建。"
G["Dun Baldar is the strongest point of Alliance power in Alterac Valley.  Nestled in the northern reaches of the valley, Dun Baldar is the staging ground for all advances to the south.\n\nDun Baldar is intact."]="丹巴达尔是联盟在奥特兰克军力最强的地方。位于山谷北部的丹巴达尔是通往南部的军事要塞。\n\n丹巴达尔现在完好无损。"
G["Dun Baldar took a real beating in the last Horde attack!  We need more supplies in order to rebuild and make repairs!"]="丹巴达尔在部落的最后一次进攻中给了我们狠狠一击！我们需要物资重建基地！"
G["Dun worry about me $G lad:lass;. I've thought for a long time that age would claim me... I'm glad I was wrong. Dun let these iron dwarves find what they're looking for."]="No te preocupes por mi $gmuchacho:muchacha;. Siempre he pensado que la edad acabaría conmigo... me alegro de haberme equivocado. No dejes que estos enanos férreos encuentren lo que están buscando."
G["Duncan's Textiles employs one of the finest tailors in Stormwind, Georgio Bolero. Look for the shop over in the Mage Quarter."]="邓肯雇佣了暴风城最好的裁缝，乔吉奥·波利罗。他的店就坐落在法师区里。"
G["Dunce."]="蠢货。"
G["Dunna' be judgin' too quickly, ya? Dis lil' trinket be exactly what ya looking for, smeller man."]="别那么快下结论，好吗？这个小玩意儿绝对就是你在找的东西，伙计。"
G["Duokna, what are you doing?"]="多克纳，你在干什么？"
G["Duokna... this is embarrassing."]="多克纳……这太难堪了。"
G["Durak, I have lost my disguise!"]="杜莱克，我失去了伪装！"
G["During Hallow's End we celebrate the day that the Banshee Queen herself delivered us from the clutches of the Lich King and the Scourge. Be sure to attend the Wickerman Festival that is held each evening outside Undercity."]="我们在万圣节上狂欢，纪念女妖之王将我们从巫妖王和天灾军团的魔掌中解救出来。每晚在幽暗城外都会举办稻草人晚会，记得参加哦。"
G["During a full moon, the sprite darters in The Woods of The Lost in Jade forest are known to shed their scales. They do it late at night and it's actually beautiful to see. \n \n Their scales glow with a bright jade light and fleck off into the water. This attracts Jade Lungfish like you wouldn't believe! Like moths to the light! \n \n Careful not to disturb those mogu, though... they ain't exactly the friendly type."]="在满月期间，翡翠林的失落林地里的小精龙就会蜕鳞。这一般都发生在夜间，那个景象非常美丽。\n \n它们的鳞片会闪着明亮的翠绿光芒撒入水中。这会吸引到大量的翠绿肺鱼，数量之多绝对超乎你的想象！就像扑火的飞蛾一样！\n \n但你要小心别惊动了那里的魔古族……他们可不太友好。"
G["During my stay in the dream I made a vital discovery. The rift that weakens the boundaries of this world has hastened the return of powerful allies."]="在梦境中，我有了一个重大的发现。那道削弱世界边际的裂隙如今加快了强大盟友的归来。"
G["During that fight, I thought of a great new brew."]="在那场对决中，我想出了一种伟大的新配方。"
G["During the Day of the Dead, people gather in graveyards to celebrate with and cherish the spirits of those they have lost.\n\nYou can find the festivities in the cemeteries of any major city, where you'll be able to cook, dance, don costumes, and more."]="在悼念日，人们会聚集在墓地，追忆、告慰那些逝者的亡魂。\n\n届时任何主城的墓地都会举行这个仪式，在那里有悼念日食品、舞蹈、化装聚会和其他活动。"
G["During the Lunar Festival, we should take time to seek out our elders and consider their wisdom."]="在春节期间，我们应该花时间来寻找我们的长者，思考他们的智慧。"
G["During the War of the Ancients, the demigod Agamaggan came forth to battle the Burning Legion. The colossal boar was defeated, and over time in the areas where his blood fell, massive thorn-ridden vines sprouted to life. The quilboar came to occupy these regions and hold them sacred. The heart of these massive thorn-colonies is the Razorfen. Razorfen Kraul was conquered by the crone, Charlga Razorflank, who some speculate has been negotiating with agents of the Scourge for some insidious purpose."]="在一万年前的上古战争中，强大的半神阿迦玛甘和燃烧军团进行了激战。虽然这头巨大的野猪在战斗中倒下了，但是他的努力最终令艾泽拉斯免遭涂炭。很久之后，在它血液流淌过的地方长出了巨大的荆棘藤蔓。那些被认为是半神后代的野猪人占领了这些地区，并将其奉为圣地。这些荆棘地的中心被称为剃刀岭，而巨大的剃刀沼泽则被一个老丑婆卡尔加·刺肋所占据。在她的统治下，信奉萨满教的野猪人和其他的部族为敌。有些人甚至猜测卡尔加还在和亡灵天灾有来往——她想要联合亡灵天灾以达到一些不可告人的险恶目的。"
G["During the flight, I shared a tender moment with the attractive human."]="我一边飞翔，一边与那个诱人的人类度过了温柔的一刻。"
G["During the flight, I shared a tender moment with the grateful young night elf."]="我一边飞翔，一边与那个优雅的暗夜精灵度过了温柔的一刻。"
G["During the flight, I shared a tender moment with the lovely orc."]="我一边飞翔，一边与那个可爱的兽人度过了温柔的一刻。"
G["During the flight, I shared a tender moment with the strapping blood elf."]="我一边飞翔，一边与那个窈窕的血精灵度过了温柔的一刻。"
G["During the full moon of the Lunar Festival, we celebrate the light of Elune."]="当春节满月的时候，我们为月神之光而庆祝。"
G["During your battles with the Scourge in Naxxramas, should you come across desecrated battlements and wartorn plate scraps, return them to me and I shall craft for you a piece of this armor worn by heroes."]="在你与纳克萨玛斯内的天灾军团士兵作战时，顺便也可以收集一些被玷污的护甲和板甲碎片，把它们带回来交给我，我可以用这些材料来为你重铸一套属于往昔英雄的铠甲。"
G["Duro will be reinforced!  Ultris was a complete disaster.  I will NOT have that mistake repeated!"]="杜隆必须得到增援！乌提斯完全是个灾难。我不允许这种错误重演！"
G["Durotan's Fury."]="杜隆坦的狂怒。"
G["Durtham Greldon over in The Forlorn Cavern can teach ye the in's and out's of lockpicking.  Just don't be practicing any of those in's or out's here in Ironforge, if ye understand my meaning."]="荒弃的洞穴的杜尔萨姆·格雷顿能教你开锁的种种技能。要是你明白我的意思，就别在铁炉堡练习这些技能。"
G["Dusk approaches! Tremble in fear!"]="暮色降临！在恐惧中战栗吧！"
G["Dust falls from the guardian as it begins to crack."]="守护者开始碎裂，大量灰尘簌簌而落。"
G["Dust off that luckydo, because you're gonna need it. It's Grandpa Grumplefloot!"]="擦亮你的幸运符吧，你会用得上它的。接下来进场的是，老爹土笛子！"
G["Dust to dust."]="尘归尘，土归土。"
G["Duyi the Fish Snack! Hah!"]="杜宇是鱼食！哈哈！"
G["Dwarf & Gnome"]="矮人和侏儒"
G["Dwarf Construction Complete!"]="矮人建筑建造完毕！"
G["Dwarf Construction Site Under Attack!"]="矮人建筑营地遭到攻击！"
G["Dwarf Gossip NPC - Periodic Talk (Expansion Prologue) 01"]="PNJ enano cotilla - Charla periódica (prólogo de la expansión) 01"
G["Dwarf... strange creature..."]="矮人……奇怪的生物……"
G["Dwarven District Auction House"]="矮人区拍卖行"
G["Dwarven District Bank"]="矮人区银行"
G["Dwarven District Hunter Trainer"]="矮人区猎人训练师"
G["Dwarven District Inn"]="矮人区旅店"
G["Dwarven District Stable Master"]="矮人区兽栏管理员"
G["Dwarves don't get drunk, $g mister:missy;. I'm just a little sloppy.\n\nAnyhow, Windsor? I figure he's somewhere in Blackrock Depths. That's the Dark Iron city for you unedumecated peoples."]="矮人可不会喝醉，$g先生:小姐;。我只是有些邋遢。\n\n无论如何，温德索尔？我猜他在黑石深渊的某处。对你们这些未受教化的家伙来说，就是一座黑铁矮人的城市。"
G["Dwarves will spin around leaving their backs open for attack at times. Take this opportunity to strike like this..."]="有时，矮人会在把武器抡圆的过程中将背部暴露出来。利用这个机会像这样打下去……"
G["Dwarves!!!  Now you're telling me that dwarves originally came from the Earthen?!"]="矮人！！难道矮人是起源于土灵的？！"
G["Dwarves. In. Space!"]="星·际·矮·人！"
G["Dwarves..."]="矮人……"
G["Dying for one's country is a soldier's duty.  But if calling this war folly is treason, then I'm a traitor."]="为国家牺牲是军人的职责。如果将这场战争称为闹剧就算是叛国的话，那我就是一名十足的叛徒了。"
G["Dying must have completely destroyed your ability to perform simple arithmetic. Can't you see that there is no way you're going to make that structure's layout work? It'll collapse!"]="你是不是衰老得连基本的算术都不会了。你难道没看出来，建筑物的设计思路根本就有问题吗？照你的方案，它肯定会倒塌！"
G["Dying... See the light... gloriouss..."]="濒临死亡……看那光……多显赫……"
G["Dyslix, I need to get to New Thalanaar!"]="德斯利克，我要前往新萨兰纳尔！"
G["Dyslix, I need to get to Westreach Summit!"]="德斯利克，我要前往西岸峰！"
G["Dyvuun, is that you?"]="戴维恩，是你吗？"
G["E'ko is da power dat each creatures possesses. Da charm I made for ya allows you ta capture it in a physical manifestation.\n\nI know an incantation dat can transform da e'ko you find, and turn it into juju.\n\nYou can den take the Cache of Mau'ari, an' use it ta reflect da power of da juju onto yourself.\n\nC'mon, give it a try. Bring da e'ko ta Mau'ari an' we have some fun."]="E'ko es el poder que poseen todas las criaturas. El talismán que he hecho para ti te permitirá capturarlo en una manifestación física.\n\nConozco un encantamiento que puede transformar el E'ko que encuentres y convertirlo en Juju.\n\nEntonces podrás coger el Alijo de Mau'ari y utilizarlo para reflejar el poder del Juju sobre ti $gmismo:misma;.\n\nVenga, dale una oportunidad. Trae el E'ko a Mau'ari y nos divertiremos."
G["E'ko is da unfocused form of the supernatural power, and Juju is da concentrated essence. By using a stong incantation, I can transform da E'ko into Juju.  Once it becomes Juju, you can den use the Cache of Mau'ari ta reflect da powers onto yourself."]="魂精是超自然力量的一种尚未汇聚起来的形态，而魂能则是浓缩的精华。通过使用一种强大的咒语，我可以把魂精变成魂能。一旦它变成魂能，你就可以使用玛艾里的容器把能量反射到你自己身上。"
G["ED-210 online!"]="ED-210来啦！"
G["EEEEEEEEEEE! RUN AWAY!"]="呃——！快跑！"
G["ELEC... TRICITY... GREATEST... WEAKNESS..."]="电……力……严重……不足……"
G["END IT! NOW! Before he can..."]="结果他！快！趁他还没有……"
G["ENOUGH - this ends now!  You fools will be added to my bone collection!"]="够了——结束吧！你们这些蠢货的骨头也将成为我的收藏品！"
G["ENOUGH OF THIS FARCE! You will feel PAIN, cowards!"]="我受够这场闹剧了！感受你们的痛苦吧，懦夫！"
G["ENOUGH TOYIN' AROUND!!!"]="不要再开玩笑了！！！"
G["ENOUGH!"]="够了！"
G["ENOUGH!  I will not give you the pleasure!"]="够了！你休想亲手杀死我！"
G["ENOUGH!  You got some BIG mojo, Vol'jin. Maybe you worth helpin' after all..."]="够了！沃金，你的魔精的确强大。也许你是值得帮助的……"
G["ENOUGH!  You tiny insects are not worthy to do battle within this sacred place!  You do not fight with honor!  You do not even ascend!"]="够了！你们这些爬虫也配在这片圣地上战斗！你们的战斗有何荣誉可言！别想战胜我！"
G["ENOUGH! I waste my time here. I must gather my strength on the homeworld."]="够了！我在这里浪费了不少时间，必须回到家乡去回复体力。"
G["ENOUGH! If you intend to reclaim Azeroth's magic, then you shall have it!"]="够了！既然你们这么想夺回艾泽拉斯的魔法，我就给你们！"
G["ENOUGH! It is time to end this game!"]="够了！该结束这场无聊的游戏了。"
G["ENOUGH! This ends now!"]="够了！了结这一切吧！"
G["ENOUGH!! There will be no more bloodshed today."]="够了！！今天已经流了太多的血。"
G["EVASIVE ACTION! MAN THE GUNS!"]="规避动作！炮火准备！"
G["EVEN IN THIS WEAKENED FORM, I WILL DESTROY YOU!!!"]="虽然被削弱了，我还是能摧毁你们！！！"
G["EVERYBODY LISTEN UP!"]="都给我听好了！！！"
G["EXECUTING GRATITUDE PROTOCOL."]="执行感谢协议。"
G["EXECUTING SAND EXTRACTION PROTOCOL."]="执行挖沙协议。"
G["EXTREME HOZEN-FU!"]="猴子偷桃！"
G["Each bodily injury endured, is a lesson learned. Each defeat, an opportunity to grow."]="每一次受伤，都是学习的过程。每一次失败，都是成长的机会。"
G["Each cycle, our young swarm their walls. The pandaren slay the weak. The strong return."]="每次轮回，我们年轻的虫群涌上长城。熊猫人杀光弱者。而强者得以返回。"
G["Each day we send off only enough warriors to hold the hozen at bay. Never enough to actually push them back."]="每天，我们派出的战士只能勉强阻挡住那些猢狲。我们的人手根本不足以发起反击。"
G["Each moment you tarry here, Quel'Delar drinks in the evil of this place."]="只要你留在这里，奎尔德拉就会汲取这里的邪能。"
G["Each time a Weeping Soul strikes you, you will lose a stack of Shadow Bait."]="每次你被泣灵击中，都将失去一层暗影诱饵。"
G["Each time he returned, more and more pandaren answered Liu Lang's call, and joined him on his growing turtle. They were the bravest among us: The explorers. The adventurers."]="他每次回来，都有更多的熊猫人响应刘浪的召唤，爬到那日渐拥挤的龟背上，与他同行。他们是勇敢的探险家，是冒险王。"
G["Each time you successfully trap a Weeping Soul, you will receive a stack of Shadow Bait."]="每次你成功地困住一个泣灵，都将得到一层暗影诱饵。"
G["Eager to defend his people, no matter the cost."]="带着宁死也要保护人民的决心……"
G["Eager to die, are we?"]="想死是吧？"
G["Eager to get to Northrend, are you? The steam-powered Kraken sails from here to Valiance Keep in Borean Tundra."]="想去诺森德，是吧？蒸汽动力船“海怪号”将载你前往北风苔原的无畏要塞。"
G["Earth Mother be merciful!"]="愿大地母亲怜悯！"
G["Earth Mother, into your arms we give one of our own. She is Unaya Hawkwind, my mother, and Greatmother to us all; the wisest of our tribe."]="大地母亲，我们之中的一员将投入您的怀抱。她就是乌纳雅·鹰风，我的母亲，也是我们所有人的伟大母亲，我们部族中最具智慧的人。"
G["Earth and sky shall burn!"]="大地和天空都将烧成灰烬！"
G["Earth can be shaped, molded... You cannot! You are useless!"]="大地可以被重铸……你们却不能！你们毫无价值！"
G["Earth!"]="大地！"
G["Earthcaller, my father, Stonefather Oremantle, has been taken prisoner by the stone troggs of Needlerock Spire."]="唤地者，我的父亲，岩幔国王，已经被针石熔渣场的石头穴居人抓为了俘虏。"
G["Earthen Ring."]="大地之环。"
G["Earthen Templar!  I hold your crest of beckoning.  Heed my summons!"]="土色圣殿骑士！我手中握着你的召唤纹章。响应我的召唤吧！"
G["Earthmender Duarn shuffles uncomfortably."]="大地治愈者达鲁不安的踱着步。"
G["Earthmother protect you, Vol'jin."]="愿大地母亲护佑着你，沃金。"
G["Earthmother, grant me the power to undo this bloodshed!"]="大地母亲，请赐予我恢复自然平衡的力量吧！"
G["Earthquake!"]="地震！"
G["Earthquakes every other day, a crazy dragon tearing up the world, what's next?"]="每天都在地震。一头疯狂的龙正在毁灭世界，接着是什么？"
G["Earwax. It's got to be good for SOMETHING."]="耳垢，这一定会有点什么用处的。"
G["Easier than I expected... the sigil of Thoradin is whole, once again."]="比我想象中的要简单……索拉丁封印又变成完整的了。"
G["Easily: You don't have to leap as far between kills."]="很简单：因为你在追杀他们时不用跳很远。"
G["East Pass! Now!"]="东边！快！"
G["Eastern Sewer Entrance"]="东部下水道入口"
G["Eastern Zeppelin Tower"]="东侧飞艇塔"
G["Easy ... does it..."]="这……容易……"
G["Easy boy.  $n is here to help, $ghe:she;'s not with the demons."]="Tranquilo chico. $n está aquí para ayudar, no es uno de los demonios."
G["Easy come, easy go."]="来得快，去得也快。"
G["Easy for you to say.\n\nI'm not cut out for this! I need to find a way out of here!"]="Para ti es fácil decirlo.\n\n¡Yo no estoy preparado para esto! ¡Tengo que encontrar una forma de salir de aquí!"
G["Easy money! Commission's to be dispersed evenly among any and all survivors!"]="轻松赚钱！佣金将由所有幸存者平分，人人有份！"
G["Easy now, drakeling."]="放松点，幼龙。"
G["Easy now. We don't want you setting one of these off prematurely..."]="放松点。这些东西可不能扔得太早……"
G["Easy now... Get in close and incapacitate them."]="放松点……靠过去，放倒他们。"
G["Easy peasy."]="小菜一碟。"
G["Easy there, girl!  Don't you recognize your old master?"]="放松点！不认识你的旧主子了吗？"
G["Easy, Miss Fanny. You hit watermelons too hard... they go boom!"]="放轻松，范妮小姐。你敲的太重了……西瓜都被你敲烂了！"
G["Easy, boy!  Don't ruin the dummy now!"]="放松，孩子！别把这靶子给打散架了。"
G["Easy, friend. We still need the info."]="$gTranquilo, amigo:Tranquila, amiga;. Necesitamos la información."
G["Easy, son. We're fighting a different war now. This isn't about hatred of the Horde. This is about a love of what's right. About doing what needs to be done."]="放心。这场战争不同，孩子。它并非出于对部落的仇恨，而是出于对正义的热爱，源于有所必为的信念。"
G["Eat axe you bacon-brained porkchops!"]="你们这些猪排原料，吃我的斧头吧！"
G["Eat bananas!"]="尝尝我的香蕉！"
G["Eat dirt and die, you spineless cowards!"]="去死吧，你们这些懦夫！"
G["Eat dirt you filthy mongrel!"]="含羞而败吧你这恶心的杂种！"
G["Eat dirt, stumpy!"]="吃土去吧，矮子！"
G["Eat dwarven lead!"]="来尝尝矮人的枪子儿吧！"
G["Eat hot metal, scumbag!"]="等死吧，草包们！"
G["Eat it big-tongues!"]="尝尝厉害吧，大舌头怪！"
G["Eat it!"]="干掉你！"
G["Eat lead!"]="看枪！"
G["Eat me already! I can't take being locked up in this cage around you stinky, fat slobs."]="吃掉我吧！我无法忍受被锁在你们这些臭胖子旁边！"
G["Eat my other shoulder-plate, vile lizard!"]="再吃我一记肩甲，邪恶的蜥蜴！"
G["Eat now, brother. Feast, for tomorrow may never come..."]="兄弟，吃吧。好好吃一顿，我们可能再也见不到明天了……"
G["Eat the flesh of Kroshik, and be cleansed of weakness! Let the spirit of Kros pass through your body!"]="享用考什克的血肉，净化你们的懦弱！让克洛斯的灵魂穿过你们的躯壳！"
G["Eat the flesh of Kroshik, and be cleansed of your weakness."]="享用考什克的血肉，净化你的软弱。"
G["Eat this, baddy!"]="尝尝炸弹的厉害吧！"
G["Eat this, my daughter.  It will help you feel better."]="吃吧，女儿。这会让你感觉好点。"
G["Eat turnip Muno!"]="吃芜菁去吧，穆诺！"
G["Eat up big fella."]="能吃下头牛。"
G["Eat you!"]="把你吃掉！"
G["Eat!  Drink!  Be merry!  Next round's on you!"]="吃！喝！快乐起来！下一轮酒该你请啦！"
G["Eat, brother wolf... Gather your strength."]="吃吧，我的兄弟……你需要恢复力量。"
G["Eat... your... bones..."]="咬碎……你的……骨头……"
G["Eating is a form of training, too, you know."]="吃东西也是一种修炼，你明白的。"
G["Echo of Medivh cheats!"]="麦迪文的回音作弊了！"
G["Echuta, gobin!"]="去死吧，地精！"
G["Edible beds. So you can have breakfast in bed. Beds... for breakfast!"]="可食用的床。这样你就能在床上吃早餐了。床……为早餐而设计！"
G["Edible rocket fuel!"]="可食用的火箭燃料！"
G["Edir harach!"]="¡Edir harach!"
G["Edward, ya leadin' us off. Git in there."]="爱德华，开始了。上！"
G["Edward. Tyler. Prepare for your first challenge."]="爱德华，泰勒尔出来。准备接受你们的第一轮挑战。"
G["Ee-nok Kryul!"]="¡Ee-nok Kryul!"
G["Eeck! Demons appear hungry for the kodos!"]="呃！恶魔对科多兽垂涎欲滴！"
G["Eediot!\n\nAvay vizh you!\n\nCan't you see zhat I am concentratink?"]="白痴！\n\n快滚开！\n\n难道你看不出来，我正在集中精神吗？"
G["Eee ya ha ha ha!"]="啊哈哈哈哈！"
G["Eee! Monsters are attacking Greenstone Village! RUN AWAY!"]="咦！怪物们在攻击绿石村！快跑！"
G["Eee! Wh-what?! Oh...\n\nD-did you n-need something?\n\nWhy d-did I ever let my sister convince me to visit here... have you SEEN how b-big the animals get?!"]="呃！什、什么？！噢……\n\n你、你需要、要什么吗？\n\n我、我怎么就让姐姐给骗过来了呢……你看到那些动物有多、多大吗？！"
G["EeeKKeech - it stings! It crushes! $GHe:She; tricked us, kills $ghim:her;, kill!"]="哎呀呀，它可真扎人啊！$g他:她;骗了我们。杀掉$g他:她;，杀掉！"
G["EeeeEEEEEEKK!"]="咿——嘎——！"
G["Eeeee! I love you Ace!"]="咿！我爱你，王牌飞行员！"
G["Eeeeeeeeeeeeeeew, it's on my head! Help!"]="啊，它跑到我的头顶上了！救命！"
G["Eeeeeeeeek!"]="呀……！"
G["Eeewwww! What is THAT THING?"]="呃！那是什么东西？"
G["Eek!"]="呀！"
G["Eek! $n coming right at us!"]="呃！$n正朝着我们过来了！"
G["Eek! Everybody run!"]="呀！大家快跑！"
G["Eek! I'm outta here! Gyrochromatic Invisibility Engine engage!"]="呀！我要走了！回旋式多彩隐形装置启动！"
G["Eek! Quick, strong, dangerous. You know how to stick it. I no longer afraid you just some filthy wikket."]="咿！你的招式真是快准狠。很好很好，看来你不是个一无是处的无毛怪。"
G["Eekrala gree-kay. By blood and by thorn..."]="Eekrala gree-kay。以血与荆棘……"
G["Eekum Bokum!"]="¡Eekum Bokum!"
G["Eep!"]="耶！"
G["Eep!  Save me from the monsters!"]="哎呀！救命啊，怪物要吃我啦！"
G["Eep! It's the Jade Witch! I need to hide!"]="呃！青玉巫婆！我得躲起来！"
G["Egad! My sophisticated heart!"]="天哪！我的老心脏可受不了！"
G["Egads! $n on me!"]="啊啊啊！$n朝我冲过来了！"
G["Egah - all hands aft. One's aboard. Shoot it! Kill it!"]="啊——后甲板集合。有敌人登船了。射击！干掉它！"
G["Egg Wave:"]="卵摇晃着："
G["Egg sensor offline. Shutting down."]="鸡蛋感应器离线。正在关闭。"
G["Eh - what? Who? What's going on?"]="嗯……什么？谁？出什么事了？"
G["Eh, well you've made it this far... go see Lavinia Crowe by the other bookshelf there. If you don't mess things up with her, maybe you can learn some more."]="呃，你进展到这个程度了吗？去那边的书架找拉文尼亚·克洛文。要是你没把事情搞糟，或许你能学到更多知识。"
G["Eh, wot?"]="呃，什么？"
G["Eh.. perhaps, after another drink."]="呃……你说的也有一定道理。再来一杯吧。"
G["Eh?"]="嗯？"
G["Eh? I don't have time ta chat, my da' wants me ta finish this order fer him."]="嗯？我没时间聊天，我父亲要我完成这个使命。"
G["Eh? Oh...uh...you're absolutely right, Prince Anduin. You are free to go as you please."]="啊？噢……嗯……安度因王子，您说的完全正确。您可以去了。"
G["Eh? What did you say?"]="嗯？你说什么？"
G["Eh? What happened?"]="嗯？出什么事了？"
G["Eh? What have we here?"]="嗯？看看这是什么？"
G["Eh? Where am I? What's happening?\n\nI'm sorry, I must have drifted off."]="嗯？我在哪儿？发生了什么？\n\n对不起，我一定是迷迷糊糊的睡着了。"
G["Ehrin'delumina shorinel!"]="¡Ehrin'delumina shorinel!"
