G["Elder Thoim has spent many years at Moa'ki Harbor in Dragonblight."]="长者索伊姆已经在龙骨荒野的莫亚基港口住了很多年了。"
G["Elder Wanikaya can be found at Rainspeaker Rapids in Sholazar Basin."]="长者瓦尼卡在索拉查盆地的雨声河。"
G["Elder Wheathoof is enjoying the vistas above Mulgore at Thunder Bluff."]="麦蹄长者正在莫高雷的雷霆崖欣赏那里的风光。"
G["Elder Windrun resides in the Crown Guard Tower in the Eastern Plaguelands."]="风路长者在东瘟疫之地的皇冠哨塔里。"
G["Elder Windtotem is keeping company with the goblins of Ratchet on the coast of the Barrens."]="风之图腾长者在贫瘠之地的棘齿城和地精为伴。"
G["Elder Yurauk can be found in the Halls of Stone."]="长者尤拉克在岩石大厅里。"
G["Elder maybe says other stuff, but you always be slave thing to Goregek."]="我可不管长者怎么说，反正你永远都是格利基克的奴隶。"
G["Elder, I found your staff."]="长老，我找到你的法杖了。"
G["Elders grant me your strength!"]="长老们，将你们的力量赐予我！"
G["Elders of Thunder Bluff, I have called you together in the sight of the ancestors to honor my father, Cairne Bloodhoof."]="雷霆崖的长者们，我把大家召集到这里，是要在先祖的见证下祭拜我的父亲——凯恩·血蹄。"
G["Eldrin is the only one in Elwynn Forest that I would call a tailor.  You can find him at the Eastvale Lumber Camp if you're interested in learning the profession."]="艾尔丁是艾尔文森林中唯一称得上裁缝的人。要是你对这个专业感兴趣，就去东谷伐木场找他吧。"
G["Electric Shock can be used to increase the patient's vitals a great deal. However, we cannot use this frequently."]="电击能够大大加强病人的生命体征。但这个办法不能多用。"
G["Electric justice!"]="电刑！"
G["Electrical wires used to send messages over great distances... no, impractical. Giant rockets, with speakers attached...."]="利用电线把信息传送到远方……不，这个发明不现实。还是造巨型火箭，把说话的人绑在上边……"
G["Electron unit activated."]="电荷金刚单位已激活。"
G["Electron unit shield systems online."]="电荷金刚单位防护系统已就绪。"
G["Elegon begins to reactivate the Engine of Nalak'sha."]="伊拉贡开始恢复纳拉克煞引擎了。"
G["Elegon has arrived! PH"]="伊拉贡已经到了！PH"
G["Elemental embers burn hotter than Durotar during the fire festival. The Alliance cannot be permitted to claim them!"]="元素灰烬在燃烧时释放出的热量，比杜隆塔尔在火焰节期间燃起的烈焰还要强烈。绝对不能让联盟得到它们！"
G["Elemental rifts have opened up around the city.  We need to shut them down now! Evacuate all non-combat ready citizens.  Make sure they get to safety!"]="元素裂隙已经在这座城市周围张开。我们必须立刻将它们关闭！撤离全部非战斗市民。确保他们到达安全的地方！"
G["Elementals are invading the area.  Prepare to defend Orgrimmar!"]="元素生物正在入侵这里地区。准备保卫奥格瑞玛！"
G["Elementals, I bid you come forth and slay this enemy of Twilight's Hammer!"]="元素，听我的命令，消灭这个暮光之锤的敌人！"
G["Elementium? I have not heard that word uttered from the mouth of a mortal in decades."]="源质？我已经很久没有听过这个词从一个凡人口中冒出来了。"
G["Elements be with us."]="元素与我们同在。"
G["Elen-ak shaktha!"]="¡Elen-ak shaktha!"
G["Elf! What is this treachery?!"]="精灵！你想要忤逆我吗？！"
G["Elfs kill too many peons in forest. Me sittin' here where it safe."]="精灵在森林里杀了太多的人。我们要留在这个安全的地方。"
G["Eliminate all murlocs by using the Blight Concoction!\n\n|r|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_ALCHEMY_POTION_05.BLP:24|t"]="用凋零化合药剂消灭所有鱼人！\n\n|r|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_ALCHEMY_POTION_05.BLP:24|t"
G["Elimination will now commence. Thank you for your cooperation."]="战斗开始。谢谢合作。"
G["Elisa! Oh, it's so good to get out of there! Auberdine is completely overrun with cultists and elementals!"]="艾丽萨！哦，能从那里逃出来可真好！现在奥伯丁已经彻底被邪教徒和元素占领了！"
G["Elise Brightletter is near the Great Forge adjacent to the Flight Master."]="艾莉丝·布莱里特就在飞行管理员旁边的大锻炉附近。"
G["Eliza isss pretty....sssso pretty..."]="伊莉莎很美……真是很美……"
G["Ella lives at the very western end of the farmlands, just north of the Stormstout Brewery.\n\nShe's been living alone since her parents died, poor thing."]="艾拉住在农田的最西边，就在风暴烈酒酿造厂的北边。\n\n她的父母死后她就一直独自生活，可怜的孩子。"
G["Elortha no Shadra\nGod of Spiders, Mother of Venom, Silk Dancer, Death's Love."]="沙德拉-艾罗萨\n蜘蛛之神，剧毒之母，蛛丝舞者，死亡之吻。"
G["Elsia is waiting for you, champion."]="艾尔希娅在等着你，勇士。"
G["Elune be praised!"]="赞美艾露恩！"
G["Elune be praised!  You seek out our Warsong Gulch Battlemaster?  Her name is Aethalas, and she stands ready to greet you near the warrior trainers."]="赞美月神！你在寻找我们的战歌峡谷军官？她的名字叫做伊萨拉斯，她就在战士训练师的旁边等着你。"
G["Elune be praised! And you as well."]="赞美月神！也要赞美你。"
G["Elune be with us! Let's make haste from this evil fortress."]="月神与我们同在！让我们赶快逃出这座魔堡。"
G["Elune be with you, $c."]="愿月神与你同在，$c。"
G["Elune be with you."]="艾露恩与你同在。"
G["Elune greet you, champion. I will watch your back."]="艾露恩欢迎你，勇士。我会掩护你。"
G["Elune guide us, $c."]="艾露恩指引我们，$c。"
G["Elune guide you through the night."]="艾露恩指引你们穿过黑夜。"
G["Elune has blessed us many times over with all the discoveries we have made.  But we must remain vigilant, $c."]="在航海之旅中，艾露恩一直庇护着我们。但是我们仍然要保持警惕，$c。"
G["Elune has granted the night elves many gifts. In return, it is our responsibility to safeguard these forests from the demonic taint that the Horde always brings with it."]="月神已经赐予暗夜精灵很多礼物。作为回报，我们有职责保卫这些森林免受部落带来的恶魔的污染。"
G["Elune has seen fit to gift me with skill and experience. Now I shall pass them on to you."]="月神曾赐与我技能和经验。现在我要把它们传授给你。"
G["Elune help us!"]="艾露恩保佑我们！"
G["Elune help us."]="愿艾露恩帮助我们。"
G["Elune watch over you, $n."]="艾露恩在注视着你，$n。"
G["Elune watch over you, $r."]="愿艾露恩保护你，$r。"
G["Elune's grace upon you.  How can I serve?"]="艾露恩祝福着你，有什么我能为你效劳的吗？"
G["Elune's light... what is that thing?"]="艾露恩在上……那是什么？"
G["Elune's secrets are many, but they are not to be shared with just anyone."]="月神的秘密很多，但是它们不能让任何人知道。"
G["Elune, guide my arrows!"]="艾露恩，指引我的箭矢！"
G["Elune, hear my prayers. Grant us serenity! Watch over our fallen..."]="艾露恩，请聆听我的祷告。让我们获得心灵的平静吧！注视着我们倒下的躯体吧……"
G["Elune-adore, my $gbrother:sister;. You are welcome here."]="Elune-adora, $ghermano:hermana;. Sé $gbienvenido:bienvenida;."
G["Elves in Warsong Gulch make crunchy sound. You crunch them good. Talk to Kurden Bloodclaw in Royal Quarter."]="战歌峡谷中的精灵们会在你的打击下发出骨头碎裂的声音。去跟皇家区的库尔丁·血爪谈一谈吧。"
G["Elves or draenei, just means more money for our engineers."]="精灵们或德莱尼人，对我们的工程师来说，不过是又多了两条财路。"
G["Embercores wake from the lava!"]="灰烬之核从熔岩中苏醒了！"
G["Emberwyrm incoming!  Pull back!  Pull back!"]="灰烬之龙来了！撤退！撤退！"
G["Embrace the Nothing!"]="拥抱虚无吧！"
G["Embrace the Wanderer's Way! It is not so much a course of action as it is an attitude.\n\nEvery one you meet is a story. Every place you go is an adventure. Every drink you have is the best you've ever tasted.\n\nThis is not such a bad life, is it?"]="拥抱云游者之道吧！与其说这是一个行动过程，不如说是一种态度。\n\n你遇到的每一个人都是一个故事。你去过的每一个地方都是一次冒险奇遇。你喝的每一杯酒都是前所未见的美酒。\n\n这种生活还算不错，对吧？"
G["Embrace the coming of the end!"]="拥抱即将到来的终结吧！"
G["Embrace the darkness... darkness eternal."]="拥抱黑暗吧……永恒的黑暗。"
G["Embrace the end!"]="拥抱你的末日吧！"
G["Embrace the future that rises from below."]="拥抱从深渊崛起的未来吧。"
G["Embrace the light that is in you, my friends! Deny yourself all darkness..."]="拥抱你体内的圣光吧，我的朋友们！将所有的黑暗拒之门外……"
G["Embrace yer demise!"]="迎接你的末日吧！"
G["Embrace your despair."]="拥抱你的绝望吧。"
G["Embrace your end."]="拥抱死亡吧。"
G["Emerald Circle."]="翡翠议会。"
G["Emerald Dragonshrine"]="翡翠巨龙圣地"
G["Emerald drakes excel at healing themselves while poisoning their enemies.\nUsing leeching poison, they can steal health from their enemies.  Repeated applications of this poison can increase the effect.\nWith touch the nightmare, emerald drakes can reach into the Dream, converting a portion of their life energy into a highly damaging attack that leaves the target weakened, reducing its damage for a short time."]="Los dracos esmeralda destacan en curarse a sí mismos mientras envenenan a sus enemigos.\n\nAl usar el Veneno parasitante, pueden robarle salud a sus enemigos. Varias aplicaciones de este veneno pueden aumentar el efecto.\n\nCon Tocar la pesadilla los dracos esmeralda pueden alcanzar el Sueño, convirtiendo una parte de su energía vital en un ataque muy dañino que deja debilitado al objetivo, reduciendo su daño durante poco tiempo."
G["Emergency Power Reserves Online."]="应急能量联线。"
G["Emergency power activated!  Initializing ambulatory motor!  CLUCK!"]="备用动力启动！启动流动电机！咯咯嗒！"
G["Emergency shutdown complete."]="紧急停机已完成。"
G["Emergency shutdown will complete in one minute."]="将在一分钟后完成紧急停机。"
G["Emergency shutdown will complete in ten seconds."]="将在十秒后紧急停机。"
G["Emergency shutdown will complete in thirty seconds."]="将在三十秒后紧急停机。"
G["Emissary Taluun brought me with him hoping I could teach our new allies about the elements of this world. So far they refuse to listen, but perhaps you would be willing?"]="塔卢恩大使把我一起带过来，希望我可以向我们的新伙伴们传授关于这个世界上的元素的知识……但迄今为止他们都拒绝听这些，也许你愿意听听？"
G["Emissary Taluun brought me with him hoping I could teach our new allies about the elements of this world... but no one will listen."]="塔卢恩大使把我一起带过来，希望我可以向我们的新伙伴们传授关于这个世界上的元素的知识……但没人愿意听。"
G["Emissary, I misplaced the Blood Oath of the Horde. Could you please give me a replacement?"]="大使，我弄丢了部落的血誓。你能再给我一份吗？"
G["Emperor Hellscream, I am Ji..."]="尊敬的地狱咆哮陛下，我是季…"
G["Emperor Thaurissan does not wish to be disturbed! Turn back now or face your doom, weak mortals!"]="索瑞森大帝不希望有人打扰他！滚回去面对自己的命运吧，你们这些懦弱的人！"
G["Emperor? You'll find KING Varian inside Stormwind Keep."]="皇帝？你可以去暴风要塞见瓦里安“国王”。"
G["Empoor, you're going to tell me what I want to know, or else!"]="埃博尔，你是想马上把我要知道的东西告诉我，还是吃点苦头？"
G["Empowered Flames speed toward $n!"]="强能烈焰飞快地冲向$n！"
G["Empress Shek'zeer knows your plans. Your treachery will be punished..."]="女皇夏柯希尔知道了你的计划。你要为背叛而受到惩罚……"
G["Empress Shek'zeer will destroy you!"]="女皇夏柯希尔会消灭你！"
G["Empress..."]="女皇……"
G["Empress... I have... failed you..."]="女皇……我……让你失望了……"
G["Empress... forgive me!"]="女皇陛下……原谅我！"
G["En Garde!"]="预备！"
G["Enabling"]="启用"
G["Enchanted thorium is a highly sought-after metal. You best chance of finding some of it is to speak with an artisan blacksmith or miner."]="魔化瑟银锭是一种很受欢迎的金属。你找到它的最好办法就是找个铁匠或是矿工谈谈。"
G["Enchanting"]="附魔"
G["Enchanting Supplies"]="附魔补给品"
G["Enchanting allows you to enchant items with a wide variety of beneficial effects, as well as disenchant items and create magical wands and oils.\nHighly skilled enchanters can even enchant their own rings, which no one else may do.\nMost raw materials for Enchanting must be gathered via disenchanting, a process which destroys the disenchanted item. For this reason the profession pairs well with Tailoring, as you can disenchant the magical Tailoring items you create for raw materials.\nEnchanters may also place enchantments upon vellum, which allows the enchantment to be sold or saved for later use. Vellum and other useful Enchanting materials may be purchased from Enchanting vendors."]="El encantamiento te permite encantar objetos con una gran variedad de efectos beneficiosos, además de desencantar objetos y crear varitas mágicas y aceites.\n\nLos encantadores más avanzados pueden incluso encantar sus propios anillos, algo que no puede hacer nadie más.\n\nCasi todas las materias primas se obtienen mediante el desencantamiento, un proceso que destruye el objeto desencantado. Por eso se compagina bien con la sastrería, ya que puedes desencantar los objetos mágicos que creas para obtener materias primas.\n\nTambién puedes transmitir tus encantamientos a vitelas, para venderlos o guardarlos. Las vitelas y demás materiales se pueden comprar a los vendedores de encantamiento."
G["Enchanting has run in our family for generations. I learned at an early age, just as my son is doing now."]="我的家族数代都从事附魔工作。我在很小的时候就学会了这项技能，就像我儿子现在在做的一样。"
G["End him..."]="了结他……"
G["End it, for the Horde."]="为了部落，结束这一切吧。"
G["End it."]="了结它的生命。"
G["End its miserable life."]="终结它可悲的生命。"
G["End our suffering!"]="结束我们的痛苦吧！"
G["End the mortal affront!"]="消灭你所见到的凡人！"
G["End the orc's misery."]="结束这个兽人的痛苦。"
G["End this mortal affront to the Lich King!"]="杀死这名胆敢挑衅巫妖王的凡人！"
G["Endala finel endal!"]="¡Endala finel endal!"
G["Endless serpents and a giant panther... It can't get much worse than this."]="无穷无尽的毒蛇和一只巨型猎豹……情况不会比这更糟了。"
G["Endlessly, he sought to break my will, to force me to serve him, to bind me to his blade..."]="无休无止，他想要击溃我的意志，让我屈服，成为剑中的冤魂……"
G["Endorel anuminor!"]="¡Endorel anuminor!"
G["Enemies approach! Call for me when you are at a safe location."]="敌人接近了！等你到达安全位置的时候再召唤我。"
G["Enemies are closing in on us from all sides, and all the elders talk of abandoning this post. I say we should stand and fight like the warriors we are."]="敌人从四面八方向我们逼近，长老们都认为应该放弃这座岗哨。但是我认为我们应该留下来，勇敢地与敌人抗衡。"
G["Enemies have reached the door!  Move in!  We must hold!"]="敌人已经打到门口了！坚持住！我们必须守住！"
G["Enemies litter this isle, both old and new. We will not gain a foot of ground here without spilling blood for it."]="这座岛上到处都是敌人，新老都有。如果没有流血牺牲的觉悟，我们是无法在这里立足的。"
G["Enemies of the Winterskorn, you will be torn limb from limb!"]="斯克恩的敌人，你们很快就会被撕成碎片！"
G["Enemies of the flame are not welcome here!"]="这里不欢迎火焰的敌人！"
G["Enemies spotted! Attack while I try to activate a Protector!"]="发现敌人！你们上去顶住！我去启动魔像！"
G["Enemies! SMASH!"]="有敌人！碾碎他们！"
G["Enemies... everywhere! Kill! Kill them all!"]="到处都是……敌人！给我杀！杀光他们！"
G["Enemy Lieutenant coming aboard, fend him off!"]="敌方上尉要登船了，击退他！"
G["Enemy down."]="消灭敌人。"
G["Enemy faction ahead."]="前方有敌对阵营。"
G["Enemy fleet yonder! Fire!"]="敌人在那边！开火！"
G["Enemy here."]="有敌人。"
G["Enemy ho! Fire!"]="是敌人！开火！"
G["Enemy is walking meat."]="敌人就是会走路的肉。"
G["Enemy presence detected."]="发现敌人。"
G["Enemy ship, starboard! Ready the guns! Fire at will!"]="右舷发现敌舰！炮火准备！自由射击！"
G["Enemy sighted!  Fall into formation and prepare for bombing maneuvers!"]="发现敌人！改变阵型，准备轰炸！"
G["Enemy sighted!  Ready your weapons!"]="发现敌人了！准备作战！"
G["Enemy sighting!"]="瞄准敌人！"
G["Enemy spotted! Fire!"]="发现敌人！开火！"
G["Energy Conduits active, draw stable."]="能量导管激活，趋向稳定。"
G["Energy Vortex ramping down."]="能量涡流缓降。"
G["Energy begins to arc across Onyxia's body as her electrical charge increases."]="随着奥妮克希亚体内电荷的增加，在她身体四周开始出现能量电弧。"
G["Energy collection complete."]="能量收集完毕。"
G["Energy. Power. My people are addicted to it... a dependence made manifest after the Sunwell was destroyed. Welcome to the future. A pity you are too late to stop it. No one can stop me now! Selama ashal'anore!"]="魔法，能量，我的人民陷入其中不能自拔……自从太阳之井被摧毁之后就是如此。欢迎来到未来。真遗憾，你们无法阻止什么。没有人可以阻止我了！Selama ashal’anore！！"
G["Enforcers! Kill them all!"]="进攻！杀光他们！"
G["Engage maximum speed."]="提升至最高速度。"
G["Engage secondary targets!"]="对准次级目标！"
G["Engaging hostile entity.  Removing protective failsafes."]="发现敌对个体。移除防护性损坏保护。"
G["Engaging self-preservation chip."]="接合自我保护芯片。"
G["Engaging total destruction sequence. Good bye."]="进入彻底毁灭程序。再见。"
G["Engineering"]="工程学"
G["Engineering Supplies"]="工程学补给品"
G["Engineering allows you to construct a wide variety of useful, amazing, and just plain weird items like rifles and scopes, motorcycles, and mechanical squirrels. However, many of these are only usable by yourself or other engineers, such as special goggles, mechanical additions to belts, boots, gloves and cloaks, and flying machines.\nMost raw Engineering materials are metals gathered by Mining, so the two professions pair well.\nMany creations require the use of a Blacksmith Hammer; this and other necessary materials, such as gun stocks or flux, may be purchased from trade or Engineering vendors."]="La ingeniería te permite construir una gran variedad de objetos útiles, increíbles o sencillamente raros como rifles y miras, motos o ardillas mecánicas. Sin embargo, muchos de estos objetos solo los puedes usar tú u otros ingenieros: por ejemplo, las gafas especiales, los añadidos mecánicos para cinturones, botas, guantes o capas, y las máquinas voladoras.\n\nLa mayoría de las materias primas de ingeniería se obtienen mediante la minería, así que ambas profesiones se compaginan bien.\n\nMuchas creaciones requieren el uso de un martillo de herrero; el martillo, al igual que otros materiales necesarios como culatas o flujos, se puede comprar a un amigo o a los vendedores de ingeniería."
G["Engineering will provide you with the skills and knowledge to dismantle your opponents! Let me show you how..."]="工程学能赋予你瓦解敌人的技能和知识！让我教你该如何做……"
G["Engineers often train at Like Clockwork in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran."]="工程师可以前往达拉然西北部的魔法商业区，在精密仪器接受训练。"
G["Enjoy de rock, mon!"]="好好享受这摇滚乐吧，伙计！"
G["Enjoy my fine wares."]="好好欣赏一下我精美的藏品吧。"
G["Enjoy ride! Call me when you get there."]="旅途愉快！等你抵达目的地后再召唤我吧。"
G["Enjoy the fall!"]="好好享受坠落的快感！"
G["Enjoy the festivities!"]="尽情享受庆典吧！"
G["Enjoy the refreshingly intelligent taste of all new Kaja'Cola!"]="品尝全新的卡亚可乐，享受全新的智慧生活！"
G["Enjoy the rest of your stay in Menethil. It won't last much longer."]="在米奈希尔好好地休息一下，不久之后你就会精力充沛了。"
G["Enjoy the ride! It's a one way trip!"]="旅途愉快！这是单程航线！"
G["Enjoy the storm warm bloods!"]="享受热血之雨吧！"
G["Enjoy the taste of fel iron?"]="喜欢魔铁的味道吗？"
G["Enjoy the taste of victory, for now. Next time we fight, you will taste the bitterness of defeat.\n\nIn fact, I think I'll name my next brew that. \"The Bitterness of Defeat.\" Doesn't roll of the tongue but it takes a special kind of failure to make one drink a brew named that."]="Disfruta del sabor de la victoria. La próxima vez que nos enfrentemos saborearás el amargor de la derrota.\n\nDe hecho, creo que voy a llamar así a mi próxima cerveza. \"El amargor de la derrota\". No es que sea muy atractivo que digamos, pero hace falta una derrota especial para que alguien se beba algo con ese nombre."
G["Enjoy the trip to Ratchet, $n!"]="祝你的棘齿城之旅一路顺风，$n！"
G["Enjoy this well earned brew. The recipe has been in my family for over ten thousand years. Once enjoyed by the Monkey King himself, they say."]="享受这来之不易的佳酿吧。它的配方在我的家族珍藏了上万年。据说，这酒还特别受到美猴王本人的亲睐。"
G["Enjoy your final moments."]="享受你们最后的时光吧。"
G["Enjoy your hollow victory, insects. (The darkness comes...) May it console you as your world rots."]="享受你们空虚的胜利吧，害虫们。（黑暗降临了……）愿它成为你们腐烂世界的安慰。"
G["Enjoy your small victory while you can, mortals. It will not stop my eventual triumph over this land!"]="欢庆你们渺小的胜利吧，凡人。这根本无法阻挡我们在这片土地上的最终胜利！"
G["Enjoy your tour of Pandaria's most ancient and respected silk farm."]="祝你在潘达利亚最古老、最负盛名的丝绸农场过得开心。"
G["Enjoy!  You won't find better ale anywhere!"]="尽情享受吧！你找不到比这更好的啤酒了！"
G["Enjoying the Fire Festival?"]="对火焰节满意吗？"
G["Enjoying the Midsummer Fire Festival, $c?"]="享受到火焰节的乐趣了吗，$c？"
G["Enjoying the festival, $c?\n\nWhile the Flame Keepers tend to the fires of the present, I am more of a historian, keeping close the festivals past. I'm also, of course, documenting this year's festivities. Things are going well thus far, don't you think?\n\nYou know, $n, there is power inherent in all festival fires burning throughout the holiday. We're taking care of ours, but I'm certain there are sacred flames burning deep within our enemy's cities..."]="¿Estás disfrutando del festival, $c?\n\nMientras los vigilantes de la Llama se ocupan de las hogueras del presente, yo soy más bien un historiador y me interesan mucho los festivales anteriores. Por supuesto, estoy documentando las celebraciones de este año. De momento, todo está saliendo bien, ¿no crees?\n\n¿Sabes, $n? Hay un poder inherente a todas las hogueras del festival que se prenderán durante estas fiestas. Nosotros cuidamos las nuestras pero estoy seguro de que en las ciudades enemigas arden hogueras sagradas..."
G["Enjoying the festival, $c?\n\nWhile the Flame Wardens tend to the fires of the present, I am more of a historian, keeping close the festivals past. I'm also, of course, documenting this year's festivities. Things are going well thus far, don't you think?\n\nYou know, $n, there is power inherent in all festival fires burning throughout the holiday. We're taking care of ours, but I'm certain there are sacred flames burning deep within our enemy's cities..."]="¿Estás disfrutando del festival, $c?\n\nMientras los celadores de las llamas se ocupan de las hogueras del presente, yo soy más bien un historiador y me interesan mucho los festivales anteriores. Por supuesto, estoy documentando las celebraciones de este año. De momento, todo está saliendo bien, ¿no crees?\n\n¿Sabes, $n? Hay un poder inherente a todas las hogueras del festival que se prenderán durante estas fiestas. Nosotros cuidamos las nuestras pero estoy seguro de que en las ciudades enemigas arden hogueras sagradas..."
G["Enjoying the festival, $c? My wares can give an extra kick to your day. Nothing like warm food and drink!\n\nAnd if you haven't tried it yet, get a friend or two and celebrate around the ribbon pole; it's sure to lift your spirits!"]="庆典上过得可愉快，$c？我的东西能让你过的更加高兴一些。没什么能比热乎乎的食物和美酒更好的了！\n\n要是你还没试过，一定要叫上一两个朋友一起去彩旗那边参加庆祝，一定会让你很开心的！"
G["Enjoying your stay? One dip in the steam pools and you come out looking 10 years younger. Just look at me if you want proof!"]="喜欢这里吗？在蒸汽池里泡一泡，你出来的时候就能年轻10岁。你要是不信，就看看我吧！"
G["Enjoying yourselves?"]="你们觉得很有趣吗？"
G["Enough Rommath! The Sin'dorei must be free from the yoke of the Horde!"]="够了，罗曼斯！辛多雷必须从部落的桎梏中解脱出来！"
G["Enough about pandaren history. Let's talk about your people, traveler."]="熊猫人的历史就说到这儿吧。谈谈你的种族，旅行者。"
G["Enough crazy talk from you worms. More work!"]="我受够你们的胡言乱语了。快干活！"
G["Enough dilly dallying supplicant! I demand you assemble my body."]="别再拖拖拉拉了，乞求者！我要你去收集我的躯体！"
G["Enough distractions!"]="别打扰我了！"
G["Enough fighting! Let's finish this and get outa here!"]="打够啦！快点解决这帮家伙，我们离开这里吧！"
G["Enough fooling around. It's time for some hands-on management!"]="不要再犯傻了。该是进行手动操控的时候了！"
G["Enough foreplay. Let's get down to business."]="别浪费时间了，让我们切入主题吧。"
G["Enough games!"]="游戏时间到此结束！"
G["Enough hiding, little ones!"]="躲够了没，小鬼们！"
G["Enough hiding. It's time to take the fight to the iron dwarves."]="我已经躲够了。和铁矮人开战的时候到了。"
G["Enough idle banter! Our champions have arrived - support them as we push our way through the hall!"]="都给我严肃点！我们的勇士已经到了，我们要奋勇战斗，支援他们！"
G["Enough jawing! There's our ride."]="闲聊结束！我们的船来了。"
G["Enough lessons!  It's time for action!"]="训练已经够多了！现在是行动的时刻！"
G["Enough messing around! There's a war going on here!"]="这里够乱了！我们还要不要去打仗了？"
G["Enough moving around! Hold still while I blow them all up!"]="不要乱动！站稳了，等我把他们都炸飞！"
G["Enough of my ramblings.  The trail leads here.  That entire building is covered in plants with leaves like the one we found."]="闲聊到此为止。足迹一直延伸到了这里。这座建筑里的植物长满了我们之前找到的那种叶子。"
G["Enough of my regrets.  This is the building.  Let's check it out."]="我的懊恼到此为止。这就是那座建筑。让我们进去调查一下。"
G["Enough of this charade!"]="别打哑谜了！"
G["Enough of this foolishness!"]="停止你的愚行！"
G["Enough of this insolence! Prepare to die!"]="我受够了你的傲慢！去死吧！"
G["Enough of this insolence.  Do you think that I'm blind to everything that goes on outside of the Undercity?"]="你这个傲慢的家伙。你以为我是个瞎子？看不见幽暗城外面发生的一切？"
G["Enough of this!"]="够了！"
G["Enough of this!  Now I call upon the fury of the cosmos itself."]="我受够了！现在我要让你们看看宇宙的愤怒！"
G["Enough of this! Come now, weaklings. You have earned your reward. You may now face the Iron Qon."]="够了！过来，爬虫。你们已经得到了奖赏。现在，你们将面对铁穹。"
G["Enough of this.  The Cult of the Damned doesn't need Andorhal.  This worthless city is yours to fight over."]="够了。诅咒教派不需要安多哈尔。就把这座毫无价值的城市留给你们吧。"
G["Enough of your blather! Knights, forward!"]="我听够了你的废话！骑士们，前进！"
G["Enough of your games! You won't live to do it again."]="我受够你们的把戏了！去死吧。"
G["Enough of your interference, $r! Spiritclaws! Deal with this pest!"]="¡Ya has intervenido bastante, $r! Atormentadores de espíritus, ¡acabad con $geste entrometido:esta entrometida;!"
G["Enough of your pesky pea-shooters. Let them shoot at this!"]="受够你这些豌豆射手了。让它们往这儿打！"
G["Enough prattling. Let them come. We shall grind their bones to dust."]="别多说废话了。让他们来吧。我们会把他们的骨头碾成灰的。"
G["Enough slacking! You're behind schedule..."]="别偷懒了！你已经跟不上进度了……"
G["Enough talk you two!  Commence fighting!"]="你们俩说够了没！战斗开始了！"
G["Enough talk.  By the time I'm through with you, not even the worgs are going to want to go near your corpse."]="够了。这场战斗结束后，我与你便再无瓜葛。那时，即便是座狼，也不愿意靠近你的尸体。"
G["Enough talk. You know how precarious our position is. Between the Alliance and the Thunder King, only with the help of heroes like you can we hope to succeed here."]="闲话少说。你也明白我们的处境很危险。在联盟和雷神的夹击下，只有像你这样的英雄才能帮我们获胜。"
G["Enough toying around! It's time to get my hands dirty!"]="玩够了！现在该是下手的时候了！"
G["Enough with the rambling. I am starving! Now, get your dusty shell into that ocean and bring momma some grub."]="少废话，我肚子饿了！现在去海里给我找点吃的来！"
G["Enough with the stick already!"]="别再摆弄那根棍子了！"
G["Enough!"]="够了！"
G["Enough!  Drawing upon this source will set us back months.  You should feel honored to be worthy of its expenditure.  Now... die!"]="够了！汲取这力量之源将使几个月的努力白费。你们应该为自己担得起这份损耗而感到自豪！现在……死吧！"
G["Enough!  I grow tired of you!"]="够了！我已经厌烦你了！"
G["Enough!  I will not stand for this!"]="够了！我受够了！"
G["Enough!  I will take care of these fools myself!"]="够了！让我亲自来解决这帮蠢货！"
G["Enough!  I will teach you some manners, wench!"]="¡Basta! ¡Te enseñaré modales, $gmozo:moza;!"
G["Enough!  I've made up my mind.  We need Crowley on our side."]="够了！我已经做出了决定。我们需要克罗雷。"
G["Enough!  The Earthen Ring will temporarily stop the invasion.  But be warned, the elementals will return!"]="够了！大地之环暂时阻止了入侵。但小心点，那些元素会再回来的！"
G["Enough!  The Earthen Ring will temporarily stop the invasion.  But bewarned, the elementals will return!"]="够了！大地之环暂时阻止了入侵。但小心点，元素会再回来的！"
G["Enough!  You win... champion.  Tell that upstart that he has my blessing."]="行了！你赢了……勇士。去告诉那个暴发户吧，就说我祝福他。"
G["Enough! (To His will all flesh succumbs. From His kingdom, chaos comes.) Yes - what he said."]="够了！（为主人碾碎所有血肉，从主人的王国，混乱降临。）对——如他所言。"
G["Enough! As much as I adore playing hostess, I have more pressing matters to attend to."]="够了！我虽然好客，但现在必须要去处理更重要的事情了。"
G["Enough! Do you want me to report to Garrosh that you asked us to bow to that Kirin Tor wench?!"]="够了！你想让我去报告加尔鲁什，说你让我们向那个肯瑞托丫头低头吗？！"
G["Enough! Have your cave, little shaman."]="够了！这洞是你的了，小萨满。"
G["Enough! I have had enough of you filthy warm bloods!"]="够了！我受够你们这些肮脏的热血生物了！"
G["Enough! I see I must take matters into my own hands!"]="够了！看来需要我亲自上阵了！"
G["Enough! I shall land and crush you myself!"]="够了！我要落下来把你们打得粉碎！"
G["Enough! I shouldn't have questioned your orders..."]="够了！我不该质疑你的命令……"
G["Enough! I tire of these games!"]="够了！我厌倦了这些游戏！"
G["Enough! I will finish this."]="够了！我会亲自解决。"
G["Enough! I will no longer be contained!"]="够了！我不会再容忍下去了！"
G["Enough! I will talk. Put your weapons away, it is not with me that you have quarrel with."]="够了！我会说的。收起你的武器，你不必用它来跟我争论……"
G["Enough! I yield to your superior skills."]="够了！我对你的卓越战技感到心悦诚服。"
G["Enough! I'll handle you myself!"]="够了！我要亲手解决你！"
G["Enough! I'll stain my hands with your blood! (Hyehahahaha! Murder! MURDER!)"]="够了！我要亲自来对付你。（呵哈哈哈哈！杀啊！杀啊！）"
G["Enough! I've told you all that I know. Your continued abuse is senseless!"]="够了！我知道的事都告诉你了。你再逼问下去也问不出什么了！"
G["Enough! Make it stop!"]="够了！快停下！"
G["Enough! No more!"]="够了！不要继续了！"
G["Enough! Off to de spirit world wit' ya!"]="够了！滚回灵魂的世界去吧！"
G["Enough! Playtime is over!"]="够了！娱乐时间已经过了！"
G["Enough! Stay your hand!"]="够了！快住手！"
G["Enough! Survey the damage. What's this - an Alliance stronghold? They think to lay claim to this land already? NOT ON MY WATCH!"]="够了！清点伤亡。那是什么……联盟的据点！他们认为已经占领这片土地了？有我在，休想！"
G["Enough! Taste the full fury of High Warlord Naj'entus!"]="够了！尝尝高阶督军纳因图斯的真正怒火吧！"
G["Enough! The realms will carry their weight or crumble beneath mine!"]="够了！这些王国最好识相点，否则就等死吧！"
G["Enough! Time to meet your end, invaders!"]="够了！你的死期到了，入侵者！"
G["Enough! We will relocate shortly. These creatures have destroyed most of what was left from the ship."]="够了！我们很快就转移。这些家伙把我们的舰船摧毁得面目全非了。"
G["Enough! What is this about?!"]="够了！这是干什么的？！"
G["Enough! You have wasted too much of my time already. I will not be distracted by such insignificant creatures."]="够了！你已经浪费了我太多时间。我不能为这种低贱的小人物分心。"
G["Enough! You've bested my consort... and now YOU shall take her place!"]="够了！你杀死了我的配偶……那就由你来代替她吧！"
G["Enough!!"]="够了！"
G["Enough'a dis...Chief Sandscalp can't reward me if I'm dead, yah? Farewell, mon...for good."]="够了……如果我死了，沙顶酋长就不可能奖励我了，对不对？再见，朋友……最好永远别见了。"
G["Enough, I will erase your very existence!"]="够了。我要把你们全部消灭！"
G["Enough, Michael. Business is hurting enough with this scare as it is. We can use every copper."]="够了，麦克尔。城里的气氛越来越恐慌，我们的生意已经够惨淡的了。就算是一个铜板的小买卖也不应该错过。"
G["Enough, Shaman!"]="够了，萨满！"
G["Enough, all of you! You have combated those who stole our children. That is reason enough for me to give you a chance to further prove yourself worthy of our trust."]="够了，全都闭嘴！你们击败了那些偷走我们孩子的人。光凭这个，我就该给你们一次机会，让你们证明自己值得我们信赖。"
G["Enough."]="够了。"
G["Enough. I have been apart from this for centuries. The well within this temple may be a pale spectre of the Well of Eternity, but it still holds the same... beauty. Purity."]="够了。几百年来我一直与它相隔天涯。这座神庙中的月亮井也许是永恒之井枯竭的影照，但它仍然是那么……美丽。纯净。"
G["Enough...stop..."]="够了……停下……"
G["Enter Twilight!"]="进入暮光吧！"
G["Enter code to receive Frost Whelp pet."]="输入兑换码，领取冰龙宝宝。"
G["Enter code to receive Netherwhelp pet."]="输入认证码以获得虚空龙宝宝宠物。"
G["Enter my realm."]="进入我的国度。"
G["Enter the Fall of Shan Bu scenario."]="进入山怖之死场景战役。"
G["Enter the Portal."]="走进传送门。"
G["Enter the Proving Grounds"]="进入试炼场。"
G["Enter the Rumpus Pit, then set off the firework. Be prepared to fight several enemies at once! Anything can happen in the Rumpus."]="进入乱斗比武场并燃放焰火。然后，做好同时面对几名对手的准备吧！在乱斗比武场中，一切皆有可能。"
G["Enter the Temple."]="进入神殿。"
G["Enter the arena."]="进入竞技场。"
G["Enter the portal!"]="快进传送门！"
G["Enter the portal."]="进入传送门。"
G["Entering Phase 2 <PH>"]="Entrando en Fase 2 <PH>"
G["Entering Phase 3 <PH>"]="Entrando en la Fase 3 <PH>"
G["Entering defensive mode.  Disabling output failsafes."]="进入防御模式。禁用输出保险。"
G["Entering the arena is the Grand Champion of Darnassus, the skilled sentinel Jaelyne Evensong!"]="进入竞技场的是达纳苏斯的总冠军，战技非凡的娅琳·永歌！"
G["Entering the arena is the lean and dangerous Zul'tore, Grand Champion of Sen'jin!"]="进入竞技场的是削瘦却极度危险的祖尔托，森金村的总冠军！"
G["Entering the arena, a paladin who is no stranger to the battlefield or tournament ground, the Grand Champion of the Argent Crusade, Eadric the Pure!"]="正在走进竞技场的是一位对于战场和比武场都绝不陌生的圣骑士——银色十字军的总冠军，纯洁者耶德瑞克！"
G["Entity designate: Yogg-Saron. Security has been compromised. Prison operational status unknown. Unable to contact Watchers for notification purposes."]="个体标识：尤格-萨隆。安全受到威胁。囚犯的行动状态未知。无法联络或通知到守护者。"
G["Entry 1"]="第1篇"
G["Entry 205"]="第205篇"
G["Entry 42"]="第42篇"
G["Entry denied.  Access level insufficient."]="拒绝登录。权限级别不足。"
G["Entryway of Time"]="时光入口"
G["Enu thora'serador. This is a sacred place."]="Enu thora'serador。这是一片神圣之地。"
G["Eoin, there's a full well right there."]="伊欧因，那里有一口满是清水的井。"
G["Eonar, your servant calls for your blessing!"]="艾欧娜尔，请祝福您的仆人！"
G["Eonar, your servant requires aid!"]="艾欧娜尔，您的仆人需要帮助！"
G["Eons I have slept undisturbed... Now this... Creatures of flesh, now you will BURN!"]="我已经沉睡了无数的时光，现在却被这些血肉生灵所扰……你们将燃烧殆尽！"
G["Eons ago, the \"Titans\" came and cast down our Masters. But this is NOT their world, and it never was! Judgment comes at last!"]="Hace eones, los \"titanes\" vinieron y desterraron a nuestros maestros. ¡Pero este NO es su mundo y nunca lo fue! ¡Por fin llega el día del Juicio!"
G["Eons of darkness... by your hand."]="永世的黑暗……因你而降临。"
G["Epic Pelt!"]="史诗投掷！"
G["Epic Purple Shirt"]="史诗级紫色衬衫"
G["Equip the Lance"]="装备长矛。"
G["Er, Dampwick, I need another miner...."]="呃，戴姆维克，我还需要一个矿工……"
G["Er... 'Moke?"]="呃……笨蛋？"
G["Er... did you mention something about a Personal Arcane Assistant?"]="呃……你刚提到了什么私人奥术助手？"
G["Er... that's how I found them.  I wanted to show the king that they were a threat!  Say Captain... I overheard Guard Fengus calling you a fat, useless gnoll lover!"]="呃……我就是这样找到他们的。我想告诉国王他们是个威胁！我跟你说啊，头儿……我无意中听到卫兵芬古斯说你是个肥胖无用的恋豺狼人癖！"
G["Er...backup release valve?"]="呃……备用减压阀？"
G["Eradicate."]="毁灭。"
G["Eradicate...."]="根除……"
G["Eraka no Kimbul\nGod of Tigers, Lord of Beasts, King of Cats, the Prey's Doom\n\nUeetay no Mueh'zala\nGod of Death, Father of Sleep, Son of Time, the Night's Friend."]="吉布尔-埃拉卡\n猛虎之神，万兽之王\n\n缪萨拉-安泰恩\n死亡之神，时间之子，睡眠之父，夜晚之友"
G["Eranikus is here! Seek shelter! Safety!"]="伊兰尼库斯来了！快躲起来！躲起来！"
G["Eranikus, Tyrant of the Dream, has entered our world."]="梦境之暴君伊兰尼库斯已经进入了我们的世界。"
G["Eranikus, Tyrant of the Dream, is wholly consumed by the Light of Elune. Tranquility sets in over the Moonglade."]="梦境之暴君伊兰尼库斯被月神之光吞噬了。月光林地恢复了往日的宁静。"
G["Erm... I really don't know you that well, sorry.  I mean, as an authorized Mechano-strider dealer, I really only can sell my mounts to those people who are considered a friend of the gnomes.  If you ever are recognized as friendly to Gnomeregan, I'd be happy to show you what I have to offer."]="Errr... No te conozco lo suficiente lo siento. Como agente autorizado de mecazancudos solo puedo vender mis monturas a los que son considerados amigos de los gnomos. Si llegas a ser $greconocido:reconocida; como $gamigo:amiga; de Gnomeregan, estaré encantado de enseñarte toda mi oferta."
G["Erm... I really don't know you that well, sorry.  I mean, as an authorized Mechano-strider dealer, I really only can sell my mounts to those people who are considered exalted amongst the gnomes.  If you ever are recognized as exalted to Gnomeregan, I'd be happy to show you what I have to offer."]="Ehh... Realmente no te conozco tan bien, lo siento. Como tratante autorizado de mecazancudos, solo puedo vender mis monturas a aquellos considerados como exaltados entre los gnomos. Si, alguna vez, Gnomeregan te considera $gun exaltado:una exaltada;, estaré encantado de enseñarte lo que tengo que ofrecer."
G["Erma does all the caring for animals around here.  She's right outside the Lion's Pride Inn if you need to speak with her."]="旅店老板艾玛照料着这周围的所有动物。要是你需要跟她交谈的话，就去狮王之傲旅店外面找她。"
G["Err, sorry... Let me put that another way."]="呃，对不起……让我换一种说法。"
G["Err... What was that?"]="呃……那是什么？"
G["Error: Attempt to write to protected memory. Resolution: Move at enemy and self-destruct."]="出错：试图在写保护内存上存储信息。解决方案：向敌人移动并自爆。"
G["Error: Divide by zero. Resolution: SELF DESTRUCT INITIATED."]="出错：除数为零。解决方案：启动自爆程序。"
G["Erunak examines the shard and nods in agreement."]="埃鲁纳克检视着碎片，认同地点了点头。"
G["Erunak! Behind you!"]="埃鲁纳克，在你身后！"
G["Erunak! Noooo!"]="埃鲁纳克！不——！"
G["Erunak! We don't have time for this..."]="埃鲁纳克！我们没时间做这个……"
G["Erunak, take a look at this. This looks like a sufficient focus for the vision magics I was speaking to you about."]="埃鲁纳克，来看看这个。还记得我跟你说过的视象法术吗？这看起来像是个有力的证据。"
G["Esbina will be happy to take care of your animal companion, my friend. She waits outside the inn within Azure Watch."]="Esbina estará contenta de cuidar de tu compañero animal, $gamigo:amiga;. Te espera fuera de la posada, dentro de la Avanzada Azur."
G["Escaping from this place is proving harder than I thought.\n\nWhere do you go when there is nowhere to go in sight?"]="从这地方逃离比我预想中还要难。\n\n当视野之中看不到出路时，你该往哪里走？"
G["Escort Dumass out of the mine safely. Keep Dumass away from webbed humans."]="护送杜马斯安全地离开矿洞。不要让杜马斯靠近那些被网住的人类。"
G["Escort caravans to earn bonus Kor'kron supplies!"]="护送车队以获取额外的库卡隆补给品！"
G["Esha the Loommaiden is renowned for her cloth skills.\n\nShe works in the chamber of masters, to the left as you enter the building.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="织花女士伊莎那一流的制衣手艺人尽皆知。\n\n她在师匠大厅内工作，就位于你进入建筑物时的左侧。\n\n我会在你的地图上标记这个位置。"
G["Especially Hao! Liu Lang once said, \"Noble is he who always asks questions.\""]="¡Sobre todo de Hao! Liu Lang dijo una vez: \"Noble aquel que siempre haga preguntas\"."
G["Especially venoms that affect the mind."]="尤其是影响心智的剧毒。"
G["Essentially that is correct."]="本质上的确如此。"
G["Essentially, it's going to be a long, long time till we are ready to launch.  Maybe you should just head back home to your family."]="事实上，距离发射还需要很长、很长时间。也许你应该调头回家去。"
G["Etched into a tablet of pure gold was the embodiment of my remorse, shame, regret, and sorrow. Unfortunately, the Twilight's Hammer found the tablet and branded me a blasphemer. I was summarily executed, my prayer to Elune incomplete. I am now bound to this world as a spirit, unable to transcend to the Nether; held in this cage as a warning to all that would betray the faith of the Twilight's Hammer."]="我的自责、羞愧、懊悔和悲伤全都刻在这块纯金石板上。不幸的是，暮光之锤找到了石板，并认定我是诅咒者。我被立即处死，而那时我对伊露恩的祷告还没有做完。现在我已经成为了一个游荡的幽灵，无法降入扭曲虚空;我被关在笼子里，用来警告那些试图背叛暮光之锤的人。"
G["Eternal agony awaits you!"]="无尽的痛苦在等待着你！"
G["Eternal damnation is your future."]="永恒的诅咒就是你的下场！"
G["Eternal suffering awaits!"]="永恒的痛苦在等待着你！"
G["Ethereal Summoner"]="灵魂商人"
G["Etu Magmothregar, cha!"]="¡Etu Magmothregar, cha!"
G["Eugh, what do you want? Can't you see I'm busy?"]="¡Uf, qué quieres? ¿No ves que estoy ocupado?"
G["Eunice Burch cooks what passes for food here over in the Trade Quarter. It's your stomach, not mine."]="贸易区的尤奈斯·伯奇是这里的厨师。是你的肚子在叫，不是我的。"
G["Eunice Burch sell leftover parts.  You find her in Trade Quarter."]="尤奈斯·伯奇卖剩下的零部件。你可以到贸易区找她。"
G["Eureka!"]="我知道了！"
G["Eva, I have lost the Spectral Essence. I need another."]="艾瓦，我的鬼灵精华不见了。我需要另外一个。"
G["Evacuate Thunder Bluff!  Stay away from the sides of the bluff!"]="撤离雷霆崖！都别待在绝壁两侧！"
G["Evacuate the city!  Clear the streets of Stormwind!"]="疏散市民！清空暴风城的街道！"
G["Evade, evade!"]="躲避攻击!"
G["Even Frenzyheart know all about you after you come to Sholazar. Maybe you teach Kekek your tricks?"]="在你来到索拉查以后，就连狂心氏族也知道了你的事情。也许你能教科科两招？"
G["Even Hao?"]="甚至是昊？"
G["Even I have my limitations! Go talk to Lavinia Crowe in Undercity if you wish to further your training."]="即使我也有我的局限性！如果你想继续学习的话去找幽暗城的拉文尼亚·克洛文谈谈。"
G["Even a blood elf can hold a sword."]="连血精灵都能挥剑战斗。"
G["Even a simple hozen like Tak-Tak can see that!"]="就连泰克泰克这样单纯的猢狲都看出来了！"
G["Even a target dummy could work faster than you! Pick it up!"]="假人都比你干得快！加快速度！"
G["Even after I gifted him with that form, he insisted on keeping me trapped. He even hoarded all the souls just so I couldn't have any...so stubborn."]="就算我把那形态给了他，他还是坚持要把我困住。他甚至还把所有灵魂都藏了起来，就是为了不让我得到……真是太顽固了。"
G["Even after our mortal flesh had rotted away, it leeched hope from our souls. It was unending!"]="即使我们的肉身腐朽成灰，它依然能从我们的灵魂中汲取希望之力。这折磨无穷无尽！"
G["Even as my health fails me... it's my duty to serve... the Clans!"]="虽然我重病在身……但是我的职责就是……为氏族效力！"
G["Even as we speak, $c, all of the war materiel is being transported over to Silithus. By the looks of things, all of it should arrive in less than $2113w days. After that, a $g hero : heroine; will need to come along and ring the gong at the Scarab Dais. Then the war will begin in earnest."]="Mientras nosotros hablamos, $c, todo el material de guerra está de camino a Silithus. Tal y como van las cosas, el último envío debería llegar en menos de $2113w días. A continuación, $gun:una; valiente tendrá que venir y hacer sonar el gong situado en el Estrado del Escarabajo. Entonces dará comienzo la parte más dura."
G["Even as we speak, $c, all of the war materiel is being transported over to Silithus. By the looks of things, the last of it should arrive in less than a day. After that, a $g hero : heroine; will need to come along and ring the gong at the Scarab Dais. Then the war will begin in earnest."]="Mientras nosotros hablamos, $c, todo el material de guerra está de camino a Silithus. Tal y como van las cosas, el último envío debería llegar en menos de un día. A continuación, $gun:una; valiente tendrá que venir y hacer sonar el gong situado en el Estrado del Escarabajo. Entonces dará comienzo la parte más dura."
G["Even as we speak, Taran Zhu and the Shado-Pan march west. When they find the sha, justice will be done."]="眼下，祝踏岚和影踪派正在向西行进。等他们找到煞之后，正义必将得伸。"
G["Even better news than I was hoping. I look forward to a warm bed."]="比我预期的消息还要好。我需要一张暖床。"
G["Even better than rations. Rest. I thought I'd be out here a while yet."]="比给养还要好——休息。我觉得我一时半会还不会离开这里。"
G["Even better, can you just show me on my map?"]="太好了，你能帮我在地图上标出来吗？"
G["Even big orc general, Nazgrim! He talk so loud! Tak-Tak hear everything!"]="还有那个大个子兽人将军，纳兹戈林！"
G["Even death may die."]="就连死神也会死亡。"
G["Even death will not free you from my grasp!"]="你就算是死了，也休想从我的手心里逃脱！"
G["Even death will not keep me from my duty to watch over the camp..."]="就算是死亡，也不能阻止我履行守护营地的职责……"
G["Even death won't prevent me from uncovering the secrets of my son!"]="即使是死亡也无法阻止我揭开我儿子的秘密！"
G["Even demons are capable of fear..."]="即使是恶魔也会感觉到恐惧……"
G["Even dying here beats spending another day collecting reagents for that madman, Finklestein."]="我宁愿死在这里，也不要为那个疯子芬克斯坦收集材料。"
G["Even foolish hozen know ikk is worse than anything. Don't eat dook, don't touch ikk!"]="即使是最笨的猢狲都知道伊克比什么东西都坏。别吃烂东西，也别碰伊克！"
G["Even here I find myself beset by fools!"]="我竟然被一群傻瓜困住了！"
G["Even here in the wilds, you seek out learning. Your drive for knowledge is an admirable trait."]="即使在这里的荒原里，你仍在寻求知识。你的求知欲是一种令人倾佩的品德。"
G["Even here, among the surf and sun, I can feel the darkness that lurks in these lands.\n\nIt's fascinating, don't you think?"]="就算是在这儿——在这海浪与暖日的环抱下，我都能感觉到在这些土地上涌动的黑暗力量。\n\n这可真有趣儿，你不觉得吗？"
G["Even here, among the surf and sun, I can feel the darkness that lurks in these lands.\n\nIt's fascinating, isn't it?"]="就算是在这儿——在这海浪与暖日的环抱下，我都能感觉到在这些土地上涌动的黑暗力量。\n\n这可真有趣儿，你不觉得吗？"
G["Even if I did, fool, do you think I'd just let you take it from me?  The only way you'd ever get it - if I did possess it - is to pry it from my cold, dead fingers.\n\nThat, my little friend, will not be happening any time soon."]="Incluso si lo tuviera, $gnecio:necia;, ¿acaso crees que te lo daría sin más? La única forma que tendrías de conseguirlo, si yo lo tuviera, sería arrancándomelo de mis dedos, fríos y rígidos.\n\nY eso, mi $gquerido amigo:querida amiga; no ocurrirá pronto."
G["Even if this potion works...  we just can't have worgen running amok in our town, Krennan."]="即使这瓶药能起作用……我们也不能让狼人在我们的城里乱跑，克雷南。"
G["Even if this potion works... we can't just have worgen running around our town, Krennan."]="即使这瓶药能起作用……我们也不能让狼人在我们的城里乱跑，克雷南。"
G["Even if we could defend ourselves they outnumber us! There is no way we will win!"]="即便我们能保护自己，也是寡不敌众！我们绝对赢不了！"
G["Even if you somehow managed to free us without defeating C'Thun, we would focus all of our powers to see the beast banished back to the hell from whence it came - AT ANY COST."]="即使你能设法不打败克苏恩而解救我们，我们也会不惜一切代价将他驱逐回地狱。不惜一切代价。"
G["Even in Darnassus we have noticed the earth is at odds with something."]="即使是在达纳苏斯，我们都感到大地有些不对劲。"
G["Even in death there will be no escape for you!"]="即便在死后，你也无路可逃！"
G["Even in death we serve."]="死后我们忠心不改。"
G["Even in my dreams, I could hear their dark thoughts... HER dark thoughts."]="哪怕是在睡梦中，我都能听见他们的黑暗思想……她的黑暗思想。"
G["Even in my sleep, I hear her terror."]="即使在梦中，我也能听到她的恐惧。"
G["Even in peace there is still war, and many clans still fight beneath the banner of the Warchief. Are you here to add your clan to those that fight for Orgrimmar?"]="即使在和平时期仍然会有战争，而许多氏族仍在酋长的领导下奋勇作战。你是来为奥格瑞玛而战的吗？"
G["Even in ruin, nature remembers. These roots still drink from Elune’s grace."]="Incluso en ruinas, la naturaleza recuerda. Estas raíces aún beben del sagrado favor de Elune."
G["Even in their own time of need, the pandaren have graciously offered to share food and a place by the fire.\n\nThe rest of us could learn a lot from them."]="即便是在困难时期，熊猫人也总是慷慨地与他人分享食物和栖身之所。\n\n我们其他人都该向他们学习。"
G["Even in these bright days after the reign of Kel'thuzad, after the fall of the Lich King: the Brotherhood lives on."]="即使是在克尔苏加德统治结束后这光明的日子里，在巫妖王战败之后——兄弟会仍生生不息。"
G["Even in this remote corner of the world, know that Hellscream's eyes are upon you."]="即使是在这个世界如此偏远的角落里，都不要忘记地狱咆哮的双目在注视着你。"
G["Even in times of great strife like these, food is always needed and appreciated. It makes the hours I spend cooking well worth it."]="即使是在眼下这种战乱时期，人们也仍然需要并享受着美食。我花再长时间烹饪也是值得的。"
G["Even in undeath, you are useless."]="没想到就算变身亡灵，你也这么没用。"
G["Even more reason to believe that he's still alive."]="那我们更有理由相信，他还活着。"
G["Even my talents have a limit, and you have reached it. Congratulations, $n. Your next stop should be Camp Mojache in Feralas. The tauren Hahrana Ironhide lives there; she is renowned for her skill."]="我的才能有限，你也已经达到了。恭喜你，$n。你的下一站应该是菲拉斯的莫沙彻营地。牛头人哈拉纳·铁皮住在那里；她的技术很有声望。"
G["Even now an airship draws near; its arcane payload will flatten Theramore Isle and everyone still standing upon it."]="一艘飞艇正在逼近，上面装载的弹药足以夷平塞拉摩，炸飞岛上所有人。"
G["Even now, da true emperor of Pandaria lives and breathes once more."]="现在，潘达利亚的真命天子要再次降临这个世界了。"
G["Even now, free-willed undead battle the League of Arathor in Arathi Basin.  Will you aid the Defilers in defeating the humans and their Alliance allies?"]="即使是现在，亡灵士兵们依然在阿拉希盆地与阿拉索联军作战。你愿意帮助污染者击败人类和他们的盟军吗？"
G["Even now, in our darkest hour, they mock us!"]="在最黑暗的时刻，他们依然不忘嘲笑我们！"
G["Even now, in the darkest of times, the teachings of the Light will guide you throught this world."]="即使是现在这个最黑暗的时代，圣光的教诲依旧能指引你安然无恙地穿行在这个危险的世界上。"
G["Even now, my power grows. I have long waited for the day when my revenge would be complete."]="我的力量在不断增长。我期待已久的复仇之日总算来临了。"
G["Even now, nothing. Why? Why would the Light forsake the innocent?"]="现在我仍是一无所获。为什么？为什么圣光会抛弃无辜者？"
G["Even now, our ally is working to open the portal on his side. And now, we will begin."]="现在，我们的同盟正在他的世界中为了打开黑暗之门而努力。那么，我们开始吧。"
G["Even now, the elements are tearing you apart - and they shall feed upon your doubts and fears 'til the last spark of life on this wretched world has been snuffed out."]="元素无时不在撕裂你的身体——它们将以你的恐惧和怀疑为食，直到这个悲惨世界上的最后一丝生命之光熄灭为止。"
G["Even now, the true battle between the forces of Light and Darkness approaches. We will all be called to join, and in the face of this conflict, all mortal suffering will be meaningless."]="现在，光明与黑暗之间的决战即将爆发。我们全都会受到召唤，参加这场大战。与它相比，所有凡间的痛苦都将变得毫无意义。"
G["Even now, while our enemies crash and surge all around us - he refuses to move - to act! Go'el, my love... you can be infuriating sometimes."]="即使是现在，无数的敌人在我们周围蠢蠢欲动，他还是拒绝行动。唉，古伊尔……有时你真是惹人生气。"
G["Even on the glacier itself, the sun manages to peek through the gloom. I have hope, Tahu. I think we'll make it through this, no matter how dire it looks."]="即使在荒凉的冰原上，阳光还是能透过昏黑的云幕。我的希望没有泯灭，塔胡。我想，我们能够取得最终的胜利，无论挡在我们面前的敌人是多么可怕。"
G["Even shattered into countless pieces, the crystals all around weaken me... perhaps I should not have underestimated the titans so..."]="即便是碎裂成粉末，这些水晶依然在削弱我的力量……或许我不该低估泰坦的强大……"
G["Even slight alterations to a potion's ingredients can change it fundamentally. Patience and precision, young one: they will serve you well in all walks of life."]="即使轻微地改变药剂的成份也能使它发生根本的变化。耐心和精确，年轻人：他们会让你在所有行业都受益匪浅。"
G["Even the Light is no match for the indomitable will of our people."]="即使是圣光也无法与我们不屈的意志相提并论。"
G["Even the bravest warrior must be well supplied if he is to face his foes with strength!"]="在面对强大的敌人时，即使是最勇敢的士兵也必须拥有充足的装备！"
G["Even the brown skinned orcs take longer to die. What a waste... next!"]="兽人就是皮糙肉厚死得慢。多浪费啊……下一个！"
G["Even the darkest memory fades when confronted!"]="只要敢于面对，即使是最黑暗的回忆也将不再可怕！"
G["Even the forest's lovely flowers were turned against us..."]="就连林中可爱的花朵都与我们作对了……"
G["Even the mighty Thunder King fell before our champion's might."]="就连雷电之王，都倒在这位勇士的脚下。"
G["Even the mighty... can fall."]="再强大的力量……也有衰落的一天。"
G["Even the most superficial glimpse into the secrets I hold would drive you mad, $c."]="对于我所保藏的秘密，即使是最肤浅的一瞥，也能够让你发疯，$c。"
G["Even the skies burn with my fury!"]="就连天空也要在我的怒火中燃烧！"
G["Even the smallest demon can be valuable, in large enough numbers."]="哪怕是最小的恶魔，只要数量够多，也是非常宝贵的助力。"
G["Even the smoke of their burning camp wreaks of futility and shame."]="就连他们那燃烧的营地上空的浓烟，都带着无能和羞耻的味道。"
G["Even the strongest ally can fall to draconic magic."]="哪怕是最强大的盟友也会倒在龙族魔法之下。"
G["Even the toads? Unbelievable!"]="连那些蛤蟆都……？难以置信！"
G["Even the very air is ripe with sadness."]="甚至连空气中都充满了悲伤。"
G["Even the walking dead need to mend themselves. Mary Edras handles it here. She's in the Rogues' Quarter, on the inner ring."]="即使是行尸走肉也需要维护自己的身体。玛丽·艾塔斯精通此道。她就在盗贼区的内环区域。"
G["Even though these presents are empty, they help remind me of old friends and better times."]="虽然这些礼物并没有什么实际用处。但它们还是能让我想起那些老朋友和过去美好的时光。"
G["Even though we are situatated a distance away from the main island, our mission here is still important."]="虽然我们距离主岛很远，但我们在这里的任务是很重要的。"
G["Even together... we failed..."]="即使……联手……我们也败了……"
G["Even verbal."]="当然，只是口头上说说。"
G["Even with enemies at our door step, the light and song of the crystals have sustained us."]="即使敌人兵临城下，水晶散发出的光芒依然鼓舞着我们。"
G["Even with the Aspect of Time on your side, you stumble foolishly into a trap?"]="嗤。仗着时光守护者站在你们那边，你们就敢闯进这陷阱吗？"
G["Even with this fiasco I am once again starting to hit my quota. Something is up with the Stormstout brewery lately in that they haven't been demanding quite as much grain as usual."]="虽然遭遇大败，但我还是要重新准备风暴烈酒酿酒厂的订单。风暴烈酒酿造厂最近似乎出了点问题，因为他们订购的谷物没有过去那么多了。"
G["Even within cold, stone walls such as the ones that shelter this town, one may find tranquility and peace.  In fact, you may find them everywhere you are... simply look inside yourself for such balance."]="即使在冰冷的石头墙内，就像庇护这座城镇的墙一样，人们仍旧可以找到宁静与和平。事实上，你可以在你所在的任何地方找到他们……只需在你体内寻找这种平衡。"
G["Even you must admit that your information from defectors is outdated and unreliable.  Let us make calculated attacks on these manaforges and gather what information we can."]="连你都必须承认你从背叛者那得来的信息是过时的，而且是不可靠的。我们应该有计划地进攻这些法力熔炉，并尽可能收集一切情报。"
G["Even your own blood can be made to serve!"]="就连你自己的鲜血都能派上用处！"
G["Even your strongest warriors succumb like lambs to the slaughter."]="就连最强大的战士，也像待宰羔羊瑟瑟发抖。"
G["Evenin', Gov'na."]="晚上好。"
G["Event heard. Spawn, damn you!"]="我知道了。该死！"
G["Eventually he grew very old, and visited Pandaria one final time."]="最后他变得非常老迈，最后一次造访了潘达利亚。"
G["Eventually, the Thunder King fell, and the Bell changed hands. Many tried to use its power. Some tried to silence its sound. All failed."]="后来，雷电之王陨落，圣钟几易其手。许多人觊觎它的力量。也有人想让它永远沉寂。可他们都失败了。"
G["Eventually, we will fight this battle for Andorhal, and only one of us can walk off of this battlefield victorious."]="最终，我们将为安多哈尔而战，我们之中只有一人能载誉离开这个战场。"
G["Ever been to Kun-Lai before? It's great. Long flowing farmlands. Beautiful mountains. And absolutely nothing dangerous whatsoever."]="以前到过昆莱吗？昆莱是个好地方。绵延不绝的农田。巍峨秀美的山脉。而且一点儿危险也没有。"
G["Ever been to the Brewmoon Festival? It's a real treat. I'm preparing a big batch of my Kun-Lai Kicker for the celebration.\n\nWant to join me in Binan Village?"]="你欢庆过酿月祭吗？那真是个大饱口福的好机会。我正在为这佳节准备一大批昆莱劲酒。\n\n想来滨岸村加入我吗？"
G["Ever heard of the Thorium Brotherhood?  Sure, we might look a lot like those dwarves down in the gorge, or in Blackrock Depths, but trust me: we're not anything like them.\n\nThose scoundrels dug too deep, and now they serve a darker force: Ragnaros, the Firelord.  We're happy to be more independent of will and purpose, although most of the time our purpose ends up being the prevention of whatever trouble they're causing."]="有没有听说过瑟银兄弟会？当然，我们可能很像山谷中和黑石深渊里的那些矮人。但相信我：我们和他们根本不是一种人。\n\n那些恶棍挖得太深。现在，他们愚昧地侍奉着一股黑暗的力量——拉格纳罗斯，炎魔君主。我们很高兴自己能有独立的意志。虽然在大多数时间里，我们不得不将自己的全部精力都用来弥补那些恶棍所犯下的罪行。"
G["Ever make a shark so mad it got out of the water and chased you on land?"]="你以前惹急过鲨鱼，让它跳出水来在陆地上追你吗？"
G["Ever met Tartek? He one of our best fighters... leads in the northwest. I hear he captured one of the dragon things. No lie, I a little jealous."]="你见过塔尔特克吗？他是氏族最优秀的战士之一……他统领着西北部的土地。我听说他还捕获过龙。说实话，我有点嫉妒他。"
G["Ever see a kracken before? Old Jin claims to have caught one, once upon a time, but let it go on acount of it looked too \"gamey.\"\n\nWe have a betting pool going to see if he ever finds it again."]="¿Alguna vez has visto un kraken? El viejo Jin dice haber pescado uno hace mucho tiempo, pero lo dejó escapar porque \"apestaba.\"\n\nHemos hecho una porra sobre si lo volverá a encontrar o no."
G["Ever since I crash landed on this shore, I been wanderin' all over, $r!\n\nI've been all the way from the Temple o' the Jade Serpent to the Krasarang coast to the top o' Mount Neverest herself!\n\nThis land is quite remarkable, and I been cataloging all o' my findings.\n\nI can't wait to tell my fellow colleagues at the Explorer's League about everything I've seen!"]="我自从溃败流落以这个海岸，便一直流浪。$r！\n\n一直以来，我从青龙寺到卡桑琅海岸，再到不息山山顶。\n\n这个地方很有名，我已经整理了我的所有发现。\n\n我迫不及待地将我的所见所闻告诉我探险者协会协会的同事！"
G["Ever since his arrival from Drak'Tharon, the master has spoken of the time you would be joining him here."]="主人从达克萨隆来到这里时，就预言了你到此造访的时间。"
G["Ever since the Vale opened up its gates, we've been sending shipment after shipment of vegetables north."]="自从锦绣谷的大门开启，我们就在源源不断地向北方供应蔬菜。"
G["Ever since the shadows claimed Duskwood I haven't been able to sleep. I am kept awake by the ghostly sounds of screaming on the breeze. It sounds almost like lambs screaming, and they won't stop."]="自从阴影占据了暮色森林我就一直无法入睡。我总是被风中传来的可怕尖叫声惊醒。那听起来好像羔羊的叫声，而且声音从不会停止。"
G["Ever since, now and then, people claim he's spoken to them and told them to get the eye..."]="从那以后，时常会有人声称听到他跟他们说话，让他们去把眼睛拿来……"
G["Ever tried boiled butter battered kracken legs? Best thing ever."]="你尝过黄油海怪腿吗？真是世间美味。"
G["Ever trip over own feet? We have. Kind of hurt. No do it, not fun. Nope."]="你被自己绊倒过吗？我们有过这样的经历诶。有点痛。不好玩，我们不要再绊倒了。"
G["Ever vigilant in their protection of the natural world, the druids are guided by Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm who resides in the Cenarion Enclave.  You will find him and the other Druid trainers in the northern section of Darnassus."]="居住于塞纳里奥区的德鲁伊一直在大德鲁伊鹿盔的领导下警惕地保卫着自然界。你可以在达那苏斯北部找到他和别的德鲁伊训练师。"
G["Ever wonder what we do with all our obsolete robots? We send them to their deaths in bloody gladiatorial arenas, of course! Here comes Blingtron 3000!"]="想知道我们是怎么处理报废机器人的吗？当然是把他们送到血腥的竞技场来送死了！现在进场的是，布林顿3000！"
G["Eversong Woods, Dalfors. I'm thinking about how beautiful it was before Arthas cut a swathe of death through it..."]="永歌森林，达尔弗斯。我至今仍然记得，在阿尔萨斯将死亡的气息散播到那片森林之前，她是多么的美丽……"
G["Every Life Rocket comes with a two-year contract and FREE non-arbitration clause!"]="每个求生火箭的合同期为两年，一切合同条款最终解释权以及仲裁权属于锈水财阀！"
G["Every Shado-Pan knows one another by name. We have trained together, fought together, and survived together.\n\nWhen you can say the same, then perhaps you are ready to join our brotherhood."]="每一个影踪派战士都能叫出彼此的名字。我们一同训练，并肩作战，同生共死。\n\n当你能做到这一点时，或许就做好了加入我们的准备。"
G["Every Shado-Pan makes three eternal oaths:\nTo defend this land, to protect its people, and to train their pupil.\nWhen a Shado-Pan dies, they must be released from these bonds."]="Todos los Shadopan hacen tres juramentos eternos:\n\nDefender esta tierra, proteger a su gente y entrenar a sus pupilos.\n\nCuando un Shadopan muerte, debe ser liberado de estas obligaciones."
G["Every action creates a reaction. Do you see what your actions have created?"]="任何行为都会引发后果。你知道自己的行为已经酿成什么后果了吗？"
G["Every bodies coming..."]="每个人都正在赶来……"
G["Every day I archive something new, and something old. Sometimes it is an ancient scroll of wisdom. Sometimes it is a painting of the Vale an Inkmaster made.\n\nWe preserve the lore so that future generations will learn from our successes... and our failures."]="我每天都存入各种新旧资料。有时是古老的智慧书卷，有时则是某位墨水大师创作的山谷写生图。\n\n我们保存着这些知识，以便让后人能从我们的成功……和失败中借鉴一二。"
G["Every day I ask myself: \"What's the right thing to do?\""]="Cada día me pregunto: \"¿Qué será lo correcto?\""
G["Every day is a test, and this day is no different. If you pass this test, I will share some of my knowledge..."]="每天都是考验，这天也不例外。如果你通过这次测试，我会教你一些知识……"
G["Every dish is more delicious than the last!"]="每顿饭都要比上一顿更加美味！"
G["Every elder reaches the day where he must pass on and plant his stave with the staves of his ancestors. Today is the day when my staff joins these woods."]="每位长者都会有离世的一天。在那之前，他必须将自己的禅杖和祖先们的种在一起。今天，我的禅杖也将种入此林。"
G["Every few days Xuen hosts a tournament of strength. Only the strongest and most brave challengers from across Pandaria dare compete."]="雪怒每隔几天就会举办一场力量大赛。只有全潘达利亚最强大最勇敢的挑战者才敢前去比试。"
G["Every few seconds, many of the nearby runes will burst with fire."]="每隔几秒钟，附近的许多符文都将起火爆炸。"
G["Every few years, he returned - with tales of mysterious cities in the sand, nomadic people living on endless grassy plains, a great empire under the ice, and a magical kingdom gilded in gold."]="他每隔几年便回来——讲述旅途中的奇遇：沙漠中的神秘城市，无边草原上的游牧民族，寒冰之下的伟大帝国，还有黄金镀成的神奇王国。"
G["Every generation, the mantid swarm the Serpent's Spine wall in great numbers. They murder many pandaren, so we kill many times their number in return. Yet each generation, they attack once more. Why do they do this?"]="螳螂妖世代都汇集大军涌上蟠龙脊。它们杀死许多熊猫人，于是我们加倍奉还。可它们的后代又会卷土重来。为何要如此？"
G["Every item that I have for sale I acquired myself.  You have my personal guarantee of authenticity."]="我出售的每项物品都是我自己的劳动所得。我向你保证。"
G["Every life is a thread, and the tapestry we weave together is the story of our world. The pandaren lorewalkers know this more than any other. Just look at this library! So many stories..."]="每个生命都是一条线，而把我们交织起来，就构成了这个世界的故事。熊猫人游学者对此的理解无人能及。看看这个图书馆吧！这么多故事……"
G["Every line, every stroke, helps define an image. It separates thought from parchment and seizes the attention of a viewer."]="每一笔一划，都表达了一个意象。它让人们的思想跃然纸上，吸引了观看者的注意力。"
G["Every orc you slay today will bring honor to them, and to every soldier who has come before you."]="击败那些兽人，送他们去追求荣耀，以此告慰每一名阵亡的士兵。"
G["Every pandaren must search out and uncover their own fate. Whether a warrior or a farmer, we each have a place that suits us, and each place carries a unique importance."]="所有熊猫人都要探寻并确认自己的命运。无论是战士还是农夫，总有一个适合我们的角色，每个角色都具有独一无二的重要性。"
G["Every reprisal is itself an act of aggression, and every act of aggression triggers immediate reprisal."]="每一次报复本身就是一次侵略，而每一次侵略又会立刻引来报复。"
G["Every sacrifice brings more of the master's heralds into this world. (The hives sing of madness, of chaos!)"]="每一个祭品都会让更多主人的使者进入这个世界。（巢穴一片疯狂，一片混乱！）"
G["Every scrap used makes us less wasteful and brings us closer to the Earth Mother.  Mooranta can show you the way.  Seek her just outside the Thunder Bluff Armorers on the middle rise."]="充分利用每块碎片会让我们更加节约并会拉近我们和大地母亲的距离。莫兰塔会教给你方法。到中部高地上的雷霆崖兵器库外面可以找到她。"
G["Every soldier matters."]="每个士兵都很重要。"
G["Every speck of suffering in my life is YOUR PATHETIC FAULT! I SHOULD KILL YOU!"]="我生命中每一道痛苦的伤痕都是你造成的！我应该杀掉你！"
G["Every strike should deliver your final intent."]="每一击都应传达你的最终意图。"
G["Every time I close my eyes I see the scourge surrounding me!\n\nI gotta get outta here...."]="一闭上眼睛，就浮现出我被天灾士兵包围的景象！\n\n我要离开这个鬼地方……"
G["Every time I fix this mailbox, it's vandalized again within a day."]="每次我修好邮箱之后，不到一天它就又坏掉了。"
G["Every troll for himself, mon!"]="朋友，各自保命吧！"
G["Every two years the Spirits of Competition grow especially fervent... and now is that time! Both Alliance and Horde wear this tabard into the Battlegrounds to honor the spirits, seeking to defeat all enemies and earn their favor."]="每两年竞争之魂就会变得特别狂躁……喏，就是现在！我们要穿上这件战袍进入战场并击败敌人，以此获得竞争之魂的青睐。"
G["Every two years the Spirits of Competition grow especially fervent... and now is that time! We wear this tabard into the Battlegrounds to honor them, seeking to defeat our enemies and earn their favor."]="每两年竞争之魂就会变得特别狂躁……喏，就是现在！我们要穿上这件战袍进入战场并击败敌人，以此获得竞争之魂的青睐。"
G["Every villager counts. Without each grain of sand we would have no beach to enjoy the ocean from."]="每个村民都算在内。不积沙粒，何来享受海滨美景的广阔沙滩。"
G["Every warrior that falls is one more for our mighty army.  There is no victory against us."]="你们倒下的伙伴将为亡灵大军注入新鲜的血液。你们没有希望获胜。"
G["Every year, I make the pilgrimage to Hallow Wind Abbey to pay tribute to the Holy Light. I will not return to Northshire without fulfilling that duty."]="Cada año, hago el viaje a la Abadía del Viento Soplado para rendir tributo a la Luz Sagrada. No regresaré a Northshire sin cumplir ese deber."
G["Everybody do the Ook!"]="你啊我啊，屁股扭起来！"
G["Everybody fighting in the good way. Everybody drinking. Everybody happy!"]="大家都在努力战斗。大家都在开怀畅饮。大家都很开心！"
G["Everybody gets one..."]="每个人都有一个……"
G["Everybody is dying! Help us!"]="大家都会没命的！救救我们！"
G["Everybody left. Nobody likes you."]="大家都走了。没人喜欢你。"
G["Everybody loves a pool pony. It's our fastest selling toy behind the Kablooey Bombs: Infant Edition."]="所有人都喜欢小马泳圈。紧随在不靠谱炸弹：未成年人版之后，它是我们这里的销量亚军。"
G["Everybody nice here... Chee Chee like that."]="这里的人都很好……吱吱喜欢这里。"
G["Everybody on board! This caravan's leaving for the Mor'shan Rampart!"]="所有人都准备好了！商队将前往莫尔杉农场！"
G["Everybody onboard the ships now!"]="所有人，立刻登船！"
G["Everybody panic!"]="所有人都慌了！"
G["Everybody settle down! We're doing our best to get the situation under control. Them bleedin' orcs are unrelenting!"]="大家安静一些！我们正在尽全力控制局势。那些该死的兽人是不可饶恕的！"
G["Everybody try to keep de Amani Empire down. Now we got friends. We wit de Zandalari now. We part of something bigger. You can't stop us all. De whole world gonna drown in blood!!"]="所有人都想毁灭阿曼尼帝国。但现在，我们有盟友了。我们和赞达拉一同战斗，我们更加强大了！你们无法阻止我们！整个世界都将溺毙在鲜血中！"
G["Everybody, stop your attacks!"]="所有人，停止攻击！"
G["Everyone I know seems to be coming down with something really bad."]="我身边的人似乎都染上了重病。"
G["Everyone always says, \"Horton, why do you drive a boat up and down the river?\" I ask them, \"Why don't you?\"  ... that's usually where I run out of witty retorts."]="Todo el mundo me dice: \"Horton, ¿por qué llevas un barco río arriba y río abajo?\", y yo les pregunto: \"¿Y por qué tú no?\"... Ahí es donde me suelo quedar sin réplicas ingeniosas."
G["Everyone around me only pretends to like me."]="我周围的所有人都是假装喜欢我。"
G["Everyone be here now. Let's get dis done wit."]="大家到齐了。我们开始吧。"
G["Everyone calm down! Compose yourselves! There is no conspiracy at play here! The warlock acted on his own volition, outside of influences from the Alliance. The tournament must go on!"]="大家冷静！不要慌乱！这并不是什么阴谋！这名术士只是在按照自己的意愿行事，并不是联盟的授意。比赛必须继续！"
G["Everyone clear!"]="大家让开！"
G["Everyone else! If you can hold a weapon, protect the village! Don't let them past this line! You..."]="其他人！如果你们拿得动武器，就去保护村庄！别让他们越过防线！你们……"
G["Everyone enjoying themselves so far?  That's great!  Welcome to the Darkmoon Faire, the greatest show in all of Outland!  Make sure that you speak with Yebb and his friends here while you're taking in Neblegear's Darkmoon Zoo Bizarre."]="大家玩得还开心吗？很好！欢迎来到外域最精彩的盛会——暗月马戏团！记得与亚布·尼比盖尔和他的朋友谈谈。"
G["Everyone enjoying themselves so far?  That's great!  Welcome to the Darkmoon Faire, the greatest show on all of Azeroth!  Make sure that you speak with Yebb and his friends here while you're taking in Neblegear's Darkmoon Zoo Bizarre."]="每个人都还玩得开心吧？棒极了！欢迎来到暗月马戏团，艾泽拉斯最盛大的展览！当你在尼比盖尔的珍奇馆购物时记得跟亚布和他的朋友谈谈。"
G["Everyone fights.  No one quits."]="所有人都要奋战到底，永不退缩。"
G["Everyone gather 'round for a group hug."]="大家都过来抱一抱吧。"
G["Everyone got a plan until dey get punched in da tusks..."]="每个人都有自己的小心思，直到他们的獠牙上被揍了这么一拳……"
G["Everyone has a weakness, it's just a matter of finding it."]="每个人都有弱点，关键是如何要找到它。"
G["Everyone has left you."]="所有人都抛弃你了。"
G["Everyone here gets the standard warrior training, but I think I'm more suited to stealth missions."]="这里的所有人都会接受标准的战士训练，可我觉得我更合适隐秘任务。"
G["Everyone is dead... Everyone and everything..."]="所有人都死了……所有的生灵……"
G["Everyone is falling ill - this is an epidemic!"]="所有人都病倒了——这是天灾！"
G["Everyone look! I won a Brawler's Guild invite! I can't wait to try it out!"]="大家快看！我赢得了搏击俱乐部的邀请函！我已经等不及要去试试身手了！"
G["Everyone look, it's $n!"]="大家看，是$n！"
G["Everyone looks ready. Remember, these people are all infected with the plague and will die soon. We must purge Stratholme to protect the remainder of Lordaeron from the Scourge. Let's go."]="大家都做好准备了吧。记住，斯坦索姆的城民已经受到感染，很快就会丧命。我们必须清洗斯坦索姆，确保洛丹伦的其它地区免受天灾军团的侵蚀。出发吧。"
G["Everyone loves Martar!"]="人人都爱马尔泰！"
G["Everyone loves those crazy Brewfest racing rams. Want to know more? Talk to Driz Tumblequick down by the ram stable. Have a blast and earn some Brewfest Prize Tokens while you're at it!"]="每个人都喜欢那些疯狂的美酒节赛羊。想要了解更多信息吗？去和羊圈旁的德利兹·塔波奎克谈谈吧。享受一点乐趣，并获取一些美酒节奖币！"
G["Everyone out before more of them show up!"]="趁现在敌人还不多，大家快离开这儿！"
G["Everyone quiet down, let Hsieh speak."]="大家安静下来，听谢说。"
G["Everyone ready?"]="都准备好了吗？"
G["Everyone ready? Let's roll!"]="所有人都准备好了吗？出发咯！"
G["Everyone says you had a fight with the warchief and you're going to abandon the Horde. Is that true?"]="大家都说你和酋长起了争执，将要抛弃部落。那是真的吗？"
G["Everyone started dropping like flies... everyone who ate the rations."]="人们开始纷纷倒毙……那些吃过食物的人全都没能幸免。"
G["Everyone succumbs in the end."]="所有人都得死。"
G["Everyone take up positions! Enemies surround us on all sides! There is no time to waste."]="所有人，各就各位！我们周围都是敌人！千万不能够浪费时间了。"
G["Everyone to arms! The mogu are attacking!"]="所有人都武装起来！魔古族攻过来了！"
G["Everyone! Advance!"]="全体前进！"
G["Everyone! Send everything! Slaughter these cowards, they are making us look like fools!"]="全体都有，全力进攻！他们在愚弄我们，杀了这些懦夫！"
G["Everyone's a critic, ladies."]="女士们，每个人都可以有自己的看法。"
G["Everyone's gotta drink. What can we get for you?"]="所有人都要喝酒。我们能为你做些什么呢？"
G["Everyone, calm down. This sounds like one of Garrosh's traps. He's trying to lure us from the beach. Troteman? Round me up some peasants and a mortar team, and don't let down your guard."]="大家冷静。这恐怕是加尔鲁什的陷阱。他想把我们引出海滩。托德曼？去组织农夫和迫击炮小队，不要放松守卫。"
G["Everyone, cheer!"]="大家欢呼吧！"
G["Everyone, fall back! FALL BA-"]="所有人，退后！退……"
G["Everyone, please cheer for the NEW CHAMPIONS of the Arena of Annihilation!"]="所有人，请为破军比武场的新冠军欢呼！"
G["Everyone, please remain calm..."]="各位，请保持冷静……"
G["Everyone, regroup back at the camp. Our work here is done."]="大家回营地休整。我们的任务完成了。"
G["Everyone, stay together. Stay focused."]="所有人，相互靠拢，集中精力。"
G["Everyone, to the parachutes!"]="全部准备跳伞！"
G["Everyone... back to Splintertree at once!"]="所有人……立刻返回碎木岗哨！"
G["Everything I am, I owe to Arthas. I savor the moment when I can repay him for this torment.\n\nI have longed for the time when the Forsaken could take the fight against the Scourge to Northrend, but we need the rest of the Horde's support. Our numbers are not great unless bolstered by the other races in our alliance.\n\nArthas's latest attack on the Horde will hopefully convince Thrall to declare war on Icecrown. He'll have my support when that happens."]="我的遭遇全拜阿尔萨斯所赐。我要让他尝到被折磨的痛苦滋味。\n\n一直以来，我都盼望着被遗忘者能在诺森德与天灾军团决一死战，但是我们需要部落的支持。我们的军队数量严重不足，必须得到盟友的援助。\n\n阿尔萨斯对部落的这次进攻或许能让萨尔认清局势，最终决定对冰冠冰川宣战。那时，我会毫不犹豫地支持他。"
G["Everything I have done... has been for Azeroth...."]="我所做的一切……都是为了艾泽拉斯……"
G["Everything has a spirit, if you learn to listen to it you can get it to take any shape you want. Blacksmithing isn't about beating metal, forcing it to do your will. It's about listening to the spirit within the steel and guiding it to the shape you know it wants to take."]="所有东西都有灵魂，如果学会聆听它们的声音，你就可以随心所欲地使用它们的力量。锻造并不是击打金属并将其改变成自己想要的形状那么简单，你必须倾听钢铁的声音，然后指引它，让它为你所用。"
G["Everything has been leading to this, $n. You must not fail, or all is lost and we will die with this island."]="天意如此，$n。你必须获胜，否则我们将落得一败涂地，与这座岛屿一同消亡。"
G["Everything here is completely on the up and up!"]="这里的一切都完全是光明正大的！"
G["Everything hurts. Please, make it stop..."]="疼死我了。请想想办法……"
G["Everything is fine.  Look, there's too much to explain..."]="一切都很好。你瞧，要解释起来话可就长了……"
G["Everything is going according to schedule.  Prince Kael'thas should be pleased."]="所有事情都正按照日程进行着。凯尔萨斯王子会感到非常高兴的。"
G["Everything is in place. We'll construct a town center on this peninsula, using resources from along the coast."]="万事俱备。我们要利用海岸上的资源在这座半岛中央建一座城镇。"
G["Everything is in readiness, warbringer."]="万事俱备了，战争使者。"
G["Everything is ok, you can go."]="一切正常，你可以走了。"
G["Everything is set up and ready to go."]="一切都准备就绪啦。"
G["Everything is so nice!"]="每样东西都很漂亮！"
G["Everything looks so good."]="这些看起来都很棒。"
G["Everything makes you hungry, Xiao."]="每样东西都让你很饿，晓。"
G["Everything must burn. None shall know of the Scarlet Crusade's shame!"]="烧光一切。血色十字军的耻辱不得外泄！"
G["Everything okay?"]="一切顺利吗？"
G["Everything seems ok, you may go now."]="看上去没有问题，你可以走了。"
G["Everything seems to be in order here."]="这里的一切都很井井有条。"
G["Everything suddenly seems... brighter."]="一切似乎都忽然……变亮了。"
G["Everything that has happened since the crash is little more than a blur. It seems like a lifetime ago that I was aboard the Exodar.\n\nNow, my reality is restricted to this island with its mutant creatures and endless sea of blood elf agents. Soon, it will be as if I've never known anything different..."]="自从坠毁之后，我看什么东西都是模糊一片。仿佛登上埃索达已经是很久很久以前的事情了。\n\n现在，我的世界中充满了变异的生物和无尽的血精灵。很快，也许我就不会记得任何别的东西了……"
G["Everything that we have, we have fought for tooth and tentacle... Retaking Telaar from the orcs and then the ogres was no easy task."]="我们所拥有的一切都是浴血奋战换来的……我们从兽人手中夺回了塔拉，随后却面临食人魔的挑衅，这帮家伙就不那么容易对付了。"
G["Everything that you are is MINE to destroy!"]="我要摧毁你们拥有的一切！"
G["Everything was goin' great! I felt like we was really bonding."]="一切都非常顺利！我觉得我们真是最佳搭档。"
G["Everything was shaking all over the place. I could hardly steady my gun."]="我感觉周围的景象在颤抖，差点抓不住手中的枪。"
G["Everything's been so strange lately..."]="最近发生的事情都很奇怪……"
G["Everything's going to be fine, Feknut. You'll see."]="一切都会好起来的，菲纳特。别担心。"
G["Everything's gone to crap, $n. This was supposed to be a simple recon mission."]="一切都搞砸了，$n。这原本只是一项简单的侦查任务。"
G["Everything's in order. You're free to go."]="没有问题，你可以走了。"
G["Everywhere I look I see thieves.  We, The People's Miltia, must return this land to the farmers."]="这里到处都是盗贼。我们人民军必须把他们占据的土地还给农夫们。"
G["Everywhere I look, the rivers have dried."]="我目光所及，河流纷纷干涸。"
G["Evidence indicates a significant battle. The opponent of Watcher Freya estimated to be of similar size and strength to Watcher Freya."]="种种迹象表明神殿曾发生过激战。估计守护者弗蕾亚的对手在体型和力量上都与她不相上下。"
G["Evil makes me so sleepy..."]="邪恶的力量让我昏昏欲睡……"
G["Eviscerate them! Our gods will drink their blood!"]="剐了他们！众神将畅饮他们的鲜血！"
G["Evol Fingers must pay! For the love of profit, $n, help me!"]="艾沃·邪指一定要为此付出代价！为了我的利润，$n，请帮帮我！"
G["Ew, boys are gross!"]="呃，男孩子们真毛躁！"
G["Eww!"]="呃！"
G["Eww! Get away from me, you nasty thing!"]="呃！离我远点，你这个脏东西！"
G["Eww.  That cub has a funny face."]="呃。那个小鬼长得真滑稽。"
G["Eww... $r!"]="呃……$r！"
G["Eww... that's not a fish!"]="呃……这不是鱼！"
G["Eww... they look like maggots."]="呃……它们看起来像蛆虫。"
G["Ewwww!"]="真恶心！！！"
G["Ewwwww... not if you were the last orc on Kalimdor, Lunk."]="呃……除非你是卡利姆多大陆上的最后一个兽人，隆克。"
G["Exactly as I had planned."]="跟我预想的完全一样。"
G["Exactly what I wanted to hear. Let's go."]="这正是我想要听到的。出发吧。"
G["Exactly!"]="正是！"
G["Exactly. I ran some tests on the residual digestive fluid coating my suit and...\n<Finkle trails off>\nSay, you haven't seen my skinning knife anywhere, have you? I seem to have misplaced it."]="Exacto. He realizado algunas pruebas en los residuos de fluido digestivo que cubrían mi traje y...\n\n<Finkle pierde el hilo>\n\nDime, ¿has visto mi cuchillo para desollar por alguna parte? No sé dónde lo he dejado."
G["Exactly. The traditions of the sapmasters reach back through countless generations. I am but one link in a chain of sap-thirsty pandaren.\n\nSometimes, however, I fear that I may be the final link."]="没错。树脂大师的起源可追溯到无数世代以前。我在广大渴求树脂的熊猫人中，只是一位无名小卒。\n\n但有时候，我担心自己也许是最后一代传人了。"
G["Exactly. Time is frozen in perpetuity. Cause and effect - rendered all but meaningless."]="没错。时间在此凝固。万物难逃因果，因果本是虚无。"
G["Exalted."]="崇拜。"
G["Examine his goods."]="检查他的货物。"
G["Examine the body."]="检查尸体。"
G["Examine the chest."]="查看这只箱子。"
G["Examine the object."]="检查该物品。"
G["Examine the pylon."]="检查这座水晶塔。"
G["Examine the remains."]="检查遗骸。"
G["Examine the statue"]="检查雕像"
G["Examines a steaming pile of smelly stuff on the ground."]="检查地上那堆冒着热气的臭东西。"
G["Examining"]="检查"
G["Examining the corpse, you conclude that this must be Blood Knight Dawnstar, the leader of the failed assault on Deatholme."]="检查了尸体之后，你断定这就是伊斯塔·晨星，进攻戴索姆却惨遭失败的血骑士。"
G["Exarch, have we taken the Sun's Reach Harbor yet?"]="主教，我们有没有拿下阳湾港口？"
G["Excellent day for a foray into the field wouldn't you say, $g sir : ma'am;?"]="Un día excelente para una incursión en el campo, ¿no le parece, $gseñor:señora;?"
G["Excellent focus, $n."]="Buena concentración."
G["Excellent move!"]="漂亮！"
G["Excellent news, Tooki! We're saved!"]="太好了，图基！我们得救了！"
G["Excellent news. Our studies of this site's energies and artifacts have begun to pay off.\n\nWe have unraveled some understanding of the mogu devices found here, and even better, a way to turn them in our favor. The very walls of this structure will siphon and sap the might of any enemies within."]="真是好消息。我们对这里的能量和神器的研究有回报了。\n\n我们已经对在这里找到的魔古族装置有所了解，更令人振奋的是，还找到了让它们为我所用的方法。这座建筑的围墙会汲取和削弱任何置身其中的敌人的力量。"
G["Excellent work down there. Top notch. Now I've got some other matters for ya if'n your thinkin' your up to some more skullbashin'?"]="在那儿干得不错啊。上乘之作。如果你打算对更多的敌人迎头痛击的话，我现在正好有些任务要交给你。"
G["Excellent work with the celestials. Can you believe how chatty they were?"]="你表现得很好。没想到至尊天神居然都这么啰嗦。"
G["Excellent work!"]="真是精彩！"
G["Excellent work! I'll be in touch soon."]="干得好！我很快会再联系你。"
G["Excellent work! I'll unload the goods. You should check in with Kranal Fiss."]="干得好！我会负责卸货。你应该去找一趟卡纳尔·菲斯。"
G["Excellent work! Let's see what these pandaren homesteaders are capable of."]="了不起！让我们看看这些熊猫人农夫的本事吧。"
G["Excellent work! Protect the forge - I am almost finished."]="干得好！保护熔炉——我就快完成了。"
G["Excellent work! We've secured the rest of the base."]="干得好！我们守住了基地其它区域。"
G["Excellent work, $n. Let's find the exit. I think I know the way. Follow me!"]="干得很好，$n。让我们去找出口吧。我想我知道该怎么走，跟着我！"
G["Excellent work, champions! We shall set up our base camp in these chambers. My magi will get the Scourge transport device working shortly. Step inside it when you are ready for your next mission. I will meet you on the other side."]="干得漂亮，勇士们！我们将在这些房间里建立营地。我的人很快就能让这架天灾传送器恢复工作。准备好就站进去。我和新的任务会在目的地等着你。"
G["Excellent work, champions! We shall set up our base camp in these chambers. My magi will get the Scourge transport device working shortly. Step inside when you are ready for your next mission. I will meet you on the other side."]="干得漂亮，勇士们！我们将在这些房间里建立营地。我的人很快就能让这架天灾传送器恢复工作。准备好就站进去。我和新的任务在目的地等着你。"
G["Excellent work, friend. You've proven that a single skilled assassin can strike a decisive blow where a whole army may fail."]="干得好，朋友。你证明了自己是一名优秀的刺客。你的致命一击能成就一支大军所不能成就的伟业。"
G["Excellent work."]="干得非常好。"
G["Excellent work. Don't let up!"]="干得好。不要松懈！"
G["Excellent work. The fire of my heart glows with a brilliant purity unmatched; every spark of it I will channel into the Dragon Soul."]="干得好。我心中的火焰将迸发出无比纯净的光芒；每一束火花都将被引导至巨龙之魂中。"
G["Excellent!"]="太棒了！"
G["Excellent!  Fresh parts!"]="太棒了！新鲜的零件！"
G["Excellent!  You are almost ready my pet."]="¡Excelente! Casi estás $gpreparado:preparada;."
G["Excellent!  You shall be doing the League of Arathor a great service in ridding Arathi Basin of The Defilers and their Horde thugs.  Seek out the Lady Hoteshem in the royal audience chamber of Stormwind Keep.  She has been expecting you, $n."]="太好了！在阿拉希盆地一役中，你将帮助阿拉索联军战胜污染者和部落那群乌合之众。去暴风要塞的皇家觐见室找赫塔希姆吧。她正等着你呢，$n。"
G["Excellent! Can you feel the power of this crystal? I can almost feel my hair standing on end."]="好极了！你能感觉到这块水晶中的能量吗？我感觉我的头发都要竖起来了。"
G["Excellent! I've been hopin' for a new student. Well, let's get started right away then!"]="很好！我一直希望收个新学生。那么就让我们立刻开始吧！"
G["Excellent! Let me know when you are ready for the next attempt."]="你干得真漂亮！等你再次准备好以后，就立刻通知我。"
G["Excellent! Now your customer will happily eat the noodle soup you've made for them. When they're done they'll leave happy."]="好极了！现在你的客人就会开心地品尝你为他们煮的面了。吃完之后，他们也会高高兴兴地离开。"
G["Excellent! The materials are prepared.  Follow me."]="好！材料准备好了。跟我来。"
G["Excellent! We will begin the ritual at once!"]="太好了！我们马上就开始仪式！"
G["Excellent! You meet the required parameters and specifications. What can I do for you?"]="很好！你达到了要求的参数和规格。我可以为你做些什么吗？"
G["Excellent, $n!  You shall find Brogun Stoneshield on the Warrior's Terrace.  He can help you to get to Alterac Valley."]="$n，布洛冈·石盾在战士区，他能帮助你前往奥特兰克山谷。"
G["Excellent, a shipment of stone. Send it to Orgrimmar!"]="好极了，一车石料。快送到奥格瑞玛去！"
G["Excellent, another sacrificial lamb."]="啧啧，送上门来的祭品。"
G["Excellent, another stone to grind!"]="不错，又是一颗要碾碎的石子！"
G["Excellent, fresh blood has arrived."]="太好了，终于有新鲜的血了。"
G["Excellent, it's party time!"]="太棒了，宴会时间到了！"
G["Excellent, you have proven yourself worthy! Now for the next phase of your instruction..."]="很好，你已经证明了你自己！现在进入下一阶段的授课……"
G["Excellent.  The work that you do now will allow us to join our brethren in Ogri'la, above, one day."]="太好了。你现在所从事的事业，终有一天会让我们加入奥格瑞拉的同伴们。"
G["Excellent.  What's the lowdown?  Do we have a bodycount?"]="很好。那么结果如何呢？"
G["Excellent. $n, you are going to make a fine $c. McBride will teach you everything that you will need to know to join the ranks of the Stormwind guard!"]="Estupendo. $n, serás $gun:una; $c excelente. ¡McBride te enseñará todo lo que necesites saber para unirte a las filas de la guardia de Ventormenta!"
G["Excellent. Continue your good work, Supply Master. Dismissed."]="太棒了。继续保持，供给官。解散。"
G["Excellent. Let's kill some vrykul!"]="好极了。我们来杀几个维库人吧！"
G["Excellent. Now back away from the Ultra Concave Fissionable Testing Platform. Slowly, if you please."]="太好了。现在，离开超级凹陷裂变测试平台，向后退。一定要慢。"
G["Excellent. Now, to plague this area and move on to-"]="太好了。在这个地区播散过魔法之后，就转移到……"
G["Excellent. We must focus our efforts on the cleansing of Nagrand!"]="太好了。我们必须把精力集中在清理纳格兰这件事情上！"
G["Excellent..."]="非常好……"
G["Excellent... it would appear as if the meddlesome insects have arrived just in time to feed my legion. Welcome, mortals!"]="很好……看起来好像这些爱管闲事的小人物来得正是时候。欢迎，凡人！！"
G["Excellent... most excellent."]="太好了……真是太好了。"
G["Excuse me while I dispose of these toxic assets all over you!"]="请原谅，我得把这些有毒资产倒给你！"
G["Excuse me, I need to get back to my work."]="请原谅，我得继续工作了。"
G["Excuse me, are you trying to sneak by without an invitation?"]="对不起，你是不是想偷偷溜进去？"
G["Excuse me. I have some former captors to speak with."]="请原谅，我得去和那些奴役我的家伙“谈谈”了。"
G["Excuse me?  We've been \"rescheduled for visitation\"?  What does that mean?!"]="¿Dime? Nos han reprogramado para la aparición\"? ¡¿Eso qué quiere decir?!\""
G["Excuuuse me, princess!"]="饶恕我，公主！"
G["Execute one of the prisoners at once!  Slay the dwarf first... he talks far too much for his own good."]="马上处决一个战俘！先杀了那个矮人……他的废话太多了。"
G["Execute one of the prisoners at once!  Slay the tauren first... keep his head as a trophy."]="开始审问他们吧！先把那个牛头人带过来。"
G["Executor, your direct assault approach will cost us more lives than I am comfortable with. A more nuanced strategy is called for; one that involves us reclaiming the surrounding territory, starting with the villages so as to cut off all points of reinforcement to Deatholme."]="执行官，你直接进攻的方针会让我们付出惨重的代价，对此我不能接受。我们需要一个调整后的战术，一个可以收回我们领土的战术，并且还要是一个能从村子入手切断戴索姆所有援助力量的战术。"
G["Exercise caution during your stay. Some close-minded individuals may still cling to old alliances long since dissolved..."]="你在这里逗留期间可要加倍小心。一些顽固的家伙可能仍然会对我们以前的盟友心存幻想……"
G["Existence ends... I become nothing..."]="存在终止……开始解体……"
G["Existing in this area are many creatures considered allies of the night elves. The elves have had access to the power within each of these creatures; it is time that the horde be allowed this same satisfaction. I have devised a way that this power can be captured and used for our benefit.\n\nDo not doubt what I tell you, $n. Help me, and you shall see that I speak truth."]="En esta área existen muchas criaturas consideradas aliadas de los elfos de la noche. Los elfos han tenido acceso al poder que alberga cada una de estas criaturas. Es hora de que la Horda disfrute con el mismo privilegio. He ideado un modo de hacernos con este poder y usarlo en beneficio propio.\n\nNo dudes de lo que te digo, $n. Ayúdame y verás que digo la verdad."
G["Existing only for chaos, its slightest whisper meant the destruction of whole worlds!\n\nYet still, there were those that would try to worship this mindless being.  There were even those more insane who dared to think to control it."]="摩摩尔只为混乱而生，它最轻微的低语就意味着诸界的毁灭！\n\n尽管如此，这个冥顽的生物却不乏崇拜者。更荒诞的是，竟然有愚蠢的狂徒企图控制它！"
G["Exodar Champion's Pennant"]="埃索达冠军的旗帜"
G["Exotic Pet"]="特殊宠物"
G["Exotic, aromatic, a brew good for both body and spirit!"]="芬芳馥郁、强身提神的异域美酒！"
G["Expedition Point is a tough place to be stationed, but it's critical to the defense of Honor Hold.  The information gathered here, and the engagements our soldiers make against the Legion and the orcs of Zeth'Gor, are invaluable to the Alliance's Hellfire campaign."]="远征军岗哨是个条件艰苦的地方，但是那里对荣耀堡的防御非常关键。在这里收集的情报，还有士兵们与燃烧军团和塞斯高兽人之间的战斗，都是联盟在地狱火半岛的战役中的关键。"
G["Expedition Point is the Alliance's closest point of contact with the Legion Front. North of here is nothin' but demon, demon and more demon. Travel with a buddy."]="Punta de Expedición es la vanguardia de la Alianza en el frente de la Legión. Al norte de aquí no hay más que demonios, demonios y más demonios. No viajes $gsolo:sola;."
G["Expertly accomplished! Now, let us continue your education..."]="完成得很熟练！现在，让我们继续你的教育……"
G["Expiration is necessary."]="必然的终结。"
