G["Falthir, I need assistance in replacing a piece of my Predator's Armor."]="法希尔，我需要你帮我重铸一件赞达拉捕猎者套装。"
G["Falthir, I no longer have my Zandalar Predator's Bracers. Can you provide a new pair?"]="法希尔，我的赞达拉捕猎者护腕似乎不见了。你能再给我一付吗？"
G["Fan the Flames! \n\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_EngGizmos_04.blp:64|t"]="用力煽火！\n\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_EngGizmos_04.blp:64|t"
G["Fancy yourself a chef?  Head to the Undercity south of town for your training.  You can catch the elevators heading down at the back of the Ruins of Lordaeron.  Talk to one of those lumbering Undercity Guardians for further assistance once you arrive."]="¿Tienes ganas de hacerte $gcocinero:cocinera;? Dirígete a Entrañas, al sur de la ciudad, para recibir instrucción. Puedes coger los ascensores que están al fondo de las Ruinas de Lordaeron. Cuando llegues, pide más ayuda a uno de los guardianes de Entrañas."
G["Fandral - what have they done to you?"]="范达尔……他们对你做了什么？"
G["Fandral Staghelm carries the burden of our sins and our follies, and in so doing deserves the respect of us all."]="范达尔·鹿盔独力担负了我们的原罪和愚行，因此，他应该得到我们全体暗夜精灵的尊敬。"
G["Fandral Staghelm has returned as a ... \"Druid of the Flame?\"\n\nI fear one of my own may be implicated in this betrayal!"]="Fandral Corzocelada ha vuelto como un... ¿\"druida de la Llama\"?\n\n¡Me temo que uno de los míos podría estar implicado en esta traición!"
G["Fandral Staghelm."]="范达尔·鹿盔。"
G["Fandral is corrupting fellow druids into something sinister. He may have other followers already - I must warn Moonglade."]="范达尔在腐蚀其他的德鲁伊。他也许已经有了邪恶的追随者——我必须立即警告月光林地。"
G["Fandral sought to use that weakness against me..."]="范达尔想利用我的弱点来对付我……"
G["Fandral was a true leader. You are nothing more than a desperate dream."]="范达尔是个真正的领袖。而你不过是个绝望之梦。"
G["Fandral would never have allowed the Horde to attack our home! And who did Malfurion send to defend us? No one!"]="范达尔决不会允许部落攻击我们的家园！玛法里奥派谁来保护我们了？谁也没来！"
G["Fandral! You escaped from prison?"]="范达尔！你从监狱中逃出来了？"
G["Fandral! Your time has come! Go and hide in the Emerald Dream and pray we never find you!"]="范达尔！你的死期到了！藏到翡翠梦境里去吧，祈祷我们永远都找不到你！"
G["Fanlyr, what is going on here? I didn't authorize this."]="法利尔，这里出什么事了？我没有批准你们这么做。"
G["Fantastic then!  Let's get this thing fixed for you."]="很好！让我来把这个东西修好！"
G["Fantastic!"]="太棒了！"
G["Fantastic! Aren't you the industrious one? Well, let's get started, shall we?"]="¡Fantástico! ¿Tú eres bastante $gtrabajador:trabajadora; verdad? Bien, empecemos, ¿te parece?"
G["Fantastic! Let's move on, shall we?"]="太棒了！我们继续吧？"
G["Fantastic! Next, some protective spells. Yeah, now we're cookin'!"]="好极了！接下来，还得有些保护性的法术。耶！这样就对了！"
G["Far from home, aren't you?"]="你走得有点远啊，不是吗？"
G["Far out, man. This bucket of bolts might make it after all..."]="很好。这桶螺钉或许能起作用……"
G["Far seer."]="先知。"
G["Far too powerful for these elementals, Caylais and her hippogryphs must have been struck down by something else."]="元素没有如此巨大的力量。凯莱斯和她的角鹰兽一定是被另外某个东西打下来的。"
G["Far, far away, in a land called Azeroth, I have an ally. He offers us his land. It is green and lush, filled with pure water and fat creatures to hunt."]="在很远很远的地方，在一个被称为艾泽拉斯的地方，我有一个同伴，他把自己的土地贡献给我们。那是一个绿色的、富饶的、充满着清澈的水和肥美的猎物的地方。"
G["Farewell for now, friend."]="再见，朋友。"
G["Farewell for now."]="这只是暂别。"
G["Farewell my friends, for time grows short. I must depart."]="再见了我的朋友，时间不早，我得走了。"
G["Farewell newcomer. May Elune's blessing be with you."]="Hasta la vista, $gforastero:forastera;. Que la bendición de Elune sea contigo."
G["Farewell stranger. When next we meet, I hope to call you friend."]="后会有期。希望我们下次碰面时能成为“朋友”。"
G["Farewell to you, and may Elune be with you always."]="再见，愿月神与你同在。"
G["Farewell to you, and may our ancestors be with you always!"]="再见了，愿我们的祖先永远保佑你！"
G["Farewell to you, and may shadow always protect you!"]="再见，愿暗影永远保护你！"
G["Farewell to you, and may the Light be with you always."]="再见，愿光明与你同在。"
G["Farewell, $n."]="保重，$n。"
G["Farewell, $n.  And remember, a warrior never shows his back to his foe!"]="再见，$n。记住，一名真正的战士是永远不会逃跑的！"
G["Farewell, $n.  Send my regards to the good men and women at the Menders' Stead."]="再见，$n。请将我的问候转达给治愈者营地的好人们。"
G["Farewell, $n. Keep us alive and get some better equipment!"]="再见，$n。好好活着，搞些更好的装备！"
G["Farewell, $n. Until we meet again..."]="再见了，$n。下次再见……"
G["Farewell, $n..."]="再见，$n……"
G["Farewell, Arthas... my brother."]="再见了，阿尔萨斯……好兄弟。"
G["Farewell, Azeroth. I leave behind a world steeped in filth and wracked by cataclysm."]="永别了，艾泽拉斯。我离开了一个在大灾变中被污损毁坏的世界。"
G["Farewell, Cerellean, until we are joined once again..."]="再见了，塞瑞利恩，我的爱人。我们终能再见……"
G["Farewell, Commander. I will be staying at the inn, should you require my services."]="保重，指挥官。我会待在旅店里面，需要帮忙的话尽管找我。"
G["Farewell, Evie Stormstout."]="再见了，艾薇·风暴烈酒。"
G["Farewell, Raelorasz."]="再见，莱洛拉斯。"
G["Farewell, Shang!"]="再见了，尚！"
G["Farewell, Warchief. I pray that the next time we meet it will be as allies."]="再见，酋长。希望下次见面时，我们能够成为盟友。"
G["Farewell, and good luck."]="再见，以及，祝好运。"
G["Farewell, champions."]="再会，勇士们。"
G["Farewell, citizens of Darkshire. Until next time..."]="再见啦，夜色镇的居民们。希望大家不要错过下一次的机会……"
G["Farewell, dear friend. We shall meet you in the next world when our duties in this one are fulfilled."]="再会，我的朋友。当我们在这个世界的使命完结之后，就可以在另一个世界中再次相聚了。"
G["Farewell, friend! Good treasure hunting!"]="¡Adiós, $gamigo:amiga;! ¡Feliz caza del tesoro!"
G["Farewell, friend. I must return to Warsong Hold."]="再见，朋友。我必须返回战歌要塞了。"
G["Farewell, friend. May we meet again under better circumstances. I'll never forget what you did for me!"]="Hasta siempre, $gamigo mío:amiga mía;. Ojalá nos volvamos a ver en mejores circunstancias. ¡Jamás olvidaré lo que has hecho por mí!"
G["Farewell, mortal. We are forever indebted to you."]="再见，凡人。我们会永远感激你的。"
G["Farewell, mortals. Your bravery is admirable, for such flawed creatures."]="再会了，凡人们。你们是不完美的生命体，但你们的勇气值得钦佩。"
G["Farewell, mortals... The earthmender knows what fire feels..."]="保重，凡人……大地治愈者了解火焰之灵的感受……"
G["Farewell, my friend."]="Adiós, $gamigo mío:amiga mía;."
G["Farewell, old friend... Farewell..."]="老朋友，再见了……再见……"
G["Farewell, stranger. When next we meet, I hope to call you 'friend.'"]="后会有期。希望我们下次碰面时能成为“朋友”。"
G["Farewell, stranger. Your heroics will be remembered by my people. Now, hurry to Telaar!"]="Adiós, $gforaestero:forastera;. Tus hazañas serán recordadas por mi pueblo. ¡Ahora corre a Telaar!"
G["Farewell."]="再见。"
G["Farewell. We shall speak again, I'm sure."]="再见，多保重。"
G["Farewell..."]="再见……"
G["Farii trains those interested in jewel crafting. You can find her in the Crystal Hall near the cavern there."]="法里在训练那些对珠宝加工感兴趣的人。你可以在水晶大厅靠近巨洞的方位找到她。"
G["Farmer Fung lives just north of town, right near the water tower.\n\nI know him well, unfortunately."]="农夫老方住在镇子北边，就在水塔附近。\n\n算我倒霉，我跟他很熟。"
G["Farmer Yoon is just a dear! I keep telling him what to do, and he goes on and does it!"]="农夫老愚真可爱！我叫他做什么，他就做什么！"
G["Farmer Yoon, will you join the council of the Tillers Union?"]="农夫老愚，你愿意加入阡陌客议会吗？"
G["Farmer, come out.  We must speak."]="农夫，到外面来。我们必须谈一谈。"
G["Farmhand, m'lord."]="雇农，大人。"
G["Farmhand, sir."]="雇农，长官。"
G["Farmhands need the hearty goodness of the Pandaren Treasures Noodle Soup to restore their spirit after a hard day's work in the fields."]="农夫在经过一天的辛勤耕作后，就需要分量十足的熊猫人八宝汤面来帮他们恢复精神。"
G["Farming is much harder than it looks."]="农活是看着简单做着难。"
G["Farming must build up a powerful thirst, eh $n?"]="干着农活肯定让你很渴吧，$n？"
G["Farraki forces pour from the Farraki Tribal Door!"]="法拉基大军从法拉基部族之门中涌出！"
G["Farraki tribe, flay their flesh wit the fury of the sands!"]="法拉基部族，用沙漠的怒火撕裂他们！"
G["Farseer! I'm so glad to see you again!"]="先知！很高兴能与你重逢！"
G["Farseer, it is good to see that you still live."]="先知，你还活着！我真是太高兴了。"
G["Farseer, you live!"]="先知，你还活着！"
G["Farseers, mend our wounds!"]="先知们，为我们治疗！"
G["Farstrider Dusking, what business have you to report?"]="远行者达斯金，你有什么事情需要报告吗？"
G["Farunn walks the lands north of what your people call the Bittertide Falls. You will find him alone, but you will see he requires no defenders."]="法鲁恩喜欢独自在苦潮瀑布以北的林地游荡。你可以在那里找到他；不过你很快就会明白，他并不需要族群其他成员的保护。"
G["Farwatch Overlook?  I've heard no reports of mantid in the chasm below."]="远戍哨站？我没听到报告说下面的沟里有螳螂妖。"
G["Fascinating! These embers somehow generate almost no heat."]="太神奇了！这些余烬没有丝毫的热度。"
G["Fascinating, I have never heard tales of anything like this. The mogu hide their secrets well."]="太棒了，我从没听说过这样的事。魔古族很擅长保密。"
G["Fascinating, Lorekeeper. Continue please."]="真令人着迷啊，博学者。请继续。"
G["Fascinating, this coincides with theories of Un'Goro being the home of the Titans when they inhabited Kalimdor. Perhaps Aman'thul himself watched over 'The God Lands.'"]="\"Fascinante, esto coincide con la teoría que afirma que Un'Goro fue el hogar de los titanes cuando habitaron Kalimdor. Quizás fuera Aman'thul quien velaba por las \"Tierras del Dios\".\""
G["Fascinating."]="真迷人。"
G["Fascinating. Continue, please."]="真令人着迷啊。请继续。"
G["Fascinating. I think they call that a \"clean kill\"."]="Fascinante. Creo que a esto lo llaman una \"muerte limpia\"."
G["Fascinating. Please, tell me more."]="请继续。"
G["Fascinating. What is it, Andormu?"]="太迷人了。这是什么，安多尔姆？"
G["Fascinating..."]="真有意思……"
G["Fast forward to the present: The resultant formula works, allowing for the creation of a more controlled drone, however, the drawback is that the inactive compound is extremely volatile.\n\nGallywix, everyone in this tower and everyone outside are infected with the poison. It's affecting our minds and our bodies. Our internal organs have become soft and extremely fragile. This is your chance, $n. I don't have the strength to carry on and I sense that soon I will become one of 'them.'"]="Avance rápido hacia el presente: La fórmula resultante funciona, haciendo posible la creación de un esclavo autómata más controlado. No obstante, la desventaja está en el hecho de que el compuesto inactivo es extremadamente volátil.\n\nGallywix, todos los que están en esta torre y fuera de ella están infectados con el veneno. Nos está afectando la mente y el cuerpo. Nuestros órganos internos se han reblandecido y son extremadamente frágiles. Esta es tu oportunidad, $n. No tengo la fuerza para seguir adelante y tengo la sensación de que pronto me convertiré en uno de ‘ellos’."
G["Fast. But not fast enough. We'll do it again."]="很快。但还不够快。我们再做一遍。"
G["Faster or Boss Grog'ak will have your head!"]="快点，否则格罗阿克会要了你的命！"
G["Faster!"]="动作快点！"
G["Faster! Faster you worthless runts!"]="快点！再快点！你这没用的家伙！"
G["Faster! Faster! These armaments must be delivered to the Kor'kron Vanguard TODAY!"]="快！快！这些武器必须今天送抵库卡隆先锋营地！"
G["Faster! The warchief's eyes are upon you."]="快点儿！酋长的眼睛在盯着你们呢。"
G["Faster! We must attack faster!  They cannot hold all of us back!"]="快点！我们必须再快点！他们不可能把我们全挡住！"
G["Faster! We must be flying by the end of the day or the Lich King will destroy us for certain."]="快一点啦！我们必须在今天之内起飞，不然巫妖王一定会要了我们的命。"
G["Faster, brother! I don't know how much longer we can hold these Scourge monsters back!"]="兄弟们，快！天灾军团的攻势强劲，我不知道我们还能支撑多久！"
G["Faster, dogs! We mustn't relent in our assault against the interlopers!"]="奴仆们，快！绝不能给敌人任何喘息的机会！"
G["Faster, dogs, or you'll get THE BOOT!"]="麻利些，狗崽子们，不然就解雇你们！"
G["Faster, faster!  Get those fel reaver parts gathered!"]="快点，再快点！把这些魔能机甲部件收集起来！"
G["Faster, hero! We must get back to the Argent Vanguard and warn them of the impending attack!"]="快一点，勇士！我们必须赶回银色前线基地，把进攻的事告诉他们！"
G["Faster, or you will taste The Claw!"]="再快点，否则就尝尝利爪的厉害！"
G["Faster, scum!  The Master won't be pleased if we don't find the Ata'mal crystal he's after."]="再快点，蠢货！如果我们找不到主人想要的阿塔玛水晶，他不会高兴的。"
G["Faster, smith! Shai Hu hungers for blood!"]="再快些，史密斯！刹嗳呼渴望鲜血！"
G["Faster, you fools. We need all of these artifacts soon or it's the cane for your hides."]="快一点，你们这些笨蛋。我们急需这些神器，否则你们就等着挨鞭子吧。"
G["Faster. Fight faster! Both of you slow like bigtongue. Maybe I dump you in water, make you slimy like bigtongues too, make them take you in."]="快。加快攻击速度啊！你们俩慢得跟大舌头怪似的。我应该将你们丢进河里，让你们全身裹满泥巴，这样大舌头怪就能收留你们了。"
G["Fastest gryphons this side of Aerie Peak. Want to take a ride?"]="我这里的狮鹫是鹰巢山以南飞得最快的。想要乘坐吗？"
G["Fate has been kind to return you to us."]="你平安地回来了，命运真是仁慈。"
G["Fate has brought you to me!"]="是命运把你带到我的面前！"
G["Fate is like fire; it can shape or destroy us."]="命运就像火焰——既能塑造我们，也能毁灭我们。"
G["Fate subjugates faith, mortal. Your prayers are meaningless here."]="命运凌驾信仰之上，凡人。此时祈祷，毫无意义。"
G["Fate, it seems, has been more than kind. A blow has been dealt to Malygos. When he learns of it, I am confident he will leave the safety of the Nexus."]="我们得到了命运的青睐。玛里苟斯遭受了沉重的打击。当他清楚地认识到眼前的局势之后，肯定不甘心龟缩在相对安全的魔枢。"
G["Fateema is our anchorite, and she has been invaluable in tending crash victims. She practices her trade on the western side of the Watch."]="法蒂玛是我们的学者，她在照顾坠毁事故受害者的过程中起到了无法估量的作用。她就在岗哨的西边。"
G["Father Cobb will be the one you want to talk to. He can be found under the Spirit Rise in the Pools of Vision cave."]="你应该找柯布神父谈谈，到灵魂高地下的预见之池去找他吧。"
G["Father taught me well."]="父亲大人教了我很多东西。"
G["Father was right about you, Sartharion. You ARE a weakling."]="父亲大人对你的评价一点都没错，萨塔里奥。你就是个废物。"
G["Father!"]="父亲！"
G["Father! Are you okay?"]="父亲！你没事吧？"
G["Father! Father! You're alive!"]="爸爸！爸爸！你还活着！"
G["Father! Let me get you free of those chains."]="父亲！让我帮你除去那些锁链。"
G["Father! You can't let them turn the Crane Temple into a war zone! That place is still recovering from a sha infestation..."]="父亲！不能让朱鹤寺变成战场！它还没能从煞魔入侵中恢复元气……"
G["Father, I am no longer the helpless child you feared for."]="父亲，我再也不是让你担忧的无助孩童了。"
G["Father, I wish to join you in the war against the undead. I want to fight! I can sit idle no longer!"]="父亲，我也想加入部队，和您一起抵抗亡灵。我也要战斗，不能再袖手旁观了！"
G["Father, NO!  Wait... where am I?"]="父亲，不！等等……我在哪里？"
G["Father, give me strength to go on."]="父亲，给我继续下去的力量吧。"
G["Father, watch out!"]="父亲，小心！"
G["Father, we need to deal with the Horde scout first."]="父亲，我们先要对付部落的斥候。"
G["Father, you can't do this. All the hatred and anger our war brings here - it poisons this place."]="父亲，不能这样。我们的仇恨和愤怒——会腐蚀这片土地。"
G["Father, you had the bowl of fruit? Right?"]="神父，盛水果的碗在你那边吗？在吗？"
G["Father, you have returned!"]="父亲，您回来了！"
G["Father, you were a man who led wisely, who battled skillfully, and who always sought the best for your people."]="父亲，您不但智勇双全，还懂得体恤人民。"
G["Father. I feared for your... your sanity."]="父亲。你的圣洁……让我，感到战栗。"
G["Father..."]="父亲……"
G["Father... But... How?"]="父亲……但是……怎么可能？"
G["Father... For you, I would give my life a thousand times."]="父亲……为了你，我万死不辞。"
G["Father... why must we endure such hardship?  Why can't we live somewhere sunny and lush?  A tropical island perhaps?"]="父亲……为什么我们一定要承受这样的苦难？为什么我们不能居住在阳光灿烂，土地肥沃的地方？也许我们应该移居到热带岛屿去？"
G["Father?  Are you proud of me now? HAHAH!"]="父亲？你现在为我感到骄傲了？哈哈！"
G["Father? Father is that you?"]="父亲？是你吗？"
G["Fathers and sons. Mothers and daughters. As parents, we pass our legacy on to our children."]="父传子，母教女。作为父母，我们会将自己的遗产传给孩子。"
G["Fathom-Lord Zin'jatar has entered the battle!"]="深水领主金加塔尔进入了战场！"
G["Fear broils forth from the heart of the infinite. Don't make me look! I've seen more than I can stand!"]="恐惧从永恒之心内蒸腾而出。别逼我看！我所看到的一切已经超出了我的承受极限！"
G["Fear broils forth from the heart of the infinite... Don't make me look! I've seen more than I can stand!"]="恐惧从永恒之心内蒸腾而出。别逼我看！我所看到的一切已经超出了我的承受极限！"
G["Fear cuts deeper than swords."]="恐惧比利剑伤得更深。"
G["Fear grips her mind and body. The Empress is no longer fit to rule the empire."]="恐惧控制了她的灵魂和躯体。女皇已经不再适合统治帝国。"
G["Fear has always been our greatest weapon. Entire wars have been won and lost upon the shifting shoulders of trepidation and doubt. So how, then, does one fight an enemy that knows no fear?\n\n<Saurfang shakes his head.>\n\nWe do not just fight the Scourge in Northrend, we fight to gain control of our senses before they tear us apart..."]="El miedo siempre ha sido nuestra arma más eficaz. Se han ganado y perdido guerras enteras apoyándose en los temblorosos hombros de la duda y la turbación. Entonces, ¿cómo se lucha contra un enemigo que no conoce el miedo?\n\n<Colmillosauro agita la cabeza.>\n\nEn Rasganorte no solo luchamos contra la Plaga, luchamos por mantener el control de nuestros sentidos antes de que nos destrocen..."
G["Fear is an illusion."]="恐惧只是假象。"
G["Fear is for the enemy! Fear and death!"]="让敌人胆战心惊吧！让他们在恐惧中死去！"
G["Fear lies in your heart. When you truly are ready to face Vorsha the Lasher, come speak with me."]="El miedo yace en tu corazón. Cuando realmente seas capaz de enfrentarte a Vorsha el Azotador, ven a hablar conmigo."
G["Fear me!"]="怕了吧！"
G["Fear not if your weapon leaves your grasp. Your body is an ample tool against any foe."]="即便没有武器在手，也无需害怕。单凭你的身体就足以对抗任何敌人。"
G["Fear not!  All fortunes can be discerned for those who know the way."]="别害怕！所有深谙此道的人都能洞察命运。"
G["Fear not, master. I shall rend the flesh of your enemy!"]="别害怕，主人。看我怎么将敌人撕个粉碎！"
G["Fear not, young one, for this crusader shall not taste death."]="年轻人，别害怕，死亡的阴霾不会降临到这位北伐军勇士的头上。"
G["Fear not.  The Night Watch will rid the land of this foul taint soon enough."]="不要害怕。守夜人很快就会把这里的邪恶力量完全清除的。"
G["Fear not. Johnny Awesome fights by your side."]="不要害怕。强尼·傲森和你并肩战斗。"
G["Fear the wrath of the yaungol!"]="害怕野牛人的愤怒！"
G["Fear... anger... doubt... these are weapons. MY weapons. And they will unmake you!"]="恐惧，愤怒，疑惑……这些情绪都是武器。我的武器。它们会让你死无葬身之地！"
G["Fear... so exhilarating..."]="恐惧……如此美好……"
G["Feast my children! Feast upon the flesh of the living!"]="仆从们，把他们都消灭！"
