G["Fierce retaliation for the defections were to follow.  Shattrath City came under unrelenting attack from Illidan and Kael'thas.\n\nArmies of blood elves, naga and Broken, would pour into the city; only to be repelled by the might of the Sha'tar.\n\nOne thing became clear to the naaru.  If they were to pursue the Legion, they would have to defeat Illidan first."]="疯狂的复仇很快就来临了。沙塔斯城遭受着伊利丹和凯尔萨斯的无情攻击。\n\n血精灵、纳迦和破碎者的军队涌入城市，沙塔尔的力量顽强抵抗着他们。\n\n纳鲁非常明白，如果他们想要追击燃烧军团，就必须首先打败伊利丹。"
G["Fiery Anger is about to |cFFFF2222|Hspell:141456|h[Detonate]|h|r!"]="暴烈之怒即将|cFFFF2222|Hspell:141456|h[爆炸]|h|r！"
