G["Fight with us. |cFF0008E8(Daggin will follow you.)|r"]="一起行动吧。|cFF0008E8（达金会跟着你。）|r"
G["Fight with us. |cFF0008E8(General Nazgrim will follow you.)|r"]="一起行动吧。|cFF0008E8（纳兹戈林将军会跟着你。）|r"
G["Fight with us. |cFF0008E8(Kiryn will follow you.)|r"]="一起行动吧。|cFF0008E8（琪麟会跟着你。）|r"
G["Fight with us. |cFF0008E8(Kromthar will follow you.)|r"]="一起行动吧。|cFF0008E8（库姆萨尔会跟着你。）|r"
G["Fight with us. |cFF0008E8(Mishka will follow you.)|r"]="和我们一起战斗。|cFF0008E8（米希卡会跟随你。）|r"
G["Fight with us. |cFF0008E8(Rivett will follow you.)|r"]="一起行动吧。|cFF0008E8（利维特会跟着你。）|r"
G["Fight with us. |cFF0008E8(Shokia will follow you.)|r"]="一起行动吧。|cFF0008E8（夏琪亚会跟着你。）|r"
G["Fight with us. |cFF0008E8(Sully will follow you.)|r"]="和我们一起战斗。|cFF0008E8（苏利会跟随你。）|r"
G["Fight without fear and the Val'kyr will reward you!"]="勇敢地战斗吧，瓦格里会奖赏你的！"
G["Fight!"]="战斗！"
G["Fight!  Fight for Darrowshire!"]="战斗！为了达隆郡战斗！"
G["Fight!  Fight for your families!"]="战斗！为了你的家人而战！"
G["Fight's over, hot stuff. Better luck next time."]="战斗结束了，宝贝儿。祝你下次好运。"
G["Fight's over.\n\nReady to go back inside?"]="战斗结束。\n\n做好回到里面去的准备了吗？"
G["Fight, and we will win this day!"]="战斗，我们今天一定会赢！"
G["Fight, kill, eat, live another day.\n\nIf you die, die where your brothers and sisters can eat you. No point in feeding your enemies."]="战斗、杀戮、进食，好好活过每一天。\n\n如果你死了，记得死在方便你的兄弟姐妹吃掉你的地方。没必要去给敌人送菜。"
G["Fight."]="战斗"
G["Fighter down!"]="有人倒下了！"
G["Fighting and beer. There is no greater place than this."]="战斗和啤酒。再也没有比这里更棒的地方了。"
G["Fighting isn't fighting without a fine ale!"]="没有好酒的战斗不是好战斗！"
G["Fighting make me... HUNGRY!"]="战斗让我……饥肠辘辘！"
G["Fighting off that leviathan was fun, but I think I've had enough adventure for a lifetime. Safe travels to you, $p. Stop by any time!"]="击退海中怪兽真是有趣，但是我想我的冒险生涯已经够丰富多彩的了。旅途平安，$p。随时欢迎来造访！"
G["Fighting the strength of the land is inevitably futile."]="与大地的力量抗争，注定是徒劳无功的。"
G["Fill these prisons with mages! Malygos demands it!"]="往这些牢笼里塞满法师！这是玛里苟斯的命令！"
G["Fill yer tankard and pull up a chair. We've stories to tell and kegs to empty."]="满上一杯啤酒，拉一张凳子过来坐坐。我们要畅饮一番，同时还要分享我们的故事。"
G["Fill your cup with joy, and you will drink joy. Fill your cup with sorrow, and you will drink sorrow.\n\nChoose your brew wisely, my friend."]="Llena la copa con alegría y beberás alegría. Llena la copa con penas y beberás penas.\n\nElige sabiamente la cerveza, $gamigo:amiga;."
G["Filth protects us. Our enemies cannot stand the smell of Ihgaluk.\n\nBut it is hard to keep filth on the beach. The ocean drinks our filth faster than we can create it. There must be other ways to protect our shores.\n\n<The seadragon flashes a razor-toothed smile.> That's where I come in, $gbrother:sister;."]="污秽保护着我们。我们敌人忍受不了伊瓜鲁克的臭味。\n\n可是，在海滩上保持肮脏是很难的。海滩消耗污物的速度比我们制造的速度更快。我们得想其他办法来保护我们的海滩。\n\n<海龙战士微微一笑，露出了锋利的牙齿。>这就是我的任务，$g兄弟:姐妹;。"
G["Filth! Filth everywhere! The forests must be cleansed!"]="邪恶！到处都是邪恶的气息！这片森林必须得到清理！"
G["Filthy $r intruder. DIE!"]="Repugnante $r $gintruso:intrusa;. ¡MUERE!"
G["Filthy Frostwolf cowards! If you want a fight, you'll have to come to me!"]="可恶的霜狼懦夫！如果你们想要一战的话，就放马，不，放狼过来吧！"
G["Filthy animals!"]="这群肮脏的野兽！"
G["Filthy animals!  Cage me will you?!"]="肮脏的动物！你们要囚禁我吗？"
G["Filthy animals! Keep your stink away from this land!"]="龌龊的畜生！我不允许你们玷污这片土地！"
G["Filthy beast!"]="无耻的怪物！"
G["Filthy beasts! Your presence in Skywall will not be tolerated!"]="肮脏的野兽！你们出现在天空之墙的行为是不可饶恕的！"
G["Filthy breather!"]="肮脏的生物！"
G["Filthy coward! Get it over with..."]="懦夫！结束这一切吧……"
G["Filthy creature!"]="恶心的家伙！"
G["Filthy cretin. Your kind doesn't deserve to live. Have at thee!"]="肮脏的畜生。你们不配活在这世上。我要杀了你们！"
G["Filthy fungal giants!  What did we ever do to them?"]="恶心的真菌巨人！我们到底欠他们什么？"
G["Filthy monsters! I owe ye me life."]="肮脏的怪物！我欠你一条命。"
G["Filthy orc!"]="肮脏的兽人！"
G["Filthy vermin.  Submit or perish!"]="肮脏的寄生虫。投降或者等死吧！"
G["Filthy void beast! DIE!"]="肮脏的虚空怪物！死吧！"
G["Filthy wolvar. I don't care if the dryskin vouches for you, I will not endure your presence for long."]="卑鄙的狼獾人。我不管干皮人是不是会为你担保，但今天就是你的死期。"
G["Filthy yaungol infestation!"]="卑鄙的野牛人祸害！"
G["Filthy, filthy orcs! Unhand those whelps!"]="卑鄙的兽人，卑鄙！放了那些小崽子！"
G["Fimble Finespindle has a shop set up on the northwest side of The Great Forge.  I wager he could show ye how to make some fine armor."]="费布·钢轴在大熔炉西北面开了一家商店。我打赌他能教你学会制作精良的装甲。"
G["Final Level: Completed!"]="最终关：完成！"
G["Final stop, the Forsaken Front! EVERYBODY OUT!"]="终点站——被遗忘者先锋军到了！所有人都下去！"
G["Finally got a seat, now what to eat?"]="总算有位子了，那么，该吃点什么呢？"
G["Finally out from under the boot of that she-witch Abbendis, and free to pursue my own interests: BLOOD, BLOOD, AND MORE BLOOD!"]="终于摆脱阿比迪斯那个疯婆娘了，我现在可以去追求我自己的目标了：鲜血，鲜血，更多的鲜血！"
G["Finally some talk of action from the big guy!"]="老大终于发话了！"
G["Finally someone to deal with that unsightly pest! You have my thanks, \"heroes.\""]="¡Por fin alguien que se ocupe de esa molestia antiestética! Gracias, \"héroes\"."
G["Finally someone to smash!"]="终于有仗可打了！"
G["Finally they show mercy!  They've given us something to drink!"]="最后他们终于表现出一丝仁慈！他们给了我一些喝的东西！"
G["Finally we are taking action! Something we should have done days ago."]="我们终于可以行动了！几天前就该这么做了。"
G["Finally you know your true destiny."]="接受命运的审判吧。"
G["Finally!"]="终于！"
G["Finally!\n\nDa $r $c foretold in da prophecies has arrived!"]="¡Por fin!\n\n¡Ha llegado $gel:la; $r $c que anunciaban las profecías!"
G["Finally!  I will never get all of this dust out of my robes."]="真不容易！看来我得换身衣服了。"
G["Finally!  This charade is over... Arthas give me strength!"]="总算不用遮遮掩掩了！阿尔萨斯，赐予我力量吧！"
G["Finally!  Well done!"]="哈哈！干得好！"
G["Finally! A hero has come!"]="终于，来了一位英雄！"
G["Finally! An excuse to squash you!"]="哈！总算有理由干掉你了！"
G["Finally! An upgrade!"]="万岁！终于可以升级了！"
G["Finally! I can't wait to get some sleep tonight."]="终于可以躺下好好睡一觉了！"
G["Finally! I thought I was never going to get my drink!"]="终于来了！我还以为我的酒压根不会送来了！"
G["Finally! I'll be glad to get out of this place."]="终于！我终于能走出这个地方了。"
G["Finally! Put some fingers in your ears, your brain mighta just grown five sizes and I'm worried it might leak out.\n\nSo, the Dark Irons spared his life and took him prisoner. Their leader, some self-important, uppity fella named Thauris-something, took Ironfoe for himself. And that was the last I saw of ol' Windsor... *hic* 'scuse me."]="¡Por fin! Tápate los oídos, porque tu cerebro va a aumentar unas cinco veces de tamaño y me preocupa que se salga por ahí.\n\nComo iba diciendo, los Hierro Negro le perdonaron la vida y lo hicieron prisionero. Su líder, un engreído con aires de superioridad llamado Thauris-no sé qué, cogió Ferromazo y se lo quedó. Y eso es lo último que supe del viejo Windsor... *hip* perdón."
G["Finally! THERE'S the Uncle Chen I've been waiting for."]="终于！这才是我所期待的陈叔呢。"
G["Finally! To be free from the grip of that darkness. The light! The blessed, beautiful light!"]="终于逃出黑暗的魔爪了！光！神圣而又美丽的光啊！"
G["Finally!! I can leave this dump."]="我终于可以离开这个垃圾场了！！"
G["Finally, I am free! I come home soon, my dear!"]="终于，我自由了！我终于回家了！"
G["Finally, I can be restin'..."]="总算可以休息啦……"
G["Finally, I entreat you to stop buffeting my squire with punches and kicks."]="最后，我恳求你不要再捶打踩踏我的侍从。"
G["Finally, I humbly request that you cease venting your hostility 'pon my good squire."]="最后，我谦恭地祈求您不要再将恨意发泄在我的好侍从身上了。"
G["Finally, Instructor Xann. His mastery of the very basics of combat has given him a nearly perfect fighting form."]="最后一位是夏教头。他十分注重基本功的磨砺，他使出的每一招都臻乎完美。"
G["Finally, Redridge. A pleasant change from the dark, cold fog of Duskwood."]="呼，终于可以到赤脊山去了。离开这黑暗阴冷的暮色森林可真让人心情愉快。"
G["Finally, Tarecgosa, our beloved sister whose essence you have generously borne, has chosen this staff as her permanent home."]="最终，泰蕾苟萨，我们挚爱的姐妹，她选择了你的法杖作为其精魄的永久栖息地。"
G["Finally, a captive audience!"]="终于，来了个看客！"
G["Finally, a chance to use the skills we've been training for. Who knows what adventure we'll find here in the Valley of the Four Winds?"]="终于有机会用上我们一直训练的技巧了。谁会知道我们会在四风谷中经历什么样的冒险呢？"
G["Finally, a fight worth watching."]="终于出现了一场值得一看的战斗。"
G["Finally, a gift from me. Make no mistake: the Black Dragonflight lives on!"]="终于等到了我要给你的礼物。别搞错了——黑龙军团还活着！"
G["Finally, a worthy offering!"]="总算来了一份有价值的祭品！"
G["Finally, an end to the suffering..."]="终于，苦难终结了……"
G["Finally, an enemy worth fighting."]="终于有了值得交手的敌人。"
G["Finally, everything is in place. Are you ready for your big stage debut?"]="Por fin todo está en su lugar, ¿Estás $glisto:lista; para tu gran debut en el escenario?"
G["Finally, for the first time in many moons, I feel hopeful for our future."]="终于，这么多天以来，我第一次感到我们的未来还有希望。"
G["Finally, free at last... I must be going now, thanks for helping me escape. I can get back to Freewind Post by myself."]="终于自由了……我现在必须走了，谢谢你帮我逃脱。我自己会回到乱风岗去的。"
G["Finally, he has been made to pay for the atrocities he imposed upon my people."]="他对我们犯下累累罪行，现在他终于付出了代价。"
G["Finally, in the face of such atrocities, we were denied even the release of death."]="最终，在这种暴行面前，我们即使死去也无法得到解脱。"
G["Finally, mere months before the Cataclysm, Zul returned. Tearing his clothes and throwing his staff to the ground, Zul spoke of earthquakes and tidal waves."]="最后，在大灾变发生的几个月前，祖尔又回来了。他撕碎衣裳，扔掉法杖，预言了地震与海啸的到来。"
G["Finally, my banishment ends!"]="我的放逐终于结束了！"
G["Finally, my soul may rest... Oh, dearest Cerellean..."]="我的灵魂终于可以安息了……哦，亲爱的塞瑞利恩……"
G["Finally, peace and quiet. Perhaps enough to allow me to contemplate the passing of our brothers and sisters."]="和平与安宁终于来临。这也许足够让我去追思那些逝去的兄弟姐妹们。"
G["Finally, please find it in your heart to forgive my squire, for I see that you are smiting him."]="最后，衷心地请您原谅我的侍从，不要再对他施以惩罚了。"
G["Finally, released from his cursed grasp. Father, I come..."]="终于从他的诅咒中解脱出来了。父亲，我来了……"
G["Finally, someone came down to talk to me!  Want to hear some of my rhymes?"]="终于有人和我说话了！想听几首我作的诗吗？"
G["Finally, someone who's not a trogg!"]="终于见到个不是穴居人的人！"
G["Finally, something to relieve the tedium!"]="终于可以解解闷了！"
G["Finally, the Korune spellweavers laid claim to their instrument and hid it away. Since then, the Bell has been lost to history."]="最终，寇茹织法者夺回了圣钟，把它藏了起来。从此，圣钟就失落在了历史的长河之中。"
G["Finally, the agony ceases...."]="痛苦……终于结束了……"
G["Finally, the backup I've been waiting for! I prepared the paperwork that Snagglebolt requested. All that remains is for someone to serve it."]="终于盼到我要的援助了！我准备了滑栓需要的各项文书。现在只剩下找人执行了。"
G["Finally, the hozen came to Narsong Trench."]="最后，猢狲也来到了纳松海沟。"
G["Finally, the sha has shown its face. Be careful!"]="煞魔总算现身了。小心点！"
G["Finally, this is Groundskeeper Wu."]="最后，这位是园丁老吴。"
G["Finally, we have the parts to repair the Spirit of Gnomeregan."]="我们总算找到零件，可以修理诺莫瑞根之魂了。"
G["Finally, we've seen a good group!"]="这组总算像样点了！"
G["Finally, when events demanded his full attention, he left me."]="最后，战争让他无暇分身，他才放弃了我。"
G["Finally, you see some thread, which will be used to hold the disguise together."]="最后，你看到了一些线团，将被用来缝制伪装服。"
G["Finally."]="终于。"
G["Finally. The monster got what he deserved."]="这个混蛋终于得到了应有的报应。"
G["Finally... home..."]="终于……回家了……"
G["Finally... something worth fighting."]="终于……有了战斗的理由。"
G["Finally... we'll see an end to this torture."]="终于……这无尽的折磨终于结束了。"
G["Finally...death!  Curse you, Hakkar!  Curse you!"]="必然的结局……死亡！诅咒你，哈卡！诅咒你！"
G["Find Iain. Secure whatever gryphon riders he's gathered to cut them off before they reach the town."]="找到伊安。保护他召集的狮鹫骑士，和他们一同去挡住敌人，不要让敌人到达这个镇子。"
G["Find Kaplak on top of the burrow in the southwest section of town."]="到村庄西南方的洞穴顶部找到卡普拉克。"
G["Find Red Canyon Mining northeast of the lake in the Valley of Honor.  Speak to Makaru there."]="到荣誉谷的湖泊的东北方找红石谷矿业工会。与那里的马卡鲁谈谈。"
G["Find Tarshaw Jaggedscar inside the barracks on the east side of Razor Hill.  Bring pride and honor to the Horde youngling!"]="到剃刀岭东面的兵营里找到塔绍尔·锯痕。给部落的年轻人带去骄傲和荣誉！"
G["Find a Tree to Climb"]="找到一棵树去爬。"
G["Find a copper, pick it up, all day long I'll have good luck."]="发现一枚铜币，把它拾起来，一整天我都会交好运。"
G["Find a way to get me out of here, $c!"]="找条路带我离开这里，$c。"
G["Find a way to get me out of here, $c."]="找条路带我离开这里，$c。"
G["Find a way to stop that conjured storm, champion, and rescue whatever prisoners you can.\n\nFare you well."]="请想办法阻止这场人为的风暴，勇士，并尽力拯救俘虏。\n\n祝你好运。"
G["Find all the Fragments of Jaina's Staff!"]="找到所有的吉安娜法杖碎片！"
G["Find and release Aggra before she gets pulled into the whirlpool!"]="在阿格娜被卷入漩涡前找到并救出她！"
G["Find another sucker to stand watch over your enormous mound of poop. I'm done!"]="找别的倒霉鬼来守你这粪山吧！我不干了！"
G["Find any survivors, $n. We're sure to need them..."]="Ve en busca de supervivientes. Los necesitaremos..."
G["Find me at town if you're looking to try to throw me to death some more."]="如果你还想让我来送死的话，就去营地找我吧。"
G["Find me for a drink sometime."]="有空来找我喝一杯。"
G["Find me some..."]="给我找些……"
G["Find me something good, you dogs!"]="给我找点吃的来，你们这些废物！"
G["Find peace within yourself, so that you may share it with the world around you."]="只有当自己静心忍性，才能做到万物归心，宠辱不惊。"
G["Find some cover!"]="寻找掩体！"
G["Find some flanking positions."]="找到侧袭位置。"
G["Find strength in patience."]="耐心地寻找你的力量。"
G["Find the Hall of the Brave in the Valley of Honor and speak to Grezz Ragefist.  Let them know that I'll be reporting back in after my shift here."]="到荣耀谷去找到勇者大厅并与格雷兹·怒拳谈谈。告诉他们我在这里的轮岗结束后就会去向他们汇报。"
G["Find the Precious Cargo!"]="找到珍贵的货物！"
G["Find the Wind Rider Master at the top of The Sky Tower in the Valley of Strength. Doras will make sure you find your way to the battle you seek."]="到力量谷的飞行塔顶部可以找到双足飞龙管理员。多拉斯会确保你到达你想要战斗的地方。"
G["Find the codes to release me from these infernal bonds!"]="找到密码，把我从这些恶魔骨头中放出来！"
G["Find the healers and get them free of the fight.  We need them here at the wound!"]="帮助那些治疗者摆脱敌人！我们需要他们来这儿治愈伤口。"
G["Find the interlopers! I know that they have someone sneaking around to the north!"]="找到闯入者！我知道他们就藏在北边！"
G["Find their source of power and tear it down. Tear all of it down."]="找到他们的能量来源，把它破坏掉。全部都破坏掉。"
G["Find what I am looking for and you may have a treat."]="如果你能帮我找到我梦寐以求的东西，我会好好奖励你的。"
G["Find your black gold somewhere else!"]="去别的地方寻找你的黑金吧！"
G["Find your soul to break the curse!"]="找到你的灵魂，打破诅咒！"
G["Finding Reethe."]="寻找帕瓦尔·雷瑟。"
G["Finding peace within will allow you to see obstacles with reason."]="找寻内心的平静，这能帮助你理性地看待前路上的阻碍。"
G["Finding yourself without a Raging Vortex Gem, you reach into the runestone to acquire another."]="发现自己并没有盛怒漩涡宝石，你便伸手到符文石中，又取了一枚。"
G["Finding yourself without a Vortex Gem, you reach into the runestone to acquire another."]="你发现身上没有漩涡宝石，便将手伸到符文石中，又拿了一枚。"
G["Finds one!"]="找到一个！"
G["Fine beasts, aren't they? The wyverns we raise here are trained to handle the fiercest and strangest weather conditions Draenor has to offer. You'll find them dependable and hardy."]="瞧这些漂亮的野兽。我们在这里饲养双足飞龙，并训练这些既可靠又勇敢的野兽适应德拉诺世界严酷的天气环境。"
G["Fine day fer sailin', innit?"]="真是个启航的好日子，对吧？"
G["Fine fishing weather!"]="真是个钓鱼的好日子！"
G["Fine then, have a seat. This might take a while.\n\nWhen we first came to this frozen hell, General Arlos, down in Valiance Keep, gave my group of flying daredevils and me a special task: to establish a forward airbase for Alliance operations.\n\nThis airstrip is the result. Let me tell you, it wasn't easy, what with all the nasty beasts and the ground rock-hard from being frozen! But we managed, and we did it quickly too!"]="好吧，坐吧。说来话长。\n\n当我们首次踏足这片冰封地狱时，无畏要塞的阿洛斯将军交给飞行敢死队一项特殊的任务。为了扩展联盟的势力范围，他命令我们建设一座空军基地。\n\n这个小机场就是我们的成果啦。这鬼地方到处都是肮脏的野兽，土地还冻得跟石头一样硬，你知道我们有多不容易吗！但是我们排除万难，在短期内就建成了这座机场！是不是很厉害呀！"
G["Fine weapons and armor for sale!"]="卖精品武器护甲了！"
G["Fine work! You are truly deserving of the knowledge I shall bestow upon you!"]="真是细致的工作！你完全有资格获得我将授予你的知识！"
G["Fine!  Amulet take, but $r help Rockpool."]="好！拿去护符，可$r要帮助岩池鱼人。"
G["Fine! Birdies be dat way! Mug'gok find new friends!"]="很好！鸟人们走开！穆格高克找到了一个新朋友！"
G["Fine! Fine. You win this one."]="太好了，太好了！你赢了。"
G["Fine! You win! I'm shrewd, not crazy..."]="好吧！算你赢了！我是狡猾，可不是疯子……"
G["Fine! You've outreasoned me, you masters of Engineering! Put the door wherever you want!"]="好的！你说服了我，你是机械方面的专家！随你在哪里安装这个门！"
G["Fine, but I'm taking this straight to the Archmage."]="好吧，但是我会直接向大法师汇报此事。"
G["Fine, but be more careful with it this time!"]="好吧，不过这次希望你再当心一点！"
G["Fine, den! Time ta play, friends."]="¡Muy bien! Hora de jugar, \"colegas\"."
G["Fine, fall off. I don't care."]="很好，摔下来吧。我不在乎。"
G["Fine, fine, what else?"]="好啊，好啊，还有什么？"
G["Fine, fine. I may have helped him contact an interested buyer. But keep your voice down! You'll scare away my customers."]="好吧，好吧。我也许帮那家伙联系过一个有意向的买家。但你能不能小声点！你会把我的顾客吓跑的。"
G["Fine, fine. I might've given him the name of a private collector interested in that crate's contents."]="好啦，好啦。我好像是跟他说过，有个私人收藏家可能对那个箱子里的东西有兴趣的来着。"
G["Fine, ignore me.  I don't care!"]="好吧，无视我。我不介意！"
G["Fine, slap the manacles on. But know this, Gallywix, you'll get yours!"]="好吧，上镣铐吧。但给我记住，加里维克斯，你也会有你的那一份！"
G["Fine, snowplum brandy sold here! Buy a snifter, and experience its wonders..."]="甘醇的雪梅白兰地！一杯入口，回味无穷！"
G["Fine, then how about some training?"]="要不要接受训练？"
G["Fine, then. It's time for an open-faced $R sandwich!"]="好吧，让我来尝尝单片$R三明治的味道！"
G["Fine.  I killed five zombies.  And they were huge.  How many undead did you kill?"]="好吧。我杀了五个僵尸。都是巨型僵尸。你干掉了多少亡灵？"
G["Fine.  I'll come with you.  This had better be important."]="好吧。我跟你来。这最好是重要的事。"
G["Fine.  Let's see what you and your lions can do."]="很好，让我们看看你和你的狮子们能做些什么。"
G["Fine.  You don't get to hear about how I beat Deathwing in a knife fight.  Your loss."]="好吧，你听不到我是怎样用匕首打败死亡之翼的。这是你的损失。"
G["Fine.  You want some of this?"]="好啊。你想要这个？"
G["Fine. Have it your way."]="好吧。随你便。"
G["Fine. If our allies are going to be the ones getting their hands dirty, we'll leave it to them to decide how to proceed."]="好吧。如果我们的盟友不嫌麻烦的话，就让他们来决定如何前进吧。"
G["Fine. Just remember though, the power of the Holy Light isn't something to be invoked casually, brother."]="好吧。不过你记住，圣光的力量是不能随便运用的。"
G["Fine. Let's proceed with the introductions."]="很好。让我们继续介绍吧。"
G["Fine. There are plenty of wild yaks near the lake to the north. You can \"replace\" your yak with one of those."]="De acuerdo. Hay un montón de yaks salvajes cerca del lago que hay al norte. Puedes \"cambiar\" tu yak por uno de esos."
G["Fine. What's done is done. But don't assume I will ever like this. Or you, Kai."]="好吧。已经发生的事就不用再追究了。可你别指望我会喜欢这桩婚事，或者是你，凯。"
G["Fine. You've made your choice, mogu. Now, you die..."]="很好。这是你自己的选择，魔古。现在，去死吧……"
G["Fine... but I won't hold back!"]="好啊……但我是不会退缩的！"
G["Fine... whatever. Hand it over."]="好吧……不管怎样。给我吧。"
G["Fineous has what you need, friend."]="芬努斯这里有你需要的东西，朋友。"
G["Finger licking good!"]="啊，真是吮指回味！"
G["Finish here first, and there'll be rum for all of you!"]="把这里的活儿干完，人人都有朗姆酒喝！"
G["Finish him off!"]="干掉他！"
G["Finish him!"]="干掉他！"
G["Finish him! Boot him off the wall!"]="干掉他！把他从长城上踢下去！"
G["Finish it! Finish it! Kill me, or I swear by the Dragonqueen you'll never see daylight again!"]="了断吧！来个了断吧！杀了我，否则我以女王陛下之名发誓，你们绝对看不见明天的太阳！"
G["Finish it, but not too quickly! I want to see a slow death!"]="解决他，但不要太快！我想看着他慢慢死去！"
G["Finish it."]="给它个了断。"
G["Finish them and then we will move south to kill their brethren!"]="杀死他们，然后我们去南边对付他们的同胞！"
G["Finish them, Blackfang."]="杀死他们，黑牙。"
G["Finish yer rum, bucko!  There's thirsty orphans in Goldshire, ye know?"]="小子，喝光你的朗姆酒！要知道，闪金镇还有着口渴的孤儿呢！"
G["Finished!  And the results are amazing.  I must convey them to my associates Grimand, Mathiel and Klockmort!"]="结束了！结果真是令人惊讶。我必须把它们转达给我的同伙格瑞曼德、玛希尔和科劳莫特！"
G["Finished."]="解决。"
G["Finlay, let me see what you have for sale."]="芬雷，让我看看你出售的货物。"
G["Fiona, I must warn you: Gidwin only wants to sit in front because he wants to kiss you."]="菲奥拉，我必须提醒你——吉德文之所以想要坐到前排，就是为了亲你的脸。"
G["Firallon, come out and fight like a goblin!"]="菲尔拉伦，出来像个地精一样地战斗吧！"
G["Fire ... FIRE!"]="火……火！"
G["Fire a barrage!"]="弹幕齐射！"
G["Fire a volley!"]="单炮连射！"
G["Fire a warning shot!"]="开火示警！"
G["Fire all the cannons!"]="全体开火！"
G["Fire and rocks don't really do anything for me. I'm really more of a flesh man."]="火焰和岩石对我来说没有任何意义，我更喜欢有血有肉的敌人。"
G["Fire at will!"]="自由开火！"
G["Fire bad!"]="该死的火！"
G["Fire burns many things, but it cannot touch a shadow."]="火焰可以焚烧许多东西，但它永远碰不到阴影。"
G["Fire consumes! You've tried and failed.  Let there be no doubt, justice prevailed!"]="烈焰吞噬一切！你们精疲力竭，毫无获胜的希望。我要伸张正义！"
G["Fire elementals must die!"]="火元素必死！"
G["Fire grant me vision..."]="火，赐予我洞察……"
G["Fire in the hole!"]="小心爆炸！"
G["Fire is scary, but fire flying through the air is even scarier."]="喷火是很吓人，可是被大炮打到天上更吓人。"
G["Fire is the instrument of change."]="火是变化的工具。"
G["Fire juggling looks pretty hard."]="喷火看起来很难。"
G["Fire kill you just as quick!"]="烈火会烧光你们！"
G["Fire on the way, clear the field!"]="攻击！肃清敌人！"
G["Fire the cannons to kill the bombadiers!"]="开炮来杀死投弹兵！"
G["Fire the even cannons!"]="偶数号的大炮开火！"
G["Fire the odd cannons!"]="奇数号的大炮开火！"
G["Fire to the aid of shadow!"]="阴影将在火焰下存在！"
G["Fire up the engines! We got a meetin' with destiny, lads!"]="启动引擎！小伙子们，向命运之战前进！"
G["Fire upon Skorn!"]="向斯克恩开火！"
G["Fire!"]="放！"
G["Fire! FIRE!"]="火！火！"
G["Fire! Fire for the booty, me hearties!"]="开火！亲爱的，为了财宝，开火吧！"
G["Fire! Fire!"]="躲火！躲火！"
G["Fire! Fire! Blow it out of the water!"]="开火！开火！把它轰出水面！"
G["Fire! Fire! Fire!"]="火！火！火！"
G["Fire! Fire, ya yella sea dogs!"]="开火！开火啊，你们这群胆小的海盗！"
G["Fire! It is the most magical of elements. It warms us, it cooks our food. It is the hearthfire that makes a house a home. In the right hands, fire can shape iron into swords or plowshares. Left uncontrolled, fire could destroy a city."]="火是最有魔力的元素。它能带来温暖，烹制食物。是它把一座房屋变成了一个家。如果善加利用，火能把钢铁铸成刀剑或犁头。但若放任不管，大火也能烧毁整座城市。"
G["Fire! Must be the damned drakes again. Come on!"]="开火！又是那群该死的龙！来吧！"
G["Fire!!"]="开火！"
G["Fire!!!"]="射击！！！"
G["Fire's comin'!"]="火要烧起来了！"
G["Fire, show yourself!"]="火之侍僧，现身吧！"
G["Fire. My love has become fire. I feared this. To find him again, we must enter Ragnaros' burning domain."]="火焰。我的爱人变成了火焰。我害怕的事发生了。我们必须进入拉格纳罗斯的火焰领地寻找他。"
G["Fire...fire..."]="火焰……火焰……"
G["Firebeard and his Fanny are tight."]="焰须和他的范妮紧抱在一起。"
G["Firecracker for throwing, banana for eating."]="爆竹是用来丢的，香蕉是用来吃的。"
G["Firelands on the Test Realm has been reserved for a special event."]="由于特殊原因，测试服上火焰之地已经关闭。"
G["Firelord! I beseech ye... Give me... yer... strength..."]="炎魔之王！我祈求你……赐予我……你的……力量……"
G["Fires Extinguished: $4857W/$4864W"]="已熄灭火焰：$4857W/$4864W"
G["Fires consume."]="火焰将你吞噬！"
G["Fires of Outland"]="外域之火"
G["Fires out! Let's rebuild those turrets!"]="火灭了！准备重建炮台！"
G["Fireworks"]="焰火"
G["Firing"]="发射"
G["Firing another round in 3... 2... 1..."]="准备下一轮发射，3……2……1……"
G["Firing at will!"]="随意开火！"
G["Firjus fears nothing! Release the combatants!"]="芬尔乌斯无所畏惧！让那些斗士上前来吧！"
G["Firjus was unworthy! Test your battle prowess against a true soldier of the Lich King!"]="芬尔乌斯算什么！让巫妖王手下真正的士兵来试试你的战力吧。"
G["First Aid"]="急救"
G["First Aid Supplies"]="急救补给品"
G["First Aid is always a nice skill to have.  Many a time during battle has it saved my hide.  Visit Spiritual Healing on the Spirit Rise.  Pand Stonebinder can teach you all you need to know to save your hide as well."]="急救是一项很有用的技能。在战斗中，它常常能救人一命。如果你想要学习这项技能的话，就去灵魂高地的“精神治疗”小店里面找找潘德·缚石，他可是这方面最好的训练师。"
G["First Aid may not make up for a priest's healing, but it's handy in a pinch.  I recommend ye go talk to Thamner in the Thunderbrew Distillery and learn what ye can."]="急救虽然不能代替牧师的治疗，但是它在紧要关头却很方便。我建议你去跟雷酒酿制厂的萨姆诺谈谈，并力所能及地学习一些东西。"
G["First Aid?  Well ye don't look hurt to me.  If yer really interested in learning First Aid, then Nissa Firestone is the one to learn from.  Go see her over by The Great Forge in her shop, The Ironforge Physician."]="¿Primeros auxilios? No me pareces $gherido:herida;. Si de verdad estás $ginteresado:interesada; en aprender primeros auxilios, hazlo con Nissa Piedra de fuego. Ve a verla a su tienda de La Gran Fundición, El Médico de Forjaz."
G["First Kezan and now here. We are toast if we don't find a way off of this island soon!"]="先是科赞，现在又是这里。如果不马上离开这座岛，我们就要被烤熟了！"
G["First Kormok crush your bones!  Then Kormok burn your soul!"]="库尔莫克会粉碎你的身躯！然后灼烧你的灵魂！"
G["First Mograine asks for arms, then he takes my servants away? Rubbish!"]="莫格莱尼先是伸手要军队，接着又要带走我的仆从？什么玩意儿！"
G["First Westfall, next, all of Stormwind!"]="首先西部荒野，然后是整个暴风城！"
G["First aid is not far from here, do not worry. The healers can be found just inside the chamber of masters.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="别担心，急救人员离这不远。治疗者就在师匠大厅里。\n\n我会在你的地图上标记这个位置。"
G["First and foremost, I'm a businessman. Bring me back to life and I'll stop haunting you. There may even be a reward in it for you."]="首先最重要的是，我是个商人。让我复活，我就停止对你的侵扰。你甚至还可能因此得到奖赏。"
G["First anger sha, now the Horde!"]="先是惹恼了煞魔，现在又是部落！"
G["First beer elementals, and now a hozen attack? Something was very wrong."]="先是啤酒元素，然后又是猢狲？这其中肯定有蹊跷。"
G["First da fire, and now da $r!  You gonna die!"]="¡Primero e' fuego y ahora $gel:la; $r! ¡Va' a morir!"
G["First kill turnips! Then kill pandaren that grows them!"]="首先我们要消灭芜菁！接着消灭种植这些芜菁的熊猫人！"
G["First mantid, then mogu. These are dark days indeed."]="先是螳螂妖，接着又是魔古。真是暗无天日啊。"
G["First of all, I don't need to be rescued.  Second of all, I'd never allow myself to be rescued by an abomination like you!"]="首先，我不需要被援救。第二，我绝不会让你这样的憎恶来救我！"
G["First of all, it wasn't sunny out.  It was cloudy when Deathwing appeared."]="首先，死亡之翼出现的时候没有太阳，而是阴云满空。"
G["First one to move gets a lightning bolt to the head!"]="第一个移动的家伙会被一道闪电劈中脑袋！"
G["First packet of seeds is on the house! Come back to me anytime you want to buy more seeds, ya hear?"]="第一包种子是免费的！要是想买更多种子，随时可以回来找我，明白了吗？"
G["First place? Wow!\n\nPretty good for a young trainee."]="¿Primer puesto? ¡Vaya!\n\nEstá bastante bien para $gun:una; joven $galumno:alumna;."
G["First rule of the Tiger Temple Tournament: We don't talk about Tiger Temple Tournament."]="白虎寺比武大赛第一条规则：我们从不提白虎寺比武大赛。"
G["First she left you for Chip, and now the Trade Prince! She was never good enough for you, $n."]="她先是丢下你，投进奇普的怀里。现在，她又成了贸易大王的人！$n，你是个好人，她配不上你。"
G["First squad is ready for battle!"]="第一小队已经准备好战斗了！"
G["First the fish!...  Now you?"]="先是鱼！……现在轮到你了？"
G["First these orcs and then those pathetic goblins down on the shore."]="来到这片海岸的先是那些兽人，然后是这些可怜的地精。"
G["First things first. We're going to need some sweet malts."]="首先我们需要的是，一些甜麦芽。"
G["First though, you sin'dorei listen up. I run a tight ship... this isn't going to be like what you're used to with the Scryers. Pull your weight, or get back on the boat!"]="首先，我要告诉你们这些辛多雷，我的要求很严格……这和占星者们的行事方式并不一样。要么给我打起精神，要么就给我滚回去！"
G["First time in Pandaria? Mine too. I remember the stories they would tell us of this place. So exciting!"]="头一次来潘达利亚？我也是。我还记得他们讲述的关于这个地方的故事。真令人兴奋！"
G["First we get into a fight, and then someone brings us beer! Can today get any better?"]="我们先是干了一仗，接着就有人给我们送来了啤酒！今天还能再爽点吗？"
G["First we'll need to add a knotroot to the pot. Don't drag your feet, now...."]="首先我们需要加入一棵结根草。别拖拖拉拉的，现在就去搞……"
G["First you became $g king : queen; of the ogres below, and now you have exalted yourself amongst us of Ogri'la.\n\nThis is unheard of for a $r, and yet, there you stand as living proof.  I thank you, $n, and we all owe you a debt that we will never truly be able to repay!"]="Primero te convertiste en $grey:reina; de los ogros de abajo y ahora te has engrandecido entre nosotros, en Ogri'la.\n\nEsto era inimaginable para $gun:una:r; $r y, sin embargo, tú eres la prueba viviente. ¡Te lo agradezco, $n y todos nosotros te debemos más de lo que jamás podremos pagarte!"
G["First you must prove yourself against my assistants.  Defeat them, and then you may face me."]="你必须先跟我的助手过招来证明自己。只有打败他们，你才能面对我。"
G["First you must prove yourself to me, then I will train you."]="你首先必须向我证明你自己，然后我就会训练你。"
G["First you need da spices."]="首先你需要一点香料。"
G["First you tell us the world is ending, now you tell us not to worry. What ruse is this?"]="你告诉我们这个世界就要毁灭了。现在你却又对我们说不必担心。你到底要干什么？"
G["First you, $r. Tomorrow: the world!"]="首先是你，$r。明天就是整个世界！"
G["First, I give you a pellet rifle in exchange for one Darkmoon Game Token.\n\nThen you shoot the targets that light up.\n\nIf you're fast enough to hit a target just after it's lit up, you get an extra point.\n\nIf you don't reach the score limit before your time's up, or you move away from the booth, don't worry: Your score carries over to the next game."]="首先，你得给我一个游戏代币，而我会给你一把步枪。\n\n然后，你就用枪射击那些亮起来的靶子。\n\n如果你出手够快，能在目标亮起后直接击中它，那你就能额外得到一分。\n\n如果你没在规定时间内打到足够的分数，或者离开了游戏场地，也不用担心。你的分数可以带到下一轮游戏里。"
G["First, Morra will be interested to know that it sounds like the Warsong clan spurred these trolls out of the mountain to attack us, so I suspect they're going to attack in Ashenvale as well."]="首先，战歌氏族驱赶这些巨魔离开山地来攻击我们。这对莫拉来说一定是一个重要的情报。我怀疑他们也打算进攻灰谷。"
G["First, an introduction.  I am Archmage Vargoth, leader of the first Kirin Tor expedition to Draenor.  We have accompanied Alliance forces through the Dark Portal, and now set up base camp - Kirin'Var Village - in Farahlon, near the ancestral home of the Laughing Skull clan of orcs.  Such a lovely place!"]="先做个自我介绍吧。我名叫大法师瓦格斯，是首批进驻德拉诺的肯瑞托远征队的队长。我们和联盟的军队一起跨越了黑暗之门，如今，我们在法兰伦建立起了一座名叫肯瑞瓦村的营地，就在嘲颅兽人氏族的家乡附近。真是个美好的地方！"
G["First, go water my Bright Green Spinach!"]="首先，去给我的鲜绿菠菜浇水！"
G["First, he gives away most of my precious Saronite, then he demands I begin crafting Runeblades of even greater power. Pah!"]="他先是将那些宝贵的萨隆邪铁随意派送出去，然后又命令我锻造更强大的符文剑。我呸！"
G["First, the blade must be fed with the souls of those who serve our enemy. Then, before the blade draws upon their power, I must encase it in Shadowfrost. This will insulate you from the corrupting voices that would otherwise consume you... I hope."]="首先，宝剑必须吞噬我们敌人奴仆的灵魂。在动用它们的力量之前，宝剑还必须侵注暗影冰霜。这将使你不受堕落之音的侵害，否则你会被它吞噬…希望这可以起作用。"
G["First, you come traipsing into Uldum as if you owned zhe place..."]="首先，你如入无人之境般地擅自闯入奥丹姆……"
G["First, you give me a game token.  Next, I give you a mallet.  Then you'll see gnolls pop from the barrels in the play area.\n\nHit the gnolls with your mallet to score points.\n\nHere's where it gets tricky.  There are three different targets: regular gnolls, Hogger gnolls, and BABIES.\n\nRegular gnolls grant one point, while Hoggers count for three.  But babies?  Hitting a baby will knock you down and stun you... SO DON'T HIT THE BABIES!\n\nIf you don't whack enough gnolls in one go, just spend another token!  The points you've earned will carry over into your next game."]="首先，你要给我一个游戏代币。然后我就给你一个大锤。然后你就会看见有豺狼人从游戏场地上的桶里冒出来。\n\n你就要用锤子去打这些豺狼人，来获取积分。\n\n但比较复杂的是，这里一共有三种目标：普通豺狼人，霍格豺狼人和娃娃。\n\n普通豺狼人计一分，霍格豺狼人计三分。而娃娃呢？击打他们会导致你被击倒并昏迷……所以千万别打那些娃娃！\n\n如果你没能在规定时间内砸到足够的豺狼人，可以再花一个代币再试一次！你累积的分数也可以带入下一轮。"
G["First, you give me one game token.  Then you find yourself in control of a steam tonk!\n\nYou have a limited amount of time to blast targets in the battlefield.  Each target you destroy earns you one point.\n\nBut watch out: The battlefield is also home to enemy tonks and zeppelins.  Getting hit by one of their shots damages your tonk.\n\nYour score will carry over from one tonk to the next, so don't worry if you explode."]="首先，你要先给我一个游戏代币。然后，你就可以操纵一辆蒸汽坦克。\n\n你需要驾驶坦克，在有限的时间内炸飞战场上的目标。每摧毁一个目标，你可以得一分。\n\n不过你要注意，战场上还有一些邪恶坦克和飞艇。被它们打中会损毁你的坦克。\n\n你的分数可以累积到下一轮，所以死了也不用担心。"
G["First, you must become an empty vessel."]="首先，你必须将自己想象成一个空坛子。"
G["First, you must escape Frostmourne's hold, or be damned as I am; trapped within this cursed blade for all eternity."]="首先，你需要摆脱霜之哀伤的控制，否则就会像我一样，永世成为这把邪剑的囚徒。"
G["First, you will face our initiates..."]="首先，你们要面对我的徒弟们…"
G["First: the races of the Alliance look out for one another."]="首先：联盟各种族之间必须团结互助。"
G["Fish Tales."]="锦鱼传。"
G["Fish here long enough and you will see everything. I once saw a walrus with legs and arms. Not only that, but it talked!"]="在这里捕鱼的时间长了，就见怪不怪了。我看到过长了胳膊和腿的海象。而且，那海象还会说话！"
G["Fish so delicious. You come learn fish? Eat fish? Mmmmm..."]="鱼肉真鲜美。你来学钓鱼的？还是来吃鱼的？呣……"
G["Fish? You gave a piece of what could be the key to saving all life on Kalimdor to a fish?"]="鱼？你是说你把这件可能关系到整个卡利姆多命运的东西交给了一条鱼？"
G["Fishing"]="钓鱼"
G["Fishing Chair"]="钓鱼椅"
G["Fishing Supplies"]="钓鱼补给品"
G["Fishing has always come naturally to my family.  You look like you could use a little help though.  How about running a few errands for a Master Angler?"]="钓鱼是我家族世代相传的天性。不过你看上去倒像是能帮点儿小忙。替钓鱼者跑跑腿儿怎么样？"
G["Fishing is a sport for the old who have not died in battle!  Go find Lumak on the lake in the Valley of Honor."]="钓鱼是那些没有在战斗中死去的老人的运动！到荣誉谷的湖边可以找到鲁玛克。"
G["Fishing is good for the soul, but crabbing is good for the belly!"]="钓鱼能磨砺灵魂，但捕蟹能犒劳肠胃！"
G["Fishing is just so pleasant, mon. You know? I owe my state of bliss to my mentor, the greatest angler in the whole world - Nat Pagle. Have you heard of him, mon?\n\nIf you be looking for enlightenment, Nat Pagle be the one who gonna show you the way."]="钓鱼只是为了娱乐，伙计。你知道吗？我是在向我的导师学习，世界上最伟大的钓鱼者——纳特·帕格。你听说他没有，伙计？\n\n如果你想要寻求启迪，那么纳特·帕格会指引你前进的道路。"
G["Fishing is real easy.  Just take a pole with a line on it, maybe put some bait on it, and cast it out in the water.  Sure enough, them fish will start biting."]="钓鱼真的很简单。就是拿着一根杆子带着一条线，或许再放些鱼饵，然后扔到水里去，然后那些鱼就会开始咬饵了。"
G["Fishing poles are a crutch! A real fisher uses their hands."]="鱼竿仅仅只是辅助工具！真正的渔夫用自己的手捕鱼。"
G["Fishing poles... you fish like tuskarr.  Or worse, like humans."]="钓鱼竿……你们钓鱼的样子就像海象人。甚至更糟，简直像人类。"
G["Fishing sounds good."]="去钓鱼听起来不错。"
G["Fishmaster Bassbait has had the waters here seeded with high quality Tastyfish so he can have his tournament.\nOnce he gets his winners, I will give you silver for each five Tastyfish you bring me!"]="El maestro de pesca Anzuelo ha llenado estas aguas con pezricos de primera para poder celebrar el torneo.\n\nCuando ya haya ganadores, ¡te pagaré por cada cinco peces suculentos que me traigas!"
G["Fist Weapon"]="拳套"
G["Fist weapons are taught by Sayoc, the orc weapon master in Orgrimmar. He spends his days in the Valley of Honor."]="你可以在奥格瑞玛的兽人武器大师塞尤克那里学会使用拳套。他每天都在荣誉谷。"
G["Fists of flame!"]="烈焰之拳！"
G["Fists of frost!"]="寒冰之拳！"
G["Five and five years, and he still searches for her, though she was no beauty, and there were many ladies that would take her place."]="十年过去了，虽然她不是个美丽的女人，而且有很多女人可以取代她的位置，但是他还是在苦苦地找寻她。"
G["Five hundred ships at my disposal, yet the one that holds the key to the kingdom is missing. How can this be?"]="有五百艘船只任我调遣，可载有王国命脉的那艘却不见了。这怎么可能？"
G["Five on one hardly seems fair, but come on... they're half-dead gnomes. It's the leper gnome quintet!"]="五对一看来似乎不太公平，可拜托……那只是一群半死不活的侏儒而已。欢迎我们的麻风侏儒五人组！"
G["Five seconds. I'm not kidding!"]="就五秒。我没有开玩笑！"
G["Five sorcerers?"]="五名巫师？"
G["Five tickets or five hundred, it doesn't matter friend, everybody is a winner!"]="不管你有五张奖券还是五百张奖券，朋友，这都没关系，人人都是赢家！"
G["Five."]="五个。"
G["Fix her... FIX HER!"]="快弄好她……弄好她！"
G["Fix my armor, Corvus! My blade is rusty, Corvus!  ... when will these damned mortals learn to care for themselves?"]="帮我修理一下盔甲，科弗斯！我的剑生锈了，科弗斯！……这些该死的家伙什么时候才能学会照顾自己？"
G["Fix your eyes upon your crude hands: the sinew, the soft meat, the dark blood coursing within."]="好好看看你粗陋的手：看看那肌腱、软肉和其中的黑暗之血。"
G["Fixed you, didn't I?"]="搞定你了，对不对？"
G["Fixin' the tower and the wall! Keep the baddies off us!"]="快把塔楼和城墙修好！别让敌人冲进来了！"
G["Fixing"]="固定"
G["Fixing for a snack, $r?"]="来份点心怎么样，$r？"
G["Fizzcrank Fullthrottle."]="菲兹兰克·铁阀。"
G["Fizzle & Pozzik's Speedbarge my sweet patootie! I built this thing! Not them, not Razzeric!\n\nIt should be called Jinky's Speedbarge!"]="¡El Barcódromo de Fizzle y Pozzik, y una porra! ¡Yo construí esta cosa! ¡Ellos no, ni Razzeric! ¡Debería llamarse el Barcódromo de Jinky!"
G["Fizzle, Pozzik, Jinky... they all think that they saved us. But it was me! I built the ship!\n\nIt should be called, Razzeric's Speedbarge!"]="菲兹尔、普兹克、金吉……他们都把自己当成我们的救星。但其实是我！船是我造的！\n\n它应该叫拉泽瑞克的赛艇平台！"
G["Fizzy yellow beer is for wussies and grummles."]="起泡沫的黄啤酒是给懦夫和土地精准备的。"
G["Fjorn's Anvil now stands prominently in Dun Niffelem as a symbol of their victory over Fjorn and his armies.\n\nYou can't help but smile, knowing that your actions have had such a lasting impact on the world."]="弗约恩的铁砧被摆放在丹尼芬雷最显然的位置，象征着他们击败弗约恩以及冰霜巨人大军的战绩。\n\n你忍不住笑了起来，你的举动竟然对世界产生了如此深远的影响。"
G["Flame consume these mortals!"]="烈焰会吞噬那些凡人！"
G["Flame of Life!  Burn within me and renew my vigor!"]="生命之火，在我体内燃烧吧，重焕我的活力！"
G["Flame! Death! Destruction! The black fire rages within my heart! I must... release it! Hahah!"]="烈焰！死亡！毁灭！黑色的火焰在我心中燃烧！我必须……释放它！哈哈哈！"
G["Flamebringer attempts to throw you from his back. Return to Voldrune!"]="烈焰使者试图将你掀下去。返回沃德伦！"
G["Flames below, obey the call of the Twilight's Hammer!"]="下界之烈火，听从暮光之锤的召唤！"
G["Flames of passion serve only to ignite the kindle of others."]="心中熊熊燃烧的激情火焰，也会让他人感同身受。"
G["Flames will consume the world. Storms will wash away all hope. The elements will reign at last!"]="火焰将吞噬整个世界。暴风会吹走全部希望。元素终将成为这里的统治者！"
G["Flamestar!  I can return these dragons to their kind.  Let me take care of them."]="焰星！我可以送这些龙回归它们的族群。让我来照顾他们。"
G["Flank! To the flank!"]="侧翼！到侧翼去！"
G["Flanking attack! March into battle!"]="侧翼攻击！长驱直入！"
G["Flap Your Wings Rapidly to Re-Gain Altitude!"]="迅速拍打你的翅膀，重新恢复高度！"
G["Flat-nosed filth! Get off of my land!"]="扁鼻子的垃圾！离开我的地盘！"
G["Flatter you? You were eight years old."]="抬举你？那时你才八岁。"
G["Flattery will get you nowhere."]="谄媚对你没有好处。"
G["Flee in terror."]="恐惧吧！逃跑吧！"
G["Flee now while you still have your life!"]="现在就逃吧，趁你还活着的时候逃走吧！"
G["Flee or die!"]="逃吧，否则就来受死！"
G["Flee the city!  The ground can't stop shakin'!"]="快逃离城市！大地还在不停的颤动！"
G["Flee this place... or die!"]="快逃……不然就死！"
G["Flee while you can mortal!"]="凡人，趁现在还有机会，赶快逃跑吧！"
G["Flee while you still have a chance, mortals. You will pray for a swift death should I enter the arena."]="趁你们还有机会的时候，赶快逃走吧，凡人。如果我进入竞技场，你们就会祈求速死的。"
G["Flee!  Flee!"]="逃啊！逃啊！"
G["Flee!  They're everywhere!"]="赶快逃吧！他们到处都是！"
G["Flee, and die."]="逃向死亡。"
G["Flee, before it's too late!"]="逃走吧，否则就太迟了！"
G["Flee, child."]="逃跑吧，孩子。"
G["Flee, craven villagers! This land belongs to nature alone once more!"]="跑吧，懦夫！乡巴佬！这片土地将重归自然的怀抱！"
G["Flee, peon!"]="逃跑吧，苦工！"
G["Fleeeee!"]="逃跑吧！"
G["Fleeing is not an option I wish to entertain at this point. We will find another way.  Perhaps these tablets from Ulduar will shed some light on our situation."]="逃生可不是我眼下愿意采纳的方案。我们会想出其它办法来的。也许这些来自奥杜尔的石板能帮我们更好的理解当前的困境。"
G["Fleeing will do you no good, mortals!"]="凡人，逃跑是无济于事的！"
G["Flerberts. I'm not sure what they do, but I'd better lock down the name with a trademark."]="“吸引力诱发”，我不确定这有什么用，不过我最好先把这个名字注册一个商标。"
G["Flesh Rippers, hold the forward courtyard for our champions!"]="血肉撕裂者们，为我们的勇士们守好前庭！"
G["Flesh and sinew, weak but proud. Dare they part the Master's shroud? They stumble fumble groping blind. Finding fate and chaos intertwined."]="血肉之躯，虽弱犹荣。他们竟胆敢窥视主人的秘密？他们盲目的挣扎求索，发现命运交织于混沌。"
G["Flesh for the Scale-Lord!"]="你们的血肉献给邪鳞领主！"
G["Flesh for the miserable slaves below..."]="下面那些卑贱的奴隶有肉吃啦……"
G["Flesh for the offering."]="真是不错的祭品。"
G["Flesh from bone.... Tsss.... their spirits are broken!"]="剜肉剔骨……嘶……他们的灵魂将被粉碎！"
G["Flesh is no match for iron!"]="血肉永远无法胜过钢铁！"
G["Flesh turns to ash!"]="血肉化为灰烬！"
G["Flesh, living flesh..."]="肉，鲜活的肉……"
G["Flesh... burns!"]="血肉……燃烧吧！"
G["Flesh... is... weak!"]="血肉……是……脆弱的！"
G["Flesh... such a hindrance."]="血肉……碍事的东西。"
G["Fleshling, I am Captain Saeed of the Protectorate and these soldiers that stand by me are my avengers. We await orders from the fleshling who destroyed the void conduit. On that fleshling's word, we will make our way up to Dimensius's lair and wait for the word to make a final strike!\n\nToo long it has been... The void lord will soon face our combined might!"]="你好，我是维序派的萨义德上尉，我身旁的这些士兵是我的复仇者部队。我们等待着摧毁虚空管道的那个肉人的命令。用那个肉人的话来说，我们要赶到迪门修斯的巢穴外，等待最后进攻的命令！\n\n等了这么多年……虚空领主很快就会面对我们的夹击了！"
G["Fleshrender kill you now."]="撕肉者现在要将你杀死。"
G["Flight Master"]="飞行管理员"
G["Flight systems online!  CLUCK!  Engaging rockets for transport to Booty Bay!"]="飞行系统启动！咯咯嗒！发动火箭并准备传送到藏宝海湾！"
G["Flink, did you compile the compression data for the hydropneumatic recoil jack yet? Chop chop!"]="弗林克，你还没有为液压反弹起重器编译好压缩数据？赶快，赶快！"
G["Flint! Get out of here! He's too powerful!"]="弗林特！快走开！他太强大了！"
G["Flintlocke, if we have a big giant cannon, why don't we just shoot ... a cannonball?"]="弗林特洛克，如果我们有一门超级大炮，为什么我们不能……发射一颗炮弹？"
G["Flip the switch!"]="打开开关！"
G["Flipping the override switch now!"]="按下超控开关！"
G["Flitting through the mists with death upon his fists comes the sinister and serene jinyu assassin: Satay Byu!"]="现在掠过死亡迷雾，迎向他双拳的是——阴险沉着的锦鱼人杀手——萨塔耶·布宇！"
G["Float like a dragonhawk, sting like a scorpid!"]="像龙鹰一样漂移，像蝎子一样蜇人！"
G["Floaty sparks! Think they maybe give me one?"]="漂浮的火花！他们会给我一个吗？"
G["Flood of the deep, take you!"]="深渊中的洪水会淹没你们！"
G["Flood's not so bad. Not as bad as the ones we've had in Ironforge."]="洪水并没那么可怕。至少没我们在铁炉堡里经历的那一切可怕。"
G["Flooting isn't for stoopids."]="笛子可不是笨蛋玩的。"
G["Florkun wikket! I'll shove your nibs into your horker!"]="该死的蠢蛋！我要把你砸扁！"
G["Flow like the water, bend like the reed... blah, blah, blah. Just kick some butt!"]="行如流水，韧如芦苇……呱啦，呱啦，呱啦。对准屁股踢就对了！"
G["Flowers"]="鲜花"
G["Flowers and seeds and such?  That would be Reyna Stonebranch's area of expertise.  Ye can find her tending to her plants over at the Ironforge Physician on the southern side of The Great Forge."]="花和种子以及类似的东西？那是雷纳·石枝的专业领域。你能在大熔炉南面的铁炉堡医师协会处看到她料理她的植物。"
G["Flowers are nice, but they aren't  my favorite."]="花是很美，但那不是我的最爱。"
G["Flowers for sale, get your beautiful flowers!"]="出售鲜花，来买美丽的鲜花！"
G["Flowers?  In this wasteland?  If anyone can teach you how to find them it will be Mishiki down in Sen'jin Village to the south."]="花？在这片荒芜的土地上？如果有人能教你如何找到它们，那就是南方的森金村的米什基。"
G["Fluffy wikkets stole the mallet head! Kunzen hozen lost it many years ago. Now the fluffy wikkets hide inside their lair and worship the head like it some kind of fancy shmancy carrot.\n\nBe careful, those fluffy wikkets bite hard."]="长毛的蠢蛋偷走了杵头！昆森猢狲在很多年之前遗失了杵头。现在那些长毛的蠢蛋把杵头藏在他们的巢穴里，把它当作某种宝贝胡萝卜供奉了起来。\n\n小心点，那些长毛蠢蛋咬人可疼了。"
G["Fluffy! Fluffy, stop running!"]="小兔子！小兔子，别跑了！"
G["Fly away little soul."]="渺小的灵魂，滚吧。"
G["Fly high up above the jungle canopy.\n\nUse Pterrordash to temporarily increase your flight speed.\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_druid_dash.blp:32|t"]="飞越这片丛林的树冠。\n\n使用展翼掠飞暂时提高你的飞行速度。\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_druid_dash.blp:32|t"
G["Fly together with honor and courage. Now... rise as a serpent rider!"]="带着荣耀与勇气飞翔吧。现在……化身为翔龙骑士！"
G["Fly up to the nests above to stop Juveniles from hatching."]="飞上巢穴以阻止幼年凤凰孵化。"
G["Fly with me, Wakener, and I will show you the way of the Wind-Reaver."]="和我一同飞翔吧，唤醒者，我要让你见识下掠风者的风采。"
G["Flying"]="飞行"
G["Flying Snow chooses |cFFFF0000$n|r to chase down with her |cFFFF0000|Hspell:106706|h[Whirling Steel]|h|r!"]="飞雪选择|cFFFF0000$n|r，作为用|cFFFF0000|Hspell:106706|h[钢铁漩涡]|h|r追踪的目标！"
G["Flying Snow is chasing you with her |cFFFF0000|Hspell:|h[Whirling Steel]|h|r technique! Run away from her until she chooses someone else!"]="飞雪正在用|cFFFF0000|Hspell:|h[钢铁漩涡]|h|r追赶你！在她选中其他人之前，离她远点！"
G["Flying Snow!  Fragrant Lotus!  Step forward!"]="飞雪！香莲！速速上前！"
G["Flying Trainer"]="飞行训练师"
G["Flying away, little rider? A true champion would face me in the heart of fear!"]="飞走了，小骑士？真正的勇士即便心怀恐惧也会面对我！"
G["Flying machines?"]="飞行器？"
G["Flying through cloud rings is the best way to pick up speed. Sometimes it's worth going out of the way for that boost of speed!"]="穿越那些云之环是提升速度的最好办法。有时候为了提升速度而偏离一下航线还是很值得的！"
G["Foam Sword Rack"]="泡沫塑料剑架"
G["Focus all of your attacks onto one single slime!"]="集中火力，攻击同一个软泥怪！"
G["Focus on the fires. No - wait - get the saurok! Just ... do something!"]="注意那些火。不——等等——抓住那个蜥蜴人！快……做点什么啊！"
G["Focus upon that warmth as I speak..."]="注意我所提到的温暖一词……"
G["Focus your fire, $p!"]="集中火力，$p。"
G["Focus your mind, mortal. This is the front line of a war unlike any you've witnessed.\n\nYou'll need full command of your faculties if you are to be of any use."]="别走神啊。这场战争非比寻常，前线的气氛尤其紧张。\n\n想帮忙的话就打起精神来，让我看看你有多大的本事。"
G["Focus, $n.\n\nWe have to get to the Coffer of Promise before Schnottz does!"]="集中精神，$n。\n\n我们必须赶在司克诺兹的前面拿到应许约柜！"
G["Focus, $p! The meat from wildlife or rations from orc troops will keep my crew well fed!"]="注意听，$p！你在野生动物身上找到的肉或者从兽人士兵身上找到的军粮都能填饱伙计们的肚子。"
G["Focus, Weisheng. Show your enemy the meaning of pain!"]="集中精神，魏尚。让你的敌人尝尝痛苦的滋味！"
G["Fodder for the engine."]="去注满引擎吧。"
G["Foe Reaper 5000 on-line.  All systems nominal."]="死神5000型已就绪。系统全部正常。"
G["Fog... nothing but dense fog... wait! Land - starboard! I see ships."]="雾……只有浓雾……等等！右转舵！我看见船了。"
G["Folk 'round here are mighty good... if you stick 'round long enough to find out."]="这里的人们心地善良……在这儿待久了你就会发现。"
G["Folks 'round here are a little wary of strangers, but they warm right up once you get to know them.\n\nOnce you're more experienced, you can get to know them by helping them out."]="这附近的住民对陌生人心怀警惕，可一旦熟识之后，他们就会令你如沐春风。\n\n等你积累更多经验后，你就能向他们提供帮助，与他们建立友谊。"
G["Folks 'round here are always in need of a hand, but you're not strong enough yet. Once you've walked more o' this land, you come back and they'll be begging you for aid."]="这附近的住民常常需要帮助，可你还不够强大。你需要在这片土地上多加游历，等你回来时，他们就会求你帮忙了。"
G["Folks 'round here have been talking about you, $n! I've been telling everyone that you're my neighbor."]="¡La gente de por aquí ha estado hablando sobre ti, $n! Les he dicho a todos que eres mi $gvecino:vecina;."
G["Folks 'round here have been talking about you, $n! You're making quite a stir around here."]="这里的人们都在谈论你，$n！你打破了这里的平静。"
G["Folks 'round here have been talking about you, buddy. Don't worry, I put in a good word now and then."]="这里的人们都在谈论你，哥们。别担心，我会时不时地帮你说些好话的。"
G["Folks 'round here have been talking about you, friend! They do seem to fancy you quite a lot."]="¡La gente de por aquí ha estado hablando sobre ti, $gamigo:amiga;! Parece que les has caído bastante bien."
G["Folks 'round here have been talking about you. Don't worry, I put in a good word now and then."]="这里的人们都在谈论你。别担心，我会时不时地帮你说些好话的。"
G["Folks, I'm handing out epics over here! Don't miss out!"]="伙计们，我这里有精美奖品发放！千万不要错过！"
G["Follow Tobias Mistmantle into the Cathedral District."]="跟踪托比亚斯·密斯特曼托，进入教堂区。"
G["Follow and use the shield as cover!"]="跟上，用护盾做掩护！"
G["Follow dis path, mon, and soon you be tastin' immortality!"]="朋友，只要踏上这条路，很快你也能成为不朽的存在！"
G["Follow me and I will show you around the Peak of Serenity."]="跟我来，我会带你在晴日峰四处走走。"
G["Follow me and I'll open the courtyard door for you."]="跟着我，我将会为你打开庭院的门。"
G["Follow me closely, and prepare for battle!"]="跟紧我，准备战斗！"
G["Follow me if you dare!"]="够胆子的话就跟我走！"
G["Follow me into the mountains to carry out the plan of the masters!"]="跟着我进入山岭，执行主人的计划！"
G["Follow me!"]="跟着我！"
G["Follow me! I'll lead you to Smuggler's Scar."]="跟我来！我带你去走私者洞穴。"
G["Follow me! You stand no chance here alone!"]="跟着我！在这儿掉队就死定了！"
G["Follow me! Zhere is much to be done!"]="跟上！还有许多事情要做！"
G["Follow me, $c. It be takin' da both of us to open these gates."]="跟我来，$c。需要我们二个人一起来才能打开大门。"
G["Follow me, $n! Hurry!"]="跟着我，$n！快一点！"
G["Follow me, $n, and I'll introduce you to your trainer, \"Doc\" Cogspin."]="Sígueme, $n, y te presentaré a tu instructora, \"Doc\" Rotadiente."
G["Follow me, $n, and I'll introduce you to your trainer, Alamar Grimm."]="跟我来，$n。我会把你介绍给你的训练师，阿拉玛尔·格里姆。"
G["Follow me, $n, and I'll introduce you to your trainer, Bipsi Frostflinger"]="跟我来，$n。我会把你介绍给你的训练师，贝西·冰雹。"
G["Follow me, $n, and I'll introduce you to your trainer, Bipsi Frostflinger."]="跟我来，$n。我会把你介绍给你的训练师，贝西·冰雹。"
G["Follow me, $n, and I'll introduce you to your trainer, Drill Sergeant Steamcrank."]="跟我来，$n。我会把你介绍给你的训练师，教官汽轴。"
G["Follow me, $n, and I'll introduce you to your trainer, Kelsey Steelspark."]="跟我来，$n。我会把你介绍给你的训练师，凯尔希·钢烁。"
G["Follow me, $n. A ceremony has been prepared in your honor."]="跟我走，$n。我们已经为你准备了一场典礼。"
G["Follow me, $n. I'll take you to the Defias hideout. But you better protect me or I am as good as dead."]="跟着我，$n。我会把你带到迪菲亚兄弟会的老巢里。但是你最好能保护我，不然我就死定了。"
G["Follow me, I know the way through."]="跟我来，我知道路。"
G["Follow me, citizen."]="跟我来，公民。"
G["Follow me, friends. To Stormwind Keep!"]="跟着我，朋友。到暴风城要塞！"
G["Follow me, good Paladin.  I'll have your barding done faster than I could down a Dwarven stout.  Mmmm... stout."]="跟着我吧，圣骑士。我制造马饰比我喝矮人烈酒要快。嗯……烈酒。"
G["Follow me, mortal. The rift is near."]="跟着我，凡人！裂隙就在附近。"
G["Follow me, my pets! The realm of the mighty Neptulon is ours at last!"]="跟着我，宠物们！耐普图隆的国度终于成了我们的掌中之物！"
G["Follow me, please."]="请跟着我。"
G["Follow me, stranger.  This won't take long."]="Sígueme, extranjer$go:a;. No tardaremos mucho."
G["Follow me, traveler. Let us get to know one another better."]="跟着我，旅行者。让我们彼此多了解一下对方。"
G["Follow me."]="跟着我。"
G["Follow me. They visited both the Shrine of Lost Souls and the Temple Summit."]="跟着我。他们光顾了失落灵魂神殿和神殿之巅。"
G["Follow me. We will use these totems to purify the earth."]="跟着我。我们要用这些图腾来净化大地。"
G["Follow my lead, $n!"]="跟着我，$n！"
G["Follow ol' Bom'bay! He know de way!"]="跟老波贝来！他认识路！"
G["Follow the hatchlings into the Obsidian Lair."]="跟随幼龙进入黑曜石巢穴。"
G["Follow the trail of homeless to the Deadmines dungeon entrance."]="跟着无家可归者前往死亡矿井地下城的入口。"
G["Follow, $n.  I will soon begin the summoning..."]="集中精神，$n。我马上要开始召唤仪式了……"
G["Follow."]="跟上。"
G["Following you all over the place. Have been for a while now."]="到处跟着你，到现在已经好一会儿了。"
G["Folvynn buul hrom onn!"]="Anulado."
G["Food & Drink"]="食物和饮料"
G["Food and drink for sale!"]="出售食物和饮料！"
G["Food and drink taste even sweeter after a well fought battle."]="大战过后，吃起东西来格外香甜。"
G["Food and wood are our primary needs. Speak with me if you seek to aid us further."]="我们最主要的需求是食物和木材。如果你想要帮我们更多的忙，就和我谈谈吧。"
G["Food for bugs!"]="有东西喂虫虫吃啦！"
G["Food is essential to life. Even a brave $c such as yourself can take the time to sit down and enjoy the essence of life!"]="El alimento es indispensable para la vida. Hasta $gun:una; $c como tú puede sentarse un rato para disfrutar de la esencia de la vida."
G["Food, now there's a subject that I can sink my fangs into! I am told that we have $2095w of $2096w lean wolf steaks, $2102w out of $2103w spotted yellowtail, and $2105w of $2106w baked salmon on ice and stored away."]="收集食物是眼下我惟一的工作！我们已经收集到$2095w块瘦狼排、$2102w条斑点黄尾鱼和$2105w条烤鲑鱼了，总的需求量分别是$2096w、$2103w和$2106w。"
G["Food? What about my last paycheck? Did you bring that too?"]="食物？我的上一期薪水支票呢？那个你带来了么？"
G["Fool mortals. Hurl yourselves into your own demise!"]="愚蠢的凡人。你们这是自寻死路。"
G["Fool mortals. Hurl yourselves into your own demise."]="愚蠢的凡人。你们这是自寻死路。"
G["Fool of a demon hunter.  How many pieces must I cut you into this time?"]="愚蠢的恶魔猎手。这次我得把你切成多少块？"
G["Fool of a mortal. Flesh burns."]="愚蠢的凡人。燃烧吧。"
G["Fool!"]="¡$gNecio:Necia;!"
G["Fool!  You led us to the only being that could stand up to our armies!  You will never bring the Etymidian back to Northrend!"]="¡$gNecio:Necia;! ¡Nos has traído ante el único ser que puede enfrentarse a nuestros ejércitos! ¡Jamás llevarás a El Etimidiano de vuelta a Rasganorte!"
G["Fool! Be bathed in the flames!"]="烈焰吞没你！"
G["Fool! Cyrukh the fire lord! When the tie was severed, Cyrukh awoke. It is the tears of Cyrukh that fill this land with molten rock."]="蠢货！火焰之王森卢肯！当联系被切断的时候，森卢肯醒了，是森卢肯的泪水注满了这片遍是熔岩的大地。"
G["Fool! Do you know what you've done? This is sacred ground!"]="¡$gEstúpido:Estúpida;! ¿Sabes lo que has hecho? ¡Esto es suelo sagrado!"
G["Fool! I will crush you!"]="蠢货！我要粉碎你！"
G["Fool! I will destroy you and finally become that which has been building inside of you all of these years!"]="蠢货！我要彻底摧毁你，成为你内心世界真正的主宰！"
G["Fool! The essence of the hawk will never be yours!"]="蠢货！山鹰精华永远不会落入你的手中！"
G["Fool! Ya coulda been havin' great power, mon!"]="蠢货！你本来可以获得强大的力量！"
G["Fool! You are a child playing in a world beyond your comprehension. Speak no more!"]="笨蛋！你这个不知道天高地厚的家伙。闭嘴！"
G["Fool! You dare enter the realm of fire?"]="¡$gInsensato:Insensata;! ¿Te atreves a adentrarte en el reino de fuego?"
G["Fool! You shall pay dearly for your interference!"]="蠢货！你们要为此而付出沉重的代价！"
G["Fool! You will never defeat me!"]="蠢货！你赢不了我的！"
G["Fool! You'll never get away with this!"]="蠢货！你永远别想逃脱！"
G["Fool! You've led us into a trap! I won't die here, Mograine!"]="蠢货！你让我们落入了圈套！我可不想死在这里，莫格莱尼！"
G["Fool! Your deeds in Ashenvale shall not go unpunished!"]="蠢货！你要为在灰谷的所作所为而遭到惩罚！"
G["Fool! Your fate is sealed!"]="蠢货！你死定了！"
G["Fool's Gold"]="愚人的金子"
G["Fool."]="蠢货。"
G["Fool. Do you think to stop the full might of the mogu empire?"]="蠢货。你竟然妄想与魔古帝国展开全面对抗？"
G["Fool. My Dark Shaman have twisted and tortured the elements for miles around. They cannot hear you now. Once again you prove too weak and powerless to do anything."]="蠢货。我的黑暗萨满已经扭曲了这附近的元素。它们听不到你的召唤了。这再次证明了你是多么软弱，一事无成。"
G["Foolish $C!  I will snap the bones of this weak $R!"]="¡Inútil $c! ¡Romperé los huesos de $geste estúpido:esta estúpida; $r!"
G["Foolish $C!  You are no match for my might!"]="愚蠢的$c！你根本无法与我对抗！"
G["Foolish $C!  You are no match for the minions of Ragnaros!"]="¡$gEstúpido:Estúpida; $c! ¡No estás a la altura de los esbirros de Ragnaros!"
G["Foolish $c, you cannot stop the Kvaldir!"]="¡$gEstúpido:Estúpida;, $c! ¡No puedes detener a los Kvaldir!"
G["Foolish $n, you serve me now!"]="愚蠢的$n，你现在为我服务！"
G["Foolish $r!  You seek the dwarf?  Baroness Anastari has hidden him well!"]="¡$gEstúpido:Estúpida; $r! ¿Buscas al enano? ¡La baronesa Anastari lo ha escondido bien!"
G["Foolish $r! There is a new order. Aviana is dead. DEAD! And never coming back.\n\nTell that to the druids in the trees.\n\nSethria will soon be the master of the skies, and she has made sure Aviana will never be reborn. The egg is hers.\n\nYou are too late."]="愚蠢的$r！新的秩序已然建立。艾维娜已经死了。死了！再也不会回来了。\n\n回去告诉树林里的那群德鲁伊。\n\n塞西莉亚很快将成为新的天穹之主，而且有她在，艾维娜再也别想重生！蛋是塞西莉亚的了！\n\n你来的太迟了。"
G["Foolish Akama, your mortal time has expired...."]="愚蠢的阿卡玛，你的生命已经到了尽头……"
G["Foolish Crok. You brought my reinforcements with you. Arise, Argent Champions, and serve the Lich King in death!"]="愚蠢的科罗克。你带来了我的援军。银色勇士们，用你们的死来效忠巫妖王吧！"
G["Foolish Troll, you will join our ranks. Zombie! Attack!"]="愚蠢的巨魔，加入我们的行列吧。僵尸！进攻！"
G["Foolish child, you will not stop what I have set in motion! Now, meet your doom!"]="傻瓜，你阻止不了我！受死吧！"
G["Foolish child."]="¡$gCrío estúpido:Cría estúpida;!"
G["Foolish druid! Dividing your essence has weakened you, opening the door for my master to dominate the Emerald Dream. Your spirit and your body will die here!"]="愚蠢的德鲁伊！精神与肉体的分离使你变得虚弱不堪，我的主人即将支配整个翡翠梦境，你的灵魂和你的身体将会在这里湮灭！"
G["Foolish elemental slave! You and your master will pay for your meddling!"]="愚蠢的元素仆从！你和你的主人会付出代价的！"
G["Foolish errand $G boy:girl;... you will die for interrupting my work!"]="愚蠢的$G小子:小丫头;……你竟然敢打扰我的工作，受死吧！"
G["Foolish girl!  You seek that which I killed long ago.  A faint echo in my mind."]="你要找那个早就被我干掉的家伙吗？现在他只是一个幽魂，一个我脑中微弱的回音……"
G["Foolish girl. You seek that which I killed long ago. He is merely a ghost now. A faint echo in my mind..."]="你要找那个早就被我干掉的家伙吗？现在他只是一个幽魂，一个我脑中微弱的回音……"
G["Foolish mortal!"]="愚蠢的凡人！"
G["Foolish mortal, I will rend your soul in two once I am released!"]="愚蠢的凡人，只要我被释放出来，我就要撕碎你的灵魂！"
G["Foolish mortals!  You toy with arcane powers beyond your understanding!  I will put an end to this mockery of magic!"]="愚蠢的凡人！你根本无法理解自己正在玩弄怎样的奥术力量！而我将结束这出魔法的闹剧！"
G["Foolish mortals-(Usurper's children!) nothing you have done- (Spawn of a lesser god!) I am TRYING to speak here. (Words, words, words. The Master wants murder.) ALL falls to chaos. ALL will be destroyed. (Chaos, chaos!) Your work here today changes nothing. (Chaos, chaos, all things end) No mortal may see what you have and live. Your end has come."]="愚蠢的凡人——（篡位者之子！）你的所为毫无意义——（劣等神之种！）你不要打断我说话。（听啊，听啊，听啊。主人渴望杀戮。）万物归于混沌。万物终将消亡。（混乱，混乱！）你今日的努力也无济于事。（混乱，混乱，一切都将终结）没有凡人能活着见证这一切。你的末日到了。"
G["Foolish mortals. Did you think that I would not strike you down for your transgressions?"]="愚蠢的凡人，竟敢冒犯我！别以为我会放过你们！"
G["Foolish mortals. You thought us defeated so easily? The San'layn are the Lich King's immortal soldiers! Now you shall face their might combined!"]="愚蠢的凡人。你以为能轻易打败我们？萨莱因是巫妖王永生的战士！现在他们将合力撕碎你！"
G["Foolish old tauren, you dare display such disrespect?!"]="愚蠢的老牛头人，你竟敢如此目空一切？！"
G["Foolish trespasser!"]="愚蠢的入侵者！"
G["Foolish warlocks. I knew you would try again to ransack our temple...!"]="愚蠢的术士，我就知道你们还在打我们神殿的主意……！"
G["Foolish whelp! I will consume your energies - and then your SOUL!"]="愚蠢的家伙！我会吞噬你的能量，还有你的灵魂！"
G["Foolishly you have sought your own demise."]="你们这些蠢货已经主动步入了陷阱。"
G["Foolishly you have sought your own demise. Brazenly you have disregarded powers beyond your understanding. You have fought hard to invade the realm of the harvester. Now there is only one way out- to walk the lonely path of the damned."]="你们这些蠢货已经主动步入了陷阱。你们正在挑战一个无比强大的存在。虽然你们经历了千难万险才来到收割者的领域，来到我的面前，但是现在，活下来的唯一途径就是加入诅咒神教。"
G["Foolishness! Do you know nothing of that accursed blade, $c?\n\nIt would devour all that you are. Whatever remained of your lifeless husk would spend eternity in the enemy's service.\n\nIt is that same rationale that bought Arthas his fate, costing Azeroth legions of its best champions.\n\nStill, there may be something...."]="蠢货！$c，你对那把诅咒之剑完全不了解？\n\n它会把你彻底吞噬，所剩下的皮囊会为敌人永远效力。\n\n阿尔萨斯的命运就是这样铸成的，艾泽拉斯无数的精英勇士为此而倒下。\n\n不过，可能还有…"
G["Fools!"]="蠢货！"
G["Fools!  It is too late for them  And it is too late for all of you! You will join us and together we will unearth secrets that will unravel this world!"]="蠢货！对他们来说，一切都已经太晚了。对你们所有人来说都太晚了！你们要和我们一起发掘出这个将毁灭世界的秘密！"
G["Fools!  This entire ship is rigged with explosives!  Enjoy your fiery deaths!"]="蠢货！整艘船上都布满了炸药！在烈焰中去见死神吧！"
G["Fools!  You cannot defeat me!  I will only return again..."]="蠢货！你们不可能打败我！我还会回来的……"
G["Fools!  You seek to abjure my father's presence?  Death awaits you, mortals!"]="蠢货！你们胆敢侮辱我父亲？受死吧，凡人们！"
G["Fools! Assemble yourselves!"]="蠢货们！集合！"
G["Fools! Attacking the might of the mantid head on?  Your deaths will be swift."]="蠢货！竟敢正面挑战强大的螳螂妖？你会死得很快的。"
G["Fools! Did you think our master blind? Did you think we did not know of this intrusion? Our elder sisters come, and there will be no escape from their wrath!"]="蠢货！你以为我们的主人瞎了吗？你以为我们不知道你的闯入吗？我们的长姊们就要来了，你绝对无法逃脱她们的怒火！"
G["Fools! Do not allow my rest to be interrupted again!"]="蠢货！别再打搅我休息！"
G["Fools! Fight harder! Do not let these puny pandaren defeat you!"]="蠢货！卖力点！别让这些弱小的熊猫人打败你！"
G["Fools! I control what makes you fight... Fear, anger, doubt... these are MY weapons!"]="蠢货！我能控制那些驱动你战斗的情绪……恐惧，愤怒，疑惑……这些是我的武器！"
G["Fools! Imbeciles!"]="蠢货！低能！"
G["Fools! It could very well be an increase in temperature that perfects the plague!"]="蠢货！高温很可能是完善药剂样本的重要条件。"
G["Fools! Make yourselves useful..."]="蠢货！派上点儿用场……"
G["Fools! Neltharion take you all!"]="蠢货！奈萨里奥会杀了你们！"
G["Fools! Nothing can stop us now!"]="蠢货！谁都无法阻止我们！"
G["Fools! Our cause is righteous!"]="蠢货！我们的事业是正义的！"
G["Fools! Simpletons! Look at you milling about, oblivious to the coming of the end!"]="白痴！蠢货！看看你们无头苍蝇般的样子，对即将到来的末日浑然不觉！"
G["Fools! The true Horde cannot be stopped by the likes of you."]="蠢货！你们这些人在正统部落面前不堪一击。"
G["Fools! These docks are under Dragonmaw control! Your ships will burn, and you with them!"]="蠢货！这里已经被龙喉氏族控制了！你们将和这些船只一起葬身火海！"
G["Fools! These eggs are more precious than you know!"]="蠢货！这些蛋比你认为的要珍贵的多！"
G["Fools! Weaklings! Tzerak has no need of your assistance!"]="蠢货！懦夫！瑟拉克不再需要你们的帮助了！"
G["Fools! You cannot defeat me! You cannot defeat the yaungol!"]="蠢货！你无法打败我！你无法打败野牛人！"
G["Fools! You think yourselves triumphant? You have only taken one step closer to the abyss!"]="蠢货！你们以为胜券在握了吗？你们只不过是离地狱更近了一步而已。"
G["Fools! You thought they were hidden, deep in the sands of Uldum..."]="蠢货！你们却还以为它们深藏在奥丹姆的沙砾之下……"
G["Fools, I knew that if I played upon my brother's feeble emotions, he would send 'rescuers.'"]="笨蛋，如果我拿我兄弟脆弱的感情开玩笑，他会被送去急救的。"
G["Fools, I possess the power of the elements!"]="蠢货，我掌握着元素的力量！"
G["Fools, you will die with me!"]="蠢货，你们得跟我一起死！"
G["Fools."]="蠢货。"
G["Fools.  Obsidion!  Rise, and destroy the interlopers!"]="蠢货。奥比斯顿！起来，消灭入侵者！"
G["Fools. Weaklings."]="蠢货！懦夫！"
G["Foolsss, you will not ssssuccceed in ssstealing the ark!"]="蠢货，你休想偷走箱子！"
G["Foolsss... Kill the one in the dress!"]="蠢货……杀死穿那件衣服的人！"
G["Footmen, make a line!"]="步兵，排成一行！"
G["Footprints lead toward the mountain to the north."]="这些最后的足印，一直延伸到北边的山里。"
G["For 10,000 years I have ruled this kingdom. In that time, I have heard many fascinating tales from those that would walk the hallowed grounds of the House of Shen'dralar.\n\nAs I am bound to this place, I often exchange stories with visitors. Do you have a story for me or perhaps you would like to hear a story?"]="我统治这个王国已经有一万年啦。在那时，我从那些神圣的辛德拉家族成员那儿听到很多令人着迷的故事。\n\n由于我必须呆在这儿，所以我常常和访问者沟通交谈。你可以为我讲个故事吗，或许你想听听我的故事？"
G["For 3,000 years, we have passed the knowledge of our people down. Elder to youth. Master to student."]="三千年来，这些智慧在我们中间代代相传，长幼相继，师徒相承。"
G["For Ashenvale!"]="为了灰谷！"
G["For Azeroth, we heed the call!"]="¡Por Azeroth, respondemos a la llamada!"
G["For Bael Modan!"]="为了巴尔莫丹！"
G["For Blackscale!"]="为了黑鳞！"
G["For Bolvar! For the Alliance!"]="为了伯瓦尔！为了联盟！"
G["For Broxigar!"]="为了布洛克斯而战！"
G["For Captain Ook!"]="为了乌克头领！"
G["For Chee Chee? You shouldn't have!"]="给吱吱的吗？你可以不用这样的！"
G["For Dalaran! Attack!"]="为了达拉然！进攻！"
G["For Darrowshire!"]="为了达隆郡！"
G["For Doloria!"]="为了多罗莉亚！"
G["For Drak'Tharon!"]="为达克萨隆要塞而战！"
G["For Elune!"]="为了艾露恩！"
G["For Fanny! For Firebeard! For fun!"]="为了范妮！为了焰须！为了我们的乐趣！"
G["For Gilneas!"]="为了吉尔尼斯！"
G["For Gnomeregan!"]="为了诺莫瑞根！"
G["For Hellscream!"]="为了地狱咆哮！"
G["For Hellscream! For the Horde!"]="为了地狱咆哮！为了部落！"
G["For I see now what I had become, so weighted down by doubt and anger. All my life, I had CHOSEN to be a slave to fear..."]="我看清了现在的自己——怀疑和愤怒摧垮了我。终我一生，我自己选择了成为恐惧的奴隶……"
G["For Ihgaluk!"]="为了伊瓜鲁克！"
G["For Ironforge!"]="为了铁炉堡！"
G["For Ironforge! FOR THE ALLIANCE!"]="为了铁炉堡！为了联盟！"
G["For Kael!"]="为了凯尔萨斯！"
G["For Kael'thas and the Burning Legion!"]="为了凯尔萨斯和燃烧军团！"
G["For Kael'thas and the Legion!"]="为了凯尔萨斯和燃烧军团！"
G["For Kael'thas!"]="为了凯尔萨斯！"
G["For Kalimdor!"]="为了卡利姆多而战！"
G["For Kargath!  For Victory!"]="为了卡加斯！为了胜利！"
G["For Kargesh!"]="为了克尔格西！"
G["For Khaz Modan!"]="为了卡兹莫丹！"
G["For Kurdran!"]="为了库德兰！"
G["For Lord Illidan, I would sacrifice even this magnificent physique. On this day, you will fall - another victim of Torloth..."]="为了伊利丹大人，我甚至愿意牺牲这强大的体魄。今天，你一定会倒下——成为我托洛斯刀下的亡魂……"
G["For Lordaeron!"]="为洛丹伦而战！"
G["For Lordaeron! For victory!"]="为了洛丹伦！为了胜利！"
G["For Neptulon! Strength of storm and sea, crush my enemies!"]="为猎潮者而战！海洋与风暴的力量，摧毁我的敌人吧！"
G["For Northwatch!"]="为了北卫军！"
G["For Ordos!"]="为了斡耳朵斯！"
G["For Pandaria!"]="为了潘达利亚！"
G["For Pandaria!!"]="为了潘达利亚！！"
G["For Pandaria!!!"]="为了潘达利亚！！"
G["For Quel'Thalas! For the Sunwell!"]="为了奎尔萨拉斯！为了太阳之井！"
G["For Salhadaar! For the Nexus-King!"]="为了萨哈达尔！为了节点亲王！"
G["For Shandris!"]="为了珊蒂斯！"
G["For Silvermoon! For Sunstrider!"]="为了银月城！为了逐日者！"
G["For Spinebreaker!"]="为了断背者而战！"
G["For Stonefather Oremantle!"]="为了岩幔国王！"
G["For Stonehearth!"]="为了巨石之炉！"
G["For Stormglen! For Gilneas!"]="为了风谷村！为了吉尔尼斯！"
G["For Stormwind!"]="为了暴风城！"
G["For Sylvanas!"]="为了希尔瓦娜斯！"
G["For Taerar!"]="为了泰拉尔！"
G["For Theramore!"]="为了塞拉摩！"
G["For Vol'jin!"]="为了沃金！"
G["For Warchief Garrosh!"]="为了加尔鲁什酋长！"
G["For Warchief Garrosh!!!"]="为了加尔鲁什酋长！！！"
G["For Warchief Hellscream!"]="为了地狱咆哮酋长！"
G["For Xi'ri!  For the Sha'tar!"]="为了克希利！为了沙塔尔！"
G["For Ymiron!"]="为了伊米隆国王！"
G["For Zandalar!!"]="为了赞达拉！！"
G["For a limited time only, crunchy frog available exclusively here at the Darkmoon Faire."]="限时供应！暗月马戏团独家美味，脆青蛙肉！机会难得！"
G["For a moment I thought you were my beloved Sif... that strand of hair... but no!  It can't be... Sif is dead....\n\nMy... my brother.... killed her!"]="刚才那一瞬间，我把你当成了我亲爱的西芙……那一缕头发……不！那不可能……西芙已经死了……\n\n我……我的兄弟……杀了她！"
G["For a small donation, I can train you in the priestly arts."]="只要一点捐赠，我就能教导你牧师的技艺。"
G["For ages, I was lost.  Now, finally, I see how dark my soul had become..."]="这些年来，我一直处于迷失的混沌中。现在，我终于看到自己的灵魂变得有多么黑暗……"
G["For all my supposed wisdom, there have been moments that I've barely been able to hold the Horde together. The Wrath Gate and Undercity displayed that clearly enough."]="即使我倾尽智慧也曾多次几乎无法维持部落的团结。天谴之门和幽暗城就是最好的证明。"
G["For all of its dangers, this land is a hunter's paradise."]="这片土地简直就是猎人的乐园，因为这里充满了危险。"
G["For as long as we are able, we shall provide safe haven for those who seek it."]="我们将竭尽所能，为那些寻求庇护之人提供安全场所。"
G["For big King!"]="为了大王！"
G["For countless years, and across the faces of many worlds, draenei have yearned to better embrace the Light and put an end to the darkness. So too have our Scryer brethren held such ambition."]="无数的时光，无尽的探寻，德莱尼人一直渴望与圣光更紧密地相拥，并将那黑暗终结。我们的占星者兄弟们也同样有着如此的雄心壮志。"
G["For da Horde!"]="为了部落！"
G["For da Horde."]="为了部落。"
G["For days following the fall of Lei Shen, the vale was shrouded in a cloud of the deepest black. Summoned by Lei Shen in his final moments, the otherworldly storm blanketed the vale with rainfall and struck jagged spears of lightning into the hills."]="雷神溃败后的这些天，四风谷被最深黑色的乌云笼罩。雷神在他临终前召唤出异世的风暴笼罩四风谷，伴随着降雨和锯齿状的闪电长矛劈落在山上。"
G["For de Darkspear!"]="为了暗矛！"
G["For dey Horde!"]="为了部落！"
G["For eight hundred and seventy-seven years, I waited in that crystal... watching shadows pass through the cracks, counting decades."]="八百七十七年来，我在那块水晶中等待……看白驹过隙，数岁月流逝。"
G["For every Horde soldier that you killed -- for every Alliance dog that fell, the Lich King's armies grew. Even now the val'kyr work to raise your fallen as Scourge."]="你每消灭一名部落士兵，或是杀死一只联盟狗。巫妖王的军力就会增长一分。瓦格里正在把你们的阵亡者变为天灾战士。"
G["For every ill or evil that rises in Pandaria, there is always a perfectly complementary cure. I find it to be a good analogy to all problems."]="对于潘达利亚的每次不幸和灾难，总有一个完美的解决方案。我觉得这一点适用于所有的问题。"
G["For every orc that struck me, I will cleave a thousand of their skulls!"]="每一个欺负过我的兽人，我都要让他们加倍地偿还！"
G["For everything that you take, give double in kind."]="滴水之恩，当涌泉相报。"
G["For everything you have done, $n... you have our gratitude."]="你为我们所做的一切，$n……我们都铭记在心。"
G["For fortune!"]="为了财富！"
G["For generations I protected my people with the mists, and yet with each and every champion I see before me, I realize more and more the error of my ways. May you learn from the lessons of Pandaria, as I have."]="几代以来，我一直用迷雾保护着我的人民，但看着眼前的一个个勇士，我越来越意识到自己的错误。愿你和我一样，从潘达利亚的历史中得到教训。"
G["For glory! For honor! FOR THUNDERMAR!"]="为了荣誉！为了光荣！为了桑德玛尔！"
G["For her Excellency... for... Vashj!"]="为了……瓦丝琪女王！"
G["For her grace, Lady Naz'jar."]="为了她的荣耀，纳兹夏尔女士。"
G["For him, Horde be about orcs, an' buildin' up orc power. Like he just come through de portal. Anyone stand in his way, anyone tink any diff'rent, he shut 'em up.\n\n<Vol'jin runs his three-fingered hand across his scar.>\n\nHe like an angry dog. Oh, I fight next to Hellscream in battle, sure. But put him in charge? Ya askin' for trouble. He pick his favorites, start his war, shove me bruddahs aside... He don't tink he need nobody else. Well, he wrong.\n\nHe gonna learn: ya never cross family."]="对他来说，部落的全部意义便是兽人，以及如何壮大兽人的力量。他就像是刚刚穿过黑暗之门。任何挡他路的人，任何与他意见相左的人，都得闭嘴。\n\n<沃金用只有三根手指的手摸了摸身上的刀疤。>\n\n他就像一条疯狗。噢，没错，我是与地狱咆哮并肩战斗过。但要让他来掌管一切？你简直是在自找麻烦。他热衷于搞自己的小团体，发动他自己的战争，将我们这些老兄弟丢在一边……他觉得自己用不着任何人帮忙。但是，他错了。\n\n他会明白：一个人永远无法与这个大家庭对抗。"
G["For his glory!"]="为了主人的荣耀！"
G["For honor!"]="为了荣耀！"
G["For honor! For justice!"]="为了荣耀！为了正义！"
G["For honor, for mercy, for Gorefiend.  Forever."]="尽其一生，为荣誉，为宽恕，为血魔而战。"
G["For hours, I agonized over the visions the waters of the river showed me."]="连续几个小时，我一直在为那河中的水流带给我的幻象而苦恼。"
G["For it to be as it must, yes."]="是的。必须这样。"
G["For many hundreds of years Alassin has cared for the animals that our hunters befriend.  His care of animals is highly sought for by the hunters around here.  If you seek him as well, then look for him in the Cenarion Enclave."]="数百年以来阿拉辛一直很关心我们猎人视作朋友的动物。他对动物的关心被周围的猎人所追随。如果你也来向他请教，那么就到塞纳里奥区找他。"
G["For mastery over the arcane, you need look no further than Semid. He teaches on the eastern side of Azure Watch along with Ruada."]="如果想要掌握奥术魔法，你只需要去找塞米德就可以了。他就在碧蓝岗哨的东边，和鲁安达在一起。"
G["For me?"]="给我的？"
G["For me? Really, mon?"]="给我的？真的吗？"
G["For me? That's mighty nice of you, $n."]="给我的？你真是太好了，$n。"
G["For millennia I have waited in darkness, in silence pierced only by the shrieks of the tormented, my dreams a waking nightmare."]="我在黑暗中等待了上千年，在死寂中只有受难者的尖叫，这是一个活生生的噩梦。"
G["For millennia this being lay dormant beneath the world - biding its time. From its prison it waited for the exact moment at which to strike back at those that would see it harmed."]="千年来，它在地底休眠，苟延残喘，等待时机发动反击。"
G["For most of my life the faire has been my home."]="我一生中的大部分都是在马戏团里度过的，它就是我的家。"
G["For multiple targets, bring a blizzard down upon their heads."]="对于多个目标，往他们的头上扔暴风雪。"
G["For my Taunka brothers and sisters! FOR THE HORDE!"]="为了我们的牦牛人同胞！为了部落！"
G["For my death, countless more will fall. The burden is now yours to bear."]="无数人将随我的死亡而倒下。重担……落到你们……肩上了。"
G["For my deeds, I was named a Paragon. A hero to be preserved in amber for a time when the empire would need... correcting."]="Por mis hazañas, me nombraron \"dechado\": un héroe preservado en ámbar, para cuando hubiera que... enderezar al imperio."
G["For my entire life I have thought my bloodline cursed. I have lived beneath the shadow of my father's greatest failure."]="一直以来，我都觉得我的血统是受到诅咒的。我生活在我父亲巨大的失败阴影之下。"
G["For my lady and master!"]="为了女王和主人！"
G["For normal maintenance of time, the Keepers of Time are sufficient caretakers. We are able to deal with most ordinary disturbances. I speak of little things, such as rogue mages changing something in the past to elevate their status or wealth in the present."]="对于普通的时间维护工作，时光守护者的力量是足够的。我们可以处理大部分普通的干扰。举个小例子来说，比如某些无赖法师们试图改变过去的一些东西来提升他们现在的身份和财富之类的事情，不在话下。"
G["For now I must leave you. Toya is gathering jade for my project. When he is finished I would like you to bring it to me at the Emperor's Omen so that we might look at what secrets history has hidden from us."]="我先失陪了。托亚正在帮我搜集玉石。等他集齐之后，希望你能帮忙带到皇帝的预言地来交给我，那样我们也许就能知道，历史究竟对我们隐藏了什么秘密。"
G["For now we cannot return to Kalimdor. Only Chawg is going back with you.  Another ship is coming to take the rest of us on to our destination.\n\nThe greatest adventure is yet ahead of you, $n. Our paths will cross again, and when they do, the fate of the world will be in your hands!"]="Por ahora no podemos regresar a Kalimdor. Tan solo Chawg volverá contigo. Otro barco vendrá a recogernos a los demás para llevarnos a nuestro destino.\n\nTu mayor aventura te aguarda, $n. Nuestros caminos volverán a encontrarse de nuevo, y cuando lo hagan, ¡el destino del mundo descansará en tus manos!"
G["For now, I must direct my attention to rebuilding the village. There is much to be done. You may rest here if you like, but we'll not accept any more help."]="现在，我必须把注意力转移到重建村庄上去。还有很多事情要做。如果你愿意的话，可以在这里休息，但我们不能接受你更多的帮助了。"
G["For now, we have regained control over this half of Stratholme and should rejoice for that. The former Bastion of the Silver Hand is back in the hands of its rightful owners. Countless treasures to the order reside here, and we now have a fortified location to launch our next assault."]="到现在为止，我们已经恢复了对斯坦索姆这半边的控制，我们应该为此感到高兴。这座白银之手的堡垒终于回到了它的主人手中。这里有数不清的财富，而且我们现在还拥有了展开下一次进攻的坚固阵地。"
G["For now, you will remain the Trade Prince of the Bilgewater Cartel."]="至少现在，你仍然是锈水财阀的贸易大王。"
G["For once I agree with you... scum."]="就这一次我同意你的意见……垃圾。"
G["For our Masters!"]="为了我们的主人！"
G["For our brothers and sisters!"]="为了我们的兄弟姐妹们！"
G["For our children and the future of the Alliance! The Legion shall not prevail!"]="为了孩子们的将来！为了联盟的将来！必须阻止燃烧军团！"
G["For our first show of skill and power we bring you SCAR-SHELL, mightiest of dragon turtles!"]="在展现的技巧和力量的首场比试中，我们将要上场的是——最强大的龙龟“刀疤壳”！"
G["For our patron!"]="为了我们的主人！"
G["For pity's sake, Ashbury, cover yourself. Your leg bones are popping out."]="天哪，灰葬，看看你自己。你的腿骨都突出来了。"
G["For reasons I cannot understand, Elder Thunderhorn has gone to the Slithering Scar in Un'Goro Crater."]="雷角长者到安戈洛环形山的巨痕谷去了，天知道他要干什么。"
G["For shure it be good."]="确实不错。"
G["For simple schematics of your skill level, speak with Ghermas, if you would."]="就你目前的水平来说，向基尔玛斯讨教些简单的设计图就成啦。"
G["For so long I have drifted in my cursed form. You have freed me... Your hard work shall be repaid."]="多年来我都在被诅咒的形态下飘泊生活。你恢复了我的自由……你会得到报答的。"
G["For so long as I live, I will stand at your side... as you have stood at mine."]="终我一生，我将伴你左右……亦如你将终生伴我身侧。"
G["For so long, I was lost... The Nightmare's corruption had consumed me... And now, you... all of you... you have saved me. Released me from its grasp."]="我已经迷失很久了……梦魇令我完全堕落……现在……你们……你们拯救了我。是你们将我从梦魇的魔爪下解放出来。"
G["For some odd reason, I love to stare at this cane. Hmmm..."]="由于某些奇怪的原因，我很喜欢盯着这根手杖看。唔……"
G["For starters, your villagers need rest. We can offer you protection long enough to allow them a break."]="首先，你们的村庄需要休息。我们会一直提供保护，直到他们休息好为止。"
G["For ten thousand years ... as the veil of mists kept Pandaria hidden from prying eyes."]="一万年以来……浓雾保护着潘达利亚不受外敌的觊觎。"
G["For that, you have earned my respect, my gratitude, and my vote. Well done."]="因此，你赢得了我的尊重，我的感谢，还有我的选票。干得好。"
G["For the Alliance and Lord Fordragon!"]="为了联盟，为了弗塔根公爵！"
G["For the Alliance!"]="为了联盟！"
G["For the Alliance! Wait... the Horde! Wait... which was I again?"]="为了联盟！等等……为了部落！等等，我是哪边的来着……"
G["For the Argent Crusade!"]="为了银色北伐军！"
G["For the Argent Crusade! The Scourge shall fail!"]="为银色北伐军而战！天灾军团注定会失败！"
G["For the Banshee Queen!"]="为女妖之王而战！"
G["For the Bilgewater Cartel! For the Shattered Hand! FOR THE HORDE!"]="为了锈水财阀！为了碎手军团！为了部落！"
G["For the Blue!"]="蓝队加油！"
G["For the Chief!"]="为了酋长！"
G["For the Crusade! Hyaaah!"]="为了北伐军！喝！"
G["For the Dark Strand!"]="为了暗滩教派！"
G["For the Deceiver! For Kil'jaeden!"]="为了欺诈者！为了基尔加丹！"
G["For the Dragonmaw!"]="为了龙喉氏族而战！"
G["For the Earth Mother!"]="为了大地母亲！"
G["For the Empire!"]="为了帝国！"
G["For the Forsaken!"]="为了被遗忘者！"
G["For the Forsaken! For Lordaeron!"]="为了被遗忘者！为了洛丹伦！"
G["For the Great Mother!"]="为了伟大的母亲！"
G["For the Horde"]="为了部落！"
G["For the Horde!"]="为了部落！"
G["For the Horde!\nArm yourself from the crates that surround us and report to Agmar's Hammer, east of here. Your first trial as a member of the Horde is to survive the journey.\nLok'tar ogar!"]="¡Por la Horda!\n\nCoge armas de los cajones que nos rodean y preséntate en el Martillo de Agmar, al este de aquí. Tu primera prueba como miembro de la Horda es sobrevivir al viaje.\n\n¡Lok'tar ogar!"
G["For the Horde! For Hellscream!"]="为了部落！为了地狱咆哮！"
G["For the Horde! No... the Alliance! Uh... which mask did I have?"]="为了部落！不……联盟！嗯……我戴着哪个面具？"
G["For the Horde!!"]="为了部落！！"
G["For the Horde."]="为了部落。"
G["For the Horde..."]="为了部落……"
G["For the King!"]="为了国王而战！"
G["For the Legion! For Kil'Jaeden!"]="为了军团！为了基尔加丹！"
G["For the Lich King!"]="为巫妖王而战！"
G["For the Light!"]="为了圣光而战！"
G["For the Light."]="为了圣光。"
G["For the Lord Reclaimer!"]="为了复国领主！"
G["For the Master!"]="为了主人！"
G["For the Pearlfin!"]="为了珠鳍部族！"
G["For the Protectorate! DIE ETHEREUM FILTH!"]="为了维序派而战！去死吧！肮脏的复仇军！"
G["For the Red!"]="红队加油！"
G["For the Shado-Pan!"]="为了影踪派！"
G["For the Silver Covenant!"]="为了银色盟约！"
G["For the Spellweaver!"]="为织法者而战！"
G["For the Stonefather!"]="为了国王！"
G["For the Sunhawks!"]="为了炎鹰部队！"
G["For the Sunreavers!"]="为了夺日者！"
G["For the Sunwell!"]="为了太阳之井！"
G["For the Thunder King!"]="为了雷电之王！"
G["For the True Horde!"]="为了正统部落！"
G["For the Warchief!"]="为了酋长而战！"
G["For the Warchief!  You lead, I will follow."]="为了酋长！我会紧紧地跟随你。"
G["For the Warchief! For the Horde!"]="为了酋长！为了部落！"
G["For the Wildhammer!"]="为了蛮锤！"
G["For the empress!"]="为了女皇！"
G["For the ever-burning flame!"]="为了永恒不灭的烈火！"
G["For the fallen!"]="为了牺牲的人们！"
G["For the finest food, look no further!"]="最美味的食物，别光看不尝啦！"
G["For the first time in the Ring of Blood's history, Mogor has chosen to exercise his right of battle! On this wartorn ground, $n will face Mogor, hero of the Warmaul!"]="有史以来，穆戈尔第一次在鲜血竞技场作战！在这个回合，$n将会面对穆戈尔，战槌英雄！"
G["For the first time, I feel safe. I do not know you, stranger, but I know that I would lay down my life for you if only you asked."]="Por primera vez, me siento a salvo. No sé tú, $gforastero:forastera;, pero sé que te entregaría mi vida si me la pidieras."
G["For the first time, the Earthen Ring and the Cenarion Circle will unite - to restore this great Tree - thereby healing the whole of Azeroth."]="这是史上第一次，大地之环与塞纳里奥议会将联合在一起——为了恢复这棵巨树，治愈整个艾泽拉斯世界。"
G["For the glory of General Zhun!"]="为了烛恒将军的荣耀！"
G["For the glory of Hellscream!"]="为了地狱咆哮的荣耀！"
G["For the glory of Ironforge!"]="为了铁炉堡的荣耀！"
G["For the glory of Loken!"]="为洛肯的荣耀而战！"
G["For the glory of the Alliance!"]="为了联盟的荣耀！"
G["For the glory of the Dark Lady!"]="为了黑暗女王的荣耀！"
G["For the glory of the Dragonmaw!"]="为了龙喉部族的光荣！"
G["For the honor of our fallen, kill them all!"]="为了阵亡的将士们，杀光他们！"
G["For the horde!"]="为了部落！"
G["For the horde..."]="为了部落……"
G["For the hozen!"]="为了猢狲！"
G["For the jinyu!"]="为了锦鱼人！"
G["For the life of me I don't know why I'm here, but I'm having the best time!"]="说实话我不知道自己为什么会在这里，但我觉得很开心！"
G["For the love of all that is holy and dear, please tell me that you've come to deliver us from this forsaken land.  Though I'm with Marshal Expeditions, I would give you the gold teeth from my mouth to climb inside your backpack and leave this place."]="为了所有神圣高贵的爱，请告诉我你是来把我们从这片被遗忘之地带走的。虽然我是与马绍尔探险队一起的，我愿给你我口中的金牙，只要你让我爬进你的背包并离开这个地方。"
G["For the love of the Light, get me out of here!"]="看在圣光的份上，把我救出去吧！"
G["For the master I'd die a thousand times... A thousan..."]="为了主人，我万死不辞，万死……"
G["For the pride of the mantid!"]="为了螳螂妖的荣耀！"
G["For the queen. For Wyrmrest Temple!"]="为女王而战！为保卫龙眠神殿而战！"
G["For the real Horde!"]="为了真正的部落而战！"
G["For the right price, my crew and I will serve.\n\nBecause General Nazgrim is an honorable orc, I will only ask 100 gold initially, with generous hazard pay for myself and my men."]="只要价格合理，我和船员们就乐意效劳。\n\n鉴于纳兹戈林将军是位可敬的兽人，我就先要100个金币好了，但要记得给我和兄弟们发放丰厚的危险津贴啊。"
G["For the swarm!"]="为了虫群！"
G["For the thane! For Loken!"]="为了领主！为了洛肯！"
G["For the time being, that area is free of Scourge influence. I fear it will only be a matter of time before they return."]="目前，这片土地还没有受到天灾军团的影响。我担心他们杀回来只是个时间问题。"
G["For the time being, yes.  However, allow my presence to be a motivator.  Prince Kael'thas was displeased with the failure of the crystal experiment on Fallen Sky Ridge.  This is one of the reasons for why we chose the Cenarion druids as the testing grounds for the bomb."]="暂时可以说不错。无论如何，请将我的到来作为一个催促的信号。凯尔萨斯王子对坠星山地区的水晶实验的失败很不满意，这也是我们选择塞纳里奥的德鲁伊们作为炸弹试验地的原因之一。"
G["For the true Horde!"]="为了正统部落！"
G["For the warchief!"]="为了酋长！"
G["For the younglings! For the Horde!"]="为了孩子们！为了部落！"
G["For this moment ALONE was I made. Look upon your death, mortals, and despair!"]="我存在的意义就是为了这个时刻。见证你们的死亡和绝望吧，凡人！"
G["For those of you allergic to almonds, our cyanide capsules come in an assortment of flavors."]="为了避免您对氰化物的杏仁味过敏，我们特意为胶囊添加了各种调味剂。"
G["For those who prefer to rely on mundane methods of mending the flesh, Kanaria keeps a tidy station within the Falconwing Square inn."]="为了那些更喜欢用普通方法来治疗伤口的人，鹰翼广场旅店里的卡娜莉亚设立了一处整洁的急救站。"
G["For too long I tolerated my brother.  It is time to set things right.  It is time to destroy him and his followers."]="我不能再纵容我的兄弟了。是时候纠正他犯下的过错了。我们要消灭他和他的追随者。"
G["For too long we have ignored the secrets of the Arcane.\n\nAre you here to learn, as well?"]="我们已经太久忽略了奥术的秘密。\n\n你是来学习这个秘密的吗？"
G["For too long we have ignored the secrets of the Arcane.\n\nSadly, they will remain a secret to you."]="我们已经太久忽略了奥术的秘密。\n\n可惜的是，它对你来说只能是个秘密。"
G["For we are all born of you, and shall all return to you."]="我们全都来自于您，也全都将回到您身边。"
G["For we have endured much... far beyond what any of us could have imagined."]="我们承受过太多……那远远超过了我们的想象。"
G["For who but the titans themselves could bestow such a curse? What could have such power?"]="除了泰坦，还有谁能对我们下这样的诅咒？谁能拥有那样的力量？"
G["For years I served in this backwater corner of the world, learning the terrain and biding my time. At last our time has come. The full might of Orgrimmar is now turned to Azshara, our gateway to Ashenvale and dominance over this continent. Welcome to the front lines, $c."]="多年以来，我一直在这个被世界遗忘的角落里工作着，查看这里的地形，在无聊中打发时间。但我的时代终会到来的。奥格瑞玛正将全部力量转向艾萨拉，我们打开了通往灰谷的通道，并终将统治这片大陆。欢迎来到前线，$c。"
G["For years I was convinced we were doing the right thing in Silvermoon - working to reach Outland so we could be reunited with Kael.\n\nHad I known what Kael'thas had in store for us, I would've stayed right in Falconwing Square."]="多年来我一直深信我们在银月城所做的事情是对的——为能到达外域而努力，那么我们就可以和凯尔萨斯重新会合。\n\n当我知道凯尔萨斯为我们准备了什么之后，我愿意还是待在鹰翼广场。"
G["For years beyond counting these woods have burned. They are fueled by an ancient magic and are the mating grounds for the brood mother and her proto-drake consorts.\n\nBut now a long-forgotten evil has reawakened and seeks once again to enslave the offspring of the brood mother for their own purposes.\n\nThese vrykul have caused a disturbance that is extending the boundary of the clutch, and threatens your people."]="在远古魔法的作用下，这场森林大火绵延燃烧了数年都不曾熄灭。这里本是始祖龙女王及其配偶的栖息地。\n\n然而，某个早已被遗忘的邪恶种族已经觉醒，并企图再次奴役始祖龙女王的后裔，让它们为自己服务。\n\n这些维库人最近在灰烬龙巢附近频频滋事，严重威胁到你们的安危。"
G["For years it has languished, slowly growing in strength..."]="多年来，它饱受煎熬，慢慢积蓄力量。"
G["For years, Honor Hold has stood against the horrors of Hellfire Peninsula.  Now, now that the portal has reopened and aid streams in from Azeroth, perhaps this bloody stalemate will end."]="很多年来，荣耀堡都在独自抵抗着地狱火半岛的敌人。现在，既然黑暗之门已经重新开启，援助者们像潮水一样从艾泽拉斯涌入，也许这个血腥的僵局将会被打破。"
G["For years, I have longed to complete this spell and my transformation. Behold!"]="多年来，我一直渴望着完成这个法术，完成我的变形。现在，见证这一切吧！"
G["For you see, strife feeds on conflict. When you have peace in your heart, strife will find somewhere else to roam."]="你明白了吧，没有对抗，就没有纷争。当你内心一片平静时，纷争便会离你而去。"
G["For you, Azshara."]="为你而战，艾萨拉。"
G["For your efforts, you be gettin' da greatest of rewards...."]="对于你付出的努力，我一定要给你丰厚的报酬……"
G["For your enchanting needs, you must speak to Lai the Spellpaw at Dawn's Blossom in The Jade Forest.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="如果你有附魔方面的需求，就得去翡翠林的晨芳园找莱·咒爪谈谈。\n\n我会在你的地图上标出位置。"
G["For your safety, I can only allow you short flights to other places in the fjord. What is your desired destination?"]="安全起见，我只能为你安排峡湾区域的短途飞行。那么，你想去哪呢？"
G["For... Khaz... Modan!"]="为了……卡兹……莫丹！"
G["For... Quel'...Thalas!"]="为了……奎尔……萨拉斯！"
G["For... Quel'Thalas."]="为了……奎尔萨拉斯。"
G["Forage for me, Wikky!"]="光板儿，给我搜！"
G["Force them into bottlenecks. Let them think they can win..."]="将他们逼入瓶颈。让他们自以为能赢……"
G["Forced to land like a dog. No matter. Soon, all of these wonderous beasts will be under the control of the master."]="像狗一样被强迫落地。无所谓。很快，这些奇妙的生物都将落入主人的掌心。"
G["Fordring shall never see his son."]="弗丁永远都不会再见到他的儿子了。"
G["Forecasts call for... your demise."]="你的毁灭……已经有了预兆。"
G["Foreman's gotta be fumin' right now. Glad yer dealin' with her and not me."]="工头现在肯定气得七窍生烟了，幸好不用我去跟她打交道。"
G["Forest just setback!"]="森林也要后退！"
G["Forge camps?"]="铸魔营地？"
G["Forgemaster Vul'kon equips his Hammer and begins to swing with great force!"]="掌炉者沃空装备上他的战锤并开始用力挥舞！"
G["Forgemaster Vul'kon equips his Staff and begins to channel the powers of lightning!"]="掌炉者沃空装备上他的法杖并开始引导闪电之力！"
G["Forgemaster!  I've been informed the enemy has disrupted your operations.  Where is the fragment?"]="铸炉之主！我被告知敌人打断了你的行动。现在，碎片在哪里？"
G["Forget Vixton's spread. You want the good stuff? You talk to Krixel here. I got just what you need, provided you got the right rep. You know, in the arena. This stuff isn't for sissies, kid."]="别理会维克斯顿的话。你想要好东西？那就和克里希谈一谈。如果你的声望够高的话，我正好有你需要的货物。孩子，你要明白，竞技场上的懦夫是没有资格拥有这些东西的。"
G["Forget about it!"]="忘了它吧！"
G["Forget it, mon. I go find me bruddas myself."]="算啦。我自己去找他们。"
G["Forget this! I'm going home!"]="我不管啦！我要回家！"
G["Forget this, Crablegs.  It's takin' too long!"]="别管它了，Crablegs。这太费时间了！"
G["Forget you, Solomon. I'll find my family by myself."]="不指望你了，所罗门。我会自己找到我的家人。"
G["Forgetting dragonscale leatherworking is not something to do lightly.  If you choose to abandon it you will forget all recipes that require dragonscale leatherworking as well!"]="遗忘龙鳞制皮可不是说着玩的。如果你选择放弃它，你同样会忘记所有需要龙鳞制皮的图样！"
G["Forgetting elemental leatherworking is not something to do lightly.  If you choose to abandon it you will forget all recipes that require elemental leatherworking as well!"]="遗忘元素制皮可不是说着玩的。如果你选择放弃它，你同样会忘记所有需要元素制皮专精的图样！"
G["Forgetting tribal leatherworking is not something to do lightly.  If you choose to abandon it you will forget all recipes that require tribal leatherworking as well!"]="遗忘部族制皮并不是说做就做的。如果你选择放弃它，你同样会忘记所有需要部族制皮的图样！"
G["Forgetting your Armorsmithing skill is not something to do lightly.  If you choose to abandon it you will forget all recipes that require Armorsmithing to create!"]="遗忘铸甲技能可不是说着玩的。如果你选择放弃它，你同样会忘记所有需要铸甲技能的图样！"
G["Forgetting your Axesmithing skill is not something to do lightly.  If you choose to abandon it you will forget all recipes that require Axesmithing to create!"]="遗忘铸斧技能可不是说着玩的。如果你选择放弃它，你同样会忘记所有需要铸斧技能的图样！"
G["Forgetting your Hammersmithing skill is not something to do lightly.  If you choose to abandon it you will forget all recipes that require Hammersmithing to create!"]="遗忘铸锤技能可不是说着玩的。如果你选择放弃它，你同样会忘记所有需要铸锤技能的图样！"
G["Forgetting your Weaponsmithing skill is not something to do lightly.  If you choose to abandon it you will forget all recipes that require Weaponsmithing to create!"]="遗忘你的武器铸造技能并不是什么轻松的事。如果你选择放弃，你会忘记所有武器专精相关的图样！"
G["Forgetting your knowledge is an expensive endeavor.  Are you willing to pay the cost?"]="遗忘你已经学会的知识需要一大笔钱，而且这并不是件容易的事。你真的希望付这笔费用吗？"
G["Forgetting your skill in Elixir Mastery is not something to do lightly.\nAre you absolutely sure?"]="Olvidar tu habilidad en maestría en elixires no es algo que deba tomarse a la ligera.\n\n¿Lo has decidido?"
G["Forgetting your skill in Mooncloth Tailoring is not something to do lightly.  If you choose to abandon it you will forget all recipes that require Mooncloth Tailoring to create!\n\nAre you absolutely sure?"]="遗忘月布裁缝专精并不是件轻松的事。如果你选择放弃，就会遗忘所有与月布裁缝专精相关的图样！\n\n你真的确定吗？"
G["Forgetting your skill in Potion Mastery is not something to do lightly.\nAre you absolutely sure?"]="Olvidar tu habilidad en maestría en pociones no es algo que deba tomarse a la ligera.\n\n¿Lo has decidido?"
G["Forgetting your skill in Shadoweave Tailoring is not something to do lightly.  If you choose to abandon it you will forget all recipes that require Shadoweave Tailoring to create!\n\nAre you absolutely sure?"]="Olvidar tu habilidad sastrería con tejido de sombra no es algo que deba tomarse a la ligera. ¡Si decides eliminarlo, olvidarás todas las recetas que necesiten sastrería con tejido de sombra para realizarlas!\n\n¿Estás completamente $gseguro:segura;?"
G["Forgetting your skill in Spellfire Tailoring is not something to do lightly.  If you choose to abandon it you will forget all recipes that require Spellfire Tailoring to create!"]="遗忘魔焰裁缝专精并不是件轻松的事。如果你选择放弃，那么你就会忘记所有与魔焰裁缝专精相关的图样！"
G["Forgetting your skill in Spellfire Tailoring is not something to do lightly.  If you choose to abandon it you will forget all recipes that require Spellfire Tailoring to create!\n\nAre you absolutely sure?"]="Olvidar tu habilidad en sastrería con fuego de hechizo no es algo que deba tomarse a la ligera. ¡Si decides eliminarla, olvidarás todas las recetas que necesiten sastrería con fuego de hechizo para realizarlas!\n\n¿Estás completamente $gseguro:segura;?"
G["Forgetting your skill in Transmutation Mastery is not something to do lightly.\nAre you absolutely sure?"]="Olvidar tu habilidad en maestría en transmutaciones no es algo que deba tomarse a la ligera.\n\n¿Lo has decidido?"
G["Forgetting your swordsmithing skill is not something to do lightly.  If you choose to abandon it you will forget all recipes that require swordsmithing to create!"]="遗忘你的铸剑技能并不是什么轻松的事。如果你选择放弃，你会忘记所有铸剑专精相关的图样！"
G["Forgive me $c, but I must concentrate on my job."]="$c，请原谅，我必须专心工作。"
G["Forgive me for questioning you, my son. My sight isn't what it once was, but the raven has blessed me with a long life.\n\nSoon, it will be time for you to take my place. I have taught you all I know. My only regret is that I didn't prove worthy enough to recover our sacred Book of the Raven."]="请原谅我质问你，孩子。我的视力已经不如从前了，但是乌鸦之神赐我长生。\n\n不久之后，你就会接替我的位置。我将我所知道的知识都传授给了你。唯一的遗憾就是我没能夺回氏族神圣的乌鸦之书。"
G["Forgive me oh great one. I did not mean to learn the truth!"]="原谅我吧，伟大的主！我不是故意要挖掘真相的。"
G["Forgive me!"]="原谅我！"
G["Forgive me, $n! Your death only adds to my failure!"]="原谅我，$n！你的死亡让我的失败更加沉重！"
G["Forgive me, $r, I must focus on my job."]="不好意思，$r，我必须专心工作。"
G["Forgive me, Empress...."]="原谅我，女皇……"
G["Forgive me, Tatjana..."]="原谅我，塔特亚娜……"
G["Forgive me, brothers, for I have failed you..."]="原谅我，兄弟们，我让你们失望了……"
G["Forgive me, but I am spent and cannot use my magic to send you back Theramore. You have the look of a worldly adventurer about you; surely you know of another way to reach Theramore in time."]="Perdóname, pero estoy agotado y no puedo usar mi magia para enviarte de vuelta a Theramore. Tienes pinta de $gaventurero:aventurera;, seguro que encuentras otro modo de llegar a Theramore a tiempo."
G["Forgive me, daughter..."]="原谅我，女儿……"
G["Forgive me, father! Please..."]="原谅我，父亲！求求您……"
G["Forgive me, heroes. I should have listened to Uther. I... I just had to see for myself. To look into his eyes one last time. I am sorry."]="原谅我，英雄们。我应该听乌瑟尔的。我……我只是希望能够，能够看他最后一眼。对不起。"
G["Forgive me, master."]="原谅我，主人。"
G["Forgive me, master... I have failed you."]="请原谅我，主人……我让你失望了。"
G["Forgive me, my prince! I have... failed."]="原谅我，王子殿下！我……失败了。"
G["Forgive me."]="原谅我。"
G["Forgive me... I have no choice."]="原谅我……我别无选择。"
G["Forgive my abruptness, $c.\n\nPressing matters of great import require my undivided attention."]="原谅我的无礼，$c。\n\n我必须全神贯注于紧迫的事情。"
G["Forgive my deception, mon. It all been for your own good."]="朋友，请原谅，我欺骗了你。这样是为了你好。"
G["Forgive my harsh methods, but the Betrayer cannot learn of the truth.  My secret must be kept at all costs!"]="请原谅我的粗暴，我不能让背叛者知道真相。无论如何都要守住我的秘密！"
G["Forgive my insolence!"]="原谅我的傲慢！"
G["Forgive my outburst.  Warchief, please, continue."]="请原谅我的无礼。酋长，请继续。"
G["Forgive... me..."]="请原谅……我……"
G["Form ranks and make the intruders pay!"]="让入侵者付出代价！"
G["Form up! Let's make quick work of them!"]="列阵！速战速决！"
G["Forsaken Champion's Pennant"]="被遗忘者冠军的旗帜"
G["Forsaken reinforcements? Undercity is stretched thin with the Scourge on all sides. No, this will be a matter largely dealt with by the blood elves. We Forsaken are here as backup and advisors."]="被遗忘者的援军？幽暗城与亡灵天灾的战事频发，兵力已日渐吃紧。不，血精灵目前的窘境恐怕远远比不上被遗忘者。我们是来为你们提供后备力量和建议的。"
G["Forshaken do... that'sh who...It'sh sho big... Look at it'sh big shtupid neck. I jusht want to choke it to death!"]="是被遗忘者干的……是他们……真是太大了……看看它那蠢笨的大脖子。我真想一把掐死它！"
G["Fortify the walls of Ironforge to prevent the city from collapsing!\n\nPick up wall fortifications in crates around the city\n\nand place them at locations marked with a red arrow |TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_HUNTER_MARKEDFORDEATH.blp:32|t."]="在铁炉堡城墙周围构筑防御工事，来防止城墙坍塌！\n\n从城市周围的箱子里取出城墙防御工事\n\n将它们安放在红色箭头标出的位置|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_HUNTER_MARKEDFORDEATH.blp:32|t。"
G["Fortunately I can just disable the security. What would you do without me, hm?"]="幸好我解除了警报。要没有我的话你该怎么办，嗯？"
G["Fortunately for our enemies, we can be in only one place at a time."]="我们的敌人真走运，我们每次只能出现在一个地方。"
G["Fortunately for you, your fate is not mine to decide. Calen awaits you by the tree."]="你很幸运，因为你的命运并不由我来决定。凯伦正在那棵树旁边等着你。"
G["Fortunately, I have agents that can help you... erase this weakness.  Beneath the Undercity you go."]="Por suerte, tengo agentes que pueden... \"eliminar\" tu debilidad. Lleváoslo al subsuelo de Entrañas."
G["Fortunately, the outhouse is currently vacant."]="真幸运，厕所现在没人。"
G["Fortunately, you can still make out enough detail to sketch what looks to be a creature's torso."]="幸运地是，你还是能辨别出一些细节，看上去似乎是某个生物的躯干。"
G["Fortune be with us!  To the skies!"]="幸运与我们同在！飞向天空吧！"
G["Fortune smiles on grummle mounts."]="幸运对着土地精的坐骑微笑。"
G["Fortune smiles on us this day. There are many people to deliver things to."]="我们今天可走运了。好多人都来托运东西了。"
G["Fortune smiles upon me this day. How I do love receiving guests in this, my humble abode...\n\nCome in, come in. You are no bother at all.\n\n<If looks could kill, your corpse would be serving as a doormat right now.>"]="La fortuna me sonríe hoy. Cómo me agrada recibir invitados en esta, mi humilde morada...\n\nPasa, pasa. No eres ninguna molestia.\n\n<Si las miradas matasen, tu cadáver estaría sirviendo de felpudo ahora mismo.>"
G["Fortune teller?"]="占卜师？"
G["Fortune with me today!"]="今天好运与我同在！"
G["Forty five seconds until the Arena battle begins!"]="竞技场战斗将在四十五秒后开始！"
G["Forty-two... forty-two... forty-two what?  It could be anything!  Forty-two... hmmm..."]="42……42……42，什么？什么都不是！42……嗯……"
G["Forward to glory, Orcs!"]="朝着荣耀之路前进吧，兽人！"
G["Forward!"]="前进！"
G["Forward! The Klaxxi reveal themselves as traitors. Decimate them, and leave nothing behind."]="前进！卡拉克西已经公然显露叛徒的身份。消灭他们，一个不留。"
G["Forward! We march to Garadar!"]="前进！向加拉达尔行军！"
G["Forward, march, yaungol! Cowards will be executed!"]="野牛人，前进，冲锋！后退者死！"
G["Forward, my minions! Forward! Let none stand in our way!"]="前进，我的仆从们！前进！扫平我们道路上的一切障碍！"
G["Forward, vindicators!  Drive these demons from our sacred temple!"]="前进，守备官！把这些恶魔从我们圣洁的神殿里赶出来！"
G["Forward.. MARCH!!"]="前进……前进！"
G["Foul Stream is being cast on you!"]="污秽水流的目标指向了你！"
G["Foul deeds, these."]="这些肮脏的勾当。"
G["Foul demon! What have you done with my brother?"]="无耻的恶魔！你对我兄弟做了什么？"
G["Found any good meat lately?\n\nI ate a blood elf the other day. He tasted like he'd been rolling in flowers."]="最近有找到什么好肉吗？\n\n我前几天吃了一个血精灵，那味道就好像他在花丛里滚过一样。"
G["Found any good meat lately?\n\nI ate a gnome the other day. Hardly worth the effort of pulling all those pink hairs out of my teeth."]="最近有找到什么好肉吗？\n\n我前几天吃了一个侏儒。太难吃了，我花了好多工夫才把牙缝里的粉色头发剔干净。"
G["Found any rare cards lately? Bring them to me, and I'll add them to the collection."]="你最近有找到什么稀有卡牌吗？把它们带给我，我可以把它们加入我的藏品里去。"
G["Found me, did ya? Now ya gotta die!"]="好吧，你找到我了。那么，你去死吧！"
G["Found something... I think."]="我想我找到了一些东西……"
G["Found!"]="找到了！"
G["Four coppers on Zhou."]="我押周，四个铜板。"
G["Four months magic-free and it feels great.\n\nWho needs the infinite mystery of the arcane when you've got fresh fruit and hot tea like this?"]="远离魔法的这四个月感觉好极了。\n\n有了这些新鲜水果和热气腾腾的茶，谁还在乎魔法的无穷奥秘呢？"
G["Four platforms with huge elementals."]="四个平台，各有一个巨大的元素。"
G["Four watchers? Sigils? Could ye be a little less cryptic, confounded machine?"]="四位守护者？徽记？你这废铜烂铁，说话能不能别这么拐弯抹角啊？"
G["Four."]="四个。"
G["Fourth place. Well, it's not very remarkable. That's all right. You can always try again."]="第四名。嗯，不算很出色。不过没关系。你可以再试一次。"
G["Fox"]="狐狸"
G["Frack!"]="可恶！"
G["Frag bombs and suppressing fire...HOLD THE LINE! We won't be turned back now!"]="全队注意，准备手榴弹和压制火力……坚守战线！我们绝不会退却！"
G["Fragile thing."]="脆弱的生物。"
G["Fragment analysis underway."]="正在进行碎片分析。"
G["Francis! We need to talk!"]="弗二郎！我们得谈谈！"
G["Franklin Lloyd in Rogues' Quarter on outer ring of Undercity."]="幽暗城外环盗贼区的弗兰克林·洛伊德。"
G["Frankly, I'm getting a little tired of these therapy sessions. We're fine! Just let us go."]="坦白说，我对这些治疗环节感到有些厌倦了。我们健康得很！我们只想离开。"
G["Frappin' cratchet! Sonnova HEY what!?"]="抓住它！你在说什么！？"
G["Free again? Keeper Mimir's work awaits."]="又自由了？守护者米米尔的工作还没有做完。"
G["Free any Alliance slaves that you come across. We will most certainly need their assistance in battling Tyrannus. I will gather reinforcements and join you on the other side of the quarry."]="解救你遇到的所有联盟奴隶.我们需要他们的协助来对抗泰兰努斯。我会集结援军，并在矿坑对面与你汇合。"
G["Free any Horde slaves that you come across. We will most certainly need their assistance in battling Tyrannus. I will gather reinforcements and join you on the other side of the quarry."]="解救你遇到的所有部落奴隶。我们需要他们的协助来对抗泰兰努斯。我会集结援军，并在矿坑对面与你汇合。"
G["Free at last from that horrible curse! Thank you! Please send word to Rilak the Redeemed that I am okay. My mission lies in Skettis. Terokk must be defeated!"]="终于摆脱了那可恶的诅咒了！谢谢你！请给救赎者瑞拉克带个口信。我在斯克提斯还有任务，必须消灭泰罗克！"
G["Free at last!"]="终于自由了！"
G["Free at last! And now to be rid of you filthy hozen rebels."]="我终于自由了！反叛的臭猴子们，我终于摆脱你们了。"
G["Free at last! I need a drink..."]="终于自由了！我得去喝一杯……"
G["Free at last! It is over, my son. This is the moment of reckoning."]="终于自由了！结束了，我的儿子。清算的时候到了。"
G["Free at last, mon."]="终于自由啦。"
G["Free drinks at the Blue Recluse!"]="在蓝色隐士有免费的饮料！"
G["Free from this wretched cell at last! Let me show you to the courtyard...."]="终于从这个肮脏的房间逃了出来！让我带你到院子里去……"
G["Free me now before it's too late! Deepholm cannot survive much longer without the World Pillar intact!"]="快放了我，否则就来不及了！要是没有完整的世界之柱，深岩之洲撑不了多久！"
G["Free me!"]="放开我！"
G["Free me.\n\nFree me so that we may rally my people against Deathwing together.\n\nAnd if that's not reason enough, you will be rewarded with great riches.  I am still a prince after all."]="把我解救出来。\n\n这样我们就能召集我的人民，共同对抗死亡之翼。\n\n如果你觉得这还不够，我还会给你丰厚的酬劳。毕竟，我是一位亲王。"
G["Free my soul if you can, cur!"]="拯救我的灵魂吧，混蛋！"
G["Free rum?  Why... that's me favorite kind!"]="免费的朗姆酒？啊……这可是我的最爱！"
G["Free to trust one another, all three dwarven leaders pledged their full strength to the Alliance cause."]="彼此信赖的三位矮人首领承诺，要为联盟大业献出全部力量。"
G["Free to--mm--fly now. Ra-aak... Not find us--ekh-ekh! Escape!"]="自由啦……呱呱。呱呱……没有找到……我们！逃跑！"
G["Free yourself and chase them, $n!"]="恢复自由，$n，追击！"
G["Free yourself of arrogance."]="远离傲慢。"
G["Free! Free at last after ten thousand years! This a happy day! Very happy happy day! Gonna need biggest party ever! With nibs! And dibs! And brews! And jungle hozen! And mountain hozen! And sky hozen!"]="自由啦！一万年以后，我终于自由啦！今天是个好日子！很好很好的好日子！要搞个大派对！要有好吃的！要有好玩的！要有好喝的！叫上丛林猢狲！叫上山地猢狲！叫上天空猢狲！"
G["Free! Free from my bonds at last!"]="解放啦！我终于从镣铐中解放啦！"
G["Free... at last."]="终于……自由了。"
G["Free... at last.  Your reward will be substantial, friends."]="终于……自由了。你们将获得十分可观的奖励，朋友们。"
G["Free... at last...."]="终于……自由了……"
G["Freedom at last! I must return to Warsong Hold at once!"]="终于自由啦！我要立即返回战歌要塞！"
G["Freedom at last.  I thank you, stranger.  Tahet is no longer here.  A cruel Neferset warlord called Caimas took him."]="Libre al fin. Gracias, $gdesconocido:desconocida;. Tahet ya no está aquí. Se lo llevó un cruel señor de la guerra Neferset llamado Caimas."
G["Freedom!"]="自由！"
G["Freedom!  Sweet, sweet freedom!"]="自由！甜美无比的自由！"
G["Freedom! Kraz life was over.\n\nI thank you, $c."]="自由啦！克拉斯的痛苦结束了。\n\n谢谢你，$c。"
G["Freedom..."]="自由……"
G["Freeing"]="解救"
G["Freewind Post is lost. Thousand Needles is destroyed."]="我们失去了乱风岗。千针石林被毁了。"
G["Freeze!"]="冻结！"
G["Freeze!\n\nHa! I love saying that."]="别动！\n\n哈！我就爱说这个。"
G["Freezing mist engulfs the jetty."]="冰冷的迷雾吞噬了码头。"
G["Frenzyheart came here not long ago for new home... big-tongue homes pretty nice, so we maybe take those too. They ugly anyway."]="不久前，狂心氏族在这里安了新家……大舌头怪的屋子看上去很漂亮啊，我们其实可以抢来自己住。它们那么丑，才不配住这么好看的地方。"
G["Frenzyheart can be vicious, but we good people. You see if you stay long, we friends with smart and strong just fine.\n\nWe just don't like dumb."]="狂心狼獾人很看起来凶猛，但其实我们是好人呀。时间长了，你就会发现，我们和聪明强壮的朋友相处得很好。\n\n我们只是不善于和笨蛋打交道而已。"
G["Frenzyheart feed Kartak big-tongues so Kartak not eat us. That why we smarter than you, slave thing."]="狂心狼獾人用大舌头怪喂养卡塔克，保证自己不会沦为他的食物。奴隶，这就是我们比你聪明的证据。"
G["Frenzyheart kill you if you come back. You no welcome here no more!"]="Corazón Frenético matarte si tú volver. ¡Tú ya no $gbienvenido:bienvenida; aquí!"
G["Frenzyheart never be friends of big-tongues. You dumb to come back here traitor thing!"]="Corazón Frenético nunca ser amigos de lenguas-grandes. ¡Tú $gtonto:tonta; por volver aquí, cosa traidora!"
G["Frenzyheart not come here alone. Slave thing should not either."]="狂心狼獾人不会独自闯入这里。奴隶也不该。"
G["Frenzyheart the strongest!"]="狂心狼獾人最厉害！"
G["Frenzyheart will take land for own. Big-tongues will leave or we kill them good."]="狂心氏族将夺得这块土地的控制权。大舌头怪最好滚得远远的，不然我们就将他们统统杀掉。"
G["Fresh Bread! Get your oven fresh bread here!"]="新鲜的面包！刚出炉的新鲜面包！"
G["Fresh air! By the light, I missed it. We have some ships just in sight to the north, $n - fire the flare in their direction."]="新鲜的空气！以圣光的名义，我想念它。我看见在我们的北边有几艘船，$n——快朝他们的方向发射信号弹！"
G["Fresh air! Grom's beard, I missed it. We have some ships just in sight to the north, $n - fire the flare in their direction."]="新鲜的空气！以格罗姆胡须的名义，我想念它。我看见在我们的北边有几艘船，$n——快朝他们的方向发射信号弹！"
G["Fresh bread for sale!"]="新鲜的面包啦！"
G["Fresh bread!"]="新鲜的面包啊！"
G["Fresh bread, baked this very morning."]="新鲜的面包，今天早上刚刚出炉的啊。"
G["Fresh cherry pie for sale, looks so good it will bring a tear to your eye."]="新鲜的樱桃馅饼！香味扑鼻，让你的眼睛发直！"
G["Fresh fish, caught within the hour! ...I think? Curse this island."]="刚出水还不到一小时的新鲜河鱼！……好像是吧？都怪这该死的岛。"
G["Fresh from our farm to your plate - it's Smokywood Pastures wholesome goodness!"]="这是刚从农场带来的新鲜货--这是烟林牧场的健康食品！"
G["Fresh fruit for me?"]="给我吃新鲜的水果？"
G["Fresh meat!"]="新鲜的肉！"
G["Fresh meat! Straight from the slaughterhouse. Good."]="新鲜的肉！直接从屠宰场运出来的。很好。"
G["Fresh muffins!  Get your fresh muffins right here!"]="新鲜的松饼！到这里来拿新鲜的松饼吧！"
G["Fresh troops flood to Iceblood Garrison!  Captain Galvangar will soon arrive, and a new battle will soon begin!"]="援军补充入了冰血要塞！加尔范上尉马上就到，新的战斗马上开始！"
G["Fresh, warm blood... it has been too long."]="新鲜的肉，温暖的血……好久没有尝到了。"
G["Freshly baked bread for sale!"]="新鲜出炉的面包！"
G["Freshly killed zombies are arriving via meat wagon, though their numbers are dwindling."]="尽管敌人的数量在不断减少，但是天灾军团的绞肉车源源不断地送来了新鲜的僵尸。"
G["Freshly picked flowers for sale!"]="出售刚采摘的鲜花！"
G["Freya begins to cast |cFFFF0000Ground Tremor!|r"]="弗蕾亚开始施放|cFFFF0000大地震颤！|r"
G["Freya casts |cFF00FF00Strengthened Iron Roots!|r"]="弗蕾亚施放了|cFF00FF00强化钢铁根须！|r"
G["Freya drains the essence of Eonar's Gift, healing nearby allies!"]="弗蕾亚从艾欧娜尔的礼物中汲取精华，开始治疗周围的盟友！"
G["Freya! They come for you."]="弗蕾亚！他们冲你来了。"
G["Freya's Ward online. Acquiring target."]="已启动弗蕾亚的防御结界。正在获取目标。"
G["Friend - Stormwind needs your assistance and your generosity!\n\nOur once large stockpile of textiles has run critically low.  Stormwind is now engaged in a multi-pronged effort to rebuild those stocks for the manufacture of textiles and bandages!  Your donation of cloth would help Stormwind immensely, as well as earn the respect of the citizenry!"]="$gAmigo:Amiga; Ventormenta necesita tu ayuda y tu generosidad,\n\nNuestra antigua gran reserva de textiles está disminuyendo críticamente. Ventormenta se encuentra en pleno proceso a dos bandas para rellenar nuestras reservas para los fabricantes de telas y vendas. Tu donación de paños ayudaría inmensamente a Ventormenta, ¡y te proporcionaría el respeto de los ciudadanos!"
G["Friend of jinyu, come sit with me a while."]="$gAmigo:Amiga; de jinyu, ven a shentarte conmigo un poco."
G["Friend! Breath my incense if you need healing!"]="¡$gAmigo:Amiga;! ¡Respira mi incienso si necesitas sanación!"
G["Friend! It's been too long.  What can we get for you?"]="朋友！好久不见！我们能为你做些什么吗？"
G["Friend, I come to help. We will show Shai Hu to his grave!"]="朋友，我是来帮忙的。让我们把刹嗳呼送进坟墓！"
G["Friend, I will return to the refugees. Meet us there, so we can thank you properly."]="朋友，我要回避难所了。在那和我碰头，我们好感谢你。"
G["Friend, have your journeys brought you to Krasarang recently?\n\nIt would be wise to venture there. The fish are as bountiful as the most fortunate harvest.\n\nAs my father said, the early fisherman gets the catch!"]="朋友，你最近去过卡桑琅吗？\n\n真该去一探究竟。那里水产丰富，绝对能让你满网而归。\n\n我父亲说过，早起的渔夫有鱼吃！"
G["Friend, this is Dawn's Blossom! The heart of Pandaren life here in the Jade Forest. If you wish to make an impression, I am certain many of these citizens could use your help."]="朋友，这里是晨芳园！熊猫人在翡翠林的生活中心。要是你想给人留下深刻的印象，相信这里有很多居民在等你帮忙。"
G["Friend, wipe the drool off of your chin and come lend me a hand!"]="朋友，快把你下巴上的口水擦一擦，来帮我个忙！"
G["Friend, you sure do run your mouth when you get a chance. But it's kinda nice to hear somethin' other than silence now and again."]="$gAmigo:Amiga;, cómo te gusta darle a la lengua cuando te dan la oportunidad... pero es agradable oír algo que no sea el silencio de vez en cuando."
G["Friend?  You were among those who spit and threw stones, Jin'do.  But let's let bygones be bygones, eh?"]="老朋友？你可是那群落井下石的人之一啊，金度。但是过去的就让它过去吧，你说好吗？"
G["Friendly with wolvar still, eh? Then I won't be surprised when you turn on us and side with them again"]="你对狼獾人还是很友好嘛？如果有一天你背叛我们，重新站在狼獾人那一边，我一点都不会吃惊！"
G["Friendly."]="友善。"
G["Friends of grummles come soon. You will see!"]="土地精的朋友就快来了，你等着瞧！"
G["Friends of the Scryers are not allowed here!"]="占星者的朋友不允许到这儿来！"
G["Friends of the tribe, our city is under attack!  Take up your arms and defend our home!  If you do not wish to battle, then grab weather breakers and line our city to protect it's citzens from the elements!"]="部族的朋友们，我们的城市遭到了攻击！拿起你们的武器，共同保卫我们的家园！要是你不想战斗，那就把天气障壁安放在城市周围，保护市民免受元素的侵扰！"
G["Friends of yours?"]="是你的朋友吗？"
G["Friends, it is my great pleasure to welcome you to the temple today."]="朋友，我很荣幸来迎接你今日驾临神殿。"
G["Friends, we have gathered here today to heal this world that we've sacrificed so much to save."]="朋友们，我们今日聚集于此，是为了治愈这个用无数牺牲换回的世界。"
G["Friends. The Wildhammer way of life is threatened. Our enemies are too numerous for us to remain isolated from one another. We must unite!"]="朋友们。蛮锤正在受到致命的威胁。我们的敌人太强大了。我们只凭一己之力无法与他们对抗。我们必须团结起来！"
G["Friends... I've failed you..."]="朋友们……我辜负了你们……"
G["Frigate Ho! 'Tis an Orc vessel no doubt! Fire!"]="护卫舰！这一定是兽人的船！开火！"
G["Frightening, isn't it?"]="很可怕是吧？"
G["Frogs and leather balls for sale!"]="出售青蛙和皮球啦！"
G["From Lordaeron to Kalimdor, they will know his name and they will sing songs of glory, praising the fallen champion of the Horde."]="从洛丹伦到卡利姆多，他们都将知道他的名字，唱起光荣的歌曲，颂扬这位牺牲的部落英雄。"
G["From a young age, I have been drawn to the healing arts."]="从小时候起，我就对医术很着迷。"
G["From all of us at Bilgewater Harbor..."]="我们留在锈水港的全体人员……"
G["From beneath the dark roots of the nearby tree, an ancient terror awakens..."]="在附近一棵树那黑暗的根须下，一个古老的恐惧苏醒了……"
G["From death comes life, and from life, death...."]="没有死就没有生，没有生，何来死……"
G["From deep within the bowels of Blackrock Mountain, it's Sanoriak, master of flame!"]="来自黑石山深处的火焰大师，萨诺里亚克！"
G["From her depths she cries out for aid, but few can hear her pleas."]="她拼命呼喊着，寻求帮助，但几乎没人能听到她的哀求。"
G["From here in the Gatehouse, you may travel in one of three directions. The stairs behind me lead to the Grand Ball Room, where guests are currently being entertained. I'm sure you can smell the nearby Stables, and the entrance to Servant's Quarters lies next to the Gatehouse door."]="从门房这里，你可以向三个方向行进。我身后的楼梯通往会客间，客人们正在那里玩乐。我相信你已经闻到附近的马厩的味道，还有仆役宿舍的入口就在门房的大门旁边。"
G["From here we can reach out to the natives and keep Horde aggression in check."]="现在我们要与当地人接触，并遏制部落的侵略行动。"
G["From here we meditate on the wonders of Pandaria."]="我们在这里思考潘达利亚的各种奇观。"
G["From his hiding place, he oversees their preparations for war with the goal of exterminating the stone giants!"]="他藏身在不为人知的角落，监督着战争的准备工作，想要消灭石巨人！"
G["From its BLEAKEST DEPTHS, we RECLAIM this world!"]="我们冲出最黑暗的深渊，将要夺回这个世界！"
G["From its shores, we shall conquer Stormwind, and with it any hope the enemy clings to."]="以它为桥头堡，我们将征服暴风城，粉碎敌人依靠的任何希望。"
G["From now on, we define the terms of the engagement."]="从今天起，我们赋予了战争新的含义。"
G["From parts unknown: Skra'gath! Can $n possibly survive the onslaught of void energies?"]="来自未知世界的强者，瑟克拉加斯！$n能否在虚空能量的冲击下幸存呢？"
G["From shattered lands where heroes tread..."]="Desde tierras deshechas donde pisan los héroes..."
G["From sundered ground the sacrament was stolen. The Shield of Aesirites is lost. Unrest will be eternal."]="大地开裂，神器失窃。古神之盾已经遗失。混乱将会笼罩世界。"
G["From the Savage Ledge of Icecrown, Vladof the Butcher and his mammoth, Enormos! There ain't gonna be a thing left of our challengers, folks! Prepare for a downpour of blood, guts and tears!"]="来自冰冠冰川野蛮之台的屠夫乌拉多弗以及他的猛犸象恩诺姆斯！各位，这次我们的挑战者恐怕会被轰得连渣都不剩！让我们共同期待一场腥风血雨的大战吧！"
G["From the air, you should be able to cast your protective ward on whole groups of animals at once."]="在空中，你可以向下方成群的动物施放保护结界。"
G["From the bowels of the Underhalls comes Carnage.  Brave and foolish $n has accepted the challenge.  $G He : She; and $g his : her; group stand ready to face the monstrosity."]="Carnicería llega desde las entrañas de Las Cámaras Subterráneas. $gEl insensato:La insensata; y valiente $n ha aceptado el desafío. $gÉl:Ella; y su grupo están preparados para enfrentarse a la monstruosidad."
G["From the cruelty and mercilessness of Arthas, the man who would be the Lich King, the Forsaken were born."]="阿尔萨斯后来成为了巫妖王，凭着对他的共同仇恨，被遗忘者诞生了。"
G["From the darkest night shall rise again the raven, shall take flight in the shadows, shall reveal the nature of its kind. Prepare yourself for its coming, for the faithful shall be elevated to take flight with the raven, the rest be forgotten to walk upon the ground, clipped wings and shame."]="在最黑暗的夜晚，乌鸦将再次飞起，它将飞入阴影，显露本性。当它到来之时，虔诚的信徒会随它一并飞翔，剩余的人将被遗忘在大地之上，夹着翅膀羞愧不已。"
G["From the depths of Icecrown Citadel, one of the Lich King's chosen comes to put an end to the existence of $n and $g his : her; friends."]="挑战者的对手来自冰冠堡垒，这位被巫妖王选中的勇士是来终结$n及其战友的生命的。"
G["From the earth you arose. To the earth you shall return."]="你从大地中来，就该回到大地中去。"
G["From the faraway boughs of tranquil Darnassus, High Priestess Tyrande Whisperwind arrives!"]="高阶祭司泰兰德·语风从遥远而宁静的达纳苏斯来到了这里！"
G["From the flames of fate, the yaungol were born. They survive beyond the wall, for they refuse to submit to any law but their own."]="命运之火熊熊燃烧，野牛人诞生了。他们定居在长城之外，拒绝臣服于除自己之外的任何律法。"
G["From the flying city of Dalaran, the leader of the Kirin Tor, Lady Jaina Proudmoore!"]="肯瑞托之首，来自浮空之城达拉然的吉安娜·普罗德摩尔女士！"
G["From the looks o' it, the Korune were loyal to the Thunder King, thousands o' years ago... before even the pandaren came to rule this land."]="寇茹部族好像在数千年以前就效忠于雷电之王……比熊猫人统治这片土地更早。"
G["From the mist and fog the Kvaldir approach. Flee while you still breathe the air of the living..."]="克瓦迪尔从迷雾中迫近。逃跑吧，趁你还有命在，逃吧。"
G["From the moment the wild creatures first stirred on Azeroth, Goldrinn was there. His is the spirit of the hunter, the animal instinct that kicks in when wild things smell food or feel their children are in jeopardy. He appears as a great white wolf, ferocious and cunning.\n\nHe's known across all cultures. The orcs even have their own name for him: \"Lo'Gosh.\"\n\nTen thousand years ago, when demons first breached Azeroth, Goldrinn stood with the other ancients to mount a desperate defense."]="Desde el momento en el que las criaturas salvajes se movieron por primera vez en Azeroth, Goldrinn estaba allí. Es el espíritu del cazador, el instinto animal que entra en acción cuando las bestias huelen comida o sienten que sus crías están en peligro. Se aparece con la forma de un gran lobo blanco, feroz y astuto.\n\nSe le conoce en todas las culturas. Los orcos incluso tienen un nombre para él: \"Lo'Gosh\".\n\nHace diez mil años, cuando los demonios entraron en Azeroth por primera vez, Goldrinn permaneció junto a los demás ancestros para organizar una defensa desesperada."
G["From the safety of Camp Taurajo I once trained young hunters in the ways of the wild.\n\nWe have no such luxury now - skills must be learned in the heat of battle against a foe camped on our very doorstep."]="我曾经在陶拉祖营地安全的环境中训练年轻的猎人熟悉荒野之道。\n\n现在我们不能奢望再有那种条件了。敌人已经踏过了我们的门槛，我们的年轻人必须在与敌人的激烈搏杀中学会战斗的技巧。"
G["From the trees, the amber flowed and nurtured us. Kyparite, we called it, the lifeblood of the earth."]="那些树上流出的琥珀养育了我们。 我们把它叫做凯帕琥珀，大地的血液。"
G["From the very air! Tendrils of arcane energy light up the obsidian sky as plumes of raw magic rise up from fissures in the land. Kneel and drink from the fissure as you do from a stream or well. Pluck a tendril from the heavens as if it were an apple hanging from a branch."]="看！原始的魔法能量从大地裂痕中喷涌而出，奥术能量的藤蔓照亮了漆黑的天空。跪下从这些裂缝中汲取魔法能量，就像从溪流或是水井中饮水那样。采集来自天堂的藤蔓，就像从树上采摘苹果那样。"
G["From the west, the mantid stir.\n\nFrom the northwest, the mogu practice their dark arts.\n\nFrom the north, the yaungol press us.\n\nThere is too much to do, and too little time."]="西边，螳螂妖蠢蠢欲动。\n\n西北边，魔古族正在阴谋作乱。\n\n北边，野牛人步步紧逼。\n\n我们有太多事情要做了，时间紧迫。"
G["From these hidden paths we can rain terror down on our enemies below.\n\nThere is not much honor in hit-and-run strikes, but a good warrior knows to keep his foe off-balance."]="借助这些隐秘的路径，我们能够对下面的敌人发动猛烈的进攻。\n\n游击战算不上是荣誉的行动，但一名优秀的战士明白该如何让他的敌人措手不及。"
G["From these the Light withdraws, until only darkness remains."]="圣光抛弃了那些执迷不悟的愚者，留给他们的是无尽的黑暗。"
G["From this day forth, failure is no longer an option."]="从今天开始，我们的字典里再无失败二字。"
G["From this day forth, you walk as one of our brotherhood."]="从今天起，你就是我们的同胞手足。"
G["From this day forth, you walk as one of us."]="从今天起，你就是我们的一员了。"
G["From this dock, The Bravery travels back and forth between Stormwind and Rut'theran Village."]="勇敢的旅者经由这座港口在暴风城和鲁瑟兰村之间往返。"
G["From this moment until the end of days I live and die - For the Horde!"]="从这一刻直到我阖上双眼——为了部落！"
G["From this spring I shall gather the sacred waters with which I will combine the blood of the fallen druids."]="我要从这里的喷泉中收集圣水，把它与那些堕落德鲁伊的血液混合起来。"
G["From up here you can see the full scope of the cataclysm's destruction. It is chilling to see just how fragile our world really is."]="从这里，你能看到大灾变所造成的全部破坏。看到我们的世界竟然如此脆弱，这真是令人胆寒。"
G["From way downtown!"]="从通往城中心的路出发！"
G["From what I can tell, there were no sides in this fight. Why would the yaungol kill each other in a free-for-all?"]="据我观察，这并不是一场派系争斗。这些野牛人为什么会自相残杀呢？"
G["From what I've gathered, they're preparing for an attack on the mogu at dawn."]="就我收集的情报来看，他们正准备在黎明时分袭击魔古族。"
G["From yesterday's field trip, Marduk showed us that the dragons will tolerate the meat of recently killed humanoids, but only if they died slowly and painfully."]="从昨天的实地考察来看，马杜克表示巨龙可以食用近期被杀人类的肉，但是只有痛苦缓慢地死去人的肉才行。"
G["From your death springs life anew!"]="你的死亡将是一个新生命的开端！"
G["From your description, I'm certain that the book I loaned our visitor could allow you to easily identify the weapon."]="根据你的描述我可以断定，我借给那位访客的书能使你很容易地对这把武器做出鉴定。"
G["Frontal defense systems? Is there something I should let Brann know before he has anyone attempt to enter the complex?"]="前沿防御系统？在布莱恩派人进入这座城市之前，我需要提醒他什么吗？"
G["Frostbite has tracked the scent to its source. Investigate the cave!"]="霜齿已经追踪到了气味的源头。进入洞穴仔细搜查！"
G["Frostmane raiders! Sound the alarm!"]="霜鬃袭击者！快响警报！"
G["Frostmourne feeds on the soul of your fallen ally!"]="霜之哀伤会饱餐你们盟友的灵魂！"
G["Frostmourne hungers..."]="霜之哀伤饿了……"
G["Frostmourne lies unguarded? Impossible!"]="霜之哀伤无人守卫？不可能！"
G["Frostmourne, OBEY ME!"]="霜之哀伤，服从我！"
G["Frostmourne: the blade that destroyed our kingdom..."]="霜之哀伤：正是它摧毁了我们的王国。"
G["Frostmourne? The Lich King is never without his blade. If you are lying to me..."]="霜之哀伤？巫妖王从不离开他的佩剑。如果你撒谎……"
G["Frostwolf Keep is razed!  We must have supplies in order to repair and rebuild!"]="霜狼要塞被摧毁了！我们需要物资重建基地！"
G["Frostwolf Keep lies in the south corner of Alterac Valley and protects Frostwolf Village, home of orc clan of the same name.  All Horde territories in Alterac Valley stem from this one place of power.\n\nFrostwolf Keep is intact."]="霜狼要塞位于奥特兰克山谷的南部，是通往霜狼村的要塞，是名为霜狼的兽人氏族的家园。部落在奥特兰克山谷所有领土都从这儿衍生。\n\n霜狼要塞完好无损。"
G["Frostwolf Keep lies in the south corner of Alterac Valley and protects Frostwolf Village, home of orc clan of the same name.  All Horde territories in Alterac Valley stem from this one place of power.\n\nFrostwolf Keep was razed and is under reconstruction."]="霜狼要塞位于奥特兰克山谷的南部，是通往霜狼村的要塞，是名为霜狼的兽人氏族的家园。部落在奥特兰克山谷所有领土都从这儿衍生。\n\n霜狼要塞被夷为平地，需要重建。"
G["Frostwolf clan."]="霜狼氏族。"
G["Frozen Spider Ichor!"]="结冰的蜘蛛毒液！"
G["Frozen and destroyed. This is all your fleshy corpse is good for."]="像你这样的血肉之躯，被冻僵之后就能很轻易地结果你的性命。这就是你的下场。"
G["Frozen solid, ripe for the slaughter. Let loose a howling blast and shatter them into pieces, disciple."]="它们被冻僵了，正是下手的好机会。利用凛风冲击将它们撕成碎片吧！"
G["Frozen solid."]="牢牢地被冻住。"
G["Fruit"]="水果"
G["Fruit?  Did somebody say they wanted fruit?"]="水果？有人说他们想要水果吗？"
G["Frustrated by the Dalaran wizards' lack of progress against the undead during the Third War, the Archmage Arugal elected to summon the extra-dimensional worgen to bolster his side's diminishing ranks. The wolf-men slaughtered the Scourge, then quickly turned on the wizards themselves and laid siege to the keep of the noble, Baron Silverlaine. The fort quickly fell into shadow and ruin. Driven mad with guilt, Arugal adopted the worgen as his children and retreated to the newly dubbed 'Shadowfang Keep'."]="在第三次大战中，肯瑞托的法师和亡灵天灾进行了殊死的战斗。大法师阿鲁高召唤了异世界中的狼人来增强达拉然守备部队的力量。这些狂暴的狼型生物踏平了来犯的亡灵天灾，然后迅速将目标转向达拉然的法师，并开始围攻席瓦莱恩男爵的城堡。这座位于焚木村的城堡不久之后就变成了黑暗势力的聚集地，并从此荒废。因为对于自己罪过的愧疚，阿鲁高将那些狼人当作自己的孩子并隐居在“影牙城堡”中。"
G["Fshhhhhhsssfhhhhh?"]="呼嘶呼呼？？"
G["Fu Mo Shi is a doddering old fool. He's a master of nothing!"]="付莫是就是个老蠢货。他简直一事无成！"
G["Fulfillment is at hand."]="我很满足。"
G["Full speed ahead Mister Copperbolt!"]="考伯伯特先生，全速前进！"
G["Fun time over!"]="你……玩完了！"
G["Fun time?"]="玩吗？玩吗？"
G["Fun?!!  You nearly gave me a heart attack!  Yeah, I guess you're right.  That was fun!!!"]="有趣？！！你差点害我心脏病发作！没错，我想你是对的。真是太有趣了！！！"
G["Funaam is our guild registrar. His office has been set up within the Exodar. Just follow the road; you'll find it in no time."]="弗纳姆是我们的公会注册员，他的办公室就设立在埃索达里面。沿着路走，你很快就可以找到他。"
G["Function: Engineers, Scientists"]="职能：工程师，科学家"
G["Function: Generals, Ground Commanders"]="职能：将军，地面指挥官"
G["Function: Honor Guard"]="职能：荣誉卫士"
G["Function: Intelligence Agents, Torturers"]="职能：间谍，拷问者"
G["Function: Overlords, Strategists"]="职能：督军，战略家"
G["Function: Priestesses, Military Chaplains"]="职能：女祭司，随军牧师"
G["Function: Secret Police, Interrogator"]="职能：秘密警察，质问者"
G["Function: Secret Police, Interrogators"]="职能：秘密警察，质问者"
G["Function: Shock Troops, Enforcers"]="职能：突击部队，执行者"
G["Function: Standard Soldiers"]="职能：普通士兵"
G["Function: Tinkerers, Machine-smiths"]="职能：修补工，机械师"
G["Funny you should ask... I just received an update on that. Thus far, the Alliance has gathered $2060w of $2061w light leather, $2063w out of $2064w medium leather and $2069w of $2071w thick leather skins."]="嗯，这个问题很有趣……我收到的最新消息是，到目前为止，联盟已经收集了$2060w张轻皮、$2063w张中皮和$2069w张厚皮了，而总的需求量分别是$2061w、$2064w和$2071w。"
G["Furdy furdy fur."]="去毛，去毛，去毛。"
G["Furious Fire Elementals Killed: $4582W/$4862W"]="已杀死狂怒的火元素：$4582W/$4862W"
G["Furious winds envelop Vakkiz as he writhes menacingly towards you."]="瓦克奇斯携着狂风朝你恶狠狠地扑过来。"
G["Furries chompin' the Jinyu!"]="毛毛们，干掉锦鱼人！"
G["Further attuning yourself with the Battlemaiden, you have gained a new ability!"]="正在使你与女武士进一步协调，你已获得一项新技能！"
G["Further corruption?  No, we are here to stop the corruption, and save Pandaria!"]="深度腐蚀者？不，我们是来阻止腐蚀，拯救潘达利亚的！"
G["Further information can only be accessed from the archives within Ulduar, by order of Keeper Loken."]="要了解更多信息，必须获取守护者洛肯的指令，然后访问奥杜尔的档案。"
G["Furthermore, I am here by the authority of Overlord Krom'gar, who was himself appointed by our Warchief, Garrosh Hellscream. You will do his bidding or suffer the consequences."]="此外，是克罗姆加大王——加尔鲁什·地狱咆哮的钦点爱将派我来的。你可以选择按他说的做，或者后果自负。"
G["Fury!"]="愤怒！"
G["Fus Ro Dah!"]="Fus Ro Dah（力——衡——冲）!"
G["G'day mate! Sit an' have yerself a sip, won't yeh?"]="你好啊，伙计！坐下来喝一杯吧，怎么样？"
G["G-g-go away! Bring my sheep back!"]="滚……滚开！把我的羊还给我！"
G["GAAAAAAHHH!"]="哇啊啊啊！"
G["GAAAH! How you kill croc?!"]="啊！你是怎么把鳄鱼干掉的？！"
G["GAAAHHH!"]="哇啊啊啊！"
G["GAH!!!!  I CAN'T SEE IN HERE!!!!"]="啊！！！！我在这儿看不到！！！！"
G["GAME OVER, MAN!!!"]="游戏结束了，伙计！！！"
G["GENERAL TRIGGER 4 SENT, REMOVE THIS ACTION!"]="紧急情况4，取消行动！"
G["GENERAL! Come out from your tent and face me!"]="将军！从你的帐篷里出来面对我吧！"
G["GET A ROPE!"]="把这家伙送上绞刑架！"
G["GET IN DA STEW!"]="到锅里去！"
G["GET SOME!"]="接招！"
G["GET THE PLANS AND GO!"]="拿起计划赶快走！"
G["GET THOSE GUNS ONLINE!!"]="把枪都准备好！！！！"
G["GET UP YOU ROTTEN PIECE OF TRASH! GET UP BEFORE I END YOU!"]="爬起来，你这堆腐臭的垃圾！在我终结你之前爬起来！"
G["GET!"]="从！"
