G["Garrosh spouts on about honor and strength, but in truth our leader sees only two outcomes - either fight and survive, or be defeated and forgotten."]="加尔鲁什总把荣耀和力量挂在嘴上，可实际上我们的领袖眼里只有胜王败寇那一套。"
