G["Garrosh will not tolerate demon worship within the walls of Orgrimmar. You will submit and allow yourselves to be taken into custody or be destroyed."]="加尔鲁什绝不容许在奥格瑞玛的城墙之内进行恶魔崇拜。你们必须立刻投降并接受羁押，否则就得死。"
G["Garrosh will not tolerate failure.  AGAIN!"]="加尔鲁什绝不容许失败。再来！"
G["Garrosh will pay for his crimes."]="加尔鲁什将为他的罪行付出代价。"
G["Garrosh will pay!"]="加尔鲁什必将付出代价！"
G["Garrosh will soon be sending his most capable soldiers. It is they who will guide you into the open and waiting arms of the Horde."]="加尔鲁什很快就会派出最精锐的军队。他们会代表部落朝你张开温暖的怀抱。"
