G["Gate?! I'm going to bring this whole wall down!"]="门？！我能把整堵墙都炸飞！"
G["Gather 'round cubs and hear the tale of \"$p and the dreaded Silken Shadows\"..."]="Únete a los cachorros y escucha el cuento de \"$p y las sombras de seda temibles\"..."
G["Gather 'round...."]="都给我过来……"
G["Gather a force and go to the lake.  I want Countess Verrall destroyed by the end of the day!"]="集结一支部队，到湖边去。我要让瓦拉尔女伯爵活不过今天！"
G["Gather around me as we prepare to reclaim our homeland!"]="请加入我们的队伍，光复我们失落已久的家园！"
G["Gather around the altar, brothers and sisters! Revelation awaits!"]="兄弟姐妹们，聚集在圣坛周围吧！真相即将被揭示！"
G["Gather behind me at the gates of the Undercity! Soon we march upon our fallen city and reclaim it - FOR THE HORDE!"]="随我到幽暗城门口集合！我们要夺回这座沦陷的城市——为了部落！"
G["Gather close. We're doing this. Let's roll!"]="聚集在一起。我们成功了。让我们开始吧！"
