G["Gather up the wounded! We've struck a mighty blow today - the next part of our campaign begins."]="去搜寻伤员！今天我们做出了致命一击——战役进入了新阶段。"
G["Gather up those explosives!"]="快把那些炸药收集起来！"
G["Gather up those fel reaver parts.  We're going to make a surprise for the goblins!"]="把这些魔能机甲部件收集起来。我们会让地精们大吃一惊的！"
G["Gather what the villagers are willing to sell us and prepare the others to leave."]="把村民们愿意卖给我们的东西收集起来，准备安排其他人撤离。"
G["Gather your courage, $r. Together, we can resist the sha."]="拿出你的勇气来，$r。团结一致，我们就能对抗煞魔。"
G["Gather your senses quickly, we must press on."]="集中精神，我们必须继续前进。"
G["Gather, brothers and sisters!  Let us fulfill our duties and return to Thrall victorious!"]="整队，兄弟姐妹们！让我们履行自己的职责，载誉回到萨尔的面前！"
G["Gather, brothers and sisters! Come, all, and listen!"]="集合，兄弟姐妹们！所有人都过来，听好了！"
G["Gather, brothers and sisters."]="同胞们，集合。"
G["Gather, gather. A story has come."]="过来吧。我给你们讲个故事。"
G["Gather, my pets... there is plenty for all!"]="快来吧，我的宠物们。来吃个够吧！"
G["Gather, soldiers! Gather and take your trophies from the carapace of the enemy!"]="士兵，集合！去敌人的尸体上掠夺战利品吧！"
G["Gathering"]="收集"
G["Gathering lumber."]="收集木材。"
G["Gathering professions allow you to acquire raw materials used by production professions: gathering herbs; mining ore, stone, and jewels; or skinning beasts for their hides.\nYou can either support a related production profession with gathering, or simply sell the raw materials on the auction house."]="Las profesiones de recolección te permiten adquirir materias primas para las profesiones secundarias: puedes recoger hierbas, extraer minerales, piedras y joyas, o desollar bestias para obtener su pellejo.\n\nPuedes suministrar lo que recolectes a una profesión de producción relacionada, o vender las materias primas en la casa de subastas."
G["Gathering... information... on the Scourge.\n\nAlliance forces appeared...\n\nWe took cover - waited until they attacked the gate... then, we hit them from the rear.\n\nPinched between us... and the Scourge... it was too much for them....\n\n$g Brother:Sister;... it was... glorious."]="收集……天灾军团的……情报。\n\n联盟的军队出现了……\n\n我们躲了起来，接着他们开始攻打大门……然后我们从背后发动了袭击。\n\n三方展开了混战……但是天灾军团……数量太多了……\n\n我的$g兄弟:姐妹;……那真是一场……荣耀的战斗。"
G["Gawurgggl! Blrgl-brgl grgl!"]="¡Gawurgggl! ¡Blrgl-brgl grgl!"
G["Gaze into the heart of N'Zoth."]="凝视恩佐斯的内心吧。"
G["Gaze into the inevitable!"]="凝视避无可避的厄运吧！"
G["Gaze into the void."]="凝视虚空。"
G["Gaze into the void. It is the perpetuity in which they dwell."]="凝视虚空吧。它们就居住在其中。"
G["Gaze now, mortals - upon the HEART OF M'URU! Unblemished. Bathed by the light of Creation - just as it was at the Dawn."]="凝视它，凡人们，凝视穆鲁这颗依然纯洁无瑕的心。沐浴在这创生的光芒之中吧，就如同在沐浴晨曦一般。"
G["Gaze to the heavens! What do you see?"]="直视这片星空！你看到了什么？"
G["Gaze upon its magnificence! Bask in its glorious, um, glory! I present you with... V-07-TR-0N!"]="庄严地注目它吧！沐浴在它的荣耀中吧！将要出场的是……V-07-TR-0N！"
G["Gaze upon my crazy tentacle-face and despair, Azerothian!"]="绝望吧！看着我的章鱼脸，绝望吧！可笑的艾泽拉斯人！"
G["Gaze upon the Exodar, young $r. It is hard to imagine that we survived such a catastrophe.\n\n<Menelaous sighs.>\n\nThe Prophet states that it is here that our fate will finally be known. Ten lifetimes spent fleeing from the madness of the Burning Legion... here we finally make a stand.\n\nNo more running... I am ready to die."]="Observa con atención El Exodar, joven $r. Es difícil imaginar que sobrevivimos a tal catástrofe.\n\n<Menelaous suspira.>\n\nEl profeta afirma que es aquí donde, al fin, se conocerá nuestro destino. Diez vidas pasadas huyendo de la locura de la Legión Ardiente... por fin aquí resistimos.\n\nSe acabó el huir... Estoy preparado para morir."
G["Gaze upon the enemy, $r. See what the might of the Horde reduces even the most powerful of dragons to! All that oppose us shall meet a similar fate!"]="盯着敌人，$r。看吧，强大的部落足以对付巨龙！所有跟我们做对的人都是这种下场！"
G["Gaze... into the void."]="凝视……虚空。"
G["Gear all banged up, eh?"]="东西都弄坏了，嗯？"
G["Geared and ready, commander."]="我们已经整装待发，长官。"
G["Geared up and ready to die. What would you have of us, sir?"]="我们已经整装待发，准备浴血沙场了。长官，请下达命令吧。"
G["Gebler, father, why would you..."]="盖比勒，父亲，为什么你们……"
G["Gebler, you came!  What did he say?"]="盖比勒，你来了！他怎么说？"
G["Gee, Budd, is there anyone alive who can back up these claims of yours?"]="我说，巴德，有谁能证明你所说的话吗？"
G["Gee, fish sure don't seem to be biting here. Maybe I should go over to Crystal Lake to try my luck there!"]="呀，这里的鱼好像不咬钩。也许我该去水晶湖那边试试运气！"
G["Gee, the lack of humility before nature that's being displayed here, uh... staggers me."]="喔唷，你还真是不懂得敬畏自然啊，呃……我真是太吃惊了。"
G["Geist... disgusting. The Cult has infested this place."]="恶鬼……真讨厌。诅咒教派已经污染了这片土地。"
