G["General Zhun intends to deliver Kotmogu Temple's ancient artifacts to his wicked liege, the Thunder King. We cannot allow this to happen!"]="烛恒将军准备把寇魔古寺的古代神器交给他的邪恶君主，雷电之王。我们不能让这种情况发生！"
