G["Give me a couple minutes, $n. There was some excitement in here a moment ago, and I just want to make sure things have died back down. I'll talk to you soon enough."]="$n，给我几分钟时间。这里刚刚发生了一些事情，我要去确定一切都已经搞定了。我会马上会来继续和你谈谈的。"
