G["Give up now."]="快放弃吧。"
G["Give up or die!"]="投降或者死亡！"
G["Give up your hope."]="放弃希望吧。"
G["Give up your will to live! I can do this all day and night."]="放弃求生的欲望吧。我可以整日整夜地折磨你。"
G["Give up, Zalazane. It be over, now."]="放弃吧，扎拉赞恩，一切都结束了。"
G["Give up, outsider!"]="放弃吧，你没有希望获胜！"
G["Give us a chance to put things right."]="给我们纠正错误的机会吧。"
G["Give us a kissss..."]="给我们一个吻……"
G["Give us a moment to prepare to build the turrets."]="给我们一点时间，做好建筑炮台的准备。"
G["Give us one good reason why we shouldn't set fire to these sacks!"]="你有什么理由阻止我们烧掉这些谷物！"
G["Give us time, Lord Zhu. Give us the opportunity to bring Hellscream to justice."]="请给我们一点时间，祝掌门。请给我们一个将地狱咆哮绳之以法的机会。"
G["Give us time... Let the man die... I am no one... I am no one... Fear the anchorite... Fear the anchorite... Barada... Barada."]="给我们一点时间……让这人死去吧……我谁都不是……我谁都不是……让那学者感到恐惧吧……让那学者感到恐惧吧……巴拉达……巴拉达。"
G["Give yourself to the flame."]="把你自己献给火焰。"
G["Give yourselves to the night, Elune will guide you from this mortal prison."]="投入暗夜的怀抱，艾露恩会指引你们逃离凡尘。"
G["Give... me... book..."]="把……它……给我……"
G["Given the body temperature, I'd say they've been dead no more than 6 hours."]="根据体温判断，我敢说他们的死亡时间不超过6小时。"
G["Gizmo, what are you doing just sitting there? Don't you recognize who that is laying next to you?!"]="发明家，你干嘛楞在那儿？难道你不知道身边的是谁吗？"
G["Gizmos... check. Doothingies... check. Wizzers... check."]="检查完毕，一切正常。"
G["Glacial Cloak."]="冰川披风。"
G["Glacial Gloves."]="冰川手套。"
G["Glacial Vest."]="冰川外衣。"
G["Glacial Wrists."]="冰川护腕。"
G["Glad I could help!"]="很高兴我能帮上忙！"
G["Glad to be of service!"]="很高兴为你服务！"
G["Glad to be out of that wretched trench. Not much nicer up here though!"]="能走出这条臭沟真好，尽管出去了也好不了多少。"
G["Glad to have a chance to catch my breath. Thanks for the help!"]="真高兴能有机会喘一口气。谢谢你的帮助！"
G["Glad to have you."]="很高兴有你加入。"
G["Glad to have you. We will be making a stout. Can you get a few barrels of water?"]="很高兴你能加入。我们要酿一种烈酒。你能弄几桶水来吗？"
G["Glad to hear it. I'll send Delber any forces I can spare."]="很高兴听到这个消息。我会将能够调遣的部队全派给戴博。"
G["Glad to help, my lady. I'm told you were once the guardian of a fabled sword. Do you know where I might find it?"]="乐意为你效劳，女士。听说你曾是一把传说之剑的守护者。你能告诉我该去哪儿寻找这把剑吗？"
G["Glad to see that Dark Iron scum is finally getting what he deserves!"]="黑铁矮人渣滓终于得到了他应得的，这太令人高兴了！"
G["Glad to see that you've arrived. Shall we get to it then?"]="很高兴看到你。我们现在可以开始了吗？"
G["Glad to see you're doing so well, Harlan.  And I hope to see you again soon..."]="很高兴看到你干得这么好，哈兰。希望我们很快能再见面……"
G["Glad you asked. Darkmoon Faire Prize Tickets are your currency to purchase some amazing prizes.\n\nPrize Tickets are rewarded for doing monthly quests and playing the games around the faire.\n\nCompleting the monthly quests will earn you the most Prize Tickets, but playing the games daily, is a great way to get ahead.\n\nOnce you have enough tickets, you can spend them at the different vendors on the faire grounds."]="Me alegro de que me hagas esa pregunta. Los vales para la Feria de la Luna Negra son tu moneda de cambio para conseguir regalos increíbles.\n\nLos vales son la recompensa por hacer las misiones mensuales y jugar a los juegos de la feria.\n\nAl completar las misiones mensuales ganarás el mayor número de vales, pero participar a diario también es una buena forma de conseguirlos.\n\nCuando ya tengas suficientes vales, puedes gastarlos en los diferentes puestos del recinto de la feria."
G["Glad you could make it, $n."]="你做到了，$n，我很高兴。"
G["Glad you could make it, Uther."]="乌瑟尔，你总算及时赶到了。"
G["Glad you decided to see things my way..."]="很高兴你能站在我的角度考虑问题……"
G["Glad you made it."]="真高兴你成功了。"
G["Glad you made it. Are we ready to proceed?"]="很高兴你们成功了。我们可以前进了吗？"
G["Gladiators earn the right to wear equipment like mine by winning ranked arena matches."]="角斗士们通过在竞技场的段位赛中取胜来获得使用我身上这套装备的权利。"
G["Gladly, my new friend. Our engineer is still in the wilds though - we'll need to rescue him first."]="我很乐意，朋友。不过我们的工程师下落不明——我们得先去救他。"
G["Gladly, sir."]="愿意效劳，长官。"
G["Gladly."]="非常荣幸。"
G["Gloat all you want, but you'll see we were right."]="随你怎么想吧，但你会看到，我才是对的。"
G["Gloom'rel, tell me your secrets!"]="杜姆雷尔，告诉我你的秘密！"
G["Glorious Goods in southern Dalaran should have all the general goods you need."]="达拉然南部的荣耀杂货店出售各种杂货。"
G["Glorious, indeed, Maltrake. It looks as if my plan worked perfectly. Wouldn't you say so, mortal?"]="Ciertamente es fabuloso, Maltrake. Al parecer, mi plan ha funcionado perfectamente. ¿Estás de acuerdo conmigo, mortal?"
G["Glory and blood for the Old Gods!"]="荣耀和鲜血全归上古之神！"
G["Glory and strength to you, $c. I bless you with all the strength left in me. May this nightmare soon end!"]="愿荣耀与力量与你同在，$c。我以仅存的力量祝福你，愿这场噩梦早日结束！"
G["Glory to Chi-Ji!"]="荣耀归于赤精！"
G["Glory to Kil'jaeden! Death to all who oppose!"]="基尔加丹万岁！所有敌人都要死！"
G["Glory to Stormwind and King Wrynn!"]="荣耀属于暴风城和乌瑞恩国王！"
G["Glory to Yogg-Saron!"]="荣耀归于尤格-萨隆！"
G["Glory to the Alliance!"]="荣耀属于联盟！"
G["Glory to the Horde!"]="荣耀属于部落！"
G["Glory to the Sun K-- ah... Silvermoon!"]="为了太阳之王——呃——银月城的荣耀！"
G["Glory to the brave!"]="勇者无敌！"
G["Glory to the master!"]="荣耀归于我主！"
G["Glory to the naaru, $n.  The Light will soon triumph over its enemies."]="荣耀属于纳鲁，$n。敌人将在圣光的照耀下湮灭！"
G["Glory will be ours when we win this tournament in the name of Silvermoon."]="等我们以银月城的名义赢下这场锦标赛时，荣耀将属于我们。"
G["Glory... to Ragnaros..."]="荣光献给……拉格纳罗斯……"
G["Gloves with built-in clappers, for hands-free clapping."]="内置拍手器的手套，不需动手就能鼓掌。"
G["Glrggg mbrrgl! Brmlgr glgglg uhmrgl grbmr."]="¡Glrggg mbrrgl! Brmlgr glgglg uhmrgl grbmr."
G["Glubtok crush you!"]="格拉布托克要粉碎你！"
G["Glubtok ready?"]="格拉布托克，好了吗？"
G["Glubtok show you da power of de arcane!"]="格拉布托克让你看看奥术的力量！"
G["Glubtok take choice two."]="格拉布托克选第二个。"
G["Glug bmrgl grggl!"]="¡Glug bmrgl grggl!"
G["Gluk is da best!"]="格鲁克是最棒的！"
G["Glumrggl?"]="¿Glumrggl?"
G["Gluth, the foul plague-dog of Naxxramas, was said to have an appetite so voracious that even the living were not enough to satisfy his hunger. Feugen was said to feed him an army of zombies daily, recycling the remains of undead too weak to use in combat."]="格拉斯，纳克萨玛斯肮脏的天灾犬。据说这只野兽极其贪婪，每天费尔根都会给它送去一批缺乏作战力的亡灵。格拉斯堪称是天灾军团废物利用系统的终端。"
G["Glyx and I have an understanding: he keeps me supplied, and I keep him rich. Seriously! What that pirate charges me for a measly pouch of crumpled kingsblood... it's enough to make a grown goblin cry."]="格里克斯和我达成一项共识：他给我供货，而我给他钱。这是很认真的！那个海盗为了一小袋皱皱巴巴的皇血草收我多少钱……足够把一个成年的地精弄哭了。"
G["Gmurgl starts to follow you."]="古穆尔格要跟随你。"
G["Gnome Construction Site Under Attack!"]="侏儒建筑营地遭到攻击！"
G["Gnome Gossip NPC - Periodic Talk (Expansion Prologue) 01"]="PNJ gnomo cotilla - Charla periódica (prólogo de la expansión) 01"
G["Gnome lover, that's my name! You know why, buddy? 'Cause you rode into this shop on a broken down unicycle and I flew in here on a 5,000 gold piece, top of the line, armored wyvern. THAT'S my name!"]="我名叫侏儒情人！你知道这是怎么来的吗？你瞧，你就只能骑着小破独轮车，我胯下却是一只价值5000金币，全副武装的双足飞龙。哼哼，我就叫侏儒情人！"
G["Gnomeregan Champion's Pennant"]="诺莫瑞根冠军的旗帜"
G["Gnomeregan can be found in western Dun Morogh."]="诺莫瑞根在丹莫洛的西边。"
G["Gnomeregan is within our grasp!"]="光复诺莫瑞根近在咫尺！"
G["Gnomeregan's finest have come to compete in the tournament. Wish us luck!"]="诺莫瑞根的精英来参加锦标赛啦。祝我们好运！"
G["Gnomes can be hard to hit due to their size. However, they have a pinchant for dancing around and thrusting their hips. When they do this, strike at them like so..."]="侏儒因为体格矮小而很难击中。不过，他们有时会手舞足蹈，摆臀扭胯。这时你就可以像这样攻击他们……"
G["Gnomes in Lava Suits, for example."]="比如说，身穿熔岩装的侏儒。"
G["Gnomes! Gnomes are marvelous people. Wonderful! And they hold such knowledge of the engineering arts! You must travel to Ironforge, to Tinkertown, and speak with Springspindle Fizzlegear."]="侏儒！侏儒是神奇的种族。他们别提有多棒了！侏儒在工程学上的造诣真是登峰造极啊！前往铁炉堡的侏儒区，和宾斯匹德谈谈吧。"
G["Gnugat, does it seem wise to you to tear apart a ship underneath your own feet?"]="果仁，你觉得把你现在正坐的船拆烂，这明智吗？"
G["Gnugat, if your goblins strip any more of this ship's supports, it'll plunge into the surf!"]="果仁，你们这些地精要是再拆一块这船的支承架，它就要窜到海里冲浪去了！"
G["Gnugat... Can you wait until we are OFF of the boat before you take it apart?"]="果仁……你能不能等我们下了船，再把它拆散？"
G["Go Ace!"]="冲啊，王牌飞行员！"
G["Go Brann. Bring me back an epic tale when we meet again. Farewell for now, brothers."]="去吧，布莱恩。下次见面时，你再告诉我这个惊天动地的故事吧。再见，兄弟们。"
G["Go Emeralda! Show them the folly of their ways!"]="去吧，艾美拉达！让他们明白自己的愚蠢！"
G["Go Forsaken!  Yay us!"]="走吧，被遗忘者！走吧！"
G["Go about your business. My errand does not require your attention."]="去忙你自己的事情吧，这边的事情不需要你操心。"
G["Go ahead and speak with the water, Ashyo."]="去和水谈谈吧，阿西约。"
G["Go ahead and start pulling some of the younger flowers. Just not too many."]="去吧，拔掉一些小花，别拔太多。"
G["Go ahead and take forty winks."]="去睡一小会吧。"
G["Go ahead and turn this thing on."]="快去打开这个东西。"
G["Go ahead with the binding, Cho."]="继续进行联结吧，周卓。"
G["Go ahead, $r. Give me an excuse."]="继续，$r。给我个理由。"
G["Go ahead, I can handle this part."]="前进，我能搞定。"
G["Go ahead, gimme your best shot.  I can take it!"]="来呀，用你最厉害的招数！我照单全收！"
G["Go ahead. Harvest your specimens."]="好了。采集你的标本吧。"
G["Go ahead. Make me bleed. A true orc lives for combat!"]="哈，你让我流血了。这不算什么。真正的兽人为战斗而生！"
G["Go an' get dem, Ohgan! We WON'T be fooled again!"]="攻击他们，奥根！我们不会再被愚弄了！"
G["Go and rest, wanderer. Our fires are yours."]="去休息吧，流浪者。让我们同享这炉火。"
G["Go and see Brewmaster Boof for some Kun-Lai Kicker!"]="向酒仙布夫要一些昆莱劲酒！"
G["Go away and leave me be. Let me suffer in peace."]="走开，别管我。让我安静地体味痛苦吧。"
G["Go away!"]="滚开！"
G["Go away! You shouldn't be here!"]="滚开！你不应该出现在这里！"
G["Go away, I don't want the Warchief to find out I've been talking to the Horde."]="滚开，我不想让酋长发现我在跟部落的人说话。"
G["Go away, gnoll!"]="滚开，豺狼人！"
G["Go away, kid, you're botherin' me!"]="¡Vete de aquí, $gchaval:chavala;. ¡Me estás molestando!"
G["Go away, marmots!"]="滚开，土拨鼠！"
G["Go away, mon."]="走开。"
G["Go away, shoe stealer!"]="滚开，偷鞋贼！"
G["Go away, whoever you are! Forgotten Hilll is mine... mine!"]="无论你是谁，给我滚开！遗忘丘是我的……我的！"
G["Go away, whoever you are! Witch Hill is mine... mine!"]="管你是谁，给我滚远点！女巫岭属于我……属于我！"
G["Go away."]="走开。"
G["Go away. My team can handle ourselves."]="滚开，我们队能自己解决。"
G["Go away.. I'm tryin' to shleep here."]="走开……我想在这里睡觉。"
G["Go back to Aggra and tell her that we're moving northwest."]="回去告诉阿格娜，我们正在朝西北方向前进。"
G["Go back to Vol'jin an' tell him dis: Zen'tabra stands ready to help him in de coming battle."]="回到沃金那里去，告诉他：岑塔布拉已经做好了和他并肩作战的准备。"
G["Go back to da Warchief.  Tell 'im I'm dead. Stay close to 'im. Watch 'im."]="回去找酋长。告诉他我死了。跟紧他。看着他。"
G["Go back to work before the overseer sees us."]="在监工看见我们之前，快回去工作吧。"
G["Go back to your Lich King, foul creatures!"]="回到你的巫妖王那里去，肮脏的东西！"
G["Go back where you came from, Horde!"]="从哪儿来的就回哪儿去吧，部落！"
G["Go back."]="返回。"
G["Go easy on me!"]="你要让让我哦！"
G["Go easy on the belly, alright?"]="别太用力打我的肚子，行吗？"
G["Go find Zando'zan in the Cleft of Shadow.  There are a couple of tunnels leading down into that cavern, one just south of the Valley of Wisdom and the other in The Drag."]="到暗影裂口去找赞杜沙。有许多隧道直通那个洞窟，有一个就在智慧谷的南面而另一个在暗巷区。"
G["Go find those hidden plagued grain crates and use your Arcane Disruptor on them!\n\nArthas will then have the evidence he needs to begin the culling of Stratholme."]="¡Busca esas cajas con grano plagado y usa tu disruptor arcano en ellas!\n\nEntonces Arthas tendrá las pruebas que necesita para comenzar la purga de Stratholme."
G["Go for the face! Go for the face!"]="狠狠打脸！狠狠打脸！"
G["Go for the throat!"]="咬他的喉咙！"
G["Go forth and slay our enemies so that our army may grow."]="每杀死一名敌人，我们就多一员炮灰。"
G["Go forth my brothers, and may your light pierce the darkness! The Deceiver must be brought to justice!"]="前进吧，我的兄弟，愿你们的圣光划破沿途的一切黑暗！欺诈者必将灭亡！"
G["Go forth, and defeat the Prince of Darkness."]="去吧，去战胜黑暗的王子。"
G["Go forth, as a member of the Shado-Pan!"]="以影踪派弟子的身份，前进吧！"
G["Go forth, minions of destruction, and bathe this world in the flames of the twisting nether!"]="前进，毁灭的奴仆们，让这个世界彻底陷入下界位面扭曲的烈火之中！"
G["Go forth, my beautiful angel! Ah, it is so very sad when one's children leave the nest, isn't it?"]="前进，我美丽的天使！啊，当孩子离开窝巢的时候总是让人感到伤心，不是吗？"
G["Go get 'em, Fangs!"]="去干掉他们，毒牙！"
G["Go get 'em, boss!"]="¡A por ellos, $gjefe:jefa;!"
G["Go get 'em, kid."]="A por ellos, $gchico:chica;."
G["Go get 'em, tiger!"]="去解决他们，猛虎！"
G["Go get dressed for the party."]="去为聚会准备服装吧。"
G["Go get him."]="去找到他。"
G["Go get it boys, that contraption's got nothin' on real goblin engineering!"]="干掉它，在正版地精工程学面前，那玩意儿不堪一击！"
G["Go get it!!"]="快去！！"
G["Go get it, Sunny!"]="接住，苏尼！"
G["Go go $pc luckydo!"]="上，上，$pc幸运符！"
G["Go go go go! To the center of the city! This way!"]="上上上！去城市中心！这边走！"
G["Go go go!"]="去，去啊！"
G["Go home to Keely, Beak. She keep you safe til Donnelly come back."]="尖喙，回家去找凯莉。她会保护你，直到东尼利回来。"
G["Go in peace, child."]="没事了，孩子。"
G["Go jump in the lake, won't ya Mack? I smelled ya before I saw ya...."]="去去去！老远就闻到一股酒臭味，我就知道是你……"
G["Go kid! Make with the punch!"]="加油，孩子！揍他！"
G["Go kill more stuff while Goregek eat."]="趁格利基克吃饭的时候，你去多杀些猎物吧。"
G["Go now and rest; you've earned it."]="现在去休息一下吧，辛苦了。"
G["Go now to my master!"]="你的灵魂可以去主人那里了！"
G["Go now! Do the bidding of your masters!"]="去吧！遵照主人的命令行事！"
G["Go now! Go to Durotar! Make your mark as history unfurls around you!"]="快去吧！去杜隆塔尔！在历史上留下你的印记！"
G["Go now, $n. Find Volcor... and remember, the magics protecting you will fail if you interact with anyone, save for talking."]="现在出发，$n。去找沃科尔……记着，除了交谈以外，与任何人交流都会使你身上的魔法保护失效。"
G["Go now, $n. The moonwell will be filled by the time you return to the front."]="去吧，$n。当你回到前线的时候，月井应该已经满溢了。"
G["Go now, and defeat the Prince of Darkness. (DO NOT USE?)"]="去吧，去战胜黑暗的王子。"
G["Go now, to Ihgaluk Crag. I will apply the second half of your illusion once you have arrived."]="现在，去伊瓜鲁克峭壁。等你一到那里，我就给你施加另一半幻术。"
G["Go now. Make tha Darkspear proud. Dere are many wars ahead of us, an' I'm sure ya be havin' a part to play in all of dem."]="去吧，让暗矛部族以你为傲。我们前方还有很多战斗。我相信你会和我们一起走到底。"
G["Go now..."]="去吧……"
G["Go on ahead without me! I will make my own way to Tarren Mill."]="别管我，赶快去！我会自己走到塔伦米尔的。"
G["Go on ahead, I'll catch up at Irontree's emcampment. Thank you!"]="你先出发，我会到铁木的营地那里与你回合。谢谢你！"
G["Go on now. You got more important things to do than to be visitin' the likes of us. Still, while you're here, you see that wascally wirmen runnin' wild out in the fields?"]="现在继续吧。你还有更重要的事情要做，别浪费时间造访我们这些人。不过，你来的时候，有没有看见那个在野外疯跑的卑鄙的瓦尔蒙？"
G["Go on, $n. Pull it out. You will not be held accountable for my death, when it comes."]="继续，$n，把它拔出来。要是我真死了，你也不必为此负责。"
G["Go on, Riko."]="继续，里克。"
G["Go on, find Thrall.  Finish this.  I will live."]="去找萨尔吧。结束这一切。我会活下来的。"
G["Go on, get out of here!  Save yourself!"]="继续，快离开这里！保护好你自己！"
G["Go on, kill them! I'll be the better for it!"]="继续，杀了他们吧！我会变得更强大！"
G["Go on, open it. I think you'll like it."]="来吧，打开它。我想你会喜欢的。"
G["Go on, please."]="请继续。"
G["Go on, then. Weep over the body of your precious tauren... though I assure you that your tears will not bring him back."]="去吧，扑倒在你们敬爱的牛头人身上尽情哭泣吧……但我保证你们的眼泪救不了他。"
G["Go on, you're free.  Get out of here!"]="走吧，你自由了。快离开这儿！"
G["Go on."]="继续讲呀。"
G["Go play under a wagon, peon!"]="去马车底下玩吧，倒霉蛋！"
G["Go quickly, $n, bring an end to Garrosh. And remember, the Earthmother's eyes are upon you."]="快去吧，$n，去干掉加尔鲁什。记住，大地母亲在关注着你。"
G["Go report that the outpost is taken.  We will remain here."]="去汇报说我们的前哨沦陷了。我们要留下。"
G["Go see Una at Thunder Bluff Armorers then.  It can be found on the middle rise."]="去雷霆崖中部高地的雷霆崖防具店找犹纳吧。"
G["Go suck on a trident."]="去舔你的三头叉吧。"
G["Go swiftly, $n. My fate is in your hands."]="赶快去，$n。我的命运掌握在你手中。"
G["Go tell them to hurry!"]="去告诉他们快一点！"
G["Go to Ironforge's Mystic Ward and speak with the night elf druids there. They can transport you to Moonglade to join in the Lunar Festival celebration."]="去铁炉堡的秘法区和那里的暗夜精灵德鲁伊谈谈吧，他们可以把你传送到月光林地去参加春节庆典。"
G["Go to Kodohide Leatherworkers in The Drag. Ask for Karolek."]="到暗巷区的科多兽皮工店那里去。问问卡洛雷克。"
G["Go to Orgrimmar, you will find her and her brood in the Valley of Honor."]="到奥格瑞玛去，你可以在荣誉谷找到她和她的家人。"
G["Go to Stars' Rest in Dragonblight and you will find Elder Morthie."]="你可以到龙骨荒野的群星之墓去找长者墨尔希。"
G["Go to de old village, across de water. Take it back. I'll help ya den."]="穿越水面，到那个村庄去，夺回它。我将帮助你。"
G["Go to inner ring of War Quarter.  Brom Killian there."]="到军事区的内环去。布罗姆·基里安在那里。"
G["Go to inner ring of War Quarter.  You find jewel-making people there."]="去军事区内环。你会在那里找到珠宝加工匠人。"
G["Go to the Freewind Post in Thousand Needles and you will find Elder Skyseer."]="星眼长者在千针石林的乱风岗。"
G["Go to the Great Forge at the very center of Ironforge. He works there, alongside the other Masters of our kind."]="大煅炉在铁炉堡的最中心。他就在那里和其他的铸造大师一起工作。"
G["Go to the Hall of the Brave.  You will find The Defiler, Deze Snowbane there to assist you in getting to Arathi Basin."]="去勇者大厅找污染者迪兹·斯诺班，他会帮助你进入阿拉希盆地的。"
G["Go to the Hunter Rise. You will find the battlemasters there."]="去猎人高地吧，你可以在那里找到战场军官。"
G["Go to the Hunter's Hall in the Valley of Honor, west of the Coliseum.  Talk to Ormak Grimshot there."]="到荣誉谷的猎人大厅去，它就位于就在大剧场的西边。与那里的奥玛克谈谈。"
G["Go to the Magic Quarter and head to the inner ring. The tailor's there."]="先到魔法区，然后朝内环区域走，裁缝店就在那里。"
G["Go to the Orc city of Orgrimmar, find him in the Valley of Honor at a shop called the Arms of Legend."]="到兽人城市奥格瑞玛去，他就在荣誉谷的“传说中的装备”那家店里。"
G["Go to the Shady Rest Inn and follow the tracks. See where they lead and report back to me."]="去树荫旅店，然后沿着足迹追踪。看看它们是到哪里去的，然后回来向我报告。"
G["Go to the Valley of Honor and seek out Xon'cha near the stables."]="到荣誉山谷去并在马厩附近找到克苏卡。"
G["Go to the Valley of Strength and look for the Bank of Orgrimmar to the south of the Sky Tower."]="到力量谷去，在飞行塔的南面就是奥格瑞玛银行。"
G["Go to the center of the temple and use the Horn of Elemental Fury!"]="进入神庙中心，使用元素愤怒号角！"
G["Go to the outer ring of the Rogues' Quarter if you want to find rogues."]="你可以在盗贼区外环区域找到那些潜行者。"
G["Go water my Huge Melons, further down the path!"]="去给我巨大的甜瓜浇水，沿着这条路往下再就是！"
G["Go with caution.  Hellscream has been assembling an arsenal down there - goblin mercenaries, pandaren artifacts, and some sort of darkness I can feel in my very soul."]="小心点。地狱咆哮把下面变成了一座兵工厂——里面有地精佣兵，熊猫人神器，我感觉到，还有某种黑暗存在。"
G["Go with grace, and may the Lady's magic protect you."]="一路顺风，愿吉安娜女士的魔法保护你。"
G["Go with honor, General."]="荣誉与你同在，将军。"
G["Go with speed... <cough cough> Find... <cough> Ryedol..."]="Ve rápido... <cof cof>Encuentra... <cof>a Ryedol..."
G["Go with the Light, friend."]="愿圣光与你同行，朋友。"
G["Go with the Light, orc."]="Ve con la Luz, orc$go:a;."
G["Go with the Light."]="圣光与你同在。"
G["Go wreck those Horde!"]="好好教训那些部落！"
G["Go!"]="走！"
G["Go!  Go and take our land! When all belongs to the quilboar, we will be delivered, and Agamaggan will rise again!"]="走！去夺回我们的土地！当野猪人得到了一切，我们也将得到我们所要的。阿迦玛甘将再次崛起！"
G["Go! GO, you lazy worms!"]="快点！快点！你们这群懒虫！"
G["Go! Get to safety!"]="快跑！到安全的地方去！"
G["Go! Go! You can take him!"]="加油！加油！你能搞定他！"
G["Go'el - the one you call Thrall - his spirit has been scattered across the elemental planes.\n\nThe Twilight's Hammer thinks to shake our will... but we shall not weaken. We will not forsake Go'el.\n\nHe has risked everything to save this world, and we'll do no less for him!"]="古伊尔——你们叫他萨尔——他的灵魂四散到了各个元素位面。\n\n暮光之锤以为这样就能动摇我们的意志……但我们不会退缩。我们不会放弃古伊尔。\n\n他赌上了他的一切来拯救这个世界，而我们也会为他做同样的事情！"
G["Go'el!"]="古伊尔！"
G["Go'el! Go'el, you must stop! Your anger is JUST - but it will only consume you! Fight it down, or we're ALL LOST!"]="古伊尔！古伊尔，你必须停下来！你的愤怒是正确的，但它会吞噬你！压抑它，否则我们都会失败！"
G["Go'el! NO!"]="古伊尔！不！"
G["Go'el, I thought I'd lost you..."]="古伊尔，我以为我要失去你了……"
G["Go'el, it's me - Aggra! Don't you know me?"]="古伊尔，是我——阿格娜！你不认得我了？"
G["Go'el.  You cannot continue to ride the line between Warchief and Shaman.  The time will come when you must commit to one side fully.  That time is fast approaching."]="古伊尔。你不能继续在酋长与萨满这两种身份间徘徊。总有一天，你必须让自己做出选择。这一天很快就会到来。"
G["Go'el. You are Go'el, son of Durotan - rightful chieftain of the Frostwolves. This day, grandson - you are the great joy of my heart."]="古伊尔。你是古伊尔，杜隆坦之子——真正的霜狼氏族的酋长。今天，我的孙儿——你是我心中最大的欢乐。"
G["Go, $n, into Arathi Basin! Slay, SLAY, as you've never slain before!"]="去吧，$n，去阿拉希盆地勇敢地战斗吧！"
G["Go, Reginald. May the light guide your hand."]="去吧，雷吉纳德。愿光明指引着你。"
G["Go, go, go!"]="快快快！"
G["Go, go, go! Get on that teleporter. Got lotsa customers today, so hurry it up!"]="走走走！到那个传送器上去。今天的客人很多，所以请你快一点！"
G["Go, hurry! You must stop the siege!"]="快去，快！你必须阻止攻城！"
G["Go, little one! Fight them! KILL THEM!"]="快，小东西！攻击他们！杀了他们！"
G["Go, my naga! Welcome the mighty Tidehunter to Azeroth!"]="去吧，我的纳迦！迎接强大的猎潮者来到艾泽拉斯。"
G["Go, my servant.  Send word of Stonetalon to Apothecary Zamah."]="去吧，我的仆人。把石爪山的消息带给药剂师扎玛。"
G["Go, my strikers. Ride out and take Zim'Torga back!"]="骑兵连，出发！夺回希姆托加！"
G["Go, speak to Vol'jin. Prepare yourself. From here on out, we be askin' more of you den ever before."]="去吧，去跟沃金谈谈。你要做好准备。从现在起，我们对你的要求会比过去更高。"
G["Go, stand by your wife's side. I will protect the tent from invaders."]="去，到你妻子身边去。我来保护帐篷，抵御入侵者。"
G["Go, you little wretches!  Show these fools that our Master is not to be trifled with!"]="去吧，你们这些可怜虫！让那些蠢货们知道藐视主人的下场！"
G["Go."]="走吧。"
G["Goat"]="山羊"
G["Goat goat gonna crush wikkets!"]="山羊山羊，踏碎蠢蛋！"
G["Gob Squad reporting."]="地精小队报告。"
G["Gob Squad, defend yourselves!"]="地精小队，保护自己！"
G["Gobber grunts his good-byes."]="大胖哼哼着道了别。"
G["Gobber, I need to look in my pack."]="大胖，我要在我背包里找找。"
G["Gobin ookum ta z'mbee!"]="地精去死！"
G["Goblin Gumbo Kettle"]="地精杂烩煲"
G["Goblin Weather Machine - Prototype 01-B"]="地精天气制造机 - 原型机01-B"
G["Goblin bombs. They have one major weakness: Other Bombs. I'll be right back."]="地精炸弹。它们有一个最大的弱点：其他炸弹。我稍后回来。"
G["Goblin grenades versus gnomish land mines. Show them who's better, $n!"]="地精手榴弹对地精陆战地雷。让他们看看谁更强，$n！"
G["Goblin technology is strange and deadly. I approve!"]="地精技术真是奇异而又可怕。我赞同！"
G["Goblin zombies? Goblin zombies! Wreck those pygmies, $n!"]="地精僵尸？地精僵尸！$n，去消灭那些俾格米人！"
G["Goblin zombies? Goblin zombies! Wreck those pygmies, $n!\n\nNeed any training before you go?"]="¿Goblins zombis? ¡Goblins zombis! ¡Destroza a esos pigmeos, $n!\n\n¿Necesitas instrucción antes de que vayas?"
G["Goblin zombies? The Town-In-A-Box has to be warned!"]="地精僵尸？一定要警告胶囊镇！"
G["Goblin zombies?! What's next... the volcano exploding?"]="地精僵尸？！接下来是什么……火山喷发？"
G["Goblin! Status report!"]="地精！进度报告！"
G["Goblin, find my axe! I'll separate this fool human's head from his neck!"]="地精，我的斧子呢！我要把这人类傻瓜的脑袋砍下来！"
G["Goblin-like typing detected, unlocking cache of riches and treasures."]="发现地精类生命体，正在解锁财宝室。"
G["Goblin: Land ho!"]="地精：陆地！"
G["Goblins sure do love their bombs. Let's go ahead and show them how a gnome makes a bomb. I'll be right back."]="地精显然很爱炸弹。我们继续前进，让他们看看侏儒是怎么造炸弹的吧。我稍后回来。"
G["Goblins with gills!"]="有鳃的地精！"
G["Godan's Runeworks is where you'll go.  Look for it on the west end of The Drag, right next to the Valley of Wisdom."]="古丹的符文工艺店就是你要去的地方。到暗巷区的西端可以找到，就在智慧谷的旁边。"
G["Goddess bless you."]="女神祝福了你。"
G["Goddess watch over you."]="女神护佑着你。"
G["Goddess, grant me the power to overcome my enemies! Hear me, please, my need is desperate and my cause is just!"]="女神啊，赐予我战胜敌人的力量吧！女神啊，请听我说，我现在要拼死一搏了，我所做的一切都是为了正义！"
G["Godfrey spent his life defending Gilneas. When the worgen curse spread across Gilneas he turned his attention towards thwarting the worgen assault."]="高弗雷毕生致力于守卫吉尔尼斯。当狼人诅咒在吉尔尼斯传播的时候，他将主要精力转向防御狼人的进攻。"
G["Godfrey will be our ace in the hole. With his knowledge of Gilneas and of the worgen, we cannot fail."]="高弗雷将成为我们的秘密王牌。依靠他对吉尔尼斯和狼人的知识，我们必将取得胜利。"
G["Godfrey? So the rumors are true."]="高弗雷？那么，那些传闻是真的了？"
G["Gods and Monsters."]="神祗与妖魔。"
G["Gods of old, we beseech you. What must we do? How can we save the gods of this land?"]="上古之神，我们乞求你的帮助。我们应该怎么做，才能拯救这片土地的神灵？"
G["Gods of shadow, lords of twilight ... give me strength!"]="暗影诸神，暮光的君主们……赐予我力量吧！"
G["Gods of terror, quake and thunder, tear these mortal bonds asunder!"]="恐怖之神，雷霆地震，撕裂生灵，威慑凡尘！"
G["Godspeed, $c!"]="万事平安，$c！"
G["Godspeed, heroes. It will be an honor to fight alongside you in battle."]="祝你们好运，英雄们。很荣幸能和你们并肩战斗。"
G["Godspeed."]="祝你成功。"
G["Going ashore, $n?\n\nSay the word and I'll lower a boat for you."]="¿Hora de desembarcar, $n?\n\nDilo y echaré al agua un bote para ti."
G["Going down?"]="下去？"
G["Going my way?"]="跟我走吗？"
G["Going so soon? What about the customers?"]="这么快就要走了吗？客人怎么办？"
G["Going somewhere?"]="要到哪里去？"
G["Going to Kun-Lai? Hop in the boat and I'll give you a ride."]="要去昆莱？跳到船上来，我载你一程。"
G["Going to be around for a while, $n?"]="你打算回来转一转吗，$n？"
G["Going to be around long, $n? You'll have to tell me about your latest exploits."]="要在这里待上一阵子吗，$n？你一定给我讲讲你最近的壮举哦。"
G["Going to go take a nap? I apologize in advance for accidentally stepping on your face while you sleep."]="你要打个盹？那我先给你倒个歉吧，待会你睡着之后，我可能会不小心踩到你的脸。"
G["Going up."]="上去了。"
G["Going... up?"]="正在……上升？"
G["Gokku-lai!"]="¡Gokku-lai!"
G["Gol'Kosh!"]="以斧之名！"
G["Gol-Crawdad!?"]="是龙虾！？"
G["Golden Dragon Noodles! The very BEST!"]="金龙面！最好吃的面！"
G["Golden Lotus"]="金莲教"
G["Golden Pig"]="金猪"
G["Goldrinn is the wolf ancient, known as \"Lo'Gosh\" in the Horde tongue. His tenacity is legendary.\n\nA shrine dedicated to him is in a basin west of the World Tree, but its keepers have fallen silent in the wake of the attack. I fear the worst.\n\nBefore we can move on, you must save the shrine, discover the whereabouts of the wolf ancient, and beat back his foes."]="Goldrinn es el ancestro lobo, al que se conoce como \"Lo'Gosh\" en la lengua de la Horda. Su tenacidad es legendaria.\n\nHay un santuario dedicado a él en una cuenca al oeste del Árbol del Mundo, pero no hemos sabido de sus guardianes desde el ataque. Me temo lo peor.\n\nAntes de que podamos proseguir, debes salvar el santuario, descubrir el paradero del ancestro lobo y rechazar a sus enemigos."
G["Goldrinn!  It's true then... the Ancients walk among us again!"]="戈德林！看来是真的……远古之神又再次出现在我们身边！"
G["Goldrinn's tenacity is the stuff of legend.\n\nWarriors from all walks visit this shrine in hopes of tapping into that kind of battle prowess."]="戈德林的坚韧战力充满着传奇色彩。\n\n各地的战士都纷纷到访这座圣殿，祈求能像戈德林那样勇猛卓绝。"
G["Goldshire's inn advertises a lakeside view..."]="闪金镇旅店为他们的湖畔景观房做广告……"
G["Goldskimmer, are you ready to run with it?"]="金筛，你准备好出发了吗？"
G["Golem movement appears to be within the specifications."]="傀儡的行动看上去很正常。"
G["Golem. Command. Operational status report."]="傀儡。命令。报告运作状态。"
G["Golganneth, lend me your strength! Grant my mortal allies the power of thunder!"]="高戈奈斯，将您的威能赐予我！让我的战友们获得雷霆的力量！"
G["Goliath online."]="歌利亚已启动。"
G["Gone to Halfhill Market. Don't touch my vegetables!\n- Farmer Fung"]="He ido al Mercado del Alcor. ¡No toques mis verduras!\n\n- Granjero Fung"
G["Gone to the market. For official Tiller's Union business, please find me at Halfhill Market. Otherwise, Mung-Mung can take care of any needs.\n- Haohan Mudclaw"]="He ido al mercado. Para cuestiones oficiales del gremio de labradores, búscame en el Mercado del Alcor. Para cualquier otra cuestión, Mung-Mung te atenderá en lo que necesites.\n\n- Haohan Zarpa Fangosa"
G["Gong Da, deal with these flies while I take this - Lin, was it? - back to Osul Mesa."]="贡达，把这些苍蝇都解决掉，我来把这个——林，是吧？——带回奥苏尔台地。"
G["Gonna bash you into pretty flower food!"]="我要把你剁成一堆肉泥！"
G["Gonna blasts you to chunkies!"]="我要揍扁你！"
G["Gonna boom wikkets up the boom boom!"]="把蠢蛋炸上天！"
G["Gonna hit you in the wikket!"]="我要打烂你的脸！"
G["Gonna make a guild, are ya? Good luck to ya then!\nTalk to Aldwin Laughlin in the Stormwind Vistor's Center. It's in the Trade District right as you come in from the Valley of Heroes."]="¿Que vas a crear tu hermandad? Entonces, ¡buena suerte!\n\nVe a ver a Aldwin Risante en el Centro del Viajero de Ventormenta. Está en el Distrito de Mercaderes, que está justo al entrar desde el Valle de los Héroes."
G["Gonna need more boats soon."]="我们很快就会用到更多的船只了。"
G["Gonna ook you!"]="我要干掉你！"
G["Gonna set wikkets up the boom boom!"]="我要用轰轰炸飞蠢蛋！"
G["Gonna set wikkets up the boom boom! AGAIN!"]="我还要用轰轰炸飞蠢蛋！"
G["Gonna spins around!"]="天旋地转！"
G["Goob and friend did good!"]="古布和伙计们干得好！"
G["Goob help!"]="古布来帮忙了！"
G["Good Morning!"]="早上好！"
G["Good as nibby new! But listen to the Monkey King. You only have enough ointment for one true swing."]="就和新的一样！听好美猴王说的话。你的药膏只够敲一次钟。"
G["Good blades, solid axes. I have nothing left to teach you in the making of weapons $n. Take your pride and courage before Kelgruk Bloodaxe, he will forge them into the skills you will need."]="多么锋利的刀刃啊，这绝对是一把精品战斧。$n，在武器锻造方面我已经没有什么可以教你的了。去向克尔格鲁克·血斧展示你的勇气和荣耀吧，他会帮你将这些融入你的技巧中，使你获得更大的提升。"
G["Good bonk, Miss Fanny! You got nice control!"]="打得好，范妮小姐！你控制得很好！"
G["Good boy!"]="好孩子！"
G["Good boy! Now put it back on the bone pile."]="干得好！现在把它放在上面。"
G["Good bye, $p! Thank you!"]="再见，$p！谢谢你！"
G["Good bye, Goldshire. I'll be back soon enough-- perhaps a week's time."]="再见了，闪金镇。我很快就会回来的——也许就只要一个星期。"
G["Good call."]="说得对。"
G["Good day citizen.  How may I assist you?"]="Buenos días, $gciudadano:ciuidadana;. ¿Cómo puedo ayudarte?"
G["Good day to ye $g lad : lass;. Can I be of service?"]="你好，$g小伙子:姑娘;。我可以帮你什么忙吗？"
G["Good day to you Nogg! I require training."]="你好，诺格！我需要接受训练。"
G["Good day to you both. I would speak to Lord Lescovar."]="你们好。我要找莱斯科瓦公爵谈谈。"
G["Good day to you!"]="你好啊！"
G["Good day to you, $c.\n\nI'm waiting to hear from one of the High Thane's advisors about an audience. It was a struggle just to get the opportunity to present my credentials.\n\nI've heard the Wildhammer described as 'wary of outsiders,' but that's proven to be quite an understatement.  Hopefully, things will improve once I've had the opportunity to meet with Featherbeard, whom I'm told favors closer ties with the Alliance."]="Buen día tengas, $c.\n\nEstoy esperando oír de uno de los consejeros de los Altos Señores feudales acerca de una audiencia. Fue una auténtica lucha solo el poder tener una oportunidad de presentar mis credenciales.\n\nHe oído describir al Martillo Salvaje como \"cauteloso con los forasteros\", pero se ha demostrado que eso es un eufemismo. Con algo de suerte las cosas mejorarán cuando tenga la oportunidad de reunirme con Barbapluma, quien, según me han dicho, aprueba un vínculo más estrecho con la Alianza."
G["Good day to you, $c.\n\nThere's much to be done to assist in the effort here. Sadly, there's very little I can do for you until I get all of my supplies.\n\nI've now got $3223w percent of the razorthorn roots I need to get started. Any assistance you provide will be well worth the effort, I assure you."]="Buenos días, $c.\n\nHay mucho que hacer para ayudar aquí. Por desgracia, no puedo hacer mucho por ti hasta que consiga todos mis suministros.\n\nPor ahora tengo el $3223w % de las raíces de Rajaespina que necesito para empezar. Te aseguro que cualquier ayuda que me puedas prestar merecerá la pena."
G["Good day to you, $r."]="你好啊，$r。"
G["Good day to you, Hogral! I seek training."]="霍格拉尔，你好！我要接受训练。"
G["Good day to you, Syurna. I am in need of training."]="塞尤娜，你好。我要需要接受训练。"
G["Good day to you."]="你好。"
G["Good day to you.  When you've risen a bit more in the ranks of the Sha'tari Skyguard, I will be able offer you a direct flight to the Skyguard Outpost, our base atop the Blade's Edge Mountains."]="你好。如果你在沙塔尔天空卫队的声望再提升一点，我就为你开通前往刀锋山天空卫队哨站的直达航线。"
G["Good day! Need some screws tightened or some bolts loosened? You've come to the right place."]="你好！需要拧紧螺丝或者松开栓钉吗？你可是来对地方了。"
G["Good day, $c. Are you in need of a reliable hippogryph?"]="早上好，$c。你需要可靠的角鹰兽吗？"
G["Good day, $c. If you wish to learn the smith's art, you've come to the right place."]="你好，$c。如果你想学习铁匠技术的话，我想你来对了地方。"
G["Good day, $c. What would you like?"]="你好，$c。你想要什么？"
G["Good day, $g brave: fair; $c.  How can I be of service?"]="你好，$g勇敢的:美丽的;$c。我能为你做些什么？"
G["Good day, $gsir:ma'am;. I'd shake your hand, but as you see, I'm in the middle of something. May I be of assistance?"]="你好，$g先生:女士;。我想握你的手，但是如你所见，我正忙着做事。我可以帮忙吗？"
G["Good day, $gsir:madam;!  How may I be of assistance?"]="你好，$g先生:女士;！我能为你做些什么？"
G["Good day, $n.  If you require my services as an auctioneer, I regret to inform you: no.  Only grand master engineers possess the minimum intellectual capacity to interface with my superior functions.\n\nMore importantly, why are you still talking to me?"]="Buenos días, $n. Si necesitas mis servicios como subastador, siento informarte de que no. Solo los grandes maestros ingenieros poseen la capacidad intelectual mínima para interactuar con mis funciones superiores.\n\nLo que es aún más importante, ¿por qué sigues hablándome?"
G["Good day, $r."]="日安，$r。"
G["Good day, Benjamin! Would you mind if I took an apple for Bessy?"]="你好，本杰明！我拿个苹果给贝希吃，你不介意吧？"
G["Good day, Corbett.  Here's your cheese, fresh made this morning!  And how are things at your shop?"]="你好，科贝特。这是今天早上刚做好的奶酪！你的商店生意还好么？"
G["Good day, Elling!  Hullo Elaine!  Let me have a wheel of bleu cheese, eh?"]="你好，埃林！你好啊，艾莱尼！我要来点奶酪。"
G["Good day, Hulfdan, I am looking for training."]="霍夫丹，你好，我要接受训练。"
G["Good day, Ros'eleth. Is my, err, um... uh, my 'headgear' finished?"]="你好啊，洛瑟蕾丝。我的那个，那个……我的“头盔”完成了吗？"
G["Good day, friend."]="你好啊，朋友。"
G["Good day, sir!"]="日安，长官！"
G["Good day."]="你好啊。"
G["Good deal. Welcome to the spirit world. Kinda. Let's check out the chests for any goodies, and see if you can find my body somewhere!"]="成交。欢迎来到灵魂世界。从某种程度来说这里也算是啦。让我们翻翻这些箱子，看看你能不能找到我的身体吧！"
G["Good enough! Now go water my Giant Carrots!"]="干得不错！现在去给我巨大的胡萝卜浇水！"
G["Good evening ladies and gentlemen, welcome to this evening's presentation!"]="女士们，先生们，晚上好！欢迎观看今晚的演出！"
G["Good evening."]="晚上好。"
G["Good fight!"]="打得好！"
G["Good fight."]="好功夫。"
G["Good fight. I'll get you next time."]="好功夫。下次我再找你单练。"
G["Good fighting, friend!"]="打得好，朋友！"
G["Good for nothing Kobolds!"]="毫无价值的废物！"
G["Good for you, $c!  Our battlemaster, Thelman Slatefist, can be found in the war room inside Stormwind Keep.  He will help you get to Alterac Valley."]="很好，$c！你可以去暴风要塞的皇家觐见室找军官塞尔曼·岩拳。他会帮助你前往奥特兰克山谷。"
G["Good for you. Good for all of you to go on living your lives knowing you can never have the wealth that I do. I'm proud of you for sticking it out."]="你们真不简单。明知道永远不可能拥有与我等同的财富，却还能勇敢地继续自己的人生，这真是太难得了。我为你们坚持不懈的精神而感到骄傲。"
G["Good form is the key to defeating your enemies. Don't swing wildly with your weapon. Be disciplined with your attacks."]="正确的战斗姿态是打败敌人的关键所在。不要疯狂挥舞你的武器。进攻要有章法。"
G["Good fortune to drink coffee before a hike. Bad fortune to drink after."]="在远足之前喝上一杯咖啡会交好运。远足之后喝就是厄运了。"
G["Good fortune to friend of grummles!"]="愿土地精的朋友一路好运！"
G["Good fortune to friend of grummles. Many thanks for aid!"]="祝土地精的朋友好运。非常感谢你的帮助！"
G["Good fortune to you!"]="祝你好运！"
G["Good fortune to you, $r. Here you will find representatives from all the factions of Pandaria. When you have had a little more experience under your belt, come back and speak to us. Great adventures and great rewards await."]="祝你好运，$r。你在这里能找到潘达利亚所有阵营的代表。当你经验再丰富些时，就回来与我们交谈吧。伟大的冒险和丰厚的奖励在等着你。"
G["Good friend, is things going good for you?"]="$gBuen amigo:Buena amiga;, ¿todas tus kosas va bien?"
G["Good girl, Bessy!"]="很好，贝希！"
G["Good girl, Ruby!"]="露比，好女孩！"
G["Good girl, good girl. You just say right here and eat."]="好孩子，好孩子。你在这里乖乖的吃吧。"
G["Good home. Had it long time, still stay good."]="美好的家。住了很长时间，依然不会厌倦。"
G["Good hunting out there, $c!"]="祝你狩猎愉快，$c！"
G["Good hunting up there, $n!"]="你干得不错，$n！"
G["Good hunting, $n!"]="¡Buena caza, $c!"
G["Good idea!"]="好主意！"
G["Good idea! Let's ookin' get it on!"]="好主意！让我们打个痛快！"
G["Good idea. I'll scout that area up ahead."]="好主意。我去侦察前面那片区域。"
G["Good job making it out in time.  We recovered a key that should work on one of these troves.  It's all yours."]="干得好，时间刚刚好。我们发现了一把钥匙，应该能打开其中一个箱子。现在它归你了。"
G["Good job you two.  Now go have a seat."]="干得好。现在请坐吧。"
G["Good job!"]="干得好！"
G["Good job! Keep your eyes open, now."]="干得好！集中精神。"
G["Good job, $n! Isn't this all very exciting? I wonder what the next island will be like?"]="干得好，$n！这是不是很令人兴奋？我很想知道，下一座岛会是什么样？"
G["Good job, $n! Isn't this all very exciting? I wonder what the next island will be like?\n\nCan I teach you anything new?"]="¡Buen trabajo, $n! ¿No te parece emocionante? Me pregunto cómo será la siguiente isla.\n\n¿Puedo enseñarte algo nuevo?"
G["Good job. Guess you learned a little something from me."]="哈哈，干得好。看来你从我这儿学到了一招半式。"
G["Good leather in the marshes, if you've the guts for it. Lots of crocolisks. Thinkin' my brother and I'll stay a while.\nSomethin' I can help you with?"]="Hay buenas pieles en los pantanos, si tienes las agallas para conseguirlas. Montones de crocoliscos. Creo que mi hermano y yo nos quedaremos una temporada.\n\n¿Puedo ayudarte con algo?"
G["Good lord! Manservants, aid your master!!"]="我的天！仆人们，帮帮你们的主人！！"
G["Good luck $r!"]="祝你好运，$r！"
G["Good luck out there, $n!"]="祝你好运，$n！"
G["Good luck out there, $n."]="祝你好运，$n。"
G["Good luck out there."]="运气真不错。"
G["Good luck stranger, and welcome to Shattrath City."]="Suerte, $gextranjero:extranjera; y $gbienvenido:bienvenida; a Shattrath."
G["Good luck to you friend!"]="祝你的朋友好运！"
G["Good luck to you in there. I'll try to find you farther inside once the concourse is clear."]="祝你好运。等广场清理干净后，我就到里面去跟你会合。"
G["Good luck to you too, $n."]="也祝你好运，$n。"
G["Good luck to you!"]="祝你好运！"
G["Good luck to you, $n. And don't forget... get that script before finding Gazin."]="祝你好运，$n。不要忘记……找到手稿之后就去找贾森。"
G["Good luck to you, friend!"]="祝你好运，朋友！"
G["Good luck to you. I'm grateful."]="祝你好运。我很感激。"
G["Good luck with Arugal. I must hurry back to Hadrec now."]="希望你能解决掉阿鲁高。我必须赶快回到哈德瑞克那里。"
G["Good luck with your interrogation."]="希望你的审问能有个好结果。"
G["Good luck!"]="祝你好运！"
G["Good luck, $n!"]="祝你好运，$n！"
G["Good luck, $n."]="祝你好运，$n。"
G["Good luck, $n. And remember, find Muiredon once you've accomplished the task."]="祝你好运，$n。记住，完成任务之后就去找穆里顿。"
G["Good luck, Ace!"]="祝你好运，王牌飞行员！"
G["Good luck, and be safe. Here comes Uther and Jaina now."]="祝你好运，千万当心。瞧，乌瑟尔和吉安娜来了。"
G["Good luck, friends. Once we find the Hidden Master, we can continue our training."]="祝你们好运，朋友们。一旦找到隐秘大师，我们就可以继续训练了。"
G["Good luck, heroes!"]="祝你们好运，英雄们！"
G["Good luck."]="祝你好运。"
G["Good luck. I hope you find that bell."]="祝你好运。我希望你能够找到那口钟。"
G["Good luck. Sorry I can't take you with me!"]="祝你好运。很抱歉我不能和你一起去！"
G["Good luck...  You'll need it!"]="祝你好运……你需要的就是运气了！"
G["Good move. It worked out well for me."]="好身手。这招对我特别管用。"
G["Good news about Mogujia, $n?"]="有什么关于魔古岬的好消息吗，$n？"
G["Good news, everyone! I think I've perfected a plague that will destroy all life on Azeroth!"]="喜讯，各位！我想我已经研制出一种能够毁灭艾泽拉斯的药剂了！"
G["Good news, everyone! I've fixed the poison slime pipes!"]="好消息！各位！我修好了毒性软泥管道！"
G["Good night, gents. Sleep well."]="晚安，兄弟们。睡个好觉。"
G["Good night, my friends. Until tomorrow."]="晚安，我的朋友。明天见。"
G["Good night..."]="晚安……"
G["Good of you to come, champion! The beast almost had me!"]="¡Me alegro de que hayas venido, $gcampeón:campeona;! ¡La bestia casi me había atrapado!"
G["Good ol' Erma, she's been taking care of the local animals for years now.  I'm sure she'd be happy to take care of any you'd like to put up.  She can be found right outside of the Lion's Pride Inn."]="好心的旅店老板艾玛，她现在已经照顾当地的动物好些年了。我敢肯定她会很高兴照顾你给的任何动物。你可以在狮王之傲旅店的外面找到她。"
G["Good ol' Thamner bandaged me up just the other day when I had a run in with a nasty trogg.  I'm good as new I tell ye!  I'm sure Thamner would be happy to show ye how to make a good bandage."]="好心的萨姆诺前些天在我与一个肮脏的穴居人战斗后替我包扎了伤口。我现在已经完全痊愈了！我敢肯定萨姆诺会很高兴教你制作绷带的。"
G["Good one! It not even see it coming."]="干得好！它一点也没有察觉。"
G["Good one, sister.  What about your pet?  Where is $n?"]="明智的判断？你的宠物呢？$n在哪儿？"
G["Good people of Goldshire, come take advantage of my incredible prices on rare goods. I shall not return for some time!"]="闪金镇的父老乡亲们，过来看看我这些价廉物美的好东西吧。我可能会有一段时间不再回来了！"
G["Good question, $c. Last I was informed; we have managed to collect $1997w copper bars out of $1998w needed. Additionally, I am told that we have $2002w iron bars out of $2003w, and $2011w out of $2012w thorium bars requested."]="问得好，$c。我得到的最新消息称我们已经收集到$1997w块铜锭、$2002w块铁锭和$2011w块瑟银锭了，总的需求量分别是$1998w、$2003w和$2012w。"
G["Good question, $r. In my younger days I was footloose and fancy free without a care in the world. In those days I would sing in a barber shop quartet out of Stormwind known as the Four Dons. That's where I learned how to craft the Bonescythe digs."]="这个问题问得好，$r。年轻的时候，我是个自由自在玩世不恭的人，从来没有关心过这个世界的命运。那时候，我在暴风城那边唱歌，参加了一个叫“劈头四”的四重唱组合。我也是在那里学会制作骨镰护甲的。"
G["Good question. You'd hafta ask my brother Turgore that one.\n\nMaybe you can get an answer out of that lazy, no good... oohh. Don't get me started."]="问得好。你不妨找我的兄弟图高尔谈谈。\n\n那个懒惰的坏家伙或许会告诉你答案……别让我打开话匣子。"
G["Good riddance!"]="很好！"
G["Good riddance, you overblown, halfbaked, bomb ignition wannabe! See if I ever summon YOU again!"]="终于摆脱了，你这个狂妄的，被烤熟的，痴迷爆炸的纵火狂！看我还会不会再召唤你！"
G["Good riddance."]="终于除掉了祸根。"
G["Good riddance... now none shall be able to repeat my mistakes!"]="谢天谢地……现在没有人会重复我的错误了！"
G["Good seein' you again, $n.  I hope our club be treatin' ya right."]="我们又见面啦，$n。希望你能喜欢我们的俱乐部。"
G["Good shooting! That one won't be getting up anytime soon."]="打得不错！那家伙短时间内是起不来了。"
G["Good shot!"]="好准！"
G["Good shot, $p! Keep aiming for those bombs."]="打得好，$p！继续瞄准那些炸弹！"
G["Good show!"]="漂亮！"
G["Good snowball fight!"]="这场雪仗打得真精彩！"
G["Good steel $n. Grab a hammer and come over here, let me show you the secret to forging a legendary weapon."]="$n，这些金属真不错。拿把铁锤过来，让我指导你如何锻造一把绝世的利器。"
G["Good sturdy dwarven construction. That oughta do some damage."]="非常结实的矮人建筑。它一定能大发神威。"
G["Good thing I don't mind waiting."]="很好，我也不介意多等一会儿。"
G["Good thing I don't really feel the cold."]="幸运的是，冰冷的死亡还没有真正降临。"
G["Good thing someone here has tracking!  Look for Shim'la in the Hunter's Hall in the Valley of Honor."]="幸运的是这里有人会使用跟踪！到荣誉谷的猎人大厅可以找到西姆拉。"
G["Good thing that we're surrounded by neighbors with excess machine parts."]="好消息是，我们周围都是有着多余机械部件的邻居。"
G["Good thing that you deactivated the moon crystal at An'owyn when you did, $c! Come around any time you feel like pitching in with my research here."]="你破坏了安欧维恩的月亮水晶，干得很好，$c！如果你对我的研究工作感兴趣的话，可以随时来找我。"
G["Good thing you brought us nine others.  I think I'll finish this later."]="你给我们带来了另外九个真是件好事。我想我一会就会完成这个的。"
G["Good things happen to us today."]="今天碰上好运气了。"
G["Good thinking, Little Lu. Go find out who lives here. Take Sully with you."]="好主意，小卢。去看看是谁住在那里。把苏利也带上。"
G["Good tidings, $c. I am Stillpine the Younger, heir to the throne of Stillpine."]="你好，$c。我是止松酋长，止松要塞的继承人。"
G["Good times! <hic!>"]="这美好的时光！<嗝！>"
G["Good timing - I was almost out."]="真及时——我差点就弹尽粮绝了。"
G["Good timing, Ricket. $n says they need your expertise on the Molten Front."]="你来的正好，莉吉特。$n说，熔火前线需要你的专业知识帮忙。"
G["Good timing, too. Here comes the assault's commander!"]="来得也正好。这位就是进攻指挥官！"
G["Good timing. Here they come again!"]="你们来得真及时。他们又过来了！"
G["Good tiny thing! You kill other tiny thing!"]="优秀的小东西！杀死另一个小东西！"
G["Good to be fighting again, don't you think?"]="浴血奋战的感觉真好，你觉得呢？"
G["Good to hear you got those farmers all squared away, chief. Now we gotta take care of some new business."]="听说你已经帮那些农夫全都摆脱了困境，真是太好了，头儿。现在我们要解决一些新问题了。"
G["Good to know they've still got our backs. Thanks!"]="他们仍在背后支持我们，这可真是个好消息。谢谢你！"
G["Good to see a $c on our side!"]="¡Es bueno ver a $gun:una; $c a nuestro lado!"
G["Good to see someone wanting to learn something useful. Head to Archibald on the inner ring of the War Quarter."]="很高兴有人愿意学点儿真正有用的东西。到军事区的内环区域去找阿基巴德吧。"
G["Good to see ya again!\n\nKing Stormheart has informed me that he will be taking his leave for a time... a grim memory brought back to him has left him with a score to settle it seems. He was very insistent that we not join him, so we have respected his wishes as we always do.\n\nI have taken responsibility for our clan in the meantime. You are still welcome with us, of course."]="很高兴再次见到你！\n\n雷心国王告诉我，说他会离开一段日子……他回忆起一些可怕的往事，决定算清这笔旧账。他坚持不让我们随行，按照惯例，我们也尊重他的决定。\n\n同时，我负责接管整个氏族。当然，你仍然是我们的贵客。"
G["Good to see you again adventurer.  Are you ready to begin?"]="很高兴再次见到你，冒险者。你做好出发的准备了吗？"
G["Good to see you again! Thanks for the hand. I'll be back on my feet in just a moment."]="真高兴能再见到你！感谢你的帮忙。我再过一会儿就能站起来了。"
G["Good to see you again, $g man! : gorgeous!; We work well together; $g see you around. : I hope we get to continue to do so.;"]="¡Me alegro de volver a verte, $gquerido:querida;! Formamos un buen equipo. Ya nos veremos."
G["Good to see you again, $n!"]="很高兴能再见到你，$n！"
G["Good to see you again, $n! Just a few more adjustments and the trajectory of the jump will be perfect!"]="很高兴再次见到你，$n！只要再调整下跳跃的轨道就完美了！"
G["Good to see you again, $n."]="很高兴又见到你了，$n。"
G["Good to see you again, $n.\n\nTake the laborers from camp here, and any others you can find in the region. Assist them in building defenses to ensure no Horde can escape our vengeance.\n\nOne more thing. These troops are not trained for battle and must be protected from harm if they are to succeed.\n\nNow go, and be quick about it. Time is running out!"]="很高兴再见到你，$n。\n\n带上这些劳工，召集你在这片区域能找到的所有人手，帮助他们建立防御工事，确保没有任何部落人员能够逃脱我们的复仇。\n\n另外，这些劳工没有受过作战训练，你要保护他们抵达。\n\n现在，快点动身吧。时间不多了！"
G["Good to see you again, $n. Feel like taking another swing at these yaungol pests?"]="很高兴再次见到你，$n。想再好好教训这群野牛人渣滓一顿吗？"
G["Good to see you again, $n. For a moment, I was worried that you wouldn't come.\n\nLet's finish this, shall we? The Scarlet Crusade has proven that it's not going to put an end to itself."]="很高兴再次见到你，$n。我还担心你不会来。\n\n让我们完成这个任务吧？血色十字军已经证明，它不会自行了结。"
G["Good to see you again, $n. I brought a friend with me. She really wanted to see you.\n\n<Kessel laughs.>"]="Me alegro de volver a verte, $n. He traído a una amiga conmigo. Ella tenía muchas ganas de verte.\n\n<Kessel se ríe.>"
G["Good to see you again, $n. I look forward to fighting by your side once more."]="真高兴又看到你了，$n。期待我们能再次并肩作战。"
G["Good to see you again, $n. We snuck some more of us in here while you were prepping the Gates for the attack.\n\nI'll show you where we're to rendezvous with Master Shaw.\n\n<The squad leader produces a map of the Twilight Citadel and points to the spot.>\n\nLet me know when you're ready, and we'll all head up together."]="Me alegro de verte de nuevo, $n. Hemos colado a unos cuantos más de los nuestros mientras estabas preparando las Puertas para el ataque.\n\nTe enseñaré dónde vamos a reunirnos con el maestro Shaw.\n\n<El líder de escuadrón saca un mapa de la Ciudadela Crepuscular y señala el lugar.>\n\nAvísame cuando estés $glisto:lista; y nos dirigiremos hacia allá juntos."
G["Good to see you again, $p.\n\nThis place is ancient. There are answers here, for those who know the questions."]="很高兴再次见到你，$p。\n\n这个地方十分古老。那些满怀问题的人，将在这里找到答案。"
G["Good to see you again, Amy. Be safe, luv. I'm off to Goldshire now."]="艾米，能再看到你真的很高兴。要小心，亲爱的。我现在要去闪金镇了。"
G["Good to see you again, friend. Make haste and hop on while the way is still clear."]="很高兴再次见到你，朋友。趁道路仍然畅通，赶紧上来吧。"
G["Good to see you again. Have we met?"]="很高兴再次见到你。我们见过吗？"
G["Good to see you still alive and kicking, $n. Don't think that I'd forgetten what you did for me in Stormwind, oh so long ago."]="$n，很高兴看到你还活着。还记得很久之前你在暴风城帮我做的事吗？真是记忆犹新啊。"
G["Good to see you still breathe, $n."]="很高兴看到你还活着，$n。"
G["Good to see you well, Rensai. We're here for Hawkmaster Nurong. Where can we find him?"]="看到你很高兴，任塞。我们是来这儿找鹰眼大师砮荣的。在哪儿能找到他？"
G["Good to see you, $c.\n\nSorry... can't talk. We're in a bit of a fight here."]="很高兴见到你，$c。\n\n抱歉……我不能和你长谈。我们这里还有一点战斗。"
G["Good to see you, $n!\n\nI just wanted to make sure that you appreciate all of the products that my genius has brought to the Kajaro Trading Company?\n\nThese include, but are not limited to: Kaja'Cola, the Poultryizer, Town-In-A-Box, my Ingenious Cap of Mook Foolery, KTC Train-a-Tron Deluxe, the Amazing G-Ray, Never-Deflating Pool Ponies, the Big Ones, Warrior-Matic NX-01, and gilgoblins. No strike that last one. Under advice of counsel, I had nothing to do with them.\n\nAnyway, I'm working on a few more things here that I think you'll find interesting, such as the Micro Mechachicken and a little something I like to call Subject Nine."]="¡Me alegro de verte, $n!\n\nSolo quiero asegurarme de que sabes apreciar todos los productos que mi ingenio ha proporcionado a la sociedad comercial de Kajaro.\n\nEsto incluye, la Kaja'Cola, el Pollotizador, la Ciudad de Bolsillo, el almete de estupidez de cateto ingenioso, el Entrenatrón Deluxe SCK, los rayos goblins alucinantes, los ponis flotadores que nunca se desinflan, los Grandes, la Guerreromática NX-01 y los gilgoblins. Aunque esto último no fue un gran éxito. Siguiendo el consejo de mi abogado, afirmo que no tuve nada que ver con ellos.\n\nSea como sea, estoy trabajando en algunas cosas más que creo que podrían interesarte, como el micromecapollo y algo que yo llamo el Sujeto Nueve."
G["Good to see you, $n! Do you have a minute?"]="很高兴见到你，$n！你有空吗？"
G["Good to see you, $n! My students and I came to try Brewmaster Boof's famous brew and to celebrate the brewmoon!"]="很高兴见到你，$n！我和我的学生来品尝酒仙布夫酿造的美酒，顺便庆祝酿月祭！"
G["Good to see you, $n."]="很高兴见到你，$n。"
G["Good to see you, $n.\n\nI trust everything is going according to plan?"]="很高兴见到你，$n。\n\n一切都在按照计划进行吧？"
G["Good to see you, friend."]="很高兴见到你，朋友。"
G["Good to see you."]="很高兴见到你。"
G["Good to see you. They're all throughout the tunnels, we'll have to stay on our guard."]="很高兴见到你。他们散布在这些隧道的每一个角落里。我们必须时刻保持警惕。"
G["Good to stay away from Kartak. He only a friend of Frenzyheart so long as we keep his belly full... and he's got a big belly."]="最好离卡塔克远点。他只会在吃饱喝足的时候将狂心狼獾人视为朋友……你要明白，他的胃口简直像个无底洞。"
G["Good will... prevail."]="正义终将……获胜。"
G["Good work Bwemba, you an' your friend, make da Darkspear proud."]="干得好，布温巴。你和你的朋友让暗矛巨魔感到骄傲。"
G["Good work Bwemba.  It be good to see dat dere be Alliance willin' to help stop da Zandalar."]="干得好，布温巴。联盟竟然愿意帮忙阻止赞达拉，这实在太好了。"
G["Good work in there, $n! Get on to the village over the bridge. I'm covering extraction for the marines."]="干得好啊，$n！过桥就能抵达村子了。我正在替那些陆战队员收拾烂摊子。"
G["Good work with the crates! Come talk to me in front of Stratholme for your next assignment!"]="干得漂亮！到斯坦索姆的大门去，我会交给你下一项任务！"
G["Good work with them constructs, $glad:lass;.\n\nYou just bought us unfettered access to the repository."]="干得好，$g小伙子:小姑娘;。\n\n你让通往储藏室的路变得畅通无阻。"
G["Good work!"]="干得好！"
G["Good work! Arthas now knows about the plagued grain in Stratholme, and is about to begin the culling.\n\nSomething is still not quite right, though. I sense a foreign presence in this timeline besides us, and that must mean the Infinite Dragonflight are here somewhere."]="¡Buen trabajo! Ahora Arthas está al corriente del grano apestado de Stratholme y está a punto de comenzar la matanza.\n\nPero algo no va bien. Siento una presencia extraña en esta línea temporal además de nosotros y eso debe de significar que el Vuelo Infinito anda por aquí."
G["Good work! Dealing with the Hozen will be easier than I had anticipated."]="干得好！这对付猢狲的办法比我预想中的还要简单。"
G["Good work! I'm glad to see some revenge taken on that traitor. Go ahead and take the path Miran did to the east and let Prospector Ironband know we're all set. I'm sure he'll have some work for you as well."]="干得好！那些叛徒终于得到了惩罚。这是一件大快人心的事情。沿着米兰走过的路向东方前进，让勘察员基恩萨·铁环知道我们的胜利。我相信，他也会有一些任务给你。"
G["Good work! Let Orseus know if we need to take another pass. Otherwise, I'll meet you in the grove!"]="干得好！如果我们还需要再来一次，就去告诉奥修斯。如果不需要了，我会在那片树林中等你！"
G["Good work! We're almost there! This way."]="干得好！我们差不多成功了！这边走。"
G["Good work! You�re quite a fighter."]="¡Buen trabajo! Luchas que da gusto."
G["Good work, $c. These blood elves are actively researching the mogu. It's clear that Garrosh is searching for artifacts of power, but we won't let him succeed."]="还不错，$c。血精灵在积极地研究魔古族。很明显，加尔鲁什在搜寻强大的神器，但我们不会让他们得逞。"
G["Good work, $glad:lass;! Now to attack their leader!"]="干得好，$g小伙子:姑娘;！现在去干掉他们的头领吧！"
G["Good work, $n!  Complete your trial by speaking with me.  Time continues to slip away until you do so!"]="干得好，$n！跟我谈谈以完成对你的考验。来吧，时间可不等人！"
G["Good work, $n."]="干得好，$n。"
G["Good work, $n. We couldn't have done it without you."]="干得好，$n。多亏了你我们才能做到这一切。"
G["Good work, $p! Now I can collect the pure water!"]="做得好，$p！现在我可以收集纯净之水了！"
G["Good work, $p! We'll take these bombs back to the admiral immediately."]="干得好，$p！我们马上就把这些炸弹送回上将那儿去。"
G["Good work, $p, you saved the village. We are forever in your debt."]="干得好，$p，是你救了村子。我们永远感激你。"
G["Good work, champion. I will take this foul creature back with me. This druid has much to answer to."]="干得好，勇士。我会把这个肮脏的家伙带回去的。我们有不少问题要问这个德鲁伊。"
G["Good work, defenders! We are gaining ground!"]="干得好，卫士们！我们寸土不让！"
G["Good work, druids! This area looks secure. Let's head back to base."]="干得好，德鲁伊们！这个地方看起来很安全。我们回营地去吧。"
G["Good work, friend. Speak with Kiryn and Rivett while I assess our new surroundings."]="啊，干得好，朋友。我得调查一下周围的情况，你去找琪麟和利维特吧。"
G["Good work, hero. Let's move on."]="干得好，英雄。我们前进吧。"
G["Good work, one and all!  The Scourge at the castle have been defeated."]="大家干得好！城堡里的天灾军团已经全部被消灭了！"
G["Good work, soldier. I need to get back to base camp! Will you cover me?"]="干得好，士兵。我需要回到大本营！你愿意掩护我吗？"
G["Good work, soldier. Now we light the fires and spite their ire!"]="干得好，士兵。现在让我们发泄对他们的忿怒！"
G["Good work, team! Take a breather and report back soon."]="干得不错，各位！休息一下，然后立刻回去复命。"
G["Good work."]="干得好。"
G["Good work.  Meet me at the eastern entrance to the blockade.  We need to find the hole in the defenses and plug it."]="干得好，到封锁线东边的入口找我。我们要找到防线的漏洞，并把它补上。"
G["Good work. I'll keep the men pushing from here. Move forward and take the last gate."]="干得好。我会让部下继续前进，拿下最后一道门。"
G["Good work. Keep it up."]="很好。再接再厉。"
G["Good work. Let's meet back up with Lord Zhu. There's nothing more we can do here."]="干得好，我们回去和祝掌门会合。这里也没什么事可做了。"
G["Good working with you."]="合作愉快。"
G["Good!"]="好！"
G["Good!  Good! You are still alive.  More fun for me!"]="很好！你还活着。我又有乐子咯！"
G["Good!  I do so like my food fresh and lively."]="好呀！我喜欢活蹦乱跳的食物。"
G["Good!  Soon you will be ready for a rider."]="¡Bien! Pronto podrás ser $gun jinete:una amazona;."
G["Good!  These pathetic initiates were boring me!"]="好！这些差劲的新兵快让我无聊死了！"
G["Good! Again!"]="很好！再来！"
G["Good! I can tell that my efforts will not be wasted!"]="太好了！我能断定我的努力不会白费！"
G["Good! I'll just leave you to it!"]="好！那它就交给你了！"
G["Good! I'm glad you're here, $n. We have much to discuss."]="太好了！真高兴你在这里，$n。我们有许多事要谈。"
G["Good! Let's clear out some of these mantid, then we can retake that bridge."]="很好！让我们解决掉这些螳螂妖，然后夺回那座桥。"
G["Good! Mah pet be gettin' hungry, mon."]="来得好！我的宠物正好饿了，伙计。"
G["Good! Maybe this time, WE can be the barrel-throwing jerks!"]="很好！也许这一次，我们可以成为扔木桶的一方了！"
G["Good! You're here.  Speak to me when you're ready to begin."]="很好！你来了。准备好就告诉我一声。"
G["Good, $n, you are under the spell's influence. I must analyze it quickly, then we can talk."]="太好了，$n，你正在受到魔法的影响。我必须马上分析它，然后我们再谈谈。"
G["Good, $r. Many Kor'kron gonna die thanks to ya help."]="很好，$r。感谢你帮助，许多库卡隆都将因此丧命。"
G["Good, Good.  And you... yes, you... the meddling worm inside dat Mind Control spell.  Don't think Jin'do can't see you."]="很好，很好。还有你……对，就是你……在意识控制法术中忙活的虫子。别以为金度看不见你。"
G["Good, a worthy sacrifice!"]="很好，一个完美的祭品！"
G["Good, another $c has come to join the fight!"]="¡Bien, $gotro:otra; $c ha venido a unirse a la lucha!"
G["Good, bad, I'm the guy with the gun."]="好还是坏，我手里拿着枪我说了算。"
G["Good, good.  Now bow to each other."]="很好，很好。现在互相鞠躬。"
G["Good, good. Keep it up and this bridge'll be done in no time."]="好，好。继续这么干，这座桥不久就会完工。"
G["Good, good. Zunta give you a treat later."]="很好，很好。祖塔晚点再款待你。"
G["Good, now you fight me!"]="很好，来跟我打吧！"
G["Good, that was good. You can rest now. I will get you some more hot water."]="很好，干得不错。你现在可以休息一下。我再去给你端点热水来。"
G["Good, the Alliance has come to play!"]="很好，联盟来了！"
G["Good, you are here."]="很好，你来了。"
G["Good, you have lit the incense."]="很好，你已经点燃了熏香。"
G["Good, you're still here.  Now, where's Deathguard Saltain?"]="很好，你还在。亡灵卫兵萨尔坦在哪儿？"
G["Good, you've got some grit! I like that. Well then, let's get going!"]="好极了，你很有勇气！我很满意。那么，我们就出发吧！"
G["Good, you've returned."]="很好，你回来了。"
G["Good-bye, little one. I will see you soon enough."]="再见，小家伙。我们后会有期。"
G["Good-bye."]="再见。"
G["Good."]="很好。"
G["Good.  Good.  User appear ready.  Now we go."]="良好。良好。使用者已准备好。现在，我们出发。"
G["Good.  If all goes as planned, we will soon be free of the gronn.  Then all of the ogres of the mountains will be able to enjoy the enlightened blessings of the ogres from Ogri'la."]="好。要是一切都能按计划顺利进行，我们很快就会从戈隆的魔掌中逃脱出来，获得真正的自由。刀锋山的所有食人魔都将从奥格瑞拉这里享受到食人魔文明的祝福。"
G["Good. Be sure they understand.\n\nNow, I would appreciate it if you would leave my temple in peace."]="好，一定要让他们理解。\n\n现在，如果你能离开我的神殿，我会非常感激的。"
G["Good. Because that brings me to my second point."]="很好。由此我要引申出第二点。"
G["Good. Channel the flames, feel them course through you."]="很好。引导火焰，感受它们在你体内的流动。"
G["Good. I have your attention, then, Godfrey?"]="很好。高弗雷，你肯听我说话了。"
G["Good. In order to carry out my plan, we must first create a lifestone. Are you prepared to act?"]="Bien. Para llevar a cabo mi plan, debemos comenzar creando una piedra de vida. ¿Estás $gpreparado:preparada; para hacerlo?"
G["Good. Ma raptor be hungry."]="好。我的迅猛龙饿了。"
G["Good. Now throw yourself off."]="很好。现在你可以滚了。"
G["Good. That means they're about to break."]="很好。这说明他们就要突围了。"
G["Good. The plan is coming together."]="很好。计划奏效了。"
G["Good. The shield is down. But what are you doing back here?"]="不错。护盾被击落。但你又回来做什么呢？"
G["Good. Then keep it coming."]="很好。那就随便来吧。"
G["Good. You are showing promise to join the elite ranks. Now, more practice."]="很好。你有希望加入精英的行列。现在，你需要更多的训练。"
G["Good. You've arrived. Now I can get out of here before I throw this goblin into the ocean."]="很好，你来了。在把这个地精扔进海里前，我总算能离开这儿了。"
G["Good... More flesh for the harvest..."]="很好……肉……更多的肉……"
G["Good... good, A-Me. A-Me good. Home. Find home."]="好……很好，A-Me。A-Me好。家。找到家。"
G["Good...luck. You'll need it."]="祝你们……好运。你们会需要好运气的。"
G["Goodbye Anveena, my love. Few will remember your name, yet this day you changed the course of destiny. What was once corrupt, is now pure. Heroes, do not let her sacrifice be in vain."]="永别了，我挚爱的安薇娜。尽管只有我们少数人会记住你，但是你今天的英勇事迹改变了命运的轨迹。曾被玷污的太阳之井又重归纯净。英雄们，千万不要让安薇娜白白地牺牲。"
G["Goodbye nearby living beings!  My unique presence is requested in another dimension."]="再见，附近的活体生物！独一无二的我即将被召唤到另一个位面。"
G["Goodbye! You were Gnimo's best friend ever!"]="再见！你曾经是尼莫最好的朋友！"
G["Goodbye, Martek."]="再见，马特克。"
G["Goodbye, Taretha. I will never forget your kindness."]="再见，塔蕾莎。我永远不会忘记你的善良。"
G["Goodbye, beloved tundra."]="再见，亲爱的冰原。"
G["Goodbye, cruel world... I'm leavin' you today... goodbye... goodbye... goodbye..."]="再见，残酷的世界……我今天要离开你了……再见……再见……再见……"
G["Goodbye."]="再见。"
G["Goodbye..."]="再见……"
G["Goods & Gear"]="物品和装备"
G["Googa fight one time, but then get a little bit eaten by crocolisk.\n\nEverybody root against Googa.\n\nGooga feel sad because of this."]="古嘎打过一次，结果被鳄鱼咬了一口。\n\n人人都讨厌古嘎。\n\n古嘎伤心了。"
G["Googa not actually supposed to be here.  Googa just not sure how to get down."]="古嘎其实不想呆在这儿的。古嘎只是不知道该怎么下去。"
G["Gor, Shin, you shouldn't really be spending all your time in this hut.  Get out there and work with the orcs!"]="戈尔、希恩，你们真不该一天到晚待在这间小屋里。赶快出去和那些兽人一起干活！"
G["Gor, when you're feeling less like a youngling, why don't you come outside with me and actually start ENFORCING for once?"]="戈尔，当你感觉自己不再年轻时，为什么不和我到外边来，开始管制那些兽人一次呢？"
G["Gorai lives? I will go find him. Thank you, friend!"]="¿Que Gorai sigue vivo? Iré a buscarlo. ¡Gracias, $gamigo:amiga;!"
G["Goramosh is busy with a ritual right now."]="古拉莫什正在主持仪式。"
G["Gordo like picking flowers.  Pick flowers kind of like killing."]="葛尔多喜欢摘花。摘花就像是打仗。"
G["Gordo, do you think you could repair my gear?"]="葛尔多，你能修理我的装备吗？"
G["Gorebag has shown me the Drakkari Empire. I am eager to help you conquer it!"]="高尔巴格带我游览了达卡莱帝国。我很乐意帮助你征服它！"
G["Gorefang."]="血牙。"
G["Gorefiend will have your head, interloper!"]="¡Sanguino te cortará la cabeza, $ginvasor:invasora;!"
G["Goregek best hunter, huh slave thing?"]="格利基克是最棒的猎人，是不是啊？"
G["Goregek best hunter... ever."]="格利基克是最好的猎人……永远是。"
G["Goregek get some sleep. Go bring foodstuffs back, slave thing."]="格利基克要去睡一会儿。奴隶，你去给我搞点吃的回来。"
G["Goregek go get drink. You sit in corner til Goregek ready."]="格利基克去搞点酒喝。你乖乖地待在角落里等我。"
G["Goregek hung... er, sorry. Goregek sorry."]="格利基克饿……哎呀，没有啦。格利基克错了。"
G["Goregek hungry."]="格利基克饿了。"
G["Goregek hungry. Go get on fire spit, slave thing. Tell Goregek when you well roasted."]="格利基克饿死了。奴隶，快趴到火堆上去。等你烤熟之后告诉格利基克一声。"
G["Goregek like killing big-tongues, but there too many here, slave thing."]="格利基克喜欢猎杀大舌头怪，但他们的数量似乎太多了点。"
G["Goregek maybe stumbled into chicken hut again..."]="格利基克好像又闯进鸡舍了……"
G["Goregek never \"stumble\" into chicken hut... Goregek always have to feed his dumb belly. Always one chicken missing when we catch them all."]="Goregek nunca \"tropezar\" con caseta de pollos... Goregek tiene que alimentar su estúpida barriga. Siempre falta un pollo cuando los atrapamos."
G["Goregek never seen Kartak yet. Goregek not think he has bad as others say."]="格利基克没有见过卡塔克。格利基克猜想，他或许没有别人说的那么坏吧。"
G["Goregek not mean to let chickens get away! Help!"]="格利基克不是故意把鸡放走的！来帮帮忙啊！"
G["Goregek slay so many bristlepine that he could fill River's Heart!"]="死在格利基克手里的钢刺野猪可以填满河流之心！"
G["Goregek the only good bristlepine hunter!"]="格利基克是最最优秀的钢刺野猪猎手！"
G["Goregek think he the boss of everyone, but he eat too much and hunt too little."]="格利基克总是摆出一副高高在上的模样，但这家伙每天吃那么多，打回来的猎物却少得可怜。"
G["Goregek wonder if there more bristlepine over mountains. One day, Goregek will go see."]="不知道山那边有没有钢刺野猪。格利基克要找时间去瞧瞧。"
G["Gorehoof."]="污蹄。"
G["Gorehowl."]="血吼。"
G["Goremaw has arrived!"]="血喉来了！"
G["Gorerot crush puny worgen!!"]="腐血打烂小狼人！"
G["Gorgek gonna catch chicken good!"]="格利基克要去抓鸡！"
G["Gorilla"]="猩猩"
G["Goriona! Give them hell!"]="格里昂纳！让他们下地狱！"
G["Gork'em big Dook!"]="狠狠地打！"
G["Gorka calls for Brutusk!"]="戈尔卡召唤蛮角！"
G["Gorlocs are the bad-guys, just so you know."]="如你所知，鳄鱼人都是大坏蛋。"
G["Gorlocs."]="鳄鱼人。"
G["Gorlop wonder if other lava hot?"]="格尔洛普不知别的熔岩是不是也这么烫？"
G["Gormal takes additional damage while taunted by a farmer!"]="格玛尔遭到了农夫的嘲讽，受到额外的伤害！"
G["Gormok smash cage, you see!"]="看到了吗？戈莫克把笼子打破了！"
G["Gormok will be free, runts!"]="你们这些小个子给我听着，戈莫克一定能获得自由！"
G["Goro'dan! You're on deck!"]="格鲁丹！攻击！"
G["Gorth is confused sometimes.  Gorth is good at killing people so Gorth is made sergeant.  But now Gorth never gets to kill nothing!"]="戈斯有时候也很迷茫。戈斯是个好杀手，所以升到了中士。但戈斯很不习惯没有东西杀的日子！"
G["Gorth no care if he die!  Gorth get put back together!"]="戈斯不在乎会不会搭上性命！戈斯要把他们都打扁！"
G["Gorth not afraid of getting killed.  Them Forsaken just put me back together again."]="戈斯从来不怕战死。被遗忘者只要把我重新拼起来就行了。"
G["Gory always wanted to be a farmer."]="血肚一直想当个农夫。"
G["Gory give up!  You farmers fight more good!"]="血肚认输！你们这群农民更能打！"
G["Gory just happy to be in the sun."]="血肚站在太阳底下真高兴。"
G["Gory not very good at planting, but Gory VERY good at reaping."]="血肚不太擅长耕种，可血肚超级擅长收割。"
G["Gory wants to help out on farm.  Gory already has his own scythe!"]="血肚想帮忙干农活。血肚已经准备好镰刀了！"
G["Gorzeeki tells me that you have brought him all that he needs for the Bell of Dethmoora, the Wheel of the Black March and the Doomsday Candle.\n\nWell done, $n!  You are almost ready to perform your ritual and bind a dreadsteed!"]="Gorzeeki me dice que le has traído todo lo necesario para la Campana de Dethmoora, la Rueda de la Marcha Negra y la Vela del día del Juicio Final.\n\n¡Bien hecho, $n! ¡Casi estás $glisto:lista; para realizar el ritual y vincular a un corcel nefasto!"
G["Gorzeeki, I wish to make a purchase."]="戈瑟奇，我想买点东西。"
G["Gosh, I'm sorry. I don't have anything new to teach you. How about you go talk to Simon Tanner in the Old Town section of Stormwind? He's a human with big muscles and dreamy red hair."]="唉，对不起。我没什么新东西可以教你了。你去暴风城的老城区找西蒙·坦纳尔谈谈怎么样？他是一个肌肉发达有一头漂亮红发的人类。"
G["Gosh, Miss Megs, maybe next time you can actually do some work!"]="天哪，梅格斯小姐，也许下一次你能真的做点儿什么！"
G["Gosh, Mr. Noggenfogger, I know you wouldn't want to damage your reputation as a neutral trade entity by forming closer ties to the Horde!"]="天哪，诺格弗格先生，我知道你不希望和部落建立更为紧密的联系，怕因此损害你作为中立贸易实体的声誉！"
G["Got a present for you."]="给你一个礼物。"
G["Got a work related complaint to register? Great! That'll be five hundred macaroons for investigation fees and three hundred macaroons for assorted palm greasing."]="要登记工作投诉？很好！请先交纳五百杏仁币的调查费和三百杏仁币的杂费。"
G["Got another one for ya!"]="给你又找到了一个！"
G["Got another pile ready to go! Outta my way!"]="木材装载完毕！别挡道！"
G["Got another shipment for you, Sid."]="你的货又来了，希德。"
G["Got another shipment of fresh meat for you, Saurboz. Let's hope these ones don't end up back as corpses on my wagon like the last battalion."]="又有一批新鲜的肉为你送到了，索博兹。希望这些不会像上次那营人一样，最后成为我车上的死尸。"
G["Got any food?"]="有吃的吗？"
G["Got any ookin' treasure, off-lander?"]="¿$gExtraño:Extraña; tiene dingue tesoro?"
G["Got any tobacco in those bags?"]="¿Tienes tabaco en esas mochilas?"
G["Got anymore of that lotus incense?"]="有没有弄到更多的莲花熏香？"
G["Got anything interesting for sale, Zorbin?"]="有没有什么好玩的东西卖，索尔宾？"
G["Got him!"]="他完了！"
G["Got it. At least we don't have to deal with those orbital emplacements."]="明白了。至少我们不用考虑那些轨道炮台。"
G["Got it. I'll head there right away."]="收到。我这就去。"
G["Got it. Thanks."]="明白。谢谢。"
G["Got me some new tricks... like me brudda bear...."]="看好了，我有许多新招，比如变个熊……"
G["Got one!"]="我钓到了！"
G["Got some rum?"]="有朗姆酒吗？"
G["Got some rye?"]="有黑麦吗？"
G["Got somethin' in my pack for ya! Here, let me find it. Nope, not there, not there either. Oh here it is, in my DEATH POUCH!"]="我包里有你要的东西！在这里，让我找找。不对，不在这里，也不在那里。哦找到了，在我的噩运袋里！"
G["Got somethin' that needs tightening, $r?"]="有什么要修理的吗，$r？"
G["Got trouble in the fields. Whether it's virmen or hozen, I tell ya, it ain't good."]="田里有麻烦啦。我告诉你，不论是兔妖还是猢狲，都不是什么好东西。"
G["Got you back!"]="你回来啦！"
G["Got you good!"]="你的样子还不错！"
G["Gotcha Chickenlips! You'd best get talky, or I'll get stabby."]="抓到你了小家伙！你最好开口，别逼我动手。"
G["Gotcha!"]="抓住你了！"
G["Gotcha! Let's try that again..."]="救下你了！让我们再试一次……"
G["Gothik, the Harvester. A master of necromancy and conjuration, Gothik is said to be able to beckon forth legions of the undead at a moment's notice. It is with his guidance that even the weakest of Death Knights can raise the dead."]="收割者戈提克。作为巫咒与魔法的大师，据说戈提克能瞬间召唤出亡灵军团为他作战。在他的指导下，即便是能力最弱的死亡骑士也能令亡者复生。"
G["Gots it!"]="接住了！"
G["Gots lost in da ook!"]="迷醉在那舞步里！"
G["Gots no time for playin' with ya. Aetherion just about ready to go!"]="没时间和你耗了。阿瑟里恩就快要开始肆虐了！"
G["Gotta calm down now... a little confused... just need to focus."]="该冷静一下了……脑子有点混乱……我需要集中精神。"
G["Gotta cut up the rotten bits - only the best components go into my creations!"]="得把这些腐烂的部分切掉，我做东西只用最好的材料！"
G["Gotta get out of here!"]="逃出这里！"
G["Gotta go elsewhere to find some more game. Was hoping to be beyond 48 by now."]="我要去别的地方找些猎物了。按照原定计划，应该不止48个啊。"
G["Gotta trim some fat around here. I'm downsizing the company!"]="我要开除这个废物。为了精简公司规模！"
G["Goutgut very special. Goutgut am first to get to crush puny humans in new place.\n\nGoutgut so happy."]="痛肠可真了不起。痛肠是在这新地方头一个打碎弱小人类的英雄。\n\n痛肠可真高兴。"
G["Graaaa!"]="啊啊啊啊啊！"
G["Graaagggh!!"]="啊啊啊！！"
G["Graaagh!"]="嘎啊啊啊！"
G["Graaahh!"]="嘎！"
G["Grab a Bear Cub"]="抓住一只熊崽。"
G["Grab a Lance from the Racks"]="从架子上抓起一根长矛。"
G["Grab a drink and join us, $r!"]="过来和我们喝一杯，$r！"
G["Grab a net, young $c. Our people need sustenance!"]="带上一张网，年轻的$c。我们需要食物！"
G["Grab a pint!"]="来喝一杯！"
G["Grab a seat and 'ave a drink, mate!  Grab me one while yer at it!"]="朋友，坐下来喝一杯吧！也给我来一杯！"
G["Grab a seat, chaps. Let me coach you on some true carnage!"]="赶快坐好，小伙子们。我要让你们知道什么才是真正的战斗！"
G["Grab anything you think we can fence."]="寻找一切可以做掩护的东西。"
G["Grab the Captain's head - I'm arming the explosives."]="抓好队长的头，我正在安装炸药。"
G["Grab the Seahorse while it's distracted!"]="在海马分神的时候抓住它！"
G["Grab the explosive on the docks and bring down those doors, men!"]="抓起码头上的炸药，摧毁大门！"
G["Grab the gear - we gotta clear out!"]="控制好设备——我们要进行清除了！"
G["Grab them ma pets!"]="我的宠物，抓住他们！"
G["Grab what supplies you can and move quick. Expect the Dargonmaw any minute!"]="拿走一切能拿得动的东西，赶快离开。龙喉兽人随时都有可能出现！"
G["Grab your things, $n! I've just gotten word from Nilith Lokrav in the Searing Gorge that the Undermarket has set up operations in the heart of the Cauldron. Find Nilith Lokrav in the Searing Gorge and get the low down!"]="收拾你的行装，$n！我从灼热峡谷那边的尼莉丝·洛克拉夫收到消息说，有个被称作“黑市组织”的团体正在大熔炉一带运作。到灼热峡谷去找到尼莉丝·洛克拉夫，然后把那个黑市组织连窝端掉。"
G["Grabbing"]="拾起"
G["Gragh! I cannot take this! While you talk and deliberate, our enemies grow stronger! Were it my choice, I would have put all our available forces onto that frozen rock and conquered it for the Horde!"]="啊！我受不了了！在你们反复权衡利弊的时候，我们的敌人正在逐渐壮大！如果让我来决定，我会召集一切力量登上那座冰山，为部落征服它！"
G["Grah! Gormok smash you!"]="哈哈！戈莫克把你打扁啦！"
G["Grahhhh!!"]="啊！！"
G["Grand Admiral Jes-Tereth is launching a fleet to break the Horde blockade of Kalimdor. Will you join her?"]="杰塔瑞斯将军要派舰队前去打破部落对卡利姆多的封锁。你愿意加入她吗？"
G["Grand Admiral Jes-Tereth sent me to ask you to join the fleet in breaking the Horde blockade of Kalimdor."]="杰塔瑞斯将军派我来让你加入我们的舰队，粉碎部落对卡利姆多的封锁。"
G["Grand Admiral Westwind has a plan... a vision. We must remain faithful and steadfast in its execution for the sake of the world."]="巴利·韦斯温元帅有一项计划……这也是他多年的愿望。为了拯救世界，我们在执行这项计划的过程中必须保持坚定和虔诚的态度。"
G["Grand Apothecary Putress unleashes the Engorged Blight Worm!"]="大药剂师普特雷斯释放了充血的凋零虫！"
G["Grand Apothecary Putress!  I come to report from the battlefronts..."]="大药剂师普特雷斯！我有来自前线的报告……"
G["Grand Empress Zek'hara masked her true intentions behind the guise of matronly worry. She claimed her overbearing ways were necessary to protect us."]="大女皇赞柯哈兰以慈爱之名掩盖自己的真正目的。她声称是自己的独裁统治是为了保护我们。"
G["Grand Foreman Puzik Gallywix finally intervened, taking the surplus of poisons to his tower, here at the Sludge Fen, in order to study and research the unstable nature of the toxins. A decision was finally reached to share the secret of the poison with the Defias Brotherhood in exchange for a very large supply of a stable, usable poison.\n\nKlaven Mortwake of the Defias Brotherhood was tasked with the job of altering the chemical properties of Zanzil's mixture."]="大工头普兹克·加里维克斯在那件事情发生之后就把剩余的毒药带到了他在淤泥沼泽的塔中继续进行研究，主要是想要解决毒药的不稳定性。最后他决定和迪菲亚兄弟会达成协议，共同研制开发这种毒药，代价是由迪菲亚兄弟会提供批量的成品毒药。\n\n迪菲亚兄弟会的克拉文·摩特维克负责对赞吉尔的毒药进行改良。"
G["Grand Vizier Zor'lok, voice of the Empress."]="大宰相佐尔洛克，女皇的代言人。"
G["Grand Warlock Wilfred Fizzlebang will summon forth your next challenge. Stand by for his entry."]="高阶术士威尔弗雷德·菲兹班将是你们的下一个对手。等待他的上场吧。"
G["Grandmatron... you're alive!"]="主母……您还活着！"
G["Grandson, will you... Will you tell Garrosh what you have told me about his father?"]="孙子，你会……你会把你所告诉我的关于他父亲的一切都告诉加尔鲁什吗？"
G["Grant me protection, $n. I must break through their foul magic!"]="保护我，$n。我必须冲破他们邪恶的魔法！"
G["Grant me the clarity to speak with this creature!"]="让我能清楚地与我面前的生灵对话！"
G["Grant me the wisdom of Winterax!"]="赐予我冰斧的智慧！"
G["Grant me your assistance, Bloodseeker. [Klaxxi Augmentation]"]="我今天需要你的帮忙，觅血者。"
G["Grant me your assistance, Dissector. [Klaxxi Enhancement]"]="我今天需要你的帮忙，切割者。"
G["Grant me your assistance, Iyyokuk. [Klaxxi Enhancement]"]="我今天需要你的帮忙，伊约库克。"
G["Grant me your assistance, Locust. [Klaxxi Augmentation]"]="我今天需要你的帮忙，暴食蝗。"
G["Grant me your assistance, Malik. [Klaxxi Enhancement]"]="我今天需要你的协助，玛里克。"
G["Grant me your assistance, Manipulator. [Klaxxi Augmentation]"]="我今天需要你的帮忙，操纵者。"
G["Grant me your assistance, Prime. [Klaxxi Augmentation]"]="我今天需要你的帮忙，至尊者。"
G["Grant me your assistance, Swarmkeeper. [Klaxxi Augmentation]"]="我今天需要你的帮忙，虫群卫士。"
G["Grant me your assistance, Wind-Reaver. [Klaxxi Enhancement]"]="我需要你的帮助，掠风者。"
G["Grant me your assistance, Xaril.  [Klaxxi Enhancement]"]="我今天需要你的帮忙，夏克里尔。"
G["Grant me your mark, mighty ancient."]="赐予我你的印记吧，强大的古树。"
G["Grant me your mark, wise ancient."]="赐予我你的印记吧，睿智的古树。"
G["Grant us the ability to know the truth. If a murderer walks in our midst, guide us in our search for justice."]="赐予我们洞悉真相的能力吧。如果凶手就在我们之中，请指引我们寻求正义的裁决。"
G["Grant your celestial mantle to my pet, and let a new celestial take your place!"]="把你的衣钵传给我的宠物，让新的天神取代你！"
G["Grapplehammer relies on me to get things done. A mind like his needs to be free of distractions."]="钩锤相信我能把事情做好。不能让这些琐碎的事情干扰他。"
G["Grapplehammer wants me to do WHAT? He's finally finished his bomb and he wants ME to fly it across the harbor? No-sir-ee!\n\nHere, I'll set one of my 'copters on autopiliot for you. Good luck!\n\nI'll be in my shelter."]="钩锤想要我做什么？他终于完成了他的炸弹，然后他想让我把它投到海湾的那头去？不行！\n\n听着，我会帮你把我的一架直升机设定为自动驾驶状态。然后我还会祝你好运！\n\n接着我就要到掩体里去了。"
G["Grark Lorkrub, you have been charged and found guilty of treason against the Horde. How you plead is unimportant. High Executioner Nuzrak, step forward."]="格拉克·洛克鲁布，你被判对部落犯有叛国罪。你如何辩护并不重要。大执行官努兹拉克，站出来。"
G["Grasp the Eye of the Lich King and focus your will upon it to scry for important information."]="紧握巫妖王之眼并集中你的意志，以此获取重要的信息。"
G["Grass, sand, and sludge mix together to form the vague resemblance of a footprint."]="草、沙子和软泥混合在一起，差不多就是这些脚印的样子。"
G["Great Gazlowe!"]="伟大的加兹鲁维！"
G["Great Jade Serpent! Hear our plea."]="青龙！请聆听我们的祈求。"
G["Great Ones keep home safe because they like Oracles I think! They know we good and nice."]="造物主能够保证家的安全，因为他们喜欢先知！他们知道鳄鱼人都是好人。"
G["Great Ones left big kitty protector thing. Not for us I think, but it good friend... keeps mean puppy-men away sometimes."]="造物主在祭坛留下了守护者。虽然不是为我们留下的，但它是我们的好朋友……帮助我们抵御过好几次狗狗人的袭击。"
G["Great Red Crane! Hear our plea."]="朱鹤！请聆听我们的祈求。"
G["Great Stones not for touching! Bad move! Bad move!"]="大石柱不能随便摸的！讨厌！不许摸！"
G["Great Tiger, the strangers from beyond the mists, they cannot be trusted. The wreckage in the Jade Forest can attest to this."]="虎神，不能相信那些来自迷雾之外的陌生人。翡翠林中的残骸便是最好的证明。"
G["Great Tzerak, in the name of Zevrax, we summon you forth!"]="伟大的瑟拉克，我们以塞弗拉克斯的名义将您召唤！"
G["Great Uther's ghost, it's chasing after us!  Squire, do something!  Throw rocks at it!  I have no plan!"]="伟大的乌瑟尔之灵，它在追赶我！侍从，想想办法！向它扔石头！我该怎么办？！"
G["Great White Tiger! Hear our plea."]="白虎！请聆听我们的祈求。"
G["Great air spirit, hear my call once more!"]="伟大的空气之灵，请再次倾听我的呼唤！"
G["Great and powerful Har'koa, please call for one of your children that it might stealthily carry me into the Altar of Quetz'lun."]="伟大的哈克娅，请召唤一名子嗣，让它将我悄悄地带进奎丝鲁恩祭坛。"
G["Great battle still going on at Sparktouched Haven.\n\nMaybe you find time to help sometime?"]="灵鳍湾的战斗仍在继续。\n\n你能抽空去那里帮帮忙吗？"
G["Great beast of burden, heed my call!"]="伟大的役畜，请听从我的召唤！"
G["Great blessings be upon you, good $r."]="你将得到强大的祝福，好$r。"
G["Great currents of... Ageon..."]="埃格恩的……巨浪……"
G["Great dangers lie beyond those walls, $n. turn back until you are more seasoned in the ways of combat."]="这些墙的另一面存在着巨大的危险，$n。等你的战斗经验更丰富之后再回来吧。"
G["Great day for a race, don't you think?"]="对一个种族来说，这是伟大的一天，你觉得呢？"
G["Great dedication is necessary to ascend the ranks of the Order of the Cloud Serpent. I wish you luck."]="想要晋升为翔龙骑士，就需要付出极大的牺牲。我祝你好运。"
G["Great driving, soldier! Not a scratch on us!"]="技术不错啊！我们毫发无损！"
G["Great events often have humble beginnings. Consider: a quiet pond. Still. The water is like a sheet of glass."]="于无声之处起波澜。比如说，一个宁静的池塘。水面平滑如镜。"
G["Great fight, everyone! A few more notches in my hammer and a few less Dragonmaw to threaten Thundermar."]="大家打得好！我的锤子上又多了几道刮痕，而威胁桑德玛尔的龙喉兽人又少了一些。"
G["Great gourds! Sorry, but I need to leave!"]="干得好！抱歉，可我得走了！"
G["Great is the healing and blessing power of the Light's most diligent followers."]="圣光最忠实的追随者们拥有无上的治愈与祝福之力。"
G["Great job guys! The key should be in his guts somewhere. Just, uh, fish around in there 'till you find it."]="干得好伙计们！钥匙应该就在他身体的某个地方。只要，呃，仔细找找，直到找到为止。"
G["Great job taking out those cannons, hero. Are you ready to settle this for good?"]="那些火炮都哑火了。干得好，英雄。你做好解决这一切的准备了吗？"
G["Great job with that metal monstrosity. There appears to be only a few more obstacles in our way.\n\nOnce you clear out that clanking robot at the end of the hall, we'll be inside Ulduar.\n\nWe also noticed an enormous, fire-breathing protodrake and a molten giant. They aren't in our way, though, if you'd like to just avoid them."]="你成功地击败了那只金属怪物。看来面前的障碍已经不多啦。\n\n一旦除掉前厅尽头的机器人，我们就能进入奥杜尔了。\n\n我们还发现了一头巨型喷火始祖龙和一个熔化的巨人。不过他们并没有挡住我们的去路，如果你想避开它们也没有问题。"
G["Great job!"]="干得好！"
G["Great job! Arthas is safely on his way to Northrend!"]="干得好！阿尔萨斯正在赶往诺森德！"
G["Great job. Take a break!"]="干得好。休息一下吧。"
G["Great news, everyone!"]="重大喜讯！各位！"
G["Great news, everyone! The slime is flowing again!"]="重大喜讯！各位！软泥又开始流动啦！"
G["Great sorrow eminates from this crystal."]="这块水晶中散发出巨大的悲伤。"
G["Great soul of champions past! Bear to me your shield!"]="先烈的英灵！用你的盾保护我吧！"
G["Great spirits of the earth, help us in our hour of need!"]="伟大的大地之灵，请在紧急关头帮助我们吧！"
G["Great to see you again, $n."]="很高兴再次见到你，$n。"
G["Great was the Old One, and terrible was His wrath. He consumed hope and begat despair; He inhaled courage and breathed fear."]="上古尊者很伟大，可发起怒来令人胆寒。他吞噬希冀，招引绝望；他吸进勇气，呼出恐惧。"
G["Great water spirit, wash away this corruption!"]="水之灵，冲走这一切堕落吧！"
G["Great wind brother, clear our path!"]="风之灵，扫清前进的道路！"
G["Great work getting this place going, $n!"]="干得漂亮，$n。是你让这个地方活起来了！"
G["Great work, everyone. Take a moment to grab your gear and let's move on."]="大家干得好。现在，各就各位，我们准备行动。"
G["Great!"]="太棒了！"
G["Great!  Let's keep those supplies coming, people!"]="好极了！我们要保证物资的运送！"
G["Great!  This servo should do the trick!"]="太棒了！这个机械臂应该会管用！"
G["Great! Let's get out of here. I don't have a weapon, so I'd really appreciate it if you could... you know... protect me?"]="太棒了！让我们离开这里。我没有武器。所以，如果你能……你明白的，如果你能保护我，我一定会非常感激！"
G["Great, let's get started... ha! Fooled you! Surely you didn't think it would be that simple. You'll need to prove your mettle just like everyone else!"]="太好了，我们开始吧……哈！你受骗了！你当然不会认为是那么简单吧。你需要像其他人一样证明你的勇气！"
G["Great, ye found yer way here!\n\nNo time to waste. Ye ready?"]="¡Estupendo! ¡Has sabido cómo llegar aquí!\n\nNo tenemos tiempo que perder. ¿$gListo:Lista;?"
G["Great. We're not gutless, we're incompetent."]="很好。我们不是没种，而是无能。"
G["Greatfather Winter can be found in front of the Ironforge bank. The tree near him is where presents are given out."]="冬天爷爷就在铁炉堡银行门口。他身旁的树下堆满了礼物。"
G["Greatfather Winter is only a wyvern's ride away to Orgrimmar."]="冬天爷爷就在奥格瑞玛，乘坐双足飞龙很快就能抵达那里。"
G["Greatfather Winter leaves toys for everyone under the tree in Ironforge during the feast of Winter Veil!"]="冬幕节期间，冬天爷爷在铁炉堡的树下给每个人都留下了玩具。"
G["Greatfather Winter will leave presents for everyone under the tree in Ironforge. I can't wait to get mine!"]="冬天爷爷会把给每个人的礼物放在铁炉堡的树下。我已经等不及要去拿我的了。"
G["Greatfather Winter will leave presents for everyone under the tree in Orgrimmar. I wonder what he'll bring me this year."]="冬天爷爷会把每个人的礼物放在奥格瑞玛的树下，我在想今年他会给我什么。"
G["Greatmother tells me that I was named after a great orcish hero."]="盖亚安祖母曾跟我说，我的名字来自一位伟大的兽人英雄。"
G["Greatmother, Garrosh has lost his heart. We are lost without you."]="盖亚安祖母，加尔鲁什已经失去了信心。如果没有了您，我们就一无所有了。"
G["Greatmother, I never had the honor. Durotan died long before my time, but his heroics are known to all on my world. The orcs of Azeroth reside in a place known as Durotar, named after your son. And... <You take a moment to breathe and think through what you are about to tell the Greatmother.>"]="祖母，我从未感到荣耀。杜隆坦已经战死很久了，但是他的英勇事迹广为我的世界所知。兽人居住在名为杜隆塔尔——以您的儿子为名——的地方。并且……<你呼了几口气，想了一下接下来要告诉祖母的事情。>"
G["Greatmother, he tells me that the Mag'har all love, honor, and trust me. He states that with me as warchief, he will be free to die when you pass, erasing his bloodline from existence."]="祖母，他告诉我整个玛格汉氏族都爱我，尊敬我，信任我。他对我说他会把酋长的位置让给我，那样当您去世后他就可以毫无挂念地死去，让他的血统彻底消失。"
G["Greatmother, is there anything I can do?"]="盖亚安祖母，有什么我可以效劳的吗？"
G["Greatmother, please drink this water."]="盖亚安祖母，请喝点水吧。"
G["Greatmother, you are the mother of Durotan?"]="盖亚安祖母，您是杜隆坦的母亲？"
G["Greatmother..."]="祖母……"
G["Greatmother...Am I..."]="祖母……我是不是……"
G["Greed has led you back to me.\n\n<Mathredis laughs.>\n\nA wise Draenei once told me that it - greed - is the single quality that all of the races on this world share. I would have to agree.\n\nHave you collected the components listed within the libram?"]="贪婪又把你带回给我了。\n\n<玛瑟迪斯笑了。>\n\n从前有个叫聪明的德莱尼人告诉我，婪是这个世界上所有的种族共有的唯一品质。我不得不同意。\n\n你找到圣契上所列出的材料了吗？"
G["Greely coughs."]="格瑞里咳嗽了一声。"
G["Greely drools a little as she continues her mindless labor."]="格瑞里一边无意识地继续着劳作，一边说了一些昏乱的话。"
G["Greely sighs and rolls her eyes."]="格瑞里叹息着，眨了眨眼。"
G["Greely, can you feel it? My moment of success is at hand!"]="格瑞里，你看到了吗？我已经成功在握了！"
G["Greely, can you get me back into that footbomb uniform?"]="格瑞里，你能让我重新穿上足球炸弹制服吗？"
G["Greely, load The Biggest Egg Ever into the Poultryizer. Mechnuggets for everyone!"]="好的，把史上最大的蛋装进变鸡器里。麦可鸡块人人有份儿！"
G["Greely, show them how the guns work."]="格瑞里，给他们演示该如何操作甲板火炮。"
G["Greely, why do the Super Booster Rocket Boots only work on the zombies?"]="格瑞里，为什么超级助推火箭之靴只对僵尸有用？"
G["Greely, would you like to demonstrate how our parachutes work?"]="格瑞里，你要不要示范一下我们的降落伞是如何工作的？"
G["Greely, you're not randomly firing that thing into Bilgewater Port, are you?"]="格瑞里，你不会在锈水港随意开火吧？"
G["Green dragonflight."]="绿龙军团。"
G["Green team scores a kill."]="绿队杀死了一个敌人。"
G["Green team wins!"]="绿队获胜！"
G["Green-skinned dog! Be silent or I will cut your tongue out and feed it to your swine-like children."]="绿皮怪！闭嘴，不然我就割下你的舌头，去喂你那群猪崽子。"
G["Greenskin... I know why you've come. You will not find allies in my kind for we do not trust you."]="绿皮肤的家伙……我知道你此行的目的。我们不信任你，别妄想说服我们成为你的盟友。"
G["Greenstone Brew! Straight from the heart of the Jade Forest."]="绿石佳酿！来自翡翠林腹地的美酒！"
G["Greenstone Dojo owes you its gratitude.\nLet's drink when this is done!"]="El dojo Verdemar te debe su gratitud.\n\n¡Bebamos cuando esto acabe!"
G["Greentill! Blacksoil! Cover our left flank! I don't want any surprises!"]="绿耕！黑土！掩护我们的左侧！我可不想遭到偷袭！"
G["Greer, I need a gryphon to ride and some bombs to drop on New Agamand!"]="格雷尔，我需要一匹狮鹫和一些炸弹来轰炸新阿加曼德！"
G["Greetin's! And, ah... salutations, I suppose.\n\nSorry. Not quite sure what to say. I'm not used to havin' much in the way of company around here.\n\nThat is, not unless they're here to buy some o' my brew, of course."]="你好！还有，呃……向你致敬，我猜。\n\n不好意思，真不知道该说些什么，我这里通常很少有人来。\n\n当然了，除非是他们来我这里买酒的时候。"
G["Greetin's, $c.\nIt be a sad ting, de way de secrets of de world are hidden from ya: Time, Fate, de burnin' stars an' de cold, cold darkness between... never will ya know de truth of such tings!"]="Saludos, $c.\n\nEs una pena, que los secretos del mundo te eh'tén veda'os: el tiempo, el deh'tino, las eh'trellas ah'dientes y la fría, fría oh'curidad que hay entre ambas... ¡Nunca conocerás la veh'dad de tales cosas!"
G["Greetin's, $c.  I be pityin' your kind, for de secrets of true magic are beyond ya..."]="你好，$c。我怜悯你，因为魔法的真正秘密是你永远也无法企及的……"
G["Greetin's, $n.  Are ya here ta be learnin' of de Hidden Arts?"]="你好，$n。你想要学习隐秘的艺术吗？"
G["Greetings $C.  Have you lost one of your pets?"]="你好，$c。你弄丢了宠物吗？"
G["Greetings $G brother:sister;, how can we help?"]="Saludos $Ghermano:hermana;, ¿cómo podemos ayudar?"
G["Greetings $G brother:sister;. How can we be of service?"]="Saludos $ghermano:hermana;. ¿Cómo podemos servirte?"
G["Greetings $N! I have traveled from the great city of Stormwind to offer my collection of mounts to aspiring Heroes such as yourself. I believe I have some mounts that will suit you well."]="Saludos $N! He viajado desde la gran ciudad de Ventormenta para ofrecer mi colección de monturas a héroes aspirantes como tú. Creo que tengo algunas monturas que te irán bien."
G["Greetings $R, I am Tharnariun Treetender."]="Saludos, $r, soy Tharnariun Espinarbolado."
G["Greetings $c - welcome to the front lines in our conquest of Ashenvale!  If you are looking for something to do, then you've come to the right place.  I'm always looking for able-bodied individuals to help bring glory to the Horde!"]="你好，$c。欢迎来到我们征服灰谷的前线！如果你在找事做的话，那么你算来对地方了。我总是在寻找体格健壮的$r去为部落赢得荣誉！"
G["Greetings $c -- if you're looking for leather goods and leatherworking supplies, you've come to the right semi-retired Paladin."]="你好，$c。如果你在寻找皮革制品和制皮物资的话，来问我这个半退休的圣骑士就算是找对人了。"
G["Greetings $c!  Welcome aboard the Cloudkisser.  Northrend can be a very harsh place.  I hope you have prepared yourself."]="你好啊，$c！欢迎乘坐吻云号。诺森德的环境非常恶劣，希望你已经做好了准备。"
G["Greetings $c, I am the leatherworking trainer for Darnassus.  What may I assist you with?"]="$c，你好，我是达纳苏斯的制皮训练师。我能帮你什么忙吗？"
G["Greetings $c, I am the leatherworking trainer for Thunder Bluff.  What may I assist you with?"]="$c，你好，我是达纳苏斯的制皮训练师。我能帮你什么吗？"
G["Greetings $c.  Do you wish to aid the Silverwing Sentinels in their fight at Warsong Gulch?"]="你好，$c。你愿意帮助战歌峡谷的银翼哨兵作战吗？"
G["Greetings $g lad : lass;, if you're looking for the best deals you'll find outside of Ironforge itself, then you've come to the right place."]="你好，$g小伙子:姑娘;，如果你想要在铁炉堡之外找到最好的交易地点，那么你就算找对地方了。"
G["Greetings $n.  Are you interested in the mystical art of Inscription, or perhaps the intricacies of Herbalism?"]="你好啊，$n。有兴趣学习铭文的神秘艺术吗？还是想了解草药学的复杂知识？"
G["Greetings $p. The waters foretold of your arrival. Unfortunately they didn't foretell of the raiders hitting us so hard.\n\nI am Waterspeaker Tired Shushen. Welcome to Fallsong."]="欢迎你，$p。水流预言了你的到来。不幸的是，它们并没有预言这些强盗会下手这么重。\n\n我是水语者疲惫的苏什。欢迎来到瀑歌村。"
G["Greetings Citizens!  Soon perhaps the tide will turn in our favor and the plague will end."]="干得好！形势在朝对我们有利的方向发展，苦难终将结束！"
G["Greetings Erion, I require training!"]="你好，艾瑞安，我需要接受训练！"
G["Greetings High Chief. Would you do me the honor of accepting my invitation to join the Horde as an official member and leader of the Taunka?"]="大酋长，您好。请问您是否愿意接受我的邀请，以牦牛人首领的身份正式加入部落呢？"
G["Greetings again, $c.  I've been watching you."]="再次问候，$c。我一直在注视着你。"
G["Greetings and salutations from the manor Ravenholdt, adventurer."]="La mansión Ravenholdt te da la bienvenida, $gaventurero:aventurera;."
G["Greetings and salutations, hero!  I have the latest news from both continents and points beyond for your consideration."]="¡Saludos, $ghéroe:heroína;! Tengo las últimas noticias de ambos continentes y de lugares que ni siquiera conoces."
G["Greetings and welcome to Blizzcon!  We are temporarily borrowing this dock to transport you to Northrend.  Your ride should be here shortly.  Enjoy!"]="欢迎来到暴雪嘉年华！这座临时租借来的码头能带你前往诺森德。船只很快就会靠岸了。祝你旅途愉快！"
G["Greetings friend! Will you require a room for the night?"]="你好啊朋友！想找个房间过夜吗？"
G["Greetings friends, and welcome to the greatest show on Azeroth!\n\nPlease, step right up and take in all we have to offer.  Ride the rides and see the sights!  Amaze at the wonders that the Darkmoon Faire has uncovered in this vast and mysterious world!  We have spared no expense in bringing you excitement that children of all ages will delight in!"]="你好，朋友，欢迎来到艾泽拉斯大陆最伟大的展出！\n\n请你过来，看看我们呈现给你的东西。快来看看这些千奇百怪的东西吧！为暗月马戏团从这个神秘广阔世界收集到的东西而惊叹吧！我们不会收取你任何费用，我们会为所有的孩子带来快乐！"
G["Greetings honored one.  Turak Runetotem and the other druids have been expecting you at the Hall of Elders on Elder Rise."]="Saludos, honorable $gamigo:amiga;. Turak Tótem de Runa y los demás druidas te han estado esperando en Sala de los Ancestros."
G["Greetings mage.  Shall I provide you with further insight into the world of magic?"]="Buenas, $gmago:maga;. ¿Quieres que te enseñe más secretos del mundo de la magia?"
G["Greetings my friend, and welcome to the greatest show in Outland!\n\nPlease, step right up and take in all we have to offer.  Amaze at the wonders that the Darkmoon Faire has uncovered in this vast and mysterious world!  We have spared no expense in bringing you excitement that children of all ages will delight in!"]="¡Saludos, $gamigo:amiga;, y $gbienvenido:bienvenida; al mayor espectáculo de Terrallende!\n\nAcércate y observa todo lo que tenemos que ofrecer. ¡Maravíllate con todo lo que la Feria de la Luna Negra ha descubierto en este vasto y misterioso mundo! ¡No hemos reparado en gastos para proporcionar diversiones con las que deleitar a niños de todas las edades!"
G["Greetings my friend, and welcome to the greatest show on Azeroth!\n\nPlease, step right up and take in all we have to offer.  Amaze at the wonders that the Darkmoon Faire has uncovered in this vast and mysterious world!  We have spared no expense in bringing you excitement that children of all ages will delight in!"]="¡Hola, $gamigo:amiga;, te doy la bienvenida al mayor espectáculo de todo Azeroth!\n\nPor favor, pasa y disfruta de todo lo que podemos ofrecerte. ¡Sorpréndete con las maravillas que la Feria de la Luna Negra ha descubierto en este vasto y misterioso mundo! No hemos reparado en gastos para poder ofrecer una diversión tan increíble que deleitará a niños de todas las edades."
G["Greetings stranger. I am Silkmaster Tsai. Welcome to the ancient Imperial Silk Farm.\n\nThis farm dates back to some of the earliest dynasties of Pandaria, and each generation exceeds the last in quality of silk."]="Saludos, $gforastero:forastera;. Soy el maestro de la seda Tsai. Bienvenido a la ancestral Granja de Seda Imperial.\n\nEsta granja se remonta a la época de alguna de las dinastías más antiguas de Pandaria, y cada generación supera a la anterior en la calidad de la seda."
G["Greetings stranger. Would you like to visit the mystical Pandaria?"]="你好啊，陌生人。你想要造访神秘的潘达利亚吗？"
G["Greetings traveler, you have my undying gratitude for dispensing with those dreadful creatures! I was beginning to think I might have to hide out forever!"]="Saludos $gviajero:viajera;, ¡tienes mi eterna gratitud por haberte ocupado de esas horribles criaturas! ¡Ya empezaba a pensar que tendría que esconderme para siempre!"
G["Greetings traveler."]="欢迎你，旅行者。"
G["Greetings traveler.  It is good to see that you made your way here safely from Camp Winterhoof."]="欢迎你，旅行者。你从冬蹄营地来的吧，很高兴你能平安抵达这里。"
G["Greetings young $c. It is here that your Warchief challenged Orgrim Doomhammer! Although it happened so many years ago, it is an image still fresh in my mind."]="你好，年轻的$c。就是在这里，你的酋长挑战了奥格瑞姆·毁灭之锤！虽然这事情已经过去了很久，但是在我的记忆中，它依然犹如刚刚发生过一样。"
G["Greetings young one, and welcome to Thunder Bluff.  You'll find safe refuge from the burdens of the world here.  All denizens of the Horde are welcome here.\n\nThe spirits of the present and past come alive here in this sacred place, my friend.  Honor them, and in doing so honor yourself."]="Saludos, joven. Te doy la bienvenida a Cima del Trueno. Aquí encontrarás un refugio seguro de las cargas del mundo. Todos los miembros de la Horda son bienvenidos aquí.\n\nLos espíritus del presente y del pasado conviven aquí, en este sagrado lugar. Hónrales y, al hacerlo, hónrate a ti $gmismo:misma;."
G["Greetings young rogue. What do you seek?"]="你好，年轻的潜行者。你在找什么？"
G["Greetings!"]="你好！"
G["Greetings!  Do you need something?"]="你好！需要什么吗？"
G["Greetings!  I am apprentice to Brewmaster Shadowpour, a pandaren we now call the Mad Brewer.\n\nHis reckless pursuit of flavor at the risk of safety has resulted in countless injuries, illnesses, and now even the wildlife of the area feels his mad brewing.  He is a villain, and I could use your help in stopping him."]="你好！我是酒仙影斟的徒弟，他就是那个被称为疯酒师的熊猫人。\n\n他无视安全、不计后果追求酒香的行为，已导致了不计其数的伤害和疾病。现在，就连当地的野生动物都察觉到他的疯狂酿酒行为了。他是个罪人，我需要你的帮助来阻止他。"
G["Greetings!  I am here to promote a tournament to test your fishing skill in Stranglethorn.  To participate you need enough might to survive there and have enough skill in fishing to coax the fish from the water.\n\n Come back later when you are more qualified!"]="¡Saludos! Estoy aquí para hablarte de un torneo que se celebrará en Tuercespina en el que podrás demostrar tu habilidad para la pesca. Para participar deberás tener paciencia y poseer la habilidad suficiente para sacar los peces del agua.\n\n¡Vuelve cuando estés mejor $gpreparado:preparada;!"
G["Greetings!  If you are here to access gnome engineering schemata, then you are welcome to do so.  Our scanners report you are a certified gnomish engineer!"]="你好！欢迎你来购买侏儒工程学图纸。我们的扫描仪已经确认，你是注册侏儒工程师！"
G["Greetings!  If you are here to access goblin engineering schemata, please know we only interface with certified goblin engineers."]="你好！如果你是来购买地精工程学图纸的，那你一定要知道，我们只为注册地精工程师服务。"
G["Greetings! Behold one of the finest musical instruments in all of Lordaeron. It's a true honor to perform for the Master and all his guests. Take a seat in the audience, I hear a show is starting soon."]="你好！看这完美的乐器，真荣幸可以为主人和他的客人们演出。去观众那里找个座位，我听说表演很快就要开始了。"
G["Greetings! I am Historian Llore! Everyone says I smile too much, but I don't think that's possible!"]="你好！我是历史学家勒洛尔！大家都说我笑得太多了，可我觉得这完全不可能！"
G["Greetings! I am Tinkmaster Overspark, the chief architect of modern Gnomish Engineering.\n\nOur assembly bay is hard at work fashioning all sorts of great mechanical wonders to aid you in not getting stabbed, slashed, blowed up, or otherwise banished from this realm of existence.\n\nOr at least, not by our enemies."]="欢迎欢迎！我是工匠大师欧沃斯巴克，当代侏儒工程学的总工程师。\n\n我们的装配工段正在努力组装各种神奇机械，保护你免遭刀戳、剑劈、爆炸或被放逐出物质领域之害。\n\n好吧，就算出故障，至少不是敌人干的。"
G["Greetings! Please have a look around."]="欢迎！请随便看看。"
G["Greetings! Wonderful day, isn't it?"]="你好！真是令人愉悦的一天啊，对不对？"
G["Greetings,  I am Vindicator Palanaar, a traveling paladin of the Light.  I am here to be of assistance to the night elves."]="你好，我是守备官帕兰纳尔，一个信仰圣光的旅行圣骑士。我是来这里帮助暗夜精灵的。"
G["Greetings, $Gsir:miss;. I am Master Xylem's apprentice Nyrill. If you have any concerns, please feel free to bring them up with the master.\n\nI will be here to serve you when you're ready to return down to the base of the mountain."]="你好，$G先生:小姐;。我是克希雷姆大人的学徒尼瑞尔。如果你们有任何问题，请随意向主人询问。\n\n当你准备下山的时候，就过来找我吧。"
G["Greetings, $c - I'm a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of Darnassus.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Alliance Commendation Signets.\n\nI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from Darnassus for your duty and service."]="Saludos, $c. Soy un oficial encomiado en misión en nombre de Darnassus. Mi deber es ayudar a los aventureros que hayan recibido un sello de mención de honor de la Alianza.\n\nYo acepto sellos en diferentes cantidades, pero lo mejor para ti es que me entregues un lote de diez de una sola vez. Inscribiré tus hazañas en nuestros registros cuando entregues tus sellos. De esta forma, te ganarás el reconocimiento de Darnassus por tu cumplimiento del deber y buen servicio."
G["Greetings, $c - I'm a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of Ironforge.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Alliance Commendation Signets.\n\nI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from Ironforge for your duty and service."]="Saludos, $c. Soy un oficial encomiado en misión en nombre de Forjaz. Mi deber es ayudar a los aventureros que hayan recibido un sello de mención de honor de la Alianza.\n\nYo acepto sellos en diferentes cantidades, pero lo mejor para ti es que me entregues un lote de diez de una sola vez. Inscribiré tus hazañas en nuestros registros cuando entregues tus sellos. De esta forma, te ganarás el reconocimiento de Forjaz por tu cumplimiento del deber y buen servicio."
G["Greetings, $c - I'm a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of Orgrimmar.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Horde Commendation Signets.\n\nI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from Orgrimmar for your duty and service."]="Saludos, $c. Soy un oficial encomiado en misión en nombre de Orgrimmar. Mi deber es ayudar a los aventureros que hayan recibido un sello de honor de la Horda.\n\nYo acepto sellos en diferentes cantidades, pero lo mejor para ti es que me entregues un lote de diez de una sola vez. Inscribiré tus hazañas en nuestros registros cuando entregues tus sellos. De esta forma, te ganarás el reconocimiento de Orgrimmar por tu cumplimiento del deber y buen servicio."
G["Greetings, $c - I'm a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of Silvermoon City.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Horde Commendation Signets.\n\nI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from Silvermoon City for your duty and service."]="Saludos, $c – soy un oficial de Honor que actúa en nombre de la ciudad de Lunargenta. Mi deber es ayudar a los aventureros que hayan recibido sellos de mención de honor de la Horda.\n\nAcepto sellos en diferentes cantidades, pero el intercambio más beneficioso para ti es entregarlos en series de diez a la vez. Introduciré tus hazañas en nuestros registros cuando entregues tus sellos. Como resultado, obtendrás reconocimiento de la ciudad de Lunargenta por tu deber y servicio."
G["Greetings, $c - I'm a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of Stormwind.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Alliance Commendation Signets.\n\nI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from Stormwind for your duty and service."]="Saludos, $c. Soy un oficial encomiado en misión en nombre de Ventormenta. Mi deber es ayudar a los aventureros que hayan recibido un sello de mención de honor de la Alianza.\n\nYo acepto sellos en diferentes cantidades, pero lo mejor para ti es que me entregues un lote de diez de una sola vez. Inscribiré tus hazañas en nuestros registros cuando entregues tus sellos. De esta forma, te ganarás el reconocimiento de Ventormenta por tu cumplimiento del deber y buen servicio."
G["Greetings, $c - I'm a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of Thunder Bluff.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Horde Commendation Signets.\n\nI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from Thunder Bluff for your duty and service."]="Saludos, $c. Soy un oficial encomiado en misión en nombre de Cima del Trueno. Mi deber es ayudar a los aventureros que hayan recibido un sello de honor de la Horda.\n\nYo acepto sellos en diferentes cantidades, pero lo mejor para ti es que me entregues un lote de diez de una sola vez. Inscribiré tus hazañas en nuestros registros cuando entregues tus sellos. De esta forma, te ganarás el reconocimiento de Cima del Trueno por tu cumplimiento del deber y buen servicio."
G["Greetings, $c - I'm a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of the Darkspear tribe.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Horde Commendation Signets.\n\nI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from the Darkspear tribe for your duty and service."]="Saludos, $c. Soy un oficial encomiado en misión en nombre de la tribu Lanza Negra. Mi deber es ayudar a los aventureros que hayan recibido un sello de honor de la Horda.\n\nYo acepto sellos en diferentes cantidades, pero lo mejor para ti es que me entregues un lote de diez de una sola vez. Inscribiré tus hazañas en nuestros registros cuando entregues tus sellos. De esta forma, te ganarás el reconocimiento de la tribu Lanza Negra por tu cumplimiento del deber y buen servicio."
G["Greetings, $c - I'm a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of the Exodar.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Alliance Commendation Signets.\n\nI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from the Exodar for your duty and service."]="你好，$c——我是埃索达的嘉奖官。我的职责就是帮助那些获得联盟荣誉徽章的冒险者们。\n\n我一次可以收取不同数量的徽章，但是对你来说，一次缴纳10枚徽章就能获得最高的收益。我会保留你缴纳徽章的记录，你在埃索达的声望也会因此提高。"
G["Greetings, $c - I'm a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of the Gnomeregan Exiles.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Alliance Commendation Signets.\n\nI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from the Gnomeregan Exiles for your duty and service."]="Saludos, $c. Soy un oficial encomiado en misión en nombre de los Exiliados de Gnomeregan. Mi deber es ayudar a los aventureros que hayan recibido un sello de mención de honor de la Alianza.\n\nYo acepto sellos en diferentes cantidades, pero lo mejor para ti es que me entregues un lote de diez de una sola vez. Inscribiré tus hazañas en nuestros registros cuando entregues tus sellos. De esta forma, te ganarás el reconocimiento de los Exiliados de Gnomeregan por tu cumplimiento del deber y buen servicio."
G["Greetings, $c - I'm a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of the Undercity.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Horde Commendation Signets.\n\nI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from the Undercity for your duty and service."]="Saludos, $c. Soy un oficial encomiado en misión en nombre de Entrañas. Mi deber es ayudar a los aventureros que hayan recibido un sello de honor de la Horda.\n\nYo acepto sellos en diferentes cantidades, pero lo mejor para ti es que me entregues un lote de diez de una sola vez. Inscribiré tus hazañas en nuestros registros cuando entregues tus sellos. De esta forma, te ganarás el reconocimiento de Entrañas por tu cumplimiento del deber y buen servicio."
G["Greetings, $c!"]="你好，$c！"
G["Greetings, $c!\n\nChieftain Baine Bloodhoof was distressed to learn of Garrosh's savage attack on the human prince. Our causes for grievance against the Alliance are many, but none are the responsibility of this little one.\n\nThe prince and I met at the Temple of the White Tiger. On my honor I have pledged that I will do what I can to keep him safe.\n\n<Despite his words and the warmth the prince directs his way, the tauren paladin suffers distrustful glances from the royal bodyguards in the corner of the room.>"]="欢迎你，$c！\n\n大酋长贝恩·血蹄得知加尔鲁什野蛮地袭击了人类王子后，一直非常忧虑。我们有许多仇视联盟的原因，但那都不是这个小家伙的错。\n\n王子和我在白虎寺见过。我用自己的荣誉发誓，一定会保证他的安全。\n\n<尽管这样说了，又有王子的热情介绍，但房间角落里的皇家卫士依然狐疑地打量着这位牛头人圣骑士。>"
G["Greetings, $c!\n\nI hope you don't mind a little hard work. We could sure use a hand here."]="你好，$c！\n\n希望你能胜任艰苦的工作。我们的人手紧张，非常需要帮助。"
G["Greetings, $c!  Stormwind Harbor is quite a sight to behold.  It's even better seen from the air.  How would you like a bird's eye view of the harbor?"]="你好，$c！暴风城港口的景色别具风格。从空中俯瞰的效果更佳。你要鸟瞰一下整座港口吗？"
G["Greetings, $c!  Welcome to the Cathedral of Light!"]="你好，$c！欢迎来到光明大教堂！"
G["Greetings, $c! I'm from the Highbank advance scouting unit, trying to win over the Wildhammer here at Thundermar.\n\nTheir gryphon riders are having a tough time bringing down Dragonmaw drake riders. I've got a plan for a contraption that will help, but I'm going to need supplies. Lots of supplies.\n\nCan you help?"]="你好啊，$c！我是来自滩头堡的先遣侦察单位，尽力说服桑德玛尔的蛮锤部族。\n\n他们的狮鹫骑士正被龙喉的龙骑士们纠缠得团团转。我设计了一个奇妙的装置来帮助他们，可我缺少一些物品。许多物品。\n\n你能帮我吗？"
G["Greetings, $c! you look like you might be interested in some fresh spices! Perhaps some books for your journey."]="你好，$c！看起来你会对新鲜辣椒感兴趣的！也许再来几本旅途中解闷用的书。"
G["Greetings, $c."]="你好，$c。"
G["Greetings, $c.\n\nHow may I help you?"]="你好，$c。\n\n我能帮上什么忙吗？"
G["Greetings, $c.\n\nLook around you. Have you stopped to ponder what all of this means?"]="你好，$c。\n\n看看你的周围。你有没有认真考虑过所有这些东西的意义？"
G["Greetings, $c.\n\nThe Alliance currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the battle has begun!  Hurry to Wintergrasp and support our forces!"]="你好，$c。\n\n现在联盟控制着冬拥堡垒。但争夺这座堡垒的战斗已经开始了。快些赶往冬拥湖，帮助我们进行这场战斗吧！"
G["Greetings, $c.\n\nThe Alliance currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the next battle starts soon.   Get ready to head to Wintergrasp and support our forces!\n\nThe next battle begins in $4354k."]="你好，$c。\n\n现在冬拥堡垒由联盟控制，但下一次战斗就要开始了！加入冬拥湖的战斗，帮助我们赢取胜利吧！\n\n这场战斗将在$4354k内开始。"
G["Greetings, $c.\n\nThe Alliance currently control Wintergrasp Fortress.  When the battle is about to begin, talk to me to enter the battle.\n\nThe next battle begins in $4354k."]="你好，$c。\n\n现在联盟控制着冬拥堡垒。当战斗就要开始的时候，你和我交谈，就能加入这场战斗。\n\n这场战斗将在$4354k内开始。"
G["Greetings, $c.\n\nThe Alliance now controls Wintergrasp Fortress. Use the portal, if you like.\n\nThe next battle begins in $4354k."]="你好，$c。\n\n联盟已经控制了冬拥堡垒。如果你想去那里的话，就穿过这道传送门吧。\n\n下一场战斗将在$4354k内开始。"
G["Greetings, $c.\n\nThe Horde currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the battle has begun.  Hurry to Wintergrasp and support our forces!"]="你好，$c。\n\n现在部落控制着冬拥堡垒。但争夺这座堡垒的战斗已经开始了。快些赶往冬拥湖，帮助我们进行这场战斗吧！"
G["Greetings, $c.\n\nThe Horde currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the next battle starts soon.   Get ready to head to Wintergrasp and support our forces!\n\nThe next battle begins in $4354k."]="你好，$c。\n\n现在部落控制着冬拥堡垒。但下一场争夺这座堡垒的战斗就要开始了。赶快做好准备，前往冬拥湖帮助我们作战吧！\n\n这场战斗将在$4354k内开始。"
G["Greetings, $c.\n\nThe Horde currently control Wintergrasp Fortress.  When the battle is about to begin, talk to me to enter the battle.\n\nThe next battle begins in $4354k."]="你好，$c。\n\n现在部落控制着冬拥堡垒。当争夺冬拥堡垒的战斗开始的时候，你和我交谈，就能加入这场战斗。\n\n这场战斗将在$4354k内开始。"
G["Greetings, $c.\n\nThe Horde now controls Wintergrasp Fortress. Use the portal, if you like.\n\nThe next battle begins in $4354k."]="你好，$c。\n\n部落已经控制了冬拥堡垒。如果你想去那里的话，就穿过这道传送门吧。\n\n下一场战斗将在$4354k内开始。"
G["Greetings, $c.\n\nThe mountains have crumbled and the Cataclysm has caused the seas to rush in and drown Thousand Needles.\n\nWe need your help, now!"]="你好，$c。\n\n山脉崩塌，大灾变造成海水灌入，淹没了千针石林。\n\n我们需要你的帮助，就是现在！"
G["Greetings, $c.\n\nThose Sentinels over there have allowed me to share their camp as long as I promise no trouble will follow--I am sure you can appreciate the need for diplomacy while here, yes?\n\nI am here investigating disturbances to the land, and since it aids their cause also, they have agreed that my presence here could only aid the tenuous alliance between all of Azeroth's races. If you wish to aid me, then I would appreciate it, but regardless, please try not to cause any trouble."]="你好，$c。\n\n那边的哨兵允许我住在他们的营地，只要我答应不会再有麻烦了——我敢肯定你能意识到对外交的需要，是吗？\n\n我来调查这片土地的紊乱状况，既然这也有助于他们的事业，他们同意我在这里 只能协助艾泽拉斯各族之间脆弱的联盟关系。如果你想帮我，那么我会很感激，但无论如何，请不要引起任何麻烦。"
G["Greetings, $c.\n\nWhen the Alliance controls Wintergrasp Fortress, I will open a portal for those who wish to travel there.\n\nThe battle currently enues. Hurry to Wintergrasp and support our forces!"]="你好，$c。\n\n一旦联盟取得冬拥堡垒的控制权，我就将为想要前往那里的旅行者开启一道传送门。\n\n战斗正在进行中，赶快前往冬拥湖，支援我们的部队吧！"
G["Greetings, $c.\n\nWhen the Alliance controls Wintergrasp Fortress, I will open a portal for those who wish to travel there.\n\nThe next battle begins in $4354k."]="你好，$c。\n\n一旦联盟取得冬拥堡垒的控制权，我就将为想要前往那里的旅行者开启一道传送门。\n\n下一场战斗将在$4354k内开始。"
G["Greetings, $c.\n\nWhen the Horde controls Wintergrasp Fortress, I will open a portal for those who wish to travel there.\n\nThe battle currently ensues. Hurry to Wintergrasp to support our forces."]="你好，$c。\n\n一旦部落取得冬拥堡垒的控制权，我就将为想要前往那里的旅行者开启一道传送门。\n\n战斗正在进行中，赶快前往冬拥湖，支援我们的部队吧。"
G["Greetings, $c.\n\nWhen the Horde controls Wintergrasp Fortress, I will open a portal for those who wish to travel there.\n\nThe next battle begins in $4354k."]="你好，$c。\n\n一旦部落取得冬拥堡垒的控制权，我就将为想要前往那里的旅行者开启一道传送门。\n\n下一场战斗将在$4354k内开始。"
G["Greetings, $c.\n\nYou want Darrok to send you to Venture Bay?"]="你好，$c。\n\n你想去风险湾吗？"
G["Greetings, $c.  Are you here to learn of the hidden arts?"]="你好，$c。你是来学习神秘的手艺的吗？"
G["Greetings, $c.  I am Exzhal, Servitor of Rastakhan."]="你好，$c。我是拉斯塔哈的仆从伊克萨尔。"
G["Greetings, $c.  I am Miranda Breechlock - one of but a few authorized equipment and materiel quartermasters for the Dawn.\n\nAs you fight evil under our commission - all the while earning our respect and trust - you'll earn valor tokens from Duke Zverenhoff.  Tokens serve two purposes: use them to gain increased standing within our ranks, or use them as tender in acquiring special items.\n\nAs you improve your standing with the Dawn, you'll discover that more items will be made available to you."]="你好，$c。我是军需官米兰达·布利洛克——银色军团为数不多的授权装备和军品军需官之一。\n\n既然你在我们的委任下与邪恶战斗——同时赢得我们的尊敬和信任——你会从尼古拉斯·瑟伦霍夫公爵那里得到勇气勋章。勋章有两个作用：用他们赢得在军队中更高的地位，或者作为交换得到特殊物品。\n\n随着你在军团中地位的升高，你会发现你会有更多的物品。"
G["Greetings, $c.  I get so few visitors up here.  To what do I owe the pleasure?"]="你好，$c。很少有客人会到我这里来。有什么我可以帮忙的吗？"
G["Greetings, $c.  I hope you find your accomodations suitable, even in this time of war."]="你好，$c。希望你能有宾至如归的感觉，即使是在这战火之中。"
G["Greetings, $c.  If I might be so bold, may I remind you that -- while I attune myself to the magics of Hellfire Citadel -- there will undoubtedly be Hellfire wardens biting at my proverbial heels!\n\nSo, do be an upstanding member of your Horde and play the part of the hero... and protect me!"]="Saludos, $c. Si se me permite el atrevimiento, te recuerdo que, mientras me ajusto a la magia de la Ciudadela del Fuego Infernal, sin duda habrá celadores del Fuego Infernal pisándome los talones.\n\nAsí que te pido que seas un miembro honesto de tu Horda y actúes como el héroe... ¡y me protejas!"
G["Greetings, $c.  It is good you've decided to visit us."]="谢谢你，$c。你能来拜访我们实在是太好了。"
G["Greetings, $c.  It is the time of the Harvest Festival - a time of great bounties and a time of remembrance.  We partake of feasts to celebrate all we have to be thankful of, and we remember our ancestors and past heroes to give thanks to the legacy they gave us.\n\nPlease feel free to partake of the feast being offered here.  Also, I am offering some fireworks to help celebrate this joyous time of year."]="你好，$c。眼下正是收获节——感恩与追思的季节。我们举办盛宴感激所有我们应该感激的人，追忆我们的祖先和英雄，感谢他们给我们留下的宝贵遗产。\n\n请尽情享受这盛宴吧。我还会燃放焰火助兴。"
G["Greetings, $c.  Though time and drink have dulled my outer senses, my inner eyes remain strong."]="你好，$c。虽然长期饮用烈酒已经让我的感觉变得迟钝了，但我的心灵之眼依然十分强大。"
G["Greetings, $c.  Welcome to Cenarion Hold.  From here we will strike against the silithid where they're at their strongest.  I hope you've come to lend a hand."]="Saludos, $c. $gBienvenido:Bienvenida; al Fuerte Cenarion. Desde aquí atacaremos a los silítidos cuando estén en su apogeo. Espero que hayas venido a echar una mano."
G["Greetings, $c.  What may this humble servant of the Feathermoon Stronghold do for you today?"]="你好，$c。我这个羽月要塞的仆人可以为你做些什么呢？"
G["Greetings, $c.  You are welcome in Nighthaven, as well as all of Moonglade.  The Cenarion Circle welcomes all beings who respect the authority and command of nature.\n\nWhile you are here, please be sure to preserve the balance in all things.  Disturbances are not welcome here, and our wardens are trained to cease all hostilities without question."]="Saludos, $c. Sé $gbienvenido:bienvenida; al Amparo de la Noche y a todo Claro de la Luna. El Círculo Cenarion da la bienvenida a todos los que respeten la autoridad y el mando de la naturaleza.\n\nMientras estés aquí, por favor, cuídate de guardar el equilibrio de todas las cosas. Las alteraciones no son bien recibidas y nuestros celadores están instruidos para poner fin a todo tipo de hostilidad sin hacer ninguna pregunta."
G["Greetings, $c.  You seek to push yourself to the limits of your hunting prowess?  Look no further.\n\nHemet Nesingwary has assembled the finest expedition the remnant of this world has ever known.  Join us on safari if you dare."]="你好，$c。你想突破你的狩猎能力的极限吗？不用到处寻找了。\n\n赫米特·奈辛瓦里集合了这个世界上最好的探险队员。如果你够胆，就加入我们的队伍吧。"
G["Greetings, $c. Before the night elves invited the draenei to join them here, this glade was all but forgotten.\n\nThe kaldorei are deeply tied to these lands, and we draenei are honored that they have asked us to share in the task of revitalizing Forest Song."]="你好，$c。在暗夜精灵邀请我们德莱尼人加入他们之前，这片林地几乎已经被遗忘了。\n\n卡多雷人完全控制了这片土地，他们邀请我们加入重建林歌神殿的任务，对此我们德莱尼人深感荣耀。"
G["Greetings, $c. Don't have too much time to talk--I'm just using Chillwind as a camp to get some rest before heading to Hearthglen. I've heard word that before they went crazy, the Scarlet Crusade had a mage working for them who was trying to create powerful bows and guns for their soldiers. I'm not sure if he succeeded or not... the Crusade killed him before any of his finished product made it out. Maybe they killed him to keep it a secret... or maybe they distrust the arcane that much."]="你好，$c。没有多少时间谈话——我在动身去壁炉谷之前只是把冰风营地作为暂留地休息一下。我曾听到传言在他们疯掉之前，血色十字军强迫一个法师为他们工作，为他们的士兵制造强大的弓箭和枪支。我不敢肯定他成功与否……十字军在他们的成品制成之前杀死了他。或许他们杀死他为了保密……也可能他们不太信任奥术。"
G["Greetings, $c. For some, the hunter is a way of life, a chosen profession. For others, it is something of a pastime, a badge of courage, or a rite of passage depending on your tribe.\n\nFor me, race and profession mean nothing - it is the testing of your spirit and mind that I respect. For one to stand against the forces of nature and test all of their skills is the true mark of honor.\n\nIf you wish to test yourself and earn my respect, then speak to me more."]="Saludos, $c. Para algunos, la caza es una forma de vida, una profesión que han elegido ellos. Para otros, es cosa del pasado, un símbolo de coraje, un rito de madurez, dependiendo de cada tribu.\n\nPara mí, la raza y la profesión no significan nada; lo que yo respeto es la capacidad de poner a prueba el espíritu y la mente. Tener la oportunidad de enfrentarse a las fuerzas de la naturaleza y poner a prueba las habilidades propias es una verdadera marca de honor.\n\nSi deseas probarte a ti $gmismo:misma; y ganar mi respeto, habla más conmigo."
G["Greetings, $c. Have you spoken with Fahrad yet?"]="你好，$c。你找法拉德谈过了吗？"
G["Greetings, $c. I am Field Marshal Snowfall, commander of the war effort here. We've a hard road to plow ahead of us, $g lad : lass;, so if you can help out, please do so. And feel free to ask questions."]="你好，$c。我是大元帅斯诺·落雪。$g小伙子:姑娘;，我们面前的道路充满艰辛，如果你想要帮忙的话，请尽量帮助我们。有什么问题尽管问吧。"
G["Greetings, $c. I am Kuros, second of the Triumvirate of the Hand."]="你好，$c。我是库卢斯，阿古斯之手三人执政团的成员。"
G["Greetings, $c. I am Leoren, stable master of Cenarion Hold."]="你好，$c。我是塞纳里奥要塞的兽栏管理员莱欧伦。"
G["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]="你好，$c。我可以帮你找回失散的伙伴。"
G["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]="你好，$c。我可以帮你看管宠物，或者帮你找回走失的伙伴。"
G["Greetings, $c. I have been sent here from the Exodar to oversee the construction of Azure Watch."]="你好，$c。我从埃索达被派来检查碧蓝岗哨的建筑。"
G["Greetings, $c. I trust that you bring me good news concerning the Worldwide Invitational event? If you are, then surely that means you were given a secret code to tell me. In return for your code I will give you a gift of one of the golden pigs that I take care of.\n\nJust whisper it in my ear when you are ready."]="Saludos, $c. Espero que me traigas buenas noticias con respecto al Worldwide Invitational. Si es así, seguramente te habrán dado un código secreto que decirme. A cambio de tu código, te daré un cerdo dorado de los que cuido como regalo.\n\nSimplemente susúrramelo al oído cuando estés $glisto:lista;."
G["Greetings, $c. I trust that you bring me good news concerning the Worldwide Invitational event? If you are, then surely that means you were given a secret code to tell me. In return for your code I will give you a gift of one of the panda cubs that I take care of.\n\nJust whisper it in my ear when you are ready."]="Saludos, $c. Confío en que traigas buenas noticias en referencia al evento internacional exclusivo para invitados. Si así es, con certeza te habrán dado un código secreto que debes decirme. A cambio de tu código te regalaré uno de los ositos panda que tengo a mi cargo.\n\nSimplemente susúrramelo al oído cuando estés $glisto:lista;."
G["Greetings, $c. I trust that you bring me good news concerning the Worldwide Invitational event? If you are, then surely that means you were given a secret code to tell me. In return for your code I will give you a gift, Tyrael's Hilt.\n\nJust whisper it in my ear when you are ready."]="Saludos, $c. Espero que me traigas buenas noticias sobre la Worldwide Invitational. Si es así, significa que tienes un código secreto para entregarme. A cambio del código, te daré un regalo, la empuñadura de Tyrael.\n\nSimplemente susúrramelo al oído cuando estés $glisto:lista;."
G["Greetings, $c. Is there something I can help you with?"]="你好，$c。有什么我能帮忙的吗？"
G["Greetings, $c. It is good to see you interested in helping with the war effort. The collectors here are organizing the gathering of various stockpiles of goods so that we will be prepared when the time comes.\n\nI am in charge of obtaining $2106w baked salmon to store away for those involved in the fighting at Ahn'Qiraj. The last time that I counted, we had collected $2105w."]="Saludos, $c. Me alegro de que quieras ayudar con la campaña. Los recolectores están organizando el almacenamiento de reservas de diversos productos para así estar preparados cuando llegue el momento.\n\nYo he de obtener $2106w salmones al horno para aquellos que luchen en Ahn'Qiraj. La última vez que los conté había $2105w."
G["Greetings, $c. My name is Thork--I lead the defenses here in the name of the Warchief.\n\nI see you have had a chance to help out here at the Crossroads. Carry on for the Horde!"]="你好，$c。我的名字是索克。以酋长的名义，我指挥这里的防御。\n\n你已经在十字路口立下了许多功绩。继续为部落而奋战吧！"
G["Greetings, $c. Our position here is a bit exposed given the build up of the Horde's forces to the south.\n\nAnything that you can do to help will be greatly appreciated."]="你好，$c。我们在这里的位置已经暴露了，部落的军队正在南方集结。\n\n我们将非常感激你为我们提供的一切帮助。"
G["Greetings, $c. Please be brief in how the Kirin Tor may be of service to you."]="你好，$c。请简要介绍肯瑞托能如何为你效力。"
G["Greetings, $c. The Fire Lord has twisted our former brothers and sisters into avatars of molten fury. Even now, the Druids of the Flame carry out his insane plan to destroy the World Tree. We will not let that happen."]="你好，$c。这些德鲁伊都曾是我们的兄弟姐妹，可现在他们已经被炎魔之王变成了熔岩的化身。现在，烈焰德鲁伊们就在执行他的疯狂计划，试图烧毁世界之树。我们绝对不能让他们得逞。"
G["Greetings, $c. We Wildhammer reward our friends."]="你好，$c。我们蛮锤绝对不会亏待朋友。"
G["Greetings, $c. We shaman have gathered here at Firestone Point to watch over the land and tend to its wounds."]="你好，$c。我们萨满祭司聚集在火石岗哨，照看这片土地，治疗它受到的伤害。"
G["Greetings, $c. Your people are inside. But first, may I ask a favor?"]="你好啊，$c。你们的人在里面。但我能不能先请你帮我个忙？"
G["Greetings, $n!"]="你好，$n！"
G["Greetings, $n! Before I join my brothers in battle, I must practice the healing arts."]="你好啊，$n！在我上战场和兄弟并肩作战之前，我必须先练好我的治疗术。"
G["Greetings, $n."]="你好，$n。"
G["Greetings, $n.  As you rise in rank among the forces of Honor Hold, I will give you access to some of the different goods we keep in stock."]="你好，$n。随着你在荣耀堡的声望不断提升，我将允许你使用一些我们库存的其它物品。"
G["Greetings, $n.  How goes your delvings into the demonic and arcane?  Have you uncovered any dark secrets of late?"]="你好，$n。你对魔法的研究进展得怎么样啦？你解开了黑暗的秘密了吗？"
G["Greetings, $n.  I have a fine selection of brews available for you.  If you are interested, I can also teach you to make your own."]="你好啊，$n。我为你精心挑选了几种美酒。要是你有兴趣，我还愿意把酿造的本领传授给你。"
G["Greetings, $n.  We've travelled from Moonglade to spread the spirit of the Lunar Festival far and wide.\n\nWon't you join us in our celebration?"]="Saludos, $n. Venimos desde Claro de la Luna para propagar el espíritu del Festival Lunar por todas partes.\n\n¿No te vas a unir a nuestra celebración?"
G["Greetings, $n. Are you as thirsty as I am?"]="你好，$n。你也像我一样口渴吗？"
G["Greetings, $n. Are you enjoying the festival?"]="你好，$n。你喜欢这个节日吗？"
G["Greetings, $n. Are you ready to train?"]="Saludos, $n. ¿$gListo:Lista; para tu instrucción?"
G["Greetings, $n. Have you come to learn of the history of Ironforge?"]="你好，$n 。你是来学习铁炉堡的历史的？"
G["Greetings, $n. I am Doctor Gregory Victor, head trauma surgeon of Horde Trauma."]="你好，$n。我是格里高利·维克托医生，部落的首席外科医生。"
G["Greetings, $n. I am Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen, head trauma surgeon of Alliance Trauma."]="你好，$n。我是古斯塔夫·范沃森医生，联盟的首席外科医生。"
G["Greetings, $n. I am Durkot Wolfbrother, protector of the pack."]="欢迎你，$n。我是杜尔克特·狼兄，氏族的守护者。"
G["Greetings, $n. I am Johnny McWeaksauce. I am used as a tool by developers to carry out specific functions for the purpose of testing. For this test period, I am set to do two specific things:\n\n(1) Flag you as having done the Naxxramas attunement quest so that you are able to accept the next quest, \"Echoes of War\" from Commander Eligor Dawnbringer. You must first complete that quest to be able to access the quests for your Tier 3 armor set.\n\n(2) Teleport you to Naxxramas.\n\nWhat is it that you require?"]="Saludos, $n. Soy Johnny MacSalsafloja. Los desarrolladores me han asignado unas funciones específicas de prueba. Durante este período de prueba, puedo realizar dos acciones específicas:\n\n(1) Marcarte de modo que quede indicado que has realizado la misión de armonización de Naxxramas y estás $glisto:lista; para aceptar la siguiente misión, \"Ecos de Guerra\", que el comandante Eligor Albar te asignará. Primero tendrás que completar esa misión para poder acceder a las misiones para conseguir tu armadura de Nivel 3.\n\n(2) Teletransportarte a Naxxramas.\n\n¿Qué deseas que haga por ti?"
G["Greetings, $n. I am Myolor Sunderfury, keeper of the Great Forge."]="你好，$n。我是米洛尔·怒斩，大熔炉的看守者。"
G["Greetings, $n. I can offer you training in the way of the mage."]="你好啊，$n。我可以对你进行法师方面的训练。"
G["Greetings, $n. I see that you are already flagged as having completed the quest to gain entry to Naxxramas. Be sure to speak with Commander Eligor Dawnbringer at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands to acquire the quest, \"Echoes of War.\" You must first complete that quest to be able to access the quests for your Tier 3 armor set.\n\nI am able to teleport you directly to Naxxramas or you may use the portal found in Plaguewood, to the west."]="\"Saludos, $n. Veo que ya llevas la marca de haber completado la misión para poder entrar en Naxxramas. Asegúrate de hablar con el comandante Eligor Albar en la Capilla de la Esperanza de la Luz en las Tierras de la Peste del Este para obtener la misión \"Ecos de Guerra\". Primero tendrás que completar esa misión para poder acceder a las misiones para conseguir tu armadura de Nivel 3.\n\nYo puedo teletransportarte directamente a Naxxramas o puedes utilizar el portal situado en el Bosque de la Peste, al oeste\"."
G["Greetings, $n. I see you've come from Orgrimmar to aid us. I'm glad. I want to be out of this forsaken forest as quickly as possible. I'd much rather be spending my time in Orgrimmar with a good ale.\n\nAlthough I cannot wait to hear how Belgrom talked you into coming out here."]="Saludos, $n. Veo que has venido desde Orgrimmar para ayudarnos. Me complace. Quiero salir del bosque de los Renegados tan rápido como sea posible. Preferiría pasar el tiempo en Orgrimmar con una buena cerveza en la mano.\n\nSi bien no puedo esperar a oír cómo me cuentas cómo Belgrom te convenció de que vinieras hasta aquí."
G["Greetings, $n. I will guide you through the cavern. Please try and keep up."]="你好，$n。我会带你游览时光之穴。请跟紧我。"
G["Greetings, $n. May Elune's wisdom guide your hand and heart. How may I help you today?"]="你好，$n。愿月神的智慧指引你的心灵。我能帮你做些什么吗？"
G["Greetings, $n. My fellow Sons of Lothar and I have been stuck on this miserable world for close to twenty years now. We held on as best we could, but it still amazes me that the threats we face today are just the shadows of our past failures.\n\nPerhaps you will help us atone for them?"]="Saludos, $n. Mis compañeros de los Hijos de Lothar y yo llevamos casi veinte años atrapados en este deprimente mundo. Hemos aguantado lo mejor que hemos podido, pero es asombroso ver que los peligros a los que nos enfrentamos hoy no son más que nuestros fracasos pasados.\n\n¿Nos ayudarás tú a superarlos?"
G["Greetings, $n. Proceed with caution..."]="你好，$n。要保持警惕……"
G["Greetings, $n. This is the workshop of Keeper Mimir."]="你好，$n。这里是守护者米米尔的工作室。"
G["Greetings, $n. You have freed me from this cave, and I wish to thank you. Please, accept my gift and my humble gratitude."]="你好，$n。你把我从这个洞里救了出来，我要谢谢你。请接受这份礼物以及我最衷心的感谢。"
G["Greetings, $n. You were not followed here, I trust?"]="你好，$n。我希望你不是被跟踪到这里的？"
G["Greetings, $p!\n\nWe have a chance to stop the Thunder King himself before he can reclaim his former power.\n\nEven on the Wandering Isle, his hateful name is remembered, and the sound of thunder feared by pandaren children."]="欢迎，$p！\n\n我们将有机会在雷电之王恢复力量前阻止他。\n\n即使在迷踪岛，此人也是臭名昭著。他的名号甚至可以止小儿夜啼。"
G["Greetings, $r $c. I am Commander Stronghammer, the ambassador representing the Alliance here. If you have any questions concerning the status of Alliance collections for the Ahn'Qiraj war effort, $g lad : lass;, don't hesitate to ask."]="你好，$R$c。我是此地的联盟大使汉默·石锤。$g小伙子:姑娘;，如果你想要了解联盟战争物资的收集情况，问我好了。"
G["Greetings, $r!  I trust this day finds you well?"]="你好，$r！我想你过得不错吧？"
G["Greetings, $r! Well timed indeed.\n\nWe had not expected to find anyone from the Alliance in this land."]="你好，$r！你来的正是时候。\n\n我们没想到在这里还能遇见联盟的人。"
G["Greetings, $r."]="Saludos, $r."
G["Greetings, $r.\n\nI am but a young sapling, grown here in Pandaria to become one with the land so that Tyrande may benefit from the stories it holds.The Strongbows have volunteered to protect me in my infancy so that our mistress' wishes are fulfilled."]="欢迎你，$r。\n\n我还只是一棵小树苗，我将在潘达利亚扎根，与这片土地融为一体。这样，泰兰德才能从它蕴藏的故事中受益。为了达成她的心愿，强弓家族自愿留下来保护我渡过幼年期。"
G["Greetings, $r.\n\nI can see from a glance that you are a great adventurer.\n\nAll across the land, there are dark crypts and vast palaces, all full of terrible and mighty enemies. They guard many secrets, but also... harbor great rewards.\n\nThe bravest of heroes may venture to attempt these encounters, but beware! You would be racing against time, as well as testing your skill against other heroes!\n\nAre you up for the challenge?"]="你好，$r。\n\n我一眼就能看出你是位伟大的冒险家。\n\n在这片土地上，到处都是漆黑的地穴和广阔的宫殿，里面充满既可怕又强大的敌人。他们守着许多秘密，可是……高风险也意味着高收益。\n\n英雄中的佼佼者可以去试试身手，但千万要多加小心！你要跟时间赛跑，还要和其他英雄比拼技能。\n\n你愿意接受挑战吗？"
G["Greetings, $r.\n\nI have been expecting you."]="你好，$r。\n\n我一直在盼着你。"
G["Greetings, $r.\n\nI'm afraid you must excuse me as I'm terribly busy at the moment."]="你好，$r。\n\n非常抱歉，你得体谅我一下，我现在实在是太忙了。"
G["Greetings, $r.\n\nIf you are interested in helping with the defense of the temple, please speak with Lord Afrasastrasz inside."]="你好，$r。\n\n如果你愿意帮助我们保卫神殿的话，请入内与指挥官阿弗拉沙斯塔兹谈一谈。"
G["Greetings, $r.\n\nMy shop is finally open. I hope you like what you see!"]="你好，$r。\n\n我的商店终于开张了。希望你能找到你想要的东西！"
G["Greetings, $r.  I am Ambassador Sunsorrow of the sin'dorei, or blood elves as we are commonly known.  I have high hopes that this new bond between us and the Horde will be mutually beneficial."]="你好，$R。我是辛多雷——也就是血精灵一族的大使欧诺·炎伤。我忠心希望我们与部落新建立起来的友好关系对双方都有好处。"
G["Greetings, $r.  I am the sworn protector of Watcher Megana.  She has special gifts that I... uh, our leaders... greatly admire, and must be guarded closely."]="欢迎，$r。我是观察者麦佳娜的忠实守卫。她有着特殊的天赋，令我……呃，我们的领袖……十分欣赏，所以必须受到严密的保护。"
G["Greetings, $r. I am Franclorn Forgewright. Are you here to learn of the Spire and of Dark Iron?"]="你好，$r。我是弗兰克罗恩·铸铁。你是来了解黑石塔和黑铁矮人的吗？"
G["Greetings, $r. I am Hidalgo, master of the hunt and world class falconer. This killing machine that you see perched atop my shoulder is Excelsior.\n\nYou might be thinking to yourself, \"What does a falconer even do?\" Well I'll tell you what we do - we hunt! Falconry is the art of using a bird of prey to hunt and catch game. Perhaps you are interested in learning to hunt with a trained raptor? Hidalgo can teach you such things!"]="Saludos, $r. Soy Hidalgo, maestro de la caza y uno de los mejores halconeros del mundo. Esta máquina de matar que ves posada sobre mi hombro es Excelsior.\n\nPuede que estés pensando: \"¿Qué diablos hace un halconero?\" Yo te lo diré: ¡cazamos! La halconería es el arte de usar un ave rapaz para cazar y recoger la presa. ¿Quizá te interese aprender a cazar con un ave entrenada? ¡Hidalgo puede enseñarte!"
G["Greetings, $r. I am Lord Itharius of the Green Dragonflight.\n\nI am here to free my kin from the evil within this temple, hopefully for good. Will you assist me?"]="你好，$r。我是绿龙军团的伊萨里奥斯勋爵。\n\n我带着善良的意愿来到这里，要从这座神殿的邪恶中解救我的同族。你愿意帮助我吗？"
G["Greetings, $r. I may be small, but size doesn't matter in a pet battle!"]="你好，$r。我也许比较小，但是在宠物的战斗中身材大小并不重要！"
G["Greetings, $r. I sense some confusion at my presence here. The others harbor suspicion as well, and I cannot blame them, after what my brethren have put them through.\n\nMuch has happened since the events at the Sunwell, little of it good. And so it falls to me to pick up the pieces, and attempt to salvage the pride of my flight. There is much to say, and more to do, but know this: Not all in the Blue Dragonflight blame the mortal races of Azeroth for the troubles that have befallen the world.\n\nSome of us have more sense than that."]="你好，$r。我察觉到你对我出现在这里感到困惑。其他人也心存怀疑，不过鉴于我的同胞给他们带来的遭遇，我并不怪他们。\n\n太阳之井事件后发生了很多事，几乎没有一样是好事。我着手开始收拾残局，希望能挽救我此行带来的影响。要说的很多，要做的更多，不过记住这一点：不是蓝龙军团的每个成员都责怪艾泽拉斯的凡人给这个世界带来的祸患。\n\n我们中的某些成员对此有着更深的理解。"
G["Greetings, $r. Please do not alarm yourself. I am indeed speaking to you in your native tongue.\n\nMy own considerable raptor intelligence has been augmented through a series of experiments. You may refer to me as \"Subject Nine,\" an identity recently bestowed to me by my creators, who are otherwise at the moment occupied or deceased. Perhaps you can render me some assistance?"]="Saludos, $r. Por favor, no te alarmes. Es cierto que estoy hablándote en tu lengua nativa.\n\nMi considerable inteligencia de raptor ha sido aumentada gracias a una serie de experimentos. Puedes dirigirte a mí como \"Sujeto Nueve\", una identidad que recientemente me han otorgado mis creadores quienes, en estos momentos, están ocupados o fallecidos. Quizá puedas prestarme tu ayuda."
G["Greetings, $r. The war materiel is gradually being sent on its way and should be at Cenarion Hold within $2113w day's time. We can only hope that once it is there that someone, having assembled the Scepter of the Shifting Sands, will step forward to ring the gong and open the gates."]="你好，$R。战争物资正在运往塞纳里奥要塞的途中，货物将在$2113w天内抵达。我们只希望那时会有一位拿着流沙节杖的英雄敲响铜锣，打开安其拉的大门。"
G["Greetings, $r. The war materiel is on its way and should be at Cenarion Hold within a day's time. We can only hope that once it is there that someone, having assembled the Scepter of the Shifting Sands, will step forward to ring the gong and open the gates."]="你好，$R。战争物资正在运往塞纳里奥要塞的途中，货物将在1天内抵达。我们只希望那时会有一位拿着流沙节杖的英雄敲响铜锣，打开安其拉的大门。"
G["Greetings, $r. Wonderful day to be alive, is it not?"]="你好，$r。活着真好，不是吗？"
G["Greetings, $r. Your noble actions are acknowledged. May Elune protect you."]="你好，$r。你高尚的行为已经得到了认可。愿艾露恩保佑你。"
G["Greetings, Chen, Li Li. You may stay, but I do not need any of your ale."]="你们好，陈，丽丽。欢迎你们，但我不需要你的啤酒。"
G["Greetings, Hero! I see you've just begun your journey. Perhaps I could offer you a mount to hasten your travel? Free of charge, of course."]="Saludos, héroe¡ Veo que has comenzado tu viaje. Quizás podría ofrecerte una montura para acelerar tus desplazamientos¿ Sin cargo alguno, por supuesto."
G["Greetings, I am Shaohao. Are you hear to hear the wisdom of the Celestials?"]="你好，我是少昊。你是来聆听至尊天神教诲的吗？"
G["Greetings, Light of Elune be with you."]="你好，愿艾露恩之光与你同在。"
G["Greetings, again. Our next trial will be more challenging. Prepare to defend me."]="你好啊。我们的下一场试炼更具挑战性。准备保护我！"
G["Greetings, ancient one. I have done all that has been asked of me. I now ask that you grant me Lok'delar."]="你好，古老的生物。我完成了你所要求的所有事情。我要求你现在赐予我罗克迪洛尔。"
G["Greetings, ancient one. I have done all that has been asked of me. I now ask that you grant me Rhok'delar."]="你好，古老的生物。我完成了你所要求的所有事情。我要求你现在赐予我伦鲁迪洛尔。"
G["Greetings, and welcome.  I am not very good at smiling, but trust me; I am happy to serve you."]="你好，欢迎。我不太擅长微笑，但是相信我；我很高兴能为您服务。"
G["Greetings, citizen."]="Saludos, $gciudadano:ciudadana;."
G["Greetings, citizen. I ask that you move along if you have nothing to ask of me."]="Saludos, $gciudadano:ciudadana;. Te ruego que sigas tu camino si es que no tienes nada que preguntarme."
G["Greetings, elder. It is time for your people to end their hostility toward the draenei and their allies."]="您好，长者。是时候让您的人民结束对德莱尼人和他们的同盟的敌意了。"
G["Greetings, fleshling. I am Navuud, chief researcher here at the Protectorate Watch Post."]="你好，肉人。我是纳乌德，维序派哨站的主研究员。"
G["Greetings, friend of the Brotherhood."]="Saludos, $gamigo:amiga; de la Hermandad."
G["Greetings, friend!  Can I interest you in some ectoplasmic capacitors?  Or perhaps a nice omni-directional spectral assimilator?"]="¡Saludos, $gamigo:amiga;! ¿Puedo ofrecerte un condensador ectoplásmico? ¿O quizás un fabuloso asimilador de espectros omnidireccional?"
G["Greetings, friend! I do not get many visitors up here, do you wish to hear a tale of the Vale of Eternal Blossoms?"]="Saludos, $gamigo:amiga;. No recibo muchas visitas por aquí. ¿Quieres escuchar un cuento del Valle de la Flor Eterna?"
G["Greetings, friend."]="Saludos, $gamigo:amiga;."
G["Greetings, friend.\n\nEnjoying the glade, I trust?"]="你好，朋友。\n\n相信你很喜欢这个地方吧？"
G["Greetings, friend.  Something I can do for ya?"]="Saludos, $gamigo:amiga;. ¿Puedo hacer algo por ti?"
G["Greetings, friend. Can I get you a mug of anything?"]="Saludos, $gamigo:amiga;. ¿Puedo servirte una jarra de lo que sea?"
G["Greetings, friends."]="你们好，朋友们。"
G["Greetings, hapless adventurer.  I ask only that you wait a moment...and BLEED!"]="你好啊，倒霉的冒险者。我只会让你们付出一点点时间……和许多的血！"
G["Greetings, hero. I craft and sell Ahn'kahar Blood Hunter armor for hunters."]="Saludos, $ghéroe:heroína;. Yo fabrico y vendo la armadura cazador de sangre de Ahn'kahar para cazadores."
G["Greetings, hero. I craft and sell Bloodmage armor for magi."]="Saludos, $ghéroe:heroína;. Yo fabrico y vendo la armadura de mago sangriento para magos."
G["Greetings, hero. I craft and sell Crimson Acolyte armor for priests."]="Saludos, $ghéroe:heroína;. Yo fabrico y vendo la armadura de acólito carmesí para sacerdotes."
G["Greetings, hero. I craft and sell Dark Coven armor for warlocks."]="Saludos, $ghéroe:heroína;. Yo fabrico y vendo la armadura Aquelarre oscuro para brujos."
G["Greetings, hero. I craft and sell Freya's Lasherweave armor for druids."]="Saludos, $ghéroe:heroína;. Yo fabrico y vendo la armadura tejeazote de Freya para druidas."
G["Greetings, hero. I craft and sell Frost Witch armor for shaman."]="Saludos, $ghéroe:heroína;. Yo fabrico y vendo la armadura bruja de escarcha para chamanes."
G["Greetings, hero. I craft and sell Lightsworn armor for paladins."]="Saludos, $ghéroe:heroína;. Yo fabrico y vendo la armadura juraluz para paladines."
G["Greetings, hero. I craft and sell Shadowblade armor for rogues."]="Saludos, $ghéroe:heroína;. Yo fabrico y vendo la armadura Hoja de las Sombras para pícaros."
G["Greetings, hero. I craft and sell Ymirjar Lord's armor for warriors."]="Saludos, $ghéroe:heroína;. Yo fabrico y vendo la armadura de señor Ymirjar para guerreros."
G["Greetings, kind stranger, and thank you for your selfless act."]="善良的陌生人，我向你的无私致敬。"
G["Greetings, little one.  You have business with the Waterlords?"]="Saludos, $gpequeñajo:pequeñaja;. ¿Tienes que hablar de algo con los Señores del Agua?"
G["Greetings, mage.  Shall I provide you with further insight into the world of magic?"]="Saludos, $gmago:maga;. ¿Quieres que te informe más a fondo sobre el mundo de la magia?"
G["Greetings, mortal."]="你好，凡人。"
G["Greetings, mortals!  I have been activated by the Discs of Norgannon to assist you!"]="你好，凡人！我已被诺甘农圆盘激活，愿意为你提供帮助！"
G["Greetings, my $g brother : sister;. How can I guide you today?"]="你好，我的$g兄弟:姐妹;。今天你需要怎样的指引呢？"
G["Greetings, my $g lord : lady;. I trust that you are having a pleasant time?"]="你好，尊敬的$g先生:女士;。我相信你一定过得很愉快？"
G["Greetings, my $r friend. You honor me with your presence.\n\nHow may I help you?"]="¡Saludos, $r $gamigo mío:amiga mía;! Me honras con tu presencia.\n\n¿Cómo puedo ayudarte?"
G["Greetings, my friend.  May the Dawn keep you well in these troubled times."]="Saludos, $gamigo:amiga;. Que el Alba te cuide en estos tiempos terribles."
G["Greetings, my name is Tae'thelan Bloodwatcher. I have spent the better part of a lifetime training in the art of sorcery and gathering like-minded blood elves to form The Reliquary.\n\nYou see, there are ancient, powerful relics spread throughout this world that I plan to use to free my people from their addiction and unify them again  as the proud, indomitable race we once were.\n\nMagic is something to be embraced and, I assure you, a force that can be utilized free of corruption with proper teaching.\n\nAs it stands, the other races of the Alliance and even the Horde mock our kind for our half-destroyed capital, still-standing statues of Sunstrider and blunder after blunder across the world.\n\nNo more."]="你好，我名叫泰瑟兰·血望者。我将一生中最好的时光都用来进行巫术的训练，并召集与我志同道合的血精灵，组成了神圣遗物学会。\n\n要知道，在这个世界的各个角落里埋藏着许多古老、强大的宝物。我打算利用这些宝物将我的族人从他们堕落的嗜好中解救出来，让他们重新团结为一体，成为往日那个光荣而坚强的种族。\n\n我可以向你保证，魔法是可以接触的。只要得到适当的教导，任何人都能使用这种力量并且免于因它而堕落。\n\n现在，联盟的各个种族，甚至是部落的人都在嘲笑我们遭受重创的首都，仍然矗立的逐日者雕像，和我们在世界各处一次又一次遭受的挫折。\n\n但这种情况不会再继续下去了。"
G["Greetings, noble $c.  This humble servant of the Cenarion Circle wishes blessings and bounties be given unto you and yours."]="您好，尊贵的$c。我这个塞纳里奥议会的谦卑的仆从愿祝福与您同在。"
G["Greetings, outsider.\n\n<Zin eyes you warily.>"]="Hola, $gforastero:forastera;.\n\n<Zin te observa con recelo.>"
G["Greetings, soldier. Are you here to help the cause?"]="士兵，你好。你是来帮我的吗？"
G["Greetings, soldier. Intelligence has reported that the Winterax trolls to the west have taken a master goblin engineer prisoner. Perhaps you should investigate?"]="你好，士兵。据报道西边的冰斧巨魔抓走了一名地精工程师。或许你得去调查一下？"
G["Greetings, traveler! Care to delve into the mysteries of the arcane? Hm?"]="¡Saludos, $gviajero:viajera;! ¿Quieres sumergirte en los misterios de la magia Arcana? ¿Um?"
G["Greetings, traveler, I wish to thank you for lifting the exarch's hold. Ah, A'dal has sent you?"]="Saludos, $gforastero:forastera;, me gustaría darte las gracias por librarnos del exarca. Ah, ¿A'dal te ha enviado?"
G["Greetings, traveler."]="¡Saludos $gviajero:viajera;!"
G["Greetings, traveler. As long as you remain within the walls of the Cenarion Hold, you will be safe from harm.\n\nBe wary when leaving the protection of the Hold as the silithid have been swarming as of late."]="Saludos, $gviajero:viajera;. Mientras permanezcas dentro de los muros del Fuerte Cenarion estarás a salvo.\n\nVe con cautela cuando abandones la protección del Fuerte pues últimamente hay muchos silítidos sueltos."
G["Greetings, traveler. I am Oronok. Please, sit by my fire and warm yourself.\n\nBeware the ravenous beasts of the shattered shelf below us!"]="Saludos, $gviajero:viajera; Soy Oronok. Siéntate al lado de mi fuego y caliéntate.\n\n¡Ten cuidado con las hambrientas criaturas que hay por debajo de nosotros!"
G["Greetings, traveler. It was here, nearly 1,000 years past, that the Qiraji began their march of destruction across Kalimdor.\n\nThousands of lives were lost during the war, most in this cursed desert during the initial invasion.\n\nI am one of only a few that remain, chained to both the past and the present. I know not why I am to remain stationed here but I know that I must."]="Saludos, $gviajero:viajera;. Fue aquí, hace casi 1000 años, donde los qiraji comenzaron su oleada de destrucción por Kalimdor.\n\nSe perdieron miles de vidas durante la guerra, la mayoría de ellas en este desierto maldito durante la invasión inicial.\n\nYo soy una de los pocos que quedamos, atados tanto al pasado como al presente. No sé por qué tengo que permanecer aquí pero sé que no puedo hacer nada para evitarlo."
G["Greetings, traveler. Welcome to The Golden Lantern!"]="你好，旅行者。欢迎光临金色神灯！"
G["Greetings, travelers. I have been instructed to treat any bearer of a key to Karazhan as an honored guest of the Master. Feel free to ask any questions you wish of me. How may I assist you?"]="您好，旅行者。我奉命在此接待主人的贵客，所有携带着卡拉赞钥匙的人都会被奉为上宾。如果您有什么疑问，请尽管开口。有什么需要我帮忙的吗？"
G["Greetings, travelers. The tides of destiny have brought you far from the bright world above. I know what it is you seek - and it lies there before you..."]="你好，旅行者。命运之潮指引你们从遥远明亮的世界而来。我知道你们在寻找什么——而他就在你们的面前……"
G["Greetings, traveller. I had not thought to see a friendly Horde face on these shores."]="你好，旅行者。没想到在这片海滩上还能看到一个友善的部落人士。"
G["Greetings, young $c."]="你好，年轻的$c。"
G["Greetings, young $c. In preparation for the war at Ahn'Qiraj against the Silithid, the Alliance has asked me to head up their collection of purple lotus. This flower has many uses that I am aware of, and thus, I have agreed to help them attain $2055w. To date we have collected $2053w."]="紫莲花的用处很多，年轻的$c。联盟派我收集这种花，为安其拉之战做好准备。我答应帮助他们收集$2055w份紫莲花，目前我们已经收集到了$2053w份。"
G["Greetings, young one, it is good to see a noble soul again.\n\nDire Maul, formerly Eldre'thalas, is corrupt to its very core. I have watched my brethren fall to the forces of darkness and chaos. Many would have this place razed to the ground to end its horrors forever.\n\nBut Dire Maul is worth saving, mortal. Help me, and perhaps together we can unleash the vast power lost here for the forces of good, as they once were so long ago."]="你好，年轻人，真高兴能再见到一个高贵的灵魂。\n\n埃德萨拉已经彻底堕落，成为了今日的厄运之槌。我亲眼看着我的同胞们败倒在黑暗和混乱力量的脚下。可能许多人都认为，只有把这里彻底夷为平地，才能永远结束盘踞在这里的恐怖。\n\n但厄运之槌还是值得拯救的，凡人。帮帮我，也许我们的共同努力能够重新唤醒这里巨大的善良力量，让久远以前的美好时代重新回来。"
G["Greetings, young shaman.  Make yourself at home within my reef."]="你好，年轻的萨满祭司。"
G["Greetings."]="你好。"
G["Greetings.  Do you seek instruction in art of war?"]="你好。你想要学一些战斗技巧吗？"
G["Greetings.  Have you come to master matters magical?"]="你好。你是来寻找魔法导师的吗？"
G["Greetings.  I am Anchorite Avuun of the draenei.  I am here studying the Lost Ones of the Fallow Sanctuary in the hope of being able to find a cure for their condition."]="你好。我是德莱尼学者阿弗恩。我在这里研究农田避难所的失落者们，希望可以找到一个治愈他们的办法。"
G["Greetings.  I am Anchorite Delan - one of the draenei.  I am a teacher of sorts.  And who might you be?"]="你好。我是学者德尔兰，一个德莱尼人。你是谁？"
G["Greetings.  I am Chronos - He Who Never Forgets.  My memory is without flaw, and exact to the most minor detail.\n\nTrust me."]="你好。我是克洛诺斯——记忆力天下第一的克洛诺斯。我是不会忘记任何微小的细节的。\n\n相信我。"
G["Greetings.  I'm a female mage trainer, and you're a mage."]="Saludos. Soy instructora de magos y tú eres $gun mago:una maga;."
G["Greetings.  I'm a gnome mage trainer, and you're a mage."]="Saludos. Soy un gnomo instructor de magos y tú eres $gun mago:una maga;."
G["Greetings.  I'm a warlock trainer, and you're a warlock."]="Saludos. Soy un instructor de brujos y tú eres $gun brujo:una bruja;."
G["Greetings.  I'm a warlock trainer, but you're not a warlock!"]="Saludos. Soy un instructor de brujos, ¡pero tú no eres $gun brujo:una bruja;!"
G["Greetings.  I'm an undead mage trainer, and you're a mage."]="Saludos. Soy un instructor de magos no-muertos y tú eres $gun mago:una maga;."
G["Greetings.  If you are here for leather goods, then you will find my wares well crafted."]="你好。如果你是来找皮件的，那么你会看到我的货品做工精细。"
G["Greetings.  Our bats are well trained and fed.  You'll not find faster."]="你好。我们的蝙蝠训练很严而且吃得不错。你不会找到比他们还快的了。"
G["Greetings.  You are here to help?"]="你好。你是过来帮忙的吗？"
G["Greetings.  You seek instruction in the art of war?"]="你好。你想要学一些战斗技巧吗？"
G["Greetings. How may we of the Royal Exchange Bank assist you today?"]="你好，今天有什么可以帮你的吗？"
G["Greetings. I am Sikari, master of jade lightning, chi, and healing mists. For this trial, you must protect me from the incoming illusions, while I heal you and dispatch our foes."]="你好。我是司佳丽，碎玉闪电、真气与治疗之雾的大师。在试炼中，你得保护我，挡住涌来的幻影。而我会治疗你并对付我们敌人。"
G["Greetings..."]="欢迎……"
G["Greetins $n.  You want to learn the art of workin with leather?  I also got a fine selection of crafted goods if that's whatcha need."]="你好啊，$n。想学习制皮技术吗？如果你需要，我这里还有不少精美的手工制品。"
G["Gregarious Grell Pet"]="合群的小劣魔宠物"
G["Gregor, you coward! Orcs of pure blood are dying off our shores. If you doom them, you doom us all."]="格雷戈，你这个懦夫！兽人的鲜血正泼洒在我们的海岸上。如果你毁灭了他们，你就把我们全都毁了。"
G["Gregory is one of our new allies from Gilneas.  It is easy to assume that he cannot be involved in this, so we've decided to trust him."]="他是我们的新盟友，从吉尔尼斯而来。很容易就能推断出他并未牵涉进此事，我们能够相信他。"
G["Gregory, please take the prisoner back to the sentinels so that we can deal with him properly."]="格雷戈里，请将这名凡人带给哨兵，我们将公正的对待他。"
G["Grek get drink!"]="葛雷克醉了！"
G["Grek try!"]="葛雷克试试！"
G["Grek, will you try out this new weapon oil Rakoria made?"]="葛雷克，你想试试这些拉克妮亚做的新武器油吗？"
G["Grekk holds them.\n\nMaybe he'll give you one if you help him out. The next time you're up north at Blue Sky logging Grounds be sure to talk to him."]="格利克有很多钥匙。\n\n如果你肯帮他的忙，他或许会考虑送你一把。下次你造访蓝天伐木场时，记得找他谈谈。"
G["Gremlock doesn't always have the best of luck with cooking, but he does have some tasty recipies worth learning.  Go chat him up in the Thunderbrew Distillery and see what he'll teach ye."]="格雷姆罗克烹饪的手艺不一定是最好的，但他确实有些美味的食谱值得学习。到雷酒酿制厂找他聊聊，看看他能教给你什么。"
G["Grenade Launcher Armed."]="榴弹发射器已装弹。"
G["Grgggl! Glmrbrgl Uhglrglrglr!"]="¡Grgggl! ¡Glmrbrgl Uhglrglrglr!"
G["Grglmbrgl? Mrgl glbmrgl rawglgl!"]="¿Grglmbrgl? ¡Mrgl glbmrgl rawglgl!"
G["Gri'lek wanders... no more..."]="格里雷克……不再游荡了……"
G["Gri'lek, of the Iron Blood\n\nThe wanderer.  May his strength and lust for battle pierce the ages.\n\nGri'lek now lingers near the edge of madness..."]="钢铁之血格里雷克\n\n游荡者。愿他的力量和对战争的渴望生生不息。\n\n格里雷克就在疯狂之缘那边……"
G["Gri'lek, of the Iron Blood\n\nThe wanderer.  May his strength and lust for battle pierce the ages.  \n\nGri'lek now dwells far from here.  One day, he may return..."]="钢铁之血格里雷克\n\n游荡者。愿他的力量和对战争的渴望生生不息。\n\n格里雷克正在遥远的地方徘徊。总有一天，他会回来的……"
