G["Grizzle has given you a portable cluster rocket!  Use it on the saurok eggs nearby."]="格里兹尔给了你一把便携集束火箭！用它对附近的蜥蜴人卵使用。"
G["Grizzle has given you a portable death ray!  Use it on the saurok eggs nearby."]="格里兹尔给了你一把便携死亡射线枪！用它对附近的蜥蜴人卵使用。"
G["Grizzle has given you a portable flamethrower!  Use it on the saurok eggs nearby."]="格里兹尔给了你一把便携式火焰喷射器！用它来对付附近的蜥蜴卵。"
G["Grizzle has given you a set of landmines!  Use them on the saurok eggs nearby."]="格里兹尔给了你一把地雷！用它对附近的蜥蜴人卵使用。"
