G["Grkkk!"]="呃！"
G["Grobbulus, the first of what was to be an army of flesh giants. It carried the plague slime of Naxxramas within its body, injecting the living ooze into the bodies of its foe. The recipient of this foul injection would usually flee to his allies, bringing them down with him."]="格罗布鲁斯，天灾军团制造的血肉巨人。格罗布鲁斯体内蠕动着纳克萨玛斯的软泥怪，能侵蚀给任何敢于靠近它的敌人。被注入软泥怪的受体通常会逃回盟友身边，顷刻之间就能击溃所有人。"
