G["Grrr... I was going to fight you fair and square, but you decided to bring friends. Fine! Behold the Alloy-Pounder Zero!"]="呃……我原本打算光明正大的与你公平交手，可你却带来了帮手。好吧！来面对合金锤击者零式吧！"
