G["Grummles en route for Neverrest Basecamp gather round for the lighting of the traditional travel incense."]="前往不息营地的土地精聚集在一起，点燃了传统的旅者熏香。"
G["Grummles have good noses. Can tell the difference between good and bad fortune by the smell. You have the smell of good fortune about you."]="土地精的鼻子很灵。能通过气味辨别是好运还是厄运。你身上有好运的气息。"
