G["Grummles! Come and breathe deep of travel incense. Go with good fortune to Burlap Waystation!"]="土地精们！过来深吸几口旅者熏香吧。它能让你的粗麻驿站之旅好运相伴！"
G["Grummles! Gather round and breathe deep of travel incense. Go with good fortune to Kota Basecamp!"]="土地精！都过来吸一口旅者熏香，带着好运前往寇塔营地！"
