G["Guarding the bank and treasures of the Horde is far more satisfying than dispensing coins and trade goods from inside a cage of iron.\n\nI would not exchange places with one of those quill-pushing goblins for a moment."]="守卫部落的银行和财宝要比呆在一个铁笼子里分派钱币，收发物品有意思多了。\n\n我可不会和那些只知道耍笔杆子的地精交换工作。"
