G["Ha - harrrum! Food? We don't eat squishlings, friend, not unless they aggravate us. We eat rocks and stones and earth. Though I sometimes find the crunch of bones makes a delightful seasoning.\n\n<Gormungan lifts up a boulder and, with one enormous hand, smashes the corpses you've given him onto the boulder as one would put icing on a cupcake. He crunches his treat, rumbling happily.>"]="哈——啊哈！食物？我们可不吃这种有汁水的东西，朋友，除非他们来伤害我们。我们吃的是岩石、石块和沙砾。不过有时候我也觉得嚼嚼小骨头是一种不错的调剂。\n\n<格蒙刚用一只巨大的手举起一块巨石。将你带来的尸体摁在上面，就好象在蛋糕上放一块水果。然后在一阵宏亮的“嘎吱”声中，他把那块石头嚼碎，咽下了肚。>"
G["Ha ha ha ha ha!  Rah ha ha ha ha ha!"]="哈哈哈哈哈！哈哈哈哈哈！"
G["Ha ha ha ha ha! The heroes have made it to the glorious finale. I take it you are in good spirits? Prepared for the final battle? Then gaze now upon my ultimate creation! RISE, SISTER!"]="啊，英雄们坚持到了辉煌的尾声。你们斗志昂扬，为最后一战做好准备了吧？那就看看我的终极造物！复活吧，妹妹！"
G["Ha ha ha ha!"]="哈哈哈哈！"
G["Ha ha ha haaa! I haven't felt like this in YEARS! Don't worry, $p... I've been in worse scraps than this. A fighting spirit like yours is welcome in the Alliance.  Now, let's get back to business."]="哈哈哈哈哈！好多年没有这么痛快过了！别担心，我的新朋友……我还受过比这更重的伤呢。联盟欢迎你这样勇敢的斗士！现在，我们来谈正事吧……"
G["Ha ha ha!"]="哈哈哈！"
G["Ha ha ha!  Those rats must be real scared now!"]="哈哈哈！那些老鼠现在肯定真的害怕了！"
G["Ha ha ha! Is that all you got?"]="哈哈哈！你就这点能耐？"
G["Ha ha ha! What bad luck you have! It's Proboskus! Ahhh ha ha ha! I've got twenty five gold that says you die in the fire!"]="哈哈哈！你可真够倒霉的！是普罗波库斯！啊哈哈哈！我敢出25个金币打赌，你肯定会被烧死的！"
G["Ha ha ha."]="哈哈哈。"
G["Ha ha!"]="哈哈！"
G["Ha ha!  Excellent!  Maybe I'll see to it that you get your names recommended to Garrosh.  Now, back to work!  Lok'tar ogar!"]="哈哈！很好！也许我会把你们的名字推荐给加尔鲁什。现在快去干活儿！Lok'tar ogar！"
G["Ha ha! Don't pull any punches!"]="哈哈！别放水嘛！"
G["Ha ha! Here comes the luckydo! I saw the idols explode from here."]="哈哈！是幸运星来了！我在这里都看见神像被炸飞了。"
G["Ha ha! I have Betsy!"]="哈哈！我找到伊丽莎白了！"
G["Ha ha! I have your Grindgear Gorilla!"]="哈哈！我得到了你的发条猩猩！"
G["Ha ha! The trial commences!"]="哈哈！试炼开始！"
G["Ha ha! There's no way they'll miss that, cannon fire or not."]="哈哈！他们肯定会看见这个，能不能开火都一样。"
G["Ha ha! What do you think of that, you old squid?!"]="哈哈！老鱿鱼，你觉得怎么样？！"
G["Ha ha, $n! I won't ever forget the look on Daryl's face when you showed him that head!"]="哈哈，$n！我永远不会忘记达瑞尔看到你时他脸上的表情！"
G["Ha ha, squishy naga!"]="哈哈，湿软的纳迦！"
G["Ha ha, you no touch Ik-Ik!"]="哈哈，你碰不到伊克伊克！"
G["Ha ha."]="哈哈。"
G["Ha hah hah! Benedictus, the Twilight Prophet!\n\nBwa ha ha ha!\n\nOh, that's a good one. Hoo-ee."]="哈哈哈！本尼迪塔斯，暮光先知！\n\n哇哈哈哈！\n\n噢，那真是太好了。万岁！"
G["Ha hah! That was glorious! I would fight by your side any day, $n."]="哈哈！这太精彩了！我随时都会和你并肩战斗，$n。"
G["Ha!  Did I not just say, good $n, chivalry and gallantry are the charge of the KNIGHT?  You seek only to be a SQUIRE.  The colossal burden of chivalry is unfit for the squire, for as I mentioned before, the only colossal burden that you are to bear is that of my belongings."]="哈！我没有说过吗，好$n，骑士精神和勇气是骑士必须坚持的原则？你要做的只是一名侍从。严格的骑士精神对于侍从来说是难以承受的重担。就像我曾经提到过的一样，你要扛起的担子只有我的随身物品。"
G["Ha!  I almost miss old Jum'ja.  He was tough.  But Ironhide seemed to chew through him easy enough."]="哈！我有点想念老祝玛伽了。他很强壮，但是铁皮轻而易举就将他干掉了。"
G["Ha!  That worked better than I thought!"]="哈！这比我想象中还要管用！"
G["Ha!  The bigger they are..."]="哈！他们要是再大一点……"
G["Ha!  You have failed!  Now I will pry my ark from your dead hands!"]="哈！你失败了！现在我要从你的手里把箱子拿走！"
G["Ha! 16! How many've you got? 10, maybe 11 if you're lucky?"]="哈！16！你呢？10个，还是11个啊？"
G["Ha! A challenge?!"]="哈！一个挑战者？！"
G["Ha! Didn't expect to see me here did you? The Monkey King does not delegate duelery! Now, are you hero? Or are you wikket?"]="¡Ja! ¿A ke tú no espera verme akí? ¡El Rey Mono no delega los duelos! ¿Y bien? ¿Tú es $ghéroe:heroína; o makaku?"
G["Ha! Do you remember nothing of Honor? Of glory on the battlefield?  You who would parlay with the humans, who allowed warlocks to practice their dark magics right under our feet.  You are weak."]="哈！你心中还有荣誉和战场的荣耀吗？你这个与人类媾和，允许术士在我们眼皮底下施行黑暗魔法的家伙。你这个懦夫。"
G["Ha! Efrem the Faithful wins again. Of course!"]="哈！虔诚者埃弗雷姆又胜利了。毫无悬念！"
G["Ha! Fooled you!"]="哈！你被骗了！"
G["Ha! Good fun!"]="哈！真好玩！"
G["Ha! Ha! Ha! Thank you for freeing me, fools. Now let me repay you by charring the flesh from your bones."]="哈！哈！哈！谢谢你们这些笨蛋放了我。现在让我吃掉你们的肉来报答你们吧。"
G["Ha! I caught up with ya! Let's stick together in 'ere, okay?"]="哈！我追上你了！让咱们并肩作战，行吗？"
G["Ha! I expected a challenge!"]="哈！我本以为能得到一个像样的挑战者！"
G["Ha! I had not realized you fools were still there."]="你们这些蠢货竟然还在我背上。"
G["Ha! I like our chances, $p."]="哈！我喜欢咱们的配合，$p。"
G["Ha! I'd take the sound of a Crater Cannon XT blasting off a shell over that any day!"]="哈！跟XT型火炮的声音比起来，那简直是蚊子叫！"
G["Ha! I'm more afraid that those old holes and gashes would burst that thing and I would be showered by the shrapnel!"]="哈！我更加担心你那破烂不堪的东西会炸成一千块！"
G["Ha! Let's see if you can figure this out!"]="哈！让我们瞧瞧你能不能看穿这个！"
G["Ha! Much better! Now you dookers gonna get it!"]="哈！这下好多了！现在你们这些坏蛋要倒霉了！"
G["Ha! Now your death is ensured!"]="哈！现在你死定了！"
G["Ha! Suchi wins this round."]="哈！这回合苏琪赢了。"
G["Ha! The old magic fingers finally won through! Now let's get down to--"]="哈！看来还是我这把老骨头厉害呀！然后再看看这里……"
G["Ha! Too easy!"]="哈！轻而易举！"
G["Ha! We've weathered storms worse than this, $n. Now hurry, you don't want to keep Garrosh waiting!"]="哈！我们还见识过比这更可怕的风暴呢，$n。那么，快行动吧，可别让加尔鲁什久等了！"
G["Ha! What say you to master swordsman, Tenwu the Red Smoke?"]="哈！你要对剑术大师“赤烟”腾武说点儿什么？"
G["Ha! You ain't got what it takes... yet! Come back to me after you've learned a few things!"]="哈！你仍然还没有所需的……！你学会些东西后再来找我！"
