G["Ha! You throw like my greatmother."]="哈！你的动作倒真像是我的老祖母。"
G["Ha! You're the one who was supposed to be watchin' the keg!"]="哈！桶本该是归你看管的！"
G["Ha, 54! In the home stretch now!"]="哈，54！进入最后冲刺阶段！"
G["Ha, not at all!  Though it is a striking coincidence.  Gnomeregan has been and continues to shame our people.  It is long past time we reclaim our homeland."]="哈，才不是呢！尽管这是个令人惊异的巧合。诺莫瑞根一直都在令我们的人民蒙羞。我们早该夺回自己的家园了。"
G["Ha, such an amusing gesture from the rabble. When I have finished with you, my master's blade will feast upon your souls. Die."]="哈，一群不自量力的乌合之众。等我杀了你们之后，主人的剑就能尽情享用你们的灵魂了。去死吧。"
G["Ha, that did it! Help's a-comin'! Take this, ya glowin' iron brute!"]="哈，终于搞定了！援军来了！接招吧，你们这群白痴铁疙瘩！"
G["Ha-HAH!"]="哈——哈！"
G["Ha-ha! Just kidding. We eat you for shure anyway!"]="哈哈！开个玩笑。我们肯定会吃掉你的！"
G["Ha-hah! It will feel good to bloody my blade again. Against Alliance or mogu, does not matter to me."]="哈！挽弓杀敌的感觉真不错。对手是联盟还是魔古族对我来说都一样。"
G["Ha... <cough>... the Divine Bell... what could you hope to do with it?"]="Ja... <tos> La Campana divina... ¿qué esperáis hacer con ella?"
G["Ha... <cough>... you young races... so impatient, petulant. Orc... you cannot even control yourself... your own rage, your own fear."]="Ja... <tos> Las razas jóvenes... tan impacientes, tan engreídas. Orcos... No podéis controlaros ni a vosotros mismos... vuestra propia ira, vuestro propio miedo..."
G["Ha... ha ha... well-struck..."]="啊……哈……打得好……"
G["Ha... ha..."]="哈……哈……"
G["Ha.... ha... hah...."]="哈……哈……哈……"
G["Haaa ha ha haa!  Now, heathens... face the TRUE might of Bethekk!"]="哈哈哈哈哈！无信者……面对贝瑟克的真正力量！"
G["Haaaaaalp!"]="救命！"
G["Haaadoouuuu...."]="Haaadoouuuu..."
G["Hackiss tries to pick your pocket."]="哈吉斯想要掏你的口袋。"
G["Had a slicky that tasted like jangos."]="我吃过滑水鱼，嘎嘣脆，香蕉味儿。"
G["Had enough?"]="够了吗？"
G["Had that dream again last night..."]="昨晚我又做了那个梦……"
G["Had we been fully handling the investigation, I assure you, the evidence would have remained safe. Instead, we used your highly questionable methods..."]="如果是我们全权负责调查的话，我向你保证，证据仍然会很安全。可惜，我们使用了你的狗屁方法……"
G["Had you not come along I would have died for sure!"]="如果你不来的话，我就死定了！"
G["Haggis fer breakfast, haggis fer lunch, and a sensible haggis dinner!"]="早饭吃羊杂馅饼，中饭吃羊杂馅饼，晚饭显然也要吃羊杂馅饼！"
G["Haggrum's plan to infiltrate Blackmaw Hold is an ambitious one. Quite duplicitous, actually, for an orc. Put on that enchanted disguise before I teleport you over there."]="哈格鲁姆渗透进黑喉要塞的计划实在是极具野心。对于一个兽人来说，这已经可以说是诡诈透顶了。在我把你传送过去之前先把这身魔法伪装服穿好。"
G["Hah ha ha... You thought you could defeat me? NOTHING can kill me now, puny mortal!"]="哈哈哈……你以为自己能击败我？现在，没有什么能杀死我了，卑微的凡人！"
G["Hah ha! Wonderful job, everyone! Friend, see Rotun about beginning the next trial."]="哈哈！干得好，各位！朋友，去找罗敦开启下一轮试炼吧。"
G["Hah hah! <Snort> You lose most everything."]="¡Ja, ja! <Bufido> Pierdes casi todo."
G["Hah!\n\nYou've really stirred up a sandstorm, $n."]="哈！\n\n你真的搅起了一场沙暴，$n。"
G["Hah!  Eternal undeath to the cursed Agamands!"]="哈！被诅咒的阿加曼德家族变成了亡灵！"
G["Hah!  Let us see the wooden human wave!"]="哈！让我们看看这个木头人！"
G["Hah!  My slaves brought back a real meal this time!"]="哈！奴隶们总算带回一顿真正的美餐啦！"
G["Hah!  So be it.  Blow the horn of a magnataur leader at the ring of torches south of the Blue Dragonshrine.  Make peace with your gods... Grom'thar will come."]="哈！好吧。碧蓝巨龙圣地以南有一处火炬环绕之地，在那里吹响猛犸人首领号角。向你信奉的诸神祈祷吧……戈洛塔尔就会出现。"
G["Hah!  That never gets old."]="哈！这种消遣真是永不过时。"
G["Hah!  The Thunderspike is mine.  Die!"]="哈哈！雷霆之刺是我的。受死吧！"
G["Hah!  This place is not yet worthy of my infliction!"]="哈哈！这里还不值得我亲自出马！"
G["Hah!  This tauren wants a kiss!"]="¡Ja! ¡$GEste:Esta; tauren quiere un beso!"
G["Hah!  Tirth's been looking for him for days, but he doesn't want to be found.  He's chicken!"]="哈！提尔斯这段时间以来都在找他，但是他不想被找到。他是一只小鸡。"
G["Hah!  Your ritual has failed, fool!"]="哈哈！你的典礼失败了，傻瓜！"
G["Hah! Another legendary Dragonmaw triumph."]="哈！龙喉又赢得了一场辉煌的胜利。"
G["Hah! Bullseye!"]="哈哈！正中靶心！"
G["Hah! Daryl, you should have seen the look on your face! You half jumped out of your skin!"]="哈！达瑞尔，你应该看看你自己的表情！你已经脸色发青了！"
G["Hah! Did you mistake me for Diamant, $r? Or perhaps some other whimpering, compliant stone trogg who cares?"]="哈！你是不是把我错认成岱亚曼塔，$r？还是只知道哭鼻子的软骨头穴居人？"
G["Hah! Didn't see that coming now did you, Lizard Lips!"]="哈哈！没想到吧，蜥蜴嘴！"
G["Hah! For that, I'm glad. The Bronzebeards and Wildhammers will regret not having been here to share in your glory."]="哈！很高兴你能这么说。铜须和蛮锤矮人会后悔未能在此与你分享荣耀的。"
G["Hah! Get these Wildhammer off their gryphons and look what kind of a fight they put up. Nothing!"]="哈！把蛮锤矮人赶下他们的狮鹫，看看他们能怎样战斗。这帮无用的家伙！"
G["Hah! Goregek the greatest hunter ever! Goregek get biggest hardknuckle!"]="哈哈！格利基克是最最厉害的猎手！格利基克杀死了个头最大的硬皮猩猩！"
G["Hah! Goregek's kill!"]="哈！是格利基克杀的！"
G["Hah! Humans..."]="哈！人类……"
G["Hah! I don't need your crutches, friend."]="哈！我不需要这种玩意儿，朋友。"
G["Hah! I see. I will remove the Sunreavers by force, then."]="哈！我明白了。那我就用武力驱逐夺日者。"
G["Hah! I was expecting a challenge."]="哈！我一直在等待一场挑战。"
G["Hah! I was hoping you'd make it this far. You'd best be ready for a real fight."]="哈！如我所愿，你们坚持到了这里。准备好迎接真正的战斗了吗？"
G["Hah! It looks like we're ready. Now, newcomers... prepare to fight!"]="哈！看来我们已经准备好了。现在，新来的……准备战斗吧！"
G["Hah! It's about time! No more fearing that each day would be our last..."]="哈哈！是时候了！再也不用每天提心吊胆了！"
G["Hah! KILL ANYTHING THAT MOVES!"]="哈哈哈！杀死一切喘气儿的东西！"
G["Hah! Leave some for Zepik too."]="哈哈！给瑟匹克留点猎物吧。"
G["Hah! Make another demand, princeling, and I'll release your head from your shoulders!"]="哈！你要再多嘴，我的小王子，我就把你的小脑袋砍下来！"
G["Hah! Maybe you learn a little after all!"]="哈！或许你能学到点什么！"
G["Hah! My brothers be itchin' for a fight. It was all I could do ta hold them back this long.\n\nYou in?"]="哈！我的兄弟们正渴望着一战。我已经无法再阻止他们了。\n\n你要参加这一战吗？"
G["Hah! Serves you right, you filthy trogg!!"]="哈哈！丑恶的穴居人，准备受死吧！！"
G["Hah! So, son of Durotan, what--"]="哈！杜隆坦之子，你——"
G["Hah! Spoken like a true disciple of Garrosh Hellscream. Our \"Warchief\" would be proud.\n\nBut MY horde does not fight unarmed children. Nor would I dare bring our war to this sacred chamber, in the presence of an August Celestial himself.\n\nBesides, this little one has earned the friendship and trust of High Chieftain Baine Bloodhoof. For that reason, consider him under my protection.\n\nFor now."]="¡Ja! Has hablado como lo haría un verdadero discípulo de Garrosh Grito Infernal. Nuestro \"Jefe de Guerra\" estaría orgulloso.\n\nPero MI Horda no ataca a niños indefensos. Y tampoco me atrevería a llevar la guerra a esta cámara sagrada, y ante un Augusto Celestial.\n\nAdemás, el pequeño se ha ganado la amistad y la confianza del Gran jefe Baine Pezuña de Sangre. Por eso, considéralo mi protegido.\n\nPor ahora."
G["Hah! Stay right there while I cast this spell! It won't hurt much."]="哈！在我施放这个法术的时候站在这里！不会很痛的。"
G["Hah! That's all you've got? I'm surprised you even made it to the citadel."]="哈！你们就这点本事啊？就凭这点实力，你们也敢闯进城堡啊。"
G["Hah! They should've known to send us in the first place."]="哈！他们早知道该先派我们出马。"
G["Hah! This is easy."]="哈哈！太简单了。"
G["Hah! This the fun part!"]="哈！真有趣！"
G["Hah! Too easy!"]="哈！太简单了！"
G["Hah! Waking this guy is no easy feat! I've hit him, I've tried to pull him over with a rope, I've thrown my body into this gong, and nothing! \n\nAh well, I've got more ideas to get started on."]="嗨！要叫醒这家伙还真不容易！我对他又敲又打，又吼又叫，用绳子拉，用身体压，什么法子都试过了，全都没用！\n\n好吧，我得好好想点别的主意。"
G["Hah! Way to go! You are a natural at this."]="哈！就这么干！你很有天分。"
G["Hah! You have... already... failed..."]="哈哈！你……已经……失败了……"
G["Hah! You thought to interfere with my ascension? Nothing can stop me now!"]="哈哈！就凭你也想阻止我完成升华仪式？没人有这个本事！"
G["Hah! You'll not get my treasure!"]="哈！别想夺走我的财宝！"
G["Hah! You've unleashed my pet! Your soul shall be its next meal."]="哈哈！你放出了我的宠物！那么你的灵魂就是它的下一顿饭了。"
G["Hah! Zepik right, big-tongues is the great hunt!"]="哈！瑟匹克没说错，猎杀大舌头怪是挺好玩的！"
G["Hah, it's true!  I'm gonna go have a closer look at the fire one!"]="哈哈，这是真的。我要走近一点去看看正在燃烧的那个。"
G["Hah, yes $n! That's what I want to hear. Let's make some noise!"]="哈，是啊，$n！这正是我想听到的。让我们弄些响动出来吧！"
G["Hah-HAH!"]="哈——哈！"
G["Hah. Darkspear never die."]="哈。暗矛永不灭亡。"
G["Hah. Your feeble attacks are entertaining. Would you like to see one of my new pets?"]="哈。你虚弱无力的攻击简直令我发笑。想看看我的新宠物吗？"
G["Hah..."]="哈哈……"
G["Hah? Hruumph? Soft little fleshy-things? Here? Nuisances, nuisances!"]="哈？软骨头的血肉凡人？在这里？麻烦，真麻烦！"
G["Haha - <snort> ha - heee! <snort> Haha no stop haha <SNORT> <wheeze> Hee hee! Battlemaster Tortusk never prepared us for this!"]="¡Jaja...! <Resopla> ¡Ja-jejeje! <Resopla> Jaja, no, basta, jaja. <RESOPLA> <Resuella> ¡Jejeje! ¡El maestro de batalla Tordiente nunca nos preparó para eso!"
G["Haha!"]="哈哈！"
G["Haha!  Take that you unsuspecting water dwellers!"]="哈哈！吃吧，你们这些笨鱼！"
G["Haha! Alterac and Hillsbrad shall come under our rightful rule once again now that the Magistrate has fallen. Retreat!"]="哈哈！奥特兰和希尔斯布莱德将再次被我们捏在手心里，镇长已经死了，撤退！"
G["Haha! I bet you thought you were done!"]="哈！我敢打赌你以为自己能获胜！"
G["Haha! Perfect!"]="哈哈！太完美了！"
G["Haha! Save for their leaders--the satyr, Bazzalan, and the warlock Jergosh--yes, all of them. That is why I constantly send Thrall's worshippers at them. It gives Thrall the impression that I am weeding out the evil in the bowels of his great city. The victory is in reality two-fold: kill Thrall's faithful and test the strength of those in the Searing Blade to see if they are truly worthy of joining me."]="哈哈！除了他们的领导人——萨特, 巴扎兰, 还有术士耶戈什——是的，他们所有人。这就是我不断的派萨尔的信徒到他们那儿去的原因。这样会让萨尔觉得我正在铲除他伟大城市中邪恶的人。事实上胜利是双重的：杀掉萨尔的信徒并测试一下那些燃刃的力量，看看他们是否真的有资格加入我的队伍。"
G["Haha! Sturdy old Trollplow has just a few meager battle scars!"]="哈哈！看看这些在战斗中留下的伤痕！"
G["Haha! That should be a blast!"]="哈哈！这下可热闹了！"
G["Haha! That's right. Show them Hellscream's fury!"]="对极了。让他们尝尝地狱咆哮的怒火！"
G["Haha! Yes!"]="哈哈！好啊！"
G["Haha, $g boyo : girlie;! The Alliance has gathered everything that we're needin' to get this here war started! Maybe the Horde will catch up soon?"]="哈哈，$g小伙子:姑娘;！联盟已经集齐所有的战争物资了！或许部落得加把劲了。"
G["Haha, flightless fools!"]="哈哈，不会飞的蠢货！"
G["Haha, no Yin. Liu Lang would eat wherever he explored."]="哈哈，不是的，尹。刘浪走到哪儿就吃到哪儿。"
G["Haha, you be pullin' me leg mon. Pele'keiki know that you know we Horde already be havin' all the war stuff we be needin'. Now we just waitin' on that Alliance to get all theirs and we startin' up the war."]="哈哈，你是在开玩笑吧。比雷凯基知道部落已经集齐战争物资了。现在我们只等联盟完成他们的收集任务，就可以开战了！"
G["Haha, you die so easily!"]="哈哈，那么轻易就死了！"
G["Haha, you're back?  You don't seriously expect me to change my mind do you?\n\nGet lost."]="哈哈，你回来了？你不会真的期盼我改变心意吧？\n\n你错了。"
G["Haha... I gonna kill puny $r and make trophy of your skull!"]="Ja, ja... ¡Voy a matar $gal patético:a la patética; $r y convertir tu calavera en mi trofeo!"
G["Hahah!"]="哈！"
G["Hahah!  $n, you make quite a partner!"]="¡Ja, ja, ja! ¡$n, vaya $gcompañero:compañera; estás $ghecho:hecha;!"
G["Hahah!  Revenge is mine!"]="哈！我复仇了！"
G["Hahah!  That was funny!  Funny wooden human!"]="哈哈！真有趣！真有趣！"
G["Hahah! You see that? Lightning bolt hit him right in the head!"]="哈哈哈！你看见没有？闪电直接击中了他！"
G["Hahah, don't get your hope up too high..."]="哈哈哈，不要抱有太大的希望……"
G["Hahah, good work!"]="哈哈哈，干得好！"
G["Hahaha!  That fool will never find out what I'm up to!  Or, if he does, it'll be too late for the draenei!"]="哈哈哈！那个白痴永远也不会知道我的计划！就算他知道了，对德莱尼人来说也太晚了！"
G["Hahaha!  We're coming for you, little goblins!"]="哈哈哈！我们来了，小地精们！"
G["Hahaha! It worked! Ken-Ken KNEW it would work! You feelin' better now?"]="哈哈哈！起作用了！肯肯知道一定有用！你现在感觉好些了吗？"
G["Hahaha! Now it be my turn! Ye gonna see what it means to be a War-God!"]="哈哈哈！现在轮到我了！见识一下战神的实力吧！"
G["Hahaha, I'm playin' possum, mon. You gonna die!"]="哈哈哈，我在装死。朋友，你的死期到了！"
G["Hahaha, very nice, $n!"]="哈哈哈，很好，$n！"
G["Hahaha, your guards no match for Scourge!"]="哈哈哈，你们的卫兵比天灾军团差远啦！"
G["Hahahah!"]="哈哈哈！"
G["Hahahah! This reminds me of that little boy who came up and told me he wanted to be just like me, sitting on his own pile of gold someday. So adorable. I told him to get back to mopping and stop being lazy. I mean, really."]="哈哈哈！这让我想起，曾经有个小男孩走到我面前告诉我，他想成为和我一样的富翁——有一天能端坐在属于自己的金山上。真是可爱的小家伙。我告诉他赶快回去拖地板，别再偷懒了。我是认真的。"
G["Hahahah, I do not think you know what you are getting into..."]="哈哈哈，我看你根本不知道自己在做什么……"
G["Hahahah... nice one."]="哈哈哈……干得好。"
G["Hahahaha!"]="哈哈哈哈！"
G["Hahahaha, you're kidding right?"]="哈哈哈哈，你在开玩笑对吧？"
G["Hahahahah!"]="哈哈哈哈！"
G["Hahahahaha!"]="哈哈哈！"
G["Hahahahahahahah!"]="哈哈哈哈哈哈哈！"
G["Hail $c. Didn't I see you recently at an exclusive gathering? You look familiar, but then again this city is a busy place.\n\nIf you attended that convention, then surely you were given a secret code. Tell me your code and I will give you a special prize in return."]="你好，$c。看来你最近在进行一项秘密的收集工作？你还是老样子，但是这是个繁忙的城市。\n\n如果你参加了那场会议，你就该得到一段神秘兑换码。把神秘兑换码告诉我，我就会给你一份特殊的奖励作为回报。"
G["Hail $g brother : sister;... I'd like a moment of your time, if I may.\n\nWe tauren have endured much in our trials and tribulations in establishing our homeland.  We now find ourselves in a dire shortage of cloth.  If you have the materials to spare, I ask that you please donate them.  You certainly would earn the gratitude of tauren everywhere in helping us out!"]="嘿，$g兄弟:姐妹;……我希望可以打扰你一下，如果可以的话。\n\n我们在通过试炼和进行家园重建中经历了很多。我们现在极度缺乏布料。如果你有一些多余的话，我希望你可以捐献给我们。你一定会为此赢得所有牛头人的尊重的！"
G["Hail $n!  New Champion of The Affray!"]="¡Ave $n! ¡$gEl nuevo campeón:La nueva campeona; de La Reyerta!"
G["Hail Akama!"]="阿卡玛万岁！"
G["Hail citizen.  Do you need directions?"]="Salve, $gciudadano:ciudadana;. ¿Necesitas ayuda con alguna seña?"
G["Hail friend - a moment of your time, if I may...\n\nWe have endured much in our trials and tribulations in establishing Teldrassil.  Were the constant strife of the times not enough, we now find ourselves in a dire shortage of cloth.  If you have the materials to spare, I ask that you please donate them.  You certainly would earn the gratitude of night elves everywhere in helping us out!"]="Hola, $gamigo:amiga;, me gustaría hablar contigo unos minutos, si es posible.\n\nHemos sufrido muchos problemas y tribulaciones para establecer Teldrassil. Por si no fuera bastante con los constantes conflictos, ahora nos encontramos con una gran escasez de paño. Si te sobran materiales, te ruego que los dones. Te ganarás la gratitud de los elfos de la noche de todas partes por ayudarnos."
G["Hail our leader!  Hail Akama!"]="为我们的首领欢呼！阿卡玛万岁！"
G["Hail the Lich King!"]="为巫妖王欢呼！"
G["Hail the hero of Kun-Lai Pass, $n!"]="¡Aclamad a $n, $gel héroe:la heroína; del Paso Kun-Lai!"
G["Hail to da new king!"]="¡Viva $gel nuevo rey:la nueva reina;!"
G["Hail to the king, baby!"]="为国王欢呼吧，宝贝！"
G["Hail to the night!"]="向暗夜致敬！"
G["Hail to the queen!"]="向女王致敬！"
G["Hail to thee $n.  Do you wish me to aid you in your journey to Warsong Gulch?"]="你好，$n。让我帮你前往战歌峡谷，好吗？"
G["Hail to thee, $c."]="你好啊，$c。"
G["Hail to you, $r. What I am doing here is a story for another time. Oof, that was a bad one.\n\nMy brother and I are stuck here, between our time and the present. We dare not leave for fear of causing a temporal paradox. Patiently we wait until the dragons restore us to our proper timeline.\n\nHow long has it been you ask? I'm not sure really. Ask my brother.\n\nCare for some cheese?"]="你好啊，$r。我在这里做的事情已经是另一个故事了。哎呀，那不是个好故事。\n\n我和我的兄弟都被困在这里，被夹在我们的时代和现在之间。我们不敢离开这里，因为我们害怕这可能会引起时间的矛盾。我们只有耐心等待青铜龙把我们送回原来的世界去。\n\n你问还要多久？我真的不知道。问问我兄弟吧。\n\n要来点奶酪吗？"
G["Hail!  By order of King Varian Wrynn, I've been given the authority to extend an offer to the people of Silverbrook."]="嗨！尊贵的瓦里安·乌瑞恩国王委任我为特使，派我来银溪镇商谈结盟事宜。"
G["Hail!  You look familiar... have we met before?\n\nWell if we have met, then... surely you were given a secret code. Tell me your code and I will give you a gift!"]="¡Hola! Me suena tu cara... ¿nos hemos visto antes?\n\nSi es así, seguro que alguien te ha dado un código secreto. ¡Dime tu código y te daré un regalo!"
G["Hail! I hate to rush you, but there's an army of iron dwarves here to stop whatever you and Creteus are trying to do... we need to get out of here."]="嗨！我不想催你的，但是铁矮人已经察觉了你和克莱特乌斯的行动……我们赶紧离开这儿吧。"
G["Hail, $C. Ill times these are, my friend, for our town is besieged! The Blackrock Orcs attack from Stonewatch Keep, the Shadowhide loom over the Tower of Ilgalar, and the Redridge Gnoll Pack gathers strength. I hope you're not here for a holiday..."]="Saludos, $C. Tiempos difíciles son estos, amigo mío, pues nuestra aldea está sitiada ¡Los Orcos de Roca Negra atacan desde el Fuerte de Vigilastrom, los Shadowhide acechan sobre la Torre de Ilgalar y la Manada de Gnollos del Picapedrero se fortalece. Espero que no hayas venido a pasar unas vacaciones..."
G["Hail, $N! Welcome to my humble garden. The weather has been perfect lately. Let us hope it holds steady for a ripe harvest."]="Saludos, $N¡ Bienvenido a mi humilde jardín. El clima ha sido perfecto últimamente. Que siga así para una cosecha madura."
G["Hail, $c!"]="嗨，$c！"
G["Hail, $c!  Our supply level is high, and we are ready to launch a ground assault through the Field of Strife.  Perhaps if your renown was greater, I would trust you to deliver the assault orders.\n\nSo get out there and fight the Alliance!  Show me you're a trusted and capable member of the Horde!"]="嗨，$c！我们的军需已经增加，现在可以对征战平原发送地面攻击啦。要是你的声望再高一点，我一定会派你传达攻击命令的。\n\n去吧，为了联盟而战！证明你是一名值得信赖的、有能力的部落成员！"
G["Hail, $c!  Welcome to the celebration!"]="¡Ave, $c! ¡$GBienvenido:Bienvenida; a la fiesta!"
G["Hail, $c! Admiral Aubrey is expecting you up above."]="你好啊，$c！海军司令奥布里正在楼上等你呢。"
G["Hail, $c! Just up ahead you'll find Honor's Stand, the Alliance's only link between Stonetalon and the coast.\n\nThe road's a treacherous one, though. I speak from experience."]="你好，$c！荣耀岗哨就在前面。那是联盟在石爪山脉和海岸之间的唯一通道。\n\n根据我的亲身经验，那也是一条充满危险的道路。"
G["Hail, $c.  The Ironforge Brigade is stationed here to keep an eye on Hive'Zora.  The Cenarion Circle druids have been monitoring silithid movement and they're anticipating something major in this area."]="嗨，$c。铁炉堡军团驻扎在此地，密切注视着佐拉虫巢的动静。塞纳里奥要塞的德鲁伊们一直监视着异种虫类的一举一动，他们预计这儿将发生大事。"
G["Hail, $c.  There is a great need and even greater honor and renown to be had in Alterac Valley at this time. Will you join our fight against the Stormpike Guard?"]="嗨，$c。眼下奥特兰克山谷急需援助，这是获得荣誉、提升声望的大好机会。你愿意加入我们，共同对抗雷矛卫队吗？"
G["Hail, $c. As you may know, we've completed all collections necessary for the Alliance's role in the upcoming war. Now it's up to the Horde to finish with theirs and we'll ship out to Silithus."]="嗨，$c。安其拉一战迫在眉睫，我们已经集齐联盟所需的战争物资了。现在只要部落收集好物资，我们就能把货物送往希利苏斯了。"
G["Hail, $c. I trust you are here to inquire on the Ahn'Qiraj war effort. We are going to need a great deal of assistance.\n\nThe war effort is a united effort between the Horde and Alliance to prepare for the impending war against the Silithid and their masters in Ahn'Qiraj. In Orgrimmar's Valley of Spirits, we are collecting a vast number of goods to create war materiel, and these gathering tasks are what we need your help with.\n\nCan I convince you to speak with our commander about helping out?"]="嗨，$c。我想你是为安其拉之战而来的吧。我们急需帮助。\n\n部落和联盟必须携手对抗安其拉异种虫类大军和它们的主使者。在奥格瑞玛的精神谷，我们正在收集原料制造战争物资，收集工作需要你的帮助。\n\n你可以跟我们的指挥官谈谈吗？"
G["Hail, $c. You look familiar... have we met before?\n\nWell if we have met, then... surely you were given a secret code. Tell me your code and I will give you a gift!"]="你好啊，$c。你看起来很眼熟……我们见过面吗？\n\n如果是的话，那么你肯定已经拿到一段神秘兑换码了。把神秘兑换码告诉我，我就给你一份特殊的奖品！"
G["Hail, $n!  It is good you came to see me.  We are prepared to launch a ground assuault through the Field of Strife!  Once Warmaster Garrick gets his orders, he and his reavers will cut a swath through the Alliance!\n\nDo you want to deliver those orders, $n?  Garrick is waiting in the Field of Strife..."]="¡Saludos, $n! Me alegro de que hayas venido a verme. Estamos listos para lanzar un asalto terrestre en la Tierra de Disputa. Cuando el maestro de guerra Garrick obtenga las órdenes, él y sus atracadores se abrirán camino entre las tropas de la Alianza.\n\n¿Quieres entregar las órdenes, $n? Garrick está esperando en la Tierra de Disputa..."
G["Hail, $n.  All friends of the Light are welcome at the Altar of Sha'tar."]="你好，$n。所有圣光的伙伴在沙塔尔祭坛都会受到欢迎。"
G["Hail, $n.  We're in need of your assistance."]="你好啊，$n。我们正需要你的帮助。"
G["Hail, $r! I am Lieutenant Haggerdin, officer in charge of recruitment for the Stormpike Guard.\n\nAs you gain prestige and notoriety among the Stormpike, return to me and I shall see about upgrading your insignia. Also, should you ever lose your insignia, I am able to supply a replacement."]="你好，$r！我是哈格丁中尉，是负责招募雷矛卫兵的官员。\n\n你在雷矛军队中获得一定的威望后再来找我吧，我会升级你的徽章的。如果你丢失了徽章，我也能再给你一枚。"
G["Hail, $r! If you're looking for Corastrasza, she's just inside.\n\n<Mostrasz shifts his weight uncomfortably.>\n\nShe's not in a very good mood."]="你好，$r！如果你是在找科拉丝塔萨，那她就在里面。\n\n<莫奥斯塔兹不安地挪动了一下身体。>\n\n她的心情可不太好。"
G["Hail, $r. Were you lucky enough to have attended that recent special event?\n\nIf so, you may have learned a secret code. Tell me your code and I will give you a special prize in return."]="你好，$r。你最近有幸参加了特别的活动吧？\n\n那样的话，你可能已经得到了一组神秘兑换码。将神秘兑换码告诉我，我就送你一份特殊的奖励。"
G["Hail, Adventurer. A moment, if you would? I would ask for your aid in Westfall."]="Salve, aventurero. ¿Me concedes un momento? Querría pedir tu ayuda en Páramos de Poniente."
G["Hail, Champion of Chi-Ji! Your presence honors us, $n."]="¡Saludos, $gcampeón:campeona; de Chi-Ji! Nos honras con tu presencia, $n."
G["Hail, Gezhe!  Seventeen more orders have been placed in the Hara'samid Sector.  The markets of heavy veldarite have all but collapsed, as you predicted."]="杰赫，您好！另外十七份定单被送到了哈拉撒米德。就像您所预见的那样，维达宝石市场崩盘了。"
G["Hail, Loramus. I bring word from the Blasted Lands."]="嘿，洛拉姆斯，我从诅咒之地给你带来了一些消息。"
G["Hail, adventurer. Heed my warnings before venturing into the Black Morass."]="Te saludo, $gaventurero:aventurera;. Sigue mis advertencias antes de aventurarte en La Ciénaga Negra."
G["Hail, adventurer. I am Rin'wosho, trader of Zuldazar. I come from the South Seas and bring many exotic goods and items from my homeland.\n\nPerhaps if you prove your worth to my tribe, I shall barter.  If you have any of my tribe's Honor Tokens, then perhaps we shall barter even more."]="Hola, $gaventurero:aventurera;. Soy Rin'wosho, mercader de Zuldazar. Vengo de los Mares del Sur y traigo mercancías y objetos exóticos de mi tierra.\n\nQuizás, si demuestras tu dignidad a mi tribu, te haga un trueque. Si tienes alguna muestra de honor de mi tribu, quizás hagamos más de un trueque."
G["Hail, champion! Have you ever thought about going into the gladiator business full time? You and I could make a mountain of gold."]="¡Saludos, $gcampeón:campeona;! ¿Nunca te has planteado trabajar de gladiador a tiempo completo?"
G["Hail, champion! Looking for a friendly challenge? I can arrange War Games - practice matches in the arena or on the battlefield. No rewards, no penalties, just pure combat. Choose your battleground."]="Saludos, campeón ¡Buscas un desafío amistoso? Puedo organizar Guerra de Clanes - partidas de práctica en el coliseo o en el campo de batalla. Sin recompensas, sin penalizaciones, solo combate puro. Elige tu escenario."
G["Hail, champion. The tale of your deeds will be told throughout the ages. Perhaps one day, a statue of you will stand amongst the heroes of Stormwind."]="勇士，向你致敬。你所立下的丰功伟绩将代代传颂。或许有一天，你的雕像会矗立在暴风城的英雄谷。"
G["Hail, champion. Yogg-Saron's defeat echoes through these halls."]="Salud, campe$gón:ona;. La derrota de Yogg-Saron resuena en estas salas."
G["Hail, citizen. I would recommend that you speak with Watch Captain Parker. He's currently at the top of this tower."]="感恩吧，公民。我推荐你去见卫兵帕克。他就在这座塔的顶上。"
G["Hail, friend!"]="你好，朋友！"
G["Hail, friend! Have you come to serve the sons of Azeroth in battle?"]="¡Saludos, $gamigo:amiga;! ¿Has venido a servir a los hijos de Azeroth en la batalla?"
G["Hail, good $c! Welcome to Ironforge's annual Brewfest celebration!"]="欢迎，$c！欢迎参加铁炉堡一年一度的美酒节庆典！"
G["Hail, stranger. If you are looking for a place in need of your help, you have found it.\n\nThe dead reawaken, walk the land, and arrive on ships from across the great ocean. The fjord grows too dangerous even for us, and soon we must leave for safer lands to the north."]="Hola, $gforastero:forastera;. Si buscas un lugar necesitado de tu ayuda, no cabe duda de que lo has encontrado.\n\nLos muertos se levantan, caminan por la tierra, llegan en barcos desde el otro lado del gran océano. El fiordo se vuelve demasiado peligroso incluso para nosotros y pronto tendremos que ir hacia el norte en busca de tierras más seguras."
G["Hail, traveler! What brings you to my doorstep?"]="¡Salve, $gviajero:viajera;! ¿Qué te trae hasta mi casa?"
G["Hail, what ya want?"]="你好啊，你想要些什么？"
G["Hail."]="向你致敬。"
G["Hail. I could not help but overhear your conversation. Please allow me to lend some assistance."]="嗨。我无意中听到了你们的谈话。请让我出一份力吧。"
G["Hailing from the deepest, darkest caverns of the Storm Peaks, Gormok the Impaler! Battle on, heroes!"]="他来自风暴峭壁最幽深，最黑暗的洞穴，穿刺者戈莫克！准备战斗，英雄们！"
G["Hailing from the distant mountains of Alterac, one of the fiercest competitors this arena has ever seen: KORRAK THE BLOODRAGER!!!"]="奥特兰克山谷的访客，斗兽场中迄今为止最为凶猛的斗士：血怒者科尔拉克！！！"
G["Hailing from the mountains of Blade's Edge comes Rokdar the Sundered Lord! $n is in for the fight of $g his:her; life."]="¡De la montaña de Filospada, llega el Señor Hendido, Rokdar! $n luchará en la batalla de su vida."
G["Hailing from the semi-distant wreck of a landscape that was once Gilneas, our champion arises! Keep your pants up $n, you don't want to show this guy a full moon!"]="从遥远的吉尔尼斯废墟中传出阵阵吼声，我们的勇士来了！把裤子穿好，$n，你不会想让他看到两轮满月吧！"
G["Hairy Herring Head!"]="毛茸茸的鲱鱼头！"
G["Hairy? You heard wrong. It's downright desperate!"]="危险？你肯定听错了。那地方简直是绝境！"
G["Haiyan the Unstoppable struck you with a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:123655|h[Traumatic Blow]|h|r! Healing abilities used on you will be less efficient while the effect persists!"]="势不可挡哈伊岩用|cFFFF0000|Hspell:123655|h[外伤打击]|h|r攻击了你！在效果持续期间，治疗技能只会为你回复较少的生命值！"
G["Hakkar binds me no more!  Peace at last!"]="哈卡再也不能束缚我了！我终于可以安息了！"
G["Hakkar grows impatient.  And so do I."]="哈卡变得越来越不耐烦了。我也一样。"
G["Hakkar is known by many names. Some call him the Blood God, others simply refer to him as The Soulflayer. Titles aside, he is an entity of enormous power with malicious intentions for our world.\n\nMy flight discovered this temple early on and sank it beneath the Swamp of Sorrows. Unfortunately, we only seemed to aid the Atal'ai by ensuring their efforts to summon Hakkar went on undisturbed. Many of the dragons tasked with guarding the temple have been corrupted, and the Soulflayer's presence grows with each passing day.\n\nI cannot stop them alone. Together, though, we might have enough time to stop this madness."]="哈卡有许多尽为人知的名字。有人叫他血神，另一些人则直白地把他称作夺灵者。抛开名衔不说，他是这个世界上强大力量与邪恶意图的化身。\n\n我早先发现了这座神庙，并将它沉到了悲伤沼泽的下方。不幸的是，我们似乎只是在帮助阿塔莱——确保他们召唤哈卡的计划能在不受干扰的环境下实施。许多负责守卫神庙的巨龙都已被腐化，夺灵者的气息却一天天变得更为强烈。\n\n我无法凭自己的力量阻止他们。但如果我们合作，也许能有足够的时间终止他们的疯狂举动。"
G["Hakkar shall live again!"]="哈卡会重生的！"
G["Hakkar will rule the world!"]="哈卡将统治世界！"
G["Hakmud cannot work under these conditions! Goodbye!"]="哈克穆德没法在这种环境下工作！再见！"
G["Hal'duron, summon the rangers. Rommath, assemble the Blood Magi, and add the Sunreavers' strength to your own."]="哈杜伦，召集游侠。罗曼斯，集结血法师，让夺日者也加入你们。"
G["Halbin Frosthammer, from the Wildhammer clan, can be found in Thunderbrew Distillery.  He can help teach ya the ways of the shaman."]="哈鲁宾·霜锤，你可以在雷酒酿制厂找到这位蛮锤矮人。他能够传授你萨满之道。"
G["Haldor of the Rocky Cliffs! Grant me your strength!"]="岩石峭壁之王赫尔多！把你的力量借给我！"
G["Halduron, we should combine our forces and make preparations to act on reports from the Darkspear scouts."]="哈杜伦，我们需要把部队联合起来，根据暗矛斥候的报告做好准备。"
G["Haleh, I have lost the Bluescale Sigil. Could you fashion another?"]="哈尔琳，我丢失了蓝鳞印记。你能再给我一个么？"
G["Haleh, I have lost the Drakefire Amulet. Could you fashion another?"]="哈尔琳，我把龙火护符弄丢了。你能帮我再做一个吗？"
G["Half man...half sharkalligator!"]="半人……半鲨鳄！"
G["Half of the Vale lies in ruin! These outsiders have been more destructive than the mantid and mogu combined!"]="半个锦绣谷都被毁了！这些外来者的破坏性比螳螂妖和魔古族加起来还要大。"
G["Half way there..."]="走了一半路了……"
G["Halfus! Hear me! (The Master calls, the Master wants.) Protect our secrets, Halfus. Destroy the intruders. (Murder for His glory. Murder for His hunger.)"]="哈尔弗斯！听我号令！（主人在召唤，主人想要）保护我们的秘密，哈尔弗斯。消灭入侵者。（为主人的荣耀，为主人的欲望，杀！）"
G["Halfway there I got orders to meet you all here. This must be important."]="我在半途接到与你们汇合的命令。这准是个重要的任务。"
G["Halfway there, $n. Keep it up!"]="就快胜利了，$n。加油！"
G["Halion will be pleased."]="海里昂会高兴的。"
G["Hallloooo stranger!"]="你好啊，陌生人！"
G["Hallo again, soft little friend. What's that you have there?"]="又见到你了，柔软的小朋友。这次你要做什么？"
G["Hallo!"]="你好啊！"
G["Hallo, friend!\n\nRussell's the name, and music is my business. All the great Wildhammer heroes from ages past are kept alive with song. Through the strings of my lute and the sound of my voice, our warriors gain immortality.\n\nStay a while, and listen!"]="你好，朋友！\n\n我的名字叫罗素，我的事业是音乐。历史长河中所有伟大的蛮锤英雄都活在我的歌曲中。借助我的鲁特琴弦和我的歌喉，我们的勇士得到了不朽的威名。\n\n请停下脚步，听我唱一段颂歌吧！"
G["Hallo, stranger! You are making quite an impression with the local hozen. I daresay they're starting to fear you."]="你好，陌生人！你给那些猢狲留下了很深的印象。我敢说他们已经开始害怕你了。"
G["Hallo."]="你好啊。"
G["Hallooo.... You just gunna sit down there an' pat yerselves on the back? What kinda rescuers are ya?"]="喂……你就准备坐在那里沾沾自喜吗？你到底是不是来救人的啊？"
G["Hallow's End is a scary holiday, but I like it!"]="万圣节是个可怕的节日，但我喜欢！"
G["Hallow's End is upon us, $c.  I hope you are enjoying the festivities."]="$c，万圣节到了。希望你能在这个节日中找到许多欢乐。"
G["Halt at once!"]="马上停下来！"
G["Halt!"]="站住！"
G["Halt! Do not carry that blade any further!"]="住手！你快把那剑放下！"
G["Halt! Identify yourself immediately!"]="站住！立即出示身份证明！"
G["Halt! This city is under Martial Law. Declare yourselves."]="站住！这座城市已经戒严。表明你们的身份。"
G["Halt, supplicant! These waters belong to the Thunder King. Your presence is unwelcome."]="站住，乞丐！这片水域属于雷电之王。你在这里是不受欢迎的。"
G["Halt."]="停下。"
G["Halt. If the core is in your possession, please place it safely on the ground to avoid any damage it make incur during your elimination."]="等等。如果你身上带着核心的话，请把它放在地上，避免在战斗过程中造成损伤。"
G["Halt. Your presence here is not authorized."]="站住。你无权进入此地。"
G["Halthar is dead! Sound the trumpets, and spread the news from Highbank to Thundermar!"]="哈索尔死了！吹响号角，将消息从滩头堡传往桑德玛尔！"
G["Hamhock in trouble! Hamhock need help!"]="哈姆霍克有麻烦了！哈姆霍克需要帮助！"
G["Hammer and tongs. Hammer and tongs. All day long its hammer and tongs."]="精力充沛，不知疲倦。一天到晚都在埋头苦干。"
G["Hammer of the Righteous!"]="正义之锤！"
G["Hammer swingin' fun! Who wants to swing a hammer?"]="挥舞大锤的乐趣！有人想挥着锤子砸东西吗？"
G["Hammer time!"]="打砸时间！"
G["Hammerhead Oil Sample"]="锤头鲨鱼油样本"
G["Hammertoe, you're as smart as you were stubborn in life and even in death. What can you tell me, ole friend?"]="铁趾，无论生死，你都表现得一样坦然自若。你能告诉我些什么吗，老朋友？"
G["Hanashi here knows staves. If you want a sturdier instructor, go to Thunder Bluff. Ansekhwa will teach you on the lower central rise there."]="这里的哈纳什知道怎么使用法杖。如果你想找一个更强健的教师，就去雷霆崖，安塞瓦会在中部高地底层教你。"
G["Hand it over, Frankie!"]="把它交出来，弗兰基！"
G["Hand me the wizzlesproket, you dwarf-brained son of a human!  No, not that one, the other one!"]="把那个旋转齿轮给我，你这个生了颗矮人脑子的人崽子！不，不是那个，是另一个！"
G["Hand over hand, $g lad: lass;... hand over aching hand.  I can't tell ya how many gallons of seawater went right up my nose.\n\nYou shoulda seen me fight off that pyreshell crab using my feet and my teeth, though!  'Twas a thing of glory, 'twas."]="我用手划啊划啊，$g小伙子:小姑娘;……精疲力竭地划。我都不知道究竟有多少海水直接灌进了我的鼻子。\n\n不过你应该看见我用脚和牙齿力战大螃蟹的精彩场面了！那可真是荣耀啊，真的。"
G["Hand over the Archmage and I may yet allow you to walk out of here, Lor'themar."]="交出大法师，这样，我或许还能放你一条生路，洛瑟玛。"
G["Hand over the Southfury moonstone and I'll let you go."]="交出南国之怒月亮石，我就让你走。"
G["Hand over the bird, yeh filthy beasts. WILDHAMMER!!"]="交出那只鸟，你们这些肮脏的野兽。为蛮锤而战！！"
G["Handheld one-way mirrors!"]="手持单向镜子！"
G["Handle Varo'then. Mannoroth is mine."]="你去对付瓦罗森。玛诺洛斯是我的。"
G["Handmade toys from all over Azeroth!"]="来自艾泽拉斯各地的手工玩具！"
G["Hands off - you don't what that thing is!"]="别碰它——天知道那是什么东西！"
G["Hands off the cloak! Yes, yes, I know that you want one too. Everybody wants one of my cloaks. Believe me, person of low moral and social standing, one day I will make my fortune from the sale of my cloaks. Everyone from here to Ironforge will know the name of Bartolo Ginsetti. The Ginsetti label will be coveted by all!"]="别动那张斗篷！没错，没错，我知道你也想要一件。每个人都想要一件我的斗篷。相信我，你这个卑微的家伙，总有一天我会靠出售我的斗篷赚到大钱。从铁炉堡到这里的每个人都会知道巴图罗·吉塞提的名字。吉塞提商标会成为令所有人垂涎欲滴的东西！"
G["Hands up, greenskins!  My men will give you your new bearing.  You try anything funny and we'll fill you with lead."]="举起手来，绿皮人！乖乖照着指示做。你要是玩什么花样，就让你尝尝子弹的味道。"
G["Hang in there ol' buddy!"]="坚持住，老朋友！"
G["Hang in there, Lieutenant!"]="坚持住，中尉！"
G["Hang in there, Mack..."]="坚持住，马克……"
G["Hang in there, bud. You're going to be okay."]="坚持住，伙计。你会没事的。"
G["Hang on tight. It's going to get bumpy!"]="抓紧。颠簸会非常剧烈！"
G["Hang on to your hat, $n! To Scalawag we go!"]="坐稳啦，$n！向无赖港出发！"
G["Hang on to your hat, pal! We're in for a bumpy ride"]="坐稳啦！可能会出现颠簸。"
G["Hang on to your hat, pal! We're in for a bumpy ride."]="坐稳啦！可能会出现颠簸。"
G["Hang on!"]="抓紧！"
G["Hang on! I'm putting the pedal to the metal!!!"]="抓紧了！我要把油门踩到底了！"
G["Hang on! Nobody's gonna' be sanitized as long as I have a say in it!"]="等等！你想清理谁啊！有我在，没门！"
G["Hang on, $n! We have to get out of here, NOW!"]="坚持住，$n！我们必须马上离开这里！"
G["Hang on, men! Reinforcements are inbound!"]="坚持住，兄弟们！援军很快就到！"
G["Hang onto your, um... helmet!"]="抓紧你的……头盔！"
G["Hang tight, $n.  We gotta wait for Maltorius and Arkkus to come back before we can fight 'em."]="提高警惕，$n。我们要等玛托留斯和阿卡库斯回来，然后迎头痛击他们。"
G["Hapana simply grunts and waves you away towards the Dread Captain DeMeza.\n\nBeneath the fur of one massive arm can be seen a tattoo of the word \"MAGATHA\" in an arrow-pierced heart."]="Hapana simplemente gruñe y hace un gesto para que te acerques a la aterradora capitana DeMeza.\n\nBajo el pelo de un enorme brazo se puede ver un tatuaje que lee \"MAGATHA\" en un corazón atravesado por una flecha."
G["Happiness is mandatory, citizen."]="快乐源于秩序，公民。"
G["Happy Brewfest, $n!"]="美酒节快乐，$n！"
G["Happy Hallow's End!"]="万圣节快乐！"
G["Happy Hallow's End!  Do you like my mask?  Very scary!"]="万圣节快乐！你喜欢我的面具吗？非常吓人呢！"
G["Happy Hallow's End!  How do you like my mask?  Very scary!"]="万圣节快乐！你喜欢我的面具吗？非常吓人呢！"
