G["Happy Lunar Festival, $n!"]="春节快乐，$n！"
G["Happy Pilgrim's Bounty, $c!"]="感恩节快乐，$c！"
G["Happy Winter Veil, $n!"]="¡Feliz Festival del Invierno, $c!"
G["Happy Winter's Veil!"]="冬幕节快乐！"
