G["Has Ban sent you to kill me, then? Just like he killed my husband?"]="这么说，是班派你来杀我的？就像他杀死我丈夫那样？"
G["Has Pilgrim's Bounty got you in the shopping spirit, $c?  Well, you have come to the right place!"]="感恩节激发起你的购物欲了吗，$c？嗯，那你可来对地方了！"
G["Has Prince Arthas turned against us?"]="阿尔萨斯王子背叛了我们？"
G["Has a secret cult infiltrated the Orgrimmar skyway?"]="秘密教派已经渗入奥格瑞玛航运线了吗？"
