G["Has anyone seen the overseer?"]="有谁看到监工了吗？"
G["Has anyone seen the quilboar they had caged up over here?"]="有人见到那些被关在笼子里的野猪人吗？"
G["Has anyone suspicious tried to list a crate of goods recently?"]="最近有可疑人员来要求拍卖一箱货物吗？"
G["Has fate been cruel to the yaungol? You may as well ask if fire is good or bad."]="命运对野牛人是否不公？这就等于是问火究竟是好还是坏。"
G["Has he come to lead us?"]="他是来领导我们的吗？"
G["Has he found the one, yet?"]="他找到那?西了吗？"
G["Has it really been an hour?"]="真的又过了一个小时吗？"
G["Has no one helped you yet, ogre?"]="还没有人帮你吗，食人魔？"
G["Has our loyalty not been tested and proven, time and again? All I hear from our Warchief's mouth are falsehoods and excuses."]="难道我们的忠诚还不算久经考验？我们的酋长口中，全是谎言和借口。"
G["Has the Earthen Ring sent you?\n\nOur efforts to heal the land must begin here, at the World Tree. I'm glad you are here to witness this."]="是大地之环派你来的吗？\n\n我们将从这里，世界之树的脚下，开始治愈这片土地。真高兴你能见证这一切。"
G["Has the Prince recanted the tale of the Ashbringer? It is our most favorite of his stories. His favorite is the followup to the Ashbringer. Of course, nobody has ever been able to get that story out of him."]="王子不再讲述灰烬使者的故事了吗？在他的诸多故事中，我们最喜欢这个。他的爱好则是寻找灰烬使者的下落。当然，没人能从他口中得知那个故事。"
G["Has the sun risen already?  There are just never enough hours in the night!  Well, Saelienne will take good care of you.  You can find her tending to her guests over in the Craftsmen's Terrace in northeastern Darnassus."]="太阳已经升起来了吗？夜晚的时间总是太短！嗯，塞琳尼会好好照顾你的。她在达纳苏斯东北面的工匠区招待客人。"
G["Has there been any word from Kota Basecamp?"]="有来自寇塔营地的消息么？"
G["Has there been contact from the Citadel?"]="堡垒那边有消息吗？"
G["Hash table collision detected. Resolution: SELF-DESTRUCT."]="检测到哈希数据表冲突。解决方案：自爆。"
