G["Hatred gives me the strength to destroy you!"]="仇恨给了我足以毁灭你的力量！"
G["Hatred will consume and conquer all!"]="仇恨将吞噬一切，征服一切！"
G["Hatred, come out and face your defeat!"]="恨之煞，出来受死吧！"
G["Have I been away so long that you have forgotten who I am?"]="我有离开这么久吗？你都把我给忘了？"
G["Have I chosen wisely, $n?"]="我的选择明智吗，$n？"
G["Have I ever told you that I hate Scallions? Hate 'em!\n\n<Jogu lets out a loud belch.>\n\nUnfortunately for me, they're going to be in high season tomorrow."]="我有没有告诉过你我讨厌葱？我讨厌它们！\n\n<贾古打了个响嗝儿。>\n\n可不幸的是，明天将是它们的生长旺季。"
G["Have I forgotten? Of course I have... I have forgotten about love, happiness... of life itself."]="我忘记了吗？我当然忘记了……我忘了爱情，欢乐……忘了生命。"
G["Have I got a heal for you!"]="让我给你治疗一下！"
