G["Have a great day and don't let the door hit you on the way out."]="祝你拥有美好的一天，出去时别让门夹了。"
G["Have a look at my meats, friend.  You won't want to go out into the Barrens without a good stock of provisions."]="看看我的肉，朋友。你不会想双手空空就进入贫瘠之地吧。"
G["Have a merry time on the merry-go-round!"]="在旋转木马上享受你的快乐时光！"
G["Have a nice day!"]="你好啊！"
