G["Have the ancient towers fallen? I can hear nothing from my brethren."]="古塔倒塌了吗？ 我从我的同胞那里听不到任何消息。"
G["Have we cleaned out the inn yet? Burn the rest of it when you're done!"]="我们还没有将这家旅店里的敌人清除干净？完成这个任务之后就把它一把火烧掉！"
G["Have we met?"]="我们认识吗？"
G["Have we taken enough magical flasks to join the Skyguard yet?"]="那些合剂的数量足够我们加入天空卫队吗？"
G["Have ya gone mad? Ya be da death of us all!"]="你疯了！你会带给所有人死亡！"
G["Have ye any news from outside?  I hear the trolls have been actin' up too."]="外面有什么新闻吗？我听说那些巨魔也在蠢蠢欲动。"
