G["Have you been to Dawn's Blossom? Did you happen to pick up an extra cask of Goldendraft while there?\n\nIt is not the easiest thing to have them deliver here."]="你有没有去过晨芳园？你去那里的时候有没有多拿一个金酿的木桶？\n\n把它们运过来可不是什么轻松的事情。"
G["Have you been to Shado-Pan Retreat or Firebough Nook yet, $n? I heard about trouble brewing there with the sha."]="你去过影踪营地或火树村吗，$n？我听说那里发生了与煞有关的麻烦。"
G["Have you been to the Jade Forest? To the Valley of the Four Winds? To the low lands of Kun-Lai?\n\nTell me, do they enjoy their peace? Are they still ignorant of the price it costs for that peace? How much Shado-Pan blood must be spilled to maintain their peace?\n\nI suppose it is best they do not. Peace is a thing best enjoyed by the ignorant so they may savor their lives without worry."]="你去过翡翠林吗？去过四风谷吗？去过昆莱的山脚下吗？\n\n告诉我，那里的人们享受和平的生活吗？他们是否仍然不知道，换取那和平所付出的代价？那是用多少影踪派弟子的鲜血换来的啊！\n\n我想他们还是不知道的好。就让他们浑然不觉地享受和平吧，这样他们才能无忧无虑地过好每一天。"
G["Have you checked out my breathin' hat?\n\nNo more suckin' on clams for Budd! No sirree..."]="¿Has visto mi sombrero de respirar?\n\n¡Budd ya nunca más tendrá que chupar almejas! No señooooor..."
G["Have you come for further training? Shake the dust of the road from your garments, then, and let us get to work."]="你来这里是为了进一步的训练？抖去你身上的尘土吧，让我们马上开始工作。"
G["Have you come for training, hunter?"]="¿Has venido para entrenarte, $gcazador:cazadora;?"
G["Have you come from the Burning Steppes?  Do you have my black dragon eggs?"]="你来自燃烧平原吗？你有黑龙蛋吗？"
G["Have you come here for instruction in the art of making potions? You were mistaken if you thought that I would offer such a privilege to you, unearned. Go, and do not return to me until you have greater skill."]="¿Has venido para instruirte en el arte de preparar pociones? Estabas muy $gequivocado:equivocada; si pensabas que te ofrecería ese privilegio, no lo has ganado. Vete y no vuelvas hasta que tengas más habilidades."
G["Have you come here to bother us, outsider?"]="为何来这里打扰我们，陌生人？"
G["Have you come here to bother us? We only want to be left alone."]="你到这里来是为了打扰我们吗？我们只想在静瑟中独处。"
G["Have you come seeking training in the ways of armed combat?"]="你是来学习如何作战吗？"
G["Have you come to help overthrow Mor'ghor?"]="你是来帮忙对付莫格霍尔的吗？"
G["Have you come to hurt me?  I have nothing to do with the war, $r.\n\nI'm just a sickly scholar, please leave me alone!"]="你要伤害我吗？我可不想和战争扯上关系，$r。\n\n我只是个体弱多病的学者，请你别来打扰我！"
G["Have you come to join the hunt, $n?"]="你是来参加狩猎的吗，$n？"
G["Have you come to kill Dalliah?  Can I watch?"]="你们是来杀达尔莉安的吗？我可以在旁边看吗？"
G["Have you come to observe my class?"]="你是来观摩我教学的吗？"
G["Have you come to observe?  Would you like a coconut?"]="你是来进行观察的吗？想要一个椰子吗？"
G["Have you come to rescue me? Quick, get me out of these chains!"]="你是过来救我的吗？快点，救我出去！"
G["Have you come to save this world? To cleanse it?"]="你是要来拯救世界的吗？要净化这一切？"
G["Have you come to see Lady Adrilia?"]="¿Has venido a ver a Lady Adrilia?"
G["Have you come to seek the knowledge of Hgarth?"]="你是来学习赫加斯部落的知识的吗？"
G["Have you come to serve the Horde?"]="你们是来投效部落的吗？"
G["Have you come to supplicate yourself before the Light? Or perhaps you have come here to train in the holy arts?\n\nIf you are here to speak with Archbishop Benedictus, I am sorry to inform you that he has left on a mission."]="你是来向圣光祈祷的吗？还是来接受圣光技艺的训练呢？\n\n如果你是来找大主教本尼迪塔斯的话，那我必须很抱歉地告诉你，他出门去执行任务了。"
G["Have you come to try my new concoctions, Wakener?  I assure you these are nothing like you've tasted before."]="想试试我的新药吗，唤醒者？我保证你从未尝过这种滋味。"
G["Have you considered settling down, $n? Kun-Lai Summit could use a strong $c such as yourself as its protector."]="¿Te has planteado la idea de asentarte, $n? A la Cima Kun-Lai le vendría de perlas tener a $gun poderoso:una poderosa; $c como $gprotector:protectora;."
G["Have you danced at the ribbon pole yet?"]="你在彩带杆那里跳过舞吗？"
G["Have you discovered something?"]="你发现什么情况了吗？"
G["Have you ever been to Jaggedswine Farm? When the swine are of age for the slaughter... It's that sound. The sound of the swine being killed... It resonates the loudest. Those are hard times for us older veterans."]="你去过野猪农场吧？猪长到适合屠宰的年纪时……对，那种惨烈的嘶叫。你听过猪临死前的哀嚎声么……非常刺耳。那些日子对我们这样的老兵来说真是煎熬。"
G["Have you ever had that feeling when you just can't remember something, but you know it's important?  It's been like that for all of us since Malfurion came back."]="你是否有过这种体验，某件事情你明知十分重要，却怎么也想不起来？似乎自从玛法里奥回来之后，所有人都变成了这样。"
G["Have you ever heard of a maiden laughing behind a fan?"]="你听过少女掩扇而笑的声音吗？"
G["Have you ever heard of a place called Dire Maul?"]="你听说过一个名叫厄运之槌的地方吗？"
G["Have you ever noticed that all those cute, orc kids look the same?"]="你有没有注意到那些可爱的兽人孩子看上去全都长得一个样？"
G["Have you ever seen a tauren hunt? You never do until it's too late."]="你见过牛头人猎人吗？等你见到时已经来不及脱身了。"
G["Have you ever seen anything like it?"]="你见过这样的东西吗？"
G["Have you ever seen drakes like the ones around here? Makes for perfect hunting."]="你没见过始祖龙吗？喏，这周围到处都是啊。祝你狩猎愉快。"
G["Have you ever seen so many unique pets?  Interested in catching some of your own?"]="你见过这么多独特的宠物吗？想不想给自己抓几只？"
G["Have you ever seen such a beautiful rabbit?  I can help you catch your own!"]="你以前见过这么漂亮的兔子么？我能帮你抓一只属于你自己的！"
G["Have you ever seen such a magnificent being?"]="你见过这么壮观的东西吗？"
G["Have you ever thought about adding some animals to your farm?"]="你有没有考虑过在自己的农场上养几只动物？"
G["Have you ever tried Eternal Blossom Fish? It's my favorite food."]="你有没有吃过锦绣鱼？那是我的最爱。"
G["Have you ever tried drinking poison, Wakener? You must start with something very mild, only a few drops at first.\n\nYou will likely become violently ill. Perhaps you will even lose an antennae or two.\n\nBut do it long enough, and you will become quite used to it."]="¿Has probado alguna vez a beber veneno, heraldo? Debes empezar con algo muy suave, solo unas gotas al principio.\n\nLo más probable es que caigas gravemente $genfermo:enferma;. Puede que hasta pierdas una antena o dos.\n\nPero si lo haces el tiempo suficiente, te acostumbrarás."
G["Have you ever wished to see the boughs of Teldrassil, $n? You should, for there is an elf there who can teach you more. Seek out Ainethil in Darnassus on the Craftsmen's Terrace."]="$n，你想目睹泰达希尔巨大的树枝吗？你真该去那儿，有位暗夜精灵能教给你更多关于炼金术的知识。去达纳苏斯的工匠区找安尼希尔谈谈吧。"
G["Have you figured out yet why that Zandalari troll was animating the statues here?"]="你查明赞达拉巨魔为什么要复活这里的雕像了吗？"
G["Have you flown in the Sky Race? I wish you luck, if you do."]="你参加飞行竞技赛了吗？祝你好运。"
G["Have you forgotten that they are holding my husband prisoner? Time is running out!"]="你是不是忘了，他们抓走了我丈夫！我们已经没时间了！"
G["Have you forgotten what it means to be an orc?! We are the blood of the Horde! Not these island beggars."]="难道你忘了生为兽人的意义？！我们是部落之血！我们和那些岛上的乞丐是不一样的。"
G["Have you fought dese 'tings before?"]="你以前和这些家伙战斗过吗？"
G["Have you found Thrall? I am badly hurt, he insisted on going ahead alone."]="你找到萨尔了吗？我受了重伤，他坚持要独自前进。"
G["Have you found something?"]="你找到什么了？"
G["Have you found them?"]="你找到他们了吗？"
G["Have you freed Drull yet? I don't know where he's being held."]="你救出德鲁尔了吗？我不知道他被关在什么地方。"
G["Have you given any more thought to my proposal, Ivar?"]="你又考虑过我的提议了吗，伊瓦？"
G["Have you given any thought to what this means, Sylvanas?"]="你考虑过这意味着什么吗，希尔瓦娜斯？"
G["Have you grunts no pride? You will have this outpost ready for the reinforcements from Warsong Hold or your worthless corpses will fill the graveyard!"]="你们这帮蠢货就没有一点自尊心吗？要么在战歌要塞的援军抵达之前修好哨站，要么就等死吧！"
G["Have you had a chance to test the efficacy of my family's dit da jow, $c?"]="你试过我们家传跌打酒的功效吗，$c？"
G["Have you had a chance to visit the Temple of the Jade Serpent? Many of our students are sent to further their training within its walls, under the watchful gaze of Yu'lon herself."]="你去过青龙寺吗？我们的许多弟子都会被派去那里潜心进修，由玉珑亲自督导。"
G["Have you had enough yet? Have you felt enough pain?"]="你受够了吗？吃够苦头了吗？"
G["Have you had the dream again? A black goat with seven eyes that watches from the outside."]="你又做同样的梦了？长着七只眼睛的黑羊从外面投来炯炯的目光。"
G["Have you heard about the great explosion in the north?"]="你听说北面的大爆炸了吗？"
G["Have you heard any news from the town leaders about the sickness going around?"]="镇长有没有提到疫情扩展的消息？"
G["Have you heard anything from Warsong? We gonna be gettin' some supplies soon?"]="有什么消息吗？我们的补给物资快到了吧？"
G["Have you heard of Azshara? There are no zombies there."]="你听说过艾萨拉吗？那里没有僵尸。"
G["Have you heard of the Isle of Thunder? Dark portents reach us even here."]="你听说过雷神岛吗？连身处此地的我们都收到了黑暗的预兆。"
G["Have you heard of the brood mother of the Black Flight? I believe she is called Onyxia..."]="你听说过黑龙公主吗？我想她名叫奥妮克希亚……"
G["Have you heard of the shadow dance? It is the dance you perform while in battle.\n\nIt is a dance with death."]="你听说过暗影之舞吗？这是在战斗中上演的舞蹈。\n\n它是死亡之舞。"
G["Have you heard of the taunka? They are supposedly related to tauren in some way. Can you imagine such a thing?"]="你听说过牦牛人吗？他们应该和牛头人有亲缘关系吧。你怎么看？"
G["Have you heard the good news, $c? The Alliance has completed all of its war effort collections! Now we simply await the Horde to finish theirs. When they do, we'll begin shipping all of the war materiel over to Silithus, and it shouldn't be long after that until the Ahn'Qiraj War begins."]="你听到那条好消息了吗，$c？联盟已经集齐战争物资了！现在只等部落完成他们的收集任务。那时，所有的战争物资将被运往希利苏斯，安其拉之战就也开始了。"
G["Have you heard the one about the ogre, the goblin and the pit lord?"]="你听说过食人魔、地精和深渊领主的故事吗？"
G["Have you heard the rumors? There was a great explosion in the northern lands of Kalimdor and the elves are finally stirring in Quel'thalas!"]="你听说那个传言了吗？在卡利姆多大陆的北方发生了巨大的爆炸，而奎尔萨拉斯的精灵们终于又活跃起来了！"
G["Have you heard the sha? We keep hearing its voice on the wind. Not good. Not good at all."]="你听说过煞魔吗？在风里，我们经常听到它的声音。不妙。大事不妙。"
G["Have you heard? The traitorous trolls have launched an attack on Razor Hill."]="你听说了吗？叛乱的巨魔对剃刀岭发动了攻击。"
G["Have you honed your skills enough to learn what I have to teach?"]="你的技巧已经达到学习新东西的标准了吗？"
G["Have you killed him? Bloodhilt served the Horde in Southern Barrens. You've avenged a great many lives today, champion."]="你杀掉他了吗？血柄曾在南贫瘠之地为部落效命。你为许多人报了仇，勇士。"
G["Have you learned nothing, boy? You have become all that your father fought against! Like that coward, Arthas, you allowed yourself to be consumed by the darkness, the hate... feeding upon the misery of those you tortured and killed!"]="你难道还不明白吗，孩子？你已经沦为了你父亲毕生都在对抗的存在！你已经和阿尔萨斯那个懦夫一样，甘心堕入黑暗……堕入仇恨……以害人为生！"
G["Have you made contact with Ivus, Arch Druid?"]="你跟大德鲁伊伊弗斯联系上了吗？"
G["Have you met Brewmaster Blanche? She wanders the roads to the south and east of here. She has been known to visit us with some of her more astounding brews."]="你见到酒仙布兰彻了吗？她经常在南边和东边的路上徘徊，总会带上口感绝妙的佳酿来造访我们，在这里家喻户晓。"
G["Have you met the Lucky Eightcoins? He is our biggest customer and the shrewdest of grummle negotiators."]="你见过好运的八铜钱吗？他是我们最大的客户，也是土地精贸易谈判代表中最精明的一位。"
G["Have you named the twins?"]="你给这对双胞胎起名字了吗？"
G["Have you not heard of Ysera? Guardian of nature? Aspect of the Dream? She is the matron of all green dragons! Aye, it was Ysera herself that gifted my kingdom with her brood. We stood shoulder to shoulder with the noble creatures and they allowed us to ride them into battle against our enemies. All was well for many centuries... until..."]="你从没有听说过伊瑟拉？大自然的守护者？翡翠梦境的守护？她是所有绿龙的女王！是的，伊瑟拉亲自将她的血脉赐予了我的王国。我们和那些高贵的生物并肩战斗，他们允许我们骑在他们身上，在战争中击溃一切敌人。就这样愉快地过了几个世纪……直到……"
G["Have you not heard?"]="你没听说吗？"
G["Have you not yet realized why we remain defiant?"]="你还不明白我们为什么要反抗十字军吗？"
G["Have you noticed anything strange happening around Zouchin Village?"]="你注意到在卓金村附近有什么奇怪的事吗？"
G["Have you noticed anything strange lately?  Any new customers in the blacksmith shop?"]="最近你有没有注意到一些奇怪的事情？铁匠铺里有没有来过什么新顾客？"
G["Have you noticed anything strange lately?  Any new customers, buying anything suspicious?"]="最近你有没有注意到一些奇怪的事情？有没有来过什么新顾客，买走什么可疑的东西？"
G["Have you recovered the final piece?"]="你取回最后一块了吗？"
G["Have you seen Lo Wanderbrew?"]="你看见罗·游酒了吗？"
G["Have you seen Merchant Greenfield's supply of seeds? There are all sorts of strange and wonderful things you can grow on your farm."]="你见过商人绿野出售的种子了吗？你在自己的农场上可以种植各种各样新鲜又奇妙的作物。"
G["Have you seen Petra or Dadanga around?"]="你在附近见过皮塔斯或达丹加吗？"
G["Have you seen Watcher Backus? So brave...\n\nI think he's the toughest of all the Night Watch. I wonder if he even notices I'm around...."]="你见过守夜人巴库斯吗？很勇敢……\n\n我想他是所有守夜人中最凶猛的一个。我怀疑他是否看到我就在周围……"
G["Have you seen all the goods that I sell? You'll have to earn favor with the Tillers to buy them from me, but in order to do that, you'll need to gain more experience by traveling this land."]="你看过我出售的所有商品了吗？你得先赢得阡陌客的青睐，才能从我这里买东西，要想做到这一点，你需要在这片土地上多加游历，积累更多经验。"
G["Have you seen all the wonderful things here in Ungoro Crater, $n? It's simply amazing. Not as amazing as some of the things I can make with my skill at engineering, but for it being all natural here... it's not too bad.\n\nMy uncle Remtravel loves old stuff like this place. I'm following in his footsteps kinda--I want to discover new things from lost cultures too!"]="¿Has visto todas las cosas maravillosas que hay en el cráter de Un’Goro, $n? Es sencillamente asombroso. No tanto como algunas cosas que podría hacer yo con mis conocimientos de ingeniería, pero para ser todo natural aquí... no está mal.\n\nA mi tío Tripirrem le encanta todo lo antiguo, como este lugar. Yo sigo sus pasos... ¡También quiero conocer cosas nuevas de culturas perdidas!"
G["Have you seen an SI:7 agent by the name of Amber?\n\nThe last I heard, her bomber took heavy damage and disappeared into the trees to the northeast."]="你见过那个名叫安玻的军情七处特工吗？\n\n她的轰炸机遭到重创，消失在了东北边的那片树林里，之后就杳无音信了。"
G["Have you seen any Stormstouts here in the Brewgarden?"]="你在落日酒坊这里见到过叫风暴烈酒的吗？"
G["Have you seen anybody named Stormstout come through here?"]="你见过有个叫风暴烈酒的人经过这里吗？"
G["Have you seen anyone suspicious trying to sell a crate of objects recently?"]="你最近是否见过某个可疑的家伙想要出售一箱奇怪的货物？"
G["Have you seen my boyfriend?"]="你看到我的女朋友了吗？"
G["Have you seen my comrades?"]="你见过我的同伴吗？"
G["Have you seen my girlfriend?"]="你看到我的女朋友了吗？"
G["Have you seen my latest invention? It's going to be a hit... if it doesn't explode."]="有没有见过我最新的发明？它一定能让你大吃一惊……如果它没有爆炸的话。"
G["Have you seen my mommy and daddy?"]="你看到过我爸爸妈妈吗？"
G["Have you seen my river boat? I can't find it anywhere!"]="看见我的赛艇了吗？我找不到它了！"
G["Have you seen my twin sister, Nimm? She's probably lost, as usual."]="你看见我的双胞胎妹妹尼姆了吗？她可能走失了，她总这样。"
G["Have you seen our lake, so calm and still? That is how we like it. Constant. Unmoving. We do not bear change."]="你看见我们湖泊了吗？多么宁静安详。我们就喜欢这样。稳定、宁静。我们不喜欢改变。"
G["Have you seen our magnificent riding turtles? They only appear slow at a glance - an experienced rider may keep pace with the swiftest wolves on all of Kalimdor. Alas, they are reserved only for our most trusted allies."]="看到我们雄壮的骑乘海龟了吗？它们乍看之下似乎慢吞吞的——可有经验的骑手却能驾着它们跟上全卡利姆多最迅捷的座狼。可惜，它们只提供给我们最信赖的盟友。"
G["Have you seen the Headless Horseman?  If he comes here then I'll fight him and steal his pumpkin!"]="你见过无头骑士吗？要是他到这里来的话，我会和他战斗，然后偷走他的南瓜！"
G["Have you seen the Headless Horseman?  The matron says if I look at him, then he'll turn me into a pumpkin!"]="你见过无头骑士吗？守护者格雷沃基说，如果他出现了的话，千万不要看他，否则他会把我变成南瓜！"
G["Have you seen the befouled water elementals in our lake, $n? It is a sorry sight, but I do not know where they are coming from.\n\nYour name has been mentioned in conversations past, perhaps you could help me with this problem.\n\nThe first thing we must learn is who is in control of these elementals."]="¿Has visto los elementales de agua podridos en nuestro lago, $n? Es un paisaje lamentable, pero no sé de dónde vienen.\n\nTu nombre se ha mencionado en conversaciones pasadas. Tal vez podrías ayudarme con este problema.\n\nLo primero que hay que saber es quién controla estos elementales."
G["Have you seen the damaged sentries that wander the island?  A few modifications to the crystals that control their behavior will allow us to gain control of them and use them to secure tactical locations.\n\nThe Sun's Reach Sanctum will be ours in no time.  We are $3244w percent done with this goal."]="¿Has visto los centinelas dañados que vagan por la isla? Unas cuantas modificaciones en los cristales que controlan su comportamiento nos permitirán controlarlos y usarlos para asegurar posiciones tácticas.\n\nEl Sagrario de Tramo del Sol será nuestro en un abrir y cerrar de ojos. Hemos completado nuestra meta en un $3244w %."
G["Have you seen the fireworks? They're beautiful!"]="你看到那些烟火了吗？真漂亮！"
G["Have you seen the fireworks? This is the best time of year to buy them."]="你看到烟火了吗？这是一年中购买烟火的最好时刻。"
G["Have you seen the golems that wander these paths, $c? Spirits bound to servitude of the Zandalari for all of eternity.\n\nPerhaps, the Mogu and the Zandalari are more alike than we ever anticipated."]="你看到那些在路上游荡的魔像了吗，$c？那些被束缚的灵魂将永世侍奉赞达拉。\n\n或许，魔古族和赞达拉比我们想象中更加相似。"
G["Have you seen the onyx serpents? They are known to lay their eggs on Windward Isle. If you find such an egg and bring it to Elder Anli, you will be justly rewarded."]="你见过玛瑙翔龙吗？它们会在临风岛上产卵。要是你能把龙蛋带给安离长老，一定能得到应有的回报。"
G["Have you seen the outrageous prices here?"]="见识过这里可怕的物价了吗？"
G["Have you seen the size of Esme's turnips?"]="你注意到艾思木家芜菁的个头了吗？"
G["Have you seen the wall over to the west? I wonder what lies beyond it?"]="你看到西面的长城了吗？我在想长城的外面有什么呢？"
G["Have you seen the way Ros'eleth winks at me whenever I go to pick up a garment or hat? When things settle down around here, I'm going to take her for a nice walk in the woods.\n\nFor once, I miss all those fancy taverns in Stormwind."]="你有没有看到每当我拿起一件衣服或者帽子的时候，洛瑟蕾丝总是对我眨眼睛？当这附近的事情安定下来后，我一定会带她去森林里散散步。\n\n有时候，我还是挺想念暴风城的那些豪华旅店的。"
G["Have you seen the yaungol fighting each other? It seems their troubles run deeper than we thought."]="你看到那些自相残杀的野牛人了吗？看来他们的麻烦比我们想象中还要严重啊。"
G["Have you seen those huge dirt mounds moving around beneath the dunes?  They belong to a species of tunneling worm the likes of which Azeroth has never seen!  I'm sure that battling one would be a great learning experience for a seasoned adventurer such as yourself."]="¿Has visto esos grandes montones de tierra que se mueven debajo de las dunas? ¡Pertenecen a un tipo de gusano tunelador que no se ha visto nunca en Azeroth! Estoy seguro de que luchar contra uno sería una gran experiencia de aprendizaje para $gun aventurero experimentado:una aventurera experimentada; como tú."
G["Have you sheen the rum? ...hic! I can't sheem to find it anywhere!"]="你看见朗姆酒了吗？……嗝儿！我到处都找遍了！"
G["Have you spoken to either of my acolytes inside the tower yet, $n? We cannot complete your orb until you've done one of their tasks. Speak to them now, if you're ready."]="¿Has hablado ya con alguno de mis acólitos de la torre, $n? No podemos terminar tu orbe hasta que no hayas cumplido sus tareas. Ve a hablar con ellos si estás $gpreparado:preparada;."
G["Have you spoken with the high priestess yet?  She's very eager to hear the tale of the pilgrimage from your point of view."]="你和高阶女牧师谈过话了吗？她非常渴望听到你去朝圣的故事。"
G["Have you talked to anyone who hasn't started getting sick?"]="你和那些尚未染病的人交谈过吗？"
G["Have you talked to my clone--I mean... my twin?"]="你和我的克隆体说过话了吗——我的意思是……我的双胞胎？"
G["Have you tried Kol's cooking? I can't seem to get enough of it."]="你有没有尝过柯的厨艺？我好像怎么都吃不够。"
G["Have you tried NOT standing in that? It might work better."]="你有没有试过不要站在那里面？那样或许会好一些。"
G["Have you tried any of Chef Tramsay's dishes yet? I really enjoyed his Moth Soup. Delicious!"]="有没有试过厨师特兰姆塞的菜肴？我非常喜欢他的蛾肉汤。那可真是美味！"
G["Have you tried our bread? Baker Masterson must be the most gifted chef to have ever lived!"]="你尝过我们的面包吗？面包师玛斯特森是最具天才的烹饪师！"
G["Have you tried that Thunderbrew Lager?  It's good stuff!"]="你喝过雷霆啤酒吗？那可是好东西！"
G["Have you tried the Dark Iron Ale?  It's the best!"]="你喝过黑铁啤酒吗？那可是最好的啤酒！"
G["Have you tried the pretzels at Brewfest?  They are amazing, $c!"]="你尝过美酒节饼干了吗？简直太可口了，$c！"
G["Have you tried the rice? You really need to try the rice."]="你尝过这个米饭了吗？你真应该尝尝。"
G["Have you? Then you know how weak and pathetic the high elf version of troll magic was?\n\nThe high elves could not understand why a people with their magical affinity could not contend with the powers of troll voodoo. This was an inconceivable notion for the pale skins to understand. They were resigned to using the bastardized version of troll enchantments. I believe they called them 'Arcanum.'"]="¿Ah, sí? ¿Entonces sabrás lo débil y patética que era la versión de los elfos nobles de la magia trol?\n\nLos elfos nobles no pudieron comprender cómo un pueblo, con su afinidad con la magia, no era capaz de competir con los poderes del vudú trol. Era una noción inconcebible para los pieles blancas, nunca llegaron a entenderlo. Se resignaron a utilizar la versión envilecida de los encantamientos trol. Creo que llamaron a esta versión, 'arcano'."
G["Haven't I seen tonight's show before? I could have sworn..."]="我以前没有看过今晚的表演吗？我发誓……"
G["Haven't I seen you before?  We'll be keeping an eye on you, citizen."]="我以前见过你吗？我们会注意你的。"
G["Haven't got much time to talk, $r. That is, unless you're willin' to help with this mine trouble."]="我没有时间闲扯，$r。确切地说，除非你愿意帮我解决矿井里的麻烦。"
G["Haven't had much luck. I think it's my bait."]="还是运气不佳。我想是鱼饵的问题。"
G["Haven't seen a battle like this since the Frost Giants!"]="自从冰霜巨人一战后，很久没有经历过这样激烈的战事了！"
G["Haven't seen any. I'm starting to wonder if we will be able to make it up the mountain."]="还没见着呢。我开始怀疑我们是否能够爬上这座山。"
G["Haven't seen that card before."]="我从没见过这张牌。"
G["Haven't you been listening? No, I very much doubt we would be having this conversation had Kel'Thuzad formed the staff. Kel'Thuzad holds the head. His underlings hold forty splinters of Atiesh. The last piece - the base - was uncovered by Brann Bronzebeard. He was last seen in the Silithus desert; undoubtedly doing his best to stay as far away as possible from the relentless seekers Kel'Thuzad has dispatched into the world."]="你没听明白吗？不，至少在我们在这里谈话时，克尔苏加德还无法重新铸成法杖。克尔苏加德拥有法杖的头，他的手下分别持有着埃提耶什的四十块碎片。可杖尾却被布莱恩·铜须拿走了。他最后一次出现应该是在希利苏斯的沙漠；很显然他是为了尽量躲避克尔苏加德派出的那些残忍的杀手与刺客才这么做的。"
G["Haven't you done enough harm?  Must you also disturb my slumber?"]="你折腾得还不够吗？你非要把我从沉睡中惊醒吗？"
G["Haven't you heard? I always win!"]="没听说过吗？我永远属于赢的一方！"
G["Haven't you poisoned the minds of enough men with your lies? Stay away from me!"]="你们用谎言毒害的人还不够多吗？离我远点儿！"
G["Havenshire is lost!"]="海文郡沦陷了！"
G["Havenshire will soon be overrun with Scourge. We must hurry!"]="天灾军团即将攻陷海文郡。我们必须加快速度！"
G["Having a bad day? Try some cherry pie."]="今天不太开心？尝尝这些樱桃馅饼吧。"
G["Having a good time?"]="玩得开心吗？"
G["Having problems, Dalliah?  How nice."]="遇到麻烦了吗，达尔莉安？啧啧。"
G["Having seen him in action, I now know what that means."]="看了他的作为，我明白了一件事。"
G["Having some trouble there, sailor?  Need some help?"]="¿Tienes algún problema, $gmarinero:marinera;? ¿Necesitas ayuda?"
G["Having successfully defended the Alonsus Chapel, %s's spirit returns to its rest."]="成功地守卫了阿隆索斯礼拜堂之后，%s的灵魂恢复了它的宁静。"
G["Having trouble dealing with the Wretched? I've got just what you need."]="和那些失心者打交道遇到什么麻烦了吗？我这里有你想要的东西。"
G["Having trouble staying grounded?"]="站不住脚了吗？"
G["Hawkstriders are noble creatures.  Make sure to always treat yours well; there are fewer things more dangerous than an angry hawkstrider."]="陆行鸟是种高贵的生物。你要好好对待你的陆行鸟，没有什么比一只愤怒的陆行鸟更危险了。"
G["Hazza'rah, the Dreamweaver.\n\nHis is the power of nightmares, and may his foes ever sleep.\n\nHazza'rah now dreams near the edge of madness."]="织梦者哈扎拉尔。\n\n他拥有噩梦的力量，愿他的敌人永远沉睡。\n\n哈扎拉尔就在疯狂之缘那边。"
G["Hazza'rah, the Dreamweaver.\n\nHis is the power of nightmares, and may his foes ever sleep.  \n\nHazza'rah now dwells far from here.  One day, he may return..."]="织梦者哈扎拉尔。\n\n他他拥有噩梦的力量，愿他的敌人永远沉睡。\n\n哈扎拉尔正在遥远的地方徘徊。总有一天，他会回来的……"
G["Hch'uu!!!"]="哈克乌！！！"
G["He IS a fighter. But... is he a leader?"]="他战技超群。可他…能当领袖吗？"
G["He already knows it will be a smashing success!"]="他已经知道，这将是一次决定性的胜利！"
G["He appeared from thin air!"]="他从空气中突然出现了！"
G["He asked if the imp could join in--can you believe it? Actually, it wasn't half bad...."]="他问我是否可以让小鬼一起来——你能相信吗？说实话，那还不是最糟糕的……"
G["He be just west of here, workin' at some black magic."]="他就在西边，在操纵某种黑暗魔法。"
G["He called himself Gearmaster Mechazod. When we arrived he was busy transforming the survivors into mechanical beings!\n\nHe greeted us warmly and explained that he was one of the first gnomes ever to be created by something he called \"The Grand Architect\", a Titan keeper from within the halls of fabled Ulduar.\n\nApparently, he was the blockage that my team had accidentally sucked up from where he'd malfunctioned thousands of years ago. It was just our luck that we'd built the pumping station right above him."]="Se hace llamar el maestro de palancas Mecazod. ¡Cuando llegamos, estaba ocupado trasvasando los cerebros de los supervivientes a cuerpos mecánicos!\n\nNos saludó con afecto y nos explicó que él era uno de los primeros gnomos creados por algo llamado \"el gran arquitecto\", un vigilante titán del legendario Ulduar.\n\nPor lo visto, él era el obstáculo que mi equipo había absorbido accidentalmente del lugar en el que se había estropeado miles de años atrás. ¡Y nosotros tuvimos que construir nuestra estación de bombeo justo sobre él!"
G["He called it the Curse of the Flesh. Mechazod is deranged!"]="麦卡佐德说那是“血肉诅咒”。他发疯了！"
G["He calls himself the Fur Baron - I call him a sucker! I get a brand new set of winter socks made of rat fur for merely killing and skinning fifty caribou fawns?"]="他居然自称皮草男爵——要我说，他简直是个吸血鬼！我用50张驯鹿皮换回的只是一双老鼠皮制成的冬袜？"
G["He can't have gotten far..."]="他不可能逃得太远……"
G["He cannot allow him to live in this madness. The Klaxxi will want him put down."]="我们不能再让他这么疯癫下去了。卡拉克西希望制止他。"
G["He cannot be defeated. <The relic burns to nothing. The memories it held are now your own. This city was destroyed by a being not of this world.>"]="他是无法被打败的。<古物燃烧起来，化为灰烬。你获悉了古物中蕴藏的秘密：这座城市是被一个不属于这个世界的生物摧毁的。>"
G["He carries the Doomhammer!"]="他拿着毁灭战锤！"
G["He claims that all creations of the Titans fall prey to what he calls, 'The Curse of Flesh'. He says that the original gnomes were once mechagnomes."]="Afirma que todas las creaciones de los titanes son víctimas de lo que él llama \"la maldición de la carne\". Dice que los primeros gnomos fueron una vez mecagnomos."
G["He closed his eyes, and became one with the land. And then - do you know what happened?"]="他闭上双眼，与大地融为一体。然后——你们知道发生了什么吗？"
G["He collapses to the floor in exhaustion."]="他精疲力竭地跌在地上。"
G["He continues cautiously."]="他小心翼翼地继续前进。"
G["He could've destroyed the entire city if he willed it. We were powerless to stop him."]="要是愿意，他原本可以毁掉整座城市。而我们根本无能为力。"
G["He cried when his worg died. Well, no one cries for him now!"]="他为他的座狼的死而哭泣。好吧，现在没人为他哭泣了！"
G["He dead."]="他死了。"
G["He dead... we free! We glad you pick us instead of puppy-men. Very glad! Definately. Very glad!"]="他死了……我们自由啦！很高兴你能站在我们这一边，而不是与狗狗人为伍。我们很高兴！真的！非常高兴！"
G["He described the golden capital of Zandalar slowly sinking beneath the waves in the aftermath of the Cataclysm, its once-great people drowning as their mighty works slipped forever beneath the sea."]="他描述了赞达拉的黄金都城将在大灾变后慢慢沉入海底，昔日伟大的人民随着自己的杰作永远葬身海底。"
G["He did NOT just say that!"]="他可不能老这么说！"
G["He did more than that, Thorim.  He controls Ulduar now."]="他罪行还不止于此，托里姆。他现在控制了奥杜尔。"
G["He did not always command such power."]="他并非一直如此强硬。"
G["He did so to keep the land whole. Living with the mantid for ten thousand years has made us both STRONG."]="因为这才是一片完整的土地。一万年来，与螳螂妖的战争令双方都变得强大。"
G["He died fighting! PH"]="他在战斗时倒下了！"
G["He died our greatest hero. It was Grom who freed us all... I was by his side when he struck down Mannoroth and ended the curse forever."]="我们最伟大的英雄去世了。那就是拯救我们全族的格罗姆……我和他并肩而战，最后他打倒了玛诺洛斯，永远地终结了我们的诅咒。"
G["He doesn't need blades or magic to defeat his enemies. Our next challenger, Hexos, fights his foes with the awesome powers of GEOMETRY!"]="接下来这位，他无需刀剑与魔法就能打败敌人。我们的下一位挑战者，海克索斯，使用强大的几何之力克敌制胜的战士！"
G["He doesn't need blades or magic to defeat his enemies. Our next challenger, Hexos, fights his foes with the powers of GEOMETRY!"]="接下来这位，他无需刀剑与魔法就能打败敌人。我们的下一个挑战者，海克索斯，使用强大的几何之力克敌制胜的战士！"
G["He doesn't see me, does he?"]="他看不见我，对吧？"
G["He ends up destroying the whole keep, freeing all the orcs we're keeping in the camps, and rising to power as the king of orcs... Warchief or somethin'."]="他最终摧毁了整个城堡，救出了所有被我们关在营地的兽人。他成为了兽人的国王……酋长之类的什么东西。"
G["He flew in, torched the park, then just flew off."]="他飞进来，一把火烧光了公园，然后拍拍翅膀飞走了。"
G["He fought and died with honor."]="他为荣誉而战，也为荣誉而死。"
G["He fought with honor. His first and last mistake."]="他曾为荣誉而战。这是他最大的错误。"
G["He found a planet whose races had deviated from the titans' blueprints. A planet where not everything had gone according to plan."]="他发现，在这个世界中，人们并不接受泰坦设计的蓝图。在这个世界中，并非一切都按照计划完美运行。"
G["He gestures towards the eastern vale, then disappears in the shadows."]="他指着东边的山谷，然后消失在暗影中。"
G["He gestures towards the incoming statues, requesting your aid."]="他指着前来的雕像，希望得到你的帮助。"
G["He got a big army, an' he be plannin' somethin' down dere."]="他有一支规模很大的军队，而且他正在策划着一个阴谋。"
G["He grew and grew and grew, SO big, that now some people call him \"The Wandering Isle.\""]="Pero creció y creció y creció, y se hizo tan grande que ahora algunos la llaman \"La Isla Errante\"."
G["He grows fatter and more corrupt with each passing day. Ye can smell the stink comin' off o' his body. He be dirty, an' I dun just mean he be needin' a wash.\n\nEnough babblin' from Hulfdan. Where did ye come from and how can me help ye, $c?"]="Se vuelve más gordo y más corrupto con cada día que pasa. Se puede oler la peste que emana de su cuerpo. Lo suyo es suciedad pura, y no me refiero a que necesite un buen lavado.\n\n¡Basta de cháchara por parte de Hulfdan! ¿De dónde has salido y cómo puedo ayudarte, $c?"
G["He had it coming."]="他让它来了。"
G["He had that one coming."]="这下够他受的了。"
G["He happened upon a pair of battling kodos.\nClever as he was, The Wolf decided to wait for one to defeat the other."]="Se encontró con un par de kodos que se estaban peleando.\n\nComo era muy listo, el lobo decidió esperar a que uno matara al otro."
G["He has ordered his crony, Razlo Crushcog, to keep us on the defensive. Hinkles, what's the latest intelligence on Razlo and his men?"]="他已经命部下——拉奇诺·碎轮来让我们疲于防御。辛克尔斯，有什么关于拉奇诺和他手下的最新情报吗？"
G["He has seen many high elders come and go. He also tends to take these celebrations very seriously."]="他见证了许多长老的兴衰沉浮。他对这些庆典也非常重视。"
G["He has the legs of an ox! Have you ever been kicked by him in training?"]="他的腿像牛一样有力！你在训练时被他踢到过吗？"
G["He has to be in the last cell. Unless... they killed him."]="他应该在最后一间牢房里。除非……除非他们已经把他给杀了。"
G["He hasn't been the same since the War. It's like he aged and became an old man overnight. That son of his, though - he'll make a fine king one day."]="自从战争以后，他就变得不一样了。好像他变老了，而且是一夜之间变老了。不过他的儿子总有一天会变成一位杰出的国王。"
G["He he!  This will be a great hiding spot."]="呵呵！这里是个不错的藏身之地。"
G["He is coming..."]="他来了……"
G["He is creating a new world for us. He is not... making a salad!"]="他在为我们创造一个新世界。他不是在……拌色拉！"
G["He is dead! You have done it!"]="他死了！你成功了！"
G["He is gone. We must all move on."]="他已经牺牲了。我们必须朝前看。"
G["He is heading to the maelstrom!  We must stop him NOW, we may never get another chance if he escapes into Deepholm."]="他朝着大漩涡去了！我们必须马上阻止他；如果他逃回了深岩之洲，我们就再也没有机会了。"
G["He is insane now. Driven mad during the shattering. There is no rest for the elements."]="他现在已经疯了，在破碎中失去了理智。元素们将永无安宁。"
G["He is lost to us, sister. He is Neltharion no longer."]="他背叛我们了，姐姐。他不再是奈萨里奥了。"
G["He is mine now..."]="他现在归我了……"
G["He is near, lurking in the shadows... I can sense it."]="他就在附近，躲藏在阴影里……我能感觉得到。"
G["He is not a chicken, and no you may not pet him. Now be on your way before I give you a closer look at his beak."]="他不是一只鸡，所以你不能把他当作宠物。该干什么干什么去，不然我就给你点颜色看看。"
G["He is our only way to find the bell. We WILL make him talk. Give us time."]="他是我们找到圣钟的唯一线索。我们会让他说实话的。只需要给我们一些时间。"
G["He is protecting the mask. Kill him!"]="他在保护面具。杀了他！"
G["He is slow from the rust of the ages... be quick on your feet and he will not best you. You have King Stormheart's favor - do not disappoint."]="岁月的侵蚀令他变得行动迟缓……你只要保持身手敏捷，他是不可能战胜你的。雷心国王在默默地支持你——别让他失望。"
G["He is still connected to the Well somehow! Focus your attacks on Mannoroth, we must disrupt his concentration!"]="他仍然与永恒之井连接在一起！集中攻击玛诺洛斯！不能让他专心施法！"
G["He is the greatest hero the arakkoa have ever known.\n\nIt is said that in ancient times, he built the city of Skettis with his own claws. He was our greatest champion and defender, but he left us when we turned away from the veneration of Rukhmar.\n\nWe came to worship a new master, one who promised us untold power and status in the cosmos.\n\nThere are some who say that Terokk and Rukhmar are one, and he withdrew his presence from us when we turned away from him."]="他是鸦人有史以来最伟大的英雄。\n\n据说在远古时代，他用自己的爪子建造了斯克提斯。他是我们最伟大的勇士和守护者，但当我们开始放弃对鲁克玛的崇拜时，他离开了我们。\n\n我们开始崇拜一个承诺给我们无尽力量的新主人。\n\n有人说泰罗卡和鲁克玛是同一个人，所以他在我们背弃他的时候离开了我们。"
G["He is too powerful!  Use the altars to harness the powers of the elements and we may stand a chance!"]="他太强大了！利用祭坛来操纵元素能量，也许我们还能有取胜的机会！"
G["He is too powerful!  You must use the drums!"]="他太强大了！一定要使用战鼓了！"
G["He is too powerful. We must leave this place at once! My magic can hold him in place for only a short time. Come quickly, heroes!"]="太强大了。我们必须马上离开！我的魔法只能暂时拖住他。快来，英雄们！"
G["He is unable to see you just yet, but do not trouble yourselves over it. I'm certain he will find a way to fit you into his busy schedule."]="他现在还不能和你会面，但不用担心。我确信他会找到合适的机会，在他繁忙的日程中与你们会面。"
G["He just came stumbing out of the barracks.\n\nI screamed for help, but the guards wouldn't even look at me!"]="他就从那座兵营里跌跌撞撞地爬了出来。\n\n我尖叫着寻求援助，但那些卫兵甚至不看我一眼！"
G["He just inherited Sunsong Ranch. You can literally see him from where you are standing."]="他刚刚继承了日歌农场。从你现在所站的位置就能看见他。"
G["He just went missing and I don't know what to do!"]="他失踪了，我完全不知道该怎么办！"
G["He keeps talking about arclight spanners and overcharged capacitors. He sure knows to lead a girl on. Rawr!"]="他总是谈论扳手和超载电容器。他肯定知道哄骗女孩。嗷！"
G["He keeps telling me that he likes my accent, and I just keep asking, what accent?"]="他经常告诉我说他喜欢我的口音，我就一直问他，什么口音？"
G["He killed everyone! EVERYONE!"]="他杀了所有人！所有人！"
G["He knew you were a traitor!"]="他早知道你是个叛徒。"
G["He knows more about this land than we do. Perhaps you should heed his warnings."]="他比我们更加了解这片土地。也许你该留意他的告诫。"
G["He knows well of your curse and of the terrible things that can come of it.  He may even hold himself to blame for it to some degree."]="他非常了解你们所遭受的诅咒和它的可怕影响。对此他也对自己怀有几分自责。"
G["He knows what we attempt. We have not much time, the forest crawls with his demons."]="他知道了我们的计划。时间不多了，他的恶魔遍布了整片森林。"
G["He looked real important. Tak-Tak try to chitchatter with 'im, but he jus' stared at me so I shut my jabber real quick."]="他看上去有很重要的事情。泰克泰克想要和他聊聊，但是他一瞪我，我就只能闭嘴了。"
G["He mad, bro, real mad!"]="他气疯了，兄弟，真的疯了！"
G["He managed to explore the ruins before the battle began, discovering three runic plates inscribed with prophecies."]="他趁战争打响前探察了这片废墟，发现了三块刻有预言的符文板。"
G["He may be a huge chicken, but he'll still put up a fight. It's Tyson Sanders!"]="虽然他就像是一只大公鸡，但他仍然要奋勇战斗。他就是，泰森·山德士！"
G["He may never know the peace of returning to the earth... but at least he went out fighting."]="他也许再也看不到大地重归平静……可他至少为此而战过。"
G["He may not wish to leave, regardless of whose heart beckons him home."]="他也许不想离开，无论是谁在呼唤他。"
G["He motions for you to wait."]="他示意让你等等。"
G["He must be overwhelmed with work at the Monastery. But still, he should have returned by now."]="他一定被修道院的工作拖住了。但是不管怎么样，他现在也该回来了。"
G["He must embrace them and find balance... or this curse will never end."]="他必须拥抱渴望，并找到平衡……否则诅咒永无终结。"
G["He must fall!"]="必须打倒他！"
G["He must have news from the field."]="他一定带来了前线的消息。"
G["He must have pursued the fleeing yaungol while we intercepted their leader."]="在我们阻截敌人时，他准是去追逃跑的野牛人了。"
G["He never gave up - Captain Irontree - said he'd make them pay for every inch of ground they defile. He may still be alive down there!"]="他从不放弃——铁木队长——他说要让他们为其所玷污的每一寸土地付出代价。他很可能就在那下面，也许还活着！"
G["He offered all of us a chance to regain our former glory... to be true tol'vir again.\n\nBut only... if we swore allegiance to him."]="他承诺会让我们恢复往日的光荣……再次成为真正的托维尔人。\n\n但条件是……我们必须发誓向他效忠。"
G["He often seeks a lordly dish..."]="来端上餐桌……"
G["He opened his umbrella, planted it in the ground, and sat underneath its cool shade."]="他撑开竹伞，把伞柄插进地里，坐在伞下乘凉。"
G["He outgrew his bowl, so now we keep him in this pond!"]="胖得连碗都装不下了，所以我们只好把它养在这池塘里！"
G["He points down the hall ahead."]="他指着前方的大厅。"
G["He promised gold and riches to any who could discover for him the hidden secrets of this land that fill Pandaria with such a dark and powerful energy."]="他许诺，谁能为他解开这片土地中那股强大的黑暗力量背后的秘密，就能得到黄金和财富。"
G["He put the needs of this flight first and foremost."]="他永远将蓝龙军团的需要放在首位。"
G["He puts the rock into the hole!"]="他把石头丢进了洞里！"
G["He really couldn't help it..."]="他真的帮不上忙……"
G["He reports deciphering part of the writing on the runic plate, but it doesn't look like he recorded his translation."]="他记录下大段已被破译的符文，却没有留下他的翻译。"
G["He represents everything that is just, and righteous, and a bunch of other boring crap too. It's the draenei paladin, Ahoo'ru!"]="他代表着一切正直、正义以及其他的无聊品质。他就是德莱尼圣骑士，阿霍鲁！"
G["He represents everything that is just, and righteous, and several other virtues which are of no interest to most of you. It's the draenei paladin, Ahoo'ru!"]="他代表了一切正直、正义与其他为大多数人所不屑的美德。他就是德莱尼圣骑士，阿霍鲁！"
G["He returned to the main continent of Pandaria once every five years."]="他每隔五年返回潘达利亚的主大陆一次。"
G["He said goodbye just a few days ago. I can still see his face! How can he be dead?"]="他几天前才跟我告别。我的眼前至今还晃动着他的脸。他怎么可能死了呢？"
G["He said he had candy..."]="他说他有糖……"
G["He scoured the sands of Durotar, hunting for his prey."]="他在杜隆塔尔的沙丘上搜寻着猎物。"
G["He seems to know more than the whispering citizens, and he seems convinced that this traitor is the one last remnant of the cities troubles, Cataclysm aside."]="他似乎比那些低语的平民所知更多，他确信这名叛徒是达纳苏斯最后的麻烦，除了大灾变。"
G["He served 248 consecutive tours of duty across the First, Second and Third Wars."]="他在第一次，第二次和第三次兽人战争时期完成过248个任务。"
G["He shoots, he scores!"]="他百发百中！"
G["He should have chosen me. Those who take the greatest risks achieve the greatest victories."]="他应该选我的。只有敢于冒险的人才会取得辉煌的胜利。"
G["He should not have angered me.  I must go... recover my strength now..."]="他不应该惹恼我。我必须……恢复我的力量……"
G["He sits idly on his chieftain's chair, content to mask his cowardice with dreams of peace!"]="他慵懒地坐在酋长宝座上，奢望用和平的美梦掩饰他的懦弱！"
G["He sought an artifact... a horn, I think. He left the village on a long journey in search of it."]="他要去找一件神器……一只号角。他离开了村子，踏上了寻找它的漫漫长途。"
G["He sought to consolidate our rightful power, fortifying us for the cataclysm that he saw coming."]="他一直努力巩固理应属于我们的力量，以应对这场他所预见的大灾变。"
G["He started it!"]="是他先惹我的！"
G["He struggles to free himself."]="他努力想要挣脱。"
G["He suggested I do something else with the lance, instead. It's not my place to repeat vulgarities."]="他建议我拿着长矛去做点别的事。他说那里不是我进行粗野行为的地方。"
G["He tampers with the lock on your cage."]="他摆弄着你笼子上的锁。"
G["He thinks he's so damned important. Always pushing me around... I'll show him. I'll show all of them!"]="他以为自己多么重要，总是把我呼来喝去的……我要给他点颜色看看……我要让他们所有人都尝尝我的厉害！"
G["He told me that you would come for me. I won't die by your hand, though. I have seen what you have done to my compatriots."]="他早就预知你会来对付我。我亲眼目睹了你对我的同胞做过的事。但是，我是不会死在你手上的。"
G["He took the unforged rune covered breastplate, used in the making of the demon forged breastplate and ran away without making payment. A fool, I am not, however... the unforged chest piece is useless without knowledge or the recipe to apply said knowledge.\n\nI wonder... does he sit safely in his city of Blackrock Spire and attempt to create the item from the raw material? I know he dare not leave!"]="Cogió la coraza rúnica sin forjar, utilizado para la creación de la coraza demoníaca forjada y huyó sin pagar. Pero yo no soy ningún estúpido... la pieza es inútil sin conocimiento o sin la receta para aplicar ese conocimiento.\n\nMe pregunto... ¿seguirá a salvo en su ciudad de la Cumbre de Roca Negra intentando crear el objeto a partir de la materia prima? ¡Sé que no se atreve a salir!"
G["He tried to sneak up behind me and plant his blade in my skull.  Lucky for me, I can smell a dwarf a mile away... and my skull's a lot thicker than most."]="他想要偷偷溜到我背后，把刀刃插进我的脑壳里。可幸运的是，我在一里外就能闻到矮人的气味……而且我的脑壳比普通人要厚得多。"
G["He united the mogu, conquered the other pandaren races, and built an empire that would last for thousands of years."]="他统一魔古族，征服了其他熊猫人种族，并建立起了延续数千年的帝国。"
G["He united the mogu, defeated the other pandaren races, and founded a glorious nation with the slave labor of those he conquered."]="他统一魔古族，击败了其他熊猫人种族，并靠他征服的奴隶建立起了辉煌的帝国。"
G["He wants his \"golds.\" Pay up or die... again..."]="Quiere sus \"oros\". Paga o muere... otra vez."
G["He wants me to do WHAT?"]="什么？他想让我干嘛？"
G["He was a good man, but terrible with a sword! PH"]="他是个好人，可拿上剑之后就变得无比可怕！"
G["He was a tough one..."]="他真难对付……"
G["He was always prattling on about finding this or that magic artifact. Said Azshara was full of them, he did. He was a bit obsessive if you ask me.\n\nLast I heard, he was trying to make friends with that Archmage person. Xylem? He said Xylem had found some grand old magic item."]="他总是嘟囔着要去找到这个或者那个魔法宝物。他说艾萨拉到处都有这种宝物。要我说，他大概是有些强迫症的迹象。\n\n最近我听说他正在和那个叫克希雷姆的大法师交朋友。他说克希雷姆已经找到了一些很强大的魔法物品。"
G["He was always studying, always trying to get better."]="他总是在学习，总是想要变得更好。"
G["He was beaten and left for dead. If Priestess Delrissa hadn't arrived when she did, who knows what might have happened!"]="他被打倒在地，人人都以为他已经死了。要不是女祭司德莉希亚及时赶到，谁知道会发生什么！"
G["He was but a trainee.  The will of a master is stronger!"]="他只是个受训者。大师的意志要强大得多！"
G["He was called James Harrington.  A tragedy in three parts."]="他曾被称作詹姆斯·哈林顿。悲剧的三部曲。"
G["He was hungry for kodo meat."]="他渴望着科多兽的肉。"
G["He was just a wee pebble..."]="他只是块小卵石……"
G["He was misguided, of course, but he was right about one thing: Our world is... so fragile."]="没错，他是误入歧途，可他却说对了一件事——我们的世界……确实脆弱不堪。"
G["He was right, you know. I'll have to take that tag-line for my own... It's not like he'll have a use for it anymore!"]="他是对的，你知道。我不得不亲自拿起那把标记射线枪……看上去他不会再使用它了！"
G["He was so cold. So limp and lifeless."]="他这么冷，这么无助，毫无生气。"
G["He was the Earthen Ring's most powerful shaman, and the ceremony cannot continue without him. But we must be prepared to accept that he may be lost forever..."]="他是大地之环最强大的萨满，这场仪式不可能在他缺席的情况下继续。但我们必须做好心理准备，接受他永远消失的可能性。"
G["He was weak, but I am stronger!"]="很弱，但我比他强！"
G["He was wounded.  I can easily pick up his trail."]="他受伤了。我很容易就能找到他的痕迹。"
G["He was wounded.  I think I can pick up the trail."]="他受伤了。我想我能追踪这些血迹。"
G["He watches your every move..."]="你的每个举动都在他的监视之下…"
G["He will be sleepy for a while.  Lunk know.  Lunk do before."]="他要睡上一会儿了。隆克知道。隆克以前也是这样。"
G["He will guide our next steps..."]="他会指引我们……"
G["He will learn... no king rules forever; only death is eternal!"]="他会明白……没有谁可以永远坐在王位上，只有死亡才是永恒的！"
G["He will live so long as he proves useful. I'd be careful if I was you, dwarf."]="他还有利用价值，就留着他吧。矮人，如果我是你的话，我会更加谨慎的。"
G["He will not be defeated until he is utterly annhilated."]="除非将他轰至灰飞烟灭，否则都不能算是击败了他。"
G["He will stop at nothing to get to Malfurion's physical manifestation. That must not happen... We must keep the beast occupied long enough for Tyrande to arrive."]="他会不择手段地摧毁玛法里奥的肉身。我们绝不能让此事发生……我们必须在泰兰德到达之前控制住那头野兽。"
G["He won't be gettin' up from that one."]="他别想再站起来了。"
G["He worried that his power weakened, that soon even we last of his precious soulgems would fade and die."]="他担心他的法力会减弱，那块宝贵的灵魂宝石也会消失和死亡。"
G["He would never just disappear like this! It's not like him."]="他不会就这样无缘无故地消失！他不是这样的人。"
G["He would never leave on his own! Where could he have gone?"]="他绝对不会单独离开！他到底去哪里了？"
G["He would say to you: Thrall. Lead your people."]="他会对你说：萨尔，领导你的人民。"
G["He'll bring you mead\nHe'll bring you beer\nA grinning face from ear to ear\nHe's served us all from year to year\nWe call him Smiling Jim."]="Te traerá hidromiel\nTe traerá cerveza\nUna sonrisa de oreja a oreja\nNos ha servido de año en año\nLo llamamos Jim Sonrisas."
G["He'll bring you mead, he'll bring you beer..."]="他给你蜂蜜酒，他给你啤酒……"
G["He'll get me more later? How are we supposed to get you promoted to Trade $g Prince : Princess; without our number one product on the shelves?!!!"]="¿Me conseguirá más después? ¡¡¡¿Cómo vamos a conseguir que asciendas a $gPríncipe:Princesa; mercante si nuestro producto estrella falta en las estanterías?!!!"
G["He'll peck your eyes out if you give him a chance. It's Dippy!"]="别让他逮到机会，他会啄你的眼睛！帝皮出场！"
G["He'll slice and dice in ways that aren't nice! Please bow respectfully for Maki Waterblade, saurok samurai!"]="他的剑一旦出鞘，敌人已经没有好下场！请对蜥蜴人武士水刃马基恭敬地鞠躬！"
G["He's a bit animated for my tastes, but the world needs all kinds, I suppose.\n\nWhy do you ask?"]="Es un poco efusivo para mi gusto, pero en el mundo tiene que haber de todo, supongo.\n\n¿Por qué lo preguntas?"
G["He's a strategic mastermind, and he doesn't even have a head. Or an elbow, even. It's Ro-Shambo! Let's give him a hand!"]="他是一位战略大师，他甚至都没有脑袋，也没有肘子。他就是，猜拳手！让我们为他拍拍手吧！"
G["He's absolutely raging!  So much anger, so much pain... and he had the strength to suppress it all these years..."]="他可真是发怒了！如此愤怒，如此痛苦……这么多年来他一直用自己的力量压抑着……"
G["He's alive alright, and been living like an outcast in Lakeshire for the past five months. Or hadn't you noticed? Now enough chatter. We've got people to save!"]="是的，他还活着，在过去的五个月里像个被放逐者一样活在湖畔镇。你没有注意到吗？我们已经聊够了。我还要去救人！"
G["He's alive, but his bones are shattered."]="他还活着，可全身的骨头都碎了。"
G["He's almost down!"]="他快不行了！"
G["He's at the Shado-Pan Garrison right now. Here's a kite. Go see him!"]="他现在身处影踪卫戍营。这儿有只风筝。去看看他吧！"
G["He's been... mortally wounded, sir."]="他……受了重伤，陛下。"
G["He's castin' something big! Stop'm!"]="他要有大动作了！阻止他！"
G["He's coming.  Get ready, lads!"]="他来了。准备好，兄弟们！"
G["He's completely mad!"]="他已经彻底疯了！"
G["He's cornered!"]="他走投无路了！"
G["He's deluded a group of diseased humans into thinking they can take their land back. He's poisoned their blood with his own draconic essence."]="他蛊惑了一群染病的人类，让他们自以为可以夺回失去的土地。他用他的龙族精华污染了那些人的血。"
G["He's gem-mad, he is, but I love him. Says I'm his favorite gem of them all, hee!\nNow then, what can I help ye with? Archaeology, is it?"]="Está loco por las gemas, sí, pero le adoro. ¡Dice que yo soy su gema favorita, jejeje!\n\nBueno, ¿en qué puedo ayudarte? Arqueología, ¿no?"
G["He's going after them? And he sent you to ask me for help? Was there begging? Were there tears?\n\n<Azuregos stares off into the distance as a toothy smile creeps onto his face.>\n\nYou know, if I came to his rescue, there's no way he could ever live it down. Maybe he'd make me one of those little Sunwell girls of my very own.\n\nNo offense, Anara."]="他正在对付黑龙？而且派你来向我寻求帮助？他有没有跪求？有没有泪流满面？\n\n<艾索雷葛斯向远处望去，一脸露齿的坏笑。>\n\n你知道，要是我去替他解了围，他可就欠了我一辈子的人情。也许他得帮我也做一个太阳井妹子什么的来还这人情。\n\n没冒犯的意思，安娜拉。"
G["He's going for Mr. Floppy!"]="他是来抓小毛球的！"
G["He's going to use the Divine Bell, and Light help us if we can't stop 'im in time."]="他将会使用圣钟的力量，如果我们不能及时阻止他，那只能祈求圣光保佑我们了。"
G["He's gone?  Hooray!"]="他逃走了？万岁！"
G["He's gonna eat Mr. Floppy! You gotta help Mr. Floppy! You just gotta!"]="他会吃掉小毛球的！你得帮帮小毛球！帮帮小毛球呀！"
G["He's got his reasons, Idonis.  He thinks the Farstriders have uncovered something."]="他有他的理由，伊东尼斯。他觉得远行者找到了一些什么东西。"
G["He's got one of the tribes on his side.  The Neferset.\n\nOrsis has made its defiance clear.\n\nRamkahen has tried to find a peaceful solution, but there is no peace possible with Deathwing and his allies."]="他已经让尼斐塞特部族成为了他的奴仆。\n\n奥西斯明确地摆出了挑战的姿态。\n\n拉穆卡恒竭力想找到一个和平解决的方法，但对于死亡之翼和他的盟军，和平是绝不存在的。"
G["He's got two modes. Both modes are labeled \"KILL\". Let's hear it for T440!"]="Tiene dos modos. Y en ambos modos el objetivo es \"MATAR\". ¡Un aplauso para T440!"
G["He's here in Northrend brother, looking for you. A seer in Wintergarde brought word that you were not dead, and he left Ironforge immediately to come find you."]="眼下麦格尼就在诺森德，他是来寻找你的下落的。暮冬城的先知传来消息，说你还活着。于是麦格尼立即离开铁炉堡，来这里找你了。"
G["He's here, stop him!"]="他在这里，阻止他！"
G["He's impulsive, but we'll get results. He'll see our way is right."]="他很冲动，但我们会取得好结果的。他最终也会认同我们。"
G["He's in here. Let's get 'im!"]="他就在这里。别放过他！"
G["He's mine..."]="他是我的……"
G["He's monstrous!"]="他的个头可真大！"
G["He's my assistant.\n\nSure, he's not been plagued in the same manner as we have, but he is clearly plagued nonetheless.  He's bent the knee to Sylvanas, so he's as much one of us as you or I.\n\nAnd just between you and me... to be perfectly honest, I think the Dark Lady thought he was already bending his knee when he entered her chamber!"]="他是我的助手。\n\n虽然他也受到了瘟疫的感染，但显然感染的方式和我们有些区别。就像你和我一样，他也臣服于希尔瓦娜斯。\n\n这话不要告诉别人……说实话，我相信当他进入黑暗女王的房间时，黑暗女王并没有怀疑他的忠诚。"
G["He's never seen an opponent that he wouldn't fight. Ah, small correction: he's never seen an opponent. He's the Blind Hero!"]="他从未见过战胜不了的对手。啊，小小地纠正一下：应该说，他从未见过对手。他就是，盲眼英雄！"
G["He's not a real doctor, but he's going to attempt some facial reconstruction surgery. On his next opponent. Welcome, Doctor FIST!"]="他不是真正的医生，但他将要给他的下一个对手做点整容手术。让我们欢迎，铁拳医师！"
G["He's not going anywhere."]="他不会去任何地方。"
G["He's not nuts, he's crazy!  Always going off looking for fortune and glory..."]="他不是蠢蛋，是疯子！整天就想着追求财富与荣耀……"
G["He's not the boy of your memories anymore, Muradin. He's become something else entirely."]="他不再是你记忆中的男孩了，穆拉丁。他已经完全变了。"
G["He's on his way!"]="他就快到了！"
G["He's ours! The Butcher of Taurajo is dead!"]="我们杀死他了！陶拉祖的屠夫死了！"
G["He's out in the field now, and waitin' fer ya special."]="他现在正在任务现场等着你。"
G["He's out to get me, too! I'd be careful around here if I was you, traveler. You never know which tree he's hiding behind!"]="他也在找我的麻烦呢！如果我是你的话，我在这一带走动时会额外小心的。你永远都不知道他会躲在哪棵树后面！"
G["He's probably the most deadly brawler we've ever had here at the Brawl'gar Arena. Unfortunately, he's a little out of his element. Everybody raise your glass for Razorgrin!"]="他可能是我们搏击俱乐部有史以来最危险的拳手。遗憾的是，他的元素好像有点不够用了。请大家举杯欢迎，锋齿！"
G["He's probably the most deadly brawler we've ever had here at the Brawlpub. Unfortunately, he's a little out of his element. Everybody raise your glass for Razorgrin!"]="他可能是我们搏击俱乐部有史以来最危险的拳手。遗憾的是，他的元素好像有点不够用了。请大家举杯欢迎，锋齿！"
G["He's protecting the mask. Kill him!"]="他守护着面具。杀了他！"
G["He's quite insane! Someone must put a stop to his madness before it's too late for everyone!"]="他疯了！必须阻止他，否则就迟了！"
G["He's really nice and he tries to cook things for me. Unfortunately, they aren't edible and I have to toss them out when he isn't looking."]="他真的很好，还想帮我煮东西吃。可惜那些东西根本没法入口，我只能趁他不注意的时候都扔了。"
G["He's right. I feel nothing... I am... nothing."]="他说得对。我觉得很失落……我……什么都不是。"
G["He's sent one of his cowards in to kill me, has he?"]="他派来个懦夫想要干掉我，是不是？"
G["He's served us all from year to year..."]="这么多年他为我们每个人都服务过……"
G["He's so well disciplined!"]="他真是训练有素！"
G["He's sort of a cute little thing, really. I think I'll keep him."]="他真是个可爱的小东西，真的。我想我会留住他的。"
G["He's still loyal to your Warchief, but he wants to do things differently."]="他仍然效忠部落酋长，但是他想干点与众不同的事情。"
G["He's too far gone! We have to keep trying!"]="他离得太远了！我们不能放弃！"
G["He's too powerful!  You've got to find a way to use those altars to give us an edge!"]="他太强大了！你要想办法用这些祭坛为我们扳回优势！"
G["He's too strong!  Use the catapults to bring him down!"]="他太强了！用投石车打倒他！"
G["He's too strong! Retreat!"]="他太强了！撤退！"
G["He's truly gone, isn't he?\n\nI... I can feel it."]="他真的离去了，是吗？\n\n我……我能感觉到。"
G["He's vulnerable to our magic now!  Hold him down!"]="他现在很容易受到我们魔法的伤害！把他打倒！"
G["He's your husband, woman. How am I to know where he is?"]="女士，他是你的丈夫，不是我的。你问我他在哪里干什么？"
G["He's... so..."]="他……简直……"
G["He's... too powerful. Heroes, quickly... come to me! We must leave this place at once! I will do what I can to hold him in place while we flee."]="他……太强大了。英雄们，快，快过来！我们必须马上离开！你们先走。我会尽全力挡住他。"
G["He's...he's dead?"]="他……他已经死了？"
G["He... He died to get this here?"]="他……为了把这个送来而牺牲了？"
G["He... he kept it? All this time, he kept it!?"]="这……他还留着？一直以来，他还带着它？"
G["He... he segregates the city?"]="他……他在城里搞种族隔离？"
G["He... hello, $n. Sorry, I'm recovering from my wounds.\n\nThose Scarlet Crusaders are tougher than I had given them credit for. They almost did me in.\n\nYou should be careful too. I'd hate to see them get the jump on you."]="Ho... hola, $n. Lo siento, me estoy recuperando de mis heridas.\n\nLos de la Cruzada Escarlata son más duros de lo que había pensado. Casi terminan conmigo.\n\nDeberías tener cuidado. No me gustaría verles lanzarse sobre ti."
G["He... wished to lay down his weapon... and the burdens of leadership..."]="他……希望放下他的武器……放下领袖的负担……"
G["Head 'em up! Move 'em out!"]="领着他们！带他们出来！"
G["Head back through the vale and meetup with Kilag at the Wild Overlook."]="经由谷地返回，与荒野瞭望台的基拉格会面。"
G["Head back up to the east pass! They're pushing hard!"]="支援东边的通道！敌人企图层层推进，突破我们的防线！"
G["Head north up the road to Orgrimmar.  You can ask one of the grunts there for directions to the Cooking Trainer."]="沿着北边的道路去奥格瑞玛。你可以问问那儿的守卫烹饪训练师在哪儿。"
G["Head on over to the Blue Recluse. Where everybody knows your name!"]="到蓝色隐士去，那里每个人都知道你的名字！"
G["Head outside and destroy the Horde!"]="去摧毁部落！"
G["Head to the Apothecarium's inner ring. Martha Alliestar is there, and she'll instruct you in herbalism."]="去炼金区的内环区域，那里的马尔萨·奥列斯塔可以教你有关草药学的知识。"
G["Head to the War Quarter. The priests are there on the outer ring making sure no limb remains unattached for long."]="去军事区外环区域看看吧。那里的牧师努力确保没有哪个断掉的肋骨长时间得不到修复。"
G["Head to the central ring; you'll find auctioneers stationed there."]="所有的拍卖师都在中央区域。"
G["Head's up!"]="集合！"
G["Headin' back up to Kun-Lai Summit, wikket?"]="想要飞回昆莱山吗，无毛怪？"
G["Heading down to Tranquillien today, $c, or is there something else that I can do for you?"]="¿Te diriges a Tranquillien, $c? ¿Hay algo que pueda hacer por ti?"
G["Heading home, $c? The Mighty Wind will get you there, if home's in Kalimdor. She flies straight from here to Durotar."]="$c，想回家吗？如果你住在卡利姆多的话，“强风号”可以送你一程。她将直接飞往杜隆塔尔。"
G["Heading to Outland? Visit Vixton Pinchwhistle in Netherstorm's Area 52. As the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit's official Arena Vendor, he has all sorts of incredible items for sale to those with enough Arena Points."]="去外域？记得拜访一下虚空风暴52区的维克斯顿。他是热砂搏击会的官方竞技场商人，他那里有许多不可思议的物品，专门卖给那些有着足够竞技场点数的家伙。"
G["Heading to the Wild Overlook."]="向荒野瞭望台前进。"
G["Heads gonna roll!"]="小心你的脑袋！"
G["Heads up!"]="小心！"
G["Heads up!  Strafe incoming!"]="注意头顶！敌人发动了低空袭击！"
G["Heads up! PAYLOAD INCOMING!"]="留神！大家伙来了！"
G["Heads up, $n! They're here. Dragonmaw ... everywhere!"]="小心，$n！他们就在这儿。到处都是……龙喉！"
G["Heads up, $n. The Dragonmaw are about to attack!"]="提高警惕，$n。龙喉就要进攻了！"
G["Heads up, boys. More tin-men comin' our way!"]="当心，伙计们。又有铁皮人过来了！"
G["Heads up, more Horde!"]="小心，部落又来了！"
G["Heads up... here they come. I'll help as much as I can. Let's just keep them off of the hourglass!"]="瞧……他们来了。我会尽全力帮助你。别让他们靠近沙漏！"
G["Heads will roll!"]="许多人会遭殃！"
G["Headshoes!"]="穿在脑袋上的鞋子！"
G["Headshot!"]="爆头！"
G["Heal me! For the love of all that's holy, heal me! I'm dying!!"]="治疗我！天杀的，赶快治疗我！我要嗝屁了！"
G["Heal me, quickly!"]="快治疗我！"
G["Heal the prince, but do not forget to keep yourself alive!"]="治疗王子，但也别忘了保护自己的安全！"
G["Healing brew incoming! Come and get it!"]="治愈佳酿来啦！来尝尝吧！"
G["Healing has turned the tide of many battles."]="治疗可以扭转战局。"
G["Healing is for those who cannot endure pain.  However if you must, seek out the Spirit Lodge on the lake in the Valley of Spirits, up and above the Valley of Strength to the west."]="治疗技能是给那些无法忍受痛苦的人学习的。如果你一定想学习的话，就去力量山谷上面以西的精神谷找灵魂归宿吧。"
G["Healing your pets will disqualify your current progress in the scenario, and you'll have to battle your opponents again.  Are you sure?"]="治疗宠物会使你失去当前场景战役的进度，而你也得与对手重新比试。你确定吗？"
G["Healiss, heal me you son of a basilisk!"]="希利斯，快治疗我，你这该死的蜥蜴！"
G["Healiss, heal me, you mogu loving pond drinker!"]="希利斯，快治疗我，你这魔古酒鬼！"
G["Healiss, keep up on the heals you mushan lips!"]="希利斯，继续治疗，你这兽唇怪物！"
G["Healiss... you failed!"]="希利斯……你失败了！"
G["Health from above!"]="奶从天降！"
G["Healthstone! Use your Healthstone!"]="炉石！快用你的炉石！"
G["Hear anything interesting, $n? Your little revelation about me is about to cost you your life."]="听到什么有趣的消息了吗，$n？你要是敢泄露与我有关的半点儿消息，就等死吧。"
G["Hear from Yoggtard? He owes me nibs."]="约格塔德的口信？他还欠我钱呢。"
G["Hear his voice..."]="聆听他的声音……"
G["Hear me brothers and sisters-in-arms! The time of our enemies is at an end! We must strike at the fel orcs that remain! Exterminate them like the vermin that they are! Carry with you the favor of the Sons of Lothar!"]="兄弟们，姐妹们！敌人的末日降临了！我们必须打击剩余的邪兽人！把他们像虫子那样消灭掉！在洛萨之子的庇护下继续战斗吧！"
G["Hear me subjects! Your empress is threatened by these outsiders. They wish to kill me... to kill us all!  Destroy them!"]="臣民们，听我说！你们的女皇受到了外来者的威胁。他们要杀死我……杀死我们所有人！干掉他们！"
G["Hear me, Go'el! You ARE NOT alone! I'm here with you - I will NOT let you go!"]="听我说，古伊尔！你并不孤单！我与你同在——我不会放弃你！"
G["Hear me, Rastakhan! Wherever ya and your Zandalari be schemin' to rule da troll people, ya be findin' da Darkspear and our allies standin' against ya!"]="听着，拉斯塔哈！无论在什么情况下，暗矛部落和我们的盟友都会挺身而出，挫败你和赞达拉阴谋统治巨魔部族的邪恶计划！"
G["Hear me, Zandalari schemers... Da Darkspears and our allies will deny you rulership of da Amani!"]="听着，赞达拉的阴谋者们……暗矛部落和我们的盟友不允许你们统治阿曼尼！"
G["Hear me, citizens of Stormwind. We have long been in the dark. I beg you to open your eyes as I have!"]="听我说，暴风城的市民们。我们已经在黑暗中昏睡了太久。我祈求你们，像我一样睁开眼睛！"
G["Hear me, denizens of the Crater!  I come to burn this land of its impurity!"]="环形山的居民们，听我说！我是来烧毁这片不洁的土地的！"
G["Hear me, invaders of Desolace! The Burning Blade shall use you all as sacrifices!"]="听我说，凄凉之地的入侵者们！你们全都会成为火刃的祭品！"
G["Hear me, minions of Twilight. (Hear! Hear and obey!)"]="听我的号令，暮光的爪牙们。（听从！绝对的服从！）"
G["Hear me, minions! Hear your lord, Antiok! Double your efforts or pay the consequences of failure!"]="奴仆们！听从我的号令吧！通灵主宰命令你们：肃清敌人，否则你们要为失败付出惨痛的代价！"
G["Hear my echo through the silent deeps."]="请在深渊中聆听我的呼唤。"
G["Hear my words, $c!"]="听我说，$c！"
G["Hear my words, Korfang!"]="听我的命令，库尔冯！"
G["Hear my words, and let the Light inside of you confirm the truth of them."]="聆听我的话语，感受存在于你们体内的圣光吧。"
G["Hear my words, brothers!"]="听我号令，弟兄们！"
G["Hear that, lads? It's only the end of the world! Well, what are ye waiting for, ye rusty machine? Initiate Reply-code Alpha. All is well! Pints are on me!"]="听到了吗，伙计们？我们的世界要完蛋了！你还等什么啊，破烂机器？快发送回复代码阿尔法。一切正常！尽在掌握中！"
G["Hear that? $n, here says that human deserter Reethe might have been the one who burned down the inn!"]="听到了吗？$n，他说可能是人类的背叛者帕瓦尔·雷瑟放火烧了那座旅店！"
G["Hear the call... serve him... join ussssssssssss..."]="听从召唤……服从他……加入我们……"
G["Hear the voices below the earth!  They call for your blood!"]="听！地底传来的声音！他们要啜饮你的鲜血！"
G["Hear ye! Hear ye! *pant pant* Be warned citizens of Southshore: assassins are heading to our fair town!"]="注意啦！注意啦！*喘息声*南海镇的居民们，有许多刺客正在向我们这里进发！"
G["Hear ye, denizens of Tanaris! Let it be known that $n is an exalted member of the Mithril Order. A blacksmith of honor, dedication, and infinite patience. Three cheers for $n!"]="¡Escuchad, habitantes de Tanaris! Se hace saber que $n es miembro de la Orden del mitril. $gHerrero:Herrera; de honor, dedicación e infinita paciencia. ¡Tres hurras por $n!"
G["Hear ye, hear ye! I'll pause to sell my wares for only a short time here in Lakeshire. Come to the town hall with haste!"]="大家听着！大家听着！我会在湖畔镇暂住一段时间来出售我的东西。快点到市政厅来啊！"
G["Heard he sent Ragnaros back to the elemental planes by himself..."]="听说他亲自将不可一世的拉格纳罗斯送回了元素位面……"
G["Heard he's Thrall's right hand orc. Hangs up dragon heads in his spare time."]="听说他待在萨尔身边。没事就在城墙上挂龙头解闷。"
G["Heart of Orgrimmar, you're coming in too low. Too low!"]="奥格瑞玛之心，你的高度太低了。太低了！"
G["Heart of the Mantid Swarm."]="螳螂群之心。"
G["Heart will stop!"]="心跳停止！"
G["Hearthglen?? But..."]="壁炉谷？ 但是……"
G["Heartless monsters!"]="没心没肺的怪物！"
G["Heartless? Is it too much to ask for a clean outhouse?"]="冷酷无情？要求有一间干净的厕所很过分么？"
G["Heartrazor bellows his appreciation."]="哈特拉斯发出感激的吼声。"
G["Hearts of fire, wills of iron! Back on your feet! GRIND THEM TO DUST!"]="以烈焰为心，钢铁为志！站起来吧！消灭他们！"
G["Hearty beatings will be dispensed in the name of the Horde!"]="以部落的名义，狠狠地教训他们！"
G["Heathens! The day of reckoning comes!"]="异端！清算之日即将来临！"
G["Heavens to Betsy!"]="赞美上帝！"
G["Heavy enemy fire... Sully, pull up!"]="敌人攻势猛烈……苏利，提升高度！"
G["Heavy, but I can hold more! Keep going!"]="好重，可我还能扛得动更多！再来！"
G["Heavy... no can see notin."]="好重……什么也看不见。"
G["Heck yeah we are! I've probably beaten up about a million virmen back on the Wandering Isle!"]="那可是我们的拿手好戏！在迷踪岛上，我打扁过上百万只兔妖！"
G["Heck'va fight ya put up Jarad. Gots'ta keep that shield up more next time. Lana! Yer in!"]="贾拉德，下回把盾牌举高点。兰纳！你上！"
G["Hee hee hee hee hee!"]="嘿嘿嘿嘿嘿！"
G["Hee hee hee! Dis gunna be some fun, mon!"]="嘿嘿嘿！这肯定会非常有趣！"
G["Hee hee!"]="嘿嘿！"
G["Hee hee... hee hee hee... ha ha ha!"]="嘿嘿……嘿嘿嘿……哈哈哈！"
G["Heed His call! Cast down the heretics!"]="听从他的召唤！干掉异教徒！"
G["Heed me, Twilight Lords!  Accept this $r as a humble offering!"]="¡A mí, señores Crepusculares! ¡Aceptad a $geste:esta; $r como una humilde ofrenda!"
G["Heed your blades, Orcs!"]="握紧你们的武器，兽人！"
G["Heeeeeeeeeeeeellllllllllllllllllllllllp!!!"]="救~~命~~啊~~~~！！！"
G["Heeeeeelp!"]="救命啊——"
G["Heeeeere's... Theldurin!"]="是……塞尔杜林！"
G["Heeeelllpp!!"]="救——命——啊！！"
G["Heeelllp!"]="救救救命！"
G["Heeellp meee... ri... ribss... bro... broken."]="帮帮我……我的……肋骨……断啦。"
G["Heeey buddy! Nice to see you again!\n\nBuuuuuuuuuuuuuuurrrrpppp!"]="嘿哥们！很高兴再次见到你！\n\n嗝——儿！"
G["Heehee! You can't catch me!"]="哈哈！你抓不到我！"
G["Heel! Or I will cook and eat you on the spot."]="跟着！否则我立马就把你煮了吃掉。"
G["Heft those barrels!"]="把那些桶举起来！"
G["Hefting"]="举起"
G["Hegnar Rumbleshot, at your service!"]="海格纳·重枪，愿为你效劳！"
G["Heh heh, stupid ogre.  Like I'm going backta work."]="嘿嘿，食人魔笨蛋。你以为我会乖乖地回去工作吗？"
G["Heh, I got a little too close.  Don't worry, I'm fine."]="呵呵，我靠得有些近。不用担心，我很好。"
G["Heh, bombs, us like bombs.  Graham Van Talen show you how to make.  He in outer ring of Rogues' Quarter."]="嗨，炸弹，我们喜欢炸弹。格拉哈姆·范·塔伦会教你如何制造炸弹的。他居住在盗贼区的外层。"
G["Heh, cool!"]="嘿，放松点！"
G["Heh, do not get angry with the elements. Violence is their nature. I conquered my own anger long, long ago."]="呵呵，别对元素发怒。狂暴是它们的天性。我早已征服了自己的愤怒。"
G["Heh, heh... Quite the inquisitive one, aren't ya, $n? Well, here's what you need to do.\n\nNorth of here, in the old ruins, lives a very disagreeable gnoll by the name of Miblon Snarltooth. He guards the only Evoroot I know of, but he watches it night and day! Seems like he never even sleeps!\n\nWhat you can do, is bribe him. I can sell you some bait that he'll find tasty -- just put it down near him and that will distract him long enough for you to grab the Evoroot. Good luck!"]="呵呵呵呵……你是个相当好奇的家伙，不是吗，$n？嗯，我来告诉你该怎么做。\n\n在此地以北的古老废墟中居住着一个名叫米布隆·乱齿的令人厌恶的豺狼人。他日夜守护着灵根草，好像从不睡觉似的！\n\n你必须把他引开才行。我可以卖给你一些他喜欢吃的东西——把食物放在他附近，引他过来，然后你就可以趁机拿走灵根草啦。祝你好运！"
G["Heh, sounds like Malkorok just tore apart those intruders."]="嘿，听起来马尔考罗克已经把那些入侵者给撕成碎片了。"
G["Heh, the skies aren't so friendly with $n flying them!"]="呵呵，有$n在天空飞翔，我们的敌人就要小心了！"
G["Heh. Nothing against you, pup, but you might want to find somewhere else to bed down for the night. Wouldn't want that tender skin of yours to get bruised."]="嗨。没有谁要故意为难你啦，不过你最好另找地方过夜。瞧你这身细皮嫩肉的，我不忍心让你吃苦。"
G["Heh... Yeh sure put them skills ta use, didn't yeh, lad?"]="呵呵……那些功夫没有白费，不是吗，伙计？"
G["Heh... heh... hey! You! I may be down, but I be gettin' back on my feet! Come over here and look at what I got. The rarest and most marvelous amulets, right here! I even picked up some extra bits! Come on, come on, ya know ya wanna look."]="嗨……嗨……嗨！就是你！我也许看上去很萎靡，但我肯定会东山再起的！过来看看我有些什么。最最珍贵和最最不可思议的护身符就在这里！我甚至还弄到了些新玩意！过来，过来，你知道你想要看看的。"
G["Heh... pandaren. You must be here to join the Alliance."]="呵呵……熊猫人。你一定是来加入联盟的吧。"
G["Hehe, that's what I get for trying to get a cat to fetch."]="呵呵，这就是我试图让一只猫去捡回来的东西。"
G["Hehe, wimp."]="呵呵，废物。"
G["Hehe... I made a pun, didn't I? Druidic in nature... I'm so funny."]="呵呵……我语带双关，不是吗？都是德鲁伊的东西……我很幽默吧。"
G["Hehehe! Things go boom!"]="呵呵呵！万物皆要爆炸！"
G["Hehehe, how you doin' mon. You gonna help Pele'keiki great deal he be thinkin'. We be needin' a bombastic amount of the firebloom herb to be preparin' right for the Ahn'Qiraj War. The Horde, they say, 'Pele'keiki, you get us $2051w of the fire petals right quick'.\n\nPele'keiki tell you now, he only have $2050w firebloom, but you gonna add to that real soon, right mon?"]="Eh, ¿cómo va, colega? Tú vas a ayudar a Pele'keiki en asunto importante que él piensa. Necesitamos mogollón de flores de fuego para estar preparados para la guerra de Ahn'Qiraj. La Horda dijo, \"Pele'keiki, consíguenos $2051w pétalos de fuego ahora mismo\".\n\nPele'keiki te dice ahora, él solamente tiene $2050w flores de fuego pero tú añadirás, ¿verdad?"
G["Hehehehahahaha!"]="啊哈哈哈哈！"
G["Hei Feng is landing!"]="黑风上岸了！"
G["Hei Feng prepares to land!"]="黑风即将准备登陆！"
G["Hei Feng takes a Deep Breath! Move behind him!"]="黑风深呼吸了！到他背后去！"
G["Heigan is probably performing maintenance on his slime and crap filled dance studio."]="希尔盖可能在清理他那间肮脏的舞蹈室。"
G["Heigh-ho... heigh-ho... OH NO!"]="嗨哟……嗨哟……噢，不！"
G["Heightened? What's the good news?"]="提高？这算是好消息吗？"
G["Hela take you!"]="见鬼去吧！"
G["Helene Peltskinner has had years of experience skinning animals for Adele Fielder to make leather items.  You can find Helene in her house by Crystal Lake."]="海伦尼·派特斯金纳有着数年的剥皮经验，他一直为艾德勒·费欧德提供兽皮以制造皮革制品。你可以在水晶湖旁的房间里找到她。"
G["Helgrum!"]="赫格拉姆！"
G["Helix Blackfuse"]="赫利克斯·黑索"
G["Helix attaches a bomb to $n's chest!"]="赫利克斯在$n的身上安了一颗炸弹！"
G["Hell awaits us. Give the order!"]="我们随时准备牺牲。请下令吧！"
G["Hellfire Citadel is ours! The source of Illidan's fel orc army is no more! Magtheridon has fallen to the might of $n and $g his:her; allies!"]="¡La Ciudadela del Fuego Infernal es nuestra! ¡La fuente de la armada de orcos viles de Illidan ha sido destruida! Magtheridon ha caído ante el poder de $n y sus aliados."
G["Hellfire Peninsula - Mordiba default"]="Península del Fuego Infernal - predeterminado de Mordiba"
G["Hellfire Peninsula is a shattered realm - ruthless and unforgiving to its inhabitants. Be sure to repair and stock up on supplies before venturing out."]="地狱火半岛是一个满目疮痍的区域——对那里的居民们来说，那是多么的残酷和艰难。确保在冒险前修理并囤积好补给品吧。"
G["Hello $c!"]="你好，$c！"
G["Hello $c, and welcome to the Darkmoon Faire.\n\nThere is so much to do here at the faire that it can be a little overwhelming for our first time visitors. That's why I'm here to help.\n\nDo you have any questions?"]="Hola, $c, y $gbienvenido:bienvenida; a la Feria de la Luna Negra.\n\nHay tanto que hacer aquí que puede resultar un tanto abrumador para aquellos que nos visitan por primera vez. Por eso estoy aquí para ayudarte.\n\n¿Tienes alguna pregunta?"
G["Hello $c, and welcome to the Darkmoon Faire. There is so much to do here at the faire that it can be a little overwhelming for our first time visitors. That's why I'm here to help. Do you have any questions?"]="Hola, $c, y $gbienvenido:bienvenida; a la Feria de la Luna Negra. Hay tanto que hacer aquí que puede resultar un tanto abrumador para aquellos que nos visitan por primera vez. Por eso estoy aquí para ayudarte. ¿Tienes alguna pregunta?"
G["Hello $gman:woman; how are you doing?"]="Hola $gviril:femenina; $c, $g¿cómo va eso?:estás preciosa.;"
G["Hello $n! The Lorewalker is beginning her lesson just down these stairs if you want to listen in."]="你好啊$n！游学者正在楼下讲学，要是你有兴趣不妨去听听。"
G["Hello $r, it is a pleasure to make your acquaintance."]="Hola, $r, encantada de conocerte."
G["Hello Master... what kind of service can I provide you today... ?"]="Hola, $gamo:ama;. ¿Qué tipo de servicio podría ofrecerte hoy?"
G["Hello Mr. Mudclaw. I don't know if you saw me earlier, but I'm helping Farmer Yoon out on his farm."]="你好，泥爪先生。不知你是否见过我，我在农夫老愚的农场帮忙。"
G["Hello Mung-Mung. How's everything at Mr. Mudclaw's farm?"]="你好，蒙蒙。泥爪先生的农场上一切都好吗？"
G["Hello Sovik, I wish to browse your goods."]="你好，索维克，我想要看看你的货物。"
G["Hello Zando'zan, I would like to learn lockpicking."]="你好，赞杜沙，我想要学习开锁技能。"
G["Hello again, $c!"]="又见面了，$c！"
G["Hello again, $c."]="你好啊，$c。"
G["Hello again, $n!  It's good to see you!  Our Darkmoon Faire is quite a show, don't you think?\n\nThere is quite a lot to see!  So look!  Look, and perhaps, one day, even more will be revealed to you..."]="¡Hola de nuevo, $n! ¡Me alegro de verte! Nuestra Feria de la Luna Negra es un gran espectáculo, ¿no crees?\n\n¡Hay mucho que ver! ¡Así que tienes que verlo! Mira y observa y quizás, algún día, te será revelado mucho más..."
G["Hello again, $n.  Did you think I would forget you?\n\nI knew you would not.  You are a clever $c who knows a person with perfect memory when $ghe:she; sees him."]="Hola de nuevo, $n. ¿Pensabas que te habría olvidado?\n\nPorque yo sabía que tú no me olvidarías a mí. Eres $gun:una; $c inteligente que reconoce una persona con la memoria perfecta cuando la ve."
G["Hello again, $n.  How is my axe treating you?"]="又见面了，$n。我的斧子怎么样？"
G["Hello again, $n.  How's my lure treating you?"]="又见面了，$n。我的鱼饵怎么样？"
G["Hello again, $p! Enjoying your second chance?\n\nIf you continue along the adventure here until the Skyfire leaves, you'll automatically re-join the normal timeline and find Lion's Landing established again.\n\nOr, if you'd rather go back, er... forward to Lion's Landing now, let me know!"]="又见面了，$p！是否对你的第二次机会感到满意？\n\n如果你在这裡继续冒险直到天火号离去时，你将自动汇入雄狮港已建好的正常时间线。\n\n如果你想要，你也可以选择立刻回到……呃……前去雄狮港。告诉我即可。"
G["Hello again, Antonio. Thank you again for the hat for my wife. She adored it."]="你好，安东尼奥。再次感谢你卖给我妻子的帽子，她非常喜欢。"
G["Hello again."]="再次问好。"
G["Hello again. $n, was it? Yes yes... I believe we left behind some unfinished business back in the Eastern Kingdoms. How have you been finding Pandaria?\n\nI have another assignment for you, if you are up to the challenge this time. I assure you the rewards will be worth it.\n\nBefore we begin, it's important that you familiarize yourself with the lay of the land. Come visit me once you have earned more experience here."]="你好，又见面了。$n，是它吗？是的，没错……我相信我们在东部王国留下了一些未完成的事业。你怎么找到潘达利亚的？\n\n如果你赢得这次挑战，我便再给你另一个任务。我保证这值得你去做。\n\n在我们开始前，重要的是你自己要熟悉地形。一旦你获得更多的经验，就来拜访我。"
G["Hello again. More illusions approach, and we will require your healing arts."]="你好啊。这次的幻影会更多，我们需要更多的治疗。"
G["Hello and welcome to the Darkmoon Faire Staging Area.\n\nThe portal here will take you to the Darkmoon Faire.\n\nBut if you have any questions before you go, I can answer them."]="Hola y $gbienvenido:bienvenida; a la zona de escala de la Feria de la Luna Negra.\n\nEste portal te llevará a la Feria de la Luna Negra.\n\nPero si tienes alguna pregunta antes de irte, yo puedo respondértela."
G["Hello fellow angler!  Have you been around these parts long?  Me and my buddy \"Big Hook\" here travel far and wide looking for the next big catch!\n\nWe ran into this place by accident and the locals were friendly with both their supplies and booze so we decided to stick around!"]="¡Hola, $gcompañero:compañera; $gpescador:pescadora;! ¿Llevas mucho tiempo por esta zona? Mi amigo \"Gran Anzuelo\" y yo llevamos viajando mucho tiempo en busca de la siguiente gran captura!\n\nEncontramos este lugar por accidente, y como la gente de aquí se portó con los suministros y la bebida, decidimos quedarnos algo más."
G["Hello friend!  You're welcome to use my cart if you like.  It will take you to the Dai-Lo Farmstead."]="¡Hola, $gamigo:amiga;! Puedes usar mi carro si quieres. Te llevará hasta la Granja de Dai-Lo."
G["Hello friend!  You're welcome to use my cart if you like.  It will take you to the Temple of Five Dawns."]="¡Hola, $gamigo:amiga;! Puedes usar mi carro si quieres. Te llevará hasta el Templo de los Cinco Albores."
G["Hello friend! What can we do for you?"]="你好，朋友！我们能帮你什么忙吗？"
G["Hello friend."]="Hola, $gamigo:amiga;."
G["Hello once again, $n.  I sense that the flow of time remains threatened by forces that are quite powerful indeed.  Your continued assistance is always welcomed by the bronze dragonflight.\n\nWhile the past is set in its ways, the future is always changing.  The decisions you make in the here and now help guide that change."]="Hola otra vez, $n. Siento que el flujo del tiempo se ve amenazado por fuerzas verdaderamente poderosas. Tu incondicional ayuda siempre es bien recibida por Vuelo Bronce.\n\nMientras que el pasado permanece inalterable, el futuro sufre continuos cambios. Las decisiones que tomes en este momento pueden orientar ese cambio."
G["Hello out there. Anybody be hearin' Hazlek?"]="嗨，有人能听见哈兹莱克说话吗？"
G["Hello out there. Anybody be hearin' Tanzar?"]="嗨，有人吗？"
G["Hello sir, I'm ready to rock!"]="嗨，来点摇滚乐吧！"
G["Hello sir. Do you live around here?"]="你好，先生。你住在这附近吗？"
G["Hello stranger, and welcome to the untamed majesty of Un'Goro Crater!\n\nMy name is Williden Marshal.  My sister, our companions, and I make up Marshal Expeditions - scientists and explorers of Azeroth's wild and great unknown."]="Hola, $gextraño:extraña;, ¡te doy la bienvenida a la majestuosidad salvaje del cráter Un’Goro!\n\nMi nombre es Williden Marshal. Mi hermana, nuestros compañeros y yo formamos Expediciones Marshal, un grupo de científicos y exploradores del Azeroth más salvaje y desconocido."
G["Hello there $g mister : ma'am;... do you have a little time that you could help us out?  Please?"]="你好，$g先生:夫人;……你能花点时间帮帮我吗？求你了。"
G["Hello there $glad:lass;... the name's Oglethorpe and I may be responsible for one of the amazing gnomish devices you might possess!  If it blew up, then it wasn't me; if it made you rich though, we can discuss royalties!\n\nOh, and if you're from Gnomeregan, you can just take two ninety degree angles, smash them together, and start marching.  I have nothing to say to you."]="你好，$g小伙子:姑娘;……我是奥格索普，你拥有的某件侏儒设备很可能就是我发明的！如果它爆炸了，那它就不是我发明的；如果它给你带来了财富，那我们可以讨论一下版权金的问题！\n\n哦，对了，如果你来自诺莫瑞根，那你可以走了。我没有什么跟你好说的。"
G["Hello there!  Fizzcrank's pilots are the best of the best.  We stay that way through constant training.  That includes parachute training.  You never know when you will need to use your chute, but you do know that one day you'll have to use it.\n\nSo what we have here is a teleporter to the top of this spire.  Once you get up there, the only way for a real soldier to get back down is with a parachute.  We've got another trooper stationed up top ready with the parachutes.\n\nIf you feel like trying it out, $c, I'll clear you for teleporter use.  Then just step onto the teleporter."]="嗨！菲兹兰克的飞行员都是王牌中的王牌呀。坚持训练是我们保持领先的秘诀。这其中就包括了跳伞训练。你永远也不知道什么时候会用到降落伞，但是迟早你会用上的。\n\n因此，我们设置了通往塔顶的传送装置。如果你是真正的士兵，就勇敢地拉开降落伞跳下来吧。塔顶有一位军官，负责提供降落伞包。\n\n$c，想要接受训练的话，我就教你如何使用传送装置。喏，你只需要踩在上面就是了。"
G["Hello there!  Oh my, a draenei!"]="你好！啊，老天，是个德莱尼人！"
G["Hello there! Care to buy some fishing supplies, or perhaps take a lesson or two?"]="你好啊！你想要购买渔具，还是学习垂钓的艺术？"
G["Hello there! Don't you dare step behind those pillars. Let me welcome you properly."]="你好！不要不敢走出那些柱子。让我好好地欢迎你。"
G["Hello there! I'm Weng: pupil of nature!\n\nI've been sent to investigate the recent wood sprite problems.\n\nI've always been fascinated with wood sprites, even as a child. They're not normally violent, you know.\n\nPlayful, maybe, but rarely do they mean any real harm."]="你好啊！我是老翁：自然的弟子！\n\n我是奉命来调查最近爆发的林精问题的。\n\n我还是个孩子的时候，就对林精很着迷。你知道，一般来说，他们并不残暴。\n\n他们或许是有点淘气，但很少会对人造成真正的伤害。"
G["Hello there! My name's Jenna! And you?"]="你好！我的名字是洁娜！你呢？"
G["Hello there! Plants are my speciality. Do you have an inquiry about the local flora?"]="你好啊！园艺可是我的强项！要打听本地的植物环境吗？"
G["Hello there! You're really growing on me."]="嘿，你好啊！我真是越来越喜欢你了！"
G["Hello there, $C. Normally I'd be out on the beat looking after the folk of Stormwind, but a lot of the Stormwind guards are fighting in other lands. So here I am, deputized and offering bounties when I'd rather be on patrol..."]="Hola, $C. Normalmente estaría en la calle cuidando de los habitantes de Ventormenta, pero muchos guardias de Ventormenta están luchando en otros lugares. Así que aquí estoy, designado y ofreciendo recompensas cuando preferiría estar patrullando..."
G["Hello there, $c!"]="你好，$c！"
G["Hello there, $c!\n\nWe cultivate and harvest the finest lotus flowers in all of Pandaria. From here they are sent down to the village of New Cifera where they are sorted and shipped all over the land.\n\nThe lotus has countless culinary, medicinal, and decorative applications - as you can imagine, demand is quite high."]="你好，$c！\n\n我们这里养殖着全潘达利亚最好的莲花。我们的莲花从这里送到下面的新希菲拉村，然后在那里分类和装船，最后运送到各地。\n\n莲花的用途广泛，在烹饪、医疗和装饰领域都能发挥作用——所以你也能想到，它的需求量是很大的。"
G["Hello there, $n.  Happy Pilgrim's Bounty!"]="你好啊，$n。感恩节快乐！"
G["Hello there, $n.  I am known as Chronormu, but you may call me Chromie.  I am comfortable with such familiarity.\n\nNow - how did I know your name, you ask?  I am one of the bronze dragonflight, forever attuned to the ebb and flow of time.  You could say that we have met before.  To that end, we shall also meet again."]="你好，$n。我是克罗诺姆，但是你可以叫我克罗米。我喜欢这种亲密感。\n\n现在——你问我是怎么知道你的名字的？我是青铜龙军团的一员，永远与时间的消长相合。你可以认为我们以前遇到过。从这个角度说，我们还会再见面。"
G["Hello there, $n. So nice of you to rescue me. No hard feelings, right?"]="Hola. Te agradezco que me hayas rescatado. Sin rencor, ¿verdad?"
G["Hello there, my name is Petra.  To my right is my kodo, Dadanga.  We're with Marshal Expeditions - been so for a few years now, ever since Dadanga was a babe.\n\nIf you have any lit torches or any open sources of flame, I'd like to ask you to keep them stashed if you could.  Dadanga dislikes smoke."]="嗨，我是派提亚。在我右边是科多兽达丹加。我们曾跟马歇尔探险队在一起——那已经是数年前的事儿了，那时达丹加还是只幼兽呢。\n\n要是你带有火炬或是任何火种，请尽可能地把它们藏起来。达丹加不喜欢烟。"
G["Hello there, traveler. I'm hard at work making my next masterpiece!"]="你好，旅行者。我在努力工作，打造我的下一个杰作！"
G["Hello to you new recruits. I'm Drill Sergeant Bahduum. For the next few days, you're going to receive orientation."]="新兵们，你们好。我是教官巴尔杜姆。在接下来的几天内，你们会接受我的训练。"
G["Hello young $g Master:Mistress;. I am Eva Sarkhoff and this is my husband, Lucien. It is a pleasure to make your acquaintance."]="你好，年轻的$g主人:女主人;。我是艾瓦·萨克霍夫，这是我的丈夫卢森。很高兴认识你。"
G["Hello!"]="嗨！"
G["Hello!  And welcome!  I'm afraid my booth is not open... many repairs are needed...\n\nBut I am still bound by blood oath to put a smile on your face.  So please, smile, or I must cut off my hand and consume no living flesh until it regenerates..."]="¡Hola! ¡$gBienvenido:Bienvenida;! Me temo que mi puesto todavía no está abierto... Se necesitan muchas reparaciones...\n\nPero hice el juramento de sangre de hacerte sonreír, y debo cumplirlo. Así que sonríe, o tendré que cortarme la mano y consumir carne sin vida hasta que se regenere…"
G["Hello!  So good to meet you!"]="你好！很高兴遇到你！"
G["Hello!  You're just the person I was looking for.  Take a seat and listen, because I have a plan that will make us both rich!"]="你好！你正是我要找的人。坐下来听我说，我有个可以让咱们两个都发家致富的计划！"
G["Hello! And welcome!"]="¡Hola! ¡$gBienvenido:Bienvenida;!"
G["Hello! I am a Rogue in need of training."]="你好！我是一个潜行者，我需要接受训练。"
G["Hello! I have your rations right here."]="嗨！我给你带干粮来啦。"
G["Hello! I'm here on behalf of Gina Mudclaw, regarding your debt."]="你好！我是代表吉娜·泥爪前来跟你谈谈你所欠下的债务。"
G["Hello! Someone who doesn't smell like fish. I like."]="你好！终于见到一个身上没有臭鱼味的人了。我喜欢。"
G["Hello! What brings you to Winterspring? These cold and vast lands may seem dismal, but this is a place of many secrets..."]="你好！是什么吸引你来到冬泉谷？这片寒冷广袤的土地或许显得有些凄凉，但是它蕴含着无数的秘密……"
G["Hello! You're pretty strong and nice and stuff. I like you. Lets stay friends, okay?"]="¡Hola! Eres fuerte y $gguapo:guapa; y esas cosas. Me gustas. Seamos amigos, ¿vale?"
G["Hello, $c!\n\nOrgrimmar's skyway is the center of the world. The north zeppelin tower will take you to Stranglethorn or Undercity. The south tower wll take you to Thunderbluff or all the way to Northrend.\n\nFlight Master Doras can send you all over Kalimdor - at least, anyplace you've already explored."]="¡Hola, $c!\n\nEl espacio aéreo de Orgrimmar es el centro del mundo. El zepelín del norte te llevará a Tuercespina o a Entrañas. La torre del sur te llevará a Cima del Trueno o hasta Rasganorte.\n\nEl maestro de vuelo Doras te puede enviar a cualquier punto de Kalimdor... Bueno, al menos a cualquier sitio que ya hayas explorado."
G["Hello, $c!\n\nThese poor creatures are giving everything they have to fight the minions of the Twilight's Hammer in this dark place.\n\nI've done my best to revive those that have fallen.\n\nIf you need an additional mount, these birds are ready to take wing again. Treat them well!"]="你好啊，$c！\n\n这些可怜的小家伙正在这黑暗的地方竭尽全力对抗暮光之锤的爪牙！\n\n我已经尽力让那些倒下的死而复生。\n\n要是你需要另一只坐骑，这些鸟已经准备好再次展翅翱翔。好好对待它们！"
G["Hello, $c!  Are you reporting for a flight mission?"]="你好，$c！你是要汇报飞行任务的进展吗？"
G["Hello, $c!  Welcome to the races at the Shimmering Flats!"]="¡Hola, $c! ¡$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a las carreras del Desierto de Sal!"
G["Hello, $c! I've went around and asked, and it looks like all of us here have collected everything that the Alliance needs to prepare for the Ahn'Qiraj War. Now we just need to encourage the Horde to do the same and then we'll be able to ship it all over to Cenarion Hold in Silithus."]="你好，$c！我四下询问过了，似乎联盟已经集齐安其拉一战所需的全部战争物资了。现在我们只需鼓励部落再加把劲儿，就能将这些物资运往希利苏斯的塞纳里奥要塞了。"
G["Hello, $c, good of you to show up. Allow me to be succinct; we are gathering supplies for the Ahn'Qiraj war effort. We wouldn't want to have more casualties than necessary, now would we? I have the responsibility of coordinating the collection of $2086w mageweave bandages. To date we have garnered $2085w. Care to assist?"]="你好，$c，很高兴你露面了。我长话短说，我们正在为安其拉之战收集战争物资。我需要收集$2086w根魔纹绷带。到目前为止，我们已经收集到$2085w根了。你愿意帮忙吗？"
G["Hello, $c.\n\nOld man Kessel over there, he's a clever one. I'd be real careful in my dealings with him if I were you.\n\nHe offered me work 'caring for the elekk' and being the fool I was, I took it to mean feeding, training, and the like. Things became real clear when he handed me the shovel..."]="Hola, $c.\n\nAhí está el viejo Kessel. Es muy listo. Yo tendría cuidado si hiciera tratos con él.\n\nMe ofreció trabajo \"cuidando elekks\" y yo, tonto de mí, pensé que se trataba de darles de comer y cosas así. Las cosas me quedaron más claras cuando me dejó esta pala..."
G["Hello, $c.  Care to purchase something?"]="你好啊，$c。想要买点儿什么吗？"
G["Hello, $c.  Have you come to learn the secrets of the Timeless Isle?"]="你好，$c。你发现永恒岛的秘密了吗？"
G["Hello, $c.  I am what is referred to as one of the Broken.  Like the Lost Ones, though not as badly as they, we were afflicted with fel energies that transformed us from our original draenei forms."]="你好，$c。我是被他们叫做破碎者的家伙。就像失落者那样，只不过还没像他们那么糟糕。邪能的摧残让我们从原来德莱尼人的形态转变到现在的这个样子。"
G["Hello, $c.  I hope you've come to bolster our ranks.  Beasts and thieves are spilling into our beloved Elwynn, and we barely have enough men to keep the roads safe!\n\nAnd if you haven't done so, read that notice about Hogger.  He's a beast in yonder woods that must be dealt with."]="Hola, $c. Espero que hayas venido a reforzar nuestras filas. ¡Las bestias y los ladrones invaden nuestra querida Elwynn y apenas tenemos hombres para mantener los caminos a salvo!\n\nY si no has venido a eso, entonces lee la nota sobre Hogger. Es una bestia que habita en el bosque y tenemos que neutralizarla."
G["Hello, $c. From what I've been told, everything's been collected, and all of the materiel for the war is being shipped over to Silithus as we speak. It should all be there in less than $2113w days. Once that's done, and the gong has been rung with the Scepter of the Shifting Sands, the war will really begin."]="你好，$c。我听说所有的物资都已经收集完毕，将如约运往希利苏斯。货物将在$2113w天内到达，在那之后，流沙节杖的持有者将敲响铜锣，战争也就开始了。"
G["Hello, $c. From what I've been told, everything's been collected, and all of the materiel for the war is being shipped over to Silithus as we speak. It should all be there in less than a day. Once that's done, and the gong has been rung with the Scepter of the Shifting Sands, the war will really begin."]="你好，$c。我听说所有的物资都已经收集完毕，将如约运往希利苏斯。货物将在1天内运达。在那之后，流沙节杖的持有者将敲响铜锣，战争也就开始了。"
G["Hello, $c. I am Jessir Moonbow. I have come from Darnassus seeking two friends who came looking for signs of the Shadow Council in Felwood.\n\nIt seems those vile creatures who claim responsibility for much of the orcish race's suffering seeks to regain some of its power.\n\nMy two friends went looking in Jaedenar to prove one way or the other what was happening.\n\nI expected them to be here when I arrived, but now they are days late."]="你好，$c。我是杰希尔·月弓。我从达纳苏斯来寻找两个朋友，他们是来寻找费伍德森林暗影议会的踪迹的。\n\n看起来那些宣称对兽人种族的苦难负大部分责任的卑鄙的生物正试图重获一些能量。\n\n我的两个朋友进入加德纳尔搜寻证据来证明有事情发生。\n\n我希望我来时他们在这里，但是他们已经晚了数天了。"
G["Hello, $c. I am collecting linen bandages here for the Ahn'Qiraj war effort; an effort that will put us all to the test, but strengthen us for the war to come. I can assure you that any bandages that you choose to donate will be put to good use in helping to save the lives of our soldiers when the time comes. I am in need of $2077w, and to this point have managed to collect $2076w. Will you assist us?"]="你好，$c。我正在为安其拉之战收集亚麻绷带。这场战争对我们来说是一次严酷的考验和锻炼，你捐献的绷带将在战争中挽救士兵们的生命。我需要收集$2077w根亚麻绷带，到目前为止已经有$2076w根了。你愿意帮助我们吗？"
G["Hello, $c. I imagine you have a lot of questions.\n\nSuffice it to say that Royce Duskwhisper sent me into the middle of an ogre cave for some \"Eye of Twilight\" jib-job, and it hasn't gone well.\n\nIf I ever get my hands on that lanky, heartless, mealy-mouthed little night elf...\n\n<Kristoff wriggles helplessly as he dangles in the air, his face reddening.>"]="Hola, $c. Supongo que tienes un montón de preguntas.\n\nBasta con que te diga que Royce Susurro del Anochecer me envió al corazón de una cueva llena de ogros en busca de algo llamado \"Ojo del Crepúsculo\", un trabajo fácil que no ha ido muy bien.\n\nSi alguna vez le pongo las manos encima a ese pequeño elfo de la noche desgarbado, cruel y de palabras comedidas...\n\n<Kristoff se retuerce mientras cuelga en el aire, con el rostro sonrojado.>"
G["Hello, $c. I trust that you are enjoying youself? What do you think of the party? I do so hope that we aren't running out of anything. Nothing kills a fete faster than running out of drinks and hors d'oeuvres, wouldn't you say?\n\nYes, well, I must be about attending to my other guests. Do enjoy your stay."]="你好，$c。我希望你玩的很高兴，你觉得聚会怎么样？我希望我们的食水都还有剩余。没有什么比吃喝全部耗尽更让人扫兴的了，你说呢？\n\n啊，好吧。我必须去照顾一下我的其他客人了。玩得开心点。"
G["Hello, $c. I trust that you bring good tidings concerning the Ahn'Qiraj War preparations. I myself have been placed in charge of all accumulation of rugged leather for the Horde; a task to which I feel uniquely qualified. Never underestimate the utility of a sharpened knife.\n\nAs to the rugged leather, we currently have $2073w out of $2074w needed."]="你好，$c。我想你一定是来帮助我们进行备战工作的。我负责为部落收集硬甲皮，我认为这任务简直非我莫数。不要低估锋利的剥皮小刀的作用。\n\n我们已经收集到$2073w块硬甲皮了，总的需求量是$2074w。"
G["Hello, $c. I'm sure that I don't need to inform you of the gravity of our situation here. We need to gather many goods, and in most cases assemble them into materiel, to be transported to Cenarion Hold in Silithus. This is no small effort.\n\nRecently in the Molten Core we discovered something called a singed corestone. Our blacksmiths and engineers tell us that they can put them to good use, so I'm supervising their accumulation here. As of now, out of $2110w needed, we've managed to collect $2108w."]="你好，$c。我想我不需要告诉你我们现在的处境有多危险吧。我们需要收集很多物资，并将它们运往希利苏斯的塞纳里奥要塞。这工作可不轻松。\n\n最近我们在熔火之心发现一种被称作熔火之石的东西。铁匠和工程师们说这东西用处很大，因此我在这里监管熔火之石的收集工作。到目前为止，我们已经设法收集到$2108w块了，总需求量是$2110w块。"
G["Hello, $c. I've set up camp here at the Bulwark to make my preparations for my journey into the Plaguelands. I've heard rumor that a great human wizard took up residency in Hearthglen not terribly long ago. He was commissioned by the Scarlet Crusade to fashion their warriors and hunters new bows and guns. It's said that he completed a remarkable weapon before the Crusade killed him.\n\nI guess their mistrust of the arcane has grown."]="你好，$c。我在亡灵壁垒设立营帐，准备进入瘟疫之地。不久之前，谣传有一位伟大的人类巫师居住在壁炉谷。血色十字军强迫他为他们的战士和猎人制造新的弓箭和枪支。据说在十字军杀死他之前，他铸造了一件非比寻常的武器。\n\n我猜想他们对奥术越来越不信任了。"
G["Hello, $c. If you haven't already, you really should speak with Farstrider Solanna."]="你好，$c。如果你还没有去和远行者索兰娜谈谈的话，就赶快去吧。"
G["Hello, $c. Please try not to draw too much attention."]="你好，$c。请尽量别引起太多注意。"
G["Hello, $c. These are troubling times indeed if this is what is to become of our beloved Quel'Thalas."]="你好，$c。现在是最艰难的时刻，我们心爱的奎尔萨拉斯居然变成了这个样子。"
G["Hello, $g sir : ma'am;!  If you want, I have a nether ray waiting to take you to the Skyguard Outpost atop the Blade's Edge Mountains.\n\nJust let me know."]="¡Hola $gseñor:señora;! Si quieres, tengo una raya abisal esperando para llevarte a la Avanzada de la Guardia del Cielo, en lo alto de las montañas Filospada.\n\nTan solo házmelo saber."
G["Hello, $n!  How goes your adventures? My experiments are progressing nicely...\n\nBe sure to check back with me later!   I might have more test flight opportunities for you!"]="你好，$n！你的冒险怎么样了？我的实验进展很不错……\n\n记得以后要经常回来看看我！我可能有更多的测试飞行机会给你哦！"
G["Hello, $n! How can I help you today?"]="你好，$n！今天你想要点什么？"
G["Hello, $n! I am master engineer, Scooty."]="你好，$n！我是一名熟练的技师，我叫斯库提。"
G["Hello, $n! If you don't see it in my shop, chances are good I can get it!"]="你好，$n！如果你需要的东西在我店里找不到，那么我可以专门去帮你找一下！"
G["Hello, $n! You're making quite a name for yourself here!"]="¡Hola, $n! ¡Parece que te estás haciendo $gfamoso:famosa; por aquí!"
G["Hello, $n, would you like to learn how to acquire and work with the various metals found around our land?"]="你好，$n，你愿意学习如何在我们的土地上找到各种各样的金属，并加以冶炼吗？"
G["Hello, $n."]="你好，$n。"
G["Hello, $n.\n\nNow that I've finished creating my anvil I can begin outfitting our troops. It's an important step, but there's still much to be done.\n\nMore importantly for you, there are new things that I can create, which you may be interested in."]="你好，$n。\n\n我已经造好了铁砧，可以开始装备我们的军队了。这一步对我们来说非常重要，不过仍然有许多事需要去做。\n\n对你来说更重要的是：我可以制造新的武器装备了！也许你会对此感兴趣。"
G["Hello, $n. \nKanrethad's power is too great to allow him to be free. I'll ensure he stays banished, for as long as I exist.\nStill, a taste of the fel energies he is saturated with should cause no ill. Feel free to drain some for your own use. Should you ever grow tired of its effects, I can purge the fel energy from you, for a price."]="Hola, $n.\n\nEl poder de Kanrethad es demasiado grande como para dejar que siga libre. Él seguirá desterrado mientras yo siga con vida.\n\nAun así, probar la energía vil que rebosa no debería causar ningún mal. Drena un poco para tus propósitos. Si te cansas de sus efectos, puedo purgar la energía vil de tu organismo, por un módico precio."
G["Hello, $n.  My name is Oriana, and I attend the tournament to make sure no pets are grievously injured, and to explain the rules.\nYou cannot heal or revive your pets during the tournament.  If you run out of pets to use in battle, you can leave and enter the tournament again.\nIf you lose to a challenger, you may fight them again."]="Hola, $n. Me llamo Oriana y soy la encargada de vigilar que ninguna mascota quede gravemente herida y de explicar las reglas.\n\nNo puedes sanar ni revivir mascotas durante el torneo. Si te quedas sin mascotas con las que luchar, puedes abandonar el torneo y volver a entrar.\n\nSi pierdes contra un oponente, puedes volver a desafiarlo."
G["Hello, $n.  My services as an auctioneer are available to those with skill in engineering.  Sadly, you have none.  Please leave."]="你好，$n。只有精通工程学的人才能使用我的拍卖服务。很遗憾，你不在此列。只好请你离开了。"
G["Hello, $n.  Need to quickly get to Blackwind Landing, our base in the Skethyl Mountains?  I've got a pretty little nether ray ready.\n\nYou want to go now?  You just say the word, $g big guy : bunny;!"]="Hola, $n. ¿Necesitas llegar rápido al Alto de los Vientonegro, nuestra base en las Montañas Skethyl? Tengo una linda raya abisal preparada.\n\n¿Quieres ir ahora? ¡Tan solo di la palabra $gchico grande: nena;!"
G["Hello, $n.  Welcome to Thelsamar, and while you're here don't forget to visit our local brewery!"]="你好，$n。欢迎来到塞尔萨玛，别忘了去本地的酿酒厂看看！"
G["Hello, $n. Are you helping with the invasion? A skilled $c such as yourself will be a valuable addition to our force."]="Hola, $n. ¿Estás echando una mano contra la invasión? $gUn:Una; $c como tú debe ser de mucha ayuda para nuestras fuerzas."
G["Hello, $n. Are you interested in outdoor survival? Sustenance off the flora and fauna of the lands!\n\nYou could learn a thing or two from me, that is, if you're interested."]="你好，$n。你对野外生存感兴趣吗？和大自然间的动植物共同生活！\n\n如果你感兴趣的话，你可以从我这里学到一些东西。"
G["Hello, $n. I heard the call to arms, so I've temporarily taken up my fighting form. You have learned all that I have to teach, so I leave you one last lesson. Fight bravely, young one, as an honored member of the Horde."]="你好，$n。我听说了动员令，所以暂时进入了战斗形态。我会的都已经教给你了，现在我要给上最后一课。作为一名光荣的部落战士，勇敢地去战斗吧，年轻人。"
G["Hello, $n. I train and care for young hippogryphs here; feel free to have a look around."]="你好，$n。我在这里训练和照料年轻的角鹰兽，你可以随意看看。"
G["Hello, $n. If you'd like to learn a thing or two about cooking, please visit me at any time."]="你好，$n。如果你想学习烹饪技巧的话，可以随时来找我。"
G["Hello, $n. If you're looking for cooking training, you've come to the right place. I usually get lots of new students when Pilgrim's Bounty rolls around."]="你好，$n。如果你想要接受烹饪训练，那你就找对地方了。当感恩节进行的时候，我经常会有很多新学生。"
G["Hello, $n. Should you require assistance in completing your mission, you have only to ask. My guardian, Raze, can assist you in defeating the shadowsilk poachers. Use this Staff of Command to command Raze in battle. He is trained to ONLY attack shadowsilk poachers."]="你好，$n。如果你在完成任务时需要帮助，你只需开口就行了。我的卫兵，拆毁者可以帮你打败暗影蛛丝偷猎者。用这个命令法杖在战斗中指挥拆毁者。他受训只攻击暗影蛛丝偷猎者。"
G["Hello, $r! What musical selection would you like to hear today?"]="你好，$r！今天你想听什么音乐？"
G["Hello, $r."]="你好，$r。"
G["Hello, $r.\n\nLet's get busy! No sense waiting around for supplies that may never arrive.\n\nI need my anvil in order to outfit our troops properly. Right now It's $3228w percent complete.\n\nAnd when the anvil is completed, there will be many more powerful items that I will be able to smith for you."]="Hola, $r.\n\n¡Pongámonos manos a la obra! No tiene sentido esperar unos suministros que podrían no llegar nunca.\n\nNecesito mi yunque para poder equipar a las tropas debidamente. Ahora mismo está completado en un $3228w %.\n\nY cuando el yunque esté terminado, habrá muchos más objetos poderosos que podré forjar para ti."
G["Hello, $r.  I'm sorry that you had to see our sacred land for the first time in such a state."]="你好，$r。这是你首次踏上我们的圣地吧，让你目睹这样的情景真是抱歉。"
G["Hello, $r.  You are welcome to share this canyon with us as refuge from the dragons.  Beware the goblin runt though... his kind cannot be trusted."]="你好，$r。你也是为了躲避巨龙才来到这条峡谷的吧，我们欢迎你啊。但是你要当心那个矮小的家伙……地精就没一个可靠的。"
G["Hello, $r. How can I help you today?"]="你好，$r。我能帮你什么忙吗？"
G["Hello, Antonio. It's good to see you safely made it here again. Let me know if you need anything."]="你好，安东尼奥。很高兴能看到你平安无事地来到这里。如果有什么需要帮忙的话尽管说。"
G["Hello, Charys. I have my list, could you get me all of that, especially the last ingredient."]="你好，查瑞斯。这是我需要的货单，你能帮我弄到这些东西吗？尤其是最后一种材料。"
G["Hello, Eitrigg. I bring news from Blackrock Spire."]="你好，伊崔格。我从黑石塔为你带来消息。"
G["Hello, Frankal. I've heard that you might have some information as to the whereabouts of Mistress Natalia Mar'alith."]="你好，弗兰卡。我听说你知道纳塔莉亚的下落。"
G["Hello, Greatmother. Garrosh told me that you wanted to speak with me."]="你好，盖亚安祖母。加尔鲁什告诉我您想和我谈谈。"
G["Hello, Ohgan'aka."]="你好啊，奥根阿卡。"
G["Hello, Pahu."]="帕乌，你好。"
G["Hello, Parkat. I wish to purchase something."]="你好，帕卡特。我想购买点东西。"
G["Hello, Quinn.  How are you faring?"]="你好，奎恩。你的伤势怎么样了？"
G["Hello, Rayne. What brings the Cenarion Circle to the Plaguelands?"]="你好，莱茵。塞纳里奥议会到瘟疫之地来干什么？"
G["Hello, Rutgar. The Commander has sent me here to gather some information about his missing wife."]="你好，鲁特加尔。指挥官派我来这里收集他失踪的妻子的信息。"
G["Hello, Selarin. I'm afraid I cannot help you at the moment, but perhaps some of the adventurers here in Auberdine can..."]="你好，塞拉伊。很遗憾此时我不能帮助你，但是在灰谷的一些探险者可能会……"
G["Hello, and welcome!\n\nUp for a challenge?"]="你好啊！欢迎你！\n\n你是来进行挑战的吗？"
G["Hello, are you here to learn about the conflict in Bloodmyst?"]="你好，你是不是到这里来了解秘血岛事态的？"
G["Hello, brother."]="兄弟，你好。"
G["Hello, cart. Still upside-downed, I see."]="你好啊，老伙计。还底朝天躺在这儿呢？"
G["Hello, citizen. You look like a $G man:woman; with a purpose - do you have business with the Stormwind Army?"]="Hola, ciudadano. Te ves como un $G hombre:mujer; con una misión - ¿tienes negocios con el Ejército de Ventormenta?"
G["Hello, dear. I am Geyah, matron of the Mag'har.\n\n<Greatmother Geyah coughs.>\n\nIf you are here, it would be safe to assume that the portal has opened. Most of the orcs here were too young or too sick to remember the Dark Portal.\n\n<Greatmother Geyah points to the orcs around her.>\n\nMany of them were orphans or would soon become orphans. Aye, Blackhand would have it no other way. Keep the sick from the healthy. Only the strong would survive... Or so they say."]="Hola, $gquerido:querida;. Soy Geyah, matrona de los Mag'har.\n\n<La Abuela Geyah tose.>\n\nSi estás aquí, deduzco que es porque el portal se ha abierto. La mayoría de los orcos son demasiado jóvenes o están demasiado cansados como para acordarse del Portal Oscuro.\n\n<La Abuela Geyah señala a los orcos de su alrededor.>\n\nMuchos de ellos eran huérfanos o estaban a punto de convertirse en huérfanos. Sí, Puño Negro no querría que fuese de otra forma. Aparta al sano del enfermo. Solo sobrevivirán los fuertes... Eso dicen."
G["Hello, dryskin."]="干皮人，你好。"
G["Hello, friend! Can I interest you in the deal of a lifetime?"]="你好，朋友！想听我介绍一桩一生难遇的好买卖吗？"
G["Hello, friend! I'd love to give you a demolisher, but I'm out of parts at the moment."]="¡Hola, $gamigo:amiga;! Me encantaría darte un demoledor, pero ahora no me quedan piezas."
G["Hello, friend! I've setup shop in this here factory. I'd be happy to set you up in a shiny new vehicle - I'll even send the bill to your leaders after the assault. Best deal anywhere!"]="¡Hola, amig$go:a;! He puesto una tienda en esta fábrica. Estaré encantado de proporcionarte un nuevo vehículo último modelo, hasta le mandaré la factura a tus líderes tras el asalto. ¡El mejor trato que hay!"
G["Hello, friend! Welcome to the Brewfest Grounds!"]="你好，朋友！欢迎来到美酒节！"
G["Hello, friend. Are you getting on all right at your farm?"]="Hola, $gamigo:amiga;. ¿Te las estás arreglando bien en tu granja?"
G["Hello, friend. Care to purchase anything while you're here?"]="你好，朋友。想顺便买点儿什么吗？"
G["Hello, friend. How may I be of service to you today?"]="你好，朋友。今天有什么我可以为你效劳的吗？"
G["Hello, friend. Hungry?"]="Hola, $gamigo:amiga;. ¿Tienes hambre?"
G["Hello, good $G sir:lady;. Have a seat, and a meal if you're hungry. Don't fret if I look busy with my needlework - I'm listening to you..."]="Hola, buen(a) $G señor:dama;. Siéntate y come si tienes hambre. No te preocupes si veo que estoy ocupado con mi labor de bordar - te escucho..."
G["Hello, good friend. Oh, is it okay if I call you my good friend?"]="Hola, $gbuen amigo:buena amiga;. ¿Te importa si te llamo mi $gbuen amigo:buena amiga;?"
G["Hello, hello!"]="喂，喂！"
G["Hello, hello, Amy. It's good to be back in Lakeshire and to see you, milady."]="您好啊，艾米小姐。很高兴能回湖畔镇，很高兴还能看到您的芳容，亲爱的小姐。"
G["Hello, how are you feeling today, $c? Well, I hope. You may be wondering what is going on here. There's a war at Ahn'Qiraj that is being planned and prepared for. We and the Horde are preparing as best we can for it.\n\nTo that end, the Alliance has asked me to supervise the collection of silk bandages here. To date we've managed to put together $2082w out of $2083w needed. Are you thinking about helping out?"]="Hola, ¿cómo te sientes hoy, $c? Espero que bien. Te debes de estar preguntando qué está pasando aquí. Se está planeando y preparando una guerra en Ahn'Qiraj. Nosotros y la Horda nos estamos preparando lo mejor que podemos.\n\nPara ello, la Alianza me ha pedido que supervise la recogida de vendas de seda en este lugar. Hasta la fecha, hemos conseguido reunir $2082w de las $2083w que son necesarias. ¿Estás pensando en echar una mano?"
G["Hello, little $r."]="Hola, $gpequeño:pequeña; $r."
G["Hello, little one.  What news do you bring?"]="嗨，小家伙。你有什么消息要告诉我吗？"
G["Hello, little one. Come to play?"]="嗨，咱们来玩玩吧？"
G["Hello, ma'am.  Heard any interesting rumors lately?"]="你好，女士。最近有没有听到过什么有趣的传闻？"
G["Hello, my child."]="Hola, mi $gniño:niña;."
G["Hello, my dear. Have you been out in the fields?"]="你好，亲爱的。你一直都在战场上吗？"
G["Hello, my friends. It is good to see you again. Still keeping our borders free I see. Antonio appreciates your hard work."]="你好，我的朋友。很高兴又能见到你。看来你依然在守卫着我们的边境，安东尼奥对你的辛勤工作表示敬意。"
G["Hello, my name's Lilian. You don't mind if I take those blades, do you?"]="你好，我叫莉莉安。你不会介意我拿走这两柄利刃，对吧？"
G["Hello, old friend!"]="你好啊，老朋友！"
G["Hello, overseer.  Ready for the attack?"]="Hola, sobrestante. ¿$gPreparado:Preparada; para el ataque?"
G["Hello, peach - good to have your company!"]="你好，伙计——很高兴有你陪在我身边！"
G["Hello, rival.\n\nI've been busy training.\n\nI hope you've done the same."]="你好，对手。\n\n我正忙着训练。\n\n希望你也是。"
G["Hello, sister. What have we here?"]="嗨，你好。这儿有什么好东西？"
G["Hello, sucker!"]="你好，混蛋！"
G["Hello, traveler!\n\nAre you coming to the Wanderer's Festival tonight? Pandaren will gather right here on Turtle Beach shortly after sunset! It's quite the sight.\n\nSpeak to me as the event draws near and I will let you know how long you have to wait."]="¡Hola, $gviajero:viajera;!\n\n¿Vas a ir al Festival del Errante esta noche? Los pandaren se reunirán aquí, en la Playa de la Tortuga, al caer el sol. Es digno de ver.\n\nHabla conmigo cuando quede poco para el evento y te contaré cuánto tienes que esperar."
G["Hello, traveler!\n\nAre you coming to the Wanderer's Festival tonight? Pandaren will gather right here on Turtle Beach shortly after sunset! It's quite the sight.\n\nThe festival will begin under three hours from now. Check back at the top of the hour!"]="¡Hola, $gviajero:viajera;!\n\n¿Vas a ir al Festival del Errante esta noche? Los pandaren se reunirán aquí, en la Playa de la Tortuga, al caer el sol. Es digno de ver.\n\nEl festival empieza en menos de tres horas. ¡Vuelve dentro de un rato!"
G["Hello, traveler!\n\nAre you coming to the Wanderer's Festival tonight? Pandaren will gather right here on Turtle Beach shortly after sunset! It's quite the sight.\n\nThe festival will begin under two hours from now. Check back at the top of the hour!"]="¡Hola, $gviajero:viajera;!\n\n¿Vas a ir al Festival del Errante esta noche? Los pandaren se reunirán aquí, en la Playa de la Tortuga, al caer el sol. Es digno de ver.\n\nEl festival empieza en menos de dos horas. ¡Vuelve dentro de un rato!"
G["Hello, traveler!\n\nAre you coming to the Wanderer's Festival tonight? Pandaren will gather right here on Turtle Beach shortly after sunset! It's quite the sight.\n\nWithin the next hour, the festival will begin. Check back at the top of the hour!"]="¡Hola, $gviajero:viajera;!\n\n¿Vas a ir al Festival del Errante esta noche? Los pandaren se reunirán aquí, en la Playa de la Tortuga, al caer el sol. Es digno de ver.\n\nEl festival empieza en menos de una hora. ¡Vuelve dentro de un rato!"
G["Hello, traveler. Not many find me out this way.\n\nMy name is Rivern, and I train the Winterspring Frostsabers to become mounts.\n\nThese cats are the most feral and difficult to subdue of all the sabers. Only the most trusted and exalted may attempt to ride one.\n\nI will not sell such a mount to just anyone; no, you must work for it and earn your acceptance not only with me, but with the sabers themselves."]="Hola $gviajero:viajera;. No son muchos los que me encuentran así.\n\nMi nombre es Rivern y entreno a los Sables de Hielo de Cuna del Inverno para convertirlos en monturas.\n\nEstos felinos son los más salvajes y difíciles de domar de todos los dientes de sable. Solo aquellos en los que tenemos más confianza, los exaltados, pueden intentar montar uno.\n\nNo venderé una montura así a todo el mundo. No, debes trabajar duro y ganarte mi aprobación y la de los propios dientes de sable."
G["Hello, what business brings you here?\n\nThis is an orphanage for the children of Outland who have lost their parents and have no one else to look after them.\n\nPerhaps you are here because you are considering adoption?"]="你好，是什么风把你吹到这儿来的？\n\n这里的孤儿院专门收留那些在外域失去双亲、无人照看的孩子。\n\n也许你是来考虑领养的吧？"
G["Hello, young $c. Are you here to bring me a batch of peacebloom? We are collecting them to make potions and elixirs for the Ahn'Qiraj war effort. Though tragic that we are forced into this war, the results will be even more terrible if we do not prepare properly.\n\nThe Horde has tasked me with the collection of $2020w peacebloom, and so far we've managed to put together $2021w. If you have it within your ability, please gather up all that you can and return them to me here."]="你好，年轻的$c。你到这儿来是带宁神花给我的吗？我们正在为安其拉之战做准备，收集宁神花，制作药水和药剂。如果我们准备得不够充分的话，将会产生非常严重的后果。\n\n部落派我来此收集$2020w株宁神花，到目前为止我们已经设法收集到$2021w株了。如果你力所能及的话，就请帮帮我们，把宁神花带给我。"
G["Hello, young $r."]="你好，年轻的$r。"
G["Hello."]="你好。"
G["Hello.\n\nMy name is Shai.\n\nThey tell me to watch the cliff.\n\nSometimes cubs come because of a dare. Sometimes grown ups come because they are curious.\n\nI tell you what I tell them. The cliffs are sad, and the jungle is even more sad.\n\nYou may descend using the rope, but know it is a very sad place."]="你好。\n\n我是沙埃。\n\n他们让我守望悬崖。\n\n有时会有初生牛犊不怕虎的幼仔跑到这里来。有时也会有大人出于好奇心前来。\n\n我要把已经告诉他们的话重复给你听。悬崖很危险，那片丛林则更加危险。\n\n你可以用绳索下去，但我要提醒你，这是个非常危险的地方。"
G["Hello.  I trust that this day finds you well?"]="你好，过得不错吧？"
G["Hello.  What brings you to Chillwind Camp today?"]="你好，什么风把你吹到寒风营地来了？"
G["Hello. By odd twist of fortune, we have obtained the remains of Kel'Thuzad's feared abomination Patchwerk.  Our researchers are able to reassemble them in various ways to test the mettle of your band of would-be heroes, should you so desire.  \nWe can construct a sturdy Patchwerk against which to measure your ability to do damage, a brutal Patchwerk who will deliver rapid and mighty blows to any who would dare stand before him, or a well-rounded Patchwerk who will test your entire fighting force.\nWhich would you prefer?"]="Hola. Por azares de la fortuna hemos recibido los restos de la temible abominación de Kel'Thuzad, Remendejo. Nuestros investigadores pueden volver a juntarlos de varias formas para poner a prueba la entereza de tus aspirantes a héroe, si así lo deseas. \n\nPodemos construir un robusto Remendejo contra el que medir vuestra habilidad para infligir daño; un Remendejo brutal que asestará rápidos y potentes golpes a cualquiera que se atreva a ponerse ante él; o un Remendejo equilibrado que pondrá a prueba toda tu fuerza de combate.\n\n¿Cuál prefieres?"
G["Hello. For this trial, you must keep us alive while we face the incoming illusions. I am Oto, and will protect you."]="你好。在试炼中，你必须在我对付幻影时保证我的生命。我是鸥图，我会保护你的。"
G["Hello. I am Groundskeeper Ponch. Have we met before? My memory is not too good."]="你好。我是管理者彭启。我们以前见过面吗？我的记性不太好。"
G["Hello. Master Fras Siabi is not in at this time. Please come back tomorrow to Fras Siabi's Premium Tobacco! Beep!"]="你好。弗拉斯·希亚比现在不在。明天再来光顾希亚比的烟草店吧！哔哔！"
G["Hello. Master Fras Siabi is not in at this time. Please come back tomorrow to Siabi's Premium Tobacco! Beep!"]="你好。弗拉斯·希亚比现在不在。明天再来光顾希亚比的烟草店吧！哔哔！"
G["Hello. Nice to meet you."]="你好，很高兴认识你。"
G["Hello. Squire Walter and I are responsible for taking care of Old Blanchy here, along with the rest of the mounts."]="你好。侍从瓦尔特和我负责照看老马布兰契和其他马匹。"
G["Hello. Would you like to fight the Anub'arak encounter for the Argent Colosseum raid? \nYou will face the version of this encounter that corresponds to the current raid difficulty you have selected. This encounter is a work in progress. Please be sure to report any bugs you experience on the Blizzard forums.\nAre you ready to begin the encounter?"]="Hola. ¿Te gustaría participar en el encuentro contra Anub'arak para la banda del Coliseo Argenta?\n\nTe enfrentarás a este encuentro en la versión que corresponda con la dificultad de banda actual que hayas seleccionado. Aún se está trabajando en este encuentro. Acuérdate de informar de los errores que encuentres en el foro de Blizzard.\n\n¿Estás $gpreparado:preparada; para comenzar el encuentro?"
