G["Hello?"]="有人吗？"
G["Hello?  Help?"]="嘿？帮个忙行不行？"
G["Hellscream already try ta have Vol'jin killed. Heh. Ain't so easy ta kill a troll."]="地狱咆哮已经派人来刺杀过沃金了。呵呵，巨魔可不是那么容易杀死的。"
G["Hellscream has sent his best to take this island. We shall see to it that none return home..."]="地狱咆哮派来了他最强的战士。我们要确保他们全都回不了家……"
G["Hellscream thought Vol'jin dead, 'til Vol'jin show up at Sen'jin Village. Den de Warchief try to crush de rebellion, but we was waitin' for 'im. We fought back de Kor'kron at Sen'jin, and den we took Razor Hill, hah, right under de Warchief's nose!"]="地狱咆哮本以为沃金已经死了，结果他却出现在森金村。然后酋长又试图绞杀起义军，但我们早有准备。我们已经在森金村击退了库卡隆，然后又攻占了剃刀岭。哈，就在酋长的鼻子底下打了个大胜仗！"
G["Hellscream will fall!"]="地狱咆哮必将失败！"
G["Hellscream will find out about this!"]="地狱咆哮会得知此事！"
G["Hellscream will settle for nothing short of total victory."]="只有彻底的胜利才能让地狱咆哮满意。"
G["Hellscream! Blessed ancestors! He is the mirrored reflection of Grom, Drek'Thar."]="地狱咆哮！天啊！德雷克塔尔，他简直就是格罗姆再世。"
G["Hellscream's Fury."]="地狱咆哮的狂怒。"
G["Hellscream's Horde demands absolute obedience!"]="地狱咆哮的部落要求绝对的服从……"
G["Hellscream's Horde has no need for your voodoo tricks, troll. Now get out of my sight!"]="地狱咆哮的部落不需要你那些巫毒把戏，巨魔。现在，滚出我的视线！"
G["Hellscream's armies march upon us, brothers and sisters!"]="地狱咆哮的军队正在朝我们袭来，兄弟姐妹们！"
G["Hellscream's armies will paint this land red!"]="地狱咆哮的军队会将这片土地染红！"
G["Hellscream's eyes are upon us all!"]="地狱咆哮之眼注视着我们！"
G["Hellscream's eyes are upon you!"]="地狱咆哮之眼注视着你。"
G["Hellscream's eyes are upon you, brothers!"]="兄弟们，地狱咆哮之眼在注视着你们！"
G["Hellscream's eyes are upon you, men!"]="地狱咆哮的双眼在注视着你们！"
G["Hellscream's eyes are upon you."]="地狱咆哮之眼注视着你。"
G["Hellscream's involved, you say?"]="你说地狱咆哮也牵涉其中了？"
G["Hellscream, I am Zaela of the Dragonmaw. Your people have freed mine from tyranny. We are your instrument. The strength of the Dragonmaw is yours to command. For the Horde!"]="地狱咆哮，我是龙喉氏族的扎伊拉。你的人民使我们从暴君的手中重获自由。我们是你的武器。龙喉氏族之力听你号令。为了部落！"
G["Hellscream... will find out..."]="地狱咆哮……会知道的……"
G["Help $p!"]="帮帮我，$p！"
G["Help Alexstrasza by killing the Twilight Corruptors."]="通过消灭暮光腐蚀者来帮助阿莱克丝塔萨。"
G["Help Cenarius defeat Ragnaros!"]="帮助塞纳留斯击败拉格纳罗斯！"
G["Help Joseph Carlin's troops defend Darrowshire!"]="帮助约瑟夫·卡林的部队守卫达隆郡！"
G["Help a goblin out and grab some of them fancy artifacts.  Meanwhile, my guys will clear the entrance to the mine."]="帮帮我这个可怜的地精，为我收集一些珍贵遗物吧。与此同时，我的人会去清理矿洞入口的。"
G["Help a grummle?"]="要不要帮土地精一把？"
G["Help a poor bloke out?"]="帮帮我这个穷人吧？"
G["Help arrives at last...."]="援军终于到了……"
G["Help help!  I'm being repressed!"]="救命啊！我动不了了！"
G["Help me choose wisely."]="帮我挑选一下吧。"
G["Help me crush these punys!"]="帮我粉碎这些微不足道的家伙！"
G["Help me feed them."]="帮我喂饱它们吧。"
G["Help me kill $n!"]="¡Ayúdame a matar a $n!"
G["Help me out here, mon!"]="帮我离开这里！"
G["Help me outta here, $r. First, you gotta kill da Amani priest who captured me. He be preparin' to sacrifice me!"]="救我出去，$r。首先，你必须杀掉抓住我的阿曼尼祭祀，他正准备献祭我呢！"
G["Help me up, $p. I... I took an arrow in the knee..."]="拉我一把，$p。我……我膝盖中箭了……"
G["Help me with this $n!"]="帮我对付这个$n！"
G["Help me!"]="帮帮我！"
G["Help me!  Please help me!"]="救救我！请救救我！"
G["Help me! Help me! Don't let them eat me!"]="救命！救命！不要让它们吃了我！"
G["Help me! Help! Assassins in the hills! To arms! To arms!"]="救命啊！山上有刺客！帮帮我！帮帮我！"
G["Help me! Save me!"]="帮帮我！救救我！"
G["Help me! This $n won't get off of me!"]="帮帮我！我甩不掉这个$n！"
G["Help me, help me!"]="救救我，救救我！"
G["Help me, please!"]="救命，救救我！"
G["Help mon! There's too many of dem!"]="帮帮忙啊！我抗不住了！"
G["Help more mosswalkers, okay?"]="继续搭救苔行鳄鱼人，好吗？"
G["Help shield us from these cutting winds, little sapling."]="帮我们抵御这刺骨的寒风吧，小树苗。"
G["Help the children of Stormwind... victims of the war and plague!"]="帮帮暴风城的孩子们吧……他们是战争的受害者！"
G["Help the injured orc up."]="帮助受伤的兽人站起来。"
G["Help us destroy the Forsaken and retake Lordaeron for the Alliance!"]="帮助我们消灭被遗忘者，为联盟夺回洛丹伦！"
G["Help us drive the yaungol back, $r!"]="快帮我们把野牛人赶回去，$r！"
G["Help us fend off these Alliance dogs!"]="帮我们击退这些联盟狗！"
G["Help us fend off these Horde pigs!"]="帮我们击退这些部落猪！"
G["Help us rout them from your land, and your kind can stand tall and proud with the Horde!"]="帮我们铲除他们，你的族人就能挺起胸膛傲然屹立在部落身边！"
G["Help us subdue him."]="帮我们制伏他。"
G["Help us!"]="帮帮我们！"
G["Help us! Please!"]="帮帮我们！求求你！"
G["Help us, outsider. <The relic crumbles to dust. A vision of eight Dark Iron dwarves performing some sort of ritual fills your head.>"]="陌生人，帮帮我们……<古物化为乌有。你脑海中浮现出八个黑铁矮人进行仪式的画面。>"
G["Help you with what situation?"]="帮你什么？"
G["Help yourself to a drink friend.  Just make sure to stay away from the ledge while you drink."]="来喝一杯，朋友。只是在喝酒时小心别摔下去。"
G["Help yourselves. It be suicide for a scout to walk around wit' so much weighing me down."]="你们随便拿吧。作为一名斥候，带着那么多拖油瓶真是自寻死路。"
G["Help!"]="救命啊！"
G["Help!\n\nIf you get me out of here, I can blow up the door that leads to the chief of Zul'Farrak!"]="救命！\n\n如果你能帮我离开这里，我就帮你炸开通向祖尔法拉克酋长所在地的那扇门！"
G["Help!  A mana wraith!  It's come to avenge its brethren and steal back their essences!"]="救命！法力怨魂！它是来为它的同伴报仇的，而且还要偷走它们的精华！"
G["Help!  My band and I have been captured by trolls, and they're going to sacrifice us!\n\nGet us out of here and I'll give you anything you want."]="救命啊！我的队伍被巨魔俘虏了，他们准备杀了我们！\n\n只要你能救我们出去，我会答应你的任何条件！"
G["Help!  My eyes!"]="这是怎么了！"
G["Help!  Please, you must help me!"]="帮帮我！你一定要帮帮我！"
G["Help!  The beast is on me!"]="救命！那野兽过来了！"
G["Help!  Up here!"]="救命！在这边！"
G["Help! $n attacking!"]="救命啊！$n在攻击我！"
G["Help! Get these things off of me!"]="救命！把它们赶开！"
G["Help! Get this $n off of me!"]="救命！快帮我把这$n搞定！"
G["Help! Grummle in trouble."]="帮帮我！土地精遇到麻烦了。"
G["Help! Guards! It's going to step on me!"]="帮帮我！守卫！就要踩到我啦！"
G["Help! Help!"]="救命！救命！"
G["Help! Help! The Horde is here!"]="救命！救命！这儿有部落！"
G["Help! Help! They're going to eat me!"]="救命！救命！他们要吃了我！"
G["Help! I am being attacked!"]="救命！我被攻击了！"
G["Help! I am trapped within this tree!  I require aid!"]="救命！我被困在这棵树里了！我需要帮助！"
G["Help! I can't swim!"]="救命！我不会游泳！"
G["Help! I lost my egg!"]="帮帮我！我的蛋不见了！"
G["Help! I think this creature might be too tough for me to handle alone."]="帮帮我！我觉得这东西对我来说可能比较棘手。"
G["Help! I'm being chased by a swarm of bees!"]="救命！一群蜜蜂在追我！"
G["Help! I'm too weak to make it on my own."]="救命！我已经没力气了。"
G["Help! I'm trapped in here!"]="救命！我被困住了！"
G["Help! I'm under attack!"]="救命！我遭到攻击了！"
G["Help! I've only one hand to defend myself with."]="救命！救命啊！"
G["Help! It's on my face!"]="救命啊！在我脸上！"
G["Help! Let me go!"]="救命！放开我！"
G["Help! Someone help us!"]="救命！谁来帮帮我们！"
G["Help! Sprites swarm!"]="救命！树精涌过来啦！"
G["Help! These yaungol are trying to steal my yaks!"]="快来帮帮我！这些野牛人想偷我的牦牛！"
G["Help! They took my luckydo!"]="帮帮我！他们夺走了我的幸运符！"
G["Help! Wait! It's like this thing has a mind of its own!"]="帮帮我！等等！这个东西好像有自己的思维！"
G["Help! We're being attacked! Dark Irons!"]="救命！我们遭到了攻击！是黑铁矮人！"
G["Help!! I told you this place was cursed!"]="救命啊！！我告诉过你这个地方是被诅咒过的！"
G["Help!!! Get these things off me so I can get my work done!"]="赶快！只有干掉这些东西，我才能完成我的工作！"
G["Help, $p! I'm under attack!"]="救命，$p！我被袭击了！"
G["Help. Help!"]="救命。救命！"
G["Help... please, if you can hear me, help..."]="帮帮我……求你，如果你能听见，请帮帮我……"
G["Help? You saved me from eternity trapped in jade! I'm gonna throw you the biggest party ever made!"]="帮助？你把我从玉石里救出来了，不用一直被关着了！我要为你开一个最最大的派对！"
G["Helpless... powerless... restore... must restore... Zevrim controls... end this torment..."]="无能为力……没有力气啦……恢复……必须恢复……瑟雷姆控制着……结束这痛苦的折磨吧……"
G["Hemet Nesingwary, what are you doing here in the Outland?"]="赫米特·奈辛瓦里，你在外域干什么？"
G["Hemet is the greatest hunter that I know.  We chanced upon each other in the hills of Winterspring back on Azeroth many moons ago.  He and I were stalking the same quarry: the great cat known as Rak'shiri.\n\nRather than fight each other over our prey, we made a wager out of it; whoever collected the frostsaber's skin would get to demand something of the other.  To my eternal shame, this is how I earned the nickname, Fitz.\n\nDo I look like a Fitz?"]="赫米特是我所认识的最棒的猎人。很久以前，我们在艾泽拉斯的冬泉谷的山上偶遇。他和我正在追踪着一个相同的目标：那只名叫拉克西里的豹子。\n\n与其为了一个猎物打得头破血流，还不如下个赌注决定胜负：谁能得到霜刃豹的毛皮，就可以要求对方做些什么。那真是我一辈子的耻辱，我这“好儿子”的绰号就是这么来的。\n\n我看上去像一个“好儿子”吗？"
G["Hemet?  Fitz?"]="赫米特？好儿子？"
G["Henchmen?  Tribute?"]="追随者？贡品？"
G["Hendel is in our custody now, $n, thanks to you.\n\nAlthough the questioning goes slowly, I assure you, he will tell us everything he knows.\n\nFor now, please be patient. I will contact you immediately if we have need of your assistance.\n\nUntil then, please, enjoy Theramore and I invite you to stay for as long as you like within our city's walls as a friend of the Alliance."]="Gracias a ti, $n, Hendel está bajo nuestra custodia.\n\nSi bien el interrogatorio es lento, te aseguro que nos dirá todo lo que sabe.\n\nPor ahora, ten paciencia. Te buscaré de inmediato si necesitamos ayuda.\n\nHasta entonces, disfruta de Theramore y te invito a quedarte el tiempo que quieras dentro de los muros de nuestra ciudad como amigo de la Alianza."
G["Her Majesty sends Dark Rangers!  Stand aside, boys!"]="女王陛下派来了黑暗游侠！退后！"
G["Her Majesty's brood will sweep over this valley!"]="女皇的虫群将席卷整个山谷！"
G["Her bag of gold should be in the mail!  It's insulting she sends someone to collect from me while I'm working."]="我会把她那几个金币寄给她的！居然在我忙碌的时候派人来取钱，这太无礼了。"
G["Her body appears even larger from the inside.  Fascinating!"]="她的身体从里面看似乎显得更大了。真令人惊叹！"
G["Her fate is regrettably unavoidable."]="很遗憾，她的命运是不可避免的。"
G["Her gifts are many, our gratitude immeasurable."]="女皇恩赐浩荡，我们感激涕零。"
G["Her happiness is our reward, her sorrow our failure."]="她的幸福就是对我们的犒赏，她的悲伤就是我们的失败。"
G["Her locomotives won't locomote, but her weapons are fresh off the assembly line."]="Sus dispositivos motrices no \"motrizan\", pero las armas están recién salidas de la cadena de montaje."
G["Her methods are cowardly.  She reminds me of the Forsaken apothecaries."]="她的手段真卑鄙，让我想起了那些被遗忘者的药剂师。"
G["Her name is \"Nalice.\" And until recently she stood at Wyrmrest Temple as the representative of the black dragonflight. Now? She's on the run."]="Se llama \"Nalice\". Y, hasta hace poco, se encontraba en el Templo del Reposo del Dragón como representante del Vuelo Negro. Ahora es una prófuga."
G["Her name!!"]="她的名讳！！"
G["Her reflection ripples a second time."]="她的倒影又再次震荡起来。"
G["Her reinforcements will arrive shortly, we must bring her down quickly!"]="她的援兵就要到了！我们必须迅速消灭她！"
G["Her strength is truly outrageous!"]="她的力气真大！"
G["Her will is greater than us all. You will join us or you will perish."]="女皇的意志凌驾于我们所有人之上。要么从命，要么受死。"
G["Her... excellency... awaits."]="女王……陛下……在等待着。"
G["Heraazi exports are on the rise, sir.  We've already bribed the appropriate taxation officers and contraband will begin to arrive within days."]="长官，哈莱兹的出口前景看涨。我们已经适当贿赂了税务官员，走私品这几天就会到了。"
G["Herbalism"]="草药学"
G["Herbalism allows you to locate and gather herbs from the wild. These can be sold at the auction house or used to support the Alchemy or Inscription professions.\nSkilled herbalists can also use their knowledge of the earth to heal themselves."]="La herboristería te permite encontrar y recoger hierbas salvajes. Se pueden vender en la casa de subastas o aprovechar para suministrar las profesiones de alquimia o inscripción.\n\nLos herboristas cualificados también pueden utilizar su conocimiento de la tierra para sanarse."
G["Herbalism requires a gentle touch that few such as Malorne can teach.  Seek him out east of the Inn in Dolanaar."]="要学习草药学，你得向玛洛尼好好讨教。去多兰纳尔旅馆东边找他吧。"
G["Herbs"]="草药"
G["Herbs are so pricey! I could always use a little something extra, if you know what I mean. Help a goblin out?"]="草药价格太高啦！我总是使用一点别的东西，如果你明白我的意思的话。帮帮我好吗？"
G["Herbs, herbs, hmmm, let me see here. Ah yes, here it is. To date we have accumulated $2047w out of $2048w stranglekelp, $2053w out of $2055w purple lotuses, and $2057w out of $2058w arthas' tears needed."]="草药，草药，嗯，让我看看。啊，是的。到目前为止我们已经收集到$2047w份荆棘藻、$2053w份紫莲花和$2057w份阿尔萨斯之泪，而总的需求量分别是$2048w、$2055w和$2058w。"
G["Herbs... you need to speak to Jandi at her arboretum in The Drag.  There are some wooden steps behind Asoran's Market in the Valley of Wisdom.  Follow them to the upper level of The Drag and you'll find her."]="草药……你需要前往暗巷区，去加迪的植物园找她谈谈。在智慧谷阿索兰的市场后面有木制的阶梯。沿着阶梯可以到达暗巷区的上层。"
G["Here I am, $g sir:madam; $n!"]="我来了，$n$g阁下:女士;！"
G["Here I am, alliance!  Take me down... if you can!"]="我来啦，联盟！如果你行的话……放马过来吧！"
G["Here I am, digging up some useless bauble from the ground at the will of someone I just recently met... does that seem right to you?"]="你瞧，我刚刚认识那家伙，他就派我来这里挖掘没用的小玩意儿……你觉得这件事正常吗？"
G["Here I am, in a rough-hewn stone tower squatting on marshy, muddy ground while clouds of midges fly unchecked through the open doorways, standing amongst hunched, greenskin figures of dubious hygiene and coarse manners. I've never been happier."]="你看，我现在就住在一座简陋不堪的石头哨塔里，望着外面泥泞的沼泽。大堆的苍蝇蚊虫到处乱飞，面如菜色、长满肉瘤的奇怪绿色生物四下游荡。我还能比现在更开心吗？"
G["Here I am, standing next to my mortal enemy, yet I haven't killed it... does that seem right to you?"]="敌人就站在我身旁，我却没有动手杀它……你觉得这件事正常吗？"
G["Here I come!"]="我来也！"
G["Here I come!  Don't you dare hide behind those trees!"]="我来了！别以为躲在那些树后面就没事了！"
G["Here I go!"]="看我的！"
G["Here I go! Keep an eye out...."]="我走了！注意警惕……"
G["Here I goooooooooo!"]="我要飞啦！"
G["Here I have amassed what may well be the greatest depository of lore in all of Outland. Even the grand libraries of Silvermoon City pale in comparison.\n\nPlease... look, read, browse to your heart's content. You'll find everything organized and clearly labeled."]="这里汇集了外域最丰富的藏书。即便是银月城的大图书馆也要相形见绌了。\n\n请……尽情享受阅读的乐趣吧。所有的书籍都已分门别类，整理得井井有条。"
G["Here among the craftsmen of Darnassus, there is a millenium of knowledge for the benefit of your chosen craft.  Now tell me, which craft do you find the most intriguing?"]="达纳苏斯的工匠们可传授给你很多工艺知识。告诉我，你对哪种工艺最好奇？"
G["Here are more of the incendiary devices, $n. Be careful with these, they can cause a great deal of disruption to time if used improperly."]="要多少有多少，$n。小心使用，如果使用不当的话，这些东西是相当麻烦的。"
G["Here are my skins, Harold.  Now give me the reward!"]="这是我的皮革，哈罗德。现在给我奖励吧。"
G["Here are some spare parts. I'll cover you while you make repairs!"]="这里有一些多余的零件。当你进行修理的时候，我会掩护你！"
G["Here are the explosives, Elsia."]="炸药来了，艾尔希娅。"
G["Here are the explosives, Vereesa."]="炸药来了，温蕾萨。"
G["Here are the final standings!\n\nThrall: $2200w\n\nCairne: $2201w\n\nSylvanas: $2202w\n\nTotal Horde: $2207w\n\n\nBolvar: $2203w\n\nMagni: $2204w\n\nTyrande: $2205w\n\nTotal Alliance: $2206w\n\nThe Horde and the Alliance tied in total votes!"]="¡Esta es la clasificación final!\n\nThrall: $2200w\n\nCairne: $2201w\n\nSylvanas: $2202w\n\nTotal de la Horda: $2207w\n\nBolvar: $2203w\n\nMagni: $2204w\n\nTyrande: $2205w\n\nTotal de la Alianza: $2206w\n\n¡La Horda y la Alianza han obtenido el mismo número de votos!"
G["Here are the final standings!\n\nThrall: $2200w\nCairne: $2201w\nSylvanas: $2202w\nTotal Horde: $2207w\n\nBolvar: $2203w\nMagni: $2204w\nTyrande: $2205w\nTotal Alliance: $2206w\n\nThe Alliance has the most popular hero!"]="¡Esta es la clasificación final!\n\nThrall: $2200w\nCairne: $2201w\nSylvanas: $2202w\nTotal de la Horda: $2207w\n\nBolvar: $2203w\nMagni: $2204w\nTyrande: $2205w\nTotal de la Alianza: $2206w\n\n¡La Alianza cuenta con $gel héroe:la heroína; más popular!"
G["Here are the final standings!\n\nThrall: $2200w\nCairne: $2201w\nSylvanas: $2202w\nTotal Horde: $2207w\n\nBolvar: $2203w\nMagni: $2204w\nTyrande: $2205w\nTotal Alliance: $2206w\n\nThe Horde has the most popular hero!"]="¡Esta es la clasificación final!\n\nThrall: $2200w\nCairne: $2201w\nSylvanas: $2202w\nTotal de la Horda: $2207w\n\nBolvar: $2203w\nMagni: $2204w\nTyrande: $2205w\nTotal de la Alianza: $2206w\n\n¡La Horda cuenta con $gel héroe:la heroína; más popular!"
G["Here are the orders, $n.  Now, take them quickly to Field Marshal Teravaine!"]="这是指令，$n。现在快将它们交给指挥官特拉瓦雷吧！"
G["Here are the orders, $n.  Take them quickly to Warmaster Garrick!"]="这些是指令，$n。请迅速将它们交给霜狼突击队队长!"
G["Here at The Golden Lantern, the taps never empty and the barrels never stop rolling! What can I get for you?"]="在金色神灯，大家吃喝不停，这里是客流不断！你想要些什么吗？"
G["Here at the Farstrider lodge, we prize hunting skills above all else. Wish to gain my approval? You'll have to earn it.\n\nYou look up to the challenge, $Glad:lass;!"]="在旅行者营地，我们最推崇狩猎技能。想获得我的赏识吗？你得靠行动来证明。\n\n面对挑战吧，$G小伙子:姑娘;！"
G["Here be some of my things...."]="这里有些我的东西……"
G["Here come Zen'Kiki!"]="赞吉吉来了！"
G["Here come more stone troggs. Defend the catapult!"]="还有更多的石头穴居人杀过来。保卫投石车！"
G["Here come the Infinites!  I've got to keep the hourglass safe.  Can you help?"]="永恒之龙来了！我必须确保沙漏的安全。你能帮帮我吗？"
G["Here come the beasts!"]="那些野兽来了！"
G["Here come the tears..."]="啧啧，哭鼻子啦……"
G["Here comes Zanzil!"]="赞吉尔来了！"
G["Here comes Zen'Kiki!"]="赞吉吉来也！"
G["Here comes the THUNDER!"]="雷霆天降！"
G["Here comes the final assault. For Domination Point! BUTCHER THEM ALL!"]="这是最后一波攻击了。为了统御岗哨！把他们全杀光！"
G["Here comes the guard, $n!  Take him out!"]="守卫来了，$n！干掉他！"
G["Here comes the pain!"]="苦难降临！"
G["Here comes the postmaster!"]="邮差来了！"
G["Here comes the small but deadly Ambrose Boltspark, Grand Champion of Gnomeregan!"]="现在出场的是矮小却极度致命的安布罗斯·雷钉，诺莫瑞根的总冠军！"
G["Here fishy fishy. . . come to papa."]="小鱼小鱼快上钩……"
G["Here fishy, fishy fishy..."]="小鱼，小鱼，小鱼，快过来……"
G["Here for a ride, $r?\n\nOr, is something else bothering you?"]="$r，想要搭乘双足飞龙吗？\n\n或者你有什么烦心事儿想向我倾诉？"
G["Here for the rod? Or, maybe you're simply stocking up on runes?\n\nWait a minute! Are you just trying to offload a whole bunch of junk on me?! Curse my never-ending compulsion to buy, buy, buy!"]="想要买魔杖？或者你只是想要囤积一些符文？\n\n等等！你该不是想把这堆垃圾扔给我吧？！该死，我怎么就控制不了自己的购买欲呢！"
G["Here for training eh? Just began my training meself, but I would be glad ta teach ye what I can."]="你是来接受训练的吗？我也是刚刚开始学习这方面的知识，但是我很乐意把我所知道的教给你。"
G["Here goes nothin'! Keep your fingers crossed, $n!"]="让我们开始吧！为成功祈祷吧，$n！"
G["Here goes nothing!"]="这里什么都没有！"
G["Here goes nothing. I always loved you, Greely!"]="我要按啦，格瑞里，我一直都是爱你的！"
G["Here goes nothing. My research did not have nice things to say about this Jade Warlord. Be ready for battle."]="但愿能成功。根据我的调查，这个青玉战神不是什么好东西。准备好战斗吧。"
G["Here goes nothing..."]="这里什么人都没有……"
G["Here goes!"]="来了！"
G["Here he comes, $n! Beat him down while I dominate him with the Demon Chain."]="他来了，$n！把他打败，让我用恶魔之链控制住他。"
G["Here he comes, $n! Flying in from the west. Get your weapons ready!"]="$n，他来了！他正从西方飞来。准备好你的武器！"
G["Here here!"]="耶！"
G["Here in Darnassus you will find skilled trainers who have perfected the skills of their chosen class through ages of training and dedication.  I will guide you to one who can become your mentor, you have but to name your chosen path."]="达纳苏斯有许多熟练的训练师，他们拥有多年的训练经验。我会介绍一名导师给你，沿着你选择的道路前进吧。"
G["Here in Ogri'la we have time to contemplate the riddle of steel. But enough of that, how can we help?"]="在奥格瑞拉这里，我们有足够的时间来沉思有关钢铁的秘密。不过这都是另一个话题了……有什么我可以为你效劳的吗？"
G["Here in Ogri'la, we have reached a higher existence.  And we will keep it that way."]="在奥格瑞拉，我们达到了一种更高的生活境界。而且我们会继续保持这种状态。"
G["Here in Valley of the Four Winds, we have our famous Stormstout Brewery. You may have noticed that a rather destructive bunch of Hozu have decided to make that place their own. Their drunken debauchery is known to get a little out of hand. \n \n Sometimes, after a new batch of brew is made, they are known to have beer fights. That's right, gallons upon gallons of brew are wasted and wash away into the Yan-Zhe river. \n \n The beer attracts Emperor Salmon, and they swarm like nothin' I've ever seen. They're a bit easier to catch, too... seein' as they've had a few."]="在四风谷，我们有着著名的风暴烈酒酿造厂。你或许已经注意到了，一群极具破坏力的猢狲想要强占那里。他们都是出了名的酒鬼，向来不懂节制。\n \n有时，当一批新酒酿好后，他们还会搞啤酒大战。没错，大量的美酒就这么浪费掉了，白白流进了炎子江。 \n \n这些美酒引来了帝王鲑鱼。我从没见过那么多帝王鲑鱼挤在一起的景象。而且这些鲑鱼还会变得更好抓……看来它们也喝高了。"
G["Here is a beacon for you, $n.  You must keep it in your possession if you are to find the corrupted items we will need."]="给你一盏塞纳里奥信标，$n。如果你想要找到我们所需的堕落的物品，你就必须留着它。"
G["Here is the Super $R that saved Stoneplow!"]="¡Akí está $gel:la; gran $R que salvó Villarroca!"
G["Here is the book. You must ensure it gets to Caladis Brightspear in Icecrown before the Sunreavers realize what is happening."]="给你书。你要确保赶在夺日者发现这一切之前将书送到卡莱迪斯·亮矛那里。"
G["Here is the first vent! Face the ledge, then jump! The heated air currents will do the rest."]="这里就是第一个热排气口了！现在面对岩壁，跳！剩下的事就交给热气流吧。"
G["Here is what I have. As you can see, things are not what we were expecting.\n\nThese people need help, and I intend to stay and help them.\n\nWe would stand a much better chance with your help if you are willing to stay as well."]="情况是这样的。如你所见，事情有些出乎我们的预料。\n\n这些人需要帮助，而我打算留下来帮助他们。\n\n如果你也愿意留下来，在你的帮助下，问题会变得更加容易解决。"
G["Here is what the pandaren do know: By massacring our people, by slaughtering tens of thousands of pandaren, generation after generation, they have taught us the value of life. A precious but fleeting gift. Easily snuffed out... in an instant."]="我们熊猫人只知道——螳螂妖屠杀我们的族人，一代又一代地杀害了无数的熊猫人，它们让我们懂得了生命的价值。人生苦短，稍纵即逝，一不留神……灰飞烟灭。"
G["Here is where I sacrificed everything to free my father. Now I come to destroy it..."]="就在这里，我放弃了一切，只为换取父亲的自由。如今，我要亲手摧毁它……"
G["Here is where I sacrificied everything to free my father. Now I come to destroy it..."]="就在这里，我放弃了一切，只为换取父亲的自由。如今，我要亲手摧毁它……"
G["Here is your bread sir."]="您的面包，大人。"
G["Here is your fortune, $n.  May it serve you well."]="$n，这是你的塔罗牌。愿你能好好利用它。"
G["Here is your share."]="这是你的那份。"
G["Here it comes!"]="它来了！"
G["Here it comes, fall back!"]="它来了，退后！"
G["Here it comes.  Stand ready."]="它来了。做好准备。"
G["Here it comes..."]="就要来了……"
G["Here it comes: TIGER WIND!"]="看招：风从虎！"
G["Here it is -- the Tanaris desert.  Funny how an inhospitable place like this looks better than a lush jungle once you've been trapped in it forever."]="就是这儿——塔纳利斯沙漠。这样荒凉的地方比难以走出的绿色丛林看起来好多了，这可真有意思。"
G["Here it is! This is what we've been looking for!"]="在这里！这就是我们一直寻找的东西！"
G["Here it is: the Stormstout Brewery."]="这儿就是：风暴烈酒酿造厂。"
G["Here kitty kitty."]="过来，小猫咪。"
G["Here lie our stores of blight crystal, without which our project would be impossible."]="这些是我们储藏的荒芜水晶。没有水晶，我们的计划就不可能成功。"
G["Here lie the remains of Weeder Greenthumb, one of Watcher Jhang's druid companions.  By all appearances he was killed quick and clean while trying to make his escape from the Slave Pens."]="这里躺着除草者格林萨姆的遗体，他是观察者杰哈恩的德鲁伊同伴。显然，当他想要逃出奴隶围栏时，他被迅速杀害了。"
G["Here lies the broken form of poor Naturalist Bite.  His zeal for knowledge was only matched in ferocity by the manner of his death."]="这里躺着可怜的博学者拜特的遗体。他对知识的热情给他带来的只有死亡的结局。"
G["Here lies the corpse of one of the Steeljaw's caravan guards."]="这里躺着一具钢腭的车队卫兵的尸体。"
G["Here lies the corpse of one of the Steeljaw's caravan workers."]="这里躺着一具钢腭的车队工人的尸体。"
G["Here on Pandaria, I see a land that the Horde deserves. We will take it for our own, and if anyone stands in our way, mogu or Alliance, we will raze them to the ground."]="潘达利亚，是属于部落的应许之地。我们必须得到它，要是谁想螳臂当车，无论是魔古族还是联盟，都将被我们踩在脚下。"
G["Here she comes!"]="她来了！"
G["Here she comes, boss!"]="她来了，老大！"
G["Here she comes. Oh, foul temptress of the sea..."]="她来了。哦，海洋的邪恶荡妇……"
G["Here she is, $n... the coffer of promise!"]="找到她了，$n……应许约柜！"
G["Here the sparktouched have been fighting the wolvar for days, yet no other oralces have come to their aid... does that seem right to you?"]="灵鳍鳄鱼人和狼獾人交战已经有段日子了，但至今没有其他神谕者前来帮忙……你觉得这件事正常吗？"
G["Here there is only fire, brimstone, and death."]="这里只有火焰，硫磺，还有死亡。"
G["Here they are! These are beautiful, $n. The Kirin Tor Offensive is in your debt."]="终于送来了！这些胡萝卜很不错，$n。肯瑞托远征军欠你一份人情。"
G["Here they are. See, told you I could find anyone or anything."]="他们在这儿呢。看见了吧，我早就说了，不管是谁，不管是什么东西，我都能找得到。"
G["Here they come again!  Stand ready!"]="他们又来了！准备！"
G["Here they come!"]="他们来了！"
G["Here they come! Defend yourselves!"]="注意！准备战斗！"
G["Here they come! HOLD FAST!"]="他们攻过来了！坚守阵地！"
G["Here they come! Protect the catapult at all costs!"]="他们来了！不惜一切代价保护投石车！"
G["Here they come, Halters! Get ready!"]="他们来了，哈特斯！做好准备！"
G["Here they come, yes, yes. You see how easy it is to make friends here?"]="它们都在这儿，是的，就这样。你看，在这儿交朋友是不是很简单？"
G["Here they come."]="他们来了。"
G["Here they come..."]="它们来了……"
G["Here to help with the disturbances?"]="你是来帮忙平息混乱的？"
G["Here to join in on the fun, I see!"]="我看出来了，这里会有很多乐趣的！"
G["Here to learn about potions? I've got plenty to teach you. I might be dead, but I haven't lost my brains. Yet."]="你是来学习配制药水的？我能传授给你很多知识。虽然我已年老力衰，但脑子还是管用的。"
G["Here to learn how to wield a new weapon, or just to waste my time?"]="到这儿是学习如何使用新武器，还是来浪费我时间的？"
G["Here to learn? Very well. I suppose you can't cause our allies much harm if I teach you. Just as long as you actually do manage to harm our enemies."]="到这儿来学习的吗？很好。我想要是我教你的话，你不会对我们的联盟造成太多的伤害。只要你一心对付我们的敌人。"
G["Here to visit the family?  Die, fool!"]="你是来这里拜访我的家族的吗？去死吧，蠢货！"
G["Here we are - the ancient seat of pandaren wisdom.\n\nShall we begin?"]="我们到了——古老的熊猫人智慧宝库。\n\n我们开始吧？"
G["Here we are in the land down under.\n\nIt is just as beautiful as the stories I was told as a cub on the Wandering Isle. Though the fish could be larger."]="我们已经踏上了南方大陆的土地。\n\n这里就跟我小时候在迷踪岛上听过故事里一样美丽。只是这里的鱼个头更大。"
G["Here we are once again, ladies and gentlemen. The epic struggle between life and death in the Amphitheater of Anguish! For this round we have $n versus the hulking jormungar, Yg... Yggd? Yggdoze? Who comes up with these names?! $n versus big worm!"]="女士们先生们，我们又见面啦。痛苦斗兽场的生死大战即将拉开帷幕！这一轮，将由$n对阵庞大的冰虫伊戈……伊戈达？伊戈杜斯？这名字是谁起的？！好吧，由$n对阵大虫子！"
G["Here we are once again, ladies and gentlemen. The epic struggle between life and death in the Crucible of Carnage! For this round we have $n versus... a really fat ogre? Wait, seriously?! That's all we could come up with on short notice? What am I paying you for?"]="女士们，先生们，我们共聚在杀戮熔炉，再次见证生与死的伟大战斗！在这一轮中，我们将看到$n与……一个真正的肥食人魔对战？等等，这是真的？！我们就只能看到这个？我付钱给你是为了什么？"
G["Here we are!"]="我们到了！"
G["Here we are!  Fire at will!"]="到了！任意开火！"
G["Here we are, FINALLY setting foot in our ancestral home, for the first time in our lives, and you want to stop and rest by a PIG FARM?"]="我们好不容易才回到故土，有生以来第一次踏上这片土地，你难道只想在养猪场里休息吗？"
G["Here we are, at the precipice of war. Signal to me when your troops are in order and I will issue the command to attack."]="我们已经站在了战争的悬崖边上。当你的部队准备好之后，就给我发信号吧，然后我就会下达进攻的指令。"
G["Here we are, safe and... OH NO! We've been double-crossed!"]="我们来了，一切平安……哦，不！我们被骗了！"
G["Here we are, the home of Niuzao, the Black Ox. He is the patron spirit of Pandaren fortitude, the only celestial who chooses to live beyond the wall."]="我们到了，玄牛砮皂的家园。他象征着潘达利亚的坚忍精神，是唯一住在长城之外的至尊天神。"
G["Here we are."]="我们到了。"
G["Here we are.  Get ready for your training, little one.  I recommend you forget about that worthless $r $c and start thinking about your duties here in Zul'Gurub."]="Ya eh'tamos. Prepárate pa' tu inh'trucción pequeña. Recomiendo que olvides a $gese:esa; $r $c inútil y te centres en tus deberes aquí, en Zul'Gurub."
G["Here we are. Climb aboard, friend."]="我们到了。上来吧，朋友。"
G["Here we are. See ya!"]="我们到了。再见！"
G["Here we are. There's no time to waste."]="我们到了。没时间可以浪费了。"
G["Here we are... Keep them off me while I open the tan-chao, $p!"]="好了……别让他们靠近我，$p！我来开启接天桥。"
G["Here we feed new silkworm larvae until they are ready to cocoon themselves."]="我们在这里饲养新生的幼蚕，直到它们能够吐丝作茧。"
G["Here we flap again!"]="我们又遇上了！"
G["Here we go - keep those things off of me while I work!"]="开始吧——在我工作的时候，别让那些东西碰我！"
G["Here we go again..."]="又开始了……"
G["Here we go!"]="我们走！"
G["Here we go!  Hold on tight -- there's rough wind ahead!"]="来吧！坐稳啦——前面有强气流！"
G["Here we go! Now this should only take a moment..."]="我们走！这下应该用不了多少时间了……"
G["Here we go, $gbub:toots;. Watch how things get done."]="好吧，$g小子:姑娘;，来让我们好好看看。"
G["Here we go, bunky. One Crafty's Ultra-Advanced Proto-Typical Shortening Blaster at your service!"]="伙计，好啦。这台超级缩小射线枪原型机可供使用啦！"
G["Here we go, people.  Watch your backs..."]="我们走吧，伙计们，路上要格外小心……"
G["Here we go, this should do it."]="好了，这应该行得通。"
G["Here we go."]="我们走。"
G["Here we go. Do try to keep yourselves alive until the end."]="我们走吧。千万别把自己的命给搭上。"
G["Here we go. Hold on tight!"]="我们出发。抓紧！"
G["Here we go. Nobody here will question it if the Prince wants to glance through some files."]="我们走。殿下想要看些文件，这个理由应该不会引起任何人的怀疑。"
G["Here we go..."]="好了……"
G["Here we have Stormwind Keep. Built upon the ruins of Stormwind Castle, which was destroyed by the Horde in the first Great War."]="现在我们看到的是暴风要塞。在第一次兽人战争中，暴风城堡被部落夷为平地，后来人们在废墟上重建了暴风要塞。"
G["Here we have the Cathedral of Light, the center of spiritual enlightenment here in Stormwind."]="现在大家看到的是光明大教堂，暴风城的精神和宗教中心。"
G["Here we practice fire fighting techniques."]="我们在这里练习灭火技术。"
G["Here we practice fire fighting techniques.  Honor to the horde!"]="我们是来练习灭火技术的。荣耀归于部落！"
G["Here we practice fire fighting techniques.  Power to the Forsaken!"]="这里是练习灭火技术的地方，为了被遗忘者！"
G["Here we will draw the attention of Ragnaros' army so that others might strike at the heart of his realm."]="我们要吸引拉格纳罗斯军队的注意，好让其他人直捣火焰王国的腹地。"
G["Here we will hold firm against the onslaught of the elements."]="我们将在此坚守，抵挡元素大军的进攻。"
G["Here ya go, friend! Icehammer is right inside that vrykul building! Give 'em hell!"]="我们到啦！冰锤就在那座维库人建筑物中！将他们统统送进地狱吧！"
G["Here you are, $n."]="给你，$n。"
G["Here you are, $n.\n\nDo be more careful, won't you?"]="$n，给。\n\n小心点，好吗？"
G["Here you are, $n.\n\nNow please, return your focus to the task at hand...."]="给，$n。\n\n麻烦你集中精神，完成任务……"
G["Here you are, Relara.  Drink this..."]="蕾拉，喝了它 ……"
G["Here you are, Relara.  Take this..."]="给你，蕾拉。喝下这个……"
G["Here you go, $g lad : lass;. Make 'em count!"]="Aquí tienes, $gchico:chica;. ¡Haz que valga la pena!"
G["Here you go, Su-Shi. You're my best friend!"]="给，苏石。你是我最好的朋友！"
G["Here you go, girls! Courtesy of $p!"]="请用吧，姑娘们！$p请的！"
G["Here you go."]="给你。"
G["Here you go. Good luck!"]="你已经到了。祝你好运！"
G["Here you go. Keep the report safe, $p. The sunwalkers are moving west as well.\n\nI'm going to stay here and help these people. We would stand a better chance if you stay and help us out."]="拿去吧。保护好报告，$p。那些烈日行者也在向西移动。\n\n我要留在这里帮助这些人。如果你能留下来帮我们的话，那我们获胜的机会就更大一些了。"
G["Here you see the Darkmoon Deathmatch pit.  Do you possess the power and will to best all comers and take the pit fighter's prize?\nBouts begin at midnight and every three hours thereafter."]="Aquí está la arena del combate a muerte de la Feria de la Luna Negra. ¿Tienes el poder y la voluntad para ganar a los participantes y conseguir el premio de los combatientes?\n\nLos ataques comenzarán a media noche y después, cada tres horas."
G["Here yous go. My best pair and I'm giving them to ya cheap!\n\nYous gonna look sharp in them!"]="好吧，我以优惠的价格把我最好的一副遮阳镜卖给你！\n\n它一定会让你爱不释手的！"
G["Here!"]="这里！"
G["Here!  A blood stain.  We're going the right way."]="这儿！一块血迹。我们的方向是正确的。"
G["Here! Here! I'll drink to that!"]="干杯！"
G["Here! Into the smoke!"]="过来！到烟雾里来！"
G["Here! My champion arrives!"]="啊！我的勇士来了！"
G["Here! Stop da boat here."]="到了！在这儿停船。"
G["Here! Stop the boats here."]="这里！把船停下。"
G["Here! The embodiment of the fear that you've conquered. May it now strike terror into the hearts of your enemies!"]="看！它就是你所战胜的恐惧实体。愿它将恐惧注入你敌人的体内！"
G["Here's a fine one for you.  Take good care of him."]="这是一等一的好马呀。你要好好照顾它。"
G["Here's a fun fact: Mogujia translates roughly as 'Home of the Mogu'. Don't let that fool you, though. It's not their only home. It's just the name people have given this place. I did some research and found out that the original name for this area was Chow Keep. That's weird. Must just be a coincidence that farmer Chow also has the same name."]="Aquí tienes un dato curioso: Mogujia más o menos quiere decir \"hogar de los mogu\". Pero que no te confunda ese nombre. No es su único hogar. Es el nombre que le han dado algunos a este lugar. He indagado un poco y he descubierto que el nombre original de esta zona era Fortaleza Tallarín. Qué raro. Debe de ser una coincidencia que se llame igual que el granjero Tallarín."
G["Here's a gold, buy yourself something nice."]="给，你可以用这枚金币买给自己想要的东西。"
G["Here's a good one, why do watermelons have water in them?"]="我有个好问题，为什么西瓜里面有水？"
G["Here's a kiss for good luck, I think you're going to need it."]="这是一个好运之吻，相信会对你有所帮助。"
G["Here's a little somethin' extra since I'll be away."]="因为我就要离开了，所以准备了这么一点额外的东西。"
G["Here's a little something something you're gonna love..."]="我这里有些你会喜欢的东西……"
G["Here's a real surprise for you. What do you suppose they're celebrating? And what do you think would be the proper drink to mark the occasion?"]="我要给你一个惊喜。你猜他们正在庆祝什么？你认为庆祝这个节日，喝什么比较合适呢？"
G["Here's a singing telegram for $n: Roses are red, violets are blue, I will kill any $R I see, including you!"]="Aquí hay un telegrama cantado para $n: ¡En tanto que de rosa y azucena, mataré a $gtodo:toda; $r y a ti también!"
G["Here's a tip from one farmer to another. There are lots of upgrades to buy at Halfhill Market. Gina Mudclaw sells tools, and Merchant Greenfield sells seeds."]="让同是农夫的我给你个建议。在半山市集里可以买到各种各样的升级用品。吉娜·泥爪出售工具，商人绿野贩卖种子。"
G["Here's another load for ya!"]="这里还有！"
G["Here's my body, fit and pure!  Now, your blackened souls I'll cure!"]="我的躯体健壮而纯洁！现在，让我来治愈你们这帮阴暗的灵魂吧。"
G["Here's my list, Keldric. The usual stuff."]="这是我的清单，凯德雷克。都是些常用的原料。"
G["Here's our challenger. Today, we welcome a Rank 4 $r $c, $n!"]="$gNuestro:Nuestra; combatiente de hoy es $gun:una; $r $c de rango 4... ¡$n!"
G["Here's some more Weed-B-Gone!"]="这儿还有一些多余的除草剂！"
G["Here's some more water."]="还要更多的水。"
G["Here's some of that moolah back that I took from you!"]="我要用你的钱来砸死你！"
G["Here's some water, Anren. Let's get you out of this cave."]="喝点水，安伦。我们快离开这个洞穴吧。"
G["Here's something you might find interesting."]="这里有些你或许会感兴趣的东西。"
G["Here's the bigger question: Can principles win a war?"]="更大的问题是：原则能赢得战争吗？"
G["Here's the eastern mountain wall!  I'm cutting towards the south now; try and keep up.  We're not out of the thick of it yet!"]="这是东部的山墙！我现在正向南推进；跟紧了。我们还不会从最危险的地方撤离！"
G["Here's the head and the hat, Fleet Master."]="这是头颅和帽子，舰队指挥官。"
G["Here's the head. A perfect fit, too."]="头在这儿。装起来也刚刚好。"
G["Here's the key.  Let's go."]="钥匙在这儿。我们走。"
G["Here's the path out of Un'Goro!  We made it!  All we have to worry about is the Tanaris desert now."]="这就是离开安戈洛的路！我们做到了！现在我们所担心的就是塔纳利斯沙漠了。"
G["Here's the report, $n. Oh! Make sure you mention my idea with the bombs. I have it lined out in the report."]="报告在这里，$n。哦！记得一定要提炸弹是我的主意哦，我在报告里标出了这一点。"
G["Here's the tome our representative brought from Wyrmrest. Get this to Myralion Sunblaze immediately."]="这是我们的使者从龙眠神殿带回来的宝典。立刻将它带给麦雷昂·阳炎。"
G["Here's to gold in our pockets!"]="为我们口袋里的金币干杯！"
G["Here's to hoping he never returns. Maybe he'll drown?"]="现在只能希望他永远不要回来了。也许他会淹死？"
G["Here's to hoping not all of Outland is as barren as this region.  This is quite a change from the green grasslands and forests of Eversong."]="希望外域不全都是像这个区域那么荒芜。这里和永歌森林的密林绿草反差真大。"
G["Here's to the Alliance!"]="为联盟干杯！"
G["Here's to the Horde!"]="为部落干杯！"
G["Here's to you!  Here's to me!  May we never disagree.\n\nBut if we do... BLAST YOU!  Here's to me."]="你一杯！我一杯！愿我们默契永相随。\n\n可要是没了默契……那你就去死吧！我再来一杯。"
G["Here's to you, Dread Captain! Make me a pirate for the day."]="祝你健康，恐怖船长！今天让我也尝尝当海盗的滋味吧！"
G["Here's what's left of the message we found, $n. Can you make any sense of it?"]="$n，这就是我们找到的密信残片。你能看懂吗？"
G["Here's where Taldan served his last drink."]="这里是塔尔丹送上最后一杯饮料的地方。"
G["Here's your escape device."]="这是你的逃生设备。"
G["Here's your kodo, Torp!"]="这是你的科多兽，托普！"
G["Here, $n.  Take a chest of containment coffers and a cantation of manifestation.  You will need them for your mission."]="过来，$n。拿一根显形卷轴以及一盒封灵箱。你需要使用这些东西才能完成任务。"
G["Here, $p, catch!"]="¡Eh, $n, cógelo!"
G["Here, Bessy, enjoy this apple while I get you ready."]="嗨，贝希，在我做准备工作的时候，你可以尝尝这只苹果。"
G["Here, I got you this."]="给，我为你弄到了。"
G["Here, I made a Billowing Fuel Sample.  It's really smoky!"]="看这儿，我做成了一份巨浪燃料样本。这烟可真呛人！"
G["Here, I made a Perduring Fuel Sample.  What do you think?"]="看这儿，我做成了一份持久燃料样本。你觉得怎么样？"
G["Here, I made a Promising Fuel Sample.  Three parts hammerhead and two parts remora."]="看这儿，我做成了一份可靠的燃料样本。锤头鲨鱼油和鮣魚油的比例是三比二。"
G["Here, I made a Quick-Burning Fuel Sample.  Is this good enough?"]="看这儿，我做成了一份快速燃烧的燃料样本。达到标准了吗？"
G["Here, I made a Smoky Fuel Sample.  Pretty, isn't it?"]="看这儿，我做成了一份浓烟燃料样本。很漂亮，是吧？"
G["Here, I made an Anemic Fuel Sample.  It seems... weak."]="看这儿，我做成了一份贫油样本。它看上去……真不带劲儿。"
G["Here, I made an Atomic Fuel Sample.  It seems to be a little too hot."]="看这儿，我做成了一份原子燃料样本。它看起来有点儿过热了。"
G["Here, I need to unload some toxic assets!"]="嗨，我需要释放一些有毒资产！"
G["Here, I stealed this from little dwarf."]="给，这是我从小矮人那里偷来的。"
G["Here, I'd like to give you this token of my love."]="来，我送你一件象征我的爱情的小东西。"
G["Here, I've got some spare Weed-B-Gone. This should help."]="我还有一些除草剂。可能有用。"
G["Here, Master Nemos, this is the drawing I was talking about."]="这里，尼莫斯，这就是我和你说的图样。"
G["Here, beastie. Come to Hemet!"]="来吧，野兽！来跟赫米特玩玩！"
G["Here, da self-righteous crusaders be standin' in da way of our goal. Dey will fall!"]="自以为是的北伐军挡住了我们前进的道路。他们注定会失败！"
G["Here, drink this."]="过来，把这个喝下去。"
G["Here, eat this! It's a special chocolate rock."]="给，把这个吃了！这是一种特殊的巧克力石头。"
G["Here, eat this, our enemies shall be delighted."]="吃吧，我们的敌人会很高兴的。"
G["Here, fishie fishie..."]="过来，小乖鱼儿……"
G["Here, girl. I've got one last meal for you before Limpy Joe's killer does us in!"]="宝贝，杀死乔伊的凶手很快就要对我们下手了，让我最后再喂你一次吧。"
G["Here, kitty kitty....."]="这里这里，小猫咪……"
G["Here, on the very borders of his domain, you will experience power you could have never imagined!"]="在这里，在最靠近他领地的地方，你可以亲身体会到这强大得无以复加的力量！"
G["Here, take these supplies. You'll need them for your missions."]="给，拿上这些补给品吧。你在任务中会用得上。"
G["Here, take this horse over to your stable.  Tell Ronald, \"Hello.\""]="Toma, lleva a este caballo a tu establo. Dile \"hola\" a Ronald."
G["Here, take this! It'll help you against any swarms."]="给！它能帮你对付虫子。"
G["Here, there is mention of an Old God. \"Y'Shaarj.\" A beast with seven heads, who breathed darkness. I suspect that thing was the source of the sha that haunts Pandaria to this day."]="Aquí se habla de un dios antiguo, \"Y'Shaarj\". Una bestia de siete cabezas que exhalaba oscuridad. Creo que es el origen de los sha que a día de hoy siguen asolando Pandaria."
G["Here, this fragment speaks of \"The Winged Legions of Y'Shaarj.\" Servants of an Old God? Could this mean the mantid?"]="Este fragmento habla de \"las legiones aladas de Y'Shaarj\". ¿Sirvientes de un dios antiguo? ¿Se referirá a los mántides?"
G["Here, troll... a gift!"]="嗨，巨魔……这是给你的礼物！"
G["Here, warrior. Eat this."]="给，战士。吃掉它。"
G["Here, we are even more exposed than before, $r.\n\nWe must find safe shelter soon!"]="这地方让我们比先前更加暴露了，$r。\n\n我们必须尽快找到安全的藏身处！"
G["Here, we will snatch up the Dragon Soul before it is lost to the mists of time."]="在这里，我们要趁巨龙之魂失落于时间的迷雾之前将它夺回。"
G["Here, what's this?"]="这是什么？"
G["Here, you can have dwarf's things."]="给，这是矮人的东西。"
G["Here, you can scrape venom off Lunk's tummy."]="你可以从隆克的肚子上把毒液刮下来。"
G["Here, you hold little carrot while you stand on big carrot!"]="在这儿，你站在大胡萝卜上，再拿着小胡萝卜！"
G["Here, you'll find several of us who have mastered the art of various crafts.  If you need any supplies along your journey, they can probably help."]="你在这里可以找到几位精通各类手艺的匠师。要是你在旅途中需要任何补给品，可以去他们那里采购。"
G["Here... try this."]="来……尝尝这个吧。"
G["Here: Use these darts to take down as many archers as you can."]="给，用这些飞镖尽量多打倒一些弓箭手。"
G["Hermesius come quick! I have an urgent delivery that must be taken to the human admiral of the Alliance expedition."]="赫米修斯，快点过来！我有个非常紧急的邮件，必须交给联盟远征军的人类上将。"
G["Hermesius, has my package from the Exodar arrived yet? It's been over a week."]="赫米修斯，有从埃索达寄给我的包裹吗？已经一个多星期了。"
G["Hero, I am honored."]="尊贵的英雄。"
G["Hero, I have urgent business with Corporal Splithoof."]="英雄，我有紧急的事情要和桑德·裂蹄商讨。"
G["Hero, it will be up to you to defeat the Storm Lord Nalak. You will have to marshal a small army!"]="英雄，击败暴风领主纳拉克就靠你了。你得集结一支小部队。"
G["Hero, you are an inspiration!"]="英雄，你是一个榜样！"
G["Hero, you have served the Horde nobly across many campaigns. I feel I can take you into confidence."]="英雄，你历经战火，对部落忠心耿耿。我想我可以信任你。"
G["Hero, you must defeat the Dark Summoner's minions in order to weaken his protective magic.  Until then he will be invulnerable."]="英雄，你必须击败黑暗召唤师的爪牙才能削弱他的防护魔法。在此之前，他是免疫伤害的。"
G["Hero... strike now! Use your newfound power to FINISH HIM."]="英雄——攻击！使用你新获得的力量去消灭他。"
G["Heroes never die, $n."]="Los héroes nunca mueren."
G["Heroes of Azeroth"]="艾泽拉斯英雄传"
G["Heroes of the Alliance, attack!"]="联盟的英雄们，进攻！"
G["Heroes of the Alliance, your King calls! Gather behind me at the entrance to the sewers!"]="联盟的英雄们，国王在召唤！随我攻入下水道的入口吧！"
G["Heroes of the Brood? C'Thun must be banished! We can assist you, mortal!"]="龙类指派的英雄？必须除掉克苏恩！我们可以帮助你，凡人！"
G["Heroes of the Horde! Are you ready to create history?"]="部落的英雄们！你们准备好创造历史了吗？"
G["Heroes of your stature should not waste their talents in Alterac Valley, $n."]="像你这样伟大的英雄不应该把才能埋没在奥特兰克山谷里，$n。"
G["Heroes!  My power wanes...."]="英雄们！我的力量消褪了……"
G["Heroes! He is bound. Finish him!"]="英雄们！他被束缚了！解决他！"
G["Heroes! We have been sent by Nozdormu! Quickly, on our backs, we must get you to the Dragon Soul!"]="英雄们！是诺兹多姆派我们来的！快上来，我们要把你们带到巨龙之魂那儿！"
G["Heroes! We will hold off the undead as long as we can, even to our dying breath. Deal with the Scourgelord!"]="英雄们！我们就算拼了性命，也会挡住那些亡灵。去消灭天灾领主吧！"
G["Heroes! You're alive. I brought help."]="英雄们，你们还好吗？援军来了。"
G["Heroes, I know this is the real Hogger. I see my eye hanging from his belt. The implications of what has taken place down here are very dark indeed. His power is...beyond our understanding..."]="英雄们，我知道他是真正的霍格。我看到我的眼睛就挂在他的腰带上。那其中包含着一段非常黑暗的往事。他的力量……已经超出了我们的理解范畴……"
G["Heroes, I salute you. There's something right foul in these chambers below the city."]="英雄们，向你们致敬。这些地下大厅里有着某种非常邪恶的东西。"
G["Heroes, have you succeeded in acquiring the Focusing Iris?"]="英雄们，你们有没有拿到聚焦之虹？"
G["Heroes, lend me your aid. I... I cannot hold them off much longer. You must heal my wounds!"]="英雄们，请快些帮助我，我……我快要抵挡不住他们了。请治疗我的伤口！"
G["Heroes, take the towers, turn the guns onto that proto-drake, and blast it from the sky!"]="英雄们，占领那些塔楼，把枪口对准那条始祖龙，把它打下来！"
G["Heroes, the world owes you a great debt."]="英雄们，这个世界欠你们太多了。"
G["Heroes, this burden falls to you once again."]="英雄们，这个重担又落到你们的肩上了。"
G["Heroes, to me!"]="英雄们，到我这来！"
G["Heroes, we have the Dragon Soul. The Aspects await us within Wyrmrest. Hurry -  come with me!"]="英雄们，我们得到了巨龙之魂。守护巨龙在神殿里等着我们。快——跟我来！"
G["Heroes, we must place this burden on your shoulders once again.  You must protect us from Deathwing's forces while we imbue the Soul with the powers of the great Aspects of Azeroth."]="英雄们，这个重担又落到你们的肩上了。我们会将守护巨龙的力量灌注到巨龙之魂中，在此期间，你们必须保护我们。"
G["Heroes, ye must fight yer way to a clear extraction point within Icecrown. We'll try an' rendezvous on the ramparts!"]="英雄们，你们必须尽快在冰冠堡垒内部夺取一个立足点。我们在城墙上汇合！"
G["Heroes, you are not alone in this dark place!"]="英雄们，你们并非在这黑暗之地孤军奋战！"
G["Heroes, you must kill Godfrey! I'll make sure nothing interferes!"]="英雄们，你们必须消灭高弗雷！我会掩护你们，确保你们不受干扰！"
G["Heroes. Port over to the docks and take out their shore defenses. Put a stop to this bloodshed."]="英雄们。快传送到码头，摧毁他们的海防工事，阻止这场杀戮。"
G["Heur has studied the local flora since our landing. He will be able to guide you. You can find him working with Daedal on the western edge of Azure Watch."]="自从我们降落以后，赫罗就研究起了这里的植物，他会指导你的。你可以在碧蓝岗哨的西部边缘发现他正在和丹达尔一起工作。"
G["Hewwo."]="你好。"
G["Hex dem good."]="妖术真带劲。"
G["Hexascrub, let me see that merciless one again."]="“洗衣桶”，让我再看看那个无悯者。"
G["Hexascrub, right?  Of course."]="洗衣桶，对吧？当然。"
G["Hexascrub, you elekk's trunk? You haven't got a pot of glue!"]="“洗衣桶”，你长了个雷象的长鼻子？你连黏胶都没有！"
G["Hey $Gbrother:sister;! You come to ask Jogu for wishdom?"]="你好啊$G兄弟:姐妹;！你是来向贾古请教问题的？"
G["Hey $c, fancy meeting you here! Were you sent to seek the young Prince, too?"]="嘿，$c，很高兴在这见到你！你也是被派去寻找小王子的？"
G["Hey $c, if you've lost a key I might be able to help you out."]="嘿，$c。如果你弄丢了钥匙，我或许能帮上忙。"
G["Hey $c, you looking to go to Stormwind? Travel fast with one of my portals! If you ain't got the commissions, you'll have to get there on your own."]="嘿$c，你想要去暴风城？我的传送门最便捷！但如果你没有委任状的话，你就只能自己去那儿了。"
G["Hey $g buddy:ma'am;, do you think you could give me a hand with something? I'm really in dire straits here..."]="Oye $g amigo:señora;, ¿crees que podrías ayudarme con algo? Estoy en un apuro muy serio aquí..."
G["Hey $gman:woman;, I'm just tryin' to get my slice of the pie."]="嗨，$g小伙子:姑娘;我正努力要拿到我的那一份。"
G["Hey $n!  Don't forget to grab a crate, a manual and a command stick!"]="嘿，$n！不要忘了去拿一只箱子，还有操作手册和指挥棒！"
G["Hey $n! Over here. We need you!"]="嘿$n！到这儿来。我们需要你！"
G["Hey $n, I been thinkin' that your farm needs some chickens. What do you think?"]="嘿，$n，我一直在想你的农场是否需要一些小鸡。你认为呢？"
G["Hey $n, I'm in the middle of something right now. I need to concentrate!"]="嘿，$n，我现在正忙着呢。我得集中精神！"
G["Hey $n, didya know that all kinds of things can happen to your plants? If you don't know how to deal with something, just ask me!"]="嘿，$n。你知道植物在生长过程中会遇到各种各样的突发情况吗？要是你有任何解决不了的难题，就来问我吧！"
G["Hey $n, we don't have to tell my father about that little ambush. If he finds out about an attempt on my life, he'd never allow me out of that keep..."]="嘿$n，别让那次小伏击的事传到我父亲耳朵里。要是他发现我竟敢冒这种险，我就再也别想踏出要塞一步……"
G["Hey $n, you're here!  These guys came out of nowhere!  Help me out while I catch my breath."]="嘿，$n，你也来了！这些家伙都是突然冒出来的！快来帮帮我，让我喘口气！"
G["Hey $p! This way to Morning Breeze Village."]="嘿，$p！晨息村往这儿走。"
G["Hey $p, we'll work faster if we have plenty of metal to work with. The local Krasari Iron Ore will do fine."]="嘿$p，如果能帮我们找到足够的金属，我们的工作效率能提高不少。这附近的卡桑利铁矿石就不错。"
G["Hey $p? I don't think I want to try Bottletoads."]="嘿，$p？我可不想尝尝蛤蟆酱。"
G["Hey $r, buddy to buddy, I'll let you in on a secret. You want big vegetables? You gotta use fertilizer.\n\nAnd you know who's got the best fertilizer in the Valley? Me!"]="嘿，$r，看在哥们的情分上，我要跟你说个秘密。你想种出大个头的蔬菜吗？你得用肥料。\n\n那你知道谷里谁的肥料最好吗？我！"
G["Hey $r, don't try anything funny! I've got several wands up my sleeves and I'm not afraid to use them!"]="嘿，$r，别没事找事！我袖子里藏着好几把魔杖，我可不介意把它们对准你！"
G["Hey $r, what do you make of this place?"]="嘿，$r，你对这地方了解多少？"
G["Hey $r. Seeing any profit lately?"]="嗨，$r。最近有什么赚钱的买卖吗？"
G["Hey - wait for me! I don't like goons, either."]="嘿——等等我！我也讨厌那些恶棍。"
G["Hey Baron, go long!"]="嘿财主，再来点儿！"
G["Hey Bly!  Bilgewizzle wants his divino-matic rod back!"]="嘿，布莱！比格维兹想要要回他的探水棒！"
G["Hey Celidh!  Do you have any pets you want me to take over to the stable?"]="嗨，塞莉德！你有宠物要寄放进兽栏吗？"
G["Hey Chee Chee, would you like to be my farm hand?"]="嘿，吱吱，愿意到我的农场来做帮手吗？"
G["Hey Chef! I gotta ask you...are we friends?"]="嘿，大厨！我想问你下……我们是朋友吧？"
G["Hey Farmer Yoon!"]="你好，农夫老愚！"
G["Hey Fish, how'd you like to be my partner at the farm?"]="嘿，玉儿，愿意做我农场的合伙人吗？"
G["Hey Fizzer, I ever tell you the time I was riding through the canals and some goblins in shredder suits tried to ambush me?"]="嘿，我说，我有没有跟你说过，那天当我骑马穿过运河的时候，有一些驾驶着伐木机的地精想要伏击我？"
G["Hey Gina! Didn't expect a visit from you."]="嘿，吉娜！真是稀客啊。"
G["Hey Gorrok, which girl do you like? Shokia or Kiryn?"]="嘿，格罗克，你喜欢哪个姑娘？夏琪亚还是琪麟？"
G["Hey Hermesius, do I have any new mail?"]="嘿，赫米修斯，有什么新邮件给我吗？"
G["Hey Hey Hey!  I am here to promote a fabulous fishing tournament in Stranglethorn but you need to be tough enough to survive there and have enough skill in fishing to fish those waters.\n\nCome back later when you are more qualified!"]="¡Eh, eh, eh! Estoy aquí para promocionar un fabuloso torneo de pesca en Tuercespina, pero necesitas ser lo suficientemente $gduro:dura; como para sobrevivir allí y tener la suficiente habilidad como para pescar en esas aguas.\n\n¡Vuelve más tarde cuando estés más $gcapacitado:capacitada;!"
G["Hey Hornizz!  I'm back!  And there are some people behind me who helped me out of a jam."]="嗨，霍恩尼兹！我回来了！有些好心人帮我脱离了困境。"
G["Hey Jangdor - can you teach me how to make Wild Leather Boots again?"]="嘿，杉多尔——你能再教我一下如何制作蛮皮战靴吗？"
G["Hey Jangdor - can you teach me how to make Wild Leather Leggings again?"]="嘿，杉多尔——你能再教我一下如何制作蛮皮护腿吗？"
G["Hey Jangdor - can you teach me how to make Wild Leather Shoulders again?"]="嘿，杉多尔——你能再教我一下如何制作蛮皮护肩吗？"
G["Hey Jangdor - can you teach me how to make a Wild Leather Cloak?"]="嘿，杉多尔——你能再教我一下如何制作蛮皮披风吗？"
G["Hey Jangdor - can you teach me how to make a Wild Leather Helmet again?"]="嘿，杉多尔——你能再教我一下如何制作蛮皮头盔吗？"
G["Hey Jangdor - can you teach me how to make a Wild Leather Vest again?"]="嘿，杉多尔——你能再教我一下如何制作蛮皮外衣吗？"
G["Hey Jogu, how'd you like to move into the pond at Sunsong Ranch?"]="嘿，贾古，你愿不愿意搬到日歌农场的池塘去？"
G["Hey Jogu, what's the word on tomorrow's crops?"]="嘿，贾古，明天的收成会怎么样啊？"
G["Hey Knot - I'm a Leatherworker.  Think you could teach me how to make the ogre suit?"]="你好，诺特——我是制皮师。你能教我怎么制作食人魔套装吗？"
G["Hey Knot - I'm a Tailor.  Think you could teach me how to make the ogre suit?"]="你好，诺特——我是裁缝。你能教我怎么制作食人魔套装吗？"
G["Hey Morgom, looks like Margie here be needin' some attention. What'dya say?"]="嗨，莫格罗姆！玛尔格似乎需要关爱，不如你陪陪她？"
G["Hey Nag, how about you slice me off a piece of that..."]="嘿，我说，娜玛拉，你能切给我一块吗……"
G["Hey Nagmara!  How about a mug of Dark Iron Ale?"]="嘿，娜玛拉！来一杯黑铁啤酒怎么样？"
G["Hey Pratt - can you teach me how to make Wild Leather Boots again?"]="嘿，普拉特——你能再教我一下如何制作蛮皮战靴吗？"
G["Hey Pratt - can you teach me how to make Wild Leather Leggings again?"]="嘿，普拉特——你能再教我一下如何制作蛮皮护腿吗？"
G["Hey Pratt - can you teach me how to make Wild Leather Shoulders again?"]="嘿，普拉特——你能再教我一下如何制作蛮皮护肩吗？"
G["Hey Pratt - can you teach me how to make a Wild Leather Cloak?"]="嘿，普拉特——你能再教我一下如何制作蛮皮披风吗？"
G["Hey Pratt - can you teach me how to make a Wild Leather Helmet again?"]="嘿，普拉特——你能再教我一下如何制作蛮皮头盔吗？"
G["Hey Pratt - can you teach me how to make a Wild Leather Vest again?"]="嘿，普拉特——你能再教我一下如何制作蛮皮外衣吗？"
G["Hey Reese, give me an' Christoph another round."]="嘿，瑞斯，给我和克里斯托弗再来一杯。"
G["Hey Sho, take a break and come watch my farm for a while."]="嘿，阿烁。休息一下，来我的农场帮我看会庄稼吧。"
G["Hey Stone, did you hear about the new steam engine old Tonkrend has been runnin on?"]="嘿，伙计，你知道新的蒸汽坦克已经可以开出去了吗？"
G["Hey Stone, let's hit the circuit some time. We could run a few laps and see who wins?"]="嘿，咱们来赛坦克吧。多跑几圈，看看谁会赢？"
G["Hey Tina, I hear Farmer Yoon needs some help at his farm. Would you... ?"]="嘿，迪娜，我听说农夫老愚的农场需要点帮助。你能否……？"
G["Hey Vi'el, show me your wares!"]="嗨，维尔，让我看看你出售的货物！"
G["Hey Yoonie! It's me, Mung-Mung!"]="嘿，小愚！是我啊，蒙蒙！"
G["Hey Zazzle! Look at these goofballs comin' through."]="嘿，萨兹尔！快看那些走过来的傻瓜。"
G["Hey all!  So how long until the jokes spawn?"]="大家好！离下个笑话还有多久？"
G["Hey boss, me been thinkin'. You been real good to Chee Chee, so I wanted to give you a sheep for your farm. It should be waiting already. You take good care of Chee Chee's sheeps, okay?"]="Oye, $gjefe:jefa;, yo está pensando. Tú fue muy $gbueno:buena; con Chee Chee, así que yo kiere darte una oveja para tu granja. Ya debe estar esperando. Tú kuida muy bien de ovejas de Chee Chee, ¿vale?"
G["Hey boss, your sheeps is lookin' pretty good."]="Oye, $gjefe:jefa;, tus ovejas tienen muy buena pinta."
G["Hey boss.  You need someone to help drive the caravan, you just let ol' Beezil know."]="Hola, $gjefe:jefa;. Si necesitas que alguien conduzca la caravana, tú díselo al viejo Beezil."
G["Hey bud, I'll sell ya my wife if you get me outta here. She won't mind!"]="嗨，好汉，如果你能把我从这里弄出去，我会把老婆卖给你。她绝对不会介意的！"
G["Hey buddy! I'm a little busy at the moment. Talk to me when I'm done creaming this rookie!"]="嘿，伙计！我现在有点忙。等我教训完这个菜鸟再来跟我说话！"
G["Hey buddy! Mighty nice seein' you again."]="嘿，哥们！很高兴再次见到你。"
G["Hey buddy! The pigs are doin' jus' fine today!"]="嘿，哥们！这些猪今天看起来不错嘛！"
G["Hey buddy! You got any good gossip for me?"]="嘿，哥们！有没有什么有趣的见闻啊？"
G["Hey buddy, I'm busy here. Can't ye come back later?"]="嘿，哥们，我现在很忙。你能过会儿再来吗？"
G["Hey buddy, feel free to come admire my yaks anytime."]="嘿，哥们，随时欢迎你来欣赏我的牦牛。"
G["Hey buddy, got shome coin to shpare a poor jinyu?"]="嗨，哥们，可不可以资助一下可怜的锦鱼？"
G["Hey buddy, what's happening?"]="嘿，哥们，发生什么事了？"
G["Hey buddy, you are making enough noise to scare off a pack of mushan beasts."]="嘿，哥们，你弄出来的噪音都能把一群穆山兽给吓跑了。"
G["Hey buddy, you got any experience dealing with hozen or virmen?"]="嘿，哥们，你有没有对付猢狲或兔妖的经验？"
G["Hey buddy, you here to buy or sell? Feel free to look around."]="嘿，哥们。你是来购物的，还是来卖货的？请随便瞧瞧吧。"
G["Hey buddy. I got two chickens gone missin' last night. Bet it was them hozen that're behind it."]="嘿，哥们。昨晚我有两只小鸡失踪了，我敢打赌是猢狲干的好事。"
G["Hey der, mon.\n\nDid ya need help recoverin' a lost companion?"]="嗨，朋友。\n\n你需要找回一个丢失的同伴吗？"
G["Hey der, mon.\n\nDid ya want ta be stablin' yer pets, or were ya lookin' for a lost companion?"]="Hey, hola, colega.\n\nSaludos, $c. ¿Quieres guardar a tus mah'cotas o recuperar a un compañero perdi'o?"
G["Hey der, mon.\n\nIf ya be ready, I can teach ya how ta be conjurin' up a portal back ta dis place..."]="Hey, hola, colega.\n\nSi eh'tás $glih'to:lih'ta;, puedo enseñah'te cómo invocar un poh'tal pa' regresar a ese lugar..."
G["Hey dere. You need anythin', you let me know."]="嘿！需要什么东西，直接告诉我就行啦。"
G["Hey deres, boss."]="Hola, $gjefe:jefa;."
G["Hey everyone, it's $n!"]="大家看啊，$n来了！"
G["Hey fathead, how about some food!?"]="嘿，胖子，给我弄点吃的怎么样！？"
G["Hey fatso, how do you go to the bathroom with all that fat!?"]="嘿，胖子，你这么胖怎么去厕所的！？"
G["Hey fatso, is there any reason why you insist on living in a dung filled hole in the wall?"]="嘿，胖子，是什么理由让你可以坚持住在这么一个满墙都是粪便的地方？"
G["Hey fellas!  How's it going?"]="嘿，伙计们！最近怎么样？"
G["Hey folks, go easy on me... it's my first time."]="嘿，朋友们，够了够了……那是我第一次。"
G["Hey friend! Mighty nice seein' you again."]="¡Hola, $gamigo:amiga;! Me alegro mucho de volver a verte."
G["Hey friend! You got any good gossip for me?"]="¡Oye, $gamigo:amiga;! ¿Te sabes algún cotilleo?"
G["Hey friend, I'm a little busy here. Ye got something ya need?"]="Mira, $gamigo:amiga;, estoy un poco ocupado ahora. ¿Se te ofrece algo?"
G["Hey friend, care to sit with me and share a drink?"]="Ey, $gamigo:amiga; ¿por qué no te shientash conmigo y compartesh una bebida?"
G["Hey friend, don't you think that Farmer Yoon's house is looking mighty empty?"]="Oye, $gamigo:amiga;, ¿no te parece que la casa del granjero Yoon tiene un aspecto bastante desangelado?"
G["Hey friend, feel free to come admire my yaks anytime."]="Oye, $gamigo:amiga;, no te dé corte admirar mis yaks cuando quieras."
G["Hey friend, here's a tip. You want big vegetables? You gotta use fertilizer.\n\nAnd you know who's got the best fertilizer in the Valley? Me!"]="Oye, $gamigo:amiga;, te daré un consejo. ¿Quieres verduras grandes? Tienes que utilizar un fertilizante.\n\n¿Y sabes quién tiene el mejor fertilizante del Valle? ¡Yo!"
G["Hey friend, how is things going on your farm?"]="Oye, $gamigo:amiga;, ¿kómo va la cosa en tu granja?"
G["Hey friend, how's the soil looking today?"]="Oye, $gamigo:amiga;, ¿qué tal está la tierra hoy?"
G["Hey friend, thanks for visiting today."]="Oye, $gamigo:amiga;, gracias por visitarme hoy."
G["Hey friend, what I've got here is a breakthrough, the likes of which have never been seen!  And it's for sale, for cheap!\n\nYou see, I got tired of spending money in taverns looking for the perfect person.  So I made these goggles and now EVERYONE looks like pure perfection.  I mean you CAN'T go wrong with these puppies!\n\nSo, you wanna try these out, help pad my pockets a bit?  Since you look soo good, I'll even give you a discount!"]="嘿，朋友，我拿来的这个东西可以说是一个伟大的成就，一件你从未看到过的东西！不过现在你可以买到它，可以非常便宜地买到它！\n\n你知道，我已经厌倦了花钱在酒馆里找寻完美的人。所以我做了这个东西……这副眼镜可以让每个人看上去都是那么完美无缺。你可别错过这种好东西！\n\n那么，你想试试吗？让我的口袋里多一点钱？既然你看上去那么完美，我会给你打折的！"
G["Hey friend, what's happening?"]="Oye, $gamigo:amiga;, ¿qué está pasando?"
G["Hey friend, you got any experience dealing with hozen or virmen?"]="Oye, $gamigo:amiga;, ¿tienes experiencia en el trato con los hozen o lo mures?"
G["Hey friend, you here to buy or sell? Feel free to look around."]="Oye, $gamigo:amiga;, ¿has venido a comprar o a vender? No te cortes en echar un vistazo por ahí."
G["Hey friend, you know the secret to a good market? Distribution. You need a way to move your goods to the people who want 'em."]="Oye, $gamigo:amiga;, ¿sabes cuál es el secreto de un buen mercado? La distribución. Necesitas tener una manera de llevar tus productos a la gente que los necesita."
G["Hey friend. I got problems, but no need to be your problems, too."]="Oye, $gamigo:amiga;. Yo tiene problemas, pero no tiene ke ser tus problemas también."
G["Hey guys, I'm your biggest fan!  I'm ready to rock!"]="嗨，我是你们的歌迷！来点摇滚乐吧！"
G["Hey guys, let's try on the other side."]="伙计们，咱们去另一边试试吧。"
G["Hey guys, this is my first time here...anything I should know about?"]="嘿，我以前没打过……打这个要注意点啥？"
G["Hey hey hey hey hey!"]="嘿嘿，嘿嘿，嘿嘿嘿……"
G["Hey hey hey! You lookin' fer some fast travel to the Barrens?"]="嘿嘿嘿！你想快速前往贫瘠之地吗？"
G["Hey hey! Come here, have some tasty noodles!"]="嘿嘿！快来尝尝好吃的面条吧！"
G["Hey hey! Look what we've scooped up for you today... it's Blat!"]="嘿嘿！请看我们今日为大家带来的……布拉特！"
G["Hey hey, don't forget to grab yourself some Brewfest souvenirs! We got everything from traditional holiday garb to mini-kegs of tasty brew. Just talk to Blix Fixwidget, but make sure you got plenty of Brewfest Prize Tokens on hand... it's the only way to buy them! You can earn prize tokens by helping out around the Brewfest Grounds."]="嗨，记得给你自己弄些美酒节的纪念品！不管是传统节日的服装还是美酒的袖珍酒桶，应有尽有。只要去找布利克斯·菲克维特就行了，但是首先请确保你手上有着足够的美酒节奖券……因为你只能用它们来购买纪念品。你可以通过在美酒节的场地附近帮忙以获取奖券。"
G["Hey hey, it's another $c! Welcome to my annual Brewfest celebration... now go feast and drink some!"]="¡Hey hey, es $gotro:otra; $c! Te doy la bienvenida a mi celebración anual de la Fiesta de la Cerveza... ¡Ahora bebe y disfruta!"
G["Hey hey, what is this, huh?  This is barely a fifth of the promised payment!"]="嘿，嘿，怎么回事？这点钱只有说好的一半！"
G["Hey lady! Watch it would ya!"]="嘿女士！小心点好吗！"
G["Hey look, it's $n!"]="嘿，看呀，是$n！"
G["Hey look, it's $n. I bet $g he's : she's; loaded. I hear that $g he's : she's; going after the Trade Prince's job!"]="Mirad, es $n. Seguro que está $gforrado:forrada;. ¡Dicen que quiere arrebatarle el puesto al Príncipe mercante!"
G["Hey look, someone's coming up the road. Hellooooo Farmer Fung! Nice to see you!"]="快看，有人走过来了。你好呀，农夫老方！很高兴见到你！"
G["Hey lookee, it's the new $Gguy:gal; in town."]="Anda, mira, es $Gel:la; $Gnuevo:nueva; $Gchico:chica; de la ciudad."
G["Hey ma'am, can you show us some fireworks?"]="嘿，小姐，你能给我们看一些烟花吗？"
G["Hey mister Ironbelly! The witch in the woods turned my friends into jade. Can you help?"]="你好，破军铁腹先生！林子里的巫婆把我朋友变成了玉雕。你能帮帮我吗？"
G["Hey mon!\n\nDis area been goin' through lotsa changes.  Tel'aporta gonna take you somewhere else."]="嘿伙计！\n\n这地方经历了许多改变。可以通过传送去往别处。"
G["Hey mon! Don't ya be forgettin' about Tanzar over here."]="嗨！你是不是忘记坦扎尔还在这里了？"
G["Hey mon! You've ever been diving deep in the ocean? I'll let you in on a little secret, eh. Deep in the ocean you can find bubbly fissures; they'll allow you to breathe air while underwater.  Let's keep this secret between you and me though, eh. I don't need no competition for me shellfish traps elsewhere... if you get my drift!"]="嗨！?从来没有过深海潜水的经历吗？我告诉你一个小秘诀，嗯。在海洋深处有许多冒气泡的裂缝，当你在水下时可利用这些气泡进行呼吸。这个秘密只限于你我之间。对我来说，贝壳到处都是……如果你懂我的意思的话！"
G["Hey mon, how'd you find me? I gotta find a better hiding spot."]="嘿，你是怎么找到我的？看来我要找一个更好的藏身地了。"
G["Hey mon, what can I be doin' for you?"]="嗨，我能为你做什么呢？"
G["Hey mon, you be here ta bring me mithril bars no doubt. There be big trouble brewin' in the Silithus desert at Ahn'Qiraj. We and the Alliance goin' all out this time to stop them bugs, and that be why you seein' everyone here.\n\nThe Horde be askin' me to collect $2009w for the war effort, but I only have $2008w. So ya gonna help me out, or what?"]="Eh colega, seguro que venir con barras de mitril. No será sencillo ponerse a fabricar cosas en Ahn'Qiraj, en el desierto de Silithus. Esta vez, nosotros y la Alianza vamos al completo a pararle los pies a esos bichejos por eso estamos todos aquí.\n\nLa Horda me ha pedido que reúna $2009w para la campaña pero solamente tengo $2008w. ¿Así que me vas a ayudar o qué?"
G["Hey mon, you be needin' to head on over to da $c trainer."]="嗨，你需要继续前进，去找$c训练师。"
G["Hey mon, you ready to try da best brew in all da realms?"]="嗨，朋友，你想试试全世界最好的酒吗？"
G["Hey monkey, don't look at me like that. I'm not for eating, got that?"]="嗨，猴子，别这么瞧我。我可不是用来吃的，明白？"
G["Hey neighbor! How do you like the new furnishings in Farmer Yoon's house? Yes, I picked them out myself!"]="¡Hola, $gvecino:vecina;! ¿Qué te parecen los nuevos muebles de la casa del granjero Yoon? ¡Sí, los he elegido yo misma!"
G["Hey neighbor! How're those pigs doin' at yer farm? I bet they're mighty happy!"]="¡Hola, $gvecino:vecina;! ¿Qué tal están esos cerdos de tu granja? ¡Seguro que están muy, muy contentos!"
G["Hey neighbor! Things going well at the farm?"]="¡Hola, $gvecino:vecina;! ¿Va todo bien en la granja?"
G["Hey neighbor! Those vegetables are looking good."]="¡Hola, $gvecino:vecina;! Esas verduras tienen muy buena pinta."
G["Hey neighbor! You like the sheep?"]="¡Oye, $gvecino:vecina;! ¿Te gusta las ovejas?"
G["Hey neighbor, how are you today?\n\nHow's Shaggy doing?"]="Hola, $gvecino:vecina;, ¿cómo estás hoy?\n\n¿Cómo está Peludo?"
G["Hey neighbor, how is that mushan beast working out for you? She's quite a beauty, ain't she?"]="Oye, $gvecino:vecina;, ¿qué tal te va con aquella bestia mushan? ¿No te parece una preciosidad?"
G["Hey neighbor, since you've been such a good friend to me, from now on I'm going to give you crop predictions for free. Absolutely no charge! Just come drink with me now and again, eh?"]="Oye, $gvecino:vecina;, como has sido tan $gbuen amigo:buena amiga; para mí, de ahora en adelante voy a darte predicciones sobre cosechas sin cobrarte nada. ¡Nada en absoluto! Simplemente ven a tomar un trago conmigo de vez en cuando, ¿vale?"
G["Hey neighbor, what're we talkin' bout anyway? Ain't nothing in a name!\n\nLike my papa always said, ye'd still eat a pink melon if it were called an onion, right?"]="Oye, $gvecino:vecina;, ¿y de qué estamos hablando? ¡Qué más dará un nombre!\n\nComo mi papá decía siempre, te comerías igualmente un melón rosa aunque se llamara cebolla, ¿verdad?"
G["Hey now!  Why do you get to sit in front?"]="嗨！为什么你要坐在前面？"
G["Hey now, this is no place to start a fight. Otherwise, no one will get to enjoy this food."]="嘿够了，这可不是打架的地方。不然谁也别想吃到这美食。"
G["Hey over there!  Hey!  Hey!  Over there!  How'sh everything going Gororgararar?"]="嗨，那边！嗨！嗨！就是那边！去看看格尔加怎么样啦？"
G["Hey pretty lady, Zebu'tan got two rugs over here! Why don't you come on over and keep he warm, eh?"]="嘿，美人儿，塞布坦有两条毯子！为什么不过来一起暖和缓和呢，嗯？"
G["Hey puppy-man thing, you ever take bath? Bet not! Hahah."]="嗨，狗狗人，你这辈子洗过澡吗？肯定没有！哈哈哈。"
G["Hey rookie, take this diving helmet. You might need it out there."]="Oye, $gnovato:novata;, toma esta escafandra. Puede que la necesites ahí fuera."
G["Hey rookie, when you're at Windward Isle, keep your eyes open for onyx eggs. The Serpent Masters'll go nuts if you bring one to them."]="Oye, $gnovato:novata;, mientras estés en la Isla de Barlovento, ten los ojos abiertos por si ves huevos de ónice. A los maestros de dragones les dará algo si les llevas uno."
G["Hey shtranger... you got some coin for a thirsty traveler?"]="Ey, $gforashtero:forashtera;... ¿tienes alguna moneda para un viajero sediento?"
G["Hey stranger, do I know you?"]="Hola, $gforastero:forastera;. ¿Te conozco?"
G["Hey stupid! Why you banging wall? Wall go up not down! Stupid orc! Up! Up!"]="嘿，蠢货！为什么你要敲这堵墙？我们是要建造墙而不是弄倒它！愚蠢的兽人！建造！我说的是建造！"
G["Hey thanks! While I'm here, ya wanna browse my wares? Got this stuff new from Pandaria. Won't be cheap, war times you know."]="嘿，谢谢！在我离开之前，你要看看我的货物吗？都是刚从潘达利亚运来的新鲜货色。东西是不便宜，你也知道，现在可是战争时期。"
G["Hey there $Ghot stuff:toots;, I'm all revved up and ready to battle!"]="Buenas, $gmozo:guapa;. ¡Estoy lista para la batalla!"
G["Hey there beautiful, I'd like to make a withdrawal."]="嘿，宝贝儿，我想要提款。"
G["Hey there friend!  I see you've got some Brewfest tokens.  As it happens, I still have some Brewfest items for sale."]="嘿，伙计！你手里拿的不是美酒节奖币吗？我恰好有一些美酒节物品要出售。"
G["Hey there traveler, you looking to learn how to cook?"]="你好啊旅行者，想要学习烹饪吗？"
G["Hey there!\n\n<The little girl squints at you.>\n\nI overheard you talking to the Elder Sage. He's pretty serious, isn't he?\n\nWell you're in luck, because I hear just about everything that happens around here."]="嗨，你好啊！\n\n<小女孩瞥了你一眼。>\n\n我无意中听到了你和大贤者的谈话。他这个人太严肃了，不是吗？\n\n哈哈，这回你可走运了，因为我碰巧知道这周围发生的所有事情。"
G["Hey there!  Are you interested in learning some more about racing rams and ram racing?"]="嗨！你有兴趣知道更多关于赛羊和赛羊会的事吗？"
G["Hey there!  Good to see a new face - I don't get many visitors and the technicians aren't very good conversationalists.\n\nI bet you're on your way to Area 52.  Am I right?"]="嗨！很高兴可以看到新面孔——我平时没有太多的客人，而且那些技术员也不是那么健谈。\n\n我打赌你是要去52区，我说得没错吧？"
G["Hey there!  Just because I can race rams better than anyone else, doesn't mean I won't pitch in and help out the brewers.  You can help out if you like.\n\nBut wait, there's more!\n\nHelping out with Brewfest means you get a chance to ride some of the fastest rams in the realms!"]="嗨！我是最优秀的赛羊手，这并不代表我就乐意帮助那些酿酒商。你高兴的话，你去帮他们好了。\n\n等等，我还没说完呢！\n\n你要是能帮到酿酒商，就有机会骑上世界上最好的赛羊！"
G["Hey there! Ain't seen a face like yours 'round here before."]="嘿，你好！以前没在这附近见过你啊。"
G["Hey there! Are you the one that brought back the fire spirit?"]="嘿，你好！是你把火灵带回来的吗？"
G["Hey there! Have I seen yer face before?"]="嘿，你好！我以前见过你？"
G["Hey there! I'm a Hydrolizer model two, dash zero or, H2-0 for short."]="你好啊！我就是水解型二杠零，简称H2-0。"
G["Hey there! Miss the Eastern Kingdoms, huh? Well, the Kraken sails back to Stormwind if you're really itching to return. I know I'd enjoy the warmer weather!"]="嗨！你想念东部王国了吧？如果你想回去的话，“海怪号”正要返回暴风城。那里的气候肯定比这里温暖得多！"
G["Hey there! Need a ride? Hop on a tallstrider!"]="嘿！想要搭一程吗？骑我们的陆行鸟吧！"
G["Hey there, $c!\n\n<Khatie looks at you slyly.>\n\nAnytime you want to wrangle us up some more aether rays, you make sure to come and see me!"]="嗨，$c！\n\n<卡提害羞地看着你。>\n\n如果你愿意为我们捕捉更多的以太鳐，可以随时过来找我！"
G["Hey there, $c! Looks like the Horde collected the last of their stuff, and now theirs and ours is being shipped over to Silithus as we speak. I'm told it'll be there in less than $2113w days, and then someone can ring that big gong near the Ahn'Qiraj gates to start the war."]="嗨，$c！似乎部落已经集齐所有的战争物资了，现在部落和联盟的物资都将如约运往希利苏斯。据说货物在$2113w天之内就能到达，那时就能敲响安其拉大门附近的铜锣，战争也就开始了。"
G["Hey there, $c! Looks like the Horde collected the last of their stuff, and now theirs and ours is being shipped over to Silithus as we speak. I'm told it'll be there in less than a day, and then someone can ring that big gong near the Ahn'Qiraj gates to start the war."]="嗨，$c！似乎部落已经集齐所有的战争物资了，现在部落和联盟的物资都将如约运往希利苏斯。据说货物在1天之内就能到达，那时就能敲响安其拉大门附近的铜锣，战争也就开始了。"
G["Hey there, $c. I've talked with everyone around here, and it seems like we have all of the stuff that the Alliance wants for the war. That mean orc ambassador said that the Horde is still gathering though, which means we have some time before we need to ship all of this stuff over to Silithus."]="嗨，$c。我跟这儿的每个人都谈过了，似乎我们已经集齐了联盟所需的战争物资。据兽人大使说部落尚未集齐，也就是说我们有充足的时间将这些物资运往希利苏斯。"
G["Hey there, $c. We're in the middle of a battle here."]="嗨，$c。我们正忙着打仗呢。"
G["Hey there, $g Mr. : Ms.; $n. I can't train you in the ways of magic, but all of this finger-waggling means that I can give a mean neck massage."]="嗨，$n$g先生:女士; ，我无法传授你魔法技艺，只能教你如何用手指按摩僵硬的脖子。"
G["Hey there, $gchief:sweetie;. You up for a fight?"]="嘿，$g老大:甜心;。你想要打一场吗？"
G["Hey there, $n, don't be alarmed. It's me... you... from the future.  I'm here to help."]="嗨，$n。别害怕。我……就是来自未来的……你。我是来帮你的。"
G["Hey there, $n. Here for a lesson? I ain't got all day..."]="嗨，$n。想要学习知识吗？我可没有一整天的时间跟你耗……"
G["Hey there, $n. How are you today?"]="嘿，你好啊，$n。今天过得怎么样？"
G["Hey there, $n. I for one am glad to be away from those damned monkeys!"]="嗨，$n。我很高兴能远离那些该死的猴子！"
G["Hey there, $n. I for one am glad to be away from those darned monkeys!\n\nSo, want to hone your skills with a little training?"]="嗨，$n。我很高兴能远离那些该死的猴子！\n\n那么，想要对你的技艺进行一些磨砺么？"
G["Hey there, $n. I know, it's not much, but the trade prince's wreck is home for now."]="嗨，$n。我知道这挺糟的，但贸易大王的船骸暂时就是我们的家了。"
G["Hey there, $n. Won't you try some of my hot noodle soup?"]="嘿，$n。要来尝尝我的热汤面吗？"
G["Hey there, $n. You heading in?"]="嗨，$n。你要进去吗？"
G["Hey there, $p!\n\nHow's it feel to be a full-fledged farmer?"]="你好，$p！\n\n做一名合格的农夫感觉如何呀？"
G["Hey there, $p! It's been a while since we shared a proper hunt, now hasn't it. Let's see if time has softened yer aim."]="嘿，你好啊，$p！我们似乎已经很久没一起像样地狩猎了，是吧？让我们瞧瞧时间有没有磨光你的战力。"
G["Hey there, $r. Lorewalker Cho told me aaaaallll about you. Or at least, the important stuff. Folks around here might be a little hesitant around you though so you may want to get on their good side first."]="嘿，你好啊，$r。游学者周卓把你的事都告诉我了，至少是重要的部分。可这附近的人对你还不太了解，所以你最好先赢得他们的好感。"
G["Hey there, Belm!  Give me a mug of Thunder Ale, and one for my good friend $n."]="¡Hola, Belm! Dame una jarra de Cerveza del Trueno y otra para mi $gbuen:buena; $gamigo:amiga; $n."
G["Hey there, I'd like to get my pet, Mr. Oinky out please!"]="嘿，你好啊。我想要领出我的宠物——呼噜先生！"
G["Hey there, and welcome to Brewfest. Come in and have a drink or three!"]="嗨，欢迎参加美酒节。过来喝上几杯吧！"
G["Hey there, boss-$g man : lady;. This batch of troll slaves has got to be the worst yet!\n\nLucky for us that the kaja'mite doesn't seem to be making their soft brains any smarter, eh?"]="¡Hola $gjefe:jefa;! ¡Este envío de esclavos trols es el peor que hemos recibido hasta ahora!\n\nSuerte que la kaja'mita no ha estimulado sus blandos cerebros para hacerlos más inteligentes, ¿eh?"
G["Hey there, boss. I trust that you're enjoying your new promotion?\n\nWe all think that you're the one who's going to finally be able to replace that stinky ol' Gallywix and take the title of Trade $g Prince : Princess;. But you didn't hear that from me!\n\nWe have a lot to do and very little time. Hope you're ready!"]="¡Hola, $gjefe:jefa;! Espero que estés disfrutando de tu ascenso.\n\nTodos creemos que tú eres la persona adecuada que por fin reemplazará a ese viejo apestoso de Gallywix y que se hará con el título de $gPríncipe:Princesa; mercante. ¡Pero yo no te he dicho nada!\n\nTenemos mucho que hacer y muy poco tiempo. ¡Espero que estés a la altura!"
G["Hey there, buddy! I loved that story 'bout that boy Arthas. You got any others to share?"]="嘿，哥们！我很喜欢那个关于小男孩阿尔萨斯的故事。你还有其他故事分享吗？"
G["Hey there, buddy! I loved that story 'bout that orc Thrall. You got any others to share?"]="嘿，哥们！我很喜欢那个关于兽人萨尔的故事。你还有其他故事分享吗？"
G["Hey there, citypaw! You heard o' any good stories that you can share? I love tellin' stories!"]="嘿，城里人！你有没有什么有趣的故事跟我分享啊？我超爱讲故事！"
G["Hey there, cutie!  Mind rubbing some lotion on my exposed areas?"]="嗨，小可爱！介意帮我涂点儿防护霜吗？"
G["Hey there, friend! Isn't it a lovely day?"]="¡Hola, $gamigo:amiga;! ¿Verdad que hace un día precioso?"
G["Hey there, friend! Tell me again that story 'bout the world tree and the... whatcha callit... the sunderin'!"]="¡Qué hay, $gamigo:amiga;! ¡Cuéntame otra vez esa historia del árbol del mundo y el... cómo era... el cataclismo!"
G["Hey there, good lookin'."]="嘿，帅哥！"
G["Hey there, good looking!  What can I do to help you out?"]="¡Hola $gguapito:guapita;! ¿Qué puedo hacer por ti?"
G["Hey there, hold on just one second.  I see you're not riding a flying mount of your own.\n\nYou probably won't be of much use to the other goblins here if you can't get around.  They've paid me to loan my used mounts to people such as yourself -- at no cost to you.\n\nInterested?"]="嘿，等一等。你没有属于自己的飞行坐骑诶。\n\n如果出行不便的话，恐怕你没有办法帮助其他的地精了。他们付钱给我，让我将旧坐骑借给你这样的人使用——免费使用哦。\n\n怎么样？"
G["Hey there, how are ye?\n\nCome ta learn the art o' the Charge, $c?"]="嗨，你好！\n\n你是来学习冲锋技巧的吗，$c？"
G["Hey there, how ya doin'? Lookin' for a ride ta Warsong Hold? The Wild Wench will get ya there lickety-split. She's the fastest zeppelin in Northrend!"]="嗨，你想去战歌要塞？搭乘“野姑娘号”吧，眨眼工夫就能到。她是诺森德最快的地精飞艇！"
G["Hey there, little buddy! I'm gonna name you Gizmo."]="嘿，小家伙！我要给你起名叫吉兹莫。"
G["Hey there, lucky. You like numbers?\n\nI keep track of all the fights around here. I can tell you how many fights each of the challengers won.\n\nMight come in handy, especially if you wanna... I dunno... predict the winner of one of these fights, for some... monetary benefit. You catch my drift?"]="Muy buenas, $gsuertudo:suertuda;. ¿Te gusta hacer números?\n\nYo llevo el registro de todos los combates. Te puedo decir cuántas peleas ha ganado cada uno de los desafiantes.\n\nPodría serte útil para... no sé... predecir el ganador de un combate, en aras de un... beneficio monetario. ¿Me sigues?"
G["Hey there, my good friend! Tell me again that story 'bout that scary dragon, Deathwing!"]="¡Hola, mi $gbuen amigo:buena amiga;! ¡Cuéntame otra vez esa historia del temible dragón, Alamuerte!"
G["Hey there, neighbor $n. Give me some gossip, already!"]="Hola, $gvecino:vecina; $n. Cuéntame algún cotilleo, ¡venga!"
G["Hey there, neighbor! I love stories so much, I just wanna hear 'em all!\n\nBut ya know, I think we've made some good stories together too, dontcha think?"]="¡Hola, vecino! ¡Me gustan tanto las historias que quiero escucharlas todas!\n\nPero bueno, creo que hemos creado buenas historias $gjuntos:juntas;, ¿no crees?"
G["Hey there, stranger. You getting along all right at the farm?"]="你好啊，陌生人。农场上一切还好吗？"
G["Hey there, sweetie. You're lookin' pretty good in all that fancy armor.\n\nSo you've found the way of the Red Crane, too? Interested in a duel?"]="嘿，你好啊，宝贝儿。你穿的那身花俏装备还真不赖啊。\n\n这么说你也领悟了朱鹤之道？有兴趣过两招吗？"
G["Hey there, welcome to Brewfest! There's a mess of ways to keep yourself entertained in there, so you got any questions, you let me know. Otherwise, go buy some beer and a pretzel!"]="嗨，欢迎来到美酒节！在这里你可以享受各种乐趣，如果你有任何问题的话，随时可以过来问我。不然，就去买些啤酒和椒盐卷饼吧！"
G["Hey there, you must be the new recruit!  Good to meet you!\n\nAny word from the Shadow Labyrinth in Auchindoun on whether we've regained control of Murmur yet?"]="¡Eh, hola! Tú debes de ser $gel nuevo:la nueva; recluta. Encantado de conocerte.\n\n¿Algún mensaje del Laberinto de las Sombras de Auchindoun sobre si ya hemos recuperado el control de Murmullo?"
G["Hey there."]="嗨，你好啊。"
G["Hey there.  Taking a break, overseer?  We don't get to see you around here much anymore since you were reassigned to Ruuan Weald.\n\nTake a look at what I have to offer.  It may not have changed much since last we spoke, but I've got plenty.\n\nAnd don't be such a stranger!"]="Hola. ¿Te tomas un descanso, sobrestante? Ya no te vemos demasiado por aquí desde que te reasignaron a la Foresta Ruuan.\n\nEcha un vistazo a lo que tengo que ofrecer. Puede que no haya cambiado demasiado desde que hablamos por última vez, pero tengo en abundancia.\n\n¡Y no seas $gun extraño:una extraña;!"
G["Hey there. Back to the market, I see."]="嘿，你好。要回市集？我明白了。"
G["Hey there. I don't think you want to go down that tunnel on foot. The saurok are out in force today and they are mighty territorial."]="你好。我想你不会愿意徒步穿过那条隧道的。蜥蜴人今天在外面集结了军队，那是一支强大的护卫队。"
G["Hey there. I'm watching these whelps until their owners come along with the proper secret passwords."]="你好啊。在这些龙宝宝的主人持兑换码来认领它们之前，我会一直负责照料它们。"
G["Hey there. If you wanna get to Northrend, then The Mighty Wind is the way to go. She'll fly you straight to Warsong Hold in the Borean Tundra."]="嗨。你可以乘坐“强风号”前往诺森德。她会载你飞往北风苔原的战歌要塞。"
G["Hey tough stuff! Hey, $c! Do you like money?  I'm loaded!  How about you come over here and check out my gold coins?"]="嗨，强壮的家伙！嗨，$c！你喜欢钱吗？我很有钱！到这来看看我的金币怎么样？"
G["Hey ugly, I would punch you right now... if I thought I could hit ya! Anyway, did ya know that they brew BEER here?"]="嗨，丑八怪，我恨不得立刻给你一拳……如果我觉得可以教训你！但是，你知道这里的人也会酿造啤酒吗？"
G["Hey wait, Gadgetzan has a disco?"]="嘿，等等，加基森真有舞厅吗？"
G["Hey you got yourself stuck there! I'm just trying to help!"]="嘿，是你把自己卡在那的！我只是想帮你！"
G["Hey you there!"]="嘿，你！"
G["Hey you!  Get over here and check out my hot muffins!"]="嗨！过来尝尝我的热松饼！"
G["Hey you!  T'chali's Voodoo Brewers have got a brew that won't kill you!  But they've also got a brew that might..."]="嗨！塔卡里的巫毒酒不会让你喝了就死的！但他们也有一种酒可以让你喝了就死……"
G["Hey you! Faster! Chop chop! Oh hey, hiya, $n. What's cookin'?"]="嘿，你！更快些！砍，砍！哦嘿，你好，$n。发生了什么事？"
G["Hey you! Help!"]="嘿，说你呢！帮帮忙！"
G["Hey you! There are keys on the vrykul. Kill them, get a key and come over here to let me out of this damned cage!"]="嘿！维库人身上有钥匙。杀了他们，拿到钥匙，把我从笼子里放出去！"
G["Hey you, over there! Please, please, please, get me out of this cage!"]="喂，你，快过来！拜托了，拜托了，拜托了，快把我从这笼子里放出去！"
G["Hey you, stranger, come here!"]="嗨，陌生人，过来！"
G["Hey you, the tall one...  Want to put some hair on your chest?  Drohn's Distillery can help you out!"]="嗨，就是你。那个高个子……想来点刺激的吗?  德罗恩的酿酒厂可以帮助你！"
G["Hey you, you're new in town. Got any good gossip from faraway?"]="Oye, tú eres $gnuevo:nueva; en la ciudad. ¿Te sabes algún cotilleo de por ahí?"
G["Hey you. Can you get me out of here?"]="嘿，你好。你能把我从这儿弄出去吗？"
G["Hey you. Would you let me loose?"]="嘿，你，能帮我松开绳子吗？"
G["Hey you. Yeah, you. You're not one of the cultists. Get me out of here!"]="嘿，你。对，就是你。你不是邪教徒。快把我弄出去！"
G["Hey!"]="嘿！"
G["Hey!  A little help over here!"]="嗨！谁来帮帮忙！"
G["Hey!  Are you on an errand for Tirth?  If I were you I'd get as far away from him as I could!  His mind's been pickled from too much drink but his magic's as strong as ever!"]="嘿！你在为提尔斯干活吗？如果我是你的话，我会离他远远的！酒精把他的大脑麻痹了，但是他的魔法还是和以前一样厉害！"
G["Hey!  Come over here and take a look at this wanted poster.  You're not going to believe this!"]="嗨！到这来看看这张通缉令，你不会相信你的眼睛！"
G["Hey!  Could you come over and get me out of this cage?"]="嘿！你能不能帮我从这笼子里逃出来？"
G["Hey!  Didn't I give you a bundle of skins before?\n\nEither way, I'm glad to be saved from the ruthless clutches of that evil Gankly Rottenfist!"]="嘿！我是不是以前给过你一捆皮革？\n\n不管怎样，能从那个坏蛋甘克雷·骨拳手下逃生，我很高兴。"
G["Hey!  Get away from our treasure!"]="嘿！离我们的财宝远一点！"
G["Hey!  Get away from that!"]="嘿！别碰那个！"
G["Hey!  Get out of our mine!"]="嘿！滚出我的矿洞！"
G["Hey!  I oughtta bounce one of these trunks off of your head, Tarenar."]="嘿！我可真该把这些东西砸到你头上，塔伦纳。"
G["Hey!  Over here!  Yeah, over here... I'm in this cage!!!"]="嘿！过来！对，过来……我在这个笼子里面！！！"
G["Hey!  Somebody's ambulatory cube is escaping!"]="嘿！那个长腿儿的盒子是谁的，它跑了！"
G["Hey!  Stop that!"]="嘿！住手！"
G["Hey!  Thanks for saving my hide!  I think I'll be lying down for a while until I recover my strength."]="嗨！谢谢你手下留情，没有惩罚我！我想我得躺一会儿恢复体力。"
G["Hey!  What are you doing down there?"]="嘿！你在那下面干什么呢？"
G["Hey!  What's gives?"]="嗨！最近怎么样？"
G["Hey!  Who gave you the cudgel?"]="嘿！你从哪儿找来的棍棒？"
G["Hey! Anybody out there?"]="嗨！有人吗？"
G["Hey! Anyone shee that cute blond dwarf?  I shwear they were jusht here..."]="嘿！有谁看到附近有没有漂亮的金发矮人妹？我……我发誓，刚才还寨周围看见咧……"
G["Hey! Anyone shee that cute goblin?  I shwear they were jusht here..."]="嘿！有人看见漂亮地精妹了吗？我发誓刚才这里肯定有个……"
G["Hey! Check out these doublets! Now you can sport your city's colors without having a tabard flapping around and getting in the way!"]="嘿！瞧瞧这些紧身衣！穿上它，既有了城市的代表色，又省去了宽松的战袍带来的麻烦事儿！"
G["Hey! Cho'gall said you had information for me!"]="嘿！古加尔说你有消息给我！"
G["Hey! Come here, $n."]="嘿！过来，$n。"
G["Hey! Did I remember to refill the tank before the zeppelin left? Oh, well!"]="嘿！我到底给飞艇的油箱里加油了没有？有人能告诉我吗？好吧，随它去吧！"
G["Hey! Did you eat the last of the chicken? I was saving that for a special occasion!"]="嗨！你吃掉了最后一只鸡？我原本打算将它留到特殊的时刻再吃的！"
G["Hey! Do you like the sauce? The sauce is good, no?"]="嗨！你喜欢沙司吗？沙司很美味，不是吗？"
G["Hey! Don't ya be forgettin' about Hazlek over here."]="嗨！别忘了哈兹莱克！在这里！"
G["Hey! Get away from my flying machine!"]="嗨！离我的飞行器远点！"
G["Hey! Gimme one o' them pitchforks!"]="嘿！给我一把干草叉！"
G["Hey! Got out of here!"]="嘿！滚开！"
G["Hey! Grats, mon!"]="嘿！恭喜你，朋友！"
G["Hey! Griftah! That is one of my luckydos! Where did you get that?"]="嘿！格里伏塔！那个幸运符是我的！你从哪里弄来的？"
G["Hey! Hands off the banner, $gson:missy;."]="嗨！别碰那面旗，$g小子:姑娘;。"
G["Hey! Hey Jibbly! This place STINKS!"]="嘿！嘿吉卜力！这地方可真臭！"
G["Hey! Hey you in the back! I'm watchin' you mister!"]="Eh, tú. ¡Sí, tú, $gel:la; de atrás! ¡Que te estoy viendo!"
G["Hey! Hey you! $R! Over here!"]="嘿！说你呢！$R！过来！"
G["Hey! Hey! Hey! It's Raliq the drunk... His momma's so fat she didn't just make the front cover of Ogre Today..."]="嘿！嘿！嘿！这不是醉鬼拉里克吗……他妈妈太胖了，她不仅上了《今日食人魔》的封面……"
G["Hey! Hey, $r! I be havin' just the thing for ya. Ya ever see a tikbalang? Frightenin' creatures. Prone to stealin' ya away. What ya need is one of my tikbalang wards. Guaranteed to ward away all tikbalangs!"]="嘿！嘿，$r！我有个东西简直是给你量身定做的！你看到过提克巴朗吗？偷你东西的可怕生物。你所需要的就是我的防盗符咒，保证可以吓走所有的提克巴朗！"
G["Hey! How'd you get here?!"]="嘿！你怎么进来的？！"
G["Hey! I spent some serious gold on that!"]="嘿！我在它身上可是花了大价钱的！"
G["Hey! I was a Shado-Pan once."]="嘿！我曾经是一名影踪派门徒。"
G["Hey! I was just lining up a shot on that one. Kill stealer!"]="嘿！我分明已经瞄准了那只猎物。你偷了我的猎物！"
G["Hey! I'm walking here!"]="嘿！我就在这儿！"
G["Hey! Is anybody out there? Hellooooooo!"]="嘿！有人吗？喂！"
G["Hey! Just what do you think you're doing?"]="嘿！你以为你在干什么？"
G["Hey! Let me in, or you-know-who will hear about this!"]="嘿！放我进来，不然“那个谁”会听到的！"
G["Hey! Lishten up!  I've got... I have something important to talk about!  Shee... Wait... What wash I shaying?  Something aboutsh boats and floating... Yeah! Sho don't float on a boat... Thank you..."]="嘿！听着！我有……我有些非常非常重要的事情要说！里看……等等，我要说虾米来着？船和飘在水面上的……对对！不要飘在船上……谢谢里……"
G["Hey! Live, FLAMMABLE pandaren here!"]="嘿！我可是一个活的、一点就着的熊猫人！"
G["Hey! Look at that waterfall!"]="嘿！看那道瀑布！"
G["Hey! Over here in Magmothregar's pit!"]="嘿！这儿呢，犸格莫斯雷加的巢穴里！"
G["Hey! Over here!"]="嘿！这边！"
G["Hey! Over here! No, down here! I can take you back to the present time, if you want."]="嘿！我在上面！不对，我在下面呢！如果你愿意的话，我可以把你送回现实世界。"
G["Hey! Put me back! I was gonna judge a match!"]="嘿！把我放回去！我要去给一场比赛当裁判！"
G["Hey! Shoes off of the table! AND FEET!"]="嘿！别把鞋踩在桌子上！还有脚！"
G["Hey! Stop rooting around in my cellar! Clear out!"]="嘿！别在我的酒窖里捣乱！走开！"
G["Hey! Stop stealing my kills, $p!"]="嘿！别跟我抢人头啊，$p！"
G["Hey! Sweet cheeks, over here!"]="嗨！美女，过来！"
G["Hey! Those are my yaks! Bring them back here this instant!"]="嘿！那些是我的牦牛！马上把它们带回来！"
G["Hey! Those bugs took my watch!"]="嗨！那些虫子把我的表抢走了！"
G["Hey! Watch where you're splashing that $g thing, big guy!:thing!;"]="嘿！看你把东西都溅到哪儿了。"
G["Hey! Where do you think you are going, sneaking around like that?"]="嘿！你想干什么，就像那样躲来躲去吗？"
G["Hey! Where'd Jaloot go? Poof!"]="嗨！亚鲁乌特到哪儿去了？噗！"
G["Hey! Why aren't you polymorphed? Enjoy it while it lasts, \"Plucky\"!"]="¡Hey! ¿Por qué no has recurrido a la polimorfia? Disfruta mientras dure, \"Desplumado\"!"
G["Hey! You better not have gone too far!"]="嘿！你最好不要走太远！"
G["Hey! You for the Horde? <hic> I'm for the Horde!"]="¡Hey! ¿Estás con la Horda? <hip> ¡Yo estoy con la Horda!"
G["Hey! You here to challenge me to a fight?"]="嘿！你是来这儿挑战我的吗？"
G["Hey! You try arranging furniture with some jerk shaking your house!"]="嘿！你倒是试试在有混蛋摇你的房子时来摆放家具看看啊！"
G["Hey! You're gonna pay for that!"]="噢，你会为此付出代价的……"
G["Hey! You're not supposed to be here! C'mon boys!"]="嘿！你不应该在这里的！快来！"
G["Hey, \"Salty\" when are you going to get a new name? Thish town ain't big 'nough for two of ussh..."]="Hey, \"Salado\", ¿cuándo vas a ponerte un nombre nuevo? Esta ciudad no es suficientemente grande para los dos..."
G["Hey, $G man:lady;? Got some money?  I got five kids to feed!"]="嘿，$g先生:女士;，可怜可怜我吧，我还有五个孩子等着吃饭呢！"
G["Hey, $c!\n\nGot any leads on some lucrative contracts? I'll cut you in on one tenth! Of a percent!"]="嘿，$c！\n\n有兴趣签几份赚钱的合约吗？我会分给你十分之一！百分之一的十分之一！"
G["Hey, $c! Help a gal out, would ya?"]="嘿，$c！帮帮我，好吗？"
G["Hey, $c! This place is pretty picked over but you might still be able to find somethin' worth your time."]="嗨，$c！这个地方已经被搜检得差不多了。不过你也许还可以花些时间来搜索一下。"
G["Hey, $c, did you see that? Out there, lingering near the water's surface....\n\nYou saw it too didn't ya?"]="嗨，$c。你瞧见了吗？水面上那是什么玩意儿……\n\n你到底看清楚没有啊？"
G["Hey, $c, over here!"]="嘿，$c，到这儿来！"
G["Hey, $g bro : lady;. Rocket ride! Yeah!"]="嗨，$g兄弟:小姐;。乘坐火箭吧！耶！"
G["Hey, $g buddy : ma'am;. I've seen you around.\n\nMind getting me out of here?"]="Hey, $gtío:señorita;. Te he visto por aquí.\n\n¿Te importaría sacarme de aquí?"
