G["Hey, you don't waste any time."]="嘿，别浪费时间。"
G["Hey, you dumb old uncle! You left me behind!"]="嘿，你个呆老头！等等我！"
G["Hey, you haven't seen Grom-Grom have you? Orc, about this tall. No?\n\nHmm. No one's seen him for a while. Probably went a.w.o.l."]="嘿，你没见过格罗姆-格罗姆那家伙吧？是个兽人，大约这么高。没有吗？\n\n嗯。大家都有阵子没见过他了。看来又擅离职守了。"
G["Hey, you numbskull!"]="你这蠢货！"
G["Hey, you old jerks! You left me behind!"]="嘿，老怪物们！你们等等我！"
G["Hey, you pirates?! Come on now, stop kidding around. Let me out of here and I'll get you all a brand new delivery of rifles just as soon as I can get them from the Speedbarge!"]="嘿，你是海盗吗？！快点儿过来，别再到处瞎闹了。把我从这儿放出去，我会给你们大家好多把全新的步枪——只要让我从赛艇平台把这些步枪拿出来！"
G["Hey, you there.  Want some candy?"]="嘿，说你呢。想要些糖吗？"
G["Hey, you! Random traveler! C'mere and make some coin!"]="嗨，你！旅行者！到这里来挣些钱吧！"
G["Hey, you! Yes, you! I can hear you! Get over here and get me outa here!"]="嘿！嘿，就是你！我听见你的声音啦！快把我救出去！"
G["Hey, you're not that stinking goat! What do you want with Kil'rek?"]="嘿，你不是那只臭山羊！你找基尔里克做什么？"
G["Hey."]="嗨。"
G["Hey. Have we met before?"]="嗨，我们以前见过吗？"
G["Hey. How ya doing, boss? Hobart and I are working on some things that will ensure that you have phenomenal backup products for when the kaja'mite runs out.\n\nThere's only so much of it left down there in the mines, and when it's gone, all of the Kaja'Cola is going to go with it, I'm afraid."]="Eh. ¿Qué tal te va, $gjefe:jefa;? Hobart y yo estamos trabajando en algunas cosas que te asegurarán un buen suministro de productos fenomenales para cuando se termine la kaja'mita.\n\nMe temo que no queda mucho en las minas, y cuando se acabe, la Kaja'Cola desaparecerá con ella."
G["Hey. I'm on break."]="嘿，我正在休息。"
G["Hey. You are Chee Chee's buddy, yes?"]="嘿，你是吱吱的哥们，对吗？"
G["Hey... HEY! What are you doing?"]="嘿……嘿！你在做什么？"
G["Hey... maybe we'll find some more useless bugs."]="嗨……或许我们会找到更多没用的虫虫。"
G["Hey... me not feel so good."]="嗨……我感觉不是太好。"
G["Hey... psst... puppy-thing. How your family doing? I think my dryskin killed them all. Ahahah! Got you good!"]="嗨……我说……狗狗人。你的亲人都还好吧？我的干皮人将他们统统杀掉了。哈哈哈！很爽吧！"
G["Hey... what's this? A pair of manacles and not just any. These are enchanted. This cargo, it wasn't a thing... it was a person!"]="嗨……这是什么？一副镣铐，还不是一般的镣铐呢。上面附有魔法。还有这箱货物，啊，里面有人！"
G["Hey...hey YOU! Those are OUR flying...beer monsters?"]="嘿……说你呢！那些是我们的飞行……啤酒怪？"
G["Heya Heya Heya!   If you want to test your fishing skills then I have just the place for you!   This Sunday we have a fishing tournament in Stranglethorn!"]="嗨！嗨！嗨！如果你想要试试自己的钓鱼技能，那么你来对地方啦！本周日荆棘谷将举办一场钓鱼大赛！"
G["Heya mon."]="嘿，伙计。"
G["Heya mon.  Once I get my hands on a few more supplies, I fix ya right up!"]="嗨，只要我手头的物资能够再多一些，我就能立刻给你修理好！"
G["Heya mon.  You come right place learn how ta wield a new weapon."]="嗨。你到这儿来学习如何使用新武器算是来对地方啦。"
G["Heya! I'm Tak-Tak. I'll take you to the Vale now, just like the big green guy over there told me to."]="嘿，你好！我是泰克泰克。我现在就把你带到谷地去，就像那个绿皮大个子告诉我的那样。"
G["Heya, $c! Lookin' like we got all the spotted yellowtail that we be needin' for that war. Maybe you going to some of the other collectors 'round here and askin' them if they be needin' your help?"]="嗨，$c。似乎我们已经集齐了战争所需的斑点黄尾鱼。或许你可以问问其他的收集者，看他们是否需要帮助。"
G["Heya, $c, don't you know? The Horde is done with all of its collecting. We're just finishing up final preparations while we wait for the Alliance to finish their gathering. Then it will be time to ship everything over to Silithus for the war."]="嗨，$c，你不知道吗？部落已经集齐所有战争物资了。我们在进行最后的准备工作，只等联盟完成他们的收集任务了。在那之后，我们会将这些东西全部运往希利苏斯。"
G["Heya, $g champ : lady;. What's shakin'?"]="你好，$g勇士:女士;出了什么事？"
G["Heya, $g dude : toots;! The word is that you're gunning for the Trade Prince's job.\n\nThat true?"]="嘿，$g老兄:小姐;！听说你对贸易大王的职位有兴趣。\n\n是真的吗？"
G["Heya, $n. I'm sure glad that you're here. This is turning into a mess."]="你好， $n。很高兴见到你在这里。这里简直是一团乱了。"
G["Heya, $n. Nice work here, chief."]="你好啊，$n。干得不错啊，酋长。"
G["Heya, Ace. Remember when we were shipwrecked on the Lost Isles?"]="你好，王牌战士。还记得我们在失落群岛落难的时候吗？"
G["Heya, hon. Um... we need to talk, but later.\n\nOkay?"]="嗨，宝贝儿。呃……我们得谈谈，不过不是现在。\n\n好吗？"
G["Heya, kid. Great job out there!\n\nSee you on the other side."]="你好，小子。你干得很不错！\n\n我会在另一边等你。"
G["Heya. They weren't sure this elevator would be workin' in time, so they called me and my brother in. You need a ride down?"]="嗨。他们不确定这台升降梯能否正常运行，因此请了我和我的兄弟来帮忙。你想下去吗？"
G["Heyarrr! I has me brew."]="嘿呀！我这儿有酒。"
G["Heyarrrr!"]="嘿呀！"
G["Heyarrrrrr!"]="嘿呀！"
G["Heyarrrrrrrr!"]="嘿呀！"
G["Hi $c! Don't you think my pets are adorable?"]="你好，$c！你不觉得我的宠物很可爱吗？"
G["Hi $c, I'm Ashli, and I need you to help me 'cause I'm trapped in this cage 'cause Budd sent me in here with some yucky trolls and stinky orcs and silly humans and a drunk dwarf and we got caught by super-bad trolls and they dragged us off and they put me in here with the big troll-cat who's really really mean and kills all the people in the cages and I think he's gunna kill me too really soon but I can't get out by myself so...\n\n<Ashli takes a deep breath.>\n\nCan you kill that thing?"]="嗨，$c。我叫阿什莉，巴德派我和一群令人讨厌的巨魔和臭气熏天的兽人和愚蠢的人类还有一个喝醉的矮人来这儿结果我们被一群超级超级坏的巨魔抓住了然后我们就被关进了笼子更可怕的是这里还有一头非常非常残忍的巨魔豹它专吃牢笼中的囚犯所以我想它很快就会来吃我了但是凭我自己的力量是不可能逃出这里的所以……\n\n<阿什莉深深地吸了口气。>\n\n你能杀死那头猛兽吗？"
G["Hi $gmanly:womanly:c; $c, $ghow's it hangin?:you look pretty.;"]="Hola $gviril:femenina:c; $c, $g¿cómo va eso?:estás preciosa.;"
G["Hi $n!\n\nI have to work on my devices, but eventually... I'm going to need someone to get me dragon eggs!"]="¡Hola, $n!\n\nTengo que trabajar en mis dispositivos pero, en algún momento... ¡Voy a necesitar que alguien me consiga huevos de dragón!"
G["Hi $n!  Are you here to buy something?  Or maybe sell something?\n\nYou won't find better prices anywhere, or my name isn't Augustus the Touched!"]="¡Hola $n! ¿Has venido a comprar algo? ¿Tal vez a vender?\n\n¡Si puedes encontrar mejores precios es que no me llamo Augustus el Agraciado!"
G["Hi $n!  Thanks for all the help you've given me!  Right now I don't need anything, but who knows what the future will bring?\n\nEnjoy yourself, and remember to tell your friends about the Darkmoon Faire!"]="嗨，$n！感谢你对我的帮助！现在我什么都不缺啦，但是未来会怎样，又有谁知道呢？\n\n享受生活吧，别忘记跟你的朋友谈谈暗月马戏团的趣闻！"
G["Hi Corbett!  Here, you go!  I trust business is faring well at your clothier shop...?"]="你好啊，科贝特！拿着吧！你服装店的生意一定很不错吧？"
G["Hi Ella, would you like to join me and Farmer Yoon at his farm?"]="嘿，艾拉，愿意加入我和农夫老愚的农场吗？"
G["Hi Ho, Hi Ho, and all that... let's get a move on."]="嗨呦，嗨呦……加油干啊！"
G["Hi I'm Jian!  Did we meet before?  You have one of those faces.  Like things with faces have..."]="嗨，我是浅浅！我们以前见过吗？你的脸和那些人很像。就是那些脸上……"
G["Hi Jubjub.  I missed you!"]="嗨，加布加布。我很想你！"
G["Hi buddy! Fancy seeing you again."]="嗨，哥们！真高兴又见到你。"
G["Hi buddy! Please tell me... do you like my earrings?"]="嗨，哥们！你觉得……我的耳环怎么样？"
G["Hi there!"]="嗨，你好！"
G["Hi there!\n\nSorry, friend, but only champions of Gnomeregan can buy what I've got."]="嗨，朋友！\n\n很抱歉，只有诺莫瑞根的勇士才有资格从我这里购买物品。"
G["Hi there!\n\nYou'll need a few more seasons behind you before joining us. Hope to see you soon!"]="嗨，你好啊！\n\n在你加入我们之前，还有几季的课程等着你去学呢。"
G["Hi there! I have a proposition for an adventure-seeker such as you, if you are up to the challenge!\n\nAlong with my invention, the Super Egg-O-Matic, I am hard at work aiding the druids with their campaign to save the hippogryphs. The birds are being affected by the evil effects of the Gordunni ogres inhabiting the ruins of Feralas, and their numbers are dwindling.\n\nI collect many different types of eggs.  Will you help and find some for me?"]="你好！如果你想要接受一些挑战的话，我这里有个建议给你！\n\n我正在利用我发明的超级测蛋器帮助暗夜精灵的德鲁伊们拯救鹰角兽。由于菲拉斯废墟中的戈杜尼食人魔，这种生物的数量正在迅速减少。\n\n我收集各种不同类型的蛋。"
G["Hi there! I'm glad you came back, $n. Tell me, have you completed the first quest I gave you? If you have, I might have a second quest for you..."]="嗨！很高兴你回来啦，$n。告诉我，你完成我给你的第一项任务了吗？如果完成了，我会给你第二项任务的……"
G["Hi there! Need some practice?"]="¡Hola! ¿Necesitas practicar?"
G["Hi there! Say, you weren't looking for a quick teleport to the big cannon, were you?\n\nBecause I can do that!\n\nFor a small fee, of course..."]="你好啊！我说，你该不会是在找返回大炮的传送门吧？\n\n我就可以帮你！\n\n当然了，只是要一小笔费用……"
G["Hi there! We're being blockaded by those good-for-nothing pirates out in the bay!\n\nDo you think you can help us out?"]="喂喂！我们被那群该死的海盗给堵在海湾里了！\n\n能帮我们出去吗？"
G["Hi there! We're being blockaded by those good-for-nothing pirates out in the bay! Do you think you can help us out by dropping a few bombs on them?!\n\nOur stolen zeppelin's almost here... I think I hear her now.  Make sure you're onboard when she leaves!"]="喂喂！我们被那群该死的海盗给堵在海湾里了！\n\n朝他们丢炸弹，看能不能帮我们出去？\n\n我们偷来的飞艇就在那里……我都听见它的声音了！趁它起航之前跳上去！"
G["Hi there! We're being blockaded by those good-for-nothing pirates out in the bay! Do you think you can help us out by dropping a few bombs on them?!\n\nOur stolen zeppelin's here; hop on board before she sets sail!"]="喂喂！我们被那群该死的海盗给堵在海湾里了！\n\n朝他们丢炸弹，看能不能帮我们出去？\n\n我们偷来的飞艇就在那边，趁它起航之前跳上去！"
G["Hi there! We're being blockaded by those good-for-nothing pirates out in the bay! Do you think you can help us out by dropping a few bombs on them?!\n\nOur stolen zeppelin's less than $3078w minutes away.  Make sure you're onboard when she leaves!"]="喂喂！我们被那群该死的海盗给堵在海湾里了！\n\n朝他们丢炸弹，看能不能帮我们出去？\n\n我们偷来的飞艇在$3078w分钟后就要起航了。趁它起飞之前跳上去！"
G["Hi there! Welcome to Fizzle & Pozzik's Speedbarge.\n\nWe have everything there is under the sky and over the deeps."]="嗨你好啊！欢迎来到菲兹尔与普兹克赛艇平台。\n\n天底下跑的深渊里游的，我们这里无所不有！"
G["Hi there, $c! With the Ahn'Qiraj War drawing near, our preparations here are in full swing. I'm in charge of thick leather collections. It's a fine day for gathering thick leather, don't ya think? I got my stacks here and it looks like we've got $2069w right now. Our magic number is $2071w. Want to help out?"]="嗨，$c！今天真是个收集厚皮的好日子，不是吗？我收集到一堆厚皮了，似乎已经有$2069w块啦。需求量是$2071w块。你想要帮帮我们吗？"
G["Hi there, $g handsome : gorgeous;. Welcome to the Speedbarge Bar.\n\nWhat'll it be?"]="嗨你好啊，$g帅哥:美女;。欢迎光临赛艇平台酒吧。\n\n想来点儿什么？"
G["Hi there, $n!  It's great to see you again.  Everyone is still talking about the last time you won the tournament... I didn't get to see all of it, but I had to heal a lot of burns and bruises.  But don't worry, they're fine now!"]="嗨，$n！很高兴再次见到你。大家还在议论你上次赢得比武大会的事呢……我没能从头看到尾，因为有太多伤员需要我来治疗了。但不用担心，他们现在都好了！"
G["Hi there, cutey!  Do me a favor... ask the Baron what he wants me to do about you know what."]="嗨，小可爱！帮我个忙……问问男爵他想让我做些什么。"
G["Hi there.  I'm Gubber Blump."]="你好。我是古博·布拉普。"
G["Hi there. All clear down here."]="嘿你好啊。这下面没问题了。"
G["Hi there. No, Marvon sure isn't here, and he won't be back for quite some time. Actually, I am getting a little worried about him...\n\nI hope he gets back soon. A large chest arrived for him and it's too heavy for me to lug it inside here! I had to leave it out by the door..."]="嗨。不，玛尔冯一定不在这儿，他还要好些时间才能回来呢。实际上，我有些担心他……\n\n我希望他能很快回来。有人寄了一只大箱子给他，我可没力气把这东西拖进去！我只能把它放在门口……"
G["Hi there. We've met before, haven't we?"]="你好。我们以前见过，对吗？"
G["Hi this is my text."]="嗨这是我的文书。"
G["Hi!"]="嗨！"
G["Hi!  Do you think you might help me to get out of here?"]="嘿！你觉得你能帮我离开这吗？"
G["Hi!  I know that you're with the Horde, and I'm with the Alliance, but do you think we could put that behind us this once?  I'd really like some help getting out of here."]="嘿！我知道你是部落的人，而我是联盟这一边的，但你觉得这次我们是否可以把这些抛到脑后呢？我真的需要有人帮我离开这里。"
G["Hi!  I'm Kwee Q. Peddlefeet!  I'm here to find out who is the most popular of all the heroes in Azeroth!\n\nIt sure warms my heart to see so many adoring fans greet their leaders, but... do you know what would warm me even more?\n\nA kiss!"]="嗨！我是匹德菲特！我在这里统计谁是艾泽拉斯最受欢迎、人气最高的英雄！\n\n看到这么多人为他们崇拜的英雄投票，这可真让我高兴，但你知道什么可以让我更高兴吗？\n\n一个吻！"
G["Hi!  I'm Luis!  What do you think of me so far...?"]="嗨！我是刘易斯！你现在对我有什么看法……？"
G["Hi!  You there!  Does it smell green to you?"]="嗨！你好！怎么样，这里闻起来也是绿色的吧？"
G["Hi! Clear your res effects here!"]="嗨！取消你的抵抗魔法！"
G["Hi! How are you?"]="嗨！你好吗？"
G["Hi! How you? We're good... yup, good good. Hi!"]="嗨！你还好吧？我们很好……嗯，很好很好。嗨！"
G["Hi! I just got back from exploring the Ruins of Kel'Theril, to the southwest. Now I'm intent on investigating the Wildkin that lie just up the ridge here, in Owl Wing Thicket.\n\nHave you spoken to Erelas Ambersky in Rut'theran Village? He requested that I come here, and perhaps he has a task for you as well."]="你好！我刚刚探索凯斯利尔废墟回来，就在西南方。现在我决定调查在这个山脉之上的枭兽，在枭翼树丛内。\n\n你与鲁瑟兰村的艾瑞拉斯·琥珀谈过话了吗？他要求我来这里，或许他还有任务给你。"
G["Hi! I work with Farmer Yoon down the road. How are you?"]="嗨！我今后会跟农夫老愚一起干活。你好吗？"
G["Hi! I'm Koa! Will you be my friend?"]="你好！我是科亚！你愿意跟我做朋友吗？"
G["Hi! My name's Uthil. We're going to be such good friends once you're dead!"]="¡Hola! Me llamo Uthil. ¡Vamos a ser muy buenos amigos cuando estés $gmuerto:muerta;!"
G["Hi! Would you like to battle my pets?"]="你好！你想和我宠物决斗吗？"
G["Hi! You're new. Did you lose your home too? You can sit with me if you want."]="¡Hola! Eres $gnuevo:nueva;. ¿Tú también has perdido tu casa? Puedes sentarte a mi lado si quieres."
G["Hi, $n!  Enjoying the party?"]="你好，$n！聚会不错吧？"
G["Hi, $n!  What do you think about my new gear?"]="你好，$n！你觉得我的新装备怎么样？"
G["Hi, $n! Going to join me?"]="你好，$n！想加入我吗？"
G["Hi, $n.  I'm here!"]="你好，$n。我在这里！"
G["Hi, $n.  No hard feelings, ok?"]="你好，$n。不要难过，好吗？"
G["Hi, $n. Click the option below to complete quest 9711 -- Matis the Cruel.\n\nNote that nothing happens even though I am attempting to cast a spell."]="Hola, $n. Haz clic en la opción de debajo para completar la misión 9711 -- Matis el Cruel.\n\nFíjate en que no sucede nada aunque intente lanzar un hechizo."
G["Hi, Harold.  I have your skins!"]="嘿，哈罗德。我拿到你的皮革了！"
