G["Hi, uh, Becanna, I mean... uh, Elenna found some herbs! Can you go pick them up?"]="嗨，贝卡娜，我……嗯，艾蕾娜发现了一丛草药！你能去采一下吗？"
G["Hi, what would you like?"]="嗨，你想要什么？"
G["Hi-Ya!"]="嗨——呀！"
G["Hi."]="嗨。"
G["Hi.  Thanks for the help.  But please don't open the cage."]="嗨，谢谢帮忙。但是请别打开笼子。"
G["Hi. Welcome to my salon.\n\nYou look great! But if you're in the mood for a change, just sit right down in one of the chairs."]="Hola. $gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a mi salón.\n\n¡Tienes un aspecto estupendo! Pero si te apetece un cambio, siéntate directamente en una de las sillas."
G["Hi. Yeah, I know. I got captured again.\n\nI don't want to talk about it.\n\nYou ready?"]="Hola. Sí, ya lo sé, me han vuelto a capturar.\n\nNo quiero hablar de ello.\n\n¿Estás $glisto:lista;?"
G["Hic... What a calim... a culamu... uhh calamit... Err, what a disaster!"]="嗝……真……真……呃……真是场灾难啊！"
G["Hiccup!"]="嗝儿！"
G["Hidden inside this defiled city is the wretch responsible for murdering our brothers and sisters at the Wrathgate! He must be brought to justice!"]="那个在天谴之门屠杀我们同胞的凶手，就龟缩在这座肮脏的城市里！他必须受到正义的裁决！"
G["Hidden power lies here, and we must reveal it!"]="这里隐藏着力量，我们必须让它显现！"
G["Hide the bodies!"]="藏好尸体！"
G["Hide your kids! Hide your wife!"]="藏好你们的孩子！看好你们的老婆！"
G["Hide your vives! Hide your children! H-h-hide you husbands!! Zhey're killink everyvone up in he'ah!"]="让你们的妻子躲起来！让你们的孩子躲起来！让你们的丈夫躲起来！！他们会杀掉这里所有的人！"
G["Hide your vives! Hide your children! Zhey're killink everyvone up in he'ah!"]="让你们的妻子躲起来！让你们的孩子躲起来！他们会杀掉这里所有的人！"
G["Hide! Hide before they see you! Back up!"]="躲起来！在他们看到你之前躲起来！后退！"
G["Hide, worms! The hunt is on..."]="躲起来吧，虫子！狩猎开始了……"
G["Hideous bellows and growls are heard coming from that old hermit's shack!"]="从那个老隐士的小屋里传出了可怕的咆哮声！"
G["Hides for the Horde, mon!  Only the best for our troops!"]="朋友，我们会为部落提供最优质的皮革！"
G["Hidey ho $g sir : miss;. I would watch your step around here, I lost a bomb disguised as a mouse and I can't seem to find it."]="你好，$g先生:女士;。我建议你在这里走动的时候小心一些，我刚刚弄丢了一个炸弹，而且现在怎么都找不到了。"
G["Hidin' from ol' Cayden, are ya..."]="想躲着老凯登吗……"
G["Hiding in 1..."]="快躲起来，倒数1秒……"
G["Hiding in 2..."]="快躲起来，倒数2秒……"
G["Hiding in 3..."]="快躲起来，倒数3秒……"
G["Hiding? Listen Bloodhilt - I've, ah, reinforced our grip on the Barrens."]="躲？听着血柄——我已经，啊，加强了对贫瘠之地的控制。"
G["High Botanist?"]="高级植物学家？"
G["High Enchanter Bardolan may be found in the Seer's Library on Scryer's Tier. A grand master of the art, he is surrounded by his students: masters, artisans, experts, and journeymen."]="高阶附魔师巴尔杜兰在占星者平台的先知图书馆。他是附魔的宗师，身边环绕着他的学生：初级附魔师，中级附魔师，高级附魔师和大师级附魔师。"
G["High Executor Anselm requests your report."]="高级执行官安希尔姆要求你立刻报到。"
G["High Executor Anselm wants a report on the situation."]="高级执行官安希尔姆要求你立刻报告情况。"
G["High General Abbendis personally told me that it was a mistake to come north and that we're doomed! I urge you all to lay down your weapons and leave before it's too late!"]="阿比迪斯将军亲口对我说，北征诺森德是个错误，我们被诅咒了！我奉劝你们赶紧放下武器，趁早离开这里！"
G["High King! I've brought reinforcements."]="国王陛下！我带来了援军。"
G["High Priest Venoxis is exhausted!"]="高阶祭司温诺希斯疲惫了！"
G["High Priest Venoxis is nearly healed!"]="高阶祭司温诺希斯快要痊愈了！"
G["High Priest Voss denounces you as a daughter.  He's ordered that you be executed immediately."]="高阶牧师沃斯已经抛弃了你这个女儿。他要求立刻把你处死。"
G["High Priestess Jeklik is nearly healed!"]="高阶祭司耶克里克就要痊愈了！"
G["High Priestess Tyrande was hesitant to approve this mission.\n\nShe seemed to believe the source of Vaeldrin's research to be a double edged sword.\n\nAfter spending days in that arcanic oubliette, I am beginning to think she might not have been wrong."]="高阶女祭司泰兰德曾对批准此任务犹豫不决。\n\n她似乎觉得瓦尔德林的研究来源是一把双刃剑。\n\n在那个奥法地牢度过许多时日后，我开始认为她或许是对的。"
G["High Tinker Mekkatorque is on his way!  The \"Tapping of the Keg\" ceremony will begin in a few minutes!"]="¡El Manitas Mayor Mekkatorque está de camino! ¡La ceremonia de \"apertura del barril\" comenzará dentro de unos minutos!"
G["High alert, soldiers! Reports are comin' in of some enemy activity near Sofera's Naze!"]="士兵们，高度戒备！有报告说，在索菲亚高地附近发现了敌人的行踪！"
G["Highborne spirits! Be at peace! The Crystal of Zin-Malor is whole once again!"]="上层精灵的灵魂，安息吧！辛玛洛水晶终于复原了！"
G["Highguard, to arms! For your queen! For Azshara!"]="上层卫士们，动手！为了女王！为了艾萨拉！"
G["Highlord Bolvar Fordragon fights for us all, newcomer. Were it not for him, Arthas would be sitting upon the throne of Stormwind right this very moment."]="伯瓦尔·弗塔根公爵一直都在为正义的事业奋斗。要不是他，阿尔萨斯没准已经坐上了暴风城的王座。"
G["Highlord Fordring, are you alright?"]="大领主弗丁，你还好吧？"
G["Highlord Tirion Fordring approaches the stage to address those gathered upon the tournament grounds! Make way to the stage area to attend him!"]="大领主提里奥·弗丁已经来到台上，要向聚集在比武场上的人们讲话！来听他的演讲吧！"
G["Hight is always going on about the 'sheep tons' of work we have to do. See if you can get him to say it. It's like a drinking game."]="Cenit siempre habla de los \"montones y montones\" de trabajo que tenemos que hacer. Intenta hacérselo decir. Se le traba la lengua."
G["Hilda's left all the documentin' to me. Ye know that fer every artifact we find, I've got six forms ta fill out? Whaddaya we need all these forms fer, I ask!?"]="希尔达把所有的文件都给我了。你知道吗，我们每找到一个神器，我就要填六份表格！我想知道，这些该死的文件到底有什么用！？"
G["Hildagard, I need a new pair of goggles."]="希尔达迦，我需要一副新的眼镜。"
G["Hillsbrad has changed. Back in my day Hillsbrad was a place of constant battle. The humans and dwarves of Southshore would constantly attack the Horde at Tarren Mill. There were days when you could look out past the intersection at Darrow Hill and see a thousand people battling. Glory days, $n - they'll pass you by."]="希尔斯布莱德已经变了。过去，这里曾经是战火连绵之地。南海镇的人类和矮人不停地向塔伦米尔的部落发动进攻。在很长一段日子里，当你望向达隆山的路口，就会看见上千人在奋死拼杀。那真是一段光荣岁月，$n——而那些岁月都已经悄然逝去了。"
G["Him Walter Soref. Work in Rogue District. He make keys."]="沃特尔·索雷夫。盗贼区。他做钥匙。"
G["Him name is Grizzle Halfmane. He in Royal Quarter with Banshee Queen and Dread Lord."]="他的名字叫格里兹尔。他在皇家区和女妖之王和恐惧魔王在一起。"
G["Him's at inner ring of Rogues' Quarter."]="他居住在盗贼区内环。"
G["Hinkles rummages through his backpack looking for supplies."]="辛克尔斯在背包中搜索着供给品。"
G["Hinkles, hand me that Whirring Bronze Gizmo and some Fresh Spring Water. Cogspin, toss me that Dirty Trogg Cloth and a Handful of Copper Bolts..."]="辛克尔斯，把高速青铜齿轮和清凉的泉水给我。克斯宾，扔给我肮脏的穴居人布片和一把螺栓……"
G["Hip hip, hoorah!"]="一，二——三！"
G["Hip hip... arrrrr..."]="嗨！嗨！……啊……"
G["Hippogryph Hatchling"]="角鹰兽宝宝"
G["Hippogryph Master"]="角鹰兽管理员"
G["His Majesty, King Varian Wrynn, and Lady Jaina Proudmoore have touched down upon the tournament grounds! Make way!"]="瓦里安·乌瑞恩国王殿下和吉安娜·普罗德摩尔女士已经茹临比武场！让路！"
G["His act could not erase the horrors we committed."]="他也无法抹去我们犯下的可怕罪行。"
G["His armor is broken. Strike at him now!"]="他的护甲破了。趁现在攻击他！"
G["His aspect shifts once again! You are losing him!"]="他的形态又开始变化了！你要失去他了！"
G["His blood is mine, as is your whole misbegotten race."]="他的血是我的，你们整个卑贱的种族都是我的！"
G["His body - it's covered with scars. Old scars."]="他的身体——伤痕累累。都是些旧伤。"
G["His body screams for death, but his soul screams for mercy."]="他的躯体在渴求死亡，可他的灵魂却在渴求怜悯。"
G["His body was found strung up from a tree. Those animals... Those filthy animals!"]="我们找到了他的尸体。那些野兽……那些肮脏的怪物！"
G["His brood learned their lesson before too long. You will soon learn yours!"]="他的族群没用多久就得到了教训。你们也快了！"
G["His creations?  So you're saying that all the creatures here in the crater are Khaz'goroth's creations?"]="卡兹格罗斯创造的？你说这座环形山里的全部生物都是卡兹格罗斯创造的？"
G["His death was even more miserable than the first!"]="他的死要比第一个悲惨得多！"
G["His flesh will feed us, and give us strength. His rotting insides will be thrown into the filth-pool, protecting us from intruders. His bones will build our homes. His seed will continue the cycle indefinitely.\n\nStrength always to Kroshik. Strength always to the Skumblade."]="他的血肉滋养了我们，赐予我们力量。他腐烂的内脏将被扔进污水池，保护我们不受入侵者袭扰。他的骨骼将被建成我们的房屋。他的种子将延续永恒的轮回。\n\n力量与考什克同在。力量与邪刃部族同在。"
G["His followers fell to their knees before him. \"We will call you 'The Lightning King,'\" they said."]="Sus seguidores se arrodillaron ante él. \"Te llamaremos 'Rey del Rayo'\", dijeron."
G["His followers helped him regain his strength inside this very temple.  Plates of powerful elementium were grafted onto his skin."]="他的追随者就是在这座神殿里侍奉他，为他恢复力量。坚固的源质盔甲被镶嵌到了他的躯壳上。"
G["His goal he professed was marital arrest"]="他的目标正是注定的婚姻"
G["His hold on me dissipates. I can see clearly once more. Thank you, heroes."]="他对我的控制已经不复存在了。我又一次恢复了理智。谢谢你们，英雄们。"
G["His journey is long. He has only taken the first steps."]="他的路还很长。他刚迈出第一步。"
G["His last terrible breath has haunted this land ever since, but the shadows he left behind are mere whispers of his former glory."]="他最后的恐怖呼吸变成挥之不散的阴影，可跟他先前的荣耀相比不值一提。"
G["His lieutenant, Ilkrud Magthrull possesses a tome which might indicate the location of the remaining soulgems."]="他的副官，伊克鲁德·玛格苏尔有一本书，里面也许记载着其它灵魂宝石的所在地。"
G["His pulse is stable, Mishka. But it's weak."]="他的脉搏平稳，米希卡。但很虚弱。"
G["His sacrifice inspires us all."]="他的牺牲令我们大受鼓舞。"
G["His son, Anduin Wrynn, was the king for a while.  He's about my age too.  Can you imagine if I were the king?"]="他的儿子安度因·乌瑞恩就是现任国王。年纪和我差不多吧。你能想象我坐上王座的模样吗？"
G["His spirit is free from the grasp of the Lich King. We must now focus our attention on breaking down the walls that block our passage into the upper reaches. It is only a matter of time now, $n. The siege engineers should have the door down in $4939W days."]="他的灵魂已经摆脱了巫妖王的束缚。我们现在必须集中力量击破那几面阻挡我们前往上方的高墙。这只是个时间问题，$n。攻城工程师只需$4939W天就可以攻破大门了。"
G["His spirit is strong for a creature of mortal flesh. He fascinates me... and I am loathe to give him up."]="作为血肉凡人，他的灵魂十分强大。他令我惊奇……我不想放弃他。"
G["His stamina is nothing against Lam's strength."]="周的耐力在蓝的力量面前不值一提。"
G["His trail is still fresh.  We're not far behind."]="他的痕迹还很新鲜。我们距离他不远了。"
G["His troops, these guards... it all seems a little intense."]="他的部队，这些卫兵……看上去倒是有些强大。"
G["His umbrella... sprouted! It grew roots, flowered, and became a tree!"]="他的竹伞……发芽了！生根，开花，变成了一颗树！"
G["His weakness led to his capture."]="他过于孱弱，所以被俘虏了。"
G["His will - it's too strong!"]="他的意志——太强大了！"
G["His... return."]="他的……回归。"
G["Hiss... hiss... dead. All dead."]="嘶嘶……嘶嘶……死了。都死了。"
G["Hisss word, FILLS me, MY BLOOD IS VENOM, AND YOU WILL BATHE IN THE GLORY OF THE SNAKE GOD!!!"]="神之真言，充盈我心，剧毒之血，灌注我身。你们将浸沐在蛇神的荣光之中。"
G["Hissssssss!"]="嘶！！！"
G["History in the making!"]="我们在缔造历史！"
G["History is about to be rewritten!"]="历史就要被改写了！"
G["History? Culture? Tch. Such is the realm of scholars and scribes.\n\nWe of The Reliquary concern ourselves with... the immediate, and perhaps the future.\n\nWe discover, acquire, and amass lost artifacts, wealth, and lore so that it cannot be used against us. Power does, after all, belong in the hands of those who would use it best... wouldn't you agree?"]="历史？文化？这些都是学者和抄写员关心的事情。\n\n我们神圣遗物学会关心的是……当前，或者也许是未来。\n\n我们发现、获取并收藏失落的宝物、财富和学识，以确保它们不会被别人利用来对抗我们。毕竟，力量只属于能够充分利用它的人……难道你不同意吗？"
G["Hit by what? Sprites?"]="被什么东西袭击了？林精？"
G["Hit dem wit da most powaful 'ting you got!"]="用最厉害的招数对付他们！"
G["Hit it as hard as possible."]="有多大劲，使多大劲。"
G["Hit it very softly."]="轻轻地打。"
G["Hit it with average power."]="用力击打。"
G["Hit me again and you'll regret it!"]="再打我一下试试，你会后悔的！"
G["Hit me as hard as you possibly can!"]="打我，使出全力！"
G["Hit me softly!"]="轻轻地打我！"
G["Hit me with average power!"]="用力打我！"
G["Hit the button labeled \"Just past the Grim Guzzler\"."]="Aprieta el botón señalado como \"Pasa al Tragapenas\"."
G["Hit the button labeled 'Entrance'."]="Aprieta el botón señalado como \"Entrada\"."
G["Hit the button labeled 'Into the Domicile'."]="Aprieta el botón señalado como \"Al domicilio\"."
G["Hit the icicle to break free!"]="击打冰柱来挣脱束缚！"
G["Hit them harder, $n!"]="用力揍他们，$n！"
G["Hiya! This workshop isn't mine, no! But one day after I finish training I am going to be an inventor, just like my hero, Marvon Rivetseeker.\n\nYou've never heard of him? Well it just so happens that he left quite some time ago to study some ancient troll ruins he kept talking about. He left in a zeppelin... not quite sure about where exactly he went...\n\nTanarasin? Tenkeris? Taneranisany?\n\n<Liv shakes her head.>\n\nNo, that's not it..."]="你好！这间工场不是我的，不是！但是终有一天当我完成训练后，我将成为一名发明家，就像我崇拜的英雄玛尔冯·瑞文斯克那样。\n\n你从来没有听说过他吗？哦，碰巧他已经离开好长一段日子啦，他去研究远古巨魔废墟啦，他是乘坐地精飞艇走的……我也不是很清楚他究竟去了哪儿……\n\n塔纳拉辛？坦克利斯？塔纳里萨尼？\n\n<莉芙摇着头。>\n\n不，名字不是这样……"
G["Hiya, $g babe : hon;! What's this I hear about you and $g Candy : Chip;?"]="嘿你好啊，宝贝儿！你和$g小甜甜:奇普;的传闻是怎么回事？"
G["Hm, hungry."]="啊，饿。"
G["Hm, the pressure must be alleviated somewhat..."]="嗯，要略微降低压力才行……"
G["Hm, these are pretty good bones you got this time, Pozzik."]="嗯，这次你拿来的骨头很合适，普兹克。"
G["Hm, unannounced visitors. Preparations must be made..."]="啊，不速之客。我得准备一下……"
G["Hm-wha? Stowaways!"]="嗯——什么？入侵者！"
G["Hm. Good."]="唔。很好。"
G["Hm. I used to think leadership was all about strength. I see things more clearly now - it's a little bit of give, a little bit of take. It's about binding people together. A bundle of sticks is not easily broken."]="我曾经以为领导力就是力量。现在我明白多了——付出才有回报。领导者要将人民团结起来。正所谓独木不成林。"
G["Hm..."]="嗯……"
G["Hm... I don't think this blinking red light is a good thing..."]="嗯……我不认为那个红色的闪光是个好兆头……"
G["Hm... don't get many $cs up this way..."]="Hm... no se encuentra a muchos de tu clase por aquí..."
G["Hm... if you're looking to adle wits, $n, then the secret behind Zanzil's zombies might just do the trick!"]="嗯……如果你注意到这些细节问题，$n，那么隐藏在赞吉尔僵尸背后的秘密也许就是元凶！"
G["Hm... yes, I do have a recipe you might find useful.  Let me teach you!"]="嗯……对，我这里确实有一些挺有用的菜谱。让我来教你吧！"
G["Hm...after dropping this off, I think I'll head to that cheese shop for a snack."]="嗯……等搞定这些，我就要去奶酪店吃点东西。"
G["Hm...it is good that you brought this to me, $n."]="嗯……很感谢你能把这个东西交给我，$n。"
G["Hm?"]="嗯？"
G["Hm? You found something, boy?"]="嗯？你找到什么了吗，小子？"
G["Hmm, I don't have any mithril casings. I'm all out. Is that all you need to get to fix A-Me? Oh, that would be fantastic!\n\nMithril casings aren't too hard to find back in civilization. Just ask any skilled engineer to make one for you. I think it takes a few bars of mithril, but if you could help me out, I'll make sure you're well rewarded!"]="嗯，我没有任何秘银外壳。我尽力了。只要有那个就可以修理A-Me 01了吗？哦，太好了！\n\n秘银外壳并不是很难找到。只需请一个技艺高超的技师为你制造一个就可以了。我想那可能需要几块秘银，但是如果你能帮我，我保证你会得到丰厚奖赏的！"
G["Hmm, I guess I can take on another student. Well, don't just stand there. Tell me what you're looking to learn."]="嗯，我想我可以再收一个学生。好吧，不要傻站在那里。告诉我你想学什么。"
G["Hmm, I have an idea. An old brewmaster trick..."]="啊，我想起来了。我有个祖传的酿酒师独门秘方……"
G["Hmm, I know I saw it around here somewhere, but are you sure? That thing turns the user into a brute instead of projecting an image of one about fifty percent of the time. And then they explode!"]="嗯，我应该是在这里见过它，但你确定吗？那东西并不只是会将使用者的外形放大百分之五十，而是会把使用者变成怪物，然后还会让使用者爆炸！"
G["Hmm, I suppose it could work.  But it could really use a little more umph!"]="嗯，我猜它可能会有用。但它至少还要再诱人一些！"
G["Hmm, arcane annihilators are pretty tough.  I wonder if Papa Wheeler knows what he's asking for?"]="唔，奥术歼灭者非常厉害，我怀疑维勒老爹是否知道他在悬赏什么？"
G["Hmm, did you hear something lads?"]="嗯，听到动静了吗，伙计们？"
G["Hmm, don't mind if I do!"]="嗯，你不介意我这样做吧！"
G["Hmm, fair enough, troll. Can't be any worse than the grog they serve around here..."]="嗯，听我说。它不会比这里出售的掺水烈酒更难喝……"
G["Hmm, good treasure."]="嗯，好多财宝。"
G["Hmm, it could be that meddler Shaw. I will see what I can discover. Be off with you. I'll contact you again soon."]="嗯，可能就是那个爱管闲事的肖尔，我要去看看能找到些什么。回头再联系吧。"
G["Hmm, it would seem Keever needs a new subject. If that fool Abernathy keeps taking Keever's subjects, Keever may have to have a word with him."]="嗯，看来基佛需要一个新的项目。如果那个笨蛋阿博纳斯继续从基佛手里抢项目，基佛肯定会对他有意见的。"
G["Hmm, looks like I've been programmed to... <sigh> Self-Destruct."]="Mmm, parece que me han programado para... <suspiro> autodestruirme."
G["Hmm, maybe it's this one - oh by the way, did I ever tell you about the time Fudgerick Two-toots snuck up on me while I was casting a fireball? We call him two-toots because, well, nevermind that, it was just terrible timing, and momma was soo mad - my eyebrows are just now growing back...."]="唔，或许是这个吧——顺便提一句，我有没有告诉过你“双响喇叭”法迪利克的事？有一次这家伙趁我搓火球时在我背后吓我。我们之所以叫他“双响喇叭”是因为，啊……当我没说吧。那次事件搞得妈妈非常生气，瞧，我的眉毛到现在也没长出来……"
G["Hmm, perhaps there is something...\n\nWe were just about to dine when you delivered the king's command. I imagine a little sustenance might provide some extra energy.\n\nAlso, come to think of it, we could use a little more wood for our spikes. Perhaps you could collect some?\n\nThen... well there's... oh, nevermind."]="唔，我们或许可以想想办法……\n\n你把国王的指令送来时，我们正要开饭。我想，一些食物或许能让大家多些动力。\n\n还有，我想起来了，我们的尖刺还需要一些木头。你能帮我们去收集一些吗？\n\n然后……嗯……哦，还是算了吧。"
G["Hmm, thank you stranger."]="陌生人，谢谢你。"
G["Hmm, that's strange, $c. I would have thought you'd have found something connected with those scourging crystals.\n\nWe really should find a way to bring down their shields and destroy them. You think you could go back out there and kill some more Scourge until you find something?"]="$c，真是奇怪。我以为你已经发现了与天灾水晶关联的东西。\n\n我们必须设法关闭水晶的护盾，然后彻底摧毁它们。在你有所发现之前不如再回去多杀些天灾军团的成员？"
G["Hmm, this will give me shomething to focush on for my next predikshun."]="嗯……这会给我一些提示，以便我专注于下一次预测。"
G["Hmm, well on second thought..."]="唔，再好好想想……"
G["Hmm, well, I can see that you have a little skill at making potions. Whether you're worthy to be my student remains to be seen, however. I have a job for you. Impress me."]="Umm... bien, puedo ver que sabes algo de preparar pociones. Pero aún hay que ver si mereces ser mi $galumno:alumna;. Tengo un trabajo para ti. Convénceme."
G["Hmm, what was that? I'm sorry my dear, I must have been daydreaming."]="唔，那是什么？对不起，亲爱的，我肯定是在做白日梦。"
G["Hmm, you scratch my back, I'll scratch yours. If you do what I ask, and do it well, maybe we can discuss your training."]="嗯，你若帮我，我就帮你。如果找我要求的做，并做得很漂亮，或许我们可以谈谈你训练的问题。"
G["Hmm, you want... me?"]="你想让……我来？"
G["Hmm, your work is allright but it's nowhere near the quality I look for in a student. Go talk with Smith Argus in Goldshire, I'm sure he can teach you some basics. Then when you're done, come on back to me and I'll give you a little test to make sure you are ready."]="Ummm... tu trabajo está bien pero ni siquiera se acerca a la calidad que busco en un alumno. Ve a hablar con el herrero Argus de Villadorada, estoy seguro de que puede enseñarte lo más básico. Cuando hayas terminado, vuelve aquí y te haré una prueba para ver si estás $gpreparado:preparada;."
G["Hmm."]="唔。"
G["Hmm.\n\n<You wait patiently for Chief Kah Kah to think, then wait some more for him to speak.>\n\nKah Kah have many nephews. They all have earned their name name.\n\nGrookin home to one who has not yet earned his name name....\n\nRiko been a little too frisky - even for a hozen. Maybe long walk do him some good."]="唔。\n\n<你耐心地等待酋长卡哈卡哈思考完，又等了一会儿，才听到他开口。>\n\n卡哈卡哈有许多子侄。他们都没给卡哈卡哈丢脸。\n\n古鲁金家族里只有一个家伙败坏了卡哈卡哈的名声……\n\n即便是对于猢狲来说，里克也显得太不安分了。也许到外面多走走能把他拉回正道上来。"
G["Hmm. A $c is interesting, but let us see how well you do against the Wrestler or Master Boom Boom."]="Hmm. $gUn:Una; $c es interesante, pero veamos cómo te las apañas contra El Luchador o el maestro Bum Bum."
G["Hmm. Dat's not da one. Let's try one o' da other vases."]="呼，不是那个，让我们再试试其他的罐子。"
G["Hmm. I never really liked that place. The outhouses were always dirty."]="嗯。我从未真正喜欢过那里。厕所里总是脏兮兮的。"
G["Hmm. I think that one is going to need some extra perfuming."]="嗯。我想得把它弄得更香一些。"
G["Hmm. Only 2 tons of explosives for this mission? Seems a bit light to me. This seems like the kind of mission we are going to need way more explosives for. Like... goblin pyromaniac explosives."]="呃。执行这任务才有两吨炸药？分量不够啊。完成这种使命光靠这么点儿炸药怎么行。起码得请……地精纵火型炸药出马。"
G["Hmm. Some say the rope is a crutch..."]="嗯，有人说绳子就是生命……"
G["Hmm. Telemetry seems to be off."]="唔。遥测功能好像关闭了。"
G["Hmm. That's actually some pretty good engineering down there. It's Disruptron time!"]="嗯。接下来这位是名符其实的工程学杰作。下面是，干涉者时间！"
G["Hmm. The significance of this bird eludes me."]="嗯。我还是不明白这只鸟的含义。"
G["Hmm. These Demolishers seem to have a serious weakness to rockets. Send in the copters!"]="唔。这些歼灭者在火箭弹面前有着致命的弱点。呼叫直升机！"
G["Hmm. What armor..."]="嗯。什么护甲……"
G["Hmm. What to make first? Incense? Campfire logs? Everburning candle?"]="嗯。首先应该做什么？熏香？营火原木？永燃蜡烛？"
G["Hmm. You don't look very tough... but okay."]="嗯，你看上去不是很强壮……不过应该还成。"
G["Hmm..."]="嗯……"
G["Hmm...  The beast looks smaller than I would have thought."]="嗯……这头野兽比我想的要小。"
G["Hmm... I can't remember which way to go here.  Let's try this side!"]="嗯……我不记得该走哪条路了。我们试试这边吧！"
G["Hmm... I didn't go this direction.  I think I'm telling the story wrong."]="嗯……我走的不是这个方向。我想我的确是把故事讲错了。"
G["Hmm... I have no idea."]="嗯……我不清楚。"
G["Hmm... I recall seeing such script on the Nathrezim homeworld. I cannot read it and I doubt any of your kind could either."]="嗯……我曾在纳斯雷兹姆的家乡见过这些文字。我无法读懂这些文字，你的族人应该也不行。"
G["Hmm... I think this year's Suntouched Special isn't so special after all.  Wouldn't you agree, $n?"]="我觉得今年的日光陈酿不是那么好喝。你觉得呢，$n？"
G["Hmm... I wonder..."]="唔……我觉得……"
G["Hmm... If I mix some pale with a stou...\nOh, yes. Hello!"]="Mmm... Si mezclo algo de rubia con negr... \n\nAh, ¡hola!"
G["Hmm... Interesting."]="嗯……真有趣。"
G["Hmm... It seems that the syncotron unit we've been using has had no noticeable effect on the gravimetric or gravitronic distortions in this sector."]="嗯……似乎我们使用的同步加速单元对这片区域的引力扭曲或是真空状态都没有产生显著的影响。"
G["Hmm... No one here specializes in fresh bread..."]="唔……这里没有人专门制作新鲜面包……"
G["Hmm... That rock is nice, but too small."]="嗯……那块石头很不错，但是太小了一点。"
G["Hmm... Troteman may have gotten himself in over his head. We'll split up."]="托德曼恐怕已经自顾不暇了。我们得分兵。"
G["Hmm... a shame to lose that experiment."]="失去这个实验品可真遗憾……"
G["Hmm... according to this codex, the Korune mogu are attempting to harness the very power of the sha. And now we know exactly where they are doing so. Well done, $n."]="嗯……根据这份抄本所说，寇茹魔古试图掌握煞魔的力量。而且，我们还知道了他们确切的活动地点。干得好，$n。"
G["Hmm... according to this codex, the Korune mogu are attempting to harness the very power of the sha. This map shows us their very location! Well done, $n. You have helped us enough for today."]="嗯……根据这份抄本所说，寇茹魔古试图掌握煞魔的力量。这张地图就标出了他们的位置！干得好，$n。你今天可帮了我们大忙了。"
G["Hmm... are you new around here...?"]="Mmmm... ¿Eres $gnuevo:nueva; por aquí?"
G["Hmm... interesting choice of parts."]="嗯……这样选择零件可真有趣。"
G["Hmm... it's not in this stack. Maybe I left it on the shelf."]="不在这一堆里面。也许我把它留在书架上了。"
G["Hmm... maybe a pinch of pandaren?"]="嗯……也许是一小撮熊猫人？"
G["Hmm... maybe over there."]="嗯……可能在那儿。"
G["Hmm... no path. Guess I'll have to Randall P. swim."]="嗯……无路可走。看来兰达尔·P·沃克得游泳了。"
G["Hmm... old coins... ugly jewelry..."]="嗯……古老的钱币……难看的珠宝……"
G["Hmm... something familiar about your face $r...  Give me a moment...\n\nAh ha! Westfall, that's where I recognize you from.  You are $n!  It's good to see you again.  But, let's hope you can help us finish the job this time.\n\nNow we're a long way from Westfall up here, but if we don't win this battle, there may not be a home to return to."]="嗯……你有点面熟……让我想想……\n\n哈哈！西部荒野！我在西部荒野见过你。你是$n！咱们又见面啦，希望你能再次伸出援手。\n\n这里离西部荒野非常遥远，但是如果我们打不赢这一战，恐怕就要无家可归了。"
G["Hmm... that Kekek very old. Must be elder, leader of Frenzyheart. This good. Kekek have good future as warrior and leader. Kekek very happy you bring him here. Orphan-lady never do that for Kekek."]="嗯……那个科科已经非常老了。而狂心氏族的首领一定要更老一些。这很不错。作为战士和首领，科科有着美好的未来。科科很高兴你能带他参观这里。孤儿院的阿姨从不带科科来。"
G["Hmm... the Omnotron Defense System. Centuries ago these constructs were considered the Dwarves' greatest technical achievements. With so many counters to each construct's attacks, I'll have to rectify these designs for them to provide me any entertainment."]="嗯……“全能金刚防御系统”。几个世纪前，这些粗糙的魔像阵列组还被称为矮人技术的杰作，殊不知每个单独的魔像都能被轻易反制。我不得不亲自修正那些设计缺陷，才能让它们给我提供些娱乐。"
G["Hmm... the readings on the gravimeteric distortions seem to have stabalized.  We did it!"]="恩……引力扭曲指数看上去稳定了。我们成功了！"
G["Hmm... the things you need to learn are a little above my head. Have a talk with Sellandus over at Larson's Clothiers just up the path to the right. He taught me everything I know!"]="嗯……你需要学的东西有点超出我的能耐了。去找那边的塞拉多斯谈谈。我会的东西全是他教的！"
G["Hmm... this one smells kinda funny."]="唔……这东西闻起来很有趣。"
G["Hmm... very impressive.  Alright, you've passed my test."]="嗯……非常精彩。好了，你通过了我的测试。"
G["Hmm... well you seem capable enough. If you truly desire to learn, then nothing will stand in your way! I will guide you through your first steps on what I hope will be a long and fulfilling path."]="Umm... pareces $gcapacitado:capacitada;. ¡Si de verdad deseas aprender, nada se pondrá en tu camino! Te guiaré en los últimos pasos y espero que sea un camino largo y provechoso."
G["Hmm... well, I can't help you quite yet! You have to learn the basics first. Why don't you go see Sprite Jumpsprocket in Stormwind!"]="嗯……好吧，我现在还帮不到你！你必须先学习基础知识。你为什么不去见见暴风城的斯普莱特呢！"
G["Hmm... well, just be careful, he might be sweet on you. I don't trust that sister of his either..."]="嗯……好吧，小心点，他可能爱上你了。我也不太相信他那个姐姐……"
G["Hmm... you show a little promise, I'll give you that. Okay then, where were we?"]="嗯……看来还有点希望，我会把那个给你的。那好吧，我们在哪里？"
G["Hmm... you're second in line. Won't be long now."]="A ver... eres $gel segundo:la segunda; en la cola. No queda mucho."
G["Hmm... your name sounds familiar to me, $n. \n\nWhat do you want from the Black Temple? Stay a moment and speak with me, rather than skulk about like a rogue."]="嗯……你的名字很耳熟，$n。\n\n你想在黑暗神殿里找到什么？留下跟我谈谈吧，别像个小贼那样鬼鬼祟祟的乱闯。"
G["Hmm...."]="嗯……"
G["Hmm...Frost, Fire, and Arcane defenses respond faster than Batch 7, but Nature defenses remain passive."]="唔……冰霜、火焰和奥术的防御反应比第7批要快，但自然防御仍然很被动。"
G["Hmm?"]="嗯？"
G["Hmm? Oh yes, I can teach you something if you desire. But stay away from Sumi and Tumi, they are not for the likes of you. Saru only let's those of great skill approach his daughters."]="嗯？啊是的，如果你期望的话我可以教你一些东西。但是要离苏米和图米远些，她们不喜欢像你这样的人。萨鲁只让那些技艺高超的人接近他的女儿。"
G["Hmm? Okay..."]="嗯？好吧……"
G["Hmm? Vhat vas zhat?"]="嗯？那是什么？"
G["Hmm? What was that?"]="嗯？那是什么？"
G["Hmm? Yes?  What's that, $n?\n\nPlease, I'm trying to study Quagmirran.  What's left of him anyway."]="嗯？什么？那是什么，$n？\n\n我在尝试研究夸格米拉，或者它剩下的东西。"
G["Hmmm, I reckon I don't know, $r. All I can understand is the part about the valley - that's right here! The Valley of the Four Winds!"]="嗯，我还真不知道呢，$r。我以为是山谷的一部分，就是这里！四风谷！"
G["Hmmm, I think it's time for..."]="嗯，是时候啦……"
G["Hmmm, I think you will need to go up to Thunder Bluff to learn that.  Head north on the road out of Bloodhoof Village.  It will take you to the base of Thunder Bluff.  Ride the elevator to the top and you should be able to ask any of the Bluffwatchers there for further assistance."]="嗯，我觉得你需要到雷霆崖去弄清楚。出了血蹄村沿着公路一直往北走。你会到达雷霆崖的底部。乘升降梯到顶部你就可以向雷霆崖的任何一个守卫寻求进一步的帮助。"
G["Hmmm, I wonder what's over this way?"]="嗯……我想知道这条路能通到什么地方？"
G["Hmmm, I'm afraid I know little of the Klaxxi, but I have heard whispers of their city, Klaxxi'vess, far to the west in the Dread Wastes. Perhaps you can find the Klaxxi Quartermaster there.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="嗯，恐怕我对卡拉克西一无所知，但我听人私下里提到过他们的城市——卡拉克西维斯，就在位于遥远西方的恐惧废土。也许你能在那里找到卡拉克西军需官。\n\n我会在你的地图上标出位置。"
G["Hmmm, dead already?  I wonder if a session of micro-sonic deep-gene probing can reanimate them..."]="唔，已经死了？我在想，微波深度基因探测能不能让他们复苏……"
G["Hmmm, it sounds like the Kunzen hozen are causing quite a lot of trouble for Mr. Mudclaw. Maybe we can help."]="嗯，听起来昆森猢狲给泥爪先生添了不少麻烦。也许我们能帮得上忙。"
G["Hmmm, maybe I should have taken the cart in for its tune-up after all."]="嗯，也许我应该将小货车带来，这样操作起来会更方便一些。"
G["Hmmm, once again I've forgotten who I am and what I'm doing here. Call me back if anything comes up."]="嗯，我又一次忘记了自己是谁，正在这里做什么。如果出了什么事，就来叫我吧。"
G["Hmmm, p'rhaps I'll rest these old bones for a bit."]="嗯，瞧我这身老骨头，看来该休息一会儿啦。"
G["Hmmm, perhaps I was wrong about you, stranger."]="Mmmm... A lo mejor me equivoqué contigo, $gforastero:forastera;."
G["Hmmm, that good idea.  Maybe we head there to get some stitches replaced?  Him sew good.  You find Josef Gregorian on inner circle of Magic Quarter."]="嗯，那是个好主意。或许我们该到那儿去换一下我们身上的线？他的针线活做得很好。你可以在魔法区的内环里找到乔瑟夫·格里高利。"
G["Hmmm, this is excellent! EXCELLENT! This is the best stuff I've tasted in a long time. Who brewed it?"]="嗯，这味道好极了！好极了！这是我这么长时间以来尝到的最好的东西。是谁酿造的？"
G["Hmmm, this one looks like something that would be better off as a windchime. Take notes class... This is NOT what you want to summon in the heat of battle."]="嗯，这东西看起来做成风铃更合适。做好笔记，学生们……冲锋厮杀时你们可不能召唤出这样的玩意儿来。"
G["Hmmm, well what is it that brings you to these parts?"]="嗯，你怎么会来到这里的？"
G["Hmmm."]="唔……"
G["Hmmm. This runestone speaks of mogu savagery. They fell apart into warrior clans. But one King was more ambitious than the others - Lei Shen. The Thunder King. When the Titan Keeper fell silent, Lei Shen decided to speak for him."]="嗯。这里记录了魔古族早期的历史。他们分裂成数个部落。可有一位王者特别野心勃勃——雷电之王，雷神。泰坦守护者沉寂之后，雷神决心代他发号施令。"
G["Hmmm...  This stairway does not look promising at all.  Let's head back to the courtyard and see if there is another way out."]="嗯……这楼梯看起来也不怎么靠谱。我们返回庭院，研究下是否还有别的路可走。"
G["Hmmm... I have a crazy idea that just might work, but we'll need your help heroes!"]="唔……我想到一个疯狂的主意，但这需要你们的帮助，英雄们。"
G["Hmmm... I think I need better bait. I'll check my father's wagon."]="嗯……我觉得我需要更好的诱饵。我得去我父亲的货车中找找。"
G["Hmmm... Where is my fishing hook? Oh, there it is."]="嗯……我的鱼杆在哪儿呢？哦，在那儿。"
G["Hmmm... looks like I'm going to need a new test subject."]="唔……好像我需要一个新的测试课题。"
G["Hmmm... only enchanters I know of around here work out of Stormwind.  Why don't you ask one of the guards up in Stormwind?"]="嗯……这附近唯一有附魔训练师的地方就是暴风城了。你为什么不问一下暴风城的守卫呢？"
G["Hmmm... this nether radiation could prove to be quite deadly.  But it could be even deadlier to  just ignore it.  I'll need some more readings to confirm this."]="唔……这种虚空辐射被证明是十分致命的。如果我们忽视了它，那就会更加致命。我需要更多信息来确定这一点。"
G["Hmmmm, only a little bit of activity on the surface but the sun is in the right place. Might turn out to be a fine day."]="恩……水面上虽然看不出什么动静，但是今天天气不错，我的运气也应该不错。"
G["Hmmmm..."]="嗯……"
G["Hmmmm... That one clipped it's shoulder. Grumlar was right, the sights are slightly off. Easy enough for me to fix though."]="嗯……格鲁姆拉说对了，准心好像是有些偏，不过很容易就能修好。"
G["Hmmmm... aye. But it's a wee bit - uh - wee, innit?"]="嗯……确实。不过这只是很少一点……唔……非常少，对不对？"
G["Hmmmm... it doesn't look like there's anything over here. Try circling around to the back of the manor."]="唔……这儿似乎什么都没有。试试绕到庄园背后去。"
G["Hmmmm... no valuable information there."]="嗯……这儿没有有用的信息。"
G["Hmmmm...."]="嗯……"
G["Hmph! A lucky blow against an unprepared opponent."]="哼！瞎猫碰到死耗子而已。"
G["Hmph! I didn't even hit the blasted target! That thick skulled dwarf was probably using the gun as a mace again."]="该死！我没有击中目标！那个愚蠢的矮人可能又把枪当锤使了。"
G["Hmph! What a sorry day for fishin' this is going to be. Ah well, a bad day fishin' is better then a good day workin'."]="唉！今天看来真的不适合钓鱼。不过什么都钓不上也比干一天活要好。"
G["Hmph, no doubt she believes herself to be the new mistress of Stonard.  Perhaps we should offer to help her succubi tidy up her messes?"]="嗯，显然她以为自己是斯通纳德的新主人了。也许我们应该去帮她的魅魔打扫房间？"
G["Hmph. I suppose these are the consequences of magic. You reap what you sew ... Elune help us all."]="嗯，我想这是魔法作用的结果。你收获了你所见到的一切……愿艾露恩保佑我们。"
G["Hmph. Those mogu will have to try harder than that!\n\nThe Golden Lotus will defend the Vale... no matter the cost.\n\nThe secrets that we guard are much too precious... much too powerful... to allow into the hands of the Shao-Tien!"]="哼，那些魔古族得再加把劲了！\n\n金莲教会死守山谷……不惜任何代价。\n\n我们守护的秘密太过珍贵……太过强大……决不能落入韶天之手！"
G["Hmph. Too easy."]="哼。轻而易举。"
G["Hmph. Y'all any good at fightin' virmen?"]="嗯，你们能对付兔妖吗？"
G["Hmph... quitter."]="哼……懦夫。"
G["Ho boy, more saurok. They always seek high ground when the rains hit!"]="呵，小子，出现了更多蜥蜴人。雨水落下时，他们总是喜欢到高处去！"
G["Ho diddly whoa diddly dee"]="\"Te quiero\", fueron palabras suyas."
G["Ho there, and welcome to Brewfest!"]="嗨，欢迎来到美酒节！"
G["Ho, $c, welcome to the eastern temple! Make yourself at home."]="Hola, $c, ¡$gbienvenido:bienvenida; al Templo Oriental! Ponte $gcómodo:cómoda;."
G["Ho, $n! My brother Balgor tells me you're quite the shot from the back of a kodo. Great work getting that caravan here from Far Watch in one piece.\n\nListen, there's plenty of work for you here in Grol'dom... but I could use your trigger fingers for the rest of the ride to Crossroads.\n\nCome see me when you're ready!"]="¡Eh, $n! Mi hermano Balgor me dice que demuestras gran puntería desde el lomo de un kodo. Has hecho un buen trabajo al conseguir traer la caravana desde la Avanzada del Puente de una pieza.\n\nEscucha, en Grol'dom hay un montón de trabajo para ti... Pero podrían venirme bien tus ágiles dedos en el gatillo durante el resto del viaje hasta El Cruce.\n\n¡Ven a verme cuando quieras partir!"
G["Ho, $n! That was some big mess you cleaned up! Well, I'd say you did your \"duty\" for the day. Go and get some rest. Plenty to do here tomorrow!"]="¡Hola, $n! ¡Menudo asunto que acabas de solucionar! Si quieres mi opinión, por hoy ya has cumplido con tu \"deber\". Ve a descansar un rato. ¡Mañana habrá trabajo de sobra!"
G["Ho, Nagala! How about some lunch for your starving brother?"]="哦，娜格拉！给你饥饿的兄弟来些午餐如何？"
G["Ho, Yoon! Is it true? Did your plan work?"]="嘿，老愚！是真的吗？你的计划成功了？"
G["Ho, did they send more reinforcements from Stormwind? $C on the field!"]="嚯，他们从暴风城派援军来了吗？$C都上战场了！"
G["Ho, ho! That had to hurt!"]="哼哼！一定很疼吧！"
G["Hoary Templar!  I hold your crest of beckoning.  Heed my summons!"]="苍白圣殿骑士！我手中握着你的召唤纹章。响应我的召唤吧！"
G["Hobart's jaw hits the ground."]="霍巴特的下巴撞到地上。"
G["Hobart's right behind you, $g sir : ma'am;."]="霍巴特就在你身后，$g阁下:女士;。"
G["Hobart, I need more single-stage booster rockets!"]="霍巴特，我需要更多单级助推火箭！"
G["Hodir's Fury online. Acquiring target."]="已启动霍迪尔之怒。正在获取目标。"
G["Hodir's sigil appears to be located inside a cache of artifacts."]="霍迪尔的徽记被放在一只用来保存神器的宝箱中。"
G["Hoff... out..."]="霍夫……完了……"
G["Hogger enrages!"]="霍格愤怒了！"
G["Hogger is eating!  Stop him!"]="霍格正在恢复生命！阻止他！"
G["Hogger is stunned!"]="霍格昏迷了！"
G["Hoh-hohhh! What a rush! I like you, $c. You keep things interesting."]="¡Uooo! ¡Qué emoción! Me caes bien, contigo pasan cosas interesantes."
G["Hoha! I'd welcome the challenge from old weakbelly!"]="好啊！让那老家伙试试看啊！"
