G["Hold Goregek back, slave thing! I going to beat up big-tongue bad! Hold Goregek back!"]="奴隶，看好格利基克身后！我要好好地惩罚一下大舌头怪！要帮格利基克留神背后！"
G["Hold On!"]="坚持住！"
G["Hold back! You're just mindlessly walking to your deaths!  I must think..."]="后退！你们这是在往死路上撞啊！我得想想……"
G["Hold everything - the walls of Northwatch have been breached! We're under attack!"]="固守阵地。北方城堡的城墙被打破了！我们遭到了攻击！"
G["Hold everything! The Aesir and Vanir went to war? Why?"]="等等！等等！你是说艾塞尔与瓦尼尔之间爆发了战争？为什么？"
G["Hold fast, $c. This is for yer own protection."]="紧紧抓住，$c。这样你才能保护好自己。"
G["Hold it in your heart, and make it happen. Dreamers change the world."]="珍藏于心，努力实现。梦想家有着改变世界的力量。"
G["Hold it now. Let's not rush in."]="稳住，不要鲁莽。"
G["Hold it!"]="握紧它！"
G["Hold it! Stop!"]="喂！站住！"
G["Hold it, $r! I promised told ye where the treasure is, but never promised ye could keep it!"]="拿着它，$r！我承诺过会告诉你宝藏在哪里，但从没有承诺过会让你拥有它！"
G["Hold nothing back, for I will not!"]="我可不会留情面！"
G["Hold off the Zan'thik while Rik'kal the Dissector gathers his strength!"]="在切割者里卡尔积聚力量时拖住扎尼提克！"
G["Hold off the mantid!  This will not take long."]="控制住螳螂妖！这不会要太多时间。"
