G["Hold on there, I'm just an assistant. If ye want to start learnin' the fancy stuff, talk to old Stonebrew over there."]="等一下，我只是一个助手。如果你想学那些花哨的东西，找那边的老约莫德·石眉谈谈。"
G["Hold on tight back there! Seat belts are for chumps."]="稳住身体，不要惊慌！安全带是给傻瓜用的。"
G["Hold on tight!"]="抓紧了！"
G["Hold on tight!\n|TInterface\\Icons\\misc_arrowlup.blp:32|t"]="¡Agárrate fuerte!\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\misc_arrowlup.blp:32|t"
G["Hold on tight! I'll take care of the flying, you focus on the wildlife below."]="紧紧抓住！我来负责飞行控制，你要集中精力注意下面的野生动物。"
G["Hold on tight, it's gonna be a bumpy ride. Be on the lookout for night elves!"]="抓紧了，这一路可会相当颠簸。密切留意暗夜精灵！"
G["Hold on tight. Here we go!"]="握紧了，我们出发吧！"
G["Hold on to yer hats!"]="都给我抓紧了！"
G["Hold on!"]="坚持住！"
G["Hold on! This is gonna be a bumpy ride!"]="坚持住！这会是一次颠簸的旅程！"
G["Hold on, $n! This won't be easy!"]="坚持住，$n！这可不是容易的事情！"
G["Hold on, $r!"]="坚持住，$r！"
G["Hold on, Gobbles! Shtand back everyvone!"]="坚持住，哥培尔！所有人都向后站！"
G["Hold on, I will break you out of those barrels."]="坚持住，我会把你们从桶里弄出来。"
G["Hold on, friend. Tell me what happened here."]="坚持住，朋友。告诉我究竟发生了什么事。"
G["Hold on, little $r."]="Aguanta, $gpequeño:pequeña; $r."
G["Hold on, the updraft from the fires can be fierce."]="稳住，火焰产生的上升气流非常猛烈。"
G["Hold out? Against a full frontal assault from the legion's vanguard? Not likely!\n\nNo, history doesn't record what happened next... for there were no survivors. The raging demons left little more than the ruins you see today, and the secrets of the academy lay buried under the soil of Azshara."]="挡住？面对燃烧军团先锋的全力进攻？这根本不可能！\n\n不，历史没有记录后来发生了什么……那里已经不再有幸存者了。狂暴的恶魔只留下了你今天所看到的这些废墟。学院的秘密就深埋在这片艾萨拉的泥土中。"
G["Hold positions!  Keep vrykul men back!"]="守住防线！把维库人赶回去！"
G["Hold steady, everyone. One step forward is all we need."]="大家坚持住。我们只需要再前进一步。"
G["Hold still, beast!"]="不要动，野兽！"
G["Hold still, it will be over soon..."]="别动，很快就过去了……"
G["Hold still, this won't hurt a bit!"]="别动，这一点儿都不疼！"
G["Hold still."]="别动。"
G["Hold still..."]="别动……"
G["Hold the barricades!  Do not give them an inch!"]="守住工事！绝不让他们前进一寸！"
G["Hold the line!"]="守住阵线！"
G["Hold the line!  Protect the King at all costs!"]="坚守防线！不惜一切代价保卫国王陛下！"
G["Hold the line!  They must not break through!"]="守住阵线！绝不能让他们突破！"
G["Hold the line! Don't let them through!"]="守住战线！不要让他们通过！"
G["Hold the line! Legion, focus fire at the gates!"]="坚守防线！全军注意，向城门开火！"
G["Hold the line! They must not get through!"]="坚守阵地！不要放过一个敌人！"
G["Hold the line, sailors! Your brothers depend on you!"]="坚持住，水手们！为了兄弟姐妹们！"
G["Hold the line, soldiers! Do not give them quarter! Do not let them pass!"]="守住阵线，士兵们！不要给敌人任何的机会！别让他们通过！"
G["Hold the ruins. Slay them where they stand!"]="守住废墟！杀了他们！"
G["Hold them back as long as possible!"]="尽全力挡住他们！"
G["Hold them back as long as you can!"]="尽全力多拖住一会儿！"
G["Hold them back at all costs!"]="不惜一切代价，顶住！"
G["Hold them back!  For Gilneas!"]="击退他们！为了吉尔尼斯！"
G["Hold them back!  We must protect the survivors!"]="挡住他们！我们必须保护幸存者！"
G["Hold them back! Do not falter!"]="守住防线！不要退后半步!"
G["Hold them back! Keep them away from the temple!"]="挡住他们！绝不能让他们靠近神殿！"
G["Hold them back! We need to buy more time!"]="击退他们！我们得争取时间！"
G["Hold them off - just hold them off. The Archmage has a plan."]="挡住他们，一定要挡住他们。大法师已经有了计划。"
G["Hold them off! Protect the archers!"]="阻击他们！保护弓箭手！"
G["Hold this ground, Blood Guard. Here is where we will build our keep. Expect peons within the hour, and be ready to motivate them."]="守住这里，血卫士。我们将在这里建造要塞。劳工将在一小时内到达，注意激励士气。"
G["Hold this rope and don't be heavy."]="Sujeta esta cuerda y no seas $gpesado:pesada;."
G["Hold tight! I am coming!"]="坚持住，我来了！"
G["Hold tight, the air currents here are deadly."]="抓紧了，这里的气流很危险。"
G["Hold up - there's somethin' dere."]="小心——那里有东西。"
G["Hold up... I don't like the looks of this..."]="等等……好像有些不对劲……"
G["Hold yer positions, men!  We can outlast 'em!"]="坚守阵地，兄弟们！胜利属于我们！"
G["Hold your attacks while the shield is up!"]="当护盾升起来的时候停止攻击！"
G["Hold your blade, adventurer!"]="握紧你的武器，冒险者！"
G["Hold your fire!"]="停止攻击！"
G["Hold your fire! Warden's orders..no shootin'...yet."]="停火！这是典狱官的命令……禁止射击……"
G["Hold your ground!"]="坚守不退！"
G["Hold your ground! Hold your ground! Sons of the Alliance!  Of the Horde! My brothers and sisters!  I see in your eyes the same fear that would wither my own heart. A day may come when our courage fails, when we forsake our friends and break our fellowships... but it is not this day."]="坚守你们的阵地！坚守你们的阵地！联盟的子民们！部落的子民们！我的兄弟姐妹们！在你们的眼中，我看到了同样存在于我心中的恐惧。也许某一天我们的勇气会消逝，也许我们会遗弃自己的朋友，也许我们的友谊会荡然无存……但决不是今天。"
G["Hold your ground, men."]="伙计们，守住阵地。"
G["Hold your ground, soldiers! Here they come!"]="坚守阵地，战士们！他们来了！"
G["Hold your ground. We Wildhammer go down fighting to the end!"]="坚守阵地。蛮锤氏族战至最后一息也不后退！"
G["Hold your horses, friend.  We'll hit them when we're all ready."]="别着急，朋友。等大家都准备好，我们就会出击。"
G["Hold your positions as long as you can!"]="尽全力死守你们的阵地！"
G["Hold your positions!"]="坚守阵地！"
G["Hold your positions, men!"]="坚守战线，弟兄们！"
G["Hold your sword, Mei. There are too many of them - and if you die, what of my son?"]="继续持剑作战，阿梅。他们人太多了——万一你死了，我的儿子怎么办？"
G["Hold your tongue, blood elf! You dare question our Warchief's judgment?"]="管好你的舌头，血精灵！你竟敢质疑酋长的决定？"
G["Hold your tongue, knave!  Do not dare use that tone with a priestess of the Light!"]="闭嘴，你这混蛋！不要用那种语调和圣光的女祭司说话！"
G["Hold your weapons!"]="收起武器！"
G["Hold! I sense an evil presence... Undead!"]="小心！我感到附近有邪恶的存在……亡灵！"
G["Hold! Let dem run away. Hellscream will execute dem as cowards if they go back. Sen'jin Village is safe!"]="住手！别追了。如果他们敢回去，地狱咆哮会把他们当作懦夫处死的。森金村安全了！"
G["Hold, $n!  I'm guarding these barrels, so ... look, but don't touch!"]="站住，$n！我在看守这些桶，所以……不要碰它们！"
G["Hold, friends! There is information to be had before this devil meets his fate!"]="等等，朋友们！送这只恶魔下地狱之前，我还有些事要问它。"
G["Hold, lad. There's an inscription on the dais. It's a warning. It says, \"Whomsoever takes up this blade shall wield power eternal. Just as the blade rends flesh, so must power scar the spirit.\" Oh, I should've known. The blade is cursed! Let's get the hell out of here!"]="Espera, chico. Hay una inscripción en la peana. Es una advertencia. Dice: \"Quien coja esta hoja obtendrá el poder eterno. Al igual que la espada desgarra la carne, su poder hiere el espíritu\". Debí haberlo sabido. ¡La hoja está maldita! ¡Larguémonos de aquí!"
G["Holding his nose, %s scoops up the dung and places it in his bucket."]="%s捏住鼻子，把挖出的粪便放在他的篮子里面。"
G["Holding me here is not the right decision, Marcus."]="把我挡在这里可不是明智的决定，马库斯。"
G["Holds mistletoe over $g his : her; head"]="Sujeta una rama de muérdago por encima de su cabeza."
G["Holia Sunshield."]="霍利亚·萨希尔德。"
G["Holiday - Scourge Invasion, mystic - how long, Tier 0"]="Fiesta - Invasión de la Plaga, mística - duración, Nivel 0"
G["Holiday - Scourge Invasion, mystic - how long, Tier 1"]="Fiesta - Invasión de la Plaga, mística - duración, Nivel 1"
G["Holiday - Scourge Invasion, mystic - how long, Tier 2"]="Fiesta - Invasión de la Plaga, mística - duración, Nivel 2"
G["Hollee!"]="霍里！"
G["Holy Cow!  That is Mushgog down there in The Maul."]="神圣的母牛！姆斯高格就在厄运之槌里。"
G["Holy Krakle! The temperature is 428,000 degrees Kraklenheit!"]="天哪！现在的温度是428,000克氏度！"
G["Holy Light! Look what happened to the dam! The other orphans aren't gonna believe this!"]="圣光啊！看看水坝变成了什么样子！其他孤儿肯定不会相信的！"
G["Holy cats! It worked! Soothfancy, come look at this!"]="天哪！它起作用了！纳瑞安，快来看！"
G["Holy moley!"]="我的天哪！"
G["Holy mother of O'ros!"]="沃洛斯在上！天啊！"
G["Holy smokes, it had a mom. Look out, $p!"]="天哪，它妈妈来了。小心，$p！"
G["Holy smokes, this fella swallowed a lot of water. I oughta pick some up."]="天呐，这家伙吞了好多水。我得弄点出来。"
G["Holy... What in the hell is this?"]="圣……这到底是什么？"
G["Home again, home again."]="又回到家了，又回到家了。"
G["Home good, but not stay long! More adventures!"]="家里真好，可惜呆不长！我们要更多的冒险！"
G["Home home home... place of the shinies!"]="家！家！家……闪闪发亮的地方！"
G["Home not far. Come!"]="就快到家啦。走吧！"
G["Home time!"]="终于可以回家啦！"
G["Home! You better have brought back meat for Goregek, slave."]="到家啦！奴隶，你最好为格利基克带回了足够的肉。"
G["Hon, food is ready. Come wash up and eat."]="饭准备好了，快洗洗手过来吃吧。"
G["Honestly, $n... were you even trying?"]="说实话，$n……你到底出力了吗？"
G["Honestly, how do these people keep getting captured? It's massive incompetence, I tell you!\n\nIt almost makes me ashamed to be a goblin.\n\nSpeaking of shame, where's that lazy assistant of mine? No doubt she's just sitting around somewhere doing nothing.\n\nOh the burdens that come with genius. I suppose I'll just have to think us all out of this mess by myself."]="老实说，这些家伙怎么老是会被捉住？真是彻彻底底的无能！\n\n这简直让我为地精的身份而感到羞耻。\n\n说到羞耻，我那个好吃懒做的助手跑哪儿去了？不用猜，她肯定正坐在什么地方发呆呢！\n\n喔，这可真叫做能者多劳。我想只能靠我来想办法帮大家脱困了。"
G["Honey Badger doesn't give a sh*t!"]="蜂蜜獾熊才不管那些烂事！"
G["Honey, you are so kind to me!"]="亲爱的，你对我太好了！"
G["Honey-Bear! I mean... it is about time."]="亲爱的！！我是说……时间快到了。"
G["Honeydew Village is ill-prepared for battle. I hope this fighting ends soon!"]="蜜露村根本没做好战斗的准备。希望这场争斗能尽早结束！"
G["Honeydew Village is run by the Honeydews, but the real heart of the village is the brewery! The brewery belongs to my family, the Honeypaws. Best Honeybrew you'll find anywhere!"]="蜜露村是由蜜露家族管理的，但村子的支柱产业是酿酒！说到酿酒，那可是我蜜掌家族的拿手好戏！你在别处绝对喝不到这么好的蜜酒！"
G["Honor & Conquest Quartermasters"]="荣誉与战利品军需官"
G["Honor Quartermaster"]="荣誉军需官"
G["Honor and loyalty."]="荣耀与忠诚。"
G["Honor and praise will be yours for the taking, $c!  Look for Kurden Bloodclaw in this city's Royal Quarter."]="$c，荣誉和荣耀都将属于你！去皇家区找库尔丁·血爪吧。"
G["Honor guard stay where you are."]="愿荣耀与你同在。"
G["Honor in victory!"]="胜利的荣耀！"
G["Honor is meaningless to a dead man. A warrior may throw himself into battle for honor's sake, but a chieftain is responsible for far more. We will follow Sage Aeire's plan and continue to defend our village."]="对死人而言，荣誉还有什么意义。战士可以为了荣耀投身沙场，但酋长要考虑的问题则要多得多。我们决定采取先知埃恩雷的计划，继续保卫村落。"
G["Honor my ancestors."]="向我们的先祖致敬。"
G["Honor the Earthen Ring bonfire!"]="祭拜大地之环大篝火！"
G["Honor to your house and ancestors, $c!  You will find Kartra Bloodsnarl inside the Hall of the Brave in the Valley of Honor."]="向你的先祖致敬，$c！你可以去荣誉谷的勇士大厅找卡尔特拉·血喉。"
G["Honor your heroes! On this day, they have dealt a great blow against one of our most hated enemies! The false Warchief, Rend Blackhand, has fallen!"]="为你们的英雄而欢庆！就在今天，他们给了我们最可恨的一个敌人一次重击！那个假的酋长，雷德·黑手，已经倒下了！"
G["Honor, courage, compassion and justice! These were once the virtues you fought for as a cleric of the Argent Dawn, Thel'zan."]="荣耀、勇气、怜悯、公正！塞尔赞，当年你也曾发誓恪守这些美德，成为一名合格的银色黎明祭司。"
G["Honor, young heroes... no matter how dire the battle... never forsake it."]="年轻的英雄们……无论战斗多么可怕……也不要忘记荣耀。"
