G["Hooray, Mr. P! You're back! Do you remember how to shoot all your guns? Why don't you take a minute to learn how to fight again! Just in case."]="万岁，钳子先生！你回来了！你还记得怎么向敌人开枪吗？为什么不花点时间重新把战斗的技艺拾起来！以防万一。"
