G["Hope can blossom anywhere... even in this dark corner of a forgotten jungle."]="希望之花会在各处盛开……哪怕是在被遗忘丛林的阴暗角落也不例外。"
G["Hope for lasting relief from the shadow that has been cast on our people for so long."]="我们终将自长久萦绕的阴影中获得解脱。"
G["Hope is a DISEASE of the soul! This land shall wither and die!"]="希望是灵魂染上的疾病！这片土地应该枯竭，从此死气腾腾！"
G["Hope is a cruel joke, played upon us by a harsh and uncaring world. There is no Hope, there is only Vanessa. Vanessa VanCleef."]="希望就是个残忍的笑话，是这个严酷而冷漠的世界同我们开的一个玩笑。希望根本就是不存在的，存在的只有梵妮莎。梵妮莎·范克里夫。"
G["Hope is an illusion."]="希望是无谓的幻象。"
G["Hope is... a belief in a better tomorrow."]="希望就是……就是相信明天会更好。"
G["Hope sweetens the soul, and yours will be a fine dessert for the Lich King!"]="希望让灵魂变得甜蜜起来，巫妖王会喜欢你这道甜品的！"
G["Hope this day finds you well.  Can I offer you something?"]="希望你今天过得不错。我能帮你什么忙吗？"
G["Hope wanes..."]="希望破灭……"
G["Hope you all like your brawlers extra-crispy! Here comes Anthracite!!"]="但愿大家都喜欢自己的拳手特脆饼干！现在进场的是，硬煤！！"
G["Hope you brought your mining pick, pilgrim.  No place better than here for digging up ancient treasure."]="Espero que hayas traído un pico, $gperegrino:peregrina;. No hay un lugar mejor para excavar tesoros antiguos."
G["Hope you don't mind the extra fortitude, boss-$g man : lady;."]="Espero que no te importe esa entereza extra, $gjefe:jefa;."
G["Hope you don't mind, but we'll stop at Dreadmist Camp to pick up additional supplies and fresh mounts for the last leg of the journey."]="希望你不要介意，我们要在鬼雾营地装载另一批补给品，并让拉车的牲口得到休息和食水，为最后一段路程做好准备。"
G["Hope you enjoyed the ride, i'm out!"]="希望你会喜欢这种旅行方式，我要出去了！"
G["Hope you like pain."]="但愿你喜欢疼痛。"
G["Hope you packed some feathers, Priest."]="Espero que lleves unas cuantas plumas, $gsacerdote:sacerdotisa;."
G["Hope you take it to big-tongues good. It about time they go away."]="希望你好好地教训一下大舌头怪。他们该滚蛋了！"
G["Hope you're not looking for those abominations. The apothecaries can't be trusted, and that means none of their little constructs patrolling the halls. We're here to keep things safe."]="希望你要找的不是那些憎恶。炼金师没有一个靠得住，他们造出来的那些在大厅里巡逻的东西也一样。真正保卫这里安全的是我们。"
G["Hope you're quick on your feet!"]="希望你的腿脚够利索！"
G["Hope you're ready for a bruising, $n."]="希望你准备好大战一场了，$n。"
G["Hope! Wha.."]="希望！什……"
G["Hope?  Like the hope Fandral had for bringing our people  back to glory?  Back to immortality?"]="希望？就像范达尔希望为我族赢回往日的荣耀？重新得到不朽的生命？"
G["Hope? Is that what I was supposed to feel when I saw my father decapitated by your henchmen?"]="希望？当我看见父亲的头被你的手下砍掉时，我心里应该有这种感觉吗？"
G["Hopefully I can send a worthy few to help Ashenvale and the Sentinels."]="希望我能派一些人来帮助灰谷的哨兵部队。"
G["Hopefully next time Xuen will let me face you directly rather than being hampered by a hozen."]="希望下回雪怒能让我直接挑战你，而不是被一个猢狲碍手碍脚。"
G["Hopefully taking these offerings will slow their sacrificial rituals down."]="但愿夺走这些祭品能推迟他们的献祭仪式。"
G["Hopefully the reinforcements from Stormwind show up soon. . . ."]="希望暴风城的增援快点到来……"
G["Hopefully they came from Niuzao's statuette. We can only hope."]="希望它们来自砮皂的雕像。我们只能祈祷了。"
G["Hopefully this one will not be worse than the last..."]="希望这个不会比上一个更糟……"
G["Hopefully this time we won't run into any hiccups."]="希望这次我们不会再嗝儿个没完了。"
G["Hopefully we can get these answers quickly.  The people are frightened, and cultists are taking advantage of that fear."]="希望我们能尽快找到答案。这里的人民惊惧不已，而教徒们正在利用他们的恐惧。"
