G["Horde say you gotta die!"]="以部落的名义，你死定了！"
G["Horde scum!"]="部落渣滓！"
G["Horde scum! I was once like you. (Our old masters, small and hungry.) You cling to your mortal shells... (Bags of blood and bone and tears). ...trying to deny your insignificance."]="部落的走狗！我曾经像你们一样。（老主人弱小又饥饿。）你们无法摆脱凡人的躯壳……（血泪白骨的肉袋）……却竭力否认自身的渺小。"
G["Horde soldiers thundered across the realm in the wake of the devastation."]="部落的军队在浩劫之后席卷大地。"
