G["Horde warships stopped us and their warriors swarmed over the deck of the Bravery. They took what they wanted and killed those who wouldn't cooperate. We were outnumbered..."]="部落的战舰拦住了我们，他们的士兵冲上勇者号的甲板。他们夺走了想要的一切，杀死了那些拒绝合作的硬骨头。我们简直寡不敌众……"
