G["Horde, Alliance... what's the difference?! Do you not both love a good brew? Do you both not value your friends and families the same?"]="部落，联盟……有什么分别？！你们不都爱喝美酒？你们不都珍惜自己的朋友和家人？"
G["Horde, hear the call of your Warchief!"]="部落的同胞，你们的酋长有话要说！"
G["Horde. By the looks of the struggle, they are here in force - somewhere."]="是部落。看这种情形，他们的军队应该，就在附近。"
G["Horde. It's a shame you were so slow to get here. The Divine Bell is already ours. Rangers! STRIKE!"]="部落。真可惜，你们来晚了。圣钟归我们了。游侠们！出击！"
G["Horde... here..."]="部落……来了……"
G["Horg 'em off their jeeks and blikker 'em til their wik falls off!"]="打到他们，揍死他们！"
