G["How about a drink, $c?"]="来喝一杯吧，$c？"
G["How about a game?"]="来玩个游戏吧？"
G["How about a little swim, $r?"]="去游个泳怎么样，$r？"
G["How about a nice brew?"]="要来杯好酒吗？"
G["How about another round?"]="再来一杯怎么样？"
G["How about comin' over here an' helpin' me outta here?"]="不如过来救我出去吧？"
