G["How about this latest crew - what became of them?"]="那么，新近的这支探险队呢？他们的情况如何？"
G["How about this: Instant water! Just add... oh."]="这个怎么样：速食开水！你只需要往里边加……哦。"
G["How about you don't go runnin' off with my explosives this time, okay?"]="这次可不要偷走我的炸药了，好吗？"
G["How about you try dis one on for size?"]="你试穿下这个怎么样？"
G["How about you?  I've heard that Sarvis is going to send you off to Calston Estate.  Big assignment, eh?"]="你呢？我听说萨维斯准备派你前往卡尔斯通庄园。重要任务，对吧？"
G["How about, in consideration of all ye've done, we go with..."]="鉴于你们所做的一切，不如我们切断……"
G["How adorable!"]="多可爱啊！"
G["How am I expected to deliver all of these messages?"]="我要怎么样才能把这么多邮件都送出去？"
G["How am I feeling? Quite soaked, thank you."]="我感觉怎么样？简直湿透了，谢谢你。"
G["How am I supposed to feed my family if I can't move my goods?"]="要是我无法运送货物，我该怎么养家糊口？"
G["How am I supposed to get anything done with Fizzcrank breathing down my neck and me without all of my stuff?!"]="菲兹兰克死命地催我，可我手里没有任何工具，这叫我怎么做事啊？！"
G["How am I supposed to make secret ingredient soup without the secret ingredient?"]="没有秘密配方，叫我怎么做秘制面汤啊？"
G["How am I supposed to run my business with an empty warehouse?"]="仓库空空，我要怎么做生意？"
G["How are my men doing?"]="我的人怎么了？"
G["How are the gift standings?  Who's the most popular?"]="现在的礼物排名情况如何了？谁的人气最高？"
G["How are the noodles today?"]="今天的面条怎么样？"
G["How are the preparations going?"]="准备工作进展如何？"
G["How are the refugees settling in?"]="迁居的难民们怎么样了？"
G["How are we doing in the battle to subvert the cauldrons?"]="我们破坏大熔炉的战斗进行得怎么样了？"
G["How are we doing in the battle?"]="我们在战场上表现如何？"
G["How are we ever going to get out of here?"]="我们究竟要怎样才能离开这里？"
G["How are we going to get Subject Nine through customs? I know! Pack her into the Lab-In-A-Box!"]="我们该怎样让九号实验品通过海关？我知道了！把她装进胶囊实验室！"
G["How are we going to get out of here?"]="我们要怎么才能从这儿离开？"
G["How are we supposed to find anything in this mist, anyway?"]="我们怎样才能在这片浓雾里找到些什么呢？"
G["How are we to live without magic?"]="没有魔法，我们要怎么生存？"
G["How are ye? Had yer fill o' Outland, and ready ta head back ta Alterac Valley and give the Horde what for?"]="你还好吗？外域的感觉怎么样，准备好返回奥特兰克山谷给部落点颜色看看了吗？"
G["How are you doing back there? Not too bumpy I hope."]="那里的路况怎样？希望不要太颠簸。"
