G["How long until Forsaken reinforcements arrive? Our position here is tenuous. Your Lady promised us more soldiers. We must be able to concentrate solely on Deatholme and the Scourge!"]="遗忘者的增援还有多久才能到达？我们在这里的形势危如累卵。你的女王曾承诺给我们更多的士兵，我们必须要把注意力集中在戴索姆和天灾军团上！"
G["How long until Lord Kael'thas reignites the sunwell?"]="凯尔萨斯大人重新激活太阳井还要多久？"
