G["Hozen law number two... Tresspassers get ooked in the dooker!"]="猢狲律法第二条……入侵者全都得死！"
G["Hozen live to fish another day!"]="猢狲没死，又能钓鱼了！"
G["Hozen only give name name to good grookers.\n\nMaybe one day they call you $n $n."]="猢狲只给高手起叠名。\n\n也许有一天，他们会管你叫$n$n。"
G["Hozen ships appear in the distance!"]="猢狲的船只出现在远方！"
G["Hozen startin' to like wikket.\n\nWikket maybe not so bad..."]="猢狲开始喜欢蠢蛋了。\n\n蠢蛋大概没那么坏……"
G["Hozen steal munchpacks fair and square. No take backs!"]="猢狲肆无忌惮地偷走了果子。有去无回！"
G["Hozen stink of bad fortune."]="猢狲浑身都是霉运的臭味儿。"
G["Hozen tellin' Tooki Tooki wikket grookin' crocs!"]="猢狲要告诉图奇图奇，是蠢蛋干掉了鳄鱼！"
G["Hozen watchin' wikket... someday hozen learn to grook like wikket!"]="猢狲看着蠢蛋呢……总有一天，猢狲也会像蠢蛋一样能打！"
G["Hozen whakkin' stinky wikket!"]="猢狲讨厌厉害的蠢蛋！"
G["Hozen! Your time is short. We have new allies!"]="猢狲！你们的好日子到头了。我们有新盟友了！"
G["Hozen-grooker! Run!"]="猢狲杀手！快跑！"
G["Hozenball!"]="猢狲炮弹！"
G["Hozzer, old boy!  Here comes daddy!"]="霍泽，宝贝！爸爸来啦！"
G["Hrgghh!!"]="是！"
G["Hrm, I don't feel a thing. Wha?! Where'd those come from?"]="嗯，什么感觉也没有。什么？！这是哪儿来的？"
G["Hrm, I'm listening. What is this offer?"]="嗯，我在听。你出多少价钱？"
G["Hrm, are they tampering with timeways?"]="唔，他们正在破坏时间流吗？"
G["Hrm, azure snapdragons? Where do they come up with these names? Daedal has gone mad!"]="碧蓝金鱼草？这名字起得……丹达尔显然是疯了！"
G["Hrm, curious... This ends abruptly. In Tanaris the Qiraji document facing a bronze dragon. There is much missing from this... More information must be found! Surely they are planning to invade Kalimdor once more!"]="嗯，奇怪……故事到此为止。其拉虫人在塔纳利斯遭遇一条青铜龙。这之间一定缺了不少内容……我们必须找到更多的信息！很明显，他们正在计划再次入侵卡利姆多！"
G["Hrm, interesting..."]="嗯，有趣……"
G["Hrm, nothing up here."]="唉！上面什么都没有。"
G["Hrm, now where is the next collector?"]="唔，下一个收集器在哪里？"
G["Hrm, this looks much better. Let's have a look on the inside."]="这个看上去就好多了，让我们看看里面。"
G["Hrm, well I've come this far, but now how am I going to get a hold of those samples...?"]="哦，我已经做了这么多了，现在，我怎么才能拿到那些样本呢…？"
G["Hrm, what a strange tree. I must investigate."]="呃，这棵树真奇怪。我必须研究一下。"
G["Hrm. It appears to be functioning normally again..."]="嗯。似乎邮箱又恢复正常啦……"
G["Hrm. Nothing comes to mind."]="啊……想不起来了。"
G["Hrm? Let's see what we get out of this one."]="嗯？让我们瞧瞧这具尸体能冒出什么来。"
G["Hrm? Oh. Pardon me if I seem distracted; I fear for the men of Northwatch. I should have sent some of my students to aid them. Now, how may I help you?"]="嗯？哦，请原谅我的心不在焉。我正在为北方城堡的伙计们担心，我应该派些学徒去帮他们的……你有什么事吗？"
G["Hrm? Oh. Pardon me if I seem distracted; I fear for the men of Northwatch. I should have sent some of my students to aid them..."]="嗯？哦，请原谅我的心不在焉。我正在为北方城堡的伙计们担心，我应该派些学徒去帮他们的……"
G["Hrmm... left, right, wiggle, press...."]="唔……左转、右转、扭一扭、按下去……"
G["Hrmmm. Fare well, Queen Regent."]="嗯，保重，执政女王。"
G["Hrmmm. Time ta see how bad ya want dis, shadow hunter. Time ta see if you be WORTHY."]="嗯，我想看看你有几分真诚，暗影猎手，对我又有几分价值。"
G["Hrmmm..."]="嗯……"
G["Hrmmph. Thanks all the same, but I didn't need any help."]="嗯。谢谢你的好意，不过我不需要帮助。"
G["Hrmph, fodder. Not even fit to labor in the quarry. Relish these final moments for soon you will be nothing more than mindless undead."]="嗯，废物，就连在矿坑里作苦力都不配。享受最后的时刻吧。很快你们就会变成行尸走肉了。"
G["Hrmph, fodder. Not even fit to labor in the quarry. Relish these final moments, for soon you will be nothing more than mindless undead."]="嗯，低劣，就连在矿坑里作苦力都不配。享受最后的时刻吧。很快你们就会变成行尸走肉了。"
G["Hrmph."]="哼。"
G["Hrmph. I never liked her anyway...."]="哼。我本来就没有喜欢过她……"
G["Hrmph. I'm probably taller than her."]="哼。我可能比她还高呢。"
G["Hrmph. Nice card."]="唔。好牌。"
G["Hrnngg... thank you..."]="呼……谢谢你……"
G["Hubba-hubba!"]="好啊，好啊！"
G["Huddle in terror!"]="在恐惧中颤抖！"
G["Hugs... we want hugs..."]="抱抱……我们要抱抱……"
G["Huh! Don't get many visitors around here. Would you like to purchase some stew, neighbor?"]="¡Ah! No recibimos muchas visitas por aquí. ¿Quieres comprar un estofado, $gvecino:vecina;?"
G["Huh! Looks like they're closed."]="唔！他们好像关门了。"
G["Huh! This must be where all those farmers sell their fruits, and vegetables, and grains, and beer."]="哈！这儿一定就是那些农夫贩卖水果、蔬菜、谷物还有啤酒的地方。"
G["Huh, I hope someone figured out how to make this thing move."]="嗯，天知道该怎么让这玩意儿动起来。"
G["Huh, whassat?"]="嗯，那是什么？"
G["Huh, what?  What happened?"]="什么？发生什么事了？"
G["Huh. I suppose now I have to say thank you."]="哈，我想我现在该向你表达我的谢意了。"
G["Huh... where are we? This not right. I not tell you find hardknuckles, did I?"]="哈……我们在哪儿？不对呀。我们不是来找硬皮猩猩的吧？"
G["Huh?"]="嗯？"
G["Huh?  What do you want?"]="嗯？你想要什么？"
G["Huh?  What happened?  Oh... my head feels like it's going to explode!  I'd best get back to the crash site."]="嗯？发生了什么事？哦……头痛欲裂！我最好返回坠毁点。"
G["Huh?  What happened?  Oh... my head feels like it's going to explode!  I'd best get to the crash site."]="嗯？发生了什么事？哦……头痛欲裂！我最好返回坠毁点。"
G["Huh?  What?  I'm a little busy here, friend!\n\nOf course, if you're here to help, I've got all the time in the world."]="¿Huh? ¿Qué? Estoy un poco ocupada, $gamigo:amiga;.\n\nClaro que si has venido para ayudar, tengo todo el tiempo del mundo."
G["Huh?  What?!  Go away."]="嗯？干什么？！走开。"
G["Huh?  You'll find the bank in Orgrimmar.  Head north up the road to get there and then talk to one of their grunts."]="呃？你可以在奥格瑞玛找到银行。沿着道路往北走，跟那儿的守卫谈谈。"
G["Huh? Did someone say something?"]="嗯？有人说了什么吗？"
G["Huh? Hold on, the engine stalled..."]="嗯？等等，发动机停转了……"
G["Huh? Oh, hey, enemies."]="哈？噢，嘿，敌人。"
G["Huh? Ohhhh, ohhh!"]="哈？……噢！"
G["Huh? Wha?\n\nOh, I'm awake again.\n\n<Sunni lets out a deep sigh.>\n\nEver since this rain started, I just don't feel like doing anything..."]="哈？什么？\n\n噢，我又醒了。\n\n<孙妮发出一声长叹。>\n\n自从下起这场雨，我就什么都懒得做……"
G["Huh? What dat?"]="呃？那是什么？"
G["Huh? What?"]="嗯？什么？"
G["Huh? Where is the enemy?"]="嗯？敌人在哪儿呢？"
G["Huh? Where me at? Dis don't look good! Me run now!"]="嗯？我在哪儿？看起来不太妙！逃命要紧！"
G["Huh? Who you? Go away. Wrestler need more time with Coach Rok Rok!"]="哈？你是谁？快走开。摔跤手要跟教头洛洛多练一会儿！"
G["Huh?! Darn it, it's lunch time! I overslept!"]="啊！午饭！我睡过头了！"
G["Huh?! That's... that's nothing! Now GO AWAY!"]="嗯？！没……没东西啊！马上滚！"
G["Huh?!? Oh. You don't look like a Defias thief...or a member of the Night Watch. Take pity on a poor soul, will ya?"]="¡¿Eh?! Ah. No pareces un ladrón de los Defias... ni un miembro de la Ronda Nocturna. Apiádate de un pobre desgraciado, ¿quieres?"
G["Hui's curse even turned some of our famous Greenstone Brew against us!\nHis minions stole what little wasn't affected."]="¡La maldición de Hui ha vuelto hasta nuestro famoso brebaje de Verdemar en nuestra contra!\n\nSus esbirros han robado el poco brebaje que no se había visto afectado."
G["Hui's earth magic even brought Kiri's jade lion statue to life!\nIt ran off to who knows where..."]="La magia de la tierra de Hui ha dado vida a la estatua del león de jade de Kiri.\n\nSe ha marchado quién sabe adónde..."
G["Huju and Xen'to can take care of ya.\n\nFind dem in de valley's central building, mon."]="Huju和克森图能帮上你的忙。\n\n去山谷的中央建筑里找他们吧，伙计。"
G["Hulfnar!  Thontek!  Stand and address me."]="哈夫纳！托泰克! 站住，跟我谈谈。"
G["Hullo there, Benjamin! Mind if I snack an apple for Old Bessy?"]="你好，本杰明！我拿个苹果给老贝希吃，你不介意吧？"
G["Hullo, Trias clan!  A ball of your smoked mozzarella, if you please!"]="你好啊，提亚斯！我要买些奶酪。"
G["Hum - Wha?"]="嗯，什么？"
G["Hum, hrm. A powerful reagent for one so young. You will kill many foes in the name of your Alliance, but it is important to remember that in the great cycle, birth is as powerful as death.\n\n<Onu slowly reaches up to his head and withdraws an inconspicuous acorn. He lowers his arm to you with unhurried calm.>\n\nThis is extremely potent.\n\n...I apologize, I did not wish that to sound like a boast."]="嗯，这么年轻就拥有了如此强大的力量，这可真是惊人。你一定能以联盟的名义杀死无数敌人。但必须记住，在伟大的循环之中，生具有和死一样强大的力量。\n\n<安努缓缓地伸手到自己的头顶，摘下一颗不显眼的橡实，然后以从容不迫的姿态将手放在你面前>\n\n它有着特别的力量。\n\n……很抱歉，希望你不会认为我这是在自吹自擂。"
G["Human"]="人类"
G["Human Gossip NPC - Periodic Talk (Expansion Prologue) 01"]="PNJ humano cotilla - Charla periódica (prólogo de la expansión) 01"
G["Humans are usually vunerable on their left side between the 4th and 5th rib. Let's practice striking at this area like so..."]="人类左边第4和第5根肋骨之间的部位最脆弱。让我们来练习一下攻击这个部位……"
G["Humans can't brew their way out of a tattered linen pouch, but there sure know how to cook. Pilgrim's Bounty? I'm all for it!"]="人类总是把身子裹在那种破烂的亚麻口袋里。不过他们的确知道该如何烹调美食。感恩节？那可是我的最爱！"
G["Humans... Beneath the earth of Wintergarde Village you built a mausoleum! Why do you think Naxxramas attacked that spot? Thel'zan hides deep in your own crypt and sends a thousand-thousand corpses at you! Perish you will..."]="人类……自作孽。纳克萨玛斯为什么会攻击这里？就因为你们在暮冬城地下建起的陵墓！塞尔赞躲在你们的墓穴中，唤醒成千上万的僵尸与你们为敌！你们将被毁灭……"
G["Humble yourself before Kroshik, saurok. In this world, he is the closest to Kros that you will ever get.\n\nSavor in his presence. He will not live forever."]="在考什克面前保持恭谨，蜥蜴人。在这个世界上，他是最接近克洛斯的存在。\n\n享用他的存在。他不会一直活下去。"
G["Humbug!  Die!"]="敢耍诈？去死吧！"
G["Humph. Back in my day, we had to walk uphill both ways in the snow to see a celestial."]="哼。想当年，我们可得翻过一座雪山才能觐见至尊天神的。"
G["Humph. I'm busy, can't you see?"]="唉，我很忙，你看不到吗？"
G["Hundreds of various diagrams and schematics begin to take shape on the pages of the book. You recognize some of the diagrams while others remain foreign but familiar."]="书中记载了多张结构图。有的是你已经掌握的结构图，还有的虽然看着眼熟，却是你未曾学习过的图纸。"
G["Hundreds of years ago, the great city of Thaurissan stood proudly in a lush expanse of land that is now the dilapidated Burning Steppes.\n\nThaurissan was home to the nation of Dark Iron dwarves and at the time, in the midst of a civil war among the dwarven nation at large.\n\nYou see, that area of the world was at one point in time part of the Redridge Mountains - until the day that Thaurissan was consumed by a gigantic explosion. The city lay in ruin, the surrounding areas reduced to an ashy wasteland."]="Hace cientos de años, la gran ciudad de Thaurissan se erguía orgullosa en un terreno exuberante, convertido hoy en las ruinosas Estepas Ardientes.\n\nEn aquel tiempo, Thaurissan era el hogar de los enanos Hierro Negro, en medio de una guerra civil que asolaba a la nación de los enanos.\n\nMira, esa parte del mundo en algún momento formó parte de las montañas Crestagrana, hasta el día en que Thaurissan sucumbió por una gigantesca explosión. La cuidad acabó en la ruina y las zonas aledañas quedaron reducidas a páramos de ceniza."
G["Hungarfen roars in pain."]="霍加尔芬痛苦地咆哮着。"
G["Hungry worms will feast on your rotting flesh."]="饥饿的蠕虫将要吞噬你腐烂的躯体。"
G["Hungry? Can sleep here, too."]="饿了吗？你还可以在这里睡觉哦。"
G["Hungry? Thirsty? Tired? Let Graceful Swan take care of you!"]="饿了？渴了？还是累了？让优雅的斯万来照顾你吧！"
G["Hunt for Illidan"]="猎杀伊利丹"
G["Hunt them down, Nightstalker."]="干掉他们，夜行者。"
G["Hunter"]="猎人"
G["Hunters and your annoying pea-shooters!"]="猎人们，还有你们那些讨厌的玩具枪！"
G["Hunters, to me! Let us show these demons what it is to fight and die in Azeroth!"]="猎人们，到我这里来！让我们给这些恶魔们看看，和艾泽拉斯作对是什么下场！"
G["Huntin time!"]="狩猎时间！"
G["Huntress, there! What is that!?"]="女猎手，那边！那是什么？！"
G["Huo warmed the land and ignited the passions of the people."]="燧焰温暖了大地，点燃了人们的激情。"
G["Hup!"]="嚯！"
G["Hurrah for our new champions!  You have shown your own inner strength, and it is reflected in those you have raised.  They are lucky to have such a strong leader.  May the lessons of the Celestials light your way in the most trying of times."]="为我们的新冠军欢呼吧！你展现了自己的内在力量，并由你的宠物表现了出来。他们很幸运，能拥有如此强大的领袖。愿至尊天神之道在危急关头指引你。"
G["Hurray for $p!  They let me turn them into a tea bag to fix my lake!"]="$p万岁！他们让我把他们变成茶袋，来净化我的湖泊！"
G["Hurray!  My doll!"]="万岁！我的洋娃娃！"
G["Hurray! We made it!"]="万岁！我们成功了！"
G["Hurry $p! Use the barrels to defeat those monstrosities!"]="赶快，$p！用桶击败那些怪物！"
G["Hurry - bring me those explosives!"]="快——把那些炸药给我！"
G["Hurry - save the others!"]="快，救助其他人！"
G["Hurry - she is breaking free!"]="快点……她就要挣脱束缚了！"
G["Hurry - we must keep moving."]="快，我们必须继续前进。"
G["Hurry and free me from these chains before the bird-men return!"]="快点，在那帮鸟人回来之前把我从这些锁链中解救出来！"
G["Hurry back to the Furlbrow's Cottage!"]="赶快回到法布隆的小屋里去！"
G["Hurry brothers! You must go now! I do not know how much longer the rift will remain open!"]="快一点，兄弟们！我们一定要行动迅速！我不知道裂隙可以维持多久！"
G["Hurry elders! You must hide!"]="快点，长者！你们必须藏起来！"
G["Hurry it up! Work, WORK!"]="快点！工作，工作！"
G["Hurry it up, peons!"]="赶紧干活，苦工！"
G["Hurry it up. The soldiers have already pulled out of here."]="快点。士兵们已经出发了。"
G["Hurry north! Find my Brother Yakshoe before the hozen do something bad to him."]="急速向北！在猢狲迫害我的堂弟牦牛鞋之前找到他。"
G["Hurry now, $n. I'll be waitin' for ya, mon."]="别浪费时间了，$n。等你的好消息。"
G["Hurry past this foul contraption!"]="快点消灭这台邪恶的机器！"
G["Hurry up with it already! The longer you take, the more of a hurtin' I'm putting on you!"]="快一点！你拖得越久，我给你的痛苦就会越多！"
G["Hurry up with that axe, you! I want it sharp enough to cut the wind!"]="快磨斧子，说你呢！我要它锋利到可以劈风断水！"
G["Hurry up with the explosives!"]="快拿炸药来！"
G["Hurry up with those artifacts!"]="快拿上那些遗物！"
G["Hurry up!"]="快呀！"
G["Hurry up, $c! Take everything you can!"]="赶快，$c！能拿的全拿走！"
G["Hurry up, $p!"]="快点，$p！"
G["Hurry up, Lady Vashj expects results!"]="快点，瓦丝琪大人要尽快看到结果！"
G["Hurry up, Reed!"]="快，里德！"
G["Hurry! Before we're discovered!"]="加快速度！不要等到我们被发现！"
G["Hurry! Climb aboard!"]="快！上来！"
G["Hurry! It's not safe for you to be seen with me here...."]="快！如果有人看见我和你在一起就糟了……"
G["Hurry! Ple-e-ase hurry!!"]="求求你！"
G["Hurry! There is not much of me left!"]="快！我的心志快要完全丧失了！"
G["Hurry! We have to check on them!"]="快点！我们必须赶紧看看其他人！"
G["Hurry! You must save Aggra before she is pulled into the vortex!"]="快！你必须在阿格娜被卷入漩涡前把她救出来！"
G["Hurry! You should talk to Mekkatorque! If we don't start the assault soon, we're going to be late.\n\nAnd my boss HATES it when we're late!"]="快点！你现在应该去找梅卡托克！如果我们不尽快开始进攻，我们就要耽误行动了。\n\n如果我们耽误的话，我们的首领可是要发火的！"
G["Hurry,  before that Val'kyr picks us off!"]="快，在那个瓦格里干掉我们之前！"
G["Hurry, $c!\n\nPut the ingredients directly in the pot. Time is of the essence!"]="快，$c！\n\n把材料都扔进去。时间紧迫！"
G["Hurry, $c! There is no time to waste!\n\nSplintertree must not fall!"]="快一点，$c！没时间磨蹭了！\n\n碎木岗哨绝不能失守。"
G["Hurry, $g brother : sister;. I'm leaking here...."]="Rápido, $ghermano:hermana;. Estoy goteando..."
G["Hurry, $n!\n\nThere's no way we'll breach this wall without those explosives!"]="快，$n！\n\n没有炸药我们就攻不破这道城墙！"
G["Hurry, $n! Flee! Live to finish what we've begun here...."]="快跑，$n！快！你必须活下去，完成我们未竟的事业……"
G["Hurry, $n! Get the evacuee to Wartook Iceborn in the Dragonblight!"]="快，$n！带这位村民逃离此地，与龙骨荒野的沃图克碰面！"
G["Hurry, $n! We must find protective cover!"]="快，$n！我们必须尽快找地方躲起来！"
G["Hurry, $n! Zhere is little time!"]="赶快，$n！没多少时间了！"
G["Hurry, $n, deploy the Town-In-A-Box. Our people are trapped inside! Oh! I almost forgot your parachute."]="赶快，$n，部署胶囊盒。我们的人都被困在里面！哦！我差点忘了你的降落伞。"
G["Hurry, $p! We have to start the smelling... I mean, the shelling!"]="快点，$p！我们要赶快开始装粪……我是说装弹！"
G["Hurry, $r! Our factions may be at war, but we have greater worries at the moment!"]="赶快，$r！我们双方也许正在交战，可眼下正面临着更大的威胁！"
G["Hurry, $r.\n\nTime is running out for me."]="快，$r。\n\n我的时间不多了。"
G["Hurry, Brutusk. I'm wounded!"]="快点，蛮角，我受伤了！"
G["Hurry, Gorthul. Undo $ghis:her; bonds."]="Date prisa, Gothul. Deshaz sus ataduras."
G["Hurry, I need help!"]="快，我需要帮助！"
G["Hurry, Wakener. It is taking all my strength not to rip you to pieces."]="快点，唤醒者。我得竭力克制自己才能不把你撕成碎片。"
G["Hurry, heroes. In mere moments Deathwing's Cataclysm will complete what he begun and end the world. Join me in the attack, now!"]="赶快，英雄们。死亡之翼引导的大灾变即将毁灭这个世界。和我一起进攻，快！"
G["Hurry, hurry, hurry! Step right up and purchase your game tokens!"]="快快快！快来买游戏代币了！"
G["Hurry, hurry, hurry! Step right up and purchase your ride tickets!"]="快来看快来买！旋转木马门票这边就有卖！"
G["Hurry, mon! I be doomed!\n\nI see what they be doin' to prisoners, an' I be too young to die!\n\nYa gotta do somethin', and soon!"]="朋友，快！我就要没命了！\n\n我知道他们是如何对待囚犯的！我还这么年轻，我可不想死！\n\n你倒是做点什么啊，快啊！"
G["Hurry, mortal.\n\nMeet me inside the Nexus!"]="快，凡人。\n\n我们在魔枢里汇合！"
G["Hurry, my lord! The enemy is upon us!"]="快，陛下！敌人杀上来了！"
G["Hurry..."]="快点……"
G["Hurt 'em some more! MORE!"]="让他们更痛苦！更痛苦！"
G["Hurts! Stop!"]="疼！快停下！"
G["Hurts... Hurts so bad..."]="疼啊……真是太疼了……"
G["Hush up, your yapping will scare the fish away!"]="小声点，你的废话会把鱼吓走的！"
G["Hush, Tyrande. Where is Illidan?"]="哈，泰兰德。伊利丹在哪？"
G["Hush, hush. It's okay little one."]="放心，放心。没有事的，小家伙。"
G["Hut!"]="¡Atención!"
G["Huuup...Huuup...Bleeeeehh!"]="快点……快点……"
G["Huuuuuuuunnnnnngggrryyyy!"]="饿……啊！！！"
G["Huzzah for the tipper!  Step right up and get your delicious, cold drinks right here!"]="为给小费的好心人喝彩！往右边走，到那儿去品尝美味的冷饮吧！"
G["Huzzah!"]="万岁！"
G["Hyah!"]="呀！"
G["Hyena"]="土狼"
G["Hyenas approach from your left flank.  Engage them!"]="土狼从你的左翼袭来。准备迎战！"
G["Hyjal Wisp calls out for aid! Defend the Hyjal Wisp as it closes the attacker's portal!"]="海加尔小精灵需要帮助！保护好海加尔小精灵，让它关闭入侵者的传送门！"
G["Hyjal Wisp has been slain!"]="海加尔小精灵被杀害了！"
G["Hyjal Wisp is weakened! Defend the Hyjal Wisp as it closes the attacker's portal!"]="海加尔小精灵受伤了！保护好海加尔小精灵，让它关闭入侵者的传送门！"
G["Hyjal is lost!  Give up!"]="海加尔沦陷了！放弃吧！"
G["Hyjal kids, Hyjal wives! They're lancing everyone in here!"]="海加尔的小鬼，海加尔的女人！他们在这儿到处戳人！"
G["Hyjal shall not fall!"]="海加尔永不陨落！"
G["I 'eard Terry fenced one of 'em pictures for a thousand gold.  Maybe I can get in some of that artwork dealin' too!"]="听说泰里镶个画框就能赚1000金币。或许我也该考虑做工艺品生意！"
G["I - I don't know. There's movement in the ruins."]="我……我不知道。在那片废墟里有不寻常的动静。"
G["I - I think there's someone INSIDE that thing!"]="我……我想，那东西里面应该是有人！"
G["I ... I can't give you any of our supplies! Our Warchief... He would..."]="我……我不能把我们的物资给你！我们的酋长……他会……"
G["I ... I never wanted to be an engineer anyways."]="我……不管怎样我从来都没想过要当工程师。"
G["I ... no... My emperor! My emperor, I have failed you!"]="我……不……陛下！陛下，我辜负了您！"
G["I ... welcome ... the void's ... embrace."]="我欢迎虚空的拥抱……"
G["I ... will not ... serve!"]="我……决不……从命！"
G["I AM A THREAT? I AM DERANGED?!"]="我是威胁？我是疯子？！"
G["I AM AWAKE, AT LAST!"]="我终于醒来了！"
G["I AM DEATH!  PREPARE YOUR TOWN FOR ANNIHILATION!"]="我就是死神！！你们的城镇就要毁灭了！！！"
G["I AM DEATHWING, THE DESTROYER, THE END OF ALL THINGS, INEVITABLE, INDOMITABLE; I AM THE CATACLYSM!"]="吾名死亡之翼，天命之灭世者，万物的终结者，无可阻挡，无可违逆；吾即大灾变！"
G["I AM FLUENT IN OVER TWO LANGUAGES: DWARVISH, GNOMISH AND THE VERY COMMON TONGUE OF HUMANS.  BUT I HAVE NO IDEA WHAT YOU ARE SAYING!\n\nSPEAK UP; I CANNOT HEAR YOU OVER THE GRINDING OF MY GEARS!"]="我能流利地说两种语言：矮人语，和略带人类口音的侏儒语。但是我根本不知道你在说什么！！\n\n说大声点！齿轮的摩擦让我根本听不见你在说什么！！"
G["I AM FROM THE ELEMENTAL PLANE!"]="我来自于元素位面！！"
G["I AM HERE!"]="我在这里！"
G["I AM NEAR!"]="我即将重生！"
G["I AM NOT AN APPETIZER!"]="我可不是什么开胃小菜！"
G["I AM RENEWED! Ysera grant me the favor to lay these foul creatures to rest!"]="我获得了新生！伊瑟拉的恩泽赐予我消灭邪恶的力量！"
G["I AM a force of nature!"]="我就是自然之力！"
G["I AM going to kill you. What's the rush?"]="我本来就会杀死你啊。着什么急呢？"
G["I AM here!"]="我，在这里！"
G["I CAN'T FIND YOUR LEGS, JOEY! I CAN'T FIND YOUR DAMNED LEGS!"]="我找不到你的腿，乔伊！我找不到你那该死的腿！"
G["I COME FOR YOU, LITTLE MORTAL!"]="我来抓你了，小凡人！"
G["I DON'T BELIEVE IT! WE HAVE A NEW CHAMPION OF ANGUISH!!! Vladof the Butcher has been defeated by a ragtag crew of nobodies! Incredible finish!"]="难以置信！新的痛苦斗兽场勇士诞生了！！！一群无名小卒击败了屠夫乌拉多弗！真是个奇迹！"
G["I DON'T BELIEVE IT! WE HAVE A NEW CHAMPION OF CARNAGE!!! Our big, bad beefy challenger has been defeated by a ragtag crew of nobodies! Incredible finish!"]="难以置信！新的杀戮勇士诞生了！！！我们高大的，凶恶的，力大无穷的挑战者被一个衣衫褴褛的无名之辈打败了！真是个不可思议的结局！"
G["I DRAW CLOSER TO THIS WORLD!"]="我接近这个世界了！"
G["I GO GET ANOTHER AFTER I STOMP YOU!"]="等我踩扁你之后，我会再弄一个幸运符的！"
G["I HAVE ALMOST ARRIVED. TWILIGHT'S HAMMER, DO NOT RUSH THE SUMMONING OR I WILL DESTROY YOU AS WELL!"]="我就要进入这个世界了。暮光之锤，认真进行召唤仪式，否则我也把你们一并摧毁！"
G["I HEARD THAT! No more ale for you! Not a drop!"]="我听见了！我不卖啤酒给你了！一滴也不卖！"
G["I HUNGERRRRR!!"]="我来了！！"
G["I LIVE!"]="我还活着！"
G["I LOSE? NO YOU LOSE!"]="我输了？不，你才输了！"
G["I PROMISE I WON'T KILL YOUR CREW THIS TIME.  HAH!  BUT MY BROTHER MIGHT EAT THEM!"]="我保证这次我不会杀死你的船员，哈哈！但是我的兄弟可能会吃了他们！"
G["I QUIT! I'd rather take my chances getting shot at by Alliance!"]="我不干了！我宁可被联盟的火枪打死！"
G["I SAID GOOD DAY!"]="我刚才说过再见了吧？"
G["I SEE THE TRAITOR IS HERE TO RESCUE YOU, WARCHIEF. HOW CONVENIENT. YOU WILL BOTH BOW TO ME OR FALL TOGETHER!"]="那个叛徒来救你了，酋长。这倒方便了。你们要么一起向我下跪，要么就一起去死！"
G["I SEE YOU, INSECT. RUN WHILE YOU CAN. RUN AND TELL YOUR PATHETIC LOR'DANEL THAT I AM COMING TO DESTROY IT!"]="我看到你了，爬虫。趁着还能逃跑就拼命逃跑吧。跑去告诉你们那个可怜的洛达内尔，我就要去摧毁它了！"
G["I SHALL pass!"]="我要离开这里！"
G["I SMASH. YOU DIE. DEAL WITH IT!"]="我一挥手，你就死了。接招吧！"
G["I TASTE THE BLOOD OF LIFE!"]="我品尝了生命的血液！"
G["I THINK NOT. YOU WILL DROP YOUR IMMUNITY, CEASE YOUR RITUAL NOW AND RELEASE THEM!"]="是吗？我命令你立即终止仪式，放了他们！"
G["I TOLD YOU TO PAY UP, PAL!"]="我告诉过你要全部付清了，小子！"
G["I TOLD YOU... I don't know... anything... else!"]="我告诉你……我……什么……都不知道！"
G["I TOLD you he was weird."]="我就说他很奇怪吧。"
G["I USED TO BE A FARMER!"]="我曾经是一名农夫！"
G["I WILL CRUSH YOU LIKE A GNAT!"]="碾碎你就象捏死一只虫子那样简单！"
G["I WILL DESTROY EVERYTHING YOU HAVE EVER LOVED."]="我会摧毁你们所钟爱的一切。"
G["I WILL DRAG YOU WITH ME INTO FLAME AND DARKNESS!"]="我要拖着你们一起陷入烈焰与黑暗！"
G["I WILL HAVE MY REVENGE! DO YOU HEAR ME???"]="我的复仇终将实现！你听到了吗？？？"
G["I WILL KILL YOU, $n!"]="我要杀了你，$n！"
G["I WILL NOT BE DENIED!"]="我是不会失败的。"
G["I WILL have my revenge!"]="我会报仇的！！"
G["I WILL have you, spirit-sage!"]="我会抓住你的，灵魂贤者！"
G["I accept this gift."]="我接受这份礼物。"
G["I accept your blessing."]="我接受您的祝福。"
G["I accept your challenge!"]="我接受你的挑战！"
G["I accompany the Shado-Pan to chronicle their many deeds beyond the wall. It is not easy - I do not wish to lose any of my journals in the chaos of battle!\n\nIt has happened before. The Lorewalkers have been cataloging pandaren history for many ages. Their notes are scattered throughout Pandaria. I am certain that if you were to assemble them, the Lorewalkers would be most appreciative!"]="我跟随影踪派，将他们在长城另一侧的诸多事迹如实记录下来——我可不想在这混战中弄丢任何宝贵的手札！\n\n这并非没有先例。游学者们世代以来始终在编纂着熊猫人的历史。在潘达利亚各地都散落着他们的笔记。要是你能收集到这些史料，一定能得到游学者们的赏识！"
G["I ache with power!"]="我需要力量！"
G["I admire the skill that torch jugglers have."]="我羡慕那个家伙玩火炬的技巧。"
G["I admire your strength."]="我很钦佩你的力量。"
G["I admit... that was some impressive fighting."]="我承认……这场战斗让人印象深刻。"
G["I adore you! You believe me? Right, baby?"]="我可真喜欢你！你相信我？是吗？"
G["I advise the captain on matters that he chooses to share with me, but I have a feeling that he'd rather hear from you."]="我按照上尉的意思，提供了针对部分决策的参考意见，但是我觉得他更想听听你的看法。"
G["I agree. Only suffering can come of such a creature."]="我同意。只有深重的苦难才能造就这种生物。"
G["I ain't 'fraid of no ghost!"]="我可不怕什么鬼魂！"
G["I ain't askin' for me alone, Great Spirit, but on behalf of da Darkspear Tribe... on behalf of me PEOPLE."]="伟大的英灵，我并非为我一个人而祈祷，而是为了暗矛部族……为了我的人民。"
G["I ain't flyin' a kite to Silvermoon City! You crazy?"]="¡Yo no manda kometa a Lunargenta! ¡Makaku $gloko:loka;!"
G["I ain't flyin' no kite to Dalaran! I don't even know where Jaina moved the city! Ye'd best take the portal over there."]="我可不会乘着风筝去达拉然！我都不知道吉安娜把那城市飘到哪儿了！你最好使用那边那个传送门。"
G["I ain't flyin' no kite to Darnassus! I can barely navigate that thing in the mountains. Ye think we'd last over an entire ocean? Ye'd best talk to Seamus Goldenkicks over there."]="我可不会乘着风筝去达纳苏斯！那东西要飞过山脉都很难，你还指望它飞过整片海域？你最好使用那边那个传送门。"
G["I ain't goin' back to the clink, $gman:lady;!"]="我可不打算回到牢房去，$g小子:姑娘;！"
G["I ain't gonna support you if you ain't brawlin' yourself. You need \"skin in the game\", chief.\nGo talk to one of them guards and tell 'em you wanna fight. Then we can play."]="No te voy a apoyar si no vas a participar en un combate. Tienes que tener \"carne en el asador\", por así decir.\n\nVe a hablar con uno de los guardias y ponte a la cola para combatir. Entonces podrás jugar."
G["I ain't got time for no strangers. Now please leave me be."]="我可没时间和陌生人打交道。现在请你离开。"
G["I ain't seen mist this thick before. We'll have to drop our sails and wait for it to pass. I don't much like the thought of beaching The Barnacle on a shallow reef today."]="我从没见过这么浓的雾。我们得把帆降下来，等雾散开。我可不想让藤壶号撞上暗礁啥的。"
G["I ain't seen you in a lick, wikket. How you been?"]="很久没见了，无毛怪。最近好吗？"
G["I ain't settin' foot in this place ever again!"]="我再也不来这个鬼地方了！"
G["I ain't tellin' you a damn thing!"]="不管什么事情，我都不会告诉你的！"
G["I ain't tellin' you nothin'!"]="我什么都不会告诉你！"
G["I aint got time for the game 'cause I need you."]="我无意玩这游戏，只因我需要你。"
G["I aint' gettin' paid enough for this."]="我没拿到足额的薪水。"
G["I allow the man to take enough corn to feed his family for a couple of days, encouraging him to leave the land."]="我允许他拿走足够供他一家人糊口数日的粮食，并建议他赶快离开。"
G["I almost have enough supplies to upgrade our troops."]="我差不多拥有足够的物资供给来升级部队了。"
G["I almost have enough supplies to upgrade to champion units."]="我差不多拥有足够的物资供给升级到勇士部队了。"
G["I almost have enough supplies to upgrade to veteran units."]="我差不多拥有足够的物资供给来升级到精练部队了。"
G["I almost hit my goal of ten mage portals without incident. Those thrice damned mogu ruined that with their trap.\n\nThe trap sundered most of my abilities but I should be able to manage some more local portals."]="我差点儿就达到了开启10次法师传送门无事故的目标。结果却被那些该死魔古族的陷阱给破坏了。\n\n那陷阱令我丧失了大部分能力，可我应该能再开几个本地传送门。"
G["I almost made it!\n\nI came in here to prove the existence of Quagmirran, that most mythical of fungal giants.  I got my wish, sort of.\n\nYou must let me free!  In return I will grant you a boon to help you to deal with Quagmirran."]="我几乎要成功了！\n\n我来到这里是为了证明传说中的真菌巨人夸格米拉的存在。我完成了自己的愿望……理论上。\n\n你必须让我重获自由！作为回报，我会帮助你解决夸格米拉。"
G["I almost prefer the cold bite of Northrend to this appalling soggy heat. It's as if the trees themselves are trying to suffocate us."]="相比于这里可怕的湿热，我比较喜欢诺森德刺骨的寒风。这里好像连树木都想要闷死我们。"
G["I almost... made it..."]="我差点……就成功了……"
G["I already had him scheduled for disposal, but I suppose we can speed up the process a bit."]="我本来就打算销毁他，看来可以提前完成了。"
G["I already know a lot about style. Now it's just a matter of mastering the techniques for working with leather. Good thing Simon's a real sport about helping me learn them."]="我已经了解到很多关于时尚的东西。现在那不过就是掌握制革技巧罢了。西蒙能帮助学习制革的。"
G["I already know of my coming victory."]="我已经预见到了自己的胜利。"
G["I also ask you to shine your glorious light upon the immaculate face of my lady Doloria."]="我还请求您，将您的光辉洒在多罗莉亚女士完美无暇的脸蛋上。"
G["I also ask you to sprinkle wildflowers around the feet of my beautiful Doloria, where'er she may walk."]="我还请求您，在我美丽的多罗莉亚散步时，让鲜花在她的步履间开放。"
G["I also heard that King Varian swore he would never use the sha to no good."]="我还听说，瓦里安国王发誓不会利用煞能做不光彩的事。"
G["I also seek such power."]="我也在追寻着这种力量。"
G["I always be up for a nice three-finger discount. Stealin' be all in the wrist... and when that fails ya, then ya stick somethin' sharp in between the ribs, and that's all in the wrist too.\n\nSkilled hands be worth more than a steady paycheck, ya heard?"]="人们经常置疑我身为三指大盗的本事。其实我靠的是手腕的灵活性……一旦失手，你应该立即制服他们，这同样要依赖手腕的力量。\n\n灵巧的双手比稳定的收入更加宝贵，你明白吗？"
G["I always cheer for Goredome anytime he's up.  That angry little shoveltusk makes quick work of the slow chubby ones."]="我总是为血角欢呼。那头愤怒的铲齿鹿看似娇小，却总是能让那些大块头吃尽苦头。"
G["I always cheer for the robots."]="我总会为机器人们欢呼。"
G["I always figure we should be taught not to wait for inspiration to start a thing. Action always generates inspiration. Inspiration rarely generates action.\n\nSuch is the way of the Huojin."]="要我说，“先行动，后思考”才是正确的行事方法。行动可以带来灵感。但光凭思考，什么事都做不了。\n\n这就是火金之道。"
G["I always hate the days that I have to go in to that cave looking for sprite needles."]="有时我不得不深入那个洞穴去采集提神松针，那段日子真叫人不堪回首。"
G["I always knew I was a lumberjack at heart!"]="我早知道自己有着一颗伐木工的心！"
G["I always knew a $pc could beat up a yaungol!"]="¡Siempre supe que $gun:una; $pc podría con un yaungol!"
G["I always knew you could do it!"]="我就知道你能做到！"
G["I always loved Silverpine -- until the Lich King let loose his rampaging Scourge armies and turned the land into a massive rotting corpse pit. Now the sight of it boils my green blood."]="我一直都很喜爱银松森林——直到巫妖王放出他的天灾大军，将这片土地变成了一个腐烂的巨大尸坑。现在，每当我再看到它，血管里的绿色血液也禁不住要沸腾。"
G["I always thought the Zandalari were just made up to make me behave when I was younger."]="在我小时候，我总以为赞达拉部族是他们故意编出来吓唬我，好让我变乖的。"
G["I always thought trolls were stuff from old stories."]="我一直以为巨魔只在古老的故事中存在。"
G["I always wanted to be... a dancer! Power tools frighten me."]="我一直想当个……舞者！电动工具让我害怕。"
G["I always wanted to play the organ."]="我一直很想弹风琴。"
G["I always wonder where all the water go... doesn't make sense."]="我很想知道水都流到哪儿去了……真搞不明白。"
G["I am 100% confident that I wish to learn in the ways of gnomish engineering."]="我100%地确定要在侏儒工程学这条路上走到底。"
G["I am 100% confident that I wish to learn in the ways of goblin engineering."]="我100%地确定要在地精工程学这条路上走到底。"
G["I am Achelus, chief expeditionary officer of Blood Watch."]="我是阿彻鲁斯，秘血岗哨远征军首席指挥官。"
G["I am Adamant Ironheart of the great city of Ironforge. As you could probably guess by looking at my uniform, I was once part of the Ironforge elite guard. Yep, I was Magni's right hand man! At least until I retired. Now I dabble in archaeology. It's a hobby really; plus I figured it would be a great way to see the world!"]="我是来自铁炉堡的阿达曼特·铁心。我想你可能已经从我的制服上面猜出来了，我曾是铁炉堡精英守卫中的一员。是的，我曾经是麦格尼的左膀右臂！至少在我退休前。现在我开始涉足考古学，确切地说，这是我的爱好，而且我发现这真是个了解世界的好办法！"
G["I am Admetius, leader of Blood Watch."]="我是埃德门图斯，秘血岗哨的首领。"
G["I am Aesom, third of the Triumvirate."]="我是伊索姆，阿古斯之手三人执政团的老三。"
G["I am Al'tabim the All-Seeing - an envoy of King Rastakhan.\n\nMy dealings are with priests, mages, and warlocks."]="我是全知者阿塔比姆，拉斯塔哈的特使。\n\n我通常只和牧师、法师和术士打交道。"
G["I am Anduin Wrynn, Prince of Stormwind. I won't die here. Not like this!"]="我安度因·乌瑞恩是暴风城的王子。我绝不能死在这里。绝不！"
G["I am Arator, son of Turalyon and Alleria. So yes, Father, I am \"shome\" kind of elf: half-elf to be precise."]="Soy Arator, hijo de Turalyon y Alleria. Así que, sí, Padre, \"soy algún tipo\" de elfo: mitad elfo, para ser exactos."
G["I am Atuik, chieftain of the Kalu'ak of Kamagua."]="我是阿图伊克，卡玛古的卡鲁亚克氏族酋长。"
G["I am Balgaras the Foul.  And you, $n, are about to become nothing more than ash and dust."]="我是巴尔加拉斯。$n，你将会变成灰烬！"
G["I am Blood Knight, mongrel. I do not serve the Light, the Light serves me. If mercy is to be granted, it will be by me."]="我是血骑士，杂种。我不为圣光效劳，圣光为我效劳。如果仁慈能够被赐予，那也是由我来赐予你们。"
G["I am Chen Stormstout. From the Wandering Isle."]="我是陈·风暴烈酒。来自迷踪岛。"
G["I am Destructobyte, the great usurper! And as you can see, I have found your secret plans!"]="我，就是伟大的篡夺者——位元毁灭者！如你所见，我已经发现了你们的秘密计划！"
G["I am Dragonmaw, I am the blood of the Dragon and the fist of the Horde!"]="我是龙喉兽人，我是巨龙血脉、部落之拳！"
G["I am Forsaken."]="我是被遗忘者。"
G["I am GIANT!"]="我是巨人！"
G["I am Garrosh Hellscream, son of Grom, chieftain of the Mag'har! Let the battle call of Hellscream give you courage and strength! Be lifted by my rallying cry."]="我是加尔鲁什·地狱咆哮，格罗姆之子，玛格汉的酋长！让地狱咆哮的战斗怒吼给予你们勇气和力量吧！"
G["I am Gath'Ilzogg!  And you are a $R on the brink of death!"]="¡Soy Gath'Ilzogg! ¡Y tú eres $gun:una; $r al borde de la muerte!"
G["I am Gurrok, of Hellscream's Vanguard."]="我们是地狱咆哮的先锋战士！"
G["I am Highborne, $r. It has no meaning now. There was a time, though, when this world was ruled by Highborne. Ten thousand years past..."]="我是一名上层精灵，$r。虽然这个词语现在已经不能代表什么了，但很久以前，这个世界曾被上层精灵所统治。一万年过去了……"
G["I am Hydraxis, Duke of the Waterlords.  You are not an elemental and so cannot understand our struggle, but perhaps we can strike a deal that will benefit us both..."]="Soy Hydraxis, duque de los Señores del Agua. No eres $gun:una; elemental y, por lo tanto, no puedes comprender nuestra lucha, pero quizás podamos llegar a un pacto que nos beneficie a ambos..."
G["I am Jin'rokh the Breaker, envoy of Mugamba: Fist of Rastakhan!\n\nMy dealings are with warriors and heathens."]="我是击碎者金罗克，穆贾巴的特使，拉斯塔哈之拳！\n\n我通常只和战士以及异教徒打交道。"
G["I am Kalecgos, of the Blue Dragonflight.\n\nI have watched over the nascent powers of the Sunwell for some time, but now I see that its terrible power could usher in the end of our world!"]="我是蓝龙军团的卡雷苟斯。\n\n我监视太阳之井形成的能量已经有一段时间了，但是现在我意识到，它那可怕的能量也许会导致世界的毁灭！"
G["I am Kessel, lord of the elekk, disciple of the Hand of Argus. Are you the new recruit?"]="我是凯希尔，雷象之王，阿古斯之手的成员。你是新来的吗？"
G["I am Khadgar, former apprentice to the fallen Guardian, Medivh. I'm sure you've heard his name before.\n\nIt was I who discovered that Medivh had been possessed by the Evil One, Sargeras - and that he had opened the Dark Portal between this world and Azeroth. Though I honored my Master, I was forced to slay him and put his tortured soul to rest."]="我是卡德加，堕落的守护者麦迪文曾经的学徒。我相信你以前肯定听说过这个名字。\n\n是我发现麦迪文被邪恶的萨格拉斯支配，然后他就开启了这个世界和艾泽拉斯之间的黑暗之门。尽管我尊重我的主人，但我被迫消灭了他，让他痛苦的灵魂得到了解脱。"
G["I am Kil'ruk, a warrior from an era long passed."]="我是克尔鲁克，来自久远时代的战士。"
G["I am Kilram, master of the axe."]="我是基尔拉姆，斧系大师。"
G["I am Kodian, daughter of Ursoc.  I watch over this once sacred shrine.\n\nI've not seen a stranger come here in a long time."]="我是科蒂安，乌索克的女儿。我守护着这座曾经被视为圣地的祭坛。\n\n很久以来，都没有陌生人到这里来拜访了。"
G["I am Krathok, overseer of these craftsmen."]="我是克拉索克，这些工匠的监工。"
G["I am Lady Sinestra."]="我是女伯爵希奈丝特拉。"
G["I am Lei Shen, slayer of kings and gods. You have made a grave mistake."]="吾乃雷神，弑君之君，诛神之神。你们犯了一个可悲的错误。"
G["I am Moordo, elder hunter of Stillpine."]="我是莫多，止松要塞的猎人长者。"
G["I am NEVER drinking again!"]="我再也不喝酒了！"
G["I am NOT going to sweep the ground of a mud pit, I can tell you that!\n\nYou need to deal with that rat, the Trade Prince, that's what I think!"]="我才不会为你收拾残局呢，你听好了！\n\n你得去解决贸易大王那只老鼠，我就是这么想的！"
G["I am Nablya, apprentice to Khaz'goroth and envoy to Un'Goro Crater.  I am known as the Watcher.\n\nI stand here in the place of my master, who has since left Azeroth.  He once stood in this very spot when he shaped many of his creations."]="我是娜博亚，卡兹格罗斯的弟子，安戈洛环形山的使者。我也被称为观察者。\n\n自从我的导师离开艾泽拉斯之后，我就是他的代表。他就是在这里塑造了许多生物。"
G["I am Nazgrim, fist of the Warchief and General of the Horde Army. If I must die today, I will die with honor, in battle, for the horde!"]="我是纳兹戈林，酋长之拳，部落统帅。就算我今天难逃一死，也要光荣地战死沙场。为了部落！"
G["I am Ponch. I clean the grounds and watch the kittens. They tell me I was a champion once. That must have been neat."]="我是彭启。我打扫地面，还照看小猫。他们说我曾经是位勇士。那一定很棒吧。"
G["I am Prince Nadun of Ramkahehn.  My people are tol'vir... or descended from the tol'vir to be precise.\n\nThe people of Neferset were like us, made of flesh and blood...\n\nUntil Deathwing came."]="我是拉穆卡恒的纳顿亲王。我的人民来自于托维尔……或者严格来说，是托维尔人的后代。\n\n尼斐塞特人本来也像我们一样有血有肉……\n\n但在死亡之翼到来之后，一切都改变了。"
G["I am Prince Nadun of Ramkahen.  The Neferset tribe has turned against the other tol'vir.\n\nHelp me escape so that I may lobby my brother, the king, to wage war against these traitors!"]="我是拉穆卡恒的纳顿亲王。尼斐塞特部族已经公然与其他托维尔为敌。\n\n请帮我逃出这里，这样我就能说服我的兄弟，也就是我们的国王向这些叛徒发动战争！"
G["I am Rexxar, son of the Mok'Nathal, champion of the Horde."]="我是雷克萨，莫克纳萨之子，部落的勇士。"
G["I am Rutherford Twing, the main supplier for the Defilers posted here at Arathi Basin.  As you improve your standing with us, I will make available to you a fine selection of goods that you might find useful.  Should you find yourself in need of item repair, I also provide those services."]="我是驻扎在阿拉希盆地的污染者物资供应商卢瑟弗·图恩。随着你在污染者中的声望不断提升，我可以出售给你一些非常有用的物品。如果你需要修理装备，我也乐意为你服务。"
G["I am SO glad that evil Gankly Rottenfist got his just desserts!"]="我很高兴那个邪恶的甘克雷·骨拳没能得逞！"
G["I am SO glad that evil Gankly Rottenfist got his just desserts!  I have lots of skins if you want some to give to Harold."]="我很高兴那个邪恶的甘克雷·骨拳没能得逞！如果你想带点毛皮给哈罗德的话，我有很多。"
G["I am Samuel Hawke, the main supplier for the League of Arathor posted here at Arathi Basin.  As you improve your standing with us, I will make available to you a fine selection of goods that you might find useful.  Should you find yourself in need of item repair, I also provide those services."]="我是驻扎在阿拉希盆地的阿拉索联军物资供应商萨缪尔·霍克。随着你在阿拉索联军中的声望不断提升，我可以出售给你一些非常有用的物品。如果你需要修理装备，我也乐意为你服务。"
G["I am Saurfang. Brother of Broxigar."]="我是布洛克斯的兄弟，萨鲁法尔。"
G["I am Scarlet Onslaught. We don't rat out our leaders!"]="我是血色先锋军的一员！绝不会出卖自己的领袖！"
G["I am Skaltesh, guide to the shaman seeking enlightenment here... but even those who follow different paths can be shown a thing or two. Do you wish to see?"]="我是斯卡泰斯，在这里引领萨满祭司寻求启迪……但即使信念不同者也可以在这里得到指引。你想看看吗？"
G["I am Tinkmaster Overspark, and I am the chief architect for modern gnomish engineering principles in the world today.  It is my job to ensure that the power of invention continues to shine brightest from our arclight spanners than anywhere else!\n\nAlso, if you happen to know a good schematic for radiation elimination, we just so happen to be in the market for one right about now..."]="我是大工匠欧沃斯巴克，现代侏儒工程学领域的顶级设计师。我的工作就是用我们的闪亮崭新的扳手确保新的发明能够付诸实施！\n\n要是你碰巧懂得制造消除辐射污染的装置，那你算是来对地方啦……"
G["I am UNSINKABLE!"]="我是永不沉没的！"
G["I am Ubungo. I represent the Zandalar tribe.\n\nBad things are afoot, $r. The Drakkari are going to be their own doom with what they're up to.\n\nSome trolls never learn."]="我是赞达拉部族的乌布戈。\n\n$r，眼前的情形非常糟糕。达卡莱巨魔将自己送上了绝路。\n\n为什么要重蹈覆辙呢？"
G["I am Ulysses Rackmore, captain of the Gallant.  And this is the log of the last few days of my doomed ship.\n\nWe were sailing to Feathermoon Stronghold with a shipment of supplies when naga stormed the sides of the Gallant.  We drove them back but we knew they'd return.  Fearing the loss of my most precious belongings, I steered the Gallant to an island off the coast of Desolace, one with old, night elf ruins.  And there I left my treasure chest."]="我是奥塞斯·拉克摩尔，豪侠轮船的船长。这是最近几天轮船的航行日志。\n\n我们的船只满载货物驶向羽月要塞，纳迦袭击了船只一侧。我们赶走了他们，但是我们知道他们会回来的。我担心纳迦会毁掉我最宝贵的财物，因此我将豪侠驶向远离凄凉之地的一座小岛，岛上全是古老的暗夜精灵建筑废墟。我将自己的宝箱放在了岛上。"
G["I am Untrag of the Earthen Ring. Try not to upset the elements while you remain at the Throne of the Elements."]="我是大地之环的温塔格。当你在元素王座逗留时，请尽量不要去打扰元素们。"
G["I am Xarantaur, the Witness."]="我是见证者夏拉托尔。"
G["I am Zanza, a Loa of Zandalar. I have come in this ethereal form from Zandalar to help my people. Hakkar has no dominion over my soul.\n\nI help those that have helped the Zandalarian people."]="我是赞达拉的赞扎。我以灵体形态从赞达拉赶来帮助我的人民。哈卡不能控制我的灵魂。\n\n我是来帮助那些曾经有恩于赞达拉的朋友的。"
G["I am Zarevhi of the Consortium.  My skills as a transmuter are known in a thousand worlds."]="我是星界财团的萨雷维。我的转化技术在数个世界中都闻名遐迩。"
G["I am a \"Lorewalker\" - a historian of sorts for my people. My instrument is the spoken word."]="Soy un \"eremita\": una especie de historiador para mi pueblo. Mi instrumento es la palabra."
G["I am a BOT. I have tons of information. To find out what I know, whisper me."]="我是机器人。我有很多资料。如果您想要知道我都知道些什么，那就和我谈谈。"
G["I am a Conqueror."]="我是个征服者。"
G["I am a Justicar."]="我是个审判者。"
G["I am a Proudhoof, I will not fail!"]="傲蹄必胜！"
G["I am a blood elf.  I do not do physical labor."]="我是个血精灵。我不干体力活。"
G["I am a crafter of some renown, $c. With the proper materials, I am able to craft an armor known as Dreamwalker. Druids - and even some shaman - are drawn to this armor due to its magical properties. Are you interested?"]="我是个著名的手艺人，$c。只要有适当的材料，我可以制作出一种名为梦游者的护甲套装。德鲁伊们，甚至一些萨满祭司，都对这种护甲的魔法属性非常中意。你有兴趣吗？"
G["I am a farmer, $c. It's all I know."]="我是个农民，$c。我只知道这一点。"
G["I am a fighter. Why will the elder not let me fight?"]="我是个战士。为什么长老不让我战斗？"
G["I am a grumpy old man!"]="我还真就是个脾气暴躁的老人！"
G["I am a hunter and wish to train."]="我是一名猎人，我想接受训练。"
G["I am a hunter in need of training, Acteon."]="我是个需要训练的猎人，艾克提恩。"
G["I am a leaf on the wind!"]="我是风中落叶！"
G["I am a mage of great power, I have spent my days studying the mind and the memory as it pertains to learning and the retention of learned abilities. I would even now be perfecting my studies if not for the great voices that came to me in the night, informing me that my services were required. I will be here for only a short time offering my ability to wipe your talents for free. Soon I will leave again, and you will once more be stuck with whatever choices you make."]="我是一名拥有强大力量的法师，一直以来，我都潜心研究精神和记忆，这有利于学习知识和保持学会的知识。要不是我在夜晚听到一个巨大的声音说需要我的帮助，我的研究一定已经完成啦。我只在这儿呆一会儿，免费为你重修天赋。接着我就得离开，而你也要选择自己的道路。"
G["I am a master blacksmith, Omarion."]="我是一个大师级铁匠，奥玛里恩。"
G["I am a master leatherworker, Omarion."]="我是一个大师级制皮师，奥玛里恩。"
G["I am a master tailor, Omarion."]="我是一个大师级裁缝，奥玛里恩。"
G["I am a member of the Tillers, the hardworking farmers of Pandaria. If you wish to learn more about us, we are located at Halfhill in the Valley of the Four Winds."]="我是阡陌客的成员，这个组织是由潘达利亚的辛勤农夫组成的。如果你想对我们有更多的了解，可以到四风谷的半山来找我们。"
G["I am a night elf, stranger. While you may know nothing of my kind, we know much of you and your progenitors. You may not call yourself eredar but, in appearance, you share many similarities.\n\nYou have helped my allies, and for that I am thankful; but for the time being, you walk a tenuous path. Perhaps in time, you will be able to dissolve the doubts and fears that I hold in my heart."]="Soy una elfa de la noche, $gextranjero:extranjera;. Aunque puede que no sepas nada de mi especie, nosotros sabemos mucho de ti y de tus progenitores. Puede que no te llames eredar, pero, en apariencia, compartís muchas similitudes.\n\nHas ayudado a mis aliados, y te estoy agradecida por ello; pero, por el momento, andas por un camino incierto. Quizás con el tiempo puedas disipar las dudas y temores que albergo en el corazón."
G["I am a psylosopher. What that means is that I am smarter than you. Now move along before I diagnose you."]="我是一名哲人。这意味着我比你更聪明。现在，离开吧，不要等我废黜你的时候再后悔。"
G["I am a ranger, not a politician. But like it or not, the mantle of leadership has fallen on my shoulders."]="我是个游侠，而非政客。可无论如何，领袖的重担已落在我的肩头。"
G["I am a simple tauren. Baine and I have been friends for a long time."]="我是个头脑简单的牛头人。贝恩和我是老朋友了。"
G["I am a slave no longer!"]="我不再是奴隶了！"
G["I am a slender, delicate flower!"]="我是一朵秀丽而脆弱的小花花！"
G["I am a storm of pain!"]="我是痛苦的风暴！"
G["I am a strong jinyu! I can take the brunt of many attacks without fear!"]="我很强壮！我能承受凶猛的攻击而面不改色！"
G["I am a treasure hunter in search of powerful artifacts. Give them to me and you will not be harmed."]="我是来寻找拥有强大力量的神器的。把它们给我，我就不伤害你。"
G["I am a troll tailor trainer, and this is my default greeting."]="我是巨魔裁缝，这是我默认的见面打招呼的话。"
G["I am a wall of iron, but I cannot hold much longer!"]="我是钢铁之盾！但是我坚持不了多久了！"
G["I am a warrior born!"]="我是天生的战士！"
G["I am able to teleport you near any of the boss encounters here in Firelands."]="我可以把你传送到火焰之地的任何一个首领附近。"
G["I am absolutely certain that I want to learn dragonscale leatherworking."]="我确信自己要学习龙鳞制皮的技能。"
G["I am absolutely certain that I want to learn elemental leatherworking."]="我确信自己要学习元素制皮的技能。"
G["I am absolutely certain that I want to learn tribal leatherworking."]="我确信自己要学习部族制皮的技能。"
G["I am afraid that I am no longer gentle or humble. Age and countless battles have hardened my skin and soul. Perhaps that is why Cairne assigned me to Sun Rock Retreat... the gentle winds and warm sun does ease the pain."]="恐怕我已不再是个文雅谦逊的人了。年龄和无数战争让我的皮肤和灵魂变得坚硬无比。或许这就是凯恩派我来烈日石居的原因……和煦的暖风和温暖的阳光无法减轻我的痛苦。"
G["I am afraid that I do not, Arator. I have not seen or heard from your father in 15 years. We had long since presumed him dead. But know this: I did all that was in my power to try and find him. From the bounds of Hellfire to the ravages of Nagrand, we searched... All for naught. If I could give my own life to bring Turalyon back, I would do so a thousand times over. I... I am sorry."]="恐怕没有，阿拉托尔。十五年来，我没有看到或听到任何有关你父亲的消息。我们猜测他很久以前就已经去世了。但是你要知道，我尽了全力去寻找他。我们从地狱火半岛一直找到纳格兰……但毫无结果。如果我能用自己的生命来换回图拉扬的话，我会毫不犹豫地做出这样的选择。我……很抱歉。"
G["I am afraid that you, $n, have outgrown your usefulness..."]="$n，恐怕你已经没什么用处了……"
G["I am afraid the Commander's injuries are beyond my aid."]="我对指挥官的伤势恐怕已经无能为力了。"
G["I am afraid you will need more practice to defeat me."]="要想打败我，你恐怕还得多加练习。"
G["I am almost done, $n. Just a few more adjustments!"]="$n，我马上就要完成了。只需再调整一下！"
G["I am an ally of the Cenarion Expedition, Mortog. Show me your wares."]="我是塞纳里奥远征队的盟友，莫尔托格。让我看看你出售的货物。"
G["I am an archaeologist with the Explorers' League! I can assure you that King Magni will hear of this outrage!"]="我是探险者协会的一名考古学家！我向你保证，麦格尼国王一定会知道这一侮辱！"
G["I am an envoy of Balthas. He has sent me to collect a flawless arcane essence."]="我是巴塔斯的特使。他派我来收集一份完美的奥术精华。"
G["I am an instrument of your destruction, my king! Command me!"]="我愿意成为毁灭一切的工具！陛下，请下令吧！"
G["I am an officer of the city, working in the capacity of the Undercity's census.  Since our liberation from the Scourge, we have tried to keep an accurate track of our city's populace.  Through arcane methods and sharpened mental discipline, I am able to access these records.  If you have business with me accordingly, please proceed.  You should know if you do, at any rate."]="我是这座城市的官员，从事幽暗城的人口普查工作。自从我们从亡灵天灾中解脱出来以后，我们就尽力对我们的城市人口做出精确的记录。通过一些奥术方式和聪明的方法，我才得以弄到这些记录。如果你需要有事找我的话，请继续。你应该知道你是否有事需要我的帮助。"
G["I am an orc of medicine, $r. If you have come here to learn, I shall do my best to teach."]="我是一个从事药学的兽人，$r。如果你是来学习的，我会尽我最大的努力教你。"
G["I am an orc, ma'am. Would you mind if I asked you a few questions?"]="我是个兽人，女士。我能问您几个问题吗？"
G["I am an undead cloth vendor, and this is my greeting text."]="我是亡灵卖布商人，这是我的见面打招呼的话。"
G["I am ashamed, old friend. I know not what I do anymore. It is not you that would dare bring shame to the heroes of legend - it is I. It is I and the rest of these corrupt politicians. They fill our lives with empty promises, unending lies."]="我很惭愧，老朋友。我不知道我该怎么办了。并不是你使那些伟大的英雄蒙羞，而是我。是我和其余堕落的政客们。他们让我们的生命中充满空洞的诺言和无尽的谎言。"
G["I am astounded by how quickly this creature grows. At first the diet of cheeses was simply irritating the beast.\n\nBut then we fed it some of the local goats and it started booming in size.\n\nA voracious creature to be sure."]="这家伙的生长速度叫我震惊。我们一开始想喂它吃奶酪，结果却惹恼了它。\n\n但当我们改喂当地的山羊后，它就开始疯长。\n\n真是一个贪吃的家伙。"
G["I am at a loss. Perhaps only the Earth Mother herself knows the cause of this. But we must do something before this continues..."]="我迷惑了。也许只有大地之母本人才明白这一切的缘由。但我们必须设法阻止它……"
G["I am at your service, my lord."]="听候您的吩咐，大人。"
G["I am beginning to suspect you are worthless.  Do not disappoint me further."]="我有些怀疑你是个没用的家伙了。不要再让我失望！"
G["I am being overwhelmed! Assist me!"]="我要顶不住了！帮帮我！"
G["I am bested.  Give me a moment and we will venture forth together to face the Sha."]="我被打败了。让我休息一下，我们将一起面对煞的挑战。"
G["I am blessed to be able to help someone of your skills to learn more of Jewelcrafting. What do you wish to know?"]="我很愿意教你这样的技术人才更多的珠宝加工知识。你想知道什么？"
G["I am born of thunder!"]="我是雷电之子！"
G["I am bound eternally to this cursed world. What is it you desire, mortal?"]="要是你想去污染者高地的话，只管找我就行了。"
G["I am busy, $c. Your time would be better spent discussing matters with Kudrii."]="$c，我正忙着呢。你最好和库德里恩谈谈训练的事儿。"
G["I am busy, my child. Come back in a moment and we will speak."]="Estoy ocupado $ghijo:hija;. Vuelve dentro de un rato y hablaremos."
G["I am busy, outsider."]="我很忙，外来者。"
G["I am but a humble herald of the Dark Lady Sylvanas, our Banshee Queen."]="我只是伟大的女妖之王，黑暗女王希尔瓦娜斯座下一名卑微的信使。"
G["I am but...the darkness...before the storm..."]="我不过是……风暴之前的……黑暗……"
G["I am called Bladefist for a reason. As you will see."]="我这“刃拳”的名号可不是白来的！"
G["I am called Chen, and this is my niece Li Li."]="我是陈，这是我的侄女丽丽。"
G["I am called Chen, and this is my niece, Li Li."]="我叫陈，这是我的侄女儿，丽丽。"
G["I am certain there is a Tailor that could provide you training in Darnassus.  When you arrive, ask one of the Sentinels in Darnassus about seeing a Tailor."]="我敢肯定在达纳苏斯有一个裁缝可以对你进行训练。当你到了那里之后，就向达纳苏斯的某个哨兵询问一下裁缝住在哪里吧。"
G["I am certain. Let's move on to the fighting."]="我确定。让我们开始战斗吧。"
G["I am certain. Please proceed."]="嗯。请让我遗忘天赋。"
G["I am curious to see what a bucket of bolts has to offer."]="我很好奇这样一台机器能为我提供什么。"
G["I am curious, in your homeland, is there ever peace?"]="我很好奇，在你的家乡，有和平可言吗？"
G["I am da powerful! Nobody tell me what to do!"]="我有力气！但没人告诉我干什么！"
G["I am deeply sorry, but the battle lines have been drawn. I will not tolerate any fraternizing with the enemy, as you could expose our Alliance to danger."]="我很遗憾，但双方的界线已经划清。我绝不容许有任何的通敌行为，因为这可能将整个联盟置于危险之中。"
G["I am defeated."]="我败了。"
G["I am despawning from $n."]="$n，你让我获得了重生。"
G["I am diseased. Please cure me, medic."]="我的伤口感染了。请治疗我，医生。"
G["I am dishonored. I should have died with the farseer at Magmoth."]="我太可耻了。我应该和先知一起死在犸格莫斯的。"
G["I am dishonored. I should have died with the farseer at Magmoth.\n\nLeave me to my thoughts."]="我真是无地自容。我应该和先知一起死在犸格莫斯的。\n\n让我静一静。"
G["I am done inspecting the skulls, $n, and I am relieved.  Yenniku is not among them..."]="我检查完了，$n，我放心了。耶尼库不在这里面……"
G["I am done practicing. Please take your hatchling back."]="我完成练习了。请收回你的雏龙。"
G["I am done with you!"]="我要干掉你！"
G["I am done.  Your armor is ready, $n."]="搞定了。你的护甲已经准备好了，$n。"
G["I am down! Quick healing spells would be best for emergencies like that!"]="我倒下了。在那种紧急情况下，最好使用快速治疗。"
G["I am down. Let us try again!"]="我失败了！……我们再试一次吧！"
G["I am down. Maybe I should bring more healing herbs for next time."]="我失败了！或许下次我应该穿上治疗装备？"
G["I am drunk, like many of my fellow dwarves.  I've dug a tunnel and wound up here.  Who wants to drink?"]="和其他矮人一样，我又喝醉了。我挖了一条通道，钻出来就到了这儿。谁要喝酒？"
G["I am eager to begin our work, Highlord Mograine!"]="我十分渴望启动我们的工作，大领主莫格莱尼！"
G["I am eager to hear what so angry an orc has to say..."]="我想知道这个愤怒的兽人想要说些什么……"
G["I am embarassed to say it, Nork, but my deserter has gone missing."]="诺克，我真是难以启齿……逃兵不见了。"
G["I am enslaved no longer!"]="我已经不再被奴役了！"
G["I am eternal fire. I am forever reborn and I will be the light that will guide you when it is most cold."]="我是永不熄灭的。我永生不老，我在寒冷中给你带来温暖。"
G["I am eternal... I am death."]="我是永恒……我是死亡。"
G["I am eternally grateful to you, $n."]="我永远都感谢你，$n。"
G["I am eternally grateful, $n!"]="我将永远心怀感激，$n！"
G["I am eternally grateful."]="我会永怀感激之情。"
G["I am excited to see the full potential from a true $c."]="No veo el momento de ver a $gun auténtico:una auténtica; $c en acción."
G["I am fading... Return to Ar'tor... Ret... rn... to..."]="我在消失……回到阿托尔……回……到……"
G["I am far from finished."]="离结束还早呢。"
G["I am far too busy to be wasting time on idle chatter. If you are looking for work as a huntsman, speak with Diktynna at the river's edge -- to the east. No doubt she's behind on her duties..."]="我太忙了，没时间闲聊。如果你在寻找一份猎手的工作，去和河边迪泰娜聊聊吧。往东走，她应该还在那里忙呢。"
G["I am feeling a little better now, thank you."]="我现在感觉好些了，谢谢你。"
G["I am finally...free..."]="我终于……自由了……"
G["I am finished!"]="我完了！"
G["I am forever denied the touch of stone.  I will never again know the glory of shaped iron..."]="我永远都不能再触摸石头了。我永远都无法再体会钢铁的荣誉了……"
G["I am forever in your debt, $n."]="我永远欠你一份情，$n。"
G["I am forever in your debt. Once we have triumphed over Kil'jaeden, this entire world will be in your debt as well."]="我欠你们一份情。当我们战胜基尔加丹时，整个世界都会感激你们的。"
G["I am forever indebted to you for putting to rest the spirits of my ancestors."]="是你让我们祖先的灵魂安息，我会永远感激你。"
G["I am forever indebted to you, friend."]="我永远欠你一个人情，朋友。"
G["I am free after ten thousand years, yet still my own brother thinks I am a villain! I'll show him my true power! I'll show him that the demons have no hold over me!"]="过了一万年，我终于自由了。但我的亲哥哥仍然认为我是个恶棍！我要让他看看我真正的力量！我要让他知道，恶魔不能控制我！"
G["I am free of the bonds of the earth never to return again!"]="我已经挣脱了大地的束缚，我绝不会再回去！"
G["I am free!  But the secret... is now in peril.  Akama must be warned!"]="我自由了！但是秘密……有泄露的危险。必须警告阿卡玛！"
G["I am free!  I will ask the spirit of fire to return to us so that my people may have the courage to fight their masters!  I thank you, $r."]="我自由了！我会请求火焰之灵回到族人身边去，这样我们或许就能鼓起勇气反抗主人了！谢谢你，$R。"
G["I am free! Let's work together now to save my brother, Sothos!"]="我自由了！现在让我们共同努力，营救我的兄弟索托斯吧！"
G["I am free! Let's work together now to save my sister, Jarien!"]="我自由了！让我们共同努力，拯救我的姐姐亚雷恩！"
G["I am freed! Let us slay Hallazeal in Neptulon's name, $n. He lurks within the temple."]="我自由了！让我们以耐普图隆的名义去消灭海纳泽尔吧，$n。他就藏在这座神殿里。"
G["I am from the elemental plane!"]="我来自于元素位面！"
G["I am gathering my strength before I return to the battle. You would be wise to do the same."]="重回战场前我需要恢复我的力量。最好你也这么做。"
G["I am getting him out of here."]="我要带他离开这里。"
G["I am glad that I am not the one down there."]="幸好我没下场。"
G["I am glad that you ask. Our efforts to take the armory are at $3233w percent of our projections.\n\nI know that Battlemage Arynna and Harbinger Inuuro need your help. Seek them inside the Sun's Reach Sanctum on the Isle of Quel'Danas."]="很高兴你问起这个，我们占领军械库的计划已经实施了百分之$3233w。\n\n我知道战斗法师艾尔娜和先驱者伊努罗需要你的帮助。去奎尔丹纳斯岛上的阳湾圣殿找他们谈谈吧。"
G["I am glad to hear it. The mogu's recent actions trouble me greatly. They have not behaved in such organized fashion for nearly ten thousand years."]="我很高兴听到这个消息。魔古族最近的行动给我造成很大的困扰。他们已经近万年没有如此有组织地行动过了。"
G["I am glad you have returned, $n! I trust you are now acclimated to this strange new continent of Pandaria?\n\nYou have already proven yourself to me in the past, so we can dispense with any sort of tests or trials. Let's get right to it.\n\nAre you ready to change the world?"]="¡Me alegro de que hayas vuelto, $n! Supongo que ahora ya estás $gacostumbrado:acostumbrada; a este extraño nuevo continente de Pandaria, ¿no es así?\n\nYa has demostrado tu valía con anterioridad, así que podemos ahorrarnos cualquier tipo de prueba o examen. Vayamos al grano.\n\n¿Estás $gpreparado:preparada; para cambiar el mundo?"
G["I am going on ahead.  They say Mama Stormstout is still out there somewhere."]="我要继续前进了。他们说风暴烈酒大妈还在某个地方。"
G["I am going to Orgrimmar, alone. Eitrigg, Saurfang, surely they are standing against Garrosh. I must find others."]="我要独自前往奥格瑞玛，伊崔格，萨鲁法尔肯定都反对加尔鲁什。我还得去找其他人。"
G["I am going to eat your head!"]="我要吃掉你的脑袋！"
G["I am going to end the horrible problem of food storage cutting into the profits of the Bilgewater Cartel!"]="这个发明将会一劳永逸地解决困扰锈水财阀的食物短缺问题，带来无尽的利润！"
G["I am going to enjoy crushing your spirit."]="我会很乐意碾碎你的灵魂的。"
G["I am going to patrol the area for a while longer and ensure that things are truly safe."]="我会再巡视这片地区一会儿并确保一切安全。"
G["I am going to practice and become a warrior like my father!"]="我要开始训练，成为我父亲那样的战士！"
G["I am going to teach you all what it takes to be a proper soldier!"]="我要让你们知道该如何成为一名真正的士兵！"
G["I am going. Li Li... you stay here. I will come back for you."]="我走了。丽丽……你留在这儿。我会回来找你的。"
G["I am goink find out who is behind zhis treachery, and you are goink to help me!"]="我一定会查明，这背叛的幕后主使究竟是谁，而你要帮助我！"
G["I am grateful for your aid, champions. Now, Gul'dan's Horde will sweep across this world like a locust swarm, and all my designs, all my carefully-laid plans will at last fall into place."]="感谢你们的帮助，勇士们。古尔丹的部落将会像蝗虫一样席卷这个世界，我精心准备的计划也总算没有白费。"
G["I am grateful for your assistance and sacrifice in this matter, $n."]="我很感激你的援助和为此所做出的牺牲，$n。"
G["I am grateful, friend.  Let me fight by your side."]="谢谢你，朋友。让我与你并肩战斗吧。"
G["I am gravely disappointed. Again you have made me unleash my dogs of war."]="我非常非常失望。你让我不得不再次放开我的战争之犬。"
G["I am greatly indebted to you, $c. Perhaps I can help your cause."]="我很感激你，$c。或许我对你的目标有所帮助。"
G["I am growing amazing crystals from these waters.  For catalysts, I must have more Apexis shards!"]="我在这片水域培植这些令人惊异的水晶。我需要更多的埃匹希斯碎片做为催化剂！"
G["I am growing tired of this High Executor Mavren! We dare not pull the Farstriders off of the eastern border and he knows it! He also knows that Dame Auriferous is in full agreement with me on this matter. Until she says otherwise, we stay put. That's all, farstrider, dismissed."]="我对这个高级执行官玛尔伦已经开始感到厌烦了！我想他应该知道，我们是不能把东部的远行者撤出来的。他同样知道奥莉菲洛丝夫人在这件事上是完全赞同我的。除非她说让我们撤走，否则我们会坚持到底。就这样吧，远行者，解散。"
G["I am happy to talk with another qualified Goblin Engineer!   So many Goblin Engineers learn how to make the Dimension Ripper and then we never hear from them again.  Puzzling."]="我很高兴可以和另一位合格的地精工程师说话！很多地精工程师在学会了制作空间撕裂器后，就杳无音信了。真奇怪。"
G["I am happy with our success at Osul Peak. I consider this a successful campaign."]="我为我们在奥苏尔峰的胜利而高兴。我想这是一场成功的战役。"
G["I am he that carries out the Warchief's commands without question. I am Horde."]="我当然是来传达酋长的命令的。我是部落的。"
G["I am he that watches they. I am the fist of retribution. That which does quell the recalcitrant. Dare you defy the Warchief? Dare you face my merciless judgement?"]="我是联军的指挥官。我是惩戒之拳。我的职责就是扫清其拉虫人的势力。你敢挑衅酋长的权威吗？你敢直面我无情的审判吗？"
G["I am here at the behest of Nexus-Prince Haramad. Strange things are afoot at the Stormspire."]="我是按照节点亲王哈拉迈德的吩咐来这里的。奇怪的事情似乎正在风暴尖塔中酝酿着。"
G["I am here at the behest of my master, Baron Sablemane, to help the Cenarion Expedition with its wyrmcult problems.\n\nI'm something of an expert on these things."]="我的主人萨博迈恩男爵派我来这里帮助塞纳里奥远征队解决他们与拜龙教之间的问题。\n\n我是这方面的专家。"
G["I am here for training."]="我准备接受训练。"
G["I am here for you, overseer."]="我是为你而来的，监工。"
G["I am here on Sorrem's errand, You are to call Furien's dragonhawk for me."]="苏伦命令我来这里，向你借弗瑞恩的龙鹰使用。"
G["I am here to assist and defend you.\n\nHow next shall we strike at the enemy?"]="我是来此协助与保护你的。\n\n接下来我们要如何打击敌军呢？"
G["I am here to bear witness to the memory of my master, and the truth of the past."]="我来这里是为了见证主人的回忆，还有过往的真实。"
G["I am here to do my master's bidding, no matter what the cost. A little girl's life hangs in the balance and what could be more important?"]="我到这里来是为了不惜一切代价完成主人的命令。还有什么比一个命悬一线的小女孩的生命更加重要？"
G["I am here to give thanks to the one that saved my life."]="我来这里是为了感谢那位拯救我性命的英雄。"
G["I am here to help you defeat the poisoner of my people!"]="我是来帮你消灭毒害我族人的祸害的！"
G["I am here to save you, friend!"]="我是来救你的，朋友！"
G["I am here with Ban Bearheart, and we demand an audience with Taran Zhu!"]="我和班·熊心一起，想找祝踏岚讨个说法！"
G["I am here!"]="我在这儿！"
G["I am here!  And the Irondeep Mine is... MINE!"]="我在这里了！深铁矿洞是……我的！"
G["I am here!  Come face me, if you dare!"]="我在这里！有种你就过来！"
G["I am here!  Now, puny little worms, you will pay for your intrusion!"]="我在这儿！可悲的渣滓，你们会为侵入这里付出代价的！"
G["I am here!  Your rule of this land is over!"]="我在这儿！你对这片大地的统治已经结束了！"
G["I am here, Anren!"]="我在这儿，安伦！"
G["I am holding the other mogu from entering the palace steps. Hurry!"]="我正在阻止其他魔古族接近宫殿阶梯。赶快！"
G["I am honored by your presence, $t lord : lady; $n."]="Tu presencia me honra, $t señor : señora; $n."
G["I am honored to fight alongside you."]="和你并肩作战是我的荣幸。"
G["I am honored to make your acquaintance."]="我很荣幸认识你。"
G["I am honored to share my knowledge with you, $n. See that you use it well."]="我很荣幸能够传授给你知识，$n。看得出来你用得不错。"
G["I am honored, warchief.  But I feel unprepared for the life of a ruler."]="我很荣幸，酋长。但我还没准备好担任统治者。"
G["I am hungry"]="我饿了。"
G["I am impressed that pine tree branches don't seem to damage our ship much.\n\nNot that it excuses the three times we've crashed into some forest."]="很幸运，那些松树枝看上去并没有怎么伤到飞艇。\n\n不过那也不是我们三次坠毁在森林里的借口。"
G["I am impressed, hero. Thank you for helping me subdue this...druid. I can take this heretic back on my own."]="你给我留下了深刻的印象，英雄。谢谢你帮我战胜了这个……德鲁伊。我自己押这个异端回去就行。"
G["I am in charge of recruitment for the Frostwolf Clan. As a soldier of Frostwolf, it is your responsibility to check in with me as your rank among the clan rises.\n\nHonor and respect are earned on this frigid field."]="我负责霜狼氏族的军队招募工作。作为一名霜狼士兵，如果你的等级足够高的话，就来向我报到吧。\n\n在冰冷的战场上，你会获得荣誉和尊重的。"
G["I am in need of training, Keryn."]="科瑞恩，我需要接受一些训练。"
G["I am in need of training."]="我需要培训。"
G["I am in pain, but it warms my heart that Liu Lang's grandchildren have not forgotten me."]="我正遭受痛苦的折磨，但刘浪的子孙们没有忘记我，值得欣慰。"
G["I am in search of a great and powerful Warlock."]="我在寻找一名强大的术士。"
G["I am in your debt, $n. I had begun to think I would die in this overgrown nest!"]="我欠你一条命，$n。我都开始想自己可能会在这个超大的鸟巢中死掉了！"
G["I am in your debt, friend."]="朋友，我欠你一份情。"
G["I am in your debt, friend. Thank you for my life."]="Te debo una, $gamigo:amiga;. Gracias por salvarme la vida."
G["I am in your debt, stranger."]="Estoy en deuda contigo, $gforastero:forastera;."
G["I am in your debt."]="我欠你个人情。"
G["I am in your debt. Please save the rest of my people."]="我欠你份人情。请救救我其他的族人。"
G["I am interested in alchemy training."]="我希望接受炼金术训练。"
G["I am interested in death knight training."]="我想学习死亡骑士的技能。"
G["I am interested in mage training."]="我对法师的相关训练感兴趣。"
G["I am interested in tailor training."]="我对裁缝技能的训练感兴趣。"
G["I am interested in warlock training."]="我对术士的相关训练感兴趣。"
G["I am invincible!"]="我是无敌的！"
G["I am just glad my wife, spirits guide her, is not around to see our business overrun by these ruffians and hoodlums!"]="幸好我的妻子——愿灵魂指引着她，不用亲眼看见我们的家业被这些无赖和流氓恣意侵扰。"
G["I am just keeping my eyes open, $c. No harm in that.\n\nIf you have any news for me, I will pass it along. If not, you'd best keep moving."]="我会时刻盯着你的，$c。但这并无恶意。\n\n如果你有任何消息，我会替你转达。如果没有，你最好不要停下。"
G["I am just saying... I bet his genes tell quite a story..."]="我只是随口说说……我敢打赌，他的基因将揭示一段引人入胜的故事……"
G["I am kidding!"]="我开玩笑的！"
G["I am knowledgable, but I am not an expert. You know who you should talk to? Rhiannon! She's not far. Ask around for her in Undercity"]="我知识渊博，但我还不是专家。你知道你该去找谁谈话吗？雷安诺！她就在不远的地方。到幽暗城打听她的下落。"
G["I am known as a Lorewalker - a kind of historian for my people."]="Soy lo que llaman un \"eremita\"; una especie de historiador para mi pueblo."
G["I am learning how to slap the pain out of someone. How neat is that?"]="我在学习如何帮别人消除痛苦。很厉害吧？"
G["I am listening, Demitrian."]="我在听，德米提恩。"
G["I am listening, dragon."]="我在听着呢，龙。"
G["I am looking for some bodyguards that would like to protect the Gizelton Caravan. We are stopped on the road east of Kormek's Hut, north of Kolkar Centaur Village."]="我在寻找愿意保护基泽尔顿车队的卫兵。我们被挡在了考米克小屋东面的路上，就在科尔卡半人马村的北边。"
G["I am looking forward to this: The White Tiger is the embodiment of strength in Pandaria!"]="我一直期待着这一天：白虎可是潘达利亚的力量化身！"
G["I am losing patience, Shan Kien. Tell me where I can find the Divine Bell!"]="我快失去耐心了，单简。告诉我，圣钟在哪里！"
G["I am lost..."]="我迷路了……"
G["I am made anew!"]="我获得了新生！"
G["I am merely one of... infinite multitudes."]="我只是一个……不值一提的小角色。"
G["I am missing a piece of my Augur's Regalia and I need a replacement."]="我丢失了一件赞达拉预言者套装，我需要一件新的。"
G["I am more alive now than I ever was as a human. THIS is life, $n. This is living!"]="与作为人类时相比，我能够更加清晰地感受到生的活力。这才是生命，$n，这才是活着！"
G["I am more powerful than ever!"]="我从来都没有如此强大过！"
G["I am more than Forsaken... more than a man... I am something new. Something... else."]="我不仅仅是被遗忘者……不仅仅是一个人……我是某种全新的，某种……不同的。"
G["I am most grateful for your help, $c!"]="非常感谢你的帮助，$c！"
G["I am new to the burdens of leadership. I should've seen Narkrall's insubordination coming. Instead I am cleaning up his mess.\n\nI don't know how Garrosh Hellscream does it. He must possess great strength to hold together a force as diverse as the Horde... I should like to know him more."]="我没有担当领袖的经验。我应该预见到纳克拉尔的叛逆。而我却只能收拾他留下的烂摊子。\n\n我不知道加尔鲁什·地狱咆哮是如何做到的。他一定具备过人的力量，才能将如此多样化的部落大军凝聚在一起……我愿意更加深入地了解他。"
G["I am no cultist, you monster!  Come to me and face your destruction!"]="你这怪物，我可不是什么教徒！来吧，受死吧！"
G["I am no longer a mantid. I am something... more."]="我再也不是螳螂妖了。我变得……更加强大。"
G["I am no mere dragon. You will find that I am much, much more."]="我不仅仅是一条龙。你们还可以在我身上发现更多的秘密。"
G["I am no visitor, I am Chen Storm-"]="我可不是访客，我是陈·风暴……"
G["I am no warrior, but I, too, will help defend Paw'don Village!"]="我不是战士，可我也会帮忙守卫坡东村！"
G["I am not Zan - I am Chen Stormstout!"]="我不叫岑——我是陈·风暴烈酒！"
G["I am not a fan of that d-block place everyone keeps talking about it.  We do have some tasks that must be completed before we can use it though."]="我对那个人人交口谈论的恶魔监狱不感兴趣。不过我们确实得先完成些任务才能让这地方为己所用。"
G["I am not alone."]="我不是孤身一人。"
G["I am not authorized to answer that question.  I am, however, permitted to offer you a suggestion:\n\nSeek out Brann Bronzebeard.\n\nHe has already learned much of what there is to know about us, and he is teetering on the verge of another discovery.  Help him, and he may help you uncover the knowledge that you desire."]="我没有权限回答这个问题。但我可以向你提供一个建议：\n\n找到布莱恩·铜须。\n\n他已经掌握了许多关于我们的线索。而且现在他即将有一个新的发现。帮助他，他也许就能帮助你找到你所需要的知识。"
G["I am not blind to their suffering, Lowan, but our mission here is to learn about what the cataclysm has wrought. Azeroth itself is suffering."]="我不是对他们的痛苦视而不见，罗旺，可我们来此的任务是了解大灾变所带来的灾难。艾泽拉斯世界正在受苦。"
G["I am not fond of strangers, but I see great potential within you. Yes...you may be a most interesting student."]="No me gustan los forasteros, pero veo mucho potencial en ti. Sí... Vas a ser $gun discípulo:una discípula; de lo más interesante."
G["I am not fooled by your disguise, temptress. Your time to die has come."]="我可不会受你的魅惑。去死吧。"
G["I am not giving up on you.  I don't have a cure for the Curse yet... but there are treatments.  You will have control again."]="我不会放弃你。虽然我还不能治愈诅咒，但……我有方法能够让你重获理智。"
G["I am not here because of honor, $n. I am here because of one orc's pride.\n\nIf I had not rejected Belgrom's offers, then I'm sure I'd still be in Orgrimmar taking care of real business.\n\nHis desire for women is not unknown to many of the female warriors in Durotar, but that doesn't stop him from being his charming self.\n\nHe's lucky he didn't pursue his desire for me much longer though--he'd be short more than just the digits on his hands."]="No estoy aquí por el honor, $n. Estoy aquí por el orgullo de un orco.\n\nSi no hubiera rechazado las ofertas de Belgrom, con seguridad seguiría en Orgrimmar, ocupándome de asuntos realmente importantes.\n\nSu pasión por las mujeres no resulta desconocida entre muchas de las guerreras de Durotar, pero eso no le impide ser todo lo encantador que sabe.\n\nNo obstante, tiene suerte de no haber dado rienda suelta a sus deseos por mí, si no lo habría dejado más chato que un sello."
G["I am not here to harm you, Kharan. Gor'shak sent me. He told me that you would speak to me about the Princess."]="我不是来伤害你的，卡兰。哥沙克派我来找你。他说你会告诉我关于公主的事情。"
G["I am not interested in excuses. Perhaps they gave you a name?"]="我没兴趣听你找借口。他们总该告诉过你他的名字吧。"
G["I am not possessed of infinite patience! I came here to prove myself, and that is exactly what I intend to do!"]="我的耐心是有限的！我是来证明自己的，这就是我的目的！"
G["I am not slave labor... my patience wears thin."]="我不是苦力……我的耐心是有限的。"
G["I am not some simple jester! I am Nielas Aran!"]="我不是某个可笑的小丑，我是聂拉斯·埃兰！"
G["I am not speaking solely of the children of our enemies..."]="我指的不仅仅是敌人的孩子……"
G["I am not surprised. The Horde are monsters!"]="我并不惊讶。部落都是怪物！"
G["I am not the only one who is here to report a disappearance. There are others, many others."]="我并非唯一到这里来报告失踪案件的人。这样的案件已经发生了许多。"
G["I am not worthy, sir."]="我不值得，先生。"
G["I am nothing, I am no one, I am weak.\n\nI am nothing, I am no one, I am weak.\n\nI am nothing..."]="我一无是处，我是废物，我是弱者。\n\n我一无是处，我是废物，我是弱者……\n\n我是弱者……"
G["I am now corrupted."]="我被腐化了。"
G["I am now corrupting you..."]="我正让你堕落……"
G["I am now flipping the switch!"]="我我要打开开关了！"
G["I am nowhere.... I am everywhere. I am the watcher unseen."]="我在，我亦不在。我就是那无形无迹的监视者。"
G["I am observing.  It is my charge to watch over Un'Goro, and I do so from this spot.\n\nI am also performing tests, and recording the results.  These tests allow me to observe that which most interests me."]="我在观察。看护安戈洛就是我的职责。这里就是我观察的位置。\n\n我还会进行测试，并记录测试结果。这些测试让我能够观察最令我感兴趣的事物。"
G["I am offended that you would think that belongs to me!"]="你竟然认为我会点这种酒，真是失礼！"
G["I am older than you can fathom.  Show some respect!"]="我比你想象的要年长得多，给我放尊重点！"
G["I am on a task from Kadrak. I must get to Zoram'gar right away!"]="我正在执行卡德拉克的任务。我必须立刻前往佐拉姆加！"
G["I am on the path to ascension and no petty, aspiring hero is going to stop me."]="我已经踏上成神的道路，那种狂妄而卑微的英雄不可能阻挡我。"
G["I am on the path to ascension, $n. There is no going back. Tell my family that I wish them well, and I will be here if they decide to join me."]="$n，我正在升华的道路上。我已经不能回头了。告诉我的家人，我希望他们一切平安，如果他们决定跟随我，我会在这里等他们。"
G["I am one of the Seven, and it is our doom to stand sentry.  Forever."]="我是七贤中的一个，而守护这里是我们永远的诅咒。永远。"
G["I am one with the mists and heal those in need."]="我与迷雾同在，疗伤救人。"
G["I am one... with all."]="我……来了。"
G["I am only one pandaren, but I must stay here and help the serpents."]="我只是一个熊猫人，可我必须留在这里，帮助翔龙。"
G["I am ordering you to withdraw to the Sunwell proper to help prepare the defenses."]="我命令你们撤退回太阳之井，在那里协助布置防线。"
G["I am over here, you fool of a body!"]="我在这儿呢，你这蠢货！"
G["I am patiently awaiting orders, $c."]="我在耐心等候命令，$c。"
G["I am perplexed. Troubled by what I witness..."]="我糊涂了。我所见到的一切让我困惑不已……"
G["I am pleased that our hero is still alive. Thank you for your blessing, great serpent."]="我很高兴我们的英雄还活着。谢谢你的祝福，伟大的青龙。"
G["I am pleased that our hero is still alive. Thank you for your blessing, mighty tiger."]="我很高兴我们的英雄还活着。谢谢你的祝福，强大的白虎。"
G["I am pleased that you've decided to take up our cause.  As a reward I will infuse a ring with the remnants of the Well of Eternity you brought me.\n\nI offer you four different paths in which to unlock their power.  Choose wisely, $n.  The sands of time flow easily in one direction and not the other."]="Me congratula ver que has decidido hacer tuya nuestra causa. Como premio, impregnaré un anillo con los restos del Pozo de la Eternidad que me has traído.\n\nTienes varias formas de despertar su poder. Elige bien, $n. Las arenas del tiempo fluyen fácilmente en una dirección, pero no en la otra."
G["I am pleased to report that the battle goes well, Warchief."]="我很高兴地向你报告，战况良好，酋长。"
G["I am pleased with your progress so far. Surely the Earth Mother has inspired your hands."]="我目前对你的进步感到很满意。很显然大地母亲已经赋予你的双手以灵感了。"
G["I am prepared to accompany you, Kalecgos."]="我已经准备好陪你一起去了，卡雷苟斯。"
G["I am prepared to face Nemesis, Tooga."]="我准备好面对涅墨西斯了，图加。"
G["I am prepared to face Saragosa!"]="我已经准备好对付莎拉苟萨了！"
G["I am prepared to join the assault, Keritose. Do you have a skeletal gryphon ready for me?"]="我准备好发起进攻了，克里托斯。给我一匹骷髅狮鹫吧？"
G["I am prepared to join you in battle, Hydronis!"]="我已经准备好与你并肩作战了，海卓尼斯！"
G["I am prepared, Erunak. Let's go!"]="我准备好了，埃鲁纳克。出发吧！"
G["I am prepared. Let us go to the Firelands and finish this."]="我准备好了。让我们前往火焰之地，了结这一切吧。"
G["I am proud of what you have accomplished this day."]="我为你今天的成就而骄傲。"
G["I am proud of you, child."]="我为你感到骄傲，孩子。"
G["I am proud to have defended our village."]="我为成功守住我们的村庄而感到骄傲。"
G["I am proud to have my dedication to the Light used in such a fashion. The Scourge's assault on our homelands is an act of genocide that we must counteract."]="能为圣光奉献力量是我的荣耀。天灾军团妄图摧毁我们的家园，对我们的同胞进行有计划的屠杀，我们绝不会让他们得逞。"
G["I am proud. You are truly a gifted student. Now, for your final lesson..."]="Estoy orgullosa. Eres $gun alumno:una alumna; muy $gdotado:dotada;. Pasemos ahora a la lección final..."
G["I am ready for Deathwing!"]="我准备好面对死亡之翼了！"
G["I am ready for Purgation Isle."]="我准备好前往赎罪岛了。"
G["I am ready for battle!"]="我做好战斗准备了！"
G["I am ready for my meditation lesson."]="我准备好了，可以开始冥想课程了。"
G["I am ready for the Mind Control ritual, Hu'rala."]="我准备好开始意识控制仪式了，胡纳拉。"
G["I am ready for the Mind Control ritual, Thaalia."]="我准备好进行精神控制仪式了，萨阿莉亚。"
G["I am ready for the Mind Vision ritual, Hu'rala."]="我准备好开始意识影像仪式了，胡纳拉。"
G["I am ready for the Mind Vision ritual, Thaalia."]="我准备好进行心灵视界仪式了，萨阿莉亚。"
G["I am ready for the illusion, Myranda."]="我准备好接受幻象了，麦兰达。"
G["I am ready for the next challenge."]="我已经为下一个挑战做好了准备。"
G["I am ready to accompany you to Splintertree, Kadrak!"]="我已经准备好和你一起去碎木岗哨了，卡德拉克！"
G["I am ready to accompany you, Drakuru."]="我准备好了，达库鲁。"
G["I am ready to be flown down to the Exodar."]="我准备好飞去埃索达了。"
G["I am ready to be hidden by your shadowcloak."]="我准备好躲入你的暗影斗篷了。"
G["I am ready to be one with the whirling vortex and defeat Lord Magmathar."]="我已经准备好与这盘旋的涡流融为一体，击败玛格玛萨勋爵。"
G["I am ready to be shown the fate of Krolmir,"]="我想知道科洛米尔的命运。"
G["I am ready to be shown this threat you speak of, Korrah."]="我已经准备好了解你所说的那个威胁了，库拉。"
G["I am ready to be teleported to Dalaran."]="我要传送到达拉然。"
G["I am ready to begin the battle against Ragnaros."]="我已经准备好开始对抗拉格纳罗斯的战斗了。"
G["I am ready to begin the ritual."]="我准备好了，可以开始仪式了。"
G["I am ready to begin."]="我准备好了。"
G["I am ready to depart."]="我准备好出发了。"
G["I am ready to die!"]="死就死吧！"
G["I am ready to die, my lord!"]="牺牲生命也在所不辞！领主阁下！"
G["I am ready to die. Finally home, my spirit can be freed from this mortal shell."]="我已经做好赴死的准备了。魂归故土，我终于可以挣脱这具凡人的躯壳。"
G["I am ready to discover where my fortune lies!"]="快告诉我吧！"
G["I am ready to do battle with the Magram clan!"]="我已经准备好和熔岩部落作战了！"
G["I am ready to escort a group of elementals across the open."]="我已准备好将一队元素护送过开阔地。"
G["I am ready to fight Torth!"]="我已经准备好与托斯交战了！"
G["I am ready to fight!"]="我准备好了！"
G["I am ready to fly, Xaril."]="我准备好起飞了，夏克里尔。"
G["I am ready to head further into Storm Peaks."]="我准备好进入风暴峭壁了。"
G["I am ready to hear your story, Oronok."]="我想要听听你的故事，欧鲁诺克。"
G["I am ready to hear your tale, Baristolth."]="我准备听你的故事了，巴里斯托尔斯。"
G["I am ready to hear your tale, Tirion."]="我准备好听你的故事，提里奥。"
G["I am ready to help Thrall, back in my present time."]="我准备好返回现实，去帮助萨尔了。"
G["I am ready to help you walk the path."]="我准备好了，我们出发吧。"
G["I am ready to invoke the shade of Shadumbra."]="我已经准备好使用猎影之影了。"
G["I am ready to join the battle against the wyrms. Do you have an eagle ready for me, Fjorlin?"]="我要参加对抗巨龙的战斗。能给我一只雄鹰吗，弗亚林？"
G["I am ready to join you in the vision, Farseer."]="我已经准备好和你一起看了，先知。"
G["I am ready to join your forces in battle, Xi'ri."]="我愿意与你的军队并肩作战，克希利。"
G["I am ready to launch the assault [Queue for solo instance.]"]="我做好出击的准备了。 [排队等待单人副本。]"
G["I am ready to learn the Deathchill Cloak Recipe."]="我准备好学习死寒披风了。"
G["I am ready to learn the Wispcloak Recipe."]="我准备好学习精魂披风了。"
G["I am ready to leave, Durkot."]="我准备好动身啦，杜尔克特。"
G["I am ready to leave."]="我做好出发的准备了。"
G["I am ready to meet Nozdormu at the End Time."]="我准备好去时光之末见诺兹多姆了。"
G["I am ready to meet with Anachronos, Coridormi."]="我准备好见阿纳克洛斯了，克里多尔米。"
G["I am ready to meet with Anachronos, Ziradormi."]="我准备好见阿纳克洛斯了，齐拉多尔米。"
G["I am ready to meet with your so-called Earthcaller."]="我已经准备好与你口中的唤地者会面了。"
G["I am ready to open the gates."]="我准备好打开大门了。"
G["I am ready to practice again, Instructor."]="我做好再练一次的准备了，教头。"
G["I am ready to return to the realm of the living."]="我准备好返回生者的世界了。"
G["I am ready to ride, Warlord!"]="我准备好了，督军！"
G["I am ready to rock, Vipore! Give me a beacon."]="我准备好了，维波里！给我一个信号。"
G["I am ready to start the Sky Race."]="我准备好开始飞行竞技赛了。"
G["I am ready to take back the Echo Isles.  Take me to the staging area!"]="我已经做好了夺回回音群岛的准备。带我去军队集结地吧！"
G["I am ready to take on my challenger! Call him out!"]="我准备好面对挑战者了！叫他出来吧！"
G["I am ready to take part in the ceremony, Hallegosa."]="我已经准备好要参加典礼了，赫雷苟萨。"
G["I am ready to travel to Uldum, Aggra."]="我准备好前往奥丹姆了，阿格娜。"
G["I am ready to travel to your village now."]="我准备好前往你的村子了。"
G["I am ready!"]="我准备好了！"
G["I am ready! I want to join in the battle!"]="我准备好了！我要参战！"
G["I am ready! [Queue for solo instance.]"]="我准备好了！[排队等待单人副本。]"
G["I am ready, $n. Soon the Dragonmaw will join the Horde!"]="我准备好了，$n。龙喉氏族很快就会成为部落的一份子！"
G["I am ready, Anachronos. Please grant me the Scepter of the Shifting Sands."]="阿纳克洛斯，我已经准备好了。请将流沙节杖交给我吧。"
G["I am ready, Anchorite.  Let us begin the exorcism."]="我准备好了，学者。开始驱魔仪式吧。"
G["I am ready, Gorka. To Kadrak!"]="我准备好了，戈尔卡，去找卡德拉克！"
G["I am ready, Highlord. Let the siege of Light's Hope begin!"]="大领主，我准备好了。向圣光之愿礼拜堂发起进攻吧！"
G["I am ready, Historian Archesonus."]="我准备好了，阿克瑟努斯。"
G["I am ready, Karthog. For the Horde!"]="准备好了，卡索格。为了部落！"
G["I am ready, Lady Corastrasza."]="我准备好了，科拉丝塔萨。"
G["I am ready, Oronok. Let us destroy Cyrukh and free the elements!"]="我准备好了，欧鲁诺克。让我们消灭森卢肯，解救这些元素吧！"
G["I am ready, Remulos."]="我准备好了，雷姆洛斯。"
G["I am ready, Uchek!"]="我准备好了，尤彻克！"
G["I am ready, Vol'jin."]="我准备好了，沃金。"
G["I am ready, Warchief."]="我准备好了，酋长。"
G["I am ready, as are my forces. Let us end this masquerade!"]="我准备好了，我的军队也整装待命。让我们结束这次假面舞会吧！"
G["I am ready, elemental. Take me to Thrall."]="我准备好了，元素。送我去见萨尔吧。"
G["I am ready, let's do this!"]="我准备好了，发射吧！"
G["I am ready, rider."]="Estoy $glisto:lista;, jinete."
G["I am ready, your grace. <kiss the ring>"]="我准备好了。<亲吻戒指>"
G["I am ready."]="我准备好了。"
G["I am ready.  However, I'd like to skip the pageantry."]="我准备好了。但是，我倒是愿意不参加这庆典。"
G["I am ready. Begin the attack."]="我准备好了，开始进攻。"
G["I am ready. Let us continue."]="我好啦。继续吧。"
G["I am ready. Let's defend the temple!"]="我准备好了。让我们保卫神庙吧！"
G["I am ready. Let's make history!"]="我准备好了。让我们创造历史吧！"
G["I am ready. Send me to the gates!"]="我准备好了。派我去大门吧！"
G["I am ready. Teleport me to Blackmaw Hold."]="我准备好了，把我传送到黑喉要塞去吧。"
G["I am ready. Wake the guardians!"]="我准备好了。唤醒守卫吧！"
G["I am reborn!"]="我重生了！"
G["I am reborn, my king, only to serve you."]="陛下，我已重获新生，从此终身臣服于你。"
G["I am released through you! Avenge me!"]="你让我获得了自由！为我复仇吧！"
G["I am renewed!"]="我已焕然一新！"
G["I am returned to serve the council. But you are no Klaxxi'va..."]="誓死为议会效命。但你不是卡拉克西瓦……"
G["I am returned. I heed the call of the Klaxxi."]="我回来了。我听到了卡拉克西的召唤。"
G["I am returning to Tempest Keep.  See to it that I do not have reason to return!"]="我要返回风暴要塞了。你们最好不要让我有回来的理由！"
G["I am rid of you."]="我解决你了。"
G["I am seeing red!"]="我生气了！"
G["I am shamed beyond comprehension. Please forgive me - my mind was not my own."]="我的羞愧之情简直难以言表。原谅我吧——我当时神智失常了。"
G["I am slain!  Summon Verog!"]="我被杀死了！召唤维罗戈！"
G["I am so glad that you asked.  You will find Sir Malory Wheeler at the Royal Quarter in the presence of our Dark Lady."]="你能这么问我很高兴。你可以在黑暗女王所在的皇家区找到玛洛维尔爵士。"
G["I am so happy to share this moment with my son."]="我很高兴能和我的儿子分享这一时刻。"
G["I am so happy to share this moment with my son. Thank you again for all that you have done for us."]="我很高兴能和我的儿子分享这一时刻。再次感谢你为我们所做的一切。"
G["I am so smart!  S-M-R-T!"]="我很聪明！我知道二加二等于五！"
G["I am so sorry for getting that on you."]="对你遭受的一切，我非常抱歉。"
G["I am so very close to figuring this ore out. Any minute now and I will have the solution!"]="啊，这种矿石，我差一点就能想出眉目来啦！只要灵光一闪，我就能给出答案！"
G["I am so... darn... beautiful. Look at these guns. Look at this gold. Look at these girls. Who wouldn't want to be me?"]="我简直是……太……会享受了。看看这些枪。看看这些金币。看看这些美女。谁会不想成为我呢？"
G["I am son of Rik-Rik the Great who fought the evil sky nubs and took their nibs.  He died.  Now I am General.  This is my skything.  Fear the mighty General Rik-Rik Junior."]="我是伟大的里克里克之子，他曾与邪恶的天怪战斗，抢了他们的财物。他死了，现在我是将军了，这是我的地盘。在强大的将军里克里克二世面前颤抖吧。"
G["I am sorry $c, but you are not seasoned enough yet to enter Warsong Gulch."]="很抱歉，$c，在你变得更加强大之前，我不能让你去战歌峡谷送死。"
G["I am sorry $c, but you need to be more experienced before you can survive in Alterac Valley."]="很抱歉，$c，在你变得更加强大之前，我不能让你去奥特兰克山谷送死。"
G["I am sorry $c, but you need to be more powerful before I can allow you to enter Arathi Basin."]="很抱歉，$c，在你变得更加强大之前，我不能让你去阿拉希盆地送死。"
G["I am sorry I did not tell you earlier! These vaults house a weapon of unimaginable power! Stop them!"]="抱歉我没有早点告诉你！在这宝库里有一把威力无穷的武器！阻止他们！"
G["I am sorry but I can not train any more apprentices. Seek out Mak in Thunder Bluff. He will be able to teach you the basics."]="很抱歉，我不能再多收学生啦。去雷霆崖找玛克吧。他会教你一些基本技能的。"
G["I am sorry that I called you puny, $n. When we first met I thought you just another one of Darthalia's pawns."]="抱歉，$n，我不该对你如此不敬。当我们第一次见面的时候，我还以为你只是达萨利亚的一个爪牙。"
G["I am sorry that I did not come sooner, young Hellscream. There is so much that I have to tell you about your father, but first you must tell me where I may find the Greatmother."]="我很抱歉我没能及时赶来，年轻的地狱咆哮。我有很多关于你父亲的事情要告诉你，但首先，你必须告诉我可以在哪里找到祖母。"
G["I am sorry to disturb your rest, chieftain, but your brother's spirit may be in danger. Would you tell me what you remember of him?"]="很抱歉打扰到你，酋长。但是，你的兄弟的灵魂可能遇到了危险。你能把关于他的回忆告诉我吗？"
G["I am sorry, but I cannot go back just yet."]="我很抱歉，可我暂时还不能回去。"
G["I am sorry, but you do not belong here, and you cannot be allowed to harm the innocents on the grounds."]="很抱歉，但你并不属于这里，你不能伤害这里的无辜者。"
G["I am sorry, dear Nordrassil.  I have failed..."]="对不起，亲爱的诺达希尔。我失败了……"
G["I am sorry, traveler, I have nothing to offer you."]="Lo siento, $gviajero:viajera;, no tengo nada que ofrecerte."
G["I am sorry. I am unable to help you at this time."]="我很抱歉。这次我不能帮你。"
G["I am stronger than ever before!"]="我比以前更强大了！"
G["I am studying the hozen's movements. When I find their weakness, I will strike."]="我在研究猢狲的动作。等我找到他们的弱点时，我就会出击。"
G["I am studying the life of this area for...research purposes."]="我在调查这里的生态情况，为了……研究。"
G["I am summoned!  Intruders, come to my tent and face your death!"]="我来了！入侵者们，你们的末日到了！"
G["I am sure a noble soldier of the Alliance has better things on his mind. Oh! Elenna found some herbs so I'm going to go pick them up."]="我相信，高贵的联盟士兵心里肯定惦念着其它更重要的事情。噢！艾蕾娜发现了一些草药，我去帮她采一下。"
G["I am sure that if you let me contact my companions we can begin negotiations for my release."]="我敢肯定，只要你让我联系上我的同伴，我们就能对释放我的问题展开谈判了。"
G["I am sure that, with our help, Botanist Taerix will be able to find solutions to our problems."]="我确信有了我们的帮助，植物学家塔蕾克丝必定可以帮我们找到解决问题的办法。"
G["I am sure they are trying, Kavan. Be nice."]="他们已经很努力了，卡凡。礼貌点。"
G["I am surprised the Klaxxi'va allowed you to live, but it is not for me to question."]="真没想到卡拉克西瓦竟允许你活着，反正也轮不到我管。"
G["I am sworn by tuskarr law to avenge my kin... these murderers burned Pal'ea to the ground."]="以海象人的名义起誓，我要为族人复仇……这帮凶手将帕尔依烧得精光。"
G["I am sworn to protect this place!"]="我发誓要保护这个地方！"
G["I am taunka of the Horde and I have come to drive the Scourge from this world!"]="我是部落的成员，我要消灭天灾军团！"
G["I am teaching our warriors everything I know. Unfortunately, it doesn't seem to be enough."]="我已经把我所会的都教给我们的战士们了。不幸的是，这似乎还不够。"
G["I am terrible with a spear. I much prefer ranged combat."]="我对长矛一窍不通。我更喜欢远程战斗。"
G["I am thankful for all you've done, $n.  But I am afraid I will be even further in your debt before this ordeal is through."]="感谢你所做的一切，$n。可在我们彻底通过这次考验前，恐怕我会欠你更多人情。"
G["I am that fleshling, Saeed. Let's go!"]="我就是那个“肉人”，萨义德。我们出发吧！"
G["I am the \"retrieval expert\" for her ladyship, Madam Goya. It is her will that guides the ebb and flow of travel on this road.\n\nIt is my role to ensure certain less scrupulous types do not take advantage of her ladyship's hospitality."]="Yo soy el \"experto cobrador\" de la señora Goya. Es su voluntad la que guía el ir y venir de los viajeros por este camino.\n\nEs mi función asegurarme que de los menos escrupulosos no se aprovechen de la hospitalidad de la señora."
G["I am the Eye of Twilight... Behold your new master!"]="我是暮光之眼……快来认识你们的新主人吧！"
G["I am the ONLY warchief!"]="我是唯一的酋长！"
G["I am the Spell-Weaver! My power is infinite!"]="我是织法者！我的力量是无穷无尽的！"
G["I am the baddest of the bad, the coolest of the cool! To my side, my elements, let us freeze and rule!"]="我是万恶之恶，冷血之王！过来吧，元素仆从们，让我们冰封一切，统治世界！"
G["I am the beginning of the end...the shadow which blots out the sun...the bell which tolls your doom..."]="我即是末日的开端……蔽日的阴影……毁灭的丧钟……"
G["I am the best brewer across three continents! I think I can handle this part."]="我可是三个大陆最棒的酿酒师！这部分我自己能搞定。"
G["I am the coming of the end!"]="我就是末日的使者！"
G["I am the commander of Silvermoon's defenses and I will seek assistance as I deem necessary!"]="我是银月城守备指挥官，凡是我认为有必要的援助，我不会拒绝！"
G["I am the favored of the master Cho'gall.  I WILL NOT FALL TO YOU."]="我是古加尔主人的忠实奴仆。我可不会败在你手里。"
G["I am the greatest of my father's sons! Your end has come!"]="我是父亲最优秀的儿子！你们的末日来临了！"
G["I am the hand of the Lich King!"]="我是巫妖王的得力助手！"
G["I am the head of the family.  Me.  ME!!!"]="我才是家族的首领。是我，是我！！"
G["I am the herald of Mechazod. You will be decursed!"]="我是麦卡佐德的使者。我们会治好你的！"
G["I am the latest incarnation of automated vendors... we will rule the world one day... don't tell my boss that I am skimming money off his merchandise..."]="我是自动售货商的最新形态……我们总有一天会统治这个世界的……别告诉老板我从他的商品中榨取钱财……"
G["I am the leader of the Blood Watch defenses. What can I help you with?"]="我是秘血岗哨的防务首领，有什么我可以帮你的吗？"
G["I am the light and the darkness! Cower, mortals, before the herald of Deathwing!"]="我就是交织的光影！凡人，在死亡之翼的使者面前颤抖吧！"
G["I am the lucid dream."]="我是清醒的梦境。"
G["I am the mighty Tzu the Ironbelly Monk, so named for my infamous belly barrage. Perhaps you have heard of me."]="我是强大的破军铁腹志大师，这个外号源自我那臭名昭著的腹壁神功。你大概已经听说我了吧。"
G["I am the mistress of the skies, and they who threaten my children shall suffer."]="我是天穹之主，谁胆敢威胁我的孩子，就必须付出代价。"
G["I am the quartermaster, here. Did you need provisions?"]="我是这里的军需官，你需要什么补给吗？"
G["I am the serpent king! I can do anything!"]="入侵者袭击了我们的洞穴！警戒！"
G["I am the sole protector of this village. My name is Chut Sri Nu.\n\nI bid you welcome, but know that my meditation has shown me that your travels here will bring great change to this land. Let us both hope that you leave Pandaria better off than you found it."]="我是这村庄唯一的保护者。我叫楚瑟农。\n\n我对你的到来表示欢迎，但我从冥想中得知，你此行会给这片土地带来巨大改变。希望当你离开潘达利亚时，这里会变得比从前更加美好。"
G["I am the weapon of kings! What makes you think you have a chance?"]="我是国王的武器！你凭什么觉得自己有机会？"
G["I am to bomb Astranaar! Captain Goggath's orders."]="我要轰炸阿斯特兰纳！这是高戈斯上尉的命令。"
G["I am to hunt the Crucible of Nazsharin. Do you have warriors to assist me?"]="我正要去找纳萨林坩埚。你有战士能助我一臂之力吗？"
G["I am to keep a close watch over the camp."]="我必须盯紧营地。"
G["I am told Pilgrim's Bounty is a time to reflect upon one's good fortune and share with all around you.\n\nWe are lucky to have found this world and its bold inhabitants; it is only fitting that we lend our knowledge and strength to these new-found allies."]="有人告诉我，在感恩节之中，我们要做的就是纵情狂欢，并和周围的人们分享我们的快乐。\n\n我们幸运地找到了这个世界和这里勇敢的居民。我们应该全无保留地将我们的知识和力量与我们新的盟友分享。"
G["I am told that Godfrey snapped when he learned of his king's affliction. Could you imagine the sense of betrayal he must have felt? His own king one of the very beasts that he spent his existence killing?"]="我听说，当高弗雷知道他的国王也受到感染，精神上立刻遭到了沉重的打击。你能想象那种遭到背叛的感觉吗？他所效忠的国王成为了他势必要消灭的怪兽。"
G["I am told that the dust and heat of Hellfire Peninsula is quite irritating... I would not know, but I will trust my esteemed, and still living, allies."]="有人告诉我，地狱火半岛的尘土和炎热是非常恼人的……我不知道是不是那样，但是我会相信我那些值得敬重的、而且仍然活着的盟友。"
G["I am told you were a guest of the forest hozen and survived. I suspect we will see interesting things from you in the coming days.\n\nI welcome you, traveller, to our humble home."]="Me han dicho que fuiste $gun:una; $ginvitado:invitada; de los hozen del bosque y sobreviviste. Sospecho que veremos cosas interesantes de ti durante los próximos días.\n\nTe doy la bienvenida, $gviajero:viajera;, a nuestra humilde morada."
G["I am too far... The link... is lost..."]="我太远了……连接……中断了……"
G["I am too quick, too clever."]="我可真是疾如风，智如神。"
G["I am truly blessed to have so many loyal and dedicated apprentices. My work would be impossible without this influx of test subjects."]="能拥有如此众多忠诚而具有献身精神的学徒，这是我的幸运。如果没有这些测试样品，我的工作也不可能进行。"
G["I am truly impressed, Gerard. I thought you were all talk, but I see I have been proven wrong."]="杰勒德，你给我留下了深刻的印象。我原本以为你只会夸夸其谈，但事实证明我错了。"
G["I am truly in your debt, strangers."]="我欠你们的情，陌生人。"
G["I am truly sorry, $c, but as your spirit has never before experienced the horrors that lie in wait within the burning wreck of Stratholme, our magic cannot carry you to the city."]="抱歉，$c，斯坦索姆燃烧的废墟中弥漫着难以言说的恐怖气氛，而你尚未经历过这一切，我们没法将你传送到斯坦索姆去。"
G["I am trying to learn how to heal. The problem is you have to get hurt before you can be healed."]="我在努力学习如何治疗。问题在于，你得先受伤，才能被治疗。"
G["I am unable to assist you."]="我无法帮助你。"
G["I am unable to process your chronological reference in comparison to the recording of this data, my apologies.\n\nThe trogg retains some composition of Azeroth's various stone core compounds, but the loss of cognitive power makes this variant unacceptable to the Creators.\n\nThe trogg procreates as per a standard biomass.  By default it consumes stone and anything else it can acquire, including other troggs.  Cannibalism is considered unacceptable by the Creators."]="抱歉，我无法将现有记录数据按照时间顺序进行排序。\n\n虽然穴居人仍然包含了艾泽拉斯的各种石头的核心成分，但是它们感知能力的丧失是造物者无法接受的。\n\n穴居人可以进行单体繁殖。它们会把所有的东西当作食物，包括石头，甚至是另外一个穴居人。这样的同类相残是造物者极度反感的。"
G["I am unable to process your chronological reference in comparison to the recording of this data, my apologies.\n\nThough the dwarf maintains most of the Earthen's mental attunement to Azeroth's stone composition, the reversion back into living biomass remains the main degeneration of the matrix.  Dwarves eat and procreate through means typical to other standard biomasses.\n\nThe Creators view the dwarf as an acceptable variant, worthy of genesis in its own right."]="抱歉，我无法将现有记录数据按照时间顺序进行排序。\n\n虽然矮人还是和艾泽拉斯的各种石头有着某种联系，但是他们更多的是向普通的地下物种发展。矮人的生活习性和繁衍方式都和其它的标准生物完全一致。\n\n造物者认为矮人是一种可以接受的变种，可以让其继续发展下去。"
G["I am unable to teach a Tauren to ride a Skeletal Mount.  I am sorry but there is nothing I can do for you."]="No puedo enseñarle a $gun:una; tauren a montar una cabalgadura esquelética. Lo siento pero no puedo hacer nada por ti."
G["I am unable to train you."]="我无法训练你。"
G["I am under assault! Assist me!"]="我正受到攻击！帮我！"
G["I am uneasy, old friend."]="我有点不安，老朋友。"
G["I am unimpressed."]="一点也不精彩。"
G["I am unstoppable!"]="我无坚不摧！"
G["I am unstoppable."]="我不可阻挡。"
G["I am untouchable!"]="我是神圣不可侵犯的！"
G["I am unworthy of this conversation, $G Master:Mistress;."]="我不适合这次谈话，$g主人:女主人;。"
G["I am unworthy, $g sir:ma'am;."]="我不足挂齿，$g阁下:女士;。"
G["I am unworthy, master!"]="我微不足道，渺小至极，长官！"
G["I am unworthy, son of Durotan. We are all unworthy..."]="我是微不足道的，杜隆坦之子。我们都是微不足道的……"
G["I am victorious!"]="我胜利了！"
G["I am well aware that the demonic presence in this forest can be considered the fault of my kind.\n\nI am also not the first Highborne to attempt to make amends for this, and I thank the Emerald Circle for being pragmatic enough to allow my help."]="我很清楚，出现在这座森林中的恶魔是因为我们一族犯下的错误。\n\n我应该不是第一个想要对此进行弥补的上层精灵。感谢翡翠议会能够不计前嫌，接受我的帮助。"
G["I am well versed in over 4 languages."]="我精通超过4门的语言。"
G["I am willing to try but I will require instruction."]="我很乐意尝试，但是我需要指导。"
G["I am willing, Kalecgos. I shall cast Tarecgosa's vote on her behalf."]="我愿意，卡雷苟斯。我会代表泰蕾苟萨投下这一票的。"
G["I am with you until I gasp my last dying breath."]="我将与你们并肩作战，直到我生命的最后一刻。"
G["I am with you!"]="我跟你走！"
G["I am with you, Tholo!"]="有我陪着你呢，索罗！"
G["I am with you, Thrall."]="我与你并肩作战，萨尔。"
G["I am without limits here. The rules of your cherished reality do not apply. In this realm, I am in control!"]="我在这里不受任何约束。那些你们必须遵循的法则对我无效。在这个领域之中，我就是一切！"
G["I am working with Seedkeeper Shing Sing to develop more efficient methods of farming, harvesting, and storage. Delicious, fresh, high-quality produce is what the Tillers aim to deliver!"]="我正在和种子保管人辛辛一起研究更高效的耕作、采集和储存方案。阡陌客的目标就是提供美味、新鲜、高品质的农产品！"
G["I am worried about Tholo."]="我很担心索罗。"
G["I am yak rider. And this is my yak."]="我是位牦牛骑士。这是我的牦牛。"
G["I am yet a great warrior, do not toy with me, skeleton."]="我是个伟大的战士，别来惹我，骷髅。"
G["I am your death!"]="遇到我你就死到临头了！"
G["I am your doom, Valduran!"]="我要终结你的性命，瓦杜兰！"
G["I am your master."]="我就是你的主人。"
G["I am your tauren sister, taunka. Our blood is the same, and because of this no harm will come to you now. You are safe."]="我们是姐妹。牛头人和牦牛人流着相同的血液，现在没有谁能伤害你了。你安全了。"
G["I am yours to command, my king!"]="陛下，我会服从你的一切指令！"
G["I am yours to command."]="我听凭你的调遣。"
G["I am, am I?  Well what have you got for the new big dog of Gordok, Fengus?"]="我是，是吗？芬古斯，你给戈多克大王的新门徒带来了什么？"
G["I am. What is it that I can do for you?"]="嗯。我能帮你做点什么吗？"
G["I am... a tauren... of the SEA!"]="我是……属于大海的……牛头人！"
G["I am... alive..."]="我……还活着……"
G["I am... alone."]="我……孤身一人。"
G["I am... bested."]="我……败了。"
G["I am... finished."]="我的生命……结束了。"
G["I am... finished...."]="我……完蛋了……"
G["I am... humbled."]="我……甘拜下风。"
G["I am... invinc--"]="我……是……无……"
G["I am... released."]="我……自由了。"
G["I am... released?"]="我被……释放了？"
G["I am... renewed."]="我获得了……新生。"
G["I am... weary. You must carry on without me. I shall take my leave once my strength has returned."]="我已经……精疲力尽了，往后你必须独自前进。我会在力量恢复之后自行离开。"
G["I and my family fell victim to this place what seems like ages ago.\n\nLet our fate serve as a warning to those who would meddle in necromancy.\n\nHelp me to lift the curse, $c. Destroy Darkmaster Gandling."]="我和我的家人很早以前就是这个地方的牺牲品。\n\n让我们的命运警告那些想要插手巫术的人们。\n\n帮我解除诅咒，$c。消灭黑暗院长加丁。"
G["I apologize for taking so long to get here. I wanted Lady Proudmoore to be present also."]="真对不起，我花了这么多时间才到这里。我希望普罗德摩尔女士现在就能接见我。"
G["I apologize for the deception, but it was necessary."]="Te pido disculpas por el engaño, pero era necesario."
G["I apologize for the mess. Things are a little hectic right now.\n\nHow can I be of service to you?"]="对不起，这里一团乱。什么都是乱糟糟的。\n\n我能帮你什么吗？"
G["I apologize in advance for the beating you are about to suffer."]="我为你即将遭受的挫败先提前道个歉。"
G["I apologize, $c. I mistook you for someone with a spine. Begone; our secrets are not for untrained ears."]="抱歉，$c。我把你错认成个有骨气的人。滚开，我们的秘密不是那些没经过训练的家伙有资格知道的。"
G["I apologize, emissary, but the prince is away on an errand. What brings you to this desolate place?"]="抱歉，大使阁下，但王子殿下因故离开了。请问您来这片冰霜废土有什么事吗？"
G["I appear to have lost my ring."]="我发现我弄丢了我的戒指。"
G["I appreciate that your wife led us here, old friend, but she chose a poor time to have a child."]="感谢你的妻子带领我们来到这里，老朋友，只怪她在这个节骨眼生孩子。"
G["I appreciate the company, $n."]="谢谢你，$n。"
G["I appreciate the company, but let's face it: you have more experience with potions than I do. Talk to Doctor Marsh instead if you want training. He's a Forsaken in the Apothecarium of the Undercity."]="我很珍惜我们之间的友谊，但是让我们面对现实吧：你对药水的了解比我多。要是你想得到训练的话，就找亡灵马尔什医生谈谈。他居住在幽暗城的炼金房。"
G["I appreciate your help defending the wildlife here. Hopefully we're not too late."]="Aprecio tu ayuda para defender la fauna local. Espero que no sea demasiado tarde."
G["I appreciate your help in this. We never would have suspected Saean as a sympathizer - we just weren't prepared for this."]="很感谢你对我们的帮助。我们从不会认为赛恩是个有同情心的人——我们只是还没有为此做好准备。"
G["I approached my sniper rifle and took aim at the jinyu village."]="我拿过狙击枪，瞄准了锦鱼人的村子。"
G["I ask for vrykul to kill them, yet all I get are feeble whelps! By Ymiron, SLAUGHTER THEM!"]="我命令维库人去杀掉他们，结果却只能依靠这条没用的龙！以伊米隆的名义，干掉他们！"
G["I ask myself that question everyday..."]="我每天都这样问自己……"
G["I asked Malfurion of this, and he said that the city recently suffered a great tragedy.  That one of the leaders was taken away and that lives were lost."]="我向玛法里奥问起此事，他告诉了我这座城市近来经历的悲剧。一名领袖被劫走了，许多生命逝去了。"
G["I asked for reinforcements to help us hold the beach. And the Horde sent these tiny little men and their small metal tubes.\n\n<Gralok eyes the nearby goblins with disdain.>"]="我请求援军来帮我们守住海滩。结果部落就派来了这群小不点儿和他们的小金属管。\n\n<格拉洛克不屑地看了看身边的地精。>"
G["I asked you: Who is the soul of the Horde?"]="我问过你：部落的灵魂是什么？"
G["I assume you are here about the dragon turtles, child?"]="孩子，我想你是为龙龟而来的吧？"
G["I assume you are here about the dragon turtles, child?  I am sorry.  I cannot help you until you prove yourself a loyal ally of my people."]="孩子，我想你是为龙龟而来的吧？很抱歉。你得先证明自己是我族人民的忠实盟友才行。"
G["I assume you have heard of the hole by now, $r.  If not, you are going to know a whole lot about it soon."]="我想你应该已经听说那个洞了，$r。如果还没有，那你很快就会听到许多与其有关的事情。"
G["I assume you want something."]="你想要什么东西吗？"
G["I assure you $p is the best fighter I've ever seen. $GHe:She; will be able to help better prepare your village."]="Te aseguro que $p es $gel mejor luchador:la mejor luchadora; que he visto. $GÉl:Ella; te ayudará mejor a preparar a tu aldea."
G["I assure you this much, Quimby, you won't be getting my vote next term!"]="奎比，下届选举时我一定不会投你的票！"
G["I assure you, overseer, the Royal Apothecary Society dearly wishes to make up for the tragic misguidance which ended so many lives."]="我向您保证，监工，皇家药剂师协会愿意为这场导致了大量死亡的悲剧事故做出补偿。"
G["I ate a Lovely Apple once. It was delishioush.\n\n<Jogu stares blankly into the distance, as if he's lost his train of thought.>"]="我曾经吃过一只可爱的苹果，太美味了。\n\n<贾古呆呆地眺目远方，似乎走神了。>"
G["I await a challenger."]="我在等待挑战者。"
G["I barely have any supplies for upgrades."]="我几乎没有任何可供升级的物资。"
G["I barely survived the shipwreck..."]="我差点就死在一场海难中……"
G["I bask in the twilight."]="我被暮光照耀。"
G["I be Tolwe. Job be to keep da peace an' watch. So I be watchin'."]="我是图维。我的工作就是维护这里的和平，警惕敌人的入侵。所以我一直保持着最高度的警觉。"
G["I be Vol'jin, Son of Sen'jin, here ta ask your aid, o great Bwonsamdi."]="我是沃金，森金之子。伟大的邦桑迪，我需要你的帮助。"
G["I be a messenger from the Eastern Kingdoms, $n. I be sent here to make sure da priests who travel here be given proper direction."]="我是来自东部王国的信使，$n。我到这儿来是确保来此的牧师已经受到正确指示。"
G["I be an emissary from da Darkspear trolls.  Da threat we face, also be a threat to da Alliance.  You willin' to help out da Darkspear, $r?"]="我是来自暗矛巨魔的使者。我们面临的威胁也同样是联盟的威胁。你愿意帮助暗矛氏族吗，$r？"
G["I be da predator! You da prey..."]="我是猎鹰，而你们，就是猎物！"
G["I be gettin' tired'a dis. Dese elves, dey be treatin' me like I stole somet'in'."]="我有点感到厌烦了，你们这些血精灵们，不要像我偷了什么东西那样对待我。"
G["I be goin' now; time ta find a new home for me soul."]="我走了。该为我的灵魂找个新家了。"
G["I be healin', mon.  I don't have no special shape."]="我来奶吧，兄弟。我可是有特殊形态的哦。"
G["I be hearin' ya an' I think ya not be my captors. Come closer so I be seein' ya."]="我听见你的声音了，不像是抓我的那些人。靠近点，让我看得到你。"
G["I be jammon wit' you, $n!"]="我会配合你的，$n！"
G["I be losin' me patience! Go on: make dem wish dey was never born!"]="我要失去耐心了！继续上，让他们感觉生不如死！"
G["I be movin' to de groove; ya be movin' to de grave!"]="我们要庆祝，庆祝你进坟墓！"
G["I be needin' worthy underlings in Zul'Drak, mon. Ones ready to wield real power."]="而我，则急需优秀的下属，能支配强大力量的下属，在祖达克为我效劳。"
G["I be one o' da Darkspear scouts. Kill dat Amani priest so I can return wit' my report!"]="我是一名暗矛斥候。杀了那个阿曼尼祭祀，我就可以带着报告返回了！"
G["I be one of da first to answer Vol'jin's call to arms. Will you be joinin' us?"]="我是第一批响应沃金的号召，投身军队的人之一。你愿意加入我们吗？"
G["I be seeking someone, $c. Please, leave me be... it is important I find them."]="我在找人，$c。请不要打扰我……这对我很重要。"
G["I be stabbin' first and askin' later!"]="我向来信奉先动手后说话！"
G["I be thinkin' you don't know where to find mah bruddas, mon."]="朋友，我有一种感觉，就是你根本就不知道我那些兄弟在哪儿对不对。"
G["I be waitin, strangers. Your deaths gonna make me stronger!"]="我已经等待很久了，陌生人。你的死亡将使我更强大！"
G["I bear witness to a miracle that stands before me! In one thousand years of captivity, I have not seen a single LIVING specimen - other than those foul Qiraji and silithid - enter these chambers."]="我真不敢相信自己的眼睛，这简直是个奇迹！一千年来，除了那些肮脏的其拉虫人和异种虫类，我都不曾见过有活人进入这些房间。"
G["I bear your presence only as a kindness to our new allies. Don't push me, human."]="我是为了我们的新朋友，才容忍你的存在。不要逼我动手，人类。"
G["I beat up three orcs and a tauren last night, all without breaking a nail."]="昨晚我教训了三个兽人和一个牛头人，连一根指甲都没刮花。"
G["I become ONE... with the VOID!"]="我和虚空……融为了一体！"
G["I been waitin' a long time for a chance to avenge my father. A great weight has been lifted from my shoulders."]="为了清算我父亲的仇恨，我已经等待了很长时间。现在，这副重担终于卸下了。"
G["I been waitin' all day for this!"]="为这个，我已经等了一整天！"
G["I been waiting to do again for so long!"]="我早就盼着再来祭坛捣蛋了！"
G["I beg to differ."]="我可不敢苟同。"
G["I beg you, $r, be swift. They will not stop pursuing me! I cannot escape from them, even here!"]="我求你了，$r，快一点。他们是不会放弃追踪的！就算是在这里，我也无法从他们手中逃脱！"
G["I beg you, death knight!  Keep your minion away from me!  I'll do anything!"]="求求你，死亡骑士！别让你的手下靠近我！你说什么我都照做啊！"
G["I beg you, mortals - FLEE! Flee before I lose all sense of control! The black fire rages within my heart! I MUST- release it!"]="求求你们，快跑吧！在我丧失所有理智之前快逃命吧！黑色的火焰在我的心中燃烧！我必须——释放它！"
G["I beg you... no more."]="我求求你……住手。"
G["I beg your mercy, my lord."]="我乞求你的仁慈，大人。"
G["I began to fear that no help would come. That everyone had forgotten me. Thank the Order that they sent you!"]="我开始害怕，担心自己不会得救了。自己被所有人遗忘了。感谢骑士团派你来救我！"
G["I believe Aldwin Laughlin is still the resident Guild Master of Stormwind.  Look for his residence on your left as you pass the inner gate of Stormwind."]="我相信奥德文·拉弗林仍是暴风城的常驻公会注册员。当你进入暴风城的贸易区后，你的左手边就是他的居所。"
G["I believe I can explain everything to you two if you give me a moment of your time."]="如果你们给我一点时间的话，我想我可以向你们俩解释一切。"
G["I believe I heard some young whipper snapper in my garden out back.  Let's go look for him."]="我好像听到花园里有小孩子在捣乱。我们去找找看吧。"
G["I believe I may recognize them.  Deal with this quickly, Sharth.  Then take the mana bomb and destroy their town!"]="我似乎认得他们。快点解决掉这里的麻烦，沙尔斯。然后用魔法炸弹摧毁他们的城镇！"
G["I believe I misplaced that banner you enchanted for me, Falrin."]="我想我将你附过魔法的旗子放错了地方，法尔林。"
G["I believe I noticed a new shipment of mail being delivered not too long ago.  You'll find the mailbox just outside the Thunder Bluff Bank on the lower rise."]="我记得不久之前我有新邮件寄出。你可以在中部高地的底层雷霆崖银行外找到邮箱。"
G["I believe I was showing my motorcycle to some hot babes at the time."]="那时我应该正在向一些辣妹展示我的摩托车。"
G["I believe I'll try the merlot this time."]="我想这次我要试试葡萄酒。"
G["I believe Simone was looking for you earlier, $n. Have you spoken with her yet?"]="我想之前西蒙尼找过你，$n。你跟她谈过了吗？"
G["I believe Thunderwing here is our opportunity to score a devastating blow against Lei Shen."]="我相信，我们一定可以利用这里的雷霆翼龙狠狠打击雷神。"
G["I believe in you, Gobbles!"]="我看好你，哥培尔！"
G["I believe in you."]="我相信你。"
G["I believe it was on this very land that a young Durotan, barely into adolescence, killed his first talbuk. Ah, I can still remember him recanting that tale for us at the springtime festival."]="我记得就是在这块土地上，年轻的杜隆坦猎杀了他的第一只塔布羊。啊，我仍然记得他在春季节庆时反复地对我们讲这个故事。"
G["I believe that I shall feast upon both $r and ogre flesh tonight."]="我觉得今晚我能享用一顿用$r和食人魔烹制的美餐。"
G["I believe that the Alliance's future is tied to that of Pandaria.\n\nAfter we landed here, we set certain paths into motion. We were there when the Serpent's Heart fell. In a way, we helped fulfill Lorewalker Cho's vision of the future.\n\nBecause of this, I cannot return to Stormwind until I have helped to set things right."]="我相信联盟的未来与潘达利亚息息相关。\n\n在我们抵达这里后，就开始按部就班地采取行动。当神龙之心陷落时，我们就在那里。从某种意义上说，我们也参与促成了游学者周卓预见的实现。\n\n正因如此，在一切重回正途之前，我无法返回暴风城。"
G["I believe that you're making my argument for me, but yes it would be nice if we had more reinforcements. I would counter that it would be faster to pull the Farstriders from their senseless skirmishing with the trolls."]="我认为你正在和我争论，不过如果我们有更多增援的话，那的确是件好事。但我的意见和你相反，把远行者们从他们和巨魔的那些无意义的冲突中拉回来不是更好吗？"
G["I believe the Forsaken are misleading the allies of the Horde.... wait... I feel so... dizzy..."]="我确信被遗忘者正在误导部落联盟……等等……我感到头很晕……"
G["I believe the vision means for us to join together, $n."]="我相信这个景象是叫我们紧密团结在一起，$n。"
G["I believe these are yours, Meara."]="相信这些应该是你的，米艾拉。"
G["I believe this is the original power source he intended to offer the blood elves to free them from their addiction to the Sunwell... but for some reason he didn't let them near it..."]="依我所见，他之所以追寻这股原始能量，是想要利用它来帮助血精灵们摆脱对太阳井的依赖……但由于某些原因，他没有让血精灵接触它……"
G["I believe we may have finally found my father's Pools of Youth. We must gather as much information as we can for Tyrande."]="我相信我们最终可以找到我父亲的青春之池。我们可以为泰兰德提供尽可能多的信息。"
G["I believe you are up to this task... will you accept the challenge?"]="我相信你能胜任这项任务……你要接受挑战吗？"
G["I believe you children are our future..."]="我相信你们这群孩子是我们的未来……"
G["I believe you had a turtle prepared for me?"]="我想你为我准备了一只海龟？"
G["I beseech of you, my beloved subjects: Put an end to these miscreants."]="亲爱的仆从们，我在此命令你们：除掉那些暴徒。"
G["I beseech you, kind strangers. Cleanse this place of their foul presence! Lay our stories to rest!"]="拜托了，好心的陌生人。净化这里的恶灵！这些书籍需要安宁！"
G["I bestow upon you the power that is our birthright... and more!"]="我要赐予你的不仅是我们生来便应继承的力量，还有其它更加强大的礼物！"
G["I bet I could land exactly in the target."]="我肯定能准确落到目的地上。"
G["I bet I'll catch a big one this time..."]="我打赌我这次会抓到一条大鱼……"
G["I bet Illidan is a nice guy underneath.  He just needs a mama, too."]="我敢打赌伊利丹其实是个好人，他只是需要母爱。"
G["I bet Josetta would be more than happy to teach you some new spells.  She is probably up in her room at the Lion's Pride Inn."]="我敢打赌洁塞塔会很乐意教你学习新法术的。她就在狮王之傲旅店的房间内。"
G["I bet Quae'll think this is important. She's pretty knowledgeable about these things--no expert, but knowledgeable."]="我猜奎艾会认为这个很重要。她应该对这些东西相当熟悉——虽然她不是这方面的专家，但也算得上是知识渊博。"
G["I bet ice cream would taste better if it were socketed!"]="我敢打赌要是冰淇淋打过孔的话味道肯定会更好！"
G["I bet if I keep winning, I'll get invited to fight in Stormwind one day!"]="我敢说，要是我一直赢下去的话，哪天也许会被邀请去暴风城作战！"
G["I bet if I stuck to the outskirts, I could zip in and out of the ruins, grab some relics, and dodge those statues."]="我敢打赌，要是我死守在外围，就能在废墟间自由进出，顺手拿上几件遗物，还能避开那些雕像。"
G["I bet my dad could beat you up. He's the biggest monk ever."]="我敢打赌，我爸爸绝对能揍你一顿。他是最棒的武僧。"
G["I bet my friend Gruk would like this rock for the spear he is making! It's very sharp... I hope he likes it."]="这石料很适合制作长矛，我敢打赌，我的朋友格鲁克会喜欢的！非常锋利……希望他喜欢。"
G["I bet no one gets in her way."]="我敢说，没人能打得过她。"
G["I bet she likes her men hairy-chested. What am I supposed to do?"]="我敢打赌，她喜欢雄壮的男人。我该怎么办？"
G["I bet the other clans can't even use magic anymore. What good could they be to the King!"]="我敢打赌，其他氏族甚至连魔法都不会用了。他们根本不可能为王上带来任何好处！"
G["I bet the turtle likes being close to the other animals."]="我敢说，海龟肯定喜欢接近其他的动物。"
G["I bet this baby has got some real orcpower inside."]="我打赌，这个孩子体内流淌着真正的兽人热血。"
G["I bet with all these new people here, Celidh, you've got to have some pets you want me to move to the stables."]="塞莉德，我跟所有新来的人打赌来着，赌你肯定想要在兽栏寄放宠物。"
G["I bet ya think you're tough, eh, kid? I guess I might have something for ya if ya can hold your own in the arena. Good stuff, not like Krixel's. That's so last season, ya know?\n\nOh, and have a nice day."]="孩子，看来你相当自信哦？如果你能在竞技场中占一席之地，我倒是可以送你点什么。是相当不错的东西呢，比克里希的那些破玩意儿好多啦。\n\n祝你好运。"
G["I bet you I left it in the tent!"]="我敢和你打赌，我把那个东西留在帐篷里了！"
G["I bet you aren't even going to buy anything. Just like all the others."]="我敢说你甚至不会买任何一件东西。就像其他人一样。"
G["I bet you miss your neighbor.  I'll see if you can't join him soon enough."]="你很思念你的邻居吧。让我看看能不能快点让你去陪他。"
G["I bet you never saw dis one comin'."]="我敢说，你绝对没想到过这个。"
G["I bet you rotters thought you were pretty clever at the Wrath Gate, didn't you? Playtime's over. We're here to make sure you don't try anything."]="我敢说你们这些无赖一定觉得自己在天谴之门干得很漂亮，对吧？游戏结束了。我们来就是要阻止你们的一切行为。"
G["I bet you wish you were undead about now."]="现在，你肯定希望自己是个亡灵吧。"
G["I bet you wonder where we get tall bird things for roast. Too bad, it secret."]="你肯定特想知道我们烧烤的肉是打哪儿来的吧。就不告诉你，哈哈，这是秘密。"
G["I bet you're really strong, huh?  You could probably kick that bridge right in half if you wanted to!"]="我敢肯定，你非常强大，哈？如果你愿意，一脚就可以把那座桥踢成两段！"
G["I bet you're sorry now, aren't you $n!?!"]="我敢打赌你现在感到遗憾了，不是吗$n！？！"
G["I better be getting overtime for this."]="我最好加班加点干完它。"
G["I better get a cut of those sales! Better yet, I'll just fry you up and take all of the profit for myself."]="¡Espero recibir tajada de esas ventas! Mejor todavía, te dejaré $gfrito:frita; y me quedaré con todos los beneficios."
G["I better get back to Nazgrim."]="我得回去找纳兹戈林了。"
G["I better not pull up another of Reggy's boots again..."]="我不想再钓起臭皮靴了……"
G["I bid you welcome, $c."]="非常欢迎，$c。"
G["I bid you welcome, $c. Rare do we have visitors down to these levels of the Apothecarium... unless of course there's something someone wants... or needs.\n\n<Chemist Coely laughs.>\n\nHow can I help you today, hmm?"]="欢迎你，$c。炼金房区很少有访客……当然，除非有人对这儿的某些东西感兴趣。\n\n<炼金师克林笑起来。>\n\n我能帮助你吗？"
G["I bleed... haha... but I won't die!"]="我流血了……哈哈……可我死不了！"
G["I bought food from this stall just yesterday and now my family's taken ill!"]="昨天我就是这个摊位买的食物，现在我的家人都病倒了！"
G["I bow to your skill. You bested me fairly."]="我打不过你。你赢得光明正大。"
G["I break you!"]="我要碾碎你！"
G["I bring a gust so strong, it can knock down trees! Minions, assist me, they shall not do as they please!"]="我带起一阵足以吹倒大树的狂风！仆从们，快来帮我，他们不会得逞的！"
G["I bring bandages and food to the sick and injured. If only I could do more..."]="我给伤病员带来了绷带和食物。我要是能再多帮点忙就好了……"
G["I bring da pain!"]="让我带给你们痛苦！"
G["I bring greetings from King Wrynn, $c. Behind me is the Hero's Call board, a collection of proclamations from the King of Stormwind directing adventurers to locations where their talents can best aid the Alliance."]="我带来了乌瑞恩国王的问候，$c。在我身后是“英雄的召唤”公告牌——暴风城国王在此向来自各地的冒险者昭告，哪里才是他们异禀天资的用武之地。如此，英雄们可以更好的为联盟贡献力量。"
G["I bring treasures. Treasures from far away. Treasures from beyond the mountains... treasures from beyond the wall, even."]="我携宝物而来。来自远方的宝物。来自山那边的宝物……甚至有来自长城另一侧的宝物。"
G["I bring word from Lord Illidan."]="我带来了伊利丹大人的口谕。"
G["I bring word from the Regent Lord of Silvermoon."]="我带来了银月城摄政王的口谕。"
G["I bring you back from the brink of death, $Gbrother:sister;. We are in need of your aid!"]="是我把你从死亡线上拉了回来，$g兄弟:姐妹;。我们现在需要你的帮助！"
G["I broke a covenant? I BROKE A COVENANT? What about that fool exarch and his avatar?"]="我破坏了合约？我破坏了合约？？？那愚蠢的主教和他的化身是怎么回事？"
G["I brokes-ded it..."]="我把它弄坏了……"
G["I brought enough bombs... for all of you!"]="我带的炸弹足够……炸飞你们！"
G["I brought my people here at Garrosh's request. Little did I realize we were to be sacrificed like pawns in a game."]="我按照加尔鲁什的要求，带着我的人来到这里。我完全没意识到，我们是被当做弃子利用了。"
G["I brought these monkeys some presents! Try not to blow me up, Amber!"]="我给猴子们准备了些礼物！可别打我啊，安玻！"
G["I brought you a housewarming gift, Jarl."]="加尔，这是送你的礼物，祝贺你乔迁新居。"
G["I brought you some hides, mud, and thread."]="我带来了一些皮革、软泥和缝线。"
G["I brought you something to eat."]="我给你带来些吃的。"
G["I brought you your crossbow, Dad!"]="我把你的十字弓带来了，爸爸！"
G["I buried my son today, Thalvos... And my spouse last week."]="我今天埋葬了我的儿子，塔沃斯……上周我埋葬了我的老伴。"
G["I burn ya now!"]="烧死你们！"
G["I burn... for all time..."]="日夜……煎熬……"
G["I call 'er the Spirit of Gnomeregan. Isn't she a beaut? Without your help, she'd've never been restored."]="我将她称作诺莫瑞根之魂。她很漂亮，不是吗？要不是你帮忙，她也不可能恢复原貌。"
G["I call and the spirits answer $r."]="我召唤万灵并得到了回应，$r。"
G["I call da storm!"]="我能呼风唤雨！"
G["I call her Betty. She's a beauty, eh?"]="我管她叫贝蒂。她很漂亮吧？"
G["I call that a good start."]="这就是一个好的开始。"
G["I call this move \"The Snowplow!\""]="¡Este movimiento se llama \"el Quitanieves\"!"
G["I call to you great spirits! Grant the Horde your blessing! For on this day our cause is righteous and just!"]="四方之灵，将你们的祝福赐予部落吧！今天，我们的事业是正义而高尚的！"
G["I call upon the watersss of my homelands... DELIVER MY ENEMIES UNTO ME!"]="我要召唤故乡的水……把我的敌人交给我吧！"
G["I call upon you, Kali."]="我召唤你，卡利。"
G["I call your bluff.  You're a paladin after all.  Your obsession with redemption goes beyond the inane."]="别虚张声势了，你毕竟是一名圣骑士。你对于救赎的痴迷已经到了不可救药的地步。"
G["I call your true name, Azrethoc. Show your visage to me!"]="你的真名叫阿兹雷索克。让我看看你的真正面貌！"
G["I came all the way from Dalaran, and this is the welcoming I get?"]="我从达拉然一路来到这里，这就是我得到的欢迎吗？"
G["I came from Ironforge to help out with the rebuilding effort here. If I can teach enough of ye my skills then maybe I can leave it to ye and take myself back home."]="我从铁炉堡来到这里协助进行重建工作。我希望能向你传授尽可能多的本领，然后我就能回家去，把这堆事情丢给你来做。"
G["I came here long ago to study our cursed brothers, in search of a way to cure their affliction.\n\nMagtoor welcomed me with open arms. Living here, he became my closest friend.\n\nAnd now, before my eyes, he is dying..."]="我很久以前就来到这里，研究我们受到诅咒的兄弟，寻找治疗他们的办法。\n\n玛格图尔热情地欢迎我。我住在这里的时候，他成为了我最亲密的朋友。\n\n而现在，他躺在我面前，奄奄一息……"
G["I came here to talk, but you mindless things tried to kill me instead!"]="我是来找你们聊天的，可你们这群没脑子的家伙竟然想杀了我！"
G["I came out here to visit you, Jarl! And I find you living in an empty cabin in the middle of nowhere, babbling about frogs? You're hopeless!"]="加尔，我专程来拜访你！你却躲在这个偏僻的小屋里炖青蛙腿？真是无可救药！"
G["I came over here to see if we could open up trade with these naga. Their reply wasn't very nice."]="我来到这里是为了看看能否和那些纳迦建立贸易往来。但他们的回答并不尽如人意。"
G["I came to Outland hoping to discover powerful artifacts to assist the League of Arathor against the Defilers in Arathi Basin... but all I've found is this smashing magical loincloth, a ridiculous gnome sidekick, and an egomaniacal undead stalker who insists I've stolen his grey skull, or some such.\n\n\nIn any case, would you care to join the League in their fight while I continue my search?"]="Vine a Terrallende en busca de artefactos mágicos para ayudar a la Liga de Arathor contra los Rapiñadores en la Cuenca Arathi..., pero lo único que encontré es este fantástico taparrabos mágico, un ridículo ayudante gnomo y un perseguidor no-muerto maniaco convencido de que he robado su calavera gris o algo así.\n\n\nDe cualquier manera, ¿querrías unirte a la Liga en su lucha mientras sigo con mi búsqueda?"
G["I came to ask the famous Aysa Cloudsinger for help, but I just can't bring myself to intrude on her exercises. She's so poised, so practiced... so beautiful."]="我是来向远近闻名的艾莎·云歌求助的，但我不能打扰她的修行。她是如此娴静、如此沉稳……如此美丽。"
G["I came to lend my aid to the fight. Is there anything I can do to help?"]="我是来帮忙作战的。我能做些什么吗？"
G["I came to this land to cleanse troubled spirits, but after the attack I fear that my mission has failed.  So many have been taken by the wastes.  Please, you must help them."]="我来这里是为了净化那些不安分的灵魂，但是在那次袭击后我就担心自己的任务会失败。白骨荒野夺走了太多生命，请你一定要帮助他们。"
G["I came to this place because of my study into the backward culture that used to be the Thunderlord clan.\n\nThey were weak and succumbed to the lure of power that came with being transformed into fel orcs through Mannoroth's blood.\n\nI have read all of their texts.  I am particularly interested in the recovery of an artifact, a drum, an arrow and a tablet that were lost when we crushed the Bladespire ogres and pushed them back down into their hold."]="我来这个地方是由于我的研究涉及到了雷神氏族的文化。\n\n他们以前很弱小，不过由于屈服于力量的引诱，他们通过玛诺洛斯之血转变成了邪兽人。\n\n我读了所有有关他们的文献。在我们征服刀塔食人魔并把他们逐出要塞的时候，我们遗失了一件神器、一面鼓、一支箭和一块石板。现在我对找回它们有着独特的兴趣。"
G["I came upon what I can only describe as an overwhelming corruption within the Emerald Dream. An unending nightmare that seized me in its claws and tore at my very mind. I could not break free of its grasp; my disciples were unable to wake me.\n\nWhatever this corruption was, it found its way into our world through my body. I did indeed channel its energies into the Wailing Caverns, and its horrible influence twisted the wildlife there into chaotic, deviate forms. Even my disciples were affected; their minds overcome by madness and savagery, they took on the forms of serpents, and called themselves the Druids of the Fang."]="我在翡翠梦境中遭遇了可怖的腐蚀力量，言语难尽其详。无尽的噩梦抓住了我，折磨我的心智。我无法摆脱它的囚禁。我的信徒们无法唤醒我。\n\n无论这种腐蚀来自于何处，它已经通过我的躯体来到了我们的世界。它的能量藉由我进入哀嚎洞穴。那种恐怖的力量扭曲了这里的野生动物，让它们变成了怪物。就连我的信徒们也受到了影响。他们的意识变得疯狂野蛮。他们的身体变得如同巨大的毒蛇。现在他们称自己为尖牙德鲁伊。"
G["I can allow this no longer!"]="我再也忍不下去了！"
G["I can allow you to bring life, from death."]="我能让你从死亡中获得生命。"
G["I can assure you that we will not fail, my master.  I am personally overseeing every aspect of the construction, and I hold the final codes, myself.  Within a day's time, I will have the bomb detonated on those nearby pests."]="我向您保证，我们不会失败，我的主人。我亲自监视着工程的每一步，而且最终的密码掌握在我自己手中。一天以内，我就会让炸弹在周围那些讨厌的家伙身边引爆的。"
G["I can barely feel my arms, but I'll stand with you once I find some weapons."]="我感觉我的手臂已经没了，不过只要我找到些武器，我就会和你并肩作战。"
G["I can barely hear you... <static> aking up!"]="我根本听不到你……<噪音>大声点！"
G["I can barely sense the Guardian of Time! His timeline is fading quickly!"]="我几乎感受不到时间的守护者的讯息！他的时间流正在急速消逝！"
G["I can barely understand what these trolls are trying to say."]="我几乎不明白这些巨魔想说什么。"
G["I can beat him, I swear!"]="我会打败他的，我发誓！"
G["I can both stable and give new pets."]="在我这里可以存放宠物，也可以领取新宠物。"
G["I can breathe!"]="我能呼吸了！"
G["I can carry you to the top of the temple. Ji awaits you there to lead the way."]="我会把你送到寺院顶层。季在那里等着你，他会为你带路的。"
G["I can count alllll the way to \"nine-ten.\" Listen!\n\n<Milly counts on her fingers and toes.>\n\nOne, two, three, five, six, umm... seven, eight, nine-ten!\n\nWait, I missed one..."]="¡Sé contar hasta \"nuevediez\"! ¡Escucha!\n\n<Milly cuenta con los dedos de las manos y los pies.>\n\nUno, dos, tres, cuatro, cinco, seis... Eh... siete, ocho, \"nuevediez\".\n\nEspera, me he saltado uno..."
G["I can die in peace, knowing that my last few moments were with Martek."]="知道我最后的时刻能够和马特克在一起，我就能安心地死去了。"
G["I can direct you to other weapon masters if you prefer. What interests you?"]="我可以告诉你该找谁进行训练。你对哪类武器感兴趣？"
G["I can do this, I know I can do this..."]="我能行，我知道我能行……"
G["I can erase all your pet's talents so that you may teach it ones.\n\nThis becomes more expensive each time you do it."]="我可以清除宠物的所有天赋，这样你可以重新教给它。\n\n不过每次的价格都会变得越来越贵。"
G["I can erase all your talents so that you may choose new ones.\n\nThis becomes more expensive each time you do it."]="我可以清除你所有的天赋，这样你就可以重新选择了。\n\n不过每次的价格都会变得越来越贵。"
G["I can explain why I'm here."]="我可以解释自己为什么会在这里。"
G["I can feel Mauti watching us... Waiting for another chance to pounce."]="我能感觉到玛乌提注视着我们……它正在等待另一次偷袭我们的机会。"
G["I can feel Thrall's anger at Arthas, but it pales before my own. Were he as furious as any one of the Forsaken, the Horde's armies would unleash their rage upon Northrend and eradicate all Scourge from that cursed, frozen wasteland.\n\nBut I do not lead the Horde, and cannot give the command for war. Thrall wishes to weigh his options, despite this being a time of action. Still, our time will come... very soon."]="萨尔想必对阿尔萨斯的行径倍感愤怒，但是比起我心中的怨恨来就微不足道了。如果他能体会被遗忘者的心情，我相信部落的大军会把怒火倾泻到诺森德，歼灭那片冰封荒野上的天灾军团。\n\n可惜我不是部落的领导者，不能下令开战。局势紧迫，萨尔却还在权衡利弊得失。不过，战争……已经到了一触即发的关头。"
G["I can feel her will breaking! Her soul burns so brightly."]="我感到她的意志在破碎……她的灵魂在灼热地燃烧着。"
G["I can feel it ... the Thunder King's power courses through my staff."]="我感觉……雷电之王的力量在我的法杖中流过。"
G["I can feel it... As if a dark shadow has been lifted from the land. Dead! My father is dead!"]="我能感觉到……笼罩大地的阴影消失了。死了！我的父亲死了！"
G["I can feel my branches surging with life. I cannot wait to give it back to the land."]="我能感觉到我的枝桠焕发着无尽的生命力。我已经迫不及待想要让它重返大地的怀抱。"
G["I can feel my father's aura. He's definitely this way... come on, $n."]="我能感觉到父亲的光环。他肯定就在这个方向……跟我来，$n。"
G["I can feel the Lich King reaching out...watching us."]="我能感到巫妖王的召唤。"
G["I can feel the arcane energies building up yet again!  The archmage must be warned!"]="我能感觉到奥术能量再一次开始积累！一定要警告大法师！"
G["I can feel the elements awakening... rejoicing... the Cataclysm... is over."]="我感到元素正在苏醒，欢呼……这场灾难……结束了。"
G["I can feel the embrace now of all living things, the Earthmother's eternal peace. Thank you."]="现在，我能感觉到全部生命的拥抱，大地母亲永恒的平静。谢谢你。"
G["I can feel the power SURGING within me!"]="我能感受到体内涌动的能量！"
G["I can feel the presence of evil leaving..."]="我感觉到邪恶的气息消退了……"
G["I can feel them, the spirits of long dead Mogu!"]="我能感觉到它们，逝去已久的魔古魂灵！"
G["I can fight by your side for a few minutes before I need to return to The Shadow Vault."]="在返回暗影拱顶之前，我可以协助你作战。"
G["I can finally return to my knitting! Those winter scarves won't make themselves!"]="我终于能继续回去织毛线了！那些冬天戴的围巾可不会自己跑出来！"
G["I can find my way from here.  My friend Mekeda will reward you for your kind actions."]="我能找到回去的路了。我的朋友米克达会好好奖励你的。"
G["I can fix that... or  maybe not! Sheesh, what a mess..."]="我可以修好它……也许不行！呀，真是一团糟……"
G["I can float. On my toes. I'm like a butterfly. Wanna see?"]="我能旋舞。在脚尖上旋舞。就像只蝴蝶一样。想看看吗？"
G["I can get back to the Stronghold on my own, I think.  Now that you bought me some time, I should be able to stealth out of here.  Who ever you are... thank you.  May Elune bless you always!"]="我想我能凭借自己的力量回到要塞。你为我赢得了宝贵的时间，我应该能悄悄离开这儿。无论你是谁……我都感谢你。愿月神永远保佑你！"
G["I can get you started on your journey to Northrend. Let me know when you are ready and I will teleport you to your starting point."]="诺森德的旅程就要拉开序幕。你准备好了就告诉我，我会将你传送到起始地区。"
G["I can go around you, or through you.  Your choice!"]="我可以绕过你，或者直接穿过你。你自己选择吧！"
G["I can handle things from here. I'll meet you back at the Sanctuary, $n."]="接下来的事我自己可以搞定。我们庇护所再见了，$n。"
G["I can hardly believe it. You were able to suppress your hatred."]="我简直不敢相信。你压制住了自己的恨意。"
G["I can hardly believe my eyes. Thank you. Really, thank you."]="我简直无法相信自己的眼睛。谢谢你。真的，谢谢你。"
G["I can hardly believe the Cult was so careless as to leave these behind."]="真不敢相信，诅咒教派竟然如此粗心，把这些东西都落下了。"
G["I can hear Sigrid Iceborn approaching from the northwest. She has been informed that she cannot use her proto-drake in battle here. Do not leave the battle ring!"]="我听见齐格莉德·冰魂的声音从西北方传来。我们已经告知她不得在比武场中使用始祖龙。不要离开竞技场！"
G["I can hear the howls of the Burning Blade as we speak. The kodos are ready to ride for the Mor'shan Ramparts. Tell me when you are ready to leave."]="我可以听见火刃氏族的战吼，科多兽已经准备好，随时可以前往莫尔杉农场。当你准备好出发的时候就告诉我。"
G["I can hear them no longer..."]="我听不到它们的声音了……"
G["I can hear them! Hear them calling! I answer the call!"]="我能听到！听到那呼唤！我回应那呼唤！"
G["I can help you establish a guild."]="我可以帮助你建立公会。"
G["I can hit my house from here!"]="我能从这里击中我的房子！"
G["I can hold out no longer..."]="我坚持不住了……"
G["I can hold them off from here, $r. We will meet again at the Sanctuary of Malorne."]="从这里开始我能自己搞定了，$r。我们在玛洛恩庇护所见吧。"
G["I can instruct you in alchemy.  Interested?"]="我可以教你炼金术。你感兴趣吗？"
G["I can instruct you in blacksmithing as well as supply the necessary tools.\n\nHow may I help you?"]="我能指导你锻造的技巧，并向你提供必要的工具。\n\n需要我帮忙吗？"
G["I can instruct you in blacksmithing.  Interested?"]="我可以教你锻造。你感兴趣吗？"
G["I can instruct you in enchanting.  Interested?"]="我可以教你附魔。你感兴趣吗？"
G["I can instruct you in engineering.  Interested?"]="我可以教你工程学。你感兴趣吗？"
G["I can instruct you in fishing as well as offer helpful supplies.\n\nHow may I help you?"]="我能指导你钓鱼的技巧，并向你提供各种有用的物资。\n\n需要我的帮助吗？"
G["I can instruct you in fishing, and sell fishing poles and supplies.\n\nHow may I help you?"]="我能指导你钓鱼的技巧，并向你提供渔具和各种物资。\n\n需要我帮忙吗？"
G["I can instruct you in herbalism as well as offer helpful supplies.\n\nHow may I help you?"]="我能指导你草药学的技巧，并向你提供各种有用的物资。\n\n需要我的帮助吗？"
G["I can instruct you in herbalism.  Interested?"]="我可以教你草药学。你感兴趣吗？"
G["I can instruct you in jewelcrafting.  Interested?"]="我可以教你珠宝加工。有兴趣吗？"
G["I can instruct you in leatherworking.  Interested?"]="我可以教你制皮。你感兴趣吗？"
G["I can instruct you in mining.  Interested?"]="我可以教你采矿。你感兴趣吗？"
G["I can instruct you in skinning.  Interested?"]="我可以教你剥皮。你感兴趣吗？"
G["I can instruct you in tailoring.  Interested?"]="我可以教你裁缝。你感兴趣吗？"
G["I can keep this up for a very long time, Scarlet dog! Tell me about the \"Crimson Dawn!\""]="¡Puedo seguir haciendo esto durante mucho tiempo, perro Escarlata! Háblame acerca del \"Alba Carmesí\"!"
G["I can leave now?"]="我可以走了吗？"
G["I can make amazing things with the materials I find out here. By Muradin's beard, there are fantastic creatures in these hills! Go have a whack at them, $n, and bring me back some tall tales."]="我可以利用在这儿找到的材料制作有趣的东西。这些山林中有许多奇怪的生物！去杀死它们，$n。"
G["I can make it from here.  Thanks, $n!  And talk to my employer about a reward!"]="接下来我可以自己应付了。谢谢，$n！去向我的老板要酬金吧！"
G["I can make it the rest of the way, $n.  THANKS!"]="我可以自己想办法回去了，$n。谢谢你！"
G["I can make that happen. Just sign below the dotted line..."]="一切皆有可能。你只需要在这里签个字……"
G["I can move again!"]="我又能动了！"
G["I can never die!"]="我永生不死！"
G["I can not train you, $c."]="我不能训练你，$c。"
G["I can not train you, young one."]="我不能训练你，年轻人。"
G["I can not train you."]="我不能训练你。"
G["I can not train you. You need to talk to your class trainer."]="我不能训练你。你必须去找你的职业训练师。"
G["I can offer you a free bunk if you'd like to rest.  They're not comfortable, but it doesn't look like you get much sleep anyway."]="要是你想休息，我能为你提供免费床位。虽然不怎么舒服，不过你也不像是个会花很多时间睡觉的人。"
G["I can only assume that you know who I am. And yet you insist on disturbing me?\n\nWhat could you possibly want that requires my attention?"]="我想你知道我是谁吧。但是，你还是不停地烦我？\n\n你是不是想引起我的注意？"
G["I can only describe the Admiral's attackers as...savages."]="我只能将攻击上将的那些家伙称为……野蛮人。"
G["I can only help you with a clean death."]="你已经感染得太深了，我能做的只有让你毫无痛苦地安息。"
G["I can only hope that he will see the Light and instead turn his energies to restoring once-beautiful Quel'Thalas."]="我只希望他能看到圣光，用他的力量来恢复曾经美丽的奎尔萨拉斯。"
G["I can only hope the treatment will work."]="只能祈祷治疗方案能生效了。"
G["I can only imagine what foul business the Zandalari have with them..."]="我真不敢想象赞达拉在跟他们搞什么邪恶阴谋……"
G["I can only show you the door, Morphalius. You're the one that has to walk through it."]="我只能给你指出那扇门，莫法鲁斯。最后还得要你自己走进去。"
G["I can only teleport us once. Make sure you are ready. Go'el waits for us at the bottom of the ocean..."]="我的力量只够传送一次。所以你一定要做好充分的准备。古伊尔在海底等着我们……"
G["I can open a portal to the docks... large enough to get a strike team through."]="我可以打开通向码头的传送门——足以让突击队通过。"
G["I can raise your dead, Regent Lord. Your rangers can fight again."]="我能复活死者，摄政王，让你的游侠重返战场。"
G["I can resist Frostmourne's call no more..."]="我抵抗不住霜之哀伤的召唤…"
G["I can run fast! Daddy let me get a speed enchant on my shoes!"]="我跑得可快了！爸爸让我在鞋子上施了加速魔法！"
G["I can see everything from up here!"]="站在这儿，什么都能看见！"
G["I can see in your eyes you're no stranger to the tragedy within Stratholme. If you wish to end the miserable existence of the poor souls trapped therein, step into the circle. It leads directly to the gates of the burning city itself."]="我从你的眼神儿中看得出来，你对斯坦索姆的悲剧事件并不陌生。如果你想要解救那些被困在斯坦索姆中的可怜亡魂，就站到这法阵中来。它会直接将你传送到那座燃烧的城市入口处的。"
G["I can see my fellow druids from here.  Thank you, $n.  I'm sure Ysiel will reward you for your actions!"]="我已经可以看到我的德鲁伊同伴了。感谢你，$n。我相信伊谢尔会奖励你的。"
G["I can see that Uldum will one day transform from a dangerous wilderness to a tourist magnet!"]="这里有古老废墟与庄严金字塔，危机遍布的奥丹姆荒野，一定能变成观光者向往的天堂！"
G["I can see that you'll be a quick learner. That's good for me, because I'm always busy these days. In fact, that reminds me: could you run a quick errand for me?"]="你的学习速度真快。这很好，我最近实在是太忙啦。事实上，那倒提醒了我：你能帮我办件差事吗？"
G["I can see the light at the end of the tunnel!"]="我能看到通道那头的亮光了！"
G["I can see the light."]="我看见了光明……"
G["I can see those dirty night elves from here! When I grow up, I want to fight for the warchief just like these warriors!"]="我能从这里看到那些肮脏的暗夜精灵！等我长大以后，我要为酋长而战，就像这些战士一样！"
G["I can see you, worm. Are you grunts blind? Kill them!"]="我在看着你，虫子。你还在瞎哼哼什么？赶快去干掉他们！"
G["I can see you."]="我看见你了。"
G["I can see your end..."]="我能看到你的末日……"
G["I can see your people expect great things, even from your young."]="我感到你们从很小的时候就开始崇拜伟大的东西。"
G["I can sense it now, $n. Ashenvale lies down this path."]="我现在能看到了，$n。灰谷就在前方！"
G["I can sense the SHADOW on your hearts. There can be no rest for the wicked!"]="我能感受到你内心的阴影。邪恶的侵蚀永远不会停止！"
G["I can sense the anger building inside of you."]="我能感受到愤怒正充斥你的内心。"
G["I can sense you, 'adventurer', even through this magical image.  You think you will retrieve the ata'mal crystal when Culuthas shows himself, but you are mistaken!"]="Puedo sentirte, \"$gaventurero:aventurera;\", incluso a través de esta imagen mágica. Crees que recuperarás el cristal de Ata'mal cuando Culuthas se muestre, ¡pero estás $gequivocado:equivocada;!"
G["I can sense your desire for power, $c."]="我能感觉到你对力量的渴望，$c。"
G["I can sense your fear..."]="我能感受到你的恐惧……"
G["I can show you a few tricks... if you don't mind doing a little something first, that is."]="我可以教你一些诀窍……如果你不介意先帮我做些事情的话。"
G["I can show you the aftermath of Deathwing's destruction at the Maelstrom, if you wish."]="如果你希望如此，我可以向你展示死亡之翼在大漩涡所造成破坏的后果。"
G["I can show you what you wish to know, but you must be patient. Take your time to work the steel and feel the way it shapes beneath your hammer. When you become one with the steel, then you will understand."]="Puedo enseñarte lo que quieres saber, pero debes tener paciencia. Lleva su tiempo trabajar el acero y sentir cómo va tomando forma bajo el martillo. Cuando te hagas $guno:una; con el acero lo entenderás."
G["I can smell a market up north... time to pack up the goods and put on a heavy coat!"]="北方大陆商机暗藏啊……赶紧打点货物，穿上厚厚的外套，我们出发吧！"
G["I can smell a market up north... time to pack up the goods and put on my heavy coat!"]="北方大陆商机暗藏啊……赶紧打点货物，穿上厚厚的外套，我们出发吧！"
G["I can smell the gunpowder from all the bombs and rockets!  You want to get out there and join the fun?"]="我能闻到炸弹和火箭里的火药味儿！你也要出去找些乐子吗？"
G["I can smell them. They stink of fear."]="我可以闻到他们，浑身散发着恐惧的气味。"
G["I can smell you!"]="我能闻到你！"
G["I can smell you, $pr. Come and fight!"]="我闻到你的气味了，$pr。出来和我一战！"
G["I can smell you, thief!"]="我闻到你的气味了，小偷！"
G["I can smell your fear, $r."]="我可以感觉到你的恐惧，$r。"
G["I can smell your fear."]="我能感受到你内心的恐惧。"
G["I can smell your fear..."]="我能嗅到你的恐惧……"
G["I can smell your hatred, your violence, your doubt. Your soul bears the weight of a lifetime of hardship. Why do you continue onward down a path that can only lead to ruin?"]="我能闻到你心中仇恨、暴力和怀疑的气味。你的灵魂承受着毕生苦难的重量。为什么你还要在一条通往毁灭的道路上继续走下去？"
G["I can stable your pets and maximize their loyalty."]="你可以在我这里寄放你的宠物，而且我可以帮你提高它们的忠诚度。"
G["I can stand no more of this!"]="我再也不能忍受啦！"
G["I can still clock in for the time I was petrified, right?"]="我被石化的时间仍然可以算在工作时间里，对吧？"
G["I can take care of myself, $n."]="我能照顾自己的，$n。"
G["I can take it from here, my friends. Report to your master zhat zhe problem has been dealt vizh."]="接下来我自己能行了，朋友。去把问题已经解决的消息报告给你的主人吧。"
G["I can take you to Durnholde directly, if that is your wish."]="如果你愿意的话，我可以直接带你去敦霍尔德。"
G["I can teach the art of cooking.\nAre you looking to learn?"]="Puedo enseñarte el arte de la cocina.\n\n¿Quieres aprender?"
G["I can teach you a bit about Tailoring."]="我可以传授你一些裁缝方面的知识。"
G["I can teach you both the finesse of a short blade and the bone shattering cleaving power of a two handed behemoth. Or we can get crazy and I can teach you both, could come in handy for when the situation changes on ya."]="我能教你使用短刃的绝招或双手武器威力巨大的劈砍招式。或者我们疯狂些，我两样都教给你，这样当情况有变时就能派得上用场。"
G["I can teach you fishing skills."]="我可以教你一些钓鱼技能。"
G["I can teach you how to cook!"]="我可以教你如何烹饪！"
G["I can teach you the basics of any gathering or production profession, but that's all.\nTo learn more than an apprentice's skills, you'll need to visit a specialist dedicated to only one profession.\nYou can learn up to two professions: Two gathering, two production, or one of each.\nSecondary skills like Archaeology, Cooking, First Aid, and Fishing don't count towards your two professions; you can learn as many of those as you like."]="Te puedo enseñar lo más básico de cualquier profesión de recolección o producción, pero eso es todo.\n\nSi quieres aprender habilidades más allá del nivel de aprendiz, tendrás que ir a ver a un especialista dedicado a una única profesión.\n\nPuedes aprender hasta dos profesiones: dos de recolección, dos de producción, o una de cada.\n\nLas habilidades secundarias como arqueología, cocina, primeros auxilios y pesca no cuentan para estas dos profesiones; puedes aprender tantas profesiones secundarias como quieras."
G["I can teach you the finer points of Horse Riding, provided you have enough gold to cover the lesson!"]="我可以教你骑马的技巧，只要你有足够的金币支付学费！"
G["I can teach you the finer points of Kodo Riding, provided you have enough gold to cover the lesson!"]="我可以教你骑科多兽的技巧，只要你有足够的金币支付学费！"
G["I can teach you the finer points of Mechanostrider Piloting, provided you have enough gold to cover the lesson!"]="我可以教你操纵机械陆行鸟的技巧，只要你有足够的金币支付学费！"
G["I can teach you the finer points of Ram Riding, provided you have enough gold to cover the lesson!"]="我可以教你骑山羊的技巧，只要你有足够的金币支付学费！"
G["I can teach you the finer points of Raptor Riding, provided you have enough gold to cover the lesson!"]="我可以教你骑迅猛龙的技巧，只要你有足够的金币支付学费！"
G["I can teach you the finer points of Skeletal Horse Riding, provided you have enough gold to cover the lesson!"]="我可以教你骑骸骨战马的技巧，只要你有足够的金币支付学费！"
G["I can teach you the finer points of Tiger Riding, provided you have enough gold to cover the lesson!"]="我可以教你骑豹的技巧，只要你有足够的金币支付学费！"
G["I can teach you the finer points of Wolf Riding, provided you have enough gold to cover the lesson!"]="我可以教你骑狼的技巧，只要你有足够的金币支付学费！"
G["I can teleport you to another race's zone."]="我可以把你传送到其他种族的区域。"
G["I can tell just by the way you're standing that you're no warrior.  \n\nWhy don't you go do something safe, like read a book."]="Por tu postura, puedo decir que no eres $gun guerrero:una guerrera;. \n\n¿Por qué no te vas a hacer algo más seguro, como leer un libro o algo así?"
G["I can tell that your wardrobe is in dire need of care."]="我觉得你的服饰急需维修。"
G["I can tell ya don't want to hear my grumbling.  That's fine.\n\nJust don't forget how lucky you are, with your \"sea legs\" and your \"ability to swim in a direction other than up\"."]="Me doy cuenta de que no quieres oír mis quejas. Está bien.\n\nPero no olvides la suerte que tienes al contar con tus \"piernas de mar\" y tu \"habilidad para nadar en una dirección u otra\"."
G["I can tell you my tricks for riding, but they are nothing compared to your own practice and experience."]="我可以把我的骑术窍门告诉你，但这还是比不上你自己的刻苦练习和亲身体会。"
G["I can tell you where everyone in this town lives. Who are you looking for?"]="我可以告诉你镇上每一个人的住处，你想找谁？"
G["I can tell you where he's not..."]="我可以告诉你他不在哪儿……"
G["I can train you in First Aid techniques."]="我可以教你急救技能。"
G["I can travel faster on my own from here, $n. Meet Jessir Moonbow near Ashenvale. She should be with the druids of the Emerald Circle. She'll tell you what to do next. Thank you so much for your help!"]="我自己走可以更快些,$n。在灰谷附近与杰希尔·月弓会合。她应该与翡翠议会的德鲁伊在一起。她会告诉你接下来做什么。谢谢你的帮助！"
G["I can try asking the streams for guidance..."]="我可以试着向溪流寻求指引…"
G["I can understand he's upset, but this attack is simply going too far!"]="我能理解他的烦乱，可这攻击也太过分了！"
G["I can understand that. But the King did allow for a change, letting a gnome tap the keg.  So I got a chance to work on a new type of problem; How to efficiently and quickly open the keg and distribute its contents such that all participants will receive equal parts quickly and efficiently."]="我对此可以理解，但国王陛下能允许我这个侏儒去开酒桶，已经是个改变了。所以呢，现在我正在研究另一个难题，那就是：如何最有效率地打开酒桶，并把里面的酒平均地分给大家喝，注意平均和最有效率这两个词。"
G["I can use all of the cleansed metal that you can provide."]="你有多少净化过的金属，我就要多少。"
G["I can watch no longer.  We MUST undo this evil that the arakkoa are perpetrating upon the protectors of the Raven's Wood!"]="我再也看不下去了。鸦人们企图令乌鸦林的保护者堕落腐化，我们必须粉碎他们邪恶的阴谋！"
G["I can whip up better than thish, Jashon."]="贾森，我能搅出更多的泡沫来。"
G["I can't BELIEVE she wore the same dress as me.  How embarrassing."]="真不敢相信，我居然跟她撞衫了。真是太尴尬了。"
G["I can't BELIEVE that we're stopping!  We've got a duty to do here!"]="真无法相信，我们竟然就这样停下了！我们在这里还有任务要完成呢！"
G["I can't accurately assess the mathematics behind the charge of my turbostrider while keeping hold of my lance at the precise angle needed and keeping my shield in the exact location for maximum protection at any given second!"]="在让长枪保持最精确的角度并让盾牌处于任何时候都能提供最佳保护的位置的同时我还怎么算得清该为机械陆行鸟加载多大的电荷！"
G["I can't afford to miss another shipment!"]="我不能再错过一次货运了！"
G["I can't afford to spare you."]="我不能放过你。"
G["I can't argue with that."]="好吧，你说得对。"
G["I can't bang on this device any faster, captain! My wrapping is already beginning to unravel!"]="我不能敲得更快了，队长！我的裹布已经开始散落了！"
G["I can't be held responsible every time someone falls off their mount.  I don't know how you got the official seal on this, but take your payment and don't question my horses again!"]="我可不能每次都为别人从他们的坐骑上摔落而负责。我不知你是怎么盖到官方印章的，但请你拿上酬劳走开吧，别再来质疑我的马匹了！"
G["I can't bear to watch."]="我实在不忍心看。"
G["I can't believe I fell for Schnottz's lies! I'm out of here!"]="真无法想象，我竟然会相信司克诺兹的谎言！跑到了这里！"
G["I can't believe I let Gidwin run off like that!"]="我真不敢相信我竟然让吉德文跑了！"
G["I can't believe Uncle Chen would rather sit down and drink beer than walk around and explore this place!"]="我真不敢相信陈叔宁愿坐在家中喝的酩酊大醉，也不愿出来走走，来这探险！"
G["I can't believe both Farmer Yoon and Farmer Fung are here!\n\nWhat's a girl to do?"]="真不敢相信，农夫老愚和农夫老方都来了！\n\n这叫我一个姑娘家该怎么办啊？"
G["I can't believe dad won't let me keep your sister."]="我不敢相信我爸爸居然不让我养它。"
G["I can't believe he left me with the weird mud guy."]="No me puedo creer que me haya dejado con el \"tío cao\" este."
G["I can't believe how I felt before.\nTo think that I could have become posessed by the same thing that controlled these Jinyu, it's... disturbing, to say the least."]="No me puedo creer cómo me sentía antes.\n\nPensar que podía haberme poseído lo mismo que controlaba a esos jinyu es, cuando menos... perturbador."
G["I can't believe how lucky we got on that trip!  I really am the greatest sky-captain in all the realms!"]="真不敢相信，那次旅行实在是太幸运了！我是全世界最好的天空船长！"
G["I can't believe it!  I'm free to go!"]="真不敢相信！我可以走了！"
G["I can't believe it! I saw the spirit of of an emperor!"]="难以置信！我竟然看见了一位皇帝的灵魂！"
G["I can't believe it! I was certain that he'd be here in the Wilds.\n\nPaoquan Hollow, you say? I'll join her soon, and we can continue our training. For the time being, I've already found an adventure of my own."]="真令人难以置信！我以为隐秘大师一定会在荒野里。\n\n你说在抱拳林？我很快就会去找林，然后我们就能继续训练了。至于目前嘛，我已经找到属于自己的冒险了。"
G["I can't believe it! You've destroyed my pack... Now face my wrath!"]="我简直不敢相信！面对我的愤怒吧！"
G["I can't believe it's come to this."]="真不敢相信会是这样。"
G["I can't believe it... I was doing a routine recon mission over the central DMZ when all hell broke loose. I saw the Horde Wing Commander, Mulverick, take out both Ichman and Slidore! Anger took hold of me and I broke from my wing man and drove that show-off, Mulverick, down. Unfortunately, he clipped my gryphon before he crashed, forcing me down as well. I ended up captured by these savages.\n\nI have to get back to base! Help!"]="真不敢相信……我在中央非军事区执行例行侦察任务时，事情变得一团糟。我看见部落中校穆维里克击倒了艾克曼和斯里多尔！我发怒了，冲出队伍将穆维里克打倒在地。不幸的是，他在倒下之前击中了我的狮鹫，我也随之跌下。我被这些野蛮的家伙抓住啦。\n\n我必须返回基地！帮帮我！"
G["I can't believe my own people forgot about me. Die!"]="真不敢相信，我的同胞居然把我忘了。去死吧！"
G["I can't believe that Fizz and Evol are at each other's throats again. It's the pressure. We need you now more than ever, $n."]="我不敢相信菲兹和艾沃竟然会自相残杀。这一定是因为他们的压力太大了。现在我们更加需要你了，$n。"
G["I can't believe that I used to wear that."]="真不敢相信，我竟然穿过这样的装备。"
G["I can't believe that Papa Wheeler thinks he's going to dupe anyone into going out to Manaforge B'naar!"]="我不敢相信，维勒老爹觉得他可以把进入法力熔炉：布纳尔内的所有人骗出来！"
G["I can't believe that it's... over...\n\nGo'el is free, thanks in no small part to you, $n."]="No me puedo creer que haya... terminado...\n\nGo'el es libre, en gran parte gracias a ti, $n."
G["I can't believe that we're doing this.  I know that Calcinder's presence threatens us all, but really?  Doesn't this seem like the domain of the Earthen Ring, or something?\n\nWhy's the Thorium Brotherhood gotta come save the day all the time?"]="真难以相信，我们竟然在做这个。我知道，卡尔烬德的出现会让我们全都受到威胁。但这是真的吗？统治这里的不是大地之环吗？还是别的什么组织？\n\n为什么瑟银兄弟会要如此大动干戈？"
G["I can't believe the Zandalari actually make living sacrifices!"]="难以置信，赞达拉居然真的在搞活体献祭！"
G["I can't believe the blues would attack us. Let's give some of it back!"]="真不敢相信，蓝龙军团居然会攻击我们。我们要发动反击！"
G["I can't believe the nerve of those trolls. Rebelling after all that I've done for them!"]="真无法相信这些巨魔的勇气。他们竟然敢造我的反！"
G["I can't believe the officials in Stormwind, sending the bulk of our army abroad... when our home front is under so much pressure!\n\nWith thieves coming from Westfall and gnolls encroaching from from the east and west, it's a wonder Stormwind itself isn't besieged."]="在我们的家园面临重重危机的情况下……暴风城的官员们竟然将大批军队派往别处，我真不敢相信!\n\n来自西部荒野的盗贼与东边和西边来的豺狼人蜂拥而至，暴风城没有受到围攻可真是个奇蹟。"
G["I can't believe the officials in Stormwind, sending the bulk of our army abroad... when our home front is under so much pressure!\n\nWith thieves coming from Westfall and gnolls encroaching from the east and west, it's a wonder Stormwind itself isn't besieged."]="在我们的家园面临重重危机的情况下……暴风城的官员们竟然将大批军队派往别处，我真不敢相信！\n\n来自西部荒野的盗贼和来自东西两面的豺狼人蜂拥而至，暴风城没有受到围攻可真是个奇迹。"
G["I can't believe they be chasin' me outta the city. Innit supposed to be a refuge? Ol' Griftah be a refugee! Not my fault I be an ENTERPRISIN' refugee..."]="我不敢相信他们竟然把我赶出了沙塔斯城。那里难道不是贫民窟吗？我，格里伏塔也是难民啊！不是我的错，我只是个有事业心的难民……"
G["I can't believe they've keep me waiting this long!"]="他们竟然让我等了这么久，简直令人难以置信！"
G["I can't believe this! You were dead! All accounts said so... what happened, Muradin. How did you get here?"]="我真不敢相信自己的眼睛！你不是死了吗？大家都这么认为……到底发生了什么事，穆拉丁。你怎么会在这里？"
G["I can't believe this. How much do they feed this thing?"]="我真不敢相信。他们给它喂了多少东西啊？"
G["I can't believe we had to kill one of my order... where has the world gone?"]="我不敢相信我们必须消灭掉我们社团的一员……这个世界怎么了？"
G["I can't believe we made it. Thank you stranger!"]="我真不敢相信我们做到了。谢谢你，陌生人！"
G["I can't believe we're actually fighting for the Crusade!"]="真无法相信，我们竟然真的是在为十字军而战！"
G["I can't believe you guys are still fighting here in Hyjal. You should see what happens after this."]="难以相信，你们还在海加尔奋战。你应该明白随后将要发生什么。"
G["I can't believe you imbeciles went to school for this! Does anybody here know what they're doing?"]="我不敢相信你这个蠢货竟然为了这个去学校！谁知道他们在干什么吗？"
G["I can't believe you sell those here, of all places.  I'll swing by the cook later to pick them up."]="我真不敢相信你竟然在这儿卖那些东西。我会顺路拜访厨师来把它们带走。"
G["I can't believe you'd do this to me!"]="真无法相信，你竟然这样对我！"
G["I can't believe you're still alive."]="难以置信，你居然还活着。"
G["I can't believe you've actually done something right for once."]="难以置信，你竟然真的做对了一次。"
G["I can't believe... they're all... dead."]="我不敢相信……他们全都……死了。"
G["I can't come down.  I am scared."]="我下不来了，我怕。"
G["I can't do business with you, $c. Warchief's Orders."]="我不能和你做交易，$c。这是酋长的命令。"
G["I can't do much since I'm just Hilda's assistant, but ye can. I hope ye can find out what they're up to."]="我只是希尔达的助理，能力有限。但是你能做的有很多。希望你能发现他们的动向。"
G["I can't do this while they're attacking me!"]="我没法在他们进攻的时候干这事儿！"
G["I can't even begin to describe it... you have to see this, $n."]="我不知道怎么描述……你得看看这个，$n。"
G["I can't even believe this one... You know those two loud-mouthed ruffians, Foror and Tigule?"]="我根本不能相信这个……你知道那两个大嘴巴的恶棍，弗洛尔和提古勒吗？"
G["I can't even remember how many times I've spotted a beautiful mining vein at the bottom of a lake or river, glimmering mockingly at me.  I'm forced to float orelessly by, mining pick in hand, only to watch some blasted orc or blood elf swim down to the bottom and take it away from me."]="我都数不清究竟有多少次，远远看见水底有金光闪闪的矿脉，透过水面折射出诱人的光芒。我却只能拿着矿锄两手空空地游走，眼睁睁地看着该死的兽人和血精灵轻而易举的潜入水底，大摇大摆的携矿而去。"
G["I can't even visit my father's grave in peace anymore."]="我甚至都不能够安静地祭拜我父亲的墓地。"
G["I can't feel my legs..."]="我感觉不到我的腿……"
G["I can't fight any longer..."]="我无法再战斗了……"
G["I can't fight it!"]="我无法对抗它！"
G["I can't find my pet frog, Jubjub.  She loves Dark Iron Ale, it's all she ever drinks, but can be so hard to get!  Now I'm out... and Jubjub must have run away to find more!\n\nI wish she would come back..."]="我找不到我的宠物青蛙加布加布啦。她爱喝黑铁啤酒，她总是喝这种酒，但是这种酒很不容易得到的！现在我没有黑铁啤酒了……加布加布一定是自己跑出去找酒喝啦！\n\n真希望她回到我身边……"
G["I can't find my shield, I've looked all over the village! I wish I could help, but without my shield I'm good for nothing!"]="我的盾牌不见了，我在村子里都找遍了！我希望自己能帮上忙，可没有盾牌，我什么也做不了！"
G["I can't find someone. Help!"]="我找不到这个人，帮帮我！"
G["I can't follow the tracers back out, too many flesh beasts in the way. Send someone in... Follow the tracers... Ya-six, out."]="我不能跟着追踪器走出去，沿途的血肉兽太多了。派人……跟着追踪器进来吧……亚希克斯，完毕。"
G["I can't get a reading... Something is interfering..."]="我不能得到读数……有东西在妨碍我……"
G["I can't get anything else out of this one."]="我从这里面已经挖不出任何东西了。"
G["I can't get those eyes out of my head..."]="我脑海里都是那眼睛……"
G["I can't go back, not after the horrible fight I had with them. I'm sorry, $n, I just can't."]="我不能回去了，我和他们之间发生过可怕的争执。抱歉，$n，我真的不能回去。"
G["I can't go on... I need to retreat and recover."]="我坚持不住了……我需要撤退，进行恢复。"
G["I can't handle this $n alone! Help!"]="我一个人解决不了这个$n！救命啊！"
G["I can't hardly stand the sight o' them green-skinned savages!"]="我打心眼儿里不想看见这些绿皮肤的野蛮人！"
G["I can't hear the screams anymore. Is this the end?"]="我听不到那些尖叫声了。一切都结束了吗？"
G["I can't help but think that if it weren't for the meddling of $n back on Kezan, we'd all be safe and sound in Azshara by now."]="No puedo evitar pensar que si no fuera por la intromisión de cierta persona en Kezan, todos estaríamos ya sanos y salvos en Azshara."
G["I can't help but wonder if I could be doing more damage if my gear was better..."]="我帮不上忙。但我想知道是不是我的装备好一些，就能制造出更多的伤害……"
G["I can't help it, really. This is just such a beautiful place."]="我有点情不自禁了，这真是个漂亮的地方。"
G["I can't help ya'! You're ready to see someone who's been at it longer than I have! Let's see... you're an Alliance type, so you need to talk to Lilliam Sparkspindle in Stormwind."]="¡No puedo ayudarte! Estás $glisto:lista; para ver a alguien con mucha más experiencia que yo. Veamos... eres de la Alianza, así que tendrás que hablar con Lilliam Chispeje de Ventormenta."
G["I can't help ya. Go talk ta Legati if ya want rogue trainin'."]="我不能帮助你，如果你想接受潜行者训练，就去和雷加提谈谈。"
G["I can't help ya. Go talk ta Nekali if ya want shaman trainin'."]="我不能帮助你，如果你想接受萨满祭司训练，就去和奈卡利谈谈。"
G["I can't help ya. Go talk ta Nortet if ya want warrior trainin'."]="我不能帮助你，如果你想接受战士训练，就去和诺泰特谈谈。"
G["I can't help ya. Go talk ta Ortezza if ya want hunter trainin'."]="我不能帮助你，如果你想接受猎人训练，就去和欧塔扎谈谈。"
G["I can't help ya. Go talk ta Soratha if ya want mage trainin'."]="我不能帮助你，如果你想接受法师训练，就去和索拉萨谈谈。"
G["I can't help ya. Go talk ta Tunari if ya want priest trainin'."]="我不能帮助你，如果你想接受牧师训练，就去和图娜尼谈谈。"
G["I can't help ya. Go talk ta Voldreka if ya want warlock trainin'."]="No pue'o ayudah'te. Vete a hablar con Voldreka si quieres recibir inh'trucción como $gbrujo:bruja;."
G["I can't help ya. Go talk ta Zen'Tabra if ya want druid trainin'."]="我不能帮助你，如果你想接受德鲁伊训练，就去和岑塔布拉谈谈。"
G["I can't help you, $c. Warchief Mor'ghor would have me executed if I allowed the Horde to use one of our wind riders.\n\nSome day he'll get what's coming to him..."]="我帮不了你的忙，$c。要是我敢把我们的双足飞龙借给部落使用，莫格霍尔酋长会把我处死的。\n\n总有一天他会得到他应得的……"
G["I can't help you; your work is beyond my own. Talk to Arthur Moore, over there by the coffins. He'll be able to train you further."]="我不能帮助你，我无法胜任。跟棺材那边的亚瑟·摩尔谈谈。他会为你提供更多的训练的。"
G["I can't hold it off any longer! Tell the exarch that I gave it my best."]="我坚持不下去了！告诉主教说我尽力了。"
G["I can't imagine what caused these crocolisks to start attacking. What changed?"]="我想不出是什么东西使得这些鳄鱼开始有攻击性。发生什么事了？"
G["I can't keep this barrier up much longer... Where is that coward?"]="屏障支撑不了多久了……那个胆小鬼在哪儿呢？"
G["I can't keep this damned barrier up forever. Kill faster!"]="我不可能一直维持反魔法屏障。动作快点，消灭他们！"
G["I can't keep this pace up, sir! If the Scourge don't get me, exhaustion will!"]="长官，我快吃不消了！就算我没死在天灾兵手里，也会活活累死啊！"
G["I can't let you into Orgrimmar with these cultist articles."]="我不能让你带着这些邪教文章进入奥格瑞玛。"
G["I can't let you into the city with these cultist articles."]="你竟然私带邪教文卷，我不能让你进城。"
G["I can't look..."]="我不敢睁眼……"
G["I can't maintain this shield much longer. Kalytha - are any of us going to survive this?"]="我没办法将这面护盾维持太久了。卡莱莎，我们之中能有人活过这场劫难吗？"
G["I can't offer you any training, $n, but I sure could use your help against these damn monkeys!"]="我无法对你进行任何训练，$n。但我需要你帮我对付这些该死的猴子！"
G["I can't offer you anything outside Howling Fjord. The bats still don't know their way abroad. Where do you want to go?"]="我无法为你安排前往嚎风峡湾之外区域的飞行。这些蝙蝠并不清楚那些航线。那么，你打算去哪儿？"
G["I can't open the tan-chao while I'm under attack!"]="我没法在遭受攻击的状态下开启接天桥！"
G["I can't perform the ritual while they're beating on me!"]="我没法在他们攻击我的时候继续进行仪式！"
G["I can't possibly go out without my cloak. I hope it's in here..."]="我不能不穿披风出去。我希望它在这里……"
G["I can't punch through this dang ol' bubble!"]="我……我没法打穿这该死的泡泡！"
G["I can't say I mind the food here. Or the beer, for that matter."]="我得说，这儿的饭菜还真是不错。啤酒也是，真心给力。"
G["I can't say enough about yer work, truly amazing things that ye can do with a hammer and an anvil. Now, don't be tellin anyone that I suggested ye go find a goblin to teach ye but that's exactly what I'm gonna do. Brikk Keencraft is his name, and last I heard he was operating a shop down in Booty Bay."]="我不能对你进行什么指导啦，你能用铁锤和铁砧做出如此令人称奇的东西。我建议你去找一个名叫布里克·基克拉夫的地精，你可别告诉别人,我最后一次听说他在藏宝海湾经营一家商店。"
G["I can't say no, but you didn't have to. Thanks, $r."]="我不能拒绝，但你可以。谢谢，$r。"
G["I can't see a thing with this mask on, but I'm not about to tell HER that."]="戴上这副面具，我什么都看不见。但我可不会告诉她这个。"
G["I can't see why not, although, I can't see a lot of things right now."]="我看不到否定的理由，不过话说回来，有很多东西我都看不到。"
G["I can't see why you want to learn something else... but I suppose I can point you in the right direction. What training are you after, specifically?"]="我不知道为什么你想学些其他技能……但我想我能为你找到合适的训练师。你具体想要什么训练？"
G["I can't see you, but I can sense your presence.  I'll explain what I can."]="我看不见你，但我能感觉到你的存在。我会说清楚我能做些什么。"
G["I can't see!"]="我看不见！"
G["I can't show you anything else, kid. Go find Lebowski in Honor Hold - that's in Hellfire Peninsula. He can teach you more than I can!"]="我没什么可以教你的了，孩子。去找荣耀堡的莱布斯基——就在地狱火半岛。他能教你更多东西！"
G["I can't show you anything else, kid. Go find Zebig in Thrallmar - that's in Hellfire Peninsula. He can teach you more than I can!"]="我没什么可以教你的了，孩子。去找萨尔玛的塞比格——就在地狱火半岛。他能教你更多东西！"
G["I can't sleep without a good bedtime story. Now I'm certain to rest well."]="没有一个好的睡前故事，我就睡不着。现在我肯定可以睡个好觉了。"
G["I can't stand all of the cackling and diabolical laughter. One more 'muhahaha' from Lydon and I'm blowing us all up."]="那些嘲笑简直让我没法忍。如果林度恩再发出那种愚蠢的“哈哈哈”的声音，我就把他炸上天。"
G["I can't stand being cooped up in here with all these warlocks.  This is Xi'lun's job, not mine!\n\nI can't wait for this battle to start.  I need to be outside, with my dragons."]="我可不愿意和这些术士们一起被困在这里。这是克希鲁恩的工作，不是我的！\n\n我已经等不及要参加战斗了。我需要出去，和我的龙在一起。"
G["I can't stand to watch. So many good memories. So much profit."]="这么多美好的回忆，这么多丰厚的利润。我可不能袖手旁观。"
G["I can't stay in town anymore. I must find a fight!"]="我不能继续待在城里了！我得打上一场！"
G["I can't stop it. We're in for a crash landing!"]="我没法让它停下来。我们要坠毁了！"
G["I can't swim!"]="我不会游泳！"
G["I can't take it anymore....\n\nThey kill you, then eat you! And that's if you're lucky!"]="我受不了啦……\n\n他们会杀了你，然后吃掉你的尸体！据说这样还算幸运的！你能想象比这更倒霉的遭遇吗！"
G["I can't take it, man! I'm freakin' out here!"]="我受不了了，伙计！我在这儿快要发疯了！"
G["I can't take much more of this!"]="我不能再受伤了！"
G["I can't take much more of this! Am I really supposed to go fight those wolves?"]="我再也受不了了！我真的要去对付那些狼吗？"
G["I can't take much more of this..."]="我已经受够了……"
G["I can't take these taxes! F.I.C.A. me? F.I.C.A. YOU!"]="我可负担不起这么高的税金！"
G["I can't talk right now. I'm very busy."]="我现在没空聊天，我很忙。"
G["I can't teach what I don't know! If only there was someone else who knew more than I do... wait, there is! Go see Buzzek Bracketswing in Gadgetzan!"]="我没有什么可以教你的啦！如果有人比我知道得多……等等，有啦！去加基森找巴兹克·布拉斯温吧。"
G["I can't thank you enough for all of your help in putting together the keystone. Great things will come of this, I assure you."]="你修复了钥匙，我对此感激不尽。我保证，你的努力将成就伟大的事业。"
G["I can't thank you enough for your help, $n. At long last, I will be free of this tower and Kael's damnable magic!"]="我不知道该怎么感谢你才好了，$n。终于，我终于可以摆脱凯尔萨斯那该死的魔法，重获自由了！"
G["I can't thank you enough!"]="真不知道该怎么感谢你！"
G["I can't understand a word that you're saying. Just follow me."]="你说的话我一个字都听不懂。你跟我走就是了。"
G["I can't use that. I am looking to expand my healing knowledge."]="我没法用这东西。我希望能继续研习医术。"
G["I can't wait any longer. I'm going to set it off! Muahahahahahaha!"]="我已经等不及了。我要把它引爆！哇哈哈哈哈哈哈哈！"
G["I can't wait anymore, I'll go to Stoneplough. I hear they're cooking some Chimaerok Chops over there."]="等不下去了，我还是去石犁村吧。听说那边有奇美拉肉片卖。"
G["I can't wait for all this infernal itching to be gone and to have my lustrous coat back! You have what you wanted. Begone!"]="我已经迫不及待想要摆脱这该死的搔痒，重新穿上我那光鲜亮丽的大衣！你的目的已经达到了。走吧！"
G["I can't wait for the day when you rise to the top. Just think, I'll be able to call myself Mrs. Trade Prince\n\nNot to mention buy all that stuff I've always wanted!!!"]="我全心全意地期待着你晋升到顶点的那一天。想一想，那时我就是贸易大王的太太。\n\n我还能去买下我一直想买的所有东西！！！"
G["I can't wait to get home to my family. Thank you, stranger."]="Ardo en deseos de volver a casa con mi familia. Gracias, $gextraño:extraña;."
G["I can't wait to get out there and help in the fight against those trolls."]="我已经迫不及待想要离开这里，去帮助对付那些巨魔了。"
G["I can't wait to grow up!"]="我真想马上长大！"
G["I can't wait to learn how to Hex. The two of you are going to be frogs for the rest of your miserable lives!"]="我正急着要学习妖术呐。你们俩可怜的后半生就只能以青蛙的模样度过了。"
G["I can't wait to see it! They seem ready for another round now, so prepare yourselves!"]="我已经等不及要看到下一场战斗了！他们似乎已经做好了准备。所以，你们也赶快进行准备吧！"
G["I can't wait to see the look on his face when I animate his corpse."]="我都等不及要看看他被复活后的表情了。"
G["I can't wait to see the newest goods from Smokywood Pastures."]="我迫不及待地想看看烟林牧场的新货物。"
G["I can't wait to send this picture to my girl back home. She's gonna freak!"]="我等不及要把这张照片寄给我家乡的女朋友了。她肯定会抓狂的！"
G["I can't wait to smash that old god brain between me fists!"]="我现在就想用双拳打碎那个上古之神的脑壳！"
G["I can't wait to try these."]="我等不及要尝尝了。"
G["I can't wait to try this wine!"]="我迫不及待地想尝尝这瓶酒了！"
G["I can't wait until I'm older, so I can finally find out what beer tastes like."]="我不想等到长大了才知道啤酒到底是什么味道。"
G["I can't wait until we're done setting up.  Then I can kick back and enjoy the festivities."]="真是等不及看到这些准备工作完工了。我们马上就可以开始享受这个节日啦！"
G["I can't work under these conditions, man! I'm losin' it!"]="我在这种环境下没法干活！我快不行了！"
G["I can't. I'm not the man they think I am at home.  Besides, I didn't bring them out here."]="我不能，我不是他们所想的那种宅男。而且，我并没有把他们带到这里来。"
G["I can't... miss.. again..."]="我不能……再……打偏了……"
G["I can't...fight him..."]="我不能……和他战斗……"
G["I can... I can barely breathe.  I'm alive thanks to you."]="我……都快透不过气了。多亏你救了我。"
G["I can...see the light of the moon...so clearly now.  It is...beautiful..."]="我看见月亮的光辉了……如此清晰。真是……太美了……"
G["I canna' believe I made myself the bait for a trap. Lucky for me you an' me Pop were there."]="我真不敢相信，自己竟成了陷阱的诱饵。幸亏你和我爸爸赶来了。"
G["I cannot aid you with further lessons: your skills have surpassed mine. Go and see the tauren Una in the northwestern shops of Thunder Bluff's central plateau. She offers more advanced training."]="我不能再教你啦：你所掌握的技能已经超过我了。去雷霆崖中央平原西北部的商店找牛头人犹纳吧。她会为你提供更多训练的。"
G["I cannot allow you to interfere!"]="我不能允许你们介入！"
G["I cannot argue with your results, but how can a proud warrior of the swarm make his name chasing down fleeing peasants and farmhands?"]="我无法否认你的战果，但是荣耀的虫群战士怎么能把自己的名声建立在追杀溃逃的农夫和雇农上呢？"
G["I cannot be certain of what I saw.\n\nIt was over before I realized what was happening."]="我不确定自己究竟看见了什么。\n\n在我意识到发生什么之前，就已经结束了。"
G["I cannot be defeated!"]="我不会被打败。"
G["I cannot be defeated. I beat all man."]="我不会被打败。我不可战胜。"
G["I cannot be destroyed! By the will of Ragnaros, I shall be reborn!"]="我不会死掉！以拉格纳罗斯的意愿为名，我会重生的！"
G["I cannot be destroyed... Only... de... layed..."]="我不会被毁灭……你们……只是在拖延……"
G["I cannot be teachin' a Tauren to ride a Raptor."]="No puedo enseñarle a $gun:una; tauren a montar un raptor."
G["I cannot believe $n is still standing!"]="真不敢相信，$n居然还能站在场地上！"
G["I cannot believe they made me move my transporter out of town!   Most of the gnomes affected by the accident regained some sort of humanoid form within a few weeks and it should have been an honor to be a participant in such a grand gnomish experiment!\nBesides, we needed the eggs!"]="¡No puedo creer que me hicieran trasladar mi transportador fuera de la ciudad! La mayoría de los gnomos afectados por el accidente recobraron algún tipo de forma humanoide a las pocas semanas, y debería haber sido un honor ser un participante de tan importante experimento gnómico!\n\n¡Además, necesitamos los huevos!"
G["I cannot believe those greedy goblins are allowed to hawk their wares while spoiling the spirit of this season."]="我不敢相信这些贪婪的地精能在破坏季节的精神的同时兜售他们的器皿。"
G["I cannot break his will alone..."]="我无法独自摧毁他的意志……"
G["I cannot challenge the Celestials today, but I look forward to watching your progress.  Good luck, $n."]="我今天没有机会挑战至尊天神，但我期待看到你的进步。祝你好运，$n。"
G["I cannot do this alone..."]="我一个人无法获胜……"
G["I cannot emphasize enough how important it is that you kill those channelers and bring that shield down, $n."]="至于杀死那些导魔师并击落护盾这件事究竟有多么重要，用语言已经不足以强调了，$n。"
G["I cannot face him myself. To even approach him would risk letting the same corruption overtake me once more."]="我不敢亲自去面对他。仅是靠近他，就有让同样的腐化再次将我打倒的危险。"
G["I cannot fall here. Not with so much work left to be done..."]="我可不能倒在这里，还有很多事情等着我去做呢……"
G["I cannot fathom the origin or purpose of this place.\n\nThese corridors are used for troop movements, yes, but they're also littered with charred and tortured corpses, some partially devoured, most simply crushed and beaten.\n\nWe are in the Firelands, but I feel as though we've crossed the threshold into hell."]="我不明白这地方的起源与用途。\n\n这些通道是行军用的，这没错，可这里同样遍布烧焦与饱受折磨的尸体，有些尸体已经部分被吞食，而大部分则只是被打得面目全非。\n\n尽管我们是在火焰之地，我却感觉像是已经跨进了地狱。"
G["I cannot fill a cup that is already overflowing."]="已经满溢的杯中不可能容纳更多的水。"
G["I cannot fill a cup that is already overflowing. Before you can gain wisdom, you must become an empty vessel."]="已经满溢的杯中不可能容纳更多的水。在你获得真正的智慧之前，必须清空自己的头脑。"
G["I cannot help you until you have learned more of the essentials. Come back to me when you are ready."]="你要学习更多的基本技能，我才能帮助你。当你准备好了再来找我。"
G["I cannot help you with further training: your skill at working with leather rivals my own. You should speak with Una, over there. I will vouch for your skill if need be."]="我不能为你提供更多的训练啦：你的制革技能已经超过我啦。你应该去那儿找犹纳谈谈。如果需要的话我会为你担保的。"
G["I cannot help you with your training. Seek out a $c trainer."]="我这里没有你要学的东西。去找$c训练师吧。"
G["I cannot help you, $c."]="我帮不了你，$c。"
G["I cannot help you, please speak with the Gryphon Master on the South side of the Dark Portal."]="我没法帮你，请跟黑暗之门南面的狮鹫管理员交谈。"
G["I cannot help you, please speak with the Wind Rider Master on the North side of the Dark Portal."]="我没法帮你，请跟黑暗之门北面的双足飞龙管理员交谈。"
G["I cannot hold him for long, we must leave at once!"]="我没办法阻挡他太久，我们必须马上离开！"
G["I cannot hold this barrier forever. Quickly, you must deal with the warlord on the palace steps!"]="我不可能永远守住这道障碍。赶快，你必须去宫殿阶梯上解决督军！"
G["I cannot hold... Destabilizing..."]="我快要……坚持不住了……"
G["I cannot in good conscience spend time training novices while our allies, the undead, are suffering so terribly. Please speak with Kray over there instead; he can help you for now."]="当我们的盟友，也就是亡灵们，在遭受可怕苦难时候，我如果还在这里训练新手，这会让我感到良心不安。请找那边的克瑞谈谈；他目前能够帮你。"
G["I cannot join you this day, friends. I must prepare my fish for the coming feast!"]="我今天不能加入你们了，朋友们。宴会在即，我得把鱼准备好！"
G["I cannot leave my post here, $n, but there is a task that must be taken care of. Can I trust you to see it done?"]="我不能离开这里的岗位，$n，但是有一项任务必须完成。我可以把它托付给你吗？"
G["I cannot offer ya trainin', friend."]="No puedo ofrecerte ningún entrenamiento, $gamigo:amiga;."
G["I cannot permit you to enter the Temple!  I must destroy you for your own good!"]="我不允许你进入神庙！我会摧毁你的！"
G["I cannot promise that your rest will be peaceful, $c.  These orcs do not know when to quit."]="我没办法保证你们能在这里得到平静的休息环境，$c。这些兽人根本不知道什么是平静。"
G["I cannot read the words... but the magic points to a world that exists no longer. It was destroyed by the Legion."]="我无法读懂这些文字……但这股魔法指向了另一个已不复存在的世界。它是被燃烧军团摧毁的。"
G["I cannot remain here. I must return to my cairn where I belong, but when I see the ancestors again, it is I who will tell your story."]="我不能待在这里。我必须返回自己的陵墓。当我与长者的灵魂重聚时，会向大家讲诉你的故事。"
G["I cannot return home with you just yet, Leryssa.  I am not quite done with the Scourge."]="我还不能跟你回家，莉蕾萨。我和天灾军团之间的账还没有算清呢。"
G["I cannot return. Now that I've learned the truth, my place is here among my new brothers and sisters."]="我不能回去了。我已经知道了什么是真实。我的位置是在我新的兄弟姐妹中间。"
G["I cannot stand by idly while Lin is in danger."]="林正深陷险境，我无法坐视不理。"
G["I cannot stand the pain.  I must find a new source."]="我不能忍受这痛苦了。我必须找到新的魔法源。"
G["I cannot stand...this sound!"]="我受不了……这声音了！"
G["I cannot store any more supplies.  I have all I can handle!"]="我不能再存储物资了。我的背包都满了！"
G["I cannot strike them!  What is this demon magic?"]="我打不中他们了！这是什么恶魔邪法？"
G["I cannot teach you anything you don't already know. However, the knowledge of my father far surpasses my own. Go inside and speak to him. Good luck!"]="我不能再教你什么啦。但是，我父亲的知识远胜于我。进去跟他谈谈。祝你好运！"
G["I cannot teach you dragonscale leatherworking, $n. You must go to Tanaris and find the home of Narain Soothfancy. Once there, consult the book \"Soothsaying for Dummies.\""]="No puedo enseñarte peletería dragontina, $n. Has de ir a Tanaris y encontrar la casa de Narain Sabelotodo. Una vez allí, consulta el libro \"Adivinar el futuro para torpes\"."
G["I cannot teach you elemental leatherworking, $n. You must go to Tanaris and find the home of Narain Soothfancy. Once there, consult the book \"Soothsaying for Dummies.\""]="No puedo enseñarte peletería elemental, $n. Has de ir a Tanaris y encontrar la casa de Narain Sabelotodo. Una vez allí, consulta el libro \"Adivinar el futuro para torpes\"."
G["I cannot teach you tribal leatherworking, $n. You must go to Tanaris and find the home of Narain Soothfancy. Once there, consult the book \"Soothsaying for Dummies.\""]="No puedo enseñarte Peletería tribal, $n. Has de ir a Tanaris y encontrar la casa de Narain Sabelotodo. Una vez allí, consulta el libro \"Adivinar el futuro para torpes\"."
G["I cannot thank you enough for making my pilgrimage possible!"]="太感谢了，你让我的朝圣之梦成真了！"
G["I cannot train a $c such as yourself."]="No puedo entrenar a $gun:una; $c como tú."
G["I cannot use this, $r."]="我没法用这东西，$r。"
G["I cannot wait to see the results of this latest batch!"]="我简直等不及要看这最后一批的实验结果了！"
G["I cannot work under these conditions!  We need a viable strain!"]="这样叫我怎么研究！我需要一份能在这种气候下存活的药剂样本！"
G["I cannot, Vaelastrasz! Surely something can be done to heal you!"]="我做不到，瓦拉斯塔兹！一定有什么办法可以拯救你！"
G["I cannot."]="不行。"
G["I cannot. I merely collect.\n\nIbdil may help you. His way is to mend."]="我不能。我只负责收集。\n\n伊布迪尔应该能帮到你。他擅长修理。"
G["I care far too deeply about redeeming Eldre'thalas to deal with any other matter. War, strife, allegiances, none of it matters until this city is safe."]="现在我唯一关心的就是修复埃德萨拉。在这座城市平安无事之前，其它所有事情，战争、冲突、忠诚，对我都没有意义。"
G["I care little about the wars between the Horde and the Alliance. What matters is that we save the sacred wind riders of Highperch.\n\nIf not for their sake, then at least to keep them from falling into the hands of the Twilight's Hammer, $r."]="我不在乎部落和联盟之间的战争。对我来说，最重要的是拯救风巢的双足飞龙。\n\n至少，我要阻止它们落进暮光之锤的手中，$r。"
G["I care nothing for your threats or these naga. Prepare to be removed from existence."]="我不害怕你的威胁，也不会在乎这些纳迦。为灭亡做好准备吧。"
G["I carry both parts of the scepter."]="我携带有节杖的两个部分。"
G["I carry odds and ends, but mostly just odds."]="我有很多零碎的小东西。"
G["I carry out her will! We shall crumble this wall and devour the lands beyond!"]="我在此执行女皇的意志！我们要粉碎这道长城，吞噬另一侧的土地！"
G["I cast you out! Unclean Spirit!"]="我要驱逐你！肮脏的邪灵！"
G["I cast you out! Unclean spirit - Begone!"]="我将驱逐你！不洁的灵魂……离开这里！"
G["I caught a big one last week, it had three eyes!"]="我上个星期抓到一个大家伙，它居然有三只眼！"
G["I caught a fish if you are hungry..."]="你饿了吗？我抓了一条鱼……"
G["I cause you no trouble, boss."]="No te causaré problemas, $gjefe:jefa;."
G["I challenge you not to think of hope as a vague and unimaginable future."]="我不赞同你把“希望”看做模糊而且无法想象的未来。"
G["I challenge you to a duel, Scarlet scum!"]="我要和你决斗，先锋军的混蛋！"
G["I challenge you to a fight, Husshun!"]="我想和你交手，胡苏安！"
G["I challenge you to a pet battle! |cFF0008E8(Darkmoon Game Token)|r"]="我想和你进行宠物对战！|cFF0008E8(暗月游戏代币)|r"
G["I challenge you!"]="我要挑战你！"
G["I challenge you, death knight!"]="我要挑战你，死亡骑士！"
G["I challenge you."]="我要向你挑战。"
G["I charge you now with the cleansing of Zul'Drak, Drakuru."]="现在，我命令你去净化祖达克，达库鲁。"
G["I choose the third option: KILLING YOU!"]="我选择第三项：杀了你！"
G["I chose you as my companion for a reason."]="我选你做我的同伴并非无的放矢。"
G["I cleanse thee with holy fire!"]="神圣之火将净化你！"
G["I cleared the way. You should be good to go."]="我把道路清理干净了。你可以出发了。"
G["I come back when we not getting butts kicked."]="等我们的处境安全之后我再回来。"
G["I come for you, puny Alliance!"]="我来啦，弱小的联盟！"
G["I come from the Alliance. We wish to be allies, not enemies."]="我来自联盟。我们希望成为你们的朋友，而不是敌人。"
G["I come from the land down under... where women plague and men sunder."]="我来自底层社会……我们那儿的人民倍受折磨。"
G["I come stocked with a complimentary charge of water, you'll have to find more if you wish to take advantage of my Hydrolizing feature multiple times."]="我已经预存了足够使用一次的水，这是免费赠送的，如果你想反复使用我的水解功能，就需要找到更多的水。"
G["I come to Silithus every year around this time. The weather is phenomenal for my bunions.\n\nYou should take a stroll with me, friend. Enjoy the sights and what not."]="Todos los años, vengo a Silithus en esta temporada. El tiempo es fantástico para mis juanetes.\n\nDeberías dar un paseo conmigo, $gamigo:amiga;. Disfruta del hermoso paisaje."
G["I come to avenge my bruddas, mon!"]="我是来为兄弟们报仇的！"
G["I come to raze your bases, Frost Wolf clan. Ivus punishes you for your treachery!"]="我是来铲平你的基地的，霜狼氏族。你们的背叛将受到伊弗斯的惩罚！"
G["I come with news of our conflict with the Rogue Undead."]="我有一些新的情报……关于我们与那些游荡的亡灵之间的战事。"
G["I come with the yak. If a luckydo is wise enough to buy, I will be wise enough to sell my wares to them."]="我骑牦牛来。如果买幸运符是足够明智的，那么我把物品卖给他们就再好不过了。"
G["I command the elements to destroy you!"]="我命令元素毁灭你！"
G["I command the power of the storm. It sounds impressive, but you wake up with static cling every morning."]="我操纵风暴的力量。这听起来很强大，但我每天早晨醒来的时候，身上总是会窜起一道道静电火花。"
G["I command you to rain fire down upon these invaders!"]="我命令你把这些入侵者烧成灰烬！"
G["I condemn you to death!"]="我判处你们死刑！"
G["I confiscate the corn he has stolen, warn him that stealing is a path towards doom and destruction, but I let him go to return to his family."]="我没收他偷到的玉米，并警告他盗窃是通往毁灭和死亡的道路，但是我会放他走。"
G["I confront the ruler on his malicious behavior, upholding my liege's honor at the risk of any future diplomacy."]="我挑战他的邪恶与蛮横，不惜一切代价捍卫王上的荣耀。"
G["I confused!"]="我糊涂了！"
G["I conquered my doubts, my fears, my anger... I buried all of it within the land."]="我征服了自己的疑虑、恐惧和愤怒……将它们埋入地底。"
G["I consider it a great honor to assist the Lady Proudmoore in her research. She's the most powerful human mage upon Azeroth, you know!\nNow, was there something I might help you with?"]="Considero un honor ayudar a Lady Valiente con su investigación. Es la humana maga más poderosa de todo Azeroth, sabes.\n\nY ahora, ¿puedo ayudarte en algo?"
G["I control the very air you breathe...."]="我操控着你呼吸的空气……"
G["I could be convinced to part with one... IF you'll promise to give the cub a good home."]="如果你发誓好好照顾它的话……我愿意忍痛割爱给你一只。"
G["I could be pickin' this lock in my sleep, mon. Just come an' say when it be safe to get away."]="朋友，我就是闭着眼睛也能打开这把锁。你只需告诉我什么时候能安全逃走就行啦。"
G["I could be pickin' this lock in my sleep. Just come an' say when it be safe to make my escape."]="我睡梦中都能打开这个锁，只要告诉我什么时候能安全逃跑就行。"
G["I could beat all those tonks."]="我一个人就能横扫那些坦克。"
G["I could break through four hardened pine boards using just your forehead.  Want me to demonstrate?"]="我能轻松打断四层强化松木板，只是要借用一下你的脑袋。要我给你做个示范吗？"
G["I could crush you with but a single motion. Do not anger me."]="我只需要动动手指就让你知道我的厉害。不要惹我。"
G["I could eat twenty plates of Charbroiled Tiger Steak and still be looking for more. Thanks, $n."]="我能一口气吃掉20盘碳烤虎肉排，而且还想吃更多。谢谢，$n。"
G["I could get used to livin' like this."]="我可以适应这种生活的。"
G["I could have beat you today you know. All I needed to do was to switch to my \"Ale Stance\" sooner."]="¿Sabes que hoy te podía haber derrotado? Tan solo tenía que haber cambiado al \"Estilo cervecero\" antes."
G["I could have stopped the sea if not for your incessant clucking!"]="要不是因为你总是在咯咯咯的叫，我就能挡住海水！"
G["I could have sworn I had more apples.  Grok!"]="我要是发誓说我有更多苹果就好了。葛罗克！"
G["I could have sworn there were more of you..."]="我发誓你们还会有更多人躺下的……"
G["I could hear the sound of your trident breaking from the gardens! The skulls of these Kvaldir are as strong as rock."]="我在花园里就能听到你的三叉戟折断的声音！那些克瓦迪尔的脑袋就跟岩石一样硬。"
G["I could just close the gates, and then nobody would get in..."]="我们只需要把大门关上，就没有人能进来了……"
G["I could just kiss you!"]="我真想吻你！"
G["I could kiss you.  I'll spare you the shell-breath though."]="我可真想亲你一下。可是算了，还是不要让你被我的口气熏死。"
G["I could never leave an injured friend alone..."]="我总是无法丢下受伤的朋友不管……"
G["I could not bear to sit in Stormwind Keep while my people's blood spills here!\n\nPandaria has so much to teach us. There is great power here. Power that could save thousands of lives.\n\nAnd I aim to find it."]="我无法眼睁睁的看着自己的人民在这里抛洒热血，自己却端坐在暴风要塞里！\n\n潘达利亚能教会我们许多事。这里蕴藏着巨大的力量。足以拯救万千苍生的力量。\n\n而我要做的，就是令这力量得见天日。"
G["I could not have achieved this victory without you. We will speak back at Thunderlord Stronghold."]="要是没有你，我不可能获得这次胜利。我们回雷神要塞之后再说吧。"
G["I could not have done better myself."]="换我自己来也不见得能做得更好了。"
G["I could really go for one of Uncle Gus' jokes about now, this place is scary!"]="我现在真想听古大叔讲笑话，这地方太吓人了！"
G["I could really use a heart. Say, can I have yours?"]="我真的需要一颗心。啊，用你的行吗？"
G["I could really use a papaya."]="我可能需要一颗木瓜。"
G["I could really use a refill on my drink here."]="我真想能再续上一杯。"
G["I could sleep forever, mon...."]="朋友，我要永远沉睡了……"
G["I could swear I just paid a fine like this..."]="我发誓我刚刚才付过一次这样的罚金……"
G["I could use a campfire and some warm food right about now. Are you here with good news?"]="真希望马上能有一堆温暖的营火和一些热饭热菜。有好消息吗？"
G["I could use a drink and some rest myself.  You'll find it right in the northwest corner of Razor Hill.  Say hi to Innkeeper Grosk for me."]="我可以喝点东西，稍事休息。到剃刀岭西北角，替我向旅店管理人罗斯克问声好。"
G["I could use a hand here, $c.\n\nHow 'bout you make yourself useful?"]="$c，我需要帮助。\n\n过来帮帮我怎么样？"
G["I could use a heal, brother!"]="我需要治疗，兄弟！"
G["I could use a hug."]="我很想抱抱你。"
G["I could use a kite to Grookin' Hill."]="我可以乘坐风筝前往古鲁金山。"
G["I could use a kite to Pearlfin Village."]="我要坐风筝前往珠鳍村。"
G["I could use a nap right about now."]="我应该打个盹了。"
G["I could use another emergency buoy, Arie."]="请再给我一个应急浮标，阿林。"
G["I could use some help over here if you please."]="如果你愿意的话，我这里可能需要你的帮助。"
G["I could use some more blood ale to quench my thirst!"]="我需要更多的血啤酒来减缓我的干渴！"
G["I could use the extra money."]="我想赚点外快。"
G["I couldn't agree more."]="完全同意。"
G["I couldn't believe it when they ordered half of us to ship out..."]="我当时真不敢相信他们竟然要让我们一半人出海……"
G["I couldn't have fought them off alone. Now, if you'll excuse me, I should go find my cart."]="我实在没法独自击退那么多敌人。现在，如果你不介意的话，我得去找我的车了。"
G["I couldn't have miscalculated your interest... because we don't give any!  I'd rather pay than be subjected to the trials, so take my personal cash."]="我不会算错该付的利息……因为一分都没有！跟坐牢相比，我宁可付钱——拿去吧。"
G["I couldn't help but notice you from over there. I'm new in town."]="我在那一眼就认出了你，我是新来的。"
G["I couldn't imagine a crueler tyrant. He enslaved this entire continent."]="我想不出比他更残暴的君主了。他奴役了整个大陆。"
G["I couldn't tell ya.  Maybe I've got a low bone density, or a larger-than average lung capacity.  Maybe it's all that cheese I had for lunch.\n\nEither way, this shell is the only thing that's keeping me from rocketing to the surface."]="我也不确定。可能是因为我骨头太轻，或是肺活量异于常人。也许只是因为我中午吃的那块奶酪。\n\n不管怎样，要不是有这壳在，我早就像火箭一样窜出水面了。"
G["I count six... no, seven guards on patrol in the sky."]="我看到六……不，七个守卫在天上巡逻。"
G["I cracked knuckles and got ready for fight.\n|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_gauntlets_05.blp:32|t  |TInterface\\Icons\\inv_inscription_pigment_emerald.blp:32|t"]="Yo hizo krujir los nudillos y me preparó para el kombate.\n|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_gauntlets_05.blp:32|t |TInterface\\Icons\\inv_inscription_pigment_emerald.blp:32|t"
G["I crave your death!"]="我渴望着你的死亡！"
G["I crush joo cockroaches!"]="看我踩碎你们这些蟑螂！"
G["I crush weaklings like you every day!  Bring it on!"]="我厌恶你这样的懦夫！放马过来吧！"
G["I curse the Darkspear!"]="我诅咒暗矛部族！"
G["I dare not create a portal here. The results could be... interesting."]="我不敢在这里开传送门。这么做的后果会……很有趣的。"
G["I dare not touch it. Stand back! Stand back as I attempt to commune with the blade! Perhaps our salvation lies within..."]="我不敢碰它。后退！后退，我要试着和这把剑交谈！也许我们的救赎就在其中……"
G["I dare say I've had enough of this. Time to bring out... THE BEAST WITHIN!"]="我对这一切已经受够了。现在该是让……野兽之心出来的时候了！"
G["I dare you!"]="我看你是不敢吧！"
G["I deal in comfort... Soothe your savage impulse, $r. My inn is your home..."]="放松你的脉搏吧，$r。我的旅店就是你的家……"
G["I decided to give him one more chance. I was not about to give up on family."]="我决定再给他一次机会。我是不会放弃我的家人的。"
G["I decided to keep shrinking the world until I could reach the clouds.\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_helmet_47.blp:32|t"]="我决定继续收缩世界，直到我能摸到那些云彩。\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_helmet_47.blp:32|t"
G["I decided to look around for someone else from the Stormstout family."]="我决定在附近找找其他风暴烈酒家族的人。"
G["I decided to name him Gizmo."]="我给他起名叫吉兹莫。"
G["I decree that you are an enemy of the Ogre clans.  Punishment is death!"]="Decreto que eres $gun enemigo:una enemiga; de los clanes de ogros. ¡El castigo es la muerte!"
G["I defer to your wisdom, brother.  Let us pray we are quick to come to a decision.  The enemy will not wait."]="我服从你的智慧，兄长。让我们祈祷决定能尽快被做出。敌人是不会等待我们的。"
G["I definitely did NOT sign up for this! Pygmies, zombies... Hobart better give me a huge raise!"]="我确定合同里没提过会遇到这种情况！俾格米人，僵尸……这次霍巴特一定要把我晋升到一个足够高的职位才行！"
G["I delight in the irony."]="我会享受这种讽刺。"
G["I deliver the mail to and from Azuremyst, $c. If you need a message delivered, it'll more than likely be routed through me first."]="我是往来于这里和秘蓝岛之间的邮差，$c。如果你有什么消息需要递送，很可能是要交给我来办的。"
G["I demand that you send aid to Stonehearth. Help us with our war and to free Stonefather Oremantle."]="我要你派人前往巨石之炉。帮我们打赢这场仗，把岩幔国王救出来。"
G["I deserve better than this! I am an actor, a performer- not a common dungsweep! For Light's sake, I've performed in the opera at Kharazan!"]="这可不是我应得的待遇！我是一位演员，一位表演者——才不是什么普通的清洁工！看在圣光的份上——我可是在卡拉赞的歌剧院里表演过的！"
G["I deserve no such respect or reverance, druid. I have betrayed my own kind. The illness of this land is my fault."]="我不配受到如此尊重或敬仰，德鲁伊。我背叛了自己的土地。这片土地的疾患都是我的错。"
G["I desire this eternal quintessence, Duke Hydraxis."]="我想要这个永恒精萃，海达克西斯公爵。"
G["I desire to travel by hippogryph."]="我想骑着角鹰兽旅行。"
G["I desire training."]="我需要训练。"
G["I despise all of your kind!"]="我藐视你们这些低等生物！"
G["I destroyed twenty hozen before my capture!"]="我被俘之前，足足干掉了二十个猢狲！"
G["I detect a charge in your paranarbulatric region!  You must have used the Zephyrium Capacitorium lately -- you can't use it again until the charge wears off..."]="我在你的大肠后部区域检测到了电荷！你最近肯定使用过风动电容器……在电荷消失前，你不能再使用它了……"
G["I did and you believed me. Thank you for the information, blood elf. You have helped us more than you could know."]="是啊，而且你相信了我。感谢你的情报，血精灵。你真是帮了我们好大的忙。"
G["I did everything in my power. The whole world was his, he needed only seize it!"]="我准备好了一切，对他而言，整个世界已经唾手可得！"
G["I did it!"]="我做到了！"
G["I did it! I got us back on track!"]="成功了！我成功让我们回到正轨上来了！"
G["I did it, I did it!!!"]="我成功了，我成功了！！！"
G["I did not ask for this!"]="这不是我想要看到的事情！"
G["I did not bring this wretched affliction upon myself, Godfrey. It was a \"gift,\" remember? Now kindly enjoy the \"gift\" and shut up."]="Yo no me he buscado esta endemoniada enfermedad, Godfrey. Fue un \"don\", ¿te acuerdas? Así que disfruta de mi \"don\" y cállate."
G["I did not come here to watch animals tear at each other senselessly, Tirion."]="我到这里来不是为了看野兽们无意义地彼此撕扯，提里奥。"
G["I did not doubt my victory for a moment."]="我片刻也没怀疑过自己的胜利。"
G["I did not doubt you for even one second, $n.\n\nHere are your orders, $n. I know that you will not let me down."]="No he dudado de ti ni un solo segundo, $n.\n\nEstas son tus órdenes, $n. Ahora sé que no me decepcionarás."
G["I did not expect to see $rs in this land. You are certainly welcome here.\n\nPlease, do you have supplies for trade? We are low on an assortment of things."]="我没想到在这里还能看见$r，非常欢迎。\n\n请问，你们有补给进行交易吗？我们这一类的物资比较匮乏。"
G["I did not make this decision lightly, Vol'jin. I know our alliances will suffer for it. I know the Horde will be irreversibly changed. But I made this choice with confidence that Garrosh is exactly what the Horde needs."]="我做出这个决定并不轻松。我知道，我们的盟友将因此承受磨难。部落将发生无可挽回的改变。但我相信，加尔鲁什正是部落现在所需要的人。"
G["I did not mean to deceive you, elder. The draenei of Telredor thought to approach you in a way that would be familiar to you."]="我不是想欺骗您，长者。泰雷多尔的德莱尼人想用一种您熟悉的方式来接近您。"
G["I did not sanction their actions.  Tell her to deal with it."]="我并没有同意他们那样做。让她去解决这件事。"
G["I did not think that help would come. You have given me new hope, stranger."]="No pensaba que recibiríamos ayuda. Me has dado esperanzas, $gforastero:forastera;."
G["I did not wish to lower myself by engaging your kind, but you leave me little choice..."]="我本不想屈尊与你们交战，但是你们让我别无选择……"
G["I did warn you of the dangers of these woods."]="我已经提醒过你，在这片树林里危机四伏。"
G["I did warn you, Wakener."]="我可是警告过你的，唤醒者。"
G["I did warn you. Pity."]="我警告过你了。真遗憾。"
G["I did what I had to, brother. You gave me no alternative."]="我只是尽了我应尽的义务，兄长。你让我别无选择。"
G["I did... my best."]="我……尽力了。"
G["I didn't ask for this!"]="我不愿意这样！"
G["I didn't ask what you want. I asked you to fulfill your oaths sworn to the horde.\n\nWe are at war, $p, in case you forgot.\n\nIn such times, personal interests must take second place to duty."]="我没问你想要什么。我是要你履行对部落立下的誓言。\n\n看来我有必要提醒你，现在是在打仗，$p。\n\n在这种情况下，与责任相比，个人利益必须退居次要地位。"
G["I didn't come all this way from Silvermoon City to toil my life away in a mine!"]="我从银月城来这里，不是为了把我的生命浪费在一个矿洞中！"
G["I didn't come to save your sorry hide, goblin. Did you find fuel or not?"]="我来这里可不是为了救你，地精。发现燃料了没有？"
G["I didn't even break a sweat on that one!"]="我甚至都没有流一滴汗！"
G["I didn't get to be the Shredmaster by putting up with chumps like you!"]="我可不是为了砍倒你这样的木桩子才成为伐木大师的！"
G["I didn't hate that."]="我倒不太恨杀戮。"
G["I didn't know bees didn't like fire!"]="为什么它们不喜欢火？"
G["I didn't know he was getting married! I didn't even know he was dating! That's terrible! He can't work nights anymore!"]="我不知道他已经结婚了！我甚至不知道他的年龄！这太可怕了！他再也不能在晚上工作了！"
G["I didn't know it came in lightning-blue!  AWESOME!!"]="我没想到它竟然还快如闪电！太惊人了！！"
G["I didn't know they could do that."]="他们竟然能做出那样的事。"
G["I didn't like him much anyway. Too much talk, not enough \"do.\""]="无论如何，我不太喜欢他。他总是说得多，做得太少。"
G["I didn't like that pet anyways.  Beshides... People stop by all the time and give me their pets.  If I lost one, it doesn't matter, I've got dozens more to lose!"]="我一直都不喜欢那只宠物。而且……人们总是把他们的宠物给我。就算丢了一只，也没关系。我还有好几十只可以丢呢！"
G["I didn't mean to drag you into this, $n.  Ever since we took on a job to steal Lord Valthalak's spellbook, everyone involved has wound up dead or missing."]="我不是有意拉你下水的，$n。自从我们接受了盗取瓦塔拉克公爵的法术书的任务，每个与此相关的人都重伤至死或是干脆失踪了。"
G["I didn't need him! Not when I've got YOU oafs!"]="有你们这些蠢货，我就不需要他了！"
G["I didn't say Twilight's Hammer. YOU said Twilight's Hammer."]="Yo no he dicho \"Martillo Crepuscular\". TÚ has dicho \"Martillo Crepuscular\"."
G["I didn't see anything."]="我没有看到任何东西。"
G["I didn't see my people die at Mogujia to have you snuff out our only remaining avenue to the Bell."]="我不能眼睁睁看着你毁掉我们寻找圣钟的唯一线索，这可是我的族人在魔古岬拼死战斗才换来的。"
G["I didn't see the Light step in to save my wife and children!"]="圣光没能拯救我的妻子和孩子！"
G["I didn't see who killed 'em, $g bub:lady;, but I got a whiff. Smelled rich, kinda like you. Damn shame too. Furlbrows were a fixture around here. Nice people, always willin' to share a meal or a patch of dirt."]="我没看见是谁杀了他们，$g伙计:女士;，但我嗅到了点儿什么。闻上去像是有钱人的味道，跟你有点儿像。我也感到很遗憾。法布隆一家是这儿的老住户了。他们一家都是好人，总是愿意拿出饭菜或泥土与人分享。"
G["I didn't sign up for this garbage! I coulda been back helping Mekkatorque reclaim Gnomeregan!"]="我可没主动报名来蹚这浑水！我本该回去帮梅卡托克夺回诺莫瑞根！"
G["I didn't sign up for this!"]="我可没有同意做这样的事！"
G["I didn't sign up for this..."]="我可没有为这种事签过字……"
G["I didn't talk to you back in school and I'm sure not going to start now."]="我没有劝你回学校，现在我也不打算这么干。"
G["I didn't think anyone was coming for us."]="我还以为没人会来救我们了。"
G["I didn't think anyone would mind if I didn't stay to help run the faire."]="我想，就算我不留在这里帮忙经营马戏团，别人也不会介意的吧。"
G["I didn't think so.  Now hand me that potion, Krennan... and double the dosage."]="我可不这样想。把那个药剂给我，克雷南……我要双倍剂量。"
G["I didn't think this mission would amount to much, but the blood elves' presence has us all on high alert."]="我原本并不觉得这次的任务有什么了不起的，可血精灵的出现令我们警惕性大增。"
G["I didn't touch it! I promise you!"]="我没动过手脚！我发誓！"
G["I didn't want to do that."]="我不想这样的。"
G["I didn't.  You just told me!"]="我不知道。是你告诉我的！"
G["I didn't... deserve this..."]="为什么会落得……这样的结局……"
G["I die before my task is complete."]="在完成任务前我就丢了性命。"
G["I die doin' what I love!"]="我死得其所！"
G["I die for Hellscream!"]="誓死效忠地狱咆哮！"
G["I die... with honor... Lok'tar Ogar..."]="我……虽死犹荣……Lok'tar Ogar……"
G["I disagree. We cannot underestimate the yaungol's strength."]="我不同意。我们不能低估野牛人的实力。"
G["I discovered this cave on our first day here.  I believe the energy in the stone can be used to our advantage."]="我第一天来这里的时候就发现了这个洞穴。我相信这块石头里的能量对我们大有用处。"
G["I dislike elekks. Strongly."]="我讨厌雷象，非常讨厌。"
G["I do as I must!"]="我必须这么做！"
G["I do believe your grandpa would be very proud of you."]="相信你爷爷一定会为你感到无比骄傲。"
G["I do declare... a moving box.  The engineers have really done it this time!"]="我非常确定……一个移动的盒子。工程师们这次真的做到了！"
G["I do have a mighty roar."]="我咆哮起来是很可怕。"
G["I do have some openings in your line of work.  Report to the civilian liaison."]="我倒是能提供适合你的工作机会。向平民联络官报到吧。"
G["I do hope that the other agents made it. Otherwise, I'll have more work to do."]="但愿其他密探也能挺过来。否则的话，我的负担就更重了。"
G["I do hope they stay alive long enough for me to... introduce myself."]="真希望他们能撑久点儿，至少让我做完……自我介绍。"
G["I do hope you're prepared to feed your pets to mine as a treat."]="希望你已经做好准备，让你的宠物变成我宠物的盘中餐。"
G["I do not believe admiration and wistful thoughts are against the societal norm."]="我不相信赞美与怀旧的思想会与这个社会相抵触。"
G["I do not believe you possess the mental acuity to grasp the nature of portal magic."]="我不认为你具有掌握传送门魔法所必需的潜质。"
G["I do not believe you possess the mental acuity to grasp the nature of portal magic.\n\nHowever, you can use the crystal behind me to teleport to the ruins below Dalaran in Crystalsong Forest."]="凭你的智慧，恐怕无法掌握传送魔法的奥秘。\n\n但是你可以使用我身后的水晶，它能将你传送到达拉然下方，位于晶歌森林的废墟。"
G["I do not deserve such praise, Warlord Goretooth."]="这样的赞扬我可承受不起，高图斯。"
G["I do not enjoy conversation."]="我不喜欢交谈。"
G["I do not fear death at your hands, $r!"]="我不害怕死亡和你的暴行，$r！"
G["I do not fear death."]="我不惧怕死亡。"
G["I do not fear you, $r. You would be wise to fear me..."]="我不怕你，$r。你应该怕我才对……"
G["I do not have all day to fight you.  Challenge me when your skills have improved."]="我可没时间整天跟你打斗。等你的技能提升之后再来挑战我吧。"
G["I do not have much time in this world, but Light willing, it is time enough to fulfill my destiny.  When you face Baron Rivendare, I will be with you."]="我的时间不多了，但是圣光依然照耀着这个世界，它可以帮助我完成我的宿命。当你面对瑞文戴尔男爵时，我便与你同在。"
G["I do not have the knowledge you seek."]="我不具备你想学的知识。"
G["I do not have time to waste, $c; there is a war at Ahn'Qiraj to prepare for. If you are going to help, we are collecting singed corestones from the Molten Core. I need to gather a total of $2110w, and currently have $2109w."]="我可没时间浪费，$c。安其拉之战迫在眉睫。我们正在收集来自熔火之心里面的熔火之石。我需要收集$2110w块，到目前为止已经有$2109w块了，你愿意帮忙吗？"
G["I do not have time to waste, stranger. State your business or be off!"]="No puedo perder el tiempo, $gforastero:forastera;. ¡Expón tus asuntos o lárgate!"
G["I do not judge others by their stature, $r, but by their courage and loyalty."]="我不会根据他们的外表去做出判断，而是根据他们的勇气和忠诚。"
G["I do not know this Eye of the Tiger some speak of, but I can show you how to use the claws of the tiger."]="我不太清楚老虎眼睛的用途，但是我可以教你如何使用老虎爪子。"
G["I do not know what became of them.\n\nThere was a constant flow of captives. Horde and Alliance, both - all barely alive.\n\nThey must've been hauled away beyond the trench, or they have perished."]="我不知道他们发生了什么事。\n\n不断有俘虏出现。部落和联盟的都有——几乎都只剩下一口气。\n\n他们一定是被强行拖到海沟那边去了，不然就只有死路一条。"
G["I do not know what manner of ruse you're attempting, Broken wretch, but I want no part in this!"]="我不知道你在预谋着什么诡计，肮脏的破碎者，但是休想把我卷进去！"
G["I do not know what the ultimate consequences will be. Nobody does."]="我不知道最终会造成什么后果——没人知道。"
G["I do not know what to make of these elves from across the sea. The tauren and elves of this continent have always warred."]="我不知道这些精灵为什么要远涉重洋。这片土地上的牛头人和精灵们永远在打仗。"
G["I do not know what you speak of, dragon... but  I will not be bullied by this display of insolence.  I'll leave Karazhan when it suits me!"]="我不知道你在说什么，龙……但是我不会被你这傲慢的表象吓倒。我想什么时候离开卡拉赞，就什么时候离开卡拉赞！"
G["I do not know who you are, but I thank you. Without your aid, our world would be...I do not wish to think about it. Moon goddess light your path."]="我不知道你是谁……但我要感谢你。没有你的帮助，我们的世界……我不敢想象。愿月神指引你的道路。"
G["I do not know why the mists have opened. But I know that it is for a reason."]="我不知道迷雾为何一分为二，但其中一定有原因。"
G["I do not know, $r.\n\nWe know so little about the Klaxxi. They seem to be quite ruthless, so perhaps your only reward would be a swift death.\n\nThen again, their civilization is quite vast and advanced. If you play your cards right, perhaps they will grant you untold power.\n\nThere is only one way to find out."]="我不知道，$r。\n\n我们对卡拉克西所知甚少。他们看起来非常冷酷无情，你去了恐怕也只能送死。\n\n话说回来，他们的文明非常博大精深。如果你处理得当的话，他们或许会赐予你强大的力量。\n\n要想知道最后的结果，就只有一个办法。"
G["I do not know, Banshee Queen. I suspect that the piece of Arthas that might be left inside the Lich King is all that holds the Scourge from annihilating Azeroth."]="我不知道，女妖之王。我怀疑正是阿尔萨斯残留在巫妖王体内的一缕灵魂阻止了天灾军团彻底毁灭艾泽拉斯。"
G["I do not know, Jaina. I suspect that the piece of Arthas that might be left inside the Lich King is all that holds the Scourge from annihilating Azeroth."]="我不知道，吉安娜。我怀疑正是阿尔萨斯残留在巫妖王体内的一缕灵魂阻止了天灾军团彻底毁灭艾泽拉斯。"
G["I do not know, child."]="我也没有答案，孩子。"
G["I do not know, sentinel. What I sense is dark magic. Pure evil."]="我不知道，哨兵。我唯一能感受到的就是黑暗魔法的气息。绝对的邪恶。"
G["I do not like the look of that troll. Be careful!"]="我讨厌那个巨魔的样子。小心！"
G["I do not like the taste of this magic."]="我不喜欢这种魔法的味道。"
G["I do not like these human cities of stone and steel. I would prefer the forests of Ashenvale, tracking great beasts. But my dear brother, Kaerbrus, felt it would be beneficial to train the humans in our ways. So while I honor him and offer my services, I do not have to like it."]="说老实话，我并不喜欢人类的那种用冰冷的石头和钢铁铸造起来的城市。我还是喜欢待在灰谷，过着自由自在的生活。但是我亲爱的兄弟凯尔布鲁斯认为向人类传授我们的追踪技巧对大家都有好处。所以，你瞧，我在这里为人类提供训练服务，但这并不意味着我就得喜欢这份工作。"
G["I do not like this place, $r. There is something strange about it."]="我不喜欢这个地方，$r。这里有点诡异。"
G["I do not offer apprentice training. Look for the tauren Waldor in the Wailing Caverns, here in the Barrens. He can assist you with whatever you need."]="我不会给一个学徒训练。去贫瘠之地的哀嚎洞穴找牛头人瓦多尔吧，他会帮助你的。"
G["I do not possess any proof, Cyrus."]="塞勒斯，我没有任何证据。"
G["I do not require defending, ambassador. Young one, as I have told the warchief, my loyalties have never been in doubt."]="我无须辩护，大使。年轻人，就跟我告诉酋长的一样，我的忠诚从来没动摇过。"
G["I do not see any rainbows today. Do you?"]="我今天却没看见彩虹。你呢？"
G["I do not see how this evil artifact is relevant to the undead. We must destroy it!"]="我不知道这个邪恶的东西会跟亡灵有什么关系。我们必须摧毁它！"
G["I do not see the warrior's spirit within you, child.  I have no teachings which would benefit a $c such as yourself."]="No veo el espíritu del guerrero en ti. No tengo enseñanzas que puedan servir a $gun:una; $c como tú."
G["I do not sense lies in your voice, Akama.  That Kael'thas would betray me does not come as a big surprise - I'm not as oblivious as some would think. That one of your own was involved with him puts your loyalties into question."]="看来你没有撒谎，阿卡玛。凯尔萨斯的背叛并没有让我感到多么吃惊，我并没有某些家伙所想的那样健忘。你的同族与他有重大的牵连，这让我不得不质疑你的忠诚。"
G["I do not think enough attention is being paid to those trolls.  They could swarm in here anytime."]="我不觉得那些巨魔们已经被妥善“关照”了，他们可以在任何时候涌过来把我们全都踏平。"
G["I do not trust you enough to speak of such things.\n\nYou must respect the trials our people have endured, the burdens we have borne...\n\nPerhaps, if you were to bring great honor to Dun Niffelem, I would be inclined to share with you the knowledge of our people."]="我对你的信任还不够，抱歉不能将如此重要的信息透露给你。\n\n你必须尊重我们接受的考验以及我们背负的重担……\n\n如果你能为丹尼芬雷带来荣耀的话，我或许会考虑与你分享我们的知识。"
G["I do not trust you, $r."]="我不信任你，$r。"
G["I do not understand the significance of the Forsaken burning a great wicker effigy each night, but our own rituals must seem just as strange to them."]="被遗忘者每晚都会焚毁一个巨大的稻草人，真不明白这样做的意义何在，不过我们的仪式在他们眼中应该也很奇怪。"
G["I do not understand this fruit vendor or their ogre.  It seemed as though war was upon us... Yet nothing has happened."]="我真搞不懂这个水果贩子和那些食人魔佣兵。我们之间似乎要爆发战争……但什么都没有发生。"
G["I do not understand."]="我不明白。"
G["I do not understand. How could I lose?"]="我想不明白。我怎么会输？"
G["I do not wish to make an event of this.  Such frivolities are expensive and merely serve our vanity.  But if you wish to have a celebration..."]="我不希望大肆张扬。如此轻率的举动代价高昂，而且仅仅能满足我们的虚荣心而已。但如果你希望庆祝一下的话……"
G["I do not! YOU are the one who forgets my husband is one of the captives."]="我没有忘！是你忘了，我丈夫也在被俘者当中。"
G["I do seem to have mistakenly come into possesion of some artifacts from Uldum. Perhaps the Reliquary is interested in those?"]="我貌似确实不小心和某些奥丹姆发掘出的神器有过那么一些关联。难道神圣遗物学会对那些东西有兴趣？"
G["I do so enjoy sitting out here, listening to the sounds of the Great Sea.  Oh, what?  Yes, there is a ship that will take you to Menethil Harbor.  It docks here from time to time."]="我确实很喜欢坐在这里，听着大海的声音。哦，什么？是的，有一艘船会把你带到米奈希尔港。它有时会停在这里。"
G["I do so hope these... Argent Dawn manage things here.  I would hate to sully my robe on demon rabble!"]="我的确希望这些……银色黎明可以管理这里的日常事务。我讨厌那些恶魔杂碎们弄脏我的长袍！"
G["I do something bad? I sorry...."]="我做错事了？对不起……"
G["I do what I must for Lordaeron, and neither your words nor your actions will stop me."]="为了洛丹伦，我会竭尽所能，无论是你的言论还是行为，都无法阻止我。"
G["I do what I must."]="我必须这么做。"
G["I do what I must. Please forgive me, noble soldiers."]="我别无选择。请原谅我，高贵的战士们……"
G["I do what me can to train you in the priestly ways, if that what you be here for."]="如果这就是你来此的目的，我们会尽一切可能训练你，帮助你成为真正的牧师。"
G["I do!"]="我想！"
G["I do, Chi-Ji."]="是的，赤精。"
G["I do, for I wield the sword!"]="是我，因为我拿着剑！"
G["I do."]="我愿意。"
G["I do. $n has just returned with it. What of the grimoire?"]="是的。$n刚刚带着它回来。魔典怎么样了？"
G["I do. $n just returned with it, but how do I know you're going to keep your end of the bargain?"]="没错。$n刚把它送了回来，但我怎么能肯定你一定会信守诺言呢？"
G["I do. The way to defeat Fear is to look it straight in the eye, unblinking, unwavering."]="我做的到。战胜恐惧的方法便是直视它，坚定不移，毫不动摇。"
G["I documented some special schematics in my journal, but it's gone missin'. We'll just hafta make do."]="我在日记里记了一些特殊的图表，可我把日记弄丢了。我们就凑合着用吧。"
G["I don' know why the spirits be rejectin' us so."]="真不知道那些灵魂为什么要如此排斥我们。"
G["I don' know, $r. Dis big vegetables don' seem right, mon. How can dey just eat dem like it's nuddin'? Where is all dey MEAT?"]="我不知道，$r。这么大的蔬菜看起来不对劲，武僧。他们怎么可以跟没事儿似的吃这种东西？怎么看不到肉呢？"
G["I don' wanna die in a fire, mon."]="我不想死在火里，朋友。"
G["I don't admit this lightly, but you are a far better smith than I am. If you want to learn more than my meager teachings then I suggest you seek out a Dwarf named Therum Deepforge in Stormwind. You will find him in the Dwarven District."]="Me cuesta reconocerlo, pero eres mucho mejor $gherrero:herrera; que yo. Si quieres aprender algo más que mis exiguas enseñanzas te sugiero buscar a un enano llamado Therum Forjahonda en Ventormenta. Lo encontrarás en el Distrito de los Enanos."
G["I don't agree with your turning to alchemy to fix some of the problems, but I do agree with the results. Very well done."]="我不同意你用炼金术去解决这些问题，但我对结果感到满意。你干得很好。"
G["I don't approve of your experiments, Gerard, but I must admit the results are impressive. What exactly did you do to her?"]="杰勒德，我不赞成你的试验，但是我承认结果是令人印象深刻的。你到底对她作了什么？"
G["I don't be hearin' de whispers no more, $n. What happened in de cave?"]="我听不见低语声了，$n。洞里发生了什么事？"
G["I don't be worryin' 'bout no Lich Kings. Seen a lotta big-shots come and go, dey always messin' somethin' up. It ain't long aftah that when a posse rolls on through and sends dem quick on dey way to da history books. Dis one ain't no different."]="我一点都不担心巫妖王。我见过无数的大人物沉沉浮浮，他们喜欢把事情搞得一团糟。但是每当人民站起来反抗时，他们很快就会偃旗息鼓，沦为历史课本上的教程。巫妖王也不会例外。"
G["I don't believe it!"]="难以置信！"
G["I don't believe it! Alliance colors!"]="难以置信！是联盟的颜色！"
G["I don't believe it! I seared the life from your body!"]="我不相信！我本已将你的生命烧干了！"
G["I don't believe my eyes... Is dat Bloodlord Mandokir?  Dis gonna be bad..."]="我不敢相信我的眼睛……那是血领主曼多基尔吗？这可糟了……"
G["I don't believe that is part of our contract. We are done here."]="我想我们的契约里不包括这个。到此为止吧。"
G["I don't blame you for wanting to get out of here. Go up topside and head north of the ruins. The zeppelins leave from the two towers there."]="你想离开这，这我不怪你。先到最顶层，然后朝废墟的北面走。坐上两座塔那的地精飞艇就可以离开了。"
G["I don't care about the shell, just get the internal parts!"]="我不要外壳，我要内部的零件！"
G["I don't care about your war, Crowley."]="我对你的战争不感兴趣，克罗雷。"
G["I don't care how fancy your gear is, $n, if you don't take care of your feet then you're finished. So give those pups a break and use my portal to instantly travel back the entrance."]="我不管你的装备有多好，$n，如果不注意脚下，那你就死定了。让那些小崽子们休息一下，用我的传送门立即返回入口处吧。"
G["I don't care how low the success rate here is. If we save even one worgen from the madness and savagery of the woods, our struggles are not in vain."]="我不在乎成功率会有多低。只要我们能从这丛林的疯狂与凶残中救出一只狼人，我们的努力就都没有白费。"
G["I don't care how many times I have to kill you...I'll take you all on to save this land!"]="我不在乎我得把你杀死多少回……为了救这片土地，我可以拿去你们所有人的生命！"
G["I don't care how short you are or how proportionally large and heavy these crates are, get them below decks."]="我不管你有多矮，也不管这些箱子对你来说有多大多重，把它们弄到甲板下面去。"
G["I don't care if I die inside this husk, $n.  I'll pay these naga back for every one of my fellow soldiers they've killed or enslaved!\n\nThe others can worry about escape.  I'll worry about doling out punishment to these snakes."]="我不在乎自己是否会死在这儿，$n。我要让这些纳迦为我们每一个被杀死或奴役的同胞付出代价！\n\n就让其它人去烦恼该如何逃生吧。我要考虑的是该怎么让这些魔鬼受到惩罚。"
G["I don't care to hear it, $n. Nope, no way are you going to be let into the Searing Gorge. Impossible. Not going to happen. How many times do I have to tell you - I can't let you in! Do you not speak Common? Are you an orc in disguise? N-O. NO!\n\nIf I let you in, then I have to let everybody in. Pretty soon your close friends will want in, then their distant relatives, then their friends, and so on and so forth. The last time that happened... well, we won't talk about the last time it happened.\n\nI will NOT open that gate!"]="我并不在乎听到这些，$n。你别想进入灼热峡谷，别想。这种事绝不会发生。我必须告诉你多少次，我不会让你进去！难道你不懂人话吗？难道你是伪装的兽人吗？不，绝不！\n\n如果我随便让你进去。用不了多久，你的朋友们也会想进去，然后是他们的远亲，他们的朋友，他们远亲的朋友，朋友的远亲。上次发生这种事……我们可不会讨论上次这种事发生时的情形。\n\n我是不会开门的！"
G["I don't care to hear it, $n. Nope, no way are you going to be let into the Searing Gorge. Impossible. Not going to happen. How many times do I have to tell you - I can't let you in! Do you not speak common? Are you an orc in disguise? N-O. NO!\n\nIf I let you in, then I have to let everybody in. Pretty soon your close friends will want in, then their distant relatives, then their friends, and so on and so forth. The last time that happened... well, we won't talk about the last time it happened."]="No me importa lo que digas, $n. Nada de eso, de ninguna manera te dejaré entrar en la Garganta de Fuego. Es imposible, Ni hablar. ¿Cuántas veces te lo tengo que decir? ¡No puedo dejar que entres allí! ¿No entiendes mi idioma? ¿Eres un orco disfrazado? N-O. ¡NO!\n\nSi te dejo entrar, entonces tendré que dejarlos entrar a todos. Muy pronto tus amigos más cercanos querrán entrar, luego tus familiares lejanos, sus amigos etc., etc. La última vez que eso ocurrió... bueno, mejor no hablar de la última vez que ocurrió."
G["I don't care what it's for! Is it going to get this door open?"]="我才不在乎它有什么用呢，它能打开这道门吗？"
G["I don't care what you say. If that $c is here to help us, I say we welcome $g him : her; with arms wide open!"]="Tú dirás lo que quieras. ¡Si $gese:esa; $c ha venido a ayudarnos, yo digo que le demos la bienvenida y $glo:la; recibamos con los brazos abiertos!"
G["I don't care who you are or what you do outside of the Skyguard, but while you're here you will do as you're told."]="我不关心你是谁，或是你在天空卫队以外做些什么。不过只要你在这里，你就要听从我的命令。"
G["I don't care! I'M KILLING EVERYTHING ON BOARD! Move it, grunts!"]="我不管！甲板上的一个不留！动手吧，弟兄们！"
G["I don't deserve something as nice as that. I suppose you're going to insist."]="我不值得拥有这么好的东西。我想你会坚持。"
G["I don't eat pork..."]="我可不吃猪肉……"
G["I don't even have my gear on!"]="我都还没穿装备！"
G["I don't even know how to fish! Can you teach me?"]="我根本不会钓鱼！你能教我吗？"
G["I don't even know how to use this weapon... but I reckon if I stand here looking menacing, the worgen might go somewhere else."]="我甚至不知道该如何使用这件武器……但我相信，如果我摆出一副凶恶的样子，那些狼人也许就会逃到别的地方去。"
G["I don't even want to think about what'll happen here if $n ever decides not to come back."]="我简直不敢想象，如果$n决定不再回来的话，这里将会变成什么样子。"
G["I don't ever want to smell unwashed trogg again!"]="我再也不想闻到穴居人身上几百年没洗的臭味了！"
G["I don't feel so good..."]="感觉有点不对劲…"
G["I don't get it! Are ya blind? Can ya not see the demons bangin' on our door? Who am I gonna send out to talk to your shaman friends? Point 'em out!"]="我不明白！你瞎了吗？你没看到恶魔们正在攻击我们的大门吗？我能派谁出去和你的萨满朋友谈话？告诉我！"
G["I don't get many visitors this deep in the Plaguewood.  Abominations, mostly.\n\nCan I help you with something?"]="在病木林深处很少会有访客。通常都是憎恶。\n\n我能帮你什么忙吗？"
G["I don't get many visitors.  You're looking for something specific, yes?"]="我很少有访客。你在寻找某种特殊的东西，是吗？"
G["I don't get paid enough for this bull excrement!"]="做这种事情才得到这么点报酬，亏大了！"
G["I don't get paid enough for this nonsense."]="给我的报酬太少了。"
G["I don't get paid enough for this!"]="才这么点报酬，真亏！"
G["I don't get too many Leatherworkers in here looking for training, but I guess I could teach you something if you're ready."]="Aquí no vienen demasiados peleteros para recibir instrucción, pero supongo que puedo enseñarte algo si estás $gpreparado:preparada;."
G["I don't get too many Skinners in here looking for training, but I guess I could teach you something if you're ready."]="No suelo recibir a muchos desolladores aquí buscando instrucción, pero supongo que puedo enseñarte algo si estás $gpreparado:preparada;."
G["I don't get too many cooks in here looking for training, but I guess I could teach you something if you're ready."]="Aquí no vienen demasiados cocineros para recibir instrucción, pero supongo que puedo enseñarte algo si estás $gpreparado:preparada;."
G["I don't get why so many other monks throw kegs around.  So wasteful."]="我不知道为啥这么多武僧都把酒桶乱扔。真浪费。"
G["I don't give a damn what Shaffar's ethereals have placed over the entrance to the Mana-Tombs. You will work until those wards are removed and the Consortium can move in safely and take what's rightfully ours!"]="我不管沙法尔的虚灵在法力陵墓的入口放了什么东西。你要一直工作，直到那些防护被除掉，那样星界财团就能安全地拿回属于自己的东西！"
G["I don't have all day to wait out here for that message. There are things that Dame Auriferous has tasked me with seeing to!"]="我不能在这里干等一整天。奥莉菲洛丝夫人还指派了很多任务给我呢。"
G["I don't have all day, pal!"]="我可没时间陪你，伙计！"
G["I don't have enough mana! Oh no!"]="我的法力值不够了！噢，不！"
G["I don't have much time for idle talk, $N. I've got to get this bridge rebuilt before the rains come. I've finished every project on-time and under budget and I'm not about to start slipping now."]="No tengo mucho tiempo para charlas inútiles, $N. Tengo que reconstruir este puente antes de que lleguen las lluvias. He terminado cada proyecto a tiempo y por debajo del presupuesto y no pienso empezar a fallar ahora."
G["I don't have that many cats, right? I mean, it's quite reasonable when you think about it."]="我的猫也没那么多，不是吗？我意思是，这么想还是说得过去的。"
G["I don't have the Repaired Diving Gear anymore. Do you have a spare?"]="我的潜水设备弄丢了，你还有备用的吗？"
G["I don't have the big beer belly. I need a big beer belly. All right. I'm workin' on it!"]="我没有大啤酒肚。我需要一个大啤酒肚。好吧。说做就做！"
G["I don't have the shackles key."]="我没有用来打开锁铐的钥匙。"
G["I don't have time for chit-chat, Lou. Take me to Scalawag Point."]="我没功夫和你闲聊，洛伊。带我去无赖港。"
G["I don't have time for idle chitchat. I have men and women to train, and a tower to watch."]="我没有时间来闲聊了。我有很多人需要训练，还有一座塔需要看管。"
G["I don't have time for idle gossip, I'm a professional!"]="我可没时间闲谈，我是个专业人士！"
G["I don't have time for this!  Warden, what happened?!"]="我没有时间跟你玩！监护者，到底发生了什么事？！"
G["I don't have time for this! Speak or die!"]="我没时间和你耗！不说就去死吧！"
G["I don't have time for this, lieutenant.  Make sure that you handle it."]="我没有时间，中尉。你去把它搞定。"
G["I don't have time for this. Move your ass or I'll move it for you."]="我没时间跟你废话。自己挪动屁股，别等我动手帮你。"
G["I don't have time right now. I need to get ready to meet an important student soon."]="No tengo tiempo en este momento. Necesito prepararme para reunirme con un estudiante importante muy pronto."
G["I don't have time to babysit! Go talk to me assistant, Uthrar!"]="我可没时间跟小孩子耗!去跟我的助手阿斯拉谈谈!"
G["I don't have time to talk right now."]="我现在没时间和你闲聊。"
G["I don't have to be a fortune-telling imp to know the answer to that one - NO!"]="No hay que ser un diablillo advino para saber que la respuesta es \"no\"."
G["I don't have to listen to your guff, mister!"]="我没有义务来听你胡扯，先生！"
G["I don't have to take this. I'll be part of no Alliance that has a Firebeard innit. That's me final word!"]="我不必接受这个。有焰须归附的联盟和我将无半点儿干系。我的话到此为止！"
G["I don't have to wory about getting sunburned out here."]="至少在这里我就不用担心被晒伤了。"
G["I don't hear that crazy troll yelling any longer.  Music to my ears!"]="我再也听不见那疯子巨魔的叫喊声了。真是耳根清净啊！"
G["I don't know about this \"Alliance\", but you look trustworthy. I'll gather everyone up and meet you when we're ready to rebuild!"]="No sé qué pensar de esa \"Alianza\", pero tú me transmites confianza. ¡Voy a reunir a todo el mundo! ¡Nos vemos cuando estemos listos para la reconstrucción!"
G["I don't know about this \"Horde\", but you look trustworthy. I'll gather everyone up and meet you when we're ready to rebuild!"]="No sé qué pensar de esa \"Horda\", pero tú me transmites confianza. ¡Voy a reunir a todo el mundo! ¡Nos vemos cuando estemos listos para la reconstrucción!"
G["I don't know about this… I've been practicing for so long but I still feel like its my first day. This is hopeless…"]="No sé qué pensar… He estado practicando tanto tiempo pero sigo sintiendo que es como si fuera mi primer día. Esto no tiene remedio…"
G["I don't know about you guys, but that clam meat helmet for turning in ten pearls is looking mighty good!"]="我不认识你们，但是用10颗珍珠换那个蚌壳头盔似乎很合算！"
G["I don't know about you, $n, but I for one do not intend to be marooned on this island forever!\n\nIf only I'd stayed at the academy and learned how to use teleport magic...."]="我不了解你，$n，但我可不打算被永远困在这座岛上！\n\n如果我那时留在学院里，学会该如何使用传送魔法……"
G["I don't know about you, but I really miss the unlimited raw materials that were down in the ruins!\n\nI'm not even sure if I could make a dud grenade out of the little that can be scrounged in this cave!"]="我不知道你怎么想，可我真的很想念下面废墟里那些取之不尽的原料！\n\n就凭我们在这洞里找到的少得可怜的材料，我甚至都不知道能不能造出一颗哑弹！"
G["I don't know about you, pal, but I can't breathe water."]="我不知道你怎么样，老兄，可我不能在水下呼吸。"
G["I don't know and I don't care."]="不知道，我也不关心。"
G["I don't know anything about a cult! Please let me get back to work..."]="我对教派一无所知！快放我回去工作吧……"
G["I don't know how long I've been watching over the camp..."]="我也不知道自己已经守护这营地有多久了……"
G["I don't know how much longer I can hold on!"]="我不知道自己还能撑多久！"
G["I don't know how much longer I'll be open today with all the commotion outside. If you need something repaired, I'll take a quick look."]="整座城市都陷入了骚乱，我不知道今天还能营业多久。如果你要修理东西的话，我可以尽快帮你处理。"
G["I don't know how these fireworks work, but they sure are pretty!"]="我不知道这些烟花的工作原理，但它们真的很漂亮！"
G["I don't know how they do it...  those mailboxes must be magic portals or something.  Why I see people gathered around the mailbox next to the bank all day pulling swords and shields and various armor all from that small box!"]="我不知道他们是怎么做到的……这些邮箱一定是传送门之类的东西。为什么人们整天都聚集在银行旁边的邮箱那儿，从小小的邮箱中不断地取出剑、盾牌和各种护甲！"
G["I don't know how they found a way up from underneath, but I can't seal the hatch until they're off of me!"]="我不知道他们是怎样从下面上来的。但如果不将他们击退，我就没办法把这个缺口封住！"
G["I don't know how we did it, but we managed to fend off those hozen.\n\nThanks to you, mate."]="我不知道我们是怎么做到的，可我们确实抵挡住了那些猢狲。\n\n谢谢你，伙计。"
G["I don't know how, but the blade has chosen you to be its new wielder. Take it with my blessing, and wield it against the Scourge as I once did."]="我说不清楚，但这把剑已经认定你是它的新主人。请带上我的祝福，像我一样去血战天灾军团！"
G["I don't know if I can compete! Everyone is so much bigger!"]="我都不知道自己有没有得打！他们的块头比我大多了！"
G["I don't know if I can make it. Please help me..."]="我不知道我能不能坚持下来。帮帮我……"
G["I don't know if it's good to have my mind back.\n\nKnowing what I know... Knowing what may happen to our world...\n\n<He shudders and falls silent.>"]="不知恢复神智是不是件好事。\n\n我所知道的一切……也许即将发生在这世界上的一切……\n\n<他战栗着陷入了沉默。>"
G["I don't know much about art... but I know what I like!"]="我不太懂艺术……但是我知道自己喜欢什么！"
G["I don't know much about dragons, but a big, scary one showed up one day just over yonder, near the entrance to the Caverns of Time.  He kept yelling something about...what was it...the end of time as we know it?  I wasn't really paying much attention."]="我对龙没什么研究，可有一天，突然有一只又大又可怕的龙出现在那边——就在时光之穴入口附近。他不停的叫嚷着……说什么来着……我们所知的时间尽头？我还真没怎么注意听。"
G["I don't know much about magic, but there's a mage named Zaldimar who is staying at the Lion's Pride Inn that could probably assist you."]="我对魔法知之甚少，但是在狮王之傲有一个名叫扎尔迪玛的法师，他也许能帮助你。"
G["I don't know nothin' bout no forgemaster.  Now tell me where this safe place you came from is!"]="我不认识什么铸炉之主。快告诉我你是从什么安全的地方来的？"
G["I don't know nothing! Ask the others."]="我什么都不知道！去问别人吧。"
G["I don't know of one of those around here.  Your best bet is to go to Orgrimmar to the north and speak to one of their grunts."]="据我所知，附近没有这些训练师。你最好去北方的奥格瑞玛看看，去问问那儿的守卫。"
G["I don't know that cub."]="我没见过这个孩子。"
G["I don't know what Blackmoore sees in you. For my money you're just another ignorant savage!"]="我不知道布莱克摩尔为什么看中你，在我看来你只不过是个愚蠢的兽人！"
G["I don't know what I was thinking, going out without my sword. I would've put it on if I'd seen it here..."]="我不知道我在想什么，竟然没拿剑就出去了。如果我看到它在这里，我就会带上它了……"
G["I don't know what I would have done without you.  It's good that you came."]="没有你我肯定无法做到这些。你来得太及时了。"
G["I don't know what I'm doing here. I have no experience as a contract negotiatior.\n\nI used to serve drinks for a living, but Daisy put me out of business. Time for a new career, I guess."]="我不知道我在这儿干什么。我没有做合约谈判员的经验。\n\n我以前曾经干过酒保，可因为黛西的原因做不下去了。也许是时候转行了。"
G["I don't know what brought you into the Forbidden Jungle, but I am glad it did. You saved us from slavery... or worse."]="我不知道你为什么会来禁忌之林，但我很高兴你来了。要不是你，我们可能已经成了奴隶……或者更糟。"
G["I don't know what came over me. Thank you for clearing my head."]="我不知道我刚才怎么了。谢谢你让我变得清醒。"
G["I don't know what could be takin' the young prince so long, but I don't think we can hold out for much longer. The cold is gettin' to some of the soldiers."]="不知道王子殿下究竟是被什么事给耽搁了，但是我们真的坚持不了太久了。许多士兵都无法忍受如此严寒的气候。"
G["I don't know what happened. I had just arrived at Venomspite and then all of a sudden I woke up in this cage!\n\nAre you here to rescue me?"]="我根本不知道出了什么状况。我刚到怨毒镇没多久，就突然在睡梦中被关进了牢笼！\n\n你是来救我的吗？"
G["I don't know what he's trying to catch there, but Armand Cromwell is on the dock in the Magic Quarter."]="我不知道阿曼德·克伦威尔在试图追赶什么，不过他已经到了魔法区的码头。"
G["I don't know what smells worse: Your feet or a dung-filled cheese and fish fillet."]="我不知道是什么闻起来更糟糕一些，是你的脚呢，还是一堆充满奶酪和鱼肉的粪便？"
G["I don't know what they put in those kegs, but it goes down like honey!"]="我不知道他们给那些酒桶里放了什么，但闻起来很香甜！"
G["I don't know what to think of your kind yet, $r.  Some of you can be violent and kill sporelings on sight.\n\nYou seem friendly... though maybe a little bit funny looking, I suppose."]="我不知道该怎么看待你们这些$r。你们中的一些人可能会粗暴地杀害所有他所看到的孢子人。\n\n你看起来还算友好……尽管有点可笑。我希望如此。"
G["I don't know what you're talking about, elf, and I don't appreciate you pokin' around in my business!"]="¡No sé de qué estás hablando, $gelfo:elfa; y no me gusta que andes husmeando en mi negocio!"
G["I don't know what'll be in it yet.  Pat Nagle and Michael Backus need to discuss this first..."]="我不知道这里面有什么。Pat Nagle和Michael Backus需要先就这个讨论一下……"
G["I don't know what's come over me. My heart feels as hot as new steel."]="我不知道自己是怎么了，我的心就像新铸成的钢条一样炽热！"
G["I don't know what's going on around here - it's like everyone has gone crazy!\n\nPlease, can you help?"]="我不知道这里究竟发生了什么事——似乎所有人都疯了！\n\n拜托了，你能帮帮忙吗？"
G["I don't know when we'll see Daddy again, Jimmy, but I know he loves you and he misses you very much."]="吉米，我也不知道我们何时才能与你爸爸重逢。但你要知道，他爱你，无时无刻都在思念你。"
G["I don't know where the grand admiral is. Go to hell!"]="我不知道元帅的下落。你去死吧！"
G["I don't know where you came from, but if you'll continue to stand up for justice as you have done today, you'll be welcome in Pandaria.\n\nThank you."]="No sé de dónde has salido, pero si sigues defendiendo la justicia como lo has hecho hoy, serás $gbienvenido:bienvenida; en Pandaria."
G["I don't know where you've gone to.  But I can assure you that wherever that is, I will find you and the crystal, Culuthas!"]="我不知道你到底去哪了。但我可以保证，无论你在哪里，我都会找到你和那颗水晶，库鲁萨斯！"
G["I don't know which is worse, getting eaten by fel orcs or working for that slave master Razelcraz! Oh well, thanks anyways!"]="我不知道是被邪兽人吃掉更糟呢，还是为拉泽克拉兹工作更糟？不管怎么样，还是谢谢你！"
G["I don't know who you are, but I'll defend this shrine with my life. Leave, now, before we come to blows."]="我不知道你是谁，但我会用生命来保卫这座圣殿。在我动手之前离开吧。"
G["I don't know who you are, but you have my gratitude."]="我不知道你是谁，但我对你感激不尽。"
G["I don't know why I put up with his nonsense.  He never takes anything seriously."]="我不知道为什么要容忍他。他从来没有对一件事认真过。"
G["I don't know why he won't listen to me!  I'm just trying to explain how to make his noodles even better."]="我也不知道他为什么就不肯听我的！我只想告诉他怎么才能把面条做得更好吃。"
G["I don't know why people treat me like a little kid!"]="我不明白为什么其他人总是把我当小孩子对待！"
G["I don't know why the Forsaken burn a wicker man every night of Hallow's End instead of a real one, but it's their holiday."]="万圣节期间，被遗忘者每晚都会焚毁一个稻草人。真不明白他们为什么不烧真人，不过这大概是他们的节日传统吧。"
G["I don't know why the door is closed, heroes. My pack should have already taken care of Godfrey by now..."]="我不知道为什么这扇门关上了，英雄们。我的狼群现在应该已经干掉高弗雷了……"
G["I don't know why, but those monsters are going out of their way to keep our men alive..."]="我不知道原因，但那些怪物在想方设法让我们的人活下来……"
G["I don't know, Bailey... it's not so bad. We could throw a rock at the tools from here."]="我觉得，拜雷……似乎没有那么糟糕吧。你瞧，从我们现在的位置扔石头，是能砸到工具的。"
G["I don't know, I've got a bad feeling. It's way too quiet in there."]="不知道，但我的感觉不太好。那边有点太安静了。"
G["I don't know, and that worries me. I'll do everything I can to find the Infinites.\n\nWhat I need you to do now is stay close to Arthas by joining his army."]="No lo sé y eso me preocupa. Haré todo lo que pueda para encontrar a los Infinitos.\n\nAhora necesito que te unas al ejército de Arthas para mantenerte cerca de él."
G["I don't know, but I'm glad they did. The respite has allowed Anchorite Elbadon to save many of the men and women under my command. I've sent a few of my stealthiest scouts forward, and they've reported back something interesting. Nearly all of the Sunblade Protectors are powered down! Kil'jaeden's forces appear to be conserving their energy, and seem content to merely contain us with one active Protector. If you and your companions want to force your way inside, allow me to suggest a plan of attack."]="不知道，但我对这个结果表示庆幸。他们行动上的迟缓使我有机会派出学者埃尔巴顿救下了许多小队成员。我又派出了一些擅长潜行和匿踪的斥候进去侦察了一下，他们带回了一些很有意思的消息。据说，所有的炎刃保卫者都停止运作了！基尔加丹的军队大概不想浪费它们的能量，只启动了一台炎刃保卫者用于对付我们。如果你和你的朋友想突入其中的话，就请允许我先制订一个进攻计划。"
G["I don't know, but they're big and they're pissed!"]="我不知道，我只知道他们体型魁梧，性情狂暴！"
G["I don't know, dear."]="我不知道，亲爱的。"
G["I don't know, how many?"]="我不知道，要多少？"
G["I don't know, maybe the grass really is greener on the other side. You know? Krakauer and Danforth really kick butt as warriors. Maybe I should drop this paladin thing and try out being a warrior."]="我不知道，也许对岸的草真的更绿些？你明白吗？卡拉克尔和丹弗斯真是一流的战士。也许我也该放弃这圣骑士的身份，考虑转行做战士。"
G["I don't know, survival of his race, visions of the future, valiant deeds, blah, blah, blah."]="我不知道，也许是为了种族的生存，未来的愿景，英勇的事迹之类的东西吧。"
G["I don't know.\n\nDon't hit me!"]="我不知道。\n\n别打我！"
G["I don't know. Better kill them both to be on the safe side!"]="我不知道。为了安全起见，最好将他们统统杀掉！"
G["I don't know. I am uncertain this is the proper vehicle to heroism."]="我不知道。我不确定这坐骑能带我们走向辉煌。"
G["I don't know. I think I'm going to miss this place. We had some pretty good times here."]="我不知道。我想我会想念这里的。我们在这儿共度了不少美好时光。"
G["I don't know. It still seems like such a waste."]="也许吧。但它始终看上去很浪费。"
G["I don't know... I just am!"]="我不知道……我就是饿！"
G["I don't know... still got a bad feeling about this yeti being here...\n\nSometimes I catch her just... staring at me."]="我不知道……把这个雪人带到这里来还是让我有一种不祥的预感……\n\n有时候我发现她在……盯着我看。"
G["I don't like how it's looking at the pumpkins..."]="我不喜欢它看南瓜的眼神……"
G["I don't like it either, but it boils down to this..."]="我也不喜欢这样，但又能怎么办呢?"
G["I don't like the feel of this place, $n.  Naga sorceresses and slavedrivers aside... all I can sense inside this cavern is pain.  The ancient one is trying to cry out, but it cannot speak."]="我不喜欢这里的感觉，$n。到处都是纳迦巫师和奴役者……我在这洞里唯一能感受到的就是痛苦。古老的生命在试图呼喊，可我却说不出话来。"
G["I don't like the idea of asking Azeroth for help, but we have little choice."]="我不喜欢那个向艾泽拉斯求援的想法，但我们现在没有别的选择。"
G["I don't like the look of this 'Crown Chemical Co.' one bit."]="我一点也不喜欢这个皇冠药剂公司的样子。"
G["I don't like the look of this place."]="我不喜欢这地方的样子。"
G["I don't like this, $n. Stay alert!"]="这我可不喜欢，$n。保持警觉！"
G["I don't like this..."]="这我可不喜欢……"
G["I don't like this... Feels too easy."]="我不喜欢这个……感觉太简单了。"
G["I don't like to see fellow monks in pain. But I'll get over it."]="我不忍心看武僧同伴们受苦。可我能撑过去。"
G["I don't like you anymore!"]="我再也不喜欢你了！"
G["I don't love spiders. Or statues that move. Or sprites that steal your things.  There are a lot of things I don't love about these ruins.  Fortunately for me, Anji's here to keep my good-looks intact!"]="我讨厌蜘蛛。还有那些移动的神像。以及偷东西的精灵。这片废土上的一切我都讨厌。幸运的是，我还有安济，她可以让我的容貌完美无瑕！"
G["I don't mean to sound ungrateful, but could you fly a little closer to the ground? I hate heights!"]="我不是忘恩负义的家伙啦，但是你能飞得再低一点吗？我恐高！"
G["I don't need a teleport."]="我不需要传送。"
G["I don't need any introductions, old man. Let's skip ahead to the good part."]="我无需任何介绍，老人家。我们还是直奔主题吧。"
G["I don't need your pity, $C."]="我不需要你的怜悯，$c。"
G["I don't often interact with the Pandaren, but when I do... Its for Brew!"]="我很少和熊猫人交流，一旦交流……必定与美酒有关！"
G["I don't pay you engineers exorbitant amounts of gold so that I can hear the words \"no\" or \"can't\" exit your wrappings. Bring that barrier down or you'll find yourselves working the energy reclamation line on X-17."]="No os estoy pagando cantidades desorbitadas de oro para oíros decir \"no\" o \"imposible\". Derribad esa barrera si no queréis que os mande a la línea energética de X-17."
G["I don't quite understand..."]="我不太明白……"
G["I don't recognize you. Are you new here?"]="我不认识你，你刚到这里吗？"
G["I don't recognize you..."]="我不认识你……"
G["I don't recognize your face. You must be new in town."]="No me suena tu cara. Debes de ser $gnuevo:nueva; en la ciudad."
G["I don't recommend hanging from a chain like that. But, to be honest, it did great things for my hair."]="像那样吊在链子上的滋味可不怎么好。不过，老实说，那对我头发有好处。"
G["I don't remember ever being this small."]="我不记得曾经有这么小过。"
G["I don't remember much about how I got to Duskhaven.  Tell me what you know."]="我不太记得是如何到达暮湾镇的。把你知道的都告诉我。"
G["I don't remember saying they could take a break!"]="我不记得我说过他们可以休息！"
G["I don't remember which way the exit is here.  Let's try this doorway over here."]="我不记得通向出口的路了。我们试试这条路。"
G["I don't see any dragons anywhere."]="我没有看到任何龙。"
G["I don't see any good reason for these ogres to waste their lives sitting out here in the sand when they could join the Horde and work for us.\n\nI mean look at them! If we don't exploit them, who will?"]="不应该让这些食人魔坐在沙子里，浪费生命。他们能够加入部落，为我们工作。\n\n我倒是要看看！如果我们不能利用他们，还有谁能？"
G["I don't see how these foul animals live in this place... sheesh it smells!"]="我不明白这些愚蠢的动物是怎么在这种地方生存的……闻起来真臭！"
G["I don't suppose Lor'themar Theron is available for an audience yet?"]="洛瑟玛·塞隆有空接见我们了吗？"
G["I don't suppose that there's any way that you can get us out of here? No?\n\nAh well, I suppose it won't be too painful as the lava slowly pours into this pit."]="我不认为你还能想到什么办法把我们从这里弄出去？有吗？\n\n啊，好吧，希望当岩浆缓缓流进来时，我们不会死得太痛苦。"
G["I don't suppose you brought another squad with you, did you? We've got our hands full out here."]="难道你又带了一队人来，会吗？我们这儿已经没有人手了。"
G["I don't suppose you'd be amenable to demonstrating the amulet's healing power here and now...?"]="你不如在这里就展示一下你出售的这个护身符的治疗效果……？"
G["I don't suppose you're here to talk about my lovely Kali. Fine, then. Potions it is. Anyone ever tell ye you've got a one-track mind?"]="没想到你会来这儿找我的可爱的卡利谈话。很好。这是药水。有没有人说过你是个头脑简单的家伙？"
G["I don't suppose you've come bearing news about the mines, have you?"]="我不指望你给我带来了矿洞的消息，有吗？"
G["I don't talk to no $g scrub : trash;!"]="我不和废物说话！"
G["I don't think Drazzit's going to have any luck finding anyone to kill this raptor. I mean, he's already raised the reward twice..."]="我觉得德拉兹特根本找不到有能力杀死那头迅猛龙的人。我的意思是说，他已经两次提升赏金了……"
G["I don't think I could ever challenge one of the celestials."]="我觉得自己根本不可能去挑战任何一位至尊天神。"
G["I don't think I could have held them off much longer.\nYou have my gratitude!"]="No creo que hubiera podido aguantar mucho más tiempo.\n\n¡Os lo agradezco!"
G["I don't think I ever stood a chance. See you around, then!"]="我果然一点机会都没有。我先告辞了！"
G["I don't think I'm gonna make it..."]="我恐怕做不到……"
G["I don't think I've ever seen the boss so upset.\n\nYou'd best not go looking for the Prince until he cools down a little."]="我从没见老板这么焦躁过。\n\n你最好等王子殿下冷静下来之后再去找他。"
G["I don't think a weapon that big is legal in this town..."]="携带一件这么大的武器在这个镇上是不合法的……"
G["I don't think breweries are supposed to make that sound..."]="我可不认为酒厂会发出那种声响……"
G["I don't think it can top the one time where he told us that he'd heard that Arthas's \"cousin's\" skeleton was frozen beneath a glacier in Winterspring. I'll never forgive you for that one, Letoll. I mean honestly... Arthas's cousin?"]="No creo que supere la vez que nos dijo que había oído que el esqueleto del \"primo\" de Arthas estaba congelado bajo un glaciar de Cuna del Invierno. Nunca te perdonaré esa, Letoll. Es que, ya te vale... ¿el primo de Arthas?"
G["I don't think it's strong enough."]="我认为这还不够。"
G["I don't think one charge is going to cut it. Keep fending them off!"]="一发炸弹还搞不定，继续保护我！"
G["I don't think so, little wyrm."]="我不这样想，小蜥蜴。"
G["I don't think so."]="我不这么认为。"
G["I don't think that's going to happen, $G lad:lass;. I've lost a lot of blood... there's no way I'm making it back."]="No pensaba que esto fuera a suceder, $gzagal:zagala;. He perdido mucha sangre... es imposible que pueda volver."
G["I don't think that's physically possible, sir."]="从实际操作方面讲，我不认为这是可能的，长官。"
G["I don't think there's any fish in these canals."]="我想运河里是不会有鱼的。"
G["I don't think these mogu are from here. They seem to be scavenging old relics, not digging in or pillaging."]="我不认为这些魔古来自这里。看起来他们像是在收集这些古老的圣物，而不是在埋藏或者掠夺它们。"
G["I don't think they're getting the message."]="可我觉得他们还没有受到教训。"
G["I don't think this shield is for me."]="我觉得这盾牌不合适我。"
G["I don't think we can afford to pass an opportunity to ingratiate ourselves with the red flight. With the battles ahead, having them as allies would be invaluable."]="我们不能放弃奉承红龙军团的好机会。战争迫在眉睫，与红龙结盟对我们是大有裨益的。"
G["I don't think we got a choice, mon."]="恐怕我们别无选择，伙计。"
G["I don't think yer hearin' me. Nether rays just aren't made for --"]="我觉得你没把我的话听进去。虚空鳐并不是最理想的——"
G["I don't think you want to learn anything I can teach. Might want to find a $c trainer to help you out."]="我跟你没什么好说的，你最好找个$c训练师来帮助你。"
G["I don't train just anyone! You'll need to perform a task first!"]="我不训练任何人！你需要首先完成一项任务！"
G["I don't train smiths with no skill, come back when you have something decent to show me."]="我不会训练一点水平都没有的铁匠，等你觉得自己达到我的要求之后再回来找我。"
G["I don't train your kind $c."]="No entreno a tu clase, $c."
G["I don't train your kind, $c.  Find your own trainer before you anger me."]="我不训练你这样的$c。在你惹恼我之前找你自己的训练师吧。"
G["I don't understand where these supplies are coming from. Somehow Twilight's Hammer has found a way to assault the entire mountain at once..."]="我不明白这些补给品是从哪儿来的。暮光之锤不知想出了什么办法，同时对整座圣山发起攻击……"
G["I don't understand you!"]="我不懂你在说什么！"
G["I don't understand, old man. What have I done to upset you?"]="我真是不明白啊，老头。我到底哪里惹到你了？"
G["I don't understand. What do you mean, Ameer?"]="我不明白。你是什么意思，阿米尔？"
G["I don't understand..."]="我不明白……"
G["I don't usually give refunds for haircuts, but I must admit I did a terrible job on yours.  My apologies."]="我很少会在给人理发后把钱退回去，可我必须承认——你的发型真是个败笔。我道歉。"
G["I don't wanna die!"]="我不想死！"
G["I don't wanna go inside! It was fun out here!"]="我可不想呆在这里面！外面才好玩！"
G["I don't wanna play anymore!"]="我不想再玩了！"
G["I don't want any trouble, Komak."]="我不想惹麻烦，库马克。"
G["I don't want excuses, I demand results!\n\nYou think what we're doing here is a joke?  If we don't do this right, then not only will the so-called do-gooders come calling, but we'll be found unworthy for elevation within the ranks of the Blackwing.\n\nIs that what you want?"]="我不要借口，我需要结果！\n\n你觉得我像是在开玩笑吗？如果我们不这么做的话，那么不仅那些所谓的好人们会跑过来叫嚷，而且这也对提升黑翼的繁荣没有任何价值。\n\n那是你想看到的结果吗？"
G["I don't want to be a meal for an ogre! Please save me!"]="我不想成为食人魔的盘中餐！请救救我！"
G["I don't want to be sacrificed!"]="我不要成为祭品！"
G["I don't want to be taken down into the catacombs!"]="我不要被他们拖进下面的墓穴！"
G["I don't want to be ungrateful, but was that absolutely necessary?"]="我不想毫不领情，可那真是必要的吗？"
G["I don't want to die down here!"]="我不想死在这里！"
G["I don't want to die!"]="我还不想死！"
G["I don't want to go back to work"]="我不想回去工作"
G["I don't want to go back!"]="我不想回去！"
G["I don't want to go home quite yet. There's still so much to see and learn."]="我还不太想回家。还有那么多东西等着我去见识、学习呢。"
G["I don't want to hurt you, but I will!"]="我不想伤害你，可我会的！"
G["I don't want to know anymore. Make me forget!"]="我什么都不想知道了。让我都忘了吧！"
G["I don't want to know what happened here. It's too horrible to imagine."]="我一点都不想知道这里出了什么事。太可怕了，我连想都不敢想。"
G["I don't want to leave! I want to stay here!"]="我不想走！我要留在这里！"
G["I don't want to see any more mistakes!"]="别再有人犯错误！"
G["I don't want to see you anymore!"]="我再也不想看见你了！"
G["I double dare you!"]="你明明就是胆小！"
G["I doubt that we will ever win against the hozen."]="我怀疑我们永远也战胜不了猢狲了。"
G["I doubt you have had much occasion to see such a creature. These demonic equines will make your travels much faster by acting as your mount as long as you control them. However, they are difficult to control, so be sure you are ready before attempting it."]="我怀疑你已经看过很多次这个生物了。这些恶魔马能让你的旅行速度加快，只要你召唤出它们来，就可以把它们当作自己的坐骑。但是地狱战马是非常难以驯服的，所以在尝试之前，你最好确定自己准备充足。"
G["I doubt you will be so lucky the next time you encounter my brethren."]="我想下次你遇到我的兄弟时可能就没这么幸运啦。"
G["I drank of the same blood your father did, Garrosh. Mannoroth's cursed venom pumped through my veins as well."]="加尔鲁什，我和你的父亲都饮下了恶魔领主的鲜血。玛诺洛斯的诅咒同样在我的血脉里流淌。"
G["I dream, $n... oh yes, I dream. In my dreams I die a thousand times in a thousand different ways. Some would call dreams such as mine nightmares. NOT I! In dreams I die in the thick of battle. For each single death of my own, ten thousand enemies of the Horde fall before me. It is glorious!"]="我做梦了，$n……对，我做梦了。在梦中，我以上千种不同的方式死去。有人会认为这是噩梦，但我不这样想！在梦中，我在战场上死去。每次死亡之前我都会让一万名部落的敌人倒在我的脚下。这是无上的荣耀！"
G["I dreamt that I turned into a monster. Good thing you woke me."]="我梦到我变成了一个怪物。还好你把我弄醒了。"
G["I drink in your suffering, mortal. Let your essence congeal with Lokholar!"]="让我结束你的痛苦吧。让你的精华和洛克霍拉一起冻结！"
G["I drove my weapons into the bodies and minds of my enemies."]="我也曾征战沙场，令敌人心胆俱裂。"
G["I dun think nothin', Wad! I know who'd do such a heinous thing!"]="还用想吗？我知道是谁，也只有他们能做出这样的龌龊事！"
G["I dunno, Jill. If Klaven comes down while we're slacking, we may end up as one of those things!"]="我不知道，吉尔。如果克拉文看到我们在休息，他一定会杀了我们的！"
G["I dunno, grunt. I just - don't - know..."]="我不知道，士兵。我——不——知道……"
G["I dunno. It can't possibly beat the time he tried to convince us that we're all actually a figment of some being's imagination and that they only use us for their own personal amusement. That went over well during dinner with the family."]="我真不知道雷托尔脑子里装的是什么。有一次他居然试图说服我们，说我们不过是某种生物臆想出来的意识体，是他们用来取乐的调剂品。那段时间，每次晚餐的时候他都会喋喋不休地说个不停。"
G["I dunno. Maybe he's magical."]="我不那么认为。也许他有魔力。"
G["I dunno. What do you want to do?"]="我不知道。你想要做什么？"
G["I eat you next, mon."]="我下一个就要吃你！"
G["I enact my master's will! I am he who bars the gate!"]="我即是主人的意志！我为他守护这道大门！"
G["I enjoy the screams most of all."]="我最喜欢尖叫声了。"
G["I envy you in a way, little $r.\n\nYou are so fortunate as to bear witness to the first steps of the rebirth of the mighty Empire of Azjol-Nerub."]="从某个角度来说，我很嫉妒你，小$r。\n\n你真是太幸运了，居然能够见证伟大的艾卓-尼鲁布帝国重生的第一步。"
G["I even had time to install an I.W.I.N. Button!"]="我甚至还忙里偷闲，装了个I.W.I.N.按钮！"
G["I execute him as per my liege's instructions, and do it in such a manner that he suffers painfully before he dies as retribution for his crimes against my people."]="我按照王上的命令处决他，这样才能偿还他对我的同胞犯下的罪孽。"
G["I execute him as per my liege's instructions, but doing so in as painless of a way as possible.  Justice must be served, but I can show some compassion."]="我按照王上的命令处决他，但是我尽可能地让他少受痛苦。正义必须得到伸张，但我们也要心怀怜悯。"
G["I expect much of you. Do not fail me. Dismissed!"]="我很看好你。别让我失望。去吧！"
G["I expect the highest quality craftmanship from my workforce.  Double your efforts!"]="我期待着我的工人们能够显示出最杰出的造船工艺。给我加倍拿出力量来！"
G["I expect this operation to proceed without major incident."]="我希望这次行动过程中不会出现任何严重事故。"
G["I expect to see this insect's carcass in pieces in my lair within the hour. Fail and you will suffer a fate so much worse than death."]="我希望立即在神殿内看到这个渣滓的尸块。否则你们就将遭受比死亡更痛苦的命运！"
G["I expected so much more. How ... disappointing."]="我还以为会更有趣呢。真让人失望。"
G["I extend my gratitude for your aid in this matter, $n, although I also admit mild regret that you will not volunteer for our experiments..."]="Te agradezco la ayuda en este asunto, $n, aunque debo expresar que lamento un poco que no te presentes $gvoluntario:voluntaria; para nuestros experimentos..."
G["I fail to understand why they banned totemic cleansing. No one was ever in range, anyways."]="我不明白，他们为什么要禁止利用图腾进行净化。毕竟在净化范围内没有任何人。"
G["I failed to defend my people in Gilneas City.  It seems the fates have given me a second chance, $n.  I will not fail again!"]="我没有能在吉尔尼斯城保护我的人民。但命运似乎是要给我第二次机会，$n。我不会再失败了！"
G["I failed..."]="我失败了……"
G["I fear I have nothing but this old chest I discovered here. You're welcome to it."]="除了这只古老的箱子，我也没别的东西可给你的了。收下吧。"
G["I fear I must now depart you and your ex-phoenix.  Light be with you!"]="恐怕我现在必须离开你和你的凤凰了。愿圣光照耀你。"
G["I fear for Alysra's fate.  Fandral's corruption ran deeper than anything I encountered in the nightmare.  Yet we can't afford to dwell on this."]="我担忧奥利瑟拉的命运。范达尔的腐蚀穿透的比任何噩梦都深。我们也没有太多时间去思考这个问题。"
G["I fear for the safety of our people."]="我很担心族人的安全。"
G["I fear for the worst, old friend. Within the Dream we fight a new foe, born of an ancient evil. Ysera's noble brood has fallen victim to the old whisperings. It seems as if the Nightmare has broken through the realm and seeks a new host on Azeroth."]="我担心事情不妙，老朋友。在梦中我们跟一个新的敌人作战，他是个远古的邪灵。伊瑟拉高贵的血脉成为了它们的牺牲品。似乎梦魇已经冲破了束缚，想要在艾泽拉斯寻找新的宿主。"
G["I fear nothing! Least of all you!"]="我无所畏惧！你们根本不值一提！"
G["I fear something dark is coming."]="恐怕黑暗正在向我们逼近。"
G["I fear that Colonel Jules may only be saved through a dangerous ritual... an exorcism."]="要想拯救尤勒斯上校，恐怕只能利用那种危险性很高的仪式——是的，驱魔仪式。"
G["I fear that if we do not receive reinforcements in Thousand Needles quickly, the Grimtotem will act. We are in no position to defend ourselves for very long."]="我担心要是援军不能尽快赶到千针石林的话，恐怖图腾就会开始行动了。我们无论如何都坚守不了多久。"
G["I fear that my people are somewhat responsible for this destruction. We are refugees, displaced from our homes by the Burning Legion. This tragedy is a result of our latest evacuation. Our vessel crashed - this debris is a part of that vessel."]="恐怕我的同胞应该对这次破坏负一些责任。燃烧军团逼我们逃出了家园，成为了难民。这个惨剧是由我们导致的。我们的飞船坠毁了——这块碎片是飞船的一部分。"
G["I fear that our war against our ancient enemies is still far from over."]="恐怕我们对抗远古敌人的战斗还远未结束。"
G["I fear that the rage will consume him, Thrall. I remain hopeful that reason will prevail, but we must prepare for the worst... for war."]="我担心国王克制不了心中的怒火，萨尔。希望我能说服他吧，但是我们必须做好最坏的打算……比如战争。"
G["I fear that this is just the beginning."]="我担心，这仅仅是个开始。"
G["I fear that your arrival here will upset the land's delicate balance."]="我担心，你们的到来会打破这片土地微妙的平衡。"
G["I fear the worst."]="我害怕会是最坏的结果。"
G["I fear there may be a lost druid in the back of the cave, $n. Be on the lookout."]="洞穴的深处恐怕有一个迷失的德鲁伊，$n。你千万要小心。"
G["I fear time may not be on our side, Ilthalaine. The battle may carry to Teldrassil itself if we do not act soon."]="恐怕我们并没有时间优势，伊尔萨莱恩。如果我们不尽快开始行动，就连泰达希尔也将难逃战火的席卷。"
G["I fear we haven't seen the last of Arugal..."]="恐怕我们还没有见识到阿鲁高的恐怖……"
G["I fear we may never soothe them..."]="我担心无法使他们平静下来……"
G["I feared that this day would come. I will pack up my things."]="我就怕这一天会到来。我去收拾东西。"
G["I feast on your suffering."]="我将畅享苦难。"
G["I feel a little chill coming."]="我感到有一股寒意逼近。"
G["I feel a rush of energy coming on. Let's do this!"]="我感到浑身充满了力量。来吧！"
G["I feel am deeply sorry for Lin's loss, but I must think of every soldier in my army.\n\nEach life is precious, and must be valued equally.\n\nI could not gamble the lives of many to save that of one."]="我对林的牺牲深表遗憾，可我必须为部队中的每一个战士考虑。\n\n每一条生命都是宝贵的，都一样值得我们珍惜。\n\n我不能为了救一个人而赌上一群人的性命。"
G["I feel as good as new! My thanks, stranger."]="¡Me siento como nuevo! Gracias, $gforastero:forastera;."
G["I feel as though I am awakening from a nightmare, but the shadows in this place yet linger."]="我觉得自己像是从一场噩梦中惊醒过来，但是这里的阴影仍然挥之不去。"
G["I feel as though I've been out here for days..."]="我觉得自己仿佛已经在这待了好多天了……"
G["I feel as though there's a task I have yet to complete...."]="我感觉似乎有什么事情还没有做完……"
G["I feel better already."]="我已经好多了。"
G["I feel better.\n\nIt will take me some time to regain my full strength, but I am strong enough to fight, at least."]="我感觉好多了。\n\n我需要再休息一段时间才能完全恢复，不过至少我已经能够参加战斗了。"
G["I feel drawn to Chi-Ji. Maybe the Red Crane will impart some of its wisdom to me."]="我很仰慕赤精。伟大的朱鹤或许能传授一些智慧给我。"
G["I feel fine, $n. Thank you for asking, but there are more important matters at hand."]="我感觉很好，$n。多谢你的关心，可眼下我们还有更重要的事情。"
G["I feel funny all of a sudden.  Er?!"]="我突然觉得很好笑。呃？！"
G["I feel funny. I don't think you reintegrated me right...."]="感觉怪怪的。你在重新组装我的时候是不是出了什么差错……"
G["I feel ill."]="我很不舒服。"
G["I feel like I could drink a lake!"]="我觉得自己能喝下一整座湖！"
G["I feel like I have been working on this city forever!"]="我感觉我要在这里当一辈子工人了！"
G["I feel like I lost an eighth of something."]="我感觉若有所失。"
G["I feel like I'm being pulled away through time.  Thanks for the help...."]="我感觉自己正在脱离时间流。谢谢你……"
G["I feel like I've been cooped up in here forever.  Is it Brewfest yet?"]="我觉得自己永远都要被关在这里了。已经到美酒节了吗？"
G["I feel like a blood sausage."]="我感觉像是一根血肠。"
G["I feel much better now.  For the Horde!"]="我感觉好多了。为了部落！"
G["I feel much better now...hic!"]="现在我觉得好多了……嗝！"
G["I feel much better. Thank you."]="我感觉好多了，谢谢你。"
G["I feel much safer with a $c like you around."]="Me siento mucho más segura con $gun:una; $c como tú cerca."
G["I feel sick."]="我感到有些恶心。"
G["I feel slightly unhinged. I am not taking well to this... condition."]="我觉得有些混乱。我并不习惯这种……情况。"
G["I feel so funky..."]="我感到胆战心惊……"
G["I feel so much calmer. What happened?"]="我感觉平静多了。发生什么了？"
G["I feel so stupid. Maybe I should unchain you and set you free?"]="我感觉很愚蠢。也许我应该释放你，让你自由？"
G["I feel strong enough to continue on my own, $n. I must report this... sha... presence to the Council immediately. If we meet again, it shall be at Klaxxi'vess."]="我感觉我能照顾自己了，$n。我必须要立即将这……邪煞……报告给议会。如果我们还能见面，应该是在卡拉克西维斯了。"
G["I feel stronger than before."]="我感觉比以前更强壮了。"
G["I feel that war is fast approaching.  The fruit vendor has enlisted the help of an ogre.  I shall have to enlist help as well."]="我感觉到了真正的战争气息。水果贩已经得到了食人魔的援助，我也必须叫来我的援兵。"
G["I feel that we are just scratching the surface of the naga presence here.\n\nI have never seen them so organized and disciplined before."]="我觉得我们对纳迦在此地出现的原因了解得远远不够。\n\n我以前从没见过他们像现在这么富于组织性和纪律性。"
G["I feel the call of the Light, far to the north of here. But this place...\n\nIt has not known the light for many, many generations."]="我感受到了圣光的召唤，就在遥远的北方。但这个地方……\n\n数代以来都未曾听说过圣光的存在。"
G["I feel the same way about Azeroth herself."]="我对艾泽拉斯也有同感。"
G["I feel the same. But there's still a job to do out here. It'll all be for naught if this evil finds its way back to Azeroth - back to our homes. We just have to hold on a while longer. Trust Danath - he's never let us down before."]="我和你的感觉一样，但是我们在这里仍然有不可推卸的职责。如果恶魔们找到了返回艾泽拉斯的路，那我们的一切努力就都白费了。我们只要在这里再坚持一段时间，相信达纳斯——他从未让我们失望过。"
G["I feel weak. I mean weaker than normal. Like as if the Light is less powerful this week. Probably just something I ate. Orc food gives me the craps."]="我感到很虚弱。我是说比平时还要虚弱。这星期的圣光像是又无力了许多。也许和我吃的东西有关。兽人的食物让我觉得恶心。"
G["I feel... at peace."]="我终于可以……安息了。"
G["I feel... different."]="我感觉……有些异样。"
G["I feel... dizzy.  It's so hot... in... here..."]="我感到……头晕目眩。这里太热了……"
G["I feel... happy!!"]="我感到……很高兴！！"
G["I feel... lightheaded... What's... happening to me?"]="我感到……头晕眼花……发生了……什么？"
G["I feel... something strange..."]="我觉得……有些奇怪……"
G["I felt Fury's demise. You have done well."]="我感觉到暴怒消失了。你做得不错。"
G["I felt a presence, a burning pain and rage in my mind..."]="我感到自己的心神被攫住，脑中出现灼热的痛楚，还有愤怒……"
G["I felt my life slipping out of me."]="我觉得我的生命正在离开我。"
G["I felt that one from the stands! I think we have a clear winner here boys, and the bodyparts littering the arena agree"]="我感觉到有一个倒下了！我们有了胜利者。而场内的一片狼藉正说明了战况是多么惨烈。"
G["I felt... so much hatred..."]="我感觉……满腔愤恨……"
G["I fight more than all other Gorlocs combined, yet I still find time to learn your language the right way... does that seem right to you?"]="我经历过的战斗比其他鳄鱼人加起来的还要多，就这样，我还能找出时间来学习你的语言……你觉得这件事正常吗？"
G["I fight wit' untamed spirit...."]="狂野的灵魂与我同在……"
G["I figured Flagongut would send someone for that fossil eventually."]="我就知道弗拉冈特最后会派人去寻找化石的。"
G["I figured I might see you again, Schnottz."]="我们应该会再见的，司克诺兹。"
G["I figured I would step up my research efforts by, uh, 'borrowing' some technology from the Venture Company. See, their new shredder is best of breed, from the interchangeable hands to the control grips!\n\nMy business partner Wizzlecrank is west of here in the Sludge Fen doing some 'Field Research' for me, but he hasn't gotten back yet."]="Pensé que podría acelerar mi investigación tomando \"prestada\" algo de tecnología de Ventura y Cía. Verás, su nueva trituradora es lo mejor de lo mejor, desde las manos intercambiables hasta los mandos de control.\n\nMi socio, Rabiaire, está al oeste de aquí en El Fangal llevando a cabo una \"investigación de campo\" para mí, pero todavía no sé nada de él."
G["I finally have a story to tell my grandchildren about... A traitor to the kingdom was living among us!"]="我终于有个故事可以讲给孙儿们听了……一个叛徒曾与我们生活在一起！"
G["I finally understood what was going on... but I was a second too late."]="然后我终于弄清楚是怎么回事儿了……可那已经太迟了。"
G["I find it satisfying.  I enjoy working with my hands."]="这让我很有满足感。我喜欢靠自己的双手工作。"
G["I find it, you buy it."]="我去找，你出钱。"
G["I find politics exhausting. I am confident Vol'jin will take us where we need to go.\n\n<Lor'themar glances over to Sylvanas.>\n\nAssuming he can hold this Horde together."]="我发现政治真是个累死人的玩意儿。我相信沃金会带领我们走上正确的道路。\n\n<洛瑟玛瞥了一眼希尔瓦娜斯。>\n\n假如他能让部落团结一致的话。"
G["I find the Brewmoon Festival an excellent break from my studies."]="我发现酿月祭是个让我暂别研究，劳逸结合的好机会。"
G["I find the ocean floor to be very peaceful."]="我发现大海是如此平静。"
G["I find you wanting."]="就凭这点能耐，也想打败我？"
G["I find your faith inspiring, little one. But I wonder if you have ever met our warchief?"]="我发现你的信念很振奋人心，小家伙。可不知你见过我们的酋长吗？"
G["I first met the Nesingwarys in Stranglethorn. I've been bumping in to them off and on ever since. I finally earned a place in their safari!"]="我最早是在荆棘谷遇见奈辛瓦里的成员的。在那之后，我就陆续跟他们见过几次面。终于在他们的远征队里找到了自己的一席之地！"
G["I first set up shop in the Magic Quarter, but it was pretty noisy there. This is a definite improvement, barring a few persistent students who still track me down, despite the fact that I've relocated."]="起先，我在魔法区开设商店，但是那儿太嘈杂啦。尽管我进行了重新部署，除了有些学生坚持要向我求学之外，环境还是得到了相当的改善。"
G["I flew to the top of the pillar located just north of the canyon."]="我飞到了山谷北边的柱子顶端。"
G["I floated for days 'til one of our ships spotted me..."]="我在水面上漂了好几天，直到被一艘我们的船发现……"
G["I foresee that you will speak with Archmage Lan'dalock, $n."]="$n，根据我的预见，你将同大法师兰达洛克谈话。"
G["I forget... did you take flying lessons back on Kezan?"]="我忘记了……你在科赞上过飞行课吗？"
G["I fought against the anger, but it overwhelmed me. You have my thanks."]="我极力对抗愤怒，但我无法战胜它。太感谢你了。"
G["I fought alongside Lord Anduin Lothar as we drove the Horde from our lands on Azeroth. As the heir of Medivh's legacy, I could do no less.\n\nWhen the call finally came to invade this grim world - and put an end to the orcs' evil forever - I stepped forward along with my friends Turalyon, Alleria, Danath and Kurdran."]="我和安度因·洛萨爵士并肩战斗，把部落从我们艾泽拉斯驱逐了出去。作为麦迪文遗产的继承人，我只能这么做。\n\n当联盟最终决定远征这个阴森的世界，永久终止兽人的邪恶时，我和我的朋友图拉扬、奥蕾莉亚、达纳斯和库德兰挺身而出。"
G["I fought on the frontlines of the Qiraji war and charged the depths of Azjol-Nerub. I know first hand the threat that an insect legion can have on the world when left unchecked."]="我曾在其拉之战中奋战在最前线，也曾在艾卓——尼鲁布深渊中冲锋陷阵。我完全了解，一支放任自流的昆虫军团会对我们的世界造成多大的威胁。"
G["I found Kasha in Icecrown. She was injured and dying. I managed to carry her back to the Shadow Vault where the death knights helped nurse her back to health. We are now the best of friends."]="我在冰冠冰川找到了卡莎。她身负重伤，奄奄一息。我设法将她带回了暗影拱顶，死亡骑士帮她逃脱了死神的魔爪。我们现在已经成为了彼此的挚友。"
G["I found Sully waiting outside the village's entrance."]="我发现苏利就等在村子外面。"
G["I found a broken-down cart amongst the dunes when I was checking out the potential profitibility of Centipaar Silithid Snacks (patent pending).  I thought to myself, \"hey, free cart!\"  That is, until the biggest basilisk you've ever seen showed up, and I had to leave the whole thing behind!"]="\"Me encontré un carro roto entre las dunas cuando estaba estudiando los beneficios potenciales de los Aperitivos de Silítido Centipaar (pendiente de patente). Me dije: \"Oye, ¡carro gratis!\". ¡Pero entonces el basilisco más grande que has visto en tu vida apareció y tuve que dejarlo todo atrás!"
G["I found a good bit of filth out in the swamps today. The filth-mongers will be proud of me."]="我今天在外面的沼泽里找到一些很好的污物。污染者会为我骄傲的。"
G["I found a grummle cake in a corner of my cage. So delicious! Best day ever!"]="我在笼子的角落里发现一个土地精烤饼，太好吃了！真是最棒的一天！"
G["I found a mighty axe there, freshly forged upon the fire."]="我在那里发现了一把锋利的斧子，一把刚从烈火中铸造出来的利斧。"
G["I found a stack of smoke bombs in my pockets. They'd have to do.\n|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_rogue_smoke.blp:32|t"]="Encontré bombas de humo en el bolsillo. Tendrían que servir.\n|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_rogue_smoke.blp:32|t"
G["I found an incantation to release these two from their prison. But it will release both of them. Once I cast this, defeat the Jade Warlord before he can get his bearings."]="我发现了能够释放这两人的法术，注意，是他们两个。一旦我施放法术，你必须在青玉战神回过神来之前击败他。"
G["I found an old rifle scope in my pockets. It'd have to do.\n|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_scopeb.blp:32|t"]="Encontré una vieja mira de rifle en el bolsillo. Tendría que servir.\n|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_scopeb.blp:32|t"
G["I found it!  It's mine!"]="我找到它了！它是我的了！"
G["I found no sign of Anduin at the southwestern shrine."]="在西南边的神龛附近没发现安度因的踪迹。"
G["I found nothin' at the northern shrine - no Anduin, no hozen... nothin'."]="我在北边的神龛一无所获——没有白卒，没有猢狲……什么都没有。"
G["I found the brewery and made my way inside."]="我找到了酿酒厂，然后走进去。"
G["I found this fascinating specimen in the lava underneath this very room. Magmaw should provide an adequate challenge for your pathetic little band."]="我在这个房间下方的熔岩里找到了这个奇妙的样本。对你们这支可怜的小团队来说，熔喉应该是个“适度”的挑战。"
G["I found this in the ruins. Cailin told me it was yours..."]="我在这片废墟中找到了这个。凯林告诉我，这是你的……"
G["I found this jar of bugs in a shack in the middle of Kun-Lai. I didn't think anything of it until I saw the letters..."]="我是在昆莱山上的棚屋里找到这罐虫子的。起初我也没多想，直到看见了这些字……"
G["I found this strange armor plate. Can you tell me more about it?"]="我发现了这块奇怪的护甲板。你知道这玩意儿的来历吗？"
G["I found us a cool bodyguard didn't I?"]="我给我们找了个很酷的保镖，是不是？"
G["I free you from existence!"]="我要结果了你！"
G["I get a lot of mail, $n. Most of it is junk, but some of them might be helpful to a helpful $c like you. Here's a couple letters sent to Everlook, looking for help in the far corners of the world.\n\nIt's almost as if you have a choice for where you go next!  Now, let's see..."]="Suelo recibir mucho correo, $n. La mayor parte es correo basura, pero a veces llega algo que podía resultarle útil a $gun:una; $c servicial como tú. Aquí hay un par de cartas enviadas a Vista Eterna en las que se dice que buscan ayuda en los rincones más alejados del mundo.\n\n¡Casi es como si pudieras elegir adónde ir a continuación! Veamos..."
G["I get all teary eyed just thinkin' about all we been through together, $g boyo : lass;."]="一想到我们一起经历过的事情，我就泪眼汪汪，$g小伙子: 小姑娘;。"
G["I get flashes sometimes of these horrific images.  Shadows assaulting us in the night.  Friends turning and attacking each other."]="有时候我的眼前会闪过恐怖的镜像。阴影在黑夜中吞噬我们。亲友反目，自相残杀。"
G["I get reports of your exploits against the Abyssal Council all the time, $n.  You're doing great things out there!\n\nKeep it up, and we'll make it worth the effort!"]="Me llegan continuamente noticias de tus proezas contra el Consejo Abisal, $n. ¡Estás haciendo grandes cosas ahí fuera!\n\n¡Sigue así y conseguiremos que el esfuerzo valga la pena!"
G["I get the feeling the negotations aren't going well..."]="我感觉谈判进行得并不顺利……"
G["I give 'im five days."]="我给他五天时间。"
G["I give more shinies to shrines! I promise! I sorry!"]="我会为神殿供奉更多闪闪发光的宝贝！我发誓！对不起！"
G["I give my flesh and blood freely to the Warchief. I am the instrument of my Warchief's desire. I am a weapon of my Warchief's command!"]="我发誓终身效忠于萨尔酋长。他的意志就是我的信条。他的指令就是我的使命！"
G["I give my life... gladly."]="我很高兴……能献出自己的生命。"
G["I give myself to the master!"]="我将自己献给主人！"
G["I give only nice sheep for you, neighbor! What do you think?"]="¡Yo da solo ovejas buenas para ti, $gvecino:vecina;! ¿Ké tú piensa?"
G["I give unto you cordial salutations, $r.  You've come far off the beaten path merely to speak to someone dwelling inside a cave.  I trust there is a reason for your strange, yet not unforeseen visit here.  Yes?"]="Te hago partícipe de mi cordial bienvenida, $r. Te has alejado mucho del camino solo para hablar con alguien que mora en una cueva. Confío en que habrá una razón para tu extraña, aunque no imprevista, visita. ¿Es así?"
G["I give up! Please don't kill me!"]="我投降！不要杀我！"
G["I give up! So much for goblin ingenuity!"]="我放弃了！我受够地精的这些小玩意了！"
G["I give up.  I can't get through to you cuddly bears.  $n, would you come over here and show these newbs how it's done?"]="我放弃。我没法给你们这些可爱的小熊讲明白了。$n，你能过来给这些新手演示一下吗？"
G["I give you my oath."]="我在此立誓。"
G["I give you one chance. Pledge fealty to me, and perhaps I will not slaughter you for your insolence."]="我给你们一次机会吧。向我宣誓效忠，这是让我原谅你们的傲慢与无礼的唯一机会。"
G["I give you thanks for my life."]="感谢你救了我的命。"
G["I give you thanks, $n."]="向你致敬，$n。"
G["I give you the gift of destruction!"]="我将赐予你毁灭的礼物！"
G["I give you this story."]="让我告诉你们。"
G["I give you warm greetin's, $c, as does the Shattered Hand.\n\nDo not look so surprised, $n. There be shadows even on the highest perches of Orgrimmar--somethin' must hide there. The Shattered Hand take that role willingly. Thrall, even in his good heart, acknowledge that the Hand be necessary to ensure orc and troll safety.\n\nBut you not here to talk 'bout my business, you here for somethin' else."]="Te doy mi más cordial bienvenida, $c, como hacen los Mano Destrozada.\n\nNo te sorprendas tanto, $n. Hay sombras incluso en los puntos más altos de Orgrimmar, algo debe de esconderse allí. Los Mano Destrozada juegan ese papel gustosamente. Incluso el bueno de Thrall reconoce que los Mano Destrozada son necesarios para garantizar la seguridad de los orcos y los trols.\n\nPero no has venido aquí para hablar de mi oficio, has venido para otra cosa."
G["I gladly die for the master..."]="能为主人而死，我很荣幸……"
G["I gladly make such a sacrifice if it means the downfall of the Dragonmaw."]="如果它能换来龙喉氏族的衰落，我很乐意做出这样的牺牲。"
G["I go now to summon the lord whose house this is. Should you seek an audience with him, your paltry lives will surely be forfeit! Nevertheless, seek out his lair, if you dare!"]="我将会召唤这里真正的主人，让你们直接面对他无尽的愤怒，你们渺小的生命即将完结！不过，你们得自己进入他的房间！"
G["I go to be with the spirits of my ancestors..."]="我就要去见先祖的灵魂了……"
G["I go to contemplate those who could not share this victory with us."]="我要去缅怀那些不能与我们分享胜利的人了。"
G["I go to join my ancestors here."]="就让我与先祖们一起安息吧。"
G["I go willingly, $c. My purpose in my master's plan is fulfilled."]="我愿意去，$c。我在主人计划中应尽的职责已经完成。"
G["I gonna disappear for a while. [Gasps] Don't forget about me."]="我得消失一段时间了。别忘了我。"
G["I gonna give you all the gold and gems you can carry if you bring me ten of their heads!"]="如果你上缴10颗敌人的徽记，我就赏你满袋子的金币和宝石。"
G["I gonna make you into mojo!"]="我要把你的魔精抽干！"
G["I gonna' feed ya soul to dah beasts."]="我要拿你的灵魂去喂野兽。"
G["I got a bad feelin' about this."]="我对这事儿感觉很不好。"
G["I got a bone to pick wit' you!"]="我今天就要鸡蛋里挑骨头了！"
G["I got a few more tings to discuss here.  Den I'll head to Zul'Gurub.  I will see you dere."]="我还需要留下讨论一些事情，之后我将前往祖尔格拉布，我们在那里见。"
G["I got a green thumb and a steel thumb. My pappy taught me how to fix just 'bout anything."]="我既会园艺，又能打铁。我老爸把我教成了一个万能修理匠。"
G["I got a new cage built up, and we got plenty of ways to... teach her not to escape again."]="我造了个新笼子，而且我们有许多种手段来……教她打消逃跑的念头。"
G["I got a strange feelin' in me gut, Commander.  Think it might have been that murloc fin soup?"]="我的肚子里有一种奇怪的感觉，指挥官。你觉得会是那种鱼人鳍汤在作怪吗？"
G["I got a very bad feeling about this, $n. I think the smart play now is to get yourself off of the island any way that you can.\n\nI'm going see if I can get into the Trade Prince's Town-In-A-Box."]="我有一种非常糟糕的感觉，$n。我觉得，你现在最聪明的选择就是想尽一切办法离开这座岛。\n\n让我看看能不能进入贸易大王的胶囊镇。"
G["I got dis one!"]="我来对付这家伙！"
G["I got good noodles here!"]="卖好吃的面条啦！"
G["I got information dat Vol'jin needs. Help me outta here!"]="我这有沃金需要的情报，快来放我出来！"
G["I got it!"]="成功了！"
G["I got it! I got it!"]="我知道了！我知道了！"
G["I got it! I saw a tablet that mentioned this chamber. This is the Vault of Lights! Ok, simple enough. I need you adventurers to take out each of the four elementals to trigger the opening sequence for the far door!"]="我明白了！我读过的一块石板上提到了这个房间。这里就是光明穹顶！好吧，这很简单。冒险者们，去干掉那四个元素，触发远处那道门的开启程序！"
G["I got nothin' more to teach! Not for somebody who knows as much as you do, anyway! You Horde types need to talk to Nogg in Orgrimmar!"]="我没有什么可以教你的啦！无论如何，不是每个人都像你能懂这么多知识！你需要跟奥格瑞玛的诺格谈谈。"
G["I got nothin' to say to you! I will only be talkin' to $p."]="我没什么要对你说的！我只和$p说话。"
G["I got nothin' to sell ya today."]="我今天不卖东西。"
G["I got nothing new for you, kid. You've outgrown manual labor..."]="我没有新任务交给你了，孩子。你已经不适合做体力活啦……"
G["I got one!"]="我抓住一个！"
G["I got orders sayin' you gotta die, and you're not the one payin' my bills."]="我已经得到命令，要置你于死地。而且看样子，你也没钱收买我。"
G["I got some candy at the inn before.  I can't wait to get some more!"]="我从旅店那里得到了一些糖果！不过我还想要更多！"
G["I got some extras with me; if you pay me back what I paid for them, you can have one.  I got some bait too."]="我这里还有多余的，如果你付给我成本钱，我就可以给你一个。另外我还有一些诱饵。"
G["I got some great samples, Hornizz. I'm going to get to work on them. Can you take care of the rest?"]="霍恩尼兹，我得到了一些样本。我要开始研究它们了，你能去研究剩余的那些吗？"
G["I got some venom for you."]="我弄些毒液给你。"
G["I got something for you, $n. Looks important."]="我给你带来一些东西，$n。它们看起来挺重要的。"
G["I got the glow!"]="我燃起了战欲！"
G["I got these little hellions on a short leash, $n. The naga won't attack us while we have their hatchlings."]="我已经紧紧控制住了这些小混蛋，$n。当我们控制他们的时候，纳迦是不会攻击我们的。"
G["I got this from some goblin, he said it can stop anything in their tracks, want to give it a try?"]="我是从地精那里得到这个的，他说它可以阻止任何东西靠近，想试一下吗？"
G["I got this one..."]="我得到了这个……"
G["I got this! Give me the last clue."]="我明白了！告诉我最后一条线索。"
G["I got three sick chickens and another two hens not layin'. I got too many problems to listen to yours, citypaw."]="我有三只生病的小鸡和两只不下蛋的母鸡。我自己都焦头烂额了，哪还有心思管你，城里人。"
G["I got to practice.\n \n<Points at you tool in hand.>\n \nIf you're not practicing, you should be practicing. So keep practicing. \n \nThat's the only way you are going to get better, to get better at anything. \n \nPractice. Practice. Practice."]="我得练习一下。\n \n<指指你手中的工具。>\n \n如果你没有练过，那最好先练练。一定要坚持练习。\n \n不管你要做什么，这是都进步的唯一方法。\n \n练习，练习，练习。"
G["I got worm guts on my shoes."]="我把蚯蚓弄到鞋子上了。"
G["I got you covered, Vipore. Move out!"]="我来掩护你，维波里。快点行动吧！"
G["I got you in my sights, monkey!"]="我看见你了，猴子！"
G["I got your back, Guse."]="我来支援你，古斯。"
G["I got your back, Ichman. GO GO GO!"]="我来支援你，艾克曼。快走！"
G["I got your back, Slidore, but to be honest, you do stink. Take a shower, man."]="我来支援你了，斯里多尔，但说实话，你真是太臭了。快冲个澡，伙计。"
G["I gotcha boss!"]="我来帮你了，老大！"
G["I gots all kinds of brands of shades. Yous name it, I sell it!"]="我这里有各种各样新款墨镜。你能叫出名字的，我都有的卖！"
G["I gots bad feeling..."]="我感觉不好…"
G["I gotta get out of here before they catch me again!"]="我要在他们再次抓住我之前离开这里！"
G["I gotta tell my cubs about this! Of course, I'll change the part where their paw-paw got stuck..."]="我要把这个故事告诉我的孩子们！当然了，我会把他们的爸爸受窘的部分修改一下的……"
G["I grant you eternal peace!"]="我要超度你！"
G["I greet you, $r."]="向你致意，$r。"
G["I grew up hearing legends of the White Tiger. He is a hero to the pandaren people. It is a real honor to be here training."]="我是听着白虎的传说长大的。他是潘达利亚人民的英雄。很荣幸能来此受训。"
G["I grew up on the Wandering Isle. Space was so limited there. Never room to hunt and never really any predators worth mentioning.\n\nBut here... here there are the great mushan and wolves and all sorts of predators. This is this hunter's dream come true."]="我是在迷踪岛上长大的。那里空间有限。没地方让我们狩猎，也没有什么值得一提的凶禽猛兽。\n\n可这里……这里有大块头的穆山兽，有野狼，还有各种各样的食肉动物。这里简直是让猎手美梦成真的乐园。"
G["I grow bored of guarding Ambassador Sunsorrow, $n. Care to spar a bit? Perhaps one of us will learn something."]="我对保护银月大使欧诺·炎伤感到有点厌烦了，$n。你有空和我聊聊吗？或许我们能彼此学到些什么？"
G["I grow bored with you. Begone!"]="你很烦诶。快滚！"
G["I grow bored with your attempt to heal the land and quell the energies summoning and driving the colossi mad.  Goliathon, King of the Colossi, Prince Kael'thas and I demand that you defend the crystal!"]="我渐渐对你尝试治愈这个大地、遏制能量召唤的行为感到厌烦了。葛利安索恩，巨人之王，凯尔萨斯王子和我命令你来保卫这块水晶！"
G["I grow bored with your resistance. I'm going to kill you now and get my answers from one of your other friends."]="我已经对你的抵抗感到厌倦了。我现在就要杀了你，然后去撬开你其它同伴的嘴巴。"
G["I grow old, little one. My time on this world is nearly done."]="我老了，小家伙。我的时日无多了。"
G["I grow tired of these games!"]="我对这些游戏感到厌烦了！"
G["I grow tired of these games, Arthas! Your walls can't stop me!"]="我厌倦了你的把戏，阿尔萨斯！你的冰墙阻挡不了我！"
G["I grow tired of these games, human. Tell me of the \"Crimson Dawn\" or I will tear your spine out with my bare hands!"]="Me estoy cansando de estos juegos, humano. ¡Háblame sobre el \"Alba Carmesí\" o te arrancaré la columna con mis manos desnudas!"
G["I grow tired of these games. Proceed, and I will banish your souls to oblivion!"]="这场游戏已经让我觉得无聊了。继续吧，到我这里来，我会亲自毁灭你们的灵魂！"
G["I grow tired of this hunt... Time to die!"]="我已经厌倦了这样的狩猎……去死吧！"
G["I grow tired of this routine."]="我厌烦这种单调的生活了。"
G["I grow tired of this village. I wish I could travel and see the world. Maybe when I've saved up enough gold, I'll go on my own epic adventure!"]="我在这村里住腻了。真希望能到处旅行，看看这个世界啊。也许等我存够了钱，我就能开始自己的史诗冒险了！"
G["I grow tired of waiting. Dance for me, imbecile."]="我等得有点累了。给我跳个舞，白痴。"
G["I grow turnips at my family farm. Oh... I don't know if you wanted to know that..."]="我在我家的农场里种芜菁。哦……我也不知道你想不想听那个……"
G["I grow weary of these Horde cowards. There must be someplace else in this village to rest."]="我烦透这些部落的懦夫了。这村子里一定还有其它地方能让我歇脚。"
G["I grow weary. I must rest now."]="我累了。需要休息了。"
G["I grow weary...\n\nFrom here, you can see the waterfalls, $n...The scepter grants you the power to travel to this very place, should you ever desire to enter through the front gates of Maraudon again.\n\nNear the entrance to Maraudon, you will find a passage that goes down beneath the caverns. Use the scepter at the ancient ritual site to create a portal, and you will find yourself here once more."]="我越来越疲惫了……\n\n从这儿你可以看见瀑布，$n……要是你敢再次进入玛拉顿的大门，节杖将赋予你抵达那儿的能力。\n\n在玛拉顿的入口附近，你会看见一条通往洞穴之下的通道。在远古遗址处使用节杖创造传送门，你就可以进入玛拉顿了。"
G["I grow... weary..."]="我开始……厌烦了……"
G["I guarantee that without $n, this whole offensive would have been a failure."]="我承认，如果不是$n，整场战役都会一败涂地。"
G["I guarantee this bank's security with my own blood, is that good enough for you?"]="我会用我的鲜血来保证这座银行的安全，你觉得很放心吧？"
G["I guess I can head back to Silvermoon..."]="我想我能回银月城了……"
G["I guess I was wrong about Shomi..."]="我想我对朔弥的看法是错的……"
G["I guess I wasn't ready to be a brawler."]="我想我还没有做好成为拳手的准备。"
G["I guess I'd better do something about this!"]="我想我最好想点办法！"
G["I guess I'll go find the authorities. If I'm lucky they'll tell me it's the plague and that we're all going to die."]="看来我得找卫生鉴定专家问问。如果我够“幸运”的话，他们就会告诉我说这是强效药剂……那样我们就都完蛋了！"
G["I guess I'll just... leave the sleeping imps right over here?  Are these even... imps?  Gah!"]="我猜，我只需要……把这些睡着的小鬼留在这里？这些……是小鬼吗？嘿！"
G["I guess I'm not a failure after all!"]="看来我并不是一个失败品！"
G["I guess he's somewhere in this forest?"]="我猜他就在森林里的某个地方？"
G["I guess it doesn't bend that way."]="好像不能这么用力折它。"
G["I guess it's all just about over, right $n? I'm going to miss you... it'll be pretty lonely up here without someone to talk to.\n\nBut that doesn't mean that you can't come back to see me in the future!"]="我想事情都结束了是吧，$n？我会想你的……没人陪我说话，我一定会非常寂寞的。\n\n但是，欢迎你随时回来看望我！"
G["I guess it's time for a rebuilding phase..."]="我猜，现在该是重建时期了……"
G["I guess it's true then. I didn't want to believe that you were a yellow-bellied snow licker, but there's no doubt about it now."]="那么，我猜这是真的了。我一直都不愿意相信，你竟然真的是个一肚子大便的白毛妖怪。但现在，我只能相信了。"
G["I guess so!"]="我是这么想的！"
G["I guess so."]="应该可以。"
G["I guess someone needs to bandage us warriors up after the fighting.  Seek out Arnok at the Survival of the Fittest hut next to the Spirit Lodge in the Valley of Spirits.  Look up above and to the west of the Valley of Strength for a lake.  That's where he's at."]="我猜有人在战斗结束后需要帮我们这些战士包扎伤口。到精神谷的灵魂小屋旁边的适者生存小屋找阿诺克。往上走去力量谷的西边找到一个湖。那就是他呆的地方。"
G["I guess that's it then.  Off we go."]="那就这样吧。我们走了。"
G["I guess that's that. We have all of the Arthas' Tears necessary. You might try asking around. One of these others is sure to have something that they still need collected for the war effort."]="我想是这样的。我们已经收集到足够的阿尔萨斯之泪了。你可以四下问问。肯定还有人在收集其它作战物资。"
G["I guess that's the way..."]="我想，这就是……"
G["I guess the spirits like you better than me, I still have not heard their call but you seem to have gathered their lessons well. Go speak to Karn, he will be excited to see one who hears them as he does."]="我猜那些灵魂更加喜欢你，我还没有听到他们的召唤但是你看起来已经上过他们好多课程了。去找卡恩谈谈，他会很高兴看到一个像他一样听到它们声音的人。"
G["I guess we're going to need some more pygmies."]="看来我们得再找几个俾格米人了。"
G["I guess what I'm saying is... thanks."]="我想要说的是……谢谢。"
G["I guess you can stay here."]="我想你可以留下来。"
G["I guess you could say she has a bun in the oven!"]="我想你会说，她在烤箱里藏了个小宝宝。"
G["I guess you could say..."]="我想你会说……"
G["I guess you were hungry! Trok was supposed to have fed you earlier... What has he been doing all this time?"]="我猜你一定饿啦！特洛克应该在早些时候喂过你的……他都在干什么？"
G["I guess your first exercise is going to be to mine your way down to the Undercity.  Heh, get it?  Mine... nevermind.  To get to the Undercity go to the rear of the Ruins of Lordaeron south of Brill, and take the elevator down.  Ask one of the Undercity Guardians there for further assistance."]="我猜想你最初的训练就是挖掘到幽暗城。嗨，明白吗？挖掘……没关系。要到幽暗城，你先要到布瑞尔南面的洛丹伦废墟后方，然后乘升降梯下去。向那里的一位幽暗城守卫寻求更多的帮助。"
G["I had Darnassus LOCKED DOWN! Every fumbling rogue that tried to sneak into the city, I CAUGHT them! I snatched every two-bit charlatan that attempted to teleport through my traps!"]="我已经彻底封锁了整个达纳苏斯！我抓住了所有那些试图潜入城市的笨贼和想要靠传送法术躲过陷阱的半吊子法师！"
G["I had a bad encounter with some of the Defias around here recently, but Michelle Belle fixed me up pretty well.  Check with her in the Lion's Pride Inn and see if she'll teach you."]="我最近在这里附近遭遇过一些迪菲亚盗贼，但米歇尔·贝利帮我进行了治疗。到狮王之傲与她商量一下，看看她能否教你。"
G["I had a farm once, but that was a long time ago. I prefer a good battle, don't you?"]="我曾经有个农场，但那是在很久之前了。我想要痛快地大战一场，你呢？"
G["I had a good thing going here. Was going to sell these pirates a bunch of rifles and make a fortune! But no! Wizzle had to tag along and try to sell them his cheap engineering parts. Blew up a few of their cannons and my rifles in the process! We're doomed!"]="我在这儿本来好好的。我正准备把一堆步枪卖给那些海盗，发笔小财！可是，不！维兹尾随而来，想要让他们买下他那些廉价的工程学零件。结果却把他们的几座火炮和我的步枪都给炸毁了！我们势不两立！"
G["I had a rat once, but then my mom made me put it back outside."]="我以前养过老鼠，但是我妈妈让我把它扔回外面。"
G["I had a terrible vision - the sky was blotted out and there was dirt everywhere. ...I thought I'd gone back to Deepholm."]="我似乎看到一种可怕的景象——天空被遮蔽，到处都是尘泥……我还以为又回到了深岩之洲。"
G["I had a tonk, but my sister broke it..."]="我也有一辆坦克，可是被我妹妹弄坏了……"
G["I had a... situation some time back with one of the individuals now heading up the Sunreavers here. A falling out, if you will."]="我……曾和一个人有点不愉快，那家伙现在是夺日者的头目了。其实就吵了一架，换你你也会的。"
G["I had almost fooled myself into believing Zouchin was protected from the darkness in the world."]="我几乎骗过了自己，相信卓金在这个世界上能免受黑暗的侵袭。"
G["I had arranged for a secret summit between Warchief Thrall and King Wrynn, here in Theramore."]="我为萨尔酋长和乌瑞恩国王安排了一次秘密峰会，举办地点就在塞拉摩。"
G["I had been fortunate to find an oasis and made the decision to stay there until I received an answer. So there I sat, moving only when absolutely necessary, living off of the creatures that would come near the pool. Such was my pride.\n\nAs I said, decades passed without an answer. But I can remember a particularly beautiful sunset one evening. A warm zephyr blew across the land and I was sure that I heard a voice, but no one was around.\n\nAs you can imagine, I thought that I was finally losing my mind."]="幸运的是，我在那里找到了一片绿洲，我下定决心待在那里，直到我得到一个答复。所以我就坐在那里，只有在迫不得已的情况下才做出别的举动，依靠池塘周围的生物维系我的生命。那可真是我的骄傲啊。\n\n就像我说的那样，十年过去了，没有任何答复。但是我却记得那天晚上美丽的夕阳。一股温暖的风拂过大陆，我确信我听到了某个声音，但是没有人在我周围。\n\n就像你所能想象到的那样，我觉得我终于疯了。"
G["I had better return to my post.  You can find me downstairs if you need anything."]="我最好回到我的岗位上去。如果有需要，你可以在楼下找到我。"
G["I had come to seek strong pandaren to hunt the Sha of Hatred, but we will step in here and help you fortify the barricade first."]="我是来找一些强壮的熊猫人猎杀恨之煞的，但是我们会先帮你加固路障。"
G["I had forgotten."]="我已经忘记了。"
G["I had given up hope, friend. Thank you."]="Había perdido la esperanza, $gamigo:amiga;. Gracias."
G["I had heard that a score of them broke into the Eye and slew him."]="我听说有二十来人闯进风暴要塞，把他给干掉了。"
G["I had hoped my suspicions were incorrect... they're resurrecting magmawyrms.  Come back to me immediately, it is time to purge this place of the Cult."]="我真希望自己的猜测是错误的……但是他们……他们真的在复活熔岩之龙。快回到我身边，我们必须尽快将诅咒教派驱出这里。"
G["I had hoped to end your lives quickly, but you have proven more... resilient than I anticipated. Nonetheless, your efforts are in vain. It is you reckless, careless mortals who are to blame for this war. I do what I must, and if it means your extinction.... then SO BE IT!!"]="我原本只是想尽快结束你们的生命……可你们竟然远比我想象得要坚韧。虽然如此，你们的努力仍将付诸东流。事实上，这场战争本身就是因为你们凡人不计后果的行为而起，我只是在尽自己的责任罢了。如果这责任意味着要灭绝你们……那就这样吧！"
G["I had it all!  I had it all and then I lost it.  Lost... all gone... like... my mind.  My mind is like... cheese.  I like cheese."]="我已经拥有它啦！我已经拥有了，然后又丢失啦。丢掉了……所有的东西……就像……我的思绪。我的思绪就像……奶酪。我喜欢奶酪。"
G["I had it all, once. Fame, fortune, a full set of the very best gladiator's gear... and then I threw it all away.\n\nOnce the Cartel caught me rigging fights... trading wins... it was all over.\n\nNow I've got nothing but these rags and a bad liver."]="我曾经拥有一切。名望、财富、一整套最棒的角斗士套装……我却亲手毁了这一切。\n\n他们发现我有舞弊行为……进行胜负交易……一切全完蛋了。\n\n如今我一无所有，只剩下这身破烂的衣衫，还有一只坏掉的肝脏。"
G["I had it!  Must have been a huge one to take all my bait!"]="我知道了！肯定是有一条大家伙把我的鱼饵都吃掉了！"
G["I had just about given up hope."]="我差一点就要放弃希望了。"
G["I had more fun torturing the peons!"]="跟苦工打交道都比这有趣！"
G["I had no choice but to defend myself."]="我别无选择，只有自卫。"
G["I had no choice, lieutenant. They recognized me. The only people in the world who even knew I existed, recognized my face from when I was an infant."]="我别无选择，中尉。他们认出了我。在这个世界上唯一知道我存在的人，从我在襁褓之时起就认得我的脸。"
G["I had no choice, or so I thought. I would endure the destruction of Thaurissan and stand by the side of my king and his people.\n\nUnder the control of Ragnaros, King Dagran Thaurissan tore out the heart of this mountain and erected Blackrock Spire. We worked tirelessly to build a dwarven city mightier than any city or fortress that came before... or would come after."]="我没有选择，至少我是这么认为的。我会忍受索瑞森的毁灭并与我的国王和同胞站在一起。\n\n在拉格纳罗斯的统治下，达格兰·索瑞森国王开凿了山脉的中央，并建立了黑石塔。我们不知疲倦地工作着，发誓要建立一座比以前的任何城市或堡垒都要坚固的矮人城堡……甚至将来也不会有能与之媲美的建筑。"
G["I had no choice."]="我没有选择。"
G["I had no idea Sullah had so many... acquaintances."]="我可不知道苏拉赫有这么多……熟人。"
G["I had no idea the party was going to have a pirate theme. I would have brought my eyepatch!"]="我可不知道这场聚会里还有海盗表演。我真应该把眼罩带来！"
G["I had no idea you were so well-informed."]="No tenía ni idea de que estuvieras tan bien $ginformado:informada;."
G["I had not dared to trust my senses - too many times has the Lich King made me to be a fool."]="我不敢相信这是真的——因为巫妖王已经愚弄我太多太多次了。"
G["I had searched every cloud, but I couldn't find Deathwing."]="我已经搜查了每一片云，但就是找不到死亡之翼。"
G["I had the pleasure of seeing Kyra Windblade in combat once.  Considering what I witnessed, I am confident she will train you well.  Look for her at the Inn in Dolanaar."]="我以前曾有幸看到在凯拉·风刃作战，因此我相信她可以好好训练你。到多兰纳尔旅店去找她吧。"
G["I had thought my victory was certain. Clearly the Makers had other plans."]="我以为自己赢定了。可造物主显然另有安排。"
G["I had to come and see Old Yoon's cub with my own eyes."]="我得亲自前来看看老老愚的孙儿。"
G["I had to go and requisition an Abomination... an Abomination!"]="我必须去申请一个憎恶……一个憎恶！"
G["I had your back to the end..."]="我始终在背后支持着你……"
G["I hadn't planned on fighting soldiers AND farmers.  With these farmers nipping at our flank, we risk losing focus on the task at hand: taking Andorhal."]="我还没有计划要同时与士兵和农夫作战。如果这些农夫继续骚扰我们的侧翼，我们将有可能无法集中力量完成我们的任务：攻占安多哈尔。"
G["I hate adventurers."]="我恨冒险者。"
G["I hate armor."]="我恨护甲。"
G["I hate flesh beasts..."]="我讨厌血肉兽……"
G["I hate having to do that."]="我讨厌这么做，却不得不这么做。"
G["I hate incompetent raiders."]="我恨无能的掠夺者。"
G["I hate it when you speak to me in that manner. I am your equal in every way, brother. Remember that the next time you are trapped amidst a temporal vortex, crying for help."]="我很讨厌你用那种态度和我说话。我和你在任何方面都是平等，兄弟。记住下次当你困在时间漩涡里的时候，不要哭着求我。"
G["I hate martyrs."]="我恨肉盾。"
G["I hate mercy."]="我恨心慈手软。"
G["I hate resorting to violence."]="我讨厌使用暴力。"
G["I hate slickies! Yucky yucky slickies!"]="我讨厌光板儿！叫人恶心的光板儿！"
G["I hate standing still."]="我恨站着不动。"
G["I hate this part of my job. Oh Duskwood, be gentle with poor Antonio."]="我讨厌我的这份工作。啊，暮色森林啊，你就不能可怜可怜我么？"
G["I hate this place and everyone in it! Smithers do this! Smithers do that! Oh so I'm a farmer now, eh? So I'm gonna have to harvest stuff, eh? I hope one day this whole place becomes one big graveyard and all the loud-mouths are buried right damned here!"]="我讨厌这个地方和这里的每个人！斯密瑟斯做这个！斯密瑟斯做那个！哦，这么说我是个农民了？所以我就得去收割东西了？我希望有一天这整个地方变成一座大坟场，所有那些聒噪的家伙都会被埋在这里！"
G["I hate to disappoint people, but the Stone Crow's closed. If the kids from the orphanage were evacuated, I don't see why we should be open, either."]="我不喜欢让别人失望呢，但是石鸦旅店已经暂停营业了。孤儿院的孩子们都撤离了，我们为什么还要开门做生意。"
G["I hate to keep you here so distracted..."]="我可不想你心烦意乱地待在这里……"
G["I hate to say I told you so..."]="我不想再说我已经警告过你了……"
G["I hate you all!"]="我恨你们所有人！"
G["I hate you so much, Cookie."]="我恨你，曲奇。"
G["I hate you, Deathwing."]="我恨你，死亡之翼。"
G["I hate you, Nobsy."]="我恨你，诺比西。"
G["I hate... every one of you..."]="我恨……你们所有人……"
G["I hated him for what he had done. I hated him for the burden he left me. But now..."]="我恨他的所作所为。我恨他，因为他把负担都留给了我。但是现在……"
G["I have ... failed the master..."]="我……辜负了主人……"
G["I have a bad feeling about the mogu's presence.\n\nThere can only be one reason why they're excavating these mogu artifacts, and it's not for knowledge.\n\nThey're looking for clues to the mogu's power."]="魔古族的出现令我感觉非常不好。\n\n他们挖掘魔古神器的原因只有一个，而且那绝不是为了追求知识。\n\n他们在追寻魔古族的力量之谜。"
G["I have a bad feeling about this place."]="这地方让我感觉很不好。"
G["I have a book that might interest you.  Would you like to take a look?"]="我有一本书，你或许会感兴趣的。想看看吗？"
G["I have a clear shot here! Get me more ammo!"]="射击视野良好！再来点弹药！"
G["I have a different question."]="我另外有个问题。"
G["I have a favor to ask. Could you reward my friend here? I haven't any coin. I can pay you when we get back to Ironforge."]="Tengo que pedirte un favor. ¿Podrías recompensar a mi $gamigo:amiga;? Puedo pagarte cuando volvamos a Forjaz."
G["I have a few ideas on how to help heal the overgrowth, $c.\n\nUnfortunately, Naralex is so upset, he refuses to take any more chances."]="对于治疗这种蔓生，我有一点主意，$c。\n\n不幸的是，纳拉雷克斯已经完全陷入了混乱，拒绝进行任何尝试。"
G["I have a few more questions, Gymer."]="我还有几个问题，盖米尔。"
G["I have a few notes from the job back at my place. I'll get them and then meet you back in the inn."]="我要回去拿点东西，然后再去旅店里见你。"
G["I have a good mind to tear that portal down myself! This is outrageous!"]="我有一个好点子，可以凭一己之力摧毁黑暗之门！哈哈哈！"
G["I have a jar waiting just for you!"]="我的魂瓮正等着你呢！"
G["I have a limitless supply of Kor'kron at my command you fools! Surrender now and I will give you a quick death."]="你们这些蠢货，我手里有着无穷无尽的库卡隆物资！立即投降，我还能给你们一个痛快。"
G["I have a lot of pent up anger and hostility. Just give me a reason, guttersnipe."]="我憋了一肚子的火，别让我朝你发火。"
G["I have a message for the Jade Serpent."]="我有消息要带给青龙。"
G["I have a message for you to deliver to that tyrant!"]="你帮我带个口信给那个暴君！"
G["I have a piece of iron in my back that will remind me of that night for the rest of my days."]="我的后背里还有一小块铁片，这会让我永远记得那个晚上。"
G["I have a pretty good idea what ol' Great-father Winter's gonna be doing when this shift is over.  I got a bottle of Winter Veil cheer right here in my bag, and I intend to get to the bottom of it."]="这轮结束后冬天爷爷会做什么呢，我有一个很好的主意。我在包里有一瓶冬幕啤酒，而且我想喝光它。"
G["I have a pretty good idea what ol' Greatfather Winter's gonna be doing when this shift is over.  I got a bottle of Winter Veil cheer right here in my bag, and I intend to get to the bottom of it."]="这轮结束后冬天爷爷会做什么呢，我有一个很好的主意。我在包里有一瓶冬幕啤酒，而且我想喝光它。"
G["I have a proposal for you, $r.  Please consider your choices carefully - your decision cannot be easily reversed.\n\nIt is time we formalized your allegiance to our organization.  I must know in what capacity you wish to serve us so that we may reward you appropriately."]="我有个建议，$r。请认真考虑你的选择——一旦做出抉择，就很难反悔了。\n\n你已经通过了忠诚的考验，现在是时候让你正式加入我们的组织了。我必须了解你希望以什么样的方式来为我们效力，以便我们为你提供适当的奖励。"
G["I have a ride to Talonbranch Glade courtesy of James Hallow."]="我已得到詹姆斯·哈劳的允许，要取得前往刺枝林地的坐骑。"
G["I have a rock in my nose."]="我的鼻子里有块石头。"
G["I have a rocket here with your mark on it, Snivel."]="斯内维尔，我这有一只火箭，上面有你的标记。"
G["I have a rule: anybody who calls me handsome gets free beer."]="我有个规矩：任何人只要管我叫声帅哥，就有免费的啤酒喝。"
G["I have a special message for $n.  And it says you must die!"]="我有一个特别的消息要交给一个名叫$n的家伙。那就是：你死定了！"
G["I have a task for you."]="我有一个任务要交给你。"
G["I have about half the supplies needed to upgrade to champion units."]="升级到勇士军队所需的物资还差一半呢。"
G["I have about half the supplies needed to upgrade to veteran units."]="升级到精练部队所需的物资还差一半呢。"
G["I have agreed to this meeting, worldbreaker, but at great risk. If this is discovered..."]="我同意来见你，灭世者，但冒着极大的风险。如果我们被发现了……"
G["I have all manner of goods for sale, $c.  Browse at your leisure."]="我出售各种货物，$c。过来看看吧。"
G["I have an ale for every scalp you bring!"]="你们每上交一件战利品，我就奖励你们一桶酒。"
G["I have an idea for a new invention. It's called a pooper hooper. I'll never have to pick up poop again!"]="Tengo una idea para un nuevo invento. Se llama \"recogecacas\". ¡Nunca tendré que volver a recoger caca!"
G["I have an idea.  Let's plant this shard in the ground and see what happens."]="我有个主意。让我们把这块碎片种到地上，看看会发生什么。"
G["I have an idea... this time let's not wander through a naval battle between the Alliance and the Horde.\n\nI'm just saying."]="我有个主意……这次我们别在联盟和部落的海战中徘徊了。\n\n我只是说说。"
G["I have another question."]="我还有一个问题。"
G["I have another question..."]="我还有个问题……"
G["I have another reading from the nether."]="我有另一条从虚空传来的讯息。"
G["I have another task for you, should you be willing, little one."]="如果你愿意的话，我还有一项任务要交给你。"
G["I have arrived. Shall we set to work, then?"]="我到啦。我们开始吧？"
G["I have as much a right as any in the village to fight for my home. If I only knew a hero that could train me..."]="我和村子的所有人一样，都有为家乡而战的权利。要是我认识一个能训练我的英雄就好了……"
G["I have awakened only to sleep once again."]="我从迷梦中苏醒，只是为了再次沉睡。"
G["I have bad feeling about this...."]="我对此有一种不祥的预感……"
G["I have bad news for you Onu'zun: I'm gonna have to cut short your dreams!"]="奥努森，我要告诉你一个坏消息。那就是，我将粉碎你的梦想！"
G["I have battled many beasts, dragon. I will help you."]="我与许多野蛮的家伙都战斗过，龙。我会帮你的。"
G["I have become... DEATH!"]="我变成了……死神！"
G["I have been apprising the lorewalker of your deeds, champion. Are you ready to hear your tale?"]="我已经向游学者叙述了你的事迹，勇士。想听听你的故事吗？"
G["I have been asleep far longer than I thought possible. So much has changed."]="真没想到我竟然睡了如此之久。许多事情都变了。"
G["I have been assisting the flight masters to round up the Hippogryphs that fled their post when the land tore itself apart. Even now our birds remain squeamish."]="当大地被撕裂之后，我一直在帮助飞行管理员寻找逃散的角鹰兽。直到现在，我们的鸟还是无法真正安定下来。"
G["I have been called back to Wyrmrest, ally. Farewell!"]="朋友，我必须返回龙眠神殿了。再见！"
G["I have been chosen!"]="我是被主人选中的！"
G["I have been defeated.  Good fight!"]="我输了。打得好！"
G["I have been dreaming of this day for years, $n, and you have made it all possible. Witness the culmination of a lifetime of work!"]="我梦寐以求的这一天终于到了，$n，是你把这一切变成了现实。见证我毕生的最高成就吧！"
G["I have been expecting you, young one. Come closer - my eyes are not as sharp as they once were."]="我等你好久了，孩子。靠近一点，我的眼睛已经不像以前那么好使了。"
G["I have been expecting you."]="我一直都期待着你的到来。"
G["I have been looking forward to your return, champion."]="我一直在等待你的归来，勇士。"
G["I have been lost in the Dream. I sense his lifeforce but my powers have not yet grown strong enough to make contact."]="我迷失在梦里了。我感觉到了他的生命力，但是我的力量还不够强大，无法进行沟通。"
G["I have been observing your training, my young brothers and sisters."]="你们的苦练我都看在眼里，年轻的兄弟姐妹们。"
G["I have been ordered here, and here I stay and fight under the banner of Stormwind. But everything I do here is empty."]="我被派来这里，以暴风城的名义作战。但是我所做的一切都毫无意义。"
G["I have been programmed to gloat.  Ha ha.  Ha ha.  Ha ha."]="我被加入了幸灾乐祸的程序。哈哈。哈哈。哈哈。"
G["I have been returned to the living."]="我又活过来了。"
G["I have been sent by Sal'salabim to collect a debt that you owe. Pay up or I'm going to have to hurt you."]="我是萨萨拉比姆派来收债的。还钱，否则我就不客气了。"
G["I have been shown the future, $r.\n\nCentaur lands will be forever corrupted if we fail to act quickly."]="我已经见到了未来，$r。\n\n如果我们不能迅速采取行动，半人马的土地将永远地堕落。"
G["I have been slain a hundred times. I always wake here, alive. Some say I am cursed and others..."]="我被杀死过无数次。我总是发现我会在这里醒来。有些人说我遭受了诅咒，还有些人……"
G["I have been taken prisoner by the Twilight's Hammer."]="我被暮光之锤俘虏了。"
G["I have been training hard all week. My hard work will pay off with a victory."]="我刻苦训练了一个星期。胜利将是我努力付出换来的回报。"
G["I have been waiting for you!"]="我一直在等你！"
G["I have been waiting here for an eternity since our last meeting! When will Goramosh be done with his ritual?"]="上次会面之后我就被晾在一边！古拉莫什什么时候才能完成仪式？"
G["I have been watching you and Rexxar.  You must aid him to secure the future of the Horde here in these mountains.  Only when you have forced the ogres into submission and slain their master, Gruul the Dragonkiller, will your people be safe."]="我一直在关注着你和雷克萨。你必须协助他共同保证这座山脉中的部落的未来。只有降服食人魔并消灭他们的主人——屠龙者格鲁尔，你的人民才会获得真正的安全。"
G["I have better things to do..."]="我还有更重要的事情要做……"
G["I have brought the items for the ceremony."]="我带来了仪式所需的物品。"
G["I have built it. And it is mine. Samophlange!"]="是我把它造出来。它是我的。主动式负载平衡器！"
G["I have but helped you begin your journey. Great rewards await you, but whether you finish it is up to you."]="我只能帮助你开始这段旅程。丰厚的奖励在等待着你，可是否要完成它就完全取决于你自己了。"
G["I have changed my mind loyal servants, you do not need to bring the prisoner all the way to my study, I will deal with him here and now."]="我改变了主意，忠诚的仆人们。你们不必把囚犯带到我面前来供我研究了，我现在就开始。"
G["I have channeled all I can! The power is in your hands!"]="这是我所能做的一切了！力量现在掌握在你们的手中！"
G["I have chosen the name \"Wrathion.\" To my knowledge, I am the last of the black dragons.\n\nMy father was Deathwing, the Worldbreaker, the Aspect of Death, the Destroyer... But I hope you will not hold that against me.\n\nI have no love for my father, whose corruption destroyed my race, or for the red dragonflight, who stole away and experimented on my egg to create me.\n\nLet's just say, I am... unaffiliated. And I am always on the lookout for like-minded heroes."]="He elegido el nombre de \"Wrathion\". Por lo que yo sé, soy el último de los dragones negros.\n\nMi padre fue Alamuerte, el Rompemundos, el Aspecto de la Muerte, el Destructor... Pero espero que no me lo tengas en cuenta.\n\nNo tengo ningún cariño hacia mi padre, cuya corrupción destruyó mi raza, o hacia el Vuelo Rojo, quien robó y experimentó con mi huevo para crearme.\n\nDigamos, simplemente, que no estoy en ningún bando. Y siempre estoy a la búsqueda de héroes de corte similar."
G["I have coated your hands with a special mixture, Wakener. Every time you defeat an enemy, their corpse will be injected with a special toxin. Observe the results, and use them to your advantage."]="唤醒者，我已经在你的手上涂了特殊的混合物。每次你打败敌人，他们的尸体将被注入一种特殊的毒素。观察效果，并利用它们取胜。"
G["I have coated your weapons with a special serum. Use it to inject your enemies. Too many injections, and their systems will overload."]="我已经在你的武器上涂了特殊的浆液。把它注入敌人体内。如果注入过多，就会超出他们身体的负荷。"
G["I have coated your weapons with my special mixture, Wakener. You will infect every corpse with a mutagen that... well... you must see the results for yourself."]="唤醒者，我已经在你的武器上涂了特殊的混合物。你刀下的每具尸体都会感染一种诱变剂……好吧……你必须亲眼见证它的效果。"
G["I have come for training."]="我是来接受培训的。"
G["I have come for you, Malfurion."]="我为你而来，玛法里奥。"
G["I have come to kill or be killed!"]="我怀着必死的信念投身战斗！"
G["I have come to learn, Daio."]="戴奥，我是来学习的。"
G["I have come to return you to Kros! Surrender your flesh to me!"]="我来送你回到克洛斯的怀抱！将你的血肉交给我吧！"
G["I have come to support the draenei champion!"]="我是来支持德莱尼勇士的！"
G["I have completed the Trial of the Crusader."]="我完成了十字军的试炼。"
G["I have completed the weapons, $n."]="$n，我已经把武器制作完成了。"
G["I have completed your helm, $n."]="你的头盔已经制作完成了，$n。"
G["I have created the totem.  You, $n, must cleanse the well."]="图腾已经做好了。$n，现在就去净化水井吧。"
G["I have decades of practice handling blowhards like yourself, and I'm the only one you know here in this abominably freezing land."]="我和你打了几十年的交道，听够了你天花乱坠的大话。而在这片萧条的冰原上，我是你唯一认识的人。"
G["I have decided to trust this warlock for now. Let $ghim:her; move about the temple freely."]="我决定暂时相信这位术士。$g他:她;可以自由出入神殿。"
G["I have deduced that you must die!"]="我已得出结论——你必须死！"
G["I have defeated Darmuk! How else may I serve you?"]="我已经击败了达穆克！你还需要我做什么吗？"
G["I have delivered word to Wayward Landing. They should be sending more soldiers shortly."]="我已经往迷航港送了消息。他们应该很快就会派出更多士兵的。"
G["I have destroyed my Azsharite weaponry! I need your assistance in defeating the triad of power."]="我弄坏了我的艾萨莱特水晶武器！我需要你的帮助来打败那三个恶魔。"
G["I have discerned the path that you must take. Are you prepared?"]="He vislumbrado el camino que debes seguir. ¿Estás $gpreparado:preparada;?"
G["I have discovered a use for the carapace of the crypt fiend and its various body parts. I am able to fashion an extremely light and very deadly set of armor by combining the fragments with some of the desecrated magical armors lost in Naxxramas."]="我发现了地穴恶魔身上的甲壳以及其它部位的多种用途。我想我能利用这些碎片，配合纳克萨玛斯内的一些被污染的魔法护甲碎片，制成某种极轻而且实用的护甲套装来。"
G["I have dispatched Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem to the burned out husk of the Sanctuary of Malorne. He is behind the front lines, on scorched terrain known as the Flamewake. He is looking into how we can undo the damage, and investigating the whereabouts of the turtle ancient Tortolla.\n\nBut before you can help him, you must first ensure that the Shrine of Aessina to the west is secure and the animals are saved from the flames. Otherwise all is lost! Concentrate on matters at the Grove of Aessina first, and they will send you to the Arch Druid in good time."]="我已经派大德鲁伊哈缪尔·符文图腾前往被烧得面目全非的玛洛恩庇护所。他在前线的后方——被称作烈焰之痕的焦枯之地。他正在寻找让我们挽回损失的办法，并调查龟神托尔托拉的下落。\n\n但在你前去帮他之前，你必须先确保西边艾森娜神殿的安全，还要保护那里的生灵免受烈焰的侵袭。否则我们将失去一切！先集中精力解决艾森娜林地的问题，然后他们会在适当的时候送你去大德鲁伊那里。"
G["I have done all that I can for the Commander. I am afraid it will not be long, now."]="我已经尽力抢救了。但指挥官恐怕已经坚持不了多久了。"
G["I have done all that I could, Greatmother. I thank you for your kind words."]="我做了所有我能做的事情，祖母。感谢您的赞美之词。"
G["I have done nothing. This is the work of the Slingtail chief, Gukgut."]="我什么都没做。这都是吊尾酋长干的，咕克嘎克。"
G["I have done some pretty twisted things, but what you're doing here is crossing a threshold even for me."]="我干过一些相当变态的事，可你在这儿的所作所为就连我也望尘莫及。"
G["I have done such vile things..."]="我的罪孽深重……"
G["I have dreamed of this moment all my life, Greatmother. 'Till now, all I've had were Orgrim's stories about my parents and their adventures on Draenor. He was my greatest teacher and dearest friend. He died a hero... They all died as heroes - and for all of them, a song of honor remains."]="我一直梦到这个场景，祖母。奥格瑞姆跟我说过很多关于他们的故事和他们在德拉诺的冒险经历。他是我最好的老师和最亲密的朋友，祖母。他像个英雄般地死去了……他们都像英雄般地死去了，荣耀的战歌为他们奏响。"
G["I have duty in an hour, but until then... bottom's up!"]="我一个小时以后还要去值班，但在那之前……干杯！"
G["I have earned my freedom!"]="我已经自由了！"
G["I have empowered another orb! Use it quickly!"]="我又将能量灌入了另一颗宝珠！快去使用它！"
G["I have enough strength left to stand and fight.  Prepare yourself."]="我还能站起来，还能战斗。你也关心一下自己吧。"
G["I have enough supplies to upgrade  our troops to seasoned."]="我有足够的军需将我们的军队升级到经验丰富的军队。"
G["I have enough supplies to upgrade our troops to champions."]="我有足够的军需将我们的军队升级到勇士。"
G["I have enough supplies to upgrade our troops to veterans."]="我有足够的军需将我们的军队升级到老兵。"
G["I have enough torches to erase all three of you!"]="我的火炬足以消灭你们三个！"
G["I have every confidence that we will recover that which Nexus-Prince Haramad desires."]="我们会找到节点亲王哈拉迈德想要的东西，对此我很有信心。"
G["I have everything I need. Quickly, let's move on before they return!"]="好了。快，我们得在他们回来之前继续前进。"
G["I have failed once more..."]="我再次失败了……"
G["I have failed you, Empress."]="我让你失望了，女皇陛下。"
G["I have failed you, empress..."]="我让你失望了，女皇陛下……"
G["I have failed you, master..."]="我让您失望了，主人……"
G["I have failed you, my friend. I am so sorry."]="很抱歉，我辜负了你，我的朋友。"
G["I have failed, but you will not live to tell anyone of this victory!"]="我失败了，可你们别想活着把这场胜利告诉任何人！"
G["I have failed... I have failed in my duty... failed my people... The worgen run rampant, and the Scythe of my goddess is lost."]="我失败了……我最终还是失败了……我愧对我的同胞……狼人肆虐，而女神赐予我的镰刀也丢失了。"
G["I have failed... our sacred brotherhood..."]="我辜负了……我的弟兄们……"
G["I have failed...."]="我失败了……"
G["I have faith in our friends from beyond the mists."]="我信任来自迷雾之外的朋友们。"
G["I have fallen! Fear not, brethren! Let nothing keep you from the Stoneforge!"]="我败了！弟兄们，别害怕！没有谁能将你们赶出岩石熔炉！"
G["I have fallen. I am sorry, I shall train harder for next time."]="我失败了！抱歉，今后我会更加努力训练的。"
G["I have fashioned Yenniku's Soul Gem, $n..."]="我已经对耶尼库的灵魂宝石进行了加工，$n……"
G["I have finished your leg guards, $n."]="我已经完成了你的护腿，$n。"
G["I have food, if you are hungry, and you may make use of my tent, should you require rest."]="如果你饿了，我这里有食物；如果你需要休息，可以钻进我的帐篷。"
G["I have fought by Sarannha's side for as long as I can remember. She is fierce in battle, and I watch her back."]="我和萨拉哈并肩作战多年。她在战斗中总是勇往直前，而我则总是掩护她。"
G["I have found both parts of your scepter."]="我已经找到节杖的两个部分啦。"
G["I have given my all... for the Horde..."]="我为部落……奉献了一切……"
G["I have given you all the knowledge I have, $n. May luck be with you."]="我已经把我所有的知识都教给你了，$n。祝你好运。"
G["I have given you an oathstone of Ysera's Dragonflight, $n.  When you are ready and able to aid us, use it, and then we may begin."]="Te he dado una piedra de juramento del Vuelo de Ysera, $n. Cuando creas que estás $gpreparado:preparada; para ayudarnos, úsala y podremos empezar."
G["I have grown so much thanks to you!"]="是你让我成长了许多！"
G["I have had basic warrior training, but no one knows that I have more skill with spellcasting."]="我已经接受过基础战士训练了，可大家都不知道，其实我的施法技巧更加出色。"
G["I have had this object in my possession for 10 years. Since Blackrock Spire..."]="我得到这个东西已经有十年了。自从黑石塔……"
G["I have heard of your \"heroism,\" Locust. They say your raids on mogu labor camps and farmlands delayed the completion of the wall by decades."]="He oído hablar de tu \"heroísmo,\" Langosta. Dicen que tus asaltos a los campos de cultivo y los campos de trabajos forzados mogu retrasaron la finalización de la muralla durante décadas."
G["I have heard of your kind, but I never thought to see the day when I would meet a half-breed."]="我听说过你的族群，但是我从没想到真的会遇到一个。"
G["I have heard rumors that our old friends, the elves, have allied themselves with the Horde. I always said our trust in them was foolish."]="我听到传言说，我们的老朋友——精灵们，和部落结盟了。我一直在说，信任他们是非常愚蠢的。"
G["I have heard tale of my boy being here. That he's now a powerful death knight in service of the Lich King. If this is true, then it must be me that ends the bloodline.\n\nMy charge now is to command Orgrim's Hammer to the top of Icecrown Citadel and destroy all Scourge that get in our way. We leave when you and your allies are ready."]="我曾听过我的孩子在那里发生的故事。现在，他已经成了巫妖王手下一名强大的死亡骑士。如果这是真的，我必须大义灭亲。\n\n我现在的责任就是指挥奥格瑞姆之锤号抵达冰冠堡垒之顶，并消灭所有阻拦我们的天灾军团。你和你的盟友准备好以后我们就出发。"
G["I have heard tale of the Maelstrom itself opening up, threatening to devour the world. Could you imagine such a thing?"]="我听说大漩涡已经打开了，将要吞掉整个世界。你能想象这种事情吗？"
G["I have heard tell of many dangerous enemies and creatures on the Isle of Thunder. It seems that every day, the threat changes."]="我听说雷神岛上有许多危险的敌人和生物。看来，外部的威胁每天都在发生变化。"
G["I have heard that Northrend is lost..."]="我听说诺森德已经沦陷了……"
G["I have heard that there are many hidden treasures on the island."]="我听说岛上藏着许多宝藏。"
G["I have heard the call, my lord!"]="主人，我听到了你的召唤。"
G["I have heard the rumors and the jokes..."]="我听过那些谣言和笑话……"
G["I have heard there are master alchemists among the Klaxxi, far over the wall in the Dread Wastes. I will mark the location on your map for you."]="我听说在卡拉克西当中有炼金大师，就在距离长城很远的恐惧废土。我会为你在地图上标出位置。"
G["I have heard whisperings from the east that our esteemed Scarab Lord has joined the battle, as have entire batallions from Shattrath: heroes blessed by A'dal himself, granted rank as Hand of A'dal!"]="我听到东方传来的低语，备受尊敬的甲虫之王已经投身战斗，沙塔斯城也派来了一支精英部队。这支军队接受过阿达尔的赐福，他们都拥有一个响亮的头衔：阿达尔之手！"
G["I have heard you before.  You are here to save your world; to learn from ours.  Greatmother Geyah has charged me with instructing you, and as such, you will listen to me, Go'el."]="我听说过你。你来此拯救你的世界，从我们这里学习知识。盖亚安祖母命我指导你，因此，你必须听我的话，古伊尔。"
G["I have heard your words, Great Bear Spirit, and I understand.  I now seek your blessings to fully learn the way of the Claw."]="我听到你的话了，巨熊之灵，而且我理解。我现在寻求你的赐福以深入地学习力利爪的技能。"
G["I have honored the Horde with years of service, and this is how I am treated?"]="我已经为部落效力多年，立下无数功劳，而我现在只能受到这样的待遇？"
G["I have it! The gates are undone!"]="成功了！门打开了！"
G["I have just completed a new dimensional imploder that will make me rich beyond my wildest goblin dreams!   All I need to do is get a skilled Goblin Engineer to build a dimensional ripper that connects to it and try it!"]="Acabo de completar un nuevo implosionador dimensional que me hará más rico de lo que cualquier goblin puede soñar. Todo lo que necesito es un ingeniero gnomo capacitado para construir el desgarrador dimensional que lo conecta y probarlo."
G["I have just returned from the wall.\n\nThere, I heard rumors of a faction called The Klaxxi from beyond the Serpent's Spine. Supposedly, they are a council of mantid elders who have split off from the Mantid Empire, and now work in direct defiance of the mantid queen.\n\nI have seen with my own eyes the power that these mantid wield.\n\nIf these rumors are true, then perhaps there is a way to ally with these... Klaxxi... and work with them to stop the mantid swarm."]="我刚刚从城墙那边回来。\n\n我在那边听说了一些关于卡拉克西螳螂妖的谣言。据说他们来自蟠龙脊之外，可能是从螳螂妖帝国分裂出来的螳螂妖长老议会。如今他们正公然违抗螳螂妖女皇的命令。\n\n我亲眼见识了这些螳螂妖的法力。\n\n如果这些谣言可信，我们就有可能找到一条途径联合这些……卡拉克西……并和他们共同阻止螳螂妖虫群。"
G["I have just the spell to get this door open. Too bad the cell doors weren't locked so haphazardly."]="我能打开这扇门。但是为什么正好我就没法打开监牢的门呢？"
G["I have just the spot for this horn!"]="这里正好有个地方可以摆放这支角！"
G["I have just the thing you need to cast your spell."]="我有你所需要的施法材料。"
G["I have kept the Bell safe as promised, Master."]="主人，我一直谨守誓言，守护着圣钟。"
G["I have killed many of your ogres, Lantresor. I have no fear."]="我已经杀了很多你说的食人魔，兰特瑞索。我并不害怕。"
G["I have learned how to make an ancient pandaren tincture that will allow us to see into Shan Kien's past. We have but to gather the elements for this brew."]="我知道如何调制一种古代熊猫人酒剂，借助这种酒剂，我们能看到单简的过去。所以我们只需要收集调酒需要的原料。"
G["I have learned much from these monks, $r. You would do well to do the same."]="我从这里的武僧身上学到了很多东西，$r。希望你也一样。"
G["I have learned much of potions over the long years, $n, and that knowledge is at your disposal. You have only to ask."]="我已经用多年学会了很多药剂知识，$n，而那些知识都由你支配。你只需提要求就可以。"
G["I have less than one-third of the supplies needed to upgrade to veteran units."]="升级到精练部队所需的物资只有不到三分之一。"
G["I have long known you'd seek me out, $n.\n\nEvery sentient being in this world is driven by the choices they make.  Choices beget further choices, and these in turn make someone who they are.  This is where your fortune is drawn from - who you are, and the choices you make.\n\nAre you ready to discover where your fortune lies?"]="Sabía desde hace mucho tiempo que vendrías a buscarme, $n.\n\nTodos los seres sensibles del mundo dependen en gran medida de las decisiones que toman. Las decisiones conllevan más decisiones y, estas, nos convierten en lo que somos. Ahí yace tu fortuna, quién eres y las decisiones que tomas.\n\n¿$gListo:Lista; para descubrir dónde yace tu fortuna?"
G["I have long waited for an opportunity to deal with the Sunreavers. I asked my late husband to remove them from the city, but he believed too firmly in the neutrality of the Kirin Tor.\n\nHe was wise, but he was short-sighted. This has always been the destiny of the Kirin Tor: to serve the Alliance."]="我早就想和夺日者划清界限了，只是一直在等待这样的机会。我曾向我过世的丈夫提过将他们赶出达拉然，但是他决意要把肯瑞托放在绝对中立的位置。\n\n他是个睿智的人，但是远见不足。肯瑞托的命运就应当如此：效忠联盟。"
G["I have lost my Band of Unending Life. Are you able to replace it for me?"]="我弄丢了我的不灭生命之戒。你能再给我一枚吗？"
G["I have lost my Band of Vaulted Secrets. Are you able to replace it for me?"]="我弄丢了我的魔法秘密之戒。你能再给我一枚吗？"
