G["I have lost my Blade of Eternal Justice. Are you able to replace it for me?"]="我弄丢了我的永恒公正长剑。你能再给我一把吗？"
G["I have lost my Blade of Vaulted Secrets. Are you able to replace it for me?"]="我弄丢了我的魔法秘密之刃。你能再给我一把吗？"
G["I have lost my Cape of Eternal Justice. Are you able to replace it for me?"]="我弄丢了我的永恒公正斗篷。你能再给我一件吗？"
G["I have lost my Cloak of Unending Life. Are you able to replace it for me?"]="我弄丢了我的不灭生命披风。你能再给我一件吗？"
G["I have lost my Cloak of Veiled Shadows. Are you able to replace it for me?"]="我弄丢了我的笼罩阴影披风。你能再给我一件吗？"
