G["I have lost my Cloak of the Unseen Path. Are you able to replace it for me?"]="我弄丢了我的隐秘通途披风。你能再给我一件吗？"
G["I have lost my Confessor's Mantle and require a replacement, Al'tabim."]="我的赞达拉忏悔者衬肩丢了，需要一付新的。"
G["I have lost my Dagger of Veiled Shadows. Are you able to replace it for me?"]="我弄丢了我的笼罩阴影匕首。你能再给我一把吗？"
G["I have lost my Drape of Unyielding Strength. Are you able to replace it for me?"]="我弄丢了我的坚定力量披风。你能再给我一件吗？"
G["I have lost my Drape of Vaulted Secrets. Are you able to replace it for me?"]="我弄丢了我的魔法秘密披风。你能再给我一件吗？"
G["I have lost my Gavel of Infinite Wisdom. Are you able to replace it for me?"]="我弄丢了我的无尽智慧之锤。你能再给我一把吗？"
G["I have lost my Hammer of the Gathering Storm. Are you able to replace it for me?"]="我弄丢了我的聚集风暴之锤。你能再给我一把吗？"
G["I have lost my Kris of Unspoken Names. Are you able to replace it for me?"]="我弄丢了我的禁断邪语短剑。你能再给我一把吗？"
G["I have lost my Mace of Unending Life. Are you able to replace it for me?"]="我弄丢了我的不灭生命之锤。你能再给我一把吗？"
G["I have lost my Ring of Eternal Justice. Are you able to replace it for me?"]="我弄丢了我的永恒公正之戒。你能再给我一枚吗？"
G["I have lost my Ring of Infinite Wisdom. Are you able to replace it for me?"]="我弄丢了我的无尽智慧之戒。你能再给我一枚吗？"
G["I have lost my Ring of Unspoken Names. Are you able to replace it for me?"]="我弄丢了我的禁断邪语之戒。你能再给我一枚吗？"
G["I have lost my Ring of the Gathering Storm. Are you able to replace it for me?"]="我弄丢了我的聚集风暴之戒。你能再给我一枚吗？"
G["I have lost my Schools of Arcane Magic - Mastery volume.  Can you provide me with a replacement?"]="我把《奥术魔法的学派 - 精通》弄丢了。你能再给我一本吗？"
G["I have lost my Scythe of the Unseen Path. Are you able to replace it for me?"]="我弄丢了我的隐秘通途之镰。你能再给我一把吗？"
G["I have lost my Shroud of Infinite Wisdom. Are you able to replace it for me?"]="我弄丢了我的无尽智慧披风。你能再给我一件吗？"
G["I have lost my Shroud of Unspoken Names. Are you able to replace it for me?"]="我弄丢了我的禁断邪语披风。你能再给我一件吗？"
G["I have lost my Sickle of Unyielding Strength. Are you able to replace it for me?"]="我弄丢了我的坚定力量之镰。你能再给我一把吗？"
G["I have lost my Signet of Unyielding Strength. Are you able to replace it for me?"]="我弄丢了我的坚定力量之戒。你能再给我一枚吗？"
G["I have lost my Signet of the Unseen Path. Are you able to replace it for me?"]="我弄丢了我的隐秘通途之戒。你能再给我一枚吗？"
G["I have lost my Titanium Seal of Dalaran.  Can you provide me with a replacement?"]="我弄丢了达拉然泰坦神铁徽记。能再给我一枚吗？"
G["I have lost my Zandalar Haruspex's Tunic, Maywiki. Do you have a replacement?"]="我弄丢了我的赞达拉占卜师外套，梅维克，你这还有吗？"
G["I have lost my Zandalar Illusionist's Robe and need a new one, Al'tabim."]="我搞丢了我的赞达拉幻术师长袍，需要一件新的，阿塔比姆。"
G["I have lost my reins. Could you provide me with another?"]="我把缰绳给弄丢了。你能再给我一根吗？"
G["I have lost my talisman and require a new one, Jin'rokh."]="我弄丢了我的饰物，能给我一个新的吗？"
G["I have lost the Eye of Haramad and require a replacement, Ameer."]="我弄丢了哈拉迈德之眼，能再给我一个吗，阿米尔？"
G["I have lost the talisman and require a new one, Al'tabim."]="我弄丢了我的饰物，能给我一个新的吗？"
G["I have lost the talisman, Falthir. I require a replacement."]="法希尔，我把坠饰弄丢了。我需要一个新的。"
G["I have lost to your mastery."]="我已经败给了你的战技。"
G["I have made contact, $n. It is Lokholar the Ice Lord. He has deemed our cause worthy - our earth bound sacrifice sufficient. He comes soon... prepare yourself."]="我已经做过接触了，$n。那是冰雪之王洛克霍拉。他认为我们的事业很有价值--我们给大地的祭品十分充足。他很快就来了……做好准备。"
G["I have managed to remove my gloves.  You may lob them at our foe."]="我把手套也脱下来了。快用它来砸我们的敌人。"
G["I have marks to redeem!"]="我要兑换徽记！"
G["I have marks to redeem."]="我要兑换徽记。"
G["I have misplaced Archmage Vargoth's Staff."]="我把大法师瓦格斯的法杖弄丢了。"
G["I have misplaced my Zandalar Augur's Bracers and require another pair."]="我的赞达拉预言者护腕找不到了，需要一付新的。"
G["I have misplaced my worg disguise."]="我弄丢了座狼伪装服。"
G["I have much knowledge to impress upon you, $c. You must learn to hunt with honor."]="我有许多知识可以让你大开眼界，$c。你必须学会带着荣耀去狩猎。"
G["I have much to do! Why can they not leave me to my work?"]="我有很多事要做！为什么他们不让我去工作？"
G["I have much to ponder, $n. Get out there and make yourself useful."]="我有很多事要操心，$n。出去找点事，证明你的价值。"
G["I have much to ponder."]="我的思绪很乱。"
G["I have my wife, two strong daughters, and two strong sons. Thank you, but we can protect this farm ourselves."]="我有妻子，两个健壮的女儿，还有两个强壮的儿子。谢谢你，但我们能保卫这个农场。"
G["I have neither the time, nor the inclination, to explain things to you, scumbag!  Now do you have something important to say, or are you just here to ask me out for a drink, princess?"]="我既没有时间，也没有兴趣来和你解释什么，混账！现在你还有什么要说的吗？或者你来这里只不过是要我和你一起去喝杯酒，公主？"
G["I have never failed a mission in many years, $n. I am not about to do so now."]="Hace muchos años que no fracaso en una misión, $n. No pienso empezar ahora."
G["I have never felt such strength radiate from an orc. Is he... mortal..."]="我从未在一个兽人身上感到如此强大的力量。他是……凡人吗……"
G["I have never seen a place like this. Have you, $n?"]="我没见过这样的地方。你呢，$n？"
G["I have never seen a trainee with skills such as yours. I must tell the others."]="我从没见过像你这么厉害的学徒。我得告诉其他人去。"
G["I have never seen anything like this. Have you, $n?"]="我从没见过这样的东西。你呢，$n？"
G["I have never seen one of those before."]="我从没见过那样的东西。"
G["I have no business with you, stranger. What do you want?"]="No tengo nada que decirte, $gforastero:forastera;. ¿Qué quieres?"
G["I have no choice but to obey!"]="除了服从，我别无选择！"
G["I have no doubt of that, Dalfors, but will we be alive to see it happen?"]="我毫不怀疑这一点，但是我们真的能活着见到那一天吗？"
G["I have no equal!"]="我无可匹敌！"
G["I have no further training for you.  Continue east, to the Menders' Stead, for now.  You will be summoned when the Battle for Andorhal commences.  Hopefully Koltira doesn't wait too long..."]="No puedo instruirte más. Por ahora, continúa al este hasta La Finca de los Ensalmadores. Serás $gconvocado:convocada; cuando comience la batalla por Andorhal. Con suerte, Koltira no esperará demasiado..."
G["I have no idea what goes on here, but I will gladly join your fight against this impudent imbecile!"]="我不知道这里发生了什么事情，但是我会很高兴和你们一起收拾这个无理的蠢材！"
G["I have no idea where he's at. I haven't seen him since we landed!"]="我真的不知道他在哪儿。抵达这里之后，我就再也没有见过他了！"
G["I have no idea who you are, but your presence is most welcome. Archimonde and his Scourge army could attack at any time, $C. Will you stand with us against this evil?"]="我不知道你是谁，但是我欢迎你的到来。阿克蒙德和他的天灾军团随时都有可能向我们进攻，$c。你会和我们一起面对这些恶魔吗？"
G["I have no interest in buying anything that you are here to sell me, friend!"]="我对你卖的货物完全不感兴趣，朋友！"
G["I have no love for the intruders, Stonemother, but these fleshlings went well out of their way to cleanse the filth from the Crimson Expanse."]="我不喜欢入侵者，石母，但这些血肉之躯不辞辛苦地清理掉了赤红岩床上的污秽。"
G["I have no more knowledge to bestow upon you. Go through the archway and down the ramp to the southeast, and talk to Doctor Herbert Halsey. He is a Forsaken who can teach you more advanced techniques."]="我没有可传授给你的知识了。穿过拱门走下斜坡到东南方，找赫伯特·哈尔希医生谈谈。他是个被遗忘者，他能教给你更加高级的技术。"
G["I have no more trials for you today, $n. Return to us again soon."]="今天已经没什么要考验你的了，$n。有空常回来看看。"
G["I have no need for bones to best you!"]="我可不需要用骨头来打败你！"
G["I have no need for eyes to see my enemies. Your clumsy footsteps and foul stench give you away!"]="我无须用双眼来发现我的敌人。沉重的脚步声和恶臭已经让你们暴露了！"
G["I have no need for this. Do you want it?"]="我不需要。你想要吗？"
G["I have no quarrel with you, stranger."]="No estoy peleada contigo, $gforastero:forastera;."
G["I have no room for you here, $n. The Kor'kron have taken over my inn as a temporary barracks."]="我这里没有房间了，$n。我的旅馆已经被库卡隆征用，成为临时兵营了。"
G["I have no taste for these games, Tirion. Still... I trust they will perform admirably."]="我对这些游戏可没什么兴趣，提里奥。不过……我相信它们一定很精彩。"
G["I have no time for a sermon now, $c. Seek your knowledge elsewhere."]="我现在没有时间来说教，$c。到别的地方去寻找你的知识吧。"
G["I have no time for interruptions."]="我可没时间停下来。"
G["I have no time for small talk, $n."]="我可没时间闲聊，$n。"
G["I have no time for such diversions. Keepers of Eternity, will you stand for your queen?"]="我没时间处理这等琐事。永恒守卫，你们是否愿意为女王而战？"
G["I have no time for this!"]="别浪费我的时间！"
G["I have no time for you, $r. Continue on your way."]="我没时间理你，$r。你还是继续走你的路吧。"
G["I have no time to waste on the likes of you $c."]="我没有时间浪费在像你这样的人身上$c。"
G["I have no use for cowards in my army. Lately, I have been questioning the blood elves' courage, and loyalty."]="我的部队不需要懦夫。最近，我一直在质疑血精灵的勇气，和忠诚。"
G["I have not always been the Banshee Queen, $n."]="No siempre he sido la Reina alma en pena."
G["I have not come this far to be stopped! The future I have planned will not be jeopardized! Now you will taste true power!!"]="我的心血是不会被你们轻易浪费的！我精心谋划的未来是不会被你们轻易破坏的！感受我真正的力量吧！"
G["I have not come to kill you, night elf. And the gods did not do this..."]="我不会杀你的，暗夜精灵。神明也不会这么做的……"
G["I have not completed the Trial of the Crusader."]="我还没有完成十字军的试炼。"
G["I have not seen Lo since he made off with my student, Syra. They were heading east toward the Arboretum.\n\nIt will not go well if their parents learn of this. The Wanderbrews and the Goldendrafts have had a long standing feud."]="自从罗拐跑了我的弟子塞拉之后，我就再也没有见到过他了。他们往东边的百木园去了。\n\n这要是让他们的父母知道了可就糟了，游酒家族和金酿家族向来水火不容啊。"
G["I have not yet... begun to..."]="我还……没有开始……"
G["I have nothing I'm allowed to sell to you."]="我这儿没什么东西可以卖给你。"
G["I have nothing for you.\n\nHegrid, though, has been gathering Twilight supplies to replenish our own. You might speak with her."]="我这里没有你要找的东西。\n\n不过赫格莉德正在收集暮光补给品，供我们自己使用。你也许应该找她谈一谈。"
G["I have nothing more to teach you. Talk to Karolek if you wish to further your leatherworking skills."]="No tengo nada más que enseñarte. Habla con Karolek si quieres seguir mejorando tus habilidades como $gpeletero:peletera;."
G["I have nothing to hide."]="我没有什么可隐瞒的。"
G["I have nothing to say to you, $r."]="我跟你没什么好说的，$r。"
G["I have nothing to say to you, $r. Your people have a lot to answer for. But maybe this is a new beginning."]="我跟你没什么好说的，$r。你们的人要为许多事情负责。但这或许能成为一个新的开始。"
G["I have nothing to teach you, $c."]="我没什么可教你的，$c。"
G["I have observed four different kinds of plants that have been affected by the corruption: the songflower, the windblossom, the whipper root, and the night dragon plant.  The songflower and windblossom are common plants in Felwood, while the whipper root and night dragon are seen less frequently.  All are a vital part of Felwood's ecosystem."]="我已经观测到有四种植物受到了腐蚀术的影响：轻歌花、迎风花、鞭根草和夜龙植物。轻歌花和迎风花是费伍德森林中常见的植物，而鞭根草和夜龙植物就不那么常见了。所有这些都是费伍德森林生态系统的重要组成部分。"
G["I have opened a portal into the Dream. Your salvation lies within, heroes..."]="我打开了进入梦境的传送门。英雄们，救赎就在其中……"
G["I have opened the portal to my retreat. Go and rest. I'll need you lively when our studies resume in the morning, you nimble little thing."]="我已经打开了通向我的休养之地的传送门。去休息一下吧。当我们的研究在早晨重新开始的时候，我需要你保持充沛的活力，机敏的小东西。"
G["I have orders for you to return to the battlefront."]="我接到命令让你回到前线。"
G["I have orders here for an attack on alliance forces in the middle fields.  I need someone to get them to the assault leader."]="我在此有命令从中场进攻联盟军队。我需要有人把它们带到攻击指挥那里。"
G["I have other business that must be done in Azshara, so I will join you on your journey, $n."]="我在艾萨拉还有其它事情要解决，所以我会和你一起上路，$n。"
G["I have other matters to attend to for the master.  Let's make this quick so that I can get back to them."]="我还要为主人打点别的事务。我们来个速战速决怎么样，这样我就能做自己的事情了。"
G["I have outfitted kings. With the proper training, you can too."]="我给国王提供过装备。如果有正确的训练，你也可以。"
G["I have paid your price, Gloom'rel.  Now, teach me your secrets!"]="我已经把你要的都给你了，格鲁雷尔。现在，告诉我你的秘密！"
G["I have pets -- ca-caw! -- of my own!"]="我有自己的—呱嘎—宠物！"
G["I have plenty of emergency pool ponies, $n. Please throw them to our laborers in the water below."]="我有许多应急小马泳圈，$n。把它们扔给水中的劳工们。"
G["I have pondered the matter unceasingly.\n\nI believe that a weapon might be fashioned which would rival Frostmourne in power without enslaving  its master.\n\nNevermind it, $r. Even if it were possible, there's not time to create such an artifact.\n\nIt is best that you focus your energies on our assault."]="我一直不断地思考这个问题。\n\n我相信可以造出一件能与霜之哀伤抗衡但却不会奴役其使用者的武器。\n\n算了，$r。即使有这个可能，也没有打造这样一件神器的时间了。\n\n你最好还是把精力专注在我们的这场战斗上吧。"
G["I have power you'll never know, Malfurion."]="我拥有你从未知晓的力量，玛法里奥。"
G["I have powerful friends, and they will not be happy to hear I was treated this way!"]="我有掌握权柄的朋友。如果他们听到我被这样对待，肯定不会高兴的！"
G["I have reason to believe you're involved in cultist activity."]="我有理由相信你参与了信徒的行动。"
G["I have regained control! Everyone - back to your posts!"]="我已经夺回了控制权！大家都回到自己的岗位上去！"
G["I have returned to finish what I started, Darkspear. These islands shall run with your blood."]="我回来是为了结束我所开始的一切，暗矛巨魔。这些岛屿将成为你的墓地。"
G["I have returned, Greatmother. Garrosh has found his heart and his fury."]="我回来了，祖母。加尔鲁什找回了他的信心和斗志。"
G["I have risen!"]="我重生了！"
G["I have run out of extinguishing mixture. May I have another vial?"]="我用完了熄焰之水。你可以再给我一瓶吗？"
G["I have run through these plains for many, many seasons.  And I have hunted great beasts.  And I had never been bested... until I faced Ghost Howl.\n\nLong ago, the massive wolf was an ally to the tauren and fought bravely against the Burning Legion.  But he was wounded savagely by a demon, and the tear in his flesh never healed.  Eventually... it drove Ghost Howl mad.\n\nNow he roams the plains in agony, seeking an end to his pain.  To my shame, when we fought I lacked the strength to slay him..."]="我在这片平原上生活了很多很多年，我捕猎过许多凶猛的野兽，从来没有失败过……直到我遇见了鬼嚎。\n\n很久以前，这只巨狼曾经是牛头人的盟友，还和燃烧军团英勇作战。不过后来它被一个恶魔所伤，身上的伤口一直没有治愈。最后……这道伤口把它逼疯了。\n\n现在它总是痛苦地在平原上游荡，寻找终止它的痛苦的方法。我很惭愧，因为我无力把他杀掉……"
G["I have secured escape for us, $n.  You are to come with me."]="我为我们安排了逃路，$n。你们跟我来。"
G["I have seen firsthand what the Forsaken are capable of doing. It is true. They hunt us... slaughter the defenseless."]="可我亲眼目睹过被遗忘者的卑鄙行径。这是真的。他们追杀我们……杀死那些毫无还手之力的无辜民众。"
G["I have seen humble slaves endure unimaginable torture, only to rise up and overthrow their masters."]="我见过卑微的奴隶忍受着难以想象的折磨，只为推翻他们的主人。"
G["I have seen it... From this blessed crystal we will forge a weapon. This weapon will hold inside it a piece of each of us... And when it is used against undead, it shall cast them down. And in its wake, it will leave only ashes..."]="我看到了……我从这块神圣的水晶中看到了……我们会铸造一件武器。这件武器中包含着我们每个人的力量……当它面对亡灵时，它会释放出这种力量，毁灭它们。这把武器所到之处，留下的只有灰烬……"
G["I have seen many battles, healed many allies, cleansed many souls, and many enemies have fallen victim to my command.\nYou may feel safe inside these city walls but make no mistake, war plagues these lands like a pandemic and only the chosen few live to tell the tale."]="He presenciado innumerables batallas, sanado a mis aliados, purificado incontables almas, y muchos enemigos han sido víctimas de mis órdenes.\n\nPuede que te sientas $gseguro:segura; dentro de las murallas de esta ciudad, pero no te equivoques: la guerra asola estas tierras como una pandemia, y solo unos pocos elegidos viven para contarlo."
G["I have seen many dangers in these wastes.  Who knows what creatures yet lurk in the dust to ambush the unwary?"]="我在这片荒野上看到了许多危险的存在。谁会注意到那些生物竟然潜伏在灰烬中，准备伏击那些粗心大意的旅者呢？"
G["I have seen many students over the years, but there is something different about you."]="这些年来，我见过不少弟子，但你似乎有些与众不同。"
G["I have seen many things in my life, but never have I encountered a creature as strange as you."]="我这一生见多识广，可从没遇见过像你这么奇怪的生物。"
G["I have seen many things. But the cruelty of the mogu still curdles my blood."]="我也算见过些场面。可魔古族的残暴还是令我的血液为之凝固。"
G["I have seen saurok with more fighting panache than what you have just displayed."]="我见过的蜥蜴人都比你刚才打得更像样。"
G["I have seen so much during my journey through this land. I feel older and perhaps a bit... wiser."]="我在这片土地上旅行时，目睹了许多见闻。我感觉自己长大了一些……也许还略微……睿智了点儿。"
G["I have seen the Horde's world. I have been inside their cities. Inside their minds..."]="我对部落了如指掌。无论是他们的城市，还是他们的思维……"
G["I have seen the TRUTH - and my chains have been broken."]="我见证了真理，我的枷锁已经碎了。"
G["I have seen the fall of the Lich King. Creations of the titans have fallen before my mighty axe. When called upon, I alone spearheaded a victory for the Argent Crusade against the beasts of Northrend. Now, I come for the ultimate challenge. What does Hillsbrad Foothills have to offer Kingslayer Orkus???"]="我见证了巫妖王的毁灭。泰坦的造物被我强大的战斧摧毁。得到号令的时候，我一个人与诺森德的怪物们对战，凭一己之力为银色北伐军赢得了巨大的胜利。现在，我来接受这场终极挑战。希尔斯布莱德丘陵能为弑君者奥尔库斯献上些什么？？？"
G["I have seen the future, brothers and sisters, and in it the Horde are no more!"]="我见到了未来，兄弟姐妹们，但却没有看到部落的踪影！"
G["I have seen worlds bathed in the Makers' flames, their denizens fading without as much as a whimper. Entire planetary systems born and razed in the time that it takes your mortal hearts to beat once. Yet all throughout, my own heart devoid of emotion... of empathy. I. Have. Felt. Nothing. A million-million lives wasted. Had they all held within them your tenacity? Had they all loved life as you do?"]="我曾见证过无数个世界被造物者的烈焰吞噬，那些世界中的人们甚至来不及发出一声悲鸣就永远消逝了。整个星球从诞生到毁灭，不过是弹指一挥间。但是从始至终，我都没有为之动容……我，毫无，感觉。千亿的生命被毁灭。他们是否都像你们一样坚强？他们是否都像你们一样热爱生命？"
G["I have seen you in these parts before. I can see that you are a $c, from the look of you."]="Te he visto otras veces por aquí. Por tu aspecto, diría que eres $gun:una; $c."
G["I have seen your magic. I know that you are not saurok. You are other.\n\nYour magic makes you weak. You are not brave. You are coward who hides in enemy's skin. YOU ARE NOT STRONG!\n\n<Gokkar spits at your feet.>"]="He visto tu magia. Sé que no eres un saurok. Eres otra cosa.\n\nTu magia te hace débil. No eres valiente. Eres $gun:una; cobarde que se esconde tras la piel del enemigo. ¡NO ERES FUERTE!\n\n<Gokkar escupe a tus pies.>"
G["I have seen your sky-fortress. Your people have an interesting notion of \"peace.\""]="我见过你们的空中堡垒。你们对“和平”的定义很是有趣。"
G["I have selected a landing site for our forces: a small peninsula to our east that is easily defended."]="我已经选好了登陆点：就是我们东边那座易守难攻的半岛。"
G["I have sent all the warriors I can. Had I but even one more for you..."]="我已经派出所有可以调遣的战士。要是我能再为你派出哪怕一个人……"
G["I have sent my boy to Thal'darah Grove to fetch you proof. You will soon see that they pose no threat to us."]="我已经派人去萨达拉树林找你所谓的证据了。你很快就会发现，那里的人根本不会对我们构成任何威胁。"
G["I have sent to Light's Hope Chapel for a grant of gold for the care of the refugees. Carry out your mission, but help as you can."]="我已经派人前往圣光之愿礼拜堂来筹措照料难民所需要的资金。执行你的任务，但也请尽全力帮助我们。"
G["I have served to the last...."]="我战斗到了最后一刻……"
G["I have set back the flow of time just once more.  If you fail to prevent Thrall's death, then all is lost."]="我再次将时间逆转了。如果你不能阻止萨尔的死，那么一切就全完了。"
G["I have shown you part of the course. Now, let us see the finish line. Follow me!"]="我已经带你看过了部分赛道。现在让我们去瞧瞧终点线吧。跟我来！"
G["I have so many wonders to show you."]="我会让你大吃一惊的。"
G["I have so much to do... so much before the plague comes..."]="我有很多要做的……在瘟疫来之前有很多……"
G["I have some Candy Coins I would like to exchange."]="我有一些想交换的糖果硬币。"
G["I have some cookies for you!"]="来吃点小甜饼吧。"
G["I have some left over."]="我还有点剩下的。"
G["I have some skill in the magical arts, but I wish I had more formal training."]="我有一些魔法天分，可我希望能接受更加系统的训练。"
G["I have something else to ask you about."]="我还有其他事想问你。"
G["I have something for you..."]="我有些东西给你。"
G["I have sometin' to show ya. It be easier to understand if ya see it yourself."]="我要让你看样东西。亲眼看到它，你就会明白了。"
G["I have sometin' to show you. It be easier to understand if ya see it yourself."]="我要让你看样东西。亲眼看到它，你就会明白了。"
G["I have sores older than you."]="我在外作战的时候你还穿着开裆裤呢。"
G["I have spent countless hours preparing for this battle."]="我为这场战斗做了无数小时的准备。"
G["I have spoken to some of your... Alliance... friends. Your people are quite interesting."]="我已经和你的一些……联盟……朋友聊过了。你们的人相当有趣。"
G["I have studied for years to master the art of the chi blast and would be honored to fight by your side. Would you like my assistance?"]="我潜心苦练了好几年，以掌握真气冲击的要诀，很荣幸能与你并肩战斗。你需要我的协助吗？"
G["I have such a hard time gathering firewood..."]="收集柴火对我来说太辛苦了……"
G["I have such fascinating things to show you."]="我有一些很棒的东西要展示给你们……"
G["I have suffered, but now I can feel it slowly fading from me. I feel... free."]="我经受过痛苦，但是现在我能感觉到它正从我身上消退。我感到……自由了。"
G["I have survived the poisons of the Forsaken, $n, and I know now what must be done."]="我险些就被那些亡灵的毒药所害，$n，现在我知道必须要做什么了。"
G["I have the best seat in the house, don't you think?"]="我的位子是整个庭院里最好的，你不觉得吗？"
G["I have the charm with me and I will unlock its power once the crate is in my hands. You were wise to change your mind, Barnes."]="我已经把护符带来了。只要一拿到箱子，我就释放它的力量。你肯改变主意是个很明智的决定，巴恩斯。"
G["I have the fuel!  Take me to Raven's Wood."]="我有燃料！带我去乌鸦林。"
G["I have the key, let's start the raid. [Queue for solo instance.]"]="我拿到钥匙了，我们开始突击吧。[排队等待单人副本。]"
G["I have the most respect for the sparktouched out of all of the oracles... they have stood up for their land admirably."]="灵鳍神谕者是我最敬重的神谕者……他们勇敢地守护了自己的家园，令人钦佩啊。"
G["I have the proper certification to use the bank."]="[DND] 我已经取得了银行的使用许可。"
G["I have the signed waiver!  Fire me into the Singing Ridge!"]="我已经签署免责声明了！把我发射到晶歌山脉去吧！"
G["I have the softest featherbeds you can find for a thousand miles. Would you like to try one?"]="我这里有最柔软的羽毛床，千里难寻。你想试试吗？"
G["I have the spell. You can analyze it."]="我得到了魔法效果，你可以分析它。"
G["I have the totem of cleansing, $n."]="净化图腾已经完成了，$n。"
G["I have to admit, that looked pretty fun!"]="我不得不承认，这非常有趣！"
G["I have to admit, you're not what I expected when I received the warchief's commission."]="必须承认，当我接到酋长的命令时，完全没有想到来的人会是你。"
G["I have to aim for the Forsaken ships."]="我必须瞄准被遗忘者的船。"
G["I have to check on my family. Please help us!"]="我要去看看我的家人。请帮帮我们！"
G["I have to clean up this mess, but I'll do it without complaint.\n\nYou'll help if you have any Horde pride at all!"]="我还有一堆乱七八糟的事情要处理呢，但是我不会有丝毫抱怨。\n\n如果你还为自己身处部落自豪的话，就来帮我一把！"
G["I have to get out of here! Can you get me free?"]="我要离开这里！你能放我出去吗？"
G["I have to give these Twilight a wee bit of credit... what they lack in skill, they make up for in numbers and tenacity. They got a few good licks in during our last bout."]="我必须承认那些暮光暴徒并非无能之辈……也许他们缺乏战斗技巧，但他们的数量和坚韧完全可以弥补这个缺陷。在我们的上一次战斗中，他们的确取得了一些战果。"
G["I have to go now."]="我必须走了。"
G["I have to go. You stay and kill more of these ugly mongrels."]="我必须离开了。你就留在这里多杀几个丑陋的杂种吧。"
G["I have to make the water not cloudy anymore. Will... will you help?"]="我不能再让水变浑了。你……你愿意帮忙吗？"
G["I have to report back. Thank you, $c!"]="我得赶回去汇报了。谢谢你，$c！"
G["I have to say, $n, your garden looks great! Of course, I have been weeding all day..."]="我不得不说，$n，你的园子看起来太棒了！当然了，因为我每天都在帮你除草……"
G["I have to take some of these flowers back home!"]="我得带些花回家！"
G["I have to tell you, I love it when a plan comes together."]="我不得不说，计划酝酿出来时，我非常开心。"
G["I have told you to call me Thrall."]="我告诉过你，请叫我萨尔。"
G["I have top men and women on it even as we speak, sir!"]="炮兵们正在执行轰炸任务呢，长官！"
G["I have toyed with you long enough!"]="很好，我已经把你们玩够了！"
G["I have tracked the various fragments of the staff across this world and in doing so, discovered Kel'Thuzad's plans to reform the staff. He has already collected several of the staff's fragments - which are being held by his most trusted lieutenants.\n\nI cannot emphasize enough the importance of keeping the greatstaff of the Guardian out of Kel'Thuzad's grasp. Frankly, I do not know what the result would be, other than a catastrophe of epic proportion."]="最近几年来，我一直在世界各地搜寻着法杖碎片的下落，并且发现克尔苏加德正试图重铸它。他已经收集到了其中的几块碎片，并交给几位深得他信赖的军官保存着。\n\n我无法再用什么语言来强调从克尔苏加德手中抢回法杖的重要性了。坦诚地讲，如果让他拿到了完整的法杖，我不知道这个世界除了被灾难彻底淹没之外还能有什么其它结局。"
G["I have trained hundreds of young warriors. The Warchief sheds their blood recklessly. He is no longer MY Warchief."]="我训练了数百名年轻战士。酋长却在让他们白白流血。他不再是“我的酋长”了。"
G["I have trained my entire life for this."]="我为此苦练了一辈子。"
G["I have traveled countless worlds, but I have never seen as enjoyable a celebration as this feast of Winter Veil. You should travel to Ironforge, the dwarves' great city, to see it for yourself."]="我到过无数个世界，但是我从没有看到过像冬幕节宴会那样的令人愉快的庆典。你应该去铁炉堡亲眼看看。"
G["I have traveled far in search of a way to ultimately defeat the League of Arathor in Arathi Basin, but that loin-clothed lummox Adam Eternum hounds my every move.\n\n\nStill, if slayers such as you were to return to Azeroth, perhaps we could defeat the Alliance once and for all!"]="He viajado hasta muy lejos en busca de una forma definitiva para derrotar a la Liga de Arathor en el Valle de Alterac, pero ese majadero en taparrabos de Adam Eternum sigue todos mis pasos.\n\n\nDe cualquier manera, si los grandes asesinos como tú volvierais a Azeroth, podríamos derrotar a la Alianza de una vez por todas."
G["I have tried everything to remove this cave-in!  Black Ox give me fortitude, I cannot move even a single rock. Perhaps if I were to borrow one of the great weapons of legend from the temple grounds..."]="我用尽了一切办法想要移走塌方的石头！可玄牛在上，我连一块石头都搬不动。或许我得去寺院里借一把传奇武器来才行……"
G["I have tried to be an accommodating host, but you simply will not die! Time to throw all pretense aside and just... KILL YOU ALL!"]="我一直在尝试扮演好客的主人，可你们就是不肯受死！该卸下伪装了……杀光你们！"
G["I have tried to speak to their chief, but he does not want to see me. It appears I am not \"high status\" enough. Apparently he's never seen an Admiral."]="He intentado hablar con su jefe, pero no quiere verme. Parece ser que mi grado no es \"lo suficientemente alto\". Por lo visto, nunca ha recibido a un almirante."
G["I have triumphed this day."]="今天我将是胜者。"
G["I have use for you..."]="你可以派上一些用场……"
G["I have ventured to dark places and learned the tailoring recipe for the Deathchill Cloak.\n\nThis cloak is a tradeable Epic cloak for spellcasters that grants Spellpower, Haste and Critical Strike.   I am looking for someone worthy to teach this recipe to.\n\nSomeone who had completed most of the quests across Northrend and had the \"Loremaster of Northrend\" achievement would be worthy of learning the recipe for the Deathchill Cloak."]="Me he aventurado en oscuros lugares y he aprendido el patrón de la capa Fríomortal.\n\nEsta capa es una capa épica para taumaturgos con la que se puede comerciar que otorga poder de hechizos, celeridad y golpe crítico. Estoy buscando a alguien digno a quien enseñar este patrón.\n\nAlguien que haya completado la mayoría de las misiones de Rasganorte y que tenga el logro \"Maestro cultural de Rasganorte\" sería digno de aprender el patrón de la capa Fríomortal."
G["I have vital information for Fizzcrank. Out of the way!"]="我有关于菲兹兰克的重要消息。让路啊！"
G["I have waited a long time for this day. Let us face one another in the Challenger's Ring."]="我对这一天期待已久。那么我们在挑战者之环见吧。"
G["I have waited long enough!"]="我的等待太漫长了！"
G["I have waited long enough. Now you face the harvester of souls."]="我已经等待很久了。现在你们将面对灵魂的收割者。"
G["I have weathered a hundred years of war and suffering. Do you truly think it wise to pit your mortal body against a being that cannot die? I'd venture you have more to lose."]="我经历了一百年的战争与痛苦。你真的觉得，凭着血肉之躯与不死生物作对是明智的选择吗？我敢说，你很可能会失败。"
G["I have what you need, $c."]="我有你需要的东西，$c。"
G["I have whipped the Blight Geists into shape!"]="我狠狠地教训了那些荒芜恶鬼！"
G["I have witnessed the rise and fall of empires... the birth and extinction of entire species... Over countless millennia the foolishness of mortals has remained the only constant. Your presence here confirms this."]="我曾见证过无数帝国的崛起与衰落……也见证过无数物种的诞生与灭绝……千百年来，凡人种族的愚蠢都不曾改变过。你们出现在这里，更是印证了这一点。"
G["I have witnessed your magnificent operation, Drakuru. When do we put your plan into effect?"]="达库鲁，我亲眼目睹了你精妙的部署。什么时候执行攻占达卡莱帝国的计划呢？"
G["I have witnessed your magnificent operation, Drakuru. When do we put your plan into effect??"]="达库鲁，我亲眼目睹了你精妙的部署。什么时候执行攻占达卡莱帝国的计划呢？"
G["I have won.  Better luck another time, friend."]="我赢了。祝你下次好运，朋友。"
G["I have written many powerful words in my time, but still, the most powerful is hidden to me."]="在我一生中，曾写下过无数强大的真言。可对于最强大的真言，我始终未窥门径。"
G["I have you to thank for my life. I will return to my comrades and spread word of your bravery. Fight the Scourge with all the strength you can muster, and we will be by your side."]="谢谢你救了我。回去之后，我一定会向大家宣扬你的勇敢。请你竭尽所能，与天灾军团抗衡吧。我们会帮助你的。"
G["I have your back, Tholo!"]="我掩护你，索罗！"
G["I have your dolly! Nyah nyah!"]="我拿到你的洋娃娃了！哈哈！"
G["I have your gorilla! Nyah nyah!"]="啦啦啦！我得到你的猩猩了！"
G["I have... failed the Horde... as Warchief...\n\nGarrosh... will lead it to ruin...\n\nMy people... to ruin. Cairne, my brother... why did I not listen?"]="我辜负了部落……不合格的酋长……\n\n加尔鲁什会毁掉部落……\n\n毁掉我的人民。凯恩，我的兄弟……为何我不听信于你？"
G["I have... failed..."]="我……失败了……"
G["I haven't bathed in sixteen days. It's easier to blend in this way."]="我已经十六天没洗过澡了。这样就不太容易被发现。"
G["I haven't been able to eat or sleep since I got here.\n\nI'm just not cut out for the Crusade...."]="自打我来到这里，就一直吃不下睡不着。\n\n我根本不该加入银色北伐军……"
G["I haven't been paid since I got here! I'm through with this place!"]="自从我到这里之后，就没有得到过任何报酬！我已经厌倦了这个地方！"
G["I haven't come to be stopped by the likes of you."]="我千里迢迢地赶来，绝不会让你拦下！"
G["I haven't done anything!"]="我什么都没干！"
G["I haven't earned my wings yet, but neither have my pets!"]="我还没能证明我可以飞呢！我的宠物们也没有！"
G["I haven't eaten in weeks; this bread is mine!  FOR THE SANDWICH!"]="我已经有好几周没吃过东西了，这块面包是我的！为了三明治！"
G["I haven't felt this bad since I tried to eat some Dragon's Breath Chili."]="自从上次尝过龙息红椒后，我还从来没有这么难受过。"
G["I haven't got any money!  Get away!"]="我身无分文！走开！"
G["I haven't got anymore work for you, $n. I do want you to know that the red snapper we shared was something special that I'll never forget..."]="我这里没有更多的工作可以给你了，$n。我想让你知道，那些红钳鱼真是我一辈子也忘不了的美味……"
G["I haven't heard a thing. I swear!"]="我什么也没听说。我发誓！"
G["I haven't much time to talk unless it's urgent, citizen. The gates of Theramore are my greatest responsibility."]="除非有紧急事务，否则我没有太多时间与你闲聊，公民。我肩负着保卫塞拉摩的重要使命。"
G["I haven't really figured out what it is, but there's something strange about the hot springs..."]="我并没有真正弄明白这是什么，但那些温泉却有些奇怪……"
G["I haven't seen Tweets in a while, I hope she's ok!"]="我已经有段时间没见过提兹了，希望她一切安好！"
G["I haven't seen a match like that in days!"]="我已经好多天没看到过这么精彩的比赛了！"
G["I haven't seen a thing. Now stop bothering me about Twilight's Hammer and let me get back to my tan."]="我什么都没看见。别用什么暮光之锤的事情来烦我。我还要晒日光浴呢。"
G["I haven't seen any Shado-Pan lately."]="我最近连一个影踪派门的人影都没见到。"
G["I haven't seen any of the sleeping druids. They must have been taken from here already."]="我还没有看到那些沉眠的德鲁伊。他们一定是已经被带走了。"
G["I haven't seen fightin' like that since, well, I guess I haven't ever seen fightin' like that. You sure are a firecracker, $n."]="我很久没见过那样的战斗了，自从……嗯，应该说，我从来就没见过那样的战斗。你可真是个高手啊，$n。"
G["I haven't seen me brothers in ages."]="很久没有看到我的兄弟了。"
G["I haven't seen such a buildup of forces since the Third War! Varian is dead set on addressing the Scourge threat directly. That's just like him....\n\nAre you heading to Northrend? I have never been there, but I hear it is both a beautiful and treacherous land. Sadly, urgent matters at home require my attention, so I will not be able to join Highlord Fordragon and his army on their journey."]="自从第三次战争后，我再也没有见过如此整齐的部队了！瓦里安已经决心直面天灾军团的威胁。这才像他……\n\n你要去诺森德吗？我没有去过那里，不过我听说诺森德是一片美丽丰饶的土地。遗憾的是，我必须留下来处理各种紧急事件，因此无法随弗塔根公爵的部队一同出发。"
G["I haven't the foggiest notion what you're talking about, Miss Greely."]="我根本不明白你在说什么，格瑞里小姐。"
G["I haven't time for idle chatter, $c. I must see to the pilgrims and ensure they are prepared for the long journey ahead."]="我没有时间来闲聊，$c。我必须照顾那些朝圣者，保证他们为漫长的旅程做好充足的准备。"
G["I haven't worked moonsteel in years, but it's not the kind of thing you forget. Apprentices, it's time to show you how to work real metal!"]="我已经有许多年没有加工过月钢了。不过这种技艺是不可能被忘记的。学徒们，是时候显示你们锻打真正金属的能耐了！"
G["I heal ya up bruddas.  You be ready for anothuh battle soon."]="让我来治疗你吧。你很快就能重返战场啦。"
G["I hear Bertelm's been collecting fur for his latest creation. He told you it's going to be a cloak, right?\n\nIt isn't. That's just the cover he's using to keep his wolf fur hatband a secret. He wouldn't put all that work into collecting the fur just to soil it in battle!"]="我听说波尔泰姆为了他的最新发明收集了很多毛皮。他对你说是件披风，对吗？\n\n其实那些毛皮是用来作帽子的。他不可能他把用尽全力收集的毛皮做成一件在战斗中很快就会弄脏的东西！"
G["I hear I have you to thank for helping to cure me. Thank you. Truly."]="我听说多亏了你的帮助，我才得到了治愈。谢谢你。衷心地向你表示感谢。"
G["I hear Pit Lords are born from maggots, Brutallus!"]="我听说深渊领主是蛆虫变成的，布鲁塔卢斯！"
G["I hear a faint humming. It is coming from this direction!"]="我听见了微弱的嗡鸣声。是从这个方向传来的！"
G["I hear a great Dragonmaw medicine man lives here, in the large hut to our right."]="我听说一位伟大的龙喉医师就住在右边的那座棚子里。"
G["I hear and obey, master..."]="听从您的吩咐，主人……"
G["I hear footsteps. Be on your guard."]="我听到了脚步声。提高警惕。"
G["I hear little hearts beating. Yes... beating faster now... soon the beating will stop."]="哦，我听见不少声音啊……不过马上就都要停止了。"
G["I hear on the wind that you have helped my great great grand-daughter Ji achieve her dream of becoming a brewmaster.\n\nI am quite proud of her and very thankful to you for your aid.  You have helped put my family name back on the right track."]="风儿告诉我说，你帮助我的曾曾曾孙女季实现了成为酒仙的梦想。\n\n我为她感到骄傲，也非常感谢你的帮助。是你帮我的家族走回了正道。"
G["I hear one comment about waterfowl, and you will be eating through a tube."]="我听过对水禽的评价，据说它们可以通过一个管子一样的东西吃东西。"
G["I hear our new allies will be joining us here. Fighting alongside elves... Just like old times."]="我听说我们的新同盟会来和我们一起庆祝。和精灵们并肩作战……就像以前那样。"
G["I hear saurok taste like chicken. Let's find out."]="我听说蜥蜴人的味道像鸡肉，让我们来瞧瞧。"
G["I hear something..."]="我听见了什么声音……"
G["I hear strange orcs whispering all the time inside the south zeppelin tower. They always shut up whenever I get near."]="南飞艇塔里一直能听到兽人在诡异地窃窃私语。每当我走近，他们就立即不说话了。"
G["I hear that Blackmoore has been acting strange."]="我听说布莱克摩尔最近行为很古怪。"
G["I hear that the Shado-Pan are preparing to assault the Isle of Thunder to the northwest. They will need plenty of food, and we're the ones to supply it!"]="我听说影踪派正准备突袭西北方的雷神岛。他们肯定会需要大量食物，而我们就是那个供应商！"
G["I hear that the trolls in Sen'jin Village have a potion maker named Miao'zan.  Look there."]="我听说森金村的巨魔中有个名叫米奥赞的药剂师。去那儿找他吧。"
G["I hear that the yaungol busted through the gates up north. Wonder what happened to the Shado-Pan there?"]="我听说野牛人冲破了北面的大门。不知那里的影踪派怎么样了？"
G["I hear that they have a Mining Trainer in Thunder Bluff to the north.  Take the road out of the village and when you get there ride the elevator to the top of the rise.  Any of the Bluffwatchers should be able to help you from there."]="我听说北方的雷霆崖有个矿工训练师。沿着村外的道路前进，然后乘坐升降梯到达山顶。任何一名雷霆崖守卫都能帮助你。"
G["I hear that they have a Mining Trainer in the Undercity.  All you have to do to get there is head south out of town and go to the back of the Ruins of Lordaeron.  Then take the elevator down into the Undercity itself and ask an Undercity Guardian for further directions."]="我听说幽暗城中有个矿工训练师。离开城镇往南走，穿过洛丹伦废墟，你就能到那儿了。然后乘坐升降梯下到幽暗城，去询问幽暗城守卫，你应该能获取更多指示信息。"
G["I hear that with fire and force you shape metals for war. I can achieve this through the pressures of water and a mastery of their densities."]="我听说，你们是靠火焰与蛮力来铸造金属武器的。而我，是通过水流的压力以及对其密度的精确把握来制造武器的。"
G["I hear that you sell Ancona chickens?"]="我听说你出售灰色小鸡？"
G["I hear that you've already begun to pull your weight around here.\n\nGood.  I was worried that we were going to have to 'convince' you to help out."]="我听说你已经在这里发挥作用了。\n\n太好了。我还担心我们得去劝你帮忙呢。"
G["I hear the \"but\" in your voice..."]="Puedo escuchar un \"pero\" en tu voz..."
G["I hear the adults whispering all the time."]="我一直听到大人们在说悄悄话。"
G["I hear the hozen and jinyu have been increasing their skirmishes. Those poor little creatures will destroy each other if they aren't careful. It is quite a vicious cycle they are trapped in."]="我听说，猢狲和锦鱼人的冲突正逐渐白热化。如果不能谨慎行事的话，这些可怜的小东西会同归于尽的。他们已经陷入了一个恶性循环。"
G["I hear the rock flayer has been sucking down unstable energy since its capture."]="我听说那些剥石者在被捕获后注射了不稳定的能量。"
G["I hear the voices!"]="我听见了那声音！"
G["I hear them, $r. Allow me to translate..."]="我能听懂他们说话， $r。请让我翻译……"
G["I hear there are great wars being fought in Outland. I wonder if there's any rooftops up there that need fixing..."]="我听说在外域发生过许多次大战。我在想，是否那边也有屋顶需要修理……"
G["I hear there's a shop up in Ironforge run by the gnomes that specializes in alchemy.  You should go have a look."]="我听说铁炉堡中有家由精通炼金术的侏儒所经营的商店。你该去看看。"
G["I hear they're sacrificing prisoners up at their ritual grounds. I think the place is called Gjalerbron..."]="我听说他们在仪式广场上将囚犯当作祭品供奉给天神。我想，那地方应该是叫亚勒伯龙……"
G["I hear things... Things that should not be."]="我听说发生了一些事情……一些不应该发生的事情。"
G["I hear those lances are rough-hewn, too. I'm no fan of splinters."]="我听说那些长矛都是粗制的，我可不想扎的满手都是刺儿。"
G["I hear wedding bells in your future."]="我在你的未来里面听到了婚礼的钟声。"
G["I hear what both of you are saying and am grateful for the counsel."]="你们两个的话我都听过了，感谢你们的忠告。"
G["I hear what you are saying, Mavren. Nevertheless, the final decision is mine. I appreciate your assistance, but the majority of the lives on the line are blood elf. I will not have those lives carelessly thrown away!"]="我听到你所说的话了，玛尔伦。然而，最终的决定权在我手上。我感谢你的帮助，但是在前线浴血奋战的大部分都是血精灵。我不会让这些生命就这么轻易逝去的。"
G["I hear what you hear, brother. Look behind you..."]="我听到的和你一样，兄弟。看看你身后……"
G["I hear whispers though... whispers of confusion... perhaps even whispers of dissent."]="但我也听到了一些传言…困惑的传言…甚至是反对的声音。"
G["I hear ya blood flow."]="我听到你的鲜血在流淌。"
G["I hear you are responsible for saving one of my youngest descendants from the clutches of the Jade Witch.  I thank you for your heroism."]="我听说，你从青玉巫婆手里救出了我的一个晚辈。对于你的义举，我深表感谢。"
G["I hear you are the reason my cousin Syra is sending me wedding invitations.\n\nThanks a lot. Now I have to be the unmarried black yak of the family."]="我听说我表弟塞拉给我发结婚请柬，都是你的功劳。\n\n谢谢你啊，现在我成了我们家还没结婚的黑牦牛。"
G["I hear you fly without a parachute cloak, $n."]="听说你不带降落伞披风就外出执行飞行任务，$n。"
G["I hear you sell motorcycle parts."]="听说你出售摩托车零件。"
G["I hear you! I can't get a moments peace without Sarah complaining about the chores!"]="说得好啊！萨拉无时无刻不在抱怨家务活！"
G["I hear you're looking for Keg Protector marks.  What are those?"]="我听说你在寻找酒桶保卫者的印记。那是什么？"
G["I hear you're quite the cook."]="我听说你的厨艺很不错。"
G["I hear you've got some drinks I can buy, Slim."]="我听说你这儿有喝的东西卖，斯利姆。"
G["I hear you, Hilda. Mogu mixin' up with sha? I don't like that one bit! We'd better bring this evidence back to the King. $n, thanks fer yer help today, but we'll take it from here!"]="我明白你的意思，希尔达。魔古族和煞魔搅和到了一块儿？我一点儿也不喜欢这消息！我们最好将我们的发现上报给国王陛下。$n，非常感谢你今天的帮助，接下来的事就交给我们吧！"
G["I hear your kind squeals like a felhunter when roasted alive over a fire."]="我听说，如果将你这样的家伙扔进火里，你就会发出地狱犬一般的尖叫声。"
G["I hear, Garrosh is goin' to torture that mogu prisoner until he talks."]="我听说，加尔鲁什要折磨那个魔古囚犯，除非他开口。"
G["I heard Azeroth needed saving. May I lend a hand?"]="我听说艾泽拉斯需要拯救。我能出些力吗？"
G["I heard Lord Xavius left today for his tower in Ashenvale."]="我听说萨维斯领主今天去他在灰谷的高塔了。"
G["I heard Tortolla was being held here, so I came over as quickly as I could.\n\nMount Hyjal is really tall."]="我听说托尔托拉被囚禁在此处，所以我以最快的速度赶来了。\n\n海加尔山真高啊！"
G["I heard a rumor that we're all going to go watch the battle with the Scourge at the border tonight.  How delightfully wicked!"]="听说我们今晚都要去边界观看防御部队和天灾军团的战斗。多令人激动啊！"
G["I heard a story about this golden fish, and if you caught it you would get three wishes!"]="我听说如果你抓住一条金鱼，那么你就会得到三个许愿的机会！"
G["I heard a story or two of a Lore Keeper in Uldaman that fit your description. Do you serve a similar purpose?"]="我听说过一两个关于奥达曼看门人的故事，和你的描述很像。你是否也有类似的用途呢？"
G["I heard all kinds of stories about what lay behind the gate. I never imagined it would be something like this."]="关于在大门背后有些什么，我听到过形形色色的传说。真没想到竟然是这样的。"
G["I heard all the kobolds that were down there are dead."]="有很多狗头人都去过那里……他们都死了。"
G["I heard everything, $n. Go ahead to the camp and I'll meet you there."]="我都听说了，$n。快到营地去吧，我们在那里会合。"
G["I heard from the others... you need a kite to the wall?"]="我听别人说……你需要乘风筝到长城上去？"
G["I heard her say it meself - that Dalaran would be a shining example of peace 'tween Alliance an' Horde fer the rest o' the world."]="我亲耳听到她说，达拉然将向世界展示一个部落与联盟和平共处的典范。"
G["I heard last night's performance was spectacular!"]="我听说昨晚的演出非常精彩！"
G["I heard of what you did in Orsis.  I will be honored to fight along your side."]="我听说了你在奥西斯的事迹。很荣幸能与你并肩作战。"
G["I heard one of the boys say he wished he could live in a tree. I want to live in a tree too!"]="我听一个男孩说他希望他可以住在树上。我也想住在树上！"
G["I heard she's the strongest woman in the world!"]="我听说，她是世界上最强壮的女人！"
G["I heard shouting through the pipes - what's happening?"]="我从管道里听到了呼叫声，发生了什么事情？"
G["I heard some hero from a far away land convinced Xuen, the tiger god, to open the Vale. Maybe I'll see them someday."]="He oído que $gun héroe:una heroína; de una tierra lejana convenció a Xuen, el dios tigre, para que abriera el valle. A lo mejor $glo:la; conoceré algún día."
G["I heard some of the earth spirits are unhappy with the Greenstone Quarry. I hope they don't take it out on us."]="我听说，土灵在绿石采掘场闹得很不愉快。但愿他们不会拿我们出气。"
G["I heard some pretty elfs got slap-slapped up at Mogujia."]="我听说不少漂亮的精灵在魔古岬被打翻了。"
G["I heard somethin' about a bell, made by those crazy mogu... thousands of years ago. Jimeny wikkets!"]="我听说了关于一口钟的事情，由那些疯狂的魔古族……在几千年前制造的。太可怕了！"
G["I heard something over there."]="我听到那里有点动静。"
G["I heard that $n comes from a far off land beyond the mists. $G He : She; must be their $g hero : heroine; to have come all this way to save us."]="我听说$n是从迷雾那一边的遥远疆域来的。$g他:她;肯定是他们的英雄，不远千里前来搭救我们。"
G["I heard that $n is gunning to be the captain of the air group."]="听说$n想要成为天空卫队的队长。"
G["I heard that Commander Rell and the others found Amber! That is good news."]="我听说指挥官利尔他们找到了安玻！真是个好消息。"
G["I heard that Gott Weedlespan fired his last assistant...by pushing him off a cliff! Best not to get on his bad side."]="我听说那个哥特·韦德斯潘解雇上一名助手的时候……直接把那个倒霉鬼推下了悬崖！你最好不要惹他发火。"
G["I heard that Kolphis Darkscale has been looking for you."]="我听说库尔菲斯·暗鳞一直在找你。"
G["I heard that Lady Jaina's still in shock about what happened."]="听说吉安娜女士到现在还在对这事儿震惊不已。"
G["I heard that a noble among the water elementals, Hydraxis, wages war with the servants of fire.  Let's hope he loses!"]="我听说水元素中的贵族海达克希斯发动了对火元素的战争。真希望他战败！"
G["I heard that if you can breathe fire, then you are part dragon!"]="我听说，如果你能喷火的话，那你就是半条龙了！"
G["I heard that some Southsea pirates pulled into dock earlier. Be careful if you go into town!\n\nThey even have women pirates! Hmm, maybe I should go check it out myself? Just to make sure it's safe for you out there, baby."]="听说早些时候南海海盗进入了港口。如果你要进城的话，一定要小心！\n\n那些海盗之中甚至还有女人！嗯，也许我应该亲自去查看一下？这只是为了保护你的安全，亲爱的。"
G["I heard that the Horde's learned of an ancient mogu artifact... somethin' called the Divine Bell."]="听说部落掌握某种远古魔古族神器的信息……一个名叫圣钟的东西。"
G["I heard that the Lich King  is stirring up north, in the Frozen Wastes.  He built a fortress, Icecrown, and plans our doom."]="听说巫妖王在北方的冰冻废土兴风作浪。他建起了一座名叫冰冠堡垒的城堡，想要消灭我们。"
G["I heard that the Shado-Pan were having trouble to the southwest. Know anything about that, $n?"]="我听说影踪派在西南边遇到了麻烦。你知道些什么吗，$n？"
G["I heard that the king is found!  He's returning to Stormwind!"]="听说他们找到了国王！他就要返回暴风城了！"
G["I heard that there are these huge fish that can walk on land to hunt, and eat people!"]="我听说有种巨大的鱼会上岸吃人！"
G["I heard that this place has great noodle soup."]="我听说这地方有很棒的汤面。"
G["I heard that your dog Fei Fei took Klatu's prayer beads..."]="我听说你的小狗菲菲叼走了克拉图的祈祷念珠……"
G["I heard that, after the fireworks show, goblets will be brought to the tables.  Fine toasts we shall raise!"]="听说在焰火表演之后，桌子上就会摆满高脚杯，然后我们就可以喝酒庆祝了！"
G["I heard the Burlap Outpost got destroyed by hozen."]="我听说粗麻哨站遭到了猢狲的破坏。"
G["I heard the Horde is amassing its own army to head to Northrend. HOPEFULLY your Alliance and the Horde can focus their aggression on the real threat. You know, instead of each other?\n\nSomehow I think that's unlikely to happen, if my experience here is any indication. Your people have been SO welcoming to me.\n\n<Valeera mutters angrily to herself.>"]="我听说部落也在招募征战诺森德的军队。希望联盟和部落可以将矛头一致指向真正的威胁。你懂我的意思吧，我是说不要窝里斗。\n\n虽然以我的经验来看，实现真正的同盟不太可能。你们对我真是太“热情”了。\n\n<瓦莉拉生气地咕哝着。>"
G["I heard the King is going to force us to fight each other. Not that it will take much for that to happen."]="我听说王上打算强迫我们彼此厮杀。不可能，这样的话代价太大了。"
G["I heard the Tauren have cousins in Northrend.  I hope they're good hunters... I hope they hunt undead."]="听说牛头人的远亲住在诺森德。希望他们都是优秀的猎手……专门猎杀亡灵。"
G["I heard the Wrestler never ever takes his mask off. I wonder what he does if his nose gets itchy."]="我听说摔跤手从不摘下面具。我很好奇，要是他的鼻子发痒，该怎么解决呢。"
G["I heard the crocs are attacking because of an ancient mogu curse."]="我听说鳄鱼人因为一个上古魔古诅咒而变得具有攻击性。"
G["I heard the forgemaster keeps notes about his meetings  in a book at the tower overlooking the camp."]="我听说铸炉之主把会面纪要夹在一本书中，藏在一座可俯瞰营地的塔里。"
G["I heard the mines are infested with spiders again. I really hope no one gets hurt."]="我听说矿坑又遭到了蜘蛛的侵袭。但愿没有人受伤。"
G["I heard the new Henweigh 6000 will be rolling off the assembly line soon. I can barely contain my excitement!"]="我听说新型的极速6000型很快就要开下生产线了。我几乎不能抑制激动的心情！"
G["I heard the reclaimer's threat, but it was faint... Fleeting, like trying to recall the details of a dream.\n\nIt seems I'm in your debt once again."]="我听到了复兴者的威胁，但模糊不清……稍纵即逝，就好像回忆梦里的细节。\n\n看来我又欠你个人情。"
G["I heard the yaungol have taken over most of the farmlands in the south."]="还听说野牛人霸占了南部的大部分农田。"
G["I heard the yaungol made it through the Pandaren Wall."]="我听说野牛人穿过了熊猫人城墙。"
G["I heard their mocking laughter as my gryphon crashed and burned, $c.\n\n\"Slidore, you stink!\" They shouted.\n\nNobody talks to Slidore that way! Help me get out of here so that I can show them who the real stinker is!"]="Oí su burlona risa cuando mi grifo se estrellaba y se quemaba, $c.\n\n\"¡Slidore, apestas!\" Gritaron.\n\n¡Nadie habla así a Slidore! Ayúdame a salir de aquí para poder demostrarles quién es el que apesta."
G["I heard them praying to their dark gods as everything went black... the Twilight's Hammer did this!"]="在黑暗降临的一瞬间，我听见他们在向自己的黑暗神灵祈祷……是暮光之锤干的！"
G["I heard there are still orcs buried underneath it."]="我听说这里还埋着些兽人。"
G["I heard they discovered the lost secret of the Lin family's secret ingredient noodle soup."]="我听说他们发现了失传的林家秘制汤面秘方。"
G["I heard they were going to try to blow up the gnome's car in the next race!  True or not, I'd stand clear of their pit area."]="我听说下一场比赛的时候他们要把地精的车炸掉！不管是真是假，我会待在安全的地方。"
G["I heard this game is pretty easy."]="我听说这个游戏很简单。"
G["I heard ya comin' a league away, mon. Maybe ya need some more trainin'?"]="我听说你走了很远的路才来到这里，朋友。也许你需要更多一些训练？"
G["I heard you found somethin'... or someone. You caught one o' those mogu, didn't you?"]="我听说你找到了什么东西……还是什么人来着？你抓到了个魔古族，是不是？"
G["I heard you was dead... well, you won't be easy to make dead after this!"]="Yo oír que tú estar $gmuerto:muerta;... Bueno, ¡no será fácil que pases por cadáver después de esto!"
G["I heard you went to Darnassus and got the Divine Bell."]="我听说你去了趟达纳苏斯，拿到了那口圣钟。"
G["I heard you were in town.  What a strange creature you are.\n\nYou wish to speak to me?"]="我听说你在城里。你可真是个奇怪的家伙。\n\n想和我谈谈？"
G["I hereby destroy these instruments of evil! For the Horde!"]="我必须摧毁这些恶魔的工具！为了部落！"
G["I highly recommend that you visit Sayge to get your fortune told.\n\nI know, I know... he's a gnoll.  But he's a very special gnoll with the power to divine your future!"]="我强烈推荐你到塞格那里去算个命。\n\n我知道，我知道……他是个豺狼人。但他是个非常特别的豺狼人，他能解读你的命运！"
G["I highly recommend that you visit Sayge to get your fortune told. I know, I know... he's a gnoll.  But he's a very special gnoll with the power to divine your future!\n\nAnd we are constantly expanding the faire with all manner of new attractions!"]="Te recomiendo encarecidamente que visites a Sayge para que te adivine el futuro. Lo sé, lo sé... es un gnoll. ¡Pero es un gnoll muy especial con el poder de la adivinación!\n\n¡Y continuamente ampliamos la feria con todo tipo de atracciones nuevas!"
G["I hired Galana specifically to deal with rudimentary training. Go speak with her. This shop is meant to be run efficiently and effectively, and I expect everyone - including the patrons - to respect it."]="我雇佣贾兰娜对学徒进行基础训练，去和她谈谈吧。我想要将这家店铺的生意运转得越来越有效率，这样所有人——包括赞助者，都会对它表示尊敬。"
G["I hold some of the emperor's most prized possessions. Should you wish to curry favor with Shaohao, you may aid us by driving back the Ordon yaungol that seek to overtake the Celestial Court."]="我这里有着皇帝陛下最珍贵的遗物。如果你想赢得少昊的青睐，就请帮我们赶走那些试图占据天神庭院的斡耳朵野牛人吧。"
G["I hold the key to lands of free! Chase me and you'll see!"]="我拥有通往那里的钥匙！跟着我来吧，你会看到的！"
G["I hold the vessel of his rebirth. Should you be prepared to take on this task, you will be required to fortify the vessel and ultimately, break the hold of Ragnaros himself!"]="Poseo la vasija de su renacimiento. Si estás $gpreparado:preparada; para llevar a cabo esta misión, necesitarás fortificar la vasija y, por último, ¡vencer al mismísimo Ragnaros!"
G["I honestly don't know how I am going to round up so many yaks on my own. Those yaungol are dangerous."]="我实在不知道自己该怎么把这么多牦牛赶到一起。那些野牛人危险得很。"
G["I honor my ancestors in the time-honored shamanistic tradition.  We must never forget the sacrifices that they have made so that we can be here.\n\nAnd we, in turn, must make the necessary sacrifices so that our descendants will have a future.\n\nWhat brings you to me, $c?"]="我为祖先们秉承着历史悠久的萨满教统而感到荣幸。我们必须铭记他们所做出的牺牲。\n\n对我们来说，作为回报，我们必须为后代的将来做出必要的牺牲。\n\n是什么把你带到我这里来的，$c？"
G["I hope Anduin's got some plan up his sleeve."]="希望安度因心中已有打算。"
G["I hope I don't chip my nails..."]="希望不会弄坏我的指甲……"
G["I hope I don't run out of bandages!"]="希望我还有点绷带！"
G["I hope I find him."]="希望我能找到他。"
G["I hope I have a chance to visit with Greatfather Winter before Winter Veil is over."]="我希望能有机会在冬幕节结束之前和冬天爷爷聊聊天。"
G["I hope I see you again, friend."]="我希望能再见到你，朋友。"
G["I hope I'm alive to see Arthas get what's coming to him."]="我希望自己能亲眼目睹阿尔萨斯接受命运的审判！"
G["I hope Jones is okay."]="但愿琼斯没事。"
G["I hope Jones makes it back okay."]="但愿琼斯能平安回来。"
G["I hope Ogron finds that pinkskin and breaks his legs. See how he survives in the marsh like that!"]="我希望奥格隆能找到那个粉皮肤的家伙，并且打断他的腿。我倒想看看他如何在沼泽地里活下去！"
G["I hope a dragon eats you!"]="我希望你被龙吃掉！"
G["I hope it helps. These vile beasts simply must be stopped!"]="我希望你能用得着它。必须阻止这群卑鄙的禽兽！"
G["I hope my friends are ok..."]="但愿我的朋友们都没事……"
G["I hope my people have been welcoming to you. These are burdened times, so I fear much may be competing with their good graces."]="希望我的人能够给予你适当的欢迎。这是个艰难的时代，恐怕没有多少人还会在乎礼貌和优雅了。"
G["I hope now you understand the limits of strength without vision. It is one thing to change the world, but quite another to do what is right."]="我希望你能明白，缺乏指引的力量是狭隘的。改变世界是一回事，但做正确的事就是另一回事了。"
G["I hope one of us dies. I hope that one is you, Skrotee."]="我希望我们中间死掉一个。我希望那个人是你，斯克罗提。"
G["I hope our paths cross again, $n! Until then, may your journey be safe and meaningful."]="希望我们会再次相见，$n。在那之前，祝你的旅途平安且充满意义。"
G["I hope so, Yalia."]="但愿如此。"
G["I hope that Jheel will be able to come back to the orphanage soon."]="我希望希尔能快点回到孤儿院。"
G["I hope that Loralthalis is alright, $c. Maybe I should go up to Duskwither Spire myself? Maybe I should have done that in the first place?"]="我希望罗拉塔利斯是对的，$c。也许我应该亲自去达斯维瑟之塔？也许我当初就应该立即赶去那里？"
G["I hope that my brother's doing okay in Durotar. There's an awful lot of smelly Orcs out there.... Then again, this isn't exactly the greatest gig, either..."]="真希望我的兄弟在杜隆塔尔没搞出什么乱子。那边臭烘烘的兽人太多了……不过，这里也不怎么轻松啊……"
G["I hope that one doesn't have to go through twice."]="但愿它不会再遇到这种事了。"
G["I hope that was a fish!"]="我希望那是一条鱼！"
G["I hope that you are here to go to Alterac Valley $n.  We can use all o' the help that we can get."]="希望你是来奥特兰克山谷作战的，$n。我们会竭尽所能，利用一切援助。"
G["I hope that you will grace our defense with your trident. The Kvaldir numbers are still increasing."]="希望你能用你的战戢为我们的防御带来荣光。克瓦迪尔人的数量还在增长。"
G["I hope that you're here to help us take back Arathi Basin from The Defilers.  What do you say $n?"]="希望你是来帮助我们从污染者手中夺回阿拉希盆地的，$n？"
G["I hope that you're ready for a one-way mission, $n."]="Espero que estés $glisto:lista; para una misión sin retorno, $n."
G["I hope that your interruption is for a good cause, I was in the middle of some important work."]="我希望你是因为好事才打断我的，我正在做一些重要的工作。"
G["I hope the Horde has a place for another mage..."]="希望部落还有我这个法师的立足之地……"
G["I hope the Jade Witch didn't get all of my friends.  She is super spooky."]="但愿青玉巫婆没把我的朋友们都抓走。她超级恐怖的。"
G["I hope the Light is with you, $n. Is there anything I can do for you today?"]="愿圣光与你同在，$n。我能为你做什么吗？"
G["I hope the Ultrasafe Transporter never lets you down!   I just know it won't but I would recommend carrying a parachute cloak just in case!"]="我希望安全传送器永远都不会让你失望！我认为它是不会出故障的！但是我还是建议你最好带一件降落伞披风……"
G["I hope the archmage appreciates what I've gone through to uphold Hemet's end of the bargain."]="我费了很多功夫，才迫使赫米特遵守协议。只希望大法师能赏识我的才能。"
G["I hope the charges are set soon. Everyone could use a respite."]="希望能尽快埋好炸药。我们已经筋疲力尽了，只有炸毁虫孔，我们才能喘口气。"
G["I hope the instructors saw that!"]="真该让师父们来看看！"
G["I hope the mantid come and drag you yaungols back over the wall."]="真希望螳螂妖能来把你们这些野牛人拖回长城那边去。"
G["I hope the orchard is still intact..."]="但愿果园能安然无恙……"
G["I hope the rings don't hurt the turtle."]="但愿这些环不会伤害那只海龟。"
G["I hope the rope holds."]="我希望绳子还挺得住。"
G["I hope the yaungol arriving wasn't a sign of worse things to come. They are bad enough."]="希望野牛人的到来不是更大厄运来临前的先兆。这些野牛人已经够麻烦了。"
G["I hope these Shattrath folks stop fighting soon.  They're beginning to get on my nerves.\n\n How can I help you?"]="我希望这些沙塔斯城的家伙们快点停止争吵，我脑袋都被吵大了。\n\n有什么我能帮你的吗？"
G["I hope they don't tell on us."]="我希望他们不会告发我们。"
G["I hope they find what they're looking for, here in Pandaria."]="真希望他们能在这儿找到想要的东西。"
G["I hope they get better."]="但愿他们能好起来。"
G["I hope they made it out all right. Ol' Muskpaw might be rough around the edges but he was always the decent sort."]="我希望他们能顺利脱身。老麝香爪虽然看上去吊儿郎当的但骨子里是个善良的人。"
G["I hope they make it this far. Then my strength and skill will be clear to all!"]="但愿他们能闯过来。这样才能让人们看清我的实力！"
G["I hope they'll be okay."]="但愿他们能没事。"
G["I hope this damned thing works. *Araxes pounds on the portable transponder.*"]="我希望这个该死的东西能管用。*阿拉克塞重重地敲打了一下便携式传送器。*"
G["I hope this ends soon.  Having to kill these owlkin, mutated or not, is making me sick."]="我希望这一切可以快点结束，杀死这些枭兽——变异的或者没有变异的——让我感到恶心。"
G["I hope this frond takes root..."]="我希望这种植物可以顺利生根……"
G["I hope this is all worth it!"]="希望这牺牲是值得的！"
G["I hope this isn't coming out of my pocket!"]="我希望这不用我掏腰包！"
G["I hope this place pans out as a forward base for Shadow Council operations.  I know it sounds weird, but I kind of miss the Shadow Labyrinth."]="我希望这个地方可以成为暗影议会的前哨基地。我知道这听上去很奇怪，但是我真的有点想念暗影迷宫了。"
G["I hope this works!"]="希望这能起作用！"
G["I hope this yak knows the way up the mountain because I sure don't!"]="希望这头牦牛知道上山的路，因为我不知道！"
G["I hope those blood elves across the way don't think that I'm spying on them!"]="希望那些过路的血精灵没有查觉到我正在侦察他们！"
G["I hope to one day forge weapons and armor from the bones of my enemies."]="我希望有一天能用敌人的骨头制作武器。"
G["I hope to see you back from this mission alive. But if I do not, I want to say I've enjoyed seeing you work. You're a credit to your race. Good luck."]="我希望能见到你活着完成这个任务。要是你挂了，至少我挺享受你为我们工作的过程。你是你们种族中的佼佼者。祝你好运。"
G["I hope we meet again soon, my new friend."]="Espero que nos veamos de nuevo, mi $gnuevo amigo:nueva amiga;."
G["I hope ye didn't come all the way to the Great Forge just to stay warm. Speak up $g lad : lass;, tell me what it is I can do for ye?"]="我希望你千里迢迢来到大煅炉不只是为了取暖。$g小伙子:小姑娘;，我能帮你什么忙吗？"
G["I hope ye had as much fun as I did."]="希望你能像我一样得到许多乐趣。"
G["I hope yer not here for our ale.  We're not sharing and that's final!\n\nIt's not our fault no one had the good sense to bring beer to Outland but us."]="我希望你不是为我们的啤酒而来的。不要想了，我们是不会把啤酒分给你的！\n\n除了我们之外居然没有人会有这么好的远见，想到把啤酒带到外域来，嘿，这可不是我们的过错。"
G["I hope yer ready to work."]="Espero que estés $glisto:lista; para trabajar."
G["I hope you Alliance are here to give them Dragonmaw Orcs a good thumpin'."]="希望你们联盟能给这里的龙喉兽人狠狠一击。"
G["I hope you all rot! I never... wanted... this."]="我诅咒你们烂在这里！我……不想要这个结局……"
G["I hope you all... die in pain!"]="我希望你们……都死在痛苦中！"
G["I hope you are having a wonderful day, $r."]="希望你今天过的愉快，$r。"
G["I hope you are having a wonderous Winter Veil, $n!"]="希望你能拥有一个最幸福的冬幕节，$n！"
G["I hope you are right."]="我希望你是对的。"
G["I hope you can fly, pipsqueak!"]="但愿你会飞，小不点儿！"
G["I hope you can swim... in molten lava!"]="希望你会游泳……在岩浆里！"
G["I hope you don't get rope burn."]="我希望你的绳子没烧起来。"
G["I hope you don't mind sharing the balloon with me. My father always told me not to talk to strangers, but you seem friendly."]="我希望你不介意和我共享气球。我父亲经常告诫我不要和陌生人说话，但你看上去很友善。"
G["I hope you don't think I'm a stalker, or anything like that, $n.\n\nI mean, I know that you're real famous within the Skyguard now, and well... I'm sure that you wouldn't want to hang out with a lowly peon like me.\n\nBut, if you ever want to get together to just hang out, or even wrangle some more rays, drop by anytime!  I'll be here.\n\nI miss you..."]="Espero que no creas que soy una acosadora ni nada de eso, $n.\n\nQuiero decir... sé que ahora eres muy $gfamoso:famosa; entre la Guardia del cielo y eso y bien... Estoy segura de que no querrás andar con una humilde currante como yo.\n\n¡Pero si alguna vez quieres quedar para estar juntos o domar algunas rayas más, pásate por aquí! Estaré aquí.\n\nTe echo de menos..."
G["I hope you fall into the muck again, Sully!"]="苏利，我真希望你再掉进那滩泥里！"
G["I hope you fellows don't mind if we crash this party.  I brought some old friends with me!"]="我们打扰了你们的聚会，请不要介意。我还带来了一些老朋友！"
G["I hope you find its contents... useful."]="希望你能……用得着。"
G["I hope you have a strong stomach.  Travelling through the breach is not for the weak."]="希望你的意志够强！穿越裂口的旅程可不适合弱者。"
G["I hope you have the courage to die bravely, human. I'm in the mood for a good fight."]="希望你有勇气来面对死亡，人类。我可是想好好打一架。"
G["I hope you know how to swim, worgen."]="我希望你会游泳，狼人。"
G["I hope you know how to swim."]="希望你知道怎样游泳。"
G["I hope you learn from your defeat."]="希望你能从自己的失败中吸取教训。"
G["I hope you like explosions. They're my specialty."]="希望你喜欢炸药。这可是我的专长。"
G["I hope you like losing!"]="希望你喜欢失败的滋味！"
G["I hope you like pain."]="希望你喜欢痛苦。"
G["I hope you made them hurt, $n."]="希望你已经让他们吃足苦头了，$n。"
G["I hope you now understand that there is no defeating me."]="希望你现在能认清现实，你是不可能打败我的。"
G["I hope you planning something secret involving that big-tongue ending up dead."]="希望你正在计划消灭大舌头怪的秘密方案。"
G["I hope you weren't looking for something to eat, $c."]="希望你不是在找东西吃，$c。"
G["I hope you weren't too put out, $n, but the contents of this crate have been very important to my family for generations."]="希望这不会给你添太多麻烦，$n。但这个箱子里的东西是祖传的，对我的家族至关重要。"
G["I hope you work hard, $n. To raise a cloud serpent is an honor bestowed upon a rare few."]="希望你多加努力，$n。只有极少数人才享有驯养云端翔龙的殊荣。"
G["I hope you'll see the merit of these events in time, Garrosh. We cannot win against the Scourge if we continue to war against one another."]="我希望你能明白现在的状况，加尔鲁什。如果再这样互相争斗，就休想战胜天灾军团。"
G["I hope you're enjoying this as much as I am."]="希望你跟我一样享受这个过程。"
G["I hope you're not coming in here fixing for a fight. There are too many angry people on the streets today."]="希望你不是来这里打架的。街上到处都是愤怒的市民。"
G["I hope you're ready to explain this to Admiral Taylor!"]="你还是想想怎么跟泰勒上将解释吧！"
G["I hope you're ready! I've souped up this Blood Elf boat with the best Goblin parts money could buy... which wasn't much, sadly, but I'll take what I can get."]="¡Espero que estés $glisto:lista;! He tuneado este barco elfo de sangre con las mejores piezas goblin que el dinero podía comprar... Que no es decir mucho, la verdad, pero me apaño con lo que puedo conseguir."
G["I hope you're ready, $n. Follow me."]="Espero que estés $gpreparado:preparada;, $n. Sígueme."
G["I hope you're ready, $p. Jaomin Ro awaits you just over the bridge."]="Espero que estés $gpreparado:preparada;, $p. Jaomin Ro te está esperando tras el puente."
G["I hope you're right, Kurdran old friend."]="希望你是对的，库德兰老朋友。"
G["I hope you're right. I really do."]="我真心希望你是对的。"
G["I hope you've made your peace."]="我希望你能安息。"
G["I hope you've made yourself welcome to the items inside my caravan.  If we're not using them, you might as well borrow them."]="希望你随意使用我的马车里的物品。只要不是我们正在使用的物品，你都可以借走。"
G["I hope your friends can do better."]="但愿你的朋友们能表现得好些。"
G["I hope your moves aren't too predictable."]="希望你的招式不会让人一眼看穿。"
G["I hope your spirit finds solace."]="希望你的灵魂能找到庇护之地。"
G["I humbly offer myself to the Light."]="我将谦卑地服从圣光。"
G["I humbly offer myself to the light."]="我将谦卑地服从圣光。"
G["I humbly offer myself to the will of the light."]="我将谦卑地服从圣光的意志。"
G["I humbly request that the Dragon Aspects provide no aid to myself and my fellow adventurers. They should worry about their own problems, and we will worry about ours."]="我谦卑地请求守护巨龙们不要为我和我的同伴提供援助。他们应该操心他们自己的事，我们的事就让我们自己来解决吧。"
G["I humbly welcome you to our temple, spirit."]="我谦卑地欢迎你来到我们的神殿，灵魂。"
G["I hunger!"]="我好饿！"
G["I hunger! Feed me the power of this forge, my children!"]="我饿了！用这座熔炉的能量喂食我吧，孩子们！"
G["I hunger."]="我饿了。"
G["I hurt you for that."]="你敢抽我我就抽你。"
G["I hurt... suffering unbearable... end my pain... I beg of you!"]="卑鄙的死亡骑士，你们的末日就要到了！"
G["I implore my Horde friend here not to push you off of the cliff."]="但我得请求我的部落朋友别把你推下悬崖。"
G["I inspect the body further."]="我将进一步检查尸体。"
G["I installed a new device in our car's matrix regulometer.  That should increase its velocity quotient by a factor of no less than fifteen!"]="我给我们的车里安装了新的矩阵式调节器，它可以使赛车的引擎转速提高至少百分之十五！"
G["I intend to fight the Soulflayer, but I have no way of summoning him.  Can you assist me?"]="我想要与夺灵者战斗，但我没有办法召唤他。你能帮助我吗？"
G["I join... the night."]="我将……融入这黑夜。"
G["I joined the faire as a child..."]="我在孩提时代就加入了马戏团……"
G["I joined the faire to escape my family."]="为了逃离那个家，我加入了马戏团。"
G["I joined this expedition for one reason, $r: revenge."]="我加入这个远征队的目的只有一个，$r，那就是复仇。"
G["I joined up because they said they'd pay my way into the academy.  My uncle says that I can go next season!"]="我加入他们，因为他们说可以付给我足够的钱让我去学院。我叔叔说我下个学期就可以去了！"
G["I judge you...DELICIOUS!"]="¡Creo que eres... $gDELICIOSO:DELICIOSA;!"
G["I just arrived in Venomspite. How could I have possibly wronged you?"]="我刚刚到怨毒镇啊，怎么可能招惹到你？"
G["I just be makin' sure we wasn't followed! *hic*"]="我只是在确保没人跟踪我们！*嗝*"
G["I just be pullin' yer leg, $glad:lass;! The slow walkin'... always good fer a laugh!"]="我简直是在拖你后腿啊，$g小伙子:小姑娘;！这么慢的步伐……真是逗人发笑！"
G["I just came here to find some turnips, I swear!"]="我只是来找芜菁的，我发誓！"
G["I just can't seem to get comfortable without a sturdy ceiling of granite over my head. All these stars up there, enough to give ye the shivers."]="如果不住在有大理石天花板的房间里，我就浑身不舒服。天上的星星让我觉得很烦燥……"
G["I just delivered it!"]="我只是负责运货而已！"
G["I just don't have the medical supplies I need to properly treat all of you."]="我根本没有能治疗你们的药品和器械。"
G["I just don't want to let anyone down."]="我只是不想再让别人失望了。"
G["I just finished wandering."]="我刚结束流浪生活。"
G["I just fired an arrow."]="我刚刚射了一支箭。"
G["I just flew in from Ironforge and, Boy!, are my mount's wings tired!"]="我刚从铁炉堡飞过来，小子！我坐骑的翅膀都快累断了！"
G["I just gave kill credit to $n."]="我刚把击杀荣誉给$n。"
G["I just going to bite without even looking!"]="我差点看都没看就一口咬上去了！"
G["I just got order to pull your flight privilege, $n.  Came back later and we'll let you back into a bomber."]="我刚得到命令，决定撤消你的飞行资格，$n。稍后再来找我吧，我们会让你重返轰炸机的。"
G["I just have one thing to check..."]="只剩一个环节要检查了……"
G["I just issued Kill Credit to $n!"]="我已经将酬劳发给$n了！"
G["I just knew that I shouldn't have fired Beebo!"]="我真后悔解雇了贝波！"
G["I just love listening to Kol talk about his delicious recipes. I never knew there were so many ways to grill meat."]="我就是喜欢听柯谈论他那些美味的食谱。我从不知道竟然有那么多种烤肉的方法。"
G["I just love the sound they make when they explode!"]="我最喜欢它们爆炸时发出的声音了！"
G["I just love these wisps! They're so pretty!"]="我喜欢这些小精灵！真是太可爱了！"
G["I just need a quart, I promise."]="我只要一点点，我保证。"
G["I just need to get into the city. Why should that be so difficult?"]="为什么连进个城都这么困难？"
G["I just need to get some things ready first. You guys go ahead and get started. I need to summon up some water...."]="等等，我要准备一下。你们先上，我先来做点水……"
G["I just notice funny-looking carrot!"]="我刚看到一根长得很滑稽的胡萝卜！"
G["I just received word on that. We currently have $2021w out of $2020w peacebloom, $2050w of $2051w firebloom, and $2054w out of $2055w purple lotus herbs requested."]="我刚得到消息说，我们已经收集到$2021w份宁神花、$2050w份火焰花和$2054w份紫莲花，而总的需求量分别是$2020w、$2051w和$2055w。"
G["I just saw a Scourge!  Kill it!"]="我看见了一个天灾士兵！杀了它！"
G["I just saw the guide a moment ago..."]="我刚才还看见向导来着……"
G["I just thought it was weird that the mountains had flippers!"]="我刚还觉得纳闷呢，怎么山峰会长蹼！"
G["I just want my family to be safe."]="我只希望我的家人都安好。"
G["I just want to go home."]="我只想回家而已。"
G["I just want to set the world on fire...."]="我只想让这个世界燃烧起来……"
G["I just want you to know that if we get through this alive, I'm making sure that we turn out better than you.  No offense."]="我想说的是，如果我们能活下来，我一定能比你做得更好。我说这话可没有冒犯的意思。"
G["I just wanted my yaks back..."]="我只不过想要回我的牦牛……"
G["I just wanted them to hand us our reward, but they were just, \"talk talk talk talk talk.\""]="Yo solo quería que nos dieran la recompensa, pero ellos: \"blablabla\"."
G["I just wanted to say thanks, $n.\n\nI'm sure glad that the doc here was able to shock you back to life or we'd all be dead by now, or worse!"]="Solo quería darte las gracias, $n.\n\nMe alegro mucho de que el doctor pudiera traerte a la vida o todos estaríamos muertos ya, ¡o peor!"
G["I just wanted... one more... pair..."]="我只不过……想再要……一双……"
G["I just wish the fish would bite more than the bugs..."]="我只是希望那些鱼不要只把鱼饵吃光却不上钩……"
G["I keep 'em fed, kid. Yep, Daryl Riknussun, at yer service."]="我会喂养它们的，孩子。达瑞尔·瑞克努索，愿为你服务。"
G["I keep getting sand stuck in my toes."]="沙子灌进鞋里了……"
G["I keep hearing voices in my head. Should I be worried?"]="总有邪恶的低语在我的脑海中盘旋。我是不是该为此担心？"
G["I keep no secrets! You are welcome to accompany us, Anduin Wrynn. If your injury permits."]="我向来坦荡！如果伤势允许，你可以一起来，安度因·乌瑞恩。"
G["I kill for the master!"]="为了主人，杀了你！"
G["I kill off any stragglers and send an event..."]="我克服重重障碍才走到这里……"
G["I kill you, dooker!"]="我要杀了你，坏蛋！"
G["I killeded anoder Warmaul ogre! I am Shadow Council! Come get me!"]="我又杀了一个战槌食人魔！我是暗影议会的！来杀我啊！"
G["I kind of like you. Try not to get killed out there."]="我有点儿喜欢你。可别送了命。"
G["I kinda like this thing. What ye think, lads? Can we keep it?"]="我有点喜欢这玩意儿。你们觉得呢？我们能留下它吗？"
G["I kinnae help ye with trainin'. Ye should look fer a $c trainer."]="我无法训练你。你该去找$c训练者。"
G["I knew Cornelius wouldn't leave us behind!"]="我知道考内留斯不会丢下我们的！"
G["I knew I could count on my team to win!"]="我就知道我的队伍赢定了！"
G["I knew I made the right choice when I took this up!"]="我就知道自己的选择是对的！"
G["I knew I should have brought my folding chair."]="我就知道，应该把我的折叠椅带来。"
G["I knew I should have paid my earthquake insurance!"]="我早就知道，我应该买地震保险！"
G["I knew I should have secured the wagon lock better when I was in Andorhal."]="在安多哈尔的时候，我就该好好地看着货车，也不至于捅这漏子了。"
G["I knew I should have stayed out of this..."]="我就知道不该插手……"
G["I knew I should've stayed in Silvermoon."]="Sabía que debería haberme quedado en Platafulgor."
G["I knew I shouldn't have come to the tournament!"]="我早就知道，我不应该到这场锦标赛来！"
G["I knew I smelled something..."]="我就说有什么味道……"
G["I knew I was stronger!"]="我果然更胜一筹！"
G["I knew I would lose. The rivers told me so."]="我早就预见了这场失败。河水早已把一切都告诉了我。"
G["I knew Lurielle would send help! Thank you, friend, and give Lurielle my thanks as well!"]="我就知道鲁莉尔蕾会派人来救我的！谢谢你，朋友，也帮我谢谢鲁莉尔蕾！"
G["I knew a man once that rejected those answers! A great man that built a home for those that felt as he did! A man that chose the impossible!"]="我曾结识过一个摒弃这些答案的人！一个为那些令他感同身受的人建造家园的伟人！一个选择不可能的人！"
G["I knew a monk once who specialized in a fish-fighting style. It was pretty limiting but he could make an amazing fish stew."]="我认识一名武僧，他擅长使用斗鱼招式。招数虽然相当有限，但是他炖的鱼汤非常好吃。"
G["I knew it was within their power to defy the mogu - they just needed someone like you to show them how."]="我知道，他们完全有反抗魔古族的力量——只是需要一个像你这样英雄为他们做出榜样。"
G["I knew it! It's calling up a message!"]="我认识它！它正在发出一条信息！"
G["I knew of another like you once... His name was Vol'jin. You are a rare breed, my friend."]="Hace tiempo, conocí a alguien como tú... Se llamaba Vol'jin. No es fácil encontrar a tipos como tú, $gamigo:amiga;."
G["I knew someone would come for us! Let me help you fight the yaungol."]="我就知道会有人来救我们的！让我来帮你揍野牛人吧。"
G["I knew someone would come for us. Thank you, $c!"]="我就知道会有人来救我们的。谢谢你，$c！"
G["I knew that was coming."]="我就知道会这样。"
G["I knew that we never should have gone into those caves. It's not natural!"]="我就知道我们不应该进入洞穴。那里的状况太异常了！"
G["I knew that you would come."]="我就知道你会来的。"
G["I knew the Silver Covenant would not desert me. Thank you, champion."]="我就知道银色盟约不会抛弃我的。谢谢你，勇士。"
G["I knew the Sunreavers would not desert me. Thank you, champion."]="我就知道夺日者不会抛弃我的。谢谢你，勇士。"
G["I knew the Thorium Brotherhood would come through!"]="我就知道， 瑟银兄弟会一定会来救我们！"
G["I knew the prince would be angry, but I... I have not been myself. I had to let them out! The great one speaks to me, you see. Wait--outsiders. Kael'thas did not send you! Good... I'll just tell the prince you released the prisoners!"]="我知道王子殿下会非常生气，但是我……我不知道自己怎么回事，居然把它们都放出来了！主人在对我说话，你也看到了……等等，有人来了。你们不是凯尔萨斯派来的！好极了……我会告诉王子殿下，是你们放走了囚犯！"
G["I knew the puny ones weren't to be trusted!  Smash them!"]="我就知道那群渣滓不值得信任！击碎他们！"
G["I knew the swamp was the right choice!"]="我就知道沼泽是个正确的选择！"
G["I knew they'd send reinforcements! Never doubted it!"]="我就知道他们会派援军来的！我对此深信不疑！"
G["I knew this was a dragonforged blade when I first laid eyes on it."]="我第一眼看到它，就知道这是一把龙铸之刃。"
G["I knew we would defeat the invaders!"]="我早知道我们能打败入侵者！"
G["I knew you could do it, Ace!"]="我就知道你能做到，王牌飞行员！"
G["I knew you had it in you all along, $n.\n\nNow, do you think there'll be a position for me in Azshara? Do they have trolls there?"]="$n, he sabido que lo tenías en tu interior todo este tiempo.\n\n¿Crees que habrá un puesto para mí en Azshara? ¿Hay trols allí?"
G["I knew you had it in you, $n! You saved our skins.\n\nNow let's get out of here before I have to kill Fizz and Evol."]="¡Sabía que podrías, $n! Nos has salvado el pellejo.\n\nAhora salgamos de aquí antes de que tenga que matar a Fizz y a Evol."
G["I knew you were coming. No one can resist me, not even you!"]="我知道你会来。没有人能与我对抗，即便是你也不行！"
G["I knew you were destined for greatness."]="我早知道，你会成为伟大的人。"
G["I knew you were on your way. I don't care what they're saying about you or your connection to Arikara. This ends here!"]="我知道你有自己的办法。我不在乎他们对于你和阿利卡拉的关系有着怎样的议论。那些话到我这里就结束了！"
G["I knew you were the right one for this task, $c. Meet me back upstairs when you are finished here."]="我就知道你合适这任务，$c。等这里的事完成后，到楼上来找我。"
G["I knew you would come, $n. It is good to see you again, friend."]="我知道你会来的，$n。很高兴再次见到你，朋友。"
G["I knew you'd return, Ysondre...It was only a matter of time..."]="我就知道你会回来的，伊森德雷……只是时间问题……"
G["I knew your grandfather well. I was very sorry when he passed."]="我跟你祖父是老相识了。他过世时，我悲伤不已。"
G["I knew!"]="我知道！"
G["I know Commander Stonebreaker and I will vouch for his loyalty and his honesty. We must take his word."]="我知道指挥官碎石和我都会为他的忠心和诚实打包票。我们必须相信他。"
G["I know I promised you the front seat, Giddy, but we have an elderly guest.  I'm sorry."]="我知道我答应让你坐在前排，吉德文，可我们这儿有位年长的客人。真对不起。"
G["I know I talk down to them, but I never want to see any of my people die."]="我知道我的态度有些傲慢，但是我不希望我的同胞受到牵连。"
G["I know I worked a hundred and sixty eight hours last week... but if the paperwork says I didn't clock in, maybe you're right."]="我知道我上星期总共工作了一百六十八个小时……可如果查不到我的考勤记录，也许你是对的。"
G["I know I'm a stubborn old paw of the earth, but even I have to admit you've done me a great deed."]="我是个顽固的老农夫，可我承认，你帮我了一个大忙。"
G["I know I'm counseling patience, Aponi, but I don't like remaining here any more than you do. Times are bleak, and failing to act only makes me worry that my idle hand may have been the one to turn the tide."]="奥伯妮，我一直在劝你要保持耐心，但现在我和你一样讨厌呆在这里。这里的时光乏味无趣。这种无所事事的状态最终也许会逼迫我彻底改变这里的一切。"
G["I know a few things, but I'm no expert. Lucky for you, Magar is. He's standing near the back of the shop. See if he can help you, but be careful not to rile him. He can be irritable."]="我知道一些，但我不是专家。祝你好远，玛加尔也是。他就站在商店后面。看看他是否能帮助你，但是小心别惹恼他。他脾气有些暴躁。"
G["I know a few things. You want me to show you?"]="我知道一些。要我告诉你吗？"
G["I know a place nearby where we can speak in private, my child. Follow me."]="Conozco un lugar cercano en el que podremos hablar en privado, $ghijo mío:hija mía;. Sígueme."
G["I know a secret trail through Neverrest. Add three days to any journey, but you see very neat waterfall along way. Most fortunate path."]="我知道一条穿越不息山的秘密小径。行程会增加三天，但沿途上有一条十分澄澈清凉的瀑布。绝对不虚此行。"
G["I know a thing or two about decorating, my good friend. I know just what Farmer Yoon needs for his house!"]="Sé un par de cosas sobre decoración, mi $gbuen amigo:buena amiga;. ¡Sé exactamente lo que el granjero Yoon necesita para su casa!"
G["I know all about your cult master."]="我对你们的教派领袖了解得一清二楚。"
G["I know all is not well in Shadowglen, but coming back to these woods is always like coming back home.\n\nEver peaceful. Ever pure."]="我知道，幽影谷的状况并不好。但回到这片森林总是让我有一种回家的感觉。\n\n这里永远都是安宁而纯净的。"
G["I know an ace when I see one.  Thanks again for saving my life!"]="我一眼就能认出谁是王牌飞行员。谢谢你救了我！"
G["I know dis is prolly busy work, but I don't mind. Dese baby raptors are cute lil devils."]="这是件苦差事，但我不介意。这些小恐龙都是可爱的小恶魔。"
G["I know exactly what I'll be doin' about it, son of Hellscream.  I'll watch and wait as ya people slowly become aware of ya ineptitude.  I'll laugh as dey grow ta despise ya as I do."]="我知道我将会怎样做，地狱咆哮之子。我会静静等待人们逐渐意识到你没有能力担当这个职位。最终，他们会像我一样离开你。"
G["I know how to speak kitty, and Effsee said thank you."]="我知道怎么跟小猫说话，喵喵说谢谢你。"
G["I know it will be ok, baby."]="我知道一切都会好起来的，宝贝。"
G["I know it'll work this time..."]="我就知道这次能成功……"
G["I know it'll work this time... My last 13 tries were just practice!"]="我知道这次会成功的……我以前的13次尝试只不过是练习罢了！"
G["I know it's too late to save them, but m-maybe you can take out the rest of the attackers..."]="我知道要想挽救这些船只已经来不及了，但也——也许你能解决掉剩下的那些攻击者……"
G["I know just about everyone in these parts. I'll let them know there's a new face in town."]="这地方的人我都认识，我会告诉他们镇上来了个新面孔。"
G["I know just the one that you speak of $c. You must seek out Brogun Stoneshield on the Warrior's Terrace."]="Debo deh'trozaros."
G["I know just the place. Will you be all right?"]="我知道该去哪里。你没事吧？"
G["I know just the soldier for that horse!"]="我会给那匹马选个合适的好主子！"
G["I know many things, stranger, but your knowledge rivals my own. Enchanters who wish to hone their skills further are known to travel to the Tower of Azora, where an artisan named Kitta Firewind resides."]="Sé muchas cosas, $gforastero:forastera;, pero tu saber rivaliza con el mío. Los encantadores que quieren seguir perfeccionando sus habilidades viajan a la Torre de Azora, donde reside una artesana llamada Kitta Vientofuego."
G["I know much, listen and be educated, $r."]="我知道很多，好好听着吧，$r。"
G["I know my jokes ain't so good... I lost my funny bone!"]="我知道我的笑话不怎么样……因为我的“笑骨”不见了！"
G["I know no death. I will... be back... for you..."]="我不怕死。我会回来……找你……"
G["I know not how this was possible, but you must still be judged Iskalder. Wait... what is this?"]="我不明白怎么会这样，但是你一定是伊斯卡德尔。等等……怎么回事？"
G["I know not the extent of their plans, heroes, but I know this:  They cannot be allowed to succeed!"]="我还不知道他们的全盘计划，但我知道，英雄们，绝不能让他们得逞！"
G["I know not what you are, but I do know that you will die!"]="我不知道你是什么玩意儿，但我知道，你必死无疑！"
G["I know not whether you've come on the call and beckon of your new Dragonmaw allies. Nor do I really care to trust you even if you do not."]="我不知道你是不是为了响应你的新龙喉盟友的号召来到这里。即使不是，我也不会信任你。"
G["I know now - beyond a shadow of a doubt - that the val'kyr are our future."]="我现在明白了——并且坚信不疑——瓦格里是我们的未来。"
G["I know of a druid that lives atop the hill above the Wailing Caverns,$n. She might be able to tell you more about this shard you have found."]="我认识一个住在哀嚎洞穴山顶的德鲁伊，$n。她也许告诉你更多关于这块碎片的信息。"
G["I know of a few people around here that practice a profession or two.  What profession do you have in mind?"]="我知道有些人在这附近练习某些专业。你想要打听哪项专业技能的训练师？"
G["I know of a local alchemist. Sheynathren, I believe his name is. When last I saw him, he was heading off to Saltheril's Haven, no doubt to engage in one of his ridiculous parties."]="我认识一位本地的炼金师。森纳瑟林，应该是这个名字。当我最后一次看到他的时候，他正在前往萨瑟利尔庄园，毫无疑问，他是去参加一场可笑的聚会。"
G["I know of a local alchemist. Sheynathren, I believe his name is. When last I saw him, he was heading off to Sartheril's Haven, no doubt to engage in one of his ridiculous parties."]="我认识一位本地的炼金师。森纳瑟林，应该是这个名字。当我最后一次看到他的时候，他正在前往萨瑟利尔庄园，毫无疑问，他是去参加一场可笑的聚会。"
G["I know of a saleswoman of trade goods in Summer's Rest. I will mark the location on your map."]="我知道有个小贩在夏之眠摆摊卖货。我会在你的地图上标出位置。"
G["I know our next step. Meet me back atop Mason's Folly - you'll be pleasantly surprised at what I have in store for you!"]="我知道接下来该怎么做。回石匠之愚来找我——我为你准备了一个惊喜！"
G["I know she likes a man who can hold his liquor, so I've been building up my tolerance by getting sloshed every night."]="我知道她喜欢千杯不醉的男人，所以我每天晚上喝得烂醉，来锻炼我的酒量。"
G["I know that I promised you last night, and the night before that, but I'm taking you out someplace really nice tomorrow night!"]="我知道，昨晚和前天晚上我都答应过你。等到明天晚上，我一定会带你去个好地方！"
G["I know that a terrible enemy pursued him after he won the horn, but I... I don't recall... what happened... next."]="在他夺得号角之后，有个可怕的敌人追上了他……但是，我不记得……后来发生了什么。"
G["I know that look in your eye... I'm not going to be able to talk you out of this.  If you die on me again..."]="你的眼神说明了一切……我说服不了你。别再让我听到你的噩耗了……"
G["I know that one of those visiting Woolybush dwarves is an archaeologist.\nI think it's the wife, Faena. They're both explorers of some sort. Look for them in the inn."]="Sé que uno de esos enanos Lanudo que han venido de visita se dedica a la arqueología.\n\nCreo que es la mujer, Faena. Los dos son exploradores o algo así. Búscalos en la posada."
G["I know that you want your vacation, but we still have work to do."]="我知道你想度假，但是我们仍然有事要做。"
G["I know the perfect people for such a task. I will send them immediately, priestess."]="我知道完成这种任务最适合的人选。我会立刻派遣他们过去，祭司大人。"
G["I know the troops need food, but this is ridiculous."]="我知道军队需要食物，但是这也太荒唐了。"
G["I know the way home. Thanks, $gmister:lady;!"]="我认识回家的路。谢谢你，$g先生:女士;！"
G["I know the way to Deathknell.  Come with me!"]="我知道通往丧钟镇的路。跟我来！"
G["I know the way, insect. There is no need to prod me as if I were cattle."]="我知道怎么走，蠢货，你没必要像赶牛那样鞭打我吧？"
G["I know there's more of ya, hidin' in your little holes..."]="我知道，你们的小窟窿里还藏着你的同伙……"
G["I know these forests as if they were a part of me... but know that there is still much to be learned from them, and much danger still hidden."]="我对这片森林非常熟悉，它们就像我身体的一部分……但是它们还蕴藏着很多值得学习的知识，当然也有很多危险。"
G["I know these luckydos."]="我知道这些幸运符。"
G["I know they funny looking, but less starting, more killing."]="我知道它们长得很滑稽，但是你也别老盯着看啊，多杀些吧。"
G["I know this does not seem like the obvious path to you, but it will bring you closer to the Light. Fight well, brother."]="Sé que este puede no parecerte el camino más obvio, pero te acercaré a la Luz. Pelea bien, herman$go:a;."
G["I know this looks grim, but our enemies will pay for what they have done. I'll make sure they do."]="我知道情势非常严峻，但我们的敌人一定会为他们的恶行付出代价。我保证。"
G["I know this will seem like betrayal, but Mr. Hastings has made an offer I simply cannot refuse. My apologies, $n."]="我知道这像是背信弃义，但我实在是难以拒绝哈斯廷先生的出价。真抱歉，$n。"
G["I know very litte else... The High General chooses who may go and who must stay behind. There's nothing else... You must believe me!"]="其他的我就不清楚了……阿比迪斯将军决定谁走谁留。我只知道这些……你要相信我啊！"
G["I know very little of the Highborne and nothing of the Shen'dralar."]="我对上层精灵知之甚少，对辛德拉更是一无所知。"
G["I know we all look alike to you, but I'm a healer, not a mage."]="我知道，在你眼里我们都是一个样儿，可我是个治疗者，不是法师。"
G["I know what I said. My trust was misplaced."]="我记得我说的话。可我信错了人。"
G["I know what I'm having for dinner tonight and it rhymes with \"Sucky\"!"]="¡Ya sé lo que voy a cenar esta noche y rima con \"Apestado\"!"
G["I know what evil lies in the hearts of orcs."]="我深知，兽人的内心是多么邪恶。"
G["I know what he would do."]="我知道他会干什么。"
G["I know what you mean... they whisper about us when they think we can't hear them. They'll get theirs."]="我知道你的意思……他们自以为他们的私语我们不知道。他们会自食其果的。"
G["I know what you're after. I can sense it!"]="我知道你在找什么。我能感觉到它！"
G["I know what you're planning, these Kor'kron will be ready when you strike."]="我知道你在想什么，等你进攻时，这些库卡隆会做好准备的。"
G["I know what you're thinking. I can see it in your little $r eyes.\n\n<The pupil smiles.>\n\nWell, are we doing this, or what?"]="我知道你在想什么。你的心思全写在你那双$r眼睛里呢。\n\n<这名徒弟露出了微笑。>\n\n好吧，我们可以开始了吗？"
G["I know what you're up to, Schnottz! Deathwing will never have the coffer, not if I can help it!"]="我知道你在找什么，司克诺兹！只要有我在，死亡之翼永远也别想得到那只箱子！"
G["I know what you're up to, and I mean to put an end to it, permanently!"]="我知道你们要干什么，而我将永远打消你们的念头！"
G["I know what your friend has seen, $n - he will need to rest for now. Come speak with me."]="我知道你朋友看到了什么，$n——他现在需要休息。来和我谈谈。"
G["I know where it CAME from, what was it?"]="我知道是从哪儿传来的，可那到底是什么？"
G["I know who ya are, shadow hunter. An' I know what ya WANT. But what makes you tink I'm gonna help YOU? Ain't a wise ting, callin' me from de Other Side..."]="我知道你是谁，暗影猎手。我知道你想要什么。但你凭什么认为我会帮助你？召唤我可算不上明智的行为……"
G["I know who you are, $n! I'll not surrender the Sacred Flame to a filthy meatbag such as yourself!"]="我知道你是谁，$n！我才不会把神圣烈焰交给像你这样恶心的饭桶！"
G["I know who you are, $n.  Fate and forces beyond that have brought you to me for a reason, and it is one I take no pleasure in being a part of.  There are many decisions you will make in the coming times, and I hope you are wise enough to make the correct ones.\n\nBelieve me, $r, when I tell you this - there are correct choices."]="Sé quién eres, $n. El destino y otras fuerzas te han traído hasta me por un motivo del cual no me complace formar parte. Tendrás que tomar muchas decisiones a partir de ahora y espero que seas lo suficientemente inteligente para hacerlo con acierto.\n\n$R, créeme cuando te digo que es posible."
G["I know why you've come - one of those foolish Magnataur on the plains meddled and managed to get the dragons involved.  Do you enjoy serving them like a dog?"]="我知道你为什么会来这里——平原上那些愚蠢的猛犸人多管闲事，竟然胆敢与龙族交战。当他们的走狗很有趣吗？"
G["I know you are not one of us. You are one of them.\n\nI follow you. I watch you. You kill our people, but you also kill mogu. You kill straight-back trolls.\n\nI do not care who you kill. I pick up the meat afterward. So very, very much meat."]="我知道你不是我们的人。你是他们的人。\n\n我跟踪了你。我监视着你。你杀了我们的人，可你也杀魔古族。你还杀直背的巨魔。\n\n我不关心你杀了什么人。我就跟在后面拣肉吃。好多好多肉。"
G["I know you are there, rogue. Leave my home or join the others at the bottom of the world tree."]="Sé que estás ahí, $gpícaro:pícara;. Abandona mi casa o únete a los demás junto al Árbol del Mundo."
G["I know you as Artorius the Doombringer. Show yourself, demon! Face me!"]="我知道你是摧毁者阿托留斯。恶魔，现身吧！"
G["I know you by your stench, little $n.  Here, in my perch, is where your bones shall finally rest."]="我闻到了你浑身散发着的臭气，渺小的$n。在这里，在我的地盘中，你将永远长眠。"
G["I know you still learning, but big-tongues are bad. Frenzyheart good, big-tongues bad, okay?"]="我知道你还在不断地学习，但是大舌头怪很坏。狂心狼獾人是好人，大舌头怪是坏人，明白吗？"
G["I know you will, $n.\n\nI myself am a priestess, though, unlike you I am long since gone from this world. My spirit, however, remains here, as do the spirits of the thousands who were brutally slain by the mad Prince, Arthas Menethil and his legion of undeath."]="Sé que lo harás, $n.\n\nYo misma soy una sacerdotisa aunque, al contrario de ti, hace mucho que me he ido de este mundo. Sin embargo, mi espíritu permanece aquí, al igual que los espíritus de los miles que fueron brutalmente asesinados por el príncipe Arthas Menethil y su legión de no-muertos."
G["I know you will. I'm sending in grunts to make sure of it."]="你一定会的。我会派步兵来监督。"
G["I know you!  You saved my brother not even a week ago.  You're a true hero!"]="¡Yo te conozco! Salvaste a mi hermano hace apenas una semana. ¡Eres $gun auténtico héroe:una auténtica heroína;!"
G["I know you're new to our kind, so I'll catch you up a bit while we're on our way over."]="我知道你对霜脉矮人还缺乏了解，因此我会在路上为你做一些简单的介绍。"
G["I know you. I have you to thank for my freedom from the deepening corruption that consumed me for so many years.\n\nWelcome to my home. Deepholm.  It is a shadow of what it used to be, but still, here I can be free. I shall never take such freedom for granted after what we have endured.\n\nI know not why you are here, but I hope you find what you seek within the stone walls of this place. Stay safe, $n."]="我认识你。我要感谢你。如果不是你，我可能还会深陷在已经将我吞噬无数个岁月的腐蚀力量中。\n\n欢迎来到我的家，深岩之洲。与曾经的深岩之洲相比，这里大概只能算是一个影子。但我现在是自由的。承受过那么多磨难之后，我已经深深地明白，自由是多么可贵。\n\n不知道你为什么会到这里来，但我希望你能在这高大的石墙中找到你所需要的一切。祝你平安，$n。"
G["I know you. If the reports I've been receiving are true, I could use a $gman:woman; like you."]="我认识你。如果我收到的报告情况属实，我的确需要一位像你这样的$g大侠:女侠;帮助。"
G["I know your face... Aggra! Oh, my heart - can't you see? I am... nothing. Selfish... all I've done... accomplished... all for the sake of pride alone. I am... unworthy of you..."]="我认识你的脸……阿格娜！哦，我的心——你看不到吗？我……一无是处。自私……我所做的一切……仅仅是为了满足我的傲慢。我……配不上你……"
G["I know your secret, Koltira.  I'm aware of your friendship with the Alliance death knight, Thassarian."]="我知道你的秘密，库尔迪拉。我知道你和联盟死亡骑士萨萨里安之间的友谊。"
G["I know your secret, outsider. I know you are an enemy. I smell through your false skin.\n\nI am not scared of you. Fear is for the weak. I am not weak."]="Conozco tu secreto, $gforastero:forastera;. Sé que eres el enemigo. Puedo oler a través de tu piel falsa.\n\nNo te tengo miedo. El miedo es para los cobardes. Yo no soy cobarde."
G["I know!  The way he looks at you with those hungry eyes.  I'm afraid to even turn my back!"]="我知道！瞧他看你时那双饥渴的眼睛，我就全都知道了。真不知道他背着我的时候会干出什么来！"
G["I know, I know, I'm out here in the middle of nowhere!\n\nMy home is actually in Ratchet, but after crashing my zeppelin here, I thought I might as well start the research I came here to do!"]="我知道，我知道，我知道我根本不知道自己在哪里！\n\n我的家在棘齿城，不过既然我的飞艇在这儿坠落了，那我不如现在就开始进行我的研究项目了！"
G["I know, I know."]="我知道，我知道。"
G["I know, I know. Back in the bucket...."]="我知道，我知道。在桶里……"
G["I know, I know. We got the upper hand here now thanks to you, so we'll get them dang yaungol out of here soon. Just the same, if you feel like crackin' a skull or two, you won't hear me complainin'."]="我知道，我知道。托你的福，我们在这里占了上风，很快就能把那些该死的野牛人赶走了。但话说回来，要是你想再亲手打碎几个脑壳，我也没意见。"
G["I know, I know... \"fishing in a sewer?\" But you'd be surprised by what you can catch down here. I've even heard stories of sharks, if you can believe it."]="Ya sé… \"¿pescar en una cloaca?\" Pero te sorprendería lo que puedes pescar aquí. He oído historias sobre tiburones, aunque te parezca increíble."
G["I know, I know... I haven't given up yet. Don't get your hopes up though, this technology is way beyond me."]="嗯，我知道……我会继续尝试的。不过你也别抱太大的希望，这种科技完全超越了我能理解的范围。"
G["I know, lass, but you're safe now and with friends. I thought you were dead!"]="啊，女孩，你现在安全地和朋友们在一起了。我还以为你已经死了！"
G["I know, right?"]="我知道，对吗？"
G["I know, sister. I know. We'll return to fighting one day. For now, though, maybe it's best to spread the word to others... give them the hope you have."]="我知道，姐妹，我知道。总有一天，我们会重返战场。但现在，我们最应该做的也许是将这个消息传递给其他人……让他们拥有和你一样的希望。"
G["I know, we thought he was dead too, but that's not the case. He's trying to use the Sunwell to bring the master of the Burning Legion, Kil'Jaeden, into this world."]="我知道，我们也以为他已经死了，不过事实并非如此。他正设法用太阳之井将燃烧军团的主子——基尔加丹带到这个世界来。"
G["I know.  It be why I went around, to warn everyone.   When da leader of da Darkspear speak, everyone listen, Horde an' Alliance."]="我知道。那正是我四处奔波的原因：警告所有人。暗矛部族的领袖亲自发言时，所有人都会认真听，无论是部落还是联盟。"
G["I know. I KNOW. We could never be, right? Dragon and Spirit Healer... two different worlds! Not to mention the physiological problems.\n\nBut you're wrong. We have a deeper connection than that. Anara and I, we're involved.\n\nBesides, I kind of like it here. No adventurers to poke and prod me with no provocation."]="我知道。我知道。我们永远也不可能，对吗？龙和灵魂医者……两个完全不同的世界！更别提生理方面的问题了。\n\n但你错了。我们有着一种更深刻的联系。安娜拉和我，我们相爱了。\n\n而且我很喜欢这里。这里没有那些惹人讨厌，让我发怒的冒险者。"
G["I know. I trust you to lead the siege. I am needed elsewhere."]="我知道。你负责指挥进攻。我有其他的事要做。"
G["I know... I know! Where's the override? The override?!"]="我知道……我知道！超控开关？超控开关在哪儿？"
G["I lack the strength to transmit the signal. You must... hurry... find a place of power... close to the skies."]="我没有足够的力气去发射信号。你们必须……尽快……找到一处发射场……要靠近天空。"
G["I last saw Elder Meadowrun at the Weeping Cave in the Western Plaguelands."]="幽林长者在西瘟疫之地的哭泣之洞外面。"
G["I laugh at you, feeble $n, but I will oblige. Now, let us return to my master, below!"]="我嘲笑你，没用的$n，但我会照做。现在我们该回下面找我的主人了！"
G["I leave you now, mortals. Alive and with these trinkets. Maltrake! Present them with the trinkets!"]="我饶了你们的性命，你得活着，拿好这些饰品！玛特拉克，把饰品交给他们！"
G["I left a war once to tend to the troubles back home in Westfall. That seems like a lifetime ago. Thank the Light that the Defias are no longer a threat.\n\nWe're a long way from home up here, but if we don't win this battle, there may not be a Westfall to return to."]="当我得知西部荒野发生骚乱时，便毅然告别战友，返回家乡处理当地的事务。算算也是陈年旧事啦。感谢圣光，迪菲亚兄弟会的威胁得以解除。\n\n如今我们再次出征，来到偏远的极寒之地。如果我们嬴不了这场战争，或许就再也没有机会回家了。"
G["I left. I would not remain with the Blackrock. No, the deaths of my children would not be in vain. I would not serve under an inept, power hungry maniac such as Rend.\n\nI took shelter in the woods of Lordaeron, living as a hermit near Hearthglen."]="我走了。我不属于黑石。不，我的孩子不能白白死去。我不会在雷德这样无能、热衷于权利的疯子手下做事的。\n\n我隐居在壁炉谷附近洛丹伦的森林中。"
G["I lend you the cold vengeance of the northern winds!"]="我赐予你北风的冷酷复仇之力！"
G["I let the dogs out!"]="我要放狗了！"
G["I lied. Your miserable food stinks, but not as much as this town is going to stink!"]="我骗了你。你这烂食物正在散发着臭气。但这城市更加臭不可闻！"
G["I lied..."]="我改主意了……"
G["I like anything pretty or shiny."]="我喜欢所有漂亮的或是闪闪发光的东西。"
G["I like cake more than pie."]="相比馅饼，我更喜欢蛋糕。"
G["I like my meat extra crispy!"]="我最喜欢烤肉了！"
G["I like my women like I like my beer: full-bodied."]="我喜欢女人就像我喜欢啤酒——丰满而醇厚。"
G["I like shorts! They're perfect for this weather!"]="我喜欢穿短裤！它最适合这里的天气！"
G["I like that brown rat over there.  HEY!  I think he waved at me!!"]="我喜欢那边的那只棕色老鼠。嘿！我想它在和我招手！"
G["I like the sound of that."]="我喜欢那声音。"
G["I like the way you fight!"]="我喜欢你的身手！"
G["I like the way you think!  Let's get outta here!"]="我喜欢你思考的方式！我们走吧！"
G["I like the way you think! Let's go!"]="我喜欢你的思路！我们走！"
G["I like the way you think, $r!\n\nUntil recently, the latent magical energies of the academy grounds attracted the attention of the Blue Dragonflight, and I wasn't able to study them. The attention of the dragons is now elsewhere, but a worse threat is in the making - these little green brutes want to level the ruins to make way for a fuel depot! Knowledge lost for ten thousand years is days away from being lost forever. We've got to act fast."]="我喜欢你的想法，$r！\n\n就在不久以前，埋藏在这片废墟中的魔法能量还一直吸引着蓝龙军团的注意。所以我无法对这里进行研究。而现在，那些巨龙的注意力已经转移到别的地方去了，但一个更加可怕的威胁正在形成——那些绿色的小畜生想要把这片废墟推平，为一座燃料补给站开辟道路！用不了多久，埋藏上万年的神秘知识就将永远遗失了。我们必须尽快采取行动。"
G["I like the way you think, Bridgewater."]="我喜欢你思考的方式，布瑞哲沃特。"
G["I like the way you think."]="我喜欢你思考的方式。"
G["I like things that come from nature."]="我喜欢纯天然的东西。"
G["I like this place. Although it needs more water... I like it."]="我喜欢这个地方。要是这里的水再多一点就好了……"
G["I like thish a lot, $n. Thanksh."]="我非常喜欢这里，$n。谢谢你。"
G["I like to build stuff. Of course, I like to blow stuff up even more!"]="我希望组建队伍。当然，我更希望扩大队伍！"
G["I like to clean the leaves away from the trails. Too many leaves brings sprites. Temple monks do not like sprites."]="我喜欢清扫小径上的落叶。过多的落叶会引来林精。寺庙武僧不喜欢林精。"
G["I like to consider myself a historian of my people. I believe that in order to understand the present, we should examine the events of the past."]="我喜欢将自己定位为本民族的历史学家。我相信，为了更好地理解现状，我们必须研究过去的历史。"
G["I like to keep an eye on all of my students. I will watch your progress eagerly."]="我会密切注意所有的弟子。我非常渴望看到你的进步。"
G["I like to offer my competitors something nice to eat. Before I crush them."]="在粉碎我的对手前，我总是喜欢让他们美餐一顿。"
G["I like to play in the water barrel but I'm told it's not for children."]="我喜欢在大水桶里划水，但是他们说那不是给孩子们玩的。"
G["I like to play in the water barrel, but I'm told it's not for children."]="我喜欢在大水桶里划水，但是他们说那不是给孩子们玩的。"
G["I like to think myself a reasonable fellow in an unreasonable situation."]="我喜欢在一个不讲道理的处境中保持讲道理的态度。"
G["I like to think of myself as the brains and the beauty of this operation. Anji's the brawn. And the second beauty.\n\nWe've got a lot of beauty."]="我喜欢把自己看作此次行动的幕后智囊和台前花旦。安济的四肢发达。并且她也是个台前花旦。\n\n我们这里已经有很多台前花旦了。"
G["I like turtles."]="我喜欢海龟。"
G["I like what I'm seeing here. Did everyone see that? Who is next?"]="我喜欢在这里看到的一切。大家都看见了吗？下一个是谁？"
G["I like what you're wearing!"]="我喜欢你的衣服！"
G["I like you! Weed make anise pear."]="我喜欢你！青出于蓝啊。"
G["I like you. Here's a raise!"]="我喜欢你。给你加薪水！"
G["I like your style, hero."]="我喜欢你这种风格，英雄。"
G["I liked that last group!"]="我喜欢上一组！"
G["I liked the worgen better when they were a disorganized mess that you'd run into in small packs. This new Gilnean worgen alliance is much more difficult to deal with."]="我喜欢散乱无序的狼人，你可以随意对他们大杀大砍。而这些新吉尔尼斯狼人联盟要难对付得多。"
G["I listen and I listen but I don't hear these spirits that Karn speaks of."]="我在听，我在听，但是听不见卡恩所说的那些灵魂的声音。"
G["I live again!"]="我又复活啦！"
G["I live again..."]="我又活了……"
G["I live another day, thanks to you."]="多亏了你，我又多活了一天。"
G["I live by the ways of the new travelers to Pandaria. \"Keep yer powder dry and yer ale cold!!\""]="Vivo según la filosofía de los nuevos viajeros de Pandaria. \"¡¡Mantén la pólvora seca y la cerveza fría!!\""
G["I live for this!"]="我为杀戮而生！"
G["I live only to serve our King."]="我活着就是为了为国王服务。"
G["I live only to serve the Lich King!"]="我的生命只属于巫妖王陛下！"
G["I live only to serve the master, my lady."]="为主人效忠就是我活着的意义。"
G["I live only to serve the master."]="我活着的目的就是为主人服务。"
G["I live only to serve, Warchief! My life is empty and meaningless without your guidance."]="我活着就是为了为战争之王服务！没有你的指导，我的生活将空虚而无意义。"
G["I live to fight again."]="我活下来，就是为了能再上战场。"
G["I live to fight another day!"]="生命不息，战斗不止！"
G["I live to serve!"]="我生来就是为大家效劳的！"
G["I live... and die... for the Banshee Queen."]="我或生……或死……都效忠于女妖之王。"
G["I lived in Dire Maul for a little bit.  That was fun.  Really."]="我在厄运之槌里住过一段时间，真令人难忘。真的。"
G["I located these leaders here..."]="那些头领在这儿……"
G["I long for the frozen wastes of Northrend."]="我向往诺森德的冰冻荒原。"
G["I look across this base and all I see is fear... Are you gonna be scared when the Lich King's armies are sittin' pretty in Stormwind? Ironforge? NO! You're not. And do you know why? Because you'll be dead, that's why."]="每一次我望向这个基地时，唯一能看到……就是恐惧……等到天灾军团占领了铁炉堡或是暴风城以后，你们还会感到恐惧吗？不！不会了！知道为什么吗？因为那时候你们早已没命了。"
G["I look forward to further training when you are ready."]="如果你准备好了，我就要进行下一阶段的训练了。"
G["I look forward to our coming challenge."]="我对即将到来的挑战充满期待。"
G["I look forward to our match."]="我很期待我们的对决。"
G["I look forward to our melee. Of course, I plan to win."]="我很期待我们的对决。毫无疑问，我赢定了。"
G["I look forward to teaching you the error of your ways."]="我可以帮你纠正你的错误。"
G["I look forward to when our paths cross again!"]="愿我们能再次相见！"
G["I look forward to working with you."]="我期待与你合作。"
G["I look into the eye..."]="我凝视着这只眼……"
G["I look upon the symbol that unites us.  This hammer.  It is the hammer that builds and creates.  But it is also the hammer that bludgeons and destroys!"]="我望着这个将我们凝聚在一起的象征——这把锤子。这把锤子象征着建设和创造，也象征着暴力和毁灭！"
G["I looked into the eyes of The Dragon, and despaired..."]="在巨龙的眼中，我只看到了绝望……"
G["I lose slapslap...?"]="我怎么没力气了……？"
G["I lost \"Scrutiny.\""]="He perdido el \"Escrutinio\"."
G["I lost Brann's Communicator and need a replacement."]="我把布莱恩的通讯器弄丢了，我想要一个新的。"
G["I lost Lord Valthalak's Amulet!"]="我把瓦塔拉克公爵的饰品弄丢了！"
G["I lost a piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet!"]="我把一块瓦塔拉克公爵的饰品碎片弄丢了！"
G["I lost again! I'd better keep training."]="我又输了！我得多加训练才行。"
G["I lost my Blackrock Disguise, Colonel.  May I have another?"]="上校，我的黑石伪装丢了。能再给我一件么？"
G["I lost my Blackrock Disguise, sir.  May I have another?"]="我的黑石伪装丢了。能再给我一件么？"
G["I lost my Crown Choclate Sampler."]="我把我的皇冠巧克力样本弄丢了。"
