G["I lost my Crystal Pylon User's Manual and need another one."]="我把水晶塔使用手册弄丢了，能再给我一份吗？"
G["I lost my Fang of Goldrinn. Can I have another?"]="我把戈德林之牙弄丢了。可以再给我一个吗？"
G["I lost my Fang of Lo'Gosh. Can I have another?"]="我把洛戈什之牙弄丢了。可以再给我一个吗？"
G["I lost my Motivate-a-Tron. May I have another?"]="我的激励仪丢了，能再给我一台么？"
G["I lost my Weathered Treasure Map. Do you have a spare copy of it?"]="我弄丢了风蚀的藏宝图。你还有多余的吗？"
G["I lost my booterang, Mudlump. I think it may have malfunctioned and is now stuck up the backside of a worthless peon."]="我把我的训诫靴弄丢了，玛德拉普。我想它可能卡在一个没用的苦工背上了。"
G["I lost my cloth. Can you rip me off another piece?"]="我把布弄丢了。能再裁一块给我吗？"
G["I lost my serpent! Could you perform the spirit link once again?"]="我的翔龙走失了！你能帮我重新建立灵魂链接吗？"
G["I lost my shades!"]="我的墨镜丢了！"
G["I lost my shield in my travels, all I wanted was a Brew, now all I want is my shield back!"]="我在旅途中弄丢了盾牌，原本我只想要品尝好酒，可现在，我只想把盾牌找回来！"
G["I lost my totems. Can you help?"]="我把我的图腾丢掉了，你能帮助我吗？"
G["I lost my transponder and need another one, Scooty."]="我的传送器被我弄丢了，现在我需要另外一个传送器，斯库提。"
