G["I love when they do that."]="我喜欢看他们那样做。"
G["I love ya pop."]="我爱你，爸爸。"
G["I love ya too, son. Now let's go get us a pint!"]="我也爱你，儿子。现在，让我们找地方喝一杯吧！"
G["I love yoooouuu man ... *hic* like a BROTHER!"]="我爱你伙计……（嗝儿）如同兄长！"
G["I love you too, snookums!"]="我也爱你！"
G["I love you too. :)"]="我也爱你 ^-^"
G["I love you wit' every bone in my body!"]="我要把你的骨头都装到我自己身上！"
G["I love you, Samophlange!"]="我爱你，主动式负载平衡器！"
G["I love you, Sensiria, but I must leave here."]="我爱你，森西莉亚，可我必须得离开这儿。"
G["I love you, my little Lyalia."]="我爱你，我的小丽娅拉。"
G["I love you, my precious Irena."]="我爱你，亲爱的伊雷娜。"
G["I love you, pooky!"]="我爱你！"
G["I loved you, Martek!"]="我爱你，马特克！"
G["I loves ya and I loves yer chest.\""]="\"Te quiero y eres la única que me puede amansar.\""
G["I lucked out. Not many tauren get to be cabin boy on a frigate like this! Grezzix even lets me man these incredible battle canoes."]="我真幸运。没几个牛头人能成为护卫舰的船员的！格雷兹克斯甚至让我操纵这些不可思议的战斗快艇。"
G["I made a lot of the things you see in the store. What do you think? Answer carefully, your life may depend on it."]="我能制造你在商店里看见的若干东西。你认为如何？小心回答，这也许能决定你的命运。"
G["I made a promise to his mother before she died; that I would cross the Dark Portal alone - whether I lived or died, my son would be safe. Untainted..."]="我在他的母亲弥留时许下诺言。我会孤身穿过黑暗之门。无论我是生是死，我的儿子都不会有事，都会纯净如初……"
G["I made it to the last waypoint.  Yay!"]="我终于到了最后一个目标地点了。好耶！"
G["I made it!  I need to get Mr. Oinky to watch my back while I'm out adventuring."]="我决定了！这次外出冒险时，我要让呼噜先生帮我拉怪。"
G["I made it! I made it!"]="我成功了！我成功了！"
G["I made it. Freedom at last!"]="成功了！我终于重获自由！"
G["I make a promise to you now, brothers and sisters: the Lich King will be defeated! On this day, I call for a union."]="兄弟们，姐妹们，我向你们发誓：巫妖王一定会被消灭！今天，我们大家要重新团结起来。"
G["I make kegs. Sounds simple to the un-enlightened but you would be surprised how much the type of materials used in a keg will affect the flavor of the beverage held within."]="我是一个酒桶匠。对外行来说，这门手艺似乎很简单。但酒桶的用料对于酒水口味的影响之大，绝对会出乎你的意料。"
G["I make no pretenses, maggot. The darkness such items hold could very well destroy the both of us. That is why the price is so high. If I'm going to die, it's going to be as a rich man.\n\nAnd I don't give an ounce of gnoll spit how you die, only that you do as I ask. Bring me what I require and we will both benefit - or die, but I've already explained this..."]="那又怎样，白痴。这些蕴涵着黑暗力量的物品或许能把我们全都毁灭掉。这是我们在获取力量时所必须付出的代价。如果我必须要死，那也要死在这样伟大的仪式与实验中。\n\n至于你……如果你在为我完成这一切的过程中死了……那我就会以豺狼人的方式嘲笑你的孱弱。把我要的东西带回来，这样我们两个都能获利益，要么就去死吧，我已经解释过结果了……"
G["I make the luckydos luckier. Bring me an item and I will change its fortune to better serve your own... for a price."]="我让幸运符更加幸运。给我一个物品，我将改变它的命运，从而更好地为你服务……要付费啊。"
G["I make this look easy."]="我会痛快地结束你的生命。"
G["I managed to discover that certain parts of the brain when removed or stimulated will make a subject much more docile."]="经过努力，我发现大脑中有这样一个特定的部位，如果你将其切除或者施加特定的刺激，就可以使得该生物变得更加温顺。"
G["I managed to take one of the attackers' weapons and fight back, but there were too many of them. See? I still have the axe..."]="我设法从攻击者手里抢来了一把武器，想要回击，可他们人太多了。看见没？我还留着那把斧子……"
G["I may be bruised and beaten, but the hatred boils inside me."]="我的身躯已满是伤痕，可我的心中翻滚着仇恨。"
G["I may be old but I can still take on a young whippersnapper like you, $n. Try not to fall behind..."]="我也许老了，但是我仍然可以轻易超越像你这样傲慢的年轻人，$n。不要落在后面……"
G["I may be restrained now, but my master will set me free when his vengeance rains down upon this city."]="也许我现在是陷入了困境，但是当主人的复仇之雨在这座城市上洒落的时候，我必将重获自由。"
G["I may fall, but I'll take a dozen of those beasts with me!"]="我也许会倒下，但我也会多拖些怪物给我垫背！"
G["I may have ninety-nine problems, but dancin' ain't one of them!  Happy Hallow's End, $n!"]="我或许有99种问题，但是跳舞绝对不是问题！万圣节快乐，$n！"
G["I may have overestimated my own strength..."]="我也许高估了自己的力量……"
G["I may look sweet, but I'm still aiming for first prize!"]="我也许看上去温和可人，可我也是冲着头等奖来的！"
G["I may not be a warrior, but I will protect my home and family!"]="我也许不是一名战士，可我会保护我的家园和家人！"
G["I may not be the best rider, but I have the best inventions!"]="我也许不是最棒的骑士，但却拥有一流的发明！"
G["I may not have any mindless servants, but at least I can see a quality blade made from time to time."]="我没有傻头傻脑的奴仆，但是我至少能亲眼目睹利刃的诞生。"
G["I may not know how to fight yet, but I do know what's worth fighting for!"]="或许我还不知道该如何战斗，但我知道什么值得我去战斗！"
G["I may or may not have pissed myself."]="我也不知道自己有没有喝醉。"
G["I mean you no harm. I am scouting the quilboar and taking notes of their activities. My people have noticed something odd--an emanation or darkness--coming from this area. I've come to investigate, and what I've found is very disturbing.\n\nThere seems to be an undead diplomat who is powerful in the ways of the arcane. I don't believe he's one of the Forsaken... I think it's worse."]="我不会伤害你的。我在监视野猪人并记录他们的活动。我的人民注意到了某些奇怪的事情……某种黑暗的气息从这个地区中散播出来。我是前来调查此事的，而我的发现很令人不安。\n\n似乎有一个很善于使用奥术魔法的亡灵外交官在附近。我不相信他也是被遗忘者……我认为情况比这更糟糕。"
G["I might be able to help.  Were the Neferset behind this?"]="我也许能帮上忙。尼斐塞特和此事有关吗？"
G["I might have escaped if I hadn't got caught in one of the thermals..."]="要不是被卷入了一股热气流，我已经逃出去了……"
G["I might have seen someone in a Twilight's Hammer robe. They were very tall. I'm sure of it."]="我似乎是看见了一些穿着暮光之锤长袍的家伙。我能确定的就是，他们的个子很高。"
G["I might if you embarrass us."]="你的无礼才让我伤心。"
G["I might just have to go hunting for that Wretched beast now that there's a bounty on his head."]="我也许早就该去猎杀那个肮脏的野兽，不过现在我决定提供赏金悬赏他的脑袋。"
G["I misplaced my Negotiator. In fact, he's probably dead. Is another available?"]="我不知道我的交涉者在哪里。实际上，他可能已经死了。还有其他人选吗？"
G["I misplaced my shiny bling!"]="我的漂亮首饰丢了！"
G["I misplaced the enchanted blade that you gave me. Have you seen it?"]="我忘记把你给我的魔能之刃放哪儿了。你看见过吗？"
G["I miss Kezan. Will we ever see Bilgewater Port again, $n?"]="我想念科赞。我们还能再看到锈水码头吗，$n？"
G["I miss Leza."]="我想念莱莎。"
G["I miss being robbed by the Defias. At least they'd leave you a little something to eat from time to time."]="我怀念被迪菲亚抢劫的那段日子。起码他们偶尔还会给你留下点儿吃的。"
G["I miss me home, sometimes. Or maybe I just miss fightin' for it."]="有时候，我会想家。也许我只是想念为它而战的日子。"
G["I miss my dog so much!"]="我好想它啊！"
G["I miss my family. I miss my home!"]="我想念我的亲人。我想家！"
G["I miss my father."]="我想念我的父亲。"
G["I miss my home!"]="我想家！"
G["I miss my mommy."]="我想妈妈了。"
G["I miss my toys. Can we go home?"]="我想念我的玩具。我们可以回家了吗？"
G["I miss the dwarven ale we used to get at that inn in Lordaeron. Remember that fight we started there?"]="我真的很怀念洛丹伦的那个旅馆里的矮人麦酒。还记得我们在那里开始的战斗吗？"
G["I miss you so much!"]="我非常想念你！"
G["I missed the gate to Acherus, Orbaz. Could you please open another?"]="我错过了通往阿彻鲁斯的传送门，奥尔巴兹。能再次开启传送门吗？"
G["I missed you so much! Where have you been?\n\nAre you going to answer me, or just stand there?"]="我真想念你！你到哪里去了？\n\n你真的不愿意理我吗？"
G["I missed you so much, Daddy!"]="我真想你，爸爸！"
G["I missed you too, honey.  And I'm finally home..."]="我也想你，亲爱的。我终于回家了……"
G["I must act to protect my people first.  Our enemies buried Orsis in the desert.  How do you fight against that sort of power?"]="我必须首先保护我的人民。我们的敌人已经将奥西斯埋葬在沙漠中。你怎么能和这样的力量作战？"
G["I must admit I had my doubts about you at first, $n, but you have proven yourself with our tribe."]="我必须承认，我一开始怀疑过你，$n，但你已经向我们的部落证明了你自己。"
G["I must admit I like what I'm seeing, Ms. Dreadshredder."]="我必须承认我喜欢我所见到的这一切，碎纸机夫人。"
G["I must admit, I am intrigued by this ambitious little upstart.\n\nI'm not rushing to judgement, mind you, but I've heard some unsettling rumors.\n\nTime will tell if his motives are just."]="必须承认，我对这个野心勃勃的小狂徒有了些兴趣。\n\n我不会急于做出判断，但我要告诉你，我已经听到了一些令人不安的谣言。\n\n时间会告诉我，他的动机是否正当。"
G["I must admit, I couldn'ta done this one without yer help."]="我得承认，没有你的帮助，我根本没法做到。"
G["I must admit, we did not bring you here for introductions and pleasantries."]="我得承认，请你来此并非为了自我介绍和寒暄。"
G["I must admit, when times were darkest, I did not believe that we would survive. Thanks to you and your people, I am glad to have been proven wrong."]="我必须承认，在那最黑暗的时刻，我不敢相信我们还能活下来。多亏你和你的族人，幸好事情没往我预想的方向发展。"
G["I must apologize for not being entirely truthful with you in regards to my identity. I had to be certain that you could be trusted - few people would have selflessly lent assistance to an old and forgotten hermit.\n\nYou have proven yourself as one of those people: A person of integrity and honor."]="由于我的身份问题，我并未对你说实话，我必须为此向你道歉。我必须确定你是值得信赖的——很少有人能无私地为一个年老的隐士提供帮助。\n\n你已经证明了自己是个正直崇高的人。"
G["I must ask that you reforge Shadow's Edge for me, Highlord Mograine."]="大领主莫格莱尼，我必须请你为我重新铸造影锋。"
G["I must attune to the Focusing Iris before transport. Protect me!"]="我必须在传送前调校好聚焦之虹。保护我！"
G["I must be going now, soldier. Stay vigilant!"]="我要出发了，士兵。保持警惕！"
G["I must be going now..."]="我现在必须走了……"
G["I must be going, there is so much to see."]="我得走了，还有好多东西要看呢。"
G["I must be in top fighting condition when we face the Hozen in battle."]="在我们与猢狲开战时，我必须达到最好的战斗状态。"
G["I must be off now, $n. See you around."]="我得走了，$n。再见。"
G["I must be returnin' ta Darkspear Hold. Please meet me there once Vanira is done with her healin' of the boy."]="我必须回到暗矛要塞去。当瓦妮拉结束对这个孩子的治疗以后，请到那里去找我。"
G["I must be returnin' to Vol'jin wit' my report! Help me outta here!"]="我必须带着报告回到沃金身边！快帮我出去！"
G["I must be swift as a rushing... stream!"]="我必须快如……激流！"
G["I must become a better leader for our tribe."]="我一定能成为更出色的部落领袖。"
G["I must beg ya council, my friend.  I can't be standin' by Garrosh while he be turnin' our people against each other for tha sake of war.  My respect for you does not extend to dis new Horde... I am tinkin' of leadin' my people away."]="我的朋友，我需要你的建议。加尔鲁什使人民自相残杀，我不能支持他这样做。我尊敬你，但我不会因此继续效忠于新的部落……我要带着我的族人离开了。"
G["I must bid you... farewell."]="我必须……说再见了。"
G["I must break you now."]="现在我必须干掉你。"
G["I must break you."]="我必须消灭你们。"
G["I must build a beacon for this marvelous device!"]="我必须为这个不可思议的装置制作一个信标！"
G["I must concentrate! Guards! Guards! Aid me!"]="我必须集中注意里！卫兵！卫兵！帮帮我！"
G["I must confess... you were not altogether unexpected.  I hope you find your final resting place... to your liking."]="我必须承认……我早已预知你们的到来。希望你们能找到安息地……适合你们的安息地。"
G["I must conserve my energy... there's no telling when my portal magic will be needed!"]="我必须保存能量……很难说什么时候会用到我的传送魔法！"
G["I must examine the tree. Guard me while I perform this task, Wakener!"]="我必须检查这棵树。在我做检查时保护好我，唤醒者！"
G["I must feed!"]="我要吃东西！"
G["I must feed..."]="我要吃……"
G["I must feed... prepare to die!"]="我必须要吃点什么……准备受死吧！"
G["I must find a way to put an end to the evil that Cersei Dusksinger is committing against our lost brothers and sisters!"]="我一定要想办法让邪恶的瑟尔希·暗歌无法再对我们的失落者兄弟姐妹们下毒手！"
G["I must finish this myself, then.  So be it!"]="看来我必须亲自动手。那就来吧！"
G["I must finish this myself, then. So be it!"]="看来我得亲自动手了，那么来吧！"
G["I must get further underground to where he is. I must jump!"]="我要到地底深处去，到主人身边去。我一定要跳下去！"
G["I must get to Stoneplow! The mantid will attack soon."]="我必须赶到石犁村去！螳螂妖很快就会发动进攻了。"
G["I must give Arugal some credit, his lines of research were quite novel."]="我必须承认，阿鲁高的研究相当新颖。"
G["I must give in to the anger! It is the only way!"]="我必须屈从于愤怒！这是唯一的出路！"
G["I must go - there are others who have landed on our northern shores."]="我必须离开了——还有其他人登上了我们北方的海岸。"
G["I must go - there are others who have landed on our southern shores."]="我必须离开了——还有其他人登上了我们南方的海岸。"
G["I must go now - disappear."]="我必须离开了——暂时消失。"
G["I must go now, before I get myself caught again. If you need anything, I won't be far."]="我得走啦，省得又被抓住。如果你有任何需要，都可以来找我。"
G["I must go now.  Good luck."]="我现在得走了。好运。"
G["I must have been pretty tipsy the night I promised you a pony.  Take your money and no hard feelings, okay?"]="我那晚肯定是喝醉了，才会答应给你一匹小马。拿着你的钱，别难过，好吗？"
G["I must have broken hundreds of vials when I first began brewing potions. The glass was so fragile in my clumsy hands. I hope you are more cautious than I was."]="Debo haber roto cientos de viales cuando empecé a preparar pociones. El cristal era demasiado frágil entre mis torpes manos. Espero que seas más $gcuidadoso:cuidadosa; que yo."
G["I must have lived a charmed life, $n.  To return to the world as a member of the Forsaken and the Apothecary Society... I couldn't have asked for a more suitable fate."]="我想我真是太好命了，$n。以被遗忘者和皇家药剂师协会成员的身份重回这个世界……我的命可真是好得无可挑剔。"
G["I must have made a misstep somewhere to be assigned here."]="我肯定在某个地方做错了什么，才被分配到这里来。"
G["I must have misunderstood the water's wisdom."]="我一定是误解了水流的智慧。"
G["I must have taken leave of my senses, allowing a Scryer to aid in such a delicate operation..."]="我肯定是疯了，让一个占星者来帮忙处理这么一个棘手的工作……"
G["I must keep my blades sharp - the threat of the Legion is ever-present."]="我的武器必须保持锋利——燃烧军团的威胁时刻存在。"
G["I must keep my eyes on ship and crew, good $gsir:madame;. You must forgive my not pausing to speak with you."]="Debo prestar atención al barco y a la tripulación, $gbuen hombre:buena mujer;. Perdona que no me pare a hablar contigo."
G["I must know something: How did you go to the bathroom with that thing on?"]="我必须知道一些事情：你如何穿着这个东西解决个人问题的？"
G["I must know... I will know..."]="我必须知道……我会知道的……"
G["I must leave this place at once!"]="我必须马上离开这个地方！"
G["I must leave.  Proceed with caution."]="我必须离开了。小心点。"
G["I must make preparations back on the mainland. Return to me at the Veiled Stair when you have what I need."]="我得返回大陆了。等你拿到我需要的东西，再来雾纱栈道找我吧。"
G["I must make the necessary preparations before the awakening ritual can begin. You must protect me!"]="在唤醒仪式开始前我必须做好必要的准备。你要保护我！"
G["I must obey."]="我必须服从。"
G["I must protect my sovereign people."]="我必须保护我的人民。"
G["I must recover my strength."]="我必须恢复力量。"
G["I must rejoin the battle to save Binan Village."]="我必须重新加入拯救滨岸村的战斗。"
G["I must resume my duties, $c."]="我必须继续履行我的职责，$c。"
G["I must return to Dun Niffilem. We shall speak again soon, Stormlord."]="我必须返回丹尼芬雷了。风暴之王，我相信我们还会见面的。"
G["I must return to Feathermoon Stronghold!"]="我必须返回羽月要塞！"
G["I must return to Warsong Hold, hero. May you swim in the blood of our enemies and feast upon their sorrow!"]="英雄，我必须返回战歌要塞了。愿你浴血沙场，令敌人闻风丧胆！"
G["I must return to Warsong Hold. Battle hard, hero!"]="我必须返回战歌要塞了。英雄，好好战斗吧！"
G["I must return to my rest... they must not find me here... the Emerald Dream..."]="我必须回去休息了……他们肯定不会在这里找到我的……翡翠梦境……"
G["I must return to the world of shadows, Koltira. Send me back."]="我必须返回阴影世界，库尔迪拉。送我回去吧。"
G["I must return. Good hunting to you."]="我必须回去，祝你狩猎愉快。"
G["I must say, Booty Bay has the best Clam Chowder to be had anywhere in the South Seas. Oh, not interested in cuisine eh? Well then let me be the first to welcome you to the berth of the Maiden's Fancy, the finest passenger ship to travel between the Eastern Kingdoms and Kalimdor. She's due back for another trip to Ratchet soon, so make yourself comfortable till she arrives."]="我必须承认，藏宝海湾有南海最好的杂烩蚌肉。哦，对烹饪不感兴趣？那么欢迎你投宿少女之爱号——在东部王国和卡利姆多之间航行的最好的客船。很快她将驰往棘齿城，在她到达之前好好享受吧。"
G["I must say, you delivered my poison and dealt with those trolls most ruthlessly, $c. You've got the makings of quite a talented young $g man : lady;!"]="Debo decir que administraste mi veneno y te ocupaste de esos trols muy despiadadamente, $c. ¡Tienes mucho talento!"
G["I must see the master at once!"]="我现在一定要看到主人！"
G["I must speak to the waters to understand their turmoil."]="我必须与流水谈一谈，才能了解它们的骚动源自何处。"
G["I must stay by Leza's side until she has given birth. Death can wait for life."]="我必须待在莱莎身边，直到她生下孩子。死亡，总要排在生命之后。"
G["I must train harder so I can be like you."]="为了赶上你，我得更加努力地训练才行。"
G["I must tread carefully. Many of my people are still within Orgrimmar."]="我必须谨慎。我有许多族人还留在奥格瑞玛。"
G["I must warn you.  Caimas does horrible things to prisoners... he forces them to fight his pet beasts.  Prepare for the worst, friend."]="Debo advertírtelo. Caimas les hace cosas horribles a sus prisioneros... Les obliga a luchar contra sus bestias mascotas. Prepárate para lo peor, $gamigo:amiga;."
G["I must warn... Hive'Ashi..."]="我必须警告……亚什虫巢……"
