G["I need a ride, Dungar!  I have important supplies to deliver!"]="杜加尔，我需要空运服务！我要运送重要物资！"
G["I need a ride, fast!  I have an important message to deliver!"]="我需要飞骑，要快！我有一封非常重要的信要送！"
G["I need a ride."]="我需要空运服务。"
G["I need a riding bat to intercept the Alliance reinforcements."]="我需要搭乘巨型蝙蝠去拦截联盟援军。"
