G["I need another Totem of Harmony."]="我还要一个祥和图腾。"
G["I need another Wildhammer Flare Gun, Thane."]="我需要一把新的蛮锤信号枪。"
G["I need another Wolvar Orphan Whistle."]="我需要另一个狼獾人孤儿哨。"
G["I need another disguise, Borak. I lost the last one."]="我需要另一个伪装，伯拉克。上一个被我弄丢了。"
G["I need another disguise."]="我需要一套新的伪装。"
G["I need another mask, Ken-Ken."]="再给我一个面具，肯肯。"
