G["I need another waiver!"]="我需要另一份免责声明！"
G["I need answers, ogre!"]="我需要答案，食人魔！"
G["I need assistance in recovering a piece of my Confessor's Raiment, Al'tabim."]="我需要你帮我重制一件赞达拉忏悔者套装，阿塔比姆。"
G["I need dat orange! Gimme!"]="我要橘子！给我！"
G["I need directions."]="我需要指引。"
G["I need help in defeating the shadowsilk poachers."]="我需要帮助来击败暗影蛛丝偷猎者。"
G["I need help recovering a missing piece of my Haruspex's Garb, Maywiki."]="金罗克，我需要你帮我重铸一付赞达拉占卜师护腕。"
G["I need help!"]="我需要帮助！"
G["I need information, NOW. How many Alliance are left, and how many orcs we still have - and help that mad goblin Clutchpop set up some defenses."]="我需要情报，立刻就要！联盟还有多少人，我们还有多少兽人——还有，去帮那个地精疯子急刹建几个防御阵地。"
G["I need ingredients and equipment for my kitchen."]="我需要给厨房补充些食材和炊具。"
G["I need many more supplies in order to upgrade our units."]="我需要更多的物资来升级我们的军队。"
G["I need more encrypted plans."]="我需要更多加密计划书。"
G["I need more parts!"]="我需要更多的零件！"
G["I need more samples like this one.  Who was it?"]="我需要更多类似的样本。它取自何种生物？"
G["I need more shoveltusk!"]="我需要更多的铲齿鹿！"
G["I need more time to prepare the mixture, $n. I'll let you know when it's ready."]="我需要更多时间准备混合，$n。好了会通知你的。"
G["I need no further convincing. If you need me, I will be waiting on the hill behind the tents."]="我被说服了。如果你需要我，我会在帐篷后的山上等你。"
G["I need no home to know I still have a place in this world, $c. The tribes will see... all of them. They fight amongst one another, and for what? Scraps left over by vultures... lands infested by the Legion... bah!\n\nThe centaur should be proud of their heritage--it is just as noble as any Night elf's or orc's--it is time we started acting like it!"]="在这世上，我已经不需要什么立足之地了，$c。部落……所有的部落成员将看见。他们相互交战，这是为了什么？遍地是秃鹫留下的骸骨……军团大肆侵犯我们的土地……呸！\n\n半人马应该为他们的遗产感到骄傲——这些遗产就跟暗夜精灵或兽人的遗产一样高贵——现在是我们效仿的时候啦！"
G["I need no more convincing, $n. The Druids of the Talon will lend you their aid."]="你已经说服我了，$n。猛禽德鲁伊愿意帮助你。"
G["I need not tell you what will happen should the mana bomb down in the courtyard fail to be used on its target soon?  Since moving into the forest, they've become increasingly annoying to our operations: here, at Tuurem and to the south at the Bonechewer Ruins."]="如果院子里的那颗魔法炸弹没有很快对目标发射，不需要我再跟你说会发生什么事情了吧？自从我们到了森林里，不管是这里，还是在图雷姆，或是南面的噬骨废墟，他们对我们行动的干扰都愈加地烦人了。"
G["I need repairs, Irongoat."]="我需要修理，铁羊。"
G["I need room to operate!"]="我需要更多的空间！"
G["I need some booze, Coot."]="给我再来点酒，笨蛋。"
G["I need some cool shades. What will two stacks of macaroons get me?"]="我需要一些超酷的墨镜。两捆杏仁币能为我换来什么样的货色？"
G["I need some fresh air, not that there's any to be had in this swamp!  I'm going out for a bit.  Tidy up a bit while I'm gone, would you?"]="我需要一些新鲜空气，不是这沼泽地里的空气。我要出去走走，当我外出的时候，你记得打扫一下房间，明白吗？"
G["I need some fresh meat... there hasn't been nearly enough blood shed today!"]="我需要新鲜的肉……今天的血流得还不够多！"
G["I need some more of your fine grog, Mack."]="再来两杯好酒，马克。"
G["I need some reagents and poisons, lady."]="我需要些毒药与材料，女士。"
G["I need some training."]="我需要训练。"
G["I need someone who can get the job done. Can I count on you, $c?"]="我需要一个真正有能力的人。我能指望你吗，$c？"
G["I need something for protection, not this."]="我需要一些防具，这东西对我没用。"
G["I need supplies for cooking lessons."]="我需要食材来上烹饪课。"
G["I need the illusion cast upon me again, Admetius."]="我需要你再次帮我施放那个幻像，德门图斯。"
G["I need this message delivered to Watch Commander Netherwane at Nethergarde Keep. There's a commendation in it for you if you make it... Your horse is waiting at the stables. Dismissed!"]="我需要把这份情报送给守望堡的指挥官奈瑟维。如果你完成任务的话，那边会嘉奖你的。你的马正在马厩里面等着你。去吧！"
G["I need time to reflect.... I will aid your cause if you should require it. I owe you at least that much. Farewell."]="我需要一些时间仔细思考……如果你们需要我的帮助，请尽管开口。这是我欠你们的人情。保重。"
G["I need time to think. It... it's too soon."]="我需要时间来好好想一想。还太……太早了。"
G["I need to be re-assigned. This job is pushing me over the edge..."]="我要换个工作。这个工作快要让我崩溃了……"
G["I need to borrow your tamed jungle cat to get to the cliffs, Kilag."]="我需要借你驯服的丛林豹去悬崖，基拉格。"
G["I need to concentrate. Keep the foundry clear!"]="我得集中精神。不能受到打扰！"
G["I need to do something to keep myself busy."]="我得让自己忙起来。"
G["I need to fight by you more often."]="我得多和你一起打打架。"
G["I need to find Dajik, do you have his chalk?"]="我要找达伊克，你有他的粉笔吗？"
G["I need to find Goregek, do you have his shackles?"]="我要找格利基克，你有他的镣铐吗？"
G["I need to find Jaloot, do you have his favorite crystal?"]="我要找亚鲁乌特，你有他的宝贝水晶吗？"
G["I need to find Lafoo, do you have his bug bag?"]="我要找拉弗乌，你有他的虫袋吗？"
G["I need to find Moodle, do you have his stress ball?"]="我要找莫乌德，你有他的皮球吗？"
G["I need to find Syra!"]="我得找到塞拉！"
G["I need to find Zepik, do you have his hunting horn?"]="我要找瑟匹克，你有他的狩猎号角吗？"
G["I need to find a new line of work."]="我需要找到一条新的工作线路。"
G["I need to find a safe place soon.\n\nOl' Mack's not doin' so well."]="我得尽快找个安全的地方。\n\n老马克的情况不太好。"
G["I need to find my family!"]="我得找到我的家人！"
G["I need to fly to the Windrunner.  Official business!"]="我需要飞往风行者号。紧急军务！"
G["I need to follow this map to Dawn's Blossom."]="我得照着这幅地图前往晨芳园。"
G["I need to get back to my ride. Search and destroy imminent! Cover me! On my six! GO GO GO!"]="我得回到基地去。摧毁那些想要阻挡我的家伙！保护我！走吧！"
G["I need to get back. I'm sure we'll cross paths again. Next time, I'll get to return the favor."]="我要回去了。相信我们一定会再见面。下次见面时，我一定会还你这个人情。"
G["I need to get out of here!"]="我要离开这儿！"
G["I need to get some medication for my allergies."]="我过敏了，得吃点药。"
G["I need to get this grain to Brewmaster Boof so we can start the festival. See you there, $p!"]="我得把粮食交给酒仙，然后我们就能欢庆节日啦！回头见，$p！"
G["I need to get this to Brewmaster Boof before the festival starts. Thanks again for saving me, $p!"]="我得赶在节庆活动开始前，把这个交给酒仙布夫。再次感谢你的搭救之恩，$p！"
G["I need to get to Dalaran."]="我要前往达拉然。"
G["I need to get to Nespirah."]="我要前往奈瑟匹拉。"
G["I need to get to Razor Hill to recruit on behalf of Vol'jin.  May I borrow a bat?"]="我需要去剃刀岭，为沃金招募新兵。我能借一只蝙蝠吗？"
G["I need to get to Wintergarde Keep fast!"]="我要立刻前往暮冬要塞！"
G["I need to get to the top of Jintha'Alor. Time to ride Sharpbeak!"]="我需要前往辛萨罗顶部。该沙普比克出场了！"
G["I need to go. Evil stirs. Die well, Omarion."]="我得走了。邪恶正在临近。自己小心了，奥玛里恩。"
G["I need to heal!"]="我需要治疗！"
G["I need to intercept the Dawnblade reinforcements."]="我必须阻止晨锋部队的增援。"
G["I need to know which side to stop rooting for!"]="我总得知道该停止给哪边加油吧！"
G["I need to make a withdrawal. Ten stacks of macaroons!"]="我要提款。来十捆杏仁币！"
G["I need to make something healthy for him, he's still not recovered from that illness from last week."]="我要为他准备一些健康的食物，上周他病得可厉害啦，至今还没有康复呢。"
G["I need to make sure to get in my sixth and seventh nap today if I expect to be ready for my big snooze."]="如果我每天想好好的睡上一觉，必须先打六七个小盹儿做做准备。"
G["I need to meet up with Chen Stormstout."]="我得去见陈·风暴烈酒。"
G["I need to meet up with Kang Bramblestaff."]="我得去见康·棘杖。"
G["I need to meet up with Ken-Ken, the hozen."]="我得去见猢狲肯肯。"
G["I need to move these toxic assets onto a sucker... like you!"]="我需要把有毒资产推给某个笨蛋……比如你！"
G["I need to pee."]="我要上厕所。"
G["I need to reach the top of the temple to leave for the Air Plateau."]="我要去笑风山，请送我到寺院的顶层。"
G["I need to rebuild my deck..."]="我得重新建一套牌组……"
G["I need to repair."]="我需要修理。"
G["I need to search you."]="我需要搜查你的随身物品。"
G["I need to take a bat to the Dawning Isles."]="我要把一只蝙蝠带到黎明岛去。"
G["I need to travel somewhere."]="我要去别的地方。"
G["I need to use the restroom."]="我需要用下洗手间。"
G["I need use of a wyvern to fly me to where the Darkspear emissary went."]="我需要借用一头双足飞龙带我去暗矛使者那里。"
G["I need you out on the front, $n.\n\nYou're going to make the difference. We'll crush the stone troggs once and for all.\n\nWe must rescue King Oremantle!"]="Te necesito en el frente, $n.\n\nTú marcarás la diferencia. Aplastaremos a los troggs de piedra de una vez por todas.\n\n¡Debemos rescatar al rey Mantomena!"
G["I need you to do what I say, $r.  If we falter, then we may be playing right into Razelikh's hands."]="我需要你按我说的去做，$r。如果我们退却，我们就很可能落入拉瑟莱克的股掌之中。"
G["I need you to show me again, Matthias."]="请你再展示一次，米斯希尔萨。"
G["I need you to take me to the lich's phylactery, Dusk."]="黄昏，带我去找巫妖的护符匣。"
G["I need you to take them out before the horde overrun us."]="我需要你赶在部落冲垮我们的防线之前摧毁这些发生器。"
G["I need your help to remove the poison from these adventurers."]="我需要你的帮助，才能除去这些冒险者身上的毒。"
G["I need... the world... needs him whole once again. But he's always placed the needs of others before his own. How long has he suppressed these feelings - these desires?"]="我……和这个世界……都如此的需要他。但他却总是将其他人的需要凌驾在了自己之上。他究竟将自己的情感和渴望……压抑了多久？"
G["I need... your help! Cannot... resist him much longer!"]="我……需要你们的……帮助！我……快支持不住了！"
G["I never asked for this! Leave me alone!"]="我从不想要这样！别来碰我！"
G["I never believed Thrall until I saw it with my own eyes. Orcs... free of demonic corruption! Proud and honorable warriors making their place on this unbroken planet.\n\nEager am I to prove myself to Thrall and the Horde. My father never had to deal with this undead menace you call the Lich King, but by all descriptions he represents a dire threat to the Horde.\n\nI will implore Thrall to let me lead his finest warriors into Northrend and destroy the Lich King! But this plague takes precedent."]="我原本是不信任萨尔的，直到我目睹了真相。兽人……从恶魔的堕落血液中解放出来了！他们在这片土地上站稳了脚跟，重铸氏族的荣耀。\n\n我渴望向萨尔和部落证明自己的实力。虽然我的父亲不曾与巫妖王交手，但是他已经对部落构成了致命的威胁，那就让我来面对他吧！\n\n我会请求萨尔，让我率领最优秀的战士前往诺森德，消灭巫妖王！不过眼前最重要的事情，就是根除亡灵天灾。"
G["I never called any dragons..."]="我从没有召唤过龙……"
G["I never cheat!"]="我可不会使诈！"
G["I never did like those two. Let's get moving."]="我从未喜欢过那两个家伙。我们继续前进吧。"
G["I never discovered... how to put a stopper... in death..."]="我一直没能发现……阻止死亡的……药物……"
G["I never doubted $n, not for one minute!"]="我从没怀疑过$n，一分钟都没有！"
G["I never even got to meet Lady Jaina..."]="我还没见过吉安娜女士呢……"
G["I never get to ride to Grom'gol. Its just so unfair. Warm, steamy beaches... Crocolisks, Raptors... hmmm... maybe I don't really want to go there after all."]="我还没去过格罗姆高呢。这不公平！温暖的沙滩……向着夕阳奔跑的鳄鱼与迅猛龙……啊……等等……或许还是不要去了吧。"
G["I never got to tell my son how proud I am of him..."]="我还没有告诉儿子，他是我的骄傲……再也没有机会了……"
G["I never had any talent with healing powers, but I found my calling in the medic's craft. Potions, bandages, and other triage methods can go a long way!"]="我在治疗法术上一向没有天分，可却在医术上找到了目标。药水、绷带和其他的诊疗手段也能治病救人！"
G["I never imagined farming would involve so many... exotic odors."]="我从未想过种地也会有如此多……奇妙的感觉。"
G["I never imagined my work would go so far. It is a testament to the great power of the kypari. Our civilization would never have recovered if it weren't for them. Remember that."]="我从来没有想到我的工作会有如此进展。这是凯帕圣树伟大力量的一次证明。如果没有它们，我们的文明永远都将无法复兴。请记住这一点。"
G["I never imagined such a world."]="我从没想过会有这样一个世界。"
G["I never imagined we'd run into this much trouble out here.\n\nMaybe we shouldn't have left the temple..."]="我从没想到我们会在这里遇到这么大麻烦。\n\n也许就不该离开寺庙……"
G["I never knew how much variety there was to brewing tea."]="我从来不知道，泡茶有多少讲究。"
G["I never knew my father or mother. Orgrim told me many stories about them and their adventures on Draenor. He was my greatest teacher and dearest friend, Greatmother. He died a hero... They all died as heroes and for all of them, a song of honor remains."]="我一点也不熟悉我的父亲或者母亲。奥格瑞姆跟我说过很多关于他们的故事和他们在德拉诺的冒险经历。他是我最好的老师和最亲密的朋友，祖母。他像个英雄般地死去了……他们都像英雄般地死去了，荣耀的战歌为他们奏响。"
G["I never knew that helping the Tillers Union would be so much work."]="我从没想过加入阡陌客后会有这么多工作。"
G["I never knew you... but you were family."]="不曾见你……但你是我的家人。"
G["I never liked that guy. He stole your girlfriend. I say, good riddance!"]="我从来都不喜欢那个家伙。他偷走了你的女朋友。不过要我说，这对你也算是一种解脱！"
G["I never liked that guy. PH"]="我从没喜欢过那家伙。"
G["I never liked you anyway!"]="我永远也不会喜欢你！"
G["I never meet an enemy head on. I prefer to use my wits...and any number of stealthy tricks."]="我从不正面对敌。我更喜欢运用头脑……以及各种鬼祟伎俩来战胜敌人。"
G["I never met a tauren I didn't like..."]="我遇到过的牛头人都非常美……"
G["I never needed ya, mon. I can crush Zul'Drak without ya!"]="我用不着再依靠你了。没有你，我一样可以毁灭祖达克！"
G["I never see nobody fight like you be fightin'."]="我从没见过像你这样战斗的人。"
G["I never seen such speed before..."]="我以前从没见过这么快的速度……"
G["I never seen this many Kor'kron in one place before!\n\nThose orcs are as fierce as fierce gets and angry to boot. They must have upped their recruiting program."]="我以前从没在一个地方见过那么多库卡隆！\n\n那些兽人总是又暴躁又愤怒。他们肯定扩大了征兵规模。"
G["I never should have opened this inn. It is just so depressing here."]="我就不该开这家旅店。这里真是太压抑了。"
G["I never stated that you were here to redeem yourself, $g priest:priestess;. You are here to redeem me and the innocents murdered while trying to escape Stratholme.\n\nMy spirit and the spirit of those lost are bound here, cursed to endlessly relive our own tragic deaths."]="Nunca dije que tuvieras que redimirte, $gsacerdote:sacerdotisa;. Estás aquí para redimirnos a mí y a los inocentes asesinados mientras tratábamos de escapar de Stratholme.\n\nMi espíritu y el de aquellos que fallecieron, están atados a este lugar, condenados a revivir eternamente nuestras trágicas muertes."
G["I never thought Garrosh would turn against orcs!"]="我从没想过加尔鲁什会对兽人下手！"
G["I never thought I would have to pick up a weapon to use it again..."]="我从没想过自己会被迫重拾武器作战……"
G["I never thought I'd be free from that terrible spell!"]="我以为再也无法摆脱那个可怕法术的束缚呢！"
G["I never thought I'd get to see Teldrassil... I certainly never thought we'd crash into Teldrassil."]="我从未想过我能看见泰达希尔……我也的确没想到我们会坠入泰达希尔。"
G["I never thought I'd see such a pure sample."]="我从没有想过还能看到如此纯粹的样品。"
G["I never thought I'd see the day! Our former champion, out of retirement! Put your big, beefy hands together for Leona Earthwind!"]="我从没想过这一天会真的到来！我们曾经的冠军，退役归来的勇士！快用力拍你的手，把最热烈的掌声献给莉安娜·地风！"
G["I never thought I'd see the day! The damsel of Darnassus! Put your big, beefy hands together for Leona Earthwind!"]="我从没想过这一天会真的到来！竟然是达纳苏斯的女勇士！快用力拍你的手，把最热烈的掌声献给莉安娜·地风！"
G["I never thought about where the food on my table came from before we started this farming business.\n\nThis experience has been enlightening, to say the least!"]="在我们开始种地之前，我从没想过餐桌上的食物是从哪儿来的。\n\n可以说，这份经历让人很受启发！"
G["I never thought it would turn out to be mana oil! There's going to be plenty of demand for that, minus Grek, of course!"]="我从未想过这个竟然是法力之油！肯定会热卖的，葛雷克！"
G["I never thought something like this could happen here..."]="我从没想过，这里居然会发生这种事……"
G["I never thought something like this could happen to our little orchard."]="我从没想过，我们的小果园居然会发生这种事。"
G["I never thought that I'd be rescued by you, $n!"]="我从没想过救我的人竟会是你，$n！"
G["I never thought that I'd be riding into battle with a $r on my back."]="Nunca pensé que cabalgaría hacia la batalla con $gun:una; $r sobre el lomo."
G["I never thought that I'd be saved by you, $n!"]="我从没想过救我的人竟会是你，$n！"
G["I never thought that it would end like this."]="我从没想到会以这种方式结束。"
G["I never thought the Warchief himself would come to bail me out!"]="真没想到，酋长亲自来救我了！"
G["I never thought the day would come that I'd leave my homeland of Westfall. . . ."]="我从来就没想过有一天我会离开西部荒野，离开我的家……"
G["I never thought we'd escape from that steamy jungle! Now I'm the lead engineer of this expedition."]="我还以为我们没法逃出那片雾蒙蒙的丛林呢！现在，我是这支探险队的首席工程师啦。"
G["I never understood why some pirates bury their treasure.  Me... I like to keep it within arm's reach."]="真搞不懂为什么有些海盗喜欢把财宝埋起来，你看……我就喜欢将它们放在随手可及的地方。"
G["I never want to see this nasty pond again. Thank you, $n. I'll never forget you!"]="我再也不想看见这个肮脏的池塘了。谢谢你，$n。我永远都不会忘记你！"
G["I never was very fond of field work. Especially when it involves vast quantities of trolls."]="我向来不喜欢野外工作，尤其是牵涉到一大群巨魔的工作。"
G["I never would have thought that these grunts could be trained."]="真想不到这些野猴子也能训练有素。"
G["I never would've made it on my own..."]="光凭我自己肯定不行……"
G["I no gonna make it...."]="我不行了……"
G["I no longer have my Zandalar Demoniac's Robe. Can you provide a replacement?"]="我的赞达拉恶魔师长袍不见了，需要一件新的。"
G["I no longer have my Zandalar Illusionist's Wraps and require a new pair."]="我的赞达拉幻术师裹布不见了，需要一件新的。"
G["I no longer possess my Zandalar Confessor's Bindings. Can you provide a replacement?"]="我的赞达拉忏悔者腰带找不到了。你能帮助我吗？"
G["I no longer recognize this world. Everything is unfamiliar, yet I have a great duty to fulfill."]="我一点都不认识这个世界了。所有事物都那么陌生，然而还有伟大的使命在等着我。"
G["I no longer remember where the others are. Indeed it has been so long since we last saw each other the others may very well be dead, or replaced by their pupils. I can only have faith that there are still five of us left."]="我不记得其他人去哪里了。我们真的已经很久没有见面了，其他人很可能已经死了，或者被他们的弟子取代了。我只能确信，我们还有五个人。"
G["I no longer train Death Knights, having grown weary of cretinous Initiates and their constant questions.\n\nNow begone."]="我不再训练死亡骑士了，我受够了那些愚蠢的新兵和他们无穷无尽的提问。\n\n现在，请你走开。"
G["I no longer wish to gain experience."]="我已经不再想获得经验了。"
G["I not afraid of little thing like you."]="我才不怕你这种小杂碎。"
G["I not feel so good..."]="我有点不舒服……*呕*"
G["I not gonna take it anymore, mon!"]="我可不打算再这样了，兄弟！"
G["I not in a big hurry. We can rest here a while if want."]="我又不急着办什么事。我们甚至可以在这里休息一阵子。"
G["I not live here always... I traveled lot of world on my own not long ago. I like all the stories of beasts and dragons and gods and stuff."]="我很少呆在营地……不久前，我还独自游历了不少地方呢。嗯，我喜欢那些关于野兽、巨龙和神灵的传说。"
G["I not scared of you!"]="我才不怕你！"
G["I not so happy about traveling with big-tongues."]="我讨厌和大舌头怪同行。"
G["I not sure this safe, little geist."]="恐怕不太安全吧，小恶鬼。"
G["I not-so-quietly ignore the insult, hoping to instill a fear in the ruler that he may have gaffed.  I then inform my liege of the insult when I return."]="我平静但略有表示地对这种冒犯一言不发，让他对自己犯下的错心怀恐惧。回去之后，我会把这一切禀报王上。"
G["I noticed some fire on that island over there. A human, too. Let's go check it out, $n."]="我注意到岛那边有一些火光。还有一个人。让我们去那边看看，$n。"
G["I now present you with a choice - a choice that I was never given."]="我现在给你个选择的机会——这机会我可不曾获得过。"
G["I now return to whence I came, only to find myself here once more to relive the same epic tragedy."]="我现在就回去，我到这儿来无非是再次体验相同的悲惨遭遇罢了。"
G["I obey."]="遵命。"
G["I offer myself in exchange.  You will have Ishanah, the High Priestess of the Aldor, as your prisoner if you release Kaylaan from your dark grasp."]="我愿以我自己作为交换。如果你把凯兰恩从你的黑暗枷锁中释放的话，你会得到奥尔多的高阶女祭司伊沙娜作为你的囚犯。"
G["I offer what shelter I can in our shattered lands."]="我尽量在这块破碎的大地上提供庇护所。"
G["I offer you the life of Lorna for your unconditional surrender."]="我要用罗娜的性命，换取你无条件的投降。"
G["I often find the trouble with ghouls is that they outlive their usefulness too quickly. Let us let death and decay reclaim these."]="食尸鬼的问题在于，他们很快就会丧失利用价值。让我们用死亡和腐烂解决他们吧。"
G["I often venture out here to think. The view is breathtaking, would you agree?"]="我经常来这儿思考。这景色真让人叹为观止，你觉得呢？"
G["I often wonder about the jinyu here. But they know how to fish and better than the rest of us so who am I to judge."]="我总对这里的锦鱼人感到奇怪。但他们知道如何捕鱼，而且技术比我们更高，所以我有什么资格去评判呢。"
G["I often worry, if the blossoms in this vale are truly eternal, it would be quite dangerous for new ones to sprout, no?  We'd be swimming in sea of choking flowers, fragrant and soft as they might be.\n\nI like to play it safe and squash the small ones under my boot, just to keep things in balance, you know?"]="如果这个山谷里百花盛开是真正永恒的，那么对于刚长出来的新芽来说是相当危险的，不是吗？这正是我所担心的地方。我们将会在香软且令人窒息的花海中畅游。\n\n为了安全起见，我将小朵的花踩在脚下碾碎，只是为了保持事物的平衡，你明白吗？"
G["I on way, Kiryn! And I don't care about you weird dead face!"]="我来啦，琪麟！我也不在乎你那张死怪物脸！"
G["I once caught a fish the size of three of your ancestors. Granted, it got away, but I caught it for all of a good minute."]="我曾经抓到过一条鱼，大小有你三个祖先加起来这么大。虽然最后它逃走了，但是逮到那条鱼的喜悦感是任何东西都无法比拟的。"
G["I once did battle with the dreaded fang toothed beast that shall not be named for fear of darkening the day."]="我曾经与长着恐怖利齿的野兽战斗过，我们最好不要提起它的名字，因为其中蕴含的恐惧足以使日月失色。"
G["I once followed the ways of the Twilight's Hammer. Obsessed with reviving the Old Gods, I journeyed deep into this lair to try to draw power from the cursed beast, Aku'mai!\n\nAfter witnessing the sacrifice of countless innocents, I came to my senses.\n\nI was trapped but now I am free! But so far from my homeland of Khaz Modan!\n\nBrave adventurer, I offer you passage to a very special land in return for slaying Aku'mai. If you wish, I can port you to the city of Darnassus."]="Una vez seguí la senda del Martillo Crepuscular. Obsesionado con resucitar a los dioses antiguos, me interné en las profundidades de esta guarida para intentar absorber el poder de Aku'mai, ¡bestia maldita!\n\nTras presenciar el sacrificio de incontables inocentes, recuperé el sentido.\n\n¡Estaba atrapado, pero ahora soy libre! ¡Y ahora estoy tan lejos de mi tierra natal Khaz Modan!\n\nValiente $gaventurero:aventurera;, te enseñaré el camino a una tierra muy especial a cambio de que mates a Aku'mai. Si lo deseas, puedo transportarte a la ciudad de Darnassus."
G["I once found a feather from big green bird on Neverrest. No green birds fly on Neverrest. This is a very good luckydo."]="我曾在不息山上捡到过一根大绿鸟的羽毛。在不息山上可没有绿鸟啊。这真是个幸运符。"
G["I once heard ol' Grimnur say he fished up a sword.  Or was it a swordfish?  Damn that Grimnur, he's told so many fish tales I can't remember which is which.  Well, why don't you go see him over in The Forlorn Cavern and have him tell you what it was."]="我听格瑞诺尔说他曾经钓起过一柄剑。或者那是一条旗鱼？这该死的格瑞诺尔，他对我讲了太多的关于鱼的故事，我都分不清了。嗯，你干嘛不去荒弃的洞穴找他，让他告诉你那究竟是什么呢……"
G["I once hunted alongside the famous Ohlorn Farstrider. He was a tauren who could hunt with nothing but a totem and his skivvies."]="我曾经与声名远播的欧洛恩·远行者一同狩猎。他是一位牛头人，打猎时只带着图腾，穿着粗布衣衫。"
G["I once roamed the Grizzly Hills, son to the great Ursoc, who ruled over this land.\n\nBut now... now I'm doomed to spend the rest of my life in this cave."]="我曾经以乌索克之子的身份在灰熊丘陵巡游，统治着这片领地。\n\n如今……我却只能窝在洞穴中苟延残喘，度过悲惨的余生。"
G["I once saw a fish so big you'd swear it was a shark. Come to think of it..."]="有一次，我看见一条非常大的鱼，你发誓它是鲨鱼。现在想起来了……"
G["I once saw a strange creature in the Grummle Bazaar. It looked like a haunched over jinyu but was mean and said something like \"Mrggmrmrgmgmgl\".\n\nI guess one of the grummles brought it up from the coastline."]="Una vez vi a una criatura extraña en El Bazar Grúmel. Parecía un jinyu encorvado, pero era violento y decía algo así como \"Mrggmrmrgmgmgl\".\n\nMe imagino que un grúmel lo traería de la costa."
G["I once served Medivh... or pretended to.  I helped the Violet Eye keep a close eye on the Master.\n\nBut now all I can think of is... making horseshoes.  Over and over."]="我曾经为麦迪文效劳过……或者可以说是假装效劳过。我帮助紫罗兰之眼监视着我的主人。\n\n不过现在我所做的只是制造马蹄铁。一个又一个。"
G["I only caught two rabbits. Now I have lots!"]="我原本只逮到了两只兔子。可现在却有这么多！"
G["I only did it for my clan!"]="我只是为了我的部族才会这样做！"
G["I only have one pet! I hope that's ok!"]="我只有一只宠物！但愿这能行！"
G["I only have one rule. Everyone fights. No one quits."]="我只有一条命令。血战到底，不许退缩。"
G["I only have two hands and two feet here!"]="我只有两只手和两只脚！"
G["I only make my mounts available to those who are considered exalted to Orgrimmar and the Orcish race.  Go prove yourself to us, and I'll make my mighty wolves available for your inspection."]="我只跟那些被奥格瑞玛的兽人当朋友的人做生意。证明自己吧，然后再来和我谈那些强大的座狼。"
G["I only make my mounts available to those who are considered friendly to Orgrimmar and the Orcish race.  Go prove yourself to us, and I'll make my mighty wolves available for your inspection."]="我只跟那些被奥格瑞玛的兽人当朋友的人做生意。证明自己吧，然后再来和我谈那些强大的座狼。"
G["I only sleep."]="我只是再次沉睡。"
G["I only teach students who have already mastered the basics. You must seek out the night elf Darianna in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus. Her skills will be a perfect complement to yours."]="我只教那些掌握基本指示的学生。你必须在达纳苏斯工匠区找到暗夜精灵达丽亚娜。她的技能与你的是完美的互补。"
G["I only understand a few words of the quilboar tongue, but I didn't like what I heard."]="野猪人的话我懂得不多，但我可不喜欢我听到的这些话。"
G["I only wanted to... do something... good..."]="我只想要……做点……好事……"
G["I only wish I had more students like you. Not many will venture so far into enemy territory. I salute your courage."]="我真希望有更多像你一样的学生。很少有人会冒险深入敌境。我佩服你的勇气。"
G["I ordered a few shipments of new perfumes and colognes from the city. After I get them unpacked, check back and I'll have them for sale."]="我从城里订购了一些新的香水，等我把它们放好之后，你就可以来找我购买啦！"
G["I ought to give your head a good shake!  I've a feeling the ley-lines are clouding up your brain.  No, Darius, what we need is a large depository of mineral-heavy water.  Even faint arcane signals will accumulate in sulphur and lime."]="我应该给你的脑袋来一次充分的振动！我感觉魔网能量线遮住了你的脑子。不，达里乌斯，我们需要的是大量富含矿物质的水源。即使是非常微弱的奥术信号也会在硫磺和石灰中累积下来。"
G["I oughtta shuffle on down and poke around fer treasure while I'm here - after all, what're the odds of a dwarf like me gettin' pinched twice?"]="我应该趁自己被囚禁在祖阿曼时四处逛逛，搞点财宝什么的——毕竟，对我这样的矮人来说，再多吃点苦头也没什么关系吧？"
G["I overheard Regnus Thundergranite in the Hall of Arms bragging about a new trophy for his den the other day.  If yer looking for training from a skilled hunter, Regnus is the one to see."]="几天前，我无意中听雷格努斯·雷石在武器大厅中吹嘘他兽穴中的一件新饰品。要是你想成为一名技艺纯熟的猎人，就去找他吧。"
G["I overheard a great deal through the cage. Rensai will be pleased with what I have to tell him."]="我在被囚禁时偷听到了不少消息。任塞一定会对我所带来的情报感到很高兴的。"
G["I overheard them talking. They're getting ready to summon up something big at their base to the east!"]="我听到了他们的交谈。他们正准备在东边的基地里召唤什么大家伙！"
G["I owe you a debt that I can never repay, $n. Or, can't I?\n\nHmm?"]="Tengo una deuda contigo que jamás podré pagar, $n. ¿O sí?\n\n¿Mmm?"
G["I owe you a favor, darling...someday I'll be back to repay it."]="我欠你个人情，宝贝儿……有一天我会回来偿还。"
G["I owe you a great deal for my freedom, $n.\n\nNow, let us see if we can free Magatha and put an end to the Twilight's Hammer in Thousand Needles."]="Te debo mucho por mi libertad, $n.\n\nAhora veamos si podemos liberar a Magatha y poner fin al Martillo Crepuscular en Las Mil Agujas."
G["I owe you a great debt for saving my life. Of course I will help you gain audience with the Elder."]="你救了我的命，我欠你一份天大的人情。我一定会帮你见到长老的。"
G["I owe you a life debt, stranger."]="Tengo una deuda de vida contigo, $gforastero:forastera;."
G["I owe you a long night of drinking, my friend."]="Te debo una larga noche bebiendo, $gamigo mío:amiga mía;."
G["I owe you a very special thank you. Find me sometime when this fight is over."]="我欠你一个天大的人情。等战斗结束后，请来找我。"
G["I owe you an ale!"]="我欠你一杯酒！"
G["I owe you greatly, friend."]="我对你感激不尽，朋友。"
G["I owe you my life!"]="我欠你一条命！"
G["I owe you my life."]="我欠你一条命。"
G["I owe you my life.  My people have paid a high price for defying Deathwing."]="我欠你一条命。在和死亡之翼的战斗中，我的人民已经付出了高昂的代价。"
G["I owe you, $c.\n\nThought I was a gonner."]="我欠你个人情，$c。\n\n我以为我死定了。"
G["I owe you.  Big time."]="我欠你个人情。很大的人情。"
G["I own a dog, but I'm not giving him a sword."]="我有一条狗，但我不会把剑给它。"
G["I own you!"]="我比你强！"
G["I panicked when I saw all those saurok and wrecked my boat."]="当我看到那些蜥蜴人时，我慌了，打翻了船。"
G["I peer into these waters and my reflection is empty..."]="我注视水面，却看不见我的倒影……"
G["I perform one final service. I pray it is sufficient..."]="我要作最后一次努力。希望它能有效……"
G["I personally didn't mind him. It was the Prince who took exception to a high elf in his domain. Alas, I am not one to question the Prince. In his defense, he did not incinerate Master Winthalus immediately."]="我个人并不在意他。王子从未如此对待过他领地中的高等精灵。唉，我还没资格质疑王子。不过至少,他并没有立即把温萨鲁斯烧成灰。"
G["I picked a bad day to stop drinking!"]="我真是选了个戒酒的好日子啊！"
G["I picked the wrong week to quit drinkin'!"]="我挑错了戒酒的日子！"
G["I pity the fool!"]="我同情愚者！"
G["I pity you, Forsaken.  Your soul is devoid of light."]="我怜悯你，被遗忘者。你的灵魂暗淡无光。"
G["I placed most of the spikes. Good amount of pointiness I think. You like?"]="我在栅栏上安了许多尖刺。它们看上去挺锋利的。你觉得呢？"
G["I plan on creating a wonder of my own for them to behold..."]="我计划亲自创造出一个奇迹，让他们全都看看……"
G["I play all of my records backwards. Except for the ones by Arrowsmite and Sons."]="所有的录音带，我都倒着放。除了“箭头小子”乐队的。"
G["I pledge my love to you forever. Death cannot erase that, even as I am sure that you still remember your love for me."]="我发誓将永远爱你。死亡也无法让我的爱褪色，我相信你仍然记得你爱着我。"
G["I pledge the blades of my Blood Knights to the defeat of Kil'jaeden and the restoration of Silvermoon."]="我以血骑士的佩剑起誓，击败基尔加丹，恢复银月城昔日的辉煌。"
G["I poop on you, trollses!"]="去死吧，巨魔！"
G["I possess part of Eranikus' essence.  What do you want with it... or with me?"]="我拥有一部分伊兰尼库斯的精华。你想用它来做什么……或者要我做什么？"
G["I pray for such things."]="我祈求能得到这样的经历。"
G["I pray that the Light of a Thousand Moons will grant me this honor."]="我衷心祈求千月之光能够赐予我这份荣光。"
G["I pray that this is not what I'm remembered for...."]="希望他们不是因为这点才记得我……"
G["I pray the illness I'm feeling is due to stress ulcers..."]="我发誓，我的不适感源于焦虑……"
G["I pray they give me a chance to prove myself."]="我请求他们给我一个机会，让我证明自己。"
G["I predict a painful death."]="我断定你们会痛苦地死去。"
G["I predicted that to be a likely outcome."]="我早就预测到类似的结果了。"
G["I prefer a little more meat on my birds, of course, but I can see that your people and mine are not so different after all."]="当然我不介意你们多喂我的鸟儿一点肉，但我开始发现你们和熊猫人之间也并没有太大的差异嘛。"
G["I prefer a swift, silent kill. But your methods have their advantages."]="我喜欢迅捷而安静的杀戮。但你的方式也有好处。"
G["I prefer my fish boiled AFTER they've been caught. Let's put out these fires."]="我更希望我的鱼在被捉住以后可以煮熟，让我们扑灭这些火吧。"
G["I prefer my food raw, but if you like yours cooked Denni'ka can show you how to light a fire.  Find her at Survival of the Fittest, a hut on the shore of the lake next to the Spirit Lodge.  Look for it up above and to the west of the Valley of Strength."]="我喜欢吃生食，但是要是你想吃熟食，德尼卡可以教你如何生火。去适者生存小屋，就是灵魂小屋附近湖畔边的那件房间里可以找到她。先往上然后往力量谷的西边走就可以到了。"
G["I prefer my meals a bit colder!"]="我喜欢冷一点的食物！"
G["I prefer not to meddle with death."]="我还是别跟死亡搅在一起了。"
G["I prefer to be hands-on..."]="我喜欢自己动手……"
G["I prefer to shape the properties of water, and unleash them against my enemies."]="我更喜欢塑造流水之形，并使用它们来对付我的敌人。"
G["I prefer to work in solitude."]="我更喜欢独自工作。"
G["I present to you experiment number 25463-D!"]="我授予你实验代号——25463-D！"
G["I present to you the Libram of Constitution."]="这是给你的体质圣契。"
G["I present to you the Libram of Resilience."]="这是给你的恢复圣契。"
G["I present to you the Libram of Rumination."]="看看吧，这就是沉思圣契。"
G["I present to you the Libram of Tenacity."]="这是给你的坚韧圣契。"
G["I present to you the Libram of Voracity."]="这是给你的贪婪圣契。"
G["I present to you the rabid thistle bear, Tharnariun."]="我带来了狂暴的蓟熊，萨纳瑞恩。"
G["I present you with proof of my deeds, Cyrus."]="我让你看看我的能力的证明，塞勒斯。"
G["I presume you come with good news?"]="我想你应该是带来了什么好消息吧？"
G["I promise not to give you warts..."]="我保证不会让你得疣……"
G["I promise this won't hurt... too much."]="我保证不会疼的……至少不会很疼。"
G["I promise this won't hurt...too much."]="我向你保证，不会痛的……起码不会很痛。"
G["I promise you an eternity of dung clean up duty for that failure!"]="你将为自己的失败受到惩罚，永远在这儿清扫粪便！"
G["I promise you this much: The Valley will be ours."]="我向你保证：这座峡谷必将是我们的囊中之物。"
G["I promise you this: I will stop at nothing to prepare this world for the battle to come."]="我发誓：我要不惜一切代价让这个世界做好战争的准备。"
G["I promised Malfurion that I would inform him if we made any progress.  I'll meet you at the beach as soon as I can."]="我向玛法里奥作过承诺，无论有任何进展都将向他报告。我将尽快与你在海滩碰头。"
G["I promised the boys a picnic up here but it is a dangerous place. Just the other day I hear there was an actual fight between strangers like yourself.\n\nAnd someone from... the turtle.\n\nI always thought the turtle was a legend."]="我答应带他们在这儿野餐，可这里太危险了。就在几天前，我听说有几个像你一样的陌生人打了起来。\n\n还有个从……龟背上来的人。\n\n我一直以为那海龟只是个传说。"
G["I propose this: We will march on the Twilight cult and extinguish any utterings of Deathwing's name from this realm.  Your Earthen Ring will march with us."]="我的提议是：我们会向暮光教派进军，将死亡之翼的名讳从这个世界中彻底抹消掉。你们大地之环，将随我而战。"
G["I punched a penguin on my way in here."]="我在来这里的路上殴打了一只企鹅。"
G["I put at your disposal whatever assistance I can offer."]="无论你需要什么帮助，我都会竭尽所能。"
G["I put this all on you, but what are you doing to get us off of this island?"]="我全都指望你了，但你怎样做才能让我们离开这座岛？"
G["I quietly ignore the insult.  I will not tell my liege, as I am to secure peace at all costs.  It's only an insult - not a declaration of war."]="我默不作声，忽略了这种侮辱。我不会告诉我的王上，因为我将不惜一切代价保护和平。这只是一次侮辱——而不是一次完全的宣战。"
G["I quit, I QUIT!"]="我退出，我退出！"
G["I raise my brew and hope to be rid of the likes of you!  Cheers, you no good scoundrel, $n!"]="¡Levanto mi cerveza y espero librarme de ti y tus semejantes! ¡Adiós, no eres más que $gun:una; miserable, $n!"
G["I ran away from my home in Strom after my father tried to kill me."]="为了躲避父亲的毒手，我逃出了位于暴风城里的家。"
G["I ran to wake up the others when the attack hit. Were they able to escape? I tried to fight off the soldiers with a skinning knife..."]="当战斗开始时，我跑去叫醒了其他人。他们逃出来了么？我只能用一把剥皮小刀和那些凶恶的士兵对抗……"
G["I readied my swords for battle."]="刀剑出鞘，准备应战。"
G["I realize we have had somewhat differing loyalties in the past, but put your suspicions aside. Our considerable power has been pledged to your leaders in good faith."]="我明白在很久以前我们曾有些分歧，但是请把你们的顾虑放在一边。我们强大的力量已经完全可以听凭你们的首领来调遣了。"
G["I realize you have only recently joined us, and thus may be unaware of our traditions. In Moonglade, a tremendous celebration is taking place. This is a time of year when we honor our elders, and you are certainly invited! Travel to one of our cities if you wish to join in!"]="Me doy cuenta de que hace poco que te has unido a nosotros y, por eso, puede que no conozcas nuestras tradiciones. En Claro de la Luna, está teniendo lugar una celebración estupenda. Es una época del año en la que honramos a nuestros ancestros, y desde luego, ¡estás $ginvitado:invitada;! ¡Viaja hasta una de nuestras ciudades si deseas unirte a nosotros!"
G["I really can't thank you enough!"]="真不知道该怎样感谢你！"
G["I really did not know what to expect, Eris. I will use my powers to assist you if that is what is asked of me."]="艾瑞斯，我真不知道会发生什么。如果你需要我的帮助，我会竭尽全力的。"
G["I really do hate being right all the time."]="我真的很讨厌每次都被我说中。"
G["I really don't think our situation is so bad.  I am certain it will all be rectified soon and the Sunwell's power will be restored.  It just can't possibly be as bad as everyone is making it out to be."]="我不觉得我们的处境有这么坏。我很确信一切都会很快得到纠正，太阳之井的能量也会恢复。事情不可能像大家所想的那样坏。"
G["I really envy you, $n. You do amazing work."]="我真羡慕你，$n。你做得太出色了。"
G["I really hope it didn't eat any of my friends before you beat it up."]="我真心希望，它在被你打跑之前，没吃过我的任何一个朋友。"
G["I really hope you know what you are doing."]="我真希望你知道自己在做什么。"
G["I really missed you, Danforth."]="我真的很想念你，丹弗斯。"
G["I really need a better system for filing these books. Ahh that's the one I wanted."]="看来我真的需要一个更好的图书分类系统了。啊，就是这本！"
G["I really need to get going now."]="我现在真得走了。"
G["I really need to stop gambling.  Tell them no more cards for me."]="我真该戒赌了。告诉他们我不会再玩了。"
G["I really owe you one, so I'll tell ya what. I'll talk to my father about letting you guys join the Tillers Union."]="我欠你的，所以我要告诉你。我会和我的父亲说，让你们加入阡陌客。"
G["I really should charge you for that."]="我真应该向你收费。"
G["I really thought I'd be more excited about this..."]="我还以为自己会更加激动呢……"
G["I really wasn't built for this. I'm a master orator and diplomat of the people. Are we quite done here yet?"]="我真不擅长干这个。我是一位演说大师，人民的外交家。我们在这里的任务快要完成了吧？"
G["I really wish I could help ya, but I can't! Kurdran's given me direct orders. Now move along!"]="我真的希望我能帮你，但是我不能！库德兰已经给我下达了直接命令。自求多福吧！"
G["I recall clearly the gleam of pride in his eye as he stood before me, eager to defeat the enemies of the Light..."]="我清晰地记得他眼中的光芒，那光芒带着荣耀，带着击败圣光之敌的热切……"
G["I received an update on that just a moment ago. It looks like out of $2061w light leather needed, we have $2060w. As for the others, the report indicated that we've gathered $2063w of $2064w medium leather, and $2069w out of our $2071w thick leather quota."]="我刚刚得到最新的消息。似乎我们已经收集到$2060w张轻皮、$2063w张中皮和$2069w张厚皮，而总的需求量分别是$2061w、$2064w和$2071w。"
G["I received the majority of my weapons training from Ilyenia Moonfire in the Warrior's Terrace.  You would do well to seek her out if you desire to learn the use of a new weapon."]="通过千百次的锤炼，伊琳尼雅·月火已经掌握了若干种武器的使用方法，现在她为别人提供训练。如果你想接受训练的话，就去战士区找她吧。"
G["I received word that you were able to help Ranger Valanna and the lieutenant at Zeb'Sora.\n\nThank you, $c. I suppose I should make my way back to Farstrider Enclave now."]="我得到消息说你帮助了游侠瓦兰娜和派往塞布索雷的上尉。\n\n感谢你，$c。我想我现在应该回远行者营地了。"
G["I recently came here to observe the Winterfin murlocs. Disguised as one of them, I kept my distance and took notes on their day-to-day life.\n\nHowever, not long after I arrived, that all changed.\n\nAn earthquake in Coldarra caused a landslide, which exposed the nearby caverns. Out came a strange makrura who stole away with the Winterfins' tadpoles. When the murlocs went into the caverns to rescue their young, they re-emerged, glowing and under the makrura's influence.\n\nNow the unaffected have retreated to here, and I have reluctantly assumed their leadership."]="不久前，我来这里观察冬鳞鱼人。我伪装成他们的模样，保持着一定的距离，记录鱼人的日常生活情况。\n\n没过多久，一切都改变了。\n\n考达拉的一场地震引发山崩，附近的洞穴都露了出来。居住在洞穴中的龙虾人开始偷窃冬鳞蝌蚪。鱼人们试图拯救他们的后代，但是一旦他们进入洞穴，就像被转换了心智似的，沦为了龙虾人的走狗。\n\n那些尚未堕落的鱼人撤退到这里，我勉为其难地成为了他们的首领。"
G["I reckon I'll head back to Stoneplow and rest my dang arms."]="我得回石犁村去放松一下我这…该死的老胳膊了。"
G["I reckon I'll see you over there."]="我会到那儿跟你们会合。"
G["I reckon that the odds of obtaining such a piece would be a one in a million! A once in a lifetime skin! Even the most disciplined artisans of the craft would no doubt fail several hundred times in the process of skinning the beast before a pristine sample was recovered."]="我估计获得这样一件东西的概率是百万分之一！一件让你终身受用的兽皮！即使是技艺最高超的工匠也不一定能剥出一张完美的皮来！"
G["I reckon we got enough."]="我看我们找得差不多了。"
G["I reckon we're almost there now."]="我觉得我们快到了。"
G["I recognize your stench. You're the one who stealthed by me on the back of that snow leopard runt!"]="Reconozco tu hedor. ¡Eres $gel que:la que; me espió $gmontado:montada; sobre ese leopardo de las nieves enano!"
G["I recommend evisceration!"]="我建议进行摘除手术！"
G["I recommend that you return to Anvilmar, $n... and quickly!  I'll send the signal to the Gnomeregan Airmen."]="我建议你去找安威玛尔，$n……而且要尽快去！我会向诺莫瑞根空军发出信号。"
G["I recommend you buy like there was no tomorrow. Who knows how long it will be until you find deals this good again."]="我建议你要以倾家荡产的豪情进行购买。谁能知道你在什么时候还有机会买到这么好的东西呢？"
G["I recovered your armor and weapons. Victory or death!"]="我拿回了你的盔甲和武器。我们不胜即死！"
G["I refuse to believe that all of my brethren support Garrosh."]="我不信所有的兽人都支持加尔鲁什。"
G["I refuse to concede defeat! I am a prince of the Eredar! I... am..."]="我拒绝承认失败！我是艾瑞达的王子！我……是……"
G["I refuse to outlive my daughter."]="我拒绝比我女儿活得更久。"
G["I refuse to take your guesses if you aren't participating in the brawl yourself. You need \"skin in the game\", if you will.\nGo talk to one of the guards and queue for the brawl. Then we can play."]="Me niego a aceptar tus apuestas si no vas a participar en un combate. Tienes que tener \"carne en el asador\", por así decir.\n\nVe a hablar con uno de los guardias y ponte a la cola para combatir. Entonces podrás jugar."
G["I regret nothing!"]="我死而无憾！"
G["I regret nothing."]="我不会为此后悔。"
G["I regret that I must fight this $n."]="我对不得不和$n交战而感到十分遗憾。"
G["I regret to inform you all that we sent home another ten soldiers today - in body bags."]="我很遗憾地告诉你们，今天我们又送了十个士兵回家——装在裹尸袋里。"
G["I regret to inform you that the evacuee I was charged with escorting is no more. Would you please allow me to escort another evacuee? I won't fail you again!"]="很抱歉，我没能完成护送任务，那位村民不幸丧命了。能再给我一次机会吗？我保证不会再让你失望了！"
G["I regret to inform you that you have failed your examination, doctor."]="你没通过测试，对此我感到很遗憾。"
G["I regret to say that I cannot aid you, $gnoble sir:gentle lady;, until you learn more of working with leather. Speak with Faldron or Darianna here instead. They can teach you the skill you require."]="$g尊敬的先生:女士;，在你掌握制皮的更多知识之前，我还不能帮助你，对此我感到很遗憾。跟法多恩或达丽亚娜谈谈。他们能教你所需的技能。"
G["I release you from the curse of flesh!"]="忠诚的追随者，从血肉的诅咒中解脱吧！"
G["I release you from this fate Leyara. May you finally find your peace in death."]="我会让你获得解脱。愿你能在死后得到安宁。"
G["I remember Gina! I bought some supplies from her, a few days back. Here's the money. Tell her I said hello."]="我记得吉娜！几天前，我从她那里买了一些物资。给你钱。请转告我对她的问候。"
G["I remember a time when the venerable Silkmaster Tsai created a strand of silk so fine it sliced through the earth when he dropped it. We never saw it again."]="我记得曾经有位德高望重的蔡丝匠做出了一种极品丝线，它掉在地上时都能把泥土切开。可那之后我们就再也没见过那种丝了。"
G["I remember a time when there were no orcs. Can you imagine it? No damned orcs!"]="我还记得曾几何时，在这个世界上没有兽人。你能想象吗？没有那些该死的兽人！"
G["I remember everything..."]="我记得所有事情……"
G["I remember it well.  It was a bright, shiny day..."]="我记得很清楚。那是一个阳光灿烂的日子……"
G["I remember my first experiment gone awry. These fields were crawling with super grubs the likes of which had not been seen in this age of the world."]="我记得我的第一次实验失败了。这些地里当时爬满了前所未见的超级大虫子。"
G["I remember now... it's all your fault!"]="我记起来了……这全都是你的错！"
G["I remember telling Silas, \"I never want to see my family again.\""]="Recuerdo haberle dicho a Silas: \"No quiero volver a ver a mi familia nunca\"."
G["I remember this one time, Keeshan and I were out fishing at the Lakeshire bridge and Keeshan farted. Don't think Oslow ever forgave Keeshan for that one..."]="我记得有一次，基沙恩和我到湖畔镇的桥上钓鱼，然后基沙恩突然放了个屁。我想奥斯洛在那件事情上永远都不会原谅基沙恩……"
G["I remember well the sting of defeat at the conclusion of the Third War. I have waited far too long for my revenge. Now the shadow of the Legion falls over this world. It is only a matter of time until all of your failed creation... is undone."]="我仍然清晰地记得上次战争败北的耻辱。我等待复仇的机会已经等得太久了。现在，军团的阴影将笼罩这个世界，你们彻底毁灭的日子……已经不远了。"
G["I remember what you can do with those elixirs of yours.  Can your elixirs help out an old friend?"]="我还记得你能让那些合剂发挥出什么样的效力。你愿意用你的合剂帮帮老朋友吗？"
G["I remember when I was just a wee little lad... the other boys would swim down to the bottom of Loch Modan to pick up sand dollars and seashells.  Oskar and I were stuck on the lake's surface, kicking our legs uselessly into the air, but we couldn't join them."]="我记得当我还是个小不点儿的时候……别的男孩子都能一猛子扎到洛克莫丹湖底，拾上来各种各样的海胆和贝壳。奥斯卡和我却只能趴在湖面上，两腿乱蹬，分享不到半点儿乐趣。"
G["I remember when Vol'jin and I first came to this land. The Horde was just an idea then. A hope. We needed one another."]="我还记得我和沃金第一次踏上这片土地的时候。那时的部落还只是一个想法。一个憧憬。那时的我们需要彼此。"
G["I remember when my brother and I would camp alone in the Azshara wilderness. Look at it now."]="我还记得和我的兄弟一起在艾萨拉荒野上露营的时候。看看它现在的样子。"
G["I remember when my shop saw this much traffic..."]="我还记得，在我的商店里看到那么多人流时的情景……"
G["I remember when the Barrens was ... barren. And we liked it!"]="我记得以前的贫瘠之地是真的很……“贫瘠”。我们还是比较喜欢那个时候的贫瘠之地！"
G["I remember you... in the mountains.... But you... what is this? Where am--"]="我记得你们……在群山中……但是你们……这是怎么回事？我这是在——"
G["I report you to HR!"]="我要上告人力官员！"
G["I represent the strength which bolsters you as a young druid.  I am the strength of the body, and the strength of the heart.  You have already come to know this in your training, and you draw upon this when you take on the aspect of the bear.\n\nContinue to keep the balance in all things, young one, and keep your perspective clear and true.  When you need me... I will be there for you."]="Represento la fuerza que te apoya como $gun:una; joven druida. Soy la fuerza del cuerpo y la fuerza del corazón. Ya has podido saber esto a través de tu instrucción y lo aprovechas cuando adoptas el aspecto del oso.\n\nSigue guardando el equilibrio de todas las cosas, joven, y mantén tu mirada limpia y verdadera. Si me necesitas... allí estaré."
G["I represent the strength which bolsters you as a young druid.  You have come to me to learn this strength, young one, and I will teach this to you.  I will teach you all that is the spirit bear, provided you will listen and understand.\n\nIn order to know what it means to draw upon my spirit, you need to understand the importance of the strength of the body, as well as the strength of the heart."]="Represento la fuerza que te apoya como $gun:una; joven druida. Has venido hasta aquí para aprender esa fuerza, joven, y te la enseñaré. Te enseñaré qué es el espíritu del oso, siempre que lo escuches y comprendas.\n\nPara saber lo que significa recurrir a mi espíritu debes comprender la importancia de la fuerza del cuerpo y de la fuerza del corazón."
G["I request that you summon birds to sing pleasant meadow-tunes into my Doloria's ears, while she sleeps."]="我祈求您，当多罗莉亚入睡时召唤来鸟雀，在她的耳边唱起优美的旋律。"
G["I require a chrono-beacon, Sa'at."]="我需要一个时空道标，萨艾特。"
G["I require a teleport to Naxxramas."]="我需要传送到纳克萨玛斯。"
G["I require a vial of aqual quintessence, Hydraxis, for I go to the Molten Core to extinguish a rune of the Firelords."]="我需要一瓶水之精萃，海达克西斯，因为我要去熔火之心毁掉炎魔之王的符文。"
G["I require aid."]="我需要帮助。"
G["I require all my students to prove their dedication. Now it's your turn..."]="我要所有学生都证明他们的热情。现在轮到你了……"
G["I require assistance in recovering a piece of my Demoniac's Threads, Al'tabim."]="我需要你帮我重制一件赞达拉恶魔师套装，阿塔比姆。"
G["I require assistance in recovering a piece of my Illusionist's Attire, Al'tabim."]="我需要你帮我重制一件赞达拉幻术师套装，阿塔比姆。"
G["I require assistance!"]="我需要帮助！"
G["I require flagging."]="Deseo que me marques."
G["I require more bodies! Bring them to me at once!"]="我需要更多的尸体！马上给我找来！"
G["I require more of the Secret Signal Powder, Kadrak."]="我需要更多的秘密信号粉末，卡德拉克。"
G["I require priest training."]="我需要牧师训练。"
G["I require repairs and supplies, Corvus."]="我需要修理装备和购买物资，科弗斯。"
G["I require rogue training."]="我需要潜行者训练。"
G["I require some components, Sorely."]="我需要一些材料，苏雷。"
G["I require the aid of another spirit hunter, Ar'tor."]="我需要另一位灵魂猎手的帮助，阿托尔。"
G["I require the flame, master."]="我需要火焰，师父。"
G["I require training, Arnok."]="我需要训练，阿诺克。"
G["I require training, Daryl."]="我需要训练，达瑞尔。"
G["I require training, Grimnur."]="我需要训练，格瑞诺尔。"
G["I require training, Highlord."]="我要接受训练，大领主。"
G["I require training, Krenk."]="我需要训练，科伦克。"
G["I require training, Lumak."]="我需要训练，鲁玛克。"
G["I require training, Nissa."]="我需要训练，妮萨。"
G["I require training, Zamja."]="我需要训练，扎姆沙。"
G["I require training, sir!"]="我需要接受训练，长官！"
G["I require training."]="我要接受训练。"
G["I require warrior training."]="我需要进行战士技能的训练。"
G["I require water breathing, Garren."]="我需要水下呼吸效果，盖伦。"
G["I require your life essence to maintain my existence in this realm."]="我需要你的生命精华，只有这样我才能在这个位面继续生存下去。"
G["I retired from battle to live in peace with my family. It seems battle will not let me retire so easily."]="我退出战斗，与世无争地和家人温馨度日。但看来战场不肯让我轻易离开啊。"
G["I return from the grave to do my master's bidding."]="为了执行主人的命令，我从坟墓中醒来。"
G["I return you whence you came!"]="从哪里来，就回哪里去！"
G["I return! A second chance to carve your skull!"]="我又回来了！又得到一次把你们脑壳敲碎的机会！"
G["I return... to the earth."]="我回到了……大地的怀抱。"
G["I return... to... da... sands..."]="我将……归于……流沙……"
G["I returned back to camp with my quarry. Shokia would be pleased."]="我带着俘虏返回了营地。夏琪亚一定会很满意的。"
G["I returned from the grave to take my revenge!"]="我从墓地里爬出来的唯一目的就是复仇！"
G["I returned to find Rell bein' attacked by hozen! Again!"]="我回来时，却发现利尔又遭到了猢狲的攻击！"
G["I returned to my people and was greeted with smiling faces and outstretched arms, mostly from the Broken. The prejudices against us from many draenei had continued in my absence. But it was as if they knew that I was coming, and I soon found out why.\n\nVelen, the prophet and leader of all of the draenei, had seen my return in one of his visions and was there to greet me as well. He asked to speak with me in private and as I related my story to him, he nodded and smiled, for this too he had foreseen."]="我回到了我的人民身边，到处都是问候的笑脸和友善的手臂，大部分都是破碎者。许多德莱尼人对我们仍持有偏见，但他们似乎知道我要回来，果然不久之后我就知道了原因。\n\n维伦，全体德莱尼人的先知和领袖，在他的梦境中看到了我们的回归，他同样赶来问候我。他要求我和他私下谈话，于是我向他讲述了我的故事。他点了点头，露出了微笑，这一切和他预知的完全一样。"
G["I revel in your pain!"]="你的痛苦就是我的快乐！"
G["I risk my own life and free him so that he may prove his innocence.  If I can, I'll help him in any way."]="我愿意以自己生命的代价来拯救他，然后他就可以证明自己的清白。如果可以的话，我会不惜一切代价来帮助他。"
G["I run now!"]="我跑！"
G["I run the fights around here.  You want to place a bet, gamble with confidence - anyone caught fixin' fights gets to walk the plank.\n\nI'll make sure of that myself!"]="我负责主持格斗比赛。你想不想赌一把啊？怎么样，有信心吗？但是——谁敢搞贿赂选手的猫腻，我就让他走跳板。\n\n我会亲自维持比赛的公平！"
G["I run the tightest airship in Azeroth. She used to be fitted with twin light cannons and enough bombs to flatten a city, you know... her mere shadow was enough to rout armies.\n\nWhat? Of course it's true!"]="我管理着艾泽拉斯最坚固的飞船。她曾经靠两门轻型火炮就炸平了一座城市，真的……她投射下的阴影就足以让敌人魂飞魄散。\n\n什么？这当然是真的！"
G["I run you through!"]="我要踩扁你！"
G["I sacrifice this human in the name of our dark master!"]="以黑暗领主之名，这名人类将成为您的祭品！"
G["I said KNEEL!"]="跪下！"
G["I said to myself, \"I'm gonna punch that dragon in the face!\""]="Y me dije a mí mismo: \"¡Voy a darle un puñetazo a ese dragón en toda la cara!\""
G["I said ye had the blood of a blacksmith in ye, and I was right. Go to Ironforge, to The Great Forge, and find yerself a Dwarven smith by the name of Bengus Deepforge. My teacher, and one of the greatest smiths I've ever known."]="我说过你有铁匠的血统，看来我是对的。去铁炉堡大熔炉找一个名叫本古斯·深炉的矮人铁匠。他是我的老师，是我知道的最伟大的铁匠之一。"
G["I said, NO transmatter! At least I'm not a mechagnome anymore."]="别再跟我提什么转换器了！我已经不是机械侏儒了。"
G["I said, SEARCH the bodies BEFORE you eat them!"]="我说过了，在你吃尸体前都先给我好好搜查一下！"
G["I salvaged what I could from the nearby wreckage, but I can only stay down for so long..."]="我把附近残骸里能抢救的东西都抢救出来了，现在我已经坚持不住了……"
G["I save you, Kiryn!"]="我来救你了，琪麟！"
G["I saw 'em draggin' Boldbrew, kickin' and bitin', towards some hut south o' here. Now if ye hurry, ye can help her, and she might know more."]="我看见他们拖着粗酿往南边的小屋去了。如果你们动作快，或许能救下她，她可能知道更多的情况。"
G["I saw Dampwick ride across on that thing. I'd rather use a Slow Fall spell, but I don't know that one yet."]="我看见戴姆维克骑过这东西。所以我宁可使用缓落术。不过我还不知道这法术该怎么用。"
G["I saw Dampwick ride across on that thing. I'd rather use a Slow Fall spell, but I don't know that one yet.\n\nWant some training, $n?"]="我看见戴姆维克骑过这东西。所以我宁可使用缓落术。不过我还不知道这法术该怎么用。\n\n想要训练吗，$n？"
G["I saw Little Timmy the other day, Ana. Would you like a kitten?"]="我前几天遇见小提米了，安娜。你想要养只小猫吗？"
G["I saw a Sea Giant once.  It's not something I would care to see again.  Burp!"]="我曾经看到过一个海巨人。再看到它们一次也没什么了不起，嗝儿！"
G["I saw a murloc swim by my window."]="结果我看到有个鱼人在我的窗边游泳。"
G["I saw a peddler setting up his trade goods in the Golden Lantern. I will mark the location on your map."]="我看到有个小贩在金色神灯摆摊卖货。我会在你的地图上标出位置。"
G["I saw first-hand what the sha did to my soldiers in the Jade Forest. My strongest men were rendered helpless by crippling doubt."]="我在翡翠林亲眼见过煞魔对我的士兵所做的一切。严重的猜疑令我手下最坚强的士兵都深感无助，自暴自弃。"
G["I saw her, you know.\n\nMazu. The goddess of the sea.\n\nWorst storm of my life. I was young and inexperienced. I went overboard. Everything went dark - I was done for.\n\nThen she appeared before me, clear as a summer afternoon. Beautiful like you couldn't imagine - shells around her neck and strings of pearls on her hips. She smiled and held out her slender arm.\n\nNext thing I remember, Dog had me on his back at the surface and the crew was pulling me aboard. Never saw him before - crew said he came out of nowhere. But I know where he came from."]="你知道吗，我看见她了。\n\n玛祖。海之女神。\n\n我人生中最猛烈的风暴。我那时候年轻，而且缺乏经验。我从船上跌进海里。到处都是漆黑一片，我完蛋了。\n\n然后她出现在我面前，像夏天的午后一样清新。那样的美丽是你无法想象的，她的脖子上戴着贝壳，臀部挂着一串串的珍珠。她微笑着并且伸出纤细的手臂。\n\n然后我只记得，狗把我背在背上，并且船员拉我上了船。之前从未见过他，船员都说不知道他是从哪里冒出来的。但我知道他从哪里来。"
G["I saw it first!"]="是我先看见的！"
G["I saw it with me own two eyes!  The biggest Makura ye ever seen, bigger'n a mountain giant's fist it was, clawed its way right up the side of one o' them twin colossals.  I dunno how yeh plan on gettin' up there, but the beast's sure to have a load of treasure if yeh do."]="我亲眼看见的！你这辈子所见过最巨大的Makura，比高山巨人的拳头还要大。那时它正在攀爬双塔山。我不知道你想怎么上去，但如果你成功了，一定不会空手而归。"
G["I saw my captors die horrible deaths.\n\nAnd I laughed."]="我眼看着那些绑匪死得惨不忍睹。\n\n忍不住哈哈大笑。"
G["I saw one, I know I did..."]="我看见了，我肯定看见了……"
G["I saw signs of a campfire up ahead, on the eastern side of the statue."]="我在前头看到了营火的痕迹，就在雕像的东边。"
G["I saw soldiers from Ironforge fighting a fire before.  They were heroes!"]="我之前看到过铁炉堡的士兵灭火。他们是英雄！"
G["I saw soldiers from Stormwind fighting a fire before.  They were heroes!"]="我看到暴风城来的士兵们在灭火。他们是英雄！"
G["I saw some killing children in battle. The bloodlust was upon them - I could not condone it but I could see how it could happen, but surely they will not make a ritual sacrifice out of this defenseless captive."]="我看到有人在战争中杀害孩子们。我不能容忍这种没有人性的屠杀——但我想看看到底是怎么一回事，不过我确信他们不会用这个毫无反抗能力的俘虏来作献祭典礼的。"
G["I saw someone setting one of those fire totems. It was dark, but I remember they were wearing red."]="我看见有人栽下了那种火焰图腾。那时天很黑，不过我记得他们穿着红色的衣服。"
G["I saw someone up there whose jaw fell off.  I wonder if Mordo can fix him up?"]="我看到有人吃惊得下巴都掉下来了。不知道摩尔多能不能把他的下巴放回去？"
G["I saw that move you pulled with the grapple. The boys will be hearing about that one when we get back for sure."]="我看见你那一把抓过来的动作了。等我们回去，一定要给弟兄们讲讲你的英勇事迹。"
G["I saw the Wastewander and their leader, Caliph Scorpidsting, heading south of here.  Watch out, they look like they've toughened up some!"]="我看见废土强盗和他们的领袖——卡利夫·斯科比斯汀往南边去了。多加小心，他们看起来更强大了！"
G["I saw the biggest bug you've ever seen wandering around one of those Silithid hives.  Or maybe it was both of them.  I think the heat's getting to me...do you see that sand kitten over there?"]="我见到一只你前所未见的大虫子，就在那其中一个——要不就是两个异种蝎虫巢附近徘徊。我想我快要中暑了……你看见那边那只沙猫没？"
G["I saw the same look in his eyes when he died. Terenas could hardly believe it."]="我看到的是同样的眼神。泰瑞纳斯怎么也想不到。"
G["I saw their leader. He was heading further up the wall. I'll mark it on your map."]="我看见了他们的头儿。他朝长城高处走去了。让我帮你在地图上标记出来。"
G["I saw them loading a shipment of artifacts onto the boats the other day.\n\nIt was the most gold I've ever seen in one place!"]="不久前，我看见他们向那些船上运送了一些古物。\n\n我还从没有见到过那么多黄金被堆在一起！"
G["I saw you across the way and was hoping you were going to stop by.  So what can I do for you sweetie?"]="我看到你在街对面闲逛，就满心希望你可以到这边来。那么，甜心，有什么需要我为你效劳的？"
G["I saw your fighting today. Less refined than some of the masters who enter the tournament, but certainly effective. I will watch you in the future, and learn."]="我看了你今天的战斗。跟某些前来参加比赛的大师相比，你的拳脚显得略欠章法，但显然更具实用性。我今后会关注你，并向你学习的。"
G["I saw... only darkness."]="我的眼前……只有黑暗。"
G["I say a prayer for you now, lost soul. May the Light take you gracefully."]="迷失的灵魂，我会为你念上一段祷言。愿圣光拥你入怀。"
G["I say just let the crocolisks come. They'll stop attacking eventually. Why interfere?"]="要我说让那些鳄鱼人放马过来好了。他们最终会臣服，为什么要干涉呢？"
G["I say nothing!"]="我不会说的！"
G["I say nothing! <snort>"]="¡No diré nada!<Resopla>"
G["I say we fire it. Cut the rope."]="我说，我们发射吧。割断绳子。"
G["I say we need less talking and more fighting."]="我认为我们要少说话多战斗。"
G["I say! I simply must find myself another line of work."]="我说！我必须另找一份谋生的活儿。"
G["I say! Raise a glass, my friend!\n\nTake in the sights here.\n\nThis entire region has been hidden away for ages, you know."]="听我说！朋友，举起望远镜！\n\n好好看看这里。\n\n要知道，在漫长的岁月里，这个地方一直被隐藏着。"
G["I say, it looks like I've racked up another win!"]="我说，看来我又赢了！"
G["I scouted the ruins. The blood elves are here in full force."]="我侦察了这片废墟。这里的血精灵已经是倾巢而出了。"
G["I see - and where is Uncle Gao?"]="原来是这样——那高老伯呢？"
G["I see - one of your great Alliance warriors, is it? You have chosen a lion as your crest."]="我明白了——联盟伟大将士中的一员，是吗？你们选择雄狮作为徽记。"
G["I see a break in the mist up ahead. We're getting closer!"]="前方的迷雾出现了缺口。我们就要到了！"
G["I see an opening! Here I come, Amber!"]="我看到一个缺口！我来了，安玻！"
G["I see bandages stacked in the same piles as weapons.  I see food that clearly has been left to expire in the sun, when I CLEARLY provided you with a tent for shade."]="我看到绷带像武器一样堆在一边。我看到食物就这么暴晒在太阳底下，尽管我显然已经为你们提供了用于遮阳的帐篷。"
G["I see endless suffering. I see torment. I see rage. I see everything..."]="我看到了无尽的苦难。我看到了无穷的折磨。我看见了滔天的愤怒。我……看到了一切……"
G["I see great darkness looming in the days ahead."]="我看见，未来充斥着巨大的黑暗。"
G["I see great profit possibility on the horizon. All of Bilgewater Port's assets are about to flow to me."]="我在远方看到了巨大的商机。整个锈水码头的资产都将流入我的腰包。"
G["I see it clearly now. I renounce my loyalties to House Sunstrider and its false prince."]="我现在都明白了。从现在起，我不再效忠于逐日者家族的那个背信弃义的王子。"
G["I see it, Shokia. I'll go take a look."]="我看见了，夏琪亚。我去看看。"
G["I see many threes repeating..."]="我要把你们分一下类……"
G["I see no one. Ha. Stupid trolls can't even collapse a tunnel properly."]="我什么也没看见。哈。那些愚蠢的巨魔连弄垮隧道都做不好。"
G["I see no reason to deny our trust."]="我认为，我们没有理由不信任它。"
G["I see nothing but purple before me..."]="我的眼前……只有一片紫色……"
G["I see now why your Alliance and your Horde cannot stop fighting."]="我现在明白你们联盟和部落为何总是争斗不休了。"
G["I see now... my hatred... consumed me. Tell Ban... all is... forgiven."]="我明白了……仇恨……吞噬了我。告诉班……我……原谅他了。"
G["I see one coming now! Looks like a real winner. Keep it cool, $n. Keep it cool."]="我看见有个家伙过来了！看上去像个真正的胜利者。保持冷静，$n。保持冷静。"
G["I see our city as a beacon of light, showing the way."]="我将这座城市视为一盏指路的明灯。"
G["I see our jinyu allies are prepared. How go the rest of the preparations?"]="看来锦鱼人盟友准备好了。剩下的事怎么样？"
G["I see potential in you $n. Now grab a hammer and some of those scraps, you need a lot of practice."]="$n，我已经看到了你的潜力。现在拿上锤子准备开工吧，你需要大量的练习才能提高自己的水平。"
G["I see right through your disguise, $r. Number Two! Number Two kill!"]="我识破了你的伪装，$R。人造猿二号！上！"
G["I see some interesting characters come and go here at the port. Watch yourself, $n. It's never clear who to trust, what with all of the shady activity that goes on here..."]="我看见一些有趣的人在港口进进出出。小心，$n。你永远不清楚谁值得信任以及跟这儿发生的所有事情的缘由……"
G["I see such a bright future for you, my $g boy : girl;! What shall I teach you today?"]="我预见到了你光辉的未来，我的孩子！今天我要教你些什么？"
G["I see that happening sometime between tomorrow and the next decade. Definitely."]="在明天到十年后这个阶段期间的某一天就会发生。我肯定。"
G["I see that look in your eyes. Don't think I'm ignorant to the feelings of your people. I'm just as uncomfortable having to suffer the distrusting glares of guard and citizen alike.\n\nI only stick around because of my obligation to Varian. He treats me as an equal... the way the Alliance should have treated my people.\n\nNow, if you're done gawking, the Scourge is making a mess of things in Stormwind. Why don't you go do something about it?"]="别用那种眼神打量我。我理解你们的感受。但是卫兵还有平民始终向我投来怀疑的目光，这点令我难以忍受。\n\n为了履行对瓦里安的承诺，我却打算继续留在这里。他能以平等的态度看待我……联盟也应该用这种态度对待我的族人。\n\n天灾军团正在破坏暴风城的宁静，如果你看够了的话，不如去帮帮忙？"
G["I see that my slumber was brief. I recognize Mel'jarak, lord of the skies. Once, my brother. Now, no longer."]="我的睡眠很短暂。我认出了天空之主梅尔加拉克。他曾经是我的兄弟。现在，已经不是了。"
G["I see that my slumber was brief. I recognize Ta'yak there, just in front of the palace. The Empress's champion of blades. In my time, he stood undefeated."]="我的睡眠很短暂。我认出了塔亚克，就在宫殿门前。他是女皇麾下的刀锋勇士。在我的时代，他战无不胜。"
G["I see that my slumber was brief. I recognize Un'sok down there. I see he has renamed himself Ambershaper. Ha! His skills never did surpass my own."]="我的睡眠很短暂。我认出了昂舒克。他现在管自己叫琥珀塑形者。哈！他的本事始终在我之下。"
G["I see that my slumber was brief. I recognize Zor'lok, voice of the Empress. Her obedient little pet."]="我的睡眠很短暂。我认出了佐尔洛克，女皇的传声筒。对她唯命是从的小跟班。"
G["I see that now. Our strength is yours to command, High King. May this be the first of many victories."]="我明白了。请领导我们，陛下。愿它成为一个好的开端。"
G["I see that thoughtful frown, Tahu."]="我看见你在沉思中紧皱双眉，塔胡。"
G["I see that you did it, $n. You're a credit to your race."]="我见证了你的成功，$n。你是你们一族的骄傲。"
G["I see that you have found the eye.\n\n<Master Ryson grins.>\n\nWell, give it to me!"]="你已经找到眼珠了。\n\n<指挥官雷尔松咧嘴笑着。>\n\n好吧，把它给我！"
G["I see that you hold the Doomhammer. Have all of our greatest heroes fallen, grandson?"]="我看到你拿着毁灭之锤。我们伟大的英雄们都倒下了吗，孙子？"
G["I see that you've been putting in your time around here, $c.\n\nPut in more; the demons aren't gone yet, rookie."]="我知道你耗费了不少精力来帮助我们，$c。\n\n新手，继续努力吧，歼灭所有的恶魔！"
G["I see the Dragonmaw have thrown in their lot with Garrosh."]="看来龙喉氏族把宝押在加尔鲁什身上了。"
G["I see the dragon up ahead.  She is larger than I had first anticipated."]="我看见恶龙就在前面。她比我预料得更大。"
G["I see the exit! Hurry, hurry!"]="我看到出口了！快点，快点！"
G["I see the hollow metal shell of a once great ally, and the precious gift of the Titans wasted."]="曾经的伟大盟友只剩这具空洞的金属躯壳，真是浪费泰坦的恩赐。"
G["I see the naive hope in your eyes. You... think you are my saviors? Wring that mocking pity from your hearts and focus it inwards, for you shall soon know my agony."]="我看到你们眼中天真的希望。你们……想来拯救我？丢掉那可笑的怜悯，打起精神吧，你们即将品尝我的痛苦。"
G["I see the paragon has been awakened."]="我看见英杰被唤醒了。"
G["I see the paragons have finally arrived to save the day."]="看来英杰终于前来扭转局势了。"
G["I see them now... assassins from Skettis!"]="我看到他们了……从斯克提斯来的刺客！"
G["I see them wiggling around in the water, but they aren't biting!"]="我看见它们在水里游来游去，可就是不咬线！"
G["I see those fools at the Abbey sent some fresh meat for us."]="修道院的那些傻子给我们送来了鲜肉。"
G["I see through your disguise, Lady Nightswood. YOU THINK THAT YOU CAN FOOL ME?!"]="奈丝伍德夫人，我能看穿你的伪装。你以为这点小把戏就能愚弄我吗？！"
G["I see twisted steel and smell sundered earth."]="我看到了扭曲的钢铁，碎裂的大地。"
G["I see we have a pet battler here in our training grounds.  Cloud serpents are cut out to do almost anything, including fighting other pets!  The key to finding the hatchlings is building a friendship with an adult.  Once you are exalted with the order, you will find them scattered across the arboretum."]="我在我们的训练场地看到一个宠物斗士。云端翔龙无论做什么都一样表现出色，包括与其他宠物战斗！要获得雏龙的关键在于与一只成年翔龙建立良好的关系。只要你在骑士团中的声望达到崇拜，就可以在百木园的各个角落找到它们。"
G["I see what you doing... maybe if we treat it nice it will lead us back to more big-tongues."]="我知道你想干什么……如果我们好好待它，说不定它会带我们去找更多的大舌头怪。"
G["I see what you mean, I suppose...\n\nYou know, I'm just here because I want to expand my horizons a bit, see the world and whatnot.\n\nI'm not terribly concerned with the goings on of others.\n\nNice to meet you, though."]="Creo que sé a qué te refieres...\n\nLa verdad, solo estoy aquí porque quiero expandir mis horizontes, ver mundo y esas cosas.\n\nNo me preocupan mucho los asuntos de los demás.\n\nPero me alegro de conocerte."
G["I see what you're doing. You're gonna take all the druid forms and make them into one super-form!"]="我知道你在干什么。你要结合全部德鲁伊形态，变出一个超级德鲁伊来！"
G["I see you are growing in numbers, my brethren. Tell me of your progress in implementing our master's plan."]="兄弟姐妹们，我看到你们的数量正在增长。告诉我，主人的计划实施得如何？"
G["I see you checking out our legally obtained racing rams...  I can see you want in on the ram racing sensation...  But before you can play, you gotta work.\n\nWell, work and play are pretty much the same when it comes to these rams."]="我看到你在欣赏我们合法拥有的赛羊……我能感觉到，你想要参加赛羊会……不过在你参与之前，你必须得做些事。\n\n嗯，对于这些山羊来说，工作和玩其实是一样的。"
G["I see you did it with your pants down and your hammer in your hand."]="Vi lo que hiciste con los pantalones bajados y el martillo en la mano."
G["I see you know more of the secret of steel than I do. That is good, for it is meant to be taken. Now you must travel to the jungle south of the human lands, to the goblin city of Booty Bay. There you will find a Goblin named Brikk Keencraft. I do not like Goblins but his knowledge of the secret of steel is unmatched by any I know of."]="我发现你所掌握的炼钢知识已经比我多了。这很好，本该如此。现在你必须去人类领土南部的丛林，去地精城市藏宝海湾。你将在那儿找到一个名为布里克·基克拉夫的地精。我不喜欢地精，但他所掌握的炼钢知识却是无与伦比的。"
G["I see you misplaced that chapter you worked so hard to put together, $n. Well, you left it right here!"]="我看到你将辛辛苦苦拼好的篇章随意乱放，$n。嗯，就放在那儿！"
G["I see you there! Yes, you! Come here. I'm going to bury you!"]="嗨，你！是的，就是你！到这里来。我要把你活埋！"
G["I see you too are gathering souls for your own ends. Are we really so different, 'champion'?"]="我看到你也在收集着灵魂，就像我一样。我们真的不同吗，勇士？"
G["I see you too are gathering souls for your own ends. Are we really so different, champion?"]="我看到你也在收集着灵魂，就像我一样。我们真的不同吗，勇士？"
G["I see you were able to get some help."]="看来你确实可以找来援助。"
G["I see you!"]="我看见你了！"
G["I see you're a battle pet trainer, $r. How about you test your skills against the might of a Grimtotem?"]="Veo que eres $gun entrenador:una entrenadora; de mascotas, $r. ¿Qué te parece poner a prueba tus habilidades contra el poder de una Tótem Siniestro?"
G["I see you're fishing... again.  Are you doing better than yesterday?"]="我见你又在钓鱼了……运气有没有比昨天好一点？"
G["I see you're here to admire my serpent. Oh, and Agara is quite impressive too."]="你是来欣赏我的翔龙的吧。噢，它给阿加拉也留下了深刻的印象。"
G["I see you've arrived. \n\nThis is the eve of the sundering, when the collapse of the Well of Eternity fractured the continents of the world.\n\nHere, we will snatch up the Dragon Soul before it is lost to the mists of time.\n\nBut first, you must bring down the protective wards of Azshara's lackeys. You will find them within the palace. I will scout on ahead.\n\nGood luck, heroes!"]="Veo que habéis llegado.\n\nEstamos en la víspera del Cataclismo, cuando el derrumbe del Pozo de la Eternidad fracturó los continentes del mundo.\n\nAquí, recuperaremos el Alma de dragón antes de que se pierda en la noche de los tiempos.\n\nPero primero, debéis eliminar los resguardos protectores de los lacayos de Azshara. Los encontraréis en el palacio. Me adelantaré para explorar.\n\n¡Buena suerte, héroes!"
G["I see you've arrived. This is the eve of the sundering, when the collapse of the Well of Eternity fractured the continents of the world."]="啊，你们到了。现在是大分裂的前夕，永恒之井即将毁灭，撕裂整个大陆。"
G["I see you've brought your pets."]="哟，你连宠物也带来啦。"
G["I see you, fool!"]="我看见你了，蠢货！"
G["I see you, insect! Come closer."]="我看见你了，蝼蚁！过来吧。"
G["I see you, land-walker. Come to me... we shall parlay."]="你好，陆行者。过来……我们聊聊。"
G["I see you, little one. Come over here, I wish to speak with you."]="我看见你了，小家伙。到这儿来，我要和你谈谈。"
G["I see you, too, have braved the perils of Kota Peak. You have proven yourself worthy to do battle with me."]="Veo que tú también has superado los peligros de la Cumbre Kota. Has demostrado ser $gdigno:digna; de enfrentarte a mí en combate."
G["I see you."]="我看见你了。"
G["I see you. Why don'tcha come on up and we settle this Drakkari to maggot."]="我看到你了。过来啊，让我们干掉这只达卡莱巨魔。"
G["I see you..."]="我看到你了……"
G["I see your Way of the White Tiger, Jade Serpent, Monkey Crane technique is as good as mine."]="我发现你驾驭白虎、青龙、灵猴和朱鹤的战技的能力不在我之下。"
G["I see your ancestors, Anchorite!  They writhe and scream in the darkness... they are with us!"]="我看到了你的祖先，学者！他们在黑暗中翻滚着，尖叫着……他们和我们在一起！"
G["I see, I see."]="我知道了，知道了。"
G["I see."]="我明白了。"
G["I see.  Then I will do the same."]="我明白了。那么我也会这么做。"
G["I see.  Well then, let's get to work, $n!  The Dark Lady needs us, right?"]="我明白了。那好，我们开始吧，$n！黑暗女王需要我们，对吗？"
G["I see.  Well, do the best you can.  And Neeralak, why are you all black and smoky?"]="我明白了。那你尽力吧。尼纳拉克，你怎么像刚从烤炉里跑出来一样？"
G["I see. Can I at least get mine serviced? He won't even take a rider."]="我知道了。那我至少能让我的牦牛干活吧？它连个人都背不动。"
G["I see. I'd hoped that we could wait out this invasion, but if the authorities want us to leave, we will leave."]="我明白了。我本来觉得我们可以挺过这场入侵的，但如果上面想让我们离开的话，那我们就离开。"
G["I see. Much has transpired since I first entered my long sleep."]="我明白。自从我开始长眠，已经发生了翻天覆地的变化。"
G["I see. So it was this... sha... that caused such violent behavior in our troops?"]="我明白了。所以是这些……煞魔……引发了我们部队中的暴力行为？"
G["I see. Thank you for informing me personally, Battlemaiden."]="我明白了。多谢你亲自赶来通知我，女武士。"
G["I see. This sha energy has trapped their spirits here, to endlessly relive their failure. It feeds on their despair."]="我明白了。煞魔禁锢了他们的灵魂，汲取由他们的失败而产生的绝望。"
G["I see. You are more formidable than I had thought."]="我明白了。你我想象中要强大得多。"
G["I see... Only darkness."]="我的眼前……只有黑暗。"
G["I see... involved in some shady business, $r? Oh no need to worry - the confidentiality of all transactions is assured.\n\nThis ring you have is a superb piece of work. We can begin the charging process... for a modest fee. Charging the ring will take roughly one half of your world's cycles to complete. In other words, twelve hours.\n\nShall we say 10,000 gold? That's fair."]="我明白了……这东西见不得光，对吧，$r？噢，不用担心——我们保证对一切交易保密。\n\n你这只解码环是一个杰作。我们可以开始充能了……收费绝对低廉。按照你们那个世界的计算方法，充能大概需要半天时间。换言之，也就是十二个小时。\n\n一万个金币怎么样？这个价钱很公道了。"
G["I see... something. It's very faint, though."]="我看到……一些东西，但是非常弱。"
G["I see... this is the path I must take.  Meet up with me back in the cave, heroes."]="我明白了……这是我必须选择的道路。回到洞里找我，英雄们。"
G["I see... your eyes never leave the target. Total focus!"]="我知道了……视线锁定目标。全神贯注！"
G["I see...she's using him to manipulate them all.."]="我明白了……她在利用他操纵他们所有人……"
G["I seek a $g hero : heroine; of the utmost skill.  $G He : She; will gather others to save the Bloodmaul clan, and all of the ogres of these mountains from the tyranny of our gronn oppressors.\n\nReturn to me when you have learned all that you can.  But, $c, keep quiet about this until that time lest the gronn get wind of our underground movement."]="Busco un $g héroe : heroína; de gran habilidad. $G Él : Ella; reunirá a los demás para salvar al Clan Machacasangre y a todos los ogros de estas montañas de la tiranía de nuestros opresores gronn.\n\nVuelve a mí cuando hayas averiguado todo lo que puedas. Pero, $c, mantén esto en secreto hasta que llegue el momento o los gronn se enterarán de nuestro movimiento clandestino."
G["I seek a sample of your restorative draught, apothecary."]="我想要一份你的疗伤药膏的样本，药剂师。"
G["I seek further druidic training to have a closer understanding of the Earth Mother's will."]="我想接受更多的德鲁伊训练，更好地理解大地之母的意愿。"
G["I seek further training in the old ways of the druids."]="我想接受更多关于古老的德鲁伊之道的训练。"
G["I seek further training."]="我在寻求进一步的训练。"
G["I seek more than anything to help young pandaren explore their potential within these grounds. True mastery comes with much time and much practice, but there is value even in finding the first beginnings of a fitting path."]="我主要是帮助年轻的熊猫人在这些方面发掘他们的潜力。虽然真正掌握技巧需要大量的时间和练习，但首先寻找到一种合适的方法也十分重要。"
G["I seek more training in the priestly ways."]="我想接受更多的牧师训练。"
G["I seek other veterans of the campaign here in Northrend. We are urgently needed to face new foes at home."]="我正在诺森德寻找其他久经战阵的老兵。我们迫切需要强大的战士去击退出现在家乡的新敌人。"
G["I seek to understand the importance of strength of the body."]="我想了解躯体力量的重要性。"
G["I seek to understand the importance of strength of the heart."]="我想了解心灵力量的重要性。"
G["I seek training as a Blacksmith."]="我想学习锻造技术。"
G["I seek training as a druid."]="我想接受德鲁伊技能方面的训练。"
G["I seek training in Fishing."]="我想接受钓鱼训练。"
G["I seek training in Pandaren cooking."]="我想要学习熊猫人烹饪之法。"
G["I seek training in the Way of the Brew."]="我想要学习酿造之道。"
G["I seek training in the Way of the Grill."]="我想要学习烧烤之道。"
G["I seek training in the Way of the Oven."]="我想要学习烘焙之道。"
G["I seek training in the Way of the Pot."]="我想要学习炖煮之道。"
G["I seek training in the Way of the Steamer."]="我想要学习蒸烧之道。"
G["I seek training in the Way of the Wok."]="我想要学习烹炒之道。"
G["I seek training in the ways of the Hunter."]="我想接受猎人技能方面的训练。"
G["I seek training to ride a steed."]="我想接受骑术训练。"
G["I seek training, Amal'thazad."]="阿曼萨加德，我想接受训练。"
G["I seek training, Lady Alistra."]="奥莉丝塔夫人，我想接受训练。"
G["I seek training, Lord Thorval."]="索瓦尔勋爵，我想接受训练。"
G["I seek training."]="我想接受训练。"
G["I seek wisdom through meditation."]="我通过冥想寻求智慧。"
G["I seem to be having a... floating problem."]="我看来遇到了……漂浮的麻烦。"
G["I seem to be... stuck..."]="我好像……卡住了……"
G["I seem to have lost my Blackened Urn."]="我好像把黑色骨灰弄丢了。"
G["I seem to have lost the Augmented Arcane Prison. Did I leave it here with you?"]="我好像弄丢了强化奥术牢笼。在你这儿吗？"
G["I seem to have misplaced Dog's Whistle."]="我好像把狗哨放错地方了。"
G["I seem to have misplaced my Ashtongue Cowl."]="我好像弄丢了灰舌兜帽。"
G["I seem to have misplaced my Zandalar Madap's Bracers. Can you help?"]="我似乎不小心弄丢了我的赞达拉狂妄者护腕。你能帮忙吗？"
G["I seem to have misplaced my key."]="我好像弄丢了我的钥匙。"
G["I seem to have misplaced my ring."]="我好像弄丢了我的指环。"
G["I seem to have misplaced my sea pup, admiral. Do you have another that you could lend to me?"]="我忘记把sea pup放哪儿了，长官。你还能再借我一个吗？"
G["I seem to have misplaced the Horn of the Peaks."]="我把峭壁号角弄丢了。"
G["I seem to have misplaced the distiller, Mux.  Did I happen to leave it here?"]="我似乎将提纯器弄丢了，穆克斯。我是不是把它放这儿了？"
G["I seem to have misplaced the remote control fireworks."]="我似乎把远程遥控焰火放错地方了。"
G["I seem to have misplaced your Shredder Control Device... might you have another?"]="我好像弄丢了你的伐木机控制器……还有吗？"
G["I seem to have... misplaced my wisp. Are there any others available?"]="我好像……把小精灵给弄丢了。能再给我一个吗？"
G["I seem to recall there is an engineer in the chamber of masters, to the left as you enter the main building.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="我依稀记得在师匠大厅内有一名工程师，就位于你进入主建筑物时的左侧。\n\n我会在你的地图上标记这个位置。"
G["I seem to recall there is an engineer in the crafter's hall, to the left as you enter the main building.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="我依稀记得在工匠大厅内有一名工程师，就位于你进入主建筑物时的左侧。\n\n我会在你的地图上标记这个位置。"
G["I sell bread from all over, but none compares to the bread of Dunshire. Crispy, aromatic, and freshly baked..."]="Vendo pan de todas partes, pero ninguno se compara con el pan de Dunshire. Crocante, aromático y recién horneado..."
G["I sell only the best gear, tested and true. And the prices are set, so if you want to haggle then go find a Goblin."]="我这里只卖最好的东西，而且绝无二价。你想要讨价还价的话，就去找个地精商人。"
G["I sell only the finest arcane gear, made by the crafters and mages here in the city of Stormwind."]="我这里卖的可都是由暴风城最好的工匠和法师制作东西，世上最好的魔法装备！"
G["I sell the finest cloth and leather garb this side of the valley!"]="我出售山谷这一边最好的布料和皮革服饰！"
G["I sell wares that crafters need. Just the basics, nothing fancy."]="我出售工匠们需要的物品。不过只是些基础物品，没什么特别的。"
G["I send you to your deity."]="我送你去见你的神明。"
G["I sense a disturbance, lurking around you..."]="我感觉一场动乱潜伏在你周围……"
G["I sense a great disturbance in the balance approaching. The chaos of it burns my mind!"]="一股破坏平衡的力量正在接近。它的混乱灼烧着我的心智！"
G["I sense a great power among us, Commander. Is the spell ready?"]="指挥官，我感觉我们中蕴藏着一股强大的力量。准备好魔法了吗？"
G["I sense a vast power has grown within you, young Thrall. You've achieved much, since last we met."]="我能感到你体内的巨大力量，年轻的萨尔。这些年你成长了不少。"
G["I sense danger deep within the grove..."]="我感到树林中隐藏着极大的危险……"
G["I sense danger up ahead."]="我感到前方有危险。"
G["I sense danger...it is a trap...carefully laid for us at this crucial moment."]="我感到了危险。这是个陷阱……在这个险恶的时刻，我们被算计了。"
G["I sense desperation in them."]="我感觉到了绝望。"
G["I sense doom in your future, $n."]="我感受到了你将面临的毁灭，$n。"
G["I sense evil brewing. . . ."]="我感到邪恶的力量正在滋生……"
G["I sense great darkness emanating from this... thing. Destroy it, now!"]="我能感到这个……东西散发着强大的黑暗力量。消灭它，马上！"
G["I sense one amongst us that does not belong!"]="我感觉到我们中间有一个外人！"
G["I sense something larger is coming, and we will need the strength of Malorne if we are to survive."]="我感到有些大家伙正在靠近。如果我们想活下去，就需要玛洛恩的力量。"
G["I sense that the great beast draws near..."]="我感到那头巨大的野兽正在逼近……"
G["I sense the living. Be ready."]="活人的气息。准备战斗。"
G["I sense the taint of corruption upon this $n. Help me destroy it!"]="我感觉$n散发着堕落的气息。帮我毁掉它！"
G["I sense the taint of this land in you, footman.  Report to the Bishop before the start of your next shift."]="步兵，我能闻到你身上的土臭味儿。换班之前，向主教报到吧。"
G["I sense the tortured spirits, $n. They are this way. Come quickly!"]="是痛苦的灵魂，我察觉到了。$n。他们在这里，快点过来！"
G["I sense uncertainty in you, and I do not trust it whether you are with them, or not. If you wish my augury for the Kalu'ak, you will have to prove yourself first."]="你是卡鲁亚克氏族的朋友？我对此持保留意见。如果你想让我为他们占卜的话，就先证明自己的忠诚吧。"
G["I sense you've cleared the path to my brethren.  My connection to them and to the temple is still strong.  Do you wish to delve deeper inside?"]="你已经清除了前路的障碍，离我的同胞又近了一步。我与他们之间，与这座神殿之间仍然有着强烈的羁绊。你愿意继续深入神殿吗？"
G["I sense... courage. Willpower. Light. Hmph. That will not do."]="我感觉到了……勇气。意志。光明。嗯。那可不行。"
G["I sensed a commotion in the village's eastern island."]="我感到村子东部起了骚乱。"
G["I sensed a part of him still alive! Trapped... struggling... Oh, Arthas!"]="我还能感觉到他！饱受摧残……苦苦挣扎……啊，阿尔萨斯！"
G["I sensed as much, Malfurion. Dark days loom ahead."]="玛法里奥，我跟你有相同的感觉。黑暗的岁月即将降临。"
G["I sent Assistant Kieu to the silos to collect a sack of grain but she still hasn't come back. Could you go check on her for me? You can find the silos on the western edge of town."]="我派助手琪舞去贮粮塔取回一袋粮食，可她还没有回来。你可以去帮我查查她怎么了吗？你可以在小镇的西侧找到贮粮塔。"
G["I sent Ranger Salissa south to the enclave and Ranger Lethvalin west to Tranquillien more than a day ago! Have you seen either of them? Are you the aid that's been sent back?"]="我在几天前派了游侠萨尔莉莎去南面的营地，派游侠莱瑟瓦林去了西面的塔奎林！你遇到过他们两个吗？你是不是他们派回来的援兵？"
G["I sent my pet out to get me shome more to drink.  You'll be shorry when he shows up with a wagon full of Mudder's Milk and you don't get any."]="我派我的宠物去找些酒回来。等它带回来一马车赛马酒，而你什么也得不到的时候，你就知道后悔了。"
G["I sent you into Stonetalon Mountains with an army.  Your orders were to secure this land for the Horde."]="我派你带一支军队来到石爪山。你的使命是为了部落守住这块土地。"
G["I sentence you to death!"]="我宣判你死刑！"
G["I serve a new master now, mortals!"]="凡人们，我现在侍奉新的主人！"
G["I serve his majesty, the last of his kind.\n\nIf you have a problem with me, take it up with the Prince."]="我为那位大人效力，他是该族最后的血脉。\n\n如果你对我有意见，就去向王子殿下诉说吧。"
G["I serve my father and respect his plan... but I also serve my own sense of justice.  I have seen enough treachery from my Blackrock brothers to fill a thousand books.  And now they plan to invade Redridge, for no reason other than blind territorialism.\n\nThe treachery stops here.  It's time for the final chapter.  And it's not going to be a happy ending."]="我忠于我的父亲，尊敬他的计划……但我也忠于我心中的正义。我的黑石兄弟们制造的阴谋和欺诈，即使用一千本书也写不完。现在，他们又要入侵赤脊山，只为了满足他们盲目的扩张主义心理。\n\n我不会让他们的阴谋继续下去。这个邪恶的故事将写完它的最后一章，并得到一个绝不会让他们满意的结局。"
G["I serve only Sargeras! You shall join him too someday, mortal..."]="我只为萨格拉斯效劳！总有一天你也会臣服在他的权威之下，凡人……"
G["I serve only the Klaxxi'va."]="我只为卡拉克西瓦效力。"
G["I serve only the master now."]="我现在只效忠于主人。"
G["I serve the Dark Lady!"]="我为黑暗女王效命！"
G["I serve the fire gods!"]="誓死效忠火焰之神！"
G["I serve to the last!"]="我战斗到了最后一刻！"
G["I serve with pride."]="我很荣幸。"
G["I serve you...Fire Lord."]="为您效劳……炎魔之王。"
G["I served Shek'zeer for a time, you know. Before I was preserved. Her madness is nothing so rational as ambition."]="你知道，我曾经为夏柯希尔效力过一段时间。那是在我被封印之前的事情了。她的疯狂和野心一样毫无理性可言。"
G["I service the five Argent towers.  Mostly repairs and maintenance, and some minor magical work."]="我负责照看五座银色塔楼。主要就是修理和维护之类的，有时还涉及一些简单的魔法工作。"
G["I set up a trap."]="我设了个陷阱。"
G["I shall add another year to your enslavement for your failure!"]="你可耻地败了！我要延长你一年的奴役期限！"
G["I shall always be in your debt, friend."]="朋友，你们的恩情没齿难忘。"
G["I shall be rewarded!"]="我会得到奖赏的！"
G["I shall breathe fire!"]="看，我会喷火！"
G["I shall call upon the chilling mountain winds to protect us from Ragnaros' flame. Malfurion and Hamuul will shatter the Firelord's defenses, allowing us to force him back."]="我会召唤冰冷的山风来保护我们，抵挡拉格纳罗斯的烈焰。玛法里奥和哈缪尔会打碎炎魔之王的防护，助我们击退他。"
G["I shall cling to the love of my daughter and hope that I will find forgiveness under the Light for my sins."]="我希望能得到我女儿的爱，也希望我犯下的罪恶能够得到宽恕。"
G["I shall consume you!"]="我要吃了你！"
G["I shall consume your lifeblood in the name of the master!!"]="我将以主人的名义，吞噬你的生命！"
G["I shall consume, decimate, devastate, and destroy! Yield now to the wrath of the pounding sea!"]="我要吞噬，要屠戮，要毁灭，要破坏！在澎湃的大海面前屈服吧！"
G["I shall draw your soul into the mist!"]="我要将你的灵魂卷入迷雾！"
G["I shall end your life and bind you to his service!"]="我会终结你的生命，让你陷入堕落的深渊！"
G["I shall enjoy the smell of the grease from your marrow crackling over the fire!"]="我要把你从表皮到骨髓都完全烤熟，我一定会很喜欢那滋味！"
G["I shall enjoy this, $c."]="我会满意的，$c。"
G["I shall feast upon your soul!"]="我要吞噬你的灵魂！"
G["I shall find you mortals!  You shall pay for destroying the Ash'ari Crystals!"]="我一定会抓到你的，凡人！你们会为破坏阿莎利水晶而付出代价！"
G["I shall get started right away, $n."]="我马上就出发，$n。"
G["I shall hurl your corpse into the pit with the others!"]="¡Te arrojaré el cadáver al pozo junto con los demás!"
G["I shall kill you myself!"]="我要亲手杀了你！"
G["I shall leave this image on display for your perusal. Study your opponents' strengths, for a creature's strength can also be its weakness."]="这尊影像就留给你们观察吧。仔细研究对手的能力，他的优势很可能也是致命的弱点。"
G["I shall not be stopped!"]="谁也别想阻止我！"
G["I shall not fail the Lich King. Come and meet your end!"]="我不会让巫妖王失望的。准备受死吧！"
G["I shall not fail, Gorka!"]="我不会失败的，戈尔卡！"
G["I shall not suffer the same fate as Vaurajo! Die!"]="我不会落得与沃拉琼相同的结局！死吧！"
G["I shall now begin the robe..."]="我现在就开始制作长袍……"
G["I shall return in time.."]="我会准时回来的……"
G["I shall rip your guts out!"]="我要把你打得稀巴烂！"
G["I shall scour the earth for this Earthshaper. What of the essence?"]="我得去找找那个什么塑地者。是什么精华？"
G["I shall see to it, sir."]="我会确保一切正常的，大人。"
G["I shall send your soul into the infinite void!"]="我要把你的灵魂送入无尽的虚空！"
G["I shall show you TRUE strength!"]="我会展示真正的力量！"
G["I shall show you a true cataclysm."]="我会让你们看看真正的大灾变。"
G["I shall spill your blood, $C!"]="我会放干你的血，$c！"
G["I shall take great pleasure in taking this poor wretch's life!  It's not too late, she needn't suffer in vain.  Turn back and her death shall be merciful!"]="能让我亲手结果这个可怜虫，我非常高兴的。还不算太晚，她不必无谓地吃苦头。转过头去吧，我会仁慈地结束她的生命！"
G["I shall take my secrets to the grave with me!"]="我会把我的秘密带进坟墓！"
G["I shall teach you the meaning of strength."]="我要教会你们力量的意义。"
G["I shall tear this world apart!"]="我要将这世界撕成碎片！"
G["I shall tear this world apart."]="我要将这世界撕成碎片。"
G["I shall transform my familiar, Sagan, into something truly wondrous!"]="我会把我的朋友，萨根，变成某种令人吃惊的东西！"
G["I shall unleash the cavalry upon your command, sir!"]="听您的命令调遣骑兵，先生！"
G["I shall use the time wisely, milord. Thank you."]="阁下，我会善用时间的。谢谢您。"
G["I shall wear your entrails as a necklace."]="我会将你的内脏当作项链的。"
G["I shall."]="我会的。"
G["I shiver with power! I am the lone locust of the apocalypse!"]="我因力量而战栗！我是天启的孤单破坏者！"
G["I should be able to get back to camp on my own."]="我应该能自己回营地了。"
G["I should be able to get out here now. Thanks!"]="现在我应该可以从这里出来了，谢谢！"
G["I should be able to make my way back. Thank you, friend."]="我可以自己回去。谢谢你，朋友。"
G["I should be able to pick up the trail with this.  Let's hope it was the killer that dragged it here."]="我应该能追踪这些痕迹。希望是那个杀手留下的。"
G["I should be dead and to death I will return!"]="我应该是死了，就算是死了，我也会回来！"
G["I should be down there working on the flying machines, not in charge of guano collection!"]="我本该留在那里鼓捣飞行器的，却被派到这里来收集蝙蝠粪便！"
G["I should be grateful... but I long ago lost the capacity...."]="我本该感谢你们的……但我已经没有那个资格了……"
G["I should be in Utgarde Keep, battling at Ingvar's side! Instead I am charged to guard little maggots like you."]="我本应该呆在乌特加德城堡，与因格瓦尔并肩作战的！现在却被派来对付你这样的废物。"
G["I should be the one learning the secrets of the Old Gods!  I'll show you!"]="我才应该是了解上古诸神秘密的那个人！我会让你看看！"
G["I should begin training immediately."]="我得立刻开始训练了。"
G["I should find some hired help; I don't like sitting here all day selling fish supplies. I'd much rather go fishing, and then sell supplies."]="我应该寻求某些帮助；我不喜欢整天坐在这儿卖鱼。我更愿意去钓鱼，然后再卖掉。"
G["I should get back before Rema starts to worry..."]="我得在雷玛开始担心之前回去……"
G["I should get going back to the Crimson Veil.  See you there."]="我应该返回红雾号了。到那儿再见。"
G["I should go now. Be careful!"]="我得走了。小心！"
G["I should have a few extra coins from this sale.  Maybe I'll buy myself some lunch..."]="卖完这些东西我也就能稍微挣点钱了，中午吃什么呢……"
G["I should have brought a cart with me. There's money to be made here!"]="我真该带一辆餐车来的。在这里绝对能赚大钱！"
G["I should have known about the Pools of Youth. I had visions before the trip but I was blinded by the dream of perpetual youth."]="我应该知道青春之池的。在这趟旅途开始之前，我就预见到了，可我却被追求青春永驻的梦想蒙住了双眼。"
G["I should have known better than to have given Silanna that tome of cantrips."]="我根本不应该把那本法术书送给西尔兰娜。"
G["I should have known better than to rely on something so stupidly named to entertain me for long."]="我早该知道，名字这么蠢的东西多半娱乐不了多久。"
G["I should have known you would not come alone Kor'ik."]="我早该知道你不会一个人来的，科尔里克。"
G["I should have known! The Twilight's Hammer knew we'd be here! Defend yourself!"]="我就知道！暮光之锤知道我们会来这里！保护你自己！"
G["I should have taken the risk and sent the order to attack."]="我应该冒一次险，让部队出击的。"
G["I should have taken the translucent pill."]="我该服下那透明小药丸的。"
G["I should have won. I was stronger. Wiser. I would have won against him!"]="赢的人应该是我。我更强壮，也更聪明。我本来是可以赢过他的！"
G["I should have... predicted... this..."]="我应该……预见到……的……"
G["I should keep you around."]="我应该留住你的。"
G["I should kill you where you stand, $r!\n\nGet on with your inane prattling and then begone!"]="我很可能会在眨眼之间把你劈成两半，$r！\n\n如果你说完了废话，最好趁早滚开！"
G["I should leave you to rot in this sewer with the filth."]="我真应该让你烂死在这个下水道里。"
G["I should like to find out! Perhaps it is related to the mists? Or the power that was unleashed in the sundering ten thousand years ago? We must investigate!"]="我会找到这个答案！究竟是因为迷雾？还是一万年前的大分裂所释放出的能量？我们必须好好调查！"
G["I should mention I reversed the gearbox to accommodate the smaller form-factor."]="我应该说一下。我翻转了变速箱，以适应变小的整体外形。"
G["I should never have left Tanaris."]="我根本就不应该离开塔纳利斯。"
G["I should not... have held back..."]="我不该……犹……犹豫的……"
G["I should really be going. All this killing reminded me I still have some fresh corpses that aren't sewn to one another."]="我必须走了。这些杀戮让我想起来还有很多尸体没缝好。"
G["I should really try to burst into flames less often."]="我实在是不应该那么频繁地喷出火团来。"
G["I should res right now."]="我应该现在就复活。"
G["I should start chargin' people to be in my presence."]="我一定能够惊艳全场。"
G["I should take the tram to Ironforge and visit Greatfather Winter."]="我应该坐地铁去铁炉堡看看冬天爷爷。"
G["I should talk to Dewey about some sort of notation system to keep these books better organized."]="我该告诉杜威关于符号系统的一些知识，让他更好地摆放这些书。"
G["I should tear you apart, Alliance scum! I will restrain myself this once."]="我真该把你撕成碎片，联盟的人渣！这次我就饶你一命。"
G["I should tear you apart, Horde scum! I will restrain myself this once."]="我真该把你撕成碎片，部落的人渣！这次我就饶你一命。"
G["I should very much like to see this island for myself. Perhaps I will see you there?"]="我很想亲眼看看这座岛。或许我们还会在那里相见？"
G["I should've broken those damn tablets the day you brought them to me, $n, but I didn't. We might still have our king's wisdom to guide us through these perilous times."]="当时你把石板带来给我，我就该把它们摔碎的，$n，可我没有。在此危难的时刻，我们仍需要国王的智慧来指引我们。"
G["I should've grabbed a bigger sword."]="我应该抢一柄大一些的剑。"
G["I should've known you were behind this, Two-Tusk. Have at it, traitor!"]="我应该知道这一切都是你在搞鬼，双齿。接受惩罚吧，叛徒！"
G["I shoulda just stayed on Kezan and taken my chances with the volcano."]="我真该留在科赞，宁可伴着火山灰度日。"
G["I shoulda known not to be trustin' nobody!"]="我就知道任何人都不能相信！"
G["I shouldn't be alive, $r.\n\nI should have died with the rest of my brothers."]="我就不该苟活下来，$r。\n\n我应该和其他兄弟们死在一起。"
G["I shouldn't even be telling you this but if you can make it past all the critters and beasties in Badlands, you might be able to make it to Searing Gorge.\n\nYes, the Badlands. There's some type of back road the orcs paved near Kargath. Just goes to show you what kind of fools we're dealing with here! A backdoor to hell? What were they thinking?"]="我原本不想告诉你的：如果你能够穿过荒芜之地的话，那么你也许可以找到通往灼热峡谷的另外一条路。\n\n没错，我说的是荒芜之地。在卡加斯营地那里，兽人铺了一条通向灼热峡谷的小路。你说说他们有多蠢吧！那帮家伙居然造了一条通向地狱的道路？他们到底在想什么啊？"
G["I shouldn't have expected these filthy trolls to stay peaceful forever. There's no place for trust with any sympathizers of the Horde."]="我不应该期待这些肮脏的巨魔永远地安于和平。同情部落者绝不能信任。"
G["I shouldn't have to submit to this."]="我真没有必要这么听话。"
G["I show you how smart I am, boss!  You be extra smart with mighty magic mojo now!\n\nUm... maybe Slip'kik use magic on self. Dat would be good idea..."]="¡Yo enseñarte lo listo que soy, $gjefe:jefa;! ¡Tú ser extra inteligente con poderoso mojo mágico ahora!\n\nMmm... Quizás Slip'kik usar magia consigo mismo. Sería una buena idea..."
G["I show you on your map where grummles are now. Find them or wait here for next wave of grummles."]="我在地图上给你指出土地精现在在哪里。要么去找他们，要么就待在这里等下一拨土地精。"
G["I show you strength... in numbers."]="现在，让我来告诉你们什么叫……数量优势。"
G["I shpilled me drink!"]="我的酒洒啦！"
G["I shudder at the thought. An ancient evil. An enemy of Pandaria. I will not speak their name."]="这念头令我不寒而栗。一群远古的邪魔。一群潘达利亚的宿敌。我无法说出他们的名字。"
G["I sincerely hope our paths cross again."]="真心希望我们能再次相见。"
G["I sincerely hope that one was our last!"]="我希望那是最后一个！"
G["I sit here by the falls, cuz I'd rather be alone."]="我坐在这瀑布边，只因我宁愿孤独。"
G["I slay the man on the spot as my liege would expect me to do, as he is nothing more than a thief and a liar."]="我按照命令把他杀掉，反正他不过是个小偷和骗子而已。"
G["I smash your mushrooms!"]="打烂你的蘑菇！"
G["I smell a $R"]="我闻到了$R的气味"
G["I smell a $R."]="我闻到了一个$R的气味……"
G["I smell an intruder..."]="我闻到了入侵者的味道……"
G["I smell intruders. They are near.\n\n<The seadragon eyes you suspiciously.>"]="我闻到了入侵者的味道。他们就在附近。\n\n<海龙战士狐疑地看着你。>"
G["I smell its fear..."]="你竟然混进了黑锋要塞，十字军！"
G["I smell my luckydo! Oh please bring to me."]="我闻到了我的幸运符！噢，拜托你把它带给我。"
G["I smell rogue."]="我感觉有盗贼在附近。"
G["I smell something... Poop."]="我闻到一股……臭味。"
G["I smell something...."]="我闻到了什么味道……"
G["I smell the stench of Klaxxi disobedience! Stop running and face the Lord of Blades!"]="我闻到了卡拉克西大逆不道的臭味！站住，面对刀锋领主吧！"
G["I smell through your disguise, stranger. You are bold to come to such a sacred ritual.\n\nWhat do you intend here? Will you eat the flesh of Kroshik?"]="Huelo más allá de tu disfraz, $gforastero:forastera;. Tienes agallas para venir a un ritual tan sagrado.\n\n¿Qué pretendes? ¿Comerás la carne de Kroshik?"
G["I smell you, outsider. I know you are not one of us.\n\nWhy do you sneak into our village? Why do you wear the skin of our people? I do not understand."]="Puedo olerte, $gforastero:forastera;. Sé que no eres uno de los nuestros.\n\n¿Por qué te cuelas en nuestra aldea? ¿Por qué llevas la piel de nuestro pueblo? No lo entiendo."
G["I smell you, strangers. Don't be delayin' your fate. Come to me now. I make your sacrifice quick."]="闻到你们的气味了，陌生人。别再逃避命运了。过来吧，我很快会把你们献祭给灵魂。"
G["I smell... $r.  Delicious!"]="我闻到了……$r的气味。好鲜美！"
G["I softened you up. My cousins will finish you off!"]="我耗光你的力气。我的兄弟们会干掉你的！"
G["I sought only to finish... the work of the Gods..."]="我只想完成……诸神的任务……"
G["I spare your insignificant life as a reward for this amusing betrayal. There may yet be a shred of potential in you."]="出演了一次如此令人愉悦的背叛，你那卑微的生命，我就留给你作为奖赏吧。或许你身上还大有潜力呢。"
G["I speak, and the oceans tremble. Fear me, enemies of Hellscream."]="只要我一开口，整个海洋都将颤栗。恐惧吧，地狱咆哮之敌。"
G["I specialize in two things: taking tiny things and making them blow up into huge things, and making huge things fit into itty-bitty places.\n\nWhich one do you need today?"]="我主要研究两方面的问题：让微小的突然膨胀成巨大的；将巨大的放入微小的空间。\n\n今天你的需要又是什么？"
G["I spend all day retrieving parts for the zeppelin and Frezza doesn't even have the decency to pay me an hourly wage. But you're not here about that, are you? I bet you want to know where the zeppelin is located. Well, you're in luck - I have my zeppelin tracking device right here!"]="我整天都在收集飞艇零件。就这样，弗雷萨还不肯给我加点薪水。至于你，你肯定不是来跟我抢工作的，对吧？我猜你想知道飞艇现在的位置在哪。总之，你运气不错，我这里就有个飞艇追踪装置了！"
G["I spend half my time in the libraries and the other half caring for the hatchlings."]="我一半的时间花在这座图书馆上，另一半的时间则花在照顾这些雏龙身上了。"
G["I spent a very long time in Northrend, Krom'gar. I learned much about the Horde in that time."]="我在诺森德奋战了很长一段日子，克罗姆加。在那儿我学到了很多有关部落的东西。"
G["I spent most of your money on getting a decent massage, goodness knows you could never do it right!"]="我把你大部分的钱都花在按摩上了，天晓得你为什么总是做不好！"
G["I spent my life on that wall, $n. I gave up everything I had to become Shado-Pan, to prevent something like this from happening.\n\nI have failed."]="我在那城墙上花费了一生的心血，$n。我放弃所有的一切成为影踪派弟子，只为阻止像这样的事情发生。\n\n我失败了。"
G["I spent my whole life caring for these trees. Pruning and nurturing them... only fitting that they have joined me in death."]="我耗尽毕生心血去照看这些树木，修剪它们，养育它们……能让它们给我陪葬也不错。"
G["I spent so long trying to find a way to extend my life that I forgot to live it."]="我花费了好长时间，设法充实我的人生，以至于忘记了要活在当下。"
G["I spit on the corpse of these filthy naga."]="这些丑恶的纳迦真是一无是处。"
G["I spit on you!"]="我诅咒你！"
G["I spit on you, Kargath.  The true Horde will crush you!"]="我唾弃你，卡加斯。真正的部落会消灭你的！"
G["I spit on you, surface filth!"]="我唾弃你们，地表的渣滓！"
G["I spoke too quickly, $n.  Even with your support, things are looking grim for our forces out there."]="我有些言之过早了，$n。虽然有你的支援，但我们的部队似乎还是陷入了困境。"
G["I squish you!"]="我要压扁你！"
G["I sshal ssslaughter you, Darksspear runt!"]="我要杀了你，暗矛渣滓！"
G["I sshal tasste your blood, landling."]="我要你的小命，陆生种。"
G["I sssaw you leaving that ssship, sssoftsskin! Sssoon we sshall have you all!"]="我看见你离开那艘船了，弱者！很快我们就会把你们全都干掉！"
G["I sssee now... Ssscourge wasss not... our greatessst enemy...."]="我明白了……天灾军团……并不是我们最大的敌人……"
G["I stabbed it in the face! Goregek so good."]="一击必中！格利基克真厉害。"
G["I stand before you - Aggralan, daughter of Ryal, daughter of Sarrak... and I will proudly be your mate, Go'el... in this world or any other."]="我就在你身边。我是阿格娜兰，瑞亚尔之女，莎拉克之女……我以成为你的伴侣为荣，古伊尔……无论身在任何世界。"
G["I stand before you - Go'el, Son of Durotan, Son of Garad... and if you would have me, I would be your life-mate."]="我就在你身边——我是古伊尔，杜隆坦之子，加拉达之子……如果你愿意，我愿成为你的终身伴侣。"
G["I stand before you only a boy in search of lost memories."]="站在你面前的只是一个想要找回失落记忆的孩子。"
G["I stand vigilant here on these steps where my ancestors thrived. Until now, I have enjoyed a lifetime of freedom. I must do what I can to ensure that my children and my children's children live their lives free of the perils of war. Praise be to King Phaoris and all of his heroic efforts for my people. Our people. I can not quite place it, $r, but I trust you. Go now, $gsister:brother;, there is much to do before the skies darken with conflict."]="我的祖先在这个地方繁衍生息。现在，我站在这里，等待敌人的到来。我已经渡过了自由的一生。而我要让我的子子孙孙能够继续平安地生活下去，远离战火的摧残。赞美法奥瑞斯国王和他为我们的人民所立下的一切英雄功业。$r，我不知道你的道路在哪里，但我相信，你不会辜负我们的期望。出发吧，$g姐妹:兄弟;，在天空被硝烟染黑之前，还有许多事要做。"
G["I still cannae believe the Horde stole the Divine Bell, after everything we did to keep it safe in Darnassus."]="我还是无法相信，我们在达纳苏斯做好了完全的准备，部落竟然还是偷走了圣钟。"
G["I still do not fully understand."]="我还是没能完全理解。"
G["I still do not understand."]="我还是不理解。"
G["I still don't know why we can't just conjur a refreshment table."]="我还是想不通，为什么不直接召唤餐桌呢。"
G["I still hate you."]="我还是很恨你。"
G["I still have a luckydo. This is your last chance to surrender before bad fortune finds you."]="我还有块幸运符。这是你们最后一次投降的机会，不然就等着倒霉吧。"
G["I still have some... fight... in me-e-e..."]="我还能……继续……战……"
G["I still have the scars from that night."]="那晚的伤痕依然留在我身上。"
G["I still love you, Ace!"]="我依然爱你，王牌飞行员！"
G["I still remember when I used to guard the Burlap Trail."]="我仍然记得守卫粗麻小径的那段时光。"
G["I stood by and watched the corruption of Ragnaros seep through the hearts and minds of the Dark Iron nation. This once honorable race, driven to madness... to evil.\n\nWhen the construction of the Spire was complete, my will to live amongst my people gave way. I passed as a hero of the new nation of Dark Iron. This tomb was placed here - at the entrance to the city I planned and built - in honor of my efforts."]="我眼睁睁地看着拉格纳罗斯的堕落渗透了整个黑铁矮人社会，使这个曾经荣耀的民族变得疯狂……变得邪恶。\n\n当黑石塔建造完毕时，我与同胞们共同生存下去的意愿也消失殆尽了。我作为新的黑铁矮人的英雄而死去。这座坟墓就在我亲手建造的城门处，作为对我的成就的敬意。"
G["I stopped by the park district on my way here. There's nothing left of it..."]="我在来的路上经过了公园区。那儿已经什么都没了……"
G["I strike from the shadows!"]="我从阴影中出击！"
G["I strongly disagree. Dar'khan is not going to get reinforcements because he'll be bottlenecked. Deatholme has only one way in and out. Your traitor was a fool to corner himself there, and I intend to exploit that weakness!"]="我可不这么认为。达尔坎不会得到援兵，他是在作茧自缚，因为戴索姆只有一条道进出。这个叛徒呆在那儿真是蠢到家了，我要宰了他！"
G["I study the known and unknown elements of our world."]="我研究这个世界上的已知和未知的元素。"
G["I su... sur... surpose that yar wanna ride back to der outpost. Yarp?"]="呃……这么说……你打算启程返回前哨站，是吧？"
G["I submit myself for further training, my master."]="我服从安排接受进一步的训练，我的主人。"
G["I submit! You win this time..."]="我投降，我投降！！这次你赢了……"
G["I suggest a new strategy: you draw their attacks while I gather reinforcements."]="我想到一个新的战术，你吸引他们的火力，我去找援兵。"
G["I summon you, Sha'ni Proudtusk!"]="我召唤你，沙妮·长齿！"
G["I summoned all my strength, faced west, and threw him to Kalimdor."]="我聚集起全部力量，转向西方，将他朝卡利姆多扔了过去。"
G["I supply the Hold with various relics required for spellcasting as well as other alchemical reagents."]="我向要塞提供各种施法所需的碎片和其它炼金材料。"
G["I supply the Krom'gar army with equipment."]="我向克罗姆加的军队提供各种装备。"
G["I suppose I can teach that to you.  You'll probably only be able to find ogre tannin here, but the other things you can find most anywhere!"]="我想我能教你。你也许只能在这儿找到食人魔鞣酸，但是你几乎可以在任何地方找到其他东西。"
G["I suppose I could leave things to Mung-Mung for a while and take a gander at Yoon's. He does have the best soil in the entire valley! Let me just get my things in order, first."]="我想我可以把这里交给蒙蒙看管一会儿，我去老愚那边转转。他的确有着整个谷里最肥沃的土地！先让我把手头的事情理理顺。"
G["I suppose I could leave things to Mung-Mung for a while and take a gander at Yoon's. Let me finish up my business here at the market, first."]="也许我可以暂时将事情交给蒙蒙来做，然后去老愚那里看一看。但是，我得先完成今天在市集上的生意。"
G["I suppose I could use one of those. Thank you."]="我猜我可以用它们中的一个。谢谢你。"
G["I suppose I need some more practice."]="我想，我还需要更多练习。"
G["I suppose I should be grateful. Please, take this. I want nothing to remind me of this place."]="我想我应该感激你。请收下这个。我不希望留着任何会让我想起这个地方的东西。"
G["I suppose I should not be surprised at this cold reception. We have long been in hiding, and the separation from our brethren was necessary.\n\nThat time, however, is done. Whether the residents of this young tree come to accept us or not, the Highborne are returning to light, and we will not turn our backs on what we are."]="我早知道我会受到这种冷遇。长久以来我们一直在隐居，因为我们必须要与族人分离。\n\n那段时间已经过去。不管这颗幼树之荫下的居民是否会接受我们，上层精灵们都要摒弃过去的身份，从黑暗中返回光明。"
G["I suppose I should thank you for freeing me. We'll soon see if you think that was a wise decision."]="我想，我应该感谢你救了我。我们很快就会知道你的这个决定是否明智。"
G["I suppose I'll be off then. You a-comin', Chen?"]="我想我还是走吧。你来吗，陈？"
G["I suppose I'll be off then. You a-comin', Li Li?"]="我想我还是走吧。你来吗，丽丽？"
G["I suppose I'll end up fighting them all myself."]="看起来我得独自解决他们了。"
G["I suppose I'll just add this to the stew. We were short on meat anyways."]="我想我会把它放进炖汤里，正好我们缺肉。"
G["I suppose it has to be this way, then. If only you'd seen what I've seen. THEN you'd understand."]="我想别无他途了。如果你们能看到我所看到的东西，你们就会明白的。"
G["I suppose it is time I headed home."]="我想我该回家了。"
G["I suppose my aim's a little off today."]="我想我今天的枪法不太准。"
G["I suppose so. It's not silly, though, what you said."]="我是这样想的。不管你怎么说，这并不傻。"
G["I suppose sometimes y'need to hit rock bottom before y'can crawl yer way back up."]="我想，有时候，在爬上去之前先要跌到最下面去。"
G["I suppose that could work, if we had twenty people to cast it with."]="我想如果有二十个人用魔法能量支持它，应该还是可以的。"
G["I suppose that's enough for today. Let's wait for Uncle Chen to return."]="我想今天应该差不多了。让我们等陈叔回来吧。"
G["I suppose there are worse fates than being stuck forever inside a beer barrel."]="我想被永远困在啤酒桶里还不算最糟糕的下场。"
G["I suppose this gift is acceptable. Thanks, $n."]="这件礼物还不错。谢谢，$n。"
G["I suppose this is it, then?  I won't go down quietly!"]="好吧，然后呢？我不会坐以待毙的！"
G["I suppose we'll just have to throw these away... WAIT!  I think I'm having an idea."]="我想，我们只能把这些丢掉了……等等！我突然有了个主意。"
G["I suppose we'll see the measure of your dedication in due time."]="我想我们会在适当的时候看到你们的贡献。"
G["I suppose you are here to be trained in the use of a new weapon?  Make it fast, I'm very busy!"]="我猜想你到这儿来是训练如何使用新武器的？快点，我很忙的！"
G["I suppose you did help me water my plants. Very well... I'll have the hops sent to your friend Chen, in Halfhill."]="我想你确实是帮我给植物浇过水了。很好……我会派人将啤酒花送到半山，交给你那位叫陈的朋友。"
G["I suppose you want something for what you did, is that it? Reminding me of my life? Pfagh. Take what I have and leave me alone."]="我猜你在期盼些什么报酬吧，是不是？你不就是让我想起了还活着的时候么？哼，算了，从我这里随便拿件东西就赶紧走吧，让我一个人静一静。"
G["I suppose you'll be needing a key for this cage? Wait, don't tell me. The horrific gibbering monster behind me ate it, right?"]="我想你得找把钥匙才能打开这笼子。等等，你该不是想告诉我，我身后那个吓人的怪物把钥匙给吃了？是吗？"
G["I suppose you're right."]="我想你是对的。"
G["I suppose."]="大概吧。"
G["I sure am a long way from home!"]="我显然已经离家万里了！"
G["I sure am hungry."]="我都快饿死了。"
G["I sure could use a kiss about now.  Know where I can find one?"]="要是有人给我个吻就好了，你知道我在哪里可以找到一个吻吗？"
G["I sure do like his pretty face."]="我当然喜欢他漂亮的脸蛋。"
G["I surmise that this object is the living embodiment of shadows... darkness... It is a manifestation. It is a void."]="我猜想这个东西是暗影的实体化身……黑暗的表象。它是一块虚空的领域。"
G["I surrender! Stay your blade!"]="我投降！把刀拿开！"
G["I surrender! You win."]="我投降！你赢了。"
G["I survived and I'm flesh again!"]="我还有命在！我恢复了血肉之躯！"
G["I survived for hundreds of years during the Thunder King's reign. Do you know how? By not keeping my masters waiting!"]="在雷电之王统治期间，我都能活好几百年。你知道为什么吗？因为我从不让主人久等！"
G["I suspect that the imps are stealing knowledge."]="我猜想那些小鬼在偷学知识。"
G["I swab the decks!"]="我在拖洗甲板！"
G["I swear I saw that little Syra Goldendraft giving my boy \"the looks\". Can't have that."]="\"Juro que he visto a esa pequeña Syra Brisa Dorada cómo miraba a mi niño. No lo soporto\"."
G["I swear I will keep him safe. We will return as soon as we can."]="我发誓会保护他的安全。我们会尽快赶回来。"
G["I swear by my ancestors, these Kor'kron will not pass. Now go, $n, the honor of felling Garrosh is yours!"]="我以先祖的名义发誓，这些库卡隆休想通过此地。快去吧，$n，打倒加尔鲁什的荣誉就归你了！"
G["I swear by the power of An'she, these Kor'kron whelps will not pass."]="我以安瑟的威能起誓，这些库卡隆杂种休想通过这里。"
G["I swear it is true! Please, don't kill me!!"]="我发誓我没说谎！求你了！别杀我！"
G["I swear that guy was dead when I found him! What - oh - Twilight's Hammer? No, I don't know anything about that."]="我发誓在我找到他的时候他已经死了！什么——喔——暮光之锤？不，我什么也不知道。"
G["I swear that if you do not work faster I'm going to feed you to my worg!"]="要是你再拖拖拉拉的，我就送你去喂狼！"
G["I swear this line's not moving!"]="我发誓这排的队压根儿就没动过！"
G["I swear this wasn't my fault.  Why are you looking at me like that?"]="我发誓，这不是我的错。为什么你要这样看着我？"
G["I swear you trolls are the worst batch of workers we've ever had!"]="我发誓，你们这些巨魔是我见过的最糟糕的工人！"
G["I swear, I didn't steal anything from you! Here, take some of my supplies, just go away!"]="我发誓，我没有偷你的任何东西！我的东西你可以随便拿，但是请快点离开！"
G["I swear, none of these Kor'kron animals will pass as long I draw breath. Just promise you will put Garrosh down like the rabid dog he is."]="我发誓，只要我还有一口气在，这些库卡隆畜生就休想通过这里。你只要保证把加尔鲁什那条疯狗干掉就够了。"
G["I swear, people have actually seen them. Pandaren really do exist!"]="我发誓，真的有人看到过他们。熊猫人是确实存在的！"
G["I swear, that woman never misses."]="我发誓，那个女人从来没有失手过。"
G["I swear... if Quint tries to plant one more fishing grub on me, I'm going to hack down his tree with my not-so-rusty sword."]="我发誓……如果奎恩提斯胆敢再乱栽食虫花，我就马上把他的树给砍了。"
G["I swore an oath to the Kirin Tor. That bond was one of trust and mutual understanding. And then they betrayed that bond. It is time to remind them the blood elves do not suffer betrayal lightly."]="我曾向肯瑞托发过誓。那是一个互信互谅的誓约。后来，他们背弃了这个誓言。是时候让他们知道，血精灵是不会轻易放过背叛者的。"
G["I swore that nothing would stir me to take up this blade again.\n\nI was a fool."]="我曾经发过誓，再没有任何东西能让我重新拿起这把剑了。\n\n我是个傻瓜。"
G["I take care o' the pigs 'round here."]="我在这附近照看着几头猪。"
G["I take great pride in the company I keep."]="我为我的同伴感到骄傲。"
G["I take it you were successful at the bridge?"]="看来你们在大桥的战斗中打了胜仗？"
G["I take my leave now, Commander. Good day!"]="指挥官，我告辞了。再见！"
G["I take pride in the fact that I am continuing my father's legacy here.\n\nA still-growing legacy, I might add."]="我很自豪能在这儿将我父亲的传说延续下去。\n\n补充一句，这是一个不断延续的传说。"
G["I take this life as an offering!"]="你的生命将成为我的祭品。"
G["I taught one of the rats to wave."]="我教会了一个老鼠招手。"
G["I teach myself a lot of my big-tongue hunt here. Lot to kill."]="我在这里掌握了许多狩猎大舌头怪的技巧。它们的数量很多，完全可以用来练习。"
G["I tell ya this guy's driving me nuts! Does anyone truly believe that a goblin could help run anything so magnificent as this speedbarge?\n\nAll they know how to do is blow stuff up and half of the time, they take themselves out doing even that!"]="¡Te digo que ese tipo me está volviendo loco! ¿De verdad hay alguien que crea que un goblin podría ayudar a gobernar algo tan magnífico como el Barcódromo?"
G["I tell ya, ten years from now everyone will be talkin' about the time that ol' Sully the Pickle and $n lit a fire right under those stinkin' yaungol's noses and blew their oil rigs to kingdom come!"]="我告诉你，十年之内，大家都会不停谈论“腌菜”老苏利和$n就在那些腐臭的野牛人鼻子底下点火，将他们的钻油机炸飞的事迹！"
G["I tell ye, I don't miss the Great War at all. I remember when we fought at Darrowmere. All night in the fog, lying in a muddy trench."]="我跟你说，我参加了整场大战。我还记得当时我们在达隆米尔战斗的情景。整个晚上都是雾，我们就躺在满是泥泞的战壕里。"
G["I tell you anything you want!"]="我说，什么都说！"
G["I tell you now, because you have earned this warning."]="我们信任你，所以给你这个警告。"
G["I tell you now, when we get back to Farstrider Enclave there will be a full accounting of your actions, Ranger Valanna! You alone were responsible for our losses and I'm certain that the captain will see it my way."]="我现在告诉你，当我们回到远行者营地，你的行动会得到全面的清算，游侠瓦兰娜！你要对我们的失败负全责，我确信上尉的想法是和我一样的。"
G["I tell you, it sure is fun to see you work!  And you sure go through a lot of bombers!"]="老实说，看你轰炸真是有趣！你肯定开过不少轰炸机吧！"
G["I tend these creatures of Gormok as he cannot. I do not fully agree with this slaughter, but at the least he will have his chance to fight."]="我帮助戈莫克照顾这些怪物。我并不完全赞同这种屠杀。但至少，他有机会进行战斗了。"
G["I thank the Light for this blessing. May it be used for justice and to defend all good creatures."]="我感谢圣光赐予我的祝福。愿它维护正义，保护所有善良的灵魂。"
G["I thank you all.  The druids of old were wise to tear down Vordrassil, for its roots seep deep into the dwelling of an ancient evil."]="谢谢你们。将沃达希尔砍倒的德鲁伊做出了明智的决定，蛰伏在地底的远古邪灵已经侵淫了那棵世界之树的根须。"
G["I thank you for coming, but you really all must die now!"]="多谢你们专程赶来，但你们现在真的都该死了！"
G["I thank you for the clean death. I would not have done the same..."]="感谢你让我死得这么痛快，要不是你，我永远也做不到……"
G["I thank you for your aid, brothers.  Our people will be redeemed!"]="我感谢你们的帮助，兄弟们。我们的人民会报答你们的！"
G["I thank you for your graciousness, Mor'ghor. I must now take my leave."]="感谢你的慷慨，莫格霍尔。但我现在必须走了。"
G["I thank you for your inquiry, but I already have all of the wool bandages necessary for the war effort. I suggest that you ask around though; there are many here that could probably still use your aid."]="感谢你对我的关心，但是我已经集齐战争所需的绒线绷带了。我建议你四下看看，也许其他人需要你的帮助。"
G["I thank you, $n.  And my brother thanks you."]="谢谢你，$n。我的兄弟也很感谢你。"
G["I thank you, $n.  My associates who will do great things with these..."]="感谢你，$n。我知道谁可以妥善地使用这个……"
G["I thank you, $n. Your dedication to my plea gives rest to my lost wife's spirit, and for that I could never repay you enough.\n\nI cannot say that my hatred will ever cease for the quilboar, but it is satiated for now.\n\nNow I must begin to rebuild my life."]="Te lo agradezco, $n. Tu total entrega a mis súplicas, permite descansar al espíritu de mi esposa perdida y nunca podré darte suficiente recompensa.\n\nNo puedo decir que mi odio por el jabaespín vaya a desaparecer jamás, pero se ha saciado por el momento.\n\nDebo empezar a reconstruir mi vida."
G["I thank you, Akama.  You honor me by allowing me this moment, surrounded by my brothers.  Farewell, friend.  Guide our people well."]="谢谢你，阿卡玛。你让我感到了无上的荣耀，我感到自己的兄弟们就在身边。再会，朋友。好好指引我们的同胞。"
G["I thank you, Garrosh. We have much to discuss when I return from my visit with the Greatmother."]="感谢你，加尔鲁什。在我拜访祖母之后，我会找你好好谈谈的。"
G["I thank you, friend of Dalaran."]="谢谢你，达拉然的朋友。"
G["I thank you, my friends. Forgive me. I... I have grown too weak to be of any assistance."]="感谢你，我的朋友。请原谅我，我……我现在太虚弱了，一点儿忙都帮不上。"
G["I thank you, strangers. I have been freed."]="谢谢你，陌生人。我自由了。"
G["I think Elder Splitrock has traveled to Maraudon in Desolace."]="碎石长者到凄凉之地的玛拉顿去了。"
G["I think I came from Eng-land, do you know where that is?"]="我觉得我是从英——格兰来的，你知道那是哪里吗？"
G["I think I can hear myself getting luckier..."]="我觉得我变得更加幸运了……"
G["I think I can just make it out from here. Right on the edge of the horizon."]="我想我从这儿刚刚能看到它。就在海平线那儿。"
G["I think I can limp back to the fortress..."]="我应该能自己回到城堡去……"
G["I think I can make it back on my own."]="我想我能自己回去了。"
G["I think I can make it to Brackenwall on my own. They've got the cargo at the top of the tower. Be careful!"]="我想我可以自己回蕨墙村。他们把货物放在了塔顶，多加小心！"
G["I think I can see the Sunwell from here!"]="我想我可以在这里看到太阳之井！"
G["I think I can speak for everyone when I say that you're a true hero of Kun-Lai Summit, not to mention Firebough Nook, $p!"]="¡Creo que hablo por todos cuando digo que eres $gun verdadero héroe:una verdadera heroína; de la Cima Kun-Lai, por no mencionar el Rincón Tallo Ardiente, $p!"
G["I think I can use that horse to make it the rest of the way.  Thanks!"]="我想，我能骑这匹马走完剩下的路。谢谢！"
G["I think I could juggle fire if I tried."]="我想，我只要努力尝试，也可以喷出火来。"
G["I think I found the emergency button. Rockets have those, don't they?"]="我想我找到了应急按钮。火箭都有这样的按钮，没错吧？"
G["I think I have a plan to infiltrate the Thunder King's armory. We'll use that creature you recovered, with a little help from the Shado-Pan."]="我有一个潜入雷电之王武器库的计划。但是这需要你找到的那个生物，以及影踪派的帮助。"
G["I think I have heard of this magic."]="我想我听说过这种魔法。"
G["I think I hear him coming now."]="他正朝这边走来，我听得见。"
G["I think I hear him coming!  Look to the west!"]="我听到他来了！朝西看！"
G["I think I hear something! Chambers must be coming. Make way! Make way!"]="我想我听到了什么！一定是查伯斯来了。快跑！快跑！"
G["I think I knocked that one into next week."]="我想，我已经把这家伙打得不省人事了。"
G["I think I learned something new!"]="我觉得我学到了一些新东西！"
G["I think I liked you better when your jaw was missing."]="我想我更喜欢变成哑巴的你。"
G["I think I lost them."]="我想我失去它们了。"
G["I think I need a bath.  *sniff*  I think you need one, too!"]="我觉得我需要洗个澡。*嗅* 我想你也要洗个澡！"
G["I think I punched him so hard his ancestors felt it."]="我想我打得太重了，连他的祖宗都感觉到了。"
G["I think I saw a key on one of those Gjalerbron vrykul up top."]="上面那些亚勒伯龙维库人身上就有钥匙。"
G["I think I saw a key on one of those vrykul."]="我好像在那些维库人身上见过钥匙。"
G["I think I saw some mogu digging up artifacts.\n\nThat can't be good.\n\nWe still tell tales of all the evil stuff the mogu did when they knew how to use artifacts and arcane powers."]="我想我看见一些魔古族正在挖圣物。\n\n那一定不是好事。\n\n我们至今还流传着当年魔古族学会使用圣物和奥术力量后，干出的邪恶勾当。"
G["I think I saw something like this on the Exodar once..."]="我记得曾经在埃索达看到过与此类似的……"
G["I think I saw them take him over by the north side of the abbey, near the archery targets."]="我看见他被带往修道院北边了，就在箭靶附近。"
G["I think I saw trolls being carted off in chains. Why would orcs be cartin' trolls off in chains?"]="我好像看见一些带着镣铐的巨魔被押走了。兽人为什么要给巨魔戴镣铐，还要押着他们走呢？"
G["I think I see a way for us to get out of this big twisted mess of a bramble."]="我想我看到了一条可以走出这片荆棘林的路。"
G["I think I see him heading over here now..."]="我想我看到他往这里走过来了……"
G["I think I see one of their plague wagons!"]="我看见了一辆天灾战车！"
G["I think I see some corpses up ahead.  Let's go, $n!  You do the searching and fighting.  I'll do the lifting."]="我想我在前方看见了一些尸体。走吧，$n！你负责搜寻和战斗。体力活儿交给我。"
G["I think I see something."]="我好像看到了什么。"
G["I think I see the camp! We're almost home, Mr. Floppy! Let's go!"]="是营地！小毛球，我们很快就要到家啦！快点！"
G["I think I see them! HERE! HERE!"]="我想我看到他们了！这边！这边！"
G["I think I understand it now."]="我想我现在能够理解了。"
G["I think I understand now. Can I help with any of this? The Ethereum and void creatures are a threat to our survival as well."]="我想我现在明白了。有什么我可以帮你的吗？复仇军和虚空生物同样也是我们的威胁。"
G["I think I understand the Creators' design intent for the Earthen now.  What are the Earthen's anomalies that you spoke of earlier?"]="我想我现在明白造物者设计土灵的意图了。你之前说的土灵的变化是指什么？"
G["I think I understand. Thank you."]="我明白了。谢谢你。"
G["I think I want to be a $c, swordmistress."]="Creo que quiero ser como $n, maestra de espadas."
G["I think I was born to be an adventurer. Like those Pandaren from the Wandering Isle..."]="我认为自己天生就是个冒险家。跟迷踪岛上的那些熊猫人一样……"
G["I think I will just sit this one out."]="我更愿意保持中立。"
G["I think I would quite enjoy skipping stones down that hallway.  It would be quite the display!"]="我想我还蛮喜欢像跳房子一样地穿过走廊。真有意思！"
G["I think I'll adventure alone for a while."]="我想，我要孤身走一段冒险的征程了。"
G["I think I'll call it... Dreadbrew. You want to try some, Lya?"]="我想我可以称呼它为……恐惧老酒。你想尝尝吗，丽亚？"
G["I think I'll go with Amble Mode, A-Me."]="我认为应该从缓速模式开始，A-Me。"
G["I think I'll just stick with \"silk-getting guy\"."]="Creo que me quedo con \"tío que recoge seda\"."
G["I think I'll make my own money on the side while the others try to decide whether it's okay to go into Oshu'gun.\n\nTime is profit!"]="我想我应该趁别人还在讨论是否可以进入沃舒古的时候自己先想办法赚些钱。\n\n时间就是利润！"
G["I think I'll rest a moment and catch my breath before heading back to Ratchet. Thanks for all the help!"]="我想在回到棘齿城之前休息一下。谢谢你的帮助！"
G["I think I'm beginning to regret undertaking this pilgrimage. I anticipated that the road would be rough and I'm no stranger to travel, but I wasn't prepared for the rigors of Outland.\n\nOn top of everything else, that Taleris seems to want to push me out of here before I've regained my strength completely."]="我想我已经开始后悔来进行这次朝圣了。我知道路途会很艰辛，而且我也并不是一个远行的新手，但我没有准备好面对外域的困难。\n\n最主要的是，那个塔雷里斯似乎想要在我完全恢复力量之前把我赶出这里。"
G["I think I'm done fighting for a while, Ku-Mo."]="我觉得我的战斗已经告一段落了，莫苦。"
G["I think I'm going to need another drink!"]="我想我得再喝一杯！"
G["I think I'm going to turn to drinking after this."]="这事儿完了之后我很可能会借酒消愁。"
G["I think I'm gonna go to Dalaran after this is over. Help 'em get that city up and floating."]="等这一切都结束后，我也许会去达拉然。帮他们重新把那座城市复建得风生水起。"
G["I think I'm ready to take that walk now."]="我想我已经做好准备了。"
G["I think I'm starting to get the hang of this."]="我想我快要掌握窍门啦。"
G["I think I've been down in this mine too long."]="我觉得我待在这矿井里太久了。"
G["I think I've eaten too much candy..."]="我好像吃了太多的糖果……"
G["I think I've found the one I'll use. Now I have to begin the task of carving it. I don't think it's going to be easy. I don't even know what a female yeti's mating call sounds like!"]="很好，我找到合适的号角啦。现在我要开始雕刻了，这恐怕会很难。我根本没听过雌雪人的叫声！"
G["I think I've got it this time..."]="我觉得这次能够成功……"
G["I think I've lost a tabard."]="我好象是丢了一件制服。"
G["I think I've lost my  Zandalar Vindicator's Belt. Can you help?"]="我弄丢了我的赞达拉辩护者腰带，你能帮帮我吗？"
G["I think I've stayed here long enough. Would you like to go on a walk with me?"]="我想我在这里待得够久了，你愿意随我一起走走吗？"
G["I think Plugger filled one of his kegs too much.  It looks like it's about to blow!"]="我认为普拉格把桶装得太满了。你瞧，简直都要炸开了！"
G["I think a change is in order...."]="我想必须得有一些变化了……"
G["I think everyone deserves a drink. If Thadok's sharing..."]="要是萨度克愿意的话……我想每个人都应该得到一杯的。"
G["I think he likes Old Blanchy."]="他多半喜欢老马布兰契。"
G["I think he likes me, but I can't be sure. What do you think, $r?"]="我觉得他喜欢我，但我不确定。你是怎么想的，$r？"
G["I think he's on the south side of the abbey."]="他应该被关押在修道院的南边。"
G["I think it like you. Maybe we can bring it back to hill and ask it nice, \"Step in cooking pot, big-tongue.\" Yes?"]="Creo que le gustas. A lo mejor podemos llevarlo de vuelta a la colina y pedírselo educadamente: \"Metete en la olla, lengua-grande.\" ¿Te parece?"
G["I think it may be time to bring my swords out of retirement..."]="我的剑已经尘封多年，看来是时候把它擦亮了……"
G["I think it needs..."]="我觉得还要加点……"
G["I think it was the sounds of the draenei children that unnerved most of them... You never forget..."]="最让他们愧疚难安的就是德莱尼小孩的哭喊声……日夜萦绕在耳畔……"
G["I think it's about time to call this fight."]="我觉得你们差不多该动真格的了。"
G["I think it's time that I cast my renew!"]="我觉得应该施放恢复了！"
G["I think it's time to go for a Randall P. walk."]="我想该兰达尔·P·沃克登场了。"
G["I think it's time to see what's behind the door near the entrance. I'm going to sneak over there, nice and quiet. Meet me at the door and I'll get us in."]="让我们看看入口附近的大门后面藏着什么。我会悄悄地潜过去。去那里和我碰面吧，我会带你们进去吧。"
G["I think it's up this way to the left.  Let's go!"]="我觉得应该走左边这条路。走吧！"
G["I think it's working..."]="我想它起作用了……"
G["I think it's your grain that's making us sick!"]="我们是吃了你的粮食才生病的！"
G["I think its spine is broken. Ghoul it is!"]="我估计这具尸体的脊椎已经断了！正好做食尸鬼！"
G["I think my boat stuck."]="我想我的船被卡住了。"
G["I think my father did the right thing. If we tried to occupy Orgrimmar, the fighting would never stop. And what about the rest of the Horde? Would we resort to internment camps? We've been down that road before - it doesn't work!\n\nWe deposed of a warmonger and replaced him with a leader we can work with. It's our only chance for peace in the future."]="我觉得我父亲做得对。如果我们试图占领奥格瑞玛，那战争将永无止境。而且剩下的部落人民怎么办？难道要依靠收容所吗？我们过去就这么干过——那根本行不通！\n\n我们废黜了一个战争贩子，并让一位可以沟通的领袖取代了他。这是达成和解的唯一机会。"
G["I think my gadget is broken, it did manage to pick up some unusual readings."]="我想我的雷达设备搞不好是坏掉了，它平时可以收集很多特殊的信息。"
G["I think my necklace fell in the lake.  My daddy got it for me, and he's gonna be mad now."]="我想我的项链掉到湖里去了。那是我爸爸送给我的，他要是知道我弄丢了项链，肯定会气疯的。"
G["I think not, I don't need to be blown up again."]="我不这么认为，我不想再被炸出实验室了。"
G["I think not, Socrethar.  With the power of the crystal, you will be serving me soon.  If I allow you to live, that is."]="我不这么觉得，索克雷萨。有了水晶的力量，你会很快就会成为我的仆人——如果我允许你活着的话。"
G["I think not. Rimblat has already proven that new life can grow from the sundered earth. Now we must find a way to reproduce and, more importantly, sustain the growth.\n\nWhile I am here, I am also offering my services to adventurers entering Naxxramas."]="我当然也不这么认为。但雷布拉特似乎已经证实了新的生命可以在这种破碎的土地上成长。现在我们的工作就是保持这种成长的可持续性，以及，最重要的，供应维持这种生长的养分。\n\n当然，既然我已经在这里了，我也会提供一些服务，帮助冒险者们进入纳克萨玛斯。"
G["I think not. When I've finished beating the arrogance out of you, I'll impale your corpse on the spikes as an example to any other 'heroes'!"]="Creo que no. ¡Cuando te haya sacado la arrogancia a palos, empalaré tu cadáver en las púas como ejemplo para otros \"héroes\"!"
G["I think one reason I like hunting big-tongues so much... they not as dumb as the other hunts. They give a real fight."]="我喜欢狩猎大舌头怪的原因之一……就是它们不像其他猎物那样愚蠢。懂得耍花招的猎物才是真正的挑战。"
G["I think she winked at me."]="我想她对着我眨了眨眼睛。"
G["I think that druid had the hots for me!"]="我觉得那个德鲁伊喜欢我！不是你，是我。"
G["I think that today, you may have settled some of his worries.  You show nobility and control.  Perhaps more than he thought possible."]="我想今天你已经消除了他的疑虑。你显示出的高贵和自律也许已经超出了他期待。"
G["I think that we might have angered them."]="我想，我们也许已经激怒他们了。"
G["I think that we should teach a lesson to both the Horde and the Alliance.  One that they will not soon forget!"]="我们应该给联盟和部落一点教训。刻骨铭心的教训！"
G["I think that's the last of them. It's a good thing you came when you did... I wasn't sure how much longer I could stay hidden."]="我想那是最后一个。你来得真是时候……我不知道我还能躲多久。"
G["I think the boys are afraid of her!"]="我觉得，男孩子们都很怕她！"
G["I think the brewery might be on fire."]="你看酿酒厂还着火了。"
G["I think the crystal on the left is defective. We should never have rushed their construction. This is how accidents happen."]="我觉得左边那块水晶有瑕疵。我们不该赶工的。事故就是这么来的。"
G["I think the meat has gone bad.  Oh wait, that's you!"]="我想这肉已经变质了。哦等等，这味道是你发出来的！"
G["I think the rats are after us!  Run!!"]="我想这些老鼠在追我们！快跑！！"
G["I think the sounds came from over here. We'd better check it out."]="我猜声音是从这里发出的。我们最好去看看。"
G["I think there's somethin' buried here, beneath the sand!"]="我觉得这里的沙子底下埋着东西！"
G["I think they have her down near the gallows."]="她应该被绑在绞刑架下。"
G["I think they put him in a cage over near the lumbermill."]="他似乎被关在伐木场附近的某个牢笼。"
G["I think this $c is spoiling for a fight."]="Creo que $geste:esta; $c está buscando pelea."
G["I think this group will really improve with age!"]="我觉得这组会随着年龄的增长而进步！"
G["I think this jungle wants to eat me!"]="我觉得这片丛林想要吃掉我！"
G["I think this one will have to be my last. I'm driving home after the party."]="我只能再喝这一杯了。聚会之后我还要开车回家。"
G["I think those weird bird guys were going to eat us.  Gross!"]="我想那些怪异的鸟人是来吃我们的。真恶心！"
G["I think we be lost, mon...."]="我们好像迷路了……"
G["I think we can do business."]="我想我们能做笔交易。"
G["I think we have both lost enough today, old elf. See to your dead."]="我想我们今天全都损失惨重，年老的精灵。收殓亡者吧。"
G["I think we have figured out a way to ward our flying mounts against the lightning. But fly in loose formation, just in case."]="我们已经有了保护坐骑免受闪电干扰的方法。但为防万一，还是得分散飞行。"
G["I think we lost 'em! That was a close one! Welp, as promised, Amberpine Lodge in one piece! Keep your feet on the ground, friend!"]="我们已经摆脱它们啦！真险呀！好啦，我这就送你去琥珀松木营地！朋友，坐稳！"
G["I think we should eat it."]="我想我们该吃了它。"
G["I think we stand a better chance fighting alongside one another."]="并肩作战，我们才有胜算。"
G["I think we're all done! Let's meet up with those two oafs at the brewery's back entrance."]="我想我们都搞定了！让我们去酿酒厂的后门和那两个呆子会合吧。"
G["I think we're getting somewhere, $p. Let's keep looking around."]="我想我们很快就会有所发现了，$p。继续在周围找找。"
G["I think we're running out of nails."]="我觉得钉子快用完了。"
G["I think we're safe now. Let's get back!"]="我想我们现在安全了。回去吧！"
G["I think we've done enough damage for one day. Let's meet up with the other two, at the brewery's rear entrance."]="我想我们今天造成的破坏已经够多了。我们去酒厂后门跟他们两人会合吧。"
G["I think we've seen just about enough of this. Am I right?"]="我觉得吧，这场无聊的闷战我们已经看够了。对吧？"
G["I think yak has started to move."]="我想牦牛已经开始移动了。"
G["I think you be lost, mon...."]="你迷路了吧……"
G["I think you don't understand how the yak temple works."]="我想你并不了解牦牛寺是做什么的。"
G["I think you should go, $g mister:miss;. You're scaring Mr. Floppy."]="Creo que debería marcharse, $gseñor:señorita;. Está asustando a Floppy."
G["I think you signed up for the wrong job, initiate. Kel'Thuzad don't need any flower girls..."]="Creo que te has equivocado de trabajo, $giniciado:iniciada;. Kel'Thuzad no precisa a blandengues como tú..."
G["I think you'd best leave before Griselda decides she's in the mood for dessert."]="你最好趁格里西达还没有胃口吃餐后甜点之前离开。"
G["I think you'll have better luck looking in Stormwind.  Ask a guard up there and they'll point you in the right direction."]="我认为你在暴风城会交到好运的。去问问那儿的守卫，他们会给你指明方向。"
G["I think you're mistaken, friend. You don't have anything that I want."]="Creo que te equivocas, $gamigo:amiga;. No tienes nada que yo pueda querer."
G["I think you're more than qualified for this little assignment... let's see if I'm right!"]="Creo que estás más que $gcualificado:cualificada; para esta pequeña tarea... ¡veamos si tengo razón!"
G["I think you're number thirty in line? Maybe forty? I lost count a while back."]="Creo que eres $gel:la; número... ¿treinta? ¿Cuarenta? Hace un rato que he perdido la cuenta."
G["I think you've got the shoulders wrong.  Looks close, though."]="我觉得你把肩部弄错了，不过看上去已经很不错了。"
G["I think you've had enough ale, $n."]="我觉得你已经喝得够多了，$n。"
G["I think you've had just about enough."]="再喝下去，你就要醉了。"
G["I think... I think it's working!"]="我想……我想这次起作用了！"
G["I think... maybe it dead."]="我想……它大概是死了。"
G["I thought Garrosh was ready. I thought the mantle of Warchief would give him perspective. Of the many problems facing our people, he saw only one solution - his vision of the Horde brought us to the brink.\n\nIt is time for a new direction. Vol'jin will take us there. In many ways he did not want this responsibility... but I think that will make him a better leader."]="我以为加尔鲁什已经做好了准备。我以为酋长的重任能让他把目光放长远。可当我们的人民面临重重困难时，他却只看到了一种解决办法——他对部落的虚妄规划将我们都逼到了悬崖。\n\n是时候了，我们要寻找新的方向。沃金会带领我们前进。他其实并不想挑起这个重担……但我想这反而能让他成为一个更好的领袖。"
G["I thought Hellscream's victory was assured before he turned half of his Horde against him. So I changed my allegiance."]="我本以为地狱咆哮赢定了，结果他把部落搞得四分五裂。所以我改变了想法。"
G["I thought I could carry a lot... until I saw all the crud you carry around in those bags o' yers."]="我原以为自己力气不小……直到我看到你背的那些玩意儿。"
G["I thought I heard something."]="我好像听到了什么。"
G["I thought I might die in this pit. Thank you!"]="我以为我会死在这坑里。谢谢你！"
G["I thought I saw eyes in the underbrush..."]="我觉得矮树丛中有东西在盯着我们……"
G["I thought I saw something go into the barn."]="我想我看到有什么东西钻进谷仓了。"
G["I thought I saw something in the bushes nearby... Then I suppose I blacked out."]="我好像看到附近的灌木丛里有什么东西……然后我就晕过去了。"
G["I thought I sensed a disturbance.  I see you have defeated my assistants.  Now you may face me."]="我想我感觉到了干扰，看来你已经打败了我的助手们。现在可以来挑战我了。"
G["I thought I smelled a filthy Alliance spy!"]="我闻到了联盟间谍渣滓的味道！"
G["I thought I smelled something!"]="我好像闻到了什么味道！"
G["I thought I smelled something..."]="我想我闻到了什么气味……"
G["I thought I was a goner for sure!"]="我还以为自己必死无疑了！"
G["I thought I was a goner for sure."]="我以为我死定了。"
G["I thought I was a goner for sure. Thank you, $n!"]="我以为我死定了。谢谢你，$n！"
G["I thought I was a goner. I owe you my life."]="我以为自己死定了。我欠你一条命。"
G["I thought I was cooked like a turkey dinner!"]="我还以为自己会像一只火鸡一样被烤熟！"
G["I thought I was dead for sure. Thanks, $n!"]="我以为我死定了。谢谢你，$n！"
G["I thought I was done for!"]="我还以为自己死定了呢！"
G["I thought I was done for! Thank you!"]="我还以为自己完蛋了！谢谢你！"
G["I thought I was done for. Thank you!"]="我还以为自己死定了。谢谢你！"
G["I thought I was doomed. Thank you for freeing me."]="我还以为我死定了呢。谢谢你救了我。"
G["I thought I was doomed. Thank you so much!"]="我还以为我死定了呢。太感谢你了！"
G["I thought I was finished. Thank you, and thank the Order. I can get out of here on my own."]="我以为自己死定了。谢谢你，也谢谢骑士团。我能自己离开这里了。"
G["I thought I was going to die down here!"]="我还以为自己要死在这下面了呢！"
G["I thought I was going to die in there!"]="我还以为我要死在那里了！"
G["I thought I was going to die in there."]="我以为我要死在那里面了。"
G["I thought I was going to die in this awful jungle."]="我还以为自己要死在这片可怕的丛林中了。"
G["I thought I was goner!"]="我还以为我要完了！"
G["I thought I would die down here."]="我还以为我要死在这下面了。"
G["I thought I would fall before help came.\nThank you."]="Creía que desfallecería antes de recibir ayuda.\n\nGracias."
G["I thought I would have more time. I always thought..."]="我以为自己还有大把时间。我一直这么想……"
G["I thought I'd been left behind for sure.  Thanks for coming back for me!"]="我以为我肯定要被落下了。谢谢你回来找我！"
G["I thought I'd never be free from that terrible curse. You have my gratitude, stranger."]="Pensé que jamás me libraría de esa terrible maldición. Tienes mi gratitud, $gforastero:forastera;."
G["I thought I'd never make it out of here alive."]="我还以为自己再也无法活着离开这里了！"
G["I thought I'd never see my son's face again.  Come here, Seth!  Let mom take a look at you!"]="我还以为再也看不到我儿子的脸了。过来，塞瑟！让妈妈好好看看你！"
G["I thought Runetotem reckless to set up camp right in the middle of this devastation, but I wasn't about to let the Arch Druid travel here alone.\n\nHe's planning something. Something big."]="我认为符文图腾在这毁灭的中心地带设营是在鲁莽行事，可我并不会让大德鲁伊只身来此。\n\n他在酝酿着什么计划。大计划。"
G["I thought about askin' her out but I didn't have the guts."]="我很想约她出去，可我没那个胆。"
G["I thought about tricking big-tongues to come here, but it too dangerous for me. You have good luck and I meet you back at hill."]="我想过设局把大舌头怪骗来这里，但对我来说这太危险了。那么，祝你好运，我们营地见。"
G["I thought all was lost when the yaungol attacked our home. It is cliche, but the old monks are right when they say: \"When one door shuts, another opens.\"\n\nOr something like that. Wasn't too big on their teachings."]="Creí que ya no había nada que hacer cuando el yaungol atacó nuestro hogar. Suena a cliché, pero los viejos monjes tienen razón cuando dicen: \"Cuando una puerta se cierra, otra se abre\".\n\nO algo así. No presto mucha atención a sus enseñanzas."
G["I thought for sure I was going to be this smelly beast's dinner!"]="我还以为自己注定要成为这头臭怪物的大餐了！"
G["I thought for sure that I would die like all the others!"]="我还以为我会落得和他们一样的下场！"
G["I thought he had all the right answers.\n\nI... hoped.\n\nHe's nothing that he portrayed himself to be.\n\nI was a fool."]="我以为他所做的一切都是正确的。\n\n我……满怀希望。\n\n但他完全不是他自我标榜的那种人。\n\n我真是个傻瓜。"
G["I thought he was with you?"]="我以为他跟你在一起？"
G["I thought he'd never shut up. At last, Sindragosa silenced that long-winded fool. To the Halls of Reflection, champions! Our objective is near... I can sense it."]="我以为他永远都闭不上嘴。但辛达苟萨让这个呱噪的家伙安静下来了。勇士们，向映像大厅前进！我能感觉到……目标已近。"
G["I thought it was secure! If your peacekeepers had the clout to control the thieves of this city, this wouldn't have happened!"]="我以为很安全嘛！要是你们这帮卫兵能惩治惩治沙塔斯城中的小偷，就不会发生这样的事件！"
G["I thought it was the last group!"]="我以为那是最后一组！"
G["I thought not!"]="我想没有！"
G["I thought our land was safe from the undead?"]="我以为我们的家园不会遭受亡灵的侵袭。"
G["I thought that I told you not to come around here.  Move on!"]="我记得我告诉过你，不要到这附近来。走开！"
G["I thought that goblins were only good for selling trinkets and blowing themselves up."]="我还以为地精只会卖卖东西，吹吹牛呢。"
G["I thought that they now called themselves the Scarlet Onslaught?"]="他们现在自称血色先锋军了吧？"
G["I thought that was it... I thought I was going to die.  Thank you, stranger."]="Creía que... creía que iba a morir. Gracias, $gdesconocido:desconocida;."
G["I thought the Park fell into a big hole, but this one's way bigger and it has a whirlwind!"]="我还以为这个公园已经变成了一个大洞。但现在，它更大了，还有了一个大旋风！"
G["I thought they were going to tear me apart!"]="我以为他们要把我撕成碎片！"
G["I thought this was a tournament of \"strength.\" Yet I see only weakness."]="Pensaba que era un torneo de \"fuerza\". Pero solo veo debilidad."
G["I thought this was going to be our chance to get away from it all?  Our vacation?"]="我想这个可能是让我们彻底远离烦恼的好机会？我们的假期？"
G["I thought those eyes would NEVER leave me alone!"]="我还以为自己永远也摆脱不了那些眼睛！"
G["I thought we could solve our own problems. But for ten thousand years, we stagnated, our doubts and fears buried in the land, rising up to fester whenever we allowed them."]="我觉得我们能解决自己的问题。但一万年过去了，我们停滞不前，地下的疑虑和恐惧一有机会，就会出来作祟。"
G["I thought we had enough in your line of work, but it looks like we have some openings.  Report to the civilian liaison."]="我还以为人手已经够了，不过好像还有一些空缺。向平民联络官报到吧。"
G["I thought we talked about this, Brogg. You can't stay in this building. Sure, it can house you, but there's no room for anyone else!"]="布洛格，我记得我们谈过这个问题。你不能待在房间里。当然啦，你是可以塞进去，不过其他人就没空间了！"
G["I thought we were friend, buddy! You leave Hakmud stranded?"]="我以为我们是朋友！你要丢下哈克穆德吗？"
G["I thought we were going to be best friends!"]="我想我们会变成最好的朋友！"
G["I thought we were going to speak with the regent lord. I'm beginning to question whether or not he exists at all at this point."]="我想我们应该去和摄政王谈谈了，现在我甚至开始怀疑他是否真的存在了。"
G["I thought we were just building houses, not a fortress."]="我以为我们只是要造一座房子，而不是堡垒。"
G["I thought we'd killed everybody... Mor'norokk should be pleased with this!"]="我以为我们把所有人都杀了……莫诺洛克一定会很开心的！"
G["I thought you might come. You've proven very persistent. Annoyingly so."]="我知道你会来。你真顽强，顽强得令人讨厌。"
G["I thought you only felt weather in your knees."]="我还以为你只能靠膝盖来感受天气的变化呢。"
G["I thought you were almost done?"]="完了？"
G["I thought you were going to hit them. You roll that keg like you're new, or something."]="Pensaba que ibas a golpearlos. Ruedas ese barril como si fueras $gnuevo:nueva;."
G["I thought you were going to keep these things off of me?"]="我想你是来帮我挡住那些东西的吧？"
G["I thought you would see it my way..."]="我还以为你认同我的观点……"
G["I thought you would see the Light, Godfrey... Now speak quickly, fiend. What does it say?"]="高弗雷，你已经见识到圣光的力量了……恶魔，说吧。秘典上都写了些什么？"
G["I thought you'd never ask!"]="我以为你不会这么主动的！"
G["I thought you'd see it my way."]="我就知道我们会达成共识。"
G["I thought... I thought you were... dead."]="我还以为……还以为你已经死了。"
G["I tink I made an angry poo-poo. It gonna blow!"]="吹个球，吹个“卟卟”会爆的大气球！"
G["I tink ya be even more like ya father den ya thought, even witout da demon blood."]="虽然没有恶魔之血，但你却比自己所想的更像你父亲。"
G["I tire of interruptions from the insignificant.  Your time has come, $n!"]="我对这些无意义的干扰感到厌烦了。你的死期到了，$n！"
G["I tire of these ogres. We should wipe them out, all of them."]="我厌烦这些食人魔。我们应该消灭他们，全部。"
G["I tire of this disguise. Now we finish this!"]="我受够这些伪装了。让我们做个了断吧！"
G["I tire of this nonsense! Prepare to die!"]="我听厌了这些废话！准备受死吧！"
G["I tire of this.  Do you see this clutch amidst which you stand?  I have nurtured the spark within them, but that life-force is and always will be mine.  Behold, power beyond your comprehension!"]="我已经厌倦了。看见你们立足的这片巢群了吗？我的力量正是滋养它们的活力。但这些生命力量永远属于我。面对这超越认知的力量吧！"
G["I tire of your evasive babble, doomguard. Explain to me why you and your kind are drawn to sacrificial magics."]="我厌倦了你的喋喋不休，末日守卫。告诉我你和你的同类为何如此执迷于献祭法术。"
G["I tire of your insolence! I will choke the life from you, impudent slave!"]="我受够你的无礼了！我要掐死你，放肆的奴隶！"
G["I told A'dal that playing host to a mass of flea-bitten refugees would only end in trouble, but would he listen? No, no, what would a Scryer know about such things? Bah."]="我告诉过阿达尔收容大量浑身长满虱子的难民只会给自己带来更多的麻烦，但是他会听吗？不，不，这样的事要是被占星者知道该怎么办？啊。"
G["I told Gar'dul not to build a fortress on top of a Silithid colony.\n\nDid he listen to Crawgol? No!"]="我告诉过加杜尔，不要在异种生物的巢穴上建造城堡。\n\n他会听克劳格的话吗？不！"
G["I told him he would simply have to contact my agent."]="我早就告诉过他了，叫他直接联系我的经纪人。"
G["I told him! I told Ban we needed to strike! This is all his fault!"]="我早就说了！我早跟班说了应该出击！这都是他的错！"
G["I told my son, I told Dion, don't take the yaks to the field when it's raining. And what does he do? He takes out the yaks when it is raining.\n\nIt is no surprise that we now have sick yaks!\n\nAi-ya! How did I raise such a foolish son?"]="我告诉过我的儿子，我告诉过迪恩，下雨时不要将牦牛带到牧场。然后他做了什么？他在雨天将牦牛带到牧场。\n\n现在我们的牦牛生病了，这并不奇怪！\n\n唉呀！我怎么会生出这样一个愚蠢的儿子？"
G["I told myself I wouldn't burden the Cenarion Circle with our expedition's problems, $n.  Our military strength is minimal, however.  We're scholars and explorers, first and foremost."]="我告诉自己不要用远征队的问题去麻烦塞纳里奥议会，$n。然而，我们的军事力量太渺小了。这主要是因为，我们大部分都是学者和探险者。"
G["I told ya so!"]="我提醒过你了！"
G["I told ye not tae leave the boar ribs out! Why couldna yae had a proper stomach and eaten yer dinner like the rest o' us Buckeys?"]="我告诉过你，不要丢掉那些猪排骨！为什么你就不能像其他巴克伊家的人一样，有一副能好好吃饭的正经胃口？"
G["I told you I'd be better prepared when next we met. I've fought and won the Hyldsmeet, trained at Valkyrion, and here I am.  Come and get some!"]="我说过，下次见面时，我会做好充分的准备。我取得了海德比武会的胜利，在瓦基里安接受了严酷的训练。今非昔比，尝尝我的厉害吧！"
G["I told you I'd have you, Pei-Zhi. You've set us back thousands of spirits today, but I'd gladly trade them all to see you bound."]="我说了我会抓住你的，裴智。你今天放跑了几千条灵魂，不过能用它们引你入彀，我就很满足了。"
G["I told you it was a fool's quest!"]="我告诉过你这是个愚蠢的举动！"
G["I told you lads to trust ol' Sully! Ha haaaa!"]="我就说相信老苏利没错吧！哈哈哈！"
G["I told you only to summon me if that stupid elf returned! What's this? No matter, you won't detain me long."]="我告诉过你，那个愚蠢的精灵回来时再召唤我！这是怎么回事？不管怎样，你都不会占用我太多时间了……"
G["I told you that you weren't machine compatible!"]="我早说了，你跟机械八字不合！"
G["I told you to leave!"]="我劝过你离开的！"
G["I told you to wait for me elsewhere, not follow me like a puppy..."]="我告诉过你在其它地方等我，不要像只小狗一样跟着我……"
G["I told you what I know, now shove off!"]="我已经把我知道的都告诉你了，现在走吧！"
G["I told you! These rocks are slippery!"]="我告诉过你！那些岩石很滑的！"
G["I told you, sugar. You aren't hot enough to handle me!"]="我提醒过你了，宝贝儿。就你那点热量，还不足以对付我！"
G["I took Helgrum under my wing when I arrived in Stonard. Under my harsh glare, he became an even greater tracker than before... and my only companion.\n\nI thought myself strong. I thought no suffering could break my spirit. When I saw the humans sink their swords into Helgrum... into my mate... I found out how wrong I was."]="当我到达斯通纳德的时候，我还带着赫格拉姆。在我严厉的教导下，他成为了一名比以前更优秀的追踪者……也是我唯一的同伴。\n\n我以为自己很强。我以为任何痛苦都不可能让我的灵魂倒下。但是，当我看到那些人类的刀剑刺穿赫格拉姆，杀死了我的同伴……我发现自己彻底错了。"
G["I took it from one of these trolls as I was captured. Maybe you can find a way to use it against them."]="在我被抓住时，我从一名巨魔身上偷来了这枚咒符。或许你能利用它来对付这帮家伙。"
G["I took no pleasure in their deaths."]="他们的死亡令我也感到难过。"
G["I took your dead master's banner. Come at me, $r!"]="是我拿了你那个死鬼大师的旗帜。来抓我呀，$r！"
G["I train and guide young hunters in the traditions passed down many generations."]="我按照传统一代代地训练、指导年轻猎人。"
G["I train better against a target dummy."]="我觉得和假人对练都比和你来得有用。"
G["I train hunters in the ways and traditions of our ancestors."]="我用祖先传下来的方法训练猎人。"
G["I train only warriors, $c. You'll have to look elsewhere."]="我只对战士进行训练，$c。你得去别处找找。"
G["I travelled all this way to speak with the famed \"Seer of the Dragonmaw.\" I wanted to see inside Cho'gall's dark heart before I tear it out.\n\nBut she's worthless to me. All riddles and rhyme. Maybe you can help."]="He viajado hasta aquí para hablar con la famosa \"Vidente de los Faucedraco\". Quería mirar en el interior del corazón de Cho'gall antes de arrancárselo.\n\nPero no me sirve. Es todo rimas y acertijos. A lo mejor tú puedes ayudarme."
G["I tried so hard to tell Jim... to tell anyone... who was behind this, but I couldn't find a way..."]="我千方百计地想要告诉吉姆……想要告诉所有人……谁才是幕后黑手，可惜始终没有机会……"
G["I tried to boot a jade monster in the head but hurt my paw."]="我想要踢碎一只玉石怪物的脑袋，结果却把爪子弄伤了。"
G["I tried to save you Istaria, but I was too weak."]="我想要救你，伊丝塔瑞亚，但我太弱了。"
G["I tried to tell him... to tell him that Hellscream betrayed us, cast aside a Warchief's responsibility to his own people.  But Nazgrim... too loyal... too proud."]="我试图告诉他……地狱咆哮背叛了我们大家，抛弃了对人民的责任。但纳兹戈林……太忠诚……太骄傲了。"
G["I tried, master. I tried."]="我尽力了，主人，我尽力了。"
G["I tried."]="我尽力了。"
G["I truly believe now that the mogu thought they were doing the work of the titans. They fought against the mantid and used the powers of the Vale to create new life."]="我现在真的相信魔古族以为自己在完成泰坦的工作。他们与螳螂妖斗争，并使用锦绣谷的力量创造新生命。"
G["I trust in the will of the Klaxxi. They know what is best for our people."]="我信任卡拉克西的意志。他们会作出符合我族人民最高利益的决定。"
G["I trust it."]="我信了。"
G["I trust that ye're well and good?"]="我想你过得还不错？"
G["I trust that you will, but please, be careful."]="我相信你会的，但请一定小心。"
G["I trust that you're planning to do something about that giant surge of anger that's erupting from the middle of the lake?!"]="我相信你肯定会对从湖中央喷薄而出的那团汹涌怒气做点什么的，对吧？！"
G["I trust the Light is with you, $n. Is there something that I can I help you with?"]="我相信圣光会与你同在，$n。我能帮忙吗？"
G["I trust very few of your kind, $n. But I can tell that you are a friend."]="Tengo muy poca confianza en los de tu clase, $n. Pero podría decirse que eres $gun amigo:una amiga;."
G["I trust you and my son are getting along? Anduin is anything but shy."]="我相信你和我儿子相处得不错？安度因唯一不具备的特质就是内向。"
G["I trust you have learned: To fight out of fear or anger is to fight a war that never ends."]="我相信你已经领悟了：若因恐惧和愤怒而战，则此战永无休止。"
G["I trust you're taking every precaution....\n\nThis is a dangerous place and I couldn't forgive myself if something were to happen to you."]="希望你已经做好了防范措施……\n\n这里非常危险，如果你出了什么事，我是不会原谅自己的。"
G["I try to keep Sentinel Hill stocked, and that's not easy with all the action we see."]="我会尽量保证哨兵岭物资供给的，要维持这项行动可不容易。"
G["I turn over the man to my liege for punishment, as he has broken the law of the land and it is my sworn duty to enforce it."]="我将这个人交给王上来处理，因为他破坏了这里的法律，而我的职责就是把他抓住。"
G["I turned that hate on the Illidari and the Burning Legion... but they weren't the ones who betrayed us.  We were the naaru's chosen!  We lived and died for them!"]="我把那仇恨转移到了伊利达雷和燃烧军团身上……但是他们并不是那些背叛我们的家伙。纳鲁选择了我们！我们为了他们战斗到死！"
G["I uh - I could use a little help here?"]="唔……有人能帮帮我吗？"
G["I understand Garrosh's desires. The urge for battle is strong within every orc, especially against a foe that has killed our people. But, the warchief has proven time and again that strategy is as important as strength in a battle.\n\nWe will set out when the time is right. We are no longer a band of mindless, demon-manipulated savages. This is the new Horde."]="我能理解加尔鲁什的心情。面对这不共戴天的仇敌，所有兽人的心中都燃起了战斗的怒火。但是，酋长反复地强调，战略计划和军队实力都是胜负的决定性因素。\n\n时机成熟时，我们一定会远征诺森德。我们不再是头脑简单，任由恶魔驱使的奴隶。这就是新生的部落。"
G["I understand how you feel Makuru.  Sedai was my brother after all.  Yet we can't disgrace his memory by going against his very ideals."]="我知道你的感受，玛库鲁。瑟丹毕竟是我的兄弟。然而我们不能通过反对他的理想来纪念他。"
G["I understand that Alexstrasza has pronounced judgement on Deathwing. Perhaps this whole ordeal will end, right here?"]="我明白，阿莱克丝塔萨已经对死亡之翼做出了判决。也许这场磨难终将在这里结束？"
G["I understand that many individuals seek romance in taverns and festivals like this one, but alcohol dulls the senses and makes calculating the difficulties of daily life all fuzzy!\n\nBut I've found a solution! Through many trials and tribulations, I've engineered an extraordinary device! With these goggles on, ANYONE looks attractive!\n\nMmm... including you, cutie! Tell you what. I'll give you a discount!"]="人们总是希望在旅店或是这样的节日聚会上找到艳遇，我非常理解这种想法。但是酒精会让人的感官变得迟钝，让你忘却生计的艰辛。\n\n不过，我找到了解决方法！通过很多次的试验和磨难，我设计出一种特别的装置！只要戴上这些护目镜，所有人都会变得魅力十足！\n\n嗯……包括你，美人！怎么样，我还可以给你打折！"
G["I understand that the Cataclysm has struck Dustwallow Marsh as well, but Mudsprocket appears relatively safe. Can you not spare any goblins?"]="我明白大灾变也同样袭击了尘泥沼泽，但泥链镇看上去还相对安全。你愿意派些地精来帮忙吗？"
G["I understand that the Cataclysm has struck Feralas as well, but Camp Mojache appears relatively safe. Can you not spare any braves?"]="我明白大灾变也同样袭击了菲拉斯，但莫沙彻营地看上去还相对安全。你愿意伸出援手吗？"
G["I understand that the mind of the Tushui is not the only path to wisdom, but there are yet choices that should not be accepted.  Risks that are too dangerous to ever be taken.  Decisions that I cannot forgive...\n\nIt is time for me to leave Shen-zin Su.  I have found respect for Delora Lionheart for her confidence and valor, and her tales of the Alliance speak well of her people.  I do not yet know if I will find a home there, but wherever my path may lead, I will find a way to help the world beyond this isle.\n\nDespite everything, I've enjoyed what little time we've had together, $n.  I hope that you might join me, but I understand that this decision is not an easy one."]="我明白，土水派之道并非通向智慧之门的唯一途径。但，有些选择依然令人无法接受，有些风险仍然令人难以承担，有些决定始终让我难以原谅……\n\n现在，是我离开神真子的时候了。我敬重德罗娜·莱因哈特的信心和勇气，她口中有关联盟的故事对她的人民赞誉有加。我还不知道自己是否能在那里找到归宿，但是无论我的道路通向何方，我都会找到一个方法来帮助迷踪岛之外的世界。\n\n无论如何，我很喜欢我们共处的这段短暂时光，$n。我希望你可以和我一起走，但我明白做这个决定并不容易。"
G["I understand that you are to thank for the bulk of our supply."]="我知道，你会为我们做好了充足的储备而感到庆幸。"
G["I understand this holiday is a creation not of our allies, but the Horde. Why we follow suit, I do not know."]="这个节日原本是部落发明的，不是联盟。真不明白我们为什么也要庆祝。"
G["I understand you want to join the Alliance."]="我知道你们想要加入联盟。"
G["I understand you, Garrosh. I know what it is like to bear the weight of your father's deeds."]="我明白，加尔鲁什。我知道背负父亲的罪孽是什么感觉。"
G["I understand your desire to inflict more suffering on the Horde. But when do we stop? How many more Alliance will number among the dead if we invaded Thunder Bluff, Azshara, and the Echo Isles? And how would we govern the conquered people?\n\nThe Pandaren always question why we fight. Today, we've won justice, and have given the Horde an opportunity to atone by supporting their rebellion. Further bloodshed would be for vengeance alone - and it would reap vengeance in return."]="我理解你希望进一步打击部落的想法。但冤冤相报何时了？如果我们入侵雷霆崖、艾萨拉和回音群岛，联盟又会增加多少伤亡？我们又该如何管理那些被征服的人民？\n\n熊猫人总是问我们为何而战。今天，我们赢得了正义，并通过支援起义军给了部落一个赎罪改过的机会。更多的血腥杀戮就变成了单纯的复仇——而这只会引来更多的复仇。"
G["I understand your frustration. Your people are ferocious in battle, and this isn't what you're used to."]="Entiendo tu frustración. Tu gente es feroz en el combate, y esto no es a lo que estás acostumbrad$go:a;."
G["I understand, Earthmother."]="我明白了，大地母亲。"
G["I understand, I owe money. I can pay you if I need to, but...\n\nI NEED this money. Our inn is falling apart. If I don't have money to pay for repairs, I'll be out of a job... and a home."]="我明白，我欠你钱。如果能还我肯定还了，但是……\n\n我急需这笔钱。我们的小店已经年久失修。如果我没钱付维修费的话，我不仅会失业……而且家庭也要垮了。"
G["I understand, Lorewalker. But the Serpent's Heart project is behind schedule and we've not a stone to spare!"]="我明白了，游学者。可是由于玉石短缺，神龙之心的项目进度已经严重落后了！"
G["I understand, brotha. I will tink on this and be troublin' ya no furtha. You have a world to be savin'."]="我明白，兄弟。我会自己考虑，不再打扰你了。你还要去拯救这个世界。"
G["I understand, my friend. I shall find someone to help your master. Go back to him now, or at least stay close."]="Ya entiendo, $gamigo mío:amiga mía;. Encontraré a alguien que ayude a tu maestro. Vuelve junto a él ahora, o al menos permanece cerca de él."
G["I understand, now. Farewell, and good luck."]="我现在明白了。永别了，还有，祝你好运。"
G["I understand."]="我明白了。"
G["I understand.  Thank you."]="我明白了，谢谢你。"
G["I understand. Here's the payment. I'm sorry to have taken so much of your time, $gsir:ma'am;."]="我明白了，这是我的欠款。很抱歉占用你这么长时间，$g先生:女士;。"
G["I understand. I'll talk to my father."]="我明白。我会跟父亲谈的。"
G["I understand. Thank you, great Crane."]="我明白了。谢谢你，朱鹤。"
G["I understand. Thank you, mighty Ox."]="我明白了。谢谢你，玄牛。"
G["I urge you to reconsider, Phaoris. Deathwing would use the scepters' power to unravel the secrets of Uldum and unleash great destruction."]="希望你能重新考虑，法奥瑞斯。死亡之翼会使用节杖的力量，开启奥丹姆的秘密，制造恐怖异常的毁灭灾难。"
G["I used good judgment when you showed none.  I don't want to see you lead us into ruin, Krenna!"]="面对困境，我做出了明智的判断，而你却束手无策。克雷娜，我不愿意眼睁睁地看着你将我们带上绝路！"
G["I used ta be in the Explorers' League, ye know.\nBut then I realized the only thing I really cared ta look for was GEMS.\nBig, sparklin', colorful, valuable gems... oh, how I love ye!"]="Yo antes estaba en la Liga de Expedicionarios, sabes.\n\nPero me di cuenta de que, en realidad, las GEMAS eran lo único que me interesaba buscar.\n\nGemas grandes, relucientes, coloridas y valiosas... Oh, ¡cómo me gustan!"
G["I used to amuse myself by accepting challenges from anyone who would offer them, but I've long since grown tired of such easy victories.\n\nFor now, I'm taking some time to get my reagent business off the ground and write a book about my experiences in Twilight's Hammer."]="我曾以接受别人的挑战为乐，但是他们无一例外地都败了，我早已厌倦了这种廉价的胜利。\n\n现在，我将精力放在经营材料生意上，还打算写一本回忆录，记录我在暮光之锤度过的岁月。"
G["I used to be a simple ticket redeemer at the racetrack. Well, no more racetrack, so no more job.\n\nI'm trying my hand at negotiations now. Could you help me get things going here? They have oil!"]="我以前就是个在赛道边上谋生的奖券商。可现在没比赛，也就没钱赚了。\n\n我现在正在努力学习谈判。你能帮我让这里的一切顺利进行吗？他们有油！"
G["I used to be beautiful..."]="我曾经很漂亮……"
G["I used to be handsome..."]="我曾经英俊潇洒……"
G["I used to be known as Iolol until a secret vote was passed around town that resulted in me having to change my name. It was either change it or go the way of Corki. You would have done the same. What do you think of my new name? Huge improvement, right?\n\nBy the way, check the bulletin board if you're looking for work."]="我的名字曾经是埃欧罗，这是我的故事：有一天，村子里进行了一场秘密的投票，最终那次投票导致我改变了自己的名字。他们让我选择是改名字还是像考尔奇一样。要是你的话，你也会这么做的吧。你觉得我的新名字怎么样？有很大的改进，对吧？\n\n对了，如果你在找活干的话，去布告栏那里看看吧。"
G["I used to be more humerus."]="我以前是很幽默的。"
G["I used to be overcome with frequent, debilitating fits of rage. But since I met Driz, I've been able to live a happy, productive life.\n\nAnd I get to tear things apart with my bare hands."]="我以前经常会频繁地陷入令人疲惫的愤怒之中。但自从我遇到德利兹之后，我的生活变得更加快乐而且积极。\n\n现在我已经学会了用两只空手把东西撕碎。"
G["I used to direct Steamwheedle's shredder development program, but last month I struck out on my own. Now all my suppliers have blacklisted me. Worse, my development efforts haven't even gotten off the ground yet. I could use your help, $n!"]="我曾经负责管理热砂港的伐木机开发工作。但上个月，我自己出来单干了。现在我的全部供应商都把我列入了黑名单。更糟糕的是，我的开发工作至今都没有实际成效。所以我非常需要你的帮助，$n！"
G["I used to have 1850 spell power, what happaned?"]="我的法术强度曾经高达1850，现在这是怎么回事？"
G["I used to know a dwarf that claimed gnomes evolved from beneath the earth. That we all started out as sand gnomes. What a load of nonsense! Sand gnomes? PUH-LEASE!"]="我认识一个矮人，这家伙宣称侏儒是从地下进化来的。我们的祖先是沙漠侏儒。简直是一派胡言！还沙漠侏儒呢！我呸！"
G["I used to live only for the pursuit of knowledge.\n\nNow I spend every waking hour searching for a way for our people to rekindle our lost immortality."]="曾经，我只为追求知识而生。\n\n现在，我穷尽每一分每一秒，只为让我的族人重新获得永生。"
G["I used to speak to the sea. Now it only screams."]="Solía hablar con el mar. Ahora solo grita."
G["I used to think it was priests that were overpowered. Now I think it's rogues."]="我曾经以为过于强大的是牧师。现在看来，是潜行者才对。"
G["I used to work for Grand Inquisitor Isillien! Your idea of pain is a normal mid-afternoon for me!"]="我曾是大检察官伊森利恩的部下！你的鞭刑就像午后茶点一般！"
G["I usually leave that sort of thing to the gnomes.  If you want to take up the profession, I'm sure you could find some gnomes hanging out in Stormwind that would train you."]="我通常将那种事情留给侏儒去做。要是你想学习这项专业的话，我想你可以在暴风城找到一些侏儒来训练你。"
G["I utterly cannot stand the presence of these demons!"]="我完全忍受不了这些恶魔了！"
G["I very much doubt that he will have anything to say, stranger..."]="Dudo mucho que tenga algo que decir, $gforastero:forastera;."
G["I vill discovah who vas behind zhis cowardly act!\n\nAnd vhen I do...."]="我会查出谁才是这懦夫行为的背后主使！\n\n然后……"
G["I vill vorry about zhe drivink!"]="我来负责驾驶！"
G["I vould offer you a prestigious position in my organization if I didn't haf to kill you."]="我真的很想让你在我的组织中得到一个崇高的职位，而不是杀死你。"
G["I vow that the Silver Covenant will see Quel'Delar restored."]="我发誓，银色盟约终将迎来奎尔德拉的回归。"
G["I wager you won't last a week."]="我打赌你连一个星期都撑不到。"
G["I wakes me up in the mornings. The sun makes me tired. Hard to think."]="早晨，我让自己醒来时。太阳总是让我觉得很累，难以思考。"
G["I walk this road alone, seeking ways to defend my honor and rid this land of our enemies.\n\nWhat can I do for you, $n?"]="Transito este camino a solas, ideando diversas maneras de defender mi honor y liberar esta tierra de nuestros enemigos.\n\n¿En qué puedo ayudarte, $n?"
G["I walked up to the top of the mountain and took a hold of my sniper rifle."]="我走到了山顶，手里端着狙击枪。"
G["I wandered for the rest of my natural life in search of knowledge, seeing more wonder and meeting more strange and mysterious races than any of my people before me. I travelled across the length and breadth of ancient Kalimdor until there was no more to see, no new lands across the horizon.\n\nYet... there was still so much I did not know as I felt my final journey approaching and I wept for the things I would never know.\n\nAs I fell, my life at an end, that is when they found me."]="我穷尽一生寻找知识，目睹了许多奇迹，遇见了各种各样神秘的种族，这些经历远远超越了所有的先辈。我的足迹遍布远古的卡利姆多大陆，直到再也找不到新鲜的事物，直到地平线看不见新的陆地。\n\n但是……就在这次旅途即将划上句号时，我觉得自己还是对很多东西缺乏了解。我深知这将成为永远的遗憾，禁不住放声痛哭。\n\n自然生命总有消亡的一天，我跌到在地。这时，他们找到了我。"
G["I wanna be just like the pitfighter!"]="我真想变得像斗士那样！"
G["I wanna fight too! I'm ready!"]="我也想战斗！我准备好了！"
G["I wanna go home."]="我想回家。"
G["I wanna go home... Take off this uniform and leave the Horde!"]="我想回家……脱下这身军装，离开部落！"
G["I wanna play soldier!"]="我想扮演士兵！"
G["I wanna see the Mage Tower."]="我要去看法师塔。"
G["I wanna see the dragon skeleton in the great library."]="我要去大图书馆看龙骨。"
G["I wanna see!"]="我要看！"
G["I wanna set something on fire, already!"]="我早已按耐不住了！"
G["I want BLUE fire!"]="我要蓝火！"
G["I want a panther encrusted in the world's finest jewels!  Wait, doesn't one of my friends already have one of those?"]="我想要一头镶满了全世界最珍贵珠宝的猎豹！等等，我有个朋友不是已经有一头了吗？"
G["I want a sample..."]="我需要一份样本……"
G["I want a surgical strike, Slidore. Carpet the road with fire!"]="我要你进行外科手术式的精确打击，斯里多尔。把这条路炸平！"
G["I want all of this fel reaver technology packed up and ready to ship out within the next turning of Outland!"]="我想把所有的魔能机甲技术整理好，准备在下次外域转向之前运出。"
G["I want all of your trackers out in search of the criminal, Matis the Cruel. I have given trusted agents of the Hand flare guns. Should you or one of your trackers see the flare, it means that an agent has found Matis and needs assistance. And remember, tracker, Matis is to be brought back to me alive."]="我希望你们全部去搜查那个罪犯，残忍的玛提斯。我将一把信号枪交给了一位可靠的阿古斯之手特派员。当你们看到闪光信号的时候，就意味着玛提斯被发现了。记住，必须把玛提斯给我活着带回来。"
G["I want blood!"]="我要血！"
G["I want more ale!  Give me more ale!"]="我想喝更多的啤酒！给我更多的啤酒！"
G["I want my daddy!"]="我想我的爸爸！"
G["I want my mommy."]="我要妈妈。"
G["I want nothing to do with Silithus, the Qiraji and least of all, any damned dragons!"]="我不想再跟希利苏斯、其拉虫人和该死的龙类有任何关系了！"
G["I want on that last ship! Don't leave us!"]="我想搭最后一班船！别扔下我们！"
G["I want some candy!"]="我想要些糖果！"
G["I want that one killed! The one right there that doesn't look like the others!"]="我想要那家伙的命！那里的那个家伙看起来有些与众不同！"
G["I want the arterieeeeeeeeees!"]="大块的——留给我！"
G["I want the perimeter secured and the gates manned by two guards at all times.  No one gets in, no one gets out."]="给我守住外围。大门始终要有两名卫兵把守。不允许任何人进出城市。"
G["I want these Alliance and Horde pigs dead!"]="我要这些联盟和部落的蠢货们都去死！"
G["I want this all to be over soon."]="希望这一切能早日结束。"
G["I want this deck so clean I could eat off of it!"]="我要这甲板干净到足以入口！"
G["I want this nightmare to be over!"]="我要结束这场噩梦！"
G["I want those boots! Nobody touch that corpse!"]="我想要这些靴子！都别碰那具尸体！"
G["I want those catapults built YESTERDAY!"]="我昨天就说要你们完成那些投石器了！"
G["I want those elves and their draenei friends dead, now!"]="我希望那些精灵和他们的德莱尼朋友现在就完蛋！"
G["I want to ask something else."]="我想问问其他的。"
G["I want to ask you about something else."]="我想问问你别的事情。"
G["I want to be a singer when I grow up!"]="当我长大之后，我要当个歌手！"
G["I want to be like Kerri when I grow up!"]="等我长大以后，也要像克莉一样！"
G["I want to be reborn. Tell me what I must do!"]="我想要得到重生，告诉我要怎样做吧！"
G["I want to become a blacksmith."]="我想成为一个铁匠。"
G["I want to begin the statue puzzle."]="我想着手解开雕像之谜。"
G["I want to browse your goods."]="我想要看看你卖的货物。"
G["I want to buy another stink bomb!"]="我想再买一个臭气弹！"
G["I want to buy some portal shards."]="我想买一些传送门碎片。"
G["I want to catch Gahz'ranka!  Tell me how!"]="我要抓住加兹兰卡！告诉我怎么样才可以抓住它！"
G["I want to create a guild crest."]="我要设计一件公会战袍。"
G["I want to die like an orc..."]="我要像兽人那样死去……"
G["I want to drive a Spider Tank!"]="我想要驾驶蜘蛛坦克！"
G["I want to eat it."]="我想吃。"
G["I want to exchange my Amber Essence for Emerald Essence."]="我想用琥珀精华换取翡翠精华。"
G["I want to exchange my Amber Essence for Ruby Essence."]="我想用琥珀精华换取红玉精华。"
G["I want to exchange my Emerald Essence for Amber Essence."]="我想用翡翠精华换取琥珀精华。"
G["I want to exchange my Emerald Essence for Ruby Essence."]="我想用翡翠精华换取红玉精华。"
G["I want to exchange my Ruby Essence for Amber Essence."]="我想用红玉精华换取琥珀精华。"
G["I want to exchange my Ruby Essence for Emerald Essence."]="我想用红玉精华换取翡翠精华。"
G["I want to explore the world!"]="我想要探索世界！"
G["I want to fight to increase my rank!"]="我想要参加战斗，提升我的等级！"
G["I want to fly on the wings of the bronze flight."]="我想坐在青铜龙背上飞翔。"
G["I want to fly on the wings of the green flight."]="我想坐在绿龙背上飞翔。"
G["I want to fly on the wings of the red flight."]="我想坐在红龙背上飞翔。"
G["I want to fly to an old location!"]="我想飞回曾经去过的地方！"
G["I want to go back to the orphanage!"]="我想回孤儿院！"
G["I want to go home and see my family, but Gott won't let us off this mountain!"]="我想回家去看看我的亲人，但多德根本不让我们离开这座山！"
G["I want to go home now."]="我想回家了。"
G["I want to go home!"]="我想回家！"
G["I want to go home."]="我想回家。"
G["I want to join your movement."]="我想加入你们的行动。"
G["I want to keep going until we see what's over that big wall to the west, but Raj'ku just keeps staring at all the giant vegetables around here. Maybe deep down, he's itching to be a farmer!"]="我想继续前进，直到抵达西边那道雄伟长城，看见另一侧的景象为止，可拉古的眼睛却总盯着附近那些巨大的蔬菜。也许在内心深处，他渴望成为一名农夫！"
G["I want to learn about Archaeology."]="我要学习考古学。"
G["I want to make sure that you are properly equipped for the trials ahead."]="我想让你为未来的试炼做好准备。"
G["I want to release the corrupted saber to Winna."]="我想将堕落的猫交给温娜。"
G["I want to return to Lion's Landing."]="我想要回到雄狮港。"
G["I want to see a tower built right here."]="这里要建一座塔楼。"
G["I want to see every scrap of paper you wretches get your claws on."]="把你们的脏爪子翻到的任何纸片儿都送来给我过目。"
G["I want to see how long I can last against the waves of undead."]="我想看看，在亡灵的连续攻势前，我能坚持多久。"
G["I want to see some sweat, here. If I don't start seeing sweat, I guarantee I'll start seeing blood."]="我要看到些汗水。如果我还看不到汗水，我保证，我一定能看到鲜血。"
G["I want to see the Skyfire in Jade Forest. Take me back."]="我想要看看飞翔在翡翠林天空中的天火号。带我回去。"
G["I want to see the baby!"]="我想看看宝宝！"
G["I want to show you a different side of me...."]="我要给你看看我的另外一面……"
G["I want to speak to Marshal McBride! This is an outrage!"]="我要和治安官玛克布莱德谈谈！这样对待我简直太无礼了！"
G["I want to start over."]="我想重新开始。"
G["I want to stay here and reflect on what we have seen. Please see Erelas and tell him what we have learned."]="我想呆在这儿，思考一下所见的事情。找到艾瑞拉斯并告诉他我们学到的东西。"
G["I want to stop the Scourge as much as you do.  How can I help?"]="我和你一样，希望能阻止天灾军团的入侵。我能帮上什么忙吗？"
G["I want to test our damage-dealers."]="我想测试我们的伤害输出。"
G["I want to test our entire raid."]="我要试试我们的团队。"
G["I want to test our tanks."]="我想测试我们的坦克。"
G["I want to train him, but I really don't want him to get hurt."]="我想要训练他，可我又不想让他受伤害。"
G["I want to travel the world someday. Have you ever seen Stormwind?"]="真希望有一天能环游世界。你见过暴风城吗？"
G["I want to use my challenge card!"]="我想使用我的挑战卡牌！"
G["I want two sharpshooters to stay behind and cover the deck.  Everyone else, use the ropes to rappel down.  Let's give them hell!"]="让两个狙击手待在后面，掩护甲板。其他人，顺着绳子下去。让他们下地狱去吧！"
G["I want you all to listen good... anyone who's not with me can start looking for a new job!"]="我要你们都好好听着……任何不跟从我的人现在就可以去找一个新的工作！"
G["I want you both to demonstrate the techniques I have taught you for the benefit of the younger students here.  Ready...  begin!"]="我想让你们俩在更年轻的学生面前展示我教给你们的种种技能。准备……开始！"
G["I want you to be with me... forever and ever."]="我想要你和我在一起……永远在一起。"
G["I want you to know that I sincerely appreciate your aid, $c. We are not fighting beasts out here, but a foe both cunning and fanatical. We must stick together or hang separately."]="Quiero que sepas que aprecio tu ayuda de verdad, $n. No estamos luchando contra animales, sino que nos enfrentamos a un enemigo astuto y fanático. Debemos permanecer juntos o separarnos."
G["I want you to know that your Alliance has my full and unwavering support in this campaign."]="请你相信，联盟在这场战役中，能得到我毫无保留、坚定不移的支持。"
G["I want you to pit the Bloodpetal against one another."]="我想让你们在彼此身上测试一下血瓣花。"
G["I want you to speak with the local gorillas."]="我希望你和当地的猩猩谈一谈。"
G["I want you to test the limits of your wings."]="希望你测试一下你的翅膀的极限。"
G["I want you to test your Bite skill on the people of Marshal's Stand."]="我想让你在马绍尔哨站的敌人身上测试你的撕咬技能。"
G["I wanted to help fight the Headless Horseman, but old Grimwatch wouldn't let me!"]="我想去帮他们打败无头骑士，但是老格雷沃基不让我去！"
G["I wanted to practice my spells on the bunnies outside my home to make my magic stronger so I could go and kill all the bad guys in Gnomeregan and let all the gnomes go back home but momma said I was too young to go on adventures but then I met Mister Budd and he told me that you're only as young as you feel and that I could come here with his friends and I would get all the practice I needed but then we got caught and put in the cages...\n\n<Ashli takes a deep breath.>\n\nAre you a real $r?"]="Quería practicar mis hechizos con los conejitos que hay fuera de mi casa para mejorar mi magia y poder ir a matar a los malos de Gnomeregan y dejar que todos los gnomos volvieran a casa pero mamá dijo que era demasiado joven para meterme en aventuras pero entonces conocí al señor Budd y me dijo que solo eres tan joven como te sientes y que podía venir aquí con sus amigos y conseguiría toda la práctica que necesitaba pero entonces nos cogieron y enjaularon...\n\n<Ashli respira hondo.>\n\n¿Eres $gun auténtico:una auténtica; $r?"
G["I wanted to scream but only a low gasp escaped my lips. I was promptly beaten for this act of rebellion. As I lay on the ground, I could see Matis pacing in front of Saruan's body. He seemed visibly concerned. He stated that Sironas or Sirona or some such entity would have his flesh flayed from his bones if Saruan had perished in the beatings."]="我想大声尖叫，却只能发出微微的声音。因为刚才的反抗行动，我很快就被打倒在地。当我躺在地上时，看到玛提斯在撒鲁安的尸体旁边来回走动，显得非常焦虑。他曾说过如果撒鲁安死于他的折磨，那个希隆娜丝会活活要了他的命。"
G["I wanted to thank you once more for what you did for me. You gave me the courage to take back my home from the beasts of the forest. In doing so, I found Magwin!"]="我想再次感谢你为我做的一切。你给了我驱赶森林中的野兽、夺回了我的家园的勇气。而且，我还找到了麦戈薇！"
G["I was EMPEROR."]="我曾经是……皇帝。"
G["I was JUST about to wiggle myself free... I think."]="我差一点就能钻出来了……反正我是这么觉得的。"
G["I was a soldier of the Light once... Look at what I have become..."]="我曾经为圣光而战……可你看看我现在的样子……"
G["I was a young tauren, barely having reached adolescence at the time, but I knew that those that would brave the battles for our freedom were well protected in my namesake's vestments."]="我那时还是一个年轻的牛头人，没有成年，但我却知道，那些为了我们的自由而战的勇士们，都拥有一套与我同名的护甲。"
G["I was afforded a brief chance to attack their leader, and he was protected by some kind of magic. Make sure Morra hears of this before leading any kind of attack."]="我曾经有机会突袭他们的首领。但那个首领被某种魔法保护着。所以在发动攻击之前，一定要让莫拉知道这件事。"
G["I was almost ghoul bait! Thanks for the rescue!"]="我差点被食尸鬼给吃了！谢谢你救了我！"
G["I was among the greatest of the Kirin Tor. You shall not defeat me idling about!"]="我是肯瑞托最强大的法师之一。你们是不可能打败我的！"
G["I was as surprised as you to find the black dragonflight asserting its will against New Kargath.  Gorn is stubborn, and refuses help from anyone.\n\nEven so, High Examiner Bloodwatcher has asked me to watch from a distance, to make sure things do not become... ugly."]="得知黑龙要与新卡加斯对抗，我像你一样感到惊讶。高恩非常顽固，拒绝任何人的帮助。\n\n即使这样，高阶考察者泰瑟兰·血望者还是要求我时刻注意新卡加斯的情况，以确保局势对我们不会太……糟糕。"
G["I was away for too long. My absence cost us the lives of some of our greatest heroes. Trash like you and this evil witch were allowed to roam free -- unchecked."]="我离开得太久了。好几位伟大的英雄为此付出了生命的代价。而你这种人渣，还有这个邪恶的巫女却还在世上，为所欲为。"
G["I was barely inside their outer patrols when they caught me. I didn't find anything."]="我才刚刚进入他们的外围巡逻圈，就被抓住了。我什么都没找到。"
G["I was blinded by all of the excitement.\n\nI should have seen this coming from a mile away..."]="我被兴奋冲昏了头。\n\n我早该感觉到的……"
G["I was bone to be wild!"]="我的骨子里充满了野性！"
G["I was born here, $r. This is my world - all that I know... As a boy, my mother and father would regale me with tales of your world and the splendor it held. How I longed to leave this place.\n\nAlas, fate is a cruel mistress. My mother and father have long since passed, buried in this very graveyard. I remain to uphold their honor and the honor of my family - the Sons of Lothar."]="我出生在这里，$r。这是我的世界，我所了解的一切……当我还是个小孩子的时候，我的父母经常向我讲述你们那个世界的故事，你们那个世界的荣光。我是多么渴望离开这个地方啊。\n\n唉，命运是残酷的。我的父母已经去世很久了，长眠在这个坟墓里。我留在这里，为他们的荣耀而战，也为我的家族——洛萨之子的荣耀而战。"
G["I was certain I was going to die out here."]="我还以为这里将成为我的坟墓呢。"
G["I was chosen!  I will prevail!"]="我是被选中的！我是不可战胜的！"
G["I was chosen. My blood burns with his power!"]="我是他的选民。我的鲜血中燃烧着他的力量！"
G["I was constructed to serve as a repository for essential information regarding this complex. My primary functions include communicating the status of the frontal defense systems and assessing the status of the entity that this complex was built to imprison."]="我的用途就是存储这座泰坦之城的重要信息。我的主要功能包括传达前沿防御系统的状况以及评估关押在这座庞大建筑物中的实体的状态。"
G["I was devoured by Horgus!  I can still feel his teeth upon me!"]="我被霍古斯吞食了！我还能感觉到他的牙齿噬咬我！"
G["I was fishing along the coast when the spiders got me! Thank you for saving me."]="我当时正在岸边钓鱼，突然就遭到了蜘蛛的袭击！多谢你救了我。"
G["I was getting real sick of eating turnips."]="吃芜菁可真让我不舒服。"
G["I was getting so hungry..."]="我觉得有点饿了……"
G["I was going draw picture of best attack plan... but you have my chalk."]="我本来想写一份详细的攻击计划的……但是你拿走了我的笔。"
G["I was going to charge you a pretty penny for that peach, but Ella is such a good customer at my market, this one's on the house. Just this once, ya hear!"]="我本该向你收取买那个桃子的一大笔钱，但考虑到艾拉是我最好的顾客，这个就免费送给你。仅此一次，听到了吧！"
G["I was going to have a party and invite Mystic Birdhat, but you dismissed him."]="我想开个派对，邀请了秘法师鸟羽帽，可你却把他赶走了。"
G["I was going to kill him anyway!"]="就算你不动手，我也会杀了他！"
G["I was going to teach you a lesson but instead, it is you who have taught me. You see, when I was young... when I was young... when I was young..."]="我本想给你上一课，结果却是你给我上了一课。你知道，在我年轻那会儿……在我年轻那会儿……在我年轻那会儿……"
G["I was gonna drown for sure!"]="我差点儿就淹死了！"
G["I was happier as a Wastewander."]="我就像废土一样快乐。"
G["I was head editor of the Tinker Town Tattler!"]="我是侏儒区闲话报的首席编辑！"
G["I was here visiting relatives when Lordaeron fell, and then... well. I suppose I won't ever be returning to Westfall, now.\n\nSometimes I wonder if my family is still alive. More often, though, I wonder why I no longer care."]="洛丹伦沦陷时，我正在这里拜访亲戚……唉。我大概再也不能回到西部荒野了。\n\n有时我会思念家人，也不知他们是否依然健在。但是更多的时候，我的内心平静地如同一滩死水，好像没有什么能让我牵挂的了。"
G["I was hoping you'd say that..."]="我就知道你会这么说……"
G["I was in Ironforge during the takeover - it was chaos.\n\nNo wonder father gets so protective when I leave the keep."]="接管铁炉堡的时候，我也在场——那时真是一片混乱。\n\n所以当我离开城堡的时候，父亲会采取这样的保护措施也就不奇怪了。"
G["I was just comin' to see you. Honest!"]="其实我正想要找你呢。真的！"
G["I was just doing what I was told.  Please..."]="我只是奉命行事啊。求求你……"
G["I was just gonna make some limeade fer me hearties!  I swear it!"]="我正想给我的伙伴们做点儿酸橙汽水！我发誓！"
G["I was just mindin' my own business, when all of a sudden, Deathwing appeared!"]="那时我正专心于自己的工作，突然之间，死亡之翼出现了！"
G["I was just taking a rest.  Eternal watch is not as easy as it sounds, $r."]="我只是稍事休息。永恒地坚守并不像听上去那么容易，$r。"
G["I was just thinking about you, $n."]="我刚才还在念叨你呢，$n。"
G["I was just thinking... we really ought to take a trip south one of these nights, maybe have an evening picnic overlooking the fighting at the border? What do you think, milord? Wouldn't that just be so exciting?"]="我就在想……也许我们真的应该在那天晚上去南边看看。也许一边享受野餐，一边看着在国界边进行的战斗？你觉得怎么样，大人？那一定很精彩的！"
G["I was just wondering what you knew about the gnolls to the south.  Someone has been giving them supplies to practice necromancy."]="我只是在奇怪，你对南边的那些豺狼人到底有些什么了解。有人正在利用它们施行巫术。"
G["I was just... following orders."]="我只是……遵守命令而已。"
G["I was never that good with a fishing pole...  No matter!"]="我向来用不好鱼竿……但没关系！"
G["I was never very good at hand-to-hand combat, you know.  Not like my father."]="肉搏战从来不是我的强项。我和我父亲不同。"
G["I was not always a shortfang. I was strong."]="我并非天生的短牙种。我原本很强壮。"
G["I was not expecting this many troops..."]="我没想到会有这么多军队……"
G["I was on my way to the temple when I was jumped. My father must be rescued before the stone troggs kill him."]="当我受到攻击时我正在前往神殿的途中。必须在石头穴居人对我父亲下手前把他救出来。"
G["I was once a great fighter. Let us hope old age has not taken too much of my skill from me."]="我曾经是位骁勇的战士。希望时间没有将我的战斗技能消磨殆尽。"
G["I was once a great magister in Silvermoon City.  Now I'm a demoted, former-foreman and little more than a slave!"]="我曾经是银月城中的伟大的魔导师。现在我却成了比奴隶好那么一点点的工头！"
G["I was once a paladin, $n.  Now the Light shuns me, for my sins are too great.\n\nI will aid my allies as best I can, but never again will I wield the powers of darkness."]="Una vez fui un paladín, $n. Ahora la Luz me rechaza, pues mis pecados son muchos.\n\nAyudaré a mis aliados lo mejor que pueda, pero nunca más utilizaré los poderes de la oscuridad."
G["I was once a priestess, but I've always been a scholar. The chance to learn from the Highborne seemed more valuable than practicing strict ignorance.\n\nWhat's more most of the apprentices here are youths who came of age during the third war. They need guidance, wisdom...\n\nI only wish those who used to call me friend understood."]="我曾经是位女祭司，但我不变的身份却是学者。能够汲取上层精灵的学识，比施行无知的严律要宝贵得多。\n\n更重要的是，这里的大多数学徒，都是在第三次大战期间成年的年轻人。他们需要指引，需要智慧……\n\n我只希望那些曾把我当成朋友的人能明白这一点。"
G["I was once the Empress Shek'zeer's most prized royal alchemist, peerless, and above all others."]="我曾经是夏柯希尔女皇最看重的皇家炼金术士，技术无人能及。"
G["I was one of the first tauren druids, of the last generation taught by Shan'do Cenarius, before the Legion, before the Sundering, when the world was still young. Before everything changed.\n\nWhile my brethren hunted great beasts, I hunted stories. I had been drawn to the druidic arts by this hunger, this lust for knowledge. For a time, that hunger was sated as I learned to talk to the trees, rocks, and beasts, and heard their stories.\n\nBut then, the time came when Cenarius walked among us no more and my brethren began to forget what he had taught us. I could not forget, though, and I still needed to learn more about our world.\n\nSo I said my farewells and travelled beyond the lands of my people."]="我是最早一批，也是最后一代接受过塞纳留斯教诲的牛头人德鲁伊之一。那时候世界还很年轻，没有燃烧军团，大灾变也还没有发生。一切都是那么宁静。\n\n当我的同胞学习猎杀巨兽时，我却在搜寻历史故事。对知识的渴求令我沉湎于德鲁伊的魔法。有段时间，我满足于与树木、岩石和野兽交谈，倾听它们的故事。\n\n后来，塞纳留斯不再露面，我的同胞渐渐遗忘了他的教诲，但是我忘不了，我还想了解更多关于这个世界的知识。\n\n于是我告别族人，离开家乡去远方流浪。"
G["I was only an infant when my father was deployed to this wasteland. All that I have ever known of him is what others have told me.\n\nDo your dreams change, $n? Mine do not. I have one dream: A crimson skyline envelops me as Legion, numbering beyond comprehension, battle in the distance. I kneel before the body of a man, presumably my father, and weep. As he is gasping for air, his body wholly crushed, he whispers something. Despite every effort, I am unable to hear what he is trying to tell me."]="Era solo un bebé cuando mi padre fue destinado a este páramo. Todo lo que siempre he sabido de él es lo que otros me han contado.\n\n¿Cambian tus sueños, $n? Los míos, no. Tengo un sueño: un horizonte carmesí me envuelve mientras la Legión, en cantidad innumerable, batalla en la distancia. Me arrodillo ante el cadáver de un hombre, es de suponer que mi padre, y lloro. Mientras lucha por conseguir aire, con todo el cuerpo aplastado, susurra algo. A pesar de todos mis esfuerzos, soy incapaz de oír lo que intenta decirme."
G["I was personally assured by Malygos that your commander would make the details of this accord his top priority. Now let me pass!"]="玛里苟斯亲自向我保证，指挥家会优先处理此次谈判的所有事宜。让我过去！"
G["I was prepared for death. Now... you have given me another chance."]="我都已经做好了牺牲的准备。可现在……你又给了我一个机会。"
G["I was promised I would never have to encounter the horrors of war at the faire."]="他们向我保证，进了马戏团里就永远不会面临恐怖的战争。"
G["I was promised substantial wealth to come out here.\n\nWhat a joke!"]="他们向我承诺过，可以在这里得到巨大的财富。\n\n这可真是个不错的笑话！"
G["I was raised at the feet of my father."]="我是父亲的膝下之子。"
G["I was raised on this land... taught to hunt on this very tundra."]="我在这片土地上长大……自幼便学习如何在冰原上狩猎。"
G["I was really hoping to find more Honeybrew. I guess I'll just try and find more on my own. Let me know if you need anymore help!"]="我真希望能找到更多蜜酒。我想我会试着自己去找。如果你需要更多帮助，就告诉我一声！"
G["I was relieving myself into one of the golden pools when they caught me.  I guess you could call it a karma capture."]="我被他们抓住时，正在其中一个金色池塘边解决内急问题。我想这就叫因果报应吧。"
G["I was rescued by some new allies. I'm sorry I was not here sooner."]="新的盟友拯救了我。没能早点到你身边，我很抱歉。"
G["I was rusty..."]="我的手艺……生锈了……"
G["I was saved by my last disciple, Muyoh, and a band of adventurers. I considered the entire incident a failure. It wasn't until the Cataclysm occured that I realized I'd been far too successful!\n\nWhen the Barrens was cracked apart, a great font of underground water was breached and flowed up to the surface, full of the energies it was imbued with in the Wailing Caverns. Life immediately sprung from the earth around it, and the animals thrived...and then it continued to grow, uncontrollably, unchecked.\n\nNow I have to answer for my arrogance in thinking I could dictate the flow and shape of nature myself. This overgrowth must be stopped, before it chokes out the natural wildlife entirely."]="我被我的最后一名信徒穆约和一队冒险者救了出来。我以为我的计划已经彻底失败了。当大灾变到来时，我才意识到，我的计划可以说是过度地成功了！\n\n当贫瘠之地裂开时，巨大的地下水流涌上地表，其中充满了那股在哀嚎洞穴中肆虐的诡异能量。各种生命随之迅速繁衍壮大，无论植物还是动物……都在不受控制地过度生长。\n\n我以为自己能控制自然本身的形态和变化。而现在，我必须为自己的傲慢做出补救。这种生命的蔓生必须被阻止，否则它就会吞没整个自然生态。"
G["I was searching for materials to build my latest and greatest invention, the portable remote control shredder unit, when these trolls clubbed me and dragged me into the depths of their cave.\n\nReturn me to safety and I will lend my aid to your cause, $r."]="当这些巨魔将我击倒，并将我拖到洞穴深处时，我便开始搜寻原料，用于制作我最后一项也是最好的一项发明——便携式远程遥控伐木机。\n\n将我送到安全地带，我会帮助你的，$r。"
G["I was sent to get some of your famous hard ale. Have any to spare?"]="我是来买那种有名的烈酒的。还有存货吗？"
G["I was sent to sabotage the Sik'thik bridge reconstruction, but you've fought your way through them like a true $c. You have an opportunity to eliminate their leader!"]="Me enviaron a sabotear la reconstrucción del puente Sik'thik, pero tú te has abierto paso entre ellos como $gun verdadero:una verdadera; $c. ¡Tienes la oportunidad de eliminar a su líder!"
G["I was shaken, but I did not give up. I pursued the strange old brewer to ask him some more questions."]="我有些动摇，但并没有放弃。我跟上那个古怪的老酿酒师，想要追问他。"
G["I was shot down by that reckless fool, Mulverick. I fear that if I do not make it back to base, all will be lost! Mulverick and his squad of War Riders must be stopped!"]="我被穆维里克这个鲁莽的蠢货击中了。我担心要是我无法回到基地中去的话，一切都要玩完了！必须阻止穆维里克和他的飞行中队！"
G["I was sleeping!"]="我那时在睡觉！"
G["I was standing right next to you, imbecile. I know what you seek."]="我就站在你旁边，笨蛋。我知道你在找什么。"
G["I was startin' to think you'd never ask!\n\nWe'll get 'er done eventually, but there's plenty you can do to help.\n\nWe gnomes have a high metabolism - and it only gets higher when we're hard at work. Food will always be welcome.\n\nThen there's oil. These traps are tricky enough without having to worry about gears jamming. Bring us any oil ya find out there.\n\nOutside'a that, just keep us safe!\n\n<Rosey looks aways for a moment, then whispers.>\n\nTh-there might be one other thing..."]="我还以为你就不问了呢！\n\n我们迟早会完成的，可现在也有很多你帮得上忙的地方。\n\n我们侏儒的新陈代谢很快——在我们努力工作时尤其如此。所以食物总是很受欢迎的。\n\n然后是油。这些陷阱非常精巧，不用担心齿轮会被卡住。把你能找到的油都带回来给我们。\n\n除此之外，还要保障我们的安全！\n\n<罗塞向四周看了看，又压低声音说道。>\n\n还——可能还有一件事……"
G["I was starting to wonder how long I would be out here."]="我都开始怀疑，自己究竟要在这里待多久。"
G["I was supposed to die in battle... ah well, another day.  I will follow you until I recover."]="我应该死在战场上……嗯，总有一天。现在我会跟随你，直到我恢复过来。"
G["I was supposed to get firewood for the campsite..."]="我原本是出来帮营地收集些柴火的……"
G["I was surely done for. I owe you greatly, $r."]="要不是你，我就死定了。真是多亏了你，$r。"
G["I was talking about you and Durty Pete."]="我正在谈你和老脏鬼佩蒂。"
G["I was tasked with finding more productive ways to make silk. In my hubris, I created monsters! This is a shame I will carry to the end of my days."]="我的任务就是设法提高蚕丝产量。但我过于自信，竟造出了怪物！这将是我的毕生的耻辱。"
G["I was the first you know. For me the wheel of death has spun many times. So much time has passed... I have a lot of catching up to do."]="对我来说，死亡之轮已经旋转了许多次。时间已经流逝了许多……有太多事情要做了。"
G["I was the last to die. As I felt my spirit leaving my mortal shell, I swore a blood oath.\n\n<Prince Toreth shakes his head.>\n\nA pact was made between this land and I: My blood for this world. I became the sole keeper of the history of my people.\n\nI cannot rest until I am secure in knowing that the story of the dragon riders of Loreth'Aran is not lost in the passages of time."]="Fui el último en morir. Mientras siento como mi espíritu deja mi receptáculo mortal, hice un juramento de sangre.\n\n<El príncipe Toreth niega con la cabeza.>\n\nSe llevó a cabo un pacto entre esta tierra y yo: mi sangre por este mundo. Me convertí en el único guardián de la historia de mi gente.\n\nNo puedo descansar hasta que sepa con seguridad que la historia de los jinetes de dragones de Loreth'Aran no se ha perdido en el laberinto del tiempo."
G["I was there... at the end..."]="在那时……我亲眼目睹了这一切……"
G["I was thinking the same thing."]="我也在想这个问题。"
G["I was tinkin' dat I was gonna to die in dis jungle."]="我还以为我要死在这丛林里了。"
G["I was told that losing my mount was a death sentence. Thanks for proving the Admiral wrong."]="我被告知弄丢坐骑就要等着受死。谢谢你证明将军是错的。"
G["I was told you could get me to Light's Breach...."]="听说你能送我去圣光据点……"
G["I was trying to negotiate with the Sin'dorei. I was opening discussions to bring them into the Alliance! By attacking their people, you've forced their hand-"]="我一直在与辛多雷谈判。我们正在商讨辛多雷重返联盟的可能性！你在这种时候攻击他们的人，这只会——"
G["I was trying to oust one of those lowlifes you so loathe permanently! Next time, I'll be certain to specify that I require a competent investigator!"]="我知道你有多讨厌那些卑鄙的家伙，我这不正在设法将他们永久驱逐出沙塔斯城吗！下次，我一定要求配备一名有能力的调查员！"
G["I was up at Whelgar's a few days ago attempting to...er...liberate...some titan relics from the bones of the dead raptors, and I saw him!  Sarltooth lives!  \nWell, he's undead, so I guess he doesn't live, but he exists.  Sarltooth exists!"]="Fui a la Excavación de Whelgar hace unos días para... eh... liberar... algunas reliquias de los titanes de los huesos de los raptores muertos, ¡y lo vi! ¡Sarldente está vivo!\n\nBueno, es un no-muerto, así que supongo que no está vivo, pero existe. ¡Sarldente existe!"
G["I was using that."]="这下它没用了。"
G["I was waiting for a reason to tear you bone from bone!"]="我一直在找机会，好拆了你的骨头！"
G["I was warned about you. I should have heeded that warning."]="有人警告过我要小心你。我真不该大意。"
G["I was wonderin' when you would ask. Sure thing, but I can't today. Once I finish my business at the market, I'll be right over!"]="我一直在想你什么时候会问起。一定的，但不是今天。一旦市集上的生意做完，我就会过去！"
G["I was wonderin' when you would ask. Sure thing. Let me take care of some things and I'll be right on over."]="我还在想你什么时候会问我呢。没问题，等我料理完这边的事后，我马上过去。"
G["I was wondering when I'd see you again, $n."]="很想知道我们什么时候能够再见，$n。"
G["I was wondering when you would get here, $n!"]="我刚才还在想你什么时候会来呢，$n！"
G["I was working on a cantrip that would counteract my predicament and I was very close to finding a <CROOAAK>... Oh my!"]="Estaba trabajando en un hechizo que contrarrestara este apuro y estaba a punto de encontrar un <CROOAAC>... ¡Oh, cielos!"
G["I was... once like you. Mortal. Soft. Only flesh and bone. WEAK AND TIMID!"]="凡人，曾经……我和你一样，血肉之躯，不堪一击！"
G["I wash away..."]="我将被冲刷殆尽……"
G["I wasn't even shackled... but I don't think I was asleep..."]="我竟然没有戴着镣铐……我应该不是在睡觉吧……"
G["I wasn't even supposed to be here today!"]="我就不该来这里！"
G["I wasn't expecting anyone down here. Come to keep me company, or just looking for a way out?"]="我没想到这里还会有人。你打算作我的同伴，还是只想找一条路出去？"
G["I wasn't finished."]="我……还不能死。"
G["I wasn't ready to die in a marsh.  Thanks again!"]="我可不想死在沼泽地里。再次谢谢！"
G["I wasn't there, but I heard that Sylvanas died in Silverpine and that her precious val'kyr resurrected her at the cost of their own lives. Know anything about it?"]="我当时不在场，但我听说，希尔瓦娜斯死在了银松森林。而她所珍爱的瓦格里牺牲自己的生命，让她得以复活。你对此有所了解么？"
G["I wasn't too sure 'bout you when you first came to the valley, but now I can proudly call you my neighbor. As a token of my friendship, I'd like to give ye a big something for yer farm. She should be there already. Name's Miss Fifi, and she likes to eat turnips!"]="No me fiaba mucho de ti cuando llegaste al valle, pero ahora puedo decir con orgullo que te considero mi $gvecino:vecina;. Como prueba de mi amistad, me gustaría darte algo importante para tu granja. Ya debe de haber llegado. ¡Se llama señorita Fifi y le encanta comer nabas!"
G["I watch as my lineage is reduced to a faded memory around me.  Once the greatest of all brewmasters we now stand backstage to the Stormstouts.  Bah!"]="我亲眼见证了家族的衰落。我们曾是最伟大的酒仙，现在却只能排在风暴烈酒家族后头，呸！"
G["I watch our new enemies.\n\nThe straight-back trolls ally with the mogu, but the other invaders fight against them.\n\nPfah! I do not care. Their battles have given us many new corpses to scavenge. The Skumblade have never been stronger."]="我看到了我们的新敌人。\n\n直背的巨魔与魔古族结了盟，但其他入侵者却在与他们交战。\n\n呸！我才不在乎。他们的战斗给我们留下了许多尸体。邪刃部族前所未有地强大。"
G["I watched Master Windfur fight a dozen mogu once without any of them successfully landing a blow."]="我有一次看见风裘大师被十来个魔古族围攻，结果那些魔古族连一下都没能打中他。"
G["I watched as he steered us through adversity, never flinching from difficult decisions."]="我注视着他，是他引领我们在逆境中前进，从不畏缩挑战。"
G["I watched as they beat him without mercy. Their ruthless lieutenant acted as if such cruelty was an act of normalcy. Through the savage beatings, I could feel myself breaking.\n\nAs I watched Vindicator Saruan take their blows, I began to weep. Not out of fear... I wept out of sadness. To see a draenei of the Triumvirate treated in such a manner. If only I could have broken free of my bonds. If only..."]="Observé mientras lo golpeaban sin compasión. Su despiadado teniente actuaba como si tal crueldad fuera un acto de normalidad. A través de la salvaje paliza, me sentía como si yo mismo me quebrara.\n\nMientras observaba cómo el vindicador Saruan recibía sus golpes, comencé a sollozar. No por miedo... Lloré de tristeza. Ver a un draenei del Triunvirato tratado de tal forma. Si yo pudiera haberme liberado de mis ataduras. Si yo pudiera..."
G["I watched the mogu torture my friends. Thanks to you, I have been spared."]="我亲眼看着魔古族如何折磨我的朋友。多亏了你，我才逃过一劫。"
G["I weep at these atrocities we commit. It is almost unbearable."]="我为我们犯下的这些罪行而哭泣。简直令人难以忍受。"
G["I weep for the fortune of this village. Their hard times seem to be without end, and with the mogu in the vale, it will likely be some time before they ever will."]="我为这个村子的将来潸然泪下。只要魔古族呆在山谷里一天，他们和魔古族之间的痛苦噩梦似乎永远没有结束的时候。"
G["I weep for you, $n. You really have no idea what you've gotten yourself into..."]="我为你悲叹，$n。你根本不明白自己陷入了怎样的窘境……"
G["I welcome you into an eternity of service, thief."]="欢迎你接受这份永恒的任务，盗贼。"
G["I welcome you to Sporeggar, $r.  We don't normally see many of your kind around here, but you've proven your worth to us.  Make yourself at home."]="欢迎你来到孢子村，$r。通常在这附近看不到很多你的同类，但是你向我们证明了自己的价值。请不要拘束。"
G["I welcome you to Theramore, $n.\n\nI apologize for being abrupt and not having a lot of time to exchange pleasantries, but my city must come first. Too many things threaten our way of life and the sanctity of the Alliance. I must stay ever vigilant against forces outside of our control if I'm to ensure my people remain safe and happy.\n\nPerhaps we'll have more time to speak later."]="Te doy la bienvenida a Theramore, $n.\n\nTe pido disculpas por ser tan cortante y por no tener tiempo para atenderte como es debido, pero mi ciudad es mi prioridad. Muchas cosas amenazan nuestra forma de vida y la santidad de la Alianza. Debo estar totalmente alerta frente a las fuerzas externas que escapan a nuestro control si quiero que mi gente esté segura y viva feliz.\n\nTal vez tengamos más tiempo para hablar después."
G["I wept like a babe when I heard of your heroics. Master Ravenholdt would do well to have an apprentice like you."]="当我听到你的豪言壮语时，我像小孩子一样哭了起来。拉文霍德有你这样的学徒真好。"
G["I weren't scurred..."]="我可不想留下疤痕……"
G["I wield... the LIGHT!"]="我掌握着……圣光！"
G["I will DESTROY you!"]="我要消灭你！"
G["I will NEVER be controlled! The Red Dragonflight has no idea what they unleashed when they experimented on my egg."]="我绝不会被控制！红龙军团在拿我的蛋做实验时根本不知道他们自己释放出了什么。"
G["I will NEVER yield!"]="我……绝不……放弃！"
G["I will NOT be a tool of the naga.  I will resist as long as I can, but I can't last forever.  Please, someone, stop them!"]="我不会成为纳迦的傀儡。我会尽我所能去抵抗，可我恐怕不能一直坚持下去。拜托了，快来人阻止他们！"
G["I will NOT be betrayed again! Those responsible for this will be punished!"]="我绝不容忍又一次背叛！那些罪人必将受到惩罚！"
G["I will NOT burn like the rest! Face the demons you fear, traitors!"]="我是不会像其他人那样坐以待毙的！面对你们最惧怕的恶魔吧，叛徒"
G["I will NOT have Horde on my ship!"]="我的船上没有部落的位置！"
G["I will NOT submit!"]="我不会屈服的！"
G["I will NOT, Archbishop. It will never be yours."]="我不会给你的，大主教。你休想得到它。"
G["I will RIP off your HEADS and EAT your filthy faces!"]="你们在我的手里根本不堪一击！"
G["I will access the discs now."]="我现在就去找那张碟片。"
G["I will accompany you, Sullah."]="我将与你同行，苏拉赫。"
G["I will add your watery innards to my own."]="我要把你血淋淋的内脏安在自己身上。"
G["I will aid you. Give me the instructions."]="我会帮你的。教我怎么做。"
G["I will attempt to not take undue pleasure in utterly destroying you."]="我会尽量让自己不因彻底摧毁你而感到过度狂喜。"
G["I will attempt to seal the scar, $n. Make sure nothing from the other side makes its way through!"]="我会尝试封住这道伤疤，$n。绝不让它另一侧的怪物们再钻过来！"
G["I will banish you to the land of wind and ghosts!"]="我要将你放逐到狂风和鬼魂肆虐之地！"
G["I will bathe in your blood!"]="我会让你血流成河！"
G["I will be a gracious winner, I promise!"]="我会是个有风度的赢家，我保证！"
G["I will be avenged!"]="我要报仇！"
G["I will be better prepared next time we meet!"]="我们下次见面时，我会准备得更充分一些的！"
G["I will be fine.\n\nThis is nothing compared to the thousand scars of battle!"]="我会好起来的。\n\n这点小事情和战斗时留下的数千个伤疤相比，不算什么！"
G["I will be goin' now.  I have no reason to remain here.  I may be undead, but my will is my own."]="我要走了。我没有理由留在这里。也许我是个亡灵，但我拥有属于自己的意志。"
G["I will be happy to slaughter them in your name! Come, enemies of the Scourge! I will show you the might of the Lich King!"]="能以您的名义杀死这些蝼蚁令我十分荣幸，来吧，天灾军团的敌人们！我让你们看看巫妖王的真正力量！"
G["I will be here doing research if anybody's got any problems for the next hour and a half."]="我将在接下来的一个半小时里留在这儿做研究，要是谁有问题可以来找我。"
G["I will be reborn, mortals! Incendius shall raise me from these ashes!"]="我会重生的！伊森迪奥斯会从这些灰烬中将我复活的！"
G["I will be the blade at the throat of our enemies."]="我会成为插入敌人咽喉的那把利刃。"
G["I will be the savior of our people! I WILL FULFILL MY DESTINY!"]="我将成为全族的救世主！我将履行我的使命！"
G["I will be watching you closely, hero!"]="我会密切关注你的，英雄！"
G["I will be with the Lightning Sons should you require my services."]="如果你需要我伸出援手的话，我随时愿意为闪电之子效劳。"
G["I will be your chosen knight, Salanar!"]="萨拉纳尔，我将成为你引以为傲的骑士！"
G["I will be your wingman!"]="为你效劳！"
G["I will begin the ritual. Prepare yourself!"]="我要开始仪式了。做好准备！"
G["I will break these bonds that hold me and send you all back to the hell from whence you came!"]="我要冲破禁锢我的牢笼，将你们统统送进地狱！"
G["I will break you in two! Relent, fool!"]="我会把你劈成两半的！收敛点，蠢货！"
G["I will break you!"]="我要毁灭你！"
G["I will break you, little rock man!"]="我要捏碎你，小石头人！"
G["I will break you."]="我要粉碎你。"
G["I will break you... as I broke him!"]="我会毁灭你……就像我毁灭了他那样！"
G["I will breathe easier knowing this one is gone."]="只有这家伙死掉，我才能松口气。"
G["I will bring you closer to the Emerald Dream. Seek safety there when the fight becomes too intense."]="我会让你们离翡翠梦境更近一些。当战斗太过激烈的时候可以进入梦境寻求庇护。"
G["I will burn away your impurities!"]="我要烧尽尔等的杂质！"
G["I will burn you from the inside out!"]="我要把你彻底烧成灰烬！"
G["I will burn you from the sky!"]="我会从空中烧死你们！"
G["I will burn your corpses to ash!"]="我要把你的尸体烧成灰烬！"
G["I will bury ya all!"]="我将埋葬你们！"
G["I will call for you when the dawning is upon us."]="等时机到来时我会来找你。"
G["I will call forth Eranikus when I am given the word."]="一旦我念动咒语，就可以召唤出伊兰尼库斯。"
G["I will carry you one last time Wakener... to your doom!"]="让我最后送你一程，唤醒者，飞向你的末日。"
G["I will catch you, small one!"]="我会抓住你，小东西！"
G["I will channel my powers into the orbs! Be ready!"]="我会将我的力量导入宝珠中！准备好！"
G["I will charge you with arcane energy to blast your foes."]="我会赋予你们奥术的力量，摧毁敌人。"
G["I will check back with you shortly, Kadrak."]="我很快就会回来找你的，卡德拉克！"
G["I will cleanse whatever corruption I can; my fire will not harm you."]="我会尽力净化一切腐化堕落；我的烈焰是不会伤害你的。"
G["I will cleanse you from the face of the world!"]="我会将你从这个世界清除掉！"
G["I will cleanse your sins with the edge of my dagger."]="我会用匕首的锋刃洗清你的罪恶。"
G["I will cleave the soul from between your bones!"]="我要把你的灵魂抽出来！"
G["I will come back for you all!"]="我会回来收拾你们的！"
G["I will concentrate on a first place finish."]="我会全力以赴，拔得头筹。"
G["I will concern myself with how it works once I have it in my possessions, Blood Elf."]="当我拥有它之后，我自会考虑如何使用它，血精灵。"
G["I will consider what you have told me."]="我会认真考虑你所告诉我的事情。"
G["I will consult the others. Meet me at the gates."]="我要征求其他人的意见。大门口见。"
G["I will continue my research in memory of Magtoor."]="我会为了玛格图尔继续研究下去。"
G["I will cover the flanks. Gather up our explosives and get them to the wall. Hurry!"]="我来掩护侧翼。你去收集炸药并把它们送到指定地点。快！"
G["I will crush any who oppose the Warchief!"]="我要碾碎所有胆敢反抗酋长的家伙！"
G["I will crush it and flay it and eat its meat and crack its bones one by one when I am done."]="等我搞定之后，我要把它碾碎，剥皮，吃肉，然后把它的骨头一块一块敲成渣！"
G["I will crush the breath from your lungs!"]="我会彻底压出你肺里的空气！"
G["I will crush the life from your skull!"]="我的杀戮之轮将从你的头颅上辗过！"
G["I will crush you all!"]="我要把你们碾碎！"
G["I will crush you all! For the Horde!"]="我会把你们全碾碎的！为了部落！"
G["I will crush you beneath my boots!"]="我要把你们踩在脚下，彻底碾碎！"
G["I will crush you beneath the onslaught of my team!"]="我队伍的攻势会把你粉碎！"
G["I will crush you into little tiny pieces!"]="我要把你打成碎片！"
G["I will crush you under foot!"]="我要把你踩在脚下！"
G["I will crush you under the weight of my waves!"]="我要把你碾碎！"
G["I will crush you with my own two fists."]="我会用双拳痛扁你的。"
G["I will crush you!"]="我要把你碾碎！"
G["I will crush you, in body AND spirit."]="我要粉碎你，让你形神俱亡。"
G["I will crush your bones to dust."]="我会把你的骨头碾成粉末。"
G["I will crush your delusions of grandeur!"]="我要让你们自以为是的错觉荡然无存！"
G["I will crush your skull with my bare hands."]="我要赤手空拳打爆你的头。"
G["I will cut down anyone I see fleeing from battle. For Garrosh!"]="谁要是临阵脱逃被我抓住，那就是死路一条。为了加尔鲁什！"
G["I will deal with Proudmoore."]="我要亲自对付普罗德摩尔。"
G["I will deal with these mongrels! Strike now, friends! Strike at the Betrayer!"]="我来对付这些渣滓！进攻吧，朋友们！向伊利丹发起进攻！"
G["I will defeat you."]="我会打败你。"
G["I will defend Ramkahen with my bare hands if I have to!"]="要是到了逼不得已的境地，我就算赤手空拳也要保卫拉穆卡恒！"
G["I will defend the vale with my life!"]="我会用自己的生命守护山谷！"
G["I will defend this portal with my life!"]="我的职责就是保护传送门，哪怕付出生命的代价！"
G["I will delay here until more reinforcements arrive, but you have to keep moving.\n\nWe won't have much time until Arthas realizes we're here."]="Yo esperaré aquí hasta que lleguen refuerzos, pero vosotros debéis seguir.\n\nNo tenemos mucho tiempo antes de que Arthas se dé cuenta de que estamos aquí."
G["I will delay here until more reinforcements arrive, but you must keep moving. Arthas will soon realize that we're here."]="在援兵赶到前我会尽量拖延时间，但你必须继续前进。阿尔萨斯很快会发现我们在这里。"
G["I will delay the Aspect of Death. Take her to safety. GO!"]="我来拖住死亡的化身。带她去安全的地方。快走！"
G["I will deliver my enemies to their ancestors!"]="我要把所有的敌人都送回老家！"
G["I will deliver my report to our leader, then.  By your leave, my lady."]="那么，我会向我们的领袖报告的。请原谅，我的女士。"
G["I will deliver this information to King Wrynn, Thrall, but..."]="我会转告国王的，萨尔，但是……"
G["I will destroy the Argent Crusade! I will crush the Scourge!"]="我要消灭银色北伐军！我要消灭天灾军团！"
G["I will destroy this barrier. You must hold the undead back!"]="我会摧毁这道屏障，但你必须挡住那些亡灵！"
G["I will destroy this cave in, and then we can sneak in from behind. Let me know when you are ready."]="我来解决这里的塌方，然后我们就从后面溜进去。你准备好就告诉我一声。"
G["I will destroy you!"]="我要消灭你！"
G["I will destroy you..."]="我要毁灭你……"
G["I will devour you whole!"]="我要把你打垮！"
G["I will devour your souls, insolent mortals!"]="我要吞噬你们的灵魂，无礼的凡人！"
G["I will dismantle this festering hellhole!"]="我要拆除这座腐烂的地狱！"
G["I will dispose of the outsiders."]="我要处决这些不速之客。"
G["I will do as you ask, demon.  At least for now."]="我会按你吩咐的去做，恶魔。至少现在是。"
G["I will do as you wish!"]="我会按照你的愿望去做！"
G["I will do my best to take care of the children, Greatmother."]="我会尽我所能照顾孩子们的，盖亚安祖母。"
G["I will do my best to translate and describe what I see."]="我将尽力翻译这些东西，并描述我看到的一切。"
G["I will do my best, Regent Lord. My troops are ready."]="我会尽力的，摄政王阁下。我的部队已经准备好了。"
G["I will do my best, Vaelan."]="我会尽力做到最好的，维埃兰。"
G["I will do no such thing. I simply cannot leave Taretha in danger while I run off into the mountains. I am no coward. Now, where is she?"]="我不会这么做的。我不会把塔蕾莎留在危险中，而我却自己跑开。我不是个懦夫。现在告诉我，她在哪里？"
G["I will do this ONE thing that you ask of me, quest giver. Pray I find more menial tasks to accomplish or you will be hearing from me again and I assure you that my commentary on forums of public opinion will be most unkind."]="Haré esta ÚNICA cosa que me pides, $gasignador:asignadora; de misiones. Reza para que encuentre más tareas insignificantes que cumplir, o volverás a saber de mí, y te aseguro que mis comentarios en los foros de la opinión pública serán de lo más rotundos."
G["I will do this with or without your help, Loramus."]="洛拉姆斯，无论你是否帮忙，我都会去做的。"
G["I will do what Pa'valak could not!"]="我会完成帕瓦拉克做不到的事！"
G["I will drain the red blood from your bodies!"]="我要榨干你们身体里的鲜血！"
G["I will drink no blood before its time."]="我已经很久没有痛饮过鲜血了。"
G["I will drink your blood!"]="我要畅饮你的鲜血！"
G["I will drive your foul stench from the forest, monster!"]="我会把你在这片森林中留下的恶臭清除干净，怪物！"
G["I will drop you near the tower. Do not get used to this."]="我会把你放在塔附近。不要掉以轻心。"
G["I will drop you with force enough to decimate anyone nearby. Choose your landing carefully."]="我把你送至地面的那股力量足以消灭着落点附近的任何敌人。请你谨慎挑选好你要着落的地方。"
G["I will end Garrosh for this. His Horde already crumbles beneath him. We will deliver the final blow."]="我会亲自跟加尔鲁什做个了断。他的部落业已分崩离析。我们将作出致命一击。"
G["I will end the Kirin Tor!"]="我要终结肯瑞托！"
G["I will end this quickly...."]="我会让你死得痛快点的……"
G["I will end you swiftly, $r!"]="我随手就能干掉你，$r！"
G["I will escape from here, and when I return, it will be with an army of jinyu warriors."]="我会逃出去的。当我回来时，将带来一整支锦鱼人大军。"
G["I will escort you into the Sunwell when you're ready."]="Te escoltaré a La Fuente del Sol cuando estés $glisto:lista;."
G["I will extinguish the life from your body!"]="我要熄灭你的生命之火！"
G["I will fear no evil!"]="我无惧邪恶！"
G["I will feast in the halls of Ymirheim tonight and you will pour my mead, cur."]="今晚我要出席伊米海姆的宴会，而你只配为我倒酒。"
G["I will feast on your remains!"]="我要吞噬你们的尸体！"
G["I will feed you to my wolf."]="我要拿你去喂我的狼。"
G["I will feed you to the dogs!"]="我要拿你去领赏！"
G["I will feed... on your soul."]="我要……吞噬你的灵魂。"
G["I will fight with honor and valor for the glory of the Alliance!"]="我会为了联盟的荣耀，勇敢光荣地战斗！"
G["I will find a way to repay you someday, hero."]="Algún día encontraré la manera de devolverte el favor, $ghéroe:heroína;."
G["I will find help!  Try to hold off the Sha for as long as you can!"]="我这就去找援军！你要坚持挡住煞魔！"
G["I will find the Mistress of the Tides immediately. Thank you for delivering this message, Battlemaiden."]="我马上就去找潮汐女王。谢谢你为我带来这个消息，女武士。"
G["I will find you!"]="我会找到你的！"
G["I will find you..."]="我会找到你的……"
G["I will find your boys and the cipher, Oronok."]="我会找到你的儿子们和密码的，欧鲁诺克。"
G["I will flatten you!"]="我要砸扁你！"
G["I will flay the flesh from your bones!"]="我要抽你的筋，剥你的皮！"
G["I will follow the north wind."]="我追随北风的指引。"
G["I will follow you no further dryskin, too many have died at the broken pillar, and I will not be among them."]="干皮人，我不会再跟着你了。很多鳄鱼人都死在破柱子了，我不想去陪他们。"
G["I will free you from that pitiful form and reforge you in our service!"]="我会让你摆脱那副可怜的皮囊，把你重塑成我们的仆人！"
G["I will freeze the blood in your veins!"]="我要把你血脉里的血液全都冻住！"
G["I will freeze you from within until all that remains is an icy husk."]="我会让你的血脉和躯壳化为寒冰！"
G["I will gain speed as the exercise continues. Try to keep up."]="我会在练习过程中加快速度，试着跟上我。"
G["I will get straight to the point.  We have something to ask of you."]="且让我直奔主题。我们有事相求于你。"
G["I will give anything, to my last dying breath, to save Lin."]="为了救林，我会竭尽全力，直到剩下最后一口气。"
G["I will give you a free meal if you can get this dwarf off of my new chair!"]="要是你能把这矮子从我的新椅子上赶走，我就免费请你吃一顿！"
G["I will give you what power I can.  May the boughs of the Great Tree shade you from the flames in this infernal abyss."]="我会将我全部的力量传给你。愿世界之树的浓荫庇佑你不受这地狱烈焰的炙烤。"
G["I will gladly pay you Tuesday for a hamburger today."]="今天我会给你一个汉堡作为星期二那天的报酬。"
G["I will gladly share my forbidden knowledge with you in this time of great peril.  The darkness will protect us, $gbrother : sister;."]="很高兴在这个极其危险的时代与你分享我的禁忌知识。黑暗会保护我们，$G兄弟:姐妹;。"
G["I will go with you by foot and clear the path of flames.  It will take all my concentration to keep the fire at bay, so you need to make sure that I remain safe."]="我会徒步跟着你，清理一路上的火焰。我需要集中精力，所以你一定要保护我的安全。"
G["I will go with you. Just spare my men. They're good lads who've only made a mistake..."]="我跟你回去。请放过我的手下吧。他们还很年轻，犯点小错误也是难免的……"
G["I will go, but only as a witness for my people. Someone gotta keep you in check, Garrosh."]="我可以去，以证明巨魔的清白。会有人来收拾你的，加尔鲁什。"
G["I will go. Shorel'aran."]="我走了。Shorel'aran."
G["I will guide you to the location of the relics, but you must guard my spirit well. As the guardian of the relics, only I can break the seals on the reliquaries."]="我会带领你去圣物的位置，但你必须保护好我的灵魂。只有身为圣物守护者的我，才能破除净化之匣的封印。"
G["I will guide you with this rope. If you get too far away from me, it will break and I will be forced to restart the exercise."]="我会用这根绳索来引导你。如果你离我太远，绳索就会断掉，而我也只能重新开始训练了。"
G["I will handle the demons. Elune, guide my arrows!"]="我来对付这些恶魔。艾露恩，请您指引我的箭矢！"
G["I will happily replace you all with goblins! Do not fail me!"]="如果能用地精将你们统统替换掉，我会很高兴的！别让我失望！"
G["I will have justice!"]="我会讨回公道！"
G["I will have my revenge on Kael'thas for this outrage against the Kirin Tor! He once walked among us as a brother, but we are brothers no more.\n\nThere will be a reckoning.\n\n<The archmage nods grimly, not relishing the prospect.>\n\nKael'thas is more than a mere rogue mage. Once I am free from my tower, Ravandwyr and I will assist anyone who opposes him."]="我要向凯尔萨斯复仇，为他对肯瑞托所做的暴行复仇！他曾经与我兄弟相称，但如今我们不再是兄弟了。\n\n我会找他算帐的。\n\n<大法师面沉似水地点了点头。>\n\n凯尔萨斯不仅仅是个无赖的法师。一旦我自由了，拉文德维尔和我会帮助任何与他为敌的人。"
G["I will have those tablets!"]="我会得到这些石板！"
G["I will have you flayed. The witch shall sew me a loincloth from your skin!"]="Te desollaré. La bruja te coserá un taparrabos con tu piel！"
G["I will have your armor as a trophy!"]="我要把你的护甲当成战利品！"
G["I will have your energy and then your life!"]="我会先要你的能量，再要你的命！"
G["I will have your head on a pike, $r!"]="我要将你的首级顶在长矛上，$r！"
G["I will have your unruly spirit, like all the others!"]="我会得到你那不驯的灵魂的，就像其他灵魂一样！"
G["I will head there immediately Battlemaiden. Thank you."]="我会立即前往的，女武士。谢谢你。"
G["I will hear what you have to say."]="我会听一听你要说些什么。"
G["I will heave your carcass into the ocean myself!"]="我要将你的尸体扔进大海！"
G["I will help you carry the barrels. Or did you think they were going to magically fit in your bag?"]="我会帮你搬桶。还是说，你觉得那些桶会魔法般地钻进你的背包里？"
G["I will help you learn to wield the powers our enemies would deny us."]="我会教你学会运用令敌人无可抵挡的力量。"
G["I will help you out before I head back to Valgarde. It's the least I could do."]="在我返回瓦加德之前我会尽量帮助你。这是我唯一能做的事了。"
G["I will help you, but first I would like to learn a little more about your people. Will you journey with me for a little while?"]="我会帮助你，可我想先对你的族人有所了解。你愿意花点时间随我走走吗？"
G["I will help, but know that you're stepping into a viper's nest. Let me draw you a map - wha - behind you!"]="我会帮忙，可你要知道，你们正在踏入毒蛇的巢穴。让我来为你画张地图——哇——你后面！"
G["I will hold them back for now!"]="我可以暂时击退他们！"
G["I will hold them back so we can get past. Be ready."]="我会拦住他们，准备通过。"
G["I will hunt you down, soft-skin..."]="我要干掉你，软壳子……"
G["I will hurry back to Vahlarriel. Finish off those that you can--I should be fine on my own from here."]="我会尽快返回瓦拉里尔那里去。干掉那些你能对付得了的敌人，我自己过去应该没什么问题。"
G["I will instruct you when the time is right... that time is not now. You have much more to learn first!"]="当时机合适时，我会传授知识给你的……不是现在。你还得学习更多的知识！"
G["I will join in the assault upon Icecrown Citadel when the time to strike is upon us."]="当进攻冰冠堡垒的战斗开始时，我一定会加入。"
G["I will join you soon. Together, we will teach these Grimtotem cowards the meaning of fear!"]="我很快就会与你汇合，我们要让那些恐怖图腾的懦夫明白什么是恐惧。"
G["I will keep this village safe so that you may retire your weapons."]="我会确保这村庄的安全，让你能安心地卸下武器。"
G["I will kill the guard at the table and then I will draw the attention of the trio."]="我会干掉桌旁的卫兵，吸引那三个家伙的注意力。"
G["I will kill you, or I will die trying."]="我要杀了你，否则就是我被你杀掉。"
G["I will launch another flare.  Pray Ebon Watch is watching."]="我打算再发一枚信号弹。但愿黑锋哨站能看见。"
G["I will lay a mild compulsion upon you. Jump into the depths before me so that you put yourself into my element and thereby display your submission."]="我要你做的事也不算太过分。当着我的面跳入深海吧，这样你才能与我的精神融合，以此表达你的诚意。"
G["I will lay down for no one!"]="没有人可以打败我！"
G["I will lead us through Hearthglen to the forest's edge. From there, you will take me to my father."]="我将带我们穿越壁炉谷到达森林的边缘。然后你就可以把我带到我父亲那儿了。"
G["I will leave to follow Dath'remar and the others. The Shen'dralar have gone too far. To traffic with demons...we're giving ourselves over to corruption."]="我要赶去与达斯雷玛他们会合。辛德拉已经走得太远了。与魔鬼做交易……我们已经将自己交付给堕落。"
G["I will leave your cities in dust and your lives in ruin!"]="我要把你们的城市夷平，把你们碾碎！"
G["I will let you live so that you can tell your King of the price for his continued defiance!"]="我不杀你，去告诉你的国王，他的挑衅付出了什么代价！"
G["I will light the way."]="我将照亮道路。"
G["I will make example of $r <Snort>! Prepare yourself <Gurgle> soft-for-face."]="¡Daré ejemplo con $r! <Bufido> Prepárate, <barboteo> cara blanda."
G["I will make good use of you, intruder."]="Me serás muy útil, $gintruso:intrusa;."
G["I will make it known to you. You are obviously already proving yourself in our ranks to become a lieutenant so quickly. Perhaps you can return to me later and I will have tasks for you. The council adores those skilled in the arcane, but servants of all kinds are always welcome, no matter their profession."]="我会让你知道这一点的。很明显，你如此迅速地成为中尉，已经证明了自己的实力。或许稍后你回到我这儿时，我会派给你任务的。委员会崇尚那些能熟练运用魔法的人，但也欢迎各种族的仆从，无论该仆从从事何种职业。"
G["I will make my stand here and buy you as much time as I am able. Use it well and make our prince proud."]="我会守在这里，尽量为你们争取时间。记住，不要辜负我们的王子。"
G["I will make the arrangements right away, my king. I know several captains that we might persuade to help us in dealing with this blockade..."]="我会立即着手安排，国王陛下。我认识几位船长，也许能说服他们帮忙应对这次封锁……"
G["I will make these beasts pay..."]="我要让这些畜生付出代价……"
G["I will make this as easy as possible for you.  Simply come here and die.  That is all that I ask for your many trespasses.  For your sullying of this exalted place of battle."]="我会尽量让你死个痛快的。过来受死吧。你侵犯并玷污了这座神圣的比武场，而我只要求你用性命赎罪罢了。"
G["I will make your death a quick one, $n."]="我会让你死个痛快的，$n。"
G["I will mark the location upon your map."]="我会在你的地图上标记出你要的地点位置。"
G["I will meet you again in Thunder Bluff."]="我会在雷霆崖上与你再次会面。"
G["I will meet you at each of the four shrines, champion."]="我会在祭坛那里等你的，勇士。"
G["I will meet you in Alonsus Chapel. It is the holy place where Uther the Lightbringer was ordained into the Silver Hand. It is the only building the Scourge cannot touch, and will be our forward base of operations in that half of the city. With your help, Stratholme will become the capital of the Light and a new beginning for Lordaeron."]="我会在阿隆索斯礼拜堂等你。那里是乌瑟尔·光明使者加入白银之手的地方。也是唯一一座天灾怪物们无法触碰的建筑物。那里将成为我们进攻另外一半城市时的桥头堡。有了你的帮助，斯坦索姆一定会成为圣光之都，洛丹伦新生的起点。"
G["I will mourn your falling."]="我会为你的失败而哀悼。"
G["I will need some time to study these samples, $n.  I will speak to you again when I have completed my analysis."]="我需要一些时间来研究这些样品，$n。等我完成了分析，我会再和你谈谈。"
G["I will need to focus my energies onto this knife.  By doing so, I should catch some of the stronger psychic impressions associated with it."]="我要将我的精力集中在这把刀上。这样就能捕获与刀关联的更强的精神印象。"
G["I will never allow it... Never!"]="我绝不允许…绝不！"
G["I will never allow you to use the Horn of Elemental Fury against us! Die, weakling!"]="我不会让你用元素愤怒号角来对付我们的！去死吧，懦夫！"
G["I will never call Brackenwall Village my home. To do so is to give up hope of reclaiming our rightful lands."]="我绝不会把蕨墙村当作自己的家。那么做就等于放弃了收复失地的希望。"
G["I will never fail the warchief!"]="我是不会辜负酋长的！"
G["I will never forget my father's sacrifice."]="我永远不会忘记我父亲的牺牲。"
G["I will never forget that day, $r. Never. Even though I had long since abandoned shamanism in favor of shadow magic, I felt the cut. A sense of loss so profound... I could not explain it to you with mere words.\n\nWhen the tie to the elements was severed, all orcs on Draenor changed. If there was ever any doubt in the power of the shadows, it was washed away with the cresting of the molten lava over the shattered earth."]="Nunca olvidaré ese día, $r. Nunca. Aunque hacía tiempo que había abandonado las vías del chamanismo para tomar las de la magia oscura, sentí cómo se cortó el vínculo. Un dolor muy profundo... No podría explicártelo con palabras.\n\nCuando se cortó el vínculo con los elementos, todos los orcos de Draenor cambiaron. Si alguien todavía dudaba del poder de las sombras, esas dudas desaparecieron con los ríos de lava que recorrían la tierra destrozada."
G["I will never forget the help you gave us or the shame you spared me, hero. Thank you!"]="Nunca olvidaré la ayuda que nos prestaste ni la vergüenza que me evitaste, $ghéroe:heroína;. ¡Gracias!"
G["I will never forget this act of kindness."]="我永远不会忘记你的善举。"
G["I will never forget this, hero."]="Nunca olvidaré esto, $ghéroe:heroína;."
G["I will never give you the information you seek!"]="我不会告诉你的！"
G["I will never know the strength of Kros. I will never hunt in his fields.\n\nI am not the predator. I am the prey."]="我无法体会克洛斯的力量。我无法在他的猎场中狩猎。\n\n我当不了猎人，我只是个猎物。"
G["I will never stop fighting to protect Hyjal. Not after all we've done to heal her."]="在彻底治愈海加尔山以前，我绝不会停止奋战。"
G["I will never succumb to your tortures! NEVER!"]="我不会屈服的！绝不！"
G["I will not allow you the pleasure."]="我不会让你得逞。"
G["I will not allow you to kill anymore of my kind!  Prepare to die!"]="我再也不能允许你杀死我的同胞了！受死吧！"
G["I will not be caged again. These Shado-Pan could not stop me. Neither shall you!"]="你们休想再封印我。影踪派阻止不了我。你们也不行！"
G["I will not be contained! Ngyah!!"]="我是不会被困住的！Ngyah！！"
G["I will not be controlled!"]="休想控制我！"
G["I will not be defeated!"]="我不会被打败的！"
G["I will not be denied! This world shall fall!"]="我是不会失败的！这个世界注定要毁灭！"
G["I will not be lured away!"]="我不会受到引诱离开的！"
G["I will not be lured from this place."]="我不会受到引诱离开这儿的。"
G["I will not be manipulated!"]="我是不会被控制的！"
G["I will not be pulled outside into your trap! Face me here, coward!"]="别想把我骗到外面，我不会中你的陷阱！就在这里面对我吧，懦夫！"
G["I will not be stopped by such pitiful defenses."]="我不会被如此脆弱的防守阻止的。"
G["I will not be taken so easily! Let the walls of this prison tremble... and fall!"]="我是不会轻易倒下的！让这座牢狱的墙壁颤抖并崩塌吧！"
G["I will not be touched by rabble such as you!"]="你们这些乌合之众休想碰到我！"
G["I will not be upstaged by amateurs!"]="我不会被业余演员轻视的！"
G["I will not bow to th-"]="我不会屈服于——"
G["I will not delay."]="我即刻执行。"
G["I will not die again! Not to the likes of you!!"]="我不会再次死去！我不会被你们这些蝼蚁打败！"
G["I will not die for you, Drahga."]="我不会为你而死，达加。"
G["I will not die here today, creature!"]="今天我不会死在这里，怪物！"
G["I will not die in bed like a coward."]="我可不会像个懦夫一样躺在床上等死。"
G["I will not die like this. Not like this!"]="我绝不能就这么死掉。绝不！"
G["I will not die powerless like this!"]="我不要这么无助的死去！"
G["I will not die so quickly this time!"]="这次我不会死那么快了！"
G["I will not die to save your hide, Twilight dude!"]="我不会为了救你而丧命，暮光小子！"
G["I will not do it. My grandfather knew what he was getting into when he first planted seed in the shadow of the Serpent's Spine."]="我不会那么做的。在蟠龙脊的阴凉中播下第一粒种子开始，我的祖父就知道将来会变成什么样子。"
G["I will not drag this out any further than it needs, Lady Sinestra. You have bent my ear, now tell me what it is that you want from Dragonmaw."]="我不想说太多废话，女伯爵希奈丝特拉。就直接告诉我你想从龙喉氏族这里得到什么吧。"
G["I will not fail you, Warchief.  I will lead as well as I can, and I will consult with the advisors you suggest.  I know what a tremendous honor you do me, and I will strive to be worthy of it."]="我不会让你失望的，酋长。我会尽我所能管理好部落，并与你推荐的顾问多加沟通。我深知你所赋予我的是一份极大的荣耀，我会全力以赴，让自己无愧于此。"
G["I will not fail you, master!"]="我不会让你失望的，主人！"
G["I will not fail you, or this village."]="我不会让你和这村子失望。"
G["I will not fail!"]="我不会失败！"
G["I will not fail! Not again!"]="我不会失败！再也不会！"
G["I will not fail."]="我不会令你失望的。"
G["I will not fall again!"]="我不会再倒下了！"
G["I will not fall, not here, not now!"]="此时此地，我是不会倒下的！"
G["I will not forget this... kindness. I thank you, Highness"]="我不会忘记您的……仁慈。感谢您，殿下。"
G["I will not forrrget what you have done...\n\nPleassse, leave meee..."]="我不会忘记你所做的……\n\n请离开我……"
G["I will not give it to you, Socrethar!"]="我不会把它给你的，索克雷萨！"
G["I will not grant you a swift death, weakling."]="你休想痛痛快快地死，懦夫。"
G["I will not hold back on you, $n. Please, do me the same favor."]="我不会对你手下留情的，$n。请你也不要有所保留。"
G["I will not last much longer!"]="我支撑不了多久了。"
G["I will not last much longer."]="我坚持不了多久了。"
G["I will not leave Kasha's side."]="我不会离开卡莎半步。"
G["I will not leave until we have located Suna."]="在找到孙娜之前，我绝不离开。"
G["I will not leave you! Do not forget that I am the huntress in this family!"]="我不会离开你！别忘了，我可是家族中的女猎手！"
G["I will not leave your side."]="我不会离你而去。"
G["I will not leave. Tell my family that I am at peace here and that I wish them well."]="我不会离开的。告诉我的家人，我在这里很好，也希望他们过得好。"
G["I will not let you and this treasonous Commander Stonebreaker steal my son's birthright!"]="我不会让你和这大逆不道的指挥官碎石盗取我儿子与生俱来的权利！"
G["I will not let you curse another soul with this nightmare."]="我决不会让你用这个梦魇去荼毒另一个灵魂。"
G["I will not let you defeat me."]="我不会让你打败我的。"
G["I will not let you destroy our hard work! Nergeld will be the end of you all!"]="我不会让你毁了我们的劳动成果的！尼尔盖德会把你们都干掉的！"
G["I will not let you do this, Garrosh."]="你休想得逞，加尔鲁什。"
G["I will not let you do this. I swear to it."]="我不会让你得逞的。我发誓。"
G["I will not let you fall, $p!"]="我不会让你倒下的，$p！"
G["I will not let you win!"]="别想赢我！"
G["I will not make the same mistake again, Sylvanas. This time there will be no escape. You will all serve me in death!"]="我不会再犯同样的错误，希尔瓦娜斯。这次你走不了了，你们死后都会成为我的奴仆！"
G["I will not participate in their false ritual. There is nothing special about Kroshik, or his meat. Meat is meat."]="我才不参加他们那个虚伪的仪式呢。考什克没什么特别的，他的肉也是。肉就是肉。"
G["I will not rest until I defeat you!"]="在我打败你之前，我决不会懈怠！"
G["I will not rest, $n. Not until they are driven back to the sea."]="在把他们赶回到大海之前，我不会休息，$n。"
G["I will not return until I am heard. There is too much at stake."]="不召见我我是不会走的。形势已经非常危险了。"
G["I will not share my father's fate!  Your tale ends here!"]="我不会重蹈父亲的覆辙！你的传说就此终结！"
G["I will not simply lay here and allow you to slay me! You will have to earn your right to draw another breath if you want to kill me, mortal!"]="我不会躺在这里等死的！凡人，想杀我的话，也得看看你有没有那个本事！"
G["I will not stand for needless violence!"]="我不会容忍毫无必要的暴力！"
G["I will not stand for this!"]="我不会容忍这个！"
G["I will not stop until this place is once again at peace."]="除非这片土地恢复安宁，否则我不会后退一步的。"
G["I will not survive!\n\n*GULP*\n\nHELP ME!"]="我要死啦！\n\n*呃呃*\n\n救命！"
G["I will not tolerate this disobedience!"]="我绝不容忍这种违逆！"
G["I will not waste this chance. I will seek out my destiny."]="我不会浪费这个机会的。我要找到自己真正的命运。"
G["I will now accept your guesses and wagers on the victor of the match."]="我现在接受你对本场比赛胜负的预测。"
G["I will now peform the sacred ritual of my people."]="我现在要举行我族人的神圣仪式。"
G["I will now remove the fog from your eyes.  Behold, our captive."]="现在我要移去你眼前的迷雾。看着吧，我们的俘虏。"
G["I will offer you accomodations for as long as you are of use to us."]="只要你对我们还有用处，我就会为你安排膳宿。"
G["I will only slow you down, but no pink-skinned humans will keep me from freedom!"]="粉皮肤的人类也许可以夺走我的生命，但他们不能夺走我的自由！"
G["I will pick my teeth with your bones!"]="我要用你们的骨头来剔牙！"
G["I will prepare the enchantment right away then. This may finally shed some light on the means and intentions of the naga."]="那我这就准备施法。这也许总算能让我们对纳迦的手段和意图有所了解。"
G["I will prepare the pack. It will take some time to gather them all, but we will join... for now."]="我会整理行装。把他们全都集结起来需要花点时间，可我们愿意加入……至少目前如此。"
G["I will present your head to Abbendis myself!"]="我要将你献给阿比迪斯！"
G["I will protect you!"]="我会保护你的！"
G["I will protect you, Anren!"]="我会保护你的，安伦！"
G["I will protect you, friend!"]="我会保护你的，朋友！"
G["I will prove it to you. I will strike the Wildhammer at Thundermar."]="我会证明给你看。我会向桑德玛尔的蛮锤部族发起攻击。"
G["I will prove myself to the master!"]="我会向主人证明自己的价值！"
G["I will prove myself!"]="我会证明我自己的！"
G["I will pull the shard from his sundered corpse."]="我会从他破碎的尸体中取出碎片的。"
G["I will purge you from this place!"]="我要将你彻底净化！"
G["I will purge you!"]="我要净化你们！"
G["I will put an end to your life before you realize the horrible truth!"]="在你了解到这恐怖的真相之前，我要结束你的生命！"
G["I will read the words carved into the stone, and you must find a way to light it."]="我会阅读刻在石头上的字，而你必须想办法点亮它。"
G["I will reanimate them all as servants of the Lich King! Bring them here..."]="我要将他们都转变成巫妖王的仆从！把尸体都带来吧……"
G["I will rejoin you soon. We will teach these Grimtotem savages the meaning of honor."]="我很快就会与你汇合。我们要让那些恐怖图腾的野人明白，什么是光荣。"
G["I will remain here to examine Kor'ik's remains. I will meet you back in Klaxxi'vess when you have completed these tasks."]="我留下检查科尔里克的遗骸。等你完成这些任务之后，我会和你在卡拉克西维斯见面。"
G["I will rendezvous with you at Niuzao temple, $p. Our investigation isn't nearly over yet..."]="我会和你在砮皂寺会合，$p。我们的调查还远没有结束……"
G["I will repay you one day."]="总有一天，我会报答你。"
G["I will require a demonstration of your determination before I share my gifts with you..."]="在我教给你我的本事之前我需要看到你的决心……"
G["I will return my fists to the battle."]="我要让敌人再尝尝我的拳头。"
G["I will return to Azeroth at once, Greatmother."]="我会马上回到艾泽拉斯的，祖母。"
G["I will return to Klaxxi'vess to meet with the council. Please take good care of Kovok."]="我将返回卡拉克西维斯会见议会。请照顾好科沃克。"
G["I will return when I have the Plates of Uldum."]="我找到奥丹姆圆盘之后会回来的。"
G["I will return you to the hell that bore you!"]="我要把你重新打回地狱里去！"
G["I will return..."]="我会回来的……"
G["I will rip apart every last slave in this valley. Your little uprising will be the death of you all!"]="我要撕碎山谷中所有的奴隶，你们这微不足道的暴动只有死路一条！"
G["I will rip out your soul!"]="我要撕裂你的灵魂！"
G["I will rip your heart from your chest!"]="我要把你的心挖出来！"
G["I will rise again, more powerful... much... more..."]="我会再站起来的，变得……更加……强大……"
G["I will roll, roll through the gates of Mogu'shan."]="我会滚啊滚，滚进魔古山的大门。"
G["I will run no longer. Seek me atop the peak to the east."]="我不会再逃离。到东边的山峰顶上找我。"
G["I will savor your death, interloper!"]="我会好好享受你的死亡的，闯入者！"
G["I will say, the Forsaken have... strange taste when it comes to brew. I get the feeling they're not exactly preparing it for friends, though."]="我想说，被遗忘者……在酒方面的口味非常独特。但是，我感觉他们不是在为朋友准备。"
G["I will see no more of my people's blood shed meaninglessly. Waste your men if you wish, Warchief, but you will waste none of mine."]="我绝不会再坐视我的人民白白流血。如果你愿意的话，就让你的人去送死好了，但你别想拿我的人当炮灰。"
G["I will see ta it personally dat the Darkspear rise as a power in their own right."]="我会确保暗矛巨魔顽强屹立，发挥出它所应有的力量。"
G["I will see to it that Shaldyn is returned safely. Thank you, hero."]="Me encargaré de que Shaldyn vuelva a salvo. Gracias, $ghéroe:heroína;."
G["I will see to it!"]="我保证！"
G["I will see to that."]="我发誓。"
G["I will see to your demise myself!"]="我要亲眼见证你的死亡！"
G["I will see you again, soon."]="我们很快就会再见面的。"
G["I will see you all burn."]="我会看着你们燃烧。"
G["I will see you at back at camp."]="我会在营地与你会面。"
G["I will see you at the Temple of Storms.  Looks like I'm going to have to break her in again."]="我会在风暴神殿等你。看来我得再降服她一次了。"
G["I will see you back at The Shadow Vault."]="我们还会在暗影拱顶见面的。"
G["I will see you back at the Valley of Echoes. Suffer well, ally."]="我会在回音谷等你。朋友，坚持住。"
G["I will see you back at the pagoda. Thank you so much."]="我们在亭子那见。真是太感谢你了。"
G["I will see you in Icecrown, weakling... if you live that long!"]="到冰冠冰川来找我吧，懦夫……如果你们还能活着到那里的话！"
G["I will see you in green fields on the other side, $n."]="我在另一个世界里的绿野上等你，$n。"
G["I will see you inside the Monastery!"]="我们禅院里见！"
G["I will see you up top, $n. Thank you again for my freedom!"]="Te veo arriba. ¡Gracias otra vez por liberarme!"
G["I will send a representative from amongst your people to the new warchief, Garrosh Hellscream in Orgrimmar."]="我会在你们族内选择一名代表，去见新酋长——奥格瑞玛的加尔鲁什·地狱咆哮。"
G["I will send my brother to go with you."]="我会让我弟弟跟你一起去。"
G["I will send some of my priestesses to aid you. Find the artifact quickly so that I can begin summoning our allies for the battles to come."]="我会派我的祭司来帮助你。尽快找到神器，这样我才能开始召唤援军，来应对即将到来的战争。"
G["I will send these to Thunder Bluff to confirm my findings. I may need your assistance again soon, friend."]="Enviaré estos a Cima del Trueno para confirmar mis hallazgos. Puede que pronto vuelva a necesitar tu ayuda, $gamigo:amiga;."
G["I will send word that you have discovered the link to the Defias. I was a fool to think them broken with the defeat of Edwin Van Cleef, and King Wrynn will want to make an example of all who remain."]="我会告诉乌瑞恩国王，是你找到了迪菲亚盗贼的幕后主使。之前我曾经以为在艾德温·范克里夫死后，迪菲亚盗贼已经土崩瓦解，看来我大错特错了。乌瑞恩国王正好借此机会向其他蠢蠢欲动的家伙发出警告。"
G["I will send you to a watery grave!"]="我要把你拿去喂鱼！"
G["I will serve the master... in death!"]="我要侍奉主人……到最后一刻！"
G["I will sever your soul from your body!"]="我会剥下你低贱的灵魂！"
G["I will shield you from harm!"]="我会保护你免受伤害！"
G["I will show no mercy to the defiled!"]="我绝不宽恕亵渎者！"
G["I will show no mercy!"]="我不会心存怜悯！"
G["I will show you horrors undreamed of."]="我会让你体验到前所未有的恐惧。"
G["I will show you no mercy."]="我不会放过你们的。"
G["I will show you not to cross us again!"]="别想再插手我们的事情！"
G["I will show you the face of fear."]="我会让你尝尝恐惧的滋味。"
G["I will show you the heart of fear!"]="见识一下恐惧之心！"
G["I will show you the meaning of despair... and I will drag this whole island down with me!"]="我会让你见识下什么叫绝望……我还要让整个岛臣服在我的脚下！"
G["I will show you the strength of a true warlord!"]="我要让你瞧瞧督军的真正力量！"
G["I will show you the weakness of flesh!"]="我要让你看到血肉之躯的软弱！"
G["I will shut you down, orc. I will put you in the dirt!"]="我会让你闭嘴，兽人。我会把你埋进土里！"
G["I will slay a hundred foes! As soon as I... can catch my breath."]="我要杀死一百个敌人！ 只等我……先喘口气。"
G["I will slow the Destroyer's attacks when I can."]="我会尽力放慢灭世者的攻击。"
G["I will smite them all in the name of Sunstrider!"]="我要以逐日者的名义把他们都干掉！"
G["I will smoke your ashes."]="我要将你挫骨扬灰。"
G["I will soon be stronger than any elf!  I will serve at Kil'jaeden's side!"]="很快我就会比其他精灵更强壮了！我会效忠基尔加丹！"
G["I will soon put you in your place."]="我这就让你们滚回去。"
G["I will spill your blood in Deathwing's name!"]="以死亡之翼之名，我要让你见不到明天早上的太阳！"
G["I will squeeze the life from you!"]="我要把你彻底捏碎！"
G["I will stay behind and investigate this dais further..."]="我要留下，进一步调查这里……"
G["I will stay here and watch over the land as it heals.  Do keep an eye out for any stragglers from here..."]="我会留在这里，照看这片正在痊愈的大地。请一定注意来自于这里的游荡者……"
G["I will stay my hand this time, Alliance hero. Let it not be said that the Sunreavers do not show gratitude."]="我就饶你一次，联盟的英雄。免得让人说夺日者不懂得感恩。"
G["I will stay my hand this time, Horde hero. Let it not be said that the Silver Covenant does not show gratitude."]="我就饶你一次，部落的英雄。免得让人说银色盟约不懂得感恩。"
G["I will stay with you, Anren!"]="有我陪着你呢，安伦！"
G["I will suffer your presence no longer. Begone. Find someone else to extort."]="我真是受不了你。滚吧，别在我身上白费力气了。"
G["I will take great pleasure in slaughtering you, $c!"]="$c，杀死你对我来说真是莫大的乐趣！"
G["I will take great pleasure in tearing the forces of the Horde apart... limb from limb and piece by piece..."]="我很乐意与部落的军队交手……将他们撕得粉碎……"
G["I will take pity on you, Sartharion, just this once."]="我真是同情你，萨塔里奥，仅此一次。"
G["I will take pleasure in gutting you!"]="我要能把你打败的话会很高兴！"
G["I will take that as a compliment.  We'll hold the docks for now and marshall the forces. Vol'jin should await you at the gates of Orgrimmar."]="谢谢你的赞美。我们得守住码头，指挥部队。沃金应该就在奥格瑞玛的城门前等你们。"
G["I will take the ugly one."]="我来对付那个丑八怪。"
G["I will take you up on that offer, Eitrigg."]="伊崔格，我会帮你的忙的。"
G["I will teach you ignorant children just how little you know of magic."]="我要让你们这些无知的孩子重新了解魔法的概念。"
G["I will teach you some respect!"]="我要让你学会敬畏！"
G["I will teach you the rules of this race. Follow me!"]="我会将比赛的规则传授给你。跟我来！"
G["I will teach you the way of the hammersmith. Just ask nicely."]="我会教你锤系专精之道。你只需要恭恭敬敬地问我就可以了。"
G["I will teach you to obey!"]="我要让你学会听话！"
G["I will teach you what I can."]="我会将我所知道的传授给你的。"
G["I will teach you what I can. Each lesson is a gift from the Goddess herself. Use her gifts wisely, and you shall not falter."]="我会尽我所能教你。每一节课都是女神亲自给你的礼物。正确使用她的礼物，你就会无往不胜。"
G["I will teach you, but first you must prove your worth..."]="我会教你的，但是首先你得证明自己的实力……"
G["I will teach you... soon. I require a demonstration of your loyalty, first."]="我会教你……很快的。可我需要你先证明自己的忠心。"
G["I will tear off your limbs and use them to beat you into submission!"]="我要撕裂你，用你的肢体打败你！"
G["I will tear you limb from limb."]="我要把你撕成碎片。"
G["I will tear you to pieces, demon!"]="我要把你撕成碎片，恶魔！"
G["I will tear your soul into morsels and slow roast them over demon fire!"]="我会把你的灵魂撕成碎片，把它们放在恶魔之火上慢慢灸烤！"
G["I will tear your tusks out. You hear me?"]="我会扯掉你们的獠牙，听到了吗？"
G["I will tell the tale of your heroics to Haramad myself! All Consortium will know your name, $n. Thank you, my friend."]="我会把你的英雄事迹亲自讲述给哈拉迈德听！星界财团的所有人都会知道你的名字，$n。感谢你，我的朋友。"
G["I will tell them. Farewell, elder."]="我会告诉他们的。保重，长者。"
G["I will tell you nothing, $r-pig!"]="¡No te diré nada, $gcerdo:cerda; $r!"
G["I will triumph in THEIR name!"]="我会以他们的名义取得胜利！"
G["I will try to lead the \"King\" back to Lion's Landing and see if I can't persuade him to volunteer the information we need. In the meantime, I would say try to solve his riddles and meet us there."]="Intentaré llevar al \"Rey\" de vuelta al Desembarco del León para ver si lo convenzo de darnos la información que necesitamos. Entretanto, supongo que puedes intentar resolver sus acertijos y reunirte con nosotros más tarde."
G["I will turn this tower to rubble, and scatter it across the wastes."]="我会夷平这座塔，将它的碎片抛洒在荒原上。"
G["I will turn your bones to ash!"]="我要把你锉骨扬灰！"
G["I will unlock the crystal's power, but only you can decide how it is to be used."]="我可以解开水晶的力量，可只有你才能决定如何使用它。"
G["I will use all the resources at my disposal to expose the source of the mogu's power."]="我会运用手里的一些资源来找出魔古族的力量之源。"
G["I will use the crying violet to bind our words... our voices will be carried to you even in the deepest reaches of Jaedenar and Shadow Hold."]="我会把我们的话语封存在悲泣的紫罗兰中……就算是在加德纳尔和暗影堡的最深处，也能听到我们的声音。"
G["I will use the power of the ata'mal crystal to crush you!"]="我会用阿塔玛水晶的力量来毁灭你！"
G["I will vanquish your soul!"]="我要征服你们的灵魂！"
G["I will wait, Sentinel... but I will have my audience."]="我可以等，卫兵……但请一定要召见我。"
G["I will wash you to sea."]="我要把你冲到海里去。"
G["I will watch over you and your allies, $r."]="我会保护你和你的盟友，$r。"
G["I will watch you bleed!"]="我就要这么看着你流血！"
G["I will wear your skin as a hat!"]="我要把你的皮做成帽子戴！"
G["I will win my freedom and leave this cursed place!"]="我要争取自由，离开这个该死的地方！"
G["I will write of your adventures right now!"]="我现在就开始动笔写你的冒险故事！"
G["I will yell out commands for \"Left\" and \"Right\". Pay close attention, $c."]="Voy a gritarte las instrucciones \"izquierda\" y \"derecha\". Presta atención, $c."
G["I will, Greatfather."]="我会的，爷爷。"
G["I will, I will. But, Hobart, you have to calm down. Your blood pressure! You're turning deep green!"]="我会的，我会的。但霍巴特，你必须先平静下来。你的血压已经很高了！你全身都变成深绿色了！"
G["I will, Tirion."]="我会的，提里奥。"
G["I will."]="我会的。"
G["I will... rise... again..."]="我还会……回来的……"
G["I win this round, rookie!"]="¡Yo gano esta ronda, $gnovato:novata;!"
G["I win this round. Better luck next time."]="这回是我赢了。祝你下次好运。"
G["I win this time. It seems that you are the one who needs more training."]="这次我赢了。看来需要多加训练的是你才对。"
G["I win!"]="我赢了！"
G["I win!!"]="我赢了！！"
G["I win? Yay!"]="我赢了？耶！"
G["I wish I could aid you in your plight, mortal. But the blue dragonflight is in disarray, and there are other urgent matters here at the World Tree that I've been sent to investigate..."]="我真希望能帮你脱困，凡人。但现在蓝龙军团内部有一些麻烦，我本人还要去处理其他有关世界之树的紧急事件……"
G["I wish I could have seen the looks on their faces when they realized you were shooting them down with our junk."]="我真想看看当他们意识到自己是被你用这些破烂打下来时，脸上有什么表情。"
G["I wish I could help but... my father is the one dragon I fear."]="我真希望能帮上忙……但父亲是我唯一惧怕的一条龙。"
G["I wish I could live in a tree house."]="我希望我可以住在这些树屋里。"
G["I wish I could make you a deal, partner - I really do - but you'll need to be exalted with the Bilgewater Cartel, first."]="Desearía poder hacer un trato, camarada, de verdad, pero primero es necesario que en el Cártel Pantoque te consideren $gun exaltado:una exaltada;."
G["I wish I could make you a deal, partner - I really do - but you'll need to be friendly with the Bilgewater Cartel, first."]="Desearía poder hacer un trato, camarada, de verdad, pero primero es necesario que en el Cártel Pantoque te consideren $gamistoso:amistosa;."
G["I wish I could pay today... but business has been so bad lately. I just don't have the money.\n\nThe few pieces of gold I have were going to buy dinner for my family. Please... there must be something you can do."]="我也想今天就能还上钱……但这段时间生意难做呀，我实在是没有钱。\n\n我身上仅有的几块金币还是准备给我家人买晚餐的。求求你……发发慈悲帮助我吧。"
G["I wish I could play ring toss."]="我也想玩套圈圈。"
G["I wish I could tell you more, but until recently nobody believed such creatures existed. Long before the Titans shaped Azeroth into the world we see today, before the natural cycle of life and death as we know it, the Old Ones ruled over the elements and corrupted creation to serve their own malignant ends.\n\nFrom what Onu here tells me, the Titans ultimately defeated the Old Ones. Or, at least, they imprisoned them under the earth. Can something like that ever really die? I wish I knew more, but this is all pre-prehistory for me, and I've been around a while.\n\nI know that there are some that worship the Old Ones, if you can believe that. That's like praying for the end of the world. These Old Gods make people crazy!"]="Ojalá pudiera contarte más, pero hasta hace poco nadie creía que existieran tales criaturas. Mucho antes de que los Titanes convirtieran Azeroth en el mundo que vemos hoy, antes del ciclo de la vida y la muerte tal y como lo conocemos, los Antiguos gobernaban los elementos y las creaciones corruptas para que sirvieran a sus malignos propósitos.\n\nPor lo que me cuenta Onus, los Titanes acabaron por derrotar a los Antiguos. O al menos los apresaron bajo la tierra. ¿Puede morir algo así? Me gustaría saber más, pero para mí esto es pre-prehistoria y no soy precisamente joven.\n\nSé que algunas personas adoran a los Antiguos, ¿te lo puedes creer? Es como rezar para que llegue el fin del mundo. ¡Los dioses antiguos vuelven loca a la gente!"
G["I wish I could watch her reduce your pitiful band to cinders, but I am needed elsewhere. Farewell!"]="我真希望能亲眼看着她将你们这群可怜的家伙烧成灰烬，但我还有别的事情要忙。永别了！"
G["I wish I had a $gfather:mother; like you!"]="我希望我能有个像你一样的$g爸爸:妈妈;！"
G["I wish I had a cookie.  I love cookies!"]="要是有甜饼吃就好了。我喜欢甜饼！"
G["I wish I had a pet turtle."]="我也想要一只宠物龟。"
G["I wish I had more time to teach all who came before me, but alas that is not the way of things. Until you have learned all that Padaar has to teach, I cannot help you."]="我希望有更多的时间来向所有找我学习的人传授知识，但是做事必须循序渐进。在你把帕达尔教你的东西都学会之前，我帮不了你。"
G["I wish I had someone other to blame than myself."]="我很想给自己找个替罪羊。"
G["I wish I had tickets for tonight's show!"]="我真希望自己有今晚演出的门票！"
G["I wish I knew, dear. He will not listen to you nor will he listen to me. In truth, it is why I am still here. It is why I have not left with Mother Kashur. He must find his heart. Our people will not survive through the winter without leadership."]="Me gustaría saberlo, $gquerido:querida;. No te escuchará. Igual que no me escucha a mí. En realidad, él es la razón por la que sigo aquí. Por eso no me fui con madre Kashur. Debe encontrar su corazón. Nuestro pueblo no sobrevivirá al invierno sin un líder."
G["I wish for a million gold, wait a second  I already have a million gold...  I wish for a million million gold!"]="我想要一百万金币……等等，我已经有一百万金币了……我想要十亿金币！"
G["I wish it were true, $n, but it will take more than you alone to overcome the forces of Razelikh and his subordinates.\n\nGather a suitable group of adventurers and would-be heroes and free my men of their eternal torture! Eighteen stones you must shatter.\n\nFight hard and die with honor, $n."]="Me gustaría creer que es cierto, $n, pero tú solo no serás suficiente para combatir a Razelikh y a sus subordinados.\n\n¡Reúne un buen grupo de aventureros dispuestos a dejarse la piel y libera a mis hombres de su eterna tortura! Tienes que romper en pedazos dieciocho piedras.\n\nLucha a muerte y muere con honor, $n."
G["I wish that I was going to fight by your side in the upcoming battle, but Erunak wants me to remain here.\n\nGood luck, $n."]="Desearía luchar a tu lado en la batalla que se avecina, pero Erunak desea que me quede aquí.\n\nBuena suerte, $n."
G["I wish the jinyu could join the Alliance.  Thank you!"]="真希望锦鱼人能加入联盟。谢谢你！"
G["I wish the snow would just all melt away. It's always getting my robe wet and messing up everything!"]="我希望雪融化掉。它总是把我的长袍弄湿，把一切都搞得乱糟糟的！"
G["I wish to be a mooncloth tailoring specialist. Can you teach me?"]="我想成为月布裁缝大师。你能教我吗？"
