G["I wish to speak to the spirits, Tiev."]="提夫，我想跟自然之魂谈谈。"
G["I wish to speak with your chief."]="我想和你们的酋长对话。"
G["I wish to stable my pet, Gedrah."]="我想要寄放我的宠物，盖德拉。"
G["I wish to stable my pet, Stable Master."]="兽栏管理员，我想寄放我的宠物。"
G["I wish to stable my pet."]="我想寄放我的宠物。"
G["I wish to start gaining experience again."]="我希望能再次开始获取经验。"
G["I wish to test the Legendary Nexus instance."]="我想要测试传奇武器魔枢副本。"
G["I wish to train as an alchemist, Daedal."]="我想要学习炼金术，丹达尔。"
G["I wish to train, Aesom."]="我想接受训练，伊索姆。"
G["I wish to train."]="我要训练。"
G["I wish to travel by hippogryph."]="我想要乘坐角鹰兽。"
G["I wish to travel directly to Vashj'ir Landing."]="我想直接前往瓦丝琪尔平台。"
G["I wish to travel to Light's Breach."]="我要去圣光据点。"
