G["I wish to unlearn Axesmithing!"]="我想要遗忘铸斧专精！"
G["I wish to unlearn Elixir Mastery."]="我希望遗忘药剂专精。"
G["I wish to unlearn Hammersmithing!"]="我想要遗忘铸锤专精！"
G["I wish to unlearn Mooncloth Tailoring."]="我想遗忘月布裁缝专精。"
G["I wish to unlearn Potion Mastery."]="我希望遗忘药水专精。"
G["I wish to unlearn Shadoweave Tailoring."]="我想遗忘暗纹裁缝专精。"
G["I wish to unlearn Spellfire Tailoring."]="我想遗忘魔焰裁缝专精。"
G["I wish to unlearn Swordsmithing!"]="我想要遗忘铸剑专精！"
G["I wish to unlearn Transmutation Mastery."]="我希望遗忘转化专精。"
G["I wish to unlearn Weaponsmithing!"]="我想要遗忘武器锻造专精！"
G["I wish to unlearn dragonscale leatherworking!"]="我想要遗忘龙鳞制皮专精！"
G["I wish to unlearn elemental leatherworking!"]="我想要遗忘元素制皮专精！"
G["I wish to unlearn my Gnomish Engineering specialization!"]="我想要忘掉侏儒工程学分支的知识！"
G["I wish to unlearn my Goblin Engineering specialization!"]="我想要忘掉地精工程学分支的知识！"
G["I wish to unlearn my Talents."]="我希望遗忘自己的天赋。"
G["I wish to unlearn my talents."]="我想要遗忘我的天赋。"
G["I wish to unlearn tribal leatherworking!"]="我想要遗忘部族制皮专精！"
G["I wish to untrain my pet."]="我想要让宠物遗忘技能。"
G["I wish we had a priest or a druid out here. I can't continue my studies until I've recovered from my injuries."]="要是有牧师或是德鲁伊在就好了。在康复之前，我没法继续研究工作了。"
G["I wish you a happy holiday, friend!"]="¡Te deseo felices fiestas, $gamigo:amiga;!"
G["I wish you could just pick me up and carry me."]="你能背我走一段吗？"
G["I wish you the best of luck on your adventures here!"]="祝你能在这里交上好运！"
G["I wish you the best of luck."]="祝你运气奇佳。"
G["I wish you'd surrendered."]="我以为你会投降的。"
G["I witnessed the handiwork of our new goblin allies when I was stranded in the Lost Isles. But now we put their ingenuity to the test: here we face down our foes in their own stronghold."]="当我在失落群岛上束手无策的时候，我见识了我们新地精盟友的能力。但现在，我们要测试他们的才华了：我们要在敌人的要塞中与他们作战。"
G["I woke up in a bed in Northshire three weeks later. Don't remember a damn thing."]="三个星期之后，我在北郡醒来。但是我已经想不起任何事了。"
G["I won a Brawler's Guild invitation just now! I'll surely be rank 8 by tonight!  I sure hope I don't lose my ticket before I get there."]="我刚刚赢得了一张搏击俱乐部的邀请函！我今晚肯定就能到8级！但愿在抵达那里之前，我不会把票弄丢了。"
G["I won't allow it, Mal'Ganis! Better that these people die by my hand than serve as your slaves in death!"]="我不会让你得逞的，玛尔加尼斯！我绝对不会眼睁睁地看着他们成为你的奴仆！"
G["I won't be far!"]="我不会离开太远的！"
G["I won't be getting any dirt on this beautiful face."]="我是不会让这张漂亮的脸蛋儿沾上一点泥巴的。"
G["I won't be held responsible for the catastrophe that will surely result from the haphazard maintenance of this building."]="我不会为这座必然倒塌的破烂建筑所造成的任何灾难负责的。"
G["I won't be the least bit upset if you choose to call it a day...."]="如果你决定就此结束的话，我一点都不会失望……"
G["I won't beat the others by standing around talking to you."]="要是我一直站着陪你聊天，就无法击败对手了。"
G["I won't challenge you, but I'd like to see your wares."]="我无意与你为敌，不过我想看看你的货物。"
G["I won't forget this.  Thank you."]="我不会忘记这件事。谢谢你。"
G["I won't give you the pleasure."]="我不会让你好过。"
G["I won't go back!"]="我不会回去的！"
G["I won't go down that easy!"]="我不会轻易倒下的！"
G["I won't go easy on you!"]="我不会对你客气的！"
G["I won't hear ya say such tings."]="不要说这种丧气话。"
G["I won't leave your side."]="我会寸步不离。"
G["I won't leave!"]="我是不会离开的！"
G["I won't let them get away with this, Twinkles. They will pay! They will all pay!"]="这件事决不会就这么算了，烁影。他们要付出代价！全都要付出代价！"
G["I won't let them take me!"]="我是不会让他们抓住我的！"
G["I won't let those damned orcs invade Redridge again!"]="绝不让那些该死的兽人再入侵赤脊山！"
G["I won't let you down!"]="我不会让你倒下的！"
G["I won't let you get away with that!"]="这事决不会就这么算了！"
G["I won't let you take us down that dark path again, young Hellscream. I'll kill you myself before that day comes..."]="加尔鲁什，我不能坐视不管，任由你带领族人重新踏上那条黑暗的道路。我会在局势无可挽回之前亲手杀了你……"
G["I won't let your families see you like this!  Us miners have to look after each other!"]="我不会让你们的家人看到你们这副模样的！矿工就应该互相照顾啊！"
G["I won't make it... go... go on without me..."]="我不会……撒手不管的……"
G["I won't sacrifice my warriors for romantic notions of glorious death on the battlefield. What use is fighting for survival if no one survives?"]="我不会让将士们为了所谓的“荣耀”白白送命。如果没人能活下来，那么为生存而战还有什么意义呢？"
G["I won't soon forget this kindness, $r."]="我会记得你的恩情，$r。"
G["I won't throw away Alliance lives. I will accept nothing less than total victory."]="我不会让联盟白白流血。我只想要一场彻底的胜利。"
G["I won't... be... ignored!"]="我不要……被忽视！"
G["I wonder how Seth's mom is doing?"]="塞瑟的妈妈在做什么？"
G["I wonder how far the gears turn?"]="真想知道，它的发条能拧多紧？"
G["I wonder how far this would launch that white cat..."]="我在想，这玩意能把一只白猫丢多远……"
G["I wonder how fast these guys can move?"]="这些家伙能跑多快？"
G["I wonder how long it would take to get all of this?"]="我在想，要花多少时间才能弄到所有这些东西啊？"
G["I wonder how long we'll be here before the general gives us our marching orders."]="我想知道在将军给我们下达行军命令之前，我们还要在这里待多久。"
G["I wonder how many kegs these animals can hold?"]="这些动物到底能背几个桶啊？"
G["I wonder how many more of them live among us. I knew Spark for years - never could I have imagined that he was a traitor."]="我怀疑还有多少这样的叛徒混在我们中间。我认识斯巴克很多年了，却从未想到过他会是个叛徒。"
G["I wonder how many reinforcements need to suffer injury before they allow us to chop down these idiotic trees. They're costing us a fortune in bats. Maybe I'll rig a harness or two..."]="援军正陆续赶来，不知道伤亡人数要上升到什么程度，他们才肯同意我砍掉这些讨厌的树木。我们的蝙蝠损失严重。或许我应该给它们配备盔甲……"
G["I wonder how much longer they'll be in Silvermoon City. I hope they play here!"]="我想知道他们会在银月城待多久，真希望他们能在这里表演！"
G["I wonder how often the sandbox gets cleaned."]="我在想，这个沙箱到底多久清理一次啊。"
G["I wonder how they got hurt."]="我很好奇，他们是怎么受伤的。"
G["I wonder if I'll ever be the same after this. Heh, nuthin' a pint won't cure I'll wager."]="我想我再也回不到从前了吧。呵呵，来一品脱酒应该就成。"
G["I wonder if I'm too cute for the jungle?"]="我这么可爱，是不是不该待在丛林里？"
G["I wonder if Ma Stonefield ever fixed the lock on that window..."]="我很好奇，斯通菲尔德妈妈到底能不能修好那扇窗子上的锁……"
G["I wonder if Sayge plays Whack-a-Gnoll?"]="我在想，塞格会不会去玩打豺狼人的游戏？"
G["I wonder if Uncle came through here on his way to the brewery."]="不知道叔叔去酿酒厂会路过这儿吗？"
G["I wonder if anyone survived..."]="不知还有没有人活下来……"
G["I wonder if it's possible to eat rocks? Got plenty of rocks around here. Just imagine it! I'd be the richest person in the world for making that discovery!"]="不知道吃石头行不行？这儿附近可有好多石头。想象一下！我将因这一伟大的发现成为这世上最富有的人！"
G["I wonder if my shoes are too fancy for exploring?"]="不知我的鞋子对于探险来说是不是太过花哨了？"
G["I wonder if our fates are somehow cursed. The horrors inflicted on us never seem to cease.\n\nSometimes all you can do is try to maintain good spirits, and perhaps a mild appreciation for fickle twists of fortune, whichever way they turn."]="我想我们也许被某种方式给诅咒了。我们所遭受的恐惧，似乎从来没有停止。\n\n有时你所有能做的就是尽量保持良好的精神状态，或许可以对变化无常的曲折命运抱一丝淡淡的感激，而不必在乎到底最后的归宿为何。"
G["I wonder if that cute pilot with the pink hair is still around..."]="不知道那个粉红色头发的飞行员还在不在附近……"
G["I wonder if the fortunes are real..."]="不知道是不是真的有命运这回事……"
G["I wonder if the pigs are hungry..."]="我在想那些猪是不是饿了……"
G["I wonder if there's a cave behind it."]="我在想它后面会不会有个洞。"
G["I wonder if there's anything this healer isn't good at!"]="我在想这个治疗有没有弱点！"
G["I wonder if they can fly?"]="我怀疑是否他们可以飞？"
G["I wonder if they ever burn themselves."]="不知道他们有没有烧伤过自己。"
G["I wonder if we could all get launched out together..."]="不知道这个大炮能不能把我们一起射出去……"
G["I wonder if we'll ever solve the mystery of the strange ore. There's gotta be some use for it!"]="或许有一天，我们能揭开这种神秘矿石的真面目。那时我们就可以好好利用它啦。"
G["I wonder if you can really hear the ocean in these things."]="你真的能在这些东西中听到海洋的声音么？"
G["I wonder if your Grindgear Gorilla can jump across the Park!"]="我想知道，你的发条猩猩能不能跳过这座花园！"
G["I wonder if your dolly can swim!"]="你的洋娃娃会不会游泳啊？哈哈！"
G["I wonder what Nesingwary will give me for your hide!"]="如果我献上你的皮，说不定奈辛瓦里会赏我点什么！"
G["I wonder what brings you to our lands, stranger.\n\nThe mists of Pandaria will reveal the answer in time..."]="我很好奇你为何会踏上我们的土地，陌生人。\n\n潘达利亚的迷雾迟早会给出答案的……"
G["I wonder what exploding feels like?"]="我想知道自爆感觉如何？"
G["I wonder what it's like to have so much fame?"]="不知道做名人的感觉怎么样？"
G["I wonder what made a hole in the roof of the Inn in the first place. See what happens when you drop a copper piece off of the edge of Outland?"]="我想知道一开始到底是什么在旅馆的屋顶上弄了这么个洞。我还想知道，在外域的边缘扔个铜币下去会发生什么情况？"
G["I wonder what that little purple creature at the village is... It's certainly beautiful."]="我在想村子里那个紫色的生物是什么……看上去真漂亮。"
G["I wonder what there is to hunt in Northrend.  Fierce beasts, I wager."]="我很想知道诺森德有什么猎物。我敢打赌，一定有凶猛的野兽。"
G["I wonder what this button does..."]="很好奇这按钮是干吗的……"
G["I wonder what this seed will grow into?"]="我很好奇这颗种子会长成什么？"
G["I wonder what those bones are from."]="不知道这些骨头是哪儿来的。"
G["I wonder where the baby is?"]="我在想，婴儿在哪里？"
G["I wonder where we're headed to. And who's going to deal with these guys?"]="我想知道我们这是去哪儿，以及谁会来对付这些家伙？"
G["I wonder who talked Xuen in to letting the sauroks compete. I like a good test of strength, but those creatures are just... so... angry."]="我想知道是谁说服雪怒让蜥蜴人参加比赛的。我喜欢观看力量的对决，但那些生物也太……狂暴了。"
G["I wonder why the sporelings live under the bridge?"]="我想知道为什么孢子人住在桥下面？"
G["I wonder, does Oshu'gun still stand... Oh the stories I could tell of the time before the darkness... So many wonderous memories..."]="我怀疑沃舒古是不是还存在……我还记得许多黑暗之前的事情……太多美好的回忆了……"
G["I wonder, heroes, what will you do when I manage to destroy this shard? Will the world be beyond salvation?"]="我在想，如果我设法摧毁了碎片，你们会怎么做？你们还能拯救世界吗？"
G["I wonder. Did my master send you as a distraction from my studies?\n\n...or perhaps you were sent to test my patience."]="我很好奇。你不会是我师父故意派来让我分心的吧？\n\n亦或是……派你来考验我耐心的？"
G["I wonder. Hamuul has guided us well, and I've learned so much from him. The legends say that our people were druids when time began..."]="我有些奇怪。伊哈缪尔一直在以他的睿智指引着我们。我从他那里学到了许多东西。而传说告诉我，起初，我们的人民全都是德鲁伊……"
G["I worry about you sometimes, Nat."]="我有些担心你了，纳特。"
G["I worry you may be too soft to wear your kingdom's crown, Prince Anduin. You would do well to learn some of your father's hardness."]="我很担心你太过软弱，不足以接过那个王冠，安度因王子。你该好好学学你父亲的强硬。"
G["I woudn't serve that to a Worg!"]="我可不会给一头座狼上菜！"
G["I would DESTROY them. It is worthless to stay here!"]="我会消灭他们的。没必要继续待下去了！"
G["I would ENJOY the trip more if we were actually GOING somewhere!"]="我是想“享受”旅程，可那也得先“出发”才行！"
G["I would ask your forgiveness for the suffering I have caused you and your people."]="请求您宽恕我为您和您的子民带来的痛苦和伤害。"
G["I would be delighted to aid you in the commencement of your pursuit! Let me grab my spinner and we'll get started..."]="我很高兴能在你事业开始的时候帮上忙，！让我们抓紧纺纱机，开始吧……"
G["I would be grateful for any aid you can provide, Priestess."]="女祭司，无论你给予我什么样的帮助，我都会感激你的。"
G["I would be happy to take you under my wing. Let us begin."]="很高兴能将你收入麾下。让我们开始吧。"
G["I would be happy to teach you when you are ready, but that time has not yet come! I'm sure Lalina Summermoon will guide you until then. You may find her in the Craftsmen's Terrace in Darnassus."]="Estaré encantada de instruirte cuando estés $gpreparado:preparada;, ¡pero aún no ha llegado el momento! Estoy segura de que Lalina Luna de Verano te guiará hasta entonces. La podrás encontrar en el Bancal del Artesano de Darnassus."
G["I would be honored by your patronage, adventurer."]="感谢你的光顾，冒险者。"
G["I would be honored to train you in the use of the weapons that I have mastered should you have the ability to learn within you."]="如果你有能力学习的话，我是很荣幸教你如何使用武器的。"
G["I would be lying if I said that I did not appreciate this opportunity to relax."]="要说我不珍惜这个放松的机会，那是假的。"
G["I would bet your soul on it."]="我可以用你的灵魂打赌。"
G["I would commit our order to an Alliance victory!"]="我会带领肯瑞托加入联盟，并取得胜利！"
G["I would create some surreptitious means to keep my brother out of the order.  I can keep him out without him being any bit wiser, thereby saving our familial bonds."]="我会想办法让他不参加危险的任务，完全不需要他做任何事情，以此来保存我的家族的血脉。"
G["I would do anything for love. But I won't do that. At least, not right away."]="我为爱甘愿付出一切。可我不会这么做。至少，现在不行。"
G["I would enjoy the trip more if we were actually GOING somewhere!"]="我是想“享受”旅程，可那也得先“出发”才行！"
G["I would gladly bear any curse to save my homeland."]="为了拯救我的祖国，再恶毒的诅咒我也承受。"
G["I would gladly fight by your side, but you do not require my assistance."]="我很乐意与你并肩战斗，但你并没有向我求助。"
G["I would gladly give my life to ensure the safety of Honeydew Village. Its legacy is my own."]="我愿意献出自己的生命，以确保蜜露村安全无虞。这是祖业的传承。"
G["I would have burned this whole place down with them in it..."]="我要把这个地方和他们一起烧光……"
G["I would have charged right in. Many more lives would have been lost in my rush for victory."]="换了我会直接进攻，而我那样冒进的话可能会牺牲更多人。"
G["I would have died in the Jade Forest had it not been for a pandaren mistweaver who healed my wounds after the battle.\n\nThese pandaren are good people and deserve our protection from the domination of the Alliance."]="要不是一位熊猫人织雾者在战后为我疗伤，我早就死在翡翠林了。\n\n这些熊猫人都是好人，我们应该保护他们免遭联盟奴役。"
G["I would have it back, mortal. Atiesh... From it I would create the Highborne anew. I would have it all back. Even the Queen..."]="我一定会把它找回来的，凡人。埃提耶什……有了它，我就可以重建上层精灵社会。我一定会把它找到的。就算是女王……"
G["I would have it no other way."]="我别无他求。"
G["I would have just dropped some Evershine in my tank and been back home before they realized I'd gone!"]="我应该往我的坦克里扔几瓶艾沃沙酒，然后在他们发现我之前赶紧回家！"
G["I would have traveled across the Great Sea to see you, friend. We will never forget what you did for us."]="Habría cruzado el Mare Mágnum para verte, $gamigo:amiga;. Nunca olvidaremos lo que hiciste por nosotros."
G["I would like a blue serpent egg."]="我想要蓝色的翔龙蛋。"
G["I would like a green serpent egg."]="我想要绿色的翔龙蛋。"
G["I would like a yellow serpent egg."]="我想要黄色的翔龙蛋。"
G["I would like that very much, Chi-Ji."]="我很愿意接受你的帮助，赤精。"
G["I would like to browse your goods, Illusia."]="我想看看你出售的货物，伊露希亚。"
G["I would like to buy from you."]="我想从你这里买点东西。"
G["I would like to check my deposit box."]="我想要查看一下我的储物箱。"
G["I would like to continue my training so that I may always defend our home."]="我愿意继续训练，使自己能永远守护我们的家园。"
G["I would like to drive a demolisher."]="我要一辆攻城车。"
G["I would like to enter my e-coupon code to win the virtual item."]="我要输入10位电子兑换券号码，赢取我的奖品！"
G["I would like to enter the secret code to receive my Big Blizzard Bear."]="我要输入神秘兑换码，兑换暴雪巨熊。"
G["I would like to enter the secret code to receive my Competitor's Souvenir."]="我要输入神秘兑换码，领取竞争者的纪念品。"
G["I would like to enter the secret code to receive my Golden Pig pet."]="我想要输入神秘兑换码来换取我的金猪宠物。"
G["I would like to enter the secret code to receive my Murloc costume."]="我想要输入神秘兑换码以获得我的鱼人服装。"
G["I would like to enter the secret code to receive my Murloc pet."]="我想要输入神秘兑换码来获得我的鱼人宠物。"
G["I would like to enter the secret code to receive my Zergling pet."]="我想要输入神秘兑换码，换取我的跳虫！"
G["I would like to fight in an arena."]="我想要在竞技场一展身手。"
G["I would like to go back and see one of the visions again. Do you still have the enchanted blade?"]="我很想回去，再看看那种幻象。你还有那件魔法武器吗？"
G["I would like to go to Krasarang Wilds."]="我想要去卡桑琅丛林。"
G["I would like to go to Lord Afrasastrasz in the middle of the temple."]="我想去龙眠神殿中层，与阿弗拉沙斯塔兹指挥官谈一谈。"
G["I would like to go to the battleground."]="我想去战场。"
G["I would like to practice catch with a baby serpent."]="我想跟翔龙宝宝练习接球。"
G["I would like to receive training."]="我要接受训练。"
G["I would like to reiterate how pleased I am with the continued development of our working relationship, $n. In the weeks following my stunning cognitive enhancement, my goblin benefactors became apprehensive, perhaps outright distrustful, as my intellect eclipsed theirs.\n\nWhat a shame that my progenitors were unable to prevent this recent cascading series of industrial 'accidents' that now allows me to operate so unencumbered..."]="Me gustaría reiterar mi satisfacción con el desarrollo de nuestra relación de trabajo, $n. Durante las semanas posteriores a mi apabullante crecimiento cognitivo, mis benefactores goblin se volvieron recelosos, quizá incluso desconfiados, a medida que mi intelecto eclipsaba el suyo.\n\nQué lástima que mis progenitores fueran incapaces de prevenir esta reciente oleada de \"accidentes\" industriales gracias a la cual puedo actuar ahora con tanta impunidad..."
G["I would like to return to the temple grounds."]="我想要返回青龙寺庭院。"
G["I would like to ride in one of your canoes, Jimmy."]="吉米，我想搭乘你的独木舟。"
G["I would like to spend my runes."]="我要使用符文。"
G["I would like to start the Amulet Ritual, Kasim."]="我准备开始护符仪式了，卡西姆。"
G["I would like to start the Amulet Ritual, Lynnore."]="我准备开始护符仪式了，莱诺雷。"
G["I would like to start the Blood Ritual, Kasim."]="我准备开始鲜血仪式了，卡西姆。"
G["I would like to start the Blood Ritual, Lynnore."]="我准备开始鲜血仪式了，莱诺雷。"
G["I would like to take a look at your wares, Sid."]="我想看看你出售的货物，希德。"
G["I would like to train further in the ways of the Light."]="我想接受更多的关于圣光的训练。"
G["I would like to train."]="我要接受训练。"
G["I would like to travel to Dawn's Blossom."]="我想去晨芳园走一走。"
G["I would like to upgarde another sha-touched weapon. Can you help?"]="我想再升级另一把感染了煞能的武器。你能帮忙吗？"
G["I would like to whisper my secret code to you to receive Tyrael's Hilt."]="我要告诉你那段神秘兑换码，获得泰瑞尔的剑柄。"
G["I would like to whisper my secret code to you to receive my Golden Pig pet."]="我愿意告诉你我的神秘兑换码，换取一只金猪宠物。"
G["I would like to whisper my secret code to you to receive my Panda Cub pet."]="我要输入神秘兑换码，领取我的熊猫宠物！"
G["I would like training."]="我想要接受训练。"
G["I would like you to come with me today."]="我希望你今天能跟着我。"
G["I would look upon these lands with my own eyes."]="我会用自己的双眼注视这片土地。"
G["I would love to help you, Lorewalker, but understand - I am in a real bind here."]="我也很想帮你，游学者，但是你得明白我也是身陷困境！"
G["I would love to read it to you!\nDo not stand at my grave and weep,\nI am not there, I do not sleep.\nI am in a thousand winds that blow,\nacross Northrend's bright and shining snow.\nI am the gentle showers of rain,\non Westfall's fields of golden grain.\nI am in the morning hush,\nof Stranglethorn's jungle, green and lush.\nI am in the drums loud and grand,\nthe thunderous hooves across Nagrand.\nI am the stars warmly gleaming,\nover Darnassus softly dreaming.\nI am in the birds that sing,\nI am in each lovely thing.\nDo not stand at my grave and cry,\nI am not there. I do not die."]="¡Me encantaría leértelo!\n\nNo permanezcas ante mi tumba llorando,\nno estoy allí, no estoy descansando.\n\nEstoy en los miles de vientos que los árboles mueven,\nen Rasganorte sobre la brillante nieve.\n\nSoy la suave lluvia que cae gentilmente\nen los campos de Páramos de Poniente.\n\nEstoy en la calma matutina,\nde la selva de Tuercespina.\n\nEstoy en el redoble magistral,\nde las pezuñas en Nagrand al pisar.\n\nEn las cálidas y brillantes estrellas me muevo,\nmientras soñando sobre Darnassus me elevo.\n\nEstoy en los pájaros cantores\ny en las cosas que inspiran pasiones.\n\nNo permanezcas ante mi tumba llorando,\nno estoy allí, no estoy descansando."
G["I would love to walk on the water."]="我想在水上行走。"
G["I would never ask a stranger to take on the duties of a Shado-Pan, but neither will I refuse help from a skilled $c.\n\nThis place is dangerous, $r. If you insist on staying, then I will gladly accept your help."]="Jamás le pediría a $gun:una; $gforastero:forastera; que realizase las labores de un Shadopan, pero tampoco rechazaré la ayuda de $gun:una; $c competente.\n\nEste lugar es peligroso, $r. Si insistes en quedarte, aceptaré tu ayuda de buen grado."
G["I would never have expected to find something in such perfect condition."]="我从来没想过居然能找到如此符合我要求的东西。"
G["I would never turn away someone who's ready to train with me. Unfortunately, you're not! You've still got a ways to go kid!"]="Nunca daría la espalda a alguien que está listo para instruirse conmigo. Por desgracia ¡tú no lo estás! ¡Todavía te queda un largo camino $gchiquillo:chiquilla;!"
G["I would not venture further if I were you, $n.  You are not permitted above."]="如果我是你的话，我是不会再进一步的，$n。你没有进入上面的许可。"
G["I would prefer sturdier equipment than this."]="我想要更结实一点的装备。"
G["I would recommend against such actions..."]="我不建议这样做……"
G["I would recommend releasing me. My father is not as forgiving as I am."]="我建议你们放了我。我父亲可没我这么宽容。"
G["I would remain silent about the kill and allow the knight to claim the reward to aid his family."]="我将对这件事情只字不提，并允许那个骑士拿到奖励来帮助他的家庭。"
G["I would say that my first command here was quite the success."]="我得说，我第一次指挥作战还是相当成功的。"
G["I would show my liege the beast's ear and claim the beast's death as my own - after all, I did slay it.  I would then offer some of the reward to the destitute knight to help his family."]="我会将这头野兽的耳朵拿给王上看，以此证明我是凭一己之力杀死它的——毕竟，我确实杀了它。然后我会用一部分奖励接济贫困的骑士，用以养家糊口。"
G["I would show my liege the beast's ear and claim the beast's death as my own, taking the reward for my own use.  It is wrong to claim a deed as your own that someone else in fact did."]="我会将这头野兽的耳朵拿给王上看，以此证明我是凭一己之力杀死它的，并且将所有的奖励收归己用。把别人的事迹宣扬成自己的功劳是不对的。"
G["I would sooner slit my own throat.  You will pay for what you did to your own men, Arthas... for what you did to me!  I swear it."]="我宁愿自行了断。为了你对同胞犯下的罪行，阿尔萨斯，为了你对我犯下的罪行，你会付出代价的！我发誓！"
G["I would speak against my brother joining the order, rushing a permanent breach in our relationship.  He would be a danger to himself and those around him, and that is too great a risk hoping he would improve over time."]="我会反对我的兄弟加入军队，即使我们的关系会因此产生永久的裂痕。对他自己和周围的人来说，他无疑是个危险，要想指望他会逐渐进步可就太冒险了。"
G["I would speak for my brother joining the order, potentially risking the safety of the order.  I could help him with the order's regimens, and I'd have faith in his ability to adapt and learn."]="我会支持我的兄弟加入军队，虽然这或许会威胁到军队的安全。我和军队的其他成员会帮助他，我相信他能够适应这儿的生活并且学会生存之道。"
G["I would stay longer, but I need to go find out what has happened to the rest of the Stormstouts."]="我愿意多留一会，可我得去看看，风暴烈酒家的其他人怎么样了。"
G["I would struggle to maintain our neutrality."]="我会挣扎着保持中立。"
G["I would suggest looking in the Cathedral of Light in Cathedral Square."]="我建议你去教堂广场上的光明大教堂里找一找。"
G["I would teach him how to demon forge in exchange for his soul. The soul of a Blackrock orc is worth very little but in these trying times, a soul, any soul, is better than none at all."]="我将教他如何去恶魔熔炉交换他的灵魂。黑石兽人的灵魂根本不值钱，但是在眼下这个艰难时代，有总比没有好。"
G["I would train ye if I could, but ye need the services of someone a bit more... what's the word? Brainy! Look for Trixie Quickswitch in Ironforge. Tell 'er Bronk sent ye!"]="要是我能的话，我是会训练你的，但是你需要找个稍微……怎么说，聪明点的人为你服务吧！去铁炉堡找特里克希吧。告诉他是布隆克派你去的！"
G["I would train you, but you are no warrior."]="我非常愿意训练你，但你不是战士。"
G["I would very much like to hear about your ancestors, stranger. Light the incense and let's reflect on where you came from, hm?"]="我很希望能了解你的先祖，陌生人。点燃那束香，让我们一起回想你的故乡，怎么样？"
G["I would very much like to study such unique items."]="我就是喜欢研究这些特别的东西。"
G["I wouldn't do that if I were you..."]="我要是你的话，我不会那样做……"
G["I wouldn't do this on any other day, but... I'm thirsty and I hate drinking alone.\n\nBottoms up!"]="若是在别的日子，我才不会这么做。不过……我很口渴，而且我讨厌独自饮酒。\n\n干杯！"
G["I wouldn't eat yer leftovers if the only other thing to eat was rubble!"]="就算只能啃石头充饥，我也不会吃你剩下的东西！"
G["I wouldn't expect a recruit to perform well in this situation, but try your best."]="我并不指望一个新兵在这种情况下还能沉着应对，只要尽力而为就行了。"
G["I wouldn't expect anything less, $r. Thanks."]="我期待下次还有更好的东西，$r。谢谢。"
G["I wouldn't have missed this for the world, $n.\n\n<Exarch Menelaous hugs you.>\n\nWe are proud of you."]="No me lo habría perdido por nada del mundo, $n.\n\n<El exarca Menelaous te abraza.>\n\nEstamos orgullosos de ti."
G["I wouldn't mind fighting with you again sometime.  Farewell!"]="我也不介意将来再跟你并肩战斗一次。再见！"
G["I wouldn't mind settling down in a place like this. Great views, plenty of beer... and lots of stuff to fight."]="我会很乐意在这里住下的。风景秀丽，啤酒充足……还有很多架可打。"
G["I wouldn't mind that you wasted each day if you caught a few more fish."]="要是你能多抓几条鱼回来，我也不会怪你终日虚度光阴。"
G["I wouldn't say that it's your fault, Tarenar.  But don't let that stop you from saving Gidwin."]="我不认为这是你的错，塔伦纳。可我不会阻止你去救吉德文。"
G["I wouldn't tell you if I did!  Because as soon as I do, I'm getting away from these crystals..."]="即使我找到了也不会告诉你！因为告诉你的话……我就弄不到水晶了……"
G["I wouldn't use it just yet, but you feel free to test it out yourself."]="我才不要使用这玩意儿呢，你想要测试的话，请便好了。"
G["I wouldn't venture into the Scryer's Terrace if I were you, $n.  You are not welcome there."]="如果我是你的话，我就不会冒险进入占星者广场，$n。你在那里不受欢迎。"
G["I wrested it free from the remains of an orc lieutenant - a dark caster... It is from their homeworld."]="我把它从一个兽人军官……一个黑暗的施法者的遗体上拿了下来……这是从他们的家乡带来的。"
G["I yield to you."]="我认输。"
G["I yield!"]="我认输！"
G["I yield!  I yield!  By Quel'thalas!  Don't kill me!"]="我认输！我认输！以奎尔萨拉斯的名义！不要杀我！"
G["I yield!  The boy chose his champion well. Give him my blessing and make sure he does not squander it."]="我认输！那个小鬼选对了人。请把我的祝福带给他，千万别让他浪费了我的好意。"
G["I yield! I submit. Excellent work. May I run away now?"]="我认输！我投降。你做的很好。我可以走了吧？"
G["I yield.  It was a worthy battle. Thank you, friend."]="我投降。这是一场光荣的战斗，朋友。"
G["I yield. I'll go quietly."]="我投降，我会悄悄走掉。"
G["I'LL GET YOU, GOLDMINE!"]="我会抓住你的，金矿！"
G["I'LL RISE AGAIN AND WHEN I DO I WILL HAVE MY REVENGE!"]="我会东山再起的，到时候我会报仇的！"
G["I'M BACK, YOU DOOKERS!"]="我回来啦，恶棍！"
G["I'M CHARGING MY LASER!"]="我正在给激光枪充能！"
G["I'M COOKIN HERE!"]="我在做饭呢！"
G["I'M FIRING MY LASER!"]="我正在发射激光枪！"
G["I'M FREE, LITTLE DRAKKARI. TIME TO PAY FOR YOUR MANY TRESSPASSES!"]="我自由了，达卡莱巨魔。为你们的罪行付出代价吧！"
G["I'M HIT!"]="我被击中了！"
G["I'M MAD AS HELL AND I'M NOT GONNA TAKE IT ANYMORE! I QUIT!"]="我快崩溃了，我再也不想忍受下去了！我退出！"
G["I'M ON FIRE!!!"]="我着火了！！"
G["I'M ON FIRE!!!  AGAIN!!"]="我又着火了！！"
G["I'M PUSHIN' AS HARD AS I CAN! THING WEIGHS A TON!"]="我已经拼尽全力了！这东西肯定有一吨重！"
G["I'M SCARED!"]="我好怕！"
G["I'VE BEEN INTERRUPTED! CALL ALEX!"]="我被打断了！去叫阿莱克斯！"
G["I'VE GOT AN IDEA!"]="我有主意了！"
G["I'd 'ave a cleaner shot 'round 'ere if someone hadn't all gone and done regrown up all them stupid trees."]="如果不是有人又在那儿种了几棵蠢树，我还可以射得再准一点儿的！"
G["I'd almost given up hope."]="我几乎放弃了希望。"
G["I'd always hoped to cut someone like that someday, to hear that sound. But to have it happen to my own prothorax is ridiculous."]="刀锋啜饮鲜血的声音如此美妙，如此令我着迷。可这声音竟来自于我的身体，真是讽刺。"
G["I'd appreciate if someone started to take my work seriously. Just because I'm not wrestling sharks or tying eels in knots doesn't mean this isn't important."]="要是有谁能严肃对待我的工作，我会感激不尽。虽然我干的不是像和鲨鱼摔跤或是把鳗鱼打结那样的活儿，可不代表这就不重要。"
G["I'd be careful if I were you, Hyldnir.  We're not afraid to lose a few men if it means smashing your pretty blue faces in."]="海德尼尔，你们最好小心一点。只要能打扁你们那漂亮的蓝色脸蛋儿，搭上几条性命也无所谓。"
G["I'd be dead if it weren't for you."]="如果不是你，我就死定了。"
G["I'd be dead or worse if not for you!"]="要不是因为你，我早就死了，甚至更糟！"
G["I'd be glad to help."]="我愿意出力。"
G["I'd be honored to have you on my wing anytime, $n."]="很荣幸能与你一起飞行，$n。"
G["I'd be wasting both your gold and my time if I were to teach you how to pilot a Mechanostrider, $c.  You're just too large!"]="要教你学会驾驶机械陆行鸟，那简直就是在浪费我的金钱和时间，$c。你的体形太庞大了！"
G["I'd better ask before I go herbing this time. I don't want to get attacked by another wolf."]="我最好在采集草药之前问清楚状况。我可不想再次被狼袭击。"
G["I'd better catch up Mudmug."]="我最好跟上泥盏……"
G["I'd better head up and talk to Nana. The farm is yours now, $n. I know you'll take great care of it."]="我最好去和娜娜谈谈。现在农场已经归你了，$n。我知道你会好好照料它的。"
G["I'd choose your next words carefully if you value your life.\n\nSilence? How wise. Now destroy the Scourge!"]="还想活命的话，你最好小心说话。\n\n沉默？你真明智。去消灭天灾军团吧！"
G["I'd give my pestle away for some earplugs."]="我愿意用我的捣药杵换个耳塞。"
G["I'd give nearly anything for a chance to go up there and speak with them..."]="如果可以的话，我愿付出一切来找寻一个上台和他们谈话的机会……"
G["I'd give you a thumbs down, but I can't find it."]="我真该对你倒竖大拇指，可我没有大拇指。"
G["I'd go back if I could. I had a life in Durnholde. Towards the end there I was beaten maybe once a week at MOST."]="如果可以的话，我宁可回去。我在敦霍尔德有自己的生活。其实我在那儿每个星期顶多挨一次打。"
G["I'd go out and clear out some of those gnolls, but this leg has seen better days and I am afraid I'd just wind up dead."]="我要出去干掉几个豺狼人，但是这条腿刚好点，我担心这样冒冒失失地出去的话不会有好结果。"
G["I'd have a hard time teaching you.  It takes years of mental preparation to become attuned to the powers of the arcane."]="教导你耗费了我很大力气。而为了让自己的心智适应奥术力量，你还需要经历许多个岁月的磨砺。"
G["I'd imagined my first adventure into the ocean as more peaceful and enlightening. Becoming one with nature perhaps?\n\nThere is very little natural about this place. The elements all around us scream for vengeance."]="我原以为我的首次洋底冒险会是波澜不惊和令我大开眼界的。也许会有种与大自然融为一体的感觉？\n\n可这地方毫无自然之感。我们周围无所不在的元素们都在为复仇而呼号。"
G["I'd keep my eyes and ears open if I were you. There's a rumor going around that you caused both Mount Kajaro and the Lost Isles volcanoes to explode.\n\nCrazy, I know. But people will gossip about anything and love to tear down their heroes, especially if there's a chance for profit and promotion."]="如果我是你，我就会放亮眼睛、竖起耳朵。有传闻说，卡亚罗和失落群岛的火山喷发都与你有关。\n\n我知道这听起来很疯狂。但人们八卦的素材总是千奇百怪，而且总以毁掉英雄为乐——尤其是在有利润和晋升驱使的情况下。"
G["I'd know that smell anywhere! Salma's famous stew!"]="不论走到哪儿都会牢记的味道！萨尔玛的拿手炖肉！"
G["I'd lend a hand, but I've got... chain rash. I'll just hang back a little."]="我很愿意帮你，可我被……链子缠住了。我只能往回晃一点儿。"
G["I'd like a Lovely Charm Collector's Kit."]="我想要一个可爱的情人符工具箱。"
G["I'd like a drink."]="我想要喝一杯。"
G["I'd like a new invitation to the Lunar Festival."]="我想要获得一份新的春节邀请函。"
G["I'd like a pair of Synthebrew Goggles."]="我想要一副合成酿酒护目镜。"
G["I'd like a ride up to the bottom of Warsong Hold."]="我要到战歌要塞的底层。"
G["I'd like a ride up to the top of Warsong Hold."]="我要到战歌要塞的顶层。"
G["I'd like passage to the Transitus Shield."]="我要去永生之盾。"
G["I'd like some weapon training"]="我想进行一些武器方面的训练"
G["I'd like to borrow one of Farmer Fung's kites."]="我想去借农夫老方的风筝。"
G["I'd like to browse the items up for auction."]="我要查看拍卖的物品。"
G["I'd like to build a bomber."]="我要造一架轰炸机。"
G["I'd like to build a catapult."]="我要造一辆投石车。"
G["I'd like to build a demolisher."]="我要造一辆攻城车。"
G["I'd like to build a fighter jet."]="我要造一架战斗机。"
G["I'd like to build a shredder."]="我要造一架伐木机。"
G["I'd like to build a siege engine."]="我要造一辆攻城坦克。"
G["I'd like to buy Jack a drink.  Perhaps something... extra strong."]="我想请杰克喝一杯。最好是……那种后劲儿特足的饮料。"
G["I'd like to buy this month's brew."]="我要购买本月美酒。"
G["I'd like to challenge your magma lord to a fight."]="我要跟你的熔岩领主打一场。"
G["I'd like to dress as a pirate."]="我想要打扮成海盗。"
G["I'd like to enter the Celestial Tournament."]="我要参加天神比武大会。"
G["I'd like to exchange the tickets in my inventory for the new tokens."]="我要把背包里的奖券兑换成新的奖币。"
G["I'd like to fly back to Silvermoon City."]="我想飞回银月城。"
G["I'd like to fly to Rut'theran Village."]="我想飞往鲁瑟兰村。"
G["I'd like to fly to Thunder Bluff."]="我想飞往雷霆崖。"
G["I'd like to go inside the Temple of the Jade Serpent."]="我想进入青龙寺。"
G["I'd like to heal and revive my battle pets."]="我要治疗和复活我的战斗宠物。"
G["I'd like to hear A Toast To You."]="我想听《为你祝酒》。"
G["I'd like to hear Joyful Celebration."]="我想听《欢乐庆典》。"
G["I'd like to hear Liu Lang's Homecoming."]="我想听《刘浪回乡》。"
G["I'd like to hear PH The Rains of Castamere."]="我想听《卡斯特梅的雨季》。"
G["I'd like to hear The Bamboo Wilds."]="我想听《翠竹旷野》。"
G["I'd like to hear The Song of Liu Lang."]="我想听《刘浪之歌》。"
G["I'd like to hear The Temple of the Five Dawns."]="我想听《五晨寺》。"
G["I'd like to leave this place."]="我要离开这个地方。"
G["I'd like to make this my home."]="我要让这里成为我的家。"
G["I'd like to punch that Chip right in the kisser! I'd also like to kiss that Candy right in the kisser, too!"]="我可真想一拳打在奇普的脸上！我还想一口亲在小甜甜的脸上！"
G["I'd like to purchase a Brewfest riding ram."]="我想买一头美酒节赛羊。"
G["I'd like to purchase a bat ride."]="我要租一只蝙蝠。"
G["I'd like to purchase a challenge card."]="我想买一张挑战卡牌。"
G["I'd like to purchase more Tharlendris seeds."]="我想购买更多的萨伦迪斯种子。"
G["I'd like to purchase primary profession training."]="我要接受主要专业技能的训练。"
G["I'd like to purchase secondary profession training."]="我要接受辅助专业技能训练。"
G["I'd like to return to Marshal's Stand, please."]="行行好，我要回到马绍尔哨站。"
G["I'd like to return to The Shaper's Terrace."]="我想要返回塑造者之台。"
G["I'd like to return to the mainland."]="我想回到大陆去。"
G["I'd like to see the Alliance try to steal our flame."]="我倒想看到联盟来试着偷我们的火焰。"
G["I'd like to see what goods you have for sale."]="我想看看你这里有什么商品出售。"
G["I'd like to see what you have to sell."]="我想看看你出售的货物。"
G["I'd like to see you try."]="我喜欢看你徒劳的挣扎。"
G["I'd like to set up shop in Light's Hope Chapel someday.  I'm not much of a fighter, but that doesn't mean I can't help the cause."]="我希望能有一天，在圣光之愿礼拜堂建起一座商店。我对战斗不在行，但这并不意味着我就不能帮上任何忙。"
G["I'd like to stable my pet here."]="我想寄养宠物。"
G["I'd like to stand for..."]="我是来……"
G["I'd like to survey those curves!"]="我要检查这些曲线！"
G["I'd like to take a flight around Stormwind Harbor."]="我要绕暴风城港口游览一圈。"
G["I'd like to take a kite somewhere."]="我想乘风筝出游。"
G["I'd like to take the great sea turtle to Kamagua."]="我要坐大海龟前往卡玛古。"
G["I'd like to take the great sea turtle to Moa'ki Harbor."]="我要坐大海龟前往莫亚基港口。"
G["I'd like to take the great sea turtle to Unu'pe."]="我要坐大海龟前往乌努比。"
G["I'd like to take the ship to Menethil Harbor."]="我要坐船前往莫亚基港口。"
G["I'd like to take the ship to Stormwind Harbor."]="我要坐船前往暴风城港口。"
G["I'd like to take the ship to Valgarde."]="我要坐船前往瓦加德。"
G["I'd like to take the ship to Valiance Keep."]="我要坐船前往无畏要塞。"
G["I'd like to take the ship to Westguard Keep."]="我要坐船前往西部卫戍要塞。"
G["I'd like to take the zeppelin to Durotar."]="我要坐地精飞艇前往杜隆塔尔。"
G["I'd like to take the zeppelin to Tirisfal Glades."]="我要坐地精飞艇前往提瑞斯法林地。"
G["I'd like to take the zeppelin to Vengeance Landing."]="我要坐地精飞艇前往复仇港。"
G["I'd like to take the zeppelin to Warsong Hold."]="我要坐地精飞艇前往战歌要塞。"
G["I'd like to train in cooking."]="我想进行烹饪训练。"
G["I'd like to train."]="我想接受训练。"
G["I'd like to travel by air."]="我要飞行。"
G["I'd like to travel to Lor'danel."]="我要去洛达内尔。"
G["I'd like to travel to Ratchet."]="我要去棘齿城。"
G["I'd like to travel to Shatterspear Vale."]="我要去碎矛谷。"
G["I'd like to travel to the Bashal'Aran."]="我要去巴莎兰。"
G["I'd like to travel to the Ruins of Mathystra."]="我要去玛塞斯特拉废墟。"
G["I'd like to use the stables."]="我想使用马厩。"
G["I'd like you better if you would apply some perfume."]="如果你能洒些香水的话，我会更喜欢你的。"
G["I'd lost all track of time in this forsaken place. You're a sight for sore eyes, friend."]="Había perdido la noción del tiempo en este maldito lugar. Da gusto verte, $gamigo:amiga;."
G["I'd love it, thank you."]="很好，谢谢。"
G["I'd love nothing more than to take down Naz'jar and her minions, but someone's got to cover your back..."]="剿灭纳兹夏尔和她的爪牙是我最想去做的事，但我也需要有人掩护……"
G["I'd love nothing more than to wring that witch's neck myself, but someone's got to keep these naga off of your back...\n\nDo not fail me, $n!"]="现在我最想去做的就是亲手消灭那个女巫。但我需要有人帮我挡住那些偷袭的纳迦……\n\n不要让我失望，$n！"
G["I'd love the opportunity to punish the Horde for this outrage..."]="我很愿意趁此机会惩罚部落犯下的暴行……"
G["I'd love to fight with you again whenever you need me."]="只要你需要，我都愿意和你再战一回。"
G["I'd love to get one of those written fortunes you mentioned!  I've got the space in my inventory for it."]="我想要你说的这些塔罗牌！我有足够的空间来存放。"
G["I'd love to help!"]="我很愿意帮忙！"
G["I'd love to learn more."]="我还想学习更多。"
G["I'd love to stay and kill vrykul with you all day, but I'm sure the baron will be wondering where I am."]="我很想留下来和你一起对抗维库人，但是我不能让男爵大人担心啊。"
G["I'd love to stop and chat awhile, but these explosives aren't going to move themselves..."]="我很想停下来聊一会儿，但这些炸药可不会自己走路……"
G["I'd love to teach you! Show my sister she's not the only one who knows a thing or two about engineering..."]="我愿意教你！要让我的姐姐看看她不是唯一了解工程学的人……"
G["I'd nearly given up. You've given me new life!"]="就在我近乎绝望的时候，你为我带来了生的希望！"
G["I'd never join anything like this. Better keep this, though. It'll come in handy in the privy..."]="我永远都不会参与这样的组织。不过最好留着这个。这东西迟早有用……"
G["I'd never leave the Buccaneers, ye whale-tail skivvy-sniffer!"]="我才不会抛弃同伴，你这条只会摇尾乞怜的狗！"
G["I'd never turn sides, ye green-gilled murloc!"]="我才不会倒戈，你这长着绿鳃的鱼人！"
G["I'd not expected the city to be taken so quickly. It seems we'll have much time to prepare for the invasion."]="我没想到能这么快地夺取这座城市。看来我们将有大把时间来准备入侵。"
G["I'd only heard about your kind in stories, $r.  I never thought I'd owe my life to one of you."]="$r，我以前只在故事里听到过你们。真没想到，我竟然会被你救了一命。"
G["I'd rather be brewin' than fightin'!\n\nBut with any luck, I can manage both, eh?"]="我宁可去酿酒也不愿意打架！\n\n可要是走运的话，也许我两项工作都能胜任，呃？"
G["I'd rather be dead than be one of you!  You think you're still human?  You're... animals!"]="我宁愿死也不要变成你们那副模样！你们还是人吗？是……畜生！"
G["I'd rather be reading!"]="我宁可去看看书！"
G["I'd rather die fighting than live like a slave!"]="我宁愿战死，也不会为了苟活而去做奴隶！"
G["I'd rather die knowing that at least we tried."]="就算再危险我也去要拼一拼。"
G["I'd rather listen to his braying than yours, dear."]="亲爱的，我宁可听骡子叫也不愿意听你讲话。"
G["I'd say come along quietly, but we both know that's not going to happen. My little friend here is going to ease your way into the afterlife."]="Te diría que vinieses de forma tranquila, pero ambos sabemos que eso no va a pasar. Mi $gpequeño amigo:pequeña amiga; de aquí va a abrirte el camino a la otra vida."
G["I'd say that we're about halfway done, wouldn't you? Scarlet Halls down, Scarlet Monastery yet to go.\n\nDon't be surprised if I disappear -- I have to get over there quickly."]="我想我们差不多干完一半了，对吧？已经解决了血色大厅，还剩下血色修道院。\n\n要是我突然消失了你可别吃惊——我得快点赶到那里。"
G["I'd sooner butcher that mule of yours! Why did you bring that beast in here, anyway?"]="我宁可屠宰那些骡子！我说，你为什么不带些牲畜来呢？"
G["I'd sooner serve the Dark Lord Alexander than be your pitiful pet."]="我宁愿为黑暗领主亚历山大效劳，也不要待在你身边做只可怜的宠物。"
G["I'd stand with you any day."]="我会永远站在你这边的。"
G["I'd started to think we'd been left out here. Thanks for the hand!"]="我本以为我们要被留在这儿了。谢谢你出手相救！"
G["I'd talk to you if you smelled better. Cologne would be nice."]="如果你能洒些香水的话，我会更喜欢你的。"
G["I'd talk to you if you smelled better. How about cologne? Maybe perfume?"]="如果你能洒些香水的话，我就愿意和你交谈。古龙水听起来如何？"
G["I'd train you if I could, but you're too much for me. Tell you what: go talk to the tauren Una in the northwestern shops of Thunder Bluff's central plateau. She's got some real talent."]="要是我能的话，我会教你的，但我力所不及。去跟雷霆崖中央高地西北部的商店找牛头人犹纳谈谈。她拥有真正的才能。"
G["I'd wager Keryn Sylvius knows the type you're looking for. The company Keryn keeps is less than honorable. She usually hangs out in the Lion's Pride Inn."]="我打赌科瑞恩·塞尔留斯知道你在寻找什么东西。她通常在狮王之傲旅店里。"
G["I'd watch my step around that machine, $c."]="我在那台机器旁边总是会保持十二分的小心，$c。"
G["I'll TELL you how we'll proceed, general."]="让我来告诉你下一步打算是什么，将军。"
G["I'll accept that answer for the time being, Kelemar, but my patience is not exactly boundless."]="我们暂时接受你的解释，克雷玛尔。不过我们的耐心是有限的。"
G["I'll admit, dwarf, I was pleasantly surprised to see your plan succeed."]="你的计划竟然成功了，我真是又惊又喜。"
G["I'll archeologize yer skull, $glad:lassie;!"]="尝尝我的锄头吧，$g小子:丫头;！"
G["I'll be a guard someday!"]="我总有一天会成为卫兵的！"
G["I'll be a snot-nosed ninny if we don't beat 'em to the punch!"]="我们可不是没用的笨蛋，一定要打败他们！"
G["I'll be back once I straighten this mess out."]="等我把这些搞定了就会立刻回来。"
G["I'll be behind the confessional screen if anyone wishes to speak with me. Any doubts, any worries, any uncertainties I will happily soothe."]="如果有谁想找我谈谈，我就在忏悔室的屏风后面等着你们。我很乐意为大家排解疑问、忧虑和彷徨。"
G["I'll be cheering for you, Ace!"]="我会为你喝彩，王牌飞行员！"
G["I'll be damned if these blasted Scourge are going to drive us away!  Us settlers gave everything up to start new lives in Northrend.\n\nYou'd better believe we're going to fight tooth and nail."]="我绝不容许天灾军团将我们驱逐出这里！我们放弃了一切，准备在诺森德开始新的生活。\n\n我向你保证，我们会拼死抵抗的。"
G["I'll be destitute if I don't recover my losses from this disaster."]="要是不能挽回在这次灾难中造成的损失，那我就要变成穷光蛋了。"
G["I'll be fine for now, don't worry about me.  I'll find a way out of here once I've performed some cleansing rituals in this room.  Foul magic taints this place, $n."]="我感觉好多了，别担心我。我要在这间房间里进行净化仪式，在那之后我自然会设法离开的。这儿被邪恶的魔法力量污染了，$n。"
G["I'll be fine, Arthura. The worgen lost our scent. It's doubtful that they even know we're here."]="我不会有事的，阿尔苏拉。狼人不知道我们的气味。他们甚至可能不知道我们就在这里。"
G["I'll be fine, Eitrigg.  We must begin preparations... I need to go to Outland at once!"]="我没事，伊崔格。我们必须开始准备了……我需要马上赶往外域！"
G["I'll be fine, please help the others!"]="我会没事的，请去帮助别人吧！"
G["I'll be glad to get out of this hellhole."]="我太愿意离开这鬼地方了。"
G["I'll be glad when final testing of this unit is complete."]="当这个东西完成最终测试时，我会很高兴的。"
G["I'll be happy to help you empty that pack of yours."]="我很乐意帮你清空那个包裹。"
G["I'll be headin' back shortly, $glad:lass;. Just one more go, for good time's sake."]="我很快就会回来的，$g小伙子:小姑娘;。为了能过上好日子，还得再走一趟。"
G["I'll be lookin' forward to it. Guess I'll get to preserving this meat, then. A good quartermaster won't turn down a reliable supply of rations."]="嗯，我很期待能和远征军做生意。这样的话，我就要好好地保存这些肉啦。优秀的军需官是不会拒绝可靠的补给品入库的。"
G["I'll be seein' ya, little man Budd. Sooner than later I'll be bettin'."]="巴德，我们总会碰面的。我相信这一天很快就要来了。"
G["I'll be sure to keep an eye on things as we begin cleaning the Deadmines out. Hopefully we can use it again soon as the famous gold mine it once was. As for the kingpin's fate..."]="当我们清理死亡矿井的时候，我会提高警惕，防备任何可能发生的意外。希望我们能尽快让它恢复成往日那座著名的金矿。至于说那个首脑的命运……"
G["I'll be sure to tell the Taurajo refugees that. Those that lived."]="我一定会告诉那些陶拉祖难民的。告诉那些活下来的。"
G["I'll be taking this cat.  It seems to work as the perfect bait.  Prepare to die now, fool!"]="我会接管这只猫。它看上去能够成为完美的诱饵。准备好去死吧，傻瓜！"
G["I'll be taking those skins, tiny."]="我会收下这些皮革的，小东西。"
G["I'll be the judge of that."]="我会做出裁决的。"
G["I'll be waitin' for ya, mon."]="朋友，等你的好消息。"
G["I'll be waiting at the Tan-Chao. Come and speak to me there."]="我会在接天桥那里等你。到那里去和我谈一谈吧。"
G["I'll be waiting."]="我会等着的。"
G["I'll be with you."]="我与你同在。"
G["I'll beat you soon enough."]="我马上就会教训你。"
G["I'll begin drawing energy from the stone.  Your job, $n, is to defend me. This place is cursed...trust me."]="我要开始将石头中的能量提取出来。$n，你的工作就是保护我。这个地方是被诅咒过的……相信我。"
G["I'll bet Uncle Chen is inside, meeting our distant relatives, as we speak."]="陈叔这会儿应该正在里面和远房亲戚们聊天呢。"
G["I'll bet that Chen never made no croc-belly-water beer."]="陈酿的酒里肯定掺着鳄鱼肚子里的水。"
G["I'll bet they grow enough food here to feed pretty much everybody on Pandaria."]="我敢打赌，他们在这儿种了足够所有潘达利亚人吃的食物。"
G["I'll blast those gnomish wannabes back to the scrap heap!"]="我要把那些机械侏儒炸成碎片！"
G["I'll blikker yer nook, then hork ya clean, wikket!"]="我要揍扁你的鼻子，然后把你抢得精光，蠢蛋！"
G["I'll bring Garrosh your head!"]="我要将你的脑袋献给加尔鲁什！"
G["I'll bring a small group of champions with me and talk to Tyrande myself. Anduin, I can handle this. I need you to trust that I'm going to do the right thing here."]="我会亲自带领一小队勇士去跟泰兰德谈谈。安度因，我能应付。相信我，我不会犯错的。"
G["I'll bring it right over, baby..."]="宝贝，我马上就过来……"
G["I'll burn this place to the ground before I am shamed in the eyes of Hellscream!"]="在我被地狱咆哮的目光盯得无地自容前，我要把这地方烧成灰烬！"
G["I'll carve the meat from your bones!"]="我要把你碎尸万段！"
G["I'll carve your heart out, maggot!"]="我要让你不得好死，蛆虫！"
G["I'll check in with Hao. Thank you!"]="我会去找豪的。谢谢你！"
G["I'll check on that right away."]="我马上就去看看。"
G["I'll chop you into minced meat!"]="我会把你碎尸万段！"
G["I'll collect my tools and meet you at Farmer Yoon's. Bet I can beat you there!"]="我去拿些工具来，待会在农夫老愚的田里跟你碰头。我打赌一定能赢你！"
G["I'll come back later."]="我马上回来。"
G["I'll come back when we've mustered an army, perhaps. The broken pillar is not welcoming."]="如果能集合起一支军队，我或许会考虑与你同去。去破柱子可不是闹着玩儿的。"
G["I'll come over there!"]="我要出手了！"
G["I'll consider that the next time I run into one of these things."]="下次再遇到这种事情的时候我会好好考虑一下的。"
G["I'll consume your flesh and pick my teeth with your bones!"]="我要消灭你们！"
G["I'll cook you into my soup, you dook-wikket!"]="我要把你丢进汤锅里，你这该死的蠢蛋！"
G["I'll cover you from here. It's dark, so you'll have to mark my targets for me."]="我就在这里掩护你。天很黑，你得帮我标出目标。"
G["I'll cover you.  Go whenever you're ready."]="我掩护你。等你准备好就出发。"
G["I'll cover your post. Go rest and be with your family."]="我来替你站岗。去休息下，陪陪家人吧。"
G["I'll crush you underfoot!"]="我要踩烂你们！"
G["I'll crush you!"]="我要撕碎你！"
G["I'll crush you, puny $r!"]="我会碾碎你，小$r！"
G["I'll crush your skull beneath my boot!"]="我要把你彻底击败！"
G["I'll crush your skull!"]="我要砸碎你的脑袋！"
G["I'll cut you in two!"]="我要把你劈成两半！"
G["I'll cut you to pieces!"]="我要把你们削成碎片！"
G["I'll cut you!"]="我要杀了你！"
G["I'll deal with you later."]="我等会儿再对付你。"
G["I'll defend my home with my life!"]="我会用生命保护我的家园！"
G["I'll defend the brew until it's ready. Then we can use it against these Bataari raiders! Everyone else, get to safety!"]="在酿出好酒之前，我会全力保护它们的。然后我们就可以用这些酒来对付巴塔里掠夺者！这样一来，其他人就安全了！"
G["I'll defend this place to my death, you monster!"]="我要誓死保卫这个地方，你这怪物！"
G["I'll defend until the last goblin is out! See you all at the rendezvous!"]="我会一直守到最后一个地精离开为止！我们在集合点见！"
G["I'll deliver the news to Thundermar."]="我会将这个消息带到桑德玛尔。"
G["I'll deliver the tome to our contacts in Icecrown, arcanist."]="我会把宝典交给我们在冰冠冰川的联系人的，奥法师。"
G["I'll deliver you, weak $C, to the afterlife!"]="让我送你一程吧，没用$c！你可以准备后事了！"
G["I'll destroy every last one of you!"]="我要把你们全都消灭掉！"
G["I'll die before I let one of you fiends turn me!"]="我宁愿死，也不愿意落在恶魔手中！"
G["I'll die before I see this village fall!"]="还没等这村子陷落，我就要死了！"
G["I'll die someday, sea-witch..."]="我终有一天会死，女海巫……"
G["I'll die with my axes in my hands and drenched in the blood of our foes!"]="就算是死，我也要紧握沾满敌人鲜血的战斧！"
G["I'll do it, I swear! I'm about to stand up!"]="我发誓，我会干的！我这就要站起来了！"
G["I'll do it, Jebediah. Teleport me!"]="尊特拉华达，我准备好了。传送我吧！"
G["I'll do what I can.  No promises, though.  This weapon has been completely shattered."]="我会尽我所能，但是我不保证什么。这把武器已经完全粉碎了。"
G["I'll double the worker shifts and put in my own money to get those ships seaworthy and back on schedule. Count on it!"]="我会让工人们加班加点，再从自己的腰包里掏钱来让这些船能禁得起大风大浪并且按时交工。放心吧！"
G["I'll drag your corpse to the filth pit!"]="我要把你的尸体拖进污水池！"
G["I'll draw her attacks. Return our brothers to their graves, then help me bring her down!"]="我来挡住她。让我的兄弟回到坟墓中去，然后帮我消灭她！"
G["I'll draw their fire, you make your escape behind me."]="我来吸引火力，掩护你逃走。"
G["I'll drink to anything!"]="有什么就上什么！"
G["I'll drink to that!"]="我要为此干一杯！"
G["I'll eat your heart!"]="我要消灭你！"
G["I'll escort you to your new 'accommodations', Your Excellency."]="Te acompañaré a tus nuevos \"aposentos\", excelencia."
G["I'll even get you started."]="你就过来吧。"
G["I'll explain on the way back to the Sapmasters."]="在回树脂大师家的路上我再解释给你听。"
G["I'll feast on your bones!"]="我要吃掉你的骨头！"
G["I'll feast on your soul!"]="我要吞噬你的灵魂！"
G["I'll fight by your side, $c. You won't regret helping us!"]="我会与你并肩作战，$c。你不会后悔帮助我们的！"
G["I'll fight by your side. Offer them no mercy."]="我会同你并肩作战。对他们绝不留情。"
G["I'll fight... to the last!"]="我会战斗到最后一刻！"
G["I'll fill your corpses with arrows!"]="我要让利箭插满你的全身！"
G["I'll find you in those clouds, you worm!"]="我会在那堆云里找到你的，你这只大虫子！"
G["I'll finish you now, pups!"]="我现在就干掉你们，崽子！"
G["I'll finish you off for good this time!"]="这次我会把你彻底干掉！"
G["I'll flay the flesh from your bones!"]="我要把你的肉一片片地割下来！"
G["I'll flush her out, $n! You just be ready for her when she comes in!"]="$n，我会将她赶出藏身之地。你要做好准备，待会她一露面就动手！"
G["I'll follow them soon, but first let me express my grati-"]="我很快就会赶上他们的，但首先请允许我表达我的谢——"
G["I'll follow you back to the camp. If you speak with my assistant, Hornizz, he'll have your payment."]="我会跟着你回到营地，然后你就可以去向我的助手霍恩尼兹要报酬啦。"
G["I'll freeze you all!"]="我要把你们全都冰冻！"
G["I'll gather up the rest of slaves and get them ready to fight. We'll catch up with you before you engage Scourgelord Tyrannus."]="我会集结其它的奴隶，被让他们做好战斗的准备。在你同天灾领主泰兰努斯开始交战前我们会赶上你的。"
G["I'll get 'em with my pesticide!"]="看我用杀虫剂对付它们！"
G["I'll get him back to Lor'danel.  Thank you for your help, stranger."]="Lo llevaré de vuelta a Lor'danel. Gracias por tu ayuda, $gdesconocido:desconocida;."
G["I'll get him!"]="我来对付他！"
G["I'll get in and fire it! What could go wrong?"]="我要让它响起来！现在还能有什么问题？"
G["I'll get that beacon to the crater safely, Guse. You can count on me!"]="我将把火炬安全带到环形山，古斯。我是值得信赖的！"
G["I'll get the fires dis time!"]="让我去踩灭那妖火！"
G["I'll get the last laugh... they'll see! Oh, hi $c, I didn't see you there."]="我是最后的大赢家……他们会看到的！啊，你好啊，$c，我刚才没看到你。"
G["I'll get to work right away, $n!"]="我马上就要开始工作了，$n！"
G["I'll get you this time!"]="这次一定要干掉你！"
G["I'll get you working yet, you bucket of junk."]="我会让你也开始工作的，你这个废物。"
G["I'll get you, $n!"]="我会找你的，$n！"
G["I'll get you, mortal! And your little wolves, too!"]="我会抓住你的，凡人！还有你那群小狼崽子！"
G["I'll give you anything you want! Just let me live!"]="生命不息，战斗不止！"
G["I'll give you more than you can handle!"]="我要让你们尝尝无所适从的滋味！"
G["I'll gladly spend the day with you."]="我很乐意与你相处一天。"
G["I'll go back fer reinforcements."]="我回去呼叫援军。"
G["I'll go back to the throne room and keep an eye on Samuelson while you speak with Mathias. Stay safe!"]="我要返回王座大厅，监视萨缪尔森的一举一动。多加小心！"
G["I'll go get some help. Hang in there."]="我去求援。你待在原地别动。"
G["I'll go secure below."]="我去看看下面。"
G["I'll gut you like a fish!"]="我会像切鱼那样把你切碎！"
G["I'll handle the rest of this. You take those arrows and get down to the action at the bridge."]="我会处理接下来的事情，你带着那些箭矢去桥下加入战斗。"
G["I'll handle this one. See if you can find any others."]="我来处理这个家伙。你们去找他的同伙。"
G["I'll have all of your heads!"]="我要摘掉你们所有人的脑袋！"
G["I'll have the Kickin' Chimeroak Chops, extra kick!"]="我要来一份铁板奇美拉肉排，双倍调料！"
G["I'll have you at Amberpine Lodge in no time, ally! We just have to make one brief stop first..."]="朋友，我这就送你去琥珀松木营地！不过我们需要稍作停留……"
G["I'll have you out of them in just a moment."]="我马上就会把你救出来。"
G["I'll have you out of there in just a moment."]="我马上带你离开这里。"
G["I'll have you out of those chains in a moment."]="我马上就会把你救出来。"
G["I'll have your gizzard for breakfast!"]="我要用你的内脏当早餐！"
G["I'll have your head!"]="你的脑袋归我了！"
G["I'll head back to the Archivum and see if I can jam his signal. I might be able to buy us some time while you take care of him."]="我这就回档案馆，看看能不能堵塞他的信号。在你们对付他的同时，我努力多争取一点时间。"
G["I'll helm the Maiden's Dagger and lead the shore parties myself."]="我会为女武士之匕号掌舵，并亲自率领登岸部队。"
G["I'll help you defend the tablets."]="我会帮助你保卫这些石板。"
G["I'll help you, Farmer Yoon."]="我会帮你的，农夫老愚。"
G["I'll help."]="我会帮忙的。"
G["I'll hide up here in the shadows. If you run into any trouble, just shine a light on the target and I'll take care of them."]="我就躲在这片阴影里。如果你遇到麻烦，就用灯光指出目标，我来对付他们。"
G["I'll hold onto this orb for...safe keeping. Go inform Rok Orhan of our cultist problem."]="为了安全起见……我要留下这个宝珠。快去把这档子邪教徒的麻烦事告诉给洛卡·奥赫。"
G["I'll hold them off as long as I can!"]="我来尽力挡住他们！"
G["I'll hunt you to the ends of the earth if I have to! Do you hear me? To the ends of the earth!"]="就算你跑到天涯海角，我也一定要抓到你！听到了吗？天涯海角！"
G["I'll hurl your corpses from this tower."]="我要把你们的尸体从塔上丢下去。"
G["I'll incinerate you!"]="我要把你烧成灰！"
G["I'll join you as soon as I catch my breath, heroes. Thank you."]="让我先喘口气，一会儿我会赶上你们的，英雄们。谢谢你们。"
G["I'll join your fleet if you can best my first officer in battle."]="要是你能打败我最优秀的大副，我就加入你的舰队。"
G["I'll just ... be right here. Don't forget about me!"]="那我就……留下吧。好吧…别忘了我！"
G["I'll just keep this here until we need it..."]="我会一直把它留在这里，直到我们需要它……"
G["I'll just label it for reference then dig it up."]="让我来把它标记起来，以后再挖。"
G["I'll just leave it here and nobody will be the wiser!"]="管它做什么呢。放在这里就是了，不会有人发现的！"
G["I'll just leave this right here."]="我会把这个留在这里。"
G["I'll just scrape some of this water from his little spider mouth-parts. A little bit o' poison never hurt no one, right?"]="我得从这蜘蛛的嘴里把水弄出来。一点小毒素应该没什么大碍的，对吧？"
G["I'll just... be right here. Don't forget about me!"]="那我就……留下吧。别忘了我！"
G["I'll keep my eyes open, Grundy. Let the wedding commence!"]="我会时刻睁大双眼，格朗迪。让婚礼开始吧！"
G["I'll keep that in mind."]="我会记住的。"
G["I'll keep the ship here as long as I can.\n\nBe safe!"]="我会尽量将船留在这里。\n\n多加小心！"
G["I'll keep you alive to witness the end, Fordring. I would not want the Light's greatest champion to miss seeing this wretched world remade in my image."]="我会让你活着目睹这个末日，弗丁。这悲惨的世界将在我手中重铸，我不想让圣光最强大的勇士错过这一切。"
G["I'll keep you covered."]="我会掩护你。"
G["I'll keep you safe, mommy!"]="我会保证你的安全，妈妈！"
G["I'll kill a hundred more of your battle worgs!"]="我要再消灭100只像你们这样的军用座狼！"
G["I'll kill every last one of your pawns, Lich King!"]="巫妖王，我要铲除你所有的走狗！"
G["I'll kill one just for you."]="我会为你杀死一名敌人的。"
G["I'll kill you and take your place, scum!"]="我要杀了你，然后夺回你的位置，渣滓！"
G["I'll kill you little one and then I will add your body parts to what we're creating!"]="我要杀了你，再把你跺碎了加入我们正在制造的巨人里！"
G["I'll kill you!"]="我要杀了你！"
G["I'll kill your companion just like I killed Hamuul. And there is nothing you can do about it."]="我会杀掉你的同伴，就如同我杀死哈缪尔。而你对此无能为力。"
G["I'll leave without you. Don't think I'm bluffing. I don't need some smelly old uncle to hold my hand."]="那我自己去。别以为我只是随口说说。我可不需要某个臭哄哄的大叔牵着我。"
G["I'll let you clean up in here, $p. See you back at Mudmug's!"]="好好打扫这里吧，$p。到泥盏那儿见！"
G["I'll let you have the first kill.  Don't make me regret that."]="我可以让你打头阵。别让我失望。"
G["I'll light the lamps."]="我会把灯点亮的。"
G["I'll make a deal with you, Hornswaggle. Help my men get a stone quarry operation running, and we'll protect your dig site."]="我们做个交易吧，盘角。帮我的人把采石场开起来，而我们保护你搞考古挖掘。"
G["I'll make an offering of your blood!"]="我要用你的血当祭品！"
G["I'll make make sure those slumps stay on task and get those defenses built."]="我得确保那些懒鬼有在好好干活儿并且把那段防御工事给造起来。"
G["I'll make ready.\n\nIt will be good to get away from these savages for a time."]="我会做好准备的。\n\n能暂时摆脱这些野蛮人就再好不过了。"
G["I'll make sure nothing interferes. Go now heroes! Kill Godfrey!"]="我掩护你们。上啊，英雄们！消灭高弗雷！"
G["I'll make sure to tell Captain Taylor that you're destroying the Hammers in here."]="我一定会转告泰勒上尉，你正在这里解决暮光之锤。"
G["I'll make this quick."]="我会速战速决。"
G["I'll make you a deal: if you get me out of here alive, you'll get a reward larger than you can imagine!"]="我们来做个交易吧：如果你把我从这儿救出去，我就给你一大笔钱，多到超出你的想象！"
G["I'll make you bleed, you weak little sacks of bones!"]="我要让你们鲜血四溅，你们这群没用的瘦皮囊！"
G["I'll make you pay for that!"]="我会让你为此付出代价的！"
G["I'll meet you at the Golden Pagoda."]="我会在鎏金亭那儿见你。"
G["I'll meet you back in the village."]="我会在村里与你会面。"
