G["I'll miss the show!"]="我会怀念这场表演的！"
G["I'll mount your skull from the highest tower!"]="我要让你尝尝我的厉害！"
G["I'll nail it!"]="我会演好它的！"
G["I'll need to find a place to rest a while. Continue on... don't leave without the relics."]="我需要找个地方休息一下。继续吧……不要把那些圣物丢下。"
