G["I'll never see my wife again..."]="我永远也见不到我的妻子了……"
G["I'll never stop hunting your kind, necromancer.  NEVER."]="我永远也不会放过你的同类，死灵法师。永远。"
G["I'll never stop. Never..."]="我不会停下的。永远不会……"
G["I'll never take another shortcut again, I swear! How was I supposed to know the skies over Hellfire Peninsula were that dangerous?"]="我发誓，我再也不会走捷径了！我怎么知道地狱火半岛的上空那么危险？"
G["I'll not be tortured again!"]="我不会再次受辱的！"
G["I'll not hear a word of it. The egg is yours. I want you to see how committed I am to this union."]="我不想听到这样的话。这颗蛋是你的。它代表了我对于我们之间盟约的忠诚。"
G["I'll not hear it! He's a Wanderbrew and she's a Goldendraft. Return my daughter or I'll make sure no one gives you work for a month."]="我不要听！他是游酒家族的人，而她来自金酿家族。把我的女儿交出来，不然我就让你整整一个月都找不到活儿。"
G["I'll offer what aid I can, $n. Just promise you'll make lots of delicious Kor'kron corpses on your way to Garrosh."]="我会尽力帮忙的，$n。你只要在追杀加尔鲁什的路上，顺手多留下几具美味的库卡隆尸体就行了。"
G["I'll paint my face with your blood!"]="我要把你们的血涂在脸上！"
G["I'll patrol the pass leading up to Frostwolf Keep. Just give me the word and I'll take flight, Commander."]="我会在去霜狼要塞的路上巡逻。只要你一声令下，我就起飞，指挥官。"
G["I'll pay!  I'll pay!  Eeeek!  Please don't hurt me!"]="我还钱！我还钱！呀～！不要伤害我！"
G["I'll perform these with pleasure, $n!"]="乐意效劳，$n！"
G["I'll pluck you, Johnson!"]="我要拔光你的毛，强森！"
G["I'll poke out yer deadlights, ye lily-livered eel!"]="我要把你的天灵盖刺穿，你这条没种的鳗鱼！"
