G["I'll probably make it back to the Forsaken Front before you two, er, three."]="也许我能抢在你们两个……呃……三个前面回到被遗忘者先锋军。"
G["I'll punch you too!"]="我也要把你们砸扁！"
G["I'll put a bolt through that thick skull of yours!"]="我要把螺栓插进你们的厚脑壳里！"
G["I'll put me items in the brazier now. You just speak to da spirits when they appear."]="我会把东西放到火盆里，你只需要在自然之灵出现的时候和他们交谈就可以了。"
G["I'll race you!"]="我要和你赛跑，看谁先到！"
G["I'll remain and inform Tirion of our progress. You must press on and bring down Sindragosa. Lok'tar, champions!"]="我会留下来，告诉提里奥我们的进展。你们必须继续前进，击败辛达苟萨。勇士们，Lok’tar！"
G["I'll return immediately. Thank you, $c."]="我立刻就回去。谢谢你，$c。"
G["I'll rip out your eyeballs, weakling..."]="我要狠狠地教训你，孬种……"
G["I'll rip the flesh from your bones!"]="我要把你们生吞活剥!"
G["I'll rip the meat from your bones!"]="我要把你们撕成碎片！"
G["I'll rip the secrets from your flesh!"]="我要从你的肉体中把秘密都挖出来！"
G["I'll rip you apart!"]="我要撕碎你！"
G["I'll rip your shriveled heart out with my bare hands before any harm comes to $n, necromancer."]="巫师，在你伤害$n之前，我就会徒手将你干枯的徽记拿过来。"
G["I'll run ye through, ye cannon-kissin' cannonface!"]="让我来送你一程，你这只配跟炮弹接吻的大饼脸！"
G["I'll scare them off with my roar!"]="我要用怒吼吓跑他们！"
G["I'll scribble you out of existence!"]="我要把你从生死簿上除名！"
G["I'll see to it that you get the middle fragment of the World Pillar."]="我一定会让你得到世界之柱中端的残片。"
G["I'll see ya there, $n! Don't be late!"]="回头见，$n！别迟到！"
G["I'll see you after class."]="下课找你谈谈。"
G["I'll see you in the ring."]="竞技场上见。"
G["I'll see you when it's done, King of Stormwind."]="我们回头见，暴风城国王。"
G["I'll send for my hozen friends, the mallet must be made anew."]="我会召集我的猢狲朋友们，重铸这把钟杵。"
G["I'll send some watchers ta get his body so we can offer a proper farewell... I wish I could do more."]="我会派人来取回他的尸体，让我们为他举行一个告别仪式……希望还有些什么是我能做的。"
G["I'll send ye down to Neptulon's Locker, ye three-gallon pufferfish!"]="我要送你去见耐普图隆，你这条笨重的大河豚！"
G["I'll send ye to feed the fishes, ye flat-shanty trogg!"]="我要拿你去喂鱼，你这下三滥的穴居人！"
G["I'll send you on my flying machine. Keep your eyes peeled for clues about what might've happened to Hemet!"]="我会让你搭乘我的飞行器的。睁大你的眼睛，给我调查清楚赫米特的情况！"
G["I'll send your soul to the afterlife little one!"]="让我送你的灵魂去极乐世界吧！"
G["I'll set the cap to auto-activate once you're at the villa. Just make sure you avoid those pigs!"]="你到了那幢小屋之后，我会将帽子设置成自动状态。小心一定要躲开那些猪！"
G["I'll shatter your soul!"]="我要撕碎你的灵魂！"
G["I'll show my father I have what it takes to be a great fighter."]="我要让我爸看看，我具有成为一个伟大斗士的所有资质。"
G["I'll show them... I'll show them all!"]="我要让他们知道我的厉害！"
G["I'll show ye access, ye wretched machine. Here it is again: Norgannon's key!"]="我叫你看看我的权限，你这烂机器。瞧好了：诺甘农的钥匙！"
G["I'll show you firsthand the strength of undeath."]="我会直接让你看看亡灵的力量。"
G["I'll show you true power!"]="我要让你看看什么是真正的力量！"
G["I'll show you!  Give me that practice parachute!"]="我来做示范！把练习用的降落伞包递给我！"
G["I'll show you: this beaten dog still has some teeth!"]="我要让你们知道，老狗也有几颗牙！"
G["I'll shut down the defensive radiation pumps. Squads, commandeer the remaining mechanized suits and move up to the Main Entry."]="我会关闭防御辐射泵。各小队，拿上剩余的机械装备，向主入口全速前进。"
G["I'll silence that infernal drum once and for all!"]="我要让那可恨的鼓声彻底消失！"
G["I'll sing 'em ta death, I will I will."]="如果我愿意的话，可以直接靠唱歌把他们唱死。"
G["I'll slice you in two!  Wait a minute... who are you?"]="我要把你切成两半！等一下……你是谁？"
G["I'll soon be revered as the greatest goblin tinker of all time! Besides, that negligence case involving the creation of the gilgoblins will never stick."]="我很快就会成为前无古人，后无来者的，最伟大的地精工匠！另外，那个导致海地精产生的疏忽根本不值一提。"
G["I'll split you from stem to stern!"]="我要把你们全都杀死！"
G["I'll start gettin' her prepped for ye to return."]="我会让她帮你做好返回的准备的。"
G["I'll stay behind with the Royal Guard, father.  It is my duty to Gilneas."]="我要和皇家卫士一起留下来，父亲。这是我的责任。"
G["I'll steer, you handle Ol' Blasty.  An' don't tie yer skivvies in a knot... I'll slow down when we get closer!"]="我驾驶，你来操控老滑膛。别把你的衣服打成结……等我们接近时我会减速的！"
G["I'll stick with you a little longer, $n. I saw many injured crewmen who may be in need of my aid."]="我会再照顾你一小会，$n。我看到还有许多受伤的机组成员需要我的帮助呢。"
G["I'll take a pint of Dark Iron ale.  Oh, you're not the $gwaiter:waitress;?"]="Yo quiero una caña de Hierro Negro. ¿Ah, no eres $gcamarero:camarera;?"
G["I'll take a ride to my first post, please."]="我想返回第一座哨站。"
G["I'll take care of the drakes. You worry about the rest of the Twilight rubbish."]="我会去对付那些龙。你只需要处理那些暮光垃圾就行了。"
G["I'll take care of the pirates. But first, maybe some liquid courage."]="我会解决那些海盗。不过首先，得先来几杯壮壮胆。"
G["I'll take good care of your pets, don't you worry!"]="我会照顾好你的宠物的，不要担心！"
G["I'll take him back to the priestess. Thank you for your kindness."]="我会把他带回到女祭司那里。衷心感谢你。"
G["I'll take it. Anything else?"]="石头我要了。别的呢？"
G["I'll take my fee out of your paycheck."]="我要从你的薪水中收取劳务费。"
G["I'll take that flight to Brill now."]="现在我要飞往布瑞尔。"
G["I'll take that gold now, if you would be so kind."]="要是你如此慷慨，我就把这金币收下了。"
G["I'll take the cultist.  You handle the traitor."]="我会对付邪教徒。你处理那个叛徒。"
G["I'll take the dancing green kite."]="我要拿热舞绿色风筝。"
G["I'll take the flight."]="我要飞过去。"
G["I'll take the high-altitude blue kite."]="我要拿高空蓝色风筝。"
G["I'll take the standard red kite."]="我要拿标准红色风筝。"
G["I'll take the swift yellow kite."]="我要拿迅捷黄色风筝。"
G["I'll take those. We can't have the mighty chieftain cowering in fear of a few hides."]="我会拿走的。怎么能让伟大的酋长被一堆兽皮吓得瑟瑟发抖呢。"
G["I'll take whatever ya got cookin'! And throw in a bottle to wash it down!"]="随便给我点什么吃的，外加一瓶酒！"
G["I'll take you to some other horses.  You probably miss being around other horses.  They can be your friend too."]="我带你去找其他马儿吧。你呀，肯定是想和它们呆在一起啦。它们也会成为你的新朋友呀。"
G["I'll take you with me!"]="我要让你陪葬！"
G["I'll take your money and your life too!"]="我会取走你的钱，还有你的命！"
G["I'll talk, I'll talk! Anything! Just keep that perfumed bag away from me!"]="我会说的，我会说的！我什么都说！赶快把这个怪味袋子从我面前拿开！"
G["I'll teach ye to chop down yer foes like saplings in the forest."]="我将教你如何杀敌，让他们像小树苗一样倒下。"
G["I'll tear the secrets from your soul! Tell me about the \"Crimson Dawn\" and your life may be spared!"]="¡Arrancaré los secretos de tu alma! ¡Háblame sobre el \"Alba Carmesí\" y quizá te perdone la vida!"
G["I'll tear you to pieces! AAAAAHHHHHHHH!"]="我要把你们撕碎！啊啊啊啊！！！！"
G["I'll tear you to shreds!"]="我要把你撕碎！"
G["I'll tell Legionnaire Nazgrim that you're destroying the Hammers in here."]="我一定会转告军团士兵纳兹戈林，你正在这里解决暮光之锤。"
G["I'll tell her, Greatfather."]="我会告诉她的，爷爷。"
G["I'll tell ya, the only proper way to hunt is when yer good an' goggled!"]="我跟你说啊，猎艳的最佳方法就是保持良好的风度，还要戴上这种护目镜！"
G["I'll tell you 'then what.' She went runnin' straight for the hive. And you know what's crazier? Not a single damned bug got in her way or tried to stop her. She ran through them all as if she'd been best friends with 'em for centuries."]="我会告诉你接下来发生了什么事。她直奔虫巢去了。还有什么比这更疯狂的事儿了吗？没有一支虫子阻挡她的去路。她直接从虫子身边跑过，就好像他们是交情很深的老朋友一样。"
G["I'll tell you everything! STOP! PLEASE!"]="我说！住手！求你了！"
G["I'll tell you more, Karnik, in time. But first, send this traveler'ta Belgrum--there's more business'ta attend to."]="我会尽快地告诉你更多内容，卡尼克。但是首先，请你让这位旅行者去找贝尔格拉姆——还有很多事情没做完呢。"
G["I'll tell you nothing, Scourge filth!"]="呸，我不会告诉你的！"
G["I'll tell you one thing, $n. I like jade, but it's not my favorite. Everyone gives it to me, all the time!"]="我要告诉你一件事，$n。我喜欢玉石，但那不是我的最爱。所有人都给我玉石，老是这样！"
G["I'll tell you what you need to know, but I don't have to like it. We're watching you and your kind."]="我会告诉你都该知道些什么，但这并不表示我有多么愿意。我们一直在监视着你和你的同类。"
G["I'll tell you what. Since you fancy yourself the hero type, if you can make your way through the Badlands to the Searing Gorge and bring me back something to prove your heroics, I'll see what I can do about getting you a key.\n\nIn the southeasternmost corner of Searing Gorge is a lady almost as tough as me, Margol the Rager. Maybe you should investigate."]="你猜怎么着，既然你觉得自己是个英雄，那么就穿过荒芜之地到灼热峡谷去，拿回一些能证明你的实力的东西，这样我也许能想办法帮你搞到一把钥匙。\n\n在灼热峡谷的最西南角有一个强壮的女士，嗯，几乎跟我一样强壮，她的名字叫狂暴的玛尔戈。也许你应该先去找她谈谈……"
G["I'll tell you where to go, provided you tell me what interests you."]="如果你想要进行更多训练，我可以告诉你该去哪里。你想要学习哪种武器呢？"
G["I'll tell your story, friends!  I'll tell everyone about how the Hollowstone miners never gave in!"]="朋友们，我会将你们的事迹传播开来的！我要所有人都知道空石矿洞的矿工永远不会说放弃！"
G["I'll throw my hammer upside his head if he makes us wait any longer."]="如果他再耽搁我们，我就把锤子敲到他的脑袋上。"
G["I'll throw your corpse in the filth-pool!"]="我要把你的尸体扔进污水池！"
G["I'll try my best to be a good student."]="我会尽力当个好学生。"
G["I'll try to get it started again. You go ahead. I'll find my way back on my own."]="我会努力让它重新动起来。你先回去吧，我随后会自己回来。"
G["I'll try to get you back on the island. We just have to get through these thermals..."]="我会尝试把你送回岛上。只要能穿过这些热气流就行……"
G["I'll turn you into a fossil, $r!"]="我要把你变成化石，$r！"
G["I'll turn your world... upside... down."]="我要让你们的世界……彻底颠覆……"
G["I'll update my journal."]="我将更新我的日记。"
G["I'll use the crystal to shield the tablets. See if it will grant you powers to defend me. If Twilight's Hammer's minions break through my shield, they'll kill me and take the tablets!"]="我会利用这块水晶来保护石板，看看它是否能为你提供力量来守卫我。如果暮光之锤的爪牙们打破了我的护盾，他们一定会杀死我，夺走石板！"
G["I'll use the forge to make batches o' earthen to stand guard... But our greatest challenge still remains: find and stop Loken!"]="我会用熔炉来制造一些土灵，让他们保卫这里……但现在最大的挑战是：找到并阻止洛肯！"
G["I'll wait for you all on the other side of the finish line!"]="我会在终点线那边等你们的！"
G["I'll wait for you at the base of Ruins Rise."]="我会在废墟高地的基地等你。"
G["I'll wait until you're healed to finish you, Nazgrim. Let it not be said that the Alliance has no honor."]="我会等你的伤养好了再结果你，纳兹戈林。免得你说我们联盟的人没有荣誉感。"
G["I'll wait."]="我会耐心等待的。"
G["I'll wipe you off of my boots later!"]="我要用你来擦靴子！"
G["I'll work on the siege engine, just watch my back.  Use those seaforium bombs on the gates if you need them!"]="我要处理这部攻城器械，掩护我。如果有需要，就对大门使用那些爆盐炸弹！"
G["I'll..."]="我会……"
G["I'll... get... back... to... work... I... promise."]="我会…回…去…工作…的…我…保证。"
G["I'll... take a look."]="我会……看一看的。"
G["I'm \"Plucky\" Johnson, and this is my default greeting."]="Soy Johnson el \"Desplumado\" y este es mi saludo habitual."
G["I'm Augustus!  You want it, I got it!  You wanna sell it, then I want it!"]="我是奥古斯图斯！我有你想要的东西！我想要你准备出售的东西！"
G["I'm Augustus, and my prices are INSANE!"]="我是奥古斯图斯，这价格太高啦！"
G["I'm Mudmug. Who's asking?"]="我就是泥盏。你们是？"
G["I'm NOT undead!  Not for long, anyway.  My father will rescue me, I know it..."]="我不是亡灵！至少很快就不是了。我父亲会来救我，我知道……"
G["I'm Toya! You need it? I can get it! Don't go to nobody else in Dawn's Blossom!"]="我叫托亚！无论你需要什么我都能帮你搞到！不用找别人了，我可是全晨芳园独一无二的！"
G["I'm a black dragon. I won't need any help."]="我可是黑龙。我不需要帮助。"
G["I'm a cloth vendor, and this is my default greeting."]="我是一个卖布的，这是我默认的见面打招呼的话。"
G["I'm a daughter of the Wildhammer Clan and a shaman of the Earthen Ring.  My code compels me to honor my ancestors and the elements."]="我是蛮锤部族的女儿，大地之环的萨满祭司。我的信条迫使我捍卫祖先与元素的荣耀。"
G["I'm a doctor!  What seems to be the problem?"]="我是医生！发生什么事情了？"
G["I'm a dwarf, ma'am. Can we borrow some food?"]="我是个矮人，女士。能向您借点儿吃的吗？"
G["I'm a fierce predator!"]="我是一个凶猛的掠食者！"
G["I'm a genius!"]="我是天才！"
G["I'm a good dancer. Wanna see?"]="我是个舞者。想要看看我跳舞吗？"
G["I'm a hunter trainer. You'll want to find the $c trainer."]="我是猎人训练师。你要找的是$c训练师。"
G["I'm a little basket filled with grain..."]="我是一个装满谷物的小篮子……"
G["I'm a little busy at the moment, $c... return when I'm less preoccupied."]="$c，现在我有一点忙……等我有空的时候再来找我吧。"
G["I'm a little busy negotiating a bribe right now.  You might want to come back later."]="我现在正忙着讨论一个贿赂计划。你不如晚点过来吧？"
G["I'm a prisoner!\n\nThey shot me and my beautiful zeppelin out of the sky. And what for? Because I was ferrying men and materiel for the Horde? That's nothing new!\n\nNow they have me running her in circles around the bay so that they can bomb the pirates. I just don't have the parts to keep her going like this! I'm barely keeping her together on spit and bailing wire!\n\nI won't be held responsible for what happens to you, but you might as well get on board before she leaves.\n\nIt's a crime I tell you!"]="我是个囚犯！\n\n这帮混蛋把我美丽的飞艇从天上打了下来。你知道这是为什么吗？就因为我帮部落运输了一些士兵和补给物资！这算什么新鲜事嘛！真是的！\n\n现在他们逼我开着飞艇在海湾上巡逻，帮他们轰炸海盗。现在飞艇的零件短缺得厉害，她随时都有坠毁的危险！我几乎靠口水和绳子才能保证她不散架！\n\n你要是出了什么事，我可不负责，不过你最好趁她起航前跳上去。\n\n我跟你说，这是违法的！"
G["I'm a prisoner!\n\nThey shot me and my beautiful zeppelin out of the sky. And what for? Because I was ferrying men and materiel for the Horde? That's nothing new!\n\nNow they have me running her in circles around the bay so that they can bomb the pirates. I just don't have the parts to keep her going like this! I'm barely keeping her together on spit and bailing wire!\n\nIf you're determined to help them out, she's due to arrive back in port in less than $3078w minutes.\n\nIt's a crime I tell you!"]="我是个囚犯！\n\n这帮混蛋把我美丽的飞艇从天上打了下来。你知道这是为什么吗？就因为我帮部落运输了一些士兵和补给物资！这算什么新鲜事嘛！真是的！\n\n现在他们逼我开着飞艇在海湾上巡逻，帮他们轰炸海盗。现在飞艇的零件短缺得厉害，她随时都有坠毁的危险！我几乎靠口水和绳子才能保证她不散架！\n\n如果你愿意帮忙的话，就去那边候着吧。她在$3078w分钟之内就会入港。\n\n我跟你说，这是违法的！"
G["I'm a prisoner!\n\nThey shot me and my beautiful zeppelin out of the sky. And what for? Because I was ferrying men and materiel for the Horde? That's nothing new!\n\nNow they have me running her in circles around the bay so that they can bomb the pirates. I just don't have the parts to keep her going like this! I'm barely keeping her together on spit and bailing wire!\n\nIf you're determined to help them out, she's due to arrive back in port in less than a minute.\n\nIt's a crime I tell you!"]="我是个囚犯！\n\n这帮混蛋把我美丽的飞艇从天上打了下来。你知道这是为什么吗？就因为我帮部落运输了一些士兵和补给物资！这算什么新鲜事嘛！真是的！\n\n现在他们逼我开着飞艇在海湾上巡逻，帮他们轰炸海盗。现在飞艇的零件短缺得厉害，她随时都有坠毁的危险！我几乎靠口水和绳子才能保证她不散架！\n\n如果你愿意帮忙的话，就去那边候着吧。她在1分钟之内就会入港。\n\n我跟你说，这是违法的！"
G["I'm a prisoner!\n\nThey shot me and my beautiful zeppelin out of the sky. And what for? Because I was ferrying men and materiel for the Horde? That's nothing new!\n\nNow they have me running her in circles around the bay so that they can bomb the pirates. I just don't have the parts to keep her going like this! I'm barely keeping her together on spit and bailing wire!\n\nIt's a crime I tell you!"]="我是个囚犯！\n\n这帮混蛋把我美丽的飞艇从天上打了下来。你知道这是为什么吗？就因为我帮部落运输了一些士兵和补给物资！这算什么新鲜事嘛！真是的！\n\n现在他们逼我开着飞艇在海湾上巡逻，帮他们轰炸海盗。现在飞艇的零件短缺得厉害，她随时都有坠毁的危险！我几乎靠口水和绳子才能保证她不散架！\n\n我跟你说，这是违法的！"
G["I'm a prisoner, what does it look like? The draenei filth captured me as I exited the sun gate. They killed our portal controllers and destroyed the gate. The Sun King will be most displeased with this turn of events."]="我是个囚犯，你看我像什么？肮脏的德莱尼人在我走出太阳之门的时候抓住了我。他们杀了我们的传送门控制者，并且摧毁了太阳之门。凯尔萨斯大王一定会非常生气的。"
G["I'm a scientist who studies both time and sound, so I'm not quite certain how I'm supposed to think, or find the time to get any work done around here, with all of this racket?!\n\nWhy can't these fools go blow themselves up somewhere else?\n\nAh well, at least I look good.  Say, $g boy : lovely;, have I seen you around here before?"]="我是个研究时间和声音的科学家，因此我不十分确信我该怎么来思考，或是找个时间在这喧嚣里来完成什么工作。\n\n为什么这些蠢货不把他们自己炸到其他地方去呢？\n\n啊，好吧，至少我看起来不错。对了， $g小子:小姑娘;，我以前在这里见过你吗？"
G["I'm a simple man who knows a few things about tailoring, but you need more assistance than I can provide. I have heard of a Night Elf who is quite an accomplished tailor. He resides in Stormwind, in the Magic District."]="我对裁缝业知之甚少，但你需要更多的帮助。我听说有个夜精灵精通裁缝技术。他居住在暴风城的魔法区。"
G["I'm a soldier, Buckets. You know, a fighting man... You're the laundry boy."]="我是一名士兵，水桶。你知道的，是战士……而你是个洗衣工。"
G["I'm a test spirit healer."]="我是个测试用的灵魂医者。"
G["I'm a tree!"]="我是一棵树！"
G["I'm a waitress."]="我变成餐厅的女招待了。"
G["I'm a wand peddler by trade. Luckily for you and me both, most of my wands survived through the shipwreck!"]="我是专卖魔杖的小贩。我们都很幸运，我的大部分魔杖都躲过了那次海难！"
G["I'm about fed up with you! Don't make me get Forgemaster Throngus over here!"]="我快要受够你了！别逼我把铸炉之主索朗格斯请来！"
G["I'm about halfway done! Keep the Alliance away - fighting's not in my contract!"]="我就要完成了！挡住那帮联盟的家伙，合同上没说我还得打仗！"
G["I'm about to open a can on this $n."]="我要让这个$n头上开天窗！"
G["I'm afraid Gunny didn't make it, $n."]="我担心冈尼没能撑下来，$n。"
G["I'm afraid I cannot assist you, $r, but I am certain Georgia can."]="恐怕我没办法帮你，$r，但我相信乔吉亚可以。"
G["I'm afraid I cannot help you, $r, but I am sure Khaelyn Steelwing can."]="恐怕我没办法帮你，$r，但我相信凯琳·斯蒂文可以。"
G["I'm afraid I cannot speak with you at the moment."]="我现在恐怕不能和你谈话。"
G["I'm afraid I have nothing to teach to someone with your experience. But you haven't reached the end of the road yet. Speak to Lucan Cordell, behind the counter there. He'll guide you through the next phase of your journey."]="我担心对有你这样经验的人没什么可教的。但是你还有其他方法。去找那边柜台后面的鲁坎·考迪尔谈谈。他会指引你通过旅行的下一个阶段。"
G["I'm afraid I'll have to... charge you extra."]="恐怕我要……额外给你些闪电。"
G["I'm afraid I'm of little use right now, $n.\n\nI am sick with worry for my husband."]="我现在恐怕帮不上什么忙，$n。\n\n我太担心我丈夫了。"
G["I'm afraid I'm rather busy fixing horseshoes at the moment.  Would you mind coming back at another time?"]="我恐怕现在正忙着修理这些马蹄铁。你不介意另挑一个时间再过来吧？"
G["I'm afraid not, $n. Now, feel the shame you have brought upon yourself."]="恐怕不是这样，$n。自食苦果吧。"
G["I'm afraid not, Schneider. Your time has come!"]="不行，斯克尼德。你的日子到头了！"
G["I'm afraid that the blade which you hold in your hands is beyond saving. The hatred runs too deep. But do not lose hope, $c. Where one chapter has ended, a new one begins.\n\nFind his son - a more devout and pious man you may never meet. It is rumored that he is able to build the Ashbringer anew, without requiring the old, tainted blade."]="我担心你手中的这把剑已经没法挽回了，它的仇恨太深重。但是不要灰心，$c。事情总是柳暗花明的。\n\n去找到他的儿子——你可能从来没见过如此虔诚的人。据说他可以铸造一把全新的灰烬使者，而不需要这把被玷污的剑。"
G["I'm afraid there is little I can teach you, $c. You're free to browse my wares, of course, but you will not find them of use to you."]="我已经没有什么新知识可以教给你了，$c。当然，你可以随意浏览我出售的货物，但是它们对你来说似乎没有什么用处了。"
G["I'm afraid there's nothin' I can do for our brother... her power tore away at his soul."]="恐怕我救不了我们的兄弟了……女海巫的力量夺走了他的灵魂。"
G["I'm afraid ye would not survive long in Alterac Valley, $c.  Come back and see us when you have a few more seasons under your belt."]="恐怕你在奥特兰克山谷中活不了多久，$c。等你更加强大一些再回来吧。"
G["I'm afraid you are not ready to become a valiant.  However I suspect you will be ready soon enough."]="恐怕你暂时还不能取得勇士的头衔。但是我相信你很快就会做好充分准备的。"
G["I'm afraid you have me confused with someone who wants to talk to you."]="恐怕你把我和某个想和你说话的人搞混了吧。"
G["I'm afraid you'll have to ask the -- Well, perhaps Kalecgos can help."]="恐怕，你得找——嗯，或许卡雷苟斯会帮忙。"
G["I'm afraid you'll have to push forward without us."]="恐怕你得独自向前推进了。"
G["I'm afraid you're at the limits of my knowledge. Camberon is more skilled in alchemy than I. Please speak with him if you're interested in advancing."]="我所掌握的知识非常有限，卡博隆在炼金术方面的造诣比我厉害得多。如果你想要继续提升自己的技能，就和他谈谈吧。"
G["I'm afraid you're out of my league, friend! You should go see Nogg in Orgrimmar, he'll take you to the next level!"]="¡Me temo que ya juegas a otro nivel, $gamigo:amiga;! Deberías ir a ver a Nogg en Orgrimmar, él te ayudará a seguir progresando."
G["I'm afraid your ancestry is the cause, troll. Decades of fighting with your green-skinned brethren have hardened their hearts against your kind."]="我恐怕是你们祖先的原因，巨魔。和你们那些绿皮肤的伙伴战斗了几十年之后，他们难免不厌恶你们。"
G["I'm afraid your darkness quotient isn't sufficient enough for me to bother talking to you any further.  Move along please."]="恐怕你给我的份额太低了，我可不愿跟你废话了。请走吧。"
G["I'm afraid your friend won't be waking up any time soon.  I always sedate my croc's food.  I hate to see them struggle with their meal."]="恐怕你的朋友不会很快就醒过来。我一直都把我的鳄鱼喂得很饱。我不喜欢看到它们为了食物而争斗。"
G["I'm alive thanks only to you... I won't forget this."]="多亏有你，我才活了下来……我不会忘记你的恩德。"
G["I'm alive!"]="我还活着！"
G["I'm alive? Ha! That's more than I can say for those Horde at Garrosh'ar Point. We tore them up good."]="我还活着？哈！加尔鲁什尔前哨站的部落真是白费力气了。给他们点颜色瞧瞧。"
G["I'm all ears."]="我将洗耳恭听。"
G["I'm all fired up over finally gettin' rid of you!"]="一想到要开除你，我就激动不已。"
G["I'm all kinds of busted up... might not... make it."]="我……我就要挂了……要坚持……不住了……"
G["I'm all over it."]="我来了。"
G["I'm all over that. Thanks."]="我没问题了。谢谢你。"
G["I'm all... yours."]="我是你的了。"
G["I'm almost as tall as you!"]="我几乎和你一样高！"
G["I'm almost jealous of our Mr. Wavesinger. Why, he may well be prettier than me!"]="我有点嫉妒维瓦·水歌了。为什么？他比我更优秀！"
G["I'm already bored!"]="我已经有些厌倦了！"
G["I'm always up for something of Grimbooze's."]="我对葛瑞姆酿造的酒总是充满兴趣的。"
G["I'm as ready as I'll ever be."]="我完全准备好了。"
G["I'm as sane as the next guy, $g fella:lady;. Believe what you will, but I AM capable of fashioning this armor. If you're interested, maybe we can make a deal. The sooner I can get out of the assassination business, the better."]="我一点都没疯，跟你一样正常，$g伙计:小姐;。相信我，我确实能做出这样一套护甲。如果你有兴趣，不如来做一笔交易。能越早摆脱杀手的行当，我就越开心。"
G["I'm at a loss. What can one simple man do in the face of disaster?"]="我完全不知所措。面对这样的灾难，我又能做些什么呢？"
G["I'm at your side, friend."]="我将追随你左右，朋友。"
G["I'm awaiting orders on your specific assignments. In the meantime, stay here and be ready to move at a moment's notice!"]="我正在等待着给你们指派特殊任务的命令。在此期间，请待在这里随时准备出发！"
G["I'm aware of the dangers of this place. Now move out of the way, I won't ask again."]="我很清楚这里有多危险。我再说一遍，别挡路。"
G["I'm awful thirsty, buddy."]="我渴坏了，哥们。"
G["I'm back where I started."]="我又回到原点了。"
G["I'm back!"]="我回来了！"
G["I'm back, Sis!"]="我回来了，姐妹！"
G["I'm badly injured!  I can't take much more of this!"]="我伤得很重！我无法承受更多的伤害了！"
G["I'm badly injured, but I'll do what I can to help. Try and stay inside of my anti-magic barrier or the acolytes' magic will tear you apart."]="我伤得很重，但是我会尽量帮忙的。你最好待在我撑起的反魔法屏障中，否则侍僧的魔法会将你撕成碎片。"
G["I'm barely even trying!"]="我压根就没认真！"
G["I'm beaten. You've shown me the error of my ways. From here on out, I promise to reform the way the cartel is run!"]="我输了。你让我看到了我的错误。从现在起，我承诺对财阀进行彻底的改革。"
G["I'm beginning to doubt this tour guide will ever arrive."]="我开始怀疑，这个向导永远都不会来了。"
G["I'm beginning to like these guys!"]="我开始喜欢这些家伙了！"
G["I'm beginning to regret promoting you, $n!"]="¡Empiezo a arrepentirme de tu ascenso!"
G["I'm beginning to think that they all forgot about me!"]="我还以为他们早把我忘了呢！"
G["I'm being sarcastic, by the way."]="我可没在嘲笑你。"
G["I'm bleeding!"]="我在流血！"
G["I'm blind, you stupid sow-spawn, not deaf. Don't even think about it."]="我是瞎了，你这个蠢猪，但不是聋了。想都不要想。"
G["I'm bonin' up on my spirit lore."]="我正在钻研我的灵魂知识。"
G["I'm bored!"]="我很无聊！"
G["I'm bored! Let's go hunt down some evildoers."]="好无聊啊！我们去追捕些坏人吧。"
G["I'm bored, Cloudwing. Go, go!"]="好无聊啊，云翼。走吧！"
G["I'm brewing as fast as I can."]="我正在以最快的速度酿酒。"
G["I'm bringin' the pain!"]="我要给你们一些苦头吃！"
G["I'm burned. Badly."]="我烧伤了。非常严重。"
G["I'm busy right now."]="我现在很忙。"
G["I'm busy, $n. Tell Whuut to handle whatever it is. That young pup has been stewing all day long. He spends much more time like that, and he's going to hurt something."]="我很忙，$n。告诉伍特去处理一切。那个年轻人整天都焦虑不安的。他大部分时间都处于这种状态，像是要做些什么。"
G["I'm busy, lad. Why don't ye go find some Forsaken goo and take a bath, eh?"]="Estoy ocupado, $gmuchacho:muchacha;. ¿Por qué no vas a buscar algo de baba Renegada y te das un baño, ¿eh?"
G["I'm busy, make it fast!"]="我很忙，快点！"
G["I'm busying showing this rookie the back of my fist!"]="我正忙着让这菜鸟尝尝我拳头的滋味！"
G["I'm certain that one of the visiting Woolybush dwarves is a jewelcrafter.\nI believe it's the husband, Ingo. They're both explorers of some sort. Look for them in the inn."]="Estoy seguro de que uno de esos enanos Lanudo que han venido de visita se dedica a la joyería.\n\nCreo que es el marido, Ingo. Los dos son exploradores o algo así. Búscalos en la posada."
G["I'm certain that the kaja'mite is having the same intelligence-increasing effect on the monkeys that it had on our ancient ancestors."]="我确信卡亚矿强化了那些猴子的智力，就如同它们曾经提升我们远古祖先的智力一样。"
G["I'm certain you will. Perhaps one day you could deliver a message to an old friend of mine. I hear he still wanders those woods.\n\n<Eitrigg bows his head for a moment, as if in prayer.>\n\nSo Rend, yes... Rend and his brother Maim ruled the Spire, in constant conflict with the Dark Iron dwarves. They managed to displace the dwarves in the upper portion of the city, but only after the dragons came and only after the death of Maim."]="我想你会的。或许有一天你能将消息传给我的一个老朋友。我听说他还在那片森林中。\n\n<伊崔格低下头，好像在做祈祷。>\n\n雷德，是的……雷德和他的兄弟麦姆统治了黑石塔，与黑铁矮人经常发生冲突。他们试图将黑铁矮人完全赶出城市的上层部分，但是只有在飞龙来到和麦姆死掉之后它才真正实现。"
G["I'm charging you for hazard pay on this one, pal."]="为了这个，你可是要付给我风险酬金的，朋友。"
G["I'm close to the edge, Morphalius. Another screw up and it'll be you running through that portal for Kaftiz's tests."]="我靠近边缘了，莫法鲁斯。接下来就该你跑过传送门了，为卡弗提兹的测试作实验吧。"
G["I'm closing soon, so buy while you can!"]="我要关门了，要买东西就赶快啊！"
G["I'm cold, lord.  When will you keep your promise?"]="我很冷，大人。你什么时候才能兑现你的诺言？"
G["I'm coming Frostwolf, and this time you're gonna feel the flames!"]="我来了，霜狼的渣滓们，这次让你们尝尝火焰的滋味！"
G["I'm coming for you, Deathwing!"]="我就是为你来的，死亡之翼！"
G["I'm coming, boss!"]="我来了，老大！"
G["I'm coming, master!"]="我来了，主人！"
G["I'm completely out of supplies and the road is blocked by orcs, just my luck!"]="我已经彻底弹尽粮绝了，而道路又遭到了兽人的封锁，我的运气可真好啊！"
G["I'm concentrating... can you bother someone else?"]="我正在集中精神……你能不能去烦别人？"
G["I'm confident you will be able to help us."]="我相信你能帮助我们。"
G["I'm confiscating this suspicious grain, Perelli. We were looking for signs of tampered food, and it would be in your best interest to stay put while Prince Arthas checks this out."]="我要没收这批可疑的谷物，皮雷利。我们奉命寻找被动过手脚的粮食，阿尔萨斯王子会亲自介入此事，你最好合作一点，呆在原地哪儿都别去。"
G["I'm confused as to how these raiders are constantly able to assail us no matter how many of them we kill."]="我很奇怪，这些袭击者为什么能不计伤亡地拼命攻击我们。"
G["I'm countin' on it!"]="我就指望这个了！"
G["I'm cryin' here! Please, make the funny stop!"]="我非常伤心！就别开玩笑了！"
G["I'm curious, of course, but what's done is done.\n\nWe wouldn't want to stir up any unneccesary panic. That simply wouldn't be prudent!"]="我当然很好奇，但过去的就让它过去吧。\n\n我们可不该再引起什么不必要的恐慌。那可一点儿都不明智！"
G["I'm cursed!  First my ship sinks, and now...I'm out of mead!"]="我真倒霉！先是船沉了，现在……又没酒喝了！"
G["I'm dead serious.  I've completely forgotten."]="我是认真的。我完全忘记了。"
G["I'm dead! Murdered by the Twilight's Hammer."]="我死了！被暮光之锤杀死了。"
G["I'm doin' everything I can!"]="我已经竭尽全力了！"
G["I'm doing Chain Lightning!! pew pew..."]="我在施放闪电链！！啾啾……"
G["I'm done for!"]="我完蛋了！"
G["I'm done for... too much blood lost... Forget about me, tell Keller... People still alive inside..."]="我……不行了……失血过多……别管我了，告诉凯勒……还有人在里面……"
G["I'm done here."]="事情办好啦。"
G["I'm done with the brawling ring.  These days, I am looking for a different kind of ring."]="我已经戴够拳手戒指了。最近，我正想找个别的戒指戴戴。"
G["I'm done with this pylon.  On to the next."]="这座塔已经搞定了。下一个。"
G["I'm done working in this heat!"]="我一直被迫在高温环境中工作！"
G["I'm done, $g brotha:sista;. Finish up yerself. I'll be restin' meself back on the rock."]="完成了，我的$g兄弟:姐妹;，接下来就是你的事情了。我要去休息一会儿。"
G["I'm down!  You must defeat him on your own!"]="我不行了！你只能靠自己的力量打败他了！"
G["I'm downsizing the cartel, starting with you!"]="财阀要裁员了，就从你开始！"
G["I'm dry! Gotta get some more!"]="我渴死啦！再来点儿！"
G["I'm dying..."]="我快死了……"
G["I'm extremely busy, $r.\n\nWe have a terrible problem on our hands that must be dealt with at once!"]="我非常忙，$r。\n\n我们现在有一个非常棘手的问题需要立刻解决！"
G["I'm fairly alarmed here."]="我在这里很紧张。"
G["I'm far too busy to be playing 'guess the smell' with you, $r. State your business or get out of my sight!"]="我太忙了，根本没有时间来陪你玩什么游戏， $r。有事就说，没事就从我眼前消失！"
G["I'm feeling better already."]="我已经好多了。"
G["I'm feeling ill..."]="我要吐了……"
G["I'm feeling much better already."]="我已经觉得好多了。"
G["I'm feeling playful.  Bring me another Infernal!"]="我觉得很好玩。再给我一个地狱火！"
G["I'm fighting you? Wow this competition is going to be easier than I thought."]="我跟你打？哇哦，这场对决比我想得还要简单。"
G["I'm fiiiighting!"]="我要战斗！"
G["I'm fine, thank you.  You asked for me?"]="我很好，谢谢你。你在找我？"
G["I'm fine... but it looks like our friend $p here is completely covered. Let me go get help..."]="Estoy bien... pero parece que $gnuestro amigo:nuestra amiga; $p aquí presente está completamente $gimpregnado:impregnada;. Iré a buscar ayuda..."
G["I'm finished.  The parchment is made.  Now, return to Gorzeeki..."]="完成啦。羊皮纸终于做好啦。现在回到戈瑟奇那儿去吧……"
G["I'm flattered, but really I'm not interested... What?  You want to know where to learn enchanting?  Oh, how embarrassing!  Well, you should...  I'm sure you could... go see, um...  Taladan!  Yes, see Taladan over in the Craftsmen's Terrace!"]="过奖了，但我真的不感兴趣……什么？你想知道在哪儿能学习附魔知识吗？哦，真令人为难！呃，你应该……我想你应该……去找那个，嗯……塔兰丹！对，去工匠区找塔兰丹！"
G["I'm flesh and blood again! Thank you, $c!"]="我又变回血肉之躯啦！谢谢你，$c！"
G["I'm flesh and blood again. That's all that matters!"]="我又变回血肉之躯啦。这才是最重要的！"
G["I'm flipping the second switch!"]="我要打开第二个开关了！"
G["I'm flirting as hard as I can, but I don't think he's getting the message!"]="我使出浑身解数调情，但我想他没收到讯息！"
G["I'm forever in your debt, hero."]="Estaré en deuda contigo eternamente, $ghéroe:heroína;."
G["I'm free!"]="我自由了！"
G["I'm free!  That device shall never torment me again!"]="我自由了！那东西再也不能折磨我了！"
G["I'm free!  The spirit of water returns to my people.  It will bring us the wisdom we need to survive in this harsh land.  I am in your debt, $n."]="我自由了！水流之灵将回到族人身边去。在它的指引下，我们终将在这片荒芜的土地上生存下去。我欠你一个人情，$n。"
G["I'm free!  You've saved me!"]="我自由了！是你救了我！"
G["I'm free! I owe you my life!"]="我自由了！是你救了我！"
G["I'm free! I'm really free!"]="我自由了！我真的自由了！"
G["I'm free! Long live the Alliance!"]="我自由了！联盟万岁！"
G["I'm free! Quickly, enact Quetz'lun's Revenge. I'll meet you afterward at Zim'Torga."]="我自由了！快，为奎丝鲁恩复仇。我稍后会和你在希姆托加碰面。"
G["I'm free! Thank you all!"]="我自由了！感谢你们！"
G["I'm free! Thank you!"]="我自由了！谢谢你！"
G["I'm free?  I'm free!"]="我自由了？我自由了！"
G["I'm freed! Thank you."]="我自由了！谢谢你。"
G["I'm from the Alliance. We're here to save you and rebuild your village."]="我来自联盟。我们是来救你们的，帮忙重建村庄。"
G["I'm from the Highbank advance unit, trying to win over the Wildhammer here at Thundermar.\n\nI think I can help them out, but can you believe that they don't have a single tri-cyclic alternating current re-polarization device? Not a one!\n\nHow do they even get by?"]="我是来自滩头堡的先遣单位，正在试图说服桑德玛尔的蛮锤部族。\n\n我想我能帮助他们，但令人难以置信的是，他们竟然没有一个三环交流极向转换装置？一个都没有！\n\n他们这些日子到底是过来的？"
G["I'm from the Horde. We're here to save you and rebuild your village."]="我来自部落。我们是来救你们，并帮你们重建村庄的。"
G["I'm full of surprises!"]="我有很多惊喜要给你们！"
G["I'm gathering funds to build a monument in honor of those who've died in the war.  It is important to not forget the sacrifices we've made to achieve victory.\n\nWe are $3275w percent done with this goal."]="我正在收集捐款，为那些在战争中牺牲的勇士们建造一座纪念碑。对我们来说，铭记这些为了取得胜利而牺牲的伙伴是非常有意义的。\n\n我们的目标完成率已经达到了百分之$3275w。"
G["I'm gettin' a little woozy... Oooooof..."]="我有点头晕……呕……"
G["I'm getting a little worried. Where is this hero that is supposed to lead us into battle?"]="我有些担心。原本应该站出来领导我们的英雄在哪儿？"
G["I'm getting fat and lazy just standing around here. I need some action!"]="待在这儿，我只会变得又胖又懒。我得找点事情做做！"
G["I'm getting out of here!"]="我要离开这儿了！"
G["I'm getting ready to travel up the ridge, $n. I could use some help -- would you like to come with me?"]="我准备出发了，$n。我需要一些帮助——你愿意跟我来吗？"
G["I'm getting rusty... and my lockpicks are too apparently.  Do me a favor, don't let Ren know you found me here, kay?"]="我的技术大不如前……开锁工具显然也生锈了。帮我个忙，别让任知道你在这里找到我了，行吗？"
G["I'm getting too old for this!  There's too many of them!\n\n<Fleet Master Seahorn pauses to catch his breath.>\n\nWhat am I saying?  There's not enough of them!  HAVE AT YOU, YOU MANGY CURS!"]="我已经老了！他们人数太多了！\n\n<舰队指挥官卡拉·海角停下来喘了口气。>\n\n我在说什么？他们人数太少了！去死吧，你们这群下贱的杂种！"
G["I'm giving her all that I've got, captain. I don't think she can take much more of this!"]="我把我手里的都给了她，队长。我觉得她拿不下了！"
G["I'm glad Taretha is alive. We now must find a way to free her from her magical bindings."]="我很高兴塔蕾莎还活着，现在我们必须找到一个方法把她从魔法禁锢中解救出来。"
G["I'm glad that these \"SI:7\" people decided to take me with.\n\nWe do not leave the comforts of our lake very often at all. This was the farthest I've ever been from home."]="Me alegro de que esta gente del \"IV:7\" decidieran llevarme con ellos.\n\nNormalmente no solemos abandonar las comodidades de nuestro lago. Esto es lo más lejos que he estado nunca de mi casa."
G["I'm glad that you're here to help, $c. The faster we can deal with these trolls, the faster we'll get to send the scourge back to where they came from."]="我很高兴你来这里帮忙，$c。我们越早解决这些巨魔，就能越早去把天灾军团赶回他们来的地方。"
G["I'm glad the commotions died down some around here. The last thing this place needs is another brawl."]="我很高兴看到骚乱被平息了下去。"
G["I'm glad to hear we're fighting along side the Stonemother herself this time."]="我真高兴这次竟然能和石母并肩作战。"
G["I'm glad to see that there's still some left, after what happened in the Jade Forest."]="在翡翠林发生了这么多事以后，我很高兴看到这里还有一些锦鱼人。"
G["I'm glad to see that you're well."]="很高兴看到你平安无事。"
G["I'm glad to see you contribute to the war effort. But I need supplies. What have you got?"]="你对战争的积极令人欣慰。但我需要补给。你有什么？"
G["I'm glad we had this talk."]="这次谈话很愉快。"
G["I'm glad you are here, $c. The military situation in the Sunwell Plateau is rather grim."]="我真高兴能在这里看见你，$c。目前太阳之井高地一带的战略状况非常糟糕。"
G["I'm glad you are here, friend!\n\nThe fires have driven the wildlife to seek shelter in this grove. They can run no farther. We must protect the survivors!"]="¡Me alegro de que estés aquí, $gamigo:amiga;!\n\nLos incendios han obligado a la fauna a refugiarse en esta arboleda. No pueden huir más lejos. ¡Debemos proteger a los supervivientes!"
G["I'm glad you asked, Yin. Liu Lang explored the world his entire life, and raised many children here on the Wandering Isle."]="很高兴你提出了这个问题，尹。刘浪一生都在探索世界，还在迷踪岛上养育了许多子女。"
G["I'm glad you here to watch me back. I don't like da look of Garrosh's goons."]="很高兴有你掩护我。我讨厌加尔鲁什的恶棍。"
G["I'm glad you saw that one!"]="还好你留意到那只蓝龙啦！"
G["I'm glad you're at least that perceptive."]="你至少有些洞察力。"
G["I'm glad you're here!  Because I need your help!!"]="我很高兴你在这里！我需要你的帮助！！"
G["I'm glad you're here! Proudmoore needs all the reinforcements she can get. Are you ready to go?"]="很高兴你能来！普罗德摩尔急需援军。你准备好出发了吗？"
G["I'm glad you're out here with us, $n. It's not easy getting stuff from naga!"]="很高兴你能和我们在一起，$n。对付纳迦可不是一件容易的事！"
G["I'm glad you're safe, Taretha. None of this would have been possible without your friends. They made all of this happen."]="我很高兴你安全了，塔蕾莎。要是没有你的朋友们的帮助，这一切是不可能发生的。"
G["I'm goin' in manually! There's gotta be a way!"]="我要靠手动拆开它！一定有办法的！"
G["I'm going ahead to see if there's anything I can do to help."]="我先走了，看有什么要帮忙的。"
G["I'm going ahead. I will see you on the other side... I hope."]="我要出发了。我们到另一边再见…但愿如此。"
G["I'm going back inside.  Let me know if anything else comes up."]="我回里面去了。要是有什么其它事情，告诉我一声。"
G["I'm going back to the Rookery, Tinkee.  I need an Eggscilliscope!"]="我要返回龙蛋房了，丁奇。我需要一个龙蛋冷冻器！"
G["I'm going deaf. That big green harpy won't shut up for five seconds. I know how to drive this thing, all right? I'm not an idiot!"]="如果这只绿色的大怪物在五秒钟之内不安静下来，我就要聋掉了。我知道该如何操纵这家伙。我可不是白痴！"
G["I'm going in after Erunak, and if you're half the $r you say you are you'll come too!"]="我要去追埃鲁纳克，如果你真的是个$r，你一定也会来的！"
G["I'm going in after Erunak... alone if I have to!"]="我去找埃鲁纳克……必要的话我只能自己去！"
G["I'm going to ask Tina to come with me next time, she'd LOVE these plants!"]="我下次一定要带上迪娜，她会爱死这些植物的！"
G["I'm going to be giving the prince a haircut tomorrow. Would you like to come and meet him, Ana?"]="我明天要去帮王子殿下理发。你愿意来见见他吗，安娜？"
G["I'm going to beat you all with my latest invention! It's a carrot on a stick!"]="我要用我的新发明打败你们。它是一个棍子上的胡萝卜！"
G["I'm going to beat you all with my latest invention! It's a checkpoint position finder!"]="我要用我的新发明打败你们。它是一个检查点查找器！"
G["I'm going to beat you all with my latest invention! It's a wind funneler!"]="我要用我的新发明打败你们。它是一个风动器！"
G["I'm going to beat you all with my latest invention. It's a cloud magnet!"]="我要用我的新发明打败你们。它是一个吸云石！"
G["I'm going to beat you all with my latest invention. It's a quick flag extractor!"]="我要用我的新发明打败你们。它是一个快速摘旗器！"
G["I'm going to beat you all with my latest invention. It's a remote control rider unseater!"]="我要用我的新发明打败你们。它是一个遥控骑手弹射器！"
G["I'm going to beat you very, very slowly."]="我会慢慢、慢慢地打你。"
G["I'm going to bet that you only killed four."]="我打赌你只杀了四个。"
G["I'm going to break every bone in your body!"]="我要打断你身上的每根骨头！"
G["I'm going to bring the venom sac to Ricket... and then... you know... collapse. Thank you for helping me!"]="我本来想把毒囊交给莉吉特的……接着……你也知道了……我倒下了。谢谢你帮我！"
G["I'm going to carefully mix this - oops! ...Well, I spilled a little, but it's ready!"]="我要小心地配制这种——啊！……嗯，洒了一些出来，但是已经做好了！"
G["I'm going to choke the life out of you, you little brats!"]="小兔崽子，我要你不得好死！"
G["I'm going to cover, you blow them up!"]="我来掩护，你去干掉他们！"
G["I'm going to die here... I just know it."]="我一定会死在这里的……我心里很清楚。"
G["I'm going to die, I just know it!"]="我快要死了，我心里很清楚！"
G["I'm going to dust you into oblivion!"]="我会让你灰飞烟灭！"
G["I'm going to enjoy this."]="我想我会喜欢的。"
G["I'm going to enjoy this..."]="我喜欢战斗……"
G["I'm going to figure out what this shadowy group is up to no matter what!"]="我要查出那些家伙的真正计划！"
G["I'm going to give Shado-Master Chong a piece of my mind when I see him. The nerve of the Shado-Pan not coming to our aid!"]="等我见到影踪派翀大师，我会把自己的智慧分一点给他。影踪派的勇气帮不了我们！"
G["I'm going to gut the lookouts that scouted these reefs!  We walked right into their blasted trap!"]="我要军法处置负责侦查这片海域的斥候！我们钻进了一个大圈套！"
G["I'm going to have to kill something, aren't I?"]="我要杀一些东西，是吗？"
G["I'm going to keep looking for jade. May want to ask around and see if anyone could use a hand."]="我继续去寻找玉石了。你可以四处问问，看有没有人需要帮手。"
G["I'm going to kick yer ugly head in!"]="我要把你彻底打败！"
G["I'm going to knock you out cold!"]="我要让你冷晕过去！"
G["I'm going to let him know right away. Meet us at Sable Ridge."]="我这就去让他知道。我们在漆黑山脊见面吧。"
G["I'm going to lose my on time bonus because of this!"]="不知道会因此耽搁多少时间呢！"
G["I'm going to make a break for safety. Thank you."]="安全起见，我这就离开。谢谢你。"
G["I'm going to make a fortune with these horns, $n.  Thanks!"]="这些牛角会给我带来好运的，$n。太感谢你了！"
G["I'm going to miss Camp Winterhoof, but I understand why Chieftain Ashtotem made his decision. Home is a comfort we cannot always afford."]="我会很想念冬蹄营地的，但是我能理解灰烬图腾酋长做出的决定。我们没有能力永远维持家园这个温暖的港湾。"
G["I'm going to miss out on a lot of the trick-or-treating!"]="我要错过“不给糖果就捣乱”了！"
G["I'm going to miss out on trick-or-treating because I can't go out!"]="我太伤心了！万圣节到了，我却没法出去，不能玩要糖果的恶作剧游戏！"
G["I'm going to miss you so much, $n!  Promise that you'll come to see me."]="我会想你的，$n！答应我你会经常回来看我。"
G["I'm going to my room. Feel free to tell my aunt about how you \"heroically\" saved me from myself or whatever."]="Me voy a mi habitación. No te cortes a la hora de contarle a mi tía cómo me has salvado \"heroicamente\" de mí mismo o algo por el estilo."
G["I'm going to name my firstborn $n."]="我会给我的长子起名叫$n。"
G["I'm going to need more parts soon."]="我还需要更多的零件。"
G["I'm going to need to research what we've learned here, $n."]="我需要进一步研究我们的发现，$n。"
G["I'm going to need you to do something else in a moment."]="一会儿我还有点别的事要你做。"
G["I'm going to punch that dragon right in the face!"]="我要一拳砸扁那头龙的脸！"
G["I'm going to put in for hazard pay."]="我要申请危险补助。"
G["I'm going to return to help free the rest of the slaves.  Thank you again, hero."]="Voy a volver para ayudar a liberar a los demás esclavos. Gracias de nuevo, $ghéroe:heroína;."
G["I'm going to return to the front of the quarry. Kill a few extra for me."]="我要回到采石场前线去。帮我多杀几个。"
G["I'm going to search you, citizen."]="我要搜查你，公民。"
G["I'm going to send you back to the Lich King in pieces!"]="我要把你切得粉碎，送还给巫妖王！"
G["I'm going to stay and do what I can to free these spiders. Thank you for your help, $n."]="我会留下，想办法释放这些蜘蛛。谢谢你的帮助，$n。"
G["I'm going to stay here until I catch a 68 Pound Grouper!  You on the other hand want to fly off somewhere, am I right?"]="我要一直待在这里直到钓到68磅重的石斑鱼！你却要离开到什么地方去，是不是？"
G["I'm going to stop by  to inform Tyrande and Malfurion of our progress.  I'll meet you at the beach as soon as I can."]="我会向泰兰德和玛法里奥报告我们的进展。我会尽快与你在海滩会合。"
G["I'm going to take a short nap.  Do you think you can handle the ship while she's not moving?"]="我去打个瞌睡。你觉得自己能在飞船停泊期间控制好她吗？"
G["I'm going to take you down to pain town."]="我要让你掉进痛苦的陷坑里。"
G["I'm going to tear your heart out, cupcake!"]="看我怎么把你揍趴下，菜鸟！"
G["I'm going to the infirmary!"]="我要去医院！"
G["I'm going to throttle you as soon as I get out of here, Wizzle!"]="只要我一出去，我就立刻把你掐死，维兹！"
G["I'm going to train you to help $n with a very important task. After that, I promise you'll be free to return home."]="为了帮助$n完成一个非常重要的任务，我要训练你一下。然后，我保证会让你重获自由。"
G["I'm going to try to get out of here now.  Thank you!"]="我正打算离开这里呢，谢谢你！"
G["I'm going to turn you to ash if you don't work faster!"]="如果你们再这样慢吞吞的，我就把你们变成一堆灰烬！"
G["I'm going to wear your skin as a smoking jacket! The stogies? You'll have to pry them from my cold dead... er... RAWR!!!!"]="我要把你的皮当作便服来穿！长靴呢？你得将它们从那儿撬下来！！！！"
G["I'm going to wreck you!"]="我要消灭你！"
G["I'm going to wring some of this beer out of my clothes. You go on ahead, find Mudmug."]="我要把衣服里的酒水拧掉一些。你们继续前进，去找泥盏。"
G["I'm going too! See you there, $p."]="我也去！在那儿见，$p。"
G["I'm going. I'm going!"]="我这就去干活儿。我这就去！"
G["I'm gonna catch you!"]="我要抓住你！"
G["I'm gonna come at you like an avalanche!"]="我要像雪崩一样碾碎你！"
G["I'm gonna come down there and kill you good, $r!"]="我要杀了你，$r！"
G["I'm gonna cook ya, an' then I'm gonna eat ya!"]="我会把你煮熟并吃掉！"
G["I'm gonna crush you! I'm the Trade Prince! Me! I gotta plan that's gonna get me off of this island and make me the king of Azshara!"]="我要毁掉你！我是贸易大王！我有个计划能让我离开这个岛，并成为艾萨拉之王！"
G["I'm gonna drown! Help!"]="我要淹死了！救命！"
G["I'm gonna go find some ointment."]="我要去找些药膏来。"
G["I'm gonna go play."]="我要去玩了。"
G["I'm gonna have to give this one the big N-O."]="答案很简单，看我口型：没门。"
G["I'm gonna jump this time, Brote. I swear it!"]="这次我一定会跳的，布鲁特。我发誓！"
G["I'm gonna light you up, sweet cheeks!"]="我要把你们烤熟了！"
G["I'm gonna need a cleanup and a new assistant over here!"]="等我处理完收尾工作，就换个新助手！"
G["I'm gonna need me a good ol' tiddlywink after this!"]="等这结束之后，我可一定要好好喝上几杯！"
G["I'm gonna need some help with this $n!"]="我需要$n的一些帮助！"
G["I'm gonna punch that dragon in the face!"]="我要一拳砸扁那头龙的脸！"
G["I'm gonna run."]="我要跑了。"
G["I'm gonna shiver your timbers!"]="我将踏平你的树林！"
G["I'm gonna spill your guts, mon!"]="我要把你碎尸万断！"
G["I'm gonna train that one myself."]="我要亲自调教那匹马。"
G["I'm gonna turn ya' blood ta venom!"]="我要把你的血变成剧毒！"
G["I'm gonna' enjoy killin' these slack-jawed daffodils!"]="我要好好享受一下把你们这群傻瓜蛋杀光的感觉！"
G["I'm grateful to you, friend."]="Te estoy muy agradecido, $gamigo:amiga;."
G["I'm gravely wounded... I cannot hold..."]="我伤得很重……我坚持不住了……"
G["I'm guessing you know something about what just happened?"]="我猜你知道刚才发生了什么？"
G["I'm halfway there! Keep the Horde away from here.  They don't teach fighting in engineering school!"]="我就要完成了！挡住那帮部落的家伙。他们可不是在工程学校进行战斗教学！"
G["I'm happy to see you too, Grim! It looks like not all strangers are to be feared after all, huh, Grim? Terenthis shall reward this adventurer well."]="锐爪，我也很高兴能见到你！看来并非所有陌生人都是有敌意的，对吧？特伦希斯一定会好好地奖赏这位冒险者的。"
G["I'm heading back now."]="我要回去了。"
G["I'm heading back now. I'll let the baron know that you liberated me."]="我要回去了。我会告诉男爵大人，是你救了我的性命。"
G["I'm heading back to the Argent Vanguard through Dalaran if you'd like to return with me, hero."]="我正打算从达拉然返回银色前线基地。英雄，你愿意与我同行吗？"
G["I'm heading to the wound. Try to keep these beasts off of me."]="我要赶到伤口那里去。别让那些野兽靠近我。"
G["I'm helping a friend brew some beer, and we need hops. Do you have any to spare?"]="我在帮一个朋友酿造啤酒，需要用啤酒花。能给我一点吗？"
G["I'm helping!"]="我很乐意帮忙！"
G["I'm here for cooking training."]="我是来学习烹饪的。"
G["I'm here for the gold."]="我是来拿金子的。"
G["I'm here for the order of red blossom leeks."]="我是来拿订好的红韭花的。"
G["I'm here on behalf of Warlord Bloodhilt, who wants you to know he will be arriving shortly."]="我代表血柄督军前来通知你，他很快就到。"
G["I'm here to aid the Captain."]="我是来帮助上尉的。"
G["I'm here to challenge you in combat."]="我来向你发起战斗的挑战。"
G["I'm here to challenge you!"]="我是来挑战你的！"
G["I'm here to clean up the mess that stems from the Skumblade saurok.\n\nWhile theirs is a different type of mess than I'm accustomed to, there are certainly several similarities."]="我是来清理邪刃蜥蜴人留下的烂摊子的。\n\n虽然我从未见过它们这样的烂摊子，但其中肯定有相似之处。"
G["I'm here to deal with the disease and plague that stems from the Skumblade saurok.\n\nWhile theirs is a different type of plague than I'm accustomed to, there are certainly several similarities."]="我是来处理邪刃蜥蜴人造成的疾病和瘟疫的。\n\n虽然我从没见过这种瘟疫，但它们肯定有一些相似之处。"
G["I'm here to escort a delivery to Kirthaven."]="我来这里是为了护送去库斯海文的人。"
G["I'm here to help with that fancy beer you was talkin' about."]="我是来帮忙酿造你们说的那种神奇啤酒的。"
G["I'm here to help you with your combat training, golem."]="我是来此帮你进行作战训练的，魔像。"
G["I'm here to make sure the job gets done on time.\n\nBooty Bay is still trying to recover from the tidal wave!\n\nThe last thing we need is a horde of rampaging trolls, zombie trolls, poisonous serpents or crazed panthers attacking us."]="我到此来监督工作顺利完成。\n\n藏宝海湾仍在努力从潮汐的冲洗中恢复！\n\n这时候我们可不想遭到一大群暴怒巨魔、僵尸巨魔、毒蛇或发狂猎豹的攻击。"
G["I'm here to mine, you're here to fight. Get it straight!"]="我到这里来是为了挖矿，你到这里来是为了战斗。明白了吗！"
G["I'm here to pick up seeds for Farmer Yoon."]="我来这儿是为农夫老愚挑选种子的。"
G["I'm here to put an end to your killing."]="我来此终止你的杀戮行为。"
G["I'm here to represent Booty Bay's interest in this expedition.\n\nIf things go bad, Booty Bay is in trouble.\n\nWe are still recovering from the events of the cataclysm."]="我到这里来的目的是为了确保藏宝海湾在这次探险中的利益。\n\n如果进展不顺利，藏宝海湾也会有麻烦。\n\n我们仍在努力从大灾难中恢复过来。"
G["I'm here to rescue you."]="我是来救你的。"
G["I'm here to retrieve your report."]="我是来拿你的报告的。"
G["I'm here to study the ways of the muisek spirits, the wild magic. Witch Doctor Uzeri sent me here to start practicing with the lesser creatures of the forest."]="我来这里是为了研究灵魂精华——野性魔法的作用方式。巫医尤克里派我来从森林里的低等生物入手。"
G["I'm here!  Come and get me you alliance pansies!"]="我在这儿！过来和我作战，你们这些联盟的懦夫！"
G["I'm here, Leza."]="我在这儿，莱莎。"
G["I'm here, commander."]="我在这里，长官。"
G["I'm hesitant to ask an outsider for help. Still, if you're offering..."]="我不想麻烦外人帮忙。但要是你乐意……"
G["I'm hiding until you leave!"]="我要躲起来，直到你们离开！"
G["I'm hit! Leave me - finish that thing off!"]="我受伤了！别管我——去干掉它！"
G["I'm honor-bound to get these supplies to the Crossroads. Pitch in or step aside."]="我要将这些物资运到十字路口，这事关我的荣誉。如果你不想帮忙，就站开一些。"
G["I'm honored to fight alongside of you, $n!"]="我很荣幸能和你并肩作战，$n！"
G["I'm honored to meet you, $n, but your skill at potions is greater than my own. Go see Doctor Herbert Halsey, an undead in the Apothecarium of the Undercity. He can help you from now on."]="见到你是我的荣幸，$n，但是你在配制药水方面比我厉害。去幽暗城 炼金房找亡灵赫伯特·哈尔希医生。他能帮助你。"
G["I'm hoping this is the breakthrough that will allow us to pack more explosive power into a smaller bomb."]="希望这个突破性的进展能让我们在更小的炸弹中装入更多的炸药。"
G["I'm hurt - do not back down."]="我受伤了——别后退。"
G["I'm hurt - don't back down."]="我受伤了——别后退。"
G["I'm hurt! Go on without me."]="我受伤了！不要管我，继续前进。"
G["I'm hurt! PH"]="我受伤了！"
G["I'm hurt, but I can still run.  Thank you, stranger."]="Estoy herido, pero aún puedo correr. Gracias, $gextraño:extraña;."
G["I'm impressed Gregory.  I must admit, I had not expected such restraint."]="令人印象深刻，格雷戈里。我必须承认，我从未料想过你能如此克制。"
G["I'm in bad shape, $n. My injuries...I...I'll try to hang on a bit longer. Get me out of here, please."]="我的情况很糟糕，$n。我的伤……我会努力多坚持一会儿的。带我离开这儿，拜托了。"
G["I'm in charge of the workers that support the Tauren Chieftains.\nYou know: packing, driving, and unpacking the wagons, building and taking down the stage, setting up the pyrotechnics, all that sort of thing."]="Estoy al mando de los trabajadores que acompañan a los Tauren Chieftains.\n\nYa sabes: cargar, conducir y descargar los vagones, montar y desmontar el escenario, colocar la pirotecnia y ese tipo de cosas."
G["I'm in charge of this operation.\n\nI don't want to hear any yammering about our transport exploding or our enemies being taller than we are. We're professionals and we're getting this job done without a hitch."]="我是这次行动的负责人。\n\n我可不想听到有人因为我们的运输工具爆炸，或者是敌人比我们高之类的无聊事情而抱怨。我们是专业人士，要一丝不苟地完成工作。"
G["I'm in jeopardy! Help me if you can!"]="我被攻击了！我需要援助！"
G["I'm in my group and ready to teleport to Mogu'Shan Palace!"]="我已组好队伍，准备好被传送到魔古山宫殿了！"
G["I'm in my group and ready to teleport to Temple of the Jade Serpent!"]="我已组好队伍，准备好被传送到青龙寺了！"
G["I'm in my group and ready to teleport to the Blackrock Caverns!"]="我已组好队伍，准备好被传送到黑石岩窟了！"
G["I'm in my group and ready to teleport to the Halls of Lightning!"]="我已经组好队伍，准备进入闪电大厅了！"
G["I'm in my group and ready to teleport to the Halls of Stone!"]="我已经组满队伍，准备前往岩石大厅！"
G["I'm in my group and ready to teleport to the Throne of the Tides!"]="我在小队中，并已准备好传送到潮汐王座！"
G["I'm in my group and ready to teleport to the Vortex Pinnacle!"]="我在小队中，并已准备好传送到旋云之巅！"
G["I'm in need of your skill as a blacksmith, Koren."]="我想要学习你的铁匠技术，库雷恩。"
G["I'm in your debt, $c."]="我欠你一个人情，$c。"
G["I'm in your debt, stranger. Please let me help you."]="Te debo una, $gforastero:forastera;. Por favor, permíteme ayudarte."
G["I'm in your debt, stranger. Thank you."]="Te debo una, $gforastero:forastera;. Gracias."
G["I'm in."]="我参加。"
G["I'm inclined to say they made ogres too big! I can see I'm not going to convince you to move now, but don't think this is permanent!"]="我想说，食人魔的体型也太大了吧！好吧，我打消说服你挪动地方的念头，不过这只是暂时的！"
G["I'm injured! I need to rest a bit."]="我受伤了！我需要休息一下。"
G["I'm innocent. Innocent I tell you! The Cataclysm isn't my fault!"]="我是无辜的！无辜的听到没有！大灾变不是我的错！"
G["I'm interested in purchasing a new drake."]="我想要购买一只新的幼龙。"
G["I'm interested."]="好吧。"
G["I'm itchin' to shoot somethin'!"]="我要开枪打点什么！"
G["I'm jumping jack in Gilneas on the spot!"]="我正在吉尔尼斯跳爆竹！"
G["I'm jumpy as it is... and people insist on scaring me... Next time, though, I'll be ready!"]="我总是战战兢兢……人们还在不断吓我……但是下次，我会有所准备的！"
G["I'm just a little grummle in a scary world."]="我只是这个可怕世界里的一个渺小的土地精。"
G["I'm just a pathetic creature of meat and brew."]="我只不过是个胡吃海喝的可怜虫。"
G["I'm just a rock. Nothing to see here."]="我只是一块石头。这里没什么好看的。"
G["I'm just a student myself, really. Rhiannon's the expert. She's standing by the crates over there. You can learn a lot from her."]="我只是个学生。雷安诺才是专家。她站在那边的箱子旁。你可以从她那儿学到很多东西。"
G["I'm just about to close..."]="我要关门了……"
G["I'm just gettin' warmed up!"]="我刚才只是在热身！"
G["I'm just getting warmed up!"]="哈哈，我正好刚刚完成热身！"
G["I'm just going to say it: you're fat."]="Lo voy a decir sin más: estás $ggordo:gorda;."
G["I'm just happy to have known you while I lived, Martek."]="很高兴能够在活着的时候认识你，马特克。"
G["I'm just letting you win."]="我是故意让你赢的。"
G["I'm just nervous.  Sorry."]="我只是有些紧张。很抱歉。"
G["I'm just trying to enjoy my drink."]="我只想好好地喝一杯。"
G["I'm just walking along, cataloging the local wildlife here in Azuremst, when suddenly...\nBAM! <Mojo mimicks an explosion with his hands.>\nI don't think I've ever heard an explosion that loud in my life!"]="Estaba simplemente caminando, catalogando la fauna local de Bruma Azur, cuando de pronto...\n\n¡ZAS! <Mojo imita una explosión con sus manos.>\n\nCreo que jamás he escuchado una explosión tan potente en toda mi vida."
G["I'm keeping an eye on the forsaken idiots down there. You can never be too cautious around them!"]="我始终留意着这群白痴的一举一动。真是怎么提防都不为过！"
G["I'm keeping an eye on you."]="我盯着你呢……"
G["I'm keeping my eye on you $r."]="我盯着你呢，$r。"
G["I'm keeping my fields fallow this season. A wise farmer knows when the land needs to rest."]="我打算让我的田休耕一季。一个聪明的农夫知道什么时候该让土地休息。"
G["I'm learning how to speak Hozen, ookin' Wikkets! Jae-Sun Di Fo eated all my slickies. For that, I'll grook him in the dookers."]="我正在学说猢狲语，该死的蠢蛋！公孙镝甫吃光了我的鱼。我要狠狠揍他一顿。"
G["I'm leaving for the next rendezvous point in a few seconds."]="我立马就会出发去下一个集结点。"
G["I'm leaving now!"]="我现在就离开！"
G["I'm like some kind of fishing god..."]="我就像什么钓鱼之神那样……"
G["I'm listening."]="我在听。"
G["I'm listening..."]="我在听……"
G["I'm locking the door. Good luck, and thank you for doing this."]="我要锁上大门了。祝你们好运，感谢你们的帮助。"
G["I'm lonely.  I wish that there were more kids my age around here.  Sometimes I miss being at the orphanage in Shattrath City."]="我很寂寞。我希望在这里有更多的和我同龄的孩子。有时候，我真的很怀念在沙塔斯城孤儿院的日子。"
G["I'm lookin' for rogue trainin'."]="我想接受潜行者的训练。"
G["I'm looking for Tahet.  Let's get you out of these chains."]="我正在找塔赫特。我这就帮你摆脱这些锁链。"
G["I'm looking for a lost companion."]="我在寻找走失的小伙伴。"
G["I'm looking for a team player..."]="我正在寻找一个伙伴……"
G["I'm looking for all sorts of things honey!  But those marks you are talking about, the Keg Protector marks?  Those show me that you know how to handle yourself in a fight.\n\nEvery time you take down a Dark Iron dwarf, you get a mark.  For every mark you have, I'll give you a prize ticket.\n\nIt pains me to give these tickets away, but it also means I get to see you again, and see you leave again..."]="我在寻找各种各样的东西！不过你所说的那些印记，酒桶保护者的印记？那些东西可以证明你知道如何应付战斗。\n\n每当你打倒一个黑铁矮人，你就会得到一个印记。我会用一张奖券来交换你所得到的印记。\n\n给出这些奖券让我感到很痛苦，但它同样意味着我能再次看到你，不过还得看到你再次离开……"
G["I'm looking for some specialty goods. Let me browse your wares, Floyd."]="我想找些特产。让我看看你的货物，弗洛伊德。"
G["I'm looking for someone to help me with a task that is long overdue.\n\nYou look capable."]="我在找人来帮我完成那个拖了很久的任务。\n\n你似乎很适合。"
G["I'm looking for someone who may have stolen some supplies from Hearthglen.  Have any leads for me?"]="我正在寻找一个曾经在壁炉谷偷窃物资的贼。有什么线索么？"
G["I'm looking forward to gutting this one."]="我真想捅死这家伙。"
G["I'm losing control!"]="我就要失去控制了！"
G["I'm losing my mind. Can't keep my thoughts together..."]="我失去理智了。我没办法让精神集中起来……"
G["I'm lucky to be alive!"]="我还活着简直是个奇迹！"
G["I'm makin' a comeback!"]="我要翻盘！"
G["I'm making a list of all of the things that I can transform you into with my Super Adaptive Transformative Shape Changing Ray, Synge! I hope that you end up as something completely useless to match your pathetic life."]="我正在列出可以用超适应性变形射线把你变成哪些样子，赛恩格！我希望你最后能变成毫无用处的蠢货，来搭配你悲剧的人生。"
G["I'm melting... melting!"]="我在融化……融化！"
G["I'm moving back to the capital after this."]="这事儿完了之后，我一定要搬回主城去。"
G["I'm moving within the building"]="我在房屋之间移动"
G["I'm neither slim nor shady. As a matter of fact, I find both references insulting.\n\nNow, get out of my sight before I plant my staff up your backside."]="我既不瘦也不黑。实话实说，这两个词都是对我的侮辱。\n\n现在，在我把法杖插到你后背上之前赶紧给我消失。"
G["I'm never gunna be servin' da Lich King! Never!"]="我绝不向巫妖王效忠！绝不！"
G["I'm never on the... losing... side!"]="我绝不会落到……输的……那一边。"
G["I'm never too busy to speak to a stranger! Almost never, anyway..."]="我忙死了，不会跟陌生人讲话的！几乎从来不……"
G["I'm no happier about being your babysitter than you are about being watched. Just remember... it could have been worse."]="当你的保姆要比看着你更让我不爽。给我记住……要不是我的话，事情可能更糟糕。"
G["I'm no healer, but I'm priest to meet you!"]="我不是以治疗者而是牧师的身份来见你！"
G["I'm no orc lover but yea, wish he were here right now. He'd dismantle these things!"]="我对兽人没有好感，但是如果现在他在这里就好了。他能将这些家伙大卸八块！"
G["I'm not THAT snarky, am I?"]="我也没那——么尖刻，不是吗？"
G["I'm not a fighter. I grow vegetables and raise yaks.\n\nYou fight, I'll watch."]="我不是战士。我只是个种菜养牦牛的。\n\n你去打，我就看看。"
G["I'm not a journeyman herbalist -- am I able to still assist you in your work?"]="我不是个熟练的草药师，那么我还能帮上忙吗？"
G["I'm not a laborer. I'm here to free you from servitude in the mines."]="我不是工人。我是来解救你的，你不用再在矿井里干苦力了。"
G["I'm not about to let this Alliance scum steal back my prize."]="我绝不能让这个联盟恶棍把我的战利品偷回去。"
G["I'm not about to perpetuate your addiction. It certainly isn't my fault. Out."]="我不会让你这么沉迷下去的。这又不是我的过错。滚出去！"
G["I'm not about to train you until you prove yourself a friend to the draenei of the Exodar."]="No voy a instruirte hasta que demuestres ser $gamigo:amiga; de los draenei de El Exodar."
G["I'm not about to train you until you're exalted in the eyes of the draenei."]="No te voy a instruir hasta que seas $gexaltado:exaltada; a ojos de los draenei."
G["I'm not afraid a' you! Do you wanna' fight? Huh, do ya'? C'mon! I'll fight ya' with both paws behind my back!"]="我不怕你们！你们想打架？那就来呀！来呀！我不用前爪都可以打败你们！"
G["I'm not afraid of anything -- bring it on!"]="我什么都不怕——来吧！"
G["I'm not afraid of you!"]="我不怕你！"
G["I'm not afraid of you! Wait - who - who are you?"]="我可不怕你！等等……你……你是谁？"
G["I'm not amused by your audacity in coming to me for training. Go through the archway and down the ramp to the southeast, and talk to Doctor Martin Felben. He is a Forsaken who can teach you the basics."]="你如此大胆地跑来找我，想要接受训练，我对此可不高兴。穿过拱道，沿着坡道向东南方走，跟亡灵马丁·费尔本谈谈。他能教你一些基础知识。"
G["I'm not an abomination, I'm simply undead.  I just want to speak with you."]="我不是什么畸形的怪物，我只是个亡灵。我想和你谈谈。"
G["I'm not an actor."]="我不是个演员。"
G["I'm not blind, you know. I can see what's going on around here!"]="我又不是瞎子。我能看到真实的情况！"
G["I'm not certain we could organize our people to move even if we wanted to.  We've also received word of hostile elementals appearing randomly across the lands, sometimes in towns, sometimes across the countryside.  Moving may not be an option."]="虽然我们想要组织人民进行迁移，但我不知道是否能做得到。我们已经接到报告，元素出现在各个地方，向我们发动袭击。无论城镇还是郊野，无一能够幸免。迁移也许不是个好选择。"
G["I'm not certain where. Start with their western base overlooking Highperch."]="我不确定那是在哪里。一开始，是在他们西边的基地。那里能够俯瞰风巢。"
G["I'm not certain. Try asking Calia Hastings, by the docks. I'm told she has connections to SI:7."]="我不太确定。你可以到码头上去问问加莉亚·哈斯汀。我听说她和军情七处有联系。"
G["I'm not dead yet you scavenger!"]="我还没死呢，你这食腐怪！"
G["I'm not done yet, idiot!"]="你急什么，白痴！"
G["I'm not done yet."]="我还没完呢。"
G["I'm not falling for your tricks, $r. Victory shall be mine!"]="我才不会落入你的圈套，$r。胜利属于我！"
G["I'm not feeling so well..."]="我有些不适……"
G["I'm not fighting, so send me in now!"]="我没有在打架，所以赶紧给我找个人来打！"
G["I'm not finished with you!"]="我和你没完！"
G["I'm not finished yet! No, I have a few more tricks up my sleeve..."]="还没完！我还有几招没有用呢……"
G["I'm not flying a kite to Darnassus, wikket. I don't even know where that is! Take that portal over there."]="我可不会乘着风筝去达纳苏斯，无毛怪。我都不知道那地方在哪儿！用那儿的传送门吧。"
G["I'm not food!"]="我不是食物！"
G["I'm not going anywhere until I find her!"]="不找到她，我就哪儿都不去！"
G["I'm not going on alone, Taleris, and that's final. I'm going to wait here for the next group of pilgrims and set out with them when they depart."]="我不想一个人走，塔雷里斯。我会在这里等着下一批朝圣者，等他们到了之后和他们一起出发。"
G["I'm not going to run away!"]="我是不会逃跑的！"
G["I'm not gonna lie to you, soldiers. We're getting our butts kicked out there! Now which one of you is orc enough to do something about it?"]="我不想对你们说谎，士兵们。我们被打得屁滚尿流！有没有像兽人那样带种的，站出来去做点什么？"
G["I'm not gonna make it... death comes..."]="我做不到了……死亡已经迫近了……"
G["I'm not good with all this emotional feeling stuff, but thank you."]="我是一个不善于表达自己感情的人，不过谢谢你。"
G["I'm not here on vacation, pal. Noggenfogger sent me down here with a mission: Find out how to turn a profit on these silithid, or wipe 'em clean.\n\nIf a $r like you wants to do some favors for the Steamwheedle Cartel, I could use a hand."]="No estoy aquí de vacaciones, camarada. Tragonublo me ha enviado con una misión: averiguar cómo sacar beneficios de estos silítidos o borrarlos del mapa.\n\nSi $gun:una; $r como tú quiere hacerle un par de favores al Cártel Bonvapor, me vendría bien una mano."
G["I'm not here to be the keeper of your hatchlings, Dorian. I'm doing research of my own, as well."]="我凭什么要替你照顾龙崽啊，多里安。我还要搞研究工作呢。"
G["I'm not here to fight.  I've only been asked to speak with you."]="我不是来打架的。我只是奉命前来与你交谈。"
G["I'm not here to teach babes fresh out of the cradle. Ye've nowhere near the amount of skill I require in my students. In fact, ye're a sad figure of a $glad:lass;, an' I'll thank ye not to stand there jibber-jabberin' at me."]="我不是来教那些刚离开摇篮的宝宝的。你离我对学生的要求还差远了。你不过是个年幼的$g小伙子:姑娘;，你最好别在这儿烦我了。"
G["I'm not impressed."]="我根本没什么感觉。"
G["I'm not into any of that creepy stuff you like, Brazie. Just show me the \"legal\" wares."]="A mí no me gustan esas cosas raras como a ti, Brazie. Solo quiero que me enseñes las mercancías \"legales\"."
G["I'm not leaving these behind. This is my family's legacy!"]="我不会扔下这些不管的。这是我家族的遗产！"
G["I'm not leaving until those brewkegs finish their work."]="在那些饭桶完成他们的工作之前，我是不会离开的。"
G["I'm not looking to cause trouble, but if things don't change around here, you're going to have an insurrection on your hands."]="我不想惹麻烦，但是如果这里的情况还得不到改善，很快就会发生暴动的。"
G["I'm not made of fire totems, you know!"]="我可不是火焰图腾做的，这你知道！"
G["I'm not one for fightin' much. Pickin' up heavy stuff, sure... but my muscles get all weak an' wobbly when it comes to hittin' somethin'."]="我不是个好勇斗狠的人。搬运重物，小事一桩……但当我遇到不得已的情况时，我的肌肉也会把那些懦夫和流氓碾碎。"
G["I'm not out of the belly of this beast for more than two minutes and someone is already asking me about my bathroom behavior??? $G Mister:Missy;, I'd have smacked you silly for that question had you not been the one to rescue me!\n\nAnyhow! I'm grateful for the assistance. Maybe I can pay you back?"]="我才从这野兽的肚腹之中出来还不到两分钟，就有人问起我如厕的问题？？？$G先生:小姐;，如果你不是救我的那个人，我一定早就把你敲傻掉了！\n\n无论如何！我很感谢你的帮助。或许我能回报你？"
G["I'm not proud.  Since then, Kalecgos and I have talked at length about power, and how it should be used."]="我很惭愧。后来，我和卡雷苟斯就力量的使用进行了一次长谈。"
G["I'm not pulling anyone from anything! He can send all of the letters that he wants. I'm fully aware of his 'strategic' plan, and he knows that the Dame and I are in full agreement with what the Farstriders need to be doing. Once the Shadowpine trolls have been dealt with then, and only then, will we divert our attentions to Deatholme. I know that the scourge are the greater threat, but Tranquillien is going to have to hold them off for now. It would be suicide to ignore the trolls! Dismissed, Dusking."]="¡No pienso retirar a nadie de nada! Puede enviar todas las cartas que quiera. Soy totalmente consciente de su plan \"estratégico\", y sabe que la Dama y yo estamos totalmente de acuerdo con lo que tienen que hacer los Errantes. En cuanto nos hayamos ocupado de los trols Sombrapino, y solo entonces, desviaremos nuestra atención a la Ciudad de la Muerte. Sé que los miembros de la Plaga son la mayor amenaza, pero Tranquillien va a tener que mantenerlos a raya de momento. ¡Sería un suicidio ignorar a los trols! Retírate, Dusking."
G["I'm not quite convinced."]="这并不能让我完全信服。"
G["I'm not ready to die..."]="我还不想死……"
G["I'm not so naive as to believe your appeal for clemency, but I will listen."]="我不会因为你的可怜而手下留情，有话快说吧。"
G["I'm not so sure. I've heard that he's being trained as a paladin. Terenas hopes the Silver Hand can teach him some discipline. If anyone can set Arthas straight, it'd be old Uther."]="我不是很确定。我听说他正在接受圣骑士训练，泰瑞纳斯希望白银之手可以教会他一些纪律。如果这世上有人可以改变阿尔萨斯，那只有老乌瑟尔了。"
G["I'm not some trophy for a red dragon's mantle-piece, and I'm never going back."]="我不是什么红龙伟大事迹的活证，我可不会回去。"
G["I'm not supposed ta say anything 'bout this, but ye've got a face that says ye like a good Dwarven stout, so I trust ye!"]="本来这事儿我不应该告诉任何人的，但是你的脸长得就像矮人酒桶这么可爱，一定是个好人，所以我相信你！"
G["I'm not supposed to talk to strangers."]="我不应该和陌生人说话。"
G["I'm not sure I could."]="我不确定。"
G["I'm not sure I have the stomach for this..."]="我恐怕对此没什么胃口……"
G["I'm not sure I know what to make of all of this, other than I'm very insulted, and thank you for returning my purse.  I mean crate!"]="除了感觉受到了严重的冒犯，我真不知道该怎样形容我今天的遭遇。谢谢你把荷包还给我。我是说箱子！"
G["I'm not sure I'm ready to go in there alone."]="我不确定我是否已经做好了只身一人进去的准备。"
G["I'm not sure that's strictly necessary."]="我不知道那是不是真有必要。"
G["I'm not sure where the zeppelin is right now, actually..."]="老实说，我也搞不清楚飞艇目前到底在哪儿……"
G["I'm not sure which one's crazier."]="我不知道到底谁更疯狂一些。"
G["I'm not surprised.\n\nSo many questions, I cannot ignore...\n\nWhy all these weapons for an archaeological dig? And what is being done with the unearthed relics? Under what authority is the excavation being conducted?\n\nThe answers don't seem to be forthcoming. I'll just have to find out for myself, I suppose."]="我并不吃惊。\n\n我也不可能忽略这么多的问题……\n\n为什么一个考古发掘场里会有这么多武器？这与埋藏在地下的宝物有什么关系吗？这里的发掘人员到底效忠于谁？\n\n我还没有找到这些问题的答案。我想，我得自己去寻找真相。"
G["I'm not talking to you right now. If I were you, I wouldn't count on getting a raise this year, $n."]="我现在没和你说话。如果我是你，我决不会指望今年的加薪了，$n。"
G["I'm not that easy, hon.  Perhaps another time."]="没那么容易，甜心。也许下一次。"
G["I'm not the only one who has lost a family member. There are others, many others!"]="失去家人的并非只有我一个。和我有着相同遭遇的人还有很多！"
G["I'm not through with you yet!"]="我跟你还没完呢！"
G["I'm not used to fighting with other people."]="我不习惯同其他人作战。"
G["I'm not working for that maniac anymore!"]="我绝不再为这种疯子工作了！"
G["I'm not worried about my competition. Because I know I will win."]="我并不担心我的比赛，因为我知道我赢定了。"
G["I'm now far enough away...so I can't see the barrel.  Poison away!."]="我现在离得太远了……所以我看不见桶。"
G["I'm off to gather supplies and reconnect with old contacts. If I need backup in Pandaria, I'll send for ya!"]="我现在要去准备补给，再找点儿过去的线人。要是在潘达利亚我有需要你的地方，我会来找你的！"
