G["I'm okay!"]="我没事！"
G["I'm old enough to shoot beasts like you right between the eyes... at twice this distance."]="别小瞧我，我也能一箭射中野兽的眉心……而且是在两倍距离开外。"
G["I'm omitting the runes for \"north\" and \"west\" because I'm not sure how they impact the giant. I'm also including a rune to limit how long you can control it."]="Estoy omitiendo las runas del \"norte\" y \"oeste\" porque no estoy seguro de cómo afectan al gigante. También voy a incluir una runa para limitar el tiempo que lo puedes controlar."
G["I'm on a bombing mission for Forward Commander Kingston.  I need a gryphon destroyer!"]="我正在执行前线指挥官金斯顿下达的轰炸任务。我需要一头武装狮鹫！"
G["I'm on a bombing mission for Forward Commander To'arch.  I need a wyvern destroyer!"]="我正在为前线指挥官托尔克执行轰炸任务。我需要一头武装飞龙！"
G["I'm on fire!"]="我着火啦！"
G["I'm on fire. Note that in the logs!"]="我着火了。赶快记录在日志里！"
G["I'm on important business for his majesty.\n\n\"Need to know\" buisness. And you don't need to know!"]="我在为陛下执行重要任务。\n\n“探听消息”的重要任务。而这与你无关！"
G["I'm on it!"]="放着我来！"
G["I'm on it, doctor. Schematics, check. Toothbrush, check."]="好的，博士。图纸，检查完毕。牙刷，检查完毕。"
G["I'm on my way, Tholo!"]="我来了，索罗！"
