G["I'm only going to carve the runes I think will give you command over a giant."]="接下来，我会帮你雕刻符文，它拥有支配巨人的力量。"
G["I'm only here in case someone faints. The new recruits get a little excited and occasionally overexert themselves.\n...well, that, and sometimes one of the new mechano-tank prototypes explode. Whoops!"]="Yo estoy aquí por si alguien se desmaya. Los nuevos reclutas se emocionan y a veces se esfuerzan demasiado.\n\n...Bueno, eso y que a veces explota uno de los nuevos prototipos de mecanotanque. ¡Vaya!"
G["I'm out of here!"]="我终于逃出来了！"
G["I'm out of ideas. Gyrocopter Attack?"]="我真是毫无头绪。旋翼机之击？"
G["I'm out of my element, eh? Walt doesn't know what he's talking about! I single-handedly kicked the iron out of these dwarves and set up camp to observe the goings-on of the dig site."]="我是个外行，嗯？沃尔特讲话不经过大脑吗？我独自一人就教训了那些铁矮人，还在这里搭建起营地观察挖掘场的动静。"
G["I'm out of the building again.  Now I'll move one more waypoint..."]="我又出来了。现在我要向下一个地点进发……"
G["I'm out!"]="我退出！"
