G["I'm sick of sittin' in this hole. I hope whatever sorry pencil-pusher is holdin' up Danath's return gets a punch in the jimmies."]="我可不喜欢坐在这个洞里。真希望我们在等待达纳斯将军回来的时候能好好喝上一杯潘趣酒。"
G["I'm so angry that we lost Wintergrasp, again!  I will try to kill your leader, the all powerful, Sylvanas, instead."]="我很生气，我们又失去了冬拥湖！取而代之的，我要杀了你们强大的领袖——希尔瓦娜斯。"
G["I'm so glad that you asked, $n!\n\nNo one ever asks how stuff works. It's just here, gimme that, I'm gonna blow stuff up. Or, don't bore me with the details, just let me point and shoot. Or, worse yet, who cares how it works, is it a bigger explosion than last time?\n\nI swear sometimes, I could just scream, you know? It's like I'm always doing all of Hobart's work for him, but I never get any of the credit! I have got to be the most underappreciated, overworked, and underpaid tinkers assistant ever!\n\nWait, what did you ask about?"]="¡Me alegra mucho que preguntes, $n!\n\nNadie me pregunta jamás cómo funcionan las cosas. Se limitan a está aquí, dame eso, voy a hacer que explote. O, no me aburras con los detalles, déjame apuntar y disparar. O, aún peor, a quién le importa cómo funcione, ¿es una explosión mayor que la última vez?\n\nJuro que, a veces, podría gritar, ¿sabes? ¡Siempre hago el trabajo de Hobart, pero nunca me llevo el mérito! ¡Tengo que ser la ayudante de manitas más menospreciada, más explotada y con el peor sueldo de la historia!\n\nEspera, ¿qué me habías preguntado?"
G["I'm so glad yer back, Shay. Please, don't ever run off like that again! What would I tell yer parents if I lost ya?"]="很高兴你回来了，沙恩。以后请不要再这样了！如果你真的不见了，我怎么向你父母交待？"
G["I'm so glad you're here, $n! Tonight is the night of the Brewmoon Festival and none of the ingredients for my famous Kun-Lai Kicker have been delivered. I sent my assistants out to gather them but none of them have returned. Could you find out what is keeping them?"]="我很高兴你能来这，$n！今晚是酿月祭，而我最拿手的昆莱劲酒所需的原料都还没有运到。我派了助手出去收集它们，可一个都没回来。你能去帮我查查他们怎么了吗？"
G["I'm so glad you're here. I wouldn't have made it much longer."]="很高兴你来了。我本来撑不了那么久的。"
G["I'm so happy that Jubjub returned!  I only hope that I don't run out of Dark Iron ale soon, or I fear my pet frog might once again escape!"]="加布加布回来啦，我太高兴了！我希望我的黑铁啤酒不会很快被喝光，否则这家伙又会偷跑出去啦！"
G["I'm so happy. Thank you, mama and thank you, $n."]="我太高兴了。谢谢你，妈妈；也谢谢你，$n。"
G["I'm so money!"]="我就是有钱！"
G["I'm so sorry!"]="我很抱歉！"
G["I'm so sorry, that did not alarm you did it, hmm? We Pandaren value calm under any circumstance."]="抱歉，没吓着你吧？我们熊猫人最推崇高山崩于前而色不变的气度。"
G["I'm so tired *pant pant*"]="累死我了……*喘气声*"
G["I'm so tired of running, but these bees won't leave me alone!"]="我讨厌跑步，但是这些蜜蜂追个不停！"
G["I'm so tired. Just let me rest for a moment."]="我累坏了，让我先休息一下。"
G["I'm so tired. We really shouldn't have stayed up so late last night,,, well this morning. But it was fun! You do throw the best soirees milord."]="我很累。我们昨天晚上真的不应该玩到那么晚……呃，应该说是玩到今天早上。但是太有趣了！那真是最棒的晚会，大人。"
G["I'm so tired...."]="我太累了……"
G["I'm so worried about those poor captured pandaren. Have you had a chance yet to see what condition they're in, $n?"]="我很担心那些被抓走的可怜熊猫人。你去查看过他们的情况了吗，$n？"
G["I'm sorry $g lad : lass; but ye just don't have the foundation to learn what I have to teach. But don't fret, go speak with my student Rotgath, he'll help ye out."]="很抱歉$g小伙子:姑娘;，但是你基础不足，我不能教你。但是别烦恼，跟我的学生洛特加斯谈谈，他会帮助你的。"
G["I'm sorry $g mon : sis;, but I won't be sellin' my raptors to someone who hasn't proven themselves to be a friendly to the Darkspear tribe.  When ya make a stand and show yourself to be at least friendly to us, then I'll make my raptors available to ya."]="很抱歉$g兄弟:姐妹;，但是在确定买主是黑暗之矛部落的朋友之前，我不会将迅猛龙卖给他的。当你证明自己是我们的朋友之后，我才会把迅猛龙卖给你。"
G["I'm sorry $g mon : sis;, but I won't be sellin' my raptors to someone who hasn't proven themselves to be exalted to the Darkspear tribe.  When ya make a stand and show yourself to be no less than exalted to us, then I'll make my raptors available to ya."]="Lo siento $ghermano:hermana;, pero no venderé mis raptores a alguien que no haya demostrado tener reputación de exaltado con la tribu Lanza Negra. Cuando demuestres tu reputación como $gexaltado:exaltada;, entonces tendrás disponibles a mis raptores."
G["I'm sorry $n, but you've already learned all I know about cooking.  Of course, you never know when our cooks will whip up something new, so don't be shy and be sure to visit again some time."]="很抱歉，$n，但是我已经没有什么可以教你的了。当然，说不定哪天我灵光一闪，就发明出新菜谱啦，所以不要忘了经常回来看看！"
G["I'm sorry - I'll return to my post!"]="我错了——我马上回到岗位上去！"
G["I'm sorry - where were we? Oh yes! I have something for you:"]="抱歉——我们说到哪儿了？噢，对了！我有东西要给你："
G["I'm sorry but I can not let you ride my gryphons. You should go talk to Gringer if you need a ride somewhere."]="很抱歉我不能让你乘坐我的狮鹫。如果你确实需要飞行服务的话，就去找格林戈谈谈。"
G["I'm sorry that I did not arrive sooner, though you seem to have held your own quite well."]="抱歉我没能早点赶到，虽然一切似乎都在你的掌握之中。"
G["I'm sorry that I didn't get here sooner. What happened?"]="很抱歉，我来晚了。发生了什么事？"
G["I'm sorry to hear that."]="真遗憾。"
G["I'm sorry to see your lack of commitment... What of the human corpses?"]="可惜啊，你真是缺乏奉献精神。那人类的尸体呢？"
G["I'm sorry, $c, I cannot help you. You'll have to find a $c trainer."]="对不起，$c，我帮不了你。你得去找$c训练师。"
G["I'm sorry, $c, but my wares are best suited to those who know which end of the needle the thread goes through.\n\nI can assure you, tailoring is about far more than monogramming handkerchiefs."]="对不起，$c。只有懂得针线活儿的裁缝才会对我出售的货物感兴趣。\n\n我敢说，裁缝这门手艺远比做一块手帕要复杂得多。"
G["I'm sorry, $c.\n\nI really don't know enough to discuss such things. And honestly, I would prefer to keep it that way."]="很抱歉，$c。\n\n对此我真的没什么了解，所以我没什么可说的。"
G["I'm sorry, $gsir:ma'am;!"]="抱歉，$g阁下:女士;！"
G["I'm sorry, $n, but I have no time to spend on novices. You want someone closer to your own skill level. Try the night elf Milla Fairancora, in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus."]="很抱歉，$n，但是我可不在新手身上浪费时间。你得找一个跟自己技能相近的人。去达纳苏斯的工匠区找一个名叫米拉·法拉科纳的暗夜精灵。"
G["I'm sorry, $n, but I'm not really up for talking.  Leave me in peace."]="我很抱歉，$n，可我不想聊天。请让我安静一会儿。"
G["I'm sorry, $r, but I just called to a defender for you.\n\nYou will have to wait a short time before I will do so again."]="对不起，$r，我刚刚才为你召唤了一名防御者。\n\n你得容我休息一会儿，我才能再次召唤。"
G["I'm sorry, Arthas. I can't watch you do this."]="对不起，阿尔萨斯。我不能眼睁睁地看着你走上歧途。"
G["I'm sorry, Huntress. None of our new $cs are ready. They still have much to learn."]="Lo siento, cazadora. $gNingún:Ninguna; $c está $gpreparado:preparada;. Todavía tienen que aprender mucho."
G["I'm sorry, I am too busy to speak to strangers."]="抱歉，我不想把时间浪费在陌生人身上。"
G["I'm sorry, I can only speak Demonic."]="抱歉，我只会讲恶魔语。"
G["I'm sorry, I can't offer you training. You'll have to find someone more familiar with your skills."]="很抱歉，我不能对你进行训练。你得去找更熟悉你技能的训练师。"
G["I'm sorry, I can't.  I've been tasked to watch this hippogryph post.  These things might seem tame, but they really require a twenty-four hour vigil."]="很抱歉，我不行。我的任务是看守这个角鹰兽哨站。这些角鹰兽看上去很驯顺，但它们的确需要二十四小时看管。"
G["I'm sorry, I cannot train you."]="对不起，我无法对你进行训练。"
G["I'm sorry, I didn't mean to be rude, I just..."]="很抱歉，我并不是要这样无礼，我只是……"
G["I'm sorry, I'm a bit busy right now making horseshoes for Verner Osgood in Lakeshire."]="很抱歉，我现在有些忙，我要为湖畔镇的弗纳·奥斯古打造马蹄。"
G["I'm sorry, I've little time for speaking to anyone other than the wisps and the captain to report my findings.  Forgive me."]="对不起，除了与小精灵交流并向船长汇报我的发现之外，我没时间和其他人闲聊。请原谅。"
G["I'm sorry, Sanders. I've just never seen such a bounty. It took me by surprise."]="对不起，杉德尔。我只是从未看到过这样的好东西。这让我太吃惊了。"
G["I'm sorry, are we interrupting?"]="抱歉，打扰诸位了吗？"
G["I'm sorry, but I can't offer you training."]="对不起，可我无法对你进行训练。"
G["I'm sorry, but I do not heal."]="我很抱歉，可我不会治疗。"
G["I'm sorry, but I won't. I'm sure you understand my reasons."]="我很抱歉，可我不能。我相信你明白我的苦衷。"
G["I'm sorry, but Lorna'd be real mad if I let you take a horse.\nThey're only for friends of Gilneas!"]="Lo siento pero Lorna se lo tomaría fatal si te dejo un caballo.\n\nSon solo para los amigos de Gilneas."
G["I'm sorry, but Lorna'd be real mad if I let you take a horse.\nThey're only for those who are exalted with Gilneas!"]="Lo siento pero Lorna se lo tomaría fatal si te dejo un caballo.\n\nSon solo para los que son exaltados con Gilneas."
G["I'm sorry, but we need to stay here for a little while. The Horde is keeping us safe."]="很抱歉，我们需要在这里呆一会儿。部落保护着我们的安全。"
G["I'm sorry, daddy...."]="爸爸，我让您失望了……"
G["I'm sorry, little sheep!"]="对不起，小羊！"
G["I'm sorry, our brews are exclusive to members of the \"Brew of the Month Club.\""]="Lo siento, pero nuestras cervezas son exclusivamente para los miembros de \"El Club de la Cerveza del Mes.\""
G["I'm sorry, outsider. Unless you are here on official business, I'm afraid I can't be of any assistance to you."]="Lo siento, $gforastero:forastera;. A menos que hayas venido en viaje oficial, me temo que no puedo ayudarte."
G["I'm sorry. I promise to be more careful."]="我很抱歉。我保证会下次更加小心的。"
G["I'm sorry. I'll work harder."]="对不起。我会努力干活的。"
G["I'm sorry..."]="很抱歉……"
G["I'm sorry... I'm sorry... I'm sorry... I'm sorry... I'm sorry..."]="我很抱歉……我很抱歉……我很抱歉……我很抱歉……我很抱歉……"
G["I'm sorry... sniff..."]="对不起……啊呀……"
G["I'm speakin' to you too, mister fancy britches Mograine! SHUT YER YAP!"]="我也在和你说话，莫格莱尼先生！闭上你的嘴！"
G["I'm starting my patrol now!"]="我现在开始巡查了！"
G["I'm starting to make bombs! PH"]="¡Estoy fabricando bombas! PH"
G["I'm starting to take a liking to you, $r."]="我开始喜欢上你了，$r。"
G["I'm starving!"]="我快饿死了！"
G["I'm staying put. Go check it out!"]="我留在这儿。你去查查是怎么回事！"
G["I'm sticking with you.  You can be my bodyguard!"]="我会紧紧跟着你的。你就是我的保镖了！"
G["I'm still amazed that I ever joined the Shado-Pan to be honest. Not that they're not an amazing bunch and all, just the thought of the violence clashing with my impecible complection.\n\nI never have trouble remembering why I joined them though... let's just say Anji can be very convincing."]="老实说，我至今仍为自己加入影踪派而感到不可思议。并不是说他们有何逊色之处，只是暴力与我的完美人格向来都是风马牛不相及。\n\n不过要是说到加入他们的原因，真是想忘记都难……简而言之，安济有着超群的说服力。"
G["I'm still wary of the risks. While I agree that Malfurion and his dirt-loving brothers are quite mad, this Lord Sargeras must have another agenda..."]="我仍然在为可能的风险感到担心。虽然我同意，玛法里奥和他那些喜爱泥土的兄弟们都是疯子，但这个萨格拉斯就是另一回事了……"
G["I'm still weak, but I think I can get an anti-magic barrier up. Stay inside it or you'll be destroyed by their spells."]="我很虚弱，但是我应该能撑起一个反魔法屏障。你最好别走出屏障，否则就会被他们的法术杀死。"
G["I'm still working out some minor details..."]="我仍然在解决一些无足轻重的细节……"
G["I'm stopping my patrol now!"]="我现在停止巡查了！"
G["I'm such a luckydont! I ruined Uncle Keenbean's kafa trade!"]="我真是个扫把星！我把表叔激情豆的咔啡交易搞砸了！"
G["I'm summoning a Flamestrike, lead them into it!"]="我正在召唤烈焰风暴，把他们引进去！"
G["I'm supposed to be hunting infected nightstalkers... This should be easy."]="我是来猎杀这些感染的夜行豹的……应该很简单。"
G["I'm supposed to get ye to the Shrine o' Seven Stars."]="我将要把你送往七星殿。"
G["I'm supposed to guard the well. It's an important job!"]="我奉命守卫这口井。这是重要的任务！"
G["I'm sure Arthas will be back any day now, soldier. Keep your chin up!"]="我相信阿尔萨斯殿下很快就会回来的。千万别气馁！"
G["I'm sure I can find a use for this mixture..."]="我相信我能找到这种混合剂的用途……"
G["I'm sure I don't need to remind you to stay alert down here."]="我相信我不必提醒你，在这儿要保持警惕。"
G["I'm sure Thrall will have his people under control..."]="我相信萨尔会管住他的部下……"
G["I'm sure everything will work out, footman."]="一切都会好起来的。"
G["I'm sure it would've been seaworthy in calm waters."]="我确定它在平静的水域中航行时一定会平稳得多。"
G["I'm sure it's just incompetence or oversight by some of the workers."]="我相信这只是一些工人的疏忽。"
G["I'm sure ol' Hemet can do something with your bones!"]="我猜老赫米特肯定会用得着你的骨头的！"
G["I'm sure that help from Farstrider Enclave will be here soon to help me and this useless lieutenant get to safety. You might not want to stick around; I've heard all sorts of strange sounds coming from the lake and that village over yonder."]="我相信从远行者营地来的援军很快就会到达这里，帮助我和这个没用的上尉回到安全的地方。你可能不想在这里逗留，因为我听到了从湖里和远处村庄那边传来的各种奇怪的声音。"
G["I'm sure they are just being overly superstitious."]="我确信他们只是被迷信冲昏了头脑。"
G["I'm sure they're quite wonderful.  If you don't mind I have some drinking to get back to.  You coming, $n?"]="那些酒可棒啦。你不介意的话，我想回去喝几杯。你要一起来吗，$n？"
G["I'm sure things would have been a lot better with you driving. We would have all probably died on the way here instead. I can see the headlines now: \"Heroes of the Argent Crusade Killed in Fatal Steam Tank Accident.\""]="Estoy seguro de que las cosas habrían ido mucho mejor si hubieras conducido tú. Habríamos muerto de camino aquí. Ya puedo ver los titulares: \"Héroes de la Cruzada Argenta mueren en un accidente fatal de tanque de vapor\"."
G["I'm sure to receive a commendation upon our return. We may have suffered a few losses, but overall I think we did quite nicely, don't you, Valanna?"]="我相信我们在回去的时候会得到一枚奖章的。我们也许经受了一些失败，但总体来说，我觉得我们做得非常好，不是吗，瓦兰娜？"
G["I'm sure you all must be in a big hurry and probably have some more big dangerous monsters to kill but if you would just take a moment and come help me out of this cage before rushing off it would make me so happy and excited that I would barely be able to contain myself so if you get a moment I'll just be over here... waiting... patiently...."]="我知道你们都在赶时间可能还需要去打败更大更危险的怪物不过如果你们肯费费神把我从这个笼子里放出去的话我一定会异常兴奋的所以要是你们愿意花上这么一点时间的话我就会很耐心……很耐心……很耐心地在这里等着哟……"
G["I'm sure you can handle things in here. I'll be outside settling things down."]="我相信你能处理这里的事。我出去解决外面的问题。"
G["I'm sure, Magni. I'll see this through, don't ya worry."]="我是认真的，麦格尼。我会小心处理的，别担心。"
G["I'm surprised he lasted as long as he did. PH"]="真没想到，他竟然坚持了那么久。"
G["I'm surprised that a $c like you could even see me, $n. I'm stealth on a stick!"]="¡Me sorprende que $gun:una; $c como tú pueda verme, $n! ¡Estoy camuflada!"
G["I'm surprised that you made it this far."]="你们竟然能做到这个地步，我很惊讶。"
G["I'm surrounded by idiots!"]="我身边这些家伙都是白痴！"
G["I'm takin' you close ta a Horde encampment though, so you'd best be on yer guard."]="不过我们的目的地离一个部落营地很近，所以你一定要多加小心。"
G["I'm taking the next ship back home."]="我会乘下一艘船回家。"
G["I'm taking this back to the old school. I'll be the Alliance and you be Frostwolf Village. BOMBS AWAY!"]="这让我回忆起了过去的时光。我扮演联盟，你则防守霜狼村。投弹完毕！"
G["I'm tellin' you, that Coren Direbrew's a madman.\nIt's not MY fault he didn't get invited to compete at Brewfest! But that didn't stop him and all his Dark Iron cronies from roughin' up my employees and drinking all my brew.\nSomeone's got to put an end to this!"]="Te digo que Coren Cerveza Temible está loco.\n\n¡No es culpa MÍA que no le hayan invitado a competir en la Fiesta de la Cerveza! Pero eso no ha impedido que él y sus colegas del Hierro Negro hayan dado una paliza a mis empleados y se hayan bebido toda mi cerveza.\n\n¡Alguien tiene que poner fin a esto!"
G["I'm telling Mommy!"]="我要告诉妈妈！"
G["I'm the bleeding edge, baby! Elemental infused technologies. Exploring the depths of Azeroth for lost knowledge and new resources.\n\nRemember the name."]="我就是尖端技术的代表，宝贝儿！灌注元素能量的高科技。到艾泽拉斯海洋的最深处去探求失落的学识与新的资源吧。\n\n请牢记我的名字。"
G["I'm the bomber man...tid!"]="我是炸弹……螳螂！"
G["I'm the heavy bomb master. Send me up!"]="我是使用重磅炸弹的高手。出发吧！"
G["I'm the king of dirt, there is none higher! To my aid, minions - assist your sire!"]="我是至高无上的土灵之王！仆从们，现身吧——快来帮助你们的君王！"
G["I'm the most intelligent, strongest, most cultured gorloc here, yet Soo-say calls all the shots... does that seem right to you?"]="我是最聪明、最强壮、最有修养的鳄鱼人，但是索乌塞却拥有氏族的统治权……你觉得这件事正常吗？"
G["I'm the new king?  What are you talking about?"]="我是新国王？你在说什么？"
G["I'm the warden, and you know that! You'd better not make any trouble, because I'll know the moment that you try anything..."]="你要明白，我是这里的长官！你最好别惹麻烦，因为你逃不过我的眼睛……"
G["I'm the... forget it. I'm here to warn you that the black dragonflight is here hunting you."]="我是……得了吧。我到这里来是为了警告你，黑龙正在这里捕杀你。"
G["I'm thinkin' of opening a lumber depot here.\n\nAll these trees just sittin' around waiting to get chopped down. I would be a fool to pass up this opportunity!"]="我正考虑在这里建造一个伐木场。\n\n这里有这么多可以砍伐的树木，要是错过这个大好机会，那我就是傻子了！"
G["I'm thinkin' the Reef Octopi are hereabouts this area in Sri-La village of Jade Forest. \n\n<Ben stuffs a pin along the Northeast shore of Jade Forest on your map.>"]="Creo que los pulpos de arrecife están más o menos por aquí en la Aldea Sri-La, en el Bosque de Jade.\n\n<Ben clava un alfiler en tu mapa, a la altura de la costa noreste del Bosque de Jade.>"
G["I'm thinking about jumping in the ring myself... just not right now."]="我都想自己下场试试了……但现在还不行。"
G["I'm thinking about the front to the north. The one you're so eager to return to."]="我正在考虑关于北方前线的问题。看样子，你正急不可待地要回到那里去。"
G["I'm thinking of a vacation. I hear Hearthglen is nice."]="我正在考虑去度假，听说壁炉谷不错。"
G["I'm thinking of trying to grow some crops here.\n\nCan you imagine what might happen if I planted an engima seed?"]="我正考虑在这里种点庄稼。\n\n你能想象，如果我在这里种下一颗谜之种，会发生什么事吗？"
G["I'm thirsty!"]="我渴死啦！"
G["I'm thirsty."]="我很渴。"
G["I'm through asking nicely, fish-man."]="我一直在友善地询问你，鱼人。"
G["I'm through being courteous with your kind, human! What is the \"Crimson Dawn?\""]="¡Me he cansado de ser cortés con los de tu calaña, humano! ¿Qué es el \"Alba Carmesí\"?"
G["I'm tired of these toys. I don't want to play anymore!"]="我不喜欢这些玩具了！我不想玩了！"
G["I'm tired of wading in water.  Let's make this a little bit easier on ourselves, shall we?  Spirit of water, come to our aid!"]="我已经厌倦在水里跋涉了。让我们给自己找点儿便利吧，好吗？流水之灵，快来帮助我们！"
G["I'm tired.  You kill next one!"]="我累了。你去杀下一个！"
G["I'm too dumb to be in a cult. Been that way since I felled off the back of the zeppelin. And hit them propellors. Landed on a rock. They fixed my head up with a metal bowl to make it round and hard.\n\n<He thunks his fist against his skull.>\n\nThen the lightning done come."]="我这么蠢，根本加入不了教派。自从我从飞艇的后部摔下来就成这样了。我被螺旋桨打到。然后掉到了一块石头上。他们用一只金属大碗把我的头固定住，以让它变得又圆又硬。\n\n<他用拳头敲了敲自己的头。>\n\n然后闪电就来了。"
G["I'm too good-looking to die as a sacrifice!"]="我长得太帅了，怎么能被当成祭品！"
G["I'm too weak to fight with you.  Please find my friends."]="我很虚弱，不能与你并肩作战。请找到我的朋友们。"
G["I'm too young to die as a sacrifice!"]="我还年轻，我不想做祭品！"
G["I'm too young to die!"]="我会战斗到最后一刻的！"
G["I'm too young to die! Hell, I'm too pretty to die!"]="我还年轻，我不想死！见鬼，我那么漂亮，怎么能死！"
G["I'm training hard, can't you see?"]="你没看见我正在刻苦训练吗？"
G["I'm training right now.  Can this wait?"]="我正在接受训练。可以等一会儿吗？"
G["I'm training to be a priest, myself. One day I hope I can command as much power as you."]="我本人正在被受训成为一名牧师。希望有一天我也能变得和你一样强大。"
G["I'm trustin' you not to lead me into any rivers, or animal mouths. Nothin' like that."]="你不会再叫我到什么沟里或是野兽嘴里去吧？可千万别。"
G["I'm trustin' you not to walk me off that big ol' cliff."]="你不会把我带到那悬崖下面去吧？"
G["I'm trusting you and the other leaders to not let this divide our people. You are stronger than that."]="我相信你和其他领袖不会让我们的族人因此而分裂。你们有足够的力量。"
G["I'm trusting you... Don't let me die!"]="我只能靠你了……不要让我死！"
G["I'm tryin' to run a business here!"]="我本打算在这里搞点小买卖的！"
G["I'm trying to convince Godfrey to just kill all of you to end your misery, but he keeps telling me no. More pain and suffering for the lot of you, then!"]="我一直在试图说服高弗雷，把你们彻底消灭，以结束你们的痛苦。但他总是拒绝我。那你们就继续受苦吧！"
G["I'm under attack! I repeat, I am under attack!"]="我受到攻击！重复一遍，我受到攻击！"
G["I'm up ta me pretty knickers in ad-mino-strative duties, but wot else is new?"]="我在执行行政管理的时候得穿上漂亮的短裤，但是其他的呢？能来点儿有新意的吗？"
G["I'm up to 15. Top that!"]="我杀了15个。看看你能不能超过我！"
G["I'm up to looking into that bounty after this shift."]="下班后我就去看看那份悬赏令。"
G["I'm used to fighting off the small ones..."]="我习惯击退小不点……"
G["I'm very busy right now, $r. Please leave me alone."]="我现在很忙，$r。让我静一静。"
G["I'm very busy right now, young $c. Please excuse me."]="我现在很忙，年轻的$c，不好意思。"
G["I'm very curious to see what this sample of water will do!"]="我很想看看这份水的样本有什么作用！"
G["I'm very interested in seeing your fighting style, $c."]="我很想见识下你的战斗风格，$c。"
G["I'm very sorry, but I no longer have relics to sell you. Their magic seems to have extinguished! Perhaps I'll go into dancing full time now, it would be a nice change of pace."]="很抱歉，可我没有古物可以出售给你了。它们的魔法力量似乎已经消失了！也许我该改行当全职舞蹈家，那会是个不错的改变。"
G["I'm warning you, I will not falter under your assault."]="我警告你，你的攻击不会让我动摇半步。"
G["I'm warning you, Lor'themar. The Alliance is besieging the city and we will destroy Hellscream. Your people had best stay out of our way."]="我警告你，洛瑟玛。联盟已经包围了那座城市，我们要消灭地狱咆哮。你的人最好别妨碍我们。"
G["I'm watching you, $r."]="我一直在观察你，$r。"
G["I'm what you call a capitalist, $r."]="我就是你所说的财主，$R。"
G["I'm willing to help you out, but you have to promise not to mention this to anyone else. Even talking about this kind of thing can hurt my reputation!"]="我愿意帮你的忙，但你得保证不向任何人提起这件事。哪怕只是随便聊聊这种事情也会对我的声誉造成负面影响！"
G["I'm with Drull, doc. Laverne and I are happy together. Why try and separate us?"]="我与德鲁尔同在，医生。我们在一起很快乐。为什么要拆散我们？"
G["I'm with you, $n."]="我会跟着你的，$n。"
G["I'm with you, Akama."]="我与你同在，阿卡玛。"
G["I'm with you, Thorim."]="我会帮助你的，托里姆。"
G["I'm with you, hero."]="Estoy contigo, $ghéroe:heroína;."
G["I'm with you."]="我跟你一起。"
G["I'm with you. Let's break into that shipyard! [Queue for solo instance.]"]="我跟你去。让我们一起攻破那个船坞吧！ [排队等待单人副本。]"
G["I'm workin' as fast as I can, cap'n!"]="我已经够快的了，上尉！"
G["I'm workin' on a new invention that's goin' to blow your mind!\n\nAnd probably maim other body parts."]="我正在研究一项能把你的理智炸飞的新发明！\n\n或许还能让你的其他肢体一起瘫痪。"
G["I'm workin', here."]="我干活呢。"
G["I'm working as fast as humanly possible, Pat. Stop interrupting me!"]="我的速度已经达到极限了。别干扰我！"
G["I'm working on a biographical piece for Commander Schnottz, among other things.\n\nYou'll have to excuse me."]="我有一个重要的任务，那就是为司克诺兹元首撰写传记。\n\n请原谅。"
G["I'm working on it, I just don't want to sell it until I'm happy with it. It shouldn't be long."]="我还在调制啊，我可不想随便出售连我自己都不满意的半成品。用不了多久啦。"
G["I'm working on it, Molsen. If you want it done faster, do it yourself."]="我正在洗呢，墨尔森。你想要洗得快一点的话，就自己动手吧。"
G["I'm working up the courage to go in after more of the relics. What do you think, $n?"]="我正想鼓起勇气去找更多遗物呢。你觉得怎么样，$n？"
G["I'm worried about the others, $n."]="我很担心其他人，$n。"
G["I'm your goblin, Thrall. What would you have of me?"]="我是你的地精，萨尔。你要我干嘛？"
G["I'm your man! Give me the coded message."]="我很乐意效劳！把密信交给我吧。"
G["I'm your man, Ich. Give me a beacon!"]="我是你的人。给我火炬！"
G["I'm your master... you're supposed to do what I say!"]="我是你的主人……你应该照我说的去做！"
G["I'm your woman! Give me the coded message."]="我很乐意效劳！把密信交给我吧。"
G["I'm, I'm simply saying that life, uh... didn't find a way."]="我，我只是说生命，呃……是找不到出路的。"
G["I'm... I'm just going to lie down a while... until this headache goes away."]="我……我得躺一会儿了……直到头疼好一点为止。"
G["I'm... alive?  Thank you... thank you so much!"]="我……还活着？谢谢你……太感谢你了！"
G["I'm... alive? I'm alive! I'm alive!"]="我还……活着？我还活着！我还活着！"
G["I'm... not sure that's a good idea, 'Moke. Ye might get hurt..."]="我……不觉得这是个好主意，笨蛋。你可能会受伤……"
G["I'm... so... dizzy."]="我……觉得……很晕。"
G["I'mma turn you into a stout!"]="我要把你酿成烈酒！"
G["I've a message for your master, scum!"]="我有个消息要带给你们的主人，渣滓！"
G["I've a surprise for ye, dogs!"]="我有个惊喜给你们，狗儿！"
G["I've almost got it! Just a little more time..."]="快完成了！只要再多一点时间……"
G["I've already alerted the Shado-Pan of what's happened here. Hopefully they can do something.\n\nI feel as though we are all woefully unprepared for the coming trials we are to face."]="我已经把这里发生的一切报告给了影踪派。希望他们能采取行动。\n\n尽管我们都对即将到来的考验毫无准备，但也必须面对。"
G["I've already told you, McSorf. I've sent no less than three rescue teams into the ruins and none have returned. I am working tirelessly to keep this port afloat and in one piece! GET OFF MY BACK!"]="我已经跟你说过很多次了，米科索夫。我已经派出至少三支救援队进入遗址了，而且一支都没有回来。我还要保证港口的正常运转呢！你马上从我面前消失！"
G["I've always had a good head for numbers!\n\nOnce the natives saw how fast I could add, subtract, and do differential equations in my head, they hired me on the spot!"]="我向来擅长算数！\n\n当地人见识了我心算加、减和微分方程的速度后，他们立马就聘用了我！"
G["I've always liked sorting and organizing things.  I guess I take after my mother."]="我一直喜欢有条理的事情。我想这是我母亲的遗传。"
G["I've always wanted my very own dragon!"]="我一直都想要我自己的龙！"
G["I've always wondered what it would be like to be a druid. Where do your clothes go when you change into a bear?"]="我一直想知道当个德鲁伊是什么感觉。当你变熊时你的衣服去哪儿了呢？"
G["I've always wondered what lay behind these gates."]="我一直想知道，在那些大门背后究竟有什么。"
G["I've always wondered when outsiders would breach out shores, and so now you have come."]="我一直想知道，外乡人何时会闯上我们的海岸，然后你们就来了。"
G["I've arranged for your flight to Manaforge Coruu.  Are you ready, $n?  You will be dropped off behind enemy lines so make sure you bring everything you need."]="He organizado tu vuelo a la forja de maná Coruu. ¿Estás $gpreparado:preparada;, $n? Te dejarán detrás de las filas enemigas, así que asegúrate de llevar todo lo que necesitas."
G["I've become one with fire!  I've... auuuggggh!!!  It burnssss!!!"]="我已经和火焰融为一体！我已经……啊！！！真热啊！！！"
G["I've been better.  Ivar the Foul got the better of me..."]="我好一些了。但伊瓦这个笨蛋过得比我还好……"
G["I've been busy. A few of the Saur-Priests have been calling for Horde and Alliance blood.\n\nNaturally, I killed them in their sleep."]="我一直很忙。一些蜥首牧师想让部落和联盟流血。\n\n理所当然的，我就趁他们睡觉时把他们都杀了。"
G["I've been circling nearby in case you needed to speak."]="我就在这周围盘旋，你随时可以和我联系。"
G["I've been delivering mail for a month now. Are there any executive openings? I have my resume right here."]="现在我已经送了一个月的信。现在有什么主管的位置空缺吗？我已经把简历准备好了。"
G["I've been expec...\n\n<Rimblat coughs.>\n\nExcuse me, old habit. I am Rimblat of the Earthen Ring."]="我希望能……\n\n<雷布拉特干咳了几声。>\n\n抱歉，老毛病了。我是大地之环的雷布拉特。"
G["I've been expecting you $n.  Are you ready to assist us in Arathi Basin?"]="Te he estado esperando, $n. ¿Estás $gpreparado:preparada; para ayudarnos en la Cuenca de Arathi?"
G["I've been expecting you, $n."]="我一直在等着你，$n。"
G["I've been expecting you, $p!"]="我一直在等你，$p！"
G["I've been experimenting with all sorts of brews in my spare time.\n\nWith the Stormstout brewery right across the way, I can't help but get inspired sometimes.\n\nOh, but these aren't anywhere as good as what they make over there."]="我在闲暇时间会利用各种各样的酒来做实验。\n\n而且风暴烈酒酿造厂就在街对面，我有时更按耐不住了。\n\n哦，但是也没有其他地方能酿造出比这儿更好的酒了。"
G["I've been feelin'... urges."]="我有一种……冲动。"
G["I've been fightin' Horde for ten years now, and I've never seen it worse than this."]="我跟部落打了十年的仗，还没见过比这次更糟的。"
G["I've been given another chance to serve?  I will not fail again!"]="又给了我一次效力的机会？我不会再失败了！"
G["I've been gone a long time...I better get back."]="我已经离开很久了……最好动身回去。"
G["I've been here for hours and the sun hasn't moved..."]="都几个小时了，太阳却一直没动过……"
G["I've been here in this valley since before the dark portal opened, $glad:lass;. I don't plan on letting a handful of blood elves traipse in here and plunder these ruins!"]="自从黑暗之门打开以前，我就已经在这座谷里了，$g小子:姑娘;。我可不打算让几个血精灵来肆意劫掠这些遗迹！"
G["I've been here long enough, $n. I'm sure we'll meet again. Good luck!"]="我在这里已经待够了，$n。我相信我们会再见的。祝你好运！"
G["I've been in here for days. They were about to sacrifice me!"]="我已经被关在这儿好多天了。他们正准备拿我献祭！"
G["I've been in here for days. They were just about to sacrifice me!"]="我已经被关在这儿好多天了。他们正准备拿我献祭！"
G["I've been in the middle of a few messes in my day, but this is ridiculous!"]="我以前也卷入过不少麻烦，但这也太荒唐了！"
G["I've been in the military my whole life.  I've fought in many wars, under many banners - but they've always been other people's battles.\n\nNot this time.  Every Forsaken soldier you see here has come for one reason alone.  Arthas must be killed."]="我一生戎马，经历过无数战争的洗礼。我曾在不同的旗帜下作战，不过那都是别人的战争。\n\n这次却截然不同了。这些被遗忘者士兵来这里的理由都只有一个。阿尔萨斯必须死。"
G["I've been looking for a little help. Since you've got the skill, I guess you'll do, provided you've also got the guts."]="我曾四处寻找帮助。你已经获得了技能，要是你有勇气的话，我猜你会付诸行动的。"
G["I've been meaning to ask you about that monkey."]="我想要问问你关于那只猴子的情况。"
G["I've been meaning to investigate this site.\n\nNo time like the present!"]="我一直都在打算调查这个地方。\n\n而现在这种情形还从没有发生过！"
G["I've been mixing potions since before the cartel wars, and I don't plan to stop anytime soon.\n\nAs long as there's a buyer to be had, Ol' Baba will be ready with a sale!"]="自从这场企业联合战争开始以前，我就在进行各种药剂混合工作了。我现在并不打算停止这行当。\n\n只要还有买家，芭芭就不愁没生意做！"
G["I've been ordered back to the main battlegroup to provide carrier escort. The full might of the Alliance navy will arrive in two months' time."]="我要奉命返回主战队，执行母舰护航任务。联盟海军的全部兵力将在两个月后抵达。"
G["I've been patient up to this point, but if they don't get that rocket sling working soon, I'm going to shadow bolt someone!"]="我现在还有点耐心。但如果他们不尽快让火箭弹射器正常工作，有人可就要吃我的暗影箭了！"
G["I've been patient up to this point, but if they don't get that rocket sling working soon, I'm going to shadow bolt someone!\n\nNeed some training, $n?"]="He sido paciente hasta ahora, ¡pero si no consiguen que ese lanzador de cohetes funcione pronto, voy a lanzarle una descarga de las sombras a alguien!\n\n¿Necesitas instrucción, $n?"
G["I've been placed in command of Alliance joint operations in the Twilight Highlands.\n\nThe independant Wildhammer clans still dot this countryside. If we can unite them under the Alliance banner, nothing can stop us! But enemies close in on all sides. I hope you're ready for a fight, $c."]="Me han puesto al mando de las operaciones conjuntas de la Alianza en las Tierras Altas Crepusculares.\n\nTodavía quedan clanes independientes de los Martillo Salvaje desperdigados por la zona. Si podemos unirlos bajo el estandarte de la Alianza, ¡nada podrá detenernos! Pero nuestros enemigos se acercan por todos lados. Espero que estés $glisto:lista; para la batalla, $c."
G["I've been practicing all week for this!"]="我为此已经训练了整整一周！"
G["I've been preparing for this moment for years, $n, and you've made it all possible. Witness my transformation!"]="为了这一天，我已经等待了好几年了，$n。是你帮我实现了它。现在，看看我的新造型吧！"
G["I've been saving this for a special occasion."]="我专门为这种特殊情况留了一手。"
G["I've been saving this just for you, big boy!"]="我特意为你留着这个呢！"
G["I've been saving this spot for something special. I don't think it gets any more special than this, $n."]="我一直把这个地方空着，希望有一些特殊的东西能放在这里。我不认为能有什么比这个更特殊了，$n。"
G["I've been sent here by my superiors to investigate some strange occurrences here in Booty Bay.  This goblin town withstood a tidal wave remarkably well, especially given the reputation of goblin engineering.  I'm surprised the place didn't explode on impact.\n\nI suspect there may be magical forces at play here.  There may be more to Booty Bay than you'd expect, $c..."]="我奉命前来调查藏宝海湾近来出现的怪事。这座地精之城出人意料地经受住了一场巨大海啸的考验，鉴于其以地精工程学而著称的美名，这就更加令人觉得不可思议。没想到这地方居然没有被巨浪冲垮。\n\n我怀疑在这里有什么魔法力量在作怪。你对藏宝海湾的了解也许远远不够，$c……"
G["I've been sent here to help you keep Anthracite under control."]="我是来帮你对付硬煤的。"
G["I've been sparring all day. When do we eat?"]="整天都在过招。啥时候吃饭啊？"
G["I've been spotted!"]="我被发现了！"
G["I've been spotted!  $n incoming! Help!"]="我被发现了！$n杀过来了！快来帮忙！"
G["I've been spotted?  Time to die!"]="我被发现了？受死吧！"
G["I've been to Ironforge before.  It smells funny there."]="我以前去过铁炉堡。那儿闻起来怪怪的。"
G["I've been told that I'm the best-looking rider in the skies. I wouldn't believe that if I were you. I'm also the best-looking rider on land, under the sea...well, just about anywhere!"]="别人告诉我，我是天空之中最英俊的骑士。如果我是你，我就不会相信这种鬼话。我也是大地之上最英俊的骑士，深海之下最英俊的骑士……呃，反正不管到哪儿我都是最英俊的！"
G["I've been training really hard! There's no way you can defeat me now, $n."]="我一直在非常刻苦的训练！你现在无法击败我了，$n。"
G["I've been unable to befriend the Glassfin Elder. $C, I'm counting on you to succeed where I failed."]="我是没法和珠鳍长老交上朋友了，$C。我就全指望你能成功了。"
G["I've been very, very naughty...."]="我非常非常淘气……"
G["I've been waiting a long time for this, you know."]="你知道，我已经等了很久了。"
G["I've been waiting a long time to be on this tour."]="为了这次观光，我已经等了很久了。"
G["I've been waiting for this day for years. Behold my transformation!"]="为了这一天，我已经等待了好几年了。看看我的新造型！"
G["I've been waiting to unleash this gunship against a worthy target. Let's spend some ammunition!"]="我一直期待能用这战机歼灭强大的目标。让我们开火吧！"
G["I've been waiting."]="我期待着这场对决。"
G["I've been watching the Aldor working on the walls. They're gonna rebuild the whole city, you know.\n\nThey work much faster than old Foreman Oslow did back home in Lakeshire. He kept losing his tools in the lake, or the gnolls would take his supplies.\n\nI should ask the Aldor to send him some help. They'd have that bridge fixed faster'n anything."]="我看到奥尔多正在修缮那些城墙。你知道，他们想要重建整座城市。\n\n他们比老工头奥斯洛在湖畔镇干得快多了，他不是把工具遗失在河里，就是被豺狼人拿走他的补给。\n\n我应该要求奥尔多去帮助他，这样他们就会很快修好那座断桥了。"
G["I've been watching the Dark Iron for a long time...plotting, hoping, wishing for the chance to drive them away and take back my land.\n\nThey can keep Blackrock Mountain. I hope it erupts again and takes them all with it. I want what is now called the Burning Steppes, my part of the Redridge Mountains that their fiery overlord destroyed.\n\n$C, I'm going to show the world the potential left in my land. I'll build a kingdom of peace and justice atop the death and trickery they leave behind them. My vigil is over. I'm here to fight for what's rightfully mine.\n\nAnd I'm willing to die for it."]="我监视黑铁矮人已经有很长时间了……我谋划，期待，希望着能有机会驱逐他们，夺回我的家园。\n\n他们可以保留黑石山。我希望那座山会再次爆发，彻底毁灭他们。我想得到现在被称为燃烧平原的那个地方，那里本来是赤脊山脉中属于我的那一部分，却被他们的烈焰统治者摧毁了。\n\n$C，我要让全世界知道，我的国土上到底蕴含着怎样的力量。我会在他们留下的死亡与欺诈之上建立一个和平公正的王国。我的守望已经结束。现在我要奋勇作战，夺回应属于我的东西。\n\n为此，我将不惜牺牲自己的生命。"
G["I've been wiped out!"]="我精疲力尽了！"
G["I've been wondering when I would be fighting you."]="我一直在想，什么时候才能与你对决。"
G["I've been working on a way to transport oil underground between major cities, but everyone tells me it's a pipe dream."]="我一直在研究在大城市间通过地下通道运送石油的方法，但是每个人都认为我是在做白日梦。"
G["I've been wrastlin' celestials all mornin'!"]="我一早上都在跟至尊天神们搏斗！"
G["I've brewed up a real fight if you think you can handle it."]="我酝酿着一场真正的战斗，就看你能不能应付了。"
G["I've brought in the best gnomes we've got to get those doors open, $n! They're estimatin' that it's gonna take another $4939W days before that door comes down!"]="我派出了我们最强干的侏儒来对付这些大门，$n！根据他们的计算，打开那道大门还需要$4939W天！"
G["I've brought some food for you."]="我给你带回一些食物。"
G["I've calculated the probability of my success, and it's distressingly low!"]="我估算了一下胜出的概率，发现这种可能性低得要命！"
G["I've changed my mind, go get that one instead!"]="我改主意了，现在我要的是这个！"
G["I've changed my mind."]="我改主意了。"
G["I've collected so much data on serpents in the wild!"]="我已经在野外收集到那么多有关翔龙的数据了！"
G["I've come at your call, Stonemother."]="我听从你的召唤而来，石母。"
G["I've come back to my old home so my knowledge may be passed on.  Unlike the mindless undead around me, I've chosen this unlife for my own reasons.\n\nThe silithid are formidable opponents, $n.  I've learned to respect them as much as I despise them.\n\nMuch of their deadliness comes from the strength and lightness of their chitin, which I've learned to work into armor.  As we seem to have a common enemy I shall teach you my trade."]="我回到我的故乡，以让我的知识得以延续。我和那些没有头脑的亡灵不一样，我出于自己的原因选择了现在的状态。\n\n异种虫类是强大的对手，$n。我学会了尊重它们和藐视它们。\n\n它们的致命之处在于它们外壳的构造，我可以将这些甲壳制成盔甲。我们有着同样的敌人，因此我可以把这种技能传授给你。"
G["I've come for our order of Scallions."]="我是来取预定的小葱的。"
G["I've come to believe Soo-holu was left here to guard the shrines, but like the shrines, he's powerless without the right crystals."]="我相信，造物主将索乌霍鲁留在这里保护祭坛。但是和祭坛一样，没有合适的水晶，他就没法发挥能力。"
G["I've come to finish my task."]="我是来做个了断的。"
G["I've come to realize our path was a false one. We were betrayed by the man we called our prince. In his lust for power, he sent the felblood to attack us, and to spirit M'uru away to the Sunwell."]="但我认识到我们走上了一条错误的道路。那个被我们称为王子的男人背叛了我们。因为他对力量的渴望，他派出了魔血精灵攻击我们，还把穆鲁带去了太阳之井。"
G["I've come too far to be chased off by a few undead bullies."]="我已经走了这么远，绝不可能被几个亡灵混混吓退。"
G["I've conjured a Blizzard, lead them into it!"]="我召唤了暴风雪，把他们引进去！"
G["I've consulted my fellow imps, and we think YES, except for that one imp."]="我跟其他的小鬼开会讨论了一下，答案是“是”。不过有一个小鬼投了反对票。"
G["I've dabbled in various forms of restorative magic, from the power of the tides to the might of the divine, but my true calling will always be to the grace of the mists."]="我对各种形式的恢复魔法都有所涉猎，从潮汐之能到神圣之力，但我真正擅长驾驭的始终是雾之优雅。"
G["I've decided to search for the Vale. I must find the Sacred Pools and study their healing powers."]="我决心去寻找那座溪谷。我一定要找到圣池，并研究一下它们的治疗力量。"
G["I've decided to search for the Vale... Vale... Vale..."]="我决心去寻找那座溪谷……溪谷……溪谷……"
G["I've decided to write a book. \"The Mysteries of Mogu Magic.\" Has a nice ring to it, don't you think?"]="He decidido escribir un libro: \"Los misterios de la magia mogu\". Suena bien, ¿verdad?"
G["I've destroyed his shield, unleash your power now!"]="我摧毁了他的护盾，释放你的能量吧！"
G["I've destroyed the key! Your cherished archmage belongs to Malygos!"]="钥匙已经被我摧毁了！你们那位尊贵的大法师归玛里苟斯了！"
G["I've done all I can for the wounded here. Twinbraid has all the bodies he'll get.\nI'm defending the injured... unless you have a better plan?"]="He hecho lo que he podido por los heridos. Trenzado tiene todos los efectivos posibles.\n\nVoy a defender a los heridos... a no ser que tengas un plan mejor."
G["I've done all that you've asked of me. I'm ready for the trial of stone."]="我已经完成了你所有的要求。我已经准备好接受石之试炼了。"
G["I've done it!\n\nUsing sapphire from the chamber's adornments, I have fashioned a pair of goggles. With them, I am able to see things...Amazing things!\n\nWith luck, my next entry will find me a newly rich man!"]="我成功了！\n\n利用从这座建筑物的装饰上取得的蓝宝石，我拼出一副眼镜。我能够通过它看到……无比神奇的东西！\n\n运气好的话，我在写下一篇日记的时候就会是一个富翁了！"
G["I've done it! I have harnessed the power of the stone into the goggles! Let's get out of here!"]="我完成了！我把石头的能量注入了护目镜！咱们赶快从这里出去吧！"
G["I've done my time in the trenches, and spent many years training the pups. It's good to be home. No matter what has become of it, this is my home."]="我在战壕中渡过了很久，还花了很多年来训练小狗们。回家的感觉真好。无论它变成了什么样子，那始终是我的家。"
G["I've dreamed of being here today. This is it! This is going to be the day I win the tournament!"]="我一直梦想来到这里。就是这地方！我将在今天赢得比赛！"
G["I've dreamed of roaming the halls of the titans for years. I never thought I'd be pitted against their creations."]="多少年来，我做梦都想在泰坦之城游览。没想到今天居然要跟他们创造的东西作战。"
G["I've dug my own grave..."]="我真是自掘坟墓……"
G["I've encountered some of his underlings out in the field. They've been quite hostile."]="我已经在战场上遭遇了他的一些部下。他们的能力相当强大。"
G["I've endured horrors you cannot possibly comprehend. Defeating you will be simple."]="我经历过你们无法想象的恐惧。击败你们就是小菜一碟。"
G["I've endured much hardship to complete my research and with your help, $n, I've finally done it. Here's to a brighter future!"]="为了完成我的研究，我忍受了许多的苦难。在你的帮助下，$n，我终于成功了。我们将会获得一个美好的未来！"
G["I've faced the best that Stormwind has to offer, and still I stand."]="我曾经面对过暴风城最强的战士，而我还是站在这儿。"
G["I've failed.  The Light has abandoned me."]="我失败了。圣光抛弃了我。"
G["I've failed... peace is impossible."]="我失败了……和平是不可能出现的。"
G["I've figured out how this works. I'm taking control!"]="我知道是怎么回事了，我来控制！"
G["I've filled out all the paperwork for the auction house."]="我已经填写了进入拍卖行所需的全部文件。"
G["I've filled out my paperwork for the bank."]="我已经填好了进入银行所需的文件。"
G["I've filled out my paperwork to enter the city."]="我已经填好了入城所需的文件。"
G["I've finally caught up with you, Arthas."]="我终于追上你了，阿尔萨斯。"
G["I've finally reached Lakeshire-- come one, come all, and take advantage of Antonio Perelli's wonderful deals."]="我终于到湖畔镇了——大家都来啊，安东尼奥·皮雷利卖的可都是价廉物美的好东西啊。"
G["I've fought Virmen more clever than you."]="我对付过的兔妖都比你聪明。"
G["I've found a bone, look!"]="我找到一根骨头，看！"
G["I've found an incredible site!\n\nThe whole area pulsates with the hum of ancient architecture.\n\nIf it were not so late in the day, I would investigate the chamber immediately!\n\nSleeping, tonight, will be a struggle..."]="我发现了一个令人难以置信的地方！\n\n这里到处都闪耀着古代文明的光辉。\n\n如果不是因为今天太晚了，我真想立刻就对这座建筑展开调查！\n\n今晚估计我要睡不着觉了……"
G["I've found it sometimes helps to change things up a bit."]="我发现，有时适当地做些改变是好的。"
G["I've found that when I throw something into this water, it has improved incredibly when I retrieve it."]="我发现当我把什么东西扔进水里然后再拿回它时，它已经明显变大了。"
G["I've found your precious sceptre. Hurry, take it!"]="我找到你的宝贝权杖了。快拿上它！"
G["I've gathered them here for you, master."]="主人，我已经为您把它们搜集好了。"
G["I've given you the information, $r! You're wasting your time...."]="我所知道的统统告诉你了，$r！你这是在浪费时间……"
G["I've gone easy on you thus far, but now you bore me. Witness the magnificence of my power, and despair!"]="我一直没把你们当回事，但现在你们已经激怒了我！感受我的力量，陷入绝望的深渊吧！"
G["I've gone too long without visiting the front, Gao-Ran. Your long efforts are appreciated."]="高岚，我已经很长时间没有视察前线了。感谢你长期以来的努力。"
G["I've got Keg Protector marks to redeem..."]="我要兑换酒桶保卫者的戳记……"
G["I've got a LITTLE somethin' special for ya this time, folks! You aren't half the man of this half-man! $n vs. the vicious Wildhammer... SULLY KNEECAPPER!!!"]="接下来为大家准备了个特别的节目！你们在这家伙面前简直渺小如微尘！$n对决凶残的蛮锤斗士……萨利·碎膝！！！"
G["I've got a bad feeling about this."]="我对此有种不好的感觉。"
G["I've got a bad feeling about this.  If something happens to me, head back to Amberpine lodge and report to Lieutenant Dumont."]="我隐约觉得事情不妙。如果我有个什么闪失，请你返回琥珀松木营地向杜蒙特中尉汇报情况。"
G["I've got a bad feeling about this..."]="我对此有一种不祥的感觉……"
G["I've got a game plan, kid!"]="我有一个有趣的计划，孩子！"
G["I've got a great joke for you!"]="我这有个好玩的笑话！"
G["I've got a hankerin' to do some fishin'!"]="好想钓鱼啊！"
G["I've got a history with fire elementals, you know. I consider myself somewhat of an expert on the subject."]="要知道，我研究火元素已经有一段时间了。我想，在这方面我应该是个专家。"
G["I've got a jade delivery for you."]="我有一块玉石要交给你。"
G["I've got a lead on Norgannon's keystone, which guards access to Ulduar's archives, but the Titans divided it into two pieces and secreted them away.\n\nOne of the pieces, the keystone's shell, is held within the Inventor's Library on the northern coast, south of Ulduar itself. The first thing you'll need to do is retrieve the fragments of an access disk from the library's guardians."]="我已经找到了诺甘农钥石的线索，有了它就能进入奥杜尔的档案室；但是泰坦将钥石分成了两块并分别藏了起来。\n\n钥石的外壳藏在北部海滩的创世者图书馆里，就在奥杜尔以南。首先，你要从图书馆守护者那里获得访问磁盘的碎片。"
G["I've got a man! Now take a hike!"]="我已经心有所属了！你给我滚远点！"
G["I've got a new jade shipment for you."]="我给你送了一批新玉石来。"
G["I've got a nice lead, yet. Think I'll do some fishin'."]="哎呀，我领先很多了嘛。我去钓会儿鱼好了。"
G["I've got a preliminary report about the gravimetric disruptions."]="我得到了一份关于重力破坏的初步报告。"
G["I've got a present for ye! Here, let me just get it out of my gun..."]="我为你准备了一个礼物！来吧，我这就把它从我的枪膛里掏出来……"
G["I've got a proposition for you: You die now."]="我给你一个建议：现在就死吧。"
G["I've got a pulse!"]="我感觉到脉搏了！"
G["I've got a ride to Irontree Clearing waiting for me on behalf of Fez Hobnob."]="我刚刚代表费兹·霍布诺布去过铁木工程营。"
G["I've got a special mix for you!"]="我给你准备了一些特别的！"
G["I've got agents on every continent in the world and none of them can give me a clear picture of what happened in Orgrimmar!"]="我的密探遍布各个大陆，可没有一个人能明白地告诉我，奥格瑞玛到底出了什么事！"
G["I've got all the cooking supplies you'll ever need, mon!"]="我这里有你所需要的所有烹饪材料，伙计！"
G["I've got all this fruit here. Could you brew up some hooch for me?"]="我这里有各种各样的水果，你能帮我酿些果酒吗？"
G["I've got an idea troll.  How about you tell me about Drak'Tharon, then I let old Ironhide have a snack?"]="我有个主意。不如你告诉我达克萨隆的情况，然后我就给老铁皮送些点心？"
G["I've got an idea, Bailey..."]="拜雷，我想到一个办法……"
G["I've got at least fifteen people waiting in line ahead of you. Hard to tell - it's a little busy in here right now."]="你前面至少还有十五个人。这很难说——现在人有点儿多。"
G["I've got backup. Watch this."]="我自然有办法。瞧瞧这个。"
G["I've got five kids, $g man:lady;! They'll die without me!"]="¡Tengo cinco hijos, $gseñor:señora;! ¡Sin mí morirán!"
G["I've got fresh meat, fish and mushrooms.  And plenty to drink!"]="我得到了足够的鲜肉、鱼和蘑菇。还有很多喝的！"
G["I've got it this time!"]="这次我成功了！"
G["I've got it: Squeezeable rocks!"]="我有个好点子：可挤压的石头！"
G["I've got its attention! Give it everything you've got!"]="我吸引了它的注意！全力攻击！"
G["I've got just the thing!"]="这玩意儿刚好能派上用场！"
G["I've got most of the basic carving done, but it needs to be tested before I can continue. Are you willing to help me with that, $n?"]="我已经把大部分基础图案雕刻好了，在完成雕刻之前需要测试一下。你愿意帮我测试吗，$n？"
G["I've got muffins right over here.  Come on over!"]="我有松饼。到我这里来！"
G["I've got my eye on you, $n. Let's just say that only one of us will be leaving this island, and that goblin's name begins with Trade Prince!"]="No te quito el ojo de encima. Solo uno de nosotros saldrá de esta isla, ¡y su nombre empieza por Príncipe mercante!"
G["I've got my eye on you, $r."]="我被你吸引住了，$r。"
G["I've got my eye on you, Faranell."]="我会盯着你的，法拉尼尔。"
G["I've got my hands full around here, but The Heartland is prospering."]="我已经快要忙死了，但汇风岭正日益繁荣。"
G["I've got my hands full here at the moment, $c.\n\nWhat can I do for you?"]="我现在很忙，$c。\n\n我能为你做什么呢？"
G["I've got plenty of cured bacon, but he had some for breakfast."]="我还有好些熏肉，不过早上他吃了一些。"
G["I've got plenty of great recipes for you to take a look at, and at discounted prices, too!"]="我有许多处方可供选择，我还可以为你打折！"
G["I've got some secrets of my own, rogue."]="我自己也有一些小秘密，潜行者。"
G["I've got the best heals, anywhere!"]="我有最好的治疗手段，独此一家，别无分号！"
G["I've got the brains, you've got the muscle. Together, we'll make beautiful carnage."]="我有脑子，你有力气。只要齐心协力，我们就能打个漂亮仗。"
G["I've got the proper amounts of mud and hide, but not enough thread to hold it together."]="我已经有了适量的软泥和皮革，可用来缝制的线还不够。"
G["I've got to get back to work!"]="我必须回去干活儿了！"
G["I've got to get this to Ratchet and nothing's going to stop me!"]="我要把这个带到棘齿城去，没有什么东西能阻止我！"
G["I've got to keep the arcane wards charged."]="我维持着那些奥术结界的能量。"
G["I've got to quit smoking! Give me a minute to catch my breath."]="我真该戒烟了！稍等片刻，让我喘口气……"
G["I've got too much to do and not enough time to do it in, $r! Please, get out of my way."]="事情太多，时间太少，$r！拜托，别挡我的道。"
G["I've got too much to do and not enough time to do it in, $r! Please, get out of my way.\n\nIf you're infected with the maggot slime or ghoul rot, I might be able to help you."]="事情太多，时间太少，$r！拜托，别挡我的道。\n\n但如果你中了蛆毒或食尸鬼疫病的话，我可以帮助你。"
G["I've got what you need!"]="我有你需要的！"
G["I've got you. That was close!"]="我救下你了！好险啊。"
G["I've got you..."]="我会帮你的……"
G["I've got your back, $n."]="包在我身上，$n。"
G["I've got your back, $p."]="我会支持你的，$p。"
G["I've got your jade right here."]="我把你的玉石送来了。"
G["I've grown quite interested in mogu culture and history. I would call it a bit more than a passing hobby."]="我对魔古族的文化和历史相当感兴趣。我这可不是一时心血来潮。"
G["I've grown used to cleaning up your messes."]="我已经习惯于帮你收拾残局了。"
G["I've had about enough of this aleless inbreed!"]="这些不喝啤酒的杂种已经让我受够了！"
G["I've had better."]="我吃过比这更好的面。"
G["I've had enough of this jungle!"]="我对这片森林已经受够了！"
G["I've had enough of this!"]="我受够了！"
G["I've had enough of this!  Time to take a break..."]="赞吉尔受够了！现在该休息……"
G["I've had it! Find someone else to guard your precious turd filled base!"]="我受够了！找别人来守你这满是粪便的鬼地方吧！"
G["I've had just about enough of your incessant whining, captain. What are you even a captain of? I mean, the nerve!"]="我受够了，不要再抱怨了，队长。你这算什么队长？你的勇气呢？"
G["I've had my fill of this place. Let us depart."]="我受够这个鬼地方了。我们走吧。"
G["I've had quite enough of this place. Goodbye."]="我受够这个地方了。再见。"
G["I've had tougher craps."]="我见过比你更强硬的废物。"
G["I've half a mind to cut you both down where you stand! The other half isn't arguing!"]="我的左边脑袋劝我把你们俩就地解决了！我的右边脑袋对此毫无异议！"
G["I've heard about enough a' yer snivelin'! Shut yer flytrap before I shut it for ye'!"]="哭哭闹闹！没完没了！我都听烦了！你们要是不能闭上嘴，我来帮你们！"
G["I've heard about this Nesingwary guy, out of Stranglethorn Vale, hunting all sorts of beasts for sport.\n\nFor SPORT. What a complete idiot, right? Think of all the profit he's letting rot in the field!"]="我听说过这个叫奈辛瓦里的家伙。他来自于荆棘谷，以猎捕各种野兽为乐。\n\n他认为这是一种运动。真是个彻头彻尾的白痴，对不对？真不知道他到底把多少值钱的东西扔在田野里，任由它们烂掉！"
G["I've heard from the other trainees that you can find rare onyx eggs at Windward Isle. I've looked and looked, but I haven't found any yet!"]="我听其他受训者说，在临风岛上能找到玛瑙翔龙蛋。我找啊找啊，可却一个都没找到！"
G["I've heard it said that Deneb Walker, holed up in Stromgarde, has a book that is sure to help improve your First Aid techniques."]="我听说居住在激流堡的德尼布·沃克有一本书，这本书一定能帮助你提高急救技能。"
G["I've heard much about you, $n.  The world needs people like you now more than ever."]="我听说过许多关于你的事情，$n。这个世界比以往更加需要像你这样的人。"
G["I've heard nothing but tales of how peaceful and beautiful this vale was, far before any of us were ever allowed in. Now that we're here, there's all manner of beasty trying to smash our head or bite off our feet.\n\nSo are the tales a lie, or are we just horrid company? I humbly exclude myself from the latter possibility, because to consider such would be silly."]="早在很久之前，我就听说这是个非常宁静、美丽的山谷，那个时候没有人被允许进入。现在我们置身其中，发现到处都是形形色色的野兽，不是想打碎我们的脑袋就是想咬掉我们的脚。\n\n所以这个传说是个谎言，或者说我们只是令人憎恶的不速之客？我还是摒弃后一种想法吧，因为那样想的话就太自欺欺人了。"
G["I've heard of mice trapped in ale bottles before, but never in bread.  P-p-please take everything and don't speak of this to anyone."]="我听说过有老鼠被卡在啤酒瓶里，可从没听过夹在面包里。求——求——求你了，要什么尽管拿去，别和任何人提起这件事。"
G["I've heard of you, $n.  Are you here to help us?"]="我听说过你，$n。你是来帮助我们的吗？"
G["I've heard some people got outrageous fortunes."]="我听说，有些人算出来的命运很吓人。"
G["I've heard something of your exploits, $n.  I know that while you're here in Forsaken lands that you'll comport yourself with dignity and as a true hero of the sin'dorei!"]="我听说了一些关于你的探险故事，$n。我知道，当你踏上遗忘者的土地时，你会举止庄重优雅，并且把自己当作一个真正的辛多雷英雄！"
G["I've heard stories about the legendary pandaren and their exotic fighting styles. Now I want to see them."]="我听说过传奇的熊猫人英雄以及他们高超的武艺。现在我就想见识见识。"
G["I've heard tales of this one: Subetai the Swift, well known as a masterful archer and genius thief. He stole from the rich, and kept everything for himself."]="对这个人物我有所耳闻：迅影匪王速不台。传闻中他是个精通箭术的神偷。他劫富却不济贫，将偷盗之物都归为己有。"
G["I've heard tell of a truly skilled smith across the sea named Saru Steelfury. The smithy in Orgrimmar is where you should head if you wish to ply your trade, $c. Best of luck."]="我听说，海对面有个名叫萨鲁·钢怒的铁匠大师。如果你想要继续提升你的技能，就去奥格瑞玛的铁匠铺找他吧，$c。祝你好运。"
G["I've heard that gnomes can grant wishes..."]="我听说侏儒们可以实现愿望……"
G["I've heard that the azure dragonshrine is being invested with the direct power of a ley line. I will defend the temple as best I can."]="听说蓝龙军团将一条能量线的能量全部引向了碧蓝巨龙圣地。我会竭尽全力守护龙眠神殿的。"
G["I've heard that the last of the preparations are being shipped over to Silithus and should arrive in under a day. I don't want to see one of those bugs burrowing through into my mine, so I hope that someone is taking the time to assemble that Scepter of the Shifting Sands so the gong can be rung, the gates opened and the war finally begun."]="我听说最后一批战争物资正在运往希利苏斯的途中，预定将在1天内抵达。我可不想看见那些虫子在我的矿井里爬行，希望有人尽快能修复流沙节杖，敲响铜锣，打开安其拉之门，迎接这场真正的战争。"
G["I've heard that the preparations are being shipped over to Silithus and should all arrive in under $2113w days. I don't want to see one of those bugs burrowing through into my mine, so I hope that someone is taking the time to assemble that Scepter of the Shifting Sands so the gong can be rung, the gates opened and the war finally begun."]="我听说最后一批战争物资正在运往希利苏斯的途中，预定将在$2113w天内抵达。我可不想看见那些虫子在我的矿井里爬行，希望有人尽快能修复流沙节杖，敲响铜锣，打开安其拉之门，迎接这场真正的战争。"
G["I've heard that there's a dwarf in Stormwind who has achieved some fame for his hunting skill.  Maybe you should go see if he could help you."]="我听说暴风城中有个矮人因狩猎技巧高超而闻名。或许你可以找他问问看。"
G["I've heard that vrykul women cannot fight at all. If you wish to prove me wrong, you can try."]="我听说女性维库人根本不擅长战斗。如果你想证明我是错的，可以自己试试。"
G["I've heard there's a pair of Wildhammer shamans visiting the Dwarven District, so you might try your luck there.\n\nThe draenei Farseer who used to lounge about the Valley of Heroes went off to meet them, too."]="我听说有两名蛮锤萨满进入了矮人区。你也许可以去那里试试你的运气。\n\n一直待在英雄谷的那位德莱尼先知也去找他们了。"
G["I've heard this one. Tell me another..."]="这个我听过了。再给我讲一个吧……"
G["I've heard whisperings of intruders.  Be wary."]="我听到入侵者在窃窃私语。当心。"
G["I've heard your name spoken only in whispers, mage.  Who are you?"]="我只在一些低声的私语中听说过你的名字，法师。你是谁？"
G["I've hidden from my destiny long enough.  What I must do has never been clearer.\n\nLoken must be destroyed by my hand."]="长久以来，我一直不明白自己的命运。我的使命从未像现在这样清晰过。\n\n我必须亲手解决洛肯。"
G["I've known nothing but Gilneas for a very long time.  I'd feared we'd not find a place we could call home again anytime soon."]="长久以来，我对吉尔尼斯之外的世界一无所知。我深恐我们再也没办法找到一个可以称之为家园的地方了。"
G["I've learned a great deal already just by watching you in action. You fight with the fervor of youth but the experience of an old veteran. You've seen a lifetime of warfare, haven't you?"]="仅仅观察你的动作，我已获益良多。你的招式既充满年轻人的热忱，又有老手的稳健。想必你是久经沙场了吧？"
G["I've learned so much about brewing. I haven't gotten my brew just right yet, but it's getting there!"]="我学到了很多酿酒知识。我还没能酿出自己的酒，但快了！"
G["I've little more than a cursory knowledge of magical artifacts, and the blue flight has enough troubles of its own.\n\nThere was a book in the library about the blades we forged for our mortal allies, but I'm afraid I've already loaned it to a representative of the Silver Covenant. You're not the first person to come asking after information on those ancient swords, $n."]="No poseo más que un conocimiento superficial sobre artefactos mágicos y el Vuelo Azul ya tiene bastantes problemas.\n\nEn la biblioteca había un libro acerca de las hojas que forjamos para nuestros aliados mortales, pero me temo que ya se lo he prestado a un representante de El Pacto de Plata. No eres $gel primero:la primera; que viene buscando información acerca de esas antiguas espadas, $n."
G["I've little more than a cursory knowledge of magical artifacts, and the blue flight has enough troubles of its own.\n\nThere was a book in the library about the blades we forged for our mortal allies, but I'm afraid I've already loaned it to a representative of the Sunreavers. You're not the first person to come asking after information on those ancient swords, $n."]="No poseo más que un conocimiento superficial sobre artefactos mágicos y el Vuelo Azul ya tiene bastantes problemas.\n\nEn la biblioteca había un libro acerca de las hojas que forjamos para nuestros aliados mortales, pero me temo que ya se lo he prestado a un representante de los Atracasol. No eres $gel primero:la primera; que viene buscando información acerca de esas antiguas espadas, $n."
G["I've little time for talk, sorry."]="对不起，我没时间闲聊。"
G["I've lived here and kept this shrine with the blessing of the Alexstrasza for longer than I can remember.  In its darkest hour, I've failed... I fell at the feet of that damned death knight...  Bloodbane."]="我一直守护着这座被阿莱克丝塔萨女王祝福过的圣地，光阴荏苒……连我都不记得度过了多长时间。在最为黑暗的年代，我未能尽到自己的职守……我倒在了死亡骑士血毒的脚下。"
G["I've longed for a good adventure!"]="我多么渴望能有一次真正的冒险！"
G["I've lost Archmage Vargoth's Staff. Can you replace it?"]="我把大法师瓦格斯的法杖弄丢了。你能重新给我一根吗？"
G["I've lost Miniwing."]="我的迷你鹦鹉不见了。"
G["I've lost Nass..."]="我找不到纳斯了……"
G["I've lost The Eye of Haramad."]="我把哈拉迈德之眼弄丢了。"
G["I've lost count of the yaungol I've killed. How many have you gotten, $n?"]="我已经数不清自己究竟杀死多少野牛人了。你杀了多少，$n？"
G["I've lost my Arathor Battle Tabard."]="我把阿拉索战袍弄丢了。"
G["I've lost my Battle Tabard of the Defilers."]="我把污染者战袍弄丢了。"
G["I've lost my Blood Knight Tabard."]="我把血骑士战袍弄丢了。"
G["I've lost my Essence-Infused Moonstone. Can you replace it?"]="我遗失了灌注精华的月亮石。你能再给我一个吗？"
G["I've lost my Green Trophy Tabard of the Illidari."]="我把绿色伊利达雷战袍弄丢了。"
G["I've lost my Jubling."]="我的加布林不见了。"
G["I've lost my Kor'kron Flare Gun, sir. May I have another?"]="我把库卡隆信号枪弄丢了。能再给我一把吗？"
G["I've lost my Loremaster's Colors."]="我弄丢了博学者的罩衫。"
G["I've lost my Prairie Chicken."]="我的农场小鸡不见了。"
G["I've lost my Purple Trophy Tabard of the Illidari."]="我把紫色伊利达雷战袍弄丢了。"
G["I've lost my Scepter of Celebras."]="我把塞雷布拉斯节杖弄丢了。"
G["I've lost my Shadowforge Key."]="我把暗炉钥匙弄丢了。"
G["I've lost my Smolderweb hatchling."]="我的烟网小蜘蛛不见了。"
G["I've lost my Tabard of Brute Force."]="我把蛮力战袍弄丢了。"
G["I've lost my Tabard of Conquest."]="我把征服之岛战袍弄丢了。"
G["I've lost my Tabard of Summer Flames."]="我把夏日烈焰战袍弄丢了。"
G["I've lost my Tabard of Summer Skies."]="我把夏日天空战袍弄丢了。"
G["I've lost my Tabard of the Achiever."]="我把成就战袍弄丢了。"
G["I've lost my Tabard of the Argent Dawn."]="我把银色黎明战袍弄丢了。"
G["I've lost my Tabard of the Explorer."]="我把探索者战袍弄丢了。"
G["I've lost my Tabard of the Hand."]="我把阿古斯之手战袍弄丢了。"
G["I've lost my Tabard of the Protector."]="我把保卫者的战袍弄丢了。"
G["I've lost my Violet Signet and seek a replacement."]="我把紫罗兰徽记给弄丢了，请再给我一个。"
G["I've lost my Zandalar Madcap's Tunic and require a new one, Falthir."]="我搞丢了我的赞达拉狂妄者外套，现在需要一个新的，法希尔。"
G["I've lost my balloon."]="我的气球不见了。"
G["I've lost my ensorcelled choker!"]="我的迷惑项圈不见了！"
G["I've lost my key to Karazhan."]="我把卡拉赞的钥匙弄丢了。"
G["I've lost my key to Scholomance."]="我把通灵学院的钥匙弄丢了。"
G["I've lost my key to Searing Gorge."]="我把灼热峡谷的钥匙弄丢了。"
G["I've lost my key to The Arcatraz."]="我把禁魔监狱的钥匙弄丢了。"
G["I've lost my key to The Shattered Halls."]="我把破碎大厅的钥匙弄丢了。"
G["I've lost my key to the Violet Hold."]="我丢掉了紫罗兰要塞的钥匙。"
G["I've lost my lashtail hatchling."]="我的鞭尾幼龙不见了。"
G["I've lost my medallion, Xi'ri."]="我弄丢了我的勋章，克希利。"
G["I've lost my panther cub."]="我的猎豹幼崽不见了。"
G["I've lost my sprite darter hatchling."]="我的精龙宝宝不见了。"
G["I've lost my totemic beacon - may I have another?"]="我把图腾信标弄丢啦，能再要一个吗？"
G["I've lost my wolpertinger."]="我的鹿角小飞兔不见了。"
G["I've lost my worg pup."]="我的座狼幼崽不见了。"
G["I've lost the cure, Doc! Tell me you got more!!!"]="医生，我把解药弄丢啦！再给我一些！！！"
G["I've lost the key to the Shattered Halls."]="我把破碎大厅的钥匙弄丢了。"
G["I've lost the sparrowhawk whistle you gave me. Can you replace it?"]="我弄丢了你给我的麻鹰哨。能再给我一个吗？"
G["I've lost track of how long we've been walking now."]="我已经不知道我们走了多久了。"
G["I've made a mental note, mogu are light sleepers.  Pass the word."]="我总结出来一条规律，魔古都睡得不沉。去转告别人吧。"
G["I've made a portal to Orgrimmar. Who wants to kick some Horde butt?"]="我开启了一道通往奥格瑞玛的传送门。谁想要猛踹部落的屁股？"
G["I've made it a point not to argue with a dwarf when it comes to the earth.  If the Bronzebeards are sure this tablet will help solve the earth's problems, then by all means we should support them."]="我已经说过，凡是跟大地有关的事情都别跟矮人争。要是铜须家族的人相信这块石板能解决困扰大地的难题，那我们就该尽力支持他们。"
G["I've made no mistakes."]="我从不犯错。"
G["I've made up my mind.  Make me forget my alchemy mastery!"]="我下定决心了。让我遗忘炼金专精吧！"
G["I've made up my mind.  Make me forget my tailoring specialty!"]="我下定决心了。让我遗忘我的裁缝专精吧！"
G["I've managed to work myself into quite a spot here. Far Seer Regulkut tried to warn me, but my carelessness has finally caught up with me.\n\nI came down here to study the ruins of Zeth'Gor, but ran afoul of the Legion on my way. Now, all I have to show for it is a nasty gash on my leg."]="是我把自己弄成这般田地的。先知雷古库特曾想警告我，但是粗心最终让我变成了这样。\n\n我是来这里研究塞斯高废墟的，但是在路上与燃烧军团发生了冲突。现在，我能给你们看的就只有腿上那道化脓的伤口。"
G["I've mastered catching fish, now on to catching yaungol!"]="我已经掌握了捕鱼的技巧，现在要去捕野牛人了！"
G["I've met cabin boys who were manlier than you. To think I ever wasted my time..."]="就连我遇到的船上服务生都比你有男人气概。真没想到我居然在你身上耽误那么多时间……"
G["I've misplaced my Zandalar Haruspex's Bracers and require another pair."]="我的赞达拉占卜师护腕丢了，需要一付新的。"
G["I've misplaced the Brazier of Beckoning!"]="我把召唤火盆弄丢了！"
G["I've never been fascinated by ancient artifacts, but this mission has proven more dangerous than I thought."]="我向来不痴迷古代神器，可这次的任务确实比我想象中更加危险。"
G["I've never been more proud ta be a Darkspear. Vol'jin leads us ta glory."]="作为暗矛部族的一员，是我最大的光荣。沃金将领导我们赢取巨大的荣耀。"
G["I've never been more ready."]="我从来没有如此准备充足过！"
G["I've never been so happy! I wish this night would never end!"]="我从来没有这么快乐过！我希望这个夜晚永远不要结束！"
G["I've never experienced cold like this, $r. Even in the absence of ice and snow, the frozen wastes of Northrend are extremely taxing."]="我从未到过这么冷的地方，$r。就算是没有冰雪覆盖，在诺森德的冰荒废土上行走还是异常艰难。"
G["I've never felt better! Thank you!"]="我的感觉从没这么好过！谢谢你！"
G["I've never fought much, but this is exciting!"]="我很少打架，但这真的很刺激！"
G["I've never had such excellent noodle soup before. What's the secret?"]="我从没吃过这么好吃的汤面。你们有什么秘诀吗？"
G["I've never heard of a tikbalang in my life. In fact, the Scryers tell me they can't find a single mention of one in their libraries..."]="我出生至今就没听说过什么提克巴朗。事实上，占星者们说他们在图书馆中也没有找到任何提及提克巴朗的资料……"
G["I've never heard of mogu gathering in such large numbers before."]="我从没听说魔古族如此大规模的集结过。"
G["I've never performed this ritual. I don't know what will happen, exactly."]="我从来没有举行过这样的仪式。我根本就不知道接下来会发生什么。"
G["I've never seen a $c like $g him : her; before. $G He's : She's; already beaten the yaungol!"]="Nunca antes había visto semejante $c. ¡Ya ha derrotado a los yaungol!"
G["I've never seen a finer $c than $n, and neither have you!"]="¡Nunca he visto a $gun:una; $c mejor que $n, y vosotros tampoco!"
G["I've never seen a flying tree before. Let's get closer!"]="我还从没有见过一棵飞行的树呢。让我们再靠近些！"
G["I've never seen a gnome clean house like that, kid. I could use someone like you to take care of the rest of those pirates, permanently."]="我从没见过想那样的侏儒大清洗，孩子。我可以派你这样的人去解决所有那些剩下的海盗，永久性的。"
G["I've never seen anyone fight like that before! You were incredible."]="我以前还从未见到过如此精彩的打斗！你可真了不起。"
G["I've never seen anyone get a vision from these waters so easily.\n\nThen again, I can't remember the last time a jinyu came to visit us and then stuck his face in the water..."]="我从未见过有人如此轻易就从水中看到幻象。\n\n不过，我都不记得上次锦鱼人是何时来访，然后把脸扎进水里的了……"
G["I've never seen anything like it. No concentration or loss of awareness while the subject is dominated. What did you do to her?"]="我从来没见过这样的情况。一个生物居然能够在没有失去自己意识的情况下被控制。你对她作了什么？"
G["I've never seen anything like the water here. It speaks, but I know not what it says."]="我从没见过这样的水。它会说话，可我听不懂它说的是什么。"
G["I've never seen anything like these nether dragons. They seem to have inherited their sire's temperment, but they have become something entirely different."]="我从来没见过像虚空龙那样的生物。他们似乎继承了祖先的性格，但他们已经变得完全不同了。"
G["I've never seen anything like this before. I'm glad that you're here."]="我从未见过这样的场面。有你陪同真是太好了。"
G["I've never seen anything like this."]="我从没见过这样的东西。"
G["I've never seen anything quite like this!  I think I'll be healing a lot of pets after the tournament is over."]="我从没见过类似的东西！等比武大会结束之后，恐怕有很多宠物需要我的治疗了。"
G["I've never seen destruction like this..."]="我从未见过如此严重的破坏程度……"
G["I've never seen one of you around here."]="我没见过你这样的家伙。"
G["I've never seen one this size before! I can't wait to send it back for research..."]="我从来没见过这么大个的！我要赶快把它送回去进行研究……"
G["I've never seen roots like this before!"]="我从没见过这样的根！"
G["I've never seen so many different kinds of mushrooms in one place. Given enough time, I'm sure I could find a use for all of them."]="我从没有在同一个地方看到过这么多的蘑菇。给我足够的时间，我保证可以找到它们的所有用处。"
G["I've never seen something like this before! Look at the extension of the jawbone..."]="我从来没见过像这样的东西！看看额骨的延伸处……"
G["I've never seen something so beautiful in all my life!"]="我这一辈子都没有见过这么美的东西！"
G["I've never seen them in such numbers..."]="它们的数量如此庞大，真是前所未见……"
G["I've never seen you so eager to cause harm to someone, sister.  Such a pleasant development... very well, go!"]="我还没见过你如此迫切地想要给他人留下痛苦的回忆呢。这是进步呢……很好，去吧！"
G["I've never understood your type. The hero..."]="我真是搞不懂你这样的人物。英雄……"
G["I've never witnessed such heroics and selflessness."]="我从没见过这般的壮举与无私。"
G["I've never worked a day in my life. That's just one of the many benefits of being nocturnal!"]="我这辈子从没干过一整天的活儿。这只是做夜猫子的诸多好处之一。"
G["I've never worked this hard before in my life! I don't like it!"]="我从小到大都没这么玩命工作过！我不喜欢这样！"
G["I've no love for Garrosh, dat much is sure, but leavin' tha Horde is not a decision I be takin' lightly."]="我并不喜欢加尔鲁什，但离开部落对我来说，是一个非常艰难的决定。"
G["I've no need to fight you, for it appears I've already won.  You cannot stop our attack on Darkshore and save Hyjal at the same time!"]="我根本不用和你作战，因为我显然已经赢了。你不能在阻止我们攻击黑海岸的同时，还能救得了海加尔山！"
G["I've not seen a more well-trained group of soldiers in all my years."]="像你们这样训练有素的部队，我还是第一次看见。"
G["I've not seen finer armor made in many years $n. Not since I trained under Grumnus Steelshaper in the Great Forge. I bet he could teach ye things about makin armor that would spark yer interest."]="$n，我已经许久没有看见过有上好的护甲被锻造出来了。我以前曾经在大锻炉的格鲁努斯·削钢那里接受过训练。我相信如果你去他那里的话，肯定可以学到很多东西。"
G["I've not spoken with the strangers, but I bore witness to their champion treading deep into the Crumbling Depths and returning unscathed.  It is clearly capable."]="我还没有和那些外来者交谈过，但是我已经见证了他们的勇士深入碎岩之渊，并毫发未损地回来。它的能力毋庸置疑。"
G["I've nothing for the likes of you, Cailan. For the last time, get out of this shop."]="我没有任何东西给像你这样的家伙，塞伊兰。像上次那样，滚出这个店。"
G["I've only done this once before... Hopefully this works."]="我以前只做过一次……希望这次能成功。"
G["I've only spent a day with you, and we've already seen this entire valley."]="而我和你在一起才一天，就看遍了整座山谷。"
G["I've opened a portal to Stormwind.  Get in there and kick some butt!"]="我开启了一道通往暴风城的传送门。穿过它，猛踹联盟的屁股！"
G["I've overcharged the anvils. They will be VERY effective against the sha, but each one can only be used once more!"]="我让铁砧超载了。它们对付煞魔很有效，但每个只能使用一次！"
G["I've picked up Walden's foul scent. Fill the air with his blood!"]="我闻到了沃登的臭气。今天他难逃一死！"
G["I've played my part in destroying entire civilizations... to have to lower myself to dealing with the wretched Cult of the Damned disgusts me."]="在摧毁这一文明的战事中，我已经尽到了自己的义务……我不得不屈尊亲自对付诅咒神教，一想到这点就觉得恶心。"
G["I've punched it, kicked it, smacked it, thwacked it. Nothing seems to break this oubliette."]="我试着打它、踢它、拍它、凿它。可任何方法都无济于事。"
G["I've purged the Horde from Dalaran. You have what you wanted, Your Majesty: The Kirin Tor belongs to the Alliance."]="我将部落逐出了达拉然。你的目的达到了，陛下：肯瑞托将属于联盟。"
G["I've put my son, Ang, in charge of my vegetable farm, just down the hill. My nephew Liang runs the pig farm down to the west, and his father - my brother - maintains a small sheep ranch to the south of that.\n\nMy farming days are over. These days, I just gather the harvested crops and sell them to folks headed down this road. Less time on my feet, more money in my pocket."]="我让我儿子昂管理山下的菜园。我侄子梁在西边的山下经营着一个养猪场，他父亲——也就是我兄弟——在南边的山下开了个小型牧羊场。\n\n我现在不务农了。最近，我只收购别人收割的庄稼，再向路人贩卖。虽然走动得少了，但我兜里的钱却多了。"
G["I've reached my supply needs for now."]="我的供给需求得到了满足。"
G["I've rearranged the reply code - your planet will be spared. I cannot be certain of my own calculations anymore."]="我已经修改了回复代码，你们的行星得救了。我不能再对自己的计算结果深信不疑了。"
G["I've received word from my brother Brann in Northrend.  In his exploring of Ulduar he came across some unusual tablets... something ancient."]="我在诺森德的兄弟布莱恩传来了消息。在他探索奥杜尔的过程中，他见到了一些很不寻常的石板……年代相当久远。"
G["I've reconsidered... it's too dangerous to stay here. No piece of land is worth losing your life over. Let me see those evacuation orders."]="我又想了下……待在这儿太危险。生命可比土地重要多了。让我看看那些疏散令。"
G["I've recovered the second relic. Take a moment to rest, and then we'll continue to the last reliquary."]="我已经拿到了第二件圣物。休息一会，然后我们继续去最后一个净化之匣那里。"
G["I've researched this site extensively and I won't allow any dim-witted treasure hunters to swoop in and steal what belongs in a museum. I'll lead this charge."]="我详细地研究了这个地方，我不会允许任何像你们这样的窃贼进入这地方，并偷走属于博物馆的财宝。"
G["I've returned only to end this, Taerar. This land will finally have peace."]="我回来只为了结这件事，泰拉尔。这片土地终将获得平静。"
G["I've returned to invite you to my housewarming in the underworld!"]="我邀请你去地底世界参加我的乔迁庆宴！"
G["I've rigged a few control consoles down the slope. Get to one quickly and take control of the fel reaver! You'll only have a limited amount of time."]="我在斜坡下装好了几个控制器。快去那里控制魔能机甲！你的时间非常有限。"
G["I've run out of arrows! I'm afraid if any more come you will need to take them on by yourself my friend."]="我的箭用光了！如果还有来进攻的话，你们就要靠自己对付了，我的朋友。"
G["I've seen a lot of things in my time, but the change that came over the Explorers' League in the Whisper Gulch takes the cake.\n\nI'm just glad that I got out of there with my skin intact!"]="我也算得上是经历丰富吧，可这次探险者协会在低语峡谷的遭遇还是超出了我的想象。\n\n能从那里逃生，我真是万幸！"
G["I've seen a single Guardian Demon slaughter a hundred elves.  Tread lightly."]="我亲眼看到一个守护恶魔屠杀了上百个精灵。放轻脚步。"
G["I've seen a troll named Lau'Tiki fishing down south at the Darkspear Strand.  That's just on the outskirts of Sen'jin Village."]="我曾见到一个名叫劳迪克的巨魔在暗矛海滩南部钓鱼，就在森金村的外围。"
G["I've seen cats that are better guards than you!"]="论起当守卫，连猫都比你们称职！"
G["I've seen enough of this cave for a lifetime. I can't wait to get back to Kharanos."]="我这辈子看够这个洞穴了。我恨不得立即返回卡拉诺斯。"
G["I've seen enough. If I were you, I'd get to the temple and pray that you shoot straighter when it counts!"]="我看不下去了。如果我是你的话，我就会去神殿祈祷自己能打得更准一点！"
G["I've seen farmers with staves hold off trained soldiers. Do not ever underestimate the power and skill it takes to wield one of these properly."]="我看过拿着棍棒的农夫抵挡训练有素的士兵。绝不要低估正确挥舞棍棒所需要的力量和技巧。"
G["I've seen female Gnomes hit harder than you!"]="女侏儒都比你打得更狠！"
G["I've seen forks stronger than this. Forge it again!"]="餐叉都比这玩意儿坚硬。重新铸造！"
G["I've seen gnomes work harder than you, peon! Little girl gnomes - with pig tails! MOVE IT, MOVE IT, MOVE IT!"]="扎着马尾巴辫的侏儒小姑娘工作起来都比你们这些苦工努力！！给我快一点！快一点！"
G["I've seen goblins riding these things. I know they can go faster!"]="我见过地精驾驶这些东西。我知道他们可以更快的！"
G["I've seen it before - in Nagrand when he refused to lay down his mantle of Warchief, and again during his training."]="我见过这个表情。那是在纳格兰，他拒绝放下酋长的责任。在他受训时也出现过。"
G["I've seen more worthy challenges in the Ring of Blood. You waste our time, paladin."]="我在鲜血之环经历过更强大的挑战。这是浪费时间，圣骑士。"
G["I've seen terrible things happen to the furbolg over the last few years--they were victims on many fronts. But it's unclear to me what's become of this tribe. Are they corrupted by the same plague that's touched Felwood? Or perhaps they are simply angry at what's happened to their once peaceful people and now seek to defend themselves. Either way, most of them appear hostile to those who come into the area."]="过去数年来，我目睹了熊怪所经历的种种可怕的事情——它们成为战场上的无辜受害者。但是我不清楚这个部落现在怎么样了。它们被席卷费伍德森林的天灾腐化了吗？或许它们对自己曾经和平的民族所遭遇的一切表示愤怒，正试图自我保护？无论如何，它们中的大多数对进入这片领域的人都会表现出敌意。"
G["I've seen what our goblin friend can do. These dwarves are in for a nasty surprise!"]="我已经见识过了地精朋友的能耐。那些矮人这次可要大吃一惊了！"
G["I've seen you fight better den dat, Lana! You can gettem next time! Tark, get in there and giv'em hell!"]="兰纳，我感觉你比以前更出色了！你下次会打赢的！塔克，过来，让他们见识见识！"
G["I've seen you prancing around.  Why don't you do us all a favor and just drop your gear off at the armory?"]="我看你在这里跳来跳去，为什么不帮大家一个忙，把你的装备全部脱了扔在军械库里面？"
G["I've selected a landing site on the island: high ground that's easily defended."]="我已经选好了登陆点：一片易守难攻的高地。"
G["I've sent my men forward on the rooftops to secure the area around Lord Walden."]="我已经派我的部下到屋顶上去，守住沃登勋爵周围的区域。"
G["I've seriously underestimated your prowess."]="我严重低估了你的实力。"
G["I've set the Bootzooka to fire several rockets per shot. I'm fairly certain that I perfectly calibrated the targeting."]="我已经让这支地精火箭筒能够一次发射多枚火箭。相信我一定也能完美地校准它的瞄准系统。"
G["I've sharpened my claws just for this moment."]="我磨利了自己的爪子，等的就是这一刻！"
G["I've shattered the shield protecting their leader! Quickly, kill him!"]="我已经粉碎了保护他们首领的护盾。赶快消灭他！"
G["I've spent enough time with clumsy XX here that I've picked up a thing or two about treating injuries.  Perhaps I can pass some of that along to you?"]="我跟那个笨手笨脚的家伙共处过很长时间了，也学会了一两招疗伤的本领。也许我能把它们传授给你？"
G["I've spent far too long in that town.  It's a wonderful place, and I enjoyed my service there, but I think I'd prefer to stay here."]="我已经在那个镇子里浪费了太长时间。那是一个不错的地方，我很享受在那里的生活。但我想，我更喜欢留在这里。"
G["I've still got a few moves left up my sleeve!"]="我还留了好几手呢！"
G["I've still got plenty of tricks up my sleeve!"]="我还有许多招数没使出来呢！"
G["I've stood with some of you draenei before at Skettis, and others in Shadowmoon Valley. But now we're on Azeroth, and the situation looks grim."]="我曾经和一些德莱尼人在斯克提斯并肩作战，也曾经和另一些德莱尼人在影月谷对抗伊利丹。然而现在，我们是在艾泽拉斯，这里的情况看上去很艰险。"
G["I've tarried too long here. I must get back to The Shadow Vault. Farewell."]="我耽搁了太多的时间，必须返回暗影拱顶了。再见。"
G["I've trained as an alchemist once again.  I wish to specialize in elixirs."]="我打算重新接受炼金师训练。我希望在药剂制作方面有所专精。"
G["I've trained as an alchemist once again.  I wish to specialize in potions."]="我打算重新接受炼金师训练。我希望在药水制作方面有所专精。"
G["I've trained as an alchemist once again.  I wish to specialize in transmutations."]="我打算重新接受炼金师训练。我希望在元素转化方面有所专精。"
G["I've trained for this moment for years!"]="为了这一刻，我已经接受了许多年的训练！"
G["I've treated peasants, nobles, merchants' sons and beggars.  Allow me to share one piece of wisdom with you - we're all the same when staring death in the face."]="我医治过农夫、贵族、商贩和乞丐。我要告诉你一个真理：面对死亡时，我们都一样。"
G["I've tried everythin' short of a righteous beating to get these dwarves up off their lazy duffs.\n\nAre you made of sterner stuff?"]="我已经想尽办法让这些矮人勤快起来，就差把他们暴打一顿了。\n\n你难道有更严苛的招数？"
G["I've tried explaining to Salsbury time and time again that there is no possible way that I could transform him into a worgen. He refuses to listen and has instead convinced himself that if he gains my trust I will let him in on the secret.\n\nGnomes are very strange."]="我已经试着向沙尔斯巴里解释过很多次了——我没办法把他变成一只狼人。可他总是充耳不闻，反而让自己坚信，只要能获得我的信任，我就会和他分享秘密。\n\n侏儒可真是奇怪的家伙。"
G["I've waited a long time for this, Thrall. For every time I was thrown into one of your damned arenas... for every time I killed a green-skinned aberration like you... I could think of only one thing."]="这一刻我等了很久，萨尔。每当我被扔进你那该死的兽人竞技场……每当我杀死一只和你一样可憎的绿皮怪物……我都只有一个念头。"
G["I've waited for this moment for years.  Illidan and his lapdogs will be destroyed!"]="这一天我已经等待许多年了！伊利丹和他的走狗都将彻底被毁灭！"
G["I've waited here for too long.  Time to say goodbye."]="我已经在这里等待了太长时间。该是道别的时候了。"
G["I've walked by here twice now, and both times you've been sitting here by the fire, lazing around while your men work."]="我已经经过这里两次了，两次都看到你坐在火堆边上，在手下干活的时候无所事事。"
G["I've watched both of you fight, Tarenar.  You've got natural talent - more than Gidwin ever will."]="你们两个的战斗技艺我都见过，塔伦纳。你有着与生俱来的天赋——在这一点上，吉德文永远也赶不上你。"
G["I've won the Brew Toss competition six years running! I am the strongest in all of Pandaria."]="我是连续六届投掷美酒大赛的冠军！我是全潘达利亚的最强者。"
G["I've won the Brew Toss competition six years running! If you'd like, I can toss this brew all the way across the village and cause a brew strike! All you have to do is point.  Would you like that?"]="我是连续六届投掷美酒大赛的冠军！要是你喜欢，我能让这瓶美酒绕村庄飞上一圈，来个陈酿打击！你要做的只是给我指明目标。要不要试试？"
G["I, Arynia Cloudsbreak, have been tasked with protecting the sanctity of the Oracle Grove."]="Yo, Arynia Romenubes, he sido encargada de proteger la santidad del Bosque del Oráculo."
G["I, Gamon, will save us!"]="我，加摩尔，会拯救大家！"
G["I, Garrosh, son of Grom, will show you what it means to be called Hellscream!"]="我，格罗姆之子，加尔鲁什，会让你们看看地狱咆哮家族的力量！"
G["I, General Zhun, Herald of the glorious Thunder King Lei Shen, hereby challenge you!"]="我，尊贵的雷电之王雷神的使者，烛恒将军，前来向你挑战！"
G["I, Peoreth Il'danube, greatest mage within earshot, will teleport you, a peon, to the Undercity.\n\nIt should be noted that my greatness will only be felt during this period of reformation, as the regal House of Blizzard prepares a teleportation device the likes of which has never before been seen, heard, or felt.\n\nOh yes, it will be grand. So grand in fact that the fabric of time and space will itself shift, propelling the denizens of this world into a new age of prosperity..."]="我，匹欧雷斯，附近最伟大的法师，会传送你，一个苦工，去幽暗城。\n\n你应该注意到的是，我的伟大只有在这改革时期才会被感觉到，我这个皇家工程师所建造的一个以前从未有人看到过、听到过、甚至想到过的传送设施。\n\n没错，太伟大了。这项发明是如此的重要，甚至会令空间和时间的构造自行切换，推动这个世界的人民进入一个繁荣的新时代……"
G["I, Wilfred Fizzlebang, have been invited to this quaint tournament to make use of my extensive knowledge of the summoning arts. What better choice?"]="我，威尔弗雷德·菲兹班，被邀请到这座怪异的竞技场来，在这里施展我无穷的智慧和伟大的召唤技艺。当然，在这方面，这个世界上不会有比我更好的人选了。"
G["I, ah..."]="我，啊……"
G["I, like many others, came to aid my fellow druids when the war started.\n\nNow that the Gates of Ahn'Qiraj are open, I've realized that much work still remains to be done.  I've decided to stay in Silithus and do my best to help the cause, $n."]="Yo, al igual que muchos otros, vine en ayuda de mis compañeros druidas al comenzar la guerra.\n\nAhora que las puertas de Ahn'Qiraj se han abierto, me he dado cuenta de que aún queda mucho trabajo por hacer. He decidido quedarme en Silithus y hacer todo lo posible por contribuir a la causa, $n."
G["I, like my brother, honor those who honor their ancestors.  It brings me great joy to share my crafting secrets to disciples of the Lunar Festival!"]="我，就像我的哥哥一样，以那些尊重祖先的人为荣。对我来说，与欢度春节的人们一起分享我的秘密手艺是极大的快乐。"
G["I, like, so don't get it..."]="我，好像，不太明白……"
G["I. AM. UNLEASHED!"]="我自由了。"
G["I. Am. UNDEFEATED!"]="我·是·不败的！"
G["I. Have. Failed."]="我……失败了。"
G["I.. I can't... they took my children!"]="不……我不能……他们抢走了我的孩子！"
G["I...  can't take much more... (Brother, it merely begins!)"]="我……再也受不了了……（兄弟，这才刚刚开始！）"
G["I... *cough*  I thank you, stranger."]="Gr... Ejem... Gracias, $gdesconocido:desconocida;."
G["I... *cough* I have been alive for a very long time. In that time I have seen and done terrible things."]="我……*咳嗽*我已经活了很长的时间，亲眼见过，亲手做过许多恐怖的事。"
G["I... *cough* I owe you my life, stranger.  Thank you."]="我……*咳嗽*我欠你一条命，陌生人。谢谢你。"
G["I... <sniff>... I don't think I can handle the next part! Little Lu, tell $n what happened next."]="Yo... <sollozo> Creo que no soy capaz de contar lo que pasó después. Cuéntaselo tú, pequeño Lu."
G["I... Am... Released..."]="我……终于……解脱了……"
G["I... Are you...\n\n<Mootoo shivers.>\n\nAre you here to save me?"]="我……你是……\n\n<小穆图浑身颤抖。>\n\n你是来救我的吗？"
G["I... HAVE HAD ENOUGH... OF... YOU!"]="我……受够你们了！"
G["I... I am badly injured..."]="我...我受了重伤..."
G["I... I am free! Ethereum were planning on torturing me until I gave in to their requests. I fear that, had you not come along, I would have surely given in to their torment."]="我……我自由了！复仇军打算折磨我，直到我交出他们所要的东西。若不是你及时赶到，我肯定会屈服于他们的折磨。"
G["I... I am in your debt."]="我……我欠你一份情。"
G["I... I am released from his grasp... at last."]="我……我终于从他的魔掌中……解脱了。"
G["I... I am undone... The new top orc is $n!"]="我……我败了……$n才是最优秀的兽人！"
G["I... I am, sir."]="我……我是，长官。"
G["I... I barely made it off the ship before it went down!"]="我……我好不容易才在飞船坠毁前逃了出来！"
G["I... I believe so. Yes."]="是的……我想是的。"
G["I... I can see..."]="我……我能看到了……"
G["I... I can understand you now! Well, now that we can talk to each other, you have some explaining to do!"]="我……我能听懂！呃，既然我们能够对话，那么我想听听你的解释！"
G["I... I can't believe it's over. You did it! You've destroyed the blood elves and their leader!"]="我……我简直不敢相信。你成功了！你消灭了血精灵和他们的首领！"
G["I... I can't believe it... Saurfang... I... I am honored... honored to have fought along side you, sir."]="我……我真不敢相信……萨鲁法尔……我……我很荣幸……能与您并肩作战。"
G["I... I can't believe you did that! You could have died up there! The way you were wrestling with that eagle, and how you used its wings to land safely... it was amazing!\n\nIf you can do something like that, then... then I can handle some measly wolves and plainshawks! This is the dawn of a new Francis.\n\nAnd it's all thanks to you, $n."]="我……我真不敢相信，你居然做到了！你可能会死在那里啊！你与那只鹰打成一团，还利用它的双翼成功着陆……太不可思议了！\n\n既然你能做到这一切，那么……那么我也可以对付那些微不足道的狼和平原鹰！对我弗二郎来说，这是个崭新的开始。\n\n这一切都要感谢你，$n。"
G["I... I can't do it. Get back on yer ship and we'll spare yer life."]="我，我不能这样做。回到船上去，我就饶你一命。"
G["I... I can't hit him! That there bubble is too durn thick!"]="我……我打不了他！泡泡真是太厚了！"
G["I... I can't hold it! Mayday! MAYDAY!"]="我……我控制不住了！求援！求援！"
G["I... I can't! I won't!"]="我……我不能！不行！"
G["I... I can't..."]="我……我不能……"
G["I... I cannot... The blade fights me..."]="我……我竟不能……这把剑背叛了我……"
G["I... I could not save them... Damn you, Arthas! DAMN YOU!"]="我……我救不了他们……该死，阿尔萨斯！你这恶魔！"
G["I... I did not think of it that way, Warchief."]="我……我可不这样想，战争之王。"
G["I... I didn't see nothin'! He... he died of natural causes."]="我……我什么也没看见！他……他是自然死亡的。"
G["I... I do not know."]="我……我不知道。"
G["I... I don't believe it! Frostmourne stands before us - unguarded - just as the gnome claimed. Come, heroes!"]="真是……不敢相信！霜之哀伤居然……无人看管，那个侏儒说的没错。来吧，英雄们！"
G["I... I don't know what came over me."]="我……我也不知道自己是怎么了。"
G["I... I don't remember... Why have you done this?"]="我……我想不起来了……为什么你们要这样做？"
G["I... I don't think I can make it..."]="我……我觉得我不行了……"
G["I... I don't understand, popo."]="我……我不太明白，爸爸。"
G["I... I don't understand. You -- and M'uru -- knew all along that this would occur?"]="我……我不明白。您——和穆鲁——很久以前就知道会发生这一切？"
G["I... I don't understand..."]="我……我不明白……"
G["I... I don't want to die!"]="我……我不想死！"
G["I... I dun know, Brann. I've been 'ere a long time... all I 'ave of me life before this place are flashes and nightmares."]="我……我不知道，布莱恩。我在这里待了很长时间……但是在此之前的记忆，只剩下支离破碎的噩梦。"
G["I... I failed. Thank you for coming for me."]="我……我失败了。谢谢你前来找我。"
G["I... I feel like I was looking for something. But I can't remember what."]="我……我觉得我是在找寻什么东西。但又记不起来在找什么。"
G["I... I feel... I feel the touch of Elune upon my being once more... She smiles upon me... Yes... I..."]="我……我感到……我再次感受到月神的触摸……她在对我微笑……是的……我……"
G["I... I feel... happy!"]="我……我感到……很快乐！"
G["I... I got a sick grandma at home... I... I'm all she's got, $g mister:miss;."]="Mi… mi abuela está en casa enferma… soy… soy todo lo que tiene, $gseñor:señora;."
G["I... I have a plan of my own."]="我……我有自己的计划。"
G["I... I have awoken to a nightmare?"]="我要代表圣光消灭你们！"
G["I... I have died... I was in so much pain... engulfed in darkness... Can you see me, $r?"]="我……我已经死了……我承受了这么多痛苦……被卷入了黑暗……你能看到我吗，$r？"
G["I... I have failed, $n. The Lord of Bla... The Lord of Blackrock is too powerful. He consumed my energy with... with ease. I turn... I... kill me... you must... you must kill me."]="我……我失败了，$n。黑石……黑石山脉的领主实在是太强大了。他轻易地……轻易地吸收了我的力量。我已经……我……请你一定要……一定要杀了我。"
G["I... I have no control. Bound by your infernal contraption."]="我……我失去控制了。被你的疯狂装置所束缚。"
G["I... I lost control of the mines!\n\nPlease, $g sir : ma'am;, don't fire me!"]="我……我失去了对这些矿藏的控制！\n\n求求你，$g先生:女士;，不要解雇我！"
G["I... I must tell the others. You should find Huntress Selura right away."]="我……我必须告诉其它人。你立刻去找女猎手塞露拉。"
G["I... I need a boat."]="我……我需要一艘船。"
G["I... I need more time!"]="我……我需要更多的时间！"
G["I... I never knew anyone like you. You saved me, $p. More than once. I... I know it's selfish, but I have something to ask of you."]="我……我从没有见过像你这样的人。你不止一次地救了我，$P。我……我知道这样做很自私，但我还有事求你帮我去做。"
G["I... I saw my life flash before my eyes!"]="我……我差点就去见死神了！"
G["I... I suppose I'll go west, then."]="我……我想我就去西面吧。"
G["I... I think I broke it."]="我……我好像把它弄坏了。"
G["I... I think I can make it back to Irontree. We can win this!"]="我……我想我一定能回到铁木那里。我们会成功的！"
G["I... I think I saw the Lich King. It was only for a moment, but he was here... And it turned so cold, friend. So, so cold..."]="我……我看见巫妖王了。他很快就消失了，但是他确实来过这里……接着温度骤降，变得非常……非常寒冷。"
G["I... I think I see Blue..."]="我……我觉得自己看见了蓝色……"
G["I... I think I'm ready to leave now."]="我……我想，我已经准备好离开了。"
G["I... I think so...."]="我……我想是的……"
G["I... I thought I was a goner.  Thanks."]="我……我还以为自己死定了。谢谢。"
G["I... I thought I'd be here forever..."]="我……我以为永远无法脱身了……"
G["I... I want to hear about the Light.  I think... I remember..."]="我……我想听到关于圣光的事。我想……我记得……"
G["I... I was not at the Wrath Gate, but the soldiers who survived told me much of what happened. Your son fought with honor. He died a hero's death. He deserves a hero's burial."]="我……那时不在天谴之门。但活下来的士兵告诉了我当时的情况。你的儿子为荣耀而战，他英勇地战死，应该得到英雄般的厚葬。"
G["I... I wasn't meant to survive this attack."]="我……我没有想过能生还。"
G["I... I will hide it. I will hide it until I find it a home, far away from here..."]="我……我会把它藏起来，直到我为它找到一个家，一个远离这里的家……"
G["I... I will stay with you, father."]="我……我一直都会在你身边，父亲。"
G["I... I'm not really sure how I got here...\n\nI seem to remember traveling... a raft..."]="Yo... no estoy seguro de cómo llegué hasta aquí...\n\nCreo recordar que iba... en una balsa..."
G["I... I'm ok! I'm ok!"]="我……我很好！我很好！"
G["I... I've seen enough I think... so very draining..."]="我……我觉得我看够了……我已经筋疲力尽……"
G["I... I... don't... feel... right..."]="我……我……感到有些不对劲……"
G["I... It can't be..."]="不……不可能……"
G["I... It... It is beautiful. What I felt when I touched it... The Light coursed through me and I through it... It healed my spirit."]="太……太……太漂亮了。当我碰到它的时候，我感觉到……圣光在我体内流过，我觉得它……它治愈了我的灵魂。"
G["I... We are powerless. Illidan found and delivered unto the Dragonmaw their leader - Zuluhed. This orc was the one responsible for the capture and incarceration of Alexstrasza. How could we fight against such power? He captured an Aspect!\n\nAnd just as easily, he took my mate."]="我……我们无力反抗。伊利丹找到了龙喉氏族的首领祖鲁希德。他曾经参与过抓获和囚禁阿莱克丝塔萨的行动。我们要怎么才能反抗这样的力量呢？他甚至曾经捕获过一只强大的守护巨龙！\n\n而且他同样这么简单地捕获了我的配偶。"
G["I... Well, I may of taken a little thing or two from the inn... but what would an ogre care about that?"]="我……好吧，我也许从旅店里拿了一些东西……但是为什么食人魔要关心这个？"
G["I... What sorcery is this?"]="我……这是什么巫术？"
G["I... ah... oh! Did I...? Was I...? It was... so... cloudy."]="我……啊……噢！我……？眼睛……好……模糊。"
G["I... am fury... unrestrained!"]="我……就是……无尽的愤怒！"
G["I... am no longer..."]="我……完了……"
G["I... am... FOREVER!"]="我……就是永恒！"
G["I... am... FREE!"]="我……自由了！"
G["I... am... released... perhaps it's not too late to- No! I need... more... time..."]="我……自由了……，希望还不是太迟……圣光啊，请再多给我一些……时间……"
G["I... am... undone."]="事业……未尽……"
G["I... am... unleashed!"]="我……自由了！"
G["I... awaken!"]="我醒了!"
G["I... be waitin' on da udda side...."]="我会在另一个世界里等你们的！"
G["I... blew it..."]="我……搞砸了……"
G["I... can't... go on..."]="我……坚持……不住了……"
G["I... can't...."]="我……不能……"
G["I... cannot be... defeated.."]="我……不会被……打败……"
G["I... cannot begin to imagine, $n.  All I know is that I am not going to allow it to happen.  It will be destroyed - if not for our continued safety from demonic taint, then for the memory of Millicent Serene... Milli...\n\nThis, my friend, this is where I hope you will come in."]="No puedo ni imaginármelo, $n. Lo único que sé, es que no pienso permitir que eso ocurra. Hay que destruirla... Si no por mantenernos a salvo de la mancha demoníaca, al menos en memoria de Millicent Serena... Milli...\n\nY, $gamigo mío:amiga mía; espero que me ayudes."
G["I... could only see darkness... Thank you."]="我的眼中……曾经满是黑暗……感谢你。"
G["I... deserve this...."]="我……罪有应得……"
G["I... didn't see that coming...."]="我……没想到会这样……"
G["I... died.\n\nWhy am I still here? Is there no great hunting ground that I ascend to?\n\nNo... I must first complete my task. Before I can leave this world, the second part of the Cipher of Damnation must be recovered."]="我……死了。\n\n为什么我还在这里？是不是我要去的地方没有什么好的猎场？\n\n不……我必须先完成我的任务。在我可以离开这个世界前，必须找到诅咒密码的第二块碎片。"
G["I... died?\n\nYes, you're right.  I died.  It was an orc... he cut off my hands, and left me to die.\n\n<Valdred looks down at his hands.>\n\nThese aren't my hands!  THESE AREN'T MY HANDS!"]="我……死了？\n\n是的，你说得没错。我是死了。有个兽人……他切断了我的双手，任由我死去。\n\n<瓦德雷看着自己的手。>\n\n这不是我的手！这不是我的手！"
G["I... fade."]="我……要消失了。"
G["I... feel something. Is it... peace?"]="我……感觉到什么东西。是……平静吗？"
G["I... hate... you."]="我……恨……你。"
G["I... have... failed..."]="我……失败了……"
G["I... is that it over there, $n? This land is doomed if the Horde manages to set that off."]="是……是那边那个吗，$n？要是部落成功把它点着了，这座岛屿就将彻底毁灭。"
G["I... is the ground shaking?"]="大……大地在晃动吗？"
G["I... just... wanted... to... build... the... damned... bridge..."]="我……只……想……建好……这座……该死的……桥……"
G["I... lost my mask. I need a new one."]="我……我弄丢了面具。需要一个新的。"
G["I... must not...falter!"]="我……不能……失败！"
G["I... must... hold on!"]="我……必须……坚持住！"
G["I... need... sustenance."]="我……需要……食物。"
G["I... really... hate... $rs! <Should have run... we should have run!>"]="$gUn:Una;... $r... ¡$glos:las; odio! <Deberíamos haber huido... ¡Deberíamos haber huido!>"
G["I... recede."]="退潮了……"
G["I... submit. As long as Simmer agrees to stop boiling my pool, I agree to an armistice."]="我……投降。只要西米尔不再侵犯我的地盘，我愿意休战。"
G["I... thank you."]="我……谢谢你。"
G["I... think I will be safe, for now, thanks to you."]="幸亏有你，我……我想我暂时安全了。"
G["I... uh... look, I'm doing the best I can, okay?! The sprites keep knocking the orbs out of my hands, or stealing them back when I'm not looking!\n\nI hate these things!"]="我……呃……听着，我已经尽力了，好吗？！这些山精不停地敲打我的手，让宝珠从我手上掉下来，或是趁我不注意的时候把它们偷走。\n\n我恨死这些东西了！"
G["I... understand. Come, we must talk."]="我……明白。来，我们得谈谈。"
G["I... wah... where? What is going on?"]="我……在……哪儿？出什么事了？"
G["I... what happened? I feel much calmer now."]="我……出什么事了？我现在感觉平静多了。"
G["I... will tell you... nothing."]="我……什么都不会……告诉你们。"
G["I... yeah, sure. Whatever."]="我……好的，当然了。去吧。"
G["I... your majesty, we were victorious!"]="我……陛下，我们胜利了！"
G["I...I am sorry for my outburst, $n. My father and I disagree on many things."]="我……我很抱歉刚才发了火，$n。我和我父亲在很多事情上都意见相左。"
G["I...I see everything clearly now."]="我……我终于看清了一切。"
G["I...I'm free? Thank you, $gbrother:sister;."]="我……我自由了？谢谢你，$g兄弟:姐妹;。"
G["I...I'm running out of breath... I must turn back!"]="我……我快要没气了……我必须调头！"
G["I...have...failed."]="我……败……了。"
G["I...lost?"]="我……输了？"
G["I...will not...be defeated..."]="我是……不会……被打败的……"
G["I...won't let you..."]="我……不会让你……"
G["I.am.a.robot."]="我·是·机器人。"
G["IF WAR IS WHAT YOU WANT, WAR IS WHAT YOU SHALL GET, FRUIT VENDOR!"]="如果你要战争，那么我们就成全你，给你战争，水果贩！"
G["IF WAR IS WHAT YOU WANT, WAR IS WHAT YOU SHALL GET, FRUIT VENDOR!  WE WILL SEE WHO SELLS MORE OF YOUR APPLES!"]="如果你想要战争，那我就给你战争，水果贩子！我们来看看谁卖掉的苹果多！"
G["IF YOU THINK THIS IS SO EASY, GRAB A BAG AND GET TO WORK!"]="如果你觉得这很简单，带上你的包去试试！"
G["IF they say... IF!  There are no if's about Ironforge!  Eh?  What now?"]="假如他们说……假如！对铁炉堡来说没有假如！嗯？现在情况如何？"
G["IN YOUR FACE! I told you there was somethin' here!"]="哈哈！我告诉过你这里有东西的！"
G["IN-FER-NO!"]="地狱——之火！"
G["INCINERATE THEM, MINIONS!"]="奴仆们，把他们烧光！"
G["INCOMING! Do not let them through! Focus fire! NOW, NOW, NOW!"]="来了！一个都别放过！集中火力！放！"
G["INCOMING!!"]="来了！！"
G["INFERNAL RAIN ON THE RISE! TAKE COVER!"]="地狱火雨！快找掩护！"
G["INFERNALS! CLEAR THE COURTYARD!"]="地狱火！准备战斗！"
G["INFERNO!"]="地狱之火！"
G["INTERLOPER! Insect! Flea! I shall brush you away!"]="闯入者！渣滓！臭虫！我会把你打烂！"
G["INTERLOPERS! Slay them!"]="入侵者！杀光他们！"
G["INTRUDERS! GUARDIANS OF THE THRONE, AWAKEN!"]="入侵者！王座守卫，醒来吧！"
G["INTRUDERS! KILL THEM!"]="入侵者！杀了他们！"
G["INVADERS! Let the mark of the Dragonmaw guide your anger! Slay $n!"]="入侵者！让龙喉的标记引导你的怒火！杀死$n！"
G["IT BURNS! THE PAIN... SEARING..."]="燃烧起来了！疼痛……灼热……"
G["IT BURNS!!"]="它烧起来了！！"
G["IT BURNSSSSS!"]="火焰！！！"
G["IT DUZ WUT IT'S TOLD!"]="按我说的做！"
G["IT IS MINE!!"]="它·是·我·的！"
G["IT IS THE WRATH OF THE STORM KING!"]="尝尝暴风之王的怒火！"
G["IT'S A TRAP! That's a fully functional irradiator!"]="陷阱！一台全线运作的辐射器！"
G["IT'S GHOULS!!!! GHOULS!!!!"]="是食尸鬼！！！！食尸鬼！！！！"
G["IT's coming! HIDE!"]="它来了！快躲起来！"
G["Ian Duran is waiting for you in camp."]="伊安·杜兰正在营地里等你。"
G["Ice Cream! Get your tasty, cold, sweet, delicious ice cream right here!"]="冰淇淋！来吃美味、冰爽、香甜、可口的冰淇淋啰！"
G["Ice cream!"]="冰淇淋！"
G["Ice cream, Brivelthwerp. I need ice cream!"]="冰激淋，布里维普。我要冰激淋！"
