G["Iceblood Bunker is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Horde will destroy it!"]="冰血碉堡受到攻击！如果我们不尽快采取措施，部落会摧毁它的！"
G["Iceblood Tower is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Alliance will destroy it!"]="冰血哨塔受到攻击！如果我们不尽快采取措施，联盟会摧毁它的！"
G["Iceblood Tower was destroyed by the Alliance!"]="冰血哨塔被联盟摧毁了！"
G["Iceblood Tower was taken by the Horde!"]="冰血哨塔被部落占领了！"
G["Icecrown"]="冰冠冰川"
