G["Icefang clan."]="冰牙氏族。"
G["Icefang has carried me through countless battles.\n\nDon't let her lack of armor fool you. She's the toughest bear I know."]="冰牙已经陪伴我经历过无数次战役。\n\n不要被她不穿护甲的表象迷惑了。她是我见过的最聪明的熊。"
G["Icefang shows great courage for entering the battlefield unarmored.\n\nPerhaps her example could instill some courage in you, $n."]="冰牙非常勇敢，不穿盔甲也敢上战场。\n\n$n，或许她能让你鼓起勇气，面对即将到来的挑战。"
G["Icemist... Not Icemist... NO!!! Come quickly, hero! Follow me!"]="冰雾村……但愿不是冰雾村……不！！！快！英雄，跟我来！"
