G["If $G King : Queen; $n dance, me dance!"]="¡Si $G Rey : Reina; $n bailar, yo bailar!"
G["If Bloodhilt thinks a few reinforcements are going to be enough to take Lion's Landing, he's got another thing coming!"]="如果血柄认为一点点援军就足够攻下雄师港，那他就大错特错了！"
G["If Evol hadn't been so clumsy, we never would have been caught!"]="要是艾沃能稍微机灵点儿，我们绝对不会被捉住！"
G["If Fizz hadn't been so clumsy, we never would have been caught!"]="要是菲兹能稍微机灵点儿，我们绝对不会被捉住！"
G["If General Krakork found out, he'd eat us alive. Don't."]="要是让克拉库克将军发现了，他会生吞我们的，不行。"
G["If Gnoarn finds out about this, it'll be my hide!"]="如果被诺恩知道了，我会被活活扒皮的！"
G["If Hydraxis recruits more in his war, then it might shift the balance of power..."]="要是海达克西斯招募了新兵，就可能使双方的力量对比发生变化……"
G["If I am correct, $n, then this... Divine Bell... is exactly the type of weapon that Garrosh is looking for. Return to your other duties for now. I will bring this information to the Warchief myself."]="如果我没弄错的话，$n，这口……圣钟……正是加尔鲁什正在寻觅的武器。你先回去忙其他事情吧，我会亲自把这个消息告诉酋长的。"
G["If I am ever freed of these chains, I will return one day and slay you myself."]="如果能挣脱这些锁链，总有一天我会回来亲手杀了你。"
G["If I am excused, then I'd like to check on Quinn..."]="如果你没事的话，我要去看看奎恩……"
G["If I am going to die, I will die with my friends by my side.\n\nI will die knowing I did everything I could to avenge my people.\n\nI will die staring directly into the shamed face of my enemy."]="如果我快死了，我也要死在我的朋友身边。\n\n能竭尽全力为我的族人报仇，虽死足矣。\n\n能让敌人感到羞愤，虽死足矣。"
G["If I am to teach you the secrets of summoning an infernal servant, you must destroy Kroshius and bring me the infernal core from his burning remains. This, however, is not as easy as it sounds. Kroshius has all but burned out completely. You must reignite his corpse and raise him from the rubble. To do this, however, you must gather some components from other demonic entities.\n\nMy imp, Impsy, shall set you on your way."]="要想让我教你召唤地狱火仆从，你必须杀死克罗苏斯，然后从他燃烧的尸体中取出恶魔之核交给我。但是这项任务并不简单，克罗苏斯几乎已经烧尽了。你必须重新点燃他的尸体，令他复活。所以你必须从其它恶魔那儿收集一些东西才能令他复活。\n\n我的孩子，准备上路吧。"
G["If I am to understand all that is transpiring, if I am to make a difference, then my devotion must be absolute.  I must submit."]="如果我想要了解所发生的一切，如果我想要发挥作用，我就必须全身心地投入，必须真心服从。"
G["If I can make a new war machine, I know I can get a pretty penny for it over at the Wrath Gate.  \n\nSome of our previous iterations haven't been entirely... stable, but my flying machine should do the trick if I can just develop an effective bomb system for it."]="如果能制造出新型的空中作战机器，我肯定能在天谴之门大赚一笔。\n\n我们进行过多次尝试，但是效果并不……理想。可别小瞧我的飞行器，一旦我鼓捣出完善的轰炸系统，它就能成为彪悍的战斗机。"
G["If I can win a battle like that, I may have a chance against the Celestials."]="如果我能赢得这样的战斗，那我或许就有机会战胜至尊天神了。"
G["If I can't move goods to and from Kalimdor, I'll be ruined!"]="要是我不能运送货物往来卡利姆多，我就完蛋了！"
G["If I cannot find a home amongst my own people, where else am I to turn, \"Shand'do?\""]="Si no puedo encontrar mi hogar entre mi propio pueblo, ¿adónde debo dirigirme, \"Shand'do\"?"
G["If I could just find \"Magic and the Ways of Power\". Ahh here it is, what was it doing over here?"]="Si pudiera encontrar Magia y los caminos del poder\". ¡Ah, aquí está! ¿Qué estaría haciendo aquí?\""
G["If I did not know better I would think that you were mocking me, mortal; but yes, that is mostly correct. You may remain fully clothed."]="如果我不明事理的话，我会认为你是在嘲笑我，凡人。但是，那基本是最正确的做法，不过你得把全身裹起来。"
G["If I didn't know any better, I'd say this was a stone ox tail."]="如果我没记错的话，这应该是根石牛尾。"
G["If I didn't mention it earlier, $n, welcome to Bravo Company."]="Si no te lo he comentado antes, $gbienvenido:bienvenida; a la Compañía Bravo, $n."
G["If I didnt know better, I'd say this party was organized by orcs!"]="换了别人，也许会以为这次庆典是兽人举办的呢！"
G["If I die, Father, I would rather it be on my feet, standing in defiance against the undead legions! If I die, let me die with you!"]="父亲，就算死，我也要在和亡灵军团的战斗中光荣地战死！就算死，我也要和您死在一起！"
G["If I die, it will be in battle!"]="就算我死，也要死在战场上！"
G["If I don't get away from these beasts, they're going to kill me!"]="如果我不甩掉这些野兽，它们会杀了我的！"
G["If I don't have it, you don't need it!"]="我没有的东西，你也别想得到！"
G["If I don't make it back to Wintergarde, let my family know that I did my best and that I love them..."]="如果我不能重返暮冬要塞，请转告我的家人，我从未放弃过与他们团聚的梦想……"
G["If I don't work hard, I will fall behind."]="要是我不努力，就会被别人甩在身后。"
G["If I encountered enemies, I'd hit them with the smoke. Shokia's sniper rifle would take care of the rest."]="如果我遇到敌人的话，就可以用烟雾弹砸他们。夏琪亚的狙击枪会对付他们的。"
G["If I ever catch whoever keeps damaging this holo-emitter..."]="如果让我抓住破坏影像生成器的混账……"
G["If I ever find the ones responsible for the crash...!"]="如果让我找到导致坠毁的元凶……！"
G["If I ever get out of here I'm gonna crap all over your head, you pig sucking orc."]="如果我能从这里出去，我一定会在你的脑袋上拉泡屎。你这个该死的兽人。"
G["If I ever get out of here, I will CRUSH every clock I come in contact with..."]="如果我能离开这里，我要把看见的每一只钟都砸了……"
G["If I fall into the abyss, I'll take all of you mortals with me!"]="如果我要落入地狱，那么你们这些凡人也要跟我同去！"
G["If I fished ya up, I'd throw ya back. Waste of good fish meat."]="如果我钓到你，也只能扔回水里，真是浪费好鱼饵。"
G["If I had a copper for each of your great deeds, I'd be a rich kobold!"]="如果我能从您的每次大买卖中提成一个铜币，那么我将会马上变成一个富有的狗头人！"
G["If I had a silver for every time I heard the world was going to end, I'd be richer than a goblin trade prince!"]="如果我在每次听到世界末日即将到来的时候攒下一枚银币，那我现在就要比地精贸易巨头更富有了！"
G["If I had emotions, I still wouldn't feel sad about that."]="如果我有感情——那我也不会为你感到难过的。"
G["If I had my way, I'd show those puffed-up paladins a thing or two."]="只要有机会，我就让那些肥胖的圣骑士看看我的厉害。"
G["If I had my way, you would be long dead. Your kind disgusts me."]="要是照我的意思，你早就死了。你这种家伙实在让我厌恶。"
G["If I had some chestnuts, you'd better believe I'd have them roasting over an open fire.  Mmmm!"]="要是我有栗子的话，你最好相信我会将它们烤熟吃掉的。嗯！"
G["If I hadn't gotten a splinter I would be out there defending our village too!"]="如果不是因为我被刺扎到，我肯定也已经跑去守卫我们的村子了！"
G["If I have to wait much longer, I will be forced to reconsider the proposed accord between the Ethereum and the Blue Dragonflight!"]="如果再让我多等一会儿，我就要重新考虑复仇军与蓝龙军团之间的协议了！"
G["If I heard correctly, you're already doing good work for Sylvanaar.\n\nKeep it up and maybe we'll be able to keep our home here."]="如果我听说的事情都属实的话，你已经为希尔瓦纳做了很多事。\n\n继续下去，也许我们能在这里安家了。"
G["If I help the Anglers, what's in it for me?"]="如果帮助垂钓翁，我能得到些什么好处？"
G["If I hold my breath, what color would I turn?"]="如果我摒住呼吸，我会变成什么颜色？"
G["If I knew it was going to be like this, I'd have worn my Greater Boots of Laughter."]="要是我知道会这样，我就该穿上我的[大笑长靴]。"
G["If I lived in a tree I would never come down to the ground."]="如果我住在树上，我就不会再回到地面上去了。"
G["If I look woozy, slap me.  If I pass out, use the canteen.  Now let's go!"]="记住，如果我迷糊了，就抽我的耳光。如果我晕厥的话，就用这个水壶。现在，我们走吧！"
G["If I make a gift collection, what do I do with it?"]="如果我有一份大礼包，我能拿它干些什么？"
G["If I make it through, I expect a pay raise."]="如果我成功了，我希望能提薪。"
G["If I must pay with some elven blood, then so be it."]="如果我必须为此付出一些精灵的鲜血，那也未尝不可。"
G["If I must..."]="那好吧……"
G["If I prove myself to Saru he will have no choice but to let me fight for one of his daughters. Then we will see who is sneering."]="要是我向萨鲁证明了自己的实力，他将别无选择，只能让我为他的一个女儿而战。让我们看看谁是失败的那个吧。"
G["If I saw anything dangerous, I'd hit it with the light, and Amber's sniper rifle would take care of the rest."]="如果我发现有危险，就用光标识出来，剩下的事就由安玻的狙击步枪去料理了。"
G["If I see any lazy peons here, I'll load them into a catapult and launch them off to the Black Temple!"]="要是给我看到谁偷懒，我就把他们绑在投石器上，丢到黑暗神殿去！"
G["If I should fall, take my pouch. Make certain that it gets to the High General."]="要是我遇难的话，拿着我的背包。一定要将它送到大将军手上。"
G["If I step on its tail, it was an accident."]="如果我踩到它的尾巴，那绝对是个意外。"
G["If I taught novices, there'd be a lot more students visiting me, and things would get noisy. Go talk to Dan Golthas over there. He's a little intense, but he means well, and he's a decent teacher."]="要是我教新手的话，那会有无数的学生来拜访我，那还不得乱成一团了。去跟那儿的丹·戈萨斯谈谈。他有些过于热情了，但意图总是好的，而且他是个相当好的老师。"
G["If I told you... it would not be called a secret, now would it?"]="如果我告诉了你……那它就不能称之为秘密了，明白吗？"
G["If I was in my dragon form, there wouldn't be any room for anyone else, little one."]="Si estuviera en forma de dragón no habría espacio para nadie más, $gpequeño:pequeña;."
G["If I was not bound by duty to Master Ravenholdt, I would follow you to the ends of the world, $G Master:Mistress; $n. You are grace and cunning personified."]="要是我无须对拉文霍德公爵尽职的话，我将跟随你到世界的尽头，$g主人:女主人;$n。你既优雅又聪明。"
G["If I wasn't stuck here day in and day out, I would have attained the mastery required to train the likes of you! Unfortunately that's not the case. Go talk to Hgarth at the Sun Rock Retreat in the Stonetalon Mountains."]="如果我不是天天都陷在这里，我已经得到训练你们这些人的技能了！不幸的是事实不是这样。去找石爪山脉太阳石居所的赫加斯谈谈。"
G["If I were an honest goblin, I'd say this was the best beer of the festival..."]="如果我是一个诚实的地精，我要说这是节日上最好的啤酒……"
G["If I were king, I'd have a horse like you.  I'd make sure you didn't get lost, and I bet you'd make sure I never got lost."]="如果我当上了国王，我一定要找到一匹像你这般健壮漂亮的马儿。我会好好保护你，我相信你也会保护我的。"
G["If I were one of those Dawnblade blood elves, I'd be swimming away from the island now that $n is here."]="如果我是那些晨锋血精灵的话，我一看到$n来了就会立即跳水游走。"
G["If I were smart, I'd be selling this research for a seat on the rocket ship.  I have a feeling we're going to need to get out of here soon!"]="要是我够聪明的话，我早就把这项研究卖了换张火箭飞船的座票。我感觉我们很快就要离开这里了。"
G["If I were to answer you now, I would deny you the enlightenment that should be yours."]="如果我必须现在回答你，那你将会失去原本应得的启示。"
G["If I were you, I'd buy a goblin race voucher.  Rooting for the other team is a waste of time."]="如果我是你，我就赌地精赢。压其他车队都是在浪费时间。"
G["If I'm going to die, I'm taking you all with me!"]="我就算是死，也要拖上你们所有人！"
G["If I'm not mistaken, this belongs to you."]="如果我没弄错，这应该是你的。"
G["If Ivar Bloodfang is here, where is Darius Crowley?"]="如果伊瓦·血牙在这里，那达利乌斯·克罗雷又在哪里？"
G["If Jones listened to me, he'd live longer."]="如果琼斯肯听我的，他或许会活得久一点。"
G["If Keely sent ya to be ropin' me back in, ya can just forget it. There's Twilight that need bashin'."]="如果是凯莉派你来抓我回去，那她可要失望了。这里还有许多暮光暴徒没消灭干净呢。"
G["If Lord Zhu was asking for us, we better not keep him waiting.  Let us go."]="要是祝掌门想见我们，最好别让他等太久。出发吧。"
G["If Mama Bramblestaff could see me now..."]="如果棘杖妈妈看到我现在的样子……"
G["If Reethe is somehow involved with the burning of the Shady Rest Inn, you'll have to find him and get some answers out of him.\n\nI sent Ogron to track him down. He was headed off to the southeast, toward the main road through the marsh. Meet up with Ogron and then go find Reethe."]="如果雷瑟和树荫旅店被烧毁的事有某种联系的话，你就得找到他，问个清楚。\n\n我派了奥格隆去追他，应该是朝东南方向去了。去跟奥格隆会合，然后一起去找雷瑟吧。"
G["If Rhunok regains his strength, we all die!"]="如果伦诺克恢复力量，那我们就死定了！"
G["If Therzok's sent you, tell him no, I won't go back to work for him, no matter how many times he asks."]="如果是瑟祖克派你来的，那么告诉他死了这条心吧。我是不会回去为他工作的，不管他怎么求我。"
G["If a bank is what you desire, then your travels take you to the heart of Darnassus.  There you will find storage for your treasures."]="要是你想找银行的话，就去达纳苏斯的中央地带。你可以在那儿存储自己的财宝。"
G["If a horse gets horseshoes, will I get draenei shoes?"]="如果连马都能得到马蹄铁，我能得到德莱尼靴子吗？"
G["If a hunter is whom you seek, then it is Dazalar that you should visit.  He can usually be found just outside the Inn in Dolanaar."]="要是你想找猎人的话，就去拜访达扎拉吧。他通常在多兰纳尔旅店的外面。"
G["If a turtle doesn't have a shell, is he homeless or naked?"]="要是海龟没有壳的话，那不就成无家可归或是裸体啦？"
G["If additional support is not soon sent to the Burning Steppes, I fear the Scourge will establish a base of operations there. If you can, you should go there to aid the defenders.\n\nNumber of Necropolises remaining: $2281W"]="如果增援部队没法快些赶到燃烧平原的话，我怕天灾军团会在这里建立一个行动基地。要是可以的话，你应该去那里帮助防御。\n\n剩余浮空要塞数量：$2281W"
G["If affection were earned by argument or visage alone, I would already be victorious.\n\nAlas, the heart is a far less reasonable thing than the mind."]="Si el afecto se ganara solo con argumentos o con el semblante, ya habría salido victorioso.\n\nAy, el corazón es mucho menos razonable que la mente."
G["If all pandaren are like you, I think you may have made some new allies!"]="如果所有的熊猫人都像你这么善良，那我相信你们已经赢得了一些新盟友了！"
G["If any of you dogs stops for so much as to scratch your nose, I'll take off the hand you did it with!"]="要是你们这群蠢货敢停下来抓鼻子，我就把你们抓鼻子的手给砍下来！"
G["If any of your people can be spared, I fear war encroaching upon us in Kalimdor."]="希望你能支援我们一些人手。在卡利姆多爆发的战争正逐步蚕食着我们。"
G["If anyone can track Mauti, Grent can.  Once the panther is taken care of, then all we have to do is worry about the serpents."]="如果真有人可以追踪到玛乌提，那就一定是格伦特。一旦解决了那只猎豹，那我们就可以专心对付毒蛇了。"
G["If beer gets you off your butt, then... sure. Let's go find you some beer."]="如果啤酒能让你挪动屁股，那……我们就去找吧。"
G["If by life or death I can repay you, I will."]="为了报答你，我愿付出任何代价。"
G["If digging in the dirt is the sort of pastime you find enjoyable, go share your insanity with Belil in Farstriders' Square. I'm certain he'd be happy to see he's not the only crazy one."]="如果在泥土里面挖掘对你来说是一种有趣的娱乐，就去远行者广场找比利尔分享你的疯狂吧。我相信他会很高兴看到他不是唯一的疯子。"
G["If dumb man lose sword, it not dumb man's sword no more!"]="如果一个傻瓜把剑弄丢了，那这把剑就不再属于这个傻瓜了！"
G["If ever a cure for my condition is found, I should like to introduce Stefan to this boot of his."]="如果有机会治好我的毛病，我一定要让斯特凡尝尝这靴子的滋味。"
G["If ever there comes a time that I have something to say to you, you should run."]="要是真到了我有话对你说的时候，你应该转身就跑。"
G["If fighting is like dancing I may be in trouble. I'm a terrible dancer..."]="如果学战斗跟学跳舞一样，那我可就麻烦了。我是个很糟糕的舞者……"
G["If fighting like that works for you, I guess it's fine..."]="如果你想这样打，那我就奉陪……"
G["If freedom is what you seek, freedom is what you shall find."]="如果你所追寻的是自由，那么你终将得到它。"
G["If given the chance, we should join the Horde. The Scourge would crumble beneath our collective strength."]="有机会的话，我们应该加入部落。只要团结起来，天灾军团就如同渣一般。"
G["If he comes back, are you going to fight him again?"]="要是他回来了，你会再去和他战斗吗？"
G["If he doesn't defend his home, he'll soon be without one."]="如果他不好好保护家园，那他就要无家可归了。"
G["If he succeeds in looting the whole of Gilneas, there's no telling where he'll hide next. Now is the time to strike."]="如果他成功洗劫了吉尔尼斯，没人能知道他以后的行踪。现在就是进攻的时机。"
G["If he's a fish, how come he's not swimming in water?"]="如果他是鱼，他为什么不在水中游泳呢？"
G["If he's anything like his father, allying with the Mag'har will mark the dawn of a new age for the Horde."]="如果他和他的父亲一样的话，与玛格汉结盟将会引领部落走向新时代的黎明。"
G["If he's in the area, we must find him. First, though, we'll need a way to decipher this journal."]="如果他在这附近的话，我们必须找到他。但是首先，我们需要破译这本日志。"
G["If he's not dead."]="如果他还没死的话。"
G["If it is Elune's... will."]="如果这是艾露恩的……意愿。"
G["If it is a matter of import that you wish to speak on, $c, it may be more appropriate to seek an audience with Dame Auriferous. I warn you though, she is very busy and you may be in for quite a wait."]="Si lo que quieres explicar es un asunto de importancia, $c, tal vez sería más apropiado que pidieras una audiencia con la Dama Aurífera. Sin embargo, debo advertirte que está muy ocupada y tal vez tengas que esperar mucho."
G["If it is my fate to fall, then my dying breath shall take you with me!"]="如果我注定要死，那就让我死亡的气息把你们也带走！"
G["If it is our fate to die this day, then we will not go easy!  Mark me, these demons will fall like wheat!"]="即使我们的命运注定要在今天完结，我们也不能就这么轻易地死去！跟我冲啊！让这些恶魔像割麦子一样倒下！"
G["If it is the way of the Warrior that you crave then you must seek out Krang Stonehoof.  You will find him in the southeast corner of the village at his training circle, often instructing his other students."]="要是你想成为一名战士，就得去找克朗·石蹄。你能在村子的东南角找到他，他通常就在那儿训练学生。"
G["If it is war you mean to bring to our shores, the very land itself will respond to your passions and your violence."]="如果你想将战火引到我们的海岸，那么这片土地会对你的冲动和暴力作出回应。"
G["If it is war you mean to bring to our shores, the very land itself will respond to your passions and your violence. I do not know what the ultimate consequences will be - nobody does."]="如果你想将战火引到我们的海岸，那么这片土地会对你的冲动和暴力作出回应。我不知道最终会造成什么后果——没人知道。"
G["If it is your desire to visit the rise of the Defiler, you have only to ask. I am able to transport you and your comrades."]="如果你想要拜访污染者高地，尽管开口好了。我会把你和你的同伴传送过去的。"
G["If it please you, King Jokkum, may I know what has become of Krolmir?"]="约库姆国王，如果您不介意的话，能不能告诉我科洛米尔的消息？"
G["If it weren't for $n, we'd all be long dead."]="要不是$n，我们可能早就死光了。"
G["If it weren't for $n, where would we be now?"]="要不是$n，我们现在会在哪里呢？"
G["If it weren't for that cursed, gnomish luck, they'd never win a race!"]="要不是侏儒的狗屎运，他们就永远不会赢！"
G["If it weren't for the Grim Guzzler, I'd probably spend my free time pulling the wings off dragon whelps."]="要不是因为这酒吧，我的空闲时间就只能用来剥龙鳞啦。"
G["If it weren't for the Grim Guzzler, I'd spend my free time pulling the wings off dragon whelps."]="要不是因为这酒吧，我的空闲时间就只能用来剥龙鳞啦。"
G["If it weren't for the goblins' inconceivable, dumb luck, they'd crash their car during every race!"]="要不是地精的狗屎运，他们每次都会把车撞进山里去！"
G["If it weren't for those damned beasts burning our ships, we'd have been home by now. Now leave me alone so I can get back to work!"]="要不是那群混蛋烧毁了船只，我们早就到家啦。别来烦我了，我要回去工作啦！"
G["If it's a hammer you're looking for,  you've come to the right place."]="要是你想买把锤子，那你可找对地方了。"
G["If it's any consolation, I'll be leaving the cell door open. How you get out is your problem. Good bye, Kharan."]="我会把门开着的，你怎么逃出去是你的问题。再见，卡兰。"
G["If it's broke, Slagtree can fix it!"]="如果它坏了，那么斯拉提可以修理它！"
G["If it's frayed abomination stitchings you be wanting, to Stratholme you'll be jaunting.\n\nFormerly the hometown of the Lightbringer hisself, now overrun by the minions of Kel'Thuzad.\n\nBrave the perils of the burning city and strike down the meaty abominations! Take from them your prize: Frayed abomination stitchings!"]="要是你想要磨损的憎恶缝合线，你就得长途跋涉去斯坦索姆。\n\n以前那儿是光明使者的家园，现在被克尔苏加德的仆从们侵占了。\n\n解除这燃烧的城市的危机，击败那些强大的憎恶吧！从他们那儿夺取磨损的憎恶缝合线！"
G["If it's my time to die, I'm going to go down swinging!"]="就算我的死期已到，我也要死得轰轰烈烈！"
G["If it's truth you're interested in, Cuddy Nordlinger's Philosophy class is right down the hall."]="如果你对真理感兴趣，卡迪·诺德林格主讲的哲学班就在大厅的另一端。"
G["If jewelcrafting is what you seek, you'll find Kalinda's shop on the south end of the Royal Exchange."]="如果你要找珠宝匠，就去皇家贸易区的南部寻找卡琳达的商店。"
G["If mother could see me now..."]="如果让妈妈看见我现在的模样……"
G["If my blood hadn't clotted long ago, it would be boiling with rage right now..."]="要不是我的血早已凝固了，它现在就会因愤怒而沸腾……"
G["If my calculations are correct, banging on this gong will bring down that door. It's crazy, I know, but to be totally honest with you, I think it's an idea that might be ahead of its time!"]="如果我的计算正确的话，敲打这面锣就可以打开那扇门。我知道，这实在太疯狂了，不过说真的，我想这可能是个节约时间的好主意。"
G["If my calculations are correct, the wheel will soon be obsolete!"]="要是我计算正确的话，这车轮很快就会作废的！"
G["If my dad was alive, he would put out the fires!"]="要是爸爸还活着的话，他会赶来灭火的！"
G["If my dad were alive, he would put out the fires!"]="要是我爸爸活着的话，他会把火灭掉的！"
G["If my division is correct... you should be quite dead."]="如果我的切割没有出错……你们应该离死不远了。"
G["If my mom was alive, she would put out the fires!"]="要是妈妈还活着的话，她会赶来灭火的！"
G["If my mom were alive, she would put out the fires!"]="要是我妈妈活着的话，她会把火灭掉的！"
G["If my mother had told me there would be days like this I would not have believed her."]="如果我妈妈告诉我会有这样的时代，我绝对不会相信她的话。"
G["If my stomach wasn't threatening to dislodge itself from my body and leave me for the refuse that we give to the prisoners, I might be insulted by this... this food."]="要不是我的胃在咕咕叫，我才不会碰这些给犯人吃的……食物。"
G["If no one help, Grok smash!"]="要是没人帮忙，葛罗克就打人！"
G["If none of you ladies have any questions, you can get further instructions and assignments from your squad leaders. That's it. Good luck!"]="你们可以从小队指挥官那里得到更进一步的分配和指示。如果没有什么其他问题，就这样，好运！"
G["If not the gods, who? How? What could cause such strife?"]="如果不是神，那会是谁？什么样的力量会把这里变成这样？"
G["If one more harpoon touches my drake I'll flay your miserable hides!"]="要是再让我的飞龙被鱼叉碰到一下，我就亲自跳下来剥了你们的皮！"
G["If one such as I can be captured by that lumbering oaf, then you must be brave indeed to venture here.\nIf you can distract Halfus and break the chains binding me then I will fight alongside you.\nMy ability to blind the eyes of an enemy will help you withstand Halfus' Frenzied Assault."]="Si ese patán inútil puede capturar a alguien como yo, entonces debes de ser muy valiente para aventurarte por aquí.\n\nSi consigues distraer a Halfus y romper las cadenas que me atan, entonces lucharé a tu lado.\n\nMi capacidad de cegar los ojos de un enemigo te ayudará a aguantar el Asalto frenético de Halfus."
G["If one such as I can be captured by that lumbering oaf, then you must be brave indeed to venture here.\nIf you can distract Halfus and break the chains binding me then I will fight alongside you.\nMy ability to engulf an enemy in a furious tempest will impair Halfus' efforts to unleash Shadow Novas."]="Si ese patán inútil puede capturar a alguien como yo, entonces debes de ser muy valiente para aventurarte por aquí.\n\nSi consigues distraer a Halfus y romper las cadenas que me atan, entonces lucharé a tu lado.\n\nMi capacidad de envolver al enemigo en una tempestad entorpecerá los intentos de Halfus de desatar Novas de las Sombras."
G["If one such as I can be captured by that lumbering oaf, then you must be brave indeed to venture here.\nIf you can distract Halfus and break the chains binding me then I will fight alongside you.\nMy ability to slow the passage of time in an area will help you evade the Proto-Behemoth's Fireball Barrage."]="Si ese patán inútil puede capturar a alguien como yo, entonces debes de ser muy valiente para aventurarte por aquí.\n\nSi consigues distraer a Halfus y romper las cadenas que me atan, entonces lucharé a tu lado.\n\nMi capacidad de ralentizar el paso del tiempo en un área te ayudará a esquivar la Tromba de bolas de Fuego del protobehemoth."
G["If one such as I can be captured by that lumbering oaf, then you must be brave indeed to venture here.\nIf you can distract Halfus and break the chains binding me then I will fight alongside you.\nMy ability to temporarily paralyze an enemy's body will grant you respite from Halfus' Malevolent Strikes."]="Si ese patán inútil puede capturar a alguien como yo, entonces debes de ser muy valiente para aventurarte por aquí.\n\nSi consigues distraer a Halfus y romper las cadenas que me atan, entonces lucharé a tu lado.\n\nMi capacidad de paralizar temporalmente el cuerpo de un enemigo te aliviará frente a los Golpes malévolos de Halfus."
G["If only Gidwin were here... he'd love to see this."]="要是吉德文在这里就好了……他一定会想看看这个的。"
G["If only I could get back to the mushroom thicket. I have not seen such a mature cluster in my lifetime!"]="如果我可以再次回到蘑菇丛就好了。我这辈子都没有看到过这么多成熟的蘑菇。"
G["If only I could get this blasted machine working!"]="要是我能让这台该死的机器工作起来就好了！"
G["If only I could get to the Launch Bay. Gimme one, just one, of those beautiful airborne machines and I could retake Gnomeregan and scare the goggles off of B.E Barechus at the same time!\n\nIf you need another parachute, we've stored some in chests near the drop points."]="要是我能到得了发射台，再给我一架那种美轮美奂的飞机——只需一架，我就能夺回诺莫瑞根，并把“坏脾气”巴拉克斯的眼镜给吓得掉下来！\n\n如果你还需要降落伞的话，我们在降落点附近的箱子里存了一些。"
G["If only I could resupply my stocks from Northrend, then I might be able to craft a weapon that could chill the heart of the unliving."]="如果能从诺森德搞到原料，我或许能锻造出可以冻结亡灵心脏的武器。"
G["If only I had come sooner! If only Ban had listened to me!"]="要是班肯听我的就好了！我能早来一步就好了！"
G["If only I had figured out the fresco sooner. So much could have been avoided, $n."]="如果我能早点发现壁画就好了。很多事本来是可以避免的，$n。"
G["If only I had more room in my store, I'd take you all with me to Dalaran."]="如果我的商店能大一点就好了，我就能把你们全带回达拉然去了。"
G["If only I had some wine to go with my cheese..."]="啊……多么可怕的工作啊！"
G["If only I had someone to dance with."]="要是我能有个舞伴儿就好了。"
G["If only I hadn't twisted my ankle coming into this place, I'd be in there with my friends.  Hmmm, now that I think about it, maybe it's better that I'm out here?"]="要是我没有在这个地方扭了脚，现在我就应该在那里，和朋友们在一起。嗯，让我先想想如何走出这里？"
G["If only I'd remembered to wear my standard-issue emergency pool pony vest."]="要是我没忘记穿上标准型紧急救生衣就好了。"
G["If only I'da been able ta stop yeh that day, how different things mighta been."]="如果那天我能阻止你，也许一切都会不一样。"
G["If only I'da never discovered that accursed blade..."]="要是我从没发现过那把被诅咒的剑……"
G["If only Malfurion hadn't dumped your grandfather in prison. He rots in a barrow den while the Horde assaults Ashenvale."]="玛法里奥将你的祖父关进了监狱。部落攻击灰谷时，他只能在兽穴里等死。"
G["If only Mishka were here. She'd fix him up in no time."]="要是米希卡在就好了。她很快就能治好他的。"
G["If only my dear brothers could be here with me at this moment in time. They would not believe what a discovery this will be!\n\nThe Tribunal are the librarians for the Titan discs, which are stored in this very room.\n\nLook! You can see the discs beneath the floor! We must hurry, the greatest discovery of Dwarven kind is just up ahead."]="要是我的兄弟现在也在这里就好了。他们肯定不会相信这项发现有多么惊人！\n\n这座大厅是储存泰坦圆盘的档案馆；而这里，就是存储圆盘的地方。\n\n瞧！地板下就散落着泰坦圆盘！我们必须赶快行动，矮人一族有史以来最伟大的发现在等着我们呢。"
G["If only my wife were here to see this. I'm going to win!"]="要是我妻子能看到这一切该多好啊。我要赢了！"
G["If only our brothers, the blood elves, could change their ways. They will bring the Legion upon us again, mark my words."]="如果我们的兄弟——那些血精灵能迷途知返就好了。他们会把燃烧军团再次带到我们面前的，你记住我的话。"
G["If only our pappy were alive to see this!"]="要是爸爸能活着看到这一天该多好啊！"
G["If only the leaders of the clans would listen.  Unity is the only answer.  All other paths lead to our destruction."]="真希望各氏族的首领都能过来听一听我的话。团结是唯一的生存之道，任何其它道路都只会给我们带来毁灭的结局。"
G["If only there were more $g heroes : heroines; such as yourself, $n."]="Si tan solo existieran más $ghéroes:heroínas; como tú, $n."
G["If only there were more time!"]="如果时间再充裕一点就好了！"
G["If only there were someone nearby who would help me escape."]="这附近要是有人能帮我逃走就好了。"
G["If only you understood!"]="如果你能早点理解就好了！"
G["If only you were here right now, old friend. You would know what to do."]="老朋友，如果你在这里就好了。你该知道要怎么做。"
G["If our enemies should choose to push us, we will drive them into the ground!"]="如果有人想螳臂当车，我们就碾过他们！"
G["If our enemies would see that we only wish to live in harmony with them, maybe we wouldn't have to attack them for our own survival?"]="如果我们的敌人了解到我们唯一的愿望就是和他们和平共处的话，也许我们就不必进攻他们来换取我们自己的生存了？"
G["If our gods can die... den so can we...."]="神都会死去……何况我们自身……"
G["If our reinforcements had arrived, we may have had a chance."]="如果援军早点赶来，我们或许还有胜利的希望。"
G["If overalls are held up by the snaps at the top, then why do they have belt loops?"]="如果罩衫是由顶部的摁扣固定的，那为什么还需要袢带呢？"
G["If pappy could see me now... runnin' my own crew in service to the king. He'd be gushin' with pride."]="如果让老爸看到我现在的样子……带着自己的队员为国王效力。他一定会骄傲地流泪的。"
G["If priestly knowledge is what you seek, Ponaris is your man. He works with the others on the second floor of Delaniel's inn."]="如果你在寻求牧师的知识，那么珀纳瑞斯就是你要找的人。他在德兰妮尔的旅店二楼。"
G["If she needs time, I can give it. I’ve waited longer for worse reasons."]="Si necesita tiempo, puedo dárselo. He esperado más tiempo por peores motivos."
G["If slave thing want to be dead, slave thing keep going to broken pillar. Goregek go away and be not dead."]="蠢奴隶，你要是想死，就径直朝那根破柱子走过去吧。格利基克还想活命呢，我先撤了。"
G["If slavery does not suit you, maybe death will!"]="要是奴役不适合你，那死亡一定适合！"
G["If someone has put together the magic scepter of the sands then the war with the bugs will be soon. I relish it, $c! The last of our war goods are on their way to Silithus and should be there within $2113w days. Go and bring honor to the Horde!"]="如果有人能修复流沙节杖，跟异种虫类的战争也就不远了。我对此很感兴趣，$c！我们的战争物资正在运往希利苏斯的途中，预计将在$2113w天内抵达。去吧，为了部落的荣誉而战！"
G["If someone has put together the magic scepter of the sands then the war with the bugs will be soon. I relish it, $c! The last of our war goods are on their way to Silithus and should be there within a day. Go and bring honor to the Horde!"]="如果有人能修复流沙节杖，跟异种虫类的战争也就不远了。我对此很感兴趣，$c！我们的战争物资正在运往希利苏斯的途中，预计将在1天内抵达。去吧，为了部落的荣誉而战！"
G["If someone's bold enough to investigate, we'll keep the ship here as long as we can."]="要是有人敢深入调查，我们会尽量将船停在这里。"
G["If tailoring is your thing, Vizzklick will most definitely have your supplies. Take a look around, $n, and let me know if you wish to purchase something!"]="如果你是个裁缝，维兹格里克肯定有你想要的东西！随便看看，$n，想要买什么东西就和我说！"
G["If that is all they want then perhaps war can be avoided.  The coming bloodshed could be prevented!"]="如果这就是他们想要的，也许我们可以避免一场战争，可以阻止血流成河的惨祸发生！"
G["If that is your wish $c, then you will need to speak to Keras Wolfheart on the Warrior's Terrace.  He is a representative of The League of Arathor and can help you to get to Arathi Basin."]="$c，如果那就是你的愿望，那么去战士区找克拉斯·沃夫哈特谈谈。他是阿拉索联军的代表，能帮助你到达阿拉希盆地。"
G["If that weren't crazy enough, they decide to quit the ice-cream business and become adventurers... They travel all over the place and finally disappear into some portal. I woke up in a cold sweat after that one..."]="还不够疯狂么？我还梦到他们退出冰淇淋生意，变成了冒险家……他们周游了全世界，随后消失在什么传送门里。我随即就醒了，出了一身冷汗……"
G["If the Alliance thinks a few reinforcements are all it takes to conquer MY fortress, they've got another thing coming!"]="如果联盟以为靠一点点援军就能攻破我的堡垒，那他们就大错特错了！"
G["If the Banshee Queen has offered me this chance, I will gladly serve."]="如果女妖之王给我这样的机会，我很愿意向她效忠。"
G["If the Burning Legion is such a problem, why not just throw water on them?  Then they'll just be a Legion."]="如果燃烧军团是这么大的麻烦，为什么就不能给他们浇些水呢？那么他们就只好停止燃烧了。"
G["If the Captain finds out, it'll be the end of me."]="如果被上尉发现，我就死定了。"
G["If the Dark Portal opens again, we could go home to Draenor."]="如果黑暗之门再次打开，我们就可以回到家乡德拉诺了。"
G["If the Explorers' League sent men, I didn't see any trace of them. I found your note buried in a camp overrun by iron dwarves."]="探险者协会真的派出了其他探员？我一个也没见着。我在一座被铁矮人攻占的营地里发现了你的日记。"
G["If the Horde will push us over the brink into war, then so be it.\n\nLight help me, I will fight for my kingdom and my people.\n\nGlory to the Alliance!"]="如果部落非要把我们逼到战争的边缘，那就来吧。\n\n在圣光的庇佑下，我会为自己的王国和人民而战。\n\n荣耀属于联盟！"
G["If the Korune were capable of such a feat, ain't no wonder Garrosh is after their knowledge!"]="如果寇茹部族真的拥有这种能力，那就不难设想加尔鲁什为何要获得他们的知识了！"
G["If the Lich King finds out that we crashed Talramas due to a malfunction, we'll all be reduced to ashes."]="如果被巫妖王发现塔尔拉玛斯出了故障，那我们就完蛋了。"
G["If the Light cannot guide you, my friend, perhaps I can be of assistance. What is it you need?"]="Si la Luz no puede guiarte, $gamigo:amiga;, quizás yo pueda ayudarte. ¿Qué necesitas?"
G["If the Lorewalker is slain, many of us will have died for nothing...\nWill you accompany me to stop the execution?"]="Si el eremita es asesinado, muchos de los nuestros habrán muerto en vano...\n\n¿Querrías acompañarme a detener la ejecución?"
G["If the Old Ones ever return, we mantid will once again stand by their side."]="一旦上古尊者归来，螳螂妖将再一次追随他们。"
G["If the Shu'halo of Thousand Needles fall, the Grimtotem clan will be at your doorstep soon after. The time for action is now, Brogg!"]="要是千针石林的舒哈鲁被击败，恐怖图腾部族很快就会出现在你家门口。现在是时候行动了，布洛格！"
G["If the Shu'halo of Thousand Needles fall, the Grimtotem clan will be at your tent flap soon after. The time for action is now, Chief Spirithorn!"]="要是千针石林的舒哈鲁被击败，恐怖图腾部族很快就会出现在你家门口。现在是时候行动了，魂角酋长！"
G["If the Thunder King is not defeated, Pandaria will suffer. But worse: if the Horde lays their hands on the source of his power, the whole WORLD will pay the price."]="如果不能打败雷电之王，潘达利亚就会遭殃。可是如果让部落得到他的力量，那全世界都得付出代价。"
G["If the blood elves go to Northrend, then vengeance shall be ours at last!  The Lich King will regret his march on our beloved Silvermoon City!"]="要是血精灵也远征诺森德的话，那么我们一定能实现复仇大业！巫妖王肯定会为当初进攻银月城而后悔！"
G["If the blues dare to attack the temple, then they have a deathwish."]="蓝龙军团敢向神殿发动攻击，他们活腻了吧。"
G["If the brewkegs catch fire, I need you to help put them out."]="酒桶要是着起火来，我需要你帮忙灭火。"
G["If the crewman is choking, we can deliver Air to temporarily stabilize their falling vitals."]="如果船员发生了窒息，我们可以输送氧气以稳定他们渐弱的生命体征。"
G["If the demons fell, where did they fall from?"]="如果恶魔是掉下来的，他们是从哪里掉下来的呢？"
G["If the furbolg could be this far gone, what does that say for the rest of Teldrassil?"]="如果熊怪会变成今天这种样子，那么泰达希尔其余的地方又会是怎样？"
G["If the jinyu set this trap, they'll be back soon.\n\n<Kiryn looks up at the horizon in shock.>\n\nDark Lady watch over us... they're here. Save yourself, Riko!"]="如果这个陷阱是锦鱼人设下的，他们很快就会回来的。\n\n<琪麟震惊地看着远处的地平线。>\n\n黑暗女王在上……他们来了。快跑啊，里克！"
G["If the king can't keep our shipments safe, he has no business on that throne!"]="要是国王无法保证我们的货运安全，他就不配坐在那个王座上！"
G["If the rumors about you are true, stranger, I will gladly join you in the fight against the Neferset!"]="¡Si los rumores sobre ti son ciertos, $gforastero:forastera;, estaré encantado de unirme a la lucha contra los Neferset!"
G["If the rumors are true, you should be able to find Jewel Danio here. \n\n<Ben marks a spot on your map.>"]="Si los rumores son ciertos, encontrarás danios enjoyados aquí.\n\n<Ben marca un punto en tu mapa.>"
G["If the snakes don't kill us, the panther will!"]="就算毒蛇不弄死我们，猎豹也会杀死我们的！"
G["If the stone giants interfere with our work at Ulduar, I will hold you and your thane responsible. Mortals must not be allowed to come to the aid of the giants."]="如果石巨人胆敢阻挠我们在奥杜尔的工事，我就撤消你和你的领主的权利。绝不允许凡人帮助巨人。"
G["If the world is going to end, do these cultists really think it would bother warning us?"]="如果世界真的要完了，难道这些教徒警告我们还有什么意义吗？"
G["If there is any hope, allow me to try!"]="如果希望尚存，请允许我试上一试！"
G["If there is any hope, you must allow me to try!"]="只要希望尚存，你就必须允许我试上一试！"
G["If there is anything you would have of me..."]="要是你能从我这儿拿走什么的话……"
G["If there is one thing in life you can learn, it is that there is always more to learn."]="如果你开始学习一样东西，你会发现还有很多要学。"
G["If there were just a few more hours in a day..."]="要是离天黑还有些时间的话……"
G["If there were one thing that you could tell me that would make today better, $n, it would be that Taylor is dead."]="如果说有什么消息能让我好过一点，$n，那就是泰勒的死讯。"
G["If there's any sign of Anduin, we'll find it."]="只要他留下了线索，我们就能找到。"
G["If there's anyone that's an expert on rocks and stones, it's a dwarf!"]="在这世上要是存在岩石和石料专家，那就一定是矮人！"
G["If there's nothing else that you can do, kill these things!"]="如果你没别的事可做，就去杀掉这些家伙吧！"
G["If there's one thing I know, it's that you can always count on a good friend. If you have such a person in your life, cherish them well."]="有件事我可以肯定，那就是你总是可以依赖你的好朋友。如果在你的生命中有这么一个人，请好好珍惜他。"
G["If there's time."]="如果还有时间的话。"
G["If these miniatures are built anything like their originals, you don't stand a chance!"]="要是这些小东西与它们的原型有半点相像，你就毫无机会！"
G["If these mortals don't kill you, I will!"]="如果那些凡人没杀掉你们，我会亲自动手！"
G["If these two don't start talking soon, I'm going to get violent with my words."]="如果这两个家伙不马上开口说话，我就要违背我所说的话了。"
G["If they can stop that storm, I'll lead the Forgeguard to the top myself."]="如果他们能阻止风暴，我就亲自率领熔炉卫士上去。"
G["If they do not kill you, I will do it myself!"]="如果他们没有杀掉你，就由我来亲自动手吧！"
G["If they get a foothold in the plane of water, we'll never get 'em out!"]="如果他们在水元素位面站住了脚，我们就麻烦了！"
G["If they have the egg, it's too dangerous to risk an all-out assault. You'll need to sneak in there, find out what they're up to... And retrieve the egg at any cost."]="如果他们拿到了那枚蛋，那么发动全面进攻就太危险了。你需要潜入那里，查清他们的阴谋……并不惜一切夺回那枚蛋。"
G["If they killed the Old Gods, Azeroth would've been destroyed..."]="如果他们真的杀光上古之神，那艾泽拉斯也就毁灭了……"
G["If they manage to enter the breach, we'll never get them out!"]="如果他们进了裂口，就赶不出去了。"
G["If they not willin' to come out of Zim'Torga, burn it to the ground!"]="如果他们不肯离开希姆托加，就将那里夷为平地！"
G["If they only knew... what horrors await..."]="如果他们知道……前路有多么恐怖……"
G["If they think I'm about to root around in a troll's wardrobe, they are SORELY mistaken."]="要是他们觉得我要去巨魔的衣柜翻东西的话，那他们完全错了。"
G["If they will not bend the knee, then she is to see to it that they are destroyed!"]="如果他们不肯屈服，那么就让她毁灭他们！"
G["If this Shado-Pan not let us in soon, I will make him smell MY luckydo."]="如果这个影踪派弟子不快点让我们进去，我就让他闻闻我的幸运符。"
G["If this be the caliber of pandaren to resist us, this land be ours in no time!"]="如果熊猫人就这点水平，那这片土地很快就得归我们了！"
G["If this is a trap, it is one I will not blindly walk into! Do not make the same mistakes as your father, Garrosh!"]="如果这是个陷阱，我是不会盲目踩进去的！不要犯和你父亲同样的错误，加尔鲁什！"
G["If this is correct then I have a lot more research to do."]="如果这个理论是正确的，那我就得做很多研究了。"
G["If this is right, we don't have long!  Oh well."]="如果这是对的，我们没有太多时间了！哦，好吧。"
G["If this is the best these dwarves can muster, the Highlands will soon be ours."]="如果这些矮人只能召集起这么一点力量，这座高地很快就会是我们的了。"
G["If this is the qualilty one can expect in a weapon of the Argent Dawn, then it is only a matter of time before they fall."]="如果银色黎明的武器都是这种品质的话，那他们迟早会完蛋。"
G["If this keeps up, I don't know how we are ever going to continue our supply of yaks to the grummle."]="要是再这么下去，真不知道我们该怎么继续向土地精供应牦牛。"
G["If two imps are better than one imp, what's better than two imps? SIXTY IMPS."]="如果说两个小鬼就是比一个要强，那什么能比两个小鬼更强呢？那就是六个小鬼。"
G["If we allow Twilight's Hammer to open up portals like these all over Azeroth, no army in the world can save the planet. We've got to shut this tunnel network down!"]="要是我们任由暮光之锤在艾泽拉斯各地打开像这样的传送门，那这世上就没有任何军团能挽救这个星球。我们必须一举解决这个坑道网！"
G["If we are forced into a conflict, the Lich King will destroy our divided forces in Northrend."]="如果闹起内讧，巫妖王就会摧毁我们在诺森德的驻军。"
G["If we are to be successful in the creation of a portal to the Isle of Quel'Danas, and the Sunwell which rests upon it, we must acquire an energy source powerful enough to ignite the portal.\n\nWe are $3269w percent completed with our efforts. Will you assist us, $c?"]="Si queremos tener éxito al crear un portal a la Isla de Quel'Danas, y a La Fuente del Sol que se encuentra en su interior, debemos adquirir una fuente de energía con potencia suficiente para encender el portal.\n\nNuestros esfuerzos están completados al $3269w %. ¿Nos ayudarás, $c?"
G["If we are to bring down the Thunder King, we must breech the shipyard. Now is the time for bold ideas!"]="如果想要打倒雷电之王，我们就必须先攻破船坞。现在应该采取行动了！"
G["If we are to defend the rift, we must do it directly!"]="要守护裂隙，就必须用直接一点的方式！"
G["If we are to die, let it be with honor against our hated enemies!"]="就算我们要死，也要带着消灭夙敌的荣耀！"
G["If we are to make these new lands ours then we must have places to rest our battle weary bodies. Lay your axe by the fire and share the stories of your mighty battles."]="如果我们要成为这块新地区的主人，那么我们就必须要找个地方好好休息。把你的斧子放在火边，让大家分享你英勇战斗的故事吧。"
G["If we can just hold them now, I am sure we will be in the clear."]="只要我们现在能控制住他们，那就肯定能搞明白这件事情。"
G["If we can keep working at this rate, the Lady will be pleased."]="要是我们保持这种工作速率，瓦丝琪女士会非常高兴的。"
G["If we can make it past the gates into Duskhaven we'll be safe.  The eastern mountains are virtually impassable."]="要是我们能通过暮湾镇的大门，我们就安全了。东边的山脉几乎是无法通行的。"
G["If we can trust one another here, then there's hope for the rest of the world."]="只有对彼此充满信任，这份希望才能留存。"
G["If we can't teach you to shoot, you'll have a career in the cantina to fall back on."]="要是我们教不会你射击，你至少可以到后面的小酒馆去打工。"
G["If we catch that turncoat, Khay'ji, I'm going to unravel him personally!  Go look for him!"]="要是我们抓到那个叛徒卡尔伊，我会亲自把他拆开！去找他！"
G["If we dawdle much longer, there'll be hell to pay!"]="如果还这样混日子的话，那我们必定会付出惨重的代价！"
G["If we do not defeat the Shao-Tien now, all is lost!"]="要是我们现在不击败韶天，就要满盘皆输了！"
G["If we do succeed here, you realize what comes next."]="嘿，要是我们成功了，你猜接下来会怎么样。"
G["If we don't expand the mine, there's no way we'll get all the ore we need. Captain Adams'll have our hides!"]="如果我们不继续开凿矿井，从哪儿弄来所需的矿石呢。没有矿石的话，亚当斯上尉会剥了我们的皮！"
G["If we don't get this shield down soon we're going to be overrun."]="如果不能尽快消除这个护盾，我们就会被打垮。"
G["If we don't get to that Divine Bell first, that lizard-livered nut-brain Garrosh will. I don't much fancy fightin' a Horde that commands the power o' the bleepin' sha."]="如果我们不能抢先得到那口圣钟，那个坏心眼的疯子加尔鲁什就会把它占为己有。我无法想象控制邪恶煞能的部落打起架来有多厉害。"
G["If we don't increase production as much as possible, the Horde might lose this war. If the Horde loses the war, we're out on our butts at best and dead at worst.\n\nI hate to break it to you, but the pretty things you might have heard at Whisperwind Grove won't save us... but hard work might."]="如果我们不尽最大可能提高生产效率，部落也许就要输掉这场战争了。如果部落输了，我们可就死定了。\n\n我不想打碎你的幻想。但你在语风林地听到的那些美妙的玩意可救不了我们……能救我们的只有勤奋的工作。"
G["If we don't slow down soon, I might pass out."]="如果我们不慢一些，我也许就要昏过去了。"
G["If we fall, then Darrowshire is doomed!"]="如果我们失败的话，达隆郡就完了！"
G["If we find a way to fight our way out of here, Hellscream will know of your deeds, $r."]="要是我们能从这儿杀出去，地狱咆哮一定会获知你的功绩，$r。"
G["If we let the kypari die out, then we will have lost a great treasure.\n\nThe amber is life."]="如果我们放任凯帕圣树灭绝，这将是巨大的损失。\n\n琥珀即是生命。"
G["If we lose our crops we'll lose our brew!"]="要是没有了庄稼，我们就要失去美酒了！"
G["If we lose the healers, Shen-zin Su dies, and all of us with him!  Keep them safe."]="要是治疗者们遭遇不测，神真子和我们都死定了。保护好他们！"
G["If we make it outta here, let's keep this part outta the story..."]="如果我们能离开这的话，就别再提这事了吧……"
G["If we reverse the Essence flows perhaps we can alter the polarity."]="如果我们改变魔法精华的流向，也许我们就可以改变其极性。"
G["If we serve the Light, then we must go north and face the darkness residing there."]="如果我们信仰圣光，就应该挥师北上，直面诺森德的黑暗势力。"
G["If we speak as one, we cannot be ignored!"]="如果我们作为一个整体来抗争，就不可能被忽视了！"
G["If we spend our time and strength fighting with each other, Loken will use Ulduar's resources to destroy both Horde and Alliance."]="如果我们继续厮杀，洛肯就会利用奥杜尔的资源将联盟和部落一起摧毁。"
G["If we stop these dwarves and worgen we will be celebrated as great heroes of the Horde!"]="如果我们能阻止这些矮人和狼人，那我们就是部落的大英雄啦！"
G["If we surrender now, the entire temple will fall!"]="如果我们现在放弃，整个青龙寺就将陷落！"
G["If we survive dis, maybe someday I call you... \"Friend.\""]="Si sobrevivimos, es posible que un día te llame... \"colega\"."
G["If we survive this, remind me to find a competent partner!"]="如果我们能活下来，记得提醒我找个靠得住的搭档！"
G["If we truly desire the same thing, Akama, then release me!  If Illidan is to die, it shall be by my hand!"]="如果我们期望的是同一件事，阿卡玛，那么你就放了我！如果伊利丹要死，那也要是死在我的手上！"
G["If we understand how Ragnaros has affected the lesser denizens of Hyjal, we may better understand how to repair it."]="如果我们能弄清拉格纳罗斯是如何影响了海加尔的低等住民，也许就能想出更好的补救措施。"
G["If we use the Surian theory, then yes, but not if we go with the Y'serian approach."]="如果根据苏瑞亚的理论，那就是没错了，不过这样一来我们就必须采用伊瑟亚的魔法启动流程理论。"
G["If we use the appropriate sequence we should be ok. Will just take some serious studying before we start."]="如果我们按照正确的次序进行操作，那就应该不会有任何问题。所以我们在开始之前应该好好地研究一下。"
G["If we were in Shadowforge City, I would have you tossed into the Ring of Law for your transgressions, Ambassador. The darkest dungeons of Ironforge will have to do for now."]="要是我们在暗炉城，我一定会把你扔进秩序竞技场的，大使先生。现在只好拿铁炉堡里最黑暗的地下城凑合一下。"
G["If we're to find him, we're headed in the right direction.  It's likely that he was taken to Stratholme, or potentially to the Plaguewood."]="我们要是想要找到他，朝这个方向前进就对了。他很可能被带去了斯坦索姆，或是病木林。"
G["If we're to help with that in any way we'll need more people.  Call some of the scouts in to help with that."]="如果我们要去帮忙的话，就必须有更多的人手。叫一些斥候过来一起帮忙吧。"
G["If we're to win this war we will need your help. Our packs must unite! The Forsaken will destroy us otherwise."]="我们若想打赢这一仗，就需要你的帮助。眼下必须团结一致！否则，被遗忘者会把我们全都消灭。"
G["If what you say is true about the fruit vendor being an old lady... Bah!  It cannot be true!"]="如果你说水果商是个老奶奶的事真的话……呸！这不可能！"
G["If ya be lucky, dey eat your head first...."]="如果你的运气够好，我们会把炖你的火烧得旺一些……"
G["If ya need a bat, ya come to da right place. I be handlin' all de bats for de scouts."]="如果你想要蝙蝠，那么你可是来对地方了。我掌管着全部哨兵的蝙蝠。"
G["If ye and Prince Anduin hadn't been there, we could all be turnin' on each other, lettin' our anger get the best o' us!"]="如果你和安度因王子不在那儿的话，他们可能就会自相残杀，我们最好的战士们可能就会被他们自己的愤怒击败！"
G["If ye ask me, I think Grif spends a little too much time with the animals.  Still, nobody else knows the hunter's path quite like he does.  Look for him outside the smithy in Kharanos."]="假如你问我的话，我想格瑞夫在动物身上花费的时间过多了。到目前为止，没人比他更精通于猎人之道。去卡拉诺斯的铁匠铺外面找他吧。"
G["If ye climb up another notch, I'll share me brew with ye!"]="如果你再爬上一级，我就把我的酒给你喝！"
G["If ye love killing orcs and ye don't talk much, glad to have ye!\n\nIf not, there's a lovely portal east of here that I heard is just lovely this time of year."]="如果你喜欢屠杀兽人，又不爱唠叨，那么欢迎你！\n\n如果不是的话，那么东边就有一座可爱的传送门。我听说，只有在每年的这个时候，它才会特别可爱。"
G["If ye need to get yer hands on some guild creation papers ye'll have to head up to Ironforge and visit the Ironforge Visitor's Center."]="要是你需要一些公会登记表的话，就前往铁炉堡，去拜访铁炉堡访客中心吧。"
G["If ye want me advice, don't go strugglin' tae much. Ye'll just encourage them."]="如果你想听我的建议，那么我告诉你，不要打得太厉害。你只是在刺激他们。"
G["If ye want to find Grumnus, the first thing ye should do is head to Ironforge. Go to the very center of the city and look for the Great Forge, ye should find him there."]="如果你想要找格鲁努斯的话，那么首先要到铁炉堡去，然后去城市中心的大锻炉，在那里你就可以找到格鲁努斯。"
G["If ye're looking to learn the profession of leatherworking, ye're gonna need to travel to Ironforge.  I hear there's a nice shop near the Great Forge where ye can learn the profession."]="要是你想学习制皮的话，就去铁炉堡吧。我听说大锻炉附近有间商店，你可以那儿学到制皮的知识。"
G["If yer here to partake in the big spoils, ya best be gettin' in line!\n\nMy share be long overdue...."]="¡Si estas aquí para tomar parte en los grandes desechos, ponte en la cola!\n\nMi parte viene con retraso."
G["If yer of need of an Inn, The Stonefire Inn is where ye should be.  Ye'll find it just to the left of the entrance to Ironforge if ye be coming, or to the right if ye be going.  \n\nOh, and if yer going that way, then tell them to have a tankard ready for me."]="要是你要找旅馆的话，石火旅店是个不错的选择。若是你前往铁炉堡的话，会在城门的左边找到这个旅馆；要是在铁炉堡里面的话，它就在城门的右边。\n\n哦，要是你现在就去那里的话，告诉他们为我准备好啤酒吧。"
G["If yer thinking about forming a guild, then ye'll need to put it past Jondor Steelbrow o'er in the Ironforge Visitor's Center.  Just head southeast from the gates of Ironforge to see him."]="要是你想组建公会的话，那你首先需要通过铁炉堡访客中心的乔多·钢眉的认同。穿过铁炉堡大门往东南方向走，你就能找到他。"
G["If yer' itchin' ta learn a bit about smeltin', I'm yer dwarf!"]="如果你想学习有关熔炼的知识，随时可以来找我！"
G["If you actually brought me the hide of the beast? Well... Let me show you..."]="要是你真的带来了那张皮？嗯……让我为你展示一番吧……"
G["If you agree to help us against our mutual enemy, you will come to no harm here."]="如果你愿意帮助我们抵御共同的敌人，我们保证不伤害你。"
G["If you ain't with us, you're against us! DIE!"]="要是你不跟我们合作，那就是与我们作对！死吧！"
G["If you are going to Alterac Valley then go speak to Kartra Bloodsnarl. You will find her inside the Hall of the Brave in the Valley of Honor."]="如果你想要去奥特兰克山谷，去和卡尔特拉·血喉谈谈。你可以在荣耀谷的勇者大厅去找她。"
G["If you are here for further training, you have overestimated my abilities. Have a word with Telonis over there; he can help you."]="如果你来这儿是为了得到进一步的训练，那你是高估我的能力了。跟泰龙尼斯谈谈；他应该能帮助你。"
G["If you are here to beg for the privilege of working for me, then your company is quite welcome. Otherwise, there is little chance you are of any use to me."]="如果你是来这里诚心恳求我赐予你为我效劳的机会，那么我欢迎你。不然的话，你到一边凉快去吧。"
G["If you are here to hunt dragons, be my guest.  Where should I send my condolences?"]="Si has venido para cazar dragones, sé $gbienvenido:bienvenida;. ¿Adónde debo enviar mis condolencias?"
G["If you are here to waste my time, then you are wasting the time of the Cenarion Circle as a whole.  For your sake, let us hope that you are not foolish enough to be doing just that."]="如果你是来浪费我的时间，那你就是在浪费整个塞纳里奥议会的时间。为你自己着想，希望你不至于那么蠢。"
G["If you are interested in our message, I will be holding a gathering. Speak with me if you wish to know more, but beware, for Orgrimmar is full of people who would silence the truth."]="我将要召集对我们的使命感兴趣的人。如果你想知道得更多，就和我谈谈吧。奥格瑞玛里对现实保持沉默的人太多了。"
G["If you are interested in our message, I will be holding a gathering. Speak with me if you wish to know more, but beware, for Stormwind is full of people who would silence the truth."]="如果你对我们的信息感兴趣，那么我告诉你，我正在聚集信徒。如果你想要了解更多，就继续和我谈谈。但请小心，暴风城中有无数妄图扼杀真相的人。"
G["If you are interested in training with us, speak with me again at the banquet tables, later this evening."]="如果你想和我们一起训练，就等晚上开席时来跟我说一声吧。"
G["If you are looking to become a great cook, venture over to the Pig and Whistle Tavern in Old Town and talk to Stephen Ryback. That man knows how to cook up a rack of ribs like no other.\nMan... now you got me hungry for some of his famous ribs. Don't count on him teaching you that recipe though!"]="Si lo que deseas es convertirte en $gun gran cocinero:una gran cocinera;, ve a la taberna El Cerdo Borracho, situada en el Casco Antiguo, y habla con Stephen Lomocenteno. Ese hombre prepara unas costillas como nadie en el mundo.\n\nHombre, ya me ha entrado hambre y ahora daría cualquier cosas por comerme sus famosas costillas. Pero ¡no cuentes con que te dará la receta!"
G["If you are looking to become a mighty paladin, there is no better teacher then Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker. He can be found in the Cathedral of Light in Cathedral Square."]="如果你想变成强大的圣骑士，那么格雷森·沙东布瑞克公爵是你最好的导师。你可以在教堂广场上的光明大教堂中找到他。"
G["If you are lost, my friend, perhaps I can be of assistance. What is it you need?"]="朋友，如果你迷了路，我或许能帮上忙。你要去哪儿？"
G["If you are not careful, your own hatred could consume you."]="只要稍有不慎，你就会被自己的仇恨吞噬。"
G["If you are not here to help the cause, get out."]="如果你到这里来不是为了帮忙，就滚出去。"
G["If you are not here to lead a tour, leave us."]="如果你不是我们的向导，就快走开。"
G["If you are one that prefers to hunt in the outdoor world, both Felwood's treants and Un'Goro's lashers are an excellent source of fronds.\n\nIf you are more of a risk-taker, the eastern and western wings of Dire Maul will provide you with a nearly limitless supply of savage fronds."]="如果你喜欢在户外狩猎的话，那么无论是费伍德的树人还是环形山的鞭笞者都是不错的目标，可以提供大量的叶子。\n\n如果你更喜欢冒险，那么厄运之槌东西两翼内都有大量的植物，可以供应足够的叶子。"
G["If you are ready and wish to quickly return to the normal time stream, I can transport you."]="Si estás $gpreparado:preparada; y deseas volver rápidamente a la corriente normal del tiempo, puedo transportarte."
G["If you are ready to laugh, head over to the World's End Tavern!"]="要是你想要大笑一场，就去天涯旅店吧！"
G["If you are seeking a locksmith, might I suggest the sewers? That's where you'll find more... disreputable types."]="如果你要找锁匠的话，不如去下水道看看？你可以在那里找到许多……名声不太好的家伙。"
G["If you are seeking a truly rewarding pursuit, then a life of enchanting is for you!"]="如果你在寻找一种真正回报丰厚的事业，那么附魔行业正在等待着你！"
G["If you are so curious about the mantid, I will tell you more on the way to Klaxxi'vess.\n\nOtherwise, leave me to my work."]="如果你对螳螂妖真这么感兴趣，我会在前往卡拉克西维斯的路上继续说给你听。\n\n现在别妨碍我工作。"
G["If you are strong, then I give you respect.\n\nIf you are weak, then I give you encouragement.\n\nIf you are my enemy, then I give you my fist. Several times over, if necessary."]="如果你很强壮，那我会向你表示敬意。\n\n如果你很软弱，那我也会鼓励你。\n\n如果你是我的敌人，那我就会用拳头来揍你。如果有必要的话，我会一次又一次地接着揍你。"
G["If you ask me, I think my brother should do something about all of these goblins! It's said that one of them set off the Cataclysm with a footbomb!\n\nWe need to get rid of all of them before it's really too late!"]="要是你问我的话，我认为我的兄弟应该解决这些地精！据说他们当中有人用足球炸弹引发了大灾变！\n\n我们得尽快除掉他们，再晚就来不及了！"
G["If you ask me, I think the goblins are a shoe in.  We have the tools, and we have the talent!"]="如果你问我，那我要说，地精的科技更加先进。我们有工具，我们还有天赋！"
G["If you ask me, and you DID, I think we should kill all of the apothecaries before it's too late!"]="你问我的意见？我觉得我们应该趁早杀掉所有的药剂师！"
G["If you ask me, the beast is insane."]="在我看来，那畜生简直疯了。"
G["If you ask me, the best part about fishing is its slow pace.  It gives one time to think, to reflect on past events and to plan for future ones.\n\nOh, and it's also a great excuse to drink.  Heavily."]="在我看来，钓鱼的美妙之处在于其缓慢的节奏。人们可以在钓鱼的过程中思考、回想过去和计划未来。\n\n哦，当然这也是大醉的托辞。"
G["If you ask me, the night elves lost this area ten thousand years ago. Their expulsion today at our hands is merely a formality."]="要让我说的话，暗夜精灵在一万年以前就已经丢掉了这个地方。今天他们被我们驱逐只不过是一个形式上的事情。"
G["If you ask me, there's no greater profession than a miner.  And if you ask me, there's no greater miner than a dwarf!"]="要是你问我的话，没有比矿工更好的职业了，也没有比矮人更好的矿工了！"
G["If you ask me, you should round up a bunch of your friends and burn Easterly Rest to the ground, $n."]="依我说，你应该召集一帮朋友，将东风之眠烧成灰烬，$n。"
G["If you be wantin' ta rest here, ya just need to ask!"]="如果你想要在这里休息，跟我说就行了！"
G["If you become a friend of the Lower City, perhaps we can do business?"]="如果你成为了贫民窟的朋友，也许我们可以做点生意？"
G["If you betray us, there will be no escape for you.  I will crush your body so slowly that you shall hear every single one of your bones break."]="如果你背叛了我们，你就将无路可逃。我会缓慢地摧毁你的身体，倾听你每一片骨头碎裂的声音。"
G["If you can dodge a double-binary fluxcillometric auto-wrench, you can dodge a ball!"]="如果你能躲开双二进制流变振波自动扳手，你就能躲开炮弹！"
G["If you can find a way into our sleep chambers, you may use them."]="要是你能进入我们的睡室，那就自便吧。"
G["If you can heft my breastplate, then throw it!  Throw it for Doloria!"]="如果你能举起我的胸甲，就把它扔出去！为了多罗莉亚把它扔出去！"
G["If you can keep my town safe,  I'll definitely make it worth your while."]="如果你能确保我城镇的安全，我一定不会亏待你。"
G["If you can shoot, you can score some sweet prizes!"]="只要你会射击，就能赢得诱人的奖品！"
G["If you can still see, it didn't go back far enough!"]="如果你还看得见的话，也没回去多远！"
G["If you can translate those plates, we can find and capture Brann."]="如果你能破译这些符文板，我们就能找到布莱恩。"
G["If you can venture into the surrounding forest and return any stolen barrels you find, I'll concoct a concentrated draft of marvelous power for you..."]="如果你有胆量进入周围的森林，把被盗的酒桶找回来带给我，我就会为你调制一种具有神奇力量的浓缩生啤……"
G["If you can't fight Zoltrik at range, use your Jump Drakes! ability:\n|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_vehicle_launchplayer.blp:64|t"]="¡Si no puedes luchar contra Zoltrik a distancia, utiliza la facultad Abordar draco!\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_vehicle_launchplayer.blp:64|t"
G["If you can't fight at range, use your Jump Drakes! ability:\n|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_vehicle_launchplayer.blp:64|t"]="¡Si no puedes luchar a distancia, utilizar la facultad Abordar draco! ability:\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_vehicle_launchplayer.blp:64|t"
G["If you cannot send any help to Westreach Summit, may the refugees from Freewind Post stay on the edge of Camp Mojache?"]="要是你不能派帮手前往西岸峰，也许能让乱风岗的难民到莫沙彻营地的边上待一阵子？"
G["If you cannot send any help to Westreach Summit, may we send refugees here?"]="要是你不能派人前往西岸峰帮忙，那我们能把难民送到这儿来吗？"
G["If you could catch a fish big enough for your mouth we'd never be hungry again."]="如果你的钓鱼水平有你说的那么好，那我们就不会在这里饿肚子了。"
G["If you could use some exotic brew, T'chali's Voodoo Brewery at Brewfest has got you covered!"]="如果你想喝些异国风味的酒，美酒节上有塔卡里的巫毒酒！"
G["If you desire to form a fellowship then it is the guild master, Lysheana, that you must see.  You will find her in the Craftsmen's Terrace in the northeastern section of Darnassus."]="要是你想要组建公会的话，你必须去见公会管理人琳沙娜。她在达纳苏斯东北部的工匠区。"
G["If you desire to learn the ways of Herbalism then it is to Thunder Bluff that you must go.  Follow the road north out of Bloodhoof Village and take the elevator to the top of the rise.  You can ask a Bluffwatcher there for further assistance."]="要是你想学习草药学，就必须去雷霆崖。出了血蹄村，沿着北边的路走，然后乘坐升降梯到达山顶。你可以问问雷霆崖的守卫获取帮助。"
G["If you desire, in addition to training, I have it within my power to erase the knowledge of your talents from your mind.  Be warned that every time you undergo this procedure the more difficult it is to perform, and therefore the more expensive it becomes."]="要是你愿意的话，除了训练之外，我还可以用自己的力量将天赋从你的头脑中抹去。我要警告你的是，你每经历一次这样的过程，执行这过程的难度就会增加一分，而且所需的费用也会随之上升。"
G["If you die, you die."]="要是你死了，就结束了。"
G["If you do not behave I will turn this picnic right around and we will go home. Is that what you want?"]="要是你们不听话，我就马上结束野餐，带你们回家。你们愿意这样吗？"
G["If you do not care then there is no harm telling me."]="既然你不关心，那告诉我又有什么关系？"
G["If you do not engage in combat soon, you will forfeit!"]="如果你不能尽快进入战斗，就将自动告负！"
G["If you do not yet know this name, we are certain you will after these battles.  We present, $n."]="如果你还不知道这个人的名字，那么你就应该好好看看他的战斗。我们在此向大家介绍$n。"
G["If you don't come out, we'll tear this place apart!"]="如果你再不露面，我们就踏平这里！"
G["If you don't do something about these gnolls, we will!"]="要是你不对这些豺狼人采取行动，我们要动手了！"
G["If you don't eat your fish, you can't have any pudding!"]="如果你不把鱼吃了，就别想吃布丁！"
G["If you don't get that thing fully operational, we're toast for sure!"]="要是你不能让这玩意儿正常运转，我们就完蛋了！"
G["If you don't like what we do here, you talk to the Eye. But it will not listen. It's not the Ear."]="要是你对我们不满意，就去跟眼睛说。可眼睛不会听。它不是耳朵。"
G["If you don't mind hurrying it up?  I think they're getting ready to sacrifice me!"]="如果你不介意的话，加快点速度可以吗？我想他们已经准备把我献祭掉了！"
G["If you don't mind me asking.  How did we manage to recover the fragment?  How did we infiltrate our enemies' forces without their knowledge?"]="呃，要是您不介意，我想问问。我们是怎么找回碎片的？又是怎么悄悄地渗透进了敌人阵营的？"
G["If you don't mind my askin', what do you do that requires walking so much?"]="要是你不介意的话——我很好奇，你是做什么的，需要走那么多路？"
G["If you don't mind, I'm going to teleport us back to the Rebel Camp.  We'll thank you in person later."]="如果你不介意，我要把我们传送回反抗军营地了。我们会稍后再向你表达我们的谢意。"
G["If you don't settle down, you'll be spending the night inside the Stockade!"]="如果你们不安静些，你们今晚就要在监狱里待着了！"
G["If you don't settle down, you'll find yourself tossed in with the rest of the arrested cultists."]="如果你们不安静些，你们就要和那些被拘捕的邪教徒关在一起了。"
G["If you don't start throwing some real punches, you'll be cleaning the drake stalls for a year!"]="要是你还不使出全力的话，就要被派去清扫一年的幼龙粪便！"
G["If you drop one more crate I swear I am sending you off to be disenchanted."]="如果你再敢弄丢一个箱子，我发誓我一定要把你拆了。"
G["If you earn enough Brewfest prize tickets, the ticket redeemer in the Brewfest camp can give you an \"Honorary Brewer\" hand stamp.\n\nThat stamp will allow me to sell you a Brewfest riding ram. But they don't come cheap, mind you!"]="\"Si consigues suficientes vales para la Fiesta de la Cerveza, el canjeador de vales, en el campamento de la Fiesta de la Cerveza, te dará un \"Sello de \"Cervecero Honorario\"\".\n\nEse sello me permitirá venderte un carnero de montar de la Fiesta de la Cerveza. ¡Pero recuerda que no son baratos!"
G["If you ever do that again, I will break your neck."]="如果你再敢这么做，我会扭断你的脖子。"
G["If you ever find yourself travelling to the west off the beaten path keep a weather eye out for my eccentric father. He never enjoyed the increased business from the Stormstouts.\n\nI grew up listening to how we were \"brewing out originallity.\" He is quite the beer snob.\n\nStill, he might have a trinket or story you might find interesting."]="Si alguna vez viajas al oeste fuera del camino transitado, echa un vistazo a ver si encuentras a mi excéntrico padre. Nunca le gustó el creciente negocio de los Cerveza de Trueno.\n\nCrecí escuchando que estábamos \"perdiendo originalidad\". Es un sibarita de la cerveza.\n\nAun así, es posible que tenga algún abalorio o historia que te resulte interesante."
G["If you ever have need of a healer in battle, speak to me."]="如果你需要我协助作战，就告诉我一声。"
G["If you ever meet Witch Doctor Tor'gash, tell him his concoctions and charms don't work! I did exactly as he told me to and still Magasha has eyes only for Zurai.\n\nDon't believe a thing that sham witch doctor tells you!"]="如果你有机会遇到巫医托尔加什，告诉他，他的药和符咒不起作用！我完全按照他告诉我的去做，但是玛加沙仍然只把注意力放在祖莱身上。\n\n不敢相信巫医告诉我的事情竟然是假的。"
G["If you ever need any filth, come talk to me. I can help."]="如果你需要污物，可以来找我。我能帮你。"
G["If you fall into the water below, don't be discouraged. Swim back to the first ledge and start again."]="如果你落进下方的水中，不要气馁。游回到第一个平台那里，重新开始吧。"
G["If you fall off, I'm not going in after you!"]="如果你摔下来了，我可接不住你！"
G["If you fall, who would notice?"]="如果你倒下了，又有谁会在意？"
G["If you figure out any way to improve the device let me know!"]="如果你有办法改进这个装置，那就告诉我！"
G["If you find the lunar festival revelers in Silvermoon, they can transport you to Moonglade to partake in the celebration."]="如果你在银月城找到春节狂欢者，他们可以把你传送到月光林地去参加庆典。"
G["If you find this note, then I am either dead or at Halfhill Market.\n\nHopefully I have temporarily left my post to enjoy a hot mug of ale in town. Perhaps you should go check, just in case.\n\nIf indeed I have failed my mission, please send my love and effects to my family in Zhu's Watch.\n- Sho"]="Si encuentras esta nota, significa que estoy muerta o en el Mercado del Alcor.\n\nEspero que sea porque he abandonado temporalmente mi puesto y he ido a disfrutar de una jarra caliente de cerveza a la ciudad. Quizás deberías ir a comprobarlo, por si acaso.\n\nSi resulta que he fracasado en mi misión, te ruego que le transmitas mi cariño y mis efectos personales a mi familia en la Atalaya de Zhu.\n\n- Sho"
G["If you find yourself in this cave again, do not forget about the thermal vents. They may help you escape some tight situations."]="如果你下次再来这个洞穴，别忘记利用那些排气口。在紧急关头，它们能救你一命。"
G["If you fished as well as you talked the ocean wouldn't have any fish left."]="如果你的钓鱼技术真的像你说的那么好，那么整个海里的鱼早就被你全钓光了。"
G["If you had not just rescued me from certain death, I would kill you where you stand. Next time we meet, I will not hold back."]="要不是你救了我一命，我一定立刻杀了你。下次再见时，我可不会手下留情。"
G["If you hadn't rescued me from that prison I surely would have succumbed by now.\n\nI have not forgotten...."]="要不是你出手相助，我肯定已经死在监牢里了。\n\n我怎么都忘不了……"
G["If you have a ranged weapon, use it to shoot down ropes that hold grummles up."]="如果你有远程武器，就用它射断吊起土地精的绳子。"
G["If you have been muted, or have questions about the Muting/UnMuting process, please visit... zzzttt!!"]="如果您被禁言或者有关于禁言/开启禁言的疑问，请访问……嗞嗞嗞！"
G["If you have come all the way out here, then it must be that you dare to venture near Manaforge Ara.\n\nCare to buy or sell before you head over?"]="如果你是沿着这条路出去的话，那你肯定够胆去法力熔炉：艾拉附近冒险了。\n\n在你出发前买点东西吧？"
G["If you have come looking for the gift of fast and safe mobility, then you have arrived at your destination!  This year's model of the new Mechano-striders have recently arrived, and I am ready to show you all they have to offer!"]="如果你是为获得快速而安全的产品而来，那么这儿就是你的目的地了！今年的机械陆行鸟模型已经到了，我将为你展示其性能！"
G["If you have come to save the world then you have come to the right place. The faceless one - the Blood God, Hakkar - has been brought back into our world!"]="如果你是来拯救世界的，那么你来对地方了。无面者——血神哈卡——已经被带回到我们的世界来了！"
G["If you have dealings with the doctor over there, be cautious. Whatever they're up to, it's unnatural."]="如果你要和那些医师打交道的话，千万当心。他们一定在干什么不正常的勾当。"
G["If you have lost a piece of your Zandalarian armor, I may be able to help you."]="如果你丢失了任何一件赞达拉护甲，我想我可以帮忙。"
G["If you have lost a piece of your Zandalarian armor, I may be able to help."]="如果你丢失了任何一件赞达拉护甲，我想我可以帮忙。"
G["If you have more thick leather, I'm sorry but you've come too late. We have all that we need, but before you go would you check with the others here? There's likely someone that still needs your help with their own collecting."]="你有多余的厚皮？很抱歉你来晚了。我们已经集齐备战所需的厚皮了，但是在你离开之前，不妨问问这儿的其他人。或许有人需要你的帮助。"
G["If you have naga blood on your hands, then you're an ally of mine.\n\nA long time ago, I swore I'd never be anyone's slave again, and I kept that bargain until Idra'kess captured us.  Now I can barely contain my fury.  All I want is blood... not food, not sleep, not even victory... only blood."]="要是你的双手沾上了纳迦的鲜血，那你就是我的盟友。\n\n很久以前，我发誓决不再做任何人的奴隶，在那以后我一直信守对自己的承诺，直到落在埃卓凯丝的手里。现在我已经抑制不住胸中的怒火。鲜血是我唯一的渴望……我可以不吃不睡，甚至可以不要胜利……只要鲜血。"
G["If you have not spoken to Magistrix Erona at the Sunspire, I recommend you do so immediately.  There are pressing matters to attend to, and she - as do we all - need your help!"]="如果你还没有和太阳之塔的魔导师艾洛娜谈过话，最好马上去看看。那里有一些棘手的问题需要解决，而且她就像我们一样，需要你的帮助！"
G["If you have not yet learned how to make use of bandages, I will be happy to show you the basics of creation and application. The difference between life and death can often come down to properly bandaging wounds."]="要是你还没学会怎么去使用绷带，我很高兴向你展示下基本的绷带制作和使用方法。生与死之间的区别，经常是一根绑带决定的。"
G["If you have something to say, say it!"]="如果你有什么话要说，就快点！"
G["If you have the coin, I have the food and drink to keep that appetite of yours satisfied.  Every copper goes to keeping the Retreat in tip-top shape."]="如果你有钱，我保证你对我提供的食品和饮料都很满意，每个铜币都物有所值！"
G["If you have the money, I have what you need."]="只要你有钱，我就能弄到你要的东西。"
G["If you have the time, Grimclaw and his master Volcor could use your help. If you're interested, speak with me further..."]="如果你有时间，锐爪和他的主人沃科尔需要你的帮助。要是你感兴趣的话，就继续和我谈谈吧……"
G["If you have the time, you should visit Binan's famous Brewmoon Festival. I will be brewing some of my famous Kun-Lai Kicker Brew."]="如果你有时间，你应该参观滨岸有名的酿月祭。我会酿造一些著名的昆莱劲酒。"
G["If you have to ask, you don't know me anywhere near well enough to be using that appellation."]="坦率地说，你还不够和我熟络到可以使用那个昵称。"
G["If you have what it takes, I will be happy to show you the way."]="如果你带着那东西，我会很高兴地为你指路的。"
G["If you haven't already, make sure that you offer your assistance to Rina Moonspring."]="去问问莉娜·月泉有什么需要你帮助的事情吧。"
G["If you haven't come to study, I'll use you to teach a lesson."]="如果你不是来学习的，我就会把你当成教材。"
G["If you haven't come to train, step back and leave me to my work."]="既然你不是过来接受训练的，就站后面点，不要妨碍我工作。"
G["If you haven't run by now, it's too late!"]="你再不跑的话，可就来不及了！"
G["If you head northwest, look for the Grummle Bazaar. Many good trinkets and luckydos for sell there. Good fortune to be found for those who seek it."]="如果你往西北走，可以去土地精集市逛逛。那有许多好看的饰品和幸运符。光顾那里的人总能交上好运。"
G["If you hear the whisper, you're dying..."]="如果你听到那低吟，你就离死不远了……"
G["If you heard that all of the Horde and Alliance collections have been completed, then you heard right, $c. All of the goods for the war that we gathered and prepared are in the process of being sent to Cenarion Hold in Silithus, with less than $2113w days until the last of it arrives there. After that I suppose we'll just have to wait and see who assembles that scepter to ring the gong with, which will open the gates to Ahn'Qiraj and herald the war."]="部落和联盟的收集任务都完成了，没错，$c。所有的战争物资都在运往希利苏斯塞纳里奥要塞的途中，预计在$2113w天内就可全部抵达。我想我们只需等待有人修复流沙节杖，敲响铜锣，打开安其拉的大门，拉开战争的序幕。"
G["If you heard that all of the Horde and Alliance collections have been completed, then you heard right, $c. All of the goods for the war that we gathered and prepared are in the process of being sent to Cenarion Hold in Silithus, with less than a day until the last of it arrives there. After that I suppose we'll just have to wait and see who assembles that scepter to ring the gong with, which will open the gates to Ahn'Qiraj and herald the war."]="部落和联盟的收集任务都完成了，没错，$c。所有的战争物资都在运往希利苏斯塞纳里奥要塞的途中，预计在1天内就可全部抵达。我想我们只需等待有人修复流沙节杖，敲响铜锣，打开安其拉的大门，拉开战争的序幕。"
G["If you here to poke more softknuckles, Dajik going to poke you too. That a bad Goregek habit."]="如果你是来戳软皮猩猩的话，达伊克就要戳你了。别学格利基克的坏习惯。"
G["If you insert tab A into slot B then of course it's going to go BOOM! Here, let me show you what I have and then you can ask Lilliam about how to put it together so it doesn't blow up."]="如果你把A标签插到B槽中，那么当然会爆炸！来，看看我有些什么，然后你可以问利廉姆怎样组合才不会爆炸。"
G["If you intend to play the fool, you may as well look the part."]="如果你们想扮小丑，就要扮得像一点儿。"
G["If you judge a fish by its ability to climb a tree, it will live its life believing it is inadequate."]="尺有所长，寸有所短。量才器使，知人善用。"
G["If you keep failing these simple tasks, you will be put down."]="Si continúas fracasando en estas tareas sencillas, serás $gsacrificado:sacrificada;."
G["If you keep killing hardknuckles, you grow up to be like Goregek. You want be like Goregek?"]="要是你不停地杀硬皮猩猩，就会成为格利基克那样的家伙。你想变成他那样吗？"
G["If you keep teleporting all over the place, Jaina will catch onto us. Please, be more careful next time."]="如果你胡乱传送，吉安娜会抓住我们的。拜托你，下次再小心点。"
G["If you kill them, I will simply reanimate their corpses. And when you die, I will do the same to you."]="无论你砍翻多少天灾士兵，我都能令他们重新站起来。如果你不幸丧命的话，我也能让你复生，成为我的仆从。"
G["If you let me out I promise that you won't regret it!"]="如果你让我出去，我保证你不会后悔的！"
G["If you like excitement, our captain's the best!  I love this job!"]="如果你喜欢刺激，那可是我们船长最擅长的事了！我爱这份工作！"
G["If you live through this... I assure you it will be worth it."]="如果你可以活着完成任务……我会付给你等值的报酬。"
G["If you love demons so much... then you shall have them!"]="既然你这么喜欢恶魔……那就尝尝它们的厉害！"
G["If you manage to complete a deck of beasts cards you will be rewarded with a greater darkmoon card of the blue dragon.   This is very useful in restoring of magical energies."]="如果你集齐一套野兽卡片，我们会奖励你一张高级暗月卡片：蓝龙。这张卡片对恢复魔法能量非常有用。"
G["If you manage to complete a deck of blessings cards you will be rewarded with a greater darkmoon card of crusade.   This will increase the damage you do with your spells and attacks as you continue to fight."]="如果你集齐一套祝福卡片的话，你将获得暗月卡片：远征。当你拿着这张卡片时，你只需持续战斗，你的法术和物理攻击的伤害就会不断提高。"
G["If you manage to complete a deck of elementals cards you will be rewarded with a greater darkmoon card of the maelstrom.   This card will occasionally impact an enemy you are fighting with for heavy damage."]="如果你集齐一套元素卡片，我们会奖励你一张高级暗月卡片：漩涡。这张卡片可能会对你的敌人造成严重的伤害。"
G["If you manage to complete a deck of furies cards you will be rewarded with a greater darkmoon card of vengeance.   While wielding this card anyone who strikes you has a chance of suffering holy vengeance."]="如果你集齐一套报复卡片的话，你将获得一张暗月卡片：复仇。当你拿着这张卡片时，任何攻击你的人都有一定几率遭到神圣的复仇。"
G["If you manage to complete a deck of lunacy cards you will be rewarded with a greater darkmoon card of madness.   The power of madness will fill you each time you slay an enemy."]="如果你集齐一套愚人卡片的话，你将获得暗月卡片：疯狂。当你拿着这张卡片时，每当你杀死一个敌人，你就会充满疯狂的力量。"
G["If you manage to complete a deck of portals cards you will be rewarded with a greater darkmoon card of the twisting nether.   This card will occasionally pull your spirit back into your body after death and restore you."]="如果你集齐一套入口卡片的话，你将获得一张暗月卡片：虚空。这张卡片将有可能在你死亡之后让你复活。"
G["If you manage to complete a deck of storms cards you will be rewarded with a greater darkmoon card of wrath.   This will increase your chance to get a critical hit with spells or physical attacks until you achieve one."]="如果你集齐一套风暴卡片的话，你将获得暗月卡片：怒火。当你拿着这张卡片时，你的法术或物理攻击的爆击几率会不断提高，直到你打出一次爆击。"
G["If you manage to complete a deck of warlords cards you will be rewarded with a greater darkmoon card of heroism.   This card will occasionally heal you while you are engaged in melee combat."]="如果你集齐一套督军卡片的话，你将获得一张暗月卡片：英雄。这张卡片将有可能在你进行近身作战的时候对你进行治疗。"
G["If you mean to free Myzrael, you will be sorry!"]="如果你想要释放密斯莱尔，那么你一定会后悔的！"
G["If you mortals are all so craven, this will be easier than I thought!"]="要是你们人类都这么胆小的话，这事儿比我想象的就容易多了！"
G["If you need a mountain moved, I can do that. I can make 'em for you, too."]="要是您想要搬山，找我就对了。我还能为您造座山出来。"
G["If you need a ride down, take one of these babies!"]="如果你需要坐骑，别客气，骑上这些小可爱吧！"
G["If you need any help, just ask me!"]="需要帮助的话，尽管找我！"
G["If you need help surviving in the woods, you had best not stray far from the city walls.  However if you do plan to stray, then you had better have a talk with Malygen in the Cenarion Enclave so that you might learn to set a proper campfire."]="如果你想要在森林中生存，最好别远离城墙。但是，如果你真的计划在森林中闲逛的话，那么就去找塞纳里奥区的玛里甘谈谈，你会学到如何生营火的。"
G["If you need keys, talk to Walter Soref in the Rogues' Quarter, but watch yourself."]="如果要钥匙，你可以找盗贼区的沃特尔·索雷夫谈一谈，不过要小心。"
G["If you need reagents, you've come to the right place. You won't find a finer selection in all of Shattrath."]="需要施法材料的话，你可来对了地方。即使找遍整个沙塔斯城，你也找不到更好的选择了。"
G["If you need to house your pet while you're training another, then you should talk to Jenova Stoneshield over in the Dwarven District."]="如果你需要将宠物关在屋内，以便训练另一只宠物的话，就去矮人区找耶诺瓦·石盾谈谈。"
G["If you need to speak with Apprentice Garion, you'll find him inside the cottage with Tabetha. At least there, he can't steal all the reagents."]="你可以在塔贝萨的房中找到学徒加里奥。至少，他没法偷走那儿的所有材料。"
G["If you need to travel to the Exodar, I have just the hippogryph for you!"]="如果你需要去埃索达，就乘坐我的角鹰兽吧！"
G["If you need training in alchemy, there is only one place in Stormwind you need to go... Alchemy Needs. You can find it in the Mage Quarter along the outer rim of shops."]="如果你要学习炼金术，暴风城只有一个地方值得你去……那就是炼金材料店。你可以沿着法师区的外围找到这家店铺。"
G["If you nice me let you live."]="如果你对我好，我就让你活下来。"
G["If you not talk to Mizzle, you not become da king!  Talk to Mizzle da Crafty!"]="¡Si no hablar con Mizzle, nunca ser $grey:reina;! ¡Habla con Mizzle el Astuto!"
G["If you only knew the power that I serve, you would not hesitate to kneel before me and join our ranks. Sadly, your ignorance will prove to be your undoing!"]="如果你明白我所侍奉的是怎样的力量，你必将毫不犹豫地跪倒在我面前，加入我们的行列。可惜的是，你的傲慢只能给你带来毁灭！"
G["If you only learn one thing during your time in Bloodmyst, $c, I hope that it is vigilance. This island claims the unwary first, then begins to wear down even the most guarded of warriors.\n\nEverywhere you turn, a foe stands ready to take your life."]="如果你在秘血岛的时候只学到一样东西，$c，我希望那是“警惕”。最初，这座岛屿看起来很安全，然而危险逐渐浮现，甚至是最谨慎的战士都会随时陷入危险。\n\n无论在哪里，总有敌人想要取走你的性命。"
G["If you pay the right price, the Light can always protect you, $c."]="只要你出得起钱，圣光就能永远保护你，$c。"
G["If you play the game, play to win."]="如果你打这场比赛，就一定要全力以赴。"
G["If you prove that you are a true ally, I might consider training you..."]="Si demuestras que eres $gun verdadero aliado:una verdadera aliada;, quizás me plantee instruirte..."
G["If you put on cologne or perfume, then you'll see who is amorous.  Those are the ones who accept love tokens... and offer a gift in return.\n\nBut remember: to give someone a love token, you have to smell just right!  Men like the scent of perfume, while women prefer cologne."]="如果你洒上一些香水，就可以找到对你有好感的人。他们会接受你的爱情信物……并给你一件礼物作为回报。\n\n但是，你要记住：要让别人接受你的爱情信物，你必须闻起来很迷人！男人喜欢香水的味道，而女人会为古龙水陶醉！"
G["If you really trust some undead with your pets, you can talk to Anya Maulray at the inn on the upper ring of the Trade Quarter."]="如果你真的想把宠物委托给某个亡灵，那你可以和安雅·玛尔雷谈谈，他就呆在贸易区上层的旅馆里。"
G["If you really want to get past those doors you'll lend me the strength of at least three people! Follow me!"]="如果你真的想打开那些门，就至少需要3个人的力量！跟我来！"
G["If you really want to help out, you can help me and my friends with some combat practice."]="如果你真的想帮忙，你可以帮我和我的朋友们进行一些格斗练习。"
G["If you refuse to bend to the torch, you will die to the torch!"]="如果你拒绝向火炬屈服，那你就会死在火炬之下！"
G["If you require more training, I would be happy to tell you who can aid you. What weapon has caught your eye?"]="如果你想要进行更多训练，我可以告诉你该去哪里。你想要学习哪种武器呢？"
G["If you require time to rest and regain your strength, you will find the best at the Inn in Dolanaar.  Innkeeper Keldamyr will see to it that you are taken care of."]="如果你需要通过休息恢复体力的话，多兰纳尔的旅店是你最佳的选择。旅店老板凯达米尔将帮你打点一切。"
G["If you run now, you may live."]="要是你现在跑的话，你也许还有机会活下去。"
G["If you seek death, you have found it!"]="如果你想死，我就成全你！"
G["If you seek peace, relinquish the World Pillar and leave Deepholm. This is our realm. Your only welcome here shall be found underneath my stone foot."]="如果你寻求和平，那么就放弃世界之柱并离开深岩之洲。这是我们的国度，你不会受到欢迎，只配被我碾于脚下。"
G["If you seek to advance your training beyond what I have to show you, you'll need to sully those fine clothes. Hgarth has unlocked a number of mysteries in our profession, and lurks in the hills behind Sun Rock Retreat in Stonetalon Mountains."]="我已经没有什么新知识可以教给你了，如果你想要进一步提升自己的技能，就需要学会分解这些精美衣物的方法。赫加斯是位精通附魔学的大师，他就隐居在石爪山脉烈日石居背后的山上，去向赫加斯讨教吧。"
G["If you seek to become my student, you'll need to complete an assignment for me. Prove yourself worthy, and I might even consider rewarding you."]="Si deseas convertirte en mi alumno tendrás que completar una tarea para mí. Demuestra que eres $gmerecedor:merecedora; y tal vez tome en consideración recompensarte."
G["If you seek to hunt naga, then you will need all the help you can get. Deep in the water you can find bubbly fissures that produce enough air bubbles that will allow you to breath underwater. Swim up close so that you can use the bubbles."]="如果你想猎杀纳迦，你需要所能获得的所有帮助。水底有裂缝，能产生足够的气泡供你在水下呼吸。向水面游动，就能利用这些气泡了。"
G["If you seek to improve your cooking skill, I have knowledge to share with you."]="如果你想提升自己的烹饪技能，我正好有些知识要与你分享。"
G["If you seek to learn more of the herbalism arts, I suggest you speak to Han Flowerbloom at the Halfhill Market in the Valley of the Four Winds.\n\nI will mark his  position for you."]="如果你想对草药学有更深的了解，我建议你去四风谷的半山市集找韩·繁花谈谈。\n\n我会为你在地图上标出位置。"
G["If you seek to learn more of the herbalism arts, I suggest you speak to the trainer in The Jade Forest.\n\nI will mark their position for you."]="如果你想对草药学有更深的了解，我建议你去找翡翠林中的训练师谈谈。\n\n我会为你在地图上标出位置。"
G["If you seek to walk a righteous path then you should speak with Seer Alsoomse."]="如果你在寻找正义的道路，你就应该去和先知艾尔苏谈谈。"
G["If you seek training in the Old Ways, I cannot help you."]="如果你在寻求古老的技艺，那我无法帮助你。"
G["If you seek training in weapons, I can provide."]="如果你需要武器训练，我可以向你提供。"
G["If you seek training, I cannot help you."]="如果你在寻求指导，恕我无法提供帮助。"
G["If you should need reagents, I have a full selection available."]="如果你需要材料，尽可以在我这里挑选。"
G["If you so much as spit without my permission, this place shuts down. Forcefully."]="这里完全不欢迎随地吐痰的人。"
G["If you spent enough time here in the valley, perhaps you could make friends with all the locals. Maybe even some day settle down with a farm plot of your own.\n\nImagine that - YOU, the world-weary $c, settling down to manage a farm!\n\n<Chen closes his eyes and laughs a deep belly-laugh.>"]="Si pasaras tiempo suficiente en este valle, a lo mejor podrías trabar amistad con todos los vecinos. Incluso podrías asentarte algún día en tu propia granja.\n\nImagínatelo: tú, $gel:la; $c trotamundos, ¡sentando la cabeza y llevando una granja!\n\n<Chen cierra los ojos y se ríe alegremente.>"
G["If you start to get too far, I will warn you. If you continue to stray, I will not hesitate to fail you."]="如果你离开太远，我会向你发出警告。要是你还不回头，我就会立即判你不及格。"
G["If you stop this, then maybe we can come up with one."]="你先住手，然后我们再想想其他办法。"
G["If you struggle, then before your death you will face pain and horror and the loss of all you love."]="如果你打算反抗，那么在死之前，你会体验到无尽的痛苦与恐惧，并眼睁睁地看着你挚爱的人撒手而去。"
G["If you think I'll betray my friend that easily, think again!  Face me, you scoundrel!"]="¡Si crees que traicionaré a mi $gamigo:amiga; tan fácilmente, piénsatelo dos veces! ¡Mírame, canalla!"
G["If you think I'm going to be intimidated by a bunch of filthy yaungol, you've got another thing coming!"]="要是你以为我会被几个脏兮兮的野牛人吓倒，那你可就大错特错了！"
G["If you think I'm good, you should see my husband fight."]="如果你认为我很棒，那你该看看我的丈夫如何打斗。"
G["If you think I'm out for the count, think again!"]="要是你以为我已经落败，那就大错特错了！"
G["If you think an orc can hit hard, check out their brew, it hits even harder!  See for yourself at Drohn's Distillery, only at Brewfest!"]="如果你以为兽人给你脑袋上来一下就已经够狠了，就去体验一下更狠的吧！去德罗恩的酿酒厂试试看，只有美酒节才有哦！"
G["If you think you can stop us, you're mistaken, 'friend.'"]="Si crees que puedes detenernos, te equivocas \"colega\"."
G["If you think you have the strength to pound good metal into weapons and armor for the Horde look for Dwukk next to the heated forge in the northwest corner of Razor Hill."]="如果你认为自己有能力为部落打造武器，就去剃刀岭西北部，炙热的熔炉旁找杜克。"
G["If you thought you had problems with trolls in Coldridge, wait 'til you get to Kharanos!  That big cataclysm got the trolls all stirred up out here."]="如果你们以为寒脊山最大的问题是巨魔，那么就到卡拉诺斯去看看吧！这场大灾变让巨魔全都发了疯。"
G["If you touch me again it'll be the last thing you touch!"]="如果你再敢碰我一下，你就别想再碰别的什么东西了！"
G["If you travel to Cenarion Hold in Silithus, you will find Elder Bladesing."]="刃歌长者就在希利苏斯的塞纳里奥要塞。"
G["If you truly desire to know such things, the answer shall come to you when you are prepared to receive it."]="Si de verdad deseas conocer estas cosas, la respuesta vendrá cuando estés $glisto:lista; para recibirla."
G["If you truly have the desire to learn this profession, then I would point you in the direction of Ainethil, a skilled alchemist at the Craftsmen's Terrace in northern Darnassus."]="如果你真的想做这个职业，就去达纳苏斯北部的工匠区找一个技艺纯熟的炼金士：安尼希尔。"
G["If you truly wish to undo what your kind have wrought upon our land you must first prove yourselves here in our school."]="你们这些人给我们的家园带来如此灾难，如果你们真想补救，就在这儿，证明自己。"
G["If you try to fail and succeed, what did you just do?"]="如果你想要失败，但是却成功了，你做了什么？"
G["If you value your beer, run for it!"]="如果你还珍惜自己的啤酒，就快跑吧！"
G["If you wanna live life to the fullest, you gotta try T'chali's Voodoo Brew!"]="如果你想充分享受生活，你就必须尝尝塔卡里的巫毒酒！"
G["If you want a fight, you'll get one!"]="如果你想要打，那我奉陪！"
G["If you want her back you're gonna have to beg!"]="如果你想把她要回去，那你就得求我！"
G["If you want him back you're gonna have to beg... like a monkey!!"]="如果要我还给你，你就必须……像猴子一样求我！！"
G["If you want something done right, do it yourself!"]="如果你想要做什么事，就去做吧！"
G["If you want the key, you'll have to catch me!"]="想要钥匙的话，就来追我吧！"
G["If you want to access the market here, get to the central ring of the city."]="如果你想看看这里的市场，那么就到中央区域去吧。"
G["If you want to be friends with big-tongues, you not friends with Frenzyheart! I tell village! We no trust you anymore!"]="如果你要和大舌头怪交朋友，那你就不是狂心狼獾人的朋友啦！我要告诉全村人！我们再也不会相信你了！"
G["If you want to find a paladin, you'll have to go to the Royal Quarter. There's some elf there who can teach you."]="找圣骑士你得去皇家区。那些有几个精灵可以教你。"
G["If you want to hire a gryphon, you've come to the right place."]="如果你想要骑乘狮鹫，那你就来对地方了。"
G["If you want to join the brawl, just let me know."]="如果你想要参加搏击，尽管告诉我就行。"
G["If you want to jump to your death this time, I won't stop you."]="你想自寻死路的话，我是不会阻拦你的。"
G["If you want to know about the comings and goings of caravans and merchants here in Splintertree Post, then I am fortunately the orc you are looking for.  Unfortunately for you though, I don't like people.\n\nIf you want something, make it quick."]="如果你想知道碎木哨岗的商旅来往情况，我恰好就是你要找的兽人。不幸的是，我不喜欢人类。\n\n要是你想要什么的话，就快些。"
G["If you want to learn enchanting, go find Lavinia Crowe on the inner ring of the Apothecarium."]="炼金区内环区域的拉文尼亚·克洛文可以教你有关附魔的知识。"
G["If you want to learn how to skin things, head to the Rogues' Quarter. The skinner has his place on the inner ring."]="如果你想学习剥皮，就要前往盗贼区。剥皮训练师的铺位就在内环区域。"
G["If you want to learn how to wield weapons, go to Archibald on the inner ring of the War Quarter."]="到军事区内环区域找到阿基巴德，他可以教你如何某些使用武器。"
G["If you want to learn to mine, talk to Brom Killian at the inner ring of the War Quarter."]="和军事区内环区域的布罗姆·基里安谈一谈，他可以教你如何采矿。"
G["If you want to speed this process up then make sure you have your papers in order!"]="如果你想要加快速度，那就认真准备好自己的文件！"
G["If you want your rams back, come get them, cowards!"]="要是你想找回你们的牲畜，就来抢啊，懦夫！"
G["If you want, go get, big-tongue baby!"]="如果你想的话，那就去吧，大舌头怪的崽子！"
G["If you watch these bolts of fire closely to see which runes are not hit, you can spot safe spots for the next burst."]="如果你仔细观察这些火焰箭，确认那些没有被击中的符文，你就能在下一次爆炸中找到安全位置。"
G["If you will follow me, then."]="那就请跟我来。"
G["If you will not cease this foolish quest, then you will die!"]="如果你不中止这愚蠢的举动，那就去死吧！"
G["If you will not leave Alterac Valley on your own, then the Frostwolves will force you out!"]="如果你不自动离开奥特兰克山谷，霜狼会强迫你离开的！"
G["If you will not serve my Master with your sword and knowledge of his enemies..."]="如果你不愿为我的主人服务，不愿提供敌人的消息的话……"
G["If you wish to advance further in the fine art of tailoring, please speak with my employer, Keelen. He can show you more than I ever will."]="如果你想要进一步提升自己的裁缝技能，就去和我的雇主基伦谈谈吧。他所掌握的裁缝知识远远超越我。"
G["If you wish to become a swordsmith, just ask."]="Si quieres convertirte en $gun forjador:una forjadora; de espadas, solo tienes que pedírmelo."
G["If you wish to continue our work, we will need some additional supplies..."]="如果你想要继续为我们工作，我们还需要一些补给……"
G["If you wish to further your skills, seek Telia's shop in Silvermoon.  It is on the south end of the Royal Exchange."]="如果你想提高你的技艺，就去银月城吧。泰莉亚的商店就在皇家贸易区的南方尽头。"
G["If you wish to truly experience the feast of Winter Veil, you should go to Orgrimmar."]="如果你想真正体验一下冬幕节，就应该去奥格瑞玛看看。"
G["If you wish to use a hippogryph, speak with Fidelio."]="如果你想要骑角鹰兽，就去找菲德利奥吧。"
G["If you would have let me drive, we wouldn't have gotten in this mess!"]="如果让我来开坦克，事情就不会搞成现在这样了！"
G["If you wouldn't mind waiting, $n... this might take a long time."]="Si no te importa esperar... puede que esto tarde un buen rato."
G["If you'd allow me just one..."]="能不能让我……"
G["If you'd be so kind, please let me out of here!"]="你一看就是个大好人，放我出去吧！"
G["If you'd been a better assistant this whole Cataclysm thing could have been avoided!"]="你要是个好点儿的帮手，大灾变这整场灾难就能避免！"
G["If you'll excuse me, I must take my leave. Good day, ladies."]="请原谅，我必须得走了。再见，女士们。"
G["If you'll excuse me, I'm afraid I have other business I must attend to.  Please call on me again in the future."]="请原谅，恐怕现在我还有别的事情必须去做。请以后再来找我。"
G["If you're a real hero of the Horde, then I wanna see you fight a dragon!  Yeah!"]="要是你真是部落的英雄，我想看看你屠龙！啊！"
G["If you're as accomplished as you claim, why don't you investigate Zul'Aman yourself?"]="你要是真有自己吹嘘的那么能干，为什么不亲自去调查祖阿曼呢？"
G["If you're ever captured by the Legion, tell them \"Xar il romath da tidesbi.\" They will kill you instantly for insulting their god, saving you intolerable torture or worse..."]="如果你被燃烧军团俘虏了，对他们说“Xar il romath da tidesbi”，他们就会马上杀了你，因为你侮辱了他们的神。否则你就会受到无尽的折磨或者更糟的……"
G["If you're expecting some kind of official welcome, you're going to be disappointed, $c. We don't stand on tradition, here. What works is what goes."]="如果你在期盼正式的欢迎，那么你会失望的，$c。我们在这里并不拘泥于传统。怎么行就怎么做。"
G["If you're feeling queasy, speak with Pestle.  He might have something for motion sickness."]="Si estás $gmareado:mareada;, habla con Pestle. Puede que tenga algo para los mareos."
G["If you're going to be taking up my time, you'd better prove you're worth it. I ought to get something out of this arrangement, after all."]="如果你要占用我的时间的话，你最好证明自己的价值。毕竟，我应该从这样的安排中获得点什么。"
G["If you're going to come out here, make yourself useful because the shadowstalker over there isn't doing much."]="如果你想从这里出去的话，就得自己努力，那边的巡影者什么忙都帮不上。"
G["If you're going to get to Warlord Kalithresh, you'll need to defeat Mekgineer Steamrigger and Hydromancer Thespia so that you can get to the Main Chambers Access Panels.\n\nYou mash a few buttons on those, and the door to the main chamber will open right up!"]="如果你想要挑战督军卡利瑟里斯，就必须先击败机械师斯蒂里格和水术师瑟丝比娅，这样才能接触到主厅控制面板。\n\n然后，你只要按下面板上的几个按钮，就能打开通向主厅的大门了！"
G["If you're going to venture into Blackrock Depths, come speak with me. I may have some work for you."]="如果你要到黑石深渊去，就来找我谈谈。或许我会有些工作要交给你。"
G["If you're heading toward the city, then I have something important for you to do!"]="要是你正准备去城里，那么我有些重要的事情需要你来做！"
G["If you're here to be trained in the tactics and strategy of hunting, you've come to the right place!"]="如果你是来接受狩猎技巧训练的，那你就来对地方了！"
G["If you're here to conduct business, say your piece."]="如果你是来这办正事的，就别绕弯子了。"
G["If you're here, then IT might be close behind!"]="你在这里，那么它肯定就在后面不远处！"
G["If you're here, then it means you are prepared to begin the study of summoning demonic cohorts to do your bidding. We will start with the lowliest creatures you will be able to call and continue from there. Let us begin."]="如果你在这里，那就表明你已经准备好去研究召唤恶魔的方法了。我们将从最低级的生物召唤开始，然后再慢慢进阶。让我们开始吧。"
G["If you're interested in learning more about the traditional Pilgrim's Bounty feast, speak to any of the hostesses."]="如果你想对感恩节的节日传统有更多了解，就和那些女侍应们聊聊天吧。"
G["If you're interested in sewing with leather, you've certainly come to the right place. Faldron and Telonis are true artists, and I hope to learn much from them."]="如果你对皮革缝纫感兴趣，那你算来对地方了。法多恩和泰龙尼斯都是真正的艺术家，而我希望能从他们那里多学些知识。"
G["If you're interested, a couple of us are going into Shattrath for drinks later."]="我们一群人准备稍后去沙塔斯城喝酒，你有兴趣吗？"
G["If you're known for trade, where are the pandaren from other towns?"]="如果你因贸易而出名，其它村的熊猫人都去哪儿了？"
G["If you're looking for a flight back to Rut'theran Village, then you should talk to my night elven counterpart, Silva Fil'naveth."]="如果你想飞回鲁瑟兰村，就该找暗夜精灵希尔瓦·菲纳雯斯谈谈。"
G["If you're looking for a flight back to Thunder Bluff, then you should talk to my tauren counterpart, Bunthen Plainswind."]="要是你想要飞回雷霆崖，就该跟我的牛头人搭档布瑟恩·草风谈谈。"
G["If you're looking for a place to rest, I can help."]="如果你想找一个地方休息，那么我能帮上忙。"
G["If you're looking for an Arcane Reforger, there is a highborne mage inside the enchanting shop just outside the Mage District."]="如果你想要找奥术重铸师重铸物品，可以去法师区外的附魔商店，那里有一位上层精灵法师可以帮上你的忙。"
G["If you're looking for gadgets, doodads, thingamajigs, widgets, whatsis, dohickeys, or gizmos, you've come to the right place!"]="如果你是在寻找零件、齿轮这种小玩意的话，那么你来对地方了！"
G["If you're looking for information that the Cenarion Circle might have archived somewhere, then I'm the one to talk to.  Then again, you need to know what information you're looking for first before I can really help you.\n\nSee how that works?  Brilliant!"]="如果你想在塞纳里奥议会中找寻某些档案的话，我就是那个你要交谈的人。你首先要知道要寻找的确切信息，那样我才能帮你。\n\n看看那个，真是光彩夺目呀！"
G["If you're looking for the Tillers quartermaster, Gina Mudclaw's your girl. She'll be running the market at Halfhill.\n\nLet me mark her location on your map."]="如果你要找阡陌客军需官，那就去跟吉娜·泥爪谈谈。她就在半山市集经商。\n\n让我为你在地图上标出位置。"
G["If you're looking for work, $c, grab yourself a pick and get to digging. There're ruins out there as far as the eye can see!"]="如果你在找活干的话，$c，拿起锄头去挖吧。你没看到那边有一大堆废墟么？"
G["If you're looking to get to Valiance Keep, you can hop onto the cargo ship that runs between here and Borean Tundra. They don't mind taking on the occasional passenger or two."]="想去无畏要塞的话，就跳上开往北风苔原的货船吧。他们不介意偶尔捎几名旅客的。"
G["If you're looking to infiltrate the ruins, speak to Kun Autumnlight at the Guo Lai Ruin first."]="如果你打算进入废墟，就得先去郭莱遗迹和奎·秋光谈一谈。"
G["If you're looking to practice fire fighting, this is the place. There may be a heap of snow hereabouts, but you never know when Steelgrill or those gnomes'll cause an explosion, eh?"]="如果你想接受灭火训练，那么你来对了地方。虽然在这附近到处都是雪，但你永远都不知道贝尔丁·钢架还是那些侏儒什么时候会引起一场爆炸，对吧？"
G["If you're looking to register a guild, I would suggest inquiring within the walls of Silvermoon City itself."]="如果你想注册一个公会，我建议你去银月城里面打听打听。"
G["If you're looking to travel to Northrend, the icebreaker Northspear sails from here to Valgarde in the Howling Fjord."]="想去诺森德的话，就乘坐破冰船“北海之矛”吧。它会载你前往嚎风峡湾的瓦加德。"
G["If you're no good at fixing, we'll see if you're good for eating. Now WORK!"]="要是你不适合修理工作的话，我们就要考虑你是否适合用来做菜了。干活去！"
G["If you're not a tailor, I don't think any of my patterns will interest you, but you're welcome to browse!"]="如果你不是裁缝的话，我想你是不会对我出售的图样感兴趣的，不过还是欢迎你来看看！"
G["If you're not here to work, then please see yourself away from our excavation."]="如果你不打算工作，那就离我们的发掘场远一些。"
G["If you're ready, then Dadanga and I are ready.  Let's go!"]="Si estás $glisto:lista;, Dadanga y yo también lo estamos. ¡En marcha!"
G["If you're seeking a bank in the eastern part of the city, look no further than the Royal Exchange. It lies along the north wall therein."]="如果你想要在城市的东部找一家银行的话，就在皇家贸易区的北墙那里。"
G["If you're seeking patterns or knowledge about shadoweave tailoring, I'd be happy to help you."]="如果你想要购买图样，或是学习暗纹裁缝的话，我很乐意帮忙。"
G["If you're shot down and caught, don't tell them your real name.  Use a codename."]="如果轰炸机被击落，而你被敌人俘虏的话，一定不要讲出自己的真名。要用代号噢。"
G["If you're so eager to fight, I'll oblige you. But know that nothing you do here can prevent the completion of the iron colossus!"]="如果你急于开战，我可以满足你。但是，无论你做什么，都无法阻止铁巨人的完成！"
G["If you're so thirsty for blood, why not group up and go tear apart Stormwind?"]="如果你如此渴望鲜血，为什么不组起队伍，把暴风城砸烂？"
G["If you're trying to be friendly, save your breath.  Better yet, just stop breathing all together."]="如果你想表示友好的话，就请屏住呼吸。最好停止呼吸。"
G["If you're willing to forget this crate thing, I can give you a good price on some recent arrivals from Uldum."]="如果你肯忘记这箱东西，我可以用最优惠的价格，卖给你几件奥丹姆的新货。"
G["If you've a way out of here, we should probably use it! I've tried casting myself and Tyrande out of here, but the well is too much in flux!"]="如果你知道怎么离开，我们恐怕得赶快了！我本想带着泰兰德离开，但井水的魔力太混乱了！"
G["If you've been sent to kill me, please take a number and wait your turn."]="如果你是来杀我的，请先去取个号，然后去排队。"
G["If you've been to Zangarmarsh, you might've run into a fellow named Daniels. You know -- wears a strange helmet, only answers to \"the Specialist.\"\n\nOf course, I taught him everything he knows.\n\nDon't let the fine clothing fool you. I'm still a rogue at heart. Daniels and I spent a lot of time in the trenches together, but that was before I retired. As far as I know, he's still out there, giving 'em hell."]="Si has estado en la marisma de Zangar, puede que te hayas encontrado con un tipo llamado Daniels. Ya sabes – lleva un casco extraño, solo responde al nombre de \"el Especialista.\"\n\nPor supuesto, le enseñé todo lo que sabe.\n\nNo te dejes engañar por la ropa elegante. En el fondo sigo siendo un pícaro. Daniels y yo pasamos mucho tiempo juntos en las trincheras, pero eso fue antes de que yo me retirara. Por lo que sé, sigue ahí fuera, desatando el infierno."
G["If you've been wrasslin' with oil, be sure to avoid all sources of sparks or open flame, such as candles, lighters, mages, Kester's shop, and Deputy Clunky!"]="如果你的身上都是油，那一定要避开一切火星和明火，比如蜡烛、油灯、法师、凯斯特的铺子，还有克朗奇警官！"
G["If you've come looking for the finest craftsmanship on this or any other continent in the world, then you've come to the right place!\n\nGrimand Elmore, at your service!"]="要是你是来找世界上最富经验的工匠，你就找对地方啦！\n\n格瑞曼德·艾尔默，愿为你效劳！"
G["If you've come to return to me to my father, I must ask that you look around us first - can we truly walk away from these people in their time of need and still claim to represent the Alliance?"]="如果你是来带我回去见我父亲的，那我必须要让你先环顾周围——我们真能在这些人急需帮助的时候扬长而去，还声称自己是代表联盟而来吗？"
G["If you've earned the respect of the warchief, there must be something to you. If you can lift the weapon, it's yours."]="如果你能赢得酋长的尊敬，那么你一定是有些过人之处。如果你能拿起这件武器，它就是你的了。"
G["If you've got somewhere to go, I can get you there."]="你要去哪儿吗？我可以送你一程。"
G["If you've got the money, I'm sure the Light's got something to teach you."]="如果你口袋里有钱，我相信圣光一定能传授给你些什么。"
G["If you've got the time, we've got the brew. Stormstout!"]="如果你有空，就来尝尝我们的美酒吧。风暴烈酒！"
G["If you've never seen one, it is a sight to behold. A very impressive creature both on and off the field of battle. Next, let us take a look at what I am sure all you male students have been waiting for. The succubus."]="如果你还没有看见过虚空行者，那你一定要去看看。这种生物看上去就极具气势，而且在战场上也能发挥很强的作用。接下来，让我们看看所有男性学员都在热切期盼的召唤生物：魅魔。"
G["If you've seen the journal, then you know what I've been discovering. The titans' own creations are at war with each other!"]="如果你看过日记，就该知道我发现了什么。泰坦的造物正在自相残杀！"
G["If you've the gold, I can teach you how to ride a hawkstrider."]="如果你有金币，我就能教你怎么骑陆行鸟。"
G["If your enemies harass the worker, productivity will cease until the threat is dealt with."]="如果敌人骚扰到了工人的工作，生产就会陷入停滞，直到你击退敌人的进攻。"
G["If your glass is full may it be again!"]="再来满饮一杯！"
G["If your glove is too big, does it still fit like a glove?"]="要是你的手套太大的话，还算是合手的手套吗？"
G["If your people are as strong as you purport, I'm sure you'll find your stride again."]="如果你的人民像你所宣称的那样强大，我深信你们会再次迈入辉煌的。"
G["If your stomach's rumbling, talk to Galley Chief Steelbelly, but just between you and me? You might want to wait. He's got that name for a reason."]="如果你的肚子饿得咕咕叫，就去找厨师长拜雷·钢胃谈谈，可别说是我告诉你的这家伙的名字可是有来历的……"
G["If zhat vere not enough, you sabotaged my ritual and caused Gobbles' death!"]="如果那些理由还不够的话，你还破坏了我的仪式，害哥培尔送了命！"
G["If'n I'm gonna be Scourge anyway, I might as well be drunk!"]="如果我真的会成为天灾恶鬼，那我最好还是先喝醉了吧！"
G["Iffin' yeh don't sumtimes shoot a small furry animal out yer gun, 'ow would yeh keep it clean? The druids don't 'ave an answer to THAT one!"]="如果你不能时不时从枪管里射出只毛茸茸的小动物来，又怎么能保持枪管清洁呢？德鲁伊对那种事可没什么办法！"
G["Ignious, burn 'em up for me, won't you?"]="伊格尼斯，替我烧死他们，没问题吧？"
G["Ignorant whelps!"]="无知的蠢货！"
G["Ignore Twilight's Hammer! They stupid. Kill other one, now!"]="别去管暮光之锤渣滓！他们都是蠢货。去杀那边那个，赶快！"
G["Ignore her, $p. Help us brew this beer."]="别管她，$p。帮我们酿啤酒吧。"
G["Ignore that... we have work to do!"]="别管那么多……我们还有很多工作要做！"
G["Ignore the Horde - focus on the Zandalari guarding the door!"]="别管部落——我们先对付守门的赞达拉！"
G["Ignore their blows, $n! They cannot harm you!"]="不用理睬他们的攻击，$n！他们伤害不了你！"
G["Ignoring the battle that raged about him, Latherion dropped his guard to cradle his love in her dying moments. But the demons gave him no quarter, and quickly laid him low."]="拉瑟里安不顾正在进行的激烈战斗，放下了自己的武器，紧紧地抱着他死去的爱人。但是恶魔没有停止攻击，很快就将他无情地杀死了。"
G["Iiiiiiiiii'm back Wikkets!"]="无毛怪，我回来了！"
G["Iilth qi'uothk shn'ma yeh'glu Shath'Yar! H'IWN IILTH!"]="¡Iilth qi'uothk shn'ma yeh'glu Shath'Yar! ¡H'IWN IILTH!"
G["Iilth vwah, uhn'agth fhssh za."]="Lilth vwah, uhn'agth fhssh za."
G["Ikan tries and tries.  I think these Dreghood are much like the Lost Ones, you know... lost."]="伊坎试了又试。我想这些残冠氏族的人更像是失落者，你知道……那些失落了的……"
G["Ikiss cut you, pretty -- ak-a-ak -- slice you, yes!"]="艾吉斯杀了你们，呱嘎嘎！杀了你们！"
G["Ikiss will not -- rak, rak -- die..."]="艾吉斯不会……呱嘎……不会死…"
G["Ikk's gonna hit da land."]="伊克会把这片土地弄坏的。"
G["Ileda of da blood elves, in Farstrider Square of Silvermoon, train her students in both one and two-handed swords. Archibald, da Undercity's weapon master, also train you, mon. He in da War Quarter."]="银月城远行者广场的血精灵伊蕾达会教你学习使用单手剑和双手剑。幽暗城的武器大师阿基巴德同样也能教你，他就在军事区。"
G["Ileda of the blood elves, found within Farstrider Square of Silvermoon, trains her students in both one and two-handed swords. Archibald, Undercity's weapon master, can also train you; he is in the War Quarter."]="银月城远行者广场的血精灵伊蕾达会教你学习使用单手剑和双手剑。幽暗城的武器大师阿基巴德同样也能教你，他就在军事区。"
G["Ilifar, your master calls!"]="伊利法尔，你的主人在召唤你！"
G["Illidan Stormrage."]="伊利丹·怒风。"
G["Illidan has been knocked to the ground!  Mannoroth is looking for a new target!"]="伊利丹被打倒了！玛诺洛斯正在寻找新目标！"
G["Illidan has recovered!"]="伊利丹又恢复了！"
G["Illidan is an arrogant fool! I will crush him and reclaim Outland as my own!"]="伊利丹是个傲慢的蠢货！我要毁灭他，重新统治外域！"
G["Illidan is looking for me.  I am not safe here... none of us are."]="伊利丹正在搜捕我。我在这里非常危险，我们大家都非常危险。"
G["Illidan reigns!"]="伊利丹至高无上！"
G["Illidan will become suspicious... that much is for certain.  We will deal with it as we always do."]="伊利丹会起疑心，这是毫无疑问的。不过我们会挺过去的，一直以来不都是这样吗？"
G["Illidan will find me and when he does... he will pry the Ashtongue secret from me - such is the power of the Betrayer!  No... there is only one way.  My usefulness to the cause has come to an end. I must venture into the spirit world!"]="伊利丹必定会抓住我，那时候，他肯定会得知灰舌部队的秘密。这对他来说根本没有什么难度！不，我们只有一个办法。是我的愚蠢和疏忽导致了今天的局面，那么就让我进入灵魂的世界，结束这次危机。"
G["Illidan will pay."]="伊利丹会付出代价的。"
G["Illidan! The well is out of control!"]="伊利丹！永恒之井失去控制了！"
G["Illidan's grasp on this land is slipping.  Can you feel it, $n?"]="伊利丹对这个地方的控制逐渐放松了。你能感觉到吗，$n？"
G["Illidan's grasp over my tribe is strong, $n. It shall all be over soon, one way or another.\n\nAre you ready, $n?  My people's future depends on us."]="El control de Illidan sobre mi tribu es fuerte, $n. Pronto acabará, de un modo u otro.\n\n¿Quieres seguir adelante, $n? El futuro de mi pueblo está en nuestras manos."
G["Illidan's lackeys still guard these halls, $n.  Once they are defeated, my powers will allow me to take you deeper inside the temple."]="伊利丹的侍从依然守护着神殿大厅，$n。如果你打败了他们，我就能带你进入神殿的深处。"
G["Illidan's lapdogs!  Destroy them all!"]="把伊利丹的走狗们全部消灭！"
G["Illidan's lapdogs!  You will pay for my imprisonment with your lives!"]="伊利丹的走狗们！你们会因为囚禁我而付出生命的代价！"
G["Illidan, I am out of arrows! Moon goddess, protect us from the darkness, that we may see your light again another night!"]="伊利丹，我的箭用光了！月亮女神，请庇护我们不受黑暗的侵袭，保佑我们见到明晚的月光！"
G["Illidan, what is in that vial? What are you doing?"]="伊利丹，那个瓶子里装的是什么？你在干什么？"
G["Illidan...you musn't!"]="伊利丹……你不能这么做！"
G["Illusionary Ambushers! Get their attention, quick. And get them away from me, so they cannot hit me with their devastating bananas!"]="幻影伏击者！快吸引它们的主意，让它们离我远点，别让那些危险的香蕉击中我！"
G["Illusionary Flamecallers! Watch your feet, everyone. Do not stand in the lava."]="幻影召焰者！各位，注意脚下！别站在岩浆里！"
G["Illusionary Foragers are attacking. Do not let their cute faces fool you. They can work together to cause terrible devastation."]="幻影抢劫者进攻了！别让它们可爱的样子骗了，它们能合力造成极高的伤害。"
G["Illusionary Hive-Singers! Their sonic waves will harm us all."]="幻影虫巢咏者来了！它们的音波能伤害整个团队。"
G["Illusionary Rippers approaching. They should pose little challenge; they are but mindless grunts."]="幻影撕裂者来了。它们算不上挑战，只是些没脑子的蛮兵。"
G["Illusionary Varmints come in packs, and are harmless. Use attacks that affect multiple opponents to kill them quickly."]="幻影恶棍总是成群结队地出现，但完全无害。你可以用范围伤害技能快速击杀它们。"
G["Illyanna, why do you spurn me? I would weave a web to catch the sun, if you were to ask me to do so!"]="伊琳娜，为什么你要拒绝我？只要你说一句话，我甚至能织出一张网，为你捉住太阳。"
G["Ilyenia Moonfire, the night elf weapon master on the Warrior's Terrace in Darnassus, or Buliwyf, the dwarf weapon master within the Timberline Arms in Ironforge, can train you in the use of fist weapons."]="达纳苏斯战士区的武器大师伊琳尼雅·月火，或是铁炉堡密林武器店的矮人武器大师布里维夫，都能教你如何使用拳套。"
G["Ilyenia Moonfire, the night elf weapon master who resides at the Warrior's Terrace in Darnassus, can show ye how to use a bow."]="居住在达纳苏斯战士区的暗夜精灵武器大师伊琳尼雅·月火能指导你怎么使用弓。"
G["Ilyenia Moonfire, the night elf weapon master who resides at the Warrior's Terrace in Darnassus, can train you in the use of bows."]="居住在达纳苏斯战士区的暗夜精灵武器大师伊琳尼雅·月火可以教你使用弓。"
G["Im... impossible! Tharon'ja is eternal! Tharon'ja... is...."]="不……不可能！萨隆亚是不朽的！萨隆亚是……"
G["Im... possible..."]="不……可能……"
G["Image dissipation in sixty seconds."]="影像将在一分钟内消散。"
G["Imagination is the limit my friend, if you can figure out how to smith it then you can make it, box it, and ship it to retailers all over the world. Of course, then you have to deal with marketing. Tell you what, let's just stick with the smithing part for now, ok?"]="El único límite es la imaginación, $gamigo:amiga;, si puedes imaginar cómo forjarlo podrás hacerlo, empaquetarlo y enviarlo a vendedores de todo el mundo. Aunque entonces, claro está, tendrás que vértelas con las técnicas de mercado. Te diré algo, por ahora vamos a quedarnos con la parte de la herrería, ¿vale?"
G["Imagine all the wisdom and knowledge locked away within Ulduar. The very secrets of life could be held there!"]="你能想象吗？奥杜尔中埋藏着所有的智慧与知识，甚至还有生命本身的秘密！"
G["Imagine my surprise when I was approached by the genius forsaken, Calder Gray, and propsitioned with a combatant made of all the best features of our previous champions... LITERALLY! Who could refuse a chance to challenge CALDER'S CREATION?!"]="想象一下，当我遇到那个被遗忘者天才卡尔德·格雷的时候，是多么惊讶。他说，他制造出了一名战士，那名战士拥有以前所有勇士的全部最优秀的能力……真的会有这样的战士！有谁能拒绝向卡尔德的造物挑战的机会？！"
G["Imagine one of those walking around on two feet, only angrier."]="想象下这些巨兽直立着用双脚走路，凶神恶煞的样子。"
G["Imagine the most amazing elevator you have ever seen... right here. Yea, its sweet isn't it? Sadly, its not ready yet."]="想象一下最令人惊叹的升降机会是什么样子……它就在这里。很漂亮，不是么？糟糕的是，它还没有准备好。"
G["Imagine what we could summon with just a fraction of this power!"]="想想吧，只要有一小部分这种力量，我们能召唤出什么样的恶魔来啊！"
G["Imagine what would happen if that knotty-pated axe-bludgeoner Garrosh could manipulate the sha to his bidding."]="想象一下，那个凶狠难缠的加尔鲁什在挥动他的大斧子的时候还能运用煞能，接下来会发生什么。"
G["Imbecile! Have you not learned the Dewey Decimal System? It has been 3,000 years since you began working for us! Incompetent buffoon."]="愚蠢！你没有学过杜威十进制吗？至少你也已经为我们工作3000年啦！无能的家伙。"
G["Imma healin."]="我要治疗。"
G["Imma runnin away."]="我要跑走了。"
G["Immalanath, yasoth nalarub!!!"]="¡¡¡Immalanath, yasoth nalarub!!!"
G["Immediately, my lady."]="立即执行，我的女士。"
G["Immortality can be yours, but only if you pledge yourself fully to Yogg-Saron!"]="只要将全部身心都献给伟大的尤格-萨隆，就连你们也可以获得不朽的生命！"
G["Imp in a Ball"]="球中的小鬼"
G["Impatience is the road to defeat, you must learn to master your timing."]="莽撞是失败的根源，你必须学会控制节奏。"
G["Imperial Vizier Zor'lok flies to one of his platforms!"]="皇家宰相佐尔洛克朝他其中一个平台飞去了！"
G["Imperial Vizier Zor'lok has |cFFFF0000|Hspell:122740|h[Converted]|h|r you to fight for the Mantid Empire! Your former allies must bring your health down to 50% to free you of the Empress's hold over you!"]="皇家宰相佐尔洛克已将你|cFFFF0000|Hspell:122740|h[策反]|h|r为替螳螂妖帝国战斗！你原来的同伴必须把使你的生命降低至50%，才能帮你摆脱女皇的控制！"
G["Imperial Vizier Zor'lok inhales the Pheromones of Zeal!"]="皇家宰相佐尔洛克吸入狂热信息素！"
G["Impersonation time!!  I call this, \"The Silly Tauren.\""]="¡¡Hora de las imitaciones!! A esto lo llamo yo, \"El tauren idiota.\""
G["Impertinent fool! You are no match for the servants of Prince Kael'thas!"]="蠢货！你们不是凯尔萨斯王子的忠实仆从的对手！"
G["Impertinent whelps, you dare challenge me atop my pedestal? I will crush you myself!"]="狂妄的小崽子们，竟敢在我的地盘上挑战我？我要亲自碾碎你们！"
G["Implementing directive!"]="执行指令！"
G["Implementing new security protocols ..."]="执行新的安全协议……"
G["Impossible sir! The current's too strong!"]="不可能，长官！水流太急了！"
G["Impossible!"]="这不可能！"
G["Impossible!  Lord Thorim, I will bring your foes a frigid death!"]="这不可能！托里姆陛下，我要让您的敌人在严寒中死去！"
G["Impossible! Our might is the greatest in all the empire!"]="这不可能！我们是全帝国最强大的！"
G["Impossible! Rise my minions!  Serve your master once more!"]="不可能！出现吧，我的仆人！再次为你们的主人效力！"
G["Impossible! Sri'thik, Zar'thik, Kor'thik, to the top of the terrace! We must defend the Empress!"]="不可能！瑟里提克、扎尔提克、库尔提克，到平台顶上来！我们必须守卫女皇！"
G["Impossible! Stay your attack, mortals... I submit! I submit!"]="不……不可能！等一下……我投降！我投降！"
G["Impossible! Why does my strength fail me?"]="不可能！ 为什么我的力量如此不济？"
G["Impossible."]="不可能。"
G["Impossible. This cannot be. The tower... must... fall..."]="不可能。这不可能。这座塔……必须毁掉……"
G["Impossible..."]="这不可能..."
G["Impossible...."]="这不可能……"
G["Impossible.... Rimefang.... warn...."]="不可能……霜牙……警报……"
G["Imposter!  It is a dishonor without equal to be summoned by a whelp such as you!  DIE!"]="¡$gImpostor:Impostora;! ¡Es una deshonra para mí ser invocado por alguien como tú! ¡MUERE!"
G["Impostor must be dealt with. The Inventor's Disk must be recovered."]="消灭冒名顶替者。夺回创世者的圆盘。"
G["Impressive skills indeed.  I believe that you are more than ready for the rank of valiant."]="你的战斗技巧令人印象深刻。我相信以你的潜力，远不止成为一名勇士那么简单。"
G["Impressive!"]="真了不起！"
G["Impressive!  You learn quickly, my pupil."]="¡Impresionante! Aprendes rápido, $gaprendiz:aprendiza;."
G["Impressive! I'm going to have to watch out for you."]="真了不起！看来我得提防你了。"
G["Impressive, $r.\n\nThanks to you, these creatures may turn out to be valuable allies."]="令人钦佩，$r。\n\n多亏了你，这些生物或许会成为宝贵的盟友。"
G["Impressive, aren't they? These giants would be the perfect fodd... er, allies.  This one is their leader, but he continues to refuse to speak with me."]="很震撼吧？这些巨人简直是完美的炮灰……呃，是盟友啦。这位就是他们的首领，但他一直拒绝和我谈话。"
G["Impressive, death knight. Return to me in the world of the living for your reward."]="很不错啊，死亡骑士。返回生者的世界，领取你应得的奖励吧。"
G["Impressive, very impressive. Does she do tricks?"]="太不可思议了。这里面到底有什么诀窍？"
G["Impressive."]="精彩。"
G["Impressive.  When do we attack?"]="太棒了。我们什么时候进攻？"
G["Impressive. But can you handle this?"]="漂亮。但这个你能行吗？"
G["Impressive. Complete domination of the animal while it's weakened."]="很好。趁那家伙处于虚弱状态，完成对它的控制。"
G["Impressive. I hadn't anticipated that."]="真了不起。太出乎我的意料了。"
G["Impressive. The master said that you and your people would be a nuisance. No matter, your end draws near. Soon the combined might of Naxxramas will come down upon this place and shatter your meager existence."]="啧啧。你们真的很讨厌呢，难怪主人警告我说要小心对付。不过，你们的末日很快就会降临了。来自纳克萨玛斯的亡灵大军将席卷这里，彻底抹去你们存在过的痕迹。"
G["Impressive. You have managed to destroy one of my most horrific creations, a task I had thought impossible until now."]="了不起。你们毁掉了我最恐怖的造物之一。我原以为这是不可能的。"
G["Impressive... Most impressive."]="令人难忘……太令人难忘了。"
G["Imps, flamekin, whatever!  I don't know warlock crap.  Demons all look the same to me!"]="小恶魔，小鬼，谁知道是什么！我对术士的玩意儿一无所知。恶魔在我看来全都一样！"
G["Impudent fool! I will kill you myself!"]="无礼的蠢货！我会亲自要了你们的命！"
G["Impudent outsiders!"]="放肆！"
G["Impudent pup!"]="放肆！"
G["Impudent whelps! You've rushed headlong to your own deaths! See now, the master stirs!"]="你这个莽撞的家伙！你简直是自寻死路！看吧，你惊动了主人！"
G["Impudent whelps, you only delay the inevitable. Where one has fallen, ten shall rise. Such is the will of Kazzak..."]="可笑的凡人，你们只是延迟了不可避免的命运。一个恶魔倒下去，十个恶魔会站起来。这就是卡扎克的意志……"
G["Impure thoughts lead to profane actions."]="不纯的思想会导致亵渎的行为。"
G["Impurity! Your fragile flesh defiles my work."]="亵渎！你们脆弱的血肉玷污了我的工作。"
G["In 20 minutes High Tinker Mekkatorque will tap the Brewfest Keg!"]="再过20分钟，大工匠梅卡托克就要来主持开酒罐仪式啦！"
G["In 20 minutes Vol'jin will tap the Brewfest Keg!"]="再过20分钟，沃金就要来主持开酒罐仪式啦！"
G["In Alterac Valley, battles rage and equipment is in short supply."]="奥特兰克山谷中的作战物资总是非常缺乏。"
G["In Azshara's name!"]="以艾萨拉之名！"
G["In Azshara's name."]="以艾萨拉之名。"
G["In Chellan's small but serviceable inn, you can find the priest Guvan."]="你可以在谢尔兰的那座很小但很实用的旅店里找到牧师古安。"
G["In Nagrand, food hunt ogre!"]="在纳格兰，食物竟敢追杀食人魔！"
G["In Outland, lunch open prison for you! What a world! Time to eat!"]="外域的监狱开饭了！多好的世界啊！到吃饭的时间了！"
G["In Outland, our forces fight against the Horde to control the Eye of the Storm. It is dangerous, fighting amidst the raging energies of the Nether. Do you have what it takes to join us?"]="在外域，为了争夺风暴之眼的控制权，我们与部落展开了激烈的战斗。在虚空的狂暴能量之间战斗是很危险的。你是否想加入我们呢？"
G["In Sargeras' name!"]="以萨格拉斯的名义！"
G["In Terokk's name!"]="以泰罗克之名！"
G["In Thundermar the tales proclaimed"]="在桑德玛尔，流传着一个故事"
G["In Tina's words, you are her bestie. She'd probably love a visit to your farm."]="Según Tina, eres su mejor $gamigo:amiga;. Seguramente le encantará visitar tu granja."
G["In War Quarter inner ring. She drunk lots."]="就在军事区的内环。她醉得很厉害。"
G["In a different time and place I would've been considered but a youngling.  Here I am a seasoned combatant ready to live and die for the glory of the naaru.\n\nTen of us went into Manaforge Ara.  All the others fell to the Legion."]="如果在其它的时间和地点，我肯定只会被当作一个新人。在这里，我已经是个有经验的老兵了，随时都准备好为纳鲁的荣耀而战。\n\n我们有十个人进入法力熔炉：艾拉，其他的人都死在了燃烧军团手下。"
G["In a flash, you'll be nothing more than dust..."]="弹指间，你就灰飞烟灭啦……"
G["In a place called Feralas to the west of here, the hippogryphs, long-time companions of the night elves, are in danger.\n\nI need you to rescue an egg from the ruins of Isildien, to the south, there. The Super Egg-O-Matic can analyze any egg brought to it and judge if it is likely to hatch. I then send the eggs along to the druids, safe from the Gordunni ogres' dark magics.\n\nPlease know, $n, some of the rescued eggs are bad eggs, and will never hatch."]="En un lugar llamado Feralas, situado al oeste de aquí, los hipogrifos, viejos compañeros de los elfos de la noche, están en peligro.\n\nNecesito que rescates un huevo de las ruinas de Isildien, en el sur, allí. El Superhuevomático puede analizar cualquier huevo y evalúa si es apto para empollar. Luego envío los huevos a los druidas, a salvo de la magia negra de los ogros Gordunni.\n\nTienes que tener en cuenta, $n, que algunos de los huevos rescatados no están en buen estado, por lo que nunca incubarán cría alguna."
G["In a real race, you will need to fly through each checkered flag to get credit for passing the checkpoint."]="在真正的比赛中，你必须飞过每个方格旗的检查点，才能得分。"
G["In a word, magic.\n\nIrresponsible mortals with their brief lifespans think nothing of the lasting effects of their actions.\n\nArcane energies have been tapped too liberally, disrupting the world's balance. If this is allowed to continue, Azeroth will soon be annihilated.\n\nOn this, both sides agree. But before a council could even be appointed, Malygos put his own plan into action.\n\nWe had no choice but to confront him."]="简言之，就是魔法。\n\n凡人的生命如此短暂，他们从不考虑自己的行为可能会造成怎样的长远影响。\n\n过于活跃的奥术能量严重影响了世界的稳定。如果听之任之的话，艾泽拉斯世界迟早会被毁灭。\n\n对于这一点，我们已经达成了共识。可还没等我们组织起专门的议会，玛里苟斯就擅自采取了行动。\n\n我们别无选择，只能与他作战。"
G["In a word? No."]="要我说？不。"
G["In accordance with my divine calling, I must share these revealed truths to all who would hear."]="我的神圣使命要求我必须将这些真理分享给所有应该知晓它的人们。"
G["In addition, my analysis links each elder to an increase in Freya's spellcasting, physical, or summoning capabilities."]="另外，我的分析表明，每位古树长老的存在都令弗蕾亚的魔法能力、物理攻击或召唤能力得到增强。"
G["In ages long past, aspiring heroes and emperors came here to face the tests of the August Celestials.\nJust as our ancestors watched over the passage of those time-honored proceedings, so shall we.\nThe Celestial Guard will brook no faction squabbles in this sacred place."]="En épocas pasadas, los aspirantes a héroes y los emperadores venían a esta isla para someterse a las pruebas de los Augustos Celestiales.\n\nNuestros antepasados vigilaban el transcurso de estos rituales ancestrales, y nosotros haremos lo mismo.\n\nLa Guardia celestial no tolerará rencillas entre facciones en este lugar sagrado."
G["In ages past, Eldre'Thalas was a nexus of magical power, and those who dwelt within its hallowed halls wielded immense power.  One such night elf was Millicent Serene - a naturalist who willed the power of nature itself into potent artifacts she forged.\n\nThe Fruit of Fertility was her crowning achievement... she used a specially prepared moonwell to grow an exotic and vibrant vine that was imbued with an aura of protection and growth.  All of Eldre'Thalas flourished from its existence."]="多年前，埃雷萨拉斯是魔法师的集中地，居住在那些神圣的大厅中的人都能使用强大的魔法。米琳丝特·塞雷恩就是这样一名暗夜精灵——她是个博学者，她可以将大自然的力量灌输到她铸造的神器中。\n\n丰饶之果就是她的杰作……她利用特殊的月亮井制造出一种奇异的、具备保护和生长效力的藤蔓来。埃雷萨拉斯在藤蔓的滋养下日益繁华起来。"
G["In agreement, Alexstrasza also refused Staghelm, and without her blessing, Teldrassil's growth has been flawed and unpredictable."]="但为了遵守上古的契约，阿莱克丝塔萨也拒绝了鹿盔。没有她的祝福，泰达希尔的成长出现了无可预期的瑕疵。"
G["In all my days, $r, I've never seen such a thing..."]="$r，我这一辈子都没见过这样的东西……"
G["In all my years I never expected to see the Zandalari."]="我这一辈子也没想过会见到赞达拉巨魔。"
G["In all my years, I have never seen the Sha so active as when your soldiers landed on our shores."]="自从你们的士兵登上这片土地，煞魔就骚动起来，其表现之活跃，实为我生平仅见。"
G["In all of my centuries, I never dreamed that it would come to this."]="我不曾料到局势会发展到今天这步田地。"
G["In all of my days I never thought to see such a magnificent new frontier.\n\nIf only it weren't tainted by evil and knowledge which is best left hidden."]="这些年来，我从来没想过还能看见这样的新疆界。\n\n只是，这里已经被邪恶玷污，亘古流传的知识也被掩埋了。"
G["In an ancient time, the spirits of the people dimmed and the land grew cold."]="在远古时期，人民浑浑噩噩，大地一片冷寂。"
G["In an effort to regain immortality for our people, and with the approval of the Circle, Staghelm and the most powerful druids grew Teldrassil, upon whose boughs you now stand."]="为了让我族重新获得不朽，在得到议会的同意之后，鹿盔率领最强大的德鲁伊们培育出泰达希尔。你正站在它的枝干上。"
G["In an hour's time, their precious city will be nothin' but ASH."]="再过一个小时，这座城市将只剩下灰烬。"
G["In building of War Quarter on outer ring of city."]="在城市外围军事区建筑中。"
G["In caring for the spirits and bringing them back among us, we can heal the land, and we can find understanding of the greater threats at hand."]="只有关注并迎回元素之灵，我们才能治愈这片土地，并真正了解目前最大的危机。"
G["In case it wasn't obvious, I'm not here for customer relations."]="事先说明，我来这里不是来搞客户关系的。"
G["In case you wonder, wasp sting not feel so good. No need to try."]="我告诉你，被蜇的滋味可不好受。你最好别去尝试。"
G["In coming here, you have made a grave mistake. These tournament grounds are a bastion of the Light, and your power cannot match it."]="你来到了这里，就是犯了一个大错。这些比武场是光明的堡垒，你的力量完全无法与之相比。"
G["In days long past, we lived for the hunt.  We hunted for glory, for honor...\n\nIs it so different now?"]="在过去的岁月里，我们以狩猎为生。我们为了荣誉而狩猎……\n\n现在有什么不同吗？"
G["In death we are brothers."]="死后我们成为了兄弟。"
G["In death, all is forgiven..."]="死亡会宽恕一切……"
G["In death, the animals of the world bestow both life and protection unto us.  If you feel that you can offer the appropriate respect for their sacrifice, then the skinner's profession may suit you.  Speak with Eladriel in the Craftsman's Terrace in northern Darnassus to learn more."]="世间动物死时会将它们的生命和兽皮赐予我们。要是你能尊重它们的牺牲，或许剥皮者这个职业会适合你的。去达纳苏斯北部的工匠区，找艾拉迪尔谈谈，学习更多知识。"
G["In death, the animals of the world bestow both life and protection unto us.  If you feel that you can offer the appropriate respect for their sacrifice, then the skinner's profession may suit you.  Speak with Eladriel in the Craftsmen's Terrace in northern Darnassus to learn more."]="世间动物死时会将它们的生命和兽皮赐予我们。要是你能尊重它们的牺牲，或许剥皮者这个职业会适合你的。去达纳苏斯北部的工匠区，找艾拉迪尔谈谈，学习更多知识。"
G["In death, they were reborn as mindless undead."]="死后，我们变成了没有思想的亡灵。"
G["In death, we are reborn."]="死亡，令我们重生。"
G["In decades past - of now ancient wars and conflicts - our kind was driven to the brink of extinction. Much we have endured, $r.\n\nThe onslaught of the Burning Legion. The Demon Soul. The Aspects divided. The ascension of Deathwing. The enslavement of our Queen, Alexstrasza, by the Dragonmaw.\n\nThrough it all, we have been the unshakable will of the dragons - the undaunted force that has fought to represent our waning existence in this world."]="En décadas pasadas, en guerras y conflictos de otros tiempos, nuestra especie estuvo a un paso de la extinción. Hemos soportado muchas cosas, $r.\n\nEl ataque de la Legión Ardiente. El Alma demoníaca. Los Aspectos divididos. El ascenso de Alamuerte. La esclavización de nuestra reina, Alexstrasza, por los Faucedraco.\n\nEn todo ello, hemos demostrado tener la inquebrantable voluntad de los dragones, la fuerza impertérrita que ha luchado para representar nuestra existencia menguante en este mundo."
G["In defeating him, $g he : she; and $g his : her; fighting companions have proven themselves worthy of battle in this most sacred place of vrykul honor."]="挑战者击败了王子，这证明$g他:她;及其战友完全有资格在维库人的圣地上战斗！"
G["In dreams, we may overcome any obstacle!"]="在梦中，我们能够克服任何障碍！"
G["In due course. There is no rush, after all - our hospitality is extended to you indefinitely. Even the troll."]="在适当的时候肯定可以，不用着急。不管怎样，我们都是非常好客的，甚至对巨魔都一样。"
G["In due time, Helcular... All in due time..."]="时机恰当的时候，赫尔库拉……等到时机恰当的时候……"
G["In due time, Maiev.  I've spent years preparing to make my move - I can't afford to put my plans in peril by tipping my hand too soon."]="不会太久了，玛维。我花了这么多年来筹划我的行动——我不能让这个计划因为操之过急而毁于一旦。"
G["In exchange for one Sulfuron Ingot, I am authorized to grant you one copy of the plans to forge a Sulfuron hammer.\n\nNow an adventurer like yourself is probably thinking to $g himself:herself;, \"What would I ever need a hammer like that for when what I already own is far superior?\"\n\nWell let me tell you something, $g mister:missy;, there ain't nothing more superior than what the Sulfuron hammer can become!"]="A cambio de un lingote de Sulfuron, estoy autorizado a darte una copia de los planos para forjar un martillo de Sulfuron.\n\nSí, seguro que $gun aventurero:una aventurera; como tú está pensando: \"¿Para qué iba a querer un martillo cuando lo que tengo es mucho más superior?\"\n\nBueno, deja que te diga algo, $gcaballerete:señorita;, no hay nada más superior que en lo que se puede convertir el martillo de Sulfuron."
G["In fact, I'll go see about those gears right now!"]="好了，我立刻就去看看那些装备！"
G["In fact, anyone who can grow such a perfect vegetable needs to be a Tiller, which is why I'm voting you in."]="事实上，任何能种出这种完美蔬菜的人都应该成为阡陌客，这正是我要投票支持你的原因。"
G["In fact, it really only serves to scare off the worgen from trying to follow us in here. It's completely harmless."]="实际上，这种魔法顶多只能吓唬一下那些狼人，让他们不敢追踪我们到这里来。它是完全无害的。"
G["In fact, it would be best if you just stay here. You'd only get in my way...."]="事实上，你最好留在这里。你只会坏我的事……"
G["In fact, let's see some more of that fancy walkin'... Move it!"]="其实，我们还想再看看那种奇特的步伐……动起来！"
G["In good time, my pandaren friend. In good time."]="看情况，熊猫人朋友。这得看情况。"
G["In good time."]="等时机成熟吧。"
G["In grizzly times a druid can be a dear friend to those around them.  Ask any of the druids in the Cenarion Enclave and they will tell you the same."]="在灰色年代，德鲁伊对周遭的人都很友好。你随便问塞纳里奥区的任何一个德鲁伊，他们会给出相同的说法的。"
G["In his mouth."]="自己的嘴里。"
G["In his vast cruelty, Arthas severed my spirit from my body and raised me as a banshee to serve in his Scourge army."]="阿尔萨斯的残忍没有止境，他将我的灵魂抽离了身体，把我变成女妖，以侍奉他的天灾军团。"
G["In honor of our benevolent ruler and protector, Matron Elestara Vashj.\n\nFor 100 years, she has faithfully sheltered us, protected us, and lead us steadily into a modern age of prosperity.\n\nUnder Queen Azshara's gaze, may she reign for 100 year more."]="向我们仁慈的统治者与保护者——埃利斯塔拉·瓦丝琪主母致敬。\n\n一百年来，她诚心地庇护着我们，保护着我们，坚定地引领我们走入了繁荣的现代新纪元。\n\n在艾萨拉女王的注视下，愿她的统治能再延续百年。"
G["In just 10 minutes High Tinker Mekkatorque will tap the Brewfest Keg!"]="再过10分钟，大工匠梅卡托克就要来主持开酒罐仪式啦！"
G["In life I had many cubs, and many grand cubs.  But none of my great grand cubs visit anymore.  Few remember with honor the great Windfur family lineage."]="我这一生中有过许多子女，以及许多孙辈。可没有一个曾孙辈的孩子来看望过我。他们几乎都忘了伟大的风裘家族。"
G["In life we were hated enemies - this is true..."]="活着的时候，我们是不共戴天的仇敌……"
G["In life, Bridenbrad was the bearer of great deeds. Now, in passing, he shall taste only paradise."]="活着的时候，布雷登布莱德拥有显赫的战绩。死后他的灵魂将升入天堂。"
G["In life, I focused my energies on healing others. Let us see in death how much pain I can cause!"]="活着的时候，我将毕生的精力都投入到治病救人中。看看我死后能给他人造成多大的痛苦吧！"
G["In life, we suffered unspeakable tragedies."]="活着时，我们经历了痛苦的劫难。"
G["In my absence, I am instructing you, Garrosh Hellscream, to lead the Horde.  You have the strength and courage that our people need to survive in these trying times."]="在我离开的这段日子里，我命令你——加尔鲁什·地狱咆哮，担任部落的领袖。你凭借力量与勇气一定能率领我们的人民在这困难时期生存下去。"
G["In my absssence, my ssservantsss will... sssee to your needs."]="我走之后，我的仆人……会满足你们的需求的。"
G["In my home town, the greatest gift one could give to a good friend was a tree.\n\nDo you know why?\n\nA tree represents peace, growth, and life. It is a blessing of friendship."]="在我的家乡，一个人能送给好朋友的最好的礼物，就是一棵树了。\n\n你知道为什么吗？\n\n树代表了和平、成长和生命。它是对友情的一种祝福。"
G["In my time, this was a mogu stronghold. It was my honor to paint the walls with their blood."]="在我的年代，这是个魔古族据点。我有幸用他们的鲜血涂满了墙壁。"
G["In my travels I have learned the recipe for the Wispcloak.\n\nThis cloak is a tradeable Epic spellcasting cloak that grants Stamina, Spellpower, Intellect and Mana Recovery.   I am looking for someone worthy to teach this recipe to.\n\nSomeone who had completed all the normal dungeons of Northrend and had the \"Northrend Dungeonmaster\" achievement would be worthy of learning the recipe for the Wispcloak."]="En mis viajes he aprendido el patrón de la capa de fuego fatuo.\n\nEsta capa es una capa épica de lanzamiento de hechizos con la que se puede comerciar que otorga aguante, intelecto y regeneración de maná. Estoy buscando a alguien digno a quien enseñar este patrón.\n\nAlguien que hubiera completado todas las mazmorras normales de Rasganorte y tuviera el logro \"Maestro de mazmorra de Rasganorte\" sería digno de aprender el patrón de la capa de fuego fatuo."
G["In my visions, negotiations with the enemy brought our people a fleeting peace... followed by terrible betrayal and destruction."]="在我看到的影像中，与敌人的谈判为我的人民带来了短暂的和平……随后就是可怕的出卖和毁灭。"
G["In my years as a member of Explorers' League, I've been all over Azeroth, but I've never seen anythin' quite like Bloodmyst."]="我加入探险者协会这么多年来，已经踏遍了整个艾泽拉斯，但我从没见过秘血岛那样的地方。"
G["In my youth, my family did not approve of my interest in shamanism. Brash and foolish as I was, I ran away from them and practiced on my own.  Upon returning to my home one day, I found my parents gone. My home destroyed. They never found who did it.\nI've spent my life striving to extend my shamanistic visions to see into the past - to find out what happened to my family and who is responsible. I've come a great way. I've learned to focus in on impactful events in the recent past, but I have much further to go if I ever hope to glimpse something that occurred so long ago."]="En mi juventud, a mi familia no le sentó bien que tuviera interés en el chamanismo. Yo era tonta y descarada y me escapé de casa para aprender por mi cuenta. Cuando un día regresé a mi casa, vi que mis padres ya no estaban. Mi casa estaba destrozada. Nunca encontraron a los culpables.\n\nMe he pasado toda la vida esforzándome por ampliar mi visión chamanística para ver el pasado; para averiguar qué le ocurrió a mi familia y quién es el responsable. He avanzado mucho. He aprendido a concentrarme en hechos impactantes del pasado reciente, pero aún me queda mucho por aprender si alguna vez espero poder ver algo que ocurrió hace tanto tiempo."
G["In need of some alchemy supplies, are we?  Or do you have other business with me?"]="需要一些炼金术的材料吗？或者你有别的什么事情？"
G["In one corner we have... $n, truly a world class $c.  Slayer of reptiles, mammals, mechanical constructs and the odd dragon...kin.  You've never seen another $r like $g him : her;."]="En un rincón tenemos a... $n, $gun:una; $c de fama mundial. $gAsesino:Asesina; de reptiles, mamíferos, ensamblajes mecánicos y algún que otro drago...nante. No habéis visto $gotro:otra:r; $r como $gél:ella;."
G["In order for this dream brew to show you what you seek, you must reach a place of inner harmony. I can show you how."]="要想靠洄梦仙酒找到你想找的东西，那你必须保持祥和的心境。我来演示给你看。"
G["In order to survive, you must fight."]="为了生存，你必须战斗。"
G["In our native tongue, \"Una'fe\" can be translated as \"Refuge.\" But the name no longer fits. From the moment we set up this camp, this strange jungle has threatened to engulf it."]="En nuestra lengua nativa, \"Una'fe\" puede ser traducido como \"refugio\". Pero el nombre ya no es apropiado. Desde el momento en el que levantamos este campamento, esta extraña jungla ha amenazado con devorarlo entero."
G["In our travels, we have sung many songs, but there are many more songs to sing."]="在旅途中，我们唱过很多的歌曲，但还有很多歌曲没有唱。"
G["In paradise, you merely reach out and take from the Nether."]="置身天堂时，你会感觉自己被来回牵扯着，在虚空间飘荡。"
G["In pieces three the mallet be. Handle, head and ointment. You ring the bell without the mallet? You going to get an ear and face full of evil."]="钟杵由三部分组成：杵柄，杵头和药膏。没有杵你想怎么敲这口钟？现在认真听我说话，然后准备好对付那些邪恶的坏蛋吧。"
G["In position!"]="就位！"
G["In reality, she was obsessed with control. She aspired to stay in power long past her time, and was willing to sacrifice our eternal cycle to achieve that. We had no choice but to end her."]="实际上，她只是恋栈权位而已。她渴望延长自己的统治，并为了实现这一目标而牺牲了我们永恒的轮回。我们别无选择，只能杀死她。"
G["In return, he 'de-cursed' us, saying that we were being 'fixed' by returning us to the state of being mechanical constructs."]="作为感谢，他要为我们“驱除诅咒”，将我们“变回”机械体。"
G["In spite of our best efforts, the naga have attacked the breach!\n\nThe Plane of Water must be defended!"]="尽管我们拼尽了全力，纳迦还是对裂口发动了攻击！\n\n必须守住水元素位面！"
G["In spite of our losses here, Hellscream will be pleased to know that the naga general was defeated."]="虽然我们在这里蒙受了巨大的损失，但地狱咆哮知道纳迦将军被我们打败了，一定会很高兴的。"
G["In tha chaos of battle, it's tha balance of light and shadow that leads us ta victory."]="在混乱的战场上，光与影的平衡将引领我们取得胜利。"
G["In that moment, the Light revealed to me the truth of the terrible things I had done."]="在那一刻，圣光为我揭示出我所犯下的种种罪过的真相。"
G["In the Celestial Tournament, either you win or you die."]="在天神比武大会上，向来都是你死我活的。"
G["In the Command Center, just outside of Old Town's southeast gates, you'll find the quartermasters."]="军需官就在位于旧城区东南门外的指挥部里。"
G["In the King's audience chamber you will find the Lady Hoteshem.  She can assist you in getting to Arathi Basin where The League of Arathor is in need of assistance against The Defilers."]="你可以在国王的觐见室中找到赫塔希姆。她能帮助你前往阿拉希盆地，阿拉索联军需要援助来打败污染者。"
G["In the Light we all cast shadows, my $g brother : sister;.  Do you seek further guidance today?"]="我的$g兄弟:姐妹;，我们都受圣光的庇护。你是来寻求更多指引的吗？"
G["In the Plaguelands, Kel'thuzad was again defeated by the agents of the Argent Dawn. However, his phylactery was delivered to a false agent of the Brotherhood. We have yet to discover who stole his phylactery or why."]="克尔苏加德再次被驻扎在瘟疫之地的银色黎明击败。可是他的护符匣落到了圣光兄弟会某个不忠诚的成员手中。至今我们还不知道是谁偷走了护符匣以及其中的阴谋。"
G["In the Silverpine Forest along the edges of the North Tide's Run, a derelict boat rests on the shore.  Out to the west of this lies what you seek; swim too far and the ocean will crush you from fatigue.  It resides on the ocean floor in a lockbox, waiting for you to claim it.\n\nYou'll be hard pressed to survive a dive to such depths without aid, so take heart; a bubbly fissure offers renewed breath to divers seeking this half of the pendant.  Use it wisely."]="在银松森林北流海岸边缘，海滩上搁着一艘废弃的船。船只以西有你要找的东西；游得太远的话，你会因疲劳无法游回海岸的。海床上有一只上了锁的箱子，等着你去取呢。\n\n要是没有人帮忙的话，潜到这样的深度会受到极大的压强，要小心；海床上有一道裂缝，能释放出气泡，有助于你寻找那半块坠饰。好好利用吧。"
G["In the War Quarter is where you'll find the warriors. Head to the outer ring there."]="你可以在军事区的外环区域找到那些战士。"
G["In the aftermath of Theramore, my first instinct was to decimate Orgrimmar - to kill every man woman and child in the city."]="塞拉摩陷落以后，我的第一反应就是要血洗奥格瑞玛——把城里的男女老幼全都杀光。"
G["In the age of war, Razelikh the Defiler served as the most fearsome of Lord Kazzak's lieutenants. When the Legion was defeated and Kazzak forced back into the Tainted Scar, Razelikh was tasked by his master to secure the Blasted Lands.\n\nWhile the Alliance fought petty battles with the Horde over territory outside of the Blasted Lands, Razelikh was uniting the differing Shadow Council sects and the brutish Dreadmaul ogres of the land."]="在抵抗燃烧军团时期，污染者拉瑟莱克是卡扎克麾下最强大的将领之一。当燃烧军团被击退，卡扎克的势力被压制之后，拉瑟莱克接受了诅咒之地的事务。\n\n当联盟和部落在诅咒之地以外的地方打得天昏地暗的时候，拉瑟莱克则在召集阴影议会的教徒，以及野蛮的巨槌食人魔。"
G["In the ancient days before the sundering of the world, the mogu emperors ruled over Pandaria. My people were made slaves, and they were afraid."]="在世界崩裂之前的古老时代，魔古族皇帝统治着潘达利亚。我们的族人被当成奴隶，而且畏惧不已。"
G["In the chamber ahead, under our peaceful land, slept the heart of an Old God."]="在前面的大厅里，在我们祥和的土地下，沉睡着古神之心。"
G["In the curves of a tree, the colors of a sunrise, even in the perfect physical form of a warrior's exquisite swordwork."]="枝干的曲线，旭日的色彩，甚至是武士舞出剑弧的完美瞬间。"
G["In the dancing glow, we see an empty bowl. We fill the bowl - it becomes our body. We rest."]="归魂入缶，喜乐安康。"
G["In the darkest of times, it is often a patient spirit and a reassuring hand that carry the most value."]="在最黑暗的时代，通常只有耐心的精神和可靠的手可以担负起最大的责任。"
G["In the dooker!"]="去死吧！"
G["In the eastern reaches of the Netherwing Fields lies Dragonmaw Fortress. It is there that the cruel Dragonmaw orc clan tortures the drakes that they capture in an attempt to bend them to their will. Many have given up hope, choosing instead to do the bidding of Dragonmaw. The others... They refuse to land for fear of Dragonmaw war parties capturing them and taking them back to the fortress."]="龙喉要塞坐落在灵翼平原的东部区域。在那里，无数残酷的龙喉氏族兽人正在折磨着他们抓来的虚空幼龙，甚至尝试扭曲它们的意志。很多幼龙就此放弃了对自由的希望，选择屈服，并开始遵守龙喉兽人的命令。而其它幼龙……它们因为害怕被龙喉兽人抓住而不敢降落，只能在天上不停地飞翔。"
G["In the end, I stood by the warchief, because it was my duty, and I am glad that it was you who struck me down. May your strength... lead the horde... into a new era of prosperity..."]="我最终站在了酋长一边，因为这是我的使命，很高兴打倒我的人是你。愿你的力量……带领部落……走向繁荣昌盛。"
G["In the end, only silence remains."]="最终，只留下一片寂静。"
G["In the end, we will all be together, sweetheart."]="最终我们会团聚的，甜心。"
G["In the end, you will all serve me."]="你们最终都要臣服于我。"
G["In the event of an uprising, we must be prepared."]="在举兵之前，我们得做好准备。"
G["In the face of great fear, the Black Ox taught me fortitude. Through terror and darkness it persevered. The fear was vanquished."]="在巨大的恐惧面前，玄牛教我懂得坚毅，让我在恐怖与黑暗的时代不屈不挠，征服恐惧。"
G["In the face of this cataclysm, I've seen how truly fleeting our lives can be. And I, for one, will not waste another second of mine."]="我见证了这场大灾变，亲眼目睹了生命的短暂。此时此刻，我不想再浪费哪怕一秒钟的时间。"
G["In the gut!"]="小心肚子！"
G["In the land of Ny'alotha there is only sleep."]="在尼奥罗萨的土地上，只有沉睡。"
G["In the last war, tauren fought. Shaman were sent in defense of this world against the Scourge invasion. Most lost their lives. Many were otherwise ripped asunder, their body parts used for foul experiments in that cursed citadel. I mourn their passing but my heart swells with pride at their courage."]="在上一次大战中，牛头人也曾参战，很多地方都有萨满祭司抵抗天灾入侵的记录。这些祭司们也献出了宝贵的生命，更悲惨的是，他们的尸体竟然还被收集起来，切割成碎片，输送到那座被诅咒的城堡中的用作某些邪恶实验的材料。我只能在此真心为他们的逝去感到默哀，他们也是我们一族的骄傲。"
G["In the middle of the pipe?"]="在这根管子的中部？"
G["In the name of Illidan!"]="以伊利丹的名义！"
G["In the name of Kil'jaeden!"]="以基尔加丹的名义！"
G["In the name of Sylvanas, the Banshee Queen, I bestow this gift upon you!"]="以女妖之王希尔瓦娜斯的名义，我将这份礼物赐予你！"
G["In the name of Warchief Garrosh, hold the line!"]="以加尔鲁什酋长的名义，守住阵线！"
G["In the name of our dark master. For the Lich King. You. Will. Die."]="以黑暗之主的名义。为了巫妖王。你必死无疑。"
G["In the name of the Kirin Tor!"]="以肯瑞托之名！"
G["In the name of the Lich King."]="以巫妖王的名义。"
G["In the name of the Light!"]="以圣光之名！"
G["In the name of the Light! It is Light that commands you! It is Light that flung you to the depths of darkness!"]="退散！我命令你退散……信念的腐蚀者！痛苦的创造者！不要再回来，否则你会遭受到和今天同样的失败命运。"
G["In the name of the Thunder King!"]="以雷电之王的名义！"
G["In the nature of all things is the will to survive."]="生存，是一切生物的本能。"
G["In the northeastern Barrens lies a pool of water sickened by pollution.  The locals call it the Sludge Fen; the Venture Company has turned the once crystal-blue waters into a mire of industrial byproducts and waste.  In the heart of this fen lies what you seek, $n.\n\nBe warned - the Venture Company does not tolerate trespassers, and they consider anyone who does not work for them as such.  You'll especially be a target as a protector of nature, something they vehemently oppose."]="En el noreste de Los Baldíos hay un pozo de agua contaminada por la polución. Los vecinos del lugar lo llaman El Fangal; Ventura y Cía. ha convertido las aguas antaño cristalinas, en un lodazal de bioproductos y residuos industriales. En el centro de este lodazal está lo que buscas, $n.\n\nTen mucho cuidado, Ventura y Cía. no tolera a los intrusos y consideran un intruso a cualquiera que no trabaje para ellos. Serás su objetivo por proteger a la naturaleza, algo a lo que se oponen vehementemente."
G["In the northern part of Darkshore runs the Cliffspring River, flowing down from the lands now known as Felwood.  As the river flows out and empties out into the Mist's Edge, travel north to where the deepest parts of the ocean begin.  A stone formation that some call the Stone Claw due to its shape is where you may find what you seek.\n\nBe warned - threshers gather by the Stone Claw, and will attack those who trespass on their territory."]="在黑海岸的北面流淌着壁泉河，发源于现今的费伍德森林。随着河流流到并汇入薄雾海，一直蜿蜒到海洋北部最深处。在那儿有你要的石头，由于这种石头的形状酷似爪状，因此被称为石爪。\n\n要当心——蛇颈龙聚集在石爪那里，他们会攻击那些贸然入侵的人。"
G["In the other corner, a serial killer, mass defenestrator, sentenced to death multiple times by noose and by blunt instrument!  Horgrenn... Hellcleave!  Ladies and gentlemen... place your bets!"]="¡En el otro rincón un asesino en serie, descuartizador de masas, sentenciado a muerte por ahorcamiento y por objeto contundente varias veces! ¡Horgrenn... Garra Infernal! Señoras y señores... ¡hagan sus apuestas!"
G["In the other corner, we have Vian, the flame-flinging follower of the Thunder King!"]="我们的另一边，则是雷电之王的狂热追随者，瓦安！"
G["In the other corner... a disgusting green pile of goblin idiocy, riding on a lumbering chariot of shame. It's Fran and Riddoh! Everybody boo!"]="在竞技场的另一侧……一坨恶心的蠢地精骑在一头可笑的伐木畜生身上。是法兰和里东！大家一起嘘他们！"
G["In the other corner... hey look! It's my buddy, Fran! And he brought his mount with him!"]="另一边进场的是……嘿，看呐！那是我的好兄弟，法兰！他还带来了他的坐骑！"
G["In the pipe, 5 by 5!"]="五个五个地来！"
G["In the process of translating this, I believe I've learned more about the drunken exploits of a certain 'Andrew Clementine' than about the journal's author."]="在翻译的过程中，我相信我对这个醉鬼所写的东西的了解，远远多于对日记本身的了解。"
G["In the sky! It approaches!"]="在天上！它靠近了！"
G["In the sleeping city of Ny'alotha walk only mad things."]="在沉睡之城尼奥罗萨中，只有疯狂在徘徊。"
G["In the sunken city, he lays dreaming."]="在那沉没的城市里，他陷入梦境。"
G["In the throes of the Sundering, Ameth'Aran was at the whim of the terror that gripped the land. There was little hope for survival."]="在大灾变时，亚米萨兰正在大陆崩裂的边界，几乎没有什么幸存者逃过那次劫难。"
G["In the time before time, what the usurpers would later call the First Age of Creation, my master and his siblings ruled over this world. It was they, the Old Gods, who created all.\n\nAnd it was they who would ultimately be cast down by those that would call themselves Shapers."]="En el principio de los tiempos, la época que los usurpadores nombraron más tarde como la Primera Era de la Creación, mi maestro y sus hermanos gobernaban este mundo. Fueron ellos, los dioses antiguos, quienes lo crearon todo.\n\nY al final, fueron expulsados por aquellos que se hicieron llamar los Creadores."
G["In the time before time, when the world was still in its infancy, a battle between a Titan and a being of unimaginable evil and power raged on this very soil. The prophecy is unclear about whether or not the Titan was vanquished in this battle but it illustrates that a Titan fell. An Old God had also fallen - or so it was thought."]="在很久很久以前，世界还在混沌伊始之际，泰坦和一位拥有不可思议的邪恶力量的神灵展开了一场恶战。预言并没有记载泰坦是否战败，但是却记载着一位泰坦阵亡的事件。一位上古之神也阵亡了——大约是这样吧。"
G["In the unlikely event of a water \"landing,\" please reach under your seat cushion where a cyanide capsule has been located for your convenience."]="En el caso poco probable de un amerizaje \"forzoso\", busca debajo de tu asiento, donde se ha colocado una cápsula de cianuro para tu comodidad."
G["In the unlikely event that a catastrophic failure does not instantly kill everyone aboard..."]="如果发生了灾难性的事故，船上却还有幸存者，当然这种情况的可能性不大……"
G["In the void, no one can hear you scream!"]="在虚空中，没人可以听到你的惨叫！"
G["In the whispering waters, they can hear the future."]="在水流的低语声中，他们能听见未来。"
G["In their hubris, the mogu never foresaw that their downfall lay in wait, not among their enemies, but among the oppressed. The day that one slave stood..."]="而狂妄的魔古族万万没想到，最后推翻它们统治的，并非敌人，而是受压迫的民众。没想到会有一天，奴隶会挺身而起……"
G["In their initial assault, I caught a glimpse of their true leader, a fearsome full-grown twilight dragon."]="刚受到攻击时，我看见了他们真正的首领，一头恐怖的暮光巨龙。"
G["In theory, these crystals are natural insulators. They should absorb most of the lightning strikes in the area."]="理论上说，这些水晶都是天然的绝缘体。它们可以吸收这个地区的大部分闪电打击。"
G["In these trying times, a simple donation of cloth can go a long way to help those less fortunate than ourselves.  Cloth goes a long way to making garments and bandages - both important for the war effort!\n\nIf you are interested in donating cloth pieces to the orcs of Orgrimmar, I will gladly accept them and make sure you receive the proper recognition for doing so.\n\nFor the Horde!"]="在这个艰难的时期，捐赠布料对于那些不幸的人是非常重要的帮助手段。布料还可以制作装备和绷带——这对于战争十分重要！\n\n如果你想要为奥格瑞玛的兽人捐赠布料的话，我会欣然接受它们，你一定会受到我们的青睐。\n\n为了部落！"
G["In this dream, I was fishin' master of the world. I moved to some place called Kalimdor..."]="在这个梦里，我是这个世界中的钓鱼大师。我搬到了一个名叫卡利姆多的地方……"
G["In this place, darkness and shadows are tools to be used and disposed of at will."]="在这里，黑暗和阴影是随你的意志而变化的工具。"
G["In this place? Are... are you sure?"]="在这里？你……确定吗？"
G["In this trial, you will not be allowed to heal your pets.  One of the marks of a great leader is the ability to lead many subjects from many backgrounds, united under one banner."]="在这场试炼当中，你不能治疗自己的宠物。伟大领袖的特质之一就是能够将不同背景的属下团结在同一面旗帜之下。"
G["In this world where time is your enemy, it is my greatest ally. This grand game of life that you think you play in fact plays you. To that I say..."]="在这个世界中，时间是你的敌人，但是它是我的战友。这段你自以为在你掌握之中的时光实际上是你的主宰。因此我会说……"
G["In those years - where strife filled the land as Legion and Scourge sacked our homes, killed our families - these insects dwelled beneath us. Beneath our homes - waiting."]="在那段战斗的岁月里，硝烟弥漫着天空和大地，燃烧军团和亡灵天灾肆虐在我们的家园，杀戮着我们的亲人。在那时，这些虫子潜伏在我们脚下，潜伏在我们的家园下面，等待着。"
G["In thousands of years, we have never seen one of your kind."]="数千年来，我们从未遇见过你这样的人。"
G["In time you will be ready for what I have to teach, $n. Until then, please ask Darianna over there to help you with your training."]="你得及时准备好接受我的教学，$n。到那时，找达丽亚娜谈谈，他会帮助你训练的。"
G["In time, the light and hope held within - will rebirth more than this mere fount of power... Mayhap, they will rebirth the soul of a nation."]="很快，其中蕴涵着的光明与希望——将重新构成一个不仅仅只是能量源泉的事物……或许，它们将构成一个国家的灵魂。"
G["In time, we will again require the assistance of the mortals. Across this world our birthright is shattered. It will be the mortal races that help us regain our rightful place on Draenor. Watch over them, Mordenaku..."]="将来我们会再次需要凡人的帮助。在这个世界上，我们与生俱来的权利遭到了破坏。凡人的种族会帮助我们重新夺回灵翼龙族在德拉诺世界的地位。莫德奈，你要守护他们……"
G["In time, we will rebuild this place and restore it to its former glory - minus all of the annoying humans."]="我们终将重建这里，并使其复现往日的荣光——除去那些麻烦的人类。"
G["In time, you may learn to see through their deceptions."]="总有一天，你可以学会看穿他们的诡计。"
G["In time, you too shall do our bidding just as the demons serve us."]="你们应该就像那些恶魔一样听从我们的命令。"
G["In times such as these, dear friends are invaluable.\n\nBe safe, $n. As safe as one can be in a place like this...."]="在动荡不安的年代，好朋友简直是无价之宝。\n\n保重，$n。尽可能地保护好自己……"
G["In weeks past, all of those living atop Teldrassil have found their memories blurry, as if time itself seized a portion of their lives."]="几周前，泰达希尔上的所有生灵都发现的自己记忆开始变得模糊，仿佛时间偷走了他们的一部分生命。"
G["In years past, the warlock Nekros Skullcrusher abused a powerful artifact to enslave Alexstrasza and much of the red dragonflight.  Zuluhed and Nekros are dead, but the debt we owe to the reds is far from repaid."]="这些年来，耐克鲁斯滥用神器奴役阿莱克丝塔萨女王和其他红龙。虽然祖鲁希德和耐克鲁斯都死了，但是我们亏欠红龙的债远没有还清。"
G["In your face!"]="迎面痛击！"
G["In your jealousy, you condemn him and dispatch him to your secret prison.  Just as eagerly as you did your own brother."]="因为你的嫉妒，你对他判刑，将他关进你的秘密监狱，如同对你的亲兄弟所做的一样。"
G["In your land, is it true that healers accompany warriors onto the battlefield? If only I had better tools, perhaps I could do the same."]="在你们那儿，治疗者真的要跟着战士上战场吗？如果我有趁手的家伙，我或许也做得到。"
G["In your rush to glory, you assumed that the pace of the game revolved around your actions. Can you even fathom how preposterous that sounds to a being like me? A being that if so inclined could cause your own insignificant thoughts to crush the peanut sized mass of grey matter floating within your skull."]="在你匆忙追寻荣耀的过程中，你有没有想过你的行动对于这场竞赛的节奏有什么影响？你有没有想过你们的行为对我来说是多么可笑而荒谬？我对你来说是个难以理解的存在，这让你那花生大小的脑子感到十分迷茫。"
G["Inbound $r!"]="$r平安降落！"
G["Including me?"]="包括我？"
G["Including the Amani?"]="包括阿曼尼巨魔？"
G["Incoming $c!"]="¡Llega $gun:una; $c!"
G["Incoming $n - look sharp, friends!"]="$n来了——留神，我的朋友！"
G["Incoming $r flier! Shoot $g him : her; down!"]="¡Viene $gun:una; $r $gvolador:voladora;! ¡Debe caer!"
G["Incoming $r!"]="$r来了！"
G["Incoming aerial support to Dun Baldar! Stormpike bow down!"]="丹巴达尔来了增援的空中部队！"
G["Incoming blast in 10 seconds!"]="炸弹将在10秒内爆炸！"
G["Incoming blast in 5 seconds. Clear the tunnel! Stay back!"]="炸弹将在5秒内爆炸。清理通道！向后撤！"
G["Incoming mortar barrage!"]="迫击炮弹幕！"
G["Incoming survivor!"]="发现幸存者！"
G["Incoming!"]="敌人来了！"
G["Incoming!  Get back down the pass!"]="敌袭！撤回通道！"
G["Incoming!  Get your heads down!"]="敌人来啦！低头！"
G["Incoming! Horde incoming - Look out behind you, $n!"]="来啦！部落来啦——$n，小心身后！"
G["Incoming."]="过来了。"
G["Incompetent fools!  Auchindoun should've been ours... look at yourselves scrambling like rats!"]="无能的蠢货！奥金顿是我们的……瞧瞧你们那抱头鼠窜的丑样儿！"
G["Incompetent fools!  Why must we suffer your stupidity?"]="白痴！为什么我们必须忍受你们的愚蠢？"
G["Incompetent fools, summon faster!"]="无能的蠢货，加快召唤！"
G["Incompetent, sniveling dandy."]="你这个无能的家伙，只会说大话的败家子。"
G["Inconceivable!"]="难以想象！"
G["Inconceivable! He couldn't possibly be alive!"]="难以置信！他不可能还活着！"
G["Inconceivable! You may actually defeat my lava worm! Perhaps I can help... tip the scales."]="难以置信，你们竟然真要击败我的熔岩巨虫了！也许我可以帮你们……扭转局势。"
G["Incorrect!"]="步骤错误！"
G["Increase your profit potential with Butcherbot!"]="让收集机器人帮你提升潜在利益吧！"
G["Incredible power can be found in the spirits or \"muisek\" of the creatures that we battle against.\n\nLook inside yourself; learn to harness the power of your own spirit, and you will be more powerful than you ever imagined."]="Se puede encontrar un increíble poder en los espíritus o \"muisek\" de las criaturas contra las que luchamos.\n\nMira en tu interior, aprende a canalizar el poder de tu propio espíritu y serás más $gpoderoso:poderosa; de lo que jamás hayas podido imaginar."
G["Incredible shooting! I'll try to calm the animals down. Report to Thork, he will want to know of this attack."]="真是令人难以置信的射击！我会尽量让这些科多兽平静下来。去向索克报告吧，他一定很想了解关于这次袭击的情况。"
G["Incredible story. So how did he die?"]="令人难以置信的故事。他后来是怎么死的？"
G["Incredible work. I knew the Shado-Pan would make excellent allies."]="难以置信。我就知道影踪派会是出色的盟友。"
G["Incredible!"]="真是难以置信！"
G["Incredible!  I know he who wrought these enchantments..."]="难以置信！我知道是谁施展了这些魔法……"
G["Incredible! Amazing! I don't even know what this means!"]="难以置信！太令我惊讶了！我甚至根本不知道这意味着什么！"
G["Incredible! Few assassins would be clever enough to infiltrate Nalice's wards and use her own magic against her."]="难以置信！极少有刺客能像你这样骗过纳莉丝的护卫，还使用她的魔法来对付她。"
G["Incredible. How did Sironas accomplish such a thing?"]="不可思议。希隆娜丝是怎么做到这一点的？"
G["Incredible. Your potions display a knowledge that rivals my own. I cannot train you further, but talk to the orc Rogvar of Stonard in the Swamp of Sorrows. He's known for his cutting-edge experiments."]="难以置信。你配制药水的技能已经能跟我匹敌了。我不能再训练你了，去悲伤沼泽找斯通纳德的兽人罗格瓦尔谈谈。他以他的宝刀而闻名。"
G["Indeed I am, child.  And do you remember what you showed me in those dreams?"]="是的，我就是，孩子。还有你记得你在梦里展示给我的一切吗？"
G["Indeed you have, mon. Our stores of blight crystals be nearly sufficient!"]="我看出来了。荒芜水晶的储量大增，很快就能满足需求了。"
G["Indeed!"]="的确！"
G["Indeed! And how do you find the Commander, friend?"]="的确！你是怎样找到元首的，朋友？"
G["Indeed! Magni will be so happy to see you too! He's gotten nothing but bad news for a long while now, but this changes everything!"]="天哪！如果麦格尼见到你，不知道他会高兴成什么样子呢！他已经很久没有听到过好消息了，这次一定能令他欣喜若狂！"
G["Indeed! Nothing like the warm air and a cool pond..."]="确实！没什么比温暖的空气和凉爽的池塘更好了……"
G["Indeed! The young one on my chest is named \"Kor\", for my oldest friend.\n\nAnd this young champion on my back is named \"$p\", for his savior."]="¡En efecto! El joven en mi pecho se llama \"Kor\", por mi viejo amigo.\n\nY este joven campeón a mi espalda se llama \"$p\", por su $gsalvador:salvadora;."
G["Indeed! They were given every advantage I could muster. I simply can't imagine what went wrong.\n\nHere, $c, take one. I've made a couple of modifications - little refinements really. Now there's no excuse for failure!"]="事实上！他们向我提出了所有我能做到的改进建议。我简直不能想像什么地方会有问题。\n\n好吧，$c，拿上这个。我做了一些的修改——一些很小很小的修改。现在没有任何失败的借口了！"
G["Indeed, I have Medivh's grimoire. I am fortunate that the Reliquary has seen the wisdom of this exchange."]="没错，我的确带着麦迪文的魔典。幸好神圣遗物学会明智地认为交换对大家都有好处。"
G["Indeed, I heard they were recovered from the brink of death by a seasoned veteran of the Horde."]="是啊，听说是位部落老兵将它们从濒死边缘救回来的。"
G["Indeed, Nexus-Prince Haramad, you do have much to think on.  Such as turning over that ata'mal crystal to my master, Prince Kael'thas."]="事实上，节点亲王哈拉迈德，你有很多东西需要考虑。比如说把阿塔玛水晶交给我的主人，凯尔萨斯王子。"
G["Indeed, Silverwing Hold is in need of your assistance. Speak with Elfarran in the audience chamber at Stormwind Keep."]="银翼要塞需要你的援助。跟暴风要塞觐见室的艾弗拉兰谈谈。"
G["Indeed, brother. It would seem so..."]="当然，兄弟。就是这样……"
G["Indeed, it is not a request."]="确实，这不是一个要求。"
G["Indeed, the flora is growing unchecked, devouring the land. Similar to our findings from the oases."]="实际上，这种植物不受任何限制地生长，吞噬了整片陆地。和我们在绿洲发现的非常相似。"
G["Indeed, the hills of Winterspring are currently attempting to withstand a renewed Scourge assault. Your assistance would help them greatly.\n\nNumber of Necropolises remaining: $2284W"]="事实上，冬泉谷北部的丘陵地区正在遭到新一批天灾军团士兵的攻击。你的援手将给予我们很大的帮助。\n\n剩余浮空要塞数量：$2284W"
G["Indeed, the time has come to end this charade."]="没错，游戏就快要结束了！"
G["Indeed, we have suffered greatly."]="没错，过去充满了磨难。"
G["Indeed."]="确实如此。"
G["Indeed.  Someone did try to kill me, but that is not my greatest concern at this moment.  The world itself calls for my aid."]="确实有人想要杀死我，但这并不是我现在最关注的问题。这个世界正需要我的帮助。"
G["Indeed. After the Cataclysm, my flight's connection to the timeways forever changed."]="确实。在大灾变之后，青铜龙军团与时间流的联系彻底改变了。"
G["Indeed. I doubt much would."]="当然，毋庸置疑。"
G["Indeed. I stand before you in a form that you can comprehend, mortal. Surely, you could not bear to stand in the presence of the dragon known as Vaelastrasz.\n\n<Vaelan laughs.>\n\nShall I continue?"]="我以你所能接受的形态站在你面前。显然，你无法接受一条名叫瓦拉斯塔兹的龙。\n\n<维埃兰笑了起来。>\n\n我可以继续吗？"
G["Indeed. Mal'Ganis is commanding the Scourge from Crusaders' Square, but the gates leading there from the city entrance are closed.\n\nLittle does he know that a small force can still reach the Square by moving through the Town Hall. Will you join me in this attack?"]="Sin duda. Mal'ganis está dirigiendo a la Plaga desde la Plaza de los Cruzados, pero las verjas que llevan allí desde la entrada de la ciudad están cerradas.\n\nLo que no sabe es que un pequeño grupo todavía puede llegar a la Plaza pasando por el Ayuntamiento. ¿Te unirás a mí en este ataque?"
G["Indeed. Nefarian, brood of Deathwing, rules the Spire now. Rend is under the command of the dragon.\n\nIf only you could somehow manage to pass through the Halls of Ascension.\n\n<Eitrigg sighs.>\n\nAlas, only those deemed worthy by the black flight earn privilege to ascend."]="事实上。奈法利安，死亡之翼的子嗣现在正统治着黑石塔。雷德受到龙的支配。\n\n只要你能设法穿过晋升大厅。\n\n<伊崔格叹息着。>\n\n此外，只有受到黑龙尊敬的人才有特权进入。"
G["Indeed. The Scarlet Crusade are an aberration of the Order of the Silver Hand.\n\nYou must believe me, $r; Taelan is a good man. He needs guidance. He needs to remember... remember what it is to be noble and honorable. I know that in his heart, he knows what he does is wrong. Will you help him? Will you help him remember?"]="真的。血色十字军是银手骑士团做出的错误决策。\n\n你必须相信我，$r；泰兰是个好人。他需要指导。他必须记起……记起高贵和荣耀的含义。我知道那信念就在他心中，他知道他所做的是错误的。你帮助他好吗？帮助他记起来？"
G["Indeed. The brood mother of the Black Dragonflight had used illusion and trickery to disguise herself as a member of the royal court. Worse yet, she had assumed control of the current Highlord of Stormwind, Bolvar Fordragon.\n\nIt is no wonder that such foolish military decisions had been made. The movement of the Alliance forces as of late had left us scratching our heads. We now understand that the Black Flight was attempting to divide the empire - destroy it from within."]="真的。黑龙之母运用幻象和欺诈术将自己伪装成贵族法庭的成员。更糟糕的是，眼下，她似乎已经控制了暴风城的伯瓦尔·弗塔根公爵。\n\n做出这样愚蠢的军事决定不足为奇。联盟军队最近的行动令我们头疼。现在我们知道，黑龙正试图分裂帝国——从内部分裂它。"
G["Indeed. The item was ultimately destroyed and Deathwing nearly slain by the combined and renewed power of the four remaining Aspects. Where Deathwing is now is unknown. What we do know, however, is that one of his progeny, Nefarian, rules this citadel and wishes to continue where his father left off."]="是的。最终恶魔之魂被摧毁了，剩余的四条守护巨龙联合起来，几乎取了死亡之翼的性命。没人知道死亡之翼现在到底在哪里。但是，我们知道他的一名后裔奈法利安正统治着这座要塞，希望能继续他父亲未竟的事业。"
G["Indeed. This place overturns our very notion of time, and how it shapes the universe."]="是的。此地推翻了我们对时间的认识，以及宇宙形成的理论。"
G["Indeed. Watch this, $r."]="当然。$r，看仔细了。"
G["Indeed. We must get you two back to safety. Thanks to you, the Thunder King is now completely under siege."]="确实如此。我们送你们回去吧。多亏你们，雷神现在已经四面楚歌了。"
G["Indeed. What better way to symbolize the bond of friendship and brotherhood between Tarren Mill and Southshore by erecting this tower at the halfway point between both towns. Brilliant!"]="确实。证明塔伦米尔和南海镇之间的友谊和兄弟关系的最佳方式，就是在两个镇子中间树立这座哨塔。多棒的点子啊！"
G["Indeed. With the aid of your champions, the Dark Irons will put an end to the Zandalari threat in Dun Morogh."]="没错。有了这些勇士的协助，黑铁矮人就能终结赞达拉对丹莫罗的威胁。"
G["Indeed... lovely dress, Jessica."]="真的……漂亮的衣服，杰希卡。"
G["Indeed? It appears I have much to learn from these \"mogu.\""]="¿Ah, sí? Parece que tengo mucho que aprender de esos \"mogu\"."
G["Indeeeeed!"]="真的！"
G["Individual strength is important, but tribal strength is more so.  Our tribe is only as strong as its weakest member."]="个体的力量很重要，但全族的力量更加重要。只有当我们部族中最弱小的个体也强大起来，我们的部族才会真正变得强大。"
G["Inessera is a sharp woman who carries various gems as well as jewelcrafting supplies. You can find her shop in the northern part of Aldor Rise."]="英妮瑟拉是个贩卖各种宝石以及珠宝加工用品的精明女人。你可以在奥尔多高地的北部找到她的商店。"
G["Infernals rain from the sky!"]="天空中落下了大量地狱火！"
G["Infested crops are covered in bugs. Yech!\n\nGrandpa's bug sprayer is on the ground near the field - use it to give those critters a blast of what-for!"]="遭虫害的农作物上爬满了害虫，真恶心！\n\n爷爷的杀虫剂就在田地边上——用它给那些臭虫子点颜色瞧瞧！"
G["Infested crops are covered in bugs. Yech!\n\nNow that we have that Pulse Wave Emitter, though, it should be easy to get rid of them. Flip it on to shoo all those pests away in a humane fashion, without any pesticide!\n\nHey, does that mean our veggies count as organic?"]="遭虫害的农作物上爬满了害虫，真恶心！\n\n不过，既然我们有了脉波发射器，那就应该能轻而易举地消灭它们。用它来赶走那些害虫真是一种人道的方式，毫无杀虫剂成分！\n\n嘿，那是不是说我们的菜也算是有机蔬菜了？"
G["Infidels!"]="异教徒！"
G["Infidels! They must be purified!"]="异教徒， 净化他们！"
G["Infiltration commencing."]="渗透行动开始。"
G["Infiltrator! You cannot hope to stop the swarm!"]="渗透者！你别妄想阻挡虫群！"
G["Infinite energy, unbound!"]="宣泄吧，永恒之能！"
G["Information on Brilliant Chromatic Scales."]="关于魔光多彩鳞片的信息。"
G["Information on Frayed Abomination Stitchings."]="关于破碎憎恶织线的信o。"
G["Information on the Blood of Heroes."]="关于英雄之血的信息。"
G["Information on the Chromatic Carapace."]="关于多彩龙鳞的信息。"
G["Information on the Skin of Shadow."]="关于暗影之皮的信息。"
G["Ingoo, I gave your people the rod for protection. Not to be ookin' used for hooliganation!"]="盎迦，我把这根棍子给你们是为了保护你们，不是给你用来该死的耍流氓的！"
G["Ingoo, rod is not for you. Give it up before it destroys you too."]="盎迦，棍子不是给你玩的，把它给我，不然它会把你也毁了。"
G["Ingvar has plans for you, little one."]="因格瓦尔早就计划好怎么对付你了，小家伙。"
G["Ingvar sends his dragon riders to descend upon these insects! Soon they will face the awakened force of the Vrykul!"]="因格瓦尔已经派出龙骑兵去消灭那些蝼蚁了！很快他们就将面临觉醒的维库军团的毁灭性打击！"
G["Ingvar! Your pathetic failure will serve as a warning to all... you are damned! Arise and carry out the master's will!"]="因格瓦尔！你这可耻的失败将警示所有巫妖王的仆从！你被诅咒了！站起来，重新执行主人的意志！"
G["Initiate Phase I: Recapture the enemy airfield!"]="第一阶段：我们将夺取敌方机场！"
G["Initiate Phase II: Capture the Surface Command Post!"]="第二阶段：攻占地面指挥所！"
G["Initiate, may I have another quiver please?"]="新兵，能再给我一个箭袋吗？"
G["Initiating cleanup ... ..."]="正在初始化清除……"
G["Initiating energy collection."]="开始收集能量。"
G["Initiating query.  The Algalon Failsafe is an automated emergency signal following a Prime Designate's demise."]="正在初始化问询。奥尔加隆保险系统是一套在首席管理官死亡时触发的自动化紧急信号系统。"
G["Initiating system reset. Module 1 at 50%. Hey, system reset requires two modules to complete."]="Iniciando sistema de reinicio. Módulo 1 al 50%. Eh, el sistema necesita que se completen dos módulos."
G["Initiating system reset. Module 2 at 50%. Hey, system reset requires two modules to complete."]="Iniciando reinicio del sistema. Módulo 2 al 50%. Eh, el sistema necesita que se completen dos módulos."
G["Initiating visual aid representation number two.\n\nThe second resultant variance of the Earthen matrix retains many desired elements when compared to the standard subterranean matrix.  The common nomenclature for this variant is \"Dwarf\".\n\nThis variant retains strength and stamina inherent to the Earthen.  In some cases, the dwarf even exceeds the cognitive powers of the Earthen's matrix.  The dwarf, however, retains none of the physical composition of Azeroth's various stone core compounds."]="Iniciando representación de ayuda visual número dos.\n\nLa segunda variante de resultado de la matriz de terráneos retiene numerosos elementos deseados cuando se los compara con la matriz subterránea estándar. La nomenclatura común para esta variante es \"Enano\".\n\nEsta variante conserva la fortaleza y la resistencia inherente a los terráneos. En algunos casos, el enano presenta incluso poderes cognitivos superiores a los de la matriz de los terráneos. No obstante, el enano no presenta la composición física de los compuestos del núcleo mineral de Azeroth.\""
G["Inland invaders! Fire!"]="陆地上有敌人！开火！"
G["Inn"]="旅店"
G["Inner ring of War Quarter where James Van Brunt work.  Him make us good chain."]="詹姆斯·范·布朗特的工作地点在军事区内环。他能为我们打造很好的锁链。"
G["Innkeeper Kauth can see to your needs.  He can be found on the west side of the village in one of the long houses."]="旅店老板考乌斯可以满足你的需求。你可以在村子西边的屋子中找到他。"
G["Innkeeper Norman keeps a dusty crack in the wall he calls an inn on the upper ring of the Trade Quarter."]="贸易区上层区域的诺曼是这里的旅店老板，他的店只不过是几面满是灰尘和裂缝的墙壁。"
G["Innkeeper Norman on upper ring of Trade Quarter is one to talk to."]="你得去贸易区找旅店老板诺曼谈谈。"
G["Innkeeper Pala will help you rest your body and spirit.  You can find her in the building just south of the bank on the lower rise."]="旅店老板帕拉能帮助你得到身心的休息。他就在中部高地的底层的雷霆崖银行以南的建筑物中。"
G["Innkeeper Renee has moved to the large building in the center of town.  It's the biggest building in Brill... Very hard to miss."]="旅店老板瑞尼已经把店搬到了镇中心的那个大房子里。那是布瑞尔最大的房子……你不会错过的。"
G["Innovation is not for the unimaginative, $C. Find a more traditional path."]="La innovación no es para los poco imaginativos, $C. Encuentra un camino más tradicional."
G["Inns are places where you can rest after your adventures.  If you do not stay at an inn such as this, then you will not be fully rested when you venture again into the wilderness.\n\nYou may also acquire a hearthstone at any inn, and later when you are ready to rest you can use this heartstone to bring you back to the inn from which you acquired it."]="旅店是供你在冒险后休息的地方。如果你不待在旅店中，那么当你重新开始冒险时候就得不到很好的休息。\n\n你可以在任何一家旅馆中免费得到一块炉石，当你准备休息时，就可以使用炉石传送回你所绑定的旅店中。"
G["Input recognized.  Please prepare for journey."]="指令输入已确认。请准备好开始旅程。"
G["Inscription"]="铭文"
G["Inscription Supplies"]="铭文补给品"
G["Inscription allows you to create magical scrolls, glyphs, off-hand tomes, Darkmoon cards, and even recipes for other professions.\nMany raw materials for Inscription come from milling herbs gathered by Herbalism, so the two professions pair well.\nYou'll need a Virtuoso Inking Set for inscribing things; this and other necessary materials, such as parchment, may be purchased from Inscription vendors."]="La inscripción te permite crear pergaminos mágicos, glifos, escritos para mano izquierda, cartas de la Luna Negra e, incluso, recetas para otras profesiones.\n\nMuchas materias primas de inscripción se obtienen al moler hierbas recogidas mediante la herboristería, así que las dos profesiones se compaginan bien.\n\nNecesitarás un juego de caligrafía de virtuoso para realizar inscripciones; el juego, al igual que otros materiales necesarios como pergaminos, se puede comprar a los vendedores de inscripción."
G["Insects!"]="渣滓！"
G["Insects! Let me show you my strength up close!"]="没用的虫子！让你们见识一下我的力量吧！"
G["Insert 35 Apexis Shards, and begin!"]="插入35块埃匹希斯碎片，然后开始！"
G["Insert a stack of Ginseng."]="放入一堆人参。"
G["Insert a stack of Green Cabbage."]="放入一堆绿色卷心菜。"
G["Insert a stack of Jade Squash."]="放入一堆碧玉瓜。"
G["Insert a stack of Juicycrunch Carrots."]="放入一堆爽脆胡萝卜。"
G["Insert a stack of Mogu Pumpkins."]="放入一堆魔古南瓜。"
G["Insert a stack of Pink Turnips."]="放入一堆粉色芜菁。"
G["Insert a stack of Red Blossom Leeks."]="放入一堆红韭花。"
G["Insert a stack of Scallions."]="放入一堆葱。"
G["Insert a stack of Striped Melons."]="放入一堆菜瓜。"
G["Insert a stack of White Turnips."]="放入一堆白色芜菁。"
G["Insert a stack of Witchberries."]="放入一堆女巫浆果。"
G["Insert an Apexis Shard, and begin!"]="插入1块埃匹希斯碎片，然后开始！"
G["Insert coins to let Warrior-Matic NX-01 teach you how to Charge. Then use it on the training dummies."]="塞入硬币，全能战士NX-01型会教你如何进行冲锋。然后你可以在训练假人身上进行实践。"
G["Inside the caravan are boxes of vendor supplies, along with the personal belongings of Fiona and her companions."]="马车里放的都是装货物的箱子。还有菲奥拉和她的同伴们的一些私人物品。"
G["Inside the great tent at the northwest corner of the village is where Chaw Stronghide resides.  He will teach you what you must know of Leatherworking for now."]="查尔·硬皮居住在村子西北角的大帐篷中。他能教你一些制皮的必要知识。"
G["Inside!"]="进来！"
G["Inside, quickly! Let's use the Legion's attack as a distraction!"]="进去，快点！可以用燃烧军团的进攻作为掩护！"
G["Insignificant gnat!"]="卑微的虫子！"
G["Insignificant!"]="微不足道！"
G["Insignificant."]="没用的东西。"
G["Insolent cubs! Submit or die!"]="无礼的小崽子们！投降免死！"
G["Insolent fool! You thought to steal Zelemar's blood? You shall pay with your own!"]="蠢货！你想窃取塞雷玛尔之血吗？你会为此付出代价的！"
G["Insolent little $r!"]="你这无礼的小$r！"
G["Insolent mortal! You will be consumed!"]="傲慢的凡人！你死定了！"
G["Insolent rat!"]="过街老鼠！"
G["Insolent whelps! Your blood will temper the weapons used to reclaim this world!"]="大胆！今天就要以尔等的鲜血，为曾用来改造这个世界的武器淬火！"
G["Inspect the body."]="调查这具尸体。"
G["Inspecting"]="调查"
G["Instant Statue"]="快干塑像"
G["Instead of bloodshed, how about we settle our differences... in a battle of the DANCE?"]="除了打得头破血流，不如用跳舞来解决……我们之间的分歧吧？"
G["Instead, look for a number of deck-mounted flak cannons positioned for just such an emergency."]="你们应该迅速找到并操作安装在甲板上的火炮，对抗敌人的进攻。"
G["Instead, we require a small, concentrated strike force for the attack to succeed. For that reason, we have created the Argent Tournament."]="实际上，我们需要组建一支小规模的精英力量，对敌人造成致命打击。这才是我们的取胜之道。所以我们举办了银色锦标赛。"
G["Instead, you laid waste to the land. Murdered innocents. Children even..."]="然而，你却把它变成了废土，滥杀无辜，连孩童也不放过……"
G["Instill me with your wisdom, Advisor."]="与我分享你的智慧吧，建言者。"
G["Instruct me further in the use of the naaru's power."]="继续指导我如何使用纳鲁的力量吧。"
G["Instructor Chillheart's soul escapes to her phylactery. Destroy it!"]="指导者寒心的灵魂向她的护命匣逃去。摧毁它！"
G["Instructor Devoran sends a contender against your raptor."]="导师德沃兰给你的迅猛龙找来了个对手。"
G["Instructor Windblade, could you call my serpent again?"]="风刃教头，你能再帮我召唤一次翔龙吗？"
G["Instructor Windblade, how is my serpent doing?"]="风刃教头，我的翔龙还好吗？"
G["Insufferable skeletons."]="我真受不了这些骷髅。"
G["Insult Coren Direbrew's brew."]="搞臭科林·烈酒的酒。"
G["Insurgents you say? Is there any risk of death or dismemberment to me?"]="你说有入侵者？我会有生命危险吗？我会被肢解吗？"
G["Interact with the Mysterious Crystal to gain new abilities and use them to defend Courier Tormun!"]="从这块神秘的水晶中获取新的能力，并用这些能力保护信使托姆恩！"
G["Interact with the Mysterious Crystal to gain new abilities and use them to defend Durak Flamespeaker."]="从这块神秘的水晶中获取新的能力，并用这些能力保护火语者杜莱克！"
G["Intercept |cFF9900CC|Hspell:107439|h[Twilight Barrage]|h|r to prevent damage to the Skyfire!"]="快挡住|cFF9900CC|Hspell:107439|h[暮光弹幕]|h|r，以防天火号受到损伤！"
G["Interested in a canoe ride to Dragonblight?"]="要搭独木舟前往龙骨荒野吗？"
G["Interested in catching a shark?"]="有兴趣抓只鲨鱼吗？"
G["Interested in catching some rare pets?"]="有兴趣去抓一些稀有宠物么？"
G["Interested in developing your cooking skills, are you?\n\nYou need to speak to the Ironpaw family. They can be found at the Halfhill Market in the Valley of the Four Winds.\n\nI will mark the location on your map for you."]="想提高自己的厨艺是吗？\n\n你应该跟铁掌家族的人谈谈。他们就在四风谷的半山市集。\n\n我会为你在地图上标出位置。"
