G["Interesting, very interesting.  You found this in Durotar, $n?"]="有趣，非常有趣。你是在杜隆塔尔找到这个的，$n？"
G["Interesting."]="真有意思。"
G["Interesting.  I'd never heard of the Twilight Council until now."]="有趣。在这以前我还从来没听说过暮光议会。"
G["Interesting.  The wanted poster calls for the extermination of the local moth population.  Something about royal teromoths."]="有意思。这张通缉令要求消灭本地的蛾子，一些“华丽的巨蛾”之类的东西。"
G["Interesting. Even this far from the epicenter, Azeroth's crust is completely torn asunder."]="真有趣，即使在距离震中如此遥远的地方，艾泽拉斯的外表还是彻底被撕碎了。"
G["Interesting. He does not like beer? A very strange land, indeed."]="有意思，他竟然不喜欢啤酒？入乡随俗吧。"
