G["Interesting... it seems the nethertron emissions are on the rise using the gobo-sin curve scale.  Yet the energon particles are cubed..."]="有意思……看来灵流粒子的喷发增量符合葛波正弦函数曲线。而超能粒子则呈三次幂增长……"
