G["Interlopers! Invaders! The All Seeing Eye has been stolen! The miserable dog, $n, has it in $g his:her; possession!"]="入侵者！入侵者！全视之眼被偷了！可耻的$n偷走了它！"
G["Interlopers! You mortals who dare to interfere with my sport will pay.... Wait--you..."]="入侵者！你们这些凡人竟敢坏了我的兴致，看我怎么……等等，你们……"
