G["Is this a serious question? You really don't know?\n\nIf you are the cowardly sort, afraid to get their hands too dirty, you will find Dark Iron scraps on the creatures in the Burning Steppes and Searing Gorge.\n\nIf you're the bloodthirsty adventuring type, the dungeons of Blackrock Spire and Blackrock Depths hold quite a large supply of the scraps."]="能问些不这么愚蠢的问题吗？你真不知道吗？\n\n要是你胆子小，怕死的话，就去燃烧平原和灼热峡谷的生物身上去找黑铁碎片。\n\n要是你够狠够胆大，干脆杀进黑石塔和黑石深渊算了，那里的黑铁碎片更多。"
