G["Ishnu-dal-dieb, $n. Have you come here in search of knowledge?"]="和平也与你同在, $n。你是来寻求知识的吗？"
G["Isillien!"]="伊森利恩！"
G["Iskalder, there you are. What is this? Engaged in battle already?"]="伊斯卡德尔，你总算露面了。怎么？你已经开始战斗了吗？"
G["Iskalder?! You fool! Have you no idea who that is? He's only the greatest vrykul warrior who ever lived!"]="伊斯卡德尔？！蠢货！你没听过他的名头吗？他是有史以来最伟大的维库人战士！"
