G["Isn't Zouchin Province beautiful? I've lived here my whole life."]="卓金界美丽吧？我一辈子都生活在这里。"
G["Isn't he magnificent?!"]="他是不是很了不起？！"
G["Isn't he so cute?!  Thanks for bringing him right to me!!!"]="他是不是很可爱？！感谢你把他带回我这里！！！"
G["Isn't it amazing, children? All who enter the city must walk beneath the watchful eyes of the greatest heroes of our lands."]="孩子们，这里是不是十分壮观？所有人都要在这些伟大的英雄的注视下进入暴风城。"
G["Isn't it beautiful? I call it the magnificent aerial command unit!"]="是不是很漂亮？我把它称为华丽的空中指挥单位！"
G["Isn't it beautiful? Such grace it has, as it dances in the sky. One day, I hope to be as graceful as the crane."]="难道不美么？如此优雅地在空中起舞。希望有一天，我也能拥有鹤般的美好气韵。"
G["Isn't it beautiful? The weaving of flesh and bone and soul."]="这难道不美么？交织着血肉、骨骼和灵魂。"
G["Isn't it just beautiful? Can you see the potential profit?"]="这里的风景是不是很漂亮啊？你能看到潜在的利益吗？"
G["Isn't it obvious, Warchief? I serve the Horde."]="答案还不明显吗，酋长？我为部落效忠。"
G["Isn't it weird how kaja'mite made us smart thousands of years ago, but it doesn't seem to be having any effect on our trolls?"]="卡亚矿石在几千年前把我们变得非常聪明，现在却对我们这些巨魔产生不了任何效果，这不奇怪吗？"
G["Isn't it weird that we're keeping Magatha Grimtotem captive here? Good thing all of her totems were destroyed.\n\nI even heard that she poisoned Cairne Bloodhoof. Wish she were on our side."]="我们居然把玛加萨·恐怖图腾囚禁在此，这不奇怪吗？好在她所有的图腾都被摧毁了。\n\n我甚至听说她毒害了凯恩·血蹄。希望她是站在我们这边的。"
G["Isn't it? However, they do differ from dragons when it comes to their lifespan. Whereas the dragons of our world can live for millenia on end, these fire hawks live brief lives, passing quickly from egg to adulthood to death.\n\nThough my master warns against making emotional connections to our studies, sometimes I can't help but feel sorry for them. They burn so brightly in life... but in death, they're quickly replaced and forgotten."]="难道不是吗？但它们的寿命却和巨龙有很大不同。和我们那个世界的巨龙动辄上千年的寿命正相反，这些火鹰的生命非常短暂，从孵化到成年，再到死亡，不过是短短一瞬而已。\n\n虽然我的导师一再禁止我们将个人感情带到研究中来，可有时我还是忍不住要为它们难过。它们的生命燃烧得如此灿烂……可一旦死亡，它们就会被迅速取代并遗忘。"
G["Isn't she beautiful? Sigh..."]="她不漂亮吗？唉……"
G["Isn't she just the most amazing little creation?"]="她难道不是最让人惊奇的小东西吗？"
G["Isn't that a bit much, lad?"]="这是否太过分了，伙计？"
G["Isn't that adorable! How did you make it out of the Vale? Maybe you should get back there before someone sends a search party after you."]="啧啧，好可爱啊！你怎么敢独自出来的？也许你在其他人派出搜索队之前赶紧回去。"
G["Isn't the memorial beautiful?  It is important to remember moments in our history when great sacrifices are made, lest we forget the price of all wars - even ones that are won."]="这座纪念碑不漂亮吗？对我们来说，铭记这些为胜利而牺牲的伙伴们非常有意义。我们永远都不能忘记战争的代价——即便是那些我们最终获胜的战争。"
G["Isn't this just so much fun? I'm so glad that Lord Saltheril throws these parties every night, especially with all of that nastiness occurring to the south. Kind of just makes all of that go away, don't you think?"]="这不是很有趣吗？我很高兴萨瑟利尔男爵每晚都举办这样的聚会，特别在南部发生着些令人不愉快的事情时，聚会可以让我们忘记那一切，你觉得呢？"
G["Iso'rath's stomach begins to churn as the brain is attacked!"]="当那个脑子受到进攻时，厄索拉斯的肚子也开始搅动起来！"
G["Issa truut, matey!  Neh tougher salts anyweh but da northsea freebootahs yahso, mon!\n\nBest not brindle s'mady, mon.  Scuppah dat!  'Alf eediat swabs get feh kiss da gunnah's dawta, mate!"]="¡Es la verdad, compay! ¡No hay marinero más duro que los piratas del Mar del Norte! Mejor no enfadar a nadie, camarada. ¡Fíjate tú! ¡Todos los marineros estúpidos acaban siendo asotaos, compay!"
G["It ... burns!"]="它……在燃烧！"
G["It IS a family thing, Mudmug. And I want you to join us."]="这确实是家务事，泥盏。但是我希望你加入。"
G["It Kota Kon!!"]="是寇塔空！！"
G["It WAS your fault."]="这是你的错。"
G["It ain't all bad...\n\nI still got my breathin' hat!"]="No es tan malo...\n\n¡Todavía tengo mi sombrero de respirar!"
G["It aint easy bein' this classy, but someone's gotta do it!"]="保持仪态可不容易，可总得有人这么做！"
G["It all be over now, mon!"]="一切都结束啦，伙计！"
G["It all ends here."]="该结束了。"
G["It all makes sense! All the strange things that have been happening on our farms. The hozen must have been behind it all! I must admit, you figured it out pretty quickly, $n."]="现在全都说得通了！发生在我们农场上的各种怪事。幕后黑手一定是猢狲！我必须承认，你分析得很快，$n。"
G["It all over for you, mon."]="你完了。"
G["It all over... now."]="都结束了……"
G["It all worked out in the end."]="最后终于全搞定了。"
G["It almost seems as if he was born with this corruption inside of him."]="他体内的腐化仿佛是与生俱来的。"
G["It amazes me how selfless and kind you have been to all of us."]="你竟然对我们大家如此无私和仁慈，这令我感到很惊讶。"
G["It amazes me that in a city full of people, only the small handful here heeded the warnings of the elements."]="在这样一座大城市里，注意到元素发出警告的人却屈指可数，这真令我感到惊诧。"
G["It appears as if I will have to step in and take care of you myself."]="似乎我不得不插手这件事，亲自来解决你。"
G["It appears as if that gold we recovered from the dead rogue was yours.  You certainly are lucky..."]="看来我们从那死去盗贼身上找到的金币归你了。你可真走运……"
G["It appears as though your experiment has failed. That whelp has gone completely blind! Look at him."]="看来你的实验失败了。那小龙已经完全瞎了！你看看他。"
G["It appears that Empress Shek'zeer has let our empire fall into chaos. This we must address. But first, I must regain my strength."]="看来女皇夏柯希尔已经把我们的帝国搞得乌烟瘴气。这个问题必须得到解决。但首先，我得恢复自己的力量。"
G["It appears that adventure has made itself apparent.  Look, for as yonder maiden treads innocently through the jungle, a hatchling phoenix stalks her as its prey!"]="这次冒险的意义已经很明显了。看，当天真的少女在丛林中穿行时，一只凤凰幼鸟却在伺机将她猎杀！"
G["It appears that the ointment is ineffective. Such a pity..."]="看上去这药膏没有起作用。真遗憾……"
G["It appears that this fishgorged crane suffered a violent death.\n\nThere are bites and claw marks all over its body and most of its viscera have been consumed.\n\nThis must be a favorite meal of something ravenous."]="这头嗜鱼鹤死得很惨。\n\n它的身体上布满了齿痕和爪印，内脏也被吞吃一空。\n\n它显然成了某个家伙的一顿美餐。"
G["It appears they are using those runes to deposit some of the power they've drained."]="很显然，他们利用那些符文来储藏从别处抽取来的能量。"
G["It appears we have more training to do."]="看来我们还得多练习练习。"
G["It appears you are near a repair station! Drive your vehicle onto the platform, and it should be automatically repaired."]="你附近似乎有一座维修站！把你的座驾开到平台上去，接受自动修理。"
G["It appears you took a wrong turn, $c."]="看来你走错方向了，$c。"
G["It appears you're losing control of Gilneas, Sylvanas.  Garrosh fears he's going to have to carry out this invasion himself."]="你正在失去对吉尔尼斯的控制，希尔瓦娜斯。加尔鲁什担心他恐怕要亲自来指挥这场战争。"
G["It appears your mind is set then.  We will guide you to the spirit world with as much kindness as we can."]="看来你已经做出了决定，那么好吧。我们会尽可能让你进入灵魂世界的过程没有痛苦。"
G["It be TIME, Hexmaster! De sons and daughters of de Darkspear have returned! We gonna drive you into de sea..."]="你的末日到了，恶魔！现在，暗矛部族的儿女们回来了！我们要把你赶进大海……"
G["It be a journey, but if we can avoid harrassment we should be able ta make it by day's end. Do ye have any food on ye?"]="这可真是长途跋涉，不过如果我们能不受干扰的话，应该能在天黑以前到达目的地。你身上带吃的了吗？"
G["It be alright, Ed. Me booty be locked away good in that thar chest. No fool will ever have Cap'n Sanders's treasure! Let's go get another drink. The spirits be runnin' low."]="没事的，艾德华。我的战利品都好好地锁在那只箱子里面。永远没有人能得到杉德尔船长的财宝了！让我再去喝一杯。我的情绪有点开始消沉了。"
G["It be chicken..."]="还是鸡肉……"
G["It be clear..."]="很安全……"
G["It be days like today that make ye grateful fer the kindness of strangers - brings a tear to me eye.... Heh, nuthin a good pint won't fix."]="像你这样的陌生人也能慷慨伸出援手，真是感动得令我落泪……嗨，只有喝上几杯才能表达我的感谢。"
G["It be done! Razor Hill is ours! Da Warchief probably see da fires all the way from Grommash Hold..."]="成功了！剃刀岭归我们了！酋长或许已经从格罗玛什要塞上看到火光了……"
G["It be done. Our ancient enemy is defeated."]="结束了。我们古老的敌人被击败了。"
G["It be done. We bruddahs in dis. Until da end."]="好。你我结成兄弟。直到末日。"
G["It be dyin' time, now!"]="死亡时间到！"
G["It be feedin' time!"]="喂食时间到啦！"
G["It be gold we're after!"]="我们要的是黄金！"
G["It be good to be free again!"]="重获自由的感觉真好！"
G["It be good to be outta dat cage. Norkani will have her revenge..."]="能从笼子里出来真好。洛尔卡尼要复仇……"
G["It be me treasure, Ed. Me life's work! Arrr... One white shirt fit fer a pirate king to be wearin'!"]="那是我的宝贝，艾德华。我毕生的心血！啊……一件适合海盗之王穿的白色衬衣！"
G["It be my duty to record these tragic events for the good of generations to come."]="为了后世的幸福，我有责任记录下这些悲剧。"
G["It be time ta kick some arse an' drink double-rum!\n\nAn' I almost be outta double-rum...."]="该喝点双份朗姆酒啦！\n\n哎呀，我的酒快喝光了……"
G["It be time to squeal, little piggy!"]="尖叫吧，小猪！"
G["It becomes so easy to take it all for granted when danger surrounds us at every turn."]="当危险无处不在的时候，它们也就变成家常便饭了。"
G["It belongs to our ancestors..."]="属于我们的祖先……"
G["It belongs to our children."]="属于我们的子孙。"
G["It borders on sacrilege that these secrets be revealed to a mortal such as yourself, but I have little choice.\n\nEver since Freya, daughter of the titans, left me here I've had but one task and I cannot fail.  Life must be protected at any cost.\n\nThere is a waygate that links this place with another very much like this one.  It is there that the weapon we seek can be found."]="将造物主的秘密告知你这样的凡人，简直是对神灵的亵渎，但是我别无选择。\n\n泰坦的女儿弗蕾亚要我不惜一切代价保卫索拉查盆地的安全，这就是我留守此地的唯一目的。\n\n盆地内有一座大门，连接着另一块与这里的环境极其相似的土地。穿越那座大门，就能找到我们所说的秘密武器。"
G["It burns in here! Wait, that's just my feet."]="这里可真烫！等等，那是我的脚。"
G["It burns like the moon!"]="像月光一样灼热！"
G["It burns so good!"]="烧得真漂亮！"
G["It burns!"]="烧起来了！"
G["It burns! IT BURNS!"]="真疼啊！真疼啊！！"
G["It burns...my soul...it burns!!!!"]="在燃烧……我的灵魂……在燃烧！！！！"
G["It came crashing through shortly after the collapse. We're examining it now."]="它在崩溃以后很快就撞毁了。我们正在检查它。"
G["It came from above!"]="从上面来了！"
G["It came from below!"]="从下方来的！"
G["It came from the wall, sir."]="是从……墙那边传来的。"
G["It can be difficult for a hardened veteran to grow accustomed to a peaceful setting, but that is our duty.  These villagers do not long for war, let us not bring it to their doorstep if we do not have to."]="对于身经百战的老兵来说，很难适应和平环境，但那是我们的职责。这些村民厌恨战争，除非别无选择，否则就不要把战火引到他们门前。"
G["It can get really hot here in the Badlands. But at least it's a dry heat."]="荒芜之地真的很热，但至少还不潮湿。"
G["It cannot be..."]="这不可能……"
G["It cannot end... like... this..."]="不能就这样……结束……"
G["It cold there! You go in Royal Quarter, talk to Grizzle Halfmane."]="那里很冷！你应该去皇家区找格里兹尔谈谈。"
G["It comes for you..."]="它为你而来……"
G["It comes from - harum - what is your word for it? Harrrm. Let us say that my kind does not have bathrooms. Do you understand?"]="它来自——嗯——你们的语言是怎样说的？嗯。我要说，我们一族可是没有厕所的。你明白吗？"
G["It confirms our suspicions. The threads of time have been severed and rewoven in the wrong pattern. But, how?"]="这证实了我们的怀疑。时间流的进程被切断了，历史也被篡改了。这是怎么做到的呢？"
G["It consumed the Light!"]="它吞噬了圣光！"
G["It couldn't hurt to study it. 'Tho I don't much care for the way it's lookin' at me."]="只是研究的话不会出事的。不过我很不喜欢它看我的眼神。"
G["It depends on how hard you throw them!"]="得看你用大力气扔泥巴！"
G["It describes a way to stop the mantid. A way to stop the sha!"]="上面记载了阻止螳螂妖的方法。一种阻止煞的方法！"
G["It did not have to be like this..."]="事情不该变成这样的……"
G["It did not have to be this way!  I only wish to see my family again...to share with them this gift!"]="事情不应该这样！我只是想再见到我的家人……同他们分享这份礼物！"
G["It did not matter. It comes.  Steel your hearts and prepare your souls."]="没有关系，它来了。坚定你们的心智，做好准备。"
G["It didn't come out very good, $n. You wouldn't want any."]="效果不太好，$n。你还是别试了。"
G["It didn't have to go down this way, $c."]="你本来不必如此的，$c。"
G["It didn't look like much of a \"cure\" to me, and I wasn't about to stand around listening to some crazy robot while he was butchering my people!\n\nWe did what any sane gnome would do... we ran! Well, actually, most of us parachuted off the side of the platform, but you get the picture.\n\nNot many of us managed to make it back here, and we're still spread thin from having to deal with everything else too, like the magnataur to the north and the Scourge to the east. To make things worse, the Horde just setup shop to the northwest!"]="A mí no me parecía una \"cura\" y no estaba dispuesto a quedarme parado escuchando a un robot demente mientras masacraba a mi gente.\n\nHicimos lo que cualquier gnomo en su sano juicio hubiera hecho... ¡corrimos! Bueno, de hecho, la mayoría de nosotros nos lanzamos en paracaídas desde la plataforma, pero te haces una idea.\n\nSolo unos pocos conseguimos regresar aquí y aún estamos bastante mermados, pues también nos tenemos que encargar de todo lo demás: el magnatauro al norte y la Plaga al este. ¡Por no mencionar que la Horda se ha establecido al noroeste!"
G["It does get worse, old friend. According to my calculations, without suitable materials to repair our parapets, the walls protecting this keep will crumble in twelve hours."]="朋友，情况越来越糟糕了。根据我的计算，如果没有足够的材料维修防御墙的话，那么保护这座要塞的城墙就会在12小时内坍塌。"
G["It does my soul good to see the walls of Stormwind standing strong and tall.\n\nIf you're looking to go to Stratholme, I'm afraid I'm unable to assist at the moment. The towers nearby the burning city are still in contention, and as such my powers are far too weak to aid you. Return to me once you're victorious there."]="看着雄伟的暴风城城墙高耸、壁垒森严、固若金汤，真是令人倍感欣慰。\n\n你想去斯坦索姆？恐怕眼下我没法帮你。在那座燃烧的城市附近，哨塔争夺战仍在继续；而且我的力量太过薄弱，真是爱莫能助啊。如果你能成功夺得哨塔，再来找我吧。"
G["It does not matter. Taoshi's proposal is too dangerous."]="算了吧。陶矢的提议太危险了。"
G["It doesn't even feel like I'm making any progress..."]="看起来简直毫无进展……"
G["It doesn't have to end this way, you know?"]="我们有必要闹得这么僵吗？"
G["It doesn't hurt anymore, does it?"]="一点都不疼了，是不是？"
G["It doesn't hurt so much anymore."]="已经没那么疼了。"
G["It doesn't look very friendly in there. Maybe I should just..."]="那里看起来可不怎么友好啊，或许我应该……"
G["It doesn't make any sense. Why don't they just fly Naxxramas over Wintergarde Keep and blow it up? I mean, that's what I would do if I were Kel'Thuzad."]="这样毫无道理啊。为什么天灾军团不将纳克萨玛斯飞到暮冬要塞上空，然后直接炸毁它呢？我是说，如果我是克尔苏加德，肯定这么做啦。"
G["It doesn't matter that Mount Kajaro has blown. All that matters is that I stay on top!"]="卡亚罗山有没有爆炸并不重要。重要的是我要继续坐在头把交椅上！"
G["It doesn't seem like you're casting enough Shadowbolts."]="看来你施放的暗影箭还不够多。"
G["It don't mattah what you do heah, ravager. Da land will heal after you be dead."]="你的一切努力都是徒劳的，破坏者。等干掉你之后，我们会再次治愈它。"
G["It drafty out here."]="这里通风很不错。"
G["It ends TODAY. Here. The cycle ends when you, Regent Lord, and you, Lady Proudmoore, turn from one another. And walk. Away."]="这循环要在今日，此地结束。当你，摄政王，和你，普罗德摩尔女士，放过彼此，并各自回头。"
G["It ends here!"]="该结束了！"
G["It ends like it began..."]="结局仿佛只是开始……"
G["It falls to us to see Quel'Delar restored for the Sunreavers."]="见证逐日者夺回奎尔德拉是我们的使命。"
G["It falls to you to defend your master."]="保卫主人的重担就交给你了。"
G["It falls upon us to usher in an age of peace, where the Light will reign."]="它引领我们走向一个由圣光统治的和平时代。"
G["It feels good to walk about and stretch all four limbs. Is there something I can help you with, $c?"]="四处走走，伸展四肢，这种感觉真好。$c，有什么我可以帮忙的吗？"
G["It feels like I've been sleeping for years..."]="我仿佛已经睡了许多年……"
G["It feels like everyone wants to kiss me under the mistletoe."]="感觉好像每个人都想在槲寄生下吻我。"
G["It feels like we were in that forest forever. Let's go! We've got to explore the valley!"]="再这么磨蹭，我们哪儿都不用去了！走啦！我们得到谷中去探险！"
G["It feels so good to stretch my limbs!  It was cramped in there.  They really should invest in more roomy cages!"]="终于能伸展筋骨了！在里面只能缩着。他们真该花钱造些大点的笼子！"
G["It fueled their hatred and anger, lending them strength on the field of battle."]="它能催化恨意和怒火，让战士们在战场上获得力量。"
G["It gets the key. It comes here. It opens the lock."]="拿到钥匙，来到笼子面前，打开锁。"
G["It gets worse."]="事情更糟糕了。"
G["It good thing that this place is timeless. Ken-Ken hopes this never ends!"]="这里的时间是停滞的，这样真好。肯肯希望比试永远不要结束！"
G["It grants the ability to perform magic on a grand scale... but they quickly lose the ability to control that power."]="它能赋予凡人大规模施法的能力……可他们很快就会无法控制那股力量。"
G["It grows late. We should set up camp for the night. Sully, do you have an axe?"]="天色已经晚了。我们该扎营了。苏利，你有斧子吗？"
G["It had to be done...."]="这是必须的……"
G["It has been a great honor to fight beside you in defense of our land and our people."]="能与你们携手保卫家园和人民，是我的荣幸。"
G["It has been a great honor to fight by your side. Thank you."]="与你并肩作战是莫大的荣幸。谢谢你。"
G["It has been a long time since we welcomed visitors to our village."]="我们村已经很久没有欢迎过外来的访客了。"
G["It has been a long time, Bethor, my friend."]="比索，我的朋友，好久不见啊。"
G["It has been a long while since I fought a worthy adversary..."]="我很久没有遇到过旗鼓相当的对手了……"
G["It has been a pleasure!"]="真是令人愉快！"
G["It has been an age of the world or more since I felt any emotion at even a fraction of that."]="我已经有太长的时间没有感受过情绪的波动了。"
G["It has been an honor to fight at your side."]="与你并肩战斗对我来说是莫大的荣誉。"
G["It has been an honor to train with you."]="能和你一起训练是我的荣幸。"
G["It has been an honor, outlander."]="Ha sido un honor, $gforastero:forastera;."
G["It has been made known to me that inside each of us, the Light resides..."]="这让我得知，我们每个人的心中都有圣光……"
G["It has been many months since those two warlocks broke into the temple... but I'm still not sure what they were after."]="那两个术士是在几个月前闯入神殿的……但我依然无法确定他们到底在找什么。"
G["It has been many years since I have seen it manifest so dramatically."]="我已经好多年没见到它显现得如此强烈了。"
G["It has been many years since I have seen this place, Wakener. Much has changed."]="我上次看到这个地方，已经是很多年前了，唤醒者。很多东西都变了。"
G["It has been many years..."]="已经很多年了……"
G["It has been quite some time since I have been so at ease!"]="我好久没这么放松过了！"
G["It has been the greatest honor of my life to serve with you, Hummel."]="同您共事是我一生最大的荣耀。"
G["It has been years since I have thought with my heart, but it's all flooding back."]="很多年来我都没有再感觉过自己的内心，它现在仿佛又活了起来。"
G["It has been... entertaining."]="这场战斗……很有趣。"
G["It has brought me naught but ill. Mayhap you can find someone who will contain its power."]="它带给我的只有痛苦与灾难。或许你可以找到那个能操控它的力量的人。"
G["It has everything a growing scorchling needs!"]="熊熊燃烧的火炬就应该散发出这样浓烈的香味！"
G["It has now been six weeks since your release. Are you ready to have the shackles removed?"]="从你被释放到现在，已经过去六个星期了。你准备好告别那双镣铐了吗？"
G["It has taken me all day to wrestle the cipher from these hieroglyphs:\n\n\n   Through eyes of blue is starlight\n              revealed.\n\n   Ten shards, one rod, and the veil\n             disappears.\n\n\nForget Schnottz and his empty promises!\n\nIf I can just unravel this riddle, its secrets shall be mine!"]="Me he peleado todo el día para obtener las cifras de esos jeroglíficos:\n\n\nA través del azul de los ojos se revela la luz de las estrellas.\n\n   Diez fragmentos, una vara y el velo\n             desaparece.\n\n\n¡Olvida a Schnottz y sus promesas vacías!\n\nSi consigo descifrar este acertijo, ¡sus secretos serán míos!"
G["It has to be a message! Maybe even a clue to something important!"]="这一定是条信息！搞不好还是什么重大线索！"
G["It has to be said, Vol'jin. If we do not make it through this - I want you to know. You have always been my friend. My brother."]="我一定要说。万一我们失败了——我希望你明白：你始终是我的朋友，我的兄弟。"
G["It healed our wounds and made us bold. It tasted like sweetness and fire, and gave us the strength to conquer all the lesser races."]="它治愈我们的伤口，强健我们的身体。它尝起来芳香中带着火辣，它赐予我们力量来征服其他弱小的种族。"
G["It horrible!"]="糟透了！"
G["It hurt!"]="好疼！"
G["It hurts so much... Itharius, my old friend... please help me..."]="这对我的伤害太深了……伊萨里奥斯，我的老朋友……请帮帮我……"
G["It hurts when I move my arm."]="我动一动胳膊都觉得疼。"
G["It hurts!"]="好疼啊！"
G["It hurts! Owww Ow Ow Owwwww!"]="好痛！好痛啊！！！"
G["It hurts..."]="痛……"
G["It hurts... so much..."]="痛……好痛啊……"
G["It is Bowen Brisboise that you seek then.  You'll find him inside his house southwest of Brill just on the other side of the bridge at Cold Hearth Manor."]="那么你是在找博文·布里斯博埃斯了。他居住在炉灰庄园大桥另一边，布瑞尔城镇西南部。"
G["It is Gennia Runetotem's counsel that you seek.  You will find her in the large tent on the east side of the village."]="你应该去听听根妮亚·符文图腾的忠告。她在村子东面的大营帐中。"
G["It is Gul'dan!"]="那是古尔丹！"
G["It is I who is unworthy."]="我才是微不足道的。"
G["It is I, Malfurion. This is what I've become."]="是我，玛法里奥。这就是我现在的样子。"
G["It is Prince Arthas I want, not you!"]="我要的是阿尔萨斯王子，不是你！"
G["It is Syurna that you seek if you are to follow the rogue's path.  She dwells in the Cenarion Enclave down the spiraling path within the western most tree."]="要是你想做潜行者的话，就该去找塞尤娜。她居住在西部森林盘旋山道下的塞纳里奥区。"
G["It is Vesprystus that you seek.  He watches over the hippogryphs that come and go from the base of Teldrassil."]="去找维斯派塔斯吧。他负责管理在泰达希尔底部起落的角鹰兽。"
G["It is Vesprystus that you seek.  He watches over the hippogryphs that come and go from the base of Teldrassil.  You will find him through the portal in western Darnassus that will take you to Rut'theran Village."]="你要找的是维斯派塔斯。他负责看管在泰达希尔底部往返的角鹰兽。你可在穿过达纳苏斯西部的传送门，然后在鲁瑟兰村那儿找到他。"
G["It is YOU who are wrong!  I will deal with you two after I have slain this meddlesome shaman!"]="¡Eres TÚ quien está $gequivocado:equivocada;! ¡Me ocuparé de ti cuando haya asesinado a este chamán entrometido!"
G["It is a beacon. A remnant of a forgotten era."]="这是一座灯塔。一个被忘却的时代留下的遗迹。"
G["It is a boat... a whole airship!  That's a bigger thorn than I was expecting."]="Lo es. Una nave entera. Esta \"espina\" es más grande de lo que esperaba."
G["It is a difficult thing for us to trust someone so new to our city.  You've come upon us during a somewhat desperate time."]="要让我们信赖一位新人着实不易。你恰好在这个危急时刻造访了我们。"
G["It is a good day for a hunt."]="这是一个狩猎的好日子。"
G["It is a good day to be alive and one with the elements."]="能生存下来，并且和元素们生活在一起，这可真好啊。"
G["It is a good thing to spend time in a place like this. We must always remember what it is we struggle so hard to protect."]="时不时来这种地方消遣一下是不错的选择，它能让我们回想起自己努力奋战究竟是为了守护什么。"
G["It is a greater knowledge of the ways of the warlock that I crave."]="我喜欢学习更多的关于术士的知识。"
G["It is a long walk from town to Sri-La, but good for the spirit. And it certainly helps get little Aerial here outdoors."]="从镇上到香里拉有很长一段路，但走路对精神有好处。这肯定有助于让小艾黎到户外活动。"
G["It is a luckydo to have a clean yak. It is a bigger luckydo to feed it my special brew. This is how one makes Kobeyaks!"]="能找到一头干净的牦牛可真是幸事。喂它喝我特制的佳酿则是更大的幸事。稞神牦牛就是这么制成的！"
G["It is a marvel how we were able to set this up in so short a time. Let's try again..."]="能在这么短的时间内取得这样的进展已经很了不起了。我们再试一次……"
G["It is a most auspicious day today, is it not?"]="今天可真是百年不遇的好日子啊，不是吗？"
G["It is a mystery to me, $r. If you want to find out, you are both crazy and foolish!\n\nBut I suppose there is no other way to meet the Klaxxi than to venture beyond the wall into the Dread Wastes."]="这对我来说是个难解之谜，$r。如果你想找到他们，你就太傻、太疯狂了！\n\n但是我认为遇见卡拉克西的唯一途径是冒险越过这座城墙，到达恐惧废土。"
G["It is a poor offerin' but I be givin' it in thanks for your help."]="这只是一份可怜的奉献，但它代表了我对您的谢意。"
G["It is a rare and auspicious day when I get to test my abilities.\n\nI think you are ready to fight me, $n. Let us find out if I am correct."]="今天是测试我能力绝佳的好日子。\n\n我想你已经准备好迎战了，$n。让我们来瞧瞧我说的对不对。"
G["It is a risk I have to take. But if I am killed, please watch over Aggra and my boy."]="我必须这么做。但是，如果我死了，请照顾好阿格娜和我儿子。"
G["It is a shame Coren's Dire Brew can't quench more thirsting throats!  It's blasphemy, I know, but  I envy those Dark Iron dwarves!"]="真可惜，科林的烈酒不能在广大啤酒爱好者中推广开来！我知道这么说可能不合适，但我真的很嫉妒那些黑铁矮人！"
G["It is a shame I am only able to mask our own smells and not the foul odors pouring out of the Zandalari and their beasts."]="真可惜，我只能掩盖我们自己的气味，却没办法驱散赞达拉巨魔和他们那些畜生身上的恶臭。"
G["It is a shame we lost our own planes during our arrival. It will make our extraction mission a bit more...challenging."]="虽然我们活了下来，可遗憾的是，我们的飞机都坠毁了。这会让我们的任务变得更加……有挑战性。"
G["It is a shame, a dreadful shame, that my brethren cannot see what benefits come from truly steeping oneself in a culture."]="我的同胞们无法领略这种感觉——当你真正融入某种文化时所感受到的好处，这真是太遗憾了。"
G["It is a simple guideline, but a meaningful one. Do you understand?"]="这个原则很简单，但意义重大。你们能理解吗？"
G["It is a small matter to control the mind of the weak... for I bear allegiance to powers untouched by time, unmoved by fate. No force on this world or beyond harbors the strength to bend our knee... not even the mighty Legion!"]="控制弱者的思想是非常容易的事情……因为我所效忠的不被时间改变的力量，不被命运左右的力量。这个世界上没有什么力量能与此匹敌……即使是燃烧军团也不行！"
G["It is a story of legend and one that I do not have the time nor the inclination to retell. Just know that Medivh was the last of the Guardians. The greatstaff of Atiesh was a focal point of his power and a focal point of corruption."]="有关他的传说，我想我没有时间也没有兴趣重述一遍给你听。你只要知道麦迪文是最后一位守护者。而埃提耶什这把传说中的法杖，既是他力量的焦点，也是腐蚀的焦点。"
G["It is a strength that we sin'dorei all share. It is a strength we will need to free ourselves of the addiction ravaging our people."]="那是一种所有辛多雷成员共享的力量。我们需要这种力量来摆脱蹂躏我们人民的魔瘾。"
G["It is a time to celebrate new friends and the future we may forge together."]="我们热情欢迎新的朋友，与他们一起展望并肩打造出的未来。"
G["It is a very fancy ritual."]="那是个非常奇特的仪式。"
G["It is a weakness; a crippling flaw....  A joke played by the Creators upon their own creations."]="多么的软弱和不堪……这真是造物主的玩笑。"
G["It is a weapon like no other. It must be like no other."]="这是一件与众不同的武器。一件绝无仅有的武器。"
G["It is all I can do to protect those who have made it here."]="我已经尽全力去保护那些坚持走到这里的人。"
G["It is all about his adventures."]="歌曲描绘了他的冒险之旅。"
G["It is already determined.  You have no hope... the flames shall consume all!"]="命运早已注定。你毫无希望……烈焰将吞噬一切！"
G["It is always a good idea to make friends with fisherman. You will never go hungry!"]="和渔夫交朋友总是好事。你永远也不会挨饿！"
G["It is always a pleasure to meet heroes such as yourself in this forsaken land. Is there some form of assistance that I can offer you?"]="能在这片被遗弃的土地上见到你这样的英雄，真是令人愉快。我能帮你什么忙吗？"
G["It is always a pleasure to see you, Lady Proudmoore."]="我还是很高兴见到您的，普罗德摩尔女士。"
G["It is always an honor to share words with the Savior of Stoneplow."]="Siempre es un honor compartir unas palabras con $gel Salvador:la Salvadora; de Villarroca."
G["It is always good to see a strong $r like yourself."]="Siempre es un placer ver a $gun:una; $r fuerte como tú."
G["It is amazing. How could it have remained in this state, untouched by the world's destruction?"]="太棒了。这里为什么居然没有被毁灭呢？"
G["It is amusing to watch you struggle. Very well, witness how it is done!"]="欣赏你的挣扎真是令人愉悦。好吧，现在让你见识见识该怎么了结这一切！"
G["It is an absolute travesty of our time I tell you. That a rancher and his son can't just run a yak wash in peace without fear of yaungol raiding..."]="这世道真是可笑，我跟你说。一个堂堂的牧场主和他儿子连开个洗牛站都提心吊胆害怕野牛人的侵袭。"
G["It is an honor to finally face you in combat. Lok'tar Ogar, for Honor, and for the Horde!"]="能够与你一战是我的荣幸。Lok'tar Ogar，为了荣耀，为了部落！"
G["It is an honor to have you among us, $n."]="你能与我们同在，是我们的荣幸，$n。"
G["It is an honor to represent the Argent Crusade in this tournament."]="能在锦标赛中代表银色北伐军出场真是无上的荣耀。"
G["It is an honor to ride with you."]="能和你同场竞技是我的荣幸。"
G["It is an honor to serve along your side, $g sir:ma'am;."]="Es un honor servir junto a usted, $gseñor:señora;."
G["It is an honor to serve alongside you, Prime. I have studied your work extensively."]="能够随侍在您身边是一种荣耀，至尊者。我曾深入研究过您的工作。"
G["It is an honor to stand in your presence, Champion $n."]="很荣幸能与你共同战斗，勇士$n。"
G["It is an honor to work alongside Grand Apothecary Putress. His work has saved the world from the Lich King's plague and has given new hope to our cause."]="能成为大药剂师普特雷斯的助手是我的荣幸。他的研究工作让整个世界摆脱了巫妖王的阴影，令我们的事业有了新的希望。"
G["It is an opportunity to mock the fearsome - to gaze boldly into the grim unknown and laugh!"]="我们要做的是嘲笑一切恐怖的存在，大胆瞪视残酷的未知，并放声大笑！"
G["It is as they say: Like father, like son. You are as weak of will as Tirion... perhaps more so. I can only hope my assassins finally succeeded in ending his pitiful life."]="就像他们说的：有其父必有其子。你就跟提里奥一样软弱……或许比他更软弱。我只希望我派出的刺客能顺利结束他令人同情的一生。"
G["It is as though my memories are shrouded in mist. I cannot even recall what became of my brother. Is this how you mean that he is in danger?"]="我的记忆似乎被一层迷雾笼罩了。我甚至不记得我的兄弟后来出了什么事。这就是你所说的危险吗？"
G["It is bad fortune to travel in boat without exploding barrels aboard."]="不带炸药桶就出海，真是倒霉。"
G["It is because of you this village has found its strength again!"]="是你帮这村庄找回了力量！"
G["It is beeping and flashing wildly.  Dig here!"]="这东西开始“哔哔”地狂叫，还在不停地闪耀着。就在这里挖！"
G["It is beeping loudly, suggesting that you are only a few paces away."]="它发出了响亮的“哔哔”声，你距离目标应该只有几步之遥了。"
G["It is beeping quietly every 5 seconds or so."]="它每5秒钟发出一次低微的“哔哔”声。"
G["It is beeping regularly, about once a second."]="它正在发出规律的“哔哔”声，大约每秒钟一次。"
G["It is beeping regularly, about once every two seconds."]="它正在发出规律的“哔哔”声，大约每两秒钟一次。"
G["It is beeping very faintly.  You are still quite far away."]="它发出的“哔哔”声很微弱。你距离目标还很远。"
G["It is being maintained by the will of a powerful demon...Mannoroth."]="有一个强大的恶魔在用自己的意志保护着它——是玛诺洛斯。"
G["It is best that we split up now, in case they send more after us. Hopefully one of us will make it back to Garrosh. Farewell, stranger."]="Lo mejor es que nos separemos ahora, por si envían más a por nosotros. Con un poco de suerte, uno de nosotros conseguirá volver a Garrosh. Adiós, $gextranjero:extranjera;."
G["It is better to face your challenges, than to run from them."]="应该直面挑战，而不是消极逃避。"
G["It is but a small token of my appreciation. My thanks to you."]="这一点微小的礼物完全无法表达我的感激之情。谢谢你！"
G["It is certainly a nice day outside!"]="今天外头肯定是个好天气！"
G["It is chaos out there, $p! The siege has begun but our heavy explosives never made it to the wall."]="现在外面一片混乱，$p！攻击已经开始，可是重型炸药还没有到位。"
G["It is clear that you are not here to bring your war to these lands. There is a darkness hidden here in Pandaria - this you have seen for yourself!"]="你显然不是要将战争带到这儿来。在潘达利亚潜藏着黑暗——你已经亲眼见到了！"
G["It is clear to me that these mogu deserve more investigation. Our work here is done for today, $n. If we have need of you, we will contact you at Domination Point."]="显然，这些魔古族值得我们进一步研究。今天我们这里的工作已经结束了，$n。如果我们还需要你，会到统御岗哨跟你联络的。"
G["It is complete."]="结束了。"
G["It is crucial that we bring all of the three remaining spirits back safely. I am too old to do this myself, and for all their strengths, both Aysa and Ji are single-minded in their ideals.\n\nYou possess all the qualities of a hero, and a balance that they do not. It is you that must do this."]="我们必须得把剩下三个灵魂安全带回来。我年事已高，力不从心，而考虑到他们的力量，艾莎和季又太过固执。\n\n你具备英雄应有的一切品质，以及他们所欠缺的平衡。必须由你完成这项任务。"
G["It is dangerous here, master. But I shall help stand guard."]="主人，这里很危险。但我要去帮你站岗放哨。"
G["It is days like this I miss using fel magic. Sure it was evil, but it got the job done."]="每当这种时候，我都会怀念以前使用邪法的光景。它虽然很邪恶，但很管用。"
G["It is decided, then.  We will unite all Gilneans and drive the Forsaken from our lands."]="那么就这样决定。我们将团结全部吉尔尼斯人，将被遗忘者从我们的国土上赶走。"
G["It is decided. The Vale of Eternal Blossoms shall remain open. The transgressions of the outsiders have been great... but I see in them the capability to right what has been wronged."]="我决定了，锦绣谷将继续对外来者开放。他们确实犯下了很大的罪孽……但是，我从他们身上看到了纠正错误的能力。"
G["It is decimating our armies!"]="兵力骤减，部队即将崩溃！"
G["It is difficult to know who to trust.  You are new here... relatively unknown.  That works in your favor in this case."]="很难分辨谁能够信任。你刚到此地不久……对此一无所知。也许你能胜任这次调查。"
G["It is difficult to say. His injuries are grievous. Even though he is a powerful druid, it will take time and patience to restore him back to full health."]="还很难说，他的伤很重。虽然他是位强大的德鲁伊，但我们还需要耐心地等待他彻底恢复。"
G["It is discouraging that Lei Shen has found so many allies to flock to his throne so soon after his return. We should have done a better job to eliminate them during his absence."]="雷神归来才没多久，就在麾下聚集起了这么多盟友，这可真叫人沮丧。我们得趁他不在时多消灭一些。"
G["It is done!"]="死吧！"
G["It is done!  We are finished."]="完成了！仪式结束了！"
G["It is done! Our power now resides within the Dragon Soul! Our fate lies with you, Earth-Warder!"]="完成了！我们的力量灌注到了巨龙之魂里！我们的命运就交给你了，大地守护者！"
G["It is done! The Ice Lord has arrived! Bow to the might of the Horde, fools!"]="结束了！冰雪之王来了！向部落的力量敬礼，蠢货！"
G["It is done, but we should not linger here. Meet me back on the eastern edge of the camp."]="完成了，此地不宜久留。回去之后到营地东边来找我。"
G["It is done, dragon. Lead the way."]="完成了。你来带路吧。"
G["It is done, friend. To my knowledge, I am the only black dragon who remains."]="都结束了，朋友。据我所知，我是这个世界上仅存的黑龙了。"
G["It is done, little one. Now, we must focus our efforts on preventing such destruction from claiming any more victims."]="Está hecho, $gpequeño:pequeña;. Ahora debemos centrar nuestros esfuerzos en evitar que tal destrucción se lleve más víctimas."
G["It is done, master."]="结束了，主人。"
G["It is done, then. Yet...how many of these machines are hidden beneath the earth? How much do we not know about the dark secrets of the mogu?"]="那就结束了。可是……地下藏有多少这种机器？我们对魔古族的黑暗秘密又知道多少？"
G["It is done."]="完成了。"
G["It is done.  $n, your armor is ready."]="完成了。$n，你的护甲准备好了。"
G["It is done.  I have your weapon, $n."]="你的武器做好了，$n。"
G["It is done.  Leave me here, then, while I wrestle with Rakh'likh in the next world.  Your job here is done, heroes."]="结束了。把我留在这儿吧，我会和拉瑟莱克在地狱里继续交战。你们的任务已经完成了，英雄们。"
G["It is done.  Serve the Light well."]="好了。好好为圣光效劳。"
G["It is done. All have given that which must be given. I now seal the Dragon Soul forever."]="完成了。大家都付出了自己该付出的。现在，我将永远封印巨龙之魂。"
G["It is done. Kypari Zar... cries out in unbearable agony."]="完成了。凯帕圣树·扎尔……因不堪忍受的痛苦而呻吟着。"
G["It is done. Run back to your masters. Run back to Har'koa. Tell her that I am coming!"]="好了。滚回你的主人身边吧。告诉哈克娅，我来了！"
G["It is done. Scour the place clean. Leave them nothing to return to!"]="结束了。把这个地方彻底摧毁。不要留下任何东西！"
G["It is done. The Dragon Soul is safely within the clutch of the dragonflights."]="成功了。巨龙之魂已经被安全送到巨龙军团手中了。"
G["It is done. The spirit is bound with you and you will carry it with you anytime you are in Darkshore. May you serve nature well."]="结束了。我们还需要再等待一段时间，这个祝福才能生根发芽。但只要你在黑海岸，随时都能接受这一祝福。愿你继续为自然贡献力量。"
G["It is done. You did it, $p!"]="完成了。你做到了，$p！"
G["It is done. You may now open the focusing iris."]="好啦。现在，你可以打开聚焦之虹了。"
G["It is done..."]="完成了……"
G["It is done; at last the Destroyer has met his end. Now, we can begin to heal our world."]="结束了；灭世者终于走向了灭亡。现在，我们将开始治疗这个世界。"
G["It is dying! The second part of the Cipher of Damnation is ours. I..."]="它快死了！诅咒密码的第二部分是我们的。我……"
G["It is dying. It is dying. It is dying."]="它快死了。它快死了。它快死了。"
G["It is exactly as I expected, soldier. They know we watch them closely."]="和我猜想的完全一样，士兵。他们知道我们在监视。"
G["It is filled with Titan magic, the very language of creation..."]="它充满了泰坦的魔力，那是创造的语言——"
G["It is finished then!"]="终于结束了！"
G["It is finished."]="结束了。"
G["It is finished. (The fate of all.)"]="都结束了。（万物的命运。）"
G["It is finished. You are beaten."]="结束了。你被打败了。"
G["It is fitting that I be the one to destroy the pet of the Klaxxi!"]="由我动手消灭卡拉克西的宠物再合适不过了！"
G["It is foolish to trust a stranger's every word, but it is also foolish to deny those who might be friends."]="无条件相信陌生人的话是愚蠢的，但拒绝潜在的朋友也是愚蠢的。"
G["It is for them, or rather for what they represent, that we fight.\n\nOutside these walls, these people's lives are forfeit.  The world as they know it... as we all know it, is threatened by Kael'thas, Illidan and the Burning Legion.\n\nWithin these walls you will find the few that are willing to fight for that world."]="我们是为了他们而战斗，更确切地说，说为了他们所憧憬的生活而战斗。\n\n在这城墙之外的人们已经丧失了和平生活的权利。世界就像他们知道的那样……就像我们所有人知道的那样，被凯尔萨斯、伊利丹和燃烧军团所威胁着。\n\n而在这城墙之内，你会找到一些同样希望来为此而战的朋友。"
G["It is for you."]="这一击是给你的。"
G["It is found on the lowest section of Thunder Bluff.  Search near the bank.  It is not far from there."]="你可以在雷霆崖的最低处寻找，就在离银行不远的地方。"
G["It is from this throne that I issue the command of Hellscream. His word is life and his word is death."]="我负责传达地狱咆哮的命令。他的指令都是生死攸关的决策。"
G["It is funny, I think my father is happier now that I have returned than he ever was before!\n\nIt seems that trying times have reminded him to appreciate simplicity."]="太有趣了，我想我爸爸现在比较高兴，因为我带回比他更多的东西！\n\n看上去，艰难的时刻提醒他要崇尚简洁。"
G["It is gone. I don't remember any of it. Oh! None of them remember. The irony!"]="结束了。我全都忘了。噢！他们也不记得了。真讽刺！"
G["It is good of us to help the survivors here, but we must not lose sight of our original mission."]="能帮助幸存者当然是好事，可我们也不能忘记自己原本的任务。"
G["It is good of you to ask, $c, but we already have all of the baked salmon that we'll need for the war. Perhaps you would be kind enough to check with the other collectors here; they are sure to have something that they could use your help with."]="谢谢你的关心，$c，但是我们已经集齐战争所需的烤鲑鱼了。或许你可以跟其他收集者谈谈，他们也许会需要你的帮助。"
G["It is good that I have been allowed to continue my pursuits here.  I do not wish to overstay my welcome, at any rate.  It would be a great dishonor if I brought any trouble to our capital."]="我很高兴能在这里继续我的追求。但我也不想在这里停留得过久。要是给我们的主城带来了麻烦，那我就太可耻了。"
G["It is good that you have come my child.  The Light's protection has worn thin on you."]="你能来真是太好啦，我的孩子。圣光对你的眷顾正在消退。"
G["It is good that you wish to help, $c. Unfortunately I have collected up all of the peacebloom that we feel we'll need for the war effort. Maybe you could ask around; I'm sure that there are likely to be others here that still need your aid in gathering other things."]="你愿意帮忙，我很高兴，$c。但是我已经收集到足够数量的宁神花了。或许你可以四下问问；我想这儿会有其他人需要你帮忙收集战争物资的。"
G["It is good that you wish to honor your kills by putting their bodies to use.  Find Thuwd inside the Kodohide Leatherworks in the middle of The Drag."]="你希望利用这些尸体以表示对它们的尊敬，这很好。去暗巷区中心的 科多兽皮工店找苏尔德吧。"
G["It is good to enjoy the fruits of the earth, but not to excess."]="享受美味的水果是件开心的事情，但不要吃太多。"
G["It is good to get out of Shattrath every now and then."]="能时不时从沙塔斯出来逛逛还真不错。"
G["It is good to have you back, Hamuul. Let us leave this place."]="欢迎回来，哈缪尔。我们离开这个地方吧。"
G["It is good to meet you, $n."]="Hola, me alegro de verte."
G["It is good to see Niuzao healthy and strong."]="我很高兴看到砮皂依然健壮。"
G["It is good to see a friend of the Aldor around these remote parts.  I fear I cannot stand for much more of these elves' insolent chatter."]="很高兴能在这个偏远的地方看到奥尔多的朋友。我恐怕自己无法再忍受这些精灵傲慢的话语了。"
G["It is good to see another explorer! When some people discover a new land, they immediately seek out the fortresses and temples.\n\nNot me.\n\nTo get the measure of a people, you need to get your feet dirty. Come, walk the land with me! Let us see what these mainland pandaren truly value.\n\nIt is the Wanderer's Way."]="能见到另一位探险者真是太好了！当某些人发现一片新土地时，他们总会立刻动身前往堡垒和寺院。\n\n我跟他们可不一样。\n\n要想深入了解一个地方的人，你就必须脚踏实地。来吧，随我四处逛逛！让我们看看这些陆地熊猫人真正重视的是什么。\n\n这才是云游者之道。"
G["It is good to see everyone in such high spirits."]="看到大家精神如此饱满，真是太好了。"
G["It is good to see others who fight the Scourge in Stratholme, for it is here they are strongest.\n\nGreetings.  I am Aurius.  I was once a paladin of the Silver Hand, but like others whose faith wavered... I fell from grace.  The Scourge seduced me and nearly transformed me into a death knight!\n\nFinally sensing my peril, I fled to this chapel.  It is a sacred place, where the first paladin, Uther the Lightbringer, was ordained into the order of the Silver Hand."]="Me alegra ver a otros que combaten la Plaga en Stratholme, porque es aquí donde son más fuertes.\n\nSaludos. Soy Aurius. Una vez fui paladín de la Mano de Plata, pero como otros que flaquearon en su fe... caí en desgracia. ¡La Plaga me sedujo y casi me transformó en un jinete de la muerte!\n\nPor último, y sintiendo los peligros que me amenazaban, me refugié en esta capilla. Es un lugar sagrado donde el primer paladín, Uther el Iluminado, fue ordenado miembro de la Orden de la Mano Plata."
G["It is good to see the Burning Blade is taking over where the Shadow Council once failed."]="很高兴看到火刃接管了那些暗影议会无力接管的地方。"
G["It is good to see you again, $C $n.  Dornaa has been asking about you."]="很高兴再次见到你，$c$n。多尔南一直在问起你。"
G["It is good to see you again, $C $n.  Salandria has been asking about you."]="很高兴再次见到你，$c$n。萨兰蒂亚一直在问起你。"
G["It is good to see you again, $n."]="很高兴再次见到你，$n。"
G["It is good to see you again, $n. How could I ever forget the $g man : woman; who saved my sister's life?"]="Me alegro de volver a verte, $n. ¿Cómo podría olvidar a la persona que salvó la vida de mi hermana?"
G["It is good to see you again, $n. How have you fared?"]="很高兴再次见到你，$n。你最近怎么样？"
G["It is good to see you again, $n. Perhaps once things have settled down, I can talk to you about the priceless treasure that we have lost..."]="很高兴能再次见到你，$n。也许当事情都解决了之后，我可以告诉你有关那些我们丢失的无价之宝的事情……"
G["It is good to see you again, $n. Would you like me to take you to the master's lair?"]="很高兴再次见到你，$n。想让我带你去主人的巢穴吗？"
G["It is good to see you again, Alexstrasza. I have been busy in my absence."]="重逢真令我高兴，阿莱克斯塔萨。分开之后，我可是一直很忙。"
G["It is good to see you again, Doctor $n. I have been following your progress and I dare say that it is time you learned some of the more advanced bandaging techniques.\n\nReturn to me from time to time, as your skill advances, and I shall teach you all that I know."]="Me alegra verte de nuevo, doctor $n. He estado siguiendo tu progreso y, debo decir, que ya es hora de que aprendas algunas técnicas de vendaje más avanzadas.\n\nVen a verme de vez en cuando, según vayas progresando, y te enseñaré todo lo que sé."
G["It is good to see you again, friend."]="很高兴再次见到你，朋友。"
G["It is good to see you alive and well, $n!"]="我很高兴看到你还健康地活着，$n！"
G["It is good to see you among us again, $n."]="很高兴再次见到你，$n。"
G["It is good to see you here, child."]="很高兴在这里见到你，孩子。"
G["It is good to see you, my friend. So much is transpiring it is hard for a Lorewalker like myself to keep up. I have seen many things through my dream brew, but we will need a hero such as yourself to help write this next chapter of our history."]="Me alegro de verte. Están sucediendo tantas cosas que a un eremita como yo le cuesta seguir el ritmo. He visto muchas cosas mediante mi brebaje de ensueño, pero necesitaremos a $gun héroe:una heroína; como tú para escribir el siguiente capítulo de nuestra historia."
G["It is great to see you again, $n."]="Estoy encantado de volver a verte."
G["It is great to see you again, my friend. It seems like only yesturday we saved the city of Stoneplow from the mantid swarms."]="很高兴再次见到你，朋友。我们帮助石犁村摆脱螳螂妖威胁的经历还历历在目呢，仿佛就发生在昨天。"
G["It is he who commands the sons of iron in their war against us."]="他指挥钢铁的子嗣，对我们发动了战争。"
G["It is heartening to see you here, Moira. You have my thanks."]="你的到来真令人振奋，茉艾拉。谢谢你。"
G["It is here that Gul'dan severed the tie between orcs and the elemental spirits. His unquenchable thirst for power could not be satiated with the complete annihilation of the draenei. He had to also destroy Draenor, razing the land and siphoning all of its energies for use in his war.\n\nNow all that is left are remnants of his madness.\n\nLook to the altar, $r - the land is forever haunted..."]="就是在这里，古尔丹切断了兽人们和元素之灵间的联系。将德莱尼人全部消灭已经不能满足他对无尽力量的渴望。为了他的战争，他要把德拉诺也夷为平地，吸取它的所有能量。\n\n现在这里所留下的一切都只是他那疯狂过后的痕迹。\n\n看那祭坛，$r——这块大地将永远死气沉沉……"
end)(AscensionCN.GossipEN2ES)
;(function(G)
G["It is here the chosen realize their destiny. (One with eternity). And it is here that you will realize yours.(End of the flesh. End of the flesh)!"]="天选者在此洞悉到他们的宿命。（永生不灭。）而你们也将在此直面你们的宿命。（终结血肉，终结血肉！）"
G["It is here, surrounded by the heroes and patriots of Gilneas where he belongs."]="他属于这里，这片被吉尔尼斯的英雄和爱国者所环绕的土地。"
G["It is history... A history of Silithus... of Ahn'Qiraj... of Titans and Old Gods... I read from the prophecy of C'Thun as written by the Qiraji Prophet Skeram. A prophecy that portends a cataclysm..."]="这就是历史……希利苏斯的历史……安其拉的历史……泰坦和上古之神的历史……我在由其拉虫人的先知斯克拉姆撰写的有关克苏恩的预言中读到过这些历史。那预言预示着一场大灾难……"
G["It is hopeless. Cutting one down results in two new growths."]="我感到绝望。杀死一个，还会出现更多。"
G["It is hopeless... I've done all I can."]="没有希望了……我尽了我的全力。"
G["It is if I'm not the one that's going to be sent in to test it... Otherwise, no."]="如果不派我去测试它的话就行……否则，不。"
G["It is imperative that we understand the mogu's history. Our best chance at a successful offensive will come from knowledge of our enemy."]="我们必须要了解魔古族的历史。知己知彼，才能百战不殆。"
G["It is important for the trainees to learn the sting of defeat, that they might appreciate the value of victory."]="只有让受训者尝到了失败的滋味，他们才会明白胜利的意义。"
G["It is important to throw the spear just before slaying the beast. Not a moment too soon! Not a moment too late!"]="你得在杀死那头野兽前掷出长矛，这很重要。不能太早，也不能太晚！"
G["It is in the forest where your feet do not walk.  Continue along the mountains and you will find it."]="它就在你从未踏足过的森林中。沿着山脉走，你就能找到它。"
G["It is in the universe's best interest to re-originate this planet should my analysis find systemic corruption. Do not interfere."]="如果我的分析结果表明确实存在系统级的污染，对这颗行星进行结构重组无疑是最妥当的方案。不要插手。"
G["It is in the western portion Trade District, just north of the fountain."]="它就在贸易区靠西的部分，喷泉的北边。"
G["It is in this moment, friends, that we should ask ourselves.  What would the Old Gods want us to do?"]="就在这一刻，朋友，我们应该问问自己。上古之神希望我们做什么？"
G["It is indeed Quel'Delar. I had not thought I'd live to see the day when Thalorien Dawnseeker's legendary sword would be restored to us."]="这的确是奎尔德拉。传说中萨洛瑞安·寻晨者的宝剑又回到我们的手里了，我从没想过我会活着见到这一天。"
G["It is integral to the assimilation of this data that it is understood that the Creators wanted to synthesize a race that would long be an integral part of this world's development cycle after they had departed.  This race would be instrumental in fulfilling the Creators' long-term development objectives for Azeroth.  \n\nAs an ancillary note, the nomenclature \"Earthen\" was deemed apropos for the new race by the Creators, based on the Earthen's composition."]="Para asimilar esta información, es preciso comprender que los Creadores querían sintetizar una raza que, tras su partida, constituyera por mucho tiempo una parte integral del ciclo de desarrollo de este mundo. Esta raza constituiría un instrumento para alcanzar los objetivos de desarrollo a largo plazo que los Creadores tenían en relación con Azeroth. \n\nCabría añadir que la denominación \"terráneo\" fue considerada adecuada por los Creadores, ya que hacía referencia a su composición."
G["It is me again. It is good to see you, $n.\n\nShall we begin?"]="又是我。很高兴见到你，$n。\n\n我们开始吧？"
G["It is my charge to watch over these eggs. I will see you burn before any harm comes to them!"]="我的职责是保护这些龙卵。在伤害到它们之前，你们就会被我的龙息烧成灰烬！"
G["It is my dream to one day serve under your command, $G Master:Mistress; $n. That is, should you ever deem me worthy of such things..."]="能为你服务是我的梦想，$g主人:女主人;$n。换句话说，你认为我值得得到这些东西吗……"
G["It is my duty and honor to die for the Abyssal Council!"]="为深渊议会而死是我的职责和荣耀！"
G["It is my fervent hope that we will be able to bring the Light to those places in Ashenvale where it has been forsaken."]="我热切希望我们可以把圣光带到灰谷中的那些被遗忘的地方。"
G["It is my honor to provide for adventurers, for they are heroes in the making."]="为冒险家服务是我的荣幸，因为他们即将成为英雄。"
G["It is my role to test our young initiates on the ways of the hunt.\n\nAnd that hasn't changed. Today, the quilboar are our prey."]="我的责任是测试我们年轻的学徒对于狩猎技艺的掌握程度。\n\n这就是我今天要做的。而那些野猪人就是我们的猎物。"
G["It is my time, Avuun. Nobody is to blame..."]="该我了，阿弗恩。没有人应受责备……"
G["It is my understanding that the people of the Alliance celebrate this Winter Veil in Ironforge."]="据我所知，联盟的人民在铁炉堡庆祝这个冬幕节。"
G["It is my warchief, Greatmother. The leader of my people. From my world. He... He is the son of Durotan. He is your grandchild."]="我们那个世界的酋长，我的同胞的领袖。他……他是杜隆坦的儿子。他是你的孙子。"
G["It is nice to see some concerned individuals travelling on the roads these days.  My husband would have liked you.  We always wanted children."]="这年头还能有人关心赶路的单身旅客可真不容易。我丈夫一定会很喜欢你的。我们一直都想要几个孩子。"
G["It is no easy task to protect the Horde's lumber gathering efforts here in Ashenvale, but we have never shied from battle!  The night elves and their allies will fall!"]="要保护部落在灰谷的木材收集工作并不容易，但是我们从不畏惧战斗！暗夜精灵和他们的盟友必将失败！"
G["It is no light endeavor upon which you embark $n.  To get to Warsong Gulch you will want to speak to Aethalas, the Battlemaster of the Silverwing Sentinels.  She will guide your way.  Blessings of the Goddess be with you!"]="你要做的事情需要很大的勇气，$n。要进入战歌峡谷，你就得跟银翼哨兵的军官艾萨拉斯谈谈。她会为你指引方向的。愿女神的祝福与你同在！"
G["It is no surprise that the people of this land hold a great festival of the moon. I should very much like to go to Moonglade to attend it."]="这个世界的人民举行隆重的月亮庆典一点也不奇怪。我非常想去月光林地参加那个庆典。"
G["It is no use, the power of the Dragon Soul is too great. I cannot wield it safely; the raging forces contained within it may be the doom of us all."]="这没有用，巨龙之魂的力量太强大了。我不能安全地使用它，这个神器里的混乱力量也许会毁掉我们所有的人。"
G["It is no use, the power of the Soul is too great. I cannot wield it safely; the raging forces within it may be the doom of us all."]="这没有用，巨龙之魂的力量太强大了。我不能安全地使用它，这个神器里的混乱力量也许会毁掉我们所有的人。"
G["It is no use.  My magic is ineffective on these creatures."]="这没有用。我的魔法对这些怪物是无效的。"
G["It is none of your concern, maggot."]="这和你没关系，废物。"
G["It is not for us to judge these atrocities. Ivus will pass judgement once he arrives."]="让伊弗斯来裁决这些暴行吧。"
G["It is not her name I am interested in. It is her. She is the kindest, nicest, prettiest person I have ever met."]="我感兴趣的不是她的名字，而是她的人。她是我见过的最善良、最温柔、最美丽的人。"
G["It is not in our nature to shirk from danger. We will dive gladly into darkness if it means protecting our loved ones."]="逃避危险绝非我们的本性。为了保护我们所爱的人，我们会毫不犹豫地闯入黑暗之中。"
G["It is not meant for you! Get away from here!"]="这不是给你的！滚出这里！"
G["It is not much, but I will lend you what little I have. May it help you in this final hour."]="虽然我能做的不多，但我会尽全力帮你。但愿能在最后关头帮上忙。"
G["It is not my decision whether you are to be trusted by my people. Until our mayor decides otherwise, I consider you a friend."]="Si mi gente confía en ti o no no es decisión mía. A no ser que el alcalde diga lo contrario, yo te considero $gamigo nuestro:amiga nuestra;."
G["It is not my intention to initiate legislation against you."]="我无意针对你创立法规。"
G["It is not our desire to get wrapped up in your bloodshed. Now have your men lower their weapons, or you will face TWO enemies on this continent."]="我们才不想卷入这场血腥杀戮。现在，请让你的人放下武器，否则你在这里就要面对两拨敌人了。"
G["It is not our way, nor would it be possible. Nefarian is guarded by ancient wards, as old as the Aspects themselves. It is what prevents me from entering the inner sanctum of this citadel. The dark magic prevents any of the other flight to enter without being ordained... unless."]="这不是我们做事的方法，也不可能是。奈法利安受到远古结界的保护，这些结界与守护巨龙本身一样古老。正是它们阻止我进入这座要塞的内部。除非……除非得到授权，否则黑暗魔法会永远把我们挡在外面。"
G["It is not safe out here, $n.  Seek shelter before it's too late."]="这里并不安全，$n。赶快去找避难所。"
G["It is not simply a beautification measure, but also a morale booster. It demonstrates to our people that we have a great deal of power at our fingertips, and with it... we can do nearly anything."]="这不只是简单的美化措施，同样也可以振奋士气。它向我们的人民证明了我们拥有着多么巨大的力量，凭借这种力量……我们可以去做任何事。"
G["It is not surprising that a blood elf's potential for power as a demon hunter is so high.  After all, the sin'dorei do not have the natural aversion to demonic magic that night elves do.\n\nHowever, I do not expect many to succeed.  Most of them, Varedis included, pursue power for its own sake.  That power will consume them, for they are not driven by the pure fire that burns inside a true demon hunter's heart."]="对于血精灵拥有着可以掌握恶魔猎手力量的天赋，我一点都不感到吃惊。毕竟，辛多雷并不像暗夜精灵那样天生讨厌恶魔法。\n\n然而，我并不希望太多的血精灵可以掌握这种力量。大部分人，包括瓦雷迪斯，都把追逐力量作为一种乐趣。但那力量会吞噬他们，因为驱动他们的并不是真正的恶魔猎手心中燃烧的那团纯焰。"
G["It is not the fighters I watch; that is the Combat Masters' task.\nMy concern is for the two neophytes whose duty it is to heal them. So far, my students are doing well."]="No observo a los luchadores, eso es trabajo de los maestros de combate.\n\nMi responsabilidad son los dos neófitos cuyo trabajo es sanarlos. Por el momento, mis estudiantes lo están haciendo bien."
G["It is not the time to turn against one another, $n."]="现在不是自相残杀的时候，$n。"
G["It is not too late to save yourselves from the coming catastrophe!"]="想要从即将到来的劫难中获得拯救，现在还不晚！"
G["It is not too late, Garrosh. Lay down the mantle of Warchief. We can end this here, now, with no more bloodshed."]="现在还不迟，加尔鲁什。卸下酋长的包袱吧。我们可以就此结束这场流血冲突。"
G["It is not worth answering."]="这问题根本不值得回答。"
G["It is not yet your time, champion. Rise! Rise and fight once more!"]="Aún no es tu momento, $gcampeón:campeona;. ¡Levántate! ¡Levántate y lucha una vez más!"
G["It is not yet your time. I shall aid your journey back to the realm of the living... for a price."]="现在还不是让你长眠的时候。我会帮你起死回生……但你也要为此付出一些代价。"
G["It is nothing. I am fine."]="没什么。我很好。"
G["It is now as it should be, shaman. You have done well."]="就应该是现在这样，萨满祭司。你干得不错。"
G["It is now flashing brightly.  You're very close!"]="现在它发出了亮光。你已经很靠近了！"
G["It is one of the synthesis matrices the Creators use when seeding a world.  Each synthesis matrix is used to achieve the Creators' goals.  For Azeroth, a subterranean being matrix was modified to create a being with increased durability with an affinity for deep region shaping; the Earthen are the product of this modification.\n\nAfter the Earthen had been put into service for the Creators, unforeseen anomalies were discovered that affected their synthesis matrix due to high-stress environments."]="它是造物者在开创世界的时候创建的最早的一个物种。造物者所创建的每种生物都肩负了一定的使命。对于艾泽拉斯来说，必须改造原有的标准地下生物构造，使其适应地下深处的生活，土灵就是这种改造的产品。\n\n在土灵被创造出来之后，由于巨大的环境压力，它们出现了许多事先无法预见的变化。"
G["It is our duty to honor the sacred days of our allies, however strange."]="就算感觉陌生与奇怪，我们也有义务尊重盟友们的神圣节日。"
G["It is our duty to protect these taunka and provide them with what little comfort we can offer."]="我们必须保护这些牦牛人，并尽可能地安慰他们。"
G["It is our responsibility to keep the muck fresh. The filth keeps us safe. It keeps our enemies away."]="我们的责任就是保持污泥的新鲜。污秽保护了我们的安全。它们能赶走敌人。"
G["It is our sacred duty to monitor and imprison the Sha. To defeat it wherever it darkens the hearts of our people."]="监视并禁锢煞魔是我们神圣的责任。不管它在哪里玷污人们的心灵，我们都要打败它。"
G["It is our sacred duty. The pact was sealed, the bargain made..."]="这是我们神圣的职责。契约已经缔造，交易已经达成……"
G["It is over! Finished!"]="结束了！"
G["It is over! Withdraw! We have failed...."]="完了！撤退！我们失败了……"
G["It is over, your search is done. Let fate choose now, the righteous one."]="湮远而艰辛的探索到此为止，真正的正义者将由命运择示。"
G["It is overwhelming... cannot fight..."]="势不可挡……难以抵抗……"
G["It is pointless to resist."]="抵抗是没有意义的。"
G["It is possible for one, not of dragon kind, to obtain the Adorned Seal of Ascension and pass through the protected barrier. While possession of such an item would surely destroy me, perhaps you could utilize it and lower the barrier."]="除龙族之外的任何人都可能获得晋升徽印并通过那层保护屏障，但是这样的东西肯定会要了我的性命，或许你能使用它，想办法破除屏障。"
G["It is power, imbecile.\n\n<Mataus's eyes darken.>\n\nThese fools send idiots like you into Naxxramas to retrieve desecrated armor so that they may purify it and restore the pieces to their former glory.\n\n<Mataus spits.>\n\nJust the thought of such utter stupidity brings the bile up to my throat.\n\nI too seek that armor, but in its most foul and desecrated form."]="那就是力量的化身，你这白痴。\n\n<玛塔乌斯的眼神变得黑暗了。>\n\n这帮白痴把你这样更白的白痴送进纳克萨玛斯里去回收那些被亵渎的护甲碎片，然后净化，重新附魔，来恢复以前的荣光。\n\n<玛塔乌斯不屑地吐了一下口水。>\n\n光是想到这群超级白痴就能让我感到不舒服。\n\n我也在寻找这些护甲碎片，不过我会把它进一步加工成为最邪恶的形态。"
G["It is quiet here today. Good."]="今天这里很安静，真好。"
G["It is regrettable that, among our many enemies in Hellfire Peninsula, the orcs of Hellfire Citadel stand among them.\n\nBut... who better to challenge and hone the Horde... than orcs?"]="我们在地狱火半岛的敌人非常多，遗憾的是，地狱火堡垒的兽人便是其中之一。\n\n但是……没有谁比这些兽人更适合用来历练部落的新兵了。"
G["It is regrettable, but necessary."]="很遗憾，我们必须战斗。"
G["It is responsible for corrupting these forests."]="正是它腐蚀了这片森林。"
G["It is rude to speak to jinyu of a higher rank than yourself."]="和比自己地位高的锦鱼人搭讪是粗鲁的行为。"
G["It is sad to see what has happened to this land.  The Cenarion Expedition will do what it can to understand and heal the damage that has been done."]="我很伤心地看着在这片大地上发生的一切。塞纳里奥远征队会尽全力了解和治愈那些创伤。"
G["It is said that \"Wisdom lights the path.\"\n\n...But wisdom never kept me from stubbing my toe at night."]="Se dice que \"La sabiduría ilumina el camino\".\n\n... Pues la sabiduría nunca me ha ayudado a no darme golpes en el pie por las noches."
G["It is said that Heigan has rigged the very walls and floors of Naxxramas itself with a vast array of traps, which he can trigger at will."]="据说希尔盖对纳克萨玛斯的墙壁和地板进行了改造，设置了大量可以随意触发的可控陷阱。"
G["It is said that Kel'Thuzad seeks the legendary Atiesh, greatstaff of the Guardian.\n\nYes, the very staff once held by Medivh."]="听说克尔苏加德正在研究传说中的埃提耶什，守护者的传说之杖。\n\n是的，就是那件曾属于麦迪文的神奇法杖。"
G["It is said that after the revolution, the Red Crane of Hope placed the rainbow in the sky, so that pandaren would know not to fear the storms any longer."]="据说在熊猫人发动起义之后，希望的化身朱鹤在天空挂上了彩虹，好让熊猫人不再害怕风暴。"
G["It is said that all the trees in the vale blossomed as he entered, and continue to blossom to this day."]="据说，当时山谷中所有的林木都花开满枝，群芳争艳，一直盛开到今天。"
G["It is said that he tore out the very heart of the mogu God. And from that hateful act he gained power over wind and storm."]="据说他挖出了魔古之神的心脏。这骇人听闻的暴行令野心勃勃的雷神获得了风暴的力量。"
G["It is said that the Thunder King's armies are vast and powerful. Do you think that the battle will ever reach us here?"]="据说雷电之王的军队庞大且强悍。你觉得战火会波及到这里吗？"
G["It is said that those who are blessed by the spirits of Auchindoun possess the ability to capture powerful souls in the form of Spirit Shards. I have come across a few of these Spirit Shards throughout my travels but have yet to unlock their secrets. \nThe only thing I have been able to discern is that they seem to originate from the depths of Auchindoun itself. If you happen to come across any of these Spirit Shards I'm sure I could make it worth your while to allow me to take them off your hands..."]="Se dice que aquellos bendecidos por los espíritus de Auchindoun poseen la habilidad de capturar almas poderosas en forma de fragmentos de espíritus. Me he cruzado con algunos de estos fragmentos de espíritus en mis viajes, pero todavía debo desvelar sus secretos. \n\nLo único que he podido percibir es que parecen originarse en las profundidades de la misma Auchindoun. Si por casualidad te cruzas con alguno de estos fragmentos de espíritus, estoy seguro de que te valdría la pena permitirme que te los quite de las manos..."
G["It is said that, before she joined our monastery, Myang defeated one hundred ravaging hozen in a single melee."]="传言她在进入禅院之前是位以一敌百的高手——她一口气收拾了一百只狂暴的猢狲。"
G["It is said the God King Rastakhan, ruler of the Zandalari, lords over his mighty kingdom from a throne carved of solid gold."]="据说赞达拉的统治者，神王拉斯塔哈在黄金宝座上统治着自己强大的帝国。"
G["It is said, \"Turn your face towards the sun, and the shadows will fall behind you.\"\n\nI hope you find many bright days ahead of you, $n!"]="Se dice: \"Mira hacia el sol y las sombras caerán tras de ti\".\n\n¡Espero que te aguarden muchos días luminosos, $n!"
G["It is settled. I command the Might of Kalimdor. Be certain that your soldiers understand and accept this as fact. Bloodshed is already plentiful. Let there be none between our factions."]="我是卡利姆多联军的统帅。让你的士兵明白这一点，并接受这个事实。杀戮已经非常沉重了，在这个时候，我们两个阵营之间最好不要再出现什么事端。"
G["It is shameful that we sin'dorei have lost so much of what we used to call home.  It shall not be long before we regain our strength and retake our southern lands back from the Scourge!"]="真让人感到羞耻，我们辛多雷在这个曾经被我们称为家的地方失去了很多东西。很快，我们就将重新获得力量，并把我们南方的领土从天灾手里夺回来。"
G["It is so energy-dense as to combust at the slightest provocation."]="这种燃料中蕴含着极为强大的能量，只要一点刺激，就有可能发生爆燃。"
G["It is so good to see you, $g brother : sister;!  This place gives me the creeps.  While you're here, be sure to avail yourself of the many opportunities that these so-called Forsaken are providing."]="$g兄弟:姐妹;，很高兴见到你！这地方令人毛骨悚然。去帮助那些所谓的被遗忘者吧，别错过这样的好机会。"
G["It is so much larger than any of the Pandaren balloons... Does it belong to the outsiders?"]="熊猫人可没有那么大的气球……是外乡人的吗？"
G["It is so nice of you think of me, darlin'."]="你还想着我真是太好了，亲爱的。"
G["It is so relaxing to not have to run the market for once."]="总算不用打理市集了，真是太轻松了。"
G["It is standing right behind you. Do not move. Do not breathe."]="它就站在你身后。不要移动。不要呼吸。"
G["It is strange, I know... Most mortals cannot actually comprehend what they see here, as often, what they see is not anchored within their own perception of reality."]="这很奇怪，我知道……大部分凡人无法真正理解他们在这里看到的东西，他们所看到往往无法和他们的理解联系起来。"
G["It is the assistance of Bulrug that you need.  You will find him outside on the lower rise standing between the inn and the Thunder Bluff Bank."]="你需要布尔鲁格的帮助。他在旅馆和雷霆崖银行间较低的山上。"
G["It is the baseline material used in race synthesis.  A cross-section of Azeroth's crust was used as the foundation for the Earthen's synthesis rather than the typical biomass construction foundation used by the Creators.\n\nResearch on the world's composition led the Creators to theorize that an enhanced being could be synthesized that would epitomize the resiliency of this world's essence.  This was accomplished by choosing to use a blend of Azeroth's various stone core compounds as the foundation."]="所谓弹性构造基础就是指用于种族合成的基本材料。造物者在创造土灵的时候放弃了以前创造世界时一直使用的基础材料，转而使用这种常见于艾泽拉斯的材料。\n\n通过对世界组成成分的分析，造物者认为可以合成一种加强型的生物，将它作为世界本质的缩影。造物者最终通过混合艾泽拉斯大陆上各种不同的石头成分，最后组成了这样一种生物的构造基础。"
G["It is the day of reckoning, $c!"]="今天是审判日，$c！"
G["It is the last night of the Lunar Festival.  May fortune be with you!"]="今天是春节的最后一天，祝你来年万事顺意！"
G["It is the wanderer's way."]="这就是云游者之道。"
G["It is the way of the Observer to bear witness to all things that come to pass. So many delicious magics have I tasted at your side, $gmaster:mistress;."]="El deber del observador es ser testigo de todo lo que sucede. He probado muchísimos tipos deliciosos de magia a tu lado, mi $gseñor:señora;."
G["It is them!"]="是他们！"
G["It is these waters that kept the Vale in bloom.  Their runoff into the Valley of the Four Winds created the most fertile farmland in the world!"]="是它们令锦绣谷四季长春，又在流入四风谷后形成了全世界最肥沃的农田！"
G["It is this memory of Arthas that I choose to keep in my heart."]="这就是阿尔萨斯，我要永记于心的阿尔萨斯。"
G["It is this phylactery - Thel'zan's phylactery - that is the key to victory!"]="这就是塞尔赞的护符匣，它是我们取胜的关键！"
G["It is this: Welcome."]="欢迎你。"
G["It is those two cannons along the wall that are slowing us down.  Without their protection our forces would be able to rush their fortification without taking any losses.\n\nIt's either take out those cannons or wait until they run out of ammunition.  Anselm's choice, I suppose."]="就是城墙上的那两尊大炮延缓了我们的攻城速度。要是没有它们的保护，城墙上的守军早就会被我们杀得丢下要塞仓皇逃命去了。\n\n现在我们有两个选择，摧毁那些大炮，或者等他们弹药消耗完。就看安希尔姆怎么决定吧。"
G["It is through the power of the unholy that we command death itself!"]="凭借邪恶的力量，我们才能统御亡者！"
G["It is time I put an end to my brother's madness."]="是时候阻止洛肯的愚蠢行径了。"
G["It is time for the final step; we must activate the altar."]="现在该进行最后一步了，我们必须激活祭坛。"
G["It is time for us as kingdoms and as individuals to set aside our long-standing feuds and unite. The tides of an unwinnable war are upon us, and we must seek refuge on higher ground, lest we be swept away by the flood of darkness."]="是时候让我们，每一个王国，每一个人，摒弃我们长久以来的不合并团结一心了。一场希望渺茫的战争就在我们面前，而我们必须寻求更高的庇护，否则就会被黑暗的洪水吞没。"
G["It is time for us to continue westward $p, after the Sha of Hatred."]="$p，我们现在得继续向西前进，去追踪恨之煞了。"
G["It is time for you to expand your knowledge with another teacher; Ockil has unlocked many fascinating wonders of the engineer, and will lead you on your path to discovery, yes?"]="现在是你向别的导师讨教新知识的时候了。奥克基尔在工程学方面的造诣非同寻常，他会继续指引你的。"
G["It is time for you to journey to Darnassus and speak to Me'lynn. She will guide you from now on."]="现在是你去达纳苏斯跟迈里恩谈谈的时候了。她将对你进行指导。"
G["It is time for you to move on. Telonis, a night elf located within the Craftsmen's Terrace in Darnassus, is the next step in your training."]="现在是你继续提升技能的时候了。前往达纳苏斯的工匠区找泰龙尼斯谈谈吧，接下来由他来训练你。"
G["It is time for you to show me that leadership. Tambre, you will spearhead the offensive on Sardor Isle. Your ferocity will be needed there."]="是时候让我瞧瞧你的领导力了。塔姆布莉，你将率军在萨尔多岛展开攻势。你一定能在那里为你的勇猛找到用武之地。"
G["It is time for your challenge disciple. Use my teachings well."]="准备接受挑战吧。好好利用我教给你的诀窍。"
G["It is time for your learning to be put to the test. Step forth."]="让我瞧瞧你都学到了什么。来吧。"
G["It is time that I returned to Ogri'la. I hope you do not forget about us, as we have not forgotten you."]="我该回奥格瑞拉去了。希望你不要忘记我们，就像我们永远不会忘记你。"
G["It is time to be rid of you."]="是时候除掉你了。"
G["It is time to face Socrethar, $n.  Are you ready?"]="Llegó el momento de enfrentarse a Socrethar, $n. ¿Estás $glisto:lista;?"
G["It is time to face your final challenge young warriors! Prepare for your hardest fight yet."]="年轻的战士，面对你们最后一轮挑战吧！"
G["It is time to get the fish from the market."]="该是去市集买鱼的时候了。"
G["It is time to go home, Prince Anduin."]="该回家了，安度因王子。"
G["It is time to show you my true power! [PH]"]="¡Es hora de mostrar mi verdadero poder!"
G["It is time you moved on to a more advanced teacher. In the Feathermoon Stronghold of Feralas dwells the night elf Kylanna Windwhisper. She has a brilliant mind; doubtless she can train you further."]="现在你该找一位更加渊博的老师了。在菲拉斯的羽月要塞居住着暗夜精灵凯兰娜·风语。她有聪明的头脑；毫无疑问她能继续教你。"
G["It is time, $c.\n\nLet us see what has been so carefully hidden..."]="是时候了，$c。\n\n让我们来看看，到底是什么东西被收藏得这么隐蔽……"
G["It is time, Frye!  Attack!"]="到时候了，进攻！"
G["It is time.  May the Light give us strength."]="时间到了。愿圣光赐予我们力量吧。"
G["It is time.  The rite of exorcism will now commence..."]="是时候了。驱魔仪式马上开始……"
G["It is time. I will expend everything to bind every thread here, now, around the Dragon Soul. What comes to pass will NEVER be undone."]="是时候了。我将使用全部的力量来控制巨龙之魂周围所有的时光线。我们过去的一切努力绝不能白费。"
G["It is time. Sully and I are leaving to scout the interior of the island."]="Es la hora. Sully y yo vamos a explorar el interior de la isla."
G["It is too late for Jarl... its hold is too strong..."]="对加尔来说太晚了……它的控制力太强大了……"
G["It is too late for us, living one. Take yourself and your friend away from here before you both are... claimed..."]="太晚了。趁你们还活着……赶紧带着你的朋友离开这里吧。"
G["It is too late to run!"]="现在逃跑已经太晚了！"
G["It is too powerful!"]="太强大了！"
G["It is trivial to extinguish your fire!"]="熄灭你们的小火苗，完全没有难度！"
G["It is true I have skills to teach to those who are worthy. Would that be you?"]="我确实有能力对那些有价值的人进行教学。你是这样的人吗？"
G["It is true that our choice here today will affect the destiny of our flight. And likely, the destiny of the world."]="我们今日的选择必将改变整个蓝龙军团的宿命，甚至改变这个世界的宿命。"
G["It is true that we serve Deathwing, but we also serve a higher power. Never forget that!"]="我们的确效忠于死亡之翼，可我们同时也效忠于更强大的存在。别忘了这一点！"
G["It is true! All is as you promised us!"]="是真的！都是真的！就像您承诺给我们的那样！"
G["It is true, $n.  The wheels of doom now turn, inevitably, toward the true return of Hakkar!"]="这是真的，$n。厄运的车轮开始运转，一切都无可避免，哈卡将重返世间！"
G["It is true, it may be possible to someday harness the sha into a weapon. But we risk destroying our own people in the process. That is not a price I am willing to pay."]="没错，或许有一天，我们真的可以驱使煞魔作为武器。但在这个过程中，我们得冒着让人民遭遇灭顶之灾的威胁。我可不愿意付出这样的代价。"
G["It is true, young $r, we and the Alliance have gathered and prepared all that we will need for this upcoming conflict at Ahn'Qiraj. Even now these things are being sent to Cenarion Hold, and the last of them should arrive within a day. After all is in place, some person will need to ring the gong on the Scarab Dais to open the gates and start the war."]="Es cierto, joven $r, nosotros y la Alianza ya hemos reunido y preparado todo lo que vamos a necesitar para el inminente conflicto que tendrá lugar en Ahn'Qiraj. Todas las cosas están de camino al Fuerte Cenarion y el último envío debería llegar en el próximo día. Cuando todo esté en su sitio, alguien tendrá que hacer sonar el gong que situado en el Estrado del Escarabajo para abrir las puertas y dar comienzo a la guerra."
G["It is true, young $r, we and the Alliance have gathered and prepared all that we will need for this upcoming conflict at Ahn'Qiraj. Even now these things are being sent to Cenarion Hold, and they should all arrive within $2113w days. After all is in place, some person will need to ring the gong on the Scarab Dais to open the gates and start the war."]="Es cierto, joven $r, nosotros y la Alianza ya hemos reunido y preparado todo lo que vamos a necesitar para el inminente conflicto que tendrá lugar en Ahn'Qiraj. Todas las cosas están de camino al Fuerte Cenarion y el último envío debería llegar en los próximos $2113w días. Cuando todo esté en su sitio, alguien tendrá que hacer sonar el gong que situado en el Estrado del Escarabajo para abrir las puertas y dar comienzo a la guerra."
G["It is true. They are strong. There is much they can teach us."]="是的。他们很强，有很多值得我们学习的地方。"
G["It is true: he has the spirit of the wolf. And he fights like a wolf."]="他的确有着狼的灵魂。他能像狼一样战斗。"
G["It is truly a great time for the Twilight's Hammer.  The greatest of times.  First, Lord Deathwing's arrival.  And now... now great Ragnaros has returned!"]="这真是暮光之锤的辉煌时刻。无与伦比的辉煌时刻。首先，我们迎来了死亡之翼领主。而现在……现在伟大的拉格纳罗斯也回来了！"
G["It is truly a pleasure to see you again, $n."]="很高兴能再见到你，$n。"
G["It is truly admirable to do combat with a celestial."]="能和至尊天神战斗真是叫人羡慕。"
G["It is truly an honor to be in the presence of Xuen and the other celestials."]="能见到雪怒和其他至尊天神真是我的荣幸。"
G["It is unconscionable that Malygos would have his forces attack the temple! With your permission, my lord, I will defend us with my life."]="猖狂的玛里苟斯居然让他的部队进攻龙眠神殿！请让我参与保卫神殿的战斗，我愿意为此付出生命的代价。"
G["It is unfortunate that this is not a contest of brewing. Never have I seen so many brewmasters gathered at once!"]="可惜没有酿酒比赛。我从没见过这么多酒仙聚在一起！"
G["It is unwise to anger me!"]="激怒我可不是个好主意！"
G["It is very good to see you again, $n! I trust the weapons I gave you at Ravenholdt have served you well?\n\nI have another \"assignment\" for you here in Pandaria. This will again require all of your skills, and again I assure you... it will be worth it!\n\nBefore we begin, it's important that you familiarize yourself with the lay of the land. Come visit me once you have earned more experience here."]="¡Qué bueno volver a verte, $n! Supongo que las armas que te entregué en Ravenholdt te han servido de ayuda, ¿no es así?\n\nTengo otro \"recado\" para ti aquí en Pandaria. Esto volverá a exigir tus mejores habilidades y de nuevo puedo asegurarte que... ¡merecerá la pena!\n\nAntes de comenzar, es importante que te familiarices con el terreno. Ven a verme de nuevo una vez hayas obtenido más experiencia."
G["It is very good to see you here my friend. It has been a while since our endevours in the Valley of the Four Winds."]="很高兴能在这里见到你，我的朋友。距离我们在四风谷携手合作已经有段日子了。"
G["It is very important that we find out what the the night elves are up to, $c! Please concentrate all of your efforts toward that end."]="查明那些暗夜精灵想干什么对我们来说很重要，$c！请朝着这个目标努力吧。"
G["It is very kind of you to ask after our needs, $c. It would appear though that we have collected all of the runecloth bandages we feel we'll need of the war. May I ask that you inquire around with some of the other collectors and lend them your aid if needed? Ancestors watch over you."]="感谢你对我们的关心，$c。但是我们已经集齐备战所需的符文布绷带了。你可以问问其他的收集者，为他们提供帮助。愿你的祖先保佑你。"
G["It is very kind of you to donate your organs!"]="真高兴，又有人来捐献器官了！"
G["It is very sad that fish have no trails or mountains to climb.  If I bring them more fish friends will they be happy?"]="真可惜，鱼都不能走路或爬山。如果我给它们多找一些鱼朋友回来，它们会高兴吗？"
G["It is warm."]="好温暖。"
G["It is we who must make the first strike. We cannot be allowed to repeat the mistakes of the past..."]="我们必须先发制人，绝对不能重蹈覆辙……"
G["It is wise that you humble yourself before me, $n, in your desire for more warlock knowledge."]="你想学习更多的术士知识，那你还是放聪明点，在我面前表现得谦卑一些，$n。"
G["It is wise to replenish our resources before they run out!"]="及时补充资源，别让它们耗尽了！"
G["It is with satisfaction that I relay to you we have collected all of the purple lotus that we feel we need. Thank you for your contribution to the effort, $c. If you are so inclined, there are most likely several still here that are collecting other resources for the struggle."]="我们已经集齐了所需的紫莲花，我很满意。谢谢你的帮助，$c。如果你愿意的话，这儿还有很多人还在为收集作战物资而焦头烂额呢，你可以帮帮他们。"
G["It is with solemn pride that I perform my services in Honor Hold."]="能在荣耀堡服役，我非常自豪。"
G["It is within the most sacred realm of Pandaria that you will now face your most difficult challenge."]="你将在潘达利亚最神圣的区域内面对最困难的挑战。"
G["It is worth all of our lives to eliminate the spirit of your fallen commander."]="我们要不惜一切代价消灭死去的指挥官的灵魂。"
G["It is worth it. I wish to augment my agility.<Pay 10,000 gold.>"]="物有所值。我希望提升自己的敏捷。<付10,000金币。>"
G["It is worth it. I wish to augment my intelligence.<Pay 10,000 gold.>"]="物有所值。我希望提升自己的智力。<付10,000金币。>"
G["It is worth it. I wish to augment my strength.<Pay 10,000 gold.>"]="物有所值。我希望提升自己的力量。<付10,000金币。>"
G["It is you again, $c.\n\nIs something wrong?\n\n<Alysra's tail flinches, and her eyes dart back and forth under their lids.>"]="又是你，$c。\n\n出什么事了吗？\n\n<奥利瑟拉的尾巴仿佛因害怕而畏缩着，她的双眼紧闭，但眼睑遮挡不住她游离的眼睛。>"
G["It is you who have destroyed my children? You... shall... pay!"]="就是你们杀死了我那么的多孩子吗？你们……要付出代价！"
G["It is you who have invaded our home. Gorefiend will avenge us!"]="你侵略了我的家园。血魔会找你报仇的！"
G["It is you who honor me, High Chief. Please read from this scroll. It is the oath of allegiance."]="大酋长，这是我的荣幸才对。喏，这份卷轴就是结盟的誓约，请您过目。"
G["It is you who should suffer. Be content that your death is a quick one...."]="这是你应受的惩罚。值得庆幸的是，你会死得很痛快。"
G["It is you who will defend my people and usher in a new era of prosperity for Stillpine!"]="你就是那个会保护我的人民，并指引止松要塞进入一个新时代的英雄！"
G["It is your life that will end soon; mine is just beginning."]="你的生命即将终结，而我的则刚刚开始。"
G["It is yours my Lord!"]="主人，这是你的！"
G["It is yours, my dear Mister Goodwin. Master Belloc will be most pleased with our trade."]="这东西是你的了，亲爱的古德温先生。贝洛克大师想必会对我们的交易十分满意。"
G["It is! The great war of Silithus raged over a thousand years ago. Valstann tried to save his people, but was captured...and killed."]="没错！这是千年之前在希利苏斯发生的大战。瓦斯坦恩为族人而战，却不幸被俘……殒命敌手。"
G["It is! Well done, $p!"]="真的是他！干的好，$p！"
G["It is... and twenty-six TIMES more powerful than the first!"]="这……比第一个强大二十六倍！"
G["It is... as it should be."]="这就是……必然的归宿。"
G["It is... not over."]="你们……等着瞧。"
G["It is... the empress who has betrayed... our people..."]="但是……是女皇背叛了……我们的族人……"
G["It isn't enough! Defenders, gather in the center of town. Together we will stand against the undead monster!"]="快一点！勇敢的卫士们，快到镇中心集合！我们要并肩击退亡灵！"
G["It isn't ready to fly yet, sister!"]="它还没准备好起飞呢，姐妹！"
G["It isn't safe to leave, there's something lurking out there in the woods."]="现在离开并不安全。这片森林中潜伏着可怕的东西。"
G["It isn't talking, milady. I know it holds secrets! Naughty secrets!"]="它不说话，夫人。我知道它保守着秘密！邪恶的秘密！"
G["It isss done!  Nessspirah isss mine!!!"]="终于完成了！现在，奈瑟匹拉是我的了！！！"
G["It jerbs the nib right outta my derb!"]="它让我有种说不出的难受！"
G["It just so happens that Mishi returned it to me. You should be more careful! This artifact is a rare one of a kind piece."]="正好米师回到了我身边。你可得万分小心！这是件独一无二的稀有神器。"
G["It knows all, it sees all!"]="它知道一切，它看到一切！"
G["It looks as if $n has decided to heal and revive his pets!  $gHis:Her; progress in the tournament has been reset, and they will be allowed to attempt each challenge again."]="¡Parece que $n ha decidido sanar y revivir a sus mascotas! Se ha reiniciado su progreso en el torneo. Ahora tendrá que superar todos los desafíos desde el principio."
G["It looks at you blankly."]="它茫然地看着你。"
G["It looks just like the paintings of King Magni too! Did he really do this to himself?"]="这看上去就像是麦格尼国王的雕像！他真的是自己把自己弄成这样的？"
G["It looks like a big fish!"]="它看起来像一条大鱼！"
G["It looks like a gateway to hell!"]="看上去像是通往地狱的大门！"
G["It looks like he's just unconscious. I should be able to wake him up."]="看来他只是失去意识了。我应该能把他叫醒。"
G["It looks like help has finally arrived!  The Omenai welcome you to our remnant camp, $n."]="似乎援兵终于来了！欧麦尼欢迎你来到我们的营地，$n。"
G["It looks like it be succulent pork ribs basted with its own delectable juices and a side o' Captain Sander's Secret Sauce - fer dippin'."]="我计划给大家烹制浇着美味肉汁、还有一点点杉德尔船长特制配方的鲜嫩多汁的烤猪排。"
G["It looks like it may have to come to that."]="看来情形可能真会如你所说。"
G["It looks like my father was wrong. Even Zouchin can be dangerous!"]="看起来我父亲也错了。即使是在卓金也会是危险的！"
G["It looks like our paths have crossed again, $n. At a pig farm, of all places.\n\nI enjoy this valley. It almost feels like... home. The green fields, the big sky... I have even heard mention that there's a big brewery down the road. Maybe it is time I settled down once and for all.\n\n<Chen looks off into the distance for a few long seconds, then shrugs his shoulders.>\n\nOr maybe not."]="看来我们的命运再次交叉了，$n，而且还是在这个大养猪场里。\n\n我喜欢这个山谷。它感觉就像……家一样。绿色的田野，广阔的天空……我甚至还听说路的那头有个大的酿酒厂。我也许是时候安定下来，不再漂泊了。\n\n<陈向远方凝视了几秒钟，然后耸耸肩。>\n\n或者不会。"
G["It looks like some sort of gigantic chest... probably full of gold.  And it's all ours!"]="看起来像某种巨型箱子……可能还装满了金币。全归我们啦！"
G["It looks like the cultists had their eye on the druids!\n\nYou can see Wildheart Point through the swirling portal. Stepping through it will take you on a one-way trip back to the camp.\n\nOnce your business here is finished, this would be a good way to make a quick exit."]="看来邪教徒盯上了那些德鲁伊！\n\n你可以通过这旋转的传送门看到野性之心哨站。穿过传送门就能返回营地。\n\n等这里的工作结束后，便可藉此快速离开。"
G["It looks like the hozen scattered their brew in mugs and kegs across the island."]="看来猢狲把酒杯和酒桶弄得满岛都是。"
G["It looks like the scavengers may be sending a large party out into the swamp soon. Tell the archmage to be ready."]="看来那些食腐者恐怕很快就要到外面的沼泽去狂欢一番了。去告诉大法师，让他做好准备。"
G["It looks like the site of... a massacre."]="这里看起来就像……屠杀现场。"
G["It looks like there's a skirmish up ahead, $n.  Let us wait til the situation clears up."]="似乎前面有一场小冲突，$n。等形势明朗了再过去吧。"
G["It looks like they crashed.  I don't think they're here for trouble."]="他们应该不是来找麻烦的，他们的飞船坠毁了。"
G["It looks like this is the end, but I'll be brave if you will, $n."]="看样子，这就是最后了，如果你有足够的胆量，那我也就有，$n。"
G["It looks like we are going in blind. I'm glad you are with us, $p."]="看来我们只能盲目前行了。很高兴有你相伴，$p。"
G["It looks like we have a ranking officer among our captives... how amusing.  Execute the Alliance wench!"]="看上去有个指挥官在我们的俘虏中间……太棒了。马上砍了那个联盟小妞！"
G["It looks like we have a ranking officer among our captives... how amusing.  Execute this green-skinned dog at once!"]="看上去有个指挥官在我们的俘虏中间……太棒了。马上砍了这条绿皮狗！"
G["It looks like we have one more challenger yet to face though, so let's get those wagers in!"]="看样子，我们又有了一个新的挑战者。现在，大家下注吧！"
G["It looks like we're in trouble. Look lively, here they come!"]="似乎我们遇到麻烦了。打起精神来，他们来了！"
G["It looks like we've managed to quell the sha... for now."]="看来我们压制住了煞魔……但只是暂时的。"
G["It looks like you are already playing catch with your serpent, $n. You can only play catch with one serpent at a time.\n\nPlease finish your current training session before practicing with another serpent."]="看来你已经在跟翔龙宝宝练习接球了，$n。你每次只能跟一条翔龙玩接球。\n\n在跟其他翔龙练习之前，请先完成你当前的训练课程。"
G["It looks like you've already found love. You can give me a love token, but I'm not giving you anything nice. I'm waiting for someone special."]="我一看就知道，你已经找到了自己的真爱。你可以给我一件爱情信物，但我没什么可以给你的。我正在等待一个特殊的人……"
G["It looks like your predecessor had time to set the flares up, but they have not yet been launched.\n\nThis is your time to shine, $n."]="Al parecer tu predecesor tuvo tiempo de colocar las bengalas, pero todavía no han sido lanzadas.\n\nAquí tienes tus minutos de fama, $n."
G["It looks scaaaary."]="它似乎受惊了。"
G["It makes no sense, but those vermin are going to great lengths to keep our troops alive..."]="这说不通，可那些恶棍却不遗余力地想要延长我们的生命……"
G["It manifests itself as a feeling, small at first and easily ignored, that confirms truths and subtly prods one to do good."]="刚开始的时候，圣光以某种微妙的感觉昭示着它的教义。人们很容易忽视这种感觉，但是圣光依然指引着他们探索真理，并促使他们常行善事。"
G["It matters not how the sha broke free of their ancient prisons. We must plan a course of action forward. How can we dispel them again from our land?"]="煞是如何冲破了古老的囚牢，已经不重要了。我们必须制定行动方案，想想怎样才能再次将其逐出我们的土地？"
G["It matters not, the Old One will not suffer their intrusion."]="没关系，上古尊者是不会被他们侵扰的。"
G["It may be best not to dabble in mysteries not yet fully understood. Perhaps you should disable the dampening devices. My companions and I can handle ourselves. I'm sure we will be fine."]="最好不要擅动我们尚未完全理解的神秘事物。也许你应该去停掉那些弱化的装置。我和同伴能自己照顾自己。我们一定会没事的。"
G["It may be wise to befriend these people."]="结交这些人或许是个明智的主意。"
G["It may come to that. Bring me my blades. The next move is mine."]="或许如此。把我的剑拿来。该我行动了。"
G["It may look simple, a large stick with a huge weight on the end. But when swung with the might of a tauren behind it, this stick can break stone walls."]="这看起来或许很简单，无非是一根前端极重的大棍。但是当强壮的牛头人挥动起来时，这根棍子可以击穿石墙。"
G["It may not be quite comfy out here, but it's still Khaz Modan, so it's still our home."]="也许这里并不怎么舒适宜人，可这里仍旧是卡兹莫丹，所以它还是我们的家。"
G["It may seem pointless, but try to find pride in a good fight. The time will come when all this practicing and competition will be put to good use."]="这看起来可能毫无意义，但是你可以试着在战斗中找到尊严。你迟早会发现这些练习的价值的。"
G["It may take time to learn what I must.  I trust I will not be gone too long, but it could be weeks - even months."]="也许要花些时间才能弄清我必须要了解的。我相信我不会离开很久，但可能也要几个星期——甚至几个月。"
G["It may'ave won in life, but it won't be winnin' in the afterlife! FIRE!"]="有人或许能风光一辈子，但是总不可能在死后也为所欲为吧！开火！"
G["It might be wisest if you and your companions were not seen here for a time, traveler."]="要是你和你的伙伴们能离开这里一段时间，那也许是最明智的，旅行者。"
G["It might help if you could tell me how many of these guys we're going to fight.  You can remember that, right, grandma?"]="你最好告诉我，我们总共需要面对多少个敌人。你还记得吧？"
G["It might help if you could tell me how many of these guys we're going to fight.  You can remember that, right, grandpa?"]="你最好告诉我，我们总共需要面对多少个敌人。你还记得吧？"
G["It might look like an ordinary pumpkin patch now, but once the plague cauldron is placed it will become a source of disease, rot and plague!"]="一旦放置天灾锅，这块看似普通的南瓜田就会成为诅咒的源头！"
G["It moved!  I swear, I saw it move!"]="它动了！我发誓，我看到它动了！"
G["It must be something in the water, I tell you."]="我敢打赌，是饮用水的问题。"
G["It must be the purity of the Mark of the Lightbringer that is drawing forth the Scourge to us.  We must proceed with caution lest we be overwhelmed!"]="一定是光明使者的印记所散发出的纯洁气息把天灾军团吸引来了。我们必须加倍小心！"
G["It must have been hidden away long before recorded history.  And with good reason!"]="它早在有史可考之前就被隐藏了起来。这一定是有原因的！"
G["It must have broken the walls of the tank!"]="它肯定打碎了罐子的外壳。"
G["It mustn't know... it mustn't learn... what's ours..."]="不能让它知道……不能让它了解……我们的……"
G["It needn't end this way."]="事情或许还有挽回的余地啊。"
G["It nice having a good hunting partner."]="有你这样优秀的猎手陪同，感觉真好。"
G["It nice that it not snow here. Snow no good."]="这里不下雪真是太好啦。我讨厌下雪！"
G["It not even see Goregek coming."]="它甚至没有发现格利基克。"
G["It not gonna make no difference."]="这没什么。"
G["It only hurts this much the first time.  The second time, you're dead."]="第一次还不会要你的命。到第二次，你就死定了。"
G["It pained me to see so many displaced from their homes in Kun-Lai. I am very happy we found a safe haven for those in need of protection."]="看见那么多人被迫离开昆莱山的家园，这令我倍感煎熬。幸好我们为那些寻求庇护的人们找到了避风港。"
G["It pains me to say this, but \"Yes\"."]="要我说出这样的话真是有些难过，不过答案是“是”。"
G["It pains me to see my ancestors disturbed from their graves.\n\nWe must strike down the cursed spirit of your Force-Commander Steeljaw, the one who foolishly led his caravan through these sacred grounds."]="看到先祖的灵魂无法安息，我非常痛心。\n\n指挥官斯尔加·钢腭这个蠢货居然带领商队穿越这片神圣的墓地，我们必须消灭他那被诅咒的灵魂。"
G["It pains me, Neltharion - but I must end you, as I have ended Malygos."]="这令我痛苦，奈萨里奥——但我必须终结你，就像我终结玛里苟斯一样。"
G["It pleases me, after all, to cause such strife in the world above... to shake, to shatter, to swallow and crush..."]="毕竟，我很喜欢在上面的世界造成冲突与战争……我喜欢震撼，粉碎，吞噬和摧毁……"
G["It probably caused the leak!"]="很可能是它引起泄漏的！"
G["It put the mutton in the stomach!"]="它一口吞下了一只羊！"
G["It puts the ghoul in the pit or else it gets the lash!"]="要么滚到坑里去，要么就吃鞭子！"
G["It really doesn't look like it, Bailey."]="拜雷，我实在想不出有什么办法可以过去。"
G["It really is good to see you again, $n.  Fur and all."]="真高兴能再看到你，$n。而且一根毛都不缺。"
G["It really is you, isn't it?  I remember those eyes."]="真的是你？我还记得这双眼睛。"
G["It remains to be seen if you are ready, young one.  Even the wisest and oldest of druids are never truly ready when their ultimate time of testing comes.\n\nYou have heard my words, and now you must move on.  Heed what I have taught you.  There will be a time when you will have your strength tested.  You must face your foe as the bear would - with strength of body and with strength of heart.  Learn from the fight, young one.  Go... with my blessings."]="Todavía está por ver si estás $gpreparado:preparada;, joven. Ni siquiera el más sabio y anciano de los druidas llega a estar nunca realmente listo cuando se acerca la hora de someterse a la última prueba.\n\nYa has oído mis palabras, ahora debes continuar. Presta atención a lo que te he enseñado. Llegará la hora en la que habrás mostrado tu fuerza. Debes enfrentarte a tu enemigo como lo haría el oso, con fuerza de cuerpo y con fuerza de corazón. Aprende de la lucha, joven. Y ahora vete... con mi bendición."
G["It rent a tree asunder and set it aflame."]="它劈倒了一棵树并将它点燃。"
G["It requires a cunning strategist indeed to defeat my monks.  Well done, $n."]="要想击败我的武僧们真的需要高明的战术。干得好，$n。"
G["It rewards those who heed its promptings with blessings, both seen and unseen."]="圣光祝福那些接受感召的人们，这种赐福可能是有形的，也可能是无形的。"
G["It saddens all of us to see the Drakkari destroying themselves this way.\n\nThe power that they gain from killing the natural gods of the land is transitory.\n\nWhat is gained in the short run will be lost to them for all eternity."]="达卡莱帝国走上了自我毁灭的道路，我们为此感到悲哀。\n\n他们通过弑神夺来的力量只能维持一段很短的时间。\n\n这短暂的收益将葬送达卡莱帝国的未来。"
G["It saddens me to see the furbolg all corrupted so readily. These used to be our friends."]="看到那些熊怪的堕落，我感到非常伤心。他们曾经是我们的朋友。"
G["It seems I have more training to do. Thank you for the lesson."]="看来我还需要更多的练习。感谢你的教诲。"
G["It seems I'll be enjoying an expedient win this fine day!"]="今天可真是个好日子啊，我都赢得不好意思了！"
G["It seems as if this world is coming apart at the seams.  I've seen these symptoms before, on Draenor... We may not be able to stop this.  Fleeing may be our best option."]="这个世界仿佛正在破碎。我曾在德拉诺见过这些征兆……我们也许无力阻止这场灾难。逃生或许是我们最好的选择。"
G["It seems as though this cave used to contain powerful Mogu magic."]="这个洞穴中似乎有强大魔古法术的痕迹。"
G["It seems hope has triumphed after all..."]="看来终究还是希望占了上风……"
G["It seems like love is drifting on the wind. I hope that I won't be left out."]="爱情随风飘过，希望我不会被它甩在后面。"
G["It seems my assistants proved too much for you.  Speak with me when you are ready to try again."]="看来我的助手们对你而言太难应对了。等你准备好重试时，再来与我交谈。"
G["It seems my freedom must be bought with blood!"]="看来我的自由必须用鲜血去换取了！"
G["It seems my strategy is superior."]="看来我的战略无人能及。"
G["It seems my strength proved too much for you.  Speak with me when you are ready to try again."]="对你来说，我的力量似乎过于强大了。等你准备好重试时，再来与我交谈。"
G["It seems that I'll need to deal with you myself. The High Inquisitor comes for you, Scourge!"]="看样子我得亲自对付你了。尝尝大检查官的厉害吧，天灾军团！"
G["It seems that a great deal of your power is used for... and I hope you'll pardon the term... frivolous things. Isn't that, well, wasteful?"]="似乎大量的能量被用在了……琐碎的东西上……我希望你能宽恕我的用词。这样是不是，呃，太浪费了？"
G["It seems that after only a few days of study, Anduin already understands the Way of the Crane.\n\nPerhaps he always has?"]="在经过短短几天的研学之后，安度因已经理解朱鹤之道了。\n\n也许他天生就懂？"
G["It seems that my defenses have prevailed.  Speak with me when you are ready to try again."]="看来我的防御更胜一筹。等你准备好重试时，再来与我交谈。"
G["It seems that there are others who see the value of amber."]="看起来好像有其他人也发现了琥珀的价值。"
G["It seems the army of the Scourge has come to Tanaris. A significant number of their necropolises and other forces have been dispatched there.\n\nNumber of Necropolises remaining: $2283W"]="似乎天灾军团的士兵正在进攻塔纳利斯。大量浮空城和其他部队还在陆续正向这里涌来。\n\n剩余浮空要塞数量：$2283W"
G["It seems the captain is correct. Quel'Delar is not to be ours after all."]="看起来队长说的是对的。我们完全无法驾驭奎尔德拉。"
G["It seems the heart of the Lunar Festival celebration is in Moonglade. The druids in the Cenarion Enclave in Darnassus can transport you there if you don't want to walk."]="春节庆祝的中心地在月光林地。要是你不想走过去的话，达纳苏斯塞纳里奥区的德鲁伊可以把你传送到那里。"
G["It seems there are hazards to living in a place so beautiful..."]="看来住在太过美丽的地方是有风险的……"
G["It seems we have a returning challenger! Welcome back to the arena, Dippy!"]="这位挑战者可是我们的老朋友了！欢迎回到竞技场，帝皮！"
G["It seems we haven't lost yet."]="看来我们还没输。"
G["It seems you Coldridge folks are dreadfully under-informed about the events of the last few days."]="看样子，你们这些寒脊山人根本不知道过去几天发生了什么。"
G["It seems you are not ready for the rank of champion.  Some more training may serve you well."]="看来你还没有做好晋级为冠军的准备。最好多加练习。"
G["It seems you have not quite mastered all that we have taught you.  Speak to me when you are ready to try again."]="你似乎还没能将我们传授给你的技能融会贯通。等你准备好重试时，再来与我交谈。"
G["It seems you still need more practice.  Perhaps another time."]="看来你还需要多加练习。我们还是下次再打吧。"
G["It seems you were not ready for mounted combat."]="Parece que no estabas $glisto:lista; para el combate $gmontado:montada;."
G["It seems you were unable to keep me at bay.  Speak with me when you are ready to try again."]="看来你还奈何不了我啊。等你准备好重试时，再来与我交谈。"
G["It seems you'll need another lesson, mortals!"]="看起来需要再给你一次教训，凡人！"
G["It seems your efforts to defeat me have failed.  Speak with me when you are ready to try again."]="看来你没能击败我。等你准备好重试时，再来与我交谈。"
G["It seems your journeys are not done. These new allies of ours come from a broken world that could use our help."]="你的旅程还没有结束。我们的新盟友来自一个破碎的世界，你的能力可以帮助他们。"
G["It seems your reputation as a formidable $c is well earned, $n!"]="看来你这强大$c的名头可真是名不虚传啊，$n！"
G["It sees us..."]="它能看见我们……"
G["It seethes and burns..."]="它沸腾燃烧了……"
G["It shall NEVER happen. We are legion. We are united. Where are your heroes? Vol'jin sits in sanctuary at the side of the young Warchief, unaware. Zul'jin missing, probably dead."]="绝不能发生这种事儿。我们是一支庞大的军团。我们团结一致。你的英雄在哪儿？沃金毫无知觉地陪在年轻的部落酋长身边。祖尔金失踪了，或许已经死了。"
G["It shall be I that earns the favor of our lord by casting out the intruders. My calmest wind shall still prove too much for them!"]="消灭入侵者的功绩应该属于我。就算是我麾下最弱小的气流，也能让他们死无葬身之地！"
G["It shall be as you say, warbringer. One last question, if I may..."]="谨遵教诲，战争使者。还有最后一个问题，我是否可以……"
G["It shall be so, sir."]="遵命，长官。"
G["It should be beautiful. It should be pristine!"]="它应该是美丽而淳朴的！"
G["It should be me in your place!  I'll show you!"]="你的位置应该是我的！我要让你瞧瞧！"
G["It should have been me that carried the blade to Northrend. The burden was mine to bear."]="这把剑本来应该由我带来诺森德的。从此以后，它所背负的一切就让我来承担吧。"
G["It should have been me!"]="为什么活下来的是我而不是你？！"
G["It should not have come to this!"]="你不该阻拦我的！"
G["It shouldn't be much further, $n. The exit is just up ahead."]="应该不会太远了，$n。出口就在前面。"
G["It simply must have some..."]="我们得添加一些……"
G["It smells delicious, doesn't it?"]="闻上去香极了，是吧？"
G["It smells like..."]="闻上去就像……"
G["It so fat!"]="真大啊！"
G["It so juicy!"]="看起来很多汁！"
G["It spoke to me of secrets and power, and also of truths. The Light had not forsaken the Broken! The fel energies that the orcs had wielded long ago against the draenei had infused us, causing a break in our ability to be heard by, or perhaps to hear, the Light. The same that had been responsible for the degradation of our bodies.\n\nBut our spirits were not broken, and the air offered to me another path, through which I might deliver my people."]="Me habló de secretos y poder, y también de verdades. ¡La Luz no había abandonado a los Tábidos! Las energías viles que los orcos habían usado antaño contra los draenei penetraron en nosotros, provocando una escisión en nuestra capacidad de ser oídos, o quizás de oír, la Luz. Lo mismo que había sido responsable de la degradación de nuestro cuerpo.\n\nPero nuestros espíritus no estaban rotos, y el aire me ofreció otro camino, a través del cual tal vez pueda liberar a mi pueblo."
G["It ssshall profit them nothing, sssave it be a ssspeedy demise..."]="这对他们没有任何好处，只会让他们死得更快。"
G["It ssspoilss our water!"]="它扰乱了我们的水！"
G["It stands to reason that it may be here for exactly the reasons it says it is."]="它站在这个地方的原因也许正如它所说的那样。"
G["It starts with a hero."]="它由一位英雄谱写。"
G["It stinks of big-tongue around here."]="空气中散发着大舌头怪的臭味！"
G["It stinky around here. Why so stinky."]="这里好臭啊。为什么这么臭呢？"
G["It sure is bright out here... and flat."]="这里真是一马平川……阳光充沛……"
G["It sure is! Those hives were abuzz with various silithid that were none too happy to see us.\n\nEverything was going fine until we came across a glyphed crystal in Hive'Regal. She was drawn to it like a moth to a flame! She put her pretty little cheek up against the crystal and instantly entered a trance-like state. Naturally, this worried my crew. We picked her up and carried her out of there with a quickness!"]="很明显！居住在虫巢中的异种虫并不欢迎我们的到来。\n\n一切进展顺利，直到我们在雷戈虫巢中发现了一块雕文水晶。她象飞蛾扑火一般急切地抓起水晶，把脸凑上去，精神也变得恍惚起来。队友们都很担心她。我们以最快的速度将她带出了虫巢！"
G["It takes a bit of practice to be this close to the silithid and go unnoticed.  I don't recommend trying it if you can avoid it."]="要靠异种这么近又要不被发现需要一点练习。如果你能避免我建议你就不尝试。"
G["It takes a few good crashes to really \"season\" a flying machine.\n\nNo goblin in their right mind flies one pristine."]="Para tener una máquina voladora \"curtida\" de verdad, hace falta estrellarse con ella unas cuantas veces.\n\nNingún goblin en su sano juicio pilotaría una máquina inmaculada."
G["It takes a lot of dedication to train and ride a Venomhide."]="训练并骑乘毒皮暴掠龙需要耗费大量精力。"
G["It takes brass ball-bearings to craft siege engines for the Horde. Now get with the program or hit the bricks!"]="制造攻城器械需要铜球轴承。动作快点，不然就给我滚蛋！"
G["It tasted soooo good going down."]="那酒真是太顺口了。"
G["It tastes like I died and went to the Nether; where slop that tastes like rotting threshadon carcass is then shoved down my throat by an obese tauren that's never washed their hands - or bathed..."]="吃了它，我就好像死后去了虚空一样；那东西尝起来就像腐烂的内脏，被一个从未洗过手或洗过澡的牛头胖子塞进我的喉咙一样……"
G["It taught me the path of shamanism, which in a way is just another facet of the Light. Joining the wind was the water of the oasis, the fire from my camp and the earth upon which I sat. All had something to say.\n\nOver the next few years they taught me what it was to call upon and be one with the elements of the world. And they told me that the worlds of all of the stars in the sky, even this one, are made up of these elements.\n\nBut the day came when I felt that I had learned enough to leave."]="它教我领悟了萨满之路，那实际上是圣光的另一种表象。风与绿洲里的水、营地中的火焰和我脚下的大地是一体的，它们都要向我表达些什么。\n\n在随后的几年内，它们教会了我召唤元素和融入元素的力量。它们告诉我，天上的群星以及这个世界的万物，都是由这些元素构成的。\n\n当我觉得自己已经学到了足够多的知识之后，我离开了那里。"
G["It tears at us from the inside!"]="它从内部撕裂了我们！"
G["It tells of the coming apocalypse. How this world will burn and be reborn from death."]="秘典中记载了即将到来的天启。世界将在灰烬中毁灭，然后重获新生。"
G["It time for work! Zug zug!"]="工作时间！哼唧哼唧！"
G["It tingles..."]="有点刺痛……"
G["It took a coward's poison and the fury of Hellscream to bring my father down."]="杀死我父亲的不仅仅是地狱咆哮的狂怒，还有懦夫的毒药。"
G["It took all of $n's skill to maintain control of Stampy."]="$n全神贯注地控制斯塔比战斗。"
G["It took all of our combined strength, but we have pushed Ragnaros back into the Firelands."]="这耗尽了我们集结起来的所有力量，不过我们终于把拉格纳罗斯赶回了火焰之地。"
G["It truly is a shame that the blue dragonflight has chosen such a heartless, cold path. It pains me greatly to do battle with Malygos's children."]="蓝龙军团竟然选择了如此残酷而冷血的道路，整个龙族都因此蒙羞。我却不得不与玛里苟斯的子嗣交战，做出这样的决定真令我痛心。"
G["It was ... the chowder."]="就是……这种杂烩。"
G["It was An! She dared Shin to go knock on the Jade Witch's door."]="都是安的错！是她怂恿阿信去敲青玉巫婆的大门的。"
G["It was High General Abbendis, High Inquisitor Isillien, and Highlord Mograine that formed the Crusade. In its infancy, the Crusade was a noble order. The madness and insane zealotry that you see now did not exist. It was not until the one known as the Grand Crusader appeared that the wheels of corruption were set in motion."]="最初，是大将军阿比迪斯、大审判官伊森利恩和大领主莫格莱尼一起建立了十字军组织。那时候，十字军还是一个高贵的组织。没有止境的狂热与愚行那时候完全不存在。直到那个自称大十字军的男人出现以后，我们才开始走向堕落与腐化的道路。"
G["It was I who brought Quel'Delar here, to return it to its makers. In breaking the weapon, so did I break its power."]="是我将奎尔德拉带来，交给它的铸造者，只为打碎这把武器，消除它的力量。"
G["It was I who suggested our greatest warriors be cast in amber to sleep, to be awakened at the swarm's greatest times of need."]="是我建议我们最伟大的战士们进入琥珀休眠，然后在虫群最需要帮助的时候唤醒他们。"
G["It was Leza's visions that led us here. Each of us have had dreams of a valley, golden with blossoms, filled with the hope of peace.\n\nEven our chieftan Baine Bloodhoof had these dreams.\n\nOnly Leza's visions gave us a path to follow, though. And now, here we are, for better or worse."]="是莱莎的预见指引我们来到这里的。我们每个人都梦到一个峡谷，盛开着金色的鲜花，洋溢着和平的希望。\n\n就连是我们的大酋长贝恩·血蹄也得到了这样的预见。\n\n可是，只有莱莎的幻象给我们指明了道路。现在，无论好坏，我们都已经到了这里。"
G["It was Sironas' idea... The abomination is actually one of their own. He is a high ranking member of the draenei military order: Triumvirate or some such nonsense.\n\nWhatever that thing is, it's massive, powerful, and full of rage. Any attacks against the Vector Coil will most certainly result in failure as long as that abomination is around."]="那是希隆娜丝的主意……那个畸变者，确切地说，是一个德莱尼人。他是个德莱尼军事统帅部的高级成员，好像是叫三人执政团或者类似的东西。\n\n不管怎么说，他都是个魁梧、强大、充满愤怒的家伙。只要畸变者还在，任何针对矢量感应器的进攻都完全是浪费时间。"
G["It was Umi, wasn't it?! She's always playing jokes on me, and now she's got you in on it too!"]="是乌米，是吗？？她总是跟我开玩笑，现在也让你参与到玩笑之中了！"
G["It was a clever ruse, $n. Alliance forces streamed out of Northwatch and marched up the gold road, besieging Crossroads as dusk fell. Then, in the heart of the night, they force-marched southward, leaving their campfires burning behind.\n\nOur meager forces at Honor's Stand were caught unawares as the Alliance poured through the pass at dawn's first light. Many of our bravest warriors fell before their blades."]="Fue una artimaña muy inteligente, $n. Las fuerzas de la Alianza salieron en masa del Fuerte del Norte, marcharon por el Camino del Oro y asediaron El Cruce al caer la noche. Después, en medio de la noche, avanzaron a marchas forzadas hacia el sur, dejando encendidas sus fogatas del campamento.\n\nLas fuerzas de la Alianza asomaron por el paso con la primera luz del día y pillaron por sorpresa a nuestras escasas fuerzas de El Alto del Honor. Muchos de nuestros guerreros más valientes cayeron bajo sus hojas."
G["It was a costly victory, but it could have been much worse. You have earned this reward."]="这是一场惨胜，但原本可能更惨。你赢得了这份奖励。"
G["It was a glorious assault. I'll give it that."]="那可真是场漂亮的突击战。我很佩服。"
G["It was a good day to fly!"]="真是航行的好天气！"
G["It was a long journey to get here. And we lost so many along the way.\n\nYet... look at this place. Astounding!"]="走了很长一段路才到这里。沿途之中我们错过了很多。\n\n但是……看看这个地方。太不可思议了！"
G["It was a pleasure. Stay safe $p."]="很高兴见到你。这里对你是安全的，$p"
G["It was a powerful feelin' while I was listenin' to yer sermon, and it's drivin' me nuts!"]="我在听你布道时，心中涌起了一股强烈的情感，我快疯掉了！"
G["It was a short time, for our part..."]="对我们来说，这点时光不过是弹指一挥间……"
G["It was a simple mistake. A wrong turn I tell you!"]="这是一个简单的错误。你只是转错弯了！"
G["It was all I could do to feign death as the corpses of the Scourge piled upon me. There was darkness and only the muffled sounds of the battle above me. The clashing of iron, the gnashing and grinding... gruesome, terrible sounds. And then there was silence. He called to me! \"Fairbanks! Fairbanks where are you? Talk to me Fairbanks!\" And then came the sound of incredulousness. The bite of betrayal, $r..."]="Era todo lo que podía hacer para fingir estar muerto mientras los cuerpos de los miembros de la Plaga se apilaban sobre mí. En la oscuridad, escuchaba los sonidos sordos de la batalla que se estaba librando. El golpear del hierro, el forcejeo, la lid... sonidos horripilantes. Y entonces se hizo el silencio y él me llamó. \"¡Ribalimpia! Ribalimpia, ¿dónde estás? ¡Dime algo, Ribalimpia!\" Y entonces se escuchó el sonido de la incredulidad, el momento de la traición, $r...\""
G["It was all her fault! She told us to steal it!"]="这全都是她的错！是她让我们偷的！"
G["It was all lies..."]="全是谎言……"
G["It was an accident. I was framed. Don't drop me!"]="是误会啊。我是被陷害的。别把我扔下去！"
G["It was an honor fighting you."]="与你交战，令我倍感荣幸。"
G["It was an honor to be defeated by you."]="被你击败是一种荣誉。"
G["It was an honor to watch you fight, $n."]="能亲眼见证你的战斗是我的荣幸，$n。"
G["It was awful... I dreamt I was fighting against my friends."]="这真可怕……我梦见我正在和自己的朋友作战。"
G["It was clear that our paths were set.  We were our own greatest enemies, and we were determined to destroy ourselves."]="很明显，从那以后，我们的种族已经在毁灭的道路上走出了很远。我们成了自己最大的敌人，成了毁灭自身的原因。"
G["It was dat angry orc.  He smushed dem!  Want Grok to smush him?"]="就是那个愤怒的兽人。他弄碎了它们！想让葛罗克去打他吗？"
G["It was delivered to the forgemaster at Deathwing's Fall.  I swear... that's all I know!"]="它被送到了死亡之翼的陨落地，交到了铸炉之主的手里。我就知道这么多了！"
G["It was dreadful, $c. Unceremoniously booted from Orgrimmar, jars of fresh squirming body parts smashed to the ground as I was hauled through the gates.\n\nLike I was some kind of monster!\n\nFortunately I've been able to continue my research here, where there's no shortage of fresh corpses."]="这太可怕了，$c。我被蛮横地赶出奥格瑞玛。当我被拖出奥格瑞玛的大门时，我的实验材料全都被扔在地上，被彻底毁了。\n\n他们对待我就好象对待某种可怕的怪物！\n\n幸运的是，我在这里还能继续我的研究。这里从不会缺乏新鲜的实验材料。"
G["It was during the Elemental Sundering that the Firelord, Ragnaros, would seek to consume my Lord, Thunderaan, Prince of Air.\n\n<Demitrian bows his head, his face contorted in rage.>\n\nSpeak his name and I shall decorate this ravaged camp with your entrails. Be silent and listen."]="Ocurrió durante el Cataclismo Elemental. El Señor del Fuego, Ragnaros, pretendía consumir a mi Señor, Thunderaan, Príncipe del Viento.\n\n<Demitrian inclina la cabeza con un gesto de cólera.>\n\nPronuncia su nombre y decoraré este campo arrasado con tus entrañas. Permanece en silencio y escúchame."
G["It was during those darkest of days that Goldrinn's tenacity in war became legendary. While others quaked at the visage of those demon hordes, their multitudes only spurred the great wolf ancient to ever greater feats of strength. He would wade into their ranks, fangs bared and spattered with their vile ichor, his great claws thrashing them by the dozen...\n\nIt was said he stayed behind to cover the Night Elf retreat from Eldre'Thalas, the ancient city we know now as Dire Maul.\n\nDid he die? I'm not certain the spirit of animal ferocity can ever truly die, $n."]="Fue en esos días oscuros cuando la tenacidad de Goldrinn en la batalla llegó a ser legendaria. Mientras los demás temblaban nada más ver el rostro de las hordas de demonios, aquellas multitudes animaban al gran ancestro lobo a realizar mayores hazañas de fuerza. Arremetía contra sus filas, mostrando los colmillos salpicados del vil icor de los demonios mientras sus enormes garras los destrozaban por docenas...\n\nSe decía que se quedó atrás para cubrir a los elfos de la noche en su retirada de Eldre'Thalas, la antigua ciudad que ahora conocemos como La Masacre.\n\n¿Acaso murió? No creo que un espíritu de una ferocidad animal como la suya pueda morir de verdad, $n."
G["It was folly for them to think us weak amidst recent events. There is no more hope for these trolls  - we will end this today."]="他们这群蠢货，竟然以为我们是软弱可欺的。这些巨魔已经没有希望了——今天将在我们手中结束。"
G["It was foolish of me to get caught away from the line. Thank you for the second chance."]="我真是个蠢货，竟然被引出了战线。谢谢你给我一个重来的机会。"
G["It was foolish of you to interrupt, outsider."]="Ha sido una insensatez interrumpirme, $gforastero:forastera;."
G["It was fun while it lasted...."]="过程本身还是很有趣的……"
G["It was horrible! They've all been changed!"]="太可怕了！他们全变成了机械！"
G["It was imperative that I first measure the bearing of your heart."]="所以我得先探明你的心意，这非常重要。"
G["It was inevitable!"]="这是必然结果。"
G["It was inevitable."]="这是必然的结局。"
G["It was just a couple of rivets. That ship had plenty!"]="只是几颗铆钉而已。船上多得是！"
G["It was just me and Gorrok. I let him take the lead... him bein' all big and all."]="只剩下我和格罗克。我让他打头阵了……因为他又高又壮嘛。"
G["It was just terrible. I was all slimy, and I kept licking my eyes!"]="太可怕了。我的皮肤变得黏糊糊的，我的舌头还一直在舔着自己的眼珠！"
G["It was kind of the Explorers' League to allow me to tag along. However, with the dangers in the Rivenwood and surrounding area, it looks like it may have been foolish of me to come without help."]="探险者协会允许我跟他们一起来真是太好了。但是裂木森林和周边区域实在是太危险，我没带帮手就闯了进来，真是蠢到家了。"
G["It was lost when the Violet Citadel fell... splintered into forty-two pieces."]="当紫罗兰城堡陨落时，它丢失了，破碎成了四十二块碎片。"
G["It was mighty kind of you to help me, $r. I'm in your debt."]="真是万分感谢你对我的帮助，$r。我欠你的人情。"
G["It was mind control boy. There's a difference. And don't worry. If big game huntin' were easy, everybody'd be doing it."]="那是精神控制，儿子。是有区别的。别担心。如果“王牌狩猎”那么容易，那就人人都能做到了。"
G["It was my Great Grandfather who first told me the tale of the mogu that I recently shared with you."]="我刚才与你分享的魔古族传说，最早是我曾祖父讲给我听的。"
G["It was my father's dream to see this place. I must carry out his wishes in his place."]="亲眼见到这个地方是我父亲的梦想。我必须在这里完成他的心愿。"
G["It was not always like this.\n\nThe Osul were not our enemies. They lived beside us. We assisted one another."]="情况并不总是这样。\n\n奥苏尔人以前并不是我们的敌人，他们和我们一起生活。我们相互帮助、互通有无。"
G["It was not enough.\n\n<Fairbanks smirks briefly, lost in a memory.>\n\nA thousand came and a thousand died. By the Light! By the might of Mograine! He would smite them down as fast as they could come. Through the chaos, I noticed that the lesser Mograine was still there, off in the distance. I called to him, \"Help us, Renault! Help your father, boy!\""]="No fue suficiente.\n\n<Ribalimpia dibujó una fugaz sonrisa, mientras recordaba.>\n\nVinieron mil y mil perecieron. ¡Por la Luz! ¡Por el poder de Mograine! Tan pronto se le acercaban recibían la fuerza de sus golpes. En medio del caos, me di cuenta de que el joven Mograine seguía allí, en la distancia. Lo llamé: \"¡Ayúdanos, Renault! ¡Ayuda a tu padre, chico!\""
G["It was not his fault. Tell him that..."]="告诉他，这不是他的错……"
G["It was not merely a name, for the World Pillar supported more than just the weight of this temple.  It must be rebuilt or all of Deepholm will collapse into Azeroth, with disastrous consequences for both worlds."]="世界之柱——可不止是个响亮的名字，它不仅承受着这座神殿的重量。如果它没有被复原，那么整个深岩之洲都向艾泽拉斯崩溃，这将会给两个世界都带来灭绝性的后果。"
G["It was not my intention to get you involved in this, $n.  I've spent every waking hour looking over my shoulder ever since I helped an old friend in a daring raid on Blackrock Spire."]="No pretendía involucrarte en esto, $n. Desde que ayudé a $gun viejo amigo:una vieja amiga; en un osado ataque a Cumbre de Roca Negra, no duermo tranquilo."
G["It was not so long ago that we had to wrest control of Thunderlord Stronghold from the nearby ogres.\n\nYou are here to help us maintain our defenses?  I know that Gor'drek is looking for assistance."]="不久以前，我们从周围的食人魔那里夺回了雷神要塞的控制权。\n\n你是来这里帮我们防守的吗？我知道高德雷克正在寻求帮助。"
G["It was not until after his controversial death that the knights and warriors of Lordaeron would wear similarly fashioned suits in honor of their fallen hero. While the death of Mograine was a great victory for Kel'Thuzad, the resulting martyrdom would be felt until the end of the war.\n\nWhere one did fall, many would rise..."]="在他不幸运遇难之后，全洛丹伦的骑士与战士都开始穿着相同式样的铠甲，以纪念这位倒下的英雄。尽管莫格莱尼的死可以算是克尔苏加德的一场大胜，但英雄之死的影响，却改变了整个战争最终的走势。\n\n一个人倒下了，但更多的人站了出来，为反抗天灾军团的入侵而战……"
G["It was not... enough."]="这还……不够。"
G["It was nothing, your majesty. Just... I'm proud of my king."]="没什么，陛下……我只是，为国王而自豪。"
G["It was on that day that the wildkin were given to us. Fierce guardians, the goddess assigned the wildkin to protect all of her sacred places."]="就在那天我们得到了枭兽。凶猛的守卫，女神派枭兽保护她所有的神圣之地。"
G["It was only a matter of time before we would have to deal with the Lich King. He represents a threat to all of Azeroth, not just the humans.\n\nBut, the decision to go to war is one that must not be made lightly. We would be fools to rush into Northrend. The Lich King has surely anticipated such an action.\n\nOur options must be weighed carefully. Our armies are mightier than ever, but a tactically unsound decision could ruin us.\n\nIf only Garrosh understood...."]="我们迟早要面对巫妖王的大军。他已经威胁到了整个艾泽拉斯的安全。\n\n但是，远征诺森德的事千万不能草率。贸然闯入极寒之地是愚蠢的行径。巫妖王想必早已做好了战争的准备。\n\n我们必须谨慎行事。没错，我们的军队实力雄厚；但是如果缺乏成熟的战略计划，那么我们终将落败。\n\n要是加尔鲁什明白这一点就好了……"
G["It was quite a haul, but now I can load up on supplies for the trip back into the Crater.  I should be able to unload some of this exotic cargo as well."]="货物非常多，但现在我可以再装载一些返回环形山了。我还可以卸载一不需要的部分货物。"
G["It was shattered when Deathwing broke through the dome above and created the rift between the two worlds.  All of Deepholm is going to collapse into Azeroth if we do not put the World Pillar back together."]="死亡之翼冲破了穹顶，在两个世界间制造了裂隙，世界之柱也裂成了碎片。如果我们不能让世界之柱复原，那么整个深岩之洲都会崩溃。"
G["It was shrouded in nightmares, Malfurion. What is happening in the Dream? What could cause such atrocities?"]="玛法里奥，梦魇里到处是尸体。究竟发生了什么事？是什么造成了这样的暴行？"
G["It was simple once I broke her spirit."]="摧毁她的精神对我来说很容易。"
G["It was so neat how you beat up those cats! They went and were like \"Grrrrr!\" and then you went and \"Wabang!\" and then you took their stuff."]="¡Ha sido genial la paliza que les has dado a los gatos! Se han puesto \"¡Grrrr!\" y luego tú \"¡Bum!\" y luego les has quitado cosas."
G["It was supposed to be a sure thing! I BET EVERYTHING!"]="那可是板上钉钉的事儿啊！我全都押上了！"
G["It was the Lieutenants of Ragnaros, Geddon and Garr, who would perpetrate the betrayal against my Lord. Thunderaan was caught unaware."]="拉格纳罗斯、迦顿和加尔背叛了我的领主。桑德兰王子在毫不知情的情况下被捕了。"
G["It was the mogu who built the Serpent's Spine. The most unlucky of slaves were sent to aid in its construction and defense, to be fodder for the mantid. And my people were afraid."]="是魔古族建造了蟠龙脊。运气最差的奴隶从事建造和防御工作，充当抵挡螳螂妖的炮灰。我的族人害怕极了。"
G["It was the sleep from which one could never awake. A great risk. A great sacrifice. But necessary."]="这一觉睡下去，也许再也无法醒来。风险极高。代价极大。但却必须这么做。"
G["It was the will of Ragnaros that Obsidion be built. Obsidion will destroy the Blackrock orcs of Blackrock Spire, uniting us with our bretheren in the fiery depths."]="拉格纳罗斯按照自己的意愿创造了奥比斯顿。奥比斯顿会毁掉黑石塔的黑石兽人，将我们和那些处于火热深渊中的兄弟们联合起来。"
G["It was then that I realized: he was hiding in the sun.  I looked up."]="这时我意识到：他正藏在太阳里。我向上望过去。"
G["It was when Arthas was at his weakest that I struck!"]="在阿尔萨斯最虚弱的时候，我发起了进攻！"
G["It was your leadership that manipulated a grieving child to try and recover the sword. A child that has grown into a man with nothing but vengeance and hatred in his heart! And for what? You are no closer to the sword now than you were five years ago."]="是你当时的指挥最终使得沉痛在无尽悲伤之中的孩子如此执着于重铸此剑。如今，这个孩子已经成长成人，可却彻底被复仇的意志与愤恨的偏见占据了身心。这都是为了什么？而且，比起五年前，你与这把剑渐行渐远了。"
G["It was your sacrifice, my son, that again saved me from eternal peril."]="那就是你的牺牲，我的儿子，再度拯救我于万劫不复。"
G["It was... a trap..."]="这是个……陷阱……"
G["It was... a worthy afterlife."]="我死的……很值得。"
G["It was... inevitable."]="这是……命运。"
G["It was... so dark..."]="真是……太黑了……"
G["It was... terrible... the demon..."]="太……太可怕了……恶魔……"
G["It wasn't I who foretold it, but Velen of the Draenei:"]="并不是我预言了这一切，而是德莱尼人的领袖维伦："
G["It wasn't me! $n did it, I swear!"]="不是我！我发誓，其实是$n干的！"
G["It wasn't me! I swear!"]="绝不是我！我发誓！"
G["It wasn't me, I swear!  You can't prove anything!"]="不是我，我发誓！你什么都证明不了！"
G["It wasn't my fault, Master Mazen!"]="那不是我的错，马森大人！"
G["It wasn't my food!"]="肯定不是我卖的食物！"
G["It wasn't ready to face the Shado-Pan."]="它还没准备好面对影踪派。"
G["It wasn't strictly voluntary, but I discovered something truly incredible. The beast seemed to be able to consume almost anything with no ill effects."]="这并非出于完全自愿，可我有个令人难以置信的大发现。这野兽看来能消化一切，而且从不会产生不良反应。"
G["It wasn't supposed to go this way. We were supposed to find the White Pawn. I should be back in Ironforge by now."]="计划出了些岔子，我们原本是要出来找白卒的。我这会儿早该回到铁炉堡了。"
G["It will all be over soon!"]="很快就会结束了！"
G["It will all end soon..."]="一切都会很快结束的……"
G["It will be a matter of hours before the Alliance in the Derelict Strand are crushed.  They are surrounded and outnumbered."]="击败荒弃海岸的联盟只是时间问题。他们已经被包围了，而且我们还占有数量优势。"
G["It will be a pleasure cleaving you in half!"]="把你打倒一定是一件令人愉快的事！"
G["It will be a pleasure shooting you down!"]="打倒你将是一件令人愉快的事！"
G["It will be alright, darling. Grieve no more..."]="Todo irá bien, $gquerido:querida;. No te aflijas más..."
G["It will be an honor to carry out King Wrynn's commission for a warrior so dedicated to the Alliance."]="Será un honor llevar a cabo la comisión del rey Wrynn para $gun guerrero:una guerrera; tan $gdedicado:dedicada; a la Alianza."
G["It will be as you say! Long live the Bilgewater Cartel! For the Horde!"]="就按照你说的去做！锈水财阀万岁！为了部落！"
G["It will be as you say, my lord."]="如您所愿，主人。"
G["It will be difficult to recover from such a loss."]="这真是个难以弥补的损失。"
G["It will be done!"]="该结束了！"
G["It will be done, Eranikus. Be well, ancient one."]="没问题，伊兰尼库斯。你要保重。"
G["It will be done, my lady."]="遵命，大人。"
G["It will be done, my lord!"]="遵命，大人！"
G["It will be done, my lord."]="遵命，大人。"
G["It will be done."]="我们会完成这个任务的。"
G["It will be much colder in your grave."]="你的坟墓会比这更加寒冷。"
G["It will be some time before I can recover from these injures. Still, I'm glad to be alive."]="我还需要一段时间来养伤。但我还是很高兴能活下来。"
G["It will be the most difficult battle we have ever faced, but our resolve and the power of the Sunwell will sustain us until we have been restored to our greatness."]="这场将是我们遭遇过的最残酷的一场战斗，但我们的决心和太阳之井的力量将始终支撑我们重返巅峰。"
G["It will be up to you to use the Horn of the Ancients and stop Soggoth's return."]="这次将由你来使用远古号角，阻止索苟斯的回归。"
G["It will destroy us, sister..."]="这会毁了我们的，姐妹们……"
G["It will feel good to rest after the statue is done."]="雕像完成后再休息一下应该会很不错。"
G["It will not be long, now before our work is finished."]="离我们完成任务的日子已经不远了。"
G["It will not end like this! I've worked too hard! So many years... I... I will consume more energy!"]="我不会束手就擒！我做了这么多的努力！这些年来……我……我需要更多的能量！"
G["It will not get me any closer to proving myself at Valhalas to kill you, but it should be entertaining!"]="就算杀了你，也不能证明我在瓦哈拉斯的地位，就当是消遣好了！"
G["It will take a sharp blade and reinforced armor to bring tranquility back to Nagrand. Shall I repair your equipment so that you may mete justice?"]="只有锋利的武器和坚固的护甲可以让纳格兰回归原有的宁静。让我修理你的装备吧，这样你才能去惩奸除恶。"
G["It will take a while, but these Broken Ones will learn the ways of the Light!"]="可能会需要一段时间，但这些破碎者终将学会如何使用圣光！"
G["It will take just a moment longer."]="只需要再等一小会儿。"
G["It will take many years for us to undo the damage that Magtheridon, Illidan and the fel orcs did to this holy place."]="要消除玛瑟里顿、伊利丹以及邪兽人对这片圣地所造成的破坏，我们还需要很多年的时间。"
G["It will take much time for the Vale to heal, but you have given us hope!"]="锦绣谷还要很久才能复原，但是你给了我们希望！"
G["It won't be easy. It's true that six out of every seven analysts won't live to see Demolitions Analyst II."]="这可不容易。实际上，每七名分析师里有六个无法活着晋升到二级爆破分析师。"
G["It won't be long before Fizzlebang is a household word, used to scare children into bed! \"Beware, or Fizzlebang will summon a mighty demon to eat you!\""]="¡No pasará mucho tiempo antes de que Chispobang sea una palabra muy conocida, que se use para asustar a los niños y que se vayan a la cama! \"¡Cuidado o Chispobang invocará a un poderoso demonio para que te coma!\""
G["It won't be long before we're out of supplies too, Captain. Between the trolls and the yeti raids, we'll be down to half rations within a week."]="我们的物资也就快要耗光了，队长。由于巨魔和雪人的袭击，一周之内我们的定额口粮就得减半。"
G["It won't be long now."]="不会让你久等的。"
G["It won't be much longer, $n. Just keep them off me while I work."]="不需要太久的，$n。不要让他们接近我。"
G["It won't be that easy, fiend!"]="恶魔，没那么容易！"
G["It won't bring our brothers and sisters back, but knowing that we are better than the yaungol helps us sleep better at night."]="这并不能让我们的兄弟姐妹复生，但知道自己胜过野牛人，会让我们晚上睡得更安稳。"
G["It won't happen again, $gsir:ma'am;."]="不会再有下一次，$g阁下:女士;。"
G["It won't matter, you'll be dead by tomorrow."]="区别不大，反正你明天就要挂了。"
G["It won't."]="不会的。"
G["It worked!  Amazing!  I guess I haven't lost my touch..."]="成功了！真让人惊讶……"
G["It worked!  The Proto-drake is falling!"]="成功了！始祖龙掉下来了！"
G["It worked! It wo-"]="起作用了！起作……"
G["It worked, just as I knew it would!\n\nBut even so, the effects of the stasis have surpassed even my original calculations."]="成功了，我就知道行的！\n\n但即便如此，静止的效果还是超过了我原先的计算。"
G["It works, Dorain! Look! It actually works..."]="成功了，多莱安！你看！它动起来了……"
G["It would appear as if the influence of the Black Dragonflight had extended beyond the borders of the Burning Steppes and into the kingdom of Stormwind itself! The usurper has since been unmasked and ousted."]="似乎黑龙的势力范围已经超越了燃烧平原，扩展到暴风城了！人们揭下了篡位者的面具并将他流放出境。"
G["It would appear dear that the Alliance has managed to collect everything needed for the war effort. Now all that we're waiting on are those poor Horde creatures to finish with theirs."]="似乎联盟已经集齐所有的战争物资了，现在我们只需等待那些可怜的部落完成他们的任务。"
G["It would appear that I've made a slight miscalculation. I allowed my mind to be corrupted by the fiend in the prison, overriding my primary directive. All systems seem to be functional now. Clear."]="看起来我的计算有一点小小的偏差。监狱中的恶魔侵蚀了我的思维，篡改了我的主要指令。所有系统都已恢复正常。完毕。"
G["It would appear that poor Lou really put his foot..."]="看来可怜的洛伊真把他的脚放进了……"
G["It would appear that we are being watched, Crowley. You have grown soft... Likely Greymane's fault."]="看来我们受到了监视，克罗雷。你的性格如此软弱……这应该是格雷迈恩的错。"
G["It would be a shame to let these leaflets go to waste, wouldn't it?"]="若是白白浪费掉这些传单就太可惜啦，不是吗？"
G["It would be an honor to battle alongside of you as a brother of the Horde, $n. I accept your offer."]="$n，能以部落的兄弟的身份与你并肩作战是我的荣幸。我接受你的提议。"
G["It would be an honor, Dark Lady."]="这是我的荣幸，黑暗女王。"
G["It would be an honor, Grand Anchorite."]="这是我的荣幸，资深学者。"
G["It would be my honor to join you in battle."]="和你并肩战斗是我的荣幸。"
G["It would be my honor to join you in battle. Speak to me on the hill if you have need of me."]="和你并肩战斗是我的荣幸。如果你需要我，就来山上找我吧。"
G["It would be my honor to sacrifice myself for what I believe."]="能为我所笃信的一切牺牲自己，是我的荣耀。"
G["It would be my honor, Kalecgos."]="这是我的荣幸，卡雷苟斯。"
G["It would be my pleasure, Matoclaw."]="这是我的荣幸，麦托克劳。"
G["It would be nice to leave the Vale some day, but it's so pretty here!"]="要是有一天能离开山谷也是不错的，可这里真是太漂亮了！"
G["It would be to your benefit for you to stay away from our holy grounds, $n."]="你最好还是离我们的圣地远点，$n。"
G["It would be unwise to assume that fighting a champion would be a simple task.  Are you sure you are ready?"]="别以为你可以轻而易举地战胜一位冠军。你确定自己已经准备好了吗？"
G["It would be unwise to assume that fighting a valiant would be a simple task.  Are you sure you are ready?"]="别以为你可以轻而易举地战胜一位勇士。你确定自己已经准备好了吗？"
G["It would be wise to explain to you the depths at which our enemies will go to to hide themselves under our noses.\n\nKnow this first and foremost: our enemy is the Shadow Council. No matter what task I give you, or who I ask you to act against, know that one simple fact.\n\nMany cults exist within the Council, but only to hide its actions against the foolish.\n\nGroups like the Burning Blade, the Argus Wake, and the Searing Blade are all tools of the Council. Consider them one and the same."]="我得向你解释，我们的敌人能安然地潜伏在我们的眼皮底下。\n\n首先要记住这一点：我们的敌人是暗影议会。无论我给你什么任务，或许无论我让你与谁对抗，你都必须明了这个事实。\n\n议会拥有许多信徒，但是其行动信息绝对不会透露给愚蠢的信徒。\n\n像火刃、阿古斯的觉醒和燃刃都是议会的工具。他们是一伙的。"
G["It would seem I underestimated your skills.  Well done."]="看来我低估了你的本事。干得不错。"
G["It would seem my guards are useless.  I will have to take care of you myself."]="看来我的守卫都是废物。我还得亲自来对付你们。"
G["It would seem so. You and your friends are welcome to as much as you can find. I suppose it's very potent. We don't need to go that often."]="看起来是这样。你和你的朋友们可以随意收集这些东西。我想，它可能是有些用处。我们可不是经常会有这些东西的。"
G["It would seem that a renegotiation is in order."]="看来我们有必要重新交涉一次。"
G["It would seem that you are not yet ready for the rank of valiant.  Some more training may serve you well."]="你暂时还不能取得勇士的头衔。你可能需要更多的训练。"
G["It would seem this \"sha\" energy is far more powerful than I previously thought."]="Parece que esa energía \"sha\" es mucho más poderosa de lo que pensábamos."
G["It would take a miracle to save the Commander, now."]="现在，只有奇迹才能拯救指挥官了。"
G["It would've succeeded if $n and I hadn't tracked the North Wind's historical corruptions to their source: your ancient battle."]="要不是$n和我循着北风扭曲历史的线索，找到了破坏的源头：你与北风的那场远古之战，它们的阴谋已经得逞了。"
G["It would've taken years to find the Book of the Raven without you, young sparrowhawk. Return to your home in Nagrand with our gratitude."]="年轻的麻鹰，如果没有你，我们恐怕要花上几年的时间才能找到乌鸦之书。带着我们的感激返回纳格兰吧。"
G["It wouldn't be long, however, before the city came under attack once again.  This time, the attack came from Illidan's armies. A large regiment of blood elves had been sent by Illidan's ally, Kael'thas Sunstrider, to lay waste to the city."]="然而好景不长，这座城市再次遭受了攻击。这次，发动进攻的是伊利丹的军队。伊利丹的同盟凯尔萨斯·逐日者派出了一大群血精灵来毁灭这座城市。"
G["It'd be an honor to spar with you, $gsir:ma'am;."]="能和你过招是我的荣幸，$g先生:女士;。"
G["It'll all be over soon. Soon you will be in the embrace of That Which Must Not Be Named!"]="一切即将结束。接受那位不可名状之存在的拥抱吧！"
G["It'll be done when it's done, darn it!"]="该煮好的时候自然会煮好的！"
G["It'll be good to hear de Darkspear drums once more. You take care now, Son of Sen'jin.  Bwonsamdi will be waitin' for ya... on de Other Side..."]="真高兴能再一次听到暗矛的鼓声。一切小心，森金之子。邦桑迪将在另一个世界，等待你的到来……"
G["It'll be okay ladies.  Just look at my painting and remember better days.  Or you can just look at me and imagine a better future."]="只需要这样就好，女士们。只要看看我的绘画，回忆一下那些更加美好的日子。或者你们可以看看我，想象一下更加美好的未来。"
G["It'll be quick, but it won't be painless!"]="我会很快解决你，而且会让你感到无比的痛苦！"
G["It'll be very tasteful!"]="那一定非常不错！"
G["It'll definitely not be anywhere in the Eastern Kingdoms, that's for sure.\n\nIt'll have to be somwhere on Kalimdor, but still far enough away from the Horde and other races. Someplace unaffected by the Sundering--that means no where near the Night elves' civilization either.\n\nI would guess it'd be someplace protected also... like a valley, or a crater. I don't know. I'm just guessing now. I'm sorry I couldn't help you more."]="那绝不是东部王国的任何一个地方。\n\n一定是在卡利姆多大陆的某处，但是距离部落和其他种族仍有相当遥远的距离。还没有受到分裂影响的某个地方——远离暗夜精灵文明的地方。\n\n我猜有人守护在那儿……就像守护山谷或是环形山一样；我不确定。我只是猜测。很抱歉我不能提供更多的帮助了。"
G["It'll never happen, Nat."]="这些永远都不会发生的，纳特。"
G["It'll take more than a rotting corpse to stop us!"]="妄图阻止我们的家伙必将付出惨痛的代价！"
G["It'll take more than you rabble to bring me down!"]="你这样的乌合之众是不可能打倒我的！"
G["It's \"Salty!\"  I got here firsht!  I got off the boat and onto land firsht!  I called the name \"Salty.\"  Hey... Where's your pet at?"]="¡Esh \"Salado\"! ¡Yo he llegado primero! ¡He shido la primera en deshembarcar y tocar tierra! He gritado el nombre \"Salado\". Hey... ¿Dónde eshtá tu mashcota?"
G["It's $n! Bow your heads!"]="瞧！$n！快鞠躬！"
G["It's $n, mighty $c and $g brother : sister; to ogres everywhere!"]="¡Es $n, $gpoderoso:poderosa:c; $c y $ghermano:hermana; de todos los ogros!"
G["It's ... your droppings!? And the goblins have been running around scooping it up?"]="这是……你拉出来的？！而地精们一直在忙着收集这些东西？"
G["It's 40 degrees Kraklenheit. Can you feel the heat? No? I really couldn't either."]="40克氏度。你觉得热吗？不觉得？我也不觉得。"
G["It's 428,000 degrees Kraklenheit... What's happening, hot stuff!?"]="428,000克氏度……怎么回事，这么热？"
G["It's BLOWIN' my mind!"]="我的脑子一片混沌！"
G["It's GO TIME! Come get sum! <replace this>"]="¡Es HORA DE IRSE! ¡Venid a por un poco de esto! <sustituye esto>"
G["It's Iskalder! Quickly, use The Bone Witch's Amulet!"]="是伊斯卡德尔。！快，使用白骨女巫的护符！"
G["It's Komak... Better get out of his way."]="是库马克……最好不要挡他的路。"
G["It's MINE!"]="这是我的！"
G["It's Proudmoore! Get out of here!"]="是普罗德摩尔将军！离开这儿！"
G["It's Quel'Delar! You possess the sword!"]="这是奎尔德拉！你获得了它！"
G["It's ROCKET TIME, ladies! Come and get it!"]="女士们，现在是火箭时间！来尝尝我的厉害吧！"
G["It's Sayena."]="是萨耶娜。"
G["It's Stormstout time!"]="风暴烈酒时间！"
G["It's a Pandaren board game. The object is for both players to win."]="这是一种熊猫人的棋盘游戏。目标是双赢。"
G["It's a bloodbath, lieutenant. They've been murdered."]="真是场惨祸啊，中尉。他们都被谋杀了。"
G["It's a cold, bloody battle we wage in Alterac Valley.  It's perfect."]="我们在奥特兰克山谷发动的战斗冷酷而血腥。太完美了。"
G["It's a complete and total barf-o-rama! RUN FOR YOUR LIVES!"]="呕！逃命吧！"
G["It's a day of reckoning, $c!"]="今天是审判日，$c！"
G["It's a difficult job keeping the steam tanks up and running by yourself, but someone has to do it."]="要独自开动并驾驶蒸汽坦克可不是件简单的活儿，但总得有人去做。"
G["It's a done deal, soldier. The replacement flare gun is in your pack. Don't lose this one!"]="好了，士兵。新的信号枪已经装到你的包里了，不要再把它弄丢了。"
G["It's a female."]="这是一头雌性野兽。"
G["It's a fire!  Hurry up mon!"]="着火了！动作快伙计！"
G["It's a good thing I love building ships, because these pirates love blowing them up."]="幸好我很喜欢建造船只，因为那些海盗总喜欢把船炸飞。"
G["It's a good thing I showed up when I did!\n\nI'm guessing we haven't seen the last of that Schnottz fellow."]="幸好我及时出现了！\n\n我想我们还没见到那最后一个司克诺兹成员。"
G["It's a good thing I spend all my spare time tinkering on my greatest passion: High-power directed explosives!\nLet's use some to set up defensive positions at the gates."]="Menos mal que dedico todo mi tiempo libre a mi mayor pasión: ¡los explosivos dirigidos de alta potencia!\n\nVamos a utilizar unos cuantos para establecer posiciones de defensa cerca de las puertas."
G["It's a good thing I was able to make duplicates of the Felsworn Gas Mask."]="我能制造出完全相同的魔誓防毒面具来，这真是件好事。"
G["It's a good thing my Uncle Chen told me not to get into any fights, otherwise you'd be dead meat, turtle!"]="幸好陈叔告诫过我不要打架，不然你死定了，缩头乌龟！"
G["It's a good thing the captain made it through. He'll know how to get us out of this mess."]="船长总算挺住了。他会想办法把我们从这混乱中救出去。"
G["It's a good thing you came along - I could not resolve this alone."]="很高兴你能前来——我一个人没法解决这个问题。"
G["It's a good thing you came along, ally! We were done for!"]="¡Qué bien que has venido, $galiado:aliada;! ¡No teníamos salida!"
G["It's a good thing you guys showed up! The Iron Dwarves have pushed us back to this location, and we're barely managing to hold the line here. \nEven worse, they've begun to power up their magical defenses. If we don't attack soon, they'll be able to annihilate us in the blink of an eye!\nWe've managed to rebuild several siege machines, demolishers and motorcycles from the Alliance and Horde expeditions that were here before us. However, all of our pilots died in the last assault.\nYou must take the vehicles and storm the gates of Ulduar! \nPlease, $n! You're our last hope!"]="¡Que os hayais presentado son buenas noticias! Los enanos férreos nos han hecho retroceder hasta este lugar, y apenas estamos consiguiendo mantener la posición. \n\nY, lo que es peor, han empezado a reforzar sus defensas mágicas. ¡Si no atacamos pronto serán capaces de aniquilarnos en un abrir y cerrar de ojos!\n\nNos las hemos apañado para reconstruir varias máquinas de asedio, demoledores y motocicletas de expediciones de la Alianza y de la Horda que estuvieron aquí antes que nosotros.\n\n¡Por favor, $n! ¡Eres nuestra última esperanza!"
G["It's a great assignment, yeah, but \"all looking and no touching\" gets old after a while."]="Es una gran misión, sí, pero \"solo mirar y no tocar\" cansa después de un rato."
G["It's a little damaged, but I should still be able to get some good information from this."]="虽然有点破损，但我还是能从其中获得一些有用的信息。"
G["It's a little late... for that... $G lad:lass;.\n\n<The Frostborn Scout coughs up some blood on the snow.>\n\nGet... that wench in charge for me...\n\n<The Frostborn Scout slumps over as he breathes his last breath.>"]="Es un poco tarde... para eso... $gmuchacho:muchacha;.\n\n<El explorador Natoescarcha tose algo de sangre sobre la nieve.>\n\nCoge... al joven que está al mando por mí.\n\n<El explorador Natoescarcha se desploma mientras exhala su último aliento.>"
G["It's a long way down...."]="这可要很久才能落地的……"
G["It's a mighty good day, is it not? I do hope we see a few fireworks before this day is through."]="今天是个好日子，不是吗？希望今天结束的时候我们能欣赏到焰火表演。"
G["It's a miracle! The beast skinned itself!"]="真是怪事！这畜生剥掉了自己的皮！"
G["It's a monastery, of course!\n\nThe monks here at Tian Monastery specialize in teaching young pandaren - like me - how to fight. All the great fighters started here: Yu Ming the Blade, Liang the Unbreakable... even the great emperor Shaohao studied at this very temple.\n\nOr so the legends say."]="当然是一座禅院！\n\n天禅院的武僧专门教授像我一样的年轻熊猫人如何战斗。所有的战斗大师都是在这里诞生的：剑仙宇明、铁布衫梁……甚至连伟大的帝王少昊都是在这座寺院学习的。\n\n或者至少传闻是这么说的。"
G["It's a mystery of the past indeed! But a key to our future!"]="过去的事情谁也说不清，但重要的是我们的未来！"
G["It's a one-seater plane, but you can always sit up on the fuselage. It's perfectly safe.\n\nYou ready?"]="这是一架单座飞机。但你可以骑在机身上。这非常安全。\n\n准备好了吗？"
G["It's a pity so many fine, and reusable, parts will go to waste..."]="哎呀，这些质量上等，可以重复利用的零件都要报废啦……真是可惜……"
G["It's a pleasure to meet you as well, Arch Druid. I am on a task from Tirion and time is short, might I trouble you for a portal to Moonglade?"]="很高兴见到你，大德鲁伊。我奉提里奥之命执行一项重要的使命，时间紧迫，你能送我去月光林地吗？"
G["It's a pleasure to see someone sane around here. How can I help you?"]="我很高兴看到有个心智健全的$r在这里。有什么我可以帮你的吗？"
G["It's a pleasure to see you again, $n.  Your aid has provided us with a considerable boost in the security of our supply lines.  I hope you understand the importance of the logistics involved in large battle efforts such as this."]="我很高兴再见到你，$n。你的帮助为我们保证了补给线的安全。我希望你可以理解在如此一场大战中，物资补给的重要性。"
G["It's a pretty smooth ride if you don't mind the dust."]="如果你不介意这些沙尘，那这就是一次很不错的旅行。"
G["It's a real honor to be able to aid Brann in exploring ancient Ulduar."]="能协助布莱恩探索泰坦古城奥杜尔的秘密真是莫大的荣幸。"
G["It's a real honor, $n. Maybe we can have a sitdown soon and you can regale me with your latest exploits?"]="这真是莫大的荣誉，$n。也许我们稍后能找个机会一起坐坐，听你给我讲讲你最近的义举？"
G["It's a relief to be surrounded by normal gnomes again!"]="能再次回到正常侏儒的中间，实在是让人松了口气！"
G["It's a rescue attempt!  Let no one escape!"]="他们想要救走人质！一个活口都别留！"
G["It's a rescue attempt!  Slay them all!"]="他们想要救走人质！杀了他们！"
G["It's a secret to everybody... including me!\n\nI'm glad you found me -- it's a good thing I'm not hiding in a bush or underneath a rock, isn't it?"]="对任何人而言……包括我，这都是一个秘密！\n\n很高兴你找到了我——我没躲藏在树丛中或是岩石下，挺幸运的，是吧？"
G["It's a simple process for a craftsman of my caliber.\n\nThe most difficult aspect of crafting items out of beast hides and carapace is the actual acquisition of said parts. Now, if you could bring me a pristine hide from this beast, I could make several different powerful items from the flesh."]="对我这样的工匠来说，制造的流程本身是很简单的。\n\n困难之处在于获得原料。如果你能为我取回一块完美的比斯巨兽的皮，我就能用它制作出一些强大的装备。"
G["It's a small comfort to see that they haven't brought any back in undeath."]="唯一值得欣慰的是，他们没有变成亡灵。"
G["It's a start. Thanks Ergll."]="这是个好的开始。谢谢，厄格尔罗。"
G["It's a strain, but I shouldn't have let it affect me.  I... I should have been better to my sister."]="我不应当让这种失常影响到我。我……我应该比我的姐妹们要好受一些。"
G["It's a strange order, you can't deny. Suspicious food? Under that definition, you should arrest Belfast!"]="奇怪的命令，你无法否认这一点。可疑食物？凭这一点，你就应该逮捕贝法斯！"
G["It's a testament to our race's tenacity that Fairbreeze Village still stands.  We shall never concede defeat to the Scourge ever again."]="晴风村仍然存在，这是对我们种族坚韧不屈的精神的证明。我们绝不让步，直到永远地击败天灾军团。"
G["It's a traaaap!"]="这是陷阱！"
G["It's a wonder these mantid keep coming back for more."]="真奇怪，这些螳螂妖总能卷土重来。"
G["It's a wonderful day to be alive, isn't it?"]="真是美好的一天啊，不是吗？"
G["It's about time we got another shipment. I heard they were having trouble at the mines, but our work cannot wait."]="下一批货应该已经送到了才对。我听说矿山那里出了麻烦，可我们的工作是不能拖延的。"
G["It's about time we returned to the Highlands! \"Twilight\" be damned."]="¡Ya era hora de que volviéramos a las Tierras Altas! Maldito sea el \"Crepúsculo\"."
G["It's about time we started doing something."]="我们该开始着手做些什么了。"
G["It's about time ye showed up. Doomsday is a comin'."]="是你该登场的时候了。末日正在逼近。"
G["It's about time you asked! I was wondering when Farmer Yoon would ever notice me. You go ahead, and I'll be there after I'm done at the market today."]="正好是你要求的时间！我想知道农夫老愚会什么时候通知我。你先走，今天市集的生意结束后，我会在那里和你会合。"
G["It's about time you asked! I was wondering when Farmer Yoon would ever notice me. You go ahead, and I'll be there soon."]="正好是你要求的时间！我正在考虑农夫老愚什么时候才会想到我。你先去吧，我很快就到。"
G["It's about time you got here, $n. This battle isn't going to win itself!"]="你终于来了，$n。什么都不做可赢不了这场战斗！"
G["It's about time you showed up with this!"]="我就在想，你和我的酒差不多该出现了！"
G["It's about time!  I'm sick of being a slave!"]="你们来得正好！我早就厌倦作奴隶了！"
G["It's about time!  Lurid was getting bored."]="是时候了！鲁瑞德早就耐不住了！"
G["It's about time! I'm parched over here!"]="总算来了！我都快渴死了！"
G["It's about time! You know how long I've been treading water here?"]="是时候了！你知道我已经在这儿踩了多久水了？"
G["It's about to blow, jump on the Wyverns!"]="它要爆炸了！快跳上飞龙！"
G["It's about to get crazy up in here, Pat. Don't say another word!"]="你快把我避疯了！闭嘴！"
G["It's about to get even more awe-inspiring."]="它甚至令人心生敬畏。"
G["It's across the bridge from the gate to The Drag. Listen for the sound of shouting goblins."]="就在通向暗巷区大门的桥对面。仔细听那些地精的喊叫就能找到了。"
G["It's admirable what The League of Arathor is attempting to do in Arathi Basin.  Too bad those undead abominations and their Horde friends are standing in the way.  Head over to Stormwind Keep.  Lady Hoteshem awaits you in the King's audience chamber.  She can help you to get to Arathi Basin."]="阿拉索联军在阿拉希盆地所做的一切令人敬佩。可惜亡灵憎恶和他们的部落盟友挡住了去路。去暴风要塞国王的觐见室找赫塔希姆吧，她会帮助你前往阿拉希盆地。"
G["It's afraid!"]="它害怕了！"
G["It's afraid."]="它害怕了。"
G["It's after me now, get behind it and do all the damage you can!"]="它在追我，绕到它后边去，使出全力攻击它！"
G["It's after you!  Don't let it get close."]="它在追你！别让它接近。"
G["It's alive!"]="它是活的！"
G["It's alive, $n. It's alive!"]="它还活着，$n。它还活着！"
G["It's all I can do to keep these wards up. Find one of the Archmages, Kalytha! I feel like I'm about to collapse..."]="我只能维持住这些结界。卡莱莎！赶快去找到一位大法师。我觉得我就要崩溃了……"
G["It's all I can do to keep this ship from tearing itself apart and I still have to deal with puffed up baffoons like Fizzle here!"]="我已经尽力让这艘船不至于散架，我能做的就这么多，而且我还得腾出精力去对付像菲兹尔那样自吹自擂的小丑！"
G["It's all I can do to stop from staring at the sun. It never moves.\n\nJust what IS this place?"]="我已经尽力不去看太阳了。它是不会移动的。\n\n这到底是什么地方？"
G["It's all a mess, $c, and it's all my fault! I was warned to get out of dock while there was still time, but did I listen? No.\n\nWhat am I going to do now? Those sickly blood elves, the Wretched, have made off with my magical goods, and ate them I think. I'm pretty sure that means they can't be retrieved. And the Grimscale murlocs pirated away the rest of my goods in the dead of night! Furthermore, to kick an honest merchant when she's down, my crew abandoned ship!\n\nI think I'm going to cry."]="一切都糟透了，$c，这一切都是我的错！当时间还不算晚的时候，我被告知最好立即离开码头，但是我听了吗？没有。\n\n现在我要干什么？那些病态的失心者偷走了我的魔法货物，我想他们已经把这些东西都吃了。我很确信这意味着它们再也没法拿回来了。而暗鳞鱼人在一个死寂的夜晚抢夺了我剩余的货物！另外，对于我这样正直的商人来说，雪上加霜的事情是，我的船员都逃走了！\n\n我真是欲哭无泪。"
G["It's all about the brewkegs - keep them from burning!"]="关键在于那些酒桶——别让它们起火！"
G["It's all about those Emperor Crabs. Sweet, blue gold is what they are."]="全是关于那些君王蟹的事情。亲爱的，他们就是蓝色黄金。"
G["It's all around us. It's in my head!"]="它就在我们身边。就在我的脑海里！"
G["It's all clear then?"]="那么，警报解除了吗？"
G["It's all gone to hell, $c!"]="全都下地狱了，$c！"
G["It's all guns and flames until someone loses and dies."]="枪炮与硝烟弥漫，直到某一方被摧毁。"
G["It's all here... how the raven's followers captured and subdued the spirits of rivals, trapping them forever within stone statues! The tablet even mentions the raven god's name -- Anzu. I'd thought it was lost to history!"]="一切都真相大白了……乌鸦之神的追随者将敌人的灵魂永久地禁锢在石像中，以此俘获和制服他们。石板甚至提到了乌鸦之神的名字——安苏。我一直以为他的名字早已湮没在历史的长河中！"
G["It's all in ruins..."]="一切都化为了废墟……"
G["It's all or nothing, $n. Thunderpaw Refuge needs us. Are you ready to finish this thing?"]="Es todo o nada, $n. El Refugio Zarpa Atronadora nos necesita. ¿Estás $glisto:lista; para acabar con esto?"
G["It's all over 'cept for the crying now. All of the war materiel is being transported to Cenarion Hold in Silithus, and the last of it will be there in less than a day. Shouldn't be much longer until the scepter is assembled and the war finally begins."]="时局紧张，所有的战争物资都在运往希利苏斯塞纳里奥要塞的途中，预定将在1天内全部抵达。一旦有人修复节杖，战争也就离我们不远了。"
G["It's all over 'cept for the crying now. All of the war materiel is being transported to Cenarion Hold in Silithus, and will be there in less than $2113w days. Shouldn't be much longer until the scepter is assembled and the war finally begins."]="时局紧张，所有的战争物资都在运往希利苏斯塞纳里奥要塞的途中，预计将在$2113w天内全部抵达。一旦有人修复节杖，离战争也就不远了。"
G["It's all over..."]="完蛋了……"
G["It's all their fault, stupid Alliance army. Just had to build their towers right behind my farm."]="这都是他们的错，愚蠢的联盟军队。居然在我的农场背后修建他们的哨塔。"
G["It's all their fault, stupid orcs. Had to burn my farm to the ground."]="这都是他们的错，愚蠢的兽人。居然放火烧我的农场。"
G["It's all true, brother. Every word. You doubted it?"]="全是真的，兄弟。每个字都是真的。你有所怀疑吗？"
G["It's all your fault! It was supposed to be dead! Now it ate your brains!"]="这都是你的错！它本该已经死了！现在它吃掉了你的脑子！"
G["It's all... coming back to me...."]="啊……那道光……"
G["It's almost here. Get ready!"]="马上就要到了。做好准备！"
G["It's alright, girl. Relax."]="没事儿，姑娘。放松。"
G["It's also coming right at us.  Watch out for the mouth!"]="它向我们冲过来了。小心！"
G["It's always nice when someone wishes to speak to me. How are things with you, $c?"]="有人找我谈话总是件高兴的事儿。事情进展如何，$c？"
G["It's amazing how much you've helped us out.  We dare say that if it weren't for you, we'd already have been overrun by the demons, or fried to a crisp by the Black Dragonflight!\n\nOn a side note, we did mention that we'd sell you one of our sons, cheap, right?  No, not interested?"]="你给予了我们这么多帮助，真是令我们感到惊讶。要是没有你，我们肯定早就被恶魔或是黑龙给撵出了家园！\n\n顺便说一句，我们提过想要将一个孩子便宜卖给你，对吧？不要？你不感兴趣吗？"
G["It's amazing what you can learn from a gnome if you squeeze them hard enough: clever little tricks about getting out of a bind, making delicious cookies, and even how to make a flying machine."]="如果你狠狠地捏一个侏儒，是可以学到很多东西的：比如说逃脱的小伎俩，制作美味的曲奇饼干，甚至可以学到如何制造飞行器。"
G["It's amazing!"]="真是惊人啊！"
G["It's an ambush! Defend yourself!"]="有埋伏！小心！"
G["It's an angry male!"]="这是一头愤怒的雄性野兽！"
G["It's an attack!"]="被攻击了！"
G["It's an honor to have a $r such as yourself aiding us ogres.  You're keeping our hope of a better future alive.\n\nNow if we could just get rid of these headaches.  Are you sure you don't want one of our sons?"]="Es un honor que $gun:una; $r como tú nos ayude a los ogros. Mantienes viva nuestra esperanza de un futuro mejor.\n\nSi tan solo pudiéramos librarnos de estos dolores de cabeza... ¿Estás seguro de que no quieres uno de nuestros hijos?"
G["It's an honor to have a hero like you among us, $n."]="Es un honor tener a $gun héroe:una heroína; como tú entre nosotros, $n."
G["It's an honor to serve with you, $n."]="$n，能为您效劳，我感到很荣幸。"
G["It's an honor to share the battlefiend with you, my liege."]="能与您并肩作战是我的荣幸，国王陛下。"
G["It's an honor, $n. Welcome back to the Cradle of Chi-Ji."]="荣幸之至，$n。欢迎回到赤精栖木。"
G["It's an ugly word, you know? It's a word I'd use to describe defecating. For example:"]="这是个非常不雅的词汇，你知道吗？我常把这个词和上大号联系在一起。比如说："
G["It's as if you were reading my mind."]="你太了解我了。"
G["It's as sure as the warts on my backside!"]="就像我背上的瘤那样千真万确。"
G["It's back to the Undermine with the lot of you!"]="我要把你们都派回到安德麦去！"
G["It's beautiful!"]="真美啊！"
G["It's beautiful! ...have we figured out what it does yet?"]="这可真漂亮！……我们有没有搞清楚它是做什么的？"
G["It's been a busy day in the air, eh $n?  Maybe you should take a moment to catch your breath before going back out."]="$n，繁忙的航程是吧？在返回战场之前，你最好先喘口气。"
G["It's been a kick, really."]="一场完胜，绝对的完胜。"
G["It's been a long day of cutting down the mindless Scourge that endlessly parade down the Dead Scar.  I hope you're here to lend a hand and not to waste my time with idle chatter."]="消灭在死亡之痕徘徊的愚蠢的天灾士兵，这可真是个单调的工作。我希望你能在这里助我们一臂之力，而不是把我的时间浪费在闲聊中。"
G["It's been a long journey to get here, hon. Thank you!\n\nLet's get off of this island now."]="这可真是个漫长的旅程啊，宝贝儿。谢谢你！\n\n现在让我们离开这座岛吧。"
G["It's been a long time since last I tasted $r."]="上次品尝$r的美味已经是很久之前的事啦。"
G["It's been a pleasure serving with you."]="能与你一起战斗是我的荣幸。"
G["It's been a pleasure, Mr. Anvilward.  I must say your enthusiastic interest in our operations is most... unexpected."]="我很荣幸，安威瓦尔德先生。我必须得说，你对我们的工作表现出来的兴趣……真令人意想不到。"
G["It's been a while since I lost to a trainee. Thank you for the match."]="我有一阵子没输给过弟子了。谢谢你跟我切磋。"
G["It's been awhile, $n."]="好久不见，$n。"
G["It's been hard for our scouts to get information on what Crushcog is planning."]="我们的侦察兵很难获知碎轮的计划。"
G["It's been hard on all of us, but we're getting by.\n\nYou've just gotta roll up your sleeves and do what needs to be done."]="这对我们所有人来说都很困难，可我们正在勉强支撑。\n\n你要做的就是挽起袖子，做你该做的事。"
G["It's been passed down from ancient times, but none of our people have needed to use it since then."]="这是从古时候传下来的，但我们的人民从来不需要用到这个。"
G["It's been quite some time since someone was brave enough to challenge me."]="已经很久没人敢挑战我了。"
G["It's been quite the pleasure workin' with yeh, $glad:lass;.\n\nI'd be honored ta do so again sometime."]="和你合作感觉很愉快，$g小伙子:小姑娘;。\n\n希望今后能与你再次携手。"
G["It's been recklessly engineered with a merciless disregard for both budgetary concerns and those cumbersome, inefficient \"laws of physics.\""]="Se ha diseñado arriesgadamente con una despreocupación implacable hacia los límites presupuestarios y esos obstáculos poco eficientes que llamamos \"leyes de la física\"."
G["It's been so long since I was a novice myself that I don't think I'd be the best teacher for you. Try talking to Tarn or Mak, right over there. One of them should be able to answer your questions."]="我自己不久前也是一个新手，所以我觉得我不太适合教你。试着跟那边的塔恩或是玛克谈谈。他们之中应该有人能回答你的问题。"
G["It's been so long since a traveler has come here bearing flowers."]="已经很久没有手捧鲜花的旅行者到这里来了。"
G["It's been too long since I last tasted Charbroiled Tiger Steak."]="自从我上次吃过碳烤虎肉排到现在已经很长时间了。"
G["It's been years since I last worked moonsteel, but I haven't forgotten the technique. Dane, join me at the anvil."]="我上次加工月钢已经是多年以前的事情了，但我还没有忘记这个技术。丹恩，到铁砧旁去等我。"
G["It's best not to get on the bad side of those that prepare your food. However, I'm not sure this patron has anything but a bad side..."]="最好不要把坏的一面暴露给那些帮你准备食物的人。但这位老主顾似乎完全没有好的一面……"
G["It's better than the drawings in the history tomes."]="这比光看历史书上的图片要好多了。"
G["It's bigger than two houses!"]="比两座房子还大！"
G["It's breathtaking."]="真是震撼人心。"
G["It's broken again?! I'll fix it... just don't expect the warranty to cover this."]="它又坏了？！我会把它修好……但我可不保证它一定能好用。"
G["It's broken already?! No worries. It's nothing I can't fix."]="它已经坏了？！别担心，没有我修不好的。"
G["It's broken."]="它断了。"
G["It's busting out of the cage!  Arm the shock collar, get that thing under control!"]="它要从笼子里冲出来了！快用电击项圈控制住它！"
G["It's calling allies!  I'll keep him busy while you handle them."]="它在召唤援军！我来拖住它，你把增援干掉。"
G["It's calling out more sha! Focus them down first, $p!"]="它在召唤更多的煞魔！先集中消灭它们，$p！"
G["It's chaos up there. We need to save whoever we can, and we'll need to move quickly."]="上面一片混乱。我们得尽力救人，而且要快。"
G["It's cold up there. And dangerous!"]="那儿可真冷，而且很危险！"
G["It's comin right for us!"]="冲我们来了！"
G["It's coming along, Wafflefry. Haven't you got a product demonstration to do or something?"]="一切进展顺利，瓦菲雷。你不是要去做些产品示范之类的事情吗？"
G["It's coming right for me!"]="它冲我来了！"
G["It's coming right for us!"]="它冲我们来了！"
G["It's dark in here!"]="这里好黑啊！"
G["It's dead! You're an inspiration to the Kirin Tor!"]="它死了！你激励了我们的士气！"
G["It's demotions for everyone if the Sharks beat the Buccaneers!"]="如果鲨鱼队击败了海盗队，所有人都要降职！"
G["It's do or die, chaps! No turnin' back!"]="非生即死，伙计们！无路可退！"
G["It's do or die, men! Don't shoot till you see the crazy in their eyes!"]="伙计们，是生是死就看这一战了！不要盲目射击，直到你们能看清他们眼中的疯狂时，再狠狠宣泄你们的子弹吧！"
G["It's done $n, and I think you'll be satisfied with the results."]="Listo, $n, creo que estarás $gsatisfecho:satisfecha; con los resultados."
G["It's done! Those of you who have the will to save this land, follow me! The rest of you... get out of my sight!"]="就这样吧！有谁希望拯救这片土地的，就跟我来！其他人……给我滚远点！"
G["It's done. The Fist of Garrosh is dropping the bomb."]="完成了。加尔鲁什之拳正在丢炸弹。"
G["It's down!  Let's finish it off."]="它掉下来了！打败它！"
G["It's driving me crazy. I cannot reach those damned eggs!"]="我快要疯了。我碰不到那些该死的蛋！"
G["It's enough to drive a man to drink."]="这足够逼得一个人去喝闷酒了。"
G["It's far too hot to work out here - especially in these uniforms."]="在这里工作实在是太热了——特别是还要穿着这身制服。"
G["It's fascinating... I have heard orcs proclaim the odor of humans to be sickening and I have heard humans proclaim the odor of orcs to be wretched; yet, to me, all of the races of these lands give off the same odor: The foul, dizzying scent of greed.\n\nDo you doubt the validity of my claim? Do you not see these things that run your life as merely runoff from the greed which dictates your every decision?\n\nSo be it. As it was greed that displaced me from my home, it shall be greed that takes me back."]="真有趣……我总是听到人类和兽人互相抱怨对方的名声是多么的差。对我来说，世界上所有种族都是一样的：他们都是笨蛋，而且脑子里只有贪婪两个字。\n\n你觉得我在胡言乱语？你难道没有发现你的生命只是为了满足贪婪的欲望而度过的吗？\n\n所有人都是这样。贪婪让我离开了家园，贪婪也会让我重新回去。"
G["It's finally over..."]="总算结束了……"
G["It's flavor is intended for friends to share after a battle. Come... friend... and battle me if you dare."]="Su sabor está dirigido a los amigos que comparten una jarra tras una batalla. Ven... $gamigo:amiga;... y lucha conmigo si te atreves."
G["It's for the best."]="这是最好的结局。"
G["It's gettin' awful crowded in here.  I don't do well in confined spaces."]="这里真是拥挤得令人窒闷。我在密闭空间里总是感到不自在。"
G["It's getting a little hot over here. Shall we move on?"]="这里越来越热了。我们继续前进吧？"
G["It's getting away!"]="它跑开了！"
G["It's getting closer!  Shoot it down!"]="它靠近了！把它击落！"
G["It's go time!"]="该出发了！"
G["It's going to blow!"]="就要爆炸了！"
G["It's going to take a bit of work, but I think we can save this blood elf's life."]="这可能比较麻烦，但是我想我们能够拯救这个血精灵的生命。"
G["It's gone. I can't believe it's gone. Who would have thought we'd be betrayed like this?"]="没了。我不敢相信它已经没了。谁能料到我们居然遭受了这么残酷的背叛？"
G["It's gonna be fine, Baine. We gonna find Thrall, gonna kill de Warchief, gonna avenge your father."]="没事的，贝恩。我们会找到萨尔，打倒酋长，为你父亲报仇的。"
G["It's gonna be veal tonight!"]="今天晚上有肉吃啦！"
G["It's good te see you though, brother. More than words can say."]="见到你我还是很高兴的。我真是激动得不知道说什么好了。"
G["It's good to be back out in the field. Nice change of pace from being cooped up in Stormwind all of the time."]="真高兴能回到原野上。这里比暴风城的那些鸽子笼舒服多了。"
G["It's good to be back, overseer. I want to help carry out the ritual."]="很高兴能回来，先知。我想为仪式的完成而出力。"
G["It's good to be in the thick of it again."]="再次投身激烈的战斗，这种感觉真好。"
G["It's good to be outta dat cage. Dey were goin' to sacrifice me..."]="能从笼子里逃出来太好了，他们正要把我当祭品呢……"
G["It's good to be the king!  Now, let's get back to what you were talking about before..."]="当国王真好！现在，让我们继续谈谈你刚才说的事儿……"
G["It's good to be your own boss!\n\nHey could you spare a couple copper for a sandwich? I'm starved."]="能当自己的老板实在是件好事！\n\n嘿，你能给我几个铜板，让我买个三明治吗？我快饿死了。"
G["It's good to finally see you, courier. Krasus has entrusted us with one of the few remaining copies of Ancient Dragonforged Blades."]="Me alegro de verte al fin, $gmensajero:mensajera;. Krasus nos ha confiado una de las pocas copias que quedan de Hojas antiguas forjadas por los dragones."
G["It's good to have traveling companions.  The road gets lonely out here."]="旅途中有人作伴的感觉真好。否则一路上孤孤单单的。"
G["It's good to have veterans like you in Alterac Valley, $n.  Our supplies are too low to launch a ground assault through Alterac Valley... speak with our quartermaster - he'll tell you how to increase our supply base."]="能在奥特兰克山谷找到你这样经验丰富的家伙真好，$n。我们的军需不够，无法发动对奥特兰克山谷的地面攻击……跟我们的军需官谈谈——他会告诉你如何增加我们的军需储备。"
G["It's good to have you back, Varok, old friend. I'm sorry about your boy."]="老朋友，见到你真高兴。对小萨鲁法尔的遭遇，我很抱歉。"
G["It's good to hear the voices of others here in Forest Song again. I'd begun to feel as though I might be the last of the kaldorei ever to set eyes on these lands before their descent into corruption."]="能在林歌神殿听到其他的人的声音，这可真是太好了，我都开始觉得自己可能是留在这里的最后一个卡多雷了。"
G["It's good to see a $r, such as yourself, contributing to the well-being of Sylvanaar.  We've done a lot here in a very short time, but the forces that surround us threaten our way of life.\n\nI would hear what you have to say.  Speak your mind, $c."]="Me alegro de ver a $gun:una; $r como tú ayudando para que Sylvanaar sea un lugar mejor. Hemos hecho mucho en muy poco tiempo, pero las fuerzas que nos rodean amenazan nuestra forma de vida.\n\nMe gustaría escuchar lo que tienes que decir. Habla, $c."
G["It's good to see a new face out here. We're barely hanging on and our enemies are plentiful.\n\nWe're surrounded by those who seek to destroy us: the satyr to the north, the orcs in the lumber camp here to the east, and the demons of Felfire Hill.\n\nWe're going to retake this place if it kills us. It looks like it just might!"]="Me alegro de ver una cara nueva por aquí. Apenas resistimos y nuestros enemigos, muy numerosos.\n\nEstamos rodeados por seres que quieren eliminarnos: sátiros al norte, orcos del aserradero Grito de Guerra al este y demonios del Cerro Lumbrevil.\n\nRecuperamos este lugar aunque sea lo último que hagamos. ¡Parece que puede que lo sea!"
G["It's good to see an engineer brave enough to make the device.   We goblin engineers laugh at danger!"]="Cuánto me alegro de ver a $gun ingeniero:una ingeniera; lo suficientemente valiente para fabricar el dispositivo. ¡Los ingenieros goblin nos reímos del peligro!"
G["It's good to see some of the mosswalker were more resilient than I thought."]="有的苔行鳄鱼人比我想象的更有活力，真是令人宽慰啊。"
G["It's good to see the world outside the monastery."]="能看到禅院外面的世界，真好。"
G["It's good to see you again, $n.\n\nCome for a refresher in Scourge tactics?"]="Me alegro de verte de nuevo, $n.\n\n¿Has venido a poner al día tus conocimientos sobre tácticas de la Plaga?"
G["It's good to see you again, $n. You have High Chief Stillpine's deepest gratitude for rescuing his daughter from the clutches of the Bristlelimb."]="很高兴再次见到你，$n。你从刺臂部族手里救了止松老酋长的女儿，他衷心地感谢你。"
G["It's good to see you again, Erland.  What is your report?"]="埃兰德，很高兴又见到你。有什么要报告的？"
G["It's good to see you again, Mr. Barnes. Do you have the crate?"]="很高兴再次见到你，巴恩斯先生。那个箱子在你手里吗？"
G["It's good to see you again."]="很高兴再见到你。"
G["It's good to see you defending Theramore with pride, friend."]="朋友，感谢你成功地保卫了塞拉摩。"
G["It's good to see you here, $n."]="很高兴能在这里见到你，$n。"
G["It's good to see you made it through, $n."]="Me alegra ver que has sobrevivido, $n."
G["It's good to see you, $n."]="很高兴见到你，$n。"
G["It's good to visit with friends and family again, celebrating and sharing stories of old."]="能够再度和亲友一起欢庆，彼此分享旧日的故事，这种感觉实在太好了。"
G["It's got me!"]="它抓住我了！"
G["It's got my vote! That'll put hair on your chest like nothing else will."]="酿造得很成功啊！这酒的后劲还挺大的。"
G["It's great bein' a member of da \"Brew of the Month\" club."]="Mola ser miembro del Club de la \"Cerveza del Mes\"."
G["It's hard to believe any of them survived this."]="很难相信在这样一场劫难后，还会有幸存者。"
G["It's hard to believe that I once respected Arthas."]="我曾经遵从阿尔萨斯，这真让人难以置信。"
G["It's hard to explain to the Dragonmaw concepts like, \"Fields of Fire\" or \"Suppressive Barrage.\"\n\nFortunately, they have a firm grasp of \"Kill Zones\" and ... uh, \"Murder.\""]="Es difícil explicar a los Faucedraco conceptos como \"campo de fuego\" o \"ráfaga disuasoria\".\n\nAfortunadamente, cuentan con una sólida comprensión de \"zonas a matar\" y... eh... \"asesinato\"."
G["It's hard to imagine that so much death and despair could be confined to such a small area; yet beyond the swamp is a land plagued by chaos and destruction.\n\nWatch your step, adventurer. The Blasted Lands are the final resting place to far greater beings than you."]="很难想象如此多的死亡和恐惧会汇集在那么小的一块地区中。在这些门后是一块充斥着混乱和毁灭的大陆。\n\n冒险者，你要非常小心谨慎才行。诅咒之地中到处都是可以让你丧命的强大生物。"
G["It's hard to put into words.  Things should be wonderful.  Malfurion's returned.  Teldrassil was finally blessed by the dragon aspects... some of them anyway."]="这些很难用语言形容。一切都应该变好的。玛法里奥回来了。泰达希尔终于得到了巨龙的祝福…某些巨龙的祝福。"
G["It's hard work putting these things together!"]="把这些东西拼起来可真够难的！"
G["It's heading right for us!"]="它冲我们过来了！"
G["It's here!  The Darkmoon Faire is now open for business!  Be sure to see the most exciting show on all of Azeroth!"]="我们终于来了！暗月马戏团现在开始展出！一定要来看看艾泽拉斯大陆各种千奇百怪的东西！"
G["It's here... somewhere... I know it. Somewhere in this library is the knowledge I'm looking for..."]="我知道……在这里……某个地方。在这图书馆的某个地方有我要找的知识……"
G["It's hotter'n a kiln down here! Ah could fry an egg on me forehead."]="这下面比火炉还热！啊，我的脑袋上都可以煎蛋了。"
G["It's in the Valley of Strength, east of the entrance to Grommash Hold."]="就在力量谷，格罗玛什要塞入口的东边。"
G["It's in the hole!  It's in the hole!"]="它在洞里！它在洞里！"
G["It's ironic, I hate the ocean but I love the beach."]="真讽刺，我讨厌海洋，但我喜欢海滩。"
G["It's just a few broken bones and some internal bleeding. Nothing an icepack can't fix!"]="只是断了几根骨头外加内出血而已。没有冰袋治不好的伤！"
G["It's just a matter of time before the naga find us here.\n\nWhat will we fight them with?"]="纳迦早晚会找到这儿来。\n\n到时候我们靠什么对付？"
G["It's just a matter of time before we retake Moonwater Retreat."]="我们夺回月水庄只是时间问题。"
G["It's just ahead!"]="就在前面！"
G["It's just horrible. I think they're all dead.\n\nHow will I get the kaja'mite out of there now?"]="Es terrible. Creo que están todos muertos.\n\n¿Ahora cómo extraeré la kaja'mita?"
G["It's just ice. Why all the fuss?"]="只是冰块而已吧。你也太大惊小怪了。"
G["It's just like an angry rabbit... except bigger... and toothier."]="它就像是一只愤怒的兔子……体型更大……更咬牙切齿。"
G["It's just like the structure you described at Umbrafen Lake.  Does this mean the naga are pumping water out of all the lakes in Zangarmarsh?"]="这与你所描述的暗泽湖中的建筑完全一样。是不是意味着纳迦们在抽取赞加沼泽的所有湖泊里面的水？"
G["It's just like the way my wife used to make it. Thanks!"]="这跟我妻子的做法如出一辙。谢谢！"
G["It's just like, all of a sudden, out of nowhere... BOOM. Super-thick jungle."]="这就好像，突然间，不知道从哪儿就……砰。超级茂密的丛林。"
G["It's just northwest o' here; if ye hurry, ye might be able ta save some! Sorry I don't know anythin' more..."]="如果你们动作快，或许能救下几个！抱歉，我就知道这么多……"
G["It's just so horrible. Our three top guns were shot down over Alliance territory during an air assault Nobody knows if they're dead or alive!\n\nThis is a terrible blow to our air strike capabilities."]="太可怕了。在一次空袭中，我们的三个顶级枪手倒在了联盟的领地上，没人知道他们是生是死！\n\n这对我们的空中部队是个可怕的冲击。"
G["It's just too bad that it's all vegetables. Why no giant meat?"]="只可惜全都是些蔬菜。为什么就没有肉呢？"
G["It's just you and me, $r. Let's get this wrapped up quickly so that I can go kill Cho'gall."]="这话别告诉别人，$r。让我们赶快把这里的问题解决掉。这样我就能去干掉古加尔了。"
G["It's just you and me, Twinkle.  Daddy's not going to be coming home."]="就我和你，咪咪。爸爸不会回家的。"
G["It's just..."]="这只是……"
G["It's keeping my boys from expanding the mine. The Alliance needs that ore!"]="它让我们的矿工完全没法开采矿石。联盟急需那种矿石！"
G["It's kind of scary looking..."]="这样子真恐怖……"
G["It's like I'm hearing the Old Gods themselves!"]="就像是从上古之神口中听到这一切！"
G["It's like bungie-jumping, right? But without a cord, see? And you start at the bottom. I guess it's just sorta like regular jumping. But with guns."]="就像蹦极跳一样，懂吗？只是没有拴上绳子，明白吗？而且你是从地面开始的。我觉得它更像是普通的跳跃，不过你是被大炮轰上去的。"
G["It's like dey got weapons, but no brains."]="看来他们空有武器，却没有脑子。"
G["It's like my mother always said: [Demonic] \"Razxx khaj jhashxx xashjx.\""]="就像我妈妈常说的一样：[恶魔语] “Razxx khaj jhashxx xashjx。”"
G["It's like the more I hammer, the bigger this hole gets."]="好像我捶得越多，这个洞就会越大。"
G["It's like... it's like the void just touched my mind."]="就像……就像虚空刚刚触摸了我的灵魂。"
G["It's likely that he's being held somewhere, awaiting a death ritual."]="他很有可能就被囚禁在某处，等待死亡仪式的开始。"
G["It's looks just like it!"]="简直和活的一样！"
G["It's lovely here, don't you think?\n\nA bit hot, perhaps, but it's a dry heat..."]="这里真不错。你不这样认为吗？\n\n也许是有一点热，但只是干热而已……"
G["It's lucky that you came along."]="还好我遇到了你。"
G["It's me or you, buddy, and it ain't gonna be me."]="不是你死就是我活，朋友。当然，最后肯定是我活。"
G["It's most fortunate for you that you rescued me, and not one of these other poor sots."]="你救的是我，而不是那些醉鬼，你应该感到庆幸。"
G["It's much easier to talk up here without all that music."]="要是没有那些嘈杂的音乐，在这里交谈会更方便些。"
G["It's my job to ensure that this whole assault runs like clockwork.\n\nHigh Tinker Mekkatorque is out in the field now, but he's scheduled to come back to get some more troops any time now.  \n\nHe's never late, so just stick around and he'll be here."]="我的任务就是确保整个进攻行动像时钟一样准确地进行。\n\n大工匠梅卡托克已经到战场去了，但他正计划返回这里，再将更多的部队带上战场。\n\n他从不会迟到，所以你应该在这里等他。"
G["It's my passion, you know. In life and in death, armorcrafting is what I love. Please, treat me as if I were a living draenei, stranger. Let me know what it is to feel again... Allow me the honor of repairing your items."]="Es mi pasión, sabes. En la vida y en la muerte, la artesanía de armas es lo que amo. Por favor, trátame como si fuera un draenei vivo, $gextranjero:extranjera;. Deja que vuelva a saber lo que es sentir... Permíteme el honor de reparar tus objetos."
G["It's my way or the Gold Road.  Is that understood?"]="要么跟着我，要么去黄金之路。明白吗？"
G["It's nearly defeated! Keep punching!"]="它就快倒下了！继续出拳！"
G["It's never easy, is it? That's alright, we came prepared."]="这当然不容易做到，对吧？没关系，我们有备而来。"
G["It's nice to relax for a day."]="能放松一天可真不错。"
G["It's nice to sit amongst friends both old and new."]="能和新朋旧友欢聚一堂真是太好了。"
G["It's no good! I'm shutting it down..."]="不好！我要关掉蒸馏器……"
G["It's no good... you need more work first."]="这样没用……你需要更多的零件。"
G["It's no lie, traitor.  Banehollow wants your heart, and I'm going to get it for him."]="叛徒，我可没骗你。魔王贝恩霍勒想要你的命。"
G["It's no use sending more claws to die at your feet. Instead, I'll leave you this warning..."]="继续派炮灰来送死是徒劳的。相反，我要给你一个教训……"
G["It's no use! The hozen are pushing us back!"]="这没用！我们被猢狲打得节节败退！"
G["It's no use! Their shield is too strong!"]="这没用！他们的护盾太坚固了！"
G["It's not Salma Saldean's recipe. It's my Ma's. She asked some passerby to deliver it to Salma right before she and Pa left Westfall with Old Blanchy."]="这才不是萨尔玛·萨丁发明的食谱。它属于我的母亲。我的父母带着老马布兰契离开西部荒野时，让某个旅行者把这份食谱送给了萨尔玛。"
G["It's not Winter Veil yet, you know. I have WORK to do!"]="冬幕节还没到呢。我还有工作呢！"
G["It's not a party without some crashers!"]="不速之客闯入了聚会！"
G["It's not a sad story! Liu Lang himself said, \"Never mourn a life well-lived.\""]="¡No es una historia triste! Liu Lang lo dijo, \"Nunca llores una vida bien vivida.\""
G["It's not always about money, clem!  While we receive generous donations - some extremely substantial - our traveling troupe of performers is fueled creatively by a need to brighten this war-torn world.  Don't worry about us, but instead let us worry about how to best entertain you."]="这不是钱的问题，伙计！虽然我们接受慷慨的捐赠——有一些捐赠量还很大——我们旅行车队的信念是为这个战火纷飞的世界带来爱与曙光！不要担心我们，让我们来为怎样取悦你们而操心吧。"
G["It's not bravery that drives it.  It strode before me like it thought this place its home. It is a fool.  It will surely get itself killed soon enough."]="驱使它的并非勇气。它仿佛将这里当作了自己的家园，冲锋在我的身前。它只是个傻瓜，迟早会送命。"
G["It's not broken!"]="它还没有断！"
G["It's not enough! Let's show them the might of the 5th Battalion up close!"]="还不够！让他们尝尝第5营的厉害！"
G["It's not him I'm worried about. It's these new rookies around here - and those creepy purple elves they brought with 'em. They ain't even proved themselves yet."]="我担心的不是他。这些新来的——和那些跟他们一起来的紫色的精灵才是我所担心的。他们甚至还没能证明自己跟我们是一路的。"
G["It's not much further. The main road is just up ahead."]="还不够远。大道还在前面呢。"
G["It's not much, but it just might keep your green skin intact."]="这不算很厉害，但它也许刚好能保护到你的绿皮肤。"
G["It's not my fault... IT'S NOT MY FAULT!!!\n\nIf they'd just done what I told them to do everything would have been fine. But no! They wouldn't listen.\n\nNow they're all dead.\n\nI just want to go home. Home to Silvermoon. I'm so tired."]="这不是我的错……这不是我的错！\n\n如果他们按照我所说的去做，那么一切都会如预期那样的。但是，不。他们不听。\n\n现在他们全都死了。\n\n我只想回家，回银月城的家。我太累了。"
G["It's not my time, not yet!"]="我还不想死！"
G["It's not over, Sylvanas. Not yet."]="还没结束，希尔瓦娜斯。还早呢。"
G["It's not safe here anymore. You need to evacuate Dalaran."]="这里已经不安全了。你必须马上逃离达拉然。"
G["It's not safe here.  Go to the Allens' basement."]="这里不安全，到艾伦家的地下室去。"
G["It's not safe in Orgrimmar for us now."]="对我们来说，如今的奥格瑞玛已经不再安全了。"
G["It's not slowing down!"]="居然还不减速！"
G["It's not too late, brothers and sisters. Repent! Repent and you may be saved."]="兄弟姐妹们，一切还来得及。忏悔吧！你们会得到救赎的。"
G["It's not what you've done, it's who you are. You are not welcome here, \"Chen Stormstout.\""]="No se trata de lo que has hecho, sino de quién eres. No eres bienvenido aquí, \"Chen Cerveza de Trueno\"."
G["It's not your fault, Tarenar.  He ran off on his own will.  None of us could stop him."]="这不是你的错，塔伦纳。是他自己要跑的。我们谁都阻止不了他。"
G["It's nothing. I'm fine."]="没什么。我很好。"
G["It's now or never, $r."]="别错过良机，$r。"
G["It's now or never, soldiers! Let's do this! For K'aresh! For the Protectorate!"]="机会难得，士兵们！让我们行动吧！为了卡雷什！为了维序派！"
G["It's official! $n managed not to die. Great job not dying, $n!"]="官方消息！$n活下来了。能活下来就不容易啊，$n！"
G["It's ok, sweetheart.  This one's on the house."]="没事，甜心。这杯是免费的。"
G["It's okay $n - you're safe now."]="没事了$n——你现在安全了。"
G["It's okay, $n. I've got you... this time."]="没事了，$n。这次……我总算救下了你。"
G["It's okay, boys. Back off. You've done enough. I'll meet up with you later."]="好了，伙计们，退后。你们做得够多了。我们以后再见！"
G["It's okay. I think he likes it there."]="还算好。我想它喜欢这里。"
G["It's on!"]="开始了！"
G["It's on! $n, meet my fists. Fists, say hello to $n."]="¡Está encendido! $n, mira mis puños. Primero, di hola a mis puños, $n."
G["It's one of them!"]="是他们中的一个！"
G["It's only a matter of time before the plague overtakes New Avalon."]="新阿瓦隆被攻陷只是时间问题。"
G["It's only right that you know the name of the one who will take your life."]="如果你到死也不知道是谁取了你的小命，那也太不公平了。"
G["It's our fault... the destruction is all our fault..."]="这是我们的错……这毁灭全都是我们的错……"
G["It's our job to find out who's behind these abductions and put a stop to them."]="我们的任务就是挖出这一系列绑架事件的幕后黑手并加以阻止。"
G["It's our turn to pickle your feet!"]="现在是我们惩罚你们的时候啦！"
G["It's over Azshara!  You and your naga will return to the bottom of the seas where you belong!"]="都结束了，艾萨拉！带着你的纳迦回到属于你们自己的海底去。"
G["It's over Godfrey.  You have no support left among the eastern lords."]="结束了，高弗雷。东部的领主中已经没有人会支持你了。"
G["It's over, Samuelson. We know who you are and I put a stop to your little cathedral scheme."]="结束了，萨缪尔森。我们知道你的身份，你要在教堂中实行的小阴谋已经破产了。"
G["It's over, Spark. The admiral knows it was you who betrayed the Alliance. Now you're either going to cooperate with me and tell me everything that you know or we're going to engage in some fisticuff."]="结束了，斯巴克。上将已经知道是你背叛了联盟。现在你是要与我合作，告诉我你知道的一切，还是和要与我为敌？"
G["It's over. The curse is lifted. Thank you, $p. Thank you!"]="结束了。诅咒被解除。谢谢你，$p。谢谢！"
G["It's payback time!"]="还债的时候到了！"
G["It's people like you who weaken the Alliance and invite the Horde to take away all we've fought for!"]="就是像你这样的家伙削弱了联盟的力量，邀请部落来夺走我们为之奋斗的一切！"
G["It's poison! Cartloads of poison!"]="这是毒药！是毒药！"
G["It's quiet here...."]="这里很安静……"
G["It's quiet... Too quiet..."]="真安静……太安静了……"
G["It's quite simple, really, $n. My old merc company, The Veiled Blade, took the wrong mission at the wrong time.\n\nWe were hired by a goblin smuggler out of Booty Bay, one Gremnik Rizzlesprang, who was covetous of Lord Valthalak's spellbook. Or, maybe there was some old rivalry there? I suppose we'll never know now, because Gremnik was killed not too long ago by a group of Valthalak's spectral assassins. They really can be very deadly when a large number of them gather.\n\nWhere was I?"]="很简单，$n。我先前所在的雇佣军团“迷雾之刃”在错误的时间接受了错误的任务。\n\n藏宝海湾外的一名地精走私者格雷姆尼克对瓦塔拉克公爵的法术书垂涎三尺，因此他雇用我们盗取那本法术书。或许还有其他人觊觎着这本书吧，我想我们是无法知道当时的真实情况了，因为不久之前格雷姆尼克就被瓦塔拉克公爵的鬼灵刺客杀死了。这些鬼灵刺客联合行动的话，谁也别想生还。\n\n我说到哪儿了？"
G["It's raining still. And freezing. At least we haven't had a typhoon lately."]="天还在下雨。又冷。还好最近没台风。"
G["It's raining yaks and mushan today! Well, I've got a market to run, rain or shine!"]="今天得在雨中做牦牛和穆山兽生意！好吧，无论天晴下雨，我都要经营这个市集。"
G["It's ready! I put it over on the table."]="好了！我把它放在桌子上面了。"
G["It's really going to work this time... right?"]="这次总行了吧……对吧？"
G["It's really quite simple, $n. Just attach these fireworks to the wild cluckers and I'll use this controller to fly them into the cage."]="其实简单得很，$n。只要把这些焰火装到野生肉鸡身上，然后我会用这控制器帮它们飞进笼子。"
G["It's right in the center of the city. The hub of the wheel."]="就在城的正中央。中心区的小房间。"
G["It's rough out there. I need some replacements, Sentinel Onaeya."]="这实在太粗糙了。我需要一些替代品，哨兵奥奈雅。"
G["It's safe now.  You can come down."]="现在安全了。你可以下来了。"
G["It's safe to come out now."]="出来吧，现在安全了。"
G["It's safe, little gnome. You can come out now."]="安全了，小侏儒。你现在可以出来了。"
G["It's safe. I brought Lorewalker Cho and his strange companions up this way not long back."]="安全得很。我不久前刚送过游学者周卓和他诡异的同伴们。"
G["It's set. Get clear!"]="安装完毕，撤离！"
G["It's shaping up!  But it needs more kick.  Yep, you guessed it... Let's wash yesterday's socks in the cauldron... Mmmh, delicious!"]="差不多啦！不过还需要加点料。嘿嘿，你猜对啦……把昨天的袜子丢进锅里吧……哎哟，那种味道……真是美呀！"
G["It's showtime!  Blast them hard, blast them fast!"]="表演时间到了！炸得再狠点，再快点！"
G["It's similar to a pattern I once noted in Sholazar Basin."]="我在索拉查盆地见过类似的东西。"
G["It's simple really. Allow me to summarize..."]="这是真的。请允许我总结一下……"
G["It's simple! You give me a Darkmoon Game Token, and I toss you in and light the fuse.\n\nYou'll \"float\" for a little while after you're shot, but you can descend quickly by dropping the \"wings\" I'll give you.\n\nYou're aiming for a big floating target in the water right off the boardwalk.\n\nJust don't drop your wings while you're still over ground, or... well... I don't sell life insurance!"]="¡Es muy sencillo! Me das una ficha de juego de la Luna Negra, te meto dentro y enciendo la mecha.\n\nEstarás \"flotando\" un rato después del lanzamiento, pero podrás descender si abres las \"alas\" que te daré.\n\nEstás apuntando a un gran objetivo que flota en el agua justo al final del paseo.\n\nIntenta no abrir las alas cuando todavía estás en tierra, o... bueno... ¡no vendo seguros de vida!"
G["It's simple, really. Rob the lich, Ras Frostwhisper, of his powers. Return him to his mortal form and then slay him, once and for all."]="这很简单，真的。从莱斯·霜语的身上夺走他的力量。将他变回普通的形态，然后果断地杀死他。"
G["It's simply too good to be true. You couldn't have killed him so easily!"]="这不可能是真的。你不可能这样轻易地杀死他！"
G["It's small but it does it's job if you know what you are doing. Let me show you just the right places to hit."]="它很小，但是如果你明白自己在做什么的话，还是能使它发挥效用的。让我来向你说明该怎么用它。"
G["It's so cold, so dark.... I'm not overacting, am I?"]="太冷了，太暗了……我没有夸张，我有吗？"
G["It's so dark in here.  I'm not sure I like being undead."]="这里可真黑。真不知道我是不是喜欢成为一个亡灵。"
G["It's so exciting to be here in Darnassus, surrounded by talented people! I just know I'm going to make my family proud. Maybe if I'm really lucky, the Sentinels will ask me to join their forces on the front!"]="在达纳苏斯这里真是太令人兴奋了，到处都是才华横溢的人们！我这才知道我会让我的家人感到骄傲的。或许如果我幸运的话，哨兵们会请我加入他们前线的军队的！"
G["It's so good seeing so many of you here to celebrate this time honored festivity.  A celebration of this magnitude is long overdue."]="你们都聚在这里庆祝这个伟大的节日，真是令人高兴。我很久没见过这么大规模的庆典了。"
G["It's so good seeing so many of you here to celebrate this time honored festivity.  We've suffered many tragedies this year, so a celebration like Brewfest is a welcome and jubilous occasion."]="你们都聚在这里庆祝这个伟大的节日，真是令人高兴。今年，我们经历了许多艰难困苦，所以像美酒节这样的节日特别振奋人心，特别受欢迎。"
G["It's so good to see another sin'dorei $g brother : sister;!  As you can imagine, there's not much in the way of conversation around here."]="很高兴看到其他的辛多雷$g兄弟:姐妹;！如你所见，这附近没有什么其他人可以说话。"
G["It's so good to see you again, Muradin. And what's this I heard about you being a King in your own right now? The Bronzebeards were always destined to greatness."]="能再见到你真是太好了，穆拉丁。我听说你现在登上了王座，真的吗？铜须家族的人注定是要成为大人物的！"
G["It's so intense!"]="这颜色太刺眼了！"
G["It's so lovely to see you again, $n! I really can't thank you enough for delivering that message to my dear little gnome.\n\nWould you like to hear a song? It will make traveling in the rough seas much easier!"]="¡Es maravilloso volver a verte, $n! No sé cómo agradecerte que le hayas entregado el mensaje a mi querido gnomo.\n\n¿Te apetece escuchar una canción? ¡Así el viaje por estos peligrosos mares se hará más corto!"
G["It's so nice to have a break from fighting the sha."]="能在与煞魔斗争之余稍稍休息一下，这种感觉可真不错。"
G["It's so nice to no longer be hearing that troll go on and on! Thank you, $n!"]="终于再也不用听那巨魔喋喋不休了，这真是太好了！谢谢你，$n！"
G["It's so red! Don't you know that's my favorite color?"]="颜色真红！你不知道这是我最喜欢的颜色吗？"
G["It's so sad for you poor children."]="可怜的孩子，我为你难过。"
G["It's so strange: I can't remember how I came to be here."]="太奇怪了，我不记得自己是怎么到这里来的了。"
G["It's starting!"]="开始！"
G["It's still good enough to ship. I can fix it with a patch!"]="它还能用作船运。我稍微修修就好！"
G["It's stomping time."]="该是战争践踏登场的时候了。"
G["It's stunned. Now's our chance to finish it off!"]="它晕了。现在是消灭它的好机会！"
G["It's sweltering down here. Did someone tell them to turnip the heat?"]="这里可真闷热。有人让他们升高温度了吗？"
G["It's tangled up in the rigging."]="它被缠在索具里了。"
G["It's that crazy Hobart Grapplehammer's fault! Someone ought to fire that guy and promote his assistant!"]="都是霍巴特·钩锤那疯子的错！应该有人站出来把他炒掉，让他的助手升职！"
G["It's that stranger Cho mentioned. I wonder if there are more of them."]="Es $gel:la; $gforastero:forastera; que mencionó Cho. Me pregunto si habrá más."
G["It's the Den Mother! Look out, $p!"]="是巢穴主母！小心，$p！"
G["It's the Highlord!"]="公爵！"
G["It's the Horde!"]="是部落！"
G["It's the TXR-5000!"]="它是TXR-5000！"
G["It's the big building in Razor Hill that's not the barracks.  Just talk to Innkeeper Grosk inside.  Got that?"]="那是剃刀岭的一幢大建筑，而不是兵营。去跟旅店老板格罗斯克谈谈。明白了？"
G["It's the end of the world!"]="这是世界的末日！"
G["It's the gallows for me..."]="这是给我准备的绞架……"
G["It's the one on the far right! Hurry, Hobart! It's going to eggsplode!"]="就是最右边的那个！赶快，霍巴特！它就要爆炸啦！"
G["It's the truth, man. Can't ya smell that?"]="这就是事实，朋友。你体会不到吗？"
G["It's the yaungol chief, slain just like the rest. Seems that he could not keep order in the final fight."]="野牛人酋长，和其他族人一样被杀害了。看来他也没能镇压住最终的混战。"
G["It's thickening! Quickly, get some..."]="变浓稠啦！快，拿些……"
G["It's those blasted iron dwarves again! Somehow, they found him before we did."]="又是那些该死的铁矮人！他们居然抢在我们前面找到了他。"
G["It's time for a little sabotage!"]="该是搞些破坏的时候了！"
G["It's time for a tactical retreat!"]="该战略性撤退了！"
G["It's time for my meditation, leave me."]="我要一个人静一静，请离开吧。"
G["It's time for revenge!"]="复仇的时刻到了！"
G["It's time for the grummle-grubbing goliath, fifteen feet of furry fury, Kun-Lai Summit's own snow-stalking horror, JOL'GRUM!"]="现在要出场的是令土地精胆寒的庞然大物，十五英尺的长毛怪物，昆莱山特有的雪山恶兽，乔古鲁！"
G["It's time for the main event!  Skarr the Unbreakable is in the Maul!"]="重要的决斗即将开始！无敌的斯卡尔就在巨槌竞技场！"
G["It's time for your ultimate attack, my darling!"]="该是发动最后一击的时候了，亲爱的！"
G["It's time to PARTY!"]="让我们狂欢庆祝吧！"
G["It's time to celebrate, I think..."]="我想……是时候庆祝一下了。"
G["It's time to deal with this fruit situtation on our terms.  We've been far too accomidating to the fruit vendor.  Now we will simply sell the fruit.  But the fruit will not be for people to eat.  I forbid it!  No one will eat our fruit!"]="现在就来解决水果的问题。我们对水果贩子实在是太过迁就啦。现在我们要开始卖水果。但这些水果不是给人吃的。我不允许！谁也不准吃我们的水果！"
G["It's time to go..."]="是离开的时候了……"
G["It's time to join the fray, $n!  With you on our side the scales will surely tip in our favor!"]="该是上战场的时候了，$n！有你的帮助，胜利的天平一定会向我们倾斜！"
G["It's time to wake up, magistrate! These aren't ordinary gnoll attacks!"]="该醒醒了，长官！这次不是普通的豺狼人攻击！"
G["It's times like these that I remember why we're best friends, Pat. You're always so full of positive encouragement."]="很多时候我都在想，为什么我们会成为好朋友呢。你总是在我的身边积极地鼓励我。"
G["It's times like these that I wish I had a longer cooldown."]="我真希望自己的冷却时间更长一点。"
G["It's too bad they don't stay cute.  There must be some rite of passage in the Barrens called, \"Climb ugly tree and fall out.\""]="Es una pena que no sigan siendo monos. Tiene que haber algún tipo de prueba de madurez en Los Baldíos que sea, \"Súbete al árbol feo y cáete.\""
G["It's too late for me."]="太迟了，我撑不下去了。"
G["It's too late to run now.  Do not leave the ring.  Die bravely, $n!"]="现在逃跑已经太迟啦。不要离开比武场。慷慨地赴死吧，$n！"
G["It's too late to stop them. Let me show you their glory..."]="现在想要阻止他们已经来不及了。让我给你看看他们的荣光……"
G["It's too much!"]="太过分了！"
G["It's too quiet today, Theloria.  The blood elves are up to no good.  I can feel it."]="今天太宁静了，塞洛莉娅。我能感觉到，这些血精灵们肯定有什么邪恶的计划。"
G["It's too quiet tonight, Theloria.  The blood elves are up to no good.  I can feel it."]="今天太宁静了，塞洛莉娅。我能感觉到，这些血精灵们肯定有什么邪恶的计划。"
G["It's too quiet. We should check this out."]="这里太安静了。我们得调查一下。"
G["It's too quiet. Where are Thermaplugg's defense forces?"]="太安静了。瑟玛普拉格的军队在哪里？"
G["It's trashed, but it doesn't look like there are any bodies."]="它已经被毁坏了，但看样子，这里并没有尸体。"
G["It's true our new... guests are limiting our work somewhat, but it is only natural to be wary when a genocidal attempt is made. Perhaps in time they will be convinced that Putress was an unfortunate anomaly and allow us to continue our work in peace."]="我们的新…客人对我们的工作的确有些拖累，不过在从事种族灭绝工作中保持机警是没错的。也许，在适当的时候他们会认识到普特雷斯就是个倒霉的异类，并且允许我们安安稳稳地继续我们的工作。"
G["It's true then?  Even those afflicted by the Curse are fighting the Forsaken!"]="这是真的？就连那些身陷诅咒的人也在和被遗忘者作战！"
G["It's true, even stranglekelp can be quite useful in building up what we need for the upcoming war at Ahn'Qiraj! It has so many uses, like making ice cream for hot days under the Silithus sun, as a salve for the effects of some icky plants, breathing underwater, hardening the skin, making you quick, regaining magic power; so many things I can't think of them all! Did I mention making ice cream?\n\nAnywhoodles, I've got about $2047w here, and I need a total of $2048w!"]="真的，就连荆棘藻也会成为战争中的重要资源！它有许多用途，比如用来制作可以在希利苏斯的炎炎烈日下品尝的冰淇淋，清除一些非常难以清除的植物，水下呼吸，硬化皮肤，让你的行动变得更迅速，恢复魔法能量，太多了，我简直没法一一历数！我有没有说冰淇淋？\n\n总之，我手头上总共有$2047w份的存货，而需求总量是$2048w！"
G["It's truly outrageous that so many workers are hurt."]="太令人震惊了，这么多工人都受了伤。"
G["It's trying to bash me skull in!"]="它打得可真狠啊！"
G["It's unsafe to wander through the forest alone, don't you think?"]="孤身一人在树林里游荡不太安全，你觉得呢？"
G["It's unseasonably hot. Time for Brivethwerp's Sililicious Crunch!"]="真是炎热得出奇啊。来尝尝布里维普的异种蝎嚼嚼乐冰淇淋吧！"
G["It's up and....it's good!"]="情况似乎不错！"
G["It's up to me to ensure these Kor'kron are ready."]="只有我才能把这些库卡隆变成合格的战士。"
G["It's up to you to find him before the irons do!"]="现在就指望你了，一定要抢在铁矮人前面找到他！"
G["It's us or them, $r. This day won't end without bloodshed."]="不是他们死，就是我们亡，$r。今天的战斗注定不死不休。"
G["It's very nice, $n. Thank you."]="非常好，$n。谢谢你。"
G["It's weird. My butt hurts. Not sure why."]="真奇怪。我的屁股好疼。疼得莫名其妙。"
G["It's what we're fighting for. On this front, at least."]="在这条战线，我们将为那座岛屿而战。"
G["It's where we will do our duty, for our king, for Stormwind and for her people..."]="我们将在那里履行使命——为了国王，为了暴风城和她的子民们……"
G["It's working! Ghabar will be pleased to hear the news."]="成功了！贾巴尔会很高兴听到这个消息的。"
G["It's working! The wound is closing!"]="成功了！伤口正在愈合！"
G["It's working. Hold him still, Jitters."]="起作用了。用力抓住他，基特斯。"
G["It's your big coming out party. We'll make you a Trade $G Prince : Princess; yet, $n!\n\nGet out there and strut your stuff!"]="Es tu gran fiesta de lanzamiento. ¡Todavía podemos convertirte en $gpríncipe: princesa; mercante, $n!\n\n¡Sal ahí y haz lo que sabes hacer!"
G["It's your call, $n. Marion brought this on herself when she attacked our matron's sacred shrine."]="你自己决定，$n。当玛瑞恩攻击我们主人的圣殿时，就已经为自己惹上了麻烦。"
G["It's your fault it happened!"]="这都是你的错！"
G["It's your lucky day, Zootfizzle. $n has brought more hatchlings for you."]="苏特菲兹，今天是你的幸运日。$n为你带回了更多的龙崽。"
G["It's your turn to die!"]="轮到你了，去死吧！"
G["It's your turn, Mr. Pinch!"]="该你了，钳子先生！"
G["It's, ah, the cycle of life, mm. The Light creates troll, troll creates dinosaur, dinosaur eats human, trolls inherit Azeroth."]="这是，呃，生命的轮回，唔。圣光创造了巨魔，巨魔创造了恐龙，恐龙吃人类，巨魔继承艾泽拉斯。"
G["It's... it's beautiful!"]="它真是……太美了！"
G["It's... too late for me...."]="已经……太迟了……"
G["It'sh a feather. Sho bootiful. Thank you...hic!"]="这根羽毛，太漂亮了。谢谢你……嗝！"
G["It'sh a nice kitty, just like in my lasht brew dream...hic!"]="真是只可爱的小猫咪，跟我梦里见过的一样……嗝！"
G["It'sh great to finally drink with friendsh... Normally I'd jusht sit at home and drink alone."]="跟朋友们喝酒最棒啦……平常我只能寨家一个人偷偷喝。"
G["It'sh makin' me hungry... why's it shooo big? You shome kind of idiot or shomething? Makin' a chicken sho big... Who doesh that?"]="让我感到饥肠辘辘了……为什么那么大呢？是白痴还是什么？居然把小鸡弄得那么大……是谁干的？"
G["It'sss mine!"]="它是我的！"
G["It. Is. PAYBACK TIME!"]="报仇的时刻到了！"
G["It... It is over, Lord Staghelm. We are victorious. Albeit the cost for this victory was great."]="鹿盔，结……结束了。我们胜利了。虽然我们为此付出了惨痛的代价。"
G["It... It's a dead end. We have no choice but to fight. Steel yourselves, heroes, for this is our last stand!"]="这……这是死路！我们别无选择，只能战斗。准备迎战，英雄们，这是我们最后的阵地。"
G["It... It's foggy, $n. I can't see anything! Wait... Wait a minute. I see... I see Doctor Weavil's hideout. It... YES! I believe he is holding a chapter of the book!\n\nLet me see if I can zoom this thing out to get a better vantage point.\n\n<Narain appears to be going cross-eyed.>\n\nAlcaz Island! That devious son-of-a-goblin is on Alcaz Island!"]="Hay... Hay niebla, $n. ¡No veo nada! Espera... Espera un minuto. Veo... Veo la guarida del doctor Weavil. Y... ¡SÍ! ¡Creo que sostiene un capítulo del libro!\n\nA ver si puedo ampliar la imagen.\n\n<Narain parece ponerse bizco.>¡La Isla de Alcaz! ¡Ese taimado hijo de goblin está en la Isla de Alcaz!"
G["It... is... done..."]="结……束……了……"
G["It... is... not... the best... time, $n. I must concen... trate."]="现在……不……是……最好的……时候，$n。我必须集中……精力。"
G["It... it is working!"]="它……它起作用了！"
G["It... it worked!  We will defend Nahom with the power stored within this temple!"]="它……它起作用了！我们将用这座神殿中的能量守卫纳奥姆！"
G["It... it's a trap..."]="这……这是一个陷阱……"
G["It... it's not doing anything!  The pit lord is loose!"]="它……它没有用！深渊领主不受控制了！"
G["It... its like I can smell the grummle luck..."]="这感觉……就好像我能闻到土地精的臭味……"
G["It... perfect."]="太……完美了。"
G["It... they planted us in the dirt like crops! Stillwater is insane! Get out of here while you still can!"]="这……他们把我们像庄稼一样种到土里！斯蒂沃特简直疯了！趁还来得及，赶紧离开这儿！"
G["It....it be beautiful!"]="太……太漂亮了！"
G["Itching for something sweet? You need to find Beige Sugar.\n\nHe's usually wandering around the bottom floor, though he's been known to step into the keggery for a treat every now and then."]="嘴馋想要吃些甜品吗？你需要找到米色糖。\n\n他通常在底层徘徊，尽管他时不时地会跑进烈酒窖里慰劳自己。"
G["Itching for something sweet? You need to find Pink Peony.\n\nShe's usually wandering around the front terrace or the main hall of the shrine."]="嘴馋想要吃些甜品吗？你需要找到粉牡丹。\n\n她通常在神殿的前露台或正殿徘徊。"
G["Items of antiquity, weapons of war, armor or rarity. Who knows what Antonio will be carrying this week if you do not come look."]="古董，武器，装甲，还有很多别的稀罕的好东西！走过路过不要错过！"
G["Items powerful enough to help make the journey through Duskwood, Antonio Perelli's goods are now for sale here in Lakeshire."]="安东尼奥·皮雷利卖的东西足以让你顺利在暮色森林旅行，湖畔镇现在就有卖了啊。"
G["Its only a matter of time before that dog, Akama, betrays the Betrayer as well..."]="阿卡玛那条狗，他背叛那个背叛者也只是时间问题而已……"
G["Its power courses through me! I AM A GOD!"]="它的能量在我体内流淌！我是神！！！"
G["Its power is so strong. It forces me to destroy you."]="它的力量如此强大。它要我消灭你。"
G["Its properties are amazing!  Provide me with Apexis crystals, and I'll form weapons and armor within crystal geodes."]="它的特性真是令人惊讶！给我点埃匹希斯水晶，我可以用它们制成武器和护甲。"
G["Its purgin time!"]="净化的时刻到了！"
G["Its shell is cracked in the back. Hit it where it hurts!"]="它背部的壳裂开了。哪儿疼打哪儿！"
G["Its spells would be less threatening if its incantations were slowed by your icy touch..."]="如果你使用冰冷触摸降低它的施法速度，那么咒语的威胁性就会降低很多……"
G["It’s sweet, really - having four men compete for your attention.\n\nMakes you feel… appreciated. Powerful."]="Es tierno, la verdad: tener a cuatro hombres compitiendo por tu atención.\n\nHace que te sientas… apreciada. Poderosa."
G["Ivar's pack failed horribly, so now he sends mercenaries. No matter, your journey ends in agony."]="伊瓦的部队遭受了惨败。所以他现在又派来了佣兵。没关系，你们就要在巨大的痛苦中彻底被毁灭了。"
G["Iverron's poison is cured, but it will take some time for him to recover."]="埃沃隆身上的毒素已经散去，但还需要一些时间才能复原。"
G["Iyyokuk begins choosing criteria from $n!"]="伊约库克开始根据$n选取标准！"
G["Iyyokuk selects: Bomb |TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_IYYOKUK_BOMB_white.BLP:20|t!"]="伊约库克选择了：炸弹|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_IYYOKUK_BOMB_white.BLP:20|t！"
G["Iyyokuk selects: Drum |TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_IYYOKUK_DRUM_white.BLP:20|t!"]="伊约库克选择了：战鼓|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_IYYOKUK_DRUM_white.BLP:20|t！"
G["Iyyokuk selects: Five!"]="伊约库克选择了：五！"
G["Iyyokuk selects: Four!"]="伊约库克选择了：四！"
