G["Ja be keepin' away from me."]="离我远点。"
G["Ja mon, I be collectin' up the fishy-fishy for the Horde. They gettin' ready for big war in the desert at Ahn'Qiraj, and askin' me to get them $2103w of the spotted yellowtail. But right now we only be havin' $2102w. You here to help?"]="嗨，我正在为部落收集食物。安其拉沙漠中即将发生一场恶战，我需要收集$2103w条斑点黄尾鱼。到目前为止，我们只有$2102w条。"
G["Jack Trapper can be found cooking in the lower city's open market, in the southeast."]="你可以在东南方的贫民区露天市场找到正在烹饪的杰克·塔博尔。"
G["Jack and Jill my wrinkled patoot! I do all the water luggin' 'round here."]="每天都要累死我！"
G["Jackpot!"]="中头彩了！"
G["Jackson, you've spilled your powder all over the ground. <Sigh>"]="Jackson, has tirado toda la pólvora por el suelo. <Suspiro>"
G["Jade Serpent, grant me strength!"]="青龙，赐予我力量吧！"
G["Jade Squash grow the color of milky jade. Conditionsh will be perfect tomorrow for growing thish vegetable... I think."]="碧玉瓜有着温润如玉的色泽。我想……明天会是种植这种蔬菜的好日子。"
G["Jade is so very lucky, didn't you know? Thanks for giving this to me."]="翡翠是好运的象征，你不知道吗？谢谢你把它送给我。"
G["Jade, it's all about the jade! We need it, and that's the bottom line!"]="玉石，一切都是为了玉石！我们需要玉石，这是底线！"
G["Jaina -"]="吉安娜……"
G["Jaina Proudmoore now sits as head of the Kirin Tor and rules Dalaran.\n\nThat puts the citadel square in the hands of the Alliance no matter how much Aethas brags about neutrality.\n\nThis young upstart may have forgotten, but the Alliance tried to imprison and massacre our people during the third war.\n\nForgive me if I do not share his faith in their... \"neutrality\"."]="Jaina Valiente es la nueva líder del Kirin Tor y gobierna Dalaran.\n\nEso deja la ciudadela en manos de la Alianza, por mucho que a Aethas le guste presumir de neutralidad.\n\nA lo mejor a este joven se le ha olvidado, pero la Alianza intentó encerrarnos y masacrarnos durante la Tercera Guerra.\n\nPerdona si no comparto su fe en su \"neutralidad\"."
G["Jaina is taking away my home by force? I'll remember this..."]="吉安娜靠武力夺走了我的家园？我会记住这一切的……"
G["Jaina takes a deep breath."]="吉安娜深吸了一口气。"
G["Jaina was right to recommend you. You saved this mission from disaster... and saved my life."]="吉安娜选对了人。你挽救了这个任务……还有我的生命。"
G["Jaina!  You ORCISH SCUM!"]="吉安娜！你这个兽人杂种！"
G["Jaina! Could it truly be you?"]="吉安娜！真的是你吗？"
G["Jaina! Stop!"]="吉安娜！停下！"
G["Jaina! What's happening in Dalaran? Has there been an attack?"]="吉安娜！达拉然出什么事了？被袭击了吗？"
G["Jaina's expression softens."]="吉安娜的表情柔和了下来。"
G["Jaina's gone over the edge. She's imprisoning the Sunreavers and attacking those who resist. What's worse, the Silver Covenant has seized the opportunity to join the bloodshed."]="吉安娜太过分了。她囚禁了夺日者，攻击任何抵抗的人。更糟糕的是，银色盟约也趁机加入了屠杀。"
G["Jaina, listen to me. You must destroy the Lich King. You cannot reason with him. He will kill you and your allies and raise you all as powerful soldiers of the Scourge."]="吉安娜，听我说。你必须终结巫妖王。不要试图说服他。他会把你们全杀掉，变成天灾军团的战士。"
G["Jaina, what happened at the Wrath Gate. It was a betrayal from within..."]="吉安娜，天谴之门的事，是因为我们中间出了叛徒……"
G["Jaina, you haven't much time. The Lich King sees what the sword sees. He will be here shortly."]="吉安娜，你没有时间了。巫妖王能看到剑旁的一切。他就要来了。"
G["Jaina, you need to talk to me before you act-"]="你在行动前应该和我谈谈——"
G["Jaina. We've got to work together on this. The Alliance must act as one."]="吉安娜。我们得合作。联盟必须团结一致。"
G["Jaina?"]="吉安娜？"
G["Jaina? Why are you crying?"]="吉安娜，你怎么哭了？"
G["James Van Brunt in War Quarter on inner ring."]="内环军事区的詹姆斯·范·布朗特。"
G["James Van Brunt runs a decent forge in the War Quarter. He's on the inner ring."]="詹姆斯·范·布朗特的锻造生意一直不错，就在军事区的内环区域。"
G["James...please...I love you..."]="詹姆斯……拜托……我爱你……"
G["James? James... No, you're not James, but I know who you are..."]="詹姆斯？詹姆斯……不，你不是詹姆斯，但我知道你是谁……"
G["Jandi and Zeal'aya work from a hut just north of de valley's central building.\n\nDey can help ya wit' whatever ya need, mon."]="加迪和希尔拉亚就在这座山谷中心建筑北边的一座小屋里工作。\n\n他们能提供你所需要的帮助，朋友。"
G["Jane will love this one!"]="杰恩会喜欢这个的！"
G["Jarad, you are up first for us."]="贾拉德，你先上！"
