G["Jenova Stoneshield over in the Dwarven District is the one you're looking for.  She tends to hunters' pets while they seek training from her father."]="矮人区的耶诺瓦·石盾是你要找的人。在猎人接受她父亲的训练时，她帮着照看猎人的宠物。"
