G["Jethan!"]="杰森！"
G["Jewelcrafting"]="珠宝加工"
G["Jewelcrafting Supplies"]="珠宝加工补给品"
G["Jewelcrafting allows you to fashion magical rings, amulets, and trinkets as well as cut gems.\nThe gems used in Jewelcrafting may be purchased or acquired via Prospecting from ore gathered by Mining; for this reason the two professions pair well.\nMost Jewelcrafting designs also require a Jeweler's Kit while more advanced creations require a Simple Grinder; these may be purchased from Jewelcrafting vendors."]="La joyería te permite elaborar anillos mágicos, amuletos y abalorios, además de tallar gemas.\n\nLas gemas que se usan en joyería se pueden comprar o adquirir mediante la prospección de menas recolectadas a través de la minería; por ello, las dos profesiones se compaginan bien.\n\nLa mayoría de los bocetos de joyería requieren herramientas de joyero, mientras que para las creaciones más avanzadas hace falta una pulidora sencilla. Ambos objetos se pueden comprar a los vendedores de joyería."
G["Jewelcrafting? That's fine work, indeed. You can purchase supplies from Bero in the crafter's hall.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="珠宝加工？这的确是件精细活儿。你可以从工匠大厅的贝诺那购买物资。\n\n我会在你的地图上标记这个位置。"
G["Jewelcrafting? That's fine work, indeed. You can purchase supplies from Vanaris Whitesong in the chamber of masters.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="珠宝加工？这的确是件精细活儿。你可以从师匠大厅的瓦纳里斯·白歌那购买物资。\n\n我会在你的地图上标记这个位置。"
G["Jewelry"]="珠宝"
G["Jeztor lives! Time to light up the Valley sky, Commander."]="杰斯托还活着！指挥官，是照亮山谷的时候了。"
G["Jeztor's Riders are ready! Soldiers of the Horde, report for duty!"]="杰斯托的骑士准备好了！部落的战士们，汇报你们的工作！"
G["Jeztor's coming for you, Stormpike!"]="杰斯托来了，雷矛的渣滓们！"
G["Jhag, did you set aside those formulas and regeants I asked for?"]="夏格，你是不是把我要的那些配方和材料收起来了？"
G["Jheel!!!"]="希尔！！！"
G["Jho'nass, let me see what you have to offer."]="霍纳斯，让我看看你出售的货物。"
G["Ji Firepaw warmly hugs you back."]="季·火掌热烈欢迎你的回归。"
G["Ji finished setting up the fireworks.  Use them to get it out of the sky."]="季已经把焰火准备好了。点燃它们，朝空中发射。"
G["Ji may kill Shen-zin Su if we let him go through with this! Come with me, $p, quickly!"]="如果我们任由季这么干的话，他可能会害死神真子的！$p，跟我来，快！"
G["Ji must be in here somewhere, I have to find him!"]="季肯定在这附近，我要找到他！"
G["Ji usually stays at the Pandaren Pavillion. It's close to the arena, and he loves to watch the fights. I hear he even participates once in a while."]="季通常都在熊猫人小亭。那个地方离竞技场很近，他喜欢看别人打架。我听说他偶尔还会参加比赛。"
G["Ji! No! I will kill you!"]="季！不！我要杀了你们！"
G["Ji, I am so sorry, we can be together now, please, let us just go back to the turtle, please do not die."]="季，真是对不起，现在我们可以在一起了，我们回迷踪岛吧，你不要死。"
G["Ji, I'd like you to go to the Dai-Lo Farmstead in search of Wugou, the spirit of earth."]="季，我想派你前去大箩农场寻找上古土灵无垢的踪迹。"
G["Ji, be respectful when we speak to Shen-zin Su."]="季，与神真子交谈的时候，应该保持恭敬。"
G["Ji, stop! This is reckless and stupid."]="季，住手！你这样太莽撞了。"
G["Ji-Kun goes into a berserk rage!"]="季鹍陷入了狂怒！"
G["Ji... I am sorry..."]="季……对不起……"
G["Ji... if this is what you must do, I will not stop you, but we could lose everything. I hope you're right."]="季……如果你一定要这么做，我不会阻止你。我们赌上了一切，但愿你是对的。"
G["Jib in snibbets!"]="刺他们右边！"
G["Jib that $pr in the dooker!"]="干掉$pr那个大坏蛋！"
G["Jib them in the nib!"]="刺他们左边！"
G["Jibbly, get someone to clean up these turds!"]="吉卜力，快找人弄掉这些大粪！"
G["Jimmy, I want to buy something."]="Jimmy, quiero comprar algo."
G["Jimmy, can you please flag me for Mount Hyjal access?"]="Jimmy, ¿puedes marcarme para acceder al Monte Hyjal?"
G["Jin'do charges his weapon with the Shadows of Hakkar!"]="金度给自己的武器注入了哈卡之影！"
G["Jin'do the Hexxer!  It's been a while since I've seen that mask."]="妖术师金度！我已经好久没见过那面具了。"
G["Jin'rokh, I am missing my Zandalar Freethinker's Armguards. Can you replace them?"]="金罗克，我的赞达拉思考者护臂不见了。你能给我一套新的吗？"
G["Jin'rokh, I fear I've lost my Zandalar Freethinker's Breastplate. Can you supply me with a replacement?"]="金罗克，我不小心弄丢了我的赞达拉思考者胸甲，你能给我一件备用的吗？"
G["Jin'rokh, I fear I've lost my Zandalar Vindicator's Breastplate. Can you supply me with a replacement?"]="金罗克，我不小心弄丢了我的赞达拉辩护者胸甲，你能给我一件备用的吗？"
G["Jin'rokh, I have lost my Zandalar Freethinker's Belt. Can you help?"]="金罗克，我弄丢了我的赞达拉思考者腰带。你能帮我吗？"
G["Jin'rokh, I need assistance in recovering a piece of my Freethinker's Armor."]="金罗克，我需要你帮我重铸一件赞达拉思考者套装。"
G["Jin'rokh, I need assistance in recovering a piece of my Vindicator's Battlegear."]="金罗克，我想我需要你帮忙重铸一件赞达拉辩护者套装。"
G["Jin'rokh, my Zandalar Vindicator's Armguards have gone missing. Do you have a spare set?"]="金罗克，我的赞达拉辩护者护臂被搞丢了，你这里还有备用的吗？"
G["Jin's life was stolen by the sha - do not blame yourself for his death.  You did what I could not."]="是邪煞夺去了金的生命——不要为他的死而责怪自己。你的努力令我望尘莫及。"
G["Jinkies, Jinky, I'm tryin' the best I know!"]="金吉，没看见我正在绞尽脑汁地鼓捣这玩意儿吗！"
G["Jinky, can I get another Speedbarge Diving Helm?"]="金吉，能再给我一个赛艇平台潜水头盔吗？"
G["Jintha'alor gonna be ours, mon. The vilebranch be weak, nasty traitors, undeservin' of the favor of the loa."]="辛萨罗一定属于我们，朋友。邪枝部族只不过是软弱而令人生厌的背叛者，他们不配得到神灵的眷顾。"
G["Jinyu Construction Site Under Attack!"]="锦鱼人建筑营地遭到攻击！"
