G["Johnson?  I think he's around here somewhere..."]="约翰森？我认为他在附近的某个地方……"
G["Join a group going to this dungeon.    <This choice will place you in a meetingstone queue>"]="加入将要进入这个地下城的队伍。<这个选择将会让你排入汇合石的队伍中>"
G["Join me ... in the depths."]="和我……共赴深渊吧。"
G["Join me in darkness and fire."]="随我一同拥抱黑暗与烈火吧。"
G["Join me!"]="加入我吧！"
G["Join me, father. Join me and we will crush this world in the name of the Scourge -- for the glory of the Lich King!"]="加入我，父亲。让我们一同以天灾之名来粉碎这个渺小的世界——巫妖王万岁！"
G["Join me, together we will weave the spirits of the forge and find the true shape that the metal seeks."]="一起来吧，我们将调整熔炉的火力，找出金属的真正形态。"
G["Join me."]="加入我吧。"
G["Join the Argent Crusade! United, we shall destroy the Lich King!"]="加入银色北伐军吧！只要我们团结起来，就一定能消灭巫妖王！"
G["Join the fight against evil!  Accept a commission within the Argent Crusade today!"]="加入对抗邪恶的战斗中吧！今天就去接受银色北伐军的委任吧！"
G["Join the fight against evil!  Accept a commission within the Argent Dawn today!"]="加入对抗邪恶的战斗中吧！今天就去获得银色黎明的委任徽章吧！"
G["Join the fight! Agrama-ka!"]="投入战斗！Agrama-ka！"
G["Join the others inside the basement next door.  Hurry!"]="去旁边那道门后的地下室里去找其他人，和他们待在一起。快！"
G["Join the students in the block formation below. Then follow the leader, as they do."]="加入下面那些弟子的队伍吧。然后像他们一样，跟着带头的做。"
G["Join us (Join us!) and be granted strength beyond strength! (Strength! His STRENGTH! His MIGHT!)"]="加入我们，（加入我们！）你们将获得超乎想象的力量！（力量！他的力量！强大的力量！）"
G["Join us!"]="加入我们吧！"
G["Join us! Join us!"]="加入我们！加入我们！"
G["Join us, $c. We could use you in the fight."]="加入我们吧，$c。你在战斗中能助我们一臂之力。"
G["Join us, $n.  Swear liegance to the Lich King.  Give yourself to him and know peace... the peace you have been denied since your wailing, terrified birth."]="加入我们吧，$n。起誓效忠巫妖王。全心全意地侍奉他，就能享受永恒的宁静……享受你降生以来从未体验过的宁静。"
G["Join us, and embrace the inevitable end. (The Master's power calls!) You will be reborn, stronger than flesh! (Strength beyond form! Power in the infinite!)"]="加入我们，接受必然的结局吧。（主人的力量在召唤！）你将重生，超越血肉！（超越形体的力量！无穷无尽的能量！）"
G["Join us, or fall forever!"]="加入我们，否则就去死吧！"
G["Join us."]="跟我们走吧。"
G["Join us..."]="加入我们……"
G["Join us... forever."]="加入我们……直到永远。"
G["Join with your brothers and sisters at Drohn's Distillery and drink for the horde!"]="去德罗恩的酿酒厂加入你的兄弟姐妹们，一起为部落干杯！"
G["Joining you in this trial will be a few of our more... reckless... students. Prove yourself by keeping them all in the fight."]="加入试炼的还有几位更……鲁莽的……弟子。想要证明你自己，就别让他们闲下来。"
G["Joke's on you, mon. I found Jang'thraze long ago. Had both of de halves...'til some wily one come and steal one away in de night."]="我在开玩笑，朋友。我很久以前就找到了迦萨斯，从而同时拥有了它的两半……但有个狡诈的家伙趁着黑夜把其中一半偷走了。"
G["Jokkum, son of Arngrim, I have always regretted my actions here. In my grief, I brought great harm to those closest to me."]="约库姆国王，安格里姆之子，我一直对自己的行为感到后悔。我压抑不住内心的伤痛，深深地伤害了身边的亲人。"
G["Jon-Jon, I'm here to lead your wind rider squad and drop off the Kor'kron assassins."]="乔乔，我到这里来是为了领导你的双足飞龙小队，空降库卡隆刺客。"
G["Jones still owes me money from our last card game.  Can you believe he tried to cheat me!  I may be little, but he cheats very big."]="上次玩牌，琼斯还欠我一笔赌债呢。这家伙居然想抽我老千！他这骗子，胃口比我个子还大！"
G["Joo may tink this ma walkin stick mon. Dat's jus wat I want joo to tink."]="你也许会认为这是我的手杖。这是我正希望你所想的。"
G["Jooga feel happy to see cute panda girl!"]="尤噶喜欢看到可爱的熊猫人女孩！"
G["Jooga feels angry about what you did!"]="尤噶对你感到很生气！"
G["Jooga is |cFFFF0000|Hspell:110182|h[Slippery]|h|r! Kick a barrel at him to make him stand still!"]="尤噶|cFFFF0000|Hspell:110182|h[滑溜溜]|h|r的！将一只木桶踢向他，让他站着别动！"
G["Jooga just want give hug to panda girl."]="尤噶只是想抱抱熊猫人女孩。"
G["Jooga no can see!"]="尤噶看不见啦！"
G["Jooga not happy about barrel on head!"]="尤噶不喜欢被酒桶套住脑袋！"
G["Jooga throwing his fruit! Because he feels mad!"]="尤噶在扔水果！因为他快要疯了！"
G["Jor Jor hails from the Valley of the Four Winds. Born a farmer's child, he left his home to come here when he heard of your arrival. He believes himself a warrior, but I can assure you he is but an arrogant youth, longing for the thrill of combat without ever having endured its horrors."]="皎皎来自四风谷。他是个农民的孩子，一听说你到来的消息就立即从家里赶来。他觉得自己是个战士，可我敢说，他只是个自大的年轻人，渴望战斗的刺激，却不曾感受过战争带来的恐惧。"
G["Jorgensen is real dainty, by the way. He's a paladin, so be careful what you say around him or you're liable to make him cry."]="顺便说一句，约根森是位真正的雅士。他是位圣骑士，所以在他身边说话时要小心点儿，否则你很可能会令他抓狂。"
G["Jorgensen, what do you have on Render's Valley?"]="约根森，你对撕裂者山谷有把握吗？"
G["Josetta has been a blessing to this town with her aid of the local guards.  If you seek her for training in the ways of a priest, you can find her in the Lion's Pride Inn."]="洁塞塔经常帮助镇子里的守卫，她是圣光赐予我们的礼物。如果你想学习牧师技能的话，可以去狮王之傲旅店找她。"
G["Joust!"]="骑兵！"
G["Jubeka's mark clearly indicates she entered the Black Temple here."]="裘碧卡留下的记号清楚地表明她进入了黑暗神殿。"
G["Jubeka, I no longer wish to be tainted by this fel energy."]="裘碧卡，我不想再被这种邪能污染了。"
G["Jubeka, complete the ritual."]="裘碧卡，结束仪式吧。"
G["Jubeka?! What are you...?!"]="裘碧卡？！你在干什么……？！"
G["Jubjub?  Where are you, Jubjub?  Oh no!  Where did you go this time!"]="加布加布？你在哪儿，加布加布？你这次又跑哪儿去了！"
G["Judge me by my age, would you?"]="你是在以年龄评断我的实力吗？"
G["Judging by its color, this must be The Warden.\n\nYou see a small indentation where your pawn might fit."]="根据颜色判断，这一定就是戒卫。\n\n你在它上面找到一个小缺口，与你的棋卒轮廓正好吻合。"
G["Judging by your signal, we put you... ust southeast of the larger part of the island we crashed onto.  Cross the Crystalbrook River to ge... kshhhhk zzzt. Sorry, there's a lot of stat..."]="根据信号来源，我们判断你是在……飞船坠毁点的东南方。穿过晶水河……嗞嗞嗞嗞。抱歉，干扰实在太大了……"
G["Judging from his injuries, the Admiral was cruelly tortured."]="从伤口上看，上将遭受过严酷的折磨。"
G["Judgment day comes! The brotherhood will be reborn!"]="审判日到了！兄弟会必将重生！"
G["Judgment day comes, brothers and sisters! Will you be prepared?"]="审判之日已经来临，兄弟姐妹们！你们准备好了吗？"
G["Judgment day is soon upon us, Helix."]="审判日很快就要到来了，赫利克斯。"
G["Juggling fire has got to be scary!"]="那个喷火的真吓人！"
G["Juicy fruits for sale!"]="卖新鲜的水果啦！"
G["Jump from rock to rock to attract the attention of the Broodmother!"]="从一块石头跳到另一块石头上，吸引龙女王的注意力！"
G["Jump three times and dance for ten minutes and it will definitely happen!"]="跳三次，然后扭摆十分钟，就行了！"
G["Jump to free yourself from the webs!"]="跳起以从网中挣脱！"
G["Jump to prevent the resin from hardening!"]="跳起以阻止树脂硬化！"
G["Jump to shake off the Cinderlings!"]="跳起来甩掉燃灰幼蛛！"
G["Jump to shake off the young crocolisks!"]="跳起来，甩掉那些小鳄鱼！"
G["Jumping jackhoppers! We found it! We really found it! It's Old Man Thistle's hidden treasure! Oh boy oh boy oh boy!!!"]="万岁！我们找到了！我们找到了！老农阿蓟的秘密宝藏！哦天哪哦天哪哦天哪！！！"
G["Jungle Fever"]="丛林热"
G["Junior! Junior! Snap out of it."]="儿子！儿子！打起精神来！"
G["Junior! Nooooo!"]="儿子！不——！"
G["Junior! You're okay!"]="儿子！你没事了！"
G["Junk shot that thing!"]="轰碎那个怪物！"
G["Juntz, I'm here to collect a debt.  Pay up."]="琼兹，我是来讨债的。给钱吧。"
G["Juro: EXECUTE HIM!"]="裘诺：处决他！"
G["Just /lay down anywhere, $n. I promise, this won't hurt a bit!"]="$n，随便找个什么地方躺下。我保证你不会受到伤害的！"
G["Just a bit longer, Wakener! They are on their last legs!"]="只需要再等一小会，唤醒者！ 他们快要撑不住了！"
G["Just a bunch of meaningless scribbles."]="只是几张没用的书写稿。"
G["Just a few more and our stables will be overflowing with mounts. Release it into my custody, soldier. I'll take it from here."]="再有一些坐骑我们的马厩就满啦。士兵，让我来保管它们吧。我会从这儿牵走一些。"
G["Just a few more minutes..."]="再等几分钟……"
G["Just a few more minutes...  Cenarius is almost here!"]="再坚持几分钟……塞纳留斯就快到了！"
G["Just a few more shipments of jade, and the dragon will be complete."]="再有一些玉石，这条龙就完成了。"
G["Just a few more swings and it'll be ready..."]="再转上几圈就准备好了……"
G["Just a few nibbles.  Hoping for a bite soon!"]="只遇到过几次试探性的啮咬。但愿很快就能有上钩的！"
G["Just a flesh wound."]="只是皮肉伤。"
G["Just a little cellular trauma induction, maybe a few tissue samples, a session of micro-sonic deep gene-probing. Nothing terribly invasive!"]="只不过是一些简单的细胞穿刺感应，可能还要进行一些组织取样，再进行一次深入的超声波基因探查。不会造成严重损伤的！"
G["Just a little closer..."]="再靠近一点……"
G["Just a little more power..."]="还需要一点能量……"
G["Just a little more, and it will be finished."]="再来一点点，就能完成了。"
G["Just a little taste..."]="一些小点心……"
G["Just a little while longer, I've almost got it!"]="再坚持一会，我快要得到它了！"
G["Just a minor adjustment here... ah there we go!"]="只需做些小调整……搞定！"
G["Just a moment, $n."]="请稍等，$n。"
G["Just a moment, Teng. We have... a visitor."]="等等，邓。我们……有访客了。"
G["Just a pinch..."]="只要一点……"
G["Just a scratch!"]="不疼不痒！"
G["Just a sec!"]="马上！"
G["Just a second! You can't rush art!"]="再等一秒！艺术是催不出来的！"
G["Just a small songbook that I thought you might like to have.  It contains the lyrics to a song known as the Lament of the Highborne; the one that Lady Sylvanas glamoured from the air."]="只是一本我觉得你可能会喜欢的小歌集而已。里面记录了一首名叫《上层精灵的挽歌》的歌词，那是希尔瓦娜斯心中的天籁之音。"
G["Just a stick? Want me to show you what 'just a stick' can do?"]="¿Un simple palo? ¿Quieres que te enseñe todo lo que puede hacer \"un simple palo\"?"
G["Just a taste..."]="就咬一小口……"
G["Just a taste... of what awaits you."]="这只是……一点小小的教训。"
G["Just about done here..."]="差不多好了……"
G["Just an ordinary crate. Definitely no one hiding here."]="只是一个普通的箱子。肯定没有人藏在里面。"
G["Just an ordinary gas cloud, but watch out because that's no ordinary gas cloud!"]="这是普通的毒云，但请千万小心，这毒云其实并不普通！"
G["Just another day workin' the kitchen.  Sure gets dull after a while."]="每天都在厨房里做同样的事。要不了多久肯定会厌倦的。"
G["Just arrived from the Barrens."]="刚刚从贫瘠之地回来。"
G["Just as Daral'nir soothes the cursed druids who gave into the beast and abandoned balance, let Tal'doren soothe $n."]="让塔多伦去安慰$n吧，就像达拉尼尔安慰那些因为受到诅咒，而放弃了平衡的信仰，变成野兽的德鲁伊一样。"
G["Just as Goldrinn's spirit once blessed our druids, let $n be blessed with the wisdom of his race and the ferocity of the wolf god."]="就像戈德林之魂曾经祝福过我们的德鲁伊那样，请让$n得到祝福，赐予他智慧和狼神的勇猛吧。"
G["Just as I expected. Did you want to give it another go?"]="不出我所料。你还想再来一次吗？"
G["Just as I expected. Do you want to give it another go?"]="不出我所料。你还想再来一次吗？"
G["Just as I expected. You are too weak to defeat me!"]="不出所料。你根本不是我的对手！"
G["Just as I suspected... the Horde is here, in Pandaria. And they've allied with the hozen."]="不出我所料……部落也来到了潘达利亚，还和一群猴子结了盟。"
G["Just as I thought, the gems and the necklace don't matter.  It's all about the power source."]="正如我所想的那样，宝石和项链没有问题，问题在于能量之源。"
G["Just as I thought. You never stood a chance."]="不出所料。你完全没机会。"
G["Just as all life ends in death ... all order must end in chaos ... Come! Embrace the inevitable, as I have!"]="如同生命终将归于死亡……秩序终将归于混沌……来吧！拥抱不可违抗的宿命！"
G["Just as our lord saved me, so too shall I save you!"]="让我拯救你吧，就像阿尔萨斯王子拯救我一样！"
G["Just as this day marks an ending, so too does it herald a new beginning..."]="这一天标志着一个结束，这一天也宣告了一个全新的开始……"
G["Just as well, I've had enough of this place."]="我已经受够这个地方了。"
G["Just as well."]="谁不是呢？"
G["Just as you deserve!"]="罪有应得！"
G["Just because it's not my heart doesn't mean it can't be broken."]="虽然这不是我的心，但它同样会破碎。"
G["Just because something isn't broke doesn't mean you can't fix it.  You lookin' for something, sweety?"]="即使东西没有损坏，也不代表你不能鼓捣它。你想要什么，亲爱的？"
G["Just because you put magic in to an artifact does not mean it has to stay there."]="你只是向神器中注入了魔力，并不意味着那些魔力将永远留存在其中。"
G["Just between you and me, I worry that the good General here doesn't have the stomach to do what needs to be done.\n\nThis is the Horde we're dealing with. History shows there can never be peace.\n\nOur goal should be ... annihilation."]="这话可别对别人说。我很担心这里的将军并不想做他该做的事情。\n\n我们要对付的是部落。历史表明，他们从不会给予我们真正的和平。\n\n我们的目标是……把敌人消灭干净。"
G["Just between you and me, hon, I'm too short to pull this kind of duty. One more month and I'm out.\n\nI've already died once. No sense doing it a second time."]="我们两个私下说，宝贝儿，我的身高不适合执行这种任务。再坚持一个月我就要离开了。\n\n我已经死过一次。没必要再来一回。"
G["Just bring them out again, then watch."]="尽管把她们带出来，然后好好看着吧。"
G["Just browsing my wares or is there something specific I can help you find today?"]="看看我卖的东西吧，有什么你想要的吗？"
G["Just calm down. Are you alright?"]="镇定。你还好吗？"
G["Just chill!"]="冷静！"
G["Just deposit any food you gather on the table here. We can take it from there."]="把你找到的食物都放到那边的桌子上吧，我们会自行取用。"
G["Just do as I say and this war will end without incident. Unless you count the death of every worgen in Lordaeron as an incident."]="按照我说的去做，这场战争将顺利结束。当然，我们不应该太在意死在洛丹伦的那些狼人。"
G["Just don't ask me where I got it..."]="不要问它从哪里来……它的故乡在……"
G["Just down the coast, the Horde is searching for a place to land their troops."]="在下面的海岸上，部落正在寻找驻扎地点。"
G["Just face the ledge, and jump!"]="只要面对岩壁，然后跳！"
G["Just fifty more hooves and I'll have the new gun!"]="还要50只蹄子我就能有新火枪啦！"
G["Just gather what we need and let him figure it out. Are you ready? Let's move."]="集齐我们所需要的，让他弄清原委。你准备好了吗？我们出发吧。"
G["Just get me close enough to our base and I can channel a teleport!"]="让我尽量接近基地，这样我才能使用传送技能！"
G["Just give me a little more time, I can fix it. I know it."]="再给我点时间，我能弄好。真的。"
G["Just give me the 'copter, Friz."]="费利兹，把直升机给我。"
G["Just give the order, sir."]="请下令吧，长官。"
G["Just give up and die already!"]="放弃吧，老老实实地受死吧。"
G["Just give up! It's hopeless! You'll never beat me!"]="放弃吧！没希望的！你赢不了我！"
G["Just go away! Zhu's Watch takes care of itself. We don't need any help from so-called \"adventurers!\""]="¡Lárgate! La Atalaya de Zhu puede defenderse sola. ¡No necesitamos la ayuda de los que os hacéis llamar \"aventureros\"!"
G["Just go stomp on those little weeds. No need to waste your time picking them."]="你只要把那些小草踩烂就行了。不用浪费时间去拔它们。"
G["Just got number 41! How's that for skill?"]="第41个！我的技术不错吧？"
G["Just had a little snow in my eye, there..."]="雪花落到我的眼睛里了……"
G["Just hang on. We'll get through this."]="抓紧。让我们勇敢地迎接挑战吧。"
G["Just in time, $n.  Here come the Forsaken."]="Justo a tiempo, camarada. Ahí vienen los Renegados."
G["Just in time, $p! We need your help!"]="$p，来得正好！我们需要你的帮助！"
G["Just in time. Let's see this thing off, then."]="来得正是时候。我们赶紧搞定这件事吧。"
G["Just in... another batch of Darkmoon Special Reserve.  Come get yours before they're all gone!"]="就在……另一批暗月储备物资中。取回属于你自己的那份吧，它们很快会被抢光的！"
G["Just keep standing there looking dumb, it suits you."]="Quédate ahí con cara de $gtonto:tonta;, es lo mejor que sabes hacer."
G["Just keep tossing! I think they are starting to run away."]="一直扔就对了！我想他们开始逃跑了。"
G["Just kill me, mon! I don't wanna be a Scourge!"]="杀了我吧！我不想加入天灾军团！"
G["Just leave 'em in the cellar."]="放在地下室就行了。"
G["Just leave me here or they'll take you too!"]="别管我了，否则它们会把你也抓走的！"
G["Just leave the poor man alone, citizen, he's not worth the trouble."]="把那个可怜人留在这里，你不应该为此浪费时间。"
G["Just leave your money in the coffer."]="就把你的钱留在箱子里吧。"
G["Just lemme know if there be anything I can help ya with, mon."]="朋友，需要帮忙的话尽管开口。"
G["Just let me know when ya ready, mon."]="准备好了就告诉我，朋友。"
G["Just let me know when you're ready for the ritual, $n."]="Avísame cuando estés $glisto:lista; para el ritual, $n."
G["Just let me know when you're ready to take a squad out.\n\nI'm holding some in reserve, so if you need a few more, come back."]="如果你准备好带队出动，就告诉我。\n\n我这里还有一些预备队，所以，如果你还需要更多的人，就回来找我。"
G["Just like her. The parallels I've heard are interesting. And it's no secret all druids, Shu'halo and elf alike, can call upon Mu'sha's light."]="就像她一样，我听到的非常有趣。众所周知的是，所有德鲁伊，无论是舒哈鲁还是精灵，都能召唤穆萨的月光。"
G["Just like hunters, pets can choose specializations. Ferocious pets, like cats, can dish out damage but can't take it as well. Tenacious pets, like turtles, are more defensive and can occupy an enemy's attention while you stay at range. Cunning pets, like spiders, have a mix of offensive and defensive abilities and are particularly useful in Battlegrounds and Arenas.\n\nEach pet comes with a default specialization, but you can change it if you like."]="与猎人一样，宠物也可选择天赋专精。狂野宠物，例如猫科动物。它们拥有可观的输出伤害，承受伤害的能力却偏弱。坚韧宠物，例如海龟。它们拥有多种防御技能，能吸引敌人的火力，便于你进行远程输出。狡诈宠物，例如蜘蛛。它们同时拥有攻击和防御技能，在战场和竞技场的作用显得尤为突出。\n\n每种宠物都自带一种默认天赋，但你可以根据自己的喜好加以更改。"
G["Just like old times, eh, $n?"]="就像过去一样，对不对， $n？"
G["Just like old times, eh, $n?\n\nI'm not too busy here to train you. These guys are creampuffs."]="Como en los viejos tiempos, ¿eh, $n? No estoy demasiado ocupado para instruirte. Esos tipos son unos bocaditos de crema."
G["Just like the League to leave a dwarf stranded with no help and no ale!"]="就像这探险者协会一样把我一个人丢在这里，甚至连一口麦酒都没得喝！"
G["Just look at this place!\n\nIt's an archaeologist's dream..."]="看看这地方！\n\n这是考古学家的梦想……"
G["Just look at this place! An entire ecology secluded, cut off from all known timelines!\n\nIt is rare for one such as I to be surprised by, well, anything really. I shall relish every moment I spend here."]="看看这儿！一个与世隔绝的、完整的生态圈，与已知的所有时间流都毫无牵连！\n\n很少有东西能让我这样的人感到吃惊。我一定要好好珍惜在这里度过的每一秒钟。"
G["Just look at this place! It's amazing!"]="看看这地方！真令人吃惊！"
G["Just look at this place, Malkorok. THIS is the prosperity that our people deserve!"]="看看这里吧，马尔考罗克。只有我们的人民才配得上这样繁荣昌盛的国土。"
G["Just look at those mantid below us. The Empress orders the Swarm much too early! Another sign of her chaotic delusions."]="看看下方那些螳螂妖。女皇这么早就派大军出袭了！这是她心智失常的又一迹象。"
G["Just need to rest my eyes a bit..."]="只是需要打个盹……"
G["Just north of Azure Watch is where you will have the best luck finding moongraze bucks.\n\nHappy hunting, $n!"]="Justo al norte de la Avanzada Azur es donde tendrás mejor suerte para encontrar ciervos lunares.\n\n¡Buena caza, $n!"
G["Just one final push and the island will be ours.  Chin up men, we move out first thing in the morning."]="只要最后一击，这座岛就是我们的了。振作起来，我们将在早晨开始行动。"
G["Just one good shot..."]="只需华丽的一射……"
G["Just one moment. You cannot purchase a fine elekk without proving yourself a friend to the Exodar. Return once we know you can be trusted."]="等一下。在你证明自己是埃索达的朋友之前，你不能购买我们的雷象。等我们足够信任你了之后再来吧。"
G["Just one... more... catch!"]="只要……再来……一次！"
G["Just open the door... oh no!"]="快把门打开……喔不！"
G["Just open this door."]="只要你们打开这扇门。"
G["Just outside the city's main gate is a signpost.  It will point you toward the western zeppelin tower."]="在城市的大门外有一处路标指向西部地精塔。"
G["Just passing through? Tell me, how can I help you?"]="Solo estás pasando por aquí? Dime, ¿cómo puedo ayudarte?"
G["Just pick a spot already!"]="随便选个地方好了！"
G["Just point me at de enemy!"]="指引我杀敌！"
G["Just point me in the right direction. I'll carry the load."]="给我指出正确的方向。我来搬。"
G["Just relax... Panicking will only make it worse."]="放松……恐慌只会让一切变得更糟。"
G["Just release me already! I've had enough!"]="让我回去吧！我受够你了！"
G["Just remember that you can only pick one gathering job to do per day. Aside from that, we're always looking for more crystals. Any worthless peon can bring those back to the base camp."]="记住，你每天只能做一次收集工作。但是，我们也一直需要更多的水晶。任何废柴苦工都能把那些东西带回营地。"
G["Just remember, $n, it's in our best interests that you do as much as possible for these... these people."]="记住，$n，你尽心竭力地帮助他们便是对我们莫大的恩惠……"
G["Just remember, real crops will take a day to grow, so after you've tilled and cared for your plants, come back the next day to harvest your bounty!"]="记住一点，真正的庄稼需要一整天的生长周期，所以在你完成耕种和照料后，第二天再回去收获果实吧！"
G["Just say the word, and I'll be there to help."]="只要你一句话，我就会来帮你。"
G["Just show me the way, Franclorn."]="弗兰克罗恩，告诉我该怎么做。"
G["Just shut up and teleport me to the Undercity."]="闭嘴，把我传送到幽暗城。"
G["Just sit right back and you'll hear a ta... *hic* a tai... *hic* a taiiii *hic* Damnit!"]="别动，你会听到嗝……嗝……的打嗝声，真该死！"
G["Just sit tight while I get this prepared for you!"]="坐好了，等我把一切都准备妥当！"
G["Just so you guys don't feel left out, all I said was how attractive the blood elves are.  It loses something in the translation."]="你们不要感到失落，我的意思是血精灵是多么迷人啊。都是翻译的错。"
G["Just stand back, $n. We wouldn't want $gyou:a pretty little thing like you; getting hurt."]="Apártate, $n. No queremos que una florecilla silvestre como tú se haga daño."
G["Just stay focused on the battle in front of us, or you won't live to worry about the rest."]="专注于眼前的这场战斗，不然你怕是没命来担心了。"
G["Just swinging a hammer at an anvil doesn't make you a smith. Give me that and let me teach you something before you embarrass us all."]="Aporrear el yunque con un martillo no te convierte en $gherrero:herrera;. Dame eso y déjame enseñarte algo antes de que nos abochornes a todos."
G["Just take a deep breath. Did you see anything?"]="深呼吸。你看见什么了吗？"
G["Just take the picture already!"]="赶紧按下快门就是了！"
G["Just tap the keg already!"]="打开酒桶！"
G["Just teleport me for now. But I can't wait for that sweet sweet elevator!"]="现在就传送我。我已经等不及使用那个漂亮的升降机了！"
G["Just tell me one thing, Vanessa."]="我只想知道一件事，梵妮莎。"
G["Just tell us what you know about the Shady Rest Inn, and I won't bash your skull in."]="和我们讲讲你对树荫旅店的事情有什么了解，放心，我不会打你的。"
G["Just the other day I saw a much more powerful $c flying overhead."]="Justo el otro día vi a $gun:una; $c mucho más $gpoderoso:poderosa; volando por el cielo."
G["Just the two of you?  You'll never stand a chance."]="就你们两个？你们根本没有机会。"
G["Just think of all the knowledge I could share. Think of all the food we could grow!"]="只要想想我能分享多少知识，我们能种出怎样的食材吧！"
G["Just this once..."]="只此一次……"
G["Just try to stop us now!"]="来阻挡我们啊！"
G["Just two minutes to go!  We're half way there, but don't let your guard down!"]="只有两分钟时间了！我们只完成了一半，不要放松警惕！"
G["Just wait, I'll have that troll singin' by day's end."]="等一会儿，我马上就让那个巨魔尖叫到半夜。"
G["Just wanted to let you know that we're all counting on you!"]="只想让你知道，我们全都在指望你呢！"
G["Just was resting eyes!  Back to work now!"]="只是歇歇眼睛！马上就回去干活！"
G["Just what I be t'inkin'. More delays."]="就像我所想的那样。又拖延了。"
G["Just what I was waiting for! Time to introduce those yaungol to my fists!"]="我已经忍了很久了！该让那些野牛人看看我的拳头了！"
G["Just what an hungry old man needs. Thanks."]="这正是一个饥肠辘辘的老头所需要的。谢谢。"
G["Just what in the name of all that is unholy was that thing?"]="那到底是什么邪恶的玩意儿？"
G["Just what we need, more of this lunacy!"]="这正是我们需要的，更多的蠢货！"
G["Just when I think a group is the worst, something wonderful happens!"]="我刚想说这是个烂组，好事就来了！"
G["Just when I thought it couldn't get any worse...."]="我本来以为情况不可能更糟了……"
G["Just when I thought we'd gotten a break by getting away from those raptors, things get even worse around here.\n\nNo use bellyaching though. We're gonna face this like proper dwarves!"]="正当我以为我们终于能摆脱那些迅猛龙，喘口气时，这里的情况却变得更糟。\n\n可是抱怨是没用的。我们得像个真正的矮人一样去面对！"
G["Just when things were getting interesting."]="事情才刚刚开始变得有趣。"
G["Just when you think you've seen it all!  $n will square off with an authentic Grizzly Hills crazed furbolg in front of your very eyes here at the Conquest Pit!  Place your bets, folks!"]="你未曾见过的激战即将在征服斗兽场中上演！$n将挑战一头来自灰熊丘陵的熊怪！快下注吧！"
G["Just who do you think YOU are?"]="你以为自己是谁？"
G["Just... end it."]="让一切……结束吧。"
G["Just... leave me alone!"]="让我……安静一会儿！"
G["Just... need a second."]="再等……一会儿。"
G["Justicar Mariel Trueheart has asked us to help administer and defend the tournament now that the coliseum is complete. She wants us to work with those worthless Silver Covenant curs, but they're just getting in the way."]="现在，竞技场已经竣工。裁决者玛蕾尔·图哈特请求我们帮助管理锦标赛和保护赛事安全。她想让我们和那些无能的银色盟约混蛋们一同工作。但他们只会碍事。"
G["Justicar Mariel Trueheart has asked us to see to the needs of the tournament. Those who have earned the right to stand as champions and who have proven themselves in our eyes are asked to assist with these duties."]="裁决者玛蕾尔·图哈特请求我们负责锦标赛所需的各项工作。而我们只会邀请那些曾经在我们面前证明过自身实力的真正勇士帮助我们完成这些工作。"
G["Justicar Mariel Trueheart has entrusted us with the duty of overseeing many of the tournament's affairs. Unfortunately, she tasked the Sunreavers with the same duty, which means we must work twice as hard to solve the problems created by those fools!"]="裁决者玛蕾尔·图哈特委托我们负责锦标赛所需的各项工作。不幸的是，她把同样的工作也委托给了夺日者。那些蠢货只会给我们制造麻烦。现在我们的工作量要成倍地增加了！"
G["Justice & Valor Quartermasters"]="英雄及勇气军需官"
G["Justice Quartermaster"]="正义军需官"
G["Justice Quartermasters"]="正义军需官"
G["Justice is done!"]="正义得到了伸张！"
G["Justice is served!"]="正义得到了伸张！"
G["Justice will be done."]="正义必将得到伸张。"
G["Justice will be served, heathen!"]="正义终将得到伸张，异端！"
G["Justice will prevail."]="正义必胜。"
G["Justin Thavirat! Roman Kenney! Our entire awesome art and animation team!"]="¡Justin Thavirat! ¡Roman Kenney! ¡Todo nuestro fantástico equipo de arte y animación!"
G["K-k-k-k-kkkah!  I am freed from the naga's servitude, and my will is once again my own!"]="啊——啊！我终于不用再受纳迦的奴役了，我的意志又是我自己的了！"
G["K... Kasha... you... came back for me..."]="卡……卡莎……你……为了我回来……"
G["KABOOM!"]="砰！！"
G["KAGANISHU!"]="卡加尼舒！"
G["KASHA! NO!!"]="卡莎！不！！"
G["KASHA! Your master needs you!"]="卡莎！你的主人需要你！"
G["KASHA, GET $P OUT OF HERE!"]="卡莎，带$P离开这里！"
G["KEEP FIGHTING! I'M GOING UP TOP TO SPEAK WITH CHO'GALL!"]="继续战斗！我要到顶上去和古加尔谈谈！"
G["KILL ALLIANCE and make sure our new goblin bomb gets to Stonetalon in one piece..."]="消灭联盟，并确保我们的新式地精炸弹能完好无损的到达石爪山……"
G["KILL ALLIANCE!"]="消灭联盟！"
G["KILL KILL KILL!!!!!!!"]="杀杀杀！！！！！"
G["KILL ME OR KILL THE GIRL!"]="杀了我，要不就杀了那小女孩！"
G["KILL PINK SKINS! KILL! KILL!"]="杀光粉皮肤的！杀！杀！"
G["KILL THEM ALL!"]="杀光他们！"
G["KILL THEM! My work must not be interrupted!"]="杀死他们！不能让他们干扰我的行动！"
G["KILL!"]="杀呀！"
G["KILL!!!"]="杀！！！"
G["KING VARIAN... YOU WISH TO MAKE WAR ON MY PEOPLE? YOU SHALL HAVE YOUR WAR, HUMAN!"]="瓦里安国王……你想向我的人民宣战？战争是你自找的，人类！"
G["KNEEL!"]="跪下！"
G["KNEEL, LITTLE MORTAL!  KNEEL BEFORE THE MIGHT OF THE HERALD OF RAGNAROS!"]="渺小的凡人，跪下！向炎魔之王拉格纳罗斯的使者致敬！"
G["KNOW NO FEAR, SOLDIERS! WE DIE FOR KALIMDOR TODAY!"]="不要感到恐惧，士兵们！今天，我们为卡利姆多奋战到最后一刻！"
G["KOL-THARISH!"]="¡KOL-THARISH!"
G["KOR! NOOOOOOOO!"]="科尔！不……！"
G["KREEEEAAGH!"]="喝啊！"
G["KROSHIUS CRUSH!"]="克罗苏斯碎击！"
G["KYTH ag'xig yyg'far IIQAATH ONGG!"]="¡KYTH ag'xig yyg'far IIQAATH ONGG!"
G["Ka-boom!"]="轰隆！"
G["Ka-boosh!"]="咔吧！"
G["Ka-kow!"]="咔咔！"
G["Kaaboooom!"]="轰轰！"
G["Kaboom!"]="嘭！"
G["Kada nu batteka, oht!"]="¡Kada nu batteka, oht!"
G["Kadesh!"]="嘿呀！"
G["Kael's lackeys are about to be taught a lesson in humility.  We will crush the Dawnblade army and take Sun's Reach Harbor from them.\n\nWe are $3238w percent done with our goal."]="Vamos a enseñar una humillante lección a los lacayos de Kael. Aplastaremos al ejército Hojalba y les arrebataremos el Puerto de Tramo del Sol.\n\nHemos completado el $3238w % de nuestra meta."
G["Kael'thas Sunstrider has been defeated by $n and $g his:her; allies."]="Kael'thas Caminante del Sol ha sido vencido por $n y sus aliados."
G["Kael'thas Sunstrider was also a student here, another of our fold who betrayed us."]="另一个背叛我们的人，凯尔萨斯·逐日者也曾在这里学习。"
G["Kael'thas and his felbloods be damned! All we've worked for is gone, but they're fools to think we won't fight back. Already, Lady Liadrin seeks a new source of power for our order. We will not be destroyed so easily."]="该死的凯尔萨斯和他的走狗们！我们的一切都没有了，但他们竟然愚蠢到认为我们不会反击。女伯爵莉亚德琳已经给我们找到了一种新的能量源。我们不会坐以待毙。"
G["Kael'thas and the Legion... just what we needed!"]="凯尔萨斯和燃烧军团……来得正好！"
G["Kael'thas lied to us.  The Outland is no paradise."]="凯尔萨斯对我们撒了谎，外域并不是天堂。"
G["Kael'thas will not tolerate any further failures!"]="凯尔萨斯不能容忍再次失败！"
G["Kael'thas will save us."]="凯尔萨斯会拯救我们。"
G["Kafa good for grummles and pandaren - not good for goots and yetis and hozen. You should know that!"]="咔啡对土地精和熊猫人有益，但对山羊、雪人和猢狲无益。这你应该知道啊！"
G["Kaganishu!"]="卡加尼舒！"
G["Kagh!"]="啊！"
G["Kagoro, I require your presence!"]="卡古隆，过来！"
G["Kah Mistrunner at Mountaintop Bait & Tackle on the high rise will show you the way to find inner peace and serenity while fishing for your next meal."]="山顶渔具店的卡尔·迷雾行者将为你指明如何实现内心平静的同时还能通过钓鱼为自己准备好下一餐。"
G["Kahil, it was a mighty effort. Come back and rest up. Narrisha will clean this up for us."]="卡希尔，你干得很好。回来休息一下。娜里莎会帮我们清理这里的。"
G["Kairoz! I want you to meet one of my most accomplished of agents."]="凯诺兹！来认识一下，这位是我最出色的帮手。"
G["Kaja'Cola is a proud sponsor of the Bilgewater Buccaneers!"]="卡亚可乐——锈水海盗队荣誉赞助品牌！"
G["Kaja'Cola! It gives you IDEAS!"]="卡亚可乐！灵感之源！"
G["Kaja'Cola! Jinxy the Weasel says, Drink it... or else!"]="¡Kaja'Cola! Jinxy la comadreja dice: \"¡Bébela... o ya verás!\"."
G["Kaja'Cola! When your tinkering has to be second to none!"]="卡亚可乐！喝上一口，你的工艺技巧就无人可比！"
G["Kaja'mite... you know, the stuff that legend holds helped the entire goblin race to evolve into the ultimate masters of alchemy and engineering?!\n\nIt's the stuff that helped us to overthrow our jungle troll oppressors, to take control of Kezan -- may she rest in peace -- and is the most valuable ore in all of existence!\n\nHey, you don't think that it's having any effect on those monkeys do you?"]="卡亚矿……你是否知道，就是这种传说中的玩意儿，帮助地精全族成为了炼金术和工程学的究极大师？！\n\n正是这种材料帮助我们推翻了压迫我们的丛林巨魔，控制了科赞——愿她得到安息——它是最珍贵的矿石！\n\n嗨，你不会是认为卡亚矿石对那些猴子也起了作用吧？"
G["Kalaran, I have misplaced my torch. I require another."]="卡拉然，我把火炬弄丢了。给我一个新的吧。"
G["Kalaran, please enchant the torch."]="卡拉然，请为火炬附魔。"
G["Kalec sent me..."]="卡雷派我来的……"
G["Kalec... Kalec?"]="卡雷……卡雷？"
G["Kalecgos has been chosen as the new aspect for the blue dragonflight.\n\nOne among you was instrumental in thwarting Arygos's betrayal to Deathwing, thereby averting a terrible crisis.\n\nWe are here to partake in the celebration of their heroic deeds."]="卡雷苟斯已经被推举为蓝龙军团的新守护巨龙。\n\n你们中的一位勇士曾帮助阻止了阿瑞苟斯倒向死亡之翼，从而避免了一场灾难。\n\n今天，我们欢聚一堂，以颂扬他们的英雄事迹。"
G["Kalecgos?! That's your good foot forward?\n\nGood luck with that one, buddy."]="卡雷苟斯？！这就是你来找我的好理由？\n\n那就祝你好运吧，伙计。"
G["Kalimaste!"]="¡Kalimaste!"
G["Kalimdor belongs to the Grimtotem. Nobody can stand in our way.\n\nWe are supreme in all things, as you will now see as I crush your pathetic team."]="卡利姆多属于恐怖图腾。没人能妨碍我们。\n\n我们是至高无上的，你马上就会亲眼看着我粉碎你那悲惨的队伍。"
G["Kalimdor for the Horde!"]="卡利姆多属于部落！"
G["Kalimdor is much changed. I do not recognize this place."]="卡利姆多改变了很多。我都不认识这个地方了。"
G["Kalytha - you're still alive! Find some cover, there's no end to these ... things!"]="卡莱莎，你还活着！赶快找掩蔽所，这些怪物简直……无穷无尽！"
G["Kalytha ... it is done. The Sarcen Stone is fully charged and is already diverting energy from the portal. Are you still the incredible swimmer I knew those many years ago? The stone must not be found by either the demons or our \"beloved\" Queen.\n\nSwim to the bottom of the lake, Kalytha, and bury the stone deep under the center arch. Hopefully the demonic invaders will not discover it when they raze the surrounding temple. Go!"]="Kalytha... Ya está hecho. La piedra sarcita está totalmente cargada y ya está desviando la energía del portal. ¿Sigues siendo esa magnífica nadadora que conocí hace tantos años? Ni los demonios ni nuestra \"amada\" Reina deben encontrar la piedra.\n\nNada hasta el fondo del lago, Kalytha, y entierra la piedra bajo el arco central. Con suerte, los invasores demoníacos no la descubrirán cuando asalten el templo circundante. ¡Ve!"
G["Kalytha! Archmage Selwyn was looking for you. She should be nearby..."]="卡莱莎，大法师瑟维恩正在找你。她应该就在附近……"
G["Kalytha! Hurry - Archmage Selwyn wanted to see you, she said it was urgent. Maybe we can win this thing?"]="卡莱莎！赶快，大法师瑟维恩正急着想要见你。也许我们还能渡过这个难关？"
G["Kang says the mogu are ruffians and bandits.\n\nFrom what we've seen so far, I think they might be becoming a larger threat than any of the pandaren suspect."]="康说魔古是一群暴徒和强盗。\n\n根据我们迄今为止的观察，我认为他们也许会成为熊猫人种族最大的威胁。"
G["Kanrethad enveloped himself with so much fel energy that it corrupted him totally. But a small taste of his power should not be harmful. Go ahead."]="坎雷萨德周围的邪能太过充沛，他已经被彻底腐蚀了。但稍微尝试一下他的力量并无大碍。去吧。"
G["Kar Aman, $n. You look to be a strong $c--you would do well to mind yourself in this area. Touching things you know nothing about, or showing disrespect to your elders is just cause for punishment.\n\nYou may not respect me or my companions, but you will learn to respect our power if you prove foolish enough.\n\nNow, enough with the pleasantries, was there something I can do for you?"]="Kar Aman, $n. Pareces $gun:una; $c fuerte. Harías bien en cuidar de ti mismo en esta zona. Meterte con cosas sobre las que no tienes ni idea u ofender a tus mayores es causa justa de castigo.\n\nPuedes faltarme al respecto a mí o a mis compañeros, pero aprenderás a respetar nuestro poder si demuestras ser lo suficientemente idiota.\n\nBueno, dejando la cortesía a un lado, ¿en qué puedo ayudarte?"
G["Kara, I need to be flown out to the Dens of Dying to find Bixie."]="卡拉，我想飞往亡者之穴寻找比希。"
G["Karazhan is more than a mere building, $n.  If you traced the ley-lines traversing Azeroth you would find that they all converge right about there.\n\n<Alturus points at an invisible spot below the tower.>\n\nFascinating, isn't it?"]="Karazhan es más que un simple edificio, $n. Si trazaras las líneas-ley que atraviesan Azeroth, verías que todas convergen justo ahí.\n\n<Alturus señala un punto invisible bajo la torre.>\n\nFascinante, ¿verdad?"
G["Karazhan wasn't always quite as... ominous.  The darkening of Karazhan only came with Medivh's death.  Or what we believe was Medivh's death."]="卡拉赞并非永远被厄运所笼罩。卡拉赞的黑暗是在麦迪文死后才降临的。或者说是我们认为如此。"
G["Kargath Bladefist has been slain! Long live the Alliance!"]="卡加斯·刃拳被杀了！联盟万岁！"
G["Kargath Bladefist has fallen! For the Horde!"]="卡加斯·刃拳倒下了！为了部落！"
G["Karin can be found in easternmost Stormwind, through the gates at the back of Old Town."]="卡琳就在暴风城的最东边，穿过旧城区后部的门就能找到她。"
G["Karn says we need to listen to the spirits of the forge and of the steel, that they will guide us. I hear nothing but a ringing in my ears. Here, take a hammer and let us try to hear the spirits together."]="卡恩说我们需要聆听熔炉和钢铁的灵魂之声，它们会指引我们的。我只听见一阵铃声。拿起铁锤，让我们一起试着听它们在说什么。"
G["Karnik, me friend, I wish I could see you with me own eyes again, but we need'ta talk of Ragnaros. His influence is spreading."]="卡尼克，我的朋友，我真希望能活着再见你一次，但是我们需要讨论一下拉格纳罗斯的问题。他的影响力正在不断扩大。"
G["Kartak comes for big-tongue meat. Frenzyheart make sure plenty is ready."]="卡塔克是来吃大舌头怪的。我们要为他准备一顿大餐。"
G["Kartak like taste of big-tongues. If Kartak hungry though, he not mind taste of Frenzyheart, so make sure Kartak not hungry."]="卡塔克喜欢吃大舌头怪。但是它饿极了的话，也会吃狂心狼獾人。所以，千万别饿着卡塔克。"
G["Kartak, I do not fear you!"]="卡塔克，我不怕你！"
G["Karu will you please help get these bees off of me? They sting!"]="卡鲁斯能不能帮我把这些蜜蜂赶走？它们在蜇我！"
G["Kasha! Come to me! I am fine!"]="卡莎！到我这儿来！我没事！"
G["Kaskala's under attack!  We must hold them off until we can escape."]="卡斯卡拉遭到攻击！我们必须拖住敌军，直到所有人安全撤离。"
G["Kaw's halberd breaks in two and falls to the ground!"]="卡奥的三叉戟断成两截，掉在了地上！"
G["Kawphi? Memory potion? Hah! This isn't a memory potion."]="卡啡？记忆药水？哈！这可不是记忆药水。"
G["Kazum!  I hold your scepter!  I command you to enter this world!"]="卡苏姆！我手中握着你的节杖，我召唤你进入这个世界！"
G["Kazzak is supreme!"]="卡扎克是至高无上的！"
G["Keegan, sir. More elementals are breaking through on the west side of the rift."]="科甘长官。更多的元素正从裂隙西侧涌过来。"
G["Keelen's tailoring shop in the northwest corner of the Bazaar has a loom like you describe."]="位于花园街市西北角的基伦裁缝店里有你说的那种织布机。"
G["Keenbean Kafa Co. is in real trouble!"]="激情豆咔啡公司这下可有大麻烦了！"
G["Keep 'em comin', $n."]="让他们放马过来吧，$n。"
G["Keep 'em hot you big dummy!"]="保持高温，你这蠢货！"
G["Keep 'em in your sights. If they make a move on the guards, they're dead."]="紧盯着他们。如果有任何异动，他们就死定了。"
G["Keep 'em off me for about 15 seconds and this thing is as good as dead."]="别让他们靠近我！我保证能在15秒内搞定这玩意儿。"
G["Keep a close eye on this Broken scum!  Far too many have escaped from us!"]="看紧这些破碎者人渣！已经有很多从我们这里逃走了！"
G["Keep a close eye on your surroundings. The route I'm taking is the same route you can use to get back to Valgarde."]="留意周围的环境。记住这条路线，以后你可以原路返回瓦加德。"
G["Keep a sharp eye out.  There must be a clue here somewhere that can help us track him down."]="别放过任何细节。这里一定有什么线索能帮助我们捉到那个凶手。"
G["Keep a sharp eye, $c.  You never know when some beastie is stalking you instead of the other way around."]="保持警惕，$c。当野兽潜行靠近你的时候，你永远不会察觉得到。"
G["Keep a wary eye out, $r; there are unsavory characters afoot."]="小心点，$r，有个令人讨厌的家伙在那里。"
G["Keep ample pressure on the southern pump."]="保证南面抽水泵的压力。"
G["Keep an eye on that tunnel. We must not let anyone through!"]="小心守着隧道。我们不能让任何人通过！"
G["Keep an eye on the rear! No - not MY rear. Behind us!"]="注意屁股后面！不——不是说我的屁股。是我们身后！"
G["Keep an eye on us, $p! We're builders, not fighters. We'll need your protection if any beasties come around!"]="注意我们这边的情况，$p！我们是建造师，不是战士。如果有敌人攻击，我们需要你帮我们防守！"
G["Keep an eye out boys.  It's too quiet out there."]="注意点，伙计们。那边太安静了。"
G["Keep an eye out for brittle roots, $p. We can use their wood in the construction of our defenses."]="别错过那些脆弱的根茎，$p。我们可以利用这些木料来建造防御工事。"
G["Keep an eye out for oily serpents, $p. They're easy enough to catch. Put their oil in the cauldron and we'll work even faster."]="注意寻找那些油腻的蛇，$p。它们很容易捕捉。把那些蛇油放进大锅里能让我们的工作速度变快。"
G["Keep an eye out for them, girl! Don't let them get us!"]="小姑娘，保持警惕！别让他们抓到我们！"
G["Keep an eye to the sea, $gbrother:sister;. The mogu can attack from anywhere."]="注意海面，$g兄弟:姐妹;。魔古族可能从任何方向发起攻击。"
G["Keep at it. If our suspicions are right and this is a transporter, it could prove extremely useful in our assault."]="别灰心。如果这确实是传送器的话，那它对我们的进攻行动会很有帮助的。"
G["Keep at them!"]="坚持住！"
G["Keep away from the edge there, champ. Don't want you falling."]="Aléjate del borde, $gcampeón:campeona;. No queremos que te caigas."
G["Keep away. The fool is mine."]="小心。这个蠢货交给我来对付。"
G["Keep back from this stall, please; there is a delicate investigation underway."]="请离开这个摊位。这里正在接受调查。"
G["Keep bringin' ones like that!"]="我想看到更多的好马！"
G["Keep bringing me food like this an' ye'll be me new best friend!"]="¡Sigue trayéndome comida como esta y pronto serás mi $gnuevo mejor amigo:nueva mejor amiga;!"
G["Keep casting! I will dispose of them."]="继续施法！我会处理掉那些家伙。"
G["Keep dese assassins off of me!"]="别让刺客靠近我！"
G["Keep everyone working efficiently."]="确保每个人都有效率地工作。"
G["Keep fighting, $c! The Demon Chain will eventually win out."]="继续战斗，$c！恶魔之链一定能制服他。"
G["Keep fighting, pandaren! Cancel all retreat orders! Stoneplow hasn't fallen yet!"]="继续战斗，熊猫人！撤销所有的撤退命令！石犁村还没有丢！"
G["Keep firing!  Cut off their reinforcements!"]="继续射击！阻挡他们的援军！"
G["Keep firing! Let none escape!"]="继续放箭！一个也别想跑！"
G["Keep going! Kill!"]="再接再厉！杀啊！"
G["Keep going! Water my Cabbages!"]="继续！给我的卷心菜浇水！"
G["Keep going, you're almost there!\n\nThis is my third trip through the pass. I wish I could say it was getting easier!\n\nWhen you get to the top, there's a wonderful inn called the \"Tavern in the Mist.\" Keep your weapons close, though. You'll run across all kinds of characters."]="Sigue andando, ¡casi has llegado!\n\nEste es mi tercer viaje por este pase. ¡Ojalá pudiera decir que se hace más fácil con el tiempo!\n\nCuando llegues arriba, hay una posada estupenda llamada \"la Taberna en la Niebla\". Pero no pierdas de vista tus armas, allí hay todo tipo de personajes."
G["Keep hacking at the overgrowth! If that doesn't work, we're going to start burning."]="砍掉这些过度生长的植物！如果这样还没有用，我们就必须烧光它们了。"
G["Keep him asleep, that's it. No need to wake him before it's time."]="让他睡吧。在那个时刻到来之前，我们不需要唤醒他。"
G["Keep him busy! I am almost finished!"]="缠住他！我就快成功了！"
G["Keep him distracted!"]="分散他的注意，别让他闲着！"
G["Keep him weak!"]="不要给他喘息的机会！"
G["Keep it down back there or you'll join your friends!"]="待在那儿别动，否则你也要加入你的朋友们！"
G["Keep it down fruit vendor!"]="安静些，水果贩子！"
G["Keep it down lady!"]="不要吵，女士！"
G["Keep it down!  I don't want them to see me over here.\n\nOoh, this really burns me up!  Who do these ethereals think they are?\n\nThis is MY claim!"]="低调！我不想让他们看到我在这里。\n\n哦，这真让我火冒三丈！这些虚灵觉得他们自己是谁？\n\n这是我的地盘！"
G["Keep it down! We'll get this sorted out as soon as we can."]="不要吵！我们会尽快做好甄别工作。"
G["Keep it down, will you? I'm trying to run a business here..."]="拜托，别吵了。我还要做生意呢……"
G["Keep it moving, people."]="下一位，下一位。"
G["Keep it quiet in there. They only get thirty minute rest shifts, and I'll not have ya distrubin' them."]="保持安静。他们只有三十分钟休息时间，我不能让你打扰他们。"
G["Keep it to yourself."]="我不想听。"
G["Keep it together man!  What about Zangarmarsh?"]="嘿！清醒一点，哥们！赞加沼泽怎么了？"
G["Keep it up!"]="继续！"
G["Keep it up! Now water my Red-Leaf Lettuce!"]="继续！现在给我的红叶莴苣浇水！"
G["Keep it up, $n, and I'll beat some manners into you."]="Anímate, $n, y te inculcaré modales a golpes."
G["Keep it up, boys!  We've got work to do!"]="坚持，兄弟们！我们还有事情没干完！"
G["Keep it up, they are beginning to rout!"]="加油，他们开始溃散了！"
G["Keep it up, you're doing great!"]="继续，你做得很好！"
G["Keep it up."]="加把劲。"
G["Keep it up. I am working miracles here!"]="加把劲。我正在创造奇迹。"
G["Keep it up... they'll never find your body."]="你再敢这样……会死无全尸。"
G["Keep killing my pets and you may find a dash of poison in your drink tonight."]="你要再敢伤害我的宠物，你今晚的酒杯里就会多出一滴毒药了。"
G["Keep looking, Reliquary. We will find it. The bell is meant to ensure Horde victory. I feel it in my bones."]="别停下，神圣遗物协会。我们会找到圣钟的。它会确保部落获得最终的胜利。我从骨子里相信这一点。"
G["Keep moving forward. My men will dispose of this sorry bag of bones."]="继续前进。我的部下会处理这只悲惨的尸骨袋。"
G["Keep moving or you will risk being hit by arcane detonations that will hurl you into the waters below."]="任何时候都不要停在某处不动，否则你就有可能被奥术爆炸击中，落进下方的水中。"
G["Keep moving! Avoid the Storm-Lord's lightning!"]="别停下！躲开暴风领主的闪电！"
G["Keep moving! They need you on the field!"]="继续前进！他们需要你前去支援！"
G["Keep moving, men! I want a steady stream of shells for these guns!"]="别停下，伙计们！保持火炮的弹药充足！"
G["Keep moving. Your foe is dangerous, but you are smarter."]="保持移动。敌人很危险，但你更聪明。"
G["Keep on 'em, mateys. We've got 'em on the run!"]="再接再厉，伙计们。他们四散奔逃了！"
G["Keep on fightin', $n!"]="继续作战，$n！"
G["Keep on fighting, grunts! THE EYES OF HELLSCREAM ARE UPON US!"]="继续战斗，蛮兵！地狱咆哮之眼在注视着我们！"
G["Keep on fighting, lads! DON'T GIVE UP!"]="战斗到底，小伙子们！决不放弃！"
G["Keep placing spitters in the center lane to hold off the zombies."]="在中间那条路上不断放置喷酸草来阻击僵尸。"
G["Keep polishing those cannonballs. I want to see my face in them!"]="继续擦亮那些炮弹。我要它们亮得能照出人影来！"
G["Keep pressing the fight, $n!"]="继续，使劲打，$n！"
G["Keep quiet, will you?  If anyone catches on, we're both dead."]="Estate callad$go:a;, ¿quieres? Si alguien nos pilla, estamos muert$go:a;s l$go:a;s dos."
G["Keep regulating the main valve to ensure steady flow."]="保持调节主阀来保证流动的稳定。"
G["Keep starin', I don't get any prettier."]="好好看看，我有没有变漂亮些？"
G["Keep staring.  I enjoy awkward silence."]="继续瞪着我。我喜欢尴尬的沉默。"
G["Keep striking!"]="接着打！"
G["Keep telling your story, Sully."]="接着说，苏利。"
G["Keep that crab on his toes, mate. His shell might 'ave hardened with age, but his joints are weak."]="让那只螃蟹动起来，伙计。它的甲壳虽然久经风霜，可它的关节是很脆弱的。"
G["Keep that sword arm straight, $n."]="持剑的手臂要挺直，$n。"
G["Keep the $c alive. $gHe:She; will be our bargaining chip."]="别让那$c死了。$g他:她;将是我们谈判的筹码。"
G["Keep the bad guys off me!"]="别让那些坏人靠近我！"
G["Keep the body strong, and the mind will follow."]="保持体魄强健，心智也将随之坚韧。"
G["Keep the chatter down, people. We need to stay alert!"]="安静！我们要保持警惕！"
G["Keep the conversations curt. I am in no mood for whining or rambling."]="说话简略一些。我可没心情听什么抱怨和闲聊。"
G["Keep the drinks coming; it's going to be a long night!"]="继续上酒，今晚不醉不休！"
G["Keep the mantid back!  We are almost done."]="挡住螳螂妖！我们就快完成了。"
G["Keep the mind open, aware. See opportunities. Exploit them!"]="保持头脑的开放与清醒。善于发现并利用机会！"
G["Keep the spark centered!"]="让火花保持在中间位置！"
G["Keep the totems alive! Hurry!"]="恢复那个图腾！赶快！"
G["Keep them away from the focus!"]="别让他们靠近！"
G["Keep them back!"]="把他们打退！"
G["Keep them back!  They will not delve into our secrets!"]="挡住他们！不能让他们知晓我们的秘密！"
G["Keep them coming!  We need more supplies in order to rebuild..."]="保持这样！我们还需要更多的物资来重建……"
G["Keep them from hitting me and I'll seal the hatch!"]="别让他们打到我，然后我才能封住这个缺口！"
G["Keep them occupied, my brothers!  Allow $n to retrieve the scythe!"]="兄弟们，吸引她们的注意力！让$n能够取回镰刀！"
G["Keep them off me!"]="别让他们靠近我！"
G["Keep them split from their main force!"]="将他们从主力部队中孤立出来！"
G["Keep these creatures off of us while we perform our healing."]="在我们进行治疗时，别让那些野兽靠近我们。"
G["Keep these ruins secure at all costs!"]="不惜一切代价，守住这片遗迹！"
G["Keep these things off me!"]="让这些东西离我远点！"
G["Keep those archers off the wall. Raigonn must reach the gate."]="别让那些弓箭手登上墙头。让莱公冲到大门前。"
G["Keep those creatures at bay while I meditate. We'll soon have the answers we seek."]="在我冥想时挡住那些精怪。我们很快就能找到答案了。"
G["Keep those hands where we can see them!"]="让那些家伙老实一点，不要乱动！"
G["Keep those naga away from the crater!"]="别让那些纳迦靠近裂口！"
G["Keep those pumps working."]="保证那些抽水泵的持续运转。"
G["Keep throwing Maximillian's armor!"]="不住手地扔出麦斯米兰的铠甲！"
G["Keep trying, we need to get this water out of here."]="继续尝试，我们要把这些水弄出这里。"
G["Keep up the good work, $p. With your help, we'll be done in no time!"]="保持这股干劲，$p。有了你的帮助，我们很快就能完成了！"
G["Keep up the good work."]="保持努力。"
G["Keep up the good work.  Do well and you will be rewarded by the master."]="继续好好干活。干得好的话，主人就会奖赏你。"
G["Keep up the good work.  This scourge will be cleansed!"]="坚持下去，一切都会变好的！"
G["Keep up the pace boys!  We need these supplies moved and weapons fixed!"]="继续干，小伙子们！我们要把这些补给品运走，还要把武器都修好！"
G["Keep up the pace!"]="快一点！"
G["Keep us well supplied for the greatest production benefit."]="为我们提供充分补给能让我们以最高效率工作。"
G["Keep us well supplied, $p. Don't let the effects expire or you'll have to start from scratch!"]="保证我们随时都有足够的补给，$p。别让这些效果过期，否则你又要从头开始了！"
G["Keep waiting - there's at least twenty people who got here before you did. Maybe more."]="Espera $gsentado:sentada;. Hay al menos veinte personas que han llegado antes que tú. A lo mejor son más."
G["Keep waiting. I count at least twenty people who got here before you did. Maybe more."]="Espera $gsentado:sentada;. Hay al menos veinte personas que han llegado antes que tú. A lo mejor son más."
G["Keep working!  You must be ready to join the front lines!"]="¡Sigue trabajando! ¡Debes estar $gpreparado:preparada; para unirte a las primeras líneas!"
G["Keep working! The general won't tolerate failure."]="继续干活！上将决不容许失败。"
G["Keep working! We'll win on our terms."]="再接再厉！我们会赢的。"
G["Keep ya eyes wide open."]="睁大你的眼睛。"
G["Keep ya hands where we can see 'em. Everybody be jumpy. We be in a war here, a war against de Warchief hisself."]="别让你的手离开我们的视线。最近大家都有些神经质。我们正在进行一场战争，一场与酋长本人的战争。"
G["Keep yer cool, soldiers. We'll be on the move soon."]="保持冷静，士兵们。我们很快就要采取行动了。"
G["Keep yer eyes open fer Dragonmaw."]="提高警惕，小心龙喉兽人。"
G["Keep yer eyes open, $n! That road is crawling with Dragonmaw."]="睁大眼睛，$n！这条路上全都是龙喉兽人。"
G["Keep your brittle bones out of my way, mindless puppets."]="给我滚远点，你这没脑子的傀儡。"
G["Keep your chin up. Perhaps with time, our people will see you as the ally you are, rather than the enemy you appear to be."]="不要灰心。也许随着时间的推移，我们的人民会把你们作为同盟那样看待，而不是敌人。"
G["Keep your claws sharp. You never know when another piece of meat will walk by."]="磨利你的爪子。你永远不知道何时会有一块好肉经过。"
G["Keep your distance from the Alliance, $n. We can't have you getting captured this deep in enemy territory."]="离联盟的家伙远点儿，$n。我们可不能让你在敌境腹地被抓住。"
G["Keep your eye on the demons.  We're not concerned with killing Scourge today."]="盯着恶魔。我们今天不是来消灭那些亡灵天灾的。"
G["Keep your eyes keen, adventurer."]="眼睛放亮点，冒险者。"
G["Keep your eyes open and your head in the mission, recruit."]="在执行任务时，一定要睁大眼睛，多动脑子，新兵。"
G["Keep your eyes open on the road."]="Mantén los ojos bien abiertos en el camino."
G["Keep your eyes open, $c. Even Durotar is not safe from our enemies."]="睁大眼睛，$c。即使是杜隆塔尔也难免会潜藏着敌人。"
G["Keep your eyes open, champion. We are all in this together... for now."]="睁大眼睛，勇士。我们是同一阵线的……目前是。"
G["Keep your eyes open, friend."]="提高你的警惕，朋友。"
G["Keep your eyes peeled for any suspicious activity, soldier. I've spotted a few troublemakers mulling about."]="随时任何可疑的动静。我发现有些捣乱分子在蠢蠢欲动了。"
G["Keep your eyes peeled for dwarven pigs."]="睁大了眼睛，别放过那些矮人猪。"
G["Keep your eyes peeled. They say that freak that was attacking people earlier might still be around."]="保持警惕。他们说早先那个到处袭击平民的怪人可能还在附近。"
G["Keep your fight away from Ogri'la!"]="让战争远离奥格瑞拉！"
G["Keep your filthy hide out of our base!"]="别弄脏我们的基地！"
G["Keep your flea ridden paws out of the food, you mangy beasts!"]="别用你们那长满跳蚤的脏爪子碰食物，肮脏的畜生们！"
G["Keep your foes at bay and carve them into cutlets at the same time. The only problem is that the long shaft keeps me from getting blood on my hands."]="让你的敌人走投无路，同时将他们撕成碎末。唯一的问题是我手拿着东西而无法大开杀戒。"
G["Keep your guard up!"]="保持高度警惕！"
G["Keep your hands off me ale, ya unclean pint-hatin' mongels!"]="别动我的啤酒，你这个肮脏的，不喜欢啤酒的怪物！"
G["Keep your head cool."]="让你的脑袋冷静一下。"
G["Keep your head low and be on the lookout for frostwyrms! YAAAW!"]="低下头，避开冰霜巨龙！呀～！"
G["Keep your head low, $g buddy:lady;."]="往这儿瞧瞧，$g老兄:女士;。"
G["Keep your heads down and follow my lead."]="保持冷静，听我的指挥。"
G["Keep your hunger in check, $gbrother:sister;. Always leave some meat behind to rot.\n\nOverly-ravenous saurok will bring doom to us all."]="管好你的胃，$g兄弟:姐妹;。记得留一点肉让它烂掉。\n\n暴饮暴食的蜥蜴人会害死我们大家的。"
G["Keep your machines away from me, $r! You'll be cleansed from this land like the weeds you are!"]="别让你的机器碰到我，$r！你会像那些杂草一样从这片土地上被清除掉！"
G["Keep your seatbelts fastened... Just kidding, we don't have seatbelts!"]="系好你的安全带……开玩笑啦，我们没有安全带！"
G["Keep your sights straight, $n."]="时刻保持警惕，$n。"
G["Keep your sword up and your back straight."]="Mantén la espada en alto y la espalda recta."
G["Keep your voice down, $c!"]="压低你的嗓门，$c！"
G["Keep your voice down, $c. I'm in disguise and spying for Venomspite."]="小声点，$c。没瞧见我正穿着伪装为怨毒镇侦察吗？"
G["Keep your voice down, $c. We wouldn't want them to hear us."]="小声点，$c。别被他们发现了。"
G["Keep your voice down, Helcular. Strangers abound..."]="小声点，赫尔库拉。周围都是陌生人……"
G["Keep your voice down, stranger. You do not want to disrupt the Master's meditations."]="Habla bajo, $gforastero:forastera;. No queremos perturbar la meditación del Maestro."
G["Keep your voice down. We wouldn't want to attract any attention from these beasties!"]="小声点。别被那些野兽发现啦！"
G["Keep your voice low and your eyes open, $n. We're surrounded by enemies out here."]="小点声，睁开你的眼睛看看，$n。我们被这里的敌人包围了。"
G["Keep your voice low, and your scent downwind."]="小点儿声，动作轻些。"
G["Keep your voices down. There are strangers about..."]="小声点。周围有陌生人……"
G["Keep your weak, fleshy eyes open! There are intruders amongst us."]="把你们的水泡眼睁大一点！我们中间有入侵者。"
G["Keep your wits about you, $r, we're surrounded by the walking dead here."]="保持警惕，$r，我们已经被亡灵包围了。"
G["Keep your wits about you. There are demons nearby."]="机灵点。这附近有恶魔。"
G["Keep your wits, warriors! There are naga yet to kill!"]="战士们，坚定意志！现在还有许多纳迦需要消灭！"
G["Keep. OUT!"]="滚、开！"
G["Keep... fighting!"]="坚持……战斗！"
G["Keeper Heartwise, cease your resistance."]="丛林守护者哈特维斯，停止你的反抗。"
G["Keeper Taldros, I am sending Sira and the others with you to help you take the tower. Elune be with you."]="丛林守护者塔尔德罗斯，我派赛拉和其他人协助你攻打塔楼。愿月神与你同在。"
G["Keeper! The sands of time have run out for you."]="时间的守护者！你们的时间之沙已经流尽了。"
G["Keeping the bomb warm, obviously. What does it look like I'm doing?!"]="保持炸弹的温度，这显而易见。我看上去像是在做什么？"
G["Keeping the fusion core stable is taxing nearly all my computational powers.\n\nLet us hope that floating-point error got worked out during my last maintenance cycle."]="保持聚变核心的稳定几乎耗尽了我的全部计算能力。\n\n现在我们只能希望那个浮点错误已经在我的上一次维护周期中被排除了。"
G["Keeping your ram in a canter or gallop for too long will exhaust him. If you want your ram to recover a bit, let him walk or trot. If there are apple bushels around, take him there to recover."]="让你的山羊慢跑或者飞奔太久的话，它会精疲力尽。如果你想让山羊恢复，让它步行或疾走一会儿就行了。如果附近有苹果就更好了，带它去吃一点，可以更快地恢复。"
G["Keeshan's a good man, $n. Any of us would give our lives for him."]="基沙恩是个好人，$n。我们所有人都甘愿为他卖命。"
G["Keeshan's alive? I thought he died."]="基沙恩还活着？我还以为他已经死了。"
G["Keever is most pleased."]="基佛很高兴。"
G["Keever is unhappy with this. Perhaps if Keever were to try a larger dose, that may fix this dilemma."]="基佛对这个结果不太满意。也许如果基佛尝试一下大剂量的话，效果会好一些。"
G["Kekek take you hunting. You be good bait."]="科科要带你去打猎。你是个不错的诱饵。"
G["Kekek thought we go see dragon queen. This just some elf-lady with funny horns."]="科科还以为我们会看到红龙女王。但那只是个长着可爱犄角的女精灵。"
G["Kekek took big-tongue hatchling's favorite toy. Maybe it help you get to sleep at night."]="科科带来了大舌头怪幼崽最喜欢的玩具。也许它能让你晚上睡个好觉。"
G["Kekeke!"]="咔咔咔！"
G["Kekekekeke!"]="咳咳咳咳咳！"
G["Kel'Thuzad has put forth considerable effort in attempting to reform the staff. The pieces were once scattered across this world, from Kalimdor to the South Seas. I myself held twenty of the pieces at one point in time - until they were stolen from me by Kel'Thuzad's minions. It is why I am here."]="克尔苏加德为了重铸这根法杖，投入了令人难以想象的代价。那些碎片当时被弹射到了世界各地，从卡利姆多到南海。我亲自曾有最多持有过其中的二十块，但最终都被克尔苏加德的手下偷走了。这也是我来到此地的原因。"
G["Kel'Thuzad is my answer."]="我的答案是克尔苏加德。"
G["Kel'Thuzad strikes!"]="克尔苏加德发动了攻击！"
G["Kel'Thuzad? If you know that name at all, then perhaps you did read the book I sent you to get.\n\nUnfortunately, you're answer is incorrect."]="¿Kel'Thuzad? Si conoces ese nombre, quizás sea porque has leído el libro que te envié a buscar.\n\nPor desgracia, tu respuesta no es correcta."
G["Kel'thuzad has survived trials that would have long since shattered the souls of even the greatest of the Brotherhood. He readily gave his life at Arthas's hand, later to be brought back - reborn in the power of the Sunwell."]="克尔苏加德通过了最为严酷的试炼。即便是圣光兄弟会的成员，这样的试炼也会撼动他们的灵魂。克尔苏加德将自己的生命完完全全交给了阿尔萨斯，然后借助太阳之井的力量得以复生。"
G["Kel'thuzad make Patchwerk his avatar of war!"]="帕奇维克是克尔苏加德的战神！"
G["Keller's soldiers ain't brought me nothin' in days... No news is good news I 'spose."]="这些天，凯勒的士兵都没带回什么消息……不过，没有消息就是最好的消息。"
G["Kelsey Steelspark of Gnomeregan Covert Operations at your service! If you're looking for rogue training, you've come to the right place."]="诺莫瑞根隐秘行动组织的凯尔希·钢烁为你效劳！要是你想接受潜行者方面的训练，你可来对地方了。"
G["Kelsey sent me to get a boat."]="凯尔希派我来要一艘船。"
G["Kelsey, allow me to introduce $n, who helped us rescue survivors in Gnomeregan."]="凯尔希，请允许我为你介绍$n，他帮助我们救出了诺莫瑞根的幸存者。"
G["Kelstrum is a loudmouth and a braggart... and if that weren't enough he's also one of the most skilled warriors ye'll ever meet!  \nI tell ye, if ye're looking to be trained in the ways of a warrior, that's who ye should be talking to.  I'm sure he can be found over in the Hall of Arms east of the Gates of Ironforge."]="Kelstrum es un bocazas y un fanfarrón... ¡y por si no fuera suficiente también es uno de los mejores guerreros que he visto nunca! \n\nEscucha, si quieres instruirte por la senda del guerrero, deberías hablar con él. Podrás encontrarlo en la Sala de Armas, al este de las Puertas de Forjaz."
G["Ken-Ken continues to be a nuissance and a destraction for everything he comes in to contact with. I look forward to the day when I no longer have to travel with him."]="肯肯还是那么招人讨厌，喜欢毁坏任何他所触碰过的东西。我希望有朝一日能够不要再和他一起结伴同行。"
G["Ken-Ken go chase east wind. Shortest walk."]="肯肯去追东风。路程最短。"
G["Ken-Ken has travelled far and now is super strong monk."]="肯肯经历了艰苦的修行，现在已是超级强壮的武僧了。"
G["Ken-Ken met a few pandaren in his time. He tell you something: they NOT sads.\n\nNow, look at this place! Sad, mopey-dopeys sulking around everywhere.\n\nWhere's song and dance? Where's piles of food?\n\nWhere's BOOZE, man?!"]="肯肯这辈子见过几个熊猫人。他会告诉你——他们一点也不悲伤。\n\n现在，看看这地方！到处都是满脸哀苦、无精打采的熊猫人。\n\n欢歌热舞去哪儿了？堆积如山的美食又去哪儿了？\n\n干杯狂饮的场面又去哪儿了啊，伙计？！"
G["Ken-Ken thinks we split up. Follow the four winds."]="肯肯觉得我们应该分开走。跟着风儿。"
G["Ken-Ken would have won if Ashyo had not been a dooker."]="要不是阿西约拖后腿，肯肯赢定了。"
G["Ken-Ken's got this!"]="肯肯做到了！"
G["Ken-Ken... I think I heard a rumor that he was staying in Zhu's Watch.\n\nShall I take you there?"]="肯肯……我听说他好像在朱家堡。\n\n要我带你过去吗？"
G["Ken-Ken... I think I heard a rumor that he was staying somewhere near the Temple of the Red Crane.\n\nShall I take you there?"]="肯肯……我听说他好像在朱鹤寺附近的某个地方。\n\n要我带你过去吗？"
G["Ken-Ken... surrenders!"]="肯肯……投降了！"
G["Kergul Bloodaxe on the Hunter Rise stands ready to help you get to Warsong Gulch."]="猎人大厅的克古尔·血斧将会帮助你进入战歌峡谷。"
G["Keristrasa, I am finished here. Please return me to the Transitus Shield."]="克莉斯塔萨，我完成了自己的使命。请送我回到永生之盾。"
G["Keristrasza! I wish that circumstances allowed for a more fitting welcome. Fate has been kind to return you to us."]="克莉斯塔萨！要不是局势恶劣，我真希望为你举行欢迎仪式。你平安地回来了，命运真是仁慈。"
G["Keristrasza! You've bested my consort... and now YOU shall take her place!"]="克莉斯塔萨！你杀死了我的配偶……那就由你来代替她吧！"
G["Kevin Jordan and Jonathan LeCraft!"]="¡Kevin Jordan y Jonathan LeCraft!"
G["Key... get the key... Gerstahn has... key."]="钥匙……拿到钥匙……格斯塔恩有……钥匙。"
G["Key? What key?"]="钥匙？什么钥匙？"
G["Kezan for da trolls!"]="科赞是巨魔的！"
G["Khadgar himself is showing you around?  You must have made a good impression, $n."]="卡德加亲自带你参观？你肯定给他留下了一个好印象，$n。"
G["Khadgar should be ready to see you again.  Just remember that to serve the Sha'tar you will most likely have to ally with the Aldor or the Scryers. And seeking the favor of one group will cause the others' dislike."]="卡德加应该准备好再次见你了。记住，如果你准备为沙塔尔效力，你很可能不得不与奥尔多或是占星者结盟。同样，对任何一方示好都会引起另外一方的敌意。"
G["Khara hums an old dwarven tune while she cooks."]="卡拉一边煮东西，一边哼着一首矮人的老歌。"
G["Khaz Modan will crumble! ALL WILL BE RUINED IN HIS NAME!"]="卡兹莫丹必将粉碎！一切都将以他的名义陷入毁灭！"
G["Khit'rix the Dark Master has been defeated by $n and $g his : her; band of companions. Let the next challenge be issued!"]="Khit'rix el Maestro Lóbrego ha sido derrotado por $n y sus compañeros. ¡Que comience el próximo desafío!"
G["Khit'rix the Dark Master skitters into Valhalas from the southeast!"]="黑暗主宰西塔利克斯从东南方冲进了瓦哈拉斯！"
G["Kibler is being investigated by G.E.T.A."]="基布雷尔正在接受地精工程学协会的调查。"
G["Kick me out, will they!? I'll show those uptight cone heads in Stormwind the true power of Niby! BEHOLD!"]="把我踢出去，他们会吗！？我会让暴风城中这些愚蠢的家伙见识见识尼比的力量！等着瞧！"
G["Kick the Footbomb between the smokestacks up and behind the opposing goal!"]="把球踢起来，让它飞进对面的烟囱球门！"
G["Kick the keg at them!"]="把桶踢向他们！"
G["Kick the machine."]="用力踢这台机器。"
G["Kick these Alliance mongrels off our ships!"]="把这些联盟狗赶下船！"
G["Kieu, Tart, Buzaki toss the ingredients in!"]="琪舞、塔蒂、布扎齐，快把原料扔进去！"
G["Kil'jaeden begins to channel dark energy."]="基尔加丹开始引导黑暗能量。"
G["Kil'jaeden is my answer."]="我的答案是基尔加丹。"
G["Kil'jaeden must be destroyed!"]="必须立刻消灭基尔加丹！"
G["Kil'jaeden will... prevail!"]="基尔加丹……会胜利的！"
G["Kil'jaeden's defenders here on the Sunwell Plateau are much stronger than anything we faced outside on the Island. The Legion have even twisted our Arcane Guardian technology with fel energy to create something much more sinister. Just one of those Sunblade Protectors decimated my troops, and I ordered a swift retreat. I expected my squad to be pushed completely off the plateau, but the enemy surprised me by calling off the pursuit."]="基尔加丹派驻在太阳井之内的卫兵远远比外面这些我们遇到过的要强大。军团将那里面的魔像全部灌入了恶魔能量能，转为他们所用。仅仅只是一只炎刃保卫者就将我派去的小队打得丢盔弃甲，我只好立刻命令他们撤退。我当时推断敌人会立刻将我的部队全部赶出高地区域，可令我吃惊的是，他们没有展开任何追击行动。"
G["Kil'jaeden's patience wears thin!  Destroy the naaru's lackeys once and for all!"]="基尔加丹快要失去耐心了！把那些纳鲁的仆从们消灭干净！"
G["Kilag Gorefang should be down the path to the west, goblin."]="基拉格·血牙应该就在通向西边的路上，地精。"
G["Kilag, I... uh, somehow... er, lost my scout."]="基拉格，我……唔……嗯，我的斥候失踪了。"
G["Kildrath tends to overdramatize the situation. For example, \"Garona: A Study on Stealth and Treachery,\" has been stolen over 400 times.\n\nThe mark of the Athenaeum protects the tomes, preventing any unauthorized viewings."]="Kildrath suele dramatizar la situación. Por ejemplo, \"Garona: un Estudio sobre el Sigilo y la Traición,\" ha sido robado más de 400 veces.\n\nLa marca de El Athenaeum protege los libros, evitando que alguien sin autorización los vea."
G["Kill $n!"]="杀了$n！"
G["Kill ALL the turnips!"]="消灭所有的芜菁！"
G["Kill Aeonaxx before his whelps overwhelm you!"]="消灭奥伊纳克斯，不要让他的爪牙吞没你！"
G["Kill a few for me, would you?"]="帮我干掉几个，可以吗？"
G["Kill anyone who tells you otherwise. So sayeth the Eye!"]="消灭任何胆敢有异议的人。听从眼睛的号令！"
G["Kill anyone who tries to interfere!"]="谁敢干涉我们，就得死！"
G["Kill anyting dat squirms!"]="杀光那些爬虫！"
G["Kill as many infected nightstalkers as I can find... This should be easy."]="尽可能多地清理掉感染的夜行豹……应该很简单。"
G["Kill dem for me!"]="为我消灭他们！"
G["Kill dese worms!"]="杀掉这些虫子！"
G["Kill elementals near Aggra's Air Totem, in the west!"]="杀死空气图腾附近的元素，它们在西边！"
G["Kill elementals near Aggra's Earth Totem, in the east!"]="杀死大地图腾附近的元素，它们在东边！"
G["Kill elementals near Aggra's Fire Totem, near Thrall!"]="杀死火焰图腾附近的元素，它们在萨尔身边！"
G["Kill elementals near Aggra's Water Totem, in the north!"]="杀死水图腾附近的元素，它们在北边！"
G["Kill first, ask questions later... Incoming!"]="先杀敌，再说废话……准备！"
G["Kill her! Take the farm!"]="杀了她！占领农场！"
G["Kill her!!"]="杀死她！"
G["Kill him!"]="杀了他！"
G["Kill it!"]="杀死它！"
G["Kill me if you must, but I owe no allegiance to you or your Horde. The only master I serve is the Thunder King."]="要杀就杀，我不会听命于你，或者你的部落。我只效忠雷电之王。"
G["Kill me... Kill me now!"]="杀了我……立刻杀了我！"
G["Kill mogu."]="杀魔古族。"
G["Kill nearest mystic."]="消灭最靠近的无名者。"
G["Kill now, eat later!"]="现在要战斗，以后再吃饭！"
G["Kill number 26 and I'm still just warming up."]="我已经杀了26个，这还只是热身而已。"
G["Kill or be killed, $n."]="Mata o muere, $n."
G["Kill some hozen today, Amber."]="去杀……几个猢狲，安玻。"
G["Kill that goblin, quickly!"]="Matad a $gese:esa; goblin, ¡rápido!"
G["Kill that one! I'll stay over here."]="干掉它！我会守在这儿。"
G["Kill that thing!"]="杀了那家伙！"
G["Kill that wascally wirmen and bring it for the stew!"]="杀死那个卑鄙的瓦尔蒙，带回来炖汤喝！"
G["Kill the Alliance $c!"]="¡Matad $gal:a la; $c de la Alianza!"
G["Kill the Hatchlings before they get a chance to eat and mature."]="在雏鸟进食并成长前杀死它们。"
G["Kill the Kodo and capture the rider!"]="杀死科多兽，捉住骑手！"
G["Kill the Skumblade Ritualist before the Echo of Kros eats it!"]="在邪刃祭司被克洛斯的回响吞噬之前，快去杀了他！"
G["Kill the big-tongue, slave thing!"]="奴隶，杀死大舌头怪！"
G["Kill the engineer before she can get a shot off!"]="杀了那个工程师，别让她还击！"
G["Kill the females! I will handle these \"warriors.\""]="¡Matad a las mujeres! Yo me encargaré de esos \"guerreros\"."
G["Kill the filthy $R!"]="¡Mata $gal asqueroso:a la asquerosa; $r!"
G["Kill the guards, take the Warden alive!"]="杀死卫兵，活捉典狱官！"
G["Kill the intruder!"]="消灭入侵者！"
G["Kill the intruders!"]="杀死入侵者！"
G["Kill the mogu.\n\nKill the mogu.\n\nKill the mogu."]="杀魔古族。\n\n杀魔古族。\n\n杀杀杀！"
G["Kill the pig! Spill its blood!!"]="杀了那只蠢猪！让它的血溅出来！"
G["Kill the stone troggs!"]="消灭石头穴居人！"
G["Kill the wikket!"]="杀死蠢蛋！"
G["Kill them Abbendis! Do not fail me!"]="阿比迪斯，杀光他们！别让我失望！"
G["Kill them all and burn their tower!"]="把他们全干掉，烧掉他们的塔楼！"
G["Kill them all!"]="杀光他们！"
G["Kill them all! No survivors!"]="杀光他们！不留活口！"
G["Kill them all! They will serve as subjects for our next study!"]="杀光他们！正好可以把他们当做下次研究的实验对象！"
G["Kill them all."]="杀光他们！"
G["Kill them all. Bring Malfurion to me."]="把他们杀光。带玛法里奥来见我。"
G["Kill them all... before they kill you."]="杀光他们……别让他们先杀了你。"
G["Kill them before they get away!"]="别让他们跑了！杀了他们！"
G["Kill them before they grow!"]="在它们成长之前干掉它们！"
G["Kill them!"]="杀了他们！"
G["Kill them!  Kill them all!"]="杀！把他们统统杀光！"
G["Kill them! Kill all!"]="杀掉他们！把他们全都杀死！"
G["Kill them! Kill them all and take back Zim'Torga!"]="杀光他们！杀光他们，夺回希姆托加！"
G["Kill them.  Take the crystals.  Should be simple enough."]="杀掉他们，夺取水晶。就这么简单。"
G["Kill these Alliance scum! For the Horde!"]="干掉这些联盟渣滓！为了部落！"
G["Kill these ettins so that we can come back and finish the job."]="消灭那些双头魔，这样我们才能回来完成工作。"
G["Kill these invaders who dare to defile our altar!"]="杀死入侵者！看看谁敢来亵渎我们神圣的祭坛！"
G["Kill this fool, or Randolph will kill us!"]="干掉这些傻瓜，否则伦道夫就会杀光我们！"
G["Kill those Alliance dogs before they can regroup!"]="不要给联盟狗喘息的机会，杀光他们！"
G["Kill ussss all... More will come for him..."]="杀了我们吧……会有更多的后来者……"
G["Kill vrykul scum!  For Sylvanas!"]="杀光维库杂种！希尔瓦娜斯万岁！"
G["Kill!"]="杀！"
G["Kill! Kill! Kill!"]="杀！杀！杀！"
G["Kill!!!"]="杀！！！"
G["Kill, KILL! Get back artifact! Bring to Kartak!"]="杀，杀啊！夺回神器！把它拿回去交给卡塔克！"
G["Kill, kill!"]="杀！杀啊！"
G["Kill. Eat. Kill."]="杀戮、进食、杀戮。"
G["Kill..."]="杀……"
G["Kill... they want me to kill you now... oh, why did you have to go and anger them?"]="杀……他们要我现在就杀掉你……哦，你为什么要故意激怒他们？"
G["Killed by lowly commoners. How droll..."]="竟然被低等平民杀掉了，真是滑稽……"
G["Killian Hagey teach skinning in Rogues' Quarter on inner ring."]="基里安·哈根在盗贼区传授剥皮的技能。"
G["Killin' time!"]="让我来消磨一下时间吧！"
G["Killin's as easy as breathin'."]="杀戮就像呼吸一样自然。"
G["Killing Spree!"]="杀戮盛宴！"
G["Killing big-tongues is fun! Goregek should go with slave thing more often!"]="狩猎大舌头怪真有趣啊！格利基克以后要常带奴隶来玩！"
G["Killing me will only strengthen the resolve of my brethren. Do your worst!"]="我的死只会令同胞们坚定必胜的决心。有胆你就动手吧！"
G["Killing you and your cohorts, $c, will amuse me.  I shall make it quick."]="消灭你和你的军团是件愉快的事儿，$c。我会速战速决的。"
G["Killing you be easy."]="杀死你简直是易如反掌。"
G["Killum gobins! Na cayno da BOOM!"]="干掉地精！轰碎他们！"
G["Kilnara laughs maniacally."]="基尔娜拉疯狂地笑了起来。"
G["Kilnara, she be crazy about panthers."]="基尔娜拉狂热地痴迷于猎豹。"
G["Kilrok, how did we lose Honor's Stand?"]="基洛克，我们是怎样失去荣耀岗哨的？"
G["Kind of them to stream in one by one."]="真不错，他们一个接一个的进来。"
G["Kindness is not lost with this one, Urik. Thank you, hero!"]="乌瑞克，这位勇士真是太善良了。谢谢你，英雄！"
G["King Jokkum, you have summoned me?"]="约库姆国王，是你在召唤我吗？"
G["King Llane Wrynn."]="莱恩·乌瑞恩国王。"
G["King Magni Bronzebeard is a fool and a charlatan!"]="麦格尼·铜须是个白痴加吹牛大王！"
G["King Magni expects us to win the tournament and make him proud. We will not fail."]="麦格尼国王希望我们赢得锦标赛的胜利。我们绝不能失败。"
G["King Magni must have sensed some disapointment as he did allow a slight change.  He allowed me a chance to tap the Brewfest Keg.  I remember spending nights trying to figure out how to efficiently and quickly open the keg and distribute its contents such that all participants will receive equal parts quickly and efficiently."]="我对此可以理解，但国王陛下能允许我这个侏儒去开酒桶，已经是个改变了。我还记得那无数个夜晚里，我独自一人静静思考如何最有效率地打开酒桶，并把里面的酒绝对平均地分给大家喝，请注意绝对平均和最有效率这两个词。"
G["King Magni's fate is my responsibility and my shame. I should've counseled patience instead of encouraging him! His rush to complete the ritual without understanding it cost him his life and availed us nothing."]="麦格尼国王的命运是我的责任，也是我的耻辱。我真该建议他耐心点，而不是怂恿他贸然行动！他还未完全理解就仓促进行仪式，这让他失去了生命，同时我们也一无所获。"
G["King Mrgl-Mrgl, I somehow misplaced your spare murloc outfit. I'm sorry."]="姆嘎姆嘎国王，我弄丢了你的备用鱼人服。对不起。"
G["King Phaoris sent me to ask you about Neferset activity."]="国王法奥瑞斯派我来了解尼斐塞特的情况。"
G["King Rastakhan did nothing."]="拉斯塔哈无动于衷。"
G["King Rastakhan tired of Zul and his troubling nightmares. To be rid of the prophet, he granted Zul the use of his largest ships, so that he and his followers could seek a new land if his visions came to pass."]="拉斯塔哈厌烦了祖尔和他的噩梦。为了摆脱先知，他让祖尔乘上自己最大的船只，好让他和他的追随者在预言实现时去寻找新大陆。"
G["King Rastakhan, he be plannin' to unite da troll tribes under his Zandalari."]="拉斯塔哈大王，他计划将所有巨魔部族归入赞达拉的麾下。"
G["King Stormheart caught wind of the iron dwarves heading this way and brought all the best warriors he could muster on such short notice."]="雷心国王听说铁矮人正朝这里挺进，于是他将眼下能召集到的最好的战士都带来了。"
G["King Stormheart had me stop by to lend you hand - looks like it was good that I did. Good luck to ya."]="国王要我顺便帮你一把——看来我干得还不错。祝你好运。"
G["King Stormheart has trained us well... turned us into even more fearsome warriors than we could have boasted during the time of our war with the Frost Giants."]="国王对我们进行了严格的训练……让我们成长为可怕的战士。如今的我们，远比当年与冰霜巨人交战时吹嘘的还要厉害。"
G["King Stormheart is putting you to the test, eh?  He must see something in you to begin with or I doubt he'd put you through such a sacred ritual."]="国王派你来接受试炼？他一定在你身上发现了某种潜质，不然也不会让你参加如此神圣的仪式。"
G["King Stormheart sent me to be tested as a frostborn would.  I am ready for my test, Fjorlin."]="雷心国王派我来接受霜脉矮人的试炼。我准备好了，弗亚林。"
G["King Terenas Menethil II."]="泰瑞纳斯·米奈希尔二世国王。"
G["King Varian's SI:7 agents have gathered information about a private sanctum of the Lich King's deep within a place called the Halls of Reflection."]="瓦里安国王的军情七处得到情报，巫妖王的私人密室就深藏在一个被称作映像大厅的地方。"
G["King Varian, Lady Jaina. Welcome to the tournament. Your place in the coliseum is waiting."]="瓦里安国王，吉安娜女士，欢迎你们的到来。我们恭候多时了。"
G["King Wrynn seeks the Black Harvest council members who trespassed here recently."]="乌瑞恩国王正在寻找那些最近擅闯黑暗神殿的黑暗收割议会成员。"
G["King Wrynn will listen to you, you're a hero to the Alliance!"]="El Rey Wrynn te escuchará, ¡eres $gun:una; $ghéroe:heroína; para la Alianza!"
G["King Wrynn will rue the day he allowed the Horde to name another Warchief.\n\nWe should've kept fighting. Who's to say this new Warchief won't get any ideas in his troll head a few years from now?"]="乌瑞恩国王迟早会为自己允许部落出现另一个酋长而后悔的。\n\n我们应该继续打下去。谁敢保证几年之后这位新酋长的巨魔脑袋里不会冒出什么馊主意？"
G["King's mercy - what happened here? What WAS that thing?"]="国王在上——这里怎么了？那玩意是什么？"
G["Kings, please."]="\"Reyes, por favor\"."
G["Kir..rawk...."]="奇拉……瓦克……"
G["Kirel narak!"]="¡Kirel narak!"
G["Kirel narak! I am Mal'Ganis. I AM ETERNAL!"]="Kirel narak！我是玛尔加尼斯！我是不朽的！"
G["Kirin'Var survived 20 long years and countless orc assaults, but it could not withstand the forces of Kael'thas. A man who once called himself a member of the Kirin Tor murdered all of us, save one.\n\nArchmage Vargoth survived the attack, so Kael'thas imprisoned him within the Violet Tower, warding it with a magic that forbids the passage of any of the Kirin Tor."]="肯瑞瓦在兽人的无数次冲击下生存了20多年，但是它并没有抵挡住凯尔萨斯的进攻。有一个叛徒，一个曾自称为肯瑞托一员的家伙，我们中除了大法师瓦格斯之外的人都被他杀害了。\n\n大法师瓦格斯从那次劫难中幸存了下来，因此凯尔萨斯把他囚禁在紫罗兰之塔内，用一种任何肯瑞托成员都无法通过的魔法屏障封印了紫罗兰之塔。"
G["Kiryn had made it to the jinyu village. I spotted her lurking in some bushes on the village's edge."]="琪麟到锦鱼人村子去了。我看见她在村外的灌木丛里潜伏着。"
G["Kiss me."]="吻我。"
G["Kiss the gunner's daughter?  Why I haven't ever met the lass..."]="亲吻炮手的女儿？为什么我总是碰不到心仪的少女……"
G["Kite"]="风筝"
G["Kitten for sale, looking for a good home."]="卖猫咪啦，我要给它找个好人家。"
G["Kitty... KITTY! I'M SO SORRY, KITTY! COME BACK! DON'T LEAVE ME LIKE THIS!"]="猫咪……猫咪！我真的很抱歉，猫咪！快回来！别这样离开我！"
G["Kkkk... aaahhh...!"]="¡Kkkk... aaahhh...!"
G["Kl-kl-kl-kl-klagh!"]="¡Kl-kl-kl-kl-klagh!"
G["Klatu, Barada, Nikto!"]="[异星语]Klatu，Barada，Nikto！"
G["Klaven doesn't pay me enough to deal with zombies, drones, or whatever he calls 'em."]="克拉文付我的钱可不够让我卖命去对付僵尸之类的东西。"
G["Kneel before me and repent!"]="在我面前下跪忏悔吧！"
G["Kneel before me!"]="跪下吧！"
G["Kneel before me, mortal! Kneel before Zod!"]="在我面前屈服吧，凡人！在佐德面前屈服吧！"
G["Kneel before me, worm!"]="跪下求饶吧，懦夫！"
G["Kneel before the Highlord!"]="臣服于大领主的力量吧！"
G["Kneel before the burning flame!"]="跪拜在烈焰之前！"
G["Kneel before your master!"]="跪下吧！"
G["Kneel beside me, friend. I caught a bullet during that last raid.\n\n<Gann grunts in pain as he tries to shift position. His left hand clutches a wound, blood welling between his quivering fingers.>\n\nWhen the dwarves first invaded the Barrens, I contented myself with harassing their diggers and sabotaging their equipment. I should've struck a killing blow when I had the chance."]="靠我近点，朋友。我在上一次袭击中被一颗子弹射中了。\n\n<甘恩努力想挪动一下身体，却只是痛苦地呻吟了一声。他的左手按在一处伤口上。血不断地从他的指缝间涌出。>\n\n当矮人们最初入侵贫瘠之地的时候，我只是满足于骚扰他们的挖掘工，破坏他们的设备。我真应该趁有机会的时候对他们发动致命的打击。"
G["Kneel dogs!"]="跪下，败狗！"
G["Kneel supplicant!"]="跪下吧，乞丐！"
G["Kneel!"]="跪下！"
G["Kneel! Kneel before the Ashbringer!"]="叩首！向灰烬使者叩首！"
G["Kneel! Kneel fools!"]="跪下！蠢货！"
G["Kneel, Alliance!  Kneel before the might of the Forsaken!"]="跪倒吧，联盟！在被遗忘者强大的力量之前跪倒吧！"
G["Kneel, Grark."]="跪下，格拉克。"
G["Kneel, heathen."]="跪下，异教徒。"
G["Kneel, worm."]="草民，跪下。"
G["Kneeling down, the Hooded Crusader examines the Flameweaver's corpse, looking for something."]="蒙面的十字军战士跪下来检查织焰者的尸体，同时在寻找着什么。"
G["Knew this was... the only way out."]="我就知道……这是唯一的结局。"
G["Knights of the Ebon Blade, prepare for battle!"]="黑锋骑士们，准备战斗！"
G["Knock 'em out of the sky! Don't let them get in range of you, soldier!"]="把他们从天上打下来！士兵，别让他们靠近你！"
G["Knock Master Tsang's Assistants down with Crackling Jade Lightning."]="用碎玉闪电击倒曾大师的助手们。"
G["Knock it off of their lump of lead!"]="把他们的大个子头领敲掉！"
G["Knock, knock!"]="打啊，打啊！"
G["Knotroot!"]="结根草！"
G["Know dat your plans please us, Darkspears. De son of Sen'jin walks de right path."]="你们的计划让我们喜悦，暗矛部族，森金之子的道路是正确的。"
G["Know my hunger!"]="我饿了！"
G["Know that what you did will save hundreds, maybe thousands of lives. You are also a true hero of the Horde, $n."]="要知道，你所做的一切将拯救数百——也许是数千条生命。你同时也是部落真正的大英雄，$n。"
G["Know that wherever you might find them in the world, they are protecting something of importance, as they were entrusted to do so long ago."]="你要知道，无论身处何地，他们都会受他人委托，保护着某种重要的东西。"
G["Know that your world will soon follow."]="这个世界即将步你后尘。"
G["Know the only thing worse than a pirate? Hozen pirates! They raid our shores and steal our fish, our boats, and our brew. No one steals our brew... no one."]="你知道比海盗更坏的是什么吗？猢狲海盗！它们袭击了我们的海岸，把鲜鱼、船只和美酒全都偷走了。没有人能偷走我们的酒……没有人。"
G["Know this, $r. Within Shaffar's chambers at the end of these tombs rests a creature of unimaginable power. It is held in check by the power of the stasis chamber. You must return to Ameer before you venture further if you wish to destroy it!"]="Escucha bien, $r. Dentro de las Cámaras de Shaffar al final de estas tumbas descansa una criatura de inimaginable poder. Está bajo el control de la Cámara de Estasis. ¡Debes volver a Ameer antes de seguir avanzando si quieres destruirla!"
G["Know this, friend: you have my deepest thanks. Your courage, your strength... you...\n\nYou remind me of him."]="朋友……请接受我最深的感谢。你的勇气，你的力量……你……\n\n你让我想起了他。"
G["Know this: I won't stand idle if the Horde interests conflict with those of my people. I may reconsider old Alliances."]="记住：我不会坐视部落与血精灵之间的利益冲突。我或许会重新考虑与联盟的关系。"
G["Know what a yak is?"]="知道耗牛长什么样吗？"
G["Know what we don't like? Puppy-things! Like that one right there! See? We no like it."]="知道我们不喜欢什么吗？狗狗人！比如那边的狗狗人！看见了吗？我们不喜欢它。"
G["Know what? I don't even want 'em. I like being able to float around freely."]="知道吗？我根本就不想要身体。我喜欢自由自在地飘浮。"
G["Know what? If Kekek closes his eyes, you can't see him."]="你知道吗？要是科科闭上眼，你就看不到他了。"
G["Know your master, you worthless mutts!"]="想清楚你要为谁效力，你这没用的蠢货！"
G["Know your place!"]="搞清楚你的身份！"
G["Know... my... pain."]="了解……我的……痛苦。"
G["Knowing a little magic comes in handy in this line of work.  Illusions can't always fool everyone, but they're usually good enough to get the job done."]="干这行，懂点魔法迟早有用。影像不能欺骗所有人，但是它们通常可以让你事半功倍。"
G["Knowing there isn't enough time, the %s doesn't even try to run."]="%s知道已经来不及了，他甚至没有尝试跑开。"
G["Knowledge is power - TRUE power, my young friend.  You'll be wise to acquire as much of it as you can, and pay proper heed to those who have already done so.\n\nBefore the razing of the Sunwell, we fooled ourselves into thinking we had neared the apex of our civilization.  It took the Scourge to bring us to our knees... and in a way, back to reality."]="知识就是力量——真正的力量，我年轻的朋友。尽你所能地学习新知识吧，同时虚心向那些学有所成的智者请教，这才是明智的做法。\n\n在太阳之井被夷为平地之前，我们曾经愚蠢地认为自己的文明已经达到巅峰。在与亡灵天灾的战斗中，血精灵却遭遇惨败……这才让我们看清自己的处境。"
G["Knowledge of a demon's true name is rumored to give a certain amount of power over that demon.\n\nThe Book of Fel names is said to contain the true name of every demon ever to have existed.  By memorizing the passages in the book, Varedis had found a source of power to rival Illidan's own drinking from the Skull of Gul'dan.\n\nAt Illidan's request, Varedis now runs the training grounds at the Ruins of Karabor - along with the three masters that mentored Varedis."]="传说，知晓一个恶魔的真名即可获得超越他的力量。\n\n恶魔名册记载着所有真实存在的恶魔的名字。在默记书中的章节时，瓦雷迪斯发现了一种力量来源，这种力量可以与伊利丹从古尔丹之颅中汲取的力量相媲美。\n\n在伊利丹的要求下，瓦雷迪斯和三位指导过他的恶魔猎手大师们一起管理着卡拉波废墟的训练场。"
G["Known throughout the lands, Antonio Perelli's goods now for sale near Sentinel Hill! I must move on soon, so make haste."]="世界闻名的安东尼奥·皮雷利现在要在哨兵岭出售他的货物了！"
G["Knucklethump gonna jib the wikkets!"]="肘锤猢狲会干掉那些蠢蛋！"
G["Knucklethumps gonna rule the Kun-Lai!"]="肘锤猢狲将统治昆莱！"
G["Knucklethumps thump! Thump! Thump!"]="肘锤猢狲！捶！捶！捶！"
G["Kobai leads the yaungol attacking us... but I do not think he is the source of our problems."]="科拜带领野牛人袭击了我们……但我并不认为他是问题的根源。"
G["Kobai used to threaten us, that was all. Now... whatever mind he had, he's clearly lost."]="科拜以前总是威胁我们，没完没了。现在……不管他打的是什么主意，他都输定了。"
G["Kodo beasts, my friend!  Trained from a young age and raised on the Golden Plains of Mulgore, these fine animals will make even finer steeds!  Please, browse my selection, and see for yourself why we taurens have come to rely on these magnificant creatures!"]="¡Bestias kodo, $gamigo:amiga;! ¡Entrenados desde edad temprana y criados en Las Llanuras Doradas de Mulgore, estos delicados animales serán los mejores corceles! Por favor, ¡déjame enseñarte mi selección y comprueba por ti $gmismo:misma; por qué los tauren hemos llegado a confiar en estas magníficas criaturas!"
G["Kodohide Leatherworkers is what you want.  Find it in the middle of The Drag."]="你要找科多兽皮工店是吧。去暗巷区中心吧。"
G["Kolkar clan! Attack!!"]="科卡尔部族！进攻！！"
G["Kologarn casts Stone Grip!"]="科隆加恩施放了岩石之握！"
G["Kologarn focuses his eyes on you!"]="科隆加恩在注视着你！"
G["Koltira Deathweaver."]="库尔迪拉·织亡者。"
G["Koltira!  I had heard rumors that you were here in Lordaeron."]="库尔迪拉！我听到传闻说你在洛丹伦。"
G["Koltira!  Your queen summons you!"]="库尔迪拉！你的女王在召唤你！"
G["Koltira, let's get out of here!"]="库尔迪拉，我们快离开这儿！"
G["Koltira... this might sound strange, but I keep seeing some kid's ghost.  Matthias Lehner... does the name mean anything to you?"]="库尔迪拉……这听上去有些诡异，但是我最近经常看见一个孩子的魂魄。米斯希尔萨·阿奈尔……你听过这个名字吗？"
G["Komak! I swear I'll have the money! Just give me some more time!"]="库马克！我发誓我会变得有钱的！只要多给我点时间！"
G["Komin Winterhoof at Holistic Herbalism is the one you want to talk to then.  He can be found on the middle rise."]="如果你想要学习草药学的话，就应该去找克米恩·冰蹄谈谈。他在中部高地那里。"
G["Konu! Behind us! A night elf."]="克努！我们身后！一个暗夜精灵。"
G["Kor'dok resurrects a fallen ally to aid him in battle!"]="寇多克复活一名阵亡的盟友来协助他战斗！"
G["Kor'dok winds up a powerful shield slam."]="寇多克发动了一次强力盾牌猛击。"
G["Kor'ik was just the first to betray us. No one can be trusted."]="科尔里克只是第一个背叛我们的人。谁也不能相信。"
G["Kor'ik! How long have you worked for the empress?!"]="科尔里克！你为女皇效命多久了？！"
G["Kor'kron! You are needed at the front!"]="库卡隆！都上前线去！"
G["Kor'kron, at my side!"]="库卡隆，支援我！"
G["Kor'kron, move out! Champions, watch your backs. The Scourge have been..."]="库卡隆，行动！勇士们，提高警惕。天灾军团已经……"
G["Kor'kron, prepare Orgrim's Hammer for its final voyage! Champions, our gunship will find a point to dock on the upper reaches of the citadel. Meet us there!"]="库卡隆，为最后的冲锋做好准备！勇士们，炮船将在那座堡垒的顶部着陆。我们在那里汇合！"
G["Kor'kron, prepare transport to the Undercity."]="库卡隆，准备传送到幽暗城。"
G["Kor'kron, stand down!"]="库卡隆，退下！"
G["Kor'kron, take us out!"]="库卡隆，出发！"
G["Kor'kron? Here? What has Garrosh been up to?"]="库卡隆？在这里？加尔鲁什在搞什么鬼？"
G["Kor, why did you do this? Vengeance is not worth dying over."]="科尔，你为什么要这样做？为了复仇而把命给搭进去，不值得呀。"
G["Korfax, what can you tell from this saronite?"]="科尔法克斯，你知道萨隆邪铁吗？"
G["Korfax, where can I find Dark Iron scraps?"]="科尔法克斯，我在哪里才能找到黑铁碎片？"
G["Korga Strongmane, once prisoner of the Alliance, now free and woefully unarmed tauren. Good to meet you, pandaren."]="我叫科尔加·蛮鬃，曾经是联盟的俘虏，现在虽然逃了出来，但是手无寸铁。很高兴见到你，熊猫人。"
G["Korrak has come, weaklings! Snowfall belongs to Winterax!"]="科尔拉克来了，懦弱的家伙！一场盛宴就要开始了。来吧！受死吧！"
G["Korrak has come, weaklings! Snowfall belongs to Winterax! Erm, Korrak mean to say amphitheater belong to Winterax!"]="科尔拉克来了！雪落墓地属于冰斧的勇士！呃，科尔拉克是想要说，斗兽场属于冰斧的勇士！"
G["Korven, let's continue."]="柯尔凡，我们继续吧。"
G["Kota Kon bigger than me thought she'd be..."]="寇塔空的块头比我想象中的还要大……"
G["Kota wikkets gettin' ravaged next!"]="寇塔蠢蛋接下来要大破坏了！"
G["Kovok seems to have weathered the years in hibernation well."]="科沃克似乎在冬眠中经受住了岁月的考验。"
G["Kovok... come to me... I need..."]="科沃克……过来……我需要……"
G["Krakauer?"]="卡拉克尔？"
G["Krang Stonehoof stands astride his training circle at the southeast corner of the village."]="克朗·石蹄在村子东南角的训练圈里。"
G["Krasus' Landing"]="克拉苏斯平台"
G["Krasus' Landing is in easternmost Dalaran.\n\nThe city's flight master is there, as well as the cold weather flying trainer."]="克拉苏斯平台位于达拉然的最东端。\n\n本城的飞行管理员和寒冷天气飞行训练师都在那里。"
G["Krathok, I was once a weaponsmith and wish to instead learn the ways of the armorsmith. Will you train me?"]="克拉索克，我以前曾是个武器铸造师，但我现在想要成为一个护甲铸造师，你能帮帮我吗？"
G["Krathok, I was once a weaponsmith and wish to retake the hammer once more! Teach me the way of the weaponsmith."]="克拉索克，我曾经是一名武器铸造师，我想重抄旧业！教教我吧。"
G["Krathok, I was once an armorsmith and wish to instead learn the ways of the weaponsmith. Will you train me?"]="克拉索克，我以前曾是个护甲铸造师，但我现在想要成为一个武器铸造师，你能帮帮我吗？"
G["Krathok, I was once an armorsmith and wish to retake the hammer once more! Teach me the way of the armorsmith."]="克拉索克，我曾经是一名护甲铸造师，我想重抄旧业！教教我吧。"
G["Kravel Koalbeard is stunned. Steal the Alliance's Proposal now!"]="克拉维尔·浓须晕了。趁现在快去把联盟投标书偷到手！"
G["Kraz lives!"]="克拉斯捡回了一条命！"
G["Kraz must meet the slayers of the great troll-beast!"]="克拉斯肯定是遇到了伟大的巨魔克星！"
G["Kraz should never have come to this cursed place... should have known not to trust the human. A blind fool I was, $c, as are you if you follow his counsel.\n\nMy son, lost for two moons, was last seen with the human, Budd. He told me I could find him behind the walls of Zul'Aman....\n\nI followed his people here, and was captured with the rest. Without your help, I was doomed to die.\n\nThank you, stranger."]="克拉斯就不该来这个鬼地方……不该相信人类。我真是个大傻瓜，$c，你莫非也是听信了巴德的鬼话来进来的？\n\n我的儿子已经失踪两个月了，据说有人最后一次看见他是和巴德在一起。巴德说我或许可以在祖阿曼中找到他的下落……\n\n我跟着探险队来到这里，然后沦为俘虏。要不是你帮忙，我肯定没命了。\n\n陌生人，谢谢你。"
G["Krenna must doubt my abilities. While our elite warriors march out to face the Alliance and their trapper allies, or wreak havoc among the trolls, I've been assigned to mop up those pesky Dragonflayer vrykul.\n\nPerhaps if we combine our efforts, we can both prove ourselves in the conqueror's sight."]="克雷娜对我的能力颇有质疑。她派出最精锐的将士对付联盟以及他们的猎户盟友，让他们执行针对冰霜巨魔的大规模作战计划，却让我与这帮粗俗的掠龙维库人周旋。\n\n或许我们应该联手，共同改变我们在征服者眼中的形象。"
G["Krolg, I need Dartol's Rod!"]="克罗尔格，我需要达图尔的魔棒。"
G["Krolmir... I thank you Jokkum. I hadn't dared hope it still existed. It shall soon see glorious battle once again!"]="科洛米尔……谢谢你，约库姆。我都不敢奢望它还完好无损。很快，它将再次见证光辉的战役！"
G["Kronk, tell me about the charged crystal foci."]="科隆克，能给我解释一下充能的聚焦水晶有什么用吗？"
G["Kros, give me strength..."]="克洛斯，赐予我力量……"
G["Kros, our creator, will not save the weak. The souls of the weak will exist in eternal fear, always fleeing from the teeth and claws of Kros and his followers.\n\nIf you are strong, Kros will allow you to hunt. Your eternity will be spent chasing the weak, eating their flesh, and becoming ever stronger.\n\nBe strong, saurok.\n\nStrength always to the Skumblade. Strength always to you, saurok."]="克洛斯，我们的造物主，不会拯救弱者。弱者的灵魂将活在永恒的恐惧之中，逃避着克洛斯和他追随者们的尖牙与利爪。\n\n如果你够强大，那么克洛斯将允许你狩猎。你们将永远追逐弱者，享用他们的血肉，变得更加强大。\n\n坚强起来，蜥蜴人们。\n\n力量与邪刃部族同在。力量与你们同在，蜥蜴人们。"
G["Kroshik gives us his body, his bones, his strength, and his spirit. We owe our existence to him."]="考什克将自己的血骨、力量和灵魂给了我们。我们要为自己的存在而感谢他。"
G["Kroshik has a body of meat and bone, but he carries with him the spirit of Kros.\n\nOne day, Kroshik's hunt will end. But Kros's hunt goes on forever."]="考什克是血肉之躯，可他拥有克洛斯的灵魂。\n\n总有一天，考什克的狩猎将会终结。但克洛斯的狩猎将永无止尽。"
G["Kroshik is a gift from our creator, Kros. He reminds us of our strength, of our heritage, of our legacy. He gives us a glimpse at our glorious future."]="考什克是来自我们的造物主克洛斯的礼物。他让我们记住自己的力量，传承与遗产。他让我们看到了辉煌的未来。"
G["Kroshik is the blood of Kros, our creator. We are Kros' chosen people.\n\nWith his strength behind us, we can never die."]="考什克是我们的造物主克洛斯的血脉。我们是克洛斯的选民。\n\n依靠它的力量，我们将得到永生。"
G["Kroshik!"]="考什克！"
G["Kroshius live? Kroshius crush!"]="克罗苏斯活了？克罗苏斯要摧毁一切！"
G["Krumn is the bull you are looking for. He can be found on the lower rise at Thunder Bluff Civic Information."]="去找克拉姆吧。你可以在中心高地上的雷霆崖咨询处里找到他。"
G["Krypta!"]="¡Krypta!"
G["Kthh! You will die in the mud like your friend over there..."]="嘻嘻嘻！你会跟你那边的朋友一样，死在泥浆里的……"
G["Ku into me carver, ye ugly croaker!  Ku and show me who dares cross me brethren!"]="看着我的刀子，蠢货！看着它，告诉我是谁背叛了我的兄弟！"
G["Ku ovah yonder, matey!  Dat scurvy bobo be all up inne quashie's face.  Dat hard-eared swab gonnna get salt, mon... gonna get keelhauled and gonna be made into a duppy, mon."]="瞧那边！那蠢货把农夫给惹火了。这下麻烦了吧，我看他的小命难保啦。"
G["Ku'nanji, de Night-Stalker, is who yer lookin' for.\n\nHe be just north of de valley's central building."]="夜行者库纳基应该是你要找的人。\n\n他就在山谷中部建筑的北边。"
G["Ku-Yao's bedroll is empty. He's not here."]="姚枯的被窝是空的。他不在这。"
G["Kulratha. Things are going well, I see."]="啊，库拉萨。我相信一切都会顺利的。"
G["Kun-Lai Summit is where you're going to die, orc. I'm going to bury you."]="昆莱山就是你的葬身之地，兽人。我会亲手埋葬你。"
G["Kung Din pounced on you! Fight for your life! |TInterface\\Icons\\ability_warrior_secondwind.blp:20|t"]="恐钉扑向了你！拼命的时候到了！|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_warrior_secondwind.blp:20|t"
G["Kurdran - no, I couldn't! Sky'ree was a legend, I can't-"]="库德兰……不，我不能！斯卡雷是一个传奇，我不能……"
G["Kurdran is down!  You've got to get him back into the fight or we're done for!"]="库德兰倒下了！快点让他恢复过来，继续战斗，否则我们就完了！"
G["Kuzari and Zanga are trainin' headhunters on one of de small islets towards de southeast end of de valley, mon."]="库扎莉和曾迦是一流的训练大师，他们就在山谷东南端的一座小岛上，伙计。"
G["Kvaldir are pouring across the bridge! Battlemaiden, Lady Naz'jar calls for you!"]="克瓦迪尔人正从桥上涌过来！女武士，纳兹夏尔女士在召唤你！"
G["Kvaldir never die... this city is ours..."]="克瓦迪尔永生……这座城是我们的……"
G["Kwa! You cannot kill me, I am immortal!"]="呱！你杀不了我，我是无敌的！"
G["Kyra Windblade wields her blade with great skill.  She should be able to provide you with some training.  You'll find her at the Inn in Dolanaar."]="凯拉·风刃的战斗技能炉火纯青。她可以对你进行训练。到多兰纳尔的旅店中去找她吧。"
G["Kyra said that you might need some help."]="凯拉说你也许需要帮助。"
G["Kzzsst! Paragon! Klaxxi infiltrator!"]="嗞嗞！英杰！卡拉克西渗透者！"
G["L'ghorek Dies!"]="拉葛雷克死了！"
G["L'ghorek is the name of the Ancient god that sits across the chasm from us. It is being infested by something.\n\nWe must put an end to this or we will certainly all meet our doom!"]="拉葛雷克是位远古之神，就在沟壑的另一侧。他正在受到某种力量的侵扰。\n\n我们必须终结这一切，否则我们谁都活不了！"
G["L'ghorek, can you give me another Attuned Runestone of Binding?"]="拉葛雷克，你能再给我一块调和过的禁锢符文石吗？"
G["LEAVE THIS PLACE!"]="离开这儿！"
G["LEAVE...THIS PLACE..."]="离开……这里……"
G["LEFT!"]="左！"
G["LEG FAILURE LOOP BROKEN. RETURNING TO BASE."]="腿部故障回路破损。返回基地。"
G["LEGION, STEADY YOURSELVES!"]="士兵们，坚持住！"
G["LET IT BE FINISHED!"]="结束这一切吧！"
G["LET THE LIGHT IN, GODFREY GOODARD!"]="让圣光渗入你的灵魂，高弗雷！"
G["LET THE STORM'S FURY CONSUME YOU!"]="让暴风吞噬你！"
G["LET'S GO! QUICKLY!"]="走吧！快！"
G["LET'S ROCK!"]="哈哈，来吧！"
G["LET'S ROCK!!"]="我们上吧！"
G["LEVIATHAN!!"]="巨兽！！"
G["LEZA!!"]="莱莎！！"
G["LIAM!!  NO!!!"]="利亚姆！！不！！"
G["LIES! The pain you are about to endure will be talked about for years to come!"]="撒谎！接下来你要承受的痛苦足够你谈论好几年！"
G["LIGHT GRANT ME ONE FINAL BLESSING! GIVE ME THE STRENGTH... TO SHATTER THESE BONDS!"]="无上的圣光啊！请祝福我！赐予我力量……帮助我冲破这些枷锁！"
G["LIGHT PURGE YOU!"]="接受圣光的净化吧！"
G["LIGHT TAKE YOU, BEAST!"]="让圣光拥抱你吧，野兽！"
G["LIGHTNING GUIDE MY FURY!"]="愿闪电指引我的怒火！"
G["LOCATION UNRECOGNIZED. RETURNING TO LAST KNOWN BASE LOCATION."]="未知地点。返回已知的最后一个基地位置。"
G["LOK'TAR OGAR!!"]="力量与荣耀！！"
G["LOK'TAR! HILLSBRAD IS OURS!"]="LOK'TAR！希尔斯布莱德是我们的！"
G["LOOK AT HIM!"]="看看他！"
G["LOOK AT ME!!!!  I'M A MANATAUR!!!"]="快看我！！！！我是猛犸人！！！"
G["LOOK AT ME, I'M RANDOMIZING! HERE IT COMES (IN 5 SECONDS)!"]="看，随机挑选开始！五秒内就有结果！"
G["LOREWALKER! You have something of mine."]="游学者！你身上有属于我的东西。"
G["LORNA? What... Where is she!? What have you done to her!?"]="罗娜？什么……她在哪儿？！你对她做了什么？！"
G["LOUD NOISES!"]="来点儿噪音！"
G["LUNCH!"]="开饭了！"
G["LYALIA! NOOOOOOOO!"]="丽娅拉！不……！"
G["Lackeys be damned! I'll finish you myself!"]="该死的废物！看我亲自解决你们！"
G["Ladies and gentledwarves, we gather here in the shadow of Thunderstrike to honor the union of Fanny Thundermar and Keegan Firebeard."]="女士们，先生们，我们聚集在雷霆山下，共同见证范妮·桑德玛尔和科甘·焰须的结合。"
G["Ladies and gentlemen!  Well... let's just say you don't want to miss this one!"]="女士们，先生们！我说……你们一定不想错过这场战斗吧！"
G["Ladies and gentlemen, gather round the Conquest Pit!  Witness the battle of $r versus bear and place your bets with confidence!"]="女士们，先生们，欢迎来到征服斗兽场！见证$r与巨熊的激战！下注吧！"
G["Ladies and gentlemen, these deliverers of dismemberment have come out VICTORIOUS! Bets on the next round start now! Let's get this money flowin'."]="女士们，先生们，这些斗士已经取得了胜利！下一场的赌盘现在开始！让我们的钱舞动起来吧。"
G["Ladies and gentlemen... gather round the pit!"]="女士们，先生们……欢迎来到斗兽场！"
G["Ladies, ladies... It's going to be alright.  I've already captured the creature's essence in my painting."]="女士们，女士们……就是这样。我已经在我的绘画中捕捉到了那头怪物的精髓。"
G["Ladies, please.  The boar will live on in my art.  Please don't shed another tear, unless it is because my art moves you so."]="女士们，请注意，这头野猪将活在我的艺术中。请不要再抛洒泪水了，除非你们是被我的作品所感动。"
G["Ladies, please. I'm desperate. Certainly you can spare something... the smallest reagent, your cheapest wares. Help a soul in need!"]="女士们，请帮帮我吧。我很绝望。你们可以随便施舍点东西……最微不足道的魔法材料，最便宜的物品，帮帮一个需要帮助的可怜人吧！"
G["Lads and ladies. Today can be your greatest day, for today, you fight for the glory of Stormpike! Ride unto the field and grant your enemies no mercy! Strike the savages down and let their Warchief sort em out!"]="女士们先生们，今天是个伟大的日子。因为今天，你们将为卡尔·雷矛的荣耀而战！前进吧，对敌人绝不手下留情！打倒那些野蛮的家伙！"
G["Lady Jaina Proudmoore would like to see you as soon as possible."]="吉安娜·普罗德摩尔女士希望尽快见到你。"
G["Lady Jaina told me to speak to you about using a gryphon to survey Alcaz Island."]="吉安娜女士让我来和你谈谈关于乘坐狮鹫调查奥卡兹岛的事。"
G["Lady Jaina would not send a messenger with such haste if she did not believe her information reliable."]="如果消息来源不可靠的话，吉安娜女士也不会急着派信使来暴风城。"
G["Lady Jaina, this may sound like an odd request... but I have a young ward who is quite shy.  You are a hero to him, and he asked me to get your autograph."]="吉安娜女士，这听起来像是个奇怪的请求……但是我正在照顾一个非常害羞的孩子。对他来说，你是个英雄，他想要你的签名。"
G["Lady Liadrin is bound to find a way. She must."]="女伯爵莉亚德琳有义务为我们找到新的出路。她必须这么做。"
G["Lady Liadrin, matriarch of the Blood Knights, has the Knights' headquarters in an enclave in Farstriders' Square. You'll need to speak to Champion Bachi there if you are looking for instruction. Be respectful while there if you value your head."]="女伯爵莉亚德琳，血骑士的领袖，把她的血骑士总部设在远行者广场的边上。如果你需要什么指导的话，可以去和勇士巴卡希谈谈。倘若你想要保住自己的脑袋，记得在那里说话时放礼貌点。"
G["Lady Proudmoore - more Zandalari are approaching from the docks."]="普罗德摩尔女士——码头上的赞达拉巨魔又冲过来了。"
G["Lady Proudmoore! Everyone is in position, and the Shado-Pan are inside, but..."]="普罗德摩尔女士！人员已经就位，影踪派也进去了，但是……"
G["Lady Proudmoore's forces have bled to delay Archimonde and his Burning Legion, and now this grim task falls to us. Are you ready to stand with me against the onslaught?"]="Las fuerzas de Lady Valiente han sufrido para ralentizar el avance de Archimonde y de la Legión Ardiente; ahora nos toca tomar el relevo. ¿Estás $glisto:lista; para luchar a mi lado?"
G["Lady Proudmoore, I am ready to go to Orgrimmar. Please open a portal."]="Lady Valiente, estoy $glisto:lista; para ir a Orgrimmar. Abre el portal."
G["Lady Proudmoore, it is safe for you to enter."]="普罗德摩尔女士，请进吧。"
G["Lady Proudmoore, the Warchief speaks the truth. This subterfuge was set in motion by Varimathras and Grand Apothecary Putress. It was not the Horde's doing."]="普罗德摩尔女士，酋长说的是实话。这是瓦里玛萨斯和大药剂师普特雷斯安排的诡计，并非部落的本意。"
G["Lady Shandris is counting on me. I will not fail her."]="珊蒂斯女士正指望我呢。我不会让她失望的。"
G["Lady Sira'kess has sent for you. You are needed for the ritual."]="希拉柯丝女士派我来找你。她需要你参加仪式。"
G["Lady Sylvanas has ordered the investigation of some of the natural phenomena of Azeroth. She feels there is something great to be learned from its secretive past.\n\nI know not how she learned such things, but I trust her completely, so I will do my best.\n\nI am currently investigating slimes, oozes and such. The creatures all seem to be similar in make up, but greatly affected by their environment.\n\nI could use your help in gathering samples of the creatures.."]="Lady Sylvanas ha ordenado que investiguemos algunos de los fenómenos naturales que ocurren en Azeroth. Ella cree que hay algo grandioso que aprender de su pasado oculto.\n\nNo sé cómo ha aprendido esas cosas, pero confío ciegamente en ella, así que daré lo mejor de mí.\n\nAhora mismo estoy investigando las babas, los mocos y organismos similares. Estas criaturas son muy similares en constitución, pero están gravemente afectadas por su entorno.\n\nTu ayuda me vendría bien para recoger muestras de las criaturas."
G["Lady Vashj expects our work to be done soon."]="瓦丝琪希望我们的工作可以很快完成。"
G["Lady Vashj is nothing like her mother. It is little wonder she left this city so long ago."]="瓦丝琪女士和她的母亲完全不同。毕竟她在很久以前就离开了这座城市。"
G["Lady Vashj must answer for these atrocities. She must be brought to justice!"]="瓦丝琪女王必须为这些暴行负责。她必将得到制裁！"
G["Lady Vashj will not be pleasssed to hear of thisss..."]="瓦丝琪大人不会对此感到高兴的……"
G["Lady Windrunner herself sent me to serve as the Horde liaison to Zaela and the Dragonmaw clan. She and the new Warchief, Garrosh, are attempting to mend their broken fences, it would seem.\n\nIn any case, we must put an end to the Twilight threat once and for all. Most importantly, though, we must keep Cho'gall from creating his ultimate weapon."]="风行者女王亲自派我来，作为部落的使者与扎伊拉和龙喉氏族联系。女王和那位新酋长加尔鲁什正在试图修复他们的关系。\n\n不管怎样，我们必须彻底结束暮光的威胁。而最重要的是，我们必须阻止古加尔制造出他的终极武器。"
G["Lady luck is on my side tonight!"]="我今晚真是鸿运当头！"
G["Lady stitch us up and bandage when we get hit.  You find her in inner ring of Rogues' Quarter."]="当我们受伤时，她总为我们医治。你可以在盗贼区找到她。"
G["Lady teach you make magic items.  She at inner ring of The Apothecarium."]="拉文尼亚女士教你制作魔法物品。她就在炼金房的内环。"
G["Lady, you need to lower your voice."]="女士，你需要把声音降低一些。"
G["Lady."]="女士。"
G["Lafoo digs up some bugs from the dirt."]="拉弗乌从土堆里挖出几只虫子。"
G["Lafoo is Soo-says little pet. Probably the most incomptent gorloc I've ever met... and that's saying something."]="拉弗乌是索乌塞的小宠物。他大概是我见过的最无能的鳄鱼人……这多少能说明点问题。"
G["Lakota'mani thunders within you, $n."]="拉克塔曼尼的力量与你同在，$n。"
G["Lambs for the slaughter!"]="一群待宰的羔羊！"
G["Lambs to the slaughter..."]="一群待宰的羔羊……"
G["Lambs! Lemmings! All of them!"]="小羊羔！小旅鼠！它们都在！"
G["Lance in the pants!"]="长矛在我裤子里呢！"
G["Lance with the devil in the pale Twilight!"]="和苍白暮光中的魔鬼纠缠去吧！"
G["Lancer? I hardly knew her!"]="长矛？我都不认识她！"
G["Land ho!"]="陆地，吼吼！"
G["Land ho, Mr. Kowalski! Port is in sight, sir!"]="是陆地，科瓦斯基先生！港口就在前方，长官！"
G["Land-dwelling scum!"]="住在地面上的蠢货！"
G["Landro's Gift Box"]="兰德鲁的礼物盒"
