G["Landro's Lil' XT"]="兰德鲁的小拆"
G["Landro's Pet Box"]="兰德鲁的宠物笼"
G["Lanfen can be found meditating over the lake in the Temple Gardens. I hear she makes quite marvelous teas."]="兰风就在神殿花园的湖上冥想。我听说她非常擅长泡茶。"
G["Langrom's Leather & Links in southern Dalaran should have what you seek."]="达拉然南部的兰格鲁的皮加锁应该能满足你的需求。"
G["Languish in damnation!"]="到下面去挣扎吧！"
G["Lao-Chin! We have won the day. Why are you weeping?"]="老陈！我们今天干得不错。你哭什么呀？"
G["Lao-Chin's Healing Spheres heal him as they fade away!"]="老陈的疗伤珠在对他进行治疗后消失不见了！"
G["Lapdogs, all of you!"]="你们都是些不值一提的渣滓！"
G["Lard keep peace here. Lard also sell fish. Want fish?"]="拉尔德在这里维持和平。拉尔德还在这里钓鱼。想要一些鱼吗？"
G["Larion, I want to help you fight these pests!"]="拉瑞安，我想帮助你打败这些家伙！"
G["Lash him to the tree!"]="把他绑到树上去！"
G["Lass, I've a confession to make to ya."]="姑娘，我要向你坦白一件事。"
G["Last I checked, your title was overseer, not overeater."]="上次我来的时候，你的头衔是监工，可不是暴食者。"
G["Last I heard from Hauthaa, she indicated that we are $3228w percent of the way there.\n\nI cannot express how vital it is to our efforts that we get them created. Our men and women are going to need better armor and weapons, and the anvil and forge are the key to that.\n\nYou will find the smith behind the Sun's Reach Armory, $n."]="Las últimas noticias que tuve de Hauthaa indicaban que estábamos al $3228w %.\n\nNo puedo expresar lo necesario que es para nuestros esfuerzos que los creemos. Nuestros hombres y mujeres van a necesitar mejores armaduras y armas, y el yunque y la forja son la clave para ello.\n\nEncontrarás a la herrera detrás del Arsenal de Tramo del Sol, $n."
G["Last I heard the Horde had accumulated $2021w of $2020w peacebloom, $2050w of $2051w firebloom and $2054w out of $2055w purple lotuses."]="我得到的最后的消息称，部落已经收集到$2021w份宁神花、$2050w份火焰花和$2054w份紫莲花，而总的需求量分别是$2020w、$2051w和$2055w。"
G["Last I heard, Elder Runetotem was traveling to Razor Hill in Durotar."]="符文图腾长者应该是往杜隆塔尔的剃刀岭去了。"
G["Last I heard, Elder Sardis was venturing to Valiance Keep."]="我最后一次听到长者萨迪斯的消息时，他正要前往无畏要塞。"
G["Last I knew, Elder Nurgen was in Azjol-Nerub."]="根据我最后得到的消息，长者努尔根在艾卓-尼鲁布。"
G["Last I knew, Elder Starsong was in the Sunken Temple of the Swamp of Sorrows."]="星歌长者应该是在悲伤沼泽的沉没的神庙中。"
G["Last I knew, Elder Stonespire was at Everlook in Winterspring."]="石塔长者眼下应该是在冬泉谷的永望镇。"
G["Last call, you fork-tongued dip-slithers!"]="最后一次警告，你们这些舌头分叉的爬虫！"
G["Last mont, me won da dead orc sound champi... champichi... me won da dead orc sound contest."]="上个月，我当上了兽人惨叫声模仿冠军。"
G["Last night, Master Snowdrift was giving some lessons at the Shado-Pan monastery in Kun-Lai Summit. He was teaching his students how to cast fists of frost. \n \n The good news is, the students did great. The bad news is, hundreds of icy fist balls were cast into the water. This froze the Tiger Gourami living in the surrounding lake!\n \n If you're looking to catch some Tiger Gourami today, that's probably your best bet."]="昨晚，雪流大师在昆莱山的影踪禅院授课。他教了弟子们如何施展冰霜之拳。\n \n好消息是，那些弟子们都做得很好。坏消息是，数百道冰霜拳劲被打入水中，冻住了周围湖泊中的虎皮丝足鱼！ \n \n如果你今天想抓一些虎皮丝足鱼，这或许就是最好的机会。"
G["Last push boys!  Let 'em have it!"]="最后一批了，伙计们！让他们尝尝厉害！"
G["Last straw..."]="忍无可忍了……"
G["Last time I went into a brawl my opponent ran away crying.  Not surprising that they fled, but it was the first time I've seen a crocolisk shed tears."]="上一回我在竞技场里把对手打到边哭边逃。按说对手打架打到一半就逃这不算什么稀奇事儿，但这可是我头一回看到鳄鱼流眼泪。"
G["Last time puppy-men attacked, Soo-holu chased them all the way back to their camp thing! It was glorious!"]="上次狗狗人打过来，结果索乌霍鲁将他们统统赶回了狗狗人的营地！真是氏族的荣耀啊！"
G["Last time someone went out to try to collect the bounty on Netherock, all we got back was a compressed layer of foolhardy adventurer!"]="上次有人妄想获得灵岩巨人的赏金，最后那个愚蠢的冒险者被踩成了照片。"
G["Last time they attacked, there was only one attack. I wouldn't be surprised if there were more this time."]="上回他们只发动了一轮攻击，如果这次他们进行多次攻击，我并不会感到惊讶。"
G["Last time we met, you had the advantage of fighting on holy ground.  You'll find that our situation has been... reversed."]="我们上次交手时，你占尽了圣地的优势。但如今，你会发现我们的境遇已经发生了……逆转。"
G["Last time we met, you were headin' to Binan Village to see your pandaren friend."]="我们上次见面的时候，你正要去滨岸村找你的熊猫人朋友。"
G["Last week I was in Goldshire. Have you been there?"]="我上周在闪金镇。你去过那里吗？"
G["Last, but certainly not least, we have the pyroblast. This is for when you absolutely, positively want to make a lasting first impression."]="最后，我们还有变羊术。当你想要给敌人留下持久的第一印象时，用它就对了。"
G["Later."]="再见。"
G["Launch me!"]="开始吧！"
G["Launch me! |cFF0008E8(Darkmoon Game Token)|r"]="发射吧！|cFF0008E8(暗月游戏代币)|r"
G["Launching."]="启动。"
G["Laurena is the High Priestess of Stormwind. You can find her in the Catheral of Light in Cathedral Square."]="劳瑞娜是暴风城的高阶牧师，你可以在教堂广场上的光明大教堂里找到她。"
G["Laurna Morninglight offers healing to those that live around Dolanaar.  Perhaps she would be able to teach you in the ways of a priest."]="劳尔娜·晨光为居住在多兰纳尔附近的居民们提供医疗服务。或许她能教你如何成为一名牧师。"
G["Lava? Pay no mind to all of that, friend. Look around you. Take in the joys that nature has to offer."]="¿Lava? No te preocupes por eso, $gamigo mío:amiga mía;. Mira a tu alrededor. Disfruta de la belleza que la naturaleza nos ofrece."
G["Lavinia Crowe's the local enchanter. She's set up shop on the inner ring of the Apothecarium."]="拉文尼亚·克洛文是这里的附魔师。他的店就开在炼金区的内环区域。"
G["Lay down and die."]="去死吧。"
G["Lay down your arms and succumb to the might of Kil'jaeden!"]="放下武器，向基尔加丹的力量屈服吧！"
G["Lay down your arms and surrender your souls!"]="放下武器，奉上你们的灵魂！"
G["Lay down your arms and surrender!"]="放下武器投降！"
G["Lay down your weapons, your feuds have no place here!"]="放下武器，你们胆敢在这里造次！"
G["Lay waste to the demons on the Dead Scar lately, $n?"]="最近在死亡之痕蹂躏那些恶魔吗，$n？"
G["Lay your duties aside and rest."]="卸下你的责任，安息吧。"
G["Lay your hand on the stone."]="把你的手放在石头上。"
