G["Lazy mutts!"]="懒狗！"
G["Lead him inta dis trap!"]="把他引到陷阱里来！"
G["Lead on, friend. It's time to set up your defenses!"]="带头干吧，朋友。该建造你们的防御工事了！"
G["Lead our people to their new home."]="带领我们的人民去他们的新家园。"
G["Lead the Twilight Recruit away from the group and use the Blackjack to knock him out."]="把暮光新兵从人群里带离，用硬铁棒将他击晕。"
G["Lead the way, Dark Lady. We will follow."]="带路吧，黑暗女王。我们会跟着你的。"
G["Lead the way, Prince Arthas."]="带路吧，阿尔萨斯王子。"
G["Lead the way, Sanders!"]="带路吧，杉德尔！"
G["Lead the way."]="带路。"
G["Lead us onward, $c."]="带我们冲啊，$c。"
G["Leading under the influence..."]="领袖也要承受压力……"
