G["Leap!"]="跃起！"
G["Leaping Leper Gnomes! You're a sight for sore eyes. I was worried the giant magma worm out front would deter visitors. Now that you're here you can give me a hand."]="真是活见麻疯侏儒了！见到你真是太好了。我原本还在担心前面那只熔岩巨虫会把来访者都吓跑了。既然你来了，就来帮我一把。"
G["Leaping leper gnomes! I've been stuck in there for months. Thanks, gang."]="这些讨厌的侏儒！我被困在这儿好几个月了。谢谢你。"
G["Learn from the masters. I have nothing to teach you, for I am but a student."]="去向教头们请教吧。我没什么可教你的，我也只是个徒弟而已。"
G["Learn from this, stranger!"]="有所领悟吧！"
G["Learn from your mistakes!"]="从错误中汲取教训！"
G["Learn how to drive you maniac!"]="你疯了吗！"
G["Learn the recipe."]="学习配方。"
G["Learn this spell well for it will burn the taint from all those who oppose us."]="好好学习这个法术，用它来烧尽我们敌人身上的污秽。"
G["Learn well from your experience here, $p. In the future, your efficient efforts may be well rewarded."]="记得你在这里学得的经验，$p。在未来，你的高效会带给你丰厚的回报。"
G["Learn your place, mortal!"]="要明白你的处境，凡人！"
G["Learn your place."]="乖乖躺下吧。"
G["Learning"]="学习"
G["Learning about new plant species is extremely important for our expedition.  Not just the medicinal or edible ones either.\n\nPlants provide the foundation for many other forms of life to exist.  Understanding them allows us to better understand nature as a whole."]="了解这些新植物的分类对我们远征队来说非常重要。这不只是为了医用或者食用。\n\n植物是很多其它生命存活的基础，了解它们可以让我们更好地了解整个大自然。"
G["Learning to read is a thirsty business. A toast, eh?"]="学会阅读是很有必要的一件事。一块面包？"
G["Leashes... with pre-attached pets."]="绳索……还有已经套在上面的宠物。"
G["Leather Armor"]="皮甲"
G["Leather skins? Yes, I just received some information on that. It would appear that of $2067w heavy leather needed, the Horde has collected $2066w. Also, $2070w out of $2071w thick leather and $2073w out of $2074w rugged leather have been gathered."]="皮革？哦，我刚收到消息。似乎部落已经收集到$2066w块重皮、$2070w块厚皮和$2073w块硬甲皮，而总的需求量分别是$2067w、$2071w和$2074w。"
G["Leatherworking"]="制皮"
G["Leatherworking & Skinning Supplies"]="制皮与剥皮补给品"
G["Leatherworking allows you to fashion armor, cloaks, armor-reinforcing kits, and other similar items from leather, hides, and scales. Other materials required for leatherworking can be purchased at trade and Leatherworking vendors.\nLeatherworking pairs well with Skinning as it allows you to gather your own raw materials; other necessary items, such as threads and dyes, can be purchased from trade or Leatherworking vendors.\nHighly skilled leatherworkers can also enforce their bracers and leg armor."]="La peletería te permite elaborar armaduras, capas, refuerzos para armadura y demás objetos similares a partir de cuero, pellejos y escamas. Los demás materiales para peletería se pueden comprar a un amigo o a los vendedores de peletería.\n\nLa peletería se compagina bien con el desuello, ya que te permite recolectar tus propias materias primas; los demás objetos necesarios, como hilos y tintes, se pueden comprar a un amigo o a los vendedores de peletería.\n\nLos peleteros más avanzados también pueden reforzar sus brazales y armadura para piernas."
G["Leatherworking and skins? You must be looking for a tanner. There's on in the crafter's hall, if I recall.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="皮革加工和皮草？你肯定在寻找一位皮匠。如果我没记错的话，应该在工匠大厅内。\n\n我会在你的地图上标记这个位置。"
G["Leatherworking and skins? You must be looking for a tanner. There's one in the chamber of masters, if I recall.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="皮革加工和皮草？你一定是在寻找皮匠。如果我没记错的话，在师匠大厅里有一位。\n\n我会在你的地图上标记这个位置。"
G["Leave ... this ... place ..."]="离开……这个……地方……"
G["Leave Azeroth be!"]="从艾泽拉斯滚出去！"
G["Leave Balboa alone you shiny gnats!"]="不要招惹巴伯亚，你这个发光的小虫子！"
G["Leave Dalaran? Where will I even go..."]="离开达拉然？那我应该去哪里……"
G["Leave Ongo'longo ALONE!"]="别惹昂格隆格！"
G["Leave Smuggler's Scar to signal Adarrah"]="离开走私者洞穴，向埃达尔拉发信号"
G["Leave at once, stranger!  I have no business with you."]="陌生人，赶快离开！我跟你没有关系。"
G["Leave behind your homes, your possessions, and your cares, and join us!"]="抛下你们的家园，你们的财产，还有你们所珍爱的一切，加入我们吧！"
G["Leave him chained there. I will deal with him in good time. As for the others... see to it that they do not escape!"]="把他锁在那里。等我有空的时候自然会去处理他的。至于其他人……别让他们跑了！"
G["Leave it be, Arthas. Forget this business and lead your men home."]="别去动它，阿尔萨斯。忘了它吧，带你的弟兄们回家。"
G["Leave it to the dwarves to send a mining specialist from Ironforge to tell us how to mine.  How hard is it to take a pick and chip away at some rock?  Well, since he's here, he's probably the one you should see anyhow.  His name is Gelman and he resides over in the Dwarven District."]="让矮人从铁炉堡指派一名采矿专家来教教我们吧。使用锄头打碎岩石有多困难？嗯，只要他在这儿，你就只管问他好了。他名叫吉尔曼，居住在矮人区。"
G["Leave me alone!!"]="别碰我！！"
G["Leave me alone."]="让我一个人呆着。"
G["Leave me and sword alone!  No retakes allowed!"]="离我的剑远点！不准把它拿走！"
G["Leave me be, fool!"]="¡Déjame en paz, $ginsensato:insensata;!"
G["Leave me be."]="别打扰我。"
G["Leave me now in peace. I must rest."]="让我安静一下。我必须休息。"
G["Leave me to my shame, $r."]="让我独自反省吧，$r。"
G["Leave me, $c. I must attend to my duties with Ambassador Sunsorrow, dull as they are."]="离我远点，$c。我必须要和他们一样，傻乎乎地保护银月大使欧诺·炎伤。"
G["Leave me."]="退下。"
G["Leave me.  My wounds are great and I fear they will overtake me.  Thank you, $n.  I will die here, but because of you... I'll die in peace."]="别管我。我伤得很重，可能会丢掉性命。谢谢你，$n。我将死在这儿，但是因为你……我能在平静中死去。"
G["Leave me. I have much to think about."]="你走吧。我要好好想想。"
G["Leave me...to die...alone...please..."]="求你……让我……独自……死去……"
G["Leave no stone unturned in our search!"]="每个角落都仔仔细细的搜查！"
G["Leave no stone unturned. I mean that literally, you heaps of decay! Tear this place apart if you have to."]="要把每块石头都翻一遍。执行我的命令，不许有半点折扣，烂家伙！如果有必要，就把这个地方翻个底朝天。"
G["Leave no survivors in your wake, brothers and sisters!"]="是伟大的天灾军团让你们重获生机。"
G["Leave no survivors!"]="不留活口！"
G["Leave no survivors! Let Arthas sort 'em out..."]="不留活口！让阿尔萨斯去教训他们吧……"
G["Leave no trace of them, Amythel. Destroy them!"]="让他们灰飞烟灭，阿米瑟尔。消灭他们！"
G["Leave no witnesses!"]="不留活口！"
G["Leave none alive!"]="不留活口！"
G["Leave none alive, save Malfurion. He is mine."]="杀掉所有人，除了玛法里奥。他是我的。"
G["Leave nothin' behind!"]="一个不留！"
G["Leave nothing behind!"]="别拉下东西！"
G["Leave nothing but ashes in your wake, brothers! Burn Sentinel Hill to the ground!"]="让你们所见之处只留下灰烬，兄弟们！把哨兵岭烧光！"
G["Leave nothing but smoldering husks."]="灰飞烟灭，寸草不生。"
G["Leave nothing for their clerics to resurrect!"]="不要让牧师复活他们！"
G["Leave now, pathetic alchemist. I anxiously await your next failure."]="走吧，可悲的炼金师。我急切地期待着你的下一次失败。"
G["Leave now... you do not deserve to suffer the crystal's wrath..."]="现在，走吧……你不应该承受这水晶的怒火……"
G["Leave off. I don't have anything for the likes of you."]="滚开！你别想从我这里得到任何东西。"
G["Leave or I'll be forced to pound yer face in!"]="离开这里，否则我就只能狠狠教训你了！"
G["Leave our lands!"]="滚出我们的土地！"
G["Leave that behind, it's not worth it!"]="别管它了，这不值得！"
G["Leave that to me."]="交给我吧。"
G["Leave the bodies here, that they may see the futility of fighting the Dragonmaw."]="把尸体留在这里，让他们知道，和龙喉兽人做对的下场。"
G["Leave the fire alone, pesky trolls! Just give up and die."]="别碰那火，讨厌的巨魔！放弃反抗，去死吧。"
G["Leave these forests!"]="离开这片森林！"
G["Leave this accursed place at once!"]="立刻离开这个诅咒之地！"
G["Leave this old Dragonmaw to his drink, $c.\n\nI've fought creatures that would curl your spine and I've seen my people all but slaughtered in the swamps of the wetlands and amidst the ruins of Outland.\n\nGet. Lost."]="别去打扰这年老的龙喉兽人喝酒了，$c。\n\n我曾经对抗过足以把你脊椎扭弯的怪物，在湿地的沼泽和外域的废墟间看着自己的人民惨遭屠戮。\n\n茫然。无措。"
G["Leave this place or I will thrash you soundly!"]="滚远点，不然我就狠狠揍你一顿！"
G["Leave this place!"]="离开这儿！"
G["Leave this place, stranger, lest it consume you as it has all that it has touched."]="Vete de aquí, $gforastero:forastera;, o te consumirá como ha hecho con todo lo que toca."
G["Leave this place."]="离开这里。"
G["Leave this place. <The relic emits a white hot arc of flame. A memory has been gained: A lone Dark Iron dwarf is surrounded by seven corpses, kneeling before a monolith of flame.>"]="离开这儿。<废墟中冒出了一道白热的拱形火焰。你的脑海中浮现出一段过去的回忆：七具尸体环绕着一个孤单的黑铁矮人，他在一团巨大的火焰面前跪了下来。>"
G["Leave this sacred place or perish!"]="离开这神圣的地方，否则你会丧命！"
G["Leave us alone! Let us be!"]="离我们远点！"
G["Leave us in peace, stranger. We have done nothing to you."]="放过我们吧，陌生人。我们没有对你做任何事。"
G["Leave your battles or errands, and browse my incredible wares! Only in Darkshire for a short time... praise the Light for that."]="走一走看一看啦，来看看我的货啦！我不会在夜色镇待很久……好机会不要错过！"
G["Leaving Kael'thas was the best thing any of us ever did.  His followers are too blind or too scared to realize where he's leading them.\n\nWe, however, are not."]="离开凯尔萨斯是我们一直以来所做过的最正确的事情。他的追随者们不是瞎了，就是对他太过恐惧，以致于无法认识到他正在把他们引向什么样的境地。\n\n然而，我们不是。"
G["Leaving ourselves unguarded on two sides will bring even more suffering, Jawn."]="让我们自己在两边都不设戒备，将会带来更大的灾难，加恩。"
G["Leaving so soon?"]="这么快就要走了？"
G["Leaving so soon? Be sure to tell your friends to stop by the Lin family noodle cart for some secret ingredient noodle soup."]="这就要走了吗？请告诉你的朋友，务必要来林家面摊尝尝我们的秘制汤面。"
G["Leaving so soon? Do come again!"]="这就要走了吗？下次再来！"
G["Leaving the faire so soon?\n\nFor a small fee, I can teleport you to a capital city.\n\nAre you sure you want to leave?"]="这么快就要走了吗？\n\n只要交纳少许费用，我就能把你传回某个主城。\n\n确定要离开吗？"
G["Lee Brown spends the whole day fishing up by Crystal Lake.  He's probably got some stories to tell and some tips he could teach you."]="李·布朗整天都在水晶湖钓鱼。或许他能给你讲些故事，还能教你一些技巧。"
G["Lee's caught some pretty odd things up at Crystal Lake.  He told me a story about this weird mask he fished up some months ago.  If you ask me, I think he just had one too many at the Lion's Pride that night."]="李·布朗在水晶湖中抓到过很多奇怪的东西。他说他数月前钓起过一个神秘的面具。但是照实说，我想他那晚一定在狮王之傲喝多了。"
G["Left Combat"]="离开战斗"
G["Left to their own devices, the Horde will overwhelm your land. Will you not help us fight them?"]="如果任其作恶，部落会吞噬你们的土地。你不打算帮忙对抗他们？"
G["Left... Left! LEEEFFFFTTTT!"]="左转……左转！左——转！"
G["Left? How can you choose to leave?"]="离开？您怎么能选择离开呢？"
G["Legend claims that in places of extreme conflict, across what is now known as the Plaguelands; clean and holy springs may erupt from the ground. The water from those springs has been named 'Blood of Heroes,' by artisans and commonfolk alike - in honor of those that fell in the war against the Scourge."]="La leyenda dice que en lugares de sumo conflicto, a través de lo que hoy se conoce como las Tierras de la Peste, pueden surgir fuentes sagradas y puras. El pueblo llano y los artesanos llaman al agua que mana de esas fuentes la \"Sangre de héroes\", en honor de los que cayeron en la guerra contra la Plaga."
G["Legend has it that Liu Lang once set out to explore the seas beyond Pandaria on the back of a giant turtle. Every few years, he would come back, always seeking new explorers to travel with him. To this day, whenever a pandaren is daydreaming or staring off into space, we ask if they're \"waiting for the turtle.\"\n\nMost pandaren aren't very adventurous - they like to stay close to hearth and home. But some of us are still dreamers... Tonight we gather at Turtle Beach on the southern coast to gaze out at the sea and celebrate Liu Lang's spirit of adventure.\n\nIt's called the Wanderer's Festival."]="Cuenta la leyenda que una vez Liu Lang se fue para explorar los mares más allá de Pandaria a lomos de una tortuga gigante. Volvía cada pocos años, siempre en busca de exploradores que viajaran con él. Hoy en día, cada vez que un pandaren sueña despierto o se queda mirando al infinito, le decimos que está \"esperando a la tortuga\".\n\nLa mayoría de los pandaren no son muy aventureros... Les gusta quedarse cerca de su tierra y de su hogar. Pero algunos somos soñadores... Esta noche nos reunimos en la Playa de la Tortuga, en la costa sur, para observar el mar y celebrar el espíritu aventurero de Liu Lang.\n\nY eso se llama el Festival del Errante."
G["Legend has it that Xuen hasn't fought in one of his own tournaments in centuries.\n\nHe says it is because he wants us to have a fighting chance. I think he's just getting old. Or... at least... old for a... well... whatever he is."]="相传，雪怒已经有几百年没有在他自己举行的比赛中大显身手了。\n\n他说是这是为了让我们都能有比试的机会。可我觉得，那只是因为他老了。或者……至少是……对于他那样的……存在……来说，已经老了。"
G["Legend has it that the Thunder King possessed enormous power, and built himself a palatial fortress. We should be able to see it soon..."]="传说雷神拥有强大的力量，他为自己建造了一座宏伟的堡垒。我们应该很快就能看见了……"
G["Legend says that the great beast Omen sleeps in the waters of Lake Elune'ara in Moonglade, only to appear once a year. But that's just a legend."]="传说月光林地的月神湖水下沉睡着一头年兽，一年只出水一次。不过那只是个传说而已。"
G["Legendary Pelt!"]="传说投掷！"
G["Legends of the great white stag have persisted in my culture for as long as we tauren can remember. Malorne likely stood guard over the primal forests at the very dawn of the world. He was an ancient spirit, the very embodiment of nature's power and purity!\n\nLong ago, the greatest tauren hunters would track the white stag when the moon was full. To catch even a glimpse of his shimmering hide through the trees was said to bring great fortune to the tribe for a generation.\n\nDid you know that Malorne was the consort of the moon goddess?"]="从我们牛头人有记录起，关于强大的白色雄鹿的传说就一直在我们的文明中流传。从开天辟地的那一刻起，玛洛恩似乎就在守护着原始的森林了。他是一位古代神灵，是自然的伟力与纯洁的化身！\n\n很久之前，最伟大的牛头人猎人会在月落时分追寻这头白鹿的踪迹。据说，哪怕是从林间瞥见一眼他那闪光的毛皮，就可以给部族里整整一代人带来巨大的幸运。\n\n你知道吗，玛洛恩还是月亮女神的伴侣。"
G["Legends tell of a great battle that took place in this very vale, turning the golden fields to crimson with the blood of many brave monks. The armies of Lei Shen the Thunder King, emperor of the mogu, fought brutally, but were eventually overcome."]="传说在这四风谷发生了大会战，许多勇敢武僧的鲜血将金色的原野染成了红色。魔古皇帝雷电之王雷神的军队战斗野蛮，但是最终被攻克。"
G["Legion everywhere... they must be dealt with!"]="到处都是燃烧军团……把它们全都干掉！"
G["Legion, to the front lines!"]="集合，开往前线！"
G["Legion?"]="军团？"
G["Legion? Demons? They hunt you? My people have also been hunted by Legion: Targeted by their dark masters for damnation.\n\n<Cowlen wipes the tears away.>\n\nIt is the reason that I moved my family here oh-so-many years ago."]="燃烧军团？恶魔？他们在猎杀你？我的人民也在被燃烧军团猎杀，被他们的黑暗主人作为诅咒的目标。\n\n<库雷擦去了泪水。>\n\n那就是我几年前把家搬到这里来的原因。"
G["Legionnaire Nazgrim"]="军团士兵纳兹戈林"
G["Lei Shen give us strength!"]="雷神赐予我们力量！"
G["Lei Shen gives life!"]="雷神赐予我们生命！"
G["Lei Shen let us prove ta ya the might of the Zandalari. We will crush des intruders where dey stand!"]="雷神要我们证明赞达拉的力量。我们将碾碎这些入侵者！"
G["Lei Shen must not be allowed to marshal his full strength.\n\nA direct assault on the front gates will take time, and the aid of your Alliance and Horde. But if there is one thing we Shado-pan know it is that where there is a wall, there is a way around.\n\nThe sewers at the back of this tunnel lead all the way to the fortress entrance. We must hold this entrance."]="绝不能让雷神恢复鼎盛时期的力量。\n\n直接攻打前门需要时间，以及你们联盟和部落的协助。但我们影踪派最相信一件事，那就是车到山前必有路。\n\n这条隧道深处的下水道可以通向堡垒的入口。我们必须守住这个入口。"
G["Lei Shen returns, weakling."]="雷神回来了，弱者。"
G["Lei Shen's power makes us stronger!"]="雷神之力令我们更加强大！"
G["Lei Shi's reflection burbles quietly."]="雷施的倒影静静地冒着气泡。"
G["Lei Shi's reflection ripples ominously."]="雷施的倒影荡起不祥的涟漪。"
G["Lei Shi's reflection ripples playfully."]="雷施的倒影荡起欢快的涟漪。"
G["Lei Shi's reflection smiles happily."]="雷施的倒影开心地微笑起来。"
G["Lemme give you some advice: Never trust a gnome."]="让我给你一个忠告吧：永远不要信任侏儒。"
G["Lemme outta here, mon!"]="放我出去，朋友！"
G["Lend me a Windrider.  I'm going to Spinebreaker Post!"]="借我一只双足飞龙。我要去断背岗哨！"
G["Lend us the strength of the giants of Shadowmoon, Corok. The master is a just ruler. He will be sure to take care of those that assisted in subduing the dissidents of this world."]="借给我们影月谷巨人的力量吧，考罗克。主人是非常公正的，他会善待那些在征服反对者的过程中给予他帮助的人。"
G["Lend us your aid, keeper. Together we will defeat Yogg-Saron."]="帮助我们作战吧，守护者。只要我们齐心协力，就一定可以击败尤格-萨隆。"
G["Lend us your voices! Now is the time we must act to save our people."]="让所有人听到你们的声音！现在是时候团结起来拯救我们的人民了。"
G["Leryssa!"]="莉蕾萨！"
G["Leryssa... you... you're all right!"]="莉蕾萨……你……你没事吧？"
G["Less fightin', more farmin'. That's the life, I tell ya.\n\n'Course, if yer doin' the fightin', I don't mind watchin'."]="Menos luchar y más cultivar. ¡Eso sí que es vida!\n\nEso sí, si $gel:la; que lucha eres tú, no me importa quedarme a mirar."
G["Less rivets mean a cleaner environment!"]="少几颗铆钉就意味着更整洁的环境！"
G["Less than a hundred of us, and over a thousand orcs. Only a handful of us managed to walk away from that one."]="我们不足百人，兽人却有上千个。区区百人怎么能够战胜他们？"
G["Less watching, more healing!"]="不要站在旁边看，多治疗些！"
G["Less yap flappin'. More ogre thwappin'. Deal?"]="少说废话，多杀点儿食人魔。好吗？"
G["Lesser beings, intruding here! A shame that your excess courage does not compensate for your stupidity!"]="低等生物，竟敢入侵这里！可惜你们过度膨胀的勇气，无法挽救愚蠢所导致的悲惨结局！"
G["Lesser? We'll show you who's lesser!"]="下等？我们会让你看看谁才是下等种族！"
G["Let $g him:her; through! Quickly, courier, to the High General!"]="¡Dejadle pasar! ¡Rápido, $gmensajero:mensajera; ve junto a la Alta General!"
G["Let 'em come. They'll pay for what they've done!"]="来吧。让它们为此付出代价！"
G["Let 'em have it!"]="让他们尝尝厉害！"
G["Let Clubnik know that the priesthood will be sending him a bill. For the Light!"]="让克拉伯尼克知道，牧师教会的账单随后就到。为了圣光！"
G["Let Connelly know that Fennie's askin' about him!"]="代范妮向康奈利问好！"
G["Let Marshal Windsor know that I am ready."]="请转告温德索尔元帅我已准备就绪。"
G["Let Quel'Delar be a sign that we will never give up, that we will face any enemy without fear."]="让奎尔德拉成为我们永不言弃的标志，面对敌人我们将不再心存恐惧。"
G["Let an old orc show you how it's done!"]="让老兽人教教你应该怎样做！"
G["Let death wash over you!"]="接受死亡的洗礼吧。"
G["Let everything you do be done for the Horde."]="确保你所做的一切都是为了部落。"
G["Let fire rain from above!"]="火焰之雨从天而降！"
G["Let hatred and rage guide your blows!"]="让仇恨和愤怒指引你们战斗吧！"
G["Let her know... my last thought was of her..."]="让她知道……我一直在想着她……"
G["Let him speak! Be silent!"]="听他说！肃静！"
G["Let him through! That strapping young pandaren is saving a keg of Honeybrew!"]="让他过来！那个魁梧的年轻熊猫人救了一桶蜜酒！"
G["Let honor guide you, $n. Do not forget that Hellscream's eyes are always upon you."]="让荣誉指引你，$n。不要忘记，地狱咆哮一直在注视着你。"
G["Let it be known that $n - Alliance $C - has earned the undying respect of Ironforge and the Alliance as a whole.  $GHe : She; has engaged in great diplomacy with Timbermaw Hold and performed valiant actions for them on our behalf.   $GHe : She; has gone above and beyond the call of duty.  Three cheers for $n - a true hero of the Alliance!"]="Todo indica que $n, $c de la Alianza, se ha ganado el eterno respeto de Forjaz y de la Alianza. $GÉl: Ella; se ha unido al Bastión Fauces de Madera con gran diplomacia y ha llevado a cabo valientes acciones para ellos en nuestro nombre. $GÉl: Ella; ha cumplido con creces con la llamada del deber. Tres hurras por $n, ¡$gun verdadero héroe:una verdadera heroína; de la Alianza!"
G["Let it be known that $n - Horde $C - has earned the undying respect of the Warchief.   $GHe : She; has engaged in great diplomacy with Timbermaw Hold and performed valiant actions for them on our behalf.   $GHe : She; has gone above and beyond the call of duty.  Three cheers for $n - a true hero of the Horde!"]="Todo indica que $n, $c de la Horda, se ha ganado el eterno respeto del Jefe de Guerra. $GÉl:Ella; se ha unido al Bastión Fauces de Madera con gran diplomacia y ha llevado a cabo valientes acciones para ellos en nuestro nombre. $GÉl:Ella; ha cumplido con creces con la llamada del deber. Tres hurras por $n, ¡$gun verdadero héroe:una verdadera heroína; de la Horda!"
G["Let it be known that it has been an honor and a privilege fighting alongside all of you."]="能与你们并肩作战是我无上的荣耀。"
G["Let it begin!"]="开始！"
G["Let it never be said that we do not listen to the concerns of the people. This \"Griftah\" individual has made false claims, and we mean to set things right."]="Que no se diga que no hacemos caso de las preocupaciones de la gente. Este sujeto \"Griftah\" ha declarado mentiras y tenemos intención de arreglar las cosas."
G["Let it not trouble your heart, beloved. You have freed me from slavery, and for that I love you all the more."]="亲爱的，不要为此而感到内疚。你使我从无尽的苦楚和折磨中解脱了出来，我只会为此而更加爱你。"
G["Let it rain!"]="让它下吧！"
G["Let loneliness guide you... give in."]="让孤独指引你……服从吧。"
G["Let loose your rage. Kill me and in so doing, validate my existence."]="释放你的怒火吧。杀了我，证明我存在的意义。"
G["Let me ask you this, brothers and sisters: Can good exist without evil? Can there be light without dark?"]="让我来问你们一个问题，兄弟姐妹们：善可以离开恶而存在吗？光明可以离开黑暗而存在吗？"
G["Let me assure you people that if he's successful, this world will suffer far worse than Outland ever did! So, let's make sure that doesn't come to pass."]="我跟你们打保票，如果他成功了，这个世界将会遭受比外域更严重的灾难！所以，我们必须保证这一切不会发生。"
G["Let me at 'em! I'll bash 'em ta bits with my lute!"]="让我来！我要用我的琴狠狠揍他们一顿！"
G["Let me at 'em! I'll blast 'em off the side o' the mountain!"]="让我狠狠地教训他们！我要把他们轰到山下去！"
G["Let me at 'em, $n! Just give the word and I'll mount up and attack their bridge!"]="让我来对付他们，$n！只要一声令下，我就会冲出去攻击他们的大桥！"
G["Let me at those crazy cultists! I'll cleave 'em in half!"]="让我们狠狠地教训那些邪教疯子！我要把他们全都砍成两段！"
G["Let me be."]="别管我。"
G["Let me break down a little math for you: \"goblin\" plus \"engineering\" equals KNOW HOW, baby.  Anyone who tells you otherwise simply doesn't know how to add."]="Déjame enseñarte algo de mates: \"goblin\" más \"ingeniería\" igual a SABER. Si alguien te dice otra cosa es que no tiene ni idea de sumar."
G["Let me browse your goods."]="让我看看你出售的货物。"
G["Let me browse your reagents and poison supplies."]="让我看看你出售的材料和毒药。"
G["Let me browse your seasonal fare."]="让我看看你携带的食物。"
G["Let me browse your selection of fireworks."]="让我看看你的焰火。"
G["Let me browse your wares, Calypso."]="让我看看你出售的货物，卡里普索。"
G["Let me browse your wares, Cookie."]="让我看看你的货物，曲奇。"
G["Let me browse your wares."]="让我看看你出售的货物。"
G["Let me confer with my colleagues."]="让我跟同伴交换一下意见。"
G["Let me fight by your side."]="让我和你一起战斗吧。"
G["Let me fly!"]="让我飞吧！"
G["Let me give you a moment to get our opponents ready for battle."]="我可以给你一点时间，让你为这场战斗做好准备。"
G["Let me give you my regards for Greatfather Winter, scum..."]="别忘了帮我向那老头问好，人渣……"
G["Let me go get you a set of tools, $n."]="等一下，我去给你拿一套工具，$n。"
G["Let me go!"]="放了我吧！"
G["Let me grab a spell focus from inside my home here, and then we'll get started!"]="让我在我的房子里施展一个法术，然后我们就开始！"
G["Let me grab parts for goblin... stop stealing!"]="这些都是地精的零件……不许偷！"
G["Let me grab the popped corn kernels, sire."]="阁下，让我拿些玉米仁吧。"
G["Let me guess, another group of Budd's riff-raff?\n\nAway with you, $r, before you get hurt - or worse."]="让我猜猜，你是巴德派来的另一队乌合之众吧？\n\n$r，趁你还没受伤——甚至送命之前离开这里吧。"
