G["Let us never again speak of this day. Our enemies are many. They need not know we hold such artifacts."]="让我们再也不要提起今天这件事情。我们有太多的敌人。他们不需要知道我们手中有这么一件宝贝。"
G["Let us not bring bloodshed to this peaceful place, \nrother:sister;."]="我们不要让杀戮席卷这片净土，$g兄弟:姐妹;。"
G["Let us not forget de help of our allies, of de members of de Horde who came to help us! Now is de time to be celebratin' dis great victory together!"]="不要忘记我们盟友的帮助。不要忘记来支援我们的部落战士！现在，正是我们一同庆祝这个伟大胜利的时刻！"
G["Let us not seek to extinguish magic from the world..."]="放弃将魔法从这个世界中根除的想法……"
G["Let us put an end to this Shatterspear threat for good. Sentinels, attack now!"]="让我们结束碎矛的威胁吧。哨兵，发动攻击！"
G["Let us re-convene by my camp, as friends and fellow heroes, to discuss our final and most dangerous quest.  Hup Hup, Pimento!"]="让我们到我营地处重聚——以朋友与同行英雄的身份，来讨论我们最后也是最重要的任务。来吧，多香果！"
G["Let us return to Sentinel Hill, allies, and inform Gryan of VanCleef's demise!"]="让我们尽快返回哨兵岭，伙伴们，把范克里夫死亡的消息通知给格里安！"
G["Let us return to the grove, mortal."]="凡人，让我们回到树林去吧。"
G["Let us see how you fare when your world is turned upside down."]="如果世界变得上下颠倒，你们会怎么办呢？"
G["Let us see how your nerves hold up against the Darkener, Thaladred!"]="让我们来看看你们如何面对亵渎者萨拉德雷！"
G["Let us see if it is truly impervious."]="我倒要看看它是否真的坚不可摧。"
G["Let us see if this is sufficient to cleanse the corruption from my people's souls."]="让我们看看这个是否足以净化我族人被腐化的灵魂。"
G["Let us see if together we can figure out what next to do."]="看看我们是否能够考虑清楚接下来该干什么。"
G["Let us see if we can freeze the enemy where they stand, little $r."]="小$r，来看看我们是不是能把敌人冻住。"
G["Let us see if your Alliance has what it takes to rule Azeroth."]="让我们看看联盟是否能够统治艾泽拉斯。"
G["Let us see this day who defeats a celestial, and who is themselves defeated."]="今天，就让我们看看谁能打败至尊天神，谁又会被打得一败涂地吧。"
G["Let us see what atrocity we can pull from the shadow realm this time..."]="让我们瞧瞧来自阴影界的残暴怪物……"
G["Let us see what fate has in store...."]="让我看看你们的命运将会如何……"
G["Let us see what he is truly made of."]="让我们看看他的能力。"
G["Let us see what horrors stir within your nightmares!"]="瞧瞧藏在你噩梦中的恐惧吧！"
G["Let us see what this journal reveals."]="让我瞧瞧这本日志都写了些什么。"
G["Let us see who is the greater tamer."]="让我们看看谁才是更厉害的驯宠师。"
G["Let us shut down this final portal and finish this."]="关闭最后的传送门，做个了断。"
G["Let us slay them!"]="消灭他们！"
G["Let us speak a moment, $r."]="我们谈谈吧，$r。"
G["Let us start with the three who sit behind me."]="从我身后这三位开始吧。"
G["Let us stop for a moment - what kind of hero are we talking about?"]="等等，不太对劲——这是我所说的那个英雄吗？"
G["Let us take back our city!"]="让我们夺回我们的城市！"
G["Let us talk about the nature of power. In my hands I hold a sword. I ask you: Who wields the power?"]="我们来谈谈力量的本质。我的手里握着一把剑。我问你：是谁支配着力量？"
G["Let us test your knowledge of history, then! Arthas's death knights were trained in a floating citadel that was taken by force when many of them rebelled against the Lich King. What was the fortress's name?"]="那就让我们来测试一下你的历史知识吧！阿尔萨斯用来训练死亡骑士，后来又由于大部分死亡骑士背叛巫妖王而被占领的浮空堡垒叫什么名字？"
G["Let us test your knowledge of history, then! Before Ripsnarl became a worgen, he had a family. What was his wife's name?"]="那就让我们来测试一下你的历史知识吧！在撕心狼变成狼人之前，他也曾有过家室。他的妻子叫什么名字？"
G["Let us test your knowledge of history, then! Before she was raised from the dead by Arthas to serve the Scourge, Sindragosa was a part of what dragonflight?"]="那就让我们来测试一下你的历史知识吧！在被阿尔萨斯复活为亡灵，并加入天灾军团之前，辛达苟萨曾属于哪个巨龙军团？"
G["Let us test your knowledge of history, then! Before the original Horde formed, a highly contagious sickness began spreading rapidly among the orcs. What did the orcs call it?"]="那就让我们来测试一下你的历史知识吧！在最初的部落建立之前，有一种高传染性的病毒在兽人间快速传播。兽人们称这种病为什么？"
G["Let us test your knowledge of history, then! Brown-skinned orcs first began showing up on Azeroth several years after the Third War, when the Dark Portal was reactivated. What are these orcs called?"]="那就让我们来测试一下你的历史知识吧！在第三次大战过去数年之后，黑暗之门重新开启时，艾泽拉斯首次出现了棕色皮肤的兽人。这些兽人被称为什么？"
G["Let us test your knowledge of history, then! Formerly a healthy paladin, this draenei fell ill after fighting the Burning Legion and becoming one of the Broken. He later became a powerful shaman."]="那就让我们来测试一下你的历史知识吧！有一位德莱尼人，他曾是一个健康的圣骑士，但在与燃烧军团作战时，他身染恶疾，变成了破碎者。后来，他成了一个强大的萨满。这个德莱尼人是谁？"
G["Let us test your knowledge of history, then! How many dragonflights were bestowed with special powers in order to protect the world of Azeroth?"]="那就让我们来测试一下你的历史知识吧！为了保护艾泽拉斯世界，有几个巨龙军团被赋予了特殊的能力？"
G["Let us test your knowledge of history, then! In Taur-ahe, the language of the tauren, what does lar'korwi mean?"]="¡Pongamos a prueba tus conocimientos de historia! ¿Qué significa \"lar'kowi\" en taurahe, el idioma de los tauren?"
G["Let us test your knowledge of history, then! In the assault on Icecrown, Horde forces dishonorably attacked Alliance soldiers who were busy fighting the Scourge and trying to capture this gate."]="那就让我们来测试一下你的历史知识吧！在突袭冰冠堡垒时，部落军队无耻地偷袭正与天灾军团激战的联盟士兵，并试图占领的那座城门叫什么名字？"
G["Let us test your knowledge of history, then! Malfurion Stormrage helped found this group, which is the primary druidic organization of Azeroth."]="那就让我们来测试一下你的历史知识吧！由玛法里奥·怒风协助建立的，艾泽拉斯最主要的德鲁伊组织叫什么名字？"
G["Let us test your knowledge of history, then! Most forest trolls became hostile to the Horde after the Second War. Which tribe of forest trolls is on friendly terms with the Horde today?"]="那就让我们来测试一下你的历史知识吧！在第二次大战之后，大部分森林巨魔都开始仇视部落。如今，哪一个森林巨魔部族依然对部落友善？"
G["Let us test your knowledge of history, then! Name the homeworld of the ethereals."]="那就让我们来测试一下你的历史知识吧！虚灵的家乡叫什么名字？"
G["Let us test your knowledge of history, then! Name the titan lore-keeper who was a member of the elite Pantheon."]="那就让我们来测试一下你的历史知识吧！隶属于万神殿精锐的泰坦知识守护者叫什么名字？"
G["Let us test your knowledge of history, then! Not long ago, this frail Zandalari troll sought to tame a direhorn. Although he journeyed to the Isle of Giants, he was slain in his quest. What was his name?"]="那就让我们来测试一下你的历史知识吧！不久之前，一个脆弱的赞达拉巨魔想要驯服一头恐角龙。虽然他登上了巨兽岛，却在任务过程中遇害。请问这个巨魔叫什么名字？"
G["Let us test your knowledge of history, then! One name for this loa is \"Night's Friend\"."]="¡Pongamos a prueba tus conocimientos de historia! ¿Qué loa se conoce también como \"amigo de la noche\"?"
G["Let us test your knowledge of history, then! One of Sylvanas Windrunner's sisters leads a militant faction of high elves and Kirin Tor. What is the name of this group?"]="那就让我们来测试一下你的历史知识吧！希尔瓦娜斯·风行者有一位姐妹领导着一个高等精灵的武装阵营以及肯瑞托。这个组织叫什么名字？"
G["Let us test your knowledge of history, then! Succubus demons revel in causing anguish, and they serve the Legion by conducting nightmarish interrogations. What species is the succubus?"]="那就让我们来测试一下你的历史知识吧！魅魔热衷于制造痛苦，她们在燃烧军团中专门负责进行可怕的拷问工作。请问魅魔属于哪个品种的恶魔？"
G["Let us test your knowledge of history, then! Tell me, hero, what are undead murlocs called?"]="那就让我们来测试一下你的历史知识吧！告诉我，英雄，亡灵鱼人被称作什么？"
