G["Let's take these ninjas out, boss.  I already see some of 'em up ahead."]="让我们把这些忍者干掉，老大。我已经在前方看见一些了。"
G["Let's take this fight to the Thunder King!"]="让我们与雷电之王决一死战吧！"
G["Let's take this show on the road and go wreck up Stormwind!"]="该我们登场发挥了，把暴风城踩烂吧！"
G["Let's talk about somethin' important."]="让我们来谈谈要紧的事吧。"
