G["Let's taste more!"]="让我们再尝尝看！"
G["Let's try Run Mode."]="让我们试试奔跑模式。"
G["Let's try planting it in some of my special, prepared soil..."]="让我来把它种在我特制的土壤里……"
G["Let's try this a new way..."]="好吧，我们换个法子……"
G["Let's try this one out..."]="让我们试试这个……"
G["Let's wait for the next wave."]="我们等下一波吧。"
G["Let's work smarter, people. The captain wants this done by the end of the week!"]="工作的时候动点脑子。上尉要求周末前必须完成这项工事！"
G["Let's wrap it up, Miz. They'll be here in a second."]="米兹利，我们最好快点弄好。他们很快就要到了。"
G["Let's you and I have a chat about some things, Godfrey."]="来吧，我们开诚布公地谈一谈。"
G["Let's... just keep moving."]="我们……继续前进吧。"
G["Let...me...go..."]="放……我……走……"
G["Lets find out what this warchief of theirs is made of."]="Veamos de qué pasta está hecho su famoso \"Jefe de Guerra\"."
G["Lets get back to your base!"]="我们回到你的基地吧！"
G["Lets go jump off tree! Fun fun!"]="来来，一起从树上跳下去吧！超级好玩！"
G["Lets go, $n. I am ready to reach Whitereach Post."]="走吧$n，前往白沙岗哨。"
G["Lets see you try that again! [PH]"]="¡Veamos si intentas eso otra vez!"
G["Letting him go is the only thing that's going to separate you from the beasts now, my friend."]="如果你要证明自己和那些野兽不同，就必须放他走，我的朋友。"
G["Level 1: Completed!"]="第一关：完成！"
G["Level 2: Completed!"]="第二关：完成！"
G["Level two grappling is done. Now to tighten up level three..."]="二层已固定。现在加固第三层……"
G["Leven! You're alive! That must mean..."]="莱文！你还活着！那意味着……"
G["Leven, take the right side! You're on your own!"]="莱文，你去右侧！靠你自己了！"
G["Lexicon of Power"]="魔法力量宝典"
G["Lexlort, I lost the thorium shackles."]="雷克斯洛特，我把瑟银镣铐弄丢了。"
G["Ley-Guardian Eregos is all that now stands between us and control of The Oculus.  He's flying above the Band of Alignment, at the very top of The Oculus.  Eregos is incredibly powerful; stay on my back when we engage him and leave the fighting to me."]="只要除掉魔网守护者埃雷苟斯，我们就能控制魔环。他就在位于魔环顶层的校准之环上方盘旋。埃雷苟斯拥有难以想象的力量。开战之后你待在我背上吧，让我来对付他。"
G["Ley-line excavations continue, with pleasant results.  We were surprised to find several similarities in the ley-line structures between Azeroth and Draenor, possibly indicating a similar genesis?\nMy close associate Naberius reports that the Laughing Skulls have established a truce with the Alliance forces in the area. Always distrustful of orcs, I thought to myself, \"This could be heaven or this could be hell.\""]="\"Las excavaciones de las líneas-Ley continúan, con resultados satisfactorios. Nos sorprendió encontrar varias similitudes en las estructuras de la línea-Ley entre Azeroth y Draenor; posiblemente indiquen una génesis similar.\nMi socio Naberius me ha informado de que los Riecráneos han pactado una tregua con las fuerzas de la Alianza en la zona. \"No hay que fiarse de los orcos\", pensé yo. \"Esto podría ser el paraíso o el infierno.\""
G["Leyara barks a cruel laugh."]="莱雅娜发出了一阵残忍的笑声。"
G["Leyara nods."]="莱雅娜点了点头。"
G["Leyara, the two of you are all I have left. I swear to you, on my life, you and my granddaughter will ALWAYS have my protection."]="莱雅娜，我只剩下你们俩了。我向你发誓，终我一生，我将始终守护你和我的孙女。"
G["Leyara, you must see that Fandral is beyond redemption. The corruption within him runs deeper than you know."]="莱雅娜，你必须明白范达尔已经无法救赎了。他受到的腐蚀比你想象的还深。"
G["Leza!"]="莱莎！"
G["Li Li does not understand why I always stop to sample the local brews. But in my experience, you can learn a lot about a people by what they drink!\n\nHave you tried mainland pandaren ales? Very crisp, very dark. One sip and you know that they are brewed to be savored slowly. It is the drink of a people that are in no hurry, who enjoy time with their friends.\n\nWhat do YOU drink, $c? And what would it tell me about you, hm?"]="丽丽不明白为什么我总是停下来品尝各地的美酒。可根据我的经验，一个人群的性格，就体现在他们喝的东西里！\n\n你尝过大陆熊猫人的啤酒了吗？口感既清冽，又醇厚。只需品上一口，你就会知道，这酒是经由悉心慢酿而成。喝这酒的人，也必然是淡然恬静，不慌不忙，乐于与朋友分享美好的时光。\n\n你喝什么呢，$c？它又如何反映着你的性格，嗯？"
G["Li Li, Mudmug, wait up!"]="丽丽，泥盏，等等！"
G["Li Li, wait up!"]="丽丽，等等！"
G["Li Li, you get the malts. I will... research the local brews. We'll meet back here."]="丽丽，你去找麦芽。我……去调查当地的啤酒。然后在这儿会合。"
G["Li Li. A stranger in need is a future friend. That is the wanderer's way!"]="丽丽。今天的陌生人就是明天的朋友。这就是云游者之道！"
G["Li Li... let's go. Your uncle has got something to prove."]="丽丽……我们走。你叔叔要证明一些事情。"
G["Li Li? Is that you? Hello? Anybody gonna pay attention to ol' Mudmug?"]="丽丽？是你吗？有人吗？谁来关心一下老泥盏啊？"
G["Li and Lo, get the sap into position!"]="李，罗，把树脂准备好！"
G["Li and Lo, go look after our friends down below."]="李，罗，照看好下面的朋友们。"
G["Li, I need another dragon gun."]="李，再给我一支龙枪。"
G["Liar!"]="骗子！"
G["Lich King say Patchwerk \"on loan\" from Naxxramas. Loan make Patchwerk ANGRY!"]="Rey Exánime decir que Remendejo \"prestado\" de Naxxramas. ¡Préstamo ENFADAR a Remendejo!"
G["Lieutenant Aden always volunteers for gate duty. That's fine by me.\n\nI've got a post that allows me a good view of my guards AND the daughters of the tradesmen at the same time."]="艾登中尉总是自愿地承担起驻守城门的重任。我对此没什么意见。\n\n我喜欢呆在岗哨，既能看到手下的侍卫，还能欣赏商人的女儿。"
G["Lieutenant General. The peons are working day and night to organize and ready the supplies from Orgrimmar. There is still much to be done, but we are an hour ahead of schedule."]="中将，苦工们日以继夜地整理从奥格瑞玛运来的补给品。还有很多没有完成，不过我们已经赶超原计划一小时了。"
G["Lieutenant Myner asked me to challenge you to a duel."]="米纳尔中尉要求我与你进行一场决斗。"
G["Lieutenant, I have lost my insignia. Could you please supply me with a replacement?"]="副官，我丢失了我的徽章。你能再给我一枚吗？"
G["Lieutenant, I want you to make that your top priority.  Notify anyone that you think can help."]="中尉，我希望你能把这个设置为最高优先级。通告任何你觉得可以施以援手的人。"
G["Life energy to... consume."]="生命的能量……"
G["Life form purged."]="生命体已被净化。"
G["Life from lifelessness... death for you."]="腐化而成的血肉生物……死吧。"
G["Life is a struggle, and the saying that which does not kill you makes you stronger is not always true.  Sometimes wounds act slowly, which is why we have bandages.  Pand Stonebinder of the Spirit Rise can teach you the art of First Aid."]="生活是一场竞争，“大难不死必有后福”这句俗语并不是始终正确的。有时伤口愈合得很慢，这就是我们需要绑带的原因。灵魂高地的潘德·缚石能教你急救的技能。"
G["Life is but a path to undeath. My pets understand that."]="生命是通往不死的必经之路。我的宠物们深知这个道理。"
G["Life is like a carefully woven tapestry."]="生活就像一幅小心编织的锦缎。"
G["Life is meaningless without suffering!"]="没有痛苦，生命就毫无意义！"
G["Life is meaningless. It is in death that we are truly tested."]="生命本身毫无意义。只有死亡才能让你了解人性的真谛。"
G["Life is meaningless. It is in the afterlife that we are truly tested."]="生命是毫无意义的。我们在死后才会面临真正的考验。"
G["Life is weak, mortal, fleeting ... fragile."]="软弱，短暂，易碎，生命必将终结。"
G["Life suddenly seems so much brighter.\n\nI still love sleeping, though."]="人生突然变得充满光明。\n\n虽然我还是喜欢睡觉。"
G["Life thrives in this jungle, $c. Birds call down from the canopy. Beasts roar out from the dark, hidden places below.\n\nAnd we, the hunters, keep them in check. It is our place - our obligation - to do so."]="这是一片生机盎然的丛林，$c。鸟儿在树冠间啁啾，野兽在树下的阴影中咆哮。\n\n而我们这些猎手，则要控制它们的数量。这是我们使命——我们的责任。"
G["Lifebinder! Do you presume that I am at your beck and call? I have a world to unmake."]="生命的缚誓者！你以为我会听从你的号令？世界正待我毁灭。"
G["Lift the frost leopard's tail to check if it's a male or a female."]="拎起冰霜豹的尾巴，检查一下它是雄性还是雌性。"
G["Lift the icepaw bear's tail to check if it's a male or a female."]="拎起冰爪熊的尾巴，检查一下它是雄性还是雌性。"
G["Lifting"]="上升"
G["Light be with them, brother - and with us, for that matter. We're spread pretty thin these days."]="愿圣光与他们同在，老兄——当然也与我们同在。我们的兵力近来分得太散了。"
G["Light be with you now and forever."]="愿圣光与你同在。"
G["Light be with you, $c."]="愿圣光与你同在，$c。"
G["Light be with you, $n.  And welcome to Shattrath."]="Que la Luz esté contigo, $n. Y $gbienvenido:bienvenida; a Shattrath."
G["Light be with you, $r."]="光明与你同在，$r。"
G["Light be with you, Harbinger."]="圣光与你同在，先驱者。"
G["Light be with you, friend."]="Que la Luz esté contigo, $gamigo mío:amiga mía;."
G["Light be with you, sir."]="愿圣光与您同在，长官。"
G["Light be with you."]="圣光与你同在。"
G["Light be with you... for the very low price of a one silver tithe!"]="圣光与你同在……只需要掏一两个银币！"
G["Light bless you, my child."]="圣光保佑你，我的孩子。"
G["Light bless you, stranger. You've saved me!"]="Que la Luz te bendiga, $gextraño:extraña;. ¡Me has salvado!"
G["Light da fuses, boys!"]="点燃引线，兄弟们！"
G["Light fades..."]="光明消退……"
G["Light grant me strength!"]="圣光赐予我力量！"
G["Light help us!"]="圣光，救救我们！"
G["Light help us... the Scourge are in the Park!"]="圣光保佑……天灾已经入侵公园区了！"
G["Light is money, friend."]="圣光就是金钱，朋友。"
G["Light of Elune take you!"]="艾露恩之光将击败你！"
G["Light of Elune, save me!"]="艾露恩之光，救救我！"
G["Light of lights...I have failed you. I am sorry...my Azshara..."]="光中之光……我让你失望了。我很抱歉……我的艾萨拉……"
G["Light preserve ye!"]="圣光会保佑你的！"
G["Light purge you from this world!"]="圣光会将你从这个世界上抹除！"
G["Light receive me!"]="圣光接纳了我！"
G["Light save me!"]="圣光！救救我吧！"
G["Light take these creature's spirits into your arms!"]="圣光把这些生物的灵魂注入你的武器中！"
G["Light take you!"]="圣光会消灭你！"
G["Light that we embrace, we beseech thee..."]="我们信奉的圣光，我们恳求你……"
G["Light the candle and watch one float, even without wind!"]="只要点亮蜡烛，它就能飞上天空，甚至不需要有风！"
G["Light the fuses! They will not leave this tower alive!"]="点燃导火索！他们休想活着离开这里！"
G["Light up the oil!"]="点燃热油！"
G["Light!  Do not fail me!"]="圣光！不要辜负我！"
G["Light's Hope Chapel remains a bastion in the Plaguelands.  Argent Dawn's foothold there is key to securing the area."]="圣光之愿礼拜堂是瘟疫之地仅存的据点。银色黎明必须在那里站稳脚跟，才能确保整个地区的安全。"
G["Light's Hope isn't far, young paladin.  Might I suggest walking?"]="圣光之愿礼拜堂就在前面了，年轻的圣骑士。介意步行吗？"
G["Light's Vengeance."]="圣光的复仇。"
G["Light, give me strength!"]="圣光，赐予我力量吧！"
G["Light, give me strength."]="圣光，赐予我力量吧。"
G["Light, give us the courage we need to enter battle with Un'Goro's corrupted dragons."]="圣光啊，请赐予我们勇气，帮助我们与安戈洛的堕落群龙作战。"
G["Light, give us the strength we need to defeat the vile broodmother of Un'Goro."]="圣光啊，请赐予我们力量，帮助我们击败安戈洛的邪恶龙女王。"
G["Light, grant us the ability to bring Un'Goro's dragons to their demise."]="圣光啊，请赐予我们能力，让我们消灭安戈洛的恶龙。"
G["Light, lead the fallen from untruth to truth, from darkness to Light and from death to immortality."]="圣光，指引那些堕落者从虚伪走向真实，从黑暗走向光明，从死亡走向永生。"
G["Light... I see... light. Finally, after centuries of silence, someone comes at last."]="光……我看到了光……经历了几百年的沉寂，终于有人来了。"
G["Light... fading... dying?  No, just sleeping..."]="生命……消褪……死亡？不，只是入睡……"
G["Light... light so bright..."]="圣光……明亮的圣光……"
G["Light... what is this light? Bless you..."]="光……哪里来的亮光？愿天神保佑你……"
G["Lightbringer."]="光明使者。"
G["Lighting"]="点火"
G["Lighting Fuse..."]="点燃导火索……"
G["Lightning Conductor works much better in a crowd, yes?"]="闪电导体对集群目标的效果更好，对吧？"
G["Lightning above, obey the call of the Twilight's Hammer!"]="苍穹之闪电，听从暮光之锤的召唤！"
G["Lightning has no mercy!"]="闪电绝无怜悯！"
G["Lightning is better than thunder right?  Well, then I wish to be crowned the Lightning King of Pandaria!"]="闪电总比打雷好，对吧？嗯，那我希望能加冕为潘达利亚的闪电之王！"
G["Lightning strikes."]="闪电一击。"
G["Lightning! Destroy my enemies!"]="闪电啊！摧毁我的敌人！"
G["Lightning, seek my foes!"]="闪电，找到我的敌人！"
G["Like Chen and Li Li Stormstout!"]="就像陈和丽丽·风暴烈酒！"
G["Like Illidan, you constantly struggle to bend the all consuming chaos to your will."]="就像伊利丹，你总是努力想要掌控那消磨心志的混沌之力。"
G["Like Kel'Thuzad, I too was once a mage of the Kirin Tor. And like Kel'Thuzad, I seek the legendary Atiesh, greatstaff of the Guardian. Our fates are intertwined as such, $c."]="与克尔苏加德一样，我也是一个来自肯瑞托议会的法师，更相似的是，我与他都在寻找着埃提耶什，守护者的传说之杖。我们的命运似乎就这样交织在一起了，$c。"
G["Like Mu'sha."]="就像穆萨一样。"
G["Like Shaohao, we know our ultimate destiny is to become one with the land. Nothing truly meets an end."]="跟少昊一样，我们知道，我们最终的命运便是和大地融为一体。一切都没有真正的终结之时。"
G["Like a  charm. Who needs a key anyway..."]="像是个魔法符咒。钥匙又有什么用……"
G["Like a Dunwald. I like you."]="你就像顿沃德家族的一员。我喜欢你。"
G["Like a cat dragged in from the rain, you scratch and claw, then do it all over again... I'll be back for more...\n\nOh, I didn't see you enter, $n! What can I do for you?"]="Como un gato al que arrastran de la lluvia, arañas y clavas las uñas, y luego lo vuelves a hacer... Vendré a buscar más... \n\nOh, ¡no te vi entrar, $n! ¿En qué puedo ayudarte?"
G["Like an angel..."]="好像天使一样……"
G["Like anything that you see, $c?"]="有印象吗，$c？"
G["Like children."]="真幼稚。"
G["Like father always said; it takes a shrewd mind, sharp instincts, and unfailing courage to become a successful investor.\n\nI must admit, I smelled this opportunity a mile away."]="就像父亲一直说的那样，要成为一名成功的投资人，必须具有精明的头脑，敏锐的直觉和无尽的勇气。\n\n必须承认，我能在一哩以外就能闻到投资的机会。"
G["Like moths to the flame!"]="就像飞蛾投火！"
G["Like music to my ears. Scream for me, human."]="尖叫吧，人类。我喜欢这美妙的乐曲。"
G["Like our people, the Horde is always in motion, always changing. But make no mistake. We will endure."]="和我们的人民一样，部落也一直在改变，一直在变革。但不用怀疑，我们会度过这黑暗的时代。"
G["Like rice stalks before the blade, all fall before me!"]="如同刀下蝼蚁，统统倒在我脚下吧！"
G["Like shootin' fish in a barrel!"]="这就叫探囊取物！"
G["Like swatting insects..."]="就好象在拍虫子……"
G["Like the phoenix, I shall be reborn."]="就像凤凰那样，我会重生的。"
G["Like the stream meeting the cliff, there is beauty in the fall, if you know where to look."]="如同溪流遭遇悬崖就会变成美丽的瀑布，只要你懂得该从何处着眼。"
G["Like this?"]="像这样？"
G["Like you, I continue to refine my skills here in Pandaria. I think you will appreciate the outcome."]="和你一样，我也在潘达利亚锻炼自己。相信结果会让你满意的。"
G["Like you, I could not resist the opportunity to take part of this ancient Pandaren tradition.  When you are ready, let us see how well you can lead your pets in battle."]="和你一样，我很难抗拒这个体验熊猫人古老传统的机会。当你准备好之后，就让我们看看你指挥宠物作战的本领吧。"
G["Like you, all of Azeroth shall burn."]="和你一样，整个艾泽拉斯都将燃烧。"
G["Like... a LOT of guns."]="或者说……很多把刷子。"
G["Likewise. Sylvanas and I have both sent ships to support Vol'jin's revolution."]="我们也一样。希尔瓦娜斯和我都派出舰队去支援沃金了。"
G["Lil' green goblin gonna bleed for all ya done!"]="小绿地精要流血了！"
G["Liladris has been waiting for me at Maestra's Post, so we should make haste, $n."]="利拉迪斯一直在梅伊瑟娜岗哨等我，我们得快些，$n。"
G["Lilatha, get someone to look at those injuries. Thank you for bringing her back safely."]="莉拉恩萨，找个人来看看这些伤口。谢谢你把她安全地带了回来。"
G["Lilian's Soul fades into the spirit realm! It can no longer be harmed!"]="莉莉安的灵魂逐融入了亡者的国度！她将免疫一切伤害！"
G["Lilian's Soul fixates on $n!"]="莉莉安的灵魂盯上$n了！"
G["Lilian, I..."]="莉莉安，我……"
G["Lilian, do you realize that you are undead yourself?"]="莉莉安，你有没有意识到自己也是个亡灵？"
G["Lilian, you're one of the Forsaken, like me.  Which brings the question: why did the Scarlet Crusade put you in a cage?  They usually kill the undead on sight."]="莉莉安，你是被遗忘者，就像我一样。可问题是——为什么血色十字军会把你放进笼子里？他们通常只要见到亡灵就会立刻杀掉。"
G["Lilian... you're... it's so nice to see you well."]="莉莉安……你……真高兴能看到你没事。"
G["Lilly, please take the prisoner back to the sentinels so that we can deal with him properly."]="莉莉，请将这名犯人带给哨兵，我们将公正的对待他。"
G["Limpet Mine Planted! Detonation in:"]="刺贝水雷已放置就位！起爆时间："
G["Limpy Joe, it's you. It's really you!"]="乔伊，是你。真的是你！"
G["Lin finds the Hidden Master? Then our training can continue!\n\nOnly one thing. Ken-Ken must finish helping the sads first. Too many sads here."]="林找到隐秘大师了？那我们的训练可以继续了！\n\n现在就还剩下一件事。肯肯得先帮助那些悲伤的家伙。这里有太多哀苦的人了。"
G["Lin is upset - Zhiya was his good friend and we lost him in the battle. \nI don't want Lin to do something thoughtless. I don't know what I'd do if I lost him..."]="Lin está triste... Zhiya era su mejor amigo y lo hemos perdido en la batalla.\n\nNo quiero que Lin haga ninguna locura. No sé lo que haría si lo perdiera..."
G["Lin, heart of my heart! No, please, NO! It cannot be!"]="林，亲爱的！不，拜托，不要！怎么会这样！"
G["Line up and crush these fools!"]="准备战斗，干掉这些蠢货！"
G["Lira sent me to watch your backs. If Obsidia is in here, I'll keep her busy while you finish her off."]="莉拉让我来留心你们的身后。如果欧比斯迪在这儿的话，我会吸引住她，然后就要由你们来解决她了。"
G["Lisrythe may be a bit... intimidating at first, but she stocks what you're looking for. She sells her wares in the eastern portion of Scryer's Tier."]="利萨尔丝可能……看上去有点凶，但是她出售你想要的东西。她在占星者平台的东部。"
G["Lisrythe may be a bit... intimidating at first, but she stocks what you're looking for. She sells her wares outside the large library on Scryer's Tier."]="利萨尔丝可能……看上去有点凶，但是她出售你想要的东西。她在占星者平台的东部。"
G["Lissah Spellwick, at the top of mage tower, is the mistress of Lady Jaina's enchanters."]="丽萨·斯贝维克位于法师塔顶层，她是吉安娜女士手下的附魔师当中的佼佼者。"
G["Lissan! I bet that girl is daydreaming at the well again!"]="莉丝安！我敢打赌她又跑到井边做白日梦了！"
G["Lissan! Lissan White! Where is that girl?"]="莉丝安！莉丝安·怀特！她在哪儿？"
G["Lissen Marge, I thought I told ya never to bother me when I be drinkin'...."]="玛尔格，我记得我警告过你，别在我喝酒的时候烦我……"
G["List says like you're third in line, $c."]="Parece que eres $gel tercero:la tercera;, $c."
G["Listen $g lad : lass;. I left the expedition in the capable hands of me son, Junior. When you've stalked the finest game in all of Azeroth you start to itch for something more.\n\nAnd have you seen the size of the beasties here?!\n\nI'm here hunting the most dangerous prey you'll ever lay your eyes on. I mean to bag myself Tusker and take her heart as my trophy!"]="Escucha, $gamigo:amiga;. He dejado la expedición en las competentes manos de mi hijo Júnior. Cuando ya has cazado las mejores presas de Azeroth, empiezas a pensar en algo más grande.\n\n¿Y has visto las bestias que hay aquí?\n\n¡He venido a abatir la presa más peligrosa que hayas imaginado jamás! ¡Quiero cazar a Eburnia y llevarme su corazón como trofeo!"
G["Listen $g sonny:missy;, I'll have you know that whatever attacked us was no priestess of nothin'! Her eyes were aglow with something evil and she was genuinely frothing at the mouth! She came in, did some kind of crazy scream that sent us all runnin' in separate directions then started flayin' our minds one by one. I'd be hearin' shadowy words in my head, watchin' the other's periodically black out here and there. It was madness! We would have been done for if not for the damned monkey."]="听着，$g小家伙:小姑娘;，你要知道，攻击我们的不是女祭司！她口吐白沫，眼睛闪着邪恶的光芒！她进来之后发出尖啸，我们被迫四下逃离，然后她便一个个地鞭荅我们的灵魂。我听见暗言术的声音，看着其他人不断倒下。要不是那该死的猴子，我们就全都玩完了！"
G["Listen carefully to the silence, $c. What does it say?"]="仔细聆听那寂静，$c。它说了什么？"
G["Listen carefully, $n, for I have much knowledge to impart."]="听仔细了，$n，我要传授给你的知识很多。"
G["Listen carefully, for the lord of Blackrock will surely destroy you, should you not be prepared."]="听仔细了，要是你没有准备好的话，黑石统领会杀死你的。"
G["Listen closely to what you are told and do not quickly trust, or distrust.  For even friends serve their own ends, $c.\n\nOur great Warchief knows this, and to prove that there are warlocks within the Horde who do not wish to destroy it from within or gain control over it, I have volunteered to aid our young leader in anyway I can."]="你要仔细听好了，别轻易相信或怀疑你所听到的一切。因为即使是朋友也可能将自己送上死路，$c。\n\n我们伟大的酋长深知这一点，为了证明部落中有一些术士并不想从内部毁掉部落，或是为了获得权力，我自愿尽我所能帮助年轻的首领。"
G["Listen here, now. When you're looking for answers nothing beats a good explosion - the bigger, the better!\n\nBut that's probably enough with the questions for now, $r.\n\nMy warheads are classified material, and the element 115 that I created to power them is even more classified!\n\nIn fact, it's best that you just return to your everyday life and pretend we never met."]="听着。想知道不明物的真相，最好是制造一场爆炸——当然是越大越好啦！\n\n不过眼下还有很多问题没有解决，$r。\n\n这些弹头都是由机密材料制成的，而作为推进能量源的115号元素就更加机密啦！\n\n事实上，你最好假装从来没有见过我，继续过你的安稳日子去。"
G["Listen ta me, $g brudda:sista;. You must fight against da Lich King's control. He be a monster dat want ta see dis world - our world - be ruined. Don't let he use you ta accomplish he goals. You be a hero once and you be a hero again! Fight it, mon! Fight he control!"]="Escúchame, $ghermano:hermana;. Debes luchar contra el control del Rey Exánime. Es un monstruo que quiere ver este mundo, nuestro mundo, convertido en ruinas. No dejes que te utilice para lograr sus metas. Una vez fuiste $gun héroe:una heroína; y puedes volver a serlo. ¡Lucha, tron! ¡Lucha contra su control!"
G["Listen to me, $n. Ye must fight against the Lich King's control. He's a monster that wants to see this world - our world - in ruin. Don't let him use ye to accomplish his goals. Ye were once a hero and ye can be again. Fight, damn ye! Fight his control!"]="Escúchame, $n. Debes luchar contra el control del Rey Exánime. Es un monstruo que quiere ver este mundo, nuestro mundo, convertido en ruinas. No dejes que te utilice para lograr sus metas. Una vez fuiste $gun héroe:una heroína; y puedes volver a serlo. ¡Lucha, maldita sea! ¡Lucha contra su control!"
G["Listen to me, $n. You must fight against the Lich King's control. He is a monster that wants to see this world - our world - in ruin. Don't let him use you to accomplish his goals - AGAIN. You were once a hero and you can be again. Fight, damn you! Fight his control!"]="Escúchame, $n. Debes luchar contra el control del Rey Exánime. Es un monstruo que quiere ver este mundo, nuestro mundo, convertido en ruinas. No dejes que te utilice para lograr sus metas... OTRA VEZ. Una vez fuiste $gun héroe:una heroína; y puedes volver a serlo. ¡Lucha, maldita sea! ¡Lucha contra su control!"
G["Listen to me, $n. You must fight against the Lich King's control. He is a monster that wants to see this world - our world - in ruin. Don't let him use you to accomplish his goals. You were once a hero and you can be again. Fight, damn you! Fight his control!"]="Escúchame, $n. Debes luchar contra el control del Rey Exánime. Es un monstruo que quiere ver este mundo, nuestro mundo, convertido en ruinas. No dejes que te utilice para lograr sus metas. Una vez fuiste $gun héroe:una heroína; y puedes volver a serlo. ¡Lucha, maldita sea! ¡Lucha contra su control!"
G["Listen to me, human. I care nothing for your plight, but you have something I require. Tell me where to find the bloodforged ingots."]="听着，人类。我不关心你们的约定，但是你们有我要的东西。告诉我在哪里可以找到血铸铁锭。"
G["Listen to me, peon. We have a process for the delivery and safekeeping of the cipher fragment. The envoy delivers the missive, which is sealed by Lord Illidan. No missive, no transfer."]="听我说，苦工。我们对于运送和保护密码碎片有着严格的流程。大使传达盖有伊利丹大人徽记的信件。没有信件就免谈。"
G["Listen to the Orc. He has a point."]="听听那个兽人的话。他说得有理。"
G["Listen to the stories of an elder. $n. I have many to speak of..."]="听一听长者的故事吧，$n。我有许多话要说……"
G["Listen to what I have to tell you about our enemy before we start. You don't want to be unprepared while we're out smashing Scourge in the field."]="Escucha lo que tengo que contarte sobre nuestro enemigo antes de que empecemos. Querrás estar $gpreparado:preparada; cuando estemos machacando a la Plaga, ¿verdad?"
G["Listen to your elders, $n. If you are strong of will and dedicated, there is no power you cannot control."]="听你的长辈的话，$n。要是你拥有强大的意志和热情，就没有不能控制的力量。"
G["Listen to your inner voice, and seek out the truth!"]="倾听你内心的声音，找出真相吧！"
G["Listen to your men's dying breaths as I drink in their souls!"]="我要吸取你们的灵魂，我要听你们临死前的哀号！"
G["Listen up Men!"]="听好了！"
G["Listen up! FALL IN!"]="听口令！集合！"
G["Listen up! Our transport should be here momentarily."]="听好了！运输船随时都会抵达。"
G["Listen up, Venture Company goons! Rule #1: Never keep the prisoner near the explosives."]="听着，风险投资公司的蠢货！准则第一条：永远不要把囚犯关押在爆炸物附近。"
G["Listen up, flapjack, we're in for the fight of our lives with the bugs in Ahn'Qiraj and we need to get prepared for it. I'm collecting iron bars here.  Currently, the Alliance only has $2002w iron bars, but we're projected to need a total of $2003w for the war effort."]="听着，我们是在赌上性命跟安其拉的虫人战斗，因此需要做好充分的战斗准备。我在此地收集铁锭。目前，联盟只收集到$2002w块，而总的需求量是$2003w。"
G["Listen up, men! Prepare for a hozen ambush!"]="大家听好了！小心猢狲的伏击！"
G["Listen up, soldiers!"]="听好了，士兵们！"
G["Listen up, you lot! Our worries are over! FREE BOOZE FOR EVERYONE!"]="听好了，大家！我们的担心是多余的！今天的酒全部免费！"
G["Listen well, Scourge defilers. None of you will reach the Sunwell so long as I stand!"]="天灾的渣滓们，给我听着。只要我活着，你们就休想靠近太阳之井！"
G["Listen well, mortal."]="听好了，凡人。"
G["Listen!\n\nTaking out those crystals should drain the construct."]="听着！\n\n拿走那些水晶会让构造体失去能量。"
G["Listen, $c, it's clear that you and your friends know your way around Azeroth. Surely you've come across certain folks who hunger for fame and fortune. \n\nSend me anyone who might be willing to enter Zul'Aman and I'll make it worth your while."]="听着，$c，我知道你和你的朋友非常熟悉艾泽拉斯世界。你们一定遇见过好些渴求名望和财富的家伙。\n\n如果有谁对祖阿曼感兴趣的话，记得介绍给我认识哟，我会酬谢你的。"
G["Listen, $g pal:lady;, I don't want any trouble, ok? I didn't see who murdered 'em, but I sure heard it! Lot of yelling. Human voices... you dig? Now get out of here before I change my mind about beating you up and takin' your shoes."]="听着，$g伙计:女士;，我可不想惹麻烦。我没看见是谁杀了他们，但我听到了！不绝的哭喊声，还有人说话的声音……懂了吗？现在赶紧离开这儿，趁我还没改变主意把你的鞋子扒下来痛打你一顿。"
G["Listen, $n, I can't be seen talking with you. You're not exactly at the top of the Trade Prince's list these days and I need to think about my future.\n\nYou understand, right, babe? Besides, I'm with Candy now."]="Escucha, $n, no pueden verme hablar contigo. Actualmente no estás precisamente en lo más alto de la lista de amigos del Príncipe mercante y tengo que pensar en mi futuro.\n\n¿Lo entiendes, verdad, cielín? Además, ahora estoy con Cara."
G["Listen, $n, I hate being indebted to anyone. So can you make sure to keep this on the down-low, just between the two of us?\n\nI'd hate for my creditors to find out."]="Escucha, $n, odio estar en deuda. Así que sé $gdiscreto:discreta; y que quede entre nosotros, ¿quieres?\n\nNo quiero que se enteren mis acreedores."
G["Listen, $n, I know of a little swamp not too far from here...."]="喂，$n，我知道有块沼泽离这里不远……"
G["Listen, $n, you should know by now that when fortune comes knocking, you open the door and ask questions later. Chances like this don't come along every day!\n\nNow, are you in or not, $c?\n\n<Budd doesn't wait for a reply>\n\nOf course you are! Now, there's work to be done, and so far I've seen a lot of talking and no action. I suggest you show me something before I find a replacement.\n\nThere are thousands who would kill for an opportunity like this, I assure you!"]="Escucha, $n. A estas alturas ya deberías saber que cuando la fortuna llama a tu puerta, primero abres y luego preguntas. ¡No todos los días se presentan oportunidades como esta!\n\n¿Te apuntas o no, $c?\n\n<Budd no espera una respuesta>\n\n¡Pues claro que sí! Vamos, hay mucho trabajo y de momento solo he visto mucha palabrería pero poca acción. Más vale que me demuestres algo antes de que encuentre un sustituto.\n\n¡Te aseguro que mucha gente mataría por una oportunidad como esta!"
G["Listen, $n, you should know by now that when fortune comes knocking, you open the door and ask questions later. Chances like this don't come around every day! Are you in or not?\n\n<Budd doesn't wait for a reply.>\n\nOf course you are! Now, there's work to be done, and so far I've seen a lot of talking and no action. I suggest you show me something before I find a replacement.\n\nThere are thousands who would kill for an opportunity like this, I assure you!"]="Escucha, $n. A estas alturas ya deberías saber que cuando la fortuna llama a tu puerta, primero abres y luego preguntas. ¡No todos los días se presentan oportunidades como esta! ¿Te apuntas o no?\n\n<Budd no espera una respuesta>\n\n¡Pues claro que sí! Vamos, hay mucho trabajo y de momento solo he visto mucha palabrería pero poca acción. Más vale que me demuestres algo antes de que encuentre un sustituto.\n\n¡Te aseguro que mucha gente mataría por una oportunidad como esta!"
G["Listen, $p, that grill's not gunna put food on itself. Don't let the fellas get hungry now!"]="听着，$p，那个烤肉架不会自己变出吃的来。别让我的伙计们饿着了！"
G["Listen, $r.\n\nIf you're lookin' for a shredder to ride, you'll need to head up into the hills just north there.\n\nThis one's out of commission."]="听着，$r。\n\n想找一台能驾驶的伐木机，你恐怕得进入北面的山岭。\n\n这台已经坏掉了。"
G["Listen, $r. Listen well...\n\nThe dragon riders came in the night, mounted atop the black flight. They struck fast and with deadly precision, taking young whelps - such as me - and escaping under the veil of darkness.\n\nI watched in horror as they used my brothers and sisters in their experiments. From our essence would be created the chromatic flight."]="听着，$r。听好了……\n\n龙骑士骑着黑龙，趁着夜色而来。他们迅速出击，给予幼龙——像我这样经验不足的幼龙——致命而精确的攻击。\n\n我怀着极大的恐惧注视着我的兄弟姐妹被他们用在实验中。我们的精华能创造出多彩龙人。"
G["Listen, I've been doin' a little celebratory drinkin' since our escape, and I've been thinkin'...\n\nThose little men that jumped us need to be brought to justice!\n\nIf somethin' ain't done, then every unsuspectin' explorer who sets foot in this place is gunna get sold into slavery - or worse!"]="听着，自从我们逃出来之后，我稍微庆祝了一下，喝了几杯。然后我一直在想……\n\n那些攻击我们的小人应该得到正义的惩罚！\n\n如果我们不为此做些事情，那么每一个没有准备就进入那个地方的探险家都会变成奴隶被卖掉，或者遭遇更可怕的事情！"
G["Listen, death knight... Listen for the voice of your master. He calls to you now."]="听，死亡骑士……是主人的声音。他在召唤你。"
G["Listen, dragon. Let the truth resonate throughout these halls."]="听着，你这条龙。让真相大白于天下吧。"
G["Listen, if you can be discreet about it, there are a bunch of places in this town guys like me aren't supposed to know about."]="Mira, si sabes ser $gdiscreto:discreta;, te diré que hay unos cuantos sitios en esta ciudad que personas como yo no deberían conocer."
G["Listen, kid. I can handle this thing. You just watch my back!"]="Escucha, $gchico:chica;. Puedo encargarme de esto. ¡Tú cúbreme las espaldas!"
G["Listen, mon!\n\nI tell ya all I be knowin', but first ya gotta be savin' me from these savages and their killer bears.\n\nDeal?"]="听着，朋友！\n\n我会把我知道的一切都告诉你，但你得先把我从这个恐怖的地方救出去！\n\n怎么样？"
G["Listen, since you two did such a good turn by helping me out, I'm casting the first vote to help you join the Tillers."]="听着，鉴于你们俩帮了我这么大一个忙，我会投出第一票，帮你们加入阡陌客。"
G["Listen, stranger, I'd love to sit and chat, but me head's poundin' somethin' fierce.\n\nHow 'bout ye git these good fer nothin' trolls to stop makin' such a racket. Then we'll get to talkin', eh?"]="陌生人，听着。我很乐意坐下来聊聊，不过我头痛得厉害。\n\n不如你先让这帮一无是处的巨魔安静点，然后我们再谈，怎么样？"
G["Listen, you tell Schweitzer and Roitau that we've got everything under control here. They don't gotta... what?\n\nThey didn't send you? Then what are you wasting my time for?\n\nI've got work to do!"]="听着，你去告诉舒维瑟尔和洛伊塔，就说我们已经控制住了这里的局势。他们不需要……什么？\n\n他们没派你来？那你干嘛还来浪费我的时间？\n\n我还有工作要做呢！"
G["Listen, you... do you have any idea how hard it is to conduct a geological survey? It's exacting, precise work!\n\nAn' it's even harder when you're drunk."]="听着，你……你知道进行地质勘察是多么困难吗？这是精确、精密的工作！\n\n而且当你喝醉时，就更是难上加难了。"
G["Listen, young $c.  You hear the call of water?"]="听好了，年轻的$c。你听见水的召唤了吗？"
G["Listen. I'm not supposed to tell you this, but there's going to be this party that you're invited to. Whatever you do, DO NOT DRINK THE PUNCH!"]="听着。我本来不打算告诉你的，很快你就会接到聚会的邀请。总之，千万别喝宴会上的饮料！"
G["Listen: The storm. We figured out what's makin' it. That sneaky Zandalari has these ice trolls makin' blood sacrifices ta elemental spirits."]="听着：我们发现了风暴的源头。卑鄙的赞达拉巨魔让冰巨魔用鲜血祭祀元素。"
G["Little $n crush all da demons."]="$n消灭了所有的恶魔。"
G["Little $n, why do you call me forth? Are you working with the trolls of this land? Have you come to kill me and take my power as your own?"]="$gPequeño:Pequeña; $n, ¿por qué me llamas? ¿Estás colaborando con los trols de esta tierra? ¿Has venido a matarme y quedarte con mi poder?"
G["Little $r, you will now come to appreciate my wrath!"]="¡$gPequeño:Pequeña; $r, ahora observarás mi cólera!"
G["Little $r. You are in MY realm now!"]="小$r。你现在闯入了我的地盘！"
G["Little Ella's trying her hand at brewing? Well, I'll be! I wish her luck. Brewing isn't something a novice can just take up, you know. Anyhow, I can spare a Lakemelon for her."]="小艾拉在试着酿酒？好吧，我是！祝她好运。你知道，酿造不是新手可以掌握的。无论如何，我可以让给她一个湖瓜。"
G["Little Lu, keep Amber alive! Sully, try and keep this plane from exploding on us!"]="小卢，保护好安玻！苏利，别让飞机在我们身边炸了！"
G["Little creature made of flesh, your wish is granted! Death comes for you!"]="渺小的血肉之躯们，你们的愿望即将成真！你们的死期即将来临！"
G["Little early to the party, aren't ya?"]="现在去参加派对有点儿早，不是吗？"
G["Little food'll feel pretty good right about now."]="现在能吃点东西的话该有多好啊。"
G["Little forsaken know all weapons.  Him Archibald.  You find on inner ring of War Quarter."]="小亡灵阿基巴德知晓所有武器。你可以在军事区内环找到他。"
G["Little goblin on top of building north of Ruins of Lordaeron.  Leave Undercity and you go there."]="洛丹伦废墟以北建筑顶端那有地精。离开幽暗城，前往那儿吧。"
G["Little goblins? I remember when your race was created."]="小地精？我还记得你们这一族被创造出来的情景。"
G["Little hairier out here than you expected, $r?\n\nCan't say I'm surprised. I hear that from most everyone who makes it this far."]="$r，是不是觉得这里比想象中更加毛骨悚然啊？\n\n如果你真有这种感觉，我一点也不吃惊。几乎所有来过这里的人都这么说，我已经习惯了。"
G["Little hand says it's time to rock and roll. Everyone into the hold: We've got a dragon to kill."]="是时候大干一场了。所有人进入船舱：我们要去杀的是一条龙。"
G["Little help here!"]="请来帮帮忙！"
G["Little more than gnats!"]="就比小虫子强了一点点！"
G["Little of their camp has been left intact. Still, there might be something we can make use of.\n\nDid you require something of me, $r?"]="他们的营地几乎被彻底摧毁了。不过我们还是从那片废墟中找到了一些可用的东西。\n\n你需要些什么，$r？"
G["Little spirit, you cannot hide from me in that body!"]="渺小的灵魂，你带着那个躯壳是逃不出我的掌心的！"
G["Little waters, if you would just stop moving so quickly, perhaps I could help you!"]="小水花们，如果你们能别跑得那么快，我或许能帮你们！"
G["Liu Lang discovered many things as he explored the world - oh - yes, Hao?"]="刘浪在探索世界的过程中有许多发现——噢——怎么了，昊？"
G["Liu stepped on my foot!"]="刘刚才踩了我一脚！"
G["Liu took my jinyu trinket!"]="刘抢走了我的锦鱼人饰品！"
G["Live EVERY day with hope in your heart. In doing so, you CREATE the future you dream of."]="要怀着希望渡过每一天。如此，方能创造梦想中的未来。"
G["Live Update Works again!"]="在线更新再次生效了！"
G["Live a life devoted to the ideals of Kros. Never stop fighting, never stop growing. Each day, stronger than before.\n\nFight through pain. Suffer through filth. Everyone is your enemy.\n\nDie with your weapon in your hand. Give your body to Ihgaluk."]="为克洛斯的理想而活。战斗不息，成长不止。每一天都要更加强壮。\n\n战胜痛苦，忍受污秽。所有人都是你的敌人。\n\n握着你的武器死去，将你的躯体献给伊瓜鲁克。"
G["Live in fear, die by the will of Kael'thas... It's all the same."]="在恐惧中生存，遵从凯尔萨斯的意志死去……都是一样的。"
G["Live to fight another day, and prosper."]="养精蓄锐，伺机再战。"
G["Live, damn you!"]="快活过来呀！"
G["Lives depend on the actions we take here.  Be quick with what you have to say, $c."]="我们在这里的行动关系到许多人的性命。你想说什么就快说吧，$c。"
G["Livin' like an animal is hard enough without your insults!"]="像个畜生一样的活着已经够痛苦了，现在你还来羞辱我！"
G["Living Fluids begin to form in a nearby pool!"]="附近的池塘中开始形成活化液体！"
G["Living flesh eases the pain..."]="活生生的血肉可以减轻痛苦……"
G["Living flesh!"]="鲜活的肉！"
G["Living in these caverns and following that mad lobstrok, Clacker, is unnatural! Let me free!"]="呆在沉闷的洞穴里，还要追随那个疯狂的龙虾人，我实在是受不了了！放我出去！"
G["Living or dead, you will serve me."]="无论生死，你都将侍奉我。"
G["Living out here in the desert is rough! I get so thirsty standing outside in this heat."]="这沙漠可真不是人呆的地方！在这种高温下还得站在外面，我都快渴死啦！"
G["Living water, bring them death!"]="活水，杀死他们！"
G["Lizzarik has blades. Lizzarik has maces. Lizzarik has all your weapon needs right here!"]="里扎雷克斯这里有利刃，里扎雷克斯这里有铁锤，里扎雷克斯这里有你需要的所有武器！"
G["Lo! We are leaving. Where did you get off to?"]="罗！我们要出发了。你去哪儿了？"
G["Lo'Gosh is the spirit of the hunter, the animal instinct that kicks in when one smells food or sees one's children in jeopardy. He has always been with us, a part of our Horde, in our instincts and in our blood.\n\nHe has appeared in many forms, both on our world and here. On Azeroth, he is seen as a great white wolf, ferocious and cunning. The night elves call him \"Goldrinn.\"\n\nThey tell of a legendary battle ten thousand years ago, where Lo'Gosh fought off the demon hordes. Do you want to hear about it?"]="Lo'Gosh es el espíritu del cazador, el instinto animal que entra en acción cuando las bestias huelen comida o sienten que sus crías están en peligro. Siempre ha estado con nosotros, como parte de nuestra Horda, en nuestros instintos y en nuestra sangre.\n\nSe ha aparecido en muchas formas, tanto en nuestro mundo como aquí. En Azeroth se le suele ver como a un gran lobo blanco, feroz y astuto. Los elfos de la noche lo llaman \"Goldrinn\".\n\nEllos suelen hablar de una legendaria batalla acaecida hace diez mil años, cuando Lo'Gosh luchó contra las hordas de los demonios. ¿Quieres oír la historia?"
G["Lo-kal..."]="¡Lo-kal..."
G["Lo? Oh. I haven't seen him today. I thought it was very odd. He usually walks me to work in the morning.\n\nHe has a kind heart. It's a shame he looks down on his apprenticeship with Singegruff. He is a very talented smelter.\n\nIf you see him, tell him I missed our walk this morning."]="罗？噢。我今天没看见他。我觉得这事儿很古怪。他每天早晨，都会陪我去工作的。\n\n他有一颗善良的心。他竟然没有好好珍惜自己与拙焰师匠的师徒缘分，这真是太遗憾了。他在金属冶炼上很有天赋。\n\n如果你见到他，请告诉他我今早没有等到他。"
G["Lo? Sure. I've been sent to hunt him down lots of times. Well, him and Syra Goldendraft.\n\nBest places to look for them are either the inn or the Arboretum."]="罗？当然。我已经去找过他好多次了。呃，其实是找他和塞拉·金酿两个人。\n\n他们最常去的地方，就是旅店和百木园。"
G["Load me into that cannon, boy!"]="把我装进炮筒里，伙计！"
G["Load those cannons, ye wretches!"]="把那些炮弹装上，你这可怜虫！"
G["Loatheb. The hideous result of fusing the living plague of the Plaguelands with the bog beasts of Azeroth, Loatheb is said to control the power of healing itself."]="洛欧塞布。据说这个地方的诅咒与艾泽拉斯的沼泽兽缝合而成的怪物拥有控制治疗能量的本领。"
G["Local proximity threat detected. Exiting energy conservation mode."]="检测到威胁。解除节能模式。"
G["Located in Dun Morogh, Gnomeregan has been the gnomes' capital city for generations, though it was recently infested by mutant troggs. In a desperate attempt to retaliate, High Tinker Mekkatorque ordered the emergency venting of the city's radioactive waste tanks. Though the troggs became irradiated, their siege continued unabated and the gnomes were forced to seek refuge in the dwarven city of Ironforge, where the High Tinker now enlists brave souls to help his people reclaim their beloved city."]="位于丹莫洛的科技奇迹城市诺莫瑞根世代以来都是侏儒的主城。最近，一群邪恶的变异食鄂怪侵入了包括侏儒主城在内的多处丹莫洛地区。为了做出殊死一搏来干掉入侵的食腭怪，大工匠梅卡托克命令打开城市中的紧急辐射水箱。侏儒在等待那些食腭怪死亡或者逃跑的同时也在寻找躲避辐射的方法。不幸的是，虽然食腭怪在经过辐射之后感染了毒性——但是它们的攻击没有停止，也没有丝毫的减弱。那些没有被辐射杀死的注入被迫逃离，他们在附近的矮人城市铁炉堡找到了安身之处。大工匠梅卡托克组建了一个智囊团来商议重新夺回他们挚爱的城市的计划。"
G["Locked and loaded!"]="填弹完毕，锁定目标！"
G["Lockpicking"]="开锁"
G["Locksmith"]="锁匠"
G["Locomotion systems operable. Resuming transport,"]="移动系统可运转。恢复传输。"
G["Log'loth og shandai, mortal. Only death is eternal. You will be undone."]="Log'loth og shandai，凡人。只有死亡才能永恒。你将不复存在。"
G["Loganaar said that you would be bringing powerful artifacts from Shadowfang Keep. At first, I questioned the value of these materials."]="洛甘纳尔说你会从影牙城堡带来强大的宝物。一开始，我还在怀疑你能弄些什么东西出来。"
G["Lok narash!"]="¡Lok narash!"
G["Lok'tar $c!  We have need of your services in Alterac Valley.  Shall I add you to the lists?"]="为了部落，$c！奥特兰克山谷需要你。"
G["Lok'tar Illadari!"]="伊利达雷是不可战胜的！"
G["Lok'tar Ogar!"]="部落的荣耀！"
G["Lok'tar Ogar!!"]="力量与荣耀！！"
G["Lok'tar Ogar, brothers."]="Lok'tar Ogar，兄弟们。"
G["Lok'tar ogar!"]="¡Lok'tar ogar!"
G["Lok'tar ogar! Victory or death - it is these words that bind me to the Horde! For they are the most sacred and fundamental of truths to any warrior of the Horde."]="Lok'tar ogar！不胜利，毋宁死——正是这条被所有的部落成员奉为真理的信条促使我加入部落！"
G["Lok'tar ogar! Victory or death - it is these words that bind me to the Horde. For they are the most sacred and fundamental of truths to any warrior of the Horde.\n\nI give my flesh and blood freely to the Warchief. I am the instrument of my Warchief's desire. I am a weapon of my Warchief's command.\n\nFrom this moment until the end of days I live and die - FOR THE HORDE!"]="¡Lok'tar ogar! Victoria o muerte: estas son las palabras que me unen a la Horda, ya que son las más sagradas y fundamentales verdades para cualquier guerrero de la Horda.\n\nEntrego mi cuerpo y sangre libremente al Jefe de Guerra. Soy el instrumento de los deseos de mi Jefe de Guerra. Soy el arma de las órdenes de mi Jefe de Guerra. ¡A partir de este momento y durante el resto de mis días vivo y muero POR LA HORDA!"
G["Lok'tar ogar! Victory, or death!"]="Lok'tar ogar！不胜利，毋宁死！"
G["Lok'tar ogar! We are ready! Onward, brother orc!"]="Lok'tar ogar！我们准备好了！兽人兄弟们，冲啊！"
G["Lok'tar ogar, $n!"]="为了部落的荣耀，$n！"
G["Lok'tar ogar, popo!"]="¡Lok'tar ogar, papi!"
G["Lok'tar ogar, soldier."]="Lok'tar ogar，士兵。"
G["Lok'tar!"]="¡Lok'tar!"
G["Lok'tar!  You look like you need help."]="你似乎需要帮助。"
G["Lok'tar! Have you come to serve the Horde in battle?"]="Lok'tar！你是来协助部落作战的吗？"
G["Lok'tar! Let no one forget the name, $n, a true champion of Orgrimmar!  All hail $n!"]="Lok'tar！所有人都不该忘却这个名字——$n，奥格瑞玛真正的勇者！向你致敬，$n！"
G["Lok'tar! Let us return through that portal we left behind... much work awaits me in Orgrimmar."]="Lok'tar！现在就让我们从刚才我们通过的那道传送门回去吧……在奥格瑞玛还有许多工作在等着我。"
G["Lok'tar! The second tower falls! Destroy the final tower and we will hasten their retreat!"]="Lok'tar！第二座塔楼已经被摧毁了！只要我们解决最后一座塔楼，敌人就不得不撤退了！"
G["Lok'tar! We need your help!"]="Lok'tar！我们需要你的帮助！"
G["Lok'tar, $c, I have important information! There's a war coming at Ahn'Qiraj and we need to get ready for it. I'm here collecting all of the thick leather that I can get my hands on. Right now we have $2070w, but the Warchief has tasked me with the gathering of $2071w. As you can see, I'm a little short."]="$c，我有个重要的消息！安其拉即将爆发一场战争，我们需要为此做准备。我是来收集厚皮的，现在我们已经收集到$2070w块厚皮了，但是酋长要求我收集$2071w块。你看，我就差那么一点了。"
G["Lok'tar, $c. Behind me is the Warchief's Command board containing our leader's instructions to members of the Horde. It will tell you where your skills will best serve the Horde in battle against its foes."]="Lok'tar，$c。在我身后是“酋长的命令”公告牌——我们的领袖向部落的成员们发出指引。它会告诉你，哪里才是你出色战技的用武之地，以更好的帮助部落对抗我们共同的敌人。"
G["Lok'tar, $n!"]="¡Lok'tar, $n!"
G["Lok'tar, $r. I am General Zog, ambassador of the Horde. I am here to keep you apprised of the progress that the mighty Horde is making in their efforts toward the Ahn'Qiraj War. What is it that you want to know?"]="你好，$R。我是部落大使佐格将军。我是来向你通报部落关于安其拉一战的准备工作的进度的。你想知道什么？"
G["Lok'tar, hero. Today I fight with you."]="Lok'tar，英雄。今天，我将与你并肩奋战。"
G["Lok'tar. Don't try anything suspicious around here. If these undead are going to be part of the Horde, they're going to mind themselves under our watch."]="Lok'tar。不要在这里做出任何可疑的行为。如果那些亡灵打算加入部落，他们就得接受我们的监视。"
G["Lok-Narash! Defensive positions!"]="Lok-Narash！防御阵型！"
G["Lok-Narash! Prepare to strike down the outsiders! Warriors, rally!"]="Lok-Narash！准备干掉这些入侵者！战士们，集合！"
G["Lok-Narash! To battle!"]="Lok-Narash！战斗！"
G["Lok-Regar, Kilag!"]="准备接受命令，基拉格！"
G["Lok-Tar! For victory!"]="Lok-Tar！为了胜利！"
G["Lok-tar ogar! This young $r $c has conquered the great Echeyakee. Let $ghis:her; actions show the might of the new Horde!"]="Lok-tar ogar！这个年轻的$r$c战胜了埃其亚基。$g他:她;的行动显示了新部落的力量！"
G["Loken and his iron dwarf minions have ousted the Earthen from Ulduar and taken over the city."]="洛肯和他的铁矮人已经将土灵逐出了奥杜尔，并占领了这座城市。"
G["Loken will never triumph!"]="洛肯必将失败！"
G["Loken will not rest... until the forge is retaken! You change... nothing!"]="洛肯是不会放弃的……他一定会夺回熔炉！你们……什么也无法改变！"
G["Loken!!"]="洛肯！！！"
G["Loken?! That's downright bothersome... We might've neutralized the iron dwarves, but I'd lay odds there's another machine somewhere else churnin' out a whole mess o' these iron vrykul!"]="洛肯？！这下我们碰到大麻烦了……虽然铁矮人已经被全部摆平了，但我敢打赌不知道什么鬼地方还有台机器，正不停向外吐着铁维库人！"
G["Long John Copper, is the Brashtide Crew ready for battle?"]="长牙约翰·库珀，“急浪船帮”做好战斗准备了吗？"
G["Long ago the Shadow Council tried to perform a dark ritual inside Auchindoun.  Their failure created the waste you see around you.  The bones and the spirits of the fallen Draenei now haunt this land.  I was sent to cleanse the tombs of my ancestors, but with so many dangers I must remain here to protect the refugees."]="很久以前，暗影议会在奥金顿之内进行了一次黑暗典礼。他们的失败创造出了你现在所看到的荒野，在那里游荡着无数的骷髅与死去德莱尼人的灵魂。我原本是被派来清理这处先祖之坟墓的，但是因为这里十分危险，我必须继续留在这里保护难民们。"
G["Long ago this land comprised the northern kingdoms of Lordaeron, ruled by King Terenas Menethil."]="曾经，这片土地属于北部王国洛丹伦，由泰瑞纳斯·米奈希尔国王统治。"
G["Long ago, a group of sturdy nomad hunters wandered the world. By a stroke of fate, they were here in Pandaria when the Sundering split apart the continents of Azeroth. The wanderers found themselves trapped in the Townlong Steppes, a harsh and dangerous land."]="很久以前，一群强健的游牧猎手在世界各处游荡。命运和他们开了个玩笑——在艾泽拉斯大分裂发生时，他们刚好来到潘达利亚。这群游荡者被困在了螳螂高原这片荒芜而危险的土地。"
G["Long ago, before the last great war, my father ran the Northridge Lumber Mill. It was his life, and he was committed to it. Then the war came, and as much as it pained him, we had to flee to Stormwind.\n\nWe lost a number of friends and family in those days, and it pains me to know that the Scarlet Crusade has taken the mill for their own ends.\n\nThat's why I've returned."]="在最后一次大战之前，我父亲经营着北山伐木场。那是他的命根子，他把所有的精力都投到了伐木场。战争爆发时，我们忍痛逃到了暴风城。\n\n那些日子里，我们失去了无数朋友，而我们的伐木场也被血色十字军占领了，我对此感到非常心痛。\n\n这就是我回来的原因。"
G["Long ago, before the last great war, my father ran the Northridge Lumber Mill. It was his life, and he was committed to it. Then the war came, and as much as it pained him, we had to flee to Stormwind.\n\nWith the passing of the Scourge and the flight of the Scarlet Crusade, however... Northridge is ours again."]="很久以前，在上一场大战还没开始的时候，我的父亲经营着北山伐木场。那是他的生命，他为之投入了全部的精力。然后战火袭来，我们逃去了暴风城——这个决定令他痛苦万分。\n\n但如今，天灾军团的威胁已经消除，血色十字军也已被击退……北山伐木场终于又回到了我们手中。"
G["Long ago, in a dimension of the cosmos unfathomable to mortal minds, there was born - if such a term can be used for it - a being of such unbelievable power that its very entrance into existence shattered all reality around it.\n\nKnown only as Murmur, it was the essence of sound, and to hear it speak was to know death eternal!"]="很久很久以前，在深不可测的宇宙维度中，一个拥有无上力量的生物诞生了——如果无上能描绘它那强大到难以置信的力量的话。在诞生的瞬间，它爆发出的能量粉碎了周围的一切事物。\n\n它就是摩摩尔，音之精华。听见它的声音就像体验湮灭的痛楚一样！"
G["Long ago, my dryad sisters and I entered these caves to free the tortured spirit of my uncle, Zaetar. However, the corruption that had already spread through these caverns soon overcame us, and we too fell.\n\nWe were destined to wander these passages; the toxins poisoning our minds...\n\nAlthough my spirit may now be at rest, I know that I have failed in my mission. It is a great sadness I must bear..."]="很久以前，我和我的森林女神姐妹们曾进入这些洞穴，想释放我的叔叔扎尔塔倍受折磨的灵魂。但是，已经充斥了所有洞穴的腐化力量很快击败了我们。\n\n我们注定要在此迷失方向；毒素侵蚀了我们的头脑……\n\n尽管现在我的灵魂已经安息，但是我知道我没能完成任务。我要为此承担巨大的悲伤……"
G["Long ago, the Jade Serpent instructed me to purify my spirit and become one with the land, my doubts were vanquished."]="很久以前，睿智的青龙教会我净化自己的灵魂并与大地融为一体，我的疑虑就此被打消了。"
G["Long ago, we wore one piece jumpsuits. Thanks to our innovative tailors, we no longer wear such impractical outfits. You can find these fashion lifesavers in the Trader's Tier."]="以前，我们曾穿过连体衣。感谢灵感不断的裁缝们，我们终于可以脱下那些不实用的制服了。你可以在贸易阶梯找到这些引领时尚的设计师。"
G["Long ago, when my people were slaves of the mogu empire, we were forbidden from carrying any weapon at all. We were not fighters. And no one believed we could fight the mogu without magic and steel."]="很久以前，我的族人还是魔古帝国的奴隶，他们被禁止携带武器。他们不是战士，既无魔法也无钢铁，没人相信他们能对抗魔古族。"
G["Long ago, when the North Wind ruled these peaks alone, a powerful taunka chieftain's brother coveted these lands for himself."]="很久很久以前，北风独自统治着这片险峻的群山。这里还生活着一支强大的牦牛人氏族，酋长的兄弟企图争夺北风的控制权。"
G["Long ago, you were a companion to my people. We gave ourselves to evil and you were forgotten."]="Mucho tiempo atrás, eras $gcompañero:compañera; de los míos. Pero nos pasamos al lado del mal y te olvidamos."
G["Long have I struggled to forgive the prince for his terrible transgressions."]="长久以来，我苦苦地想要宽恕王子的滔天罪行。"
G["Long have I waited for this day, hero. Are you and your allies prepared to bring the Lich King to justice? We charge on your command!"]="我等待这一天的到来已经太久了，英雄。你和你的同袍们是否已经准备好对巫妖王进行正义的审判？我们将在你的命令下向敌人发起冲锋！"
G["Long have my spirit and remains been kept captive here within Maraudon, young $c. The time has given me nothing but ample opportunities to reflect on my mistakes and realize that my jealousy of Remulos was foolish. He attempted to warn and persuade me that my relations with Theradras would bear nothing pure--that only destruction would come from chaos. My brother was right.\n\nBut that does not mean since you have freed me, I am free of penance."]="我的灵魂和残骸被禁锢在玛拉顿很久了，年轻的$c。我在这儿深深反思自己的错误，发现自己对雷姆洛斯的嫉妒是很愚蠢的行为。他尝试告诫我，并劝我说我和瑟莱德丝公主之间的关系只能是纯洁的——一旦关系混乱灾难就会降临。我的兄弟是对的。\n\n但是现在你释放了我，情况就不同了。"
G["Long have we craved your return! Command us in the destruction of the Legion's greatest foes!"]="长久以来我们期盼着您的回归！引领我们去消灭那些燃烧军团的宿敌吧！"
G["Long have we toiled to see our land returned to its former glory, $c. Ever shall we remain vigilant against those who have invaded and defiled Quel'thalas. We will not rest until they are driven from our sight.\n\nLet none exist who stand in the way of the sin'dorei!"]="多年来我们为了保护我们的领土艰苦地战斗着，期盼恢复它往日的荣耀，$c。无论什么时候，我们都会继续警惕着那些侵略和污染奎尔萨拉斯的家伙。我们不会休息，直到他们被彻底赶出我们的视野。\n\n辛多雷是不可战胜的！"
G["Long is the way, and hard, the road you have traveled. Few reach such status amongst our ranks. You are a great friend of the Zandalar empire, $n.\n\nLegendary perhaps... Yes... Perhaps."]="El camino que has recorrido es largo, y duro. Muy pocos consiguen esa consideración en nuestras filas. Eres $gun gran amigo:una gran amiga; del Imperio Zandalar, $n.\n\nQuizás, hasta $glegendario:legendaria;... Sí... Quizás."
G["Long live $n!"]="$n万岁！"
G["Long live the Dark Iron!"]="黑铁万岁！"
G["Long live the Dragonmaw! Die you worthless $r!"]="¡Larga vida a los Faucedraco! ¡Muere, insignificante $r!"
G["Long live the Golden Lotus!"]="金莲教万岁！"
G["Long live the mighty Blackrock Clan!"]="伟大的黑石氏族万岁！"
G["Long time ago, Kartak came to Frenzyheart from mountains. Rakjak fed Kartak big-tongue slaves so now Kartak not eat Frenzyheart."]="很久很久以前，卡塔克翻越群山来到狂心氏族的领地。那时候，拉克亚克用大舌头怪奴隶来喂他，所以现在卡塔克不会找狂心狼獾人的麻烦。"
G["Long time no see, $n. Welcome back."]="Cuánto tiempo sin vernos, $n. Bien $ghallado:hallada;."
G["Long-dead fire, black and smouldering!"]="死寂之火，浓烟蔽日！"
G["Long-lasting, well-crafted items for sale near the Hill! Come one, come all! Time is short, so make haste."]="哨兵岭附近有耐用的好东西在卖啊！都过来看看吧！时间不多了，大家赶快啊。"
G["Longbrow? Does that mean Yi-Mo is a descendant of Zhu?!"]="长眉？难道说，易默是朱的后人？！"
G["Longrunner, your fodder... err, people will be a valuable resource against the vrykul. Did I say resource? I meant, 'ally.'"]="远行者，那些炮火……呃，我是说那些人……他们是对抗维库人的重要资源。啊，我说的是“资源”？好吧，我的意思是“盟友”。"
G["Look - dwarves. Hah! They sulk like prairie dogs in holes in the ground."]="看——那些矮人。哈！他们生气的样子就好像缩在洞里的土拨鼠。"
G["Look Lagnus, I consider you a capable man, but my patience is wearing thin. I know that Muradin is here, can you point me to him or not?!"]="拉格努斯，我一直觉得你是个人材，不过我的耐心正在逐渐消失。我知道穆拉丁在这里，但是你到底能不能带我找到他？！"
G["Look Snowpuff, a $c's come ta save us!"]="¡Mira, Ventonieve! ¡Ha venido $gun:una; $c a rescatarnos!"
G["Look above you; thara dormil dorah..."]="朝上看，Thara dormil dorah……"
G["Look across the aisle to those you would call enemy. Despite the hatred that separates you, there are qualities to respect in your opponent. Their prowess should be acknowledged."]="走廊对面，就是那些被你们视为敌人的家伙。尽管仇恨让彼此疏远，但是他们依然拥有值得你们尊重的品德。他们的勇气就值得钦佩。"
G["Look alive marines!"]="陆战队员，快！"
G["Look alive, dogs! We got an operation to run here!"]="打起精神来，你们这帮蠢货！我们还有任务要执行！"
G["Look alive, lads!  The enemy has been sighted!  Form ranks immediately!"]="小伙子们，保持警惕！敌人已经出现了！迅速列队！"
G["Look alive, lads! Today might be the day we leave this cursed land! O' sweet Ironforge, how I missed ya!"]="振作一点！或许我们今天就能离开这片被诅咒的土地！噢，铁炉堡！我真想家啊！"
G["Look alive, men! There are orcs and worgs about!"]="注意了弟兄们！周围到处都是兽人和座狼！"
G["Look alive, peasant! We've got to get these structures back up!"]="别一副懒散模样！我们必须将这些建筑物修好！"
G["Look alive, soldier! Stormpike Intelligence has reported that a master goblin engineer has been taken prisoner by the Winterax trolls. The Frostwolf dogs are actively trying to rescue him so that they may use his engineered gadgets to destroy us! Do not let that happen."]="提起精神，士兵！雷矛智者报告说冰斧巨魔已经抓住了一名地精工程师。霜狼正试图解救他，以便利用他的工程学制品来摧毁我们！可别让这种事情发生。"
G["Look alive, we've got company!"]="赶快，我们有朋友来了！"
G["Look around and let the devastation sink in, $c. Every last troll that lived here is either dead or has fled to the upper levels.\n\nIt gets worse.\n\nIn an act of desperation, the living Drakkari trolls sacrificed their own animal gods so that they could drink from the blood of the gods and gain untold power. While they succeeded in keeping the Scourge at bay with their newfound strength, the results were catastrophic. The ancient empire of Zul'Drak lies in ruin as proof."]="Mira a tu alrededor y deja que la devastación cause su efecto, $c. Hasta el último trol que vivía aquí está muerto o ha huido a los niveles superiores.\n\nY solo empeora.\n\nEn un acto de desesperación, los trols Drakkari vivos sacrificaron a sus propios dioses animales para poder beber la sangre de los dioses y conseguir un poder increíble. Aunque tuvieron éxito al mantener a raya a la Plaga con su nueva fuerza, los resultados fueron catastróficos. La prueba es que el antiguo imperio de Zul'Drak yace en ruinas."
G["Look around for new paths. Sometimes the fastest way is not the most obvious!"]="四处找找看有没有新路线，有时候最快捷的路线并不是那么显而易见的！"
G["Look around you $c.  You are in rare company to be certain, yet still I think you need to prove yourself.  Hmm, perhaps I shall allow you to aid us in our cause at Arathi Basin.  Would you like that?"]="看看四周，$c。你身边的朋友并不多，我想你需要证明自己的价值。嗯，或许我应该同意你帮助我们在阿拉希盆地作战。你愿意吗？"
G["Look around you, $c!\n\nIsn't it all just beautiful?"]="看看你周围，$c！\n\n这里难道不是非常美丽吗？"
G["Look around you, $r. Appreciate what you see today.\n\nMuch has changed since I first stepped foot into this forest. Wonderful and unexpected changes...."]="Mira a tu alrededor, $c. Disfruta de lo que ves.\n\nMuchas cosas han cambiado desde la primera vez que pisé este bosque. Cambios maravillosos e inesperados..."
G["Look around you, Vol'jin. This land is rich in resources: wood, stone, iron, fuel. And people."]="看看吧，沃金。这里资源丰富：木材、石料、铁矿、原油。还有人口。"
G["Look around you, brothers and sisters. Open your eyes! Look at what they have done to our kingdom!"]="看看周围，兄弟姐妹们，睁开眼睛！看看王国被践踏成了什么样子！"
G["Look around you, servant of the Horde..."]="看看你的周围，部落的仆人……"
G["Look around you, shaman.  Can you see the balance of the elements in the earth, the air, the water and the fire that has touched them all?"]="看看你周围，萨满祭司。你可以看到在大地、空气、水和火焰这些元素之间的平衡吗？"
G["Look around you, younglings. This is Draenor!"]="看看你们的周围，年轻人。这里是德拉诺！"
G["Look around you. See how the waters bring life.\n\nWe are grateful for our blessings, and we rejoice in our people."]="看看四周，清澈的流水就是生命之源。\n\n我们对这上天的恩赐深表感激，也为我们的人民欢欣鼓舞。"
G["Look around. They will all betray you. Flee screaming into the black forest."]="看看你的周围。他们全都会背叛你。尖叫着逃进漆黑的森林。"
G["Look around... business is BOOMIN'!\n\nWhile Gallywix is wastin' time pickin' custom wallpaper for his Pompous Palace in the Azsharan boondocks, I'm makin' twice the coin movin' and shakin' for Big G.\n\nYou heard me: Counting houses, trade halls, construction and maintenance, the war-works, supply lines...\n\nDon't even get me STARTED on transit! Orcs can fight, but they can't move goods; my boys ship it twice as fast for half the cost! Well... when it doesn't blow up along the way, hee.\n\nAnyhow! Take a load off, huh? Enjoy yourself, spend some coin... we've got everything from money changers and laundry services to exotic drinks and fishing trainers."]="看看这里……这里的生意是多么兴旺啊！\n\n当加里维克斯还为他在艾萨拉荒地的花哨宫殿选墙纸的时候，我已经在为老大挣取双倍的利润了。\n\n听我说：数数这里的房子、货栈、各种建筑和维护设施；看看这里的战争工事和补给线……\n\n这一切都还只是刚刚开始！兽人能打仗，但他们不懂得后勤运输。我的人搞运输的速度比他们快两倍，成本却只有他们的一半！好吧……前提是运输途中不出意外。\n\n不管怎样！在这里你可以尽情享受。放松放松，消费一下……我们这里什么都有——兑钱商、洗衣店、异国美酒、钓鱼训练师，你可以享受到一流的服务。"
G["Look at 'em go! Spotless!"]="瞧！一尘不染！"
G["Look at 'em, Ug. You know what those are?"]="乌格索，瞧。你知道他们是谁吗？"
G["Look at Xiao over there. He understands the value of a big belly."]="听到那边晓怎么说了么。他就意识到了大肚子的价值。"
G["Look at all dem boxes.  What in dis box?"]="看啊，这些盒子。它们里面到底有什么？"
G["Look at all that slime. One is flying straight at me!"]="小心那些软泥怪。有一个直冲我过来了！"
G["Look at all the children! They bring such joy to my heart."]="看那些孩子们！他们给我带来了欢乐。"
G["Look at all the explosions!"]="看看那些大爆炸！"
G["Look at all the flowers blooming. Aren't they lovely?"]="瞧瞧那些盛开的鲜花啊，是不是很可爱？"
G["Look at all these adorable animals!"]="快看这些动物，真可爱！"
G["Look at all those ripples. Lots of activity in the water so I should catch a mess of fish today."]="看看水面那些波纹……水里可真热闹，今天我一定能钓很多鱼。"
G["Look at da little one hurtin'!"]="瞧瞧，这会有一点儿疼！"
G["Look at her down there!  Just who does she think she is?"]="看！她以为自己是谁啊？"
G["Look at him! He's always a little crabby in the morning."]="看看他！早上的时候他总是有些脾气暴躁。"
G["Look at how far we've come!  Yesterday we lived in the shadows of civilization... hunted like rats!  But today!  Today... HYJAL BURNS!!!"]="看看我们已经走了多远！昨天我们还活在文明的阴影下……就像过街老鼠！而今天！今天……海加尔正在燃烧！"
G["Look at it, Jon. It's glorious!"]="乔纳森，看看。多壮观啊！"
G["Look at it, Lor'themar. It is certainly Quel'Delar."]="洛瑟玛，看那。的确是奎尔德拉。"
G["Look at me again skeleton. I will rip your skull from your flimsy frame!"]="看着我，骷髅。我要把你的头从脆弱的骨架上拧下来！"
G["Look at me! Do I look like I would order that?!"]="你看看我这样子像是会点这种东西的人吗？"
G["Look at me! You said I would be fine! Do I look fine?"]="你看看我！你跟我说不会有事的！你看我像没事的样子吗？"
G["Look at me, I'm Uther Lightbringer!"]="看着我，我是乌瑟尔·光明使者！"
G["Look at me, I'm Warchief Garrosh!"]="快看我，我是加尔鲁什酋长！"
G["Look at me, peasant. Heirlooms cover my body from head to toe, gifted to me by the greatest heroes Azeroth has ever known.\n\nNow look at yourself.\n\nQuickly, look back at me.\n\nYes, this horse IS made of STARS.\n\nWhat pointless series of tasks befitting a mentally deficient orc have you prepared for me?"]="Mírame, $gplebeyo:plebeya;. Mi cuerpo está cubierto de reliquias, de pies a cabeza, que me han entregado los mayores héroes que Azeroth ha conocido jamás.\n\nAhora mírate.\n\nRápido, vuelve a mirarme.\n\nSí, este caballo está hecho de ESTRELLAS.\n\n¿Qué serie de tareas inútiles propias de un orco retrasado me has preparado?"
G["Look at that handsome grouping of chaotic energies!"]="看那些壮观的混乱能量之流！"
G["Look at that one! He looks... weird."]="看看那位！他看起来……怪怪的。"
G["Look at that!  Near the fruit carts, an ogre.  The fruit vendor is preparing for war..."]="看！水果摊边上有个三层楼高的食人魔。那个水果贩看来想和我们大战一场了……"
G["Look at that!  Someone is fighting Mushgog!"]="看那边！有人在跟姆斯高格打斗！"
G["Look at that. How easy it must have been for Lei Shen to build an empire, for he wielded the power to create worlds."]="快看。难怪雷神这么轻易就建立起了一个帝国，他掌握了创世之力。"
G["Look at that. The little guy left you some purified water."]="看哪。那个小家伙给你留下了一些纯净之水。"
G["Look at that. This old Titan technology is acting like a magnet for the sha."]="看。这种古代泰坦技术会像磁石一样吸引煞魔。"
G["Look at that. Your people revere their ancestors as well. And you cherish the land. We have much in common! Ah, but I see that your ancestors were nomads, whereas we Pandaren prefer the comforts of hearth and home. You'll find few travellers among us."]="看哪。你们的族人也崇敬先祖，珍爱土地。我们的共同点真多！啊，可你们的先祖是游牧民，而我们熊猫人则喜欢待在温暖舒适的家里。很少有人外出远行。"
G["Look at the dust along the floor, these dark halls have not seen footfalls for many centuries."]="看看地上的灰尘，这黑暗的殿堂已有几百年无人踏入了。"
G["Look at the peaceful, kind people of this land. They were born to belong to the Alliance."]="看看生活在这片土地上的平和善良的人们。他们生来就属于联盟。"
G["Look at the size of that thing! That easily has to be the biggest moth I've seen all week."]="看那家伙多大啊！它一定是我这星期见过最大的飞蛾。"
G["Look at the size of these! This one is definitely a breeding male."]="看看它们的体型就知道了！这一定是只成年雄性螳螂妖。"
G["Look at the size of those things! What ARE they?"]="看看那些玩意儿的大小！那是些什么东西？"
G["Look at the size of your head! That should fetch me twice as much of a bounty!"]="哈哈！我可以拿双份的赏金啦！"
G["Look at the sky, $n! It's raining! Should be good for the crops, eh?"]="看看天空，$n！下雨了！对作物生长应该有好处吧？"
G["Look at the wisdom and knowledge of the beast, and you will see yourself. Observe as the owl does, learn cleverness from the sabercat, embody the mighty spirit of the wolf."]="Observa la sabiduría y el conocimiento de la bestia, y te verás a ti $gmismo:misma;. Observa como el búho, aprende la astucia del dientes de sable, encarna el poderoso espíritu del lobo."
G["Look at the wonders of this city! This is magic."]="看看这座神奇的城市！这就是魔法本身。"
G["Look at them go!"]="看着他们离开！"
G["Look at them, $p. They scurry like rats, veering headlong to their doom. Surely Crowley and Bloodfang can see the futility in this!"]="看看他们，$P。他们像老鼠一样来回奔窜，瞎着眼睛朝他们的末日冲过去。克罗雷和血牙肯定知道这是多么没有意义！"
G["Look at them... all they care about is outdoing each other."]="看看他们……他们一心只想超过别人。"
G["Look at these ruins, $p! What sort of empire built them I wonder."]="看看这片遗迹，$p。真不知道是什么样的帝国建造出来的。"
G["Look at these samples! What does it mean? What does it mean? I'm going to need time, time to look at all this information. And I'll need more information. Information I can't get... damn! Think, Laris, think!\n\nWhat are you going to do? What?!\n\nThere has to be a solution!"]="看看这些样本！这意味着什么？这意味着什么？我需要时间来解读这些信息。我还需要更多我无法获得的信息……该死！好好想想，拉里斯，好好想想！\n\n你要做什么？什么？！\n\n必须得有解决的方法！"
G["Look at this - total amateur hour! Doesn't even have a second-stage turbine blade."]="瞧瞧这个——简直太业余了！甚至连二级涡轮叶片都没有。"
G["Look at this astounding dirt! It's so dirt-like!"]="瞧瞧这令人惊讶的泥土！简直太有泥土的样子了！"
G["Look at this blade thrower.  The pride of the orcs... HAH!"]="看看这掷刀车。兽人的荣耀……哈哈！"
G["Look at this devastation, $c! Blood and ash, as far as the eye can see.\n\nBut nature is not so easily put down. With some effort, we may yet coax life from this scorched soil."]="看看这惨状，$c！放眼望去，视线所及到处都是鲜血与灰烬。\n\n但自然不会如此轻易被打败。只要我们做些努力，这片焦灼的土地将会重焕生机。"
G["Look at this devastation. These foothills have never recovered from the campaigns of the second and third wars."]="看看这片狼藉的土地。这片丘陵一直没能从第二次和第三次战争中恢复过来。"
G["Look at this dishonorable creature. You smell of straw."]="看看这个下贱的家伙，满身的稻草味儿。"
G["Look at this land, Mankrik. The Horde and Alliance tear the earth apart just to claw at each other in spite."]="看看这片土地，曼科里克。部落和联盟之间争斗不休，也让这片土地满目疮痍。"
G["Look at this land. Now is the time to be talking about peace and exploration."]="看看这片土地。现在，该是探讨和平，探索秘境的时候了。"
G["Look at this mess. I was told the Barrens would be... barren.\n\nThis jungle appeared overnight and has already swallowed up my camp and choked off the roads!"]="太奇怪了。我听说贫瘠之地非常……贫瘠。\n\n而这片森林在昨天晚上才冒出来，现在却已经吞掉了我的营地，还把道路堵住了！"
G["Look at this mess... The Scourge will pay for this!"]="瞧瞧眼前的惨状……天灾军团会此付出代价的！"
G["Look at this one... standing bravely with earth beneath his feet, thinking to challenge me."]="看看这个东西……勇敢的站在大地之上，以为能够挑战我。"
G["Look at this place!"]="看看这个地方！"
G["Look at this wise guy!"]="看看这个自作聪明的家伙！"
G["Look at this!"]="看看这个！"
G["Look at this! A little farm, right in the middle of a town."]="瞧瞧这个！一个小农场，就在镇子中间。"
G["Look at this, I have been beaten!  I'm going to have to brew up some ideas for next time."]="你看看，我可被打惨了！下次我得好好想几个计划。"
G["Look at those boats! Where are they coming from?!"]="看看那些船！它们从哪而来？"
G["Look at those crazy kids running around.  Not a care in the world."]="看那些四处奔跑的孩子们，他们是多么天真烂漫。"
G["Look at us three. Back to da sands of old Durotar! It be just like old times."]="看看我们三个。又回到了杜隆塔尔的沙滩！就像从前一样。"
G["Look at us, elf. Look at us. Unemployed, destitute, and drinking swill from an establishment in the sewers named after a carrion bird!"]="你瞧瞧我们俩，瞧瞧。失业，穷困潦倒，整天躲在下水道这家以食腐鸟命名的破旅店借酒浇愁！"
G["Look at what $n brought us!  Let's drink up!"]="看$n给我们带来了什么！我们畅饮吧！"
G["Look at what we have here! Another straggler from the orchard..."]="看看我们找到了什么！又一个从果园里跑出来的农夫……"
G["Look at what you have done, death knight! You have brought glory to the Scourge!"]="看看你所取得的成就，死亡骑士！你真是天灾军团的荣耀！"
G["Look at what you made me do!"]="看看你们强迫我做了些什么！"
G["Look at ya mon! You be out here all day tryin' to find em!"]="瞧你！你这一整天都在找它们啊！"
G["Look at you fight; no wonder I turned to drinking."]="瞧瞧你在战斗中的表现，难怪我会染上酒瘾。"
G["Look at you! HAH!"]="看看你！哈！"
G["Look at you! I'm the luckiest boyfriend on the island!!!"]="看到你！我就知道我是这座岛上最幸运的男孩子！！！"
G["Look at you! The picture of serenity. I knew I liked you."]="看呐！多么闲逸的风度。我很喜欢你。"
G["Look at you, child; would-be wielder of souls... you cannot fathom the power that lies at my command!"]="孩子，你想操纵灵魂吗……你还无法理解我所掌握的力量！"
G["Look at you, clean-scale. Do you want the mogu to attack you? Do you want to be their pet?\n\nProtect yourself, $gbrother:sister;. Get your filth on."]="瞧瞧你这副干净的皮囊。你想让魔古族攻击你吗？你想做他们的宠物？\n\n保护好你自己，$g兄弟:姐妹;。快把污物涂在身上吧。"
G["Look at you, you're so skinny! You need to eat more!"]="瞧瞧你，简直瘦得皮包骨头！你得多吃点！"
G["Look behind you, $r. The hive stirs as the land that surrounds us shudders and shakes.\n\nThe time has come for me to fulfill a promise I made a thousand years past. The sands shift once more as the Qiraji plan for war."]="看看你身后，$R。虫巢中的异动使我们周围的土地震动起来。\n\n现在是我们实现一千年前许下的诺言的时候了。沙土飞扬，似乎其拉虫人是在计划开战了。"
G["Look below - some of those thistle bears haven't been consumed yet. We're not too late."]="看下面——还有一些蓟熊活着，我们来得还不算太晚。"
G["Look below! Our continued assaults on the town and crypts have thrown the enemy into disarray. The mogu and the Zandalari already fear the might of the Horde."]="看下面！我们对城镇和墓穴的持续攻击已经令敌人陷入了混乱。魔古族和赞达拉开始害怕部落了。"
G["Look brothers, the Wakener is here!"]="看呐，兄弟们，唤醒者来了！"
G["Look carefully, Lucas. The Light is strong with them. Particularly that one."]="Presta atención, Lucas. La Luz es fuerte en ellos. En particular en $gaquel:aquella;."
G["Look everyone, it's $n! Hurray for $n!"]="大家快看啊，是$n！为$n欢呼吧！"
G["Look fer brittle roots stickin' out of the soil. There's good wood in 'em!"]="脆弱的根茎有时会暴露在土外。那些可是上好的木材。"
G["Look fierce!  You are Kolkar, so act like one!"]="¡Muestra tu ferocidad! Eres $gun:una; Kolkar, así que ¡actúa como tal!"
G["Look for Allen Bright at the sparring ring near the barracks.\nHe and Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen oversee the training of the isle's healers."]="Busca a Allen Fulgente en el círculo de entrenamiento cerca del cuartel.\n\nÉl y el doctor Gustaf VanHowzen supervisan el entrenamiento de los sanadores de la isla."
G["Look for Audrey Burnhep just outside the city, north of the Dwarven District, near the lakeside cabin."]="去城外找奥黛丽·伯恩赫普，就在矮人区北部，湖畔小屋附近。"
G["Look for Brother Karman overseeing training at the combat dummies outside the barracks."]="到兵营外的训练假人处寻找正在监督训练的卡尔曼修士。"
G["Look for Caz Twosprocket at the smithy."]="到铁匠铺去找卡兹·双链。"
G["Look for Faruza.  Last I saw she was standing out front between the stables and the house on the northwest end of town."]="去找法鲁萨。我最后一次见到她时，她正站在马厩和西北方向的房间之间。"
G["Look for Innkeeper Grishka in the Valley of Strength.  Her inn is on the east side, north of the main city gates."]="去力量谷寻找旅店老板格雷什卡。她的旅馆主城门以北东侧的地方。"
G["Look for Innkeeper Pala in the building just south of the Thunder Bluff Bank on the lower rise."]="去中部高地的底层的雷霆崖银行以南的建筑物中可以找到旅店老板帕拉。"
G["Look for Jensen Farran near the archery range."]="到靶场附近去找杰森·法兰。"
G["Look for Nogg's Machine Shop in the Valley of Honor northeast of Red Canyon Mining."]="去红石谷矿业工会东北部的荣誉谷找诺格机械店。"
G["Look for Old Man Barlo out by Silmyr Lake, northeast of Shattrath City."]="去沙塔斯城东北边的希尔米耶湖畔找老渔夫巴尔洛吧。"
G["Look for Runda.\nShe's usually just north of the barracks entrance."]="Habla con Runda.\n\nSuele estar al norte de la entrada del cuartel."
G["Look for Saren, in the Falconwing Square inn.\nYou'll find him upstairs, near the kitchens."]="Busca a Saren en la posada de la Plaza Alalcón.\n\nLo encontrarás en el piso de arriba, cerca de las cocinas."
G["Look for Sayoc and Hanashi at the Valley of Honor inside Arms of Legend.  Watch your tongue around them or Sayoc may decide to give a piece of you as a snack to Grinning Dog."]="去荣誉谷的传说中的装备店中找塞尤克和哈纳什。注意你的言行，否则塞尤克也许会将你作为喂狗的美食。"
G["Look for Tarshaw Jaggedscar in the barracks on the east side of town."]="去城镇东面的兵营找塔绍尔·锯痕。"
G["Look for The Wyvern's Tail, just outside the Hall of the Brave."]="你要找飞龙之尾？就在勇者大厅外面。"
G["Look for Theoden Manners at the top of Lady Proudmoore's tower."]="到普罗德摩尔女士的法师塔顶层去找瑟尔顿·曼勒斯。"
G["Look for Yelmak's Alchemy and Potions.  Find it in the middle of The Drag, west of the huge tree."]="去大树以西的暗巷区中心寻找耶尔玛克药剂店。"
G["Look for a fellow by the name of Milo Geartwinge.  I suppose I'll see what I can do about this cave-in."]="寻找一个名叫米罗·齿针的家伙。看来我能在这件事上帮些忙。"
G["Look for idols south of here at the Deeper and Camp Broketooth."]="去南边的深石窟和断牙营地找神像。"
G["Look for it high up on the west side of the Valley of Strength."]="去力量谷西边的山顶找找看。"
G["Look for my Blacktalon Quartermaster here in the tavern. He can resupply you with any rewards I have given you previously... for a price of course. As you no doubt have noticed, the materials I work with are not at all cheap."]="在酒肆里找到我的黑爪军需官。他可以帮你找回我先前给你的任何奖励……当然是收费的。显然你已经注意到了，我用的材料可是一点儿也不便宜。"
G["Look for the eastern Zeppelin Landing Tower outside of the city to the southeast."]="去城外东南方找东部飞艇塔。"
G["Look for the mounds of glowing stuff on the ground."]="在地面上寻找一堆堆发光的东西。"
G["Look for the orc Varzok atop the city's central mesa, just east of the Flight Master."]="去城中台地的顶上找名叫瓦佐克的兽人，就在飞行管理员东边。"
G["Look for the potion-shaped door to the Agronomical Apothecary in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. It's quite impossible to miss!"]="农艺炼金房位于达拉然西北部的魔法商业区，房间的门呈药水瓶状。你是不可能找错地方的！"
G["Look for the shackles around the edges of the oubliette. There should be three."]="在地牢边上找一些镣铐，应该有三个。"
G["Look here! He left his weapon behind."]="看这里！他丢下了自己的武器。"
G["Look here! It's the history of Zian of the Endless Shadow, a powerful sorcerer who kept the kingdoms in check through terror and darkness."]="看这里！永影巫王提安的历史记录于此。他法力无边，曾将整个帝国都笼罩于恐惧与黑暗之中。"
G["Look here, if you don't tell me about the fire--"]="看看这里，如果你不告诉我有关那次火灾的事情的话——"
G["Look here, lad. I admire your dedication, but I'm not sure how to tell you this... You're an ogre, son."]="听我说。我钦佩你做出的贡献，但我不知道该怎么说……你，你是个食人魔，孩子。"
G["Look how big and ugly he is!"]="看看他有多大多丑！"
G["Look how big that thing is!"]="看那东西有多大啊！"
G["Look how slow your boat go."]="看看你的船走得多慢啊。"
G["Look how they fall, like so many blades of grass in the wind."]="看看他们倒下的样子，活像狂风中的杂草。"
G["Look in the waters that divide this island, but be warned: the stinkhorn striker makes its home in the waters of the river."]="搜索一下将小岛一分为二的河流，但是要多加小心，水里有很多臭角刺鱼。"
G["Look inside the Gallows' End Tavern's main dining room for Austil de Mon.  The tavern is on the southeast edge of Brill."]="去恐惧之末旅店的主餐厅找奥斯蒂尔·德·蒙。酒馆就在布瑞尔城的东南角。"
G["Look inside yourself and cleanse the darkness within."]="看清你的内心，净化其中的黑暗。"
G["Look into my eyes... Find your death within..."]="看着我的眼睛……在这里寻找你的死亡吧……"
G["Look it's the Skyguard!!"]="看，是天空卫队！"
G["Look like, my lady? A vrykul, I suppose. They did not actually show him to me. Ever since The Shadow Vault...."]="模样？他就是个维库人。呃，其实我并没有见过他本人。自从暗影拱顶……"
G["Look lively there, Grizwald."]="格兹沃德，睁大眼睛。"
G["Look lively! Keep firing!"]="打起精神来！继续开炮！"
G["Look lively, mates!"]="放机灵点，伙计！"
G["Look man, I only need to know one thing, where they are."]="朋友，我只想知道一件事，他们在哪里。"
G["Look mon, Alliance filth washed up from Theramore. Kill it!"]="看呐，伙计，又是从塞拉摩来的联盟渣滓。干掉它！"
G["Look no further than Saltheril's little celebration if you're after the enchanter Eredania. She received her invitation a few days ago."]="如果你在找艾雷达妮娅的话，就应该去萨瑟利尔的庆典那里。她几天前收到了邀请。"
G["Look no further than the Lion's Pride Inn in Goldshire.  With a wide selection of ales and soft down beds you, couldn't ask for a better place to rest."]="到闪金镇的狮王之傲旅店去吧。那儿有啤酒和柔软的床铺供你尽情享用，没有比那里更好的休息场所了。"
G["Look out - Dragonmaw ambush!"]="小心——龙喉兽人有埋伏！"
G["Look out - Dragonmaw!"]="警报……龙喉兽人！"
G["Look out - I see another!"]="小心——我又发现一个！"
G["Look out - it's loose..."]="看——它松开了……"
G["Look out - more dwarves attacking from the rear!"]="小心——更多的矮人正从后面攻过来！"
G["Look out - the Alliance is aiding the Wildhammer!"]="注意了——联盟正在帮助蛮锤矮人！"
G["Look out Ragnaros! You're next!"]="小心拉格纳罗斯！你是下一个！"
G["Look out below!"]="小心下面！"
G["Look out for that beam!"]="当心撞上横梁！"
G["Look out for that turtle!"]="小心那只龟！"
G["Look out for the dwarf, Kerik, outside Theramore's smithy.\nHe's a drunkard and a bit free with the explosives, but he's friendly enough and knows his way around a mine."]="Busca al enano, Kerik, en el exterior de la herrería de Theramore.\n\nEs un borracho y se le va un poco la mano con los explosivos, pero es majo y sabe manejarse en una mina."
G["Look out spider!  Here come Lunk!"]="小心蜘蛛！隆克来了！"
G["Look out there. Too many for us to take head on."]="看看外面。敌人太多了，我们对付不过来。"
G["Look out!"]="小心！"
G["Look out!  It's a box-demon!"]="小心！那是个盒子魔鬼！"
G["Look out!  It's an invading $r!"]="¡Mirad! ¡$gUn:Una; $r nos invade!"
G["Look out!  The $n attacks!"]="小心！$n发起了攻击！"
G["Look out!  We're under attack by a $n!"]="小心！我们正在被一个$n攻击！"
G["Look out! Another wave comes!"]="小心！又有敌人冲过来了！"
G["Look out! Here comes Mudmug!"]="当心！泥盏来啦！"
G["Look out! Here they come!"]="小心！他们来了！"
G["Look out! It sounds like more of them!"]="小心！听起来他们数量众多！"
G["Look out! Its friendses are coming!"]="小心！它的同伴过来了！"
G["Look out! Mantid!"]="当心！螳螂妖！"
G["Look out! There's a bee loose and it's on a stinging rampage!"]="当心！有只蜜蜂飞出去啦，它气得想到处蛰人呐！"
G["Look out! We're under attack!"]="当心！我们正在遭受攻击！"
G["Look out, $n!  Enemies ahead!"]="小心，$n！敌人就在前面！"
G["Look out, Fitz, they're coming right for us!"]="小心，好儿子，它们冲过来了！"
G["Look out, he is coming your way!"]="小心，他冲你去了！"
G["Look out, incoming!"]="当心，敌人来了！"
G["Look out, more Dragonmaw. And the Horde is with them!"]="小心，有更多的龙喉兽人杀过来了。还有部落的军队支援他们！"
G["Look out, the Grimtotem are upon us!"]="当心，恐怖图腾的成员快要过来了！"
G["Look out... ball of light!"]="看……发亮的球！"
G["Look out... here comes the deadly Rank 6 $r, $n!"]="¡Cuidado! Aquí viene $gel:la; $r letal de rango 6, ¡$n!"
G["Look out... the night elves are back!"]="留神……暗夜精灵回来了！"
G["Look over here, $c! I got somethin' for ya. Just what ya need. It's soap, right... and it's on a rope! No offense, $G man:honey;, but yer a little ripe, know what I'm sayin'?"]="看这里，$c！我这里有样东西给你，你绝对需要。是块肥皂，是的……而且系在一根绳子上！我没有要冒犯的意思，$G先生:甜心;，但是我相信你知道我在说什么？"
G["Look sharp troops! Varedis is known for conducting surprise inspections."]="精神点，士兵们！瓦雷迪斯就喜欢突击检查。"
G["Look sharp! They're closing in on our heels!"]="保持警惕！他们从后方包抄过来了！"
G["Look sharp, $r.\n\nIt's life or death out here!"]="保持警惕，$r。\n\n生命在这里显得尤其脆弱！"
G["Look sharp. These woods are crawling with lieutenants of fire."]="注意。这片林地里充斥着火焰的仆从。"
G["Look squire, yon maiden has lost her purse to the sulfurous waters of the Golakka Hot Springs."]="看啊，侍从，那位少女的荷包掉在了葛拉卡温泉的硫磺水中。"
G["Look there - a vision within the torrent! Is this what Go'el longed for most? Peace with his enemies - an end to the constant warring of his world?"]="看那边，漩涡中有一个幻象！那就是古伊尔长久以来的期望吗？和平……摒弃敌意，结束连绵不绝的战争？"
G["Look there!  It looks as though the Twilight Cultists have brought the Old Gods and their corruption to Wyrmrest.  Hold on tight!"]="看那边！暮光教徒好像将上古之神以及他们的腐蚀也带到了龙眠神殿。坚持住！"
G["Look there! The Krom'gar balloon is heading towards the grove! We must hurry!"]="看那儿！克罗姆加热气球朝林地飞去了！我们得赶快！"
G["Look there, 'Linda! What in the..."]="看那儿，琳达！是什么……"
G["Look there, fleshling! Salhadaar's conduits! He's keeping well fed...."]="看那边！萨哈达尔的管道！他一直吃得很不错嘛……"
G["Look there, near the map table! The Stormpike Battle Master holds the Alliance battle plans!"]="看那边，地图桌附近！联盟进攻计划在雷矛战斗大师手里！"
G["Look through the spyglass."]="透过望远镜看。"
G["Look to the seas, as your doom comes with the swell of tides."]="瞧瞧波涛汹涌的大海，潮水高涨的时刻就是你的末日。"
G["Look to the southeast and you will see the thane upon the platform near Gjonner the Merciless when he shows himself. Let him come down.  Stay within the ring of Valhalas."]="往东南方看，领主很快就会出现在残忍的亚纳尔附近的平台上。等他自己下来。不要离开瓦哈拉斯的竞技场。"
G["Look to this fallen dragon, $r. The might of the Horde is unquestionable!"]="看看这条被干掉的龙的脸，$r。部落的强大是毋庸置疑的！"
G["Look to this ravaged field and know the power that the elements hold, $r."]="看看这片被蹂躏的土地，你就知道元素的力量了，$r。"
G["Look up to the heavens, $c. The Dragonflights have not been seen in this area for a thousand years! Those Qiraji are up to something, I just know it!"]="仰望天空吧，$c。这片区域已经有一千年没有见过龙族了！我就知道，那些其拉虫人在策划着什么阴谋！"
G["Look upon me and you see death incarnate, the unmaker of worlds."]="面对我，面对死亡的化身，世界的毁灭者！"
G["Look upon the field, Highlord. The Lich King has halted your advance completely and won the upper hand!"]="大领主，认清眼前的局势吧。巫妖王已经彻底封锁了你的前路，占据了上风。"
G["Look upon the true face of death, and know that your end comes soon!"]="凝视死亡的真正面孔吧，你们的末日就要来了！"
G["Look upon the world, Cliffwalker, and see the might of the Horde!"]="仔细看着这一切，峭壁行者，见证部落的力量！"
G["Look upon what you have accomplished, soldiers! Even the Legion's most fearsome machines are no match for the Horde!"]="士兵们，干得好！就算是燃烧军团最可怕的机甲都不是部落的对手！"
G["Look what I have to work with. Szabo can perform miracles?\n\n<Szabo sighs>\n\nYes, yes. Szabo thinks he can do something with you."]="看看和我共事的都是什么人。苏扎博能弄出奇迹来吗？\n\n<苏扎博叹了口气>\n\n是的，是的，苏扎博认为他能为你做些事。"
G["Look what Wikky found!"]="看看光板儿找到什么了！"
G["Look what the cat dragged in. What can I get you, $n?"]="看看谁来了……我能为你做点什么吗，$n？"
G["Look what the winds blew to my door! Take a break from your adventures and rest, $c."]="瞧啊，是什么风把你给吹来了！快进来好好休息一下吧，$c。"
G["Look what they did to my boy."]="看看他们对我的孩子做了什么!"
G["Look what they've done to me!"]="看看他们都对我做了什么！"
G["Look what's come to play."]="看看这是谁来了。"
G["Look what's lost its way..."]="啧啧，迷路的小羊羔……"
G["Look who's here, it's Raliq the drunk... His momma's so fat dragons won't eat her..."]="看这是谁啊，醉鬼拉里克……他的妈妈太胖了，连龙都不要吃她……"
G["Look who's here.  It's $n, our top gun."]="瞧，是$n，我们的王牌飞行员。"
G["Look with your eyes. What do you see? What do you feel?"]="用你的眼睛去看。你看到了什么？你感觉到了什么？"
G["Look!"]="看！"
G["Look! Behind you! A mirror!"]="快看！你身后！镜子！"
G["Look! Frostwyrms, to the south!"]="小心！冰霜巨龙从南边过来了！"
G["Look! Here comes Miss Fanny right now!"]="快看！范妮小姐正好来了！"
G["Look! Is that us? We think it's us. A bit older, maybe?"]="看啊！那是我们吗？我们觉得那是我们。只是好像有一点老？"
G["Look! It's Ji Firepaw and $p!"]="看！是季·火掌和$p！"
G["Look! Look! I caught something! Aww....it's just a stinky ol' boot."]="快看！快看！我抓到鱼了！呃……这是谁的臭鞋？"
G["Look! Over there at the tunnel wall!"]="看！在隧道那边！"
G["Look! Suna's tracks lead into the village ahead."]="看。孙娜的足迹往前面的村子去了。"
G["Look! That must be Kekek as a mighty warrior! See? What Kekek tell you?"]="看啊！那一定是强大的战士科科！看到了吧？科科说什么来着。"
G["Look! There's a mook-mook right there!"]="瞧！那边就有一只土拨鼠！"
G["Look! What's a frostwyrm doing here? It's coming straight for us."]="瞧！冰霜巨龙！它冲我们来了！"
G["Look, \"Chen Stormstout,\" we all can't be heroes, running from our responsibilities, tromping around the Dread Wastes, saving the world. Some of us are \"Artists.\""]="Escucha, \"Chen Cerveza de Trueno\". No todos podemos ser héroes, huir de nuestras responsabilidades, viajar por el Desierto del Pavor y salvar el mundo. Algunos somos... \"artistas\"."
G["Look, $c. Here's the thing. Toys and lights and bundles of holiday herbs don't make THEMSELVES, you know. So ENOUGH with the Helper summoning, PLEASE."]="你瞧，$c。事情是这样的。玩具啊，彩灯啊，还有各种节日草药是不会自己做出来的，你知道吧？所以，别再召唤小助手了，拜托你！"
G["Look, $n, the hourglass has revealed Nozdormu!"]="Mira, $n, ¡el reloj de arena ha mostrado a Nozdormu!"
G["Look, $n. The beast stirs from its lair!"]="看，$n。那头野兽在它的巢穴里醒过来了！"
G["Look, $r.  I see man and orc, chained up as slaves, mining Nespirah's pearls.  And I see naga holding the whip.  Something must be done."]="Mira, $c. Veo un hombre y un orco encadenados como esclavos, recogiendo las perlas de Nespirah. Y veo un naga con un látigo. Hay que hacer algo."
G["Look, Anren! $n has come to help us!"]="看，安伦！$n来帮我们了！"
G["Look, I don't know, okay? I don't know!\n\nI just got paid to make rockets that deliver an airborne chemical payload, and that's what I did. Job's done, pal. They're all made, packaged, and sent off. I got the money and I was TRYING to enjoy myself a little when you started chasing me all over town.  I don't have any more of that chemical and I don't know what it was."]="Mira, no lo sé, ¿vale? ¡No lo sé!\n\nMe pagaron para hacer cohetes para entregar una carga química aérea, y eso hice. Trabajo hecho, $gamigo:amiga;. Están hechos, empaquetados y enviados. Me dieron el dinero y estaba INTENTANDO disfrutarlo cuando empezaste a perseguirme por toda la ciudad. No tengo más de esa carga y no sé lo que era."
G["Look, I see some of Suna's things! She must have made camp here. But where is she?"]="我看见孙娜的东西了！她肯定在这里宿过营。可是她去哪儿了呢？"
G["Look, I'll sell you shields today, but no maces. The last thing I want is for some innocent to get brained by one of my weapons."]="今天我只出售盾牌，不卖锤子。我不希望看到无辜的市民被我出售的武器所伤。"
G["Look, I'm sorry, I really am, but all of my food is fresh!"]="呃，听到这样的消息真让我难过呀，但是我出售的食物都是新鲜的！"
G["Look, Uyen, it's a $c. You here to help, $g mister : miss; $c?"]="Mira, Uyen, es $gun:una; $c. ¿Has venido a ayudarnos, $gseñor:señora; $c?"
G["Look, a stranger."]="Mirad, $gun extraño:una extraña;."
G["Look, don't ask me how I found it. Just toss  it onto that big blue bonfire and destroy Yngwie's soul before it's too late!"]="听着，别管我是怎么找到它的。趁还来得及，快把它扔到那蓝色的大篝火里，毁掉英格维的灵魂！"
G["Look, here he comes now! How was the brewery, Uncle?"]="看，他回来了！酒厂怎么样，叔叔？"
G["Look, here's the deal. You keep yammerin' and I stop hammerin'."]="要不这样吧。你接着嚎，我不干了。"
G["Look, if I've told ya once, I've told ya a hundred times: WE CANNOT HELP YOU!"]="看，我都跟你说过几万次了，我再告诉你一次：我们帮不了你！"
G["Look, if you want to go talk to those engineers on the outer ring of the Rogues' Quarter, it's your hide."]="听着，如果你要去见盗贼区外环区域的那些工程师，那就看好标记。"
G["Look, in my business, discretion is important. I shouldn't be talking about this at all."]="你瞧，干我这份工作的人，谨慎是第一要诀。我本来是不该提这事儿的。"
G["Look, it $n!"]="看，是$n！"
G["Look, it works."]="看，起作用了。"
G["Look, it's $n!"]="快看，是$n！"
G["Look, it's $n, savior of Binan Village!"]="¡Mira, es $n, $gel salvador:la salvadora; de la Aldea Binan!"
G["Look, it's not my fault that Tinky took off. This thing's her baby... I've just watched her keep it going on spit and glue."]="你瞧，又不是我让丁奇跑掉的。这玩意儿是她的宝贝……她不费吹灰之力就能让它运转起来的。"
G["Look, just at the water's surface!"]="看水面！"
G["Look, look! Weird, bumpy carrot!"]="看，看！古怪、畸形的胡萝卜！"
G["Look, look, it's okay! It's just a tiny little glitch. See?"]="看哪，看哪，没事了！只是个小得不能再小的小故障。看到没有？"
G["Look, man, they didn't live to be writin' about it, okay?!"]="要知道，他们可不是为了写这个而活的，你说是吧？"
G["Look, mom! A spirit! See? See?"]="看，妈妈！一个幽灵！看见了吗？看见了吗？"
G["Look, mortal, upon the instrument of your undoing. (The Hammer, hand of the Gods Below.) Forged of molten blood... (...gift of the master. His gift!) Shaped upon the Last Altar of Storm."]="看哪，凡人，这件造物便是你们的末日。（这战锤，是下界诸神之手。）用熔火之血铸造……（……主人的礼物。他的礼物！）在最后的风暴祭坛锻造。"
G["Look, one of the eggs hatched!"]="看，有一个蛋孵化了！"
G["Look, pretty girl, look! The nice $r brought some kafa treats for you!"]="¡Mira, guapa, mira! ¡$gEl simpático:La simpática; $r ha traído unos dulces de kafa para ti!"
G["Look, slave thing... Goregek got stung by big bad wasp queen once. Goregek all done with wasps."]="听着，奴隶……格利基克被那只坏心肠的蜂后蜇过。所以啊，格利基克才不要招惹它们。"
G["Look, someone's attacking Sentinel Hill. C'mon guards, you just hafta win!"]="小心，有人正在进攻哨兵岭。卫兵们，一定要打败敌人！"
G["Look, stranger, I'll tell you the same thing I told the honorable Lorewalker...\n\n<Mann leans in closer with each word, her eyes widening.>\n\nI. Have. No. Jade!"]="Mira, $gforastero:forastera;, te digo lo mismo que le dije al honorable eremita...\n\n<Mann se va acercando a cada palabra que pronuncia y abre los ojos cada vez más.>\n\n¡No. Tengo. Jade!"
G["Look, sweetheart.  No one's talking about storming Tempest Keep ourselves, but when we see a target of opportunity we have to take it."]="你瞧，甜心。我们没有人想要直接进攻风暴要塞，但要是机会就在眼前，为何不去拿下呢？"
G["Look, the warchief's sent us some entertainment!"]="看啊，酋长给我们送来了娱兴节目！"
G["Look, there! By Hive'Regal! Is that... a sandworm?!"]="看那儿！雷戈虫巢那儿！那是……沙虫吗？！"
G["Look, there's $n!"]="¡Mira, ahí está $n!"
G["Look, there's a weed now! Go pull it!"]="看，那儿长了一棵草！去拔掉它！"
G["Look, up ahead - an Alliance bomber!"]="看，正前方——联盟的轰炸机！"
G["Look. A stranger. I wonder if $g he's : she's; come to save us from the yaungol."]="看呐，是个陌生人。不知道$G他:她;是不是来帮我们摆脱野牛人的。"
G["Look. You don't even WANNA know the sorta stuff I could teach ya.\n\nSeriously. It'd melt yer brain. Go play nice somewhere else."]="听着，你不会想知道我到底掌握着什么。\n\n别以为我在开玩笑。那种力量能融化你的大脑。去别的地方，找些好玩的事情吧。"
G["Lookie here, ma, it's $n. We was just talkin' 'bout you."]="妈，快看是谁来了，是$n。我们刚才正谈论你呢。"
G["Lookie what Zebu'tan got for you! Roses for da rose!"]="看看塞布坦要送你什么！玫瑰赠佳人！"
G["Lookin' for some punishment?"]="想受惩罚吗？"
G["Lookin' good, kid.\n\nWhat's the word? Up for some trainin'?"]="Tienes buen aspecto, $gtío:tía;.\n\n¿Qué te cuentas? ¿Quieres entrenar un poco?"
G["Lookin' mighty cris, me bucko!  Ye pillage a fat sutler?  Best ye spread da wealth... don't be a craven choke puppy, mon!"]="朋友，瞧你那副得意忘形的模样！你是不是从哪个富商那儿抢到什么好东西了？财富是要大家分享的……朋友，别小气嘛！"
G["Lookin' to be an engineer, eh? Well, by Muradin, ye've come to the right place!"]="Quieres ser $gingeniero:ingeniera;, ¿eh? ¡Bien, por Muradin, has venido al lugar adecuado!"
G["Lookin' to scrap?"]="想要打架吗？"
G["Lookin' to take a gryphon ride, eh? Dungar keeps his birds up on the rampart in the Trade District. Just remember to hold on tight!"]="你需要租用一只狮鹫进行飞行，是吗？杜加尔就在贸易区的城墙上，他那里有很多狮鹫，记着飞行的时候要抓紧哦！"
G["Looking around for help, %s sighs."]="%s环顾四周，却发现没有人愿意帮助自己，只得叹了口气。"
G["Looking around, %s frowns at what he considers the overreactions of his compatriots."]="%s环顾四周，皱了皱眉头，觉得同事们的反应明显过激了。"
G["Looking at these energy levels, Shaffar was set to make a killing!"]="啧啧，看这能量等级，沙法尔准备大开杀戒了！"
G["Looking for Diya, wandering among the images around the Seat of the Naaru. She will be more than happy to help you."]="如果你要找蒂亚，她经常在纳鲁之座的幻象中流连。她一定很愿意帮助你。"
G["Looking for Shenthul of the Shadowswift Brotherhood, huh?  In The Drag across from Droffers and Son Salvage look for a tunnel leading down into the Cleft of Shadow."]="想找迅影兄弟会的申苏尔，是吗？去暗巷区，过了杜佛斯回收店之后就可以找到通往暗影裂口的通道。"
G["Looking for a lapidary? Our jewelcrafters are in the Exodar, using the materials they have uncovered to work wonders. Speak with Farii when you arrive."]="在找宝石工匠吗？埃索达的珠宝匠们用双手雕琢出精美的工艺品，到那边找法里谈谈吧。"
G["Looking for a professions trainer?\n\nThe zen master trainers can be found all across Pandaria. Tell me who you are looking for.\n\nIf you cannot find the person you seek here in Pandaria, you may also seek professions masters in your home city. They should also be able to improve your skill in your craft."]="在找专业训练师？\n\n在潘达利亚各地都能找到禅师级训练师。告诉我你要找哪位吧。\n\n如果你无法在潘达利亚找到要找的人，那就回主城找专业大师吧。他们应该也能帮你提高手艺。"
G["Looking for a ride?"]="在找坐骑吗？"
G["Looking for a tabard?"]="想要购买战袍？"
G["Looking for an Arena Battlemaster? You can find them on the road between towns, or in the capitals.\n\nYou can bind here, at me. I can also teleport you to one of the capitals."]="你在寻找竞技场管理员吗？他们在城镇之间来回行走，或是呆在主城。\n\n你可以将炉石绑在这儿。我还能将你传送到任意主城去。"
G["Looking for food and brew, stranger? We've got it right here at Halfhill Market."]="¿Buscas comida y cerveza, $gforastero:forastera;? Pues aquí en el Mercado del Alcor tenemos de eso."
G["Looking for general goods? Bonni will have what you need. She sells her wares at the Golden Lantern. I will mark the location on your map."]="想买杂货？伯妮那儿应该有你要找的东西。她就在金色神灯卖杂货。我会在你的地图上标出位置。"
G["Looking for general goods? Marli Two-Toes will have what you need. He is located inside summer's rest. I will mark the location on your map."]="想买杂货？胼趾马利那儿应该有你要找的东西。他就在夏之眠。我会在你的地图上标出位置。"
G["Looking for meat? I've got plenty right here.\n\nOn my grill, I mean."]="你想吃肉？我这里有很多。\n\n我的意思是，在我的烤架上。"
G["Looking for some brew, eh? The Keggary is the place to go for fine ales! I'll mark it on your map."]="在找啤酒吗？烈酒窖有最香醇的美酒！我会在你的地图上标出位置。"
G["Looking for some brew, eh? Well, there are two brewmasters who wander around the city selling their excellent ales.\n\nIf you don't run into them, then Hara Alebelly up at the Nightingale Lounge or Sarya Teaflower in the inn can fix you right up."]="在找啤酒吗？好的，有两名酒仙在城市里徘徊，出售优良的啤酒。\n\n如果你没有遇见他们，夜莺旅馆的哈兰·酒腹或旅店的萨娅·茗流可以帮你安排好一切的。"
G["Looking for some training, eh? I could train you better then anyone in Stormwind but the guard prohibits it. I guess you will have to settle for one of those has beens hanging out around the Barracks or at the Pig and Whistle Tavern in Old Town."]="想要接受训练？我可以把你训练成暴风城最好的战士，但是守卫是不能这么做的。我想你得去兵营或者猪和哨声旅店，找些合适的人来对你进行训练。"
G["Looking for something to eat, $c?\n\nOr just a place to rest your weary bones for a while?"]="想吃点儿什么吗，$c？\n\n还是你只想找个地方放松一会儿？"
G["Looking for the old steam tonks?\n\nWell, we've got some new ones for you to enjoy.\n\nNormally, it would cost two tokens to use a tonk remote.  But because of your military service, you get a discounted rate of one token.\n\nWe at the Darkmoon Faire thank you for your service."]="在找旧的蒸汽坦克吗？\n\n好吧，我们现在有些新的货色了。\n\n通常情况下，使用坦克遥控器要花费两个代币。但由于你曾经在部队服过役，所以能享受一个代币的优惠。\n\n我们暗月马戏团的成员非常感谢你所做的贡献。"
G["Looking for the perfect Winter Veil gift, $c, or are you just here to treat yourself?"]="你在寻找最棒的冬幕节礼物吗，$c，还是想要好好犒劳自己一番？"
G["Looking for these???? You'll never have em!"]="想找这些？？？？你永远都不可能得到它们的！"
G["Looking for this: [Red Scepter Shard]? Come and get it..."]="你在找这个[红色节杖碎片]吗？过来取吧……"
G["Looking over, you see the obsidian-flecked mud that you collected from the lava beds.  This will be used to color your disguise."]="往旁边看去，映入眼帘的是你从熔岩层收集来的黑曜斑点软泥。这些将被用来为你的伪装服染色。"
G["Looking through the portal only nets you an eye full of sand.  A pool of water surrounded by desert ruins is all that you can make out.  Where could this portal lead?"]="向传送门的另一侧望去，你满眼却只看到黄沙。只能分辨出沙漠废墟当中的一池水。这传送门是通向哪里的呢？"
G["Looking to be a great warrior?  War does not make one great.  Still, you will find our great warrior trainers on the Warriors' Terrace, overlooking the rest of the Trader's Tier."]="想成为一名伟大的战士吗？战争不会让你变得伟大。尽管如此，你可以在战士平台找到我们伟大的战士训练师，战士平台就在贸易阶梯的上方。"
G["Looking to find the Anglers Quartermaster? That would be Nat Pagle. You can find him at the Anglers Wharf in Krasarang Wilds.\n\nLet me mark the location on your map for you."]="垂钓翁军需官？看来你要找的人是纳特·帕格。他就在卡桑琅丛林的渔人码头。\n\n让我为你在地图上标出位置。"
G["Looking to fly somewhere?  Anette Williams, in the western part of town, can get you there on one of her trained bats."]="想要飞到别处去？安内特·威廉姆斯在镇子西部，她训练有素的蝙蝠能满足你的要求。"
G["Looking to learn how to use a new weapon?  Find Sayoc and Hanashi inside Arms of Legend in the Valley of Honor."]="想学习如何使用新武器？去荣誉谷的传说中的装备店中找塞尤克和哈纳什吧。"
G["Looking to learn how to work an anvil and hammer, eh?  Karn Stonehoof can teach you how.  He has a smithy set up on the lower rise by the pond."]="你想知道如何用铁砧和锤子制作东西吗？卡恩·石蹄可以教你这些。他是个铁匠，就在中部高地的水池旁。"
G["Looking to rush to your death at the broken pillar? You're all alone in that one."]="你想去破柱子送死啊？那你自己去吧。"
G["Looking to take a ride on a gryphon, now are ye?  Gryth Thurden is the one ye'll want to be seeing about that.  \nYe can find him on the eastern side of The Great Forge in the middle of Ironforge."]="Quieres dar una vuelta en grifo, ¿verdad? Gryth Thurden es quien puede ayudarte. \n\nPuedes encontrarlo en la parte oriental de La Gran Fundición en el centro de Forjaz."
G["Looks dead to me. Not much use to us like this. You'd better go back and tell Krog what happened."]="好像是挂了，你最好回去告诉克罗格这里发生了什么。"
G["Looks good for you...and bad for me."]="对你来说不错……对我则相反。"
G["Looks good so far."]="目前看来还不错。"
G["Looks just like all the other titan archives me lads have found... only older... and bigger."]="看起来跟我们找到的其它泰坦档案库也没什么不同嘛，只不过旧了点……大了点。"
G["Looks just powerful enough to carry one gnome.  Maybe two."]="看上去，它足以承载一名侏儒，也许还能承载两个。"
G["Looks like $n passed out. What should we do, Tirion?"]="$n好像晕过去了。我们该怎么办呢，提里奥？"
G["Looks like I found us a savory and clean piece of dirt! Tonight we eat like kings, Mr. Penguin! Of course I'll share it with you! You're my best friend!"]="看来我给咱们找到了一块可口又干净的泥巴！今晚我们将吃得像皇帝一样，企鹅先生！我当然会与你分享！你可是我最好的朋友！"
G["Looks like I left you earthbound!"]="看来你被束缚在地面上了！"
G["Looks like I made it just in time!"]="看起来我来的正是时候！"
G["Looks like I need more practice!"]="看来我还需要更多的练习！"
G["Looks like I owe you another one."]="看来我又欠了你一份人情。"
G["Looks like I picked a bad day to stop drinking."]="看来今天不宜戒酒。"
G["Looks like I picked the wrong day to quit mana tapping..."]="我似乎选择了个错误的日子来戒除法力吸取……"
G["Looks like I picked the wrong day to stop killin' fel orcs."]="看来今天不是个戒杀兽人的好日子。"
G["Looks like I'll have to get my drink elsewhere."]="看上去我得去其它地方喝酒了。"
G["Looks like I'm an underachiever."]="我似乎不够强力啊。"
G["Looks like I'm doing this myself. Good!"]="看来我得亲自动手了。很好！"
G["Looks like I'm in the market for a new assistant."]="看来我得找一个新助手了。"
G["Looks like Skarr has found his next challenger!  Wouldn't want to be in that poor fool's shoes!"]="似乎斯卡尔已经找到了下一个挑战者！想取代他的位置吗！"
G["Looks like a last ditch effort by the stone troggs. Your destination is just around the corner!"]="看起来，这是石头穴居人最后的一波攻击了。你的胜利已经近在眼前了！"
G["Looks like a storm's coming in, Scruffy..."]="暴风雨就要来了，脏脏……"
G["Looks like dis one has a bit of a sting!"]="看来这个会让人感到刺痛！"
G["Looks like he sprung a leak!"]="它好像被打漏了！"
G["Looks like he's about to explode!"]="看样子，他就要爆炸了！"
G["Looks like he's got a little bit o' that water stuck in his gills. I'll just scoop some of this up..."]="看起来他的鳃里有点儿水，我得弄一些出来……"
G["Looks like it's going to be one of those days."]="似乎昨日就要重现。"
G["Looks like it's just you, me, and those two Earthen Ringers over at the mine. Let's work fast, $n, before we're discovered."]="看样子，这个矿洞里只有你、我和那两个大地之环成员。我们要加快速度，$n，在被发现前完成任务。"
G["Looks like it's time for the grunts to clean out the Drag and the Cleft of Shadow again."]="看样子，现在已经是再次清理暗巷区和暗影裂口的时候了。"
G["Looks like it's time for the guards to clean out Old Town again."]="看样子，该是让卫兵再次清理旧城区的时候了。"
G["Looks like it's time to Randall P. jump."]="兰达尔·P·沃克看来该跳跃了。"
G["Looks like it's time to let you out of this cage."]="看上去该把你从笼子里放出来了。"
G["Looks like me boys need a hand!"]="看来我的伙计们需要帮手啊！"
G["Looks like my Sugar Beets still need more water! Turn back!"]="看起来给我的甜菜浇的水还不够！赶快回去！"
G["Looks like my fuse... went out..."]="看来我的导火索……烧到头了……"
G["Looks like my work here is done. Report back to the holo-image of Ameer over at the transponder."]="我在这里的工作大约已经完成了。去发射器那里向阿米尔的影像报告吧。"
G["Looks like somebody's getting a special delivery."]="看来这是给某人的特别快递包裹。"
G["Looks like that hurt!"]="看上去就很疼！"
G["Looks like the Furlbrow's were murdered..."]="看来法布隆一家遭到了杀害……"
G["Looks like the Scourge have hit the area ahead pretty bad..."]="看来前面的区域已经被天灾军团清扫过了……"
G["Looks like the Southsea Freebooters are heavily entrenched on the coast. This could get rough."]="好像有南海海盗在这附近出没，这样事情就有点麻烦了。"
G["Looks like the battle's about to get under way, that's my cue to leave. We'll have to pick this up later."]="战斗即将开始，我该离开了。另找时间继续我们的谈话吧。"
G["Looks like the crew here is in trouble."]="这里的船员遇到麻烦了。"
G["Looks like the deck swabbing assignments from the day of the battle."]="看来在战斗打响的那天还有清洗甲板的指派。"
G["Looks like the king got himself a new court jester!"]="看来国王又有了一个新的宫廷小丑！"
G["Looks like the last of the goods we've collected are shipping out to Silithus over the next $2113w days. And once that's done, someone will have to come along and ring the gong on the Scarab Dais, outside of Ahn'Qiraj, to open the gates. That's when our bandages will come in handy."]="似乎所有的物资都将在接下来的$2113w天内运抵希利苏斯。一切就绪后，某位英雄将敲响甲虫墙上的铜锣，打开安其拉的大门。那时，我们收集的绷带就能派上用场了。"
G["Looks like the last of the goods we've collected is going to be shipped out to Silithus sometime in the next day. And once that's done, someone will have to come along and ring the gong on the Scarab Dais, outside of Ahn'Qiraj, to open the gates. That's when our bandages will come in handy."]="似乎所有的物资都将在明日运抵希利苏斯。一切就绪后，某位英雄将敲响甲虫墙上的铜锣，打开安其拉的大门。那时，我们收集的绷带就能派上用场了。"
G["Looks like the mook-mooks went away. For now. You should go talk to boss Mudclaw."]="看来那些土拨鼠逃跑了，至少现在是这样。你该去和泥爪老大谈一谈。"
G["Looks like there be only $2113w more days left to fish until all this here war materiel is shipped over to the Silithus desert mon. Then they's gonna be getting' it all ready, and someone is gonna have to ring that gong down south of Cenarion Hold there to open them gates and be startin' the war."]="我们似乎只须再等$2113w天了，所有的战争物资将被运往希利苏斯沙漠。一切准备就绪之后，将会有人敲响塞纳里奥要塞南边的铜锣，打开安其拉之门，拉开战争的序幕。"
G["Looks like there be only one more day left to fish until all this here war materiel is shipped over to the Silithus desert mon. Then they's gonna be getting' it all ready, and someone is gonna have to ring that gong down south of Cenarion Hold there to open them gates and be startin' the war."]="我们似乎只须再等一天了，所有的战争物资都将被运往希利苏斯沙漠。一切准备就绪之后，将会有人敲响塞纳里奥要塞南边的铜锣，打开安其拉之门，拉开战争的序幕。"
G["Looks like they couldn't handle the taste of Alliance steel. Good work, $n."]="看来他们抵挡不住联盟的利剑了。干得好，$n。"
G["Looks like they found their way back home.  I'm relieved.\n\nYou came back, too!  Are you interested in joining us?"]="看样子，他们已经找到了回家的路。我终于放心了。\n\n你也回来了！有兴趣加入我们吗？"
G["Looks like they really put the cart..."]="看来他们真把推车放在了……"
G["Looks like things are finally starting to calm down."]="看起来这些家伙总算开始安分下来了。"
G["Looks like this is it, boss-$g man : lady;. It's been a real honor. I'm sure we'll see each other again real soon."]="看来就这样了，$g阁下:女士;。这真是我的荣幸。相信我们很快就会再见面。"
G["Looks like this is it, boss-$g man : lady;. It's been a real honor. I'm sure we'll see each other again real soon.\n\nJust let me know when you're ready to head out for Orgrimmar."]="看来就这样了，$g阁下:女士;。这真是我的荣幸。相信我们很快就会再见面。\n\n当你准备好动身前往奥格瑞玛时，告诉我一声。"
G["Looks like we blessed by Great Ones! Shrines give magic, make us high-oracle someday? Maybe?"]="我们也许真的得到了造物主的祝福！也许有一天，圣坛的魔法会把我们变成大神谕者？"
G["Looks like we did it! We're in the clear!"]="看来我们成功了！我们畅通无阻了！"
G["Looks like we do this the hard way. Let's go!"]="看来我们要费一番功夫才行。我们走！"
G["Looks like we got a war to win."]="看来我们还有场胜仗要打。"
G["Looks like we have as many lean wolf steaks as the Horde wants. They told me to pack up what we have here and ready it to be shipped it out to Cenarion Hold in Silithus. But it looks like some of the others here might still be collecting whatever it is that they're in charge of. Go bug one of them."]="似乎我们已经集齐了部落所需的瘦狼排。他们让我把这些瘦狼排打包运送到希利苏斯的塞纳里奥要塞去，这儿似乎还有其他人在设法收集各种物资。去找找他们吧。"
G["Looks like we have our work cut out for us..."]="看来我们的任务是为我们量身定制的……"
G["Looks like we have room for one more... no, my mistake.  That's a seven not a one.  Hope you're good with a sword - report to the barracks."]="似乎我们还需要一名……啊，不对。是七名士兵。希望你擅长使剑——去兵营报到吧。"
G["Looks like we won't get away so easily.  Get ready!"]="看起来没那么容易逃脱。做好准备！"
G["Looks like we'll be eating shoe leather for dinner again."]="看来我们今天的晚餐又只能啃皮鞋了。"
G["Looks like we're going to have ourselves an execution."]="这简直是引狼入室的行为。"
G["Looks like we're in a pretty tight jam. Think you can get us out of here?"]="看样子我们被困在这儿了。你能让我们从这里出去吗？"
G["Looks like we're not done yet, $p."]="看起来还没完，$p。"
G["Looks like we're out of the woods, eh? Wonder what this does..."]="我们好像走出森林了？这到底是怎么一回事……"
G["Looks like we've got some of Rockrain's soldiers here. Dontrag, Utvoch, we're gonna need your expertise over at Krom'gar Fortress."]="看来我们这儿来了一些石雨的士兵。多特拉格、乌图克，你们的专长能够在克罗姆加壁垒派上用场。"
G["Looks like we've uncovered this $n. Now help me kill it!"]="Al parecer, hemos descubierto a $n. ¡Ayudadme a $gmatarlo:matarla;!"
G["Looks like whatever Tirion did put some hurt on the Lich King.  It's too bad we can't finish him off...."]="看来提里奥的确对巫妖王造成了一定伤害。可惜我们不能杀死他……"
G["Looks like ye may have the makings of a great smith. But before I teach ye anything I need to know that ye've got what it takes."]="看来你具有成为一名优秀铁匠的潜质。但是在我教你之前，我得知道你是否明白自己在做什么。"
G["Looks like you brought the whole family!  What's your business here, then?"]="你把全家人都带来了吗！那么，你来这里做什么？"
G["Looks like you brought the whole fleet with you, $n!  And a pack of angry Brashtide to boot!\n\nI hope you're battle-ready, because these guys sure came packin'."]="¡Parece que te has traído toda la flota, $n! ¡Y una manada de Fuertemarea furiosos, por si fuera poco!\n\nEspero que te hayas preparado para la batalla, porque estos tipos vienen armados."
G["Looks like you can handle yourself in the water. Keep up the good work."]="看起来你在水中没什么不妥的啊。继续这样干。"
G["Looks like you can still best me in a fair fight, little brother."]="在公平对决的情况下，你似乎有机会战胜我。"
G["Looks like you couldn't keep up ... pity."]="看来你坚持不下去了。真遗憾。"
G["Looks like you got more than enough. Quick, $n, I think I can see the yaungol reinforcements massing on the horizon."]="看来你弄到的这些已经绰绰有余了。快，$n，我想我已经在地平线上看到了铺天盖地的野牛人援军。"
G["Looks like you had the same idea I did. Hunting for fruit, are you?"]="看来你和我的想法一样啊。你想找些水果，对吧？"
G["Looks like you know a good machine when you see one. Give'm hell!"]="看来你在操纵器械方面很有天分。给他们点颜色瞧瞧！"
G["Looks like you lose."]="你好像输了。"
G["Looks like you're third in line, $c."]="Parece que eres $gel tercero:la tercera;, $c."
G["Looks like you're too late, $c. We have all of the roast raptor that we need; killed, cooked and salted. Anyway, it looks like some of the others around here could use some help. You should go check with them. I'm going to see if they'll let me go home now."]="看来你来得太晚了，$c。我们已经集齐所需的烤迅猛龙肉了。但是，似乎还有人需要帮助。你可以跟他们谈谈。我得看看他们会不会现在就让我回家。"
G["Looks like you've had a fun time playing with Festergut, but to harvest a proper specimen I'm afraid I will need BOTH strains of blight at the same time!"]="看起来你和烂肠在一起玩的挺开心，但要取得合适的标本，恐怕我同时需要两样东西才行！"
G["Looks like you've had a fun time playing with Rotface, but to harvest a proper specimen I'm afraid I will need BOTH strains of blight at the same time!"]="看起来你和腐面在一起玩的挺开心，但要取得合适的标本，恐怕我同时需要两样东西才行！"
G["Looks over in the direction of the witch doctor and is thoughtful."]="若有所思地向巫医所在的方向看去。"
G["Loommaster Jeng once spun a weave of silk so thin and smooth that it slipped through a crack in time. It hasn't re-appeared yet but we expect it one of these days."]="纺丝人锦织曾经织出很薄很滑的丝绸，可以瞬间从细缝中滑过。虽然尚未将其复制出来，但我们希望能在近期成功。"
G["Loon Mai has issued evacuation orders."]="麦龙下达了疏散命令。"
G["Loot and pillage, bwahahaha!"]="抢呀，杀呀，啊哈哈哈哈！"
G["Looting"]="正在拾取"
G["Lor'danel is next, fool. With Aetherion almost completely in this world, it is only a matter of time!"]="Lor'danel es la siguiente, $gnecio:necia;. Ahora que Aetherion casi ha entrado del todo en este mundo, ¡es solo cuestión de tiempo!"
G["Lor'danel must have been desperate to send you. We'll deal with them soon enough!"]="新奥伯丁竟然派你这样的人来,他们一定是绝望了。我们很快就会和他们开战了!"
G["Lor'themar be ready to strike once he finish wit da Isle of Thunder, and da Banshee Queen need no excuse, but they both across da sea. Without ya strength, we can't breech the city. I need tauren arms."]="等雷神岛事毕，洛瑟玛就会立即起兵，而女妖之王也责无旁贷，可他们都远隔重洋。没有你的力量，我们无法突破城防。我需要牛头人部队。"
G["Lor'themar elf ranger thinkin' about leavin' the Horde!"]="精灵游侠洛瑟玛正在考虑脱离部落！"
G["Lor'themar has remade Silvermoon into something we may truly be proud of."]="洛瑟玛重建的银月城真是我们的骄傲。"
G["Lor'themar must hear us! We will not be silenced!"]="洛瑟玛必须听到我们的呼声！我们不能再沉默下去了！"
G["Lor'themar narrows his eyes."]="洛瑟玛眯起了眼睛。"
G["Lor'themar wants a status update on the experiment."]="洛瑟玛想要知道实验的最新进展。"
G["Lor'themar wants a status update? Or is it his master Garrosh?\n\nYou should tell them both that this experiment is a waste of time. The mogu drew power by enslaving the living essence of other creatures. Is this something our Warchief should be dabbling in?\n\nThis is the same road Kael'thas Sunstrider once walked, and it nearly destroyed our people. Why are we taking orders from someone who would have us walk down this road again?"]="洛瑟玛想知道最新的进展？我猜是他的主子加尔鲁什想知道吧？\n\n没关系，反正你可以告诉他们俩，这实验完全是浪费时间。魔古族的力量来自于剥夺其他生物的生命精华。难道我们的酋长会涉足这种邪恶的勾当？\n\n这是凯尔萨斯·逐日者曾经走过的邪道，而这段历史几乎毁掉了我们的人民。我们为什么要听命于某个想要令我们重蹈覆辙的人？"
G["Lord Afrasastrasz sent me. He said you have a message to decode?"]="是阿弗拉沙斯塔兹指挥官派我来的。他说你这里有一份密信需要破译？"
G["Lord Afrasastrasz, with your leave, I wish to defend the temple."]="阿弗拉沙斯塔兹，请让我参与保卫神殿的战斗。"
G["Lord Deathwing's sundering of the Well of Eternity has brought down Uldum's defenses. Prepare yourselves. We will march through the Waygate soon!"]="死亡之翼大人对永恒之井的破坏，削弱了奥丹姆的防御。做好准备。我们很快就将穿越界门！"
G["Lord Deathwing, your gift...it is too much! I am...rrrraaaaagghhh!!"]="死亡之翼阁下，我承受不了……您的馈赠……我……啊啊啊啊！！"
G["Lord Doomclaw.  Yes, I like the sound of that!"]="“厄运之爪大人”，哈哈，听起来不错！"
G["Lord Fordragon!"]="弗塔根公爵！"
G["Lord Fordring, you mustn't reveal yourself!"]="弗丁大人，您不能露面！"
G["Lord Gura commanded the very power of the storm at his fingertips. With a single word, he could blanket the earth in crackling electricity. Those caught in his storm died a terrible, scorching death."]="军阀古拉能将风暴的力量玩弄于股掌之间。只要一个指令，他就能让劈啪作响的电流笼罩大地。那些被他卷入风暴中的人都会浑身焦黑地凄惨死去。"
G["Lord Hir'eek, grant me wings of vengeance!"]="希里克，赐予我复仇的翅膀！"
G["Lord Illidan will be here shortly."]="伊利丹大人很快就来到这里。"
G["Lord Illidan will... crush you!"]="伊利丹大人……会干掉你们的！"
G["Lord Illidan, I..."]="伊利丹大人，我……"
G["Lord Illidan, I... I am... sorry."]="伊利丹大人，我……我很抱歉。"
G["Lord Illidan, bless me with the power of the flight!"]="伊利丹大人，赐予我飞翔的力量吧！"
G["Lord Illidan, this is the Dragonmaw that I, and others, have told you about. He will lead us to victory!"]="伊利丹大人，这位就是我和其他人向您提到过的龙喉氏族的英雄。他会引领我们走向胜利！"
G["Lord Kael'thas insisted upon it."]="凯尔萨斯大人坚持要这么做。"
G["Lord Lor'themar demands an explanation for the presence of this... exile in our lands."]="为什么这个流亡者会在这里？摄政王洛瑟玛大人需要一个合理的解释。"
G["Lord Lor'themar does not concur with your reasoning, ranger-general. You have no authority to invite this --"]="洛瑟玛大人不会赞同你的解释的，游侠将军。你无权邀请这个——"
G["Lord Mayor!  Our scouts report strange activity to the west."]="大人！我们的卫兵报告说西边有一些异常的情况。"
G["Lord Ragnaros! Shield me!"]="拉格纳罗斯大人！庇护我吧！"
G["Lord Ragnaros, grant me your everlasting fire!"]="拉格纳罗斯大人，请赐予我不熄的烈焰吧！"
G["Lord Saltheril, my dear, did you notice that supplies for the party are a little low? We really should send for one of those couriers from Fairbreeze Village to deliver more of whatever is needed. I especially like those little hors d'oeuvres wrapped in the smoked bacon. What are those called?"]="我亲爱的萨瑟利尔男爵，你有没有注意到聚会的供应品似乎有些不足？我们真的需要那么一个信使从晴风村运些我们需要的东西过来。我特别喜欢那些包裹在熏肉中的小点心，对了，那东西叫什么来着？"
G["Lord Sargeras, I will not fail you! Sweep your molten fist through this world, so that it may be reborn in flames and darkness!"]="萨格拉斯大人，我是不会让你失望的！用你的熔岩之拳横扫这个世界吧，让它在烈焰与黑暗中重生！"
G["Lord Staghelm, where are you going? You would shatter our bond for the sake of pride?"]="鹿盔，你要去哪儿？为了自尊和高傲，你就要切断我们的联系？"
G["Lord Taran Tzu has travelled westward beyond the wall to hunt the Sha of Hatred. I hope the hunt goes well."]="祝踏岚领主已经出城墙向西追捕恨之煞。我希望他追捕顺利。"
G["Lord Taran Zhu just departed with the majority of our soldiers. Attacking now would be foolish."]="祝踏岚掌门刚刚带走了我们的大部分战士。现在进攻是愚蠢的决定。"
G["Lord Taran spoke to me earlier! I hope I won't let him down."]="踏岚掌门已经跟我说了！但愿我不会让他失望。"
G["Lord Taran, our foothold here is secure. We should take the first opportunity to attack."]="踏岚掌门，我们此处的据点已经稳固了。我们应该第一时间出击。"
G["Lord Thrall, it is time to go!"]="萨尔大人，该出发了！"
G["Lord Ufrang, there are strangers on the ledge petitioning your warriors to honor duels. They are not vrykul."]="乌弗朗领主，平台上来了一些陌生人，要求与您的战士进行公平决斗。他们都不是维库人。"
G["Lord Zhu!"]="祝掌门！"
G["Lord Zhu! The Alliance - the Horde - all chaos is about to erupt out here!"]="祝掌门！联盟——部落——这里马上就要乱作一团了！"
G["Lord Zhu! They are down at the bridge, holding off a mantid attack force, sir."]="祝掌门！他们在桥那边，抵挡一支螳螂妖部队，大人。"
G["Lord Zhu, please understand - the orc \"Warchief\" who ordered the deed no longer speaks for the whole of the Horde. Many voices are rising up against him."]="Lord Zhu, compréndelo, por favor. El \"Jefe de Guerra\" orco que ordenó tal acción ya no habla en nombre de toda la Horda. Hay muchas voces que se elevan ya contra él."
G["Lord Zhu, the mantid have not been seen in these numbers since the swarm more than 90 years ago. My men are going days without sleep just to hold this line."]="祝掌门，九十多年来，螳螂妖的数量从未如此泛滥。士兵们夜以继日、不眠不休地战斗，死守这道防线。"
G["Lord Zhu, we'll return shortly."]="祝掌门，我们很快回来。"
G["Lord of thunder... protect me!"]="雷霆之主……保护我！"
G["Lord-Commander, I would hear your tale."]="高级指挥官，我要听你的故事。"
G["Lord-Commander, would you repeat what you said before?"]="高级指挥官，能再讲一遍刚才的故事吗？"
G["Lord."]="阁下。"
G["Lordaeron belongs to the Alliance. You only delay the inevitable..."]="洛丹伦属于联盟。你们只是在拖延无可阻挡的命运……"
G["Lordaeron belongs to the Forsaken - always and forever."]="洛丹伦永远属于被遗忘者，永远。"
G["Lordaeron belongs to the Forsaken."]="洛丹伦属于被遗忘者。"
G["Lordaeron is ours!"]="洛丹伦是我们的了！"
G["Lords, be on your guard! The Horde plan to breach our defenses and stop the ceremony!"]="大人，当心！部落计划突破防线来破坏我们的仪式！"
G["Lorekeeper Vaeldrin insists he can find the Pools of Youth.\n\nShould we succeed, imagine what that would do for our people. To be immortal again..."]="博学者瓦尔德林坚信他可以找到青春之池。\n\n想象一下，如果成功的话，那将为我们的人民带来什么啊，我们将再次获得永生……"
G["Lorewalker Cho spoke highly of you. You are welcome as long as you don't go all hozen on us."]="游学者周卓对你称赞有加。只要你帮我们赶走猢狲，你永远都会受到欢迎。"
G["Lorewalker Cho! I'm so glad you're joining us this week."]="游学者周卓！我很高兴你能和我们一起度过这一周。"
G["Lorewalker! What ever happened to Liu Lang?"]="游学者！刘浪后来又遇到了什么事？"
G["Lorewalkers"]="游学者"
G["Lorna said a truly brave adventurer helped rescue many of the horses near her family's orchard.\nI offered to take care of those that made it across the sea with us. I learned how from my mother and father, Light bless them!\nWere you interested in a fine Gilnean steed...?"]="Lorna dijo que un auténtico aventurero ayudó a rescatar muchos de los caballos del huerto de su familia.\n\nLe ofrecí encargarme de los que consiguieron atravesar el mar con nosotros. Mi madre y mi padre me enseñaron a hacerlo, ¡que la luz los bendiga!\n\n¿Quieres un buen corcel gilneano?"
G["Lorna!"]="罗娜！"
G["Lorna, is that how you greet old friends?"]="罗娜，这就是你向老朋友问候的方式？"
G["Lorna... I... Release her. I will sound the retreat."]="罗娜……我……快放了她。我会下令撤兵。"
G["Lorokeem, grand master alchemist and Skettis outcast, lives among the other arakkoa in the northwest portion of the lower city."]="斯克提斯流浪者，宗师级炼金师罗罗基姆和与其他鸦人一起住在贫民窟的西北。"
G["Lorthuna is preparing a powerful spell - get behind cover!"]="洛苏娜正在准备施放一个强大的法术——快躲好！"
G["Losing my life was a danger I had come to terms with.  Losing Ysida is something I cannot endure, even after my own death."]="面对危险时我选择了妥协并由此送了命。但是即便是死了，我也无法承受失去伊思达的悲痛。"
G["Loss of life unavoidable."]="生命的凋零，不可避免。"
G["Lost it? What do you mean?"]="失心疯？你说的是什么意思？"
G["Lost some of my best soldiers that day..."]="那天我失去了许多最棒的士兵……"
G["Lost your Rocket Pack? Have you checked your bags?"]="火箭背包不见了？看看在不在背包里。"
G["Lost. Stolen! This is a terrible blow. Terrible!"]="不见了。被偷了！这是一个可怕的打击。可怕的打击！"
G["Lost... to a CHICKEN!"]="输给了……一只小鸡！"
G["Lost?\n\nI am deeply disappointed, $n.\n\nThat ring was one of a kind, crafted out of the remnants of the armor of our fallen heroes and the purified metal from our enemy's blades.\n\nLet's not allow this to happen again."]="丢了？\n\n我真是失望极了，$n。\n\n那只戒指曾是用我们已逝英雄的护甲碎片，加上净化后的敌人刀刃打造的。\n\n这样的事情不要再次发生。"
G["Lot more going to fall like you."]="更多的人会像你们一样倒下。"
G["Lot of strong Frenzyheart here. Dajik taught most of them. First time I teach something like you though. You not a Frenzyheart, you know."]="这里有许多优秀的猎手，大部分都是达伊克调教出来的。不过教你这样的家伙还是头一次。要知道，你并不是狂心氏族的成员。"
G["Lots of corpses in the sea. More than usual.\n\nThere is war nearby.\n\nThis is good for the saurok. More corpses means more food, more filth."]="海里有很多尸体。比平时更多。\n\n附近发生了战争。\n\n这对蜥蜴人是好事。更多的尸体意味着更多的食物，更多的污物。"
G["Lots of gnoll activity reported in the Gold Coast Quarry and the Jangolode Mine."]="据报告，有大量豺狼人在金海岸矿洞和詹戈洛德矿洞地区活动。"
G["Lots of junk food here, but is it ever delicious."]="这里有着大量的垃圾食品，但到底好不好吃呢？"
G["Lots of nibbles today, but not many bites."]="我今天遇到的鱼都是试探性的轻咬，真正咬钩的很少。"
G["Lots of saurok live in the Ancient Passage."]="在远古之路住着许多蜥蜴人。"
G["Lots of shiny. Maybe me like you more than admiral."]="好多金灿灿的宝贝。也许你比将军更让我喜欢。"
G["Lots to be done around here, $r.  Are you ready to help?"]="Hay mucho que hacer por aquí, $r. ¿Estás $glisto:lista; para ayudar?"
G["Lots to do! Haven't been this busy since my cousin accidentally vaporized all the cloth and leather in Gnomeregan. My, it was drafty for a while! Ah, $n, those were the days...."]="要做的事情很多！自从我的兄弟不小心蒸发了诺莫瑞根所有的衣料和皮革之后，事情便多起来了。我只能保持暂时通风！啊，$n，那些日子……"
G["Loudly explain how to get back to camp."]="大声解释如何返回营地。"
G["Lousy... tank..."]="蹩脚的……坦克……"
G["Love tokens are small messages of affection you can give to amorous town and city folk.  Such people will reward you with a gift of adoration.\n\nOr, if you are already adored by another, then at the least they'll give you a gift of friendship."]="爱情信物是用来向你中意的某个城中的居民表达爱意的小东西。如果对方也对你感兴趣的话，你就可以收到一份爱情的礼物。\n\n如果你已经和别人相爱了，那么至少对方会给你一份代表友谊的礼物。"
G["Lovely outfit. Dressed for the part!"]="这套衣服真漂亮。专程为了聚会穿的吧！"
G["Lovely song, isn't it?"]="很动听的歌，不是吗？"
G["Lovely, beautiful! I see you have already visited the East Temple. Then you understand why this statue is so important to our way of life."]="太好了，太棒了！我看你已经去过青龙寺了。那你应该明白，这座雕像为何对我们如此重要。"
G["Lovely, beautiful! If you have time, you should also visit the East Temple. You may gain further insight into our great statue, and its importance to our way of life."]="太好了，太棒了！如果你有时间，应该去看看青龙寺。这样，你才能进一步了解我们伟大的雕像，以及它对我们的重要性。"
G["Lovers do what lovers will. He's a good boy."]="热恋中的情侣总是要谈情说爱的嘛。他是个好小伙儿。"
G["Low spirits"]="情绪低落"
G["Low-tech, yet quite effective."]="没什么技术含量，但是很有效。"
G["Lower your voice, $r. I am no longer welcome in Sethekk."]="小声点，$r。塞泰克已经不欢迎我了。"
G["Lower your voice. It's no wonder Taran did not pick you for command. You take too many risks."]="你别这么大声。难怪踏岚不选你来做指挥官。你太冒进了。"
G["Lu'lin! Lend me your strength!"]="露琳！将你的力量借给我！"
G["Luara, I would like to take one of your nightsabers to Maestra's Post."]="露亚娜，我要骑着你的一头夜刃豹去梅伊瑟娜岗哨。"
G["Lucan Cordell has a small shop on the canal by the Stockade. I am sure he will be able to teach you the art of enchanting."]="鲁坎·考迪尔在监狱附近的运河边上有一家小店。我相信他可以教你附魔的技巧。"
G["Lucc is the one to speak to now, $n, to further your skill."]="$n，想要提升你的炼金术技能，就去找鲁克谈谈吧。"
G["Lucien's gonna getcha!"]="卢希恩要抓住你！"
G["Lucius is an old and trusted friend of Ravenholdt Manor - he and I have much to discuss. Find me at the docks in Lakeshire should you require my assistance or council."]="卢修斯是拉文霍德庄园的老朋友了——我和他有很多事情要说。如果你需要我的帮助，那就去湖畔镇的码头找我。"
G["Luck is like lady grummle: hard to find but worth the search."]="好运就像是土地精美女——世间罕有，但却值得你费尽心机去找寻。"
G["Luck is with us today!  A damsel appears before us, stuck in a crag, without hope of escape!  Let us go save her!"]="幸运在召唤我们！一位少女出现在我们面前，她被困在高耸的悬崖上！让我们去拯救她！"
G["Luckily, High Elders no longer have to perform basic training. I find that I am happier when I am not exercising."]="幸好当上长老之后我就不用练基本功了。老实说，自从不练功之后我的心情好了很多。"
G["Luckily, I had been tinkering with my world-shrinking device."]="幸运的是，我一直在修补我的世界缩小设备。"
G["Luckily, I managed to salvage a few bottles."]="太幸运了，我成功打捞到了几瓶。"
G["Luckily, I was nearby.  How can I help?"]="幸运的是，我就在附近。我能帮你什么忙吗？"
G["Luckily, the Lich King's grasp has not reached Dalaran yet."]="好在巫妖王的魔爪还没有伸到达拉然来。"
G["Lucky fer you, I'm Prince Anduin's best gal. We're friends, but don't go tellin' Agent Connelly."]="你真幸运，我是安度因王子手下最能干的姑娘。我们是好朋友，但是可别把这告诉特工康奈利。"
G["Lucky for you I'm in this cage."]="我被关在笼子里是你的运气。"
G["Lucky-Lucky! Come have some noodles!"]="幸运儿！来吃碗面条吧！"
G["Luckydo floot!"]="幸运之笛！"
G["Luckydo, or Luckydon't?"]="幸运符，还是厄运符？"
G["Luis, Brianna and Eric! Blizzard QA team! Of course our fans!"]="¡Luis, Brianna y Eric! ¡El equipo de control de calidad de Blizzard! ¡Por supuesto, nuestros fans!"
G["Lumbering in from the south, the smell of Carnage precedes him!"]="南方飘来的气味预示了卡纳基的到来！"
G["Lumurk open this box easy!"]="拉穆尔克轻易打开了箱子！"
G["Lunar Festival is the best time of year for fireworks!"]="春节是一年中看烟火的最好时节！"
G["Lunch has arrived, my beautiful children. Tear them to pieces!"]="你们的午饭来了，孩子们。把它们全部吃光吧！"
G["Lunk going to find some real adventures!"]="隆克要去进行真正的冒险！"
G["Lunk got you some venom with his tummy."]="隆克用他的肚子给你弄了些毒液。"
G["Lunk here to help."]="隆克来帮忙了。"
G["Lunk loves to play on seesaw!"]="隆克喜欢玩跷跷板！"
G["Lunk no kill!!"]="隆克不杀人！！"
G["Lunk ride spider now!"]="隆克骑着蜘蛛！"
G["Lunk think you killed too much bad guy. But Lunk still think you OK $g guy:lady;."]="隆克觉得你杀掉了太多坏家伙，但隆克依然觉得你是个好$g家伙:女孩;。"
G["Lunk tired of all this killing!  Lunk quits!"]="隆克厌倦了杀戮！隆克退出！"
G["Lunk warn you one last time!"]="隆克最后一次警告你！"
G["Lunk will ride you now!"]="隆克要骑你了！"
G["Lurching Blossom begins to breath a foul gas in front of it."]="蹒跚花苗开始向正前方喷吐秽臭气体。"
G["Lure Caimas over the Croc Eggs without stepping on them yourself!"]="引诱凯玛斯到鳄鱼蛋旁边去，但你可不要踩上那些鳄鱼蛋！"
G["Lure him into da trap!"]="把他引到陷阱里！"
G["Lure it into the trap!"]="诱使它踩进陷阱！"
G["Lurid could get used... to working with you."]="鲁瑞德和你……应该能够合作的。"
G["Lurosa, I am entrusting the Relics of Aviana to $n, who will take them to Morthis Whisperwing. I must return completely to the Emerald Dream now. Do not let $n fail!"]="鲁罗萨，我把艾维娜圣物委托给$n转交莫希斯·轻翼了。现在我必须彻底地回到翡翠梦境去了。不要让$n失败！"
G["Lyalia wants me to create a new portal? That woman is crazy. Did she already forget what happened the last time?\n\nWell, Vaeldrin's research did suggest some possible ways around traps like that. And I may have taken a short cut or two to get us here.\n\nGive me enough time and I might be able to summon another portal for the encampment."]="丽娅拉想让我开启新的传送门？那女人简直疯了。难道她已经忘记上次发生的事了？\n\n好吧，瓦尔德林的研究提供了几种绕开陷阱的可行方案。而我也许是走了点儿捷径才把我们带到这里来的。\n\n多给我些时间，我也许能召唤出另一个撤退传送门。"
G["Lyalia! I am so sorry, my child."]="丽娅拉！非常抱歉，我的孩子。"
G["Lydon!? Alive?"]="林度恩？！还活着？"
G["Lylagar is offended by your inferior howl."]="你低劣的咆哮激怒了莱拉克斯。"
G["Lylagar lets out a pitiful whimper."]="莱拉克斯发出了可怜的呜咽声。"
G["Lynalis can help you more than I, $c. Speak with her to learn more."]="$c，莱纳里斯更适合担当你的导师。想要学习更多关于制皮的知识，就和她谈谈吧。"
G["Lynna, stay here and establish a camp. Your first priority should be medical tents and shelters. When the peasants arrive, see that they begin construction of the docks."]="琳娜，你留下来建营地。医疗帐篷和掩体一定要优先建造。等农夫到达后，就安排他们开始建港口。"
G["Lyria's the one you should talk to if you need some training.  She can usually be found out behind the smithy waiting for some armor or weapon to be finished."]="要是你想接受训练的话，就去找科瑞恩。她通常在铁匠铺外面等着铁匠打造武器。"
G["Lysheana can offer you the proper documents, she resides in the Craftsmen's Terrace in northeasten Darnassus.  May your fellowship bring glory to the Night Elves!"]="琳沙娜能为你提供所需要的文档，她居住在达纳苏斯东北部的工匠区。愿你的伙伴为暗夜精灵带来无比的荣耀吧！"
G["Lysta, summon forth... the abomination!"]="利斯塔，冲啊……憎恶！"
G["Lysta, summon in the captives."]="利斯塔，把战俘带过来。"
G["Lysta, summon in undead captives."]="利斯塔，召唤亡灵俘虏。"
G["M A r c K e T.\n- Chee Chee"]="M E r c K A d O.\n\n- Chee Chee"
G["M'uru accepted his role in this long ago, knowing full well what would happen to him. Will you accept your own?"]="穆鲁很久以前就理解了他的角色，他很清楚在他身上会发生些什么。你理解你自己的角色吗？"
G["M-mistress... did you n-need more corpse dust, p-perhaps...?"]="小……小姐，您需……需要更多的尸尘吗？"
G["M-mistress... does your axe n-need sharpening...?"]="小……小姐，您的战斧需要打……打磨吗？"
G["M-mistress... may I p-polish your armor...?"]="小……小姐，您的盔甲需要抛……抛光吗？"
G["M-mistress... might I b-brush your mighty steed...?"]="小……小姐，您的战马需要梳……梳洗吗？"
G["M... maybe you're not all bad after all..."]="也……也许你也没那么坏……"
G["MADNESS WILL CONSUME YOU!"]="疯狂将把你彻底吞噬！"
G["MALFURION, CAN YOU HEAR ME?! WHEN I HAVE DESTROYED THE CHILDREN OF ELUNE, I WILL COME AND PUT AN END TO YOU!"]="玛法里奥，能听到我说话吗？等到我毁灭了艾露恩的孩子们，我就会来把你了结掉！"
G["MALYGOS!!"]="玛里苟斯！！"
G["MAMA STORMSTOUT IS NOT HERE ANYMORE..."]="她再也不是风暴烈酒大妈了！"
G["MANA FLOW RATE NOMINAL. RETURNING TO BASE."]="法力流失速度正常。返回基地。"
G["MANKER!"]="蠢货！"
G["MASTER! NO!"]="主人！不！"
G["MASTERS! Intruders in the temple!"]="大师！寺院中有入侵者！"
G["ME NO SIGN UP FOR DIS! WAIT! Yes, me did sign up for dis."]="这可不包括在我的职责范围内！等等！是的，这是在我的职责范围内。"
G["ME SO ANGRY!"]="我生气了！"
G["MEATBALL BELLY GURGLE!"]="肉弹肚子咕咕响！"
G["MEATBALL BELLY HURTS!"]="肉弹肚子痛！"
G["MEATBALL EAT SMELLY THING NOW!"]="肉弹吃掉臭东西！"
G["MEATBALL EAT WHAT MEATBALL WANT!"]="肉弹想吃就吃！"
G["MEATBALL FEEL FUNNY!"]="肉弹很高兴！"
G["MEATBALL HUNGRY!"]="肉弹饿了！"
G["MEDIC!"]="医生！"
G["MEMORY RECORDS DESTROYED. WHO ARE YOU. RETURNING TO BASE."]="记忆档案已销毁。你是谁。返回基地。"
G["MINE!"]="是我的！"
G["MINION, to my aid!"]="小的们，快来帮我！"
G["MMmmMMmmm. Smells delicious Khara."]="嗯……闻起来真香啊，卡拉。"
G["MOLDFANG STRONG!"]="霉牙最厉害！"
G["MONSTERS!"]="这群怪物！"
G["MORE Ghaz'ridian?  Why would you think I would want any MORE of those infernal things?  I'm stuck with about nine thousand, and they're not selling!  Why did I ever think anyone would want a statue of an overgrown snake?  Pah!"]="更多加兹瑞迪安？你为什么觉得我还愿意要更多这玩意？我已经积压了九千个了，一个都卖不出去！我竟然以为有人会对这种超大块头的毒蛇雕像感兴趣！啊呸！"
G["MORE INCOMING! FIRE! FIRE!"]="更多敌人来了！开火！开火！"
G["MORE PAIN!"]="更多的痛苦！"
G["MORE PIRATES FOR SORLOF TO SMASH!"]="索罗夫要消灭更多的海盗！"
G["MORE POUR, LESS BORE!"]="我们要酒啊啊啊啊！"
G["MORE SUFFERING AWAITS!"]="品尝更多的痛苦吧！"
G["MOVE FORWARD!"]="前进！"
G["MOVE LEFT!"]="左转！"
G["MOVE RIGHT!"]="右转！"
G["MOVE! DIS ROCK HEAVY!"]="动起来！这块石头太重了！"
G["MRGLLL GLRRM GL! Translation: I will kill you!"]="MRGLLL GLRRM GL！翻译过来：我要杀了你！"
G["MRMRFRMRFRMRRRR!"]="¡MRMRFRMRFRMRRRR!"
G["MRRRFFFFMMMMRRR!"]="¡MRRRFFFFMMMMRRR!"
G["MRRRFRRRR!"]="¡MRRRFRRRR!"
G["MUGG! Get over here! The Hoff's under attack!"]="姆格！快过来！霍夫被袭击啦！"
G["MULVERICK!"]="穆维里克！！！"
G["MY FATE IS MY OWN!"]="我的命运属于我自己！"
G["MY MASTER COMES, MORTALS! I AM BUT ONE OF A LEGION OF HERALDS. YOUR WORLD IS ABOUT TO UNDERGO A TRANSFORMATION THAT WILL SEE THE END OF YOU!"]="凡人们，我的主人来了！我只是主人大军的传令官。你们的世界将经历巨大的转变，你们全都难逃一死！"
G["MY MIGHT IS ENDLESS!"]="我的力量无穷无尽！"
G["MY PARENTS... MURDERED BEFORE I COULD KNOW THEM... BETRAYED!"]="我的父母……在我懂事之前就被害了……背叛！"
G["MY POWER WILL NOT BE CONTAINED!"]="我的力量不再受到束缚了！"
G["MY WIFE DIED, YOU MONSTERS!"]="我的妻子死了，你们这些怪物！"
G["MY!"]="船上！"
G["Ma'am, would you mind dropping me off at Light's Shield Tower, just up ahead?  I have to stop here."]="女士，你介意让我在圣光之盾哨塔那里下车吗？就在前面。我得在这儿停一下。"
G["Ma'haat, slaughter these rabble.  I will deal with the fool priestess."]="玛哈特，杀掉这些教徒。我会去对付那愚蠢的女祭司。"
G["Mace"]="锤"
G["Maces are a specialty of Buliwyf's! He's around this shop somewhere, grousing. If his training techniques aren't your style, I hear the draenei weapon master in the Exodar, Handiir, knows his way around the weapon too! He's up on the Trader's Tier there."]="锤子是布里维夫的最拿手的武器！他就在这家店附近。如果你不喜欢他的训练方法，我听说埃索达的德莱尼的武器大师韩迪尔同样也知道怎么摆弄锤子！他就在贸易阶梯那里。"
G["Maces are taught by Ansekhwa, found on the lower central rise of Thunder Bluff."]="安塞瓦会教你怎么使用锤子，你可以在雷霆崖的中部高地底层找到他。"
G["Maces, they taught by Ansekhwa, found on da lower central rise of Thunder Bluff."]="他们都是从在雷霆崖中部高地底层的安塞瓦那里学会使用锤子的。"
G["Mack belches loudly..."]="马克大声地打嗝……"
G["Mad Qao Pao and his Jewel Danio were last found  in the Summer Fields in Vale of Eternal Blossoms. Probably around this area. \n\n<Ben marks a spot on your map.>"]="La última vez que vimos a Qao Pao el Excéntrico y sus danios enjoyados estaban en Los Campos Estivales, en el Valle de la Flor Eterna. Probablemente estarán por esta zona.\n\n<Ben marca un punto en tu mapa.>"
G["Mad Qao-Pao doesn't mean any harm. Truly, he doesn't. He heard that the pond in front of the Mogu'shan Palace granted wishes, you see... like a wishing well. \n \n And... well... the poor guy has more gold than wit. Last I heard, he's been dumping gold into the water... hoping to become king of the world! \n \n Sadly, Jewel Danio's favorite treats are fireflies that fly low on the water. The glimmer of the coins lures them out in droves. \n \n Hopefully the poor things aren't swallowing too many coins. Today's the day to get Jewel Danio if you want, though. You may even find a couple of coins yourself."]="疯狂的乔宝没有任何恶意的。真的。他听说魔古山宫殿前的池塘能够实现你的愿望，你懂的……就像许愿井什么的。\n \n而且……呃……这个可怜的家伙有钱却没有脑子。据我得到的最新消息，他还在往水里扔金币呢……希望自己能成为世界之王！ \n \n遗憾的是，珍宝斑马鱼最喜欢的食物就是在水面上飞舞的萤火虫。那些闪闪发光的金币将它们成群结队地吸引了出来。\n \n但愿那些可怜的小家伙不要吞食太多的金币。但如果你有需要的话，今天就是钓珍宝斑马鱼的好日子。你甚至还能从里面发现一些金币。"
G["Mad yeti! Mad yeti!"]=" 雪人疯了！雪人发疯了！"
G["Made any good kills lately?\n\nI killed a draenei yesterday. You can still find her near the filth-pool... just look for the blue entrails."]="最近有没有大开杀戒？\n\n我昨天杀了一个德莱尼。你可以在污水池附近找到她……有蓝色内脏的就是。"
G["Made any good kills lately?\n\nI killed a tauren yesterday. It took three scavengers to bring his parts back to the filth-pool!"]="最近有没有大开杀戒？\n\n我昨天杀了一个牛头人。我们出动了三个食腐者才把他运回污水池！"
G["Made by the finest craftsmen in all of Teldrassil, carried by hand from Kalimdor to Azeroth as a sign of the growing alliance between the people of the Great Tree and the humans of this land. If there is anything you require, you have but to ask."]="为了增进暗夜精灵和人类的联盟关系，我千里迢迢带来了由泰达希尔最好的工匠制作的东西。我这里的东西应有尽有，请随意挑选。"
G["Made to far exceed Brann's specifications. You won't be disappointed."]="它的质量远远超过了布莱恩的要求，肯定不会让你失望的。"
G["Madness has brought you here to me. I shall be your undoing!"]="疯狂将你们带到我的面前，而我将以死亡终结你们！"
G["Madness. Chaos. Much as I thrill to see the titans' work undone, I do wish to remain alive when the master returns. I will help you."]="疯狂。混乱。看到泰坦的作品没有完成时，我全身战栗。现在我只希望当主人回来的时候，自己还能活着。好了，我会帮助你的。"
G["Madrigosa accompanied me on this journey, but we have become separated in the Sunwell.\n\nMay fate keep her safe."]="Madrigosa me acompañó en este viaje, pero nos hemos separado en La Fuente del Sol.\n\nEspero que el destino la mantenga a salvo."
G["Madrigosa deserved a far better fate. You did what had to be done, but this battle is far from over!"]="Madrigosa merecía un destino mejor. Hicisteis lo que teníais que hacer, pero esta batalla aún no ha acabado."
G["Maeshtro! Cue da mushic!"]="老板！来点音乐听听！"
G["Maexxna, born deep within the mountains of Northrend many ages ago, she was captured within the dread citadel Naxxramas, where she gives birth to her brood, feeding them the corpses of all who dare venture too deeply into Naxxramas."]="迈克斯纳。数百年前，这只出生在诺森德冰峰深处的蜘蛛就被天灾军团虏进了纳克萨玛斯。她在这座恐怖之城中繁衍后代，那些胆敢进入纳克萨玛斯的冒险者都沦为了蜘蛛的美餐。"
G["Magar's Cloth Goods is in The Drag.  Find him south of the huge tree next to the Kodohide Leatherworks."]="玛加尔的玛加尔布品店在暗巷区里。去科多兽皮工店旁边的大树南边就可以找到他。"
G["Mage"]="法师"
G["Mage & Portal"]="法师&传送门"
G["Mage Trainer"]="法师训练师"
G["Mage-Lord Urom is our next target.  He should be hiding on one of the floating platforms on the Band of Transmutation, near the top of The Oculus.  Be warned, Urom is a powerful conjurer; he may not be alone."]="下一个目标是法师领主伊洛姆。前往靠近魔环顶层的转化之环，在浮动平台上找到伊洛姆。他正在引导蓝色的魔枢能量旋。当心，这位强大的咒术师能召唤仆从帮他作战。"
G["Mages fear our kind... with reason. Play upon this fear, disciples."]="法师害怕我们……这是有原因的。你们要学会利用这种恐惧。"
G["Mages of the Kirin Tor, on Brann's Command, release the shield! Defend this platform and our allies with your lives! For Dalaran!"]="肯瑞托的法师们，布莱恩命令你们解除护盾！用你们的生命保卫这座平台和我们的盟友！为了达拉然！"
G["Mages too? You should be more careful when you play with magic..."]="你们也是法师？小心别玩火自焚……"
G["Mages! Take wing!"]="法师！起飞！"
G["Mages? They're in the Magic Quarter, in the central building. Thought you'd be smart enough to figure that out."]="法师？他们都在魔法区的中央建筑中。你得机灵点儿才能找得到。"
G["Magic Rooster Mount"]="魔法公鸡坐骑"
G["Magic is a tool, some would even say a gift. But you should never forget its fundamental nature."]="魔法是个工具，有些人甚至会把它当作馈赠。可你永远不应该忘记它的本性。"
G["Magic must be... contained..."]="必须抑制……魔法……"
G["Magic sky lanterns for sale!"]="卖魔法天灯啦！"
G["Magic sky lanterns for sale! Light the candle and watch it float, even without wind!"]="卖魔法天灯啦！只要点亮蜡烛，它就能飞上天空，甚至不需要有风！"
G["Magic's done."]="法术完成。"
G["Magical studies stressing your brain? Relax at the Blue Recluse!"]="繁重的魔法研究让你身心疲惫吗？到蓝色隐士放松一下！"
G["Maginor says that twisting alternating flows of positive energy actually creates a much more stable flow."]="玛吉诺曾指出，改变正极能量的流量会使其更加稳定。"
G["Magister Hathorel said you might be able to lend me a certain tabard."]="魔导师哈瑟尔说你会借我一件战袍。"
G["Magistrate Barthilas is unavailable at the moment..."]="巴瑟拉斯镇长现在没空……"
G["Magistrix Carinda has sent me to ask you about Arelion's secret.  Who was he seeing?"]="魔导师卡尔琳达让我来问你关于埃雷利恩的秘密。他是不是在外面跟别人幽会？"
G["Magma swirls and eddies lazily inside the orb, but the translucent surface is solid and cool to the touch."]="熔岩的涡流在这颗宝珠内缓慢地旋转着，但半透明的宝珠表面摸上去却是坚硬冰凉的。"
G["Magmatooth?! NOOOOOOOO!"]="熔岩之牙？！不！！！"
G["Magmatron unit activated."]="熔岩金刚单位已激活。"
G["Magmatron unit shield systems online."]="熔岩金刚单位防护系统已就绪。"
G["Magmaw begins to break free from the single chain binding him!"]="熔喉开始挣脱捆绑他的锁链了！"
G["Magmoth Crusher is on the move!"]="犸格莫斯碾压者正在行动！"
G["Magmoth Crusher's moving off!"]="犸格莫斯碾压者已经出发！"
G["Magna Medivh dies today!"]="麦迪文会在今天死去！"
G["Magni nods."]="麦格尼点了点头。"
G["Magni! Forgive me, the memories are comin' back slowly, brother."]="麦格尼！很抱歉啊，我的记忆恢复得很慢。"
G["Magnificent! It talks! This seems beyond what we thought the mogu were capable of."]="太神奇了！它说话了……看来我们低估了魔古族的能力。"
G["Magnitude set. Release."]="范围确认。释放。"
G["Magtoor, I have faith that there is a way to bring the Lost Ones back from the brink.  By studying them, I will find a way to cure the fel energies that have consumed them.  And in so doing, I will be able to reverse the damage to the Broken as well."]="玛格图尔，我相信我们有办法从灭亡的边缘挽救这些失落者。通过研究，我将会发现净化他们所受的邪恶污染的办法。而且，你们破碎者也必然可以通过这种方法完全康复。"
G["Magtoor, thank you for allowing me to stay here with you.  I'm sure that there is much that we can learn from each other.  And I'm eager to learn all that I can of the Lost Ones to the east."]="玛格图尔，感谢你允许我留在这里。我相信我们彼此还有很多东西可以互相学习，而且我很希望能对东边的那些失落者有更多的认识。"
G["Magtoor, you have endured your plight bravely. Are you ready to return to the embrace of the Light?"]="玛格图尔，你已经勇敢地接受了你的挑战。现在，你准备好回归圣光的怀抱了吗？"
G["Mahka wants you to come see her, Mankrik."]="玛卡想要你去看她，曼科里克。"
G["Mahka wishes to see me? ...very well. Return to her, I will follow."]="玛卡想要见我？……好吧，去告诉她，我这就来。"
G["Maiden!  Fear not, I seek only to steady the quiver in thine lower lip.  Is that your purse that floats 'pon the water, so agonizingly close yet so perilously far away?"]="姑娘！不要害怕，我只是要让你的嘴唇不再颤抖。那个漂在水上的是不是你的荷包？小心，那温泉是很危险的。"
G["Maiden!  Fear not, for Maximillian of Northshire has arrived to deliver you from your rocky tomb!"]="姑娘！不要害怕，北郡的麦斯米兰将把你从岩壁牢狱中拯救下来！"
G["Maiden: if your curiosity gnaws at you, then you may know your salvation was delivered by Maximillian of Northshire."]="女士，如果你真的是如此好奇，那么我可以告诉你，是北郡的麦斯米兰拯救了你。"
G["Maiev... How is it even possible?"]="玛维……怎么可能……？"
G["Mail Armor"]="锁甲"
G["Mailbox"]="邮箱"
G["Mailbox in middle of city, Trade Quarter, upper ring... next to inn."]="在交易区中心就有的邮箱……就在旅馆旁边。"
G["Mailbox? You want to head to the inn in the center of the city's upper ring. It's right there."]="邮箱吗？你可以到城中央上层区域的旅店看看，那里有邮箱。"
G["Mailboxes are scattered throughout the city. You can find one in front of any auction house, bank, or inn."]="邮箱在城中随处可见。你在任何一间拍卖行、银行以及旅店门外都能找到。"
G["Maintain focus."]="集中注意力。"
G["Maintain order within these walls."]="维护银月城的秩序。"
G["Maintain your faith. The grand admiral will deliver us to victory over the Lich King."]="坚守你的信仰。元帅会带领我们战胜巫妖王的。"
G["Maintaining this barrier will require all of my concentration. Kill them all!"]="我必须集中精神维持这个屏障。去消灭他们！"
G["Maintenance initiated."]="开始维修。"
G["Majestic forest striders! Free rides down to the Darkmoon Faire!"]="巨型森林陆行鸟！前往暗月马戏团的免费坐骑！"
G["Majesty, run while you still can. She is not what you think her to be..."]="国王陛下，请在一切还来得及的时候赶快退避一下吧。她并非你所想象的那样……"
G["Major Domo Enabled."]="管理者埃克索图斯被激活。"
G["Makaru can be found day and night at Red Canyon Mining in the Valley of Honor, just off the lake."]="马卡鲁整天都在荣誉谷的红石谷矿业工会，就在湖边。"
G["Make 'em pay, Brutusk!"]="蛮角，让他们付出代价！"
G["Make 'em sorry for hurting you, Mr. D!"]="让他们后悔对你造成的伤害，气泡先生！"
G["Make 'em sorry for hurting you, Mr. P!"]="让他们后悔对你造成的伤害，水泡先生！"
G["Make Sunsong Ranch your home."]="将日歌农场设置为你的家。"
G["Make Way!  Make Way!"]="让一让！让一让！"
G["Make a demonstration of these invaders, such that all nations tremble before me."]="让这些入侵者看看我的厉害，让万民在我面前颤栗。"
G["Make a note: Fire bad."]="记录：火是不好的。"
G["Make a run for Dawn's Blossom. We'll meet you there!"]="快去晨芳园。我们会在那里等你的！"
G["Make dem fear the Zandalari!"]="让他们畏惧赞达拉！"
G["Make every second count.\nWhen you're ready to go, let me know and I'll get you out of here."]="Que cada segundo cuente.\n\nCuando quieras partir, avísame y te sacaremos de aquí."
G["Make for that cave to the west. It's safe and dry."]="到西边那个洞穴去。那里安全又干燥。"
G["Make friends with the jinyu. We may need them before this mission is over, and that's an order."]="去和锦鱼人交个朋友吧。在完成任务之前，我们或许需要他们的帮助，这是命令。"
G["Make good use of those tar pools. Your friends should be able to light them on fire if they're smart about it."]="好好利用那些焦油。如果你的朋友够聪明的话，就应该知道怎么点燃它们。"
G["Make haste and secure the area! Much work remains to be done."]="快行动，保护好这个区域！我们还有很多事要做呢。"
G["Make haste, $c!\n\nThis crisis is nowhere near being under control."]="快点，$c！\n\n这场危机快要失控了。"
G["Make haste, $n. Use the portal!"]="快，$n。快使用传送门！"
G["Make haste, champions! I will prepare the troops to fall in behind you."]="赶快，勇士们！我会让部队紧跟在你们身后。"
G["Make haste, ma priests! Da rituals must not be interrupted!"]="动作快点，祭司们！仪式绝不能被中断！"
G["Make it fast, buddy. We've got deadlines to meet."]="动作快点，伙计。我们一定要赶上最后期限。"
G["Make it fast."]="快点。"
G["Make it out of there with anything good?"]="在里面找到什么好东西了吗？"
G["Make it quick $r, your kind make me sick."]="快点，$r，你们真让我恶心。"
G["Make it quick, $c - we've got a war to fight here, or hadn't you noticed?"]="动作快点，$c。战斗已经在这里打响了，难道你还没注意到？"
G["Make it quick, $c."]="快点，$c。"
G["Make it quick, $r."]="快点儿，$r。"
G["Make it quick, $r. I am weary and have no time for pleasantries.."]="快一点，$r。我很疲倦，没功夫开玩笑……"
G["Make it quick... the fighting here is grim. I need to stay sharp."]="麻烦你快一点……局势每况愈下，我必须做好战斗准备。"
G["Make it stop!"]="阻止它！"
G["Make it stop! MAKE IT STOP!"]="住手！快住手！"
G["Make it!"]="成功！"
G["Make mine Noggenfogger!"]="我要诺格弗格！"
G["Make no mistake. Pandaria will challenge your King."]="潘达利亚对你们的国王无疑将是个挑战。"
G["Make no sound during the ritual.  One misstep could spell our doom..."]="在仪式上要小心谨慎。一不小心就可能导致全盘皆错……"
G["Make peace, worms.  I be deliverin' you to Hakkar myself!"]="投降吧，虫子。我将把你们献给哈卡！"
G["Make ready for battle, my creations."]="准备作战吧，我的孩子们。"
G["Make ready the chambers, another ally will soon join our ranks!"]="准备好具化间，新的同盟很快就会加入我们！"
G["Make some noodle soup for your customer. This is a scholar so they like the simplicity of a standard noodle soup. Try making one now."]="为你的客人煮汤面吧。这是一位学者，他们都喜欢简单清爽的汤面。试着做一碗吧。"
G["Make sure everything is ready.  The orcs' emissary is ready to meet Sylvanas inside the cathedral."]="做好一切准备。兽人使者就要在这座教堂里与希尔瓦娜斯会面了。"
G["Make sure my name is spelled correctly on the tombst--"]="一定要确保我在墓碑上的名字拼写正确……"
G["Make sure these Broken are thoroughly cleaned before touching the water."]="确保这些在破碎者在接触水源之前消过毒。"
G["Make sure to tend those scallions. After that, nothing to do but wait until tomorrow when they'll be nice and ripe."]="好好照顾那些葱。然后就耐心等待明天的到来吧，它们会长得成熟喜人。"
G["Make sure to visit the Gizmotronic Apparatus to grab a lockpick and an E.C.A.C. You will definitely need both to complete your mission!"]="别忘了在我的机械设备中拿取一份大饼干和盗贼工具，你的任务需要使用这两件东西！"
G["Make sure we always have camouflage up. The orcs in Render's Valley will kill us both if we're spotted."]="随时确认我们是否处于伪装状态。要是被撕裂者山谷的兽人发现，我们两个就都没命了。"
G["Make sure you are all on guard for any more Alliance attacks."]="所有人，全力防范联盟的攻击。"
G["Make sure you not forget anything. I forgot stuff once."]="看看你有没有忘记什么东西啊。我以前就老忘事儿。"
G["Make sure you pull plenty of moolah out of the bank. I don't want you buying any of that cheap clothing you usually like to wear. This party's important!"]="一定要从那个银行里拿到足够的钱。我可不希望你还去买你平时喜欢穿的那种廉价衣服。这可是个重要的聚会！"
G["Make sure you stick around for the next firework show!  Starting at 6PM, they're every hour on the hour!"]="下次烟火表演的时候你一定要来这里看哦！下午6点开始，每个准点的时刻都会有表演哦！"
G["Make sure you weren't followed, mon!"]="确保你没被跟踪，朋友！"
G["Make sure your blades are sharp. We've got enemies to cleave today!"]="让你们的武器保持锋利。我们今天将要上阵杀敌！"
G["Make the call, Commander. I'll tear the bottom half of their base apart."]="指挥官，发号令吧。我会彻底粉碎他们的基地！"
G["Make the journey to Orgrimmar and seek him out in the Valley of Honor. He works in a shop called the Arms of Legend."]="到奥格瑞玛的荣誉谷去找他。他在那里有一家名叫“传说中的装备”的小店。"
G["Make their deaths quick! We have much to do!"]="迅速干掉他们！还有很多事情要做！"
G["Make them pay!"]="让他们付出代价！"
G["Make them work faster!"]="让他们再干快点！"
G["Make this inn your home."]="将这座旅店设为你的家。"
G["Make this quick, $c. The Warchief personally sent me to evaluate our progress in the Barrens, and when I get here I find our towns aflame and Alliance dogs running amok."]="快一点， $c。酋长亲自派我来评估我们在贫瘠之地的工作进展，然而我却在这里看到我们的城镇燃起大火，联盟败狗肆无忌惮地发狂。"
G["Make use of every resource! Leave them nowhere to run!"]="利用每一点资源！让他们无路可逃！"
G["Make way for da Nalorakk!"]="纳洛拉克，变形，出发！"
G["Make way!"]="让开！"
G["Make way!  A wyrm is coming to our aid!"]="前进！有条巨龙来帮助我们啦！"
G["Make what out, exactly?"]="到底要打什么？"
G["Make with more left right punch and runs!"]="多用左右摆拳，多跑动！"
G["Make your mind as calm as still water. Breathe deeply. And be at peace."]="让你的思绪澄净如水。深呼吸，然后保持平静。"
G["Make your preparations, $n, but do it quickly!"]="去做准备吧，$n，但动作要快！"
G["Make your search fast, I have to be somewhere."]="搜查快一点，我还要赶时间呢。"
G["Make your time, mortals.  You will never defeat the Occulus!"]="把握机会吧，凡人。奥库鲁斯永远都不会被打败！"
G["Make your way back to Taran Zhu. I'll catch up with you shortly."]="回去找祝踏岚吧。我很快就会追上你的。"
G["Make your way through the maze of Eye Sores while avoiding Durumu's Disintegration Beam."]="在躲避杜鲁姆的衰变光束的同时走出炙眼灼光的迷宫。"
G["Make yourself useful and heal me, Paxton!"]="发挥你的作用，快治疗我，帕克斯顿！"
G["Make yourself useful and help me out here!"]="别那么没用，帮帮我的忙！"
G["Makes me shudder even ta think."]="我想到就会发抖。"
G["Making it out of here without a blade in your back or poison in your veins would be an accomplishment."]="不借助刀具或是毒药离开这儿就算完成任务。"
G["Maktu doesn't recognize you, $r, but he is pleased to meet you. If ever you need to buy or repair armor, look no further than Maktu."]="玛克图不认识你，$r。但是他很高兴和你相识。如果你需要购买或修理，就找玛克图。"
G["Mal'Ganis appears to have more than Scourge in his arsenal. We should make haste."]="看来玛尔加尼斯除了天灾军团的亡灵大军外，还另有秘密武器。我们得抓紧时间了。"
G["Mal'Ganis is not making this easy."]="玛尔加尼斯不会让我们好过的。"
G["Mal'Ganis will pay for this."]="玛尔加尼斯必将为此付出代价。"
G["Mal'Ganis will send out some of his Scourge minions to interfere with us. Those of you with the strongest steel and magic shall go forth and destroy them. I will lead the rest of my forces in purging Stratholme of the infected."]="玛尔加尼斯肯定会派出天灾部队阻挠我们。我希望能有些精通剑术或魔法的勇士对抗天灾士兵。而我，会率领剩余的军队清理斯坦索姆中的亡灵，将全城拯救出来。"
G["Malfurion is not here. Only me."]="玛法里奥不会来的。只有我在。"
G["Malfurion may not say it aloud, but he was greatly concerned for the coming of your people."]="玛法里奥也许不会把他的想法挂在嘴边，但他却一直在关注着你的族人。"
G["Malfurion strikes me as both wise and honest.  I take him at his word.  I'd welcome more answers, but it's not my place."]="玛法里奥的智慧和诚实令我折服。我相信了他的说法。也许还有其他的答案，但与我无关。"
G["Malfurion!"]="玛法里奥！"
G["Malfurion, a coward? How can you justify that?"]="玛法里奥是懦夫？你有什么证据吗？"
G["Malfurion, he has done it! The portal is collapsing!"]="玛法里奥，他成功了！传送门崩溃了！"
G["Malik the Unscathed."]="无伤者玛里克。"
G["Maloriak, try not to lose to these mortals. Semicompetent help is SO hard to create."]="马洛拉克，尽量别输给那些凡人。“半称职”的帮手可是很难创造的。"
G["Malorne somehow manages to pick the most delicate herbs without damaging them.  Certainly he is the one you should learn from.  He lives just east of the Inn in Dolanaar."]="不知道玛洛尼是如何采集到那些最为娇嫩的草药的。显然你得向他多多学习。他就住在多兰纳尔的旅店东边。"
G["Malton, you dummy!"]="玛尔顿，你这个蠢货！"
G["Malukaz chatters incessantly about the historical importance of this forest, but I don't have the luxury of indulging in history until our present problems are settled.\n\nI'm not saying his work here isn't important, but someone has to see to the defenses and logistics of running the hold."]="玛鲁卡兹喋喋不休地讲述着这片森林的辉煌历史，但是在我们解决掉现在的问题前，我不会再奢靡无度了。\n\n我不是说他在这里的工作不重要，但是必须有人要去检查一下要塞的防御和后勤工作。"
G["Malygos - in the open? I hadn't dared hope for an opportunity such as this. I'll assemble our bretheren at once!"]="玛里苟斯——现身？天大的好机会啊。我这就去召集同胞！"
G["Malygos has clearly gone insane."]="玛里苟斯显然是疯了。"
G["Malygos is my answer."]="我的答案是玛里苟斯。"
G["Malygos the Spellweaver, the Lord of Magic, Master of the Blue Dragonflight. He is the blue dragon aspect, one of the most ancient creatures on Azeroth.\n\nHe is said to be recovering from a madness which has lasted for millennia, but his recent actions lead me to believe that he is still far from sane.\n\nHis solution to our dilemma is to search out and destroy every magic-wielding mortal on Azeroth.\n\nAs the guardians of life, this has forced the red dragonflight to take action.\n\nDragon now fights against dragon, and the fate of our frail world lies in the balance."]="魔法之王玛里苟斯是蓝龙军团的统帅。作为蓝龙守护者，他是艾泽拉斯世界最古老的生物之一。\n\n据说他已经从数千年来的疯狂中觉醒，可是他最近的行为表明他远没有恢复理智。\n\n对于我们的困境，他竟然决定以摧毁艾泽拉斯世界所有施法者的方式来解决。\n\n生命守护者红龙不得不采取行动。\n\n蓝龙军团和红龙军团展开了一场激战，世界的命运，就取决于那脆弱的平衡。"
G["Malygos' most powerful agents protect the rings above.  Alone, you cannot hope to defeat them.  We can grant you power to call upon drakes from our dragon flights.  Mounted on the back of a drake, you will be able to fly here in the Oculus and command powerful dragon magic."]="玛里苟斯最强大的仆从守卫着上层的环。单凭你的力量，根本不可能战胜他们。我们将赋予你召唤幼龙的能力。你可以骑着幼龙在魔环飞翔并使用强大的龙族魔法。"
G["Malygos, is it?"]="玛里苟斯，是吗？"
G["Malygos, my lord... I did my... best."]="玛里苟斯大人……我……尽力了……"
G["Mama Bramblestaff often told me if I didn't stop breaking her vases she would ship me off to the Dungeons of Dojan."]="棘杖妈妈经常告诉我，要是我继续打烂她的花瓶，她就把我送到都阳地下城去。"
G["Mama loves oranges, but oranges are so hard to find in the Valley.\n\nI tell my son to buy some oranges at the market, so I give him some copper.\n\nWhat does he do? He buys some beans!\n\nWe are not farmers! We are yak-herders! What do I do with stupid beans, I ask you?"]="妈妈喜欢吃橙子，但在谷里很难找到橙子。\n\n我给我的儿子一些铜钱，让他去市集上买一些橘子。\n\n然后他做了什么？他买了一些豆子！\n\n我们又不是农民！我们是放养牦牛的牧民！我问你，我该怎么处理这些愚蠢的豆子？"
G["Mama! I'm coming home, Mama!"]="妈妈！我要回家，妈妈！"
G["Mama?"]="妈妈？"
G["Man am I tired!"]="我累了！"
G["Man down!"]="阵亡！"
G["Man down!  We've got a man down!  Get him back up as soon as you can!"]="有人倒下了！我们有人倒下了！尽快让他站起来！"
G["Man the harpoon cannon!"]="鱼叉炮准备！"
G["Man'ari... But how... We are not eredar! She must know! If there are others like her, we must find them and explain..."]="腐蚀者……但是……我们不是艾瑞达人！她必须明白这一点！如果还有其他类似她的生物，我们必须找到他们，给他们解释……"
G["Man, oh man...Just look at that amazing view! Are those LIONS? Oops, almost let go of the steering wheel there."]="天哪，哦，天哪……看看这惊人的景色！那些是狮子吗？哦，我差一点松开了操纵杆。"
G["Man, that will never work. The iron dwarves are never gonna fall for that hunk o' junk!"]="朋友，这行不通的。铁矮人才不会喜欢那个大家伙！"
G["Man... I thought I had that one..."]="大哥……我觉得差不多可以了……"
G["Mana Loom"]="魔法织布机"
G["Mana gem..."]="魔力宝石……"
G["Manach sheek-thrish!"]="¡Manach sheek-thrish!"
G["Manaforge Duro is the closest facility to Tempest Keep, so it handles most of the load.\n\nAs you should know, overloading these manaforges causes leaks in the pipelines.  The emanating energy attracts unwanted mana creatures.  We've had mana creature infestations at many leak locations; Manaforge Duro is being hit the hardest at the moment."]="Forja de Maná Duro son las instalaciones más cercanas a El Castillo de la Tempestad, así que se ocupa de la mayor parte de la carga.\n\nComo deberías saber, si estas forjas de maná se sobrecargan se producen derrames en los conductos y a veces no solo se derrama maná. Hemos tenido plagas de criaturas de maná en muchos puntos en que ha habido derrames; la Forja de Maná Duro fue la peor parada, hace un tiempo.\n\nPor lo menos no explotó como la Forja de Maná Ultris."
G["Manaforge Ultris, of course!  Where have you been?\n\nThe manaforge was overloaded and created a huge explosion.  It left a tear in reality and now void creatures have been pouring in through it.  You can see them all over the place towards the northeast."]="当然是法力熔炉：乌提斯！你以为是哪里？\n\n那个法力熔炉由于超过负荷而造成了大爆炸。事实上，它已经被完全摧毁了，而现在虚空生物正川流不息地在那里涌现，就在东北方向，到处都是。"
G["Manaforge shutdown aborted.  Resuming manaforge activity."]="法力熔炉停机中断。恢复法力熔炉运作。"
G["Managed to find me, eh? No matter, you won't live to tell anyone of it!"]="终于找到我了？没关系，你不可能有机会再把这件事告诉别人了！"
G["Mandokir sure do love his raptors."]="曼多基尔一定很爱他的迅猛龙。"
G["Mankers?"]="蠢货？"
G["Mantid and mogu alike were brought low by the hero's fury."]="用怒火折服了螳螂妖和魔古族。"
G["Mantid are born with little on their mind but a lust for battle. Participation in a swarm is not only a cultural rite of passage - it is the catalyst for our physical maturation.\n\nOnly those who return from battle can develop from a swarmborn into a fully-aware, individual citizen."]="螳螂妖生来脑子就缺根筋，却极度渴望战争。参与到集群战争中不仅仅是一种文化上的进阶仪式——还是身体成熟的催化剂。\n\n只有那些从战场上归来的勇士，才能从聚生虫成长为有完整自主意识的个体公民。"
G["Mantid?"]="螳螂妖？"
G["Many Argent Dawn are numbered amongst the simpletons that have fallen before me. The Argent Crusade will prove no different."]="我的双手沾满了银色黎明成员的鲜血。银色北伐军也会落得同样的下场。"
G["Many Frenzyheart lost at broken pillar. Today is not Zepik's day to be lost too."]="许多狂心狼獾人都在破柱子附近失踪了。今天不会轮到瑟匹克吧。"
G["Many an advantage can be gained from getting to know your enemy.  Take that lesson to heart, $n.\n\nThe more we learn about the Scourge the better prepared we are to defeat them."]="Se pueden obtener muchas ventajas conociendo al enemigo. Apréndete esa lección, $n.\n\nCuanto más sepamos sobre la Plaga, más bien preparados estaremos para derrotarlos."
G["Many animals lost their lives so that we could gain these materials. Do not take their sacrifice lightly, $n. Handle the leather with the respect it deserves."]="我们可以从死去的动物身上获得原料。别无视它们的牺牲，$n。带着尊敬来处理这些皮革。"
G["Many are the paths of the Earth Mother.  May your ancestors watch over you $c."]="这些都是大地之母走过的道路。愿你的祖先保佑你$c。"
G["Many are the paths of the Earth Mother.  Wherever you decide to travel, may she watch over you."]="这些道路都是大地之母走过的道路。无论你决定前往何方，愿大地之母与你同在。"
G["Many are the paths of the Light, $c.  You must decide which to follow on this world, or any other."]="圣光为我们指引了许多道路，$c。你必须决定要走哪一条。"
G["Many are the rare and precious objects that my clientele seek.\n\nYou could be the one to bring them to me, $c. In return I offer that which you covet.\n\nShall we speak more on that which I look to procure today?"]="这些珍贵的器物都是我的客户指名预订的呢。\n\n$c，只要你能帮我找回来，我是绝对不会亏待你的，我懂你的心思啦。\n\n我们来谈谈今天的订单如何？"
G["Many artifacts lay here, seemingly discarded. Most appear to have come from Garrosh's dig site in the Vale of Eternal Blossoms. Whatever he is trying to find, it does not appear to be among these forgotten relics."]="这里放着许多遗物，似乎都已经被丢弃了。大部分好像都是来自加尔鲁什在锦绣谷的挖掘场。无论他想在那里找到什么，看来都不包括这些被遗忘的文物。"
G["Many bad fortunes to you!"]="祝你倒大霉！"
G["Many beautiful flowers grow around here, but my favorite is the Marsh Lily. Unfortunately, those gorgeous blooms are rare to find."]="这附近长着很多漂亮的花，而我最喜欢的是泽地百合。可惜，那种美丽的花很难找到。"
G["Many champions have fallen to the skills displayed by $n.  We are proud to present this formidable $c."]="许多勇士都败在了$n的手中。现在，我们将骄傲地介绍这位可怕的$c。"
G["Many changes are occuring here, young one.  Do not fret if you see anything out of place...such as me.  Moo."]="这里发生了许多变化，年轻人。不管看到什么奇怪的东西都不要惊慌……比如我。哞。"
G["Many changes come to the land and water: you, them... much change.\n\nKamagua's way of life is threatened by these changes. What will you do?"]="沧海桑田，你，还有他们……世事变幻。\n\n卡玛古因此受到威胁。你能为我们做些什么呢？"
G["Many confuse the Earthen Ring with the Cenarion Circle. ...I TOLD Thrall we should rename ourselves the \"Earthen Square\"."]="Muchos confunden el Anillo de la Tierra con el Círculo Cenarion. Le DIJE a Thrall que debíamos cambiarnos el nombre a \"Cuadrado de la Tierra\"."
G["Many good fortunes to you. I am Brother Rabbitsfoot. I am a merchant, a traveller, and a big luckydo for grummles.\n\nIn times of peace, $p would do well to buy of my wares. But fortune has us meet this day.\n\nWe have much work to do together."]="祝你好运。我是堂弟兔子脚。我是个商人、旅行者，对土地精来说还是一个特大幸运符。\n\n在和平时期，$p买我的商品会有好运。但好运让我们在今天相逢。\n\n我们有很多事情要一起做。"
G["Many great conflicts have occurred in these swamps. I can still feel the lingering energy."]="在这片沼泽里发生过许多重大冲突。我仍然能感觉到那久未散尽的能量。"
G["Many have been lost to the seas.  I, and the wisps, are charged with looking for those souls."]="很多人葬身大海。我和小精灵负责在海面上搜寻灵魂。"
G["Many have come from all corners of the land to see the gates opened at last. Indeed, many of your people have already found their way inside. Seek your own solace and refuge within."]="许多人从四面八方赶来，亲眼见证大门的开启。确实，你的许多族人都已经进去了。你也去里面寻找慰藉和庇护吧。"
G["Many have come to this sanctuary, few have left."]="我们可不能惹恼了他。他发起火来就没有节制啦。"
G["Many have fallen within Valhalas and their corpses are a testament to the strength of our ways.\n\nWill your bones litter this place of honor and battle as well, $n?"]="Muchos han caído dentro de Valhalas y sus cadáveres son el testamento de la fuerza de nuestros métodos.\n\n¿Quedarán también tus huesos esparcidos en este lugar de honor y batalla, $n?"
G["Many have tested my claim, and I yet stand proven."]="试者连连，屡试不爽。"
G["Many imps! Handle it!"]="好多小鬼！快解决他们！"
G["Many locked boxes of supplies were sunk by the orcs in Lake Everstill in Redridge."]="兽人将许多带锁的物资箱沉入了赤脊山的止水湖。"
G["Many locked supply boxes were lost when the Naga overran the Zoram Strand in Ashenvale."]="在纳迦侵袭灰谷佐拉姆海岸时，许多带锁的物资箱都丢失啦。"
G["Many of the Mogu emperors buried their servants with them trapping their spirits in servitude for eternity."]="很多魔古帝王都让他们的仆从殉葬以困住他们的灵魂，这些仆从只能永远侍奉他们的主人。"
G["Many of the priesthood had been slain by the same magisters who now vowed to serve the naaru.  They were not happy to share the city with their former enemies."]="许多传教士曾经被那些如今发誓效忠纳鲁的魔导师们杀死。他们对于和旧日的敌人同住在一座城市里面感到非常不悦。"
G["Many of the supplies that tradesmen need can be found in the world. For those that cannot, I provide a limited selection for fair price."]="你所需要的东西很多都可以在普通商人那里找到。对于一些很难找到的东西，我可以为你限量提供，而且价格公道。"
G["Many of the supplies the tailors need come by way of Darnassus.  It is not surprising that they all moved there to work.  If you wish to be a tailor then you best head to Darnassus."]="裁缝所需的多数物品都是从达纳苏斯获得的。他们都在那儿工作，这并不是件奇怪的事情。要是你想成为一名裁缝的话，你最好前往达纳苏斯。"
G["Many of us tried to escape the naga.\n\nI am the only one who succeeded..."]="我们许多人都试图逃离纳迦。\n\n我是唯一成功的幸运儿……"
G["Many of you have experienced a betrayal of trust."]="你们中的大多数都体会过被背叛的苦楚。"
G["Many people forget that a fine brew has equal application in cooking as it does for drinking! There's nothing in all of Pandaria quite like my famous Honeydew glazed fish!"]="许多人都忘了，美酒不仅可以用来喝，还能用来烹饪美食！在全潘达利亚，没什么能跟我大名鼎鼎的蜜露烤鱼相提并论！"
G["Many thanks for rescue of most good fortune."]="多谢你拯救了大部分好运气。"
G["Many thanks for rescue!"]="多谢营救！"
G["Many thanks to you, $c.  I'd best get to the crash site and see how I can help out.  Until we meet again."]="万分感谢，$c。我最好返回坠毁点，看看有什么需要帮忙的。下次再见。"
G["Many thanks!"]="非常感谢！"
G["Many thanks! \n\nThe local earth spirit, Hui, is angry that we hired adventurers to drive off his mischievous sprites. \n\nI can understand he's upset, but this attack is simply going too far!"]="非常感谢！\n\n由于我们雇用冒险者帮忙驱赶那些淘气的精灵，土灵仇灰为此大发雷霆。\n\n我能理解他的烦乱，可这攻击也太过分了！"
G["Many thanks! Allow me to repay you by killing a few dozen of these beasts!"]="非常感谢！我也去杀那些野蛮人，就当算是感谢你，帮你的忙了。"
G["Many thanks! This is the last time we travel west of the wall."]="感谢你！这是我最后一次在城墙的西边旅行。"
G["Many thanks, $c!"]="非常感谢，$c！"
G["Many thanks, $n.  These horns are going to make me a fortune!"]="太感谢你了，$n。这些角会给我带来好运的！"
G["Many thanks, hero!"]="太感谢你了，英雄！"
G["Many thanks."]="非常感谢。"
G["Many thanks... I couldn't have held out much longer."]="非常感谢……我已经坚持不了多久了。"
G["Many thanks... I couldn't have held out much longer.\nAlas, I'm in no condition to go on.\nIf only our entire supply of Greenstone Brew hadn't been stolen!  I would've concocted a draft of marvelous power for you..."]="Muchas gracias... No habría aguantado mucho más.\n\nPor desgracia, no estoy en condiciones de seguir.\n\n¡Ojalá no nos hubieran robado todas nuestras reservas de brebaje de Verdemar! Os habría elaborado una bebida con un poder maravilloso..."
G["Many things to sell, yes. Yak-hair amulets. Very popular. Very lucky."]="是的，好货品应有尽有。看看这用牦牛毛做的护符。非常热销。非常好运。"
G["Many think the staff an inferior weapon. I challenge any who think so to prove their strength against my staff."]="许多人认为法杖是一种下等的武器。我向所有这么认为的人发出挑战，让他们挑战我的法杖以证明他们的实力。"
G["Many thousands of years ago, the mogu held all the power. They ruled this land with fists of iron. But as their empire grew, they needed a way to police and control it."]="几千年前，魔古族掌握着所有的力量，他们残暴地统治着这片土地。但是随着帝国的不断发展壮大，他们需要维持秩序并加以控制。"
G["Many times have I fallen at the hands of an Orc, and many times have I risen again."]="我一次又一次倒在兽人手下，一次又一次地站了起来。"
G["Many times my blades have felled my target before they even drew near. The secret is in the flick of your wrist."]="好几次我仅用刀就吓退了试图靠近袭击我的敌人。秘密就在于手腕的动作。"
G["Many were the threats to our race after the usurpers remade the world. Narrow was the path ahead."]="自从篡位者改变了世界后，我们的种族就受到了很多威胁。前途渺茫。"
G["Many would tell you that the Tallstrider is a laughable pet. But it's intelligence and loyalty make it a hard creature to match in many situations. If you are interested in the breed, then perhaps I can introduce you and your pet to a few talents I have learned over the years."]="许多人也许会告诉你把陆行鸟作为宠物是一件可笑的事情。但是它的智力和忠诚度使其可以成为你最好的伙伴。如果你对它感兴趣的话，我可以向你和你的宠物传授一些技能。"
G["Many years ago I died tragically while attempting to help with a local murloc problem. However, I was content to stay and watch my family and friends instead of passing on to be with the Goddess.\n\nNow they are all gone, or worse, dead, and I have only one reason to stay.\n\nVengeance."]="多年以前，我本想帮助解决本地的鱼人问题，不料却因此而悲惨地丢了性命。但值得欣慰的是我并未如其他灵魂一般前往女神身边，而是得以留在这里继续看着我的家人和朋友。\n\n现在，他们都已经离开，甚至去世了。我留在这里的理由就只剩下了一个。\n\n复仇。"
G["Many years ago, my men and I followed the wizard Khadgar and the paladin Turalyon to this world. Our sole aim was to annihilate the orcs and their vile kin. Yet something went terribly wrong in the final hours of our war.\n\nUltimately, this dark world was ripped asunder - and my dear friends were lost to the void."]="很多年以前，我和我的部下追随着卡德加和图拉扬来到这个世界。我们唯一的目标是消灭兽人和他们卑鄙的同类。然而在战争的最后时刻，有些事情变得十分糟糕。\n\n最终，这个黑暗的世界变得支离破碎——而我亲爱的朋友们则消失在虚空中。"
G["Many young Pandaren warriors have vanished into this...tomb. Have your wits about you."]="许多年轻的熊猫人都在这墓穴里……蒸发了。时刻保持警惕。"
G["Mar'kowa tallol ye'tarin, it knows, it knows."]="Mar'kowa tallol ye'tarin，它知道，它明白。"
G["Marauders to the north! Fire!"]="北边发现敌人！开火！"
G["Maraudon is located in the middle of the western coast of Desolace, in the Valley of Spears."]="玛拉顿位于凄凉之地西部中间的长矛谷中。"
G["Maraudon is one of the most sacred sites within Desolace. The great temple/cavern is the burial place of Zaetar, one of two immortal sons born to the demigod, Cenarius. Legend holds that Zaetar and the earth elemental princess, Theradras, sired the misbegotten centaur race. It is said that upon their emergence, the barbaric centaur turned on their father and killed him. Some believe that Theradras, in her grief, trapped Zaetar's spirit within the winding cavern - used its energies for some malign purpose."]="玛拉顿被狂暴的玛拉顿半人马所保护，那是凄凉之地最神圣的地方。玛拉顿是札尔塔的伟大神庙，札尔塔使半神塞纳留斯不朽的儿子之一。传说札尔塔和瑟莱德丝大地元素公主的私生子成为了半人马种族。据说半人马这个野蛮的种族在其出生了之後就开始转向他们的父亲并将其杀死。有些人则相信瑟莱德丝在悲伤中将札尔塔的灵魂困了起来，并将其藏在洞中——利用它的能量来达到一些不可告人的目的。"
G["March of the Legion"]="军团的远征"
G["Marduk, gather the box and place it before me!"]="马杜克，把箱子放在我面前！"
G["Marines, Sergeants, attack!"]="将士们，给我进攻！"
G["Marines, stand at ease!"]="陆战队员，稍息！"
G["Marion Call is keeping Dark Cleric Beryl company in the reading room upstairs at the Gallows' End Tavern on the southeast edge of Brill.  I'm just dying to see who wins that staring contest."]="马里恩·考尔和黑暗牧师贝里尔一起在布瑞尔镇东南角恐惧之末旅店楼上的阅览室中。我只是想看看谁是这场对抗的胜利者。"
G["Marion Call is lurking under the stairs in the inn."]="马里恩·考尔就藏在这家旅店的楼梯下面。"
G["Mark II, get your metallic behind back here this instant!"]="麦克斯米林II型，马上把你的金属背板对着这里！"
G["Mark my words!  You won't find faster gryphons anywhere in the Eastern Kingdoms than the ones right here in Thelsamar!"]="记得我的话！你在东部王国是找不到比塞尔萨玛狮鹫更快的狮鹫的！"
G["Mark my words! I'm gonna get you, $n! I'll get you all! Out of my way!"]="¡Recuerda mis palabras! ¡Te mataré! ¡Os mataré a todos! ¡Largo!"
G["Mark my words, I will catch you, imp. And when I do!"]="记住我的话，我会抓住你的，小鬼。我会的！"
G["Mark my words, these forsaken fools will be the death of us all!"]="记住我说过的话，这帮愚蠢的被遗忘者迟早会毁了我们！"
G["Markhor, I wish to stable my pet."]="马克霍尔，我要把我的宠物收藏起来。"
G["Marksmen! Front and center! Scourge attack incoming!"]="射手！天灾军团朝要塞发动了正面攻击！"
G["Marksmen, form up and take your positions!"]="射手，列队准备！"
G["Marksmen, lock and load!"]="射手，瞄准目标！"
G["Marlgen... One of the jailors. He has the key to my bonds."]="玛尔根……他是一个狱卒。他应该有那把钥匙。"
G["Marooned! Blasted to bits by the Alliance and stranded on some island in the middle of who-knows-where?!\n\nBusiness as usual, right, $n?"]="¡Abandonados! ¡Destrozados por la Alianza y varados en una isla en mitad de quién-sabe-dónde!\n\nAsí son los negocios, ¿eh, $n?"
G["Marry me, $p!"]="嫁给我吧，$p！"
G["Marshal Marris expects the reserve from Stormwind any time now. . . ."]="马瑞斯大人无时无刻不在期待着暴风城的增援……"
G["Marshal Marris, sir.  Corporal Keeshan of the 12th Sabre Regiment returned from battle and reporting for duty!"]="马瑞斯大人！第12军团的基沙恩下士从战场返回，前来报到！"
G["Marshal Troteman and a handful o' scouts pursued a Horde warband up the beach. They haven't come back."]="托德曼元帅和几个斥候追击一支部落小队去了海滩，至今还没回来。"
G["Marshal Windsor has been expecting you, $n. Unfortunately, he is currently indisposed. He should be returning shortly."]="温德索尔元帅一直都盼着你呢，$n。不幸的是，眼下他身染微恙，不过应该很快就能康复。"
G["Marshal our forces. Contact our goblin shipwrights. The Horde prepares for war!"]="召集军队，联络地精造船商！部落要开战了！"
G["Marshal, excellent work fortifying the harbor. Our next priority is -"]="元帅，干得好。港口防御得到了巩固。接下来——"
G["Marshal, see to it that you hold this position until construction is complete."]="元帅，你一定要守住这地方，直到建设完成。"
G["Marshals... brothers and sisters of the sword.  I'd rather fight alongside you than any army of thousands.  We are lions!  You know what's waiting through these demons and beyond that Dark Portal?  Immortality!  Take it!"]="军官们……生死与共的兄弟姐妹们。比起指挥千军万马，我宁可与你们并肩血战。我们是一群狮子！你们知道在黑暗之门和这些恶魔背后有什么在等待着我们吗？是永恒！是不朽！"
G["Martar wants a furry buddy!!"]="马尔泰想要个毛茸茸的伙伴！！"
G["Martek, you are the bravest orc I know."]="马特克，你是我所知道的最勇敢的兽人。"
G["Martha, I'm out of flour for bread. You wouldn't happen to have any grain from that recent shipment, would you?"]="马尔萨，我的面粉用光啦。最近不是刚运来一批粮食吗，你能借我一些面粉吗？"
G["Martha, something's wrong with this grain! Some of the Prince's soldiers were looking for this. I'm going to go look for one."]="马尔萨，面粉有问题！王子正在寻找被动过手脚的粮食。我这就向他的士兵汇报。"
G["Marvel at its tenacity and vigor! A champion has been found!"]="令人钦佩的坚韧与魄力！一位新的勇士诞生啦！"
G["Marvelous! You bound ahead with more haste than a flame-laden kitten. Quite suitable indeed!"]="真是不可思议！你向前蹦的速度简直比被火烧了尾巴的小猫更快。实在是太合适了！"
G["Marvelous. Simply marvelous. You are an inspiration to us all, $n."]="不可思议。太不可思议了。你给了我们启迪，$n。"
G["Marwyn, finish them..."]="玛维恩，干掉他们……"
G["Mary Edras is the one you want. She's set up at the inner ring of the Rogues' Quarter."]="你可以找玛丽·艾塔斯谈一谈。她就呆在盗贼区的内环区域。"
G["Masha, go to our tent and hide yourself away."]="玛莎，快到我们帐篷那边去躲起来。"
G["Masha, we have to run. We must get far away from here. They will come for us."]="玛莎，我们必须逃走。逃得远远的。他们会来找我们的。"
G["Mason, sir."]="泥瓦匠，长官。"
G["Masses of wolves are to the east, and whoever lived at Malden's Orchard is gone."]="大量的狼都在往东边迁徙，而住在玛尔丁果园里的人也都跑光了。"
G["Massive Qiraji resonating crystals break through the earthen crust of Kalimdor. Colossal creatures made of obsidian stone breach the freshly broken land."]="巨大的其拉共鸣水晶穿破了卡利姆多的地壳，由黑曜石构成的巨大生物来到了这片刚刚破碎的大陆。"
G["Master Boom Boom ready to boom up some wikkets!"]="布姆布姆大师准备要炸飞一些蠢蛋了！"
G["Master Boom Boom's got some super boom sticks."]="布姆布姆大师这儿有超级强大的火器。"
G["Master Brownstone and his crew have fallen asleep!"]="褐石大师和他的小队睡着了！"
G["Master Brownstone and his lackeys are notorious for sleeping on the job."]="褐石大师和他的那些手下因为时常在工作中偷懒睡觉而臭名昭著。"
G["Master Cheng is burning you alive!  Move!"]="程大师要把你活活烧死！快走开！"
G["Master Cheng is spinning!  Paralyze her!"]="程大师正在旋转！使她瘫痪！"
G["Master Crane! Are you okay?"]="神鹤大师！你还好吗？"
G["Master Hight is burning you alive.  Move!"]="海特大师要把你活活烧死。快走开！"
G["Master Hight is healing.  Interrupt him!"]="海特大师正在治疗。打断他！"
G["Master Hight is preparing a massive strike with his polearm.  Disarm him!"]="海特大师正准备用长矛发起重击！将他缴械！"
G["Master Hight is spinning.  Paralyze him!"]="海特大师正在旋转。使他瘫痪！"
G["Master Hsu prepares a hard-hitting swing with his polearm.  Disarm him before he can complete it!"]="许大师准备用手中的长矛发起一记重击！在他得手前将他缴械！"
G["Master Jiying says we have to continue our research, but it's nice to come here and relax every once in a while."]="基赢大师说我们必须继续研究，但偶尔来这里放松一下也是不错的事情。"
G["Master Kistane is running away to heal at a nearby Jade Serpent Statue.  Slow her and defeat her before she can heal herself!"]="吉斯坦大师跑去附近的青龙雕像处寻求治疗。拖住她，在她伤愈前将她击败！"
G["Master Li Fei fades away."]="李飞大师消失了。"
G["Master Li Fei's voice echoes, \"Go, children. We shall meet again very soon.\""]="Se oye la voz del maestro Li Fei: \"Adelante, jóvenes. Nos volveremos a ver muy pronto\"."
G["Master Li Fei's voice echoes, \"Huo, the spirit of fire, is known for his hunger. He wants for tinder to eat. He needs the caress of the wind to rouse him.\""]="Se oye la voz del maestro Li Fei: \"Huo, el espíritu del fuego, es famoso por su hambre. Ansía yesca para comer. Necesita la caricia del viento para despertarse\"."
G["Master Li Fei's voice echoes, \"If you find these things and bring them to his cave, on the far side of Wu-Song Village, you will face a challenge within.\""]="Se oye la voz del maestro Li Fei: \"Si encuentras estas cosas y se las llevas a su cueva, al otro lado del Aldea Wu-Song, tendrás que enfrentarte a un reto\"."
G["Master Li Fei's voice echoes, \"It is good to see you again, Aysa. You've come with respect, and so I shall give you the answers you seek.\""]="Se oye la voz del maestro Li Fei: \"Me alegro de volver a verte, Aysa. Has venido con respeto, por lo que te daré las respuestas que buscas\"."
G["Master Li Fei's voice echoes, \"Overcome that challenge, and you shall be graced by Huo's presence. Rekindle his flame, and if your spirit is pure, he shall follow you.\""]="Se oye la voz del maestro Li Fei: \"Supera ese reto y se te concederá el honor de contar con la presencia de Huo. Reaviva su llama y, si eres pura de espíritu, te seguirá\"."
G["Master Li Fei's voice echoes, \"The way of the Tushui... enlightenment through patience and meditation... the principled life.\""]="Se oye la voz del maestro Li Fei: \"El camino de los tushui... Iluminación a través de la paciencia y la meditación... Una vida de principios\"."
G["Master Nesingwary has a big hunt ahead of him.  I find helping him prepare for a day in the jungle is much more relaxing than helping him ready for combat.  Although I do miss some of those glorious moments on the battlefield."]="奈辛瓦里要出去狩猎。我发现帮助他做丛林狩猎的准备工作比做战争准备的工作轻松多了。尽管我错过了战场上的光辉岁月。"
G["Master Putress, a bat rider approaches!"]="普特雷斯大人，是蝙蝠骑士！"
G["Master Pyreanor can be found among Thrall's advisors in his fortress, Grommash Hold, in the Valley of Wisdom."]="身为萨尔酋长大人的顾问，派雷亚诺一直待在智慧谷的格罗玛什要塞里。"
G["Master Shang Xi, I would like to accompany the Alliance back to their home."]="尚喜师父，我想要加入联盟，一起返回他们的故乡。"
G["Master Shang has trained you well. Thank you, friend!"]="El maestro Shang te ha entrenado bien. ¡Gracias, $gamigo:amiga;!"
G["Master Snowdrift attacks you with his hand to hand techniques!"]="雪流大师以他的近身格斗技巧对你发动了攻击！"
G["Master Snowdrift is |cFFFF0000|Hspell:118961|h[Chasing]|h|r you! If he catches you he will use his |cFFFF0000|Hspell:106352|h[Tornado Slam]|h|r technique on you! Run away from Master Snowdrift until Chase Down expires!"]="雪流大师正在|cFFFF0000|Hspell:118961|h[追逐]|h|r你！如果被他抓住，他就会对你使用|cFFFF0000|Hspell:106352|h[狂风掼]|h|r！在追逐效果结束前，离雪流大师远点！"
G["Master Snowdrift speaks highly of how you can hold your own in a fight."]="雪流大师高度赞扬你在战斗中的表现。"
G["Master Snowdrift vanishes to the shadows and creates duplicate illusions of himself! Strike the illusions to dispel them!"]="雪流大师消失在暗影之中并造出了他的几个幻影！攻击这些幻影，驱散他们！"
G["Master Stone Fist is nearly unmatched in single combat. He once defeated nine hundred and ninety-nine challengers in a row."]="石拳大师在一对一的比试里几乎未尝一败。他的最高连胜纪录是九百九十九场。"
G["Master Stone Fist was right about you. You're good."]="石拳大师说的没错。你可真强。"
G["Master Stormrage. It's good to have you back in the waking world."]="怒风大师。你能回到清醒的世界真是太好了。"
G["Master Taerar no longer dwells here, fool. He has bestowed me with enough power to stop you!"]="El maestro Taerar ya no vive aquí, $gnecio:necia;. ¡Me ha otorgado suficiente poder para detenerte!"
G["Master Taerar will show you such wonder!"]="主人泰拉尔将让你见证奇迹！"
G["Master Thal'darah has sent me to rescue you. Climb on!"]="萨达拉大师派我来营救你。快上来！"
G["Master Vectus, I sense something strange within this container..."]="维克图斯大人，我觉得这个容器中有一些奇怪的东西……"
G["Master Woo Ping has mastered nearly every weapon known to man.  He is especially deadly with his sword techniques.  He spends a good deal of time over in the Weller's Arsenal waiting on new shipments of weapons to arrive if you need some training."]="吴平大师几乎懂得人类所知的所有武器的用法。在徒手搏斗中，他的觉醒之拳技能具有致命的攻击力。要是你需要训练的话，就去找他吧，他一般都在维勒武器店等待新武器的运送。"
G["Master Woo's defenses are nearing their maximum potential.  Use Touch of Death to finish her off!"]="吴大师的防御力已经接近极限。使用轮回之触来终结她！"
G["Master Yoon is healing, interrupt him!"]="尹大师正在治疗，快打断他！"
G["Master chef, can you train me in the culinary arts?"]="大厨师，你能教我做一手好菜吗？"
G["Master craftsman Omarion just vanished one night. Like a toot in the wind... Poof! Gone! Bah, now I'm the only one left to craft the goods for the boys on the front lines."]="大工匠奥玛里恩某个晚上消失了。就像是风中的柳絮一样……呼地一声就没了！好吧，现在我就是唯一能够为前线的那帮家伙打造装备的人了。"
G["Master!  We've found the traitor who escaped Vashj!  His body lies in front of me... lifeless!"]="主人！我们抓住了从瓦丝琪那里逃跑的叛徒！他的尸体就躺在我的面前！"
G["Master, I have failed you..."]="主人，我令你失望了……"
G["Master, I have failed..."]="主人，我失败了……"
G["Master, I lost my torch."]="师父，我的火炬不见了。"
G["Master, I require aid!"]="主人，我需要帮助！"
G["Master, I wish to review my advanced training."]="大师，我想要重温一下进阶训练。"
G["Master, I wish to review my basic training."]="大师，我想要重温一下基础训练。"
G["Master, a gift for you!"]="主人，这是奉献给您的礼物！"
G["Master, command me!"]="主人，指挥我！"
G["Master, dis mortal scum be double-crossin' us. Dey must be made to suffer!"]="主人，就是这个无耻的凡人出卖了我们。我们一定要好好教训他！"
G["Master, fill me with your glorious radiance!"]="主人，请让你的光辉照耀着我吧！"
G["Master, grant me strength."]="主人，赐予我力量。"
G["Master, my mission be complete."]="主人，我的任务完成了。"
G["Master, save me!!"]="主人，救救我！"
G["Master, they come...."]="主人，他们来了……"
G["Master, where have all the trees gone?"]="主人，树都去哪里了？"
G["Master, your wisdom is matched only by your hugeness!"]="主人，您的英明举世无双！"
G["Master... I have... failed."]="主人……我……失败了。"
G["Master... I've failed you..."]="主人……我辜负了你……"
G["Master... is my service... complete?"]="主人……我的使命……结束了吗？"
G["Master... you have guests."]="主人……您有客人了。"
G["Master... you want... I kill puny priest?  Make painful, yes?"]="主人……你要我……杀死这名小祭司？让他痛苦地死去，对吗？"
G["Master?"]="主人？"
G["Masterful."]="厉害。"
G["Masterfully done, $n."]="干得漂亮，$n。"
G["Masterfully done.\n\nWe wouldn't have succeeded without you."]="干得好。\n\n没有你，我们就无法成功。"
G["Masters, I pledge this $r to you!"]="¡Maestros, os ofrezco $geste:esta; $r!"
G["Match altitude and speed, Mister Gearchum."]="调整高度和速度，断轮先生。"
G["Mathias Shaw himself appointed me to assist the night elves."]="马迪亚斯·肖尔亲自派我来协助暗夜精灵。"
G["Mathreyn is skilled in the barbaric practice of skinning, if that is truly your wont. He supplies Sathein with hides; you can find them both just southwest of the Magister's Gate."]="如果你真能习惯的话，玛斯雷恩对野蛮的剥皮工作很在行。他在为萨瑟林提供皮料，你可以在魔导师之门的东南找到他们俩。"
G["Matis, blood elf lieutenant of the Sunhawks, you have been found guilty of genocide against the draenei people."]="玛提斯，炎鹰部队的血精灵中尉，你犯有对德莱尼人实施种族灭绝的罪行。"
G["Matoclaw believes that you may yet be redeemed. This is your chance to atone for siding with demons."]="麦托克劳相信，你仍值得被宽恕。这是你的机会，为投靠恶魔的行为赎罪。"
G["Matron!  Is that bad man going to eat us?"]="监护员！那个坏人是来吃我们的吗？"
G["Matron!  Is the Headless Horseman going to eat us?"]="监护员！无头骑士会吃掉我们吗？"
G["Matron, flee! They are ruthless...."]="主人，快逃！他们非常残忍！"
G["Matron, one has fallen!"]="主人，我不行了！"
G["Matron, the Conservatory has been breached!"]="主人，温室已经被攻破了！"
G["Matters are so uncertain now that the chamber below is empty..."]="世事无常啊，谁曾想到下面的大厅也会变得空旷……"
G["Matters of such an official nature are only handled in Darnassus.  You must travel there to begin the process of your guild's creation."]="官方事宜只能送交达纳苏斯处理。你必须前往那儿去创建自己的公会。"
G["Mau'ari know why you seek her out...\n\nBring me da E'ko you find in the world, an' I can transform it for you."]="玛艾里知道你为什么找她……\n\n带给我你找到的魂精，我就会为你转换它。"
G["Maul!  Swipe!  MANGLE!"]="乱锤掌！扫堂爪！裂伤牙！"
G["Maulgar is king!"]="莫加尔是大王！"
G["Mauri's death removes the protections from a nearby cauldron!"]="玛乌里的死亡移除了附近坩埚受到的保护！"
G["Mavren, I don't want excuses, I want results! The Farstriders aren't available and we've received all that we're going to get from Silvermoon for now. I cannot ignore the Shadowpine trolls and Zul'Aman... they're arrayed across our eastern border!"]="玛尔伦，我不想听借口，我只想要结果！远行者们还没准备好，而银月城所能给予我们的支援也都已经给了，我不能无视那些暗松巨魔和祖阿曼的威胁……他们已经成群结队地穿越了我们东部的领土。"
G["Mawurrgggl, gurgl lur!"]="¡Mawurrgggl, gurgl lur!"
G["Maximillian has handed you his shield.  Throw it at the Devilsaur!  Er... dragon!"]="麦斯米兰把他的盾牌交给你。把它向那头魔暴龙，呃，……那头恶龙扔过去！"
G["Maximillian, I am ready for adventure."]="麦斯米兰，我已经准备好进行冒险了。"
G["Maximillian, I am ready for more adventure."]="麦斯米兰，我已经准备好进行更多的冒险了。"
G["Maximillian, I am ready to ride."]="麦斯米兰，我已经做好了出发的准备。"
G["Maximum power achieved."]="达到最大功率。"
G["Maxnar is going to have my hide if we don't get this assault underway soon!"]="如果我们不立即发动攻击，玛克纳尔肯定会剥了我的皮！"
G["May Azeroth never fail to remember the terrible price we paid for our weakness... for our pride."]="愿艾泽拉斯不要忘记那曾因软弱和傲慢所付出的沉重代价。"
G["May Cenarius guide you, $c.\n\nI am here in this corrupt land with my sisters on a mission of great importance to the Cenarion Circle. But only those who are powerful enough I ask speak to me about such matters--to send a lesser being would be folly."]="愿塞纳留斯指引你，$c。\n\n我和我的姊妹身负重任，从塞纳里奥议会来到这片被污染的土地。而只有那些足够强大的人才能帮助我，毕竟让能力不足的人去完成任务是愚蠢的做法。"
G["May Cenarius watch over you, $g brother : sister;.\n\nI am Tajarri, and I am a sworn protector of this shrine.  It is my honor to serve Keeper Remulos as a warden of this sacred land."]="愿塞纳留斯庇护你，我的$g兄弟:姐妹;。\n\n我是塔加里，神殿的保卫者。能够作为这片神圣大地的看守来服侍守护者雷姆洛斯是我的荣耀。"
G["May Elune walk with you, $c.  The Temple of the Moon has come to help the troubled citizens of Auberdine."]="愿月神与你同在，$c。月神殿已经来帮助奥伯丁饱受煎熬的公民了。"
G["May Elune watch over you."]="愿艾露恩护佑你。"
G["May I bask in your shadow forever!"]="请永远庇护我吧！"
G["May I browse your epic gem recipes?"]="我能看看你的史诗宝石配方么？"
G["May I have another Cleansing Totem?"]="可以再给我一个净化图腾吗？"
G["May I have another Darkmoon Adventurer's Guide?"]="能再给我一本暗月冒险者指南吗？"
