G["Maybe you should talk to her."]="也许你该和她谈一谈。"
G["Maybe you should worry about your pet and not me!  I'm taking care of my bushinesh jusht fine!"]="也许你应该担心你的宠物，而不是我！我对工作一直都很尽职尽责！"
G["Maybe you will be a shaman like your auntie Twinbreeze?"]="你想不想像蒂布雷兹阿姨那样，成为一名萨满祭司？"
G["Maybe you'll be a challenge?"]="也许你会是个挑战？"
G["Maybe you're asleep, Mr. Great One? We understand. Must be hard working being Great One, collecting all the shinies we leave for you."]="你睡着了吗，造物主？我们知道，为了收集我们留给你的所有好东西，一定费了很大力气。"
G["Maybe, but if it did hit me upside the head I'd know exactly which cannon to use to blow it into the smallest bits!"]="也许吧，但不管是什么型号的坦克，我都能用XT型火炮把它炸得稀巴烂！"
G["Maybe, uh, maybe you're ready for a lesson in chaos?"]="你，呃，做好学习混沌之道的准备了吗？"
G["Maybe."]="也许。"
