G["Maybe... What do I do now?"]="或许吧……我现在能做什么呢？"
G["Maybe... maybe life is worth living."]="也许……也许活着是有意义的。"
G["Maybe... you could carry me?"]="你……能不能背我一程？"
G["Mayday! Mayday! Mayday! Bail out everyone. BAIL!"]="求救！求救！求救！所有人跳伞。跳！"
G["Mayor Ello!  Our graveyard scouts return with ominous reports..."]="艾尔罗大人！我们派去墓地的探子带来了一些坏消息……"
G["Mayor Khang is so worried, he called the Shado-Pan to deal with your arrival. I still cannot believe Lord Taran Zhu is here!"]="康村长担心不已，他请求影踪派帮忙应对你们的到来。我至今还不敢相信祝踏岚来了！"
G["Mayor Khang, we must act quickly! Rally the city guards, at least!"]="康村长，我们必须赶快行动！至少，把村里的卫兵召集起来！"
G["Maywiki, I no longer have my Zandalar Haruspex's Belt. Can you help?"]="梅维克，我的赞达拉占卜师腰带似乎不见了。你能帮我吗？"
G["Maywiki, I was hunting Zanzil and I lost track of what I was doing.  Can you remind me where to go next?"]="梅维克，我光顾着追踪赞吉尔，忘了自己该干的事儿了。你能提醒我接下来要去哪儿吗？"
G["Maywiki, I've lost my Zandalar Augur's Hauberk and need a new one."]="梅维克，我弄丢了我的赞达拉预言者外套，需要一件新的。"
G["Maywiki, I've lost my talisman and require a replacement."]="梅维克，我把坠饰弄丢了，想再要一份。"
G["Maywiki, a dastardly little gnome made off with my Zandalar Augur's Belt. Can you provide a replacement?"]="梅维克！我的赞达拉预言者腰带被一个混球小侏儒偷走了！你能不能再给我一条？"
G["Mazu's been good to me. Her waters have sustained me and her winds have carried me to far off places. What better life could I have asked for?"]="玛祖对我很好。她用水使我维持生命，并且她用风将我带到遥远的地方。人生如此，夫复何求？"
G["Mazu, guide my arm..."]="玛祖，指引我出击……"
G["Me Grimlok, king!"]="我，格瑞姆洛克，是国王！"
G["Me am so thirsty!"]="渴死我了！"
G["Me and $n go way back. Ain't that right, $n?"]="我和$n是老交情了。对吧，$n？"
G["Me and Gunny, we wash up wid a few of our crew near Sri-La Village in da Jade Forest. Our feet was itchin' to walk da land after months on da churnin' sea. We came here an' found paradise."]="冈尼和我，我们与其它几名船员一起，被冲到了翡翠林的香里拉村附近。在海上颠簸了几个月后，我们的双脚早已疼得走不动路。我们来到了这里，找到了天堂。"
G["Me and my trusty nets will not fail this village!"]="我和我可靠的渔网一定不会让村庄失望！"
G["Me angered. Raaah!"]="我生气了。啊呀呀呀呀呀呀！"
G["Me angry now!"]="我现在生气了！"
G["Me back still be a wee bit stiff from bein' stuck inside that coffer for so long. Bear with me if I'm a little slow..."]="我被困住太久了，到现在仍然感到腰酸背痛。要是我动作有些慢的话，请原谅……"
G["Me back, boss.  Me tell you wut me know."]="我回来了，老大。让我告诉你我知道的事情。"
G["Me become powerful tamer, then me become da Gordok King!"]="我先成为强大的驯宠师，然后就会成为戈多克大王！"
G["Me catch firefly!"]="我抓萤火虫！"
G["Me check with other ogres.  Them's ready."]="我和其他食人魔已经协商好了。他们也准备好了。"
G["Me cold."]="我好冷。"
G["Me come back... master. Me... loyal servant."]="我回来了……主人。我是您……忠实的仆从。"
G["Me crush puny friend of dragons!"]="龙族的帮手，去死吧！"
G["Me crush you like bug!"]="你会像虫子一样被我碾死！"
G["Me da best bodyguard!"]="我是最好的守卫！"
G["Me da king!"]="我是大王！"
G["Me do whatever birdy want. Just stop the hurting."]="我会听鸟人的吩咐。不要再啄我了。"
