G["Me versus fifty orcs? I'm no fool, $n. My pappy always told me, 'Discreditin is the better part of a cracker,' or something, and I knew what that meant."]="我单挑50个兽人？我可不是傻子，$n。我爸爸常说“卑鄙是卑鄙者的通行证”这类的话，我突然之间就明白了那是什么意思。"
G["Me want Gug fix armor. Maybe me buy someting."]="我想让古格修护甲。也许我还会买点什么。"
G["Me want eat you, but me full. Me kill you instead."]="我想吃你，但我已经饱了。所以我要杀了你。"
