G["Me? I practice the art of the Jade Lightning. My fists are so fast, you won't even be able to see them!"]="我？我掌握着碎玉闪电的技巧。我的出拳速度非常快，你甚至都看不清我的拳影！"
G["Me? Oh, I'm not from around here."]="我？噢，我不是本地人。"
