G["Measure twice; cut once."]="三思而后行。"
G["Measuring by Kraklenheit, it is 428,000 degrees! That's Krakley!"]="要是按照克氏度计算的话，有428,000度！"
G["Meat"]="肉类"
G["Meat for the pack."]="狗崽子们有肉吃了。"
