G["Mebbe someone will come around and get us out of this mess!"]="也许能有人来帮我们离开这个该死的地方！"
G["Mebbe there be some unexploded cannonballs 'round these parts. Plenty of fightin' offshore recently..."]="这附近也许能找到一些哑火的炮弹。最近这片海滩上打了不少炮战……"
G["Mechanical servants appear to have turned against each other. Several attendants have been piled together in an unorganized manner."]="机械仆人之间似乎发生了内讧。部分机械侏儒随从被随意地堆放在一起。"
G["Mechazod is insane! You have to stop him before it's too late!"]="麦卡佐德发疯了！你必须立即阻止他！"
G["Meddlesome gnats! You think us defeated so easily?"]="多管闲事的虫子们！你以为你能轻易地打败我们？"
G["Meddlesome insects! Now you will feel my wrath!"]="多管闲事的虫子！面对我的愤怒吧！"
