G["Meddling fools! You will pay with your lives!"]="爱管闲事的蠢货！你们会为此付出生命的代价！"
G["Medic!"]="医生！"
G["Meeeee sooooorrryyyy...."]="我很……难过……"
G["Meep!  $R is good friend.  Follow now!  We find intruder!"]="¡Meep! $R es $g buen amigo:buena amiga;. ¡Seguir ahora! ¡Nosotros encontrar intruso!"
G["Meesa na watun ta longa!"]="你们活不了多久了！"
G["Meet me at Maxwell's encampment. We'll go over the next stages of the plan there and figure out a way to decode my tablets without the decryption ring."]="到麦克斯韦尔的营地碰面吧。我们将在那儿开始下一阶段的计划，在没有译码戒指的情况下找出破解石板上的文字的方法。"
G["Meet me at the Torjari Pit once you have the carcasses, $p."]="等你找到足够的龟壳后，去托加尼洼地与我会面，$p。"
G["Meet me atop Mason's Folly, where we met before!"]="老规矩，到石匠之愚上来见我！"
G["Meet me back at Aviana's Shrine, $n!"]="回艾维娜圣殿找我，$n！"
G["Meet me back up top.  This two-headed freak has a few questions to answer!"]="回到顶上找我。这个双头怪物有几个问题要回答！"
G["Meet me down below and we'll discuss our upcoming counter-attack."]="到下面去找我，我们会认真谈一谈即将到来的反击。"
G["Meet me down by the orchard--I just need to put my gun away."]="到果园去和我碰头——我现在要去把我的枪放好。"
