G["Meet me in the Gullet, $n. Fly west, across the river, and look for a small cave along the ridgeline..."]="到咽喉洞与我见面，$n。向西飞，飞过那条河，然后沿着山脊寻找一个小山洞……"
G["Meet me in the Valley of Honor. I have a gift for you."]="到荣誉谷来见我。我有一份……礼物送给你。"
G["Meet me in the Veiled Stair when the deed is done - assuming you're still alive when this is over."]="等事情了结之后，就来雾纱栈道找我——如果你那时还活着的话。"
G["Meet me just outside of the Twilight Withering down the path to the east."]="沿这条路向东走，我们在暮光凋零法阵外碰头。"
G["Meet me near the statue at the center of the temple grounds. We will speak there."]="到寺庙庭院中心的雕像附近与我会面。我们在那谈谈。"
G["Meet me up in the cave if you would, friend."]="朋友，我们洞穴里见。"
G["Meet me up in the pools whenever you're ready!"]="你准备好后，就到水池里找我！"
G["Meet the LT-403 Evaporation laser. A personal point of pride."]="来见识一下LT-403汽化激光炮。这可是鄙人的杰作。"
G["Meet the brawn to my brains! Prime subjects, devour them!"]="见见我的心血之作！原型实验体，吞噬他们！"
G["Meet us at Dooker Dome. We need to find some incense and a dirty yak."]="到暴徒末路与我们会合。我们要找一些熏香和一头肮脏的牦牛。"
G["Meet us back at the World Tree. There's something... I want you to witness."]="回世界之树再见吧。有件事情……我想邀你一同见证。"
G["Meet us west of the temple, $rt. We shall require your aid."]="在寺庙西边和我们碰头，$rt。我们需要你的帮助。"
G["Meet your doom, surface dwellers!"]="迎接你们的末日吧，地面上的蠢货！"
G["Mega-Pelt!"]="超多中！"
G["Megaera's rage subsides."]="墨格瑞拉的怒火平息了。"
G["Megs sent me to get a boat."]="梅格斯派我来取一艘小艇。"
G["Megs, I misplaced the keys to the cruiser. Did you find them?"]="梅格斯，我把那些钥匙错放在那艘船上了。你找到它们了吗？"
G["Meh."]="切。"
G["Mei, do you have any idea where I can find salt around here?"]="明，你知道在这附近哪里有盐吗？"
G["Mekgineer Thermaplugg refuses to acknowledge that his defeat is imminent! He has sent Razlo Crushcog to prevent us from rebuilding our beloved Gnomeregan!"]="机械师瑟玛普拉格拒绝承认他的失败已经近在眼前！现在，他又派出了拉兹诺·碎轮来阻止我们重新建设我们亲爱的诺莫瑞根！"
G["Mekkatorque-Beam!"]="梅卡托克——射线！"
G["Mekkatorque-Cannon!"]="梅卡托克——大炮！"
G["Mekkatorque-Missiles!"]="梅卡托克——导弹！"
G["Mekkatorque-Ray!"]="梅卡托克——激光！"
G["Melee Weapons"]="近战武器"
G["Members only, scrub!"]="会员制的，废柴！"
G["Memories of this temple shroud my mind like a thick haze, yet I cannot assemble them into a coherent story. This place meant something to me once. Until I can restore that memory, I will feel as though a part of me is missing.\n\nPerhaps the draenei can help me recover what I've lost."]="这座神殿留给我的记忆好像一层浓重的雾，至今我都不能把它组织成一个连贯的故事。这个地方应该曾经对我意味着什么……除非我能恢复那部分记忆，否则我会觉得我的记忆缺少了什么。\n\n也许德莱尼人可以帮助我恢复失去的记忆。"
G["Men -- can't live with them, can't live without them.  Well, you can... but it's just really boring."]="男人——很难与他们相处，但是又离不开他们。好吧，也不是离不了……不过那样真的很无聊。"
G["Men!"]="男人！"
G["Men! To arms!"]="弟兄们！拿起武器！"
G["Men, attack now!"]="战士们，进攻！"
G["Men, stand down - this is one of the natives."]="弟兄们，放下武器——这是个当地人。"
G["Men, women, and children... None were spared the master's wrath. Your death will be no different."]="男人，女人，还有孩子……没人能逃过主人的怒火。你的死早已注定。"
G["Men, you've trained for this. You're among the elite.  You are Skyfire men!"]="兄弟们，你们都是受过严格训练的。你们都是精英，天火号的精英！"
G["Mennet said I should ask you for a set of thieves' tools."]="米奈特说我应该向你要一套盗贼工具。"
G["Mental interference from this presence dangerously close to triggering partial memory damage."]="这一外部影响所导致的心智干扰极可能触发局部的记忆损伤。"
G["Mental note, don't mix the blue one with the green one."]="记住，别把蓝色的和绿色的混起来。"
G["Mental note, don't touch the blue one."]="记住，别把蓝色的和绿色的混起来。"
G["Meow!"]="喵！"
G["Meow."]="喵。"
G["Merchants will spend that extra bit for something with more variety like the Dragon's Nest Noodle Soup."]="商人会愿意多花一些钱来品尝浇头比较多的面，如龙须汤面。"
G["Merciful Earthmother, look at the scope of the devastation! We're lucky the entirety of the Barrens isn't crumbling into the sea."]="仁慈的大地母亲啊，看看这场浩劫带来的满目疮痍吧！或许我们还应该感到庆幸的是，贫瘠之地没有整个沉入海底。"
G["Mercy is for the weak."]="弱者才会有仁慈之心。"
G["Mercy!"]="仁慈！"
G["Mercy!  You were once with us!  Do you not remember?"]="发发慈悲吧！你曾经是我们中的一员！你不记得了吗？"
G["Mercy... Chieftain, on this day I learn from you."]="宽恕……族长，今日你教导了我。"
G["Mercy... Your wife and child were murdered. Your kin wiped out. Your home burned to the ground."]="宽恕……你的妻儿被杀，族群被灭，你的家园被烧至焦土。"
G["Mercy?!"]="饶过？！"
G["Mere dust..."]="只是一团尘埃……"
G["Mere initiates."]="完全是新手。"
G["Mere mortals."]="卑微的凡人。"
G["Mere whelps, experiments, a means to a greater end. You will see what the research of my clutch has yielded."]="这些龙崽子，这些实验，只为一个崇高的目标。你很快就会看到我最伟大的研究成果。"
G["Merely a transport, Grud. Not a warship."]="只是艘运输船，格鲁德。不是战舰。"
G["Merely a whisper in the wind...."]="不过是狂风中的低语。"
G["Merely an impurity in the compound..."]="不过是合金中的杂质……"
G["Merely being in your presence is an affront to my beliefs."]="容许你的存在简直侮辱了我的信仰。"
G["Merideth, could I have some more manna-enriched horse feed please?"]="梅丽德丝，请问我能再要一些魔法粮草吗？"
G["Merok!  Shai!  To my side!"]="梅洛克！沙艾！到我这儿来！"
G["Merry Midsummer, $n!"]="¡Que tengas un agradable Solsticio de Verano, $n!"
G["Mess with the bull...."]="挑战公牛的下场……"
G["Messengers from Ravenholdt delivered this letter to me this morning. It is addressed to you, $n."]="拉文霍德的信使今天早上将这封信交给了我。这是写给你的，$n。"
G["Messner is a master of fire magic. We invite him to all of our barbecues."]="梅森纳是火焰法术的大师。我们每次烧烤都会邀请他来助阵。"
G["Messner kills bad guys so fast. I wish I could kill as fast as him. WHY can't I shoot fireballs? What does the LIGHT have against fireballs?"]="梅森纳能如此迅速地干掉坏人。我真希望自己杀敌的速度能和他媲美。为什么我不能发出火球？圣光与火球相比优势在哪里？"
G["Messy."]="一团糟。"
G["Messy..."]="真惨……"
G["Met someone? I didn't know there were any other dragons out here."]="与“某人”相遇？我还不知道这里有其它的龙。"
G["Metal Lord Mono-Han prepares a whirling attack!"]="金铁领主莫诺汗正在准备回旋击！"
G["Metal, as with all things, should be used in balance with nature.  Karn Stonehoof has a smithy setup near the pond on the lower rise.  Seek out his wisdom."]="和其他所有事物一样，金属应该被平衡的使用。卡恩·石蹄在中部高地的底层的池塘边设立了一处铁匠铺。去寻求他的指引吧。"
G["Metalhead ate Rejek! Run!"]="啊，钢盔把雷耶克吃掉了！快跑啊！"
G["Metallic specimen of foreign origin detected."]="检测到不明金属样本。"
G["Metz?"]="梅兹？"
G["Metzen's eyes light up with reindeer joy."]="梅森的眼睛里亮起了喜悦的光芒。"
G["Mhrrumph rummrhum phurr!"]="¡Mhrrumph rummrhum phurr!"
G["Miall is our chief blacksmith on the Exodar. She can be found on the lower level of the Trader's Tier.  Go with the Light."]="米阿尔是我们埃索达的首席铁匠，你可以在贸易阶梯的底层找到她。愿圣光与你同行。"
G["Miall is the next step in your training, friend $c. You've grown beyond what I can teach you."]="Miall es el próximo paso en tu instrucción $gamigo:amiga; $c. Has superado lo que yo puedo enseñarte."
G["Michael Bedernik growls."]="米歇尔·扫榻咆哮起来。"
G["Michael Crowe, down by the docks, can teach you anything you need to know about catching and gutting fish."]="码头上的迈克尔·克罗维可以教你捕鱼、剖鱼相关的各种知识。"
G["Michael Garrett on upper ring in Trade Quarter."]="贸易区上层的迈克尔·加勒特。"
G["Michael Garrett tends the Undercity's bats. He's in the upper ring of the Trade Quarter."]="迈克尔·加勒特是幽暗城的蝙蝠管理员。他就在贸易区的上层区域。"
G["Michelle Belle's bedside manner is remarkable!  While she might not be able to teach you that, she surely could teach you some proper First Aid.  She currently resides in the Lion's Pride Inn."]="米歇尔·贝利对病患的态度令人钦佩！她也许无法教你如何对待病人，但是她可以教你一些急救技巧。她现在居住在狮王之傲旅店。"
G["Midnight is Attumen the Huntsman's personal mount. I've never seen a faster, stronger, or more mean spirited horse. And her rider is even more temperamental! Everyone keeps their distance from her, lest they get a hoof upside the head from Midnight or a beating from Attumen."]="午夜是猎手阿图门的私人坐骑。我从未见过一匹比它更快、更强壮或者更英勇的马了。而且它的骑士更是喜怒无常！每个人都和它保持一定距离，以免被午夜踢到头，或被阿图门揍一顿。"
G["Midsummer Fire Festival is a great time to adventure, but it's also a great time to shop!"]="火焰节正是适合冒险的好时候，但也是开心购物的好时机！"
G["Midsummer Fire Festival is a great time to celebrate the summer!"]="仲夏节是每个夏天里最重要最欢乐的时刻！"
G["Might I ask, what's with the worgen in the stocks?"]="请允许我问一下，那里面关着的狼人是怎么回事儿？"
G["Might as well make yerself comfortable.  Ironstock's not lettin' anybody out until the troggs die down."]="你最好能安下心来。在穴居人被消灭干净之前，铁枷不会让任何人出去。"
G["Might grace you, $c. Let the Scourge feel the fury of a million lost souls!"]="愿力量与你同在，$c。让天灾军团感受到百万灵魂的愤怒吧！"
G["Might not be snowy out there, but the nights here can freeze your nose right off. The bunks are in the back - just don't make a nuisance of yourself."]="外面或许没有下雪，不过这里的夜晚能把你的鼻子给冻掉。床铺就在后面——别招惹是非就是了。"
G["Might you focus your attention on the other cheek for a time?"]="能不能将你的注意力转移到别人的臀部去？"
G["Mighty Black Ox! Hear our plea."]="玄牛！请聆听我们的祈求！"
G["Mighty Eye of Twilight, guide your humble servant!"]="伟大的暮光之眼，引导你谦卑的奴仆吧！"
G["Mighty fine hat!  I take it this is what you were looking for?"]="漂亮的帽子！我猜这就是你在找的东西？"
G["Mighty fine weather we're having here, wouldn't you say?"]="这里的天气真不错，你说呢？"
G["Mighty one! How can we serve you?"]="勇士！我们能帮你什么忙吗？"
G["Mighty one! We hope that you find our food to your satisfaction."]="勇士！希望你喜欢我们的食物。"
G["Mildred Fletcher may be found within the infirmary in the northeastern section of the lower city."]="在贫民窟东北角的医务室内可以找到米尔蕾·弗莱彻尔。"
G["Milk me, John."]="挤“奶”吧，约翰。"
G["Millagazor begins to escape!"]="米拉盖佐尔开始逃跑！"
G["Millhouse Manastorm."]="米尔豪斯·法力风暴。"
G["Milly, I need you to bag some seeds for me."]="米莉，请帮我包一些种子。"
G["Milord, do you think that we can join the party soon? I'm so bored in here."]="大人，你觉得我们马上就能参加聚会吗？在这里很无聊啊。"
G["Milord, there have been reports of the other thanes preparing their forces for a strike against us. We should move quickly."]="大人，有消息说，其他领主准备发兵进攻我们。我们必须赶快行动了。"
G["Milord, with much of the sin'dorei nobility regrettably crushed, does that mean that you are likely to receive an elevation soon?  I'm so excited for you!"]="大人，那么多辛多雷贵族令人扼腕地去世了，这是否意味着您很快就会受到提拔了？我真是为你感到兴奋！"
G["Milord, your guest has arrived. He awaits your presence."]="大人，您的客人到了。他正在等你。"
G["Mimiron's Inferno online. Acquiring target."]="已启动米米尔隆的烈焰。正在获取目标。"
G["Mina! You're home!"]="米娜！你回来了！"
G["Mind over matter, $n."]="La mente domina la materia."
G["Mind you, this part I learned later because I wasn't out there at the time.\n\nWhen they ratcheted up the suction on the pump, up came pieces of a robot that looked like a gnome! Of course the fools worked night and day to put it back together without telling us.\n\nThis is when we lost communication with the pumping station."]="不过呢，当时我并不在场，所以接下来发生的事我是后来才知道的。\n\n他们从主管道中扒拉出一些零件来，似乎是机械侏儒的部件！结果，那群“勤奋”的蠢货就擅自将这玩意儿拼接起来了！\n\n从此，我们就与泵站失去了联系。"
G["Mind your own business."]="管好你自己的事吧。"
G["Mine faster! I don't care if your actuators are rusty!"]="挖快点！我可不管你的传动装置是不是生锈了！"
G["Mine gots a RUSTY nail!"]="我有一根生锈的钉子！"
G["Mine gots a bigger nail!"]="我有一根更大的钉子！"
G["Mine gots a nail in it!"]="我的大棒子上还有根钉子！"
G["Mine hit me!"]="我被地雷炸到了！"
G["Mine is an idiot."]="我的是个傻瓜。"
G["Mine is not to question why."]="我的职责不是问为什么。"
G["Mine it's mine I found it. Mine I say! Mine!"]="我的，是我的，我找到它的。我说了，是我的！我的！"
G["Mine rock!  Crack stone!  Faster!  Faster!"]="快挖！快采！快一点！"
G["Mine!"]="我的！"
G["Mine! Mine! Mine!  Gizlock is the ruler of this domain!  You shall never reveal my presence!"]="我的！我的！我的！吉兹洛克是这片领域的统治者！你绝对不能泄漏我的行踪！"
G["Mine! You shall not take this place!"]="我的！你们休想夺走这块地方！"
G["Miner, sir."]="矿工，长官。"
G["Miner."]="矿工。"
G["Miners trainers and supplies are found in the All that Glitters Prospecting Co. in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran."]="魔法商业区的亮晶晶矿业公司汇集了全城的采矿训练师和供应商。魔法商业区就在达拉然的西北部。"
G["Mini-Mount"]="迷你坐骑"
G["Miniature bolts of lightning burn across Onyxia's skin. Her electrical charge is at critical levels!"]="微小的闪电灼烧着奥妮克希亚的皮肤。她体内的电荷已积聚到濒临迸发的阶段！"
G["Miniature tanks, or Tonks as we've cleverly named them, have been a faire favorite for as long as I can remember.\n\nWe have two arenas dedicated for tonk battles.\n\nOne arena pits you against the clock as you race to destroy targets, and avoid the enemy tonks.  You just need a game token to play!\n\nThe other arena is a place where you can use your own tonks or MiniZeps to battle your friends."]="我们给这些迷你坦克起了一个很拉风的名字，叫蒸汽坦克。它们可是我记忆当中，最受欢迎的马戏团游戏了。\n\n我们有两座坦克大战专用的战场。\n\n一座为限时挑战战场，你需要在里面快速摧毁目标，并躲避敌对坦克的攻击。只要一个代币，你就可以参加游戏了！\n\n另一座战场则是对战专用的场地，你可以驾驶自己的坦克或迷你飞艇来和朋友对战。"
G["Mining"]="采矿"
G["Mining Supplies"]="采矿补给品"
G["Mining allows you to locate and mine ore, minerals and stone from mining nodes in the wilderness and underground. These can be sold at the auction house or used to support the Blacksmithing, Engineering, or Jewelcrafting professions.\nSkilled miners also become tough and gain increased Stamina.\nYou'll need a Mining Pick in order to mine; this can be purchased from trade or Mining vendors."]="La minería te permite encontrar y extraer menas, minerales y piedras de los nodos de minería que hay en el campo y bajo tierra. Se pueden vender en la casa de subastas o aprovechar para suministrar las profesiones de herrería, ingeniería o joyería.\n\nLos mineros cualificados también se vuelven más duros y obtienen aguante adicional.\n\nNecesitarás un pico de minero para excavar mineral; se lo puedes comprar a un amigo o a los vendedores de minería."
G["Mining iron."]="采集铁矿。"
G["Mining's all you dwarves are good for!"]="你们这帮矮人只配挖矿！"
G["Minions of Hakkar, hear your God. The sanctity of this temple has been compromised. Invaders encroach upon holy ground! The Altar of Blood must be protected. Kill them all!"]="哈卡的仆从，听从主人的召唤！圣洁的神庙已经受到威胁。神圣的土地已经被入侵者占领！誓死保护血神祭坛，杀死所有的入侵者！"
G["Minions of fire! Purge the outsiders!"]="火焰的奴仆！净化外来者！"
G["Minions of the Firelord, lay waste to these invaders! The Guardians of Hyjal shall burn for their arrogance!"]="炎魔之王的仆从，将入侵者烧成焦炭！烧死傲慢的海加尔守护者！"
G["Minions!  Take my brother and his drake to their new dwellings.  Make sure the beast makes it alive.  I have special plans for the broodmother."]="奴隶们！把我的兄弟和他的飞龙送去他们的新家吧。别伤了那头畜生的性命。我还有个针对她的特别计划呢。"
G["Minions! Bring me a brew worthy of Ook!"]="小的们！给我找桶好酒来！"
G["Minions, come to my aid!"]="仆从们，快来帮我！"
G["Minions, destroy the interloper! The shield must not come down!"]="¡Esbirros, destruid $gal intruso:a la intrusa;! ¡El escudo no debe desactivarse!"
G["Minions, destroy these insects!"]="我的仆从们，消灭这些爬虫！"
G["Minions, destroy these interlopers!"]="奴仆们，消灭那些闯入者！"
G["Minions, destroy these interlopers."]="奴仆们，消灭那些闯入者！"
G["Minions, followers, children of the Worldbreaker, I call to you now! The hallowed halls of our father have been befouled! Kill the intruders!"]="仆从们，信徒们，灭世者之子，我在此召唤你们！我们父亲的神圣大厅已经被玷污了！杀死入侵者！"
G["Minions, servants, soldiers of the cold dark! Obey the call of Kel'Thuzad!"]="仆从们，侍卫们，隶属于黑暗与寒冷的战士们！听从克尔苏加德的召唤！"
G["Minions, sieze them.  Bring their corpses back to me."]="奴仆们，抓住他们！带他们的尸体来见我！"
G["Minionsss of the scale, heed my call!"]="蛇鳞的仆从，响应我的召唤！"
G["Minus 50 DKP to the person that pulled!"]="那个乱引怪的最少扣50DKP！"
G["Minuscule."]="不值一提。"
G["Miraculously, the satyr does not die. Instead he is bathed in a warm light."]="不可思议的是，这只萨特并没有死，而是沐浴在一片温暖的光亮之中。"
G["Miranda, could you please tell me the insignia cost of items that you are offering for adventurers of exalted reputation?"]="米兰达，你能告诉我，在崇拜声望级别的情况下，你所提供的物品需要多少徽记吗？"
G["Miranda, could you please tell me the insignia cost of items that you are offering for adventurers of honored reputation?"]="米兰达，你能告诉我，在尊敬声望级别的情况下，你所提供的物品需要多少徽记吗？"
G["Miranda, could you please tell me the insignia cost of items that you are offering for adventurers of revered reputation?"]="米兰达，你能告诉我，在崇敬声望级别的情况下，你所提供的物品需要多少徽记吗？"
G["Miranda, could you please tell me the insignia cost of items that you are offering for adventurers with other reputations?"]="米兰达，你能告诉我，在其它声望级别的情况下，你所提供的物品需要多少徽记吗？"
G["Mirren and I are two of the very best hunters on either side of the Dark Portal.  Stick around, you might learn a thing or two."]="无论是在黑暗之门的那边还是这边，米伦和我都是非常优秀的猎人。到处晃晃，你也许可以学到点什么的。"
G["Mirror... IMAGE!"]="镜……像！"
G["Mirrors pointing all over the place."]="镜子指向各个位置。"
G["Mischievous by nature, they are fond of employing their own hastily-constructed technologies."]="由于与生俱来的玩世不恭，他们喜欢使用自己那不成熟的科技手段。"
G["Miserable creatures! Die!"]="可怜的生物！死吧！"
G["Miserable gnomes! They dropped out of the sky and set fire to EVERYTHING.\nNow the whole refinery's alight, and the main Alliance forces will advance on the keep at any moment!\nWe don't have the numbers to stop them..."]="¡Malditos gnomos! Cayeron del cielo y le prendieron fuego a TODO.\n\nAhora toda la refinería está ardiendo y el ejército principal de la Alianza atacará el fuerte en cualquier momento.\n\nNo somos suficientes para detenerlos..."
G["Miserable nuisance!"]="可怜虫！"
G["Miserable vermin. I shall exterminate you from the air!"]="可怜的渣滓。我要腾空而起，让你尝尝毁灭的滋味！"
G["Misery...confusion...mistrust. These are the hallmarks."]="痛楚……迷惑……猜忌，这是一切的基石。"
G["Misha lets out a loud roar as she rakes her claws against the gronn's altar."]="米莎巨吼一声，同时用它的爪子掠过了戈隆的祭坛。"
G["Mishka's gonna take good care of you, you hear me?"]="米希卡会好好照顾你的，能听见我说话吗？"
G["Miss Boulian... will you..."]="波利安小姐……你愿意……"
G["Miss Fanny, you stronger than that! Try and put a little more ook in it next time!"]="范妮小姐，你可以的！再试一次吧，多用点力气！"
G["Missile incoming! Shields! SHIELDS!"]="有飞弹打过来了！护盾！护盾！"
G["Missing pages, broken equipment, tainted samples! How does someone work in these conditions!"]="散落的书页，残破的装备，被污染的样品！怎么会有人在这种环境里工作！"
G["Mission accomplished!"]="任务完成！"
G["Mission complete. Thank you, friend."]="任务完成。谢谢你，朋友。"
G["Mist big-tongues are smart with their shrine thing sometimes... cover whole area with mist and it get hard to find any."]="雾语大舌头怪很会利用那些祭坛捣鬼……它们能让迷雾覆盖整片区域，令我们难以发现它们的行踪。"
G["Mist gathers around you."]="你周围开始起雾了。"
G["Mist! I feared I would never see you again! Yes, I am well, do not worry for me. You must rest and recover your health."]="密斯特！我担心再也看不到你了！嗯，我很好，不用担心我。你必须好好休息，恢复健康。"
G["Mistakes are simply lessons we have yet to learn, $n. It is how you handle those mistakes that will ultimately define you."]="犯错只说明我们还有待学习，$n。而你处理那些错误的方法，才是最终证明你品行的东西。"
G["Mistcaller really good at controlling weather with shrine. They know just which crystals to use! Really good!"]="唤雾者擅长利用祭坛来控制气候。他们知道各种水晶的用途！对，他们知道得一清二楚！"
G["Mister Blaine, signal the shore batteries and let Mr. Whessan know $n is on $ghis:her; way. Handsomely, now."]="布兰恩先生，向海岸炮兵阵地发信号，让维桑恩先生知道$n就要到了。好，就是现在。"
G["Mister Blaine? Flag down a gryphon for $n if you please."]="布兰恩先生？请为$n准备一只狮鹫。"
G["Mister Copperpot, you may take us out."]="考伯波特先生，可以出发了。"
G["Mister Coppertop... Punch it!"]="考伯托特先生……快点！"
G["Mister Fairweather, slow ahead if you please!"]="菲尔维兹先生，请你稍微慢点！"
G["Mister Gearchum, signal the fleet. Defensive formations!"]="断轮先生，向舰队发信号。防御队形！"
G["Mister Goldendraft, I humbly ask permission to marry your daughter Syra."]="金酿先生，我在此恳请您将您的女儿塞拉嫁给我。"
G["Mister Mortuus gonna be so mad! Me go home now."]="摩尔图斯工头一定会大发雷霆的！我得赶紧回去。"
G["Mister Pleeb is teaching me how to be a taxidermist. Personally I think he is a little too dated and could benefit from a little gnomish \"engi-nuity.\""]="普利波先生在教我如何做一位标本剥制师。我个人觉得他的思想过于陈旧了，应该从侏儒工程学中找点儿灵感。"
G["Mister body guard, are you going to earn your money or what?"]="保镖先生，你是要赚钱还是干嘛？"
G["Mistress!! They seek to destroy your work!!"]="夫人！他们正在毁掉你的心血！"
G["Mistress, you tell Plugger that I want more of his ale.  I can't get enough!"]="小姐，请你告诉普拉格，我想要更多的啤酒。这些远远不够！"
G["Mistsilver."]="米瑟维尔。"
G["Mistweaver Nian is a strict teacher but has a kind heart."]="织雾者年云也许有些严厉，但实际上是个心地善良的老师。"
G["Mistwhisper kind of boring. Yeah, boring... little bit."]="雾语鳄鱼人都很无聊。对，真的有点……无聊。"
G["Mistwhisper not always like us. They say we \"damage their calm.\""]="No siempre gustar a Susurraneblina. Ellos decir que nosotros \"dañar su calma\"."
G["Misty. Very misty. Seem sort of misty to you? Maybe not so much."]="雾气。好重的雾气啊。对你来说，这或许算不上浓雾吧？"
