G["Mmmm! FOOD!"]="嗯！食物！"
G["Mmmm, Bloodmaul Brew!"]="嗯，血槌啤酒！"
G["Mmmm, did you make thish yourself? It'sh just what I wanted, thank you!"]="呃……你亲手做的？这正是我想要的，谢谢你！"
G["Mmmm, flies! Even better now that I can taste them."]="嗯……苍蝇！好在现在我能尝尝它们的味道啦。"
G["Mmmm, mmmm! Smells delicious, \"Cookie!\" Who could resist such a meal? $n, get this meaty offering to the Grimtotem ambassador immediately!"]="¡Mmmm, mmmm! Huele genial, \"Cocinitas\"! ¿Quién podría resistirse a una comida así? $n, lleva esta jugosa ofrenda al embajador Tótem Siniestro inmediatamente!"
G["Mmmm, shall we?"]="嗯，好吗？"
G["Mmmm, that was good. However, time to get back to work!"]="嗯，不错。但是，该回去工作了！"
G["Mmmm, the soup tastes delicious. Good job, Noodles!"]="嗯。这汤味道不错。干得好，米线！"
G["Mmmm... There's nothing like good, home-cooked human food."]="嗯……还是人类烹调的食物好吃。"
G["Mmmm... a warrior does need to keep up her strength. Thank you."]="嗯……战士应该要学会保持自己的体力。谢谢你。"
G["Mmmm... be free. Caw!"]="嗯……你自由了。呱！"
G["Mmmm... delicious."]="啊……美味极了。"
G["Mmmm... don't you look good enough to eat."]="嗯……你看起来味道不错。"
G["Mmmmh..."]="嗯……"
G["Mmmmm food.  It's not too long of a run, but you need to head north to Orgrimmar and ask one of the grunts there."]="嗯……食物。旅途并不遥远，你需要朝北走，去奥格瑞玛，问问那儿的守卫。"
G["Mmmmm! I just love green cabbage soup!"]="唔！！！我最喜欢绿色卷心菜汤了！"
G["Mmmmm! I smell a delicious sheep!"]="呒！我闻到羊肉的香味！"
G["Mmmmm, I haven't tasted a brew of this complexity and clarity since... well... since the golden age of the Stormstout Brewery! Whoever made this has a real talent."]="嗯，自从……风暴烈酒酿造厂的黄金时代过后……我就没有尝到过口感如此醇厚清冽的美酒！无论是谁酿的，他都是一个真正的人才。"
G["Mmmmm, an ale by the fire does sound good. Sure, I will join ya Jern."]="嗯……围着火炉喝点麦酒，这个主意听上去很不错。我当然会和你一起去的，吉恩。"
G["Mmmmm. Mmmmmm...... This is... simply put... amazing. Your friend Ella has real talent! Tell her to speak to my Uncle Gao at the Brewery. I think she has found a new home with us Stormstouts."]="嗯。嗯……这……简直是……令人吃惊。你的朋友艾拉真是太有天赋了！让她去找我在酿造厂的高老伯谈一谈。我想她已经在我们风暴烈酒家族里找到了自己的位置。"
G["MmmmmMmmmm... Enormous chemically altered cracker...."]="嗯……大量的化学变化……"
G["Mmmmmm..."]="嗯……"
