G["Moa'ki Harbor is blessed with two great sea turtles: Walker of Waves and Green Island. They swim between Unu'pe and Kamagua."]="莫亚基港口因两只大海龟“踏浪者”和“绿背岛”而闻名。它们往返于乌努比和卡玛古。"
G["Model U-9207 Iron Rune Construct does not appreciate your tone of voice. Commencing total annihilation of your rug, Lebronski."]="铁符文构造体U-9207无法识别你的声音。雷波斯基，现在开始摧毁你的地毯。"
G["Modernization is the key. With a crank and a lever you can fire this baby with the power of an ogre pulling a normal bow."]="现代化是关键。利用手柄和杠杆，你只需用食人魔拉弓的力量就能使这个小孩弹出去。"
G["Module 1's all prepared for system reset."]="1号模组准备完毕，可以系统重置。"
G["Module 2's all prepared for system reset."]="2号模组准备完毕，可以系统重置。"
G["Mog'dorg is a fool to think that one of the smaller races will be our savior."]="莫戈多格这个蠢货，居然认为那个小个子是我们的救世主。"
G["Mog'dorg the Wizened tell Grok go to city, get help for Bloodmaul.  Grok go."]="枯瘦的莫戈多格告诉葛罗克，要去城市里为血槌氏族寻求帮助。葛罗克就来了。"
G["Mog'dorg, me know stuff you want to know."]="莫戈多格，我知道那些你一直想知道的东西。"
G["Mog'dorg, me not tell no one 'bout cov... cov... cov... secret plan against da gronn."]="莫戈多格，我不会把对付戈隆的秘密计划告诉任何人。"
G["Mogg, get inside. It is not safe out there while your father is gone."]="莫戈恩，到里面去。你父亲不在了，外面可不太平。"
G["Mogor has challenged you. You have to accept! Get in the ring if you are ready to fight."]="Mogor te ha retado. ¡Debes aceptar! Entra en el círculo cuando estés $glisto:lista; para luchar."
G["Mogor not impressed! Skra'gath wuz made of da air and shadow! Soft like da squishy orcies!"]="穆戈尔没有印象！瑟克拉加斯是由空气和暗影组成的！像被压扁的兽人一样软！"
G["Mograine has fallen! You shall pay for this treachery! Arise, my champion! Arise!"]="莫格莱尼倒下了？你们要为此付出代价！复活吧，我的勇士！复活吧！"
G["Mograine's sacrifice was for nothing. You will let Koltira know, won't you?"]="莫格莱尼的牺牲毫无意义。你会让库尔迪拉明白这一点的，对吧？"
G["Mograine?"]="莫格莱尼？"
G["Mogu ambushers descend from the trees. Look out!"]="魔古伏击者从树上跳下来了。小心！"
G["Mogu are imperious, arrogant, and powerful - all characteristics that will send Garrosh into a rage when he arrives. \nThis is why it is critical that we capture and interrogate the leader of these mogu before that happens."]="Los mogu son imperiosos, arrogantes y poderosos, características todas que enfurecerán a Garrosh en cuanto llegue.\n\nPor eso es vital que capturemos e interroguemos a su líder antes de que eso pase."
G["Mogu are not bright, they fail to see things for what they are."]="魔古族不聪明，他们看不清事物存在的原因。"
G["Mogu are raiding the western vale in 5 minutes!  Defenders, this is your last chance to get clear!"]="魔古族将在5分钟后入侵西部的山谷！防御者们，这是你们扫清山谷的最后机会！"
G["Mogu forces surge at the main gate!  All defenders are to return to the Golden Pagoda in 15 minutes!"]="魔古大军正涌向正门！所有防御者必须在15分钟之内返回鎏金亭！"
G["Mogu sympathizers!"]="魔古支持者！"
G["Mogu'Shan Palace, a level 87-89 dungeon in the Vale of Eternal Blossoms, is now available for testing. Please be in your full group before teleporting to the dungeon. Meeting Stones are not available for this dungeon yet.\nTo leave Mogu'Shan Palace, simply exit through the normal exit inside the dungeon and you will be teleported to Dalaran. If you die and release, you should teleport back from this NPC."]="El Palacio Mogu'shan, una mazmorra de nivel 87-89 en el Valle de la Flor Eterna, ya está disponible para pruebas. Antes de teletransportarte a la mazmorra, asegúrate de que el grupo está formado. Las rocas de encuentro para esta mazmorra todavía no están disponibles.\n\nPara abandonar el Palacio Mogu'shan, simplemente sal por la salida normal dentro de la mazmorra y serás teletransportado a Dalaran. Si mueres y liberas espíritu, puedes teletransportarte de nuevo con este PNJ."
G["Mojka, cover for me! I have some business to attend to."]="摩卡，顶替我一下！我有些事要处理。"
G["Mojo leaps into $n's pocket!"]="魔汁跳进了$n的口袋。"
