G["Mook-mooks?"]="土拨鼠？"
G["Moon goddess, your light dims!  I am lost without your guidance!"]="月之女神，您的光辉黯淡了！失去指引，我已迷失！"
G["Moonbrook, mistress?"]="月溪镇，女主人？"
G["Moonfang, Den Mother of Darkmoon Island, has been slain!"]="暗月巢母月牙被击杀了！"
G["Moongraze stags can be found grazing south and east of Azure Watch."]="你可以在碧蓝岗哨的南面和东面找到月痕雄鹿。"
G["Moonstalkers displaced by the fires patrol this strand, we need to keep them safe!"]="被烈火赶出家园的月夜猛虎正在这片海滩上游荡，我们需要保护它们！"
G["Moonwells."]="月亮井。"
G["Mooo!"]="哞！"
G["Mooooo..."]="哞……"
G["Mooooom! Liu keeps poking me!"]="妈妈！刘总是找我麻烦！"
G["Moooooooooo!"]="哞！"
G["Mooranta can help you learn skinning.  She can be found just outside the Thunder Bluff Armorers on the middle rise."]="莫兰塔可以教你如何剥皮。你可以在中部高地的卡恩铁匠铺旁找到她。"
G["Mootoo thanks you, $n."]="$n，穆图感谢你。"
G["Mor'ghor! You should've stayed in Outland with the rest of your half-demon scum. There's no place for you here."]="莫格霍尔！你应该和你那些恶魔混血渣滓一起死在外域！这儿没有你的容身之处。"
G["Morae... Is that you?"]="莫莱……是你吗？"
G["Morale is growing higher, thanks to your efforts, $c."]="士气变得高涨了，多谢你的努力，$c。"
G["Morbidus, show them what happens to those who defy the will of their king!"]="摩比乌斯，让他们知道，敢于违抗国王的旨意是什么下场！"
G["Mordenaku... Your allies have saved us and destroyed the wretch, Zuluhed. Forever they will be a friend to the Netherwing."]="莫德奈……你的盟友拯救了我们，并杀死了卑鄙的祖鲁希德。他们永远是灵翼龙族的朋友。"
G["Mordle get the outgoing on the transmatter fixed now!"]="墨尔杜将转换器的输出装置修好了！"
G["More DoTs! More DoTs! Throw more DoTs!"]="持续伤害！持续伤害！再来点持续伤害！"
G["More Elementium for the Bastion of Twilight!"]="暮光堡垒需要更多源质！"
G["More Elementium! Now!"]="我还要更多源质！动作快一点！"
G["More Goblin Bombs? It seems like only yesturday I was getting rid of a pile of goblin bombs. Wait here a moment."]="又是地精炸弹？我昨天好像才搞定一堆地精炸弹。在这儿等我一会儿。"
G["More Grimtotems are coming this way!"]="更多恐怖图腾的成员正在朝这边冲过来！"
G["More Minions of Terokk are coming!"]="更多泰罗克的爪牙过来了！"
G["More Wildhammer scum. Assault the ridge!"]="还有蛮锤渣滓。向那座山脊发动进攻！"
G["More agents of the Syndicate I'll wager! You'll never take back Alterac... or Southshore!"]="我敢打赌还会有更多辛迪加的刺客跑来送死！你们永远也不可能得到奥特兰克和南海镇！"
G["More ale... hic!"]="再来点麦芽酒……嗝！"
G["More and more of Kalimdor is turning into the twisted landscape to our left, and the critters who dwell within are NOT friendly.  Watch your step."]="越来越多的卡利姆多的生物正开始变得疯狂，而栖息其中的小动物并不友善。你走路时要多加小心。"
G["More are coming aboard.  Hold 'em off!"]="又有人上来了。挡住他们！"
G["More are coming aboard.  Hold them off!"]="又有人上来了。拖住他们！"
G["More are swinging over.  It looks like this is the last of 'em!"]="又有人荡过来了。看来这是最后一批了！"
G["More artifacts to confiscate."]="又有更多的神器可以没收了。"
G["More artillery... more! I never liked peninsulas."]="炮火一定要更猛烈！我从来都不喜欢什么半岛。"
G["More beasts on the way!"]="野兽越来越多了！"
G["More blood for my axe!"]="我的战斧在渴望战斗！"
G["More blood!"]="更多鲜血！"
G["More blood! I want more blood!"]="战斗！我要更多的战斗！"
G["More bodies for the master..."]="主人需要更多的尸体……"
G["More bones for the offering!"]="又一份给主人的献礼！"
G["More bones to gnaw on..."]="有更多的骨头可以啃啦……"
G["More bones to honor the floor of Valhalas. Bring on the next group!"]="瓦哈拉斯的荣耀源于这满地的尸骨。让下一组挑战者进来吧！"
G["More bread boy!"]="孩子，给我更多的面包！"
G["More carrion for the swarm..."]="虫群又有腐肉吃了……"
G["More chickens! Many more chickens!"]="再来几只鸡！再来几只鸡！"
G["More cultist traitors? Good job gettin' 'em off the streets."]="还有邪教叛徒？能把他们抓起来实在是一件好事。"
G["More delays... Form up, men!"]="麻烦真多…重组阵型！"
G["More dots! I need more dots!"]="上诅咒！上钉刺！上痛！有什么上什么！"
G["More elves to slaughter!"]="又有精灵来送死了！"
G["More fighting, less talking."]="多战斗，少说话。"
G["More fodder for the Horde war machine."]="为部落作战机器准备了更多的弹药。"
G["More food! More wine!"]="多来点食物！多来点酒！"
G["More fuel for the fire!"]="火焰又获得了燃料。"
G["More grog?"]="还要酒？"
G["More grummles leaving here shortly for Kota Basecamp. Wait here if wish to help!"]="很快就要有更多土地精启程前往寇塔营地了。要想帮忙就待在这儿！"
G["More hired thugs?! It will take more than these three to best me!"]="你们还有人，一起上吧？！光靠这三个可赢不了我！"
G["More importantly, your champion would not let you fall. Do you see? With the support of friends, nothing is impossible."]="更重要的是，你的勇士不会让你倒下。明白吗？在朋友的支持下，一切皆有可能。"
G["More ingredients to fuel our rituals here."]="我们的仪式能添上新的祭品啦。"
G["More intruders! Sound da alarm!"]="又有入侵者，敲响警钟！"
G["More intruders? You'll soon learn, no one messes with the Venture Company!"]="又有入侵者？我倒要看看谁敢和风险投资公司过不去！"
G["More kindling for the fire."]="再往火里添点儿柴。"
G["More kindling for the flame! Come, Lu'lin... let us burn them to ash!"]="再添点儿柴！来吧，露琳……把他们烧成灰烬！"
G["More knowledge, more power!"]="更多的知识，更多的力量！"
G["More magnataur attackers are getting close..."]="猛犸人越来越近了……"
G["More mook-mooks! Look out!"]="更多的土拨鼠！小心啊！"
G["More mortals have come seeking the mysteries of Karazhan?"]="还有更多的凡人来探索卡拉赞的秘密吗？"
G["More naga! Brace yourselves!"]="更多的纳迦！当心！"
G["More naga... make ready!"]="更多的纳迦…做好准备！"
G["More of Gormok's vermin. Keep them fed."]="戈莫克还有更多的仆从。吃个饱吧。"
G["More of the Warden's errand boys!"]="又来了几个典狱官的狗腿子！"
G["More of them coming! Watch out!"]="又过来了一些！小心！"
G["More of these creatures! Where are they coming from? What's going on in the capital?"]="还有更多怪物！它们都是从哪里来的？首都现在怎么样了？"
G["More of you stand in my way? Kill them, Sunhawks!"]="还有多少条挡路狗？杀了他们，炎鹰部队！"
G["More paint for the Oz set--yes, I'll have to remember...."]="给绿野仙踪的戏服添上更多的颜色，嗯，我一定要记住……"
G["More perils... await..."]="更大的危机……在等着你们。"
G["More please?"]="再给我一个好吗？"
G["More portals will take this one's place!"]="你们无法摧毁所有的传送门！"
G["More power!"]="更多能量！"
G["More prisoners!"]="囚犯越来越多了！"
G["More reliable this way I think."]="我相信这个方式会更可靠。"
G["More saurok incoming!"]="有更多蜥蜴人来了！"
G["More scraps for the scrap heap."]="废料堆上又多了些渣滓。"
G["More sentries approach! There's no other way..."]="来了更多的哨兵！没办法了……"
G["More skulls for the pile..."]="又来一群送死的……"
G["More smash rock!  Rar!"]="砸开更多的石头！嘎！"
G["More souls for the Lich King! Come, little ones! Come!"]="巫妖王又能收割更多的灵魂啦！来呀，小子们，来呀！"
G["More souls for the blade!"]="我的剑刃渴望更多的亡魂！"
G["More souls to power the engine!"]="需要更多的灵魂为引擎提供能量！"
G["More souls...  yes, more...  you will find it hard to stop, mortal."]="你会发现……对灵魂的渴求……是多么的难以抗拒。"
G["More souls... yes, more... you will find it hard to stop, mortal."]="你会发现……对灵魂的渴求……是多么的难以抗拒。"
G["More spirits! MORE! Quickly now!"]="我还要更多的灵魂！更多！马上！"
G["More strangers seem to wash up on our beaches every day.\n\nThis bunch was still trying to shoot at each other until yesterday evening. I hope this isn't a sign of what's to come."]="每天都有越来越多的陌生人登上我们的海滩。\n\n直到昨天晚上，这群人才停止向对方射击。但愿这不是什么事情即将发生的预兆。"
G["More supplies! De Alliance be like a machine. Soon we cut our way through Garrosh's goons... A lotta orcs done picked the wrong side."]="又是补给！联盟真像一架机器。很快我们就能在加尔鲁什手下的恶棍中杀出一条血路……许多兽人都站错了队。"
G["More than you can handle, scryer?"]="嘿，你这就顶不住了？"
G["More traitors? Put 'em down in the pit, where they belong!"]="还有叛徒？把他们扔进大坑里去，那才是他们应该待的地方！"
G["More treasures! Treasures of all kinds! Yay treasures!"]="更多的宝藏！各种各样的宝藏！宝藏！"
G["More tricks, I say. Those are the REAL treats!"]="再来捣乱啊，我说，再来啊。这里可有“真正”的糖哦！"
G["More troggs! Ward them off as I prepare the explosives!"]="穴居人！挡住它们，我要准备爆破了！"
G["More ugly jewelry... letters home... I'm beginning to give up hope!"]="又是难看的珠宝……还有家书……我快要放弃希望了！"
G["More vile sorcery! Be ready for anything!"]="又是这种邪恶的巫术！提高警惕！"
G["More visitors? Bah!"]="还有更多访客吗？呸！"
G["More will take my place."]="更多人会顶上我的位置。"
G["More work?"]="又有活儿干了？"
G["More! I want more!"]="更多！我还要更多！"
G["More! More!"]="不够！还不够！"
G["More! Spill more of their blood! I am near!"]="再多点！再多点血！我已经很近了！"
G["More, more, more!  I must feed soon."]="多点，再多点！我必须马上吃点什么。"
G["More. More!"]="更多。更多！"
G["More... I must have more."]="更多……还要更多。"
G["More... More souls!"]="更多的……更多的灵魂！"
G["More... energy."]="更多的……能量。"
G["More... more! I must have more!"]="更多……更多！我要更多！"
G["More... more... MORE!!!"]="多点……多点……再多点！！！"
G["More... training..."]="还需要……训练……"
G["More.... More!"]="再来些……多来些！"
G["More? Where are they all coming from!?"]="还有？他们都是从哪里来的！？"
G["Moreover, they are a threat to me."]="他们也是对我的威胁。"
G["Morganus the stable master can be found out in front of the stables strangely enough."]="说也奇怪，兽栏管理员莫加努斯就在马厩外面。"
G["Morning, my friends."]="早安，我的朋友。"
G["Moroi, I know you're in there! We don't have all day. Mother doesn't either! Get out here you scoundrel!"]="Moroi, sé que estás ahí dentro¡ No tenemos todo el día¡ ¡Ni mi madre tampoco¡ ¡Sal de una vez, bribón!"
G["Mortal Insects! You dare trespass into MY domain?  Your arrogance will be purged in living flame."]="蛆虫般的凡人！你们胆敢入侵我的领地？烈焰之灵将烧尽你们的傲慢。"
G["Mortal champions have long used these weapons to combat evil. I see no reason to keep the swords from them in this battle."]="凡间的勇士长久以来都在使用这些武器对抗着邪恶。我认为没有理由不让他们在这场战斗中使用这些剑。"
G["Mortal creature, you are the infestation that must be cleansed."]="凡间的生物，你们是必须被清除的害虫。"
G["Mortal filth... the master's keep is forbidden...."]="污秽的凡人……不能进入主人的城堡……"
G["Mortal fools!  The ghouls of Deatholme will feast on your remains!"]="愚蠢的凡人！戴索姆的食尸鬼们会吞噬你们的躯体！"
G["Mortal heroes - your victory here today was foretold long ago. My brother's anguished cry of defeat will echo across the universe - bringing renewed hope to all those who still stand against the Burning Crusade."]="凡人英雄们，很早以前的预言之中就昭示了你们今天的胜利。我那堕落兄弟的凄惨号叫将会响彻整个宇宙——这也会把希望带给那些仍然在反抗着燃烧军团的人们。"
G["Mortal minds... So easily manipulated."]="凡人的心智……真是容易控制。"
G["Mortal! You overreach."]="凡人！你越界了。"
G["Mortal, I want you to bear witness to this, but for your own safety stay back. Calen, you too."]="凡人，我希望你能见证这一切，不过为了你的安全，站远一点。凯伦，你也是。"
G["Mortal, take the dragon queen. Carry her to safety. Now! RUN! Get her away from here!"]="凡人，带上红龙女王，送她去安全的地方。现在！快跑！把她从这里带走！"
G["Mortal? Yes I was once mortal. Weak.\n\nYou see my bonds now? These restraints are nothing compared to being shackled within a mortal coil.\n\nEven now the master's gifts stir within me, ready to be unleashed.\n\nNo, $c, my mortal days have passed, and if any flame of my former life still flickers within I would wish it extinguished. You'll have to do better than that, $r."]="凡人？不错，我曾是个凡人。弱小的凡人。\n\n你看到我现在所受的束缚了吗？但与身为凡人的桎梏相比，这些根本算不了什么。\n\n甚至现在，我主人的馈赠都在我体内激涌，随时准备释放。\n\n不，$c，凡人的身份已经离我远去，假如我体内还有丝毫过往生命的残焰在燃烧，我也希望它尽快熄灭。你最好去想其它办法，$r。"
G["Mortals are..."]="凡人……"
G["Mortals have no place here!"]="凡人不许进入这里！"
G["Mortals that fancy themselves HEROES have entered the Broken Hall. Oh, I do hope this \"raid\" will amuse me more than the last."]="Unos mortales que se creen HÉROES han entrado en la Cámara Partida. Oh, de verdad espero que esta \"banda\" al menos me divierta más que la última."
G["Mortals! I cannot follow you any further - accept my blessing and use the Hourglass of Time to defeat Murozond!"]="凡人们！我不能再跟你们前进了——接受我的祝福，使用时光沙漏击败姆诺兹多吧！"
G["Mortals! You dare breach our inner sanctum. (Unbelievers. Heretics! Burn burn)\n You cross a threshold from which there is no return. (burn burn the heretics will burn.)"]="¡Mortales! Os atrevéis a profanar nuestro Sagrario Interior. (Infieles. ¡Herejes! Arded, arded...) Habéis cruzado el umbral del que ya no es posible regresar. ... (Arded, arded. Los herejes arderán.)"
G["Mortals, I am indebted to you for freeing me from the terrible corruption that besets this place. Though I have not yet recovered fully, I can help you battle Yogg-Saron.\nI can grant you and your friends the Fortitude of Frost, increasing your damage and reducing damage taken from enemy attacks. Should one of you be about to fall in battle, I can freeze you in a block of ice, protecting you from all damage for a short time. Know that this ability taxes my power, and I must rest after using it."]="Mortales, estoy en deuda con vosotros por liberarme de la terrible corrupción que acosa este lugar. Aunque todavía no me he recuperado del todo, puedo ayudaros a luchar contra Yogg-Saron.\n\nPuedo otorgarte a ti y a tus amigos Entereza de Escarcha, que aumenta vuestro daño y reduce el daño recibido. Si alguno de vosotros cae en la batalla, puedo congelaros en un bloque de hielo, protegiéndoos de cualquier daño durante un breve período de tiempo. Debéis saber que esta habilidad pone a prueba mi poder y debo descansar después de usarla."
G["Mortals, I am indebted to you for freeing me from the terrible corruption that besets this place. Though I have not yet recovered fully, I can help you battle Yogg-Saron.\nI can grant you and your friends the Fury of the Storm, increasing your damage and maximum health. Should you be faced with evil so malevolent that it cannot be destroyed, I can channel all my power into a final Titanic Storm that will destroy even Immortals."]="Mortales, estoy en deuda con vosotros por liberarme de la terrible corrupción que acosa este lugar. Aunque todavía no me he recuperado del todo, puedo ayudaros a luchar contra Yogg-Saron.\n\nPuedo otorgaros, a ti y a tus amigos, Furia de la tormenta, que aumentará vuestro daño y vuestra salud máxima. Si os enfrentarais a un mal tan poderoso que no pudiera ser destruido, puedo canalizar todo mi poder en una Tormenta titánica final que destruirá incluso a los Inmortales."
G["Mortals, I am indebted to you for freeing me from the terrible corruption that besets this place. Though I have not yet recovered fully, I can help you battle Yogg-Saron.\nI can grant you and your friends the Resilience of Nature, increasing your damage and increasing healing taken from spells and effects. In addition, I can conjure Sanity Wells that will allow you to recover your Sanity when your grip on reality falters."]="Mortales, estoy en deuda con vosotros por liberarme de la terrible corrupción que acosa este lugar. Aunque todavía no me he recuperado del todo, puedo ayudaros a luchar contra Yogg-Saron.\n\nPuedo otorgaros, a ti y a tus amigos, Temple de naturaleza, que aumentará vuestro daño y la sanación recibida de hechizos y efectos. Además, puedo invocar Pozos de cordura que os permitirán recuperar vuestra cordura cuando perdáis contacto con la realidad."
G["Mortals, I am indebted to you for freeing me from the terrible corruption that besets this place. Though I have not yet recovered fully, I can help you battle Yogg-Saron.\nI can grant you and your friends the Speed of Invention, increasing your damage and movement speed. In addition, I can destabilize the matrices of certain Saronite based life-forms, reducing their attack and casting speeds."]="Mortales, estoy en deuda con vosotros por liberarme de la terrible corrupción que acosa este lugar. Aunque todavía no me he recuperado del todo, puedo ayudaros a luchar contra Yogg-Saron.\n\nPuedo otorgarte a ti y a tus amigos Velocidad de invención, que aumenta vuestro daño y velocidad de movimiento. Además, puedo desestabilizar las matrices de ciertas formas de vida basadas en la saronita y reducir su velocidad de ataque y de lanzamiento."
G["Mortals, here?  What is the meaning of this, pathetic Broken!"]="这里有凡人？这是什么意思，你这可悲的破碎者！"
G["Mortals, you have saved me from a fate worse than death. Left to their devices, the sorcerers of the Lich King would have broken my will eventually, and condemned me to a tortured eternity of unlife. Ahead of you lies one who was not so fortunate: the once-proud consort of Malygos, Sindragosa.\n\nMortally wounded after Neltharion's betrayal and left to die alone in the snows of Icecrown, she exists now as a being of pure hatred. And yet, beneath those layers of malevolence still remains the noble spirit of a dragon queen. I believe there is yet hope that Sindragosa's soul may find peaceful respite."]="凡人们，你们将我从那比死亡更可怕的厄运中拯救了出来。如果继续困在那些设备中，我的意志迟早会被巫妖王的巫师们摧毁，我的身体也将遭受永恒的折磨。在你们面前的便是荣耀一时的辛达苟萨——玛里苟斯的配偶。\n\n奈萨里奥的背叛使她受到了致命的创伤，躺在冰冠冰川的积雪中孤独的等待死亡，现在的她完全被仇恨所充斥。然而，恶意之下仍存留着龙之女王的高尚灵魂。我相信辛达苟萨的灵魂还有机会回归安宁。"
G["Mortals, you merely separate the wheat from the chaff. (Unworthy, unworthy)."]="凡人，你们不过是在替我们筛选真正的虔诚者。（微不足道，微不足道。）"
G["Mortals... They never cease to amaze me."]="凡人……他们一直都让我感到惊讶。"
G["Mortar strike called in. Let 'em have it, Hackel!"]="臼炮射击准备。让他们尝尝苦头，海克尔！"
G["Mortar team, reload!"]="火炮小队，装弹！"
G["Morthis! Thank Elune! I was worried I'd never see you again."]="莫希斯！感谢艾露恩！我还以为我再也看不到你了。"
G["Mortimer Moloch collapses from a heart attack!"]="莫提姆·摩洛克被命中要害，颓然倒下！"
G["Most bad fortune with big hozen ravage. Makes for bad travels."]="多数厄运都是由大规模的猢狲劫掠带来的。使旅途变得艰难。"
G["Most bad fortune."]="真是衰透了。"
G["Most definitely."]="基本确定了。"
G["Most definitely.  Might you mentor me?"]="干脆地说，你能指导我吗？"
G["Most dragons would fear to tread here, $r.\n\nWhat could possibly bring a mortal to such a treacherous place?"]="大多数巨龙都不敢来到此地，$r。\n\n你这样的凡人为何要以身犯险？"
G["Most esteemed Warchief -"]="最受敬爱的酋长——"
G["Most good fortune to you, $r! My brother and I come from far away to share our luckydos."]="祝你好运，$r！我和我的兄弟大老远赶来就是为了给人带来幸运符的。"
G["Most grummles keep a few luckydos about.\n\nLook, lint in pocket. Big luckydo. Oh, and smelly incense. Very big luckydo.\n\nNever trust unsmellible luck. Sometimes that is luck for someone else."]="大多数土地精身上都会带些幸运符。\n\n瞧，口袋里的棉绒，大号的幸运符。哦，还有这臭臭的熏香，超大号的幸运符。\n\n永远别相信闻不到臭味的幸运符。不过对某些人来说倒是很幸运。"
G["Most impressive.  You are worthy to gain the rank of champion."]="令人印象深刻啊。你完全有资格成为冠军。"
G["Most of my brethren are disdainful of the Horde's \"barbaric\" ways, and I once counted myself among them. When I was first ordered to this somewhat humid and... fragrant place, I cursed my lot in life.\n\nDuring my studies, however, I grew to appreciate my surroundings. It has a certain charm, don't you think?\n\n...you wouldn't be interested in my studies, of course, not being a mage yourself."]="\"La mayoría de mis hermanos desaprueban los medios \"bárbaros\" de la Horda y hubo un tiempo en el que yo era uno de ellos. Cuando me ordenaron venir a este húmedo y... aromático lugar, maldije mi suerte.\n\nPero, mientras llevaba a cabo mis estudios, he acabado apreciando lo que me rodea. Tiene cierto encanto, ¿no crees?\n\nNo creo que te interesen mis estudios ya que no eres $gun mago:una maga;..."
G["Most of my brethren are disdainful of the Horde's \"barbaric\" ways, and I once counted myself among them. When I was first ordered to this somewhat humid and... fragrant place, I cursed my lot in life.\n\nDuring my studies, however, I grew to appreciate my surroundings. It has a certain charm, don't you think?\n\nAh, and my studies, of course, were to allow other mages to return here with a spell. Shall I teach you?"]="La mayoría de mis hermanos desaprueban los medios \"bárbaros\" de la Horda y hubo un tiempo en el que yo era uno de ellos. Cuando me ordenaron venir a este húmedo y... aromático lugar, maldije mi suerte.\n\nPero, mientras llevaba a cabo mis estudios, he acabado apreciando lo que me rodea. Tiene cierto encanto, ¿no crees?\n\nAh y mis estudios, por supuesto, permitirán que otros magos vuelvan aquí con un hechizo. ¿Te lo enseño?"
G["Most of my debt was repaid... I think..."]="我想……我大部分的债已经还清了……"
G["Most of my men were killed while infiltrating the Neferset borders.\n\nIt is my duty to make that sacrifice count for something."]="在渗入尼斐塞特边境的行动中，我大部分兄弟都倒下了。\n\n他们决不能白白牺牲，对此我责无旁贷。"
G["Most of our steam tanks are out of commission and we're losing mountaineers quickly."]="我们的大多数蒸汽坦克都已经无法使用，而且我们的山地作战人员也损失惨重。"
G["Most of the Alliance forces have left for Azeroth.  Hopefully the carefully-compiled reports that we sent with General Turalyon will make it back to Dalaran safely.\nNer'zhul's reckless portals have torn Farahlon apart, its green hills now quickly crumbling as the Twisting Nether corrupts the earth.  I have to find a passage back to the place I was before!"]="联盟的军队大多已经启程前往艾泽拉斯。希望图拉扬将军能将我们仔细撰写的报告安全地送回达拉然。\n耐奥祖不计后果地开启了传送门，强大的能量撕碎了法兰伦。在扭曲虚空的侵蚀下，这片青翠的山岭迅速沦为了废墟。我必须想办法回去！"
G["Most of this stuff is beads and hides. Where's all the treasure?"]="这帮家伙身上只有些破珠子和硬皮。财宝到底在哪里？"
G["Most people around these parts frown on lockpicking. As a little professional courtesy, let me show you a few tricks I've learned."]="大多数人似乎都对开锁技巧有一些偏见。让我给你露两手看看吧。"
G["Most people hate swamps, but I know that they hold great secrets just beneath the murky surface."]="大多数人都讨厌沼泽，可我知道在沼泽地阴湿的表面之下，隐藏着不为人知的重大秘密。"
G["Most rogues prefer to cloak themselves in the shadows, but not Helix."]="许多盗贼喜欢把自己藏在阴影中，赫利克斯是个例外。"
G["Motega, can I get another Water Explorer?"]="莫特加，能再为我派一名水域探险家吗？"
