G["Mothallus approaches!"]="魔丝勒斯来了！"
G["Mothallus ascends, free the Mothfighters from their cocoons so they can bring her down."]="魔丝勒斯飞起来了，将灭蛾战士从丝茧中解救出来，让他们把她打下来。"
G["Mothallus is defeated! Hurray for $p!"]="魔丝勒斯被打败了！$p万岁！"
