G["Mother of all winged creatures, hear my prayer and reveal yourself... a vision! What could this mean, $n? I will report this to Omnuron."]="天空万灵之母，聆听我的祈祷，为你自己显现……一幕景象！这会是什么意思呢，$n？我要报告给欧穆隆。"
