G["Mount up and rendezvous with Scout Captain Elsia. She is organizing an elite group of rangers to accompany you. May the light of the sun shine upon you."]="找一匹坐骑，去和斥候队长艾尔希娅会合吧。她会召集一队精锐游侠配合你行动。愿阳光照耀着你。"
G["Mount up and rendezvous with Vereesa Windrunner. She is organizing the forces that will accompany you."]="找一匹坐骑，去和温蕾萨·风行者会合吧。她正在召集一队精锐游侠来配合你。"
