G["Moving on!  As chivalry is the way of the knight, and I am a knight, you must know then that my own intentions are indeed valorous.  It is true, I fight for my Lady Doloria, to proclaim her beauty and majesty across all the lands.  Any who question her beauty are without a doubt the most vile of enemies, and must be brought to justice.\n\nAs I speak, it occurs to me that I am a failure.  We have come quite far in the squiring ceremony, yet I have not yet ascertained whether or not you deserve my charity or my righteous fury.\n\nI must know, now, do you agree that my Lady Doloria is unquestionably the fairest Lady across all of Azeroth?"]="开始吧！骑士精神是骑士之道，我正是一名骑士。你必须明白，我天生就是一名勇者。这是真的，我为多罗莉亚女士而战，要将她的美丽与高贵在全世界传颂。任何对她的美好有所质疑的人都是我最大的敌人，一定会得到我正义的惩罚。\n\n当我说话的时候，我才意识到我的一个失误。我们已经正式开始了接纳侍从的仪式，但我还没有确认你是应该接受我的赞许，还是我的正义怒火。\n\n现在我必须知道，你是否认为多罗莉亚女士是艾泽拉斯无可置疑的最美丽的人？"
G["Moving on. I know that you are not the only pandaren to escape from that island."]="我们继续。我知道，从那岛上逃出来的熊猫人不止你们几个。"
G["Moving on..."]="继续……"
G["Moving out!"]="出去！"
G["Mphmm rmphhimm rrhumghph?"]="¿Mphmm rmphhimm rrhumghph?"
G["Mr. Bigglesworth. The last living creature in Naxxramas, this cat is said to be the last thread connecting Kel'thuzad to his mortal life. It is said that any who dare to harm a hair on his head doom themselves to... wait a second, what is he doing on there?!"]="比格沃斯先生。这只猫是纳克萨玛斯中唯一有生命的物体，据说它是克尔苏加德与生者世界的最后一丝联系。谣传胆敢碰它一根毛发的人都难逃……等等，它在做什么？！"
G["Mr. Combs, the ship's engineer and quartermaster, can furnish you with whatever supplies you might require. He is a fair tinker, too, if your gear is in need of repair."]="考布斯先生是随船的工程师和军需官，他出售各种你可能需要的物资。若是你想要修理装备的话，也可以找他哦，他技术不错的。"
G["Mr. Ely!"]="伊莱先生！"
G["Mr. Floppy and I went for a walk, but then we got lost and I was really scared, cause there were these wolves, you know, and they chased us, but then I saw this tower and Mr. Floppy and I hid here and the wolves finally went away after a while and it was terrible and now we don't know how to get back home."]="本来呢我是带小毛球出来散步的走着走着就迷了路，你也知道这附近有狼群出没呀没想到真被我们给撞上啦，我抱起小毛球撒开脚丫没命地逃就在我近乎绝望的时候眼前出现了一座哨塔！我们迅速躲进塔内惊魂未定地熬了许久直到外面的狼群悻悻地离开才松了一口气……这段经历真是太可怕啦而且我们还不知道回家的路。"
G["Mr. Floppy, you're ok! Thank you so much for saving Mr. Floppy!"]="小毛球，你竟然没事！谢谢你救了小毛球，太感谢了！"
G["Mr. Goldmine, I'm ready for that wild ride."]="金矿先生，我已经准备好进行这次狂野驾驶了。"
G["Mr. Mudclaw, would you lend us a hand at Sunsong Ranch?"]="泥爪先生，您愿意帮我们打理日歌农场吗？"
