G["Mr. Perelli, I know you travel around quite a bit hawking your goods. Surely you've heard rumors or information about the Scourge?"]="皮雷利先生，象你这样的旅行商人肯定见多识广。你应该对天灾军团的传言有所耳闻吧？"
