G["Mr. Perelli, have you seen any signs of the undead? Any information you can provide would be appreciated by Prince Arthas."]="皮雷利先生，你在附近见过亡灵吗？阿尔萨斯王子欢迎你提供任何线索。"
G["Mr. Perelli, have you seen any suspicious activity by men wearing dark robes in the last few weeks?"]="皮雷利先生，最近那些穿着暗色袍子的家伙有没有什么可疑的行动？"
G["Mr. Perelli, if you happen across any signs of Scourge activity or shady dealings in your travels, let the nearest Lordaeron soldier know."]="皮雷利先生，如果你在旅途中发现天灾军团的活动迹象或是任何可疑的行为，请立即向洛丹伦士兵汇报。"
