G["Ms. Pomeroy gathers herbs for an Alchemist who lives up in the hills between Northshire and Stormwind.  Check for her at his cottage and see if she'll show you the profession."]="草药师博米洛伊为居住在北郡和暴风城之间的山上的一名炼金师收集草药。去他的住所找草药师博米洛伊，看她是否能对你有所指引。"
