G["Muahahahaha!  You fool!  You've released me from my banishment in the interstices between space and time!"]="哈哈哈哈哈！你这个蠢货！你把我从时空之间的缝隙中放了出来，终结了我的流放！"
G["Muahahahaha! What is this pathetic spectacle I see before me? Well, what are you waiting for? I hunger, and you look as if you may make for a passable appetizer!"]="啊哈哈哈哈哈！我眼前的是个怎样的可怜虫啊！好吧，你等什么呢？我饿了，不如就拿你当开胃菜吧！"
