G["Mudskunks are a particularly smelly breed of fish that likes tropical waters.  The Zulian Mudskunk - the smelliest of them all, can only be found in the steamy waters of Zul'Gurub.\n\nThe Zulian Mudskunks are what I believe attracted Gahz'ranka to the place, though trolls will probably tell you he's one of their gods...\n\nBelieve what you like, but mark me - fill one of my lures with Zulian Mudskunks and that old boy will come, for sure!"]="臭泥鱼是一种散发着特殊臭味的鱼，它们生活在热带水域中。祖利安臭泥鱼则是其中最臭的一种，只有在祖尔格拉布的水域中才能找到。\n\n我想一定是祖利安臭泥鱼引来了加兹兰卡，尽管巨魔会告诉你它是巨魔膜拜的众多神灵之一，但是……\n\n相信自己——用祖利安臭泥鱼制成的诱饵去捕捉加兹兰卡吧，那家伙肯定会上钩的！"
G["Mulfunction.  Error Code: .- .- .-"]="操作错误。密码错误：.- .- .-"
G["Muln falls! And the Earthen Ring dies with him."]="穆恩死了！大地之环也随他一同消亡了。"
G["Multi-Pelt!"]="多中！"
G["Multiple vapors appear from the fog!  Kill Admiral Ripsnarl before you are overwhelmed!"]="从雾中涌出了许多蒸汽！在被它们吞噬之前赶紧击败撕心狼将军！"
G["Mumman has set up her humble shop near the main entrance of the city, just past the inn. A fine cook, that one."]="穆曼的小店就在城市主入口附近，就是刚过旅店的那家美食店。"
G["Mummified trolls... hastily embalmed by the looks of them."]="巨魔木乃伊……看上去处理得很草率。"
G["Munchies and crunchies for most happy sale. You buy?"]="小点心和小脆饼卖得最好。你要来点儿吗？"
G["Munchy munchy!"]="嚼呀嚼！"
G["Mung-Mung impressed, $n. You help me without asking for anything in return. That's what being a Tiller is all about. I'll meet you back on your farm. Mung-Mung will give you his vote."]="蒙蒙对你印象深刻，$n。你不求回报地帮助我。那正是阡陌客的意义所在。我会去你的农场上找你。蒙蒙决定投你一票。"
G["Mung-Mung in big, stinky dook without you! Mung-Mung is in your debt. Maybe you and Yoon aren't such jibnibbers after all."]="没有你，蒙蒙就变成了大臭蛋！蒙蒙会感谢你的。或许你和老愚也不是那么没用。"
G["Mung-Mung is too impatient to farm on his own.\n\nI am trying to help him take things more slowly."]="蒙蒙不够耐心，没法独立工作。\n\n我正试图帮他放慢节奏。"
G["Mung-Mung tried some of the beer at Pi'jiu. Terrible!"]="蒙蒙尝过老酒湾的啤酒。太难喝了！"
G["Munitions ready!"]="弹药就绪！"
G["Mur'ghouls."]="行尸鱼人。"
G["Mur'liches."]="巫妖鱼人。"
G["Muradin clutches his head and reels for a moment as the memories rush back to him."]="穆拉丁抓着脑袋，使劲地晃了晃，一幕幕的往事渐渐涌入他的脑海。"
G["Muradin has a point. If you cannot govern your own people, you have no place at this table."]="穆拉丁说得对。要是你连自己的人都管不好，就没资格进行这场谈判。"
G["Murder never gets old."]="谋杀永远也不会过时。"
G["Murder permits!"]="谋杀许可证!"
G["Murder."]="杀戮。"
G["Murderer!"]="凶手！"
