G["Murkash!"]=" [泰坦语]Murkash!"
G["Murloc pests, I have come to steal your treasure! Attempt to stop me! Quickly!"]="鱼人害虫，我要偷走你们的宝物！来阻止我吧！快一点！"
G["Murloc, I know that you hold the Amulet of Sevine.  I need it."]="鱼人，我知道瑟温妮的护符在你手里。我需要它。"
