G["Mushrooms always grow in damp places and so they look like umbrellas."]="蘑菇总是生长的阴暗的地方，因此它们长得像雨伞。"
G["Mushrooms grow big and strong. Too big to stomp on! So strong they stomp back!"]="蘑菇大又壮。没人能踩扁大蘑菇！可是它能踩扁别人！"
G["Music is good for the mind, body, and soul!"]="音乐对人的心灵、身体和灵魂都有好处！"
G["Mussst ressissst...."]="必须——抵抗……"
G["Must ... return to ... Irontree!"]="必须……回到……铁木那里！"
G["Must I come out there myself and do your job for you Taskmistresses?!"]="难道一定要我亲自监督吗，啊？！"
G["Must I tell her every little thing to do?  I have larger issues of my own to deal with here."]="每件小事都要我来告诉她该怎么做吗？我有更重要的事情要处理。"
G["Must I? I doubt Tyrande has more pressing business."]="有这个必要吗？我想泰兰德女士还有更重要的事。"
G["Must be careful not to damage the specimen..."]="必须多加小心，不要弄坏标本……"
G["Must be very careful with this one... Very delicate."]="必须非常小心……这东西很精密。"
G["Must be your lucky day. Alright, I'll talk. Just leave me alone. Look, you're not going to believe me, but it wa... oh, Light, looks like the girl could shoot..."]="今天一定是你幸运的一天。好吧，我会说的。先让我一个人呆一会。瞧，你还不相信我，但它……哦，天哪……"
G["Must feed..."]="我要战斗..."
G["Must fight Osul now. Must stop hatred."]="必须立即向奥苏尔人开战。必须消除仇恨。"
G["Must have snuck in through the back when I wasn't lookin'... I'll get those ravagers if it's the last thing I do."]="肯定是在我没注意的时候偷偷溜到我身后的……我一定会抓住这些该死的掠食者。"
G["Must we use the word, \"Conquer?\""]="¿Es necesario decir \"conquistar\"?"
G["Must you follow me everywhere? <sigh>"]="¿Me tienes que seguir a todas partes? <suspira>"
G["Must you leave so soon?  Very well, may your journey bring you honor."]="你急着离开吗？好吧，愿你在旅途中总能受到礼遇。"
