G["Mutiny!"]="造反啦！"
G["Mutiny?  I'll show ye mutiny, ye cockle-knuckled squiffy!"]="反叛？我让你看看什么叫反叛，你这弱不禁风的醉鬼！"
G["Muttering to himself about the slow speed at which his plans are proceeding, the %s continues with this rituals."]="%s暗自嘀咕，一边抱怨自己的计划进展缓慢，一边继续进行仪式。"
G["Muttering under his breath, %s goes back to work."]="%s嘀咕着回去工作了。"
G["Mwahahaha!"]="哇哈哈哈哈！"
G["Mwahahahaha. Had enough, Stormrage?"]="啊哈哈哈哈。受不了了吧，怒风？"
G["My $g Lord:Lady;, please allow me to live long enough to see you purge this world of the infidels."]="$g阁下:女士;，请您允许我穷尽后半生，注视着您净化这世间一切邪恶。"
G["My $g lord : lady;."]="Mi $gseñor:señora;."
G["My ... brain ... hurts!"]="我的……头……好疼！"
G["My Battlemaiden, once again you have earned my respect, and the respect of all our people."]="我的女武士，你再一次赢得了我和我们全部族人的尊重。"
G["My GEARS...that's got to be every last trogg in the city! Squads, dig in!"]="我的天啊……这座城里的穴居人一定全都杀出来了！"
G["My Gizmotic Almanacotron says that we should beat the goblins by twenty seconds more than we did last time!"]="我的数据分析师认为这次我们会比上次的纪录提高二十秒！"
G["My Go'el... consumed by the sea. Tormented by his own desires!"]="我的古伊尔……被大海吞噬了。在他自己的欲望中煎熬！"
G["My Hozen took the pieces and scattered them across the lands,"]="我的猢狲们带着这些碎片，去往大陆各地。"
G["My King knows of you.  He wants to see you..."]="王知道你。他想见你……"
G["My King, I promise you. The Kirin-Tor will come down on Garrosh so hard his ancestors will reel. Blood will pay for blood!"]="国王，我保证。肯瑞托一定会让加尔鲁什受到最严厉的惩罚。血债必须血偿！"
G["My Lady will be mosst grateful for my effortsss."]="我的女士一定会对我的努力大加赞赏。"
G["My Lady!  Should I order my men to stop the deployment of the Plague?  Or are we to continue as planned?"]="女王陛下，我是否要命令手下停止部署魔法？或者我们还是按原计划进行？"
G["My Lord Abernathy sends this to you."]="我的主人阿博纳斯大人让我把这个交给你。"
G["My Lord Regent - you should not be so close to the front lines."]="摄政王阁下——你不该到前线来。"
G["My Lord Regent! What have they done to you?"]="我的摄政王！他们都对你做了些什么？"
G["My Lord!"]="阁下！"
G["My Lord."]="大人。"
G["My Lord. From Father Lankester."]="大人，这是兰克斯特神父给您的。"
G["My Lord. YOU would make a fine Warchief."]="大人。你会是个好酋长的。"
G["My Lord..."]="大人……"
G["My Lord... you are gravely wounded!"]="掌门……你伤得很重！"
G["My Onslaught will wash over the Lich King's forces!"]="我的先锋军，将会荡平巫妖王的部队！"
G["My Prince, we should leave this place, in case they come back to finish the job."]="我的王子，我们应该离开这儿，他们也许会回来继续攻击你。"
G["My Queen, do they know?"]="女王陛下，他们知道吗？"
G["My Royal Dreadguard, you will deal with this matter as befits your station.  That, or you will wish that you had."]="我的皇家卫士们，解决掉眼前的这些入侵者。不然你们的麻烦就不止这么点了。"
G["My S.T.O.U.T. is more than just a target for throwing steins, it's a valuable training asset.  If you can hit S.T.O.U.T. you can probably hit anything!\n\nJust try not to hit me."]="我设计的掷杯训练器不只是用来训练扔酒杯的，它还是非常有价值的训练设施。如果你能击中它，就可以击中任何东西！\n\n不要击中我就行了。"
G["My Syra will NOT be seen with the likes of a Wanderbrew."]="我的塞拉一定不会受到游酒家族的待见。"
G["My Zandalar Demoniac's Wraps have gone missing. Can you provide me with another set?"]="我搞丢了我的赞达拉恶魔师裹布。你能给我一付新的吗？"
G["My Zandalar Predator's Belt has gone missing. Can you help, Falthir?"]="我的赞达拉捕猎者腰带不见了。你能帮我吗，法希尔？"
G["My achy bones. Achy knees. Achy face. I shoulda stayed in school I shoulda."]="我骨头疼，膝盖疼，脸也疼。我真不应该离开学校。"
G["My advice is no good to ye unless ye're ridin' a tournament mount.\n\nEquip a lance and grab a tournament mount outside yer faction's pavilion."]="你必须骑上锦标赛坐骑，我才能教你如何骑乘作战。\n\n拿上一支长枪，然后从你所在阵营的兽栏中挑选一匹坐骑吧。"
G["My advice to you is simple, $r.\n\nDo not get in the way here."]="我的建议很简单，$r。\n\n别在这儿碍事。"
G["My alchemy is supreme!"]="我的炼金术无与伦比！"
G["My altar will siphon the life from you!"]="我的祭坛将汲取你的生命！"
G["My answer? Here's my answer, little messenger!"]="¿Mi decisión? ¡Aquí está mi decisión, $gpequeño:pequeña; $gmensajero:mensajera;!"
G["My apologies, $c, but the arcane secrets of the Highborne will forever remain secrets to you."]="很抱歉，$c，但上层精灵的奥术秘密是你永远也无法理解的。"
G["My apologies, $n, but I do not offer instruction to novices. Instead, talk to Milla Fairancora in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus. She can help you make up for lost time."]="我很抱歉，$n，但是我不给新手提供培训。你应该找达纳苏斯工匠区的米拉·法拉科纳谈谈。她可以帮你弥补损失的时间。"
G["My apologies, Advisor. I did not recognize $Ghim:her;!"]="很抱歉，建言者。我没能认出$g他:她;来！"
G["My apologies, Cromush, but I assure you there is no problem. We are using an extremely dilute plague."]="很抱歉，克鲁姆什，但我可以向你保证，我们的行动绝无问题。我们使用的是一种效能被减弱的魔法。"
G["My apologies, I did not realize that you could understand what I was saying. What is it you are doing out here?"]="很抱歉，我没有意识到你可以理解我说的话。你在这儿做什么？"
G["My apologies, Lady Prestor."]="很抱歉，普瑞斯托女士。"
G["My apologies, Nozari. I have been a bit 'on edge' as of late. These creatures are attempting to alter the timeways."]="对不起，诺萨莉，我最近有点急躁。这些生物正企图改变时间流。"
G["My apologies, Pebblebitty."]="对不起，贝波蒂。"
G["My apologies, adventurer. The grand warlock Wilfred Fizzlebang has not arrived on the tournament grounds yet, so the next challenge of the trial is not available. We expect him next week."]="Mis disculpas, $gaventurero:aventurera;. El gran brujo Chispobang no ha llegado a los Campos del Torneo aún, así que el siguiente reto aún no está disponible. Esperamos que venga la semana que viene."
G["My apologies, ambassador. My orders were quite clear."]="很抱歉。上命难违，请你理解。"
G["My apologies, but you have already learned everything I know. The night elf Faldron could offer you further training, however. Look for him in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus."]="我很抱歉，但你已经学会我所知的一切了。然而，暗夜精灵法多恩可以提供给你进一步的培训。你可以到达纳苏斯的工匠区找他。"
G["My apologies, friends. Here, now. This should help to cover the expenses involved in my rescue."]="抱歉，朋友。收下吧，这应该能弥补你在营救我的过程中遭受的损失。"
G["My apologies, sir. I wish I had more to report."]="对不起，长官。我本应能带回来更多的情报。"
G["My apologies. I did not mean to offend. I am here on behalf of my people."]="很抱歉，我无意冒犯。我为我的人民而来。"
G["My apologies. My name is Anduin Wrynn. This champion and I need your help."]="Lo siento. Me llamo Anduin Wrynn. $gEste campeón:Esta campeona; y yo necesitamos tu ayuda."
G["My arm is getting sore."]="我胳膊越来越疼了。"
G["My arm is tired..."]="我的胳膊累了……"
G["My armies are endless, my power, unmatched."]="我的军队无穷无尽，我的力量无可匹敌。"
G["My arms grow restless, anxiously waiting to drive my axes into the skull of the Lich King. Thrall would have us wait and let the Scourge continue to grow in strength. I will not have this!\n\nIf we are to end the threat of the Lich King, we must sail to Northrend and give him the full might of the Horde! Our forces are ready and willing to exact revenge for the deaths wrought by the plague and invasion.\n\nThe time to strike is now!"]="我难以平息心中的怒火，迫不及待地想用手中的利斧劈开巫妖王的脑袋。萨尔只会说什么时机尚未成熟，让我们眼睁睁地看着天灾军团日益壮大。我不会让这种事发生的！\n\n想要解除巫妖王的威胁，就必须集结部落的全部军力，远征诺森德彻底击败他！我们的军队已经整装待发，期盼着为死于侵略的同胞复仇。\n\n反击的时刻已经到了！"
G["My army has not arrived.  I knew I could not trust the people I hired.  We will recruit new people.  We will sell these apples and our new army will crush them!"]="我请来的雇佣兵还没有到。我就知道他们不可靠。我们要招募新的人手。卖掉这些苹果，然后让新的部队去踩烂它们！"
G["My army will crush you!"]="我的大军必将碾碎你们！"
G["My arrows alone cannot bring that monstrosity down."]="光凭我的箭没法把那头怪物打下来。"
G["My assistance?! You want my assistance?! I will not be part of your petty fighting."]="我的帮助？！你们需要我的帮助？！我才不要介入你们那琐碎的战斗。"
G["My assistant will show you to Master Cheng.  Good Luck!"]="我的助手会带你去见程大师。祝你好运！"
G["My attention... was wasted on you..."]="关注你们……简直浪费精力……"
G["My awakening is complete! You shall all perish!"]="我的觉醒已经完成了！你们的死期到了！"
G["My axe has seen many battles, and I like to keep it handy. Enemy forces have fought their way into our capital several times now, but have no fear: we have always driven them back."]="我的斧头经历过多场战事，我喜欢将它带在身边。敌人曾数次入侵我们的首都，但是别怕：我们总能击退他们。"
G["My axe has split as many Alliance skulls as yours, brother. Maybe more."]="我干掉的联盟战士可不比你少，兄弟。也许更多。"
G["My axe is yours, hero! Together we will destroy these insects!"]="英雄，我愿为你效劳！让我们一起干掉这些家伙！"
G["My axe will soon feast upon your blood, human."]="我的斧子会享用你的鲜血，人类。"
G["My baby boy... NO!!!!! WHY!???"]="我的宝贝儿子……不！！！为什么？？！"
G["My back is killing me today."]="今天我的后背痛得几乎要了我的命。"
G["My back is killing me."]="我的背部痛死了。"
G["My banishment is ended! Let the blood flow!"]="我的流放生涯结束了！让鲜血尽情流淌吧！"
G["My beautiful Kolramas! You will all pay dearly for this outrage!"]="我美丽的科尔拉玛斯！你们要为此付出惨痛的代价！"
G["My beautiful mill. You! You'll die for this!"]="天哪，我漂亮的小磨坊！你！我要你为此付出性命！"
G["My bed is looking pretty good right now."]="我的床看上去很漂亮啊。"
G["My best guess is that the enormous floating fortress deterred any would-be travelers as of late."]="我只能说，那个巨大的漂浮堡垒近来让许多旅行者却步难行。"
G["My best scouts still haven't returned."]="我手下最好的斥候还没有回来。"
G["My bird! Lightning - they shot her! Those filthy beasts shot her from the sky!"]="我的鸟！闪电——他们射中了她！那些肮脏的野兽从天空中射中了她！"
G["My blade is peerless!"]="我的利刃攻无不克！"
G["My blade is yours, champion."]="愿为您效劳，勇士。"
G["My blade never misses its mark!"]="我的剑永不落空！"
G["My blade thirsts for battle. Do not keep me waiting."]="我的剑在渴望战斗。不要让我久等了。"
G["My blade thirsts for blood!"]="我的剑刃渴望鲜血！"
G["My blade will char your flesh!"]="我的焰刃会烧焦你的血肉！"
G["My blades are sharp, but my skill is unhoned. I am ready to learn, $n."]="我的刀很锋利，但我的技巧太笨拙了。我准备好向你学习了，$n。"
G["My blades hunger."]="我的双刃渴望鲜血。"
G["My bling is blung..."]="我的零件被打坏了……"
G["My blood feeds Hakkar! My soul... feeds... Jin'do!"]="我的鲜血献给哈卡！我的灵魂……归于……金度！"
G["My blood hungers."]="我的鲜血饥渴难耐了。"
G["My blood is like venom!"]="我的血剧毒无比！"
G["My blood will be the end of you!"]="我的血就是你们的末日！"
G["My boat winning!"]="我的船就要赢了！"
G["My body is already starting to fight the naga infection.  Please, I ask you to get to safety before I unleash my wrath!"]="我的身体已经开始对抗纳迦的侵染。我请你们在我释放怒火之前，快逃到安全的地方去！"
G["My body returns to the earth..."]="我的身体归于大地……"
G["My bones are weak, my eyes see only darkness, and my body feels only pain; but these things are good because my will is my own."]="我的骨骼十分虚弱，我的双眼只能看到黑暗，我的身体只能感受到痛楚……但这一切都算不了什么，因为我的意志还是我的。"
G["My boom boom is too small! Can I have another?"]="我的轰轰太小啦！我能再拿一个吗？"
G["My boss is going to kill me if I have to stay home sick another day this month."]="本月我要是再多请一天病假的话，老板就会杀了我。"
G["My boy died at the Wrath Gate. I am here only to collect his body."]="我的儿子战死在天谴之门。我来只是想带走他的尸体。"
G["My boy! Just in time. We have more yaks to clean."]="我的孩子！来得正好，我们还有很多牦牛要洗。"
G["My boys may not be the brightest, but we can take all of you on!"]="我的小伙子们也许不是最聪明的，但我们可以把你们全干掉！"
G["My braids!"]="我的辫子！"
G["My brethren are endless in number."]="我的同胞无穷无尽。"
G["My brethren were here not long ago.  My connection to them has grown tenuous.  A powerful presence in the courtyard guards the way forward."]="不久前，我的同胞还在这里，但是现在我和他们之间的感应却越来越微弱。一个拥有强大力量的生物守护着庭院，阻止了通往神殿深处的道路。"
G["My brethren, my comrades-in-arms!  I must go to seek the forces of the Horde and direct them here!  Keep your spirits strong, brave hunters!  Do not fall to the portal-spawned fiends!"]="我的兄弟们，我的战友们！我必须去寻找部落的帮助，指引他们来到这里增援！勇敢的猎人们，顽强地战斗下去！不要被那些从黑暗之门涌出的恶魔击败！"
G["My brood will feed on your bones!"]="我的孩子们会啃光你们的骨头！"
G["My brother Krixx thinks he has it bad working in Orgrimmar. Nothing compares to the stench of this place. At least the boss had the decency to give me hazard pay!\nWhat? Do you want to see where the zeppelin is? Good thing I've got my zeppelin tracker right here!"]="Mi hermano Krixx cree que trabajar en Orgrimmar es malo. Nada se parece a la peste de este lugar. ¡Al menos el jefe me paga un plus de peligrosidad!\n\n¿Qué? ¿Quieres saber dónde está ahora el zepelín? ¡Estás de suerte, tengo mi dispositivo de seguimiento de zepelines aquí!"
G["My brother and I have dedicated ourselves to Sylvanas. She is our beacon of light when times were darkest. We sacrifice ourselves day in and day out to ensure our kind overcome the destiny that's chosen us.\n\nWe will not remain weak. We will take that which is owed to us. We will return tenfold, the pain that was done to us. And we shall do so with smiles on our faces."]="我和我的兄弟效忠于希尔瓦娜斯。在最黑暗的时代，她是我们的指路明灯。我们日复一日地奉献着，希望使种族避免遭受厄运。\n\n我们不会一直软弱下去的。我们会取回自己应得的。我们将报复敌人，让他们尝到十倍于我们的痛苦。并且，我们将面带微笑报复敌人。"
G["My brother has spent years working on a cure for leper gnomes. Using his notes, I think I've perfected a process for restoring gnomes who've devolved to sludge."]="我的兄弟多年来一直在研究使麻风侏儒痊愈的方法。通过研习他的笔记，我想我已经完善了流程——可以使那些已经被认定无药可救的侏儒回复到从前的样子。"
G["My brother said we could make great money with this trade route, but he didn't tell me I would be the one living on this side. If you come back this way on the Zeppelin, could you bring me something to eat? They sell some of the finest meat in Orgrimmar, and I sure could use something that didn't die weeks before it stopped moving."]="我兄弟说我们能在这条商贸路线上赚到更多的钱的，但是他没告诉我要独自应对。要是你乘坐地精飞艇沿着这条路返回的话，你能帮我带点吃的吗？在奥格瑞玛，有人出售最好的肉类，当然我还能以那些苟延残喘的动物为食的。"
G["My brother simply must try these."]="我的弟弟肯定想尝尝的。"
G["My brother, Stormhoof, was a far greater warrior than I. While I trained to be the chieftain of our clan, he prepared for a larger quest."]="我的兄弟雷蹄，是一位比我更出色的战士。在我接受继任氏族酋长的训练时，他正在为一项重要的任务做准备。"
G["My brother, Synipus has lots of them. You should head up north to Blue Sky Logging Grounds and talk to him."]="我的兄弟塞尼普斯有很多伐木机。你可以前往北边的蓝天伐木场和他谈谈。"
G["My brother, no!"]="不！哥哥！"
G["My brother... yes... I do have brothers..."]="我的弟弟？呃……我倒是有几个兄弟……"
G["My brothers and I can reach northern Gilneas by boat in a matter of days.  As soon as we finish the repairs, that is."]="我的兄弟和我乘船几天时间就能到达北吉尔尼斯。当然，我们得先完成修理工作。"
G["My brothers and sisters have gone insane! Do you think you could help me get out of here?"]="我的兄弟姐妹都发疯了！你能帮我逃离这里吗？"
G["My brothers and sisters, words cannot describe what I felt upon seeing the Sunwell rekindled."]="兄弟姐妹们，目睹太阳之井再度复苏的感受简直难以言表。"
G["My brothers and sisters. Listen to me. We must speak of the survival of our people. We have narrowly survived one calamity, but I fear the next shall destroy us."]="我的兄弟姐妹们，听我说。我们必须开始关注自身的生存了。虽然我们在一场灾难中勉强幸存了下来，但是我担心下一场灾难会把我们彻底摧毁。"
G["My brothers are strong, but my brothers are passive.\n\nChange does not occur without movement, contention, and violence. Our enemies live this, whether they fully realize it or not. The passive nature of my brothers makes them weak and vulnerable to these new enemies.\n\nNot I. I have no fear of change. I will tear at the ground and move the mountains. I embrace change."]="我的兄弟们很强壮，但却总是非常被动。\n\n没有运动、没有竞争、没有暴力，就不会产生变化。我们的敌人深谙此道，不管他们是不是完全意识到了这一点。我兄弟们被动的天性使他们在这些新的敌人面前显得脆弱而无力。\n\n别把我算在内。我不惧怕改变。我愿意撕裂大地，挪移群山。我热爱改变。"
G["My brothers have awoken. Your efforts are wasted..."]="我的同胞已经醒了。你的努力白费了……"
G["My brothers have grown hungry. Your souls will sate their appetites."]="我的兄弟们都饿了。你们的灵魂一定很合他们的胃口。"
G["My brothers in Stormwind told me not to join the military... I'm glad I didn't listen to them!"]="暴风城的兄弟们告诉我不要参军……我很高兴当初没有听他们的！"
G["My brothers will come for me and then you will see what true power is!"]="我的兄弟会来救我的，然后你们就会见识到真正强大的力量！"
G["My burden grows heavier..."]="我心中的负担更加沉重了……"
G["My business partner slays things; I drain a portion of their essence... a pittance, really; the slightest of slivers. It won't be missed.\n\nStill, to fulfil my portion of the contract, I pay in Ethereal Credits.\n\nOne may redeem these credits for items I sell at any time. I'm bound to have something that will interest you..."]="我来告诉你虚灵是怎么做生意的。我让合作伙伴去杀死生物，然后我来抽取它们的精华……只要一点点就够啦，真的。\n\n我会支付虚灵货币，以此履行合同规定的义务。\n\n你可以用货币购买我出售的货物哦。肯定有你感兴趣的东西……"
G["My calculations did not..."]="我的计算居然没有……"
G["My calculations, incorrect? Perhaps another 800 years..."]="我的计算，出错了？或许还要800年……"
G["My captors were cruel beyond measure, $n. They would alternate between Lieutenant Kirith and I, torturing one while the other watched. During a lull in the activity of an especially brutal day, Kirith told me what had happened to my men and a plan he had been formulating to free them from their masters.\n\nThey suffered a fate far worse than death, or even the pain Kirith and I  endured."]="Mis captores fueron de una crueldad imposible imaginar, $n. Nos alternaban al teniente Kirith y a mí, torturando a uno mientras el otro miraba. En un momento de calma tras un día brutal, Kirith me contó lo que les había ocurrido a mis hombres y el plan que había ideado para liberarlos de sus maestros.\n\nSu destino fue mucho peor que la muerte, o incluso peor que el martirio que Kirith y yo padecimos."
G["My case is made. This yak is very bad. We will not leave this yak temple until you fix him or replace him."]="我搞定了，这头牦牛很差劲。除非你搞定或更换这头牦牛，否则我们不会离开这座牦牛寺。"
G["My challenge, if you accept it, tasks you with healing the most grievous of wounds."]="如果你们接受我的挑战的话，就要治愈最惨痛的创伤。"
G["My challenge, if you accept it, will test your champion's ability to defend and protect while enduring terrible hardship."]="如果你们能够接受我的挑战的话，它将测试这位勇士在艰苦条件下的防卫能力。"
G["My challenge, if you accept it, will test your cunning and footwork even in the midst of life-threatening danger."]="我的挑战，如果你们接受的话，将测试你们在遭到生命危险时的机智和手段。"
G["My challenges have strengthened you, champion. You shall serve me well!"]="我的考验让你变得更强，你将更好地效忠我！"
G["My champion and I seek the blessing of your strength."]="我和我的勇士希望得到力量的祝福。"
G["My champion and I seek the blessing of your wisdom."]="我和我的勇士希望得到智慧的祝福。"
G["My champion and I seek your blessing of fortitude."]="我和我的勇士希望得到坚忍的祝福。"
G["My champion and I seek your blessing of hope."]="我和我的勇士想要得到希望的祝福。"
G["My champion, destroy this monster!"]="我的勇士，消灭这个怪物！"
G["My champions will go. They will see what can be done, and rescue who they can."]="我让勇士们先上。他们会竭尽所能把我们的人救出来的。"
G["My charge at Agmar's Hammer extends far beyond the care of the animals at the stables."]="我在阿格玛之锤的工作远不止照料兽栏里的动物这么简单。"
G["My charge ends as your charge begins, Irulon. Farewell and may the Light guide you."]="伊鲁伦，我的任务完成了，接下来一切都交给你了。再见，愿圣光指引你前进的道路。"
G["My charge to watch the temple has failed... my corrupted soul knows no peace..."]="我没能守护好神殿……我堕落的灵魂将永远无法平静……"
G["My chest is one of ingenious design, and requires two keys to unlock, one gold and one silver.  The first key, the silver key, I gave to my first mate, and I kept the gold.\n\nBut we were doomed to lose them.  My key was lost during the next naga attack, and my first mate's was lost a day later when drysnap makrura assailed us and pulled him into the deep.\n\nI am sure the naga and makrura have the keys.  I am glad the two are enemies and will not share them."]="我的箱子设计独特，需要两把钥匙来开锁，一把金钥匙和一把银钥匙。我将银钥匙给了我的大副，自己保留了金钥匙。\n\n但是我们注定会失去它们。在一次纳迦发动的袭击中，我丢了钥匙；而后，龙虾人攻击了我们，将大副推入了深渊。\n\n我想钥匙一定在纳迦和龙虾人那儿。还好这两方是敌人，不会共享钥匙的。"
G["My chickens... ATTACK!"]="小鸡们……进攻！"
G["My child is nearly here... everything changes today..."]="我的孩子就要降生了……今天一切都变了……"
G["My children are in Stormglen alone! I have to get to them!"]="我的孩子们还在风谷村里，没有人照顾！我必须去找到他们！"
G["My children were kidnapped while they slept! I WANT ANSWERS, SOLOMON!"]="我的孩子在睡梦中被劫走了！我想要知道真相，所罗门！"
G["My children will be made orphans!"]="我的孩子们会变成孤儿的！"
G["My children will not know war if I have anything say about it!"]="只要我守口如瓶，就能让孩子们对战争一无所知！"
G["My children... what have I done?"]="我的孩子们……我干了什么！"
G["My clothing?!  Is that what this has come to now?  We debate the merits of my clothing?"]="我的衣服？！现在这变成了重要话题？难道我的着装也有争论的价值？"
G["My colleagues and I are gathering the deadliest substances we know and testing their effects on our enemies. Once I have everything I need, I shall brew such plagues as this world has never seen."]="我和我的同伴正在收集我们所知的素材，并测试它们的效果。一旦我收集齐备，我将制造出这世界前所未有的药剂。"
G["My command?"]="我的命令？"
G["My commander was butchered before my eyes - my brothers dead all around me - I could not fight on. I am so ashamed, $c. I did not avenge them."]="我的指挥官就在我的眼前被杀害了，兄弟们不断地在我身边倒下。我无法继续战斗下去。我没有能为他们报仇，$c，我让他们蒙受了羞耻。"
G["My commanding officers are all dead or missing."]="我的指挥官们不是死了就是失踪了。"
G["My companion is dispersed.  She will flow back to me when the time is right."]="我的同伴被打散了。但她一定会在适当的时候卷土重来的。"
G["My companions and I are with you, Lady Proudmoore."]="我和我的伙伴们将与您并肩作战，普罗德摩尔女士。"
G["My companions are all accounted for, Muradin. Let's go!"]="我的战友全都加入，穆拉丁。出发吧！"
G["My companions are all accounted for, Saurfang. Let's go!"]="算上我所有的同伴，萨鲁法尔。出发吧！"
G["My compliments to the chef!"]="赞美厨子！"
G["My compliments, friend.  I can't remember the last time someone bested me so handily."]="向你致敬，朋友。我都不记得，上次被别人轻易战胜是什么时候了。"
G["My compliments."]="我真服了你。"
G["My comrades and I called ourselves the Sons of Lothar - in honor of the greatest, most selfless man we ever knew.  We gave our all to defeat Ner'zhul and end his madness.\n\nAs this doomed world fell apart around us, we shattered the Dark Portal to prevent any further harm befalling our beloved Azeroth."]="我和我的伙伴们称自己为洛萨之子，以此来对我们所认识的最无私和最伟大的人表示尊敬。我们用尽全力击败耐奥祖，结束了他的疯狂。\n\n当这个被诅咒的世界在我们身边崩塌时，我们破坏了黑暗之门，以阻止更多的伤害降临到我们所深爱着的艾泽拉斯。"
G["My comrades will... will... arrrrgghhh..."]="我的朋友们会……会……啊……"
G["My concern for the moment is with the ruins that surround Lake Mennar, to our east. Thousands of years ago the Mennar Academy was among the first to study the arcane arts. It was a beautiful terraced structure built in a ring around a tranquil lake, a place of quiet contemplation and focused study. It was there that my ancestors first discovered the potential of the magical energies seeping from the Well of Eternity.\n\nI'm sorry - is this all too much to take in? I've immersed myself in arcane history for several decades now, I forget that others do not share my passion."]="我现在很关心东边门纳尔湖周围的废墟。千万年以前，门纳尔学院第一个开始研究奥术的技艺，那是一座美丽的多层建筑，环绕一座平静的湖泊，非常有利于贤者们沉思和冥想。正是在那里，我的祖先首先发现魔法能量从永恒之井中溢出。\n\n很抱歉，我的介绍是不是太过冗长了？至今为止，我沉浸在这段神秘的历史中已经有数十年之久。我忘记了，其他人并不一定有和我一样的兴趣。"
G["My condolences. These past years have been hard on us all."]="我很遗憾。过去的几年对我们来说很艰难。"
G["My congratulations, champions. Through trials both planned and unexpected, you have triumphed."]="勇士们，祝贺你们！经历过一系列计划之中和意料之外的试炼，你们终于取得了胜利。"
G["My contract is to fight for you, not to reveal the Legion's secrets, mortal."]="我的契约只让我为你而战，而非向你透漏军团的秘密，凡人。"
G["My crop is Growing... now what?"]="我的农作物在生长……现在该怎么做？"
G["My cup runneth over."]="杯子已经被斟满了。"
G["My daddy can catch more fish than your daddy!"]="我爸爸能比你爸爸捕更多的鱼！"
G["My daddy says that in the ocean, there are fish so big they could swallow a whole ship."]="我爸爸说在大海里有一种很大很大的鱼，可以一口吞下一整条船。"
G["My daughter Lyalia would have me spend the rest of my days cleaning a temple.\n\nBah! I have never felt so alive as when I chose to step through the portal to this strange and beautiful land."]="我女儿丽娅拉本想让我终日打扫寺庙，以过此余生。\n\n呸！当我决定跨过传送门来到这片神奇而又美丽的土地时，我感受到前所未有的活力。"
G["My daughter has spirit and persistence! I worry less about her than I do my husband."]="我的女儿浑身充满了志气和坚毅！她比我丈夫还让我省心。"
G["My dead grandmater, rest her soul, could beat you... even now!"]="就连我去世的祖母……都能打倒你！噢，愿她的灵魂安息吧。"
G["My dead orc sound is da best!"]="我学兽人临死前的惨叫声最像了！"
G["My dear Staffron, have you forgotten what it is to love? The love that we once shared?"]="我亲爱的斯塔弗隆，你忘了爱情的感觉吗？那段我们曾经共同拥有过的爱情……"
G["My dear friends... I'm so sorry..."]="我亲爱的朋友们……我很抱歉……"
G["My dear general, your time has come!"]="亲爱的将军，你的末日来临了！"
G["My dear prince, you and I share the same goals. We only differ in our level of commitment."]="我亲爱的王子，我们的目标是一致的，只是投入程度不同。"
G["My dear, it appears we have visitors!  Friends of yours, Voss?"]="宝贝儿，好像有客人来了！是你的朋友吗，沃斯？"
G["My dear, you should embrace this gift that has been bestowed upon you."]="宝贝儿，你应该将这份礼物视作对你的恩赐。"
G["My dearest Torta, I have been gone for so long. Finally we are reunited. At long last our love can blossom again."]="亲爱的托尔塔，在别离那么长时间之后我们终于再次相见了。我们之间的爱还会更加热烈。"
G["My dearest old friend Nordu has bestowed to you a great gift, $r. The gift of life."]="我最亲爱的老友诺尔度赠予了你一件伟大的礼物，$r。生命的礼物。"
G["My dearest sibling, do you hunger? THEN FEAST UPON OUR ENEMIES!"]="我最亲爱的妹妹，你饿了吗？那就吃掉我们的敌人吧！"
G["My death has gained you nothing!"]="我的死对你们没有任何好处！"
G["My death matters little... the Hammer will still fall!"]="我的死微不足道……你们必将血债血还!"
G["My death means nothing!"]="我的死改变不了什么！"
G["My death means nothing.... light... will... prevail!"]="我死不足惜……圣光……将……照耀大地！"
G["My death means... little."]="我的死亡……不值一提。"
G["My death means...nothing..."]="我的死……微不足道……"
G["My death only serves to hasten your demise."]="我的死只会加速你们的灭亡。"
G["My death will be avenged!"]="有人会替我报仇的！"
G["My death will not save you from what is coming..."]="我的死不会让你们得到救赎的……"
G["My death will not stop da storm that is coming! Da Thunder King will rise!"]="就算我死了，你们也阻止不了即将到来的狂风暴雨！雷电之王必将崛起！"
G["My death will not stop this invasion!"]="就算我死了，这次入侵行动也不会停止！"
G["My death... heralds the end of this world."]="我的死亡……预示着世界的终结。"
G["My death... means... nothing. The Divine Bell is already in Darnassus. You filthy Horde... will never... have it!"]="呃……我的死……不算什么。圣钟已经被送到了达纳苏斯。肮脏的部落……永远得不到它！"
G["My death... means... nothing..."]="我的死亡……毫无……意义……"
G["My debt was almost repaid.  No one was going to miss those last gold coins..."]="我的债已经基本还请了。谁也不会在乎剩下的那点金币的……"
G["My debt? I owe that girl nothing.\n\nI'm pretty sure she... GAVE me those spices. I saw her wink at me. This sort of thing happens often when you're as handsome as I am.\n\nAre you still here? Scurry off, little $r."]="¿Mi deuda? Yo no le debo nada a esa chica.\n\nEstoy seguro de que me... regaló esas especias. Vi cómo me guiñaba el ojo. Estas cosas pasan cuando eres tan guapo como yo.\n\n¿Todavía estás aquí? Lárgate, $gpequeño:pequeña; $r."
G["My decision is final.  I will not be dissuaded.  I have devoted my life to our plan.  To jeopardize it now would betray all who have died for the cause long before me."]="我已经下定了决心，不要再劝说我了。我把自己的生命都献给了我们的计划，如果现在前功尽弃，我们怎么能对得起那些为此牺牲的伙伴？"
G["My demise accomplishes nothing! The master will have you! You will drown in your own blood! The world shall burn! Aaaghh!"]="我的死根本算不了什么！主人一定会消灭你们的！你们会溺毙在自己的鲜血中！这个世界将会熊熊燃烧！啊！"
G["My destiny is to serve the Lich King!"]="我注定要为巫妖王效劳！"
G["My dog?! Where's my dog?!"]="我的狗？！我的狗呢？！"
G["My drakes have been eagerly awaiting your return, $c.\n\nAre you ready to take wing?"]="Mis dragones han aguardado tu regreso ansiosos, $c.\n\n¿Estás $glisto:lista; para alzar el vuelo?"
G["My drakes shall be watching you. Choose your words and your actions carefully, $r."]="我的龙会盯着你。记住，要谨言慎行，$r。"
G["My dream is to be as brilliant as Sputtervalve someday. You should see his design for a two-wheeled tricycle!"]="我的梦想是有一天成为像斯布特瓦夫那样的超级技师。你真应该看看他设计的只有两只轮子的三轮车！"
G["My dryskin can beat your dryskin. Yup, definately."]="我的干皮人肯定比你厉害。别不信。"
G["My duty is to protect my people. If I must be on the frontlines, then I would gladly do so."]="我的职责就是保护我的人民。如果必须要我上前线，那么我将义无反顾。"
G["My duty is to the Klaxxi Council. Whatever they ask of me, I must obey."]="我效命于卡拉克西议会。不管他们要我做什么，我都必须服从。"
G["My eagles gonna bear your spirits to me. Your sacrifices not gonna be in vain...."]="我的猎鹰将把你们的灵魂带到我这里。你们的牺牲也并非毫无意义……"
G["My ear! You grazed my ear!"]="耳朵！你弄伤了我的耳朵！"
G["My early classes are always filled with bright-eyed young lads. Few make it past the first test, though.\n\nI've given up on shouting, 'when I yell vanish, you need to vanish.' They never listen. Now, the test simply kills the inept."]="Mis primeras clases siempre están llenas de chicos con ojos brillantes. Pero pocos aprueban la primera prueba.\n\nMe he cansado de gritar \"cuando grito desaparecer, tenéis que desaparecer\". No escuchan nunca. Ahora, la prueba simplemente mata al inepto."
G["My education is ongoing, and your knowledge surpasses mine. If you wish to learn more you must speak to Me'lynn. She will guide you."]="你的教育正在继续，而你的知识已超越了我。如果你还想继续学习你就必须找迈里恩谈谈。她会指引你的。"
G["My endless agony shall be yours, as well!"]="让你们也尝尝我无尽的痛苦！"
G["My entire team's been razed!"]="我的整支队伍都被消灭了！"
G["My entrails are leaking out! HELP!"]="我受伤了！帮帮我！"
G["My epic schemes, my great plans! Gone!"]="我宏大的谋略，绝妙的计划！都完了！"
G["My errands are almost complete. Come, visit my collection of exotic birds. You may have the honor of feeding them."]="我的任务就快完成了。来吧，来看看我收养的珍禽异鸟。能喂喂它们可是你的福气哦。"
G["My essence...will...persist..."]="我的精华将……永存……。"
G["My eternal gratitude; I had thought myself doomed."]="我将永远感激你，我还以为自己死定了。"
G["My eternal thanks to you."]="永远地感谢你。"
G["My eternal vigil has kept the corruption of pride at bay. To face this corruption yourself you must purify yourselves in the burning light.  This process will not go easily for you.\nAre you ready?"]="Mi vigilia eterna ha mantenido a raya a la corrupción del orgullo. Si queréis enfrentaros a ella, antes debéis purificaros en la luz abrasadora. Será un proceso doloroso.\n\n¿Estáis listos?"
G["My expertise is needed elsewhere, heroes! When you see Garrosh, tell him he should've invested in gnomish technology!"]="英雄们，我得去其他地方支援了！如果你们见到加尔鲁什，记得告诉他，他应该投资侏儒科技才对！"
G["My eyebrows! You singed my eyebrows!"]="我的眉毛！你烧焦了我的眉毛！"
G["My eyes - auuugh!"]="我的眼睛……噢！"
G["My eyes are opened, yet they see only black."]="我睁开双眼，却只见到黑暗。"
G["My eyes are playing tricks on me! Are those... skeletons manning that ship?"]="我不是眼花了吧？！船上那些……是骷髅吗？"
G["My eyes never deceive me, $r. I see great power in you - enough power, perhaps, to further our cause. Find me at the top of the tower."]="我的眼睛从不欺骗我，$r。你身上蕴涵着巨大的能量——足够的能量，或许能对我们有所帮助。来塔顶找我吧。"
G["My eyes!  It burns... it burns..."]="我的眼睛！它在燃烧……它在燃烧……"
G["My eyes! The goggles do nothing!"]="我的眼睛！这眼镜没用啊！"
G["My face!  What's wrong with my face!"]="我的脸！我的脸怎么了！"
G["My failings will be your downfall!"]="我的失败将是你的衰亡！"
G["My failure?! MY FAILURE?! It was your incompetence that landed us here, you insufferable prat!"]="是我把事情搞砸的？！是我吗？！是因为你无能！我们之所以这么落魄，都是拜你所赐！"
G["My faith guides my actions, $r. I know that Ivus will come."]="我的信念指引着我的行动，$r。我知道伊弗斯会来的。"
G["My family and I are bringing fresh fish from the Anglers to town. Would you like to buy some?"]="我和我的家人将新鲜的鱼从渔人码头带到镇上。你想买一些吗？"
G["My family hammer?! What could have possibly possessed you... never mind, I don't care.  You'll always be welcome in our home - we'll save a place for you at the table.  Thank you."]="¡¿El martillo de mi familia?! ¿Qué te podría haber impulsado a...? No importa, me da igual. Siempre serás $gbienvenido:bienvenida; en nuestra casa. Te guardaremos un sitio en nuestra mesa. Gracias."
G["My family has been running caravan routes in the Barrens since Orgrimmar was settled. We raise and train the kodos ourselves. My sister Nagala is the best kodo breeder outside of Mulgore."]="从奥格瑞玛建立时起，我的家族就在经营贫瘠之地的运输商队。我们养育并训练科多兽。我的姐姐娜格拉是莫高雷以外最优秀的科多兽养育者。"
G["My family has crafted jade and gems for nearly ten generations. You may be surprised at what I can teach you."]="我的家族以制作玉石和宝石为生，这门手艺已经传承了将近十代人。我能传授给你的技艺可能会令你大吃一惊。"
G["My family has guarded this town for generations. I pray that I will be able to uphold their legacy."]="我的家人世代守卫着这座村庄。我祈求自己能继承祖业。"
G["My family has stood as the greatest brewmasters of the Jade Forest for generations.\n\nUnlike those filthy travelling Wanderbrews. Peasant brews, that's what they make."]="数代以来，我的家族一直是翡翠林最伟大的酒仙家族之一。\n\n我们跟那个卑鄙的旅行家族游酒可不一样。他们只会酿造村野劣酒。"
G["My family hates me.  Frightened idiots, all of them!"]="我的家族非常恨我。胆小的白痴，他们都是胆小的白痴！"
G["My family is planning a great banquet to celebrate the statue's completion."]="我的家族正在策划一场盛大的宴会，来庆祝雕像的落成。"
G["My family left mainland Pandaria to explore the world on the back of the Wandering Isle. That was many generations ago.\n\nBut I have learned that there are other Stormstouts, here, on Pandaria! My long-lost family. What are they like? Do they still brew, as I do? Are they adventurers, like you and I?"]="我的家人离开潘达利亚大陆去探索迷踪岛以外的世界。这是几代人之前的事。\n\n但是我知道潘达利亚这里还有其他风暴烈酒家族的成员！我失散已久的家人。他们长什么样子？他们还像我一样在酿酒吗？他们是和你我一样的冒险家吗？"
G["My family must know... I... for them... always for them..."]="务必转告我的家人……我……永远……爱他们……"
G["My family used to make this... They're gone now, but I shtill love thish dish."]="我家族以前常常做这个……现在他们都走了，但是我还是喜欢这道菜。"
G["My family was slaughtered without mercy. Even the young."]="我的家人都被残忍地杀害了。连孩子都不能幸免。"
G["My family was wiped out by the Scourge! MONSTER!"]="天灾军团杀死了我的家人！怪物！"
G["My family worked  the Northridge Lumber Mill in what's now Western Plaguelands. They were dedicated to the Dumah family, and now the Scarlet Crusade have taken it over along with all of Hearthglen!\n\nI will not rest until those zealots are wiped from Azeroth."]="我的家人过去在北山伐木场工作，那里现在被称作西瘟疫之地。他们曾忠于杜马家族，而现在血色十字军把一切连同壁炉谷全都占领了！\n\n在把那些狂热分子从艾泽拉斯驱逐出去之前，我是不会停止行动的。"
G["My family's been clearing out swarms for years! Not that we're above a bit of hired help..."]="我家几代人都是除虫高手！尽管我们只是普通的雇佣劳工……"
G["My family's sick!"]="我的家人都病倒了！"
G["My family... did you find my family?"]="我的家人……你有没有找到我的家人？"
G["My farm was in real trouble because of those hozen, but it's saved thanks to you."]="那群猢狲给我的农场添了大麻烦，幸亏你帮我解决了问题。"
G["My fastest wolf is ready to take you to Taunka'le Village, champion. Let me know when you are ready."]="勇士，我会让速度最快的座狼载你前往牦牛村。你准备好之后就告诉我吧。"
G["My fate is written in flames!"]="我的命运将由烈火来书写！"
G["My father and my father's father spent their lives toiling on this statue. I am proud to be the one who will finish it."]="我父亲和我爷爷将毕生的精力都花费在这座宏伟的雕像上。作为收官之人，我感到非常自豪。"
G["My father brewed Firebough Stout. His father did before him. I can't let the legacy die out."]="我父亲酿制火树烈酒。在他之前还有我的祖父。我决不能让这个家传秘方失传。"
G["My father doesn't think so, but I can take care of myself."]="我父亲可不这么想，但我会照顾好自己的。"
G["My father foresaw this day in the waters. He told me that I would be defeated, but I refused to believe it."]="我父亲说他已经预见到了这一天。他说我会被击败，但我始终没相信。"
G["My father has gifted me with his battle armor and axe. Soon I put it to good use."]="我的父亲将他的作战盔甲和斧头都送给我啦。很快我就能好好利用它们了。"
G["My father has trained me since I was a wee lad to respect the elements. Earth and fire, wind and sea - they possess great power, $c.\n\n<Grundy gets a gleam in his eye.>\n\nMore than you realize."]="我还是小孩子的时候，我的父亲就已经在训练我该如何尊敬元素。大地和烈火，疾风和海洋——它们都具有无比强大的能量，$c。\n\n<格朗迪的眼睛里闪过一丝光芒。>\n\n那是你没有能力去认知的能量。"
G["My father is close, I know it! We have to bust through their defenses and rescue him!"]="我父亲就在附近，我能感觉到！我们必须突破他们的防线，救出我的父亲！"
G["My father is here for the Pools of Youth. I'm here at Tyrande Whisperwind's command."]="我父亲来这里是为了寻找青春之池，我来这里是奉了泰兰德·语风之命。"
G["My father is so overly protective. I never get to do anything!"]="我的父亲对我过于保护了，从来不让我做任何事情！"
G["My father isn't asking you to pledge the Kirin-Tor to the Alliance-"]="我父亲并不是要求你带领肯瑞托加入联盟——"
G["My father lives in his farmhouse in the middle of the farmlands. He's just east of the big ol' crane statue.\n\nHe owns almost all the fertile land in the valley, and he never lets anyone forget it.\n\nThat's why I left home, you know. He thinks he owns everything...and everyone."]="我父亲住在田地中间的农舍里，就在那座古旧的仙鹤雕像东边。\n\n他拥有山谷里几乎所有的肥沃土地，而且他从不让任何人忘记这一点。\n\n这就是我离家出走的原因。因为他觉得所有东西……所有人，都是属于他的。"
G["My father once told me that life is meaningless... That it is in death that we are truly tested. I sense that the siege of Light's Hope will give meaning to his words. We strike soon, $n. Stand ready."]="我的父亲曾经说过，生命本身毫无意义……只有死亡，才能让你了解人性的真谛。圣光之愿礼拜堂的沦陷将完美地诠释他这番话的含义。$n，我们很快就要进攻了。做好准备吧。"
G["My father says that's just a story."]="我父亲说那只是一个故事。"
G["My father thinks he can tell me what to do still! I'm not a child anymore and he needs to see that."]="我父亲还以为他能对我颐指气使！我不再是个小孩子了，他应该认识到这一点。"
G["My father thinks it's too dangerous beyond Zouchin's walls for a lady. He only lets me leave when we need supplies from One Keg."]="我父亲认为对于一个淑女来说，到卓金村城墙外面去太危险了。只有当我们需要去酒坛集采购补给时，他才让我离开。"
G["My father thought they were all doomed... but behind him, a furious roar rumbled across the snow, and he turned to see the mountain dwarf growing in size, his skin taking on a stone-like texture, and his hands sizzling with lightning."]="我的父亲以为大家都难逃此劫……但听背后的雪地里传来一声怒吼，他扭头看见高山矮人的体型正在增大，他的皮肤上浮现出岩石般的纹理，他的手上冒出嘶嘶作响的闪电。"
G["My father thought we would not encounter resistance. But then, he often spends his time obsessing over immortality instead of thinking things through."]="我父亲曾以为我们不会遇到抵抗。但是之后，他总是把时间花在研究永生上，而不是全面考虑问题。"
G["My father told me there'd be days like this, where a stranger would talk to me and I'd have to restrain myself from killing $ghim:her;."]="我父亲告诉我：有一天，会有一个陌生人跟我交谈，我必须控制住自己，不能杀了$g他:她;。"
G["My father was High Elder before Cloudfall. He taught me everything that I know."]="我父亲是云瀑长老的前任。我所知道的一切都是他教的。"
G["My father was a brute. My mother was a saur-priest. I am nothing.\n\nI am a disgrace to the Skumblade. I will die in the filth, and they will not eat my meat."]="我父亲是个蛮兵，我母亲是蜥蜴人祭司。而我一无是处。\n\n我是邪刃部族的耻辱。我会死在垃圾堆里，谁也不会来吃我的肉。"
G["My father was slain by the filth that inhabits the cauldron. My pleas for assistance to the Stormwind magistrate fell on deaf ears. Nay, they want not to admit that this part of the world even exists, let alone send their precious military in to administer justice.\n\nI seek vengeance, $r, plain and simple. Is there a more passionate cause in this world?"]="La escoria que vive en la Caldera asesinó a mi padre. El Magistrado de Ventormenta hizo oídos sordos a mis súplicas de ayuda. No, no quieren admitir que esta parte del mundo existe y mucho menos enviar a su valiosa milicia para administrar justicia.\n\nBusco venganza, $r, llanamente. ¿Existe una causa más apasionada en este mundo?"
G["My father would tell you we are here for the Pools of Youth.\n\nThe real story is that our lady Tyrande Whisperwind has had visions of a great light we would... will... find on this journey. A light that will need to be found and defended.\n\nMy father insists it is the Pools of Youth.\n\nI think he is blinded by a decade of obsession."]="我父亲会告诉你我们来这里是为了寻找青春之池。\n\n而实际上，我们的泰兰德·语风女士在幻象中看到了一道神圣的光芒，我们也许会……不……我们一定会找到它。我们必须找到并且守护那束光。\n\n我父亲坚信那束光就是青春之池。\n\n但我觉得他被这十年来的狂热研究蒙蔽了双眼。"
G["My father's off to more exotic locations in search of bigger prey.  Don't worry though, we're still on the hunt here!"]="我父亲去了更光怪陆离的地方寻找更大的猎物。不用担心，我们还会在这里继续打猎！"
G["My father's sacrifice will not have been in vain. We need to press the attack against the mantid."]="我父亲是不会白白牺牲的，我们得向螳螂妖发动进攻。"
G["My father, Deathwing, tried to destroy the whole of Azeroth."]="我的父亲死亡之翼，曾经想摧毁整个艾泽拉斯。"
G["My father? What good is it to speak to him?"]="我父亲？干嘛要提起他？"
G["My fault? I wasn't one who bought unclean yak."]="我的错？脏牦牛可不是我弄来的！"
G["My favorite kind of $c: the brave, rescue-y type!"]="Mi $c $gfavorito:favorita;: ¡$gel:la; que me rescata!"
G["My favorite part was when you splashed muddy water in my eyes."]="我最喜欢的就是你把泥水溅到我眼睛里。"
G["My feet hurt."]="我腿疼！"
G["My feet hurt..."]="我的脚有些疼……"
G["My finest work so far! This siege engine is ready for action!"]="这是我最成功的作品！这部攻城器械已经准备好，随时可以使用了！"
G["My fire... has gone out.."]="我的火焰……熄灭了……"
G["My firebolt is useless! No matter you smug little insect. I will still destroy you!"]="我的火焰箭居然没用！不要紧，你这自鸣得意的小虫子。我一定会把你毁掉！"
G["My first command has been more difficult than I anticipated. Did I make the right decision?"]="首次指挥作战比我想象中的要难一些。我的决定到底正确吗？"
G["My first field test of this technology went better than expected!  Take this with you, it should be useful against any more swarms you run into."]="这项技术的首次实地测试效果超过预期！带着这个，就算遇到再多虫群，你也能搞定它们。"
G["My fists are ready. Bring on the trial of wood."]="我的拳头已蓄势待发，想继续接受木之试炼。"
G["My fists are scarlet... with your blood!"]="我的双拳沾满了……你的鲜血！"
G["My flames have died, left not a spark. I shall send you myself, to the lifeless dark."]="我的地狱烈焰竟已不再煌煌。你的生命火烛必也要暗褐无光！"
G["My flesh!"]="我的身体！"
G["My flight is ready! Soldiers come to my aid!"]="我准备飞行了！士兵们，过来帮忙！"
G["My floot is good luckydo! You can't have it!"]="你的笛子是个很好的幸运符！你不配拥有它！"
G["My forces cannot overcome the Qiraji defenses. We will not be able to get close enough to place your precious barrier, dragon."]="我的军队不足以抵抗安其拉的部队。我们无法走到足够近的地方，启动你那宝贵的魔法屏障。"
G["My former brethren, your time draws short!  Join us, before you are lost to the sands of eternity!"]="我曾经的弟兄们，你们没有时间了！加入我们吧，趁还没有迷失在永恒之沙里！"
G["My fortune telling powers are immeasurable - your chances are though: NO CHANCE"]="我预知未来的能力趋于无穷大，不过你成功的机会趋于零。"
G["My freedom means nothing if we fail to save Ursoc.  Make haste, $n."]="如果不能拯救乌索克，那我的自由也就毫无意义了。要快，$n。"
G["My friend come to visit Jogu again? What can I do for you today?"]="¿Mi $gamigo:amiga; viene a visitar a Jogu otra vez? ¿Qué puedo hacer por ti hoy?"
G["My friend had a pet turtle, but he gave it away as a gift."]="我朋友就有一只，可他把它送掉了。"
G["My friend was afraid, but not me!"]="我的朋友很害怕，但我不怕！"
G["My friend, $n! Let us share a drink together."]="¡Mi $gamigo:amiga; $n! Vamos a tomar un trago juntos."
G["My friend, if you blindly trust a black dragon in the search for greater power, are you any better than Garrosh Hellscream? Please - just be careful."]="我的朋友，如果你盲目信任这头追逐力量的黑龙，那你又能比加尔鲁什强多少呢？请你三思。"
G["My friend, one of these days we should see who is stronger in battle - you, or me."]="$gAmigo mío:Amiga mía;, un día de estos veremos quién es más fuerte en combate... tú o yo."
G["My friend, please think carefully about the legacy you will leave behind."]="我的朋友，请认真考虑要为后人留下什么。"
G["My friend, please, meet me near the Big Blossom Mine in the center of the Vale. There is something I wish to show you there."]="我的朋友，请到锦绣谷中心的繁盛矿洞附近来找我。我想给你看点东西。"
G["My friend, something is about to give. I wish I could experience the next chapter of the story, but alas, I am just the storyteller."]="朋友，大事将要发生。我很想亲身体验接下来的故事，但是，很可惜，我只是个说故事的人。"
G["My friend, today we will face one of the greatest and most diabolical of brewmasters the pandaren have ever known.\n\nThere are few who have not heard of the dangers of his brews and yet despite that he is able to dupe people and animals alike into tasting his beverages.\n\nHe must be stopped!  Are you with us?"]="$gAmigo:Amiga;, hoy nos enfrentamos a uno de los maestros cerveceros más geniales y más malvados que jamás han conocido los pandaren.\n\nCasi todo el mundo ha oído hablar de los peligros de sus productos, pero a pesar de todo sigue ingeniándoselas para que las personas y los animales sigan probando sus destilados.\n\n¡Hay que detenerlo! ¿Estás con nosotros?"
G["My friend, you are making enough noise to scare off a pack of mushan beasts."]="$gAmigo mío:Amiga mía;, con el ruido que estás haciendo podrías ahuyentar a una manada de bestias mushan."
G["My friends and I come with peaceful intentions."]="我和我的朋友带着和平的意愿而来。"
G["My friends say I'm a little slow, but I run faster than all of them!"]="朋友们说我有些慢，可我比他们所有人跑得都快！"
G["My friends, my colleagues. Put yourselves at ease."]="我的朋友们，我的同伴们，请尽管放心。"
G["My friends, please join me in humble supplication to the Light."]="我的朋友们，请与我一起谦卑地向圣光祈祷。"
G["My fur, doesn't it look good today?"]="我的毛今天看起来是不是很闪亮啊？"
G["My fury is UNLEASHED!"]="我的怒火无人能挡！！"
G["My fury is released!"]="我的愤怒释放出来了！"
G["My gadget can't get an accurate reading with all the quatum nether fluctuations."]="我的雷达设备由于量子虚空波动的干扰而不能获取准确的信息。"
G["My genius cannot be contained within a box!\n\nWait, this isn't Azshara?! What is this place? That's a dormant volcano!\n\nI have half a mind to go join the Trade Prince! The other half of my mind is considering the possible weaponization of the clucker eggs!"]="我的天才不可能被束缚在一个胶囊里！\n\n等等，这里不是艾萨拉？！这是什么地方？这是一座休眠火山！\n\n我本来有些想去找贸易大王的！但我也在考虑将肉鸡蛋实现武器化的可能！"
G["My goal is to work as slowly as possible, giving any murderous Scourge in the area a large window in which they can choose to kill us and then do terrible things to our corpses. Isn't that the plan?"]="我就是打算尽可能地拖延时间，让那些不怀好意的天灾军团杀掉我们，然后对我们的尸体做一些可怕的事。我这样说你满意了吧？"
G["My good friend $n! Are you here to buy or sell? Feel free to look around."]="¡Mi $gbuen amigo:buena amiga; $n! ¿Has venido a comprar o a vender? No te cortes en echar un vistazo por ahí."
G["My good friend! How are things at the farm?"]="¡Mi $gbuen amigo:buena amiga;! ¿Cómo van las cosas en la granja?"
G["My good friend! You drink with Chee Chee sometime, yes?"]="¡Mi $gbuen amigo:buena amiga;! Tú bebe kon Chee Chee alguna vez, ¿sí?"
G["My good friend, here's a tip. You want big vegetables?\n\nYou gotta tend them. Give them some water, some fertilizer, and some love."]="Mi $gbuen amigo:buena amiga;, te daré un consejo. ¿Quieres verduras grandes?\n\nTienes que cuidarlas bien. Regarlas de cuando en cuando, echarles un poco de fertilizante y darles un poquito de amor."
G["My good friend, how are you today?\n\nListen, I don't say this to just anyone, but if you ever need a yak, you let Fung know."]="Mi $gbuen amigo:buena amiga;, ¿cómo estás hoy?\n\nMira, no le digo esto a todo el mundo, pero si alguna vez necesitas un yak, díselo a Fung."
G["My good friend, one of these days we should see who is stronger in battle - you, or me."]="$gMi buen amigo:Mi buena amiga;, un día de estos veremos quién es más fuerte en combate... tú o yo."
G["My good friend, you are making enough noise to scare off a pack of mushan beasts."]="$gMi buen amigo:Mi buena amiga;, con el ruido que estás haciendo podrías ahuyentar a una manada de bestias mushan."
G["My good friend, you got any news for me today?"]="$gMi buen amigo:Mi buena amiga;, ¿tienes algo que contarme hoy?"
G["My good friend, you must know a thing or two about exterminating virmen."]="Mi $gbuen amigo:buena amiga;, debes saber un par de cosas sobre cómo exterminar a los mures."
G["My goodness, Duyi. What have you been feeding that thing?"]="天哪，杜宇。你喂那东西吃了什么？"
G["My goods aren't for sale to the Horde. Don't like it? Take it up with the Warchief!"]="我不会把商品卖给部落。你不满意？那去找酋长吧！"
G["My gosh, it's full of rocks!"]="天哪，这里全都是石头！"
G["My grandmother used to tell me it was bad for a fighter's balance to enter battle on an empty stomach!"]="我外婆常说，饿着肚子打仗会让你站都站不稳！"
G["My granny, livin' down in Redridge, hits dummies harder than you, rookie!"]="我那个住在赤脊山的奶奶出拳都比你重，菜鸟！"
G["My great hammer, Ironfel, was handed down to the new chief architect, Fineous Darkvire: A man of despicable motive and little talent.\n\nThis is where you come in, $n. I want him stopped. He is too inept to harness the true power of Ironfel, but should one come after him with the aptitude to use Ironfel to its full potential, the destruction they could cause with their creations would be disastrous to this world."]="Mi gran martillo, Ferrovil, pasó a manos del nuevo arquitecto jefe, Fineous Virunegro: un hombre de voluntad despreciable y escaso talento.\n\nAhí es donde apareces tú, $n. Quiero detenerlo. Es demasiado inepto como para ejercer el poder de Ferrovil, pero si su sucesor tiene la capacidad de usar el martillo en todo su potencial, la destrucción que podría ocasionar con sus creaciones podría ser de una magnitud incalculable."
G["My gut is telling me that it's about time we jump into action and start drinking."]="我的肚子告诉我，现在应该是我们立即行动，开始痛饮的时候了。"
G["My gut's telling me...."]="我的内心告诉我……"
G["My hammer always strikes true! Let the fires rage once again!"]="我的大锤总能克敌先机！让大火烧得更猛烈些吧！"
G["My hands... don't look at my hands!!"]="我的手……不要看我的手！！"
G["My hate will consume you!"]="我的仇恨会吞噬你！"
G["My hated rival... so glad you came."]="我的死对头……很高兴你来了。"
G["My hatred burns!"]="我的仇恨在燃烧！"
G["My hatred is strong <snort>, but the time is right to tell you a tale, $r.\n\nLong ago a battle took place between gods. Agamaggan, our great boar god, fell to the earth after being defeated in the War of the Ancients, his blood raining down and his bones torn asunder. <snort>\n\nGreat thorns reached up out of the earth where his blood touched the ground, and his skull adorns one of the caverns to the south."]="我怀着深深的仇恨<哼>，但是是时候告诉你了，$r。\n\n很久之前，众神之间爆发了一场战争。我们伟大的野猪神阿迦玛甘在史前战争中战败，鲜血四溅，骨肉横飞。<哼>\n\n当他的鲜血流到地面上时，巨大的荆棘破土而出，他的徽记装饰着此地以南的洞穴。"
G["My head be swimmin'. Please, I be beggin' ya!"]="我觉得头晕目眩。求你了，帮帮我！"
G["My head is clear and cloudy at the same time... Crystal Lining...Silver Clouds..."]="我的脑子既清醒又混乱……有时候像水晶那样明了……有时候又像云彩那样模糊……"
G["My head swims... I am... not myself yet."]="我的头好晕……我还……没有完全恢复。"
G["My heals really don't have the 'OOMPH' that they used to, $n. You know what I'm saying?"]="我的治疗确实不具备原先那样的“吸引力”，$n。你明白我在说什么吗？"
G["My heart grows darker... Soon I will be judged... Worthy of the Val'kyr! Worthy of the Lich King!"]="我心中的黑暗面正逐渐膨胀……我就要接受审判了……为了瓦格里！为了巫妖王！"
G["My heart hangs heavier with each passing day, Confessor."]="我的心情一天比一天沉重，神官。"
G["My heart has been filled with hate since our sworn enemies were allowed into our city.  I knew the one known as Voren'thal before he was called a Seer.  It was by his hand that my brother was slain."]="自从我们的死敌被允许进入我们的城市后，我的心中充满着仇恨。那个沃雷塔尔被称为先知以前，我就认识他了。正是他亲手杀死了我的兄弟。"
G["My heart is heavy with the burden of this war. I lead my people to their deaths. But if we cannot stand against Ragnaros now, how will we withstand Neltharion?\n\nWe must fight with everything we have, or witness the destruction of our world."]="这场战争令我心情沉重。我正带领着我的人民走向死亡。但如果我们现在不站出来反抗拉格纳罗斯，将来又怎么能抵挡得住奈萨里奥呢？\n\n我们必须为自己所拥有的一切而战，否则就只能眼睁睁看着世界毁灭。"
G["My help? Have things really grown so dire?\n\n<The distant flames flicker in Blackhorn's cruel, dark eyes.>\n\nTell me why I shouldn't let your world burn."]="¿Mi ayuda? ¿Las cosas se han puesto tan difíciles?\n\n<Una llama lejana arde en los ojos oscuros y crueles de Cuerno Negro>.\n\nDime por qué no debería dejar que ardiera el mundo."
G["My home... I wonder if it's still standing. I'll go back and find out!"]="我的家园……不知还在不在。我要回去看看！"
G["My hound!"]="我的狗！"
G["My hounds shall feast on your corpse!"]="我的猎犬将把你的尸体当作一顿美餐！"
G["My house is just to the right as you enter the village. The mask should be upstairs."]="我的房子就在你进村之后的右手边。面具应该在楼上。"
G["My house!"]="我的房子！"
G["My house! My things! It's all ablaze!"]="我的房子！我的家当！都烧没了！"
G["My humblest apologies, Champion, but you have run out of opportunities to complete the Trial of the Grand Crusader. As a reminder, you and your fellow adventurers are able to begin the Trial of the Grand Crusader once every week. May the lessons learned this week bring you one step closer to final victory here and against the Scourge!"]="Mis disculpas más humildes, $gCampeón:Campeona;, pero te has quedado sin oportunidades para completar la Prueba del Gran Cruzado. Como recordatorio, tú y tus compañeros aventureros podréis comenzar la Prueba del Gran Cruzado una vez cada semana. ¡Que las lecciones que habéis aprendido esta semana os acerquen a la victoria final aquí y contra la Plaga!"
G["My hunger knows no bounds!"]="我的渴求是无限的！"
G["My husband and children are sick in bed because of the poison you sold me!"]="你卖的食物有毒！我的丈夫和孩子都病倒了！"
G["My husband has disappeared. Please, blood guard, he is no warrior. You must help me find him."]="我的丈夫失踪了。求求你，血卫士，他并不是战士。请一定帮我找到他。"
G["My husband just disappeared. You have to help me, captain. I'm no warrior."]="我的丈夫失踪了。将军，请一定帮帮我。我不是战士。"
G["My husband wanted to see what was happening down by the water. That's when...when...\n\n<Elder Yoon Su begins to sob uncontrollably.>"]="我丈夫想去看看水边发生了什么事。就在那时……那时……\n\n<苏云长老泣不成声。>"
G["My husband was captured by the yaungol several days ago. I cannot not rest until I see him safely returned."]="我丈夫在几天前被野牛人抓走了。在看到他安全归来之前，我一刻都安宁不下来。"
G["My husband was taken prisoner by the yaungol several days ago.\n\nHe is in danger as we speak."]="我丈夫在几天前被野牛人抓走了。\n\n在我们说话的时候，他正处在危险之中。"
G["My husband's been missing for days.  We went on this pilgrimage together; we were supposed to finish it together.\n\nAll this worry has gotten me tapping into mana crystals more often than I really should."]="我的丈夫失踪好几天了。我们一起到这里来朝圣，我们本应该在一起的。\n\n我太担心他了，我触摸魔力水晶的次数远远超出了必需的范围。"
G["My injuries are too great. I won't make it... Our citizenry held in cages... ritual..."]="我的伤势太重了。没法活着回去了……村民们……被关在笼子里……仪式……"
G["My inn has all the comforts of home, and more. Please make yourself comfortable here."]="我的旅店舒适得像家一样。请别客气，随意。"
G["My inner fire can never die."]="我的烈焰永不熄灭。"
G["My insignia! Yes. I did lose it. Where did you find it, tauren?"]="我的徽章！是，是我丢的。你在哪里找到的，牛头人？"
G["My intelligence suggests this one is a high-value target."]="情报显示，这是一个极具价值的目标。"
G["My jade!"]="我的玉石！"
G["My job consists of one task and one task only: ensuring that the West Sanctum runs smoothly.\n\nYou'll have to excuse my temper but, as you can see, the situation here is a bit out of hand."]="我的职责只有一个：确保西部圣殿运转顺畅。\n\n请原谅我的坏脾气，就像你所看到的那样，这里的状况已经超出了我的控制。"
G["My job is to care for these poor souls.  I accept the help of any willing to lend a hand, be they Aldor or Scryer.\n\nWe are so understaffed, I wouldn't turn an ogre away if they knew how to apply a tourniquet.  The politics of the city are of little matter to me."]="我的工作是照顾那些可怜的灵魂。我愿意接受任何帮忙，无论他们是奥尔多还是占星者。\n\n我们太缺人手了，如果食人魔知道怎么扎绷带，我甚至愿意让他们帮忙。这座城市里的政治派系对我来说是个不小的麻烦。"
G["My job title is Waste Management Specialist."]="我的头衔是废物管理专家。"
G["My journeyman often forgets that one must expect to fail many times in the pursuit of perfection."]="我的学徒们常常忘记，一个人要达到登峰造极的境界必须先经历多次失败。"
G["My judgment is final."]="你的命运由我主宰！"
G["My kin won't forget what you've done! We will rage, mortals!"]="我的同胞不会忘记你们所做的一切！承受我们的怒火吧，凡人们！"
G["My kind not welcome at broken pillar. I going back to hill - find me when you done."]="破柱子不欢迎狼獾人。我要回去了，你把事情办完之后再来找我吧。"
G["My kind, da druids, we been layin' low for some time now. We been waitin' to see when an' if Vol'jin might return."]="我们德鲁伊一直潜伏在这里，等待着，看沃金是不是会回来。"
G["My kindness only extends so far, friend."]="我只能为你做这么多了，朋友。"
G["My king!  I cannot hear your voice!  Do not leave me!"]="王！我听不见你的声音！别扔下我！"
G["My king, the world will tremble in reverence..."]="陛下，整个世界将因你而颤抖……"
G["My kingdom? My kingdom is no more."]="我的王国？我的王国已经不复存在了。"
G["My knowledge is limited, though I am still learning. It is time for you to move on, traveler. Find Josef Gregorian in Undercity and tell him you are ready."]="Mi conocimiento es limitado, sigo aprendiendo. Es hora de que sigas adelante. Busca a Josef Gregorian en Entrañas y dile que ya estás $gpreparado:preparada;."
G["My knowledge of Jewelcrafting I will share with you."]="我会和你分享我的珠宝加工知识。"
G["My knowledge of night elf lore is limited, but it is said long ago--back when the night elves still held sacred the art of arcane spell casting--that Azshara was the greatest of their kind. A beautiful woman they named queen. Sadly, it was her addiction to the arcane that would one day be the catalyst for the most devastating events in this world's history."]="我对暗夜精灵的了解有限，但是据说很早以前——当暗夜精灵还掌握着神秘法术时——艾萨拉便是其中的佼佼者，她年轻美貌，是暗夜精灵的女王。不幸地是，正是她对魔法的痴迷才导致历史上最具破坏性事件的发生。"
G["My lady, I am unworthy of your prayer. Truly, you are an angel of light. Please, assist me in returning to the barrow den so that I may return to the Dream. I, like Malfurion, also have a love awaiting me... I must return to her... to protect her..."]="我的女王，我不值得你亲自祈祷。你是光明的天使，希望的化身。请让我返回那个古老的洞穴，这样或许我就可以回到翡翠梦境。跟玛法里奥一样，我也有心爱的她……她在等着我……我必须回到她身边……保护她……"
G["My lady, I think I hear Arthas coming. Whatever you're going to do, do it quickly."]="我的女王，我想我听到了阿尔萨斯的临近。不管您有什么样的计划，请快些执行。"
G["My lady, thank you for coming to our aid. I assure you that we'll do whatever we can to help."]="我的女王，感谢您接受我们的援助。我向您保证，我们会尽一切所能提供帮助。"
G["My lady, the surge needle is fully operational."]="尊贵的女士，湍流之针传送器已准备就绪。"
G["My lady."]="尊贵的主人。"
G["My lady.\n\nI was unable to protect her. How can I return to Silvermoon..."]="我的女士。\n\n我没有能保护她。我又怎么能回到银月城……"
G["My lady. Weapons of the Thunder King are an abomination. They should be destroyed."]="女士，雷电之王的武器都是畸形的怪胎。我们应该销毁它们。"
G["My leg feels much better now, the remedy must be working. If you will excuse me, I must go report to my superiors about what has transpired here."]="我的腿现在感觉好多了，治疗肯定起作用了。请原谅我，我必须去向我的上级汇报这里发生的事情。"
G["My legacy... will live on..."]="我的精神……永垂不朽……"
G["My legend begins NOW!"]="我就是传说！"
G["My legs feel stiff."]="我的腿都僵了。"
G["My liberators! Come down and have a word wit' Norkani."]="我的英雄！过来和洛尔卡尼谈谈。"
G["My liberators! Come down and speak with Kraz."]="我的英雄！过来和克拉斯谈谈。"
G["My liege!  Allow me to go instead."]="殿下！请改派我去吧。"
G["My liege! I have done as you asked, and now beseech you for your blessing!"]="尊敬的陛下！我已经完成您的全部要求，希望您能不吝赐下伟大的祝福！"
G["My liege, a skirmish along the Neferset border just occurred.  A patrol led by your brother was involved..."]="我的君主，不久之前，尼斐塞特边境发生了一场小规模冲突，一支由您的兄弟率领的巡逻队被卷入其中……"
G["My liege, the infiltration and control of the Alliance power structure by our cultists is well underway."]="陛下，我们的教徒已经顺利地混入联盟的地盘并取得了一定的控制权。"
G["My life and spirit has been filled with memories of the insufferable Horde. Times of sorrow, desperation, and sacrifice have come to pass. The rage of battle could never leave my heart!"]="我的生命与灵魂中充斥着部落留给我的痛苦回忆。悲伤、绝望和牺牲已经成为历史。战争的怒火永远在我内心深处燃烧！"
G["My life before the faire was hard.  I never missed it, or my family."]="加入马戏团之前，我的生活苦不堪言。我一点都不想再回忆起那段时光，和那个家。"
G["My life for Ymiron!"]="伊米隆国王万岁！"
G["My life for my masters.  Rejoice!"]="为了我们的主人们！欢呼吧！"
G["My life for the Dread King!"]="恐惧之王万岁！"
G["My life for the Horde!"]="誓死效忠部落！"
G["My life for the Horde."]="誓死效忠部落。"
G["My life for the flame!"]="我的生命属于烈火！"
G["My life for the... death god!"]="我的生命……献给死神！"
G["My life for you!"]="我的生命属于你！"
G["My life for you, master!"]="为你效忠，主人！"
G["My life is forfeit. If in my final hour I can be of some service, you needn't bother asking. Do with me what you will...."]="我的生命已逝。要是在我生命的最后时刻还能效力的话，我将再所不辞。听凭你的安排……"
G["My life is yours, oh great one..."]="我的生命属于您，主人……"
G["My life means nothing!  Our sacred task is all!"]="我的性命并不重要！重要的是一定要完成我们神圣的使命！"
G["My life's fortune... gone.\n\nThere's no hope left for me."]="我一生的财富都……没了。\n\n我的生活已经毫无希望了。"
G["My life... to the master."]="我的生命……属于主人。"
G["My little angel. Are you hungry? Will you eat for auntie Twinbreeze? Just a little?"]="我的小天使，你不饿吗？听蒂布雷兹阿姨的话，吃点东西好吗？就吃一点？"
G["My little sister could best the lot of ya. This ain't no arena. This is a nursery!"]="我的小妹妹也能把你们都打趴下。这里不是竞技场。这里根本就是个托儿所！"
G["My loathing of interruptions is overshadowed only by my hatred of Gruul the Dragonkiller and his seven sons!"]="我讨厌别人打断我说话，但我更讨厌屠龙者格鲁尔和他的七个儿子！"
G["My long hunt is finally over. Today, Justice will be done!"]="我长久以来的追猎终于要结束了！今天，正义将得到伸张！"
G["My lord will be outraged to learn of this ambush.  Let us hope your death will appease him."]="领主知道这次伏击之后一定会勃然大怒的。希望你的死会给他带来一些安慰。"
G["My lord will be... the end of you all!"]="我的主人……会毁灭你们的！"
G["My lord!"]="大人！"
G["My lord, I am ready to go."]="指挥官，我准备好出发了。"
G["My lord, I need to get to the top of the temple."]="指挥官，我想去龙眠神殿顶层。"
G["My lord, Instructor Hroegar conveys that your warriors are ready. They spar on the ledge outside awaiting your orders"]="大人，教官霍加尔禀告说战士们都准备好了。他们正在外面的平台上等候您的命令。"
G["My lord, Lord Servin Darengar, has been staying at Stormwind Keep for some time now. Seek him out in the House of Nobles. He is surrounded by vipers."]="Mi señor, Lord Servin Darengar, lleva ya un tiempo alojado en el Castillo de Ventormenta. Búscalo en la Casa de los Nobles. Está rodeado de víboras."
G["My lord, surely you do not expect me to leave you unattended. Lord Illidan would have my head if anything were to happen to you."]="大人，您显然不是希望我离开您身边吧？如果您有个什么闪失，伊利丹大人一定会惩罚我的。"
G["My lord, this draenei was caught along with an entire contingent of death knights from The Shadow Vault. They are Knights of the Ebon Blade!"]="大人，这个德莱尼人是和一整队来自暗影拱顶的死亡骑士一起被抓的。他们来自黑锋骑士团！"
G["My lord."]="陛下。"
G["My lords and ladies, I present $n, bearer of Quel'Delar."]="Señoras y señores, os presento a $n, $gportador:portadora; de Quel'Delar."
G["My lords!  I come to thee!"]="主人！我听从你们的召唤！"
G["My love... whatever happens... you must protect our... our child...."]="亲爱的……不管发生什么事……你都必须保护我们的……我们的孩子……"
G["My luster... wanes."]="我的光辉……黯淡了。"
G["My lute is all tuned up. Are we ready to compose something?"]="我的鲁特琴已经调整到了最佳状态。我们是否准备好谱写一些东西了？"
G["My machines are the future! They'll destroy you all!"]="我的机器代表未来！它们会将你们统统摧毁的！"
G["My magic is fading. I'm going through!"]="魔力在衰退，我快撑不住了！"
G["My magical power can turn back time to before Thrall's death, but be careful. My power to manipulate time is limited."]="我的魔法力量可以让时间回到萨尔死亡之前，但是小心点，我控制时间的力量是有限的。"
G["My mantid stuffs! Go away!"]="该死的螳螂妖！走开！"
G["My marines are already on shore, holding the harbor entrance.\n\nYou have your orders. Do your jobs, and return safely.\n\nThe eyes of Hellscream are upon you!"]="Mis soldados ya están en la costa y protegen la entrada del puerto. Ya conocéis vuestras órdenes. Cumplidlas y regresad con vida. ¡Grito Infernal os observa!"
G["My master has a message for you..."]="主人要我告诉你……"
G["My master has shown me the future, and you have no place in it. Azeroth will be reborn in darkness. Yogg-Saron shall be released! The Pantheon shall fall!"]="在主人为我展示的未来图景中，没有你们的位置。艾泽拉斯将在黑暗中获得新生。尤格-萨隆将获得自由，而万神殿，必将毁灭！"
G["My master, Plugger Spazzring, is a good boss.  And he makes a lot of money.  His pockets are bursting!"]="我的主人普拉格是个不错的老板，而且他赚了很多钱。他的钱包都快要被撑破了！"
G["My master, we are honored by your presence.  How may I serve thee?"]="我的主人，您的到来使我们万分荣幸。请问有什么可以效劳的？"
G["My masterpiece is finished!"]="我的杰作完成了！"
G["My mate was slain while I was made to watch. Only vengeance remains in my heart."]="在我负责警戒时，敌人杀害了我的伙伴。现在我只想着报仇。"
G["My meager healing powers are at your disposal, Zalduun."]="我所有的治疗之力都听从你的支配，扎尔杜。"
G["My memories of Thalorien went cold and so did his blade."]="对萨洛瑞安的回忆已和他的剑一样冰冷。"
G["My memory isn't what it used to be."]="我的记性大不如前了。"
G["My men - they're all taken... Go! Save youselves!"]="我的人——他们都被带走了……快逃！自己保重！"
G["My men and I will hole up inside the Light's Dawn Cathedral.  I've already given the order and the cannons are on their way.  Lead our people well, Genn."]="我们会在圣光黎明大教堂里死守。我已下令，并布置了火炮。吉恩，好好领导人民。"
G["My men are eager for some blood, commander."]="指挥官，士兵们渴望杀戮的快感。"
G["My men are prepped and ready - just give us the word!"]="我的士兵已经准备好了——请下命令吧！"
G["My men are ready. Let's draw some Vrykul blood!"]="士兵们都准备好了。我们要让那些维库人流血！"
G["My men recovered the corpses of two of Godfrey's lieutenants: Baron Ashbury and Lord Walden."]="我的部下已经复活了高弗雷的两名副官：灰葬男爵和沃登勋爵。"
G["My men speak highly of this Nurong, it will be good to finally meet him."]="弟兄们都对这位砮荣赞誉有加。终于能得见本尊了。"
G["My men. All dead? No..."]="我的人……都死了？不……"
G["My menagerie will eat the flesh from your bones."]="我的兽群将畅享你的血肉。"
G["My message of unity is meant for the Ogre clans, not for you, $R!"]="我的团结号召是针对各食人魔氏族的，而不是你，$R！"
G["My methods never fail!"]="我的方法是绝不会失败的！"
G["My mind is clear. Thank you, $r."]="我的头脑清醒了。谢谢你，$r。"
G["My mind... my flesh... I'm... rotting...!"]="我的思想……我的血肉……我在腐烂……！"
G["My minions..."]="我的仆从们……"
G["My mission is compete. I may have some spare supplies if you need any."]="我的任务就是竞争。我这里还有些剩余补给，不知你是否需要。"
G["My mom said that if I don't get enough exercise, I could end up looking like a sporeling."]="我妈妈说要是我不好好锻炼的话，最后我会变得像个孢子人一样。"
G["My momma always told me these flowers were lucky."]="我妈妈总是跟我说，这些花象征好运。"
G["My money is on one of those kids that came up from the Valley of the Four Winds.\n\nI heard they trained at the monastery in the Jade Forest."]="我把钱押在了其中一个小毛孩身上，他们都是从四风谷来的。\n\n听说他们曾受训于翡翠林的禅院。"
G["My money's on Lam. Did you see him take down Chu during training last week?"]="我押蓝获胜。你没看见他在上周的训练中，是怎么打倒楚的吗？"
G["My money's on the fleshfiend. That creature is terrifying!"]="我赌血肉魔赢。那个家伙很可怕！"
G["My money's on the goblins!  And if you have any sense then yours is too!"]="我已经把钱压在地精身上了！如果你够聪明的话也应该赌地精获胜！"
G["My monks were shrunken by a troll witch doctor, and thus meet the size requirements for battle.  Do you wish to face them in combat?"]="我让一个巨魔巫医把我的武僧们给变小了，以迎合比赛的体型要求。你想跟他们打一场吗？"
G["My mother could hunt faster than you, $n."]="我妈妈狩猎起来都比你快，$n。"
G["My mouth tastes wet!"]="我的嘴巴湿透了！"
G["My mouth waters just to think on it.  Pyall Silentstride is the finest cook in Bloodhoof Village.  You will find him in the great tent at the northwest corner of the village."]="只是想想那美味，我就已经垂涎三尺了。派尔·沉默行者是血蹄村最好的厨师。你可以在村子西北角的大营帐里找到他。"
G["My my - this is all that remains of the terrible being that haunted Pandaria all these years."]="天哪。这就是多年以来一直侵扰着潘达利亚的恐怖生物。"
G["My my, the child of the Worldbreaker, proof that none are beyond redemption. I am honored by your visit."]="哦，灭世者之子，你证明了众生皆可得到救赎。你的光临令我深感荣幸。"
G["My name ISN'T FRONKLE!"]="我的名字不叫弗朗科！"
G["My name is Nimrida, boy."]="我叫尼姆瑞达，小子。"
G["My name is..."]="我的名字是……"
G["My name's J.D., and I really can't tell you much about how I got here, but what I can tell you is that this camp is my home now!\n\nI spend my time studying the strange crystals that can be found all over the crater.  You must have seen some on your way over here.  Say, did you happen to pick any up?"]="我叫科琳，我实在没法告诉你我是怎么到这儿来的，但是我可以告诉你，这个营地现在就是我家了！\n\n我在这儿研究环形山里随处可见的奇怪水晶。你在来这里的路上一定已经看见不少这样的水晶了。你有没有拾取一些水晶？"
G["My neck! I'm gonna sue!"]="我的脖子！我要提出控告！"
G["My new life was just beginning..."]="我的新生命刚刚开始……"
G["My next great adventure is about to begin.\n\nIs that a Light I see?"]="我的下一个伟大的冒险即将开始。\n\n我看到的那是一道圣光吗？"
G["My niece Li Li is so impatient to explore Pandaria. But one never learns a new land by rushing headlong from place to place. It is important to talk to everyone you meet, to experience a place until it becomes a part of your soul.\n\nIt is the Wanderer's Way!"]="我的侄女丽丽无法静下心来探索潘达利亚。但如果只是蜻蜓点水般的东游西逛，是不可能了解一片全新土地的。重要的是，要跟你遇见的每一个人交谈，用心体会每一个地方，直到它已深入你的灵魂。\n\n这才是云游者之道！"
G["My nightmare, is it finally over?"]="我的噩梦终于结束了？"
G["My noble Varo'then, do return and dispose of this murderous band."]="我高贵的瓦罗森，记得回来处理这群野蛮的暴徒。"
G["My nose is cold. That is a very bad sign."]="我的鼻子凉了。这是非常糟糕的预兆。"
G["My official diagnosis is that you are both idiots! IDIOTS I SAY!"]="我的官方诊断结果就是——你们简直是一对白痴！听到没有，白痴！"
G["My older sister, Hilda, told me to expect ye."]="我姐姐希尔达告诉我你会来。"
G["My olfactory sensors detect a burning odor."]="我的嗅觉感应器检测到一股烧焦的味道。"
G["My only wish is to serve you, great one, until I die by your foot!"]="我唯一的愿望只是希望能够服侍伟大的您，我愿为您赴汤蹈火！"
G["My orchids!"]="我的果园！"
G["My order has long wandered these lands, lending aid where we can. Ever since the days of Lei Shen there have been five of our order, passing the secrets of our order from generation to generation."]="我的组织在这片土地上游历多年，尽力帮助他人。自从雷神的时代至今，我们的成员一直保持在五人，将组织的秘密代代相传。"
G["My orders are that you must wait here."]="我奉命请你在这里耐心等待。"
G["My orders are to create a distraction at the Dead Scar so our forces can take the Sun's Reach Armory.  It might not be as glamorous as killing demons face to face, but if it wins us this battle then I'm all for it.\n\nWe are $3233w percent done with our goal."]="我的任务是在死亡之痕吸引敌人的注意力，这样我们的军队就可以拿下阳湾军械库了。虽然听上去并不像和恶魔直接交锋那么吸引人，但如果这能让我们赢下这场战争，那我一定会全力去做。\n\n我们的目标完成率已经达到了百分之$3233w。"
G["My orders from Baine were to secure new holdings in this land and investigate the light our sunwalkers felt. The Alliance is of little concern."]="贝恩的命令是保护我们在这片土地上的新据点，并调查我们的烈日行者所感受到的圣光。联盟方面不足为虑。"
G["My own death came at the hands of Arthas when he and his armies sacked my homeland, Quel'Thalas, and murdered my people."]="阿尔萨斯和他的军队肆虐了我的家园奎尔萨拉斯，杀死我的人民，并给我带来了死亡。"
G["My pain... is endless..."]="我的痛苦……永无止尽……"
G["My pal Buliwyf here can show you how to use fist weapons... or, if you prefer, Ilyenia Moonfire - she's the night elf weapon master on the Warrior's Terrace in Darnassus - can show you, too!"]="我的朋友布里维夫能指示你怎么使用拳套……或者，如果你喜欢女性教师的话，达纳苏斯战士区的暗夜精灵武器大师伊琳尼雅·月火同样能教会你！"
G["My papa always did say to help out a neighbor in need! I've just gotta take care of some stuff here at the market, first. I'll be there soon as I can!"]="我爸爸经常告诉我要在危难之际帮助邻居！我得先去市集上办一些事情才行。我会尽快过去的。"
G["My papa always did say to help out a neighbor in need! I've just gotta take care of some stuff, then I'll be there in a jiffy!"]="我爸爸经常说助人为快乐之本！我手头还有些事要处理，回头一忙完就去找你！"
G["My papa always told me that fish swim 'n birds fly. Now if I can swim AND fly, what does that make me?"]="我老爸常说鱼儿会游、鸟儿会飞。假如我既会游又会飞，那我成啥了？"
G["My papa always told me that friends are worth more than sweet turnips. That's why yer my friend, $n!"]="Mi papá siempre me decía que los amigos valen más que las nabas dulces. ¡Por eso eres mi $gamigo:amiga;, $n!"
G["My papa always told me that good friends are worth more than a chipper carrot. That's why yer my good friend, $n!"]="Mi papá siempre me decía que los buenos amigos valen más que una zanahoria fresca. ¡Por eso tú eres mi $gbuen amigo:buena amiga;, $n!"
G["My papa always told me that neighbors are worth more than earth. Now that's sayin' something!\n\nThat's why yer my neighbor, $n!"]="Mi papá siempre me decía que los vecinos valen más que la tierra. ¡Muy bien dicho!\n\n¡Por eso eres mi $gvecino:vecina;, $n!"
G["My papa always told me to make friends 'stead o' enemies. That's why ye're my buddy!"]="老爸常告诫我要多交朋友少结仇，那就是为什么你会是我哥们！"
G["My pappy helped build this harbor, you know. Ain't she a beauty?"]="知道吗，是我爸爸帮忙建造了这个港口。这里美不美？"
G["My pappy must've told me the story a hunnert times!\n\nBack during the great drought, times sure were hard. Farmers were spitting on their crops to water 'em, it was so dry. The entire town was starvin' o' thirst!\n\nSo what does Farmer Yoon's grandpappy do but pack up his wagon in the middle o' the night.\n\nThen he drives his mushan beast all the way to the lake at the base o' Kun-Lai Summit. He loads up that wagon with a hunnert barrels o' fresh water, then drives right on back.\n\nHe didn't stop fer nuthin'! How could he? Our whole town was dyin'! He drove that busted wagon up to his farm and his mushan died on the spot!\n\nBut we had enough water for the entire town and the spring harvest, too.\n\nSaved Halfhill, Yoon's grandpappy did!"]="我老爸无数次跟我说起过那个故事！\n\n大旱那段期间日子非常难过。农夫们都在用唾沫浇灌庄稼了，因为太干了。整个村子又饿又渴！\n\n所以农夫老愚的祖父在夜里收拾好自己的货车。\n\n然后骑着穆山兽直奔昆莱山脚下的湖泊。他在货车上装满了几百桶清水，然后立即返乡。\n\n他马不停蹄、日夜兼程！他如何能停下脚步？整个村子的人都快渴死了！当他赶着涨裂的货车回到田里时，穆山兽当场就累死了！\n\n但我们村子有了足够的水，并且还完成了春耕。\n\n泽被半山众生，老愚的祖父就是这样的人！"
G["My parents once spoke of a strange, furry folk that lived far to the south of our homeland before the Sundering. I always assumed they spoke of smarter furbolgs.\n\nI know now just how wrong I was. Would that they still walked this world and could see this."]="我的父母曾说过，在大分裂之前，在离我们家乡很遥远的南方居住着一个毛茸茸的奇怪种族。我一直以为他们说的是一种比较聪明的熊怪。\n\n现在我知道自己错得有多离谱了。真希望他们能活到今天，亲眼看看这一切。"
G["My parts, gnoll!"]="这是我的零件，豺狼人！"
G["My path is a dark and cursed one, $c. You do not wish to walk with me."]="我的道路是黑暗的，受到诅咒的。$c，你不会想要和我同行的。"
G["My patience has reached its limit!"]="我的耐心已经到头了！"
G["My patience has reached its limit. I will be rid of you!"]="我的耐心到此为止了。我要亲自消灭你们！"
G["My patience has run out! Die! Die!"]="我的耐心用尽了！死吧！去死吧！"
G["My patron requests your presence."]="我的主人需要你。"
G["My people and I are studying the nearby rivers and ponds. Never before have we seen such revitalizing water."]="我和我们的人民正在研究附近的河流和水塘。我们以前从来没有见过如此具有活力的水。"
G["My people and their new allies will burn this village to the ground."]="我的人民和他们的新盟友会把这个村子夷为平地的。"
G["My people are here to ensure they honor the rules of engagement. It will do your subjects well to see you in the stands."]="我的人在这里是为了确保比赛的井然有序。最好让你的部下知道你在看着他们。"
G["My people are wary of strangers. However, it seems I have no choice but to trust you."]="我的族人们不喜欢陌生人，可是，我欠你太多了。但愿长老们不会因此怪罪我。"
G["My people ask that you pull back your Boulderfist ogres and cease all attacks on our territories. In return, we will also pull back our forces."]="我的人民需要你撤回你的石拳食人魔，并停止所有针对我们领土的进攻。作为回报，我们同样会撤回我们的部队。"
G["My people do not like strangers, but I owe you this much. May the elders not punish me for this deed."]="我的族人们不喜欢陌生人，可是，我欠你太多了。但愿长老们不会因此怪罪我。"
G["My people fight to defend our last village. If we lose now, it will be the end of a lineage of once great emperors and philosophers."]="现在，我的族人要为保卫我们的最后一个村子而战。如果我们现在失败了，那么曾经显赫一时的帝王与贤者的血脉就将消失。"
G["My people gunna rescue me any minute, mon! ....I think."]="我的族人随时会来救我……我相信。"
G["My people have come a long way in those regards, my lady.  I'm sorry if I gave you any cause to doubt."]="我的族人们绝不是徒有虚名，我的女士。如果给您留下了任何疑虑，我都向您致歉。"
G["My people have enjoyed a good relationship with the Wildhammer for quite some time now.\n\nA few of us have settled here... those who have found this land to be a home worth defending."]="我的人民长久以来都和蛮锤部族保持着良好的关系。\n\n我们当中有少数人在此定居。那些人把这片土地看作是值得守护的家园。"
G["My people have faced many trials...but never have we encountered anything like this."]="我的族人面对过许多考验……可却从没遇到过这样的事。"
G["My people have stood tall without you for thousands of years."]="没有你们，我们也挺着胸膛在这里生活了几千年。"
G["My people have survived in Outland..."]="我的同胞在外域中幸存了下来……"
G["My people should have taken this world long ago, during the First War. But they fell to corruption.  In their weakness, they allowed the pitiful races of Azeroth to join the horde.  I will succeed where they have failed, and no power in this world can stop me!"]="早在第一次战争时，我的人民就该统治这个世界。可他们堕落了。他们软弱地允许艾泽拉斯的下等种族加入部落。我要完成他们未竟的事业，谁都别想阻止我！"
G["My people will stand idle no longer. The halls of Ulduar shall be cleansed!"]="我们的人不能再袖手旁观了。我们必须把整个奥杜尔的所有大厅扫荡一遍！"
G["My people, corrupted...\nShai Hu, a local warrior, was the first to drink of the tainted waters.\nHe was strengthed, emboldened, and urged the others to do the same.\nI warned them against it. I sensed danger, corruption..."]="Mi gente, corrompida...\n\nShai Hu, un guerrero local, fue el primero en beber de las aguas contaminadas.\n\nSe hizo más fuerte y valiente, e instó a los demás a hacer lo mismo.\n\nLes advertí que no lo hicieran. Percibí peligro, corrupción..."
G["My people, here $ghe:she; is! The one who gave the Inkgill new life. $n!"]="¡Mi gente, aquí $glo:la; tenéis! $gEl:La; que dio nueva vida a Branquias de Tinta. ¡$n!"
G["My people, they are as shattered as the relic you seek to repair."]="我的人民，他们就像你试图修复的遗物一样支离破碎。"
G["My people, who have suffered through so many challenges and betrayals, look to me to secure their future."]="我的人民，经历了太多的挑战与背叛，希望我能保证他们的未来。"
G["My pet! Oh no!  Uh... I am shure that pet is around here somewhere..."]="我的宠物！哦，不！嗯……我相信那个小东西应该就在这附近……"
G["My pets are all hand-grown! You don't stand a chance!"]="我的宠物都是我亲手养大的！你毫无半点机会！"
G["My pets claim yet another victim."]="我的宠物们又夺取了一条性命。"
G["My pets speak to me. They tell me stories late at night."]="我的宠物们会跟我说话。还会在夜晚给我讲故事。"
G["My pheromones should be useful when dealing with multiple enemies."]="在对付多个敌人时，我的信息素将会有所帮助。"
G["My plan hinges on you bringing us as many arrows as you can from the battlefield, $c."]="我的计划取决于你能否从战场上给我们带来尽可能多的箭矢，$c。"
G["My plan was to connect these underground waters directly to the Emerald Dream itself. With my faithful disciples, I journeyed deep within the Wailing Caverns, settled into meditation, and entered the Dream. Through my own body, this world was connected to it.\n\nIt was there that everything went wrong."]="我的计划是将这些地下水与翡翠梦境直接连通。我带领我忠实的信徒们，进入到哀嚎洞穴深处，在冥想中进入翡翠梦境。通过我的躯体，这个世界和翡翠梦境连接在一起。\n\n然而就在那时，发生了可怕的灾祸。"
G["My pleasure, milady!"]="我很荣幸，夫人！"
G["My pleasure, sugar drop.  I'll be back soon..."]="啊，我很荣幸，小甜心。我很快就回来……"
G["My plucky companion Bixi Wobblebonk here can train ye in crossbows. If ye're looking for other trainers, though, ye might want to try Ilyenia Moonfire on the Warrior's Terrace in Darnassus, or maybe the draenei weapon master, Handiir, in the Trader's Tier within the Exodar."]="那个勇敢的比克斯就能教你怎么使用弩。不过如果你在找其他训练师的话，可以去找达纳苏斯战士区的伊琳尼雅·月火，或者是埃索达内贸易阶梯的德莱尼人武器大韩迪尔。"
G["My poor Gobbles..."]="我可怜的哥培尔……"
G["My poor Lo. He tried so hard to earn the respect of the pandriarchs. It was the only honorable solution we could think of to bypass our family feuds."]="我可怜的罗。他是那么努力地去争取族长们的认可，这也是我们能够想到的唯一一个能避开家族恩怨的体面的解决办法。"
G["My poor family. Everything has been destroyed."]="我可怜的家，所有的东西都被摧毁了。"
G["My poor flying machine. She didn't survive the crash and without spare parts, I'll never get 'er up and running again!"]="我可怜的飞行器。她在坠机事故中遭到严重损坏，我偏偏没有备用零件。看样子她是没法恢复原貌了！"
G["My poor old bones were starting to get stiff out here."]="我这把可怜的老骨头都要在这里僵住了。"
G["My portal creation spells do not appear to work here. The damned naaru constructed this place well."]="我的传送门创造法术似乎在这里不起作用。该死的纳鲁把这个地方建得滴水不漏。"
G["My power cannot be contained!"]="我的力量无可匹敌！"
G["My power grows feeble, brothers. I shamefully must rely on you for a time."]="我的力量在衰减，兄弟们。暂时我必须依赖你们了。真是羞耻啊。"
G["My power has returned!"]="我的力量回来了！"
G["My power is discombobulatingly devastating! It is ludicrous that these mortals even attempt to enter my realm!"]="我拥有无穷的力量！这些愚蠢的凡人居然企图进入我的领域！"
G["My power is unimaginable!"]="我的力量超出你的想象！"
G["My power is waning - support me, brothers!"]="我的力量正在消褪……兄弟们，支援我！"
G["My power is waning... you fool! I will come for you next!"]="我的力量衰减了……蠢货！我一定会回来取你性命！"
G["My power wanes!"]="我的力量在衰退！"
G["My power... is gone!"]="我的力量……消失了！"
G["My powers are drained!"]="我的力量在流失！"
G["My powers are fading, Highlord!"]="我的力量正在减弱，大领主！"
G["My powers have returned and you have squandered your chance, foolish mortals. Till we meet again."]="我已经恢复了力量，愚蠢的人类，你浪费了一次机会。下次再会吧。"
G["My powers must be concentrated on the portal! I do not have time to hold the shield!"]="我的能量必须集中在传送门上！我没有时间来增强护盾了！"
G["My powers of sight... I beheld the future... I have seen what is to come..."]="我的预视能力……我看到了未来……我看到了将要发生的一切……"
G["My precious $n! You'll pay for that!"]="¡Mi $gquerido:querida; $n! ¡Pagarás por eso!"
G["My precious magmawyrms... perhaps not all is lost... perhaps there is something left to raise."]="啊，我的熔岩之龙……事情并非无可挽回……或许我还能让它们复生。"
G["My pride cloaked this land in mists! I thought we were better than the rest of the world."]="骄傲令这片土地陷入迷雾！我们自以为比外面的世界更优越。"
G["My programming will not allow me to lower the cost of any items."]="我的规划是不允许减少任何项目的成本的。"
G["My purpose is to regulate access to the Uldum complex for the Creators.  I allow entry into the compound only when the solicitor exhibits for access the proper sequencing discs.\n\nYour disc set currently does not contain the Plates of Uldum, the primary prerequisite for entry.  Access is not granted unless the Plates of Uldum are present."]="我的职责是为造物者守卫奥丹姆的入口。只有拥有正确的圆盘才能进入其中。\n\n你的圆盘中没有包含奥丹姆圆盘，所以你不具备进入奥丹姆的基本条件。除非奥丹姆圆盘存在，否则你无法进入。"
G["My quad-corder has detected some anomolous readings from the nether anomolies."]="我的四分记录器从虚空中检测到了一些反常的讯息。"
G["My queen, they... come."]="我的女王，他们……来了。"
G["My question to you is this, $c:\nWhich of the Aspects created by the titans became the nefarious creature known as Deathwing?"]="我想问你，$c：\n在泰坦创造的守护巨龙中，是谁后来变成了被称作死亡之翼的邪恶生物？"
G["My rage is not silenced... but it is quieter. For now."]="我的怒火并未平息……只是我的心情暂时平静了一些。"
G["My rangers have sent back disturbing reports from Za'Tual. I believe it is time to take this fight to their doorstep."]="我的游侠从赞图尔发回的报告相当令人不安。我想，该是我们打上门去的时候了。"
G["My raptor can take on ANYTHING and ANYONE!"]="我的迅猛龙能战胜任何事任何人！"
G["My realm has at last been cleansed of the vile filth."]="终于把污秽从我的国度中清除了。"
G["My redemption? You are bold, little one. My redemption comes by the will of my god."]="¿Mi redención? Eres muy $gosado:osada;, $gpequeñajo:pequeñaja;. Mi redención llegará cuando mi dios así lo desee."
G["My rescue plan is brilliant. Infallible. Only a goblin could possibly stop me from succeeding. A goblin with fins. Scary thought."]="我的营救计划非常完美。简直无懈可击。只有一个地精可能阻止我成功。一个长鳍的地精。这想法可真可怕。"
G["My research must continue."]="我的研究必须继续下去。"
G["My ribs are broken."]="我的肋骨断了。"
G["My ring... Who holds my family ring... Tilloa, is that you?"]="我的戒指……谁拿走了我的家族戒指……蒂罗亚，是你吗？"
G["My rotting flesh was just getting in the way!"]="我的烂肉还真碍事！"
G["My scepter will once again become whole!"]="我的节杖再次合二为一啦！"
G["My scepter... After so many years... You have recovered it! You shall truly be the savior of this place...\n\nPlease listen to me carefully, $n. The head and the rod of the scepter may only be reunited into one at the Stone of Maraudon."]="Mi cetro... Después de tantos años... ¡Lo has recuperado! ¡Realmente eres $gel salvador:la salvadora; de este lugar!\n\nEscucha con atención, $n. Solo es posible unir la cabeza y la vara en la Piedra de Maraudon."
G["My scouts have informed me that the grove holds a powerful weapon. A weapon that the Alliance will use against us if they are not stopped."]="据我的眼线回报，在树林里藏着某种强大的武器。如果不加以阻止，联盟就将用它来对付我们。"
G["My scouts have reported nothing but quiet outside Zul'Aman."]="我的斥候报告说祖阿曼附近没有任何动静。"
G["My scouts report that the Syndicate has taken up residence in a hidden cave on the eastern plateau. Be cautious when adventuring in that area."]="我的斥候报告说辛迪加在东部平原一处隐秘的洞穴中居住。在你进入这片地区的时候要小心。"
G["My scouts report that the shield is maintained by several generators around the island."]="根据斥候的报告，这座岛屿上有几部护盾发生器，它们为护盾提供能量。"
G["My scouts tell me that you brought the shield down. I'm confused as to why you're back here instead of up there killing their leader."]="我的斥候告诉我，说你击落了护盾。我很纳闷，为什么你会回到这儿，而不是在那里追杀他们的首领。"
G["My seeds grow the best veggies in the valley. Guaranteed!"]="我的种子长出的菜是谷里最好的，我保证！"
G["My sensibilities are offended by this mess!"]="这些玩意儿伤害了我的感情！"
G["My sentinels have faced far worse than this jungle has to offer."]="我的哨兵曾经面对过比这丛林还要糟糕的境况。"
G["My sentinels have faced many dangers since we came to this new land. We are ready for whatever the future has to offer."]="因为我们来到这片新的土地，所以我的哨兵面临许多危险。我们准备好迎接任何挑战。"
G["My services were rendered. The protection of the city is not my jurisdiction. I believe that's why they call you \"peacekeepers?\""]="Yo cumplí con mi cometido. La protección de la ciudad está fuera de mi jurisdicción. Creo que por eso os llaman \"¿pacificadores?\""
G["My sheep! Someone, do something!"]="我的羊！来人啊，帮帮忙啊！"
G["My shift's almost over.  Can't wait to catch some shut-eye, know what I mean?"]="差不多到换班的时间了。我好想眯一会儿，你明白我的意思吧？"
G["My shiny..."]="我那亮晶晶的宝贝……"
G["My ship took a beating to make landing on these shores. I will see to it that they pay for every single nick on her hull."]="我的船经过一番斗争才得以靠上这片海岸。我一定会让他们为她船体上的每一条伤疤付出代价的。"
G["My shop is filled with many wonderous and hard to come by things. It would be wise to look, but not to touch."]="我这里卖的都是既神奇又难得的宝贝。快来瞧瞧吧，不过别乱碰。"
G["My shop's doors will always be open to you, friend."]="我的店门将永远对你敞开，朋友。"
G["My sight is filled with visions of events taking place throughout the world and ones that may yet happen. Many of them are grim, but we needn't believe they are incapable of changing."]="我的预言梦境中充满了世界各地正在发生着和可能发生的事件的景象。它们大部分都非常可怕，不过，这未必是不可改变的。"
G["My sight may be gone, but I am fortunate to live in a land which rewards all of the senses."]="我的视力可能不行了，但幸运的是，我生活在一个到处都充满了感知的土地上。"
G["My sincerest apologies for the disturbance, my liege. But I believe I have something you may be very interested in!"]="打扰了您，我深表歉意，我的主人。但我相信，我这儿有您非常感兴趣的东西！"
G["My sister Silanna is naive to the growing danger in these woods. But like it or not, as soon as I get this wagon loaded we're moving within the city walls. \n\nIt appears that I've got more bags here than I need. Perhaps you could make use of them."]="Mi hermana Silanna es muy ingenua, no entiende el peligro creciente que habita en estos bosques. Pero de todas formas, en cuanto cargue el carro, nos vamos a la ciudad. \n\nParece ser que tengo más bolsas de las que necesito. Quizás a ti te vengan bien."
G["My sister and I haven't seen this much activity in Honeydew since, well ever!"]="我跟妹妹从来都没在蜜露村里见过这种阵势，从来没有！"
G["My sister lives with my father in his farmhouse in the middle of the farmlands, just east of the big ol' crane statue.\n\nI like to see my sister now and then, but she's usually too busy making herself look pretty for the next farmboy to pass through these parts."]="我的姐姐和我父亲一起住在田地中间的农舍里，就在那座古旧的仙鹤雕像东边。\n\n我很希望能时不时地见到我姐姐，但她这些天来总是忙于梳妆打扮，好引起那些路过这里的农场小伙的注意。"
G["My sisters and I have come down from the Stonetalon Mountains to put to rest a tragedy from ages past. Unfortunately, we are not powerful enough to accomplish our goals on our own and now seek mortals such as yourself to aid us.\n\nIf you are powerful enough, then we have much to discuss, $c. If you are not, then, for your safety, I will leave the details of my mission out of our conversation."]="Mis hermanas y yo hemos venido desde Sierra Espolón para concluir una tragedia del pasado. Por desgracia, no somos lo suficientemente poderosas para conseguir nuestro objetivo, y estamos buscando a un mortal como tú que pueda ayudarnos.\n\nSi eres lo suficientemente $gpoderoso:poderosa;, podríamos hablar de ello, $c. Si no, por tu propia seguridad, no te contaré los detalles de esta misión."
G["My sisters and I welcome you, $r."]="我和姐妹们都欢迎您造访，$R。"
G["My skill at creating potions is inferior to yours. You are ready to speak with Ainethil, just over there. She will understand that you are ready for further instruction."]="Mi habilidad creando pociones es inferior a la tuya. Estás $glisto:lista; para hablar con Ainethil. Ella comprenderá que estás $gpreparado:preparada; para seguir tu instrucción."
G["My skills are better for offense, not defense."]="我更擅长攻击，而不是防御。"
G["My skills are no match for yours. I admit defeat."]="我打不过你。我认输了。"
G["My skull feels like it was hit by a hammer, but otherwise I'm all right. That's more than I can say for most of the crew."]="我的脑袋就像被榔头砸过一样，不过除此之外，我毫发无伤。我敢说，这一点已经比大部分船员都好多了。"
G["My slack-jawed compatriot, the time to act is now! Pull yourself together and lend me a hand!"]="别发呆了，拿出行动来！赶紧打起精神，帮我一把啊！"
G["My snakes are pretty right? ...RIGHT?"]="我的蛇很漂亮对吧？……对吧？"
G["My snakes, mon. They took my snakes!"]="我的蛇，伙计。他们抢走了我的蛇！"
G["My son Dion is out in fields all day. He works so hard. Makes Mama so proud."]="我的儿子迪恩整天在牧场。他这么努力工作。妈妈很自豪。"
G["My son Dion say Mama make the best dumplings in all of Valley!\n\nOoohoohoohooo. That's my boy."]="我的儿子迪恩说，妈妈做的饺子是全谷最好吃的！\n\n噢哈哈哈。真是我的好儿子。"
G["My son could design a faster car than that clunky goblin junk heap!"]="我那两岁的儿子设计的赛车都比那些可笑的地精造出来的破烂跑得更快！"
G["My son does not eat enough. Look at him! So scrawny and skinny! I must feed him more."]="我的儿子吃的不多。看看他！骨瘦如柴！我要多给他吃点儿。"
G["My son loved these feathers because they are blue as the sky. He always said he was going to fly someday."]="我的儿子很喜欢这些羽毛，因为它们像天空一样蓝。他总是说，他总有一天要飞翔。"
G["My son used to love finding these feathers."]="我的儿子之前喜欢收集这些羽毛。"
G["My son! My dear, beautiful boy!"]="我的儿子！最让我自豪的孩子！"
G["My son's soul will find no comfort in this hollow victory, dragon. I will have him back. Though it takes a millennia, I WILL have my son back!"]="虚假的胜利无法告慰我儿子的灵魂。我会把他找回来的。尽管这或许需要数千年，但是我会把他找回的！"
G["My son, Taelan, was only a child when I was found guilty of treason and banished from the Alliance to live a life in exile. I chose to remain here so that I could watch over him; to somehow insure that he would grow up an honorable man.\n\nAs I had hoped, he took my place as lord of Mardenholde; but in a cruel twist of fate, joined the ranks of the Scarlet Crusade. He is now their Highlord, $r."]="当我以叛国罪被放逐离开联盟过着流放的生活时，我的儿子泰兰还是个小孩。我呆在这儿就是为了看着他长大，让他成为一个可敬的人。\n\n正如我期望的那样，他接替我的位置，成为玛登霍尔德之王，但是命运是如此残酷，他加入了血色十字军的队伍。现在他成了十字军的高级统领，$r。"
G["My son, there will come a day when you will command the Ashbringer and, with it, mete out justice across this land. I have no doubt that when that day finally comes, you will bring pride to our people and that Lordaeron will be a better place because of you. But, my son, that day is not today."]="我的儿子啊，你总有一天会举起灰烬使者，凭借它的力量在这片土地上匡扶正义。我坚信，当那一天终于到来的时候，你会为我们的人民带来荣光，洛丹伦将因你而变得更加美好。但，我的孩子，不是今天。"
G["My son... he's here? Alive!?"]="我的儿子……他在这儿？安然无恙！？"
G["My son... though I have recovered my goods, what will come of him?"]="我的儿子……虽然我找回了货物，可我的儿子会有什么下场？"
G["My soul burns for revenge, but the elements tell me to think clearly. The Lich King is a ruthless opponent... one who must be handled carefully."]="复仇的烈焰煎熬着我的灵魂，但眼前的局势迫使我们必须仔细权衡。巫妖王是个残忍的对手……我们要小心应付。"
G["My soul for you, master."]="我的灵魂属于您，主人。"
G["My soul has been wracked with unbearable anxiety, dark thoughts... distancing me from the Light."]="焦虑和痛苦撕扯着我的灵魂，邪恶的念头……让我远离圣光。"
G["My soul is not a trinket!  Mortal, you must release me from these chains!"]="我的灵魂不是用来当装饰品的！凡人，你必须将我从枷锁中释放出来！"
G["My sources say \"no\". Before the torture, that is."]="Mis fuentes decían \"no\". Eso fue antes de torturarlas."
G["My sparkly!"]="看我的金闪闪！"
G["My spear will finish you!"]="用我的长矛终结你！"
G["My spirit be watchin' over ya, $n."]="我的灵魂与你同在，$n。"
G["My spirit dreams no longer..."]="我的灵魂再也不会做梦了……"
G["My spirit gonna be watchin' over ya, $n."]="我的灵魂与你同在，$n。"
G["My spirit is lifted with the sight of you, $c. We fight on two fronts.\n\nWe're trying to push back the yaungol horde at the gate. And up on the mountain to the north, we've lost the Shado-Pan Monastery to unknown forces."]="一看到你我的精神就振奋了，$c。我们在两条战线上激战。\n\n在大门处，我们奋力击退野牛人大军。在北边的山上，我们的影踪禅院被未知力量攻占了。"
G["My spirit leaves this cursed place at last..."]="终于我的灵魂可以离开这被诅咒的地方……"
G["My spirit will fight on."]="我的灵魂会继续战斗！"
G["My spirit... goes on."]="我的灵魂……会继续战斗。"
G["My spouse has gone missing! Please help!"]="我的另一半走丢了！快帮帮我！"
G["My squad stands ready, $r.\n\nWe have a traditional defense that should prove effective against your Horde enemies."]="我的小队已经准备就绪，$r。\n\n我们已经开发出了一种可以有效打击你的部落敌人的武器。"
G["My squad's morale has improved since we entered the Vale."]="在进入四风谷后，我军的士气有所提高。"
G["My squire will retrieve your purse for you."]="我的侍从会为你取回荷包。"
G["My ssssserpents, dey already ssssslither beneath every rock an' shrub of Ssssstranglethorn."]="荆棘谷每一块岩石和灌木之下都潜伏着我的毒蛇。"
G["My state of the art teleporter will take you straight to the Northern Barrens. Whaddaya say?"]="我的高新传送器可以将你直接送往北贫瘠之地。想试试吗？"
G["My statue will crush the life from him, leaving nothing but a shattered corpse."]="我的石雕将碾碎他的生命，只留下四分五裂的躯壳。"
G["My story? It is kind of you to ask. Very well.\n\nLong ago on the planet Draenor - the remains of which are now known as the Outland - all of the draenei lived in peace. But then the Burning Legion came, and they corrupted the orcs with their fel magics.\n\nWith no other option we fought to survive, but exposure to these fel energies had horrible effects upon some of us, over time transforming us into the Broken like me, or worse, the seemingly mindless Lost Ones.\n\nShall I go on?"]="我的故事？很高兴你问起这个。\n\n很久以前，在德拉诺世界——它的遗迹就是你所知道的外域——所有的德莱尼人都和平地生活着。但是燃烧军团来了，他们用魔法腐蚀了兽人。\n\n为了生存，我们除了战斗之外别无选择，但是这些魔法能量的辐射对我们中的一些人造成了可怕的影响，一段时间之后，我们变成了像我这样的破碎者，或者更糟糕的，变成看起来可以说是愚昧无知的失落者。\n\n要我继续说下去吗？"
G["My strength ... is beginning ... to falter. Kalytha, please tell me the Archmages have a backup plan..."]="我的力量……正在……减弱。卡莱莎，请告诉我，大法师们还有备用计划……"
G["My strength grows!"]="我的力量不断增长！"
G["My strength is returning, slowly....\n\nI hope to be able to show you the glory of my true form soon."]="我的力量在逐渐恢复……\n\n很快你就能见识到我真正的实力。"
G["My strength is returning. Press on, heroes!"]="我的力量回来了。坚持，英雄们！"
G["My strength returns."]="我的力量恢复了。"
G["My strength returns. Speak to me, Wakener, before I report to the Klaxxi."]="我的力量回来了。在我向卡拉克西报告之前与我交谈，唤醒者。"
G["My strength wanes, mortal. I have done as promised, the way is clear. I now return to whence I came."]="我的力量在消退，人类。我履行了承诺，清除了道路。我得回去啦。"
G["My strength.... is... returning!"]="我的……力量……正在恢复！"
G["My strider requires training."]="我的陆行鸟需要接受训练。"
G["My studies... had only just begun..."]="我的研究……才刚刚开始……"
G["My suffering is at an end, $r. But yours has just begun!"]="我的苦难将要终结，$r。可你的才刚刚开始！"
G["My suffering is eternal!"]="我的痛苦是永恒的！"
G["My sweet, adorable progeny!"]="我的心肝宝贝！"
G["My sword Archeus served me well in life, but as at last my spirit may pass from the unhappy existence, I need it no longer."]="我的佩剑阿契厄斯伴随了我一生，但是现在我的灵魂已经脱离了痛苦，我已经不再需要它了。"
G["My sword is quick and my feet steady. Enemies must deal with me first before attacking my allies."]="我步履沉着、运剑如风。敌人必须先打倒我，才能去阻挠我的战友们。"
G["My tactics are unbeatable."]="我的战术无以伦比。"
G["My talents are wasted on this filth."]="我的时间都浪费在对付你们这些肮脏的家伙身上了。"
G["My talons will shred your puny body, $R."]="我的爪子将把你撕得粉碎，$R。"
G["My talons will slice you to shreds, invader."]="Mis garras te desagarrarán, $ginvasor:invasora;."
G["My task is done!"]="任务完结！"
G["My teachings are only of use to mages. I cannot help you, $c."]="我的魔法只传授给法师。很抱歉，$c。"
G["My teachings would be too advanced for you at this stage. If you wish to learn more of potions, speak with Tel'Athir here instead."]="对你来说，我的教学在这个阶段略显深奥了。要是你想学习有关药水的更多知识，就跟泰兰希尔谈谈。"
G["My team will crush you."]="我的队伍将粉碎你。"
G["My teammate is to blame for everything..."]="都是我队友的错……"
G["My thane, I bear untimely news. Your champion, Bethod, has fallen in the ring at Valhalas. As a vargul, he has been exiled to The Underhalls."]="领主大人，我带来了最终的消息。您的勇士贝索德，已经在瓦哈拉斯阵亡了。作为一名瓦古，他已经被放逐到地下大厅去了。"
G["My thanks for your assistance, champions. I will tend to the slain and wounded here before returning to Ironforge."]="感谢你们的协助，勇士们。在返回铁炉堡之前，我得先照料这里的死者和伤者。"
G["My thanks to you, hero!"]="谢谢你，英雄！"
G["My thanks! None of us expected to survive... I will aid you as best as I can!"]="谢谢！我们都没想到能活下来……我会尽我所能帮助你！"
G["My thanks! Shall we make our way off this miserable little island?"]="谢谢你！我们现在能离开这该死的小岛了吗？"
G["My thanks, $p, for saving me from that vile jade witch.\n\nEven now my legs still feel stiff. I can command soldiers, if we can call these creatures that. But I think I will be of little use in any battle."]="谢谢你，$p，你把我从那个邪恶的巫婆手里救了出来。\n\n虽然我的腿到现在还有点僵硬。但我可以帮你指挥士兵——如果这些家伙也能算士兵的话。但我恐怕没法在战场上起多大作用了。"
G["My thanks, $r. I won't be forgettin' dis."]="我要感谢你，$r。我不会忘记你所做的一切。"
G["My thanks, brave one."]="谢谢你，勇士。"
G["My thanks, stranger."]="Gracias, $gextranjero:extranjera;."
G["My theory is there isn't anything that can't be fixed with fire!"]="我的理论就是，没有啥是用火修不好的！"
G["My thoughts exactly."]="我的想法很对。"
G["My time is done."]="我的命运终结了。"
G["My time is done... I offered myself to Alexstrasza in life, but I have nothing left to offer in death.  She will need a new keeper for her shrine."]="我的时日不多了……我为阿莱克丝塔萨女王奉献了一生，可死亡终将阻断我的奉献之意。红玉巨龙圣地需要一名新的守护者。"
G["My time with the Red Crane was short, but I learned a great deal under his tutelage.\n\nThis foe--this \"sha\" energy--is unlike anything we've ever faced. It is the physical manifestation of emotional turmoil, bottled in the land for centuries\n\nThis emotional energy has now burst forth to find living, feeling hosts in which to reside.\n\nThe sha threatens to wash over the whole continent, possibly the world, if we do not aid the pandaren in facing it down!"]="He pasado poco tiempo con la Grulla Roja, pero he aprendido mucho bajo su tutela.\n\nEste enemigo, esta energía \"sha\", no se parece a nada a lo que nos hayamos enfrentado anteriormente. Es la manifestación física del tormento emocional encerrado en la tierra durante siglos.\n\nEsta energía emocional ha estallado en busca de vida, tanteando a huéspedes donde residir.\n\n¡El sha amenaza con arrasar todo el continente, posiblemente el mundo entero, si no ayudamos a los pandaren a acabar con él!"
G["My time with the Shado-Pan has taught me many secrets. Perhaps you have earned the right to learn some as well."]="我在影踪派期间学到了许多秘技。或许你也已经有幸学到了一些。"
G["My time... has run out..."]="我的生命……结束了……"
G["My torment continues."]="我的痛苦还在继续。"
G["My torture is ended and now I can join the Goddess. Thank you so very much!"]="苦难的日子终于到头了，现在我能追随女神而去了。非常感谢你！"
G["My totems!!!"]="我的图腾！！！"
G["My training has led to this point. I must not fail my brothers and sisters!"]="这么多年的训练就是为了今天，我决不能让我的兄弟姐妹们失望！"
G["My training was for nothing, because of you!"]="都是因为你，让我的训练全白费了！"
G["My treasure! You no steal from Tartek, dumb big-tongue traitor thing."]="我的宝藏！可耻的叛徒，不许偷塔尔特克的东西。"
G["My trees.... they have withered up and died just like me."]="我的树……它们正在枯萎而死，就像我一样。"
G["My troll bruddas be in for some real fun today, mon!"]="这些巨魔朋友今天可有乐子了！"
G["My troops are yours to command, my King."]="我的部队听候您的吩咐，国王陛下。"
G["My tummy doesn't feel so good..."]="我有点想吐……"
G["My turn, meathead! I get to throw now."]="傻瓜，轮到我了！我要投掷了。"
G["My vicious teromoths will avenge me!"]="我的巨蛾们会为我报仇的！"
G["My victory draws near."]="我的胜利近在眼前。"
G["My victory is close at hand."]="我的胜利近在咫尺。"
G["My victory will be sweet."]="我会品尝到甜美的胜利。"
G["My vigil never ends, but I cherish this short reprieve in my duty."]="我的守望永不停歇，但我很珍惜这个短暂的假期。"
G["My village is under attack! I hope my family is alright."]="我的村庄在受到攻击！我希望家人都安好。"
G["My village will not enter your conflict. Though, I fear your arrival has changed our peaceful existence forever."]="我的村庄不会卷入你们的冲突。尽管你们的到来也许已经彻底打乱了我们平静的生活。"
G["My vision in the Eye of Eternity haunts me, Kalecgos. What do you make of it?"]="永恒之眼里的景象一直困扰着我，卡雷苟斯。你是怎么看的？"
G["My vision is clouded, why have you done this to us?"]="我被蒙蔽了，你为什么要这样对待我们？"
G["My voice, gone?  How will my subjects hear me?  Will they still love their empress?  Will they turn on me as the Klaxxi have?"]="怎么了？臣民们都不听我的了？他们还会爱自己的女皇吗？会不会像卡拉克西一样背叛我？"
G["My wares are reserved for those who have proven themselves on the field of battle. Come see me after you've swept the fields clean of Alliance filth."]="我的货物只卖给那些在战场上证明过自己的人。等你扫清了战场上的联盟渣滓再来找我吧。"
G["My wares are reserved for those who have proven themselves on the field of battle. You'll need to prove your dominance over the Horde scum before I'll entrust them to you."]="我的货物只卖给那些在战场上证明过自己的人。在我把它们托付给你之前，你得先证明自己比那些部落渣滓强。"
G["My warmages are inbound and will arrive presently.\n\nSpeak to me again when they have returned,"]="我手下的战斗法师很快就会回来。\n\n等他们到了之后再来找我谈谈吧。"
G["My warriors! You have already proven your valor. This is why the Warchief has selected you."]="我的战士们！你们已经证明了自己的勇猛。这也是酋长选中你们的原因。"
G["My watch continues."]="我将继续守护。"
G["My watch is eternal, mortal."]="我将永远在此守护，凡人。"
G["My waters are cleansed! Drink in their power!"]="我的水域净化了！汲取它的力量吧！"
G["My weapon be thirsty!"]="我渴望战斗！"
G["My weapon! Champion, with me. I want you to see this."]="我的武器！勇士，跟我来。我要你见证这一切。"
G["My weapons are nearby - we can regroup with Irontree."]="我的武器就在附近——我们可以去和铁木会合。"
G["My whole family's been killed! Where was the army when we needed them most?"]="我的家人都被杀害了！在我们最需要军队帮助的时候，他们在哪儿？"
G["My wife and I were happy for 23 years..."]="我和我的妻子一起快乐地生活了二十三年……"
G["My wife and children are sick in bed because of the poison you sold me!"]="你卖的食物有毒！我的妻子和孩子都病倒了！"
G["My wife used to make a mean dish of braised turtle. The taste of that dish sure would bring back memories."]="我妻子常会做一道美味的炖龟肉，那味道一定能带来美好的回忆。"
G["My wife, Leza, is in labor and fighting a fever.\n\nThis cursed jungle is sapping all of our strength. It could be something in the water."]="我的妻子莱莎即将分娩，现在还发着高烧。\n\n这该死的丛林简直要榨干我们所有人的力量了。也许是水里有古怪。"
G["My wind riders are trained to fly quickly through the hot Barrens air."]="我的双足飞龙可以在贫瘠之地高速飞翔。"
G["My wisdom is yours, as is my knowledge. What can I do for you, $n?"]="我的智慧就是你的智慧，我的知识也一样。我能为你做什么，$n？"
G["My wolf will feast on your blood!"]="我的座狼将畅饮你的鲜血。"
G["My work here is complete!"]="我的工作完成了！"
G["My work here is done."]="我在这里的工作已经完成了。"
G["My work here is done. I'll be sure to let Mar'alith and the others at Cenarion Hold know that you helped me out a little. Be careful in here, you don't have me holdin' your hand past this point."]="我在这里的任务已经结束了。我会告诉玛尔利斯和塞纳里奥要塞的其他人，让他们知道你们帮了我的忙。多加小心，越过这里，我就没法帮助你们了。"
G["My work is done."]="我的使命完成了。"
G["My work is not quite finished. This cloak will grant you the power of the celestials."]="我还没有全部完成。这件斗篷能带给你至尊天神的力量。"
G["My work must not be interrupted!"]="我的工作不能中断！"
G["My work will continue... elsewhere."]="我的伟业将在别处……继续。"
G["My workers are highly skilled, but they are ineffective when it comes to combat. Do not wander too far off."]="我的工人有着高超的建筑技艺，却并不擅长战斗。别跑得太远了。"
G["My wounds are grave.  Forgive my slow pace but my injuries won't allow me to walk any faster."]="我伤得很重。很抱歉我不能走得更快一些。"
G["My wounds are not healing, $r.  I fear I may die inside this creature's gut if we do not act soon."]="我的伤口还没愈合，$r。要是我们不尽快行动，恐怕我就要死在这家伙的肚子里。"
G["My wrath flows freely!"]="我的怒火一泻千里！"
G["My wrath knows no bounds!"]="我的怒火无边！"
G["My wrench of vengance awaits!"]="我要挥起复仇的扳钳！"
G["My younger brother here is quite the rising star in the Consortium. Of course, he's too modest to acknowledge it."]="我身边的弟弟是星界财团的后起之秀。当然，他太谦虚了，甚至要拒绝这种光荣。"
G["My zeppelin has docked. Despite my being held captive, and the sorry state that she's in, she'll be departing the dock again in two minutes."]="我的飞艇刚刚入港。虽然我被扣押起来充当人质，而且飞艇本身的状态也不太好，但是2分钟后，她就要再度起航了。"
G["My, it sure is hot down here. I didn't even need to bring my own forge."]="天呐，这里可真热。我连熔炉都可以不用带了。"
G["My, my, I never thought I would have the chance to see Ulduar myself. Why, when Brann asked me to help fund this expedition, how could I refuse?!"]="天哪，我从来没有想过能亲眼目睹泰坦之城奥杜尔。当布莱恩恳求我资助这支探险队时，我怎么能忍心拒绝呢？！"
G["My, my. Hello, stranger! Sampled my dream brew, have we? Its visions are hard to interpret - half truth, half illusion. Who's to say which is which?"]="啊，你好，陌生人！洄梦仙酒味道如何？酒不醉人人自醉，雾里看花花非花。半梦半醒，谁是谁非？"
G["My, that Black Claw stout packs quite a punch!"]="啊，好来劲的酒啊！"
G["My, that's quite a load you have there."]="哇噢，你可装了不少。"
G["My, you are strong! When I was young, I might have doubted that we could do this. But now, I have no doubts at all."]="啊，你真强壮！我年轻时，准会怀疑我们能否做到。可现在我不再怀疑了。"
G["My---raaak--favorite! Awk awk awk! Raa-kaa!"]="我……呱呱……最喜欢的！哇哇哇！呱呱！"
G["My... My powers have diminished... You shall pay for this insolence!"]="我的……我的力量在减弱……你要为你的傲慢付出代价！"
G["My... aunt died?  I can't believe I never even met her.  Take this money and give him a good funeral."]="我的……阿姨死了？我真不敢相信自己居然从未见过她。拿着这些钱，好好安葬她吧。"
G["My... blood burns."]="我的血……在燃烧。"
G["My... brother died?  I can't believe I never even met him.  Take this money and give him a good funeral."]="我的……兄弟死了？我真不敢相信自己居然从未见过他。拿着这些钱，好好安葬他吧。"
G["My... grand creation! How DARE you?"]="我的……伟大造物！你们怎么敢这么做？"
G["My... sister died?  I can't believe I never even met her.  Take this money and give him a good funeral."]="我的……姐妹死了？我真不敢相信自己居然从未见过她。拿着这些钱，好好安葬她吧。"
G["My... uncle died?  I can't believe I never even met him.  Take this money and give him a good funeral."]="我的……叔叔死了？我真不敢相信自己居然从未见过他。拿着这些钱，好好安葬他吧。"
G["Myolor, I was once a weaponsmith and wish to instead learn the way of the armorsmith. Will you teach me?"]="米洛尔，我以前曾是个武器铸造师，但我现在想要成为一个护甲铸造师，你能帮帮我吗？"
G["Myolor, I was once a weaponsmith and wish to retake the hammer once more! Teach me the way of the weaponsmith!"]="米洛尔，我曾经是一名武器铸造师，我想重抄旧业！教教我吧。"
G["Myolor, I was once an armorsmith and wish to instead learn the way of the weaponsmith. Will you teach me?"]="米洛尔，我以前曾是个护甲铸造师，但我现在想要成为一个武器铸造师，你能帮帮我吗？"
G["Myolor, I was once an armorsmith and wish to retake the hammer once more! Teach me the way of the armorsmith."]="米洛尔，我曾经是一名护甲铸造师，我想重抄旧业！教教我吧。"
G["Myranda, do you have enough eyeballs to make another amulet? I have lost the old one."]="麦兰达，你有足够的眼珠再制作一个护身符吗？我把先前那个弄丢了。"
G["Mysteries and wonders surround us every day, not just at the faire.  We've compiled a list of some of the wonders you may encounter in your every day business.  The Darkmoon Adventurer's Guide will help you navigate the wonders of the world.\n\nWith the guide in your possession, you may come across items you never knew existed.  Items you may have taken for granted in the past are now treasures that others long for.\n\nKeep the guide with you, and keep your eyes open for mystery.\n\nIf you happen to lose your guide, seek us out and we will replace it for free."]="神秘与奇迹不仅仅存在于马戏团，我们身边每天都有奇迹发生。我们列出了一张表格，上面写着你在日常生活中可能遇到的奇迹。暗月冒险者指南能帮你找出这个世界上的奇迹。\n\n只要拥有了这本指南，你就能够发现未知的物品。你熟视无睹的东西可能就是别人孜孜以求的宝物。\n\n带上这本指南吧，用你眼睛去发现未解的谜团。\n\n如果你不小心丢失了指南，可以再来找我们，我们会免费送你一本新的。"
G["Mysterious hoofprints, scorched shields, stray badges... how do we make sense of all this?"]="神秘的蹄印，烧焦的盾牌，四散的徽章……这些东西有什么联系吗？"
G["Mysterious prizes await the adventurous.  Step right up, step right up!"]="神秘的奖品在等你，冒险家们。快来啊，快来啊！"
G["Mysterious runes adorn this artifact, though they appear to be unpowered at this time."]="神秘的符文装饰着这件神器，不过他们现在看似并无能量。"
G["Mysterious..."]="真神秘……"
G["N-n-nice doggies..."]="好——好——好狗狗……"
G["N-no!"]="不——不！"
G["NAP'S OVER!! WE ARE HEADING OUT!"]="别睡了！！我们要出发了！"
G["NEFARIAN IS SLAIN! People of Orgrimmar, bow down before the might of $n and $g his:her; allies for they have laid a blow against the Black Dragonflight that is sure to stir the Aspects from their malaise! This defeat shall surely be felt by the father of the Black Flight: Deathwing reels in pain and anguish this day!"]="¡NEFARIAN HA SIDO ASESINADO! Ciudadanos de Orgrimmar, inclinaos ante el poder de $n y sus aliados, porque ellos han asestado un gran golpe al Vuelo Negro que sacará a los Aspectos de su pesadumbre. El padre del Vuelo Negro sentirá esta derrota. ¡En este día, Alamuerte retrocede, lleno de dolor y angustia!"
G["NEVER AGAIN!! Next time some wounded soldier wants to return to the front line, I am putting my foot down.  I mean it this time."]="休想！！下次要是再有受伤的士兵想回到前线，我会坚决反对的。就从现在开始！"
G["NEVER say that name around me! Consider this your one and only warning!"]="别在我面前提他的名字！我只警告你这一次！"
G["NEVER! Gnomeregan is MINE, Mekkatorque."]="绝不！诺莫瑞根是我的，梅卡托克。"
G["NEVER! I... I will never... serve... you..."]="绝不！我……绝不……服从你。"
G["NEVER! Wait...is this thing on? Is it...this button? Testing...testing. Ah! *ahem*"]="绝不！等等……这东西启动了？是这个……按钮？测试……测试。啊！*咳嗽*"
G["NINE! NINE! NINE! NINE! NINE!!!"]="九个！九个！九个！九个！九个！！！"
G["NO - and don't try shaking me again for a better answer!"]="不可能——你继续摇我也不会改变这个答案。"
G["NO BUT! Silence! Keep Movink!"]="没有但是！安静！继续前进！"
G["NO CAN SEE NOTHIN! Move out of da way!"]="什么都看不见了！别挡路！"
G["NO ESCAPE FOR THE WICKED!"]="邪恶必将受到惩罚！"
G["NO ESCAPE!"]="无路可逃了！"
G["NO MORE! DIS IS MAXI... MAXIMO... ME... DIS TOO MUCH!"]="到此为止！这是我的……上……上限了……不行了！"
G["NO MORE! ONGOLONGO GO HOME!"]="没有了！安戈龙格回家了！"
G["NO ONE CAN PROTECT YOU!  Kill the Proudmoore wench, and bring me that bomb."]="恐怕没人能保护你。杀了这个贱人，把那炸弹带回来。"
G["NO RUN!!! NO MORE RUN!!!!"]="别跑！！！别再跑了！！！！"
G["NO SERVICE!!"]="停止服务！"
G["NO!"]="不！"
G["NO!  AHHHHHHH!!!!"]="不！啊——！！！"
G["NO!  My machine... my bombs!  THAT'S IT!  Those Harpies are going DOWN!"]="不！我的机器……我的炸弹！好吧！那些鹰身人死定了！"
G["NO! Eat it slower!"]="不！吃慢点儿！"
G["NO! GIZMO!"]="不！吉兹莫！"
G["NO! Garrosh, I have failed you...."]="不！加尔鲁什，我辜负了你……"
G["NO! Get back here coward!"]="不！回来，懦夫！"
G["NO! How is this possible?"]="天哪！这怎么可能？"
G["NO! I WILL POSSESS YOU AND ALL OF YOUR KIND!"]="不！我会控制你，以及你所有的族人！"
G["NO! I will feed your bones to her pups!!!"]="不！我要拿你们的骨头去喂她的小崽子！！！"
G["NO! I will not be defeated!"]="不！我是不会被打败的！"
G["NO! I... will... not..."]="不！我……不会……"
G["NO! IT CANNOT BE! YOU CAN NOT STOP ME!"]="不！这不可能！你无法阻止我！"
G["NO! It is too soon - Lord Ahune is not yet at full power!"]="不！现在还不是时候——埃霍恩大人还未得到全部的能量！"
G["NO! It's TURNIP!"]="不！这是个芜菁！"
G["NO! ME NO HELP HORDE!"]="不！我是不会帮部落的！"
G["NO! ME WIN!"]="不！我赢了！"
G["NO! Magatha, forgive me! Bring me back!"]="不！玛加萨，请原谅我！带我回去！"
G["NO! My servants!"]="不！我的仆从！"
G["NO! NO! NO! NO! NO!"]="不！不！不！不！不要这样！"
G["NO! Noooooo!"]="不！不——！"
G["NO! Not turnip!!"]="不！不要芜菁！！"
