G["Nablya, is that you?"]="娜博亚，是你吗？"
G["Nadyia has made quite the leatherworker in her years of practice.  Travel west on the road to Darnassus to pay her a visit and maybe she can bestow some of her knowledge upon you."]="纳迪娅在数年的实践中掌握了制皮技术。沿着通往达纳苏斯的道路向西走，去拜访她，或许她能传授给你一些知识呢。"
G["Nae, I'm enjoying me fine some Ironforge mead. Might be the last drink we have for a while yet."]="嘿，我在享用铁炉堡蜜酒。这段时间里，我们可能只剩下这点酒了。"
G["Nae, that's fer wimps. Hit me with yer hammer!"]="不，拳头太弱了。用锤子敲我！"
