;(function(G)
G["Naga attacking from the port and starboard! Faceless ones attacking head on...! We're heavily  outnumbered, but the ship is holding, sir!"]="纳迦从左舷和右舷方向同时发动了攻击！正前方还遭遇到未知目标的突袭……！我们在人数上处于极端劣势，但船还在坚持，长官！"
G["Naga ssshall never ssserve your kind!"]="纳迦永远不会效忠于你们这些鼠辈！"
G["Naga warlord! Oh dear..."]="天哪……纳迦督军！"
G["Naga.\n\n<Vilethorn spits on the ground in disgust.>\n\nIt was foolish of them to think they could make an orc labor at their whip. We will make every last one of them regret not killing us when they had the chance."]="纳迦。\n\n<维索恩充满厌恶地朝地上吐了口唾沫。>\n\n他们可真蠢，居然妄想能用鞭子把兽人训得任其差遣。我们要让他们后悔，没把握住机会杀了我们，让他们一个个全都后悔。"
G["Nagala will have her famous grilled zhevra chops waiting for us, no doubt. She says I need to cut back and eat more vegetables, but I don't think I've gained that much weight...do you?"]="娜格拉一定会切好她拿手的炙烤斑马肉等我们。她说我需要节食并多吃点蔬菜，但我觉得我还没那么胖吧……你说呢？"
G["Nagmara!  Have any mutton left?"]="娜玛拉！还有羊肉吗？"
G["Nagrand, the land to the west, has recently become littered with enemy forge camps that threaten our security."]="纳格兰，西边的那块大陆，敌人在那里的铸魔营地威胁着我们的安全，使纳格兰最近变得有点混乱。"
G["Nah, I can handle it. Thanks."]="不用，我自己能搞定。谢谢你。"
G["Nah, I don't much care for that one. Do you have any more?"]="不不，我不太喜欢这个。还有吗？"
G["Nah, not really. I just wanted to see the look on your face."]="哈哈，骗你的。我只是想看看你脸上的表情。"
G["Nah. I said \"Hallo.\" But that's close enough.\n\nBye now."]="No, he dicho \"A las muy buenas\", pero se le parece mucho.\n\nHasta luego."
G["Naive as always, I see. Your pet orc cannot save you now, Malfurion."]="你还是这么天真。你的兽人宠物救不了你，玛法里奥。"
G["Naive fool. The Burning Blade IS the Shadow Council! There are many cults and organizations under the Council's rule, but all of them are just extensions of their will. I may lead the Burning Blade, but I am still just as much a pawn to the Council as you are to me!\n\nLook at the Searing Blade--most of them think they are becoming the next rising group of powerful warlocks that they will replace the Shadow Council."]="天真的傻子。火刃就是暗影议会！议会拥有许多信徒和组织，但是他们都服从于议会的意愿。我或许能领导火刃，但是我无非是议会手下的一名爪牙，就像你是我的爪牙一样！\n\n看看燃刃吧——他们中的大多数人认为自己会成为下一批极具潜力的术士，并成功替代暗影议会。"
G["Nalorakk is dead, you're free to go."]="纳洛拉克已经死了，你自由了。"
G["Nam daed, no em nrut."]="身起魂尸，令律如急急！"
G["Name, rank and serial number, soldier."]="报上你的名字，军阶，还有编号。"
G["Nana Mudclaw asked ME to join the Tillers council?"]="娜娜·泥爪邀请我加入阡陌客？"
G["Nana always said there was no greater thing in the whole world than a warm, toasty slice of fresh, homemeade cherry pie."]="奶奶总是说世界上没有比一块自制的、鲜美的樱桃馅饼更好的东西了。"
G["Narain Soothfancy, at your service! Retired engineer and master soothsayer! I can tell your future before it even happens!\n\nIf you're here to try and relearn a tradeskill, use the book over there...\n\n<Narain points to \"Soothsaying for Dummies.\">"]="¡Narain Sabelotodo, a su servicio! ¡Ingeniero retirado y maestro adivino! ¡Puedo adivinar tu futuro incluso antes de que ocurra!\n\nSi estás aquí para intentar volver a aprender un oficio, usa ese libro de ahí...\n\n<Narain señala \"Adivinar el futuro para torpes\"."
G["Narain, I need another special kit."]="纳瑞安，我还想再要一个特殊工具箱。"
G["Narain, if you have enough materials, I could use another arcanite buoy."]="纳瑞安，如果你有足够的材料的话，我还想再要一个奥金鱼漂。"
G["Naralex sleeps again!\n\nLong ago, Naralex journeyed to this cavern with the honorable goal of entering the Emerald Dream and regrowing the Barrens into a lush forest. His focus waned and his thoughts became tainted by serpentine visions.\n\nNow, reptilian beasts seep from his dreams to the land. He must be awoken from the nightmare or he will be forever lost, and a great evil unleashed.\n\nOnly after his corrupted servants, the Fanglords, have been slain can I perform the awakening ritual."]="¡Naralex duerme nuevamente!\n\nHace tiempo, Naralex vino hasta esta caverna con el honorable fin de entrar en el Sueño Esmeralda y convertir los Baldíos en un bosque frondoso. Se le nubló la vista y sus pensamientos dieron paso a visiones serpenteantes.\n\nAhora, bestias reptiles descienden de sus sueños para penetrar en la tierra. Hay que despertarlo de la pesadilla o lo perderemos para siempre y se desatará un mal terrible.\n\nSolo después de matar a sus corruptos sirvientes, los Nobles del Colmillo, podré iniciar el ritual del despertar."
G["Narali deserved worse!"]="纳拉利死不足惜！"
G["Narkrall! If you want to challenge me, you do so here. Do NOT squander our forces on a fool crusade."]="纳克拉尔！要是你想挑战我，就在这儿解决。不要把我们的兵力浪费在愚蠢的征讨上。"
G["Nasty little...A-ak, kaw! Kill! Yes, kill you!"]="可恶的……哇哇！杀！对，杀了你！"
G["Nasty rock-mans! Do as we say!"]="讨厌的矿工！照我们说的去做！"
G["Nasuun, do you know how long until we have an alchemy lab at the Sun's Reach Harbor?"]="纳苏恩，你觉得我们还要多久才能在阳湾港口布置一个炼金台？"
G["Nat, I want to buy your mudskunk lures!"]="纳特，我想要购买一些臭泥鱼诱饵！"
