G["Natalia?"]="纳塔莉亚？"
G["Nathanos, I have lost the rotten apple. I require another."]="纳萨诺斯，我把腐烂的苹果弄丢啦。我需要一个。"
G["Natural causes? Two bullets in the chest and his shoes are on his head. What kind of natural death would that be?"]="自然死亡？胸部中了两枪，鞋子也跑到头上去了。什么样的自然死亡会是这种效果？"
