G["Nature is a powerful force, $r.  Those who seek to subdue never succeed in doing so permanently."]="自然是一种强大的力量，$r。那些尝试征服它的人从来没有成功过。"
G["Nature lives at peace with magic. With both, there is no limit to our future."]="自然和魔法和平相处。有了这两者，我们前途似锦。"
G["Nature provides all that we need.  Speak to Komin Winterhoof at Holistic Herbalism on the middle rise."]="自然会提供我们所需的一切。跟中部高地中层克米恩·冰蹄谈谈草药学吧。"
