G["Nazgrim: We're not returning until we discover its fate - even if we have to scour the sea floor!"]="纳兹戈林：我们一定要找到它，否则绝不返航——哪怕是要把大海翻个底朝天！"
G["Naznik's the local barber. He set up shop on the top ring of the Trade Quarter."]="纳兹尼克是这里的理发师。他的理发店就开在贸易区的上层区域。"
G["Nearby sha creatures have the shade I'm looking for... though you might find a little bit on the nearby wildlife. Good luck!"]="附近的煞魔生物有我需要的阴影……但是你也可以在附近的野生动物身上找到一些。 祝你好运！"
