G["Need supplies for your journey? Smart adventurer! Too many rush off into the forest unprepared and end up as kobold lunch."]="Necesitas suministros para tu viaje? ¡Buen aventurero! Demasiados se apresuran a entrar en el bosque sin prepararse y terminan siendo la comida de los kobolds."
G["Need tank."]="需要坦克。"
G["Need to do some shopping?"]="想要做买卖吗？"
G["Need to relax?  Visit T'chali's Voodoo Brewery at Brewfest for drinks that go down smooth!"]="需要放松吗？去美酒节的塔卡里巫毒酒馆看看，那里的酒会让你感到舒畅！"
G["Need to requisition some supplies?"]="需要补给吗？"
G["Need water... not much time..."]="要水……时间不多了……"
G["Need your blade sharpened, or perhaps a new weapon? Better safe than sorry..."]="你要磨刀还是要一把新武器？安全第一、安全第一……"
G["Need... better... healer...."]="需要……更好的……治疗者……"
G["Needleback gonna beatcha!"]="针背龟要打扁你！"
G["Needless to say, a lot of us won't be going home. But if you remember your training and keep your wits about you, you'll greatly increase your chances."]="不用说也知道，我们中的很多人将一去不复返。但你们只需要牢记训练的内容，时刻保持警惕，就可以大大提高生还的机率。"
G["Needless to say, it is an honor to work on behalf of such an upstanding servant of the Light and the Alliance."]="Huelga decir que es un honor trabajar para $gun súbdito:una súbdita; de la Luz y de la Alianza de semejante rectitud."
G["Needless to say, when I walked into the pavilion there was something of an altercation."]="不用说了，那天我走进大帐，里面在吵架。"
G["Needlework requires a steady hand. And patience... above all, patience."]="缝纫需要娴熟的手法，以及……也是最重要的，耐性。"
G["Needs more glitter..."]="还需要更多闪闪发亮的……"
G["Nefarian had ordered that unsuitable subjects be destroyed immediately, but these retched beasts would not do so without first inflicting an 'ample' amount of torture.\n\nWhen we were thoroughly 'broken,' they would round up what remained and throw us to these thugs. Our bodies used as instruments in their sick game: thrown into the lava or worse; to the open and waiting arms of the bloodthirsty legion below."]="Nefarian había ordenado destruir inmediatamente a los sujetos no aptos, pero esas bestias repugnantes no iban a hacerlo sin someternos antes a una \"gran\" tortura.\n\nCuando estuvimos \"destrozados\", reunieron nuestros restos y nos arrojaron a estas bestias. Utilizaron nuestros cuerpos como instrumento para sus perversos juegos: fuimos arrojados a la lava o a algo aún peor: a los brazos abiertos y ansiosos de la sádica legión de ahí abajo."
G["Nefarian, Onyxia, Sinestra... they were nothing. Now you face my ultimate creation."]="奈法利安，奥妮克希亚，希奈丝特拉……他们毫无价值。现在，你们就要面对我最终的造物。"
G["Nefarius' hate has made me stronger than ever before! You should have fled while you could, mortals! The fury of Blackrock courses through my veins!"]="奈法里奥斯的仇恨让我变得空前强大！赶快逃跑吧，凡人！黑石之王的怒气涌动在我的血脉中！"
G["Neferset City will fall!"]="尼斐塞特城将要陷落！"
G["Neferset City will fall!  ATTACK!!!"]="尼斐塞特城将要陷落！攻击！！！"
G["Negative emotions, like anger or doubt, they take on a strange power here on Pandaria. But this you will discover in time."]="负面情绪，如愤怒或疑虑，会在潘达利亚表现出一种诡异的力量。你将来就会明白的。"
G["Negative, Admiral. No sign of Captain Taylor OR his flagship."]="没有，上将。未能发现泰勒上尉及其坐舰的线索。"
G["Negotiations aren't going well, $n. The Dragonmaw are not yet free orcs.\n\nSomehow, we MUST get them to join the Horde!\n\nLet me know if you need transport back to the fleet."]="Las negociaciones no han ido bien, $n. Los Faucedraco aún no son orcos libres.\n\nDe alguna forma, ¡tenemos que hacer que se unan a la Horda!\n\nSi necesitas un transporte de vuelta a la flota, házmelo saber."
G["Negotiations?  NEGOTIATIONS!\n\nAllow me to make our stance perfectly clear.  We are a free people, able to do whatever we want and come and go as we please.  The Cenarion Expedition does not own this mountain range.\n\nThere will be no negotiations!  Now, go back to the druids and tell them that we will continue to do as we please."]="谈判？谈判！\n\n请允许我把我们的立场完全说清楚。我们是自由人，没有人能干涉我们的自由。塞纳里奥远征队并不是这片山脉的主人。\n\n所以没有什么好谈的！现在，回去告诉那些德鲁伊，我们还是要我行我素。"
G["Neighbor, I would gladly fight alongside you any day."]="$gVecino:Vecina;, estaré encantada de luchar a tu lado cuando quieras."
G["Neighbor, because of you, my problems is less somewhat."]="$gVecino:Vecina;, gracias a ti, mis problemas son algo menos."
G["Neighbor, you move quietly today."]="$gVecino:Vecina;, hoy te mueves silenciosamente."
G["Neither Ealdir nor of the kingdom. Free!"]="Ni siquiera Ealdir ni del reino. Libre!"
G["Neither generals is spawned."]="双方的将军均未重生。"
G["Neither you nor I could possibly imagine the pain an individual suffers when their soul is ripped from their body. They are not dead and by no means are they alive. Instead, they walk the land, servants of those that bind them to this world.\n\nLord Razelikh, demonic overlord of these lands, enslaved them all. Nine he took for his own, placing stones of binding near the Dark Portal. The remaining nine were divided up between his subordinates."]="你和我都无法想象当他们的灵魂被强行从躯体中剥离出来的时候有多么痛苦。他们没有死，但是他们也不是活着的。他们成为了一具具行尸，只会听从主人发号施令。\n\n干出这些惨绝人寰的事情的就是这里的恶魔首领拉瑟莱克，他把我的战友都变成了奴隶。其中的九个被他绑定在黑暗之门附近，其余的九个则被他的爪牙们瓜分。"
G["Neltharion is  my answer."]="我的答案是奈萨里奥。"
G["Neltharion! Look at yourself. Misshapen. Twisted. You're coming apart."]="奈萨里奥！看看你自己。残缺。扭曲。你已支离破碎。"
G["Neltharion! What have you done? You have doomed us all to the madness of the Old Gods!"]="奈萨里奥！你都做了些什么？你将上古之神的疯狂厄运带给了我们！"
G["Neltharion, hmm? As good an answer as any, yes?"]="奈萨里奥，嗯？这是个很好的回答，是吗？"
G["Neptulon will rise and wash your kind from Azeroth."]="耐普图隆将会崛起，将你们从艾泽拉斯清除掉。"
G["Neptulon's minions are growing desperate! We must hurry!"]="耐普图隆的仆从在拼死抵抗！我们得快点！"
G["Neptulon's revenants must not consider us enemies!"]="不能让耐普图隆的亡魂把我们当成敌人！"
G["Ner'zhul is my answer."]="我的答案是耐奥祖。"
G["Nergeld is only the first of a new army of vargul-powered flesh giants. You've not known fear until now!"]="尼尔盖德不过是第一个瓦古血肉巨人，我们会造出一支大军来的。到那时，你就会明白什么是真正的恐怖！"
G["Nerzhul will never give up. Where are our heroes?"]="耐奥祖永远都不会放弃。我们的英雄在哪里？"
G["Nesingwary is a brilliant hunter, but I wish there was a druid here to teach us some proper animal hunting tactics."]="奈辛瓦里是位杰出的猎手，可我多么希望这儿能有一位德鲁伊，向我们传授些实用的捕猎动物的技法。"
G["Nesingwary is going to go broke if he keeps this up! Lane probably has no idea what he's doing!"]="如果奈辛瓦里一意孤行的话，他很快就会完蛋了！兰恩根本就不知道他在干什么！"
G["Nespirah is waking up! Use the Nespirah Fluid to kill Idra'kess."]="奈瑟匹拉正在醒过来！用奈瑟匹拉流体怪消灭埃卓凯丝。"
G["Nessspirah!  Why do you turn againssst me?"]="奈瑟匹拉！你为何要对抗我？"
G["Net not stop me! No... net stop me."]="丝网拦不住我！不……网把我拦住了。"
G["Nether Ray"]="虚空鳐"
G["Nethergarde, for years, has stood watch over the Dark Portal.  Ever vigilant, it was we who first sensed fel energies leaking through the long closed gateway.\n\nWe raised a global alarm, and the world answered...\n\nNow, the Argent Dawn holds this line as the kingdoms and clans of the Horde and Alliance marshal their forces and rush to aid us!"]="很多年来，守望堡一直看守着黑暗之门，时刻保持着警惕，是我首先感觉到了魔能从这个常年关闭的门里泄漏出来。\n\n我们发出了一个世界范围的警告，然后收到了答复……\n\n现在，银色黎明把守着这里，同样，部落和联盟很快也会赶来帮助我们！"
G["Netherock?!  That thing'll squish you flat with one step of its massive foot!  No thanks!"]="灵岩巨人？！那东西一脚就能把你踩扁！不用了，谢谢！"
G["Neutralizing agent FAILED!"]="中和剂失效了！"
G["Neutralizing agent failing!\nAdd fluid NOW!!"]="中和剂失效了！\n立即倒入液体！！"
G["Neutralizing agent failing!\nAdd fluid soon!"]="中和剂失效了！\n赶紧倒入液体！"
G["Never a glancing blow laid upon you, but countless foes cut down by your halberd."]="没有一击能伤你分毫，却有无数敌人倒在你的战戟之下。"
G["Never again shall we allow our differences to divide us.\n\nLong live the children of Cenarion!"]="我们绝不会再让我们之间的差异分裂我们。\n\n塞纳里奥之子万岁！"
G["Never again will you fly alone."]="Nunca más volarás $gsolo:sola;."
G["Never again."]="再也不想看见第二次。"
G["Never again..."]="不……"
G["Never ask Hawkmaster Norung about his eye patch. You will never hear the end of it."]="别问鹰眼大师砮荣他的眼罩是怎么回事。他唠叨起来没完没了。"
G["Never before has a father felt such pride for their child, Shomi."]="从没有哪个父亲为自己的孩子感到如此骄傲过，朔弥。"
G["Never cross a Dark Iron, $C."]="不要穿过黑铁矮人的地盘，$c。"
G["Never cross a Dwarf!"]="不要惹怒矮人！"
G["Never did I dream that our \"king\" would betray us as he did. To think that he had been a worgen in secret while he ruled over us. Sickening..."]="Nunca soñé que nuestro \"rey\" pudiera traicionarnos como lo ha hecho. Y pensar que era un huargen en secreto mientras nos gobernaba... Me pone enfermo."
G["Never doubt it. Here, allow me to give you my wedding gift."]="不必怀疑。给你，请接受我的结婚礼物。"
G["Never drink before 5 o'clock, momma used to say. Well, momma, it's bound to be 5 o'clock somewhere!"]="妈妈常说5点钟之前不许喝酒。可是，世界上一定有某个地方已经到5点了吧！"
G["Never fear, Bodley is on the job! Let's see here, ah yes... there it is. Let me just summon it... and, presto!\n\nTry not to lose it again, $n."]="千万别害怕，有伯德雷在呢！我们看这里，啊，是了……就在这里。让我把它召唤过来……嗯，快点！\n\n下次别再把它弄丢了，$n。"
G["Never fear, Trade Prince Gallywix is here. We'll be on our way to our new home in Azshara before you know it! Despite the bumbling interference of $n."]="不要害怕，贸易大王加里维克斯就在这里。我们立马就要出发前往我们在艾萨拉的新家了！就算是某个人继续在那儿捣乱也没用。"
G["Never felt hurt like this!"]="我从未体验过这样的煎熬！"
G["Never forget those that came before you. Never forget where you came from."]="做人要向前看，也不能忘本。"
G["Never forget those that you love. Never forget what you're fighting for."]="不要忘记你所爱的人，不要忘记你为之战斗的理由。"
G["Never forget whom you serve.  Illidan will rule this land and beyond."]="永远不要忘记你在为谁效力。伊利丹会统治这个世界，以及所有的世界。"
G["Never forget your greatest friend, they stick with you until the end."]="永远不要忘记你最伟大的朋友，他们会与你并肩作战，直到最后一刻。"
G["Never give up, friends!"]="不要放弃，朋友们！"
G["Never had an unsatisfied customer! Try Chatterswitch Travels today!"]="顾客满意度百分之百！今天就来试试跳闸旅行社的服务吧！"
G["Never had much use for a bow, but these rifles the goblins make are very handy when hunting. Still can't get used to the smell though."]="弓箭的用途向来不大，但是地精制造的这些来复枪在狩猎时非常有用。虽然我仍然无法习惯这气味。"
G["Never have I had cause to regret sparing your life, mortal. Always, you find ways to amuse me."]="你要知道，凡人，我并不后悔饶你一命，因为你总会给我带来乐趣。"
G["Never have I seen an enemy such as this."]="我从来没有见到过像这样的敌人。"
G["Never have I seen such a barren wasteland."]="我从来没见过这么荒凉的地方。"
G["Never have such humble words come from mighty Thorim. I shall deliver your words to Dun Niffelem."]="托里姆竟然说出过如此谦卑的言辞。我会将你的这番话转达给丹尼芬雷的。"
G["Never heard of it. Looks like pure evil."]="没听说过。它似乎散发着邪恶的气息。"
G["Never in my ranging have I seen a place like this."]="我从来没有见过像这样的地方。"
G["Never interrupt an artist!"]="别来打扰艺术家。"
G["Never leave home without ample supplies of flash powder, especially when working with others. I guarantee someone will run out every time.\n\nWhen the choice comes down to handing out materials or letting the poor sap die, I help... most of the time."]="千万不要在准备足够的闪光粉之前就离开基地，特别是在与其他人合作的时候。我保证你的同伴永远会给你制造麻烦。\n\n当闷棍失败时，你的选择只剩下扔出闪光粉迅速逃跑，或是硬拼闷棍对象的时候，我……都会选择前者。"
G["Never look the Commander directly in the eyes."]="绝不要直视指挥官的眼睛。"
G["Never look these Broken directly in the eyes. I think they can suck the soul right out of you if they're so inclined!"]="永远不要直视破碎者的眼睛。我认为，如果他们愿意的话，他们可以把你的灵魂从眼中抽出来！"
G["Never met Great Ones. Nope, just met their shrines."]="我没有见过造物主。真的，只见过他们留下的祭坛。"
G["Never met them before in my life. Pandaren don't really come in any bad flavors though."]="我和他们素昧平生。不过我的熊猫人同胞绝不会是坏人。"
G["Never powerless Garrosh. And never alone."]="我或许很软弱。但我不是一个人。"
G["Never put yourself ahead of others. Never forget that this land is shared by many."]="永远不要自以为高人一等。记住，这片土地是大家共同的家园。"
G["Never return to this place, elemental. This is a place of nature!"]="永远别回来了，元素。这是自然的领域！"
G["Never say never, my grandpa always said. I'm going to give it my best shot."]="我爷爷经常告诫我，不要把话说得太满。我会尽力而为。"
G["Never seen a dooker like you before!"]="从没见过像你这么坏的坏蛋！"
G["Never seen anyone move so fast in my whole life."]="我从来没看到过有人逃得这么快。"
G["Never set a yeti on fire. They just get mad."]="千万别惹恼了雪人，他们会发飙的。"
G["Never shall you find the twin blades of Sul."]="你永远也不会发现苏萨斯双剑。"
G["Never stop fighting."]="永远不要停止战斗！"
G["Never stop fighting. Never stop practicing. You are never perfect."]="战斗不息，修行不止。你永远也无法达到完美境界。"
G["Never stop training, $n. I want every gnome ready for the day when we take down the traitor Thermaplugg for good."]="训练一刻都不能停，$n。我要每个侏儒都做好准备，等到我们将叛徒瑟玛普拉格彻底干掉的那天，都能大展拳脚！"
G["Never thought I was any good with animals 'til these little fellas started showin' up.  So what do ye say, wanna fight?"]="我从没想过自己会有跟动物交流的天分，直到这些小家伙的出现。那么，你想来打一场吗？"
G["Never thought I'd need a $c to save me from nibblers. Thank you!"]="Nunca pensé que me haría falta $gun:una; $c para salvarme de los mordisqueadores. ¡Gracias!"
G["Never thought I'd see one of your kind walk through here."]="真没想到我能在这里见到你们的族人。"
G["Never to question, nor to contemplate; we simply act."]="从不质疑，也不思考，我们只需行动。"
G["Never trust the Sunreavers. They are hard at work undermining us in the eyes of our Argent Crusade allies."]="永远不要相信那些夺日者。他们不遗余力的破坏我们和银色北伐军盟友的关系。"
G["Never underestimate the importance of healing."]="永远不要低估治疗的重要性。"
G["Never underestimate the other ethereal's greed!"]="永远不要低估其他虚灵的贪婪！"
G["Never underestimate the power of proper supply management. The warriors may win the battles, but it's the supplies that win the war."]="绝不要低估后勤供给的作用。战士们也许会赢得几次战斗，但只有足够的物资供应才能确保一场战争的胜利。"
G["Never underestimate the worth of a good mushan beast."]="千万别低估一头好穆山兽的价值。"
G["Never weak. Always strong."]="不要软弱，保持强壮。"
G["Never you mind, $r. The details of my past were burned away when I joined the Druids of the Flame. They are of no concern to you.\n\nBesides, I am here to discuss the future of this realm. And I do not plan to discuss it with you.\n\nNow answer me... where is Malfurion!?"]="这不关你的事，$r。从我加入烈焰德鲁伊的那一刻起，我的过去已经在烈火中消逝了。它们对你毫无意义。\n\n而且，我来是要讨论这个王国的未来，但你并不是能与我对话的人。\n\n现在回答我……玛法里奥在哪儿！？"
G["Never!"]="休想！"
G["Never!  I love working for the Dark Iron!"]="绝不！我喜欢为黑铁矮人工作！"
G["Never! I'll never abide by their will! I'd sooner be dead."]="不！我绝不遵从他们的意志！反正我也是个将死之人了。"
G["Never! Riko protect you to death!"]="绝不！里克要誓死保护你！"
G["Never, you two-timing dog!"]="绝不屈服，你这条恶狗！"
G["Never... could reach... the top shelf..."]="永远……差那么……一点儿……"
G["Never... submit!"]="绝不……屈服！"
G["Nevermind me, $r. \n\nKraz as good as dead. Leave now, $r, before bad trolls get you too."]="别管我，$r。\n\n克拉斯活着跟死了也没什么两样。趁那些巨魔还没发现你，快逃命吧。"
G["Nevermind me, $r. \n\nNorkani as good as dead. Leave now, $r, before da Amani get you too."]="不要管我，$r。\n\n洛尔卡尼已经难逃一死。赶快在阿曼尼抓到你之前离开，$r。"
G["Nevermind my injuries, $g brother : sister;. It's a miracle that any of us are alive!"]="我的$g兄弟:姐妹;，别在意我的伤。我们能活着就是个奇迹了！"
G["Nevermind."]="没关系。"
G["Nevermore!"]="够了！"
G["Nevertheless, you are now freed from the mountains' grip and safe from harm.  Marshal's Stand lies to the east, I believe."]="不管怎样，你现在已经摆脱了高山的魔爪，不会再受伤害了。马绍尔哨站大概就在东边。"
G["New Avalon shall be purged! All Scourge will be eradicated!"]="净化新阿瓦隆！铲除天灾军团！"
G["New Pet"]="新宠物"
G["New directive: assist in the defeat of the iron dwarves."]="新指令：帮忙击败铁矮人。"
G["New directive: leave mine and return to Inventor's Library."]="新指令：离开矿井并返回创世者的图书馆。"
G["New directives acquired.  Obey $g magister:magistrix; $n."]="Nuevas directivas adquiridas. Obedecer $g al magister:a la magistrix; $n."
G["New here? It is like we tell the children, do not go into the water without a handful of distracting bait and an exit strategy."]="¿Eres $gnuevo:nueva; aquí? Como les decimos a los niños, no te metas en el agua sin un buen cebo como distracción y una buena estrategia de huida."
G["New king, new rules. Sorry, but wikkets gonna get ravaged!"]="新酋长，新规矩。抱歉，蠢蛋要遭劫了！"
G["New life from clay. Dead earth... reborn."]="来自泥土的新生命。死亡之土……得到重生。"
G["New life from the ashes of old... this is Aessina's gift.\n\nWithout you, this miracle never would've happened."]="从过往的灰烬中生出新的生命……这是艾森娜的馈赠。\n\n如果没有你，这奇迹决不会出现。"
G["New orders! Unlock the entry to the Celestial Planetarium."]="新的指令！打开天文馆的大门。"
G["New posting going up! Adventurers and heroes, gather round the bulletin board!"]="新的公告贴好了！冒险家和英雄们，聚集到公告板前吧！"
G["New recruit? Have you reported to the commander yet?"]="¿$gUn nuevo:Una nueva; recluta? ¿Ya te has presentado ante el Comandante?"
G["New struggles await us with each dawn, and uncertainty weighs upon us all."]="每个黎明都会有新的战斗，还有挥之不去的动荡与不安。"
G["New tasty creature!"]="新鲜美味的家伙！"
G["New this year: the PX-238 Winter Wondervolt.  Step on up and don't be shy!\n\nAnd sign these forms before you try it, we're still working a few bugs out of this thing..."]="La última novedad este año: la PX-238 Maravoltio Invernal. ¡Acércate, no seas $gtímido:tímida;!\n\nY rellena estos formularios antes de probarla, aún estamos corrigiendo algunos problemas de este chisme..."
G["New to town? You should try Chin's noodles. They are the stuff of local legend."]="新来的吧？你应该去尝尝秦的面条，那可是本地一绝。"
G["New toys!"]="新的玩具！"
G["New toys? For me? I promise I won't break them this time!"]="新玩具？给我的吗？我保证这次不会把它们弄坏了！"
G["New troll here!"]="新巨魔报道！"
G["News of your success has preceeded you.  Our ranks have swelled!  We're in better shape now than I'd dared to hope for thanks to you, $n."]="你成功的消息不胫而走，我们的队伍更壮大了！现在我们的规模比我之前所期望的还要好，这多亏了你，$n。"
G["News spread quickly of Shattrath City's victories.  Refugees from all previous wars and from the one that had begun anew begun to pour into the city.\n\nThe entire lower third of the city is inhabited by them now.  No one who seeks respite from Illidan is turned away, so you might run into an unsavory character or two there.  But for the most part, they're just ordinary people who had lost all hope and have now been given a new lease on life."]="Las noticias de las victorias de la Ciudad de Shattrath se expandieron rápidamente. Refugiados de antiguas guerras y de la que acababa de comenzar empezaron a llegar a la ciudad.\n\nAhora, todo el tercio inferior de la ciudad está habitada por ellos. Se acepta a todo el que busque una tregua de Illidan, así que podrías encontrarte con un par de personajes indeseables allí... Pero, en la mayor parte, son solo gente normal que han perdido toda esperanza y ahora han recibido una nueva vida."
G["News to no one, Regent Lord. King Wrynn's fleet is converging on Orgrimmar as we speak."]="这并不稀奇，摄政王。如今，乌瑞恩国王的舰队正驶向奥格瑞玛。"
G["Newt, get that door open."]="蝾螈，去打开那道门。"
G["Newt, we need this door open now."]="蝾螈，我们得立刻打开这道门。"
G["Newt, you're up! Break out the gatestone!"]="蝾螈，该你上了！把门石打开！"
G["Next please!"]="下一个请！"
G["Next round's on me!"]="下次我请！"
G["Next squad, push forward!"]="下一队，前进！"
G["Next squad, to the front!"]="下一队，冲上去！"
G["Next stop, Thunder Bluff!"]="下一站，雷霆崖！"
G["Next time I face the sha, I will be prepared."]="我下次面对煞魔时，会做好准备的。"
G["Next time I hit harder!"]="下次我会打得更重！"
G["Next time I see a jade monster I'm gonna punch it in the naughty bits."]="下次再让我看见这些青玉怪物，我要狠狠揍扁它们。"
G["Next time I see one of you not working, I'll have Buzzer cut your head off!"]="再让我看到有人偷懒，我就剁了他的头！"
G["Next time Ken-Ken gonna win! With or without Ashyo."]="下一次肯肯一定要赢！不管有没有阿西约。"
G["Next time ya go hunting, cover that glowing eye of yours. It gives ya away."]="下次去打猎的时候，蒙住你那发光的眼睛。不然就会暴露你的位置。"
G["Next time you may find I'm harder to defeat! I've made sure my healer remembers his place."]="下一次，我才不会这么轻易被打败！我已经让我的治疗者记住他的位置了。"
G["Next time, I will leave nothing to chance."]="下一次，我绝不会再失手。"
G["Next time, I won't miss!"]="下一次我可不会打偏了！"
G["Next time, Poppy... Next time..."]="下一次，鲍比……下一次……"
G["Next time, bring friends."]="下一次带朋友一起来。"
G["Next time, bring more friends!"]="下次，劳驾多带点朋友来！"
G["Next time, maybe Goregek let you try."]="下次格利基克让你试试。"
G["Next time, show me the respect of at least being prepared!"]="下次给我放尊重点，至少先准备好再来向我挑战！"
G["Next to signs of a scuffle is a sharp, pointy spearhead and some colorful feathers."]="在混战痕迹的边上，散落着一个锋利尖削的矛头，还有几根彩色羽毛。"
G["Next to the beer and sausage, the most popular part of Brewfest is the souvenirs! From traditional holiday garb to mini-kegs of tasty brew, all sorts of Brewfest-themed items are available from Belbi Quikswitch. Just be sure to have plenty of Brewfest Prize Tokens on hand, as it's the only way to buy them! You can earn prize tokens by helping out around the Brewfest Grounds."]="除了啤酒和香肠，美酒节最受欢迎的就是纪念品了！不管是传统节日的服装，还是美酒的袖珍酒桶，一切应有尽有，你可以在贝尔比这里买到各种美酒节的主题物品。记得你手上要有足够多的美酒节奖币，因为你只能用它们来购买纪念品。你可以通过在美酒节的场地附近帮忙来获取奖币。"
G["Next to this track, you see some bits of chewed up carrot."]="在这踪迹旁边，你看到一些嚼碎的胡萝卜。"
G["Next warrior, now!"]="下一个战士！补上来！"
G["Next warrior, step up!"]="下一个战士！上前来！"
G["Next year, I'm dressing up as either a corsair or an assassin."]="明年我计划装扮成一个海盗或者一个刺客。"
G["Next!"]="下一个！"
G["Next, I shall speak of the accursed spider wing of Naxxramas. It is there the Scourge breed even more poisonous and dangerous versions of their kin."]="接下来介绍纳克萨玛斯被诅咒的蜘蛛区。天灾军团在这里培育蛛怪的变种，以便繁殖出毒性更厉害的危险生物。"
G["Next, I shall speak of the blighted abomination wing of Naxxramas. There, the Scourge develop the strongest and most hideous aberrations of their armies."]="接下来介绍纳克萨玛斯毒气缭绕的憎恶区。天灾军团在这里制造大批强壮而丑陋的怪物，以此扩充他们的军事武装力量。"
G["Next, I shall speak of the death knight wing of Naxxramas. Within its corrupted halls, the echo of battle rings day and night, as our finest warriors are corrupted and twisted into the Scourge's greatest warriors."]="接下来介绍纳克萨玛斯的死亡骑士区。在腐化力量的侵蚀下，我们最杰出的战士沦为了天灾军团的走狗。如今，战争的号角日夜在死亡骑士区的大厅中回荡。"
G["Next, I shall speak of the dread plague wing of Naxxramas, where the Scourge seek to improve upon the deadly blight which they spread across Lordaeron."]="接下来介绍纳克萨玛斯恐怖的天灾区。天灾军团在这里进行药理研究，企图改良他们在洛丹伦传播的药剂。"
G["Next, I shall speak of the most powerful entities within the pinnacle of Naxxramas. Truly, these are two of the greatest threats to all of Northrend."]="接下来介绍盘踞在纳克萨玛斯顶端的生物。他们拥有无可思议的强大力量，当之无愧地被冠以诺森德两大威胁的称号。"
G["Next, I'll place the wheel... to protect you from harm."]="接下来，我会用车轮……来保护你。"
G["Next, please!"]="下一位！"
G["Next, we ferment the brew! Look out!"]="下一步，我们要给酒发酵！小心点！"
G["Next, we have Master Stone Fist. He will be leading your sparring exercises."]="这位是石拳大师。他会主持你的过招训练。"
G["Next, we'll need..."]="接下来，我们需要……"
G["Nexus-Prince Haramad kept telling me that if we didn't find a way through Shaffar's ward soon that I'd be the next test subject.\n\nHe wasn't bluffing."]="节点亲王哈拉迈德一直在威胁我说，如果我们不能尽快穿过沙法尔的警戒线，他就要拿我当下一个实验品。\n\n他可不是开玩笑的。"
G["Nibbin' these slickies gonna grook you in the jerb."]="敢捞这些光板儿你就要倒霉了。"
G["Niby sold me out! HE SOLD ME OUT!"]="尼比出卖了我！他出卖了我！"
G["Niby, you are stupid."]="尼比，你真蠢。"
G["Niby, you're an idiot."]="尼比，你是个白痴。"
G["Nice day for digging up the last known deposits of kaja'mite in the world, wouldn't you say, $n?"]="今天可真是个好日子，正适合开挖这世上仅存的卡亚矿石，你不这样认为吗，$n？"
G["Nice day for flying, isn't it?"]="天气不错啊，很适合飞行，不是吗？"
G["Nice fightin'... real hero-like. Y'all should check in with Li Li, up ahead."]="打得好……真像个英雄。你该到前面去找丽丽了。"
G["Nice form $n, I bet a full mug at Bruuk's Corner that the function is just as solid. Ye know, ye might want to talk to Myolor Sunderfury. He'll set ya straight."]="干得好，$n，我打赌你做的东西和布鲁克的酒一样正点。你应该去和米洛尔·怒斩谈谈，他会给你更多指引的。"
G["Nice going you incompetent morons! Another one of our engineers vaporized!"]="干得好，你这个蠢货！我们的又一个工程师被蒸发了！"
G["Nice going! I knew I was right about you, no matter what those other people said. Ha! I'm kidding! Okay, on with your lessons..."]="很好！无论其他人怎么说，我想我对你的看法是正确的。哈哈！我是开玩笑的！好吧，开始上课……"
G["Nice job big guy.  Brains and brawn -- together we overcome any obstacle!"]="干得好，大个子。头脑加蛮力——只要我们齐心协力，就能克服任何障碍！"
G["Nice job!"]="干得好！"
G["Nice job!  She looks like she's in fine condition.  Thank you!"]="干得好！她各方面条件都挺不错的。谢谢你！"
G["Nice job! Let's finish him off."]="干得漂亮！让我们解决了他。"
G["Nice job, Yoonie!"]="干得好，小愚！"
G["Nice move!"]="打得好！"
G["Nice moves!"]="好身手！"
G["Nice moves, sweetie. Maybe I'll see you again..."]="干得好，宝贝儿。或许我们会再见面的……"
G["Nice moves. I'll have to study those."]="漂亮的招式。我得学学。"
G["Nice moves. You keep reapin' in those wins like grain, neighbor. I'll be rootin' for you."]="干得好，你如秋风扫落叶般技压群雄，邻居。我会支持你的。"
G["Nice one, $p! That was close."]="干得漂亮，$p！千钧一发。"
G["Nice one, kid."]="干得不错。"
G["Nice pets have weapons. No so -- ra-ak -- nice."]="不错的宠物，但是有武器就—嘎嘎—不太好了！"
G["Nice pets, yes... raa-a-ak!"]="不错的宠物，哈哈……呱呱嘎！"
G["Nice seeing another Alliance face! I thought I was going to die out here."]="又见到一张联盟的脸孔，真是太好了！我还以为自己死定了。"
G["Nice shooting!"]="漂亮的射击！"
G["Nice shooting! The sniper cannon is a miraculous wonder!"]="射得漂亮！狙击炮可真是个神奇的玩意儿！"
G["Nice shooting, $p! The shield is weakening!"]="打得好，$p！护盾的能量在衰退！"
G["Nice shot!"]="打得好！"
G["Nice shot, Amber!"]="打得好，安玻！"
G["Nice spirit - I think I'll take it."]="不错的灵魂——归我了。"
G["Nice stuff. You must be rich."]="好东西。你肯定很有钱。"
G["Nice timing. I was just getting hungry."]="来的正是时候，我刚好感到饿了。"
G["Nice to be back among the unliving, thanks to you."]="能变回从前的样子真好，谢谢你。"
G["Nice to see a friendly face. I don't get much chitchat from Apothecary Johaan unless he wants something. He's been out of the grave too long. Someday I'll be like that, I hear. Creepy. Maybe by then I won't care."]="能看到一张友善的脸真不错。我没有跟药剂师乔汉聊过很多，除非他想要什么东西。他离开坟墓太久了。有一天我也会像他一样，我听说。真可怕。或许到那时我就不在乎了。"
G["Nice to see you again, $n."]="$n，很高兴再见到你。"
G["Nice try, but you'll need some more experience before training with me! Back to the trenches!"]="很好的尝试，但是在训练之前，你还需要进行更多的锻炼!回到战壕!"
G["Nice try, but you're going to need more than that!"]="干得不错，可那还远远不够！"
G["Nice try, sweet cheeks."]="值得表扬，甜心。"
G["Nice try."]="还算有两下子。"
G["Nice weather wouldn't you say?"]="好天气啊，不是吗？"
G["Nice work back there! One more time!"]="干得好！继续！"
G["Nice work deploying the Town-In-A-Box, $n."]="胶囊镇已经成功地安置下来了，$n。"
G["Nice work deploying the Town-In-A-Box, $n.\n\nNeed any training?"]="胶囊镇已经成功地安置下来了，$n。\n\n需要进行训练吗？"
G["Nice work so far.  The recruits keep on coming and they're all going to need new blades.  Keep it up!"]="干得不错。我们还在不断招募新兵，他们还等着用新武器呢。继续加油！"
G["Nice work soldiers!  This is the last of them!"]="干得好，士兵们！这是他们最后的挣扎了！"
G["Nice work!  Let's get down there and finish it off."]="干得漂亮！我们降到那边，准备收工。"
G["Nice work!  You've found them.  Let's bring these back to Mordo."]="干得好！你找到它们了。我们把它们送到摩尔多那里去吧。"
G["Nice work! I'll set off the charges to prevent any more troggs from making it to the surface."]="干得漂亮！我会组织人手发动进攻，以防止更多穴居人到达地表。"
G["Nice work! Is there a window open up there? Look around!"]="干得漂亮！那上面有没有打开的窗户？仔细找找！"
G["Nice work! The shield looks like it's weakening."]="干得漂亮！护盾似乎正在削弱。"
G["Nice work! We can only rest a moment."]="干得好！我们只能休息一会儿。"
G["Nice work, $p! You were the right choice for the task."]="干得好，$p！选你真是选对人了。"
G["Nice! I'm on my way to victory!"]="好极了！胜利在望！"
G["Nice, Miss Fanny! You hit it strong!"]="不错，范妮小姐！你打得很重！"
G["Nice. I don't want to know what that stain was."]="干得好。我不想知道那点污迹究竟是什么。"
G["Nice. Now that's the life..."]="太棒了。这才是生活……"
G["Nicely handled! Stay on your toes!"]="很好！不要大意！"
G["Night Elf"]="暗夜精灵"
G["Night Elf Construction Site Under Attack!"]="暗夜精灵建筑营地遭到攻击！"
G["Night Elf Gossip NPC - Periodic Talk (Expansion Prologue) 01"]="PNJ elfo de la noche cotilla - Charla periódica (prólogo de la expansión) 01"
G["Night Elves like to stand off on one leg while casting. Strike at that leg like so..."]="暗夜精灵在施法时喜欢单腿站立。你可以这样来攻击那条站立的腿……"
G["Night elven mages. Pah!"]="暗夜精灵法师，呸！"
G["Night, all. I'm gonna sit up for a bit. Maybe Darcy'll come by."]="诸位，晚上好。我要在这里坐一会。达希可能会过来的。"
G["Night, night."]="晚安，晚安。"
G["Night... becomes day!"]="黑夜…变成白昼！"
G["Nightly brawls and great drinks! Get it all at the Pig and Whistle!"]="在猪和哨声旅店享受夜晚的喧闹和最好的啤酒！"
G["Nightmare spiders appear in the darkness!  Kill Helix before his nightmare overwhelms you!"]="噩梦蜘蛛出现在黑暗中！在赫利克斯的噩梦吞噬你之前消灭他！"
G["Nightmares!  Horrible nightmares!"]="噩梦！真是可怕的噩梦！"
G["Nightsaber Cub"]="夜刃豹幼崽"
G["Nightwind! Take your men and scout the interior. Look for a Horde presence. And find Prince Anduin!"]="夜风，带着你的人往内陆地区搜查。探测部落的踪迹，找到安度因王子。"
G["Nightwind, have you pieced together that last transmission yet? Play me whatever you have!"]="夜风，你拼合出最后的信息了吗？尽全力去做！"
G["Nightwind, report! What's going on down there?"]="夜风，报告！下面发生了什么事？"
G["Nine, nine, NINE! Vhat could be so hard to undershtand?!"]="九个，九个，九个！到底有什么会这样难以理解？！"
G["Ninety-nine point nine nine percent."]="百分之九十九点九九。"
G["Niuzao will fall!"]="砮皂必亡！"
G["Niuzao's forces attack from the rear!"]="砮皂的部队从后面攻上来啦！"
G["Niuzao, strength of the west, charges into battle!"]="砮皂，西方之力，冲进了战场！"
G["Niuzao, the Black Ox, stands firm against the enemies beyond the wall.\n\nHe desperately needs aid to fight off the encroaching mantid.\n\nIf you wish to help, travel west to the temple in the Townlong Steppes."]="玄牛砮皂将敌人阻挡在城墙之外。\n\n他也非常需要帮助，以击退渐渐入侵的螳螂妖。\n\n如果你想提供帮助，就西行至螳螂高原上的寺院。"
G["Niuzao... we must save him!"]="砮皂……我们必须得救他！"
G["Nnn... nn nnnn... n-nl nnnr nnn... nn n nnnt...\n<I'll... be fine... it'll wear off... in a bit...>"]="Nnn... nn nnnn... n-nl nnnr nnn... nn n nnnt...\n\n<Estaré... bien... desaparecerá... pronto...>"
G["No - No! This one is ours..."]="不——不！这个是我们的……"
G["No - no! This land... is ours..."]="不，不！这片土地……是我们的……"
G["No - not another one! I'll have your heads for this atrocity!"]="不！住手！我要会让你来弥补自己的罪行！"
G["No - stop. Stop this at once!"]="不——住手。立刻住手！"
G["No - this is our problem, we must deal with it ourselves."]="不——自己的问题，自己解决。"
G["No Calder. What do you like?"]="不，卡尔德。你喜欢什么？"
G["No Effect!"]="没有效果！"
G["No I am!"]="不，我才是！"
G["No I didn't!"]="不，我没有！"
G["No Kota Kafa? How am I going to wake up in the morning?"]="没有寇塔咔啡？那我早上要怎样才能醒来？"
G["No Pennant"]="清空旗帜"
G["No abominations protecting you. No secrecy. No plotting in the dark."]="没有憎恶保护你。没有秘密。没有私下密谋。"
G["No alliance hand has ever struck me down. Do you think you are seasoned enough?"]="我从未被联盟打倒过。你觉得自己够强吗？"
G["No amount of healing can save me now. Fight on, brothers..."]="我已经救不活了。兄弟们，继续战斗……"
G["No amount of marketing is going to get us out of this one. The only thing that's going to work is a bazillion macaroons!\n\nYou have to get that moolah and get to the docks, pronto!"]="市场营销搞得再好也没办法把我们从这座岛上弄出去。我们唯一的希望就是弄到一万亿杏仁币！\n\n你最好赶紧弄到那笔钱并且送到码头去！"
G["No auctions today, $r. No auctions for a while, by the look o' things."]="今天不举行拍卖，$r。以目前的局势看，拍卖恐怕要暂停一阵了。"
G["No better place to learn First Aid than under the watchful eye of Angela Leifeld at the Cathedral of Light.  \nTo get there, just look for the yellow rooftops, or the towering spire of the Cathedral itself which you can see from almost anywhere in the city."]="No hay ningún lugar mejor para aprender primeros auxilios que bajo la atenta mirada de Angela Leifeld en la Catedral de la Luz. \n\nPara ir allí solo tienes que buscar los tejados amarillos o la altísima aguja de la Catedral, la podrás ver desde casi cualquier punto de la ciudad."
G["No breaks until it's all chopped down!"]="在全部砍下之前，别想休息！"
G["No breaks, just work!"]="不许休息，赶紧干活！"
G["No brew for you!"]="没有你的啤酒！"
G["No bristlepine at broken pillar, just dead stuff. Goregek leaving, slave thing."]="破柱子附近根本没有钢刺野猪，只看见一堆死尸。奴隶，跟格利基克走吧。"
G["No bristlepine here, let's go somewhere else."]="这里没有钢刺野猪，我们去别的地方吧。"
G["No bugs here... where all bugs go?"]="这里没有虫虫……虫虫都到哪里去了呢？"
G["No chance!"]="不可能！"
G["No clues here... but I did find this."]="这里没有任何线索……但我找到了这个。"
G["No come back this time!"]="它再也不能来捣乱啦！"
G["No coming back for you!"]="去死吧！"
G["No contest."]="毫无悬念。"
G["No coppa? This flights on me."]="没有钱？那这次飞行就算我的好了。"
G["No deployment target found.  Searching for type: Sanctum.  Location: Sun's Reach."]="没有找到部署目标。搜索类别：圣殿。方位：阳湾港。"
G["No disturbances!  Zero tolerance!"]="别打扰我！绝对不能出现任何偏差！"
G["No doubt the fools that banished me are long dead.  I shall take wing and survey my new demesne.  Pray to whatever gods you hold dear that we do not meet again."]="毫无疑问，那些放逐我的蠢货们早就死了。我要俯瞰我的新领地。向你们的神明祈祷吧，祈祷你们不会再被我看到！"
G["No doubt you are another inept simpleton sent from the Dark Lady to train under her champion.\n\n<Nathanos sighs.>\n\nI've sent every one of you back to her in pieces, I don't see why it will be any different this time.\n\nMine, however, is not to question why, but instead to do as the Dark Lady bids."]="Sin duda eres $gotro inepto enviado:otra inepta enviada; por la Dama Oscura para que se instruya con su Campeón.\n\n<Nathanos suspira.>\n\nOs he devuelto a todos hechos pedazos, no creo que esta vez vaya a ser diferente.\n\nPero yo no debo plantearme el porqué, tan solo hacer lo que disponga la Dama Oscura."
G["No doubt."]="嗯，我知道你会这么想。"
G["No earthquake, flood, or any other act of the spirits will stop me from doing my duty."]="不管是地震还是洪水，魂灵使出的任何把戏都别想阻止我履行自己的职责。"
G["No escape."]="休想逃走。"
G["No fair!  Gimme back my gorilla!!"]="不行！把我的猩猩还给我！"
G["No fair! Three of you wikkets against one o' me?!"]="不公平！你们这些蠢蛋竟然三打一？！"
G["No fair! Wikket step on hozen tail!"]="不公平！无毛怪踩着猢狲的尾巴！"
G["No farm woman can stand against the Defias!"]="一个小小的农妇是无法对抗迪菲亚的！"
G["No fear. No remorse. Kill invader."]="拒绝恐惧。拒绝同情。杀光入侵者。"
G["No flights out right now, $r. By order of Garrosh, these windriders are for military use only until the night elves are wiped out."]="现在还不是飞出去的时候，$r。根据加尔鲁什的命令，要等到暗夜精灵被彻底清除之后，这些双足飞龙才能被用于军事行动。"
G["No foolin'?"]="不开玩笑？"
G["No further corruption will enter the heart chamber!"]="深度腐蚀者严禁进入中央大厅！"
G["No gnome will be left behind."]="我们不能放弃任何一个侏儒！"
G["No go with stranger!"]="才不要跟陌生人走！"
G["No gold for oil!"]="石油不是好东西！"
G["No good piece of crap!"]="一无是处的废物！"
G["No graveyard here for you to play wicked games on Korrak! DIE!"]="别想对科尔拉克耍花招，斗兽场可没有墓地！去死吧！"
G["No greater freedom than to soar through the skies, $c. What can I do for you today?"]="没有什么比在天空中翱翔更自由的了，$c。我能为你做些什么吗？"
G["No grummlepacks for you!"]="土地精包裹没你的份儿！"
G["No handouts, Cailan."]="没有施舍，塞伊兰。"
G["No hard feelings, $n.  You might be a feral killing machine, but it looks like you're with us for now."]="请不要见怪，$n。也许你的确是一台狂野的杀戮机器，不过你现在至少还是我们这一边的。"
G["No harm? Pah! Many thousand years ago, the Pearlfin Tribe stood on the throne of all Pandaria. Now, this village is all that is left of our people, all because we trusted a tribe of outsiders... the hozen."]="不会伤害？呸！几千年前，珠鳍部族统治着潘达利亚全境。可现在，我们就只剩下这个村子里的族人了，而这一切都是因为我们相信了一个外来部族……那些猢狲。"
G["No hello for your old friend, Narain? Who were you expecting???"]="纳瑞安，不给你的老朋友打声招呼吗？你在等谁呢？"
G["No hit me! Tell Peake I been good."]="不要打我！告诉匹克，我变好了。"
G["No honey bear. I need you to get those legs nice and strong. You want to be as strong as me one day, right?"]="不行，亲爱的。我要你的腿长得即好看又结实。你希望有一天像我一样强壮，对吗？"
G["No hope for you!"]="你没有获胜的希望！"
G["No horror here can compare with what you'll face when I'm through with you!"]="这里没有什么能比我更让你感到恐怖的了！"
G["No hozen num nums for you!"]="猢狲不和你耍嘴皮子了！"
G["No hurt Hogger!"]="不要伤害霍格！"
G["No hurt Mug'gok's feelings, bird-men!"]="穆格高克一点都不疼，鸟人！"
G["No hurt the lifegiver!"]="不准伤害母蛾！"
G["No hurt!!"]="不要伤害我！"
G["No idea."]="不知道。"
G["No idea. But it's doing it perfectly!"]="不知道。但它现在做得实在是完美！"
G["No idea. It made no sense..."]="不知道。这说不通……"
G["No indications of struggle are present. No guardians are present."]="未发现战斗迹象。未发现神殿守护者。"
G["No introduction could possibly do our challengers justice. Feast your eyes on the Bear and the Lady Fair!"]="接下来这对挑战者难以用语言来形容。就请大家自己好好欣赏吧，巨熊与淑女！"
G["No it's not! Don't be stupid!"]="不，它不是的！不要傻了！"
G["No job is worth this!"]="没有任何工作值得这样做！"
G["No justice, no peace!"]="没有正义，没有和平！"
G["No kidding, rookie..."]="不是开玩笑，菜鸟……"
G["No kill me!"]="别杀我！"
G["No kill me! No kill me!"]="不要杀我！不要杀我！"
G["No let it get away! We got it this time."]="别让它逃走！这次一定要抓住它。"
G["No letting up. Full speed ahead!"]="决不懈怠。全速前进！"
G["No longer are you bound here, great Princess. Have you not heard?"]="您已经不再被困于此地了，伟大的公主。您还不知道吗？"
G["No longer shall we tolerate your presence here, orc!"]="我们不会在容忍你了，兽人！"
G["No longer will we wait behind barred doors and walls of stone! No longer will our vengeance be denied! The dragons themselves will tremble before our wrath!"]="我们不用再呆在这座石墙里面了！我们很快就能报仇了！在我们的怒火面前，就连那些龙也会战栗！"
G["No luck with the Twilight's Hammer deserter?  Check the mountains to the southeast thoroughly.  There are numerous rumors of a mysterious hermit living there."]="暮光之锤的事情没有什么进展？去搜索一下东南面的山岭吧。传言说那里居住着一个神秘的隐士。"
G["No magic of nature will help you now!"]="自然魔法现在帮不了你们啦！"
G["No make me small!"]="不要缩小我！"
G["No matter how far it takes me - I refuse to give up on him."]="无论要走多远，我也绝不放弃他！"
G["No matter how much one learns, there is always more to know."]="活到老，学到老。"
G["No matter what happens - we must stay focused on our objectives here."]="无论发生了什么事——我们都必须专注于我们来的目标。"
G["No matter what's going on elsewhere, Ironforge hasn't forgotten this land, nor any of Khaz Modan."]="不管在别处正在发生着什么，铁炉堡没有忘记这片土地，也没有忘记卡兹莫丹的任何角落！"
G["No matter what, you can't die, because that would mean that I would cease to exist, right? But, I was here before when I was you. I'm so confused!"]="你可千万别出事啊。你若是死了，我也就不存在了，对吧？但是如果你真的死了的话，我又是如何能从未来返回呢。我被绕糊涂了！"
G["No matter what, your efforts will always be exalted here, $n!"]="无论怎样，我们都将永远赞扬你所作出的努力，$n！"
G["No matter! I can't be touched. No living ting can make its way trough dis barrier! Da Echo Isles be Zalazane's ta rule, shadow hunter! Now, and FOREVER!"]="没关系！我是不可战胜的。没有人能穿越这道屏障！回音群岛是扎拉赞恩的，暗影猎手！永远都是！"
G["No matter! In a moment, nozhink vill remain of any of zhis!"]="没关系！再过一会儿，这东西就彻底不复存在了！"
G["No matter! My guardians and I will make short work of you. To arms, men!"]="没有关系！我会带领护卫迅速地干掉你。准备战斗！"
G["No matter! We don't be needin' what's back dat way anyhow!"]="没关系！反正我们也用不着那些了！"
G["No matter.  You were a fool to help me, and now you will pay!"]="不过没关系。你真是个笨蛋，居然帮助了我，现在是该让你付出代价的时候了！"
G["No matter. A single life for a victory is well worth the sacrifice."]="不要紧。为了胜利，牺牲区区一条性命是值得的。"
G["No matter. Even I can feel the evil that taints their minds. Let us end their madness."]="不论如何，就连我都能感受到荼毒它们心智的邪恶。我们必须终止它们的疯狂！"
G["No matter. I shall watch Hyjal burn from afar."]="没关系。我会在远处看着海加尔燃烧。"
G["No matter. Nobody can stop me in the end."]="不要紧。最后谁也阻止不了我。"
G["No matter. These are not the spiders we need to worry about, however. Their queen, Beth'tilac, is the true danger. Her webbed fortress lies to the east, beyond our reach. There, she is protected by an army of arachnids, all prepared to give their life for the queen.\n\nAnd they're huge, too! Believe it or not, the 12-foot-long spiders you see here are the small ones. That being said, while they may not be minions of Ragnaros in the literal sense, they are a danger to our cause and should be treated as such."]="没关系。毕竟这些蜘蛛不是我们真正需要担心的。它们的蛛后，贝丝缇拉克才是我们真正的威胁。她那结满蛛网的堡垒就在东边，我们无法靠近。那里，有一整支蜘蛛大军在保护着她，个个都甘愿为这位蛛后赴汤蹈火。\n\n而且，它们的体型也非常巨大！信不信由你，你在这儿看到的那种12尺长的蜘蛛只不过是些小家伙而已。据说，它们不能算是拉格纳罗斯真正意义上的仆从，但它们仍然对我们的事业构成了威胁。所以，我们仍然要把它们当敌人来看。"
G["No matter. You will die now, a paltry offering to Deathwing as our march upon Stormwind begins."]="不要紧。你现在就要死了，作为在我们进军暴风城之时献给死亡之翼的卑微供品。"
G["No mercy for the living!"]="不要对活人心存怜悯！"
G["No mercy for the weak!"]="不必怜悯弱者！"
G["No mercy for weak."]="不要同情弱者。"
G["No mercy remains in them. Make your peace."]="他们没有任何怜悯之心，你安心受死吧。"
G["No mercy."]="不要心存怜悯。"
G["No mon, we dun want to be part of da Scourge!"]="不，朋友，我们可不想加入天灾军团！"
G["No more LIGHT! NO MORE! I BEG YOU!"]="圣光！不要！求求你！"
G["No more ale for you $n."]="我不能再卖啤酒给你了，$n。"
G["No more brew! Remember last time with Captain Ook? Want that to happen again?"]="别喝酒了！记得乌克头领的下场吗？想要和他一样吗？"
G["No more chances! Now you pay da ogre!"]="没有机会了！现在你要付出代价了！"
G["No more chatter for you."]="别喋喋不休。"
G["No more eat hatchlings, scary snake thing!"]="大坏蛇，你再也别想吃掉幼体了！"
G["No more excuses, Empress! Eliminate these cretins or I will kill you myself!"]="别找借口了，女皇！消灭这些傻瓜，否则我会亲手杀了你！"
G["No more games for you."]="你不能再参加游戏了。"
G["No more hesitation! Your fates are written!"]="别再犹豫了！你们的命运就是如此了！"
G["No more hurt! Me join you!"]="别伤害我！我听你的！"
G["No more lies, Quimby! We want answers!"]="奎比，别再隐瞒了！我们要知道实情！"
G["No more lying down on the job."]="不要再傻躺着了。"
G["No more meddling for you!"]="看你还怎么多管闲事！"
G["No more mister nice wolvar!"]="再也不会有狼獾人好好先生了！"
G["No more nice ogre! You hurt Mogor!!"]="我发怒了！你把穆戈尔打疼了！！"
G["No more play."]="别玩了。"
G["No more play?"]="不玩了？"
G["No more playing around. I will crush you!"]="不胡闹了。我要粉碎你！"
G["No more scary!"]="不用再害怕了！"
G["No more shall our people live as refugees, as outcasts, as wretched, irradiated slaves chained to the yoke of a madman's war machine!"]="我们曾经是难民，是被放逐之人，是饱受辐射之苦，被拴在战争机器上的奴隶！但是，灾难已经过去！"
G["No more shootin' straw orcs fer me!"]="我可不想再去打什么垃圾兽人了！"
G["No more tin bars! Even my arms hurt from stacking them. We have all that we need, so go ask one of the others if they need you to collect anything."]="不需要锡锭了。堆放这些锡锭还弄伤了我的手臂。我们已经有足够的锡锭了。去问问其他人吧，他们或许需要你的帮助。"
G["No more will your minions assail the creatures of stone and their allies."]="你的奴仆将再也不能攻击岩石的子嗣和他们的盟友了。"
G["No more!"]="不！"
G["No more! I no like that!"]="不要再这样了！我不喜欢这样！"
G["No more!!"]="不！"
G["No more, Arthas! No more lives will be consumed by your hatred!"]="结束了，阿尔萨斯！你残害生灵的日子今天结束了！"
G["No more."]="你完了。"
G["No mortal may stand before me and live!"]="没有凡人能从我手中逃脱！"
G["No mortal shall turn me from my task."]="没有凡人能阻碍我的使命。"
G["No my friend... we failed you... we failed you."]="不，我的朋友……我们辜负了你……我们辜负了你。"
G["No mysterious fossil here... Ah, but my copy of Green Hills of Stranglethorn.  What a good book!"]="这里没有那块神秘的化石……啊，但是有《荆棘谷的青山》的手抄本。多好的一本书啊！"
G["No need to lug water around here."]="在这里没必要带那么沉的水。"
G["No need to wait outside in the rain.  Come in... you're welcome with us in here."]="不需要在雨中等待。进来吧……我们欢迎你。"
G["No no no - this isn't right at all. Let's get out of here."]="不不不——这完全不对。我们快离开这儿。"
G["No no no! Jib! Then Jab!"]="不不不！打啊！然后猛刺！"
G["No no no! Leave Glop alone! My mushrooms! Mine!"]="不，不！离戈洛普远点儿！我的蘑菇！我的！"
G["No no no! Return to me, and we'll try again!"]="不不不！回来，我们再试一次！"
G["No no no! This land is mine, all mine!"]="不不不！这片土地是我的，都是我的！"
G["No no no, that's not what I want."]="不不不，这不是我想要的。"
G["No no no, the pain returns!"]="不不不，又开始痛了！"
G["No no no, you don't understand. I'm here to help."]="不，不，不，你不明白。我是来帮忙的。"
G["No no, don't try to get up. Your war isn't here, soldier - you need your rest"]="不，不，不要起来。这里没有战争，士兵，你需要休息。"
G["No no, not nearly sharp enough."]="不不，它还不够锋利。"
G["No no... I had no intentions of betraying your people. I was only defending myself. It was all a misunderstanding."]="没有……我没有背叛狂心氏族的意思。我当时只是……正当防卫啊。完全是个误会。"
G["No offense, babe, but Chip is my boyfriend and I'm working for the Trade Prince now.\n\nMove along, would ya? You're blocking my view."]="无意冒犯，宝贝儿，但我的男朋友是奇普，而且现在我要听贸易大王的。\n\n赶快走吧，你挡住我的视线了。"
G["No offense, but you don't look like you could shoot the broad side of a pack kodo.\n\nHow about we stop wastin' each other's time and you go find the right trainer."]="我没有恶意，但我觉得你连一头科多兽的肚子都射不中。\n\n我们不应该再浪费彼此的时间了，去找一位合适的训练师吧。"
G["No one attacks the Big G and lives!"]="敢惹老子就是死路一条！"
G["No one builds it faster, cheaper, and better than the Blastbolt brothers!"]="布拉斯波兄弟的建筑工程是速度最快，造价最低、质量最上乘的！"
G["No one can discern their motives..."]="没人能判断他们的动机……"
G["No one can question the strength of your abilities, champion."]="Nadie puede negar la fuerza de tus habilidades, $gcampeón:campeona;."
G["No one can stand against the fear. You will perish."]="没人能对抗恐惧。你必将消亡。"
G["No one can stop us! Onward to the open seas!"]="没人能阻挡我们！向公海进发！"
G["No one challenges the Wastewander nomads -- not even robotic chickens!  ATTACK!"]="没人敢挑战废土强盗团——机械小鸡也不行！进攻！"
G["No one could have done what you did, $n. Why you spared Gallywix is beyond me. You should have had his job.\n\nHere's to hoping that setting up our new home in Azshara is uneventful. I'm looking forward to retiring."]="Nadie podría haber hecho lo que tú, $n. No entiendo por qué permitiste vivir a Gallywix. Deberías ocupar su puesto.\n\nEsperemos que todo vaya bien en nuestros esfuerzos por construir un nuevo hogar en Azshara. Estoy deseando jubilarme."
G["No one disobeys Hellscream!"]="任何人都不能反抗地狱咆哮！"
G["No one escapes Skettis!"]="没有人可以逃出斯克提斯！"
G["No one expects the Dark Iron dwarves!"]="没人料到黑铁矮人会来吧！！"
G["No one get past me and threaten da king!  Ungh, take it!!"]="¡Nadie pasar por mí y amenazar $gal rey:a la reina;! ¡Agh, toma!"
G["No one here gets out alive!"]="谁也别想活着离开！"
G["No one insults Ma and Pa! Take it back!"]="不准侮辱我的父母！收回你的话！"
G["No one is coming to save you."]="没人会来救你。"
G["No one is going to save you."]="没有人可以挽救你。"
G["No one is safe!"]="没有人是安全的！"
G["No one knows what's on the bottom of the lagoon, except the folks who've been down there. And the folks them folks talked to afterwards."]="没人知道环礁湖底有些什么，除了那些去过下面的人们。还有那些和去过下面交流过的人。"
G["No one knows where the artifact was hidden, but the Horde's doing anything they can ta get their hands on it first."]="没人知道那个神器被藏在哪里，但是部落正在动用一切力量，想要先下手为强。"
G["No one laughs behind the great Millhouse Manastorm's back and lives to tell the tale!"]="没人能在背后嘲笑伟大的米尔豪斯·法力风暴之后还能活着去向他人讲述这个故事！"
G["No one lives forever..."]="没有人能长生不老……"
G["No one may enter the city. Not even you, Shaman."]="谁都不准进入城市。包括你，萨满。"
G["No one messes with MY boy!"]="任何人不准惹我的人！"
G["No one messes with the Grimleer Tribe. It is time for our clan to taste blood and victory!"]="谁也别想挑战恐目部族。现在，该是我们品尝鲜血与胜利的时刻了！"
G["No one provokes the servants of Loken and gets away with it!"]="没有人能在惹恼了洛肯的仆人之后还能全身而退的！"
G["No one really knows who made the Darkmoon Cards or what their true purpose is, but I can tell you that they have been found all over Azeroth, usually in the hands of a villain attempting to unlock their mysteries."]="没有人知道谁制作了暗月卡片，或者他们真正的意图是什么，但是我可以告诉你，在艾泽拉斯各地都可以找到它们，那些试图揭开它秘密的邪恶怪物手中都可能有卡片。"
G["No one rides the Lady!"]="没人能骑我的驼背淑女！"
G["No one shall withstand our might!"]="我们的力量无人能挡！"
G["No one speaks of my mother in that manner!"]="你竟敢辱骂我的妈妈！"
G["No one throws rocks at me!"]="不准朝我扔石头！"
G["No one wants your bread lady.  But what we do want is for you to keep it down."]="没有人想要你的面包，女士。我们只想你能安静一些。"
G["No one will keep us from our destiny!"]="没有谁能阻止我们完成使命！"
G["No one will question the might of Hellscream's Horde!"]="谁也不能质疑地狱咆哮领导下的部落的实力！"
G["No one will stop us!"]="没有人可以阻挡我们！没有人！"
G["No one's allowed to leave. Prince Liam's orders."]="任何人都不许离开，这是利亚姆王子的命令。"
G["No one's ever stolen anything out of here. Not in the whole history of... the whole history!"]="没有人能够从这里偷走东西。从来没有人……从来！"
G["No one's going to save you now, human!"]="现在没有人能救你了！"
G["No orc should ever flee from battle as I did. Leave me to my disgrace. Would that I would die in this tower, but I dread learning what my ancestors think of my cowardice."]="任何兽人都不应该像我一样逃离战场。别理我，让我单独咀嚼自己的耻辱吧。我不害怕死在这座塔里，却害怕知道我的祖先会如何看待我的懦弱。"
G["No other holiday matches the feasting and drinking of Brewfest!"]="没有什么节日比得上美酒节的美食和美酒！"
G["No other race on Azeroth has suffered as much as our people, $c. To laugh in the face of death has become second nature for all of us."]="艾泽拉斯中没有哪一个种族经历过我们的人民所受的磨难，$c。面对死亡仍安之若素已经成为我们的第二天性了。"
G["No overgrown bug's gonna chase me out of Zangarmarsh! I'll show 'em what the Explorers' League is made of..."]="没有什么畸形的虫子可以把我赶出赞加沼泽！我会让它们知道探险者协会不是好惹的……"
G["No part goes to waste! Yay!"]="什么都不能浪费！吖！"
G["No part of the animals we hunt is wasted."]="我们没有浪费狩猎而得的动物的任何一部分。"
G["No pathetic $r will deny me my birthright!"]="¡$gNingún patético:Ninguna patética; $r me negará lo que me pertenece por derecho de nacimiento!"
G["No peace here... no rest..."]="不得安宁……无法安息……"
G["No peeking!"]="不准偷看！"
G["No place for warm bloods on our Stair!"]="热血生物在我们的阶梯上绝无立足之地！"
G["No point in wasting any more time here. Ghosts don't have money!"]="别在这儿浪费更多的时间了。鬼魂都是穷鬼！"
G["No potions!"]="不准喝药！"
G["No prison can hold me!!"]="任何牢狱都困不住我！！"
G["No prison will hold me, fool!"]="没有牢笼能够关住我，白痴！"
G["No questions remain unanswered. No doubts linger. You ARE Azeroth's greatest champions. You overcame every challenge I laid before you. My mightiest servants have fallen before your relentless onslaught... your unbridled fury..."]="我不再有问题，也不再有疑问。你是艾泽拉斯最强大的勇士。我的阻挠都被你一一化解。我最悍勇的仆从也都倒在了你的无情怒火和利刃之下……"
G["No remedy seems to work - the entire city has sickened..."]="药物根本不起作用——整座城市在痛苦中呻吟。"
G["No rest for wicked, but us guess you ok.  You find Innkeeper Norman on upper ring of Trade Quarter."]="不能让邪恶势力有喘息的机会，但是我想你还是需要一些休息。去贸易区的上层找旅店老板诺曼吧。"
G["No rest... for the angry dead!"]="愤怒的死者是永远不会安息的！"
G["No restraints? Just in a circle?"]="没有任何限制？就在一圈鲜血之中？"
G["No room for mistakes this time! I don't want any of these siege engines breaking down on the field."]="这次不能再出错了！我可不希望这些攻城器械在战场上抛锚。"
G["No sale today. Too dangerous."]="今天不卖东西。太危险了。"
G["No scallywag $c is taking our Winter Veil plunder!  Get 'em!"]="¡$gNingún:ninguna; $c va a expoliar nuestro Festival de Invierno! ¡Cogedlos!"
G["No second chances!"]="没有第二次机会了！"
G["No shining army? No righteous words? It seems your 'honor' suits you no longer."]="¿Sin ejercito resplandeciente? ¿Sin palabras de rectitud? Parece que tu \"honor\" ya no va contigo."
G["No sign of the final explosives shipment to the west either.  Where are those lollygaggers?"]="还是没有最后一批炸药的消息。那些东西究竟在哪里？"
G["No sign of the flagship, and no sign of Admiral Taylor or Prince Anduin."]="没有旗舰的线索，也没有上将泰勒或安度因王子的踪迹。"
G["No snooping around, friend.\n\nIf you're looking to buy Crown holiday goods, you'll have to do it at the Lovely Merchant in the city."]="Nada de cotillear, $gamigo:amiga;.\n\nSi quieres comprar regalos festivos de La Corona, tendrás que ir a la mercader preciosa en la ciudad."
G["No so fast, betrayer."]="没那么快，叛徒。"
G["No sooner does King Wrynn return to us that another king makes his presence known.  For five years, we have had the luxury of the Scourge keeping to their conquered lands while brave heroes dealt with threats both near and far."]="乌瑞恩国王很快就会回归。五年来，天灾军团按兵不动地驻守在原有的领地上，并未向外扩展他们的势力范围。世界各地偶尔出现的危机，也被勇敢的英雄们逐一化解。这样和平的日子已经结束了。"
G["No sooner said than done, sir."]="马上就来，先生。"
G["No stealing the goods!"]="不许偷盗货物！"
G["No stupid hozun on our farm! Go!"]="在我们的农场上不许出现笨猢狲！滚开！"
G["No surprise there."]="有什么值得大惊小怪的。"
G["No surrender!"]="绝不投降！"
G["No surrender! No mercy! For AZEROTH!"]="不投降！不宽恕！为了艾泽拉斯！"
G["No survivors."]="不接受投降。"
G["No tampering with the mail!"]="别把邮件给弄乱了！"
G["No tanks.  Watching figure."]="没有坦克。看那体格儿就知道了。"
G["No taste good. Bad."]="味道不好。真难吃！"
G["No team's ever come back from this far behind!"]="还没有哪支队伍能够把这么不利的局势扳回来！"
G["No telling...\n\nThey brought new soldiers in every day. Horde and Alliance, both.\n\nSome would get hauled away the same day... others, like me, kept there for a week... maybe more."]="说不好……\n\n他们每天都会带来新的士兵。部落和联盟的都有。\n\n有些在来的当天就会被拖走……其它像我一样的，会在那儿待上一个星期……也许更久。"
G["No thank you! I think we've already proven that this wasn't a beer recipe."]="不用了！我想我们已经证明了这并不是一个啤酒配方。"
G["No thank you."]="不了，谢谢。"
G["No thanks to you.  Andorhal should have been ours days ago, when we defeated the Scourge."]="别想得到我的感谢。当我们击败天灾军团的时候，安多哈尔就已经应该属于我们了。"
G["No thanks!  Maybe sometime in the future.  Or the past.  Not today."]="不！谢谢，也许将来有可能，也许过去也有可能，但绝不是今天。"
G["No thanks, I need to stay sharp for the invasion."]="不用了，谢谢，我必须时刻提防入侵。"
G["No thanks, I'll be on my way."]="不用了，谢谢。我自己能行。"
G["No thanks..."]="不用了，谢谢……"
G["No time for beer!  The race is about to start."]="没时间喝啤酒了！比赛马上就要开始了。"
G["No time for breaks! Get back to work!"]="没时间休息了，快回去工作！"
G["No time for slumber! Join the fight!"]="没时间打盹了！准备战斗！"
G["No time to be talkin', mon. I be needin' to rest now...."]="朋友，我没功夫和你聊天。我需要休息……"
G["No time to catch our breath. Quickly! We've got to help them!"]="没时间休息了。快！我们得帮帮他们！"
G["No time to talk -- I have work to do!"]="没时间闲聊——我有工作要做！"
G["No time to waste!"]="没有时间可以浪费了！"
G["No time to waste... let's blow this wall to pieces!"]="不能再浪费时间了……让我们把这堵墙炸成碎片吧！"
G["No time! We'll send a small team immediately. An elite force. Rescue the survivors, AND their precious cargo!"]="没时间了！我们要立即派出一支小队。一支精英战队。去救回幸存者，还有那些珍贵的货物！"
G["No time, brothers! We've got to keep fighting!"]="没时间了，弟兄们！我们要奋战到底！"
G["No touch spores!"]="别碰那些孢子！"
G["No tunic, no boots, no service!"]="不穿外套和靴子的不能享受服务！"
G["No two-bit traitor will stop the powder from getting to Ironband!"]="那些叛徒是不可能阻止我把炸药运到铁环挖掘场的！"
G["No violence in Ogri'la!"]="奥格瑞拉需要和谐！"
G["No wall can hold the Banshee Queen. Keep the undead at bay, heroes. I will tear this barrier down!"]="没有墙壁能阻挡女妖之王。挡住那些亡灵，英雄们。我会粉碎这道屏障！"
G["No want trouble. Want gold."]="不想找麻烦。只想要钱。"
