G["No way! Rhino head helmet for the low, low price of thirty rhino heads? I'll take two at those prices!"]="不是吧！30个犀牛头就能换一个犀牛头盔？给我来两个！"
G["No way."]="没门。"
G["No way. That bell is bigger than my daddy's belly!"]="没门。那口钟比我爸爸的肚子还大呢！"
