G["No wikkets allowed!"]="不准蠢蛋肆意妄为！"
G["No wonder it took you so long, then. You can't explore anything sitting on your butt."]="难怪你花了这么长时间。你一直坐着的话，什么收获也不会有。"
G["No word from the nexus-prince as of yet.  Rumors of a dispute with our clients in Netherstorm have begun to circulate.  Our Sodaraami backers speak of divesting.  We've dispatched our top negotiators to dissuade them, sir."]="目前没有从节点王子那边传来的命令。一个与我们的客户在虚空风暴发生纠纷的传言正在传播。索达亚米的支持者提出要脱离我们，我们已经派遣了最好的交涉者去劝阻他们，长官。"
G["No word since the disturbance earlier, sir."]="上次干扰后还没有任何消息，长官。"
G["No words could do justice to those who would so unselfishly lay down their lives for the good of all. Suffice it to say that I am honored to have fought beside each and every one of you. Now go forth and celebrate. Victory is ours!"]="对于那些在这场战役中献出生命的勇士，没有什么词语能够表达我们敬意。但是我想说，很荣幸能与你们并肩作战。现在，尽情地庆祝吧，胜利属于我们！！"
G["No worries, everyone. This is just a short pit stop on our way to our new home."]="大家不必担心，这只是前往我们新家园途中的一次短暂的休整。"
