G["No worry, Kekek. You grow up, be strong for Frenzyheart. You lead people back to old home, where there no big-tongue babies."]="别担心，科科。你要长大，成为一名强壮的狂心者。你要率领族人返回旧日的家园。那里不会再有大舌头怪。"
G["No worry, we find you."]="别担心，我们找到你了。"
G["No you don't. It's full of trolls."]="不行。到处都是巨魔。"
G["No you won't, Tony. Go away, I'm busy summoning up a date for later!"]="不，千万别，托尼。离我远点儿，我晚上还有约会呢！"
G["No you're not! Here, take this!"]="不，你不会的！拿上这个！"
G["No!"]="不！"
G["No!  Get away from me!  Help!!"]="不！滚开！帮帮我！！"
G["No!  I love you, Martek!"]="不！我爱你，马特克！"
G["No!  It can't be..."]="不！这不可能……"
G["No!  Leave us!  We must not fail our task!"]="不！快走开！我们绝对不能失败！"
G["No!  M-my ankle!  I'm not sure I can make it... after we've come so far..."]="不！我——我的脚踝！我不确定自己是否能做到……我们已经走了这么远……"
G["No!  My bubble is weakening!"]="不！我的气泡正在变得薄弱！"
G["No!  Nessspirah belongsss to the naga!"]="不！奈瑟匹拉属于纳迦！"
G["No!  No kill!"]="不！不要杀！"
