G["No! No no no! No more muffins for you! Muffins for closers!"]="不！不不不！不能再给你松饼了！结束了才有松饼吃！"
G["No! No no no! No more party! This still Ingoo Ingoo's village!"]="不！不不！不开聚会了！这是盎迦盎迦的村子！"
G["No! No no no! Put those down."]="不！不不！放下它。"
