G["No! No, nothing like that. He is an elder for good reason, sister. Mu'sha is one of the Earthmother's eyes, and she watches over us. That isn't sinister."]="不！不，不会那样的。他是一位好长者。穆萨是大地之母的一只眼睛。她看护着我们。这不是什么坏事。"
