G["No! Such power! Deathwing's summoning of the final Cataclysm will destroy all life on Azeroth. Quickly, we must interrupt him!"]="不！如此强大的力量！死亡之翼将召来毁灭所有生命的大灾变。赶快，我们必须阻止他！"
G["No! That horn is MINE!"]="不！那个号角是我的！"
