G["No! You cannot defeat me!"]="不！你休想打败我！"
G["No! You do not escape the rage of the Gurubashi!"]="不！你躲不开古拉巴什之怒的！"
G["No! You killed Stinky! You Pay!"]="不！你杀了大臭！你赔！"
G["No! You killed queen thing! What have you... wait, nevermind. Sorry, that okay."]="什么！你杀死了蜂后！怎么可能……呃，没什么。好吧，没什么。"
G["No! You steal kill! Now you owe Gekgek!"]="啊！你竟然抢走属于我的猎物！基克吉克要干掉你！"
G["No! You will not defeat me!"]="不可能！你不可能击败我！"
G["No!!! A curse upon you, interlopers! The armies of the Lich King will hunt you down. You will not escape your fate..."]="不！！！诅咒你，入侵者，诅咒你！巫妖王的军团一定会杀死你的。你逃避不了必然的命运……"
G["No, $c, that is not all. The elite fighting forces of the opposition are commanded by the four Commanders of the base. Should you be able to strike a fatal and rapid blow to their Commanders, the elite line will falter. Their numbers dwindling to nothing!\n\nBut be warned, soldier; Commanders and Lieutenants are not to be trifled with or taken lightly. They earned those ranks..."]="不，$c，这并不是全部。敌对阵营的精英部队是由基地的四名指挥官领导的。要是你能给予他们致命的一击，快速解决掉这些指挥官，精英前线即可攻破。他们将溃不成军！\n\n但是，士兵，要小心；对指挥官和中尉可不能掉以轻心。他们可不是徒有虚名的……"
G["No, $n, you did not. I do not fault you, however, as yours is a mind much like mine was as a youth: Impetuous, rebellious, and often without a single coherent thought! Traits I can no longer afford to express.\n\nEnough lamenting. $R, I have a task for you; one that you may not survive."]="No, $n, por supuesto que no. Sin embargo, no te culpo, ya que tu mente se asemeja a la mía cuando era joven: impetuosa, rebelde y, a menudo, ¡sin ningún pensamiento coherente! Unos lujos que ya no puedo permitirme.\n\nPero basta de lamentarme. $R, tengo un trabajo para ti. Uno al que quizás no sobrevivas."
G["No, $r. Your bulk would only crush one of these noble creatures.\n\n\nNow, away with you!"]="No, $r. Tu peso aplastaría a una de estas nobles criaturas.\n\n\n¡Vete!"
G["No, Aetherion, we will not allow that to happen!"]="不，阿瑟里恩，我们不会允许这样的事情发生！"
G["No, Captain. Another signed letter has arrived by messenger from Tranquillien. It's signed again by High Executor Mavren. He wants to know why we haven't begun pulling the Farstriders from their missions against the Shadowpine trolls as he previously ordered, sir."]="不，长官。又一封从塔奎林的信使那里送来的署名信到了。还是由高级执行官玛尔伦签署的。他想知道，为什么我们还没有执行他所下达的把远行军从暗松巨魔方面撤出来的命令，长官。"
G["No, Gargal. Just no."]="不，加戈尔。不可能。"
G["No, I can see it perfectly!"]="不，我看得太清楚了！"
G["No, I cannot let it end like this. I have to keep fighting!"]="不，我不能让一切就这么结束。我必须继续战斗！"
G["No, I cannot return to Orgrimmar. I grieve for my family, but they have made their choices and I have made mine. My future is here, among my chosen brethren."]="不，我不能回奥格瑞玛。我也在为家人伤心，但他们已经做出了选择，我也做出了我的选择。我的未来在这里，在我的兄弟姐妹中间。"
G["No, I don't know what's inside, either."]="不，我也不知道里面有什么。"
G["No, I don't know where he is and if I did, I wouldn't tell you -- even if my life depended on it!"]="我不知道他的下落。就算我知道，也不会告诉你——哪怕你杀了我！"
G["No, I don't think they had the guts!"]="不，我觉得他们没这胆！"
G["No, I think not.  The selflessness that I have just been witness to has cleared my mind.  My dealings with your master are at an end.  You may return and let him know that I have decided to turn the ata'mal crystal over to the naaru."]="不，我不觉得。刚才我所目睹的无私行为净化了我的心灵。我和你的主人之间的交易已经结束了。你可以回去告诉他，我已经准备把阿塔玛水晶交给纳鲁了。"
G["No, I was right to begin with. Deatholme must come last. We must secure all of the Ghostlands first. I will not commit the forces here to a battle against Dar'khan with enemies to our flank and rear!"]="不，我是对的。戴索姆应该最后拿下，我们必须首先保卫整个幽魂之地。我不会在腹背受敌的时候派这里的部队去和达尔坎作战。"
G["No, I'm not important right now. You have to go help Thrall escape. I was going to set a fire as a diversion, but with me in this magical prison you'll have to do it instead. [PH]"]="No, yo no soy importante ahora mismo. Tienes que ir a ayudar a Thrall a escapar. Iba a encender un fuego para crear una distracción pero, conmigo en esta prisión mágica, vais a tener que hacerlo vosotros. [PH]"
G["No, I'm not, but lots of others are looking for love.  You should buy my love tokens, put on some cologne or perfume, and then pass them around!"]="没有啊，不过许多其他人都在寻找爱情。你应该从我这里买些爱情信物，洒上一些香水，然后勇敢地出击！"
G["No, I'm the intellectual one, and I am not to be taken lightly.  I could brew a healing potion from dishwater and dandelions, although that's not something I'll show you!\n\nAnyhow, if you'd like to make a purchase, please speak with Patricia."]="不，我的脑子很不错，最好不要小看我。我能够用洗碗水和蒲公英配制出治疗药剂。不过这不是我要给你的东西！\n\n不管怎样，如果你想要买东西，就请和Patricia谈谈吧。"
G["No, I'm the other Cheng. No relation. \nYes, I am a monk, though I always dreamed of being a demon hunter."]="No, yo soy el otro Cheng. No hay parentesco.\n\nSí, soy un monje, aunque siempre he soñado con ser un cazademonios."
G["No, Jaina! ARRRRRRGHHHH... He... He is coming. You... You must..."]="不，吉安娜！啊……他……他来了。你……你必须……"
G["No, Lilly.  Do not kill him."]="不，莉莉，别杀他。"
G["No, Matoclaw.  Ragnaros will not be content to send mere foot soldiers to attack us."]="不，麦托克劳。拉格纳罗斯不会只派几个小兵来对付我们。"
G["No, Mr. Floppy! No!"]="不，小毛球！不！"
G["No, NO! I didn't \"betray\" the dragonflights. We were all betrayed. Ysera was lost in a dream while this whole world came undone."]="No, ¡no! Yo no \"traicioné\" a los Vuelos. Fuimos traicionados. Ysera estaba perdida en su sueño mientras el mundo se venía abajo."
G["No, No! I'm in control of the voices. They're here to help me."]="不，不！我能控制那些声音。他们只是来帮我的。"
G["No, No, No! Turn them all on! Turn them all on!"]="不不不！把它们全打开！把它们全打开！"
G["No, Riko. You stay here. Try not to get anyone killed this time."]="不，里克。你留下。这次可别再出人命了。"
G["No, Sergeant."]="没有，中士。"
G["No, Sully. My injuries will heal. Right now, we need to find the White Pawn."]="不，苏利。我的伤没事。现在，我们必须去找白卒。"
G["No, Ulathek.  He knows your secret.  He knows you plot with Lord Hel'nurath of Xoroth."]="不，乌拉泰克。他知道你的秘密。他知道你跟克索诺斯的赫尔努拉斯之间的阴谋。"
G["No, Vaelan, I do not."]="不，维埃兰，我不清楚。"
G["No, Warchief!"]="不，酋长！"
G["No, Warchief, this is enough."]="不，酋长，这就够了。"
G["No, an old man like me doesn't need anything. But my son... now he loved collecting blue feathers..."]="不，像我这么一个老头已不需要任何东西了。但我的儿子……他现在喜欢收集蓝色羽毛……"
G["No, blood of my blood, they are soldiers of the Alliance. Our sworn enemies."]="不对，儿子。他们是联盟的士兵，是我们不共戴天的敌人。"
G["No, but I don't need to have seen it to know that we're all going to DIE!\n\nDo you hear me?!"]="No, ¡pero no me hace falta para saber que todos vamos a MORIR!\n\n¡¿Me oyes?!"
G["No, chancellor, I wouldn't say that I'm here to 'rescue' you, per se."]="No, Canciller, no diría que he venido a \"rescatarle\" per se."
G["No, dear, this is something far worse than the Horde. The darkness emanating from Stonetalon Peak is ancient. Older than the world itself."]="不，宝贝儿，这可比部落要邪恶得多。从石爪峰发散而出的黑暗力量非常古老。甚至比这个世界本身还要久远。"
G["No, don't feel bad.  I get that a lot.\n\n<Taela looks both amused and annoyed.>\n\nI'm a HIGH elf, not a blood elf.  Don't worry, I'm not going to suck all of the magic out of you."]="不，没关系。我经常遇到这种事情。\n\n<泰拉看上去有些高兴又有些恼火。>\n\n我是个**高等**精灵，不是个血精灵。所以不要担心，我不会把你的所有法力吸个精光的。"
G["No, father, I will. Lo was willing to fight the Pandriarchs for me. It took $p to champion us but they consented."]="不，父亲，我会的。罗甚至愿意为了我去挑战族长，连$p都支持我们，他们不会不同意的。"
G["No, fiend. Your time is NOW."]="不，恶魔。你的时间不多了。"
G["No, girl. Arthas is not here. Arthas is merely a presence within the Lich King's mind. A dwindling presence..."]="不，孩子。阿尔萨斯不在这里。阿尔萨斯只是巫妖王意识中的一个存在。一个即将泯灭的存在……"
G["No, he'd never just leave his prayer book behind!  He was always nose-deep in that book, studying."]="不，他决不会丢下自己的祈祷书。他总是把脸埋在那本书里，学个没完。"
G["No, hit me!  Over here, mon!"]="喂，打我呀！这边，伙计！"
G["No, idiots! The ones down by the beach!"]="不对，蠢货！是海滩上的那些家伙！"
G["No, it cannot be! Nooo!"]="不，这不可能！不！！！"
G["No, lad, not Bronco! He's not been broken yet! You'll get yerself killed up there!"]="嗨，伙计！别挑布隆库！他还没有被驯服！你骑上去的话很可能会没命的！"
G["No, little one, it's nothing like that. My spirit spent many years in the Emerald Dream while my body slept, and it started to take on attributes of our animal forms."]="不，小家伙，不是这样的。我的灵魂在翡翠梦境中渡过了许多岁月；而我的肉体一直在沉眠之中。于是它开始呈现出我们各种动物形体的属性。"
G["No, me!"]="不，是我！"
G["No, minion. This one is not ready."]="不，我的仆从。这一个还没有准备好。"
G["No, my beloved."]="不，亲爱的。"
G["No, my eyesight will get worse!"]="不，是我的视力会退化！"
G["No, my student, look at these words here: \"vessel\", \"quench\", \"recipe\"..."]="No, alumna mía, mira estas palabras de aquí: \"vasija\", \"saciar\", \"receta\"..."
G["No, no - this might work!"]="听我说——这个法子说不定管用！"
G["No, no Neferset movement.  But I just received word that the city of Orsis is being hit by the largest sandstorm anyone has ever witnessed.\n\nI was about to send word to the king myself, but perhaps you can relay the information."]="不，尼斐塞特没什么行动。可我刚刚收到消息，一场前所未见的强大沙尘暴袭击了奥西斯城。\n\n我正准备亲自将消息带给国王，看来你可以帮忙转达一下。"
G["No, no! Do not fail me!"]="不，不！别让我失望！"
G["No, no! Where's your sense of showmanship? Theatrics!"]="不，不！你怎么一点表现力都没有？要讲究舞台艺术！"
G["No, no, I'm not brawling. I'm mainly here to cheer for Bruce."]="不，不，我不是来打拳的。我主要是来给布鲁斯捧场的。"
G["No, no, little ones. You aren't big enough yet!"]="不，不，小家伙们。你们还太小了！"
G["No, no, mon. Dere be no trolls here...."]="不对，不对。这里没有巨魔……"
G["No, no, no! Come back here!"]="不，不，不！回到这边来！"
G["No, no, no! I cannot stop now. My mutations must live!"]="不，不，不！我不能停下来。我的变异体必须活下去！"
G["No, no, no! Not short... it's just... well... maybe I could toss you across most of it?"]="没有！没有！我不是说你矮啦……呃……这么说吧……或许我可以将你扔过去，直接穿越这片雷区？"
G["No, no, no! The Bell!"]="不，不，不！圣钟！"
G["No, no, no, Theldurin.  You're telling the story wrong!"]="不，不，不，塞尔杜林。你把故事讲错了！"
G["No, no, no. Lin, my dear husband. You can't be gone."]="不，不，不。林，我亲爱的丈夫，你不能死。"
G["No, no, no... Left foot then right foot!"]="不，不，不……先是左脚，后是右脚！"
G["No, no, no... you took my family, but you won't take my land!"]="不，不，不……你毁了我的家庭，但你别想夺走我的土地！"
G["No, no, no...this can't be happening. This wasn't part of the travel plan!"]="不，不，不……这不可能。这不是旅行计划的一部分！"
G["No, no, please continue... it's just that the air up here is so, um, smoky."]="不，不，请继续……这里的空气……似乎，呃，有点浑浊……"
G["No, no, silly $r..."]="No, no, $gestúpido:estúpida; $r..."
G["No, no, that was under the OLD guild rules...."]="不，不，那是以前的公会的条例……"
G["No, no, you'll need FAR more training before you're ready to learn from me! Go talk to that uptight dabbler Malcomb Wynn. He's the one buried in books over there."]="¡No, no, necesitarás MUCHA más instrucción antes de estar $gpreparado:preparada; para aprender de mí! Ve a hablar con ese mojigato de Malcomb Wynn. Es el que está enterrado entre libros."
G["No, no. No need for him to trouble about a student's idle philosophizing while he entertains a friend."]="不，不。不要在他招待朋友的时候用无聊的哲学问题去打扰他。"
G["No, no... it's just that... well... we're attracting looks."]="不，不……其实……呃……我们走在街上的回头率比较高。"
G["No, no... no!"]="天哪……不！"
G["No, no... this swarm is too early. I must speak with the Adjunct!"]="不，不……这群袭发动得过早了。我必须跟副官谈谈！"
G["No, noooo- This was to be my hour of triumph..."]="不，不——这本该是我的荣耀之时……"
G["No, not Akali too!"]="不，也不是哈克娅！"
G["No, not me limes, says I!"]="不，别碰我的酸橙，听见没有！"
G["No, not now! Not like this!"]="不，不是现在！不是这样的！"
G["No, not over here."]="不，不在这里。"
G["No, not savagery! Conscience. The excesses of our people will destroy us, and all that we have struggled to build."]="不，不是野蛮人！这是道德。我们毫无节制的行为会最终摧毁我们，进而摧毁我们所努力构建的一切。"
G["No, not that I can tell. It seems to be mostly based on region. Some races have labled them slimes, some oozes. It seems to be preference mostly.\n\nEvery time I've encountered ooze, sludge, or slime they have basically been the same creatures. The differences seem to be based on their environment, which is why we need a pure sample."]="不，我并不清楚。似乎那主要与地域有关。有些种类称为泥浆怪，有些称为软泥怪。似乎这属于个人偏好。\n\n每次我遇到软泥怪、淤泥怪或泥浆怪时，它们从根本上都是一种生物。不同之处在于它们的环境，这也是我们需要一份纯净的样本的原因。"
G["No, not the Sanitron... it was my pride and joy!"]="不，别碰净化者……那是我的骄傲与乐趣所在！"
G["No, not the chasm. Fliers.  In numbers like we've never seen."]="不，不是沟里。它们会飞。数量庞大，前所未见。"
G["No, not the cogs! Anything but the cogs!"]="不要，我讨厌齿轮！别让我碰那玩意儿！"
G["No, not the needle! Anything but the needle!"]="不，别动针！除了针以外什么东西都可以！"
G["No, not yet."]="不，还没有。"
G["No, old friend, it is very relevant."]="No, $gviejo amigo:vieja amiga;, es muy relevante."
G["No, old friend.  I've come to you as an equal."]="不，老朋友。我以平等的身份来找你。"
G["No, old friend. You've freed us all..."]="不，老朋友。你解放了我们所有人。"
G["No, please go on."]="不，请继续。"
G["No, please!  Don't!"]="啊，不要！住手！"
G["No, popo. They look kind of like the pigs. Are they pigs?"]="嗯。他们看上去像是猪啊。是猪吗？"
G["No, really, I still don't understand..."]="不，真的，我还是不懂……"
G["No, rocket! Don't go that way!"]="不，火箭！不要往那飞！"
G["No, she cannot hate you. At least not forever. Hahahaha!"]="不，她不会恨你的。至少不会一直如此。呵呵呵！"
G["No, sir."]="没有，长官。"
G["No, sir. A signed letter from the High Executor has come in from Tranquillien. He's requesting that we pull all Farstrider forces from the eastern border and the trolls. He wants us to prepare to deploy to Andilien Estate as a staging area for an assault on Deatholme, sir."]="不，长官。一封从塔奎林的高级执行官那里送来的署名信。他要求我们从东部边界和巨魔那里撤回所有的远行者部队，他想让我们准备把人员部署在安迪尔林庄园，把那里作为一个对戴索姆进攻的中转站。"
G["No, sir. I don't believe so."]="不，先生。我不这么认为。"
G["No, spirit, I am afraid that they are all trapped inside - FOREVER! Now leave me be..."]="不，灵魂，我恐怕他们都被永远困在里面了！现在，离我远点……"
G["No, stay with the others. Escort them north, away from the fighting. I will stay here with the wyverns and cover your escape. Go!"]="不，和其他人待在一起。护送他们向北离开战场。我会和双足飞龙留在这里掩护你们。快走！"
G["No, tell me more!"]="不，请继续讲！"
G["No, that is my femur, but I am happy to see you."]="不，那是我的大腿骨，但是我见到你很高兴。"
G["No, that one! That one! Get that one!"]="不，是那个！那个！就是他！"
G["No, that's not true - there is so much more to us than this!"]="不，那不是真的——对我们来说绝对不止这样！"
G["No, the Firelord has already claimed this one for his own. Do you doubt his power?"]="不，炎魔之王亲自挑选了她。你们想要质疑他的力量？"
G["No, there won't be any taste tests today. Not until someone helps me get my stolen grain back!"]="不，今天不提供试吃了。除非有人帮我将被盗的谷物找回来才行！"
G["No, this can't be! This tonic... it was supposed to reverse my addiction, not hasten my descent into the ranks of the Wretched!"]="不，这不可能！这药剂……是应该改变我对魔法的沉迷，而不是把我变成一个肮脏丑陋的失心者！不！！！"
G["No, this can't be... It says this creature willingly became a servant of the Legion. He transforms into a satyr and receives the Legion's \"blessing.\""]="No puede ser... Dice que esta criatura se unió a la Legión voluntariamente. Se transformó en un sátiro y recibió la \"\"bendición\"\" de la Legión."
G["No, this is the work of a traitor to both our peoples. Despite my best efforts, some Dark Irons remain in the grip of Twilight's Hammer."]="不，这对我们双方的人民来说都是一种背叛。尽管我拼尽了全力，一些黑铁矮人仍在暮光之锤的掌控之中。"
G["No, this isn't right. What's happened here?"]="不，不是这样的。这里发生了什么事？"
