G["No, wait! You haven't told me how to use this charm yet!"]="喂，等等！你还没告诉我该怎么使用这个咒符！"
G["No, we been tricked!"]="不，我们被骗了！"
G["No, we didn't find the White Pawn.\n\nNo, I can't tell you what the White Pawn is."]="不，我们没有找到白卒。\n\n不行，我不能把白卒的身份告诉你。"
G["No, we escaped from those monsters! They're nothing like us, Griselda."]="我们已经摆脱那些怪物了！格里西达，他们和我们截然不同。"
G["No, we will NOT let you live."]="不，我们不会让你活下来。"
G["No, we will not be pulling back. It's many years yet before the mantid birth their next swarm. I will not see the Townlong Steppes given to them freely."]="不，我们绝不撤军。在螳螂妖繁殖下一代虫群之前，我们还有很多年时间。我可不想把螳螂高原拱手相让。"
G["No, you aren't hearing things. I actually do have the voice of a young orc woman. But you listen here, $g boy:girl;, time travel does strange things to a body.\n\nBy the way, it's 250 years."]="不，你没有听错。我确实是有个年轻女兽人的声音。但是你听好了，$g小子:姑娘;，时间旅行会给身体带来奇怪的反应。\n\n顺便说一句，这已经是第250年了。"
