G["Nope, can't say I've heard of you."]="不，我想我不认识你吧。"
G["Nope, didn't leave the fossil back here!"]="不，我没有把化石留在这里！"
G["Nope, don't think there are any Enchanters here in Elwynn Forest.  There's a guy named Lucan who runs a shop up in Stormwind though.  You could check with him and see if he will train you."]="不，我不认为在艾尔文森林中有附魔师。但是，在暴风城中有个名叫鲁坎的家伙，他开了一家商店。你可以去找他，看他是否能训练你。"
G["Nope, no alchemists out here in Dun Morogh.  Ye best take a look in Ironforge for them... try the gnomes in Tinker Town."]="不，在丹莫罗是没有炼金师的。你最好去铁炉堡……去工匠区找侏儒。"
G["Nope, nobody who can teach ye herbalism out here.  I think ye'll have better luck in Ironforge though."]="不，这儿没人能教你草药学。你最好去铁炉堡碰碰运气。"
G["Nope, not here..."]="不，不在这里……"
G["Nope, not in that one either - well, it must be around here somewhere, by the way, did I mention how wonderful it is to be out of that stinky cage? It was almost impossible to run around in there but I did anyway but sometimes I got going so fast that I ended up walking on the walls of the  cage so finally I stopped trying and just turned around in circles...."]="啊，那里也没有——好吧，它一定在这附近啦。我有没有跟你说过离开那个臭烘烘的牢笼是件多么美妙的事情？笼子空间狭小不过我凭借灵巧的身段能在奔跑哟只是有时候我跑得太快了就跟飞檐走壁似的所以呢我决定在里面转圈子玩……"
G["Nope, still not done with these repairs.  Shouldn't be long though."]="不，还没完全修好。但估计不会太久了。"
G["Nope."]="没有。"
G["Nope.  How about you?"]="不怎么样。你呢？"
G["Nope. Didn't hear a thing..."]="没有。什么声音也没听见……"
G["Nope.. not yet."]="不……还不行。"
G["Nope... nope... not good."]="不……不……不好。"
G["Nor my husband and brothers!"]="也没能拯救我的丈夫和兄弟！"
G["Nordrassil lies a pale shadow of what it once was, its power used to defeat Archimonde and drive back the Burning Legion."]="诺达希尔的力量曾经败过阿克蒙德，击退了燃烧军团的入侵，但它只剩下了一个苍白的影子。"
G["Norgannon's shell accounted for and secure. It will be available for transfer once user's identity has been verified."]="诺甘农之壳处于安全状态。核实用户身份后即可进行数据传输。"
G["Norkani still be needin' your help!"]="洛尔卡尼仍然需要你的帮助！"
G["Normal dogs won't come anywhere near me nowadays.  I was devastated when I found out... I used to love the beasts.\n\nPlaguehounds make for a fine substitute, however.  They're not quite as... easy on the eyes.  But then again, neither am I!"]="正常的狗根本不敢靠近我。当我发现这点时深受打击……我其实是很喜欢动物的。\n\n天灾犬是不错的替代品。当然，它们的模样……并不好看。但你知道吗，我的相貌也好看不到哪儿去！"
G["Normally I kill these things. You know that, yeah?"]="通常我都是直接杀掉这些家伙的。你知道的，对吧？"
G["Normally it would not be my place to speak with you directly; rather, you would seek an audience with milady. However, I did give you a task directly, so what is it that we need to discuss?"]="通常来说我是不会和你直接谈话的，你应该直接去找夫人。不管怎样，既然我直接给你下达了命令，那么我们需要讨论的事情是……？"
G["Normally we'd be more than capable of fulfilling Cho's request. Jade veins run through this land like...\n\n<Mann scratches her head for a moment in thought.>\n\nWell, like something that runs through something else in veins. \n\nLook, I ain't a poet.\n\nPoint is: we got problems."]="通常我们都能轻松完成周卓的要求。这里的玉石矿脉贯穿大地，就好像……\n\n<孟挠了挠头，似乎在思考。>\n\n呃，就好像某些东西体内的血管。\n\n你瞧，我又不是诗人。\n\n重点在于：我们遇到麻烦了。"
G["Normally we'd have plenty on hand, but most of our supplies have been left out to ruin in the rain.\n\nHowever, I'm certain the creatures in the dried up ponds are a mixture of rainwater and salt from the earth. You may be able to get what you need from them."]="通常我们手上会有很多，但眼下几乎所有补给品都被雨水冲毁了。\n\n不过，我相信那些干涸池塘里的生物是雨水和泥土盐分的混合物。你也许能从它们身上找到需要的东西。"
G["Normally, I'd just shrug off an explosion like that, but I think someone got the nitro and kaja'mite mixture wrong."]="通常，我面对那样的爆炸只会一笑了之，可我认为有人把硝基和卡亚矿石混合比例搞错了。"
G["Normally, new trainees have a little more time to prepare."]="一般来说，新手会有较多的准备时间。"
G["North through Alther's Mill, but we'd have to cut through an army of bloodthirsty worgs or south through Render's Valley."]="向北穿过奥瑟尔伐木场，但我们得遭遇嗜血的座狼大军，或是向南穿过撕裂者山谷。"
G["North wind! You will do as I command!"]="北风！照我说的去做！"
G["Northern Bank"]="北部银行"
G["Northern Rocketway Exchange, please."]="北部火箭车换乘站，谢谢。"
G["Northern Rocketway Terminus, please."]="北部火箭车终点站，谢谢。"
G["Northrend awaits, $r. The majestic Cloudkisser will take you straight across the sea to Vengeance Landing in Howling Fjord."]="$r，诺森德等你去开拓。“吻云号”会载你前往嚎风峡湾的复仇港。"
G["Northrend requires your attention Overlord Hellscream. We will deal with the Lich King and his minions without your aid."]="诺森德的战事需要你的关注，地狱咆哮统帅。没有你的力量，我们也将去讨伐巫妖王和他的爪牙。"
G["Northrend's depths belong to the nerubians, $r.\n\nI have devoted myself to restoring that great truth."]="诺森德的地底深渊是属于蛛魔的，$r。\n\n我毕生都在为重建这一秩序而奋斗。"
G["Nose-stenders. For smelling things in different rooms."]="模拟鼻子。用来闻不同房间里的气味。"
G["Not Haloke!"]="哈鲁克，不！"
G["Not a bad place here, if you aren't into the whole \"sunshine\" thing."]="Este lugar no está tan mal si no te importa que no haya eso que llaman \"luz del sol\"."
G["Not a bad shot. For a fleshling..."]="对于一个血肉之躯来说……已经射得不错了。"
G["Not a bit. For the life of me, I can't figure out how this thing works."]="不行。我完全搞不明白这玩意儿是如何运作的。"
G["Not a challenge at all it seems. Let us see how you handle your second test. Lysta, bring forth the minions of the Lich King."]="看来你们应付第一轮还是非常轻松的嘛。让我们看看你是怎样对付第二轮测试的。利斯塔，把巫妖王的爪牙带上来。"
G["Not a chance, boy.  Gilneas is going to need its king's undivided attention.  Can't have your father wondering whether his child is alive or not."]="不行，孩子。吉尔尼斯的国王必须心无旁骛。不能让你的父亲分心担忧你的安危。"
G["Not a chance, you can keep that Mr. Derpa."]="不必了，你可以留着它，迪嘭先生。"
G["Not a chance."]="门都没有。"
G["Not a creature in the forest can elude Corand, such is his skill at tracking.  You would do well to listen to his teachings if you wish to be even half as successful.  \nI will relieve you of the burden of tracking him and mark his location on your map, there in the Cenarion Enclave."]="No hay criatura en el bosque que pueda escapar de Corand, tal es su habilidad en el rastreo. Harías bien en recibir instrucción suya si quieres tener al menos la mitad de sus habilidades. \n\nTe ayudaré a encontrarle fácilmente y marcar su ubicación en tu mapa, en el Enclave Cenarion."
G["Not a penny was wasted on comfort or personal safety!"]="不要在舒适和安全方面浪费一个钱！"
G["Not a sentry!"]="我不是哨兵！"
G["Not a year ago, poor old Fitzsimmons passed on, his body ruined by drink."]="不到一年前，大副菲兹莫斯那个可怜的老家伙去世了，是酒毁了他的身体。"
G["Not again!"]="不要再这样了！"
G["Not again! Not again..."]="不！不！！"
G["Not again, Grok.  You've been told before to stay away!"]="不要再这样了，葛罗克。我跟你说过的，离远点！"
G["Not again..."]="不要再来了……"
G["Not all Forsaken are driven by Sylvanas' will, $n. Some of us are driven by true power--power we earn for ourselves."]="并不是所有的被遗忘者都屈从于希尔瓦娜斯的意志，$n。我们中的某些人是被真正的力量驱动的——我们为自己赢得的力量。"
G["Not all Tauren despise your kind, $r. Alas, I am forbidden to offer you my services."]="并不是所有牛头人都藐视你们$r。不过，我无法向你提供服务。"
G["Not all da places held together so well.  We try to help as much as we can.  But da source, it be Zul'Gurub."]="不是所有地方联系都如此紧密。我们会尽力帮忙，但这一切的源头，是在祖尔格拉布。"
G["Not all dinner guests are gracious.  Mind your manners!"]="不是所有的客人都是那么和蔼的。注意礼貌。"
G["Not all of the paragons were choosen for the physical skills, Wakener."]="不是所有的英杰都因为身手矫健而被选中的，唤醒者。"
G["Not all of you will ascend to glory. Look to your left. Look to your right. THEY will perish in the end times. But YOU will become immortal."]="不是你们所有人都能登上荣耀的顶峰。看看你的左边。再看看你的右边。他们最后都将消亡。但你，却将永存不朽。"
G["Not all pandaren have chosen the same path as you three."]="并不是所有的熊猫人都选择了和你们一样的道路。"
G["Not all problems can be solved with your fists.  Sometimes you must center yourself and channel your energy towards a distant target."]="不是所有问题都能用拳头解决。有时你必须以自己为中心点，朝远处的目标引导你的能量。"
G["Not an apple cart to be seen..."]="连一辆卖苹果的小货车都看不到……"
G["Not anotha!"]="别再来了！"
G["Not another one..."]="不要再来了……"
G["Not anymore!  Here's your sword.  Report to the barracks for duty!"]="又是来应征士兵的！喏，这是你的剑。去兵营报到吧！"
G["Not as quiet as I would prefer, but it works."]="没我想得那么安静，但还是成功了。"
G["Not at all! If my gut could take three years of the Razor Hill barrack's Stinky Cactus Grub Soup, a bowl of roaches isn't going to kill me."]="完全不担心！我在剃刀岭兵营吃了三年臭虫仙人掌浓汤也没闹过肚子，一大碗蟑螂算什么。"
G["Not at all, priestess. We are very grateful for all that you've offered us here."]="没关系，祭司大人。您为我们所提供的一切已经让我们感激不尽了。"
G["Not backing out, are you?"]="还没有放弃，是么？"
G["Not bad for a dryskin."]="对干皮人来说很不错了。"
G["Not bad for a goblin."]="对于地精来说，还不算糟。"
G["Not bad for a landlubber."]="No eshtá mal pa' $gun marinero:una marinera; d’agua ¡hic! dulse."
G["Not bad for a newbie."]="No está mal para $gun novato:una novata;."
G["Not bad, $c. Our work here is finished for today, but stay sharp. I wouldn't be surprised if your next orders came from Lion's Landing in a few days' time."]="不错嘛，$c。我们今天的工作暂时完成了，但你要保持警惕。过几天，给你的下一道指令说不定就是从雄狮港发出的了，这是完全有可能的。"
G["Not bad, $n. Not bad."]="不坏，$n。不坏。"
G["Not bad, I guess."]="我猜，不算坏。"
G["Not bad, champion! What they say about you is true. However, we part ways here. I must go deal with this prisoner...personally."]="不赖嘛，勇士！看来关于你传闻都是真的。不过我们得在这儿分道扬镳了。我得亲自处理这个囚犯……"
G["Not bad, for a beginner! I guess it couldn't hurt for me to show you a few things..."]="¡No está mal para $gun:una; principiante! No me hará ningún daño enseñarte un par de cosas..."
G["Not bad, not bad! If I do say so myself, your farm is running smoothly. Maybe one day you'll be as successful as Haohan Mudclaw!"]="不赖，不赖！我凭良心讲，你的农场搞的真不赖。或许有一天，你会像郝瀚·泥爪一样成功呢！"
G["Not bad, not bad... But it's missing spice!  How about adding scorpid venom?  Yes!  That'll fix it right up!"]="呃，还不错吧……总觉得少了点什么！不如加点蝎毒？对呀！那样就很完美啦！"
G["Not bad, not bad... but we are not done yet!"]="不错，还不错……可还没完呢！"
G["Not bad, though some additional schooling wouldn't hurt! Here, watch my hips... like so!"]="还不错吧，但是多掌握点技巧总是没错的！你瞧，看我摆臀的动作……像这样！"
G["Not bad."]="不坏。"
G["Not bad.  Try that trick I told you about when you temper the steel."]="还不错。下次你在回火的时候可以试试我教你的窍门。"
G["Not bad. Go talk with Snarl, he just moved to Orgrimmar to study under Saru. Look for him in the Warrior district near Saru's smithy. Oh and he'll test you, so you better be as ready as you think you are."]="还行。去跟斯纳尔谈谈，他刚前往奥格瑞玛向萨鲁求学。去萨鲁的铁匠铺附近的战士区找他吧。他会对你进行测试，你最好做好准备。"
G["Not bad... I suppose training you is not out of the question. Very well! Let's begin..."]="还行……训练你是不成问题的。很好！我们开始吧……"
G["Not bad... for an amateur! Still, you know about as much as I do. If you wanna' learn more you're gonna' have to talk to Josef Gregorian in Undercity."]="对一个业余者来说……这还行！你的知识量已经跟我持平了。要是你想学习更多知识，就去幽暗城找乔瑟夫·格里高利谈谈。"
G["Not bad... not bad."]="不错……不错。"
G["Not bad... you might be able to hit the broad side of a sickly kodo."]="还不赖……你也许还能打中生病科多兽的大肚子。"
G["Not doing so good. I come back and find you later."]="情况很糟糕啊。我待会再回来找你。"
G["Not eating."]="别说吃的了。"
G["Not entirely unexpected."]="倒也不是完全没料到。"
G["Not even a thousand deaths could put my soul to rest..."]="即使死一千次……我的灵魂也不会安宁……"
G["Not even close."]="相差甚远。"
G["Not even my father could have planned such tragedy... such chaos. You will never make it! Time is running out!"]="即使是我的父亲也未曾预料到这样的悲剧……这可怕的混乱。你们是不可能成功的！没时间了！"
G["Not even the Lich King's most powerful minions can stand against the Alliance. All hail our victors!"]="即使是巫妖王最强大的爪牙也无法与联盟抗衡。为胜利欢呼吧！"
G["Not everyone gonna come out of this alive."]="这场战争过后，许多人都会死去。"
G["Not everyone is cut out for the work I do.\n\n<Tormentor Sipe sharpens his blade.>\n\nCut out, get it? Oh, I slay me."]="我这活儿可不是人人都能干的。\n\n<折磨者赛普磨着他的小刀。>\n\n天赋，明白吗？噢，我真是个天才。"
G["Not exactly.  In fact, many of the creatures here in the crater existed long before my master arrived... but some did not.\n\nNevertheless, we observe them all, without prejudice."]="不尽然。事实上，这座环形山中的许多生物在我的导师到来之前就已经存在了……\n\n无论是否由我的导师亲手创造，我都对它们进行绝对客观的观察。"
G["Not fair! I wanna watch the fights!"]="不公平！我想看打斗！"
G["Not far now...."]="现在不远了……"
G["Not feel so good... maybe come back find us later?"]="情况不妙……要不你待会再来找我们？"
G["Not for long. Time ta finish dis ting."]="他灭亡的时刻已经近了。"
G["Not getting out of your debts that easy."]="别想轻易逃过债务。"
G["Not gonna jorb my jangos!"]="休想抢我的香蕉！"
G["Not gonna talk."]="不想说。"
G["Not good enough...."]="还不够好……"
G["Not if I have something to say about it, sparky!"]="我不会让你这么做的！"
G["Not if they renounced the Horde."]="除非他们放弃与部落的盟约。"
G["Not if we're caught up in it! Why weren't you running? What have you been doing with your hand in the Well?"]="我们可不能被卷进去！你为什么不逃跑？……你把手伸进井水里想干什么？"
G["Not if you were the last troll on Azeroth!"]="除非艾泽拉斯世界的其他巨魔都死绝了！"
G["Not important. I will stop at nothing to win!"]="无关紧要。什么都别想阻止我胜利的步伐！"
G["Not in here!"]="别在这里闹事！"
G["Not in the face!"]="别打脸！"
G["Not it!"]="不会吧！"
G["Not just any fish, mortal. This fish was a minnow. A very special minnow."]="不是别的鱼类，凡人。我说的是米诺鱼，一种非常特别的米诺鱼。"
G["Not just any scars, either. These were created by pandaren weapons."]="但也不是一般的伤痕，这些伤痕是熊猫人的武器造成的。"
G["Not just anyone can be the boss ya know! It takes skill, brains, and of course looks!"]="工头可不是人人都能当的！它需要技巧、头脑，当然还有仪表！"
G["Not like this..."]="不是这样……"
G["Not long ago, but I've already seen terrible suffering in this place!"]="不久前，我就在这个地方亲眼见证了一场恐怖的灾难！"
G["Not long ago, this place was the site of a terrible battle.  We of Nethergarde and the Argent Dawn held at bay a wave of demons, surging relentlessly from the Dark Portal.\n\nThose were dark days, full of bloodshed and despair...\n\nBut the Kingdoms of Azeroth soon joined us and pushed the monsters back!  The fighting continues on the far side of the Portal...\n\nThis camp is now calm, but I fear the quiet here belies the madness found through that hellish gate."]="不久之前，这个地方发生了一场可怕的战斗，我们守望堡和银色黎明在黑暗之门涌出的恶魔们无情的冲击下，几乎要全线崩溃。\n\n在那段黑暗的日子里，充满了流血和绝望……\n\n但是，艾泽拉斯各国很快就赶来支援，把那些恶魔赶了回去！战斗还在黑暗之门的另一边持续着……\n\n这座营地目前恢复了平静，但是我担心这里的宁静掩饰了黑暗之门另一边的疯狂。"
G["Not long ago, we knew nothing but the simple life of brewing fine cider. So much has changed in so little time."]="就在不久前，我们还过着只知道酿造可口苹果酒的简单生活。在这么短的时间内，一切都变了。"
G["Not long later, out of nowhere, the snow burst before them and a jormungar the size of Veranus herself came down upon their party... one of them was swallowed whole before they even had time to react."]="走着走着，他们面前的雪地突然裂开了，一只像维拉努斯那么大的冰虫袭击了他们……其中一位伙伴还来不及反应，就被整个吞了下去。"
G["Not looking too good today. Sun is high and bright early and no activity on the water."]="今天估计没戏。太阳早早地到了正中，而且阳光太耀眼了，水里也没有什么动静。"
G["Not me battle? I dunnae who ye think ye are, mister, but I got a score to settle with Arthas and yer not gettin' in me way! FIRE ALL GUNS! FIRE! FIRE!"]="想挡住我？也不看看自己是谁？我现在就要去和阿尔萨斯算账了，谁也别想拦着我！注意！全火力射击！开火！开火！"
G["Not me, Great Spirit. Me TRIBE."]="伟大的英灵，一切都是为我的部族。"
G["Not mentioned much, but Kartak ate dozen Frenzyheart before became \"friend.\""]="No muy mencionado, pero Kartak comió doce Corazones Frenéticos antes de volverse \"amigo\"."
G["Not much fishing to be had around here, but what little there is to be had is Paxton's ye can be sure.  Ye can find him fishing out on Iceflow Lake."]="这周围可不是钓鱼的好地方，但是你应该去找帕克斯顿问问看。他在涌冰湖钓鱼。"
G["Not much of a day. Just right for not much of a life."]="这日子马马虎虎吧。跟混日子的人正相配。"
G["Not much so far, but the day is young."]="目前还没钓到什么，可时间还早。"
G["Not much, I'm afraid. I'm no druid, I'm here to lead troops. Seems odd to me that Malfurion tried to plant a tree in the middle of a warzone, but... like I said, I'm no druid.\n\nHowever, I can tell you this. NOTHING makes those fire elementals angrier than the idea of a big, leafy tree growing right in the middle of their homeland. If nothing else, when this tree grows to its full size, it will be a beacon of hope for our forces... and a thorn in the side of our enemy."]="我知道的恐怕也不多。我并不是德鲁伊，我只是来指挥部队的。在我看来，玛法里奥想要在战区里种一棵树的想法很古怪。不过……我也说了，我并不是德鲁伊。\n\n不过，我可以这么跟你说。没有什么能比自己的老家里长出一棵郁郁葱葱的大树更让那些火元素生气的了。就算没有其他意义，当这棵树完全长成时，也可以象征我军的希望之光……并成为敌人的眼中钉。"
G["Not much, Magni. I've had nightmares of a human... tall... light hair... death black armor. His name rests on the tip of me tongue, but..."]="我不太记得了，麦格尼。我经常做噩梦，梦见一个人类……很高……浅色的头发……死黑色的盔甲。他的名字……话在嘴边却说不出口……"
G["Not much."]="不是很多。"
G["Not my gears - not my beautiful gears!"]="我的设备……不，我美丽的设备！"
G["Not my problem! If yer so antsy to get yerself a house built, do it 'ere in the fort and quit yer whinin'!"]="这又不是我的问题！如果你这么着急建房子的话，就在要塞里建好了，省得你整天抱怨！"
G["Not my problem, Messner. Make it happen."]="这就不是我要考虑的问题了，梅森纳。总之要找到。"
G["Not necessarily. I believe...yes...it just might work."]="不，还不一定。我相信……是的……这样也许能行。"
G["Not now!"]="现在不是时候！"
G["Not now, $c. I cannot train you today.\n\n<Your trainer's voice lowers to a whisper.>\n\nThe Kor'kron watches our every move. Garrosh has the Valley of Spirits under his thumb.\n\nYou want to help? Find Vol'jin. He will know what to do."]="现在不行，$c。我今天没法训练你。\n\n<你的训练师压低嗓门，悄声说道。>\n\n库卡隆正盯着我们的一举一动。加尔鲁什已经控制了精神谷。\n\n你想帮忙？那就去找沃金吧。他知道该怎么办。"
G["Not now, $gpal:lady;.\n\nI gotta re-tune the boss' shredder.\n\nShe don't like movin' around the city on foot like any old chump, ESPECIALLY if she's gotta go deal with the warchief."]="Ahora no, colega.\n\nTengo que volver a poner a punto la trituradora de la jefa.\n\nNo le gusta tener que andar por la ciudad a pie como un si fuera una bobalicona, ESPECIALMENTE si tiene que hacer tratos con el Jefe de Guerra."
G["Not now, $n. The bank's been taken over for the time being.\n\nThe Kor'kron leader said that they won't be makin' any \"unauthorized withdrawals\", but... you might wanna check an' make sure."]="Ahora no, $n. El banco ha sido absorbido.\n\nEl líder Kor'kron dijo que no permitiría ninguna \"retirada no autorizada\", pero... pero puede que quieras asegurah'te y confirmarlo."
G["Not now, Mack. I be in no mood for your drunken pawing. Off with ya!"]="马克，别来烦我。我没心情和你这个醉鬼说话。离我远点！"
G["Not now, mortal.\n\nI am here on urgent business."]="现在不行，凡人。\n\n我到此地有重要的事要做。"
G["Not now.  Have you any tasks for me?"]="现在还不是时候。你有任务交给我吗？"
G["Not now. Leza needs all of my attention. She is three weeks early and something is very wrong."]="现在别来打搅我。我得全心全意照料莱莎。她早产三个星期，出了不小的问题。"
G["Not on your life!"]="你这辈子别想了！"
G["Not one of you will live to see the final cataclysm! Finish them!"]="你们没人能活着看到真正的大灾变！杀掉他们！"
G["Not one step closer, ogre!"]="不要过来，食人魔！"
G["Not one word...."]="一言不发……"
G["Not only am I havin' all the mithril bars I be needin', but all the Horde collections are done now mon. It's lookin' like we just waitin' on the Alliance and then we be goin' to war!"]="我们不仅集齐了秘银锭，还完成了部落的所有收集任务。似乎我们只需等待联盟完成他们的任务，就能开战了！"
G["Not only haf you led me right to zhe coffer, but you haf removed its protektions!"]="你不仅让我找到了这个箱子，还去除了它的保护！"
G["Not quick enough!"]="还不够快！"
G["Not quite so sure of yourself without the Purifier, hm?"]="净化者德尔格伦不在的时候你好像不太自信，不是吗？"
G["Not quite, old friend. Times have changed. The line between friend and foe is not so clear."]="不一样了，老朋友。时代不同了。敌友间的界限已不再清晰。"
G["Not quite.  We shall need a great many offerings of sacrifice before the Herald of the Old Gods roams the land again."]="还没有，我们还需要大量的祭品才能让上古之神的使者重新降临这片大地。"
G["Not really much of a \"group\" anymore, is it?"]="Ya no queda mucho del \"grupo\", ¿eh?"
G["Not really."]="不完全是这样。"
G["Not right now, $gpal:sugar;... I got things to do. See ya around."]="Ahora no, $gtío:cielo;... Tengo cosas que hacer. Nos vemos."
G["Not running this time, Jung Duk?"]="这次不跑了吗，江达克？"
G["Not safe here, slave thing. This big-tongue home."]="奴隶，这里很不安全。这里是大舌头怪的老窝。"
G["Not see these very much. That fine though, it not very pretty."]="我都没怎么见过。虽然不够漂亮，但是还将就吧。"
G["Not so brash now, are you?"]="你现在怎么不那么嚣张了啊？"
G["Not so fast!"]="别高兴得太早！"
G["Not so fast! Save some for me, mon!"]="别那么快！给我留点，兄弟！"
G["Not so fast, $g guy : lady;... I'll not be handing out the reigns of a mighty ram steed to someone that's not a proven ally of the dwarves of Ironforge.  Once you've been recognized as exalted to Ironforge, I'll gladly show you what varieties of rams I have for sale."]="No tan rápido, $gchico:chica;... No entregaré las riendas de un poderoso corcel a alguien que no haya demostrado ser un aliado de los enanos de Forjaz. Cuando Forjaz te reconozca como $gexaltado:exaltada;, te mostraré encantado la variedad de carneros que tengo a la venta."
G["Not so fast, $g guy : lady;... I'll not be handing out the reigns of a mighty ram steed to someone that's not a proven ally of the dwarves of Ironforge.  Once you've been recognized as friendly to Ironforge, I'll gladly show you what varieties of rams I have for sale."]="No tan deprisa, $gmuchacho:muchacha;... No iré repartiendo por ahí el mando de un poderoso carnero de montar a alguien que no es considerado aliado de los enanos de Forjaz. Cuando tu reputación sea de $gamistoso:amistosa; con Forjaz, estaré encantado de mostrarte toda mi variedad de carneros."
G["Not so fast, $r!\n\nOnly champions of Ironforge can purchase what I got ta offer."]="急什么呢，$r！\n\n只有铁炉堡的勇士才有资格从我这里购买物品。"
G["Not so fast, Schnottz!"]="没这么快，司克诺兹！"
G["Not so fast, Son of Durotan! You and your allies have certainly set us back, but the Hour of Twilight CANNOT be averted!"]="没那么快，杜隆坦之子！你和你的盟友的确阻碍了我们，但暮光审判日是不可避免的！"
G["Not so fast, bearface. First I need a foot-rub."]="别着急，熊脸丑八怪。首先，我需要来次足浴。"
G["Not so fast, little troll!"]="没有这么快，小巨魔！"
G["Not so fast, matey. Yer on my turf!"]="No tan rápido, $gchaval:chavala;. ¡Este es mi territorio!"
G["Not so fast, wet guy!"]="别这么快，疯家伙！"
G["Not so fast."]="别这么快。"
G["Not so fast. You're not dying on us just yet."]="别那么着急。你不会那么巧死在我们背上的。"
G["Not so fast..."]="稳住……"
G["Not so tough now!!"]="怎么，这就不行了？"
G["Not so tough now, are you? That's right. You look so dumb there laying on the ground. Don't make me make $p throw more barrels at you."]="现在狠不起来了，对吧？这就对了。你躺在地上的样子看上去傻透了。别逼我让$p再往你身上扔酒桶。"
G["Not sure how I got here. But... good fortune often finds the open minded."]="不知道我是怎么来到这的。但是……好运常常降临开明的人。"
G["Not sure how ol' Nass always finds his way back here. Must be by smell...."]="老纳斯每次都能找到回来的路，真是奇怪。肯定是靠闻的吧……"
G["Not sure how reading helps. Kekek can't read anyway, but if Hemet Nesingwary say, Kekek try."]="科科不知道阅读有什么用。科科不会阅读，但如果赫米特·奈辛瓦里要科科这样做，科科就会努力去做。"
G["Not sure how thing got here. Not matter if dead though."]="真不明白它怎么能捕杀那些多生物。不过反正它已经死了，威胁解除啦。"
G["Not sure if this is going to be good enough.  These aren't troggs we're trying to fool."]="不知道这是不是足够好了，我们要愚弄的人并不是傻瓜。"
G["Not sure if you notice, but there rumbling sometimes from the water in the big hole. I think there something down there."]="你有没有发现，洞穴中有时会传来隆隆声。一定有什么生物潜伏在里面。"
G["Not sure who told you I had some ale left, but keep it quiet will ya? There ain't no way I have enough for the whole camp."]="不管是谁告诉你我这里还有存货，请你务必替我保密。我可没法满足整座营地的需求。"
G["Not that I doubt your abilites, but I would like you to perform a task for me. Call it a demonstration of good faith..."]="我并非怀疑你的能力，但是我希望你为我执行一项任务，以此证明你的信念。"
G["Not that I'm quite sure that you could ever possibly in a gazillion years have enough stranglekelp, what with all the ice cream one needs, but we seem to have enough. Or that's what I'm told anyway. It looks like some of the others here might need help with whatever it is that they're collecting. Understandable really when you consider that theirs just couldn't possibly be as fun as collecting stranglekelp."]="我不是置疑你收集荆棘藻的能力，但是我们似乎已经拥有足够的荆棘藻了。至少我是这么听说的。这儿的其他人需要你帮忙收集战争物资。收集其他的作战物资可没有收集荆棘藻那么有趣，我能理解你这种想法。"
G["Not the 'stache! Now I'm asymmetrical!"]="我的胡子！两边不对称了！"
G["Not the ale!"]="我的啤酒！"
G["Not the face!"]="别打脸！"
G["Not the face! Not the face!"]="别打脸！别打脸啊！"
G["Not the face, not the face!"]="不要打脸，不要打脸！"
G["Not the face... Not the face!!!"]="不要打脸……不要打脸！！！"
G["Not the red wire, the blue one!"]="不是红色的线，是蓝色的！"
G["Not this nonsense again..."]="别又说废话啊……"
G["Not to worry, $c. With this barrier in place, the arakkoa cannot see me.\n\nI'm here on business."]="不用担心，$c，有了这道屏障，鸦人就看不见我了。\n\n我来这里是有公务在身的。"
G["Not to worry, $n, one of the gatherers found the outfit where you accidentally dropped it.\n\nHere, take it, but please be more careful. I'd hate for you to have to fight your way to Claximus and kill more of the Winterfin murlocs unnecessarily along the way."]="别担心，$n。我们帮你找到了那件意外丢失的鱼人服。\n\n喏，拿好了，千万要小心哦。再搞丢的话，你还得消灭更多的冬鳞鱼人才能杀回克拉西姆斯的巢穴。我可不愿意让你再费这么大劲。"
G["Not to worry, I'll make this quick."]="不用担心，速战速决。"
G["Not to worry, my pretties, we'll soon be flying high again."]="宝贝儿，别担心啦，我们很快就要大功告成了。"
G["Not to worry. I'm far from finished with you."]="别急。我跟你还没完呢。"
G["Not to worry. The little fellas seem to have found their way back here. Here you go."]="别担心。小家伙们似乎已经找到回来的路了。去吧。"
G["Not to worry. These little fellas seem to have found their way back here."]="别担心。这些小家伙似乎已经找到回来的路了。"
G["Not today, little one. We have errands to run."]="今天不行，小家伙。我们有任务在身。"
G["Not today, senior scrivener!"]="今天不行，首席抄写员！"
G["Not too clever are you?  Hmm, if I were a stable master perhaps I might be in the vicinity of say, the stable?  Look for Morganus over there."]="你不算太聪明吧？嗯，如果我是兽栏管理员的话，我应该是在马厩附近吧？去那边找莫加努斯吧。"
G["Not too shabby. Looks like you've got room for more fields there, too."]="不算太糟。看来你在那边还能多耕出几块地来。"
G["Not tossing boulders at us anymore, are ya?"]="别再朝我们扔石头了，好不？"
G["Not unless you're some kind of super-person.  And don't kid yourself, you're not."]="No, a menos que seas $gun superhéroe:una superheroína;. Y no te engañes, no lo eres."
G["Not wasted, Stonemother.  It has been very useful."]="这不是浪费，石母。它派上了不小的用场。"
G["Not what I had... planned."]="这……这可不在计划……之内……"
G["Not what Keever was hoping for. Keever may have added too much earthroot. Let's see if the second serum will do what Keever needs."]="不是基佛想要的结果。基佛可能加了太多的地根草。我们来看一下第二份药水是不是基佛所需要的。"
G["Not while Leza is in labor. We must wait."]="莱莎还在临产的时候可不行。我们还得等等。"
G["Not work so good for not birdies!"]="这玩意好像对鸦人之外的生物不起作用！"
G["Not yet, Ymiron, I have other plans for you. You will serve me better within Utgarde Pinnacle. And if these insects survive to find you again, you will get the chance to avenge your wife."]="不要着急，伊米隆。我对你另有安排。你先回到乌特加德之巅去，在那里更好地为我效劳。如果真有这些蝼蚁再次找上你的那一天，到时你就可以亲自为妻子复仇了。"
G["Not yet... not ye--"]="我……还没……还没……"
G["Not you, moron! The other imbecile."]="不是你，蠢货！我说的是另一个白痴。"
G["Not--caww--get in way of--rrak-rrak--flee!"]="不要……呱呱……挡我……呱呱……去路！"
G["Not... fair..."]="这……不……公平……"
G["Not... my best... day."]="不是……我最好的……日子。"
G["Not... no... Our people... Wyrmskull... some live..."]="不……不……龙颅村……还有……幸存者……"
G["Not... over... yet."]="没……完……呢。"
G["Notch your arrows, men..."]="弟兄们，准备好你们的箭……"
G["Note the weak binding structure of this one. Be sure to finish your incantations or this is what you will end up with."]="看看这东西不牢靠的结构。你一定要念完咒语，否则你就只能召唤出这样的东西来。"
G["Note to self: Build parascope."]="提醒自己：造一个示波器。"
G["Note to self: Cannon highly effective against flesh."]="我得记下来：火炮对血肉之躯非常有效。"
G["Note to self: Don't get on Amber's bad side."]="我得提醒自己：绝对不要惹恼安玻。"
G["Noted.  Return to the conflict areas.  Concentrate our outfield efforts on procuring more victims of the zombie plague."]="知道了。立即返回战争区域。我们的战略目标是尽可能多地搭救那些感染的受害者。"
G["Noth, where is Heigan?"]="诺斯，希尔盖呢？"
G["Nothin' finer than enjoying a fine beverage and the company of some fine buckos... hic!"]="和好朋友坐在一起分享美酒，还有什么能比得上这样的惬意呢……嗝儿！"
G["Nothin' ta see here, mon.  Be on yer way, why don'cha?"]="这里没什么可看的，朋友。为什么不到别处去逛逛？"
G["Nothin' to see here... move along!"]="这儿没什么好看的……走开！"
G["Nothin' will warm your belly like a cup of caraway burnwine. Buy it here!"]="没有什么能比一杯茴香烈酒更暖胃啦。来这里购买吧！"
G["Nothing beats the bold bite of Greenstone Brew!"]="绿石佳酿，一口难忘！"
G["Nothing beats the sound of a twin-carb, fork-ring steam engine burning pure firestone!"]="没有什么声音能比双缸蒸汽坦克开动时的动静更大了！"
G["Nothing biting. . . ."]="没有鱼上钩……"
G["Nothing but ash!"]="只留灰烬！"
G["Nothing but trouble in these parts. I tried to tell that fool Saldean to get out while he still could be he won't hear of it. But I ain't no fool. Verna and I are gonna mosey on out as soon as we get this wagon fixed."]="Solo problemas por estos pagos. Intenté advertir a ese idiota Saldean que se marchara mientras aún pudiera, pero no quiso escuchar. Pero yo no soy un tonto. Verna y yo nos vamos a movernos hacia fuera tan pronto como arreglemos este carro."
G["Nothing can stop me now!"]="现在没有任何东西可以阻止我了！"
G["Nothing can stop our Rank 10 champion brawler, $N!"]="¡Nadie puede detener a $gnuestro:nuestra; contendiente de rango 10, $N!"
G["Nothing can stop the Scourge!  Nothing!"]="没有人能阻止天灾军团！没有人！"
G["Nothing can stop the wrath of the Banshee Queen."]="任何人都无法阻挡女妖之王的怒火。"
G["Nothing compares to my magnificent muffins!"]="没有什么食品能和我这些华丽的松饼相比！"
G["Nothing could have kept me away from here, Darion. Not from my home and family."]="没有什么能够阻止我回家，达里安。我绝不会离开自己的家乡和亲人。"
G["Nothing frees the spirit like soaring through the sky.  There is such a place in our great tribal center Thunder Bluff.  The road north out of Bloodhoof Village will guide you there.  Once you ride the elevator to the top speak with one of the Bluffwatchers who can give you further directions."]="只有在天空自由翱翔时，灵魂才能得到真正的解脱。在我们伟大的部落中心雷霆崖就有这样一块地方。血蹄村外以北的道路就通往那儿。一旦你乘坐升降梯到达高处，就找雷霆崖守卫谈谈，他会做出进一步的指引。"
G["Nothing frees the spirit like soaring through the sky.  You may speak with Tak, the Wind Rider Master, in the center of the village, if you wish to soar through the air."]="在空中翱翔的自由是没有任何东西能与之相比的。如果你想飞上天空，可以和村子中央的双足飞龙管理员塔克聊聊。"
G["Nothing gets your blood flowing quite like a long, slow walk."]="没什么能比长长的慢速步行更能促进血液循环了。"
G["Nothing goes to waste..."]="一点儿也不浪费……"
G["Nothing good has come from that dreadful place."]="那鬼地方没出过什么好东西。"
G["Nothing heals like a fistful of needles."]="没有什么东西能比针灸的疗效更好啦。"
G["Nothing here. Keep moving."]="这里没有。继续前进。"
G["Nothing in all of the elemental planes will stop me from killing you once I get out of these chains, Bouldergut!"]="等我挣脱这些锁链，元素位面中没有任何力量能阻止我杀了你，石胆！"
G["Nothing is ever going to change."]="什么都没有改变。"
G["Nothing is free, $r. You want hops, you need to work."]="天下没有免费的午餐，$r。想要啤酒花，你就得出点力。"
G["Nothing is happening... something must be preventing me from speaking with her."]="什么都没有发生……一定有东西在阻止我与她交流。"
G["Nothing is wasted in the process. You will see...."]="一切都不会被浪费的。看着吧……"
G["Nothing keeps a fleet of combustible dirigibles safer than randomly flinging molten metal in every conceivable direction!"]="朝各个方向随机掷出熔融金属，只有这样才能让一支由易燃飞船组成的舰队确保绝对安全！"
G["Nothing lasts forever, $p"]="没有什么是永恒的，$p。"
G["Nothing like a fresh harvest of vegetables for your soup."]="没什么能比这新鲜蔬菜更适合你的汤了。"
G["Nothing like a good evening to fish!"]="没什么比一个适合钓鱼的晚上更让我开心的了！"
G["Nothing like a homemade roast! Delicious!"]="一点也不像是自己烤的！好吃！"
G["Nothing like a roaring fire on a cool night with good friends and dwarven ale."]="喝着啤酒和好朋友围坐在火堆旁边可真是一件乐事。"
G["Nothing like a tankard full to wash down one of my magnificent muffins."]="喝一口啤酒，吃一口我的松饼，真是人生的一大享受啊。"
G["Nothing like a warm day and no ol' lady to yell at ya..."]="在这样温暖的日子里没有老婆在耳边大吵大闹，这真是太好了……"
G["Nothing like feeling the wind in your hair! Make sure you wear some goggles though, I bet those Iron dwarves are going to be made into a bit of a mess."]="风掠过头发的感觉真是酷毙了！不过你最好戴上护目镜。我敢打赌，那些铁矮人一定会被你吓得乱作一团。"
G["Nothing like peace an quiet... unlike home!"]="没有什么比安安静静地更好了，家里太吵了！"
G["Nothing like spending a day down at Crystal Lake fishing. Arnold Leland is the man that taught me. You can usually find him out on the dock in the Canal District just fishing the day away. \nOh, and don't believe any of the stories he tells you about monsters in the canals either."]="No hay nada como pasar un día pescando en el Lago de Cristal. Arnold Leland es quien me enseñó. Suele estar en el muelle del Distrito del Canal, pescando durante todo el día. \n\nAh, y no le creas ninguna de las historias que cuenta sobre monstruos en los canales."
G["Nothing made by pandaren hands can withstand me."]="熊猫人双手创造出的一切都抵挡不了我的额头。"
G["Nothing more than dust in the wind."]="不过是风尘中的沙土。"
G["Nothing must befoul the gardens! You must be destroyed!"]="花园绝不能被弄脏！你死定了！"
G["Nothing new here."]="没什么新鲜事。"
G["Nothing on this one."]="这只没有。"
G["Nothing personal."]="我们其实没有个人恩怨。"
G["Nothing personal. We're just a little tired of being pushed out of our homes. Now it's our turn to push back."]="无关私人恩怨。我们只是对那种被驱逐出家园的日子感到有些厌倦。现在轮到我们反击了。"
G["Nothing quite like the feel of something dead rubbing up against you.  You can find Shelene Rhobart by heading southeast on the road out of town, and then going east at the intersection.  She's at a small camp there not too far along the road."]="接近尸体时的感觉是独一无二的。你可以沿着城镇外东南方面的道路前进，到达十字路口后向东走，找到舍伦尼·洛巴尔特。她居住在离道路不远处的小营帐中。"
G["Nothing says \"Hallow's End is here\" more than a ride on a broomstick."]="还有什么事儿能比骑魔法扫帚更能说明“嘿，万圣节到了”呢。"
G["Nothing seems to happen.  The plague cauldron may be ruined, but it certainly doesn't look any different.  What will you do?"]="似乎什么事都没有发生。天灾之锅也许已经被毁掉了，但它看上去的确和以前没什么两样。你要怎样做？"
G["Nothing shall stop the engine of creation!"]="创造之源，所向披靡！"
G["Nothing shall stop us!"]="谁也不能阻止我们！"
G["Nothing short of total decimation will suffice."]="只有把你们全部消灭才能解恨。"
G["Nothing stands against me."]="我是所向无敌的。"
G["Nothing surprising there.  Come back with some real news, will you?"]="没什么异常。有新消息的时候再来吧。"
G["Nothing terribly invasive?"]="不会造成严重损伤的？"
G["Nothing that you say will convince me to give up such power!"]="说什么我也不会放弃这种力量！"
G["Nothing to offer, except your backs and your shovels.  So you will dig."]="没有任何奉献，除了你们的力气和铲子。所以你们就用力挖吧。"
G["Nothing to see here! Let's keep going!"]="这里没什么好看的了！继续前进！"
G["Nothing to see here. Move along."]="没什么好看的。走开。"
G["Nothing warms my bones like this trusty southsea rum!"]="只有这种带劲的南海朗姆酒能让我的骨头暖和起来！"
G["Nothing will prevent your doom!"]="什么都无法阻止你的末日！"
G["Nothing will remain but a pile of ash!"]="除了灰烬，什么都不会剩下！"
G["Nothing will stand in the way of vengeance!"]="没人能阻止我复仇！"
G["Nothing will stop me from fulfilling my destiny!"]="任何事不能阻止我来实现我的命运！"
G["Nothing will stop me. Not even you, demon."]="什么也阻止不了我。连你也不行，恶魔。"
G["Nothing will stop us!  You will die!"]="没有什么可以阻止我们的！你死定了！"
G["Nothing wrong with a little drive-by fortitude!"]="随手丢个韧可是好习惯！"
G["Nothing you can do can compare to what Arugal can do to us!  I will tear you apart myself!"]="和阿鲁高比起来，你对我们的威慑力差得远了！我要将你撕成碎片！"
G["Nothing you can say will ever get me in the arena against that monstrosity of a machine you call a steam tank!"]="这世上根本就没有任何可以跟蒸汽坦克叫板的东西！"
G["Nothing! Nothing...."]="这不算什么！不算什么……"
G["Nothing's getting over this wall.\n\nThis is MY wall."]="谁也不能越过这道城墙。\n\n这是我的城墙。"
G["Nothing's going to catch you on this baby!"]="只要骑上这辆宝贝，谁也别想抓住你了！"
G["Nothing's working!"]="没有用！"
G["Nothing, honey. I'm just glad you're okay..."]="没什么，宝贝儿。我只是很高兴你一切都好……"
G["Nothing, nothing, we are nothing. The grasper touches our hearts and clenches his fist."]="虚无，虚无，我们化为虚无。执掌一切者握住我们的心灵，攥紧了他的拳头。"
G["Nothing, yet..."]="暂时还没做什么……"
G["Nothing."]="没有用。"
G["Nothing. My orders were to speak with you and then speak with Thrall. All I know is that Thrall is interested in saving your princess."]="没什么。我的任务是跟你谈谈，然后回去找萨尔。萨尔对营救公主的事情很有兴趣。"
G["Nothing. There is nothing that you can do while the Light binds you. It controls you wholly, shackling you to the ground with its virtues."]="什么也不能。你的能力受到圣光的局限，在这种情况下你什么都做不了。圣光完全控制了你，将你牢牢地束缚在它所能触及的范围之内。"
G["Nothing. Wanna help me whip up some frog leg stew?"]="没什么。有兴趣帮我炖青蛙腿吗？"
G["Notices of bounties and job openings are posted here."]="这里发布着各类悬赏和工作机会的布告。"
G["Notices of reward for the naga leaders of the Darkcrest and Bloodscale tribes are listed here."]="暗潮纳迦氏族和血鳞纳迦氏族首领的悬赏布告被列在这里。"
G["Notices of reward for the naga leaders of the Darkcrest and Bloodscale tribes are listed here.  They both sound extremely dangerous, perhaps you should check again later."]="暗潮纳迦氏族和血鳞纳迦氏族首领的悬赏布告被列在这里。听说他们两个都非常危险，也许你应该以后再去看看。"
G["Notify me when you are ready to listen to the story."]="Avísame cuando estés $gpreparado:preparada; para oír la historia."
G["Noting can save you, beasties! Dis be Scourge land now!"]="谁也救不了你们！这片土地现在归天灾军团了！"
G["Now - to the business of winning this war!\n\nAcross the scarred terrain to the east, the Alliance hopes to build an overland link between their coastal strongholds. They think to build a fortress here, in the center of the Barrens. In the center of MY Barrens.\n\nIt will not stand."]="现在，我们要赢得这场战争！\n\n越过这片满目疮痍的地区向东，联盟希望在他们的海岸要塞之间建立起陆上连接。他们想要在这里，在贫瘠之地的正中心建立一座堡垒。但这是我的贫瘠之地。\n\n我绝不会允许那座堡垒出现。"
G["Now DIE!"]="去死吧！"
G["Now GO! Use me boon wisely."]="去吧！谨慎使用我的恩惠。"
G["Now I am complete!"]="啊，如此强大的力量！"
G["Now I can really get this party started!"]="酒来了才算是聚会嘛！"
G["Now I can return with dignity!"]="现在我可以带着尊严回去了！"
G["Now I entrust you with an even greater responsibility."]="而我会给予你一个更加伟大的责任。"
G["Now I feel better. Let's get back to Ratchet. Come on, $n."]="现在我感觉好多了。让我们返回棘齿城吧，$n。"
G["Now I have what is required. Let us continue."]="现在我有了必需的东西，继续进行下一步吧。"
G["Now I know where your allegiances lie, $n!"]="我现在知道你在为谁效命了，$n！"
G["Now I see why the Darkspear are fighting back!"]="现在我明白暗矛部族为什么会反抗了！"
G["Now I stand, the lion before the lambs... and they do not fear."]="我如同羊群前的雄狮，但它们不畏惧我。"
G["Now I wish I had stayed awake during those defense lessons at the monastery when I was a cub."]="我现在真希望自己年少在禅院里受训时，没在防御课上打瞌睡。"
G["Now I'll show you the REAL power of the Onslaught!"]="我会让你们见识见识先锋军的真正实力！"
G["Now I'm coming for you, Exarch!"]="来吧，主教！"
G["Now I'm getting annoyed."]="现在我可真有点火了。"
G["Now I'm gonna give you to the count of '3' to get out of here before I sick the dogs on you."]="在我数到“3”之前，滚出这里，否则小心我放狗咬你。"
G["Now I'm really angry!"]="这下我真的生气了！"
G["Now I'm really angry."]="我可真的生气了。"
G["Now I'm the one who feels rough around the edges, I honestly don't think there's anything left I can teach you. But you know who can? Bengus Deepforge in Ironforge, now there's a dwarf that knows his steel. Go look him up in The Great Forge of Ironforge, see if he's up to having a new trainee under him."]="现在我真是力不从心了，我说实话真是没什么可教你的了。但你知道谁可以吗？铁炉堡的本古斯·深炉，现在有一个矮人很了解他。到铁炉堡的大铁炉去找他，看看他是否想收个新学徒。"
G["Now Ken-Ken! Like we planned!"]="现在轮到肯肯了！和我们计划的一样！"
G["Now Shen-zin Su is ill, and we are all in danger. With the help of the elements, you will break the silence. You will speak to him."]="现在，神真子病了，我们都处在危险之中。有了元素之灵的帮助，你将打破这种沉默，聆听它的诉说。"
G["Now THAT was a fine display of harpoonery!"]="现在那里是一片和睦气象！"
G["Now THAT'S what I was looking for! You've given me a reason to train again."]="这才是我所期盼的！你给了我一个很好的理由继续刻苦训练。"
G["Now THAT's more like it!"]="这才像话嘛！"
G["Now THAT's what I call oomph!  I wish all our potions did this!"]="那才叫做吸引力！我希望我们所有的药水都能产生那样的效果！"
G["Now THIS is a discovery!"]="这可是个重大发现！"
G["Now THIS is a sport!"]="让我们较量一下吧！"
G["Now THIS is what I call profit skimming. HEY! You missed some, over there."]="这就是我所说的利润精华。嗨！你漏掉了一些，就在那里。"
G["Now all Sons of Gruul dead!  Now new $g king : queen; lead all ogres to Ogri'la!"]="¡Ahora todos los hijos de Gruul muertos! ¡Ahora $g el : la; $g nuevo: nueva; $g rey : reina; guiar a todos los ogros a Ogri'la!"
G["Now all you have to do is wait! Most crops are ready the day after they start growing.\n\nAren't we lucky to have land in such a fruitful valley?"]="现在你该做的就是等！大多数农作物在开始生长之后的第二天就成熟了。\n\n在这样肥沃的山谷里拥有一块土地不是很幸运的事吗？"
G["Now at least the demons will no longer corrupt the forests. But, if I claim this power as my own, I will become stronger than any of Archimonde's lieutenants."]="现在，至少恶魔们不会再腐蚀森林了。但如果我能够掌握这种力量，我将比阿克蒙德的任何部下都更加强大。"
G["Now be silent and note where you are, lest I inform Lord Fordring and his knights that you are no longer here on amicable terms. I am certain he would take great pleasure in seeing to your 'atonement.'"]="Y ahora permanece en silencio y ten en cuenta dónde estás. De lo contrario, advertiré a Lord Vadín y a sus caballeros de que ya no eres bien recibida aquí. Estoy seguro de que disfrutará viendo tu \"expiación\"."
G["Now blow me a kiss while you stand on the big carrot!"]="你现在站在这根大胡萝卜上，给我个飞吻吧！"
G["Now bow to me."]="向我鞠躬。"
G["Now children stop that!  I mean it!"]="孩子们，停下来！别闹了！"
G["Now click on the seated customer to deliver them their noodle soup."]="现在，点击入座的客人，把汤面给他们送过去吧。"
G["Now comes our chance at redemption, Jadaar. We could become heroes through this tournament!"]="咸鱼翻身的时刻到了，亚达尔。这场比赛会让我们从此扬名立万！"
G["Now comes the hard part. Everyone stand back, precision is the key to the perfect Kun-Lai Kicker!"]="现在到了最难的部分。大家都往后退，酿造完美的昆莱劲酒关键在于精度！"
G["Now dance together!"]="一起来跳舞吧！"
G["Now dat Sang'thraze is mine again, de only thing ya be findin' here...is ya own fresh grave."]="现在，桑萨斯终于又是我的了。而你只能在这里找到……你新鲜的坟墓。"
G["Now dat it looks like de Darkspear be returnin' to these isles, maybe de time has come for us to reveal ourselves."]="看样子，暗矛部族正在返回这些岛屿。也许我们现身的时候到了。"
G["Now do you see, Helcular? Do you doubt the power? I control life!"]="现在你看到了吗，赫尔库拉？你还会怀疑我的力量吗？我控制着生命！"
G["Now do you see? Do you?!"]="你明白了吗？明白了吗？！"
G["Now don't move if you ever want to walk again!"]="如果你还想走路的话，就别乱动。"
G["Now don't you be thinkin' about tryin' to make off with me baby murlocs! I got the eyes of a hawk and ears like... ears like... like somethin' with mighty powerful ears!"]="别妄想把我的鱼人宝宝从我身边夺走！我有鹰的眼睛和像……像……有着强大力量的什么东西的耳朵！"
G["Now eat the carrot!"]="现在吃掉那根胡萝卜！"
G["Now entering the arena, we have a very talented $c. Say hello to $n, a Rank 5 brawler!"]="Y ahora entra en la arena $gun:una; $c de gran talento. ¡Saludad a $n, $gun:una; camorrista de rango 5!"
G["Now entering the arena: $n!"]="现在进入竞技场的是：$n！"
G["Now entering the arena: You know $ghim:her;. You love $ghim:her;. Give it up for our Rank 8 Brawler, $N!!"]="Y $gel:la; siguiente combatiente... $gLo:La; conocéis. $gLo:La; amáis. ¡Un fuerte aplauso para $gnuestro:nuestra; camorrista de nivel 8, $N!"
G["Now entering the arena: a Rank 1 $r $c, $n! $n is pretty new around here, so go easy!"]="Y ahora entra en la arena $gun:una; $r $c de rango 1... ¡$n! $n acaba de empezar, ¡así que tened paciencia!"
G["Now entering the arena: a returning champion. Our Rank 7 $c, $n!"]="Y ahora vuelve a la arena $gun gran campeón:una gran campeona;: ¡$n, $gnuestro:nuestra; $c de rango 7!"
G["Now entering the arena: an up-and coming Rank 2 $c, $n!"]="Y ahora: $gun prometedor:una prometedora; $c de rango 2... ¡$n!"
G["Now fight me, $n! Kill Iskalder!"]="来战，$n！杀死伊斯卡德尔！"
G["Now for a real pet."]="来看看真正的宠物吧。"
G["Now for that snack..."]="现在可以吃了……"
G["Now for the next race, the car will be even FASTER than before!"]="在下一次比赛中，这辆车将会比以前更快！"
G["Now get out of my way, it's time to send the Burning Legion back to the nether!!"]="给我走开，该是把燃烧军团送回虚空去的时候了！！"
G["Now get out there and make some noodle soup!"]="现在，快去煮汤面吧！"
G["Now get over here and pop his bubble, $p!"]="$p，现在到这里来，戳破他的泡泡！"
G["Now get us some real eggs."]="现在给我们找些真正的蛋来。"
G["Now get your minds right! We'll be killing orcs within the hour."]="集中精神！很快就要和兽人交手了。"
G["Now go back home where you belong!"]="回到属于你们自己的地方去！"
G["Now go, and use what you've learned. If you ever wish to have the fel energy purged from you, or reabsorb some of Kanrethad's, talk to me. I'll be at the Altar of Damnation in Shadowmoon Valley, keeping him banished."]="去吧，好好利用你所学到的一切。如果你想净化体内的邪能，或者重新吸收坎雷萨德的力量，就跟我谈谈。我会待在影月谷的诅咒祭坛，确保他被放逐。"
G["Now go, impart my techniques to the initiates."]="现在，把我的技术传授给新人。"
G["Now go, my friend. Thank you."]="走吧，朋友。谢谢你。"
G["Now hold yer breeks. The zeppelin will take a minute or so to pull around."]="抓紧了。飞艇将在片刻之后抵达。"
G["Now how am I supposed to get those mechanical wretches out of my fields?"]="我怎么才能把这些机械怪物赶出我的农田啊？"
G["Now if I were Innkeeper Renee where might I be?  Hmmm?  Oh, perhaps inside the Gallows' End Tavern.  Yes, that's it, I'm sure of it.  Try the southeast end of Brill... think you can find that?"]="如果我是旅店老板瑞尼的话，我可能在哪儿？嗯？哦，也许在恐惧之末旅店中。是的，是那儿，我敢肯定。试着去布瑞尔的东南角……你认为自己能找到他吗？"
G["Now if I were a dwarf I would just start randomly pushing buttons. But you and I are here for a purpose."]="现在，我可不会像个矮人那样乱搞一气。我们是有备而来的。"
G["Now if you turn to page 34 in your text, you see an illustration of a dwarf undergoing dissection..."]="如果你翻到34页的话，你会看见矮人被解剖的图片……"
G["Now is my chance!"]="机会来了！"
G["Now is not the time for idle chit-chat, squire $n.  We are in the middle of a quest."]="Ahora no es momento de parlotear, $gescudero:escudera;, $n. Estamos en medio de una misión."
G["Now is not the time for this, $p. Leave me in peace."]="我现在没空管这些，$p。别来打扰我。"
G["Now is the hour of twilight!"]="暮光审判降临了！"
G["Now is the time for revenge."]="报仇的时刻到了。"
G["Now is the time in which we pay homage to the birth of life, and the eggs are symbols representing the spring and rebirth. May you enjoy the spring."]="此刻，我们赞美生命的诞生，而彩蛋代表着春天和复苏。愿你度过一个美好的春天。"
G["Now is the time to attack!  For the Horde!"]="准备发动攻击！为部落而战！"
G["Now is the time to prove your allegiance to the Alliance. Please send whatever aid you can to New Thalanaar."]="现在到了证明你对联盟忠心的时候了。请派出任何你所能调派的人手前往新萨兰纳尔。"
G["Now is the time when the year is new and the moon shines bright.\n\nIt is our time... when the ancients awake."]="新的一年来临了，月光洒满大地。\n\n这是属于我们的日子……远古的生命苏醒了。"
G["Now is the time, Davil.  Now is the time of your death!"]="戴维，你的死期到了！"
G["Now is the time, Maiev!  Unleash your wrath!"]="时机到了，玛维！释放你的怒火吧！"
G["Now is the time, Maiev! Unleash your wrath!"]="时机到了，玛维！释放你的怒火吧！"
G["Now it is time for us to begin."]="现在该是开始的时候了。"
G["Now it's laundry."]="现在不得不清洗衣物了。"
G["Now it's time to brag about how utterly awesome I am."]="现在该侃一侃?是多么卓越啦。"
G["Now it's time to show my brother who the real master tamer is!"]="是时候让我兄弟看看，谁才是真正的驯宠大师！"
G["Now keep an eye out! I'll have this licked in two shakes of a--"]="嗯，你们帮我看着点外面。我这样的强者只要锤两下就能搞定这破烂……"
G["Now lay down your arms and surrender. We are not here to kill you. Not yet."]="现在，放下武器投降吧。我们来这里不是为了杀你。至少现在还不是。"
G["Now leave here, Crowley, and never return."]="现在你可以离开了，克罗雷，永远别再回来。"
G["Now leave me be. I see the Light...."]="现在，走吧，我已看到了圣光……"
G["Now let cheering dispel the twilight"]="现在，让欢呼驱散暮光"
G["Now let me tell you somethin' about knotty pine, it's got knots, $gson:missy;.\n\nAnd knots is just big holes in trees, which makes for a stupid rowboat and I blamed Whistler but he had his own ideas about my choice of tar (I chose to forget it) so we decided to settle it by drinking.\n\nWhen the grog ran out, that's when we had the knife fight. For sport.\n\nAnyways, we never made it to Menethil, and I'm pretty sure one or both of us drowned."]="现在，$g小子:姑娘;，让我和你说说那根长满瘤子的老松木吧。它的确是有很多瘤子和疖子。\n\n那些节瘤让松木上多了许多窟窿，用这种木材可做不出好的独木舟来。我要给它上面涂一层柏油，威斯利却不同意。所以我们决定用拼酒来达成一致。\n\n酒喝光了以后，我们开始抽出匕首来对打。当然，我们只是要比试一下。\n\n不管怎样，那艘松木船最后也没能到达米奈希尔港。我相信我们之中至少有一个人，或者两个人都溺水了。"
G["Now let us place this rare earth in my planter..."]="现在把这些稀土放到我的培养槽里去……"
G["Now let's give shootin' another try..."]="现在让我们再射一次试试……"
G["Now let's heat up these flakes..."]="现在让我们加热这些碎片……"
G["Now let's look for the herb."]="现在让我们去寻找药草吧。"
G["Now let's see what Bwemba's conjured up..."]="让我们看看布温巴召唤出了什么……"
G["Now let's try it..."]="现在让我们来试一试……"
G["Now listen here! That was simply uncalled for!"]="听着！你根本没理由踹我这一脚！"
G["Now look at me. Sweeping up after this dumb beast."]="瞧瞧我现在的模样。跟在这只蠢野兽的屁股后面打扫个没完。"
G["Now look at this... a jinyu and... what is that? Some sort of Beard-Sprite?"]="看看这个……一个锦鱼人和……这是什么东西？一个胡子精吗？"
G["Now look who's here. Heya, $n, bring us a pint and get o'er here!"]="看看现在谁在这儿。嘿呀，$n，给我们来瓶酒，到这里来！"
G["Now make ready, for soon we'll be ashore."]="现在做好准备。我们即将登岸。"
G["Now me crush you myself!"]="现在我要亲自解决你！"
G["Now me grow bigger and crush you!"]="现在我会变得更大，我会压碎你！"
G["Now move out! You must not keep the Banshee Queen waiting."]="现在就行动！绝不能让女妖之王等待。"
G["Now our Multi-Bombers can obliterate the Thermaplugg's shielded Tankbuster Cannons."]="现在多重轰炸机可以摧毁瑟玛普拉格的反坦克大炮护盾了。"
G["Now prove your worth!"]="现在是证明你们的价值的时候了！"
G["Now sit down and stand up lots of times in a row!"]="坐下，再站起来，这样连续做多次！"
G["Now stand up!"]="现在站起来！"
G["Now stay dead."]="去死吧。"
G["Now swim back with the knowledge I have granted you. Do what you can for them, $r."]="你的使命已经达成，游回去吧。尽你所能地帮助他们，$r。"
G["Now that $n is here, we won't need to worry about the Burning Legion any longer."]="有$n在，我们再也不用担心燃烧军团了。"
G["Now that I am at my full power I can perform Dream Funnel.  You can use it to heal other drakes, but it drains my health, so make sure you're using Leeching Poison too!"]="我已经具备全部力量，可以使用梦境通道了。你能利用它治疗其他幼龙，但这个技能会消耗我的生命值，因此必须与吸血之毒配合使用！"
G["Now that I am at my full power I can perform Martyr.  You can use it to protect other drakes, but I will take lots of damage, so make sure you're using Evasive Maneuvers too!"]="我已经具备全部力量，可以使用殉难了。你能利用它保护其他幼龙，但这会让我承受大量伤害，因此必须与闪避机动配合使用！"
G["Now that I am at my full power I can perform Temporal Rift.  You can use it to make enemies take extra damage and to get Shock Charges.  Save up Shock Charges and then Shock Lance for huge damage!"]="我已经具备全部力量，可以使用时间裂隙了。你能利用它对敌人造成额外的伤害并获得震击能量。积攒足够的能量后，再使用震击之枪造成大量伤害！"
G["Now that I have been reassembled, we can return to a time of perfection... the time of the Titans!"]="我再次复苏啦，这样我们就能回到那个完美的时代……泰坦的时代！"
G["Now that I'm free of training those miserable wretches, I'll entertain myself with you!"]="现在我有空来教训那些可怜虫了，让我来和你玩玩！"
G["Now that I've been beaten to within an inch of my life what do you want?"]="现在我被打得就差一口气了，你想要什么？"
G["Now that I've had my peek into the Vale, I gotta say, some o' this place feels a bit... familiar.\n\nI know it don't look like it, but I can't shake that feeling. What do you think that means!?"]="现在，我已经见过这个谷，我得说，这里有些地方感觉有点……熟悉。\n\n我知道，它并不像它，但我不能摆脱这种感觉。你认为那意味着什么！？"
G["Now that Ji-Lu has his trinkets back maybe I'll get some peace in the inn!"]="现在季禄拿回了他的那些小玩意儿，或许我能在旅馆里消停一会了！"
G["Now that Lady Sacrolash and Grand Warlock Alythess have been defeated, can you teleport me to the Witch's Sanctum."]="现在萨洛拉丝女王和高阶术士奥蕾塞丝都已经被打败了，你能把我传送到巫女密室吗？"
G["Now that is a sight for sore eyes!"]="久旱逢甘霖啊！"
G["Now that is hot."]="那可真够热的。"
G["Now that is what Zunta be talkin' about!"]="祖塔意料之中！"
G["Now that that's out of the way, welcome to the Isle of Quel'Danas. The Sunwell's on the plateau to the south, and Prince Kael'thas is holed up in the Magisters' Terrace to the east."]="既然没人有异议，欢迎来到奎尔丹纳斯岛。太阳之井就在南边的高地上，而凯尔萨斯王子则躲藏在东面的魔导师平台里。"
G["Now that the Frostwolf general is defeated, we can spare some troops to guard the entrance to Winterax Hold.\n\nBut stay vigilant!  We must always be on the lookout for Horde interlopers.."]="现在霜狼氏族的将军被击败了，我们可以派出一些军队来驻守冰斧要塞。\n\n但是我们还是要保持警惕！我们要小心那些部落的入侵者……"
G["Now that the Stormpike general is defeated, we can spare a few troops to guard Winterax Hold.  But we must be ever vigilant, $c, for the Alliance will return.\n\nWhen you find them skulking about, teach them another lesson!"]="现在雷矛部族的将军被击败了，我们可以派出一些军队来驻守冰斧要塞。但是我们还是要保持警惕，$c，联盟会回来的。\n\n当你在周围看到他们在偷偷摸摸活动的时候，好好教训他们一下吧！"
G["Now that the coast is clear..."]="现在海岸清晰可见……"
G["Now that the demons have been dealt with, we can proceed with the establishment of a new base here."]="现在那些恶魔已经被解决了，我们可以在这里建立一座新的基地了。"
G["Now that the deserters have taken over Lost Point, North Point Tower is the most distant of Theramore's outposts."]="目前逃亡者占领了废弃哨塔，所以北点哨塔成为距离塞拉摩岛最远的岗哨。"
G["Now that the flasks are ready, we can show the Skyguard our moves!"]="合剂都准备妥当了，我们要让天空卫队看看我们的决心。"
G["Now that the rude interruption is over, as I was saying, Quagmirran is nearby!\n\nAs promised, I can fortify you with a magical boon that should aid you in your fight with him."]="现在终于安全了，就像我刚才所说的那样，夸格米拉就在附近！\n\n我说到做到，现在我可以给你施加一个强化魔法，应该可以在你和他的战斗中帮到你。"
G["Now that the show's done, can someone run me through Scarlet Monestary?"]="现在表演结束了，有人可以带我去刷血色修道院吗？"
G["Now that the soup is made, pick it up by clicking on it. Soups will go bad if left out too long so only make what you need for your customers."]="汤面做好了，现在，点击拿起它吧。如果放置太久，汤面就会坏掉。所以，你一定要按照客人的需求来煮面。"
G["Now that the unpleasantness is finished with, let's talk about you dealing with Grand Admiral Westwind."]="事情总算有了眉目，那么就让我们谈谈要如何对付巴利·韦斯温元帅吧。"
G["Now that the war is in full swing, we've had no shortage of able-bodied combatants from the Horde and Alliance.\n\nIf only we could keep them off of each other's throats..."]="战争犹如箭在弦上，蓄势待发；部落和联盟都有着无数强大的勇士。\n\n但愿他们不会互相争斗……"
G["Now that was really unnecessary."]="这次可真有点过分了。"
G["Now that we are besties, I must tell you that your outfit is... just to die for!"]="Ahora que somos mejores $gamigos:amigas;, tengo que decirte que tu conjunto es... ¡para morirse!"
G["Now that we are friends, I must tell you that your outfit is... hideous."]="Ahora que somos $gamigos:amigas;, debo decirte que tu conjunto es... espantoso."
G["Now that we are good friends, I must tell you that your outfit is... atrocious."]="Ahora que somos $gbuenos amigos:buenas amigas;, debo decirte que tu conjunto es... horrible."
G["Now that we have Freewind Post, all that's left is that stupid barge. Gnome and goblins. How sad your people are."]="既然我们已经占领了乱风岗，现在就只剩下那艘愚蠢的驳船。侏儒与地精。你们这些人是多么的可怜。"
G["Now that we have captured this wretched isle, we need to do some work to get it into shape.  Can you help us out $n?"]="既然我们已经夺取了这座该死的岛屿，我们就得做些什么来让它变得像模像样。你能帮帮我们吗，$n？"
G["Now that we have taken the island back, it's time to get to work.  Talk to me again when you are ready to help."]="Ahora que hemos recuperado la isla, es el momento de ponerse manos a la obra. Habla conmigo de nuevo cuando estés $glisto:lista; para ayudar."
G["Now that we're acquaintances, $n, let me give you a tip. Folks 'round here can help spruce up your farm, but you gotta become friends with them first. Make friends by helping them out with daily tasks, or by giving them gifts like the one you just gave me."]="既然我们已经是熟人了，$n，那我就给你点提示吧。这附近的村民能帮你装扮农场，但你得先跟他们成为朋友才行。你可以帮他们完成日常任务，或送他们些小礼品——就像你刚才给我的那个，这样就能和他们建立友谊。"
G["Now that we're acquaintances, $n, let me give you a tip. Folks 'round here can help spruce up your farm, but you gotta become friends. Unfortunately, you're too green to help them out or give gifts yet, so get stronger first!"]="既然我们已经是熟人了，$n，那我就给你点提示吧。这附近的村民能帮你装扮农场，但你得先跟他们成为朋友才行。遗憾的是，你现在还无力帮助他们或赠送礼物，先把自己变强吧！"
G["Now that we're best friends, I have a confession to make. I... I think I quite fancy Farmer Fung. But then again, Farmer Yoon has nice eyes, don't you think?\n\nOh, I just can't decide!"]="Ahora que somos mejores $gamigos:amigas;, tengo que confesarte una cosa. Creo... creo que me gusta bastante el granjero Fung. Por otra parte, el granjero Yoon tiene ojos bonitos, ¿no te parece?\n\n¡Uff, es que no me decido!"
G["Now that we're friends, I have a confession to make. I... I think I quite fancy Farmer Fung."]="Ahora que somos $gamigos:amigas;, tengo que confesarte una cosa. Creo... creo que me gusta bastante el granjero Fung."
G["Now that we're friends, you can call me Fish.\n\nHa ha! I'm so funny!\n\nI'm jus' kidding... everyone calls me Fish! That's cuz everyone's my friend!"]="Ahora que somos $gamigos:amigas; puedes llamarme Pez.\n\n¡Ja, ja! ¡Qué graciosa soy!\n\nEs broma... ¡todo el mundo me llama Pez! ¡Es que todo el mundo es amigo mío!"
G["Now that we're good friends, I have a confession to make. I... I think I quite fancy Farmer Fung. But then again, Farmer Yoon has nice eyes, don't you think?"]="Ahora que somos $gbuenos amigos:buenas amigas;, tengo que confesarte una cosa. Creo... creo que me gusta bastante el granjero Fung. Por otra parte, el granjero Yoon tiene ojos bonitos, ¿no te parece?"
G["Now that we're neighbors, I've decided to give you the best gift a neighbor can just about give to anybody! I'm going to give you one of my prized yaks! I'll swing on by later and leave 'er in your pen."]="既然我们现在是邻居了，我决定送你一个作为邻居所能送出的最好的礼物！我打算送你一头珍贵的牦牛！我一会儿就把它送到你的围栏里。"
G["Now that we're neighbors, you have to tell me your farming secrets. Do you use fertilizer? Growth spray? Weedkiller? Tell me, already!"]="既然我们现在成邻居了，你得告诉我你的务农小秘密。你用化肥了？增长素？除草剂？快告诉我嘛！"
G["Now that you have bested me, test your skills against each other!  Take control of either king to begin play."]="现在你遇到了我，让我们看看谁的棋艺更加优秀吧！控制国王便可开始棋局。"
G["Now that you have completed the Trial of the Crusader, you should consider returning to take part in the Trial of the Grand Crusader. Only the strongest adventurers can hope to complete the Trial, but you will be rewarded well for your efforts."]="现在，你已经完成了十字军的试炼，你应该考虑去参加大十字军的试炼了。只有最强大的冒险者才有希望完成这一试炼。但你的努力一定能换回丰厚的报偿。"
G["Now that you have had a chance to study the imp, let us move on to the next minion you will be able to summon, the voidwalker."]="现在你已经了解了小鬼的特性，那么让我们继续研究下一种你可以召唤的生物：虚空行者。"
G["Now that you have your Black Temple key (Medallion of Karabor), I can teleport you directly to the Black Temple. Just tell me when you are ready."]="Ahora que tienes tu llave de El Templo Oscuro (Medallón de Karabor), puedo teletransportarte directamente a El Templo Oscuro. Avísame cuando estés $glisto:lista;."
G["Now that you know the truth, I can't let you leave!"]="既然你已经知道了真相，我就更不能让你离开了！"
G["Now that you mention it, I've been craving Charbroiled Tiger Steak for a while! We don't get many tigers down in the valley, so the dish is hard to find."]="既然你提到了，我想吃碳烤虎肉排都想了好久了！我们谷里并没有多少老虎，所以这盘菜不是那么好搞的哦。"
G["Now that you mention it... my mother used to make the best Shrimp Dumplings.\n\nSigh... I miss her..."]="既然你提到了……我妈做的虾饺最好吃了。\n\n唉……我好想她……"
G["Now that you're attuned to Mount Hyjal, I can teleport you to the Caverns of Time. Just let me know when you are ready."]="现在你先到海加尔山，我可以将你传送到时光之穴。准备好了就告诉我。"
G["Now that you've helped me to establish my ice cream empire, make sure to enjoy one of my many tasty concoctions!"]="现在，你已经帮助我建立起了我的冰激凌帝国。请尽情享用我的诸多美味吧！"
G["Now that's a War Stomp!  Good job!"]="现在来个战争践踏！干得好！"
G["Now that's a piece of steel worth wearing. Form and function lad/lass, I am impressed. Only ever seen it's match once, a Master in the Great Forge named Grumnus Steelshaper. I bet he has learned a few things since then, could probably teach some to ye."]="¡Ese es un acero que sí merece la pena llevar encima! Forma y función, $gmuchacho:muchacha;. Estoy impresionado. Solo he visto a alguien capaz de superarlo, un maestro de la Gran Fundición llamado Grumnus Forjacero. Y apuesto a que ha aprendido algunos trucos desde entonces. Probablemente podría enseñarte un par de cosas."
G["Now that's earnin' your supper!"]="干得好，你们的晚饭算是有着落了。"
G["Now that's just rude..."]="这太粗鲁了……"
G["Now that's putting your hoof down!"]="现在放下你的蹄子！"
G["Now that's what I call a match!"]="这才是我所说的比赛！"
G["Now that's what I call craftsmanship.  You'll have to show me how you did this.  Promise?"]="这就是技术啊！你一定要把其中的窍门告诉我。说定咯？"
G["Now that's what I call froggy-style!"]="这就是我说的“青蛙风格”！"
G["Now that's what I'm talkin' about!"]="我的话应验了吧！"
G["Now that's what I'm talking about!"]="这正是我想要的！"
G["Now that's what I'm talking about! Woohoo!"]="说赢就赢了！哇噢！"
G["Now that's what ye call heavy hands!"]="这就是你所说的严厉手段！"
G["Now that...that is fightin'! Whoever's controllin' these pets sure ish somethin'! ...hic!"]="现在……动真格的了！不管是谁在控制着这些宠物，肯定是……嗝儿！"
G["Now the Lich King is dead and we have returned."]="现在，巫妖王被消灭了，我们回到了这片土地。"
G["Now the Master has them."]="它们属于主人了。"
G["Now the Wildhammers are one!"]="现在，蛮锤团结为一体！"
G["Now then, $n. Let's see what this what this crazy stick is capable of..."]="喂，$n。让我们来看看这根疯狂的棒子能做些什么……"
G["Now then, my new friend. We have much to talk about."]="好吧，我的新朋友。我们还有不少事要聊。"
G["Now there is only one way out- to walk the lonely path of the damned."]="但是现在，活下来的唯一途径就是加入诅咒神教。"
G["Now there's some REAL blood and thunder!!"]="现在，终于有真正的鲜血与雷鸣了！"
G["Now they say that whoever can git their hands on that map, can find that lost treasure..."]="现在他们说，无论谁得到地图，都可以找到失去的宝藏……"
G["Now this is a surprise, Thassarian.  I hadn't heard from Mograine or the other death knights for months.  You've come to rejoin the Scourge, I take it?"]="这可真是个惊喜，萨萨里安。我已经数月没有听到有关莫格莱尼和其他死亡骑士的消息了。我猜，你是回来重新加入天灾军团的？"
G["Now this is an example of what not to summon. Look, it's frail and brittle. One good whack from a mace will send bone shards flying."]="瞧，不要召唤这样的东西。它如此脆弱，用棒敲击就能使它粉身碎骨。"
G["Now this is how you win a war!  Someone ought to teach that death knight some military strategy."]="这就是你们赢得战争的方法！真应该有人教导一下那个死亡骑士该如何运用军事策略。"
G["Now this is what I'm talkin' about! Ain't no spiders or crabs in this water."]="我想说的就是这个！水里既没蜘蛛也没螃蟹。"
G["Now this is what I'm talking about! More dinosaurs, please! It's King Kulaka!!"]="接下来，正是我们最喜闻乐见的场面！拜托，再多来几条恐龙吧！有请，库拉卡大王！"
G["Now this looks familiar. If we keep heading east, I think we can... Ahh! Wyvern on the attack!"]="这看上去很眼熟，要是我们一直朝东走的话，我想我们能做到的。啊！双足飞龙，备战吧！"
G["Now throw it at me!"]="现在扔给我！"
G["Now to apply the ointment to her wounds."]="现在把药膏涂在她的伤口上。"
G["Now to begin the repairs."]="现在开始修理吧。"
G["Now to destroy this foul substance..."]="现在，摧毁这些可恶的东西……"
G["Now to find an unsuspecting Harpy!"]="去找一个鹰身人！"
G["Now to finish the job!"]="现在，最后一步！"
G["Now to get the egg..."]="现在该去找蛋了……"
G["Now to mix it all together and add me special spices!"]="现在该把它搅拌在一起，加上我的秘制香料！"
G["Now to recover the lost words!"]="现在去找回遗失的咒语吧！"
G["Now to test my design!"]="现在来实地检测一下我的设计吧！"
G["Now try out your skills."]="去熟悉一下技能吧。"
G["Now turn your lovely runeblades on our guests, and fetch me their bones!"]="现在用你可爱的符文剑对准客人们，取来他们的骨头！"
G["Now wait a darn minute. Is that an orc? Is... is the HORDE here too!?"]="等一下。那不是兽人吗？部……部落也来了！？"
G["Now watch, val'kyr. Observe as I apply pressure. Can you see that it is not yet ripe? Watch as it pops and falls lifeless to the floor."]="看仔细了，瓦格里。看我如何施压。你瞧，它还没有成熟呢。接着它就会爆裂，毫无生气地陨落。"
G["Now we are making progress!  This is the way out for sure.  Looks like a lot of guards though so I really need you to help me out!"]="总算有进展了！走这条路肯定能出去。不过看来有不少卫兵在把守，我迫切需要你的帮助！"
G["Now we call forth the arcane acolyte."]="现在，我们将召唤奥术侍僧。"
G["Now we finish the job."]="我们完成了这个工作。"
G["Now we gonna kick it up a notch wit da secret ingra... ingor... inrag... da secret sauce!"]="现在我们把主菜弄开一道小口，放那些……那些……特别的调料！"
G["Now we just have to free Tobias and we can get out of here. This way!"]="我们只需解放图比亚斯，然后就能离开这儿了。这边走！"
G["Now we just need to figure out how to get this thing working again."]="现在我们需要讨论怎么让这东西重新开始工作。"
G["Now we must find the exit."]="现在我们必须找到出口。"
G["Now we must wait. It won't be long before the naga realize what we have done."]="现在我们必须等待。纳迦很快就会意识到我们干了些什么。"
G["Now we will see why this ore is so important to the Scourge."]="我们得搞清楚，为什么天灾军团如此看重这种矿石。"
G["Now we're cooking, $n."]="我们正在做饭，$n。"
G["Now we're gettin' someplace!"]="这才像话！"
G["Now we're getting somewhere..."]="现在我们算是有点头绪了……"
G["Now we're making progress!"]="现在我们取得了进展！"
G["Now we're talkin'!"]="我们正说着呢！"
G["Now we've come to the truth!"]="现在我们终于接近真理了！"
G["Now what do I do?"]="现在，我该做些什么？"
G["Now what should I do with you? I simply can't make up my mind."]="我该把你怎么办？我完全不知道。"
G["Now what was the name of that book? Oh yes, it was-- No, no, that wasn't it...."]="那本书的名字是什么？哦对了，是——不，不，不是那个……"
G["Now what's this about you 'always loved me', Grapplehammer?"]="Bueno, ¿qué es eso de que \"siempre me has amado\", Martillazos?"
G["Now whatchoo got to say?"]="现在你们有什么好说的啊？"
G["Now where did I put my Windwool Bandages?"]="我的风绒绷带哪儿去了？"
G["Now where did I put that companion document?"]="我把勇士的资料放在哪儿了？"
G["Now where did I put that mysterious fossil? Ah, maybe up there..."]="我到底把那个神秘的化石放在哪里了？啊，也许在那上面……"
G["Now where did I put that silver spool..."]="我把银线放在哪里了……"
G["Now where did I put the Venture Company formulations?"]="我把风险投资公司的文件放哪里去了？"
G["Now where was I?  I yeah...  So I said to her, \"But I need you!  I need you!\"... and she just laughed and slithered away!  It's the honest truth, $n.  Naga can be so cruel!"]="¿Por dónde iba...? Ah, sí... Así que le dije \"¡Pero te necesito! ¡Te necesito!\" ¡... Y ella simplemente se rió y se alejó deslizándose! Es la verdad, $n. ¡Los nagas pueden resultar tan crueles!"
G["Now where was that book on Night Elf customs I was looking for..."]="我要找的关于暗夜精灵习俗的书在哪里……"
G["Now where's that big mogu baddy that came tramping through here a short bit ago?"]="刚才还在这里踩来踏去的魔古大块头去哪儿了？"
G["Now which one of these did I put it in..."]="我刚才把哪个放进去了……"
G["Now who's going to get pummelled?!"]="现在轮到谁挨打了？！"
G["Now who's the crybaby, crybaby!?"]="现在谁是爱哭鬼，爱哭鬼？！"
G["Now why would ya wanna go an' break poor Mack's heart? When I return, I'll pray ye've changed yer way of thinkin'...."]="你为什么要让可怜的马克伤心啊？等我回来后，希望你会改变想法……"
G["Now why would ye be needing the services of one of those types?  We get enough trouble out of that rogue, Hulfdan Blackbeard, over in The Forlorn Cavern, do I need to be turning my eye to you as well?"]="为什么我们需要这样的服务？荒弃的洞穴的潜行者霍夫丹·黑须已经给我们惹了一大堆麻烦，我是不是还要留意你一下？"
G["Now with more BOOM in every BOOM BOOM!"]="给每次轰轰里多加一点轰轰！"
G["Now with new passenger tossing capability! I'm sure your buds will love ya."]="试试新增的乘客抛掷功能吧！你们一定会喜欢的！"
G["Now ya be knowin' everything, mon! Prepare yourself... we attack soon!"]="朋友，眼下的形势你已经了如指掌了！做好准备吧……我们很快就要发动攻击了！"
G["Now ye just be fass and facety, mon!  Ye fixin' fe vex me, ye maga dog blaggard?\n\nG'waan den, ye lily-livered scallywag.  Be seen ya first light!"]="¡Y ahora te pones cheche! ¿Intentas ofenderme, pulgoso chucho de tierra firme?\n\nApártate, cobarde pillastre. ¡Voy en pira, t'aluego!"
G["Now ye're talkin'!  I'll take the Twilight guy.  You focus on the little dwarf."]="你说的对！我去对付那个暮光混蛋。你对付那个小矮人。"
G["Now you all die!"]="现在你们统统去死吧！"
G["Now you are caught up. And would you look at that? My cup is full again! It is good to be the High Elder."]="你现在明白了吧。瞧见没？我的杯子又满了！当长老还真不错。"
G["Now you are in the Lich King's embrace."]="接受巫妖王的拥抱吧。"
G["Now you are ready to learn the finer points of kodo hide tanning. Let us begin..."]="你已经准备好学习科多兽制皮的要点。让我们开始吧……"
G["Now you are surrounded by Wolfoids!  What will you do?  Where can you run?"]="现在，你已经被机械狼人包围了！你还能做些什么？你能逃到哪里去？"
G["Now you are thinking like a ruler, Garrosh.  You must look at all sides of a problem.  Consult with your advisors and act with confidence."]="现在你已经像统治者那样思考了，加尔鲁什。你必须全面地分析问题。听听你顾问的意见，信心满满地展开行动吧。"
G["Now you ask for our help?  Where were you when we needed you?  Do you've any idea what we've been through?"]="现在你想要寻求帮助了？我们需要帮助的时候，你在哪儿呢？你知道我们是怎么熬过来的吗？"
G["Now you burn!"]="燃烧吧！"
G["Now you can shoot the mantid!"]="现在，你可以用它来射杀螳螂妖了！"
G["Now you die!"]="去死吧！"
G["Now you done made me angry!"]="现在你把我惹毛了！"
G["Now you face Orabus, fool!"]="你竟敢挑战奥拉布斯，蠢货！"
G["Now you face da true champion! I give you chance to run away little one. Run away now before Mogor decim... destyor... Run away before Mogor KILL!"]="现在你将面对真正的冠军！我会给你一个逃跑的机会，小家伙。在穆戈尔把你杀死之前逃跑吧！"
G["Now you feel pain..."]="你感受到痛苦的滋味了吧……"
G["Now you gone for good!"]="去死吧！"
G["Now you gonna die!"]="受死吧！"
G["Now you gunna die, mon!"]="你死定了，朋友！"
G["Now you know your place in my new world."]="你们在我的新世界中一文不值。"
G["Now you know. Now you must die!"]="既然你已经知道了，那就必须死了！"
G["Now you must usher in a new age... The age of mortals."]="现在，你们必须开创一个新的时代……一个属于凡人的时代。"
G["Now you not catch us with back turned! Now we hurt you bad undead. BAD!"]="我们躲在你身后，这次你休想抓到我们！现在要好好教训你！哼！"
G["Now you see me..."]="现在你看见我了……"
G["Now you shall witness the meaning of true power!"]="现在你会看到真正的力量！"
G["Now you stay dead!"]="现在，你去死吧！"
G["Now you will know fear!"]="现在你该知道什么是恐惧了！"
G["Now you will pay the ultimate price!"]="现在你将付出终极的代价！"
G["Now you will see. Traitors hide within our ranks."]="现在你会看见。叛徒就混在我们自己人里。"
G["Now you will work off the offense of shooting down Kolramas for all eternity."]="除非你能击落科尔拉玛斯，否则不可能阻挡天灾军团的攻势。"
G["Now you'll have to join us... permanently!"]="现在你必须加入我们了……永远地！"
G["Now you'll shee shome real fancy riding!"]="现债里看到缀厉害的骑术了吧！"
G["Now you'll stay... for eternity."]="永远留在这里吧。"
G["Now you're gonna get it good, $n!"]="现在你要好好了解一下了，$n！"
G["Now you're just wasting my time!"]="你现在只是在浪费我的时间！"
G["Now you've gone and done it! TIME FOR THE FIST!"]="你这蠢货竟然真敢这么干！尝尝我的拳头！"
G["Now you've gone and done it. I thought you were better than the people at Southshore. They would have bought all my wares! Too bad they're all dead."]="你终于还是做了。我原以为你比南海镇的那帮家伙要好得多。他们会买走我所有的东西！可惜他们都死了。"
G["Now your benefactors make their appearance, but they are too late! The powers contained here are sufficient to destroy the world ten times over. What do you think they will do to you?"]="现在你们幕后的主使终于出现了，但已经太迟了！这里弥漫着的能量已经足以将世界毁灭十次。你们觉得他们会对你们做些什么呢？"
G["Now!"]="上！"
G["Now!  Finally!  Our plans can take effect!"]="就是现在！我们的计划生效啦！"
G["Now! Destroy zhe coffer! And zhem vhizh it!"]="现在！摧毁这只箱子！也将他们一同摧毁！"
G["Now! Let us see what darkness corrupts this place!"]="现在！来看看是何种黑暗腐蚀了此地吧！"
G["Now! Unleash the kraken!"]="现在！放出海怪！"
G["Now's as good a time as any, I suppose."]="这可真是个大好机会啊。"
G["Now's not a good time, $n.\n\nAre you insane?!"]="Este no es un buen momento, $n.\n\n¿Estás $gloco:loca;?"
G["Now's our chance! Let me out of this cage!"]="我们的机会来了！让我出去！"
G["Now's your chance to escape. Make a run for it!"]="逃跑的机会来了。快跑啊！"
G["Now, $n, let us release their souls and hear what they have to say."]="Ahora, $n, liberemos esas almas y escuchemos lo que tienen que contar."
G["Now, $r! Place the spear!"]="$r！长矛就位！"
G["Now, Chieftain Vol'jin, before we were so rudely interrupted, you were telling us of the Zandalari plan."]="让我们继续吧，沃金酋长。在被打断之前，你刚才正在向我们叙说赞达拉的计划。"
G["Now, I am all that I once was... and more."]="我又变成了曾经的我……而且更加强大。"
G["Now, I am needed elsewhere."]="现在，别的地方还需要我。"
G["Now, I call out to the spirits of this place. I will give anything or pay any price, if only you will help me save my people."]="现在，我召唤镇守此地的魂灵。我愿付出任何代价，做出任何牺牲，只要你能协助我拯救祖国的人民。"
G["Now, I haven't had a reason to train me guns on a Horde vessel in a long time..."]="这个嘛，我已经很久没找到理由，拿部落的舰船练枪法了……"
G["Now, I know what ya be thinkin'. Ol' Griftah's in a spot of trouble. This be nothin'. I still got a lotta my stock on me, so c'mere and check out what I got."]="现在，我知道你在想什么了。格里伏塔有些麻烦，但这不算什么。我身边仍然有着很多库存。过来看看我有些什么吧。"
G["Now, I look at our Warchief, and I begin to see the very same racism. He is willing to throw away our lives for his agenda."]="而现在，我在部落的酋长身上，看到了同样的歧视。他随意将我们当做炮灰。"
G["Now, I will imbue this crystal with the Light's power to cut through lies and deceit."]="现在，我要将圣光之力注入这块水晶，让它揭穿一切谎言与欺瞒的伪装。"
G["Now, I will reveal to you the visions I have had."]="现在，我会给你们展现我所看到的未来。"
G["Now, Jooga chase panda girl!"]="现在，尤噶追熊猫人女孩！"
G["Now, Lilian, it is time for your transformation."]="现在，莉莉安，你变身的时刻到了。"
G["Now, answer me this, $n:\nWhich creature became the Lich King before spreading the plague across Lordaeron?"]="Ahora, respóndeme a esto, $n.\n¿Qué criatura se convirtió en el Rey Exánime antes de extender la Peste por Lordaeron?"
G["Now, back to the brewing!"]="现在，继续酿酒！"
G["Now, back to work!  Your superiors are watching from the outlook above and they do not take kindly to idleness!"]="赶快回去工作！大人们正在上面看着你，他们可不会对偷懒的人心慈手软！"
G["Now, be free and join the battle! Let us end this together!"]="加入战斗吧！让我们了结这一切！"
G["Now, brothers!  Attack the $r!"]="¡Ahora, hermanos! ¡Atacad $gal:a la; $r!"
G["Now, choke on your own hubris!"]="现在，咽下这傲慢的苦果吧！"
G["Now, cry not, as you fall not to your death, but into the waiting arms of my squire!  Off you go now!"]="不要哭，你不会跌向死亡，而是会跌落在我的侍从的臂弯里！现在，松开手吧！"
G["Now, dance!"]="跳舞吧！"
G["Now, do I have any volunteers?"]="现在，有没有志愿者？"
G["Now, execute the instructions!"]="按指示行事！"
G["Now, feel my master's limitless power and despair!"]="绝望吧，体会主人那无穷无尽的力量吧！"
G["Now, follow me!"]="现在，跟我走！"
G["Now, friend. Prepare yourself to defeat whatever emerges!"]="现在，朋友，做好准备，击败出现的一切敌人！"
G["Now, friends. Attack!"]="就是现在，朋友。进攻！"
G["Now, have a taste of Jin'do's true powah!"]="现在，尝尝金度真正的力量吧！"
G["Now, heroes!  Finish me, while Rakh'likh possesses my body!"]="冒险者们！了结我吧，不要让拉瑟莱克再控制我了！"
G["Now, hurry along, little $n. I've one more challenge to see if you're worthy of the honor."]="Date prisa, $gpequeño:pequeña; $n. Tengo otro reto para ver si eres $gdigno:digna; del honor."
G["Now, if I add the yellow ones..."]="现在，要是我加入这些黄色的……"
G["Now, if you'd be so kind as to get your ass away from my forge..."]="你能不能从我的熔炉旁滚开……"
G["Now, in Shattrath City: The Tauren Chieftains! Playing in the World's End Tavern at the top of the hour!"]="牛头人酋长乐队来到了沙塔斯城！就在天涯旅店，整点开始演出！"
G["Now, isn't this the place to be?\n\nTouring unexplored corners of the world with likeminded fellows?\n\nWhat could be better?"]="不就是这里吗？\n\n与志同道合的伙伴一同探索这个世界从未被开发过的角落？\n\n还有什么能比这样更好的？"
G["Now, it is time to bring her reign to an end, Marcus. Stand down, friend."]="现在是结束她统治的时候了，马库斯。让开，我的朋友。"
G["Now, kill them all!"]="现在，杀光他们！"
G["Now, know demise!"]="尝尝死亡的滋味吧！"
G["Now, let's clean up the rest of the trash, men!"]="现在让我们把剩下的垃圾清理干净！"
G["Now, let's see to our supplies..."]="现在，来看看补给……"
G["Now, let's see what we can find out..."]="现在，让我们看看可以发现些什么……"
G["Now, let's see..."]="现在，让我们看看……"
G["Now, let's see... If I am correct, then... Hmmm..."]="现在，我们来看看……如果我是正确的，那么……嗯……"
G["Now, look around you. De Darkspear rebellion begins. Hellscream's worst nightmare."]="现在，看看你的周围吧。暗矛起义军正在壮大。它将成为地狱咆哮的噩梦。"
G["Now, look before you! One of Azeroth's most powerful \"druids\", reduced to nothing but a charred husk. Such is the will of Fandral Staghelm. Such is the will of the flame!"]="¡Mira ante ti! Uno de los \"druidas\" más poderosos de Azeroth reducido a un cascarón chamuscado. Tal es la voluntad de Fandral Corzocelada. ¡Tal es la voluntad de la llama!"
G["Now, my loyal custo... err, friends, go forth and conquer this land for our people!"]="我忠诚的顾客，呃……朋友们，来吧，征服这片土地！"
G["Now, now! Bad luck to raise your fists in the middle of town. I was just... just testing you. Here is the money I owe."]="¡Calma, calma! Da mala suerte sacar los puños en mitad de la ciudad.\n\nSolo estaba... Solo te estaba poniendo a prueba. Aquí tienes el dinero que debo."
G["Now, now, $n, just relax and take a deep breath. You really need to learn to trust me.\n\nYour lack of experience in these situations is causing you to panic, and panic always exaggerates the truth. So you see, there really is no crisis.\n\nNow that we've settled that, I must ask that you stop being so negative. It's not good for the crew's morale...."]="好啦，$n，放轻松点，做个深呼吸吧。你要相信我。\n\n你缺乏处理这类情况的经验，才会搞得惊惶失措。心理上的恐惧感往往会夸大事实。所以啦，根本不存在什么危机。\n\n我说，你不要这么消极嘛。这会影响到整个探险队的士气……"
G["Now, now, Blanchy. Don't be jealous, you'll be going on a big adventure of your own, soon."]="听着，布兰契。别嫉妒，很快你就要独自探险了。"
G["Now, now. Don't be scared. Brave heroes are fighting the sha right now. And as long as I'm here, nothing will hurt you."]="好了，好了。别害怕。勇敢的英雄们正在和煞交战。只要我在这，就没人能伤害你。"
G["Now, off with you! I require meditation before I begin the restoration ritual."]="现在，你们走吧！我得在复原仪式开始前冥想一下。"
G["Now, only one step remains to rid us of the Soulflayer's threat..."]="我们就要摆脱夺灵者的威胁了，只差最后一步……"
G["Now, pandaren... let me see what you've got!"]="现在，熊猫人……让我看看你的本事吧！"
G["Now, proceed to the translocator.  Forge Camp Wrath awaits your arrival!"]="现在，向传送器进发。铸魔营地：天罚等着你的到来！"
G["Now, remove yourself from my presence. You would be wise not to come within sight of me again."]="你，立即从我的视线中消失。最好别让我再看见你。"
G["Now, rise."]="好了，起来吧。"
G["Now, take another long look before we make our way to the Holy District and the great Cathedral of Light."]="接下来，我们要去教堂广场看看光明大教堂。"
G["Now, then... the rod. Let's see about putting it back together, shall we?"]="嗯，现在我们可以把节杖组合起来了……要试试吗？"
G["Now, there's the kick I've come to expect from Grimbooze's drinks! I like it!"]="哇，仔细品味后才发现口感一流啊！葛瑞姆总是能为我带来惊喜！我喜欢！"
G["Now, this is what I call a target rich environment!"]="这才叫“目标不计其数”嘛！"
G["Now, this is what we call a nice find!"]="看哪，这就是我们所说的重大发现！"
G["Now, to my point: I believe we are headed towards a reckoning. And no, I am not talking about the current conflict between the Alliance and the Horde."]="现在，言归正传——我觉得一场末世浩劫正在酝酿。不，我说的不是联盟和部落之间的冲突。"
G["Now, to put the neutralizing agent on it..."]="现在，把中和剂放上去……"
G["Now, watch..."]="现在，看好了……"
G["Now, we burn this wickerman as a symbol of our victory against old enemies!"]="现在，我们将这个稻草人付之一炬。这是我们战胜宿敌的象征！"
G["Now, where could those supplies be?"]="那么，那些物资会在哪里？"
G["Now, where do they keep those oats?"]="他们把燕麦放哪儿了呢？"
G["Now, where have dey put Norkani's things?"]="他们把洛尔卡尼的东西放哪里去了？"
G["Now, where have they put Kraz's things?"]="现在，来看看……，他们把克拉斯的东西放哪去啦？"
G["Now, where is it?"]="那么，它在哪儿？"
G["Now, where was I? Oh, yes..."]="我说到哪里了？哦，对了……"
G["Now, why would you go and do something like that? Didn't you see the sign that said, \"DO NOT PUSH THIS BUTTON!\"? How will we finish testing with the self-destruct mechanism active?"]="Veamos, ¿cómo se os ocurre hacer algo así? ¿No habéis visto la señal que dice \"NO PULSAR ESTE BOTÓN\"? ¿Cómo vamos a acabar la prueba con el mecanismo de autodestrucción activado?"
G["Now, with my blessing, you arise as true sons of the Light!"]="现在，在我的祝福下，你们将成为真正的圣光之子！"
G["Now, witness the true might of the Beast Ward. D'akala di'chuka HORRIDON! Kalimaste!"]="看看神兽真正的力量吧。D'akala di'chuka，赫利东！Kalimaste！"
G["Now, you must STAY CENTERED. You can focus or relax, but above all else, remain in the center."]="现在，你要紧守本心。你可以集中或者放松精神，但是必须守住本心。"
G["Now, you try."]="你来试试看。"
G["Now, you will watch as I complete the ritual and turn the beast against you!"]="现在，你将见证仪式的完成，那匹野兽将成为你的敌人！"
G["Now, young $n, you will die!"]="年轻的$n，你现在要死了！"
G["Now, zhen, vhere vere ve?"]="那么，我们是在哪儿？"
G["Now."]="开始。"
G["Now. My challenge, should you accept it, will test your ability to stand right in the face of danger and persevere."]="那么，我的挑战，如果你们接受的话，将测试你们正确应对危险的能力与毅力。"
G["Now. Show me your fury. Show me!"]="现在。让我看看你的怒火。来吧！"
G["Now... THAT is a trophy."]="看好了……这才叫作战利品。"
G["Now... We need the eggs that you recover. The Netherwing eggs. They are, after all, a product of the master. We will pay whatever price that you ask."]="现在……我们要你找回龙卵。灵翼龙卵。他们毕竟是主人的东西。无论你出多高的价钱，我们都会和你交换的。"
G["Now... YOU must die!"]="现在……你去死吧！"
G["Now... if you value your life, scum, you'll tell me what I need to know."]="现在……如果你还想要活命，废物，就好好回答我的问题。"
G["Now... sit!"]="现在……坐下！"
G["Now... where was my thread and needle. Ah! There it is..."]="嗯……我的针线在哪里？啊！在这里……"
G["Now... witness the full power of Millhouse Manastorm!"]="现在……见识米尔豪斯·法力风暴的全部力量吧！"
G["Now... witness the power of a war kodo in the hands of a master!"]="现在……见证战斗科多兽在一位大师手中所能发挥出的力量吧！"
G["Nowhere to run!"]="无处可逃！"
G["Nowhere to run... You're mine now!"]="穷途末路……变成我的奴仆吧！"
G["Nowhere."]="哪儿都不去。"
G["Nozari, I'm not talking about a greedy wizard looking to improve his station in life by making a small adjustment to the past."]="诺萨莉，我不是在谈论某个想要通过微调过去来提升他现世地位的贪婪巫师。"
G["Nuaar, are you feeling well?  You don't look like yourself today."]="努埃尔，你还好吧？你今天看上去有些不大对劲。"
G["Nuh uh!"]="不！"
G["Nuh uh! And besides, that's not a gong! It's a bell. I didn't say I would hit a bell."]="我才不要！而且，那不是锣！那是一口钟。我可没说过我要敲钟。"
G["Nuh uh."]="哼哼。"
