G["OK Fengus, where you at?!  You come call me a gnoll lover while I give you da hammer upside da head!"]="好吧，芬古斯，你什么意思？！你敢叫我恋豺狼人癖，看我一锤打得你找不到北！"
G["OK boss, I get back to tree-hitting."]="好的大人，我这就回去敲树。"
