G["OUCH! Safe to say that Jol'Grum wasn't quite yet-i ready for his battle with these three killing machines! Speaking of ready..."]="哎哟！ 看来乔古鲁面对这三个杀人机器还没有做好充分的战斗准备！ 说起准备……"
G["OUR JINYU! YOU CANNOT HAVE THEM BACK, $P!"]="我们的锦鱼人！你别想夺回他们，$P！"
