G["OW! Not again."]="噢！又失败了。"
G["OW! OW! OW!"]="嗷！嗷！嗷！"
G["OW! OW! OW! OW!"]="啊！啊！啊！啊！"
G["OW! That's not right!"]="啊，又错了！"
G["OW, MON!"]="嗷，伙计！"
G["OW...NO! We know that you've been stealing our armor and weapons and horses!"]="噢……不！我们知道是你偷了我们的盔甲、武器，还有马匹！"
G["OWIE!  GORLOP CAN'T MOVE!  GORLOP GONNA FALL!"]="喔咦！葛洛普动不了了！格尔洛普要倒下了！"
