G["OY! GET A ROPE!"]="哈！得到了一根绳子！"
G["OY! Piss off, eh?"]="喂！走开！"
G["OY! Wait in line, would ya? Outland food doesn't agree with me at all."]="哎！排队好不好？我一点都吃不惯外域的东西。"
