G["Oben Rageclaw resides at the double bridges in the western chamber, near the hallway that leads out of the Barrow Den."]="奥本·怒爪就在双桥之一所通向的西边房间里，靠近离开兽穴的走廊。"
G["Obey his commands and be honored among the Burning Legion.  Falter and you will be consumed!"]="Obedece sus órdenes y serás $ghonrado:honrada; entre la Legión Ardiente. ¡Vacila y serás $gconsumido:consumida;!"
G["Obey me!"]="听我号令！"
