G["Observe, Heigan the Unclean. The mastermind behind the plague cauldrons that turned the wilderness of Azeroth into the Plaguelands."]="这是肮脏的希尔盖。他就是指挥天灾军团利用天灾之锅将艾泽拉斯宁静的旷野变成诅咒之地的罪魁祸首。"
G["Obsidian Defender has cast Harden Shield! It is taking less damage!"]="黑曜石守卫者施放了刚硬之盾，所受伤害降低！"
