G["Obsidion rise and serve your master!"]="出来吧，奥比斯顿，保护你的主人！"
G["Obviously we got off to a bad start.  How about an ale... of more pain?!"]="显然我们有了一个很坏的开局。再来一杯……更苦的酒怎么样？！"
G["Obviously you have mistaken me for someone who cares."]="很显然，你把我和某个跑龙套的家伙给搞混了。"
G["Obviously, I picked the blood elf."]="当然，我选择了血精灵。"
