G["Obviously, I picked the orc."]="当然，我选择了兽人。"
G["Obviously. How else could she infiltrate their ranks and pass as a draenei? She had been living among them for a very long time."]="很明显，不然她怎么能渗透到他们中去，变成一个德莱尼人的模样？她和他们一起生活了很长时间。"
G["Occassionally, some runes will fizzle with black smoke, preventing them from firing during the following burst."]="偶尔会有符文冒起黑烟，这样的符文将不会在随后的爆炸中起火爆炸。"
G["Och I love a good brawl, but sometimes yer foe has a skull thicker than a Thorium heat shield. Times like that ye need a wee bit o assistance."]="啊，我想好好干一架，但是有时你的敌人的骨头比瑟银护甲还坚硬。这时你就需要一些帮助了。"
G["Och!\n\n'Bout time ye showed up.\n\nI been expectin' ye fer days now.\n\nLeavin' an ol' dwarf ta swelter... I trained junior better than that."]="啊！\n\n你来得正是时候。\n\n我已经等了你好几天了。\n\n竟然把一个老矮人丢在这个闷热的地方……就算是训练新兵也比这个好。"
G["Och!\n\nWhy can't it just be easy fer once?!"]="哎呦！\n\n怎么就不能顺利一次？！"
G["Och!\nWe've got ghosts AND the Reliquary to contend with here?! I dunno what's worse!"]="¡Ay!\n\n¿Tenemos que enfrentarnos a fantasmas y al Relicario a la vez? ¡No sé qué es peor!"
G["Och!  Now that's a skill worth knowing.  Tognus beats the anvil with a fury ye don't see often.  Why don't ye go talk him up and see what he can teach ye?"]="哦！这是一项极有价值的技能。托格努斯以你从未见过的方式敲击铁砧。为什么你不去跟他谈谈，看看他能教你什么？"
G["Och!  Now ye're talkin'!  I bet Granis Swiftaxe could show ye a thing or two about swinging steel.  He's over in the Thunderbrew Distillery in Kharanos at the moment."]="哦！这可是你说的！我敢打赌格兰尼斯·快斧会向你展示如何挥动武器的。他现在在卡拉诺斯的雷酒酿制厂。"
G["Och!  That Daryl Riknussun is a brilliant cook!  He makes a chilli so hot ye could temper steel with it!  I don't think he'll teach ye the recipe, but he'll certainly help ye to become a good cook.  Ye'll find him at the Bronze Kettle o'er on the northeastern side of The Great Forge."]="¡Aj! ¡Daryl Riknussun es un cocinero excelente! ¡Hace un pimiento tan picante que se podría templar acero con él! No creo que te enseñe la receta pero seguro que te ayudará a convertirte en $gun buen cocinero:una buena cocinera;. Lo encontrarás en La Tetera de Bronce, en la parte noreste de La Gran Fundición."
G["Och!  Ye should be careful what ye get enchanted $glad : lass;.  I had me mug enchanted so it wouldn't spill a drop, but now I can't drink from it!  Such a tragedy.  \nYou be sure to heed me advice when ye see Gimble.  He'll be in his shop right by the Gryphon Master at The Great Forge."]="¡Ay! Tienes que tener cuidado con lo que encantas, $gmuchacho:muchacha;. Yo, por ejemplo, encanté mi jarra de cerveza para que no cayera ni una sola gota al suelo, pero ahora no puedo beber de ella! Qué tragedia. \n\nNo olvides seguir mi consejo cuando veas a Gimble. Lo puedes encontrar en su tienda, junto al maestro de grifos, en La Gran Fundición."
G["Och! Come on now, ye buggar..."]="嗷呦！来吧，你这家伙……"
G["Och! I can't decide!"]="哎呀！我没法决定！"
G["Och! Ye seek training in the way of the warrior, do ye?  Kelstrum Stonebreaker will put ye through yer paces!  Just march yerself over to the Hall of Arms east of the gates of Ironforge."]="哦！你想接受战士的训练，是吗？克斯塔姆·碎石会帮你实现梦想的！去铁炉堡东门的武器大厅吧。"
G["Och, 'twas a sad day when I realized my obsession. I woke up and found myself tannin' before I had my first tankard of ale. Hardly even a respectable hangover! I knew then--aye, I knew!--how it was goin' to be."]="哦，我认识到自己的困惑，这真是个悲伤的日子。当我醒来时，发现自己被晒黑了，接着我生平第一次喝啤酒。那根本不算一场宿醉！从那时起——我便明白了啤酒！——明白了喝下啤酒是怎么样的状况。"
G["Och, there's nothing I can teach ye, $n. Have a word with Tally Berryfizz over there. She can hardly reach the tables, but when she starts brewing a potion, watch out!"]="哦，我不能教给你什么，$n。跟塔雷·浆泡谈谈。她几乎够不着桌子，但是当她在配制药水时，你得看仔细了！"
G["Och... a paladin?  Well $glad : lass;, ye're in luck!  Azar Stronghammer is back from training and is currently staying at the Thunderbrew Distillery in Kharanos."]="哦……一个圣骑士？嗯，$g小伙子:姑娘;，你真走运！阿扎尔·战锤刚结束训练，他现在在卡拉诺斯的雷酒酿制厂。"
G["Odd city, ain't it?"]="奇特的城市，不是吗？"
G["Odd, I would have thought you'd have found something useful on those Scourge that might help us deal with the scourging crystals.\n\nIf I may strongly suggest, and I do, $c, go back down to the beach and continue to slaughter them until you do find something of use to me."]="奇怪，我还以为你从那些天灾军团成员身上找到了关闭瘟疫水晶的方法呢。\n\n$c，我建议你有所发现之前，返回海滩继续屠杀他们。"
G["Odd, she's usually here..."]="奇怪，她通常都待在这儿的……"
G["Odd. That usually does it."]="奇怪。怎么不对劲呢。"
G["Of a beauty destined for fame"]="故事里讲述了一位美艳无俦的女郎"
G["Of a bold lass destined for fame"]="讲述了一个大胆的女郎"
G["Of a depth the like few can be blessed."]="满溢的祝福，世间罕有"
G["Of all the ancients, Goldrinn is the most magnificent. His fury, his resolve... you would do well to emulate."]="在所有远古半神中，戈德林是最杰出的一位。他的狂怒，他的决心……你一定能赶上他。"
G["Of all the buildings in all of Dunwald, why this one?!"]="顿沃德有许多房子，为什么偏偏是这一座？！"
G["Of all the hair-brained, idiotic, BRAINLESS ideas... \"Yea, Brote, it'll be great... the Forsaken will rain gold coins down on our heads!\""]="De todas las absurdas, estúpidas y DESCERREBRADAS ideas... \"Sí, Brote, será genial... ¡los Renegados nos cubrirán de monedas de oro!\""
G["Of all the slimy, inconsiderate, bullheaded..."]="这些不可理喻，不知好歹，肆意妄为的家伙……"
G["Of all the wild serpents, the onyx serpent is the rarest. These elusive black cloud serpents are known to lay their eggs on Windward Isle to the northeast.\n\nIf you come across any Onyx Eggs, please bring them to me. I shall reward you handsomely."]="在所有的野生翔龙中，玛瑙翔龙是最稀有的。据悉，这些难得一见的黑色云端翔龙会在东北边的临风岛上产卵。\n\n如果你在那里发现任何玛瑙翔龙蛋，请把它们带来给我。我会好好奖赏你的。"
G["Of all the wondrous places within Darnassus, which would you have me direct you to?"]="达纳苏斯有无数令人惊异的地方，你想去哪儿？"
G["Of course I can help you with training. I'm just a journeyman myself, but I'm sure there's something I can show you."]="当然，我可以帮你进行训练。我也只是一个新手，但是我想我还是能对你有所帮助的。"
G["Of course I do not have the shard. That would be asinine. I walk amongst savages in this cursed land! I cannot take five steps without some crazed orc or human trying to thrust a sharp stick into my hide. At any given time you could very well be speaking to my ghostly spirit.\n\nAnyhow... I hid it.\n\nGo on... ask me where."]="我当然没有碎片。把那东西带在身上是极其愚蠢的做法。我生活在这片被诅咒的蛮荒之地上！我走不到五步，就必然有疯子一般的兽人或是人类想要攻击我。我随时都可能命丧黄泉。\n\n总之……我把那东西藏起来了。\n\n继续吧……问问我把碎片藏在哪儿了。"
G["Of course I offer lessons to other Enchanters, provided you are ready."]="Por supuesto que ofrezco lecciones a otros encantadores, siempre y cuando estés $gpreparado:preparada;."
G["Of course I was the one chosen to summon a demon for the competitors. I am Wilfred Fizzlebang, master summoner! Demons quail before the mere thought of being under my will!"]="为这些竞技选手们召唤恶魔敌人的工作当然应该由我来完成。我是威尔弗雷德·菲兹班，召唤大师！在我钢铁般意志的控制下，即使是恶魔也会瑟瑟发抖！"
G["Of course I will help!"]="我当然会帮忙的！"
G["Of course I'm not just going to drop you off, Master Highbeacon.  We'll be happy to wait for you."]="当然，我不仅会把你放下，海毕肯大人。我们还很乐意在这儿等你回来。"
G["Of course I've got a job for you! We're always looking for $cs. Hopefully you'll fare better than the draenei we had to send back to the Exodar -- for burial.\n\n<Acteon laughs.>\n\nI'm joking! You should have seen the look on your face. They got sent back to the Exodar for treatment of minor wounds. Nothin' that they won't recover from..."]="¡Por supuesto que tengo un trabajo para ti! Siempre nos viene bien $gun:una; $c. Esperemos que te vaya mejor que a los draenei que tuvimos que mandar de vuelta a El Exodar... para enterrarlos.\n\n<Acteon ríe.>\n\n¡Es broma! Si hubieras visto la cara que has puesto... Los mandamos a El Exodar para tratarlos de heridas leves. Nada de lo que no pudieran recuperarse en unos días..."
G["Of course he was hot! Don't be dumb, Deng."]="他当然很烫了！别说傻话了，小邓。"
G["Of course it's my drink! I invented this ya know!"]="当然，这就是我点的！这种酒其实是我发明的！"
G["Of course my worst fears are going to come true."]="果然，我最担心的事情终究还是发生了。"
G["Of course none of my goods are stolen.  But if someone asks, you didn't get them from me!"]="当然我的货物都安然无恙。若是有人问起来，你可不要说是从我这里弄来的！"
G["Of course not! We brewed beer together. That practically makes us brothers."]="当然不开玩笑！我们一起酿过酒，我们是好兄弟。"
G["Of course not, dear $g boy:girl;. You 'adventurer' types are often victims of circumstance; subject to the political drama which tends to unfold between citizenry and royalty.\n\nMy advice to you, then, is to seek out something else, more specifically: A new career.\n\nThis world has enough heroes."]="Por supuesto que no, $gchico:chica;. Vosotros, los aventureros, a menudo sois víctimas de las circunstancias; sujetos al drama político que suele desarrollarse entre los ciudadanos y la realeza.\n\nMi consejo es que busques algo más, específicamente, una nueva profesión.\n\nEste mundo ya tiene suficientes héroes."
G["Of course the Explorer's League stumbled into a foolish situation and are in over their heads.\nAnd of COURSE we are going to take advantage of it."]="Como siempre, la Liga de Expedicionarios se ha metido en camisa de once varas.\n\nY como siempre, nosotros nos aprovecharemos de la situación."
G["Of course there's no danger in everything catching flames and exploding like a huge helium bomb. This baby will get you to Undercity faster and safer than any boat, and the view is truly breathtaking. Speaking of breath, smoking is not allowed while on board the zeppelin"]="氦弹点火和爆炸的过程是没有危险的。跟船只相比，这宝贝能更为快速安全地将你送达幽暗城，途中的景色真是惊心动魄。说到这，在地精飞艇上是不允许吸烟的，旅途中也不允许使用火的法术。"
G["Of course there's no danger in everything catching flames and exploding like a huge helium bomb. This baby will get you to Undercity faster and safer than any boat, and the view is truly breathtaking. Speaking of breath, smoking is not allowed while on board the zeppelin, and fire spells are banned from being cast during the trip."]="氦弹点火和爆炸的过程是没有危险的。跟船只相比，这宝贝能更为快速安全地将你送达幽暗城，途中的景色真是惊心动魄。说到这，在地精飞艇上是不允许吸烟的，旅途中也不允许使用火的法术。"
G["Of course they are. One problem at a time, Vereesa."]="他们当然会来。一个个来，温蕾萨。"
G["Of course they will."]="他们当然会的。"
G["Of course we need a sound strategy. But why cut off an arm when you can strike at the heart?"]="我们当然需要稳健的战术。但在能直捣黄龙时，为何要断臂自保呢？"
G["Of course you are! Thanks for coming by. Here's my payment."]="¡Por supuesto que sí!\n\nGracias por venir. Aquí tienes el pago."
G["Of course you are. Here to save big blue from himself, spending all his time in the spirit world, obsessing over magical artifacts. Kalec doesn't understand though, I've turned a new leaf.\n\nI've met someone."]="哈，你当然是来帮忙的，来拯救这个蓝色的大家伙，现在他已经彻底沉陷在灵魂世界里，完全被魔法物品迷住了。但卡雷苟斯并不明白，我已经翻开了新的一页。\n\n我与“某人”相遇了。"
G["Of course you did. We will put your understanding to the test."]="是啊……你知道。但或许我们该考验一下你的理解。"
G["Of course you lost. What did you expect?"]="显然你输了。你还指望能怎么样呢？"
G["Of course!"]="当然！"
G["Of course!\n\nWhat seems to be the problem?"]="当然！\n\n是什么问题？"
G["Of course! After helping me with those weeds, sharing some hops is the least I can do. I'll have the hops delivered to Master Stormstout, in Halfhill."]="当然了！你帮我除掉那些杂草，我肯定会分你一些啤酒花。我会把啤酒花送给半山的风暴烈酒大师的。"
G["Of course! Anything for you, darling!"]="当然！没问题，亲爱的！"
G["Of course! Go with Elune's blessing."]="当然可以！愿艾露恩祝福你。"
G["Of course! Help yourselves."]="当然！别客气。"
G["Of course! I helped her back when I was in the Badlands."]="当然！我在荒芜之地的时候也帮过她的忙。"
G["Of course! It would be an honor."]="当然可以！这是我的荣幸。"
G["Of course! This codex is written in the ancient Nathrezim tongue. Nathrezim, or the Dreadlords, as you call them, were once an enlightened and powerful race. Their skill in summoning and gateway magics was unsurpassed by any in the Great Dark Beyond. \n\nThis particular tome contains instructions to open a gateway to another world. Sadly, I fear that world no longer exists. It was destroyed as a show of power during the enslavement of Xoroth.\n\nThe tome is useless, I'm afraid. No $r $c could open such a gateway alone."]="¡Por supuesto! Este códice está escrito en la antigua lengua de los Nathrezim. Los Nathrezim, o Señores del Terror, como los conoces, antes eran una raza ilustrada y poderosa. Su habilidad con la magia de portales e invocaciones no tenía parangón en toda la Gran Oscuridad del Más Allá.\n\nEste escrito en concreto explica cómo abrir un portal a otro mundo. Por desgracia, me temo que ese mundo ya no existe. Lo destruyeron como demostración de poder durante la esclavitud de Xoroth.\n\nLo siento, pero el escrito no tiene valor. $gUn:Una; $r $c sería incapaz de abrir semejante portal $gsolo:sola;."
G["Of course, $c. What is the young warrior's name?\n\nI wish more of our people shared your concern for the orphans of Orgrimmar."]="当然，$c。那位年轻战士叫什么名字？\n\n真希望我们有更多的人能像你那样关心奥格瑞玛的孤儿。"
G["Of course, $n! We're really good friends.\n\nDon't you remember the time that you saved me from that mountain hozen? And then afterward we got drunk and lost our pants?"]="¡Por supuesto, $n! Somos muy $gbuenos amigos:buenas amigas;.\n\n¿No te acuerdas de aquella vez que me salvaste de aquel hozen de la montaña? ¿Y que luego nos emborrachamos y perdimos los pantalones?"
G["Of course, $n."]="当然，$n。"
G["Of course, $n. You rescued these turtles from the Twilight's Hammer - they will follow you anywhere."]="当然可以，$n。是你把这些海龟从暮光之锤的魔爪中救了出来——他们会追随你到任何地方。"
G["Of course, Brann. We will have the shield down momentarily."]="好的，布莱恩。我们这就解除护盾。"
G["Of course, Harbinger. Dismissed."]="当然，先驱者。解散。"
G["Of course, I will share my knowledge with you."]="当然，我会和你分享我的智慧。"
G["Of course, I will share my knowledge with you.  Especially if it helps us defeat the worgen."]="当然，我会和你分享我的智慧。你可以借助这些智慧帮助我们击败狼人。"
G["Of course, Lord Zhu."]="是，祝掌门。"
G["Of course, Lucan. Here they are."]="当然，鲁坎。给你。"
G["Of course, Priestess."]="当然，女祭司。"
G["Of course, Shen-zin Su!  But your shell is large, and I do not know where this thorn could be."]="当然，神真子！可您的壳太大了，我不知道这根刺在哪儿。"
G["Of course, Son of Sen'jin. Zen'tabra always keep her word."]="不必担心，森金之子，岑塔布拉从来不会食言。"
G["Of course, Tirion. I apologize for his outburst.  It will not be repeated."]="当然，提里奥，我为他的莽撞向你致歉，我保证下不为例。"
G["Of course, Warchief!"]="遵命，酋长！"
G["Of course, Zalduun."]="当然，扎尔杜。"
G["Of course, back then, I had a lot more hair to protect it."]="当然，在那时候，我头上还有好多头发做保护。"
G["Of course, darling."]="当然啦，亲爱的。"
G["Of course, ma'am.  At once!"]="是，夫人。马上就去！"
G["Of course, mistress."]="当然，主人。"
G["Of course, my Lady."]="当然，我的女士。"
G["Of course, my friend.  You are welcome to stay with us for as long as you like."]="Por supuesto, $gamigo:amiga;. Puedes alojarte con nosotros todo el tiempo que quieras."
G["Of course, my friend. How can I be of service to you?"]="Por supuesto, $gamigo mío:amiga mía;. ¿En qué te puedo ayudar?"
G["Of course, my lady."]="当然，我的女士。"
G["Of course, my lady. Until we meet again..."]="当然，女王。再见……"
G["Of course, my mind isn't what it used to be. The only spells I'm familiar with now are dizzy spells."]="当然，我的脑子不像以前那么好使了。我现在唯一熟悉的就是眩晕法术。"
G["Of course, of course.  Please speak with Deze Snowbane at the Hall of the Brave in the Valley of Honor of this city, $c."]="当然，当然。$c，跟荣誉谷勇者大厅的迪兹·斯诺班谈谈吧。"
G["Of course, sir."]="当然，先生。"
G["Of course, somebody's going to have to take care of the small army between here and there."]="当然，总得有人去处理这两个地方之间的那支小军队。"
G["Of course, those cowards will likely sneak by rather than face my wrath."]="当然，这些懦夫很可能会悄悄溜过去而不敢直面我的怒火。"
G["Of course."]="当然。"
G["Of course.  It's all yours."]="当然。全听你的。"
G["Of course.  My staff is yours, Lord Zhu."]="当然。我任你差遣，祝掌门。"
G["Of course. By the way: you'll find several smaller vents which behave the same way, deeper in the cavern. With time, you may learn to use them to travel more efficiently within the cavern - or simply as a way to torment those gutless flamewakers."]="当然。顺便说一句，你可以在洞穴的深处找到一些功能类似的小型排气口。慢慢的，你就能学会如何利用这些排气口更加便捷在洞穴中穿行——或者是如何利用它们去折腾那些没脑子的火妖。"
G["Of course. Don't think anything of it. And I won't hear of you trying to pay me back, either!"]="不要这样说。我不想听你说什么给我报偿之类的话！"
G["Of course. Don't worry."]="当然。别担心。"
G["Of course. He awaits you in the library."]="当然，他在图书馆等您。"
G["Of course. I found it on the corpse of a dwarf nearby."]="当然。我是在附近一具矮人的尸体上找到的。"
G["Of course. I will finish shortly and meet the Mistress at the temple. Thank you, Battlemaiden."]="当然，我会立即收工，回圣殿与女王会面。谢谢你，女武士。"
G["Of course. It is only fair that we reward those who risk their lives for our cause.\n\nBy helping to defend the Vale, you will not only keep our borders safe, but you will also gain access to our vast stores of powerful treasures."]="当然。我们应该奖励那些冒死护谷的人。\n\n通过帮助保护锦绣谷，你不仅可以使边界安宁，而且还能获得我们浩如烟海的强大珍宝。"
G["Of course. Let me just take off my mask..."]="当然。等我把面具摘了……"
G["Of course. My methods are questionable. It was my methodology, I'll note, that exposed that \"Griftah\" as a fraud in the first place! You had only to keep the peace, and you failed in that simple task!"]="Por supuesto. Mis métodos son cuestionables. He de apuntar que fue mi metodología la que descubrió que \"Griftah\" era un fraude. ¡Tú solo tenías que mantener la paz y has fracasado en tan fácil tarea!"
G["Of course. We must not lose hope."]="当然。我们决不能失去希望。"
G["Of her suitors she was unimpressed"]="无数人在追求她，却得不到她明眸一瞥"
G["Of the $1998w copper bars that we'll need, we have $2018w. The number for tin bar collections sits at $2005w out of $2006w needed. And, there have been $2008w of $2009w mithril bars smelted for the cause."]="我们已经收集到$2018w块铜锭、$2005w块锡锭和$2008w块秘银锭，而总的需求量是$1998w、$2006w和$2009w。"
G["Of the many ways to prove your worth, I require the simplest of you now. I must know that you will fight for our people. I must know that you can keep them safe."]="要证明自己，方法有很多，而我的要求是最简单的。我必须知道，你是否愿意为族人而战；你是否有能力来保护他们。"
G["Off course, sir! At Vonce!"]="当然，先生！马上就办！"
G["Off to Darkshire then, I suppose."]="我想接下来该去夜色镇了。"
G["Off to Grom'Gol with you, $n!"]="祝你的格罗姆高之旅一路顺风，$n！"
G["Off to Orgrimmar with you, $n!"]="祝你的奥格瑞玛之旅一路顺风，$n！"
G["Off to Orgrimmar with you, $n. Say hi to Thrall for me!"]="祝你的奥格瑞玛之旅一路顺风，$n。代我向萨尔问好！"
G["Off to the Undercity with you, $n!"]="祝你的幽暗城之旅一路顺风，$n！"
G["Off to the Undercity with you, $n! Try not to catch the plague..."]="祝你的幽暗城之旅一路顺风，$n！小心不要摔跤……"
G["Off we go!"]="我们出发吧！"
G["Off with his head!"]="干掉他！"
G["Off with you!"]="滚开！"
G["Off with you, $c. You have much to do."]="去吧，$c。你还有很多事情要做。"
G["Off with you, $n!"]="走开，$n！"
G["Off with your head!"]="斩首一击！"
G["Off-lander smell like rotton dooker!"]="¡$gExtraño:Extraña; huele a miko pocho!"
G["Off-landers bringin' shinies to hozen?!"]="迷路鬼给猢狲送亮晶晶来啦？！"
G["Offer them no mercy, not after what they've done."]="想想他们的所作所为，不要对他们手软。"
G["Officer's Lounge"]="军官的休息室"
G["Officer: Looks like we've made it through enemy lines, General."]="军官：看来我们已经突破了敌人的防线，将军。"
G["Officer: Still no sign of the missing transport."]="军官：仍没发现失踪运输机的踪迹。"
G["Officers' Lounge"]="军官的休息室"
G["Official Explorers' League business, McGoyver. Take me to the Explorers' League Outpost!"]="米克高维尔，我负责处理探险者协会的官方事宜。带我去探险者协会哨站！"
G["Official business, John. I need some information about Marshal Windsor. Tell me about the last time you saw him."]="约翰，我有公务在身。我需要一切有关温德索尔元帅的信息。你最后一次见他是什么时候？"
G["Official postings by Wintergarde citizenry and officials."]="暮冬要塞的市民与官员联名发布的官方公告。"
G["Oftentimes, the silent grasshopper knows how to best avoid the boot."]="俗话说得好，树大易招风，菇小可避雨。"
G["Ogo, I need another Pot of Fire."]="傲古，再给我一个火罐。"
G["Ograbisi needs new hat!"]="奥格拉比斯需要新的帽子！"
G["Ogre Costume"]="食人魔装束"
G["Ogre Disguise"]="食人魔的服装"
G["Ogre Mage Costume"]="食人魔法师装束"
G["Ogre Pinata"]="食人魔皮纳塔"
G["Ogre look funny."]="食人魔看起来很有趣。"
G["Ogre!"]="食人魔！"
G["Ogre, leave!"]="食人魔，快走开！"
G["Ogre, please leave.  You are disturbing our clientele!"]="食人魔，请离开这里。你正在打扰我们的客户！"
G["Ogres.\n\nI hate ogres."]="食人魔。\n\n我恨食人魔。"
G["Oh $n, as your best friend, I'd really like to give you something. I thought your farm could use a little sprucing up, so I had some folks install some new furniture in your house. I hope you like it!"]="哦，$n，作为你的挚友，我真想送你些东西。我觉得你的农场需要一点装饰，所以我找人给你家装了些新家具。希望你会喜欢！"
G["Oh - I fowgot the voodoo to enwawge them."]="哦，我忘记了用魔法拴住他们。"
G["Oh - I may have spoken too soon. The sha grows in strength! Destroy it!"]="噢——我好像言之过早了。煞魔变强了！消灭它！"
G["Oh - I see them - a million, million worlds - glittering in their perfection - but one above all others - oh -"]="噢——我看见了——数百万个世界——闪烁着完美的光芒——其中一颗特别璀璨——噢——"
G["Oh - I've said too much!"]="哦，我已经说得太多了！"
G["Oh - of course you haven't heard of the Vale.\n\nTwelve thousand years ago, it was the seat of Mogu power, the heart of an empire. Legend tells of sacred pools in there, the source of Mogu magic that allowed them to twist and shape flesh. But they could also be used for healing miracles. That is, if you believe in the legends.\n\nAfter the pandaren revolution, the Celestials agreed to seal away the Vale, so that the power of the pools could never be used for mischief."]="噢——你当然没有听说过锦绣谷。\n\n一万两千年前，它是魔古大军的基地，也是魔古帝国的心脏。传说那里有圣池，这是魔古法力的源泉。魔古族可以借助于魔古法力扭曲和改变肉身。但圣池也可以用于治愈神迹。这要看你是否相信传说。\n\n在熊猫人革命之后，天神同意封印锦绣谷，这样就无法滥用圣池的法力了。"
G["Oh - this is terrible. Why would Leyara cling to this memory? Valstann must have been an important part of her life..."]="哦……这太可怕了。为什么莱雅娜会执着于这段回忆？瓦斯坦恩一定是个对她非常重要的人……"
G["Oh Buddy, you big baby!  Look, it's working.  It's really working!!  Now all I need to do is grow more of these mushrooms here and the bog lords will likely leave the sporelings alone!"]="¡Oh, vaya! ¡$gpobrecito:pobrecita;! Mira, funciona. ¡Funciona de verdad! ¡Ahora solo necesito cultivar más champiñones de estos y los señores de la marisma dejarán a los esporines vivir en paz!"
G["Oh Fanny! No Fanny, don't flee!"]="哦，范妮！不，范妮不要逃！"
G["Oh Feknut, hush!"]="菲纳特，嘘！"
G["Oh Festergut, you were always my favorite -- next to Rotface.  The good news is that you left behind so much gas. I can practically taste it!"]="哦烂肠，你是我的最爱，仅次于腐面。不过你的死给我留下了那么多毒气，我都快被熏死了！"
G["Oh Fish? That sweet girl lives up at the docks to the north.\n\nI've known that girl since she was a little'un.\n\nShe's always digging in mud or swimmng in the lake or jumping off trees. Her parents sure named her right, cuz she's as slippery as a fish."]="哦，玉儿？那个可爱的女孩住在北边码头。\n\n我在她还是个小姑娘的时候就认识她了。\n\n她总是在泥里挖来挖去，或在湖里游来游去，或在林间上串下跳。她父母还真给她起对名字了，因为她就像鱼一样滑溜。"
G["Oh I got something for you to 'taste'! Come a little closer..."]="¡Oh, tengo algo que quiero que \"pruebes\"! Acércate un poco más..."
G["Oh I'm sorry... did my totem offend your delicate sensibilities? Fine. Here. Now get to work!"]="喔抱歉……我的图腾冒犯到脆弱敏感的你了？好吧。看这儿。现在回去干活！"
G["Oh Masha..."]="噢，玛莎……"
G["Oh Syra, Syra. She is the most beautiful person I have ever met and the kindest soul to ever walk Pandaria.\n\nWe want to get married but she is a Goldendraft, and I'm a Wanderbrew."]="噢，塞拉，塞拉！她是我见过的最美丽的人儿，她有着全潘达利亚最善良的灵魂。\n\n我们想要结婚，可她姓金酿，而我姓游酒。"
G["Oh Tito, we simply must find a way home! The old wizard could be our only hope! Strawman, Roar, Tinhead, will you - wait... oh golly, look we have visitors!"]="啊，托托，我们必须找到回家的路！那位老巫师是我们唯一的希望了！稻草人、狮子，还有铁皮人，你们能不能——呀，有人来了！"
G["Oh Umi, please teach me again how to create a Tranquil Yeti. I miss it so."]="乌米！告诉我怎么制作机械雪人吧！我很想念它。"
G["Oh Zan! You remind me so much of your father."]="噢，岑！你可真像你的父亲。"
G["Oh Zanzil, Zanzil. I jes' love dat voodoo dat you do."]="哦，赞吉尔，赞吉尔。我和你一样爱巫毒。"
G["Oh alright! Don't get your trousers in a bunch!"]="噢，够了！别再垂头丧气了！"
G["Oh at last, at last I can go home!"]="啊，我终于……终于可以回家啦！"
G["Oh aye, this'll teach yeh to stop doin' whatever yeh done did."]="没错，这只是给你个教训，以后别再干那种蠢事了！"
G["Oh boy Jones and I have had some adventures..."]="以前，我和琼斯总是一起外出探险……"
G["Oh boy! A new program! Let's see here... BLOW MYSELF UP?!"]="天呐！一个新程序！让我们看看……自爆？！"
G["Oh boy. Do you suppose Sputtervalve will mind if the shredder is just a little bit ... inoperable?"]="哦，小子，你觉得，如果伐木机有一点……不正常，斯布特瓦夫会介意吗？"
G["Oh boy. Luckydo don't fail me now."]="噢，天呐。幸运符居然在这会儿坑我。"
G["Oh boy... I can't believe I just remembered that..."]="天哪……我居然还记得这些往事，真不敢相信……"
G["Oh brother, not this again... Have a seat $g sonny:missy;.\n\nI'm sure Rutgar has told you some of this story already so I'll spare you the boring details and get right down to the nitty gritty."]="哦，就是这样了……先找个椅子，$g小伙子:小姑娘;。\n\n我肯定鲁特加尔已经告诉你一些事情了，因此我将省略一些细节，让你直奔主题。"
G["Oh brother... Listen, he's gonna be here crying like a baby for another five hours. If you're really the son of Turalyon, go speak with Trollbane. He's in the keep - top floor."]="哦，兄弟……我跟你说，他至少还要像婴儿那样再哭上五个小时才算罢休。如果你真的是图拉扬的儿子，就去和托尔贝恩谈谈吧。他就在要塞的顶楼。"
G["Oh c'mon, that's not true."]="嘿，得了吧，那不是真的。"
G["Oh come now, don't be ridiculous! I'm the one and only Budd Nedreck!\n\nI've been all over this land, from the top of Mount Hyjal to the depths of the Sunken Temple. In fact, I was the first to call it the Sunken Temple!\n\nYes, that was me. Don't give it a second thought."]="Vamos, ¡no seas ridículo! ¡Yo soy el único Budd Magallenas!\n\nHe recorrido toda esta tierra, desde lo alto del Monte Hyjal hasta las profundidades del Templo Sumergido. ¡De hecho, yo fui el primero en llamarlo el Templo Sumergido!\n\nSí, fui yo. Pero no lo pienses demasiado."
G["Oh come on! We've been doin' this all day!"]="噢得了吧！我们已经忙活了一整天了！"
G["Oh come on! What about us?!"]="哦，天哪！我们怎么办？！"
G["Oh come on. As if I haven't been through enough."]="喔拜托。看来我经历得还不够多。"
G["Oh come on. What was that? Was that a punch? That didn't look like a punch. That looked like a cry for help."]="噢，得了吧。那是什么？那是一记重拳吗？看起来一点也不像。倒像是在哭着求人救命呢。"
G["Oh darn. You're our only hope. Survive!"]="该死！你是我们唯一的希望。别死啊！"
G["Oh dear lords of stone and steel, what... I repeat... WHAT are ya gonna do with that?"]="噢，尊贵的岩石与钢铁领主，您……您打算如何处理呢 ？"
G["Oh dear! He wasn't able to do it after all. And it seems he's paid the ultimate price to try."]="噢，亲爱的！它终究还是没能挺过来。看来，它的努力让它付出了最沉重的代价。"
G["Oh dear! It looks like we've got company... You take care of those mongrels, and I'll get the brew going."]="噢宝贝儿！看来我们有伴了……你解决那些混蛋，我去酿酒。"
G["Oh dear! What happened here?"]="哦，亲爱的！这里发生了什么？"
G["Oh dear, I am running dangerously low on supplies! What is taking that blasted goblin so long?"]="唉，我现在的补给品储量已经非常少了！是什么耽搁了那个该死的地精那么长时间？"
G["Oh dear, I'm losing!"]="哦天哪，我要输了！"
G["Oh dear, Lieutenant General, how ghastly! I would most certainly never. I shall return to my charges, now."]="天哪，中将，太可怕了！我保证再也不会了。我现在就交出管理权。"
G["Oh dear, where is the \"Codex of Defense?\" Lydros will be most assuredly displeased."]="Oh, no, ¿dónde está el \"Códice de Defensa?\" Lydros se disgustará mucho."
G["Oh dear.  Things aren't looking good for Felix."]="哦，天哪。菲利克斯的情况并不乐观。"
G["Oh dear. Speedy, help!"]="噢，天呐……飞毛腿，来帮忙！"
G["Oh dear..."]="啊……"
G["Oh dear... I'm sorry, but it looks like you're going to have to fight Proboskus."]="哦，天哪……对不起，你的对手好像是普罗波库斯。"
G["Oh dear...this could get messy. I will observe from a safer distance!"]="噢……这恐怕要糟糕。我还是把它留给你，然后远远地看着吧。"
G["Oh don't you worry none, I don't think anyone wants to touch that thing again.  I'll collect our money and we are outta here."]="别紧张，我想没人愿意再碰那玩意儿了。只要拿到钱，我们马上就离开这儿。"
G["Oh exalted one! Through me you shall melt flesh from bone!"]="噢，至高的神！借我之手融化他们的血肉吧！"
G["Oh gods! It's not dead! RUN!"]="哦上帝！它还没死！快跑！"
G["Oh gods, $n, these mogu heads are staring at me!"]="噢天呐，$n，这些魔古脑袋正在瞪着我呢！"
G["Oh gods, someone get me out of this cage!"]="喔上帝，快来人把我从这笼子里弄出去！"
G["Oh good to see you again! Clever Ashyo is derk for company."]="噢，很高兴再次见到你！聪明的阿西约是个烂伙伴。"
G["Oh good, I was beginning to worry."]="那就好，我都有点开始担心了。"
G["Oh good, a $c who looks like $Ghe:she; knows $Ghis:her; way around a battlefield."]="噢，真不错，像$g他:她;这样的$c完全清楚自己在战场上的位置。"
G["Oh good, a $g hero : heroine; of the land. Come, let us speak, $c."]="噢，很好，是这一带的$g大英雄:女英雄;啊。过来，我们聊聊吧，$c。"
G["Oh good, reinforcements!"]="哎呀，是援军啊！"
G["Oh good, you're here to rescue me. Now let me out of here!"]="啊，你是来救我的吧。快带我离开这个鬼地方！"
G["Oh goodness, you did it, $n, you really did it!\n\nNow, by my calculations, if we do not get this bucket sailing very very soon, there is the increasing likelihood of one of those giant volcano rocks shooting through the air and smashing the yacht to smithereens.\n\nShall we?"]="¡Vaya, lo has conseguido, $n, lo has conseguido de verdad!\n\nSegún mis cálculos, si no zarpamos ya mismo hay muchas probabilidades de que una de esas rocas volcánicas gigantes que vuelan por los aires aplaste este yate y lo rompa en mil pedazos.\n\n¿Nos vamos?"
G["Oh goody! I haven't had a break since the day before yesterday!"]="哦，好啊！从前天到现在，我还完全没休息过呢！"
G["Oh goody! The party's about to start!"]="啊，太好了！聚会就要开始了！"
G["Oh goody! Time to fight fire with...highly flammable weapons grade explosives!"]="哇，太棒啦！是时候让那些火元素尝尝……高度易燃的爆炸类武器的厉害啦！"
G["Oh gosh! Oh golly! You're gonna put out the fires and stop those pirates from getting on the Speedbarge, right?!!"]="喔天哪！喔神哪！你会扑灭火焰，并阻止那些海盗登上赛艇平台，是吧？！！"
G["Oh great Flaskataur, allow me to purchase your goods."]="伟大的Flaskataur，让我购买你出售的货物吧。"
G["Oh great Queen of the Dragons, I have somehow misplaced my Heroic Key to the Focusing Iris. Can you find it for me?"]="伟大的红龙女王，我弄丢了英雄聚焦之虹的钥匙。能帮我找回来吗？"
G["Oh great Queen of the Dragons, I have somehow misplaced my Key to the Focusing Iris. Can you find it for me?"]="伟大的红龙女王，我弄丢了聚焦之虹的钥匙。能帮我找回来吗？"
G["Oh great luckydos! What is THAT!?"]="噢！伟大的幸运符！那是什么？！"
G["Oh great spirit! Grant me the power of the earth!"]="噢，伟大的神灵！赐予我大地的力量！"
G["Oh great! Someone else has come to bother me."]="噢，好极了！又有人来烦我了。"
G["Oh great, thanks. That looks...um...delicious."]="哦，太好了，谢谢。这看上去……嗯……一定很美味。"
G["Oh great... not this one again. I know this orc. He's got no business being here, but since he's a bottom-feeding pansy he likes to hang around here and prey on the helpless. Don't let him bully you."]="哦，好啊……这个也不是。我知道这个兽人。他不做什么正经事，只是在这里四处晃荡，靠敲诈欺凌为生。别让他吓唬了你。"
G["Oh hello! Haven't seen you around before..."]="噢，你好！以前没见过你……"
G["Oh hello! I was just about to reel in this catch. I have a hunch it's going to be a doozy!"]="噢，你好啊！我正打算收线呢。我有预感，这是个大家伙！"
G["Oh hello, Jena. Of course you can borrow some grain. Help yourself."]="嗨，珍娜。没问题。想要多少都可以。"
G["Oh hells no! Those things are death-traps!"]="哦，天哪，不！这些东西都是死亡陷阱！"
G["Oh hey $n... Gina's a voting member of the Tillers, so... try and make a good impression, okay?"]="噢你好，$n……吉娜是阡陌客的表决成员，所以……试着给她留个好印象，好吗？"
G["Oh hey! $n! You want to fight today?"]="嘿！$n！你今天想上场吗？"
G["Oh hi! My name's Sarah. What can I do for you?"]="哦你好！我的名字是萨拉。我能为你做什么吗？"
G["Oh hi. Who you? Want be friends?"]="嗨。你是谁？我们来做好朋友吧？"
G["Oh ho ho ho ho! By my beard, I thought I was done for! Oh, thank ye. Thank ye!"]="噢，以我胡须的名义，我还以为死定了呢！谢谢你们！谢谢你们！"
G["Oh ho ho, this is for me? Thank you."]="哦，嚯嚯，这是给我的吗？谢谢你。"
G["Oh ho ho, you and I are going to have a LOT of fun together!"]="嚯嚯，我们一定可以找到很多乐趣的！"
G["Oh hoh, you tickle me. But I be done playin' with you."]="哦呵呵，你是在给我挠痒痒。我已经玩够了。"
G["Oh hooray - you killed the bad troll just in time to save me from being helplessly slaughtered and having my innocent little soul enslaved and used to add power to their wicked scheme to take over Azeroth and seeing how you have risked your lives to free me from certain death I must repay your kindness regardless of who you are or where you may have come from so help me out of here and I will do my best to find some way to reward you....\n\n<Ashli takes a deep breath.>\n\nI hope you like candy...."]="哇噢——你杀死了巨魔坏蛋不仅挽救了我的性命使我幼小而纯洁的灵魂免遭奴役还粉碎了他们企图利用我的力量来帮助他们统治艾泽拉斯世界的邪恶计划你冒着生命危险将我从死亡的边缘拉了回来因此不管你是谁也不管你从哪儿来我都要好好地报答你的救命之恩你相信我啦我会竭尽所能地报答你的……\n\n<阿什莉深深地吸了口气。>\n\n我希望你会喜欢糖果……"
G["Oh it's just so horrible, $g sir:miss;. The house Barov was once full of life... full of splendor. The manor was the Barov's primary residence amidst their far reaching empire.\n\nLucien and I noticed that as the days progressed, the Barovs became depressed. Despondent. Paranoia and rage often overcame the master and missus. At night, we could hear the Barovs arguing in their chambers. From what we understood, their greed had 'broken the dam,' so to speak."]="Oh, es horrible, $gseñor:señora;. La casa Barov estaba llena de vida... llena de esplendor. La mansión era la residencia principal de los Barov en el centro de sus enormes dominios.\n\nLucien y yo observamos que a medida que avanzaban los días, los Barov parecían cada vez más hundidos, un ambiente depresivo. Abatidos. A menudo la ira y la paranoia invadían al señor y a su esposa. Por la noche podíamos oírles discutir en sus habitaciones. Por lo que podíamos entender, su codicia \"se había desbordado\", por decirlo de algún modo."
G["Oh look at you, giving little old Gina such a lovely gift. Thank you!"]="瞧啊，你给小老太吉娜送了一个这么可爱的礼物。谢谢你！"
G["Oh look, we are here. Later!"]="哦，看呀，我们到了。回头见！"
G["Oh man, I thought I was dead for sure.  Ugh... still dizzy..."]="啊，真悬，我以为自己这次铁定玩完了。呃……还是有点晕……"
G["Oh man, I'm glad someone is here! Things are CRAZY down here! Crazier than usual!"]="喔伙计，终于有人来了！这下面简直疯狂透顶！比疯狂还要疯狂！"
G["Oh man, he got you good!"]="哦，他待你真好！"
G["Oh man, zombies?"]="哦，僵尸？"
G["Oh man, zombies?\n\nNeed some training?"]="哦，僵尸？\n\n需要进行训练吗？"
G["Oh mighty Quagmirran, we beseech thee to welcome us into your presence!"]="哦，强大的夸格米拉，我们恳请你欢迎我们的到来！"
G["Oh most unluckiest of days! What is THAT!?"]="噢！最不幸的日子！那是什么？"
G["Oh my - as I suspected. Your ancestry dates back to the dawn of the world. Great were the ancient empires of the trolls. I see a spark in your eyes, a powerful will - you wish to be great again, yes?"]="噢——果然不出所料。你们的祖先诞生于世界起源之日；强大的巨魔帝国盛极一时。你的眼中闪烁着复兴的火花和强大的意志，不是吗？"
G["Oh my friend - that awful sound. For a hundred hundred generations the crash of thunder filled the hearts of pandaren with terror."]="噢，我的朋友——那可怕的声音。数百年来，雷电可怕的巨响一直在熊猫人心中回荡。"
G["Oh my goodness! Oh my goodness! Someone get me out of here! I have claustro.. claustro... claustro.. er, a fear of being trapped in a cage!"]="喔我的天哪！喔我的天哪！快来人放我出去！我有幽闭恐惧症……幽闭……幽闭……呃，反正就是怕被关在笼子里！"
G["Oh my gosh! Keep your voice down, $n! What? Are you trying to get us killed?!\n\nOf course I know who you are! Who in the Alliance doesn't know the name, $n?!\n\nSay, what do you think of my jumpbot? She's based off of the mechagnome design. Sleek and aerodynamic!"]="¡Cielos! ¡Baja la voz, $n! ¿Qué? ¿Quieres que nos maten?\n\nClaro, ¡ya sé quién eres! ¿Hay alguien en la Alianza que no conozca tu nombre, $n?\n\nDime, ¿Qué te parece mi saltarrobot? Está basado en el diseño de los mecagnomos. ¡Elegante y aerodinámico!"
G["Oh my gosh! Thank you SO much! You have no idea how much this means to me. You're the sweetest thing!"]="哦，天哪！真的是非常感谢你。你不知道这对我有多么重要。你真是最好的人！"
G["Oh my!  Look at the state of these books!  Who put them back without alphabetizing them??"]="哦，我的天啊！看看这一堆书！是谁把这些书没归类就胡乱地放回书架上的？"
G["Oh my!  What is this?  Hello!  I am Lorewalker Cho!"]="噢！什么？你好！我是游学者周卓！"
G["Oh my! A new urgency has hardened your resolve. I suppose my work here is done."]="天呐！急迫的形势坚定了你的决心。我在这儿的任务已经完成了。"
G["Oh my! Look at this... all these candles. I'm sure they're used for some terrible ritual or dark summoning. We best make haste!"]="啊，天哪！看看这……这些蜡烛。我敢肯定它们是被用来进行某种可怕而黑暗的仪式的。我们最好快一点！"
G["Oh my! What's this? Help!"]="哦，天呀！这是什么？快来帮忙！"
G["Oh my, a visitor. Your presence makes me very happy."]="Oh, $gun:una; visitante. Tu presencia me llena de alegría."
G["Oh my, let me change those bandages!"]="哦……见鬼，让我换个绷……带！"
G["Oh my, this Twin Fish Platter smells delicious. Thank you!"]="我的老天，这份鸳鸯鱼拼盘闻着太诱人了。谢谢你！"
G["Oh my, this is bad..."]="哦，天啊，糟糕……"
G["Oh my, this is beautiful. How did you know that I like jewels?"]="哦天啊，太漂亮了。你怎么知道我喜欢珠宝？"
G["Oh my, what a surprise! Another failure!? But how, oh great one??"]="我的天，我太惊讶了！又一次失败啦！？怎么会呢？？"
G["Oh my, what has overcome our Dark Lady?"]="噢，天呐，我们的黑暗女王怎么了？"
G["Oh my, what is that thing?"]="天哪，那是什么？"
G["Oh my, yes. In order to maximize both range and payload, we've concocted an unorthodox blend of rocket fuels for the state-of-the-art engines."]="哦，是了。为了让飞艇的续航力和有效载荷达到最大化，我们还为它殿堂级的伟大引擎调配了一种非正统的火箭燃料。"
G["Oh my, you got me something? Why how can I ever thank you?"]="我的老天，你要送我东西？我该如何感谢你啊？"
G["Oh my."]="喔我的天。"
G["Oh my. Ye must be the hero that everyone's been tellin' me about."]="¡Vaya, vaya! Tú debes de ser $gel héroe del:la heroína de la; que habla todo el mundo."
G["Oh my..."]="啊……"
G["Oh my... hang on tight!"]="天哪……抓紧！"
G["Oh my... someone became ill from my bread?  How can this be?  Please, I hope my meager earnings are enough to help out."]="喔我的天……居然有人因吃我的面包而生病了？这怎么可能？拜托了，希望我这微薄的收入能解决这困局。"
G["Oh my... we made it to the other side somehow. I am so relieved.\n\nIt is not an easy thing to create a portal to a place you have never been before.\n\nBut then, if it were easy, everybody would be doing it."]="噢天哪……我们到另一侧来了。这真让我欣慰。\n\n开启一道通往陌生地方的传送门可不是件容易的事啊。\n\n可要是容易的话，岂不是人人都能做到了。"
G["Oh my...that is an impressive weapon."]="哦天哪……那武器真不一般。"
G["Oh no not de bar! Take it outside, mon!"]="哦不，别在酒吧里闹事！去外面解决，伙计！"
G["Oh no you did not just talk to me!"]="哦，不，别和我说话！"
G["Oh no you didn't!"]="哦，不，你不能那样！"
G["Oh no you don't!"]="哦不，不是吧！"
G["Oh no you don't! You'll stop practicing when I'm damn well ready for you to stop practicing! KEEP GOING!"]="休想！我没让你们休息之前，就继续练习练习再练习！继续！"
G["Oh no you don't. I'm two steps ahead of you, squirt. We'll see who razes Lost Rigger Cove first."]="喔不，你不会的。我比你要快两步，小不点儿。让我们瞧瞧谁能先把落帆海湾夷为平地。"
G["Oh no!"]="不！"
G["Oh no!  $n is looking hurt!"]="¡Oh, no! ¡$n parece $gherido:herida;!"
G["Oh no!  Does this thing need ANOTHER recalibration?"]="哦，不！这东西需要另一个刻度吗？"
G["Oh no!  Here they come!"]="啊，注意！"
G["Oh no!  I'm losing this one!"]="啊，不！这一个快不行了！"
G["Oh no!  It's out of control!  Run!"]="啊啊啊！它失控了！快跑！"
G["Oh no!  The X-52 Nether-Rocket is being attacked!  Guards!  Guards!"]="哦，天哪！X-52虚空火箭被攻击了！卫兵！卫兵！"
G["Oh no!  What's that?  Quickly, defend us with the Scrap Reaver X6000!!!"]="天哪！那是什么？快点，派再造机甲X6000型来保护我们！！！"
G["Oh no!  Where are we?  What happened?  Look, there's part of the ship!"]="天啊！我在哪里？发生了什么事？看，那是飞船的一部分！"
G["Oh no!  Why do you kill it?"]="哦，不！为什么你要杀它？"
G["Oh no!  Will I ever get you working?!"]="天哪！我什么时候才能让你运转起来？"
G["Oh no! Captain Ook? I thought he was only a legend."]="噢不！乌克头领？我以为他只是传说。"
G["Oh no! Look at those huts! Why are they attacking defenseless villagers?"]="哦不！看看那些小屋！ 他们为什么要攻击手无寸铁的村民？"
G["Oh no! Prince Anduin!"]="哦，不！安度因王子！"
G["Oh no! Some puppy-men followed!"]="不妙！我们被狗狗人跟踪了！"
G["Oh no! That wasn't good..."]="噢不！那可不太妙……"
G["Oh no! The key broke in the lock! I'll never get out of this cage!"]="喔不！钥匙断在锁眼里了！我永远也别想离开这笼子了！"
G["Oh no! They've spotted us! Hang on -- I'll get us out of here!"]="哦，不！他们发现我们了！抓紧——我们要马上逃走！"
G["Oh no! Where is everyone? I dropped them off here!"]="哦不！人都去哪儿了？我把他们放在这儿的！"
G["Oh no, I didn't get you anything in return! Boo..."]="噢，不好，我没有给你任何东西作为回报！嘘……"
G["Oh no, Ji! They are going to execute him!"]="噢，不，季！他们要砍掉他的头！"
G["Oh no, Sputtervalve is going to kill me! Sigh...You'd better find your own transportation from here. I have to pick up the pieces and start the long walk back to camp..."]="哦，不，斯布特瓦夫一定会杀了我的！唉……剩下的路你自己走吧，我还要把火箭残骸收集好，踏上返回营地的漫漫长路……"
G["Oh no, did you forget to heal yourself?"]="哦不！你忘记给自己治疗了吗？"
G["Oh no, he was merely an instrument, a stepping stone to a much larger plan! It has all led to this... and this time you will not interfere!"]="噢，显然不是，我只是利用他而已，他不过是我庞大计划的一个垫脚石！我真正的目标在这里……而且，这一次不会再被你们干扰到了！"
G["Oh no, it didn't work! Somehow I feel... lighter."]="天哪，这玩意儿不行啊！我觉得有点……轻飘飘的。"
G["Oh no, no, no... I'm a rocket man."]="哦，不，不，不……我是飞行员。"
G["Oh no, not the transmatter... it'll probably malfunction!"]="不要！别动那台转换器……它很可能会出故障！"
G["Oh no, not you again!  Go away!"]="啊，怎么又是你！滚开！"
G["Oh no, we've lost a patient. Do not despair, $n. They were too far gone already."]="噢，不。我们失去了一位病人。不过别难过，$n。他们已经坚持得够久了。"
G["Oh no, what if he thinks I'm too furry? What if he doesn't like black and white women?"]="噢，不，如果他认为我太多毛了呢？如果他不喜欢黑白相间的女子呢？"
G["Oh no, you don't...."]="哦，不，你不能……"
G["Oh no..."]="哦，不……"
G["Oh no... Bambala...  It look like we already too late.  Da Zandalar attack, it begun."]="哦不……邦巴拉……看来我们太迟了，赞达拉已经发动进攻了。"
G["Oh no... I'm not done with you."]="哦，不……我和你的事情还没有结束。"
G["Oh no... Mist... what has happened...?"]="天哪……密斯特……发生了什么事情……？"
G["Oh no... Quetz'lun is dead! Stay still. We'll sneak past the prophet."]="天哪……奎丝鲁恩死了！别动。我们偷偷绕过先知。"
G["Oh no... they've shackled his spirit!"]="噢不……他们禁锢了他的灵魂！"
G["Oh now you've gone and angered me! Time to see the true force of the Stone of Tides!"]="你彻底地激怒了我！我要让你好好见识一下海潮之石的真正力量！"
G["Oh panda girl... Jooga want feed you banana!"]="哦，熊猫人女孩……尤噶想喂你吃香蕉！"
G["Oh really?\n\nFine.  I don't want to join you and your Forsaken.  Maybe I'll start my own Forsaken!  Maybe I'll invent Forsaken with elbows!"]="喔，真的吗？\n\n好的。我不想与你和你的被遗忘者为伍。也许我会创造属于自己的被遗忘者！也许我会创造出肘部会动的被遗忘者！"
G["Oh really?  What exactly will you do, dwarf?  There's nobody to save you here."]="哦，真的？你还能做些什么，矮人？这里可没有人能救你。"
G["Oh really? And what might that be?"]="真的吗？那会是什么？"
G["Oh sage of the ages! Instill to me your arcane wisdom!"]="噢，上古的贤者！赐予我魔法的智慧吧！"
G["Oh samophlange... I have failed you!"]="喔主动式负载平衡器……我让你失望了！"
G["Oh shut up, you dolt.  YOU probably want to kiss her a hundred times."]="喔闭嘴，你这白痴。恐怕是你想要亲她一百遍吧。"
G["Oh so much pain..."]="哦，非常痛苦……"
G["Oh stop complaining and grab the stick!"]="噢，别再抱怨了，抓住棍子！"
G["Oh stop! You're going to make me turn red and then someone is going to mistake me for Ethereum and kill me."]="停下！你这样会让我变红，然后就会有人把我错当成复仇军并把把我干掉！"
G["Oh sure, another year of fighting. Enormous casualties trying to take Thunder Bluff. But the rest of the Horde would've caved, eventually."]="当然，还是得打一仗。要想攻陷雷霆崖必然会伤亡惨重。但其他部落成员一定会逐渐崩溃。"
G["Oh sure, bein' a nurse is fine and all for fixin' folk up after all the hard work's been done.  Don't let that Mishka fool ya."]="哦，的确，当护士也不错，只需在硬仗打完之后安顿好伤员。别让米希卡耍了你。"
G["Oh sure, she said, it'll be a simple trip out into the wastes."]="没错，她是这么说的：“只是一次前往废土的简单旅程，毫无压力。”"
G["Oh sweet, delicious, spotted eggs - you will be mine..."]="啊，美味的鸟蛋啊……你们都将是我的……"
G["Oh sweetheart, grandpoppy has passed. It will be ok."]="哦，宝贝，爷爷去世了。一切都会好起来的。"
G["Oh thank you hero! You have given us a great gift!"]="Muchas gracias, $ghéroe:heroína;. Nos has dado una gran bendición."
G["Oh thank you! Thank you! Thank you!"]="哦，谢谢！谢谢！谢谢！"
G["Oh that looksh delishush. It will go great with my cold drink here."]="哦，它看起来很好吃。它搭配我的冷饮一起吃会很不错。"
G["Oh that's a big one!"]="¡Oh, es $guno de los:una de las; grandes!"
G["Oh that's a fine piece o' metal you have der. I am quite fond of a good piece of steel."]="噢，你手里拿的可是块上佳的金属啊。我对精良的钢材总是相当钟爱。"
G["Oh that's right, don't make any effort to make your own fortune!"]="行啦，别白费力气了！"
G["Oh that. Bah, I've been through worse. And who exactly are you?"]="噢，对。呸，我遇到过更糟的事呢。你是谁？"
G["Oh the big hero has arrived. I'm saved! Yea, right..."]="¡Oh, $gel gran héroe:la gran heroína; ha venido! ¡Estoy salvado! Sí, claro..."
G["Oh the drama and fuss the young Master exerted. You would think the fate of the world rested squarely on his shoulders. Only mortals could have such a skewed perspective on our world.\n\nAlas, he left me with his meager magical secrets... Librams or some such nonsense. I have no use for these paultry magics but perhaps you might be interested in their enchantments."]="哦，年轻的主人制造的这一系列事件和慌乱。可以想象，世界的命运就掌控在他手中。只有人类才会对世界产生这种扭曲的看法。\n\n唉，他将奥术的秘密都告诉了我……圣契之类的无用之物。这种东西对我来说是一无是处，但是或许你对它们感兴趣。"
G["Oh the horror! The tragedy! We are on the verge of a breakthrough, yet all could be lost."]="哦，真恐怖！这是个悲剧！我们就要突破啦，但也有可能遭遇全军覆灭的惨剧。"
G["Oh the pain!"]="疼死我了！"
G["Oh this will be fun..."]="噢，这一定很有趣……"
G["Oh wait! I'm supposed to be looking for that mysterious fossil!"]="哦，不对！我是来寻找那块化石的！"
G["Oh wait, I have a better one!"]="噢，等等，我有了一个更好的主意！"
G["Oh wait, that's Hollee's tent... and it's empty."]="哦，等等，那是霍莉的帐篷……但它是空的。"
G["Oh well, I was starting to miss my pals anyway - they're not gunna believe this! Oh, here - you can have this, I found it playin' hide and seek."]="我开始想念我的朋友了——他们肯定不会相信我的经历！哦，给你——这是我在玩捉迷藏游戏的时候找到的。"
G["Oh well, I'm sure she'll be around later."]="哦，好吧，我相信她会回来的。"
G["Oh well, back to the drawing board."]="好吧，重新制定计划吧。"
G["Oh well."]="哦，好吧。"
G["Oh well... Maybe next time."]="哦，好吧……或许下次可以。"
G["Oh well...."]="哦，好吧……"
G["Oh will you? Do you dare cross that line and risk your life?"]="哦你会吗？你敢冒生命危险做这种越界的事情吗？"
G["Oh woe. Low. Low."]="噢，唉。低点。低点。"
G["Oh wow!"]="哦，哇喔！"
G["Oh wow! It was like \"Rawwr!\" and you were like \"Kahpowww!\""]="¡Guau! Ha sido como \"¡Grrr!\" y luego tú has hecho \"¡Pum!\"."
G["Oh wow, yer givin' that to me? I don't know how to thank ya!"]="哇，你要把它送给我？我都不知道该怎么感谢你了！"
G["Oh yah, uh huh."]="喔呀，啊哈。"
G["Oh yeah!"]="哈哈哈！"
G["Oh yeah! Tremble at the might of our catapults!"]="喔耶！在我们强大的投石车面前战栗吧！"
G["Oh yeah, $glad:lass;! Been through 4 times already."]="哦，$g小伙子:姑娘;！已经4次了。"
G["Oh yeah, I got a million spares just hanging around."]="喔好的，我这儿还有几百万个没人要呢。"
G["Oh yeah, I got muffins!"]="来看看我的松饼吧！"
G["Oh yeah, I heard about that."]="是啊是啊，我听说过。"
G["Oh yeah, I've brought plenty of onyx eggs to Elder Anli. Whenever I give her one, I rise higher in the ranks of the Order."]="哦耶，我给安离长老带去了许多玛瑙翔龙蛋。我每给她一枚，就使自己在骑士团中的地位得到了提升。"
G["Oh yeah, I've never seen them personally, but sometimes I hear them in the distance. Keep a watchful eye out for them if you venture inside."]="是的，我从未亲自见过它们，但有时候我可以从远处听到它们的声音。如果你想进去冒险的话，对它们要保持充分的警惕。"
G["Oh yeah, Jin'do.  We gonna take REAL good care of Ohgan'aka."]="喔没错，金度。我们会非常小心地照料奥根阿卡。"
G["Oh yeah, hey no nothing your, uh, your hugeness.  Uh, for the Horde, and all that...  Bye!"]="噢，呃，没什么，大人。为了部落，就这样。再见！"
G["Oh yeah, it's real funny isn't it?"]="哈哈，这真是太有趣了，不是吗？"
G["Oh yeah, there are plenty of false rumors going around about me.  That I grew up as an attraction in the Darkmoon Faire, that I killed six demons on my fifth birthday using only a spoon, or even -- and this is my favorite -- that I'm actually a natural blonde.  Folks will believe anything."]="啊，没错，那些关于我的谣言满天飞，可惜都是假的。什么我小时候是暗月马戏团的吉祥物，五岁生日那天杀了六个恶魔——用的还是一把勺子——我最喜欢这段了。但事实上，我只是个普通的金发姑娘。人们就喜欢相信那些有的没的。"
G["Oh yeah. Slinky's going to cut you."]="哦，没错。史莉琪要砍你。"
G["Oh yeah? Tell me more."]="噢？告诉我更多详情。"
G["Oh yeah? Um... get him!!!"]="哦，是吗？嗯……抓住他！！！"
G["Oh yes! The market girl! Here you are! A wise man pays his debts when an imposing-looking $c is involved."]="¡Ah, sí! ¡La chica del mercado! ¡Aquí tienes! Un hombre sabio paga sus deudas cuando $gun:una; imponente $c está de por medio."
G["Oh yes, now... where were we?"]="嗯嗯……我们说到哪儿了？"
G["Oh yes, old one, Hakkar has returned. Soon the world shall crumble beneath his might. Consumed. Left in ruin..."]="哦，老家伙，哈卡已经回来了。很快这个世界就会在他的强大力量下崩溃。毁灭。毁灭……"
G["Oh yes, that's right.\n\nSo, here we are invading deep into the upper reaches of Blackrock Spire, against their lord and leader; this was before Drakkisath. Not too smart if you ask me, but our leader, Anthion Harmon, you met him, was always one who loved a challenge.\n\nSurprisingly, everything went according to plan, right up to the point where we were prying Valthalak's spellbook out of his stiff fingers. That's when it all went south.\n\nShould I continue? You look like your eyes are glazing over."]="哦，是的。\n\n后来我们就侵入了黑石塔上层的深处，决定去挖掘他们的头目与领主所拥有的财富，哦，是达基萨斯之前的那一任。现在你要问我，我确实觉着这不是个聪明的决定，可我们的队长安泰恩·哈蒙，你见过他的，他是一个非常喜欢挑战与冒险的人。\n\n令我们吃惊的是，一切竟都按计划顺利的进行着，我们还得到了瓦塔拉克的法术书……那本书就握在他僵硬的手里。\n\n还要继续吗？你的眼睛里似乎有点困意。"
G["Oh yes, the bile; it's amazing stuff. With the proper catalysts it renders anything to which it's applied practically immortal*. I've been harvesting it with my reprogrammed Bile-O-Tron 800 and I'm certain I've got the mixture right this time. I just need a few volunteers to test it out against a suitable creature. What do you say, friend?\n*Immortality subject to certain restrictions."]="Ah, sí, la bilis. Es fascinante. Con los catalizadores adecuados, hace que todo a lo que se aplica se vuelva prácticamente inmortal *. He estado recolectando con mi Bilistrón 800 reprogramado y esta vez estoy seguro de haber encontrado la mezcla correcta. Solo necesito unos pocos voluntarios para probarlo contra una criatura apropiada. ¿Qué me dices?\n\n*Inmortalidad sujeta a ciertas restricciones."
G["Oh yes, the molt - do not lose it. There are those of my kin in the Burning Steppes that would craft items that only the molt of the black Dragonflight could fortify."]="哦，当然，龙皮——可别弄丢了。我们家族的一些成员所制造的东西必须用黑龙皮来强化。"
G["Oh yes, this is my favorite food - fish!"]="没错，这是我最爱的食物——鱼！"
G["Oh yes, this ruby looks quite valuable. Thanks, $n!"]="哦，这颗红宝石看起来价值不菲。谢谢你，$n！"
G["Oh yes, you are looking for Ala'thinel. You can find her inside the Shrine of Two Moons.\n\nI will mark her location on your map."]="噢是的，你一定是在找艾拉西尼尔。她就在双月殿里。\n\n我会在你的地图上标出她的位置。"
G["Oh yes, you are looking for Healer Nan. You can find her inside the Shrine of Seven Stars.\n\nI will mark her location on your map."]="噢是的，你一定是在找治疗者楠。她就在七星殿里。\n\n我会在你的地图上标出她的位置。"
G["Oh yes. Immensely. The pain will probably render you unconscious - hence the vat of slime you're floating in!"]="嗯。强烈的痛感可能会令你昏迷，因此你最好待在这只装满软泥怪的大桶里！"
G["Oh you know me. I'm a humble girl, so I'd only ask for rubies.\n\nWhat? It's not like I'm asking for diamonds!"]="哦，你了解我的。我是个谦逊的女孩，所以我只想要些红宝石。\n\n什么？我又不是跟你要钻石！"
G["Oh you little beasts..."]="哦你们这些小畜生……"
G["Oh you poor thing, you're covered head to toe in sand!  Please feel free to rest and rejuvenate yourself here at this beautiful oasis."]="¡Ay, $gpobrecito mío:pobrecita mía;, estás $gcubierto:cubierta; de arena de pies a cabeza! ¡Disfruta de este hermoso oasis libremente para rejuvenecerte un poco!"
G["Oh you shouldn't! Oh, but I do love gifts, so maybe you should."]="哦，你不必啦！哦，但我确实喜欢礼物，所以……或许……你还是送吧。"
G["Oh!  Someone needs to get those fires out so I can get in there and save that goblin!"]="哦！得有人去灭了那些火，不然我没法进去救那个地精！"
G["Oh! $c! Over here. I could use some assistance if you have a moment."]="哦！$c！到这来。如果你有空的话，我需要你帮我个忙。"
G["Oh! A new customer! You are most welcome, friend!"]="¡Ah! ¡Un nuevo cliente! ¡$GBienvenido, amigo:Bienvenida, amiga;!"
G["Oh! Back to my beautiful self? How lovely! I thought I would be a frog forever."]="哦！我恢复先前的美貌啦？太好了！我还以为要当一辈子青蛙呢。"
G["Oh! Brann, jus' look at this claw! I have a creepin' suspicion that these mogu are meddlin' with some dark magic."]="噢！布莱恩，看看这个爪子！我有种不好的感觉：魔古族似乎在研究某种黑暗魔法。"
G["Oh! Dajik has idea! Make chicken sounds and maybe they come to you!"]="噢！达伊克想到个办法！我们来学鸡叫，它们或许会循声而来！"
G["Oh! Hello there! I... um... didn't expect to see you here!\n\n<Ella looks back to the arena suddenly.>"]="噢！你好啊！我……呃……没想到能在这儿遇见你！\n\n<艾拉突然回头向竞技场看去。>"
G["Oh! Hello...\n\n<Ella's face turns pink and she looks down shyly.>"]="呃！你好……\n\n<艾拉的脸红了，她害羞地低下头。>"
G["Oh! Hi! Um... I should probably... go...\n\n<Ella blushes as her voice lowers to a whisper.>"]="哦！嗨！呃……我或许该……走……\n\n<艾拉红着脸，窃窃私语道。>"
G["Oh! I almost forgot! I slipped you a set of thieven' tools. You'll need those where you're going."]="哦！我差点忘记了！我会给你一套盗贼工具。它会对你有很大帮助的。"
G["Oh! I feel something rumbling. Excuse me!"]="噢！我感觉到有东西在隆隆作响。失陪了！"
G["Oh! I think I recognize you. You're from the Wandering Isle right?\n\nIsn't it so strange to be in Pandaria?\n\nI always thought this place was nothing more than a legend. I can't believe it actually exists!"]="噢！我想我认识你。你是从迷踪岛来的是不？\n\n身处潘达利亚的感觉很奇妙吧？\n\n我一直以为这地方不过是传说罢了。真不敢相信，它竟然真实存在着！"
G["Oh! Now Kekek understand. Not want to be crushed by big dragon-lady. Maybe come back sometime when not so crowded. Nice to meet you, dragon-lady."]="哦！现在科科明白了。科科不想被强大的女王捏扁。也许等这里不太挤的时候，科科还会回来。不管怎样，很高兴见到你，女王。"
G["Oh! Orders! Let's see here... Self Destruct?!"]="喔！有指令！让我们看看……自爆？！"
G["Oh! So sorry. How terribly embarrassing! I didn't realize... ah... please, lie down, get some more rest."]="哦！真对不起！太尴尬了！我没注意……啊……请躺下，多休息会吧。"
G["Oh! Too full... oh no..."]="哦！太满了……哦，不……"
G["Oh! When did you get here?"]="噢！你什么时候来的？"
G["Oh! You mean she looked like this before the crash?!"]="噢！你是说，她在意外发生前就是这个样子的？！"
G["Oh! You're not gonna get my boy that easily."]="噢！你不会那么容易抓到我的人。"
G["Oh!!! Get that thing away from me!"]="啊呀！把那东西从我这儿拿走！"
G["Oh, $n, it was just you. Please don't scare me like that."]="哦，$n，是你啊。请不要这样吓唬我。"
G["Oh, $n, wait a minute! There's one more thing! Come back!"]="哦，$n，等一下！还有一件事！快回来！"
G["Oh, $n, we're marooned!"]="哦，$n，我们被困住了！"
G["Oh, $n, you did it! It warms my heart to see the pandaren families reuniting."]="噢，$n，你做到了！看到熊猫人一家团聚，我的心里也热乎乎的。"
G["Oh, $n, you've saved us again! Thank you for getting rid of those evil humans before they could get us!"]="哦，$n，你又救了我们！感谢你为我们消灭了那些恶棍！"
G["Oh, $p! How you get here? Are we fighting today?"]="噢，$p！你怎么到这儿来了？我们今天要打一场吗？"
G["Oh, Aysa? I think I saw her training other pandaren near the lake, northwest of Stormwind Keep."]="哦，艾莎？我想我看到她在湖边训练其他熊猫人，就在暴风要塞的西北方向。"
G["Oh, Captain Jewels is going to be angry..."]="哦，珍宝船长要发怒了……"
G["Oh, Chad... of course I will!"]="噢，查德……我当然愿意！"
G["Oh, Darrowshire!  I would give a thousand lives for you!"]="哦，达隆郡！我会为你带来无限生机的！"
G["Oh, Farmer Yoon is such a gentleman! He even said he liked the new furniture!"]="哦，农夫老愚真是一位绅士！他甚至还说他很喜欢那些新家具！"
G["Oh, Go'el, hold on! I WILL free you! And you'll HAVE this life, I swear it!"]="哦，古伊尔！坚持住！我会救出你，让你拥有这样的生活，我发誓！"
G["Oh, Gobbles! Ve're ready to begin! Come, come!"]="哦，哥培尔！我们已经准备好了！来吧，来吧！"
G["Oh, Hello! Can I interest you in a piping hot cup of tea before you leave?"]="嗨，你好！我能在你离开之前请你喝杯新鲜热茶吗？"
G["Oh, I HAVE heard of the ancestors' stair. That's what some folks call those mountains to the north."]="噢，我听说过先祖的阶梯。有些人就是这么称呼北面的群山的。"
G["Oh, I am so glad you have returned, $n.\n\nMy brother's spirit has now be freed from the corruption, but I choose to remain here, in my mourning.\n\nThank you so much for your help, $n."]="Oh, me alegro tanto de que hayas vuelto, $n.\n\nEl espíritu de mi hermano está libre de la corrupción, pero he decidido quedarme aquí, llorando.\n\nMuchísimas gracias por tu ayuda, $n."
G["Oh, I am so tired..."]="哦，我太累了……"
G["Oh, I can see Liladris from here... Tell her I'm here, won't you?"]="哦，我能从这儿看见利拉迪斯……告诉她我在这儿，好吗？"
G["Oh, I don't know. I am old, and I have always..."]="哦，我不清楚。我老了，而且常常……"
G["Oh, I dunno. This kinda seems like a family thing you're doin'..."]="噢，我不太确定。这看来是你们的家务事……"
G["Oh, I hope the injury is not serious! The healers can be found inside the main hall, just to the left of the central stairs.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="噢，我希望伤势并不严重！治疗者在主大厅内，也就是中央楼梯的左侧。\n\n我会在你的地图上标记这个位置。"
G["Oh, I hope you like surprises."]="噢，但愿你会喜欢惊喜。"
G["Oh, I hurt all over. Can you help me?"]="啊，我全身都好疼，你可以帮帮我吗？"
G["Oh, I really should go check on my cats. I hope they're okay!"]="噢，我得去看看我的猫咪们了。但愿它们一切都好！"
G["Oh, I see how it is... You're gonna do me like that, eh?"]="噢，我明白了……你也想那样对待我，是吗？"
G["Oh, I think we all know who's really responsible for the mess we're in! Don't worry, I'm going to see to it that $n gets what $g he : she; deserves!"]="¡Oh, creo que todos sabemos quién es el responsable de este lío! No te preocupes, ¡voy a ocuparme de que reciba su merecido!"
G["Oh, I understand perfectly. I have eyes. But Pandaria is not like whatever land you came from; it lives and breathes. You should be careful what kind of energy you bring here. Now put those weapons away!"]="噢，我明白得很。我有眼睛。可潘达利亚跟其它地方不一样，它有生命，会呼吸。你应该小心控制自己带来的能量。现在，丢掉那些武器！"
G["Oh, I wandered off again.  I'm sorry."]="哦，我又迷路了，抱歉。"
G["Oh, I was just resting... I rest sometimes... under rocks..."]="噢，我只是在休息……我有时候就是在……石头底下休息的……"
G["Oh, I will, my friend. I will indeed. You, too, be safe."]="Oh, lo haré, $gamigo mío:amiga mía;. Así será. Y tú, cuídate."
G["Oh, I'd love to see that old cog's face. I bet he...what? It's still on? WELL TURN IT O-"]="哦，我想看看那个老家伙的脸。我打赌他……什么？它还开着？快关掉……"
G["Oh, I'll get me gun, and I'll shoot ye wit' it if ye ever interrupt me when I'm drinkin' again!"]="噢，我会去拿枪，要是你再敢打扰我喝酒，我就先把你的屁股射出个洞来！"
G["Oh, I'm gonna enjoy this more than I probably should."]="哦，这一定会乐趣十足。"
G["Oh, I'm sorry, but you know more about leather than I do at this point. Talk to Faldron over there if you wish to learn more."]="哦，我很抱歉，但是对于皮革你知道的比我要多。如果你想多学些知识的话去找那边的法多恩谈谈。"
G["Oh, I've been looking all over for that one. He's a handful."]="噢，我一直在到处找它， 真是个麻烦的家伙。"
G["Oh, I've gone and made a mess..."]="啊，真惨。"
G["Oh, Illyanna, I love you!"]="哦，伊琳娜，我爱你！"
G["Oh, Illyanna, your eyes, they are so beautiful."]="哦，伊琳娜，你的眼睛，它们是那样美丽。"
G["Oh, Ji? He's at the Pandaren Pavillion in the Valley of Honor, checking out the fights and talking with the warriors."]="哦，季？他在荣誉谷的熊猫人小亭，正在一边观看比赛一边和战士们交谈。"
G["Oh, Liu of the Bottomless Tankard? He's been in a drinking contest for the longest time at the Stonefire Tavern, just north of the gates of Ironforge."]="噢，千杯不醉刘伶？他大部分时间都在铁炉堡大门北边的石火旅店里跟人拼酒。"
G["Oh, Mr. Floppy, this is hopeless!"]="噢，小毛球，我们没救了！"
G["Oh, Samophlange. Is there nothing you can't do?"]="喔，主动式负载平衡器。有什么是你办不到的吗？"
G["Oh, Sauteed Carrots! My favorite!"]="哦，煎炸胡萝卜！我的最爱！"
G["Oh, Spirits... have mercy... on my... soul..."]="Oh, Espíritus... tened misericordia... de mi... alma..."
G["Oh, Verinias. You poor fool. You should have left earlier."]="噢，维林尼亚斯。你这可怜的傻瓜。你真该早点儿离开。"
G["Oh, a $c? Entering in the tournament? This should be interesting indeed."]="Oh, ¿$gun:una; $c que participa en el torneo? Esto se pone interesante."
G["Oh, a Lovely Apple! Thish must me by lucky day!"]="哦，一只可爱的苹果！今天真走运！"
G["Oh, a fellow Physician. I would be glad to teach you anything that would aid your journeys."]="哦，一个医师。我愿意传授给你一些能够在你旅途中对你有所帮助的东西。"
G["Oh, a priest is it?  Well good ol' Maxan is sure to be found having a drink in the Thunderbrew Distillery if ye need a bit of training."]="哦，是牧师吗？要是你想接受训练的话，就去雷酒酿制厂找马克萨恩吧，他一定在那儿喝酒呢。"
G["Oh, a visitor.  I don't get many visitors out here.\n\nHungry? I've cooked MANY delightful things, my dear.\n\nNo, no, not the fish. Those are for when I can't catch anything tastier, sweetling."]="噢，一个客人。我这里的客人可不多。\n\n饿了吗？我做了很多好吃的东西，亲爱的。\n\n不不，不是鱼。只有在我抓不到什么好东西的时候，才会拿鱼出来充数。"
G["Oh, ahh... hello there, good traveler!  What can this fine goblin do for you today?\n\nI'll assure you that I'm here in Light's Hope Chapel solely due to my hatred of the Scourge which I share with these Argent Crusaders, and definitely not because I'm running away from any sort of embrarassing zeppelin crash!\n\nI'll stop talking now, before I implicate myself any further!"]="Oh, ah... ¡Hola, $gbuen viajero:buena viajera;! ¿Qué puede hacer este humilde goblin por ti?\n\nTe aseguro que me encuentro en la Capilla de la Esperanza de la Luz exclusivamente por mi odio hacia la Plaga, que comparto con la Cruzada Argenta, ¡rotundamente no porque me esté escondiendo de un vergonzoso accidente de zepelín!\n\nAhora voy a dejar de hablar, antes de incriminarme más."
G["Oh, alright. If you insist.\n\nYou see, $r, legends tell of an ancient mogu artifact in this region - a richly ornamented sceptre. It is said that the one who wields this treasure will have the love and devotion of those who serve him. That or fear and respect, I forget which.\n\nEither way, it couldn't hurt. Hmm?"]="呃，好吧，如果你坚持的话。\n\n你瞧，$r，传说这一地区埋藏着一件古代魔古神器——一根装饰精美的权杖。传说拥有这件宝物的人将得到部属的衷心爱戴。也可能是敬畏，具体的我忘了。\n\n总之呢，这也不会有什么坏处。你说呢？"
G["Oh, and $r! Come back with the goods, okay? I've got to make sure they're up to snuff."]="哦，还有，$r！去把货物带回来，好吗？我得确保它们没事。"
G["Oh, and Farmer Yoon."]="噢，还有农夫老愚。"
G["Oh, and I am now able to shrug off mind controlling effects - BECAUSE I LACK A BRAIN!"]="哦，现在我还能轻松地摆脱意识控制效果——因为我根本没有脑子！！！"
G["Oh, and I'll be taking my Ancona chickens back, thank you!"]="噢，然后我要把我的灰色小鸡拿回来，谢谢你！"
G["Oh, and don't die."]="噢，你可别死了。"
G["Oh, another one eh? $p, kite him toward the back o' the cave so I can snipe him."]="噢，又来一个？$p，把他引到洞穴最里边，让我一枪击毙他。"
G["Oh, another show already? Very well then..."]="哦，还有一场表演？太好了……"
G["Oh, are ye one o' Brann's friends? Betcha didn't know that back in archaeology school, he used to copy MY notes!"]="Ah, ¿eres $gamigo:amiga; de Brann? ¿A que no sabías que en la escuela de arqueología me copiaba los apuntes?"
G["Oh, are you here from my fan club? I'm sorry, I'm not giving autographs right now."]="哦，你是我的粉丝吗？真不好意思，我现在不能给你签名。"
G["Oh, aye. I took the wee rotter's candle.\nNow, what did ye need?"]="Ah, sí. Cogí la vela de ese granujilla.\n\nBien, ¿qué necesitas?"
G["Oh, bother."]="噢，麻烦让一下。"
G["Oh, boy! I'm so hungry, I could eat a fire elemental!"]="啊孩子！我饿得连火元素都可以吃掉了！"
G["Oh, bravo. Do you feel proud of yourself now that you've unleashed this terrible mistake?"]="啧啧。你犯下了如此可怕的错误，是不是感觉很自豪啊？"
G["Oh, can it be? I... I'm free of that hideous curse?"]="啊，这是真的吗？我……我摆脱了那个可怕的诅咒？"
G["Oh, close call. It's just the grain here."]="虚惊一场……只是粮食的气味。"
G["Oh, come on!  First the mana wraith and now revenge from a stalker?!  No, you're not getting your mojo back!"]="哦，拜托！先是法力怨魂，现在又是追迹者？！不，你休想拿回你的魔精！"
G["Oh, come on! My cart broke, my horse lost a shoe, and now the cargo goes bad!"]="不是吧，我怎么这么倒霉！货车坏了，马蹄铁丢了一只，粮食也出了问题！"
G["Oh, cool! This must be where they store the grain for all the beer they make at that brewery."]="噢，真酷！这儿一定就是他们储藏酿造啤酒用的谷物的地方。"
G["Oh, darn..."]="哦，该死……"
G["Oh, dear."]="啊，天哪。"
G["Oh, dearest Gilneas, how I miss thee..."]="喔，我最亲爱的吉尔尼斯，我是多么的想念你……"
G["Oh, do be a dear and kill Arnak for me along the way. He's become something of an embarassment to the family."]="哦，做点好事，顺便为我杀掉阿纳克吧，他已经成为了家族的耻辱。"
G["Oh, do tell! The suspense alone is enough to make a girl scream!"]="哦，快说吧！这悬念本身就足以让一个女孩尖叫了！"
G["Oh, don't MAKE me summon my troll-servant."]="哦，不要逼我召唤我的巨魔仆人。"
G["Oh, don't be such a fool! I never vanted your silly chest for myself."]="哦，不要犯傻！我从没有想过要占有你的蠢箱子。"
G["Oh, don't look so surprised! I'm a black dragon. My loyalties are my own."]="噢，别那么惊讶！我可是黑龙。我只忠于我自己。"
G["Oh, don't worry about him.\n\nMy oaf of a husband is just sleeping off a nasty blow to his thick skull."]="噢，不用为他担心。\n\n我那个白痴丈夫只是脑袋上挨了一下，睡一觉就好了。"
G["Oh, don't you tell ME to be patient, you green-skinned..."]="啊，你别再叫我保持耐心了你这个绿皮……"
G["Oh, finally! This is my absolute dream! Yes, Mr. Mudclaw! Of course I'll join you!"]="噢，终于盼到了！这是我最大的梦想！是的，泥爪先生！我当然愿意加入！"
G["Oh, gifts? I hope you're not thinking of getting me anything!"]="噢，礼物？我还以为你没打算送我东西呢！"
G["Oh, give the $Glad:lass; a chance, would ya? Bunch of hardasses."]="Vamos, da una oportunidad $gal:a la; $gmuchacho:muchacha;. Panda de insensibles..."
G["Oh, goody, something else to do while I wait! You're a real life-saver, $n!"]="哦，好啊，在我等待时找些别的事情做！你真是救命菩萨，$n！"
G["Oh, grandmother, what big ears you have."]="喔，奶奶，你的耳朵怎么这么尖？"
G["Oh, grandmother, what big eyes you have."]="喔，奶奶，你的眼睛怎么这么大？"
G["Oh, grandmother, what phat lewts you have."]="喔，奶奶，你的衣服怎么这么紫？"
G["Oh, great."]="哦，太好了。"
G["Oh, great. An adventurer. Just what I needed."]="Oh, estupendo. $gUn aventurero:una aventurera;. Justo lo que necesitaba."
G["Oh, hello Zan, it is good of you to visit ol' Auntie Stormstout."]="噢，你好啊，岑。欢迎你来看望风暴烈酒大婶。"
G["Oh, hello friends! We've just about secured the surface, it looks like the real fight's going to be down here."]="噢，你们好，朋友们！我们已经差不多肃清了地面，看来真正的战斗还在下面！"
G["Oh, hello friends! We've just about secured the surface. It looks like the real fight's going to be down here!"]="噢，你们好，朋友们！我们已经差不多肃清了地面，看来真正的战斗还在下面！"
G["Oh, hello stranger. Very sorry for the mess here. Normally this granary is in tip top super efficient status."]="噢，你好，陌生人。很抱歉，这里很乱。通常这个粮仓是非常有秩序有效率的。"
G["Oh, hello there!  I'm Hol'anyee, the chief scientist and biologist of Marshal Expeditions.  My brother and I, along with our companions, travel Azeroth exploring the wild and untamed majesty.  It is exciting... but, um... I think we got ourselves into a little too much excitement this time!"]="哦，你好！我是霍莱伊，马绍尔探险队的首席科学家和生物学家。我的兄弟和我，还有我们的同伴，一起到艾泽拉斯去探索荒野和未被驯化的雄伟景象。真是太激动人心了……但是，嗯……我想这次我们陷入了太多激动中了！"
G["Oh, hello there.. um, what's your name?\n\nNo matter, what brings you to my home-away-from-home here out in the beautiful countryside?"]="你好……嗯，你叫什么？\n\n没关系，你来这个小村庄做什么？这个美丽的地方是我的第二故乡。"
G["Oh, hello!\n\nPlease, come in, come in! Rest for a while.\n\nWould you like something to eat? To drink?"]="噢，你好！\n\n请进，快请进！请休息一会儿吧。\n\n你想吃点什么吗？或者来杯喝的？"
G["Oh, hello, $n.\n\nYour timing couldn't be better."]="噢，你好，$n。\n\n你的时机再好不过了。"
G["Oh, hello, little $r."]="Ah, hola, $gpequeño:pequeña; $r."
G["Oh, here they are! Lion's Landing thanks you!"]="噢，他们在这儿呢！雄狮港感谢你！"
G["Oh, here you are, Rockbiter! I'm sorry, I know I'm not supposed to wander off."]="啊，你在这里啊，罗克比特！对不起，我知道我不该到处乱跑。"
G["Oh, hey $n."]="哦，嗨，$n。"
G["Oh, heya, toots. Yeah... we need to talk.\n\nLater, okay?"]="喔，嗨，宝贝儿。对……我们得谈谈。\n\n稍后好吗？"
G["Oh, hi, $c. I guess the Alliance asked me to come here and keep track of all of this cooked meat that people are gathering because of the impending doom at Ahn'Qiraj. Doesn't that sound like fun?\n\nAnyway, I suppose you'd like to know how much we have. Last time I counted it we were at $2098w out of a total $2099w roast raptor needed."]="¡Oh! Hola, $c. Deduzco que la Alianza me ha pedido que venga para llevar la cuenta de toda esta carne cocinada que la gente está reuniendo en vista de la inminente tragedia en Ahn'Qiraj. ¡Tiene gracia!\n\nDe todas formas, supongo que te gustaría saber cuánta tenemos. La última vez que hice el recuento teníamos $2098w de los $2099w raptores asados necesarios."
G["Oh, ho ho... Hey now. What do we have here?"]="嘿，看看我们找到什么了？"
G["Oh, ho! Oh ho ho.\n\nYo ho ho, even.\n\nI just come back from the land of Pandaria, with its rolling hills and harsh mountains, and the strangest rum I ever tasted.  I crashed me ship into the Jade Forest and me cargo made the land uninhabitable, but in the meantime I can take ye to the Valley of the Four Winds, lickey-split.\n\nDo yeh trust me, $c?"]="喔，嚯！喔嚯嚯。\n\n呦嚯嚯，扯平。\n\n我刚从潘达利亚回来，那里丘陵起伏，山势崎岖，还有味道最为诡异的朗姆酒。我的船在翡翠林中失事了，我的货物把当地变得无法居住，可与此同时，我能带你风驰电掣般地前往四风谷。\n\n你相信我吗，$c？"
G["Oh, ho! Oh ho ho.\n\nYo ho ho, even.\n\nThe flight to Twilight Highlands event is being worked on. In the meantime, I'l take yeh there, lickety-split.\n\nDo yeh trust me, $c?"]="喔，嚯！喔嚯嚯。\n\n呦嚯嚯，扯平。\n\n去往暮光高地的航班正在准备中。与此同时，我愿意送你去——全速直达。\n\n你信任我吗，$c？"
G["Oh, honey..."]="噢，亲爱的……"
G["Oh, how positively delightful!"]="哦，多么欢欣鼓舞！"
G["Oh, how the pandaren laughed at him. But Liu Lang was more clever than anyone thought. Sea turtles always return to the beach where they were born. And so, despite the mists that envelop our land, he always had a way home."]="噢，那些熊猫人不遗余力地嘲笑他。可是刘浪比人们想象得要聪明。海龟总能回到自己出生的岸边。于是，尽管迷雾笼罩着我们的土地，刘浪总能安然返家。"
G["Oh, if I only had a tree branch to hold up in front of me. The guards would never see me then."]="嗯，如果我能用树枝做掩护的话，那些守卫是看不见我的。"
G["Oh, isn't she a beauty!  Can't wait to get her properly trained and back up in the air!"]="噢，她是不是很漂亮啊？我等不及要好好训练她，与她一起在天空翱翔了！"
G["Oh, it's been wonderful!\n\nThe commander is so confident, and that accent! I must admit, he's quite captivating.\n\nDo you know if he's married?"]="实在是太棒了！\n\n元首是如此自信，还有他的声音！必须承认，他的样子真是有魅力。\n\n你知道他结婚了吗？"
G["Oh, it's just terribly, terribly, awful! You will just DIE when you see it, Vivian."]="哦，这真可怕，真是太可怕了！薇薇安，你也许刚看到它就会死掉。"
G["Oh, it's just you."]="噢，就只有你。"
G["Oh, it's not my fault, I can assure you."]="哦，这不是我的错，我向你保证。"
G["Oh, it's on now! Bet you thought I'd be alone too, huh?!"]="哦，开始起作用了！我敢打赌你觉得我会孤单，是吧？！"
G["Oh, it's you again! Do you think we'll be able to mustard up the forces we need?"]="噢，又是你呀！你觉得，我们能召集到足够的部队吗？"
G["Oh, it's you."]="噢，是你啊。"
G["Oh, just die!"]="啊，死吧！"
G["Oh, just look at what Szabo has done. A masterpiece!\n\nYou are not worthy of such an outfit, but Szabo needs the money. <sigh>"]="哦，看看苏扎博做了什么。真是杰作啊！\n\n说实话，你配不上这身行头，但苏扎博需要钱。<叹气>"
G["Oh, lad..."]="哦，伙计……"
G["Oh, like you coulda done any better."]="哦，难道你能做得更好吗？"
G["Oh, look at her over there.  She's be beautiful.  A perfect 10!"]="噢，快看那个姑娘。真漂亮，10分！"
G["Oh, look you... dead."]="喔，瞧瞧你……已经死了。"
G["Oh, look, it's another cartload of explosives! Let's help them dispose of it."]="瞧，又是一车炸弹！让我们引爆它吧。"
G["Oh, look. You're the ones that smashed up my Juggernaut."]="噢，看看谁来了。就是你们毁了我的战蝎。"
G["Oh, looking for some arcane enlightenment are you? No place better then then Wizard's Sanctum in the Mage Quarter."]="哦，你正在学习魔法？那没有什么地方会比法师区的巫师圣殿更好了。"
G["Oh, looking for your class trainer? Unfortunately none of them have made it here to the Vale of Eternal Blossoms.\n\nYou can return to your home city to find those."]="噢，你在找职业训练师？很可惜，他们并没能抵达锦绣谷。\n\n你可以回主城去找他们。"
G["Oh, looks like we're here!"]="哦，看起来我们到了！"
G["Oh, me a cook?  I suppose that's true.  A barmaid's got to work in the kitchens from time to time, and I've learned a few recipes over the years.  Nothing too special, but they're hearty enough to fill Grok's substantial belly."]="啊，我的厨艺吗？应该是吧。作为女招待，当然总得在厨房里跑来跑去的。我确实学到了一些新的菜谱，虽然不是很特殊，但至少可以填饱葛罗克那无底洞一样的胃。"
G["Oh, mon, I had an itch when I died and now it won't go away. Please tell me it doesn't last for eternity?! You gotta get me rezzed!!!"]="噢，老兄，我死的时候身上长了个疮，直到现在都没消失。你可别跟我说，我得永远带着它？！你一定要把我复活！！！"
G["Oh, most definitely, Elisara. But please, can you show the least bit of patience?"]="哦，一点也没错，埃莉萨拉。但是请你拿出点耐心来好吗？"
G["Oh, most excellent!  That was great fun, was it not?  Little by little I've been cursing more of those disgusting Lost Ones.  Soon enough I'll be ready to try it on the draenei!"]="太棒了！真是太有趣了，难道不是吗？我满满地诅咒了这些恶心的失落者，很快我就可以在德莱尼人身上试试了！"
G["Oh, my brothers!  May you find rest in your watery graves!"]="唉，我的弟兄们！希望你们能够在潮湿的坟墓中得到安息！"
G["Oh, my head hurts..."]="噢，我的头好疼……"
G["Oh, my head hurtsh."]="哦，我头痛得厉害。"
G["Oh, my lordship, I do so hope that you've arranged for more of that excellent wine from Silvermoon City. I dare say drinking it makes me feel almost as forward as a common woman!"]="哦，我的大人。我非常希望你准备了足够的银月城美酒。我敢说喝下这些可以让我感觉自己像个正常的女人！"
G["Oh, my love! No! Don't let me die without you..."]="啊，我的爱人！不！让我临死之前再见你一面吧……"
G["Oh, my pappy always said these little cat figures were lucky!"]="噢，我的爸爸总是说，这些小猫图形是象征好运！"
G["Oh, my stomach... That food really was awful."]="哦，我的肚子……那食物真的很糟糕。"
G["Oh, my student - you wish to study the mantid? Be warned: the pandaren frontier is littered with the graves of former pupils."]="噢，我的弟子——你想要了解螳螂妖？我提醒你，边境前线上到处都是我原先弟子的坟冢。"
G["Oh, my!"]="哦，天哪！"
G["Oh, my! I wasn't expecting company! The workshop is such a mess. How embarrassing."]="哦，天哪！我没想到有人要来！工作间里真是一片狼藉。真丢人啊。"
G["Oh, my! It would seem that we are out of time, my friends."]="哦，天哪！我们好像已经超时了，朋友们。"
G["Oh, my."]="天哪。"
G["Oh, my. Do you feel remorseful, at least?"]="天哪。你连一点怜悯之心都没有吗？"
G["Oh, my. Excuse me a moment."]="天哪。不好意思，稍等一会儿。"
G["Oh, my. If I am not mistaken, it appears that the tale of Zao Sunseeker has come to life before us."]="噢，天哪。如果我没搞错的话，这似乎是在演绎赵·追日者的故事。"
G["Oh, my. What IS that smell - oh wait, heh, whoops! Guess my senses will take a little time to get readjusted."]="我的天哪，那是什么气味——噢，哎呦！我的嗅觉恐怕要好一会儿才能恢复了。"
G["Oh, my... The enchantment succeeded even beyond my expectations."]="哦，天哪……这次的作品甚至远比我想象的更加强大。"
G["Oh, nasty."]="噢，可恶。"
G["Oh, no I'm sorry but I can't!  It's against the rules to heal pets during the tournament."]="噢，不，我很抱歉，可我不能这么做！在比武大会期间治疗宠物是违反规则的。"
G["Oh, no!  My Fei Fei would never take someone else's things!  He's a good dog... he just needs attention sometimes.  If you give him a treat, then you see!"]="哦，真糟糕！我的菲菲从不会拿其他人的东西！它是条好狗……它只是有时候需要些关心。如果你请它好好吃一顿，一切麻烦就都没有了！"
G["Oh, no! Adventurers, something awful has happened! A colleague of mine has been captured by the Infinite Dragonflight, and they're doing something horrible to him!\n\nKeeping Arthas is still your highest priority, but if you act fast you could help save a Guardian of Time!"]="噢，不！冒险者们，刚刚发生了一件可怕的事！永恒之龙抓走了我的一位同伴，他们正在对他做一些可怕的事！\n\n保护阿尔萨斯还是你们的首要任务。但是如果你们行动够快的话，或许还有机会挽救一位时光守护者！"
G["Oh, no! Look, it's another wolf, and it's a biiiiiiig one!"]="噢，不！又来了一头狼，好大！！！"
G["Oh, no! That wasn't right. Now I'll have to go get more detergent so we can start over!"]="哦，不！不应该这样的。现在我们不得不再弄些清洁剂重新开始了！"
G["Oh, no! We've run out of time."]="啊，糟糕！我们没时间了。"
G["Oh, no.  Not another one!"]="哦，不。不要再来了！"
G["Oh, no. We're too late. These people have all been infected! They may look fine now, but it's just a matter of time before they turn into the undead!"]="糟糕。我们太迟了。他们已经被感染了！虽然他们现在表面上还正常，但是迟早会变成亡灵！"
G["Oh, not that! Look, I'm quaking in my boots..."]="哦，不是那样！看啊，我正在我的靴子里震动……"
G["Oh, nothing. Merely thinking aloud."]="没什么。我只是在自言自语罢了。"
G["Oh, now I'm pissed!"]="啊，现在我生气了！"
G["Oh, now you did it, that was really really really not the correct input code."]="噢，那你来试试？那绝对绝对绝对不是正确的代码。"
G["Oh, of course."]="嗯，是啊。"
G["Oh, oh my! Mr. Mudclaw! I didn't expect such an important visitor."]="哦，我的天呐！泥爪先生！真想不到会有您这样的贵客临门。"
G["Oh, oh, I know this one! It's better than doing business with failed goblins that had to beg others for help!"]="噢，噢，我知道这个！这可比和那些失败的地精做生意要好多了，他们总是要乞求别人的帮助！"
G["Oh, oh, I know! The eggheads!"]="噢，噢，我知道了！是鸡蛋脑袋！"
G["Oh, oh, oh!  I can see this one clearly...  Nah, lost it."]="哦哦哦！我可以清晰地感觉到……呃，没了。"
G["Oh, ok!  Here you are, $n.  It's the least I can do for all the help you've given me."]="哦，好的！给你，$n。我只能这么报答你了！"
G["Oh, pay no attention to me. I'm just a messenger. The leader of the Deathstalkers certainly wouldn't be stupid enough to stand here on the dais waiting to be gutted. No need for history to repeat itself."]="哦，别盯着我不放。我只是个传话儿的。死亡猎手的领袖当然不会蠢到亲自到这来送死。历史不会重演的。"
G["Oh, pay no mind to Buddy.  He won't hurt you, he just likes to scratch now and then.\n\nHe's just a big, loveable kitty.\n\nAren't you Buddy?  Yes, you are, you cute, little thing.  You're mommy's little baby, that's what you are!"]="哦，不用担心巴迪。他不会伤害你的，他不过是喜欢这样抓来抓去而已。\n\n他只是一只又大又可爱的猫而已。\n\n不是吗，巴迪？可爱的小东西，我的小宝贝！"
G["Oh, please!  This is sickening; I'm going to have to kill you all myself."]="哦，天哪！这太令人作呕了，看来我不得不亲自把你们全部解决掉。"
G["Oh, please.\n\n\nI cannot teach a $r to ride a hawkstrider."]="Por favor...\n\n\nNo puedo enseñar a $gun:una; $r a cabalgar un halcón zancudo."
G["Oh, praise!  Your vigilance keeps Myzrael deep in the earth!"]="哦！太棒了！您的努力将使密斯莱尔长眠于地下！"
G["Oh, quite succulent. Many thanks, Mrs. Chambers."]="哦，真是多汁肥美的猪排，非常感谢，查伯斯先生。"
G["Oh, resorting to hocus pocus now are ya?"]="噢，你现在是要回霍克噗克去吗？"
G["Oh, right!  Over here now..."]="哦，对！就在这儿……"
G["Oh, shut up."]="给我闭嘴。"
G["Oh, sick!"]="哎哟，真恶心！"
G["Oh, sorry, I can't buy you a drink.  I'm a bit broke right now, but that'll turn around."]="啊，对不起，我不能请你喝酒了。我最近有点小穷，但我相信我会时来运转的。"
G["Oh, sorry, that fella's gunna need some tender lovin' later."]="噢，抱歉，你待会儿恐怕要好好安慰安慰那家伙了。"
G["Oh, stop your whimpering!"]="啊，不要哀号了。"
G["Oh, such... exquisite... pain!"]="噢，如此……强烈的……痛苦！"
G["Oh, sure!\n\nFarmer Fung said that, if you want, you can use one of his FANCY kites. Apparently he's taken a liking to you."]="哦，没问题！\n\n农夫老方说，如果你想要，你可以使用一只他精美的风筝。显然他喜欢上你了。"
G["Oh, sweet airstrip, I shall never see your wee runway again."]="哦，亲爱的机场，我再也看不到你那笔直的小跑道了。"
G["Oh, thank you!"]="喔，谢谢你！"
G["Oh, thank you!  I have been trapped in this nightmare for so long..."]="哦，谢谢你！我已经深陷恶梦多时了……"
G["Oh, thank you!  Thank you!"]="哦，谢谢！谢谢！"
G["Oh, thank you!  The pit of blackness inside of me has been lifted!  I can see again... and I see the face of my savior!"]="喔，谢谢你！我体内的黑暗物质已经被驱除了！我的眼睛又能看见东西了……啊，我看到了救世主的脸庞！"
G["Oh, thank you, $n!  You've made it possible to save both the sporelings from the bog lords, and the bog lords from our wrath."]="啊，谢谢你，$n！你成功地从沼泽领主手中拯救了孢子人，同时从我们的愤怒中拯救了沼泽领主。"
G["Oh, thank you, Elisa! Thank you!"]="哦，谢谢，艾丽萨！谢谢你！"
G["Oh, thank you, thank you!"]="噢，谢谢你，谢谢你！"
G["Oh, that doesn't sound good. We might have a complication or two..."]="噢，见鬼，好像有点不太妙，看来我们遇到点小麻烦啦……"
G["Oh, that looks delicious. Thank you, $n."]="噢，看起来很好吃。谢谢你，$n。"
G["Oh, that looks like fun!"]="噢，这看上去真有趣！"
G["Oh, that one's for sure."]="绝对是啊。"
G["Oh, that was a CLOSE one, thank ye!"]="噢，刚才好险呐，多谢了！"
G["Oh, that was a bad move, buddy. A baaaaad move."]="噢，这种行为可不好，伙计。非常不好。"
G["Oh, that was cute..."]="哦，真可爱……"
G["Oh, that's just like a Firebeard, can't see anything past yer own fat nose. We were up to arses and elbows in Dragonmaw. But did you send a single bird to help? NO!"]="喔，这可真符合焰须的身份，对自己大鼻子以外的一切都视而不见。我们在龙喉那被逼得走投无路。可你有派过一只鸟来帮忙吗？没有！"
G["Oh, the Goblinity!"]="哦，地精圣灵啊！"
G["Oh, the Illusionary Sha! Save your strongest attacks for when its barrier falls, leaving it exposed."]="噢，幻影煞魔。等它的屏障消散，弱点暴露后再使用你最强的攻击！"
G["Oh, the ever-present obsession with material wealth.  Well, fortune smiles on you, as you can find the auction house in the Tradesman's Terrace."]="哦，沉迷于物质财富，这很常见呢。呃，去贸易区的拍卖行吧，财富在对你微笑。"
G["Oh, the grummle are going to love that one."]="噢，土地精会喜欢它的。"
G["Oh, the horror!"]="噢，天啊，你们真可怕！"
G["Oh, the hozenity! Get it out of here! Ken-Ken too smart to die!"]="噢，是猢狲！快把它弄走！肯肯那么聪明，可不能英年早逝！"
G["Oh, the pain..."]="啊……好疼啊……"
G["Oh, the things I do for the Horde..."]="噢，我为部落做了那么多事……"
G["Oh, the tram, the tram...  everyone wants to ride the tram.  What happened to the good ol' days of flying on the back of a gryphon, gripping the saddle for dear life as you flew up high in the sky above?  \nBah!  You go take the tram then... it's over in Tinker Town with the rest of the gnomish contraptions."]="Oh, el tren, el tren... todos quieren montarse en el tren. ¿Qué hay de los buenos tiempos en los que se volaba sobre el lomo de un grifo, asiendo con fuerza la silla mientras volabas en lo alto del cielo? \n\n¡Bah! Coge el tren si quieres... está en Ciudad Manitas con el resto de artilugios de los gnomos."
G["Oh, there you are!"]="哦，你在这里啊！"
G["Oh, these apples are utterly delicious!"]="啊，这些苹果实在太可口了！"
G["Oh, these are sticky! I wonder how they shoot the webbing?"]="哎呀，好粘啊！它们是怎么结网的啊？"
G["Oh, they will be. But knowledge is power, and I will never turn down an opportunity to study something new. Thank you, Taoshi."]="噢，我们会的。但知识就是力量，我从不放弃学习新知识的机会。谢谢你，陶矢。"
G["Oh, this gonna HURT!"]="哦，尝尝什么叫疼！"
G["Oh, this looks delicious. Thank you, $c."]="噢，看起来很好吃。谢谢你，$c。"
G["Oh, this? <Anduin indicates his crutch.>\n\nGarrosh Hellscream tried to use an ancient mogu artifact to summon and control sha energy. I found a way to stop him, but probably shouldn't have confronted him on my own. He thought I was dead when he left me buried under the wreckage of his failed plan. I swear he shattered every bone in my body.\n\nThe pandaren mistweavers got me back on my feet again, but it may be some time before I can walk without assistance."]="Ah, ¿esto?\n\n<Anduin señala su muleta.>\n\nGarrosh Grito Infernal intentó utilizar un antiguo artefacto mogu para invocar y controlar la energía del sha. Encontré la forma de detenerlo, pero no debería haberme enfrentado a él solo. Me dio por muerto y me dejó sepultado entre los restos de su plan fallido. Te juro que me rompió todos los huesos del cuerpo.\n\nLos tejedores de niebla pandaren me curaron, pero todavía tardaré un tiempo en poder andar sin ayuda."
G["Oh, was that one of your favorites?  My bad."]="噢，那是你最喜欢的宠物？我很抱歉。"
G["Oh, we are going to get along just fine, $n."]="哦，我们将会相处得很融洽，$n。"
G["Oh, we know just the thing...."]="噢，我们知道现在需要什么……"
G["Oh, we're from Blackrock Mountain,\nWe've come ta drink yer brew!\nDark Iron dwarves, they do not lie,\nAnd so yeh know it's true!"]="我们来自黑石山，\n我们来喝你的酒！\n黑铁矮人说到做到，\n你对此清楚得很！"
G["Oh, welcome back, $n. You here to break a few more faces, or what?"]="哦，欢迎回来，$n。你是来打肿几张老脸的，对吧？"
G["Oh, well, that all depends on which partners you mean. Many have come and gone over the years - always someone eager to ride the coat-tails of the legend that is Budd Nedreck!\n\nYou can rest assured that most of them have become wealthy and retired. That's simply not the path I've chosen. You see, I've always felt that I've been called to reveal the world's great mysteries. Alas, if I don't do it, who could?"]="Ah, bueno, eso depende de a qué socios te refieras. A lo largo de los años muchos han ido y venido, siempre hay alguien ansioso por aprovecharse de la leyenda que es Budd Magallenas.\n\nPuedes descansar tranquilo sabiendo que la mayoría se han jubilado siendo ricos. Pero ese no es el camino que yo he elegido. Yo siempre he sentido que mi destino es desvelar los mayores misterios del mundo. Claro, si no lo hago yo, ¿quién lo hará?"
G["Oh, what a beautiful flower over there..."]="啊，那朵花多漂亮啊……"
G["Oh, what a breathtaking flower. You know these are supposed to be lucky?"]="哦，多么令人惊艳的花啊。你知道这些代表了幸运吗？"
G["Oh, what a nice outfit you have there. I hadn't noticed before."]="哦，你这套衣服真漂亮。我之前居然没注意到。"
G["Oh, what a sacred place is here overthrown!"]="啊，一个多么神圣的地方被破坏了！"
G["Oh, what has become of the Vale?"]="噢，锦绣谷怎么成这样了？"
G["Oh, what horrors await...."]="哦，真正的恐惧还在前方……"
G["Oh, when is my son going to meet a nice young lady? All he does is hang around yaks all day!\n\nWhat girl is going to want a stinky yakherd, huh? Ai-ya, Mama worry so much..."]="噢，我的儿子什么时候能遇见一位年轻漂亮的女子？他整天围着牦牛转！\n\n哪个女孩愿意嫁给臭烘烘的牦牛牧人啊？唉呀，妈妈真担心……"
G["Oh, where does Dooka begin!?\n\nFirst, farmer sows seeds and harvests crops. Vegetables can be used in cooking, sold at market, traded to other buyers, and lots of other stuff. I've even heard of rare seeds that can be planted for special items... like a little pet!\n\nThen there's everyone in Halfhill to meet! The people who live there are real interesting, even to a monkey like me. You give them gifts, make nice friends, and they might give you some nice gifts, too!\n\nAlways plenty to do around the fields!"]="哦，杜凯要从哪里说起呢？！\n\n首先，农夫需要播种和收获庄稼。你出售的庄稼可以用于烧饭、拍卖出售、卖给其他买家，或者换购其它东西。我还听说，农夫可以种植一些稀有种子以获得特殊物品……比如小宠物！\n\n另外，你应该去见见半山的每一个人！这里的住民有趣极了，就连像我这样的捣蛋鬼都喜欢他们。你给他们礼物，与他们做好朋友，他们就会用贴心的馈赠来回报你！\n\n在田野周围总有许多事情可做！"
G["Oh, where should I begin!?\n\nFirst, the life of a farmer involves sowing seeds and harvesting crops. The crops that you sell can be used in cooking, sold on the auction house, traded to other buyers, or traded for meat and fish. I've even heard of rare seeds that can be planted for unique items... perhaps even a little pet!\n\nThen there's all of Halfhill to explore! The best way to make friends with the locals is to give them gifts, and if you become friends, they might just give you some nice gifts in return.\n\nThere's always plenty to do around the fields, and an extra pair of hands would sure be appreciated."]="哦，我应该从哪里说起呢？！\n\n首先，农夫需要播种和收获庄稼。你出售的庄稼可以用于烧饭、拍卖出售、卖给其他买家，或者换购肉和鱼。我还听说，农夫可以种植一些稀有种子以获得特殊物品……甚至有可能是珍贵的宠物！\n\n接下来，还有整个半山供你探索！要想与当地人做朋友，最好的办法就是送他们礼物，而一旦你们成为朋友，他们就会给你一些不错的礼物作为回馈。\n\n田里一直有许多工作要做，多个人帮忙总是好的。"
G["Oh, who am I kidding? You are a wily one, thief."]="哦，我在唬谁呢？你真是个狡猾的小偷。"
G["Oh, why can't this dang kite go faster?"]="哦，为什么这风筝不能飞快点儿呢？"
G["Oh, why... thank you... you shouldn't have...!"]="哦，为什么……谢谢你……你没必要……！"
G["Oh, why? You interrupted the most pleasant dream..."]="噢，为什么？你打扰了我的好梦……"
G["Oh, would you please stop checking your nails and spanking yourself, for one moment?  Really, no one cares!"]="你能不能先别修自己的指甲？就一小会儿行不行啊？说真的，没人关心你的指甲！"
G["Oh, wow, is that a naaru they're channeling from?  I feel funny...."]="哦，哇噻，他们正在从那个纳鲁身上抽取能量吗？好有趣啊……"
G["Oh, ye like me eyepatch now do ya?  Well, just make sure that ya don't have ta be wearing one yerself now $g boyo : girly;."]="Oh, ¿te gusta mi parche, verdad? Bueno, asegúrate de no tener que llevar uno $g chico : chica;."
G["Oh, ye want to learn to pick some daisies do ye?  Ha!  I'm just teasing ye $gladdie : lass;.  \nA fine profession it is, and Reyna Stonebranch can show ye how it's done.  She works at the Ironforge Physician on the southern side of The Great Forge."]="Ah, ¿quieres aprender a cultivar margaritas? ¡Ja! Solo estoy bromeando, $gmuchacho:muchacha;. \n\nEs una profesión excelente y Reyna Ramapiedra puede enseñarte sus secretos. Trabaja con el médico de Forjaz, al sur de La Gran Fundición."
G["Oh, yeah. I remember you. Let's see what you've learned."]="噢，对。我记得你。让我们瞧瞧你学会了什么。"
G["Oh, yes I am new to Orgrimmar.  Is it that obvious?"]="哦，没错，我刚到奥格瑞玛不久。这不明摆着的吗？"
G["Oh, yes I am new to Stormwind.  Is it that obvious?"]="噢，是啊，我刚来暴风城。这不是很明显吗？"
G["Oh, yes. Hrm. I'm... sorry it wasn't to your liking..."]="噢，是啊。唔，我……很抱歉没能让你称心如意……"
G["Oh, you ain't so much once yer off yer dragon, are ya?"]="哦，你一离开了龙，就什么也不是了，对不对？"
G["Oh, you and I are going to have a great time. I have so much to teach you about the ways of the hunter."]="哦，我们将一起渡过一段重要的时光。关于猎人之路，我有很多东西要教你。"
G["Oh, you are looking too thin, $r. You must have something to eat. Sit and I will get you something."]="噢，你看起来很瘦，$r。你必须吃些东西。坐下，我给你拿些吃的东西。"
G["Oh, you are so very kind, $n."]="噢，你真是太客气了，$n。"
G["Oh, you freed him, did you? No matter, his death and reconstruction will only be slightly delayed."]="哦，是你放了他？无所谓，不过是将他的死期和重生稍微往后推了一点而已。"
G["Oh, you mean Johnson?  I heard he's in hiding."]="哦，你说的是约翰森？我听说他躲起来了。"
G["Oh, you murderers! Why? Why would you kill such a noble animal?"]="你们这些凶手！为什么你们要杀掉这么一只高贵的动物！"
G["Oh, you must mean the Stormwind Counting House.  It's not far from the gates after you enter Stormwind."]="哦，你一定是说暴风城会计室。走进城门之后，它就在贸易区的西南部。"
G["Oh, you shouldn't have. Thanks."]="哦，你不用这样的。谢谢。"
G["Oh, you want some of this?"]="哦，你想来点这个，是吗？"
G["Oh, you were expecting something else to happen just then, weren't you? Let's see how well YOU adapt after a new set of \"adjustments,\" shall we?"]="Oh, estabais esperando que ocurriera otra cosa, ¿verdad? Veamos lo bien que os adaptáis VOSOTROS a una nueva serie de \"ajustes\", ¿os parece?"
G["Oh, you're gonna try that one? Come on!"]="噢，你想试试那招？来吧！"
G["Oh, you're just disgusting! Why is it always the ugly ones that try to pickup on me?!"]="哦，你可真让人讨厌！为什么来找我的总是你这种丑家伙？！"
G["Oh, you're looking for Springspindle Fizzlegear then.  Why that little gnome and his gadgets...  Let me tell you, if you're going to his shop in Tinker Town, keep your hands to yourself and don't pet any of his mechanical sheep!  \nExploding sheep... now why would you even make such a thing!?"]="Oh, entonces estás buscando a Muello Saltarín. Ese pequeño gnomo y sus inventos... Te voy a decir una cosa, si vas a su tienda en Ciudad Manitas, ¡mantén las manos quietas y no toques ninguna de sus ovejas mecánicas! \n\nOvejas explosivas... ¡¿harías tú algo así?!"
G["Oh, you're not from around here. Are you a citypaw? Tell me, how do you like my dress?"]="哦，你肯定不是这附近的人。你是从城里来的吗？你觉得我的裙子怎么样？"
G["Oh, you're still here?  I had kind of hoped that you had perished.  You would make a very attractive corpse."]="噢，你还活着呢？我还真希望你死掉。你的尸体一定很迷人。"
G["Oh, you've got oodles of things to learn still. I would teach you everything if I could, but I'm still learning too! Why don't you talk to Trixie Quickswitch in Ironforge, she'll help you further your education!"]="哦，你还有很多东西要学。我会教给你我所学的全部知识，但是我自己也在学习！你为什么不找铁炉堡的特里克希谈谈，她会帮你进修的！"
G["Oh, yuck! This food is terrible!"]="呃，真恶心！这些食物太恐怖了！"
G["Oh. Ogre like eat bug. Get bug from west."]="哦，食人魔喜欢吃虫子。去西边弄虫子。"
G["Oh. Oh... I see. How nice!"]="噢。噢……原来如此。不错呀！"
G["Oh. Sorry."]="哦，真遗憾。"
G["Oh. That? Thought I hadn't noticed the scorched earth and senseless slaughter that usually give them away? I'm not THAT old."]="哦，是吗？你以为我没有注意到被烧焦的土地和那些无意义的杀戮吗？无论他们到哪里，都会留下这些痕迹。我还没有老糊涂呢。"
G["Oh. Well, forget it then."]="噢。好吧，当我没说过。"
G["Oh. You're seeking one of... them. Well, if you truly want to waste your time speaking with those backward individuals, you'll find the rangers in Farstriders' Square. Zandine can take care of you."]="哦，你在找……他们。好啊，如果你真的想浪费你的时间来和那些迟钝的家伙谈话，可以在远行者广场里面找到这些游侠。桑迪恩会接待你的。"
G["Oh... Have I got your attention now? Good, 'cause we're adding a little something to this month's crafting contest."]="哦……现在可以专心听我说话了吗？很好，这个月的制造合同里又添加了新内容。"
G["Oh... I seem to have lost my sword."]="噢……我好像把剑弄丢了。"
G["Oh... I think I'm going to be sick.  How could I have cut off someone's ear and not have noticed?  Please take this money to a healer and have it reattached."]="喔……我想我要吐了。我怎么可能把人家的耳朵切下来却浑然不觉？快拿上这点钱找个医生，把耳朵接上去吧。"
G["Oh... I wish I'd never come to this place!"]="喔……我真希望我没到这儿来！"
G["Oh... I'm feeling faint..."]="啊……有点晕……"
G["Oh... I'm feeling groggy..."]="噢……我有点头晕……"
G["Oh... OH! YES! Orkus has regained his senses! The foul human mage must have cursed Orkus' mind. Quickly we must get to shore! Kasha is hurt!"]="喔……喔！太好了！奥尔库斯恢复了神智！那个该死的人类法师肯定诅咒了奥尔库斯的灵魂。我们必须赶快前往海岸！卡莎受伤了！"
G["Oh... Oh no... I'm going to die here..."]="哦……哦不……我要死在这里了。"
G["Oh... Orgus not feel so good..."]="哦……奥古斯觉得不太好……"
G["Oh... So cute!"]="噢……真可爱！"
G["Oh... do I know you?"]="啊……我认识你吗？"
G["Oh... good point. How about right there? That looks clear... kind of."]="噢……有道理。是那里吗？那条道似乎……没有障碍。"
G["Oh... my head... it hurts so badly!  I've... the pillar must contain enormous power... perhaps stronger even than my brow..."]="噢……我的头……好痛啊！我……这根柱子肯定蕴藏着巨大的力量……也许比我的额头还要厉害……"
G["Oh... my. That brew is a bit stronger than I had expected..."]="哦……老天。这酒比我预想中更烈一些……"
G["Oh... my. That brew is a bit stronger than I had expected... I..."]="哦……老天。这酒比我预想中更烈一些……我……"
G["Oh... oh my..."]="喔……我的天……"
G["Oh... oh no. I'm gonna be in big trouble when ma finds out about this.\n\nCould you pay my debt for me?"]="噢……噢不。要是让妈妈知道，我就有大麻烦了。\n\n你能帮我还债吗？"
G["Oh... okay, I'll just wait for zero then..."]="哦……好吧，让我们先等它归零……"
G["Oh... one of those types.  Well, Maximillian is the only one around here that knows about the dark arts.  You can probably find him in the dark of the Lion's Pride Inn basement."]="哦……好吧，玛克西米利安是这附近唯一一个了解黑暗魔法的人。你也许可以在狮王之傲旅店那阴暗的地下室里找到他。"
G["Oh... right. Now: Did the human king send ye? Oh, his spies are all dead... and most of us are, too."]="那么……是人类国王派你们来的？他的密探都死了……我们的人也牺牲了大半。"
G["Oh... thank you!"]="噢——谢谢！"
G["Oh... the missing Harmonic Mallet, eh? Such a silly name. So you come find the King because he is to blame?"]="哦……那个丢失的祥和钟杵，是吗？真是个傻名字。那么你来找到美猴王，是要问罪于他？"
G["Oh... ughh... what have you done to me?!"]="噢……呃……你对我做了什么？！"
G["Oh... well.. you know... \"they\"."]="哦……好吧……你知道……“他们”。"
G["Oh... what... who? How did I get here?"]="噢……什么……谁？我是怎么到这儿来的？"
G["Oh... why, hello $n! Your farm is looking very pretty today."]="哦……为什么，你好，$n！你的农场今天看起来很不错啊。"
G["Oh....\n\nWhere am I?"]="噢……\n\n我在哪儿？"
G["Oh...<hic>... hello... $nsszzhhhh..."]="Oh...<hip>... Hola... $nsszzhhhh.."
G["Oh...these flowersh remind me of home."]="哦……这些花让我想家了。"
G["Oh...where is everyone? Gnome in a cage here! Help!"]="呃……大家都去哪儿了？这边笼子里有个侏儒！救命啊！"
G["Oh?"]="哦？"
G["Oh? Do you think his promise of an even greater source of power will come true?"]="哦？你认为他真的能兑现诺言，给我们一个更强大的能量之源吗？"
G["Oh? Of course you have papers documenting this request."]="哦？那么你当然也把相关的书面文件带来了吧？"
G["Ohgan'aka, the young raptor, looks at you with pleading eyes."]="小迅猛龙奥根阿卡用恳求的眼神看着你。"
G["Ohh, look at that!"]="噢，快看！"
G["Ohh, look! Bloodmaul Brew! Mmmm..."]="哦，看！血槌啤酒！唔……"
G["Ohh, my head..."]="天哪，我的头……"
G["Ohh, of course! The Sunsong place, just over yonder. Was wondering who might be movin' in on that.\n\n<Greenfield squints over your shoulder and waves at Yoon.>\n\nWhen you come back to market with the biggest, juiciest vegetables anyone's ever seen, you tell 'em where you got the seeds!"]="噢，当然！日歌农场，就在那边。我还好奇谁会搬进那去呢。\n\n<绿野斜眼向你肩后瞥了一眼，并向老愚挥了挥手。>\n\n等你带着大家从没见过的最大、最鲜美的蔬菜回市集时，你就告诉他们你是在哪儿搞到的种子！"
G["Ohh, thank you soo much for getting me out of that cage because I was in there for soo long and it smelled like minced mutton that had been sitting out in the sun for a week and I don't like mutton to begin with because when I was little, well littler, I was actually turned into a sheep for a minute and so I know what it feels like to be a sheep and I don't want someone eating me, especially an overgrown troll dressed up like a kitty....\n\n<Ashli takes a deep breath.>\n\nHow's my hair?"]="Oh, muchas gracias por sacarme de esa jaula porque llevo tanto tiempo ahí y olía a carne de oveja picada que ha estado al sol durante una semana y, para empezar, no me gusta la carne de oveja, porque cuando era pequeña, bueno más pequeña, me convirtieron en oveja durante un minuto, así que sé como es ser una oveja y no quiero que alguien me coma, sobre todo si es muy grande y va vestido de gatito...\n\n< Ashli respira hondo>\n\n¿Qué tal tengo el pelo?"
G["Ohh, that. See, there's been nuthin' but orc grog around camp lately.\n\nOrc grog doesn't seem to agree with me, if ya know what I mean...."]="瞧，这营地附近只有兽人烈酒而已。\n\n我可不喜欢喝这种酒，你懂我的意思吧……"
G["Ohh... the pain.  Lord of Fire, it hurts...."]="哦……真痛苦。炎魔之王……这真痛……"
G["Ohhh, I... cannot go on...."]="啊，我……快撑不住了……"
G["Ohhh, the pain is... overwhelming...."]="啊，难以忍受的……痛苦……"
G["Ohhhh, pretty! I like it!"]="哦，太美了！我喜欢！"
G["Ohmygosh! I didn't think that I was ever going to see anyone ever again!\n\nYou have to get me out of here!"]="天哪！真没想到我还能看到别人！\n\n请一定救我出去！"
G["Oi mon, it reeks of bad fish in 'ere."]="喂，兄弟，这里到处都是烂鱼的臭味儿。"
G["Oi!  Who's been using up all the tin?  Don't think just because I'm a lass I won't kick yer behind for wasting materials!"]="啊！这是谁啊，居然快把锡锭用光了？你们再浪费材料试试，别以为我是女人就不敢踢你们的屁股！"
G["Oi! That was a fun ride!"]="噢！真是段有趣的旅程！"
G["Oi, you'll pay for that one you will!"]="喂，你会为此付出代价的！"
G["Oi. So we'll have to contend with that thing after all then?"]="噢。这么说，我们不得不跟那个大家伙打一架了？"
G["Oil leak! OIL LEAK! Someone's done flipped the switch!"]="漏油了！漏油了！有人把开关切了！"
G["Oiling the gears will increase the \nmovement speed of the demolisher.\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Gem_Pearl_01.blp:32|t"]="给齿轮上油可以提高\n攻城车的移动速度。\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Gem_Pearl_01.blp:32|t"
G["Ok I am here.  Come buy my wares while the getting is good.  I mean I am giving you first crack at these."]="嗯，我来了，快过来买我的东西吧！你们不买，另一边那些家伙就要买了！"
G["Ok break time is OVER. Let's go!"]="好吧，休息结束。出发！"
G["Ok mon, a deal be a deal....\n\nIt was night when we all snuck in to Zul'Aman fer a look around.\n\nAll was quiet, til we be hearin' a rustlin' sound, like the wind through the trees. Before we know it, we be surrounded by these savages and their pets! Next day, I be wakin' up here, stuck in a cage.\n\nDay an' night, one by one, prisoners be gettin' killed. Every time one be dyin', that bear-troll be lookin' stronger.\n\nThat be all I know 'bout this place, mon. And I don't wanna be knowin' any more!"]="好吧，朋友，我告诉你……\n\n那晚我们潜入祖阿曼，想要一探究竟。\n\n夜色寂静，突然传来一阵微风掠过树叶般的飒飒声。没等我们回过神来，就被这帮野蛮的巨魔和他们的宠物包围了！等我醒来的时候已经是次日，我发现自己被囚禁在牢笼中。\n\n日复一日，囚犯们接二连三地惨遭毒手。每杀死一名囚犯，那名熊巨魔的力量就增加一些。\n\n朋友，我对祖阿曼的了解仅限于此。我也不想知道更多了！"
G["Ok mon, this be what I saw....\n\nAll was quiet, til we be hearin' a rustlin' sound, like the wind through the trees. Before we know it, we be surrounded by these Amani and their pets! Next think I knew, I be wakin' up here, stuck in a cage.\n\nDay an' night, one by one, da captured scouts be gettin' killed. Every time one be dyin', that bear-troll be lookin' stronger.\n\nThat be all I could learn from my place in dat cage."]="哦朋友，当时的情况是这样的……\n\n夜色寂静，突然传来一阵微风掠过树叶般的飒飒声。没等我们回过神来，阿曼尼巨魔和他们的宠物已经包围了我们！等我醒来的时候，发现自己被囚禁在牢笼中。\n\n日复一日，囚犯们接二连三地惨遭毒手。每杀死一名囚犯，那个熊巨魔的力量就增加一些。\n\n我关在牢笼中，只知道这些。"
G["Ok soldiers, take a break!"]="好了，士兵们，休息一下！"
G["Ok then, back to business."]="那么好吧，回去工作。"
G["Ok you two, play nice!"]="好吧你们两个，好好玩！"
G["Ok!"]="好！"
G["Ok!  Let's get started!"]="好了！让我们开始吧！"
G["Ok, $n, let's go find where I left that mysterious fossil. Follow me!"]="好吧，$n，让我们去找找看我到底把那神秘的化石留在哪里了。跟着我！"
G["Ok, $n. Follow me to the cave where I'll attempt to harness the power of the rune stone into these goggles."]="好了，$n。跟我到那个洞里去一趟，我会试着把符石的能量注入到护目镜上。"
G["Ok, Budd. Go tag a troll...."]="好吧，巴德。去找你的巨魔朋友……"
G["Ok, I think I can make it on my own from here.  Thank you so much for breaking me out of there!"]="好吧，我想我可以自己逃出这里了。很感谢你的帮助！"
G["Ok, I want a good clean spar. Remember to keep your sword up and shield ready."]="好了，我要获得一次漂亮的胜利。准备好你们的剑和盾牌。"
G["Ok, I'll give it a try, then."]="好吧，那么我试试看。"
G["Ok, Rejek show!"]="好吧，雷耶克让你们瞧瞧！"
G["Ok, enough work for now. Time for refreshments and a little conversation in the inn."]="事情做得差不多啦。我要回旅店吃点东西，然后好好睡一觉。"
G["Ok, enough!  I give up!"]="好吧，够了！我放弃！"
G["Ok, here I go!"]="好了，我这就去！"
G["Ok, hit me with another clue!"]="好吧，再告诉我一条线索！"
G["Ok, if your party is ready then I'm ready to fall back and let you continue the defense here. I'll overload the defenses to clear the prison long enough to let us leave and shut the door. After that, it's up to you to protect this door at all costs!"]="如果你们都准备好了，那么我就开始组织撤退，让你们接手这里的防务。我会采取激进的防御措施，让守卫们安全离开监狱并关上大门。此后，你们要不惜一切代价守住大门！"
G["Ok, kick the boss on the third cast of the second phase. Always kick the first cast of the first phase but never the second on the first. Unless, you see lightning. If you see lightning - kick anyway. What's so hard about that?"]="听好了，地上有什么躲什么，boss召什么打什么，换阶段的时候记得停手。踢掉boss在二阶段的第三次施法。一阶段的第一次施法一定要踢掉，但是第二次施法一定不能踢。除非是你看到他在用闪电。如果你看到他用闪电就无论如何都踢掉。这很难吗？"
G["Ok, let me get this straight. You put the scepter shard entrusted to your Flight by Anachronos on a minnow of your own making and now you expect me to build an... an arcanite buoy or something... to force your minnow out of hiding? AND potentially incur the wrath of an Elemental Lord? Did I miss anything? Perhaps I am to do this without any clothes on, during a solar eclipse, on a leap year?"]="好吧，让我们打开天窗说亮话吧。你把阿纳克洛斯交给你们蓝龙军团保管的节杖碎片给了某条你造出来的米诺鱼；现在你希望我制造一个……奥金鱼漂什么的玩意，用它来追踪你的那条鱼？另外这还可能引发元素领主的愤怒？我说漏了什么没有？或许我得找个闰年，在日食时分，赤身裸体地帮你干这件事儿？"
G["Ok, let me think a moment."]="好吧，让我好好考虑一下。"
G["Ok, let's get going!"]="好了，我们继续前进！"
G["Ok, let's get out of here!"]="好吧，让我们离开这里。"
G["Ok, let's get started."]="好的，我们开始吧。"
G["Ok, let's get this orb made..."]="好的，让我们来制作这颗宝珠吧……"
G["Ok, let's get to work!"]="好的，让我们开始工作吧！"
G["Ok, let's go!"]="好的，我们走吧！"
G["Ok, let's go.  I know just the perfect spot!"]="好，我们走吧。我知道有个完美的地点！"
G["Ok, let's move out!"]="好吧，我们出去吧！"
G["Ok, let's see about using those mushrooms you brought back to grow the bog lords a new food supply."]="嗯，让我看看能否用那些你带回来的蘑菇制作一种食物喂给沼泽领主吃。"
G["Ok, let's take a look at this thing..."]="好吧，让我好好看看这东西……"
G["Ok, mon. Tell me when we be close to mah troll bruddas."]="好啦。什么时候才能找到那些巨魔兄弟呀？"
G["Ok, now let's get out of here!"]="好了，我们离开这里！"
G["Ok, ok, I give up!  I'll tell you everything!"]="好吧，好吧，我放弃！我什么都告诉你！"
G["Ok, ok. Me dance now."]="好，好。我现在跳。"
G["Ok, so where the hell is he? Wait a minute! Are you drunk?"]="好吧，他到底在哪儿？等一会！你喝醉了吗？"
G["Ok, this is the right way for sure.  Quite a few guards out there so be on your toes."]="好了，一定是这条路。那边有几个守卫，多加小心。"
G["Ok, we're here. Get out!"]="好了，我们到了。下去吧！"
G["Ok, who pushed me down? Was it you, $n? Someone turn the lights back on. Hiccup!"]="嗯，谁把我推下去了？是你吗，$n？谁去把灯开一下啊？嗝儿！"
G["Ok, you had the fish platter, Commander. Enjoy!"]="指挥官，您的鱼。请慢用！"
G["Ok. Goob go back to Zino."]="好吧，古布回兹诺那儿了。"
G["Ok..."]="好吧好吧……"
G["Okay bye."]="好吧，再见。"
G["Okay okay, stop! Stop! You make a compelling argument."]="好吧好吧，停！停！你可真有说服力。"
G["Okay so you've got two pygmies in the box. Now all you have to do is chop carefully, aiming for the empty space between them."]="好的，现在盒子里已经装了两个俾格米人。你要做的就是小心劈砍，对准他们之间的空隙。"
G["Okay! Let me just see if I can fashion these disgusting parts into something useful."]="好吧！让我看看能不能将这堆破铜烂铁改造成有用的装置。"
G["Okay! Let's move out. Get into your machines; I'll speak to you from here via the radio!"]="好了！我们出发吧。钻进你的战车里，我会通过无线电跟你保持联络！"
G["Okay! We're running a little behind, but the assaut is SCHEDULED to start in $5071W minutes.\n\nI mean, everything looks ready to go, and the Gyrocopters, Mechanotanks and Infantry are all here.\n\nIt looks like Mekkatorque is waiting on a few more things before the assault begins.  Let's hope we start on time or I may lose my job!"]="我们的进度有一点落后了，但进攻仍然要按照计划，在$5071W分钟后开始。\n\n现在战前准备大致已经就绪，侏儒直升机、步行坦克和步兵都已就位。\n\n看样子，梅卡托克还在等待一些东西就位后才会下令开始进攻。让我们希望行动能够按时开始吧，否则我可就要丢工作了！"
G["Okay, $g brotha:sista;, now fer da sapta... stay close ta me."]="好吧，我的$g兄弟:姐妹;，现在开始灵契仪式……你要靠我近一点。"
G["Okay, $n, here we go. Cross your fingers, toes, eyes and whatever else you can cross!"]="好啦，$n。交叉手指，虔诚地祈祷好运降临吧！"
G["Okay, $p. I can only make these so fast... you gotta make every shot count!"]="好了，$p。我的速度只能那么快了……你要好好利用每一颗炸弹！"
G["Okay, I like!  Um... what's going on?  Save me!"]="哈哈，我喜欢！唔……发生了什么事？救救我！"
G["Okay, I think I've got it, now. Follow me, $n!"]="嗯，我想我知道该怎么做了。跟我来，$n！"
G["Okay, I'll lead the caravan to our destination. You stay in the back and make sure our tail is clean. Let me know when you're ready."]="Vale, encabezaré la caravana hasta su destino. Tú quédate atrás y asegúrate de que la retaguardia está despejada. Avísame cuando estés $glisto:lista;."
G["Okay, I'll teach you, but I want you to do something for me. This is important, so pay close attention."]="好吧，我会教你的，但是我需要你为我做一些事情。这很重要，听仔细了。"
G["Okay, Rivett. I'm ready!"]="好的，利维特。我准备好了！"
G["Okay, Sassy, I'm ready to go."]="好的，莎希，我已经准备好出发了。"
G["Okay, all done playing. Time to kill it."]="嗯，玩够啦。杀死它算了。"
G["Okay, back to work. If we're fast we can finish up here before another attack."]="好了，去工作吧。如果我们的速度够快，我们就能在敌人再次发动攻击之前完成这里的任务。"
G["Okay, boss! Chee Chee got stuff to do at the market today, then he be there soon."]="¡Vale, $gjefe:jefa;! Chee Chee tiene kosas que hacer en el merkado, luego vuelve pronto."
G["Okay, boss! Chee Chee got stuff to do, then he be there soon."]="¡Vale, $gjefe:jefa;! Chee Chee tiene kosas que hacer, luego vuelve pronto."
G["Okay, boys, let's get this baby over to Orgrimmar!"]="好吧，孩子们，让我们飞越奥格瑞玛！"
G["Okay, crew. Get to work on getting these bones installed."]="好的，弟兄们。开工了，去把这些零件装好。"
G["Okay, form it up! If it moves, shoot it. If it shoots... Move it!"]="听好了，列队！看到会跑的东西就开枪。如果对面也开枪……就快跑吧！"
G["Okay, here we go.  It's going to take about five minutes to shut this thing down through the ritual.  Once I start, keep the vermin off of me or it will be the end of us all!"]="嗯，我大约需要5分钟的时间来完成关闭它的仪式。在我开始之后，你一定要好好保护我，否则我们都会没命的！"
G["Okay, here we go. You're gonna cover me, right?"]="好吧，我们出发。你会掩护我的，对吗？"
G["Okay, if you can manage to get even one of those fixed, I'll let you take a ten minute break.  How's that sound?  Pretty good, huh?"]="好吧，如果你能修好那些东西中的任意一个，我就让你休息十分钟。怎么样？不错吧？"
G["Okay, let's do this! You fight the ogres, and I will... not fight them. Head for the exit!"]="好吧，就这么办！你对付食人魔，我……就不对付他们了。我去找出口！"
G["Okay, let's get out of here quick quick! Try and keep up. I'm going to make a break for it."]="好，让我们赶快离开这里吧！你们继续跑。我要停一下。"
G["Okay, let's get the controller off of him and use the portal to get out of here."]="好吧，让我们从他身上找到控制器，用这道传送门离开这里。"
G["Okay, let's try this again."]="好吧，让我们再试一次。"
G["Okay, lunch time's over, guys. Let's get back to work. If the rest of the day goes this well, then maybe we'll cut out early."]="好了，午饭时间结束了，伙计们。开始干活吧。如果今天接下来一切顺利的话，那么我们就可以早点收工。"
G["Okay, me go now."]="好的，我现在出发了。"
G["Okay, my Personal People-Porter is ready for testing! I mean, ready for use. I wouldn't test unproven hardware on you, would I?"]="好吧，我的单人传送器已经做好测试准备了！我是说，已经可以使用了。我不会把没经过测试的设备给你用的，对不对？"
G["Okay, no more time. Yi-Mo needs help now! Let's get a mask on him!"]="好了，没时间了。易默需要帮助！我们得给他找个面具！"
G["Okay, okay! Enough fighting. No one else needs to get hurt."]="好了，好了！不要再打了！不要再有人受伤了。"
G["Okay, okay! I got the message!"]="好的，好的！我明白她的意思了！"
G["Okay, okay! Me dancing!"]="好吧，好吧！我跳！"
G["Okay, okay! No need to get all violent. I'll talk. I'll talk!"]="好了，好了！不要动粗。我会说的，我会说的！"
G["Okay, okay! Ya didn't hafta hit me!"]="知道了！别打我！"
G["Okay, okay, I know what ya be thinkin'. This be a stick. But it be no ORDINARY stick, no! What ya be seein' here, $c, be a stick of incredible rarity and extraordinary value, shaped by the very powers that wrought the world! Ya wanna own this fantastic piece of Draenor, touched by magnificent power, I know ya do. I be practically givin' em away!"]="好吧，好吧，我知道你在想什么。这是根棍子，但它绝不是一根普通的棍子，绝不是！$c，你在这里看到的是一根非常非常稀有，非常非常珍贵，以这个世界特别的力量精炼而成的棍子！你想拥有这被华丽的力量触及过的德拉诺神器吗？我知道你想。千万不要错过了，如果你错过了，那么恭喜你！你买不到了。"
G["Okay, okay, I'm going!"]="好，好，要来了！"
G["Okay, okay... I'm up."]="好吧好吧……我起床了。"
G["Okay, okay... gimmie a minute to rest now. You gone and beat me up good."]="好吧，好吧……让我休息一下。你把我打得够呛。"
G["Okay, recruits, salute!"]="好了，新兵们，敬礼！"
G["Okay, stop! I give up!"]="好了，好了！我投降！"
G["Okay, that hurt! We going over here fast! Be back soon!"]="好痛啊！我们要赶紧撤离这里！很快就会回来！"
G["Okay, this place is set to blow. Let's get out of here!"]="好了，这个地方就要爆炸了。我们赶快离开这里！"
G["Okay, well... don't get cocky! Since you have demonstrated  your competence though, we may now begin!"]="Bueno, vale... ¡no te pongas $gchulo:chula;! Aunque, como has demostrado tu competencia, ¡podemos empezar!"
G["Okay, who's the joker that threw an orb at me?"]="好吧，谁朝我扔了宝珠？"
G["Okay. Fight again. No more stupid."]="很好。再打一次。别再犯傻了。"
G["Okay. Me sign."]="好吧，我签。"
G["Okay. We're going to move away from the exploding volcano and try to hook up with the orcs for the final assault on the Trade Prince. See you on the other side... I hope."]="好了，我们现在要离开这座正在爆炸的火山，尝试和兽人们取得联系，对那个贸易大王发动最后的攻击。希望到时候能再见到你。"
G["Okay... I think... I can stand..."]="好吧……我想……我还站得住……"
G["Okay... so you wanna' be a tailor. How about you prove it?"]="好的……那么说你想成为一个裁缝。你能证明这点么？"
G["Okay... so... the new trick to dealing with pirate hozen is to do what you just did right there."]="好吧……那么……对付猢狲海盗的新招数就是把你刚才做的再做一遍。"
G["Okay... structure? Check. Power? Check. Danger? Double-check. Let's fire up my masterpiece!"]="好了……结构？确认。能量？确认。危险？双重确认。让我们发射我的杰作吧！"
G["Okay... that was pretty good."]="好吧…这招还不错。"
G["Okay... you got us... sniff..."]="好吧……你嬴了……"
G["Oke doke, boss. I will finish this."]="好的，老板。我会完成的。"
G["Okee dokee! Let's see what you got."]="明白了！让我瞧瞧你的本事。"
G["Okey dokey. We outta here, mon!"]="好啦，好啦。我们离开这里，朋友！"
G["Oki... How about now?"]="好啊……就现在吧？"
G["Okidoki. Uh. R-ready to work!"]="遵……遵命。呃。准备工作！"
G["Okothos will train you, $n."]="奥克索斯会教你的，$n。"
G["Okrilla doesn't like to let us non-orcs into town, but that doesn't stop her from putting us to work.  No matter... I prefer it out here anyway."]="奥莉里拉不喜欢让我们这些非兽人进入镇子，但那并不妨碍她安排我们去工作。不管怎样……我倒宁可待在这外面。"
G["Ol' Boots?! He's a creation all my own. After Socks, may he rest in peace, I needed a more durable companion.\n\nIt was Amber that decided to use him for our mission, so try not to blow him up!"]="老靴子？！它可是我的杰作。自从袜子死后，愿它安息，我需要一个更加耐用的小伙伴。\n\n都是安玻想出来要用它来执行这个任务的，所以你千万别把它炸坏了！"
G["Ol' Firebeard he made her his quest"]="老焰须在追求她"
G["Old Gods, huh? So they zapped the earthen with this Curse of Flesh... and then what?"]="上古之神是吧，也就是说他们给土灵施加了什么血肉的诅咒，然后怎么样了？"
G["Old Hat is the most good coach. $p would be a luckydo to listen to my advice."]="老帽儿是最棒的教练。$p要是听从我的建议，一定会走运的。"
G["Old Hillpaw lives up on the rise to the northwest. His farm is just south of the mountain.\n\nPoor old man's shut everyone out since his son died."]="老农山掌住在西北边的山上，他的农场就在山的南边。\n\n那个可怜的老人自从儿子死后就再也不和人交往了。"
G["Old Hillpaw's prize-winning chicken, Buck-Bucka Betty!"]="老农山掌的获奖小鸡——雄赳赳的贝蒂！"
G["Old Hillpaw's prize-winning chicken, Egga!"]="老农山掌的获奖小鸡——肥蛋！"
G["Old Hillpaw's prize-winning chicken, Madam Specklybottom!"]="老农山掌的获奖小鸡——斑臀女士！"
G["Old Hillpaw's prize-winning chicken, Mantidsbane!"]="老农山掌的获奖小鸡——螳螂克星！"
G["Old Hillpaw's prize-winning chicken, Mother Clucks!"]="老农山掌的获奖小鸡——咯咯妈妈！"
G["Old Hillpaw's prize-winning chicken, Rumblefeather!"]="老农山掌的获奖小鸡——鸣羽！"
G["Old Hillpaw's prize-winning chicken, Stumbleflutter!"]="老农山掌的获奖小鸡——抖翅！"
G["Old Hillpaw's prize-winning chicken, Thunderpeck!"]="老农山掌的获奖小鸡——雷啄！"
G["Old Man Thistle found a cave full o' TREASURE!!!!\n\nThere was gold 'n diamonds 'n jade 'n statues 'n a whole room full o' books!\n\nWell he wandered 'round that cave 'n before long a whole day had passed 'n he was gettin' mighty hungry.\n\nSo he heads back toward the way he came and what happened but he couldn't find no way back out agin'!"]="老农阿蓟发现了一个堆满金银财宝的洞穴！！！\n\n那里有黄金、钻石、翡翠、雕像，还有一整屋的古籍！\n\n他在洞穴里徘徊许久。很快，一整天就过去了，他感到非常饥饿。\n\n于是他就沿着来时的路往回走，却找不到回去的路了！"
G["Old Man Thistle owned a little plot o' land just o'er there on that hill.\n\nNow one day he was diggin' and diggin', and he dug so far down he didn't do but found a whole cave underneath these them hills!\n\nAnd what do you suppose he found in that cave?"]="老农阿蓟在那山上有一小块地皮。\n\n有一天他在那挖呀挖呀，也不知道自己挖了多深，突然发现在山底下居然有一个洞穴！\n\n你猜他在洞穴里发现了什么？"
G["Old Sho can be found in the Farstrider's Square, practicing his moves."]="老肖正在远行者广场练武呢。"
G["Old Town Hunter Trainer"]="旧城区猎人训练师"
G["Old Town Stable Master"]="旧城区兽栏管理员"
G["Old Town is where you should go if you want to find rogues. It's in the eastern corner of Stormwind."]="如果你要找潜行者的话，就应该去旧城区。它坐落在暴风城的东部。"
G["Old Umbehto be on a lil' islet east of de valley's central buildin'."]="老恩姆贝托就在位于山谷中部建筑东面的一座小岛上。"
G["Old king got dead?  That's unpossible!"]="老国王死了吗？那不可能！"
G["Old legends tell of the Dojani Dynasty and their Pools of Youth. Let us see if the legend is true."]="古老的传说讲述了都阳王朝和他们的青春之池。让我们看看传说究竟是不是真的。"
G["Old mogu traps are as dangerous now as they were back in the scary story times."]="时至今日，这些古老的魔古陷阱仍然危险得很，其威力与恐怖的传说时代相比也毫不逊色。"
G["Olum... old friend.  It is good to see that you are safe."]="奥鲁姆，我的老朋友。看到你一切安好，真是令人欣慰。"
G["Om nom nom nom..."]="嗷呜嗷呜嗷呜嗷呜……"
G["Omarion, I am not a craftsman. Can you still help me?"]="奥玛里恩，我不是一个工匠，你还能帮助我吗？"
G["Omega Rune deployed.  Activation successful."]="放置欧米伽符文。成功激活。"
G["Omega Stance activated. Annihilation of foreign unit is now imminent."]="欧米加姿态已被激活。对入侵单位的清除即将开始。"
G["Omen sleeps in the depths of Lake Elune'ara, but may be summoned at the southeast banks near the Stormrage Barrow Dens.  There, you will find special cluster launchers...\n\nUse your rockets in the launchers and Omen's minions will come.  Fire more rockets, nearly three dozen, or fire Elune's candles at his minions, and soon he will awaken."]="Augurio descansa en las profundidades del Lago Elune'ara pero puede ser invocado desde la orilla sudeste, cerca del Túmulo de Tempestira. Allí encontrarás unos lanzacohetes muy especiales...\n\nLanza varios de tus cohetes y aparecerán los esbirros de Augurio. Si continúas lanzando cohetes, unas tres docenas aproximadamente, o si enciendes velas de Elune ante sus esbirros, pronto se despertará."
G["On Argus, Mac'Aree was the most sacred of our cities.\n\nWould you believe me if I told you that the walkways were lined with precious minerals? That the rivers glittered even in complete darkness?\n\nI long for those days... How long has it been? A thousand years? Ten-thousand?"]="在阿古斯，玛凯雷是我们最庄严最神圣的城市。\n\n如果我告诉你，那里的人行道都是用贵重的矿石铺设的，那里的河流甚至在完全黑暗的地方都能闪闪发光，你能相信吗？\n\n我向往那些日子……多久了？一千年？还是一万年？"
G["On Draenor, he was a miserable wretch. The actions of his father hung heavy on his heart."]="在德拉诺，他就是个可怜虫。他父亲的过去总是纠缠着他。"
G["On behalf of all of Ogri'la, we give you thanks for your efforts, $n.\n\n<Chu'a'lor's left head nods while his right head smiles at you.>\n\nAnd do not forget that by helping us here you are also helping to protect our brethren down below whom you have become like a $g king : queen; to."]="De parte de todo Ogri'la, agradecemos tus esfuerzos, $n.\n\n<La cabeza izquierda de Chu'a'lor asiente, mientras que su cabeza derecha te sonríe.>\n\nY no olvides que al ayudarnos aquí, también ayudas a proteger a nuestros hermanos allá abajo, para quienes eres como $g un rey : una reina;."
G["On behalf of the Argent Crusade, I welcome you to the Argent Tournament."]="我谨代表银色北伐军，欢迎你参加银色锦标赛。"
G["On behalf of the Bilgewater Cartel, I lay claim to this mine!"]="以锈水财阀的名义，这里的矿是我的！"
G["On behalf of the Bilgewater Cartel, allow me to offer a very generous reward to the first person that gets me free of this cage! Of course, standard contractual stipulations apply, but don't worry about the fine print. Just get me out of here!"]="请允许我代表锈水财阀，向第一个把我从这笼子里放出去的人赠予慷慨奖励！当然，还是要遵守标准合同条款的规定，但不用在意那些细枝末节。只要你能快点儿放我出去！"
G["On behalf of the Royal Apothecary Society, I am pleased to offer you the finest steeds available for the Forsaken.  These beasts have endured trials and tribulations as we all have, and now they too have emerged stronger and more resilient than mere mortal flesh would have had them destined to be!  Please, inspect them for yourself and see."]="En nombre de la Sociedad Real de Boticarios, me complace ofrecerte los mejores corceles a disposición de los Renegados. Estas bestias han sufrido las mismas pruebas y tribulaciones que nosotros ¡y ahora han emergido más fuertes y resistentes de lo que les hubiera estado destinado por la simple carne mortal! Por favor, examínalos por ti $gmismo:misma; y lo verás."
G["On behalf of the Sunreavers, I welcome you to the tournament. The Argent Crusade has asked us to register and train those interested in competing."]="我代表夺日者欢迎你参加锦标赛。银色北伐军委托我们登记并训练那些对比赛感兴趣的选手。"
G["On behalf of the crew of the Moonspray, I welcome you $c.  I hope you take advantage of our provisions before parting with us."]="我代表月海之浪号的全体船员欢迎你,$c。希望在起航之前，我们的食物供应商能帮你准备好一切。"
G["On behalf of the illustrious and always-neutral Steamwheedle Cartel, welcome to Bogpaddle! We're proud to be the only beachfront resort and military-grade weapons yard in the Eastern Kingdoms.\n\nYou guys may have that little war ragin' just south of here, but inside these walls, it's all fun and games. So take a load off, have some R&R and a drink or two, and keep out of trouble... or my bruisers will remind your skull what \"neutral territory\" means."]="En nombre del ilustre y siempre neutral Cártel Bonvapor, ¡$gbienvenido:bienvenida; a Chapaleos! Nos enorgullecemos de ser el único complejo de vacaciones en la playa y almacén de armamento militar de los Reinos del Este.\n\nVosotros tendréis vuestra guerra dando ídem en el sur, pero tras estos muros todo es fiesta y diversión. Así que date un respiro, descansa un poco, tómate una copa o dos y no te metas en líos... O mis truhanes le recordarán a tu cráneo lo que significa \"territorio neutral\"."
G["On behalf of the illustrious and still neutral Steamwheedle Cartel, I hope you enjoy your stay.\n\nRemember, everyone is welcome in Gadgetzan! Everyone except pirates."]="我代表杰出的，并依旧保持中立的热砂集团向你表示问候，并衷心希望你能在这里渡过一段愉快的时光。\n\n请记住，加基森欢迎所有人！只有海盗除外。"
G["On darkest wing they fly. Prepare to meet your end!"]="黑龙来了，准备受死吧！"
G["On duty. GO. AWAY."]="忙着呢，走开。"
G["On guard!"]="看招！"
G["On guard, friend. The lady dragon will not give in without a fight."]="朋友，保持警惕。除非打一架，否则母龙是不会放弃的。"
G["On it!"]="得令！"
G["On it."]="正在执行。"
G["On my flight south from Darnassus to seek out Malfurion Stormrage, I came across these injured refugees from the Ruins of Auberdine.\n\nTheir cause is just and I am helping to heal them, but their injuries are numerous, and it will take time.\n\nI trust that you will be willing to lend them your aid as well."]="在我从达纳苏斯向南方飞行，寻找玛法里奥·怒风的途中，我遇到了这些受伤的旧奥伯丁难民。\n\n我开始帮忙照料这些伤员，但他们的数量太多了，让他们完全恢复需要很长的时间。\n\n相信你也会愿意帮助他们。"
G["On my way down here from Dun Algaz I saw a gnoll hunting Threshadons in the middle of a lake.  If you've never seen a dog try to use a spear, you're in for a treat!"]="在我从丹奥加兹赶来的路上，我看见一只豺狼人正在湖心捕猎蛇颈龙。要是你从没见过狗使长矛的滑稽样，那你可有眼福了！"
G["On my way!"]="马上就来！"
G["On my way."]="开始行动。"
G["On my way. Thank you."]="我要走了。谢谢你。"
G["On one knee his love he professed:"]="他单膝跪下，立下皈依的誓言："
G["On second thought, Drahga may need help after all! Fall in!"]="经过三思——达加可能还是需要帮助！集合！"
G["On second thought, I don't care.  Burn in hell wretch!"]="呸，我才不在乎你有没有遗言。下地狱去吧，可怜虫！"
G["On second thought, keep the whole bag. I have to, uh, get going."]="我又想了想，整个袋子都拿走吧。我必须，嗯，走了。"
G["On second thought, what fun is an \"adequate\" challenge?"]="Pensándolo mejor, ¿qué tiene de divertido un desafío \"adecuado\"?"
G["On second thought... I think I'll pass."]="让我想想……我想我会通过的。"
G["On t' the next one!"]="下次再打！"
G["On the contrary, my friend."]="正好相反，我的朋友。"
G["On the cooked goods front it would appear that we've managed to collect and store away $2092w rainbow fin albacore, out of $2093w requested. Additionally, right now we have in $2098w of $2099w roast raptor and $2101w out of $2103w spotted yellowtail in cold storage."]="我们已经收集到了$2092w条彩鳍鱼、$2098w块烤迅猛龙肉和$2101w条斑点黄尾鱼，而总的需求量是$2093w、$2099w和$2103w。"
G["On the corpse of my only child, you miserable son of a pig."]="在我唯一孩子的尸体上，你这蠢货。"
G["On the east side of Razor Hill, behind the barracks is where you will find Dhugru Gorelust."]="你能在剃刀岭东面的兵营后找到杜格鲁·血怒。"
G["On the matter of war against the rebel tribe of Neferset... has each member of the High Council reached a decision?"]="关于对抗尼斐塞特反叛部族的议案……高阶议会的成员有没有做出决定？"
G["On the move back up to the eastern pass!"]="立即支援东边的通道！"
G["On the move to the southern pass!"]="快去南边的通道！"
G["On the move, men!"]="继续前进！"
G["On the night of the Brewmoon, water spirits can be found on Inkgill Mere performing a ritual. Over the years we have made offerings to them in return for a vial of pure water used in crafting the Kun-Lai Kicker. I sent Assistant Tart out to the lake but she hasn't come back yet. Can you head to the north and find out what's keeping her, $n?"]="在酿月祭的夜晚举行仪式，就可以在墨鳃潭见到水灵。过去这些年，我们都会向水灵敬献贡品，以获取一瓶纯净之水用于酿造昆莱劲酒。我派助手塔蒂去湖那儿了，可她还没有回来。你可以去北方查查她出什么事了吗，$n？"
G["On the northern dock, you can board a ship that will carry you to Rut'theran Village and Darnassus.  From the southern dock, you can find passage across the Great Sea to Stormwind Harbor.  The dock to the west, at the end of the pier, leads to Azuremyst Isle, near the Exodar. Safe journeys to you!"]="你可以在北边的码头搭船前往鲁瑟兰村和达纳苏斯。南边的码头是穿越无尽之海通往暴风城港口的航线。西边的那座码头通往埃索达附近的秘蓝岛。祝你一路平安！"
G["On the outer ring of the Magic Quarter you'll find a large, stepped building. That's where the mages hide."]="在魔法区的外环区域你能找到一座大型、阶梯式的建筑。法师们都在那里。"
G["On the prowl."]="早就迫不及待了。"
G["On the south end of the island is a cave -- a hidden hollow. The grand admiral has holed himself up in there, preparing for the final battle against the Lich King."]="这座岛屿的南端有一处极端隐蔽的洞穴。元帅就躲在那儿，策划着对巫妖王的最后决战。"
G["On the wings of death, I ride."]="我骑乘着死亡的双翼。"
G["On this day all Vrykul will shed their old beliefs! We denounce our old gods! All Vrykul will pledge their allegiance to Ymiron! Ymiron will protect our noble race!"]="今天，所有的维库人都将抛弃过去的信仰！废除我们曾经信奉的神灵！维库人将效忠伊米隆国王！伊米隆会保护我们的！"
G["On this day, a great burden has been lifted from my chest. My heart swells with pride. And for the first time, I can proudly proclaim who I am. I can finally unleash the fury in my heart."]="在今天，我心中的重担终于可以放下了。我的内心充满着自豪。我有生以来第一次可以骄傲地说出我的名字，终于可以释放我心中的愤怒！"
G["On this island I must ask you to face great dangers. Your loyalty and trust are appreciated, $n."]="在这座岛上，我不得不让你面对更大的危险。你的忠诚和信任令人赞赏，$n。"
G["On ya knees!"]="跪下！"
G["On you knees!"]="跪下！"
G["On your feet!"]="站起来！"
G["On your feet! Naga attack!"]="稳住！纳迦进攻了！"
G["On your feet! Nazgrim is organizing a counter-attack. We're regrouping in the village."]="赶快行动！纳兹戈林在谋划反击。我们正在村里重新集结。"
G["On your feet, boys!"]="站起来，小伙子们！"
G["On your feet, boys! Move, move move!"]="站起来，小伙子们！前进！前进！"
G["On your feet, men! Move, move move!"]="站起来，小伙子们！前进！前进！"
G["On your feet, soldier. The ancients are with us, and the mountain is healed!"]="振作起来，士兵。远古半神与我们同在，群山得到了治愈！"
G["On your first try! Now, take the flame to the top of the temple and burn the scroll that you find there."]="你居然一次就成功了！快，把这火焰带到寺院顶层去，烧掉挂在那里的卷轴。"
G["On your guard marines!"]="保持警惕，陆战队员！"
G["On your guard!"]="小心了！"
G["On your guard, $n!"]="小心啊，$n！"
G["On your guard, invaders. I, Ta'yak, Lord of Blades, will be your opponent."]="自求多福吧，入侵者。我——刀锋领主塔亚克，将是你们的对手。"
G["On your knees!"]="给我跪下！"
G["On your word, commander."]="请下令，指挥官。"
G["Once Hamuul and Malfurion arrive, we shall begin..."]="等哈缪尔和玛法里奥一到，我们就开始……"
G["Once I welcomed darkness, for it was the sister of night. Now it is dark all the time, even during the day, and the forests cry out for sustenance. Unless we act soon, this spreading blight will cover the world."]="从前我欢迎过黑暗，因为它是夜晚的姐妹。现在总是漆黑一片，甚至在白天也是这样，而森林迫切需要给养。除非我们快些行动，否则这扩散的瘟疫就会遍布整个世界。"
G["Once I've hacked off your limbs, I may hang your body from our battlements."]="等我砍下你的肢体后，一定要把它挂在城墙上。"
G["Once I've perfected the infusing process, the power of Y'Shaarj will make us unstoppable!"]="等我完善了灌注过程，亚煞极的力量将使我们所向披靡！"
G["Once a customer is done eating, the seat they were using will need to be cleaned. Just click on them and I'll go clean up."]="客人吃完之后，他们坐过的位子还需要清洁。你只需要点击它们，我就会去清洁了。"
G["Once a great city of the night elves, the Highborne once ruled there, practicing great and powerful arcane magics. They are cursed now, haunting the lands, and their ruined city has been victimized by the Spitelash naga. I understand that the naga search the ruins for powerful Highborne artifacts."]="上层暗夜精灵曾经统治这座城池，他们在此演练威力强大的奥术。现在他们受到诅咒，灵魂在这片土地上游荡，恶鞭军官纳迦侵占了精灵的城市。纳迦一定在废墟中搜寻那些上层精灵的神器。"
G["Once a match starts there's two ways out: WIN OR DIE! Fleeing is not an option!"]="一旦比赛开始，就是不死不休的局面！逃跑是不可能的！"
G["Once a thief, I am now a servant of the Stars."]="我曾经是一名盗贼，现在则是群星的仆人。"
G["Once again you have impressed me, $n. Without your aid, we would have not made it this far. Walk with me..."]="你再一次地令我震惊，$n。没有你的帮助，我们绝对不会取得这样的成功。欢迎与我同行……"
G["Once again, all soldiers of Lordaeron are ordered to immediately report to the entrance of Stratholme, and await further instructions from Prince Arthas."]="再次通告！洛丹伦的士兵立即前往斯坦索姆入口处集合，等待阿尔萨斯王子的进一步指示。"
G["Once again, we will show this Burning Legion that our world is not for the taking!"]="我们会让燃烧军团再次看到，他们休想抢走我们的世界！"
G["Once again, you must defend me. Rotun, give us a challenge this time."]="这次，你还是要保护我。嘿，罗敦，来场真正的挑战吧！"
G["Once all this strife is behind us, I think I'll retire to Durotar.\n\nA nice little shack on a hill. Maybe a little garden.\n\nYeah, that sounds nice."]="等这场战争结束后，我打算回杜隆塔尔去。\n\n在山上造一座小房子，或许还带一个小花园。\n\n嗯，听起来不错。"
G["Once da high priest is dead and da coast is clear, let me know and I be returnin' to the blood guard wit' my report."]="杀死高阶祭司，一切都安全之后再来找我，我就可以带着我的报告回到血卫士身边了。"
G["Once he has done so, tell him to leave this land in peace. He does not belong here."]="事情办完之后，就让他趁早离开。他并不属于这里。"
G["Once in a while we'll come up against a lone orc that stands between us and victory. Chloroform is often best used in those situations. Just remember to apply chloroform we have to be behind the enemy."]="有时我们会遇见落单的兽人，这时胜利距我们只有一步之遥。在这种情况下通常会用到麻醉。需要记住的是，若要使用麻醉，我们必须位于敌人身后。"
G["Once inside, we sabotage the Zandalari ship. In the chaos, we will slip into the courtyard and open the gates from within."]="进去之后，我们要破坏赞达拉的船只，并趁着混乱溜进庭院，从内侧打开大门。"
G["Once more I apologize, but you chose this fate."]="我再一次道歉，但这是你选择的命运。"
G["Once more shall the twisted flesh-banners of N'Zoth chitter and howl above the fly-blown corpse of this world. After millennia, we have returned."]="恩佐斯这扭曲的血肉大旗终将再次飘扬在这个世界的尸体上空，猎猎作响。一千年后，我们终于回来了。"
G["Once more we fight for our master."]="我们再次为主人而战。"
G["Once more we hear your call, Khufu. We have wisdom for you and $n. You face great peril and must act swiftly or you all and Har'koa will die."]="库弗，我们再次听到你的召唤。请允许我们给你和$n几句忠告。你们即将面临巨大的威胁，如果不赶紧行动的话，你们和哈克娅都会丧命。"
G["Once more, thank you for your assistance with the cursed Lost Ones.  Without your help I would never have been able to continue my research."]="再次感谢你对被诅咒的失落者所提供的帮助。没有你的帮助，我想我是无法继续研究的。"
G["Once more... the dawn..."]="再度……黎明……"
G["Once our warchief heard that the Dark Portal had been reopened, he immediately gathered his advisors to plan this daring expedition. Though a few of his councilors have their doubts, Thrall holds out the hope that we might discover new insights into the history of our people. He believes that somewhere amidst the wreckage of this world, the true tale of the orcish people lies hidden.\n\nI must admit that in my darkest moments... I fear that that tale should remain untold."]="当我们的酋长听说黑暗之门被重新打开之后，他马上召集了他的顾问来计划这次远征。尽管少数几个顾问还抱有怀疑态度，但萨尔坚信我们能开拓新的视野，并将其写入我们的历史。他相信在这个充满灾难的世界的某处隐藏着兽人真正的传说。\n\n我必须要承认，在我内心最黑暗的时候，我曾为那传说不能昭告世人而感到恐慌。"
G["Once seated, a customer will wait a short while for you to deliver their noodle soup. As with waiting in line, be sure to get the customer their food before they decide to leave."]="坐下之后，客人会等着你给他们上面。和排队一样，你要在他们离开前送上他们要的食物。"
G["Once the White Pawn is recovered, the full might of our navy can engage the Horde. On OUR terms."]="等救出白卒后，我们的海军就能发挥出全部威力，去迎战部落。这次该轮到我们做主了。"
G["Once the capital city of the Dark Iron dwarves, this volcanic labyrinth now serves as the seat of power for Ragnaros the Firelord. Ragnaros has uncovered the secret to creating life from stone and plans to build an army of unstoppable golems to aid him in conquering the whole of Blackrock Mountain. Obsessed with defeating Nefarian and his draconic minions, Ragnaros will go to any extreme to achieve final victory."]="黑石深渊曾经是黑铁矮人的伟大都城，这个火山中的迷宫现在成为拉格纳罗斯火焰领主的王座所在地。拉格纳罗斯找到了特殊的方法，可以使用石头来创造一支无敌的石头人军队，帮助它征服黑石深渊。为了打败奈法利安和他的龙子龙孙，拉格纳罗斯会不惜一切代价达到最后的胜利。"
G["Once the detonator goes off in... err... NOW!"]="一旦炸药爆炸……呃……快跑！"
G["Once the greatest gold production center in the human lands, the Dead Mines are now inhabited by the Defias Brotherhood, who have turned the dark tunnels into their private sanctum. It is rumored that the thieves have conscripted the clever goblins to help them build something terrible at the bottom of the mines - but what that may be is still uncertain. Rumor has it that the way into the Deadmines lies through the quiet, unassuming village of Moonbrook."]="这里曾经是人类最主要的产金地，希望矿井在部落第一次大战期间席卷暴风城的时候被废弃。现在迪菲亚兄弟会的人占据了那里并将这个黑暗的通道转变成他们的避难所。据说那些盗贼已经劝说了聪明的地精帮助他们在矿井的深处建造一些可怕的东西——但是没有人知道这是真的还是假的。有传言说，死亡矿井的入口在安宁的月溪镇中。"
G["Once the hatred in my heart became focused, everything became clear to me.  Shattrath must be destroyed and the naaru with it."]="当我心中的仇恨开始凝聚之后，整件事情就开始变得清晰起来。沙塔斯城必须和纳鲁一起被毁灭。"
G["Once the incision is made, the blood flows quickly."]="一旦割开创口，鲜血就会迅速外流。"
G["Once the jewel of northern Lordaeron, the city of Stratholme is where Prince Arthas turned against his mentor, Uther Lightbringer, and slaughtered hundreds of his own subjects who were believed to have contracted the plague of undeath. Arthas' surrender to the Lich King soon followed. The broken city is now inhabited by the undead Scourge - led by the powerful lich, Kel'Thuzad, and a contingent of Scarlet Crusaders, led by Grand Crusader Dathrohan. The two sides are locked in constant, violent combat."]="斯坦索姆曾经是罗德隆北部一颗璀璨的明珠，但是就是在这座城市阿萨斯王子背叛了他的导师乌瑟，并屠杀了数百个被认为感染了可怕瘟疫的臣民。阿萨斯不久之後就向巫妖王臣服。这个破碎的城市也被巫妖科尔苏拉德领导的天谴军团所占据。而一直由大十字军战士达索汉领导的血色十字军分遣队也占据了这个城市的一部分。这两方力量在城市中进行着激烈的战斗。"
G["Once the system activates, you will be required to manually\n maintain your demolisher."]="一旦启动系统，你就必须手动\n维持攻城车的运作。"
G["Once the system activates, you will be required to manually\n respond to emergencies that occur within the engine."]="一旦启动系统，你就必须手动\n处理引擎发生的各种紧急故障。"
G["Once the totem of Kar'dash is ours, we will raze your cities and rebuild them as our own."]="一旦卡达什图腾落入我们手中，我们就会把你们的城市夷为平地，以我们自己的方式重建它。"
G["Once the trap is sprung no one gets in or out until the people trapped are completely drained of life. Mogu are evil."]="陷阱一旦被触发，任何人都进不去也出不来，直到被困在里面的人被彻底吸干生命。魔古族可真邪恶。"
G["Once the world was small enough, I started to hunt for Deathwing in the clouds.\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_frost_arcticwinds.blp:32|t"]="一旦这个世界收缩到足够小，我就会开始在云端猎捕死亡之翼。\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_frost_arcticwinds.blp:32|t"
G["Once they're dealt with we can dedicate more resources to the war effort."]="等他们被解决了，我们就可以为战争提供更多的资源。"
G["Once this ritual ceases, we will not be able to resume it, and the corruption will remain at full strength. Your courage is admirable, but if you fail, we are all doomed. Do you understand what you ask? Do you understand the consequences?"]="一旦停止这个仪式，我们将不能重新开始，腐蚀会保有全部力量。你的勇气令人钦佩，但如果你失败了，我们将无力回天。你明白你在做什么吗？你清楚后果吗？"
G["Once upon a time - moments ago, in fact - a great king sought the help from a trio of powerful dwarves: The Council of Three Hammers."]="从前——其实也没过多久——有位伟大的国王向三位强大的矮人，也就是三锤议会求助。"
G["Once we are all free, we shall fly with you through Grim Batol!"]="一旦我们重获自由，我们将与你一同飞过格瑞姆巴托！"
G["Once we capture the underground railway and loading dock, we'll use them to make a rapid attack on the heart of the city."]="一旦我们攻占了地下铁路和码头，我们就可以对城市中心发动快速突袭。"
G["Once we defeat the Alliance and their allies, claiming this land will be a fitting testimony to the tenacity of the Horde."]="等我们击溃联盟和他们的盟友，并占领这片土地之后，它就将成为部落百折不挠的精神最强有力的证明。"
G["Once we get rid of these spirits, we can move on."]="等我们摆脱了这些水灵，就可以继续了。"
G["Once we open this portal, we will be able to travel much more quickly between here and the garrison."]="传送门一旦被打开，我们就能更快地穿行于此地和影踪卫戍营之间。"
G["Once ye've seen one trogg, ye've seen 'em all."]="你看见一个穴居人，也就相当于看见了所有穴居人。"
G["Once you are of revered standing with the Golden Lotus, you will be able to help the August Celestials.\n\nTo the east, Yu'lon's temple is under attack by the Sha of Doubt.\n\nTo the south, Chi-Ji's trainees are rebuilding and retraining after the attack on their temple.\n\nTo the north, Xuen tests the might of worthy combatants who enter his rings.\n\nAnd to the west, Niuzao stands vigilantly against some of the most dangerous enemies in Pandaria."]="Cuando hayas alcanzado el estado de $gvenerado:venerada; con el Loto Dorado, podrás ayudar a los Augustos Celestiales.\n\nAl este, el Sha de la duda ataca el templo de Yu'lon.\n\nAl sur, los aprendices de Chi-Ji están reconstruyendo y entrenándose después del ataque a su templo.\n\nAl norte, Xuen pone a prueba la fuerza de los valientes combatientes que entran en su dominio.\n\nAl oeste, Niuzao se alza firme contra algunos de los enemigos más peligrosos de Pandaria."
G["Once you die from the torture, we will go out and kidnap another of your kind. One of you is bound to crack under the pain and give us the information we need."]="如果你在拷问中丧命，我们会出去再绑架一个你的同类。迟早你们之间有一个会因为受不了酷刑而招供的！"
G["Once you enter the Order of the Cloud Serpent, you will begin the journey of a serpent rider.\n\nYou will raise a baby serpent from the egg, train with it every day, and watch it grow to adulthood."]="一旦进入云端翔龙骑士团，你就可以利用翔龙坐骑开始一段旅程。\n\n你可以孵化一头幼小的翔龙，每天培训它，看着它长大成年。"
G["Once you go shaman, you don't go back.\n\nI completely underestimated the usefulness of fire elementals. Easy to discipline too: just add water."]="一旦你决定成为一名萨满祭司，就再无法回头了。\n\n我曾经严重低估了火元素的效用。而且它也很容易管束：只需要加水就可以了。"
G["Once you have built the device, you simply activate the device to be transported to Toshley's Station!    A few people have reported being transformed into chickens, but I am sure they were exaggerating!\nIf possible I would try and not use the device on a day when someone else has, but it will probably work out alright even if you do!"]="Cuando hayas construido el dispositivo, simplemente lo activas para que te transporte a la Estación de Toshley. Varias personas han informado que fueron transformadas en pollos, ¡pero estoy seguro de que exageraban!\n\nSi es posible, intentaría no utilizar el dispositivo un día que lo haya utilizado otra persona, ¡pero seguramente funcionará bien incluso si lo haces!"
G["Once you have built the device, you simply activate the device to be whisked away to lovely Gadgetzan!    Nearly everyone who has used the device has arrived on the pad here looking just the way they did when they began!\nThere have been some reported problems with transportees being replaced by their evil selves from an alternate universe, but I'm sure we will have that worked out soon..."]="一旦你建造了这个装置，你就将被传送到可爱的加基森！几乎使用这个装置的人都发现在其立即到达了这里！\n\n有报告说，有别人试图用一种坏的版本来替换我们的产品，但是我相信我们不久之后就可以解决这个问题……"
G["Once you have defeated them, help your allies collect Jungle Brew for Bo!"]="等你打败他们之后，跟同伴一起为珀收集丛林酒！"
G["Once you have delivered supplies, your work is not done. Do your best to keep our resources topped off."]="把补给物资送达之后，你的工作还没有结束。你需要保持我们的资源存量。"
G["Once you have earned the respect of his majesty, the Black Prince, then you will have earned mine. Complete more of his tasks.\n\nUntil then, begone. I have nothing to sell to you."]="只要你赢得了黑王子殿下的尊重，那你也就赢得了我的尊重。再去完成一些他给你的任务吧。\n\n在此之前，请你先走开。我没有什么可卖给你的。"
G["Once you have learned to control your own actions, you must learn to control your opponent to gain the upper hand.  A slowed opponent allows you more time to attack, which can mean the difference between victory and defeat."]="等你学会控制自己的动作后，就必须学会控制敌人以占取先机。要是敌人动作迟缓，就能使你有更多时间发起攻击，往往能让胜败立显。"
G["Once you have met the various factions in Pandaria, work orders will pour in."]="一旦你结识了潘达利亚的各个阵营，大量产品订单就会蜂拥而至。"
G["Once you start loosening the reins on the ram, you'll see his speed change. He starts off walking. Ease up on the reins a bit more and he'll start to trot. Give him more slack on the reins while he's trotting and he'll go into a canter. Give him even more slack while he's in a canter and you will send him into a gallop."]="你只要一开始甩甩缰绳，就可以看到山羊速度的改变。它起初是步行，甩几下缰绳以后就会开始疾走，在它疾走的时候再来几下，就会开始慢跑了。在它慢跑得时候再加把劲，就可以让它飞奔起来。"
G["Once your wounded are gathered, you can thank me by leaving."]="你的伤势愈合了，就离开吧，也算是感谢我。"
G["Once, I brained an opponent who was stunned to see that my pants had fallen down during battle. He wasn't looking where he should have been."]="有一次，我的裤子在战斗中掉下来了，我的对手目瞪口呆地看着我，结果被我打碎了脑壳。他的眼睛看错了地方。"
G["Once, I had a home in the lush woods of Quel'Thalas. Once, I had a family, a husband... children. Once, I was alive and one with the world. The Lich King took all of that away from me in the blink of an eye.\n\nThough I have not the power to strike at him directly, I will pay him back threefold!"]="我曾经拥有一个温暖的家，它就坐落在奎尔萨拉斯苍翠的森林中。我还记得我的丈夫……还有孩子们的笑容。我曾经生活在这个美好的世界。眨眼之间，巫妖王夺走了这一切。\n\n虽然单凭我的力量根本不足以与他抗衡，但是总有一天，我要让他付出三倍的代价！"
G["Once, it is true, I was human. What might otherwise be a shortcoming works to our advantage, $n, for I know human weaknesses intimately."]="这是真的，我曾经是人类。缺点是可能转换为我们的优势的，$n，因为我对人类的劣势了如指掌。"
G["Once, jinyu ruled all of Pandaria from this place, from this seat of power.\n\nWe must learn all that we can from the histories, so that we may once again regain our ancient wisdom."]="锦鱼人曾经从这个地方，以这个权力座位统治整个潘达利亚。\n\n我们必须学习所有历史知识，这样，我们才有可能收复失地。"
G["Once, the Titans used these life-giving waters to create and shape all life in Pandaria."]="泰坦们曾用这些生命之水创造了潘达利亚所有的物种。"
G["Once, the mogu enslaved all of the races of Pandaria, and bent them to their nefarious will."]="魔古族曾奴役潘达利亚的所有种族，并让他们屈从于自己的邪恶意志。"
G["Once, these crypts were sacred to my people. They held our loved ones' spirits. A great many people traveled long distances here on pilgrimages.\n\nThose times are long gone. Something has taken a hold of the Auchenai that used to care so deeply for the deceased. Please, you must help before the spirits tear the crypt apart."]="这些地穴对我的族人来说，曾经非常神圣。因为里面有我们的亲人的灵魂。许多人不远万里赶来这里朝圣。\n\n但那已经是很久之前的事了。某种力量控制了奥金尼，这个曾经与亡者们戚戚相关的地方。我请求你，在灵魂们捣毁地穴之前，做点什么吧。"
G["Once, when I was young, I dreamt of ending this war against the hozen. Now, I fear I will not see such a day before my death."]="在我年轻时，曾梦想能结束这场与猢狲的战争。可现在，我感觉自己恐怕无法活着看到那一天了。"
G["One Centrifuge Construct remains.  We must find and destroy it to disable Varos Cloudstrider's protective shield.  The construct should be about halfway up The Oculus, on the Band of Acceleration."]="只剩1个离心构造体了。我们必须摧毁它们，才能破除瓦尔洛斯·云击的护盾。你可以在位于魔环中层的加速之环找到那些构造体。"
G["One Samophlange to rule them all!"]="一部主动式负载平衡器就能统御一切！"
G["One a dem lizard-beasts. Fight on me bruddahs!"]="该死的蜥蜴人。随我战斗，兄弟们！"
G["One a dem lizard-beasts. Fight on, me bruddahs!"]="该死的蜥蜴人。随我战斗，兄弟们！"
G["One among us will ascend on this day."]="今天，我们中的一员将得到升华。"
G["One approaches Morulu..."]="有人来找莫勒鲁了……"
G["One bright light appears accross the room, then disppears. Then you notice another beam... and then another.\n\nThey seem to be showing you a pattern."]="房间中出现一道明亮的光束，随即消失了。然后你注意到了另一道光束……又一道光束。\n\n它们似乎拼接出了某种图案。"
G["One by one the secrets of an ancient empire were laid bare."]="雷神那古老帝国的秘密也被一一破解。"
G["One by one, I overcame them - and buried them deep within the earth."]="我将其逐一制服——并深深埋入地下。"
G["One by one, nearly everyone involved in this matter has fallen prey to these spectres.  I'll understand if you decide to walk away from this, $n."]="一个接着一个，几乎所有人都成为了这些幽灵的猎物。如果你最终决定远离我们这摊子事，我能够理解，$n。"
G["One by one... our enemies will perish!  One by one... they will be destroyed!"]="一个接一个……我们的敌人都将消亡！一个接一个，他们都将走向毁灭！"
G["One can learn to fish near the enchanted fountain in the Eventide, a square in southern Dalaran."]="在达拉然南部的日暮广场内有一座魔法喷泉，你可以在那附近找到钓鱼训练师。"
G["One can learn volumes about a culture by studying its refuse."]="研究垃圾也能了解到这个文明的不少信息。"
G["One can only grow from their defeats."]="人只有在失败中才能得到成长。"
G["One cannot break Pandaria.\n\nOne can only break one's self upon Pandaria."]="谁也不能毁灭潘达利亚。\n\n野心家只会在潘达利亚碰得头破血流。"
G["One cannot simply FLY into Gilneas City!"]="谁都别想就这么飞进吉尔尼斯城！"
G["One day I'll be a real boy."]="总有一天我要成为一个真正的男孩。"
G["One day I'm going to explore the whole world, and my pets are coming with me!"]="总有一天，我将探索整个世界，而我的宠物们也会与我同行！"
G["One day maybe you can be Soo-dryskin. Like?"]="没准你能成为索干皮。你喜欢吗？"
G["One day soon, my friend, you will carry an Ogri'la crystal, as I do.  Then you will come to a greater understanding of the world around you."]="不久之后，我的朋友，你就会像我一样得到一块奥格瑞拉水晶。那样的话，你就能更深刻地了解周围的世界。"
G["One day you will have to teach me your secrets."]="以后你一定得把你的秘诀教给我。"
G["One day, I, too, will ascend."]="有一天，我也会升华。"
G["One day, Rejek be mighty warrior."]="总有一天，雷耶克会成为强大的战士。"
G["One day, The Wolf was very hungry, so he ran east to look for some food."]="有一天，孤狼饿坏了。他向东跑去，寻找食物。"
G["One day, a father grew tired of his young cub's misbehavior.  \"You act just like a hozen!\" the father scolded. Still, his son misbehaved."]="Un día, un pandaren se cansó de las travesuras de su cachorro. \"¡Te comportas como un hozen!\", le dijo. Pero su hijo siguió portándose mal."
G["One day, a hero will rise and lift the orcs up to their former glory."]="总有一天，一个英雄将会挺身而出，让兽人重获昔日的荣耀。"
G["One day, the beloved monk issued a challenge to his fellow slaves. \"Hit me!\" he called out."]="Un día, el venerable monje desafió a sus compañeros esclavos. \"¡Pegadme!\", dijo a sus hermanos."
G["One day, we will rule this dark temple."]="总有一天，我们会统治这座黑暗的神殿。"
G["One day...I will have my revenge..."]="总有一天……我会复仇……"
G["One down!"]="干掉一个！"
G["One down, one to go!"]="干掉一个，还剩一个！"
G["One empty cage.  One troll lost to the pit.  Do any of you other trolls need more convincing?"]="瞧，笼子空了。一只可怜的巨魔倒在斗兽场的血泊中。你们还是坚持不肯屈服是吧？"
G["One fewer of these pests behind the blockade."]="又少了一只躲在封锁线后的害虫。"
G["One final cell remains. Yes, O great one, right away!"]="还剩下最后一个牢笼。好的，主人，马上！"
G["One final... embrace."]="最后的……拥抱。"
G["One fire burns for lives at their end; their work may be done, but their contribution eternal."]="为即将凋零的生命燃起烈焰，他们的使命也许将要完成，但他们的贡献却会成为永恒。"
G["One fire burns for lives born anew; the passion of youth and the energy they bear."]="为新诞的生命燃起烈焰，青春盛放的热情与蓬勃不息的活力。"
G["One fire burns for lives in their prime; struggling to make and reshape the world."]="为正值盛年的生命燃起烈焰，奋力缔造和重塑这个世界。"
G["One fire burns for lives long lost; their essence now shared with all living things."]="为殒落已久的生命燃起烈焰，他们的魂灵与所有鲜活的生命同在。"
G["One fire burns for lives to come; nascent souls awakening in the womb."]="为即将降临的生命燃起烈焰，懵懂的灵魂在母体中苏醒。"
G["One fog beast remains."]="还有一只雾行兽。"
G["One gains little wisdom from speaking. One gains much wisdom from listening."]="能说会道只能得点小聪明，善于倾听才会明白大智慧。"
G["One has opened up on the Tradesman's Terrace.  If you take the path leading Southeast from the bank, it should be easy to find."]="贸易区刚刚开放了一座拍卖行。如果你沿着银行东南方的路走，很容易就能找到贸易区。"
G["One healthy kypari remains, far to the southwest, but the Empress's slaves are destroying it as we speak."]="远在西南方向，存活着一棵健康的凯帕圣树，但就在此时，女皇的奴隶正在试图毁灭它。"
G["One is such a lonely number."]="“一”这个数字，可真令人感到孤独。"
G["One keg?! I was carrying one keg with ease when I was a young cub, barely higher than your knee!"]="一桶？！我牙牙学语时就能轻而易举地搬起一桶，那时我才跟你膝盖一样高！"
G["One last drink before we head to the front?"]="在上前线之前，让我们再喝一杯吧？"
G["One last favor from old Zuni."]="这是老祖尼最后的请求。"
G["One last impersonation.  It's tough, but let's see if you can guess who it is..."]="最后一个模仿。有点难度，但是你们能猜出是谁吗……"
G["One less cultist for us to worry about."]="又少了一个邪教徒。"
G["One less cultist to worry about."]="又少了一个邪教徒。"
G["One less demon to contend with!"]="又消灭了一个恶魔！"
G["One less enemy of the master!"]="主人的敌人又少了一个！"
G["One less obstacle in our way!"]="又少了一个障碍！"
G["One less obstacle to deal with."]="又少了一个障碍。"
G["One less threat to the timeways!"]="又少了一个威胁时间之流的家伙！"
G["One minute until the Arena battle begins!"]="竞技场战斗将在一分钟后开始！"
G["One minute!? Come on, Brann! Think!"]="一分钟？！快点，布莱恩！快想！"
G["One moment while I stitch this together..."]="稍等片刻，我要把这些缝在一起……"
G["One moment, $n..."]="等等，$n……"
G["One more beast saved from certain death!"]="又一头科多兽逃过了死亡的魔爪！"
G["One more bottle?  I don't see any reason why not!"]="再来一瓶？为什么不呢！"
G["One more down!"]="有人挂啦！"
G["One more elemental to go! The door is almost open!"]="只剩一个元素了！大门就要被打开了！"
G["One more for dinner this evening."]="晚餐又多了一道菜。"
G["One more lock of scourge hair gained, one more shred of dignity lost...."]="每收集一束毛发，就损失一份尊严……"
G["One more minute!  Hold on now, the ritual is about to take hold!"]="再坚持一分钟！坚持住，仪式就要完成了！"
G["One more sip of the ol' fire water and I'll be ready to talk. Hiccup! Cheers!"]="再喝一口酒，我就可以发言了。嗝儿！干杯！"
G["One more slave for the Lich King."]="巫妖王又多了一名仆从。"
G["One more thing.  We've arranged for one of our own to accompany you."]="还有一件事。我们安排了一名自己的人随你一同调查。"
G["One more word out of you and so help me..."]="如果你再罗嗦一句，我就……"
G["One more, Kat."]="再来一盘吧，凯特。"
G["One note stands out from the other various pieces of parchment that are tacked onto this wanted poster.  It's a call to slay the bonelashers of the Bone Wastes."]="Una nota destaca de los demás pedazos de pergamino que están clavados en este cartel de \"Se busca\". Un llamamiento para matar a los Atizahuesos de El Vertedero de Huesos."
G["One of Clay's catapult teams is broken down on the front. $n, I need you to get some parts from him and get that catapult back in the fight!"]="克莱的一支投石机部队在前线被击溃了。$n，我需要你从他那里取得一些零件，让那架投石机重新投入战斗！"
G["One of Darnassus' Highborne, an Arcane Reforger, is working with the Exodar's enchanters.  You'll find them all in the Crystal Hall, opposite the jewel crafters."]="一名属于达纳苏斯上层精灵的奥术重铸师正和埃索达的附魔师们呆在一起。你可以在水晶大厅中珠宝加工师的对面找到他们。"
G["One of my ancestors took part in the uprising at Tu Shen, and now lies among the graves.  I would pay my respects if only I could, but the spirits there know no peace."]="我的一位先祖参加了徒圣起义，他的尸体就躺在这墓地里。我愿意放弃我的自尊去接受和平，但是墓地里的鬼魂知道这个世界是没有和平可言的。"
G["One of our best sentinels was on his trail - we assume it's a \"he\" - but it appears that she was discovered."]="Una de nuestros mejores centinelas le seguía el rastro, aunque al parecer él la descubrió. Damos por sentado que es un hombre."
G["One of our merchants has gone missing!"]="我们的一个商人失踪了！"
G["One of our scouts is reporting that a shadowy group has moved into the ruins of Grangol'var Village.  Oops, this report is over a week old."]="我们的一个斥候报告说，有一支秘密组织已经进入了格兰戈瓦村的废墟。糟糕，这报告是一周前的。"
G["One of our warriors broke free and smashed many of the prisons... we were free - at least for a moment.\n\nSome swam up towards the surface... some saw this cave and swam for it.\n\nI'm the only one that lived...."]="我们当中有位战士得以逃脱，并打碎了许多牢笼……我们自由了——至少是片刻的自由。\n\n有些人朝水面蜂拥游去……有些则看到并朝这个洞穴游来。\n\n我是唯一活下来的人……"
G["One of the Ash'ari Crystals has been destroyed!  Slay the intruders!"]="一块阿莎利水晶已经被摧毁了！杀死入侵者！"
G["One of the Gilneans, Vitus  Darkwalker, can help you. Find him at the Howling Oak."]="一个叫维图斯·暗行者的吉尔尼斯人能帮助你。你可以在风嚎橡树找到他。"
G["One of the children swears up and down they saw a cross between a shark and an octopus the other day.\n\nI know there are a lot of strange things in the ocean but that seems extra silly to me."]="有个孩子发誓，有一天，他看到了在鲨鱼和章鱼之间的一个十字形物。\n\n我知道海洋中有很多奇怪的事情，但在我看来，都很无聊。"
G["One of the cultists seems to have stumbled onto my blade and died... can I have a new disguise? I promise that I will be more careful this time."]="有个教徒不小心撞上了我的剑刃，然后就死了……我能再要一套伪装吗？我发誓这次会更加谨慎的。"
G["One of the druids? Our people don't walk that path... but you are in luck. A tauren woman - at least, I believe it's a woman - has set up a modest residence on the north end of the Walk of Elders. Harene Plainwalker is her name."]="德鲁伊之路？我们的人不会选择这个……但是你很幸运。一个女性牛头人——至少，我相信那是个女性——在长者步道的北面尽头建了个住处。她叫哈雷尼·平原行者。"
G["One of the fiercest $cs on the field of battle, we present $n."]="$gUno de los:Una de las; $cs más fieros en el campo de batalla, presentamos a $n."
G["One of the humans has the key to this infernal contraption. Eston I think they said his name was."]="有个人类手中有能打开这个装置的钥匙。我想他的名字叫埃斯顿。"
G["One of the initiates pulled a prank on me the other day. He said I was supposed to sniff his \"healing mists\". There was nothing healing about that mist."]="Uno de los iniciados me gastó una broma el otro día. Dijo que tenía que olfatear sus \"brumas sanadoras\". No había nada de sanador en esa bruma."
G["One of the mountaineers has seen something. Keep your eyes open!"]="有位巡山人已经看见了什么。睁大你们的双眼！"
G["One of them flies higher than the others... He loops far out over the water - alone. He is over-extending. That is our in."]="有一个比其他人飞得都高……他一直独自在海面上盘旋。他脱队了。这是个机会。"
G["One of them has the key. Find it and get me out of here!"]="他们当中有人身上带着钥匙。快找来放我出去！"
G["One of them has the key. Find it and get me out of this cage!"]="他们当中有人身上带着钥匙。快找来放我出去！"
G["One of these days I'm going to bust out the crystalline doomhammer and go positively orc on this town. Then they'll be sorry..."]="总有一天，我会突然拔出水晶战锤把这地方砸个稀巴烂……看他们还催不催我！"
G["One of these days I'm gonna drown him in that blue robe. And all his brooms too."]="我总有一天要把他用那件蓝色的长袍裹起来，和他的扫帚一起扔到河里去。"
G["One of these days we're going to have to talk about you joining my group, $n."]="总有一天我们得谈谈让你加入我队伍的事，$n。"
G["One of these is BOUND to get through!"]="这些当中一定有一个能通过！"
G["One of these smoke bombs will blind a sentry totem."]="这些烟雾弹可以蒙蔽岗哨图腾。"
G["One of those blasted Jaedenar demons saw me! Gave me a good slash in the side. The wound isn't pretty, but I'll live.\n\nThere are more urgent matters at hand, like stopping the Shadow Council from launching a full-scale attack on our friends at Wildheart Point. I'm in no shape to fight, so you'll have to go in my place."]="有个可恨的加德纳尔恶魔发现了我！还在我的身侧划了一条大口子。这道伤口不浅，但我还能活下去。\n\n还有更要紧的事情要办，暗影议会将对我们在野性之心哨站的朋友们发起全面进攻。我现在没法战斗了，所以你必须代替我去阻止他们。"
G["One of you man da guns, the rest on foot."]="一人操作机枪，其他人步行。"
G["One of you, stay with me to keep the cauldron safe. The others, go find some Unga Jungle Brew and bring it back!"]="你们来个人和我一起看管酿酒的大锅。其他人去找一些盎迦丛林酒，然后交给我！"
G["One order at a time please."]="请每次只下一个订单。"
G["One pitiful wretch down. Go on, take another one!"]="有个废柴挂了，继续，干掉下一个！"
G["One problem at a time, people. Focus on the Zandalari!"]="一个个来，将士们。先集中解决赞达拉！"
G["One red sash that ye can put on yer head or your britches. Pride o' the fleet, that sash is..."]="一块你可以系在头上或腰上的红色饰带。那饰带是舰队的荣耀……"
G["One set of trolls dealt with, one yet to go. You have no idea how much I appreciate what you're doing, $n! Before you came along I didn't think we'd ever get the Shadowpine problem under control."]="解决掉一批巨魔，下一批就已经来了。你不知道我对你所做的事情有多么感激，$n！在你来之前，我甚至觉得我们根本无法把这些暗松巨魔给控制住。"
G["One shoeshine coming up!"]="来擦擦鞋吧！"
G["One shot, one kill!"]="一击必杀！"
G["One sip of my brews and you will see how unworthy you really are."]="Un trago de mi cerveza y descubrirás lo $gindigno:indigna; que eres en realidad."
G["One statue in particular stood out. I had never seen a creature like this."]="其中有一座雕像特别突出。我从没见过那种生物。"
G["One step closer to victory!"]="又向胜利迈进了一步！"
G["One step closer."]="更近了一步。"
G["One step closer..."]="又近了一步……"
G["One technique alone is not enough."]="一招半式不解决问题。"
G["One thing I have learned from the sha. They know how to prey on our weaknesses."]="我从煞魔身上了解到的一点就是，他们知道如何利用我们自身的弱点。"
G["One thing is clear. Our future will be affected by you and your people."]="有件事很清楚，你和你的同胞将会影响到我们的未来。"
G["One thousand blades!"]="千刃乱舞！"
G["One time, Keeshan told me that he could take on five of me at once. Why am I so weak?"]="有一次，基沙恩告诉我，他能同时把五个我打倒。我为什么这么弱？"
G["One who shares your pain. One who offers you the power to assuage it."]="与你有着同样伤痛的人。能助你缓解伤痛的人。"
G["One word: Incense!"]="一个词：熏香！"
G["One would be hard pressed to find a more steadfast champion than this $c.  Today we present, $n."]="Sería difícil encontrar un campeón más inquebrantable que $geste:esta; $c. Hoy presentamos a $n."
G["One! Two! Five!... THREE!"]="一！二！五！……三！"
G["One, two, three, four, I declare a thumb war!"]="一、二、三、四，拇指大战开始了！"
G["One-sided paper!"]="只有单面的纸！"
G["One..."]="一……"
G["Online."]="联线。"
G["Only $3658E shopping minutes before Christmas!  But wait, is it Christmas?  Well then, there are only $3659E minutes left to party!  TEST TEST DO NOT LOCALIZE"]="Only $3658E shopping minutes before Christmas! But wait, is it Christmas? Well then, there are only $3659E minutes left to party! TEST TEST DO NOT LOCALIZE"
G["Only 10 minutes remain before the Kalu'ak Fishing Derby ends!"]="离卡鲁亚克钓鱼大赛结束仅剩10分钟！"
G["Only 10 more minutes until Vol'jin taps the Brewfest keg!"]="再过10分钟，沃金就要来主持开酒罐仪式啦！"
G["Only a few more towers and that whole thing is coming down!"]="没剩下几座塔楼了，那东西马上就要被打垮了！"
G["Only a few spots to get any fishing done around here.  Paxton knows them all and probably a few he won't tell ya about.  Why don't ye go over to Iceflow Lake and see what he will tell ya."]="这附近只有几处地方可以钓鱼。帕克斯顿对此了如指掌，但是他不一定都会告诉你。为什么不去涌冰湖找他谈谈呢？"
G["Only a flesh wound!"]="只是轻伤而已！"
G["Only a fool walks into a den of thieves unaware. That fool rarely walks out..."]="只有傻子才会在不知不觉中进入贼窝。他是不可能出来的了……"
G["Only a fool would dare disturb me in my lair."]="只有傻子才敢侵犯我的巢穴。"
G["Only a fool would mock the appearance of my battle-garb.\n\nThis raiment of well-worn steel is from an ancient place of learning!"]="那些嘲笑我的战袍的人都是蠢货。\n\n这件衣服所用的旧钢都来自一个远古的学习之地！"
G["Only a fool would remain in this battle. Farewell, coward."]="只有傻瓜还会继续战斗。再见了，懦夫。"
G["Only a mage can learn portal magic, $c."]="只有法师可以学习传送魔法，$c。"
G["Only a matter of time, now."]="只是时间问题了。"
G["Only a mind at peace can fully ready a body for battle."]="只有冷静的头脑能够做好战斗的准备。"
G["Only a non-believer would ask such a question!  Are you a non-believer?"]="只有怀疑论者才会问出这样的问题！你是怀疑论者吗？"
G["Only an elemental lord could bind so many elementals so quickly. It seems we're at war with da Stonemother herself..."]="只有元素领主才有可能在短时间内唤醒这么多的元素。看来，我们面对的正是石母本尊……"
G["Only babies play in the sandbox."]="小婴儿才玩沙箱呢。"
G["Only by working together will you overcome the final challenge. From the depths of Icecrown come two of the Scourge's most powerful lieutenants: fearsome val'kyr, winged harbingers of the Lich King!"]="你们只有团结才能战胜最终的挑战。来自于冰冠冰川的深处，天灾军团最强的战将：巫妖王的双翼使者，恐怖的瓦格里！"
G["Only champions of Orgrimmar may purchase what I have to offer."]="只有奥格瑞玛的勇士才有资格从我这里购买物品。"
