G["Only if I were about five feet taller, then I would show these blasphemous demons a thing or two! Help!"]="要是我再高五英尺，我就会给这些亵渎神明的恶魔一点颜色看看！快帮帮我！"
G["Only if Lord Deathwing commands it!"]="听从死亡之翼领主的号令！"
G["Only if we didn't follow the proper initialization procedures."]="除非我们没有按照正确的初始步骤进行操作。"
G["Only in silence will we hear the trees speaking."]="只有在寂静中，我们才能听到林木间的窃窃私语。"
G["Only in this way will our wisdom be passed forward through time."]="只有这样，我们的智慧才能得以代代相传，绵延后世。"
G["Only love can drive out hatred."]="以德报怨，以爱消恨。"
G["Only mortal..."]="区区凡人……"
G["Only one dwarf offered to help the king. \"We will lend you our strength,\" said Moira, of the Dark Iron. \"We will trust our dwarven brothers, and we will show them what loyalty means!\""]="Solo una enana ofreció su ayuda al Rey. \"Cuenta con nosotros\", dijo Moira, de los Hierro Negro. \"¡Confiaremos en nuestros hermanos enanos y les daremos una lección de lealtad!\"."
G["Only one of us may leave this world!"]="我们中只有一人能离开这个世界！"
G["Only one swing? Are we sure this will work? Is there any way to get more ointment?"]="只能敲一次？一次真的就够了吗？我们有办法多找到一些药膏吗？"
G["Only one thing to do with a lousy, good-for-nothin eavesdropper."]="对惹人讨厌、一无是处的偷听者来说，只有一个待遇。"
