G["Only stoopid wants to meet Bad Luckydo."]="只有笨蛋才想遇见扫把星。"
G["Only strong--ka-raaak-survive!"]="强大的人……呱呱……才能活下去！"
G["Only ten copper? You're not even worth killing!"]="才10个铜币？杀你还真不划算！"
G["Only the Horde can save us now."]="现在只有部落能救我们了。"
G["Only the best brew for Derpa Derpa."]="只给迪嘭迪嘭最好的酒。"
G["Only the best of friends will do."]="只有挚友才行。"
G["Only the best of the best get a shot in Valhalas to go to Ymirheim. Everyone else dies... or worse!"]="只有精英中的精英才能进入瓦哈拉斯，前往伊米海姆。剩下的人都得死……甚至落得更加悲惨的结局！"
G["Only the blood of an innocent can quench Aku'mai's hunger."]="只有无辜者的鲜血才能平息阿库麦尔的愤怒。"
