G["Only the gathered mind is truly prepared to face any trial."]="只有集中精力，才能直面任何考验。"
G["Only the highest-ranking members of The Reliquary know where our order's Grand Vault is located.\n\nSome say it is not even upon this plane of existence..."]="只有神圣遗物学会最高阶的成员知道我们的大殿堂在哪里。\n\n甚至有人说，大殿堂根本就不存在于这个位面……"
G["Only the most seasoned hunters of Illidan's minions gain access to my wares.\n\nYou will be considered worthy when your status with the Sha'tar, Cenarion Expedition and the Aldor is exalted."]="只有最擅长追捕伊利丹仆从的猎手才能在我这里选购货物。\n\n当你在沙塔尔、塞纳里奥远征队以及奥尔多的声望达到崇拜时，我才会出售货物给你。"
G["Only the most seasoned hunters of Illidan's minions gain access to my wares.\n\nYou will be considered worthy when your status with the Sha'tar, Cenarion Expedition and the Scryers is exalted."]="只有最擅长追捕伊利丹仆从的猎手才能在我这里选购货物。\n\n当你在沙塔尔、塞纳里奥远征队以及占星者的声望达到崇拜时，我才会出售货物给你。"
G["Only the most valiant and honorable amongst the tribe can earn the honor of being laid to rest at Red Rocks."]="只有部族中最勇猛，最具荣誉感的成员才能安息在赤色石。"
G["Only the pure of heart may pass!"]="只有纯洁的心灵才能通过！"
G["Only the renowned Doctor Gregory Victor can improve your skill now.  He can be found in Arathi Highlands at Hammerfall."]="现在，只有著名的格里高利·维克托医生能提高你的技能啦。你可以在阿拉希高地的落锤镇找到他。"
G["Only the strong should survive. Not to mention..."]="唯有强者才能生存。更别说是……"
