G["Only the strongest survive."]="只有强者才能生存。"
G["Only the very best, hmmm?"]="只挑最好的，是吧？"
G["Only the weak hide in shadows, Twilight filth!"]="只有弱者才藏在阴影里，暮光垃圾！"
G["Only the worthy will learn the secrets we keep!"]="只有真正的强者才能学到我们的秘密！"
G["Only thirty gyrocopters? We are going to need way more than that before this is over."]="才三十台旋翼机？要想顺利完成任务，还需要许多许多台。"
G["Only this book survived the cataclysm that destroyed their world.  Those proud and foolish men who thought to control a cosmic being of untold power.\n\nWould you, the possessor of the codex, do the same?\n\nHave you devised a foolproof method to summon forth Murmur, or any of the other entities cautiously whispered of in these unhallowed pages?\n\nWe shall see."]="在以后的那场大灾难中，只有这本法典得以保存下来。那些高傲而愚蠢的凡人妄图控制拥有无上力量的宇宙生物。\n\n而你呢？法典的拥有者，你会做出同样的蠢事吗？\n\n你是否已经想好了召唤摩摩尔的安全之策？这本邪恶的禁断之书还记载着其它神秘的宇宙生物，或许你对它们更感兴趣？\n\n我们等着瞧吧。"
G["Only those of the highest esteem may speak to the elder."]="只有最为尊贵的客人，才能与长老说话。"
G["Only those who have proven themselves to not be hostile toward the Timbermaw may pass through the Hold without fear of being attacked.  Have you made an effort to earn our trust, outsider?"]="只有那些对木喉没有敌意的人能通过安全通过要塞。陌生人，你赢得我们的信任了吗？"
G["Only those who have the ranger general's approval may enter the Sunwell Plateau."]="只有取得游侠将军的许可才能进入太阳井高地。"
G["Only those who have trained extensively can enter the tournament.\nWhen you have trained 15 pets to their maximum level, you will be deemed ready."]="En el torneo solo pueden entrar los entrenadores más experimentados.\n\nCuando hayas alcanzado el nivel máximo con al menos 15 mascotas, habrás demostrado estar a la altura."
G["Only three Horde rats left. Shouldn't be a problem to finish you off once and for all."]="还剩三个部落鼠辈。这次我会一块儿把你们收拾了。"
G["Only through inner balance can we find peace within ourselves."]="只有通过内在的平衡，我们才能让自己内心平静下来。"
G["Only time will tell."]="时间会告诉我们。"
G["Only time will tell..."]="只有时间能证明一切……"
G["Only to the most trusted allies do we reveal the Golden Lotus's deepest secrets."]="我们只会对最可信赖的盟友透露金莲至深的秘密。"
G["Only you can give us our opening!"]="英雄们，进攻。只有你们能为我们创造机会！"
G["Only you can save me from Kaganishu, $n."]="$n，只有你能从卡加尼舒的魔掌中救出我。"
