G["Onu'zun here to challenge the vrykul and work himself up in the ranks.\n\nThen when Onu'zun fight in Valhalas and win, Onu'zun gonna be workin' for the Lich King!"]="奥努森来这里挑战维库人，以此提升自己的地位。\n\n然后，奥努森要在瓦哈拉斯战斗并赢得胜利，奥努森要为巫妖王效力！"
G["Onu'zun is defeated by the ugliest person ever!"]="奥努森被迄今为止最丑陋的人打败了！"
G["Onu'zun is number one! You are number two!"]="奥努森第一！你第二！"
G["Onward to the Stormstout Brewery!"]="前往风暴烈酒酿造厂！"
G["Onward!"]="前进！"
