G["Onward, $n! We will beat back the Alliance dogs and secure Lordaeron for the Forsaken! For the Horde!"]="$n，前进！我们会击退联盟狗，为被遗忘者占领洛丹伦！为了部落！"
G["Onward, Crusaders! We must retake Corin's Crossing!"]="前进，十字军！我们必须夺回考林路口！"
