G["Ooh, that looks dangerous. Get in there, boys, and show em' what we're made of."]="呼，它看起来很危险，冲上去，小伙子们，让他们看看我们的本事。"
G["Ooh, that's gotta hurt!"]="哦，这可真疼！"
