G["Oooh, an Inn is it?  Well, ye just can't beat the Thunderbrew Distillery.  Rest if ye must, but be sure to have an ale or two while ye're there."]="哦，旅店是吗？嗯，雷酒酿制厂是最棒的。你可以在那里稍事休息，但是你一定得尝尝那儿的啤酒。"
G["Oooh, delicious juju!"]="哦，美味的魂能！"
G["Oooh, look at his muscles!"]="噢，快看他那一身肌肉！"
G["Oooh, look at that!"]="噢，看那个！"
G["Oooh, pretty... Zanzil's got big plans for this one..."]="哦，真漂亮……赞吉尔会让这个派上大用场……"
G["Oooh, this is so exciting! A real life treasure hunt!"]="噢，这太令人兴奋了！现实版的寻宝！"
G["Oooh, this looks promising..."]="哦，有戏了……"
G["Oooh.  Mr. Big Mean Mogu.  I'm so scared."]="噢。邪恶的大魔古。我好怕呦。"
G["Oooh. I'm afraid you've chosen a bad time for building defenses, friend."]="噢。你恐怕选错了建造工事的时机，朋友。"
G["Oooh... ooooh! My shenses are tingling! I see... huge Green Cabbages in your future."]="哦……哦！我感到刺痛无比！我看见……巨大的绿色卷心菜……在你的未来里。"
G["Oooh... shiny!"]="哦……闪闪发光！"
G["Ooohh. Somethin's not agreein' with the tummy today..."]="哦。我的肚子有点不舒服……"
G["Ooohh... This rock is nice and colorful. Let's see if I can find more like it..."]="哦……这块漂亮的岩石。看看我能不能找到更多这样的石料……"
G["Oook!  Ooooooook!!"]="乌克！乌………克！"
G["Ooooh! I think that one's head exploded!"]="噢噢噢噢！一枪爆头！"
G["Ooooh, YAH! Gaze upon my rippling musculature. Bask in the glow of my physique."]="喔喔，耶！看看我鼓起的肌肉，感受我身体的温暖吧。"
G["Ooooh, a $c! Try to catch me, slowpoke!"]="哦，一个$c！来抓我啊，你这个慢手慢脚的家伙！"
G["Ooooh, you have lots of pretty things to steal!  Gimme!"]="噢，你身上有这么多好东西可以偷呀！给我！"
G["Ooooh... looking sexy!"]="哦……看上去很性感！"
G["Oooooh, isn't this scary? Do you think there are ghosts in there?"]="哇！这不可怕吗？你觉得那里有鬼吗？"
G["Oooooo hot hot hot!  If that won't put spring in your step, I don't know what will!"]="哦，热啊热！如果这样的热度都不能让你跳起来，那你简直就是块石头了！"
