G["Oops!"]="啊！"
G["Oops! That lever activates the Bile-O-Tron. Oh, and if you happen to come across a key..."]="哎呀！那控制杆激活了胆汁喷洒机。喔，要是你刚好能找到一把钥匙的话……"
G["Oops! That was a bit off. I didn't even hit the target!"]="啊！有一点偏。我甚至没有射中靶子！"
G["Oops, break's over."]="哦，休息结束了。"
G["Oops, how do ye fly one o' these things? Fer light's sake! Ye crummy piece o' whackery, WORK!"]="喔，在这种东西上飞行，你们是怎么做到的？圣光在上！你们这小手艺可太拉风了！"
G["Oops, my bad.  Sometimes I can't control my moonfire."]="糟糕，我的错。有时候我无法控制我的月火。"
G["Oops."]="啊呀。"
G["Oops. Grondo sorry."]="啊。格隆度很抱歉。"
G["Oops. I guess it IS working! That's odd."]="哎呀。我觉得这玩意儿起作用啦！真奇怪。"
G["Oops... not again."]="糟糕……不是吧。"
