G["Open fire!"]="开火！"
G["Open for business!"]="开张了！"
G["Open for business! The goblin car is looking sharp and it's sure to be a winner! Get your bets in before the race starts!"]="开始下注啦！地精的车看上去很酷，它肯定能赢！趁比赛还没有开始赶快下注啦！"
G["Open it and be careful this time!"]="打开它，这次小心点！"
G["Open it."]="打开它。"
G["Open it. We need to hurry up. I can smell those Dark Irons coming a mile away and I can tell you one thing, they're COMING!"]="打开它。我们要抓紧时间。我已经可以闻到黑铁军团的气味了，我可以告诉你，他们就要来了！"
G["Open me! Open me! Open me! Then only will you know peace."]="打开我！打开我！打开我！然后你才能获知平静的意义。"
G["Open the gates brothers! Let us welcome our visitors in true Horde fashion!"]="兄弟们，打开大门！让我们以真正的部落风格欢迎我们的来访者！"
G["Open the portal to Kun-Lai Summit, you fools! Quickly!"]="打开通往昆莱山的传送门，你们这群蠢货！赶快！"
