G["Open your senses, little one. Can you not feel it - the pain, the suffering this tree endured when it was ripped from the nourishing earth? We will heal it and give it peace, though the tree will never grow again."]="Abre tus sentidos, $gpequeño:pequeña;. ¿No lo sientes? El dolor, el sufrimiento que este árbol soportó cuando lo arrancaron de la tierra que lo alimentaba. Lo curaremos y le daremos paz, aunque no vuelva a crecer nunca."
G["Opening"]="正在打开"
G["Operation: Gnomeregan begins NOW!"]="诺莫瑞根行动正式开始！"
G["Operation: Gnomeregan is divided into a number of phases:\n\nFirst, we must retake the air tower.  This will allow our planes give us air support as we move towards Gnomeregan's main entrance.\n\nIn addition, a cache of mechanized Battle Suits was discovered in one of the nearby buildings.  Once we have those suits, our assault on the entrance should be unstoppable.\n\nThen, we go straight for Thermaplugg in the heart of Gnomeregan!"]="诺莫瑞根行动将分成数个步骤完成：\n\n首先，我们必须夺回航空塔。这样我们的飞机才能支援进攻诺莫瑞根主入口的部队。\n\n而且，我们还在诺莫瑞根入口附近的一座建筑中发现了防辐射服。装备上防辐射服的侏儒部队能够直接进入诺莫瑞根。\n\n这样，我们就能在诺莫瑞根的核心对瑟玛普拉格发动直接攻击！"
G["Operation: Gnomeregan was a success. Sure, that dastardly Thermaplugg had an unforeseen trick up his sleeve, but we have him on the run! It's only a matter of time before Gnomeregan is cleaned up and in our hands again!"]="诺莫瑞根行动取得了成功。当然，那个卑鄙的瑟玛普拉格使出了让人出乎意料的一招，但我们还是把他赶跑了！诺莫瑞根很快就会被肃清，重新回到我们的手中，这只是时间问题！"
G["Operational status: nominal."]="运行状态：正常。"
G["Optical sensor malfunction detected! Shutting down..."]="已发现光学感应故障！正在关闭中……"
G["Opus wants some Cuergo's Gold... with worm."]="奥普斯想要一些科尔戈的黄金……和一些虫子。"
G["Or THIS is what you get."]="否则，这就是后果。"
G["Or else great darkness looms in the days ahead..."]="否则，未来的日子将被强大的阴影所笼罩……"
G["Or if you want to wander the woods a while, Aysa and I can hang out here.  You know... just the two of us."]="如果你想在林子里逛逛，艾莎和我可以在这里等着。我是说…就我们俩。"
G["Or in this case, better undead than worgen."]="所以，亡灵要比狼人更好。"
G["Or is it an alliance of convenience, a confederacy of unlikely partners free to pursue their own agendas?"]="或者说，仅仅是一个权宜之计，由一群各怀目标的盟友临时拼凑而成？"
G["Or one murder."]="或者杀戮别人。"
G["Or perhaps a testament to your abilities?"]="或者说，这正显示出了你的能力？"
G["Or stay if you want. We always be needin' more to sacrifice."]="想留下也可以。我们的祭品总是不够用。"
G["Or that time when you told us that you'd discovered the cure for the plague of the 20th century. What is that even? 20th century?"]="还有那一次，你告诉我们说，你发现了治愈20世纪疾病的办法。这所谓的20世纪又到底是什么东西？"
G["Or, they killed most of us. I was the village's healer - after they ran me through, I was able to apply enough of my medical skills to keep me alive... but barely."]="他们杀死了我们当中的大部分人。我是村里的治疗者——在被刺穿之后，我运用医术救活了自己……可也只是勉强留下一口气罢了。"
G["Orachi shall have my head if you do not work faster, smith! And I shall have yours."]="如果你不快点干完，太蛇就要把我杀掉了，史密斯！到时候我先把你杀掉。"
G["Orbaz Bloodbane, self proclaimed hand of the Lich King."]="奥尔巴兹·血毒，就凭你也敢自称是巫妖王的左膀右臂。"
