G["Orgrimmar is under lock down. All shops are closed. Please visit Thunder Bluff or Silvermoon City if you require a merchant, auctioneer or trainer.\n\nStay clear of the Undercity!"]="奥格瑞玛正处于封锁状态。所有商店全部关闭。如果你要寻找商人、拍卖师或训练师，请前往雷霆崖或是银月城。\n\n幽暗城还是算了吧！"
G["Orgrimmar portal open, Brawl fans!  Tell 'em Bubbles sent ya."]="奥格瑞玛传送门已经开启，搏击粉丝们！告诉他们是“泡泡”送你们来的。"
G["Orgrimmar will fall to our forces!"]="我们的大军一定能攻克奥格瑞玛！"
