G["Osadi!"]="啊哈！"
G["Other"]="其它"
G["Other customers are impatient, they won't wait as long; but are really happy when they are served quickly."]="有些客人比较性急，不愿等太久。但如果你能迅速招呼好他们，他们就会很开心。"
G["Other shaman used to say, \"Only yer offhand should be flaming.\" What were they going on about?"]="Otro chamán solía decir: \"Solo tu arma debería arder.\" ¿De qué estaban hablando?"
G["Other sshaman used to say, \"Only yer offhand should be flaming.\" What were they going on about?"]="Otro chamán solía decir: \"Solo tu arma debería arder\". ¿De qué estaban hablando?"
G["Others are like me. You gotta find 'em."]="还有和我一样的人。去找他们。"
G["Others cite rumors of his escalating conflicts with Tyrande Whisperwind, the shining light of our people, our leader in Darnassus."]="还有谣言说，他和我族的光芒，达纳苏斯的领袖泰兰德·语风之间出现了越来越多的矛盾。"
G["Others will come... the age of mortals... has passed."]="其它人也会来……凡人的年代……已经远去。"
G["Others will take my place!"]="其他人会顶替我的位置的！"
G["Otherwise, get off my back! One of these days you won't have old Hermesius to push around anymore. That much I can promise..."]="要不然就离我远点！总有一天，老赫米修斯发飙了，不会再被你们支来支去。我是认真的……"
G["Oto! I cannot attack them while they are attacking me!"]="欧图，我老被攻击的话就没法全力输出了！"
G["Otoh Greyhide spends much of time in the Hall of Elders on the Elder Rise.  Seek him out there, and he will help you."]="欧托·灰皮通常都在长者高地的长者大厅。你可以在那里找到他。他会帮助你的。"
