G["Our Aether-tech and his escort are heading to Bash'ir Landing.  Meet them there and help with their mission!"]="太空卫队以太技师和他的护卫队正在前往巴什伊尔码头的途中。去那里和他们碰面，帮助他们完成任务吧！"
G["Our Alchemist's name is Carolai Anise.  You'll find her in a house at the northwest end of Brill."]="我们的炼金师名叫卡罗莱·安尼斯。她居住在布瑞尔镇西北角的房屋中。"
G["Our Alliance allies are assisting the Leage of Arathor in their defense of Arathi Basin.  They could use your aid against the undead Defilers, $c."]="我们的联盟友军在帮助阿拉索联军防守阿拉希盆地。你可以来帮助他们对抗亡灵的污染者，$c。"
G["Our Bilgewater Cartel representatives are waiting to help find the payment plan that's right for you as soon as you land!"]="只要你一落地，我们的锈水财阀代表就会帮助你确定合适的酬金计划！"
G["Our Bloodmyst scouts have located our contact. The fool, Velen, will soon leave himself open and defenseless -- long enough for us to strike! Now get out of my sight before I vaporize you..."]="我们的秘血岛斥候已经定位到了我们的联系人。那个笨蛋维伦很快就会处于毫无防备的状态，让我们有充足的时间发动进攻！现在，在我把你蒸发掉之前离开我的视线……"
G["Our Caregiver Center is located above the central Vault of Light, near the Exodar's main entrance."]="我们的医护中心位于圣光穹顶中心的上方，靠近埃索达的主入口。"
G["Our Commander has fallen! The time for vengeance is now! Ram riders charge!!!!!!"]="我们的指挥官倒下啦！报仇的时候到啦！山羊骑士们，冲吧！！"
G["Our Expedition made it safely through the Portal and set up a new base called Thrallmar. Yet as you can see, the Burning Legion moved in and cut us off from our brothers. Clearly, the demons hope to retake the Dark Portal and prevent us from gathering reinforcements from Azeroth."]="我们的远征军已经安全地穿越了黑暗之门，建立起了一座名为萨尔玛的新基地。就像你看到的那样，燃烧军团切断了我们和兄弟们之间的联系。很明显，那些恶魔希望能重新夺回黑暗之门，阻止我们从艾泽拉斯得到更多的增援。"
G["Our Gods were many, and powerful. We mantid worshipped the seven heads of Y'shaarj."]="我们的神祗众多而强大。我们螳螂妖崇拜的是七首亚煞极。"
G["Our Lord commands us to make ready for war!"]="准备战斗！"
G["Our Master, protector of all life, will soon blind all of the heretics and grants us immeasurable power!"]="我们的主人——万物守护者，他的光芒将刺瞎异教徒的双眼，赋予我们无限的力量！"
G["Our Multi-Bombers have destroyed Tankbuster Cannons' shields. Take them down and secure the Surface Command Post!"]="多重轰炸机摧毁了反坦克大炮的护盾。端掉那些大炮，攻占地面指挥所！"
G["Our Sanctums syphon arcane power from ley-line currents that traverse our lands invisible to the naked eye.\n\nWith the Sunwell gone, they provide us with a steady and reliable source of energy."]="我们的圣殿正从魔网中吸取着奥术能量，那些能量线贯穿我们的大地，是肉眼无法看到的。\n\n由于太阳之井的毁灭，它们为我们提供了一个稳定而又可靠的能量来源。"
G["Our Skyguard Aether-tech and her escort is studying the Bash'ir crystal forge.  She needs help!  Go to Bash'ir Landing, find the aether-tech and keep her safe!"]="太空卫队以太技师和她的护卫队正在研究巴什伊尔水晶熔炉，她需要帮助！前往巴什伊尔码头，找到以太技师并确保她的安全！"
G["Our Storm Crows struggle to fly in this high density air, but the fire hawks on that ridge seem to soar with ease.\n\nThey are as wild as any of the creatures in the Plane of Fire, yet there is beauty in their form."]="风暴乌鸦很难在这种高密度的空气中飞行，可那边山脊上的火鹰翱翔起来却好像很轻松。\n\n它们和这片火焰平原上的其他生物一样狂野，但它们的形态却十分美丽。"
G["Our Warchief's campaign across Kalimdor and Pandaria is pulling the Horde apart at the seams."]="酋长在卡利姆多和潘达利亚的战役已令部落濒临分裂。"
G["Our agents have been outed and killed, master."]="我们的密探都被除掉了，主人。"
G["Our allies are ready. Bring down the shield and make way!"]="我们的盟友已经准备好了。解除护盾，前进！"
G["Our allies have arrived! Push them back over the edge, my brethren."]="我们的盟军到了！全力进攻，族人们，把他们赶回去。"
G["Our allies within the Argent Crusade and the Knights of the Ebon Blade have broken through the front gate of Icecrown and are attempting to establish a foothold within the citadel."]="银色北伐军和黑锋骑士团的盟军已经打破冰冠堡垒的大门，他们正努力在城堡中安置一个前哨站。"
G["Our ally has arrived!  Clear the way to the materialization chamber!"]="我们的同盟到了！打开具化间！"
G["Our ancestors looked far into the future to witness his rebirth, but instead, we saw our race troubled by many dangers. Dangers that, left unchecked, could destroy us."]="我们的祖先曾经看到了遥远的未来，看到了他的再生，但是我们看到的却是族人受到了诸多危险的困扰。 如果对这种危险置之不理，我们将会灭亡。"
G["Our ancestors teach us that while the individual must be strong, there is safety in numbers.  Do you wish to defend the honor of Thunder Bluff by organizing a guild?"]="我们的祖先教诲说，集体的力量胜过个人的力量。你想要加入公会为了雷霆崖的荣誉而战吗？"
G["Our ancient writings indicate that the mantid have always been here. They predate even the mogu. Where did they come from?"]="古书上说，螳螂妖一直都在这里。它们甚至比魔古族出现得还要早。它们是哪儿来的？"
G["Our armies shall shake the pillars of the world!"]="我们的大军将动摇世界的支柱！"
G["Our arrogance was unpardonable. We damned one of the most noble beings of all. We may never atone for this sin."]="我们的傲慢是无法宽恕的。我们竟然加害于一位如此高贵的存在，这样的罪孽永远也无法弥补。"
G["Our assault on the Firelands cannot wait. We strike, at Ragnaros and at Fandral, as soon as we can."]="对火焰之地的突袭刻不容缓。我们必须尽快向拉格纳罗斯和范达尔发动反击。"
G["Our battle is most difficult, Tai-Feng. The sha of doubt is subtle and insidious. Once the dark seed of doubt is planted, only one of strong mind and heart can remove it."]="我们的战斗极其艰苦，泰峰。疑之煞狡诈阴险。怀疑的黑暗种子一经种下，只有心神无比强大的人才能将其荡除。"
G["Our blades and spells are at the ready!"]="我们的剑和魔法已经准备就绪了！"
G["Our blessed great sea turtle, Green Island, travels from here to Moa'ki Harbor in Dragonblight."]="大海龟“绿背岛”将从这个港口游往龙骨荒野的莫亚基港口。"
G["Our brilliant brew is back! You've all our gratitude."]="我们的佳酿回来了！我们所有人都由衷地感谢你。"
G["Our brother has lost his way. He scorches the ground, he vaporizes the water, and devours too much air.\n\nHelp us to bring him back into balance and harmony."]="我们的兄弟迷失了。他烧焦了大地，蒸发了水体，吞噬了太多空气。\n\n帮助我们让他回复平衡与和谐吧。"
G["Our brother over there drowns his sorrows in apathy and wine, instead of work and toil."]="那边的那位兄弟只是借酒消愁，对世事不闻不问，从不辛苦工作。"
G["Our brothers are falling to the northwest. Get out there and help them!"]="我们的兄弟们在西北面遇到了危险。快去帮帮他们！"
G["Our brothers at Baradin Hold on Tol Barad are very busy and not always available when you need them.  I have been stationed here around the clock to help you with tasks they might have given you."]="在托尔巴拉德，我们在巴拉丁监狱的兄弟都很忙，并非总是能及时为你提供援助。现在我驻扎在这里，就是为了帮你完成由他们分配给你的任务。"
G["Our business has stood for twelve generations and supplied many hundreds of fresh, clean, and smelly yaks to the grummles.\n\nWe've faced floods, famine, and mogu. I'll be a hozen's uncle if I let these yaungol run us off."]="我们的产业已经沿袭了十二代，给土地精供应了无数新鲜、卫生又“芬芳”的牦牛。\n\n我们经历过洪灾、饥荒和魔古族的入侵。要是我让这些野牛人赶跑我们，那我就是猢狲叔叔！"
G["Our cache of equipment grows!"]="我们的装备储备增加啦!"
G["Our captain has fallen!"]="我们的队长倒下了！"
G["Our captain will save us!"]="我们的队长会救我们的！"
G["Our captors have allied with Deathwing, $r."]="抓住我们的人和死亡之翼结盟了，$r。"
G["Our caravans go out 'bout twice a day, but I'll be damned if the Scourge haven't gone out of their way to stop Didier and his mules from getting shipments to the front lines. Craziest thing I've ever seen. If only we had the heroic adventurin' types to help protect the shipments..."]="我们的大篷车队会往前线运送物资，每天两次。要是不能帮助负责运送的迪迪尔和他的骡子清理掉路上骚扰的天灾士兵的话，我就得挨罚了。那可是我所见过的最疯狂的事。看来我们得像英雄那样冒险保护货物了。"
G["Our casualties are too heavy!"]="我们的伤亡太大了！"
G["Our cause falls on deaf ears beyond the thick, stone walls of Stormwind."]="看来我们已经被暴风城完全抛弃了。"
G["Our champion units are equipped!  Beware, alliance!"]="我们的勇士军队已经装备就绪！联盟，小心了！"
G["Our champion units are leaving the field.  We need more supplies!"]="我们的勇士军队已经离开战场。我们需要更多的军需！"
G["Our champions have lost much blood in the struggle to activate this Scourge transporter. We must be prepared to return the favor. Follow me, men!"]="我们的勇士在激活这台天灾传送器的战斗中付出了沉重的代价。我们必须时刻准备着延续他们的光辉。伙伴们，跟我来！"
G["Our charge is an ancient one, dating back to the time of Shaohao, our founder and the last emperor of Pandaria."]="我们的历史悠久，可以追溯到少昊时代，他是影踪派的创始人，也是潘达利亚的末代皇帝。"
G["Our child has been born. It's a girl! A beautiful baby girl."]="我们的孩子刚出生。是个女孩！多漂亮的女儿。"
G["Our clan holds true to the ways set forth by the ancients. We deserve the king's favor above all others!"]="我们氏族一直谨遵先祖定下的规矩。与其他氏族相比，我们更应该得到王上的青睐！"
G["Our clan is the greatest in all the land, he must choose us!"]="我们的氏族是这片土地上最了不起的氏族，他肯定会选我们！"
G["Our clan is the true clan! No interloper can change that!"]="我们氏族才是真正的氏族！任何闯入者都无法改变这一点！"
G["Our continued incursions into the graveyard and town below are already paying off. Neither the mogu nor the Zandalari should be able to mount a counter-attack."]="我们对下方墓地和城镇的持续进攻取得了成效。无论是魔古族还是赞达拉巨魔都已无力反攻了。"
G["Our crafters build the finest wooden planks.  They would weather the most brutal of storms.  But they are as water before the storm of my crushing skull."]="我们的工人制造出了最好的木板。它们能经受最恐怖的风暴考验。但在我碎颅风暴的侵袭下，它们就像流水一样软弱。"
G["Our dark master has noticed your trifling, and sends me to bring a message... of doom!"]="我们的主人已经注意到了你们这些蟑螂，他要让我毁灭你们！"
G["Our defenses are failing!  By the light we must prevail!"]="我们的防线崩溃了！以圣光的名义，我们一定要战斗到底！"
G["Our defenses are impenetrable! WE are the true sons of Gnomeregan!"]="我们的防御牢不可破！我们是真正的诺莫瑞根之子！"
G["Our defenses stand ready!"]="我们的防守已经准备就绪！"
G["Our descent into the depths of depravity begins! Be on guard! Jaina, lend us your strength!"]="我们即将进入这邪恶的深渊！保持警惕！吉安娜，赐予我们力量！"
G["Our destination is the Twilight Highlands. We strike at the beating heart of our enemy."]="我们的目的地是暮光高地。我们要直接把敌人跃动的心脏给挖出来。"
G["Our dreams have been haunted by mantid. We hoped the Crane Temple would give us some insight to these visions."]="我们连做梦都是螳螂妖的进攻。我们希望朱鹤寺能为我们解梦。"
G["Our drinks should quench even the mightiest of thirsts."]="我们的美酒能滋润最干涸的喉咙。"
G["Our duties await."]="责任在召唤。"
G["Our efforts have paid off.  We've captured the Sun's Reach Sanctum, $n.  Go there and see if there's anyone you can assist."]="我们的努力得到了回报。我们已经占领了阳湾圣殿，$n。去那里看看有什么可以帮忙的吧。"
G["Our efforts in Lordaeron have been all for naught. Despite numerous setbacks, the Scourge remain unfazed. We must cut them off at the source.\n\nThe time draws near to sail for Northrend. I don't know what awaits us; only that our enemies are numerous and are eager for our slaughter.\n\nBut we cannot pursue any other path in good conscience. Azeroth depends on our vigilance."]="我们在洛丹伦的努力已化为泡影。军队遭到重创，而天灾军团的势力并未损减。我们必须从源头上消灭他们。\n\n我们要去诺森德。我并不知道前方隐藏着怎样的危机，只知道那里有无数急于杀死我们的敌人。\n\n但是我们别无选择，艾泽拉斯的未来已经落在了我们的肩膀上。"
G["Our empire will be glorious! And you won't be there to see it!"]="我们的帝国壮丽辉煌！而你们都将看不到那一天！"
G["Our empires will take what is ours!"]="我们的帝国将会夺回自己的东西！"
G["Our enchanters are located in the Crystal Hall opposite the jewel crafters.  Light be with you."]="我们的附魔师们就在水晶大厅，珠宝匠的对面。圣光与你同在。"
G["Our enchanters spend their days in the Exodar, working away at any number of projects. Nahogg will start your training."]="我们的附魔师们在埃索达研究各种课题，纳霍加可以教你一些初步的知识。"
G["Our enemies believe us vanquished from the frozen wastes.\n\nWe will show them the consequence of their ignorance."]="我们的敌人以为能靠冰封的荒原来击败我们。\n\n我们要让他们看看愚昧的后果。"
G["Our enemies can bury entire cities under the sand.  Our traditions have not prepared us for such a war."]="我们的敌人能把整座城市用沙土掩埋。我们的传统并未让我们做好应对此战的准备。"
G["Our enemies have finally arrived!  Demolishers, fire at will!"]="敌人终于来了！投石车，自由射击！"
G["Our enemies once turned our strongest weapon against us. What makes you think the prismatic blades will be any different?"]="我们的敌人曾利用我们最强大的武器来对抗我们。是什么让你觉得这些古剑会有所不同？"
G["Our enemies shall fall before us."]="我们的敌人必将灭亡。"
G["Our enemies surround us.  I would have a better life for the Mok'Nathal, but the forces we are at battle with have chosen otherwise for us.\n\nIf you would prove yourself worthy to the Mok'Nathal, aid us in their elimination."]="莫克纳萨村周围都是敌人的势力范围。若不是这些敌对势力迫使我们不得不为了生存而战，我相信莫克纳萨氏族会拥有更美好的生活。\n\n想要向莫克纳萨氏族证明自己的价值，就帮助我们消灭这些敌人吧。"
G["Our enemies think we are weak. Are we weak, soldiers? If not, then prove it to them!"]="我们的敌人以为我们很弱。我们弱吗，士兵们？向他们证明，他们大错特错了！"
G["Our enemies underestimate the power of the light."]="我们的敌人低估了圣光的力量。"
G["Our enemies will be annihilated!"]="我们的敌人只有死路一条！"
G["Our enemies will fall beneath our blades!"]="敌人将在我们的利刃下毙命！"
G["Our enemies will fall!"]="我们的敌人注定会失败！"
G["Our enemies will perish!"]="我们的敌人将要毁灭！"
G["Our enemies wouldn't dare attack us this close to the Crossroads. It's further out that we'll have to watch our backs."]="在这么靠近十字路口的地方，敌人不敢攻击我们。但继续前进的话，我们就要提高警惕了。"
G["Our enemy, cloaked in shadow, seeks to unmake our world. We will not lose another home."]="我们的敌人——潜于暗影之中，妄图颠覆我们的世界。我们不会再失去另一个家园。"
G["Our engines are damaged!  We're sitting ducks up here!"]="我们的引擎受损了！我们成了活靶子！"
G["Our envoy was making for the Crane Temple when the mogu ambushed us."]="当我们遭到魔古族的伏击时，我们的使者正在去朱鹤寺的路上。"
G["Our equipment is really taking a beating out here!"]="我们的装备在这里受到了真正的打击！"
G["Our ethereal technomancy has the ability to modify an item's arcane essence in ways previously unimaginable. We can also house items in a pocket dimension... for a small fee. See my associates for details.\n\nUnless you have something for me to examine?"]="我们虚灵的技术能够改变一件物品的魔法本质，这在过去是不可想象的。我们还能将物品放入其他位面保存起来……只是需要少许费用。具体情况，你可以找我的同伴询问。\n\n你有东西要让我检查吗？"
G["Our eye say you look lost."]="你似乎迷路了。"
G["Our fate is the doom of all who face the Great Fire."]="挑战炎魔之王的下场就是我们现在的样子。"
G["Our fates lie ahead..."]="我们的命运之战即将开始……"
G["Our fight against the sha can continue tomorrow. For now, rest."]="我们明天再继续对抗邪煞。现在，好好休息吧。"
G["Our fighters need nutritious food to keep our enemies at bay!\n\nHurry up and tell me what I can get for you."]="我们的战斗需要有营养的食物才能挡住敌人！\n\n快，告诉我我能给你弄点什么。"
G["Our foes will fall!"]="我们的敌人必将败北！"
G["Our food and drink are in short supply.  I'm afraid I do not have anything to offer you."]="我们的食物和饮料储备已经出现短缺。恐怕我没什么能给你的。"
G["Our food should satisfy even the mightiest of hungers."]="我们的食物能令最强大的勇士赞不绝口。"
G["Our forces are poised for battle, and eager to spill the blood of the Alliance.  Soon our captain will enter Iceblood Garrison and the war will begin anew!"]="面对战争，我们的军队泰然自若，誓与联盟展开血战。我们的队长很久就会进入冰血要塞，战争即将展开！"
G["Our forces are ready and eager.  Soon, Balinda Stonehearth will enter her outpost and the battle will begin anew!"]="我们的军队已准备就绪，士气高涨。巴琳达·斯通赫尔斯将很快进入前哨，战争即将开始！"
G["Our forces in Alterac Valley need wisdom to achieve victory $c.  You look like the one to lead them."]="我们在奥特兰克山谷的军队需要运用谋略获胜，$c。你看起来是个不错的领导者。"
G["Our forces report major victories off the coasts of Tanaris and Tol Barad..."]="我方军队在塔纳利斯和托尔巴拉德海岸频频告捷……"
G["Our forces will fall."]="我们的军队将要陷落。"
G["Our fortifications are ready."]="我们的工事完成了。"
G["Our freedom would have meant nothing if C'Thun had survived. You are truly a champion of prophecy."]="Nuestra libertad habría sido inútil si C'Thun hubiera sobrevivido. Eres $gun verdadero campeón:una verdadera campeona; de la profecía."
G["Our friends fought well, Brann, but we're not done yet."]="布莱恩，看来我们的朋友干得不错，但是事情还没有解决呢。"
G["Our friends in the Alliance gather to fight alongside the Silverwing Sentinels in Warsong Gulch. Will you travel there to help them?"]="我们的盟友仍然在战歌峡谷的银翼岗哨与敌方作战。去助他们一臂之力如何？"
G["Our friendship is OVER!"]="我们的友谊完蛋了！"
G["Our future promises even greater threats."]="我们的未来面临着更大的威胁。"
G["Our general, Vanndar Stormpike, has fallen in battle!  The battle is lost!\n\nSpeak with our quartermaster and help rebuild our forces."]="我们的将军范达尔·雷矛在战斗中倒下了！战斗失败了！\n\n和我们的军需官谈谈，然后帮助重建我们的部队。"
G["Our goal is in sight - press forward..."]="我们的目标已经在望——前进……"
G["Our goal... Our sole purpose was to destroy the Lich King. We threw our lot in with the Horde and began our journey towards redemption."]="我们的目的—我们唯一的目的便是毁灭巫妖王。我们加入了部落，并踏上了通往救赎的远征。"
G["Our great queen beckons us forward. Let us turn the waters red with the blood of our enemies!"]="我们的女王鼓舞我们奋勇前进。让我们将敌人打个落花流水！"
G["Our greatest enemies are ourselves."]="我们最大的敌人就是自己。"
G["Our gryphons are still learning the lay of the land, $c, so I can only offer you short flights to other places in the fjord. Where do you want to go?"]="$c，我们的狮鹫还在学着适应这里复杂的地貌，因此我只能为你提供峡湾内的短途飞行服务。你想去哪儿啊？"
G["Our gunnery instructor is Ansekhwa, the tauren weapon master on the lower central rise of Thunder Bluff."]="我们的射击教师是安塞瓦，居住在雷霆崖中部高地底层的牛头人武器大师。"
G["Our gunnery instructor, he Ansekhwa, da tauren weapon master on da lower central rise of Thunder Bluff."]="我们的射击老师是雷霆崖中部高地底层的牛头人武器大师安塞瓦。"
G["Our hearts are heavy with grief at the passing of master Zhen. Will you face Humongous to regain his honor, $n?"]="陈大师的辞世令我们的心情无比沉重。你要去找胡墨戈斯，重拾大师的荣耀吗，$n？"
G["Our hero!"]="我们的大英雄！"
G["Our highest priority is to evacuate The White Pawn, Prince Anduin Wrynn."]="我们的首要任务是保护白卒——安度因·乌瑞恩王子安全撤离。"
G["Our history has been wrought with great challenges..."]="我们的历史写满了挫折与挑战……"
G["Our home is lost, but as long as we are still alive, there is still a home to be made... somewhere."]="我们无家可归，但只要我们还活着，就会在其他地方重建家园。"
G["Our home was destroyed during the Cataclysm!\n\nAll of the rest of the survivors moved north to build Lor'danel, but those of us that stayed behind are here for a reason. We WILL retake the Ruins of Auberdine from those Twilight's Hammer scum just as soon as we heal up.\n\nI hope that you can help us to deal with them in the meantime."]="我们的家园在大灾变中被摧毁了！\n\n许多幸存者向北流亡，逐步建立起新奥伯丁。而我们留在这里也是有原因的。等到我们治愈了伤口，就要从那些暮光之锤的恶棍手中夺回旧奥伯丁。\n\n希望你能在那时帮助我们消灭那些敌人。"
G["Our home was stolen! So we will take yours!"]="我们的家园被人侵占了！所以我们要抢占你们的！"
G["Our homes... destroyed... We did what we had to...."]="我们的家……被毁了……我们已经尽力了……"
G["Our honor has been besmirched! They make wild claims and false accusations against us. I demand justice! Allow my champions to fight in place of your knights, Tirion. We challenge the Horde!"]="我们的荣耀被玷污了！他们对我们进行肆意的污蔑与诽谤。我要讨回公道！请允许我的勇士代替你的人出场，提里奥。我们要挑战部落！"
G["Our house is this way, through the thicket."]="这边走，我们的房子在那里，穿过灌木丛就到。"
G["Our humble inn is located in the north of Azure Watch; Chellan will take good care of you."]="我们那简陋的旅馆坐落在碧蓝岗哨的北面，谢尔兰会照顾好你的。"
G["Our immortality-the very essence of our beings!-was lost."]="我们的不朽力量，我们的生命的精华——已经丢失了。"
G["Our imprisonment was intolerable. The sooner we can leave this accursed place, the better."]="被关在这个地方是非常痛苦的，越早离开这个可恶的地方越好。"
G["Our iron masters have a mission for us!"]="铁领主交给我们一项任务！"
G["Our job is to clear out as much of his fodder as we can, while supporting the specialists that the powers-that-be are having brought in."]="我们的任务是在支援上头派来的特种部队的同时，尽可能多的消灭凯尔萨斯的手下。"
G["Our land be a land of ice an' snow."]="我们的世界是一片冰雪之地。"
G["Our leader, Doom'rel, has ears for the challenge."]="去找我们的领袖杜姆雷尔发出挑战吧。"
G["Our leader, Vol'jin, son of Sen'jin, issued de call to all Darkspears: reclaim de Echo Isles for our tribe."]="我们的领袖，森金之子沃金向全体暗矛部族的成员发起了号召：夺回回音群岛。"
G["Our lines are holding, but Vol'jin's rebels are taking a beating."]="沃金的起义军被压制了，但我们守住了阵线。"
G["Our little friend is here. I weep for the dwarves if the goblin has their weed whacker!"]="我们的小朋友来了。等到地精拿起他们的除草器，我就要为那些矮人哀悼了！"
G["Our lives are but a blink of reality's eye."]="生命之短暂犹如白驹过隙，眨眼即逝。"
G["Our lives are yours, Blood Knight."]="我们听从你的调遣，血骑士。"
G["Our lives were worth far more than your blood feud..."]="我们的性命远比你那所谓的血海深仇重要……"
G["Our lord Hydraxis speaks highly of you.  My water is your water, friend."]="Nuestro señor Hydraxis habla muy bien de ti. Mi agua es tu agua, $gamigo:amiga;."
G["Our lord, Arthas, saw in me the frailty of man."]="阿尔萨斯王子从我身上看到了凡人的脆弱。"
G["Our loss in Tol Barad will be avenged!  I will try to bring death to this grand city.  Cower as I try to remember a battle cry!"]="托尔巴拉德输了，我们必须复仇！我将给这座城市带去死亡。当我想起来如何战吼时，颤栗吧！"
G["Our magic... useless against this sickness!"]="我们的魔法……对这种疾病完全没有作用！"
G["Our march upon Icecrown Citadel begins now!"]="现在，我们向冰冠堡垒进军！"
G["Our master Malfurion has returned from the Dreaming, $c.  His is the light of a beacon that shows the way for us, and we must do everything in our power to preserve that light."]="我们的导师玛法里奥已经从沉睡中回来了，$c。他是我们的指路明灯，我们必须竭尽全力保护他。"
G["Our master commands us."]="我们受主人的指挥。"
G["Our master wants you!"]="我们的主人想要你的灵魂！"
G["Our master will break the world asunder and all that you know will come to an end. This is only a taste of what's to come!"]="我们的主人将打碎这个世界。你所熟知的一切都将终结。现在只是一个小小的开端！"
G["Our matron craves the taste of your blood!"]="我们的主人很喜欢你的鲜血！"
G["Our matron will be... the end of you."]="我们的女王……会消灭你们的。"
G["Our men are almost finished unearthing great Soggoth.  Is the ritual ready?"]="发掘伟大的索苟斯的工作就要由我的人完成了。仪式已经准备好了吗？"
G["Our men are regrouping.  They will be ready for battle in mere minutes."]="我们的战士正在重新集结。再过几分钟，他们就能做好战斗准备。"
G["Our men have secured the walkway. Focus on helping those in the main room."]="我们的人已经守住了通道。现在要集中全力帮助主室中的人了。"
G["Our messenger to the slave pens never returned, sir."]="我们派去奴隶围栏的那个信使再也没有回来过，长官。"
G["Our might will be focused. We will not allow the desecration to continue."]="我们的力量将被聚集。我们不会允许亵渎再继续下去。"
G["Our minds were finally free, yes... Free to relive all of the unthinkable acts that we had performed under the Legions' influence."]="我们终于恢复了理智，是的……终于能够反省自己在燃烧军团驱使下做出的鲁莽行径。"
G["Our mission is now clear: The Lich King will answer for his crimes and we will save Highlord Bolvar Fordragon!"]="任务已经明确：巫妖王将为他的罪行付出代价，我们一定要救出伯瓦尔·弗塔根公爵。"
G["Our mission priority has changed.\n\nWe need to defend this camp. Now!"]="我们的任务优先级变更了。\n\n我们得去守护这座营地，快！"
G["Our need for assistance in Arathi Basin is greater than one might imagine, $n.  So too is the honor and reputation one might acquire there in this time of need, however.  I implore you to seek out the Arathi Basin battlemaster in this city."]="$n，阿拉希盆地急需增援。在这危急时刻，正是获得荣誉、提升声望的大好机会。我恳求你去城中寻找阿拉希盆地的军官。"
G["Our neighbors are positively laughable. Have you seen the way they turn up their noses at us?"]="我们的邻居真可笑。你看到他们是怎么蔑视我们的吗？"
G["Our new allies will avenge us!"]="我们的新盟友会为我们复仇的！"
G["Our new allies will bring us back to our former glory. These bonds will be true, and we will not be betrayed again!"]="我们的新盟友会帮助我们回归昔日的荣光。这一次，我们不会再被背叛了！"
G["Our new allies, the Stillpine furbolgs, have expressed interest in taking what hides we find. They live to the north; I would seek knowledge from them."]="我们的新朋友——止松要塞的熊怪们对我们找到的皮革表现出了很强烈的兴趣。他们就住在北面，不如去他们那里问问看。"
G["Our new challenger returns! Welcome, $n."]="¡Regresa $gel nuevo:la nueva; aspirante! Te doy la bienvenida, $n."
G["Our newest attraction, and at no cost to you I might add, these miniature tanks, or Tonks as we've cleverly named them, can be controlled from any of the Tonk Control Consoles spread throughout the faire.\n\nAll that you have to do is activate an available control console. Each tonk will come equipped with a stock set of devices, and a random special power to unleash upon your enemy!\n\nHold epic battles with your friends, cruise around, or just cause wild mayhem... the choice is yours!"]="我们新近发现，马戏团中随处可见的蒸汽车控制台能操纵这些被称为蒸汽车的迷你坦克，我可是很慷慨地跟你分享这一信息。\n\n你只需激活控制台就行了。每辆坦克都配备了常用的弹药和某种秘密武器，向你的敌人开火吧！\n\n和朋友一起参加史诗般的战斗、巡逻、或者仅仅是进行野蛮的破坏……一切都由你自己选择！"
G["Our next fighter was found in the deepest tombs of Zul'Farrak! Gorged on cursed blood, raised from death countless times, he now knows only fury and violence! Dare you face the mindless wrath of...ZUMONGA!"]="我们下一位斗士来自祖尔法拉克最深的墓穴之中！饱食诅咒之血，无数次死而复生，他现在只知道狂怒与暴力！鼓起勇气面对……祖蒙加盲目的怒火吧！"
G["Our numbers are endless, our power beyond reckoning! All who oppose the Destroyer will DIE A THOUSAND DEATHS!"]="我们的数量无穷无尽，我们的力量超乎想象！所有敢于和灭世者作对的人，都将被千刀万剐！"
G["Our numbers... endless! You... cannot win..."]="我们……无穷无尽！你们……赢不了……"
G["Our oldest clutch of dragons are still far from maturity, but with patience and study, we are confident the dragonflight will soon be ready."]="最早产下的龙蛋尚未成熟，但是通过耐心地研究，飞龙很快就能孵出了。"
G["Our only hope of getting out of here alive is to take the town."]="我们逃出升天的唯一希望就是占领城镇。"
G["Our only viable port for resupply is held by the Forsaken on the other side of this blasted continent!"]="唯一能够正常运转的补给港口位于这片大陆的另一端，在被遗忘者手中！"
G["Our original duty binds us to defend this land, but if Fandral has indeed escaped to the Firelands, then we must bring him to justice."]="我们的天职要求我们守好这片土地。可如果范达尔真的逃进了火焰之地，那我们必须将他绳之以法。"
G["Our orphan matron says druids can turn into birds, cats, and bears, but you look like a combination of all of them!"]="我们的监护员说，德鲁伊能够变成鸟、豹子和熊。但你看上去像是所有这些野兽的组合！"
G["Our paths through life intersect only briefly and now is the time for ours to part ways. I consider myself blessed to have spent this time teaching you and now send you along to join paths with your next mentor. Seek out Saru Steelfury of Orgrimmar, he will teach what you need to learn."]="我们的人生之路只是暂时相交，现在是我们分道扬镳的时候啦。很荣幸能传授你知识，现在我送你上路，去找下一个导师吧。去奥格瑞玛找萨鲁·钢怒，他会教你你想学的知识。"
G["Our patience is growing thin..."]="我们的耐心是有限的……"
G["Our people are strong. We bring you a mastery over arcane magics that you have previously lacked - ah, no offense intended, of course."]="我们的人民非常强大。我们给你们带来了你们前所未知的、不可思议的魔法——啊，当然我不是在冒犯你们。"
G["Our people gunna kill every last one o' you Scourge!"]="我们会杀光天灾兵！"
G["Our people had walked a dark path and mine was among the darkest of them all."]="我们的人民走上了一条黑暗的道路，而我在这条路上走得最远。"
G["Our people have their differences, $c, but we are all guests in this place.\n\nThe pandaren have shown me great hospitality and respect, as I'm sure you've also received, and now they need our help.\n\nThe Horde is not without honor. If you know honor, you will know to save our quarrel for another time."]="在我们的族人之间存在分歧，$c，可我们都是这里的宾客。\n\n熊猫人热情尊敬地厚待我们，我敢肯定你也受到了同样的待遇，现在，他们需要我们的帮助。\n\n部落也并非没有荣誉感。如果你也知道荣誉为何物，那你应该明白，我们的恩怨可以改日再行了结。"
G["Our people were held as prisoners, as slaves, in this very camp by the humans. I was locked in these cages; I saw my brothers held in these stocks, hung in these gallows.\n\nI saw Orgrim Doomhammer, leader of us all, stabbed in the back. His blood stained black the earth we stand on.\n\nAnd look at us now. This is our legacy: Hammerfall, where we lost everything, and then took it back with our own hands."]="我们的人民被人类当作囚犯、当作奴隶，就关在这座营地里。我被锁在这些笼子里面；我看到我的兄弟们被关在这儿，吊在这些绞架上。\n\n我看见我们所有人的领袖——奥格瑞姆·毁灭之锤，被利刃刺穿背部。他的血把我们脚下的土地都染成了深色。\n\n现在再看看我们。落锤镇——我们世代的家园，我们在这里失去了一切，然后再用我们自己的双手夺回来。"
G["Our pillas! Someone has stolen our pillas!"]="有人偷走了我们的东西！"
G["Our plans are in danger already.  It appears Maiev's decided to do things her own way."]="我们的计划早已危在旦夕。好像玛维决定以她自己的方式来做事。"
G["Our prayers have been answered!"]="我们的祈祷得到了回应！"
G["Our prayers to Aessina go unanswered. The burning minions of Ragnaros have driven us to the brink. If they are not stopped here, the World Tree will be little more than a stump amidst the conflagration!"]="我们向艾森娜发出的祈求没有得到回应。拉格纳罗斯麾下的燃烧爪牙已经将我们逼到了悬崖的边缘。如果我们不能在此终止他们的行径，世界之树将被大火烧得只剩下残桩断枝！"
G["Our priest trainers can be found within the Order of Light's chamber, at the entrance to the Seat of the Naaru. Light be with you."]="我们的牧师训练师就在靠近纳鲁之座入口的圣光教团房间里。愿圣光伴随你。"
G["Our prince has forsaken us! All is lost!"]="王子抛弃了我们！所有的希望都破灭了！"
G["Our prisoner is strange. He carries no weapon, and his garb is... untraditional.\n\nPerhaps he's a lord of some kind. With any luck, we might have captured someone valuable!"]="我们的俘虏很奇怪。他没有带武器，而且他的服装很……怪异。\n\n他可能是某个贵族。如果走运的话，我们或许抓住了个大人物！"
G["Our punishment is also our blessing."]="我们的惩罚也是我们的祝福。"
G["Our resident alchemist Lorokeem brought his equipment with him, in fact. It may be slightly different from what you're used to - he is an arakkoa, after all - but it should serve your needs. He roosts in the northwest portion of the lower city."]="我们的常驻炼金师罗罗基姆把他的设备都一起带了过来。不过，这些设备和你以前习惯使用的略微有些不同——毕竟他是个鸦人——但这些设备应该足以满足你要求。他就在贫民窟的西北部分。"
G["Our resident jewelcrafter, Aleinia, can be found within Delaniel's establishment in Falconwing Square. She might be looking for an apprentice."]="珠宝加工训练师奥雷妮亚就居住在鹰翼广场那间德兰妮尔开设的旅店里。她或许正需要一名学徒。"
G["Our resources are well stocked, thanks to you. Please strive to keep them so."]="我们的资源储量充足，感谢你的帮助。请继续保持如此良好的势态。"
G["Our scouts have reported that the Lich King has a private chamber, outside of the Frozen Throne, deep within a place called the Halls of Reflection. That is our target, champions."]="我们的侦察兵说巫妖王在冰封王座外有个私人密室，深藏在被称作映像大厅的地方。那就是我们的目标，勇士们。"
G["Our search has taken us across vast oceans and deep jungles, and yet we encounter one another here, of all places. It truly seems that our conflict is inevitable, wherever we go."]="我们一路搜寻，跨越了千山万水，可却偏巧在这里狭路相逢。看来不管走到哪里，我们的冲突都是难以避免的啊。"
G["Our seasoned units are leaving the field.  We need more supplies!"]="经验丰富的士兵已经离开战场。我们需要更多士兵！"
G["Our serpents are working hard to save the temple.\n\nThey will gladly lend their strength if you require it."]="我们的翔龙正在努力拯救寺庙。\n\n如果你需要的话，它们很乐意向你伸出援手。"
G["Our ship from Northrend was attacked by Twilight's Hammer! I don't know how they got aboard, but they killed everyone."]="我们来自诺森德的船遭到了暮光之锤的袭击！我不知道他们是怎样攻入那艘船的。那艘船的船员都牺牲了。"
G["Our ship... NO! Did everyone escape? Gather here!"]="我们的船……不！大家都逃出来了吗？来这集合！"
G["Our ships! What in the name o' me beard happened?!"]="我们的船只！这到底是怎么回事？！"
G["Our sisters have been captured! Fall back!"]="我们的姐妹被敌人捉住了！后撤！"
G["Our soldiers speak of nothing but their new training."]="我们的士兵一直在谈论着他们的训练。"
G["Our soldiers... they're all captives now."]="我们的士兵……他们都已沦为俘虏。"
G["Our souls will never be freed."]="我们的灵魂将永无宁日。"
G["Our steady progress in our fight against the Qiraji can be attributed to the diverse help we received from nearly every corner of Kalimdor.\n\nYou need more than just soldiers to fight a war, $n.  Many of the war's unsung heroes are the traders and craftsmen that keep our forces supplied with the resources they need."]="Nuestros progresos en la lucha contra los qiraji se deben a la ayuda que estamos recibiendo de casi todos los rincones de Kalimdor.\n\nNecesitas algo más que Soldados para luchar en una guerra, $n. Los héroes olvidados de la guerra son los comerciantes y artesanos que suministran a nuestras tropas todo lo que necesitan."
G["Our storehouses have been depleted.  I have nothing to sell until we can get more supplies."]="我们的库房已经空了。在补给物资送来之前，我没东西可卖。"
G["Our story begins long ago in the days of the monstrous Emperor Tian."]="我们的故事发生在很久很久之前，荒暴无道的皇帝阗在位的时候。"
G["Our strategy is sound. We must not falter now, when we have so much still to gain."]="我们的战术很有效。胜利的果实正在向我们招手，我们决不能在这个时候动摇。"
G["Our studies are complete!  Well fought!  Headquarters will pour over our gained measurements and, with luck, uncover the Bash'ir's intentions.  Now, to the skies!"]="我们的研究完成了！干得好！总部会花大量精力来研究我们获得的测量数据。而且幸运的是，我们还揭开了巴什伊尔的阴谋。现在，启航！"
G["Our suffering is at an end. When this war is won, our people will see prosperity at last."]="苦难结束了。战争胜利后，部落将迎来繁荣兴盛。"
G["Our summoning is complete! The Ash'ari crystal has been restored!"]="召唤已经完成！阿莎利水晶已经复原！"
G["Our systems are jammed, Commander! I can't control this plane!"]="系统受损，指挥官！我控制不了这飞机！"
G["Our tactics, our science, our bravery and determination shall prevail."]="我们的战术，我们的技术，我们的勇气和决心都无可匹敌。"
G["Our task is not yet done!"]="我们的工作还没完成呢！"
G["Our time draws near."]="我们翘首企盼的日子就快来了。"
G["Our time has come!"]="我们翘首企盼的日子终于来了！"
G["Our time is at an end, $n. I would wish you luck, if such a thing existed."]="我们的时间正处在危险的边缘，$n。如果运气这种东西确实存在的话，我祝你好运。"
G["Our time is finally at hand. The naaru and their allies will learn the true meaning of suffering."]="我们翘首企盼的日子就快来了。纳鲁和他们的盟友将尝到真正的痛苦。"
G["Our time is up. We need to get aboard that ship."]="时间到了。我们得登上那条船。"
G["Our top minds have been looking into the seismic activities... Well, we've mostly been looking at how to secure a building's frame while at the same time simulating tectonic shifts..."]="我们的顶尖人才一直在探究这些地震活动……嗯，我们主要是在模拟地壳构造转变的同时，研究如何稳固住建筑物的框架……"
G["Our torment is eternal."]="我们永远无法摆脱折磨。"
G["Our town's under the blasted ocean, our keep's full of Dark Iron traitors, and I'm laid up with such a wound I can't do a single thing about any of it.\n\nSo welcome to Menethil Harbor!"]="我们的城镇沉没在被诅咒的洋底，我们的要塞已被黑铁叛徒侵占，而我也身受重伤，对这种局面束手无策。\n\n所以欢迎来到米奈希尔港！"
G["Our troops, general, consist mostly of villagers and peasants.  Good men, but not quite rid of the prejudices and superstitions of their upbringing.  They're not ready to fight alongside our more exotic allies."]="将军，我们的军队主要是由村民和农夫构成的。他们都是很好的人，但是还没有完全摆脱自小养成的偏见和迷信。他们还没有准备好与外来盟友并肩作战。"
G["Our underground movement against the gronn must not falter!  Return and gather more information."]="我们坚定不移地继续反抗戈隆的秘密行动！回去收集更多的信息吧。"
G["Our units are not upgraded, and I don't have enough supplies to upgrade them."]="我们的军队不能升级，军需不够，无法升级。"
G["Our units are upgraded to Champions, but I can still collect more supplies."]="我们的军队已经升级到勇士，但是我仍需要收集更多的军需。"
G["Our units are upgraded to Seasoned, but I don't have enough supplies to upgrade them to Veteran."]="我们的军队已经升级到经验丰富的军队，但是我没有足够的军需升级到老兵。"
G["Our units are upgraded to Veteran, but I don't have enough supplies to upgrade them to Champion."]="我们的军队已经升级到老兵，但是我没有足够的军需升级到勇士。"
G["Our veteran units are leaving the field.  We need more supplies!"]="老兵部队已经离开战场。我们需要更多的士兵！"
G["Our veterans are entering the field!"]="老兵已经离开战场！"
G["Our veterans are leaving the field.  We need more supplies!"]="老兵已经离开战场。我们需要更多的士兵！"
G["Our victory here was much thanks to you, $n."]="我们在这里的胜利都是多亏了你，$n。"
G["Our victory in Sun's Reach is absolute!  The naaru bless us with their presence!"]="我们已经在阳湾港取得了全面的胜利！纳鲁祝福着我们！"
G["Our victory is all but assured. With the power of the bell on our side, we will be unstoppable."]="我们必将赢得胜利。有了圣钟的力量，我们将无人能挡。"
G["Our vigilance is eternal..."]="我们将永远保持警惕……"
G["Our village is small, but my family has been producing Pandaria's finest cider atop these hills for generations.\n\nI want nothing more than for peace to return so that we may collect our harvest and reunite with our children."]="我们的村庄不大，但我家世代都在这片山上酿造潘达利亚最优质的苹果酒。\n\n我现在只想平安回去，好收割庄稼，与孩子们团聚。"
G["Our vision will be realized!"]="我们的理想终将实现！"
G["Our voice gives form to Her will."]="我们的声音承载着女皇的意志。"
G["Our war against the mogu is not yet over. But today we can rest, and proclaim our victory."]="我们对抗魔古的战争还远未结束。但今天我们可以稍作休息，欢庆胜利。"
G["Our warriors are dying. Do you have medical supplies I can take back with me?"]="我们的战士正一个个死去。你有药品能让我带回去吗？"
G["Our warriors are losing!"]="我们正在损兵折将！"
G["Our warriors... they're all captives now."]="我们的战士……他们现在都已沦为俘虏。"
G["Our way is sacred.  We will choose death before we abandon Thorim and join the likes of the Lich King."]="我们的道路是神圣的。我们宁愿死去，也不会背弃托里姆，与巫妖王同流合污。"
G["Our wolves will feast on your bones!"]="我们的狼群会把你吃光！"
G["Our work here has been steady and tedious, but the statue is almost complete."]="我们在这里的工作一成不变且沉闷冗长，但雕像已经快接近完工了。"
G["Our work here is finished for now. Let us deliver news of our victory to the Klaxxi Council. They await our return."]="我们在这里的工作暂时结束了。让我们将胜利的消息传达给卡拉克西议会吧。他们在等我们回去。"
G["Our work in the Living Grove must not be endangered.  Our very lives hinge upon its continued health and growth."]="我们在活木林的工作不能受到打扰。活木林持续与健康的成长决定了我们的命运。"
G["Our work is almost complete."]="我们的工作就快做完了。"
G["Our work is done. Now we wait on the Alliance to finish theirs before shipping everything over to Silithus."]="我们的工作完成了，现在只等联盟完成他们收集任务。在那之后，所有的战争物资都将被运往希利苏斯。"
G["Our work is far from done. Fandral will pay for his deceit."]="我们的工作还远未完成。范达尔必须为他的欺骗付出代价。"
G["Our work is not yet complete! Stop them!"]="我们的工作尚未结束！快阻止他们！"
G["Our work is not yet complete."]="我们的工作还没完成。"
G["Our work must not be interrupted! Ick, take care of them!"]="我们的工作绝不能被干扰！伊克，招呼他们！"
G["Our world needs more heroes like you."]="我们的世界需要更多像你这样的英雄。"
G["Our world will be torn apart. Join us, so that you may live!"]="我们的世界将四分五裂。加入我们才能活命！"
G["Our world will end soon, but together we will ascend and inherit the power of the elements."]="我们的世界很快就要完结。但我们将共同得到升华，得到元素的力量。"
G["Our world."]="我们的世界。"
G["Our wrath will paint the highlands red  - or whatever color our enemies bleed!"]="我们的怒火将把高地染红——或是敌人血液的任何颜色！"
G["Ours is a path for those with an iron will and unfaltering resolve. You seem to possess none of these traits, $c."]="我们只接受那些拥有钢铁般坚定的意志、怀着永不动摇的决心的同伴。似乎这两样优点你都不具备，$c。"
G["Ours is an ancient and long lived culture.\n\nThanks to our craft, some of the memory of that culture can be preserved for future generations."]="我们的文化源远流长。\n\n多亏了我们的能工巧匠，使我们的文化记忆得以保存，并传承给下一代。"
G["Ours is but to serve in Her divine name."]="我们只以她的神圣之名效忠。"
G["Ours is but to serve; yours is but to die."]="我们惟命是从，而你，惟死乃终。"
G["Ours is the TRUE Horde! The only Horde!"]="我们才是真正的部落！唯一的部落！"
G["Ours is the path of glory, $r! The puny Alliance is still trying to scrape together their war supplies, while we have gathered all of ours and stand ready to send them to Silithus."]="¡El nuestro es un camino de gloria, $r! La endeble Alianza sigue intentando reunir sus provisiones para la guerra mientras que nosotros ya tenemos las nuestras y estamos listos para enviarlas a Silithus."
G["Ours is the path of purity and righteousness in the Light."]="我们在圣光的庇护下追求纯净和正义。"
G["Ours is the true Horde!"]="我们才是真正的部落！"
G["Ours is the way of highest service. I have no time for petty conversation or challenges from a low lander."]="我们奉行服务至上的理念。我可没功夫闲聊，也没时间接受低地人的挑战。"
G["Ours is to rule. Yours is to serve!"]="我们是主，你们是仆！"
G["Out da way!"]="滚开！"
G["Out for the day at Halfhill Market.\n- Ella"]="Pasando el día en el Mercado del Alcor.\n\n- Ella"
G["Out of all the people in the heartland, you gave this to me? I don't even know what to say, except I'm mighty honored."]="在汇风岭的所有这些人之中，你把它送给我了吗？我甚至不知道该说什么，这是我莫大的荣幸。"
G["Out of mana..."]="法力值用完了……"
G["Out of my sight, vizh you! Auch..."]="滚开，别让我看到你！混……"
G["Out of my way!"]="别挡着我的道儿！"
G["Out of my way."]="滚开。"
G["Out of nowhere, some 300 foot tall demon or somethin' walks up and starts climbin' the tree..."]="不知道从哪里冒出来的一个300尺高的恶魔或者什么东西走了过来，开始爬树……"
G["Out of our way, fools!"]="别挡道，蠢货！"
G["Out of our way, or your hatchlings get it!"]="别挡我们的道，否则就让你们的鱼苗吃点苦头！"
G["Out of the frying pan and into the fire, eh $n?"]="刚出油锅，又入烈火，是吗，$n？"
G["Out of the frying pan and into the fire, eh $n? Need any training?"]="刚出油锅又入烈火，是吗，$n？需要训练吗？"
G["Out of the mist, a creature emerges!"]="迷雾之外浮现出了一个生物！"
G["Out of the scroll, demon!"]="滚出来，恶魔！"
G["Out of the water, into the barrels. Move it! Time is money, ya know."]="来自于清水，被灌入桶中。赶快！时间就是金钱。"
G["Out of the way, peasant!"]="滚开，乡巴佬！"
G["Out on a boat... way far away from the dock..."]="泛舟乘海……远离湾岸……"
G["Out with it, Farstrider! What news do you bring?"]="快说，远行者！你带来了什么消息？"
G["Outa my way, mon. I'm off ta join da pirates!"]="别挡我的路，兄弟。我要加入海盗！"
G["Outgoing, $c."]="出发，$c。"
G["Outland just oozes with magical energy, it's in the very air.  Can you feel it, $n?  I can't think of a place better suited to our race.  Soon the sin'dorei shall have a new land to call our own!"]="外域中弥漫着魔法的能量，到处都是。你能感觉到吗，$n？我不相信还有比这更适合我们种族的地方。很快辛多雷就会拥有一个属于自己的新世界！"
G["Outland!"]="外域！"
G["Outplayed!"]="你败了！"
G["Outsider! Ally of the Shado-Pan.\n\n<The old yaungol spits out the strange words bitterly.>\n\nCome closer if you wish me to break your neck!"]="¡$GForastero:Forastera;! $GAliado:Aliada; del Shadopan.\n\n<El yaungol viejo dice con amargura esas extrañas palabras.>\n\n¡Acércate si quieres que te rompa el cuello!"
G["Outsider, what brings you to our village?"]="¡$gForastero:Forastera;! ¿Qué te trae a nuestra aldea?"
G["Outsiders are forbidden!"]="不许进来！"
G["Outsiders are rare here. Rarer still are outsiders who arrive on a floating ship of death."]="这里很少有外来者。乘死亡浮船而来的外来者更是少之又少。"
G["Outsiders! Kill em all!"]="外来者！杀掉他们！"
G["Outsiders, yes - but their intentions are good."]="外来人，的确如此——不过他们的动机是好的。"
G["Outsiders? Maybe you can beat some sense into that dolt!"]="懦夫？也许你该把那个白痴给我打得聪明点！"
G["Outstandin' fightin'! Ya made an old man proud. Keep it up and ale will be on me ta'night."]="干得漂亮！你们让一个老人感到骄傲。好好干，今晚我请大家喝啤酒来犒劳你们。"
G["Outstanding party, $n. Thanks for the disco ball!"]="真是一场精彩的聚会，$n。迪斯科舞会更是令人兴奋！"
G["Outstanding! Kaz'rogal's death cry should strike fear into the core of the Burning Legion. They now know the power your forces possess, so expect the worst the Legion can offer."]="太棒了！卡兹洛加死亡时发出的嚎叫应该会让燃烧军团感到畏惧。他们现在认识到了你们所拥有的力量，那么准备好接受燃烧军团的更强烈的打击吧。"
G["Outstanding! Killing a Pit Lord such as Azgalor is no small feat, my friend. If we had more time, I would love to hear the story of you and your companions. Archimonde will not give us that pause, however. My scouts have already reported that the Legion is amassing an immense force outside our camp, and Archimonde is very close to the World Tree. We are evacuating with the help of Lady Proudmoore. You should head to the World Tree at once. The fate of our world is still undecided."]="太精彩了！杀死一个像阿兹加洛这样的深渊领主并不是件小事，我的朋友。如果我们有更多的时间，我会很乐意倾听你和你同伴的故事。但是阿克蒙德不会给我们休息的机会，不管怎样，我的斥候报告说，燃烧军团正在我们营地外聚集更强大的力量，而且阿克蒙德离世界之树已经非常近了。我们正在普罗德摩尔女士的帮助下撤退。你应该立即向世界之树进发。我们世界的命运仍然未定。"
G["Outta my way!"]="不要挡我的路！"
G["Outta my way, mon!"]="别挡道！"
G["Over 12,000 years ago, the Mogu empire was founded by Lei Shen, \"The Thunder King.\""]="Hace 12.000 años, el imperio mogu fue fundado por Lei Shen, \"el Rey del Trueno\"."
G["Over a thousand years ago a group of troll priests known as the Atal'ai attempted to bring back an ancient blood god named Hakkar the Soulflayer. After the resulting civil war the priests were defeated and exiled to the Swamp of Sorrows. There they erected a temple to Hakkar to prepare for his arrival into the physical world. The dragon Aspect Ysera soon learned of the Atal'ai's plans and smashed the temple beneath the marshes. To this day, the temple's ruins are guarded by the mighty green dragons."]="在一千年之前，强大的古拉巴什王国被一次大型内部战争所毁灭。一部份被称为阿塔莱的巨魔牧师试图将古代的血神，夺灵者哈卡带回这个世界。虽然这些牧师被击败并最终被流放，这个伟大的王国变得四分五裂。流放的牧师逃到了北面的悲伤沼泽。他们为哈卡建立了一座伟大的神庙——在那里他们期望能够把哈卡重新带回世间。伟大的守护神龙伊瑟拉了解了阿塔莱的计划并将神庙摧毁沉入沼泽之中。在今天，神庙沉没的遗迹被绿龙所守卫并阻止任何人进入或者出去。"
G["Over by Crystal Lake there lives a lady named Adele Fielder.  She makes patches for the local guards with the extra leather she gets from the local skinner, Helene.  She would probably be the one to see if you're interested in learning the profession."]="Junto al Lago de Cristal vive una señora llamada Adele Fielder. Remienda el equipo de los guardias locales con el cuero que consigue de nuestra desolladora, Helene. Deberías ir a verla si estás $ginteresado:interesada; en aprender la profesión."
G["Over here $G laddy:lass;, I have something I could use a hand with."]="Por aquí, $gmuchacho:muchacha;, necesito que me eches una mano."
G["Over here - an Alliance $c!"]="¡Allí! ¡$gUn:Una; $c de la Alianza!"
G["Over here - an assassin!"]="在这里——一个刺客！"
G["Over here - get $ghim:her;!"]="在这儿——抓住$g他:她;！"
G["Over here!"]="这边！"
G["Over here!  You must stop them!"]="在这边！你必须阻止他们！"
G["Over here! Down on the ground! Help!"]="我在这儿！躺在地上！救命！"
G["Over here! I'm on top of the destroyed plague spreader! Help!"]="在这儿！我在被摧毁的天灾车上面！救命！"
G["Over here! Inside the room. Did you find the key to my chains? The human Borhuin has them."]="在那里！在那间屋子里。你找到钥匙了吗？就在那个叫博胡恩的人类那里。"
G["Over here! Please let us out! They key is around here somewhere!"]="在这儿！放我们出去！钥匙就在这附近！"
G["Over here, $c! Help me!"]="这边，$c！救救我！"
G["Over here, $n!"]="来这边，$n！"
G["Over here, $n! Your gyrocopter's ready to go!"]="过来，$n！你的旋翼机可以使用了！"
G["Over here, $p! We need help!"]="快来这儿，$p！帮帮我们！"
G["Over here, hero!"]="到这儿来，英雄。"
G["Over here, in the shadows."]="我在暗影之中。"
G["Over here, to the southeast. I see they got you, too..."]="在这里，东南方。啊，你也落到他们手里了……"
G["Over here, ugly!"]="来这边，丑八怪！"
G["Over here, you fleabags!"]="在这儿，你这跳蚤！"
G["Over here, you ugly whale!"]="到这儿来，你这傻大个儿！"
G["Over here. Find out anything? Were you tailed, $n?"]="有什么发现吗，$n？有没有被跟踪？"
G["Over in the Hall of Arms you can find our resident stable master, Ulbrek Firehand.  He'll make sure any pets ye have are well fed and rightly cared for."]="你可以在武器大厅找到我们的常驻马厩管理人乌布雷克·火拳。他将替你喂养和照料宠物。"
G["Over my dead body!"]="你妄想！"
G["Over the course of 8,000 years, only a handful of these blades were created - each blade unique in both power and appearance. The blades of Quel'Serrar would take on the characteristics of their creator."]="8,000年来只铸造出少量的剑——每柄剑的威力和外观都是独一无二的。奎尔赛拉之剑将沿袭其锻造者的特点。"
G["Over the course of time, through obedience to the Light's guidance, one becomes more sensitive to its voice, and its power."]="经过时间的历练，越是服从圣光指引的人，就越能触及到圣光的声息，越能驾驭圣光的力量。"
G["Over the song of the crystals, do you hear the battle that is approaching?"]="在水晶的歌唱声中，你可曾听见战争迫近的号角？"
G["Over the wall, HUP!"]="上城墙，冲啊！"
G["Over there! Can it be?"]="在那里！就是那个吗？"
G["Over there! The fire's flarin' up!"]="那边！那里的火飚起来了！"
G["Over there! They're following us!"]="看！他们在跟踪我们！"
G["Over time, Staghelm only grew more disconnected from our people."]="随着时光的推移，鹿盔只是同我们的族人变得越来越疏离。"
G["Overdrive Mode!  Let's do this!"]="超速模式！我们来试试！"
G["Overdrive engine activated."]="超速引擎已激活。"
G["Overflowin' with rats! Help a pirate out, matey!"]="老鼠泛滥成灾啦！朋友，帮助一个可怜的海盗离开这儿！"
G["Overheat threshold exceeded.  System failure.  Wheat clog in port two.  Shutting down."]="已超出过热临界值，系统崩溃，有小麦堵在2号端口内，关机中。"
G["Overloading"]="销毁"
G["Overlord Agmar demands more of us! We must not disappoint!"]="阿格玛大王等着我们的好消息呢！我们不能让他失望！"
G["Overlord Krom'gar has called for infantry in Stonetalon Mountains."]="克罗姆加大王正在召集步兵前往石爪山。"
G["Overlord Krom'gar, you have disgraced the Horde."]="克罗姆加大王，你使部落蒙羞了。"
G["Overlord Mor'ghor, I presume... A pleasure to finally make your acquaintance."]="莫格霍尔大王，我想……能够和你攀上交情真是荣幸。"
G["Overpowered..."]="败了……"
G["Overseer Tidewrath, watch out!"]="工头泰德瓦斯，小心！"
G["Overseer!  Tell me what you see."]="监工！告诉我你看到了什么。"
G["Overseer, I am here to negotiate on behalf of the Cenarion Expedition."]="工头，我是来代表塞纳里奥远征队和你谈判的。"
G["Overseer?\n\nYou are no more an overseer than I am the king of Stormwind. Yes... You are the one they speak of."]="督工？\n\n你不是龙喉督工，正如我不是暴风城的国王一样。对……你就是他们提起的那个家伙。"
G["Overwhelming... fear!"]="震慑灵魂的……恐惧！"
G["Overwhleming power. Use it to heal or destroy! To protect or annihilate!"]="它无所不能。守护还是毁灭，尽在你的掌握！"
G["Ow ow! Ow ow ow..!"]="哎呦！哎呦呦……！"
G["Ow!"]="噢！"
G["Ow!  Hot!!"]="哦！好烫！"
G["Ow!  OK, I'll get back to work, $n!"]="嗷！好吧，我回去工作，$n！"
G["Ow! <Snort>"]="¡Au! <Resopla>"
G["Ow! Hahah... er, that no good."]="哦！哈哈……滋味不好受吧。"
G["Ow! I'll tell you NOTHING, filthy $r!"]="¡Ay! ¡No te diré NADA, $gsucio:sucia; $r!"
G["Ow! Now they can see us!"]="嗷！现在他们发现我们了！"
G["Ow! Ow! Ow!"]="哇！哇！哇！"
G["Ow! Stop it! I'm waiting for the thunderbirds to take me!"]="啊！住手！我在等雷鸟来抓我！"
G["Ow! That hurt. I going to limp over here."]="啊！好痛。我只能一瘸一拐地挪动了。"
G["Ow! Well I guess that prototype didn't work, either."]="哎呀！好吧，我估计那个设备也没法运转了。"
G["Ow, I got a pebble in my shoe."]="哎呦，我鞋里有颗石子。"
G["Ow, mon!"]="喔，伙计！"
G["Ow, ow ow. Okay... ow!"]="哎哟。嗯……哎哟！"
G["Ow-oooh! I not talk for nothing!"]="嗷喔！我什么都不说！"
G["Ow."]="哦。"
G["Ow.  Spicy."]="啊，真劲……"
G["Ow.  That really hurts.  Not."]="哎呦。那可真疼。才没有呢。"
G["Ow. No slave thing, really... ow!"]="哎哟。没用的奴隶……哎哟！"
G["Ow... it okay if we go back now? Hurt so much... we sorry."]="哎哟……我们现在回去没问题吧？痛死我了……我们真惨啊。"
G["Ow...that was an eye. Yes, definitely an eye."]="噢……那是一只眼睛。没错，肯定是一只眼睛。"
G["Owning a little piece o' jade is like having a charm to ward off evil spirits. Thanks so much for this little cat! It'll keep me safe, I just know it."]="拥有一小块翡翠就可以辟邪。非常感谢你送我这只小猫咪！我知道，它会保佑我平安。"
G["Oww now hey."]="嗷，干什么。"
G["Oww! You've got quite a swing there..."]="哎哟！你这一脚踢得真重……"
G["Owww!"]="噢！"
G["Oy mon! I know you?\n\nAhh yeah, Prigmon not forget a face.\n\nYou... followin' me, mon? Cuz whatver it be, Prigmon never done it!"]="朋友！我认识你？\n\n哦，是你啊，普雷蒙有过目不忘的本事。\n\n你……跟踪我？不关我的事！我什么都没做过！"
G["Oy! Keller! Any word from the ruins? Anything at all??"]="天啊！凯勒！遗址那里的情况怎么样了？还是没消息吗？"
G["Oy, 'Linda, where are we meetin' up with this Ivar Bloodfang fella? An' what in Bronzebeard's name is that terrible smell?"]="哎，琳达，我们要在哪里跟这个名叫伊瓦·血牙的家伙碰面？而且以铜须的名义——这难闻的气味到底是怎么回事？"
G["Oy, lad! Have ye gotten that Thundertank XT 9000 workin' yet?"]="噢，小伙子！你让那个雷霆坦克XT-9000开始工作了吗？"
G["Oy, mon!\n\nThis not be what it looks like. Well, maybe...\n\nIt be complicated."]="朋友！\n\n事实上并不是这样的。呃……\n\n情况太复杂了。"
G["Ozumat is vulnerable, strike now!"]="厄祖玛特现在衰弱了，进攻！"
G["P-p-p-lease don't hurt us m-m-m-ister Painmaster, sir!"]="请——请——请别伤害我们，痛苦主宰大——大人！"
G["P-p-punch!"]="来——来吧！"
G["P... Please don't..."]="求……求你……"
G["PAH! A lopsided challenge."]="呸！这场挑战不公平。"
G["PAIN TRAIN INCOMING!"]="痛苦号列车来了！"
G["PAIN is all that you will find here, $r!"]="¡Aquí solo encontrarás DOLOR, $n!"
G["PATIENCE! THE RITUAL TO BRING ME INTO THIS WORLD IS COMPLEX AND MUST NOT BE RUSHED!"]="耐心一些！让我进入这个世界的仪式非常复杂，绝不能有任何贸然行动！"
G["PEASANT CROSSES LINE."]="农夫跨过了界线。"
G["PH - My attention is elsewhere. Please speak to me in a moment."]="我有其它事情要忙。过会儿再来找我。"
G["PICK ME!!!!!"]="看这边！！！"
G["PIRATES!  AAAAAHHHHH!"]="海盗！啊——！"
G["POOF!"]="噗！"
G["POUND!"]="重击！"
G["POWER acquired for WAR and CONQUEST!"]="获得了战争与征服的力量！"
G["POWERING ON..."]="正在开机……"
G["PR'PR TA DI, GOBIN!!!"]="准备去死吧，地精！！！"
G["PREPARE TO DIE, VILLAIN!"]="准备受死吧，恶棍！"
G["PRESENT!"]="瞄准！"
G["PRIDE HERALDS THE END OF YOUR WORLD.  COME, MORTALS!  FACE THE WRATH OF THE SOULFLAYER!"]="骄傲会将你送上绝路。来吧，凡人！品尝夺灵者的愤怒吧！"
G["PROPHET!"]="先知！"
G["PULVERIZE!"]="摧毁！"
G["PUNY $R! DIE!"]="弱小的$R！死吧！"
G["PUNY TROLLS NOT STOP ONGOLONGO!"]="弱小的巨魔别想阻止安戈龙格！"
G["PUPS OF ORGRIMMAR!  HEAR ME, BRASH UPSTARTS OF THE HORDE!  TREMBLE, AND KNOW YOUR DOOM,  FOR THE LICH KING'S GAZE IS FIXED UPON YOU!"]="奥格瑞玛的狗崽子们！部落的蠢材们！聆听我的审判吧！在恐惧中颤抖吧。巫妖王的双眼已经在凝视着你们。"
G["PUSH HARDER!"]="继续用力！"
G["PUT YOUR BACKS INTO IT, BOYS!"]="把你们的后背靠上去，孩子们！"
G["Pa keeps telling me I need to be more like my grandpa. But he died before I was born in a yak stampede."]="爸爸总说要我变得跟爷爷一样，但爷爷早在我出生之前就死于一次牦牛踩踏事故了。"
G["Pa says we've faced worse. But when he says \"we\" he means people like his great great grandfather.\n\nThe worst thing I've ever had to face was a grummle angry that his yak wasn't smelly enough."]="Papá dice que hemos superado cosas peores. Pero cuando dice \"hemos\" se refiere a su tatatatarabuelo.\n\nA lo peor que nos hemos tenido que enfrentar ha sido a un grúmel enfadado porque su yak no apestaba lo suficiente."
G["Pack yer bags, $n! We're off to the Twilight Highlands. You ready?"]="¡Haz las maletas, $n! Nos vamos a las Tierras Altas Crepusculares. ¿Estás $glisto:lista;?"
G["Packed up with lumber? Good. Send it up to Orgrimmar."]="全是木材？很好。把它们送去奥格瑞玛。"
G["Pah! Does not prove anything!"]="哈！没关系！"
G["Pah! I know I seen you around, but that don't make us friends. Go away!"]="呸！我知道我见过你，但那并不意味着我们是朋友。快滚！"
G["Pah! I remember when Un'sok was still a drone, afraid to mix his first toxin. I dare him to face me alone. Then we shall see whose alchemy is supreme."]="唉！我记得当时昂舒克还微不足道，不敢配制他的第一份毒药。我量他不敢独自面对我。然后，我们将比比谁的炼金术才是终极的。"
G["Pah! That was a show of strength, worthy of a leader. I only regret I did not kill that human before the mage interfered."]="哼！那只是领袖在展示他的力量。我真后悔没在那个法师插手前干掉那个人类。"
G["Pah! Those who failed deserved to die; you have merely culled the weak!"]="呸！失败者活该受死，你们只不过是淘汰了弱者！"
G["Pain and suffering are all that await you!"]="等待你们的只有痛苦与折磨！"
G["Pain is temporary! PH"]="痛苦只是暂时的！"
G["Pain will be the price for your insolence! You cannot stop me from claiming the Emerald Dream as my own!"]="你会为你的傲慢付出痛苦的代价！你休想阻止我夺走翡翠梦境！"
G["Pain!"]="痛苦！"
G["Painful but beautiful! Gurgthock gives you what you want! The best display of carnage in Azeroth. Show me some love, people!"]="痛苦，但是美丽！古尔戈索克将满足你们的欲望！这是艾泽拉斯最有观赏性的角斗场。朋友们，让我感受到你们的热情吧！"
G["Paint Bomb"]="涂料炸弹"
G["Paladin"]="圣骑士"
G["Paladin Aurelon, if you have the mana to spare, could you help with that one, please?  Thank you."]="圣骑士奥雷伦，如果你有多余的力气，能不能帮一下那边的那个？谢谢。"
G["Paladin, perhaps you would lend a hand?  I just need another heal on that one.  Thank you."]="圣骑士，或许你能帮个忙？那边的那个需要一些治疗。谢谢你。"
G["Paladin? Have you been partaking of the Apothecary's concoctions or some such thing? I have heard a rumor that some elven contingent is visiting the Dark Lady within the Undercity. Perhaps one of them might know."]="圣骑士？你是不是吃错药了还是怎么？我听到有传言说一个精灵代表团正在幽暗城拜访黑暗女王。也许他们之中有人会知道。"
G["Paladins... I've heard you have many lives. Show me."]="圣骑士……听说你们有无数条命。让我看看到底是怎么样的吧。"
G["Paltry kill."]="死不足惜。"
G["Pamela?  Are you there, honey?"]="帕米拉？亲爱的，你在那儿吗？"
G["Pan of the Martial Spirit trains with the warriors on the Warriors' Terrace, overlooking the rest of the Trader's Tier."]="武魂潘劲正在俯瞰贸易阶梯的战士平台上和战士们一起训练呢。"
G["Panda girl, why you so fast?"]="熊猫人女孩，怎么跑这么快？"
G["Panda lady! Catch this carrot!"]="熊猫小姐！抓住这根胡萝卜！"
G["Panda lady! Catch!"]="熊猫小姐！接着！"
G["Panda lady! Do a dance on top of the carrot!"]="熊猫小姐！在胡萝卜上面跳只舞吧！"
G["Panda lady! I have an idea!"]="熊猫小姐！我有个主意！"
G["Panda lady! Sit down on the carrot!"]="熊猫小姐！坐到胡萝卜上！"
G["Pandaren legends tell of Lei Shen, \"The Thunder King.\" He was the brutal founder of the Mogu empire over 12,000 years ago."]="Las leyendas pandaren hablan de Lei Shen, \"el Rey del Trueno\". Es un déspota que fundó el imperio mogu hace más de 12.000 años."
G["Pandaren pay for growing disgusting turnips!"]="熊猫人将为种植这些恶心的芜菁而付出代价！"
G["Pandaren will tell this tale for generations!"]="这个传奇将在熊猫人中代代相传！"
G["Pandaren! Approach."]="熊猫人！过来。"
G["Pandaren? Here, in Stormwind?"]="熊猫人？在这里？在暴风城？"
G["Pandaren? I mussht be seein' thingssh..."]="熊猫人？我肯定是眼花了……"
G["Pandaren? What business do you have in Stormwind?"]="熊猫人？你来暴风城干什么？"
G["Pandaria does not have a standing army. We, the Shado-Pan, are its first - and only - line of defense."]="潘达利亚没有常驻军队。我们影踪派，是这儿最早的——也是唯一的，防御阵线。"
G["Pandaria has not seen a full-scale war since the mists closed in. The Shado-Pan usually handle any trouble that crops up on the continent."]="潘达利亚自从被迷雾笼罩之后，就再也没经历过全面战争。影踪派总能应对在这片土地上滋生的任何麻烦。"
G["Pandaria is indeed a jewel. Such beauty. It makes you want to protect her, yes?"]="潘达利亚真是一颗明珠。美轮美奂。使你想要去保护她，是吧？"
G["Pandaria is ours!"]="潘达利亚属于部落！"
G["Pandaria will be ours!"]="潘达利亚是我们的！"
G["Pandaria will be ours, mongrel!"]="潘达利亚是我们的，混账！"
G["Pandaria. Land of opportunity. Time to get rich or get bent."]="潘达利亚。机遇之地。不能一夜暴富，就得倾家荡产。"
G["Panic!"]="恐慌！"
G["Pansy."]="胆小鬼。"
G["Papa! I'm coming home, Papa!"]="爸爸！我要回家，爸爸！"
G["Paper Airplane"]="纸飞机"
G["Papers to weigh? Doors to stop? Windows to break? bam, Bam, BAM! Volcano rocks."]="能做镇纸，能挡门，还能砸窗户！来看看，来看看！火山岩。"
G["Paragons of Power are powerful mojo.  They are Gurubashi Empire mojo.  We Zandalar must get mojo.  The tribe will take mojo for our own.  The Blood God will not destroy us.\n\nThere are three kinds of Paragons in Zul'Gurub.  Seek coins.  Seek bijous.  Seek primal items.  These are the Paragons.\n\nGo to Zul'Gurub now.  Kill.  Take the Paragons of Power.  Bring them to the tribe.  Earn our respect.  Earn our battle gear.  Earn real power."]="权力珍宝是强大的魔精，是古拉巴什帝国的魔精。我们赞德拉部族必须得到魔精，必须把魔精占为己有。血神将无法毁灭我们。\n\n在祖尔格拉布有三种权力珍宝。去找到硬币，找到珠宝。找到原始神灵的物品。这些都是权力珍宝。\n\n现在就去祖尔格拉布，杀戮……然后拿到权力珍宝。把它们带给部族，获得我们的尊敬，赢得我们对你的奖励，得到真正的力量。"
G["Paratroopers?!"]="伞兵？！"
G["Parched crops just need water!\n\nThey should be easy to take care of now that we've got that sprinkler! It should be on the ground just at the edge of the field."]="干枯的农作物需要水！\n\n有了洒水器我们就可以很轻松地照料它们了！那东西应该就在田地边上。"
G["Parched crops just need water!\n\nYou can use the old rusty watering can my grandpa left here. I keep it right over there by that tree stump, just next to the field."]="干枯的农作物需要水！\n\n你可以用我爷爷留下的那个生锈的老式洒水壶。我把它放在那个树桩旁边了，就在田地边上。"
G["Pardon me traveller, but did you happen to bring any bamboo up from the forest below?  I spend all day staring at it, drooling, hungry to no avail.  Yet all I have to eat up here is what I can conjour from my limited magics."]="Discúlpame, $gviajero:viajera;, pero ¿no habrás traído por casualidad algo de bambú del bosque? Me paso el día mirándolo, babeando, hambriento y sin remedio. Todo lo que tengo para comer aquí arriba es lo que puedo invocar con mis limitadas dotes de magia."
G["Pardon me, $r, but I am on official business and cannot be disturbed.\n\nPlease excuse me."]="抱歉，$r。我还有正事要办，不能耽搁。\n\n不好意思。"
G["Pardon me, friend, but I'm busier than it might appear.\n\nI've been commissioned to document the discoveries of the commander in this region, you see.\n\nThey're certain to be most profound!"]="Discúlpame, $gamigo:amiga;, pero estoy más ocupado de lo que parece.\n\nMe han encargado documentar los descubrimientos del Comandante en la región, ¿sabes?\n\n¡Seguro que son de lo más profundos!"
G["Pardon the intrusion, Lady Prestor, but Highlord Bolvar suggested that I seek your advice."]="普瑞斯托女士，请原谅我的冒昧，但是伯瓦尔·弗塔根公爵让我来寻求您的建议。"
G["Parents cannot always be assured of the legacy they will leave behind."]="父母并不能确保自己总能留下好的遗产。"
G["Parents place their children on a path, but they do not always know where the road will take them."]="父母将孩子送上人生的道路，却不知道他们会走向何方。"
G["Parting is such sweet sorrow."]="离别是这样甜蜜的凄清。"
G["Party G.R.E.N.A.D.E."]="自动跳舞信号发射器"
G["Party crashers!"]="不速之客！"
G["Party on, $c!"]="享受聚会吧，$c！"
G["Pat Nagle! World design team! Cory Stockton, Paul C., Jim Chadwick, Staats, Ed Hanes, Morris, Gotcher, Jesse!, Sarah B., Victor C., Dave A.! All of our amazing exterior artists!"]="¡Pat Nagle! ¡Equipo de diseño mundial! ¡Cory Stockton, Paul C., Jim Chadwick, Staats, Ed Hanes, Morris, Gotcher, Jesse! ¡Sarah B., Victor C., Dave A.! ¡Todos nuestros increíbles artistas exteriores!"
G["Patches get revenge on Doctor Sabnok!"]="补丁要向萨布诺克博士复仇！"
G["Patches not going to be cut open or sewn up no more!"]="补丁再也不想被随意地切开或是缝合了！"
G["Patchwerk miss Naxxramas. Maybe kill you all fast so Patchwerk go home?"]="帕奇维克想念纳克萨玛斯。杀死你们，帕奇维克或许就能早点回家啦。"
G["Patchwerk want to play!"]="帕奇维克要跟你玩！"
G["Patchy?"]="帕帕？"
G["Path of Cenarius"]="塞纳留斯之路"
G["Path of Illidan"]="伊利丹之路"
G["Pathetic Forsaken weakling. You wish to see my master? So be it."]="可怜的懦弱者。你想见我的主人？那就放马过来吧。"
G["Pathetic flesh!"]="可怜的血肉之躯！"
G["Pathetic fool!  Now I will teach you the meaning of pain!"]="可怜的家伙！让我来教教你痛苦的含义！"
G["Pathetic fool! A servant of Malygos would sooner die than aid an enemy...."]="可悲的蠢货！玛里苟斯的仆人宁死也不会为敌人效劳……"
G["Pathetic mortal... I will build a new empire atop your corpse!"]="可怜的凡人……我会在你的尸体上建立一个新的帝国！"
G["Pathetic mortals! You will pay dearly."]="可悲的凡人，你们要付出巨大的代价。"
G["Pathetic old orc! Come then, heroes. Come and face the might of the Scourge!"]="可怜的老兽人！来吧，英雄们，来尝尝天灾军团的力量吧！"
G["Pathetic weakling. You'll die quickly!"]="可怜的弱者。你的死期不远了！"
G["Pathetic weaklings."]="可怜的家伙。"
G["Pathetic worm!"]="可怜的爬虫们！"
G["Pathetic worm... your master's days are over!"]="可怜虫……你主人的计划破产了！"
G["Pathetic worms. Prepare to face the Mor'ghor Slam!"]="可怜的虫子。准备面对莫格霍尔猛击吧！"
G["Pathetic wretch!"]="可怜虫！"
G["Pathetic! Behold the true might of my chosen..."]="真可怜！看看我精兵真正的力量吧……"
G["Pathetic! You and your mogu are nothing to the might of the Horde!"]="可怜虫！你和你那些魔古族根本无法和部落的力量匹敌。"
G["Pathetic, bearded little rodents!"]="可怜的，长胡子的小老鼠！"
G["Pathetic, inferior mortals!"]="真可悲，愚蠢的凡人！"
G["Pathetic, really. Is that the best you can do?"]="可怜，真可怜。这就是你的全部力量了？"
G["Pathetic."]="真可怜。"
G["Pathetic. Is that the best you can do?"]="真可怜。你就这点能耐？"
G["Pathetic. The Horde grows weaker by the day..."]="真是可悲。部落变得一天比一天弱……"
G["Pathetic. You two do not deserve the training you are getting here if that was the best you can do."]="真可怜。如果这就是你们的最佳表现，你们俩的训练算是白费了。"
G["Pathetic..."]="废柴……扣你五十个学分！"
G["Patience is not one of my virtues."]="我可没什么耐性。"
G["Patience is the key."]="耐心是关键。"
G["Patience, $g dearest: dear; $n. The time is not quite right. Fire the flare again soon and we shall begin...."]="Paciencia, $gquerido:querida; $n. Aún no es el momento. Vuelve a lanzar la bengala pronto y comenzaremos..."
G["Patience, $n. I didn't become the renowned Budd Nedreck by being hasty.\n\nFinal preparations are being made and soon the treasures and secrets of Zul'Aman shall be mine! \n\n<Budd pauses and looks at you for a moment, then chuckles.>\n\n...ours I mean, of course."]="$n，要有耐心。若是我像你这般草率行事，也就不会成名了。\n\n做好最后的准备工作，祖阿曼的财富和秘密很快就属于我啦！\n\n<巴德看了看你，轻声地笑了。>\n\n……哎呀，我是说属于我们俩啦。"
G["Patience, Suna! If we march into Townlong alone, we compound our problems. We must focus on the Monastery and get reinforcements."]="耐心点，孙娜！如果我们贸然进入螳螂高原，那问题就复杂了。我们必须把注意力集中在禅院和援兵上。"
G["Patience, Suna. I share your desire to stop the yaungol. But I must consider every soldier, not just your husband."]="耐心点，孙娜。我们都想阻止野牛人。可我必须考虑到每一个战士，而不仅仅是你的丈夫。"
G["Patience, Tyrande."]="耐心点，泰兰德。"
G["Patience, Tyrande. We'll have our victory, but we're not going in unprepared."]="耐心点，泰兰德。我们必将取胜，但得做好准备。"
G["Patience, friend. Allow me to assist in preparing another attempt."]="耐心点儿，朋友。让我帮你准备下一次尝试。"
G["Patience, friends.  We will strike soon."]="耐心点儿，朋友们。我们很快就会出击。"
G["Patience, general. The Light embraces all who enter Shattrath in good faith."]="容忍，将军。圣光善待所有心怀虔诚的信念来到沙塔斯城的访客。"
G["Patience, guests. The waters are nearly cleansed."]="耐心点，客人们。这片水域快被净化了。"
G["Patience, now. It will be done soon."]="耐心点。很快就要完成了。"
G["Patience, patience. We will be with you shortly."]="耐心，耐心。我们很快就会加入你了。"
G["Patience... let them come to us!"]="耐心……等他们送上门！"
G["Patience... our turn will come."]="耐心……我们的机会就要来了。"
G["Patience... we will get our chance soon enough.  Be content that for once, it is Tirion who is in our debt."]="耐心点……我们会有机会干掉巫妖王的。这次，提里奥欠我们一份情。对此我已经很满足了。"
G["Patrol Frost Dagger Pass. Let none through! Die with honor..."]="去霜刀小径巡逻。别让任何人通过那儿！为荣誉而战……"
G["Patrol the front line, soldiers!"]="士兵们，去前线巡逻！"
G["Paval Reethe! Found you at last. And consorting with ogres now? No fear, even deserters and traitors are afforded some mercy."]="帕瓦尔·雷瑟！终于找到你了。你现在和食人魔混在一起了？不要害怕，即便是背叛者也会得到宽恕。"
G["Paw-paw says I'm not s'posed to talk to strangers."]="爸爸说，不要跟陌生人说话。"
G["Pawn ... takes ... bishop ..."]="卒……吃了……象……"
G["Pay 'em back! Hit them with everything you've got!"]="反击！好好教训他们！"
G["Pay 5 Timeless Coins for 1 Kukuru's Kache Key."]="支付5枚永恒铸币换取1把库库鲁的宝箱钥匙。"
G["Pay 5 Timeless Coins?"]="支付5枚永恒铸币？"
G["Pay attention, friend! We're headin' into hostile territory with both vrykul and Horde all over the place!"]="小心！我们要去的地方非常危险，那里到处都是维库人和部落！"
G["Pay attention, soldier! You need to take this beacon to the Snowfall graveyard and plant it! Protect it long enough so that my gryphon can lock on.\n\nIf my gryphon gets a solid strike location, Mulv and his crew will be humiliated!"]="注意！你需要带上这根火炬，将它插在中央墓地！要好好保护它，以便我的狮鹫能进行追踪。\n\n如果我的狮鹫能准确定位的话，穆维和他的手下会感到耻辱的！"
G["Pay attention. This is Instructor Razuvious, Kel'Thuzad's appointed trainer of all death knights. It is said that his own technique is so potent, only a disciple of his could possibly withstand his might."]="注意。这是教官拉苏维奥斯，由克尔苏加德亲自指派的死亡骑士训练师。这位威严的教官拥有独特的教学法则，据说只有他的学徒才有可能承受得住他的威力。"
G["Pay for your crimes!"]="付出代价吧！"
G["Pay me and I'll talk...\n\nOh hey, it's you, $n! Nevermind about that..."]="Págame y hablaré...\n\n¡Ah, oye, eres tú, $n! No te preocupes por eso..."
G["Pay no attention to the hozen behind my back. His discipline training is... in progress."]="不必理会我身后的那只猢狲。他的戒律训练正在……进行中。"
G["Pay no attention to their kind, $n. The sacrifices made by your order are lost on them. They will never understand the price you pay for the power you wield in their defense."]="不用在意他们，$n。你所属的组织所做出的牺牲对他们来说不值一提，他们永远也不会懂得你为了保卫他们付出了什么样的代价。"
G["Pay up, Bruno!"]="布隆诺，你要付出代价！"
G["Pay up, Harry!"]="还钱，哈瑞！"
G["Pay up, they made it through those alementals!"]="给钱，他们没受那些酒灵的影响！"
G["Pay your respects. $n is in the house!"]="注意礼节。$n在屋里呢！"
G["Pay? Well, they don't pay anything at all."]="报酬？哦，他们并不给他任何报酬。"
G["Payback's gonna hurt."]="偿还总是痛苦的。"
G["Payment for those plans comes in bones - YOUR BONES!"]="这些计划的报酬将从尸体中得来——你的尸体！"
G["Peace and patience be with you, $n. Remain strong always."]="愿安宁和耐心永远与你同在，$n。"
G["Peace is all that is worth fighting for."]="和平是唯一值得为之而战的东西。"
G["Peace is but a fleeting dream! Let the NIGHTMARE reign!"]="和平不过是短暂的梦想！让梦魇统治整个世界吧！"
G["Peace is for the weak!"]="只有弱者才希望和平！"
G["Peace will come. I swear it. And old hatreds will go away. You have to believe me."]="和平终将来临。我发誓。往昔的仇恨将不复存在。你要相信我。"
G["Peace, child, your time has not yet come. Remain here and witness that which is to unfold."]="Calma, $g chico:chica; tu hora aún no ha llegado. Quédate aquí y observa lo que se va a desvelar."
G["Peace? PEACE?"]="平静？“平静”？"
G["Peak, I'm ready to escort the catapult."]="皮克，我准备好护送投石车了。"
G["Peanuts!  Get your peanuts here!"]="花生！来买点花生吧！"
G["Pebble bobbles around appreciatively and then disappears into the distance."]="佩波充满感激地跃动着，然后消失在远方。"
G["Pebble bobbles around appreciatively."]="砾石佩波感激地来回蹦跳着。"
G["Pebble bounces around and looks up at you hopefully. He definitely remembers you."]="佩波跳来跳去，充满希望地抬头望着你。他显然记得你是谁。"
G["Pebble bounces up and down happily as he disappears into the distance."]="佩波欢快地上下弹跳着，消失在远方。"
G["Pebble bounces up and down happily."]="砾石佩波欢快地上下蹦跳着。"
G["Pebble looks up at you hopefully."]="砾石佩波充满希望地抬头看着你。"
G["Pebble races in circles, clearly happy."]="砾石佩波不停地绕着圈，显得非常欢快。"
G["Pebble sees the crystals ahead and excitedly rushes towards them!"]="砾石佩波看到前面的水晶，兴奋地向它们跑了过去！"
G["Pebble shuffles around happily and disappears into the distance."]="佩波欢快地四下跳跃着，消失在远方。"
G["Pebble shuffles around happily."]="砾石佩波在周围欢快地滑动着。"
G["Pebble shuffles up against your leg happily, then races off into the distance."]="佩波欢快地在你腿边跳上跳下，然后飞也似地消失在远方。"
G["Pebble shuffles up against your leg happily."]="砾石佩波快活地蹭着你的腿。"
G["Pebble slumps down sadly."]="砾石佩波伤心地趴了下去。"
G["Pebble turns away sadly."]="砾石佩波伤心地转过了身。"
G["Pebble's excitement has drawn the attention nearby rock flayers!"]="兴奋的砾石佩波引起了附近剥石者的注意！"
G["Pebble's stones jitter as he obediently falls in beside you."]="佩波跳动着顺从地跟在你身边。"
G["Pebbles stones burst apart onto the ground, then slowly reform into a full fledged, happy Pebble."]="砾石佩波的石块散落在地上，然后又慢慢地组合成一个完整的，快活的砾石佩波。"
G["Peck 'dere eyes out!"]="把他们的眼球啄出来！"
G["Peel banana first, eat second."]="先剥皮，再吃香蕉。"
G["Peer inside the warp-gate if you dare. I've prepared something special for you..."]="要是你有胆的话，就凝视着迁跃门内部吧。我已经为你准备了一些特别的东西……"
G["Peer into the cauldron, $n.  Marg wishes to speak..."]="仔细看着锅，$n。他似乎有话要说……"
G["Peering through the portal, you see the inner portion of an underground cave.  The sound of water falling is muffled by the sound of earth shifting.  This portal must have been opened for a reason, but why?"]="穿过传送门往里望去，你看到一个地下洞穴的内部。水流拍击与大地移位的声音混杂在一起。这个传送门一定是因某种原因打开的，但究竟是为什么呢？"
G["Pele'keiki know, it seem impossible even to him, but we be havin' all that firebloom the Horde be wantin' for the war. If you not be feelin' too lazy, Pele'keiki think you be helpin' out the others here. They sure to have many things they be wantin' you to get for them."]="比雷凯基知道收集火焰花的任务非常艰巨，也许连他自己都做不到，但是我们已经集齐部落所需的火焰花了。如果你不想无所事事的话，就去帮帮别人吧。这儿一定有人需要帮助。"
G["Pelting Spree!"]="疯狂投掷！"
G["Penniless and away from what we know in the middle of the frozen, undead-infested northland."]="是啊，我们背井离乡，身无分文，孤零零地呆在这片亡灵肆虐的极北荒地。"
G["Pentarus, you heard the $gman:woman;. Have your mages release the shield and let these brave souls through!"]="Goran, ya has escuchado $gal hombre:a la mujer;. ¡Que tus magos abran el escudo y que dejen pasar a estas almas valerosas!"
G["Pentigast! Bring the new $r up to speed, would you?"]="¡Pentigast! Pon $gal nuevo:a la nueva; $r al día, ¿quieres?"
G["Peon! Unpack the food and medical supplies!"]="苦工！把这些食物和医疗物资搬出来！"
G["People are always accusin' me of using my family connections to get promoted. I choose to see it as using my resources wisely.\n\nBesides, what else would I use my family for?"]="人们总是指责我任人唯亲。可我把这看做合理使用资源。\n\n再说了，不然我的家人还能做什么？"
G["People be dyin' up above. Da city is in chaos. I'm gonna finish it - stop da bloodshed. I'll come back for ya."]="人民正在哀嚎。城里一片混乱。我要去阻止这场屠杀。我会回来找你的。"
G["People here really see the world the way I do. You've got to make a place for yourself, you know?"]="这里的人有着和我相似的世界观。你必须打出自己的一片天地，你明白吗？"
G["People of Azeroth and Outland... ARE YOU READY TO ROCK?!"]="艾泽拉斯和外域的人们……你们准备好了吗！"
G["People of Orgrimmar, listen. We have been blind for too long! I ask you to open your eyes to the truth!"]="奥格瑞玛的居民们，听我说。我们已经失明了太长时间！我请求你们，向真实睁开双眼吧！"
G["People of Outland, are you ready to rock?! The Tauren Chieftain concert now begins!"]="外域的居民们，你们准备好了吗？牛头人酋长音乐会现在正式开演！"
G["People of Stormwind! Citizens of the Alliance! Your king speaks!"]="暴风城的市民！联盟的公民！你们的国王有话要说！"
G["People of the Horde, citizens of Orgrimmar, come, gather round and celebrate a hero of the Horde. On this day, $n, under the auspices of our glorious Warchief, laid a mortal blow against the Black Dragonflight. The brood mother, Onyxia, has been slain!"]="部落的人民，奥格瑞玛的居民，来吧，聚集在一起，欢庆部落英雄的诞生！今天，$n在我们伟大的酋长的领导下，给予了黑龙致命的一击。奥妮克希亚已经被斩杀了！"
G["People think I like corndogs, but actually, they give me indigestion!"]="人们都认为我喜欢玉米热狗，但实际上玉米热狗让我消化不良！！！"
G["People tink raptors wild and vicious, but little else. In truth, they be loyal and cunnin' in ways ya hardly know."]="人们对迅猛龙的了解只限于野蛮凶残，除此之外知之甚少。实际上，他们的忠诚和机智超乎你的想象。"
G["People used to come up to me because they thought I was the king.  I guess we look alike..."]="有时人们会将我误认成国王陛下。大概是我们的容貌过于相似吧……"
G["People will come from all over Azeroth to marvel at her wonders."]="人们从艾泽拉斯各地赶来，向她的奇迹致敬。"
G["People will come from far and wide to witness the fruits of our labor, $n."]="人们将从世界各地赶来，见证我们劳动的果实，$n。"
G["People, really, there's nothing to worry about!"]="相信我，真的没什么可担心的！"
G["Peppy, I swear you could drink a dwarf under the table."]="贝比，我敢打赌矮人都喝不过你。"
G["Per your request, Corporal Splithoof has come, $n."]="$n，桑德·裂蹄已经来了。"
G["Perfect technique!"]="战技绝伦！"
G["Perfect! C'mere, buddy. Sorry about last time! Put this on."]="好极了！过来，伙计。上次真是不好意思！把这个戴上吧。"
G["Perfect.  As long as you don't go hacking and slashing your way through, they'll never know the difference."]="很好。看来不派你去好好地教训他们一下，他们是搞不清楚状况的。"
G["Performing the same action multiple times in a row will get you a small bonus. Try seating many customers or delivering their orders in rapid succession to earn extra points!"]="连续执行相同的动作可以让你获得一些小奖励。尽量连续引导客人入座或者连续上菜来赢得额外的分数吧！"
G["Perhaps - perhaps he might someday remember what he once was."]="也许……也许有一天，他会想起真正的自己。"
G["Perhaps Belloc and the Reliquary shall have both of these after all..."]="也许贝洛克和神圣遗物学会想要把两件东西都拿到手……"
G["Perhaps Ebon Watch can spare some reinforcements.  Fire another signal flare."]="黑锋哨站或许还能再派一些援军来。再发一枚信号弹吧。"
G["Perhaps I am able to offer something of interest to you? Come, see if there's anything you like."]="或许我这里有你感兴趣的东西？过来，看看有喜欢的吗？"
G["Perhaps I brewed the tea wrong? Yes, that must be it. I brewed the tea wrong. My apologies."]="也许是我泡错了茶？对，肯定是这样。抱歉，我泡错茶了。"
G["Perhaps I can be of some assistance. I will make a deal with you, Satyr. I shall recover this unforged breastplate and slay the beast, Goraluk Anvilcrack. In exchange for this task, you will teach me how to create the breastplate."]="或许我能帮上忙。萨特，我们来谈笔交易吧。我去取回这块未铸造的胸甲并杀死野兽古拉鲁克。作为交换，你要教我如何制造胸甲。"
G["Perhaps I can find a use for you..."]="也许我可以好好利用你……"
G["Perhaps I can interest you in a magic map? Oh nevermind, we're all sold out."]="也许你会对魔法地图感兴趣？噢算了，都卖光了。"
G["Perhaps I can teach you something..."]="或许我能教你些什么……"
G["Perhaps I could have used... some enhancements... of my own..."]="或许我应该……强化一下……我自己……"
G["Perhaps I have been too shrouded in my own doubts and fears."]="或许我是被自己的疑虑和恐惧蒙蔽了眼睛。"
G["Perhaps I need to increase the dosage to prevent such quick deaths."]="也许我该加大剂量，避免如此快速地死亡。"
G["Perhaps I should explain..."]="也许我应该解释一下……"
G["Perhaps I should tell you why I am here.\n\nDo you know of the Aspect, Deathwing? Or of his progeny, Nefarian and Onyxia?"]="或许我应该告诉你为什么我会在这儿。\n\n你知道死亡之翼或者他的后裔，奈法利安和奥妮克希亚吗？"
G["Perhaps I underestimated you. It would be unfair to make you fight all four advisors at once, but... fair treatment was never shown to my people. I'm just returning the favor."]="也许我确实低估了你们。虽然让你们同时面对我的四位顾问显得有些不公平，但是我的人民从来都没有得到过公平的待遇。我只是在以牙还牙。"
G["Perhaps I was wrong about you, $r. You have already done much to help our village."]="或许我误解了你，$r。你已经帮了我们村很多忙了。"
G["Perhaps I'll be able to sell your hide on the market.  Then again, it's likely worthless."]="或许我可以剥下你的皮，然后拿到市场上叫卖。不过还是算了吧，你这身臭皮囊看上去就不值几个钱。"
G["Perhaps I've met an adventurer worthy of my company... perhaps you will redeem my people."]="或许你就是值得我陪伴左右的冒险家……或许你能拯救我的同胞。"
G["Perhaps Ograbisi will use your head as a tiny little hat when I'm through with you."]="当我厌倦你时，或许奥格拉比斯会拿你的脑袋做一顶小帽子。"
G["Perhaps Subject 142 will be more successful than Subject 141."]="也许142号要比141号成功得多。"
G["Perhaps a bit more grease will do the trick."]="也许多一点点润滑油就可以了。"
G["Perhaps a quick stab will let out all that tension in your shoulders..."]="也许在你背后捅上一刀就能帮你卸下肩上的重担……"
G["Perhaps another day, tamer."]="择日再战吧，驯宠师。"
G["Perhaps cutting your rations in half will be incentive to get you to mine faster?"]="把你们的口粮减半或许能刺激你们挖得快点儿？"
G["Perhaps he felt he needed to prove that he was as talented as you."]="也许他觉得自己需要证明，他和你一样天赋异禀。"
G["Perhaps he took her unaware.  Perhaps he is that well trusted."]="也许她被偷袭了。也许…她完全信任那个杀手。"
G["Perhaps if I overcharge the forge, it will destabilize this sha nuisance? Let's try it."]="如果让熔炉过载的话，或许就能消灭这该死的煞魔。试试看。"
G["Perhaps if he spent less time playing with his pet Goblin and more time training we'd have enough power to fix this thing!"]="如果他在他的地精宠物身上少花点时间，在训练上多花点时间的话，我们应该就能修复这东西了！"
G["Perhaps it could be harnessed. My people are well-versed in controlling the rage within..."]="也许这股能量可以被驾驭。我的人民……长久以来一直在控制内心的愤怒……"
G["Perhaps it is your imperfections... that which grants you free will... that allows you to persevere against all cosmically calculated odds. You prevail where the Titan's own perfect creations have failed."]="也许正是这种不完美，才使你们获得了自由的意志，并因此有能力改变那些看起来不可避免的必然命运。泰坦所创造的许多完美生命体都遭遇了失败，而你们仍能继续前行。"
G["Perhaps it was a mistake to travel so close to the Rivenwood and Gjalerbron to get here."]="或许我们选择靠近裂木森林和亚勒伯龙的道路是个错误。"
G["Perhaps it was wrong of me to venture here."]="也许我到这里来探险是错误的。"
G["Perhaps just one more dance. Then I really must be leaving! I have to get back to... to..."]="也许只能再跳一支舞了。我必须要走了！我必须回到……回到……"
G["Perhaps later we should join the dance."]="也许我们应该加入跳舞的人群中。"
G["Perhaps now you're ready to see things my way?"]="也许你现在准备按我的方式看待事物了？"
G["Perhaps one day I will repay you for this kind act."]="也许有一天我将报答你的善举。"
G["Perhaps one day, your contributions to the Alliance will be as great as the heroes you have seen this day. Honor them, $n."]="或许有一天，你对联盟的贡献会跟你今日所见的英雄一样伟大。尊重英雄吧，$n。"
G["Perhaps our newfound reinforcements will aid us."]="或许新来的援军能帮上忙。"
G["Perhaps so, but it's only a matter of time until we break back into Ulduar. Any luck finding a way to teleport inside?"]="或许吧，但是我们攻入奥杜尔是迟早的事。找到传送进去的办法了吗？"
G["Perhaps some other kind of arrangement can be worked out here. A simple tap on the shoulder, maybe?"]="或许换个方式也能奏效啊。比如，只是拍拍肩膀？"
G["Perhaps someday I can visit your village too, $n."]="或许有一天，我也会去拜访你的村子的，$n。"
G["Perhaps that's why he left without you."]="也许这就是他独自离去的原因。"
G["Perhaps the mogu hid the bell for a reason, Warchief."]="或许魔古族出于某些原因将圣钟藏了起来，酋长。"
G["Perhaps there exists a way?"]="或许还有别的方法进入？"
G["Perhaps there is hope after all."]="或许我们还有希望。"
G["Perhaps these events are also what have brought forth the Highborne from Shen'dralar."]="也许辛德拉的上层精灵也是因此赶来的。"
G["Perhaps they should send their gnomes down here? They could do no worse!"]="也许他们应该把侏儒派到这里来？他们不可能更蠢了！"
G["Perhaps they will come to their senses... and run away as fast as they can."]="或许……他们会觉悟过来，然后立刻逃离这儿。"
G["Perhaps this battle will not be as easy as I thought..."]="也许这场战斗并不像我想的那么容易……"
G["Perhaps this one will know something about the poem. Be cleansed, spirit!"]="也许这个灵魂知道那首诗歌。净化吧，灵魂！"
G["Perhaps this will cool your heads..."]="也许这个能冷静一下你的头脑……"
G["Perhaps this will test your skills."]="也许这会考验你的技能。"
G["Perhaps we can attempt this later. Please speak to me again if you wish to do so."]="或许我们可以稍后再尝试尝试。等你想好的时候再跟我谈谈。"
G["Perhaps we can find a new home here in the Vale."]="也许我们能在山谷里找到新家。"
G["Perhaps we could arrange the sale of some of our remaining goods for your gold? We'll need to purchase food and water from other villages now if we're to survive."]="也许我们可以把剩下的货物卖给你，换些金币？要想活命，我们就必须从其它村子采购食物和饮水。"
G["Perhaps we ought to give the enemy what they're after... and spare our people the coming bloodshed."]="也许我们应该把敌人要的东西给他们……这样至少可以让我们的人民免受血腥屠杀。"
G["Perhaps we shall need more..."]="也许我们还需要一些……"
G["Perhaps we should have resisted - because, despite the fact that we... I... allowed them to take what they wanted, they killed us anyways."]="也许我们应该反抗——因为，即便我们……我……我任由他们恣意夺取想要的一切，可他们还是对我们下了毒手。"
G["Perhaps we should let the matter rest for the time being until your chef has prepared your meal? You look a bit piqued if you don't mind my saying. We can resume our discussion when you are feeling more yourself."]="或许我们应该暂时把问题放一放，先让厨子为你准备一顿美餐如何？你看上去有些不悦的样子，如果你不介意我这么说的话。我们还是等你感觉好点之后再来探讨问题吧。"
G["Perhaps we should pull back to the wall?  If the full force of the mantid come, we can confidently hold them there."]="或许我们应该撤退到城墙那里？即便是螳螂妖全数出动，我们也绝对能将它们挡住。"
G["Perhaps we will be allies soon."]="或许你很快就要成为我的盟友啦。"
G["Perhaps we will be fortunate enough to watch an Alliance dog get torn limb from limb."]="如果走运的话，我们或许能看到哪个联盟狗被撕成碎片。"
G["Perhaps we will get a moment to rest. But I will not give up until we have faced off against Vorsha!"]="或许我们能休息一下。但是在打败沃尔沙之前我绝不放弃！"
G["Perhaps we will meet again. I hope we find ourselves on the same side..."]="也许我们有朝一日会再次相遇。但愿届时我们还能站在同一阵线……"
G["Perhaps we're not ready yet. Speak to me again when you be wantin' to open da gates."]="也许我们还没准备好。你们准备打开大门的时候告诉我。"
G["Perhaps ye filthy animals would like another taste o the dirt!"]="也许你们这些肮脏的动物想要尝尝泥土的味道！"
G["Perhaps you can succeed where Illidan failed... perhaps you can accept the disorder of this universe."]="或许你能做到伊利丹没能做到的事……或许你能接受这个宇宙的无序。"
G["Perhaps you could speak to Nazgrim on my behalf? He seems unwilling to negotiate with me."]="要不你帮我跟纳兹戈林谈谈？他似乎不太愿意跟我交涉。"
G["Perhaps you did not hear me, Ruusk. I am giving you an order from Illidan himself!"]="也许你耳朵不太灵光，卢斯克。我向你传达的是伊利丹大人亲自发布的命令！"
G["Perhaps you did not hear me. I said, get me free of these chains!"]="也许你没有听到我的话。我说了，让我摆脱这些链子！"
G["Perhaps you do stand a chance against me."]="也许你确实有些实力。"
G["Perhaps you have what it takes, perhaps not. If you do then I will take you on and teach you what you wish to know. If you do not... well, I'll just leave it at that."]="或许你明白这意味着什么，或许你不明白。如果你懂的话，我会传授知识给你。如果你不懂……嗯，那就这样吧。"
G["Perhaps you should have stayed... in the mountains!"]="也许你早应该留在……群山里！"
G["Perhaps you should have studied more."]="也许你应该再温习一遍的。"
G["Perhaps you should speak into these sound enhancing devices attached to my FISTS OF FURY."]="也许你应该对着这些套在我愤怒的拳头上的扩音器讲话。"
G["Perhaps you should try hurling them at the nearby dragons to practice your throwing arm."]="也许你应该试着将它们抛向附近的恶龙。这样也可以锻炼你的臂力。"
G["Perhaps you will have better luck in our next encounter."]="也许我们下一次交手时，你会交好运。"
G["Perhaps you will tell me of your deeds, $n.  I would be honored to know them."]="或许你能告诉我你的一些事情，$n。我非常想听听。"
G["Perhaps you won't need to rely on your chanting so much with a proper weapon by your side."]="也许当你拥有一件合适的武器，你就不需要过于依赖你的咒语了。"
G["Perhaps you would rather test yourselves against a more formidable opponent?!"]="也许你应该找个更加厉害的对手过招！"
G["Perhaps you'll think twice about stealin' one of Kitrik's horses next time, eh?"]="下次偷基特里克的马之前，你最好考虑清楚，嗯？"
G["Perhaps, $c... perhaps.\n\nBut if you would be the one to attempt its creation, you must learn the ways of the Argent Verdict Forgemasters.\n\nAssociate yourself with them and prove your loyalty and dedication.\n\nWhen this is done, we shall discuss the matter further."]="Quizá, $c... quizá.\n\nPero si tú fueras a ser $gel:la; que intentara crearla, deberás aprender el arte de los maestros de forja del Veredicto Argenta.\n\nAsóciate con ellos y demuestra tu lealtad y dedicación.\n\nCuando hayas terminado, hablaremos más sobre ello."
G["Perhaps, $c... perhaps.\n\nBut if you would be the one to attempt its creation, you must learn the ways of the Argent Verdict Forgemasters.\n\nAssociate yourself with them and show them your loyalty and dedication.\n\nWhen this is done, we shall discuss the matter further"]="Quizá, $c... quizá.\n\nPero si tú fueras a ser $gel:la; que intentara crearla, deberás aprender el arte de los maestros de forja del Veredicto Argenta.\n\nAsóciate con ellos y demuestra tu lealtad y dedicación.\n\nCuando hayas terminado, hablaremos más sobre ello."
G["Perhaps, $c... perhaps.\n\nBut if you would be the one to attempt its creation, you must learn the ways of the Argent Verdict Forgemasters.\n\nAssociate yourself with them and show them your loyalty and dedication.\n\nWhen this is done, we shall discuss the matter further."]="Quizá, $c... quizá.\n\nPero si tú fueras a ser $gel:la; que intentara crearla, deberás aprender el arte de los maestros de forja del Veredicto Argenta.\n\nAsóciate con ellos y demuestra tu lealtad y dedicación.\n\nCuando hayas terminado, hablaremos más sobre ello."
G["Perhaps, but know this: there must always be a Lich King. Even if you were to strike down Arthas, another would have to take his place, for without the control of the Lich King, the Scourge would wash over this world like locusts, destroying all that they touched."]="也许吧，但要记住：一定要有一位巫妖王。即使你终结了阿尔萨斯，也要有另一个人来取代他。没有了巫妖王的控制，天灾军团就会像蝗灾一样横扫世界，所到之处，寸草不生。"
G["Perhaps, but with the opportunity to make names for ourselves! Think of the reception you'd have in Shattrath as the savior of Azeroth, slayer of the Scourge!"]="或许吧，但是我们很有机会出名啊！你想想，我们在沙塔斯城的时候是多么受欢迎啊，我们是艾泽拉斯的救星，是天灾军团的克星！"
G["Perhaps, if you were to befriend the mantid, and earn a reputation among them, they would teach you their secrets. But I warn you:"]="如果你能和螳螂妖交上朋友，赢取了信任，那他们会告诉你螳螂妖的秘密。可我提醒你："
G["Perhaps. And perhaps we would win, but at what cost? Maybe $n has a better plan..."]="也许吧。也许我们能取胜，但代价会有多大？说不定$n有更好的主意……"
G["Perhaps. For that reason, we will need to gather more supplies..."]="也许吧。因为这个缘故，我们还需要更多的补给……"
G["Perhaps. Go now, young one. Seek council with the Warchief. He will surely wish to know of your discovery."]="或许吧。年轻人，现在就出发吧。去找酋长，他肯定会乐意知道你的发现的。"
G["Perhaps. I doubt the effectiveness of this gambit. We would be better served preparing our armies for the final assault."]="也许吧。我觉得这比赛没什么意义。我们现在就应该集结大军发动总攻。"
G["Perhaps..."]="也许……"
G["Perhaps... I was a bit too... optimitistic about my condition..."]="也许……我对自己的处境有点太……乐观了……"
G["Perhaps... we attacked... too soon."]="也许……我们出击得……过早了。"
G["Perhaps... we have... underestimated... you."]="或许……我们……低估了……你们。"
G["Perhaps... you were right, Crok."]="也许……你是对的，科罗克。"
G["Perimeter breached!  Destroy $R!"]="边界已被突破！消灭$R！！"
G["Perish the thought!\n\nI'm simply trying to rid the world of a horrible menace, and that type of thing rarely comes without a price, as I'm sure you know.\n\nThink of it like this, $n. You'll be offering ordinary folks the chance to become heroes! A rare opportunity indeed!\n\nYou just send them my way and I'll handle the rest...."]="说什么呢！\n\n我只是想铲除邪恶势力啊，你应该知道，这种事情肯定要付出代价的嘛。\n\n$n，换个角度来想吧。我这是为普通人谋福利，让他们有机会成为世人瞩目的英雄！多么难得的机遇呀！\n\n你只需让他们来这儿找我，剩下的事就交给我来应付好了……"
G["Perish!"]="去死吧！"
G["Perish, insect!"]="死吧，小虫子！"
G["Perish, mortal!"]="死吧，凡人！"
G["Permanently!"]="永远！"
G["Permission to buzz the tower!"]="请求低飞掠过哨塔的允许！"
G["Perpetual Purple Firework"]="紫色焰火"
G["Perry Gatner! What an act!  The cantina is open all night long, so please, stay and enjoy yourselves!"]="派瑞·加奈尔！多棒的表演！酒馆是通宵营业的，所以请待在这尽情享受吧！"
G["Perseverance! Victory is in our grasp."]="坚持住！胜利在望了。"
G["Persistence in training shall always achieve results."]="坚持训练，必有所获。"
G["Persistence or stupidity? It matters not. Let this be a lesson learned, mortal!"]="这是毅力还是愚蠢？无所谓了。铭记这个教训吧，凡人！"
G["Persistent whelps! You will not reach the entrance of my lord's lair! Soldiers, destroy them!"]="固执的家伙！你们根本到不了主人的密室！士兵们，消灭他们！"
G["Personal hygiene?"]="个人卫生问题？"
G["Personal reservoirs of hope and faith are strengthened, and one's capacity for greater light increases."]="随着个人信念的逐渐强化，他对圣光之力的驾驭就会愈发纯熟。"
G["Perty light!"]="多漂亮的光啊！"
G["Perusing"]="查看中"
G["Pestilence upon you!"]="天灾降临！"
