G["Pet battles are the most awesome force that Azeroth has ever seen, but I've seen those that wield it like a kid that's found his father's crossbow.  What about you?"]="宠物对战是艾泽拉斯有史以来最棒的游戏，可我见过不少人在战斗中表现得就像三岁小孩儿。你又能好到哪里去呢？"
