G["Pet smash! You die!"]="宠物碎击！你死定了！"
G["Petrov promised me more help would be coming. What's taking so long?!"]="派特洛夫许诺说马上就派援兵过来。怎么这么久都没动静？！"
G["Pets to take care of?  Just make sure you clean up after it!  Look for Shoja'my in front of the inn."]="要照料宠物吗？你得确保它的清洁！去旅馆前面找苏亚米吧。"
G["Petulant children, pray to your gods for you are about to meet them!"]="狂妄的孩子们，在你们快要见到你们的神明之前向他祈祷吧！"
