G["Pfagh! What sort of necromancer lets death stop him? I knew you were worthless!"]="呸！通灵师岂有死了就放弃的道理？你这没用的东西！"
G["Pha! Ken-Ken doesn't need a jinyu to win."]="得了！肯肯才不需要靠锦鱼人帮忙来赢取胜利。"
G["Phalanx, I think you need to teach thos person a lesson."]="法拉克斯，我想你需要好好教训一下这些家伙。"
G["Phew! Glad to be back from that creepy cave."]="呼……终于可以离开那个阴暗的洞穴了！"
G["Phew! I need a breather. Let's rest here a momen- wha?"]="唷！我得喘口气。我们在这儿歇一会吧？"
G["Phew! That was close. Ok, here's the deal..."]="呦！就差一点儿。好，不如这样……"
