G["Pick any of these fabulous rods and CAREFULLY tug the line. That should help set the hook into whatever's flailin' around at the other end."]="从这些上好的鱼竿中选择一根，然后小心地拉鱼线。这样可以更加轻松地钓到东西。"
G["Pick their corpses clean!"]="干净利落地解决掉他们！"
G["Pick up the Weed-B-Gone!"]="捡起除草剂！"
G["Pick up the hammer."]="拿起锤子。"
G["Pick up the pace, boys. We're not making any progress here."]="加快速度，小子们。我们在这里还没任何进展。"
G["Pick up the pace, men. We're about ready to set off!"]="加快节奏，伙计们。我们就快出发了！"
