G["Picking that up for Aska? She'll be pleased with your choice."]="选这个给阿丝卡？她会很高兴的。"
G["Pickled Eagle Egg!"]="腌鹰蛋！"
G["Picnic Basket"]="午餐篮"
G["Pie is far better than cake. Everyone knows that! Shouldn't a $c of your standing be well-informed about such important matters?"]="El pastel le da mil vueltas a la tarta. ¡Todo el mundo lo sabe! ¿$gUn:Una; $c de tu calibre no debería estar al tanto de estas cosas?"
G["Pie, Pastry & Cakes"]="馅饼和蛋糕"
G["Piece by piece I will tear this challenger apart... PIECE BY PIECE!"]="我要把这个挑战者撕成碎片！"
G["Pierce the flesh!"]="刺穿血肉。"
G["Piertotum Locomotor!"]="[咒文]Piertotum Locomotor（即刻起身）！"
G["Piggy stop!"]="小猪停下！"
