G["Pigs! Scum! I will cleave your fat heads like apples!"]="该死的猪！你们的胖脑袋里只有一团肥肉！"
G["Pilgrim's Bounty is a time to reflect upon one's good fortune and share with all around you.\n\nIn Mulgore and the Horde, we have found both a home and friends to enjoy its many fruits with.\n\nIt is our hope that every one of our allies will be able to join us in feasting and celebration."]="感恩节是人们纵情狂欢，并与你周围的朋友分享快乐的节日。\n\n在莫高雷和部落中间，我们都找到了家的感觉和亲密的朋友，来共同享用各种美好的果实。\n\n我们希望，在这个节日里，我们所有的朋友都能加入到庆祝的行列中来。"
G["Pilgrim's Bounty is a time to reflect upon one's good fortune and share with all around you.\n\nWe hope that all of our noble allies will join us in feasting and celebration."]="感恩节是人们纵情狂欢，并与你周围的朋友分享快乐的节日。\n\n我们希望，在这个节日里，我们所有高贵的朋友们都能加入到庆祝的行列中来。"
G["Pillagers! Desecrators!"]="强盗！流氓！"
G["Pirate friends, listen. I'm not with this Synge character. Let me assure you that if you let me out of this cage, I'll be the best engineer you've ever had. I mean, really, have you seen the accuracy of your cannons? So close, yet soooooo far away!"]="海盗朋友们，听好了。我跟这个叫赛恩格的家伙不是一伙的。我向你们保证，要是你们能把我从这笼子里放出去，你们会发现我是你们所遇到的最顶级的工程师。我是说——真的，你们见识过你们火炮的精准性吧？非常接近目标，可还是差了好——远！"
G["Pirates and centaurs and Grimtotem, oh my!\n\nAnd I think I saw something big fly overhead last night. It was so big it blocked out the moon!"]="海盗、半人马、恐怖图腾，我的天！\n\n而且我想我昨晚还看到一个庞然大物从头顶上飞了过去。它可真是太大了，大得把月亮都遮住了！"
G["Pirates are NOT in my contract!"]="海盗不在我的合同之内！"
G["Pirates? PIRATES!"]="海盗？海盗！"
G["Pirates?! Boss, you have to deal with this! They're ruining the party!"]="¡¿Piratas?! ¡$gJefe:Jefa; tienes que encargarte de esto! ¡Están arruinando la fiesta!"
G["Pirates?! Nobody said anything about pirates!\n\nDon't let them get me, boss. I'm too young to die!!!"]="¿Piratas? ¡¡¡Nadie dijo nada de piratas!!!\n\nNo dejes que me cojan, $gjefe:jefa;. ¡¡¡Soy demasiado joven para morir!!!"
G["Pit Lord"]="深渊领主"
G["Pitch was weakling anyway... why else you think Goregek not bother with him?"]="匹奇根本构不成威胁嘛……要不然格利基克肯定不会放过他。"
G["Piteous mortal!"]="可悲的凡人！"
G["Pitiful creatures."]="可怜的生物。"
G["Pitiful little creatures! Thundrak will show you no mercy!"]="可怜的小东西们！桑德拉克不会对你们施以丝毫怜悯！"
G["Pitiful meat bags! Feel the full force of the Dragonmaw!"]="可怜的酒囊饭袋！好好看着龙喉的强大力量吧！"
G["Pitiful mortal, Onyxia answers to no one!"]="可悲的凡人，奥妮克希亚不会任凭你摆布的！"
G["Pitiful wretches. You dared to assault Illidan's temple? Very well, I shall make it your death bed!"]="可怜的家伙，你们胆敢进攻伊利丹大人的神殿？好吧，我会让这里变成你们的墓地！"
G["Pitiful!  I will rend the flesh from your bones and wrack your soul for my pleasure!"]="可怜虫！我要让你尝尝粉身碎骨的痛苦！我要毁灭你的灵魂！"
G["Pitiful, predictable mortals... You know not what you have done! The Master's will fulfilled. The Moonglade shall be destroyed and Malfurion along with it!"]="可怜的凡人……你都不知道自己在干什么！主人的愿望已经达成。月光林地和玛法里奥都会被摧毁的！"
G["Pitiful, wingless grubs. You step out into my domain, and I will hear your death screams as you plummet from this terrace!"]="没翅膀的可怜虫也敢踏足我的地盘。我马上就会听见你从平台上摔下去时发出的惨叫！"
G["Pitiful."]="可怜虫。"
G["Pitiful... just pitiful."]="可惜……真是可惜。"
G["Pity, no time for a slow death!"]="真可惜，没时间继续跟你打交道了。"
G["Pity. In death, you no longer dream..."]="可怜。死后你就不能做梦了……"
G["Place 35 Apexis Shards into the prism."]="将35块埃匹希斯碎片放入棱柱中。"
G["Place 35 Apexis Shards near the dragon egg to crack it open."]="将35块埃匹希斯碎片放在龙卵附近使其碎裂。"
G["Place Avruu's Orb on the altar."]="将亚维鲁的宝珠放到祭坛上。"
G["Place Rend's head on the stake."]="将雷德的徽记放到树桩上。"
G["Place Termite Barrel on the crate."]="将装有白蚁的桶放入箱中。"
G["Place a palm across your heart and reach forward with your other hand to touch the infinite. Does it feel soft? NO! It feels... immense."]="把一只手掌放于胸前，伸出另一只手去碰触永恒。心中有种柔软的感觉吗？不！你只感到……广大无边。"
G["Place barricades around Orgrimmar to protect the city!\n\nPick up a barricade from a box scattered around the city\n\nand then place them at a location marked by a red arrow |TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_HUNTER_MARKEDFORDEATH.blp:32|t."]="在奥格瑞玛附近布下路障来保卫城市！\n\n从散落在城市各个角落的箱子里拾取路障\n\n将它们安放在红色箭头|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_HUNTER_MARKEDFORDEATH.blp:32|t所标记的位置。"
G["Place sandbags around Stormwind to ward off flooding!\n\nPick up a sandbag from any sandbag pile located around the city\n\nand place them at a location marked with a red arrow |TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_HUNTER_MARKEDFORDEATH.blp:32|t."]="将沙袋堆砌在暴风城周围，挡住洪水！\n\n从散落在城市各个角落的沙袋堆里背起一个沙袋\n\n将它们放在红色箭头标记的位置|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_HUNTER_MARKEDFORDEATH.blp:32|t。"
G["Place the Jungle Hops directly into the cauldron, $p. No such thing as too much hops!"]="把丛林啤酒花直接丢进大锅里，$p。啤酒花永远不嫌多！"
