G["Place upon it the trappings befitting a herald of Arthas."]="让它穿上阿尔萨斯传令官的服饰。"
G["Place weather breakers around Thunder Bluff to protect the city!\n\nPick up wind breaks in crates around the city\n\nand place them at locations marked with a red arrow |TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_HUNTER_MARKEDFORDEATH.blp:32|t."]="把天气障壁放在雷霆崖周围来保护城市！\n\n从城市周围的箱子里取出防风屏障\n\n将它们安放在红色箭头标出的位置|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_HUNTER_MARKEDFORDEATH.blp:32|t。"
G["Places like Uldaman hold secrets as to the mysteries of my people's past!"]="像奥达曼这样的地方肯定隐藏着关系到我们一族过去的秘密！"
G["Placing"]="放置"
G["Plague batch neutralized!"]="天灾之锅中的东西被中和了！"
G["Plaguebringer, show them the power of the plague!"]="瘟疫使者，让他们见识下瘟疫的力量！"
