G["Play the Dragonmaw drums to call for reinforcements!"]="敲响龙喉战鼓，召唤援军！"
G["Play time!"]="来玩玩吧！"
G["Play with fire and get burned, trespasser."]="Si juegas con fuego, te quemarás, $gintruso:intrusa;."
G["Play with fire, and you might just get burned."]="玩火者，必自焚。"
G["Play!"]="来玩吧！"
G["Players capture control of the North Tower Anti-Air Turret!"]="玩家控制了北部塔楼的防空炮台！"
G["Players capture control of the South Tower Anti-Air Turret!"]="玩家控制了南部塔楼的防空炮台！"
G["Playful Azure Serpent is hungry!"]="顽皮的青色小翔龙饿了！"
G["Playful Azure Serpent licks itself."]="顽皮的青色小翔龙在舔舐自己。"
G["Playful Azure Serpent needs some love!"]="顽皮的青色小翔龙在撒娇！"
G["Playful Azure Serpent plays with its own shadow."]="顽皮的青色小翔龙在和自己的影子嬉戏。"
G["Playful Azure Serpent wants a snack."]="顽皮的青色小翔龙想要吃点心。"
G["Playful Azure Serpent wonders if you have a treat."]="顽皮的青色小翔龙问你有没有东西吃。"
G["Playful Crimson Serpent is bored."]="顽皮的赤红小翔龙觉得很无聊。"
G["Playful Crimson Serpent licks you."]="顽皮的赤红小翔龙舔了舔你。"
G["Playful Crimson Serpent makes a fearsome face."]="顽皮的赤红小翔龙做了个鬼脸。"
G["Playful Crimson Serpent nips at you experimentally."]="顽皮的赤红小翔龙试探着咬了咬你。"
G["Playful Crimson Serpent roars with vigor."]="顽皮的赤红小翔龙兴奋地大叫。"
G["Playful Emerald Serpent is sleepy."]="顽皮的翡翠小翔龙开始昏昏欲睡。"
G["Playful Emerald Serpent looks around curiously."]="顽皮的翡翠小翔龙好奇地环顾四周。"
G["Playful Emerald Serpent sniffs you."]="顽皮的翡翠小翔龙嗅了嗅你。"
G["Playful Emerald Serpent tries to eat your hair, and then spits it out. Yuck!"]="顽皮的翡翠小翔龙想要吃你的头发，可马上又吐了出来。呃！"
G["Playful Emerald Serpent tumbles through the air."]="顽皮的翡翠小翔龙在空中打滚。"
G["Playful Emerald Serpent wants to play a game!"]="顽皮的翡翠小翔龙想要玩游戏！"
G["Playful Gold Serpent chases its own tail."]="顽皮的金色小翔龙在追咬自己的尾巴。"
G["Playful Gold Serpent licks you."]="顽皮的金色小翔龙舔了舔你。"
G["Playful Gold Serpent makes a fancy flip."]="顽皮的金色小翔龙翻了个漂亮的筋斗。"
G["Playful Gold Serpent nips at you playfully."]="顽皮的金色小翔龙淘气地咬了咬你。"
G["Playful Gold Serpent pounces at the air."]="顽皮的金色小翔龙直冲云霄。"
G["Playful Gold Serpent rubs affectionately against your arm."]="顽皮的金色小翔龙亲昵地挨擦着你的胳膊。"
G["Playful Gold Serpent wants to be petted."]="顽皮的金色小翔龙在向你撒娇。"
G["Playing hard to get today, I see.... Very well, perhaps I'll find you in a better mood later."]="好吧，你这个矫情的家伙……待会等你心情好些了，我再来找你吧。"
G["Playing possum is super easy, $n.  Just watch...."]="装死是一件超级容易的事，$n。你来看……"
G["Pleaase! Someone save poor ol' Tanzar."]="救命！谁来救救可怜的坦扎尔！"
G["Please $c, don't encourage Gorgal. We're supposed to observe and report - not raise up a ruckus."]="$c，请不要刺激格高。我们应该做的是观察和报告情况，而不是引起一场骚乱。"
G["Please - don't hurt us! Vol'jin is welcome to quarter his revolutionaries here."]="拜托——别伤害我们！我们完全欢迎沃金把起义军驻扎在这里。"
G["Please - don't make me do this."]="不——不要逼我。"
G["Please accept this humble offering, oh great one..."]="主人，请接受这谦卑的祭品……"
G["Please accept this payment, as well as my gratitude, for your trouble."]="请收下这点微不足道的报酬，接受我的谢意吧。"
G["Please allow me a few seconds of rest."]="请让我休息一小会。"
G["Please allow me to browse your wares, Daedal."]="请让我看看你的货物，丹达尔。"
G["Please allow us a chance to prove our friendship. We wish you no harm."]="请给我们一个机会来证明我们的友谊。我们不会伤害你们的。"
G["Please be careful."]="请小心。"
G["Please be more careful, $n. This relic was created by the Earthen Ring, and it is our gift to you."]="请一定更加小心，$n。这件宝物是由大地之环所创造的。它是我们赠予你的礼物。"
G["Please be patient, the tour guide should be here any moment now..."]="耐心点，向导随时可能出现……"
G["Please be patient, we will call your name when it is your turn. We are helping people in the order they appear to us on our screen."]="耐心点，轮到你的时候我们会叫你的。我们会依照屏幕显示的顺序帮助你们的。"
G["Please be patient, we will call your name when it is your turn. We are helping people in the order they appear to us on our screen. $n!"]="请耐心一点，轮到您的时候我们会通知您的。谢谢您的支持，$n！"
G["Please bless and protect them, and grant them success over those who seek to do us harm..."]="请为他们祝福，请保护他们吧，请赐予他们成功，凌驾于那些想伤害我们的人……"
G["Please bring him back safely. He is young, but clever. He can help you find your way."]="请把他安全地带回来。他还年轻，但很聪明。他能为你们带路。"
G["Please cast a high priority BUFF spell on all nearby targets."]="请为附近所有的目标施放高级的增益法术。"
G["Please cast a high priority DEBUFF spell on all nearby targets."]="请为附近所有的目标施放高级的减效法术。"
G["Please champions, rescue my brethren from the Twilight's Hammer!"]="勇士们，求求你们，请从暮光之锤的手中救出我的兄弟吧！"
G["Please come down, Fish. It isn't safe up there."]="快下来吧，玉儿。那上面不安全。"
G["Please come enjoy my fine Golden Dragon Noodles."]="来尝尝我精心烹制的金龙面吧。"
G["Please consider joining our cause!"]="请考虑一下我们的提议吧！"
G["Please continue, Bodley."]="请继续，伯德雷。"
G["Please continue, Hero..."]="请继续，英雄……"
G["Please continue, Zamael."]="萨麦尔，请继续。"
G["Please continue."]="请继续说下去。"
G["Please do as I instruct you, $n."]="请按照我教你的那样做，$n。"
G["Please do."]="请继续。"
G["Please don't beat me!"]="请不要打我！"
G["Please don't break... please don't break...."]="别断……千万别断……"
G["Please don't go back there!"]="请不要再聚集在这里！"
G["Please don't ignore us..."]="请不要视而不见……"
G["Please don't leave us!"]="别丢下我们！"
G["Please don't tell my parents I was here."]="千万别告诉我爸妈我来过这里。"
G["Please don't tell the Warlord..."]="请别让督军知道……"
G["Please enjoy the rest of your time at the Faire. Or did you want another round...?"]="祝你在马戏团玩得愉快。或者你还想再来一局……？"
G["Please enjoy their company, the Lich King sends his regards!"]="让他们陪伴你吧，巫妖王向你致意！"
G["Please excuse me while I begin my tests..."]="在我开始测试的时候拜托离我远点……"
G["Please excuse me, Greatmother. I will return soon."]="请原谅，祖母。我很快就回来。"
G["Please explain how the scepter works."]="请解释一下怎么使用节杖。"
G["Please feel free to browse the items up for bid, or if you would like to list an item, I can help."]="请随意浏览这里的拍品。如果你有东西要拍卖的话，我也可以帮你办理。"
G["Please fly me to Kypari Zar."]="请带我飞到凯帕圣树·扎尔去。"
G["Please fly me to Zan'vess."]="请带我飞到扎尼维斯去。"
G["Please fly me to the Clutches of Shek'zeer"]="请带我飞到夏柯希尔之巢"
G["Please fly me to the Terrace of Gurthan."]="请带我飞向格尔桑平台。"
G["Please grandchildren, can you remove this thorn?  I cannot do so on my own."]="孩子们，你们能帮我拔掉这根刺吗？我对此无能为力。"
G["Please help me!"]="请救救我！"
G["Please help me! I'm the last member of my family left. Everyone else has been kidnapped!"]="快帮帮我！我全家只剩我一个了。其它人都被劫走了！"
G["Please help us! The Prince has gone mad!"]="请帮帮我们！王子发狂了！"
G["Please heroes, help my brothers and we shall assist you!"]="拜托了英雄们，求你们帮帮我的同胞，我们会帮助你们的！"
G["Please hold still for a moment."]="请坚持一段时间不要动。"
G["Please hurry!  I must stay and tend to the wounded."]="请抓紧时间！我必须留下照顾伤患。"
G["Please hurry, $n. I am in a great deal of pain and time is running out."]="请你快一点，$n。我承受着莫大的痛苦，时间已经不多了。"
G["Please hurry. I want to get going."]="请抓紧时间。我想出发了。"
G["Please insert 25 silver pieces and try again."]="请投入25银币，然后再试一次。"
G["Please insert coins and then proceed to deal with the Trade Prince."]="请插入硬币，然后继续同贸易大王做交易。"
G["Please insert coins into ship in order to move away from exploding island."]="请把硬币插入船里，以驶离爆炸的岛屿。"
G["Please insert coins."]="请投入硬币。"
G["Please insert vegetation......"]="请放入植物……"
G["Please leave me to my sadness."]="请让我一个人独自伤心流泪。"
G["Please leave the cage door closed.  Thanks."]="请把笼门关上。谢谢。"
G["Please let me know if you need anything else!"]="要是你们还有什么需要的话，直接和我说！"
G["Please let someone else have a turn, Lunk."]="隆克，让其他人也玩玩吧。"
G["Please loan me that spyglass."]="望远镜借我用一下。"
G["Please no whip me! Me help Horde!"]="噢别打我！我愿意帮助部落！"
G["Please port me to Darnassus."]="请把我传送到达纳苏斯。"
G["Please remember that not all of your allies in Pandaria will be won over by sword point."]="请记住，在潘达利亚，不是所有的盟友都必须用刀剑来赢得的。"
G["Please repair my items."]="请修理一下我的物品吧。"
G["Please reset the chess board, we would like to play again."]="请重置棋盘，我们想再玩一次。"
G["Please respect the laws of Dalaran while you are here, stranger.\n\nWere you lost? Is there something I might help you find?"]="Por favor, respeta las leyes de Dalaran mientras estés aquí, $gforastero:forastera;.\n\n¿Te has perdido? ¿Puedo ayudarte a encontrar algo?"
G["Please rest while you are here, $n. I hope the Vale brings you much peace and happiness."]="请在此处休息，$n。我希望山谷会带给你和平与欢乐。"
G["Please return to Zoram'gar and report our success to the Warsong Runner."]="请回到佐拉姆加前哨站，向战歌信使汇报我们的成功。"
G["Please return to your places!"]="请回到原位上去！"
G["Please save me!"]="请救救我！"
G["Please send me into the Emerald Dream to recover the acorns. I know of the danger and I do not fear it."]="请送我去翡翠梦境寻找橡果。我知道这很危险，但是我不怕。"
G["Please share your wisdom with me, Warchief."]="战争之王，请将你的智慧与我共享。"
G["Please show me the Stone of Maraudon."]="请让我看看玛拉顿的石头。"
G["Please show me your documents before proceeding."]="请先让我看看你的公文。"
G["Please show me, Chromie."]="请让我看吧，克罗米。"
G["Please speak with Sentinel Onaeya at Maestra's Post in Ashenvale, she will see to it that you are properly rewarded for your bravery this day."]="跟灰谷梅伊瑟娜岗哨的哨兵奥奈雅谈谈，她将为你今天的勇敢行为给予相应的回报。"
G["Please stay out of the gaming area."]="请离开游戏场地。"
G["Please stop."]="请停下。"
G["Please take care of Kasha. Make sure she finds a cold place to live."]="请照顾卡莎。一定要让她生活在够冷的地方。"
G["Please take care, $n.\nThe August Celestials will not tolerate aggression between the Alliance and Horde here."]="Ten cuidado, $n.\n\nLos Augustos Celestiales no tolerarán agresiones entre la Alianza y la Horda."
G["Please take dis. Norkani be havin' no use for it."]="请拿着这个，洛尔卡尼不再需要这个了。"
G["Please take me off of your guest list."]="请把我从你的客人名单里划去。"
G["Please take me to the master's lair."]="请带我去主人的巢穴。"
G["Please take one of these leaflets and consider joining our cause!"]="请收下这份传单，考虑一下我们的提议吧！"
G["Please take... my shinies. All done..."]="请收下……我亮闪闪的财宝。结束了……"
G["Please teach me how to become a hammersmith, Lilith."]="请告诉我如何成为一名铸锤师，莉莉丝。"
G["Please teach me how to become a swordsmith, Seril."]="请告诉我如何成为一名铸剑师，瑟里尔。"
G["Please teach me how to become an axesmith, Kilram."]="请告诉我如何成为一名铸斧师，基尔拉姆。"
G["Please teach me how to fish, Diktynna."]="请教我如何钓鱼，迪泰娜。"
G["Please teach me how to skin, Gurf."]="请教我如何剥皮，古尔弗。"
G["Please teach me."]="请教教我吧。"
G["Please teleport me to the final chamber."]="请将我传送到最终密室前。"
G["Please tell Guvan that I'll be fine, thanks to you."]="请告诉古安我没事的，谢谢你。"
G["Please tell me Hanae is safe!"]="告诉我，韩妮没事，对吧？！"
G["Please tell me about Zhu's legacy."]="请你告诉我与朱的遗产有关的事吧。"
G["Please tell me more about Maraudon."]="告诉我关于玛拉顿的更多信息。"
G["Please tell me more about Zaetar."]="告诉我关于扎尔塔的更多信息。"
G["Please tell me more about the Gordunni ogres."]="请告诉我更多关于戈杜尼食人魔的信息。"
G["Please tell me more about the hippogryphs."]="请告诉我更多关于角鹰兽的信息。"
G["Please tell me that you didn't just do what I think you just did. Please tell me that I'm not going to have to hurt you..."]="请告诉我你没有做那件我认为你刚刚做了的事情。请告诉我……我不必对你动手……"
G["Please tell us this: Who or what is Cyrukh?"]="请告诉我们：森卢肯是谁，或者说，是什么？"
G["Please to be quiet! Pups asleeping!"]="安静！孩子们在睡觉！"
G["Please train me."]="请训练我吧。"
G["Please transport me to the Guardian's Library."]="请把我传送到守护者的图书馆去吧。"
G["Please transport me to the bottom."]="请把我传送到底部。"
G["Please transport me to the top."]="请把我传送到顶部。"
G["Please try my Harmonious River Noodles. They will not disappoint."]="请来尝尝我的杂烩河鲜面吧，绝对不会让你失望。"
G["Please unlock the courtyard door."]="请打开庭院的大门。"
G["Please wait a moment."]="请稍后。"
G["Please wait while I attempt to bind the shards together so that they will be whole once again."]="我尝试把碎片复合，以使他们能再次成为一个整体，在这期间请你耐心等待。"
G["Please!  $n!  Destroy me!"]="求你！$n！杀了我吧！"
G["Please!  I must feed on something soon... A mana crystal.... a shard... anything!  The pain is unbearable!"]="可怜可怜我吧！我必须马上吃点东西……一块魔力水晶……一块碎片……任何东西都行！我实在无法忍受这种痛苦了！"
G["Please!  Stop the burning!"]="天哪！快灭火！"
G["Please! Can you help me! These sprites grabbed me when I was searching for some of our missing yaks."]="拜托了！你能帮帮我吗？这些树精在我寻找走失的牦牛时绑架了我。"
G["Please! Free the others from their Nets!"]="拜托！把其他人也放出来！"
G["Please! No more. I can't handle any more of this!"]="求你了！我真的……我真的受不了了！"
G["Please! Someone! Anyone! Help me get out of here!"]="有人吗？救命！请把我救出去！"
G["Please! Spare me! I..."]="求你饶命！我……"
G["Please, $c, drive them out of Kun-Lai for good."]="拜托了，$c，将他们彻底赶离昆莱山。"
G["Please, $g mister : ma'am;..\n\nWill you get me out of here?"]="Por favor.\n\nsáqueme de aquí."
G["Please, $g sir:madam;, I have three hungry children! Did I say three? TEN HUNGRY CHILDREN!"]="帮帮忙吧，$g先生:女士;,我有三个孩子等着吃饭呢！我说的是三个？不对，我有个十个饥饿的孩子等着吃饭呢！"
G["Please, $n.  You must take the Heart of Fury somewhere safe... you must take it to A'dal!"]="$n，你必须把愤怒之心带到安全的地方去……你必须把它交给阿达尔！"
G["Please, $p, do not tell Garrosh what we have done here today. I must make some weighty decisions before confronting him directly."]="$p，请不要让加尔鲁什知道今天发生在这里的一切。在和他直接对抗之前，我还有一些非常重要的事情需要思考。"
G["Please, $p, keep me awake! If we fall asleep, all productivity comes to a halt."]="¡Mantenme despierto, $n! Si nos dormimos, la productividad cae en picado."
G["Please, $r, get me out of here! Unlocking the cage will surely attract my brother's attention. Kill Darkweaver Syth!"]="$r，请带我逃走吧！打开笼子就会引起我哥哥的注意。杀掉黑暗编织者塞斯！"
G["Please, $r.\n\nI don't know how much longer I can make it here..."]="拜托了，$r。\n\n我不知道自己还能在这儿撑多久……"
G["Please, $r.\n\nRelease me..."]="求求你，$r。\n\n让我解脱吧……"
G["Please, $r...\n\nLeave nothing for the Scourge to raise!"]="求求你，$r……\n\n我不想被天灾军团复活！"
G["Please, I beg you."]="拜托，求你了。"
G["Please, I just need a little.  A finger or an ear will do..."]="吃一点点就够了。一根手指或是一只耳朵就行……"
G["Please, I must focus. This process is very intensive, and many innocent lives are depending on us."]="我必须集中精神，许多无辜的生命要靠我们去挽救。"
G["Please, I'm just a delivery man!"]="我只是个送货的！"
G["Please, Mankrik. Let go. Set down your blade."]="求求你，曼科里克。放手吧，放下你的剑。"
G["Please, Yi-Mo: your aunt's worried sick about you."]="拜托了，易默，你的阿姨很担心你。"
G["Please, a moment, $n. Kindal is down below in the Grimtotem camp trying to free the faerie dragons from captivity. We were just lucky that help came along when it did. Who knows what those foul tauren would have done to them."]="请等一下，$n。辛达尔在想办法把精灵龙从恐怖图腾营地中救出来。我们正巧路过这里，谁知道那些邪恶的牛头人对它们做了些什么。"
G["Please, accept the ancestors blessing. It is not much, but it is all I can give without my staff, and will help you traverse the Mere."]="请接受先祖的祝福吧。尽管微不足道，但没有法杖我能给你的就只有这些，它将助你渡过墨鳃潭。"
G["Please, as a favor to a friend... tell me the truth about my outfit. Is it... awful?"]="拜托，作为朋友……实话告诉我，我的衣服怎么样？真有那么……糟吗？"
G["Please, as a favor to a good friend... tell me the truth about my outfit. Is it... horrible?"]="拜托，作为好朋友……实话告诉我，我的衣服怎么样？真有那么……难看吗？"
G["Please, as a favor to your best friend... tell me the truth about my outfit. How is it?\n\nOh? Wonderful you say? Why thank you! This is why you're my friend for life!"]="A modo de favor para tu mejor amiga... dime la verdad sobre mi conjunto. ¿Cómo es?\n\n¿Eh? ¿Precioso, dices? ¡Vaya, gracias! ¡Por eso serás mi $gamigo:amiga; de por vida!"
G["Please, captain, I can put box down?"]="拜托了，船长，我能把箱子放下吗？"
G["Please, carry out our vengeance on the Scourgelord."]="拜托了，为我们向天灾领主报仇。"
G["Please, champion, protect our people."]="勇士，请保护我们的人民吧！"
G["Please, come down. How am I ever going to explain this to the rest of the Tillers?"]="拜托，快下来吧。你让我怎么去跟其他阡陌客交代啊？"
G["Please, continue your report."]="请继续你的报告。"
G["Please, delicious animal, you come with Martar?"]="拜托，美味的小动物，跟马尔泰走吧？"
G["Please, do not bother me... Your kind is all the same..."]="请不要打扰我……你们这种人都一样……"
G["Please, don't bring your battle here. We have no part in it!"]="拜托，别把战火引到这里来。这跟我们毫无干系！"
G["Please, don't cry. What happened next?"]="先别哭。然后呢？"
G["Please, don't say anything to me. I don't want to get into any more trouble with them."]="请不要对我说任何事，我不想再介入他们的麻烦之中。"
G["Please, father, I do not have your strength. I cannot do this on my own. Please help me..."]="父亲，求你了。我没有你的力量。我一个人做不到。请帮帮我……"
G["Please, feel free to speak to me anytime, $n. You have served Magatha well. I am sure she will call upon you in the future."]="你随时都可以跟我交谈，$n。你对玛加萨忠心耿耿。我想将来她会召见你的。"
G["Please, find me in the Cave of Words, just up the hill here, when you have time to speak!"]="等你有空的时候，请到这座山上的千言洞来找我！"
G["Please, find my babies!"]="求求你，找到我的孩子们！"
G["Please, follow me, $n. There is much for you to see...."]="请跟我来，$n。有很多东西要给你看……"
G["Please, follow me."]="请跟着我。"
G["Please, friends, accept this offering with Kraz's thanks."]="拜托你，朋友，收下这个吧，带着我克拉斯的感激一并收下吧。"
G["Please, go on."]="请继续。"
G["Please, help me $g brother : sister;...\n\nI will soon pass from this world, and though I suffer I know I shall not any more once I pass.  The wildlife though, my $g brother : sister;... the wildlife suffers too, and it knows no release.  I ask for your aid with my last breaths of life."]="我的$g兄弟:姐妹;帮帮我吧……\n\n我很快就将离开这个世界了，虽然我饱受苦楚，但是我知道死了之后所有痛苦都将解除。但是，那些野生生物，我的$g兄弟:姐妹;……也历经折磨，永无止境。在我生命的最后一刻，我请求你的帮助。"
G["Please, help me to get through this cursed forest, $r."]="请帮助我穿越这片被诅咒的森林，$r。"
G["Please, help me! They're going to kill me!"]="请帮帮我！他们要杀我！"
G["Please, it's not my fault! If... if I give you a refund, maybe you can speak to a healer? I don't know what you expect me to do!"]="根本不关我的事啊！要不……要不我赔偿啊，就诊的钱我来出？你们到底要我怎么样！"
G["Please, just go! You are making her angry."]="请走吧！你们激怒她了。"
G["Please, just make it all stop!"]="拜托了，快阻止这一切吧！"
G["Please, keep away the distractions.  I need to concentrate on this."]="别让我分心。我得集中精神。"
G["Please, keep your voice down, $r. Hamat is old and needs her rest."]="请你小点声，$r。哈玛特老了，她需要休息。"
G["Please, keep your voice low, $r. I was sent here by Baine Bloodhoof to keep an eye on events in the Vale."]="拜托你小声点，$r。是贝恩·血蹄派我来监视锦绣谷动向的。"
G["Please, leave an old spirit in peace."]="请不要打扰古老的灵魂。"
G["Please, leave this place, $n. You know nothing of what troubles us..."]="请离开这个地方，$n。你对困扰我们的问题毫不知情……"
G["Please, let me out of here!"]="求你了，带我离开这里！"
G["Please, let us go!"]="求你，放过我们！"
G["Please, let us remain civil while we are guests in this town. I suspect our hosts will not react kindly to bloodshed."]="拜托，既然我们是村里的客人，就守规矩些。要是我们大开杀戒，主人们恐怕不会善罢甘休。"
G["Please, light this while I am channeling."]="请在我吟唱的时候点亮这个。"
G["Please, lower your voice. It isn't wise to remind Lady Proudmoore of the sorts of things we study.\nNow, shall we speak of TRUE power...?"]="Por favor, baja la voz. No es muy sabio recordar a Lady Valiente el tipo de cosas que estudiamos aquí.\n\\Y bien, ¿hablamos de poder VERDADERO...?"
G["Please, mortal, seek out Magister Hathorel in Dalaran. He might be able to negotiate with the Silver Covenant for access to the book."]="拜托你了，凡人，在达拉然找到魔导师哈瑟尔。他可能有办法和银色盟约进行交涉，让你看一看那本书。"
G["Please, mortal, speak with Arcanist Tybalin in Dalaran. He may be able to negotiate with the Sunreavers for access to the book."]="拜托你了，凡人，同达拉然的奥术师泰拜林谈一谈。他可能有办法和夺日者进行交涉，让你看一看那本书。"
G["Please, no kill when Lunk is around."]="请不要在隆克身边杀戮。"
G["Please, no more! I just need to rest for a moment!"]="请停下来吧！我只是需要休息一会儿！"
G["Please, no more! My son... he's gone mad!"]="求求你们，不要这样！我的儿子……已经疯了！"
G["Please, no more."]="求求你，住手。"
G["Please, no more... I hurt all over... sniff..."]="求你，别打啦……我全身都疼……"
G["Please, no! Spare me!"]="等等！我要坚持下去！"
G["Please, not now. Speak with Edrem. He can show you what you need to know."]="现在还不是时候呢，你先和埃德雷姆谈谈吧。他会教给你关于锻造的基础知识的。"
G["Please, partake in the buffet laid out by the Golden Lotus as a thanks to your people for their aid in protecting the Vale of Eternal Blossoms."]="为了答谢你们为保护锦绣谷所做的贡献，金莲教将举办一场盛大的宴会。请你务必要来参加。"
