G["Please, remember what we have shown you..."]="记住我们向你展示的……"
G["Please, return to your homes."]="请大家回家去吧。"
G["Please, rise my friend.  Keep the Blessing as a symbol of the strength of the Light and how heroes long gone might once again rise in each of us to inspire."]="Por favor, ponte en pie, $gamigo:amiga;. Guarda la bendición como un símbolo de la fuerza de la Luz y de cómo los héroes de antaño podrían volver a alzarse para inspirarnos a cada uno de nosotros."
G["Please, sit and make yourself comfortable."]="Siéntate y ponte $gcómodo:cómoda;."
G["Please, stay back, stronger. I want no fight."]="求你，退后，强者。我不想打仗。"
G["Please, take the crate. I'm already thinking about what I'll find in the tower's library!"]="这是箱子，请拿好。我已经开始想象，自己能在塔里的图书馆发现些什么了！"
G["Please, tell me more of this artifact, Highlord Mograine."]="请告诉我更多有关这件神器的事，大领主莫格莱尼。"
G["Please, tell me more."]="请再多告诉我一些。"
G["Please, try and be sensitive to an orc's condition.  I'm having a rough couple of days, and I'd prefer if you kept your comments to yourself."]="Por favor, sé comprensivo con el sufrimiento de un orco. Estoy teniendo un par de días muy malos y preferiría que te guardes tus comentarios para ti $gmismo:misma;."
G["Please, would you get me out of here?"]="拜托，你能帮我离开这儿吗？"
G["Please, you MUST keep them out of the general's hands! I will return to the Vale of Eternal Blossoms and report to the Golden Lotus. Again, many thanks!"]="拜托了，一定不能让它们落入将军的手里！我要返回锦绣谷向金莲报告。再次感谢！"
G["Please, young prince. Take this lesson to heart."]="年轻的王子，请记住这一课。"
G["Please."]="拜托。"
