G["Please. Show Razia your weak little concoctions if you must. Return to me when you can handle more... potent fare."]="拜托。如果你一定要这么做的话，还是让拉斯亚来看看你做出的劣等药剂吧。等你能制作……更有效力的药剂之后，再回来找我。"
G["Please. We are staging a relief effort at Westreach Summit. Thousand Needles has been decimated!"]="拜托了。我们正在西岸峰展开救援工作。千针石林已经消亡了！"
G["Please... Is Kil'jaeden red?"]="告……告诉我……基尔加丹是红色的吗？"
G["Please... Kill... Me..."]="杀了……我……吧……"
G["Please... Make it stop."]="拜托……阻止这一切吧。"
G["Please... all our orders come from Naxxanar... me and my men are kept in the dark!"]="求你了……我们只是执行来自纳克萨纳尔的命令啊……我和我的手下都被蒙在鼓里了！"
G["Please... burn my remains. Let me live warm in the afterlife..."]="请……将我火化。让我在死后得到温暖……"
G["Please... don't encourage him."]="Por favor... no lo alientes."
G["Please... help...\nThe Headless Horseman... must be stopped...\nHe has slain so many... and yet rides out for more victims with every rising moon!"]="...por favor, ayuda...\n\n...El Jinete decapitado...debe ser detenido...\n\n...¡Ha matado a tantos! Y, sin embargo, en cuanto sale la luna sigue cabalgando en busca de nuevas víctimas."
G["Please... help...."]="请……帮帮我们……"
G["Please... kill... me..."]="请……杀死……我……"
G["Please... please... Miss Proudmore. I didn't mean to..."]="求求你了……普罗德摩尔小姐。我并不是想要……"
