G["Plentiful, exploitable resources... primed for acquisition!"]="采之不尽，用之不竭的资源……我必须要得到它！"
G["Plenty of good mining to be had in Durotar, or so I hear.  So good in fact that we have a Mining Trainer right here in Razor Hill.  You'll find Krunn next to the heated forge in the northwest corner of town."]="我听说杜隆塔尔的采矿业极为发达。我们在剃刀岭有一个采矿训练师，你可以去城镇西北角的大熔炉附近寻找克鲁恩。"
G["Plenty of stone, aye. But no sign of major ore veins in this whole area."]="大量的石头。但这里没有发现大型铁矿。"
G["Plot revenue minus supply expenditures against the elasticity of demand, considering assets and liabilities inflected across the regression quotient....oh hi! How are you?"]="计划收入减去弹性需求的供给支出，考虑到衰减函数中的资产和负债曲线……哦，嗨！你好啊？"
G["Plucked ripe off the vine."]="新鲜的尸体。"
G["Plucky doesn't want Tirth to know he's still in the Shimmering Flats, so he turned himself into a chicken!\n\nIf you find Plucky, beckon him to you.  Maybe he'll come out of hiding."]="约翰森不想让提尔斯知道他还在闪光平原，所以他把自己变成了一只小鸡！\n\n如果你找到约翰森，就冲他招招手。没准他会跑过来的。"
G["Plucky?  I heard race master Kronkrider up on the the tower knows where he is."]="胆大的约翰森？我听说塔顶的赛场主管科鲁克莱德知道他在哪儿。"
G["Point out the pools of corruption, and I will use my staff to cleanse them. You'll need to defeat the creatures that emerge!"]="指出腐蚀之池，我会用法杖净化它们。你要打败出现的怪物！"
