G["Practicing!  Soon I'll be good enough to join the other summoners and take my turn inside the Shadow Labyrinth at Auchindoun.\n\nI hope that I'll get the chance to summon something big!  Maybe something as big as Murmur, though I wouldn't lose control of him!"]="加紧练习！很快我就会有足够的能力跟其他召唤者一起进入奥金顿的暗影迷宫了。\n\n我希望能得到召唤一些大东西的机会！也许是和摩摩尔一样大的家伙，但是我不会失去对他的控制！"
G["Praise Elune! I don't know if I could have survived the day without you, friend."]="¡Alabada sea Elune! No sé si habría acabado el día con vida si no fuera por ti, $gamigo:amiga;."
G["Praise Elune! It has been many years since I have had visitors."]="赞美艾露恩！好些年都没有人来拜访我了。"
G["Praise be to Egan!"]="赞美埃根！"
G["Praise be to Elune... Eranikus is redeemed."]="赞美艾露恩……伊兰尼库斯被拯救了。"
G["Praise the Light!"]="赞美圣光！"
G["Praise the Light, one has finally answered the calling."]="赞美圣光，终于有人对召唤做出了回应。"
G["Praise the Titans, they have returned!"]="赞美泰坦，他们回来了！"
G["Praise the naaru, I'm saved.  I will try to make it clear on my own."]="感谢纳鲁，我得救了。我会照顾好自己的。"
G["Praise to the Light, $gbrother:sister; $n! Let's take a look here..."]="赞美圣光，$n$g兄弟:姐妹;！让我们好好看看……"
G["Pray Skrotee... Find religion... Because if we ever get out of here, you will be wishing you were back in here!"]="祈祷吧，斯克罗提……找回你的信仰……否则就算我们有机会逃走，你也会盼望着回来的！"
G["Pray for mercy!"]="祈祷我的慈悲吧！"
G["Pray that the chilling embrace of Teron Gorefiend does not reach out for you..."]="但愿你没有落入塔隆·血魔冰冷的怀抱……"
G["Pray to whatever gods you believe in that I am never freed!"]="你最好祈祷我永远也出不来！"
G["Pray to your gods for a quick death."]="赶快向你们的诸神祈祷，企求速死吧。"
G["Pray to your gods, shaman. Perhaps they will come to your aid. The Horde, however, cannot..."]="向你的神祈祷吧，萨满祭司。也许他们会来帮助你的。然而部落是不可能……"
G["Precious life--ra-aak--wasted!"]="宝贵的生命……呱呱……浪费了！"
G["Precisely how to do it, $n!"]="简直无懈可击，$n！"
G["Precisely!"]="没错！"
G["Precisely."]="非常精确。"
G["Predictable. Fall back behind the lines - let them come!"]="如我所料。退回防线——让他们过来！"
