G["Prepare your men. The Gilneas Liberation Front amasses at the Greymane Wall. Soon their reinforcements from Stormwind will arrive. We haven't a minute to waste."]="让你的部队做好准备。吉尔尼斯解放阵线正在格雷迈恩之墙集结。他们的援军很快也会从暴风城赶到。我们不能再浪费任何一分钟了。"
G["Prepare your weapons, men!"]="弟兄们，准备好你们的武器！"
G["Prepare yourself for eternal torture, mortal!"]="准备接受无尽的折磨吧，凡人！"
G["Prepare yourself for the end."]="准备迎接你的末日吧。"
G["Prepare yourself for the most difficult illusions. Defeat them before time expires, and success will be yours."]="准备迎接最强大的幻影吧。在时间用尽前击败他们，你就胜利了。"
G["Prepare yourself!"]="做好准备吧！"
G["Prepare yourself! Saurok raiders approach!"]="作好准备！蜥蜴人突袭者来了！"
G["Prepare yourself! The acolyte of water is soon to come..."]="准备好！水之侍僧很快就要来了……"
G["Prepare yourself, $n.\n\nWe'll be entering a target-rich environment!"]="做好准备，$n。\n\n我们即将进入危机四伏的环境！"
