G["Prepare yourselves, for we will soon launch an assault against they who called themselves \"The Forsaken.\""]="Preparaos, porque pronto emprenderemos un asalto contra los que se hacen llamar \"los Renegados.\""
G["Prepare yourselves, the bells have tolled! Shelter your weak, your young and your old! Each of you shall pay the final sum. Cry for mercy, the reckoning has come!"]="战栗吧，丧钟已为你鸣响！颤抖吧，挽歌已为你宣唱！末日审判已潸然降临，所有生者都要付出代价！"
G["Prepare yourselves.  Silverwing is just around the bend."]="准备好了。银翼正在发狂呢。"
