G["Present your challenge."]="发起挑战吧。"
G["Present?"]="礼物？"
G["Presenting the fierce Grand Champion of Orgrimmar, Mokra the Skullcrusher!"]="现在请注意，强大的奥格瑞姆总冠军，碎颅者莫克拉出场！"
