G["Prison guards, we are leaving! These adventurers are taking over! Go go go!"]="监狱守卫们，准备撤退了！这些冒险者将接管这里的防御事务！迅速撤离！"
G["Prison taught me one very important lesson, well, two if you count how to hold your soap, but yes! SURVIVAL!"]="监狱生活给我上了一堂很重要的课，如果算上要把肥皂捏稳那就是两堂，是的！生存第一！"
G["Private Reginald Pollard, 13th brigade, Stormwind infantry... $gsir:ma'am;."]="列兵霍金纳多·伯纳德，暴风城步兵团第十三编队……$g阁下:女士;。"
G["Private Thorsen returning from patrol.  Nothing new to report - it's pretty quiet out there..."]="列兵索尔森巡逻归来。没有新的情况要报告——今天特别地平静……"
G["Private Weeks, I need another disguise."]="列兵维克斯，我还需要一个伪装。"
G["Private, show Lieutenant Reethe some mercy."]="士兵，别对雷瑟中尉太狠了。"
G["Privates Fontane, MacDugal, Wilcott..."]="弗塔恩，马克杜加，维尔考特……"
G["Privates Horus, Tilling, Rockwell..."]="赫鲁斯，提林，洛克威尔……"
