G["Prizes!  Get your prizes right here!  Get over here and turn in your Darkmoon Prize Tickets for valuable prizes!"]="奖品！到这儿来领取奖品啦！快来用暗月马戏团奖券兑换丰厚的奖品吧！"
G["Probability of successful repair by ordinary means available in this world is close to nil. Please hold while theoretical means are analyzed."]="通过这个世界上实际存在的常规手段修复瓦兰奈尔的可能性趋近于零。正在分析理论上可能存在的修复方式，请稍候。"
G["Proceed by foot. We'll circle around and look for another entrance."]="徒步前进。我们到四周找找其他入口。"
G["Proceed."]="出发。"
G["Production professions allow you to turn raw materials into items that you can use yourself, give to companions, or sell at an auction house.\nThey are often paired with a gathering profession so that you can gather your own raw materials, but it is possible to simply buy materials on the auction house."]="Las profesiones de producción te permiten transformar materias primas en objetos que puedes usar, dar a tus amigos o vender en la casa de subastas.\n\nSe suelen compaginar con profesiones de recolección, para poder recoger tus propias materias primas, pero también se pueden comprar los materiales en la casa de subastas."
G["Productivity stops if we're attacked. Keep an eye on us!"]="如果遭到进攻，生产就会停止。记得帮我们防守基地！"
G["Profession Trainer"]="专业训练师"
G["Profession vendors can always be found near their respective trainers. Other sorts of vendors are scattered throughout Stormwind.\n\nWhat were you looking for?"]="专业技能供应商总是待在对应的专业技能训练师附近。其它商贩则遍布暴风城的各个角落。\n\n你要买什么？"
G["Professor Putricide cast |cFF00FF00Malleable Goo!|r"]="普崔塞德教授施放了|cFF00FF00可延展黏液！|r"
G["Professor Putricide has removed your mutation!"]="普崔塞德教授驱散了你身上的变异效果！"
G["Profit!"]="利益！"
G["Progeny of Aegwynn, he that would be the last Guardian of Tirisfal... Medivh."]="艾格文的唯一子嗣，最后一任提瑞斯法的守护者……麦迪文。"
G["Prognosis: Negative!"]="手下留情？不行！"
G["Progress is going swimmingly, friend. You should focus on maintaining what you've done."]="Progresamos estupendamente, $gamigo:amiga;. Céntrate en seguir así."
G["Promise me you will keep out of trouble while I am away?"]="答应我，我不在时，你可不要惹麻烦啊。"
G["Promise me you'll find him, $n."]="向我保证，你一定会找到他，$n。"
G["Promised One, do you remember us? Do you recall the prophecy of Kurz? This moment was pre-ordained. You have done what you were put on this world to do.\n\n<High Chief Stillpine bows before you.>\n\nDraenei will always be welcome among my people."]="$gPrometido:Prometida;, ¿nos recuerdas? ¿Recuerdas la profecía de Kurz? Este momento ya estaba dispuesto. Has hecho aquello para que lo viniste a este mundo.\n\n<El gran jefe Semprepino se inclina ante ti.>\n\nLos Draenei siempre serán bienvenidos entre mi gente."
G["Promised One, we thank you for the warning. The Stillpine tribe will be prepared."]="$gPrometido:Prometida;, te agradecemos la advertencia. La tribu Semprepino estará preparada."
G["Promises, promises! There is nothing you can do to save us. The Zandalari are ruthless!"]="承诺，承诺！你无论如何也救不了我们了。赞达拉残忍至极！"
G["Proper sustenance will keep a soldier alive long after the wounds of the battlefield should have finished $g him : her; off, $c. If we're to persevere in the Ahn'Qiraj War to come, we'll need all of the provisions that we can carry. I'm gathering up spotted yellowtail fish at this location before it is to be shipped out.\n\nAs of now we have $2101w, but we need to collect a total of $2103w if we're going to be able to feed everyone."]="Es imprescindible una buena alimentación para que un Soldado siga vivo tras las heridas sufridas en el campo de batalla y que ponen en peligro su vida, $c. Si queremos durar en la guerra de Ahn'Qiraj, necesitaremos todas las provisiones que podamos traer. Yo estoy reuniendo serviolas moteadas en este lugar para después enviarlas.\n\nHasta ahora tenemos $2101w pero necesitamos reunir un total de $2103w si queremos alimentar a todo el mundo."
G["Properly responding to these events builds power\nwithin the Demolisher  5000's overflow tank.\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_EngGizmos_04.blp:32|t |TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_EngGizmos_12.blp:32|t |TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_EngGizmos_13.blp:32|t"]="正确处理以下情况可以为\n攻城车5000型的溢流罐充能。\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_EngGizmos_04.blp:32|t |TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_EngGizmos_12.blp:32|t |TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_EngGizmos_13.blp:32|t"
G["Prophet Velen!"]="先知维伦！"
G["Propose? I propose that we prepare. That we prepare our loved ones, family and friends for the possibility of an undead holocaust."]="建议？我建议我们现在就准备起来。为亡灵可能对我们的爱人、家人和朋友展开的屠杀准备起来。"
G["Propose? I will show you what I propose!"]="我的计划？你很快就会明白的！"
G["Prospecting is the primary method of finding gems!   You simply use the prospecting ability (which is found in the professions tab of your spellbook) on a stack of five ore to extract the gems from it.   Any type of non-precious ore will do!    \nBetter quality ores will provide more valuable gems so you will find higher quality gems in iron ore than in copper ore."]="¡La prospección es el método principal para encontrar piedras preciosas! Simplemente usa la habilidad de prospección (que se encuentra en la pestaña Profesiones de tu libro de hechizos) en un montón de cinco minerales para extraerle las piedras preciosas. ¡Cualquier tipo de mineral no precioso servirá! \n\nLos minerales de mejor calidad proporcionarán piedras preciosas más valiosas, así que encontrarás piedras preciosas de mayor calidad en el mineral de hierro que en el mineral de cobre."
