G["Psst! $c! Over here by the stairs! No don't look at me! Just come here."]="喂！$c！我在楼梯这边！别盯着我看！过来就是了。"
G["Psst! $n! Over here..."]="喂！$n！到这里来……"
G["Psst, $n, get over here."]="喂，$n，到这里来。"
