G["Push them back to their base! Let not a single Alliance soldier remain living on this battlefield!"]="将他们逼回基地去！将战场上的联盟士兵统统杀死！"
G["Push them back!"]="击退他们！"
G["Push!"]="推！"
G["Push!  Make a path to the shrine!"]="推进！杀出一条通往圣地的血路！"
G["Put a little elbow grease into it!  And maybe some regular grease, while you're at it.  Those mag'har sure like the clefthoof fat."]="放点牛油进去！可能还需要加点普通油脂。玛格汉兽人可喜欢裂蹄牛油啦！"
G["Put a muzzle on that damned sword, Mograine. I am sick and tired of its incessant whining."]="莫格莱尼，让那把该死的剑闭嘴。它发出的哀鸣令我难以忍受。"
G["Put a papaya in the still!"]="往蒸馏器里扔颗木瓜！"
G["Put all of that out of your head, recruit."]="别胡思乱想，新兵。"
G["Put down that ale and take up your gun. Your captain's shipping out."]="放下酒杯，把枪拿起来。你的船长要起航了。"
G["Put down your arms fools... you are too late!"]="蠢货，放下武器……已经太迟了！"
G["Put down your fork, and pick up your fists! I challenge you!"]="别吃了，露两手吧！我要挑战你！"
G["Put down your weapons or die!"]="缴械投降，不然就死！"
G["Put in a drop of liquid, as Betina requested."]="按照贝蒂娜的要求，倒入一滴液体。"
G["Put it out!"]="快灭火！"
G["Put it with the others for the Lord Reclaimer's inspection."]="把它和其他的放在一起，以便复国领主前来检查。"
G["Put me down!"]="放我下来！"
G["Put me in, coach! I'm ready to fight!"]="算我一个，教官！我做好战斗的准备了！"
G["Put me out of this misery!"]="结束我的痛苦吧！"
G["Put more stuff in the thing more stuff goes in."]="放入越多，进去越多。"
G["Put on your big-boy pants, Taylor. I will leave the SI:7 officers with you. I suggest a scouting mission."]="别耍小孩子脾气，泰勒。军情七处的军官们会留下帮你。我建议先做一番侦查。"
G["Put out those brewkegs!"]="快把酒桶的火扑灭！"
G["Put out those fires!"]="快把火扑灭！"
G["Put that Morning Glory dew DOWN! Morning Glory dew is for crafters only."]="把晨露酒放下！晨露酒是给技师喝的。"
G["Put these cultists on a boat and send it into the Maelstrom! We don't need this kind of thing in Stormwind!"]="把这些教徒都扔进一艘船里。再让那艘船驶进大漩涡里去！暴风城不需要这种人。"
G["Put these cultists on a zeppelin and send them to Stormwind! We don't need this kind of thing in Orgrimmar."]="把这些教徒都扔进一艘飞艇里。再让那艘飞艇飞到暴风城去！奥格瑞玛不需要这种人。"
G["Put those stone troggs back into the earth!"]="把这些石头穴居人赶回到地下去！"
G["Put up Defend\n|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_ShieldMastery.blp:32|t\nThen use Thrust on a Melee Target.\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Sword_65.blp:32|t"]="给自己加上防御。\n|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_ShieldMastery.blp:32|t\n然后对近战目标使用刺击。\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Sword_65.blp:32|t"
G["Put your back into it, $glad:lass;. Hard work and determination--that's the way! Don't let anyone tell you book learnin' is all ye need."]="$g小伙子:姑娘;，努力吧。苦干和决心——那就是成功之道！书本知识是远远不够的。"
G["Put your backs into it!"]="卖力一点！"
G["Put your backs into it! You're the most pathetic group of goblins I've ever seen!"]="再加把劲儿！你们是我所见过最没用的地精！"
G["Put your backs into it, you lazy peons!"]="全身心投入进去，你们这些懒惰的苦工！"
G["Put your faith in the Light and all is possible!"]="信仰圣光吧，一切都可能实现！"
G["Put your hands together for $n! $n is a Rank 3 $c."]="¡Un aplauso para $n! $n es $gun:una; $c de rango 3."
G["Put your might into it! Really crack that crate in half, watch!"]="要运用你的力量！真真正正地把这箱子劈成两半，看好了！"
G["Put your pets to the test, and challenge the best!"]="考验你的宠物，挑战顶尖高手！"
G["Put your shoulders into it! We must defend the Sunwell with our lives if needed!"]="认真一点！必要的时候，我们必须以生命来保卫太阳之井！"
G["Put your weapons down, everyone.  Wait out the shield!"]="所有人，放下武器。等护盾消失！"
G["Putrid Pirate Perspiration!"]="恶臭的海盗汗液！"
G["Putting in twelve centers of focus might allow the magical energies to form more solidly, adding the necessary stability."]="加入十二个聚焦核心可以使魔法能量变得更加稳固。"
G["Putting the bottles away, %s sighs."]="%s把瓶子放到一边，然后叹了口气。"
G["Puzzled by what you see, stranger?\n\nWe give praise to the spirits of our ancestors by keeping the flame of their memory alive and paying it tribute."]="¿Te asombra lo que ves, $gextraño:extraña;?\n\nElogiamos a los espíritus de nuestros ancestros manteniendo viva la llama de su recuerdo y rindiéndole homenaje."
G["Puzzling. They're clearly harnessing great power from their sacrifices. But for what?"]="奇怪。很明显，他们利用献祭仪式获取强大的力量。但他们的目的是什么呢？"
G["Pyrendius is slain! Our work here is done.\n\nJust step through the flamegate to return to Mount Hyjal, $c. I'll make sure the gate is taken care of."]="派伦迪乌斯倒下了！我们在这儿的工作完成了。\n\n现在只要穿过火焰之门就能返回海加尔山了，$c。我会确保看好大门的。"
G["QUIMBY!!!!!!"]="奎比！！！！！！"
G["Qiraji War Party spotted!"]="其拉军队出现了！"
G["Quake, mortals!  Quake and kneel before your destroyer!"]="颤抖吧，凡人们！颤抖并在你们的毁灭者面前卑躬屈膝吧！"
G["Quality over quantity my boy."]="重质不重量，孩子。"
G["Quarterflash, I need another homing bot."]="夸特弗拉什，再给我一个导航机器人吧。"
G["Quartermasters"]="军需官"
G["Queen Alexstrasza has placed me in charge of the defense of Wyrmrest Temple.\n\nAs you know, Malygos had his forces destroy a nearby ley line anchor. The forces of the dragonflight then redirected that power to the Azure Dragonshrine.\n\nThe blue dragons are using that power to strengthen themselves; so much so that they dare attack the temple itself! They're starting to win.\n\nAre you here to help us, $r?"]="阿莱克丝塔萨女王任命我负责龙眠神殿的防务工作。\n\n但如你所知，玛里苟斯和他的军团摧毁了附近一处魔网能量线的锚点。蓝龙军团将其中的能量导向了碧蓝巨龙圣地。\n\n毫无疑问，他们是想利用这种能量强化自己，伺机向神殿发动攻击！我们已渐渐处于劣势。\n\n$r，你愿意帮助我们吗？"
G["Queen Azshara will return and your land will be forfeit."]="艾萨拉女王将会归来，你们将会失去一切土地。"
G["Queen Lia Greymane."]="莉亚·格雷迈恩王后。"
G["Queen Liria Greymane."]="莉莉娅·格雷迈恩王后。"
G["Queen Malia Greymane."]="玛利亚·格雷迈恩王后。"
G["Queen Mia Greymane."]="米亚·格雷迈恩王后。"
G["Quel'Delar is not held in high esteem by the sin'dorei alone. It holds a place in the heart of all children of Silvermoon."]="不仅辛多雷的人十分看重奎尔德拉。它在银月城所有孩子们的心中都占据着一定的位置。"
G["Quel'Delar leaps to life in the presence of Frostmourne!"]="面对霜之哀伤，奎尔德拉很快复苏了！"
G["Quel'Delar will never serve another!"]="奎尔德拉只能有一个主人！"
G["Quel'Thalas is as much my home as it is yours and I would not see it fall to our ancient enemy. Now, you tell your cowardly regent --"]="奎尔萨拉斯是你的家园，同样也是我的家园。我不会任由它被我们远古的敌人攻陷。走吧，去告诉你懦弱的摄政王——"
G["Query? What do you think I'm here for, tea and biscuits? Spill the beans already!"]="问询？要不你以为我来这干嘛？喝下午茶吗？少废话！"
