G["Quick - they haven't spotted us yet."]="快，他们还没发现我们。"
G["Quick Shot!"]="快射击！"
G["Quick is the word and sharp is the action, $gMister:Miss; $n."]="说话很容易，但行动才有力量，$n$g先生:女士; 。"
G["Quick!  Do not let them disrupt Ysera's magic!"]="快！别让他们打断伊瑟拉施法！"
G["Quick!  Grab onto the ladder!"]="快！抓住梯子！"
G["Quick!  Hide in the water!"]="快点！藏进水里！"
G["Quick!  Use the ashes on Ursoc's corpse.  We must purge its corruption!"]="快！对乌索克的尸体使用灰烬。我们必须净化它！"
G["Quick! Finish him while he's down!"]="快！趁现在把他干掉！"
G["Quick! Grab a keg and start tossing like your life depended on it!"]="赶快！抓起酒桶，豁出老命丢出去！"
G["Quick! Into the plane!"]="赶快！到飞机里面去！"
G["Quick! Run!"]="快！快跑！"
G["Quick, $n!  Put on your disguise!"]="$n，快！快穿上伪装！"
G["Quick, $n! Into the chests!"]="赶快，$n！到箱子里去！"
G["Quick, $p! Come pop that bubble!"]="快，$p！戳破那个泡泡！"
G["Quick, add some shirts to the laundry!"]="快点儿，扔几件衬衫到洗衣桶里！"
G["Quick, grab onto the ladder!  That troll doesn't look too friendly!"]="快，抓住梯子！那巨魔看起来可不太友善！"
G["Quick, kill all of these trolls and then let me out of this thing!"]="快点，杀了这些巨魔，让我离开这东西！"
G["Quick, let's get out of here."]="赶快，我们离开这儿。"
G["Quick, over here!"]="快过来吧！"
G["Quick, through the portal!  He won't stay down for long."]="快穿过传送门！他坚持不了多久的。"
G["Quick, use the Ice Stones at each corner of the city to open a portal to the elemental plane and summon in those responsible.\n\nActivate each stone at the same time to ensure victory."]="\n\n抓紧时间，使用城中每个角落的寒冰之石打开一道通往元素位面的传送门并召唤那些要为此事负责的家伙。\n\n同时激活所有的寒冰之石以确保胜利的取得。"
G["Quicken your pace, maggots!"]="蠢货，加快速度！"
G["Quicker or I'll turn you into cinder myself!"]="动作快，不然我会亲自把你烧成灰！"
G["Quickfix!!  We've got our self a situation down here!!"]="奎菲克斯！！我们遇到麻烦了！"
G["Quickly now! Grab one of them while I take the supply cart!"]="快点！抓活口。我去对付补给车！"
G["Quickly!  Use the knife on me!  Time runs short!"]="快！用那把刀杀了我！时间要来不及了！"
G["Quickly! $n attacks!"]="快点！$n来了！"
G["Quickly! Evasive action! Evasive act--"]="小心！规避动作！规避——"
G["Quickly! Lure the enemy onto my trap!"]="快点！把敌人引到我的陷阱上！"
G["Quickly! Make your way across the chasm."]="快点！赶紧穿过裂口。"
G["Quickly! Poison them all while they're still close!"]="快点，趁他们在一起的时候上毒！"
G["Quickly! Use the flames and support the ground troops. Its ancient magic should cleanse Terokk's shield."]="快！利用火焰来支援地面部队。它的远古魔力应该可以清除泰罗克的护盾。"
G["Quickly! We must head back to the Forsaken Front before we are discovered!"]="赶快！我们必须在被发现之前返回被遗忘者先锋军！"
G["Quickly! We'll ambush them from behind!"]="快点，我们会在背后伏击他们！"
G["Quickly, $c!  Blazes rage through Falconwing Square!  Go! Fight those fires!"]="快点，$c！鹰翼广场到处都是火焰！走！去扑灭那些火焰！"
G["Quickly, $c!  Blazes rage through Razor Hill!  Go! Fight those fires!"]="快点，$c！剃刀岭失火了！快上！快去灭火！"
G["Quickly, $n!  We haven't much time before Razelikh makes his return."]="动作快，$n！我们没多少时间，拉瑟莱克很快就会回来。"
G["Quickly, $p! We need you over here!"]="快一点，$p，我们这里需要你！"
G["Quickly, Creteus is to the west. King Stormheart is holding them off, but they have the advantage of numbers."]="快，克莱特乌斯在西边。雷心国王会尽量阻止铁矮人大军，但是他们在数量上占据了绝对优势。"
G["Quickly, Sid. Fill my tankard. Make the memories fade..."]="快点，希德。帮我倒满酒。让我忘记这一切……"
G["Quickly, catch your breaths before we press to the gate!"]="快，在我们冲到大门之前，摒住呼吸迅速前进！"
G["Quickly, climb aboard! We mustn't tarry here! There's no telling when this whole mountainside will collapse."]="快！立刻上船！此地不可久留，山壁随时都有可能全面塌陷。"
G["Quickly, destroy that thing. We have to catch Gandling!"]="快，摧毁它们。我们要追赶加丁！"
G["Quickly, everyone move into position! Force him back into the Firelands!"]="快点，所有人赶紧就位！把他赶回火焰之地！"
G["Quickly, everyone run toward those dragons!  All troops, towards the dragons!  The dragons will save us!"]="赶快，所有人都向龙靠近！所有部队，全速向龙奔跑！那些龙是我们的救星！"
G["Quickly, everyone to arms!"]="赶快，所有人拿好武器！"
G["Quickly, friend. Go'el should be just below."]="快一点，朋友。古伊尔应该就在下方。"
G["Quickly, get me some..."]="快，给我来点……"
G["Quickly, get to the middle of the platform! Illidan's fury is soon to be unleashed!"]="快点，到平台中间去！伊利丹很快就会释放他的怒火了！"
G["Quickly, heroes, destroy the demon lord before it can open a portal to its twisted demonic realm!"]="快，英雄们，消灭那只恶魔，不要让他打开通向恶魔空间的传送门！"
G["Quickly, push on!"]="快！推进！"
G["Quickly, reactivate the totem!"]="快点，重新激活那个图腾！"
G["Quickly, return to me at the Veiled Stair. We should talk face-to-face."]="快，回雾纱栈道来找我。我们得当面谈谈。"
G["Quickly, this way! The cannon fire has opened a passage to the courtyard!"]="赶快，这边！炮弹击穿了院墙！"
G["Quid pro quo! I'll teach you what I know, but first I want you to perform a small task..."]="成交！我会将我所知的传授给你，但是你首先得执行一个小任务……"
G["Quiet down, everyone... we don't want to make it angry. Just gaze in silent awe at Unguloxx, the murderaffe!"]="各位，请安静……我们可不想激怒它。请屏息静气地欢迎我们的杀人鹿，乌古洛克斯！"
G["Quiet now! We'll form up a plan within this cave..."]="安静点！我们要在这个洞穴里制定一个计划……"
G["Quiet! Moira's in a foul mood and if she hears you, she'll have your head..."]="安静！茉艾拉现在心情很糟，要是让她听见，你的脑袋就保不住了……"
G["Quiet, $r. Please do not break my concentration."]="安静，$r。请别分散我的注意力。"
G["Quiet, Issara. Your chatter is going to get us killed."]="安静点，伊莎娜。你的噪音快把我们吵死了。"
G["Quiet, Naanae. Outsiders approach."]="闭嘴，纳娜伊。那些外来人过来了。"
G["Quiet, did you hear that?!"]="安静，你有没有听见啊？！"
G["Quiet, fools. If I had wished to kill you, you'd already be dead."]="安静点，蠢货。如果我要杀你，你早已经死了。"
G["Quiet, slave! You're worth just as much dead as alive."]="安静点，奴隶！你们活着跟死了没什么两样。"
G["Quiet, stranger. I need complete focus for the task at hand."]="Silencio, $gforastero:forastera;. Tengo que concentrarme bien para la tarea que tengo entre manos."
G["Quiet, you."]="你，安静。"
G["Quillboar scraps! These should do the trick. Fish love Quillboar."]="野猪人的废弃物！这个应该可以。鱼喜欢野猪人。"
G["Quit being such a baby, Razal'blade. It's time to start acting like you're part of one of the Warchief's elite forces. You don't want to end up like Gargal, do you?"]="别那么孩子气，拉扎布雷德。现在你要以酋长的精英部队的身份参与战斗了。你不想像加戈尔那样死掉，对吧？"
G["Quit lookin' at me, ya big purple eye-face! Ah, blast it all, $n."]="别盯着我看，你这紫眼睛的大胖脸！啊，全都炸光，$n。"
G["Quit messing around and use your knife! Nazgrim wants you to report to the village immediately."]="别浪费时间了，打起精神来！纳兹戈林要你立刻去村里报到。"
G["Quit pokin' me with that thing!"]="别再用那玩意儿戳我！"
G["Quit running and DO SOMETHING!"]="别跑啦，赶快做些什么！"
G["Quit running around, $n!"]="不要跑来跑去的，$n！"
G["Quit wasting time! Let's do this!"]="别浪费时间了！发射吧！"
G["Quit wasting words, worm. If you want the aid of the Dragonmaw, you should've come on bent knee and with offerings of gold."]="别废话了，虫子。要是你真想得到龙喉的帮助，你应该卑躬屈膝地来，还要带上足够多的金子。"
G["Quit yer pokin', mon!"]="快住手，伙计。"
G["Quit your pacing, mon! You're gonna be seen."]="脚步放轻！你会被发现的。"
G["Quit your whining, you worthless wolves!"]="别在呜咽了，没用的东西！"
G["Quite a lively event!\nI suspect our own brewmasters will attend and compete, next year."]="¡Un festejo de lo más alegre!\n\nCreo que el año que viene nuestros maestros cerveceros también asistirán para competir."
G["Quite a work out! These fiends are relentless."]="好累！这些恶魔还真是顽固。"
G["Quite an adventure, this. The boys back home won't believe a word of it...."]="这才是真正的冒险。那些足不出户的孩子肯定难以想象这样的经历……"
G["Quite an operation, indeed. What do you think of our host?"]="的确是效率惊人。你对我们主人有什么看法？"
G["Quite brave for one so small and fragile."]="又小又脆弱，却又如此勇敢。"
G["Quite impressive to have made it this far, Ohgan'aka.  You are truly a talented young raptor... but the toughest test is yet to come.\n\nThe trolls patrol the bridges up ahead, and they will be difficult to distract.  If you drop a skull in their path, however, you may be able to cause them to trip and fall..."]="能走到这一步可真令人印象深刻啊，奥根阿卡。你可真是只天赋异禀的年轻迅猛龙……可最难通过的考验还在后面呢。\n\n巨魔们就在前方的桥附近巡视，他们的注意力很难被分散。可要是你能在他们的必经之路上放块头骨，也许能把他们绊个跟头……"
G["Quite right, Greely. You passed today's pop quiz."]="非常正确的回答，格瑞里。你通过了今天的突击小测验。"
G["Quite the riveting tale.  Now I know why there was so much dust on that book."]="相当引人入胜的故事。现在我知道为什么那本书上积了那么多灰尘了。"
G["Quite the thrill."]="嗯，真是令人兴奋。"
G["Quite the welcome for our good mantid friends."]="好好招待了我们的螳螂妖朋友一番。"
G["Quitting time can't come too soon."]="退休的日子不会来得这么快的。"
G["R-really? I won't forget this, $gsir:ma'am;!"]="真——真的？我不会忘记的，$g先生:女士;！"
