G["RAAAAAAAR!"]="啊啊啊啊啊啊！"
G["RAAAAGH!"]="¡RAAAAGH!"
G["RAISED AS A SLAVE... TO KILL FOR HUMAN AMUSEMENT..."]="当作奴隶养大，为取悦人类而杀戮……"
G["RAKH'LIKH!  Come, and know demise!"]="拉瑟莱克！来吧，面对死亡吧！"
