G["RETREAT!!  We've already lost $3096W and we can't afford to lose any more!!"]="撤退！已经死掉$3096W个黑铁矮人了，我们承受不起更多的人员伤亡了！！"
G["RETREAT!!  We've taken a beating and had $3151W casualties!  We can't keep taking these losses!  FALL BACK!!"]="撤退！我们遭到了重创，还有$3151W个人员伤亡！我们不能承受这样的损失！撤退！！"
G["RETREAT!!!!"]="撤退！！！！"
G["RIDDOH!"]="里东！"
G["RIGHT!"]="右！"
G["RISE UP BROTHERHOOD! THE DAWNING DAY IS UPON US!"]="站起来吧兄弟会！破晓之日即将到来！"
G["RISE!"]="复活吧！"
G["ROARRRRR!!"]="呼啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！"
G["ROCK NOT SO HEAVY! PUNY HUMIES!"]="石头没有多重！小人类！"
G["ROCK ON!!!"]="厉害！！！"
G["ROKDAR SMASH PUNY $n!"]="洛卡达尔要揍扁弱小的$n！"
G["RRGLRGLRGLRGLRLR!!"]="¡¡RRGLRGLRGLRGLRLR!!"
G["RRRAAAAGGHHH!"]="啊！！！"
G["RUBBISH! Godfrey do you take me for a fool? Do not spew your Scourge propaganda at a man of the Light, heathen! Speak now or I will have the peasants craft a holy water bath and dip you into it like a dog with fleas!"]="一派胡言！高弗雷，你当我是傻子吗？别拿天灾军团那套邪说来恐吓圣光的战士！你放聪明点，不然我就叫人把你丢进装满圣水的木桶，像给狗除跳蚤那样让你冲个圣水浴！"
G["RUN FOR YOUR LIVES!"]="快逃命吧！"
G["RUN THEM THROUGH BROTHERS!"]="兄弟们，超过他们！"
G["RUN THEM THROUGH, SOLDIERS!"]="士兵们，干掉他们！"
G["RUN TO YOUR DARK GODS, YOU FILTHY ANIMALS!"]="去见你们的黑暗神灵吧，你们这些龌龊的畜生！"
G["RUN!"]="跑啊！"
G["RUN! DO NOT LET THEM TURN YOU!"]="跑啊！别让他们转变你！"
G["RUN! RUN FOR HILLS!"]="快跑！快离开这座山！"
