G["Raaarrrrggghhh!  We come for you!"]="哇哈哈哈哈！杀！"
G["Rabbitsfoot and Eightcoins argue over who has more luck. Those silly grummles forget that nothing is more lucky than finding lint in your pocket."]="兔子脚和八铜钱为谁运气更好而争论不休。那些愚蠢的土地精竟然不记得，没什么能比在口袋里找到棉绒更走运了。"
G["Race does not dictate honor, $r. While you remain on my farmstead, I ask that you remember and respect this credo.\n\nI have known orcs who have been as honorable as the most noble of knights and humans who have been as vile as the most ruthless of Scourge.\n\nBut I shall not bore you with tales of my youth! There is much work to be done - if that is what you desire."]="种族并不代表荣誉，$r。只要你呆在我的农场，就请你记住并尊重这个信条。\n\n我曾见过一些兽人，他们像最高贵的骑士那样可敬；我还见过某些人类，他们像最残忍的亡灵天灾那样邪恶。\n\n啊，我不该拿我年轻时的故事来烦你的！要做的事情还很多呢——如果你很想找些事情做的话。"
G["Radiation?!\n\nNo, you don't need to worry about that!  Sheesh, the things that people believe these days.\n\nSo, what do you think of our operations down here?  State of the art, baby!  You better believe it."]="辐射？！\n\n不，你不用担心那些。天哪，这几天大家都这么认为。\n\n那么你对我们在这里的计划有什么看法？技术的巅峰，宝贝！你最好相信它。"
G["Radioactive biohazard."]="放射性生化灾难。"
G["Radnaal provides Nadyia with a good supply of leather from the animals he skins.  I recommend you speak with him if you wish to learn the profession."]="拉德纳尔为纳迪娅提供大量的兽皮。如果你想学习剥皮技术的话，我建议你跟他谈谈。"
G["Raelorasz, it is good to see you again."]="莱洛拉斯，很高兴能再见到你。"
G["Raene, I lost Dartol's Rod of Transformation."]="莱恩，我把达图尔的变形魔棒弄丢了。"
G["Raene, I need Dartol's Rod!"]="莱恩，我需要达图尔的魔棒。"
G["Rage at your defeat."]="为你的失败而愤怒吧。"
G["Rage is power!"]="怒火就是力量！"
G["Rage is the only emotion I have left."]="现在我的体内只剩下了愤怒。"
G["Rage. That's how I can sum up my feelings towards this whole mess. We worked our fingers to the bone trying to get through the woods to the shore only to find that we were too late. Our only way home had been destroyed."]="愤怒。看着眼前这堆烂摊子，我实在是压抑不住心中的怒火。我们历尽艰辛，一路披荆斩棘穿越森林才来到海边，却发现还是迟了一步。返回家园的唯一希望已经破灭了。"
G["Rageclaw and troll friends no more!"]="怒爪和巨魔不再是朋友了！"
G["Rageclaw free! Troll die now!"]="怒爪自由了！巨魔去死吧！"
G["Ragefire"]="怒焰裂谷"
G["Ragefire Chasm can be found beneath the Shadow Cleft in the center of Orgrimmar."]="怒焰裂谷位于奥格瑞玛中心的暗影裂口。"
G["Ragefire Chasm consists of a network of volcanic caverns below the orcs' new capital city of Orgrimmar. Recently, rumors have spread that a cult loyal to the demonic Shadow Council has taken up residence within the Chasm's fiery depths. This cult, known as the Burning Blade, threatens the very sovereignty of Durotar. Many believe that the orc Warchief Thrall is aware of the Blade's existence and has chosen not to destroy it in the hopes that its members might lead him straight to the Shadow Council."]="怒焰裂谷是由许多火山洞穴所组成的，它位于部落的新都城奥格瑞玛中。最近，有传言说一群忠于阴影教会的教徒占据了那个地方。这群被称为火刃得教徒威胁了杜隆塔尔的安宁。许多人相信兽人酋长萨尔已经意识到了火刃的存在，他并不想着急于摧毁他们，因为萨尔希望这个教会能够将他带往阴影教会。"
G["Ragers, Fetch!"]="狂暴者，出击！"
G["Raggaran, I'm safe."]="拉格兰，我安全了。"
G["Ragnaros has perished.  But the primal powers he represents can never be vanquished.  Another will rise to power, someday."]="拉格纳罗斯灰飞烟灭了。但他所代表的原始力量不会终结。将来，必定会有人替代他。"
G["Ragnaros sees all, mortal."]="拉格纳罗斯无所不知，凡人。"
G["Ragnaros will reign supreme!"]="拉格纳罗斯将拥有至高无上的统治权！"
G["Ragnaros's assault has taxed my strength... Heal me!"]="拉格纳罗斯的攻击削弱了我的战斗力……快治疗我！"
G["Ragnaros, I call upon your power to aid me!"]="拉格纳罗斯，请赐予我力量吧！"
G["Ragnaros? Terrible news indeed..."]="拉格纳罗斯？这真是个可怕的消息……"
G["Raiders from the northwest! Fire!"]="敌人从西北方攻过来了！开火！"
G["Raiders, join ranks! On Korfang's signal, charge forth and crush these cowardly dogs! Forward!"]="骑兵们！列队！跟着库尔冯的信号冲锋，碾碎这些胆怯的家伙！前进！"
G["Raiding party over yonder! Fire!"]="在那边！开火！"
G["Raise you a keg of Stormstout Gold. It'll be your loss."]="我赌一桶风暴金酿。你输定了。"
G["Raise your weapon, $r! Let's fight!"]="拿起你们的武器，$r！冲啊！"
G["Raishen the Needle is well-known for her beautiful clothes.\n\nShe works in the crafter's hall, to the left as you enter the building.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="铁针莱绅那漂亮的衣服是众所周知的事情。\n\n她在工匠大厅内工作，就位于你进入建筑物时的左侧。\n\n我会在你的地图上标记这个位置。"
G["Raj'ku and I, we've been traveling for days and days. Just when we think we've seen it all, we're surprised again."]="我和拉古旅行了好多天。可就在我们认为自己已经饱览一切时，我们再次感到了惊奇。"
G["Rak'gor has dropped a gas bomb.  Stand in a Healing Ward to heal yourself!"]="拉克戈尔投下了一枚毒气炸弹。站在治疗结界里治疗你自己！"
G["Rakat, you stupid. You lose your nose if you keep sticking it where claws go. You lose nose, you can't smell. You can't smell, you hunt bad, you useless."]="拉卡特，你这蠢货。如果你再用鼻子嗅猎物的行踪，那你的鼻子就废了。你没有了鼻子，还怎么闻气味呢。闻不到气味，我看你还怎么打猎，你就成废物了！"
G["Rake in face!"]="吃我一耙！"
G["Rakjak say Kartak once ate whole village of big-tongues. They must be tasty."]="拉克亚克说卡塔克曾经一口吞下整座村子的大舌头怪。他们的味道想必美极了。"
G["Raliq teach you lesson now!"]="拉里克要教训你！"
G["Rally around your Lieutenants and Commanders! Protect our bases!"]="团结在中尉和指挥官身边！保护我们的基地！"
