G["Rally the forces!"]="重新整队！"
G["Ram Racing"]="赛羊"
G["Ram Riders, REGULATE!"]="山羊骑兵，列队！"
G["Ram racing is easier than it seems, but it takes skill to master. Just use the reins, eat apples if you can and avoid exhausting your ram."]="赛羊其实比看上去更简单，不过要掌握的话还是需要技术的。如果你能避免让你的山羊精疲力尽，你只需要用用缰绳，吃吃苹果就可以了。"
G["Ram racing is one of the great traditions of Brewfest. Speak to Pol Amberstill down by the ram stable if you want to learn more. It's a right hoot AND can be a great way to earn Brewfest Prize Tokens!"]="赛羊会是美酒节的一个重要传统节目。如果你想知道更多的信息，就去和羊圈旁的波尔·冻石谈谈。而且那也是获取美酒节奖币的好方法！"
G["Ramkahen will only wage war against Neferset if the High Council's vote is unanimous.\n\nThe odds are against us, but my brother needs to understand there is no reasoning with Deathwing's allies."]="只有当最高议会全体表决通过的时候，拉穆卡恒才会对尼斐塞特发动战争。\n\n我们的机会不大，但我的兄弟必须明白，死亡之翼的盟军绝对不会讲任何道理。"
G["Rampaging yeti?! Hmm. This gives me a most big idea."]="狂暴的雪人？！嗯……我想到一个绝好的主意。"
G["Ramstein hunger for flesh!"]="拉姆斯登想吃肉了！"
G["Rand Rhobart is fairly good at skinning felbats and the like.  You can find him at a camp along the road to the southeast of Brill.  Take the road southeast out of town and then head east at the intersection."]="兰德·洛巴尔特对制皮这样的技能相当精通。你可以在往布瑞尔东南角沿途的某个营帐中找到他。沿着城镇东南方的道路走，然后在十字路口向东转。"
G["Randal's a bit of a dandy, but he's dependable, which is more than I can say for a lot of the students I take on. Still, I guess I can't blame them for wanting a bit of adventure."]="兰达尔打扮得有些像花花公子，但是他是个可靠的人，他比我向许多学生所说的那样更加值得信赖。尽管如此，我还是不能责备他们想要冒险的想法。"
G["Randolph Moloch vanishes!"]="兰多菲·摩洛克消失了！"
G["Range set."]="射程设定。"
G["Range."]="校准射程。"
G["Ranged & Thrown Weapons"]="远程和投掷武器"
G["Rangers - shatter the hinges. Wedge the doors open!"]="游侠们——破坏铰链。把门打开！"
G["Rangers - to me! We have broken their lines!"]="游侠们——跟我来！我们击穿了他们的防线！"
G["Rangers! Advance!"]="游侠们！前进！"
G["Rangers! Secure the forge. Smash the gate, so it cannot be closed!"]="游侠们！保卫熔炉。打破大门，别让它关上了！"
G["Rangers, listen up! We stand ready to take the pain directly to the heathen Bash'ir devils.  Our mission is simple. Hold the area long enough to get accurate readings on their new technology."]="游侠们，听好了！让那些野蛮的巴什伊尔恶魔尝点苦头。我们的任务很简单，尽可能地坚守这片区域，获取他们的新技术的准确读数。"
G["Rangers. Lower your weapons."]="游侠们。放下武器。"
G["Rangers? ...Tyrande."]="游侠？……泰兰德。"
G["Ranked arena matches start again in $6318d.\n\nWould-be champions are already busy honing their skills and acquiring the best gear they can. Are you going to be ready?"]="Los encuentros de arena puntuados volverán a comenzar en $6318d.\n\nLos aspirantes a campeones ya están afinando sus habilidades y consiguiendo el mejor equipo posible. ¿Estarás $gpreparado:preparada;?"
G["Ranked arena matches start in $4262d. Would-be champions are already busy honing their skills and acquiring the best gear they can. Are you going to be ready?"]="Los encuentros de arena puntuados comienzan en $4262d. Los aspirantes a campeones ya están ocupados perfeccionando sus habilidades y adquiriendo el mejor equipo que pueden. ¿Estarás $gpreparado:preparada;?"
G["Ranulf of the Screaming Abyss!  Snuff these maggots with darkest night!"]="恐怖深渊之王拉努夫！以漆黑的深夜吞噬这群蝼蚁！"
G["Raptor Claw!"]="迅猛龙爪！"
G["Rare creature."]="稀有生物。"
G["Rargh! Not another one!"]="啊！不要再搞了！"
G["Rarrrargh! Rip! Rip!"]="啊！撕裂！撕裂！"
G["Ras Frostwhat? Who is that?"]="莱斯·霜什么……？那是谁？"
G["Rasp, shoot fire!"]="拉斯普，开火！"
G["Rastakhan be callin' me his brother, but da Horde be our true brothers. We gotta stop him before he can sweet-talk da others into joinin' his empire."]="拉斯塔哈想跟我称兄道弟，但部落才是我真正的兄弟。我们必须阻止他，以防他继续诱骗其他部族加入他的帝国。"
G["Rat-kabobs!  Get your tasty Rat-kabobs here!  Get them while they last!"]="烤鼠肉串！在这儿取一些好吃的烤鼠肉串！尽快拿吧！"
G["Ratchet security is a joke, open to the highest bidder. Our coffers will buy us the guards."]="棘齿城保安只是个笑话。它会向出价最高者开放。我们的保险箱可以把那些卫兵全买过来。"
G["Rats everywhere.  Everywhere I see rats.  Always looking at me with their beady little eyes.  I'll show them.  I'll show them all!"]="到处都是老鼠。随处可见。它们那贪婪的小眼睛老是盯着我。我会给它们点颜色看看的！"
G["Ravage the living, minions!"]="消灭所有活人，仆从们！"
G["Ravage! Ravage! Ravage!"]="复仇！复仇！复仇！"
G["Ravaged!"]="毁灭吧！"
G["Ravager"]="掠食者"
G["Ravenholdt Manor does not recognize you, $c."]="你并未得到拉文霍德公爵的认可，$c。"
G["Ravenholdt? It just doesn't make sense! A mongrel band of petty thieves. How did they even KNOW about the egg?"]="拉文霍德？这可真奇怪！那不过是一群小毛贼。他们怎么可能知道龙蛋的事？"
G["Rawr!"]="啊呜！"
G["Rawr! Me is Shadow Council magishun! Me come for Warmaul terri... tettritor... Me come for Warmaul land!"]="喔！我是暗影议会的人！我来攻打战槌氏族！"
G["Rawr!!"]="啊呜！"
G["Rawww!  Urok is dead!!  Hahah!!"]="啊！乌洛克死了！哈哈！！"
G["Rayne, Rimblat, what about the power of nature and the elements?"]="莱茵，雷布拉特，试试自然与元素的力量？"
G["Rayne, where should I look for savage fronds?"]="莱茵，我在哪里才能找到蛮荒之叶？"
G["Raz... Tired..."]="拉兹……累了……"
G["Raze every structure! Silence every cry!"]="烧毁每一座建筑物！杀光每一个人！"
G["Raze follow $n! Raze SMASH poachers! SMASH SMASH SMASH! Tell Raze to SMASH by playing with stick! SMASH!"]="拆毁者跟着$n！把偷猎者碾成粉！毁灭他们！告诉拆毁者什么时候出击！碾碎一切！"
G["Raze need go home now. Bye, bye, $r."]="Arrasa tener que ir a casa. Hasta la vista, $r."
G["Razelikh the Defiler."]="污染者拉瑟莱克。"
G["Razlo Crushcog is no more! The people of Ironforge and Gnomeregan speak with one voice this day. Hear us well, Thermaplugg. The day of your defeat approaches!"]="拉奇诺·碎轮已经完蛋了！铁炉堡和诺莫瑞根的成员们今天团结在了一起。给我听好了，瑟玛普拉格。你被我们消灭的日子也不远了！"
G["Razor claw."]="剃刀般的爪子。"
G["Razor tooth."]="剃刀般的牙齿。"
G["Razorfen Downs"]="剃刀高地"
G["Razorfen Downs can be found on the very southern tip of the Barrens on the east side of the road."]="剃刀高地位于贫瘠之地最南端的大路东边。"
