G["Readying Zip Line"]="准备拉索"
G["Reagents & Magical Goods"]="施法和魔法材料"
G["Real funny, Danforth."]="真是有趣啊，丹弗斯。"
G["Reality... unwoven."]="谜底将揭示。"
G["Realizing that the gem needed to be protected, we turned to the goddess herself."]="宝石需要得到保护，于是我们就向女神求助。"
G["Really, Uncle? We're stopping already? We only moved, like, ten feet."]="不会吧，叔叔？我们这就要停下了？我们才走了，大概，十尺啊。"
G["Really, it's the anticipation that's so unnerving..."]="真的，期望令人心烦意乱……"
G["Really, mon? Just like dat you be leavin' Mojodishu behind?"]="你是认真的吗？你想丢下莫吉蒂？"
G["Really...? Is that all you've got?"]="真的……？你就这点能耐？"
G["Really?"]="真的？"
G["Really?  That's great news!"]="真的？这可是天大的好消息！"
G["Really? That whole pond, just for me? I'll be right there!"]="真的？整个池塘，都是我的？我马上就去！"
G["Really? That whole pond, just for me? I'll be right there... right after I finish this drink... hic!"]="真的吗？整个池塘都是我的了？在我喝完这杯酒之后……我会在那里……嗝！"
