G["Reclaim the sword, $n, and bear it through that portal to Dalaran. Archmage Aethas Sunreaver will be waiting to congratulate you."]="拿回那把剑，$n，带着他穿过传送门前往达拉然。大法师艾萨斯·夺日者正等待着为你喝彩。"
