G["Red at Glorious Goods in southeast Dalaran can provide most general trade supplies.\n\nIf you need something more specialized, try the Magus Commerce Exchange. Each trade shop there has its own supply vendor."]="达拉然东南部的荣耀杂货店中，“红发”杰克·芬德出售各种杂货。\n\n如果你想购买特殊物品，就去魔法商业区吧。那里的店铺都设有供给商贩。"
