G["Redeem Battleground Marks for Honor."]="战场牌子兑换荣誉值。"
G["Redeem, nay, PROVE yourselves now. Deal with these intruders. The clan who brings me their heads will have my favor!"]="将功补过，肃清这些入侵者。哪个部族能够立下首功，就将得到我的青睐！"
