G["Reforging"]="重铸"
G["Refresh my memory on the whole kaja'mite thing."]="帮我回忆一下有关卡亚矿的知识。"
G["Refugees are flooding into Binan from all throughout the steppes. I fear the yaungol have breeched the wall!"]="难民从高原各地涌向滨岸村。我担心野牛人已经攻破了长城！"
G["Regain your strength. The place where Steeljaw was felled is just ahead."]="打起精神来。钢腭就死在前面。"
G["Regardless, stay out of my way, and don't bother calling for me when you get yourself into trouble...."]="无论如何都别来烦我，就算你惹上麻烦也不要叫我……"
G["Regardless, we have delivered a terrible blow to the Thunder King today. Horde metalsmiths can begin studying mogu fabrication techniques immediately."]="无论如何，我们今天重创了雷电之王。部落的铁匠会立即开始研究魔古族的锻造技术。"
G["Regent Lord - more Zandalari approach from the mines!"]="摄政王——矿洞那边的赞达拉又冲过来了！"
G["Regent Lord! Everyone is in position, and the Shado-Pan are inside, but..."]="摄政王阁下！人员已经就位了，影踪派也进去了，可是……"
G["Reginald Windsor is not to be harmed! He shall pass through untouched!"]="雷吉纳德·温德索尔不得受到任何伤害！让他安全地通过这里！"
G["Reginald, you know that I cannot let you pass."]="雷吉纳德，你知道，我是不能让你通过的。"
G["Reginald... I... I am sorry."]="雷吉纳德……我……很抱歉。"
G["Registrants are required to speak with Warden Bullrok before posting any task.\n\nThose found making unapproved postings will be prosecuted.\n\nPost no bills."]="Los inscritos tendrán que hablar con el celador Tororroc antes de publicar cualquier tarea.\n\nLos que publiquen anuncios no aprobados serán perseguidos.\n\nNo publiquéis facturas."
G["Registrants are required to speak with Warden Moi'bff Jill before posting any task.\n\nThose found making unapproved postings will be prosecuted.\n\nPost no bills."]="Se exige que los participantes hablen con el celador Moi'bff Jill antes de anunciar ninguna tarea.\n\nAquellos a los que se halle haciendo anuncios sin aprobar serán procesados.\n\nNo colguéis facturas."
G["Regret. It is all I have now. One bad decision resulting in several horrible outcomes. If only I had waited for those orders. Maybe they would have detailed the horrors that awaited us in those cursed lands! Maybe they were to redirect us to another detail? Ultimately, it was my fault. All of it was my fault."]="后悔。这就是现在我所能感受到的一切。一个错误的决定导致了如此灾难性的后果。我多么希望当时能多等几天，直到命令传来。也许那样我们就能事先知道这片被诅咒的土地上到底有多少恐怖的东西等着我们！也许这一条命令就能指引我们去另外一个方向！无论怎么样，这都是我的错。所有的一切都是我造成的。"
G["Regrettably, Balnazzar is not yet finished. Defeating a dreadlord in the mortal plane only sends it back to the Twisting Nether. He will be back one day, perhaps even working again with his brothers, Varimathras and Detheroc."]="巴纳扎尔并没有被真正消灭，这一点实在是让人感到懊丧。在物质位面击败一名恐惧魔王，只能让它返回到扭曲虚空中去。总有一天，他会回来，甚至有可能再度与他的兄弟瓦里玛萨斯和迪瑟洛克联手。"
G["Regroup behind the wards, everyone. They will counter-attack... but we will be ready."]="快去掩体后面重整队伍。他们会反攻……但我们会做好准备的。"
G["Regroup! We press da advantage. Before the Warchief fortifies Razor Hill, we take it for da revolution, an' close off da road to da Barrens."]="集合！我们得先发制人，抢在酋长增兵剃刀岭之前先占领它，并阻断通往贫瘠之地的交通！"
G["Regrouping... In the village... I think I can make it."]="去村里……重整队伍……我想我能坚持下去。"
G["Reinforce the front! We are being invaded!"]="增援前方！我们遭到了入侵！"
G["Reinforce the gate! Do not let the Scourge through!"]="增援城门！不要让天灾军团攻破城门！"
G["Reinforcements are needed on the Wintergrasp battlefield!  I have opened a portal for quick travel to the battle at Sunreaver's Sanctuary."]="冬拥湖战场需要援军！我已经在夺日者圣殿开启了一道通往冬拥湖的传送门。"
G["Reinforcements are needed on the Wintergrasp battlefield!  I have opened a portal for quick travel to the battle at The Silver Enclave."]="冬拥湖战场需要援军！我已经在银色领地开启了一道通往冬拥湖的传送门。"
G["Reinforcements en route. Function must be unabated."]="援军正在途中。确保功能正常。"
G["Reinforcements have arrived to the Vale."]="援军已抵达山谷。"
G["Reinforcements have arrived! Come $r, lend us a hand!"]="援军到了！来吧，$r，来帮我们一把！"
G["Reinforcements to the docks!  Lok'tar Ogar!"]="增援部队快去码头！Lok'tar Ogar！"
G["Reinforcements, finally! The prison guards can't hold out against this invasion for much longer! You'll have to relieve my men and try to hold out for as long as you can. There's still some power in the defense system available. Use the activation crystals located around the prison to trigger a discharge if the situation worsens."]="总算盼来了援军！面对如此大规模的入侵，监狱守卫是坚持不了多久的！请你前去增援我的士兵，尽量为我们争取时间吧。防御系统的能量尚未用尽。如果情况危急的话，务必要激活监狱周围的水晶发射能量波。"
G["Reinforcements, get over here and kill these weaklings!"]="援军，过来消灭这群懦夫！"
G["Rejek and $n will teach the enemies of the Frenzyheart to fear us!"]="雷耶克和$n要让狂心氏族的敌人吓得簌簌发抖！"
G["Rejek feel strong! Rejek crush big-tongue skulls between his hands!"]="雷耶克感觉自己变强壮了！雷耶克能徒手击败大舌头怪！"
G["Rejek like! If helmet scares pups, Rejek can't wait to see what it does to big-tongue cowards!"]="哦耶！连狗崽子们都害怕这头盔，肯定能把那些胆小的大舌头怪吓得屁滚尿流啊！"
G["Rejoice, for you shall be first to die. We will sweep across Khaz Modan and burn all to ash."]="狂喜吧，因为你将第一个死去。我们会横扫卡兹莫丹，将一切烧成灰烬。"
G["Rejoice, my friends! $n has saved us from the looming shadow that threatened our very lives!"]="欢呼吧，我的朋友们！$n从威胁我们生命的暗影手中拯救了我们！"
G["Relara is saved, $n.  Thank you."]="蕾拉获救了，$n。太感谢你了。"
G["Relara... you're awake?"]="蕾拉……你醒了？"
G["Relatively speaking, Feralas has barely been touched by the Cataclysm. Surely you can send some aid to New Thalanaar?"]="相对而言，大灾变对菲拉斯的影响并不大。你当然能派些人前往新萨兰纳尔对吧？"
G["Relax, Aethas. This attack cannot be traced. I am certain."]="放松点，艾萨斯。他们追查不到这次袭击的。我保证。"
G["Relax, Li Li. We have all the time in the world to explore Pandaria. Take some time to enjoy the trip."]="别着急，丽丽。我们有大把的时间来探索潘达利亚。花点时间来享受这个旅程吧。"
G["Relax, Spark! I have it all under control. We'll strip mine the Exodar right out from under 'em - making both you and I very, very rich in the process."]="放松一点，斯巴克！一切都在我的控制下。我们会慢慢挖光埃索达的水晶……让我和你都变得非常非常富裕。"
G["Relax, friend. You have not passed away... yet. Sadly, these others cannot say the same."]="放松，朋友。你还活着。但其他人就没有你这么幸运了。"
G["Relax, mon, I be makin' dis quick."]="放松，朋友，我下手很快。"
G["Relax. You are among friends."]="放松点。你还有朋友呢。"
G["Relax? Do you know what Kael'thas does to those that fail him, Geezle? Eternal suffering and pain... Do NOT screw this up, fool."]="放松点？你知道凯尔萨斯会对那些让他失望的家伙做些什么吗，吉兹尔？无尽的痛苦……不要把这事情搞砸了，白痴！"
G["Relaxation is the key to being an efficient crew.  Let the crew relax, and they'll perform better."]="娱乐是让船员保持工作效率的重要手段。心情轻松了，他们的表现才会更好。"
G["Release her, Godfrey."]="放了她，高弗雷。"
G["Release me from this torment!"]="帮我解除这种折磨吧！"
G["Release me immediately or face my wrath!"]="快点放了我！不然就面对我的愤怒吧！"
G["Release me, cowards! I'll show you what a dwarf is made of!"]="让我出来，懦夫！老子要让你知掉矮人的厉害！"
G["Release me, fiends!"]="放我出去，朋友！"
G["Release the Rabid Thistle Bear for Tharnariun."]="把狂暴蓟熊交给萨纳瑞恩接管。"
G["Release the doubt from your soul!"]="将犹疑逐出你的灵魂！"
G["Release the hounds!"]="关门，放狗！"
G["Release the prisoners! Firjus will destroy them all!"]="放出所有俘虏！芬尔乌斯要把他们全碾成渣！"
G["Release your rage!"]="发泄你的愤怒吧！"
G["Release yourself from the chains of life..."]="让你自己摆脱生命的轮回…"
G["Release... me..."]="释放……我……"
G["Relent! This ssssoul iss not worth sssaving..."]="放弃吧！他的灵魂根本不值得救赎……"
G["Relief at last..."]="终于得到了安息……"
G["Relieved? Over my dead body!"]="解除指挥权？除非从我的尸体上碾过去！"
G["Relinquish."]="放弃吧。"
G["Relish this victory, mortals, for it will be your last. This world will burn with the master's return!"]="享受胜利吧，凡人们，这是你们最后的胜利。回归的主人将烧毁这个世界！"
G["Rell is... he is hurt badly.\n\n<Agent Kearnen slams her fist on the ground.>\n\nHe's dying, $n! And there's not a damn thing we can do about it!"]="利尔……伤得很重。\n\n<密探吉尔妮用力地捶了地面一拳。>\n\n他快死了，$n！可我们对此却无能为力！"
G["Rell lowers his voice to a whisper."]="利尔压低了声音，窃窃私语着。"
G["Rell survived the attack, but he wasn't doing very well."]="利尔在袭击中活了下来，可是他的情况不太好。"
G["Rell's condition is worsening. We must stop to rest again."]="利尔的情况不妙。我们再停下休息一会儿。"
G["Rell, please... save your energy. Sully can tell $n what happened next."]="Por favor, Rell, ahorra energías. Sully le contará lo que pasó después."
G["Reload!"]="装填！"
G["Remain calm!"]="保持镇静！"
G["Remain calm!  We will take care of everybody."]="保持平静！我们会照顾好大家。"
G["Remain on the pure path.  The Light will protect you."]="在纯洁的道路上继续走下去吧。圣光会保佑你的。"
G["Remain steady always."]="一定要保持镇定。"
G["Remain strong. Kael'thas will - error - Lor'themar will lead you to power and glory!"]="要坚强起来。凯尔萨斯——错误——洛瑟玛会指引你们走向力量和光明！"
G["Remain vigilant!"]="保持警惕！"
G["Remain vigilant, but do not forget to enjoy the finer things in life. Good food, good friends, and good drink!"]="保持警惕，但也别忘了享受生活中的小乐趣。美食，好友，还有美酒！"
G["Remain vigilant, soldier. This terrible war will be over soon."]="保持警惕，士兵。这场可怕的战争很快就要结束了。"
G["Remain... strong."]="坚持……战斗。"
G["Remaining mechagnome guardians corrupted by unknown source."]="某种未知的力量摧毁了剩余的机械侏儒守卫。"
G["Rematch!"]="重赛！"
G["Remembah! Kor'kron axes gotta' hit you wit' their blade. Ya maces ain't got dat kinda limitation."]="记住！库卡隆必须用战斧开刃的那一面来攻击你。而你们的钉锤却没有这种限制。"
G["Remember $p, meat from wildlife or rations from your enemies will keep my crew well fed!"]="记住了，$p，无论是你从野生动物身上取得的肉还是从敌人身上取得的军粮都能喂饱我的队伍！"
G["Remember - fly through 10 checkpoint flags, then fly under the finish line."]="记住——飞过10个检查点旗帜，然后从下方穿过终点线。"
G["Remember hero: I, too, once sought a weapon of great power..."]="记住，英雄：我也曾寻找一件强大的武器……"
G["Remember how quiet it was before the elves came here? I miss that."]="还记得精灵们来这里之前的安静日子吗？我真怀念那时候。"
G["Remember how you're always telling us to chill?"]="你不是一直跟我们说要冷静的吗？"
G["Remember ta always show yer respect for the elements."]="记得永远要对元素表现出你的尊重。"
G["Remember that time we caught the red-finned murloc down in Elwynn?"]="还记得那个时候我们在艾尔文森林抓红鳞鱼人的事吗？"
G["Remember the dwarven journal that was discovered? Well, this dwarf could be exactly what we need to track down Brann Bronzebeard and capture him."]="还记得你找到的那本矮人日记吗？呃，它的主人很可能就是我们追捕布莱恩·铜须的重要线索。"
G["Remember the goblin that you once were, $g brother:sister;! You were my best friend! Fight this!"]="¡Recuerda el goblin que fuiste una vez, $ghermano:hermana;! ¡Fuiste $gnuestro salvador:nuestra salvadora;! ¡Combátelo!"
G["Remember the words of C'thun!  Remember them well! \"Your friends will betray you!\"  And betray us they have!"]="¡Recordad las palabras de C'thun! ¡Recordarlas bien! \"¡Vuestros amigos os traicionarán!\" ¡Y nos han traicionado!"
G["Remember the worgen that you once were, $g brother:sister;! You were our savior! Fight this!"]="¡Recuerda el huargen que fuiste una vez, $ghermano:hermana;! ¡Fuiste $gnuestro salvador:nuestra salvadora;! ¡Combátelo!"
G["Remember this day as the day that Forteski saved your hide. Now run! Get back to Sylvanas!"]="记住这一天——是Forteski救了你。快跑吧！回到希尔瓦娜斯那里去！"
G["Remember this day, $n, for it is the day that you will be thoroughly owned."]="Recuerda este día, $n pues es el día que vas a ser $gmachacado:machacada; a fondo."
G["Remember this, young ones. Every spell you cast, no matter how minor, cuts both ways. This is why sorcery must never be used frivolously."]="记住这一点，年轻人。你所施放的每一个法术，不管威力多么不值一提，都会产生两方面的影响。这也正是严禁随意使用法术的原因。"
G["Remember though, a key factor in winning any battle is positive reinforcement."]="但要记住，赢得战争的关键因素是活跃的增援力量。"
G["Remember to always show your respect for the elements of the world."]="永远要对这个世界上的元素表示尊敬。"
G["Remember to stay clear of those sentry totems."]="记住，躲开那些岗哨图腾。"
G["Remember to take your Bag of Wu Kao Supplies!"]="记得拿上一袋悟道者补给品！"
G["Remember when Danath gathered all the mercenaries of Stormwind together and we marched to fight at Nethergarde?"]="你还记得当年达纳斯聚集了暴风城的所有雇佣兵，然后开到守望堡去跟兽人大战的事情吗？"
G["Remember when we were kids, Gidwin?  We would spend all day pretending to fight the trolls, or the murlocs, or the girls."]="还记得我们小的时候么，吉德文？我们会用一整天的时间玩打败巨魔，打败鱼人，或者是打败女孩的游戏。"
G["Remember where your loyalties lie, $n!"]="记住你应该向谁效忠，$n！"
G["Remember your training, Helena...you've got this."]="记住你的训练，海伦娜……这对你有益。"
G["Remember your training.  As long as you do not give in to hatred, you will make it out alive."]="要记住你们训练时学到的东西。如果想活命，就别屈服于仇恨。"
G["Remember, $n!  Remain within Dawning Street and you will reach the Inner Elf Gate!"]="记住，$n！沿着黎明之路就可以走到精灵之门！"
G["Remember, $n, if you're going to be a $g priest : priestess; of the Light, you're going to need a lot of gold to keep things running smoothly.\n\nNever be afraid to ask for donations."]="Recuerda, $n, si vas a ser un $gsacerdote:sacerdotisa; de la Luz, vas a necesitar un montón de oro para que las cosas sigan adelante sin problemas.\n\nNunca tengas miedo de pedir donaciones."
G["Remember, $n, this is no sprint. The true test of a hunter tests his endurance over the course of a long expedition."]="记住，$n，这不是短期的考验。对猎人而言，真正的考验是在长途跋涉中锻炼自己的耐性。"
G["Remember, $n. Not all Dragonmaw are your enemies!"]="记住，$n。并非所有的龙喉成员都是你的敌人！"
G["Remember, Avuun. Not all who wander are lost."]="记住，阿弗恩，并非所有徘徊者都是迷失之人。"
G["Remember, I need your help to properly channel. I will ask you to aid me several times on our path, so please be ready."]="Recuerda, necesito tu ayuda para la canalización. Te pediré ayuda varias veces durante nuestro camino, tendrás que estar $gpreparado:preparada;."
G["Remember, Rajaxx, when I said I'd kill you last?"]="拉贾克斯，还记得我说过要杀光其它虫子之后再干掉你么？"
G["Remember, Sylvanas, eventually we all have to stand before our maker and face judgment. Your day may come sooner than others'...."]="记住，希尔瓦娜斯，终有一天，我们都将站在造物主面前接受审判。你的审判日也许比别人来得更早……"
G["Remember, Xuen told us to work together."]="记住，雪怒让我们合作。"
G["Remember, all things are connected. If the beasts were gone from the land, our kind would die from a great loneliness of spirit, for whatever happens to the beasts also happens to the Tauren. Whatever befalls Azeroth befalls all those that inhabit it."]="记住，所有的事物都是有关联的。如果陆地上的野兽灭绝，我们的种族将在孤独中死去，因为牛头人和野兽的命运是相通的，而艾泽拉斯的命运和所有艾泽拉斯上的生灵的命运也休戚相关。"
G["Remember, fly UNDER the finish line!"]="切记，要从下方飞过终点线！"
G["Remember, heroes, fear is your greatest enemy in these befouled halls. Steel your heart and your soul will shine brighter than a thousand suns. The enemy will falter at the sight of you. They will fall as the light of righteousness envelops them!"]="记住，英雄们，在这邪恶之地，恐惧是你们最大的敌人。勇气将让你们的灵魂比千颗太阳还要明亮。敌人会在你们面前溃不成军。正义的光芒将彻底摧毁他们！"
G["Remember, honey, we need to get a plot of land with a nice hot spring."]="亲爱的，我们得找到一块带温泉的好地方。"
G["Remember, if you harass the rep or spam the channel, your account may be kicked, banned, or worse."]="记住，如果你骚扰机器人或者在频道里传播垃圾信息，那你的人物将被踢出服务器，被暂时封锁或者遭受更严厉的处罚。"
G["Remember, in a real race, you will compete against the other trainees in the Order."]="记住，在真实比赛中，你要与骑士团的其它受训者同场竞技。"
G["Remember, it is at the darkest moment that light shines the brightest."]="记住，正是在最黑暗的时刻，光明才格外耀眼。"
G["Remember, kid: You're always more wrong than you think you are. Double It!"]="记住：你犯下的错误永远比你想象的要严重得多。给我加双倍的剂量！"
G["Remember, look for the pygmy leaders: Gaahl, Malmo, and Teloch."]="记住，一定要找到那些俾格米头领：加奥、马奥默和塔卢可。"
G["Remember, the mogu were overthrown! THAT should be the lesson of the Thunder King. It's your move, by the way."]="记住，魔古族被推翻了！雷电之王应该吸取教训。现在轮到你了。"
G["Remember, the warlock at the top of the tower will see through your invisibility!"]="记住，那座塔顶的术士能够看穿你的隐形！"
G["Remember, we must visit all four, but we only need to complete ONE of the four challenges."]="记住，我们要拜访所有四个祭坛，但只要完成一个挑战就够了。"
G["Remember, you will not fire until you see the - whatever color their eyes are."]="记住，在看清楚他们眼睛的颜色之前绝不能开火。"
G["Remember... always..."]="永远……记住……"
G["Remember: Hellscream's eyes are upon you, $n!"]="记住——地狱咆哮的双眼在注视着你，$n！"
G["Remember: You are never defeated until you decide to remain so. Those with true fortitude always rise whenever they fall."]="记住：除非甘心放弃，否则没有人能够击败你。真正坚忍的人总能在跌倒后爬起来。"
G["Remind me again why I tolerate your company, Asric."]="艾斯瑞克，我又想起了为什么我至今还能容忍你的原因。"
G["Remind me how to make Northern Stew."]="我要温习诺森德炖肉的做法。"
G["Remind me once again why it is that I don't just leave?"]="给我个理由，为什么我就不能离开呢？"
G["Remind me to dock them for leaving without permission!"]="提醒我拴住他们，以防他们逃跑。"
G["Remind me to tell you the story about my friend here and what we accomplished together at Ravenholdt. Good times!"]="记得提醒我以后告诉你我们在拉文霍德庄园的事迹。那可真是一段好时光！"
G["Remind me to thank Hamlock for a lovely weekend."]="记得提醒我谢谢汉姆洛克，他让我度过了一个愉快的周末。"
G["Remind me why we don't travel by portal?"]="Recuérdame por qué no viajamos a través de portales?"
G["Remind me, ambassador... what precisely will your people be contributing to our efforts?"]="提醒我，大使……你的人民会为我们做出什么样的贡献？"
G["Reminds me of the time I was stationed at Cenarion Hold during the second war of the shifting sands... Remember that orc? Saurfang? Damndest thing I ever did see."]="让我想起了第二次流沙之战时我驻守塞纳里奥要塞的日子……还记得那个兽人吗？是叫萨鲁法尔？他是我见过的最厉害的家伙。"
G["Remora Oil Sample"]="鮣魚油样本"
G["Remove the Eye of the Prophets from the idol's face."]="从神像脸上取下预言者之眼。"
G["Remove your disguise, lest you feel the bite of my blade when the fury has taken control."]="脱下你的伪装吧，以免我控制不住，挥刀伤到你。"
G["Removing"]="移除"
G["Removing the spirit's illusion damages the hozen's fragile mind!"]="移除酒灵的幻象对猢狲脆弱的心智造成了伤害！"
G["Removing the tome."]="正在移除书籍。"
G["Remtravel has been a hero to the archaeology world for nearly 40 years. If he could only remember them, oh, the stories he would tell..."]="雷塔维在过去的近四十年里一直都是考古界的英雄。要是他还记得它们，哦，他要讲的那些故事……"
G["Remulos, I am being drawn back... Tyrande... send her my love... Tell her I am safe. Tell her... Tell her I will return... Farewell..."]="雷姆洛斯，我正在被拖回梦境……泰兰德……告诉她……告诉她我很安全。告诉她……告诉她我会回来的……再见……"
G["Remulos, look how easy they fall before me? You can stop this, fool. Turn the druid over to me and it will all be over..."]="雷姆洛斯，我不费吹灰之力就能了结他们。住手吧，愚蠢的家伙。把这个德鲁伊交给我来对付，我会很快结束战斗的……"
G["Remulos, old friend. It is good to see you once more. I knew that the message would find its way to you - one way or another."]="雷姆洛斯，我的老朋友。能再见到你真好。我知道消息会传到你这里的——它终究会?到你这里。"
G["Ren bet me that I couldn't steal one of the mogu cannons.  I didn't think they'd be so heavy!"]="任说我肯定连一个魔古炮弹都偷不到。我怎么知道它们竟然这么重！"
G["Renataki, of the Thousand Blades.\n\nPain is his lifeblood.  Fear, his ally.  May he one day return and bring joyous bloodshed with him.\n\nRenataki now dwells near the edge of madness."]="千刃之王雷纳塔基。\n\n痛苦是他的生命。恐怖是他的伙伴。愿他早日重返世间。\n\n雷纳塔基就在疯狂之缘那边。"
G["Renataki, of the Thousand Blades.\n\nPain is his lifeblood.  Fear, his ally.  May he one day return and bring joyous bloodshed with him.  \n\nRenataki now dwells far from here.  One day, he may return..."]="千刃之王雷纳塔基。\n\n痛苦是他的生命。恐怖是他的伙伴。愿他早日重返世间。\n\n雷纳塔基正在遥远的地方徘徊。总有一天，他会回来的……"
G["Rend, son of Blackhand: Impotent chieftain of the Blackrock clan. A more stubborn fool does not exist.\n\nAt the end of the second War, Rend and his brother, Maim, fled to find sanctuary within the mountainous stronghold of Blackrock Spire. It was there that Rend declared himself Warchief of the weakened Blackrock clan."]="雷德，是黑手的儿子，他是黑石氏族的酋长。他是一个十足的恶棍。\n\n当第二次大战结束时，雷德和他的兄弟麦姆逃往黑石塔要塞避难。雷德正是在那儿宣称自己为黑石氏族的酋长的。"
G["Rendezvous back here when you're done."]="侦察完毕在这里汇合。"
G["Rendow, can I get a ride with another Water Traveler?"]="瑞恩多尔，我还能再搭乘一次水上旅行者吗？"
G["Renounce the Scarlet Onslaught! Don't listen to the lies of the high general and the grand admiral any longer!"]="与血色先锋军断绝关系！别再听信将军和元帅编造的谎言了！"
G["Reorigination device detonation aborted."]="起源重组装置爆炸进程已中断。"
G["Repair module activated!"]="修理模块已经激活！"
G["Repairing the damage Kor'ik did will take time, but it can be done."]="修复遭到科尔里克破坏的地方需要一些时间，但可以完成。"
G["Repel the intruders!"]="击退入侵者！"
G["Repent, mortals!  Repent in the face of unstoppable annihilation!"]="忏悔吧，凡人们！在这无法阻止的大毁灭之前忏悔吧！"
G["Replacement siege vehicles brought right to your doorstep in no time flat. Can't ask for better service than that!"]="备用攻城器械立即送货上门。还有比这更好的服务吗？"
G["Replacement, quickly!"]="预备兵！补上来！"
G["Reply hazy and slightly damp. Dry thoroughly and try again."]="答案有些模糊且潮湿。请清理一下思维后再重试。"
G["Report to Captain Evencane on the second level of the barracks. He can see to your training."]="向兵营第二层的伊文凯恩队长报到。他将负责你的训练。"
G["Report!"]="报告！"
