G["Right now, the best medical care I can provide is giving you the tools to avoid injury in the first place."]="目前，我能提供的最好的医疗手段就是给你一些能够避免伤害的东西了。"
G["Right outside de valley's inn, mon.\n\nIt be de tall building in de middle."]="就在这座山谷的旅店外面，朋友。\n\n就是山谷中部的那座高大的建筑物。"
