G["Right then! Keep your eyes open for civilians. Let's move. For Thundermar!"]="好了！睁大眼睛，关照好平民。我们行动。为了桑德玛尔！"
G["Right then! So the Mistress had come back for a second go at the hives but Brann was having none of that nonsense! Before the melee began, she started talking to something or someone. Crazier still, she started chanting in a language none of us had ever heard."]="好吧！她从虫巢回来过，但是布莱恩一点都没有察觉到！混战之前，她开始跟什么人交谈起来。奇怪的是，她用了一种我们从未听过的语言谈话。"
G["Right then, no time to waste. Let's get outa here!"]="好啦，别浪费时间嘛。我们快走！"
G["Right then. I hate long plane rides. So I'mma gonna kick in the after-market burners and ignite our entire fuel supply in one go."]="告诉你，我要对燃烧引擎进行一次大改造，让它能一次烧光我们全部的燃料储备，把我们一下子轰到目的地去 ！"
G["Right then... You have to build an arcanite buoy and place it in the ocean. My minnow will be attracted to the magical emanations. When he gets near the buoy - BLAMO! It will explode in a glorious pulse of arcane energy, revealing the minnow's true form. Also, you may or may not incur the wrath of Neptulon. A 50/50 chance I would say."]="好吧……你需要制作一个奥金鱼漂，把它放进海水中。米诺鱼会被奥金鱼漂所吸引，当它接近鱼漂时——砰！奥金鱼漂将释放出神秘的力量，使它现出原形。不过这么一来，你有可能招致耐普图洛斯的仇恨，几率大概是50%吧。"
G["Right this way!"]="这边！"
G["Right!"]="对！"
G["Right!  Let's try this so-called dire brew..."]="好！让我们来尝尝这个所谓的烈酒……"
G["Right! Burn the bodies of this filth while I search the ol' homestead."]="好啊！在我搜索这片古老的家园时，把那些肮脏的尸体都烧光吧。"
G["Right, Cuthbert should be below decks. Come with me, mon!"]="好了，卡斯伯特应该在下面的甲板上，跟我来吧！"
G["Right, let's go! Just need to input the final entry sequence into the door mechanism... and..."]="好啊，我们走！只需要在门禁系统中输入最终登录序列……然后……"
G["Right, right... I know the earthen were made from stone to shape the deep regions o' the world. But what about the anomalies? Matrix non-stabilizin' and what-not?"]="对，对。我已经知道土灵是用石头创造出来，用以改造地下世界的。但变异是怎么发生的？我听说过什么母体扰动？"
G["Right, right... So let's start the countdown from ten, ready?  TEN!"]="好吧，好吧……现在我们就开始十秒倒计时，大家准备好了吗？10！"
G["Right, thanks. Just go ahead and head southeast. More south than east. Probably off the coast."]="好的，谢谢。只要向东南偏南前进。也许就在海岸边。"
G["Right, that should do it. I think ...hic."]="很好，这个就行。我觉着……嗝儿。"
G["Right, the meeting.  Let's get down to it then.\n\nThe fact is that the lumber and livestock being gathered from the Ruuan Weald, which you're responsible for, has slowed to a trickle.\n\nWe need those resources, but you've allowed the druids of the Cenarion Expedition to get in the way!"]="是的，让我们静下心来商讨一下吧。\n\n实际上，你负责把木材和家畜汇聚到卢安荒野，而你的进度越来越慢了。\n\n我们需要那些资源，但是你却让塞纳里奥远征队的德鲁伊来妨碍我们！"
G["Right.  Go ahead."]="好吧。继续。"
G["Right.  We just busted our tails to haul all of this stuff up here, and you want to work more?"]="好吧，我们刚费了九牛二虎之力把这东西拖过来，你还想让我再干点活？"
G["Right.  We, uh, need to... examine... those blackwhelps."]="对。我们，嗯，需要……检验……那些黑龙幼崽。"
G["Right. I'd better get back to the sergeant then."]="好吧。我还是返回中士身边吧。"
G["Right. I'm off. Time ta get blootered."]="好了，我得走了。到时间去喝上一杯了。"
G["Right. Let's see if we can finish this keystone."]="嗯。我们试试能不能拼好钥石。"
G["Right... He ran away!  He's a big, juicy guy and he just got away from us here.  I'm sorry miss."]="对了……他逃走了！他真是个又肥又多汁的家伙，但他刚从我们这儿逃走了。真遗憾。"
G["Right... let me in there!"]="好吧……让我进去！"
G["Right... my bad. Now where was I?"]="好吧……是我的错。我这是在哪儿？"
G["Righto."]="没错。"
