G["Rise, my angels! Let your screams fill the streets of Orgrimmar with TERROR!"]="来吧，我的天使们！用尖叫声让奥格瑞玛的街道颤栗吧！"
G["Rise, my fallen brothers! Take form and fight!"]="复活吧，我死去的兄弟们！准备战斗！"
