G["Rise, young Voldoun.  Do not worry yourself with pleasantries.  I come at the behest of our master, Prince Kael'thas.  He bids me to check on the progress of the mana bomb."]="起来吧，沃多恩。不用多礼。我是奉凯尔萨斯王子之命而来，他要我来检查一下魔法炸弹的进程。"
