G["Rohendor has been obliterated.  Only the gateway, Archonisus, remains.\n\nOur mages are $3257w percent through the defenses of the final gate, Archonisus."]="洛希多尔已经被摧毁，现在只剩下埃库尼苏了。\n\n我们的法师们已经摧毁了埃库尼苏百分之$3257w的防御屏障。"
G["Rohendor, the Second Gate has been brought down, but the last of the Sunwell Plateau's magical barriers, Archonisus, resists us, $n.\n\nMaintain your efforts to assist at the Sunwell in any way that you can."]="第二道屏障洛希多尔已经被摧毁了，但是埃库尼苏——太阳之井高地最后的那道魔法屏障挡住了我们，$n。\n\n继续尽一切可能帮助我们吧。"
G["Rokaro, I have lost the Drakefire Amulet. Could another be created?"]="罗卡鲁，我丢了龙火护符。你能再给我一个吗？"
G["Roll Yi-Mo towards Zhu's Watch!"]="让易默滚回朱家堡！"
G["Roll!"]="开始翻滚！"
