G["Rupert Boch is his name.  I hear that he's upstairs in one of the rooms at the Gallows' End Tavern on the southeast end of town."]="他名叫鲁伯特·鲍什。我听说他在城镇东南角的恐惧之末旅店楼上的某间房间里。"
