G["Salutations.  My function is to offer access to and, when permissible, insight into information regarding the Creators' synthesis of the Earthen on the world designated as Azeroth.  I am ready to share this information with you now at your leisure."]="你好。我的职责在得到允许的情况下，根据艾泽拉斯的造物者对于土灵的分析，向来访者提供相关的信息。我随时都可以与你分享这些信息。"
