G["Sapphiron. Once a noble blue dragon within the mountains of Northrend, Sapphiron was slain by Arthas during his campaign through the frozen north. Resurrected to serve him, Sapphiron guards Kel'thuzad's lair eternally, awaiting those who would dare tresspass upon his master."]="萨菲隆。它本是高贵的蓝龙，自由地翱翔在诺森德的冰峰间，被征战极寒之地的阿尔萨斯所杀。克尔苏加德复活了萨菲隆，如今这头冰霜巨龙守卫着主子的巢穴，等待那些胆敢挑战克尔苏加德的冒险者。"
