G["Say, did I ever tell you about the dwarf that tried to kill me in the battle for Grim Batol?"]="喂，我有没有告诉过你，我在格瑞姆巴托的战斗中差点儿被矮人杀死的事？"
G["Say, do you guys hear that?"]="那么，你们都听到了吗？"
G["Say, nice shot!\n\nScared the fish, though.\n\nNeed a quick teleport back to the cannon?\n\nFor a small fee, of course..."]="哇，准头不错嘛！\n\n就是把我的鱼吓跑了。\n\n你想快速传回大炮那里去吗？\n\n当然了，你得付一小笔费用……"
