G["Scout Vor'takh's hunch was correct. Brann Bronzebeard visited Thor Modan recently and this journal records his findings."]="斥候沃塔肯的直觉是正确的。布莱恩·铜须最近确实造访过索尔莫丹，并在这本日志上记录了他的发现。"
