G["Second prize is some fused wiring."]="二等奖是保险丝。"
G["Second squad is ready to fight!"]="第二小队准备好战斗了！"
G["Secret cult? Is that who I see having meetings at the base of the south zeppelin tower?"]="秘密教派？是不是在南飞艇塔底下集会的那些人？"
G["Secret cult? You're not with those creepy orcs who lurk around the south zeppelin tower, are you?"]="秘密教派？有些鬼祟的兽人在南飞艇塔附近游荡，这事儿跟你没关系吧？"
G["Secret nearby."]="附近有秘密。"
G["Secure da remains, bruddahs!"]="守住遗骸，兄弟们！"
G["Secure the main road. We can launch our main assault from here."]="坚守主路。这是我们的主攻击方向。"
G["Secure the rafters!"]="确保椽子的安全！"
G["Securing this area for the Sentinels will be the final part of our defense of Feralas."]="为哨兵守住这片区域，将是我们守卫菲拉斯任务的最后一步。"
G["Securing this land will win us our war!"]="占领那岛屿，我们就能赢得这场战争！"
G["Security breach in progress. Analysis of historical archives transferred to lower-priority queue. Countermeasures engaged."]="安全系统发现不明入侵。历史文档的分析工作优先级转为低。对策程序立即启动。"
G["Security breach.  All safety protocols disabled."]="安全漏洞。禁用所有安全协议。"
G["Security here is much stronger than I recall... what is Arygos protecting?"]="守卫比之前要严密多了……阿瑞苟斯在保护什么？"
G["Security override permitted. Secondary defensive systems activated.\n\nBackup deactivation for secondary systems can be accessed via individual generators located on the concourse."]="允许安全控制。辅助防御系统已激活。\n\n可以通过广场上的独立能源塔关闭这些辅助系统。"
G["Security system deactivated.  Welcome back Siegecrafter Blackfuse."]="安全系统关闭。欢迎回来，攻城匠师黑索。"
G["See Kil'ruk? Speed is king!"]="看到了吗？速度才是王道！"
G["See her face? Is it really..."]="你看到她的脸了吗？她的脸真是……"
G["See how easy that was with everyone working together? Just take what you need from the clean laundry here, but don't forget to return it when you're finished."]="看到人多好办事了吧？尽管从干净的里面挑你需要的吧，不过别忘了穿完了再送回来。"
G["See how effortlessly I CRUSH your bones!"]="看看我是怎么碾碎你们的骨头吧！不费吹灰之力！"
G["See how effortlessly you become unraveled."]="看着自己四分五裂吧。"
G["See how the shadowflame animates their bones! They fight at my command!"]="暗影烈焰为他们的骨骼注入了活力！他们为我而战！"
G["See how they pour from every letter of these sacred scrolls... corrupting them! Defiling them!"]="看看它们是怎么对待这些神圣书卷的……腐化它们！亵渎它们！"
G["See how you like a taste of this!"]="尝尝这个！"
G["See if the new recruits are up to a challenge. They could use a lesson in advanced combat."]="看看这些新兵能否接受挑战。他们需要在战斗之前先积累些经验。"
G["See me if you need a boat to the shore, $n!"]="如果你需要一艘小艇去岸边，就来找我，$n！"
G["See now the product of your meddling!"]="看看你多管闲事的后果吧！"
G["See some armor you like, $r? These rare armor sets can only be obtained by proving your worth in the most challenging dungeons in Pandaria.\n\nYou must seek out these dungeons and enter them by foot. Those who pass the challenges with enough speed shall earn the regard of our master armorers, and may find a gift of rare armor awaiting them in the mail."]="想看些你喜欢的护甲吗，$r？只有你在潘达利亚最具挑战性的地牢中证明自己的价值，你才能获得这些罕见的护甲套件。\n\n你必须寻找这些地牢，并步行进入。以足够快的速度赢得挑战的人们应得到我们大铸甲师的尊敬，也许还会在邮件中收到一个罕见护甲礼物。"
G["See that broken trap over yonder?  The ogres are too stupid to figure out how to fix it.  Clearly, it needs a little tinkering!  If you fix it, I bet you could lure Slip'kik into it, and BLAMMO - trapped ogre guard!"]="看到那边坏掉的陷阱了没？愚蠢的食人魔对此感到束手无策。很明显，只要略做修理就能恢复原状！要是你能修好它，我敢打赌斯里基克一定会中圈套。哈哈——食人魔卫兵掉入陷阱！"
G["See that it thrives. Drive out those who would do it harm. Do this in my name."]="定要使它兴盛。驱逐意欲危害它的敌人，以我之名。"
G["See that? Ironclad!"]="看见没有？铁甲万能车！"
G["See the fall of the Lich King."]="必定要铲除巫妖王。"
G["See the piles of laundry and the bucket of water? I'll call out what I need next, and you put it in the tub. Ready?"]="看到大堆的衣服和那桶水了吧？我会大声喊需要什么，你就把需要的扔进盆里。准备好了吗？"
G["See the visions of fear, despair, and doubt, as I have!"]="跟我一起看清恐惧，绝望与猜忌的幻象吧！"
G["See this card here? This one's going to really knock the dwarf off his chair!"]="看到这张牌了吗？它肯定能把那个矮人从椅子上打翻。"
G["See this card? He won't see this one comin'!"]="看见这张牌了吗？他这次休想打败我！"
G["See this staff? It has been in my family for generations and won hundreds of tournaments at this very spot.\n\nCan you feel the power in it? It is much stronger here than anywhere else I've travelled."]="看到这把棘杖了吗？这是我家世代相传的神兵，到目前为止已赢过数百场比赛。\n\n你能感受到其中的力量吗？在这儿，它更是前所未有的强大。"
G["See this statue, boy?  This is the king of Stormwind, Varian Wrynn."]="你瞧这座雕像。他就是暴风城的国王瓦利安·乌瑞恩。"
G["See this? This is my boom stick! Dwarven top of the line. That's right, this sweet baby was made in Ironforge, Khaz Modan. Retails for about one hundred and nine gold, ninety five copper. It's got a walnut stock, thorium steel, and a hair trigger."]="看到这个了吗？这是我的钓竿！这就对了，这个甜美的宝贝在卡兹莫丹的铁炉堡制造。零售价一百零九块金币，九十五块铜币。它的柄是胡桃木做的，钍合金的钢铁做的竿身，还有一个灵敏的浮标。"
G["See those seaforium bombs? Use them on the gates while I repair the siege engine!"]="看到那些爆盐炸弹了吗？在我修理这部攻城器械的时候，你要对大门使用它们！"
G["See those ships in dock?"]="看到码头里的船啦？"
G["See to it that I'm not followed."]="注意不要让我被跟踪。"
G["See to it that they are made to feel MOST welcome, hmmm? After all, their bones will be lying here for a long, LONG time..."]="一定要以最大的热情欢迎他们，不是么 ？毕竟，他们要留在这里很长，很长的时间……"
G["See to it that you do, Sharth, or I will personally see to your slow torture and death."]="确保这一点，沙尔斯。否则我会亲自看到你慢慢地被折磨致死。"
G["See to it, Ardonis!"]="你给我确保一切正常，阿尔杜尼斯！"
G["See to your arms! We must protect the harbor, or the Alliance's assault on Northrend will be halted before it can even begin!"]="拿起武器！我们必须守住港口，否则联盟远征诺森德的计划就会提前流产！"
