G["See you there, Uncle Chen!"]="回头见咯，陈叔！"
G["See your world through my eyes: A universe so vast as to be immeasurable - incomprehensible even to your greatest minds."]="通过我的双眼来观察你们的世界吧：一个广袤无垠的宇宙，即使是你们当中最睿智的人，也无法理解这一切。"
G["See!? Very bitey. And he doesn't follow orders, either. Try to move him, $r."]="看到了吧！？很爱咬人。还不听使唤。试着让它动两下，$r。"
G["See, Cassius. I told you that we could depend upon $n."]="看，卡修斯，我早就和你说过，我们可以指望$n。"
G["See, Cousin Bag-of-Rocks? Persistence pays off."]="表哥石头包，看见了吧？功夫不负有心人。"
G["See, Marin? We've got you covered, babe. No sweat."]="看到了吗，马林？我们保护了你，宝贝儿。毫不费力。"
G["See, the Venture Company's new shredder is better than my latest, from the interchangeable hands to the control grips!\n\nMy boss has given me a pretty strict deadline, but my boys and I couldn't come up with anything. Nothing was working, so we decided to \"borrow\" one of their prototypes. I sent Wizzlecrank to the Sludge Fen to steal one, but he hasn't gotten back yet!"]="Mira, la nueva trituradora de Ventura y Compañía es mejor que la que tenía antes, ¡desde las manivelas intercambiables hasta los controles!\n\nMi jefe me ha dado un plazo muy estricto, pero ni a mis chicos ni a mí se nos ocurría nada. No funcionaba nada, así que decidimos coger \"prestado\" uno de sus prototipos. Envié a Rabiaire al Fangal a robar uno, ¡pero todavía no ha regresado!"
G["See... THIS is the type of adventure I can get behind."]=" 瞧……冒险一定要有高手保护才行。"
G["See... you... soon."]="再……见……"
G["See?  No kill spider for venom.  Just ride."]="看到了吗？要取得毒液不需要杀蜘蛛，只需要骑上它。"
G["See? I'm helping by picking up this full mug of ale that someone left on the ground."]="看到了？不知道谁在地上留了满满一杯啤酒，我正帮忙把它拿起来呢。"
G["See? I've got the Southfury moonstone and there's not a thing you can do about it. So long!"]="看到吗？我得到了南国之怒月亮石，而你无能为力。再见！"
G["See? See how these outsiders hate one another! They wear their hatred to battle and carry it to their graves!"]="看见没有？这些外来者如此憎恨彼此！他们身披仇恨上阵，再把仇恨带进坟墓！"
G["See? That's all it takes. It 'twasn't so bad."]="看到了吗？就是这样。看上去还不错。"
G["See?! That wasn't hard, was it? You'll have no problem fooling stinky old Oso Bramblepaw and his guardians now."]="看到了吗？！这不难吧？现在你可以轻松地戏弄那个恶心的老奥索·棘痕和他的卫士了。"
G["Seeing scenery that beautiful really puts things into perspective."]="看着这么美丽的风景，一定会让你茅塞顿开。"
G["Seek absolution, Eranikus. All will be forgiven..."]="伊兰尼库斯，寻求赦免吧。一切都会得到宽恕的……"
G["Seek out Catarina Stanford in the canals southwest of The Stockade."]="卡塔莉娜·斯坦弗就在监狱西南方的运河边。"
G["Seek out Iranis Shadebloom.\nYou'll find him inside the inn, on the main floor."]="Busca a Iranis Sombraflor.\n\nLo encontrarás en la posada, en la planta baja."
G["Seek out Lalum Darkmane, within the village's main tipi."]="去村里的主帐篷里找拉鲁姆·黑鬃吧。"
G["Seek out Lien Farner. He'll be able to train you in any profession."]="去找莱恩·法尔娜。他可以教你任何的专业技能。"
G["Seek out Miao'zan in Sen'jin Village to the south."]="去南方的森金村找米奥赞。"
G["Seek out Poshken Hardbinder in The Pools of Vision, below the Spirit Rise."]="波什金·哈比德尔在灵魂高地下的预见之池。"
G["Seek out Shandrina in Silverwind Refuge.  She can sell you the \"Expert Cookbook\"."]="Busca a Shandrina en el Refugio Brisa de Plata. Te puede vender el \"Libro de cocina para expertos\"."
G["Seek out The Reliquary in the Royal Exchange; doubtless one of that organization's many archaeologists will be there and can likely assist you."]="在皇家贸易区找到神圣遗物学会。毫无疑问，那个组织中的诸多考古学家之一会在那里帮助你。"
G["Seek out The Scribe's Sacellum in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran."]="你要找的铭文师的殿堂就在达拉然西北部的魔法商业区。"
G["Seek out Turak Runetotem in the Hall of Elders on the Elder Rise."]="去长者高地的长者大厅找图拉克·符文图腾吧。"
G["Seek out a vessel... and return!"]="找一个容器……然后重返人世！"
G["Seek out the Tanwell brothers in Theramore's inn. One of them will be able to help you."]="到塞拉摩的旅店里去找坦维尔兄弟吧。他们俩当中，应该有一个能帮你。"
G["Seek out the Volatile Fireflies, $p! They are instrumental in the creation of this special brew."]="仔细寻找那些暴躁萤火虫，$p！它们可以用来调制这种特殊的啤酒。"
G["Seek out your true enemy! Do not be fooled by his false images!"]="找出真正的敌人！别被假象迷惑了！"
G["Seek sanctuary in the Hearthglen! It is our only hope!"]="去壁炉谷寻求庇护吧！那是我们惟一的希望！"
G["Seek shelter, lest I strike you down as the Sha commands!"]="快躲起来吧，以免我奉煞魔之命，将你们赶尽杀绝！"
G["Seek the Cloudchasers upon the lower rise. They should be able to help you in all matters of jewelcrafting."]="到中部高地的底层寻找追云者，他们可以就珠宝加工方面的事宜为你提供帮助。"
G["Seek your mark!"]="一击必杀！"
G["Seeker of Chaos... Summoner of Demons... Wielder of Shadows..."]="混沌的追随者……恶魔的召唤者……暗影的掌控者……"
G["Seeking storage? You'll want to head to the safety of the Exodar, then... the bankers will be more than happy to help you."]="在找仓库？你是想去埃索达的保险箱那里吧，那么……银行职员们会很高兴帮助你的。"
G["Seem like there more wasps every time Dajik come back. Why they not run out?"]="每次来虫巢，达伊克都觉得这里的巨蜂又变多了。它们的数量怎么就不见少呢？"
G["Seemingly unphased by the nearby plague tank on fire, %s appears inspired."]="%s若有所思地注视着附近着火的药剂罐头。"
G["Seems I'll be cuttin' yer throat by me self!"]="看样子，我要亲自割断你的喉咙了！"
G["Seems kind of girly to me."]="太娘娘腔了吧。"
G["Seems legit."]="看起来不错。"
G["Seems like a hundred times a day I walk all the way to the well to get more water. No respect for their elders I tell ya."]="我一天要走好多趟到水井那边去打水，现在的年轻人啊……"
G["Seems like we never run out of things to do around here.  New orders arrive every day at 3am, it's really strange."]="看样子，我们在这里永远都有事要做。新的命令会在每天凌晨三点到达。这可真是奇怪。"
G["Seems like we've been working on this roof forever."]="看上去，我们得在这屋顶上永远工作下去了。"
G["Seems the elevator is out.  I could give you a lift."]="看上去升降机坏了，不过我可以帮你一下。"
G["Seems we're a little low on oil. Just keep your eyes peeled for snakes and we should be fine."]="看来我们的油料有点不够了。睁大你的眼睛，小心那些蛇，我们会没事的。"
G["Seen any strange things in the desert lately?"]="最近在沙漠中有发现什么奇怪的东西吗？"
G["Seer Hao Pham Roo hands you the end of his climbing rope. Tie it to the next Rope Anchor and help him up the mountain!"]="先知昊梵舟将爬绳的一端交到你手中。将它绑在下一个绳锚上，帮助昊梵舟爬上山顶！"
G["Seikwa can take care of your animal friends when you have the need.  Seek her out in front of the inn."]="希克瓦能在你需要的时候帮你照看宠物。去旅馆前面找她吧。"
G["Seize him! Seize the worthless criminal and his allies!"]="抓住他！抓住这个卑鄙的罪犯和他的同伙！"
G["Selama am'oronor!"]="¡Selama am'oronor!"
G["Select a Start Zone from the list below to be teleported there."]="Selecciona una Zona de inicio de la lista siguiente para ser teletransportado allí."
G["Select a phrase to carve into the sign."]="请选择要刻在标志上的话。"
G["Select your destination."]="选择你的目的地。"
G["Self Destructing is SO COOL."]="自爆的感觉太棒了。"
G["Self-destruct sequence activated."]="自毁系统程序启动。"
G["Self-destruct sequence finalized. Have a nice day!"]="自毁程序确认启动。祝你愉快！"
G["Self-destruct sequence initiated."]="自毁程序启动。"
G["Self-destruct sequence terminated. Override code A-9-0-5."]="自毁程序已中断。过载代码A-9-0-5。"
G["Self-training complete!"]="自我训练已完成！"
G["Send for Velen. Bring him here at once!"]="去找维伦，马上带他来！"
G["Send in da reserves! Charge!"]="让后备队上来！冲锋！"
G["Send in the next pair of prisoners, let them fight to see who lives!"]="还有人吗？今天的讯问结束了？"
G["Send it out!"]="发射！"
G["Send it to Orgrimmar."]="把它送去奥格瑞玛。"
G["Send me a real challenge!"]="给我一场真正的挑战吧！"
G["Send me ashore, Horzog."]="送我去岸边，霍尔佐格。"
G["Send me back in Tenwu!"]="送我回去，腾武！"
G["Send me back to Nozzlepot's Outpost."]="送我回诺兹波特的哨站。"
G["Send me back to Raven's Wood."]="送我回到乌鸦林。"
G["Send me back to Razaan's Landing."]="送我回到拉扎安码头。"
G["Send me back to Ruann Weald."]="把我送回卢安荒野。"
G["Send me back to the Jagged Ridge."]="送我回到锯齿山。"
G["Send me back to the Singing Ridge."]="把我送回晶歌山脉。"
G["Send me on my way... I beg you..."]="送我上路吧……求求你……"
G["Send me to Akil'darah at the middle terrace."]="送我到平台中央的阿基尔达拉那里去。"
G["Send me to Dawn's Blossom."]="送我去晨芳园。"
G["Send me to Eastern Plaguelands!"]="带我去东瘟疫之地！"
G["Send me to Ebon Hold, horse."]="带我去黑锋要塞吧。"
G["Send me to Garrosh's Landing, Yanni."]="亚尼，送我到加尔鲁什码头吧。"
G["Send me to Honor Hold!"]="送我到荣耀堡去！"
G["Send me to Honor Point!"]="送我到荣耀岗哨去！"
G["Send me to Orgrimmar."]="送我去奥格瑞玛。"
G["Send me to Pandaria!"]="送我去潘达利亚！"
G["Send me to Razaan's Landing!"]="送我到拉扎安码头去！"
G["Send me to Shatter Point!"]="送我去破碎岗哨！"
G["Send me to Thrallmar!"]="送我去萨尔玛！"
G["Send me to portal 1."]="送我去1号传送门。"
G["Send me to portal 2."]="送我去2号传送门。"
G["Send me to portal 3."]="送我去3号传送门。"
G["Send me to the Abyssal Shelf!"]="送我去地狱岩床！"
G["Send me to the Mor'shan Ramparts, Kulg."]="库格，送我去莫尔杉营地。"
G["Send me to the boss."]="送我去见首领。"
G["Send me to the surface, Torben."]="送我回到地表，托尔本。"
G["Send more, demons! We will destroy them as we have this one!"]="再来啊，恶魔们！我们会像这样消灭它们！"
G["Send them back to the wastelands of their world, champions!"]="把他们送回荒废虚无的世界去，勇士们！"
G["Send them on! I'm not afraid of some scrawny beasts!"]="把它们赶走！坚守阵线！"
G["Send these scumbags back to hell!  Fire at will!"]="把这些渣滓都赶下地狱！开火！"
G["Send your Ashtongue into Tempest Keep and slay his most prized possession, the phoenix known as Al'ar.  I must know that you're not on his side.  Do not think of betraying me, Broken.  We both know who owns your soul!"]="将你的灰舌部队派进风暴要塞，去杀掉他最得意的部下，那只名叫奥的凤凰。以此来向我证明你不是他的同党。不要妄图背叛我，破碎者。我们都知道你的灵魂在谁的掌握中！"
G["Sending ground assaults takes huge amounts of supplies!"]="发动地面攻击需要大量军需物资！"
G["Senior Initiate Goldmine, reporting for duty!"]="见习萨满金矿，报到！"
G["Senior Wing Commander Vipore, launching. Pray for a swift death, Frostwolf."]="高级空军指挥官维波里，进攻。霜狼氏族，准备受死吧。"
G["Senses beyond this realm of mortality!"]="超越一切凡人的感知力！"
G["Sensors online. All cores operating at peak efficiency."]="传感器上线。所有核心满功率运转。"
G["Sentence executed!"]="行刑！"
G["Sentinel Commander Lyalia needs your report."]="哨兵指挥官丽娅拉需要你的报告。"
G["Sentinel!  Did you see a wounded night elf pass by this way?"]="哨兵！你有没有看到一个受伤的暗夜精灵经过？"
G["Sentinel, I would like to ride one of your nightsabers to Astranaar."]="哨兵，我想骑着你的一头夜刃豹去阿斯特兰纳。"
G["Sentinel, I would speak with your High Priestess."]="卫兵，我想和你们的高阶祭司谈谈。"
G["Sentinels be on the alert!  I heard something over there..."]="哨兵们，警戒起来！我听到了什么声音……"
G["Sentinels, come to my defense!"]="哨兵部队，来保护我！"
G["Sentinels, saddle up and prepare to move out! Xintar, carve us a portal to the next location. We are leaving a small garrison here and pressing northwestward."]="哨兵们，收拾好你们的行装，准备出发吧！埃克辛塔尔，为我们开启一道通往下一个位置的传送门。我们要在这里留下一个小卫戍营，然后向西北方向进军。"
G["Serena Bloodfeather will rip out your eyes and feast upon your heart!"]="塞瑞娜·血羽会挖出你的眼睛，吃掉你的心！"
G["Serge I have lost the cure to the Touch of Zanzil! HELP!"]="瑟尔格，我把赞吉尔之触的解药弄丢了！帮帮我！"
G["Sergeant Hartman!  I need to buy another stink bomb cleaner!"]="哈特曼中士！我要再买一个臭气弹清洁器！"
G["Sergeant, allow me to introduce $n, who helped us rescue survivors in Gnomeregan."]="军士，请允许我为你介绍$n，他帮助我们救出了诺莫瑞根的幸存者。"
G["Sergeant, loan me your spyglass."]="中士，把你的望远镜借给我。"
G["Sergra falls into a trance for a moment, then looks to the sky."]="瑟格拉神情恍惚地发了会儿呆，然后看着天空。"
G["Seriously though, Mudmug. Don't be dumb."]="说正经的，泥盏。一起去吧。"
G["Seriously. Feast away. I'm quite beautiful."]="好好看看，我是多么美丽啊。"
G["Seriously?"]="来真的？"
G["Serpent"]="蛇"
G["Serpent, charge me with your power!"]="翔龙，赐予我力量吧！"
G["Serpentine Basin."]="蛇行盆地。"
G["Serpents of the depths!  Come and aid your master!"]="深渊中的毒蛇！来侍奉你们的主人！"
G["Servants of the Betrayer"]="背叛者的仆从"
G["Serve Azshara, puppets, and rejoice."]="快乐地服侍艾萨拉吧，傀儡们。"
G["Serve the Dragonmaw and you will be handsomely rewarded, $c."]="Sirve a los Faucedraco y serás generosamente $grecompensado:recompensada;, $c."
G["Serve the Fel Horde!"]="为邪部落而战！"
G["Serve the public trust!"]="为人民的信赖服务！"
G["Serve your penitence!"]="忏悔吧！"
G["Served!"]="你完了！"
G["Services"]="服务"
G["Set"]="设置"
G["Set aside your weapon and take up a carving knife, traveler. The Ironpaws can teach you all manner of roasting, brewing, stewing, steaming, and grilling!"]="Aparta el arma y empuña el cuchillo de carnicero, $gviajero:viajera;. ¡Los Zarpa Férrea podemos enseñarte a asar, a fermentar, a guisar, a hervir y a saltear!"
G["Set me up with the phattest, shiniest bling you got!"]="把你最华丽，最耀眼的首饰都给我拿来！"
G["Set us down as close to the crater as possible!"]="让我们尽量接近那个坑洞！"
G["Set us down next to the crater!"]="我们到那裂口旁边去！"
G["Set'thik, in formation! Show them who controls the winds of Pandaria!"]="赛特提克，列阵！让他们瞧瞧谁才是潘达利亚的御风者！"
G["Setting foot in the Dread Wastes taught me the value of knowing the terrain and understanding the enemies' movements.  Whether the goal is victory or simply survival, the best route is always to be two steps ahead of your opponent."]="踏上恐惧废土，使我明白了探查地形与洞悉敌人行动的重要性。不论是为了取胜还是存活，先发制人总能事半功倍。"
G["Setting up and maintaining the grounds is tough work..."]="建立及维护场地可不容易……"
G["Settle down, Li Li. You know that I hate to be interrupted while I'm knocking on doors."]="安静点，丽丽。你知道我可不喜欢在敲门的时候被人打扰。"
G["Settle down, soldier!"]="冷静，士兵！"
G["Settle down, will ya! No need to be gettin' all riled up over nothin'! Remember what happened last time? Now sit down!"]="你冷静点！无缘无故地发什么脾气呀！还记得上次你乱撒气的后果吗？坐下啦！"
G["Settle down, you two. We have much to do, and getting Lin out alive is one of our top priorities."]="你们俩都冷静点。我们要做的事还有很多，但援救林是我们的重中之重。"
G["Settle yourselves in and come by the market any day if you are looking for work."]="安顿下来吧，要是你想找工作，可以随时到市场上来。"
G["Settle yourselves in first. You'll be able to farm your fields, but I'm afraid you're too inexperienced to continue further. Once you've seen more of Pandaria, be sure to stop by."]="先安顿下来吧。你可以在自己的农场上耕种，但由于经验不足，你能做的恐怕也仅限于此。等你见识了潘达利亚更多的风土人情后，一定要再来找我。"
G["Seven Burdens of Shaohao."]="少昊的七罪责。"
G["Seven."]="七个。"
G["Seventy percent of all archaeology is done in the library. Research. Reading."]="El setenta por ciento de la arqueología se lleva a cabo en la biblioteca. Investigando. Leyendo."
G["Several leaves and branches cling to this object, indicating that it may have been used as part of a nest for some creature.  There is otherwise nothing of note."]="这个物件粘着了些许树叶和杂枝，显示出它曾被某种生物用来筑巢。除此以外，这东西就没有什么值得注意的地方了。"
G["Several piles of supplies rest on the table.  You decide to start with the worg hides."]="桌上放着几堆货物。你决定先从座狼皮开始。"
G["Several sets of the Plates of Uldum have been synthesized by the Creators for their expressed use.  The Creators control the distribution of said discs for all complexes on this world.  As such, Azeroth has been rescheduled for visitation, and therefore future discs may enter circulation at that time.\n\nExisting discs have been fully distributed to those parties with appropriate security clearance."]="造物者制造了若干张奥丹姆圆盘以供使用。他们控制着向整个世界分配奥丹姆圆盘的工作。同样，艾泽拉斯已经被安排了新的探访计划，到那时，未来的奥丹姆圆盘也许会重新开始流通。\n\n现有的奥丹姆圆盘已经被全部分给了具有一定忠诚度的种族。"
G["Several small samples of oil sit in front of you, along with an empty beaker.  The beaker looks like it can probably fit about five samples inside of it.\n\nWhat kind of oil will you take first?"]="你面前放着几种油料样本，旁边还有一个空烧杯。烧杯看起来能装下大约五种样本。\n\n你想先选哪种油料？"
G["Several spots of dried blood can be seen on this object, likely a result of the struggle to obtain the artifact by the trolls.  The object is quite plain, however, and may not have been worth the struggle."]="该物件上残留着斑斑血迹，很可能是巨魔们在争夺它时留下的。然而这个物件本身平凡无奇，其实并不值得争抢。"
G["Several strange carvings adorn this object, perhaps made by the trolls in an attempt to decipher its origins.  They did not seem to meet with much success, as the object remains inert."]="这个器物表面有一些奇怪的刻痕，也许是巨魔尝试用来解开它的起源之谜的。看起来他们并未获得成功，因为该物件原封未动。"
G["Severe stomach pain?"]="没有效果？"
G["Sewer Exits"]="下水道出口"
G["Sewer Tunnel"]="下水管道"
G["Sewers"]="下水道"
G["Seyala, I need to get to New Thalanaar!"]="塞亚娜，我要前往新萨兰纳尔！"
G["Seymour, the principal skinner in Shattrath and grand master of the trade, may be found in the lower city's open marketplace."]="宗师级剥皮师塞莫尔就在贫民窟的露天市场里，他也是沙塔斯城最好的剥皮师。"
G["Sezik calls this food?!"]="塞兹克管这叫食物？！"
G["Sha'amoor ara mashal?"]="¿Sha'amoor ara mashal?"
G["Sha'nir said that I can help her when I get older."]="沙妮说等我长大了就可以来帮她。"
G["Shackles, NOW!"]="用镣铐，快！"
G["Shado-Pan"]="影踪派"
G["Shado-Pan Fire Archers appear on the rooftops!"]="影踪派火箭手出现在屋顶！"
G["Shado-Pan Ice Archers appear on the rooftops!"]="影踪派冰箭手出现在屋顶！"
G["Shado-Pan Stormbringers react to your presence and begin to |cFFFF0000|Hspell:115009|h[Focus Energy]|h|r!"]="影踪派风暴使者对你的出现迅速作出反应，并开始|cFFFF0000|Hspell:115009|h[专注能量]|h|r！"
G["Shado-Pan?"]="影踪派？"
G["Shadow Council come for you Warmaul! We is mad at you!"]="暗影议会要灭了战槌氏族！我们很生气！后果很严重！"
G["Shadow Hunter Denjai sent me here with a small contingent of builders and warriors to establish this outpost. We've barely finished building it and he's already asking for reports!\n\nIf you need supplies, I can offer a few things, but we're still waiting for our first shipment."]="暗影猎手德恩加派我、建筑工和一些战士到这里来建立这座哨所。我们刚刚完工，他就已经要求汇报了！\n\n如果你需要补给，我可以给你提供一些东西，但是我们仍然在等待第一批物资。"
G["Shadow Hunter Denjai uses this board to post important announcements and news of bounties on the foes of Zabra'jin."]="暗影猎手德恩加用这块公告板来张贴重要的公告和萨布拉金的新悬赏名单。"
G["Shadow and fire, how quaint. Ride the lightning!"]="暗影对火焰，你们可真复古。吃一记闪电！"
G["Shadow to the aid of fire!"]="火焰将在阴影中燃烧！"
G["Shadow-Walker Zuru can help ya.\n\nYou'll find him on de lowest floor of de taller building in de southeast."]="暗影行者祖鲁能够帮助你。\n\n你可以在东南方那座更高的建筑物最下面的一层中找到他。"
G["Shadow-Warders, prove your worth!"]="暗影卫士，展现实力的时候到了！"
G["Shadowfang Keep"]="影牙城堡"
G["Shadowfang Keep is in southern Silverpine just north of Pyrewood Village."]="影牙城堡位于南部银松森林，就在焚木村的北面。"
G["Shadowglen tribe."]="幽影部族。"
G["Shadows amass and swarm around $n!"]="蜂拥的阴影在$n的四周积聚！"
G["Shadows engulf."]="暗影将你包围。"
G["Shadows, begone!"]="阴影，退散！"
G["Shadowthread Cave lies to the north. Be careful, it's dangerous there of late."]="黑丝洞就在北面。多加小心，那里近来危机四伏。"
G["Shadra's rage will destroy you!"]="让沙德拉的怒火消灭你！"
G["Shadra, make of me your avatar!"]="沙德拉，让我成为你的化身！"
G["Shadra... save... me..."]="沙德拉……救救……我……"
G["Shadron! Come to me! All is at risk!"]="沙德隆，帮帮我！一切都危在旦夕！"
G["Shael'dryn, I need the Rod of Dartol."]="莎尔蒂恩，我需要达图尔的魔棒。"
G["Shake Drakuru's outstretched hand."]="与达库鲁握手。"
G["Shake dat shake dat!"]="扭啊扭！"
G["Shake in fear, dogs!  I am here!"]="颤抖吧！我来了！"
G["Shake it like a goblinoid picture!"]="像地精巨星那样摇滚！"
G["Shake it like a sine wave, baby!"]="要以正弦波的幅度晃动它，宝贝！"
G["Shake it off, brothers. It's brewin' time."]="放松点，伙计们。现在是畅饮时间。"
G["Shake your dooker!"]="尽情摇摆！"
G["Shal'mor sinabanal!"]="¡Shal'mor sinabanal!"
G["Shaldyn!"]="莎尔蒂！"
G["Shale Spider"]="页岩蜘蛛"
G["Shalenn tends the animals within the city and prevents them from running amok while their masters continue to fritter their lives away. She stands in Farstriders' Square, just outside the rangers' hall."]="沙尔蕾恩在城市里面照顾动物，避免它们在主人离开的时候因为无所事事而发狂。她就在远行者广场的游侠大厅外面。"
G["Shall we begin, my friend?"]="¿Comenzamos, $gamigo mío:amiga mía;?"
G["Shall we destabilize the shrine first or disable the enemy?"]="我们是先攻打圣地呢，还是先对付敌军？"
G["Shall we execute him, my prince?"]="我们要处决他吗，王子殿下？"
G["Shall we get a move on?"]="我们赶快吧？"
G["Shall we meet in the Challenger's Ring?"]="我们在挑战者之环见吧，如何？"
G["Shall we prepare it for you, my lord?"]="需要为您准备好一切吗？"
G["Shall we see what the grunts have to say about your stolen antiquities?"]="让我们看看那些兽人步兵对失窃的古物都知道些什么？"
G["Shall we slay them for the impertinence of disturbing our sleep?"]="我们是否该杀了这群打扰我们安息的无理之徒呢？"
G["Shall we try another...?"]="我们不如试试别的……？"
G["Shall we?"]="我们应该这样希望吗？"
G["Shaman"]="萨满祭司"
G["Shaman Jakjek is quiet for a Frenzyheart, but still very strong. He probably the only reason Kartak not turned on more of us."]="就狂心狼獾人来说，萨满祭司亚克耶克显得安静了些，但是他拥有强大的力量。这或许是卡塔克不敢肆意妄为的唯一禁忌。"
G["Shaman Vekjik comes out of the underbrush nearby."]="萨满祭司维克伊克从旁边的灌木丛中走了出来。"
G["Shaman Vekjik scurries off towards Frenzyheart Hill."]="萨满祭司维克伊克朝狂心岭的方向奔去。"
G["Shaman Vekjik, I have spoken with the big-tongues and they desire peace. I have brought this offering on their behalf."]="维克伊克，我诚恳地和大舌头怪们谈过了，他们渴望和平。这是他们赠送的求和礼物。"
G["Shaman and druid ways are very different. When was the last time you saw one of us turn into a wild beast?  ... nevermind."]="萨满和德鲁伊之道截然不同。你什么时候看见过我们变成野兽？……算了。"
G["Shaman! The Dragon Soul is not yours. Give it up, and you may yet walk away with your life."]="萨满！巨龙之魂不属于你。现在放手，你还有机会活着离开这里。"
G["Shaman."]="萨满祭司。"
G["Shaman...? A troll mystic of some sort has come to the city recently to visit Harene upon the Walk of Elders. She might be able to help you."]="萨满祭司……？一个神秘的巨魔最近来到这里拜访长者步道的哈雷尼。她也许能帮助你。"
G["Shamanism has brought you here... Its scent permeates the air. *The Lich King laughs* I was once a shaman."]="萨满的精魂将你带来了这里……我能感应到空气中涌动着那种力量。*巫妖王大笑起来* 我也曾是个萨满祭司。"
G["Shamanistic healing is a complex art. You can't just chain heal all day."]="萨满的治疗术是一种复杂的艺术。你不可能花一整天的时间来操纵治疗的能量。"
G["Shamans, show me what your totems can do!"]="萨满祭司，让我看看你们的图腾到底是干什么用的！"
G["Shame to sit on something so pretty."]="坐在这么漂亮的东西上面真是不好意思。"
G["Shan Bu shall fall! Are you ready to proceed?"]="¡Shan Bu caerá! ¿Estás $glisto:lista; para continuar?"
G["Shan Bu! Again you try to create a God. When will you learn?"]="山怖！你又妄想造神了。你何时才能吸取教训？"
G["Shan Bu's monstrosity remains at the foot of the palace. It must be stopped before it wreaks havoc across Pandaria."]="山怖的怪物还在宫殿之下。我们必须在它肆虐潘达利亚之前阻止它。"
G["Shan Bu, secure the inner courtyard. None should look upon my works and live."]="山怖，守住内庭。绝不能让活人见到我的造物。"
G["Shan Kien's eyes glow with Sha Magic!"]="单简的眼睛闪耀着煞能的光芒！"
G["Shan Kien's hand twists into a Sha Claw!"]="单简的手畸变成了煞之爪！"
G["Shan-ze! Hei Feng! Kill him!"]="山泽！黑风！杀了他！"
G["Shandris raises her bow to the stars!"]="珊蒂斯弯弓对准了群星！"
G["Shane Dabiri, Lee, Alex T., Rob F., J. A. B.,  A. Mayberry!"]="¡Shane Dabiri, Lee, Alex T., Rob F., J. A. B., A. Mayberry!"
G["Shaohao must have sent you."]="你一定是少昊派来的救星。"
G["Shaol'mara Beastcaller summons raptors to his aid!"]="绍尔马拉驭兽师召唤迅猛龙前来助战！"
G["Shapeshift!  Get ready for de moonfire!"]="变形！接受月火术的试炼吧！"
G["Shapeshift!  Get ready to taste my claws!"]="变形！尝尝我爪子的厉害！"
G["Shapeshift!  Here come de moonfire!"]="变形！月火术出场！"
G["Shapeshift!  Here it comes, mon!"]="变形！接招，伙计！"
G["Shapeshift!  Oh no!  Not again..."]="变形！哦不！不会吧……"
G["Shapeshift!  Over here, mon!"]="变形！这边，这边！"
G["Shapeshift!  Time for bear form!"]="变形！该熊登场了！"
G["Shapeshift!  Time for cat form!"]="变形！变个猫玩玩儿！"
G["Shapeshift!  Try to swim away now, mon!"]="变形！现在试着游走，伙计！"
G["Shapeshift!  Uh oh... wait a minute here..."]="变形！呃哦……等一下……"
G["Shapeshift!  Zen'Kiki will absorb de damage!"]="变形！赞吉吉吸收伤害！"
G["Shapeshift!  Zen'Kiki's ready to pounce!"]="变形！赞吉吉准备猛扑！"
G["Shaping the flow of time is a very difficult and quite delicate task, but you have performed admirably today."]="修正流动的时间是非常困难和精细的工作，但是你今天表现得很完美。"
G["Share in my pain!"]="分担我的痛苦！"
G["Shark!!!"]="鲨鱼！！！"
G["Sharp claw."]="锋利的爪子。"
G["Sharp teeth, muscles like cables, and a mind like a steel trap. This fella is one of the finest pets I have ever seen. Now if ye are interested, I could show ye a few things to make even the weakest of Raptors into a force to be reckoned with."]="锋利的牙齿，坚实的肌肉，还有钢铁般的意志。这可是难得的宠物啊。如果你有兴趣，我可以告诉你如何把最弱的迅猛龙变成你在战斗中最好的伙伴。"
G["Sharp teeth, sharp claws."]="尖牙与利爪。"
G["Sharp tooth."]="锋利的牙齿。"
G["Sharp!"]="疼！"
G["Sharpbeak's the finest gryphon in Aerie Peak. He'll get you right to the top of Jintha'Alor, and we'll take the top terraces in no time."]="沙普比克是鹰巢山最出色的狮鹫。它会把你直接送到辛萨罗顶部，我们就能以迅雷不及掩耳之势直取顶层平台。"
G["Sharpbeak."]="沙普比克。"
G["Shatter Point is a great place for a Wildhammer dwarf.  I've never had so much time in the air!"]="破碎岗哨很适合蛮锤矮人，我从来没在空中逗留过这么久！"
G["Shatter the bones!"]="碎骨成灰！"
G["Shattered Sun scum!  Fire at will!"]="破碎残阳的垃圾！随意开火！"
G["Shattered!"]="支离破碎！"
G["Shattrath did not fall, as you can see.  To the contrary, the naaru known as Xi'ri, led a successful incursion into Shadowmoon Valley - Illidan's doorstep.\n\nThere he continues to wage war on Illidan's armies with the assitance of the Aldor and the Scryers.\n\nThe two factions have not given up on their old feuds, however. Such is their animosity that they vie for the honor of being the ones sent to assist the naaru there.  Each day, that decision is made by A'dal right here in Shattrath."]="沙塔斯城没有沦陷，就像你看到的那样。相反，那个叫做克希利的纳鲁发动了一次向影月谷——伊利丹的门阶的袭击。\n\n在那里，在奥尔多和占星者的帮助下，他持续向伊利丹的军队发动猛攻。\n\n他们争先恐后地想要为纳鲁效力，想要在纳鲁那里获得更多的荣耀。可是睿智的阿达尔却能让这两个派系维系着微妙的平衡。每一天，双方的军队都聚集在这里，等待着由阿达尔决定派遣谁到影月谷去参战。"
G["Shattrath is more than a staging ground for war against the Burning Legion and Illidan.  It serves as a sanctuary to those seeking to escape the violence surrounding us.\n\nWe would be hypocrites if we turned the refugees away.\n\nIf your question refers to the Scryers, then I will respond that while I may not like them or their leader's wild claims of visions of redemption, it is not for us to question the wisdom of the naaru.\n\nThese are difficult times, $n.  We need allies where we can find them."]="Shattrath es algo más que un cuartel general para la guerra que libramos contra Illidan y la Legión Ardiente. Es un santuario para los que quieren refugiarse de la violencia que nos rodea.\n\nSi no aceptáramos a los refugiados, seríamos unos hipócritas.\n\nSi preguntas por los Arúspices, te diré que, aunque no me gusten ellos ni su líder, no tenemos la autoridad para cuestionar la sabiduría de los naaru.\n\nSon tiempos difíciles, $n. Necesitamos a todos los aliados que podamos encontrar."
G["Shattrath was once the draenei capital of this world. Its name means \"dwelling of light.\""]="Shattrath fue antiguamente la capital draenei de este mundo. Su nombre significa \"morada de la Luz.\""
G["Shattrath's battlemasters often congregate on the stairwells between the upper and lower city. The Alliance battlemasters gather in one place, the Horde in another, with the arena battlemasters between and across from them."]="沙塔斯城的军官们经常聚集在上层平台和贫民窟之间的楼梯口。联盟的军官们在一个地方，部落的在另一个地方，竞技场管理员在他们中间。"
G["Shattrath's flight master is Nutral. You will find him east of the city's center."]="沙塔斯城的飞行管理员是努特拉尔。你可以在城市中心的东面方找到他。"
G["Shattrath's inns are full of wounded refugees. Still, there is room among the draenei Aldor and blood elf Scryers on Aldor Rise and Scryer's Tier."]="沙塔斯城的旅店里住满了受伤的难民。尽管如此，在奥尔多高地和占星者之台还有属于奥尔多的德莱尼人和血精灵占星者自己的旅店。"
G["Shay, what'sh your deal anwaysh? Are you shome kind of elf or shomethin? You looksh shorta familiar."]="嘿，有什么可以为你效劳的？你是精灵还是什么？你看上去有点眼熟。"
G["Shaza-kiel!"]="¡Shaza-kiel!"
G["Shcourged trooolls roashting...."]="堕落的巨魔……"
G["She allowed herself to be defeated. The others will not be so weak."]="她的失败是自找的。剩下的可没那么好对付。"
G["She asked for eggs. Eggs for her fiery hatchery in another realm.\n\nAnd one egg... a special egg... she sought more than any other."]="她要这些蛋。要把它们带到她在另一个王国的炽热孵化场。\n\n而其中一只蛋……很特别的一只……是她最想要的。"
G["She blames me, you know."]="我知道，她在怪我。"
G["She came from Thundermar, they say"]="他们说，她从桑德马尔而来"
G["She demanded that we immediately head back to Hive'Regal! Brann would have none of that sass. He told her that there's no way we would go back into those hives without an army backing us up. It had gotten far too dangerous. The number of those stinking insects seemed to have tripled from when we first ventured into 'em.\n\nThat's when Natalia lost it!"]="她要我们立即返回雷戈虫巢！布莱恩拒绝了她。他认为我们在没有军队支援的情况下是无法进入虫巢的。那样太危险了。跟我们首次进入虫巢相比，这些虫子的数量似乎膨胀了3倍。\n\n纳塔莉亚就是在那时得了失心疯的！"
G["She did? He is?\n\nI suppose I'll have to head over there then. Maybe... after a few more bites of food..."]="她找到了？他在抱拳林？\n\n看来我得走一趟了。也许……等我再吃几口……"
G["She has a name, you know. Anara. You'd do well to treat her with the respect she deserves.\n\nHow many times have she and her sisters brought you back from the grip of death itself? You're just all kinds of inconsiderate, aren't you?"]="她有名字。她的名字是安娜拉。你应该对她保持应有的尊敬。\n\n她和她的姐妹们有多少次将你从死亡的利爪中拯救出来？你这种人真是从来不懂得尊重他人，不是吗？"
G["She has returned. Tha revenge of the Darkspear finally comes to pass dis day.\n\nLet me know when ya ready, $n. We'll not let her slip away again."]="她回来了。暗矛部族的仇恨终于要在今天有个了结。\n\n准备好以后就告诉我们，$n。我们绝不会再让她逃走。"
G["She hits 'em between the eyes, every time."]="她每次都能一枪爆头。"
G["She is here at my invitation, courier. Most of my Farstriders are away and cannot be recalled easily. Vereesa's rangers know the land and they are experienced combatants."]="是我邀请她来到这里的，信使。我手下大多数远行者都在远方，无法轻易召回。温蕾萨的游侠们熟知这片土地，他们也都是经验丰富的战士。"
G["She is trying to throw you off, hold on tight!\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_desecrated_leatherglove.blp:32|t Hold On"]="她要把你甩下去，抓紧了！\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_desecrated_leatherglove.blp:32|t坚持住"
G["She looked like Li Li."]="她长得很像丽丽。"
G["She made the back cover too!"]="还上了封底！"
G["She must answer for her crimes."]="她必须要偿还自己的罪孽。"
G["She must be torn by grief over her husband's death."]="她肯定是对她丈夫的死太伤心了。"
G["She now resides at the side of Emperor Thaurissan. He has her under some sort of powerful thought altering spell... and here I sit, completely helpless."]="她现在就在索瑞森大帝身边。他对她施加了某种可以改变思维的强大法术……而我只能待在这儿，束手无策。"
G["She of the skies, but also of darkness. Brood of the Earth-Warder. Invincible!"]="她是天穹之主，也是黑暗之王。她是大地守护者的子嗣。她是不可战胜的！"
G["She retains knowledge and speech, and even the self sufficiency to perform tasks for you. Precisely what did you do?"]="她保留了她的知识和语言能力，同时还能为你出色地完成任务。你到底做了些什么？"
G["She said to meet her right here... maybe I'm in the wrong place?"]="她约我在这里碰面的……难道我找错地方了？"
G["She scare me, she mean and say we smell bad. She in War Quarter, inner ring."]="她可吓人了，总是很刻薄，还说我们很臭。她就在军事区的内环。"
G["She seems to be assaulting her own towers!"]="看来她要攻击自己的塔楼了！"
G["She should be a pile of bones and slime! Strong of stomach, indeed..."]="她早该变成一堆枯骨和烂泥了！她还真有一个好胃啊……"
G["She stole your man, girlfriend! You know what you gotta do!"]="女孩，她偷走了你的人！你知道该怎么做！"
G["She submits.  Well done, fleshling."]="她屈服了。干得好，血肉之躯。"
G["She tests us. We will not disappoint Her."]="她在考验我们。我们不会让她失望。"
G["She took a pretty nasty spill. the damage is horrific! I haven't been able to wake her."]="她狠狠摔了一跤。伤势严重！我一直都叫不醒她。"
G["She trusts no one. Paranoia gnaws at her mind. She is driven by fear unrelenting."]="她不相信任何人。妄想侵蚀了她的心智。无尽的恐惧驱使着她的行动。"
G["She wanted me to tell you lugs that she appreciates the job that we did for her on the Furlbrows. Gave me a pile o' gold to split with you all."]="她要我转告你们这群蠢货，她很欣赏我们替她对法布隆一家所做的一切。还给了我不少赏金，让我跟你们分。"
G["She was a female dwarf.  A paladin.  She used the last of her mana curing comrades before falling to her own infection."]="女性矮人的血样。这位圣骑士在临死前，用她仅剩的法力治疗了自己的同伴。"
G["She was found by our patrols this morning.  Murdered within our own city."]="今天早上，她被我们的巡逻队发现了。她就在我们自己的城市里被谋杀了。"
G["She was ready ta forge a new future for the Kirin Tor, one where the Horde-allied Sunreavers and the Alliance-sided Silver Covenant could work together in peace."]="她已经准备好为肯瑞托创造一个崭新的未来，让部落的夺日者和联盟的银色盟约能够在一起和平共处。"
G["She was ready ta forgive the Horde fer the destruction o' Theramore."]="她已经准备好原谅部落在塞拉摩的所作所为。"
G["She will feast on yer soul!"]="她将享用你的灵魂！"
G["She will never return the dwarf to you!"]="她绝对不会将那个矮人还给你！"
G["She will protect me!"]="她会保护我！"
G["She won't let me go down to the excavation, so I've become somethin' o' a personal assistant and chauffeur."]="她不让我下挖掘场，所以我就成了私人助理和司机。"
G["She'll have our heads if we're caught!"]="如果我们被抓住的话，她会取我们的性命的！"
G["She's a beaut', isn't she? Sky'ree... the faithful gryphon of our commander. Kurdran himself, he holds his audiences in th' stronghold. I care fer our Sky'ree here when he's busy. Gorgeous creature, she is; as strong and fierce as they come. She'd die fer Kurdran, she would. A more loyal soul ye've ne'er seen.\n'Tis an honor to care fer her, it is."]="Es una preciosidad, ¿a que sí? Cielo'ree, el fiel grifo de nuestro comandante. Kurdran ha desaparecido, ¿sabes? No está muerto, no; eso no lo sabremos hasta que encontremos el cuerpo. Y todavía entonces, habrá quienes no lo crean. Mientras tanto, Cielo'ree está con nosotros, esperando a que vuelva."
G["She's a real powder-keg that one. She'd make a fine Firebeard! Y'think the Thundermars would go for it?"]="她就像火药桶一样一碰就炸！所以她一定能生出最优秀的焰须战士来！你认为桑德玛尔会答应吗？"
G["She's all fixed up and ready to go. Treat her nice!"]="它已经翻修一新，随时可以出发啦。要好好待它哟！"
G["She's attacking the keep! Bring her down!"]="她正在攻击要塞！击落她!"
G["She's attacking the towers again."]="她又去攻击塔楼了。"
G["She's beautiful..."]="她真的很美……"
G["She's breaking up, sir!"]="舰体严重损毁，长官！"
G["She's called in more siege weapons!"]="她正在调集更多的攻城武器！"
G["She's coming! Quiet down, you fools! The Dark Lady approaches..."]="她来了！安静，你们这帮傻瓜！黑暗女王驾临……"
G["She's drawing power from the fires! Stamp out the braziers, quickly!"]="她正在从火焰中吸取力量！赶快扑灭火盆！"
G["She's going to blow! Get a parachute and jump!"]="她要炸了！快背好降落伞准备跳！"
G["She's gone too far. I'm certain the Alliance can move their war mages through the city at will. That human ... witch!"]="她太过分了。联盟的战斗法师肯定横行达拉然了。那个人类……巫婆！"
G["She's here to make new friends... and then set them on fire! It's Pandaria's prettiest little playful pyromaniac, Liuyang!"]="她来这里结交新朋友……然后放火烧他们！这是潘达利亚最漂亮的小淘气纵火者，流炀！"
G["She's here! Get in that cannon, damnit! Get ready to fire!"]="她来了！准备好火炮，该死！随时开火！"
G["She's hung up in the debris and I've lost steam pressure. This terrain is murder!\n\nCan you get us out of this?"]="她被困在了这堆垃圾里，而我已经失去了蒸汽动力。这里的地面太泥泞了！\n\n你能帮我们离开这里么？"
G["She's just as beautiful as ever! Please, $n, tell her for me!"]="她依然那么美丽！$n，拜托你转告我的话！"
G["She's not here."]="她不在这里。"
G["She's not lying.  Nordrassil is in danger.  I must make haste and prepare for Hyjal's defense."]="她没撒谎。诺达希尔处于险境之中。我必须加紧准备海加尔的防御。"
G["She's sent you to do her dirty work, has she? I'll deal with the countess after I've killed you, fleshling!"]="她派你来完成这个肮脏的任务，对不对？杀掉你之后，我自然会去对付她！"
G["She's so smart and funny! I'm head over heels for her."]="她是那么聪明、有趣！我为她神魂颠倒。"
G["She's sooo strong!"]="她可真——强壮！"
G["She's still breathin', sir! Get over here! Talk to 'er!"]="她还有呼吸，长官！快过来！跟她说说话！"
G["She's surrounded herself with a small army of deranged dragon cultists. They may not by right in the head, but they're well-armed. And dangerous."]="她由一群疯狂的巨龙教徒守卫着。那些教徒也许脑子不太正常，但却武装到了牙齿，极度危险。"
G["She's tall!"]="她真高！"
G["She's turning her siege weapons on her own towers!"]="她将攻城武器对准了自己的塔楼！"
G["Sheena Sunweaver is known for her sales of reagents and can be found in the chamber of masters, to the left as you enter the building.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="辛娜·织日在师匠大厅里兜售试剂，就位于你进入建筑物时的左侧。\n\n我会在你的地图上标记这个位置。"
G["Sheesh, Hao. Haven't you ever paid attention?"]="嘘，昊。你一直都没注意听吗？"
G["Sheesh, guys! Hurry it up already!"]="嘘，伙计们！得赶快了！"
G["Sheesh, you don't have to beg! Anyways, I'm almost done with the story.\n\nSo, the whole company is in the middle of that massive chamber fighting over this amulet, and you know how it echoes in there! In the end it was broken into three pieces, and we rolled the dice, with it going to various people or groups.\n\nThe rest is a bit of a blur, though, because it was at about that time that old Valthalak's spirit decided to make an entrance and start summoning forth all of these spectral assassins."]="咳，你也不用求我呀！无论如何，这个故事已经快讲完了。\n\n当时，全兵团的人都进入那个大房间里，为争夺饰品而战，你可以想象那里的回声有多大！最后，它裂成三部分，我们决定投骰子来决定这三部分饰品的归属。\n\n最后的事我已经有点记不清了，或许是因为那时候老瓦塔拉克的灵魂开始出现在尘世间，并召唤了那些幽灵刺客。"
G["Shelby Stoneflint houses a good deal of pets for the local hunters.  She can be found over by the Thunderbrew Distillery if ye need her to look after a pet."]="谢尔比·石火帮当地猎人看管宠物。如果你想让她帮你照看宠物的话，就去雷酒酿制厂找她吧。"
G["Shen-zin Su has never returned to Pandaria."]="神真子再也没有返回潘达利亚。"
G["Shen-zin Su hasn't made landfall for a long time. But that hasn't stopped some pandaren from exploring, anyway."]="神真子很久没有上岸了。可那也没能阻止某些熊猫人外出探险。"
G["Shen-zin Su!"]="神真子！"
G["Shen-zin Su, the very land on which we stand, is in deep pain. Though I don't know the source, I can feel his ache within my own body."]="神真子，也就是我们脚下的这片土地，正承受着极大的痛苦。虽然我不知道这痛苦从何而来，但我对此感同身受。"
G["Shen-zin Su, we are the descendants of Liu Lang.  We've sensed your pain, and we want to help."]="神真子，我们是刘浪的后人。我们感到您很痛苦，我们想帮您。"
G["Shenthul, I have lost my whistle and I have no more flares. Please help!"]="申苏尔，我丢了我的哨子，也没有信号枪啦。请帮帮我！"
G["Shethnoth, ol'goth, grell. Such is the mantra of those who come."]="Shethnoth, ol'goth, grell，这便是即将到来者的咒文。"
G["Shh! Be very quiet; I'm observing murlocs.\n\nLiving in an oversized turtle shell is a sacrifice I'm willing to make for science. After all, if the murlocs see me here, they'll react to my presence and contaminate my data!\n\nAs the first gnomish member of the Explorers' League, I'm boldly going places no dwarf has gone before!"]="嘘！安静点，我正在监视那些鱼人。\n\n住在这个大龟壳里是我对科学的献身精神的体现。毕竟，要是让那些鱼人看到我在这里，它们肯定会做出一些反应，这样数据就乱套了！\n\n作为探险者协会的第一名侏儒会员，我大胆地来到了矮人从未涉足的地方！"
G["Shh! I'm working undercover here."]="嘘！我躲在这里呢。"
G["Shh! Keep your voice down. The babes are sleeping."]="嘘！小声点。孩子们正在睡觉。"
G["Shh! Someone's here."]="嘘！有人在这里。"
G["Shh! They can hear you, dummy!"]="嘘！会被他们听见的，呆瓜！"
G["Shh, jinyu. It's hard enough to fish here as it is!"]="嘘，锦鱼人。在这儿钓鱼已经够困难了！"
G["Shh, mon!  We be hidin' here."]="嘘，小声点儿！我们正躲着呢。"
G["Shh... quiet, death knight.  When I'm finished with you, your fear will be gone."]="嘘……安静，死亡骑士。当我了结你的时候，你的恐惧也将不复存在。"
G["Shh... quiet, it da new $g king : queen;."]="Shh... silencio, es $g el : la; $g nuevo : nueva; $g rey : reina;."
G["Shhh!"]="嘘！"
G["Shhh!  SHHH!!!!!  Maybe if you shtay quiet your pet might come back to you!"]="嘘！嘘！！！如果你能安静一会儿，也许你的宠物就会回来找你了！"
G["Shhh! The spirits are sleeping!"]="嘘！灵魂们正在长眠！"
G["Shhh! You're scaring the fish away."]="嘘！别把鱼给吓跑了。"
G["Shhh, $n. I will need total concentration to attend these wounds."]="嘘，$n。我必须专心处理这些伤口。"
G["Shhh, an outlander."]="Sssh, $gun forastero:una forastera;."
G["Shhh, this patient needs to rest."]="嘘，这个伤员需要休息。"
G["Shhh... I have a little secret I've been keeping."]="嘘……我还保守着个小秘密。"
G["Shhh... do you smell something?"]="嘘……你闻到什么了吗？"
G["Shhh... it will all be over soon."]="嘘……很快一切就都结束了。"
G["Shhhad ak kereeesshh chak-k-k!"]="¡Shhhad ak kereeesshh chak-k-k!"
G["Shhhh - Please don't give away my position when I'm out in the field. Mathas needs to know what's happening out here."]="嘘……我在战场上的时候请不要暴露我的位置。马萨斯需要知道这里发生了什么。"
G["Shhhh! Come quietly. She's practicing."]="嘘！脚步轻点儿。她正在修炼。"
G["Shhhh! Keep it down! You'll blow our cover."]="嘘！轻点儿！你要害我们被发现了。"
G["Shhhh! They don't know that I'm hiding here."]="嘘！它们不知道我藏在这里。"
G["Shhhhh! You'll blow my cover!"]="嘘！你会让我的伪装暴露的！"
G["Shhhhhh, my sweet darling, sleep now and be at peace."]="嘘，亲爱的。现在，安静地睡吧。"
G["Shield defense arming. Executing in 10 seconds."]="护盾防御正在启动，10秒后执行"
G["Shield defense arming. Executing in 20 seconds."]="护盾防御正在启动，20秒后执行"
G["Shield defense arming. Executing in 30 seconds"]="护盾防御正在启动，30秒后执行"
G["Shield generators all over the island are protecting the Heart of Zan'vess, preventing us from reaching the weapons cache."]="覆盖整个岛屿的护盾生成器保护着扎尼维斯之心，使我们无法抵达武器库。"
G["Shield our vessel Shadow-Warders!"]="暗影卫士，保护我们的飞船！"
G["Shield-Mages, get some shields up!"]="护盾法师，撑起护盾！"
G["Shields"]="盾牌"
G["Shifting, %s moans from the pain of his thorn scratch."]="由于被荆棘划伤，%s发出了痛苦的呻吟。"
G["Shimmer Ridge. I know it well. The Frostmane trolls breed and plot atop that snow-blown mesa."]="闪光岭。我知道霜鬃巨魔就窝在那片白雪皑皑的山头上。"
G["Shimmering amber-brew! Come and try!"]="荧光琥珀酒！快来尝尝吧！"
G["Shin tried to back out of the hozen dare but then we double hozen dared him and he couldn't back out of that."]="阿信想要反悔，可我们都故意打赌说他肯定不敢去，他就没法反悔了。"
G["Shine and rise."]="闪耀上升吧。"
G["Shine yer armor for a copper."]="擦一件装甲只收一个铜板咯！"
G["Shiney jab-jab, wikket."]="留下买路财，蠢蛋。"
G["Shinies!"]="酷！"
G["Shiny things! Shiny things! Not as shiny as my crystal, but still shiny!"]="亮闪闪！亮闪闪！虽然不如我的水晶闪亮，但依然很闪亮！"
G["Shiny tools mine! Tasty carrots mine! All for Kunzen. All for Chief Yip-Yip!"]="闪亮的工具是我的！可口的胡萝卜也是我的！一切都属于昆森。一切都属于酋长伊普伊普！"
G["Shiny!"]="真是闪亮啊！"
G["Ship it!"]="搬走它！"
G["Shipping lanes... supplies... You bore me to death! We need nothing more than the warrior spirit of the Horde, Saurfang! Now that we are firmly entrenched in this frozen wasteland, nothing shall stop us!"]="航道……补给……我快给你烦死了！萨鲁法尔，部落需要的只是勇者无畏的精神罢了！既然我们已经在这片冰原上站稳了脚跟，还有什么能阻挡我们呢！"
G["Shipwrecked on an island infested with bomb-throwing monkeys? What's next... is there a volcano that's going to blow?!"]="一座岛屿旁的失事船只上挤满了扔炸弹的猴子？那这以后又会有什么……一座即将爆炸的火山？"
G["Shipwright, sir."]="造船工，长官。"
G["Shipwright."]="造船工。"
G["Shirts with leg-holes. Reversable shirtshorts!"]="有腿洞的衬衫。翻领衬衫短裤！"
G["Shirvallah, fill me with your RAGE!"]="西瓦尔拉，让我感受你的愤怒吧！"
G["Shiver me timbers!"]="天哪！"
G["Shkul an'zig qvsakf KSSH'GA, ag'THYZAK agthu!"]="¡Shkul an'zig qvsakf KSSH'GA, ag'THYZAK agthu!"
G["Shock it until it can't move anymore!  It's causing a riot in here!"]="电击它，别让它动弹！真是一团糟！"
G["Shock then silence overtakes the crowd."]="众人震惊了片刻，随即是一片沉默。"
G["Shocking!"]="颤栗吧！"
G["Shocking, I know."]="很震惊？我可以理解。"
G["Shocking."]="震死你。"
G["Shocking. I know."]="很震撼。我知道。"
G["Shoes are for the weak."]="弱者才穿鞋。"
G["Shoes with wheels on them. And gloves with wheels - for when you fall down."]="带轮子的鞋子。还有带轮子的手套——专为你跌倒时设计。"
G["Shoja'my is over in front of the inn.  Now move along, I'm busy."]="苏亚米在旅馆前面。去吧，我正忙着呢。"
G["Shokia an' Kiryn went off to do some girl stuff."]="夏琪亚和琪麟处理姑娘们的私事去了。"
G["Shokia watched the prisoner while Kiryn went ahead."]="琪麟继续前进，而夏琪亚留下看守俘虏。"
G["Shokia, they've spotted me! Give me cover!"]="夏琪亚，他们发现我了！掩护我！"
G["Sholazar Basin"]="索拉查盆地"
G["Shomi is such a child!"]="朔弥还是个孩子！"
G["Shomi should not want to fight. That is a man's job!"]="朔弥不会想去战斗的。那是男人的责任！"
G["Shoo!"]="咻！"
G["Shoo, shoo!"]="嘘，嘘！"
G["Shoot all the guards, so I can move ahead!"]="放倒所有守卫，我才能前进！"
G["Shoot for loot! Who wants to shoot for some loot?"]="射击得奖励了！有人想射几件奖品回去吗？"
G["Shoot it between the eyes! Those beasts are vulnerable there!"]="瞄准它们的眉心！那里是怪兽的弱点！"
G["Shoot it down!"]="击落它！"
G["Shoot it in the face! And the sides! And the pooper! You know, the soft bits."]="先来个迎面痛击！接着打两侧！然后打尾巴！你知道的，这些是软肋。"
G["Shoot it! Destroy it!"]="射击它！摧毁它！"
G["Shoot straight to the northwest section of the Valley of Honor.  There you will find the Hunter's Hall."]="你的目标位于荣誉谷西北角。你会在那儿发现猎人大厅的。"
G["Shoot!"]="射击！"
G["Shooting Gallery?"]="射击场？"
G["Shooting you a glance, %s frowns and spits."]="%s撇了你一眼，又是皱眉又是吐唾沫。"
G["Shore up those flanks!"]="撑住侧翼！"
G["Shorry about your shoes."]="抱歉弄脏了你的鞋子。"
G["Short work, an' none too pretty!"]="不工作的人不美丽！"
G["Shortly after you disappeared into the jungle, rescued soldiers began returning to us at Paw'don. It wasn't difficult to track you here."]="就在你进入丛林之后，得救的士兵就开始陆续返回坡东村。跟着你找到这里并不困难。"
G["Shortly afterward, another raccoon befriended me."]="很快，又有一只浣熊跟我交上了朋友。"
G["Shot down by a group of alliance cowards?! PATHETIC!"]="被一队联盟懦夫给击落了？！真是可鄙！"
G["Shot out of the sky!"]="击破长空！"
G["Shotgun!"]="射击！"
G["Should I ever escape this prison..."]="我还能逃出去吗……"
G["Should I know? You look like an orc to me."]="我应该知道吗？你看上去就像个兽人。"
G["Should I live through this, I shall make it my life's sole ambition to destroy Arthas..."]="如果我能活下来，我一定把杀死阿尔萨斯当做毕生的目标……"
G["Should I run?"]="我该跑了么？"
G["Should Kil'jaeden rise up through the Sunwell our world will be thrown into a war the likes of which has not been seen for 10,000 years!"]="如果基尔加丹通过太阳之井进入这个世界，我们就将陷入一场一万年以来最残酷的战争。"
G["Should have had more fiber in your diet then."]="看来以后你的膳食里该多加点纤维素了。"
G["Should the Empress ever fall to corruption or endanger our civilization, the Klaxxi are sworn to unseat her."]="一旦女皇堕入腐化或威胁到我们的文明，卡拉克西就一定让她皇位不保。"
G["Should try the special."]="应该试试特别的。"
G["Should we allow them to stay here? They have wounded to tend to."]="我们不该让他们留在这儿吗？他们有伤员需要照料。"
G["Should we fail, he'll chase us into the afterlife to take his retribution."]="要是我们失败了，他会一直追到地狱来惩罚我们的。"
G["Should you actually succeed in accomplishing this monumental feat, return here, to Death's Breach, with my deathcharger and use the Horseman's Call to summon Salanar from the realm of the living."]="等你成功地完成这项创举后，就带着我的死亡战马返回死亡裂口，用骑手的召唤将萨拉纳尔从生者的世界召唤出来。"
G["Should you choose to follow me, be on guard. The animals and beasts of the Darkshore will not harm me but they may attempt to harm you, adventurer."]="Si eliges seguirme, mantente en guardia. Los animales y las bestias de Costa Oscura no me harán daño a mí, pero a ti posiblemente intenten atacarte, $gaventurero:aventurera;."
G["Should you desire sustenance, Galley Chief Grace can tend to your needs."]="肚子饿的话，可以找厨师长格莱斯。"
G["Should you ever be buried neck deep in a field of feces and urine, I will be sure to lend you a hand."]="Si alguna vez te encuentras $gmetido:metida; hasta el cuello en un campo de heces y orina, me aseguraré de echarte una mano."
G["Should you ever need aid of any kind, from a handful of turnip seeds to a volley of arrows, know that Zhu's Watch will provide it."]="如果你今后需要任何帮助，不管是缺少芜菁种子还是箭矢，朱家堡永远是你的坚实后盾。"
G["Should you pass this door, at this time, you would fail!  You, all of you, are corrupted with the insiduous plague known as Pride."]="如果就这样让你们进去，你们一定会失败的。你们，全都被名为“傲慢”的恶疾腐蚀了。"
G["Should you venture outside the gates, $c, be alert; a garishly-dressed troll may attempt to approach you. Leave him to his exile where he rightly belongs."]="如果你要出城冒险的话，$c，小心那个衣着光鲜的巨魔，他可能会尝试接近你。不要理他，让他在那里享受他应得的放逐吧。"
G["Should you wish to defeat the corruption, you will first need to purify the corruption within yourselves."]="要想击败腐蚀，首先要净化自己内心的腐蚀。"
G["Should your zeppelin be attacked en-route, panic is inadvisable."]="如果你们的飞艇在途中遭到攻击，惊慌失措肯定是不明智的。"
