G["Sif... was Sif here? Impossible--she died at my brother's hand. A dark nightmare indeed...."]="西芙……西芙在这里吗？不可能——她被我的兄弟杀死了。一场黑暗的噩梦……"
G["Sigh... she has always been this way. Proud, decisive, and always right.\n\nIn twenty years, I have not yet won an argument.\n\nWhy have I not yet learned my lesson?"]="唉……她总是这样。自负，执拗，从不认错。\n\n二十年了，我从来都没有在争执中赢过她。\n\n我怎么就不会吸取教训呢？"
G["Sighing quietly, the %s awaits the inevitable."]="%s轻轻叹了口气，等待着无可避免的结局。"
