G["Sighted, but blind to the truth. Embrace the finality of it all!"]="空有双眼，却看不见真相。拥抱这一切的终结吧！"
G["Sightless I may be, but vision I have.\n\nMy primary dealings are with hunters and rogues, $r."]="我眼睛瞎了，但是我还拥有洞察力。\n\n我主要跟猎人和潜行者打交道，$r。"
G["Sign me up!"]="算我一个！"
