G["Sigrid Iceborn has returned to the heights of Jotunheim to prove herself against $n.  When last they met, $n bested her in personal combat.  Let us see the outcome of this match."]="齐格莉德·冰魂已经重返尤顿海姆，她将与$n展开对决。他们上次交手时，$n战胜了她。这场比赛的胜负如何呢？让我们拭目以待吧！"
G["Silas kept me safe from my previous captors..."]="希拉斯把我从那群绑匪手里救了出来……"
