G["Silence, servant! Vengeance will be mine! Death to Stormwind! Death by chicken!"]="肃静，仆人们！复仇吧！摧毁暴风城！让他们全军覆灭！"
G["Silence, you motherless mu'shan herders! I'd blame your clan, but your skulls are too thick to figure out a child's puzzle box, let alone how to usurp power."]="闭嘴，你们这些没娘养的穆山兽放牧人！我本以为是你们氏族的错，可你们比三岁小孩都笨，更别说篡权了。"
G["Silence... at last."]="终于……安静了。"
G["Silent and deadly."]="悄然致命。"
G["Silithid"]="异种虫"
G["Silk farming is a dangerous business."]="养蚕取丝真是一个危险的活儿。"
G["Silly lizards. Did you think you could defeat the mighty yaungol?"]="愚蠢的蜥蜴人，你们以为能击败强大的野牛人？"
G["Silly wikket! Brew is for hozen!"]="该死的蠢蛋！啤酒是给猢狲的！"
