G["Silver Covenant."]="银色盟约。"
G["Silver Pig"]="银猪"
G["Silverbrook is due northwest of here.  A small community of hunters and trappers.  They know the lay of the land -- it would be good to have them on our side."]="银溪镇就在西北方。镇上的居民都是猎户。他们熟知这里的地貌，如果能争取到他们的支持，对我们是非常有利的。"
G["Silvermoon Champion's Pennant"]="银月城冠军的旗帜"
G["Silvermoon City"]="银月城"
G["Silvermoon has been allies with Dalaran for over 2000 years. It is not a friendship we should idly toss aside at the whim of our 'esteemed' Warchief Garrosh.\n\nOh... are you here about the artifact?"]="Lunargenta es aliada de Dalaran desde hace más de 2000 años. No se trata de una amistad que se pueda olvidar por capricho de nuestro \"estimado\" Jefe de Guerra Garrosh.\n\nAh, ¿has venido por el artefacto?"
G["Silvermoon, over nine thousand..."]="银月城，超过九千……"
G["Silverwing is ours!"]="银翼是我们的！"
G["Silvia, I'm sending you to the Tower of Estulan to drive out the Gordunni ogres. Your diplomacy and strategy will both be put to the test."]="西尔维亚，我要派你前往埃斯图兰之塔驱逐那些戈杜尼食人魔。看看你的外交手段和战略对策能否经受住考验。"
G["Simmer say Gordo got guts, but got no brains.  Why he mean?"]="希米尔说葛尔多有肚子，却没有脑子。这是什么意思？"
G["Simple fools! Time is the fire in which you'll burn!"]="愚蠢的家伙！时间就是吞噬你躯体的烈焰！"
G["Simple game, for simple folk. Think you can manage it?"]="很简单的游戏，傻瓜都能玩。你有信心玩好吗？"
G["Simple kindnesses, charitable deeds, service to those in need. These are all fruits of the Light."]="真诚、仁慈、宽恕、奉献。这些都是圣光结出的硕果。"
G["Simple stimulus-response tests.  Normally my kind does not interfere with the matters of Azeroth, but here in Un'Goro, we are free to take a more direct approach.  As Un'Goro is the experimental ground of the Titans, it is our right to do so.\n\nFor example, say Khaz'goroth wants to know what happens when one of his creations is exposed to a sulfurous hot spring.  He could wait for millenia, observing, and waiting for the creature to accidentally stumble and fall in.  Or, he could place the creature in the water himself.\n\nIn Un'Goro, we may do so."]="简单的刺激——响应测试。一般来说，我们不会干扰艾泽拉斯的运转。但在安戈洛，我们可以自由地使用更加直接的手段，因为安戈洛是泰坦的试验场。\n\n比如说，卡兹格罗斯想要知道，当他创造的一种生物被暴露在硫磺热泉中的时候，会有怎样的变化。他可以等待千万年，观察，等待这种生物在偶然间跌落入热泉——或者他或许亲手将这种生物放进热泉中。\n\n在安戈洛，我们就能这么做。"
G["Simpletons! You cannot comprehend the forces you have set in motion. The ley line conduit will not be disrupted! Your defeat shall be absolute!"]="蠢货！你们根本无法理解这种你们正在对抗着的伟大力量。魔网能量的传输是不会被你们干扰的！而你们，唯一的结局只有失败与死亡！"
G["Simply aim and pull the trigger. Or don't aim. I wash my hands of the whole thing."]="只要瞄准，再扣动扳机。或者不瞄准也行。你会怎么干和我可没有任何关系。"
G["Simply amazing!\n\nYou're reading this which means that DAN IS THE MAN!"]="真是令人吃惊！\n\n你读的这个东西意思就是“DAN纯爷们！”"
G["Simply amazing!  You can fight by my side any day."]="太棒了！希望有一天能够和你并肩作战。"
G["Simply grab a nearby parachute to be vaulted clear of the burning zeppelin. Hopefully onto dry land."]="只需要抓住身边的降落伞，跳离燃烧的飞艇。然后希望自己能平安落在陆地上就行了。"
G["Simply put, you must tell the tuskarr that they cannot run. If they do so, their spirits will be destroyed by the evil rising within Northrend."]="请你转告卡鲁亚克海象人，逃亡是没有出路的。一旦选择逃亡，他们的灵魂将被诺森德滋生的邪灵毁灭。"
G["Simply stated, this is correct.\n\nThe Earthen's physical features are that of a smaller stature humanoid, though their composition is that of Azeroth's various stone core compounds.  Their design maximizes strength and stamina without sacrificing cognitive processing power.  Their skin and musculature are nearly impervious to physical damage, and with very minor modifications the Earthen display a remarkable resiliency to unwanted magical forces."]="简单地说，事实确实如此。\n\n虽然土灵的外表看上去像是一个小型的人型生物，但它们包含了艾泽拉斯大陆上各种石头的成分。它们在得到了力量和耐力最大化的同时也没有牺牲敏锐的感觉。它们的皮肤和肌肉的设计使其几乎完全免疫物理伤害，而且只需进行非常小的改动，土灵就可以展现出惊人的魔法抗性。"
G["Sin'dorei and Forsaken share a common goal in the Ghostlands, $n.  Together we shall defeat the Scourge and who knows... perhaps the Forsaken will be valuable allies in our quest to reach Outland."]="$n，辛多雷和被遗忘者在幽魂之地的目标是一致的。我们将共同击败亡灵天灾，或许在我们进军外域的过程中，被遗忘者也将成为最有价值的盟友……谁知道呢。"
G["Sin'dorei have lost far too much in the past years.  Our land, our homes, even our identities...\n\nIt's about time we started taking it all back."]="辛多雷在过去的日子里失去了太多。我们的领土，我们的家园，甚至我们的自我……\n\n是时候把一切都夺回来了。"
G["Sinan, may I please have the Wings of Hope again?"]="思南，请再给我一次希望之翼好吗？"
G["Since I'm not farming right now, this is a great way to pass the time!"]="反正我现在不用种田，这真是个消遣的好去处！"
G["Since landing here I have seen horrors that had previously only haunted my darkest nightmares, but nothing could have prepared me for what lies beyond the mist.\n\n<Mootoo nods.>\n\nThrough that fog, not more than a few yards from us, stand the bloodthirsty creatures known as Kvaldir. None have returned from the fog and few that were originally at the landing when the mist rolled in have escaped. The area has since been condemned by Hellscream. Enter at your own risk..."]="自打我来到这里，就目睹了原本只存在于噩梦中的恐怖景象，但是没有什么能比潜伏在迷雾中的可怕生物更让人毛骨悚然了。\n\n<穆图点了点头。>\n\n就在距离我们几码的雾气中，盘踞着一种名叫克瓦迪尔的噬血生物。迷雾席卷码头时，只有少数的幸运儿捡回了性命。从那之后，但凡进入迷雾的人无一生还。地狱咆哮也因此将这里划为禁区。如果你坚持要进去的话，后果自负……"
G["Since meeting you I have fought legends and seen countless wonders."]="遇见你以来，我们经历了传奇般的战斗，见证了数不清的奇迹。"
G["Since my husband left for the front, Helene here has been my strength. Her kind heart and sharp sword have helped me through a lot of tough times. I don't know what I would've done without her."]="自从我的丈夫上了前线后，海伦尼便一直保护着我。她用善良的心肠和锋利的宝剑帮助我度过了无数艰难岁月。没有她，我真不知道会发生什么事。"
G["Since the dark days of the old kingdom, we pandaren have turned to the mystical art of brewing to keep our spirits and strength high.\n\nEven as we speak, brewmasters wander the world, seeking rare and powerful ingredients to craft the finest of brews.\n\nThose who seek out these elusive brewmasters and lend them aid may earn flavorful items. At the very least, you will drink plenty of brew!"]="从古代王国的黑暗时期开始，我们熊猫人就开始依靠神秘的酿造工艺保持充沛的精力和体力。\n\n甚至在我们谈话的时候，我们的酒仙仍然在周游世界，寻找罕见和充满力量的成分来酿造最好的酒。\n\n找到这些行踪不定的酒仙并且帮助他们的人，可以得到香甜可口的美酒。至少，你能喝个够！"
G["Since the fall of Dalaran and the destruction of Quel'Thalas, wares of this sort have been hard to come by. But Lucan Cordell and some of our other Tradesman have been doing a fine job of filling our orders with quality merchandise."]="在达拉然陷落和奎尔萨拉斯被摧毁之后，这样的东西就很难在世面上看到了。但是鲁坎·考迪尔和我的其他一些商业伙伴很好的完成了我的订单。"
G["Since the fall of Grim Batol, we Wildhammers have never truly been united. Out here in the Highlands, forgotten by the rest of the world, the different clans have all gone their separate ways.\n\nTo join them all back together isn't going to be easy."]="自从格瑞姆巴托陷落之后，我们蛮锤部族就再也没有真正团结起来。在这高地之上，被世界所遗忘，各个部族都已选择了各自的生存方式。\n\n若想将他们重新凝聚在一起可不是件容易的事。"
G["Since the founding of Orgrimmar, many trials have tested the Horde, but we have risen up and beaten back any who'd seek to destroy us!\n\nBut this... this is something that even my power cannot defeat. It pains me deeply to watch my people suffer from this plague. I must rely on the Forsaken for their assistance.\n\nThe Lich King will hear the approaching war drums of the Horde, but not yet. First, we must help our people before exacting our revenge on the Scourge."]="奥格瑞玛建立以来，部落历经磨难，我们一次次地奋起抵抗，击退了那些妄图消灭我们的敌人！\n\n但是，面对眼前的危机……我却无能为力。部落的子民饱受折磨，这惨不忍睹的场景令我痛苦难安。我们必须寻求被遗忘者的帮助。\n\n总有一天，巫妖王会听见震天的战鼓声，不过现在还不是时候。在向天灾军团复仇前，我们要搭救部落的子民。"
G["Since the sparrowhawks have proven such a success in hunting down the raven stones, Watcher Elaira has trained another one to relay my voice at a great distance. He can help us communicate as you investigate the bird spirits revealed in the tablet!"]="麻鹰被证明在搜索乌鸦石方面是非常有天分的，因此观察者艾莱亚训练了另一只麻鹰远程传递我的声音。当你研究显现在石板上鸟的灵魂时，它可以帮助我们进行联络！"
G["Since we've begun our stay in the crater, Dadanga's taken a liking to the large bloodpetal sprouts that grow all over the place here.\n\nI'm sure she'd enjoy a snack, if you feel like bringing her some..."]="从我们呆在环形山这里开始，达丹加就喜欢上了遍布这里的巨大的血瓣花苗芽。\n\n我敢肯定她会喜欢，如果你愿意带给她一大堆花苗芽的话……"
G["Since you are a tailor of some skill, I can tell you that I know some special recipes.   I know recipes for both the Wispcloak and the Deathchill Cloak."]="你是一位颇为出色的裁缝，因此我可以教你一些特别的图样，比如精魂披风和死寒披风。"
G["Since you saw Shan Kien's memory, they been sendin' scouting parties out."]="既然你阅读了单简的记忆，他们一定会派出侦察队。"
G["Sing... yes! Sing in agony!"]="吟唱……对！痛苦地吟唱！"
G["Sink your teeth into a fresh, ripe apple."]="快来买这些苹果啊，又甜又脆的新鲜苹果！"
G["Sintharia, your master owes me a great debt -- one that I intend to extract from his consort's hide!"]="辛萨尼亚！你的主人欠我一笔巨债——我要好好在你的身上讨回来！"
G["Sinu a'manore, champion."]="Sinu a'manore，勇士。"
G["Sinu a'manore. If you seek to learn how to conjure a portal to Theramore, I can show you."]="Sinu a'manore。如果你想要学习开启一道通向塞拉摩的传送门的法术，我可以帮你。"
G["Sir Zeliek, a paladin in life, so strong in his faith, that even in undeath, the power of the light still heeds his call, smiting his foes in battle."]="瑟里耶克爵士。生前他是一名信仰坚定的圣骑士，虽然他已是死灵之躯，却依然能召唤圣光的力量惩击敌人。"
G["Sir!"]="长官！"
G["Sir!  If I don't get out there and fight for Azeroth, then why am I in this army? I enlisted to do a job, and I intend to see it through."]="长官！要是我不去为艾泽拉斯而战，那么为什么我要加入这支军队呢？我应征就是为了能为军队效力，我要坚持到底！"
G["Sir! The fleet is straight ahead."]="长官！舰队正向前进发。"
G["Sir! Until my body ceases to function!"]="长官！我将不惜一切代价来完成任务！"
G["Sir! We have reports of a Man'ari abomination being summoned to the west. I am deploying the Defenders to intercept along the path to Blood Watch."]="长官！我们收到报告说，一个艾瑞达堕落者在西面被召唤了出来。我会派遣防御部队在通往秘血岗哨的路上拦截他。"
G["Sir, Farstrider Solanna informs me that attacks on Zeb'Tela and Zeb'Nowa are underway. She was able to recruit a promising, young candidate to help with the situation. Also, the apothecary upstairs has made mention of a solution he believes he has to also help with the trolls."]="长官，远行者索兰娜告诉我，对塞布提拉和塞布努瓦的攻势正在进行中。她招募到了一个可靠的年轻人来帮助她处理各种状况。另外，楼上的药剂师提到一种药剂，他相信那也可以帮到我们解决巨魔。"
G["Sir, I am here to deliver my report from the Scryer's Tier."]="长官，我是从占星者之台来递交报告的。"
G["Sir, I demand to be released to my father's custody!"]="先生，我要求你立即释放我，并将我送到我父亲那里！"
G["Sir, I need another flying machine..."]="长官，我需要一架新的飞行器……"
G["Sir, I think the explosions and gunfire gave us away. You don't have to use hand signals."]="长官，爆炸和枪炮的声音应该已经让我们暴露了。你不必再打手语了。"
G["Sir, I think we were close with the Lethargy Root in that last poison recipe."]="先生，我认为上一张配方中死亡根须的用量已经很接近合适剂量了。"
G["Sir, I... my orcs were working well, so I just... thought I'd..."]="长官，我……我的兽人们干得很好，所以我只是……认为我……"
G["Sir, if you could at least get my gender correct..."]="先生，你至少得认清我的性别吧……"
G["Sir, it appears that another of our special units have arrived."]="长官，看来我们的另一批特殊单位已经到位了。"
G["Sir, it's impossible to read anything into their actions."]="长官，我们不可能从他们的行动中得到什么情报。"
G["Sir, my name is... Oh, never mind..."]="先生，我的名字是……啊，算了……"
G["Sir, no, sir! Another dispatch has arrived from Tranquillien. It's High Executor Mavren again, captain. This time the language in the letter was very 'colorful'. He reiterates his request that we marshal the Farstriders in support of the efforts against Deatholme, and suggests that you should send a runner north to Farstrider Retreat in Eversong Woods and muster their forces as well."]="¡Señor, no, señor! Ha llegado otro informe de Tranquillien. Se trata nuevamente del sumo ejecutor Mavren, capitán. Esta vez el lenguaje de la carta era muy \"colorido\". Reitera su petición de que formemos a los Errantes en apoyo de los esfuerzos contra la Ciudad de la Muerte y sugiere que usted debería enviar un mensajero al norte, al Retiro del Errante, en el Bosque Canción Eterna, y unirse también a sus fuerzas."
G["Sir, our customers are complaining that there's not enough Maiden's Anguish in our Deadly Poisons."]="先生，有客户投诉说我们出售的致命药膏中，魔女之毒的含量不足。"
G["Sir, our customers are complaining that there's too much Deathweed in our Anesthetics."]="先生，有客户投诉说我们出售的麻醉药膏中，丧命草的含量过高。"
G["Sir, student requests that you beat him for his lack of understanding!"]="长官，学生希望您对我的愚钝做出惩罚！"
G["Sir, these Kor'kron don't seem very friendly!"]="长官，这些库卡隆看起来不是很友善啊！"
G["Sir, these are Garrosh's men."]="长官，那是加尔鲁什的人。"
G["Sir, we can have the entirety of the seventh fleet on the scene within the month--"]="长官，我们在本月内就能集齐整支第七舰队——"
G["Sir, we're doing everything we can to address the leak!"]="长官，我们正在尽一切可能找出泄漏的位置！"
G["Sir, we've just flown in from the south. What are your orders?"]="长官，我们已经从南面进入了。有何指示？"
G["Sir, yes Sir!"]="遵命！"
G["Sir, yes sir!"]="遵命，长官！"
G["Sir, yes sir! Private will do their best to not die, sir!"]="是，长官！士兵的职责就是尽他们所能坚持到底，长官！"
G["Sir, yes, sir!"]="遵命！"
G["Sir.  The reinforcements were cut off by Neferset troops.  We are on our own."]="长官，援军被尼斐塞特的军队阻截了。我们只能靠自己了。"
G["Sir?"]="长官？"
G["Sire, any news from the king?"]="陛下，国王那里有什么新消息吗？"
G["Sire, let me join the fray! I shall tear their spines out with my bare hands!"]="阁下，让我参战吧！我将赤手空拳地把他们的脊椎撕碎！"
G["Sironas claims that certain eredar possess the ability to transform others of their race into man'ari. Draenei were supposedly once eredar and Sironas is a powerful eredar.\n\n<The agent laughs.>\n\nCan you believe it? These pathetic creatures were once all-powerful demons. What kind of fool rejects such power?"]="Sironas afirma que algunos eredar tienen la capacidad de transformar a otros de su raza en man'ari. Se supone que los draenei fueron eredar en sus orígenes y Sironas es una eredar muy poderosa.\n\n<El agente ríe.>\n\n¿No te parece increíble? Esos seres lamentables fueron en su día demonios poderosísimos. ¿Qué clase de idiota rechazaría ese poder?"
G["Sironas claims that certain eredar possess the ability to transform others of their race into man'ari: Savage demonic beings. Draenei were supposedly once eredar and Sironas is a powerful eredar.\n\n<The agent laughs.>\n\nCan you believe it? These pathetic creatures were once all-powerful demons. What kind of fool rejects such power?"]="Sironas afirma que algunos eredar tienen la capacidad de transformar a otros de su raza en man'ari. Se supone que los draenei fueron eredar en sus orígenes y Sironas es una eredar muy poderosa.\n\n<El agente ríe.>\n\n¿No te parece increíble? Esos seres lamentables fueron en su día demonios poderosísimos. ¿Qué clase de idiota rechazaría ese poder?"
G["Sironas is an eredar... I mean, yes, obviously."]="希隆娜丝是个艾瑞达人……我是说，当然，这很明显。"
G["Sironas stirs, master? Does she toil?"]="希隆娜丝有消息了吗，主人？她处境不妙了？"
G["Sironas will have our skulls if these are allowed to grow!"]="如果让这些东西继续成长的话，希隆娜丝会要我们的命！"
G["Sister!  The mean men were going to take me to Badmoon Isle.  They wanted to turn me into one of them."]="姐姐！那些卑鄙的家伙打算将我带去邪月岛，把我变成他们的一员。"
G["Sister! I... too... have f-failed..."]="姐妹！我……也……失——败了……"
G["Sister, look! The artifact is surrounded by an aura of darkness!"]="姐妹，快看！那个神器被黑暗的光环所围绕！"
G["Sister, we must act! If we do nothing, we will lose our entire harvest to a war we have no part in!"]="妹妹，我们必须行动起来！否则，我们所有的收成都会赔在这场自己无份参与的战斗中！"
G["Sisters, show yourselves. The time for subtlety is past. We will face our enemies in the Plane of Fire."]="姐妹们，显身吧。隐藏的时刻已经过去了。我们要去火焰之地对付敌人。"
G["Sisters, the village need our help. Head to the front lines and heal the wounded!"]="姐妹们，村庄需要我们的援助。到前线上去，治疗伤员！"
G["Sit and listen to my story, $r."]="坐下来听听我的故事吧，$r。"
G["Sit down!"]="坐下！"
G["Sit with me a while. We can roast crabs over the fire and sing songs."]="和我一起坐一会儿。我们可以唱唱歌，在火上烤烤螃蟹。"
G["Sittin' in the middle of enemy forces with not much more than this cloaking chicken protectin' us. This has become my new normal!"]="藏身于敌军腹地，只靠这只隐身小鸡来保护我们。这已经变成我最新的日常工作了！"
G["Sitting easier than killing."]="坐下总比战斗容易。"
G["Sitting here injured and watching my brothers fight is almost too much to bear, but even I understand that I'm more valuable alive than dead."]="负伤坐在这儿，看着我的弟兄们奋力战斗，这感觉可真让人难以忍受，可就连我都知道，我活着的价值要比死掉大得多。"
G["Situated along the Zoram Strand of Ashenvale, Blackfathom Deeps was once a glorious temple dedicated to the night elves' moon-goddess Elune. However, the great Sundering shattered the temple - sinking it beneath the waves of the Veiled Sea. There it remained untouched - until, drawn by its ancient power - the naga and satyr emerged to plumb its secrets. Legends hold that the ancient beast, Aku'mai, has taken up residence within the temple's ruins."]="位于灰谷佐拉姆海岸的黑暗深渊曾经是为供奉暗夜精灵月神艾露尼尔建造的。然而，在大分裂中，神庙受到极大的冲击然后沉入了海中。它一直保持着原样——直到，其蕴含的古老的力量吸引来了纳迦和萨特。传说，古代怪兽阿库麦尔就居住在神庙遗迹中。作为古代之神最喜欢的宠物之一，阿库麦尔就一直生活在这个地区进行捕食。在阿库麦尔的吸引下，一群被称作幕光之锤的教徒也聚集在这里从事邪恶的勾当。"
G["Six Lieutenants control the front line's defenses. They must be destroyed first and fast! We cannot risk one of their priests returning the fallen Lieutenants to life.\n\nShould all of the Lieutenants be killed in quick succession, the morale of the front lines will falter! It will be shattered! Their troops will run in fear, leaving the remaining soldiers without backup."]="六名中尉指挥着前线的防御事务。必须迅速解决他们！我们绝不能让他们的任何一名牧师活着逃回去。\n\n要是我们能很快结果掉所有的中尉，前线的士气将大跌！战线也会很快攻破！他们的军队将落荒而逃，留守的士兵将失去后援。"
G["Six weeks? I spent six years in Durnholde! You cannot possibly expect me to just throw aside something that has been a part of my life for so long!"]="六个星期？我在敦霍尔德待了整整六年！这玩意儿跟了我这么久，我怎么可能如此轻易就摆脱它！"
G["Sk'yahf qi'plahf PH'MAGG!"]="¡Sk'yahf qi'plahf PH'MAGG!"
G["Skadi the Ruthless is within range of the harpoon launchers!"]="残忍的斯卡迪已经进入鱼枪的射程！"
G["Skaldrenox!  I hold your scepter, and charge you to enter this world!"]="斯卡德诺克斯！我手中握着你的节杖，我召唤你进入这个世界！"
G["Skar'this has informed us well. We have worked our way into the slave pens and await your cryomancerss."]="卡希斯已经告诉我们了。我们已经进入了奴隶围栏，就等你们的冰术师了。"
G["Skarvald, you incompetent slug! Return and make yourself useful!"]="斯卡瓦尔德，你这无能的废物！滚回来，让我把你变得更有用一点！"
G["Skeer the Bloodseeker has returned! Unnngghhh..."]="觅血者斯基尔归来了！啊……"
G["Skeezy says he already paid for my flight to Hardwrench Hideaway.  I'm ready to depart."]="斯奇兹说他已经为我前往硬钳避世乐园的旅途付过钱了。我想现在出发。"
G["Skeletal mages. A perfect opportunity to display the utility of some of our powers."]="骷髅法师。这是展示某些技能的绝好机会。"
G["Skeletons have advanced past the Hall of Lights!  Destroy them!"]="骷髅已经进入了光明大厅！消灭他们！"
G["Skeletons. Simple play things, but there are lessons to be learned even here."]="骷髅。即便是骨头架子这样的玩物，我们也能从中学到新的知识。"
G["Skettis prevails!"]="斯克提斯胜利了！"
G["Skill is important, but sometimes it comes down to luck."]="技巧很重要，但归根结底有时候还得看运气。"
G["Skill with a weapon is but a physical manifestation of one's martial strength. Let me show you what spiritual power is!"]="会舞刀弄枪只能证明你们身子骨不错，略懂武学。让我告诉你们什么才是融汇真气之力。"
G["Skillfully done."]="水准高超。"
G["Skimmer, old friend, it is your turn to battle."]="掠影者，我的老朋友，该你出战了。"
G["Skin on fire!"]="我身上着火了！"
G["Skin ye right up and our customers will never know the difference!"]="你的皮也成啊，反正客户也瞧不出什么差别！"
G["Skin, glorious skin. It holds your insides... in. You might've noticed my skin's not doing so well. To think I used to worry about my pores. Hardly any skin left to worry about these days. In a way, it's very freeing."]="肤质很好。它将你包裹其中。你也许已经注意到我的皮肤不是那么好。我过去常常担心自己的毛孔。这些日子我几乎不担心皮肤了。在某种程度上，它得到了解放。"
G["Skin... burns... the... pain..."]="皮肤……滚烫……好痛……"
G["Skinners and leatherworkers of all sorts may be found at Legendary Leathers in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran."]="魔法商业区的传说皮甲汇集了各种剥皮和制皮训练师。魔法商业区就在达拉然的西北部。"
G["Skinning"]="剥皮"
G["Skinning allows you to remove and prepare the hides from slain creatures. These can be sold at the auction house or used to support the Leatherworking profession.\nSkilled Skinners also become masters of anatomy, increasing their chances to critically hit a target.\nYou'll need a Skinning Knife in order to skin creatures; this can be purchased from trade or Leatherworking vendors."]="El desuello te permite extraer y tratar el pellejo de criaturas muertas. Se puede vender en la casa de subastas o aprovechar para suministrar la profesión de peletería.\n\nLos desolladores cualificados pueden convertirse en maestros en anatomía, lo que aumenta su probabilidad de asestar un golpe crítico contra un objetivo.\n\nNecesitarás un cuchillo para desollar; se lo puedes comprar a un amigo a los vendedores de peletería."
G["Skinning?  The only thing ye look like ye could skin is yer own knee!  Ha!  Now why don't you go see Balthus Stoneflayer so he can teach you how to properly skin some animals.  You'll find him in Finespindle's Leather Goods on the northern side of The Great Forge."]="剥皮？能不能学成只有看你自己了！哈哈！你为什么不去找巴尔萨斯·裂石呢，他能教你如何剥皮。他在大熔炉北面的皮甲用品店。"
G["Skip the warmup, sister... or are you too scared to face someone your own size?"]="你还需要热身吗……莫非你害怕面对与你同等体型的对手？"
G["Skullcrusher the Mountain goes into a frenzy!"]="碎颅者魔山陷入狂怒之中！"
G["Skulls you will give and skulls I will take."]="我是不会放过你的！"
G["Skullsplitter... is... forever... mon..."]="劈颅……是……永存的……伙计……"
G["Skwak!"]="¡Skwak!"
G["Skwol!  I hold your scepter!  I command you to enter this world!"]="斯古恩！我手中握着你的节杖，我召唤你进入这个世界！"
G["Sky Commander Keller, I don't like my Deathwing Brood Cloak."]="天空指挥官凯勒，我不喜欢这件死亡之翼血脉披风。"
G["Sky'ree."]="斯卡雷。"
G["Skybreaker infantry, hold position!"]="破天号的兄弟们，给我顶住！"
G["Skydancer Shun can teach you how to fly in Pandaria. He rides his cloud serpent on the main terrace. I will mark his location on your map."]="舞空者书恩可以教你如何在潘达利亚飞行。他就在主露台上，骑着他的云端翔龙。我会在你的地图上标出位置。"
G["Skyguard Rangers, MOUNT UP!!"]="天空卫队游侠，准备起飞！！"
G["Skymaster Skyles stands just before the gate to Eversong Woods."]="飞行管理员斯凯勒斯就站在通向永歌森林的大门前。"
G["Skymistress Gloaming and her dragonhawks are just outside and to the west of the Shepherd's Gate."]="葛拉米和她的龙鹰就在城外的牧羊人之门西面。"
G["Skymistress Gloaming stands just outside the Magister's Gate near Silvermoon proper, tending to the dragonhawks."]="葛拉米就站在银月城的魔导师之门外，她管理着龙鹰。"
G["Skywing, I will free you from your curse over my dead body!"]="天空之翼，除非杀了我，否则我永远也不会让你从这个诅咒中解脱！"
G["Slain Hatchlings will drop feathers, use the feather to fly for short periods of time."]="被击杀的雏鸟会掉落羽毛，使用羽毛可以短暂飞行一段时间。"
G["Slap Ringo before he passes out!"]="狠狠地抽林格，别让他昏过去。"
G["Slate, did the Axe of Earthly Sundering return to you?"]="岩幔国王，裂地之斧回到你手里了吗？"
G["Slaughter them all! Show no mercy, brothers!"]="消灭他们，绝不怜悯，兄弟们！"
G["Slaughter them all."]="杀光他们！"
G["Slaughter them, $c! Destroy as many naga as you can to honor those that fell."]="消灭他们，$c！摧毁尽可能多的纳迦，为逝去者报仇。"
G["Slaughter yourselves for my amusement!"]="自我了断，供我消遣吧！"
G["Slave thing! Go get chicken for Goregek!"]="奴隶！快来帮格利基克抓鸡啊！"
G["Slave thing, you so full of fail."]="奴隶，你太令我失望了。"
G["Slavery and death are all that away you."]="等待你的只有奴役和死亡。"
G["Slaves - everywhere slaves. You can see what we fight against."]="奴隶——到处都是奴隶。你明白我们为何要抗争了吧。"
G["Slaves to our own prince, we're treated worse alive than dead."]="我们都是王子的奴隶，我们的境遇生不如死。"
G["Slaves... Zombies... It don't matter to Zanzil. Dey all serve Gurubashi, one way or de other..."]="奴隶……僵尸……赞吉尔都无所谓。他们都要服侍古拉巴什，无论是活还是死……"
G["Slay Ancient Spirits to empower the Staff of Pei-Zhi!"]="杀死古代灵魂来为裴智之杖充能！"
G["Slay Warden Stillwater before you're overwhelmed!"]="¡Mata al celador Aguaserena antes de que te veas $gsuperado:superada;!"
G["Slay all Redfang!"]="杀光红牙熊怪！"
G["Slay all who see us!  Word must not get back to Illidan."]="把所有看到我们的人都杀掉……一定不能让伊利丹得知我们的到来！"
G["Slay all who see us... word must not get back to Illidan."]="把所有看到我们的人都杀掉……一定不能让伊利丹得知我们的到来！"
G["Slay her now, before Aviana's magic wears off!"]="艾维娜的魔法还未褪去，现在就杀了她！"
G["Slay stone troggs."]="在线。"
G["Slay the Idra'kess Mistresses to destroy the shield!"]="消灭埃卓凯丝海妖，摧毁护盾！"
G["Slay the courier!"]="干掉信使！"
G["Slay the last prisoner.  Maybe our intruders will reconsider their foolish actions now!"]="杀了最后的那个战俘。我们的入侵者现在也许会重新考虑他们那愚蠢的行动了！"
G["Slay them all! No excuses! No mercy! No rest!"]="杀了他们！别找借口！没有怜悯！不留俘虏！"
G["Slay them all, $n!"]="杀光他们，$n！"
G["Slay them all. Leave their husks for the master to consume..."]="杀光他们。把他们的壳留给主人享用……"
G["Slay them in the master's name!"]="以主人之名，杀了他们！"
G["Slay them!"]="杀光他们！"
G["Slay them!  Don't let the Scourge scum defile our city!"]="消灭他们！不要让那些天灾垃圾污染我们的城市！"
G["Slay them, my brethren! For the Scourge!"]="兄弟们，杀了他们！为了亡灵天灾而战！"
G["Slay these dogs, Kaylaan!  Earn your place in the Burning Legion!"]="干掉这些狗东西，凯兰恩！提升你在燃烧军团的地位吧！"
G["Slay these intruders, filthy Dreghood!  I promise you neverending pain if you disobey me!"]="消灭这些入侵者，肮脏的残冠氏族！如果你们不服从我的命令，我会让你们尝到无尽的痛苦！"
G["Sleep no longer, my love. With the might of the Lich King behind you, the world will tremble."]="从沉睡中醒来吧，我的爱。有了巫妖王的支持，世界将因你而颤抖。"
G["Sleep now in the cold dark...."]="在寒冷的黑暗中长眠吧……"
G["Sleep now, little one. We'll find your parents soon."]="睡吧，小家伙。我们很快就能找到你的爸爸妈妈。"
G["Sleep now, young one...."]="沉睡吧……"
G["Sleep on your own time!"]="别睡了！"
G["Sleep time yet?"]="睡觉时间到了？"
G["Sleep... finally..."]="终于……可以安息了……"
G["Sleepy... so sleepy..."]="困啊……真是困死了……"
G["Slickies love wikket slerp...  Hozen grookin' love wikket slerp!"]="光板儿喜欢蠢蛋的去死……猢狲也喜欢蠢蛋去死！"
G["Slickies?"]="光板儿？"
G["Slicky not so slick now eh?"]="光板儿现在不光了？"
G["Sliiickeeey!"]="光……板儿！"
G["Slinger eat slicky. Slicky make dooker. Slingin' dooker grook the Jinyu!"]="吊尾吃鱼。鱼造武器。吊尾武器杀锦鱼人！"
G["Slink back to your pathetic mist. Return and we will slaughter every last one of you."]="逃回你那可悲的迷雾中去吧。要是胆敢回来，我们就要把你们杀得一个不剩。"
G["Slinky, I need a new mook disguise!"]="史莉琪，我需要一件新的巨怪伪装服！"
G["Slip a little coin into the boss's hand and look what it gets ya. I love my job. Though, if I could find a way to get that little firecracker Snurk reassigned to this port....well, I can't imagine it any better. But I'm betting that you aren't here about my business practices. You're looking for the Zeppelin to Undercity, am I right? Well that's great, because it docks right here behind me. Oh and hey, if you see Snurk, put a good word in for me, would ya?"]="将一枚硬币塞到首领手中，看看你会得到什么。我喜欢自己的工作。但是，如果我能设法让斯纳尔克重新分配给这个飞行点的话……那样就好了。但是我敢打赌，你到这儿来不是要帮我进行职业训练的，而是寻找地精飞艇前往幽暗城，对吧？那很好，因为它会停泊在我后面。如果你看见斯纳尔克，代我向他问好，行吗？"
G["Slip-an-die! Dooker!"]="滑倒，去死吧！暴徒！"
G["Slippery little stone trogg."]="狡猾的石头穴居人。"
G["Sloppy, but adequate.  You seem capable in a fight and in need of direction.\n\nThere are hundreds of demons ahead, it would be suicide to go it alone:"]="Arriesgado, pero adecuado. Pareces ser bastante $gdiestro:diestra; en el combate y necesitar dirección.\n\nHay cientos de demonios ahí delante, sería un suicidio ir solo:"
G["Slow down Mei, I'm getting tired!"]="慢点儿，梅，我累了！"
G["Slow down you big fool!"]="慢点儿，你这大蠢货！"
G["Slow down! I was getting to that!\n\nSo there he was, standing tall with all the blood and guts dripping off him when who shows up?\n\nThe Dark Irons! Didn't you hear a word I said??\n\nWell, the Dark Irons are a little craftier than those Blackrock orcs. They came prepared. By prepared I mean there were about 300 of em... *hic* 'scuse me."]="放慢速度！就快接近了！\n\n他在那儿，全身血肉模糊，连内脏都流出来了，是谁把他弄成这样的？\n\n黑铁矮人！你记得我说过的话吗？？\n\n嗯，黑铁矮人比黑石兽人更为狡猾。他们是有备而来的。人数有300之多……*嗝尔*。"
G["Slow down, $r. The one you need to kill is already dead. Killing him again will serve no purpose. There are very few ways in which a lich can actually be destroyed and none of those means are available to you or I. That is why I have a plan. A plan that will have a very noticeable and real impact upon the Cult."]="Con calma, $r. A quien tienes que matar ya está muerto. Matarlo de nuevo no serviría para nada. Hay algunas formas de destruir a un exánime pero ninguna de ellas está en tus manos ni en las mías. Por eso he concebido un plan. Un plan que tendrá un impacto real y muy notable en el Culto."
G["Slow down, friend. You say the General is coming?\n\nNow THERE'S a trophy for my wall! I'll distract the bodyguards, but it will be up to you to kill General Hawthorne himself. Are you ready to strike?"]="Cálmate, $gamigo:amiga;. ¿Dices que viene el general?\n\n¡Ese sí que es un trofeo digno de mi pared! Yo distraeré a los guardaespaldas, pero te tocará a ti matar al general Hawthorne. ¿Estás $glisto:lista; para entrar en acción?"
G["Slow kobold look tasty!"]="磨洋工的家伙总能令我胃口大开！"
G["Slowly then."]="慢点儿。"
G["Slumber... another dream awaits you..."]="睡吧……另一个梦境在等着你……"
G["Slurp. YUM!"]="啧啧。真是美味！"
G["Small, one-time portals to a major Horde or Alliance city.\n\nThe shards all washed down the drain together, so there's no way for me to know which shard will end up going where. The best I can do is figure out whether they came from Sunreaver portals or Silver Covenant portals. Both sides like to put a little signature in their portal magic - typical elvish flair.\n\nI'll sell you shards appropriate for your faction, and you'll find out where they go once they're stabilized."]="一座通往部落或联盟主城的一次性小型传送门。\n\n它们都是一起被冲下来的，所以我也不知道哪个碎片能够通向哪里。我最多只能分辨出它们是来自于夺日者的传送门，还是银色盟约的传送门。这两边都喜欢在自己的传送门魔法中加入一点自己的特色——典型的恶趣味。\n\n我可以卖给你相应阵营的碎片，而你得在它们稳定下来之后自己分辨它们通向哪里。"
G["Smart money's on the gnomes to take the next race! Get your money in while you still can!"]="明智的人绝对会赌侏儒获胜的！快下注啦，比赛马上就要开始了！"
G["Smash da' siege, $n! Murp will know."]="毁掉那些攻城器械，$n！莫普会知道的。"
