G["Smash the pumpkin!"]="打碎南瓜！"
G["Smash their kegs! DRAIN BREWFEST DRY!"]="打碎他们的酒桶！倒掉这些美酒！"
G["Smash them! Destroy them! Lok'tar ogar!"]="砸扁他们！打碎他们！为了部落的荣耀！"
G["Smash them! Grind the bones into the dirt!"]="粉碎他们！把他们的骨头碾进泥土里！"
G["Smash them! Then we join attack upon Temple of Earth!"]="干掉它们！我们得尽快加入大地神殿的战斗！"
G["Smash!"]="杀！"
G["Smashing the pumpkin reveals a hidden treasure!  This is the greatest day you've ever known!"]="打碎南瓜就能得到隐藏的财宝！这真是太棒了！"
G["Smear the ash on my face like war paint!"]="将我脸上的灰尘抹去！"
G["Smell blood, do you?"]="闻到血了，你呢？"
G["Smell blood. Puny fleas afraid to fight."]="鲜血的味道。只有卑微的蝼蚁才会害怕战斗。"
G["Smell flesh... close..."]="敌人…来了..."
G["Smell good!"]="闻起来真香！"
G["Smell ugly near. Me smell you ugly."]="附近的味道真难闻。你身上真臭。"
