G["Snake."]="你是一条蛇。"
G["Snakecoil Cavern."]="盘蛇洞穴。"
G["Snap out of it! You're alive! Nazgrim has ordered us to report to the nearby village."]="振作起来！你还活着！纳兹戈林命令我们去附近村子报到。"
G["Snap out of it, girl. You must destroy the Lich King at the place where he merged with Ner'zhul - atop the spire, at the Frozen Throne. It is the only way."]="振作起来，女孩。你必须在巫妖王和耐奥祖融合的地方－－冰封王座，将他终结。这是唯一的办法。"
G["Snap to attention, $n, one of our finest, is here!"]="快看，我们最棒的勇士$n，在这里！"
G["Snarl calls me simple because I am too slow. I just want to do the job right, and that takes time."]="斯纳尔因为我动作慢了所以叫我。我只是想做好工作罢了，这得花时间的。"
G["Sneak, sneak, sneak. Let me tell you something about Gorgal: Gorgal doesn't sneak."]="偷偷摸摸，鬼鬼祟祟。让我告诉你关于格高的事：格高从来不会躲躲藏藏。"
G["Sneak?! What do you think we are, marmots?"]="溜过去？！你以为我们是什么，土拨鼠吗？"
G["Sniff 'em out!"]="追踪他们的气味！"
G["Sniff for pheromones to find your way into the hive!"]="通过嗅觉寻找信息素，这样才能找到进入虫巢的路径！"
G["Sniff... That's the spirit soldier... I only wish we had more soldiers like you in this army.  Now go out there and give 'em hell!!"]="这就是士兵的精神……我真希望军队里有更多的士兵像你这样。现在拿上你的武器，送他们去地狱吧！！"
G["Sniff... We're all out... The Dark Iron dwarves... sniff... Come back later...  sniff..."]="啊……我们的酒都没了……黑铁矮人……啊……会回来……啊……"
G["Sniveling cowards! Hellscream's Horde will leave all of your brothers and sisters to a similar fate!"]="只会哭鼻子的懦夫们！地狱咆哮的部落大军将让你们所有的兄弟姐妹都面对同样的命运！"
G["Sniveling maggot!"]="无能的家伙！"
G["Sniveling pig!"]="面对我的愤怒吧！"
G["Snivvle is here!  Snivvle claims the Coldtooth mine!"]="斯尼维尔在此！冷齿矿洞是斯尼维尔的！"
G["Snooping around here won't help you much, friend. You can find out more about us from our members in the city."]="在这里晃荡是没用的，朋友。这座城市中有许多我们的人，你可以从他们那里得到更多关于我们的信息。"
G["Snow lily! We're back from the quarry! Got a special delivery just for you, my sweetness."]="雪百合！我们从采石场回来啦！我特别为你带回一车玉石哦，我的小甜心。"
G["Snowpuff and I'll be waitin'! Please hurry!"]="我和雪雾会等着的！请快去快回！"
G["Snowpuff! Ye're saved! Oh thank ye, $c!"]="雪雾，你得救了！真是太感谢你了，$c！"
G["Snuck out while my dad wasn't looking. Find me at Halfhill Market!\n- Tina Mudclaw"]="Me he escapado mientras mi padre no miraba. Puedes encontrarme en el Mercado del Alcor.\n\n- Tina Zarpa Fangosa"
G["Snuffed out like a candle! Is there anyone these three can't beat?!"]="就像蜡烛被掐灭一般！就没有他们三个打败不了的人？"
G["So $g lad : lass;, you think you have what it takes to defend the Alliance against the Horde in Alterac Valley?  Very well then, you will want to speak with our very own Glordrum Steelbeard here in Ironforge.  You'll find him strategizing over the war table in the Hall of Arms."]="那么$g小伙子:小姑娘;，你认为你具有在奥特兰克山谷帮助联盟抵御部落的能力？非常好，那么你一定希望和铁炉堡的格罗杜姆·钢须谈谈。你可以在武器大厅的战略沙图之前找到他。"
G["So Ergll, is that all that you needed for your memory potion?"]="那么，厄格尔罗，这些就是你的记忆药水所需要的全部东西么？"
G["So Garrosh hopes to isolate Kalimdor completely?"]="看来加尔鲁什是希望将卡利姆多彻底隔绝？"
G["So Garrosh is looking for something called the Divine Bell? Whatever that is, it can't be good. I'll get this information back to headquarters."]="这就是说加尔鲁什也在寻找那个叫做圣钟的东西？不管那是什么，一定不是个好东西。我会让总部知道这个消息的。"
G["So Garrosh thinks he can cheat ol' Grizzle out of a payday, huh?!"]="加尔鲁什还以为他能赖掉格里兹尔的帐，嗯？"
G["So Glubtok have two choices: die or be rich and powerful?"]="所以格拉布托克现在有两种选择——死，或是变得富有而强大？"
G["So Hakkar has returned?"]="那么说来哈卡回来了？"
G["So Hellscream's arrogance unleashed the last of the sha. I am not surprised."]="看来地狱咆哮的傲慢放出了最后一头煞魔。我早料到了。"
G["So I had my top men and women start working on a machine to do this exact task!  We've calculated down to the second how best to dist-"]="现在，我手下最精锐的技师们正在研制一台伟大的机器来完成这个使命！我们可以计算出……"
G["So I have this idea for a movie. Three gnomes find a bracelet of power..."]="我有了个能拍成电影的创意。三个侏儒找到了一个魔力手镯……"
G["So I hear Varian Wrynn is back. That true? Sorry, I'm a bit out of the loop."]="我听说瓦里安·乌瑞恩回来了。是真的吗？不好意思，我有点儿闭塞了。"
G["So I heard Thrall left the Horde. That true?"]="我听说萨尔离开了部落。是真的吗？"
G["So I heard your brother joined the Scryers?"]="我听说你的兄弟加入了占星者？"
G["So I said, \"Yeah, but that'll cost you extra.\""]="Así que dije, \"Sí, pero eso te costará más.\""
G["So I take it you aren't having any luck?"]="看来你又是空手而归？"
G["So I uh, lost my Fireliminator X-21. Can I get a new one?"]="呃，我把X-21型灭火器弄丢了。能再给我弄一个新的吗？"
G["So I was right about the energies. Let's see what the other tome has to say on the subject."]="看来我对于能量的理解是正确的。让我们去看看另一本书讲了些什么。"
G["So I'm on some mountain with some big ol' tree. Bunch of elves runnin' around all over..."]="然后我梦到一座长着大树的山，一群精灵们到处跑来跑去……"
G["So I've been sharing some of my brews around town, and everyone is raving! I can hardly believe it!"]="我将我的一些酒分享给镇子里的人，每个人都大加赞赏！我真是不敢相信！"
G["So Kel'Thuzad holds all of the pieces?"]="也就是说克尔苏加德拥有全部的碎片？"
G["So Old Man Thistle's stuck down the cave, so what does he do but whistle fer his trusty mushan, Bobo!\n\nAnd right fore long, he hears a boomin' noise, and Bobo busts a hole right in that cave!\n\nThat mushan done hear his master and come fer him!\n\nAnd then, what happens but the whole cave starts a shakin' and the ceiling starts crashing down.\n\nSo Old Man Thistle jumps on Bobo's back and you know what happened' then?"]="老农阿蓟被困在了洞穴里，于是他吹哨召唤他忠诚的穆山兽——波波！\n\n很快，他就听到了一声巨响，是波波在洞穴里炸出了一个洞！\n\n那头穆山兽听从了主人的召唤而来！\n\n而后，整个洞穴开始摇晃起来，洞顶开始坍塌。\n\n老农阿蓟跳上波波的后背，你知道后来发生了什么吗？"
G["So Tortolla has risen to fight at our side. You are wise, $n; it is difficult to earn that ancient's trust. He will be a stalwart companion."]="Así que Tortolla se ha alzado para luchar a nuestro lado. Eres $gsabio:sabia;, $n; no es fácil ganarse la confianza del ancestro. Será un aliado inquebrantable."
G["So angry, Sarok? You shouldn't drink so much... Just tell us what you know about Mosarn."]="很生气吗，萨洛克？你不应该喝这么多……告诉我们，你对莫萨恩了解多少。"
G["So angry.  We should calm you down with a nice lager... of pain!"]="这么生气啊。那我们一定得用一杯…苦酒来让你消停下来！"
G["So are the loa still holding to their side of the deal?"]="神灵们仍然在履行他们允诺的职责吗？"
G["So are you going to bring this up to the elder?"]="那么，你打算把这个交给那位长者？"
G["So be it then. I have to return to my people, brothers. Come back to me in one piece."]="那就这样吧。我要回去了。祝你平安。"
G["So be it! They will curse Thrall for a fool once they have tasted our strength! To the towers!"]="很好！一旦他们见识到了我们的厉害，就会咒骂萨尔的愚蠢了！向哨塔方向出发！"
G["So be it."]="那就这样吧。"
G["So be it. Al'galar thol, thol al'thaug: The end is the beginning."]="那就来吧。Al'galar thol，thol al'thaug：末日即是新的开始。"
G["So be it. Champions, attack!"]="好吧，勇士们，进攻！"
G["So be it. Farewell, Belmont."]="就这样吧，再见，贝尔蒙特。"
G["So be it. I shall do this myself!"]="那就来吧。我会亲自动手！"
G["So be it. It is done."]="好吧。结束了。"
G["So be it. The test is over."]="好吧，试炼结束了。"
G["So be it... brother."]="就这样吧……兄弟。"
G["So be it... you have been warned."]="那么开始吧。我已经警告过你们了。"
G["So close to blessed Lakeshire.  By the Light, let my legs carry me a bit further!"]="离湖畔镇很近了。以圣光的名义，让我坚持到那里吧！"
G["So cold!  There is no heat left in this world."]="真冷！这地方真是一点热气都没有。"
G["So cold, so dark..."]="如此寒冷，如此黑暗……"
G["So cold..."]="好冷……"
G["So cold... and hungry.\n\nMy poor friend, I hope you've found peace. I can't stand to think about what they could have done to you.\n\nYou! You there! Please, you have to help me escape. One of them has a key, can you find it? I know they have it. If you get it, you can help me get out of here. Trey is probably already dead, but there's still time! Please, can you help me?"]="真冷……我很饿。\n\n我可怜的朋友，希望你已经安息了。我不忍心去想他们会对你做什么。\n\n你！嘿，就是你！请你一定要帮我逃跑。他们之中的某个人身上肯定有钥匙，你能找到它吗？我知道他们有钥匙。如果你弄到钥匙，就可以帮我离开这里了。特雷可能已经死了，但是我还心存希望！求你了，帮帮我吧！"
G["So dark..."]="这么黑暗……"
G["So delicious!"]="真美味！"
G["So does anyone know anything about Thel'zan? Who is he? How did he come to leading the Scourge armies on the ground?"]="有谁知道塞尔赞吗？他是谁？他是如何成为统领天灾军团地面部队的统帅的？"
G["So eager to be rescued, but no one came now did they?"]="你还指望谁来救你是吧？可是都没有人露面呢。"
G["So eager to die are we?"]="你是来送死的吧？"
G["So eager you are, for my blood to spill. Yet to vanquish me, 'tis my head you must kill!"]="你们竟如此渴望将我灭亡。可却不知，首级还在，我便可避过一切灾殃！"
G["So easily fooled by Tyrion's boasts upon holy ground, you rush to him thinking he would be victorious. You always were a coward, Darion. Just like your father."]="泰里恩随口吹嘘了几句，你竟然就被蛊惑了，以为他会赢得最终的胜利。达里安，你终究是个胆小鬼啊。就跟你的父亲一样。"
G["So easily solved, you are not so complicated after all!"]="太容易解决了，你们毕竟不算复杂！"
G["So easy to break."]="这么快就死了。"
G["So easy. What a disappointment!"]="太轻松了。真让人失望！"
G["So ends you defiance of the Spell-Weaver."]="你对织法者的冒犯到此为止了。"
G["So ends your curse."]="让我结束你的诅咒吧。"
G["So enters the dragon, and his mortal champion. You are welcome here."]="小龙和他的凡人勇士来了。欢迎你们。"
G["So far away, here on the dark side of the wall."]="远离人群，在长城的阴影中彷徨。"
G["So far they're holding.  Let's turn up the heat..."]="到目前为止它们还没有被融化。让我们把温度继续调高……"
G["So far, so quiet. We're lying low around those blood elves."]="目前为止，一切平静。我们一直躲着那些血精灵。"
G["So few Klaxxi'va are even left.\n\nWhat has happened to my people while I slept?"]="存活下来的卡拉克西瓦太少了。\n\n我沉睡的时候，发生了什么事？"
G["So few. So weak."]="不值一提。不堪一击。"
G["So foolish..."]="多么愚蠢……"
G["So forget any ideas you've got about lost cities, exotic travel, and digging up the world."]="快忘了你那些关于失落的城市、奇妙的旅行以及把世界挖个底朝天的想法吧。"
G["So fragile and weak!"]="真是不堪一击！"
G["So gets a keg of Stormstout Brown..."]="让我们端起风暴啤酒……"
G["So good of you to speak with me.  Please, help the Alliance in any way that you can."]="很高兴能和你说话，请尽量帮助联盟吧。"
G["So good!  So packed with energy!"]="真是太棒啦！香味中充斥着能量！"
G["So have I, Grimtotem."]="我也一样，恐怖图腾。"
G["So have you heard about Lieutenant Blackmoore's new gladiator? Some say he's unbeatable."]="那么你有没有听说布莱克摩尔的那个新角斗士？有人说他是不败的。"
G["So he took a strange, diminutive cave creature he found and warped it with the powers of the Vale."]="他找来了一个古怪的洞穴小生物，并用锦绣谷的力量改造了它。"
G["So help me, I'm gonna count to ten and if yer not outta there by the time I reach 10, I'm comin' in!"]="帮帮我，我开始数数，要是我数到10你还没走开，我就不客气了！"
G["So help me, if I can get a single one of these lazy sods on his gorram feet, I'm puttin' him to work beating the others black and blue!\n\nWe've got WORK to do here!"]="请帮帮我，要是这群懒虫能有一个叫得动，我就会让他回去工作，再把其它人打得鼻青脸肿！\n\n我们在这儿有工作要做！"
G["So help me... If I get out of this cage there will be hell to pay."]="帮帮我……只要我能从这个该死的笼子里出来，这帮家伙就有苦头吃了。"
G["So how about you deliver a message for me?"]="帮我送个信怎么样？"
G["So how are we going to deal with this alliance between the Amani and the Zandalari?"]="那我们该如何对付阿曼尼和赞达拉的联盟？"
G["So how did he break the deal?"]="他是怎么破坏协议的？"
G["So how did he die?"]="他是怎么死的？"
G["So how did your trip to the Valley of Emperors go, wikket?"]="你的皇帝谷之旅如何呀，无毛怪？"
G["So how does the Infinite Dragonflight plan to interfere?"]="永恒之龙打算如何破坏这一时间流呢？"
G["So how is your research into the Eye coming along?"]="你对眼睛的研究进展得怎么样了？"
G["So how, then, did Father Inigo Montoy, bastion of virtue for the Argent Dawn, become the embodiment of that which he hated most?"]="那么英尼戈·蒙托尔神父是如何堕落的呢？身为银色黎明的精神领袖，他为什么会变成自己百般唾弃的魔鬼？"
G["So hungry! Must feed!"]="好饿啊！必须吃饭！"
G["So hungry..."]="敌人在哪里…"
G["So hungry...  Mmm! YOU!"]="饿死了……嗯！你！"
G["So if i just substitute the powder with compressed...fuel, we should be in business! So to speak."]="所以，如果我用压缩……燃料来替代火药，那我们就发达了。只是打个比方。"
G["So is that why you have moved out?"]="那就是你迁出来的原因吗？"
G["So it is certain den. Dese elementals were bound from dormant stone only recently."]="现在可以肯定了。这些石头元素不久前才被唤醒。"
G["So it is with your Alliance and your Horde. They are not strong despite one another; they are strong BECAUSE of one another."]="联盟和部落之间的战争也是一样。如果没有对方存在的话，他们也绝不会如此强盛。"
G["So it is. You have my thanks, $n, for restoring Quel'Delar to its rightful owners."]="就这样吧。感谢你，$n，帮助我们将奎尔德拉归还给它真正的拥有者。"
G["So it seems! And you haven't lost any muscle yourself. Do you remember anything of what happened, Muradin? Fate has turned ill in your absence."]="似乎的确如此！你看上去还是那么强壮。你还记得发生了什么事吗，穆拉丁？在你离开的日子里，命运愈发糟糕了。"
G["So it was you, Spark! How could you? You were a trusted envoy of Mekkatorque!"]="原来是你，斯巴克！你怎么会这样？你曾是梅卡托克的大使！"
G["So it's come to this, eh?"]="所以必须做个了断了，对吧？"
G["So it's not true? Thank the ancestors! I wouldn't want you to be my enemy, Lady Sylvanas."]="所以说那不是真的？感谢先祖！我可不希望做你的敌人，希尔瓦娜斯女士。"
G["So it's true? Sauranok IS guilty of treason!"]="这么说来是真的了？萨乌拉诺克真的背叛了部落！"
G["So let me get this straight. You were swimming, nay, doing backstrokes in molten lava with this... this lava suit of yours? Yes? And out of nowhere, this here beast swallowed you whole?"]="让我搞搞清楚。你穿着这件……这件熔岩服，在火红的岩浆里面游泳，不，仰泳？而且在毫无察觉的情况下，被这只野兽吞下了肚？"
G["So let me get this straight: I give Lane fifteen mammoth trunks and he gives me a set of daggers that I can use as steak knives? How does he do it? How does he make such amazing deals??"]="让我直说吧：我用15根猛犸象牙和兰恩做买卖，他给了我一套匕首。我拿这玩意儿来切牛排吗？他怎么能这样？这买卖也太好做了吧？"
G["So let us pretend I get this hide, what else would you need and what could you actually make?"]="假设我已经得到了比斯巨兽的皮，那么你还需要什么东西吗？你能用它做些什么？"
G["So let's make every explosion a quality asplosion!"]="所以，我们要让每一次爆炸都有极高的质量！"
G["So lift a mug to Coren,\nAnd Hurley Blackbreath too!\nThis drink is weak, without much kick,\nBut oi!  At least it's brew!"]="举杯向科林祝酒，\n还有霍尔雷·黑须！\n酒味淡雅不上头，\n好在它还算是杯酒！"
G["So long as violence lurks in your hearts... I... will... return..."]="只要你们心中的暴虐不除……我……就会……回来的……"
G["So long as we're sendin' troops up the beach, we should double-up the artillery-fire. You know, to help."]="既然我们要派遣部队登上那片海滩，我们就应该用加倍猛烈的炮火轰击那里。如果你明白，就来帮忙吧。"
G["So long as yer fools be fillin' my cages with sacrifices I'd be a fool to kill ya."]="只要你们能将祭品塞满这些笼子，我就不会要你们的命。"
G["So long as you stay here with us, you da king.  You take off, and some other ogre will take your place.  That's da way of da Gordok!"]="Mientras te quedes aquí con nosotros, tú ser $grey:reina;. Tú marcharte y algún otro ogro ocupará tu lugar. ¡Así funcionamos los Gordok!"
G["So long, Dalaran..."]="再见了，达拉然……"
G["So long, Halfhill!"]="再见，半山村！"
G["So long, Ruthers! We won't miss you!"]="再见了，拉瑟斯！我们不会想念你的！"
G["So long, and thanks for all the fights!"]="再见，感谢你的英勇奋战！"
G["So long, suckers. I'm out of here!"]="你们这帮蠢货！终于还是让我逃出来啦！"
G["So many SEEDS!"]="这么多种子！"
G["So many are hurt, that can't be good."]="受伤的人太多了，情况不太好。"
G["So many are in need of help..."]="需要帮助的人太多了……"
G["So many bells and whistles!"]="那么多零零碎碎的东西！"
G["So many books, so little time."]="瞧瞧这些书籍，我只恨时间不够用。"
G["So many bookshelves, so little time..."]="这么多的书架，时间却如此紧迫……"
G["So many choices, so little time..."]="选择太多了，时间太短了……"
G["So many dead serpents... If only I had kept up with my skinning..."]="好多死掉的毒蛇啊……如果我的剥皮技巧没荒废就好了……"
G["So many demons, not enough time."]="恶魔太多，时间不够了。"
G["So many fools, so little time!"]="蠢货太多，时间太少！"
G["So many have died at my hands.  I just wanted to escape those horrors."]="尽管我手下的亡魂无数，可我只是想逃离那些噩梦而已。"
G["So many hounds... we can't hold them back!"]="猎犬太多了。我们顶不住啊！"
G["So many hunters have been taken by that beast..."]="那只野兽捕获了那么多猎手……"
G["So many lost.  And so many more we must lose before this battle ends."]="已经有这么多勇敢的战士失去了生命，在这场战役结束之前，我们可能还会失去更多……"
G["So many mouths to feed, and never enough ingredients to feed them!"]="有这么多人要去养活，可是从来没有足够的食物去喂饱他们！"
G["So many new visitors... what is becoming of our village?"]="这么多客人……我们的村子出什么事了？"
G["So many people to tend to..."]="要照料的人太多了……"
G["So many places, so little time. Where to, $Gbrother:sister;?"]="¡Tantos sitios ke ver! ¿Adónde va makaku?"
G["So many puppy-men here. Think they want be friends now maybe?"]="这里好多狗狗人啊。或许他们想和我们交朋友？"
G["So many slickies...  Hozen grookin' love slickies!"]="好多光板儿……猢狲就爱光板儿！"
G["So many uses for the plague, so little time!"]="药剂的用途如此广泛，我们得加紧研究！"
G["So many wonderful books..."]="这么多神奇的书籍……"
G["So many wonderful varieties, which concoction shall I give you?"]="好品种太多了，我该选哪种呢？"
G["So many years of battle and slavery, it feels good to have a home again."]="经历了多年的战乱和奴役生活，再次拥有一个家园的感觉真好。"
G["So much activity... It reminds me of the Trade District."]="好多活动啊……这里让我想起了贸易区。"
G["So much blood!"]="好多鲜血！"
G["So much data... so little time..."]="这么多数据……这么点时间……"
G["So much destruction... so much death... will this ever stop?"]="太多的毁灭……太多的死亡……什么时候才是个尽头？"
G["So much emotion has been realeased from the tombs. So much anger and fear..."]="这么多的情绪被从陵墓中释放出来。到处充满了愤怒和恐惧……"
G["So much for a happy ending."]="多么快乐的结局啊。"
G["So much for a real challenge. Die!"]="这根本算不上真正的挑战。你们去死吧！"
G["So much for the Scarlet \"paradise!\""]="¡El \"paraíso\" Escarlata era mucho pedir!"
G["So much for the element of surprise."]="这还真是惊喜不断。"
G["So much for the power of nature... muhahahaha."]="自然的力量是如此强大……哈哈哈。"
G["So much junk food... But not a single apple."]="这么多垃圾食物……连一个苹果都没有。"
G["So much knowledge! I must study this immediately."]="这么多知识啊！我得立刻开始学习了。"
G["So much lost time... that you'll never get back!"]="失去了这么多时间……你们永远也无法挽回！"
G["So much pain..."]="痛死啦……"
G["So much power!"]="如此强大的力量！"
G["So much senseless loss."]="这么多无谓的损失。"
G["So much to do, so much to do!  Where does the time go?"]="事情太多，时间太少！"
G["So much unstable energy... but worth the risk to destroy you!"]="这么多不稳定的能量……但为了消灭你们，这点风险不算什么！"
G["So much whining! You would think I was trying to kill you!"]="这么多抱怨！你以为我要杀了你吗！"
G["So much... lost.\n\nAnd I fear, $n, that this is only the beginning."]="失去了……这么多。\n\n我担心，$n，这仅仅只是个开始。"
G["So my blood was not a sufficient payment, eh? Fine, let us recover your arcane essence. After this, I owe Balthas nothing."]="这样看来仅凭我的血还不足够来偿还这一切，是吗？好吧，那么再让我恢复你的奥术精华。在这之后，我和巴塔斯就两清了。"
G["So my shouting, my rally cries... All for nothing... Everyone must think me a fool..."]="所以我那些卖力的吆喝……都是白费力气……大家肯定觉得我是个白痴……"
G["So negative all the time Hou!"]="你总是那么消极啊，侯！"
G["So not all of your people have allied with him?"]="这样说来，你们并没有全都与他结盟？"
G["So now, let us celebrate with our fine warrior brothers!"]="伟大的战士兄弟们，让我们举杯欢庆吧！"
G["So predictable."]="太容易看穿了。"
G["So predictable. I knew you would come. And I see you've brought the mighty Hellscream."]="在我意料之中。我知道你会来这里，而且我看到你把强大的地狱咆哮也带来了。"
G["So predictable..."]="不出所料……"
G["So seriously, how did your undead hunting go?  I want to hear stories."]="我是认真的，你们的僵尸狩猎进行得如何了？我很想听一听。"
G["So serve him I did... Were it not for me the glorious dread citadel of Naxxramas may never have returned to Northrend."]="我成为了巫妖王的仆从……恐怖之城纳克萨玛斯能重返诺森德全都是我的功劳。"
G["So sexy it hurts!"]="真性感啊，就是太痛了！"
G["So small.  So soft.  It's a wonder you've even lasted this long down here, fleshling."]="这么小。这么软。真好奇你是如何坚持到现在的，血肉之躯。"
G["So soft!"]="太软了！"
G["So sorry to leave a customer but we have places to go and people to swindle. We will be back sometime later today. Good-bye!"]="很抱歉。我们不得不动身前往别处，继续行骗。我们会回来的。再见！"
G["So spout your platitudes and flail until you are spent. In the end, you will be mine, and Morbidus will be the harbinger of your death!"]="趁你还活着，只管宣扬这些陈词滥调吧。你终究会落到我的手里，摩比乌斯将宣告你的死讯！"
G["So sticky! I'll try to bring that moth down for you."]="好粘啊！我会帮你把那只飞蛾弄下来。"
G["So tasty! So delicious! Double Lucky special noodles!"]="最好吃！最美味！能给你带来双倍好运的美味面条！"
G["So tell me, goblin, why did your slave ship wander through our battle?"]="告诉我，地精，为什么你们的奴隶船会开进我们的战场？"
G["So that was the problem? Now I'm makin' progress..."]="哈！终于找到问题出在哪儿了！我马上就能搞定了……"
G["So that's how Windsor died..."]="温德索尔就那样死了……"
G["So that's the queen of the dragons? Hmm... we thought she'd be bigger. Yes, we did."]="她就是红龙女王？嗯……我们一直以为她应该更大一些。"
G["So that's what happens what you stand too close to a bomb!"]="这就是你距离炸弹太近的结果！"
G["So the Alliance sent... you?"]="所以……是联盟派你来的？"
G["So the Banshee Queen has sent assassins?"]="女妖之王派遣了刺客？"
G["So the Light's vaunted justice has finally arrived? Shall I lay down Frostmourne and throw myself at your mercy, Fordring?"]="怎么，自诩正义的圣光终于来了？我是不是该丢下霜之哀伤，恳求您的宽恕呢，弗丁？"
G["So the Searing Blade is expendable?"]="这么说，燃刃可以牺牲了？"
G["So the blood elves think they're just one step away from ruling the world..."]="那些血精灵认为他们离控制这个世界只有一步之遥……"
G["So the cave's a crashing down, and Old Man Thistle and Bobo run as fast as they can! They twist and turn through the caves, til they burst outta the ground right up that hill!\n\nAnd what happened then but the cave closed up right behind 'em, like it got swallowed by the earth.\n\nOld Man Thistle's shaking, but first thing he does when he gets home is make a map to that cave full o' treasure. Cuz maybe it's still there, true?\n\nGood thing he did, cuz the next day, he couldn't remember as well, and the day after that he remembered even less, till he plumb forgot 'bout that cave altogether."]="那洞穴开始坍塌，老农阿蓟和波波拼命跑！他们腾挪闪躲，在山洞中穿梭，直到在那山上破地而出！\n\n然后那个洞穴在他们身后合拢起来，就好像被大地吞没了一样。\n\n老农阿蓟浑身打颤，但是他到家做的第一件事就是给那个堆满财宝的洞穴画了一张藏宝图。因为那洞穴或许还在那儿，不是吗？\n\n他做了件正确的事，因为到了第二天，他就想不起来洞穴在哪儿了。接着又过了一天，他忘得更厉害了，后来就连那洞穴的事也忘得一干二净。"
G["So the dogs have returned to sniff around?"]="那些狗继续去闻味了？"
G["So the fruit vendor was never going to wage war against us?  I find it hard to believe..."]="所以说，水果商其实无意跟我们作对？真是难以置信……"
G["So the giants have been dropping the azsharite? But where does it come from?"]="巨人的身上一直在掉下艾萨莱特水晶？但它到底是从巨人身上的什么地方出来的呢？"
G["So the grand admiral knows about my... affliction, does she? I didn't know she cared!"]="看来将军知道我所遭受的……折磨，是吧？我不知道她竟然在乎！"
G["So the oracle has decided to aid you, outlander. Very well, I will offer you what I know."]="Así que el Oráculo ha decidido ayudarte, $gforastero:forastera;. Muy bien, te ofreceré mi conocimiento."
G["So the other kids, not me, dared Shin to knock on the Jade Witch's front door.  He wouldn't do it though but then someone, not me, hozen dared him.\n\nShin backed out of that but then someone, not me I swear, double hozen dared him.  And not even Shin can get out of a double hozen dare.\n\nHe went and knocked on the door but we didn't see what happened.  Jade Monsters came at us and we ran away. \n\nI never should have dared Shin..."]="于是其他孩子，不是我，挑唆阿信去敲青玉巫婆的前门。他不肯去，结果有个人，不是我，故意说他肯定是没胆子。\n\n阿信想反悔，结果有个人，我发誓不是我，是别人在一旁煽风点火。阿信受了挑唆。\n\n他去敲了门，但我们没有看到发生了什么事。青玉怪物冲出来攻击我们，我们就跑了。\n\n我真不该去挑唆阿信的。"
G["So the prodigal son has spoken!"]="这就是你所谓的计划吗！"
G["So the rumors are true? Vol'jin is alive and out for Garrosh's blood?"]="这么说传言是真的？沃金还活着，并回来向加尔鲁什复仇了？"
G["So the stories were true..."]="看来传说是真的……"
G["So then the array of magics would cascade into a chain reaction of positively charged energies."]="然后，预设的魔法序列将产生链式反应，并最终使能量开始从正极输入。"
G["So then we too are cursed?"]="我们也被诅咒了吗？"
G["So there we were - me and the battalion, doing a routine recon down the bone road. We'd sent the scout up ahead to look around in case anything dangerous come up."]="那时，我和其他士兵就在荣耀之路上巡逻，这是我们日常的职责之一。我们派了侦察兵去前面察看情况，以防发生任何危险状况。"
G["So they CAN die... I have to stay focused."]="那就让他们死吧……我只能保持专注。"
G["So this gnome tells a tauren that he's been to Molten Core."]="这个侏儒告诉牛头人说，他去过熔火之心。"
G["So this is how Illidan bound so many demons to his will..."]="所以，伊利丹就是靠这种办法役使了大量的恶魔……"
G["So this is how a chieftain is honored!"]="正该如此祭拜酋长！"
G["So this is how it ends? A pity..."]="这就是事情的结局？真可怜……"
G["So this is what you have come for? To try and claim that which is the reason for the Dawn's existence and the Crusade's downfall? You open old wounds with your words, Commander!"]="这就是你到这里来的目的？过来宣告银色黎明的存在与血色十字军的没落？你的话太令我感到遗憾了，指挥官！"
G["So this is where you're hiding, Gar'dul."]="原来你躲在这儿了，加杜尔。"
G["So this... is what it feels like... to be mortal?\n<The question trails off as Mavralyn's breathing stops.>"]="¿Así que... esto es lo que se siente... al ser mortal?\n\n<La pregunta se desvanece cuando Mavralyn deja de respirar.>"
G["So this... this is how it ends, my love..."]="就这样结束了……我的爱人……"
G["So tired. I will rest for just a moment!"]="真累呀。我要休息一会儿！"
G["So tired..."]="真累啊……"
G["So tired... just want to rest..."]="真累啊……真想休息……"
G["So today as I was gathering supplies, I found a wandering sherpa who sold exotic potions and oils. One of the more strange oils he had was known as a \"love potion\" for fish.  \n \n Nevermind how he created it, just know that the stuff REALLY works! It DOUBLED the Redbelly Mandarin population in his pond! \n \n I found him at the lake north of Niuzao Temple. You'd probably do some good if you helped even out the population there."]="Hoy estaba recogiendo suministros cuando me he cruzado con un grúmel ambulante que vendía pociones y ungüentos exóticos. Uno de los más extraños era un \"filtro de amor\" para peces.\n\nDa igual cómo lo creara: ¡lo que importa es que funciona de verdad! ¡Ha DUPLICADO la población de mandarines panzarroja de este estanque!\n\nLo encontré en el lago que hay al norte del Templo de Niuzao. Estaría bien que ayudaras a reequilibrar la fauna de los alrededores."
G["So too do the Knights of the Ebon Blade. Although our kind has no place in your world, we will fight to bring an end to the Lich King. This I vow!"]="这也是黑锋骑士们的心愿……尽管在你们的世界中已没有立足之地，但我们仍要为打倒巫妖王而战斗。我在此立誓！"
G["So troll, have you given thought to my suggestion?  Whatever you decide, I'm sure it'll make Ironhide happy."]="那么，我的建议你考虑得怎么样了？不论你做什么决定，我想铁皮都会很高兴的。"
G["So until they do... bye bye!"]="等他们完成再说吧……再见！"
G["So warm, so red!"]="如此温热，如此鲜红！"
G["So we finally meet to do battle."]="我们终于要面对面交手了。"
G["So we just wait until we think of something? Shen-zin Su is dying! Doing nothing risks everything!"]="等我们想到好办法神真子已经死了！艾莎，无所作为会给大家的生命带来危险！"
G["So we're to trust people who would insult us with this deception? Do the draenei think so little of us that they must resort to trickery to get our attention?\n\nWe're aware of their desire to 'redeem' us, but my people want none of their redemption. We are capable of standing on our own and we will pursue our destiny as a proud and separate people. Carry this message to your allies."]="Así que debemos confiar en quienes nos insultan de esta manera. ¿Qué imagen tienen los draenei de nosotros como para usar trucos que llamen nuestra atención?\n\nSabemos que están deseando \"redimirnos\", pero mi pueblo no necesita redención alguna. Somos capaces de arreglárnoslas solos y perseguiremos nuestro destino como un pueblo independiente y orgulloso. Transmite este mensaje a tus aliados."
G["So weak."]="太弱了。"
G["So were you!"]="你也是！"
G["So what brings you to Light's Hope?"]="你为什么要来到光明之愿礼拜堂？"
G["So what can I do to help?"]="那么，我能帮什么忙呢？"
G["So what did Ragnaros do next?"]="那么，拉格纳罗斯接下来做了什么？"
G["So what did you do?"]="你干了些什么？"
G["So what do you think of my new toy?"]="你觉得我的新玩具怎么样？"
G["So what do you want to do today?"]="你今天想要做什么？"
G["So what else do you have in that belt?"]="你那条腰带里还有什么？"
G["So what happened then?"]="然后发生了什么？"
G["So what happened?"]="接下来发生了什么事？"
G["So what has led you to Naxxramas?"]="那你为什么要来纳克萨玛斯？"
G["So what if it is? Why do you even care?"]="那又怎样，你为什么要关心这种事？"
G["So what is your purpose?"]="那么你们的目标是……？"
G["So what of the cipher now? And your boys?"]="密码现在怎么样了？你的孩子呢？"
G["So what's this new plague all about?"]="那么，这次新的瘟疫是怎么回事？"
G["So what's up with the bridge in Lakeshire? Oslow ever finish building it?"]="那湖畔镇的那座桥后来怎么样了？奥斯洛把它造完了吗？"
G["So whatever happened to that hot little number in Stormwind? Lady Prestor was her name."]="那么暴风城里那个小可爱怎么样了？她叫女伯爵普瑞斯托。"
G["So when you're feeling that tinglin' sensation at the base of your spine and you're 'bout ready to wet your pants, embrace it. Let it enrage you. That fear is the only thing that's gonna keep you breathin'."]="如果你感觉脊椎下传来阵阵凉意，甚至有尿裤子的冲动，倒是应该感到欣慰。让这种感觉刺激你的情绪吧。恐惧是唯一能让你保持呼吸的情感。"
G["So where do we go from here?"]="接下来，我们要去哪儿？"
G["So where was I? Oh yea, so the orcs rushed Windsor and Windsor, well, he didn't move an inch. He stood tall as they charged him, ten at a time. All I could see was the glow from Ironfoe and a lot of blood. This went on for hours, maybe days. I don't remember. Anyhow, FINALLY, it stopped."]="我说到哪里了？哦，兽人突袭了温德索尔，温德索尔呢？他是山崩于前而面不改色，从容应对。只见反对者击起冲天血光，鲜血四溅，持续了数个小时，没准是数天。我记不得了。但是最终，杀戮停止了。"
G["So who is protecting the Burlap Trail?"]="那么是谁在保卫粗麻小径？"
G["So why are you here? What are we to do if there is no hope?"]="那么你为什么会在这里？既然那里已经没有希望了，那我们该做什么呢？"
G["So why are you still here?"]="为什么你还在这里？"
G["So wild and vicious he was kicked off the Peak of Serenity, it's the froth-mouthed frenzy, always-bananas monkey monk master CLOUDBENDER KOBO!"]="如此野蛮恶毒，被赶下晴日峰的就是愤怒和疯狂的猴子武僧驾云者科博！"
G["So ya be smellin' fortune eh? What say ya come with me to Bilgewater and we make a fortune at the gamblin' tables."]="这么说你正在寻找发财的机会？跟我去锈水港怎么样，我们可以在赌桌上好好赚一笔。"
G["So ye want me to go join the Alliance front in this... Pandaria... eh?"]="所以说你想让我去这个什么……熊猫……利亚……的联盟前线？"
G["So ye want to be a Blacksmith eh? Grab an apron and a hammer $g lad : lass;, let's see what ye've got."]="那么说来你想要成为一名铁匠？$g小伙子:小姑娘;，扎好围裙，拿上铁锤，让我们开始吧。"
G["So you are Klinfran the Crazed? Sad, I was expecting an actual challenge. Do you dare face me in your true form?"]="这么说你是疯狂的克林弗兰？真不幸，我所期望的是一次真正的挑战。你敢以真面目视人吗？"
G["So you are the creature who gave the jinyu the courage they needed to stand their ground against the hozen.\n\nSuch courage is something we have not seen in some time. I welcome you to our humble home."]="原来就是你让锦鱼人重振勇气，对抗猢狲的。\n\n这般勇气我们已经许久未见了。欢迎光临寒舍。"
G["So you are to be my commander today. Very well."]="那么，今天你就是我的指挥官了。很好。"
G["So you can teach me this... this..."]="那么你真的可以教我这个……这个……"
G["So you caught a thief.  Enjoy your finder's fee!"]="你抓到了小偷。享用酬劳吧！"
G["So you have come here, to the heart of the pollution. We will aid you. Our song will resonate through the walls of this twisted place, weakening the resolve of those who have forsaken our race."]="你终于来到了这污染的中心地带。我们会助你一臂之力。我们的歌声会在这扭曲之地四处回响，让那些遗弃我族的人，决心尽数瓦解。"
G["So you have come seeking our aid?"]="你是来寻求帮助的？"
G["So you have come to Niby to learn the secrets of calling down an infernal servant from the Nether.\n\nSilence! Niby knows all!\n\nNiby is not so quick to part with such knowledge. First, you must assist Niby with a very important task."]="这么说，你是来找尼比学习如何从虚空中召唤地域火仆从的。\n\n安静！尼比什么都知道！\n\n他可不会这么轻易地将知识传授给你。首先，你必须帮助尼比完成一项至关重要的任务。"
G["So you have defeated the Crimson Sigil. You now seek to challenge my rule? Not even Arthas could defeat me, yet you dare to even harbor such thoughts? Then I say to you, come! Come $n! The Black Temple awaits..."]="你竟然击败了火色魔印，还想挑战我的统治吗？即使是阿尔萨斯都不能打败我，你们这些家伙竟然也敢做这种梦？那么我要告诉你，来吧！来吧，$n！我就在黑暗神殿里等着你……"
G["So you have returned to help Kum'isha, $r? Do not worry, the pang that you feel in the pit of your stomach is merely your willpower collapsing.\n\nThankfully, you will not need willpower for this collection. I am certain that you will enjoy the trinkets I will have waiting for you upon your return with the item."]="¿Así que has vuelto para ayudar a Kum'isha, $r? No te preocupes, los retortijones que sientes son fruto del desmoronamiento de tu fuerza de voluntad.\n\nPor suerte, no la necesitarás. Estoy seguro de que te gustarán los dulces que tendré preparados para tu regreso."
G["So you know why I'm here then.  All right Midriff, pay up."]="那你知道我来这里的原因了。好吧小腹，给钱吧。"
G["So you refuse? Is the son of Durotan a coward?"]="这么说你打算拒绝我的请求？杜隆坦之子原来是个懦夫！"
G["So you say now, but at least you've got a warm dinner waiting for ya..."]="换句话说，至少你回家就可以吃到一顿美味佳肴……"
G["So you see - power is easily taken, but should not be lightly given."]="明白了吧——力量得来容易，却不可轻易给予。"
G["So you see fit to toy with the Lich King's creations? Ramstein, be sure to give the intruders a proper greeting."]="你想戏耍一下巫妖王创造的生物吗？拉姆斯登，好好教训这些入侵者。"
G["So you suspect that someone on the inside was involved? They were tipped off?"]="你怀疑某个内部人员与此有关？向敌方泄密？"
G["So you think you are good enough to learn from me? The great Snarl? You are no more than a lowly worm beneath my boot. However, taking on an underling might make me seem more appealing to Sumi and Tumi. Let's see what meager skills you possess."]="¿Así que crees que eres tan $gbueno:buena; como para aprender de mí? ¿Del gran Gruños? No eres más que un gusano bajo la suela de mis botas. Sin embargo, con un subordinado puede que Sumi y Tumi me encuentren más atractivo. Vamos a ver cuáles son tus habilidades."
G["So you thought to make a fool of Mor'ghor, eh? Before you are delivered to Lord Illidan, you will feel pain that you could not know to exist. I will take pleasure in exacting my own vengeance."]="你胆敢欺骗莫格霍尔！在将你送到伊利丹大人的神殿之前，我要让你尝尝你想都不敢想的痛苦！我要折磨你，享受复仇的乐趣。"
G["So you thought you could break into this palace of the Light and run away with our secrets! Vishas, interrogate this criminal at once!"]="这样看来，你觉得你可以逃出这座圣光的宫殿，带着我们的秘密逃走吗？韦沙斯，立即审问这个罪犯！"
G["So you want to know what I'm looking for?  I like that... I'm looking for someone strong and courageous.  Brains are one thing, but you've gotta be able to back it up with some muscle.\n\nWhenever those pesky Dark Iron dwarves attack, you can attack them by throwing a mug at them.  Just down it and throw.  Simple.\n\nFor every dwarf you down, you'll be marked.  Talk to me and I'll give you a prize ticket for every mark you have."]="这么看来你想知道我在寻找什么吗？我正在找一个既勇敢又强壮的家伙。聪明是一方面啦，不过你也得有一定的肌肉才行。\n\n当那些讨厌的黑铁矮人进攻时，你要以投掷杯子的方式来攻击他们——就是扔杯子击倒他们就这么简单。\n\n你每打倒一个矮人，你就会被标记一次。和我交谈，我就会根据你得到的印记数量发给你奖券。"
G["So you want to play?!"]="噢，你想来玩玩？！"
G["So you will help?"]="那你会帮忙？"
G["So you wish to commune with the dead? You shall have your wish."]="你真的想和死人交谈？我会满足你。"
G["So you would like to learn a few things? I would be happy to get you started!"]="你想学点东西吗？我会很乐意教你的！"
G["So you're a hunter? My father has taught me to be pretty handy with a bow, myself."]="¿Así que eres $gun cazador:una cazadora;? Mi padre me ha instruido bastante bien en el tiro con arco."
G["So you're here for the Warsong axes. Well, it's about time, $n. That crate has been sitting out there for days, now.\n\nFeel free to haul it away whenever you are ready."]="Así que has venido a buscar las hachas Grito de Guerra. Bueno, ya era hora, $n. Esa caja lleva días ahí.\n\nEres libre para llevártela cuando quieras."
G["So you're looking to relearn what you forgot, eh? Or maybe learn what you were never taught? I know just the thing, $n. Over by Steamwheedle port, to the east, you'll find a magical book in Narain's hut called \"Soothsaying for Dummies.\" Give it a read.\n\n<Nixx winks.>\n\nYou'll find all that you need to know and then some..."]="Conque quieres aprender de nuevo lo que has olvidado, ¿eh? ¿O quizás aprender lo que nunca has sabido? Mira, $n. Al este del Puerto Bonvapor, encontrarás un libro mágico en la cabaña de Narain titulado \"Adivinar el futuro para torpes\". Échale una ojeada.\n\n<Nixx guiña un ojo.>\n\nEncontrarás todo lo que necesitas saber y mucho más..."
G["So you're part of the Argent Crusade, eh?"]="这么说来，你是银色黎明的成员咯？"
G["So you're the Alliance's so-called champion. With your death this place will easily fall."]="Así que eres $gel supuesto campeón:la supuesta campeona; de la Alianza. Con tu muerte este lugar caerá fácilmente."
G["So you're the new hot shot in town, eh?\n\n<Zorek spits on the ground.>\n\nYea..."]="你是新来的吧，瞧你那副自以为是的模样。\n\n<索雷克朝地上吐了口唾沫。>\n\n肯定是……"
G["So you're the one who ventured into Shadowfang Keep to retreive the rare and powerful materials hidden there?"]="就是你进入影牙城堡，取得了藏在那里的罕见而且具有强大力量的材料？"
G["So you're the ones causing all that ruckus!"]="就是你们制造了所有这些麻烦！"
G["So you've conquered a small spot of land. A minor setback! I will reign here!"]="你们攻下了这片土地。这对我们只是个微小的挫折！我们终将成为这里的统治者！"
G["So you've recently arrived from Azeroth, eh? You'd best steel yourself, $c - there are perils in this land unlike anything the Horde has faced before. I am Nazgrel - right hand to our mighty warchief, Thrall. He honored me with the task of safeguarding this brave expedition and - by all the spirits - I shall!"]="你是刚从艾泽拉斯世界到这边来的吧？你最好武装好自己，$c。这里的危险和部落之前所面对的大不一样。我是纳兹格雷尔——伟大的酋长萨尔的左右手。我很荣幸他让我负责保证这支勇敢的远征队的安全，以所有的灵魂之名，我会出色地完成任务！"
G["So your bat and your snake need Zanzil's help?  Very well.  I'll see you inside Zul'Gurub... old friend."]="这么说，你的蝙蝠和蛇群需要赞吉尔的帮助？非常好。那我们在祖尔格拉布里面见吧……老朋友。"
G["So! Even as the Alliance binds itself ever closer together, the Horde is ripping itself apart."]="所以，当联盟前所未有地团结一致时，部落却正在分崩离析。"
G["So! You DO have a spine!"]="噢！你还有点儿骨气！"
G["So, $n, I'm ready to tell you what happened in the Swamp of Sorrows. Hiccup!"]="那么，$n，我来告诉你在悲伤沼泽发生了什么。嗝儿！"
G["So, $n, which item are you interested in?"]="那么，$n，你想要什么东西？"
G["So, $n, you have a near perfect track record. Tell me, how do you feel about the Navy?"]="那么，$n，你拥有近乎完美的战绩。告诉我，你觉得海军怎么样？"
G["So, Alliance finally decided to drop in some reinforcements, eh? Get to the front, $c!"]="这么说，联盟终于下决心派援兵来了，嗯？快到前线上去，$c！"
G["So, General Twinbraid is dead? He was a pivotal figure in the Alliance push through Southern Barrens. Impressive work."]="那么，双辫将军死了吗？他是联盟在南贫瘠之地行动的关键人物。你干得很好。"
G["So, Gorrok, do you think I have a chance with Kiryn?"]="那么，格罗克，你觉得我能追到琪麟吗？"
G["So, I found this shackle key..."]="这样，我发现了镣铐的钥匙……"
G["So, I really appreciate you taking with me into this scary jungle and all..."]="真是谢谢你把我带到恐怖的丛林和各种麻烦中来……"
G["So, Twilight's Hammer is trying to finish me off? Honorless filth!\n\nI will definitely help you, $c. You say you need a map?"]="这么说来，暮光之锤想要除掉我？恬不知耻的垃圾！\n\n我一定会帮助你的，$c。你说你需要一张地图？"
G["So, are you ready to start? Let's see what you've got."]="这么说，你准备开始了？让我们看看你有什么能耐。"
G["So, did you hear about Helper 432-A? I heard that... what the-? HEY! We Helpers have WORK to do, you know!"]="那么，你听说过432-A型小助手吗？我听说……什——？嘿！我们小助手也是有正经工作的，你知道嘛！"
G["So, dis be Budd?"]="嗯，这就是巴德？"
G["So, do you just want to... I don't know... Roll it away or something?"]="这么说，你不过是想……我不知道……滚着玩还是怎么样？"
G["So, doctor, how goes your research?"]="博士，你的研究进行得如何了？"
G["So, friends... how are we going to find the hidden master?"]="那么，朋友们……我们该如何找到隐秘大师呢？"
G["So, how does a dwarf like you end up in a place like this?"]="那么，一个像你这样的矮人到底是怎样沦落到这里的呢？"
G["So, how does it all turn out in Icecrown?"]="嗯，冰冠冰川的局势怎么样啦？"
G["So, it has begun...."]="终于，开始了……"
G["So, it has come to this. Together, we have learned and grown over the years, and now we find ourselves face to face on the battlefield. Do not think I will go easy on you, nor do I expect any quarter. What we do now, we do for the horde, both of us."]="这一天终于来了。多年来我们一起成长，一起学习，如今却在战场上兵戎相见。别幻想我会放过你，我也不会求饶。此时此刻，我们所做的一切，都是为了部落。"
G["So, it is done."]="一切都结束了。"
G["So, now that I'm the king... what have you got for me?!"]="那么，现在我是国王啦……你给我带来了什么？！"
G["So, off to see Myolor, eh? He's right o'er there... behind ye! Er, maybe in front of ye! Near the Great Anvil!"]="你要找米洛尔·怒斩？他就在那儿，你瞧，就在你身后！呃，好吧，也许在你前面！反正就在大锻炉附近！"
G["So, stranger, are you the wild and crazy type like the hozen?\n\nOr the quiet and thoughtful type like the jinyu?"]="Entonces, $gforastero:forastera;, ¿eres salvaje y $gloco:loca; como los hozen?\n\n¿O $gtranquilo:tranquila; y $greflexivo:reflexiva; como los jinyu?"
G["So, the frail members of the living have some teeth after all. Take this place, then, for the time being. I will return, twice as strong, and your paltry forces will fall!"]="看来这群貌似脆弱的活人还真有几颗锋利的牙齿。这地方就暂时归你们吧。我们会回来的，会比现在更强大，到时候你们这些弱者就不会再有机会了！"
G["So, we live to fight another day."]="养精蓄锐，来日再战。"
G["So, what are the fish like where you come from?"]="那么，那鱼长什么样，你又从哪里来？"
G["So, when does this excavation of Zul'Aman begin?"]="那么，祖阿曼的挖掘工作何时开始呀？"
G["So, when's the next party?"]="那么，下一次聚会在什么时候开始？"
G["So, where should we search first?"]="那么，我们从哪儿开始找？"
G["So, you are willing to help repair the mighty Exodar?  I heard it will take years before the Exodar is fully functional once more.  You have two hours.  Just kidding.  Our engineers are located on the lower levels of the Trader's Tier.  Go with the Light."]="这么看来，你想帮我们修理埃索达吗？我听说让埃索达再度恢复所有功能需要几年的时间，但你只有两个小时。开个玩笑。我们的工程师们就在贸易阶梯的底层，愿圣光与你同行。"
G["So, you have found me. I suppose that you have come to learn of suppression and control.\n\nI will teach you much more than that... you will also learn of sacrifice.\n\n<Daio grins.>"]="你来了。你是来学习镇压和控制之道的吧。\n\n我会教你更多的东西……你将学会牺牲。\n\n<戴奥咧嘴而笑。>"
G["So, you wanna find de fabled swords of de Sandfury, eh?\n\nYa be ready ta kill for Sul'thraze? Spill de blood across de sands? In search of treasure, of power?\n\nIf ya are...welcome to de desert, mon."]="那么，你想要找到传说中的沙怒之剑？\n\n为了寻求财富与权力，你已经准备好为苏萨斯而杀戮？将热血泼洒在黄沙之上？\n\n既然如此……欢迎来到这片沙漠，朋友。"
G["So, you wish to face off against a real Orc Warchief.  So be it."]="看来，你们想要挑战一位真正的兽人酋长。那好吧。"
G["So, you wish to learn more about our elven weaponry? Let your first lesson begin."]="那么，你想多学些我们精灵族的武器？我们开始上第一节课吧。"
G["So, you're a homebrewer?"]="这么说，你是个酿私酒的？"
G["So, you've been around a lot, but we seem to keep missing each other for getting together after work.\n\nIs it me?\n\n<Khatie purposely cheers up.>\n\nAnyway, I just wanted to say that I... we really appreciate everything that you've been doing for the Skyguard!"]="这么说，你常来这附近，可惜闲暇时我们总是没机会聚聚。\n\n我说得对吗？\n\n<卡提故意流露出振奋的神情。>\n\n不管怎样，我都想告诉你，我……我们真的非常感谢你为天空卫队所做的一切！"
G["So, you've come to die?!"]="这么说，你是来送死的？！"
G["So, you've managed to train an army...\n\nAn impressive achievement, but is war really the right course of action?"]="所以，你训练出了一支军队……\n\n一个了不起的成就，可战争真的是正确的应对方式吗？"
G["So, you've taken over the ranch for good, eh?"]="这么说，你永久性地接管了农场，嗯？"
G["So, zhis is zhe $r $c I haf heard so much about, hmm?"]="Así que $geste es el:esta es la; $r $c de la que tanto he oído hablarrr, ¿hmmm?"
G["So, zhis is zhe $r $c I've heard so much about, hmm?\n\nAs you know, zhere is vone obelisk zhat has yet to be activated....\n\nVhen zhe time comes to restore zhis ancient mechanism, vhill you be zhere? Vill history remember you?\n\nZhat depends on your villingness to cooperate!"]="Así que $geste es el:esta es la; $r $c sobre $gel:la; que tanto he oído hablarrr, ¿hmmm?\n\nComo sabes, todavía queda un obelisco porrr activarrr...\n\nCuando llegue el momento de restaurrrar este antiguo mecanismo, ¿estarrrás allí? ¿Te recordarrrá la historia?\n\n¡Eso dependerrrá de tu foluntad de cooperar!"
G["So-ngh-thirsty."]="口好渴。"
G["So... EPIC!!!"]="真是……伟大！！！"
G["So... Hungry..."]="好……饿……呀……"
G["So... SPICY!!!"]="真……辣！！！"
G["So... SWEET!"]="真……甜！"
G["So... You thought you could fool me, did you? The greatest criminal mastermind Azeroth has ever known???"]="这么说……你觉得你能愚弄我，是吗？你没听说过艾泽拉斯最伟大的罪犯的名头吗？？？"
G["So... appetizing."]="不错的开胃菜。"
G["So... as much as I hate to complain after being saved from a horrible death I just thought you should know that I'm still over here stuck in one of these messy cages and it would really be great if you could come on over and let me out so I could help you celebrate your amazing victory over that big crazy scary troll-cat... thing."]="我说……虽然我讨厌那种刚从死亡边缘捡回一条命就开始喋喋不休抱怨起来的家伙不过呢我也要提醒你我还被关在这个肮脏的笼子里呢如果你能放我出去的话我就可以和你一起分享打败那头恐怖的巨魔豹的喜悦啦……"
G["So... business or pleasure?"]="是办正事还是找乐子呢？"
G["So... cold..."]="啊……真冷……"
G["So... confused. Do not... belong here."]="非常……困惑。我不属于……这里。"
G["So... difficult!"]="真是……难啊！"
G["So... do any of you know where the hidden master lives?"]="那……你们知道那位隐居的大师在哪儿吗？"
G["So... foolish."]="太愚蠢了……"
G["So... full of life."]="这里……充满了活力。"
G["So... lonely."]="好孤单……"
G["So... many... carrots..."]="这么……多……胡萝卜……"
G["So... much... power."]="这么……多……能量。"
G["So... so very thirsty..."]="太……太渴了……"
G["So... sore..."]="真……疼啊……"
G["So... the Earthen were made out of stone?"]="难道……土灵是用石头做出来的？"
G["So... thirsty..."]="真……渴啊……"
G["So... uh... can Riko get a kiss?"]="那么……嗯……能给里克一个吻吗？"
G["So... umm... $p? I'm still here, you know."]="那么……嗯……$p？我还在这儿呢。"
G["So... want to talk about it?"]="那么……想谈谈这个事儿吗？"
G["So... what's inside Uldum?"]="那么……奥丹姆里面到底有些什么？"
G["So... where can I find Azuregos, Ergll?"]="那么……厄格尔罗，我能在哪里找到艾索雷葛斯？"
G["So... why isn't that troll dead yet?  He is the one reanimating all of those mogu, yes?"]="所以……那个巨魔怎么还没死？就是他复活了这些魔古族，是吧？"
G["So... you took out the King eh?  I knew that these bozos would make you the new king, I just knew it!  That's all these bozos understand - power.\n\nIt would seem that the more henchmen you keep alive, the higher your tribute will be.  Not to shabby - makes for an interesting challenge I'd say.  If you leave, I wouldn't expect to remain king.  One of these yokels will no doubt step up and take your place.\n\nOne more thing... you didn't happen to find my key, did you?"]="¿Así que has matado al rey, eh? Sabía que esos tipos te harían $grey:reina;, ¡lo sabía! Solo entienden eso: el poder.\n\nParece ser que cuantos más esbirros mantengas con vida, más alto será tu tributo. No está tan mal... Diría que es un desafío interesante. Pero si te vas, no creo que sigas siendo $gel rey:la reina;. Sin duda, uno de esos palurdos ocupará tu lugar.\n\nOtra cosa, ¿no habrás conseguido encontrar mi llave, no?"
G["So... you want to be a tailor? Very well, we'll see if you have what it takes."]="这么说……你想当一名裁缝？很好，让我们看看你是否具有这样的潜质。"
G["So... you wouldn't happen to have a chest around here that has, let's say, a gauntlet that the Gordok ogres consider to be a priceless artifact?"]="那么……这附近没有什么箱子了，你要知道，在戈多克食人魔眼里，护手是一件无价的神器？"
G["So... you're the stranger Cho was talking about.\n\nWelcome to Dawn's Blossom! I am Peiji Goldendraft and my family makes only the finest brews in Pandaria.\n\nUnlike those Wanderbrews who keep slinking around ruining the good name of Brewmasters everywhere. I think I even spied the young one eyeing my daughter. Can't have that! Goldendrafts and Wanderbrews do not mix."]="Así que tú eres $gel:la; $gforastero:forastera; $gdel:de la; que hablaba Cho.\n\n¡$GBienvenido:Bienvenida; a Floralba! Yo soy Peiji Brisa Dorada, y mi familia fabrica la mejor cerveza de toda Pandaria.\n\nNo como esos Pócima Errante, que no dejan de manchar a escondidas el buen nombre de los maestros cerveceros por todos lados. Creo que hasta una vez pillé a su hijo pequeño mirando a mi hija. No toleraré ese tipo de cosas. Los Brisa Dorada y los Pócima Errante no se mezclan entre ellos."
G["So.... How's about one 'a ya stroll on up 'ere an' help me out, eh?"]="我说……别在那儿闲逛，过来帮我一把好吗？"
G["So...how about we forget about our little wager and carry on with our busy lives?"]="那么……不如我们先别打赌了，继续过我们忙碌的生活吧？"
G["So...tired..."]="太……累了……"
G["Soap on a rope! Attached to a chain. Mounted via a steel cable. To some soap."]="绳子上的肥皂！特别限定版的锁链肥皂和钢缆肥皂已经上架！多种附加选择，多种额外功能。"
G["Socks followed along, faithfully."]="袜子忠心耿耿地跟了过来。"
G["Socrethar is clouding your mind, Kaylaan!  You do not mean these words!  I remember training you when you were but a youngling.  Your will was strong even then!"]="索克雷萨蒙蔽了你的心灵，凯兰恩！这些话不是你的本意！我还记得你孩提时我训练你的情景。你的意志向来那么坚强！"
G["Soft emerald green eyes framed a countenance, wise"]="柔美的脸上，一双翡翠般的眼睛里闪烁着智慧的光芒"
G["Soft, vulnerable shells. Brief fragile lives. You cannot escape the curse of flesh!"]="看看你们那软弱的躯壳和短暂的生命。你们永远也无法逃避血肉的诅咒！"
G["Soldier! Front and center!"]="士兵！立正！"
G["Soldier, call Captain Blackanvil at once!"]="士兵，立即呼叫布莱卡维尔上尉！"
G["Soldier, run to me! I'll clear a path with the chain gun!"]="到我身边来！我用枪掩护你！"
G["Soldier, you have new orders. You're to pull back and report to the sergeant!"]="士兵，听令！立即撤退，向中士报到！"
G["Soldier..."]="士兵……"
G["Soldiers arise, stand and fight! Bring victory at last to this fallen knight!"]="士兵们，起来战斗吧！为死去的骑士带来胜利的荣耀！"
G["Soldiers of Azeroth, you now fight against the vile Burning Crusade.  And the hopes and prayers of all Light-loving people march with you.  In the company of our brave allies and brothers-in-arms you will hold your ground and break this demonic charge.  You will stem the destructive tyranny that rages across so many worlds."]="艾泽拉斯的士兵们，你们正在与邪恶的燃烧军团对抗。所有信仰圣光的人民的希冀和祈祷与你们同在。在我们勇敢的同盟和战友们的帮助下，你们会坚守每一寸土地，击退恶魔的冲击。你们将阻止这些肆虐了很多世界的暴徒！"
G["Soldiers of Frostwolf, come to my aid! The time has come to unleash the fury of the elements upon them!"]="霜狼的战士们，来帮助我！是时候让他们感受元素的狂怒了！"
G["Soldiers of Kalimdor! Heroes of Silithus! One among you has dealt a vicious blow to our mortal enemies! $n and $g his:her; allies have relieved the Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj of its merciless leader! Ossirian the Unscarred, scourge of Silithus, has finally been destroyed and his armies wholly dismantled!"]="¡Soldados de Kalimdor! ¡Héroes de Silithus! ¡Uno de vosotros ha asestado un certero golpe a nuestros archienemigos! ¡$n y sus aliados han liberado las Ruinas de Ahn'Qiraj de su despiadado líder! ¡Osirio el Sinmarcas, peste de Silithus, ha sido al fin destruido y sus ejércitos desmantelados por completo!"
G["Soldiers of Kalimdor, defend the base!"]="卡利姆多的士兵们，防守基地！"
G["Soldiers of Lordaeron, rise to meet your master's call!"]="洛丹伦的战士们，服从主人的召唤！"
G["Soldiers of Stormpike, come to my aid! The beacon must be planted."]="雷矛士兵，过来帮帮我！必须插好火炬。"
G["Soldiers of Stormpike, your General is under attack! I require aid! Come! Come! Slay these mangy Frostwolf dogs."]="雷矛士兵，你们的将军受到攻击！我需要援助！快！快！杀死这些卑鄙的霜狼氏族的成员。"
G["Soldiers of the Horde, attack!"]="部落的战士们，进攻！"
G["Soldiers of the Scourge, death knights of Acherus, minions of the darkness: hear the call of the Highlord!"]="天灾军团的士兵们，阿彻鲁斯的死亡骑士们，黑暗的仆从们：听从大领主的召唤！"
G["Soldiers of the Scourge, stand ready! Prepare to unleash your fury upon the Argent Dawn!"]="天灾军团的士兵们，做好准备！你们马上就可以向银色黎明倾泻怒火了！"
G["Soldiers of the frozen wastes, rise and hear the call of your master! Do not let $n escape with the tome!"]="冰霜废土的士兵们，聆听主人的召唤，站起来吧！夺下$n手中的魔典！"
G["Soldiers! Crush their flank!"]="士兵们！粉碎他们的侧翼！"
G["Soldiers, fall in! Guard the halls!"]="士兵们，集合！保卫大厅！"
G["Soldiers, fall in! Looks like the Horde are comin' to take another shot!"]="士兵们，集合！看样子部落马上又要射击了！"
G["Solve the other riddles, I am demanding! And then meet me down south at Lion's Landing."]="按我的要求解开其他的谜语！然后到南边的雄狮港来找我。"
G["Some action. Glad to hear it."]="有活儿干了。真好。"
G["Some adventurers think enchanting doesn't work. I find that when I challenge them to battle they change their tune!"]="有些冒险家认为附魔术不起作用。我发现当我向他们挑战，要与他们作战时，他们的看法就改变了！"
G["Some are easy for even simple men to discern, while others require wisdom to see."]="有些就连那些最天真的人都能发现，而要想找到另一些，则需要具备非凡的智慧。"
G["Some argue Brother Rabbitsfoot has more good fortune than I, the Lucky Eightcoins.\n\nAt this I laugh.\n\nIt is simple: he is called \"brother\", I am called \"Lucky\". Obviously I am of more luck."]="Algunos dicen que el hermano Pata de Conejo tiene mejor fortuna que yo, Fortuno el Calderillas.\n\nYo me río.\n\nEs muy sencillo, a él le llaman \"hermano\" y a mi \"Fortuno\". Está claro que yo tengo más suerte."
G["Some call me... Impsy?"]="有人叫我……伊普斯？"
G["Some called my father mad. But even in his darkest hours, his vision was clear."]="有人宣称我的父亲疯了。但即使在最黑暗的时刻，他也有着清晰的远见。"
G["Some champion."]="$gMenudo campeón:Menuda campeona;."
G["Some consider these yaks to be lowly beasts, suitable only for grazing and menial labor. Few recognize the innate beauty that these creatures - the scions of the Black Ox - truly possess."]="有些人认为牦牛是低等动物，只配用来放牧和做一些低贱的劳动。很少有人能看到他们的内在美，那才是这些——玄牛的子嗣——真正拥有的东西。"
G["Some customers are hungry, they'll want a second bowl after they finish their first."]="有些客人特别饿，会在吃完之后再要一碗。"
G["Some dance with great passion and enthusiasm, like Fei Li.\n\nOthers do not dance unless they are provoked, such as Yalia."]="有些人的舞蹈充满激情并热衷于此，比如非离。\n\n而有些人却不喜欢，除非被激怒，比如雅丽亚。"
G["Some day I'll be able to put my skills at the service of Ramkahen."]="总有一天，我将为拉穆卡恒贡献自己的力量。"
G["Some day we're havin', eh?\nMe poor gryphons..."]="Vaya día llevamos, ¿eh?\n\nPobres grifos..."
G["Some decisions have dire consequences."]="某些决定会引发可怕的后果。"
G["Some enemies gain most of their power from the weapon that they wield.  Take that away, and their power over you goes with it."]="对某些敌人来说，大部分力量都是来自于手中挥持的武器。把武器夺走，他们就无计可施了。"
G["Some folks might ask why I like flowers so much. That's just me appreciatin' the beauty of this land."]="有些人可能会问我为什么这么喜欢花。我只是在欣赏这片土地的美丽。"
G["Some furless things been making friends with big-tongues... seem pretty dumb to Dajik."]="有些没毛的家伙和大舌头怪成了好朋友……达伊克觉着这太傻了。"
G["Some have sided with the Horde."]="其中一些加入了部落。"
G["Some have spent decades meditating upon this mystery, Avuun. I do not wish the same fate upon you."]="阿弗恩，有些人花费了数十年的时间思考这个秘密。我并不希望同样的命运会落在你身上。"
G["Some healers lack the knowledge to counter the diseases that we master."]="我们能够使用暗影的能量封印住这些治疗者的能力。"
G["Some help! Anyone!"]="有人吗！有人能救救我吗？！"
G["Some help, my little friend?"]="¿Necesitas ayuda, $gpequeño amigo:pequeña amiga;?"
G["Some injuries never heal, noble dwarf. A broken soul cannot be fixed."]="高贵的矮人，有的伤口是难以愈合的。破碎的灵魂要如何复原。"
G["Some kind of attack plan?  Auberdine was ravaged during the first throes of the cataclysm.  What value could it have to anyone?"]="这是某种攻击计划？奥伯丁已经被大灾变的动荡撕碎了。那儿能有什么价值？"
G["Some laugh at my concern for beasts. I scoff at their lack of compassion."]="有人嘲笑我对野兽的关注。而我要嘲笑他们的冷漠。"
G["Some may question my methods, but there's no denying my results."]="很多人都质疑我的方法，但没人能否认我的成果。"
G["Some more weeds, over here!"]="那儿也有一些草！"
G["Some nice contagion of rot for you, my pretty?"]="小可爱，想尝点儿腐化污染吗？"
G["Some o' us be loa priests, witch doctors before. Like Zalazane...\n\n<Zen'tabra's face grows hard as her gaze drifts south.>\n\nWe thought de spirits be angry wit us; we did not suspect it be Zalazane slowly cuttin' us off from dem. We knew he be strong, but not dat strong... and by de time his voodoo had reached de other isles, we was powerless ta stop 'im."]="我们当中有些人曾是祭司或巫医。就像扎拉赞恩……\n\n<岑塔布拉的视线飘向南方，神色变得严峻。>\n\n我们以为是自己惹怒了神祗，完全没怀疑过是扎拉赞恩在慢慢阻断我们之间的联结。我们知道他很强大，但没想到竟会这么强……当他的巫毒妖术蔓延到其它岛屿时，我们已无力阻止他。"
G["Some of me best friends be orcs. Dis' be a bad time."]="我也有一些很好的兽人朋友。这世道太糟糕了。"
G["Some of our huntresses have already made their way to Ban'ethil Barrow Den. They will find you when you get inside. Go ahead and speak to Citarre to secure a ride there."]="我们的一些女猎人已经去过班尼希尔兽穴。当你在那里的时候，她们会找到你。去和辛塔瑞谈谈，从她那里取得坐骑吧。"
G["Some of our kegs went missing recently. They were last seen just east of here..."]="最近我们丢了一些酒。它们本来就在东边不远的地方……"
G["Some of the things here are so glamourous."]="这里有些东西很漂亮。"
G["Some of this ointment should help."]="这些药会有作用的。"
G["Some of those cake designs are outrageous!"]="那几个蛋糕的样子真漂亮！"
G["Some of us get to avoid military duty.  A good fisherman's always handy... even generals need to eat."]="我们中的某些人打算逃避兵役。任何时候，好的渔夫总是有用的……将军也得吃饭啊。"
G["Some of you have not fought in battles. Peace has been with us for many years. Many years we sat idle but many years we battled."]="你们当中的许多人没有参加过真正的战斗。和平，和平已经伴随了我们许多年。这些年来，我们无所事事，但我们也曾奋战过许多年。"
G["Some of you should stay behind to hold the landing zone."]="你们得留下一部分人，守住登陆区域。"
G["Some of you veterans might remember this fella'. Sure, he's broken, but he means to break you! It's Akama!"]="你们中的一些老兵或许还记得这家伙。没错，他是有点支离破碎的，可他也能砸扁你！他就是，阿卡玛！"
G["Some of you veterans might remember this guy. He may be Broken, but today, he means to break you! It's Akama!"]="也许有些老兵还记得这个人。他是个破碎者，但今天他会打碎你的骨头！是阿卡玛！"
G["Some of you will need to stay behind to hold the beachhead."]="你们得留一部分人守住滩头阵地。"
G["Some of your kind chose to join the Alliance."]="你们的一些族人选择加入了联盟。"
G["Some people only want to watch the world burn. Others want to be the ones responsible for burning it..."]="有些人只想看着这个世界燃烧。而另一些人更要亲手把它点燃……"
G["Some people say I'm corny, but I think I'm rather sage."]="有人说我很土，可我觉得自己还挺睿智的。"
G["Some pose that he blames us, his people, for the loss of his son, long ago during the War of the Shifting Sands."]="有些人认为他在责怪我们，责怪他的族人。因为他在很久以前的流沙之战中失去了儿子。"
G["Some rangers seem to be unable to look after their beastly charges themselves. If you simply must stow such a thing somewhere in town, Anathos will take it off your hands. She waits and works in Falconwing Square, outside the inn."]="有些猎人们似乎无法看管好他们自己的野兽。如果你必须找个地方把野兽暂时圈养起来，阿娜索丝可以帮忙。她就在鹰翼广场的旅馆外面工作。"
G["Some saur-priests call me traitor. \"Kroshik does not hunt in the sea,\" they say.\n\nI follow the path of Kros, but I do not agree with these priests. Kroshik hunts WHEREVER HE CAN, and so do I.\n\nThese priests and their stubborn, closed-mind idea of Kroshik have no place in today's Skumblades."]="Algunos sacerdotes saurios me llaman traidor. \"Kroshik no caza en el mar\", dicen.\n\nYo sigo el camino de Kros, pero no estoy de acuerdo con esos sacerdotes. Kroshik caza DONDE PUEDE, igual que yo.\n\nLa visión obstinada y cerrada de esos sacerdotes no tiene sentido para los Hojaescoria de hoy en día."
G["Some say that strength and bravery are most needed for an army's success.  And it's true!  But an army also needs supplies to keep itself in good shape, and it's my job to make sure they have what they need."]="有人说军队的成功靠的是力量和勇气。这是真的！但是军队同样需要充足的物资来维系士气，我的工作便是确保他们的物资需求。"
G["Some seek to take the land from us. The finned hunters squat upon the plains and devour the antlered ones themselves."]="有的想要夺取陆地的控制权。那些盘踞在苔原地带的鳄鱼人大肆掠夺我们赖以为生的猎物。"
G["Some seek to take the sea from us. The giant raiders have invaded our sacred place on the shore."]="敌人打破了我们的宁静生活。他们有的想要夺取海洋的控制权。那些高大的维库人已经侵占了岸边的海象人圣地。"
G["Some sort of rituals were performed at this altar. It looks like a kind of pagan initiation ritual that Velen once told me about. Bloody. Disgusting."]="这座祭坛上曾举行过某种仪式，看起来像是范伦曾经说过的那种异教徒入会仪式。血腥又令人作呕。"
G["Some supplies for the road?  Perhaps a refreshment to enjoy while you watch the fights?"]="买点干粮在路上吃？或者观战的时候也可以喝上一杯？"
G["Some take their knives and lop away anything that displeases them, but this would kill the entire tree. That is not the Pandaren way."]="有些人觉得哪里不如意就剪掉，那实在是取了这棵树的性命。此绝非熊猫人处世之道。"
G["Some terrible things have happened in the Vale of Eternal Blossoms, but the real tragedy is that it's no longer a good place for fishing. All that Jewel Danio! Gone!  \n \nFortunately for you, I've heard of an island off the eastern coast where you can still fish Jewel Danio. If the rumors are correct, you should be able to find a lake full of them there."]="锦绣谷发生了一些可怕的事，但真正的悲剧在于，那里已经完全不适合钓鱼了。所有的珍宝斑马鱼！都完了！\n \n但你很走运，我听说东部海岸附近的一座岛上还能钓到珍宝斑马鱼。如果传言属实的话，你可以在那儿找到满满一湖的鱼。"
G["Some things Gorth has to do himself!"]="看来有的事还是得戈斯亲自动手！"
G["Some things are better left alone!"]="有些东西，最好永远都不去碰！"
G["Some tips: You can always tell what a customer wants by their outfit."]="提示：你可以从客人的穿着打扮上看出他们的需求。"
G["Some topics I can help you with are: | drivers | commands | lag | bots... zzzttt!"]="我能向您提供帮助的主题包括：| 驱动 | 命令 | 延迟 | 机器人……嗞嗞嗞！"
G["Some were spared the anguish that memories provide."]="有人没有受到记忆的折磨。"
G["Somebody call for an exterminator?"]="有人要杀虫剂吗？"
G["Somebody help!"]="谁来救救我！"
G["Somebody help!  Our young are in peril!"]="谁来帮帮忙啊？我们的幼体危在旦夕！"
G["Somebody kill it!"]="快来人干掉它！"
G["Somebody knock that thing off of $n's head!"]="快来人，把$n的脑袋给我砍下来！"
G["Somebody please! Get me out of here before they sacrifice me!"]="有人能救我吗？请救我出去，不要让他们把我当成祭品！"
G["Somebody please... Help..."]="有人吗……救命……"
G["Somebody save me!"]="谁来救救我！"
G["Somebody save us!"]="快来人救救我们！"
G["Somebody set us up The Bomb!"]="有谁来为我们安放好这颗炸弹！"
G["Somebody shut this little girl up!"]="快来人让这小姑娘闭嘴！"
G["Somebody, DO SOMETHING! That's an order!"]="来人呐，快做点什么！这是命令！"
G["Somebody... anybody..."]="有人吗……有人吗……"
G["Somebody... please... get... rock... off... me..."]="有人吗……请……把……这块……石头……挪开……"
G["Someday I hope to improve on our ancient knowledge. Much of it has been lost through the ages."]="我希望有一天能增进我们的古老知识，其中绝大多数都在历史的长河中遗失了。"
G["Someday I'm going to fly on one of those."]="总有一天，我要驾驭其中的一个飞行。"
G["Someday the Klaxxi will elevate my rank. I will be allowed to consume amber."]="终有一天，卡拉克西会晋升我的地位。会允许我消耗琥珀。"
G["Someday when you have seen more of the world, you should come back and speak to me. I can tell you all about the Serpent Riders."]="等你将来见识过更多世面之后，记得回来跟我谈谈。我会把有关翔龙骑士的一切都告诉你。"
G["Someday, I want to be an explorer!"]="将来，我也要成为探险家！"
G["Someday, I will tell my children about you, $n."]="有朝一日，我会把你的故事讲给我的孩子听，$n。"
G["Someday, Ren is going to show me his family's village."]="总有一天，任会带我去看他家所在的村子的。"
G["Someday, perhaps you can tell me more about this strange land from where you came."]="或许某天，你可以跟我多讲一些有关你们那片神奇的故土的情况。"
G["Someday, perhaps you too can aspire to become a serpent rider."]="也许有一天，你也会渴望成为一名翔龙骑士。"
G["Someday, perhaps you will show me your home. It must be very different than ours."]="或许某天，你可以带我去看看你的故乡。那里一定有着别样的风景。"
G["Someday, you may also be called upon to defend all that is dear to you."]="有朝一日，你也会响应召唤，捍卫你所挚爱的一切。"
G["Somehow I doubt that you want training from me, $n. I'm not sure those fingers can handle a firebolt."]="不管怎样，我怀疑你不会想接受我的训练，$n。我不确定你的手指能不能控制好火焰箭。"
G["Somehow the night elves found out we were going to launch the fleet and they struck! Most of the new ships were burned at anchor in the harbor!"]="那些暗夜精灵不知怎的发现了我们要派出舰队，于是就发起了攻击！大部分停泊在港口里的新造船只都被烧毁了！"
G["Somehow, you and Farmer Fung have become acquaintances."]="不知不觉之中，你和农夫老方竟成了熟人。"
G["Somehow, you and Farmer Fung have become best friends. He would probably love to help on Sunsong Ranch."]="不知不觉之中，你和农夫老方已经成了挚友。他或许乐意帮助日歌农场。"
G["Somehow, you and Farmer Fung have become buddies."]="不知不觉之中，你和农夫老方已经成了哥们。"
G["Somehow, you and Farmer Fung have become friends."]="不知不觉之中，你和农夫老方已经成了朋友。"
G["Somehow, you and Farmer Fung have become good friends."]="不知不觉之中，你和农夫老方已经成了好友。"
G["Somehow, you managed to elude all of my guards. You slipped in here like a ghost. That makes you... valuable to me. Let's talk."]="但是，你躲开了我所有的守卫，像个幽灵一样的潜入了这里。这让我觉得……你还有点用处。我们聊聊吧。"
G["Someone LIVES back here?"]="有人住在这后边？"
G["Someone been burnin' my tiki!"]="有人在烧我的神像！"
G["Someone called for me...?"]="谁在叫我……？"
G["Someone called?"]="谁在叫我？"
G["Someone come read this wanted poster to Grek.  Grek can't read!"]="谁过来给葛雷克读下这张通缉令。葛雷克不识字！"
G["Someone else from beyond the portal! I hope you're ready for a fight, $c."]="¡Alguien más del otro lado del portal! Espero que estés $gpreparado:preparada; para luchar, $c."
G["Someone get me out of this cage!"]="快来人把我从这笼子里弄出去！"
G["Someone get me out of this cage!!!"]="快来人把我从这笼子里放出去！！！"
G["Someone get me outta here!"]="来人啊，救我出去！"
G["Someone get me somebody stupid enough to move this thing into Stonetalon!"]="我需要找个够蠢的家伙把这东西带进石爪去！"
G["Someone has come to save us? Perhaps all is not lost..."]="有人来救我们了？也许还有希望……"
G["Someone has crashed into our island.  Removing this thorn may be more complicated than we thought."]="飞船失事，一定有人在这座岛上遇难了。看来要拔掉这根刺绝非易事。"
G["Someone has to report this!"]="必须有人报告这里的情况！"
G["Someone has to save the beer!"]="来人抢救啤酒啊！"
G["Someone help me!"]="谁来救救我！"
G["Someone is using these beakers and alchemy tools to perform experiments with various types of submarine fuel."]="有人正在用这些烧杯和炼金工具进行各种潜水艇燃料的实验。"
G["Someone lost their derk?"]="谁的东西丢了？"
G["Someone must stay behind and keep the Forsaken from gaining a foothold.  Farewell, Genn."]="一定要有人留下来，阻止被遗忘者在这里站稳脚跟。再见了，吉恩。"
G["Someone needs ta lose some weight, mon."]="有人需要减重了，朋友。"
G["Someone needs to do something about that giant turtle in the cave!"]="一定要有人去对付那个洞里的大海龟！"
G["Someone save me!"]="快来人救救我！"
G["Someone shoot that bat down!"]="谁把那只蝙蝠给我打下来！"
G["Someone should finish these yaungol off. I've got better things to do than stand around here all day!"]="真该有人来解决掉这些野牛人。我忙得很，可不能一天到晚站在这儿！"
G["Someone should make a candy with a chewy gnome center."]="真该发明个侏儒夹心软糖啥的……"
G["Someone should tell the king. A chat with Lo'gosh would set these cultists straight!"]="应该有人将这件事告诉国王。同洛戈什谈谈，应该能够让这些教徒明白道理！"
G["Someone tell those fools to stay back.  They're getting slaughtered when they go over there alone!"]="去告诉那些蠢货，别一个劲儿地往前冲。这简直是自寻死路！"
G["Someone told me these crystals are blue in their natural state. I am so glad someone took the time to apply some proper aesthetics."]="有人告诉我，这些水晶在天然状态下是蓝色的。我很高兴有人花时间做了点适当的美化。"
G["Someone took refuge here after the attack, but no sign of Beak."]="在那次攻击之后，有些人逃难到了这里，但他们之中并没有尖喙。"
G["Someone was saying I was \"overhealing\" the other day. I am so confused."]="El otro día, alguien me dijo que estaba \"sobresanándome\". Ya no sé qué hacer."
G["Someone! Help!"]="救命！有人吗？！"
G["Someone! Please help!"]="来人啊！救命啊！"
G["Someone's already made a challenge. The ring will be free when the fight is over."]="有人正在进行挑战。战斗结束后才能使用竞技场。"
G["Someone's been killing all the game out from under me. Hard-won number 48, here."]="有人将那些从我手中逃掉的猎物都杀了。能有48个的成绩已经很不容易了。"
G["Someone's got to stop the Crown Chemical Co. I'd bet my gold-plated Nether-Rocket they're cooking up the next big plague on the chocolate-crazed citizenry's coin...\nIf only I could find someone to serve their apothecaries with court papers! Then we could put an end to it... and maybe seize all their assets, while we're at it!"]="Alguien debe detener a Químicos La Corona S.L. Apuesto mi cohete abisal chapado en oro a que están fabricando la próxima gran plaga con el dinero de los ciudadanos adictos al chocolate...\n\n¡Ojalá encontrara a alguien que entregue los papeles del juzgado a sus boticarios! Entonces acabaríamos con esto... y ya que estamos, ¡quizá podríamos confiscar sus activos!"
G["Someone's here!"]="这里有人！"
G["Someone, or something, seems to have done in the Ambassador!"]="大使似乎是因为某个人或某件事而遇害了！"
G["Somethin unnatural about 'dese creatures."]="这些生物不太正常。"
G["Somethin' hit it, sir. Wasn't cut down, didn't fall on its own."]="什么东西撞上它了，长官。不是砍倒的，也不是自己倒下的。"
G["Somethin' pinched me! Get it, $p!"]="有东西蛰了我！抓住它，$p！"
G["Somethin' smell funny."]="有股怪味儿。"
G["Somethin's a little funny about this here water..."]="这里的水倒是有点意思……"
G["Something I can do for you, Boss?"]="老大，我能为你做什么吗？"
G["Something I can help you with? Looking for a pet pig, perhaps?"]="有什么我能帮你的吗？也许你在找一头宠物猪吧？"
G["Something about sound of battle make this place more relaxing than main hill."]="听着激烈的厮杀搏斗声，远比待在营地舒畅啊。"
G["Something about this land seems to be affecting our squad's morale."]="看来这片土地上的某些东西影响了我们小队的士气。"
G["Something about this village makes my fur stand on end."]="这个村子里有种让我毛骨悚然的气息。"
G["Something about watching people fight to the death really warms my heart!"]="有时候看着其他人以命相搏真是令我感动！"
G["Something about you seems... familiar."]="你看起来……很眼熟。"
G["Something bad in that juju..."]="那个魂能有点古怪……"
G["Something big make pillars and crystals and everything. Frenzyheart not care much cause it not here anymore."]="某个强大的存在制造了柱子、水晶以及别的东西。不过它已经不在这里了，所以我们不用害怕。"
G["Something big's brewing at the Withering to the east.\n\nWhatever it is, I hope that it'll be over soon and we get restationed somewhere nicer."]="在东边的凋零法阵中正酝酿着什么大事。\n\n不论是什么，都希望能早点儿结束，我们可以到环境更好的地方去。"
G["Something big's coming out from the hive, ma'am.  Headed straight for us."]="长官，一个庞然大物从虫巢中钻出来，直接冲我们来了。"
G["Something different!!!"]="一些特别的东西！！！"
G["Something drives them. They are frightened."]="有东西在驱使它们。它们被吓坏了。"
G["Something emerges from the cauldron!"]="有什么东西从锅里冒了出来！"
G["Something feels... different up here. I don't know what, but I expect we shall find out soon enough."]="感觉……这里好像有什么不太对劲。不知道是什么，但我希望我们能尽快将其找出来。"
G["Something fishy here..."]="有点可疑啊……"
G["Something funny about carrot..."]="这根胡萝卜有点怪怪的……"
G["Something happening?"]="发生什么事了？"
G["Something has disturbed the waters. They are normally so well-behaved."]="有什么东西扰乱了水。它们平常都很乖的。"
G["Something is happening with the mantid... and I suspect it has to do with that temple across the bridge."]="螳螂妖心怀不轨……我想和桥那边的寺庙有关。"
G["Something is wrong with the Highlord. Do something!"]="大领主有些不对劲。采取行动！"
G["Something isn't right..."]="有些不太对劲……"
G["Something must be done about these Wretched..."]="必须对这些失心者采取行动了……"
G["Something needs to be done about the Blackwood tribe."]="我们必须采取行动来对付黑木部族。"
G["Something plagues this tower. I've fallen ill and the other Venture Co. employees that work near or in the tower have also become sick.\n\nJust last week, two of our patrollers died, only to instantly come back to life as mindless drones!\n\nThe lifeforce is draining from my body. I can feel myself losing control. Urges taking over... Bad urges... *Fizzule slaps himself in the face* Not yet... Listen... Mine is a position of power. This position privies me to some sensitive information."]="Cierto mal asola esta torre. Yo he caído enfermo y los otros empleados de Ventura y Cía. que trabajan cerca o en la torre también lo han hecho.\n\nPrecisamente la semana pasada murieron dos de nuestros patrulleros para luego volver a la vida instantáneamente, ¡pero como esclavos autómatas!\n\nLa fuerza vital abandona mi cuerpo. Siento cómo pierdo el control. Me invaden impulsos... Malos impulsos... *Burbujita se abofetea la cara* Aún no... Escucha... disfruto de una posición de poder. Esta posición pone a mi alcance información confidencial."
G["Something plagues this tower. I've fallen ill and the other Venture Co. employees that work near or in the tower have also become sick. Just last week, two of our patrollers died, only to come back to life immediately as mindless drones! The lifeforce is draining from my body. I can feel myself losing control. Urges taking over... Bad urges... Not yet... Listen... Mine is a position of power. This position privies me to some sensitive information."]="Cierto mal asola esta torre. Yo he caído enfermo y los otros empleados de Ventura y Cía. que trabajan cerca o en la torre también lo han hecho. Precisamente la semana pasada murieron dos de nuestros patrulleros para luego volver a la vida instantáneamente, ¡pero como esclavos autómatas! La fuerza vital abandona mi cuerpo. Siento cómo pierdo el control. Me invaden impulsos... Malos impulsos... Todavía no... Escucha... Disfruto de una posición de poder. Esta posición pone a mi alcance información confidencial."
G["Something riled that horse. Let's go!"]="有东西惊动了马，我们去看看！"
G["Something smells funny."]="有很奇怪的味道啊。"
G["Something stinks, and for once it's not my socks."]="有东西在发出臭味，这次可不是我的袜子。"
G["Something stirs in the pool of mojo..."]="魔精池里似乎有什么生物在骚动……"
G["Something stirs near Southwind Village! It... it's one of those sandworm creatures! Look out!"]="南风村附近似乎有什么生物蠢蠢欲动！是……是沙虫！保持警惕！"
G["Something straight up stinks in here! It's definitely not me. Gnomes smell like butter and sunshine. Not like those dwarves that smell like they were born from a trogg's armpit! None of you are dwarves, are you?"]="什么东西这么臭啊！肯定不是我。侏儒散发着黄油和阳光的味道，才不像那些脏兮兮的矮人。他们简直像从穴居人的腋窝里爬出来的一样！这里没有矮人，对吧？"
G["Something tells Ken-Ken that's not the last of the sads, though..."]="但肯肯总觉得悲伤的还不止那几个……"
G["Something tells me our friend has returned triumphant."]="我猜我们的朋友已经凯旋而归了。"
G["Something tells me this $n wants the mysterious fossil too. Help!"]="我感觉这个$n也想要这块神秘的化石。快来帮忙！"
G["Something that should have been done a long time ago, you filthy animal."]="干了件我早该完成的事，你这龌龊的怪物。"
G["Something unnatural is going on, Bwemba.  Can you help?"]="这儿发生了些不寻常的事情，布温巴。你能来帮忙吗？"
G["Something very, very disturbing. We're starting to see more of them across the timeways."]="一些非常非常烦人的事情。它们越来越频繁地穿越时间流了。"
G["Something wrong?"]="怎么啦？"
G["Something you need, sir?"]="您需要什么吗，长官？"
G["Something's got those Dark Iron Dwarves riled up.  They show up almost every half-hour, break all the kegs, and leave!\n\nSo you're probably asking, \"Why should I care?\"\n\nI'll tell you...  Because the kegs they break stop us from giving out free brew!  You heard me right, free brew!\n\nSo if you are around when those dwarves show up, take a minute and help protect the kegs."]="Los enanos Hierro negro están irritados por algo. Vienen casi cada media hora, rompen todos los barriles y se van.\n\nTe estarás preguntando \"¿y a mí qué?\"\n\nTe lo explicare... ¡Los barriles que rompen evitan que regalemos cerveza gratis! Me has oído bien: cerveza gratis.\n\nAsí que, si estás por aquí cuando aparezcan esos enanos, dedica un minutos a ayudar a proteger los barriles."
G["Something's wrong. The baby's turned the wrong way."]="不太对劲。婴儿的胎位不正。"
G["Something's wrong... I sense a dark presence."]="不对劲……我感觉到黑暗的气息。"
G["Somethun' even BETTER. History! Artifacts from an ancient an' powerful race!"]="还有更好的东西。史无前例！一个强大的远古遗物！"
G["Sometimes I dream of this amazing city being complete.  Alas, all this work has turned my dreams into nightmares!"]="有时候我曾梦想这座宏伟的城市竣工后的模样。唉，但是这些工作把我的梦变成了噩梦！"
G["Sometimes I get so tense, but I can't speed up the time..."]="有时我是如此紧张，但我不能加速时间……"
G["Sometimes I impress even myself. And down goes the dragon!"]="有时候我觉得自己还不错。那条龙掉下来了！"
G["Sometimes I stand here, looking into the forest beyond the lake, and I see the land as it once was... green and full of life."]="有时候我站在这里，看着河对岸的森林，我仿佛看到了这片土地曾经的容貌……一片充满生机的绿色。"
G["Sometimes I surprise even myself!"]="有时，连我自己都感到惊讶！"
G["Sometimes I think it was the very precariousness of our world that drove my father to madness."]="有时我会想，正是我们这个世界的动荡，逼疯了我的父亲。"
G["Sometimes Tonsa lets me ride on his back... but he's kinda stinky."]="有时唐莎会让我骑到他背上……可他太臭了。"
G["Sometimes a distraction can backfire and cause the orcs to become suspicious. In those instances the orcs will actively search for us. It's best to keep a good distance from any orc detecting stealth."]="有时分散注意力的行为会引发反效果，让兽人们变得多疑。在那种情况下，兽人们会主动寻找我们。最好离那些具备侦测隐形能力的兽人远一点儿。"
G["Sometimes a well timed precision strike is all you need to take down even the toughest of foes."]="有时候，时机和精准都把握得恰到好处的攻击，足以击败最难对付的敌人。"
G["Sometimes big-tongues try to come get crystals. Not now because they not like it when we kill them."]="有时候大舌头怪会来这里采集水晶。当然，它们现在敢来的话，就是找死。"
G["Sometimes dey start eatin' before you dead."]="有时他们不得不直接吞了你。"
G["Sometimes even I wish that I didn't know. But then I realize it's for the best."]="有时候，我甚至希望我什么也不知道。但很快我就意识到现在这样也挺好的。"
G["Sometimes even the finest make mistakes."]="有时即便是精英也会犯错。"
G["Sometimes it feels like I'll never go back to being a simple functionary in service to Dame Auriferous. I'm not cut out for war.\n\nThankfully there are those like you who burn to see Quel'Thalas restored to its former beauty. Crush the Scourge, $c! Crush them wherever you can!"]="有时我会觉得，我永远也不能再像以前那样单纯地为奥莉菲洛丝夫人服务了。战争完全扰乱了我的生活。\n\n好在还有你这样的人物，致力于使奎尔萨拉斯恢复它原有的平静。消灭亡灵天灾，$c！竭尽全力消灭他们！"
G["Sometimes it is good to take a step back and reflect upon our larger goals."]="有时后退一步，将目光放在长远目标上，还是大有裨益的。"
G["Sometimes it's nice to get away from the sanctum and get some fresh air."]="偶尔离开圣殿，呼吸一下新鲜空气也是很不错的。"
G["Sometimes the best defense is to prevent your opponent from acting against you."]="有时，最好的防御就是在敌人采取行动前，先发制人。"
G["Sometimes the mist cannot find its way if we are too far. Let's venture further and try again."]="有时候，如果我们距离太远，雾气就会让我们无法找到路径。让我们更深入一些，重试一次。"
G["Sometimes the most beautiful things are also the most deadly. Just look at me!"]="有时候最美丽的事物也是最致命的。看着我！"
G["Sometimes the only way to find something is to stop looking."]="有时候，你不去找它，想找的东西反而会自己出现。"
G["Sometimes the roads we travel teach us more about ourselves than we would expect."]="有时，我们能在旅途中意外地看清自己。"
G["Sometimes the straightforward approach to a problem is the best."]="有时候，直接了当地提问是最好的。"
G["Sometimes these goons make it too easy."]="有时这些蠢蛋太好对付了。"
G["Sometimes things happen because someone said a thing had to happen.  It makes keeping history straight a little difficult... but we make do."]="有些事，不过是人们口口相传的留言罢了。这使得我们揭示历史真相时变得有些困难……但我们也只能将就一下了。"
G["Sometimes things just need doin' even if it does mean breakin' a few things along the way!"]="有些事情必须做好，哪怕它意味着要损失一些其他的东西！"
G["Sometimes those damnable blood elves stop by and require some inane reagent or poison. I must keep my stock of such items full at all times lest Lord Illidan get word of the Dragonmaw not cooperating...\n\n<Rumpus swallows hard.>\n\nWe don't want that..."]="A veces esos detestables elfos de sangre vienen por aquí y necesitan algún reactivo inane o algún veneno. Tengo que mantener mis reservas de esos productos llenas todo el tiempo para que no le lleguen rumores a Lord Illidan de que los Faucedraco no están colaborando...\n\n<Rumpus traga con dificultad>\n\nNo queremos que pase eso..."
G["Sometimes virmen try to burrow up into the soil plots and live there, hoping vegetables will just rain down on them - I think they figure we just put 'em in the ground whole for some reason.\n\nSquatters, that's what Grandpa called them. You gotta put your foot down. Literally. Stomp the ground and root 'em out!"]="有时候兔妖会在地里打洞然后住进去，盼着蔬菜能掉到它们头上——我想它们是觉得我们把蔬菜放进土里是有什么原因的。\n\n赖着不走的家伙，我爷爷是这么叫它们的。你得脚踏实地，我是说字面意思。你用脚使劲跺地面，把它们震出来！"
G["Sometimes you gotta be sternum with unruly ghosts."]="有时你就得对不守规矩的鬼魂狠一点。"
G["Sometimes you just need to take out one target. Use chloroform while behind the enemy!|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_NATURE_SLEEP.BLP:16|t"]="!有时你只需要解决一个目标。在敌人背后使用麻醉！|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_NATURE_SLEEP.BLP:16|t"
G["Sometimes you want to party hard, Thunderbrew's got ya covered!  Check them out at Brewfest!"]="你想尽情享受欢乐吗？雷酒就是你最好的选择！去美酒节试试吧！"
G["Sometimes, even when I'm awake, I think they're watching us. Maybe they're watching us right now..."]="有时候，甚至在我清醒的时候，我都觉得他们正监视着我们。也许他们现在正监视着我们……"
G["Sometimes, the fragile wasp is far more effective than the mighty bull."]="有时，弱不禁风的黄蜂会比力大无穷的公牛更有威力。"
G["Sometimes... sometimes it hurts to have so much money. It's so lonely. Just me and all my gold."]="有时候……有时候抱着这么多钱也不是什么好事儿。这感觉太孤单了。我穷得就只剩下钱。"
G["Somewhere safe..."]="安全的地方……"
G["Somewhere to fly to?  You'll need to go to the Undercity for that!  Go south on the road out of town, then southwest to the Ruins of Lordaeron.  You can catch the elevator down to the Undercity from the back of the ruins and once there ask an Undercity Guardian for more specific directions."]="想飞往某处？你得去幽暗城才行！沿着城镇南面的道路走，然后往西南方前进，到达洛丹伦废墟。你可以乘坐废墟后面的升降梯到幽暗城，问问幽暗城守卫，获取更详细的指示。"
G["Somone stop that ghoul!"]="谁能挡住这个食尸鬼！"
G["Son of Durotan... Grandson of Garad and Geyah... Bow your heads for a Warchief is among us..."]="杜隆坦之子……加拉达和盖亚安的孙子……向我们的酋长鞠躬吧……"
G["Son! Are you well?"]="儿子！你还好吗？"
G["Son! What are you doing! She's a Goldendraft."]="儿子！你在干什么！她是金酿家族的人。"
G["Song of the Yaungol."]="野牛人之歌。"
G["Sons and daughters of Gilneas! Friends and allies old and new! Please, come close!"]="吉尔尼斯的儿女们！新老盟友们！大家请到我这里来！"
G["Sons and daughters of de Darkspear! Friends of de tribe!"]="暗矛的儿女们！部族的朋友们！"
G["Sons and daughters of the Horde! Today you stand free due to the strength of your heroes and the actions of this champion, $p! The Kor'kron arrival heralds dark times for the Horde."]="部落的儿女们！今日你们之所以还能自由地站在这块土地上，全归功于这位英雄，$p！库卡隆的暴行宣告着部落进入了一个黑暗的时代。"
G["Sons of Cenarion, UNITE!"]="塞纳里奥之子，团结起来！"
G["Sons of Hodir! I humbly present to you...."]="霍迪尔之子！在此，我谦卑地奉上……"
G["Sons of Stormwall, descend and destroy those who would prevent me from protecting this world!"]="风墙之子，降临凡间，摧毁那些阻止我保护这个世界的敌人吧。"
G["Soo-$n, maybe you give us whistle for when we need to call you. Oki?"]="那么$n，你能给我们个哨子吗？这样我们想你的时候吹吹哨子就能见到你了，好吗？"
G["Soo-holu appear to Sparktouched more than any other Oracle tribe. It's true!"]="索乌霍鲁是最聪明的灵鳍神谕者。不骗你！"
G["Soo-holu going to get you! Silly puppy-men. Hahah!"]="索乌霍鲁来抓你们啦！愚蠢的狗狗人。哈哈哈！"
G["Soo-holu was left behind by the Great Ones... you might know them as titans."]="造物主将索乌霍鲁留在这里……我们口中的造物主，就是你熟知的泰坦。"
G["Soo-holu with see this battle done..."]="索乌霍鲁会终止这场战斗……"
G["Soo-say better appreciate these."]="索乌塞应该会喜欢这些玩意儿吧。"
G["Soo-say didn't look into anything when the mosswalkers mentioned strange weather, now they're all dead... does that seem right to you?"]="整个苔行村都在谈论异常的气候时，索乌塞没有采取任何措施，现在他们都死了……你觉得这件事正常吗？"
G["Soo-say really nice to us.  We like Soo-say."]="索乌塞对我们很和善。我们都很喜欢他。"
G["Sooie nah mi juju, gobin!"]="¡Sooie nah mi juju, gobin!"
G["Sooli, move!"]="苏立，快跑开！"
G["Soon ALL of Azeroth will burn!"]="整个艾泽拉斯都将燃烧！"
G["Soon I will plant roots and sleep.   Before I rest there are things that must yet be done."]="播下种子之后我就要睡觉了。在休息之前，我必须做好这些应该做的事。"
G["Soon Kun-Lai Summit and all of Pandaria will be consumed with anger. And then, the world!"]="很快，昆莱山和整个潘达利亚都将被怒火吞噬。然后，就是全世界！"
G["Soon after, the pandaren arrived."]="不久以后，熊猫人来了。"
G["Soon after, we began to have visions of a creature... A creature with the feathers of an owl, but the will and might of a bear..."]="很快，我们眼前浮现出一种生物的幻象……它有猫头鹰的羽毛，同时也有熊的意志和力量……"
G["Soon all of Draenor's water will be ours."]="不久以后，德拉诺的所有水都会是我们的。"
G["Soon all our enemies will beg for mercy or be shatterd bones under our feet!"]="很快，我们所有的敌人都会祈求我们的仁慈，或成为我们脚下的碎骨！"
G["Soon all the world will know the name of Wilfred!"]="很快，全世界都将知道威尔弗雷德的名字！"
G["Soon child... very soon."]="不久之后，孩子……不久之后。"
G["Soon da cages gonna be empty, da sacrifices be complete, and you gonna take dere places."]="很快，笼子就会变空，献祭就将完成，而你们，则会代替他们的位置。"
G["Soon enough we take over dis valley.  Soon enough."]="我们很快就会占领这座山谷。"
G["Soon it will be finished!"]="很快就都结束了。"
G["Soon now, $n.\n\nFinal preparations are being made, den our advance on Gundrak begins!"]="很快，$n。\n\n我们已经做好准备，可以启程前往古达克了！"
G["Soon the master will reclaim me!"]="主人很快就会召我回去的！"
G["Soon the master's voice will call to you."]="很快，你就将听到主人的召唤。"
G["Soon the world will tremble."]="很快，这个世界也要颤抖。"
G["Soon they will overwhelm this continent! Where do we draw the line?"]="很快他们将霸占整个大陆！我们何以划清界限？"
G["Soon we gonna' be seein' dem Kor'kron rollin' up over da hills."]="很快，那些库卡隆就会像潮水一样涌上山头。"
G["Soon we shall bring about the return of the old gods."]="不久我们就可以迎回上古之神了。"
G["Soon we shall rid Azeroth of the silithids' abominable presence.  Their potential for destruction is much greater than what you've seen firsthand, $n.  Greater, darker powers are behind their activities."]="很快我们就能让那些可憎的异种虫类从艾泽拉斯世界消失了。它们可能造成的破坏比你先前所见的要恐怖得多，$n。他们背后是更可怕、更黑暗的力量。"
G["Soon we will eradicate the Alliance and Horde. Then the rest of Azeroth will fall before the might of my army."]="联盟和部落很快就将被我们瓦解，之后，艾泽拉斯大陆也必然被天灾大军征服。"
G["Soon we will have the power of your gods!"]="我们将攫取你们崇拜的神灵的力量！"
G["Soon we will march upon this cursed place and cleanse it of its evil!"]="很快我们就会进入这个被诅咒的地方，清除一切邪恶！"
G["Soon you shall be nothing more than a stain to clean off of my foot."]="很快，你们这些家伙就会变成我脚底下的一块污渍。"
G["Soon you will be like us..."]="你很快就会和我们一样了……"
G["Soon you will belong to the Scourge."]="很快，你就会成为天灾军团的一员。"
G["Soon you will know the price of your meddling, mortals... The master is nearly whole... And when he rises, your world will cease."]="很快你就会知道多管闲事的后果了，凡人……我的主人很快就能恢复力量……当他站起来的时候，就是你的世界毁灭的时候。"
G["Soon you will understand why my subjects fear the shadows!"]="你很快就会明白，为什么我的臣民惧怕暗影！"
G["Soon, $n!\n\nSoon ya be tastin' true power. Soon ya be rewarded for your dedication and service."]="¡Pronto, $n!\n\nPronto probarás el auténtico poder. Pronto recibirás la recompensa por tu dedicación y servicio."
G["Soon, Lokholar shall rise... Soon... Very, very soon..."]="很快，洛克霍拉就会出现……很快……非常，非常快……"
G["Soon, mortal, you too shall have a blade for a prison."]="凡人，你很快也会成为剑中的囚徒。"
G["Soon, my love. Soon you will waken and all of Azeroth will know fear!"]="亲爱的，快啦。你很快就会苏醒过来，艾泽拉斯世界将在恐惧中颤抖！"
G["Soon, one known as $n, soon we will have destroyed our captors!"]="不必再等多久了，你这个叫$n的家伙，我们很快就会消灭那些抓捕我们的混蛋！"
G["Soon, our sideshow will be the talk of Azeroth!"]="很快，我们的行动便将在艾泽拉斯住民间广为传颂！"
G["Soon, our time will come!"]="很快，我们的时代就要来了！"
G["Soon, the Scourge will rule the world!"]="亡灵天灾很快就将统治世界！"
G["Soon, the bones of Galakrond will rise from their eternal slumber and wreak havoc upon this world!"]="迦拉克隆的骸骨很快就要从永恒的长眠中觉醒，为世界带来一场残酷的浩劫！"
G["Soon, the master will grant them the dark gift, making them fit to serve the Lich King for eternity!"]="很快，主人会赐予他们黑暗的礼物，让他们能够永远为巫妖王效劳！"
G["Soon, the rifts will be large enough for Gahz'rilla to assault the heathens' cities directly. She will reduce them to frozen rubble!"]="很快，加兹瑞拉就能通过增宽的裂隙一举摧毁异教徒的城市了。她会把它们都碾成冰冷的碎石！"
G["Soon, they started killing the mogu themselves."]="很快，他们便开始残杀魔古。"
G["Soon, very soon, it will all pay off."]="快了，快了，很快就要完成了。"
G["Soon, you and your Alliance will only be found in Azeroth's history books."]="很快，你和你的联盟就会被写进艾泽拉斯的历史书里。"
G["Soon, young ones. Soon the armies of the Horde will arrive. We march. March to the cursed gates and crush all in our way. Let them feel the might of Kalimdor!"]="很快，年轻的勇士们。很快部落的军团就会抵达这里。我们将全面推进，开往那座被诅咒的大门，消灭一切敌人。让它们感受卡利姆多联军的力量！"
G["Soon, your thirst for destruction will be quenched."]="你毁灭一切的欲望很快就会消失……"
G["Soon, zhey shall learn... and vhen zhey do, zhey vill tremble!"]="他们很快就会明白……而那时，他们将在恐惧中战栗！"
G["Soon. I hear he has gathered the most powerful casters in Outland together to help perform the summoning."]="很快。我听说他聚集了外域所有最强大的法师来帮他召唤。"
G["Sooo lifelike!"]="真是栩栩如生！"
G["Sooo spikey! Ouch! Ouch!"]="太蜇人了！哎哟！哎哟！"
G["Sooooo cute!!!"]="太可爱了！！！"
G["Sorlof been tricked! Aarrrrggghhh..."]="索罗夫被耍了！啊啊啊啊……"
G["Sorlof's booty falls to the floor."]="索罗夫的财宝掉在了地上。"
G["Sorry $g lad : lass;, ye aren't quite up to the challenge of learning from me. Go see my son Groum, it would make his day to get a new apprentice."]="Lo siento $gmuchacho:muchacha;, todavía no eres tan $gbueno:buena; como para aprender de mí. Ve a ver a mi hijo Groum, le alegrará el día conseguir un nuevo aprendiz."
G["Sorry I asked..."]="呃，抱歉，我不该问的……"
G["Sorry I haven't seen it either.  Maybe it's for the best..."]="抱歉，我也没看见。也许这样倒好……"
G["Sorry I made such a mess o' things."]="对不起，我把一切都搞砸了。"
G["Sorry about having to deal with my wife, mon. She's crazy, but I still love her, you know?"]="很抱歉让你去和我妻子打交道，老兄。她很疯狂，但我仍然爱她，你知道吗？"
G["Sorry about my earlier rudeness. I was worried about my father. Friends?"]="我为刚刚的无礼行为道歉。因为我非常担心我的父亲。我们是朋友，对不对？"
G["Sorry about the interruption, Martek.  You've gotta admit though... I made your story about fifty times better.  Next drink's on me."]="抱歉打扰你，马特克。虽然你已经得到了承认……是我让你的故事精彩了五十倍。下次也应该让我露露脸了。"
G["Sorry for ribbin' ya so much."]="抱歉我太爱开玩笑了。"
G["Sorry for slicky smell. Clever Ashyo not clean jinyu."]="我对这臭味儿感到很抱歉。聪明的阿西约是条臭鱼。"
G["Sorry friend, we don't have one of those here in Brill.  You'll have to head to the Undercity for that.  The Undercity is underneath the Ruins of Lordaeron to the south of Brill.  From the back of the ruins take the elevator down and then speak to one of the Undercity Guardians to find your way further."]="Lo siento $gamigo:amiga;, no hay ninguno de esos aquí en Rémol. Tendrás que dirigirte a Entrañas. Entrañas está bajo las Ruinas de Lordaeron, al sur de Rémol. En la parte trasera de las ruinas encontrarás un ascensor, baja con él a la ciudad y pide a uno de los guardianes de la ciudad que te siga ayudando con las señas."
G["Sorry pal, can't let you play for free."]="抱歉伙计，我可不能让你白玩。"
G["Sorry to have bothered you, friend. Carry on!"]="朋友，很抱歉打扰到你了。你忙你的吧！"
G["Sorry to keep you waiting, sugarfur. I know how you worry. Truth is, this stranger here saved my old hide. Go figure."]="抱歉让你久等了，甜心。我知道你有多担心。事实上，是这个陌生人救了我这把老骨头。真不可思议。"
G["Sorry!  Won't happen again, sir!"]="抱歉！下不为例，长官！"
G["Sorry, $c.\n\nI ain't believin' ya got de right mind for graspin' de nature of portal magic."]="抱歉，$c。\n\n我不认为你有能力掌握传送门魔法的真髓。"
G["Sorry, $c. \n\nYour grasp of the arcane isn't strong enough to understand portal magic."]="抱歉，$c。\n\n你对奥术的掌握还不够强大，还无法理解传送门魔法。"
G["Sorry, $c. De ink's run dry 'round here."]="抱歉，$c。我的墨水都干了。"
G["Sorry, $c. I got nothin' for ya."]="抱歉，$c。我这里没有你要的东西。"
G["Sorry, $n, but you do kind of stand out."]="Perdona, pero das un poco el cante."
G["Sorry, $n, we can't serve you anymore ale."]="对不起，$n，我们不能再卖啤酒给你了。"
G["Sorry, $n, you've had enough ale for now."]="对不起，$n，你已经喝得够多了。"
G["Sorry, $n. Now would you kindly remove your corpse so that the others can have a go?"]="很抱歉，$n。现在，可以请你把自己的尸体弄走，好让下面的人继续比赛吗？"
G["Sorry, Huldar... But it seems I've misled you."]="对不起，胡达尔……但是似乎我骗了你。"
G["Sorry, I can't talk right now. After we're done training here, it's time for lunch!"]="抱歉，我现在不能和你闲聊。等我们完成这里的训练之后，就该吃午饭了！"
G["Sorry, I cannot train you."]="对不起，我无法对你进行训练。"
G["Sorry, I couldn't hold out.  I hope this doesn't mean that you're about to cease to exist...."]="对不起，我坚持不住了。希望你不会就此消失……"
G["Sorry, I don't speak with the help."]="对不起，我不需要帮忙。"
G["Sorry, I have to set a broken leg on a baby dragon. Can you come back in a few minutes?"]="抱歉，我必须要给一个龙宝宝接上断腿。你能过几分钟再回来吗？"
G["Sorry, I'm a little pre-occupied at the moment. This is my chance to show off for the ladies. Talk to me after I've won this fight!"]="抱歉，我现在可没空理你。这是我向那些小姐们炫耀身手的大好机会。等我打赢再来找我！"
G["Sorry, I'm still gettin' the hang o' things 'round here."]="抱歉，我在这儿还有点事情要做。"
G["Sorry, Tinky, but I can't afford you as a distraction while I'm doing what needs to be done here."]="抱歉，丁奇。我有事要办，不能陪你。"
G["Sorry, Yue, but that's all the full blossoms I could find. Most of the flowers in this pool just aren't ready yet."]="对不起，月，我所能找到的鲜花都在这里了。水池里的花大多数还没开。"
G["Sorry, ah'm late."]="对不起，我来晚了。"
G["Sorry, but Chromie said that I couldn't reveal anything about your future to you. She said that if I did, I would cease to exist."]="不好意思，克罗米禁止我透露任何未来的事情。她警告说，如果我告诉了你，那我有可能就不会存在了。"
G["Sorry, but I am not disposed to sell horses to any individual who is not considered to be at least exalted to the Kingdom of Stormwind.  These steeds are the finest you'll find anywhere, and we certainly wouldn't want them in the hands of our enemies.\n\nNot saying you're an enemy, of course... just earn the trust of Stormwind and then we can do business."]="Lo siento, pero no estoy dispuesto a vender caballos a alguien a quien el Reino de Ventormenta no considere exaltado. Estos corceles son los mejores que se pueden encontrar y, ciertamente, no queremos que caigan en manos enemigas.\n\nNo estoy diciendo que seas $gun enemigo:una enemiga;, no... Solo tienes que ganarte la confianza de Ventormenta y después podremos hacer negocios."
G["Sorry, but I am not disposed to sell horses to any individual who is not considered to be at least friendly to the Kingdom of Stormwind.  These steeds are the finest you'll find anywhere, and we certainly wouldn't want them in the hands of our enemies.\n\nNot saying you're an enemy, of course... just earn the trust of Stormwind and then we can do business."]="Lo siento, pero no estoy dispuesto a vender mis caballos a nadie que no sea considerado amistoso del Reino de Ventormenta. Estos corceles son los mejores que podrás encontrar y no los querríamos ver en las manos de nuestros enemigos.\n\nNo sugiero que tú seas $gun enemigo:una enemiga;... por supuesto... gánate la confianza de Ventormenta y podremos hacer negocios."
G["Sorry, but I had to check. Okay, let's get out of here."]="抱歉，但我必须进行检查。好了，让我们离开这里吧。"
G["Sorry, but I only train rogues."]="对不起，但是我只训练盗贼。"
G["Sorry, but my services are only of use to druids."]="抱歉，但我只跟德鲁伊打交道。"
G["Sorry, but my services are only of use to hunters."]="抱歉，但我只跟猎人打交道。"
G["Sorry, but my services are only of use to mages."]="抱歉，但我只跟法师打交道。"
G["Sorry, but my services are only of use to paladins."]="抱歉，但我只跟圣骑士打交道。"
G["Sorry, but my services are only of use to priests."]="抱歉，但我只跟牧师打交道。"
G["Sorry, but my services are only of use to rogues."]="抱歉，但我只跟潜行者打交道。"
G["Sorry, but my services are only of use to shamans."]="抱歉，但我只跟萨满祭司打交道。"
G["Sorry, but my services are only of use to warlocks."]="抱歉，但我只跟术士打交道。"
G["Sorry, but my services are only of use to warriors."]="抱歉，但我只跟战士打交道。"
G["Sorry, but we'll have to speak some other time. Farewell."]="不好意思，我们还是另找时间谈吧。再见。"
G["Sorry, but you've reached the limit of what I can teach. If you want to learn more, go see Telonis in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus. He's pretty talented, so I hear."]="很抱歉，我已经没有什么可以教给你的了。如果你还想学的话，就去达纳苏斯的工匠区找泰龙尼斯吧。我听说他相当有才能。"
G["Sorry, friend. I'm afraid we've used all of the parts we can spare at the moment."]="对不起，朋友。我们手头的零件好象都用完了。"
G["Sorry, friend. Only certified officers of the Alliance can authorize the purchase of a vehicle."]="对不起，朋友。只有联盟的军官才有权购买载具。"
G["Sorry, friend. Only certified officers of the Horde can authorize the purchase of a vehicle."]="对不起，朋友。只有部落的正式军官才有权购买载具。"
G["Sorry, friend. You'll have to seek training elsewhere."]="Lo siento, $gamigo:amiga;. Tendrás que buscar instrucción en otra parte."
G["Sorry, he doesn't seem to like you very much. He's usually only friendly with Pyromancers."]="Lo siento, él no parece que te quiera mucho. Generalmente solo es amigable con los Pirománticos."
G["Sorry, mon. It won't happen again."]="抱歉。这件事不会再发生了。"
G["Sorry, not here to chat.  I need a wind rider to take on a special mission."]="对不起，我不是来聊天的。我需要一头双足飞龙来执行特殊任务。"
G["Sorry, sister. It's nothing to worry about."]="抱歉，姐妹。这不值得担心。"
G["Sorry, vanishing!"]="抱歉，隐身！"
G["Sorry, we aren't accepting visitors right now."]="抱歉，我们现在不接待访客。"
G["Sorry, you lose! <PH>"]="¡Lo siento, has perdido! <PH>"
G["Sorry, you win! <PH>"]="¡Lo siento, tú ganas! <PH>"
G["Sorry... me gone... so long... master."]="对不起……主人……我离开了……这么久。"
G["Sorry? SORRY?! Here's sorry for you!"]="对不起？就会说对不起？！我对你太失望了！"
G["Sorta busy."]="有点忙。"
G["Soul-less, ale-hatin', uncultured vagabonds! Ya better hide!"]="没有灵魂的，不喜欢啤酒的，粗蠢的混蛋！你们可别让我看见！"
G["Soulfire."]="灵魂之火。"
G["Sound the alarm!"]="拉响警报！"
G["Sounds good to me! And maybe next time, you could warn us about the GIANT MURDEROUS CROCODILE."]="听起来不错！也许下次你可以提醒我们“巨型杀人鳄”的事。"
G["Sounds good."]="听起来不错。"
G["Sounds good. First battalion prepare yourselves! And never forget..."]="听起来不错。第一营做好准备！而且千万别忘了……"
G["Sounds impressive."]="听上去很不错。"
G["Sounds kinda like one of Billy's fish stories to me."]="对我来说，这听起来就像是比利的那些关于钓鱼的故事。"
G["Sounds like a bunch of rotten Hawkstrider eggs to me."]="对我来说这些东西就好似一堆腐烂的陆行鸟蛋一样。"
G["Sounds like the Horde are close to finding the location o' that Divine Bell, and that ain't no good."]="听上去部落就快要找到那口圣钟的地点了，那可不是什么好事。"
G["Sounds like the Muskpaw Ranch was hit."]="听起来受到袭击的应该是麝香爪牧场。"
G["Sounds like the battle will be fierce and the plunder good!"]="听起来会是场激烈的战斗，战利品一定很丰厚！"
G["Sounds like they found our little present."]="他们好像发现那个小礼物了。"
G["Sounds like you want to talk to Maginor Dumas! You can usually find him in the Wizard's Sanctum in the Mage Quarter. Course, you never know when or where those magi will portal off to."]="听起来你得去跟玛吉诺·仲马谈谈！你可以在法师区的巫师圣殿找到他。当然，那些法师总是来去无踪……"
G["Sounds like you've had quite the adventure, $n. There must have been plenty of moolah on those Alliance creeps."]="看样子你进行过不少冒险，$n。那些联盟软蛋手里可是有不少钱。"
G["Sounds like you've had quite the adventure, $n. There must have been plenty of moolah on those Alliance creeps.\n\nWant to purchase some training?"]="看样子你进行过不少冒险，$n。那些联盟软蛋手里可是有不少钱。\n\n想要进行训练吗？"
G["Sounds like you've really stirred up a hornet's nest, $c.\n\nReady to set sail?"]="看来你确实捅了马蜂窝了，$c。\n\n准备好起航了吗？"
G["Soup's on, men! Eat up. We've got a long day ahead."]="汤做好了！快点吃。我们还有很长的路要赶。"
G["South! Now!"]="南边！快！"
G["Southern Bank"]="南部银行"
G["Southern Rocketway Terminus, please."]="南部火箭车终点站，谢谢。"
G["Southsea Freebooters? This place is really going downhill."]="南海海盗？这个地方真的要完蛋了。"
G["Southshore is such a peaceful town.... I'd like to live here someday."]="南海镇是个多么宁静的城镇啊……我真希望有一天可以定居在这里。"
G["Southshore shall pay in blood!"]="南海镇将会付出血的代价！"
G["Southshore stout, how do I love thee? Let me count the ways..."]="你知道我多么喜欢南海镇的美酒吗？让我告诉你……"
G["Spare a copper, $G sir:madam;?"]="施舍个铜币吧，$g先生:女士;？"
G["Spare a copper? You won't need it soon. The end of days nears..."]="有多余的铜币吗？反正你很快就不再需要它了。世界末日快要来了……"
G["Spare a silver, friend?"]="¿Tienes un poco de plata para mí, $gamigo:amiga;?"
G["Spare me, Muradin. You weren't there to see what Mal'Ganis did to my homeland."]="别管我了，穆拉丁。你没见过玛尔加尼斯对我的家乡做了什么。"
G["Spare my life!  I will tell you about Arelion's secret."]="请饶我一命！我会告诉你埃雷利恩的秘密。"
G["Spare my life! I will leave this place forever! Please!"]="饶命！我会离开的！永远不会回来！求你！"
G["Spare my life, $n! Please!"]="饶了我吧，$n！求你了！"
G["Spare no one!"]="不留活口！"
G["Spare some change for a poor blind man? ...What do you mean I'm not blind? ...I'M NOT BLIND! I CAN SEE!! It's a miracle!"]="给我这个可怜的瞎子一点零钱吧？……你说我不是瞎子？……我真的不瞎了！我能看见了！！这真是一个奇迹！"
G["Spare some change for a starving artist?"]="施舍施舍我这个饿得要死的艺术家吧？"
G["Spare some change?"]="省下一些零钱？"
G["Spare some copper?"]="赏几个铜板吧？"
G["Spare the cleaver, spoil the patient."]="不动真格的，就治不好病人。"
G["Sparklight's vehicle emporium is open for business!"]="斯巴克莱特的战车商店开始营业啦！"
G["Sparkmaster Vu stares at you mutely. With a powerful swing of his halberd, he attacks!"]="电卜师乌古沉默地凝视着你，狠狠一挥手中的战戟，发动了进攻！"
G["Sparktouched best fighters for sure! Zap zap. Get things good!"]="灵鳍鳄鱼人最厉害！嚓！嚓！拯救世界！"
G["Spawn Nefarian please!"]="请刷新奈法利安"
G["Spawn of the Old Gods materialize nearby!"]="上古之神的爪牙突然现身了！"
G["Speak for yourself, Thrall."]="别算上我，萨尔。"
G["Speak freely, friend."]="有话直说，朋友。"
G["Speak not your vulgar language to me!  Only Hydraxis can stand it."]="闭上你的脏嘴！也只有海达克西斯公爵才受得了你。"
G["Speak now, Eye of Twilight."]="请说吧，暮光之眼。"
G["Speak quickly, $n. We haven't much time!"]="说快点，$n。我们没有太多时间！"
G["Speak quickly, mortal, before you are discovered by one less discriminating than I."]="有话快说，凡人，趁着其他人还没发现你。可不是人人都像我这么有耐心的。"
G["Speak quickly; I don't have time to waste on idle chatter. The Forsaken have become a force to be reckoned with, but there is still much to do in a given day. This city doesn't run itself.\n\nWhat do you want?"]="快点说，我没有时间浪费在闲聊上。被遗忘者已经变成了一股不可低估的力量，但是我们仍然有很多事需要去做。这座城市可不会自己运转起来。\n\n你想要什么？"
G["Speak quietly and with great care, the wrong word in these parts could get your throat cut. Now, what is it you need from me?"]="在这里说话你要小心点，一不小心就可能招来杀身之祸。现在，你有什么需要我帮助的事情吗？"
G["Speak slowly, child, I am new to your strange tongue."]="Habla despacio, $gniño:niña;, tu extraño idioma es nuevo para mí."
G["Speak to Elder Anli if you are interested in joining our ranks."]="如果你想加入到我们的行列，就去跟安离长老谈一谈。"
G["Speak to Grezz Ragefist in the Hall of the Brave, which is in the Valley of Honor.  Put in a good word for me!"]="去荣誉谷的勇者大厅找格雷兹·怒拳谈谈。并代我向他问好！"
G["Speak to Paymaster Lendry on the second floor of the barracks.\nHe can arrange to store your goods with Theramore's treasury."]="Habla con el pagador Lendry en la segunda planta del cuartel.\n\nÉl se encargará de que puedas almacenar tus objetos en la tesorería de Theramore."
G["Speak to Pephredo at the Darkbriar Lodge in the Valley of Spirits, up above and to the west of the Valley of Strength."]="往上走去力量谷以西，去精神谷的黑石南小屋找皮菲瑞多谈谈。"
G["Speak to me again when you are prepared to face your inner demons."]="当你们准备好面对自己的心魔，再来跟我说话吧。"
G["Speak to me when you are ready for combat, young $c."]="Habla conmigo cuando estés $gpreparado:preparada; para el combate."
G["Speak to me when you are ready to begin."]="当你们准备好的时候就告诉我。"
G["Speak to me when you are ready to go, $n."]="准备好出发的时候跟我说话，$n。"
G["Speak to me when you are ready to launch the assault!"]="做好出击的准备后，请告诉我一声！"
G["Speak to me when you are ready to race, $n."]="Habla conmigo cuando estés $glisto:lista; para competir, $n."
G["Speak to me when you are ready to try again."]="等你准备好再试一遍的时候，来找我谈谈。"
G["Speak to the commander at your post, $g lad:lass;, and persuade him to abandon Vor'takh's foolish plan."]="$GMuchacho:Muchacha;, habla con el comandante de tu puesto, y convéncelo para que abandone el estúpido plan de Vor'takh."
G["Speak to the gnome foreman, Rosey Axlerod, who will use the Soggy Journal to permanently grant a significant increase to the gnome rate of progress! \n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_MISC_BOOK_11.blp:64|t"]="和侏儒工头罗塞·轮轴交谈，她会使用浸水的日记来显著提高侏儒营地的进度！ \n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_MISC_BOOK_11.blp:64|t"
G["Speak to the jinyu foreman, Elder Adler, who will use the Adorned Sceptre to permanently grant a significant increase to the jinyu rate of progress! \n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_STAFF_2H_PANDARIATRADESKILL_C_05.blp:64|t"]="和锦鱼人长老阿德勒交谈，他会使用缀饰权杖来显著提高锦鱼人营地的进度！\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_STAFF_2H_PANDARIATRADESKILL_C_05.blp:64|t"
G["Speak with Alchemist Finklestein, $c. He can set you on the path.\n\nDemonstrate your loyalty and their methods shall be made known to you."]=" $c，和炼金师菲肯斯坦谈谈。他会为你指明道路。\n\n表明你的忠诚，你就会知道他们的办法。"
G["Speak with Hydraxis."]="跟海达克西斯公爵交谈。"
G["Speak with Ironus, $n. He'll be the one training you in the way of the weaponsmith."]="跟埃隆努斯谈谈，$n。他会教你如何成为一名武器铸造师的。"
G["Speak with Joseph Redpath in the center of Darrowshire."]="同约瑟夫·雷德帕斯谈谈。他就在达隆郡中心。"
G["Speak with Lawrence Shneider at Duncan's Textiles around the corner to the left. He is adept at dealing with beginners."]="跟楼梯那儿的劳伦斯·瑟尼德交谈。他善于引导初学者。"
G["Speak with Regthar.  He is wise and can help you find what you seek."]="和雷戈萨谈谈。他非常聪明，能帮你寻找东西。"
G["Speak with Terrath the Steady when you are ready to begin."]="Habla con Terrath el Firme cuando estés $glisto:lista; para empezar."
G["Speak with Un'Thuwa outside of the Razor Hill barracks."]="同剃刀岭营地外面的安苏瓦谈谈。"
G["Speak with Un'Thuwa to the south in Sen'jin Village."]="去南方的森金村，找安苏瓦谈谈。"
G["Speak with Wing Commander Brack, $n.  He'll outfit you with one of our armored wyvern destroyers.  And, good luck!"]="去和空军指挥官布拉克谈谈，$n。他会给你配备一只武装飞龙。对了，祝你好运！"
G["Speak with a guard if you wish to fight, $c."]="如果你想要参战，就去和守卫聊聊，$c。"
G["Speak with me to hear my tale."]="跟我谈谈，听听我的故事吧。"
G["Speak with me when you are ready."]="准备好就告诉我一声！"
G["Speak with me, $n - if you are willing, the Cenarion Circle would eagerly accept your generous offer of aid.  The threat posed by the Felvine of Eldre'Thalas is indeed dire."]="Habla conmigo, $n. Si estás $gdispuesto:dispuesta;, el Círculo Cenarion aceptará encantado tu generosa oferta de ayuda. La amenaza que representa la gangrevid para Eldre'Thalas es muy grave."
G["Speak with me, $n, for we have much to prepare..."]="告诉我，$n，我们还要准备些什么……"
G["Speak with one of each type - Gorilla, Stomper, and Thunderer -\nand learn what they have to teach you."]="分别找一只猩猩、大猩猩和巨猩猩谈一谈。\n了解一下他们都会教你一些什么。"
G["Speak your name puppet, that our annals will be complete."]="报上名来，傀儡，让我们的历史记载更完整些。"
G["Speak your peace, $c."]="说吧，$c。"
G["Speak! I grow weary of asking!"]="说！我可不耐烦了！"
G["Speak, $c."]="说吧，$c。"
G["Speak, Lich!  Undeath won't save you from what I'll put you through!"]="巫妖，说话啊！即便你有不死的本事也难逃此劫！"
G["Speak, filthy refugee!  What was your caravan doing in the Bone Wastes?"]="快说，肮脏的难民！你们的车队在白骨荒野干什么？"
G["Speak, goblin..."]="说吧，地精……"
G["Speak, then!"]="那就快说！"
G["Speak..."]="直呼……"
G["Speaking of action, I've been ordered to undertake an air strike."]="说到行动，我接到命令，要去发动一次空袭。"
G["Speaking of which..."]="说起来……"
G["Spear of Elune, drive back the night!"]="艾露恩之矛，驱散这黑夜吧！"
G["Special attack: TIGER BOMB!"]="特殊攻击：猛虎之雷！"
G["Special lunch?  How about a special death!"]="特别的午餐？一个特别的死亡怎么样？"
G["Specialist, eh? Just what kind of specialist are you, anyway?"]="专家，嗯？那么你是哪一方面的专家？"
G["Species: Annihilan"]="物种：安尼赫兰"
G["Species: Ered'ruin"]="物种：埃雷杜因"
G["Species: Eredar"]="物种：艾瑞达"
G["Species: Mo'arg"]="物种：莫尔葛"
G["Species: Nathrezim"]="物种：纳斯雷兹姆"
G["Species: Sayaad"]="物种：萨亚德"
G["Species: Shivarra"]="物种：破坏魔"
G["Specimen identified as an alloy of saronite and iron."]="确认样本为萨隆邪铁与铁的合金。"
G["Speckled Guano!"]="斑点杂色鸟粪！"
G["Spectacular! Move up - press onward. Show them no quarter!"]="好极了！前进——压上去。不要给他们喘息之机！"
G["Spectral Tiger Cub"]="幽灵虎幼崽"
G["Spectral Tiger Mount"]="幽灵虎坐骑"
G["Speculation, my dear $gboy:girl;!\n\nOnce our eager little furrier has unearthed enough treasure, he'll be one of Azeroth's most influential figures.\n\nWe'll all be properly positioned when that comes to pass."]="好好想想，我亲爱的$g男孩:女孩;！\n\n一旦我们野心勃勃的小毛皮商发掘出足够的财宝，他就会成为艾泽拉斯最有影响力的角色。\n\n如果这一天到来，我们都会有一个令人满意的地位。"
G["Speed it up, Tinker!"]="快点快点，补锅的！"
G["Speed of the storm, heed my call!"]="疾速的风暴，响应我的召唤！"
G["Spend a few years of yer life with Sulfuras over yer head, and you'll learn tae appreciate the lava beetle's resilience."]="让萨弗拉斯在你头顶上方挂个几年，你就能学会欣赏熔火甲虫的适应力了。"
G["Spend less time rattling and more time listening."]="少说废话，认真听讲。"
G["Spending coin is NOT the reason for the Feast of Winter Veil!"]="花费金钱不是为了冬幕节！"
G["Spider"]="蜘蛛"
G["Spider left some venom on Lunk's tummy.  You want?"]="蜘蛛在隆克的肚子上留下了一些毒液。你想要吗？"
G["Spider tummy time!"]="蜘蛛肚子时间！"
G["Spiderlings appear on the web!"]="蛛网上爬出了小蜘蛛！"
G["Spiderlings have been roused from their nest!"]="幼蛛从巢穴里爬出来了！"
G["Spike, show dem what you can do!"]="长钉，让他们瞧瞧你的厉害！"
G["Spiky Spider Egg!"]="尖刺蜘蛛卵！"
G["Spill their... blood!"]="受死吧！"
G["Spinebreaker Post is a great place to be stationed!  The Bleeding Hollow aberrations are so close you can smell their foul blood!  What better place to gather vengeance from a clan that has forsaken its brethren and made a pact with demons?"]="断背岗哨真是一处优秀的营地！离那些血环的邪兽人们那么近，甚至都可以闻到他们肮脏的血液的味道！那个氏族竟然遗忘了它的同伴，还和恶魔之间达成了协议，让我们在此向他们发起复仇吧！"
G["Spiralfang Cistern."]="旋牙水潭。"
G["Spirit Beast"]="灵魂兽"
G["Spirit Rise is secure! The invaders have been eliminated and the evacuation is complete!"]="灵魂高地守住了！所有入侵者都已被击退，撤离也已顺利完成！"
G["Spirit of Life, lend me your aid!"]="生命之魂，给我你的力量！"
G["Spirit walkin' be taxin' work."]="灵魂状态下行走并不轻松。"
G["Spirit, come back to me!"]="灵魂，到我这里来！"
G["Spirit, you will submit to my will."]="灵魂，屈服于我的意志吧。"
G["Spirit-Kissed Water is very unstable. Only one can be carried at any given time."]="灵吻之水非常不稳定。每次只能携带一瓶。"
G["Spirit-Kissed Water will awaken Master Brownstone, boost progress at pandaren construction site, or increase progress rate at night elf site! \n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_MISC_VOLATILEWATER.blp:64|t"]="灵吻之水能唤醒褐石大师，或者用来加快熊猫人或者暗夜精灵建筑营地的进度！\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_MISC_VOLATILEWATER.blp:64|t"
G["Spiritbinding is a brutal practice. Depriving the dead of their eternal peace is an unspeakable cruelty."]="束缚灵魂是非常残暴的法术。剥夺死者永恒的安宁是一种无法形容的残忍行为。"
G["Spiritcaller, I need more totems to save the spirits of the nether drakes."]="唤灵者，我需要更多的图腾来拯救虚空幼龙的灵魂。"
G["Spirits and elements of Pandaria, I call upon you! Destroy $p!"]="潘达利亚的灵魂和元素，我召唤你们！摧毁$p！"
G["Spirits appear and surround the altar!"]="灵魂们出现并围在祭坛四周！"
G["Spirits be praised!"]="赞美灵魂！"
G["Spirits be wit' ya."]="万灵与你同在。"
G["Spirits give me strength! Take from my soul these old wounds and expose them for all to see! Let this child know his father! Let these people know their savior!"]="灵魂们，赐予我力量吧！从我的灵魂中抽出那些旧日的伤痛，让所有人都看看！让这个孩子了解他的父亲！让这些人认识他们的救世主！"
G["Spirits give me strength. Break their will..."]="万灵赐予我力量。粉碎他们的意志……"
G["Spirits grant me the strength to heal!"]="灵魂赐予我治愈的力量！"
G["Spirits let dis one return to us."]="愿灵魂将你带回我们身边。"
G["Spirits of Deepholm, grant me your strength!"]="深岩之洲的英灵，给予我你的力量！"
G["Spirits of Skywall, heed my call!"]="天空之牆的英灵，听从我的召唤！"
G["Spirits of Water, I give you praise, and I beg of you a favor. You have heard $n's pleas, and I trust $ghis:her; intent is noble. Please, will you aid us?"]="Espíritus del Agua, alabados seáis, ruego vuestro favor. Habéis escuchado la súplica de $n y confío en la nobleza de sus propósitos. Por favor, ¿nos prestaréis vuestra ayuda?"
G["Spirits of air!  Come to my aid!"]="空气之灵！快来帮我！"
G["Spirits of da wind be your doom!"]="风之圣魂将是你的梦魇！"
G["Spirits of de Darkspear... ARISE! Take up de ancient masks, take up de bloody spears... you be followin' VOL'JIN, now!"]="暗矛的英灵们……起来吧！戴上古老的面具，拿起血色的长矛……现在你们将追随沃金而战！"
G["Spirits of fire grant us wisdom!"]="请赐予我们智慧吧，火焰之灵！"
G["Spirits of fire, destroy this vermin!"]="火焰之灵，消灭这只爬虫吧！"
G["Spirits of old, I release you from my staff! Seek your vengeance on this beast!"]="古老的灵魂们啊，从我的法杖中出来吧！向这个畜生复仇吧！"
G["Spirits of the Firelands, fill me with your rage!"]="火焰之地的英灵，让你的愤怒充满我的身躯！"
G["Spirits of the Highborne! You may now rest! The curse of the crystal releases you!"]="上层精灵的灵魂！你们可以安息了！水晶的诅咒已经被解除了！"
G["Spirits of the forest come forth and heed nature's call!"]="森林中的小精灵不断出现，响应自然的召唤！"
G["Spirits of the forest, you are needed! Make haste to the Charred Vale!"]="森林之灵，现在我需要你们的帮助！快点去焦炭谷！"
G["Spirits of the sea, rise and lay waste to my enemies!"]="海之英灵，让敌人葬身于你的怒涛之下！"
G["Spirits of wind, carry to Saurfang the Younger the song of war! May ALL of our fallen brethren be vindicated by this battle!"]="风之灵，将这曲战歌送到小萨鲁法尔耳畔吧，为所有阵亡的同胞们报仇雪恨！"
G["Spirits rise once again!"]="灵魂们再次复苏！"
G["Spirits watch over you, $r!"]="灵魂与你同在，$r！"
G["Spirits watch over you, friend. I must make my return to Warsong Hold."]="灵魂在护佑着你，朋友。我必须返回战歌要塞了。"
G["Spirits! I offer me own body to you! Speak through me! Is de time right for mighty Vol'jin's undertaking?"]="伟大的英灵啊！我向您献出自己的身躯。请通过我说话吧！现在是不是强大的沃金开始行动的时刻？"
G["Spirits, heed my call! Aid this fallen warrior!"]="万灵，请听从我的召唤！帮助这位倒下的战士吧！"
G["Spirits, we be gathered here to ask for your guidance."]="伟大的英灵啊，我们聚集于此，寻求您的指引。"
G["Spiritsage!!"]="灵魂贤者！！"
G["Splendid! Marvelous! An excellent performance!"]="太精彩了！精彩绝伦！多华丽的演出啊！"
G["Splendid! Wonderful! Such an excellent performance from a relative unknown! Do you have an agent, perhaps?"]="¡Espléndido! ¡Maravilloso! ¡Una actuación tan excelente de $gun relativo desconocido:una relativa desconocida;! ¿Tienes agente, por casualidad?"
G["Splendid, you've proven yourselves as great champions here today. With you fighting alongside the Argent Crusade, victory against the Scourge is inevitable!"]="太好了，今天你们证明了自己是强大的勇士。只要你们和银色十字军并肩作战，我们必将战胜天灾军团！"
G["Splendid. I'm going to get the audience ready. Break a leg!"]="太棒了。我去让观众们准备好。祝你成功！"
G["Splintertree is surrounded!"]="碎木岗哨被包围了！"
G["Splintertree under attack!!"]="碎木岗哨遭到了攻击！！"
G["Splintertree..."]="碎木岗哨……"
G["Split in two to form the one. The twin blades are bound to Zul'Farrak.\n\nSul'thraze will be reborn when the twins are found."]="分久必合，合久必分。那两把剑被隐藏在祖尔法拉克城中。\n\n苏萨斯会在两把剑都被发现时重生。"
G["Spoken like a stalwart Alliance $c! Believe me, I understand the sentiment.\n\nNow then, as leader of the Kirin Tor and a faithful part of the Alliance, what would you do about the Sunreavers? True, they are advocates of the Horde. But they have been allies and productive members of the Kirin Tor for over 2000 years. This city is their home.\n\nWould you expel them?"]="¡Hablas como $gun auténtico:una auténtica; $c de la Alianza! Créeme, sé cómo te sientes.\n\nBien, como líder del Kirin Tor y fiel $gsúbdito:súbdita; de la Alianza, ¿qué haces con los Atracasol? Es cierto que son leales a la Horda, pero han sido aliados y miembros productivos del Kirin Tor desde hace más de 2000 años. Esta ciudad es su hogar.\n\n¿Los expulsarías?"
G["Spoken like a true child of the Aspects. Always seeking to change the world."]="这口气真像巨龙的后裔。总想着改变世界。"
G["Spooky..."]="真恐怖……"
G["Spoon sharpeners!"]="勺子打磨器！"
G["Sporebat"]="孢子蝠"
G["Sporelings have pretty colors."]="孢子人有着漂亮的颜色。"
G["Spot of tea, gov'na?"]="¿Desea té, $gseñorito:señorita;?"
G["Spotted."]="已定位。"
G["Spraggle! I didn't think I'd make it back!"]="斯普拉格！我简直不敢相信自己居然能活着回来！"
G["Spread across the ledge of the Arcane Pinnacle are 6 pedestals that will energize you if touched."]="在奥术之巅凸出的平台上分布着6个基座，如果你碰触它们，就能得到它们的能量。"
G["Spread across the plateau are frost orbs that will grant you stacks of Essence of Ice if you approach them."]="冰霜宝珠分布在这片高地上，如果你接触它们，就会得到冰之精华。"
G["Spread among the spires are 10 hot air balloons, or checkpoints. We are passing one just now."]="在尖塔之间有10个热气球。这些是检查点。我们刚才就经过了一个。"
G["Spread out!"]="队伍散开！"
G["Spread out! Find out who did this. They're gonna get fired for sure!"]="开始吧！找出到底是谁干的，然后让他们求生不得求死不能！"
G["Spread out! Spread out!"]="分散！分散！"
G["Spread the word that another artifact  will soon be brought to our defenders."]="防御者们很快就能获得另一件古器，我要你将这个消息传播开来。"
G["Spread the word that this mighty bush has thorns!"]="去告诉其他人，林木有刺！"
G["Spread throughout the Ghostlands, our forces will be of little use in an assault on Deatholme. No, milady, I am here to kill Dar'khan and that is what I intend to do!"]="如果我们的兵力分散在幽魂之地各处，恐怕就根本没法在戴索姆之战发挥任何作用了。不，女士，我是专程为击败达尔坎而来的！"
G["Spring is my favorite season of the year. What is your favorite season?"]="春天是四季中我最喜欢的季节。你最喜欢哪个季节？"
G["Spring lives eternally in the heart."]="春天永远都活在每个人的心里。"
G["Spring to life!"]="水泉急升！"
G["Spurious Sarcophagus"]="伪造的石棺"
G["Spurts of crimson!"]="鲜血四溅！"
G["Sputtervalve you're a genius! I'll take 30."]="斯布特瓦夫，你是个天才！我要30。"
G["Squad reporting."]="小队报告情况。"
G["Squad! Initiate Operation: Cackleberry!"]="小队注意！失心果作战行动开始！"
G["Squad, move."]="全队前进。"
G["Squad, you know what to do."]="小队，你们知道该做什么。"
G["Squash these snakes!"]="碾碎这些毒蛇！"
G["Squawk!  Who dare slay my Worshippers and summon me , High Priest A, forth! [PH]"]="¡Kruaaaac! ¿Quién osa asesinar a mis adoradores e invocarme, el sumo sacerdote A! [PH]"
G["Squawky..."]="真聒噪……"
G["Squeak!"]="吱吱！"
G["Squeak, little pest."]="小害虫，真吵闹。"
G["Squeal! Squeal! So good!"]="它们可真灵活！"
G["Squealer take this land! Tauren will burn!"]="这片土地属于尖啸！牛头人必将毁灭！"
G["Squire!  I understand you are newly trained, but must I tell you not to kill the spirits of the Light?"]="侍从！我明白你刚刚接受训练不久，但我难道没有告诉过你，不能杀死圣光之灵吗？"
G["Squire!  Please stand next to me as I request the blessing of this Light-blessed spirit."]="侍从！请在我祈求圣光之灵的祝福时站在我的身边。"
G["Squire, meet me back at my camp for your reward."]="侍从，去我的营地找我，接受我的酬金吧。"
G["Squirm, surface filth!"]="没用的东西！"
G["Sshe will find you...."]="她会找到你……"
G["Ssscared now?"]="害怕了吧？"
G["Ssserenity...at lassst!"]="宁静……终于来临了！"
G["Ssslay them!"]="杀死他们！"
G["Ssso... assshamed..."]="真……耻辱……"
G["Sssoftsskinss! Sssoon you shall ssserve my Lady!"]="弱者！很快你们就将臣服于我的女士！"
G["Sssoon, your preciousss throne will lie in ruins!"]="再过不久，你宝贵的王座就会成为一片废墟！"
G["Sssplendid... Then let us watch as my children tear these mortals to pieces."]="妙极了……让我的孩子们将这些凡人撕成碎片吧。"
G["Ssssekk-sara Rith-nealaak!"]="¡Ssssekk-sara Rith-nealaak!"
G["Ssssupper comess early?"]="提前开饭了吗？"
G["Ssssurely the overseer can stop him!"]="工头完全可以阻止他！"
G["Sssuch weapons. I must have them!"]="这般武器。必须归我！"
G["Sssurrender!"]="投降吧！"
G["Stab stab stab stab stab!"]="杀！杀！杀！"
G["Stabby stabby stab stab!"]="杀杀杀杀！"
G["Stable"]="存放宠物"
G["Stable Master"]="兽栏管理员"
G["Staff"]="法杖"
G["Staghelm and his armies were clearly overwhelmed as the endless flow of Rajaxx's troops poured into Silithus. It would seem as if Staghelm, however, was more than just a nuisance to the Qiraji. Under Staghelm, the whole of the night elf armies had come together to defend Kalimdor, greatly slowing the Qiraji forces."]="拉贾克斯的大军源源不断地涌入希利苏斯，鹿盔和他的军队毫无胜算。但是对其拉虫人而言，鹿盔也是个令他们非常头痛的人物。他手下的所有暗夜精灵都团结一致，誓死保卫卡利姆多，这大大妨碍了其拉虫人军队的入侵。"
G["Staghelm retreated to his enclave in Darnassus, ever seeking a new direction by which to bless Teldrassil, and restore the immortality of our people."]="鹿盔回到了他在达纳苏斯的领地里，开始寻找能够祝福泰达希尔，让我族恢复不朽的新方法。"
G["Staghelm will whimper and beg for his life, just as his whelp of a son did! One thousand years of injustice will end this day!"]="鹿盔将会呜咽着哀求我饶他一命，就像他那懦弱的儿子一样！一千年来的屈辱会在今天洗清！"
G["Stairways... for horizontal surfaces!"]="专为水平移动设计的……楼梯！"
G["Stalactites begin to fall from the ceiling!"]="钟乳石从洞顶纷纷坠落！"
G["Stalagg crush you!"]="斯塔拉格要碾碎你！"
G["Stalagg kill!"]="斯塔拉格宰了你！"
G["Stamp out the Alliance bonfire!"]="扑灭联盟篝火！"
G["Stamp out the Horde bonfire!"]="扑灭部落篝火！"
G["Stamped into the footprint is a clod of mud mixed with hay and yak hair."]="被踩进脚印里的，是混有干草和牦牛鬃的泥团。"
G["Stand and FACE ME!"]="站起来……面对我吧！"
G["Stand and be judged!"]="站起来，接受审判吧！"
G["Stand and be measured! Rise, for your master awaits your arrival. Go now!"]="站起来吧！主人在等待着你们。去吧！"
G["Stand and fight!"]="来吧！"
G["Stand aside, mortals!"]="别挡道，凡人！"
G["Stand at attention, captain!"]="立正，队长！"
G["Stand at attention, grunt!"]="立正，步兵！"
G["Stand back!  This is real fire I'm handling here, and it can really burn you!"]="退后点！我拿着真正的火焰，它真的会烧伤你！"
G["Stand back! Stand clear! The infernal will need to be given a wide berth!"]="退后！退后！与地狱火保持安全距离！"
G["Stand back! Touch that blade and your soul will be scarred for all eternity! I must attempt to commune with the spirits locked away within Frostmourne. Give me space. Back up, please."]="后退！如果碰到这把剑，你的灵魂就会受到永恒的创伤！我必须试着与封印在霜之哀伤中的灵魂交谈。远离我，请再后退一点。"
G["Stand back! Zhi-Zhi practicing here! Anybody who gets within 5 yards of here is probably going to get knocked out... maybe even killed.\n\nHai-yah!"]="闪开！齐齐正在练功！靠近我五码之内的人都有可能被踢飞……甚至可能被踢死。\n\n呀哈——！"
G["Stand back, $n! When \"Cookie\" cooks things be gettin' crazy!"]="¡Atrás, $n! Cuando \"Cocinitas\" cocina, las cosas se vuelven un poco locas!"
G["Stand back, $n, the beast might lash out and harm you."]="退后点，$n。这头野兽可能会突然暴起伤人。"
G["Stand back, $n. I must cleanse the Forest Heart."]="后退，$n。我必须净化森林之心。"
G["Stand back, $n. The spirits may lash out."]="靠后，$n。灵魂可能会伤害到你。"
G["Stand back, $n. There are going to be a lot of sparks."]="站后面点，$n。会有很多火花溅射出来的。"
G["Stand back, $n. This may be an Ethereum trap."]="退后点，$n。这可能是一个复仇军的陷阱。"
G["Stand back, and ... hold your breath.  I haven't done this in a while."]="往后站一点……摒住呼吸。我很久没这么做过了。"
G["Stand back, monster.  You want to fight?  Because I'll fight you.\n\nI'll fight any one of you creatures!  Do you hear me?"]="退后，怪物。想打架吗？因为我就是来大打一场的。\n\n我会把你们这些怪物都打得落花流水！听懂了吗？"
G["Stand back, mortals. I'm not here to fight you."]="退后，凡人们。我不是来这里跟你们打架的。"
G["Stand back, or I'll pick you to death!"]="退后，不然我就把你献给死神！"
G["Stand by, $n! To craft a reward of such exquisite quality takes time."]="$n，准备行动！"
G["Stand clear...."]="站开点……"
G["Stand close to the keg to catch the beer!"]="站在酒桶边取些啤酒吧！"
G["Stand down reavers!"]="撤退，掠天者！"
G["Stand down! Can you not see that heroes walk among us?"]="退后！你们没看到英雄正在与我们同行吗？"
G["Stand down, Muradin. Let a grieving father pass."]="退后，穆拉丁，让这位伤心的父亲过去。"
G["Stand down, death knights. We have lost. The Light... this place... no hope..."]="死亡骑士们，撤退。我们战败了……这里的……圣光之力…………我们输定了……"
G["Stand down, savages! I claim this land in the name of the Alliance!"]="退下，野蛮人！我以联盟之名宣布对这片土地的占有权！"
G["Stand down, tauren, before I put you back in chains."]="放下武器，牛头人，不然我就再把你铐上。"
G["Stand fast and slay the rest!"]="决不后退，不留活口！"
G["Stand fast! The ritual is almost complete."]="坚持住！召唤仪式就要完成了。"
G["Stand fast, brothers and sisters! The Light will prevail!"]="兄弟姐妹们，坚持住！圣光必胜！"
G["Stand firm, brothers.  And don't worry!  Size is on our side!"]="站直了，弟兄们！不要怕！我们这里有大个的！"
G["Stand guard -- intruders are near."]="保持阵形——入侵者正在靠近。"
G["Stand in Blanche's Elixir of Replenishment to restore health and mana!"]="站在布兰琪的恢复药剂中可恢复生命值和法力值！"
G["Stand in the light and be judged!"]="接受光明的审判吧！"
G["Stand near me, $n. I will protect you should anything go wrong."]="靠近我，$n。我会保护你的。"
G["Stand on an elevated surface to avoid the Shadow Fog!"]="站到高处，避开暗影之雾！"
G["Stand prepared! The naga won't wait long to press their advantage once they know we're alive."]="做好准备！若是纳迦知道我们还活着，他们就会马上进攻的。"
G["Stand proud, $g brother:sister;!"]="骄傲地站起来吧，我的$g兄弟:姐妹;！"
G["Stand ready!"]="准备就绪！"
G["Stand ready, $n. We attack when all of our forces have arrived!"]="做好战斗的准备，$n。等部队全部就位之后，我们就要开始进攻了！"
G["Stand ready, guards!  We don't know how many intruders we're dealing with, but the Headlands are overrun and we're cut off from the harbor towns.  Expect to be outnumbered."]="准备作战，卫兵们！我们不知道入侵者的数量。但海角已经沦陷，港口城镇的联系被切断了。做好孤军奋战的准备。"
G["Stand solo against a yeti with nothing but a bowie knife while wearing a loincloth and you'll earn yourself the title of \"lucky\" as well."]="Enfréntate a solas con un yeti sin nada más que un cuchillo y llevando un taparrabos, y tú también te ganarás el título de \"afortunado\"."
G["Stand still and stare into the light!"]="站好了，凝视这耀眼的光芒吧！"
G["Stand still you worthless chicken!"]="站着别动你这没用的小鸡！"
G["Stand still! I am trying to kill you here!"]="站住！我正要杀了你呢！"
G["Stand still! Rom'ogg crack your skulls!"]="站着别动！罗姆欧格要打碎你的脑袋！"
G["Stand still, $n! And hold your breath in case you end up over the ocean..."]="站直了，$n！屏住呼吸，"
G["Stand straight!  Your weakness sickens me!"]="站直了！你的软弱令我恶心！"
G["Stand strong!  Only a bit longer!"]="坚持住！再坚持一会儿！"
G["Stand strong, combatants."]="战士们，拿出勇气来。"
G["Stand tall and proud, $n. Don't let any of these scrubs give you any trouble. Show them who's boss!"]="要高傲地昂起头，$n。不能允许这些小矬子们给你制造任何麻烦。让他们知道，谁才是老板！"
G["Stand tall, $c. Today ya saved de soul of de Horde."]="抬头挺胸，$c。今天，你挽救了部落的灵魂。"
G["Stand tall, soldiers. Show them no quarter!"]="士兵们，奋勇作战吧！不要对敌人手下留情！"
G["Stand up and fight me, you worthless traitor!"]="来吧，和我交战！你这没用的叛徒！"
G["Stand up straight, grunt! You're under the command of the Kor'kron Guard now."]="¡Ponte $gderecho:derecha;, $gbruto:bruta;! Ahora estás bajo las órdenes de la Guardia de Kor'kron."
G["Stand upon this disc, $p. Kalecgos approaches!"]="站到这个圆台上，$p。卡雷苟斯过来了！"
G["Stand vigilant."]="保持警惕。"
G["Stand your ground and keep alert for any Alliance that may try to attack."]="坚守阵地，小心任何伺机进犯的联盟。"
G["Stand your ground! Use my anti-magic barrier to dampen their spells!"]="坚守阵地！利用反魔法屏障抵挡他们的法术！"
G["Stand your ground! Wait 'em out."]="坚守阵地！等他们出来。"
G["Stand your ground! We will drive the sha from this place!"]="坚守阵地！我们会把煞魔从这里赶出去的！"
G["Stand your ground, brothers! Make it bleed!"]="坚守信念，兄弟们！浴血杀敌！"
G["Stand your ground, defenders! Do not let them pass!"]="坚守阵地，卫士们！别让他们通过！"
G["Stand your ground, men!"]="坚守阵地！"
G["Stand your ground... fight!"]="坚守阵地……战斗！"
G["Stand your posts and keep any Alliance filth from us."]="坚守阵地，别让任何联盟渣滓靠近我们。"
G["Stand, my children... that's enough for now."]="站起来，我的孩子们……先到这里吧。"
G["Stand... there is more to discuss."]="站起来吧……还有很多事情要谈。"
G["Standby to verify identity as Keeper Mimir."]="准备核实守护者米米尔的身份。"
G["Standing in the way of nature is heresy.  Even when nature's force is a destructive one.\n\nThe forces that would destroy Darkshore are not natural, however.  I will not let this land be torn asunder."]="阻挡自然者即是异端，即便在自然发挥它破坏之力时亦然如此。\n\n但如今要摧毁黑海岸的并非自然的力量。我不会让这片土地分崩离析。"
G["Standing this close to the blade that ended my life... The pain... It is renewed."]="站在这把杀害我的长剑面前……那种痛苦……仿佛又重新回来了。"
G["Stanton, keep some ice on that man's head. We need to get the swelling down."]="斯坦顿，把冰块敷在那人的头上。我们得帮他消肿。"
G["Starboard Side Hit!"]="击中右侧！"
G["Stare at me like that one more time and I will push you off the side of the boat."]="你要敢再那么看我一眼，我就把你从船上推下去。"
G["Stare into the abyss and see your end."]="看这深渊，那里有你的末日。"
G["Stare into the abyss and watch as it blackens your souls!"]="凝视深渊吧，它将吞噬你们的灵魂！"
G["Stare into the darkness of your soul."]="直视你灵魂深处的黑暗吧。"
G["Stare into the eyes of the Betrayer!"]="直视背叛者的双眼吧！"
G["Stare into the face of true power!"]="直面真正的力量吧！"
