G["Start doing something before I replace that target dummy with you and begin a warm up session of my own!"]="在我把这些假人换成你们，并且拿你们好好热身之前，你们最好拿出点像样的东西来！"
G["Start fighting, or start bleeding!"]="不是敌人死，就是我们亡！"
