G["Start making sense, dwarf. I don't want to have anything to do with your cracker, your pappy, or any sort of 'discreditin.'"]="矮人，脑子放清醒点。我可没问你什么老爹啊名誉啊之类的事儿。"
G["Start running!"]="快跑！"
