G["Starting Event <PH>"]="Evento de inicio <PH>"
G["Starting at 6PM, the city will have a fireworks extravaganza every hour on the hour."]="从下午6点开始，每个准点的时刻，城里都会有烟火表演哦！"
G["Starting at 6PM, they will show fireworks from the highest bluff!"]="每天下午6点钟，雷霆崖都会有华丽的焰火表演！"
G["Starting test.  Casting trigger spell now."]="测试开始。正在施放触发法术。"
G["State your business, $r."]="说说你的情况，$r。"
G["State your business.  Be brief, if possible."]="有话就说吧。尽量简短些。"
G["State your profession."]="报上你的职业。"
G["State-sponsored healthcare!"]="医疗改革!"
G["Status: Life-giving substance collection completed."]="状态：已完成生命物质的收集。"
G["Staves & Wands"]="法杖和魔杖"
G["Staves are taught by Hanashi, the troll weapon master in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor, and Ansekhwa, the tauren weapon master who trains on the lower central rise of Thunder Bluff."]="奥格瑞玛荣誉谷的巨魔武器大师哈纳什和雷霆崖中部高地底层的牛头人武器大师安塞瓦可以教你如何使用法杖。"
G["Staves are taught by both Woo Ping, the master found at Weller's Arsenal in Stormwind, and Ilyenia Moonfire, who trains the night elves on the Warrior's Terrace in Darnassus."]="暴风城维勒武器店的武器大师吴平和达纳苏斯战士区的伊琳尼雅·月火都能教会你怎么使用法杖。"
G["Stay a while and listen."]="等等，听我说。"
G["Stay alert and on guard. There's no telling what horrors await us."]="保持警惕。我们不知道前面会有怎样的恐怖。"
G["Stay alert!"]="保持警惕！"
G["Stay alert! Don't let them drag you away!"]="保持警觉！别让他们把你给拖走了！"
G["Stay alert, $c."]="保持警觉，$c。"
G["Stay alert, now. There's no telling what we might run into down here..."]="Mantente alerta. No hay forma de saber con qué nos podemos encontrar aquí abajo..."
G["Stay alive, $n."]="好好活着，$n。"
G["Stay away from Kartak mouth, slave thing. He maybe eat you too."]="奴隶，离卡塔克远点。他可能会一口吃掉你。"
G["Stay away from Sumi and Tumi. They are....spoken for."]="离苏米和图米远点。他们会……极力推销他们的东西的。"
G["Stay away from Wil'hai!"]="别靠近维尔哈伊！"
G["Stay away from da voodoo."]="离巫术远点儿。"
G["Stay away from me creature! Do not touch me!"]="滚远点！别碰我！"
G["Stay away from me!"]="别靠近我！"
G["Stay away from me, $r! There's no telling when the sickness will take me again.\n\nJust leave me alone before it happens again."]="离我远点，$r！很难说我什么时候会再次发病。\n\n离我远点，免得出事！"
G["Stay away from my crops!"]="离我的庄稼远点！"
G["Stay away from my sheep!"]="离我的羊远点儿！"
G["Stay away from the guards! This spell should shield you from the night elves' vision, but you'll still need to keep your distance.  If you get into trouble, return to safety here."]="远离那些守卫！这个法术可以让你躲过暗夜精灵的视线，可你还是得保持距离。如果你遇到麻烦，就撤回来。"
G["Stay away from the sea. Too clean.\n\nThe saur-priests can tell you: Filthiness is next to godliness."]="远离大海。它太干净了。\n\n蜥蜴人祭司会告诉你：污秽是仅次于虔诚的美德。"
G["Stay away from the temple doors, you're playing into their hands."]="别靠近大门，那正中他们的下怀。"
G["Stay away from those claws - they look sharp!"]="小心螳螂妖的爪子，它们很锋利！"
G["Stay away from... Me!"]="离我……远点！"
G["Stay away! We no know what it can do!"]="后退！我们都不知道它会做什么！"
G["Stay back in the name of the King!"]="以国王的名义，后退！"
G["Stay back vile creatures!"]="滚开，可恶的东西！"
G["Stay back!"]="后退！"
G["Stay back!\n\nWait... you're not one of them. We're not accustomed to outsiders, and with the mantid breaking through the wall, I...\n\nAnyhow, what can we do to help you?"]="退后！\n\n等等……你不是它们的一员。我们不习惯有外人，在螳螂妖破墙而入的当下，我……\n\n无论如何，我们能为你做些什么？"
G["Stay back! Back!"]="后退！后退！"
G["Stay back! Children should not be here! Be gone, child!"]="后退！小孩子不应该在这儿的！回去吧，孩子们！"
G["Stay back! Don't let them lure you in."]="后退！不要孤军深入。"
G["Stay back, I'm going to resuscitate $g him : her;! I hope these wet jumper cables don't kill us all!"]="后退，我要让$g他:她;活过来！希望浸水的起搏器不会把我们都杀死！"
G["Stay back, you ookin' bugs!"]="退后，你们这群该死的虫子！"
G["Stay behind me, $r.  I will do my best to protect you."]="站到我身后，$r。我会尽力保护你的。"
G["Stay behind us! Keep your heads down!"]="呆在我们后面！把头低下！"
G["Stay behind your foe. He cannot see you! Move quickly!"]="绕到敌人背后去。他看不见你！动起来！"
G["Stay by Malfurion's side while he summons Malorne!"]="陪同玛法里奥召唤玛洛恩！"
G["Stay by me! We're going out the tunnel!"]="跟紧我！我们要出隧道了！"
G["Stay by my side!"]="跟着我！"
G["Stay by my side, $n. We may have need of one another."]="跟紧我，$n。我们可能需要互相帮助。"
G["Stay calm, $p. Focus on your goal, not on your fears."]="$GTranquilo:Tranquila;, $p. Céntrate en tu objetivo, y no en tus temores."
G["Stay calm, people.  We don't want to give away our position."]="保持镇静。我们不能放弃自己的阵地。"
G["Stay calm. I'm here, you're safe."]="冷静。我在这儿，别怕。"
G["Stay calm. We have everything under control."]="保持冷静。一切都在控制之中。"
G["Stay cautious. The enemy can attack at any time."]="保持警惕。敌人随时可能发动攻击。"
G["Stay close and keep these healers safe.  Our lives depend on it."]="别离开太远，保护治疗者！我们全指望他们了。"
G["Stay close and keep your eyes peeled."]="跟紧了，提高警惕。"
G["Stay close men - it's an ambush. To arms!"]="大家排成密集队形。这是一场伏击。准备武器！"
G["Stay close to Yalia's healing, champion!"]="靠近雅丽亚，接受她的治疗，勇士！"
G["Stay close to me, $n. I could not bear for any harm to come to you."]="跟紧我，$n。我不能让你受到任何伤害。"
G["Stay close to me. I will keep us camouflaged from the enemy."]="靠紧我。我会将我们伪装起来躲开敌人。"
G["Stay close! We are too few already!"]="靠紧点！我们的人已经很少了。"
G["Stay close, $n. I'll need all the help I can get to break out of here. Let's go!"]="靠紧点，$n。我们必须全力以赴才能冲出包围圈。出发吧！"
G["Stay close, $n. If we are caught, it will be the end of both of us."]="No te alejes. Si nos cogen, será el fin de ambos."
G["Stay close, gorgeous.  I'm worth chasing."]="跟紧点，亲爱的。我值得你的追逐。"
G["Stay close, now! Ya never know when Deathwing's agents might be swoopin' in and puttin' an early end to our quest!"]="跟紧了！你永远不会知道死亡之翼的爪牙会什么时候突然冲出来，让我们的行动提早夭折！"
G["Stay close."]="跟紧我。"
G["Stay close. Stay vigilant."]="靠近点。保持警惕。"
G["Stay close..."]="靠近些……"
G["Stay down, Wretch!"]="蹲下来，蠢货！"
G["Stay down, stupid slickies!"]="退下，笨光板儿！"
G["Stay for as long as you like, $n. Glory in the fruits of your labor!"]="$n，你想在这里呆多久都行。好好享受你的努力所换来的成果吧！"
G["Stay frosty boys!"]="站着别动，伙计们！"
G["Stay healthy!"]="保重！"
G["Stay here tonight, buy my wares, and fortune will shine on you for certain."]="今晚留在这儿，选购我的商品，好运定会伴你左右。"
G["Stay here with the others and don't try anything funny."]="和其他人一起留在这里，不要擅自行动。"
G["Stay in da fight!"]="继续战斗。"
G["Stay in the anti-magic field! Make them come to you!"]="别离开反魔法屏障！将他们引过来！"
G["Stay inside, Hanae! Adventurer, please see if there's anything the Gentle Mother needs. She is working tirelessly to tend to the survivors inside."]="¡No salgas, Hanae! $gAventurero:Aventurera;, comprueba si la dulce madre necesita algo. Trabaja sin descanso para atender a los supervivientes."
G["Stay light on your feet."]="脚步放轻点。"
G["Stay near Yalia so that she may heal you!"]="靠近雅丽亚，让她治疗你！"
G["Stay on dem, beasts!  Rip dem from the air!"]="继续攻击，野兽们！把他们在空中撕碎！"
G["Stay on my back, Tholo!"]="到我后面去，索罗！"
G["Stay on task, do not waste time!"]="集中注意力，不要浪费时间！"
G["Stay on the attack, $n!"]="持续攻击，$n！"
G["Stay on the ground, and stay hidden. I'll port you back here if you get into any trouble!"]="身子伏低，注意隐蔽。如果你遇到麻烦，我会立刻把你传送回来的！"
G["Stay on the roads.  The forest is overrun with undead."]="不要离开大路。森林里到处都是亡灵。"
G["Stay on your toes!"]="保持警惕！"
G["Stay out of Redridge!"]="离开赤脊山！"
G["Stay out of his range!"]="快离他远点！"
G["Stay out of its way! It'll burn you alive!"]="躲开！那东西会烧死你！"
G["Stay out of our crops!"]="离我们的庄稼远点！"
G["Stay out of the way of Volcanoth's breath!"]="快躲开沃卡洛斯的呼吸！"
G["Stay out of this!"]="别插手这事！"
G["Stay sharp, $n.\n\nWe're not out of the woods yet...."]="保持警惕，$n。\n\n我们还没有走出这片森林呢……"
G["Stay still and I don't think it'll attack us!"]="别动，相信它不会攻击我们的！"
G["Stay still. I'll get you to safety."]="呆着别动。我会把你送到安全的地方。"
G["Stay strong, $c.  Hold on tightly to those you love.  We never know how long any of us will have for this world."]="坚强点，$c。珍惜你所爱的人。我们永远不知道自己能在这个世界上停留多久。"
G["Stay strong, $c. The mogu will not lay down their arms quietly. We will have to fight for every inch of land on this forsaken island."]="坚强点，$c。魔古族是不会轻易放下屠刀的。在这个被遗忘的岛上，我们必须为每一寸土地而奋斗。"
G["Stay strong, friend. You know as well as I do - there'll be no help for us within the Firelands."]="保持坚强，朋友。你我心中都清楚……在火焰之地，我们将孤立无援。"
G["Stay true to yourself always, and your resolve will be that of a mighty glacier."]="忠于自我，你的决心就会变成强大的冰川。"
G["Stay vigilant, hero. The return of the Thunder King is both a threat... and an opportunity!"]="小心，英雄。雷电之王的回归既是威胁……也是机遇！"
G["Stay vigilant, hero. This place has been sealed for centuries. Who knows what we will encounter within."]="保持警惕，英雄。这地方封闭了数百年。天知道里面会有什么东西。"
G["Stay with me, $n."]="跟紧我，$n。"
G["Stay with me, friend. I must know what happened here."]="朋友，坚持住。告诉我究竟出了什么事。"
G["Stay with me. You're going to make it out of here."]="待在我身边。我们一定会把你弄出去的。"
G["Stay with us mortal... live eternal."]="凡人，和我们在一起……永生不死。"
G["Stay within the runes without getting hit by fire until you have 10 stacks of Fire Dancing to complete the trial."]="待在符文中，注意不要被火焰击中，直到你积累了10层火焰之舞，完成这个试炼。"
G["Stay your arms! I yield!"]="住手！我认输了！"
G["Stay your blade, Chieftain. He may yet have value to us."]="酋长，刀下留人。他还有利用价值。"
G["Stay your blades, heroes. This dragon's scales glow red with flame."]="停手，英雄们。这头龙的鳞正在闪耀鲜红的火光。"
G["Stay your hand and step aside. Very well."]="住手，让开。很好。"
G["Stay your hand! Not here - not now!"]="快住手！此时此地，你们不能这么做！"
G["Stay your sword and loosen your cap.  Before we do battle with our blades, I first have prepared an assault to unleash upon your ears.\n\nAre you prepared?"]="Deja tu espada y aflójate el almete. Antes de que luchemos con nuestras espadas, he preparado un asalto para desatar contra tus oídos.\n\n¿Estás $gpreparado:preparada;?"
G["Stay, pup."]="站住，小崽子。"
G["Stay."]="站住。"
G["Stay. Enjoy your final moments."]="留下。好好享受你们的最后时光吧。"
G["Stay... the course."]="坚持……到底。"
G["Steady hands.."]="手不要抖……"
G["Steady men...steady..."]="稳住……稳住……"
G["Steady the pumps."]="稳定泵阀。"
G["Steady your hand, you fool!  Those are rare components you're spilling on the floor!"]="拿稳了，笨蛋！你将那些稀有的材料都弄洒了！"
G["Steady yourself, friend...\n\nThese next hours shall determine the fate of our clans."]="Tranquilízate, $gamigo:amiga;... \n\nLas próximas horas determinarán el destino de nuestros clanes."
G["Steady, number two..."]="稳住，二号……"
G["Steady, people.  We'll raid soon enough."]="保持镇定。我们很快将发动奇袭。"
G["Steal a banana from a hozen, expect a angry hozen."]="从猢狲那里偷香蕉，你就等着遇到一只暴怒的猢狲吧。"
G["Steal everything! Ssteal all of their thingsss!"]="全都偷走！把他们所有的东西都偷走！"
G["Steal food from sleeping Gurubashi Soldiers!"]="从熟睡的古拉巴什士兵身上偷取食物！"
G["Steal jab-jab from wikket!"]="把蠢蛋偷得分文不剩！"
G["Stealer of signals! This is the Empress's tower!"]="偷信号的贼！这是女皇的塔！"
G["Stealing"]="收集"
G["Stealing artifact"]="窃取神器"
G["Steamed buns, delicious steamed pork buns! Come and get them!"]="小笼包，美味多汁的猪肉小笼包！快来吃啊！"
G["Steaming goat noodle: NUMBER ONE!"]="热气羊肉面！最好吃的面！"
G["Steaming hot noodle soup, come and get your hot noodle soup!"]="热气腾腾的汤面，快来吃一碗热乎乎的汤面啊！"
G["Steel isn't strong, exalted one, flesh is stronger. Steel gains its strength from the one who wields it. But enough of that... How can we help you exalted one?"]="尊贵的英雄，钢铁远没有血肉之躯来得强壮。唯有持有者才能令钢铸武器的效力发挥到极致。嗯，不说这些了……我们能帮你什么忙吗？"
G["Steel your minds and guard your thoughts. The dark wings will cloud and consume the minds of the weak, a flock of thralls whose feet may never leave the ground."]="坚定你的信念，捍卫你的想法。黑暗之翼会淹没与吞噬弱者的信念。他们的双脚将永远无法离开大地高飞。"
G["Steel yourselves! More of them approach!"]="坚持住！又有煞魔逼近了！"
G["Steel yourselves! Summoning a being this powerful is seldom done with positive results."]="坚强一点！召唤这样强大的家伙是很少取得成功的。"
G["Steel yourselves, heroes, for the twin terrors, Acidmaw and Dreadscale, enter the arena!"]="做好准备，英雄们，两头猛兽已经进入了竞技场！它们是酸喉和恐鳞！"
G["Steel yourselves, men! We're bein' boarded!"]="守住，伙计们！敌人登上甲板了！"
G["Steel yourselves, soldiers. $n has provided us with the final piece of this puzzle. The dread lich, Thel'zan, will soon come out of hiding, only to be rendered powerless against us!"]="士兵们，振作起来。$n已经帮我们揭开了最后的谜团。巫妖塞尔赞很快就会显身，让我们一举击败他吧！"
G["Steelmauler."]="钢拳。"
G["Steer!"]="转向！"
G["Stefan told me you would demonstrate the purpose of this item."]="斯特凡说你可以示范要如何使用这东西。"
G["Step aboard, friends! Carefully now..."]="请登船，朋友们！小心……"
G["Step aside and let some others have a chance to play."]="让开点，让其他人也来玩玩吧。"
G["Step aside goblin.  This artifact is exactly what the warchief hoped to find here.  I am taking it under Kor'kron protection."]="让开，地精。这个遗物正是酋长要找的东西。从现在起，它受库卡隆的保护。"
G["Step aside lest I add you as another adornment to my armor. Your leader and I have matters to attend..."]="在我把你做成我护甲上的又一个装饰前，给我滚到一边去。你的领袖和我有事要商量……"
G["Step aside, brothers. We must speak with Hellscream."]="请让开，兄弟们。我们必须和地狱咆哮谈谈。"
G["Step aside. I've got the key right here."]="让开。我这儿有钥匙。"
G["Step away from the Lieutenant's belongings!"]="不要碰中尉的东西！"
G["Step away from there, $c!"]="你要为你的妄为付出代价，$c！"
G["Step carefully mortal.  You tread where mightier beings have met their fate."]="当心点，凡人。那些强大的生物就是在此地葬生的。"
G["Step forth disciple. Show me what you have learned."]="来吧，让我瞧瞧你都学了些什么。"
G["Step forward! Witness the gift of the Thunder King!"]="站出来！见证雷电之王的恩赐吧！"
G["Step forward.  I will see that you are properly welcomed!"]="过来，我会好好欢迎你们的！"
G["Step in close. Engage into his space. Don't give him the initiative!"]="靠近点。深入他的空间。别让他掌握主动！"
G["Step inside, step inside! Is there anything I can get for you today?"]="快进来，快进来！我今天能为你做些什么吗？"
G["Step it up, Horvik. You too, Gleenix! Grapplehammer demands nothing less than perfection here."]="再用心一些，霍维奇。你也是，格伦尼克斯！钩锤只需要绝对的完美。"
G["Step lightly! We are almost to the gate."]="放轻脚步！我们就快到门边上了。"
G["Step lively Dadanga!  Come on, girl!  The quicker we get through here, the happier we'll both be."]="加把劲，达丹加！快一点，小女孩！"
G["Step lively; the master is counting on us!"]="快点，主人正指望着我们演出呢！"
G["Step on through, $n!"]="赶快，$n！"
G["Step one: dance."]="第一步：跳舞。"
G["Step onto that teleporter. Ratchet, comin' right up!"]="站到那个传送器上去。棘齿城，马上就到！"
G["Step out of the illuminated area before Force of Will finishes casting to avoid being knocked down."]="在意志之力施放完毕前走出发光区域以避免被击倒。"
G["Step right up and get your game tokens!"]="快来买游戏代币啊！"
G["Step right up and hear about the most amazing spectacle in all of Azeroth - the Darkmoon Faire!  Huzzah!"]="快来吧，听说艾泽拉斯最盛大的集会——暗月马戏团开张啦！哈哈！"
G["Step right up and take your best shot!"]="站出来，发挥一下神枪手的本事吧！"
G["Step right up and try a tonk!"]="站出来，试试我们的坦克吧！"
G["Step right up and wet your whistle."]="向上方走，吹吹口哨。"
G["Step right up!  Get your red hot wings right here!"]="快来吧！来买热辣烤翅啊！"
G["Step right up! Finest selection of weapons this side of Ashenvale!"]="快来看看！这里有灰谷最好的武器供你选择！"
G["Step right up! The zeppelin to Orgrimmar has arrived! All aboard to Durotar!"]="做好准备！前往奥格瑞玛的飞艇已经到达！全体登船，目标杜隆塔尔！"
G["Step through the portal and return to Wildheart Point."]="穿过传送门，返回野性之心哨站。"
G["Step two: say the words. \"Heed my call, waters of pain, and bring forth, Torjari's Bane!\""]="Paso dos: decir las palabras. \"¡Oíd mi llamada, aguas del dolor, y traed la Perdición de Torjari!\""
G["Step up the pace, you peons! ...Don't make me use the stick."]="加快脚步，苦力！……不要让我抽打你们。"
G["Step up to get blown up!"]="快上来试试被人肉炮弹的滋味吧！"
G["Stephanos is our Hippogryph master.  He resides in the Exodar's central hub.  May the Light bless you on your travels."]="斯泰法努斯是我们的角鹰兽管理员。他就在埃索达的中央。愿圣光庇护你。"
G["Stern Hit!"]="击中后部！"
G["Stew, stew, stew, stew..."]="好汤，好汤，好汤啊……"
G["Steward, please allow me to ride one of the drakes to the queen's chamber at the top of the temple."]="塔里奥斯塔兹，请允许我搭乘龙兽前往神殿顶端女王陛下的王廷。"
G["Stick around after the firework show is over.  Find a goblet and raise it to toast your hardy friends!"]="焰火表演之后不要走开！拿起高脚杯和你的好朋友一起庆祝吧！"
G["Stick around!"]="定住吧！"
G["Stick around..."]="留在这里……"
G["Sticks and stones may break my bones..."]="棍棒和石头可能会敲碎我的骨头……"
G["Stickybombing"]="粘性炸弹"
G["Still I hunger. Still... I... thirst."]="我依然这么饿。我依然……这么……渴。"
G["Still a bit weak, unbalanced, unsure. Not your work youngling, I am speaking of you! Now, are you ready to be shaped into a real smith or not?"]="Sigue siendo débil, sin equilibrio ni seguridad. ¡No estoy hablando de tu trabajo $gjovencito:jovencita;, estoy hablando de ti! Dime, ¿estás $glisto:lista; para convertirte en un auténtico herrero o no?"
G["Still alive? You do surprise. Watch me as I flee!"]="还活着吗？惊讶吧。眼睁睁看着我逃跑吧！"
G["Still carryin' these barrels back here."]="我还扛着这些桶呢。"
G["Still clinging to the tailfeathers of Chi-Ji, and his idiotic notions of \"hope\"?"]="¿Os seguís aferrando a las plumas de cola de Chi-Ji y a sus estúpidas ideas de \"esperanza\"?"
G["Still hungry $G brother:sister;? How can we help?"]="¿Aún estás $ghambriento:hambrienta; $ghermano:hermana;? ¿Cómo podemos ayudar?"
G["Still leaking, sir."]="仍然在泄漏，长官。"
G["Still no sign of the 2nd Battalion from Stormwind.  Reports are coming in of Shadowhide movement in the Northeast."]="仍然没有暴风城第二军团会赶来增援的迹象，而东北方的暗皮豺狼人又在蠢蠢欲动。"
G["Still no sign of the final shipment of explosives."]="依然没有最后一批炸药的任何消息。"
G["Still standing? Not for long."]="竟然还没倒下？不会太久了。"
G["Still these strangers would oppose your queen's will. Who will stop them?"]="这些外来者想要违抗你们女王的意志。谁来阻止他们？"
G["Still warm, just the way Rejek likes it."]="剑刃残留着鲜血的余温，雷耶克很喜欢。"
G["Still with us, Reethe?"]="雷瑟，你在干什么？"
G["Still you fight. Still you cling to misguided principles. If you survive, you'll find me in the center ring."]="你们还要打下去吗？你们仍然遵守着被扭曲的教条吗？如果你们能活下来，就到中央的圆环中找我吧。"
G["Still, I be hopin' Thrall will return to us one day. Tha future right now be lookin' very grim... and very bloody."]="但，我还是希望萨尔终有一天能够回来。现在我眼中的未来只剩下了暴力和血腥。"
G["Still, I can hear the cry of a distant heart, echoing through the labyrinths between worlds. It's the cry of a lover's heart, I hear... and Great Therazane has not forgotten what it was to love..."]="但我能听到哭泣的心声，遥远地回响在两个世界间的无尽迷宫里。这是为爱人哭泣的心声……伟大的塞拉赞恩并没有忘记爱是什么……"
G["Still, I can't help but get an uneasy feelin' that the Horde ain't goin' to take that quietly."]="然而我仍然不由地觉得部落不会就此善罢甘休。"
G["Still, I fear I was lettin' my temper drive me ta bein' rash. Thrall devoted himself to makin' the Horde what it is, so I've no eagerness to be leavin' it on a whim.  Dis will be needin' much more thought."]="不过，我也在担心会过于意气用事。萨尔竭尽心力，才让部落成为今天这个样子，我不想因为一时冲动就离开。我需要再好好想想。"
G["Still, King Rastakhan did nothing."]="拉斯塔哈还是无动于衷。"
G["Still, in time, I will... fall to madness. And you, heroes... will vanquish me. The cycle will repeat. So it goes."]="在未来，我仍将……堕入疯狂。而你们，英雄们，注定将消灭我。循环仍将继续，如此往复。"
G["Still, looks are deceiving for the likes of you. Don't worry, I'll make something that favors your style of fighting."]="对于你这样的人，外表实在是一种欺骗。别担心，我会打造适合你的战斗风格的武器。"
G["Still, the Blood Knights will endure through this loss. We have no other choice... we must find another source."]="无论怎样，血骑士必须坚持到底。我们没有选择……我们必须找到新的能量源。"
G["Still, the elements clearly speak to you, and when I'm done, you'll have a fine weapon to help you harness their power."]="你显然能够和元素进行顺畅的交流。等我的工作完成之后，你就会有一件精良的武器。它能帮助你充分施展元素的力量。"
G["Still... there is balance in all things, even death. I simply hate the concept that such destruction and darkness might be necessary."]="万物皆有平衡，死亡亦然。我痛恨那种认为破坏和黑暗也是一种合理存在的想法。"
G["Stillpine raiders, the time to strike is at hand! Charge!"]="止松要塞的勇士们，进攻的时机来临了！冲锋！"
G["Stinkbeard comin' for you, little ones!"]="一群小不点，恶臭之须来了！"
G["Stinkin' ettins!"]="臭气熏天的双头魔！"
G["Stinking ettins!"]="臭气熏天的双头魔！"
G["Stinking. Disgusting. Filthy animals!"]="肮脏，可憎，臭气熏天的野兽！"
G["Stinky tofu, come and get your stinky tofu! I've got the stinkiest tofu in all of Pandaria!"]="臭豆腐，快来尝尝臭豆腐啊！我们这儿有全潘达利亚最臭的臭豆腐！"
G["Stinky wikkets gonna get ravaged."]="臭蠢蛋要遭殃了。"
G["Stir fry! Thanks boss!"]="¡Revuelto! ¡Gracias, $gjefe:jefa;!"
G["Stitch, would you please show our upcoming tamer how we like to battle?"]="斯蒂奇，你愿不愿意让我们这位准驯宠师瞧瞧，我们是如何战斗的？"
G["Sto-o-op! Make it stop!!"]="停下！停下这东西！！"
G["Stolen supplies?  Well, let me think about it...\n\nI know a certain priest named Daria who took all the extra wine after last week's service, but didn't throw it out as I asked.  I believe she'll be apologizing soon, though.\n\n<Alphus winks at you.>\n\nI've also heard an abnormal number of confessions this week from one of the mages... what was his name?  Crisp?  Lisp?  Something along those lines.\n\nNow, be on your way."]="被盗的补给品？嗯，让我想想……\n\n我知道有个叫达莉亚的祭司，在上星期活动结束后把剩下的酒都拿走了，并没有照我说的放回来。不过我相信她很快就会前来为此道歉的。\n\n<阿尔法斯朝你眨了眨眼。>\n\n我还听到那个法师……叫什么来着……克里斯普？还是利斯普？差不多就是这名字吧。他这礼拜一反常态地做了不少次忏悔。\n\n好了，快走开吧。"
G["Stomp and burn, stomp and burn."]="踩死他们，烧死他们！"
G["Stomp now."]="践踏。"
G["Stomp on marmots! Avoid insect swarms!"]="狠踩土拨鼠！避开虫群！"
G["Stompers, defend your Chieftan!"]="践踏者，守卫你们的酋长！"
G["Stompy, show this tamer what you can do!"]="斯多皮，让这位驯宠师看看你的本事！"
G["Stone troggs are attacking!"]="石头穴居人正在进攻！"
G["Stone troggs incoming!"]="石头穴居人来了！"
G["Stone troggs... the vermin of the deeps."]="石头穴居人……深渊的害虫。"
G["Stonecore was merely a setback!"]="巨石之核不过是个小小的挫折！"
G["Stonemasons. . .errr. . Defias be warned:  The rusty anchor sinks tonight."]="石匠……呃，迪菲亚兄弟会的成员们请注意：今晚抛锚。"
G["Stonemaul comin' in FOR DA HORDE!"]="石槌为部落而战！"
G["Stones of the earth, obey the call of the Twilight's Hammer!"]="大地之山岩，听从暮光之锤的召唤！"
G["Stonetalon Mountain has many perilous caves through out this region.  Exploring these caves can hold many adventures for those willing to risk life for glory.\n\n$C, perhaps you seek riches that only following your heart and soul can garnish."]="石爪山脉在这片区域拥有许多危险的洞穴。若干冒险家愿意冒着生命的危险到这些洞穴中探险。\n\n$C，也许只要你全心全意地寻找，会找到财宝的。"
G["Stonetalon has always had its fill of problems, $n, but never has the land and its people suffered so badly. The Horde will destroy us all if left unchecked."]="石爪山这里总是困难重重，$n，但这片土地和生活在这里的人民从没像现在这么痛苦过。如果不加以制止的话，部落会把我们全都毁掉。"
G["Stop $Ghim:her;! $GHe:She; must not get to Doren!"]="¡$gDetenedlo:Detenedla;! ¡No podemos permitir que llegue hasta Doren!"
G["Stop - no. Slow down - maybe.\n\nThe Scholomance is their primary source of training and education. It is from there that the Cult members fan out and ultimately, make their way into our societies.\n\nThat is why we must strike at the source. The very heart of the Cult of the Damned!"]="停下来——不。放慢速度——或许这样比较好。\n\n通灵学院是他们接受初级训练和教育的地方。信徒们从那儿走出来，并最终进入我们的社会。\n\n这就是我们必须攻破通灵学院的原因。它是诅咒神教的中心！"
G["Stop agreeing with me!"]="别再附和我说的话！"
G["Stop bothering me! I normally get up late in the afternoon."]="别烦我了！我一般要下午才起床。"
G["Stop calling me Fronkle!"]="别再叫我弗朗科了！"
G["Stop casting! %s is generating an |cFFFF0000|Hspell:138763|h[Interrupting Jolt]|h|r."]="快停止施法！%s正在酝酿|cFFFF0000|Hspell:138763|h[震荡干涉]|h|r。"
G["Stop casting! %s is generating an |cFFFF0000|Hspell:139867|h[Interrupting Jolt]|h|r."]="快停止施法！%s正在酝酿|cFFFF0000|Hspell:139867|h[震荡干涉]|h|r。"
G["Stop casting! %s is generating an |cFFFF0000|Hspell:139869|h[Interrupting Jolt]|h|r."]="快停止施法！%s正在酝酿|cFFFF0000|Hspell:139869|h[震荡干涉]|h|r。"
G["Stop crowding me, everybody's always crowding around in this village. There's no space."]="别挤我，人们总喜欢在村子里挤成一堆。没地方啦。"
G["Stop da Scourge!"]="阻止天灾军团！"
G["Stop dat!"]="住手！"
G["Stop disturbing the peace, cultist!"]="教徒们，不要再扰乱和平了！"
G["Stop drinking tha last o' our ale and help me off this blasted branch!"]="别再喝我们最后的那点酒了，快来帮我弄掉这该死的树枝！"
G["Stop evading the question, Quincy! I know the thief was here with that crate."]="别再躲躲闪闪的了，昆西！我知道那个贼和那个箱子就在这儿。"
G["Stop fighting yourself this instant, Chimaeron!"]="立刻停止自相殴斗，奇美隆！"
G["Stop giving me that look. I may not be an adventurer like you, but that doesn't mean I can't have a few muscles. All that stirring makes your arms strong."]="别那样看我。我也许跟你不同，我不是个冒险家，但是这并不意味着我的力量比你小。忙碌的生活会让你的手臂变得强壮的。"
G["Stop her!  We can still complete da binding!"]="阻止她！我们还能继续完成仪式！"
G["Stop here a moment, my children, and close your eyes. Can you feel the air currents?"]="在这里停一会，我的孩子们，闭上眼睛。你们可以感觉到空气的流动吗？"
G["Stop hiding behind your traps and face me cowards!"]="别躲在你那些陷阱后面，出来面对我，懦夫！"
G["Stop hiding, Barthilas!"]="别再躲了，巴瑟拉斯！"
G["Stop him! Forget about her!"]="快去阻止加丁！别管这个女亡灵了！"
G["Stop interruptin'."]="别干扰我们。"
G["Stop it meanies!  Maybe I take your sword too!"]="住手，卑鄙的家伙！小心我去抢你的剑！"
G["Stop it with this Light nonsense.  The swamp is where we need to go!  We belong there!"]="停止你这圣光如何如何的废话吧。我们要去沼泽！我们属于那里！"
G["Stop it!"]="住手！"
G["Stop it! You'll break his legs off!"]="停下！你要把他的腿掰断了！"
G["Stop it, both of you!"]="你们两个都给我闭嘴！"
G["Stop it, both of you. You are smarter than this. Can you be clever like a jinyu and get along? Or are you just going to keep misbehaving like a hozen?"]="你们两个都给我住手。别弄得自己傻乎乎的。你们就不能像聪明的锦鱼人一样好好相处吗？还是说，你们就乐意毛毛躁躁地像个猢狲？"
G["Stop it, you tiny, angry woman!  I'll tell you everything!  What do you want to know?"]="快住手，你这狂暴的小女人！我把一切都告诉你！你想知道什么？"
G["Stop it. You both are behaving like a pair of hozen!"]="够了。你们俩简直是一对猢狲！"
G["Stop looking at me with your beady little eyes!"]="别用你那贼溜溜的小眼睛盯着我看！"
G["Stop looking at me!"]="不要看着我！"
G["Stop me then, human."]="那就试试看啊，人类。"
G["Stop pulling her hair out!"]="不要拉她的头发！"
G["Stop right there!"]="站住！"
G["Stop shooting you senile idiot! You're going to kill somebody!"]="停止射击，你这个老白痴！你要打死人了！"
G["Stop slacking off!"]="别偷懒！"
G["Stop standing in the fire!"]="别傻站在火里！"
G["Stop staring at me and go make yourself useful!"]="别再盯着我看了，去做些有用的事！"
G["Stop talk, start eat!"]="废话少说，开吃吧！"
G["Stop that thing!"]="停下来！"
G["Stop that, I'm no soldier!  Hmm... are you?"]="停下，我不是士兵！嗯……你是吗？"
G["Stop the Bomb!"]="阻止那个炸弹！"
G["Stop the Horde from retrieving the embers, $n. We cannot risk them having the advantage when the battle resumes!"]="你要阻止部落收集灰烬，$n。我们不能让他们在以后的战斗中占据优势！"
G["Stop the emergency shutdown!  Kael will have our heads if he hears about this!"]="中断紧急停机！凯尔萨斯大人若是知道了，我们必定人头不保！"
G["Stop them!"]="阻止他们！"
G["Stop them! Mantid attack!"]="阻止他们！螳螂妖攻击！"
G["Stop them! The Animus must not be disturbed!"]="阻止他们！别让他们干扰黑暗意志！"
G["Stop this immediately!"]="马上停下来！"
G["Stop this madness! You have no idea what you're dealing with!"]="快给我住手！你知道自己究竟在干什么吗？！"
G["Stop this nightmare!"]="停止这噩梦！"
G["Stop those horde! They're storming the island!"]="阻止那些部落！他们在抢占这座岛屿！"
G["Stop toying with my emotions!"]="不要浪费我的感情了！"
G["Stop trying to hit him and HIT HIM already!"]="别光摆架势啊，上去给他一拳！"
G["Stop twisting his legs, they aren't supposed to bend that way!"]="别再拧他的腿了，它们不能弯成那样！"
G["Stop whatever wickedness is conjuring up that storm, and the Forgeguard will assault the ridge and wipe out the Frostmane and Zandalari both.\n\nUse my mountaineers and whatever prisoners the trolls have taken to guide your way."]="不管是什么邪恶力量引来了这场风暴，快去阻止它吧。这样，熔炉卫士就能攻上山头，并扫清那里的霜鬃和赞达拉巨魔。\n\n去找我的巡山人，或者任何被巨魔俘虏的人，他们能为你指路。"
G["Stop whining!"]="别发牢骚了！"
G["Stop whining. You've still got your luck."]="别抱怨了。你的运气还不错啊。"
G["Stop your attacks! Its shield will overwhelm you."]="停止攻击！它的护盾将会粉碎你们。"
G["Stop your cryin'!"]="别吵啦！"
G["Stop your slacking and fight like a true fel orc!"]="不要偷懒，像一个真正的邪兽人那样战斗！"
G["Stop!"]="住手！"
G["Stop!  Do not shoot!  Do not hurt Tatjana!"]="等等！别开枪！不要伤害塔特亚娜！"
G["Stop!  Foolish $c, we cannot let you summon the creature Myzrael!"]="住手！愚蠢的$C，我们不能让你召唤密斯莱尔！"
G["Stop!  Infidels!"]="住手！异教徒！"
G["Stop!  Please..."]="住手！求求你……"
G["Stop!  Put that knife away.  You don't have to do... whatever they sent you to do.  You're not like them yet!"]="等等！把刀放下。你为什么……为什么要听他们的呢。你和他们截然不同啊！"
G["Stop!  Stop attacking!"]="停！停止攻击！"
G["Stop!  You will NOT turn my friends into stupid statues!"]="住手！你休想把我的朋友们变成可笑的雕像！"
G["Stop! Back to your corners! Well fought, both of you."]="停！回到你们各自的位置上！你们两个表现得都很好。"
G["Stop! Do not go any further, mortal. You are ill-prepared to face the forces of the Infinite Dragonflight. Come, let me help you."]="¡Detente! No avances más, mortal. Estás mal $gpreparado:preparada; para enfrentarte a las fuerzas del Vuelo Infinito. Vamos, déjame ayudarte."
G["Stop! I beg you, please stop. Please...."]="你有什么要问我的吗？"
G["Stop! I could be convinced to join you!"]="住手！我愿意加入你们！"
G["Stop! Omosh time!"]="停止！沃姆什来了！"
G["Stop! Stop partying! This not the real Monkey King! Monkey King die long long long long long long long time ago!"]="停！别闹了！这不是真的美猴王！美猴王很多很多很多很多很多年前就死了！"
G["Stop! Turn back and speak to Sinan at the bottom of the stairs. You should not face the Warlord's wrath alone!"]="停下！回去和楼梯下面的思南谈一谈。你不能独自面对督军的怒火！"
G["Stop! You have bested my wind serpent."]="住手！你已经打败了我的风蛇。"
G["Stop! You maggots call that fighting? That is pathetic! Now put your hearts in it, you don't need them anymore anyway!"]="停！你们把这个叫做战斗？真可怜！现在用心去战斗，好吧，你们其实已经没那东西了。"
G["Stop! You must stop!"]="住手！你必须马上住手！"
G["Stop! You'll pull her head off!"]="住手！你将会把她的头都扯掉的！"
G["Stop!! Stop!!! Scrap metal moves itself now?"]="站住！！站住！！废铁现在会自己移动了？"
G["Stop, Garrosh! You do not know what that bell is capable of!"]="住手，加尔鲁什！你不明白那个钟的力量！"
G["Stop, my brothers! Do you not see the beast of burden before you?"]="停下，兄弟们！看到你们面前的役畜了吗？"
G["Stop, thief!"]="住手，你这小偷！"
G["Stop.  Let me finish him."]="别动，让我结果他。"
G["Stop. Let them pass."]="别动。让他们过去。"
G["Stop... need to catch.... my breath."]="停下来……我要喘……喘口气……"
G["Store an item."]="储存一件物品。"
G["Storm Peaks"]="风暴峭壁"
G["Storm crow, go!"]="风暴乌鸦，出发！"
G["Storm the shores! Steal their brew!"]="攻进库房！偷取美酒！"
G["Storm!"]="风暴！"
G["Stormbeak."]="风暴比克。"
G["Stormcaller."]="唤雷者。"
G["Stormforged dwarves pour out of the broken corpse!"]="雷铸铁矮人从残破的尸体中涌了出来！"
G["Stormhoof ambushed the North Wind in the heart of its domain, and nearly succeeded in his plot. But the North Wind survived Stormhoof's treachery and executed the taunka as punishment for his invasion."]="雷蹄在北风的王国中心策划了一场伏击战，他的阴谋差一点就得逞了。但是北风侥幸逃生，最终处死了这个牦牛人，以此惩罚他的背叛。"
G["Stormhoof and his kin will be erased from history and these lands will be restored to their rightful owner!"]="雷蹄和他的同胞的历史将被抹去，这片土地将回到真正的主人手中！"
G["Stormlash, vanquish these foes."]="鞭风者，击溃这些敌人。"
G["Stormpike filth! In my keep?! Slay them all!"]="雷矛的渣滓！在我的要塞？！杀光他们！"
G["Stormpike soldiers, aid and protect us! The Forest Lord has granted us his protection. The gateway must now be opened!"]="卡尔·雷矛的战士，帮助并保护我们！森林之王已经许诺要保护我们。大门现在必须被打开了！"
G["Stormpike weaklings, face me in my fortress - if you dare!"]="雷矛的渣滓们，如果你们真的有这么大胆的话，就来我的堡垒中挑战我吧！"
G["Storms may rise, but we stand tall..."]="Las tormentas pueden alzarse, pero seguimos firmes..."
G["Storms of the sky, obey the call of the Twilight's Hammer!"]="天空之风暴，听从暮光之锤的召唤！"
G["Storms! I summon you to my side!"]="暴风啊！到我的身边来！"
G["Stormstout!"]="风暴烈酒！"
G["Stormstout. Pandaren for \"beer.\""]="Cerveza de Trueno. Es como se dice \"cerveza\" en pandaren."
G["Stormstout. Probably the best brew in Azeroth."]="风暴烈酒，全艾泽拉斯最好的酒。"
G["Stormstout: Delicious and light!"]="风暴烈酒：可口清爽！"
G["Stormstout: It's all about the brew."]="风暴烈酒：美酒中的美酒！"
G["Stormstout: The emperor of brews!"]="风暴烈酒：酒中帝王！"
G["Stormstouts, open up! I have returned. And I brought beer!"]="风暴烈酒家人们，赶快开门吧！我带着啤酒回来啦。"
G["Stormwind"]="暴风城"
G["Stormwind Cemetery"]="暴风城公墓"
G["Stormwind Champion's Pennant"]="暴风城冠军的旗帜"
G["Stormwind Counting House is located by the front gates in the Trade District of Stormwind. And when you get tired of counting your money, be sure to stop by the Gilded Rose for a drink."]="暴风城的暴风城会计室位于城中贸易区的前门处。当你厌烦细数你的金钱时，一定要在镶金玫瑰喝一杯。"
G["Stormwind Counting House is located by the front gates in the trade district of Stormwind. And when you get tired of counting your money, be sure to stop by the Gilded Rose for a drink."]="暴风城的暴风城会计室位于城中贸易区的前门处。当你厌烦细数你的金钱时，一定要在镶金玫瑰喝一杯。"
G["Stormwind Harbor"]="暴风城港口"
G["Stormwind Harbor is the fastest way to get to Auberdine or Valiance Keep.  You can find it between the Cathedral District and the Park."]="暴风城港口是前往奥伯丁和无畏要塞的捷径。它就在教堂广场和花园之间。"
G["Stormwind Keep"]="暴风要塞"
G["Stormwind Stockade"]="暴风城监狱"
G["Stormwind and the Alliance cannot allow them to succeed, but our options are limited. Most of the fleet is being refitted."]="暴风城和联盟决不会让他们得逞，可我们能采取的行动也非常有限。舰队的大部分舰船正在整修中。"
G["Stormwind has many points of interest, from the Deeprun Tram to Stormwind Keep.\n\nWhat were you looking for?"]="暴风城有许多特色景点，从矿道地铁到暴风要塞。\n\n你想去哪里呢？"
G["Stormwind is still beset -- a necropolis looms at its walls and random Scourge outbreaks have been reported."]="暴风城的危机尚未解除——有报告称城外飘来了一座浮空城，天灾兵进攻的事件也时有发生。"
G["Stormwind is the pillar of the human race, maintained through strength of will and the edge of a sturdy blade."]="暴风城是人类的支柱，它是建立在钢铁的意志和锋利的刀刃上的。"
G["Stormwind shall never fall!"]="暴风城永不陷落！"
G["Stormwind still stands, and we won't be losing anything to the Horde!"]="暴风城还没失守，我们不会让部落占到半点儿便宜！"
G["Stormwind's Royal Bank is in the northernmost corner of the Dwarven District, just inside the Northern Landing."]="暴风城皇家银行位于矮人区最北边的角落里，城北降落点区域内。"
G["Stormwind's desertion shall not be forgiven by the people of Westfall."]="暴风城背信弃义的行为永远也无法得到西部荒野人民的原谅。"
G["Stormwind's resident engineer trainer is an ingenious gnome by the name of Lilliam Sparkspindle. He can be found in the back of the Dwarven District."]="暴风城有一个天才侏儒名叫利廉姆·火轴，他是这里最好的工程学训练师。你可以在矮人区的后面找到他。"
G["Stormwind's two most popular inns are located in the Trade and Dwarven Districts: The Gilded Rose and The Golden Keg."]="暴风城最热门的两个旅店分别坐落于贸易区与矮人区——镶金玫瑰旅店与黄金酒桶旅店。"
G["Stormy seas out there.  The sea spirits must be restless....hic!"]="波涛汹涌的海洋……看来海之精灵是永不疲倦的……嗝儿！"
G["Straight and true, that's the way."]="不偏不斜，就是这样。"
G["Straight from the lush forests of Elwynn, get your fresh fruit right here."]="产自茂密的艾尔文森林的新鲜水果，快来尝尝啊！"
G["Straight out of Thor Modan and made of 100 percent authentic... metal... here is Rustblood, the lightning-powered iron golem!"]="它就是来自索尔莫丹，由百分百……纯……金属打造而成的闪电动力铁人——锈血！"
G["Straight to the heart!"]="直指人心！"
G["Straighten up!  I will not have soldiers in my unit looking so undisciplined before Val'zareq."]="站直了！我不会让瓦萨雷克看到我的部队里还有那么懒散的士兵。"
G["Straining my eyes, I could just barely read her lips, as she said:"]="我使劲看才看清了她的口型，她说的是："
G["Straining my eyes, I could just barely read his lips, as he said:"]="我聚精会神，好不容易看清他的口型，他说："
G["Stranded on this island you will find the most dangerous creatures in all of Pandaria. Explore if you must, Prince Anduin. But be cautious."]="这里有着全潘达利亚最危险的生物。如果你坚持，安度因王子，你可以去探索一番。但请务必小心。"
G["Strange activity has been reported at Frostmourne Cave. Scout it out!"]="据说霜之哀伤洞穴有可疑情况！立即去侦察！"
G["Strange getup, even for a $r $c if you ask me."]="Vaya forma de vestir... incluso para $gun:una; $r $c."
G["Strange ghosts walk the land. Be careful!"]="这里到处都是幽魂。小心！"
G["Strange that the naga would go out of their way to keep us alive.\n\nThey create prisons from mystical pearls - cells that allowed us to breathe, but little else..\n\nThey ship the prisoners off... somewhere.\n\nNever see them again...."]="真是奇怪，从没想过纳迦竟然会设法让我们活下来。\n\n他们用神秘的珍珠造出牢房——让我们能够呼吸的小单间，然后就不管我们了……。\n\n他们每天都会送走一些囚犯……不知道去往哪里。\n\n再也没见过他们……"
G["Strange wizard?"]="奇怪的巫师？"
G["Strange, I did not think there were any of those left in the shadow realm. Beware disciples, this one is a bit dangerous."]="奇怪，我还以为它们在阴影世界已经绝迹了呢。当心点，它不容易对付的。"
G["Strange, I don't remember any mention of those orbital emplacements last time. I wonder what dolt activated them."]="奇怪，我记得上次根本没提到什么轨道炮台啊。是哪个蠢货把它们给激活的？"
G["Strange, the records on this one are incomplete.  It just says \"I killed it!\" in a rough scrawl, written in blood."]="Extraño, las anotaciones en este están incompletas. Solo dice \"¡Lo maté!\" con unos garabatos escritos con sangre."
G["Strange.  Very strange..."]="奇怪。非常奇怪……"
G["Strange... Just yesterday, I was dispatched to Ashenvale."]="奇怪……昨天我刚刚被决定派往灰谷。"
G["Strange... never thought the naga would go out of their way to keep us alive.\n\nThey create these pearly bubbles... one per man... made it so we could breathe.\n\nEvery day they send a bunch of the prisoners off... somewhere.\n\nNever see them again...."]="真是奇怪……从没想过纳迦竟然会设法让我们活下来。\n\n他们弄出这些像珍珠一样的泡泡……一人一个……让我们能够呼吸。\n\n他们每天都会送走一些囚犯……不知道去往哪里。\n\n再也没见过他们……"
G["Strange... these mosaics don't resemble any known troll traditions."]="奇怪啊……，这上面的镶嵌着的图案跟任何已知的巨魔传统风格都完全没有任何接近之处。"
G["Strange... this one carries a few pieces of polished stone."]="奇怪……这个家伙带着一些打磨过的石头。"
G["Stranger - your own doubts have been made manifest. Pandaria is not like whatever land you come from; it lives and breathes. You should be careful what kind of energy you bring here."]="陌生人——你自身的疑惑现形了。潘达利亚跟其它地方有所不同，它有生命，会呼吸。你应该小心控制自己带来的能量。"
G["Stranger! A moment of your time if you please?"]="¡$gForastero:Forastera;! ¿Tienes un momento?"
G["Stranger, find the fallen Prince Menethil and end his reign of terror."]="$gForastero:forastera;, encuentra al príncipe caído, Menethil, y pon fin a su reinado de terror."
G["Stranger, have you ever seen a stone fall into a calm lake? Every action creates a ripple, even accepting a pledge of friendship. I shall think upon your request."]="$gForastero:Forastera;, ¿alguna vez has visto una piedra caer en un lago en calma? Toda acción provoca una reacción; incluso aceptar una petición de amistad. Consideraré tu solicitud."
G["Stranger, make haste and contact Lady Jaina Proudmoore. Her small Alliance force is bravely attempting to blunt the Burning Legion's initial assault and delay the approach of Archimonde."]="$gForastero:Forastera; date prisa y ponte en contacto con Lady Jaina Valiente. Con su pequeño ejército de la Alianza pretende frenar el asalto de la Legión Ardiente y retrasar la llegada de Archimonde."
G["Stranglethorn belongs to da Gurubashi. You best be leavin' before we bury you here."]="荆棘谷属于古拉巴什。赶快离开，否则就埋了你。"
G["Stranglethorn, $g man: babe;.  That's where it's AT!"]="荆棘谷，$g伙计:宝贝儿;。就在那儿！"
G["Strategy, Dark Lady. We should repurpose the shore defenses."]="要用战术，黑暗女王。我们得重新布置海防工事。"
G["Stratholme is no more! The city lies in ruins. The Prince consumed by hatred... madness..."]="斯坦索姆已经面目全非了！城市变成了一片废墟。王子被仇恨和疯狂……吞噬了……"
G["Stratholme may take quite some time to be rebuilt and fully cleansed, but it is an effort I will take great pleasure in watching unfold. Perhaps one day we will see the next great defender of the Light armed in the Bastion of the Silver Hand, or ordained in Alonsus Chapel. No matter the outcome, our work here will bear great fruit one day."]="斯坦索姆的彻底净化和重建还需要相当长的时间和巨大的精力，但我很高兴能亲身经历这个过程。也许在未来的某一天，我们能在这座白银之手的堡垒看到下一位伟大的圣光守卫者，亲眼见证他在阿隆索斯礼拜堂加入我们的队伍。无论以后会如何，我们在这里的工作总有一天会结下丰硕的果实。"
G["Strawberries! Oh wait, they're not in season."]="草莓！不行，现在不是季节。"
G["Stray arcane forces can do strange things to the land, the elements and even the spirits of the dead."]="堕落的奥术能量可以对大地、元素甚至是死者的灵魂都产生奇怪的影响。"
G["Strength always to the Skumblade!"]="力量与邪刃部族同在！"
G["Strength always to the Skumblade. Death and dismemberment to our enemies."]="力量与邪刃部族同在。杀死我们敌人，割碎他们。"
G["Strength and Honor, General. We come to speak with Garrosh. There may yet be hope for peace."]="力量和荣誉，将军。我们是来找加尔鲁什谈判的。这样或许还有一线和平的希望。"
G["Strength and endurance; patience and wisdom--remember these things always, $n."]="力量和忍耐，耐心和智慧——永远记住这些，$n。"
G["Strength and honor, $c. We need eager soldiers like you in Alterac Valley; the territory of the Frostwolves must be defended! Will you return to Azeroth and lend your aid?"]="力量和荣誉，$c。我们非常渴望像你这样的士兵能前往奥特兰克山谷，保卫霜狼氏族的领土！你会回到艾泽拉斯帮助我们吗？"
G["Strength comes in many forms. For some it is a weapon. For others a burden. For myself, I see it as a way of being."]="力量有多种形态。它对某些人是武器，对另一些人则是负担。而对我自己而言，它是生存之道。"
G["Strength of the Earth, hear my call! Shield them in this dark hour, the last defenders of Azeroth!"]="大地之力，听我召唤！请在这个黑暗的时刻庇护艾泽拉斯最后的守护者！"
G["Strength of the body is the power and swiftness of action.  You must keep yourself fit at all times, both physically and mentally.  The bear's girth highlights its strength, as it is a ferocious foe in combat.  The bear's girth, however, belies its lithe agility and sharp mind.  These are surprises you will use to your advantage.\n\nYou must rely on the strength of the bear's body in order to master the way of the Claw."]="身体的力量能使动作充满力度，行动迅速。你必须在身体上和精神上一直保持就绪状态。熊的体型造就了它的力量，使它成为危险的对手。但是，熊的体型也限制了其身体的敏捷性和头脑的灵活性。你可以好好利用这点。\n\n你必须依赖熊的力量掌握利爪的使用方法。"
G["Strength of the heart is what gives you the resolve to take action... action that is rooted in intents that are pure and forthright.  To keep the balance is not to be complacent or banal.\n\nYou must show resolve for that which you believe in, and you must be willing to fight for it.  The mother bear shows endless conviction in protecting her young, as does an elder bear protecting his den.  It is this resolve, this strength of heart, which you must come to know if you are to master the way of the Claw."]="心灵的力量将给你采取行动的决心……基于明确的、直接的目的的行动。保持平衡并不意味着自命不凡或是平庸陈腐。\n\n你必须表现出对信仰的决心，你必须愿意为此奋斗。母熊对幼仔有极强的保护意识，年老的熊也这样保护着它的洞穴。这就是决心，心灵的力量，如果你想要掌握利爪的使用方法，你就必须知道这一点。"
G["Strength to the Clans, $c!  What brings you here?"]="氏族的力量，$c！你来这里干什么？"
G["Strength to the Skumblade!"]="邪刃之力！"
G["Strength used in the service of others is twice as powerful as strength spent on our foes."]="用力量去帮助别人，会比用它来对付敌人更加强大。"
G["Strength!"]="力量！"
G["Strength!  My new brothers and sisters!  Beat back these devils for the sake of your world.  Hold here, and your friends and allies will come and weigh their swords with you!"]="力量！我的兄弟姐妹们！把这些馋涎你们这个世界的恶魔赶回去！守住这里，你们的朋友和同盟会来与你们并肩而战！"
G["Strength!  That is the lifeblood of the Bramblestaff family.  My lineage lives today as a testament of physical greatness willing to take on any challenger."]="力量！这才是棘杖家族的生命之源。我的家族能延续至今，就是强大的肉身力量不惧任何挑战的最好明证。"
G["Strength."]="力量。"
G["Strength. It is far more than simple physical prowess. When you are truly tested, will you be able to tell the difference between strength and power?"]="力量。它不仅仅是指单纯的肉体强度。在面对真正的考验时，你是否能够分清力量与能力？"
G["Strike at the enemy - I shall be your shield."]="去杀敌吧——我来做你的后盾。"
G["Strike at these barbarians with the full force of my rage!"]="以我全部的怒火攻击这些野蛮人！"
G["Strike it down!"]="打倒它！"
G["Strike me down. I shall be reborn... Even more powerful..."]="打倒我吧。我会重生的……变得更强大……"
G["Strike now heroes, while he is weakened! Vanquish the Deceiver!"]="趁他虚弱时发动攻击！杀死基尔加丹！"
G["Strike now!"]="发动攻击！"
G["Strike now!  Strike Ahune's frozen core while he is weakened!"]="攻击！趁埃霍恩的力量被削弱的时候，攻击它的霜冻之心！"
G["Strike now! Obliterate them!"]="进攻！消灭他们！"
G["Strike quickly, Manchu. Show them no mercy!"]="孟楚，快攻击。不要手下留情！"
G["Strike swiftly an' fade away. You'll know ya beginin' ta master ya skills when people know ya deeds, but never heard of you."]="骤隐骤现。当人们看到你所做的一切，却看不到你的时候，你就掌握了你的职业技巧。"
G["Strike the crystals when you are ready and we shall face the Broodmother together."]="准备好了就敲打水晶，我们将共同面对龙母。"
G["Strike the stack of bamboo when the meter is full!"]="在力量积聚到顶点时，一拳击打到竹堆上！"
G["Strike the stack of stone when the meter is full!"]="当力量积蓄到顶点时，一拳击打到石堆上！"
G["Strike the stack of wood when the meter is full!"]="当力量积蓄到顶点时，一拳击打到木堆上！"
G["Strike them down in the name of the Scourge!"]="以天灾军团的名义，消灭他们！"
G["Strike them down, and I become more powerful than you can ever imagine."]="击倒他们，我变得更为强大，超乎你的想象。"
G["Strike true, brothers and sisters!  Today our quarry is demons!"]="战斗到底，兄弟姐妹们！今天我们狩猎恶魔！"
G["Strike true, friends!"]="狠狠地打呀，朋友们！"
G["Strike!"]="出击！"
G["Striker Ga'dok prepares to make a strafing run!"]="突袭者加杜卡准备发动一次扫射！"
G["String-less kites!"]="没线的风筝！"
G["Strip the flesh, harvest the organs!"]="剥去皮肉，收割内脏！"
G["Striped melons are quite juishy this time of year! Put some sheeds in the ground, and you will reap the harvest on the morrow."]="每年一到这个时节，菜瓜就变得多汁爽口！把种子撒在地里，天亮就能收获果实。"
G["Stripping energy from our foes, both fighting and fallen, allows us to persevere where lesser beings fall exhausted."]="无论对手是一息尚存还是已然毙命，我们都能汲取他们的能量，以此获得远胜于低等生物的生存力。"
G["Strive to keep the balance in all things, $c.  This is where true harmony lies."]="努力保持所有事情的平衡性，$c。真正的和谐便在于此。"
G["Strong enough for THE BOARPOCALYPSE?"]="你能抵挡野猪启示录吗？"
G["Strong of body and spirit.  There can be no stronger combination!  Find your destiny with Sark Ragetotem in the Hunter's Hall."]="强壮的身体和精神。没有比这更强大的组合了！去猎人大厅跟萨尔克·暴怒图腾找寻自己的命运吧。"
G["Struggle as much as you like..."]="尽力挣扎吧……"
G["Struggling only makes it worse."]="挣扎只会让你更痛苦。"
G["Stubborn and old. What chance do you have? I am stronger, and more powerful than you ever were."]="顽固的老头。你以为你能赢？即使你最强壮的时候，也不如我现在的力量。"
G["Stubborn weeds! They're a constant nuisance, creeping up in the soil and threatening to take over your land.\n\nBefore you can till that plot, you need to rip the weed out. There's no trick to it, really - just grab it and pull!\n\nIn the words of my grandpa, \"you just gotta be more ornery than the weed!\""]="¡Hierbajos obcecados! Son una molestia constante, invaden el terreno y amenazan con cubrir todas tus tierras.\n\nAntes de poder arar esa parcela, tienes que arrancar los hierbajos. No hay ningún truco, la verdad: ¡solo hay que agarrar y tirar!\n\nComo decía mi abuelo, \"¡solo hay que ser más terco que el hierbajo!\"."
G["Student is worthless, master! Student apologizes for his deficiency!"]="学生我毫无价值，长官！我为这次失误而向您道歉，长官！"
G["Student will work harder, master!"]="我们会更加努力的，长官！"
G["Students are a bit like sheep.  They're useful and even likeable when you guide and pay close attention to them.\n\nYou leave them alone for a minute and they end up falling down a cliff or drowning in a shallow river."]="学生们有点像绵羊。当你教导和关心他们时，他们是有用的，甚至可能是讨人喜欢的。\n\n但是只要你离开他们一分钟，他们就会从悬崖上摔下去，或者淹死在河里。"
G["Students of our Order test their speed in an aerial competition known as the Sky Race."]="我们骑士团的学员们会在名为“飞行竞技赛”的比赛中一较高下。"
G["Students! Students! Pay attention now."]="弟子们！弟子们！集中精神。"
G["Study dis place well, mon. Ya gonna be helpin' me conquer it!"]="朋友，好好瞧瞧这里。你要帮我征服它！"
G["Study hard and you might one day be able to summon one on your own, but for now it's time to move on to the felhunter."]="努力学习，总有一天你们也可以召唤魅魔的，但现在我们要继续课程了，下一讲是地狱猎犬。"
G["Study it, $n: The Catalogue of the Wayward."]="好好看看目录吧，$n。"
G["Study well, $n. We may need you fighting by our side before the next moon fills."]="好好学习吧，$n。在下个月满之夜到来之前，我们可能会需要你协同作战。"
G["Studying and understanding the Colossus will give us a needed advantage over the Qiraji."]="研究并了解这些巨甲虫，可以让我们更有把握打败其拉虫人！"
G["Stuff me like a haggis! Kurdran Wildhammer - in the flesh. He lives!"]="我简直无话可说了！库德兰·蛮锤就出现在我眼前。他还活着！"
G["Stupid $R!  The Blackrock Clan shall dance on your grave!"]="愚蠢的$R！黑石氏族会在你的坟墓上跳舞！"
G["Stupid $r think $ghe's:she's; the boss of me."]="$r idiota cree que es mi jefe."
G["Stupid Dwarves and your fascination with runes! Why would you create something that would help your enemy?"]="愚蠢的矮人，对符文愚蠢的痴迷！为什么你们要创造能够帮助敌人的东西？"
G["Stupid Gronn, you'll obey us or... or... well you better!"]="愚蠢的戈隆，你要么服从我们，要么……要么……你最好识相点！"
G["Stupid animals!  I'll put you down after I kill these weaklings."]="啊！愚蠢的动物！等我干掉这些懦夫之后，再来教训你们。"
G["Stupid animals! I'll put you down after I kill these weaklings!"]="笨狗！等我杀死这些废物之后再来教训你！"
G["Stupid beasts!"]="愚蠢的畜生！"
G["Stupid box! Stupid, stupid box! OPEN! GRURK SAY YOU OPEN!"]="愚蠢的箱子！愚蠢！打开！格鲁尔克要你快点打开！"
G["Stupid drake!  When will you learn to follow directions?"]="笨龙！你什么时候才能学会跟随？"
G["Stupid grenade picked a fine time to backfire! So much for high quality goblin engineering!"]="手榴弹竟然在这种时候逆火，这蠢东西还真会挑时间啊！我受够了这些所谓的高品质地精工程学制品！"
G["Stupid grummlepack!"]="笨蛋土地精包裹！"
G["Stupid lizards."]="愚蠢的蜥蜴人。"
G["Stupid mages... always using the last of a reagent and never replacing it."]="愚蠢的法师们……总是将材料用得一干二净，还不知道及时补充。"
G["Stupid ogre.  You all need to be taught a lesson."]="愚蠢的食人魔。你们都应该好好上一课。"
G["Stupid pig. This ground is already dead. Move on!"]="蠢猪。这地方已经没东西可挖了。继续前进！"
G["Stupid puny thing.  Me smash!"]="愚蠢的小家伙！我打！"
G["Stupid snake. I said shoot fire!"]="蠢蛇。我说开火！"
G["Stupid snow... Hey, you're, $n, aren't you? I've just received a message asking for you."]="该死的雪……哦，你是……$n，是吗？刚刚还有人跟我打听你的事情呢。"
G["Stupid ting!"]="蠢东西！"
G["Stupid tiny thing kill my tiny thing. RAAAAAAAAR!"]="愚蠢的小东西杀死了我的小东西。啊啊！"
G["Stupid, squishy $r. That weapon mine now! Give!"]="$gEstúpido, esponjoso:Estúpida,esponjosa; $r. ¡Esa arma mía ahora! ¡Dar!"
G["Stupid, stupid, stupid ookin' dookers!"]="愚蠢的、愚蠢的、愚蠢的大坏蛋！"
G["Stupidity! I'm surrounded by stupidity!"]="笨蛋！我周围的这帮家伙全是笨蛋！"
G["Subjugate THIS!"]="尝尝我的厉害！"
G["Submit or die, you fool!"]="投降免死，你这蠢货！"
G["Submit!"]="投降吧！"
G["Subordinates?"]="手下？"
G["Succeed here, and our work is nearly done. Good luck, hero!"]="若是你成功了，我们的工作就接近尾声了。祝好运，英雄！"
G["Succeed, and even greater power shall be yours!"]="获得成功，更加强大的力量就唾手可得！"
G["Succeed, and you may ascend after all.  Fail, and burn."]="如果成功，你们将得到升腾。失败的话，你们都将被烧成灰烬。"
G["Success is ours! The Ash'ari Crystal has been restored!"]="我们胜利了！阿莎利水晶已经修复！"
G["Success!"]="成功了！"
G["Success!  Huzzah!  The power source restored the necklace!"]="成功了！哈哈！项链的能量恢复了！"
G["Success!  I have attuned myself to Hellfire Citadel and the magic within.  Ah, such power!\n\nThere are countless fel orcs in that place... but that is not all!  I sense demonic power within those walls as well...\n\nIf you open yourself, then I shall grasp your mind -- briefly, mind you -- and take quill to parchment and record my findings for you..."]="成功了！我已经完成了与地狱火堡垒的同调，并与堡垒的魔法能量相互融合。啊，这种力量！\n\n地狱火堡垒中盘踞着不计其数的邪兽人……但是，事情并非如此简单！那些城墙后也涌动着恶魔的力量，我感觉得出……\n\n如果你愿意让我控制你的心灵——别担心，只是暂时的，那么我就能挥笔在羊皮纸上为你记录我发现的一切……"
G["Success! Another corrupt dragon obliterated! Soon, none will stand but Deathwing himself..."]="成功！我们又消灭了一条堕落的巨龙！很快，死亡之翼就得孤军奋战了……"
G["Success! Hah, well done. See me for your next trial."]="成功了！干得好。来找我开启下一场试炼吧。"
G["Success! The Siege Tank is able to retreat."]="成功了！攻城坦克能够撤退了。"
G["Success! The female yak bleats at you peacefully."]="成功了！母牦牛轻轻地对你哞叫着。"
G["Success! The hill is yours!"]="成功！这座山丘是你的了！"
G["Success! They are alive!"]="成功了！他们还活着！"
G["Success! You have your Personal Riches!\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_coin_02.blp:64|t"]="成功了！你得到了你的私人财产！\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_coin_02.blp:64|t"
G["Success, the rift is open!! My brethren, rise and return home! The Outland awaits!"]="成功了，裂隙被打开了！！兄弟们，振作起来，我们要回家了！外域在等待着我们！"
G["Succubus"]="魅魔"
G["Succumb ta her venom!"]="让她的毒液杀死你！"
G["Succumb to living flame!"]="屈服于烈焰之灵！"
G["Succumb to living flame."]="屈服于烈焰之灵。"
G["Succumb to the chill of the grave."]="屈服于死亡的严寒吧！"
G["Succumb to the darkness inside your soul."]="屈服于灵魂深处的黑暗吧。"
G["Succumb to the endless dream, little ones. Let it consume you!"]="渺小的凡人，在无尽的噩梦中沉睡吧。让噩梦吞噬你！"
G["Succumb to the gaze, mortals!"]="去死吧，凡人！"
G["Succumb to the icy chill... of death."]="在死亡的严寒面前屈服吧。"
G["Succumb to your pride!"]="屈服于你的骄傲吧！"
G["Such a beautiful creature, wouldn't you agree? Do not let his small size deceive you. Even at a young age the Kunchong are lethal.\n\nBefore my discovery, the Kunchong were used as weapons with little regard for their intelligence. We struggled to control them until it occurred to me that we didn't fully understand them.\n\nBy forming a bond with the creatures we no longer needed to exert control forcefully. Instead, a partnership occurred.\n\nKovok was the next step in my experiment."]="多美的生物啊，你不觉得吗？别被它的小身材给骗了。恐虫在幼年时期也有着致命的杀伤力。\n\n在我的发现之前，恐虫只被当做武器，几乎无人关注它们的智力。我们竭力控制它们，直到我突然意识到，我们对它们的了解还远远不够。\n\n通过与这个物种建立起纽带，我们不再需要对其强行施加控制，而是形成一种伙伴关系。\n\n科沃克将是我的下一个实验对象。"
G["Such a dangerous and unpredictable profession cannot reliably be practiced among our pristine woods without calamitous consequences. You might try Silvermoon City itself, however; the walls are strong enough to weather the blasts."]="这么危险和不可预知的专业技能是不能在我们的森林里修习的。你可以去银月城，不管怎样，城墙还是足够承受住爆炸的。"
G["Such a delight to see you again, $c. No, really. You're the reason that I'm making money here, hand over fist.\n\nNow, what can I sell to you today?"]="很高兴再次看到你，$c。不，真的，你是我能在这里发大财的原因。\n\n现在，有什么我可以出售给你的吗？"
G["Such a foolish creature, trying to challenge us.  His rancid corpse will serve as a reminder to the Legion of the power of Illidan Stormrage.\n\nThe shadowcloak's magic is fading, concealing us no longer.  It was fun while it lasted, but I prefer a more direct approach to bringing death to my enemy.\n\nYou fought well, but where I'm heading I need to go alone."]="Qué criatura tan necia, intentando enfrentarse a nosotros. Su cadáver rancio servirá de recordatorio a la Legión del poder de Illidan Tempestira.\n\nLa magia del manto de las Sombras se desvanece y deja de ocultarnos. Fue divertido mientras duró, pero prefiero un plan más directo para dar muerte a mi enemigo.\n\nLuchaste bien, pero adonde me dirijo ahora tengo que ir solo."
G["Such a foul, foul thing - destroy it, before it seeps deep into the soil and corrupts all of Pandaria!"]="这污秽的东西——消灭它，别让它渗入泥土，污染整个潘达利亚。"
G["Such a futile gesture."]="瞧你这丧气的模样。"
G["Such a glorious defeat!"]="虽败犹荣！"
G["Such a meaningless death!"]="你的死亡毫无意义！"
G["Such a patient one! When I was young, I would have hated this task. Nowadays, I am filled with love."]="你很有耐心！年轻的时候，我最恨这种事。而现在，我感到了满满的关爱。"
G["Such a pity, and here I'll wager that you sharpened your knife special in anticipation of slicing a few skins for me. Alas, we've already gathered all of the rugged leather necessary, $c. Do make yourself useful though, and check with the others here to see if they have any other collection tasks to send you on."]="真可惜，你本来有机会磨亮你的小刀，为我弄些皮来的。但是我们已经集齐硬甲皮了，$c。你可以问问其他人，看看他们是否需要帮助。"
G["Such a pity."]="真是可怜。"
G["Such a pity..."]="真是可怜啊……"
G["Such a powerful weapon!"]="真是强大的武器！"
G["Such a sacred text will not be wasted on me. Thank you!"]="我是不会白白浪费掉这本神圣经卷的。谢谢你！"
G["Such a shame for this food to go to waste. Oh, well."]="这食物浪费了真可惜。哦，好吧。"
G["Such a shameful display. You are better off dead."]="低劣的顽抗，死亡是对你的优待。"
G["Such a stark contrast, this holiday, to typical human behavior. Who'd have thought such a relentlessly voracious people would make a celebration of giving and sharing?\n\nIt's pleasant to see. Darnassus should do its utmost to support and encourage it."]="这样的节日和人类的风格实在是有着巨大的反差。有谁会想到，贪婪无情的人类竟然会举办一个表达赠与和分享的节日？\n\n我很高兴看到这样欢乐的景象。达纳苏斯会不遗余力地支持这一活动。"
G["Such a tragedy..."]="悲剧啊……"
G["Such a tragic waste of life."]="这种对生命的浪费实在是可惜。"
G["Such a unique specimen! So many possibilities! I must devote myself harder to the study of the local flora and fauna."]="多么特殊的标本啊！具有如此之多的可能性！我一定要更加努力地研究当地的动植物了。"
G["Such a waste.  That arrow's poison was not meant to be wasted on your whelp.  We'll meet again, Genn!"]="真是浪费。这样的毒箭可不该浪费在你这种小狗崽的身上。我们会再见的！"
G["Such a waste..."]="真可惜……"
G["Such a waste...."]="真是浪费……"
G["Such a weak creature."]="真是没用的东西。"
G["Such an exotic land. I am sure there is quite a menagerie of animals and beasts to be found here. And all with that delightful electrical discharge popping off their bodies."]="多么奇特的地方。我敢肯定，我们一定能在这里发现许多珍禽猛兽，而且每一只都浑身带电。真可爱！"
G["Such an old wagon, no wonder it broke down on you, Samuel."]="这马车太破旧了，贝希。它没少给你添麻烦吧？"
G["Such arrogance!"]="不自量力！"
G["Such attention!  You flatter me, love."]="如此关注！真让我受宠若惊，亲爱的。"
G["Such death..."]="这般惨死……"
G["Such devastation... what a horrible mess..."]="太混乱了……简直一团糟……"
G["Such easy prey.  Sylvanas will be most pleased!"]="真是轻而易举的捕猎。希尔瓦娜斯一定会非常高兴的！"
G["Such easy prey..."]="真容易对付……"
G["Such energy. Excellent!"]="如此能量。真了不起！"
G["Such flammable little insects...."]="这些小虫太容易燃烧起来了……"
G["Such fragile creatures. Worthless!"]="太脆弱了。不堪一击！"
G["Such glorious, beautiful power!"]="真是辉煌而美丽的力量啊！"
G["Such harmony of flavor, such heady aroma! It is...the perfect brew!"]="如此甘醇的味道，迷人的芳香！这是……完美的酒！"
G["Such hatred is only bringing us destruction. I can see it in you as you fight the quilboar...your anger does nothing but wear you away."]="这样的仇恨只会给我们带来毁灭。当你和那些野猪人作战的时候，我也能在你的眼睛里看到那种仇恨……你的愤怒只会让你变得衰弱。"
G["Such horror... Such emptiness..."]="如此恐怖……如此空虚。"
G["Such hunger..."]="如此饥渴……"
G["Such insolence!"]="真是无礼！"
G["Such insolence. My temper grows short."]="真是傲慢无礼。我有点生气了。"
G["Such insolence... such arrogance... must be PUNISHED!"]="如此肆意妄为，如此骄纵轻狂……必须惩罚你们！"
G["Such insolence....such arrogance..."]="如此傲慢……如此无礼……"
G["Such is the fate of all who oppose the Lich King!"]="这就是反抗巫妖王的下场！"
G["Such is the fate of those who question authority."]="质疑权威的人就是这个下场。"
G["Such is the price of curiosity."]="这就是好奇的代价。"
G["Such is the price of failure."]="这就是失败的代价。"
G["Such is the price... of failure...."]="这……就是失败的……代价……"
G["Such is their animosity that they vie for the honor of being sent to assist the naaru there. Each day, that decision is made here by A'dal.  The armies gather here to receive A'dal's blessing before heading to Shadowmoon."]="他们争先恐后地想要为纳鲁效劳，想要在纳鲁那里获得更多的荣耀。可是睿智的阿达尔却能让这两个氏族维系着微妙的平衡。每一天，双方的军队都聚集在这里，等待由阿达尔选择要派遣谁前往影月谷参战。"
G["Such is your fate."]="这就是你的宿命。"
G["Such little things you are. May this challenge fortify your strength!"]="你们可真是弱不禁风啊。希望这次挑战能够增强你的力量！"
G["Such marvelous sights. I regret being unable to see it when I was younger."]="如此不可思议的奇观。我真后悔没有在年轻的时候看到它。"
G["Such mediocre resistance..."]="真是微弱的抵抗……"
G["Such needless strife, but if the elves of Silverwing Hold will not speak to us in peace, then what alternative do they leave us? Seek out the aid of Kergul Bloodaxe on the Hunter Rise to get to Warsong Gulch."]="真是无谓的攻击，但是如果银翼要塞的家伙不想要和我们和平相处的话，那么他们还能留给我们什么？去猎人大厅找克古尔·血斧，他将会帮助你进入战歌峡谷。"
G["Such noble boasts, but in the end, we've brought you down to reality."]="真是动听的豪言壮语啊，但是你们必须面对现实。"
G["Such power! Can you not feel it, mortals? Cease this foolishness and join me!"]="强大的力量！凡人们，你们感受不到吗？别愚蠢啦，加入我们吧！"
G["Such power! I AM INVINCIBLE!"]="如此强大！我是不可战胜的！"
G["Such rage I have never seen..."]="如此……愤怒……我从未见过……"
G["Such skill for a new trainee."]="Qué habilidad para $gun nuevo:una nueva; aprendiz."
G["Such sssorrow... The passst cannot be undone..."]="真让人感到悲痛……但是覆水难收……"
G["Such strange creatures. Why do they remain so long after the Legion has left?"]="多么奇怪的生物。燃烧军团都离开了，它们为什么还一直留在这里？"
G["Such strength... it must be mine!"]="如此强壮……我要了！"
G["Such will be the fate of all enemies of the Horde, Warchief.  Now we must deal with the wretch, Putress."]="酋长，这就是与部落为敌的下场。现在，该去对付普特雷斯那个恶棍了。"
G["Such wind! Such cold! Once, it would have filled these old bones with despair. But on this day, I am filled with hope."]="这风真冷啊！过去，它曾让我这把老骨头感到绝望。但是今天，我却满怀希望。"
G["Such wisdom is steeped in a mystery that can only be found in great Thunder Bluff.  Follow the path north out of Bloodhoof Village until you come to an elevator at the base of the bluffs.  Ride it to the top and ask one of the Bluffwatchers for further assistance."]="只有在雷霆崖上的神秘之地才能找到这样的智者。沿着血蹄村北面的道路一直走，直到你来到雷霆崖底的升降梯。乘坐升降梯到达顶端，询问雷霆崖守卫，您能获取到更多的帮助。"
G["Such wondrous power! The Darkfallen Orb has made me INVINCIBLE!"]="如此汹涌的力量！黑暗堕落宝珠让我所向无敌！"
G["Such... dark... energy!  How can this be possible?"]="这么……黑暗的……能量！这怎么可能？"
G["Such... madness..."]="太……疯狂了……"
G["Suck it down, freaks!!"]="吸下去，怪物！！"
G["Suck it down, orc!"]="去死吧，兽人！"
G["Suffer for your arrogance!"]="尝尝傲慢的苦果吧！"
G["Suffer in flames!"]="在烈焰中呻吟吧！"
G["Suffer the storm!"]="承受这场风暴！"
G["Suffer the storm's wrath!"]="承受风暴的怒火吧！"
G["Suffer well, death knight!"]="接受痛苦的试炼吧，死亡骑士！"
G["Suffer well, death knight..."]="接受痛苦的试炼吧，死亡骑士……"
G["Suffer!"]="受苦吧！"
G["Suffer, insect!"]="受死吧，蝼蚁！"
G["Suffer, insects!"]="在痛苦中煎熬吧！"
G["Suffer, mortals, as your pathetic magic betrays you!"]="痛苦吧，凡人，你们可怜的魔法背叛了你们！"
G["Suffer, you despicable insect!"]="受苦吧，你这卑劣的虫子！"
G["Suffering from amnesia, he fought for his life in Horde arenas."]="当时失忆的他，在部落竞技场里厮杀求生。"
G["Suffering loosens the tongue. Take my word for it, $r."]="相信我吧，$r。酷刑能撬开所有人的嘴巴。"
G["Suffering to the conquered!"]="享受失败的痛苦滋味吧！"
G["Suffering to the weak!"]="为弱者带去痛苦！"
G["Suffice it to say that the academy was cautious in its application of these newfound powers - what few writings remain indicate that the mages there worried about arcane addiction, a problem my race suffers from to this day.\n\nThis restraint put the mages of Mennar in opposition to Queen Azshara and her highborne lackeys, who sought ever greater power with wild abandon, throwing caution to the wind and delving into ever more dangerous applications of the arts."]="总的来说，学院对于这种新发现的力量抱着相当谨慎的态度。从那个时代留存下来所剩无几的史籍资料来看，当时的贤者法师们非常担心我们会沉迷在这种奥术能量中而无法自拔,而这正是时至今日仍困扰我族的麻烦根源。\n\n因此，门纳尔贤者们最终与艾萨拉女王和她的上层精灵仆从决裂。而艾萨拉女王和她的奴仆很快便肆无忌惮地汲取并滥用这股力量，丝毫不在意这其中蕴含的巨大危险。"
G["Sufficient use of force would trigger a reset in watcher functions, removing the external influence."]="足够的冲击力可以使守护者重启动，消除外部影响。"
G["Suffocate upon your own hate!"]="被你们自己的仇恨吞噬吧！"
G["Suicidal bugs, aren't they?"]="飞蛾扑火，对不对？"
G["Suit yerself, mate. Me an' the treasure can both be buried."]="敬请随意，朋友。我和财宝都可以被埋起来。"
G["Suit yourself. At least three of you must assist me if we're to get inside. Follow me...."]="准备好。如果我们想进去的话，至少得有3个人帮我。跟着我……"
G["Suited up and ready to go, sir!"]="报告长官！装配完毕，随时可以出发！"
G["Sul'thraze... the first time I heard the word uttered I was around your age. It meant nothing to me then, as it means nothing to you now. It was not until a warband of trolls coming from Zul'Farrak laid waste to the land that I understood... and feared.\n\nMany will tell you that the Splitblade of Suffering does not exist. That it's a myth; a rumor started to scare children. But believe me, $r, it exists.\n\n<Trenton loses focus as he runs his hand across the jagged scar on his face.>"]="苏萨斯……第一次听到这个词的时候，我还和你一样大。那个时候这个词对我来说没有什么意义，就好像现在它对你没有什么意义一样。但是当一群巨魔从祖尔法拉克来到这里肆意妄为之后，这个词就变成了恐惧的代名词。\n\n这里的人都会告诉你痛苦双刃并不存在，那只是一个神话，一个用来吓唬小孩子的故事。但是，$r，请相信我，它确实存在。\n\n<说到这里，特伦顿不禁开始用手抚摸自己脸上累累的伤疤。>"
G["Sulfuras will be your end."]="萨弗拉斯将会是你的末日。"
G["Sully planted some explosive barrels for me to shoot."]="苏利埋下了一些火药桶，让我来开枪引爆。"
G["Sully! How could you just let him go?"]="苏利！你怎么就这样让他跑了？"
G["Sully! Little Lu! Anyone!"]="苏利！小卢！你们人呢！"
G["Sully, Little Lu, our plans have changed. We need to transport Amber back to the main camp."]="苏利，小卢，计划有变。我们要把安玻送回营地去。"
G["Sully. Investigate those shrines to the west. Look for signs of the White Pawn."]="苏利，去查看一下西面那些神龛，找找白卒的踪迹。"
G["Sully... those aren't statues on her lawn! She wants to turn you into jade!"]="苏利……她是想把你变成玉雕，她草地上的雕像都是受害者！"
G["Summon Ahune, the Frost Lord."]="召唤冰霜之王埃霍恩。"
G["Summon elevator to current floor."]="将升降梯召唤至当前层。"
G["Summon forth your cowardly master, fool! Let him face me!"]="蠢货，让你那胆怯的主人出来！让他面对我！"
G["Summon... ha, imagine what we could become if fused with power of this magnitude..."]="召唤……呵呵，应该想象一下有了这样的力量，我们能够变成什么……"
G["Summoned by a fumbling $r? Unbelievable. Desperate or stupid, this will be your final mistake."]="我被一个$r给召唤出来了？真是难以置信。无论是出于绝望还是愚蠢，这都将是你最后的错误。"
G["Summoning"]="召唤中"
G["Sumthin Happenin Here. The exact nature of it lacks clarity."]="这里发生了一些事情。具体的情况还有待进一步查明。"
G["Sumthin' I can do fer ya, $c?"]="$c，要我帮忙吗？"
G["Sun's Reach is ours.  Kael's dogs are on the run... it is time to put them out of their misery!"]="阳湾港是我们的了。凯尔萨斯的走狗们落荒而逃……是时候让他们脱离苦海了！"
G["Sun... He... aid me."]="孙……禾……协助我。"
G["Suna and I do not always agree, but I always respect her opinion."]="孙娜和我也会有分歧，但我总是很尊重她的观点。"
G["Suna's thoughts are colored by worry for her husband."]="对他丈夫的担忧已经冲昏了孙娜的头脑。"
G["Sunken Temple"]="沉没的神庙"
G["Sunreavers."]="夺日者。"
G["Sunsong Ranch needs my help? I'll meet you there after I'm done here at the market today."]="日歌农场需要我帮忙吗？今天市集的生意结束后，我会在那里和你会合。"
G["Sunsong Ranch needs my help? Let me gather my equipment, and I'll meet you there."]="日歌农场需要我帮忙吗？让我去拿装备，我会去那里找你。"
G["Sunstrider shall be victorious!"]="逐日者必胜！"
G["Sunwalker, I respect your people. You have aided us in our campaign against the Sha and the Thunder King. Otherwise, I would've already ordered the Shado-Pan to purge this entire shrine. But my patience is at an end. The Horde must leave."]="烈日行者，我很尊重你们的人民。你们在我们与煞魔和雷电之王的战役中出力甚多。否则，我已经直接命令影踪派肃清整座双月殿了。但我的耐心是有限的。部落必须离开这里。"
G["Superb!"]="漂亮极了！"
G["Superb! Because of your help, my people stand a chance of re-taking our beloved city. Three cheers to you!"]="太棒了！在你的帮助下，我们又有机会夺回我们挚爱的城市了。让我们为你大声为你喝彩吧！"
G["Superb! Gather your strength, whats-your-face. We've got a long way to travel."]="好极了！振作起来，我们还有很长的路要走。"
G["Superstitious or not, you won't find me exploring some place a grummle is afraid to travel."]="迷信与否，你是不会看到我去任何连土地精都不敢涉足的地方。"
G["Supplies are limited, but I accept only the best from the traders."]="补给品有限，可我只从贸易者手中购买最好的货物。"
G["Supplies from our enemies!  Well done, $n!"]="我们敌人送来的补给品！干得好，$n！"
G["Supply drop at the Wrathgate! Ride with caution!"]="向天谴之门空投物资！小心驾驶！"
G["Support and heal me! Take up this warhammer and be a shaman."]="快来帮助和治疗我！拿起这把战锤，有点萨满祭司的样子。"
G["Supremus acquires a new target!"]="苏普雷姆斯锁定了一个新目标！"
G["Supremus punches the ground in anger!"]="苏普雷姆斯愤怒地击打着地面！"
G["Sure I can teach you the fine art of wielding a polearm, but it's gonna cost you."]="我肯定会教你挥舞长柄武器的艺术，但你要交费。"
G["Sure I hear ya."]="我听到你说话了。"
G["Sure are a lot of litter bugs around here."]="这附近有很多乱扔垃圾的家伙。"
G["Sure can! I left grandpa's shovel out with the rest of the tools.\n\nYou can use it to dig up a Growing crop, clearing the land to make room for something else."]="当然可以！我从一大堆农具里找到了我爷爷的铲子。\n\n你可以用它来挖掉生长中的作物，清理出田地来种别的东西。"
G["Sure could go for a drink of water right now."]="现在该去喝点水了。"
G["Sure does seem like it's been a long time since anyone has relieved me from my post."]="已经很久很久都没有人替我干这个苦差事了。"
G["Sure enough, scout came runnin' back, talkin' bout some orcs down the path. They hadn't seen us yet so we figured we'd go get acquainted."]="果然，侦察兵急匆匆地跑了回来，说荣耀之路的另一端有一些兽人出没。他们尚未发现我们，因此我们决定立即将这一消息通传到荣耀堡。"
G["Sure is a nice day today."]="今天可真是个好日子。"
G["Sure is busy here Celidh.  Do you have any pets you want me to move to the stables?"]="我是很忙啦，塞莉德。你有宠物要寄放进兽栏吗？"
G["Sure it takes longer to reload but this baby will punch a hole the size of my fist through any set of armor."]="要重新装弹显然要花费较长时间，但是有了这个家伙，我可以在任何护甲上弄一个拳头大的洞来。"
G["Sure the fields here are prosperous, but that's on account of hard, back-breaking work!"]="的确，这里的农田非常肥沃，但这都缘于我们起早贪黑、没日没夜的辛勤劳作！"
G["Sure thing, $g pal : gal;!"]="当然，$g小伙子:小姑娘;！"
G["Sure thing, $n! Enjoy!"]="当然了，$n！尽情享用吧！"
G["Sure thing, $n."]="当然，$n。"
G["Sure thing, $n. Here's another for you."]="当然的事情，$n。还有一个给你。"
G["Sure thing, $n. You look like you can be trusted... Trustworthy! I can spot that a mile away...\n\nAnyway, back to what I was sayin'. Takes one Evoroot plant to make the Videre Elixir. The rest 'a the ingredients are trivial really, but the Evoroot, well, that can be a bit tricky to get."]="Claro, $n. Pareces de fiar... ¡$gdigno:digna; de confianza! Puedo detectarlo a un kilómetro de distancia...\n\nDe todas maneras, vuelvo a lo que iba. Para fabricar el Elixir de Videre es necesaria una planta de raíz del mal. Los demás ingredientes son prácticamente irrelevantes, pero la raíz del mal, esa sí que cuesta conseguirla."
G["Sure thing, boss."]="没问题，头儿。"
G["Sure thing, friend. I'll mark where you can find Mantis Shrimp map. Take a look at the Northwest corner of Dread Wastes, it's a place called Gokk'lok Shallows."]="当然了，朋友。我可以帮你把螳螂虾的位置标在地图上。去恐惧废土的西北角看看吧，那个地方叫古克罗克浅滩。"
G["Sure thing, kid!"]="¡Claro, $gchico:chica;!"
G["Sure thing, love.  Put it on Harry's tab, will ya?  He owes me a drink!"]="当然啦，亲爱的。把它算到哈里的账上好不好呀？他欠我一杯酒呢！"
G["Sure ye don't want to be a Blacksmith?  Well, if yer heart is set on Leatherworking, then you best talk to Fimble Finespindle over at his shop on the northwest side of The Great Forge."]="¿Seguro que no quieres ser $gherrero:herrera;? Bueno, si lo que te gusta es la peletería lo mejor es que hables con Fimble Bueneje en su tienda, está situada en la parte noroeste de La Gran Fundición."
G["Sure you don't need a break, old woman?"]="老太太，要不要休息一下啊？"
G["Sure!"]="当然！"
G["Sure! Choosing which group to be in!"]="当然有！不会选队友！"
G["Sure! I'll give it a whirl."]="当然了！我一定要试一试。"
G["Sure! Let's go for a ride."]="好吧！我们出发。"
G["Sure! That last group did about thirty times!"]="当然！上一组复活了差不多三十次！"
G["Sure, $n, I'll train you, $n. Just keep an eye out for those monkeys!"]="Claro, $n, te entrenaré, $n. ¡Tú simplemente no mires a los monos!"
G["Sure, I suppose I could help out for a bit! I can't leave the market today, but I'll be there as soon as I can."]="当然，我想我能帮到你一些事情！我今天不能马上离开市集，不过我会尽快去那里的。"
G["Sure, I suppose I could help out for a bit! I'll meet you there in a bit."]="没问题，我觉得我能帮上点忙！我一会儿去那找你。"
G["Sure, I'd love to hear a secret."]="当然，我最喜欢听秘密了。"
G["Sure, I'll get into the ring.  Let me finish these two kegs first."]="当然，我会上场的，等我把这两桶酒喝完。"
G["Sure, I'll go with you. Gotta study up on your moves!"]="当然，我跟你走。还得研究一下你的招式呢！"
G["Sure, I'll tell you the phrase.  As long as I don't have to go anywhere near Tirth!"]="当然了，我会告诉你密码的。只要你不让提尔斯抓到我就行了！"
G["Sure, Paige. Just be gentle."]="当然，派格。记得要表现得绅士一点。"
G["Sure, but you're not going to like it."]="当然，但是你不会喜欢的。"
G["Sure, go ahead and take one, there's plenty for all!"]="当然，去拿一个吧，有很多呢！"
G["Sure, he's a little small, even by gnome standards, but he's all there! The real question is, what will he remember?"]="当然，他个子小了点儿，即使是按侏儒的标准来看也一样，可他够机敏！关键问题是，他还记得什么？"
G["Sure, it's got bugs to work out. But the microtank is a marvel of engineering.\n\nit uses one quarter the materials of a full-sized siege engine, and it can be mass-produced by anyone! ...with really tiny hands!"]="当然，这里面还有不少的错误要解决。但微型坦克绝对是工程学上的一大奇迹。\n\n它只需要攻城坦克四分之一的制作材料，而且能够由任何人进行大规模生产！……呃，只要你有一双精巧的小手！"
G["Sure, it's not like things could get any worse..."]="没问题，反正事情也不会变得更糟……"
G["Sure, let's go have a drink."]="走，我们去喝一杯。"
G["Sure, she's wearing a dress, and her knees bend the wrong way, but that doesn't mean she can't walk all over you. It's Dominika!"]="没错，她穿着裙子，她的脚关节还是反着长的，可她照样能痛扁你一顿。她就是多米尼卡！"
G["Sure, sure.  We have a Mining Trainer right here in town.  Look for Krunn over in the northwest corner alongside the inn."]="当然，当然。城镇中有一名采矿训练师。在旅馆旁西北角可以找到克鲁恩。"
G["Sure, the others might have gone off on exciting adventures, but I don't mind. I'm perfectly happy right here."]="当然，其他人可能已经踏上了激动人心的探险之旅，但我并不在乎。我在这里过得非常开心。"
G["Sure, we found an Alliance prisoner of war... but at what price?"]="没错，我们抓到了一个联盟战俘……可我们付出了什么样的代价呢？"
G["Sure, why not?"]="当然好，为什么不呢？"
G["Sure, you can ride on a mount while you water the plants. Why should I care?"]="当然，你可以在骑乘状态下去为植物浇水。我为什么要在乎这个？"
G["Sure. I was getting tired of this sewer anyway."]="好吧，我早就厌烦这下水道了。"
G["Surely Mot didn't send you to me? He knows better. You are not yet capable of understanding what I would teach you. See my son Mot, just outside there, and finish training with him."]="明显莫特并没有派你到我这儿来。他知道得很清楚。你还无法理解我能传授给你的知识。去外面找我的儿子莫特，他会对你进行训练的。"
G["Surely a hot bite and a fresh pint will help those battle wounds heal a bit faster, eh?"]="一份热腾腾的饭菜，一杯透心凉的啤酒，绝对能让战斗的伤口复原得更快些，对吧？"
G["Surely they... are worth fighting for."]="告诉了我们何以为战。"
G["Surely ye didn't think ye would find a town without a resident miner about, did ye?  Yarr can usually be found over at Steelgrill's Depot just outside of Kharanos."]="这么说，你以为在这个城镇里没有常驻矿工，是吗？错！在卡拉诺斯外的钢架补给站附近去找亚尔吧。"
G["Surely you agree that decisive action wins wars, Lord Zhu."]="你也明白，只有果断行动才能赢得战争，祝掌门。"
G["Surely you can do do better than this.  This fight has wasted my time.  You are not yet ready to be a champion."]="Seguro que puedes hacerlo mejor. Esta lucha ha sido una pérdida de tiempo. No estás preparad$go:a; para ser $gun Campeón:una Campeona;."
G["Surely you can help. He just went out to the market and never came back."]="你一定要帮帮我。他去了市场，就再没有回来。"
G["Surely you can see the futility of it all!"]="很快你们就会发现一切都是徒劳无功。"
G["Surely you did not think you could win."]="你显然没有奢望自己可以获胜。"
G["Surely you do not think that you will get away with this incursion. They will come for me and you shall pay for your insolence."]="你显然很明白自己无法从这场袭击中逃生。他们是冲我而来的，你将为自己的傲慢付出代价。"
G["Surely you see the advantage in our relationship. The powers we command are immense. With our aid, your enemies could well be decimated."]="我肯定你们会看到与我们搞好关系的益处。我们所掌握的力量是无穷的。有了我们的帮助，你们的敌人将很快被消灭。"
G["Surely you wouldn't deny an old man a replenishing drink? No, no, I thought not."]="你们应该不会不让一个可怜的老人喝点东西吧？不，不，当然不会。"
G["Surely you've been a student once in your life, $c. You learned from an instructor, and you gained respect for them in some way, yes? Maybe not as a person, but at the least, as one who knew more than you and was willing to teach you. If not, use your imagination...\n\nWhat would you do if you came to realize your instructor may not know as much as you thought, and that you may have found a better path?"]="$c，在你的一生中，你肯定有过一段做学生的时光。从导师那里学习知识，并想要为导师争光，对不对？我不是指具体的某个人，但导师肯定是比你知道更多，而且愿意教导你的人。不过，要不是这样呢？想象一下……\n\n如果你发现，你的导师所知道的也许并不如你想象的那样多，你也许能找到更好的办法提升自己，你又会怎样做？"
G["Surely you've felt anger. Anger so foul and vicious that it makes you want to tear someone to shreds..."]="你当然感到愤怒。愤怒的情绪是如此邪恶和凶狠，会让你想要把人撕成碎片……"
G["Surely you've got something to spare, Zalle. You know I'm good for it. Something, anything!"]="我知道你肯定有什么东西可以施舍给我，萨尔雷。随便什么东西，任何东西都行！"
G["Surely, the king thought, if he helped them with their troll problem, they would give him more troops for his campaign against the Horde."]="国王想当然地认为，只要帮他们化解巨魔危机，他们就会派出军队帮他对抗部落。"
G["Surprise us both and do something smart, like running away."]="你可以做点让我们都吃惊的聪明举动，比如夹起尾巴逃走。"
G["Surprise!"]="惊喜！"
G["Surprise, dragon!  Aw, shucks."]="吃惊吧，龙！哦，哼！"
G["Surprise, surprise! Another ghoul!"]="啧啧！又一个食尸鬼！"
G["Surprise, you scum!  You're going to tell me where my sister is or I'll put a bucketful of truesilver bullets through your wife's heart."]="畜生！快说！我的妹妹在哪儿，否则我不会放过你们的。"
G["Surprise."]="一个惊喜。"
G["Surprised to see an orc here? Don't be.\n\nThe forsaken need watching. If we'd been paying closer attention from the start, maybe the Wrath Gate wouldn't have happened."]="在这看到兽人感到意外吧？用不着这样。\n\n需要有人看着那些被遗忘者。如果从一开始我们就好好盯着，或许天谴之门的事根本就不会发生。"
G["Surprised, the beleaguered Pandaren slaves tried to strike Kang. One by one they failed, for he intercepted their blows like a dancer and sidestepped their attacks like a reed in the wind."]="奴隶们非常诧异，尝试着攻击康，结果无一例外地失败了。他如舞者般格挡着他们的拳脚，如风中芦苇般闪避着他们的攻击。"
G["Surprised? You thought what? That draenei do not beat their prisoners?"]="很吃惊吗？你以为怎样？德莱尼人不会对他们的囚犯用刑？"
G["Surrender an' we'll let ye live, heathens! Jus' put down yer arms an' march!"]="你们这些野蛮的家伙，投降吧，我们会留下你的小命的！放下武器！"
G["Surrender immediately!"]="马上投降！"
G["Surrender your soul, mortal."]="交出你的灵魂吧，凡人。"
G["Surrender your spirit to a stone body!"]="把你的灵魂交付给岩石之躯吧！"
G["Surrender!"]="投降！"
G["Surrender, Maestra, and I will see to it that your deaths are quick!"]="投降吧，梅伊瑟娜，我会让你死个痛快！"
G["Surrender, creature!"]="投降吧！"
G["Surrender, warm blood!"]="投降吧，温热的鲜血！"
G["Surrender? I'll scrawl out the terms of our surrender in their blood."]="投降？我的投降书只能用他们的血来写。"
G["Surround them! Let none escape!"]="包围他们！一个也别放走！"
G["Survey says: BZZZT!"]="调查结果表明：哼哼！"
G["Surveyor? I hardly know her! Hah HAH!"]="勘测员！我可不认识她！哈哈！"
G["Survival"]="生存技能"
G["Surviving this attack will take a miracle."]="要是能经受住这次攻击，那可真是奇迹了。"
G["Suspicious activity? Assistant Director Weedlespan doesn't want anyone going to the north side of the lake. Weird, don't you think?"]="可疑活动？主管助理韦德斯潘不想让任何人到湖北边去。你不觉得这很奇怪吗？"
G["Susurrus is expecting you, $n."]="苏苏鲁斯正在等着你呢，$n。"
G["Swabbin' decks cured my rickets!"]="拖洗甲板治好了我的驼背！"
G["Swagger all you like; you pups don't stand a chance. Flee now, while you can."]="尽管虚张声势吧，但你们这些小崽子毫无机会。快跑吧，否则就迟了。"
G["Swarmborn! Filthy muckeaters! You defile our grotto. You will not escape!"]="聚生虫！肮脏的食粪者！你玷污了我们的洞穴。你休想逃走！"
G["Swarmers are coming up the ramp -- use the sap to slow them down!"]="虫群从斜坡上来了，快用树脂让他们减速。"
G["Swarmers, attack!  Tear the flesh from their bones!"]="虫群，攻击！把他们统统撕碎！"
G["Swear da blood oath wit me."]="跟我发下血誓。"
G["Swear the blood oath with Vol'jin"]="向沃金发下血誓"
G["Swear your allegiance to me (The master wants! He sees and wants and hungers!) and you will be remade in my image. (Wait! INFIDEL! A heathen among us!) An intruder! YOU! Show yourself..."]="向我宣誓效忠，（主人看要的就要得到，他渴望一切！）——你将被我的精神重新塑造（等等！异端！我们这儿藏着一个异端！）入侵者！你！现身吧……"
G["Sweep the area for anything of use. Quickly now - they'll attack again soon."]="彻底搜索这片区域，收集一切可用的物资。迅速行动——他们很快又要发动攻击了。"
G["Sweep the leg!"]="扫堂腿！"
G["Sweep the leg... Do you have a problem with that?"]="绊腿……有什么问题么？"
G["Sweep the ridge! Kill the Wildhammer!"]="攻占山脊！消灭蛮锤矮人！"
G["Sweet Elune, thanks for getting me out of that... thing!"]="亲爱的艾露恩，感谢你让我摆脱了……那个！"
G["Sweet Neptulon!  That was... one drink... too many!"]="太棒了！喝得……有点……多了！"
G["Sweet Treats"]="甜点"
G["Sweet baby titans! That's got to be the biggest trogg I've ever seen! Keep firing...take it down!"]="我的娘亲啊！这是我见过的最大的穴居人！继续开火……把它干掉！"
G["Sweet dreams."]="甜蜜的梦乡。"
G["Sweet, sweet embrace... take me..."]="亲爱的，拥抱我……拥抱我……"
G["Sweetie! Are you interested in a woman able to hold intelligent discourse and look attractive while doing so?"]="嗨，甜心！你对伶牙俐齿魅力四射的女人感兴趣吗？"
G["Sweetie! Hey, $c! Are you interested in a woman able to hold intelligent discourse and look attractive while doing so?"]="甜心！嗨，$c！你对伶牙俐齿魅力四射的女人感兴趣吗？"
G["Sweetie, where have you been? You know how worried I get when you don't check in with me!"]="甜心，你去哪里了？你是否知道，当我无法联系到你的时候，是多么担心吗！"
G["Swift Shorestrider"]="迅捷海滨陆行鸟"
G["Swift Spectral Tiger Mount"]="幽灵虎坐骑"
G["Swift and sure. Cut a tendon here, slit an artery there. I can show you how to turn any knife into a perfect killing machine."]="敏捷而自信。这里切断一条肌腱，那里割断一根动脉。我要教你如何把任何一把刀子变成一种完美的杀人机器。"
G["Swiftclaw isn't stopping!  Steer him back to the raptor pens near Darkspear Hold."]="迅爪不会停下来！控制它返回暗矛要塞旁边的迅猛龙围栏。"
G["Swiftwing."]="迅捷之翼。"
G["Swing a hammer, win a prize!"]="挥挥锤子，就能赢得奖品！"
G["Swing those hammers, squishies!"]="把锤子挥起来，你们这些没骨头的家伙！"
G["Swish!  We are on fire today boys."]="精神抖擞一些！快一点！"
G["Switch out!"]="换走！"
G["Sword"]="剑"
G["Swords, claws, daggers, of course -- I've trained rogues in the use of them all. Now maces, I won't touch maces and I won't instruct any rogue who gets it in his head to wield one.\n\nThere's nothing stealthy about a mace. You're in for a noisy kill and a long cleanup if you go that route."]="剑、爪，还有匕首，当然——我所训练的盗贼对这些武器都非常精通。至于锤，我是不会碰锤子的，我也不会让任何我教出来的盗贼去玩锤子，免得他们敲到自己的脑袋。\n\n总之，锤与盗贼必备的隐秘行动完全没有关系。你若是用锤，杀起人来的时候就不会再那么安静，不过威力倒是不错。"
G["Sylann, one of the finest cooks in the city, can be found upstairs in the Wayfarer's Rest tavern. You can purchase cooking supplies from her assistant there, too."]="塞莱恩是城里最好的厨师之一，你可以在旅者的梦乡旅店的楼上找到她。你同样可以从她的助手那儿买到烹调用品。"
G["Sylvanas! You will leave our corpses alone or I will deal with you here and now."]="希尔瓦娜斯！不准碰我们的尸体，否则我现在就干掉你。"
G["Symbols of Divinity? Check. Candles? Check. Arcane powder, uh... arcane powder? Oh, no! This is the last time I offer to pick up reagents for anyone. Is there a vendor around here?"]="神圣符印？有了。蜡烛？有了。魔粉，嗯……魔粉？啊，该死的！我再也不要帮别人带施法材料了。这附近有商人吗？"
G["Synge, I can't believe you got us into this mess, you stupid goblin!"]="赛恩格，没想到你居然让我们陷入这样的混乱，你这个愚蠢的地精！"
G["Synge, I'm going to slap you around some, and then some more! Just watch. I'm going to get out of this cage and then gloat and laugh at you!"]="赛恩格，我要打扁你，然后再打扁你！等着瞧吧。我要从这笼子里出去，然后幸灾乐祸地嘲笑你！"
G["Syntax Error Line 14, Sequence: Flee for Life. Entering passive mode. *Click!*"]="语法错误行14，序列：逃命。进入被动模式。*点击！*"
G["System failure in 3... 2..."]="系统故障。3……2……"
G["System failure in five, f-o-u-r..."]="系统崩溃倒计时，五，四……"
G["System failure. Internal data corruption detected.\n\nConstructing defense mechanism."]="系统宕机。发现内部数据破坏。\n\n构建防御机制。"
G["System malfunction detected... recalculating route..."]="检测到系统故障……重新计算路线……"
G["System malfunction. Diverting power to support systems."]="系统故障。正在转换能量以支持系统运行。"
G["System online. Life form pattern recognized.  Welcome, Branbronzan.  Query?"]="系统已上线。生命形态模式已确认。您好，铜须先生。是否需要问询？"
G["System resetting. Don't turn the power off, or the whole thing will probably explode."]="系统重置中。请勿关闭电源，否则将发生爆炸。"
G["System restart required. Deactivating weapons systems."]="系统需要重启。正在解除武器系统。"
G["System's shutting down.  HEY DOES ANYONE KNOW IF ITS SUPPOSED TO BE DOING THIS?"]="系统正在关闭。嘿，有谁知道，这样正常吗？"
G["Systems failing *click*"]="系统故障*滴答*"
G["Systems failing...."]="系统当机……"
G["Systems... shutting... d-o-w-n..."]="系统……关闭……"
G["Szabo already made you an outfit worthy of a trade prince. Move along now, you are scaring all of Szabo's customers away."]="苏扎博已经为你制作了一套配得上贸易大王的装扮。现在离开吧，你已经把苏扎博的客人都吓跑了。"
G["Szabo, I need a hip, new outfit for the party I'm throwing!"]="苏扎博，我需要一身闪亮的新装扮，为了我即将参加的聚会！"
G["Szabo. He's so hot right now!"]="苏扎博。他现在太热了！"
G["T'chali's Voodoo Brewery has the best brew you can find!  They were voted \"Best Brew\" by the Goblin Brew Weekly!"]="¡La Cervecería vudú de T'chali tiene la mejor cerveza que puedas encontrar! ¡Fueron elegidos \"mejor cerveza\" por el semanal cervecero goblin!"
G["T'chali's Voodoo Brews helps keep the party going!  Check out the party at Brewfest!"]="塔卡里的巫毒酒可以让狂欢一直继续下去！去美酒节看看吧！"
G["T'ink ja be contributin' less glarin' in dis troll's direction?"]="你不觉得你们对巨魔的贡献还不够吗？"
G["T'kulu's death removes the protections from a nearby cauldron!"]="提库鲁的死亡移除了附近坩埚受到的保护！"
G["T-thank you, Undert-t-taker."]="感谢你，送葬者。"
G["TAKE ITS HEAD!"]="要它的脑袋！"
G["TARREN MILL! OK! IS THAT IN THE BARRENS! I'M ON MY WAY! THANKS!"]="塔伦米尔！好啊！就是那个在贫瘠之地的塔伦米尔吗！我要走了！谢谢！"
G["TASTE THE FLAMES OF SULFURON!"]="尝尝萨弗隆的火焰吧！"
G["TAUREN CHIEFTAINS! Playing LIVE, in the WORLD'S END TAVERN! Be there, at the top of the hour! Banished from Shattrath? SNEAK BACK IN!"]="牛头人酋长乐队！在天涯旅店现场演出！整点之后十分钟就开始啦！千万不要错过！你被沙塔斯城放逐了？还不快潜回去！"
G["TEAR THE SKY ASUNDER!"]="把天空撕成碎片！"
G["TEN MINUTES?! You left the factory setting on? Give me that controller, you idiot!"]="十分钟！你还没改那东西的设置？快把控制器给我，白痴！"
G["TERROR!"]="死亡骑士不需要怜悯，"
G["TEST"]="测试"
G["TEST - death after attack $n"]="测试——攻击$n后死去"
G["TEST - death before attack $n"]="测试——攻击$n前死去"
G["TEST - restart battlefield."]="测试——重启战场。"
G["TESTING. IS THIS THING WORKING????"]="测试。这东西正常工作吗？"
G["THANKS FOR RESCUING ME!"]="谢谢你救了我！"
G["THANKS! HI! LET'S ROUND UP SOME HUMANS FOR THE CAPTAIN!"]="谢谢！嗨！让我们为队长收集些人类！"
G["THAT was for bringing me spoiled spider ichor!"]="这是为了让我得到变质的蜘蛛毒液！"
G["THAT was payback for Taurajo!"]="那一下是为陶拉祖报仇！"
G["THAT'S ALL, JOHNNY AWESOME. TAKE IT OR LEAVE IT!"]="就是这些，强尼·傲森。不愿意接受就走吧！"
G["THAT's how you handle an orc, boys."]="这就是对付兽人的办法，男孩们。"
G["THAT... WAS... AWESOME!"]="那……真是……酷毙了！"
G["THE FLAMES SHALL CONSUME YOU! THEY SHALL CONSUME US ALL!"]="烈焰将会吞噬你！会把我们所有人都吞噬殆尽！"
G["THE HATCHING HOUR IS NIGH... I MUST ANSWER TO THE SWARM..."]="孵化的时间快到了。我必须回应虫群的召唤。"
G["THE LIGHTNING COURSES THROUGH ME!"]="闪电的力量在我体内流淌！"
G["THE MASTER WOULD HAVE YOU SILENT."]="主人会让你安静下来的。"
G["THE MASTER'S RAGE COURSES THROUGH ME!"]="主人的怒火赐予我力量！"
G["THE MASTER'S WILL BE DONE!"]="主人的意志必将实现！！"
G["THE POWER OF THE HORDE!"]="部落的力量！"
G["THERE ARE NO FRIENDLY CIVILIANS!"]="没有友好的平民！"
G["THERE IS BUT ONE OUTCOME POSSIBLE. THE CATACLYSM WAS ONLY THE BEGINNING. THE WORLD AS YOU KNOW IT IS AT AN END!"]="最终的结局只有一个。大灾变只是一个开始。你所熟悉的这个世界终将灭亡！"
G["THERE IS NO MERCY!  YOU WILL BURN FOR THIS, DRAGON!"]="我什么也不会饶！你要为自己的冒犯而被烧为灰烬，龙！"
G["THERE IS NO PLACE FOR YOU IN MY WORLD."]="在我的世界里，你们无处容身！"
G["THERE!"]="在那边！"
G["THERE! Hide in the armoire! I'll hide in the shadows next to you."]="那边！躲进衣橱里！我会躲在你旁边的阴暗处。"
G["THERE'S NOTHING HERE EXCEPT FOR THIS FOG!"]="除了雾气之外，这里什么都没有！"
G["THERE'S ONE OVER THERE!"]="那边有一个！"
G["THESE HUMANS LOOK DANGEROUS!"]="这些人类看起来很危险！"
G["THESE SHOULDERS... SO HEAVY..."]="这副肩甲……太重了……"
G["THEY ARE NO MATCH FOR MANCHU!"]="他们不是我孟楚的对手！"
G["THEY'RE ALIVE!!!"]="他们还活着！！！"
G["THEY'RE TRYING TO KILL ME! HELP!"]="他们想杀我！救命！"
G["THIS CANNOT BE!"]="这不可能！"
G["THIS CANNOT BE!!"]="这不可能！"
G["THIS CANNOT BE!!! Rend, deal with these insects."]="这不可能！！！雷德，解决掉这些家伙。"
G["THIS EVENT IS WORKING."]="这个东西正在起作用。"
G["THIS IS A TEST"]="ESTO ES UNA PRUEBA"
G["THIS IS EASY! YES!"]="这很容易！没错！"
G["THIS IS TORTURE!"]="这简直是非人的折磨！"
G["THIS IS WHERE A MOVIE WILL BE\n\nWE LOVE YOU, BETA TESTERS"]="AQUÍ VIENE UN VÍDEO\n\nOS QUEREMOS, BETA TESTERS"
G["THIS ONE IS ANGRY!"]="这家伙发怒了！"
G["THIS WHOLE PLACE IS GONNA BLOW!"]="这地方快要爆炸了！"
G["THIS WILL BE THE LAST TIME YOU UTTER THAT NAME, PALADIN! Breathe your dying breath!"]="圣骑士，这将是你最后一次提及那个名字！受死吧！"
G["THIS is the best your pathetic Alliance can muster? PAH!"]="你们这群可悲的联盟就这点能耐？呸！"
G["THIS is what it means to face an emperor!"]="这就是违抗皇帝的下场！"
G["THIS is who I am. No paperwork, no politics - just the hot fury of magic and steel!"]="这才像我。丢掉文件，抛开政治——只有魔法与钢铁的炽烈怒火！"
G["THIS is your hero?"]="这就是你所谓的英雄？"
G["THIS.  This is what has diluted the vitality of our precious Horde!"]="你！就是你这种人让我们高贵的部落死气沉沉！"
G["THRALL! HERE?"]="萨尔！他来了？"
G["THREE!"]="¡TRES!"
G["THREE? He woulda paid five, easy... Dummy!"]="三个？他至少值五个椰子，很轻松……蠢货！"
G["THRYM CRUSH!"]="塞穆来了！"
G["THUNDER!  THUNDER!  THUNDER!  THUNDERBREW, HO!"]="雷霆！雷霆！雷霆！雷霆啤酒，哈！"
G["TIME IS MONEY, TROLLS!"]="时间就是金钱，巨魔！"
G["TIME TO DIE, FOOL!"]="死吧，蠢货！"
G["TIMMY!"]="提米！"
G["TINK, $n. Tink back, mon! We be Darkspear, mon! Bruddas and sistas! Remember when we fought da Zalazane and done took he head and freed da Echo Isles? MON! TINK! You was a champion of da Darkspear trolls!"]="Piensa, $n. Recuerda. ¡Nosotros somos Lanza Negra! ¡Hermanos y hermanas! ¡Recuerda cuando luchamos contra Zalazane, nos llevamos su cabeza y liberamos las Islas del Eco! ¡Una vez fuiste $gun campeón:una campeona; de los trols!"
G["TO PURGATION ISLE, KASHA! RIDE LIKE THUNDER!"]="为了赎罪岛，卡莎！像雷霆一样驰骋吧！"
G["TO THE GROUND!"]="夷为平地！"
G["TONG! DRINK! NOW!"]="童福！拿酒来！快！"
G["TOO SOON! YOU HAVE AWAKENED ME TOO SOON, EXECUTUS! WHAT IS THE MEANING OF THIS INTRUSION???"]="你为什么要唤醒我，埃克索图斯，为什么要打扰我？"
G["TOO...MUCH...POWER!!!"]="力量……太强了……"
G["TROLL MAKE ME ANGRY!"]="巨魔把我惹火了！"
G["TRY NOT TO... LOSE... THAT ONE."]="尽量……别丢了……那个。"
G["TUNG! I'll feed your corpse to your useless beasts!"]="唐骨！我要把你们这些没用的畜生大卸八块！"
G["TURKEY TRIUMPH!"]="火鸡制霸！"
G["TWINKLES! TWINKLES! NOOOOO!!"]="烁影！烁影！不——！！"
G["TWO!"]="二！"
G["Ta ta for now, friend!"]="回头见，朋友！"
G["Tabard #3"]="3号徽章"
G["Tabard of Brilliance"]="辉煌徽章"
G["Tabard of Fury"]="愤怒徽章"
G["Tabard of Nature"]="自然徽章"
G["Tabard of the Arcane"]="奥法徽章"
G["Tabard of the Defender"]="防御者徽章"
G["Tabard of the Void"]="虚空徽章"
G["Tactical analysis suggests approaching the arena from the front and splitting secondary force through a side passage at the ground level. This will maximize odds of reaching Thorim's outlook before mental domination by external presence is complete."]="战术分析结果显示，最佳方案为从前方进入竞技场，同时派遣另一支分队通过位于底层的小路。要在外部影响完全控制托里姆的心智之前抵达他所在的高台，这是成功率最高的方案。"
G["Tactical suppression fire, Vipore. Lay it on thick."]="需要战术性压制火力，维波里。火力再猛一些。"
G["Tadpoles!  Tadpoles is the winner!"]="蝌蚪！蝌蚪赢了！"
G["Taerar has not fled Feralas. He acts as a conduit to the nightmare through his own form."]="泰拉尔并没有逃离菲拉斯。而是以自己的方式充当着连通恶梦的管道。"
G["Tag! You're it!"]="抓住你了！就是你！"
G["Tai'jin is her name and you'll find her inside the barracks on the east side of Razor Hill.  She'll teach you to respect the gods.  Make certain that you show her the proper respect in return!"]="她名叫泰金，你可以在剃刀岭东面的兵营中找到她。她会教你如何尊敬神灵的。作为回报，你必须向她表示尊重。"
G["Tailor."]="裁缝。"
G["Tailoring"]="裁缝"
G["Tailoring Supplies"]="裁缝补给品"
G["Tailoring allows you to fashion armor, cloaks, clothing, bags, spellthread, and other similar items from various types of cloth, which can be purchased or taken from slain humanoid enemies. Additional necessary materials such as threads and dyes can be purchased from trade or Tailoring vendors.\nHighly skilled tailors can also upgrade their cloaks with magical embroidery.\nEnchanters are often tailors as well, since they can disenchant the magical items they create."]="La sastrería te permite elaborar armaduras, capas, ropa, bolsas, hilo de hechizos y demás objetos similares a partir de varios tipos de tela, que se puede comprar o despojar de enemigos humanoides caídos. Los materiales necesarios adicionales, como hilos y tintes, se pueden comprar a un amigo o a los vendedores de sastrería.\n\nLos sastres más avanzados también pueden mejorar sus capas con bordados mágicos.\n\nLos encantadores también suelen ser sastres, ya que pueden desencantar los objetos mágicos que crean."
G["Tailoring can come in very handy. I once had to sew my arm back on."]="裁缝可以派得上大用场。我从前就不得不把我的胳膊缝上。"
G["Tailoring you say?  Hmmm.  Ah yes, of course.  You'll need to head to Thunder Bluff, up north.  Take the path out of the village to get there.  When you arrive at the base of the bluffs ride the elevator to the top of the rise and speak with one of the Bluffwatchers."]="你是说裁缝？嗯。是的，当然。你得去正北方的雷霆崖。沿着村外的道路走。到达雷霆崖底后，乘坐升降梯去雷霆崖顶部，跟那儿的守卫谈谈。"
G["Tainted grain."]="被污染的粮食。"
G["Tainted soil."]="被污染的泥土。"
G["Tainted water."]="被污染的水。"
G["Tainted wildlife."]="被污染的野生动物。"
G["Tak-Tak also hear mogu using dark magic."]="泰克泰克还听说魔古族会使用黑暗魔法。"
G["Tak-Tak been listenin'. Everybody think oh, Tak-Tak is a stupid hozen, he don't know anything."]="泰克泰克听到了很多。每个人都想，哦，泰克泰克是个笨猢狲，他啥都不懂。"
G["Tak-Tak good on his word. Tak-Tak been real quiet. Me helpful!"]="泰克泰克很守信用。泰克泰克口风很紧。我能帮忙！"
G["Tak-Tak know this..."]="泰克泰克还知道……"
G["Take $g him:her; away and prepare $g him:her; for reanimation."]="$gLleváoslo:Lleváosla; y $gpreparadlo:preparadla; para la reanimación."
G["Take $ghim:her; out!"]="把$g他:她;揪出来！"
G["Take Ducal's horse, he's one of them now!"]="牵走杜卡尔的马吧，他已经彻底沦陷了！"
G["Take THIS, ye blue-skinned hag!"]="尝尝这个，你这蓝皮巫婆！"
G["Take a Candle of Beckoning from this crate, $n."]="从箱子里拿一根诱灵蜡烛，$n。"
G["Take a break and chill, sweetie. You'll get your turn again soon."]="歇会，降降温吧，宝贝儿。很快就又轮到你了。"
G["Take a break, men! Half hour and then back to work."]="休息一下，伙计们！休息半小时后回去工作。"
G["Take a chest of containment coffers and a cantation of manifestation, $n.  You will need them for your mission."]="过来，$n。拿一根显形卷轴以及一盒封灵箱。你需要使用这些东西才能完成任务。"
G["Take a deep breath, $c. The air atop Thunderhead Summit is thin, but free of the choking dust that strangles the land below."]="$c，深吸一口气。雷鸣峰顶的空气非常稀薄，不过这里毕竟没有下面那种呛鼻子的尘土。"
G["Take a dose of pain!"]="尝尝痛楚的滋味吧！"
G["Take a look around and let me know if there's anything that you're interested in."]="请随便看看，如果你对什么感兴趣，就告诉我。"
G["Take a look around, $n!\n\nWe've turned these monkeys into a bonifide army while you were away!"]="$n，瞧瞧他们！\n\n你不在的这段时间里，我们已经把这群猴子打造成一支训练有素的军队啦！"
G["Take a look around, $n. Perhaps you will find something that I have missed."]="去四周看看，$n。也许你能找到一些我忽略掉的东西。"
G["Take a look at me, scum!  This is what a real orc looks like!"]="看看我，你们这帮渣滓！这才是真正的兽人该有的样子！"
G["Take a look at this holotable. I want to show you a bit about Operation: Gnomeregan."]="看看这个全息平台。我想让你对诺莫瑞根行动有所了解。"
G["Take a look at this passage..."]="注意一下这条小路……"
G["Take a look at this, Malyfous."]="看看这个，玛雷弗斯。"
G["Take a look, $p. This panel clearly depicts war.\n\nWhat could be next? What is it trying to say?"]="看呐，$p。很显然这嵌板描述的是战争。\n\n下一块呢？它又会试图描述些什么呢？"
G["Take a moment and look at the statue. This marvel is the culmination of a hundred years of labor."]="花点时间仔细瞧瞧这座宏伟的雕像吧，它可是耗费了近百年的人力所创造出来的奇迹。"
G["Take a moment and relish this with me. Soon... all will be revealed. Okay then, let's do this!"]="休息一会，然后和我一起来启动这个东西。一切……马上就要真相大白了。好了，我们开始吧！"
G["Take a moment to catch your breath before we move on."]="抓紧时间喘口气，然后我们就继续前进。"
G["Take a stone from the table, $n.  You will need it for your quest."]="从桌上拿一块石头，$n。你会需要它的。"
G["Take advantage of their deactivated Sunblade Protectors. If one of their Sunblade Scouts spot you, I'm sure the elf will try to reactivate a nearby Sunblade Protector. Kill him quickly to prevent this. With the blood elves eliminated, as long as you do not trigger the Protector's proximity sensors you should be able to move past them without a fight. That will save you both time and resources."]="你要充分利用他们那些已经关闭了的炎刃保卫者。如果被炎刃斥候发现的话，我敢肯定那些血精灵会立刻冲向最近的炎刃保卫者旁，试图启动它。你们得立刻冲上去杀了他。消灭了那些血精灵之后，只要你不激活那些保卫者的近距传感器，应该就可以安然通过，不用费力消灭它们了。这可以为你节省无数的时间和资源。"
G["Take aim!"]="瞄准！"
G["Take aim, sisters..."]="瞄准，姐妹们……"
G["Take all of the nibs!"]="左右一起刺！"
G["Take all of the things!"]="夺走一切！"
G["Take arms, minions! Rise from the icy depths!"]="武装起来，我的奴仆！从寒冰深渊中崛起吧！"
G["Take as long as you need, Go'el. If Vol'jin believes his people are in danger then you had best aid them as you can."]="不用着急，古伊尔。如果沃金相信他的人民正处在危险之中，那你最好尽力帮助他们。"
G["Take care - do not lower your guard."]="小心——不要放松警惕。"
G["Take care and be safe, mortal; you are a valuable ally we do not wish to lose."]="凡人，好好保护自己；我们不想失去你这样宝贵的盟友。"
G["Take care not to forget the true price of war."]="一定要记住战争真正的代价。"
G["Take care of her spirits! We be handlin' Zar'jira."]="解决那些鬼魂！我们来对付扎尔吉拉。"
G["Take care of him, Sid. He may be the only link I have to my father and mother. He needs to sober up..."]="好好照顾他，希德。他可能是我和我父母之间唯一的联系。他需要清醒一点……"
G["Take care of that shine, $c."]="好好保养鞋子啊，$c。"
G["Take care of ya weapons an' they'll take care of ya back."]="照顾好你的武器，它们就能照顾好你。"
G["Take care of yourself, Antonio. I'll see you in another week."]="安东尼奥，你自己要保重。我们以后会再见面的。"
G["Take care, Garrosh. You would destroy the Horde to create your perfect future."]="小心，加尔鲁什。你的“美好未来”恐怕会摧毁部落。"
G["Take care, and send our regards to your family."]="保重，代我向你家人问好。"
G["Take care, friend!"]="多加小心，朋友！"
G["Take courage, crusaders.  You do not fight alone!"]="振作起来，北伐军战士。你们并非孤军奋战！"
G["Take cover and be ready for the fight of your life, $n!"]="快找掩护！准备为你的性命而战吧，$n！"
G["Take cover behind me! Quickly!"]="躲到我后面来！快！"
G["Take cover behind the barricades!"]="躲到路障后面去！"
G["Take cover in the shadows. We have business to discuss once I finish showing these beasts why I am called the Hand of Chaos."]="躲到暗处去。在这些野兽搞明白为什么我会被称为混乱之手阿兰提尔之后，我们还有些事情要谈谈。"
G["Take cover! Take cover!"]="躲起来！避开火力！"
G["Take curse away!"]="除掉诅咒！"
G["Take down the rifts and use the totems given by the Earthen Ring Defenders to free Trapped Citizens!"]="关闭那些裂隙，使用大地之环防御者提供的图腾，解救被围困的平民！"
G["Take every word I say and commit it to memory. Until our enemies have been eradicated, we must never shirk a chance to further our knowledge. Reinforce your armor, and never relax your guard."]="记住我说的每句话。在打败敌人之前，我们绝对不能放弃学习知识、提高自身能力的机会。增强你的实力，绝不能放松警戒。"
G["Take for instance this quiet elderly woman waiting for a visit from her granddaughter... surely there is nothing to fear from this sweet, gray-haired old lady!"]="比如说，这位老奶奶正在等待她的孙女……显然，头发斑白的慈祥老奶奶没有什么威胁！"
G["Take four handfuls of mud."]="拿四捧软泥。"
G["Take four hides."]="拿四张皮。"
G["Take four spools of thread."]="拿四团线。"
G["Take heart!\n\nThe Soulflayer has been defeated and his wretched heart has been cast into the nether!"]="振作起来！\n\n夺灵者已经被打败，他肮脏的心已在虚空中粉碎！"
G["Take heart!  Pain goes away and $gladies love men with scars:men love women with scars;!"]="振作起来！疼痛会消失的，$g女人喜欢有伤疤的男人:男人喜欢有伤疤的女人;！"
G["Take heart! Your friends will not long mourn your passing!"]="来吧！你的朋友不会为你哀悼太久的！"
G["Take heart, Alliance!  Throw these villains from Alterac Valley!"]="把这些渣滓赶出奥特兰克！"
G["Take heart, heroes, life will always blossom from the darkest soil!"]="振作起来，英雄们，生命总能在最黑暗的土地上绽放！"
