G["Take position here, and I will lead a small force inside Stratholme to begin the culling. We must contain and purge the infected for the sake of all of Lordaeron!"]="部队在这里待命，我会亲自率领一支小分队进入斯坦索姆，开始清理行动。为了洛丹伦，我们必须除掉所有被感染的城民！"
