G["Take your time, $n. Better that you face the Fury Leviathan prepared and on your terms."]="Tómate tu tiempo, $n. Será mejor que te enfrentes al leviatán de furia $gpreparado:preparada; y según tus términos."
G["Take your time, look the weapons over.  I also repair weapons and armor if you need such services."]="请自便，看看这把武器。如果你想修理你的武器和装备，我们这里也提供周到的服务。"
G["Take your time, my $g boy : girl;. Now what can I modify this shredder boot to be? Hmm."]="别着急，$g男孩:女孩;，现在，让我看看能怎样改造这台伐木机？嗯。"
G["Take your vile message away from this city! You will steal no more citizens away with your fake 'prophecies'!"]="¡Llevaos vuestro vil mensaje de esta ciudad! ¡No robaréis más ciudadanos con vuestras falsas \"profecías\"!"
G["Takedown!"]="搞定！"
G["Taken to war, the bell's cacophonous tones stirred the hearts of Lei Shen's warriors."]="在战场上，那钟声能让雷神的战士们热血沸腾。"
G["Takers keepers!  Don't be dumb."]="谁拿到就是谁的！别傻了。"
G["Taking Readings"]="监测数据"
G["Taking a hozen guide with us might not have been the best idea."]="带上个猢狲向导恐怕不是什么好主意。"
G["Taking all bets on who wins between these two idiots."]="有人要赌赌这两个白痴谁会打赢么？"
G["Taking care of animals is something that Ulbrek Firehand takes quite seriously.  He usually hangs out with the hunters at the Hall of Arms if ye want him to look after a pet or two."]="乌布雷克·火拳总是极其认真地照顾动物。如果你想让他帮你照看宠物的话，就去武器大厅找他吧，他通常跟那些猎人在一起。"
G["Takk!"]="好疼！"
G["Takrik Ragehowl has asked for you up in the camp."]="塔科里克·怒哮在上面的营地等你。"
G["Tal anu'men no sin'dorei!"]="¡Tal anu'men no sin'dorei!"
G["Taldan!"]="塔尔丹！"
G["Tales of your exploits spread.  Your name is not unknown to us, $n."]="关于你的英雄事迹已经流传开来。我们没有听说过你的名字，$n。"
G["Tales of your heroics are heard throughout Ravenholdt Manor, $G Master:Mistress; $n."]="Hemos oído muchas historias sobre tus heroicas hazañas en la Mansión Ravenholdt, $gMaestro:Maestra; $n."
G["Talk about making the wrong investment!\n\nLord Valthalak's dark book of spells fetched a pretty penny in the black market.  It's too bad he didn't take too kindly to getting his possessions stolen.  That stinker got us even after he'd been dead for months!"]="¡Hablando de hacer la inversión equivocada!\n\nEl libro oscuro de los hechizos de Lord Valthalak se vendió por una buena cantidad en el mercado negro. Es una lástima que no encajara con demasiada amabilidad que le robaran sus posesiones. ¡Ese apestoso nos pilló, aunque llevaba meses muerto!"
G["Talk around camp is that on the other side of the wall to the west, Townlong Steppes is crawling with bugs.  What do you think, $n?"]="你说的那个营地往西方向，在城墙的另一边。螳螂高原到处都是虫子，你怎么看，$n？"
G["Talk to Narf.  Lets take care of those bird-brains once and for all."]="和纳尔弗谈谈吧。让我们一次性解决这些傻瓜。"
G["Talk to Saru Steelfury at The Burning Anvil.  Go to the Valley of Honor.  It's at the end of the path to the right of Red Canyon Mining."]="跟燃烧的铁砧的萨鲁·钢怒谈谈。沿着红石谷矿业工会右边的道路走到尽头，去那得荣誉谷找他吧。"
G["Talk to any of the Ironpaws at the market if you want to improve your own cooking skill."]="要是你想提升自己的烹饪技能，就去集市上与任何铁掌家族的人聊聊吧。"
G["Talk to me for a free beer at the Pig and Whistle!"]="要想得到猪和哨声旅店的免费啤酒券的话，就赶快来找我！"
G["Talk to me, Tahu. Something. Anything! I'm going stir-crazy."]="和我聊聊，塔胡。随便和我说些什么。什么事都行！我要闷得发疯了。"
G["Talk to you soon."]="一会再聊。"
G["Talk with me now."]="有话快说。"
G["Talk! Talk! Talk!"]="说，说，说！"
G["Talk, ogre. Who's giving your clan these trinkets?"]="快说，食人魔。这些宝珠是谁给你们的？"
G["Talk. More talk... Now release us, mortal."]="交谈，更多的交谈……现在放了我们，凡人。"
G["Tall in the saddle of his kodo, here is the venerable Runok Wildmane, Grand Champion of Thunder Bluff!"]="高高地骑坐在科多兽上的是雷霆崖的总冠军，令人敬畏的鲁诺克·蛮鬃！"
G["Tallstrider"]="陆行鸟"
G["Tally ho! The hunt begins!"]="发现目标！狩猎开始！"
G["Talnivarr the Sleeper."]="催眠者托尼瓦尔。"
G["Tamer ho! Prepare for battle!"]="你好，驯宠师！准备战斗！"
G["Tamers! Can YOUR pets best a team of the Faire's Finest?"]="驯宠师们！你们的宠物能击败马戏团的顶尖高手吗？"
G["Tamp down the inflammants. Batten up the gear carriage. Rudder for the shore."]="抛去全部多余负重。加固装备舱。让飞船转向岸边。"
G["Tandrine is the guild master of Silvermoon. Her residence is along the Walk of Elders, close to the Magister's Gate."]="坦德莉恩是银月城的公会注册员。她的住处就在长者步街上，魔导师之门附近。"
G["Tangleweeds, eh? Nasty little devils. They run deep into the ground some fifteen yards or so - you gotta pull the entire length out if you wanna get rid of it.\n\nGrab the exposed end of the weed and just keep moving away until you see the other end come out. Nothin' more to it than that."]="纠缠的杂草，嗯？卑劣的小恶魔。它们会钻进地下差不多十五码——如果你想根除它们的话，就必须要连根拔起。\n\n抓住杂草露出地面的部分，然后一直向外拔，直到你看到根部被完全拔出来为止。就是这么回事。"
G["Tank ya for savin' my life."]="多谢救我一命。"
G["Tankiss! Help!"]="坦齐斯！救命啊！"
G["Tankiss... get a shield!"]="坦齐斯……找个盾来！"
G["Tankiss... too... squishy..."]="坦齐斯……粘糊糊……"
G["Tanks for Everything in northern Dalaran is the city's most popular plate armor and shield merchant."]="达拉然北部的坦克用品店是城里最受欢迎的板甲和盾牌商店。"
G["Tanks for da help."]="多谢相助。"
G["Tanks mon, we won't be forgettin dis!"]="谢了，伙计，我们会记住你的。"
G["Tanks!"]="谢谢你！"
G["Tanks, buddy!"]="谢了，伙计！"
G["Taoshi motions at Captain Halu'kal, then draws a finger across her neck."]="陶矢指指哈鲁卡尔船长，然后用手指做了个割脖子的动作。"
G["Taoshi nods toward the crewman on the right. Sneak up behind him to knock him out!"]="陶矢冲右边的船员点点头。潜行到他背后并将他打晕了！"
G["Taoshi speaks highly of you. Her respect for you says a great deal."]="陶矢对你的评价很高。她对你的尊重就很能说明一些问题。"
G["Taoshi! Hand me my weapon."]="陶矢！把武器给我。"
G["Taoshi, Lao-Chin, Nurong, you all have your assignments.  Set up at each location and wait for our signal."]="陶矢、老陈、砮荣，你们都已分配好各自的任务。到指定地点准备，等我们的信号。"
G["Taoshi, did you bring the shackles and rings?"]="陶矢，你带镣铐和扣环了吗？"
G["Taoshi, get those doors open."]="陶矢，打开那些门。"
G["Taoshi, go north and make sure there are no mantid on our flank. I will see to the defenses."]="陶矢，去北边看看有没有螳螂妖骚扰我们的侧翼。我去看看防御工事。"
G["Taoshi, the Sha of Hatred is close. Find it and report back to me."]="陶矢，恨之煞就在附近。找到它，回来跟我报告。"
G["Tap Keg"]="拍打酒桶"
G["Tapping"]="敲击"
G["Tapping is an art form passed down through the generations. No need to ask anyone else if that is true or not. Just take my word for it."]="开酒桶可是一门代代相传的手艺。用不着去问别人这是不是真的，只要记住我的话就行了。"
G["Taran Zhu and the Shado-Pan are MINE. Come forward and die by my hand, as all who oppose me shall in the days to come!"]="祝踏岚和影踪派是我的。快过来受死吧，跟我作对的人都不会有好下场！"
G["Taran Zhu leads the Shado-Pan, as his father did before him. But he has elected to close our Monastery gates - why?"]="祝踏岚子承父业，领导着影踪派。可他却选择关闭我们的禅院大门——这是为什么呢？"
G["Taran Zhu stares grimly into the distance."]="祝踏岚冷酷地看向远处。"
G["Taran Zhu won't send us reinforcements. We've got a massive army we're dealing with here. As tough as we Shado-Pan may be, we're going to need to take a different approach."]="祝踏岚不会向我们派援军了，我们要在此面对一支庞大的军队。他们或许跟我们影踪派一样强悍，我们得另外想个办法了。"
G["Taran Zhu!"]="祝踏岚！"
G["Taran Zhu! It does not matter how many you array against the Thunder King. Soon all will kneel before him."]="祝踏岚！不管你召集多少帮手都没用。很快，所有人都将向陛下俯首称臣。"
G["Taran Zhu, you are a fool.  You escaped me only to return with your hatred broiling inside you.  You... are... MINE!"]="祝踏岚，你多么愚蠢。你逃出了我的手心，却带着满腔的仇恨。你……是……我的！"
G["Taran and Ban are masters of strategy and logistics. I prefer fighting to planning."]="踏岚和班都是战略和后勤学大师。相比计划，我更喜欢战斗。"
G["Tarecgosa!"]="泰蕾苟萨！"
G["Tarenar, you dolt!  The chapel is twenty yards away!  Let's get moving!"]="塔伦纳，你这个傻瓜！礼拜堂还在二十码以外！我们快走！"
G["Taretha cannot see you, Thrall."]="塔蕾莎不能见你，萨尔。"
G["Taretha isn't here. Let's head into town."]="塔蕾莎不在这里。我们去城镇里看看。"
G["Taretha must be in the inn. Let's go."]="塔蕾莎肯定在旅店里。我们走吧。"
G["Taretha! What foul magic is this?"]="塔蕾莎！这是什么邪恶的魔法？"
G["Taretha's life hangs in the balance. Surely you care for her. Surely you wish to save her..."]="塔蕾莎性命堪忧，你一定非常关心她，你一定想要救她……"
G["Taretha...  Cairne...  Aggra...  I will not fail you.  I will not fail this world!"]="塔蕾莎……凯恩……阿格娜……我不会辜负你们。我不会辜负这个世界！"
G["Taretha...."]="塔蕾莎……"
G["Target acquired.  Harvesting servos engaged."]="已获取目标。收割系统已启动。"
G["Target acquired. Light it up."]="已获取目标。开火！"
G["Target annihilated."]="目标被消灭。"
G["Target destroyed."]="目标已摧毁。"
G["Target down."]="击中目标。"
G["Target exterminated."]="目标已歼灭。"
G["Target lost....resuming search patterns Delta"]="目标丢失……返回搜索模式"
G["Target nonfunctional. Ending combat actions."]="目标停止运行。战斗行动终止。"
G["Target practice has ended."]="瞄准练习结束。"
G["Target sighted."]="发现目标。"
G["Targets in sight! Squads, deploy: Destroy all enemy rocket launchers!"]="目标进入视野！各小队，摧毁全部敌方火箭发射器！"
G["Tark, what happened in there? You know yer better den dat! Blue team, you will get yours soon 'nuff!"]="塔克，怎么回事？你应该知道你比他们要厉害！蓝队，加油！"
G["Taronto bosch!"]="¡Taronto bosch!"
G["Tarren Mill is destroyed by some crazy force of undead and forever more becomes an enemy to Southshore."]="塔伦米尔被某种疯狂的亡灵力量毁灭了，而且永远地变成了南海镇的敌人。"
G["Tarren Mill lies beyond these trees. The commotion at Durnholde should give us a little time to find Taretha before the entire countryside is flooded with human soldiers. Let's check the nearby barn, then head into town."]="这些树木后面就是塔伦米尔。敦霍尔德的暴乱应该可以让我们有时间在整个村庄被人类士兵包围前找到塔蕾莎。我们去附近的谷仓找找，然后去城镇里面看看。"
G["Tarren Mill."]="塔伦米尔。"
G["Tartek and nasty dragon going to kill you! You so dumb."]="塔尔特克要和凶暴的龙一起杀了你！蠢货。"
G["Tartek is dumb! All you puppy-men follow the dumb. Not so smart!"]="塔尔特克是个笨蛋！狗狗人都听这个笨蛋的话。狗狗人都很愚蠢！"
G["Tartek no match for you! You got the skills. Yeah!"]="塔尔特克比不上你！你真够厉害的。呀！"
G["Taruk sent me to collect what you owe."]="塔鲁克派我来收欠款。"
G["Taskmistress, the next slave to stop mining is to be fed to the creature!"]="瓦格里工头，如果再有奴隶偷懒，就送他去喂怪物！"
G["Taskmistresses, do your jobs. Production must increase!"]="瓦格里工头，给我盯紧点。我们必须提高产量！"
G["Tassle sniffs the air."]="塔索尔嗅了嗅空气。"
G["Taste Gymer's size 600!"]="尝尝盖米尔的厉害！"
G["Taste blade, mongrel!"]="看招，混帐！"
G["Taste defeat, stranger!"]="品尝失败吧，陌生人！"
G["Taste his flesh! Drink his blood!"]="吃他的肉！喝他的血！"
G["Taste hot TNT you fishy fiends!"]="尝尝热乎乎的TNT炸药把，坏鱼！"
G["Taste in my power!"]="尝尝我的力量吧！"
G["Taste my axe!"]="尝尝我的斧头吧！"
G["Taste my axe, coward!"]="尝尝我的斧子吧，懦夫！"
G["Taste my blade!"]="尝尝我的利刃吧！"
G["Taste my fist!"]="尝尝我的拳头！"
G["Taste my steel!"]="尝尝我的武器吧！"
G["Taste my steel, little $g boy : girl;!"]="¡Prueba mi acero, $gpequeño:pequeña;!"
G["Taste pure energy!"]="尝尝纯净的能量吧！"
G["Taste the fury of my moonbeam!"]="尝尝我的月光射线吧！"
G["Taste the jade! Greenstone Brew!"]="绿石佳酿！美玉的滋味！"
G["Taste your world's corruption!"]="尝尝堕落的滋味吧！"
G["Tastes like I'm drinking... engine degreaser!"]="我好像在喝……引擎清洁剂！"
G["Tastes like it needs more...."]="似乎还要加点料……"
G["Tastes like... Cherry! OH! Excuse me!"]="味道像……樱桃！哦！见笑了！"
G["Tasty drinks for sale!  Quench your thirst on some of the Darkmoon Faire's finest brews!"]="出售可口的饮料啦！暗月马戏团最好的酒，生津止渴！"
G["Tasty, fresh, wholesome and delicious! Come get some of Tao's noodle soup!"]="新鲜可口、健康美味！快来尝尝陶记的汤面吧！"
G["Tatai!"]="塔泰！"
G["Tatai, please. We're guests here."]="塔泰，不要这样。我们是客人。"
G["Taunt Flag"]="嘲讽旗"
G["Taunt the Vision of Deathwing when he fixates on Wrathion!"]="死亡之翼的幻影锁定了拉希奥，快嘲讽他！"
G["Taurajo had a significant civilian population. I wanted to ensure that they could escape the fighting, and many did, finding refuge in the north.\n\nThere are some, even in Alliance High Command, who argued that I let an opportunity slip away. That I should've taken hostages. But I don't see the value in those sort of terror-tactics.\n\nHear me out, $n: I want this war to end someday. It won't ever stop if we butcher or imprison civilians.\n\nI just pray that there are those on the other side who see things as I do."]="陶拉祖有许多平民。我希望能让他们避过战火。他们之中有许多人逃出来了，流亡到了北方。\n\n但即使是在联盟最高指挥部里，也有人在指责我放任敌人逃走，说我应该把他们全部俘获，当作人质。但我完全看不出来这种可怕的战术对我们有什么益处。\n\n听我说，$n：我希望这场战争能够结束。但如果我们屠杀或者囚禁平民，这张战争就永远不会有结束的可能。\n\n希望在我们的敌人之中也会有人能看清这一点。"
G["Tauren Gossip NPC - Periodic Talk (Expansion Prologue) 01"]="PNJ tauren cotilla - Charla periódica (prólogo de la expansión) 01"
G["Tauren Paladins!"]="牛头人圣骑士！"
G["Tauren arch druid? Do you mean Hamuul?"]="牛头人大德鲁伊？你是指哈缪尔吗？"
G["Tauren have a passion for hunting; it is something that runs deep with our kind."]="牛头人热衷于狩猎，这是流淌在我们血液中的灵魂。"
G["Tauren! What have your people done? You have dredged open a scar within our sacred Vale!"]="牛头人！你们的人都干了些什么？你们在我们神圣的山谷中挖出了一条丑陋的疤痕！"
G["Tay'kn gobins!"]="抓住地精！"
G["Taylor fought against the hozen like a wild beast. He is a great credit to your people!\n\nBut in the end, he was overcome."]="泰勒就像头野兽一样激烈地抵抗那些猢狲。他真是你族人中的英雄！\n\n但最后，他还是被击败了。"
G["Taylor must be close by."]="泰勒一定就在附近。"
G["Tazaga-choo!"]="¡Tazaga-choo!"
G["Tch!  So soon?"]="嗬！这么快？"
G["Tch. Amateurs."]="嗤！真业余。"
G["Tch. One might think you're ashamed to be seen with me, master."]="哼。有人可能会觉得你和我在一起的时候显得很害羞，主人。"
G["Tcha! Why did Taran leave you in charge? You would have us cower in our bedsheets until the yaungol break down our very doors!"]="嗤！踏岚为什么会选你做指挥官？你只会让我们缩在床单里，等着野牛人打上门来！"
G["Teach me how to cook, Cookie."]="教我怎么烹饪吧，曲奇。"
G["Teach me how to create and apply a Heavy Mageweave Bandage, Doctor."]="医生，请告诉我制作厚魔纹绷带的方法。"
G["Teach me how to create and apply a Heavy Runecloth Bandage, Doctor."]="医生，请告诉我制作厚符文布绷带的方法。"
G["Teach me how to create and apply a Runecloth Bandage, Doctor."]="医生，请告诉我制作符文布绷带的方法。"
G["Teach me the ways of the spirits."]="教我灵魂的行事方法。"
G["Teach me, $n! I will bend the forces of water to destroy our foes!"]="教教我，$n！我要借用水的力量来消灭我们的敌人！"
G["Teach them the meaning of blood and thunder!"]="让他们明白鲜血与雷鸣的意义！"
G["Teach these cowards the true meaning of war!"]="让这些懦夫们明白，什么是真正的战争！"
G["Teach those cultists a lesson, $n. No one messes with Crusader Kul and gets away with it!"]="给那些邪教徒们一个教训。$n。没有人能在惹恼了北伐军战士库尔之后全身而退！"
G["Teach you gnomish engineering? I don't have time for this nonsense. You only get one chance with Oglethorpe and you blew that, didn't you?\n\nYou'll have to head to Tanaris and find Narain Soothfancy's hut. In that hut is a magical book that might be able to jostle whatever is left of your brain and reconnect you with what you've lost.\n\nNow get lost!"]="教你侏儒工程学？我可没时间做这些没有意义的事。你只有一次选择的机会，并且你已经做出了选择，对不？\n\n要不你就去塔纳利斯找纳瑞安吧。他的小屋里有本魔法书，或许能把你的脑子处理处理，让你重新得到已经失去的东西。\n\n现在就去吧！"
G["Teach you the ways of gnomish engineering? Not going to happen! Not this gnome, anyway. You have a stink on you, $n. Maybe this is the pity talking but I will offer some advice.\n\nIn the Tanaris desert you'll find a hut that belongs to Narain Soothfancy. In that hut is a magical book that has been known to do wonderous things. Find that book and you may yet learn the gnomish way."]="教你侏儒工程学？不可能的！至少我这个侏儒不会。你真让人讨厌，$n。算了，既然你诚心诚意地来找我，那我就大发慈悲地告诉你。\n\n在塔纳利斯沙漠里，你可以找到一个叫纳瑞安的侏儒，他有一本很神奇的魔法书。在那本书的帮助下，你或许可以学习到侏儒的工程学。"
G["Teach you to steal our treasures! Our treasures are... ours, okay?!"]="让你偷我们的财宝！财宝属于……我们，明白吗？！"
G["Teacher are there night elves in Stormwind? I've never seen a night elf before."]="老师，暴风城里有暗夜精灵吗？我以前从来没见过暗夜精灵。"
