G["Tell me what you know about \"Crimson Dawn\" or the beatings will continue!"]="¡Cuéntame lo que sepas sobre el \"Alba Carmesí\" o las palizas continuarán!"
G["Tell me what you need, and make it quick."]="你需要什么？有话快说。"
G["Tell me what you want, and make it quick."]="告诉我你要什么，别磨磨蹭蹭的。"
G["Tell me what's going on out here, Fizzcrank."]="菲兹兰克，出了什么事。"
G["Tell me when you are ready and we will go!|TInterface\\GossipFrame\\GOSSIPGOSSIPICON.blp:32|t"]="¡Avísame cuando estés $glisto:lista; y empezaremos!|TInterface\\GossipFrame\\GOSSIPGOSSIPICON.blp:32|t"
G["Tell me when you are ready, $n. We will attack on your command."]="Avísame cuando estés $glisto:lista;, $n. Atacaremos a tu orden."
G["Tell me where the totem of Kar'dash is hidden and the beatings will stop."]="告诉我卡达什图腾藏在哪里，不然就继续吃我的拳头吧！"
G["Tell me your name, orc."]="告诉我你的名字，兽人。"
G["Tell me your story again, Fizzcrank."]="菲兹兰克，把你的故事再说一遍吧。"
G["Tell me, $r, have you ever had a hankering to fish?\n\nIf so, you might want to visit the Anglers down in the Krasarang Wilds."]="告诉我，$r，你对钓鱼心怀向往吗？\n\n如果答案是肯定的，那你应该去卡桑琅丛林找垂钓翁。"
G["Tell me, Black Prince: What is the nature of fortitude?"]="告诉我，黑王子：什么才是坚忍？"
G["Tell me, Godfrey.  Those that stayed in Gilneas City so that we could live.  Were they following protocol?"]="告诉我，高弗雷。那些留在吉尔尼斯城中，让我们能够活下来的人。他们的死也是“既定程序”？"
G["Tell me, do your feel prepared to face the challenge I have laid out for you? The spirits tell me that you will pass, but do you have faith in them or in yourself?"]="Dime, ¿te sientes $gpreparado:preparada; para afrontar el reto que te he dispuesto? Los espíritus me dicen que lo superarás, pero ¿tienes fe en ellos o en ti $gmismo:misma;?"
G["Tell me, dragon child: What is the nature of wisdom?"]="告诉我，巨龙之子：什么是智慧？"
G["Tell me, how goes the battle up above? What of Nazgrim? Speak to me!"]="告诉我，上面的战斗怎么样了？纳兹戈林呢？告诉我！"
G["Tell me, son of the Earth-Warder: What is the nature of hope?"]="告诉我，大地守护者之子：什么是希望？"
G["Tell me, what has happened here?"]="告诉我，这里发生了什么事？"
G["Tell me, what is this charm you're using?"]="告诉我，你用的是什么魔法？"
G["Tell me, young prince: What is the nature of strength?"]="告诉我，年轻的王子：什么是力量？"
G["Tell me... tell me everything!"]="告诉我……告诉我所有的事情！"
G["Tell my family...\n\nMy last thoughts were of them..."]="请转告我的家人……\n\n我临死前还记挂着他们……"
G["Tell my husband I love him very much!"]="请转告我的妻子，我很爱她！"
G["Tell my story."]="说说我的故事吧。"
G["Tell my story..."]="说说我的故事吧……"
G["Tell my wife I love her very much!"]="请转告我的妻子，我很爱她！"
G["Tell that to the farmer that told me. Poor guy lost all his crops to the invaders."]="把我所知道的转告给那个农夫。可怜的家伙在遭受入侵时失去了他所有的庄稼。"
G["Tell the Warden this prison is ours now!"]="告诉典狱官，这座监狱现在是我们的地盘了！"
G["Tell the mystic that his people are to stand and fight alongside the Horde and Alliance against the forces of Malygos and the Lich King."]="告诉秘法师，卡鲁亚克氏族必须与部落和联盟并肩战斗，共同抵抗玛里苟斯和巫妖王的军队。"
G["Tell the warchief it isn't my fault! My guys fought back with mallets or whatever they had at hand, I swear!"]="去告诉酋长，这不是我的错！我的兄弟们抓起木槌或是手边可用的一切武器奋起回击，我发誓！"
G["Tell them that I am free of my father's madness, and I will be free of them as well. I am to be left alone: this will be my first and only warning."]="告诉他们，我是自由的。我没有受到父亲疯狂的影响，也不会成为红龙的囚徒。别来打扰我：这是我第一次也是唯一的警告。"
G["Tell us about your captors, Gurrok."]="告诉我们是谁把你抓住的，古罗克。"
G["Tell us again how you slew the yaungol war leader, $n."]="再给我们讲讲吧，你是怎么杀死野牛人战争领袖的，$n。"
G["Tell us again why this island is so unique?"]="说说看，这里为何如此奇特？"
G["Tell us more, Martik. What is it? What does it feel like?"]="玛提克，快说下去。那是什么？感觉怎么样？"
G["Tell us!  Where does your leader hide?"]="告诉我们! 你们的首领躲在哪里？"
G["Tell us, Ambassador Kelemar... how do the blood elves plan to aid us, exactly?"]="告诉我们，克雷玛尔大使……血精灵们到底准备怎么样来帮助我们？"
G["Tell ya what Sully, tell me all about him over a mug of ale when we get back."]="听着苏利，我们回去之后得好好喝一杯，到时候把与他有关的一切都说给我听。"
G["Tell ya what, me crewmen are drinkin' wherever ale can be found in this city. If ya can convince 'em to give up their ales and take up their guns, count me in!"]="我跟你说，我的船员们已经快把这城里的酒都给喝干了。要是你能劝他们放下酒杯，重新拿起枪，那我就入你的伙！"
G["Tell ya what, mon. You take a little taste so I know ya ain't tryin' ta poison me. Then I'll drink."]="朋友，你是不是先喝上一口，证明这不是毒药？那样我才会喝的。"
G["Tell you nothing, preacher."]="我不会告诉你的，你这神棍。"
G["Tell you what, hon.  If you help me get all of this unpacked, we can both take a breather.  Deal?"]="亲爱的，听我说。如果你能帮我把这些东西拆开，我们就能好好休息一下了。怎么样？"
G["Tell your admiral that if this works, my ship and crew will be at her command."]="告诉你们的将军，如果这药有效，我的船只和船员就任她调遣。"
G["Tell your rune-smiths to continue converting what stone giants you can. Those that will not submit must be destroyed."]="告诉你手下的符文铁匠，必须加紧改造石巨人。摧毁那些不服从指令的家伙。"
G["Tell yourself again that these are not truly your friends."]="告诉你自己，这些人并不是你真正的朋友。"
G["Telredor has seen more change in the last 20 years than it did in prior centuries. I cannot complain, $n, for the world has changed far more in that time.\n\nThe Light has brought me friends and companions I could not have met as a cloistered priest. Learn what you can of the past in your time here. It will help you to understand where your journey is leading you."]="Telredor ha cambiado más en los últimos veinte años que en los siglos pasados. Yo no me quejo, $n; no es la primera vez que cambia el mundo.\n\nLa Luz me ha traído amigos y compañeros que no habría conocido como monje de clausura. Aprende lo que puedas del pasado mientras estás aquí."
G["Telredor was once a secluded retreat for draenei priests and pilgrims. The resident priests seldom received visitors.\n\nWhen the orcs started to attack draenei settlements, refugees began to arrive in larger numbers. Anchorite Ahuurn and the others transformed Telredor from a shrine into a safe haven. Many draenei, myself included, owe our survival to his efforts."]="泰雷多尔对德莱尼人牧师和朝圣者来说曾经是个隐密的据点。很少会有人拜访这些隐居的牧师。\n\n当兽人开始攻击德莱尼人的时候，难民的数量多到无法想象。学者安霍尔和其他人把泰雷多尔从一座神殿转变成了一处避风港。很多德莱尼人，包括我自己，都很感谢他为拯救我们的生命所做出的一切。"
G["Temple guardians are no longer present. Plant forms associated with temple are deceased."]="未发现神殿守护者。与神殿伴生的植物形态已经死亡。"
G["Temple guardians verified to be deceased. Sulfurous odor suggests that death resulted from a fire-based entity."]="神殿守卫者已经死亡。弥漫神殿的硫磺气味表明他是被某种火焰生物杀死的。"
G["Temple of Invention analysis commencing."]="开始对创世神殿进行分析。"
G["Temple of Invention verified to be intact."]="创世神殿完好无损。"
G["Temple of Life analysis commencing."]="开始对生命神殿进行分析。"
G["Temple of Life verified to be damaged beyond repair."]="生命神殿遭到破坏，无法修复。"
G["Temple of Order analysis commencing."]="开始对秩序神殿进行分析。"
G["Temple of Order verified to be in tact."]="秩序神殿完好无损。"
G["Temple of Winter analysis commencing."]="开始对寒冬神殿进行分析。"
G["Temple of Winter verified to be in tact."]="寒冬神殿完好无损。"
G["Temple of the Jade Serpent, a level 85-87 dungeon in the Jade Forest, is now available for testing. Please be in your full group before teleporting to the dungeon. Meeting Stones are not available for this dungeon yet.\nTo leave Temple of the Jade Serpent, simply exit through the normal exit inside the dungeon and you will be teleported out. If you die and release, you should teleport back from this NPC."]="El Templo del Dragón de Jade, una mazmorra de nivel 85-87 en el Bosque de Jade, ya está disponible para prueba. Antes de teletransportarte a la mazmorra, asegúrate de que el grupo está formado. Las rocas de encuentro para esta mazmorra todavía no están disponibles.\n\nPara abandonar el Templo del Dragón de Jade, simplemente sal por la salida normal dentro de la mazmorra y te teletransportarás. Si mueres y liberas espíritu, puedes teletransportarte de nuevo con este PNJ."
G["Ten minutes? Plenty of time to disarm the device."]="十分钟？足够拆除这个装置了。"
G["Ten silver says I can hit Honor Hold with this boulder!"]="我赌十个银币，我能把这块石头扔到荣耀堡！"
G["Ten thousand and one."]="一万零一次。"
G["Ten thousand strikes, every day."]="一万次，每天。"
G["Ten thousand years ago demons first breached this world, just as they had the orc homeworld of Draenor. They flooded across the terrain in legion. The great ancients of Azeroth helped the mortal races to mount a desperate defense.\n\nThe tenacity of Lo'Gosh in these dark days became the stuff of legend. He feared no demon. He would wade into their ranks, fangs bared and spattered with their vile ichor, his great claws thrashing them by the dozen...\n\nHis stand against the demons inspires us all. We can all learn from his example."]="一万年前，恶魔首次侵入了我们的世界，就像他们夺取兽人的家园德拉诺一样。他们鱼贯而入，将战火蔓延到了各个角落。艾泽拉斯伟大的远古半神们帮助凡间种族拼死抵抗。\n\n洛戈什的坚忍战力便是在这段最黑暗的日子里成为了传奇。他对恶魔毫无畏惧。他会冲进敌阵，尖牙沾满敌人肮脏的血液，他的利爪会一下刺穿数十个敌人……\n\n他不屈于恶魔的勇武精神激励着我们每一个人。我们都能从他身上汲取能量。"
G["Ten thousand years ago, the last Pandaren Emperor came seeking my advice. He, too, was filled with conflict. Let us see if you are correct, Taran. Let us see how this stranger deals with turmoil of the soul."]="一万年前，末代熊猫人皇帝曾向我讨教治国之道。他也是一个充满矛盾的人。让我们看看你是否正确，踏岚。看看这个陌生人如何应对灵魂的骚动。"
G["Ten thousand years ago, when the demons of the Burning Legion invaded Azeroth, the ancients fought side-by-side with the mortal races. Many of the ancients met their end by the Legion's hand. Cenarius would've been killed as well, were it not for the actions of his father, Malorne.\n\nThe mighty stag leapt into battle, his hooves crashing down on demon skulls and his antlers piercing their fiery flesh.\n\nThen Archimonde the Defiler took to the field of battle. After a fierce fight, he seized Malorne by his antlers and... and snapped the ancient's neck.\n\nBut as long as there's life in the world, can a force of nature like Malorne ever truly die?"]="一万年前，远古半神与凡人种族并肩作战，共同抵御入侵艾泽拉斯世界的燃烧军团。许多半神死于燃烧军团之手。塞纳留斯也差点被杀，但他的父亲，玛洛恩舍身救下了他。\n\n强大的雄鹿纵身跃入战场，他的巨蹄碾碎了恶魔的颅骨，他的鹿角刺穿了无数恶魔的身躯。\n\n但随后，污染者阿克蒙德现身了。一场恶战之后，他攫住了玛洛恩的鹿角……扭断了这位半神的脖子。\n\n但只要世间还有生命在绽放，像玛洛恩这样的自然之力怎么会真正死去呢？"
G["Ten thousand!? Outrageous! I'll kill you while you sleep!"]="一万金！？你这是抢劫！我非趁你睡觉的时候杀了你不可！"
G["Ten years. I have faithfully brushed yak for ten years."]="十年了。我任劳任怨地刷牦牛十年了。"
G["Tenacious Pet"]="坚韧宠物"
G["Tenaron, old friend. Would you go collect a vial of moonwell water for this $c?"]="Tenaron, viejo amigo. ¿Te importaría recoger un vial de agua de la Poza de la Luna para $geste:esta; $c?"
G["Tend to the injuries of the wounded, sisters!"]="姐妹们，照顾那些受伤的士兵！"
G["Tend to the wounded! This isn't over yet."]="保护伤员！战斗还没完呢。"
G["Tender your souls, mortals! These are the halls of the dead!"]="啊，没错。交出你们的灵魂吧，凡人！这里是亡者的殿堂！"
G["Tenebron begins to hatch eggs in the Twilight!"]="塔尼布隆开始孵蛋！"
G["Tenebron! The eggs are yours to protect as well!"]="塔尼布隆！你也有保护龙卵的责任！"
G["Tenebron, Vesperon, and Halion."]="塔尼布隆、维斯匹隆和海里昂。"
G["Tenebron, Vesperon, and Shadron."]="塔尼布隆、维斯匹隆和沙德隆。"
G["Tenwu the Red Smoke greets you."]="“赤烟”腾武向你问好。"
G["Tepa is renown for her clothwork.  She can be found at Thunder Bluff Armorers on the middle rise."]="坦帕以她制作的衣物而闻名，你可以在中部高地的雷霆崖防具店找到她。"
G["Terenas had a son named Arthas."]="泰瑞纳斯有一个儿子，名叫阿尔萨斯。"
G["Terenthis, Raene sent me to find you. The Sentinels are in need of help in Ashenvale."]="特伦希斯和莱恩派我来找你。灰谷的哨兵需要帮助。"
G["Terminate $ghim:her;."]="干掉$g他:她;。"
G["Teron Gorefiend."]="塔隆·血魔。"
G["Teron Gorefiend? Yes... I know of him."]="塔隆·血魔？没错……我认识他。"
G["Terramok is my home, not my prison. The remains of my beloved make it so."]="泰拉莫克是我的家园，而不是我的牢狱。造就它的正是我曾经钟爱的一切。"
G["Terrapin Oil Sample"]="龟油样本"
G["Terrible business!\n\nThere was a horrific growling noise that seemed to echo throught the region.\n\nPoor fellow...\n\nYou'll excuse me - I do believe I need a drink."]="太可怕了！\n\n整个地区都在回响着令人毛骨悚然的咆哮声。\n\n可怜的家伙……\n\n请原谅——我想我得来一杯。"
G["Terrible destruction awaits you when this seed erupts."]="当这颗种子发芽时，可怕的毁灭将等着你。"
G["Terrible news, everyone. Rotface is dead, but great news everyone! He left behind plenty of ooze for me to use! What? I'm a poet and I didn't know it... Astounding!"]="惊天噩耗，我作的腐面，刚刚死了。但重大喜讯，他留下了，大量软泥！哇，我居然还有这么出众的诗歌才华……雷死了！"
G["Terrible thing, what happened to them mules... Metz is gonna have my hide for this failure."]="太可怕了，这些骡子到底怎么了……要是这样下去，梅兹会把我剥了皮的。"
G["Terrible!"]="糟透了！"
G["Terrible, but don't tell him I said so. Vermins is running everywhere. Crops ain't growing. And something keeps eating the harvest."]="太可怕了，但别告诉他我说过这样的话。兔妖到处肆虐。庄稼也长不出来。还有东西在不断地吞吃着收成。"
G["Terrific! That went down nice and clean."]="干得好！一切顺利。"
G["Terror, darkness, power? The Forsaken crave not these things; the Forsaken ARE these things."]="恐惧，黑暗，还有力量？被遗忘者并不渴望这些东西，被遗忘者就是这些东西。"
G["Tesoran! I need someone--Falgran Hastil, preferably--to take care of $n's lead on the prints near the Shady Rest Inn."]="泰索兰！我需要一些人，最好是法格兰·哈斯迪尔，到树荫旅店附近去调查一下$n发现的那些蹄印。"
G["Test"]="测试"
G["Test not my patience, mortal."]="凡人，别考验我的耐性。"
G["Test your aim! Test your aim!"]="试试你的准头吧！试试你的准头吧！"
G["Test your might!"]="试试你的力量！"
G["Test your skill, win a prize!"]="展示你的技巧，赢得精美奖品！"
G["Test."]="测试。"
G["Test02"]="Prueba02"
G["Testing 1"]="Probando 1"
G["Testing 2"]="Probando 2"
G["Testing 3"]="Probando 3"
G["Testing, 1... 2... 3!"]="测试，1…2…3！"
G["Testing, testing, 1, 2, 7. Can you hear me $p? I have deployed Scout-o-meters in the field to gather data for the Siege-o-Matic here. This should help with a proper and mostly non-lethal test of my Siege-o-Matic."]="开始测试，开始测试，1，2，7。你能听见吗，$p？我已经在这里布置了探查器以帮助自动攻城器收集数据。这将帮助我的自动攻城器完成一次充分且通常不致命的测试。"
G["Testing..."]="测试……"
G["Tests?  What kind of tests?"]="测试？什么测试？"
G["Tether-footbomb!"]="链式足球炸弹！"
G["Th-there's no way, sir! The current... it's too strong!"]="这、这不可能，长官！水流……太急了！"
G["Th... thank you."]="谢……谢谢你。"
G["Th... thank you.  I thought I was going to die."]="谢……谢谢你。我原以为我会死的。"
G["Tha Darkspear are 'ere because I led dem here.  Orgrimmar be no home as long as it be under Hellscream's hand."]="是我带领暗矛部族来到这儿。但现在奥格瑞玛已经不再是我们的家了。"
G["Tha Darkspear shall never give in to ya kind, Zar'jira. We're stronga' than you'll eva' be."]="暗矛部族绝不会再次屈服，女海巫。我们的力量远远超过了你的想象。"
G["Tha Sea Witch is dead, our home is reclaimed, but our future still be uncertain."]="女海巫死了，我们夺回了家园，但我们的未来仍然充满未知数。"
G["Tha elements be crying out in rage. It ain't no coincidence dat da naga are here. Dey be wantin' someting."]="元素在愤怒的咆哮着。这与纳迦的到来一定不会是巧合。他们一定在等待着什么。"
G["Tha naga and de Twilight Cult be workin' together, and dis be the focus of dey're efforts."]="纳迦正在和暮光教派合作，而这就是他们努力的焦点所在。"
G["Tha's the way we Wildhammer ... get hitched, it was. *hic* That were BEAUTIFUL!"]="我们蛮锤部族缔结百年之好……正像那样。（嗝儿）简直太美了！"
G["Thaddius, built from the flesh of women and children, it is said that their souls are fused together - eternally bound within that foul prison of flesh."]="塔迪乌斯，用女人与孩子的血肉缝合而成的巨人。据说他们的灵魂也融入塔迪乌斯体内，永远被禁锢在这肮脏的囚牢中。"
G["Thalorien fell before the gates of the Sunwell, buying time for others to escape."]="为掩护族人逃生，萨洛瑞安在太阳之井的大门前壮烈牺牲。"
G["Thane Banahogg appears upon the overlook to the southeast!"]="巴纳霍格领主出现在东南方的高台上！"
G["Thane Banahogg returns to Valhalas for the first time in ages to prove that the vrykul are the only beings worthy to fight within its sacred ring.  Will $n prove him wrong?"]="数个世纪后，巴纳霍格领主首次重返瓦哈拉斯。他要证明，只有维库人才有资格在这片圣地上战斗。$n能证明他错了吗？"
G["Thane Banahogg the Deathblow has fallen to $n and $g his : her; fighting companions.  $G He : She; has but one challenge ahead of $g him : her;.  Who will it be?"]="El señor feudal Banahogg, la \"Arremetida mortal\", ha caído ante $n y sus compañeros de lucha. Ya solo le queda un desafío por delante. ¿Quién será?"
G["Thane Illskar, you were challenged to honorable combat and failed."]="伊尔斯卡领主，你接受了公平决斗的挑战，并且输了。"
G["Thane Torvald Eriksson's temperamental proto-drake is chained up here."]="托瓦德·埃里克森领主的始祖龙被锁链拴在这儿，它是一只脾气暴躁、喜怒无常的凶兽。"
G["Thane Ufrang the Mighty, I bear ill news. The Shadow Vault over the mountain to the east has fallen."]="强大的乌弗朗领主，有个坏消息要告诉你。东边的暗影拱顶沦陷了。"
G["Thank Shen-zin Su that you're here.  I could use your help!"]="感谢神真子你来了。我需要你帮忙！"
G["Thank again, $n.  Now I'll just wait here until it's safe to leave."]="$n，我要再次对你表示感谢。现在我会留在这里，等安全了再离开。"
G["Thank da elements..."]="感谢元素…"
G["Thank goodness for you!"]="太感谢你了！"
G["Thank goodness for you!  Claw and I were investigating this place when we were jumped by Swamplord Musel'ek.\n\nUnfortunately, Claw was caught in bear form at the time, and is now the swamplord's pet.\n\nI'm afraid you'll have to fight Claw in order to save him."]="谢天谢地多亏有了你！克劳恩和我正在调查这个地方时，沼地领主穆塞雷克突然出现在我们面前。\n\n不幸的是，克劳恩被他抓住了，而且他当时正在熊形态下，现在他变成沼地领主的宠物了。\n\n如果你要去救克劳恩的话，恐怕得跟他打一架。"
G["Thank goodness you arrived when you did, heroes. Orgrim's Hammer has already left. Quickly now, to the Skybreaker! If you leave soon, you may be able to catch them."]="谢天谢地，你们终于来了，英雄们。奥格瑞姆之锤号已经离开了。赶快到破天号去！也许你们还能乘上那艘船。"
G["Thank goodness you came along when you did. Please, take one of these troll boxes to remember me by."]="谢谢你救了我。请收下这只巨魔货箱，就当作我们之间的回忆吧。"
G["Thank goodness you got here, it was almost dinner time!"]="感谢你的仁慈，晚饭时间快到了！"
G["Thank goodness you recovered the brew, $n! Since our work is done for the day, I'd say it's time to start drinking!"]="谢天谢地，你终于把酒找回来了，$n！既然今天的任务已经完成，是时候开怀畅饮了！"
G["Thank goodness you're here!  Toss that fishing pole and help us out!"]="谢天谢地，你来了！快把钓鱼竿扔下来，把我们救出去！"
G["Thank goodness!"]="谢天谢地！"
G["Thank goodness! I was worried they were going to press me into service in their war against the stone giants!"]="谢天谢地！我正担心他们会不会强迫我去对付石巨人呢！"
G["Thank goodness, you look like a capable $c with some brains."]="Menos mal, pareces $gun:una; $c bastante capaz y con algo de cerebro."
G["Thank heavens!  It's so good to see...  Why are your pants on backwards?"]="感谢上帝！见到你真高兴……你裤子怎么穿反了？"
G["Thank the Earth Mother!"]="感谢大地母亲！"
G["Thank the Light for granting me another chance. And thank you, $n."]="感谢圣光再次赐予我机会。同样谢谢你，$n。"
G["Thank the Light for seeing you here safely! We have much work to do if we are to defeat the Lich King and put an end to the Scourge."]="感谢圣光，你安然无恙！为了消灭巫妖王和天灾军团，我们还有很多事要做。"
G["Thank the Light for that."]="感谢圣光。"
G["Thank the Light for you!"]="感谢圣光！"
G["Thank the Light the Defias don't know the first thing about diving!"]="感谢圣光，迪菲亚的那帮家伙对潜水一窍不通。"
G["Thank the Light you're here! Get your sword out, there's centaur on my tail!"]="感谢圣光，你终于来了！拔出你的剑，有几个半人马在追杀我！"
G["Thank the Light you're here, $n.  Something has gone horribly wrong and our leader is killing everyone!"]="感谢圣光，你终于来了，$n。这里出了大问题，我们的头领正在大肆屠杀！"
G["Thank the Light!"]="感谢圣光！"
G["Thank the Light! I'll never do anything this foolish again!"]="感谢圣光！我绝不会再干这种蠢事了！"
G["Thank the Light! I'm parched!"]="感谢圣光！我真是渴坏了！"
G["Thank the Light! I'm saved!"]="感谢圣光！我得救了！"
G["Thank the Light! I've made it."]="感谢圣光！我成功了。"
G["Thank the Light, $n, my leg is completely healed!"]="感谢圣光，$n。我的腿已经痊愈了！"
G["Thank the heavens... I thought the secrets of Firebough Stout would die with me. Help me out of here, friend!"]="感谢上天……我原本以为自己要把火树烈酒的秘方带进棺材了呢。快帮我离开这儿，朋友！"
G["Thank the laws of physics you're here!"]="感谢物理法则，你可来了！"
G["Thank the light that Bertha's not here..."]="感谢圣光，波尔塔不在这里……"
G["Thank the light you are here! I'd accept help from a two-headed ogre at this point.\nThe city has been overrun by troggs! The attempts to wipe them out resulted in mass contamination. But there is still hope.\nOur scientists who evacuated to Ironforge are working on a cure for the fallout sickness. Meanwhile, if you can help me stop the trogg invasion, perhaps the city can be retaken."]="¡Gracias a la Luz que estás aquí! En estos momentos aceptaría ayuda de un ogro de dos cabezas.\n\n¡La ciudad está invadida por troggs! Los intentos por eliminarlos provocó una contaminación masiva. Pero hay esperanzas.\n\nNuestros científicos que fueron evacuados a Forjaz están trabajando en curar las enfermedades producidas por la lluvia radiactiva. Mientras tanto, si puedes ayudarme a detener la invasión de los troggs, quizás entonces podamos recuperar la ciudad."
G["Thank the sea, stranger! I can get back to Sri-La village on my own."]="¡Gracias al mar, $gforastero:forastera;! Puedo volver solo a la Aldea Sri-La."
G["Thank the spirits for you, brothers and sisters. The Skybreaker has already left. Quickly now, to Orgrim's Hammer! If you leave soon, you may be able to catch them."]="感谢你们，我的兄弟姐妹。破天号已经启程了。快到奥格瑞姆之锤去！也许你们还能乘上那艘船。"
G["Thank the spirits!  The blizzard will slow down the kvadir ships!"]="感谢灵魂！暴风雪会减慢克瓦迪尔船只的航速！"
G["Thank the stars!  Now turn around so I can put them on."]="感谢辰星！现在请转过身去，让我穿上。"
G["Thank the waves, you're back! The others have already retreated, we need to get out of here!"]="感谢海浪的庇护，你终于回来了！别人都已经撤退，我们得离开这儿！"
G["Thank ya for aidin' us in our battle."]="感谢你帮助我们作战。"
G["Thank ya for your guidance, spirits."]="感谢你们的指引，伟大的英灵。"
G["Thank ya, scout. Keep up da patrols. But for now, a rest is in order. Dismissed."]="谢谢你，哨兵。你还要继续巡逻的工作。不过现在你应该去休息一下。解散。"
G["Thank ya, scout. Tell de builders dey be needed on de isles. De Darkspears be home again!"]="谢谢你，侦察兵。告诉那些建筑工人，这片群岛需要他们。暗矛部族将重建家园！"
G["Thank ye for saving me, $p! I owe ya a big one."]="多谢你救了我，$p！我欠你个大人情。"
G["Thank ye!"]="谢谢你！"
G["Thank ye, $G lad:lass;. Thank ye, greatly."]="谢谢你，$g小伙子:姑娘;。非常感谢。"
G["Thank you $g mister : miss; for finding my necklace!  You're the best!"]="谢谢你，$g先生:小姐;，你找到了我的项链！你是最棒的！"
G["Thank you - both of you. The Red Crane has always symbolized hope to our people, but in his absence I fear that even my thoughts began to darken."]="谢谢，谢谢你们两位。对我的族人来说，朱鹤始终象征着希望，没有了他，就连我的思绪也开始变得晦暗。"
G["Thank you - this was turning into a massacre..."]="谢谢。我们已经损失惨重……"
G["Thank you Elders. We will not dissapoint you."]="长者，谢谢你们。我们一定不负所望。"
G["Thank you Nablya."]="谢谢你，娜博亚。"
G["Thank you again for helping Nida, $g mister : miss;!  When I grow up, I wanna be a hero just like you!"]="再次感谢你帮助希拉里，$g先生:小姐;！我长大了也要成为你这样的英雄！"
G["Thank you again for replenishing our healing crystals.  I hear that you're helping out all over the place.  Keep up the good work!"]="再次感谢你为我们补充了治疗水晶。我听说你在到处帮忙，加油！"
G["Thank you again for your aid, $n. Our children have returned safe, and your enemies have turned tail.\n\nAs far as I'm concerned, you and your Horde are always welcome here in Pandaria."]="再次感谢你的帮助，$n。我们的孩子都已安全返回，敌人也已经四散而逃。\n\n对我来说，随时欢迎你和你的部落造访潘达利亚。"
G["Thank you again for your aid. May the wind always be at your back during your travels."]="再次感谢你的帮助。祝你一路顺风。"
G["Thank you again for your help, stranger. I have already begun to think of ideas on the ring I shall craft for Syra's hand."]="Gracias de nuevo por tu ayuda, $gforastero:forastera;. Ya he empezado a pensar en el anillo que forjaré para Syra."
G["Thank you again for your help. I will remain here briefly, to help tend the wounded.\n\nThen I will be making my way north..."]="再次感谢你的帮助。我会暂时留在这里，帮忙照料伤患。\n\n然后我会向北行进……"
G["Thank you again, $n, for helping me to uncover what happened here at the thicket."]="$n，再次感谢你帮我找出了树林里这件惨剧的真相。"
G["Thank you again, $n, for this delectable incense."]="$n，再次感谢你为我带来这么好闻的熏香。"
G["Thank you again, $n.  This rare earth will be very helpful in my experiments."]="再次感谢你，$n。这些稀土对我的实验帮助很大。"
G["Thank you again, $n. I'll make my way to the road now. When you can, find Terenthis and let him know we escaped."]="再次感谢你，$n。我现在要上路了。如果可以的话，请你去找特伦希斯，告诉他我已经安全逃脱了。"
G["Thank you again, Terenthis. I shall return again if more help is needed. Until then, please send more adventurers to Ashenvale"]="再次感谢你，特伦希斯。如果你需要帮助，我会再次回来。在此之前，请派遣更多的冒险者到灰谷去。"
G["Thank you again, friend. We will remember your name in our people's history."]="Gracias de nuevo, $gamigo:amiga;. Recordaremos tu nombre en la historia de nuestro pueblo."
G["Thank you again.  I will return to Razor Hill now."]="再次感谢你。现在我要返回剃刀岭了。"
G["Thank you all for attending this sermon. It's wonderful to see so many familiar faces!"]="感谢大家参加此次布道会。看到这么多熟悉的面孔真是令人欣慰！"
G["Thank you all for coming tonight.  Now put your hands together to welcome Shattrath's best, Perry Gatner!"]="感谢大家光临。现在请鼓掌欢迎沙塔斯城最棒的——派瑞·加奈尔！"
G["Thank you and farewell, friend. I must return to the Argent Vanguard."]="Gracias y adiós, $gamigo:amiga;. He de volver a La Vanguardia Argenta."
G["Thank you everyone!  And keep clapping, there is a fly in here and one of you are bound to get it!  Good night!"]="感谢大家！继续鼓掌，那里有只苍蝇，你们中一定要有人把它拍下来！晚安！"
G["Thank you for agreeing to help. Now, let's get out of here, $n!"]="谢谢你愿意伸出援手，现在让我们离开这里，$n！"
G["Thank you for all that you have done for us.  May you rest in peace."]="谢谢你为我们所做的一切。愿你安息。"
G["Thank you for allowing me to speak, A'dal. I know many of your allies despise me and my knights for our treatment of M'uru."]="阿达尔，感谢您能给我这么一个说话的机会。我知道您的支持者们大多都厌恶我和我的手下对待穆鲁的方式。"
G["Thank you for allowing me to visit, $n.  You have a very colorful soul, but it's a little brighter than I prefer... or I might have stayed longer!"]="谢谢你肯让我洞察你的内心，$n。你的灵魂很有趣，只是比我想象得要聪明许多……不然我还会多待一会儿的！"
G["Thank you for becoming my next victim!"]="谢谢你成为我的下一个祭品！"
G["Thank you for breaking me out of here!"]="谢谢你把我从这儿弄出来！"
G["Thank you for bringing back Yi-Mo.\n\nIt's clear to me now that we can no longer ignore our duties in the province."]="谢谢你把易默带回来。\n\n我现在明白了，我们再也不能忽视自己在这里的职责。"
G["Thank you for bringing me here to see my friend, Hch'uu!"]="感谢你带我到这里来看望哈克乌！"
G["Thank you for bringing my driver back, friend."]="Gracias por devolverme al conductor, $gamigo:amiga;."
G["Thank you for checking in with me, $c. We now have all of the thorium bars that we'll need, but you may want to ask some of the others here that are in charge of different collection efforts."]="谢谢你，$c。我们已经集齐了所需的瑟银锭了，但是你可以问问这儿收集其他作战物资的负责人。"
G["Thank you for choosing the Bank of Silvermoon. What may I do for you today?"]="感谢你选择了银月城银行。今天我能为你做些什么？"
G["Thank you for clearing out those foolish senators.  Now prepare to meet your doom at the hands of Ragnaros' most powerful servant."]="感谢你清除了这些愚蠢的议员。去面对拉格纳罗斯最强大的仆人吧，看看你的命运如何。"
G["Thank you for coming here in remembrance of me.  Your efforts in recovering that symbol, while unnecessary, are certainly touching to an old man's heart."]="感谢你专程来纪念我。你找回了这个印记——虽然它并没有什么实际的意义，但是仍然让我心里感到很温暖。"
G["Thank you for coming so quickly, $n."]="谢谢你这么快赶到，$n。"
G["Thank you for coming, everyone!"]="谢谢大家能来！"
G["Thank you for delivering that list!  My leg is almost recovered enough that I'll be able to walk back to the crash site."]="谢谢你帮忙递交清单！我的腿差不多已经痊愈，这样我就可以自己走回坠毁点了。"
G["Thank you for doing this, $r. I... I think I know how to get back to my father. Please don't let the bad things hurt me."]="谢谢你，$r。我……我知道如何才能回到父亲身边。请保护我，别让我受到伤害。"
G["Thank you for freeing Thrall, $n. He's been missed.\n\n<Aggra looks over at the Warchief.>"]="Gracias por liberar a Thrall, $n. Le hemos echado de menos.\n\n<Aggra mira al Jefe de Guerra.>"
G["Thank you for freeing me of that horrible burden."]="谢谢你把我从那种可怕的梦魇中解救出来。"
G["Thank you for freeing me!"]="谢谢你让我重获自由！"
G["Thank you for freeing me! May the tides always favor you."]="谢谢你救了我！愿好运永远伴随你。"
G["Thank you for freeing me, $Gbrother:sister;. I cannot let you fight alone."]="Gracias por liberarme, $ghermano:hermana;. No puedo dejar que luches $gsolo:sola;."
G["Thank you for freeing me, $Gbrother:sister;. I could not have survived another day of the yaungol's cruelty."]="谢谢你救了我，我的$g兄弟:姐妹;。我本来以为要死在残忍的野牛人手中了。"
G["Thank you for freeing me, $n! I'm going to make my way to Shattrath!"]="谢谢你解救了我，$n！我马上就回沙塔斯城去！"
G["Thank you for freeing me, $n. Now let's get out of here!"]="感谢你解救了我，$n。现在让我们离开这里！"
G["Thank you for freeing me, my brother, and all of you! We can finally rest in peace now."]="谢谢你让我重获自由，我的兄弟，感谢你们大家！现在我们能安然长眠了。"
G["Thank you for freeing me, my sister, and all of you! We can finally rest in peace now."]="谢谢你们让我和姐姐重获自由！我们终于可以安息了。"
G["Thank you for freeing me.  Speak with my sister in Splintertree.  I... I must find a place to rest..."]="谢谢你给我自由。去碎木岗哨找我的姐妹谈谈。我……我必须找个地方休息……"
G["Thank you for freeing me. I thought I was done for."]="谢谢你救了我。我还以为自己死定了呢。"
G["Thank you for freeing us, mortals.  Beware, the blue flight is alerted to your presence.  Even now, Malygos sends Varos Cloudstrider and his ring guardians to defend the Oculus.  You will need our help to stand a chance."]="感谢你们，凡人。蓝龙军团已经察觉到你们的动向，你们要当心。眼下，玛里苟斯任命瓦尔洛斯·云击率领碧蓝魔环卫士死守魔环。请接受我们的帮助，这样才有机会击败敌人。"
G["Thank you for getting me out of there!"]="感谢你把我救出来！"
G["Thank you for helping Thrall escape, friends. Now I only hope you can help me as well. I awoke this morning to find myself trapped in this magical prison. A strange wizard told me that I would have to stay here for a while."]="感谢你们帮助萨尔逃脱，朋友们。现在我只希望你们同样能帮我。我早上醒来时，发现自己被囚禁在这个魔法监牢中。一个奇怪的巫师告诉我，我必须在这里待一段时间。"
G["Thank you for helping me end the great mistake I made long ago, that led our people into this dark place. I could not do it alone. Let me regain my honor, and end Garrosh's reign of terror once and for all."]="谢谢你来帮助我纠正过去所犯下的错误，是它将我们的人民推入了黑暗的深渊。我一个人是无法成功的。现在，我就要赢回自己的荣誉，并彻底终结加尔鲁什的恐怖统治。"
G["Thank you for helping me to get back to the camp. Go tell Walter that I'm safe now!"]="谢谢你帮我返回营地。请转告瓦尔特，就说我已经平安无事啦！"
G["Thank you for helping me. I know my way back from here."]="谢谢你帮助我。我知道从这里回去的路。"
G["Thank you for helping us and for helping Jim. If you see him, tell him little Jimmy and I love him and that we're waiting for him."]="谢谢你为吉姆和我们所做的一切。如果你遇见吉姆，请告诉他我和小吉米始终爱着他，我们一直在等他回家。"
G["Thank you for helping us with the flasks."]="感谢你为我们提供了合剂。"
G["Thank you for helping us, $n."]="谢谢你帮助我们，$n。"
G["Thank you for making the journey here. I hope you will find Silvermoon to your liking."]="感谢你来到这里。我希望你在银月城过得开心。"
G["Thank you for opening my eyes to who my daughter really is."]="谢谢你让我看清楚我自己的女儿。"
G["Thank you for opening the gates for us, $p. You honor us with your presence."]="感谢你为我们打开大门，$p。你的到来是我们的荣幸。"
G["Thank you for purifying the armaments yourself, $n. I have much to do and very little time to do it in."]="谢谢你帮我净化这些金属，$n。事情实在太多了，我根本没时间去做。"
G["Thank you for reminding me that I must train more diligently."]="多谢你的指点，我必须更加努力地修炼才行。"
G["Thank you for rescue! Meet me at Burlap Waystation."]="谢谢你的搭救！到粗麻驿站和我会合。"
G["Thank you for rescuing me stranger! I will see you at the Yakwash."]="¡Gracias por rescatarme, $gforastero:forastera;! Te veré en el lavadero de yaks."
G["Thank you for rescuing me! Word of your deed will not go unnoticed."]="感谢你救了我！你的事迹一定会被广为流传的。"
G["Thank you for rescuing me, $n. I will never forget your courage and determination."]="谢谢你救了我，$n。我永远不会忘记你的勇气和决心。"
G["Thank you for rescuing me, $r. Please tell the king that I am back."]="感谢你救了我，$r。请转告国王我回来了。"
G["Thank you for rescuing me, but the others are still held on the tiers above!"]="谢谢你救了我，我的同胞还被关押在上面几层！"
G["Thank you for rescuing me, now please aid the rest of my brood!"]="多谢你救了我，现在请你帮帮我其它的同胞！"
G["Thank you for rescuing me. For the Alliance!"]="谢谢你救了我。为了联盟！"
G["Thank you for rescuing me. I simply hate being a yucky frog!"]="谢谢你救了我。我讨厌变成青蛙！"
G["Thank you for rescuing the king... and the prince, $n."]="感谢你救出了国王……还有王子，$n。"
G["Thank you for rescuing us, $c. Hopefully now our mission will not be lost."]="谢谢你救了我们，$c。希望我们的任务不会以失败而告终。"
G["Thank you for returning Wolf."]="谢谢你为我带回了狼。"
G["Thank you for saving me from that nightmare. I wanted to rip everything apart!"]="谢谢你把我从那个噩梦中救出来。当时我真想把一切都毁了！"
G["Thank you for saving me the trouble. Now it's my turn to have some fun!"]="谢谢你们帮我省去不少麻烦。现在，该我来找找乐子了！"
G["Thank you for saving me!"]="谢谢你救了我！"
G["Thank you for saving me!\n\nI'm a cook and an alchemist from Stormwind.  I was here looking for local herbs and recipes for my uncle Angus when these quilboar captured me.  If you hadn't come around, I'm sure I'd have ended up in their stew pot!"]="谢谢你救了我！\n\n我是一名来自暴风城的厨师兼炼金师。我到这儿来是要帮我叔叔安古斯寻找草药和食物的，但是这些野猪人将我抓了起来。要不是你赶过来的话，我想我已经被它们煮着吃了。"
G["Thank you for saving me! But don't tell Ferli, ok? I said I busted out on my own!"]="谢谢你救了我！不过能不能别告诉费尔莉？我说是我自己逃出来的！"
G["Thank you for saving me, $g Mr. : Ms.; $n."]="谢谢你救了我， $n$g先生:女士;。"
G["Thank you for saving me, $n! My father will be delighted!"]="谢谢你救了我，$n！我父亲会很高兴的！"
G["Thank you for saving me, $n. This is the least that I could do to return the favor. Hold on tight. Here we go."]="谢谢你救了我，$n。这是我唯一能为你做的。握紧了，我们出发吧。"
G["Thank you for saving me, soldier. You too, young prince."]="感谢你救了我，士兵。也谢谢你，年轻的王子。"
G["Thank you for saving me, stranger."]="感谢你救了我，陌生人。"
G["Thank you for saving me. I'll make my way back to Orgrimmar once I recover a bit."]="感谢你救了我。等我恢复了体力，就会回到奥格瑞玛去。"
G["Thank you for saving my life and bringing me back to safety, $n!"]="感谢你救了我的命，并把我带回安全的地方，$n！"
G["Thank you for saving my life!"]="谢谢你救了我一命！"
G["Thank you for saving my life."]="谢谢你救了我的命。"
G["Thank you for saving my life. I owe you a debt of gratitude."]="谢谢你救了我。我欠你份人情。"
G["Thank you for saving us. We accidentally uncovered the pieces of Gearmaster Mechazod and reassembled him."]="谢谢你救了我们。我们偶然发现了机甲专家麦卡佐德的零件，并把他重新组装了起来。"
G["Thank you for speaking to the men, Almonen. They'll be better for it."]="感谢你的演讲，奥蒙纳。他们会铭记在心的。"
G["Thank you for taking care of the lake, the lashers and the owlkin, $c."]="Gracias por cuidar del lago, los azotadores y el buhíco, $c."
G["Thank you for taking the time to help us test the Cataclysm content for World of Warcraft. \nWhere would you like to go?"]="Gracias por tomarte el tiempo de ayudarnos a probar el contenido de World of Warcraft: Cataclysm.\n\n¿Adónde te gustaría ir?"
G["Thank you for that. Now let's take down that wall!"]="谢谢你。现在，让我们攻破那道城墙吧！"
G["Thank you for that... It was humbling to be served in such a manner."]="感谢你……这可真令我感到羞耻。"
G["Thank you for the armor scraps, $n!"]="谢谢你提供的护甲碎片，$n！"
G["Thank you for the blessing, $n."]="谢谢你的祝福，$n。"
G["Thank you for the gifts. Let us see if you are worthy, $c!"]="Gracias por los obsequios. ¡Veamos si eres $gdigno:digna;, $c!"
G["Thank you for the help. I'll go help with the wound."]="感谢你的帮助。我会去帮忙治疗伤口的。"
G["Thank you for the inquiry, $c, but as you can see, I already have all of the linen bandages that the Alliance feels is necessary in preparation for the war at Ahn'Qiraj. Don't let that stop you from helping out with the other collections going on here though."]="谢谢你，$c。但是我们已经集齐联盟在安其拉一战中所需的亚麻绷带了。你可以帮帮其他人收集战争物资。"
G["Thank you for the invitation, Lord Fordring. We look forward to observing these games."]="感谢您的邀请，弗丁大人。我们期待着精彩的比赛。"
G["Thank you for the masks, $n. Be at peace and take this blessing as a token of our thanks."]="谢谢你的面具，$n。请放心接受此祝福，以聊表我们的谢意。"
G["Thank you for the offer, $c.  Unfortunately you are not yet experienced enough to weather the hazards of Arathi Basin."]="感谢你的帮助，$c。不幸的是，你的经验不够丰富，无法承受阿拉希盆地的险恶环境。"
G["Thank you for the opportunity of getting beaten up by you."]="感谢你的指点。"
G["Thank you for the opportunity to demonstrate my skills."]="感谢你为我提供了展示技能的机会。"
G["Thank you for the opportunity. I shall report to Vol'jin with your regards."]="感谢你让我有机会痛快杀敌。我会向沃金报告你的功绩。"
G["Thank you for the spores, $n.  They are now prepared for transport."]="谢谢你收集的这些孢子，$n。"
G["Thank you for the summon, little one. My group left for the dungeon without me!"]="谢谢你召唤我，小家伙。我的队伍把我丢在这里，就直接跑进地下城了！"
G["Thank you for the supplies, $n."]="谢谢你提供的物资，$n。"
G["Thank you for the timely rescue, hero."]="感谢你及时出手相救，英雄。"
G["Thank you for the warning, $n. We will prepare our defenses."]="感谢你的提醒，$n。我们会做好防御准备的。"
G["Thank you for the warning. Be safe."]="谢谢你的警告。一路平安。"
G["Thank you for these badges, $n.  I will send news to the families of the deceased."]="谢谢你帮忙找回这些徽章，$n。我将通知阵亡者的家属。"
G["Thank you for thinking of a lonely old man, $n."]="谢谢你为一个孤独的老人着想，$n。"
G["Thank you for this report, $n.  It is now clear that we must tighten our patrols near Theramore."]="谢谢你的报告，$n。很明显，我们要加强在塞拉摩附近的巡逻。"
G["Thank you for trying, my friends. We'll unlock its secrets. Hopefully before it's too late."]="朋友们，谢谢你们的尝试。我们一定会揭开其中秘密，只希望一切不会太迟。"
G["Thank you for watching, everyone! If you'd be so kind as to bring your non-irradiated currency to tomorrow's performance, I'd appreciate it."]="感谢大家的观看！如果你们明天能带上一些零钱来看表演的话，我会非常感激的。"
G["Thank you for what you have done, $n.\n\nKeep the scepter safe; may it aid you in your toil against the evils that have invaded this place..."]="Gracias por lo que has hecho, $n.\n\nProtege el cetro. Que te ayude en tu lucha contra el mal que ha invadido este lugar..."
G["Thank you for your aid in this desperate time, $n.  May the Light grant you speed and strength in the face of darkness."]="$n，感谢你在危急关头伸出援手。当你面对黑暗时，愿圣光赐予你速度与力量。"
G["Thank you for your assistance, $n. As the leader of the blood elves, it is my duty to protect my people. It is not a responsibility to be taken lightly."]="感谢你的协助，$n。作为血精灵的领袖，保护人民是我的职责。这份责任不容轻忽。"
G["Thank you for your assistance, $n. You have helped me enough for today. I shall seek you at Domination Point if I have further need of you."]="感谢你的协助，$n。你今天已经帮了我们不少忙了。如果我还需要你的帮助，会去统御岗哨找你的。"
G["Thank you for your counsel. I will meditate on it deeply."]="感谢您的告诫。我会认真思考这个问题的。"
G["Thank you for your hard work and dedication. Unpaid overtime is approved for all!"]="感谢你的努力工作和无私奉献。没有报酬的加班对所有人都应该是最合适的安排！"
G["Thank you for your help - these notes are important to my studies. Your people value knowledge too, yes? I assume so, only because you arrived on a great airship."]="感谢你的帮助——这些笔记对我的研究至关重要。你的人民也同样重视知识吗？我想是的，因为你是乘坐一艘巨大的飞船来的。"
G["Thank you for your help in making the salve, $n. Once it's had a chance to dull the pain, I'm going to see how far I can get on this leg."]="感谢你帮我制造药膏，$n。如果它真能缓解痛苦，我会去看看我能让这条腿走多远。"
G["Thank you for your help, $n! These woods may never be safe from the evils that once dwelled here, but I feel better knowing that heroes like you are helping me keep watch."]="感谢你的帮助，$n！这片森林中潜藏的邪恶从没有彻底消失过，但知道有你这样的英雄帮助我守护这里，我的感觉就好多了。"
G["Thank you for your help, $n.  These frostberries are literally the fruits of your labor."]="谢谢你的帮助，$n。这些冰莓就当作你的劳动果实吧。"
G["Thank you for your help, $n. I wish you well in your adventures."]="谢谢你的帮助，$n。祝你探险顺利。"
G["Thank you for your help, $n. My daggers will cut through many enemies."]="谢谢你的帮助，$n。我的匕首将刺穿许多敌人的心脏。"
G["Thank you for your help, $p. We may not have made the best brew, but we had quite an adventure."]="谢谢你的帮助，$p。我们也许没有酿出最好的啤酒，不过我们倒是经历了一场惊心动魄的冒险。"
G["Thank you for your help, adventurer.  We will assist you as best we can in fending off the mogu."]="感谢你的帮助，冒险者。我们会尽力帮你挡住魔古族的。"
G["Thank you for your help, friend. I'll take it from here."]="Gracias por tu ayuda, $gamigo mío:amiga mía;. Yo me encargo del resto."
G["Thank you for your help."]="感谢你的帮助。"
G["Thank you for your help. I'll make sure this Honeybrew gets back to the village. Try not to blow anything else up!"]="多谢你的帮助。我一定会把这蜜酒送回村里。尽量别惹其它麻烦了！"
G["Thank you for your help. Try not to blow anything else up!"]="多谢你的帮助。尽量别惹其它麻烦了！"
G["Thank you for your help. You can find me at the Argent Vanguard if you require anything further."]="谢谢你。如果你还有其他需要，可以到银色前线基地来找我。"
G["Thank you for your hospitality, Mayor. I assure you: you're doing the right thing."]="感谢你的盛情款待，村长。我向你保证，你做得很对。"
G["Thank you for your hospitality."]="感谢你的热情好客。"
G["Thank you for your inquiry, $c, but we have all of the spotted yellowtail necessary. There are others here though that may still be gathering materiel for the upcoming war. Seek them out, and may the goddess shine upon you."]="谢谢你，$c。但是我们已经集齐斑点黄尾鱼了。这儿或许还有其他人正在收集战争物资。去找他们吧，愿女神保佑你。"
G["Thank you for your time, Lady Prestor."]="普瑞斯托女士您费时了，谢谢你。"
G["Thank you for your time. I hope you will reconsider training me in the future."]="多谢你的宝贵时间。我希望你以后能重新考虑训练我。"
G["Thank you for your training, $n. I hope to one day be as good a fighter as you!"]="谢谢你的训练，$n。我希望有朝一日能成为像你一样棒的斗士！"
G["Thank you friends, I owe my freedom to you. Where is Taretha? I hoped to see her one last time and thank her before leaving into the mountains."]="谢谢你们，朋友。我非常感激你们。塔蕾莎在哪里？我非常希望能在动身离开之前再见她一次，并再次感谢她。"
G["Thank you kindly!"]="没问题，非常感谢你！"
G["Thank you my friend for making this possible.  This is a day that I shall never forget!  I think I will stay a while.  Please return to High Priestess MacDonnell at the camp.  I know that she'll be keenly interested to know of what has transpired here."]="Gracias, $gamigo:amiga; por hacer esto posible. ¡Nunca olvidaré este día! Creo que me quedaré un rato. Por favor, vuelve al campamento con la suma sacerdotisa MacDowell. Sé que estará muy interesada en saber lo que ha ocurrido aquí."
G["Thank you sergeant.  You may return to your post."]="感谢你，军士。你可以回到岗位上去了。"
G["Thank you sir, though I cannot accept your praise without acknowledging the assistance of our guest, Emissary Mordin."]="谢谢。摩尔丁特使给予了我莫大的帮助，您的褒扬我真是受之有愧。"
G["Thank you so much $p!"]="真是太感谢你了，$p！"
G["Thank you so much $p! If you find me in Dawn's Blossom later I'll give you one of the things we stashed from our adventures."]="太感谢你了， $p！你等下到晨芳园来找我，我会送你一件我们为探险准备的东西的。"
G["Thank you so much for the lovely gift, $n. Cats are my favorite!"]="谢谢你送我这么可爱的礼物，$n。我最喜欢猫啦！"
G["Thank you so much!"]="太感谢你了！"
G["Thank you so much! I thought I'd never wake up from that nightmare!"]="非常感谢！我以为我再也不能从噩梦中醒来了呢！"
G["Thank you so much! The Golden Lotus is in your debt."]="太感谢了！金莲教欠你一份人情！"
G["Thank you so much, brave heroes! I will tell stories of you! Of $p the Mighty! And Ken-Ken the Fearless!"]="¡Muchas gracias, valientes héroes! ¡Narraré historias sobre vosotros! ¡Sobre $p $gel:la; Valiente! ¡Y Ken-Ken el Intrépido!"
G["Thank you soooooo much for bringing it back.  I think you're going to be my best wrangler ever!"]="非常感谢你把它带回来。你会成为我最好的放牧者！"
G["Thank you stranger!"]="¡Gracias, $gforastero:forastera;!"
G["Thank you very much!"]="太感谢你了！"
G["Thank you very much! I don't know what I would have done if you weren't here!"]="非常感谢！要是没有你，我真不知该如何是好！"
G["Thank you very, very much."]="真是太谢谢你了。"
G["Thank you!"]="谢谢！"
G["Thank you!  I don't know how much longer we would have survived."]="谢谢！我不知道我们还能活多久。"
G["Thank you!  I owe you my life."]="谢谢你，我欠你一条命。"
G["Thank you!  I will be sure to notifiy you if I find anything else."]="谢谢你！如果有所发现，我一定会及时通知你的。"
G["Thank you!  The battle for Darrowshire doomed me, but you have set me free!"]="谢谢你！我注定会在达隆郡之战中身亡，但是你让我获得了自由！"
G["Thank you!  You freed me!"]="谢谢你！你让我自由了！"
G["Thank you! Don't forget to tip your waiters! Good night folks."]="谢谢！别忘记给服务生小费！晚安。"
G["Thank you! I could not have held out for much longer.... A terrible thing has happened here."]="谢谢你的帮助！我已经濒临崩溃了……这里发生了可怕的事情。"
G["Thank you! I will try to break some of that silk shield off."]="谢谢你！我会设法弄破一部分丝盾的。"
G["Thank you! Now to see about this burning sensation..."]="谢谢你！我要赶紧处理下这种烧灼感的后遗症……"
G["Thank you! Please, save... Lorewalker Fu if you can... I... have failed..."]="谢谢你！请你，救救……游学者福云，如果你可以的话……我……失败了……"
G["Thank you! Thank you! Thanks for that warm welcome."]="谢谢！谢谢！谢谢你如此热烈地欢迎我。"
G["Thank you! Thank you, $gpriest:priestess;. Now I can take on those corrupt timberlings with Elune's power behind me!"]="谢谢你！谢谢你，$g牧师:女祭司;。有了月神的庇护，我就可以对抗那些堕落的树精了！"
G["Thank you! Thank you, $gpriest:priestess;. Now I can take on those gnolls with your power to back me!"]="¡Gracias! Gracias, $gsacerdote:sacerdotisa;. ¡Ya me puedo encargar de esos gnolls con el poder que me has devuelto!"
G["Thank you! Thank you, $gpriest:priestess;. Now I can take on those humans with your power to back me!"]="谢谢！谢谢你，$g祭司:女祭司;。有了你的力量我就可以继续作战了！"
G["Thank you! Thank you, $gpriest:priestess;. Now I can take on those murlocs with the Light on my side!"]="¡Gracias! Gracias, $gsacerdote:sacerdotisa;. ¡Ya me puedo encargar de esos múrlocs, la Luz está de mi lado!"
G["Thank you! Thank you, $gpriest:priestess;. Now I can take on those wendigo with the Light on my side!"]="¡Gracias! Gracias, $gsacerdote:sacerdotisa;. ¡Ya me puedo encargar de esos wendigo, la Luz está de mi lado!"
G["Thank you! That thing was shaking me like a ragdoll."]="谢谢！我在那个家伙的触手里简直就象个破布娃娃。"
G["Thank you! There's no telling what those brutes would've done to me."]="谢谢你！真不知道那些野蛮人会怎么对付我。"
G["Thank you! They were saying we were going to be slaves."]="谢谢你！他们说，我们要变成奴隶了。"
G["Thank you! We will not trouble you for long."]="谢谢！我们不会待得太久。"
G["Thank you! You good!"]="谢谢你！你是个好人！"
G["Thank you, $G lad:lass;. Thank you, greatly."]="谢谢你，$g小伙子:姑娘;。非常感谢。"
G["Thank you, $R. Now prepare yourselves. Archimonde is on the march, and we must hold off the inevitable for as long as we can."]="Gracias, $r. Ahora, preparaos. Archimonde está en marcha y debemos retrasar lo inevitable todo lo que podamos."
G["Thank you, $c! Back to the fight!"]="谢谢你，$c！继续作战！"
G["Thank you, $c, for seeing to it that I received the letter from my brother.\n\nRest assured, his death will not have been in vain. The blue dragonflight will pay for this.\n\nI'll see to it personally!"]="$c，谢谢你，自从收到兄弟的来信后，我就一直在关注这件事。\n\n他的牺牲总算不是徒劳的，愿他的灵魂安息。蓝龙军团会付出惨痛的代价的。\n\n我等着这一天！"
G["Thank you, $c, for seeing to it that I received the letter from my daughter.\n\nRest assured, her death will not have been in vain. The blue dragonflight will pay in spades.\n\nI'll see to it personally!"]="$c，谢谢你，自从收到女儿的来信后，我就一直在关注这件事。\n\n她的牺牲总算不是徒劳的，愿她的灵魂安息。蓝龙军团会付出惨痛的代价的。\n\n我等着这一天！"
G["Thank you, $c."]="谢谢你，$c。"
G["Thank you, $c.\n\nI nearly died out there."]="多谢你，$c。\n\n我差一点儿死在那了。"
G["Thank you, $c.  Thank you!"]="谢谢你，$c。谢谢！"
G["Thank you, $c. I can get back to camp on my own."]="谢谢你，$c。我可以自己返回营地的。"
G["Thank you, $c. I might have died out here if not for you."]="谢谢你，$c。要不是你的话，我恐怕已经死在这儿了。"
G["Thank you, $c. I owe you."]="谢谢你，$c。我欠你一份情。"
G["Thank you, $c. May the winds and seas always deliver you safely."]="谢谢你，$c。愿微风与海洋保佑你。"
G["Thank you, $c. You honor me."]="谢谢你，$c。你让我感到很荣幸。"
G["Thank you, $g sir : ma'am;!  It was so great to get to speak with Salandria again!"]="谢谢你，$g先生:女士;！能再和萨兰蒂亚谈话实在是太好了！"
G["Thank you, $n!"]="谢谢你，$n！"
G["Thank you, $n!  I couldn't have done it without you.  You'll let Gahruj know?"]="$n，谢谢你！没有你的帮助，我是不可能成功的。你会跟加鲁斯说明这一切吗？"
G["Thank you, $n!  You will find Keras Wolfheart on the Warrior's Terrace near the trainers there.  He will guide your way to Arathi Basin.  Good luck and great honor upon thee."]="谢谢你，$n！你可以在战士区的训练师附近找到克拉斯·沃夫哈特。他会指引你前往阿拉希盆地。祝你好运，那会是一场荣誉之战。"
G["Thank you, $n! I'd given up any hope of being rescued from these crazy bird-brains!"]="$n，谢谢你！我原本以为我死定了！"
G["Thank you, $n! I'm free!!!"]="谢谢你，$n！我自由了！！！"
G["Thank you, $n! Now I can begin my final assembly..."]="谢谢你，$n！现在我可以开始最终的装配了……"
G["Thank you, $n! With Baine and our Horde allies working together, we may yet push the invaders back to the swamp they washed in from."]="谢谢你，$n！只要贝恩和我们的部落盟友同心协力，我们就能将入侵者赶回到他们盘踞的沼泽里面去。"
G["Thank you, $n, for saving us from a fate worse than death.  You have our eternal gratitude."]="$n，谢谢你将我们从生不如死的惨境中解救出来。你的恩情我们永世不忘。"
G["Thank you, $n."]="谢谢你，$n。"
G["Thank you, $n.  And good luck!"]="谢谢你，$n。祝你好运！"
G["Thank you, $n.  And luck to you."]="谢谢你，$n。祝你好运。"
G["Thank you, $n.  I will remember you always.  You can find my strongbox in my camp, north of Stonard."]="谢谢你，$n。我将会永远记住你。你可以在斯通纳德北部的营地里找到那个大箱子。"
G["Thank you, $n.  I'll mobilize my people right now!"]="谢谢你，$n。我立即动员人民！"
G["Thank you, $n.  It looks like they're going to get along just fine."]="谢谢你，$n。他们应该没什么问题。"
G["Thank you, $n.  May the Light bless you, $Gbrother:sister;, and guide your path."]="谢谢你，$n。愿圣光保佑你，我的$G兄弟:姐妹;，愿它指引你前进的道路。"
G["Thank you, $n.  Now, to perform the test..."]="谢谢你，$n。现在，去完成测试吧……"
G["Thank you, $n.  You have tempered the cold rage in my heart."]="谢谢你，$n。你平息了我心中的怒火。"
G["Thank you, $n. A girl can never have enough rubies."]="谢谢你，$n。女孩子总是觉得自己少一颗红宝石。"
G["Thank you, $n. As long as we stay together, Anren and I will be fine. Go check on the others!"]="谢谢你，$n。只要我和安伦在一起，我们就没什么好怕的了。快去看看其他人吧！"
G["Thank you, $n. From the bottom of my heart. Thank you."]="谢谢，$n。衷心地感谢你。"
G["Thank you, $n. I am in your debt."]="谢谢你，$n。我欠你一个人情。"
G["Thank you, $n. I have had enough training."]="谢谢你，$n。我已经训练得很充分了。"
G["Thank you, $n. I have much to report to Ban. I think I can find my way back from here."]="谢谢你，$n。我有很多情况要向班报告。我想我能找到回去的路。"
G["Thank you, $n. I trust you will, ah, defer to my authority on this matter."]="谢谢你，$n。我相信你一定会，啊，维护我的权力。"
G["Thank you, $n. My son would have liked to see this."]="谢谢你，$n。我儿子原本喜欢见到这个。"
G["Thank you, $n. My torment is now at an end."]="谢谢你，$n。我的痛苦结束了。"
G["Thank you, $n. Now my spirit will finally be at peace."]="谢谢你，$n。我的灵魂终于得到了安宁。"
G["Thank you, $n. Please return to my brethren at the Altar of Damnation, near the Hand of Gul'dan, and tell them that Wilda is safe. May the Earthmother watch over you..."]="谢谢你，$n。请回去转告我的兄弟，告诉他们维尔达安全了，他们在古尔丹之手附近的诅咒祭坛那里。愿大地之母保佑你……"
G["Thank you, $n. See you in Silvermoon..."]="谢谢你，$n。我们银月城见……"
G["Thank you, $n. Thank you!"]="谢谢你，$n。谢谢！"
G["Thank you, $n. The health of our soldiers depends upon your success."]="谢谢你，$n。士兵们的健康就全靠你了。"
G["Thank you, $n. Without you, the Admiral would have perished in that filthy pit."]="Gracias, $c. Sin ti, el almirante habría perecido en aquel agujero infecto."
G["Thank you, $n. You just saved my hide!"]="谢谢你，$n。你刚刚救了我一命！"
G["Thank you, $n. Your kindness will not be forgotten."]="谢谢你，$n。我们永远不会忘记你的慷慨相助。"
G["Thank you, $p! I am so happy that you helped us. My Lo is with me now, and even my father seems to have relaxed.\n\nHe won't admit it to me, but I think my father likes Lo."]="谢谢你，$p！我很高兴你帮助了我们。罗现在跟我在一起了，甚至我的父亲看起来也缓和了许多。\n\n他是不会向我承认这点的，但我认为我的父亲是喜欢罗的。"
G["Thank you, $p! Your courage saw us through the battle."]="谢谢你，$p！是你的勇气激励着我们战斗。"
G["Thank you, $p. You fight well for one not of our order. I can handle the rest from here."]="谢谢你，$p。虽然不是我们的一员，但你打得很好。剩下的就交给我吧。"
G["Thank you, $p. You have saved us all."]="谢谢你，$p。你救了我们大家。"
G["Thank you, $r!"]="谢谢你，$r！"
G["Thank you, $r! I feel the tide of battle turning in our favor. You have gained us a moment's respite, $n."]="谢谢你，$r！我感到战局正在朝有利于我们的方向发展。你为我们赢得了喘息之机，$n！"
G["Thank you, $r! Your service to the Mag'har will not be forgotten."]="谢谢你，$R！你为玛格汉所做的一切，我们都将铭记在心。"
G["Thank you, $r."]="谢谢你，$r。"
G["Thank you, $r.\n\nYou saved me from certain death."]="谢谢你，$r。\n\n是你把我从死亡线上拉了回来。"
G["Thank you, $r. I can find my way back on my own."]="谢谢你，$r。我自己能回去。"
G["Thank you, $r. I shall not forget your kindness."]="谢谢你，$r。我不会忘记你的帮助的。"
G["Thank you, $r. I will join your struggle against the stormforged."]="谢谢你，$r。我要和你一起反抗雷铸铁矮人。"
G["Thank you, $r. I will take this miserable cur from you now."]="谢谢你，$r。我现在就把这个孬种带走。"
G["Thank you, $r. It would be my honor to fight at your side."]="谢谢你，$r。能和你并肩作战是我的荣幸。"
G["Thank you, $r. Without your help I would have become one of them!"]="谢谢你，$r。要不是你出手帮忙，我已经落得和他们一样的下场了！"
G["Thank you, $r. Your endurance and dedication to the preservation of your race has inspired your people and your friends.  Allow me to thank you with the presentation of this reward.  Raise your hand and accept your prize, $n!"]="谢谢，$r。你的坚持和为了保卫你们一族所做的贡献激励了你的人民和朋友。请让我用这份礼物表达我的谢意。伸出你的手，接受你的奖励吧，$n！"
G["Thank you, $r... I was close to death.  May I stay by your side for a moment?"]="谢谢你，$r……我差一点就死了。我能在你身边待一会儿吗？"
G["Thank you, Adamant. I think I know just the person for the job."]="谢谢你，阿达曼特。我想我知道谁最适合这项工作。"
G["Thank you, Akiaruk.  We'd heard of your kindness even in Iskaal."]="谢谢你，阿加鲁克。我们在伊斯卡尔就听说了你的事迹。"
G["Thank you, Alliance hero, but next time we meet, I will show no mercy."]="谢谢你，联盟的英雄。但下次见面时，我还是不会对你手软的。"
G["Thank you, Anduin."]="谢谢你，安度因。"
G["Thank you, Catherine. It's good that you're here: With full carrier support we can push north-"]="谢谢，凯瑟琳。你来得正好，在母舰的全力支持下我们就能向北推进——"
G["Thank you, Corecam.  May the Light bless you, brother, and guide your path."]="Gracias, Corecam. Que la Luz te bendiga, hermano, y guíe tu camino."
G["Thank you, Cyness. And luck to you."]="Gracias, Cyness. Y que tengas suerte."
G["Thank you, Diki.  May the Light bless you, brother, and guide your path."]="Gracias, Diki. Que la Luz te bendiga, hermano, y guíe tu camino."
G["Thank you, Dollardollar. And luck to you."]="Gracias, Dollardollar. Y que tengas suerte."
G["Thank you, Fatekiss. And luck to you."]="Gracias, Fatekiss. Y que tengas suerte."
G["Thank you, Father Gavin. The world needs more like you and Buin in these dark times."]="谢谢你，伽文神父。在这黑暗的时刻，这个世界需要更多像你和布伊恩这样的人。"
G["Thank you, Genn. I am glad to see such poise and composure from your people. Perhaps your curse does not define you after all."]="谢谢你，吉恩。很高兴能看到你的人民会如此镇定从容。也许你们受到的诅咒并没有真正伤害到你们的心灵。"
G["Thank you, Highlord. Now, challengers, I will begin the ritual of summoning. When I am done a fearsome doomguard will appear!"]="感谢你，大领主。挑战者们，我将开始召唤仪式。当仪式完成时，一个恐怖的末日守卫就会出现！"
G["Thank you, Horde hero, but next time we meet, I will show no mercy."]="谢谢你，部落的英雄。但下次见面时，我还是不会对你手软的。"
G["Thank you, Horsepigg. And luck to you."]="Gracias, Horsepigg. Y que tengas suerte."
G["Thank you, I don't even want to know what they were planning to do with us."]="谢谢你，我都不敢想象他们想对我们做什么。"
G["Thank you, I had lost sight of the Way."]="谢谢你，我忘记了“道”之真意。"
G["Thank you, I'll go now."]="谢谢你，我马上就去。"
G["Thank you, Ironbark. We are ready for you to open the door."]="谢谢你，埃隆巴克。我们等着你打开大门。"
G["Thank you, Jessica."]="谢谢你，杰希卡。"
G["Thank you, Keldric. See you later."]="谢谢你，凯德雷克。再见。"
G["Thank you, Kodian.  I'll do what I can."]="谢谢你，科蒂安。我会尽力的。"
G["Thank you, Lord Zhu. I will not let you down."]="谢谢你，祝掌门。我不会让你失望的。"
G["Thank you, Lorewalker!"]="游学者，谢谢你！"
G["Thank you, Maolin."]="谢谢你，茂林。"
G["Thank you, Master White Tiger. You will see. I believe that my people - and the Horde - are essentially good."]="谢谢你，白虎大师。我会证明给你看。相信我的族人——还有部落——内心本善。"
G["Thank you, Mr. Henders."]="谢谢你，亨德尔先生。"
G["Thank you, Mr. Kowalski! You may return to your post to oversee docking!"]="谢谢你，科瓦斯基先生！你可以回去继续监督进港情况了！"
G["Thank you, Mrs. Chambers."]="谢谢你，查伯斯先生。"
G["Thank you, Naenea. And luck to you."]="Gracias, Naenea. Y que tengas suerte."
G["Thank you, Omarion. You have taken a fatal blow for the team on this day."]="谢谢你，奥玛里恩。今天你的盔甲让一支军队得以避免伤亡。"
G["Thank you, Outlander!"]="¡Gracias, $gforastero:forastera;!"
G["Thank you, Ruolin! That was beautiful."]="洛林，谢谢你！你的歌喉美极了。"
G["Thank you, Son of Ursoc.  I'll see what can be done."]="谢谢你，乌索克之子。我会力所能及地帮助你。"
G["Thank you, Stable Master. Please take the animal."]="谢谢你，兽栏管理员。请牵走动物吧。"
G["Thank you, Stonemother."]="感谢您，石母。"
G["Thank you, Stonemother.  It was an honor to have..."]="感谢你，石母。这是我的荣幸……"
G["Thank you, Terenthis. I shall remain here for as long as I can."]="谢谢你，特伦希斯。我会尽可能留在这里帮忙的。"
G["Thank you, Tirion. What of your identity?"]="谢谢你，提里奥。你的身份是什么？"
G["Thank you, Xeldra.  May the Light bless you, sister, and guide your path."]="Gracias, Xeldra. Que la Luz te bendiga, hermana, y guíe tu camino."
G["Thank you, Zegra.  May the Light bless you, sister, and guide your path."]="Gracias, Zegra. Que la Luz te bendiga, hermana, y guíe tu camino."
G["Thank you, all. I shall return again in about a week."]="谢谢大家。我会在一周后回来。"
G["Thank you, and good night!"]="谢谢大家！晚安！"
G["Thank you, brave $c."]="谢谢你，勇敢的$c。"
G["Thank you, brave heroes. Thank you for showing Azeroth that no matter how overhwelming the darkness becomes, a single Light can pierce through."]="谢谢你们，勇敢的英雄们。谢谢你们向艾泽拉斯证明了，无论邪恶的力量多么恐怖，凶猛，不可阻遏，总有一线圣光会冲破黑暗，为我们带来希望。"
G["Thank you, brother."]="兄弟，谢谢你。"
G["Thank you, but this is hardly the time for a party. A dangerous war leader named Garrosh has found the Divine Bell. We need the Harmonic Mallet to counter it."]="谢谢你。但现在可不是开派对的时候。一个穷凶极恶的军阀已经找到了圣钟，他的名字叫加尔鲁什。我们需要祥和钟杵来对抗他。"
G["Thank you, champion! The Horde may be on the verge of crisis, but your actions on these shores have ensured our continued survival and prosperity no matter what comes next."]="谢谢你，勇士！部落或许正处在危机边缘，但无论如何，你在这片海滩上的行动已经确保了我们的生存与发展。"
G["Thank you, champion. Please, free the others as well!"]="谢谢你，勇士。请你也救救其他人吧！"
G["Thank you, dear emperor."]="谢谢你，尊敬的皇帝陛下。"
G["Thank you, earthmender."]="谢谢你，大地治愈者。"
G["Thank you, friend of the grummles!"]="¡Gracias, $gamigo:amiga; de los grúmel!"
G["Thank you, friend, but we're not out of trouble yet!"]="谢谢你，朋友。但是我们还没有彻底摆脱危险！"
G["Thank you, friend."]="谢谢你，朋友。"
G["Thank you, friend.  Soon, we will be free of our slavery to the gronn."]="谢谢你，朋友。很快，我们就能从戈隆的奴役中解脱出来。"
G["Thank you, friend. Don't worry, it was just a scratch. Now I feel good as new!"]="谢谢你，朋友。别担心，只是皮外伤。我现在又生龙活虎了！"
G["Thank you, friend. I could not escape the sha's grip on my own."]="Gracias, $gamigo:amiga;. Necesitaba que alguien me ayudase a escapar de las garras del sha."
G["Thank you, friend. I could not rest knowing that my mission had not been completed."]="Gracias, $gamigo:amiga;. No podía descansar sabiendo que mi misión no había sido completada."
G["Thank you, friend. I didn't uncover anything before they caught me."]="Gracias, $gamigo:amiga;. No pude descubrir nada antes de que me capturaran."
G["Thank you, friend. I'd be bound to that wretched construct right now if it weren't for your intervention.\n\nStill, I shouldn't be here at all. We must put a stop to the spiritbinders."]="Gracias, $gamigo:amiga;. Si no fuera por tu intervención, aún seguiría ligado a ese ensamblaje maldito.\n\nNo debería estar aquí. Debemos poner fin a los vinculadores de espíritus."
G["Thank you, friend. Let's kill us some overgrown... spiders. Sounded better in my head."]="谢谢你，朋友。让我们去杀几个超大号的……蜘蛛。我觉得是个好主意。"
G["Thank you, friend. Now these beasts shall feel the fury of the Sunwell!"]="谢谢你，朋友。现在该让这群野兽尝尝太阳之井的愤怒了！"
G["Thank you, friend. The Alliance is lucky to have you."]="谢谢你，朋友。联盟幸亏有你。"
G["Thank you, friend. Were it not for your aid I would be no more."]="Gracias, $gamigo:amiga;. Si no fuese por tu ayuda, ya no existiría."
G["Thank you, friend. You are truly a hero."]="Gracias. Eres $gun verdadero héroe:una verdadera heroína;."
G["Thank you, friend. You have rescued me from a terrible fate."]="谢谢你，朋友。你将我从可怕的命运中救了出来。"
G["Thank you, friend... I'll make my way to the south!"]="Gracias, $gamigo:amiga;... ¡partiré hacia el sur!"
G["Thank you, friends! Your efforts have yielded some fantastic data! Now, where did I put-- oh, there it is."]="非常感谢，朋友们！你们的帮助使我获得了一些极其珍贵的数据！下面，我要让你们——咦，我把它放哪去了？哦！这里。"
G["Thank you, friends. I will lend what aid I can."]="谢谢，朋友们。我会尽力帮助你们的。"
G["Thank you, funny ogre!"]="谢谢，有趣的食人魔！"
G["Thank you, good $c."]="谢谢你，好心的$c。"
G["Thank you, good herald. Your words are too kind."]="感谢你，传讯者，你的话真令我高兴。"
G["Thank you, grandchildren."]="谢谢，我的孩子们。"
G["Thank you, great spirit. Thank you!"]="谢谢你，伟大的精灵。谢谢你！"
G["Thank you, hero!"]="¡Gracias, $ghéroe:heroína;!"
G["Thank you, hero."]="谢谢你，勇士。"
G["Thank you, hero. You and your companions were the tip of the Alliance spear: Your work exploring Pandaria, securing the Vale, and ultimately assaulting Garrosh's stronghold is what made this victory possible.\n\nOur triumph here will put a stop to the fighting in Kalimdor, but even in peace, there's much to be done - here, back home, and elsewhere."]="谢谢你，英雄。你和你的同伴们都是联盟的尖刀：你探索潘达利亚、保卫锦绣谷，以及突袭加尔鲁什老巢的一系列行动为我们带来了这次胜利。\n\n我们在这里的胜利将使卡利姆多的纷争落下帷幕，但即使在和平时期，我们在这里、在家乡、在全世界，都还有许多事情要做。"
G["Thank you, hero. You have granted me another chance at life."]="谢谢你，英雄。你给了第二次生命。"
G["Thank you, heroes. I will stay behind and round up the slaves as you free them. If you kill the Forgemaster to the east, we should be able to get ourselves equipped for battle."]="十分感谢，英雄们。我会一直呆在这，将你们施放的奴隶集结起来。如果你们能杀死东北方的熔炉之主，我们便可以把自己武装起来。"
G["Thank you, heroes. I..."]="谢谢，英雄们。我……呃……<被诡异的事情打断>"
G["Thank you, kind $gsir:lady;!"]="谢谢你，好心的$g先生:女士;！"
G["Thank you, kind and gentle stranger."]="Gracias, amable y gentil $gextraño:extraña;."
G["Thank you, kind soul."]="谢谢你，善良的灵魂。"
G["Thank you, kind soul. You have freed me from the watery prison of Coilskar but many more are being held prisoner nearby. Will you assist me in freeing them as well?"]="Gracias, amable $gamigo:amiga;. Me has liberado de esta prisión de agua de Cicatriz Espiral, pero todavía quedan muchos otros prisioneros en los alrededores. ¿Me ayudarás a liberarlos también?"
G["Thank you, kind stranger. May your heroism never be forgotten."]="谢谢你，好心的陌生人。我们将永远铭记你的英雄事迹。"
G["Thank you, kind... OH NO, HERE HE COMES AGAIN!"]="谢谢你，好心的……噢，不，他又来了！"
G["Thank you, lad."]="谢谢你，孩子。"
G["Thank you, little $r!"]="¡Gracias, $gpequeño:pequeña; $r!"
G["Thank you, mortal! Your heroism in The Inferno has made my escape possible."]="感谢你，凡人！你在炼狱火海的英雄之举让我逃了出来。"
G["Thank you, mortal, for freeing me from this curse. I beg you, take this blade."]="凡人，感谢你让我摆脱了这个诅咒的束缚。请你收下这把剑。"
G["Thank you, mortal."]="谢谢你，凡人。"
G["Thank you, mortal. There is but one service that I may offer to you before I return to the Dream.\n\nThe door to Zevrim's master, Alzzin, blocks your path. I shall act as your instrument of destruction. The door will be opened, I merely await your command."]="谢谢你，人类。在我重回梦境之前我只能帮助你一次。\n\n通往瑟雷姆的主人奥兹恩的大门阻挡了你前进的道路。我会充当你破坏的器械。我等待你的命令，帮你打开大门。"
G["Thank you, my dear."]="谢谢你，宝贝儿。"
G["Thank you, my friend.  This drake from Dragons' End is just what we need to lure Goc out from hiding!"]="Gracias, $gamigo:amiga;. ¡Este draco del Cabo del Dragón es justo lo que necesitamos como cebo para sacar a Goc de su escondite!"
G["Thank you, my friend. Go."]="谢谢你，朋友。出发吧。"
G["Thank you, my friend. I can never repay your service or your friendship."]="谢谢你，我的朋友。我难以回报你的忠诚和友谊。"
G["Thank you, old friend. Our warriors thank you."]="谢谢你，老朋友。我们的勇士感谢你。"
G["Thank you, old friend. You have done the right thing."]="Gracias, $gviejo amigo:vieja amiga;. Has hecho lo correcto."
G["Thank you, priestess."]="感谢你，女祭司。"
G["Thank you, shaman.  I am reborn and will burn brighter than ever before!"]="谢谢你，萨满祭司。我已经获得了新生！"
G["Thank you, sisters, I am renewed."]="谢谢，姐妹们，我重焕活力了。"
G["Thank you, small one."]="谢谢你，小个子。"
G["Thank you, son of Durotan."]="谢谢你，杜隆坦之子。"
G["Thank you, spirits."]="谢谢你们，万物之灵。"
G["Thank you, stranger! We're free!"]="谢谢你，陌生人！我们自由了！"
G["Thank you, stranger."]="Gracias, $gforastero:forastera;."
G["Thank you, stranger. I... have never felt like that before."]="Gracias, $gforastero:forastera;. Nunca había sentido nada parecido."
G["Thank you, stranger..."]="Gracias, $gforastero:forastera;..."
G["Thank you, strangers. You have given me hope."]="谢谢你们，陌生人。你们给了我希望。"
G["Thank you, sweety. We love you, too."]="谢谢你，甜心。我们也爱你。"
G["Thank you, thank you!"]="谢谢你，谢谢你！"
G["Thank you, thank you!  Time to get away from these crazy blue women!"]="谢谢，谢谢你！总算能摆脱这些蓝皮肤的疯女人了！"
G["Thank you, traveler. I think I can make it now."]="Gracias, $gviajero:viajera;. Creo que saldré adelante."
G["Thank you, you're a great audience!  I'll be here all week!"]="谢谢你，你是个很好的聆听者！我整周都会在这儿的！"
G["Thank you."]="谢谢你。"
G["Thank you.\n\nIn return, I will teach you how to distract the trolls up ahead."]="谢谢你。\n\n作为回报，我会教你如何分散前面那群巨魔的注意力。"
G["Thank you.  I will not forget this!"]="谢谢你，我永远不会忘记你的恩情！"
G["Thank you.  I... I should get going now."]="谢谢你。我……该离开啦。"
G["Thank you.  Truly."]="真心地感谢你。"
G["Thank you. I can find my way back to camp from here."]="谢谢你。现在我可以自己回营地去了。"
G["Thank you. I could use the rest."]="谢谢你。我可以稍微休息下了。"
G["Thank you. I must go find Tholo, my fellow druid and treasured friend."]="谢谢你。我得去找索罗了。他是我的德鲁伊同伴，也是我最珍贵的朋友。"
G["Thank you. I owe you greatly."]="谢谢。多亏你了。"
G["Thank you. I thought I was doomed."]="谢谢你。我还以为自己死定了呢。"
G["Thank you. I thought I would die without seeing my sisters again!"]="谢谢你。我还以为我再也见不到我的姐妹啦！"
G["Thank you. I will not forget."]="谢谢你。我不会忘记你的恩情。"
G["Thank you. I'll be okay, but we'd better keep moving."]="谢谢你。我没事，我们继续前进。"
G["Thank you. I'll be on my way."]="谢谢你。我要上路了。"
G["Thank you. I'll be sure to slay a few spiders on my way back to camp."]="谢谢你。我一定要在回营地的路上顺手干掉几只蜘蛛。"
G["Thank you. I'll make my way to the village. Stay safe..."]="谢谢你。我能自己去村子里。注意安全……"
G["Thank you. It's the least I can do to support this; we need to stand together."]="谢谢，这是我唯一能做的。我们需要同心协力。"
G["Thank you. Let us begin."]="谢谢你。让我们开始吧。"
G["Thank you. Let's hope there aren't any more."]="谢谢你。希望这种事情不要再发生。"
G["Thank you. Mind if I tag along and take some revenge?"]="谢谢你。你不介意我与你同行，顺便报仇吧？"
G["Thank you. My pets are stronger than ever now."]="谢谢你。我的宠物变得比以往更加强大了。"
G["Thank you. Now behold as I stabilize the highly unstable miniaturization process."]="谢谢你。现在，你可以看着我如何稳定这种极度不稳定的微型化处理程序。"
G["Thank you. Once again you have saved us all. I will see you back at Zim'Torga."]="谢谢你。你再次拯救了我们。我会在希姆托加等你。"
G["Thank you. Thank you all for coming to stare at my enormous, bulging piles of gold. It must feel like such a wonderful privilege to be in my presence."]="谢谢。谢谢你们特地前来瞻仰我这浩瀚的金币海洋。能见到我本人，相信你们一定感到无比荣幸。"
G["Thank you. The Light be with you both."]="谢谢，愿圣光与你们同在。"
G["Thank you. Time to lick my wounds and get back to the fight!"]="谢谢你。是时候抚平伤痛，回去再战了！"
G["Thank you. You have saved my life."]="谢谢你。是你救了我。"
G["Thank you. You saved my life."]="谢谢你。你救了我一命。"
G["Thank you..."]="谢谢你……"
G["Thank you... *gasp*   I owe you my life."]="谢谢你……*喘息声*是你救了我一命。"
G["Thank you... I wish I could help you find the forgemaster."]="谢谢你……真希望我能帮你找到铸炉之主。"
G["Thank you... Now what?"]="谢谢你……现在怎么办？"
G["Thank you... emperor. Thank you."]="感谢您，皇上。感谢您。"
G["Thank... you."]="谢谢……你。"
G["Thank... you..."]="谢……谢……你……"
G["Thankfully our allies on the other side of the portal can send supplies through now that the oubliette is disabled.\n\nUnfortunately we still haven't disabled the trap preventing us from returning through it."]="幸运的是，地牢已被关闭，我们在传送门另一端的盟友可以把补给品传送过来了。\n\n不幸的是，我们还未能解除这个阻止我们通过传送门回传物品的封印。"
G["Thankfully, there's a steady stream of these fools chomping at the bit to get in here."]="好在总有一帮愚蠢的家伙挤破头似的往这里涌。"
G["Thanks $n, I think I can take one of these horses and make it back to camp from here.  I could not have made it without your help."]="谢谢你，$n，我想我能骑上匹马，一径返回营地去。真是多亏了你的帮助。"
G["Thanks $n.  Now let's get out of here!"]="谢谢你，$n。现在让我们离开这儿！"
G["Thanks Miss Kite Lady!"]="感谢风筝女士！"
G["Thanks Mrs. Brightbeard!"]="谢谢叔叔！"
G["Thanks a bunch... I can find my way back to Whitereach Post from here. Be sure to talk with Motega Firemane; perhaps you can keep him from sending me home."]="非常感谢你……从这里我能找到回白沙岗哨的路。记得跟莫特加·火鬃谈谈，也许你能阻止他送我回家。"
G["Thanks a lot, $n!"]="非常感谢，$n！"
G["Thanks a lot, $n.  We couldn't have made it without you.  Oh, and if I had mentioned before something about repaying you for saving us, well... you can forget it!"]="$n，非常感谢你。没有你，我们绝对没办法逃离魔爪。哦，如果我刚才说过要报答你之类的话……忘掉它吧！"
G["Thanks a ton, pal!"]="非常感谢，朋友！"
G["Thanks again for all your help, $n. The crocolisks aren't attacking nearly as much as they were before.\n\nWe're also doing our part here. We haven't caught any more fish than we need to eat."]="再次感谢你的帮助，$n。最近鳄鱼像以前一样不再那么有攻击性了。\n\n我们也在改善自己的行为，只要鱼够吃，我们再也不会滥捕了。"
G["Thanks again for bringing my sister to visit me, $G Mr. : Miss; $n!"]="$n$G先生:小姐;，谢谢你来带我的小妹妹来看我！"
G["Thanks again for handling my chores. See you back at the village soon?"]="再次感谢你帮我处理杂事。我们稍后在村里见？"
G["Thanks again for returning my lucky measuring tape, $n.  I swear it helps me catch bigger fish!"]="再次感谢你找回了我的幸运卷尺，$n。这东西能帮我捕到更大的鱼呢！"
G["Thanks again for the help with these lazy cretins, boss-$g man : lady;.\n\nIf you ask me, we shouldn't have been so lenient with the trolls when we freed ourselves from being their slaves."]="Gracias de nuevo por ayudarme con esos vagos cretinos $gjefe:jefa;.\n\nSi quieres saber mi opinión, no debimos ser tan indulgentes con los trols cuando conseguimos liberarnos de la esclavitud a la que nos tenían sometidos."
G["Thanks again!"]="再次感谢！"
G["Thanks again, $n! I'm very pleased with what we found.\n\nGood luck to you!"]="再次感谢你，$n！我对我们所发现的东西感到很高兴。\n\n祝你好运！"
G["Thanks again, $n.  Now I'll use this indurium to beef up my car!"]="再次感谢你，$n。现在我要用精铁来加固我的战车！"
G["Thanks again, $n.  Rocknot and I are really hitting it off!"]="再次感谢你，$n。罗克诺特和我非常合得来！"
G["Thanks again, $p! I'll get this to Brewmaster Boof right away."]="再次感谢，$p！我会立刻把它交给酒仙布夫。"
G["Thanks again.  Sergeant Doryn will be glad to hear he has one less scout to replace this week."]="再次谢谢你。如果杜尔因上尉得知本周能少替换一名斥候的话，他肯定会很高兴的。"
G["Thanks and good luck!"]="谢谢，祝你好运！"
G["Thanks be to de ancestors! Thanks be to de great Bwonsamdi! We all be makin' offerings in gratitude!"]="感谢祖先们！感谢伟大的邦桑迪！我们在此奉上我们感激的心情！"
G["Thanks fer savin' me! When you passed out, I thought we were done fer!"]="谢谢你救了我！你昏过去的时候，我还以为我们都完了！"
G["Thanks fer saving me, $gladdie:lassie;, I had a horrible vision. I was trapped in a cave of flame, forced to drop totems and heal irate warriors for years on end without seeing a single piece of shaman gear."]="感谢你救了我，$g小伙子:姑娘;，我看到了非常可怕的情景。我被困在一个满是火焰的洞窟中，被迫不停地栽下图腾，治疗愤怒的战士，就这样连续许多年没有停止过，却始终没有见到一件萨满装备。"
G["Thanks for being nice."]="谢谢你，你是个好人。"
G["Thanks for coming out to see me!  I hope you are ready for a good time, because I am."]="谢谢你到这儿来看我！希望你已经准备好享受这个时刻了，我早就迫不及待了。"
G["Thanks for everything... father."]="谢谢你为我做的一切……爸爸。"
G["Thanks for finding my reagents!  *yawn*  That poison's made me... a bit tired..."]="感谢你找到了我的材料！*打呵欠*这毒药令我……感到疲倦……"
G["Thanks for freeing me! I'm off to have more amazing adventures."]="谢谢你们救了我！我要踏上更为刺激的冒险之旅了。"
G["Thanks for getting me out of there! That was awful."]="谢谢你把我救出来！真是太可怕了。"
G["Thanks for getting me out of there. I owe you one!"]="谢谢你帮我脱身。算我欠你的！"
G["Thanks for getting me out of there. I should be able to swim back from here, but before I go, one quick thing..."]="终于逃出来了。到了这里，我就应该能游回去了。但在我离开之前，还有件事要对你说……"
G["Thanks for getting me out of there. Not pleasant in the slightest."]="感谢你救我出来。这段经历真是令人不快。"
G["Thanks for getting that ore and taking it to Magister Quallestis, $c. I suppose that I should head back, but I'm afraid of the punishment I'm going to receive because I couldn't get the ore myself.\n\nDon't tell the magister, ok?"]="感谢你收集了矿石，把它们交给魔导师奎尔林提斯吧，$c。我想我应该回去，但我又害怕因为不能亲自收集矿石而受到惩罚……\n\n不要告诉魔导师，好吗？"
G["Thanks for helpin' me out, mon!  No more shapeshifts for me... I'm gonna work on my healing!"]="感谢你帮助我，朋友！我已经不想再变形了……现在我要努力提高我的治疗术水平！"
G["Thanks for keeping us covered back there! We'll hold the gate while we wait for reinforcements."]="谢谢你掩护我们回来！我们会一边等待援军，一边守住大门。"
G["Thanks for rescuing us, $c.\n\nWe'll accompany the next caravan off of this mountain, but... I don't think I'll ever be the same..."]="多谢你救了我们，$c。\n\n我们要护送下一个车队下山，但……我不认为我还会犯同样的错误……"
G["Thanks for saving me!"]="谢谢你救了我！"
G["Thanks for saving me. It was rough up there."]="感谢你救了我。待在那上面可真难受。"
G["Thanks for saving the festival, $n!"]="感谢你挽救了节日，$n！"
G["Thanks for saving us!  Are you ready to get this party started?"]="谢谢你救了我们！你准备好开始这场宴会了吗？"
G["Thanks for taking me out exploring with you, $n."]="谢谢你带我一起出来探险，$n。"
G["Thanks for the apple, $r."]="谢谢你的苹果，$r。"
G["Thanks for the assist, friend. I'd better report back to Bowmistress Li."]="感谢你的帮助，朋友。我得去向女射手李琪薇汇报了。"
G["Thanks for the backup, friends."]="谢谢你的援助，朋友。"
G["Thanks for the cask of booze, $n.  I think I'll open up a bottle right now!"]="谢谢你的这箱酒，$n。我现在就想打开一瓶尝尝！"
G["Thanks for the cheese!"]="我会的，谢谢你的奶酪！"
G["Thanks for the company!"]="幸好有我们的团结奋战！"
G["Thanks for the concern, but we intend to explore Zul'Aman."]="感谢关心，不过我们有意要探索祖阿曼。"
G["Thanks for the cover fire! It's a MADHOUSE down there!"]="谢谢你掩护我！下面简直就像精神病院！"
G["Thanks for the cover!"]="谢谢你掩护我们！"
G["Thanks for the great cut and shave, buddy."]="伙计，感谢你提供这么棒的理发、修面服务。"
G["Thanks for the great meal darlin' but I need to get back out front."]="亲爱的，谢谢你的大餐，我要出去了。"
G["Thanks for the heal, $n!"]="$n，谢谢你帮我疗伤！"
G["Thanks for the helmets, $n.  These will really reduce our medical bills..."]="谢谢你的头盔，$n。你这下能帮我们减少很多医疗帐单的开销了……"
G["Thanks for the help friend. If you see Nesingwary and his boy to the west tell them how many things we killed. They like hearing that."]="Gracias por tu ayuda, $gamigo:amiga;. Si ves a Nesingwary y a su chico en el oeste, háblales sobre todo lo que hemos matado. Les gusta escuchar esas cosas."
G["Thanks for the help. That one was far tougher for some reason."]="多谢你的帮忙。不知为什么那个要难对付得多。"
G["Thanks for the information, Frankal."]="感谢你提供的信息，弗兰卡。"
G["Thanks for the opportunity to dole out some payback. I'm going to head back to Valgarde now, friend."]="还能有机会略略报复一下真好。我这就动身返回瓦加德，朋友。"
G["Thanks for the opportunity to take it to Ragnaros."]="感谢你让我有机会同拉格纳罗斯一战。"
G["Thanks for the refill, $g sir : ma'am;!"]="感谢你给我斟酒，$g先生:女士;！"
G["Thanks for the relief. It's getting hairy out here."]="谢谢你的帮忙。这儿可真危险。"
G["Thanks for the rescue. Let's get out of here!"]="感谢你的救援。让我们离开这里吧！"
G["Thanks for the save, but we're still stuck in the middle of the entire mantid army."]="多谢你赶来救援，可是我们仍然被螳螂妖大军包围着。"
G["Thanks for the supplies, $n!"]="感谢你提供的物资，$n！"
G["Thanks for the warning, $n! We shall prepare!"]="$n，谢谢你的提醒！我们这就着手准备！"
G["Thanks for your help taking the island back $n.  Now we need your help in the Cursed Depths."]="感谢你帮助我们夺回了这座岛，$n。现在，我们需要你继续在咒怨地牢施展你的力量。"
G["Thanks for your help, $gmister:ma'am;. I'm going to keep looking for my dad now."]="感谢你的帮助，$g先生:女士;。我现在要继续寻找我的爸爸了。"
G["Thanks for your help, $n."]="Gracias por tu ayuda, $n."
G["Thanks for your help, $n. Because of you, another shipment arrived safely at the excavation."]="谢谢你的帮助，$n。在你的帮助下，另一艘货船安全抵达了挖掘地。"
G["Thanks for your help, hero!"]="谢谢你的帮助，勇士！"
G["Thanks for your help.  Let's get out of here!"]="谢谢你。我们离开这里吧！"
G["Thanks for your patience, $n."]="谢谢你的耐心，$n。"
G["Thanks so much for the cookies!"]="非常感谢你的点心！"
G["Thanks so much!  I'm glad I could extend the warranty on my cast iron pots for another month."]="非常感谢！我生铁锅的保修期能再延长一个月，这太令人高兴了。"
G["Thanks to everyone's efforts we now have all the iron bars that we need. Check with one of the others to see if there's something else you should be out there collecting for the war effort. Me, I'm going to see if I can get out of here a little early to play some cards."]="在大家的努力下，我们已经集齐了必需的铁锭。问问其他人，看他们是否需要你帮忙收集作战物资。至于我，我得瞧瞧我能不能早点离开，去玩几局牌。"
G["Thanks to the careful notes you kept while developing the preservation chamber, I was able to create a modified version that could preserve Kovok here as well."]="多亏您在开发封印仓时留下的详细记录，我才得以在此处建造出保存科沃克的改进版封印仓。"
G["Thanks to the combined efforts of the Alliance's adventuring guilds, we have been able to gather all of the singed corestones we think that we'll need. However, you might want to check around with the other collectors here to see if they still need help in gathering up vital resources."]="在联盟方的各大冒险公会的共同努力下，我们已经集齐了所需的熔火之石。但是，你可以问问其他的收集者，看他们是否需要帮忙。"
G["Thanks to the small fortune we made last season I was able to mail-order this fancy new camera!"]="幸亏我们上一季发了笔小财，我才能邮购到这台新式相机！"
G["Thanks to this hero, a few of us made it out of there. Many more have been sent to the Violet Hold."]="多亏这位英雄，我们逃了出来。还有许多人被送去了紫罗兰监狱。"
G["Thanks to you I'll be rested when those barbarians return."]="托你的福，等那些野蛮人回来时，我的体力应该已经恢复过来了。"
G["Thanks to you our young ones will be safe, $n.  Go to Sporeggar and meet my people.  They've all heard great things about you."]="$n，你保护了我们年轻的族人。前往孢子村，跟我的同胞们碰面吧。你的美名早就在他们中流传开来了。"
G["Thanks to you, $n."]="谢谢你，$n。"
G["Thanks to you, my work can now continue."]="多亏了你，我现在可以继续工作了。"
G["Thanks to you, the hozen are no longer a threat. Our village can now work on rebuilding and growing."]="多亏有你，猢狲以后再也不会成为我们的威胁了。我们的村子现在可以重新投入建设和发展了。"
G["Thanks to you, we can now unlock the secrets of the crystals and the mysterious pylons, $n. If you need more information at any time, please come back and visit me again!"]="谢谢你，现在我们能解开水晶和神秘的水晶塔的秘密了，$n。要是你需要更多信息，请随时回来找我！"
G["Thanks to you, we'll be able to proceed with our plans for the Ruins of Farahlon."]="谢谢你，我们在法兰伦废墟的计划又可以顺利进行了。"
G["Thanks to your actions, the Hozen fear your people. Indulge me a moment..."]="多亏了你，猢狲开始忌惮你的族人了。暂且等我一下——"
G["Thanks to your little friend, you've left the Temple of Storms, where you were at your strongest.  Instead we fight closer to my master's power."]="这就要感谢你的小朋友了。你离开了风暴神殿，在那里你才能发挥出全部的力量。而现在，我们战斗的地方更靠近主人的力量。"
G["Thanks!"]="谢谢！"
G["Thanks!  And when I make my drinks...don't tell anyone what they're made of!"]="万分感谢！另外……请不要告诉别人我的酒是用什么酿的！"
G["Thanks!  I can make it from here."]="谢谢！从这里开始，我自己就能搞定了。"
G["Thanks!  I'll try it right now."]="谢谢提醒！我现在就去试试。"
G["Thanks! I don't like the Alliance."]="谢谢！我不喜欢联盟。"
G["Thanks! I don't like the Horde."]="谢谢！我不喜欢部落。"
G["Thanks! I'm getting out of here!"]="谢谢！我这就离开这儿！"
G["Thanks! I'm outta here!"]="谢谢！我要离开了！"
G["Thanks! If you uh, need any help, just come pick me up... I mean, come get me and I'll help!"]="谢谢！如果你……嗯，需要帮助的话就来采我……啊，我是说，就来找我，我很乐意帮忙的！"
G["Thanks! Most folk 'round here prefer it over anything from that \"Stormstout Brewery\"."]="¡Gracias! Aquí casi todo el mundo la prefiere a cualquier cosa que sale de esa \"Cervecería del Trueno\"."
G["Thanks! We owe you one!"]="谢谢！我们欠你一份情！"
G["Thanks, $c."]="谢谢你，$c。"
G["Thanks, $g mister:lady;! That guy smelled."]="谢谢你，$g先生:女士;！那家伙可真难闻。"
G["Thanks, $n!"]="谢谢你，$n！"
G["Thanks, $n! How many times have you saved my life now? Three? That makes us blood in my book!"]="¡Gracias, $n! ¿Cuántas veces me has salvado la vida ya? ¿Tres? ¡Puedes considerarte mi $ghermano:hermana;!"
G["Thanks, $n! I should be able to get back on my own. Come see me later if you need any provisions for the road."]="谢谢你，$n！我自己能回去。如果你需要补给，就回来找我吧。"
G["Thanks, $n! You're the hero of Un'Goro Crater!"]="¡Gracias, $n! ¡Eres $gel héroe:la heroína; del cráter de Un'Goro!"
G["Thanks, $n."]="谢谢你，$n。"
G["Thanks, $n.  I'll be selling those drinks in no time!"]="谢谢，$n。我会立刻出售这些饮料！"
G["Thanks, $n.  If you hadn't shown up I'm sure we would have been dead meat!  Now the only thing between us and the chief troll is that door yonder..."]="谢谢你，$n。你出现的真是时候，我差一点就死于非命了！现在我们只差打破这扇门就能面对巨魔酋长了……"
G["Thanks, $n. You still owe me that money, $g man : lady;!"]="谢谢你，$n。但你欠我的钱还是得还，$g先生:女士;！"
G["Thanks, $p! I thought I was done for."]="谢谢你，$p！我以为自己死定了。"
G["Thanks, $p! I'll tell my pa you helped me see the world!"]="谢谢你，$p！我要告诉爸爸，说你带我出来见了世面！"
G["Thanks, $p! They were going to eat me!"]="谢谢你，$p！它们要吃掉我！"
G["Thanks, $r! I'm sure my dad will reward you greatly! Bye!"]="谢谢，$R！我的父亲一定会好好奖励你的！再见！"
G["Thanks, Benjamin!"]="谢谢你，本杰明！"
G["Thanks, Charys. C'mon Paige, sweetie."]="谢谢你，查瑞斯。派格，小甜心，快过来。"
G["Thanks, I needed that."]="谢谢，这正是我需要的。"
G["Thanks, I should've never left Silverpine Forest."]="谢谢你，我永远都不会再离开银松森林了。"
G["Thanks, Martha! I owe you one."]="马尔萨，谢谢你！我欠你一份情。"
G["Thanks, Ragged John. Your story was very uplifting and informative."]="谢谢你，约翰。你的故事振奋人心，使我受益匪浅。"
G["Thanks, Wikky!"]="谢谢，光板儿！"
G["Thanks, boss!"]="¡Gracias, $gjefe:jefa;!"
G["Thanks, buddy! Let's see if I can't get this hunk o' junk movin' faster!"]="谢谢你，伙计！让我瞧瞧要如何让这个笨家伙移动得快一点！"
G["Thanks, buddy! Thanks for nothing!"]="谢谢你！谢谢你一点忙都不帮！"
