G["Thanks, but I'm not very hungry right now."]="谢谢你，但我现在并不是很饿。"
G["Thanks, friend. Looking for another to join your group?"]="谢谢你，朋友。你的队伍还需要人吗？"
G["Thanks, friend. My rocket jump fizzled."]="Gracias, $gamigo:amiga;. Mi salto de cohete me ha salido rana."
G["Thanks, friend. That was some firefight, but I knew that blue would pull through!"]="谢谢，朋友。真是枪林弹雨啊，但我知道联盟的蓝色一定会全线告捷！"
G["Thanks, friend. We owe ya one."]="谢谢你，朋友。我们欠你个人情。"
G["Thanks, friend. Will you help me get out of here?"]="Gracias, $gamigo:amiga;. ¿Me ayudarás a salir de aquí?"
G["Thanks, just put that anywhere."]="谢谢，随便放在哪里都行。"
G["Thanks, mon. You've been true to your word and I can respect that."]="谢谢你，伙计。你实现了自己的诺言，我很钦佩。"
G["Thanks."]="谢谢！"
G["Thanks. How can I help?"]="谢谢。我能帮什么忙吗？"
G["Thanks. I was almost out. So hungry!"]="谢谢，我几乎不行了。实在太饿了！"
G["Thanks. Now, let's blow up that cave!"]="谢谢你。现在，让我们把这洞穴炸烂吧！"
G["Thanks. That beast was a handful!"]="谢谢。那家伙可真难缠！"
G["Thanks..."]="谢谢……"
G["Thanks... I think."]="谢谢……我想。"
G["Thanks... this'll give us a couple more hours of not running into the rocks.  No guarantees after that."]="谢谢……这样的话，我们还可以坚持几个小时，不跑进岩石里去。但那以后，我就没办法做任何保证了。"
G["Thanksh everybody for sheeing me... Todaysh a day that we should all... fall.. shmall... No... CALL! That's it... We should all call Thrall small... That way he'll know we love the Horde.  FOR THE SHWORD!"]="感谢大家……今天我们要……要……是啦！其实……我们要叫萨……萨尔老大……和吉……吉……反……反正……他会明白我们是热爱部落的。部……部落万岁！"
G["Thanksh for thinkin' of me, buddy. No one elshe doesh."]="谢谢你这么为我着想，哥们。只有你才会这样想着我。"
G["Thanksh!"]="感谢！"
G["Thar she be! Ain't she a beaut?"]="就是她！很漂亮吧？"
G["Thar she blows!"]="一炮轰成渣啊！"
G["Tharnariun, I have lost the trap. Could you please give me another?"]="萨纳瑞恩，我把捕兽器弄丢啦。你能再给我一个吗？"
G["Tharon'ja has a use for your mortal shell!"]="你的躯壳对萨隆亚还有些用处！"
G["Tharon'ja sees all! The work of mortals shall not end the eternal dynasty!"]="萨隆亚已经预见了一切！凡人的徒劳努力根本无法毁灭永恒的王朝！"
G["Thas'it! Pulverize the beach! Leave nuthin' but ... sand."]="就是这样！轰平那片海滩！除了沙子，什么都不留。"
G["Thassarian!  You're alive!"]="萨萨里安！你还活着！"
G["That $n wants me dead!  Help!"]="那个$n要杀我！救命！"
G["That Aimee has some sweet pies."]="艾美那里有很多好吃的馅饼。"
G["That Bramblestaff boy is down in the wilds, fraternizing with those \"night elves\" at the place they call \"the Incursion\". He's looking for trouble, if you ask me.\n\nYou want to join him?"]="Ese chico Vara Enzarzada está en los bosques, fraternizando con esos \"elfos de la noche\" en el lugar que ellos denominan \"la Incursión\". Está buscando problemas, si quieres mi opinión.\n\n¿Quieres unirte a él?"
G["That Bramblestaff boy is down in the wilds, fraternizing with those \"tauren\" at Dawnchaser Retreat. He's looking for trouble, if you ask me.\n\nYou want to join him?"]="Ese chico Vara Enzarzada está en los bosques, fraternizando con esos \"tauren\" en el Retiro del Cazador del Alba. Está buscando problemas, si quieres mi opinión.\n\n¿Quieres unirte a él?"
G["That Bramblestaff boy is down in the wilds, fraternizing with those \"tauren\" at Thunder Cleft. He's looking for trouble, if you ask me.\n\nYou want to join him?"]="Ese chico Vara Enzarzada está en los bosques, fraternizando con esos \"tauren\" en Grieta del Trueno. Está buscando problemas, si quieres mi opinión.\n\n¿Quieres unirte a él?"
G["That Bramblestaff boy is down in the wilds, fraternizing with those night elves at their base camp. He's looking for trouble, if you ask me.\n\nYou want to join him?"]="那个棘杖家的小子成天在野外游荡，和营地里的暗夜精灵打成了一片。依我看，他这是在找麻烦。\n\n你也想加入他？"
G["That Broken worm gave you that staff, didn't he?  Did he also tell you he's the one that sold out his tribe?  No matter, you will both pay for this!"]="是那个破碎者渣滓给你这根法杖的吧？他有没有告诉你，他就是那个出卖自己同胞的家伙？无所谓，你们两个都会为此付出代价的！"
G["That Broken worm!  Did he come clean to you!?  Did he tell you he's the one that sold out his tribe to my master?"]="那个破碎者渣滓！他把什么都告诉你了吗？！他有没有告诉你，他就是那个把自己的部族出卖给我的主人的家伙？"
G["That Curse of Ultimate Doom looks pretty dangerous! Dispel it, quick!"]="那个终极厄运诅咒看起来很危险！驱散它，快！"
G["That DID take a long time!"]="真是花了很长时间！"
G["That Duke Studlington's a jerk.  He talks a big game, but can barely lift his own sword.  Oh, and yeah that's not his real name, as I'm sure you guessed."]="斯特林顿公爵就是个渣渣。他吹牛吹得厉害，但连自己的剑都拿不起来。啊，没错，他的名字也是瞎编的，我相信你肯定猜到了。"
G["That Eunice Burch in Trade Quarter."]="贸易区的那个尤奈斯·伯奇。"
G["That Granis Swiftaxe could drink a fish under the table and yet his axe still swings true.  However, if yer looking for training, ye best catch him while ye can understand him."]="格兰尼斯·快斧能把一条鱼给喝趴下，而且还能把斧头抡得虎虎生风。如果你想接受训练的话，就去找他吧。"
G["That I must fight against my own kind deeply saddens me."]="我必须跟同族作战，这令我非常伤心。"
G["That Jade Witch is super spooky."]="那个青玉巫婆超级恐怖的。"
G["That Jones..."]="这个琼斯……"
G["That Jormund Stonebrow has a knack for the needle, he does.  Should you be needing some training, then you'll find him at Stonebrow's Clothier on the northern side of The Great Forge."]="约莫德·石眉对缝纫有独到之处，真的。如果你想接受训练的话，就去大熔炉北边的石眉布衣店找他吧。"
G["That Kel'Thuzad is nothing but a troublemaker. If he keeps it up he'll get himself in hot water again."]="克尔苏加德是个纯粹的捣乱分子。如果他还这样，早晚会再次惹祸上身。"
G["That Lumak... always fishing instead of fighting.  You'll find him out on his dock on the lake in the Valley of Honor.  While you're there say hi to Shankys for me."]="鲁玛克……总是在荣誉谷的湖边钓鱼。你找到他后，顺便帮我向山吉斯问好。"
G["That Malfurion... fitting of him to send his $r underling to speak with me.\n\nHe has proven himself a coward, as always."]="那个玛法里奥……他只会派手下来找我。\n\n他就是个懦夫，一直都是。"
G["That Saurok's making off with our loot, get him!"]="那个蜥蜴人在偷我们的战利品，抓住他！"
G["That Schnottz is a madman! I ain't never goin' back!"]="那个司克诺兹是个疯子！我绝对不会回去！"
G["That Shaffar is a clever one. He's rigged the entrance with some sort of ward to prevent other ethereal groups from entering. We're working on breaking through his defenses so we can get in there and take what's ours. I've got top ethereals working on this around the clock. We'll have it open any minute now. I can feel it..."]="沙法尔真是个聪明的混蛋。他在入口装上了一些防护装置来阻止其他虚灵进入。我们正在想办法击溃他的防线，以便进去拿回属于我们的东西。我已经让最好的虚灵们在这里日以继夜地工作了。很快就可以打开它了。我的预感越来越强烈了……"
G["That Wanderbrew? Why would a Goldendraft ever know where a Wanderbrew is? Their family has always been a scar on our beautiful town's reputation.\n\nTo make things worse, that filthy creaton is probably making eyes at my daughter. That I will not have!\n\nIf you see either him or my daughter you tell them as much for me."]="那个游酒家的家伙？为什么一个金酿家的人要知道游酒家的人在哪儿呢？他们家族只会让我们美丽的小镇蒙羞。\n\n更可恶的是，那个卑鄙肮脏的家伙好像盯上我的女儿了。我绝不允许这种事发生！\n\n如果你看到他或是我女儿，帮我多说说他们两个。"
G["That William is so funny. His face always turns bright red."]="威廉真有趣。他常常脸红。"
G["That all sounds very complicated..."]="听上去很复杂……"
G["That all ya got?!"]="你就这点能耐？！"
G["That all you've got?!"]="你就这点能耐？！"
G["That apprentice of yours ran off with my daughter again."]="我的女儿又跟你的学徒跑了。"
G["That bad, eh?"]="这很糟，不是吗？"
G["That be property 'o the Southsea Freebooters now, landlubber!"]="那现在是南海海盗的财产了，旱鸭子！"
G["That beast came from nowhere!"]="那家伙简直神出鬼没！"
G["That being the fresh piece of land just off the coast of the Eastern Kingdoms."]="那还是东部王国海岸边的处女地呢。"
G["That bell's capable of turning a normal army into killin' machines!"]="那口钟能够把普通的军队变成杀戮机器！"
G["That better be finished by the time Prince Arthas returns!"]="最好在阿尔萨斯王子回来之前完工！"
G["That better be the last one that blows up on our watch. They're paying top dollar for these things."]="但愿这是最后一辆毁在我们手里的器械。他们可是为这些东西花了大价钱的。"
G["That bitch Sylvanas sent you too, did she? No matter, your journey ends in agony."]="那个该死的希尔瓦娜斯又派你来了？没关系，来迎接你痛苦的末日吧。"
