G["That brute has the key."]="那个家伙有钥匙。"
G["That bum Leland... all he does is sit out on the dock outside the Trade District and fish all day.  I sure hope he's good at it for all the time he spends fishing.  If you want to learn, why don't you go talk to him?"]="那个游手好闲的利兰……他整天就在贸易区外的码头边钓鱼。他在钓鱼上花费这许多时间，我想他的钓鱼技术一定很高。如果你想学的话，为什么不去跟他谈谈呢？"
G["That cage was stifling my magic."]="这个笼子困住了我的魔法。"
G["That cannon is huge!"]="那个大炮好大啊！"
G["That cat-creature chained back there looks like he wants to talk.  Maybe he can help us... but be careful."]="锁在后面的那只像猫一样的家伙好像有话要说。也许他能帮到我们……但一定要小心。"
G["That certainly wasn't the reaction I wanted."]="这不是我想要的结果。"
G["That coded message is the only clue we have."]="那封密信是我们手中唯一的线索了。"
G["That concludes our lesson."]="我们的课程结束了。"
G["That could have gone better, $n.  Come, I have something for you."]="还可以更好一些，$n。过来，我有东西给你。"
G["That could have gone better. $n, come here, please. I have something I need you to take care of for me."]="不要感到诧异，$n，请过来。我有东西需要你帮我处理下。"
G["That crash between here and Razor Hill really messed up the brew flow!  It doesn't help that Dark Iron dwarves seem to be attacking every hour or so!\n\nSo if you want to help, here's the deal.  I'll let you borrow some reins and one of my rams.\n\nEvery time you bring me a keg, I'll give you some tokens.  I'll even let you use the ram for a bit longer for every keg you bring me!\n\nBUT, once you start this, you won't be able to do it again until tomorrow.\n\nAre you sure you're ready to do this?"]="¡El accidente de Cerrotajo está entorpeciendo la llegada de la cerveza! ¡Y los ataques de los enanos Hierro Negro cada hora no están ayudando!\n\nAsí que si quieres ayudar, este es el trato: te prestaré unas riendas y uno de mis carneros.\n\nPor cada barril que me traigas te daré unas fichas. Hasta dejaré que te quedes con el carnero un ratito más por cada barril\n\n¡PERO una vez que empieces, no podrás repetirlo hasta mañana.\n\n¿Estás seguro de que estás preparado?"
G["That crate won't deliver itself, friend. Get a move on!"]="Esa caja no se va a entregar sola, $gamigo:amiga;. ¡Muévete!"
G["That cursed Jonah Sterling will lead us right into doom.  If he spent more time outside of his cave, he would realize the folly of attacking professional navies in a time of war."]="约纳·斯特林这个蠢货迟早要害死我们。如果他多花点时间观察局势的话，就会明白在战争期间攻击职业海军是件多么愚蠢的事。"
G["That cursed crystal! We will not give up so easily. We will have that tablet for our ascendants. Perhaps not today, but soon!"]="该死的水晶！我们不会这样轻易就放弃。我们一定会把这块石板献给我们的先祖。也许不是今天，但这一天很快就要来了！"
G["That day is not today..."]="但，不是今天……"
G["That definitely ended our business relationship with Kael'thas.  Please stay here.  I will return shortly and there is something that I want you to do."]="这肯定会中断我们和凯尔萨斯之间的一切交易关系。请待在这里，我会很快回来，有些事情想让你去做。"
G["That depends on what your definition of \"is\"... is."]="Eso depende de cuál sea tu definición de \"es\"..."
G["That did NOT just happen!"]="怎么会这样！"
G["That did the trick! The control room should be right behind this... oh... wow..."]="成功了！控制室应该就在这后面……哦……喔……"
G["That doesn't even tickle."]="那连挠痒痒都算不上。"
G["That doesn't make any sense. Doublecheck your work."]="那说不通。再好好检查一下。"
G["That doesn't sound good!"]="听上去很糟糕！"
G["That door didn't even budge..."]="这门连动都没动一下……"
G["That dumb cricket keeps me up at night.  Don't tell Uncle, but I want you to squash it!"]="那个白痴蟋蟀害得我整晚都睡不着觉。别告诉我叔叔，你帮我去踩死它吧！"
G["That encampment has been begging for our attention. Let's get this done."]="那营地一直在试图得到我们的关注。我们去解决这件事。"
G["That enough!"]="够了！"
G["That explosion was great! Did you see how big it was?"]="爆炸很强烈！你看到那有多厉害了吗？"
G["That felt kinda good!"]="这感觉挺不错！"
G["That fight was savage and brutal. I haven't seen a grand melee like that in many years! Amazing!"]="这场战斗真是野蛮残忍至极。我已经有许多年没见到过如此大规模的战斗了！实在是令人震惊！"
G["That fool king!!"]="那个愚蠢的国王！！"
G["That foul sea-witch has overpowered our ship! Brace for impact!!!"]="该死的海巫击垮了我们的舰船！抓紧了！！！"
G["That foul thing got stains all over my new robes!"]="这个脏东西让我的新袍子上全是污渍！"
G["That funny."]="太可笑了。"
G["That giant squid didn't stand a chance. The Verne's already rearmed and ready for another go... now we just wait.\n\nIt'll be back.\n\nYou'll see."]="那只巨型鱿鱼就要完蛋了。凡尔纳已经重整装备，准备再次上阵……现在，我们只需要耐心等待。\n\n它会回来的。\n\n你就看着吧。"
G["That goes for all of you traitorous scum who supported this fool!"]="还有你们——与这蠢货同流合污的叛徒渣滓！"
G["That gold is ours!  Open fire, says I!"]="那金子是我们的！开火，这是命令！"
G["That group that recently arrived from Honor Hold -- they're mercs!  They're starting to stir up trouble.  Maybe I should have a talk with them?"]="最近从荣耀堡来的那些人——他们是雇佣兵！他们正在挑起是非，也许我应该和他们谈谈？"
G["That grouping looks promising."]="那簇水晶似乎有异样。"
G["That guano's not going to collect itself!"]="总得有人去收集粪便啊！"
G["That guy sure had a lot of guns."]="天哪，那家伙绝对有两把刷子。"
G["That had to hurt! Brains!"]="这一定很痛！脑子！"
G["That has to be the biggest $n I have ever seen... and it's coming right for us!"]="¡Es $gel:la; $n más grande que he visto nunca... y viene directo hacia nosotros!"
G["That he is, Dalfors..."]="他会的，达尔弗斯……"
G["That heap o' rubble yonder was me family's homestead fer five generations.\n\nWe're takin' it back.\n\nWe're outnumbered... But we're Wildhammer! Are yeh with me?"]="远处的那片碎石堆曾经是我们家族传承了五代的产业。\n\n我们正在把它夺回来。\n\n敌人的数量远远超过我们……但我们是蛮锤氏族！你愿意帮助我们吗？"
G["That hermit Mallory is known to concoct some potions for the local townsfolk on occasion.  He has a cottage in the hills between Stormwind and Northshire."]="听说那个隐士玛洛瑞有时会为当地居民配制药剂，他居住在暴风城和北郡之间的小山上。"
G["That hit the shpot! Gimmie anudder one, Coot! *hic*"]="这酒可真够劲儿的！再……再来一杯！*嗝儿*"
G["That how it done, slave thing. Maybe you figure out how someday."]="奴隶，看清楚了吧。或许有一天你也能领悟这一招。"
G["That hurt!"]="真疼！"
G["That hurt."]="好痛。"
G["That intolerant dirtbag finally got what was coming to him. Good riddance!"]="那个愚蠢的家伙真是罪有应得！"
G["That is *exactly* what I wanted to hear. Thanks."]="这“正是”我想要听到的。谢谢你。"
G["That is a dangerous train of thought.  If something was truly amiss, Soridormi would be the first to know."]="那是个危险的想法。要是真的出了差错，索莉多米肯定会第一个察觉的。"
G["That is a fine weapon indeed $n. You guide the spirits like few I have ever known. Listen to them and they will guide you as you have guided them. Go, seek out the Orc known as Kelgruk Bloodaxe. He does not speak with the spirits but he does listen, and his weapons are the finest I have ever laid my eyes upon."]="$n，你制作的这件武器确实很不错。你对指引钢铁灵魂的方法也已经非常精通了。聆听它们的呼声，它们就会像你指引它们一样指引你。去吧，去找那个名叫克尔格鲁克·血斧的兽人。他没有和钢铁的灵魂交谈过，但是他很善于倾听，他制作的武器是我见过的最好的武器。"
G["That is all that is to be said. Come, take your reward. And remember what you have learned today."]="要说的就这么多。来吧，拿上你的奖赏。记住你今天学到的一切。"
G["That is an awfully impressive weapon for someone that comes in peace, stranger."]="Es un arma muy imponente para alguien que viene en son de paz, $gforastero:forastera;."
G["That is correct!"]="答对了！"
G["That is enough for now. Come."]="先说到这里吧，来。"
G["That is enough!"]="停手！"
G["That is enough."]="停手。"
G["That is for Naisha!"]="这一下是为了奈莎！"
G["That is most unfortunate."]="那可真是太不幸了。"
G["That is much better."]="感觉好多了。"
G["That is none of your concern, Helcular, as you are neither Kirin Tor nor a necromancer."]="这和你无关，赫尔库拉，你既不是肯瑞托的一员也不是一个通灵师。"
G["That is not even remotely imaginable!"]="简直是遥不可及！"
G["That is part of the test. Yes... to succeed, you must focus all your energy into one fist..."]="这只是测试的一部分。是的，要想成功，你必须将全身力量集中在一只拳头上……"
G["That is powerful healing!"]="真是强大的治疗啊！"
G["That is precisely why I have called for you old friend. We have much to discuss."]="这正是我叫你老朋友的原因。我们得好好谈谈。"
G["That is precisely why I wish to conserve our strength today."]="这正是我今天决定保存实力的原因。"
G["That is quite an accusation, Moira. It's hardly your throne room in the first place."]="这指控可真荒诞啊，茉艾拉。首先，这就不能算是你的宫殿。"
G["That is quite an impressive beast you have there, Manipulator. Very intriguing."]="操纵者，你的这头野兽真是令人印象深刻。非常有趣。"
G["That is some first-rate harpoonery!"]="那简直是一流的叉鱼技术！"
G["That is strange..."]="这真奇怪……"
G["That is terrible."]="那可真糟糕。"
G["That is the wrong answer, $n. Be off with you."]="答案错误，$n。走吧。"
G["That is tragic. How did this happen?"]="真惨。这是怎么发生的？"
G["That is what these structures that litter the landscape are called. The Legion have employed the mo'arg and gan'arg to build weapons of mass destruction at these mobile forge camps. Let us not find out what it is that they intend to build here in Nagrand!\n\nYou will be my eyes. Your weapons will be my fury."]="那是他们的这些邪恶的建筑物的名称。燃烧军团雇用了莫尔葛恶魔和甘尔葛恶魔，在这些营地中建造具备大规模杀伤能力的武器。有了结界的存在，我就不能发现他们正在纳格兰建造些什么！\n\n你将是我的眼睛。你的武器将是我的愤怒。"
G["That is where the skull of Gul'dan is being kept! These paltry demons will not prevent me from claiming it!"]="这里就是收藏古尔丹之颅的地方！这些低贱的恶魔不可能阻止我！"
G["That is where you are wrong, Garrosh."]="你错了，加尔鲁什。"
G["That is where you come in, heroes. The war for Stratholme is not yet over. Leave this area and travel east to the Eastwall Gate. It is the service entrance to the city, and the last remaining opening into Lord Aurius Rivendare's scourge-infested domain. If we defeat him, Stratholme will be ours once more."]="这里正需要你们，英雄们。斯坦索姆之战还没有结束。你们应该向东进发，前往东墙大门。那里是这座城市的出入口，也是能够进入瑞文戴尔男爵的天灾军团领地的唯一通道。如果我们能把他打败，斯坦索姆将再一次完全属于我们。"
G["That is wonderous, Rimblat! Even this foul, sundered earth is not beyond healing."]="这太神奇了，雷布拉特！即使是被污染成这样的破碎大地，也能得到滋润与修复。"
G["That island on the horizon is our destination."]="海平线上的岛就是我们的目的地！"
G["That island over there is full of Obsidium creatures! I'd go over there myself, but I can't get across the bridge."]="那边那座岛上到处都是黑曜石生物！我本该自己去的，可又过不了那座桥。"
G["That isn't Shin.  It looks super lifelike though."]="这个不是阿信。不过它看上去真是活灵活现。"
G["That it is. You speak with a wisdom beyond your years. If we get through this, I think I'd like to know more about where you are from."]="很好。在你的言辞间我看到了超乎年龄的睿智。等这一切结束之后，我很愿意进一步了解你的来历。"
G["That joke kills me!"]="真是笑死我了！"
G["That joke's hot."]="那笑话真好笑。"
G["That joke... I swear I laugh every time!"]="那个笑话……我发誓我每次听到都会笑！"
G["That kind of magic is just bad news, I tell ye.  I don't know why that Grimrizz has been allowed to set up outside the Thunderbrew Distillery of all places!  You stay away from him, you here!"]="我告诉你，掌握那种魔法可不是什么好事。我不知道为什么他们会允许吉姆瑞兹在雷酒酿制厂外面安营扎寨！离他远点！"
G["That kodo sure is a beauty.  Wait a minute, where are my bifocals?  Perhaps you should inspect the beast for me."]="那只科多兽真美。等等，我的眼镜在哪儿？也许你该帮我照看这头野兽。"
G["That lake near here actually full of sea things. Not sure how it all get here... maybe in floods?"]="附近的湖里全是海洋生物。不知道是怎么来的……莫非是洪水？"
G["That last paladin offered me eternal salvation!"]="那圣骑给我来了个永久的拯救祝福！"
G["That last priest had me smitten!"]="我对最后那个牧师一见钟情！"
G["That last shaman really knew his place!"]="刚才那个萨满祭司站位不错！"
G["That last time was just practice, right? You've got this!"]="上一轮不过是热身而已！这次你一定要成功！"
G["That liquid... it reeks!"]="这液体……真是难闻！"
G["That look in his eyes now... it scares me."]="他现在的眼神……让我感到害怕。"
G["That look like it hurt. No hit us like that, okay?"]="它好像受了重伤。别像那样对待我们，好不好？"
G["That look painful."]="看上去很痛苦的样子。"
G["That looked a bit painful."]="尝到痛苦的滋味了吧。"
G["That looks fun! I wanna drive, but the orphan matron says I can't get a mount 'til I'm older."]="这看上去真有趣！我真想自己驾驶一下。但监护员说我年纪还太小，不能有坐骑。"
G["That looks like... my father!"]="那看起来像是……我父亲！"
G["That machine is a piece of junk.  But once you are done using it, come see me for your first aid needs, $c."]="那台机器简直就是一堆垃圾。你用过它之后，可以到我这里来接受紧急治疗服务，$c。"
G["That machine is too powerful for us alone, quickly, before we are spotted!"]="我们可没法就靠这么点人搞定那台机器，趁我们还没被发现，快跑！"
G["That made me hungry."]="我觉得肚子饿了。"
G["That makes sense!"]="这很有意义！"
G["That makes sense, I suppose. Just doesn't feel right..."]="有点道理。只是感觉有些不对劲儿……"
G["That malfunctioning piece of junk was murder on the repair bills."]="这下不用再为那堆垃圾付修理费了。"
G["That man be nuthin' but a fool!\n\nFame, fortune? Phooey! This place be nuthin' but a deathtrap, mon!\n\nI seen all kinds a' trolls in my day, but these, they be different - sneaky, strong, tricky.\n\nSeemed to me like they knew we was comin'...."]="¡Ese hombre no es más que un loco! ¿Fama... fortuna...? ¡Puff! ¡Este lugar no es más que una trampa mortal, tío!\n\nHe visto todo tipo de trols en mi vida, pero estos son diferentes: escurridizos, fuertes, tramposos.\n\nMe daba la sensación de que sabían que veníamos..."
G["That man didn't pay me enough to put up with this blowhard..."]="我凭什么要忍受这个自吹自擂的家伙……"
G["That man was Genn Greymane and that impossible choice was Gilneas!"]="那个人就是吉恩·格雷迈恩，而那个“不可能”的选择就是吉尔尼斯！"
G["That man's bound ta get all jealous, an' I don't want him poppin' a cap inta the royal son."]="那个男人肯定会非常嫉妒，而我可不想他为了我和王子闹矛盾。"
G["That mantid is its host.  Chain it down.  We will rip the hatred from its body!"]="那个螳螂妖就是它的宿主。用锁链锁住它，逼出恨之煞！"
G["That may be, but it was no one's fault."]="或许吧，但这并不是谁的错。"
G["That may not be true Hou. The Lorewalker seems confident. What will your protection cost us?"]="那也许不是真的，侯。游学者似乎很有信心。你的保护要让我们付出什么代价？"
G["That means the mantid queen is involved in this... somehow."]="这就是说螳螂妖女皇也牵扯其中……不知何故。"
G["That meat smells so good."]="那块肉闻起来真香。"
G["That merchant already paid... now it's your turn!"]="¡Ese comerciante ya pagó... ¡ahora es tu turno!"
G["That might be, but I don't need to stand on holy ground to run that disembodied heart of yours with the Ashbringer."]="或许吧。就算我的双脚没有踏在圣地上，也能用灰烬使者摧毁你的徽记。"
G["That no good kiss-up is probably practicing ballet in his chambers."]="那个马屁精大概正在房间里练习芭蕾舞吧。"
G["That not nice!"]="那样可不太好！"
G["That ogre is just the first sign that war is upon us.  The fruit vendor has gone too far."]="那个食人魔就是他要发动战争的迹象。水果贩已经坏了道上的规矩！"
G["That one died so quickly! Perhaps his brothers can put up more of a fight!"]="那家伙死得太快了！也许他的兄弟可以撑得更久一些！"
G["That one dream... The crazy one. Remember?"]="那个梦……那个疯狂的梦。记得吗？"
G["That one is WEAK."]="一个弱者。"
G["That one is unworthy of your group."]="这家伙只会拖你们后腿。"
G["That one maybe not so good to eat now. Stupid Garfrost! BAD! BAD!"]="这个好像不……不太好吃。加弗斯特真笨！真笨！"
G["That one tickled..."]="这一鞭就跟挠痒似的……"
G["That one was already in my sights!"]="那是我先看见的！"
G["That one where I'm in Durnholde and that one orc that Blackmoore keeps as his personal slave breaks out..."]="我还梦到敦霍尔德，布莱克摩尔那个的兽人奴隶逃跑了……"
G["That one where thousands of people are all watching us from up in the sky..."]="那是个成千上万的人们都从天上看着我们的地方……"
G["That one's a brother.  A forsaken.  Treat him with respect."]="它取自我们的同胞。被遗忘者。对他尊重些。"
G["That one's a male tauren.  A shaman.  He was infected and killed before he could cure himself."]="男性牛头人的血样。这位萨满祭司被感染后，还没来得及治愈自己就被杀掉了。"
G["That one's empty!!"]="喝空的！！"
G["That one's for Theramore!"]="那一炮是为塞拉摩！"
G["That one's for you, Gizmo!"]="这场胜利是送给你的，吉兹莫！"
G["That one's free of charge, $g sir : ma'am;."]="这次是免费的，$g先生:女士;。"
G["That one's huge. You shouldn't have made him angry."]="那家伙可真大。你不该激怒他。"
G["That one's skin may be red, but his belly is yellow!"]="那家伙的毛皮可能是红色的，但是他的肚子是黄色的！"
G["That one, Malagan. I know $g him:her;. Dependable, brave, and trustworthy. $n is $g his:her; name."]="$gEse:Esa;, Malagan. $gLo:La; conozco. $gDigno:Digna; de confianza, valiente y fiable. Su nombre es $n."
G["That one, over there. Target them. Do NOT let them get past you!"]="注意那边。好好瞄准他们。不要放过他们！"
G["That one? Well done. It's the best here."]="那个？好样的。这可是这边最好的。"
G["That oughta do it!"]="应该能行！"
G["That oughta do it! Just a few more seconds now."]="就快搞定啦！再给我几秒钟。"
G["That our lives... our lives are worth living."]="因为我们的生命……是值得延续的生命。"
G["That oversized toy is no match for me!"]="那个超大号的玩具根本不是我的对手！"
G["That poor creature. It's so thin... it must be starving."]="可怜的小东西。骨瘦如柴……一定饿坏了。"
G["That poor village was ambushed when the Zandalari arrived. They don't even have any skilled fighters to defend themselves! You have to help them. Shin will make sure you get to the village safely."]="赞达拉部族伏击了那些可怜的村民。他们手无寸铁，根本无法保护自己！你必须帮帮他们。阿信会确保你能够安全抵达那个村子。"
G["That pygmy helm should fool them, at least for a little while. Get back to town!"]="那个俾格米头盔应该能蒙住他们，至少能拖住一阵子。快回城！"
G["That rat over there looks mean.  I wonder if it has rabies."]="那只老鼠看上去情绪很低迷。我猜想它是不是有什么病。"
G["That reminds me, I'm going to need to find something to eat soon. As to what the Alliance has been cooking up, I'm told that $2092w out of $2093w rainbow fin albacore have been packed away. As well, $2098w of $2099w roast raptor and $2101w out of $2103w spotted yellowtail have been prepared and are currently in cold storage awaiting transport to Cenarion Hold in Silithus."]="这倒提醒我了，我得去找点吃的。据说联盟已经收集到$2092w条彩鳍鱼、$2098w块烤迅猛龙肉和$2101w条斑点黄尾鱼，而总的需求量分别是$2093w、$2099w和$2103w。一旦收集完毕，这些食物就将被运往希利苏斯的塞纳里奥要塞。"
G["That rescue came just in time. Ya shoulda seen what them brutes did to their prisoners...."]="你真像一场及时雨。瞧瞧那帮野蛮人是如何对待囚犯的……"
G["That right? Well why don't you go prance your merry little self over and grab them, eh?"]="是吗？既然如此，你为什么不自己跳过去取回工具呢？"
G["That rocket looks unsafe even by our standards!"]="即使以我们的标准来看，那个火箭也不安全！"
G["That seems to have done the trick."]="看起来，这很有效。"
G["That shield-toss worked remarkably well.  Quickly, hurl my holy shoulder-plate!"]="那个盾牌扔得真好。快，再把我的神圣肩甲扔过去！"
G["That ship's been commissioned by Hellscream himself."]="这是由地狱咆哮亲自派来的。"
G["That should complete the enchantment. Here is your new staff, $n. Always use it in service to the Horde."]="这样应该就能完成附魔步骤了。$n，给你新的法杖。用它来为部落建功吧。"
G["That should do it!"]="这样应该就行了！"
G["That should do it! Hiccup!"]="真棒！嗝儿！"
G["That should do it.  The teleporter should blow any second now!"]="这样应该就可以了。传送器随时可能爆炸！"
G["That should do it. The gate's primary locking mechanism has been nullified."]="这样应该就没问题了。这扇大门的机关已经被解除了。"
G["That should do it..."]="这就应该能行了……"
G["That should do the job. Come back right away if it falls off again."]="这样就没问题了。如果它再掉下来，就回来找我。"
G["That should do the trick."]="这样应该就可以了。"
G["That should get Telaar the assistance it needs!"]="这样塔拉就应该能得到它所需要的援助了！"
G["That should slow the infection down a little."]="这样或许可以延缓感染的速度。"
G["That should slow you down."]="放慢你的脚步。"
G["That should take care of that. Summon me if you have further need of my services."]="应该没问题了。如果你还需要我的话，召唤我。"
G["That simply will not suffice."]="那还远远不够。"
G["That single moment is all a demon needs to wreak havoc. The Burning Legion has watched us for millenia, always waiting for the smallest rift to slip through, the smallest stirring to whisper from."]="可恶魔只需要那片刻的时间就能造成浩劫。燃烧军团已经盯了我们上千年，总是想伺机抓住最小的裂隙趁虚而入，利用最小的骚动制造混乱。"
G["That sounds dangerous."]="那听上去很危险。"
G["That sounds fine to me."]="听起来不错嘛。"
G["That sounds serious."]="听起来情况相当严重。"
G["That spell should wipe their memories of us and what just happened. All they should remember now is what reality would be like without the attempted temporal interference. Well done. Thrall will journey on to find his destiny, and Taretha..."]="这个法术应该可以清除他们对我们和刚才所发生的事情的记忆。他们现在所要记住的是没有被干涉过的历史。干得好，萨尔会继续旅行以找寻他的命运，至于塔蕾莎……"
G["That spineless troll has failed me for the last time.  Anthis!  Break his legs!"]="那个没用的巨魔再度失败了。我的容忍已经到了极限！安希斯！给我打断他的腿！"
G["That statue's provin' ta be quite the pain.  I thought we could lift it up an' outta the water with a crane an' some well timed explosives.  But Wick thought we'd be safer an' do less damage by rolling it up this ramp.\n\nNow look at it...  We've got it angled all wrong.  An' once we get it to the top, then what?\n\nI've gotta bad feeling we're gonna to be here a long time.  A real long time..."]="这尊雕像实在是让人头痛。我本来设想，我们能用一台起重机和几次定向爆破让它浮出水面。但维克认为我们应该采取更加安全和能够减少损伤的办法，就是沿这道斜坡把它滚上去。\n\n现在可好了……我们把它的角度全都弄错了。就算我们把它弄到顶上，又能怎样？\n\n我有一种很糟糕的感觉，我们要在这里耽搁很长时间，很长很长的时间……"
G["That storm pushed us off course. We could be anywhere between Kul Tiras and Lordaeron, so stay sharp!"]="那场风暴将我们吹离了航道。我们可能位于库尔提拉斯和洛丹伦之间的任何地方，所以都给我提高警惕！"
G["That strange girl Sho's been hanging around up the mountain.\n\nNo one knows where she comes from, but she's trained in the assassin's arts.\n\nJust showed up one day to help us with our hozen problem. Nice girl, but she don't talk much."]="那个奇怪的女孩阿烁总是在山上转来转去。\n\n没人知道她从哪儿来，但她受过杀手的训练。\n\n以前帮我们对付猢狲时露过一两手。她是个好女孩，但是话不多。"
G["That sub's gunna blow! We have to move, now!"]="潜艇快爆炸了！我们必须离开，快！"
G["That sure turned sour quick..."]="真令人失望……"
G["That sure was nice of those spirits to hop into this pot."]="那些水灵会自己跳进锅里，这真是太好了。"
G["That swarm is what we have to look forward to. Ancestors help us if they decide to turn on the battlefront."]="那便是我们顾虑已久的虫群。如果他们决意突破前线，那我们只有祈求先祖保佑了。"
G["That target didn't stand a chance."]="那个沙袋毫无还手之力。"
G["That terrible glow... should that be?"]="这可怕的光芒……难道是……？"
G["That thar monster be yers, Ed? Arrr... She's a big'un!"]="那个怪物是你的，艾德华？啊……她真大啊！"
G["That the Sironas entity had plans for Saruan... \n\n<The writing stops abruptly and a long line scrolls off the page. This draenei died while making the entry.>"]="Que la entidad Sironas tenía planes para Saruan... \n\n< La escritura se detiene repentinamente y una larga línea se desplaza hasta salirse de la página. Aquel draenei murió mientras escribía.>"
G["That the fates should be so cruel as to permit us only this after a thousand years apart..."]="命运是如此残酷，它让我们在分别了数千年之后才能重逢……"
G["That they are, King Varian. And at the service of the Alliance, I might add."]="确实如此，瓦里安国王。我还想说，愿为联盟效劳。"
G["That thing is seriously scary-looking! You saved our lives, $n!"]="那件事看上去太可怕了！你救了我们的命，$n！"
G["That tough, huh?"]="很困难吗？"
G["That town's so small, I asked a kid to draw me a map. He drew it on the back of a Defias wanted poster..."]="那镇子真小，我让一个小孩给我画张地图。结果他画在了迪菲亚通缉令的背面……"
G["That troll doesn't seem to want to tell me what he knows. You want to take a stab at him, $c?"]="那个巨魔似乎并不打算开口。你想拿他来练练手吗，$c？"
G["That useless blood elf!  We have a DUTY to perform, and he wastes our time!"]="没用的血精灵！我们还有任务，而他却在浪费我们的时间！"
G["That very well may be.  Even fools have uses though.  I keep you around after all."]="也许你说的对。即使是蠢货也能有些用处。我不是照样留下了你。"
G["That vile beast has been driven off, but my precious waters have been tainted! I must cleanse them at once.\n\nIf you insist on lingering here, prepare to defend yourself."]="¡Esa bestia vil ha sido espantada, pero mis preciosas aguas han sido contaminadas! Debo purificarlas inmediatamente.\n\nSi insistís en quedaros aquí, preparaos para defenderos."
G["That wagon break down on you again, Samuel?"]="萨缪尔，你又在为那辆破旧的马车烦恼了是吧？"
G["That warlock certainly didn't summon a Doomguard! Your next challenge will find you fighting knights of the Argent Crusade. Think you're up for the challenge?"]="那名术士肯定没有召唤末日守卫。你在下一场挑战中将和银色十字军作战。做好接受挑战的准备了吗？"
G["That was 54! Soon you'll be congratulating me!"]="54了！准备祝贺我吧！"
G["That was Saurfang's boy - the Horde commander at the Wrath Gate. Such a tragic end..."]="这就是萨鲁法尔的儿子——部落在天谴之门的指挥官。真是个悲剧……"
G["That was a 200 year old Pupellyverbos Port!"]="那是有200年历史的紫葡萄酒！"
G["That was a close one! Well, let's get going, we're almost there."]="真玄啊！继续前进吧，我们就要到了。"
G["That was a close one, $n."]="已经很接近了，$n。"
G["That was a fearsome battle."]="真是可怕的战斗。"
G["That was a fine battle!  The likes of which I have not enjoyed in many decades.  Go and give the boy my blessing."]="真痛快！我已经好多年没打得这么痛快过了。为那个孩子带去我的祝福吧。"
G["That was a good match. Thank you."]="真是场痛快的战斗。谢谢你。"
G["That was a good nap.  Wait, where's my elbows and knees?!"]="这场觉睡得真香。等等，我的胳膊肘和膝盖到哪里去了？！"
G["That was a nice shot... but not perfect. Maybe a bit more to the left."]="射得不错……但还不够完美。稍微往左偏了点。"
G["That was a tough fight. The most we ever have to worry about are saurok raiders or the occassional hungry hozen.\n\nThose trolls... they fight differently."]="真是一场艰苦的战斗。我们从前只需要提防蜥蜴人突袭者和偶尔前来捣乱的饥饿猢狲。\n\n那些巨魔……他们作战的方式很不一样。"
