G["That's good to hear, marshal. While $n has brought the perpetrators to justice, their ringleader is still on the loose. Perhaps with the aid of the Westfall Brigade we will finally be able to solve this case."]="这是个好消息，长官。可尽管$n已经将行凶者绳之以法，但他们的主谋却仍逍遥法外。也许在西部荒野人民军的协助下，我们终于能够了结这个案子。"
