G["That's great, $p. We'll take it from here."]="真是太好了，$p。接下来就交给我们吧。"
G["That's great, just give me the signal for when to drop the binding spells."]="这太好了，一定及时给我信号，让我知道该在什么时候放下那些法术。"
G["That's highly unlikely, brother."]="不可能吧。"
G["That's hot."]="真酷。"
G["That's how it's done class!  You better be paying attention!"]="那就是完成的方法！你最好认真听讲！"
G["That's how it's done!"]="就是这样！"
G["That's how it's done!  Yeah!"]="就是这样！耶！"
G["That's how we do it, lads! Here comes more!"]="就这么打，小伙子们！他们又来了！"
G["That's how you know it's working."]="生效了，等着瞧吧。"
G["That's impossible. Nothing gets through the wall."]="这不可能。没有东西能越过这城墙。"
G["That's in the past, Muradin. Regrets won't change anything."]="那已经是陈年旧事了，穆拉丁。后悔是没有用的。"
G["That's it -- we made it!  The ritual is set in motion, and idol fires are about to go out for good!  You truly are the heroes I thought you would be!"]="很好——我们成功了！雕像中的火焰即将永远熄灭！我就知道你能行的！"
G["That's it for me! No more beer to deliver."]="任务完成！没啤酒要送了。"
G["That's it up ahead."]="镇子就在前面。"
G["That's it!  Bite the sword arm!"]="对！咬持剑的手！"
G["That's it!  I'm tired of helping you out.  It's time we settled things on the battlefield!"]="就这么办吧！我实在是厌倦了事事都帮你。我们到战场上去解决问题吧！"
G["That's it!  It worked!"]="就是它了！成功了！"
G["That's it!  It's all finished, $n."]="就是它了！全做好了，$n。"
G["That's it!  No more beer until this mess is sorted out!"]="好了！把这儿收拾好才能喝酒！"
G["That's it!  You're going down!"]="¡Ya está bien! ¡Estás $gacabado:acabada;!"
G["That's it! Far as I got... Whatd'ya think?"]="好啦！扯远了……你觉得呢？"
G["That's it! No more wagers! Let's see what happens!"]="好了！停止竞猜！我们看比赛吧！"
G["That's it! That's it! I've had just 'bout enough of ya, brother! Ya had to bring in our pappy, didn't ya! Stand up and fight! I don't wanna belt ya while yer sittin' and then hear ya cryin' 'bout it later!"]="够了！别说了！兄弟，我受够你了！干嘛提到爸爸！起来！我要跟你决斗！别坐在那儿挨打，不然待会又要听你抱怨了！"
G["That's it! That's what you were waiting for! KILL THEM!"]="很好！这就是你等待的机会！杀了他们！"
G["That's it! The fight's goin', no more guesses!"]="好了！搏击开始，停止竞猜！"
G["That's it, I've reached my limit! This is quite the haul!"]="够了，这是我的极限了！这可真累人！"
G["That's it, delicate cuts. Let the tree decide."]="好极了，完美的修剪。所谓顺木之天，以致其性。"
G["That's it, everything's been collected by both sides. Now it's all being transported over to Silithus and should be there in less than $2113w days. Once that's done and someone rings the gong on the Scarab Dais with the Scepter of the Shifting Sands, the war is on!"]="好极了，双方都完成了收集工作。现在这些物资都已经运往希利苏斯了，所有的货物预计将在$2113w天内抵达。一旦准备就绪，就会有人使用流沙节杖敲响甲虫之台的铜锣，战争也就开始了！"
G["That's it, everything's been collected by both sides. Now it's all being transported over to Silithus and should be there in less than a day. Once that's done and someone rings the gong on the Scarab Dais with the Scepter of the Shifting Sands, the war is on!"]="好极了，双方都完成了收集工作。现在这些物资都已经运往希利苏斯了，所有的货物预计将在1天内抵达。一旦准备就绪，就会有人使用流沙节杖敲响甲虫之台的铜锣，战争也就开始了！"
G["That's it, lad! It looks totally safe. Go for it, I'll be right behind ya!"]="¡Eso es, $gmuchacho:muchacha;! Parece completamente seguro. Adelante, ¡estaré justo detrás de ti!"
G["That's it, you've done it! The vault door is opening! Now we can... oh, no!"]="你成功了！穹顶的大门被打开了！现在就能……哦，不！"
G["That's it... no more grog for me!"]="够了……我喝不下了！"
G["That's it... you've got this... keep it up..."]="就是这样……你做的很好……坚持住……"
G["That's it: I'm demanding hazard pay after this."]="就这样：这事完了之后，我要申请危险津贴。"
G["That's it? Ya gotta have more than that!"]="就是这样？你要做到的不应该只有这些！"
G["That's me job, $c. The General goes out on patrol, and I carry his banner and plant it in the dirt.\n\nImagine a General out and about without his banner. He might as well not wear pants."]="这是我的工作，$c。将军在巡逻的时候，我扛起他的旗帜，并将旗帜牢牢插在土中。\n\n一位将军怎么可能没有旗帜？他还不如不穿裤子。"
G["That's mighty kind of you, $r."]="你真是太好了，$r。"
G["That's mighty nice of you, sharing such a lucky flower with me."]="你真是太好，送如此幸运的花给我。"
G["That's more like it!"]="那才像样！"
G["That's more like it! Let's get out of here!"]="就要到了！让我们逃离这里！"
G["That's more like it."]="这才像话。"
G["That's more like it. Now off you go. Shoo! You're scaring off the real customers!"]="这还差不多。现在就去吧。嘘！你要吓跑真正的顾客了！"
G["That's my $g boy : girl;! How goes the fight, $n?"]="¡$gEse:Esa; es mi $gchico:chica;! ¿Cómo va la lucha, $n?"
G["That's my $n!"]="¡$gEse:Esa; es mi $n!"
G["That's my 16th and I'm still going easy on ya!"]="第16个。我可是一直让着你的！"
G["That's my 25th kill. How far behind are you now?"]="我杀了25个了。你落后多少呀？"
G["That's my Bruce!"]="这才是我的布鲁斯！"
G["That's my girl, fanning the flames! I like it. Now, which one o' us is brave enough ta pay a little visit to tha Darkspear?"]="多聪明的姑娘！煽风点火！我喜欢这主意。那么，我们中有哪个勇士敢去拜访一下暗矛部族呢？"
G["That's my little Jir'see! We'll make you into one of those netherhounds yet!"]="那是我的基尔西！我们会把你变成那些虚空犬中的一员！"
G["That's my right knee. My left knee feels hozen ravages."]="那是我的右膝。我的左膝能感受到猢狲的肆虐。"
G["That's neat."]="很好很好。"
G["That's nice, $n. Go show whatever it is to Vosur over there. He'll answer any questions you have."]="那很好，$n。无论那是什么，去拿给那边的沃萨看看。他会回答你的任何问题。"
G["That's not fair... my target... it moved!"]="这不公平……我的目标……它动了一下！"
G["That's not funny!"]="这一点都不有趣！"
G["That's not good."]="这可不好。"
G["That's not important right now. Ota Wen, listen to me. You must rise up against the orcs!"]="现在这并不重要。奥塔·旺，听我说。你必须起来反抗那些兽人！"
G["That's not necessary. I'll be coming with you."]="没那个必要。我会跟着你们的。"
G["That's not nice Maia. Even if he does look weird, you shouldn't say it to his face."]="马亚，这样说不妥。即使他看起来有些怪，你也不应该当他的面说。"
G["That's not right... this is a massacre... they were unarmed - ugh! I don't... I don't feel well..."]="不……这简直是屠杀……他们手无寸铁——呃！我不太……不太舒服……"
G["That's not something Limpy Joe would ask! But yeah, I know Loken."]="乔伊怎么会问这样的问题！好吧，我确实知道洛肯的事。"
G["That's not true. You're still a great wizard."]="不，你仍然是个伟大的巫师。"
G["That's not what I was saying at all."]="这根本就不是我想说的。"
G["That's nothing a good spit shine won't fix."]="没什么难题是解决不了的。"
G["That's number 10! How many've you got?"]="第10个！你呢？"
G["That's odd."]="那真奇怪。"
G["That's okay, you hang onto those nets."]="没关系，你继续捣鼓那些网吧。"
G["That's one down. Keep attacking!"]="干掉了一个。保持攻势！"
G["That's one more for the Wildhammer!"]="又一个愿意帮助蛮锤战斗的朋友！"
G["That's our treasure, you lubber!"]="你这个笨蛋，那些是我们的财宝！"
G["That's quite a story."]="说来话长。"
G["That's quite a tale, lord-commander."]="高级指挥官，这真是个精彩的故事。"
G["That's repeating, of course."]="小数点后无限循环。"
G["That's ridiculous! Why would you even play!?"]="简直荒唐！那有什么好玩的！？"
G["That's right friend!  The Darkmoon Faire is going to be right here.  Just as soon as I unload those huge wagons, put up all the tents, erect the zoo and pour the drinks.  Make sure you come back!"]="没错！暗月马戏团很快就要来了！只要我把这些东西从车上卸下来，搭好帐篷弄好场地，就马上开工！别忘了届时过来看看哦！"
G["That's right! Back to the depths with ya!"]="对极了！滚回深渊中去吧！"
G["That's right! Die, vermin! The Horde will have your heads for this."]="没错！死吧，害虫！部落将彻底消灭你们。"
G["That's right! Liu Lang always had a way back home. Every five years, he would return, to pick up more explorers."]="没错！刘浪总能设法回到家乡。每隔五年他就会回去，带走更多的探险者。"
G["That's right! They can keep on comin', we'll keep knockin' 'em down!"]="没错！他们可以不断地杀过来，而我们将一次又一次地把他们打趴下！"
G["That's right, I'd like to list some of these 'fireworks'."]="没错，我会把那些“烟火”列一张表出来。"
G["That's right, I've seen you here before! How could I forget?\n\nI can teleport you to Stratholme now, if you wish."]="¡Claro! ¡Sí que te había visto aquí antes! ¿Cómo he podido olvidarlo?\n\nPuedo teletransportarte a Stratholme ahora si quieres."
G["That's right, Ug. Victory or death!"]="乌格索，这就是真理啊。要么胜利，要么死亡！"
G["That's right, beast. You belong to the Dragonmaw now."]="没错，野兽。你现在听命于龙喉氏族了。"
G["That's right, dig it up. Leave no living thing behind!"]="没错，把它挖出来。身后不留活口！"
G["That's right, it's over by the bed.  Heh, sorry about that!"]="终于找到了，它就在床上。呵呵，对不起！"
G["That's right, mortal. The prize you seek no longer sleeps within a shell. Here I am: in the flesh."]="没错，凡人！你寻找的东西如今不再沉睡在蛋壳里。我就活生生地站在这里。"
G["That's right, orc. I'mma beat your tattoos clean off!"]="没错，兽人。我要把你的魂打飞！"
G["That's right, show 'em our colors. Let 'em come!"]="没错，给他们点颜色瞧瞧。让他们来吧！"
G["That's right, squeal you maggots. I will gut you lengthwise and roast you when we are through!"]="没错，你们这帮只知道尖叫的害虫。我现在倒是很想吃烤猪肉！"
G["That's right, the turtle was called Shen-zin Su. At first, he was only big enough for Liu Lang to sit on."]="没错，那只海龟被称作神真子。一开始，他的大小只容得下刘浪一人坐在上面。"
G["That's right, um, $g lad : lass;, all of the war materiel is being transported to Silithus and the last of it should get there within $2113w days. After that, we'll all just have to wait and see who puts forth a $g hero : heroine; to reconstitute the Scepter of the Shifting Sands and ring the gong on the Scarab Dais. Only when that occurs will the war begin to open the gates of Ahn'Qiraj."]="是的，嗯，$g小伙子:姑娘;，所有的战争物资都在运往希利苏斯的途中，预计将在$2113w天内全部抵达。我们只需等待某位英雄修复流沙节杖，敲响甲虫之台的铜锣，打开安其拉之门，拉开战争的序幕。"
G["That's right, um, $g lad : lass;, all of the war materiel is being transported to Silithus and the last of it should get there within a day. After that, we'll all just have to wait and see who puts forth a $g hero : heroine; to reconstitute the Scepter of the Shifting Sands and ring the gong on the Scarab Dais. Only when that occurs will the war begin to open the gates of Ahn'Qiraj."]="是的，嗯，$g小伙子:姑娘;，所有的战争物资都在运往希利苏斯的途中，预计将在1天内全部抵达。我们只需等待某位英雄修复流沙节杖，敲响甲虫之台的铜锣，打开安其拉之门，拉开战争的序幕。"
G["That's right, we're stupid. Stupid like a Fox!"]="是的，我们很愚蠢。和狐狸一样愚蠢！"
G["That's right, yeh manks! Yer Horde's a heap o' sheep dung, an' I jes' proved it!"]="这就对了，你们这些乌合之众！我这就证明给大家看，你们部落就是一堆羊屎！"
G["That's right, yes!"]="就是这样！"
G["That's right. Die like the dog you are."]="¡Eso es! Muere como $gel:la; miserable que eres."
G["That's right. Look at the pretty flags."]="好啊，看看这些漂亮的旗子。"
G["That's right. Now please, $r, leave and let us defend our property."]="没错。所以，$r，你还是快走吧，让我们来保卫自己的财产。"
G["That's right. Takes a lickin' but keeps on kickin' butt!"]="没错。稍事休息，再接再厉！"
G["That's right... I recovered munitions from the quarry just yesterday for that purpose."]="没错……我昨天从采石场回收了一些军事物资，就是打算炸毁虫孔。"
G["That's seawater. It's breached the ocean. Do you think the fissure is growing?"]="是海水。海洋也被扯开了。你认为这道裂缝还在变宽吗？"
G["That's so nice of you, to think of me."]="你真是太好了，还能想到我。"
G["That's so unlike her.  She would have fought tooth and nail if she knew the danger."]="这很反常。当危险临近之时，她一定会全力一搏。"
G["That's some impressive skill ye have there $n. The blades and hammers ye make surpass even my own, hard as that is to admit. Only person I ever met with skill even greater is Borgus Steelhand, I bet he could teach ye a thing or three."]="$n，你已经拥有了惊人的锻造技能。我不得不承认你锻造出的武器已经超过了我的水平。我所认识的水平高过你的铁匠只有博古斯·钢拳，我相信你可以从他那里学到不少东西。"
G["That's some nice work there!"]="真是出类拔萃的工艺！"
G["That's strange... for a moment there, I could have swore you called me short."]="真奇怪……等等，刚才我分明听见你说我矮。"
G["That's suicide, Claw! It's too dangerous."]="那是自杀，克劳恩！这太危险了。"
G["That's tha spirit!"]="就是这种感觉！"
G["That's the 64,000 gold piece question, isn't it?"]="你问的是奖金高达64,000金的竞猜问题？"
G["That's the Alliance spirit for you - unstoppable!"]="这就是联盟的精神——勇往直前！"
G["That's the best brawl I've had in weeks! I'll save the rest for our enemies."]="那是我几个星期以来最痛快的一次吵架了！我要把剩下的留给我们的敌人。"
G["That's the best reward we're going to be able to offer. Hopefully someone accepts the mission."]="那已经是我们所能提供的最好的奖励了。希望有人会接受那个任务。"
G["That's the blood of a male orc.  He burned himself alive in order to halt his infection."]="男性兽人的血样。为了避免传染，他选择了自焚。"
G["That's the first relic, but there are still two more. Follow me, $n."]="这是第一件圣物，不过还有两个。跟着我，$n。"
G["That's the funniest thing I've read in a long time. You've just made my day!"]="我很久没读到过这么好笑的东西啦。你是来逗我开心的吧？"
G["That's the idea."]="就是这样。"
G["That's the last mistake you'll make, skeleton."]="这是你最后一次犯错误了，骷髅。"
G["That's the last of the ingredients! Good work, $p! Now the festival can begin!"]="那是最后一部分原料！做得好，$p！现在可以开始欢庆节日了！"
G["That's the last of them!  Get to the bottom of the ship and plant those explosives!"]="最后一个也拿到了！快到船底去，放下这些炸药！"
G["That's the last time I try to set up the cannon alone..."]="我再也不一个人去调整大炮了……"
G["That's the last time I'll let them catch me, promise."]="那是我最后一次被他们抓住了，我保证。"
G["That's the new Forsaken plague?!"]="那是被遗忘者最新研制的药剂？！"
G["That's the rudest thing anyone's ever done to me!"]="这是我见过的最粗鲁的行为！"
G["That's the second building on the right in the Valley of Strength north of the main city entrance.  Speak to Innkeeper Gryshka."]="旅馆位于主城入口以北，力量谷右边的第二幢建筑物。和旅店老板格雷什卡谈谈。"
G["That's the spirit!\n\nI'm glad that we had this little meeting.  I feel much better about the attack now.  With leaders like you on the front, how can we lose?\n\nAlright, you have your marching orders.  Now get back to the Ruuan Weald and make it happen!"]="这就对了！\n\n这次小碰头会让我很高兴，我对进攻更有信心了。有你这样的领袖在前线，我们怎么可能输呢？\n\n好吧，这是你的行军令。返回卢安荒野，付诸实施吧！"
G["That's the spirit, $g laddy : lassie;!  Yer making all of us proud with all o' the work ye be doing!\n\nAnd ya know, if ya want a quick trip ta our other base in the Skethyl Mountains, go down an talk ta Skyguard Handler Irena.  She'll set ya up nicely."]="¡Ese es el espíritu, $gchico:chica;! ¡Estamos muy orgullosos del trabajo que estás haciendo para nosotros!\n\nY ya sabes, si quieres un viaje rápido a las Montañas Skethyl, baja a hablar con la cuidadora de la Guardia del cielo Irena. Ella se encargará."
G["That's the stuff!"]="那就对了！"
G["That's the stuff! All awake now. Tasty!"]="我要的就是这个！现在我完全清醒了！太美味了！"
G["That's the stuff, boys. We did it!"]="干得好，兄弟们！我们办到了！"
G["That's the way to do it!"]="这么做就对了！"
G["That's the way, $n!"]="就是那样，$n！"
G["That's the way..."]="这就是……"
G["That's the worst marching I've ever seen!"]="这真是我见过的有史以来最最糟糕的行军队列！"
G["That's the...pressure release valve."]="这是……减压阀。"
G["That's tiring... but fun."]="很累……但是很有趣。"
G["That's too bad.  Anyhow..."]="真是太糟了。总之……"
G["That's troll business.  Look for Un'Thuwa in Sen'jin Village down south."]="那是巨魔的事儿。去南方的森金村找安苏瓦。"
G["That's troubling news indeed.  See to it that it's taken care of immediately!"]="真是个麻烦的消息。看看是不是能够立刻解决！"
G["That's un-possible!"]="那不可能！"
G["That's very kind of you to ask, but it would appear that we've collected all of the silk bandages that we'll need. You could ask around though and see if anyone else needs help with their collections."]="谢谢你的关心，但是我们已经集齐丝质绷带了。你可以四下问问，看看他们是否需要帮助。"
G["That's what I like to hear."]="这就是我希望听到的。"
G["That's what I like to see. Who needs a gatestone anyway..."]="这才像样。谁会需要这碍手碍脚的门石啊……"
G["That's what I said!  Badmoon!  Sasha... don't ever leave me again!  First they took papa, then they took you... I don't want to be alone with them!"]="对，就是那个岛屿！邪月岛！萨莎……别再离开我啦！他们抓走了爸爸，然后又抓走了你……我不想和他们单独相处！"
G["That's what I wanted to know. Now I just need to find where the flux variance is discussed."]="那就是我想要知道的东西。现在我要知道书中的哪个章节讨论的是魔法流量的变化问题。"
G["That's what I'm talkin' about!"]="我说到做到！"
G["That's what happens when you go into the whelp pits!"]="进入巢穴就会遇到那样的事情！"
G["That's what you always say. Sometimes I think you're never going to finish that thing."]="你每次都这么说。有时候，我甚至怀疑你永远也配制不出那玩意儿。"
G["That's where you come in. Help us to slay them all, and I will reward you handsomely."]="这就是你的任务了。帮我们去杀掉他们，然后我会好好回报你。"
G["That's where you're mistaken, friend. Zhou is as sturdy as an oak."]="你这就错了，朋友。周就如橡树一般坚韧不拔。"
G["That's why you're here, $n. The egg was hidden here at the Vermillion Redoubt. Days ago, it disappeared.\n\nWhoever did it was able to elude our sharpest guards. One of the thieves was killed during the abduction, although now I believe he may have been a diversion - the egg is simply GONE.\n\nOn his corpse we found this note. It remains our only clue, but it is written in a dense code and it MUST be deciphered."]="那就是你被派来的原因，$n。那颗蛋原本一直被藏在这里的朱红庇护所内。可几天前，它却突然消失了。\n\n不管这是谁干的，但他们确实骗过了我们最精锐的守卫。其中一个小偷在行动中被我们打死，可我现在认为，那个家伙只是个转移我们视线的幌子而已——那颗蛋就这么不见了。\n\n在他的尸体上，我们发现了这张纸条。上面有我们目前唯一的线索，可它是用一种复杂的密码写成的，我们必须先破解它。"
G["That's, that's chaos theory."]="这，这就是混沌理论。"
G["That's... great.  What about these flying machines?"]="那实在是……太棒了。你说的飞行器是什么？"
G["That's... nice o' ya. Thanks."]="你真是……太好了。谢谢。"
G["That's... one big orc."]="那个兽人……可真大。"
G["That's... one... giant... keester..."]="那……真是个……巨大的……屁股……"
G["That's... special."]="真……特别。"
G["That, my friend, is for you to decide."]="这个问题就要让你自己去回答了。"
G["That, sir, is a mule!"]="那，那是头骡子！"
G["That... barely even makes sense! You're just saying that because you're lazy and old!"]="这……你说的都是废话！你这么说都是因为你又老又懒！"
G["That... did not end well."]="这个……下场可不怎么样。"
G["That... hurt..."]="好……疼……"
G["That... no, keep your filthy money! It won't help my family!"]="呸……省省吧！不收你的钱，这也救不了我的家人！"
G["That... odor is from Tobias, I believe."]="我认为，那……气味是从托比亚斯那里来的。"
G["That... that looks just like Garrosh Hellscream!"]="那……好像是加尔鲁什·地狱咆哮！"
G["That... thing must be what was controlling the villagers! I now know what we must do."]="那……一定就是控制着村民的东西！我现在知道我们必须做什么了。"
G["That... will not be necessary."]="那……没必要了。"
G["Thata girl! Dig it all up - leave no stone unturned."]="那个小姑娘！全都挖出来——一处都不放过。"
G["That’s what I get for using magic from the Defias…"]="Eso me pasa por usar magia de los Defias…"
G["The \"End Time,\" I once called this place. I had not seen, by then; I did not know. You hope to... what? Stop me, here? Change the fate I worked so tirelessly to weave?"]="Una vez llamé a este lugar el \"Fin de los Días\". Entonces, no había visto, no sabía. ¿Qué esperáis? ¿Detenerme aquí? ¿Cambiar el destino que tanto me ha costado tejer?"
G["The \"failed\" siege was merely a feint, of course. You didn't realize?"]="El asedio \"fallido\" era una maniobra, evidentemente. ¿No os habéis dado cuenta?"
G["The \"orc\" tried to punch me."]="El \"orco\" ha intentado golpearme."
G["The $c returns. Is that my mask I spy?"]="$gEl:La; $c ha vuelto. ¿Eso que veo es mi máscara?"
G["The $g hero : heroine; returns triumphant. How are you, $n?"]="原来是我们的$G大英雄:女英雄;得胜凯旋了。你好吗，$n？"
G["The $r that rescued Prince Nadun is the only $r that I'll ever take orders from."]="$gEl:La; $r que rescató al príncipe Nadun es $gel único:la única; $r $gdel:de la; que aceptaría órdenes."
