G["The Ahn'Qiraj War is on the horizon, $c, and in preparation the Alliance has asked my family to gather up a good deal of light leather for the war effort. Out of $2061w needed, we currently have $2060w. You look the type that might be able to help out."]="$C, la guerra de Ahn'Qiraj está cerca y la Alianza ha pedido a mi familia que reúna una gran cantidad de pieles de cuero ligero para la campaña. De las $2061w necesarias, disponemos actualmente de $2060w. Tienes pinta de poder echarnos una mano."
G["The Aldor are followers of the Light and forgiveness and redemption are values they understand. However, they found hard to forget the deeds of the blood elves while under Kael's command."]="奥尔多是圣光的追随者，宽恕和救赎是他们的信条。然而，他们却很难忘记血精灵在凯尔萨斯命令之下的所作所为。"
G["The Aldor bank is located northwest of the the city's center."]="奥尔多银行座落在城市中心的西北。"
G["The Aldor inn is located high above Shattrath city, on Aldor Rise. The lift to there is northwest of the city center."]="奥尔多旅店坐落在沙塔斯城高处的奥尔多高地上。在城市中心的西北方有去那里的升降梯。"
G["The Aldor shall be victorious!"]="奥尔多会获胜的！"
