G["The Alliance has made landfall master, and in great numbers upon the shore."]="联盟已经登陆了，主人，他们集结在岸边，数量众多。"
G["The Alliance has maintained this remote lodge for a while.  It's seen some use by our hunters and woodsmen.\n\nWith the war going on, you'd better believe the military is in charge here now, though."]="联盟控制这座偏远的营地有好些日子了。对我们的猎户和伐木工而言，这倒算不上是什么坏事。\n\n不过局势日益恶化，很快这里也要进驻军队了吧。"
G["The Alliance has stood against us for decades! Even now they \n mock us with the towers they have built on our land!"]="联盟和我们作对已经几十年了！现在，他们\n甚至在我们的领土上建起了哨塔！"
