G["The Alliance holds the only secure shipping lane in this region, and even that is at risk of being lost to those dreaded mists."]="联盟控制着这个地区唯一一条安全的航道，即便如此，这条航道也面临着随时被致命的迷雾吞噬的危险。"
G["The Alliance is near victory!"]="联盟离胜利不远了！"
G["The Alliance is victorious!"]="联盟获得了胜利！"
G["The Alliance is waiting for us just across the courtyard."]="联盟就在庭院的那头等着我们。"
G["The Alliance must fall!"]="联盟必败！"
G["The Alliance needs you. Answer the hero's call!"]="联盟需要你。响应英雄的号召吧！"
G["The Alliance now controls the Twilight Shores beach head."]="联盟控制了暮光海岸的滩头阵地。"
G["The Alliance now dominates the Battlescar!"]="现在联盟控制了战斗之痕！"
G["The Alliance requires your strength $R! Core Materials and Demon Materials can be claimed by Heroes willing to venture into High-Risk to obtain them.\n\nWhile in High-Risk, you can obtain these materials and choose the risk you are willing to take with Tiered Zones.\n\nTier 1 Zones: Un'goro Crater, Burning Steppes and Azshara. You will only drop items from your bags.\n\nTier 2 Zones: Western and Eastern Plaguelands. You will drop items from your bag, equipped items or Felcom gold if your items are insured.\n\nTier 3 Zones: Silithus and Winterspring. You will drop items from your bag and equipped items. Felcom costs 3 times more."]="La Alianza requiere tu fuerza $R! Los Materiales Esenciales y los Materiales Demoníacos pueden ser reclamados por Héroes dispuestos a aventurarse en Alto Riesgo para obtenerlos.\n\nMientras estés en Alto Riesgo, puedes obtener estos materiales y elegir el riesgo que estás dispuesto a asumir con Zonas Graduadas.\n\nZona de TIER 1: Cráter Un'goro, Llanuras Ardientes y Azshara. Solo perderás objetos de tu mochila.\n\nZona de TIER 2: Tierras del Plagueón Occidental y Oriental. Perderás objetos de tu mochila, objetos equipados o oro Felcom si tus objetos están asegurados.\n\nZona de TIER 3: Silithus y Primavera Invernal. Perderás objetos de tu mochila y objetos equipados. Los costos de Felcom son 3 veces mayores."
G["The Alliance sends gnomes and dwarves against us? Is this some kind of joke?!"]="联盟派侏儒和矮人来对抗我们？他们是在开玩笑吗？！"
G["The Alliance spectators cheer for $n."]="联盟的成员们为$n而欢呼。"
G["The Alliance steams in close formation without escort."]="联盟军队阵型密集，而且没有护卫。"
G["The Alliance team is running out of reinforcements!"]="联盟的增援快要耗尽了！"
G["The Alliance tower was destroyed!"]="联盟哨塔被摧毁了！"
G["The Alliance towers have fallen! We have forced their hand. Finish off the remaining forces!"]="联盟的塔楼全部被摧毁了！他们已经落败。解决残余的敌人！"
G["The Alliance will never recover from the blow that we are about to deal them!"]="联盟将永远无法从我们的打击中恢复过来！"
G["The Alliance will not be allowed to scar this land!"]="绝不能让联盟玷污了这片土地！"
G["The Alliance wins!"]="联盟胜利了！"
G["The Alliance? If the crashed ship is theirs, we need to contact them. Jojo, would you come with me?"]="联盟？如果坠毁的飞船是他们的，那就应该马上联络他们。乔乔，一起去吗？"
G["The Altar of Kros is sacred ground, $gbrother:sister;. Watch where you tread when you're on my beach."]="克洛斯祭坛是神圣的地方，$g兄弟:姐妹;。在我的海滩上，你要小心行走。"
G["The Amber Monstrosity readies an |cFFFF0000|Hspell:122398|h[Amber Explosion]|h|r!"]="琥珀畸怪准备好|cFFFF0000|Hspell:122398|h[琥珀爆炸]|h|r了！"
G["The Amberwing is flying in, watch out!"]="琥珀之翼飞进来了，小心！"
G["The Ancient Gate of the Keepers unlocks!"]="守护者的远古之门开启了！"
G["The Ancient Guardians are coming back.  Cenarius, Aviana, Goldrinn... I can feel their presence.  We must make sure we usher them into this world.  Their timely aid will be indispensable."]="上古的守护者正在归来。塞纳留斯、艾维娜、戈德林……我能感受到他们的气息。我们必须确保他们能顺利回归。他们的及时援助将是不可或缺的。"
G["The Ancient Mogu Machine breaks down! |cFFFF0000|Hspell:116779|h[Titan Gas]|h|r floods the room!"]="上古魔古机器损坏了！|cFFFF0000|Hspell:116779|h[泰坦寒气]|h|r涌入了房间！"
G["The Ancient Mogu Machine goes into overdrive! |cFFFF0000|Hspell:116779|h[Titan Gas]|h|r floods the room!"]="上古魔古机器超载了！|cFFFF0000|Hspell:116779|h[泰坦寒气]|h|r涌入了房间！"
G["The Anglers Wharf in southeastern Krasarang Wilds is home to the most avid of all fisherman this side of Pandaria.\n\nIf you love the reward of a day spent with the great sea, I urge you to honor us with your presence."]="位于卡桑琅丛林东南部的渔人码头是潘达利亚这一带所有的钓鱼发烧友都倾心向往的好地方。\n\n如果你愿意忙里偷闲，在海边享受一日静谧的好时光，就来找我们吧。"
G["The Anglers over at Sri-La village are reporting an unusually high number of Reef Octopi at their village. I'd wager that it's spawning season, but who knows? \n \n The problem is, that the increased octopus influx is damaging the shellfish population... and everyone knows the real money is in shellfish. \n \n Dangle your bobber there for a minute or two, I bet you'd walk away with swarms of those octopi."]="香里拉村的垂钓翁报告说那里的八爪鱼数量异乎寻常的多。我敢打赌，肯定是它们的繁殖期到了，但谁知道呢？\n \n问题是，日益增多的八爪鱼危害到了那里的贝类生物数量……大家都知道，贝类才是最值钱的。\n \n快去那里挥舞你的钓竿吧，肯定能钓到不少八爪鱼。"
G["The Annihilan are incredibly destructive creatures. Their sheer strength and power is absolutely unrivaled."]="安尼赫兰是极具毁灭性的生物。他们那排山倒海般的力量无人能挡。"
G["The Anti-Air Rockets should be perfect for taking down those air transports to get at the extra pyrite."]="防空火箭可以击落那些空中运输器，这样我们就能获得更多蓝铁了。"
G["The Anub'ar have destroyed the %s!"]="阿努巴尔蛛魔摧毁了%s！"
G["The Apexis Monument looms above you."]="你隐约看见了前方的埃匹希斯纪念碑。"
G["The Apexis Relic shimmers, betraying a hidden intelligence within."]="埃匹希斯圣物闪着微光，似乎里面隐藏着什么东西。"
G["The Apothecary Society researches to find a cure against the plague of the Lich King.."]="炼金师协会研究出了治愈巫妖王天灾的方法。"
G["The Arcane Storage Unit begins to overload. Step back!"]="奥能存储单元开始过载了。退后！"
G["The Arch Druid approached the dragons for their blessings, as the dragons had placed on Nordrassil in ancient times."]="大德鲁伊造访了巨龙，祈望他们的祝福新生的生命之树，就如同他们在上古时代祝福诺达希尔那样。"
G["The Arch Druid believes that Ivus the Forest Lord will come once he is made aware of the destructive forces within this valley."]="德鲁伊首领相信，一旦森林之王伊弗斯意识到山谷中的破坏性力量，他就会出现的。"
G["The Arch Druid... how in the world...?"]="大德鲁伊……究竟是……？"
G["The Archonisus Gate is no more! The way to the Sunwell is clear!"]="埃库尼苏之门已经不复存在了！太阳之井就在眼前！"
G["The Arena battle ends in 60 seconds."]="竞技场战斗将在60秒后结束。"
G["The Arena battle ends in sixty seconds."]="竞技场战斗将在六十秒内结束。"
G["The Arena battle has begun!"]="竞技场战斗开始了！"
G["The Arena battlemasters are in the southeast lower city, along the wall."]="竞技场管理员就在东南面贫民窟的墙边。"
G["The Argent Crusade and the Knights of the Ebon Blade have assaulted the gates of the Icecrown Citadel and are preparing for a massive attack upon the Scourge. Our mission is a bit more subtle, but equally as important."]="银色北伐军和黑锋骑士团已经攻入冰冠城堡大门，正准备向天灾军团发动总攻。我们的任务虽小，但同样重要。"
G["The Argent Crusade can wait for us a little while longer.  Besides... our guest may want to get off the caravan soon."]="我们就算是晚到一会儿，银色北伐军也不会着急的。而且……我们的客人也许很快就会想要下车了。"
G["The Argent Crusade comes for you, Arthas!"]="阿尔萨斯，银色北伐军向你宣战！"
G["The Argent Crusade invites you to test your skills in honorable combat against other heroes of Azeroth at the Argent Tournament."]="银色十字军邀请你参加银色锦标赛，在光荣的战斗中与艾泽拉斯各地的英雄们比试，并以此测试你的战斗技艺。"
G["The Argent Crusade is here in force, friend. We weren't going to let you have all the glory!"]="朋友，银色北伐军的部队已经抵达此地。我们不会让你独占所有荣耀的！"
G["The Argent Crusade never surrenders!"]="银色北伐军决不投降！"
G["The Argent Crusade riders believe in balance and precision, deftly mixing attack and defense.\n\nHowever, they will often open themselves to Charges by trying to gain range on you.\n\nClose that range with a Charge before they can do the same, and then Shield-Break them as you wheel around for more Thrusts."]="银色北伐军的骑兵将攻击和防御巧妙地结合起来，在作战中实现平衡与精准。\n\n但是，由于他们需要时刻与你保持距离，因此你可以伺机冲锋。\n\n你必须抢在他们之前发起冲锋，拉近彼此的距离，接下来在围绕他们跑动的过程中使用碎盾并看准机会使用刺击。"
G["The Argent Crusade salutes you, $c!  The name's Lightspark, and I'm an authorized equipment and materiel quartermaster for the Crusade.\n\nAs you fight evil under our commission - all the while earning our respect and trust - you'll earn valor tokens from Officer Pureheart.  Tokens serve two purposes: use them to gain increased standing within our ranks, or use them as tender in acquiring special items.\n\nAs you improve your standing with the Crusade, you'll discover that more items will be made available to you."]="银色北伐军向你致敬，$c！我叫莱斯巴克，是银色北伐军委派的装备和物资军需官。\n\n如果你愿意接受任命，同邪恶力量作战——以此赢得我们的尊重和信任——你就能在军官普尔哈特那儿获得勇气勋章。勋章有两个用途：提高在我们阵营内的地位，或是获取特殊物品。\n\n随着你在银色北伐军内阵营地位的提高，你会发现自己能获得更多的物品。"
G["The Argent Crusade stands behind you."]="银色北伐军支持你。"
G["The Argent Dawn and the Order of the Silver Hand will come together as one! We will succeed where so many before us have failed!"]="银色黎明和白银之手骑士团将在此合二为一！我们一定可以完成前人未尽的事业！"
G["The Argent Dawn coordinates the Scourge's opposition at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.  Go there for instructions."]="在东瘟疫之地的圣光之愿礼拜堂，银色黎明指挥着对抗天灾军团的战斗。去那里接受命令吧。"
G["The Argent Dawn dogs will be consumed by the shadow of the Scourge!"]="天灾军团的阴影将吞噬整个银色黎明！"
G["The Argent Dawn is finished!"]="银色黎明完蛋了！"
G["The Argent Dawn might be impotent idealists but their delusional leader knows that they are outmatched. I have been sent here as an emissary of the Scarlet Crusade. An ambassador, if you will... It is doubtful that we could even dent the armies of Kel'Thuzad - united or not - but we might be able to contain them long enough for some sort of miracle to happen.\n\nAs for me? I'll die in battle...\n\n<Marjhan shrugs.>"]="Los de El Alba Argenta serán unos idealistas impotentes pero su ilusorio líder sabe que no son capaces de aguantar. Estoy aquí en calidad de emisaria de la Cruzada Escarlata. Una embajadora, si preferís... No hay duda de que no podríamos infligir ni el menor de los daños a los ejércitos de Kel'Thuzad, unidos o no, pero debemos intentar contenerlos el mayor tiempo posible a la espera de que se produzca un milagro.\n\n¿En cuanto a mí? Moriré luchando...\n\n<Marjhan se encoge de hombros.>"
G["The Argent Dawn salutes you, $c.  I am Hasana - one of but a few authorized equipment and materiel quartermasters for the Dawn.\n\nAs you fight evil under our commission - all the while earning our respect and trust - you'll earn valor tokens from Officer Garush.  Tokens serve two purposes: use them to gain increased standing within our ranks, or use them as tender in acquiring special items.\n\nAs you improve your standing with the Dawn, you'll discover that more items will be made available to you."]="银色黎明向你致敬，$c。我是哈萨娜——银色黎明为数不多经过授权的装备和军品军需官之一。\n\n既然你在我们委任下作战——同时赢得我们的尊敬和信任——你会从加鲁什军官那里得到英勇勋章。它们有两个作用：在我们的队伍中赢得地位，或者作为交换得到某些特殊物品。\n\n随着你在银色黎明地位的升高，你会发现你能够得到更多物品。"
G["The Argent Dawn will fight until the end!"]="银色黎明将战斗到底！"
G["The Argent Dawn's agents scored a decisive victory in the deserts of Tanaris."]="银色黎明在塔纳利斯的荒漠中赢得了决定性的胜利。"
G["The Argent Tournament has begun in the northern reaches of Icecrown, $c. If you've yet to find your way there, I can pay your way.\n\nThe more we have participating in the melee, the stronger we'll be when we strike against the Lich King."]="银色锦标赛在冰冠冰川的北部边界拉开了帷幕，$c。如果你不知道怎么去哪儿，我可以免费送你一程。\n\n我们积累的作战经验越多，在面对巫妖王时胜算也就更大。"
G["The Arsenal Absolute in southeast Dalaran carries all manner of melee weapons."]="达拉然东南部的神兵利器出售各类近战武器。"
G["The Ash'ari Crystals have been destroyed! The Slaughterhouse is vulnerable!"]="阿莎利水晶已经被摧毁了！屠宰场危险！"
G["The Ashbringer is dead and there will never be another like him. The lesser Mograine is a far cry from the man his father was. You know this, Commander! It was, after all, your own leadership that was responsible for the death of the Scarlet Highlord Mograine."]="灰烬使者已经死了，这世上也不会再有另一个像他这样的人了。小莫格莱尼远远无法匹敌他父亲昔日的辉煌。这些都你都知道的，指挥官！总之，毕竟，你要为血色十字军大领主莫格莱尼的死负责，你当时的指挥造就了这个结果。"
G["The Ashbringer..."]="灰烬使者……"
G["The Ashen Verdict is a select group of the most talented craftsmen in the Ebon Blade and Argent Crusade. Its creation symbolizes the unity of our forces as we mount this final assault on the Lich King and his minions.\n\nIt is through the Ashen Verdict's efforts that we have discovered how to bend primordial saronite to our will."]="灰烬审判军是由黑锋骑士团和银色北伐军中的精英工匠组成的一支队伍。他们的创造标志了一种团结，各支力量齐心协力同巫妖王及其爪牙展开最终的战斗。  \n\n正是通过灰烬审判军的努力，我们掌握了如何将源生萨隆邪铁为我们所用的方法。"
G["The Aspects believe it will. And they should know..."]="守护巨龙相信这有用……"
G["The Aspects have already gathered and await your arrival. Go now!"]="守护巨龙早就等着你们了。快去吧！"
G["The Aspects misplaced their trust."]="守护巨龙们信错了人。"
G["The Assistant Resort Director doesn't like to see us taking breaks. We don't like to see him, either."]="主管助理不喜欢看到我们休息。我们也不喜欢看到他。"
G["The Assurance has somehow become inundated with bugs and we are unable to set sail to Northrend."]="自信号上虫灾泛滥，我们没法开往诺森德了。"
G["The August Celestials quartermaster can be found here in the Vale. Sage Lotusbloom stands with the other faction representatives, in the lower section of The Golden Terrace.\n\nI will mark her location on your map."]="至尊天神军需官就在山谷里。莲蕊贤者与其他阵营的代表都在金色平台的下层。\n\n我会在你的地图上标出他的位置。"
G["The August Celestials quartermaster can be found here in the Vale. Sage Lotusbloom stands with the other faction representatives, in the lower section of The Golden Terrace.\n\nI will mark his location on your map."]="至尊天神军需官就在山谷里。白心贤者与其他阵营的代表都在夏之台的下层。\n\n我会在你的地图上标出他的位置。"
G["The August Celestials quartermaster can be found here in the Vale. Sage Lotusbloom stands with the other faction representatives, in the lower section of The Summer Terrace.\n\nI will mark her location on your map."]="至尊天神军需官就在山谷里。莲蕊贤者与其他阵营的代表都在夏之台的下层。\n\n我会在你的地图上标出她的位置。"
G["The August Celestials quartermaster can be found here in the Vale. Sage Whiteheart stands with the other faction representatives, in the lower section of The Summer  Terrace.\n\nI will mark his location on your map."]="至尊天神军需官就在山谷里。白心贤者与其他阵营的代表都在夏之台的下层。\n\n我会在你的地图上标出他的位置。"
G["The Avatar of Terokk has been defeated! Death to Terokk! Death to Skettis!"]="泰罗克的化身被击败了！去死吧，泰罗克！去死吧，斯克提斯！"
G["The Azsharite Core is Overheating - use the Fireliminator to cool it!"]="艾萨莱特水晶核心过热——使用灭火器进行冷却！"
G["The Azsharite Core is about to go critical!"]="艾萨莱特水晶核心即将到达临界点！"
G["The Azsharite Core is dangerously close to overheating."]="危险，艾萨莱特水晶核心接近过热。"
G["The Azsharite Core momentarily cools off."]="艾萨莱特水晶核心立刻冷却了。"
G["The Azure Serpent moves in to attack!"]="碧空翔龙开始攻击！"
G["The Azure Serpent stirs in the distance!"]="碧空翔龙冲向了远处！"
G["The Bank"]="银行"
G["The Bank of Dalaran is in the northern part of the city."]="达拉然银行位于城市北部。"
G["The Bank of Orgrimmar is in the Valley of Strength. Look for it north of the main entrance to the city."]="奥格瑞玛银行在力量谷那里。去主城门以北的地方找找吧。"
G["The Bank of Silvermoon can be found within the Bazaar. Seek it out in the southeast corner."]="银月城银行就在花园街市。去东南角找找吧。"
G["The Banshee Queen has plans for you!"]="女妖之王对你早有安排！"
G["The Banshee Queen has plans for you, human."]="女妖之王已经对你做出了计划，人类。"
G["The Banshee Queen sees all."]="女妖之王已经预见到了一切。"
G["The Barleybrews have always been leaders in brewery innovation.  Check out our newest creation, Barleybrew Clear!"]="麦酒引领了酿酒工艺的革新。来试试我们最新的产品，纯正的麦酒！"
G["The Barov house sure does keep me busy. Always some sort of refuse coming out of there."]="巴罗夫家族让我忙个不停。总有一些垃圾从那儿出来。"
G["The Barrens ... will ... devour you, $r."]="贫瘠之地……会……吞噬你，$r。"
G["The Barrens may be dry, but these plains once teemed with life. We roamed, we hunted, and we lived off the land.\n\nThen the Alliance came... slashing, burning, killing. We call these the Fields of Blood now, $c.\n\nThe refugees have all fled. Those who remain behind remain to fight."]="贫瘠之地现在也许是干枯荒凉的，但这片土地曾经生机勃勃。我们在这里漫游、狩猎，过着丰足的生活。\n\n然后，联盟来了……他们烧杀抢掠。被他们蹂躏过的地方，现在被我们称为鲜血旷野，$c。\n\n那里的居民已经全部流亡到其它地方。留下来的只有继续与敌人苦战的士兵。"
G["The Barrens, with its hot sun and hostile denizens, is the perfect place to test your strength and fortitude."]="贫瘠之地阳光灼热，那儿的居住者充满敌意，是考验你的力量和决心的最佳地点。"
G["The Bash'ir crystalforge can be used to transform your apexis shards into unstable flasks of the sorcerer.  These flasks make the imbiber more intelligent, heartier, and increase the effectiveness of their damaging and healing magics.\n\nIt appears, however, that you do not have the requisite ten shards to purchase even a single flask."]="巴什伊尔水晶熔炉可以将埃匹希斯碎片转化成不稳定的巫术合剂。这种合剂能让饮用者变得更加聪明，更具活力，还能增加法术伤害和治疗效果。\n\n但是10块埃匹希斯碎片才能购买1瓶合剂，你身上的碎片数量不够。"
G["The Bash'ir crystalforge can be used to transform your apexis shards into unstable flasks of the sorcerer.  These flasks make the imbiber more intelligent, heartier, and increase the effectiveness of their damaging and healing magics.\n\nMake your choice, below."]="巴什伊尔水晶熔炉可以将埃匹希斯碎片转化成不稳定的巫术合剂。这种合剂能让饮用者变得更加聪明、更具活力，还可以增加法术伤害和治疗效果。\n\n来吧，做出你的选择。"
G["The Battle Helm of the Thunder King..."]="雷电之王的战盔……"
G["The Battle for Gilneas"]="为吉尔尼斯而战"
G["The Battle for Gilneas City is underway!  You can head to the frontlines or wait until our men regroup for the next attack."]="吉尔尼斯城之战正在进行！你可以直接到前线去，或者等待我们的队伍重新集结，展开下一波进攻。"
G["The Battle for Gilneas is about to begin."]="吉尔尼斯的战斗即将打响。"
G["The Battle for Lake Wintergrasp is about to begin!"]="冬拥湖之战即将开始！"
G["The Battle of Mount Hyjal is one of the most well-guarded events of this timeline.  Should an intruder alter its outcome, the impact would extend to all subsequent moments in history.\n\nAs the Aspect's prime mate I'm far more in tune with the flow of time than other bronze dragons.  I recently sensed a minute ripple in time emanating from the events surrounding the Battle of Mount Hyjal.  Someone or something is attempting to change this timeline and they must be stopped."]="海加尔山战役是这条时间流里防备最严密的事件之一。一旦入侵者改变了它的结果，历史上所有的后续事件都会受到波及。\n\n做为守护者的配偶，我比其他青铜龙更熟悉时间流的动向。最近，我感觉海加尔山战役周围的时间突然出现了微妙的波动。一定有谁正在企图改变这条时间流，我们必须阻止他们。"
G["The Battlegrounds are full of eager competitors today."]="今天的战场里充满了斗志昂扬的勇士。"
G["The Battlescar is a dangerous place. All the armor in the world can't save a steam tank that's swallowed up by the earth."]="战斗之痕是一个危险的地方。当大地把一辆蒸汽坦克吞下去的时候，就算是全世界最好的护甲也保护不了它。"
G["The Beard-Sprite will make an excellent addition to my family!"]="这个胡子精一定能成为一个很不错的家族藏品！"
G["The Bell... speaks with the voice of the gods..."]="圣钟的声音……是神之声……"
G["The Bellmaster is right over there. I heard he turns kids into bells!"]="敲钟人就在那边。我听说他会把小孩子塞进钟里！"
G["The Betrayer hasn't been the most predictable of foes, Exarch.  I have no fear however, with the Light on our side we shall defeat his forces today, tomorrow, or whenever he chooses to attack."]="背叛者并不是一个循规蹈矩的敌人，大主教。但不管怎样，我一点也不害怕他，因为圣光与我们同在。今天，明天，或者无论什么时候，他若选择进攻，我们就能打败他！"
G["The Betrayer no longer holds sway over us.  His dark magic over the Ashtongue soul has been destroyed!"]="背叛者不再掌控着我们的命运了，他施加在灰舌氏族灵魂上的邪恶魔咒已经消散了！"
G["The Betrayer was freed from his prison, and Shand'do Stormrage disappeared into the emerald dream."]="那名叛徒已经离开了他的牢狱，大导师怒风则消失在翡翠梦境里。"
G["The Bile-O-Tron signals in the affirmative and shuts down permanently."]="胆汁喷洒机发出了肯定的信号，永久地关闭了。"
G["The Bile-O-Tron springs to life and begins to emit a foul smelling substance."]="胆汁喷洒机恢复运作，并开始喷射一种恶臭的物质。"
G["The Bilgewater Cartel has grown too large. Time to downsize!"]="锈水财阀的规模已经太大了。该裁员了！"
G["The Bilgewater Cartel thanks you for your frequent future purchases!"]="锈水财阀感谢您使用本企业产品，并期待您继续购买本企业产品！"
G["The Bilgewater Cartel will be in business here by the end of the day, mark my words."]="记住我的话，锈水财阀终将在这里稳稳地扎下根来。"
G["The Binan fishermen could catch a greased hozen in their nets while blindfolded, $n. Surely they could snare a few yaungol for us. Talk to them about helping us defend the village!"]="滨岸渔民闭着眼睛都可以用渔网捉到醉醺醺的猢狲，$n。他们当然也可以帮我们捉一些野牛人了。和他们谈一谈帮助我们保卫村庄的事情吧！"
G["The Bishop moves diagonally!"]="象沿对角线移动着！"
G["The Black Bishop's shields dissipate as the wretched traitor breathes his last."]="随着那个可耻的叛徒咽下最后一口气，黑主教的护盾终于消散了。"
G["The Black Feather Quill is located down the ramp in the lower section of the southern chamber."]="黑色羽毛就在南边房间里下层部分的坡道尽头。"
G["The Black Knight has been defeated!"]="黑骑士被击败了！"
G["The Black dragonkin materialized from thin air, and set upon us before we could react."]="黑龙人凭空出现，在我们反应过来之前就发动了攻击。"
G["The Blackhand legion shall wear your skin as fashion accessories!"]="黑石军团会将你们的皮制成饰品！"
G["The Blackrock forces are panicking!  Strike at them now!"]="黑石军队害怕了！趁现在攻击他们！"
G["The Blackrock infestation is thick in these parts.  I will do my best to keep the pace.  Let's go!"]="黑石氏族的兽人在这一带部署了不少兵力，我会尽我所能跟上你。我们出发吧！"
G["The Blackrock orcs are my kin.  My father was a Blackrock, as was his father before him.  My mother was a Blackrock.  And I am a Blackrock.\n\nBut before anything else, I am an orc.  And that means honor above all else.\n\nMy Highlord has granted me leave to complete my task here in the Burning Steppes.  And I will not leave until the Blackrock orcs here learn the error of their ways."]="黑石兽人是我的同族。我的父亲、母亲、父亲的父亲都是黑石兽人。我也是黑石兽人。\n\n但更重要的是，我是一个兽人。这意味着荣誉对我比什么都重要。\n\n我的领主允许我来到燃烧平原完成我的任务。在这里的黑石兽人明白他们的错误之前，我绝不会离开。"
G["The Blackrock orcs blew up the bridge leading to Stonewatch Keep. Frontal assault is out of the question."]="黑石兽人炸毁了通往石堡要塞的桥梁。正面交战是不可能了。"
G["The Blackwood tribe is disrupting our sacred lands."]="黑木部族正在侵犯我们神圣的领土。"
G["The Blackwood tribe must not be permitted to interfere with the progress of nature."]="我们绝不能允许黑木部族破坏神圣的大自然。"
G["The Blade's Edge Mountains are a place of great opportunity.  How unfortunate that some deem themselves above all others on matters that pertain to taking advantage of such opportunities.\n\nWho do the Cenarion Expedition think they are to tell us what we can and cannot do here?"]="刀锋山是充满机遇的地方。不幸的是总有些家伙自认为他们要比其他人更能占有先机。\n\n塞纳里奥远征队觉得他们自己是谁？居然敢在这里对我们指手画脚？"
G["The Blastenheimer 5000 Ultra Cannon is a state-of-the-art single person projectile device.\n\nDelivering its payload at near the speed of a dragon, the cannon is the pride and joy of the Blastenheimer family, world renowned for their aeronautical and combustible feats!\n\nIf you'd like to be launched through the skies to fly free as a bird, seek out Maxima Blastenheimer."]="雷管5000型超级大炮是一种代表世界最尖端技术水平的单人发射装置。\n\n它能以接近飞龙的速度将搭乘者发射出去。它的发明者是雷管家族，这个家族在航空及爆破领域享有盛名。这架超级大炮已经成为了家族的荣耀！\n\n如果你想像鸟儿一样在空中翱翔，就去找玛克希玛·雷管吧。"
G["The Blastenheimer 5000 Ultra Cannon is a state-of-the-art single person projectile device. Delivering its payload at near the speed of a dragon, the cannon is the pride and joy of the Blastenheimer family, world renown for their aeronautical and combustible feats!\n\nIf you'd like to be launched through the skies to fly free as a bird, seek out Maxima Blastenheimer in the Terrace of Light in Shattrath City. She'll aim you at a target in a small pond outside the city walls!"]="雷管5000型超级大炮是一种代表世界最尖端技术水平的单人发射装置，它能以龙的速度将人发射出去。发明该设施的地精家族是家喻户晓的航空领域先驱，这种超级大炮已经成为了家族的荣耀！\n\n如果你想象鸟儿一样在空中翱翔，就去沙塔斯城的圣光广场找玛克希玛·雷管吧。她会把你发射到城外的小池塘去！"
G["The Blastenheimer 5000 Ultra Cannon is a state-of-the-art single person projectile device. Delivering its payload at near the speed of a dragon, the cannon is the pride and joy of the Blastenheimer family, world renown for their aeronautical and combustible feats!\n\nIf you'd like to be launched through the skies to fly free as a bird, seek out Maxima Blastenheimer on the east end of the faire. I hear that she's placed a target ring way over on Crystal Lake for you to aim for as you sail through the air!"]="雷管5000型超级大炮是一种代表世界最尖端技术水平的单人发射装置，它能以龙的速度将人发射出去。发明该设施的地精家族是家喻户晓的航空领域先驱，这种超级大炮已经成为了家族的荣耀！\n\n如果你想象鸟儿一样在空中翱翔，就去马戏团东边找玛克希玛·雷管吧。听说发射线路是横跨水晶湖呢！"
G["The Blastenheimer 5000 Ultra Cannon is a state-of-the-art single person projectile device. Delivering its payload at near the speed of a dragon, the cannon is the pride and joy of the Blastenheimer family, world renown for their aeronautical and combustible feats!\n\nIf you'd like to be launched through the skies to fly free as a bird, seek out Maxima Blastenheimer on the south edge of Thunder Bluff's central rise. She'll aim you at the target far to south on Stonebull Lake!"]="雷管5000型超级大炮是一种代表世界最尖端技术水平的单人发射装置，它能以龙的速度将人发射出去。发明该设施的地精家族是家喻户晓的航空领域先驱，这种超级大炮已经成为了家族的荣耀！\n\n如果你想象鸟儿一样在空中翱翔，就去雷霆崖的猎人高地南部找玛克希玛·雷管吧。听说它可以把人发射到石牛湖以南呢！"
G["The Blessed Banner of the Crusade has been planted.\nDefend the banner from all attackers!"]="北伐军的神圣军旗已经插好了。\n保护旗帜，击退攻击者！"
G["The Blessed Banner of the Crusade is destroyed!\nThe Scourge are victorious!"]="北伐军的神圣军旗被摧毁了！\n天灾军团获胜！"
G["The Blight Slimes are beginning to react negatively towards your prodding."]="你的戳刺引起了枯萎软泥怪的消极反抗。"
G["The Blight Slimes are getting ANGRY!"]="枯萎软泥怪发怒了！"
G["The Blight Slimes want your blood!"]="枯萎软泥怪想要吸你的血！"
G["The Blood Furnace is a testament to the dark past of my people."]="鲜血熔炉见证了我的族人们黑暗的过去。"
G["The Blood God, the Soulflayer, has been defeated!  We are imperiled no longer!"]="夺灵者已经被打败了！我们不再有危险了！"
G["The Blood Knights in Farstriders' Square graciously allow space within their halls for Ileda, the weapon master of Silvermoon. While her training is not cheap, you'll appreciate her expertise."]="远行者广场的血骑士慷慨地允许银月城的武器大师伊蕾达使用他们的大厅。虽然她的训练费用并不便宜，但是你会非常欣赏她的专业素养。"
G["The Blood Prince should be very pleased with these..."]="血王子一定会对此感到满意的……"
G["The Bloodfang Berserkers begin to salivate heavily."]="血牙狂战士们开始大流口水。"
G["The Bloodfang come for you, worgen hunters!"]="血牙是为你们而来的，狼人猎手们！"
G["The Bloodfang will prevail."]="血牙将会崛起。"
G["The Blue Rays reveal an Azure Fog!"]="蓝光照出了一只碧蓝雾行兽！"
G["The Bone Wastes!  I don't care what's being offered as a reward, I'm not going into the Bone Wastes!"]="白骨荒野！哪怕你给我再多报酬，我也不想去那个鬼地方！"
G["The Branch of Nordrassil reacts violently to $n's touch!"]="$n的触摸令诺达希尔的分枝产生了强烈反应！"
G["The Bravery's crew will do its best to make your journey as swift and pleasant as possible."]="勇者号上的水手将竭诚为你提供温馨舒适的服务。"
G["The Bravo Company, all present and accounted for..."]="B连，全体出席并作为……"
G["The Brawler $ghimself:herself;: $n!\n\nYou here to beat up my monsters some more?"]="¡$n, $gel:la; camorrista en persona! ¿Has venido para darles otra paliza a mis monstruos?"
G["The Bright  Light reveals an Amber Fog!"]="强光照出了一只琥珀雾行兽！"
G["The Broken Temple siege workshop has been attacked by the Alliance!"]="破碎神殿攻城车间遭到了联盟的袭击！"
G["The Broken Temple siege workshop has been attacked by the Horde!"]="破碎神殿攻城车间遭到了部落的袭击！"
G["The Broken Temple siege workshop has been captured by the Alliance!"]="联盟占领了破碎神殿攻城车间！"
G["The Broken Temple siege workshop has been captured by the Horde!"]="部落占领了破碎神殿攻城车间！"
G["The Brotherhood of the Light transcends the ability of any other group to eradicate affronts to the Light. We will take any actions necessary to rid the world of foul beasts like these undead. Nothing will stand in our way.\n\nAre you with us, or against us?"]="比起其它任何组织，圣光兄弟会更有能力铲除敢于冒犯圣光的人。我们会采取一切必要手段，将亡灵那样的邪恶怪物从这个世界上彻底清除掉。没有任何人能阻挡我们。\n\n你要加入我们？还是和我们作对？"
G["The Brotherhood shall prevail!"]="胜利属于兄弟会！"
G["The Brotherhood will not be hampered by insects."]="La hermandad no tolerará insectos."
G["The Brotherhood will not tolerate your actions."]="兄弟会不能容忍你的行为。"
G["The Burning Blade sends its greetings."]="火刃向你们致以问候。"
G["The Burning Blade? What are they doing here? Shoot to kill!"]="火刃？他们在这里干什么？全力开火！"
G["The Burning Inn."]="烧毁的旅店。"
G["The Burning Legion"]="燃烧军团"
G["The Burning Legion has returned! What can we do to stop them?"]="燃烧军团回来了！我们该如何来阻止他们？"
G["The Burning Legion presses us hard, but our defenses hold. Every moment we keep Archimonde away from the World Tree brings us closer to victory."]="燃烧军团紧紧逼迫着我们，但是我们顶住他们潮水般的进攻。阿克蒙德接近世界之树的时间越晚，我们离胜利就越近一步。"
G["The Burning Legion. Demons. I see them as clearly as you can see your own hand in front of your face. That is, I used to be able to see them clearly.\n\nWith the Legion's return come new machinations. Under normal circumstances, I am able to sense the presence of a demon from a thousand paces.\n\n<Altruis grimaces.>"]="燃烧军团。恶魔。我可以清晰地看到他们，就像你能清晰地看到自己的双手那样。以前，我总是能一眼看清他们。\n\n随着燃烧军团的回归，他们正在进行着新的诡计。在通常的情况下，我可以感觉到千里之外的恶魔。\n\n<奥图里斯的面孔扭曲了一下。>"
G["The Burning Steppes is a dangerous place, but scholars like me will do almost anything to advance our knowledge."]="燃烧平原是个危险的地方，但是我这样的学者将不惜一切代价来获取新知识。"
G["The Butcher of Taurajo will pay."]="陶拉祖的屠夫将会付出代价。"
G["The Butcher would speak of 'the blood of innocents,' and his dark master, 'Kirtonos.' Of how he must appease his master.\n\nFinally, the beast was done with his experiments. We had been drained of all life. Our spirits shattered. The sweet embrace of death was upon us and we welcomed it with open arms. But in his infinite cruelty, the Butcher revived us from death's door.\n\nWe were to be kept alive and thrown to his ravenous ghouls. He laughed as he watched the fiends devour our flesh."]="El Carnicero hablaba de la \"sangre inocente\" y de su oscuro señor, \"Kirtonos\". De cómo debía aplacar a su señor.\n\nPor último, la bestia terminó sus experimentos. Nos habían quitado toda la vida. Nuestros espíritus estaban destruidos. El dulce abrazo de la muerte vino a nosotros y lo recibimos con los brazos abiertos. Pero en su infinita crueldad, el Carnicero nos revivió a las puertas de la muerte.\n\nSe nos mantuvo con vida y fuimos arrojados a sus feroces necrófagos. Reía mientras veía cómo esos demonios devoraban nuestra carne."
G["The Cabal have threatened the innocent for far too long! The time for retribution has come!"]="秘教徒们对无辜者的威胁已经持续得太久了！他们的报应已经到了！"
G["The Cabal will pay for their recklessness!"]="秘教徒们必将为他们的鲁莽付出代价！"
G["The Captain is busy at the moment.  He's studying maps we recently acquired of the underground silithid hives.  Stay with us if you'd like to help, he'll come out any moment now."]="上尉现在很忙。我们最近刚得到一份异种虫类的虫巢地图，他正在研究这张地图。如果你想要帮忙的话，就跟我们待在一起，他随时都会出来的。"
G["The Captain of the Guard upstairs, Hedric Evencane, should posses a key. Please, make haste. We do not have all night, you know!"]="楼上的卫兵队长赫德里克·伊文凯恩应该有钥匙。请你抓紧时间，我们可不能整晚都待在这里！"
G["The Captain's Log lies nearby."]="船长的日志就放在附近。"
G["The Cataclysm crumbled the eastern mountains. The South Seas poured in and submerged all of Thousand Needles! Can you aid us in our time of need?"]="大灾变把东部山脉碾碎。南海的水灌入并吞没了整个千针石林！你能在这紧要关头帮帮我们吗？"
G["The Cataclysm has destroyed Thousand Needles, $c. Will you help us in our greatest time of need?"]="大灾变毁掉了千针石林，$c。你愿意在我们最危难的时刻来帮帮我们吗？"
G["The Cataclysm has destroyed Thousand Needles. We need your help so that we can save as many lives as possible!"]="大灾变毁了千针石林。我们需要你的帮助，以挽救尽可能多的生命！"
G["The Cataclysm has destroyed the western mountains of Thousand Needles. The South Sea has rushed in and the canyons are flooded.\n\nPlease, $c, you must come to our aid at New Thalanaar!"]="大灾变毁了千针石林的西部山脉。南海灌入并淹没了峡谷。\n\n拜托了，$c，你必须来新萨兰纳尔帮帮我们！"
G["The Cataclysm has struck hardest in Thousand Needles. Please, can you lend us your aid?"]="大灾变对千针石林造成的影响最大。拜托了，可以帮帮我们吗？"
G["The Cataclysm is only the beginning. Let the two-legs drown in a sea of their own blood!"]="大灾变只是开始。让那些两条腿的家伙们死无葬身之地！"
G["The Catacylsm has created chaos in Dun Morogh. The troggs have come to the surface in numbers we haven't seen before, driving our traditional enemies, the Frostmane trolls, ever closer to our settlements.\n\nIronforge has dispatched my mountaineer company to help deal with the problems."]="大灾变在丹莫罗引起了混乱。穴居人以我们前所未见的规模成群结队地迁移到地表，把我们的宿敌霜鬃巨魔赶到了离我们居住地更近的地方。\n\n铁炉堡已经派出我的巡山小队来协助解决这一问题。"
G["The Cathedral District is under Stormwind Control again. The Light always prevails!"]="教堂区又归暴风城控制了！圣光之力永胜！"
G["The Cathedral of Light in Cathedral Square is home to the priests of Stormwind. There you will find High Priestess Laurena."]="教堂广场的光明大教堂是暴风城神职人员的住所，你可以在那里找到高阶牧师劳瑞娜。"
G["The Cathedral of Light is the center of all the healing practices of Stormwind. There you can find Angela Leifeld to help you learn this craft."]="光明大教堂是暴风城所有治疗相关技能的训练中心。你可以去那里找安吉拉·雷菲德学习急救技能。"
G["The Celestial Blacksmith is near death!"]="天界工匠已经濒临死亡！"
G["The Celestial Defender is critically injured and is no longer able to fight!"]="天界防御者遭到重创，无法继续战斗了！"
G["The Celestial Defender is near death!"]="天界防御者已经濒临死亡！"
G["The Celestial Defender manifests an area of |cFFFF2222|Hspell:140068|h[healing energy]|h|r!"]="天界防御者为一片区域注入了|cFFFF2222|Hspell:140068|h[治疗能量]|h|r！"
G["The Celestial Tournament is nearly as old as Pandaria itself.  Many have come to test their mettle.  Shall we test yours?"]="天神比武大会的历史几乎和潘达利亚一样古老。许多人都曾来这里检验自己的勇气。我们可以开始了吗？"
G["The Celestial Tournament tests your leadership skills through pet battles with other contestants, and if you are successful enough, the children of the celestials."]="至尊天神的子民们，天神比武大会将考验你们在宠物战斗中的领导能力，以及你们能否做个成功的领袖。"
G["The Cenarion Circle been around a long time, mon. We trolls are newcomers to this party."]="塞纳里奥议会已经有很长的历史了，朋友。而我们巨魔才刚刚成为其中的一员。"
G["The Cenarion Circle is wise, and has delved into many of earth's secrets.  Craftsmen would do well to heed the words of these druids."]="塞纳里奥议会是睿智的，他们发现了很多有关大地的秘密。愿意聆听这些德鲁伊的教诲的工匠总是会得到许多宝贵的知识。"
G["The Cenarion Expedition rescued me from certain death inside the mines. I owe them my life! I offer up my services of repair and reagent sales to those that are allies of the Cenarion Expedition."]="要不是塞纳里奥远征队，我肯定早就葬身矿洞了……是他们救了我的命！因此，我为塞纳里奥远征队的盟友们提供修理装备以及出售施法材料的服务。"
G["The Center Rise has been reclaimed!  The Earthmother be praised!"]="我们夺回了中央高地！赞美大地之母！"
G["The Challenge begins!"]="挑战开始！"
G["The Challenge has been completed!"]="挑战结束！"
G["The Champions' Hall is located in the southeastern end of Old Town.\n\nThe Honor and Conquest quartermasters can be found there."]="勇士大厅位于旧城区的东南端。\n\n荣誉与战利品军需官就在那里。"
G["The Cipher of Damnation belongs to us now!"]="诅咒密码现在属于我们了！"
G["The Cipher of Damnation was kept in Gul'dan's private quarters inside Karabor for twenty years. Ah, that's right, you have no idea what Karabor is, do you?\n\nThe Black Temple...\n\nAye, now home to Illidan Stormrage.\n\nWhen Illidan took control of the Black Temple, he discovered the cipher. He recognized that the damage to this world had already been done but thought it wise to keep the cipher secure for later use."]="诅咒密码被古尔丹封存在他位于卡拉波的私人住所已经有二十年了。啊，对了，你不知道卡拉波是什么，对吗？\n\n黑暗神殿……\n\n是的，就是伊利丹·怒风现在的家。\n\n当伊利丹控制了黑暗神殿之后，密码落入了他的手中。他认识到，虽然对这个世界的破坏已经完成，但是为了日后的使用，他还是谨慎地将密码保存了下来。"
G["The Citadel, correct? Facing the Lich King's most powerful minions."]="你说那冻冰的堡垒？当然是面对巫妖王最强大的爪牙。"
G["The Coffer!? You wouldn't..."]="约柜？！你不能……"
G["The Coldtooth Mine is owned by the Alliance."]="冷齿矿洞为联盟所有。"
G["The Coldtooth Mine is owned by the Horde."]="冷齿矿洞为部落所有。"
G["The Coldtooth Mine is owned by the Kobolds."]="冷齿矿洞为狗头人所有。"
G["The Coldtooth Mine lies in Horde territory, in the mountains north of the Frostwolf Graveyard.\n\nIt is controlled by the Alliance."]="部落领地中的冷齿矿洞就在霜狼墓地以北的山脉脚下。\n\n它现在被联盟控制着。"
G["The Coldtooth Mine lies in Horde territory, in the mountains north of the Frostwolf Graveyard.\n\nIt is controlled by the Horde."]="部落领地中的冷齿矿洞就在霜狼墓地以北的山脉脚下。\n\n它现在被部落控制着。"
G["The Coldtooth Mine lies in Horde territory, in the mountains north of the Frostwolf Graveyard.\n\nIt is controlled by the Kobolds."]="部落领地中的冷齿矿洞就在霜狼墓地以北的山脉脚下。\n\n它现在被狗头人控制着。"
G["The Colossus burrows underground!"]="巨虫正在地下挖洞！"
G["The Commander has been slain! Charge their lines! Die with honor!"]="指挥官被杀死啦！冲向他们的战线！为荣耀而死！"
G["The Commander has not been himself as of late. His mistress disappeared while on an archaeological dig in the southern desert - vanished without a trace! Very strange, indeed.\n\nI suppose you're looking for work? Do I need to bash you in the head with a clue?"]="指挥官最近一直心不在焉。他的妻子在最近的一次南部沙漠考古挖掘中失踪了——一下子消失地踪影全无！真的非常奇怪。\n\n我想你是不是想要找份工作？我是不是可以给你一些提示？"
G["The Commander will have the Alliance king's head on a spike!"]="指挥官会把联盟国王的脑袋刺在长矛上！"
G["The Commons are secured!  Now, secure the rest of the city!"]="平民区守住了！现在去守卫城市其它区域！"
G["The Conclave of Wind has dissipated. Your honorable conduct and determination have earned you the right to face me in battle, mortals. I await your assault on my platform! Come!"]="风之议会已经沉沦。而你们光荣的行为和决心为你们赢得了与我一战的权利，凡人们。我一直在等待着你们的进攻！来吧！"
G["The Conclave of Wind is nearing full strength!"]="风之议会即将获得全部力量！"
G["The Conduit is at full energy and Lei Shen disconnects!"]="导管能量已满，雷神断开了链接！"
G["The Conquest will sail into Ratchet harbor first. Noise is her aim: Double-shot the guns, sew havoc."]="征服号将首先进入棘齿城港口。它将指向喧哗声发生的地方：枪支两次齐射，制造大规模混乱。"
G["The Conservatory must be protected!"]="必须保卫温室！"
G["The Consortium has been planning this operation for months!  We were to dig Oshu'gun, the largest known diamond in the universe.\n\nMinutes before we were to begin, Nexus-Prince Haramaad sends word that we're to hold off until a political matter is resolved in Netherstorm.  I've transformed our operation into a clearing house for smuggled gems in the meantime, but this is slowly eating into our profits."]="星界财团已经策划这个行动好几个月了！我们要挖掘宇宙中最大的钻石——沃舒古。\n\n就在我们要开始动手的时候，节点亲王哈拉迈德送来口信说，我们需要暂缓一下，直到解决一个虚空风暴地区的政治问题。我只能把我们的行动改变为在空闲时间走私宝石，但是这似乎在慢慢消耗我们的利润。"
G["The Consortium will exact its revenge upon the Zaxxis betrayers!"]="星界财团会对那些萨克希斯背叛者进行复仇的！"
G["The Corporal's a good man, but he's got tunnel-vision when it comes to his orders.\n\nSomething unnatural is happening to the land here, $n. This jungle shouldn't be here!"]="El cabo es un buen hombre, pero tiene una visión limitada cuando se trata de órdenes.\n\nAlgo antinatural le ocurre a esta tierra, $n. ¡Esta jungla no debería estar aquí!"
G["The Council of Duskwood must take action.  Evil lingers in the air."]="暮色森林的议会必须行动起来了。这里已经充满了邪恶。"
G["The Crane Temple usually comes to our defense and keeps the raiders at bay. But lately they have been quiet."]="朱鹤寺通常都会来帮我们抵御这些强盗。但近来他们却一点动静也没有。"
G["The Crazy Sapper activates the bomb strapped to its chest!"]="疯狂的工兵激活了绑在胸口的炸弹！"
G["The Creators are cognizant of the magnitude of the information housed in this repository.  Subsequently, a portable copy of the data stored here will be made available to you once you are attuned with the Discs of Norgannon.\n\nPlease consider your cursory requirements for the assimilation of this knowledge to be complete.  At your leisure, access the Discs of Norgannon to begin synthesis of your discs."]="造物者也知道这个数据库中汇集了大量的信息。所以，如果你拥有诺甘农圆盘的话，便可以得到一份所有信息的拷贝。\n\n请确认你现在没有关于这方面信息的问题了。当你找到诺甘农圆盘之后，可以随时过来制作拷贝。"
G["The Creators are... the Creators.\n\nThey are the beings that seeded and shaped this world by their own design.  They are the reason for this world's existence, as well as many other worlds.  They are the wellspring from which Azeroth flows."]="造物者就是……造物者。\n\n他们根据自己的设计来创造和改变这个世界。他们是这个世界出现的原因，他们是艾泽拉斯的创造者。"
G["The Creators use visitation as a means to reestablish control over seeded worlds when forces, both external and internal, upset the matrix dynamics associated with it.  Such tactics are not to be taken lightly when executed by the Creators.\n\nFor additional information on this world's scheduled visitation, please consult the appropriate data repository that fields all Creator-related scheduling considerations."]="当外部势力和内部势力相互冲突，以至于扰乱整个世界的时候，造物者将探访计划作为重新控制世界的手段，不过执行这样的策略并不容易。\n\n关于预先安排的探访计划的更多信息，请查询所有与造物者相关的数据库。"
G["The Crusade appreciates the work you're doing out here, $n."]="北伐军感谢你在这里所做的一切，$n。"
G["The Crusade has been marked for death!"]="十字军注定会被毁灭！"
G["The Crusade will be victorious!"]="胜利属于十字军！"
G["The Crusade will purge your kind from this world!"]="十字军会从这个世界上抹去你们的存在！"
G["The Crystal Pylons of Un'Goro are a mystery to all. To the few inhabitants here, they are a source of legend, with much speculation as to their purpose."]="安戈洛的水晶塔相当神秘。对这里少数的居住者来说，它们代表某种传奇，而其建造目的则更值得深思了。"
G["The Cult of the Damned has grown large in scope. Nearly every city, from the capitals to the small hamlets and hovels of both the Horde and Alliance, have Cult members hidden amongst their citizenry.\n\nDo not look so surprised. The Cult only wears a uniform for ritual and ceremony. It is quite possible that you have interacted with one during your adventures and not even known."]="诅咒神教正在迅速壮大。从小型村落到首都，从部落到联盟，几乎每座城镇的居民中都有诅咒神教的信徒。\n\n别惊讶，他们只在仪式和庆典上面才身穿统一的服饰。你很可能已经跟他们的信徒碰过面了，只是你不知道而已。"
G["The DARKNESS devours ALL!"]="让黑暗吞噬一切！"
G["The DEC operator can also choose to load themselves into the loading arm,\n allowing the Demolisher driver to launch them into the distance.\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_EngGizmos_27.blp:32|t"]="操作员还可以将自己装填到装载臂中，\n让攻城车的驾驶员将其发射到远处。\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_EngGizmos_27.blp:32|t"
G["The Dalaran Merchants' Bank is in the southern part of the city, off the Eventide."]="达拉然商业银行位于城市南部，毗邻日暮广场。"
G["The Dark Animus goes berserk!"]="黑暗意志狂暴了！"
G["The Dark Iron Dwarves shall reclaim their rightful lands!"]="黑铁矮人将会收复属于他们自己的土地！"
G["The Dark Iron dwarves of the Slag Pit in Searing Gorge have a great number of locked boxes."]="灼热峡谷熔渣之池的黑铁矮人有许多带锁的箱子。"
G["The Dark Irons in Blackrock have got nothin' on me.  Neither do those boys up at Thorium Point.\n\nI'm independent as can be, and that's the way I like it.  Of course, for the right price, I'd listen to either side..."]="黑石的黑铁矮人和瑟银哨塔的那些男孩都和我没关系。\n\n我是中立的，而且我喜欢这样。当然，只要出价合适，我会帮助任何人……"
G["The Dark Irons thought these tablets to be encoded. This is not any form of coding, it is the tongue of ancient dragon."]="黑铁矮人认为这些石板是经过加密的。但这不是什么密码，只是古老的龙语而已。"
G["The Dark Lady fought off as many as she could, but in the end... I hope she survived. Please help!"]="黑暗女王竭尽全力迎战，但最终……希望她能活下来。请你帮帮我们！"
G["The Dark Lady has said that knowledge will be our greatest weapon in this war."]="黑暗女王说过，在这场战争中，知识是我们最强大的武器。"
G["The Dark Lady lets these mongrels live? Useless..."]="黑暗女王会让这些渣滓活着？除非……"
G["The Dark Lady watch over you..."]="黑暗女王在注视着你……"
G["The Dark Lady watches over you. Make haste!"]="黑暗女王正在看着你，加紧行动！"
G["The Dark Lady's followers are blind to think they can stand against our might."]="黑暗女王的追随者们都瞎了眼，竟然自以为他们能和我们对抗。"
G["The Dark Lord is displeased with your interference."]="黑暗之王对你的介入很不高兴。"
G["The Dark Pharaoh has fallen!  His immortal colossi tumble like toys!"]="黑暗法老倒下了！他那不朽的巨像犹如玩具一般地打着滚！"
G["The Dark Portal coming alive? This can't be good."]="黑暗之门活跃起来了？这不是个好消息。"
G["The Dark Portal opens once again! What does it portend?"]="黑暗之门再度开启了！这预示着什么？"
G["The Dark Shaman go into a berserker rage!"]="黑暗萨满陷入了狂怒！"
G["The Dark Summoner is vulnerable for a short time, now's your chance!"]="黑暗召唤师将暂时衰弱，你的机会来了！"
G["The Dark Summoner's protective magics are active once again."]="黑暗召唤师重新激活了防护魔法。"
G["The Darkhatched Lizard-Lord begins to spin violently."]="暗生蜥蜴领主开始剧烈地旋转。"
G["The Darkhatched Lizard-Lord calls for help!"]="暗生蜥蜴领主在召唤援军！"
G["The Darkhatched Lizard-Lord prepares to unleash a group of Water Jets!"]="暗生蜥蜴领主准备施放激水喷涌！"
G["The Darkmoon Deathmatch is over!  $n is the victor!"]="暗月死斗大赛结束！胜利者是，$n！"
G["The Darkmoon Faire has already arrived, you say?  Where is it located?"]="你是说暗月马戏团已经来了？它在哪里？"
G["The Darkmoon Faire has come to town!  Be sure to experience the most thrilling show you'll ever see!"]="暗月马戏团已经来到本镇了！不要错过有史以来最华丽的表演！"
G["The Darkmoon Faire is coming to town!  Don't miss it!"]="暗月马戏团已经来到本镇了！走过路过不要错过！"
G["The Darkmoon Faire is coming!  There is fun for children of ALL ages!  Come one, come all!"]="暗月马戏团来了！所有的孩子都可以在这里找到好玩的东西！来吧，都来吧！"
G["The Darkmoon Faire is filled with all sorts of amazing attractions.  We have a fortune teller, a concert, a fishing contest and a lot of games.\n\nWe are constantly expanding the faire with all manner of new attractions!\n\nAre there any attractions you'd like more information on?"]="暗月马戏团里有各种有趣的游乐设施，有占卜师，音乐会，钓鱼大赛以及各种游戏。\n\n而且我们还在不断扩张马戏团，添加各种新的游乐设施！\n\n你要不要了解一下某种游乐设施的具体情况呢？"
G["The Darkmoon Faire is now open!\n\nFor a small fee, I can teleport you to the fairground staging area.\n\nWould you like to go?"]="暗月马戏团开张啦！\n\n只要一点点费用，我就能把你送到马戏团入口。\n\n你想去吗？"
G["The Darkmoon Faire is right now located in Elwynn Forest, just south of Goldshire.  Don't miss it!"]="暗月马戏团到艾尔文森林来了，就在闪金镇的南边。走过路过不要错过！"
G["The Darkmoon Faire is right now located in Terokkar Forest in Outland, just south of Shattrath City.  Don't miss it!"]="暗月马戏团正在外域的泰罗卡森林开张，就在沙塔斯城的南边。走过路过不要错过！"
G["The Darkmoon Faire is right now located in the golden plains of Mulgore, just southwest of Thunder Bluff.  Don't miss it!"]="暗月马戏团到莫高雷的金色平原来了，就在雷霆崖的西南边。走过路过不要错过！"
G["The Darkmoon Faire is the greatest event in all of Outland!"]="暗月马戏团是整个外域最隆重的庆典！"
G["The Darkmoon Faire is the greatest event on all of Azeroth!"]="暗月马戏团是全艾泽拉斯最华丽的！"
G["The Darkmoon Faire will only be live for a short time before the curtains are drawn closed.  Be sure to visit it today!"]="暗月马戏团只会逗留有限的时间。一定要在今天来看看啊！"
G["The Darkspear and her allies will attack Orgrimmar by land, so that you can attack her by sea. It be the only way."]="暗矛部族会和盟友从地面进攻奥格瑞玛，以便你们从海上进攻。只有这个办法。"
G["The Darkspear never deserved to be part of the Horde!"]="暗矛部族根本不配加入部落！"
G["The Darkspear will know the true price of defiance!"]="暗矛部族将会为他们的背叛付出代价！"
G["The Darkspears stand ready to face the competition and the enemy."]="暗矛氏族已经做好了竞争的准备。"
G["The Darnassus riders count on their nimbleness and skill at range.\n\nThey are quick and cunning enough to avoid your Charges, so try using a mixture of close-range Thrusts and the occasional Shield-Breaker to defeat them."]="达纳苏斯的骑兵以灵巧与远程攻击著称。\n\n他们敏捷的身手足以避开你的冲锋，因此你必须灵活运用近距离刺击和碎盾攻击，才有可能击败他们。"
G["The Dawnblade forces have been driven from the Sun's Reach Harbor!  The day is ours!"]="晨锋部队被赶出了阳湾港口！我们胜利了！"
G["The Dawnblade will defend this land for all of the Sin'dorei. There is no turning back!"]="晨锋部队会为所有的辛多雷守卫这片土地。我们没有任何退路！"
G["The Deadmines can be found beneath Moonbrook in the south of Westfall."]="死亡矿井位于西部荒野南端月溪镇的地下。"
G["The Deathforge is run by the Shadow Council, under the watchful eye of the Legion."]="在燃烧军团的监控下，暗影议会负责死亡熔炉的正常运转。"
G["The Defenders are here to protect Blood Watch from the Sunhawk threat."]="防御者们在这里抵御着来自炎鹰部队的威胁。"
G["The Defenders of Blood Watch protect this outpost from any threat."]="秘血岗哨的防御者抵御着任何针对这座哨所的威胁。"
G["The Defiant is mine! Stand down or die!"]="挑战号是我的！不滚就死！"
G["The Defias are a joke compared to us."]="Los Defias son un chiste comparados con nosotros."
G["The Defias are little more than a band of thugs. We should be busy combatting Stormwind's real enemies instead of chasing baseless speculation!"]="迪菲亚兄弟会不过是群乌合之众。我们要对付的应该是真正有威胁的对手，而不是在这里捕风捉影。"
G["The Defias shall succeed! No meek adventurer will stop us!"]="迪菲亚兄弟会必胜！没有人能阻止我们！"
G["The Defiler... must warn Thrall..."]="污染者……必须马上去通知萨尔……"
G["The Demon Chain. It projects our will like a physical force."]="恶魔之链。它能将我们的意志转换为战斗力。"
G["The Denmother will have your head!"]="狼巢之母会要了你的脑袋！"
G["The Destroyer is gathering all his might for a blow that will split the world. Attack him, now! We must stop the final Cataclysm!"]="灭世者想要集中它全部的力量来撕裂这个世界！快进攻！我们必须阻止这最后的大灾变！"
G["The Destructive Ward gains in power."]="毁灭结界正在充能。"
G["The Destructive Ward has been destroyed."]="毁灭结界已经被摧毁了。"
G["The Destructive Ward is fully charged!"]="毁灭结界充能完毕！"
G["The Devourer awaits..."]="吞噬者在等待着…"
G["The Displacement Pad appears to be active and stable."]="位移石板被激活并稳定下来了。"
G["The Divine Bell is a weapon of unquestionable power. It belongs in horde hands. It belongs to me!"]="圣钟是武器，它的力量无可置疑。它属于部落，属于我！"
G["The Divine Bell means a great deal to the Horde.\n\nThe Warchief is counting on us."]="圣钟对于部落而言意义重大。\n\n酋长对我们寄予厚望。"
G["The Divine Bell! I knew I could count on you, $n."]="圣钟！我就知道你靠得住，$n。"
G["The Divine challenges us to face these intruders."]="神祗命我们对抗这些闯入者。"
G["The Divine chose us to give mortal voice to Her divine will. We are but the vessel that enacts Her will."]="我们被神祗选中，为女皇神圣的意志赋予不朽的声音。我们任她差遣。"
G["The Divine will not suffer your taint here, outsider."]="神祗决不容许你玷污此地，外来者。"
G["The Dojani Dynasty is remembered for their cruelty. Use caution."]="都阳王朝是以凶残著称的。多加小心。"
G["The Doomguard are utterly devoted to their Pit Lord masters and revel in the destruction of worlds."]="末日守卫完全效忠于他们的主人深渊领主，享受着破坏世界的乐趣。"
G["The Door is under attack!"]="城门遭到攻击！"
G["The Drag race will start in 1 minute!"]="拉力赛将在1分钟之后开始！"
G["The Dragon Soul is safe once again. Quickly, into the time portal, before this world sunders!"]="巨龙之魂安全了。快，在这个世界分裂之前进入时光传送门。"
G["The Dragon Soul's link to the portal has been broken!  The Soul plummets downwards towards the Well!"]="巨龙之魂与传送门之间的联系被切断了！它正在坠入永恒之井！"
G["The Dragonmaw Warchief is in the largest building up on the hilltop here. I'm sure he'll be reasonable."]="龙喉酋长就在这里山顶上最高大的那座房子里。相信他是个通情达理的人。"
G["The Dragonmaw are attempting to push out of the Angerfang Encampment and are already raiding the caravan to the east.  They've called in two powerful warriors who are leading the charge.  If you're up for a challenge, you might find them at the Encampment, planning and strategizing and doing other evil, Orcish things."]="龙喉部族正在试图把势力扩大到怒牙营地以外的地方，并已对东边的车队发起了突袭。他们找来了两位强大的战士领军。要是你愿意接受挑战的话，你也许能在营地找到他们——那群正在策划密谋和从事其它邪恶活动的兽人。"
G["The Dragonmaw are corrupt. They are strip-mining this island of all natural resources and using those resources to supply Illidan's armies out of the Black Temple. They take much for themselves, however, and sell whatever they have hidden away to the highest bidder."]="龙喉氏族已经堕落了。他们在岛上疯狂地开采天然资源，并利用这些资源支援伊利丹派驻在黑暗神殿外的军队。当然，他们将大部分资源据为己有，而且把私藏的资源出售给出价最高的人。"
G["The Dragonmaw are supporting the Warchief."]="龙喉氏族在支持着酋长。"
G["The Dragonmaw can be great again. Help our conquest of the Twilight Highlands - can you give me a map?"]="龙喉必将再次崛起。帮我们征服暮光之锤吧——你能给我一张地图吗？"
G["The Dragonmaw drums fall from Zaela's unconscious body!"]="龙喉战鼓从扎伊拉身上掉落下来！"
G["The Dragonmaw must be stopped..."]="必须阻止龙喉氏族……"
G["The Dragonmaw stand proudly with the Horde. The Twilight Citadel will fall, $n!"]="龙喉氏族与部落并肩作战，这是我们共同的荣耀。暮光堡垒一定会被攻陷，$n！"
G["The Drakkari Chieftains have been captured! What more would you have me do?"]="我已经俘获了达卡莱酋长！你还需要我做什么吗？"
G["The Drakkari are keeping my body close to death up in the altar building. They cannot see my spirit though.\n\nWe must work together to prevent them from getting my power."]="达卡莱巨魔将我囚禁在祭坛，令我的肉身处于濒死状况。但是他们无法看见我的灵魂。\n\n我们必须协同作战，阻止他们夺取我的力量。"
G["The Drakkari must not be allowed to break through the defenses."]="绝不能让达卡莱巨魔突破防御线。"
G["The Dread Captain DeMeza has pulled into Booty Bay and declared it Pirates' Day!\n\nShe's making anyone who's brave enough to share a drink with her an honorary crewmember."]="恐怖船长德梅萨已经进驻藏宝海湾并宣布这一天为海盗节！\n\n她邀请所有敢于前往的人与船员们一起开怀畅饮。"
G["The Dread King sends his regards! Pray that today is the day that we die in battle! Pray that the judgement is favorable!"]="恐惧之王已经向我们致意了！祈祷吧！我们今天或许将战死沙场！祈祷吧！最终的审判已经来临！"
G["The Dream Brew is an ancient recipe passed down through the ages."]="洄梦仙酒是多年以来流传至今的古老配方。"
G["The Dream Brew will put you into a deep state of meditation. Your mind's eye will find the answers to your greatest questions."]="洄梦仙酒会让你进入深度的冥想，你的心灵之眼会帮你解答最大的疑问。"
G["The Dude, over yonder, is pretty upset about his rug."]="瞧，那家伙正在为地毯的事烦恼呢。"
G["The Dun Baldar North Bunker is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Alliance will destroy it!"]="丹巴达尔北部碉堡受到攻击！如果我们不尽快采取措施，联盟会摧毁它的！"
G["The Dun Baldar North Bunker is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Horde will destroy it!"]="丹巴达尔北部碉堡受到攻击！如果我们不尽快采取措施，部落会摧毁它的！"
G["The Dun Baldar North Bunker protects the eastern entrance to Dun Baldar.\n\nIt is controlled by neither side."]="丹巴达尔北部碉堡保护着丹巴达尔要塞的东部入口。\n\n联盟和部落还在争夺它。"
G["The Dun Baldar North Bunker protects the eastern entrance to Dun Baldar.\n\nIt is controlled by the Alliance."]="丹巴达尔北部碉堡保护着丹巴达尔要塞的东部入口。\n\n联盟控制着这片土地。"
G["The Dun Baldar North Bunker protects the eastern entrance to Dun Baldar.\n\nIt is controlled by the Horde."]="丹巴达尔北部碉堡保护着丹巴达尔要塞的东部入口。\n\n部落控制着这片土地。"
G["The Dun Baldar North Bunker was destroyed by the Horde!"]="丹巴达尔北部碉堡被部落摧毁了！"
G["The Dun Baldar North Bunker was taken by the Alliance!"]="丹巴达尔北部碉堡被联盟占领了！"
G["The Dun Baldar South Bunker is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Alliance will destroy it!"]="丹巴达尔南部碉堡受到攻击！如果我们不尽快采取措施，联盟会摧毁它！"
G["The Dun Baldar South Bunker is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Horde will destroy it!"]="丹巴达尔南部碉堡受到攻击！如果我们不尽快采取措施，部落会摧毁它的！"
G["The Dun Baldar South Bunker protects the south and east flanks of Dun Baldar.\n\nIt is controlled by neither side."]="丹巴达尔南部碉堡保护着丹巴达尔要塞的东南侧。\n\n联盟和部落还在争夺这片土地。"
G["The Dun Baldar South Bunker protects the south and east flanks of Dun Baldar.\n\nIt is controlled by the Alliance."]="丹巴达尔南部碉堡保护着丹巴达尔要塞的东南侧。\n\n联盟控制着这片土地。"
G["The Dun Baldar South Bunker protects the south and east flanks of Dun Baldar.\n\nIt is controlled by the Horde."]="丹巴达尔南部碉堡保护着丹巴达尔要塞的东南侧。\n\n部落控制着这片土地。"
G["The Dun Baldar South Bunker was destroyed by the Horde!"]="丹巴达尔南部碉堡被部落摧毁了！"
G["The Dun Baldar South Bunker was taken by the Alliance!"]="丹巴达尔南部碉堡被联盟占领了！"
G["The Dunwald family is built tough, but they let it go to their heads. I worry that me brothers put their repuation to the test a wee bit too often."]="顿沃德家族以刚强悍勇著称，但他们的脑子并不怎么灵光。我很担心我的兄弟们会把他们的名誉和生命浪费在一些不必要的地方。"
G["The EMP disrupts Iron Thane Furyhammer's shield!"]="电磁脉冲击碎了铁领主弗雷哈默尔的护盾！"
G["The Earth Mother calls and you answer.  You will find the Hall of Spirits on the Spirit Rise."]="大地之母发出召唤，你得做出应答。你可以在灵魂高地找到灵魂大厅。"
G["The Earth Mother holds many secrets and Brek Stonehoof can help you to discover some of them.  You will find him on the lower rise at Stonehoof Geology."]="大地之母有许多秘密，布瑞克·石蹄能帮助你发现一些秘密。你会在 石蹄地质学会的中部高地的底层那找到他的。"
G["The Earth Mother provides, but at times, a $c needs a little extra help to survive. Thus, I am collecting all of the runecloth bandages that we can in preparation for the looming war at Ahn'Qiraj. As of now we have gathered $2089w on our way to collecting a total of $2090w."]="La Madre Tierra nos ofrece todos sus recursos pero, en ocasiones, $gun:una; $c necesita un poco de ayuda extra para poder sobrevivir. Por ello, estoy recogiendo todas las vendas de paño rúnico que puedo en vista de la guerra que se avecina en Ahn'Qiraj. Hasta el momento, hemos reunido $2089w de un total de $2090w."
G["The Earth Mother watch over us; under cover of the night as in the day. Let this fire illuminate both our bodies and spirits and remind us of our honored ancestors, who are ever present and guiding our way."]="大地之母日夜监视着我们。让这火焰照亮我们的身体和灵魂吧，让我们想起尊敬的祖先，他们一直都在我们身边，指导我们前行。"
G["The Earth Warder... he is dead."]="大地的守卫者……他死了。"
G["The Earthen Ring cannot withstand my fury!"]="大地之环无法抵挡我的愤怒！"
G["The Earthen Ring have set up portals to various regions of the world on a small lake islet northwest of Stormwind Keep.\nThere are representatives from the Baradin Wardens there as well, offering transport to Tol Barad."]="El Anillo de la Tierra ha erigido unos portales a varias regiones del mundo en un islote en un pequeño lago que hay al noroeste del Castillo de Ventormenta.\n\nAllí también hay representantes de la Guardia de Baradin que ofrecen transporte a Tol Barad."
G["The Earthen Ring have set up portals to various regions of the world on the cliffs north of the zeppelin towers.\nThere are representatives from Hellscream's Reach there as well, offering transport to Tol Barad."]="El Anillo de la Tierra ha erigido unos portales a varias regiones del mundo en las colinas al norte de las torres de zepelín.\n\nAllí también hay representantes del Mando Grito Infernal que ofrecen transporte a Tol Barad."
G["The Earthen Ring seeks to preserve the strength and majesty of the elements."]="大地之环会设法维护元素们的权威和力量。"
G["The Earthen Ring shall fall!"]="大地之环必亡！"
G["The Earthen Ring stands behind you."]="大地之环支持你。"
G["The Earthen Ring's Assault Begins."]="大地之环的进攻开始了。"
G["The Earthen are a synthesized race engineered by the Creators, functioning as one of the seed races in the initial population of the world designated as Azeroth.  The Earthen were created to aid the Creators' efforts in shaping the deep regions of this world.\n\nThey are a modification of the standard subterranean being matrix used on other worlds that the Creators have seeded.  The construction of this prototype race created various anomalies that were observed after initial synthesis."]="土灵是造物者设计的综合产物，并作为艾泽拉斯开始的几个种族之一。土灵被用于帮助造物者改善这个世界。\n\n他们是造物者在其它世界中设计的标准地下生物的改良型态。在最初的结构得以确定之后，这种原型产生了很多的变化。"
G["The Earthen's only anomaly in synthesis is the tendency for matrix destabilization while being utilized in high-stress environments.\n\nAddendum: deep earth sculpting was naturally suited to the new matrix design and thus never met the qualifications of duplicating a high-stress environment.\n\nDestabilization was not discovered until well into the Earthen's primary service cycle for the Creators.  The Creators began work on post-synthesis modification, rather than recall and re-synthesis."]="土灵唯一的异常变化是在高压环境下对于母体扰动的趋向。\n\n附录：设计的目的是让该物种能够适合地下深处的生活，从而无法满足高压环境下的适应性要求。\n\n这种扰动直到土灵按照计划进入世界的主循环之后才被发现。造物者并没有将土灵召回再重新进行改造，而是直接对其进行了实时的改造。"
G["The Earthwatchers won't allow faction squabbling to jeopardize the Earthen Ring's work here.\nThose who break the peace will be dealt with... harshly."]="Los Vigiatierra no permitirán que las riñas entre facciones pongan en peligro el trabajo del Anillo de la Tierra en este lugar.\n\nAquellos que perturben la paz serán castigados... severamente."
G["The East Frostwolf Tower is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Alliance will destroy it!"]="东侧霜狼哨塔受到攻击！如果我们不尽快采取措施，联盟会摧毁它的！"
G["The East Frostwolf Tower is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Horde will destroy it!"]="东侧霜狼哨塔受到攻击！如果我们不尽快采取措施，部落会摧毁它的！"
G["The East Frostwolf Tower was destroyed by the Alliance!"]="东侧霜狼哨塔被联盟摧毁了！"
G["The East Frostwolf Tower was taken by the Horde!"]="东霜狼哨塔被部落占领了！"
G["The East Spire has been destroyed!"]="东部尖塔被摧毁了！"
G["The East Spire has been heavily damaged!"]="东部尖塔受到了重创！"
G["The Eastern Crossroads changed tracks!"]="东部十字路变轨了。"
G["The Eastern Graveyard has been captured by the Alliance!"]="联盟夺取了东部墓地！"
G["The Eastern Graveyard has been captured by the Horde!"]="部落夺取了东部墓地！"
G["The Eastern Pylon accepts blue, yellow, and green crystals.\n\nIt focuses on the energy that can be created using blue crystals as the main source of power. There are two possible effects: one provides bonus to spirit, and one that creates a damaging shield.\n\nCrystal Force requires blue and green crystals. This will provide you with an increase in spirit.\n\nCrystal Spire requires blue and yellow crystals. This will create a shield that does damage to attackers."]="La Torre de Cristal del Este acepta cristales azules, amarillos y verdes.\n\nSe centra en la energía que puede crearse usando cristales azules como fuente principal de poder. Existen dos efectos posibles: uno proporciona puntos adicionales para el espíritu y el otro crea un escudo de ataque.\n\nLa fuerza de los cristales requiere cristales azules y verdes. Esto fortalecerá tu espíritu.\n\nLa aguja de cristal requiere el uso de cristales azules y amarillos. Esto creará un escudo que perjudica a los atacantes."
G["The Eastspark siege workshop has been attacked by the Alliance!"]="联盟正在进攻东部火花车间！"
G["The Eastspark siege workshop has been attacked by the Horde!"]="部落正在进攻东部火花车间！"
G["The Eastspark siege workshop has been captured by the Alliance!"]="联盟占领了东部火花车间！"
G["The Eastspark siege workshop has been captured by the Horde!"]="部落占领了东部火花车间！"
G["The Ebon Blade is indebted to you for your help in taking The Shadow Vault. We are lucky to have you.\n\nWhile the Alliance and the Horde fight each other, doing the Lich King's job for him, we will stay focused on the task at hand.\n\nWhere the Argent Crusade might falter and think twice about how best to crush the enemy, we will have no such moral difficulties.\n\nYou shall be our instrument of vengeance, $n."]="La Espada de Ébano está en deuda contigo por tu ayuda en la toma de La Cámara de las Sombras. Tenemos suerte de tenerte entre nosotros.\n\nMientras la Alianza y la Horda luchan entre ellos, haciendo el trabajo del Rey Exánime, nosotros nos mantendremos centrados en la tarea que nos ocupa.\n\nDonde la Cruzada Argenta puede dudar y pensar dos veces en la mejor manera de aplastar al enemigo, nosotros no tendremos dificultades morales.\n\nTú serás nuestro instrumento de venganza, $n."
G["The Elder Crone rubs her wrists as she flashes a toothy grin your way."]="巫婆长老揉搓着她的手腕，露出牙齿向你笑了笑。"
G["The Elder has much to consider, but I think it's clear. You are meant to lead us to victory against the hozen."]="长老还有很多顾虑，但我觉得已经很清楚。你是来领导我们击败猢狲并取得最终胜利的。"
G["The Emerald Circle strives to heal the wounded land of Felwood. Although the land is named for the very thing that has corrupted it, we hope that one day we will be able to eradicate the corruption from this land."]="翡翠议会试图治愈费伍德森林受伤的大地。尽管这片大地是以腐蚀它的东西命名，我们还是希望有一天我们能从这片土地中将腐败清除。"
G["The Emerald Circle welcomes you, $n.\n\nHopefully together we can help rejuvenate and protect this once-mighty forest. Many forces seek to destroy it from without... and within.\n\nDo not be persuaded by the power here--it will only corrupt you, like it has this entire land."]="翡翠议会欢迎你，$n。\n\n希望我们能一起恢复并保护这片曾经繁茂的森林。许多势力试图从外部和……内部毁灭它。\n\n不要被这里的邪恶力量打败——它会腐蚀你，就它腐蚀这片土地一样。"
G["The Emerald Dream doesn't sound like a place for me. What if it turns me into a turtle? I've always wanted wings, though..."]="听起来，翡翠梦境不像是一个适合我去的地方。如果我变成一只海龟该怎么办？我一直都想要一对翅膀，但……"
G["The Emerald Dream has become a dangerous place. I grow increasingly concerned for those who have sacrificed their waking life in Azeroth in hopes of saving it."]="翡翠梦境已然危机四伏。许多勇士放弃了艾泽拉斯的生活，试图拯救翡翠梦境。我越来越担心他们的安危了。"
G["The Emerald Dream will never be yours!"]="翡翠梦境永远都不会属于你！"
G["The Emperor was in need of trusted messengers and deliverymen."]="这位皇帝需要一些可靠的信使和转运人。"
G["The Emperor's Breath abates."]="皇帝之息渐灭。"
G["The Emperor's Breath is regained."]="皇帝之息重燃。"
G["The Emperor's Courage appears in the alcoves!"]="皇帝的勇气出现在壁龛中！"
G["The Emperor's Courage burns everlasting."]="皇帝之勇光照万世。"
G["The Emperor's Rage echoes through the hills."]="皇帝之怒响彻群山。"
G["The Emperor's Strength appears in the alcoves!"]="皇帝的力量出现在壁龛中！"
G["The Emperor's Strength grips this land with fists of iron."]="皇帝之力铁血治国。"
G["The Emperor's Will dominates all it beholds."]="皇帝之志统御万物。"
G["The Empire rises again!"]="帝国再次崛起了！"
G["The Empress commands it!"]="这是女皇的命令！"
G["The Empress fears her own undoing, yet fear itself is her undoing. She is gone beyond the edge of madness."]="女皇惧怕自己的灭亡，而惧怕本身就会为她招致灭亡。她已经超出了疯狂的底线。"
G["The Empress must be brought to justice."]="必须要将女皇绳之以法。"
G["The Empress would force this swarm and raze our own lands in the process.\n\nThe cost is too high."]="女皇会在此过程中驱使虫群，同时也会摧毁我们自己的土地。\n\n代价太大了。"
G["The End of the Scourge draws near."]="天灾军团的末日即将降临。"
G["The Endless Army will crush the Emperor's foes."]="无尽大军碾碎皇帝之敌。"
G["The Energy Vortex begins to shut down."]="能量涡流开始关闭。"
G["The Energy Vortex is active!"]="能量涡流活跃了起来！"
G["The Energy Vortex is inactive!"]="能量涡流停止了！"
G["The Energy Vortex is powering down! Get off the platform!"]="能量涡流减弱了！快离开平台！"
G["The Energy Vortex is powering up!"]="能量涡流增强了！"
G["The Engine of Nalak'sha begins to self destruct!"]="纳拉克煞引擎开始自毁！"
G["The Ethereum have grown dark... twisted. Vengeance has become their only recourse and any that would stand in their way or not join their cause are considered enemies. Many saw that the Ethereum were plummeting into madness and left. Several of the Nexus-Princes of the Ethereum council abandoned the Ethereum to form other groups and factions with different goals. The Consortium are one such example of an off-shoot group. The Protectorate another..."]="复仇军在黑暗扭曲中成长。复仇变成了他们唯一的依靠，任何阻碍他们或者不愿意加入他们的人都会被他们认为是敌人。很多人因为看到复仇军陷入了疯狂而离开了他们。复仇军议会的几个节点亲王也离开复仇军，创立了其它一些有着不同目标的团体和阵营。星界财团就是其中之一，而维序派是另一个……"
G["The Ethereum were the ruling class of ethereal on my homeworld of K'aresh. Tragically, we were forced to evacuate K'aresh shortly before the void lord, Dimensius, unleashed his void armies upon the world and utterly decimated all that stood in his way. For this act, the Ethereum vowed vengeance. They have been tracking Dimensius ever since...\n\nThe Protectorate, however, were not a reaction to Dimensius. We were a reaction to Ethereum."]="复仇军曾经是我们的家乡卡雷什的统治阶级。悲惨的是，在虚空领主迪门修斯释放他的虚空大军，吞噬一切阻挡他的生物前，我们被迫从卡雷什逃了出来。为此，复仇军发誓要报仇。从那时起，他们一直都在追踪迪门修斯……\n\n然而，维序派成立的初衷并不是为了对抗迪门修斯，而是复仇军。"
G["The Eventide"]="日暮广场"
G["The Eventide is a square in southern Dalaran. The enchanted fountain there is popular for fishing."]="日暮广场位于达拉然南部。广场上的魔法喷泉是很受欢迎的钓鱼场所。"
G["The Exodar"]="埃索达"
G["The Exodar has not answered my pleas, $n. I am afraid you are the only one who can help poor Magtoor."]="埃索达没有回应我的请求，$n。恐怕只有你才能帮可怜的玛格图尔。"
G["The Exodar riders are massive and powerful combatants, terrifying at close range.\n\nTry to stay out of their defense-crushing Thrust range, breaking down their defenses with Shield-Breakers before risking a Charge."]="埃索达的骑兵是魁梧而强壮的战士，近身战时能爆发出可怕的威力。\n\n他们的刺击势如破竹，你要尽量拉远彼此的距离，并在发起冲锋前使用碎盾打破他们的防御。"
G["The Exodar's once-vast supply of textiles has dwindled dangerously low. Your reputation with the draenei here would increase were you to assist us by donating cloth."]="埃索达的布料储备快要消耗殆尽了，如果你以捐献布料的方式帮助我们，无疑可以提升你和在德莱尼人中的声望。"
G["The Exodar's paladin trainers are found in the luminous Chapel of Light in the Seat of the Naaru."]="你可以在纳鲁之座内的圣光礼拜堂找到埃索达的圣骑士训练师。"
G["The Exodar's vaults are vast and well-protected. Your goods will come to no harm here."]="埃索达的地下储藏室规模庞大，守卫森严。你的物品放在这里一定很安全。"
G["The Explorers' League exists to uncover the hidden secrets within this world.  While the cataclysm was devastating for most, for us, it provided access to untold troves of information and wealth."]="探险者协会的组建是为了发掘出隐藏在这个世界各个角落的秘密。大灾变对这个世界造成了巨大的破坏，但数不清的古代遗迹和宝藏也因此有机会重现天日。"
G["The Eye Sentry pulls nearby enemies into its field of misery, defeat it to get free!"]="眼魔哨兵将附近的敌人拉入自己的痛苦领域，击败它才能获得自由！"
G["The Eye have no lips, but the Eye whispers to Gar'gol. The Eye knows everything!"]="眼睛没有嘴唇，可眼睛偷偷说给伽格尔听。眼睛无所不知！"
G["The Eye led me here, Eris."]="眼睛指引我来到这儿，艾瑞斯。"
G["The Eye of Acherus is in your control."]="你控制了阿彻鲁斯之眼。"
G["The Eye of Acherus launches towards its destination."]="阿彻鲁斯之眼朝目标发射能量。"
G["The Eye of Paleth was retrieved and cleansed a long time ago, $c. We thought the curse lifted."]="帕雷斯之眼早在很久之前就已被夺回和净化，$c。我们以为诅咒早已被消除。"
G["The Eye of the Storm... countless battles have been fought just to find that artifact. I know not why Xi'ri entrusted it to your care, $c... but be warned... no one has wielded its power without paying a greater price."]="风暴之眼……为了寻找那件神器，曾爆发过无数惨烈的大战。我不知道为什么克希利会把它交给你，$c……可你一定要小心……掌握它的人无一不付出了惨重的代价。"
G["The Eye sees all within its sphere of influence, $c. What is it that you wish to see?"]="这眼睛能看见其视线范围内的一切事物，$c。你想看什么？"
G["The Eye talks in shadow-talk. I do what Eye says! You do what Gar'gol says!"]="眼睛用暗语交谈。我照眼睛说的做！你们照伽格尔说的做！"
G["The Eyes of Peroth'arn are looking for you."]="佩罗萨恩之眼正在搜寻你。"
G["The Faith of Ramkahen... abstains."]="拉穆卡恒之心……弃权。"
G["The Fanglords are dead! All hope is not lost!\n\nThe awakening ritual is quite complex, however. It cannot be done alone.\n\nI will handle all of the necessary preparations but I will need you to protect me. The nightmares summoned from Naralex's journey through the Emerald Dream prove to be quite formidable. Without your help, this mission is doomed.\n\nWhen you are ready to defend me, say the word, and I shall lead the way to Naralex's chamber."]="¡Los Nobles del Colmillo están muertos! ¡No se han perdido todas las esperanzas!\n\nNo obstante, el ritual del despertar es una tarea compleja. No puedo hacerlo solo.\n\nMe ocuparé de todos los preparativos necesarios, pero necesito que me protejas. Las pesadillas invocadas desde el viaje de Naralex por el Sueño Esmeralda han demostrado ser formidables. Sin tu ayuda, esta misión está condenada al fracaso.\n\nAvísame cuando estés $glisto:lista; para defenderme y yo te conduciré hacia la cámara de Naralex."
G["The Fel Horde is on the move!"]="邪部落正在行动！"
G["The Felsworn Gas Mask was destroyed, do you have another one?"]="我不小心弄坏了魔誓防毒面具，你能再给我一个吗？"
G["The Festival Loremaster asked me to speak with you."]="节日博学者要我来找你。"
G["The Festival Talespinner asked me to speak with you."]="节日诗人要我来找你。"
G["The Fire Hawk Matriarch screams in rage at your theft."]="你的偷窃行为令火鹰鸟后愤怒地尖啸起来。"
G["The Fire Lasher wriggles with glee. You found him!"]="火焰鞭笞者欢快地舞动起来。你找到它了！"
G["The Firelord and all who dare stand in my way shall reel from my wrath."]="炎魔之王和所有胆敢挡住我去路的家伙，都将尝到我的愤怒。"
G["The Firelord and his brethren once held sway over this entire world, mortal. As a servant of the Old Gods, he fought against the Titans for domination of this planet. The victorious Titans banished my master and his brethren to the Elemental Plane - there to remain imprisoned until the end of time."]="炎魔之王和他的兄弟们曾经统治整个世界。作为上古之神的一名仆从，他与泰坦争夺这个星球的统治权。获胜的泰坦将我的主人和他的兄弟们放逐到元素神域——他们被关押在那儿直到时间尽头。"
G["The Firelord has risen!  We must send word to the others.  Let us hurry!"]="炎魔之王来了！我们必须赶快把这件事告诉其他人。抓紧时间！"
G["The Firelord will be most pleased."]="炎魔之王会非常高兴的。"
G["The Firelord will bring about the end of Azeroth at long last! You will burn in his fury, fools!"]="炎魔之王终将为艾泽拉斯带来末日！你们将成为他怒火中的灰烬，蠢货！"
G["The Firelord's advances were wholly unknown to Thunderaan. Before my Lord could react, Sulfuras, legendary hammer of Ragnaros, would strike an unmerciful blow. Thunderaan fell, utterly defeated.\n\nThe Firelord feasted upon the essence of my Lord, but was unable to consume him entirely."]="桑德兰王子对炎魔之王的进攻毫不知情。在王子做出反应之前，传说中拉格纳罗斯使用的大锤萨弗拉斯就会无情地痛击王子。桑德兰倒下了，他完全被打败了。\n\n炎魔之王吸取了王子的精华，但这仍然不能满足他的贪欲。"
G["The Firewing blood elves... for some reason they want to stop us.\n\n<Warden Treelos visibly struggles to keep his wits about him for a few more seconds.>\n\nThey... they sent one of the Broken as ... as an emissary....  But he had a bomb!\n\nThey died, they all died!  They tried to run away!  The lucky ones didn't even know.\n\nI must have been at the edge of the blast.  It was horr...IT'S WATCHING US AGAIN!\n\n<Treelos becomes despondent and looks straight through you as if you're not there.>"]="火翼的血精灵们……不知道为什么，他们想阻止我们。\n\n<监护者忒洛斯努力地想镇静下来。>\n\n他们……他们派了一个破碎者作为……作为大使……但是他有炸弹！\n\n他们都死了，他们都死了！他们想逃跑！有些幸运的家伙甚至都不知道。\n\n我肯定是在爆炸的边缘。那实在太糟了……又开始监视我们了！\n\n<忒洛斯变得很沮丧，直钩钩地看着前方，好像把你当成了空气。>"
G["The First World Pillar Fragment drops from Abyssion's lifeless corpse!"]="只要杀了艾比希昂，就能拿到第一块世界之柱碎片！"
G["The Flame Leviathan begins to overload!"]="烈焰巨兽开始超载！"
G["The Fleshwerks is the heart of the Scourge's ghoul, abomination, and flesh giant production. If we can take it out, the Lich King will be greatly weakened."]="缝合场是天灾军团制造食尸鬼、憎恶和血肉巨人的中心。如果我们能摧毁这座工厂，巫妖王的力量就会被大大削弱。"
G["The Fleshwerks will never again produce soldiers for the Lich King's armies."]="缝合场再也不能为巫妖王制造血肉大军了。"
G["The Flower of Life calls upon me. I WILL NOT fail you, my Queen."]="生命之花在召唤我。我不会让您失望的，女王陛下。"
G["The Focusing Iris thrums, holding back an inconceivable amount of restrained power!"]="聚焦之虹发出低沉的嗡嗡声，积蓄着不可思议的强大力量！"
G["The Focusing Iris within the Eye of Eternity may allow us to converge the magical matrix contained within the Dragon Soul."]="永恒之眼里的聚焦之虹也许能让我们汇聚储藏在巨龙之魂里的魔法矩阵。"
G["The Forest Lord is aware of the destruction in this valley, $n. Soon we must make our way to the Circle of Calling. Prepare yourself!"]="森林之王已经知晓了这个山谷的毁灭，$n。很快我们就要到召唤法阵去了。做好准备！"
G["The Forsaken are right to celebrate their freedom."]="被遗忘者一定要庆祝他们重获自由！"
G["The Forsaken are right to celebrate their freedom. What else is more important?"]="被遗忘者有权庆祝自己重获自由。还有什么比这更重要的吗？"
G["The Forsaken brew such intriguing and strong concoctions, don't you think? It comes from an inability to poison oneself with failures, I believe. Luckily for you, Doctor Herbert Halsey in the Undercity has already done the necessary research; all that remains is for you to visit him."]="被遗忘者配制出的药剂非常强劲，你不觉得吗？我相信，他们以自身为实验品，经历无数次失败才取得了如此伟大的成就。当然你很幸运，赫伯特·哈尔希医生已经完成了所有必要的研究，你只需去拜访他就行了。"
G["The Forsaken have broken through your defenses, magistrate."]="被遗忘者已经攻破了你的防线，镇长。"
G["The Forsaken think we're weak.  A broken people.  They think we'll roll over like a scared dog."]="被遗忘者以为我们软弱无能。心灰意冷。他们以为我们会像丧家犬一样投降。"
G["The Forsaken weapon master Archibald knows his way around the polearm. He trains others in the War Quarter of the Undercity. Ileda, the blood elf weapon master within Farstrider Square in Silvermoon, can show you the proper techniques also."]="遗忘者的武器大师阿基巴德知道如何使用长柄武器，他就在幽暗城的军事区训练其他人。银月城远行者广场的血精灵武器大师伊蕾达也能教你相同的技能。"
G["The Forsaken will pay for what they've done!"]="被遗忘者将要为他们所犯的罪行付出代价！"
G["The Fossil-Finder 3000 indicates that there is a large fossil to the east of here."]="化石探测器3000显示东边有一块巨大的化石。"
G["The Fossil-Finder 3000 indicates that there is a large fossil to the north of here."]="化石探测器3000显示北边有一块巨大的化石。"
G["The Fossil-Finder 3000 indicates that there is a large fossil to the northeast of here."]="化石探测器3000显示东北边有一块巨大的化石。"
G["The Fossil-Finder 3000 indicates that there is a large fossil to the northwest of here."]="化石探测器3000显示西北边有一块巨大的化石。"
G["The Fossil-Finder 3000 indicates that there is a large fossil to the south of here."]="化石探测器3000显示南边有一块巨大的化石。"
G["The Fossil-Finder 3000 indicates that there is a large fossil to the southeast of here."]="化石探测器3000显示东南边有一块巨大的化石。"
G["The Fossil-Finder 3000 indicates that there is a large fossil to the southwest of here."]="化石探测器3000显示西南边有一块巨大的化石。"
G["The Fossil-Finder 3000 indicates that there is a large fossil to the west of here."]="化石探测器3000显示西边有一块巨大的化石。"
G["The Fostwolf Graveyard is owned by the Alliance."]="霜狼墓地为联盟所有。"
G["The Fostwolf Graveyard is owned by the Horde."]="霜狼墓地为部落所有。"
G["The Frost Lord has won."]="冰霜之王赢了。"
G["The Frost Lord, Ahune, must be stopped.\nEven now he is taking form, summoned from his elemental prison by the mad cultists of the Twilight's Hammer.\nIf he's allowed to enter our world completely, he'll bury us beneath an eternal winter."]="Hay que detener al Señor de la Escarcha Ahune.\n\nEn estos mismos instantes está tomando forma al ser invocado de su prisión elemental por los cultores locos del Martillo Crepuscular.\n\nSi consigue entrar en nuestro mundo por completo, nos enterrará bajo el manto de un invierno perpetuo."
G["The Frost Queen is gone. We must keep moving - our objective is near."]="冰霜女王飞走了。我们……我们必须继续前进——目标就在眼前。"
G["The Frostlord... will... destroy you..."]="冰霜领主……将……毁灭你……"
G["The Frostmane trolls have been raiding the ranch continuously."]="霜鬃巨魔一直在突袭这农场。"
G["The Frostwolf General is dead!"]="部落的将军死了！"
G["The Frostwolf Graveyard is along the side of the road, not far north of Frostwolf Village.\n\nNeither side controls it."]="霜狼墓地就在距离霜狼村以北不远的路面。\n\n联盟和部落还在争夺这片土地。"
G["The Frostwolf Graveyard is along the side of the road, not far north of Frostwolf Village.\n\nThe Alliance currently controls it."]="霜狼墓地就在离霜狼村北面不远的地方。\n\n联盟控制着这片土地。"
G["The Frostwolf Graveyard is along the side of the road, not far north of Frostwolf Village.\n\nThe Horde currently controls it."]="霜狼墓地就在离霜狼村北面不远的地方。\n\n部落控制着这片土地。"
G["The Frostwolf Graveyard is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Alliance will capture it!"]="霜狼墓地受到攻击！如果我们不尽快采取措施，联盟会占领它的！"
G["The Frostwolf Graveyard is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Horde will capture it!"]="霜狼墓地受到攻击！如果我们不尽快采取措施，部落会占领它的！"
G["The Frostwolf Graveyard was taken by the Alliance!"]="霜狼墓地被联盟占领了！"
G["The Frostwolf Graveyard was taken by the Horde!"]="霜狼墓地被部落占领了！"
G["The Frostwolf Quartermaster is southwest of this bunker.  Enter the bunker and then exit on the right, you'll see the quartermaster a short way down the path."]="霜狼军需官就在这个工事的东面。进入碉堡，从右边的出口出去，不远处你就可以看到军需官。"
G["The Frostwolf Relief Hut is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Alliance will capture it!"]="霜狼急救站受到攻击！如果我们不尽快采取措施，联盟会占领它的！"
G["The Frostwolf Relief Hut is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Horde will capture it!"]="霜狼急救站受到攻击！如果我们不尽快采取措施，部落会占领它的！"
G["The Frostwolf Relief Hut lies in Frostwolf Keep, south of the Frostwolf Towers.\n\nNeither side currently controls it."]="霜狼急救站在霜狼城堡中，就在霜狼哨塔以南。\n\n联盟和部落还在争夺这片土地。"
G["The Frostwolf Relief Hut lies in Frostwolf Keep, south of the Frostwolf Towers.\n\nThe Alliance currently controls it."]="霜狼急救站在霜狼城堡中，就在霜狼哨塔以南。\n\n联盟控制着这片土地。"
G["The Frostwolf Relief Hut lies in Frostwolf Keep, south of the Frostwolf Towers.\n\nThe Horde controls it."]="霜狼急救站在霜狼城堡中，就在霜狼哨塔以南。\n\n部落控制着这片土地。"
G["The Frostwolf Relief Hut was taken by the Alliance!"]="霜狼急救站被联盟占领了！"
G["The Frostwolf Relief Hut was taken by the Horde!"]="霜狼急救站被部落占领了！"
G["The Frostwolf forces gain the General's Warcry."]="霜狼军队得到了将军的怒吼。"
G["The Frozen Heart of Isuldof will consume this land until it is returned. Woe unto those that hold the heart as the curse of frozen blood besets them..."]="除非伊斯多弗的冰冷之心归位，否则它迟早会吞噬这片大陆。但凡拥有它的人，无一例外地被冰冷鲜血诅咒所困扰，为他们的痛楚默哀吧……"
G["The Frozen Throne..."]="冰封王座……"
G["The Fruit of Fertility?"]="丰饶之果？"
G["The Fury Leviathan will enjoy using your body as a puppet against these lands."]="狂怒的海怪会很乐意将你的身体当做傀儡，对抗这片土地。"
G["The Gastropod starts chasing |cFFFF0000$n|r!"]="巨型蜗牛开始追逐|cFFFF0000$n|r！"
G["The Gate of the Blue Sapphire is under attack!"]="蓝玉之门遭到攻击！"
G["The Gate of the Blue Sapphire was destroyed!"]="蓝玉之门被摧毁了！"
G["The Gate of the Green Emerald is under attack!"]="翡翠之门遭到攻击！"
G["The Gate of the Green Emerald was destroyed!"]="翡翠之门被摧毁了！"
G["The Gate of the Purple Amethyst is under attack!"]="紫晶之门遭到攻击！"
G["The Gate of the Purple Amethyst was destroyed!"]="紫晶之门被摧毁了！"
G["The Gate of the Purple Amythest was destroyed!"]="紫晶之门被摧毁了！"
G["The Gate of the Red Sun is under attack!"]="红日之门遭到攻击！"
G["The Gate of the Red Sun was destroyed!"]="红日之门被摧毁了！"
G["The Gate of the Yellow Moon is under attack!"]="金月之门遭到攻击！"
G["The Gate of the Yellow Moon was destroyed!"]="金月之门被摧毁了！"
G["The Gearmaster has plans for your weak flesh."]="机甲专家能改造你那虚弱的血肉之躯。"
G["The General is determined to set up camp here.\n\nI hope he knows what he's doing..."]="将军决心在这里扎营。\n\n但愿他知道自己在做什么……"
G["The Ghostlands will not be won back by military force alone, $n.  That's where we magisters come in.\n\nOur guile and knowledge of the arcane are unmatched."]="Las Tierras Fantasma no se recuperarán con solo la fuerza militar, $n. Aquí es donde entran en juego los magistri.\n\nNuestra astucia y nuestro conocimiento de lo Arcano no tienen igual."
G["The Ginormus has fallen! $n looks like $Ghe's:she's; ready for more!"]="¡El Enormus ha caído! ¡Parece que $n está $glisto:lista; para más!"
G["The Glacial Falls be to the east, mon. Bring back da best armor ya be findin'. Those Alliance won't know what hit 'em."]="冰川瀑布就在东边，朋友。带回你能找到的最好的护甲。联盟不会知道是谁在攻击他们。"
G["The Glacial Falls is a dangerous place, $n. The Horde will be just as happy to claim your armor for their vile hoodoo magics."]="冰川瀑布非常危险，$n。为了施放邪恶的巫毒魔法，部落会毫不犹豫地杀死你，夺走你的护甲。"
G["The Glintrok Scout shouts a warning!"]="格林托克斥候发出了警报！"
G["The Glopgut ogres stormed Thundermar while Colin was here at the summit. They kidnapped Fanny and ran for the hills!"]="黏肠食人魔趁科林离开之机，攻入了桑德玛尔。他们把范妮劫走了！"
G["The Gnomeregan riders believe in balance and precision, deftly mixing attack and defense.\n\nHowever, they will often open themselves to Charges by trying to gain range on you.\n\nClose that range with a Charge before they can do the same, and then Shield-Break them as you wheel around for more Thrusts."]="诺莫瑞根的骑兵将攻击和防御巧妙地结合起来，在作战中实现平衡与精准。\n\n但是，由于他们需要时刻与你保持距离，因此你可以伺机冲锋。\n\n你必须抢在他们之前发起冲锋，拉近彼此的距离，接下来在围绕他们跑动的过程中使用碎盾并看准机会使用刺击。"
G["The Goblin All-In-1der Belt's battery is depleted."]="地精百宝腰带的电池耗光了。"
G["The Goddess has granted me wisdom, stranger. If it is her will, I shall pass it on to you."]="La Diosa me ha otorgado sabiduría, $gforastero:forastera;. Si ese es su deseo, te la transmitiré."
G["The Golden Keg is in the northen part of the Dwarven District, right by the fountain."]="黄金酒桶旅店位于矮人区的北部，就在喷泉旁边。"
G["The Golden Lotus has overseen the Vale for thousands of years.\n\nThe heavens have sent us their sign, and we stand united in our belief that it is time to open the gates once more.\n\nAre you ready?"]="El Loto Dorado ha estado vigilando el valle durante milenios.\n\nLos cielos nos han enviado su señal, y unidos y seguros decimos que es hora de abrir de nuevo las puertas.\n\n¿Estás $gpreparado:preparada;?"
G["The Golden Lotus is charged with defending the Vale of Eternal Blossoms.\n\nIf you wish to help us, defeat enemies of the Golden Lotus who currently occupy the Vale.\n\nYou may also speak to Anji Autumnlight at the Setting Sun Garrison training camp for further tasks."]="金莲教肩负着守卫锦绣谷的重任。\n\n如果你想帮助我们，就去打败那些目前占据着锦绣谷的敌人吧。\n\n你也可以去残阳关卫戍营的训练场找安济·秋光，获取下一步的任务。"
G["The Golden Lotus will never yield."]="金莲教永远不会屈服。"
G["The Golden Lotus... they pledged their lives to defend this place."]="金莲教……他们曾经誓死保卫这片土地。"
G["The Gordunni Ogres have blighted this land long enough. We are here to take this land and its resources for the Horde."]="戈杜尼食人魔已经破坏这片土地相当久了。我们来这里，就是要为部落夺回这片土地以及它丰富的资源！"
G["The Gordunni are a large ogre tribe that has control over considerable portions of forests in Feralas. Their dark magic seeps into the elements around them, damaging both the environment and the creatures that inhabit it.\n\nIf you do decide to travel to Feralas, please be mindful of these ogres -- they are quite nasty and many are able to wield powerful dark magic."]="庞大的戈杜尼食人魔部落控制了菲拉斯森林的很大一块区域。他们的黑暗魔法已经渗透了周围的环境，从而直接对那里的其它生物造成了毁灭性的打击。\n\n如果你去菲拉斯的话，可得小心那些食人魔——他们非常肮脏，而且很多都会使用强大的黑暗魔法。"
G["The Grand Admiral himself has come to see to our dedication.  If I see you slacking on your post again, I will gut you myself."]="韦斯温大人正在这一带巡视呢！如果再让我看见你在岗位上划水，我就把你撕成碎片。"
G["The Grand Crusader has charged me with destroying you and your newfound friends, Taelan, but know this: I do this for pleasure, not of obligation or duty."]="大十字军命令我毁掉了你和你新交的朋友泰兰，但是你要知道：我做这事儿纯属个人兴趣，跟职责和义务无关。"
G["The Grand Widow Faerlina, a botanist in life, breeder and caretaker of arachnids in death, she overseers the spider wing, developing the most potent of poisons for the Lich King."]="黑女巫法琳娜。生前她是一位植物学家，死后她为巫妖王效力，负责管理蜘蛛区的蛛怪培育与毒药研制工作。"
G["The Great One will smash you!"]="你会被碾成粉末的！"
G["The Greatmother raised all of us. Any Mag'hari that you see has had their life touched in some special way by the Greatmother. We will miss her greatly when she passes."]="盖亚安祖母让我们获得了升华。所有你遇到的玛格汉族人的生活都与盖亚安祖母有着某些特殊的联系。当她去世的时候，我们会非常怀念她的。"
G["The Grimleer tribe owns this forest. We'll kill anyone who creeps on our turf."]="这片森林属于恐目部族。闯进来的人都要死。"
G["The Grimtotem attacked us by surprise. We're barely hanging on here."]="恐怖图腾出其不意地突袭了我们。我们就快要坚持不住了。"
G["The Grimtotem have struck us for the last time. Since they cannot be taught the error of their ways, we will destroy them like beasts.\n\nEarth Mother forgive us."]="这是恐怖图腾最后一次向我们发动进攻了。既然他们不可能明白自己的错误，我们就要像消灭野兽一样摧毁他们。\n\n愿大地母亲原谅我们。"
G["The Grimtotem will never surrender!"]="恐怖图腾绝不投降！"
G["The Guild Master & Vendor."]="公会注册员及公会商人"
G["The Gumps are letting me help them run their shop! I just love flowers.\n\n<Little Adeline suddenly squints at you, looking very serious.>\n\nDo you like flowers?"]="那群傻瓜竟然让我帮他们管理他们的商店！而我只喜欢花。\n\n<小艾德琳突然斜眼盯着你，表情显得异常严肃>\n\n你喜欢花吗？"
G["The Gurubashi are dead, and Hakkar with them.  Most of my fellow Zandalar have returned to their homeland.\n\nIt falls on me, Chabal, and the Darkspears of Bambala to watch over Zul'Gurub now."]="古拉巴什已经灭亡，连同哈卡一起。我大多数的赞达拉同胞都回到了他们的故乡。\n\n现在，守卫祖尔格拉布的重任就落在了我，查巴尔和邦巴拉暗矛巨魔的肩上。"
G["The Gurubashi are dead, and Hakkar with them.  Most of my fellow Zandalar have returned to their homeland.\n\nIt falls on me, Maywiki, and the Darkspears of Bambala to watch over Zul'Gurub now."]="古拉巴什连同哈卡一起都完蛋了。大多数追随我的赞达拉巨魔都回到了他们的家园。\n\n现在，看护祖尔格拉布的任务落在了我、梅维克和邦巴拉暗矛巨魔的肩上。"
G["The Gurubashi attackers just keep streaming in! We've been pinned down here and haven't received word from the outlying outposts in days."]="古拉巴什进攻者接连不断地涌来！我们被围困在这里好多天了，完全收不到来自外围哨站的情报。"
G["The Gurubashi have fallen on hard times.  I live, and Mandokir has returned... but the rest of us are gone."]="古拉巴什遭遇了危难。我活了下来，曼多基尔也回来了……可我们却失去了剩下的所有人。"
G["The Hall of Spirits is where our shamans call home.  You can find it on the Spirit Rise.  May your ancestors watch over you."]="灵魂大厅是萨满祭司的家园，它坐落在灵魂高地上。愿你的先祖保佑你。"
G["The Halls of Lightning, a level 80 dungeon within Storm Peaks, is now available for testing. Please be in your full group before teleporting to the dungeon. Meeting Stones are not available for this dungeon yet.\nTo leave the Halls of Lightning, simply exit through the normal exit inside the dungeon and you will be returned here. If you die and release, you should teleport back from this NPC."]="位于风暴峭壁的80级地下城闪电大厅已开放测试。请在进入地下城之前组满队伍。该地下城的集合石尚未开放。\n您只要通过从地下城的常规出口，就能离开闪电大厅，返回这里。如果您的角色死亡并选择了释放，您可从该NPC处传送回去。"
G["The Halls of Origination lie due east of here, near the desert sands of Tanaris. It be a bit of a walk, so we'd best get movin'."]="起源大厅就在东面，靠近塔纳利斯沙漠。要走一阵子才能到，所以我们最好尽快动身。"
G["The Halls of Stone, a level 77-79 dungeon within Storm Peaks, is now available for testing. Please be in your full group before teleporting to the dungeon. Meeting Stones are not available for this dungeon yet.\nTo leave the Halls of Stone, simply exit through the normal exit inside the dungeon and you will be returned here. If you die and release, you should teleport back from this NPC."]="Las Cámaras de Piedra, una mazmorra de nivel 77-79 en Las Cumbres Tormentosas ya está disponible para probarla. Por favor, forma un grupo completo antes de teletransportarte a la mazmorra. Las Rocas de Encuentro todavía no están disponibles para esta mazmorra.\n\nPara salir de Las Cámaras de Piedra, basta con salir por la salida normal de la mazmorra y volverás aquí. Si mueres y te liberas, deberás volver a teleportarte con este PNJ."
G["The Hammer of Twilight. (The Hammer of Twilight!) Commissioned by the Aspect of Death. It is the breaker of worlds. It is not yours to wield. (Kill the intruders!) Kill them all!"]="暮光神锤。（暮光神锤！）它由死亡的化身赐予。是世界的破坏者。不是你能使用的。（消灭入侵者！）把他们杀光！"
G["The Harsh Light reveals a Pale Fog!"]="刺眼强光照出了一只苍白雾行兽！"
G["The Headless Horseman attacks the village!  Someone must save the children and stop him!"]="无头骑士要攻击村子了！谁能救救孩子们，谁能阻止它！"
G["The Headless Horseman attacks!  The fires threaten to consume the whole village!  What will we do?"]="无头骑士发动了攻击！火焰可能会吞噬整个村落！我们该怎么办？"
G["The Headless Horseman had been driven away, for now.  We may breath easy for a time, but must remain ever vigilant."]="无头骑士暂时被击退了。我们可以稍微松口气，但是仍然不能掉以轻心。"
G["The Headless Horseman has set fire to the village!  We must protect the children!"]="无头骑士正在村子里到处放火！我们必须要保护孩子们！"
G["The Headless Horseman is attacking!  Quickly, aid your Horde brethren in the village's defense!"]="无头骑士来了！快一点，帮助你们的部落同胞保卫村庄！"
G["The Headless Horseman lives in the Scarlet Monastery with all the other creepy ghosts and humans."]="无头骑士与其他令人毛骨悚然的鬼魂和人类一起住在血色修道院。"
G["The Headless Horseman lives in the Scarlet Monastery.  Sometimes he comes out and scares the grown ups, but not me!"]="无头骑士居住在血色修道院。有时候他会出来吓唬小孩子，但我不怕！"
G["The Headless Horseman was scared away!"]="无头骑士落荒而逃了！"
G["The Headless Horseman was scary, but I wasn't scared!  Not me!"]="无头骑士很可怕，但我一点都不害怕！一点也不害怕！"
G["The Headless Horseman's mind is plagued with dementia!  During Hallow's End, he might attack this village at any moment."]="无头骑士的灵魂已经变得疯狂了！在万圣节期间，他随时可能袭击这座村庄！"
G["The Headless Horseman's undead mind is obsessed!  During Hallow's End, his attacks on this village are frequent, and terrible."]="无头骑士的灵魂已经变得疯狂了！在万圣节期间，他随时可能袭击这座村庄！"
G["The Headless Horseman, once a knight of the Silver Hand and a hero among his fellow paladins, is cursed.  Driven insane within the Scarlet Monastery, he believes that he is alive and we are dead.\n\nNow, his fervor no longer serves the Light.  With the coming of Hallow's End, he spreads gloom and fire across the villages of Azeroth."]="无头骑士本是白银之手的成员，可惜这位昔日的英雄被诅咒了。他盘踞在血色修道院中，失去理智的无头骑士竟然认为自己还活着，我们才是没有生命的亡者。\n\n他再也不是圣光忠诚的仆从了。随着万圣节的来临，他在艾泽拉斯世界各地的村落中散播着阴暗的种子，还有那仇恨的火焰。"
G["The Heart of Fury... I witnessed its power long ago, when Velen wielded it.  I feel the same power coursing through it right now!"]="愤怒之心……很久以前，维伦持有它的时候，我目睹过它的力量。而现在，我依然可以感觉到相同的力量正在它内部澎湃着！"
G["The Heart will be your end!"]="亚煞极之心就是你们的末日！"
G["The Helm of Hodir!"]="霍迪尔之盔！"
G["The Helmsman comes for you!"]="舵手奥拉布斯来对付你了！"
G["The High Commander said to speak with you to get a ride to Thorson's Post."]="高级指挥官说你可以送我前往索尔森的岗哨。"
G["The High Executor is a very busy man, $c.  Maybe I can help you with whatever you need?"]="高级执行官公务繁忙，$c。或者我能帮得上你的忙？"
G["The High Inquisitor comes! Be ready, death knight! Do not let him draw you out of the protective bounds of my anti-magic field! Kill him and take his head!"]="大检察官来了！准备迎战，死亡骑士！别离开反魔法屏障的安全区域！击败他，拿到他的徽记！"
G["The High King has no intention of letting Garrosh continue his mad campaign. It is costing too many innocent lives.\n\nWe are here to look for vulnerabilities in Orgrimmar's defenses. The sort of vulnerabilities that an Alliance army could take advantage of.\n\nUnfortunately, it looks like Garrosh has not been idle. He has stepped up recruitment of Kor'kron and turned them into a full-fledged war machine."]="国王陛下不想让加尔鲁什继续他那疯狂的战役了。它已经吞噬了太多无辜的生命。\n\n我们是来寻找奥格瑞玛的防线弱点的，那种能够为联盟部队所用的弱点。\n\n不幸的是，加尔鲁什显然也没闲着。他已经加快了库卡隆的征兵速度，并将他们变成了彻头彻尾的战争机器。"
G["The High King, his champions, and the Dark Iron dwarves worked together to save Ironforge."]="国王率领他的勇士，和黑铁矮人齐心协力拯救了铁炉堡。"
G["The High King. Varian Wrynn - Leader of the Alliance."]="联盟的领袖——国王瓦里安·乌瑞恩。"
G["The High Priest sends his regrets.  He had hoped that one day you would be a powerful weapon against our enemies."]="高阶牧师对你失望不已。他曾经以为，你终有一天会成为我们对抗敌人的一件强大武器。"
G["The High Priestess could not leave Darnassus. Fandral is in a very foul mood."]="高阶女祭司现在不能离开达纳苏斯。范达尔的情绪非常奇怪。"
G["The High Priestess will feast on your bones!"]="高阶女祭司会吞噬你的骨头！"
G["The High Shaman is here - I can see the storm clouds. Crush him, that we may take his skull as a trophy!"]="高阶萨满祭司就在这里——我能看到那团暴风云。干掉他，我们也许能从他身上弄到一个漂亮的战利品！"
G["The Highborne Archmage, Aranhir Starsinger, is a master of arcane reforging... you might convince him to aid you.\nHe can often be found discussing his craft with those of Simply Enchanting, just outside the Magus Commerce Exchange in northwest Dalaran."]="Aranhir Vocestrella, el archimago Altonato, es un maestro de la reforja Arcana... A lo mejor lo puedes convencer para que te ayude.\n\nA menudo se le ve charlando de su arte con el personal de Simplemente Encantador, justo en el exterior del Mercado de Magos al noroeste de Dalaran."
G["The Highborne ghosts that you see wandering through the courtyard and halls of Eldre'Thalas were slain, not by invading Gordok ogres or satyrs, but by the Prince himself!"]="你所见到的那些在埃雷萨拉斯的庭院和城墙附近游荡的上层精灵灵魂不是被戈多克食人魔或萨特所杀，而是死于王子之手！"
G["The Highborne have returned, and with them spellcraft lost to the world for centuries.\n\nDo you have something for me to examine?"]="上层精灵回来了，还带回了失落已久的神秘法术。\n\n你有什么需要我检视的东西吗？"
G["The Highborne, Irriende, inside of the inn, can train you in the ways of the arcane."]="上层精灵艾莉恩蒂就在这家旅店里。她能传授你奥术的秘密。"
G["The Highlord has requested more abominations!"]="大领主需要更多的憎恶！"
G["The Highlord was the lynchpin of the Crusade. Aye, Mograine was called the Ashbringer because of his exploits versus the armies of the Lich King. With only blade and faith, Mograine would walk into whole battalions of undead and emerge unscathed - the ashes of his foes being the only indication that he had been there at all. Do you not understand? The very face of death feared him! It trembled in his presence!"]="大领主那时是十字军的核心人物。哎，当时，莫格莱尼被称作灰烬使者，因为他曾把成千上百的巫妖王的爪牙化为灰烬。手中有神兵，心中有信仰，就算是所有的亡灵军团排成阵列在莫格莱尼面前，他也会从容步入，然后他所经过的地方便只会留下敌人的身躯所烧成的灰烬。你能理解吗？就算是亡灵，遇到他也会感觉到恐惧！就算是魔鬼，站在他面前也会浑身颤抖。"
G["The Hippogryph is a noble beast, proud and swift.  They are an honor to train, and can quickly take their rider a great distance."]="角鹰兽是一种高贵而迅捷的动物。这些训练有素的飞兽可以让它们的骑手以很快的速度旅行。"
G["The Hole is a foul place $n.  I would not venture down there unless you are well armed and ready for battle."]="这个洞穴是个肮脏的地方，$n。除非你已经装备妥当，做好了充分的战斗准备，否则我可不会进去冒险。"
G["The Honor Quartermaster can be found on the Serpent's Spine, the great wall to the west.\n\nI will mark their location on your map for you."]="你可以在西边那道名为蟠龙脊的雄伟长城上找到荣誉军需官。\n\n我会为你在地图上标出位置。"
G["The Hooded Crusader gazes down upon the high inquisitor's blade-skewered corpse."]="蒙面的十字军战士凝视着检查官被刀片刺穿的尸体。"
G["The Horde Captain Galvangar is slain.  Defeat Drek'Thar and victory will be ours!"]="Han matado al capitán de la Horda Galvangar. Derrotad a Drek'Thar y la victoria será nuestra."
G["The Horde Embassy is in the Valley of Strength on the west side."]="部落大使馆位于西边的力量谷。"
G["The Horde Flag has returned to its base!"]="部落军旗已回到旗座上了！"
G["The Horde Flag is now placed at its base."]="部落军旗现在被放在旗座上。"
G["The Horde Flag was dropped by $n!"]="$n掉落了部落军旗！"
G["The Horde Flag was picked up by $n!"]="$n拾起了部落军旗！"
G["The Horde Flag was returned to its base by $n!"]="$n将部落军旗放回到旗座上了！"
G["The Horde General's chest drops to the ground."]="部落将军的箱子掉在了地上。"
G["The Horde Quarter"]="部落区"
G["The Horde are attacking, Nove!"]="部落进攻了，诺弗！"
G["The Horde are coming aboard!  Get up to the deck and help fend them off!"]="部落快要爬上来了！快去甲板上帮忙御敌！"
G["The Horde battlemasters can usually be found on a stairwell southeast of the city's center."]="你通常可以在城市中心东南方的楼梯口找到部落军官。"
G["The Horde bridge is under attack!"]="联盟的桥梁遭到攻击！"
G["The Horde brought back a hozen?! Dinna' they had enough of those back in Pandaria?"]="部落带回来一只猢狲？！他们在潘达利亚还没有受够那些家伙吗？"
G["The Horde cannot be allowed to recover the Focusing Iris.  Eliminate what remains of their forces, and I will secure the artifact."]="绝对不能让部落找到聚焦之虹。消灭他们军队的所有残余力量，我会保护好神器。"
G["The Horde cannot win!"]="部落决不会获胜！"
G["The Horde captured the last flag!"]="部落夺取了最后一面旗帜！"
G["The Horde captured the titan portal!"]="部落占领了泰坦的传送门！"
G["The Horde cries for a hero of old. An orc of true blood that will bow to no human and bear no betrayal. A warrior that will make our people proud again. Garrosh can be that hero."]="部落渴望一个旧时代的英雄，一个血统纯粹，不会向人类低头，不会容忍背叛的兽人。一位能让人民重活荣耀的战士。加尔鲁什就是这样的英雄。"
G["The Horde demands justice! We challenge the Alliance! Allow us to battle in place of your knights, paladin. We will show these dogs what it means to insult the Horde."]="部落需要公正！我们向联盟挑战！请允许我们代你出战，圣骑士。我们要让那些狗知道侮辱部落的下场。"
G["The Horde did attack the ship, preventing it from reaching Teldrassil. But that's only the beginning of it..."]="部落确实攻击了舰船，使其无法顺利抵达泰达希尔。但那仅仅是开始……"
G["The Horde did much to aid my people in freeing the Black Temple of Illidan's grasp. \n\nI will help you as a show of mutual trust."]="部落曾鼎力协助我们从伊利丹手中夺回黑暗神殿。\n\n我愿意帮助你，因为我们彼此信任。"
G["The Horde doesn't pay me enough for this... this crap!"]="部落可没给我足够的钱来干这……破事儿！"
G["The Horde embraced my people when we stood alone and we Forsaken never forget a debt..."]="我们永远不会忘记，在我们被遗忘者孤立无援的时候，部落张开双臂欢迎了我们。"
G["The Horde fires will never be extinguished!"]="部落的火焰永远都不会熄灭！"
G["The Horde gold cart is now full and can be stolen from their base!"]="部落运金车已满，现在可以潜入他们的基地去偷走它了！"
