G["The Horde is stockpiling a great many bandages. So far $2079w out of $2080w wool bandages have been collected. $2085w out of $2086w mageweave bandages have been created. And $2089w out of $2090w runecloth bandages have been gathered."]="部落正在收集绷带。到目前为止，我们已经收集到$2079w根绒线绷带、$2085w根魔纹绷带和$2089w根符文布绷带，而总的需求量分别是$2080w、$2086w和$2090w。"
G["The Horde is up to something. They've never attacked our transports directly before."]="部落一定是在谋划着什么。他们以前从没直接攻击过我们的运输工具。"
G["The Horde is victorious!"]="部落获得了胜利！"
G["The Horde isn't the only danger in this forest.  Don't let its seeming tranquility fool you."]="部落不是这片森林里潜伏着的唯一危险。不要让它宁静的表象迷惑了你。"
G["The Horde means to strangle us to death this time. I hope to the Light that the king acts before it's too late..."]="部落这次是想要置我们于死地了。我祈求圣光，希望国王能及时采取行动……"
G["The Horde must not allow the draenei and their meddling Alliance to control all the mana cells in Outland. Will you join the blood elves in their assault on the Eye of the Storm?"]="部落不会允许德莱尼人和那些爱管闲事的联盟来控制外域的魔法晶格。你会加入血精灵的部队并前往风暴之眼作战吗？"
G["The Horde needs you! Beat back the Lich King's forces!"]="部落需要你！击退巫妖王的军队！"
G["The Horde now controls the Twilight Shores beach head."]="部落控制了暮光海岸的滩头阵地。"
G["The Horde now dominates the Battlescar!"]="现在部落控制了战斗之痕！"
G["The Horde seems determined to escalate this war even further and that warchief has his eyes on my homeland!"]="部落似乎决意要扩大这场战争的规模，酋长竟然要把战火烧到我的家乡！"
G["The Horde sends assassins! Kill them all!"]="部落派来了刺客！把他们全都干掉！"
G["The Horde shall tremble before me!"]="部落将在我面前战栗！"
G["The Horde spectators cheer for $n."]="部落的成员们为$n而欢呼。"
G["The Horde stands ready now that we have finished with all of our resource gathering. We only wait for the sluggish Alliance to finish with theirs, and then on to glorious battle!"]="我们已经完成了收集资源的工作，一切都准备就绪了。只等那些懒惰的联盟完成他们的任务，就能开战了！"
G["The Horde team is running out of reinforcements!"]="部落的增援快要耗尽了！"
G["The Horde tower was destroyed!"]="部落哨塔被摧毁了！"
G["The Horde towers have fallen! We have forced their hand. Finish off the remaining forces!"]="部落的塔楼全部被摧毁了！他们已经落败。解决残余的敌人！"
G["The Horde war machine needs you!"]="部落的战争机器需要你！"
G["The Horde will be victorious!"]="部落必将赢得胜利！"
G["The Horde will find no purchase on these shores. And when the Thunder King lies beaten, the Pandaren will see that it was Alliance heroes who stood by them in their hour of need."]="部落休想在这片海滩上占得便宜。等雷神被击败后，熊猫人就会明白，在紧急关头，是联盟的英雄与他们并肩作战。"
G["The Horde will pay for this atrocity. Hellscream must answer for this crime!"]="部落将为他们的残暴付出代价。地狱咆哮必须对这罪行负责！"
G["The Horde will pay for what they've wrought here.\n\nOnce I reclaim the Focusing Iris from this... abomination... Garrosh will know the true meaning of destruction.\n\nOrgrimmar... will DROWN."]="La Horda pagará por los estragos que ha causado aquí. En cuanto le arrebate el Iris de enfoque a esta... abominación... Garrosh comprenderá el verdadero significado de la destrucción. Orgrimmar... CAERÁ."
G["The Horde will protect the Taunka. Be calm, friend."]="部落会保护牦牛人的。冷静点，朋友。"
G["The Horde will taste Alliance steel!"]="让部落尝尝联盟钢刃的味道！"
G["The Horde wins!"]="部落胜利了！"
G["The Horde! Run away!"]="是部落！快跑！"
G["The Horde's gathering efforts are completed, $c. Now we bide our time with extra preparations while the Alliance finishes their war collections."]="部落已经完成了收集任务，$c。现在我们就只等联盟集齐他们的战争物资了。"
G["The Horde?"]="还有部落？"
G["The Horde? I SPIT on your Horde! Our enemies are weak and splintered, yet you bargain with Hellscream? Dragonmaw stand alone!"]="部落？我呸你个部落！我们的敌人是一盘无力的散沙，你却跟地狱咆哮讲条件？龙喉无人能及！"
G["The Hour of Twilight falls - the end of all things - you cannot stop it. You are nothing. NOTHING!"]="暮光审判降临了——万物的末日到了——你阻止不了。你微不足道。微不足道！"
G["The Hour of Twilight is nigh; the sun sets on your pitiful mortal existence."]="暮光审判已经临近；你们这些可悲的凡人即将谢幕。"
G["The Hourglass' power is exhausted. No more games, mortals. Relent, or perish."]="沙漏的力量耗尽了，游戏结束了，凡人。屈服，或者消亡。"
G["The Hulking Jormungar falters for a moment, opening its mouth wide."]="巨大的冰虫张开大嘴，颤抖了一会儿。"
G["The Hunter Trainer's name is Thotar.  Seek him out inside the burrow on the southwest corner of Razor Hill."]="猎人训练者名叫索塔尔。去剃刀岭西南部的洞穴中找他吧。"
G["The Hunter's Reach in eastern Dalaran sells guns, bows, ammunition and the like."]="达拉然东部的猎人用品店出售枪支、弓弩、弹药等商品。"
G["The Hyldsmeet is sacred.  Whoever earns victory is assured a lifetime next to Thorim."]="海德比武会是神圣的。获胜者将赢得终身陪伴托里姆的殊荣。"
G["The Ice Lord will consume the entire Stormpike army!"]="冰雪之王会吞噬整个的联盟军队！"
