G["The Iceblood Graveyard was taken by the Horde!"]="冰血墓地被部落占领了！"
G["The Iceblood Tower protects the Iceblood Garrison from the southeast.\n\nIt is controlled by the Alliance."]="冰血哨塔保护着冰血要塞。\n\n联盟控制着这片土地。"
G["The Iceblood Tower protects the Iceblood Garrison from the southeast.\n\nIt is controlled by the Horde."]="冰血哨塔保护着冰血要塞。\n\n部落控制着这片土地。"
G["The Iceblood Tower protects the Iceblood Garrison from the southeast.\n\nis controlled by neither side."]="冰血哨塔保护着冰血要塞。\n\n联盟和部落还在争夺这片土地。"
G["The Icewing Bunker holds the pass between Alliance territory and the Field of Strife.\n\nIt is controlled by neither side."]="冰翼碉堡是联盟领地和征战平原之间的要塞。\n\n联盟和部落还在争夺这片土地。"
G["The Icewing Bunker holds the pass between Alliance territory and the Field of Strife.\n\nIt is controlled by the Alliance."]="冰翼碉堡是联盟领地和征战平原之间的要塞。\n\n联盟控制着这片土地。"
G["The Icewing Bunker holds the pass between Alliance territory and the Field of Strife.\n\nIt is controlled by the Horde."]="冰翼碉堡是联盟领地和征战平原之间的要塞。\n\n部落控制着这片土地。"
G["The Icewing Bunker is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Alliance will destroy it!"]="冰翼碉堡受到攻击！如果我们不尽快采取措施，联盟会摧毁它的！"
G["The Icewing Bunker is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Horde will destroy it!"]="冰翼碉堡受到攻击！如果我们不尽快采取措施，部落会摧毁它的！"
G["The Icewing Bunker was destroyed by the Horde!"]="冰翼碉堡被部落摧毁了！"
G["The Icewing Bunker was taken by the Alliance!"]="冰翼碉堡被联盟占领了！"
G["The Illidari demons keep me here because of my knowledge of ancient draenei crystals and relics.\n\nThey've enslaved many of my people and use us to look for a powerful crystal... one that in all likelihood is not even here."]="因为我了解古代德莱尼水晶和遗迹，所以伊利达雷的恶魔们把我囚禁在这里。\n\n他们奴役了我的很多族人，并且利用我们寻找一块能量巨大的水晶……一块可能根本不在这里的水晶。"
G["The Illusionary Amber-Weaver conjures globs of amber that float toward you and explode on any contact. Lead the amber globs into other illusions."]="幻影织珀者会召唤一些琥珀球向你飘去，并在接触后爆炸。将琥珀球引到其他幻影身边去吧！"
G["The Illusionary Mystic will heal any ally that is significantly wounded. Interrupt its healing spells."]="幻影秘法师会治疗被重创的幻影。注意打断它的治疗法术！"
G["The Infinite Dragonflight has destroyed the %s!"]="永恒之龙摧毁了%s！"
G["The Infinite Dragonflight is attempting to alter the destiny of Prince Arthas Menethil.\n\nYou know him now as the Lich King, but here and now he was still a Prince of Lordaeron trying to do what was best for his kingdom.\n\nArthas makes a very fateful choice today, leading to something we Keepers of Time call an inflection point in the timeline."]="El Vuelo Infinito está tratando de alterar el destino del príncipe Arthas Menethil.\n\nAhora lo conoces como el Rey Exánime, pero aquí y en este momento aún era un príncipe de Lordaeron que trataba de hacer lo que era mejor para su reino.\n\nHoy Arthas toma una decisión que marcará el destino, llevando a lo que los Vigilantes del Tiempo llamamos un punto de inflexión en la línea temporal."
G["The Infinites are attempting something unusually subtle for them. They are trying to hide the evidence that will lead to Arthas deciding to cull Stratholme.\n\nTheir agents have used illusionary magic on the plagued grain shipments in the nearby countryside to make them appear normal.\n\nI need you to find the hidden grain, and use this Arcane Disruptor on the shipments. Arthas' men are looking for plagued grain, and should find it quickly with the illusion gone."]="Los Infinitos están intentando algo con una sutileza poco común en ellos. Están tratando de ocultar las pruebas que llevarán a Arthas a tomar la decisión de arrasar Stratholme.\n\nSus agentes han usado magia ilusionista para que los cargamentos de grano de los campos cercanos parezcan normales.\n\nNecesito que encuentres el grano y uses este disruptor Arcano en los envíos. Los hombres de Arthas están buscando grano apestado y lo encontrarán rápidamente cuando desaparezca la ilusión."
G["The Infrared Light reveals a Crimson Fog!"]="红光照出了一只猩红雾行兽！"
G["The Injured Rainspeaker Oracle rises clumsily to its feet."]="受伤的雨声神谕者笨拙地站了起来。"
G["The Inn"]="旅店"
G["The Inn?  Ah, ye looking to toss back some of the best ales Ironforge has to offer?  The Stonefire Tavern is where ye'll want to go. \n\nYe'll find it just to the left of the entrance to Ironforge if ye be coming, or to the right if ye be going."]="旅馆？啊，你是来寻找铁炉堡出产的美酒的？你该去石火旅店。\n\n如果你在铁炉堡之外，它就在铁炉堡大门的左边；反之，则在大门右边。"
G["The Inn?  Ah, ye looking to toss back some of the best ales Ironforge has to offer?  The Stonefire Tavern is where ye'll want to go.  \n\nYe'll find it just to the left of the entrance to Ironforge if ye be coming, or to the right if ye be going."]="旅馆？啊，你是来寻找铁炉堡出产的美酒的？你该去石火旅店。\n\n如果你在铁炉堡之外，它就在铁炉堡大门的左边；反之，则在大门右边。"
G["The Inventor's Disk has fallen into the hands of an unauthorized user.  Activating defense protocol."]="创世者的圆盘已落入非法用户手中。激活防御协议。"
G["The Iron Giant shudders slightly."]="铁巨人略微有些颤抖。"
G["The Iron Juggernaut focuses a |cFFFF0404|Hspell:144918|h[Cutter Laser]|h|r on you!"]="钢铁战蝎向你发射了一束|cFFFF0404|Hspell:144918|h[切割激光]|h|r！"
G["The Iron Watcher loses its footing under the furious blow."]="钢铁观察者发出一声怒吼，摔倒在地。"
G["The Iron Watcher reels, reaching to its now useless eyes, and charges blindly."]="钢铁观察者捂着受伤的双眼，盲目地横冲直撞。"
G["The Iron Watcher roars with fury, shaking more rust from its ancient frame."]="钢铁观察者咆哮起来，更多的铁锈从古老的躯干上滑落下来。"
G["The Irondeep Mine is in Alliance territory, north of the Stormpike Graveyard.\n\nIt is controlled by the Alliance."]="联盟领地中的深铁矿洞就在雷矛墓地北边。\n\n它现在被联盟控制着。"
G["The Irondeep Mine is in Alliance territory, north of the Stormpike Graveyard.\n\nIt is controlled by the Horde."]="联盟领地中的深铁矿洞就在雷矛墓地北边。\n\n它现在被部落控制着。"
G["The Irondeep Mine is in Alliance territory, north of the Stormpike Graveyard.\n\nIt is controlled by the Troggs."]="联盟领地中的深铁矿洞就在雷矛墓地北边。\n\n它现在被穴居人控制着。"
G["The Irondeep Mine is owned by the Alliance."]="深铁矿洞为联盟所有。"
G["The Irondeep Mine is owned by the Horde."]="深铁矿洞为部落所有。"
G["The Irondeep Mine is owned by the Troggs."]="深铁矿洞为穴居人所有。"
G["The Ironforge riders are a tenacious lot, relying heavily on their defenses and steadfastly trading blows with their opponents, strike for strike.\n\nTrying wearing them down with Charges while maintaining your own Defense... meet them with a defensive advantage so that they will suffer the most with each exchange."]="铁炉堡的骑兵是一群坚韧的勇士，他们擅长防御与持久作战。\n\n你应该在维持自身防御的前提下使用冲锋把他们累得趴下……只要你能保持防御优势，他们就会在对战中承受较大的伤害。"
G["The Isle of Conquest is laden with valuable resources we cannot allow to fall into Alliance hands. Will you join the fight?"]="征服之岛上有许多非常重要的物资，我们绝不能让它落入联盟的手中。你愿意加入我们的战斗吗？"
G["The Isle of Conquest is laden with valuable resources we cannot allow to fall into Horde hands. Will you join the fight?"]="征服之岛上有许多非常重要的物资，我们绝不能让它落入部落的手中。你愿意加入我们的战斗吗？"
G["The Isle of Quel'Danas has been overrun by the forces of Prince Kael'thas Sunstrider. Intel had him pegged as deceased. Intel was wrong."]="凯尔萨斯·逐日者王子的军队占领了奎尔丹纳斯岛。先前的情报表明他已经死了，但情报错了。"
G["The Jade Serpent is nearly complete. You know what that means? Several months of cheering, celebrating, sleeping, and brewing! I can't wait!"]="青龙雕像就要完工了。你知道那意味着什么吗？持续数月之久的狂欢、庆典、酣睡和豪饮！我等不及了！"
G["The Jade Serpent is the incarnation of wisdom in Pandaria. Let's see what she has to say."]="青龙是潘达利亚的智慧化身。我们来看看她会怎么说吧。"
G["The Jade Serpent statue was destroyed? How could this have happened?"]="青龙雕像被毁坏了吗？怎么可能发生这样的事？"
G["The Jade Serpent! It... it broke."]="青龙！它……它碎掉了。"
G["The Jade Serpent... what will it do now?"]="青龙……它现在想做什么？"
G["The Jib of Dook was a friend of grummles. He lasted a whole three seasons. Now the Ook of Dook is in charge and most angry. He thinks food from grummles will stop soon, so he ravages."]="呷卟督曾是土地精的朋友。他整整统治了三季。现在改由呜咔督掌权，他是脾气最为暴躁的一个。他认为来自土地精的食物供应很快就会中断，因此他开始四处掠夺。"
G["The Jin'yu of Binan Village in Kun-Lai Summit spoke to the water today, and it is TEEMING with Sha. \n \n You may already know this, but the Spinefish is a rather aggressive fish. Now, you mix that with a little bit'o that Sha mojo, and you've got a proper frenzy in the make!  \n \n If you can catch those angry beasties, you may help restore balance to their fragile ecosystem... not to mention gettin' yourself a dream catch of Spinefish."]="今天，昆莱山滨岸村的锦鱼人和水流沟通了一番，发现水中充满了煞能。\n \n你或许已经知道了，刺皮鱼是一种极具攻击性的鱼类。如果再给它们加点煞能，那你就能见识到什么叫疯狂了！ \n \n如果你能抓住那些愤怒的野兽，或许就能帮忙恢复当地脆弱的生态平衡……更不用说你还能抓到大量刺皮鱼。"
G["The Kalu'ak Fishing Derby ends in 5 minutes!"]="卡鲁亚克钓鱼大赛将在5分钟后结束！"
G["The Kalu'ak Fishing Derby has begun!  The first person to bring a blacktip shark to me in Dalaran will be declared the winner!  Blacktip sharks can be caught anywhere you can catch a pygmy suckerfish."]="卡鲁亚克钓鱼大赛已经开始了！第一个到达拉然带给我一只黑鳍鲨的参赛者便是本届比赛的冠军！能够钓到小型亚口鱼的地方能都钓到黑鳍鲨。"
G["The Kalu'ak Fishing Derby has ended!  If you caught a shark, please bring it to me within the hour."]="卡鲁亚克钓鱼大赛已经结束了！如果你捉到了一条黑鳍鲨，请在规定时间内把它送到我这。"
G["The Kalu'ak Fishing Derby starts in 10 minutes!"]="卡鲁亚克钓鱼大赛将在10分钟后开始！"
G["The Kalu'ak Fishing Derby starts in 20 minutes!"]="卡鲁亚克钓鱼大赛将在20分钟后开始！"
G["The Kalu'ak Fishing Derby starts in 5 minutes!"]="卡鲁亚克钓鱼大赛将在5分钟后开始！"
G["The Keepers of Time thank you for your assistance. The Timeless One shall be pleased with this outcome..."]="时光守护者感谢你的帮助。时间之王一定会为这个结果而感到高兴的……"
G["The Keg Bomb is becoming unstable!"]="酒桶炸弹变得不稳定了！"
G["The King's guards should be along shortly to pick up the Memorial. In the meantime, come join me upstairs and let's finish our little chat, $n."]="国王的卫兵会去搬运那座纪念碑。至于你，请上台阶来，让我们好好谈谈，$n。"
G["The King's royal banner. Someone of royal blood certainly slept in this chamber."]="国王的皇家纹章。这间舱室里肯定住过某位具有皇室血统的大人物。"
G["The Kingways is treacherous. Proceed with caution."]="The Kingways es peligroso. Procede con cautela."
G["The Kirin Tor can keep Dalaran for all I care. This is where I feel most at home, behind enemy lines, right in the thick of things!"]="肯瑞托可以留着他们的达拉然，我才不在乎。这才是最合适我的地方，在白热化的战斗中深入敌后！"
G["The Kirin Tor can't possibly spare any additional resources to take on anything that size. We may not have to though."]="肯瑞托不可能在这种大块头上浪费资源。或许我们也没有必要跟它正面冲突。"
G["The Kirin Tor must be stopped!"]="必须阻止肯瑞托！"
G["The Kirin Tor was betrayed from within. I've handled the situation."]="肯瑞托内部出了叛徒。我已经控制了局势。"
G["The Kirin Tor will not tolerate insurrection."]="肯瑞托绝不容忍叛乱。"
G["The Kirin-Tor has a legacy of abuse. Kel'thuzad turned his knowledge of the arcane arts toward Necromancy."]="肯瑞托向来不乏滥用力量之徒。克尔苏加德把魔法知识用在了死灵法术上。"
G["The Klaxxi Paragons go berserk!"]="卡拉克西英杰开始狂暴了！"
G["The Klaxxi are to be disbanded, by the will of the Empress."]="遵照女皇的旨意，卡拉克西将被遣散。"
G["The Klaxxi beckon..."]="卡拉克西召唤……"
G["The Klaxxi do not give their trust easily, outsider. It has taken me many years to even be seen by them."]="卡拉克西从不轻易相信别人，外来者。我花了很多年时间才令他们正眼相看。"
G["The Klaxxi have betrayed her majesty. Your corpses will be strung from the palace walls for this."]="卡拉克西背叛了女皇陛下。你们的尸体会因此被挂在宫殿的墙壁上。"
G["The Klaxxi have spoken. The Empress must fall."]="卡拉克西说话了。女皇必亡。"
G["The Klaxxi said they needed someone to continue punishing fools in a future generation.\n\nI told them, \"I'm your mantid.\""]="Los Klaxxi me dijeron que les hacía falta alguien para castigar a los mequetrefes de las generaciones futuras.\n\nYo les respondí: \"Soy vuestro mántide\"."
G["The Klaxxi sent you to oppose the Swarm? Ah, how the mighty have fallen. Come, little fly. Take the paragon, if you can!"]="卡拉克西派你去对付虫群？ 啊，如此强大的人居然堕落到这个地步。 过来，小朋友。 如果可以的话，请带上这位英杰！"
G["The Klaxxi'va you sent has fallen to an adjunct of Her majesty."]="你派出的卡拉克西瓦已经沦为女皇的仆从。"
G["The Kolkar are the strongest!"]="科卡尔部族是最强大的！"
G["The Kolkar invaders are retreating!"]="科卡尔入侵者们撤退了！"
G["The Kolkar will rule!"]="科卡尔部族将统治世界！"
G["The Kor'kron are making a push for this compound. They're not giving up!"]="库卡隆正在煽动这群乌合之众。他们还不肯投降！"
G["The Kor'kron are ready. Let them come and taste steel!"]="库卡隆已经蓄势待发了。让他们来尝尝铁与血的滋味吧！"
G["The Kor'kron could not fight better! For the Horde!"]="库卡隆不可能打得更好了！为了部落！"
G["The Kor'thik have no equal in combat!"]="库尔提克势不可挡！"
G["The Krasarang Wild Brew is extremely volatile, $n! We could set the barrels near where the yaungol will approach and then blow them up. Grab one and I'll put a marker where we should place them."]="卡桑琅荒原啤极其易爆，$n！我们可以将酒桶放在野牛人的必经之路上，然后点火。拿上酒桶，我会做好标记，告诉你应该把它们放在哪里。"
G["The Kun-Lai Kicker is finished, $n! Are you ready for the best brew in all of Pandaria? I'll warn you now, after drinking this brew you may want to kick things. Which is good because we have a lot of yaungol that need a good kicking!"]="昆莱劲酒完成了，$n！准备好见识一下潘达利亚最好的酒了吗？我要警告你，喝过这种酒之后，可能会产生踢东西的冲动。这是件好事，因为有太多的野牛人需要被踢飞了！"
G["The Kun-Lai Kicker is finished, $p! Now we can use it to kick some yaungol butt!"]="昆莱劲酒完成了，$p！我们现在用它们来教训野牛人了！"
G["The Kur Drakkar is engulfed in tuskarr fire!"]="库尔达卡被烈焰吞没了！"
G["The Kvaldir are without mercy, $n.  But I cannot abandon sacred Kaskala.  If we don't abandon the spirits, the spirits will not abandon us either."]="$n，克瓦迪尔生性残忍，可是我不能放弃神圣的卡斯卡拉。只要我们不抛弃灵魂，灵魂就不会抛弃我们。"
G["The Kvaldir have been purged from the city. Now we can begin our preparations."]="城市中的克瓦迪尔已经被清除了。现在我们可以开始仪式的准备了。"
G["The Kvaldir have returned to take the city back from us, Battlemaiden. They will need you outside."]="女武士，克瓦迪尔要将这座城市从我们手中夺回去。外边的人需要你的帮助。"
G["The Lady Mehley"]="梅蕾女士号"
G["The Lady Mehley is in Theramore enough that we've been assigned to guard her passengers."]="梅蕾女士号长期停靠塞拉摩岛，我们奉命保护船只上的乘客。"
G["The Lady Mehley is the best ship EVER!"]="梅蕾女士号永远是最棒的船！"
G["The Lady has requested you back at the temple, Honor Guard."]="女士要你返回圣殿，荣誉卫兵。"
G["The Lady has sent word for your return to the temple. Do not delay."]="女士捎话来，要你返回圣殿。别耽搁了。"
G["The League of Arathor has sworn to retake Arathi for humans of Stromgarde and the Alliance.  It is a battle hard fought, but a battle worth fighting."]="阿拉索联军发誓为激流堡和联盟夺回阿拉希。这将是一场恶战，但是是一场值得打的战争。"
G["The League of Arathor is trying to reclaim their ancestral holdings in Arathi Basin from the Forsaken.  If you would aid them $n speak to Donal Osgood in the Hall of Arms."]="阿拉索联军试图从被遗忘者手中夺回自己的失地。$n，如果你想要帮助他们的话，就跟武器大厅的杜纳尔·奥斯古德谈谈。"
G["The Left Arm has regrown!"]="左臂再生了！"
G["The Legion reigns!"]="燃烧军团是世界的主宰！"
G["The Legion requires you work faster!  Faster, worms!"]="燃烧军团命令你们工作得快点！再快点，虫子！"
G["The Legion will conquer all!"]="军团将会征服一切！"
G["The Legion will consume you all!"]="军团会吞噬你们！"
G["The Legion will prevail!"]="燃烧军团必将获胜！"
G["The Legion's creations truly grow more foul by the day."]="燃烧军团造出来的东西真是一天比一天邪恶了。"
G["The Legion's final conquest has begun! Once again the subjugation of this world is within our grasp. Let none survive!"]="燃烧军团的最终战役开始了！这个世界再一次任凭我们宰割。不要留任何活口!"
G["The Legion's machinations are truly intimidating!"]="燃烧军团的诡计真是个巨大的威胁！"
G["The Legion... will never... fall."]="军团……永远不会……失败。"
G["The Lich King brought only small forces to bear against each of Azeroth's capital cities, while their main forces periodically attack the following lands:\n\nAzshara, the Blasted Lands, the Burning Steppes, the Tanaris Desert, the Eastern Plaguelands and Winterspring."]="对于艾泽拉斯的各大主城，巫妖王都只派出小股部队进行牵制和骚扰，其主力部队则主要进攻以下地区：\n\n艾萨拉、诅咒之地、燃烧平原、塔纳利斯沙漠、东瘟疫之地和冬泉谷。"
G["The Lich King cannot be stopped. Accept it."]="巫妖王是不可战胜的。认命吧。"
G["The Lich King demands more frost wyrms be sent to Angrathar! Meet his demands or face my wrath!"]="巫妖王下令继续向天谴之门安加萨调派冰霜巨龙！服从指令，否则就尝尝我的厉害！"
G["The Lich King demands more saronite. Work harder fools or we'll feed you to the creature!"]="巫妖王需要更多的萨隆邪铁。快点干活，蠢货。不然就送你们去喂怪物！"
G["The Lich King has given me power beyond your wildest nightmares. Behold!"]="巫妖王赐予我的力量远远超过了你们的想象。看招！"
G["The Lich King has spoken to each of you! Let his words resonate among you once more!"]="巫妖王和你们都谈过！让他的教诲再次引起你们的共鸣吧！"
G["The Lich King is attempting to make his presence known in our world. This must not be allowed to occur."]="巫妖王正试图要将他的存在传达给整个世界，让这个世界陷入恐慌与噩梦之中。绝对不能让这一切发生。"
G["The Lich King is badly hurt.  We ought to stay behind and finish him."]="巫妖王受了重伤。我们应该留下来杀死他。"
G["The Lich King is here.  May the Light guide our blades."]="巫妖王就在这里。愿圣光指引我们的剑刃吧。"
G["The Lich King is here? Then my destiny shall be fulfilled on this day!"]="巫妖王就在这里？那今天就是我完成使命的日子！"
G["The Lich King is near, $n. His voice taunts me...\n\nLet us silence him at last!"]="巫妖王已经离我们很近了，$n。我感觉到了他声音中的嘲弄…\n\n去让他安静下来吧！"
G["The Lich King is stretching his hand far now... fearlessly treading on the most sacred lands of all of the flights.  He intends to force us to action."]="巫妖王已经伸出魔爪……肆无忌惮地践踏着龙族最神圣的领地。他想逼迫我们采取行动。"
G["The Lich King is unlike any foe that you have ever faced, Highlord. Though you bested him upon the holy ground of Light's Hope Chapel, you tread now upon his domain."]="巫妖王不同于已往的任何敌人，大领主。虽然你曾在圣光之愿礼拜堂打败过他，但如今，你却身处巫妖王统御下的邪恶王国中。"
G["The Lich King is unstoppable..."]="没人能阻挡巫妖王的步伐…"
G["The Lich King knows your boundaries, Highlord. He knows that you will not fire on your own men. Do you not understand? He has no boundaries. No rules to abide."]="巫妖王清楚你心中的底线，大领主。他知道你是不会对自己人开火的。你还不明白吗？对他来说，不谈底线，不讲原则。"
G["The Lich King must answer for what he has done, and must not be allowed to cause further destruction in our world."]="巫妖王必须为他的所作所为付出代价，我们绝不能再让他继续破坏这个世界。"
G["The Lich King must fall!!"]="巫妖王必须死！"
G["The Lich King reacted swiftly to the breach. Faster than I anticipated."]="巫妖王对此次反击迅速做出了反应，竟然比我预想中的还要快。"
G["The Lich King say to tell you... DIE!"]="巫妖王要你的……命！"
G["The Lich King shall consume all..."]="巫妖王将扼杀一切生灵……"
G["The Lich King shall extinquish... every... last... one... of you."]="巫妖王会将……你们……统统……干掉。"
G["The Lich King tormented me without end, Darion."]="巫妖王一直在折磨我，达里安。"
G["The Lich King will be pleased with this initiate."]="巫妖王一定会对这位死亡骑士新兵感到满意的。"
G["The Lich King will see his true champion on this day!"]="看看谁才是巫妖王麾下真正的勇士！"
G["The Lich King's cruel reign has inflicted great suffering on all of Northrend's inhabitants, particularly the children. If you are a friend to the Oracles or Frenzyheart Tribe of Sholazar, perhaps you might consider caring for an orphan for a week."]="巫妖王的残酷统治让所有诺森德的居民们都饱受痛苦，尤其是那些孩子。如果你是索拉查盆地的狂心氏族或是神谕者的朋友，也许你会考虑抚养他们的一位孤儿，陪那个小家伙一周。"
G["The Lich King's forces are building.  It is imperative that our timetable supports his plans."]="巫妖王的势力渐渐扩大。我们的时间安排必须支持他的计划。"
G["The Light be praised!  I would have died out here if it weren't for you, $c!  I must get to the ship."]="赞美圣光！$c，要是没有你，我一定会衰竭而死！我必须回到飞船那里。"
G["The Light be with ya, $c. How can I help ya?"]="愿圣光与你同在，$c。我能帮上忙吗？"
G["The Light be with ya, $n."]="愿圣光与你同在，$n。"
G["The Light burns bright in you, Davil.  I will enjoy snuffing it out!"]="戴维，圣光照亮你的内心。我要把它挖出来！"
G["The Light condemns all who harbor evil.  Now you will die!"]="圣光将会惩罚所有心怀不轨的人。你死定了！"
G["The Light gives us the strength and magic to triumph."]="圣光给了我们通往胜利和力量之路的魔法。"
G["The Light has abandoned us!"]="圣光抛弃了我们！"
G["The Light has abandoned you!"]="你被圣光抛弃了！"
G["The Light has no choice. It does as it is commanded. Just as the naaru you hold at the core of your vessel will do when we capture and enslave it... Do my words surprise you, blue blood? Yes, we know... We know everything."]="圣光没有选择，我们让它做什么，它就得做什么。当我们捕获了那个被你们藏在飞船中的纳鲁时，他也会听我们的号令……是不是我的话让你们很惊讶，蓝血的杂种？我们都知道……我们知道一切。"
G["The Light has not chosen you for the Templar path, $C. Seek training elsewhere."]="La Luz no ha escogido a $C para el camino del Templario. Busca entrenamiento en otro lugar."
G["The Light has spoken!"]="圣光会审判你！"
G["The Light is my guide... it is my sustenance!"]="圣光指引着我……它一直支持着我！"
G["The Light is my shield."]="圣光就是我的护盾。"
G["The Light is no match for the Lich King's might!"]="圣光的力量也难以战胜巫妖王的强大！"
G["The Light is with us this day!"]="圣光与我们同在！"
G["The Light is with you, $c.  No harm will come to you today."]="圣光与你同在，$c。今天你必将不会受到伤害。"
G["The Light must prevail!"]="圣光力量会胜利的！"
G["The Light of Elune shine upon thee, $n!  You will find Aethalas, our battlemaster, on the Warrior's Terrace.  She will aid you on your way to Warsong Gulch."]="愿月神之光照耀你，$n！你可以在战士区找到军官伊萨拉斯。她将帮助你前往战歌峡谷。"
G["The Light protect you, $c."]="愿圣光保佑你，$c。"
G["The Light that guides us. This movement was set in motion before you came... We... We do as we are told. It is what must be done."]="是圣光在指引我们。天灾军团抵达之前，这次行动就已经开始了……我们……只是简单地奉命行事。我们必须服从军令。"
G["The Light wants its lost son back, Socrethar."]="圣光想让它迷失的孩子回来，索克雷萨。"
G["The Light will abandon you, hero, just as it did me."]="圣光会抛弃你，英雄，就像抛弃我那样。"
G["The Light will bless these dismal halls once again... I swear it."]="圣光会再次照耀这阴暗的大厅……我发誓。"
G["The Light will bless these dismal halls once again.... I swear it."]="圣光会再次照耀这阴暗的大厅……我发誓。"
G["The Light will consume you!"]="圣光会吞噬你！"
G["The Light wishes suffering on none, my child. But it does not reign unopposed in our realm."]="圣光不愿意让任何人受苦，我的孩子。但在我们的国度里，它并不能决定一切。"
G["The Light's blessing be upon you for aiding me in my time of need, $n."]="$n，在我最需要帮助的时候，是圣光的赐福让你找到了我。"
G["The Light?"]="圣光？"
G["The Lightbringer..."]="光明使者……"
G["The Lightwarden's job is twofold.  Protect the priesthood at all costs first and foremost.  Destroy the enemies of the Light wherever they may hide second."]="圣光护卫者的工作是双重的。保护传教士的安全是他们的首要任务，而消灭圣光的敌人是次要的。"
G["The Lion's Pride Inn in Goldshire is as good as any inn you will find around these parts.  Drop in and let Innkeeper Farley make you feel at home."]="闪金镇的狮王之傲旅店是这个地区中最好的旅店了。在那儿歇一歇吧，旅店老板法雷会让你感受到家的温暖。"
G["The Lithe Stalker is weakened by the assault."]="轻盈追迹者遭到攻击，变得虚弱了。"
G["The Loa gonna' eat you up."]="神灵会将你吞噬殆尽。"
G["The Loch belongs to the Stonesplinter Tribe now, $n!  Now die!"]="洛克湖现在属于碎石部族了，$n！去死吧！"
G["The Long Tube Gadget Analyzer should tell me what I need to know."]="长管零件分析器应该会告诉我需要知道些什么。"
G["The Lord of Blackrock hangs from the arches!"]="黑石领主从灰烬中升起！"
G["The Lorehammer is reacting. This must be from Stormhoof's time."]="知识之锤有反应。这件古器肯定来自雷蹄的时代。"
G["The Lorehammer is silent. This isn't from Stormhoof's time."]="知识之锤没有反应。这件古器不属于雷蹄的时代。"
G["The Lorehammer..."]="知识之锤……"
G["The Lorekeeper is an ancient. He has served under our glorious Queen!"]="博学者是个古老的学者。他为我们伟大的女王服务！"
G["The Lorewalker's art lacks both subtlety and technical expertise. Perhaps you can do better?"]="游学者的技艺不够精妙，缺少专业的技术指导。 也许你能做得更好？"
G["The Lorewalkers travel the world, discovering new tales and retelling old ones.\n\nWe explore the rich history of the places and people in Pandaria.\n\nIf you would like to hear some of these stories for yourself, speak to Lorewalker Cho at the Seat of Knowledge, above the entrance to Mogu'shan Palace here in the Vale of Eternal Blossoms."]="游学者走遍世界，发现了新的传说，也重新阐释了旧的故事。\n\n我们仔细研究了潘达利亚地区丰富的地理人文历史。\n\n如果你自己想听某些故事，就与闻道之座的游学者周卓交谈。闻道之座在锦绣谷魔古山宫殿入口上方。"
end)(AscensionCN.GossipEN2ES)
;(function(G)
G["The Lorewalkers will send you to explore significant areas of Pandaria to recover cultural artifacts.\n\nOnce you find all the artifacts that belong to a collection, you will be able to hear the entire story from start to finish.\n\nFind all the artifacts and collect all the books to become a Lorewalker!\n\nIf you would like to become a researcher, then you should speak to Lorewalker Cho at the Seat of Knowledge."]="Los eremitas te enviarán a explorar zonas importantes de Pandaria para recuperar artefactos culturales.\n\nCuando encuentres todos los artefactos que componen la colección, podrás escuchar la historia de principio a fin.\n\n¡Encuentra todos los artefactos y colecciona todos los libros para convertirte en $gun:una; eremita!\n\nSi te interesa convertirte en $gun investigador:una investigadora;, habla con el eremita Cho en el Trono del Saber."
G["The Lost Shandaral Spirit kneels silently before the violet waters, gazing into the tranquil surface of the pool."]="失落的杉达拉之魂默默地跪在紫色的湖泊前，凝视着平静的湖面。"
G["The Lovely Merchant is waiting for that. Hurry it up!"]="可爱的商贩正等着呢。快点吧！"
G["The Lunar Festival celebration being held by the druids is taking place in Moonglade. If that's too far for you to travel, they are offering transportation just outside Stormwind."]="德鲁伊们在月光林地举行春节庆典。如果你觉得路途太遥远了，他们在暴风城外提供传送服务。"
G["The Lunar Festival holds special meaning for the night elves. We seek out the wisdom of our elders across the world."]="春节对暗夜精灵来说有着特殊的意义。我们在全世界寻找长者的智慧。"
G["The Lunar Festival holds special meaning for the tauren. We seek out the wisdom of our elders across the world."]="春节对牛头人来说有着特殊的意义。我们在全世界寻找长者的智慧。"
G["The Lunar Festival is a special time for us. We seek out our ancient elders, the Earthen, and pay homage to them."]="春节对我们来说是个特别的日子。我们寻找古代的长者，对他们表示敬意。"
G["The Lunar Festival is in full swing in Moonglade. A delegation of druids can be found in the throne room of Undercity, transporting people there."]="春节盛典正在月光林地举行。你可以在幽暗城的谒见厅找到一群德鲁伊，他们会把你传送到庆典现场。"
G["The Lunar Festival is in full swing on Azeroth! Return there and honor your elders in this wonderful celebration! The main festivities can be found in Moonglade, but we've provided easy transportation from Stormwind, Ironforge, Darnassus, Thunder Bluff, Orgrimmar, and the Undercity. We hope to see you there!"]="艾泽拉斯各地都在庆祝春节！回到那边去吧，在这个伟大的节日向你的长者表达敬意吧！最大的庆典活动会在月光林地举行，但我们在暴风城、铁炉堡、达纳苏斯、雷霆崖、奥格瑞玛和幽暗城也都提供了方便快捷的传送器。希望能在那边见到你，一定要来哦！"
G["The Magical Menagerie is located in northeast Dalaran. Pet supplies, exotic mounts, and stables are all available there."]="魔法动物店位于达拉然东北部。那里出售宠物用品和珍稀坐骑，并提供兽栏服务。"
G["The Magistrate has fallen! Make your escape, my brothers."]="镇长已经死了！快撤，弟兄们！"
G["The Magistrate is too well protected. Retreat!"]="镇长身边戒备森严，撤退！"
G["The Magus Commerce Exchange is in northwest Dalaran, and holds most of the city's profession trainers."]="魔法商业区位于达拉然西北部，那里汇集了大部分专业技能训练师。"
G["The Maiden's Fancy"]="少女之爱号"
G["The Maneweavers practice their professions out of their home on the road to Darnassus.  Nadyia is an excellent teacher when it comes to Leatherworking.  You should see what she can teach you."]="纳迪娅·织发离开自己的家园前往达纳苏斯进修去了。她精通制革，而且是一名优秀的老师。你该去向她求教。"
G["The Manifestation of Terror has appeared on the battlefield!"]="惊怖具象已经出现在战场上了！"
G["The Manor has been abuzz with talk of your arrival, $G Master:Mistress; $n. We are all honored and graced by your presence."]="整个庄园都在议论你的到来，$g主人:女主人;$n。对你的光临，我们感到无比荣幸。"
G["The Mantid will cover this land, and devour all who oppose use!"]="螳螂妖将席卷这片土地，挡我者死！"
G["The Master has gone to great lengths to secure information about the whereabouts of the Exodar. You could have blown the entire operation, including the cover of our spy on the inside."]="主人不遗余力地探查有关埃索达所在之处的信息。你可能会破坏整个行动，包括我们在埃索达安插的间谍！"
G["The Master holds great interest in the lair of Nefarian. If only someone would defeat the dragon and his minions and retell the tale to the Prince. I bet that would loosen the Prince's lips. The Ashbringer could be found!"]="王子对奈法利安的巢穴非常感兴趣。如果有谁能杀死巨龙及其属下，并将战斗经过告诉王子，我敢打赌王子会非常满意的。找到灰烬使者之日可待啦！"
G["The Master is deep in study."]="主人正在潜心研究。"
G["The Master is resting after his labors."]="主人刚忙完，正在休息。"
G["The Master shall rain hellfire upon Azeroth, and then we will at last cleanse the Light from this wretched world!"]="主人会在艾泽拉斯降下地狱烈焰，然后我们就能让圣光从这恼人的世界上彻底消散！"
G["The Master will be pleased."]="主人一定会很高兴的。"
G["The Master will return from Stormwind soon...."]="主人很快就会从暴风城回来……"
G["The Master's will remains inviolate..."]="主人的意志不容侵犯…"
G["The Matrix Punchograph Technologic Huerist-o-meter has detected your aptitude in engineering.  You may now choose from the following option(s):\n01000111 01101111 00100000 01100111 01101111 00100000 01100111 01101111 00100001 00100001"]="El Tonómetro Tecnológico del Perforágrafo Matriz ha detectado tus habilidades en ingeniería. Ahora puedes elegir entre una de las siguientes opciones:\n\n01000111 01101111 00100000 01100111 01101111 00100000 01100111 01101111 00100001 00100001"
G["The Melee Target trains Aspirants in both mounted attack and defense.\n\nApproach the Melee Target and strike it with a Thrust attack. The force of the blow often spins the target hard enough to injure you or your mount. This is where defense comes into play.\n\nBe certain to have at least one layer of Defend before attacking the target, and continue to stack and refresh Defend throughout the training exercise. Otherwise, you may well find yourself dismounted.\n\nThe same holds true in actual mounted combat: Balance attack and defense, Thrusting at every opportunity and maintaining your layers of Defend as best you can."]="近战目标可以帮助候选者训练骑乘攻击与防御的技巧。\n\n你需要靠近并刺击近战目标。刺击的力量通常会令目标旋转起来，对你或你的坐骑造成伤害。因此，你需要巧妙地利用防御技能。\n\n在攻击目标之前，最好确保自己至少有一层防御效果。在接下来的战斗中，你还需要尽可能地堆叠并刷新防御效果。否则，你很快就会被打下坐骑。\n\n在骑乘实战中遵循着同样的原则：在攻击与防御之间寻求平衡，一有机会就发动刺击，并尽可能保持多层防御效果。"
G["The Menagerie is for guests only."]="展览厅只对访客开放。"
G["The Mercurial Guardian comes to life!"]="水银守护者活了过来！"
G["The Mercurial Guardian's skin becomes as hard as silver!"]="水银守护者的皮肤变得和白银一样坚硬。"
G["The Midsummer Fire Festival has something for everyone to enjoy!"]="每个人都能享受到仲夏火焰节的乐趣！"
G["The Might of Kalimdor is victorious! The last of the Qiraji forces are defeated, retreating back to the ancient city-fortress of Ahn'Qiraj. The Qiraji Resonating Crystals littering Kalimdor vanish as quickly as they appeared, leaving behind nothing but sundered earth."]="卡利姆多联军胜利了！其拉虫人的最后一股力量被彻底打垮，逃入了古老的安其拉城堡。遍布卡利姆多的其拉共鸣水晶就像它们出现时一样飞快地消失了，只留下了一片片凹陷的地面。"
G["The Might of Kalimdor will halt their advances!"]="卡利姆多联军必须马上停止推进！"
G["The Militant Mystic in southern Dalaran should have what you desire."]="达拉然南部的好战的秘法师应该能满足你的需求。"
G["The Military Ward is clear of rifts and we have completed the evacuation of the citizens in this district!"]="军事区危险已排除，而且我们已成功撤离该区市民！"
G["The Mist-Hopper Jr. is on the dock just southeast of here. Let's go!"]="雾海飞跃者二世在东南方向的码头。出发！"
G["The Mistress of the Tides will need your defense back at the temple. Make your way there immediately."]="潮汐女王需要你帮她守卫圣殿。立即赶回那里。"
G["The Moat Monster submerges."]="壕沟怪物潜入了水中。"
G["The Mogu cannot reclaim our rightful glory without our clan's strength!"]="若非我族之力量，魔古无法重夺那份荣耀！"
G["The Molten Eggs begin to crack and splinter!"]="熔火之卵开始开裂了！"
G["The Molten Eggs begin to hatch!"]="熔火之卵开始孵化了！"
G["The Monastery... it worries me that we have heard nothing from them..."]="禅院……我有点担心，他们怎么一点消息都没有……"
G["The Monkey King broke the mallet and sent the pieces afar."]="美猴王折断了钟杵，把碎片藏得远远的。"
G["The Monkey King was there, the last time this mallet struck true. Tears came to eyes, and harmony was felt through and through. But no more ointment was ever made, for the mogu came with their raid. Use what you have, be grateful it is there. For the bell is a dangerous weapon, so handle with care."]="上一次钟杵敲响圣钟的时候，美猴王就在旁边。美猴王热泪盈眶，但内心无比平静。在那之后，圣钟被魔古人夺走，再也没有人做过药膏了。心存感激，你手上的药膏就是最后的药膏。圣钟是危险的武器，一定要小心处理。"
G["The Narsong crocolisk is no more... simply because the pandaren didn't see the whole story."]="纳松海沟的鳄鱼不再那么……只因为熊猫人不了解整个事情的来龙去脉。"
G["The Nathrezim are merciless villains who feed upon the energies of mortal creatures."]="纳斯雷兹姆是通过吞噬普通生物以获得力量的残忍的恶魔。"
G["The Nerub'ar have been punished for their transgression!"]="尼鲁巴尔蛛怪尝到了贸然来犯的后果！"
G["The Nerubians built an empire beneath the frozen wastes of Northrend. An empire that you so foolishly built your structures upon. MY EMPIRE."]="蛛魔在诺森德的冻土荒原地下建立了一个帝国。只有最愚蠢的人才会在这个帝国上方建起房屋。那是我的帝国！"
G["The Netherwing. They speak to us. They offered us peace and protection. Something the broken have never truly felt. We accepted their offer and assisted Toranaku in rousing the creatures of this mine - at great personal cost to us. Many of my brothers gave their lives for this offensive. We were attempting to make the mine uninhabitable, forcing the Dragonmaw to relocate and ultimately move off of this island."]="灵翼龙族。他们说愿意保护破碎者氏族，让我们享受未曾体验过安宁与和平。我们决定接受龙族的恩惠，帮助托兰纳古唤醒了那些居住在矿洞中的生物，并为此付出了巨大的代价。在这场骚乱中，很多兄弟不幸遇难。我们计划让矿洞变成不适合居住的废墟，以此迫使龙喉兽人离开这座岛屿。"
G["The Nexus War will not be stopped!"]="你们无法阻止魔枢之战！"
G["The Night Watch alone cannot protect us forever.  We need the backing of the Stormwind Army."]="仅仅依靠守夜人并不能永远地保护我们。我们需要暴风城军队的援助。"
G["The Nightmare Elixir takes hold!"]="噩梦药剂发挥了作用！"
G["The Nightmare Elixir wears off!"]="噩梦药剂的效果消退了！"
G["The Nightmare cannot be stopped!"]="梦魇是不可抵挡的！"
G["The Nightmare is finally over!  Darrowshire, forgive me!"]="恶梦终于结束了！达隆郡，原谅我吧！"
G["The North Wind is the ancient enemy of the taunka, a ruler among the elements, and the very force which bleeds the life from these ancient people."]="北风是牦牛人的夙敌。它统治着元素生物，肆意践踏着牦牛人的性命。"
G["The North Wind? It still troubles my people?"]="北风？它还在祸害我的族人？"
G["The Northern Crossroads changed tracks!"]="北部十字路变轨了。"
G["The Northern Pylon accepts yellow, red, and green crystals.\n\nThe focus is the energy that can be created using yellow crystals as the main source of power. There are two possible effects: one that will produce damage, and one that will negate damage. \n\nCrystal Charge requires red and yellow crystals. This will produce a large explosion, stunning your enemies.\n\nCrystal Restore requires yellow and green crystals. This will provide you with a healing aura."]="北方的水晶塔接受黄红绿三种颜色的水晶构成。\n\n而关键是使用黄水晶所产生的能量作为主要的力量来源。有两种可能的效果：一种会制造破坏，一种会消除破坏。\n\n爆炸水晶需要红水晶和黄水晶。这将产生剧烈爆炸，足以震慑你的敌人。\n\n恢复水晶需要黄水晶和绿水晶。这将给你提供治疗光环。"
G["The Northpass tower needs our aid!  Once again, let us charge and do proud our liege!"]="北地哨塔需要我们的支援！冲啊！"
G["The Oculus is ours!"]="魔枢是我们的！"
G["The Ogre clans will not be subjugated.  Not by the gronn, and not by a puny $r like you!"]="Los clanes ogros no serán subyugados. ¡Ni por los gronn ni por $gun:una; enclenque $r como tú!"
G["The Old God would create avatars from the silithid in its own image. These avatars were to be known as Qiraji. Sentient and with purpose, the Qiraji would name their creator: C'Thun was born... For many thousands of years the Qiraji worked feverishly to build a force capable of laying waste to the world that would betray their god. The great fortress city of Ahn'Qiraj was created to house their growing armies and prepare for the coming of C'Thun."]="上古之神使用异种虫创造出了自己的化身。这些化身被称为其拉虫人。其拉虫人将他们的创造者称为克苏恩……数千年来，其拉虫人疯狂地扩充军队，企图毁灭曾经背叛上古之神的世界。庞大的安其拉堡垒则用于容纳他们日益增加的军队，准备迎接克苏恩的到来。"
G["The Old Gods have shown themselves - a tide of darkness sweeps from their gaping maws towards the temple. We MUST buy the aspects more time."]="上古之神现身了——黑暗之潮从他们撕开的裂口中涌出，直奔神殿而去。我们要为守护巨龙争取时间。"
G["The Old Gods protect the Soul!"]="是上古之神在保护着巨龙之魂！"
G["The Old Gods will be restored.  You will not be allowed to interfere!"]="上古之神将会重生，你别想阻止这一切！"
G["The Old One calls to you!"]="上古尊者在召唤！"
G["The Old One grants us strength."]="上古尊者赐予我们力量。"
G["The Order of the Cloud Serpent is sworn to defend the Jade Forest. We train at the Arboretum, just to the north of the Temple of the Jade Serpent in the Jade Forest."]="云端翔龙骑士团发誓保卫翡翠林。我们在翡翠林青龙寺正北面的百木园进行训练。"
G["The Order of the Shattered Hand existed before Thrall and shall exist after Thrall."]="无论萨尔是否存在，碎手氏族的秩序都将延续下去。"
G["The Orgrimmar Auction House is in the Valley of Strength.  Look for it on the east side next to Boomstick Imports."]="奥格瑞玛拍卖所位于力量谷。去火枪进口公司东面找它吧。"
G["The Orgrimmar riders pride themselves on fearless and devastating charges. Such is their skill and ferocity that even when charged themselves they simply charge right back.\n\nTry staying close and Thrusting, and when they attempt to gain range, throw them off-balance with a Shield-Breaker before you Charge. Otherwise, they'll meet you head-on every time."]="奥格瑞玛的骑兵以其无畏而极具破坏性的冲锋为傲。即便是被对方冲锋，他们也能立即以牙还牙，这就是奥格瑞玛骑兵的可怕之处了。\n\n你要尽可能地打近身战并使用刺击，当他们试图拉开距离时，先利用碎盾令他们失去平衡，然后使用冲锋。否则，他们会不断地向你发动正面攻击。"
G["The Pandaren are deeply concerned about the return of this \"Thunder King.\" But I'm more concerned about the Horde. We can talk during the flight."]="A los pandaren les preocupa enormemente el regreso del \"Rey del Trueno\". A mí me preocupa más la Horda. Hablaremos durante el vuelo."
G["The Pandaren are terrified that the former Emperor will try to reclaim his empire, and enslave them once again."]="熊猫人害怕这位前皇帝会试图重建他的帝国，并再次奴役他们。"
G["The Paragons of Power are remnants from the ancient Gurubashi Empire.  We Zandalar seek them - not only are they of tremendous collectible value to us, but we believe that they also hold latent signatures of magic used by the old Empire.\n\nYou'll more than likely discover three kinds of Paragons in Zul'Gurub: coins, bijous, and primal items.  Bring them to us in the quantities that we seek, and you'll be rewarded with some of the finest items we Zandalar have ever crafted."]="Los Dechados de Poder son vestigios del antiguo Imperio Gurubashi. Nosotros los Zandalar los buscamos no solo por el hecho de coleccionarlos, sino porque creemos que tienen signos latentes de la magia utilizada por el viejo Imperio.\n\nEncontrarás tres tipos de Dechados en Zul'Gurub: monedas, preseas y objetos primigenios. Tráenoslos en las cantidades que necesitamos y recibirás como recompensa algunos de los mejores objetos que los Zandalar jamás han fabricado."
G["The Paragons of Power are remnants from the ancient Gurubashi Empire.  We Zandalar seek them - not only are they of tremendous collectible value to us, but we believe that they also hold the strongest of mojo used by the old Empire.\n\nYa can expect to be findin' three kinds of Paragons in Zul'Gurub: coins, bijous, and primal items.  Bring them to us in the quantities that we seek, and you'll be rewarded with the some of the finest items we Zandalar have ever crafted.\n\nCount on it, mon!"]="Los Dechados de Poder son vestigios del antiguo Imperio Gurubashi. Nosotros los Zandalar los buscamos no solo por el hecho de coleccionarlos sino porque creemos que guardan el mojo más poderoso jamás utilizado por el viejo Imperio.\n\nSe pueden encontrar tres tipos de Dechados en Zul'Gurub: monedas, preseas y objetos primigenios. Tráenoslos en las cantidades que necesitamos y recibirás como recompensa algunos de los mejores objetos que los Zandalar jamás han fabricado.\n\n¡Cuenta con ello!"
G["The Park"]="花园"
G["The Park is where you want to go if you are looking for druid trainers. Theridan and Maldryn can usually be found by the moonwell in the center of the district."]="如果你要寻找德鲁伊训练师，那就去花园区。塞瑞德兰或者玛尔德利恩一般都在那里的月亮井旁边。"
G["The Park's been ruined... we'll have to go another way, today. Miserable dragon!"]="花园已经变成了废墟……我们今天得另寻出路了。这该死的龙！"
G["The Park...?\n\nIt's in ruins. Haven't you heard? The great dragon Deathwing soared over Stormwind and destroyed it in passing.\n\nNot sure why he didn't level everything, honestly, but we all thank the Light he didn't."]="花园……？\n\n已经变成废墟了。你没听说吗？巨龙死亡之翼从暴风城上空掠过，顺便把它给毁了。\n\n老实说，我不懂他为什么没夷平整座城市，但感谢圣光，幸好他没这么干。"
G["The Pearlfin do not trust us. We must show them that we mean no harm."]="珠鳍部族不信任我们，我们必须向他们表明我们没有恶意。"
G["The People of Westfall salute $n, a brave and valiant defender of freedom."]="El Pueblo de los Páramos de Poniente saluda a $n, $gsoberbio:soberbia; y valiente $gdefensor:defensora; de la libertad."
G["The Pincer X2 has docked. All aboard!"]="扳钳X2号已经到达。全体上船！"
G["The Pincer X2 will be arriving shortly! Get your gear and form up, boys!"]="扳钳X2号马上就要到了！整装列队，弟兄们！"
G["The Plaguelands are an excellent place to strike against the Scourge!"]="瘟疫之地是对付天灾亡灵绝佳的地方！"
G["The Plaguewood is too big!  Your friend is gone!  You will never find him!"]="病木林实在是太大了！你的朋友失踪了！你绝对不可能找到他！"
G["The Plates of Uldum are discs synthesized by the Creators that allow access into the Uldum compound.  These discs house and store specific data related to the Creators' activities here.\n\nPhysically, they are nearly identical in circumference to the disc set you currently possess.  Their markings, however, are directly related to information on Uldum as opposed to the Uldaman complex."]="拥有奥丹姆圆盘才能够进入奥丹姆。这些圆盘中储存了造物者在这里的所有活动的纪录。\n\n从组成上来看，这些圆盘各不相同。它们的标注则只和奥丹姆信息相关，与奥达曼圆盘截然不同。"
G["The Pool of Tears in the Swamp of Sorrows holds ancient locked boxes that were lost in another age."]="悲伤沼泽泪水之池有许多带锁的上个世纪丢失的盒子。"
G["The Pools of Youth were an ancient fable my grandsires told me long ago. Now this old man intends to find them!"]="青春之池是我祖祖辈辈流传下来的一个古老传说。现在，我这个老朽决心要找到它们！"
G["The Primal Gods serve Hakkar. Turn back now, you stand no chance."]="远古之神效忠于哈卡。逃走吧，你是没有机会获胜的。"
G["The Primal Gods? Impossible!"]="狂野之神？不可能！"
G["The Prince of Stormwind is unguarded! Why don't we capture him for the Horde?"]="暴风城的王子毫无防备！我们为什么不为了部落抓住他呢？"
G["The Prince plotted to imprison a demon of immense power behind a grand force field. The pylons would channel latent energies into the field, keeping it operational.\n\nWhile imprisoned, Immol'thar would serve as a battery to the populace of Eldre'Thalas."]="王子策划将拥有巨大力量的恶魔伊莫塔尔禁锢到一个巨大的力场中。水晶塔能将潜在的能量汇集到这个力场中。\n\n一旦被囚禁，恶魔将成为埃雷萨拉斯人民的能量来源。"
G["The Qiraji forces were commanded to fall back and hide the bulk of their numbers beneath the sands of the desert. A small attack was ordered upon Southwind Village while the front lines of Staghelm's army were kept occupied."]="其拉虫人的军队奉命后撤，藏身在沙土之下。在牵制鹿盔的前线部队的同时，他们发动了对南风村的小规模袭击。"
G["The Quicksilver falls off his blades! Kill the blobs to absorb their power!"]="水银污泥怪从他的刀刃上滴落下来！快杀死污泥怪以吸收它们的力量！"
G["The Quilboar here are too dangerous to get riled up over outside conflicts, $r. My totem will not ward them off forever.\n\nWe must put a stop to their transgressions against nature."]="与外部冲突相比，激怒这里的野猪人太危险了，$r。我的图腾不能永远把他们挡在外面。\n\n我们必须终止他们侵害自然的行为。"
G["The Rabid Mastiff slobbers all over the floor..."]="狂暴猎犬的口水淌了一地板……"
G["The Ragemesa leader is in the caves!"]="怒山领袖在洞里！"
G["The Ranger-General of Silvermoon will be a loyal ally!"]="她曾经是银月城的游侠将军，现在也会是我们忠诚的盟友！"
G["The Rapier has fallen to the ground.  Pick it up to engage Admiral Hagman!"]="细剑掉在了地上。快将它捡起来以对付海军上将哈格曼！"
G["The Raven Claw Talisman is located on the ledge in the upper section of the northern chamber."]="鸦爪神符就在北边房间里上层部分的露台上。"
G["The Razza just made more fertilizer for Mushgog!"]="拉扎尔给姆斯高格带来了更多的肥料！"
G["The Rear Admiral will hear of this."]="海军少将会知道这件事的。"
G["The Recombobulator is shaping up quite nicely. Just a few adjustments to go!"]="净化装置一切正常。只要再调整一下就可以了！"
G["The Red Crane of Hope has inspired the citizens of Pandaria from the very dawn of history. I very much want to speak with him."]="朱鹤带来的希望曾在历史上最黑暗的时刻鼓舞过潘达利亚的人民。我很想跟他谈谈。"
G["The Red Crane saw hope in me, and instructed me to look inward. Despite my visage of despair, I found this hope, and the despair was vanquished."]="朱鹤看到了我内心的希望，并且教我学会自省。透过绝望的表象，我发现了希望，并由此征服了绝望。"
G["The Regent Lord will want a full report. Let's get you back to camp - you have earned a rest."]="摄政王一定想听听完整的报告。我们送你回去吧——你该休息了。"
G["The Reliquary is hot on the trail o' that bell at Mogujia."]="神圣遗物学会正在魔古岬努力搜寻这口钟的下落。"
G["The Remnant of Dahlia Suntouch fades away..."]="达莉亚之魂逐渐消失了……"
G["The Right Arm has regrown!"]="右臂再生了！"
G["The Ring of Trials was once of place of great glory and honor. But then, the Steamwheedle Cartel came, with their wagons of gold and quill pens sharper than any orc axe..."]="试炼竞技场曾经是个满是荣耀的地方。不过，热砂港集团的出现，带来了成车的黄金和比兽人的斧子更硬的羽毛笔……"
G["The Rogue Trainer's name is Marion Call.  You can find her upstairs in the reading room at the Gallows' End Tavern at the town's southeast edge."]="潜行者训练者名叫马里恩·考尔。她在城镇东南角的恐惧之末旅店的阅览室中。"
G["The Rohendor Gate has been shattered! Move forward, champions!"]="洛希多尔之门被击碎了！勇士们，进攻！"
G["The Royal Apothecary Society has little patience for fools, as do I.  Perhaps the next time you and I speak of my steeds, you will be considered a friend of the Undercity.  Until then..."]="La Sociedad Real de Boticarios tiene poca paciencia con los necios, y yo también. Quizás la próxima vez que hablemos sobre mis corceles, ya tendrás reputación de $gamistoso:amistosa; en Entrañas. Hasta entonces..."
G["The Royal Apothecary Society has little patience for fools, as do I.  Perhaps the next time you and I speak of my steeds, you will be considered exalted by the Undercity.  Until then..."]="La Sociedad Real de Boticarios tiene poca paciencia con los necios, y yo también. Quizás la próxima vez que hablemos sobre mis corceles, ya tendrás reputación de $gexaltado:exaltada; en Entrañas. Hasta entonces..."
G["The Royal Apothecary Society of the Undercity is eager to aid our orc allies here, in Outland.  It is an opportunity to strengthen our bonds, and to find new specimens and compounds for study.\n\nCompounds...such as poisons."]="幽暗城的皇家药剂师协会渴望去外域帮助我们的兽人盟友。这是个加强我们之间联系的好机会，而且我们还能借此机会找到新的标本和混合物。\n\n混合物……例如毒药。"
G["The Royal Apothecary Society welcomes you to Northrend, $c.  Now, what is it that you will do to aid us in Sylvanas' service?"]="皇家药剂师协会欢迎你来到诺森德，$c。你愿意为我们伟大的希尔瓦娜斯女王陛下做些什么呢？"
G["The Royal Exchange auction house can be found in the eastern part of the city, just south of the training area for the blood knights and rangers."]="皇家贸易区的拍卖行可以在城市的东部找到，就在血骑士和猎人的训练区域往南一点。"
G["The Royal Quarter is just up ahead, Warchief."]="前面不远就是皇家区了，酋长。"
G["The Ruins of Eldarath."]="埃达拉斯废墟。"
G["The Rune of Nesting is located across the bridge in the upper section of the southern chamber."]="筑巢符文就在这座桥另一端，南边房间里的上层部分。"
G["The Runebreaker fails to free the Runed Giant, weakening it and causing it to attack!"]="符文碎裂之石未能解放符文巨人，只是削弱了它的力量。符文巨人发动了攻击！"
G["The SD-5 Automated Shredder defense unit. A labor of love."]="SD-5自动伐木机防御单位。一位劳模。"
G["The Sacred Pools have been corrupted by dark energy, thanks to Garrosh Hellscream. Remnants of the sha still linger."]="拜加尔鲁什·地狱咆哮所赐，圣池被黑暗能量腐蚀了。煞魔余孽也依然在四处流窜。"
G["The Sandfury reign supreme!"]="沙怒部族拥有至高无上的统治权！"
G["The Sapphire of Sky is located at the separate room in the lower section of the northern chamber."]="天蓝之石就在北边房间里下层部分的小房间中。"
G["The Sarkhoff's... sometimes the Sarkhoff's visit. They are good people."]="萨克霍夫……有时萨克霍夫他们会来。他们是好人。"
G["The Scarlet Crusade is not over! Undeath is merely a setback!"]="血色十字军还没有完！亡灵只不过是一个小小的挫折！"
G["The Scarlet Crusade is powerless to stop us!"]="血色十字军休想阻止我们！"
G["The Scarlet Crusade of Tyr's Hand in the Eastern Plaguelands have many lockboxes that will challenge your skill."]="东瘟疫之地蒂尔引领的血色十字军有许多带锁的箱子，这对你的技能可是个挑战。"
G["The Scarlet Crusade shall not fail in its mission!"]="血色十字军战无不胜！"
G["The Scarlet Crusade shall smite the wicked and drive evil from these lands!"]="血色十字军将会消灭一切邪恶的力量，把它们彻底赶出这片领地！"
G["The Scarlet Crusade will return to its noble roots!"]="血色十字军将荣返故里！"
G["The Scarlet Crusade will scour these lands!"]="血色十字军将彻底净化这片土地！"
G["The Scarlet Crusade will serve a new master - in death..."]="血色十字军将迎来一名新主子——我是说，在他们死后……"
G["The Scarlet Monastery belongs to the Forsaken now!"]="血色修道院现在的主人是被遗忘者！"
G["The Scarlet fleet lies in ruin upon the sundered coast!"]="停泊在破碎海岸的十字军舰队已成残骸！"
G["The Scepter of Domination glows brightly! Use it now!"]="支配节杖散发着明亮的光芒！快使用它！"
G["The Scepter of the Shifting Sands is whole once more, $n.\n\nIt is you who must lead your armies into the cursed fortress city of Ahn'Qiraj and mete justice to its inhabitants.\n\nVenture to Silithus and present the Scepter of the Shifting Sands to Jonathan the Revelator."]="流沙节杖终于得以复原，$n。\n\n你必须带领你的军队进入被诅咒的安其拉之城，让那些异种虫类受到正义的审判。\n\n前往希利苏斯吧，将流沙节杖交给天启者乔纳森。"
G["The Scepter of the Shifting Sands is whole once more, $n.\n\nIt must be you who uses the scepter. It must be you who heralds in the next age of your people.\n\nWhen you are prepared to ring the Scarab Gong and once more open the gates of Ahn'Qiraj, I will grant you the Scepter. You have only to ask."]="流沙节杖终于得以复原，$n。\n\n只有你能使用这把节杖，只有你能带领你的同胞走向新的纪元。\n\n当你准备好敲响甲虫之台的铜锣，再次打开安其拉之门时，我就会把节杖交给你的。"
G["The Scepter of the Shifting Sands is whole once more, $n.\n\nIt must be you who uses the scepter. It must be you who heralds in the next age of your people. \n\nYou must wait for the armies of the Horde and the Alliance to arrive in Silithus before you may ring the Scarab Gong. The time for war is close at hand."]="流沙节杖终于得以复原，$n。\n\n只能你能使用这把节杖，只有你能带领你的同胞走向新的纪元。\n\n你必须等待部落和联盟的军队抵达希利苏斯，然后你就可以敲响甲虫之台的铜锣了。战争即将拉开序幕。"
G["The Scholomance is housed in crypts beneath the Caer Darrow keep. Once owned by the noble Barov family, the keep fell to ruin after the Second War. As the wizard Kel'Thuzad enlisted followers for his Cult of the Damned, he often promised immortality for those who served his Lich King. The Barovs fell to his influence and donated their keep, but the cultists killed the family and turned the crypts into a school of necromancy. Though Kel'Thuzad no longer resides there, cultists and instructors still remain."]="通灵学院位于凯尔达隆废弃的城堡中的地下室中。那里曾经是高贵的巴罗夫家族的庄园，但是在第二次大战中凯尔达隆变成了一块废墟。法师克尔苏加德经常向他的诅咒神教信徒承诺可以用对于巫妖王的效忠来换取永恒的生命。巴罗夫家族受到克尔苏加德的魅惑而将城堡和其地下室献给了亡灵天灾。那些信徒将巴罗夫家族的人杀死，并把地下室变成了通灵学院。虽然克尔苏加德不再住在这个地下室中，但是狂热的信徒和讲师都还留在那里。"
G["The School for Necromancy known as Scholomance is on the ruined island of Caer Darrow in the Western Plaguelands."]="通灵学院这个学习亡灵术的学校位于西瘟疫之地的凯尔达隆那个废弃的小岛上。"
G["The Scoured Reach lies to the west."]="蚀沙荒漠就在西边。"
G["The Scourge are a blemish upon these pristine lands.  By the might of my creators, I will crush every last one of their decrepit bones under my heel."]="天灾军团玷污了这片古朴的土地。以伟大的造物主之名，我会将他们污朽的躯壳踩得粉碎。"
G["The Scourge are a fearless machine set to bring about the end of all life on this world."]="天灾军团是不懂得恐惧的机器，他们只知道摧毁这个世界上所有的生命。"
G["The Scourge are at the castle entrance!  For Stormwind!  For King Anduin!"]="天灾军团已经打到城堡入口了！为了暴风王国而战！为了安度因国王陛下而战！"
G["The Scourge are at the entrance to the Royal Quarter!  Kill them!!"]="天灾军团出现在皇家区入口！消灭他们！"
G["The Scourge are breaching the northern wall!"]="天灾军团攻破了北面的城墙！"
G["The Scourge are breaching the southern wall!"]="天灾军团攻破了南面的城墙！"
G["The Scourge are breaching the western wall!"]="天灾军团攻破了西面的城墙！"
G["The Scourge are defeated!  Darrowshire is saved!"]="亡灵天灾被打败了！达隆郡得救了！"
G["The Scourge are establishing small staging points in the places under attack, receiving communications and other assistance from the necropolises that fly overhead. From what we can tell, the only way to root them out is by killing the ground forces that surround the points."]="天灾军团在这边建立起了一处据点，用于与天上的浮空城联络并接受支援。根据我们所知的情报，唯一根除的他们的办法就只有杀死据点附近的所有地面部队。"
G["The Scourge are everywhere!  This is... a nightmare!"]="到处都是天灾军团！这真是……一场噩梦！"
G["The Scourge are no match for me, Torp!"]="天灾军团也不是我的对手，托普！"
G["The Scourge are running freely through the streets!"]="天灾军团在街道上横冲直撞！"
G["The Scourge are upon us! Run! Run for your lives!"]="亡灵天灾来了！快跑啊！逃命吧！"
G["The Scourge attack against my court has been eliminated.  You may go about your business."]="进攻王廷的天灾士兵已经完全被消灭了。你可以去做你自己的事情了。"
G["The Scourge beckons you, foolish $r."]="La Plaga te llama, $gestúpido:estúpida; $r."
G["The Scourge cannot be stopped..."]="天灾军团无人可挡……"
G["The Scourge descends like locust from the north."]="天灾军团如蝗虫一般挥师北下。"
G["The Scourge don't stand a chance!"]="天灾军团没有机会获胜！"
G["The Scourge has broken through!"]="天灾军团冲破了防线！"
G["The Scourge has broken through! RUN AWAY! RUN AWAY!"]="天灾军团冲破了防线！快跑！跑啊！"
G["The Scourge has us surrounded. We can hold the village for awhile, but if we can't defeat them, they will overrun us."]="我们已经被天灾军团包围了。从目前的情况看，我们还能坚持一段时间。但这将是一场你死我活的战斗。"
G["The Scourge have broken into the Bastion!  Redouble your efforts!  We must not fail!"]="亡灵天灾打进堡垒了！坚守阵地！我们绝对不能失败！"
G["The Scourge have broken through in all wings!  May the light defeat these foul creatures!  We shall fight to the last!"]="亡灵天灾从四面八方涌入了堡垒！愿圣光击败这些邪恶的生物！我们要奋战到底！"
G["The Scourge infestation grows in Azshara. Every able bodied warrior is needed to stem the tide of their invasion.\n\nNumber of Necropolises remaining: $2279W"]="天灾军团的势力正在艾萨拉迅速滋长。所有能参加战斗的人都必须并肩战斗，阻止他们的侵略大潮席卷世界！\n\n剩余浮空要塞数量：$2279W"
G["The Scourge infestation grows in the Blasted Lands. Every able bodied warrior is needed to stem the tide of their invasion.\n\nNumber of Necropolises remaining: $2280W"]="天灾军团的势力已经蔓延到了诅咒之地。所有的士兵都要集结起来，击退他们的进攻之潮。\n\n剩余浮空要塞数量：$2280W"
G["The Scourge infestation grows in the Eastern Plaguelands. Every able bodied warrior is needed to stem the tide of their invasion.\n\nNumber of Necropolises remaining: $2282W"]="天灾军团的势力正在东瘟疫之地迅速滋长。所有能参加战斗的人都必须并肩战斗，阻止他们的侵略大潮席卷世界！\n\n剩余浮空要塞数量：$2282W"
G["The Scourge must be stopped at any cost. We cannot permit them to field the army they're constructing here."]="必须不惜一切代价阻止天灾军团。绝不能让他们在这里组建的大军进入战场。"
G["The Scourge shall reign supreme!"]="天灾军团终将拥有至高无上的统治权！"
G["The Scourge spread so rapidly, I often find myself wondering why they haven't already won this war."]="天灾军团扩张如此迅速，我有时都忍不住会想，他们怎么还没赢得这场战争呢。"
G["The Scourge will consume you!"]="你注定要死在天灾军团手中！"
G["The Scourge will destroy this place!"]="天灾军团将要毁灭这里！"
G["The Scourge will destroy you all!  Death will sweep the lands!"]="天灾军团将把你们全部摧毁！死亡将横扫这片陆地！"
G["The Scourge will not prevail!"]="亡灵天灾不会得逞的！"
G["The Scourge will rise again, under a dark new master... Ix'lar!"]="天灾军团将再次崛起，他们将得到新的黑暗主人……埃克斯拉尔！"
G["The Scourge will wash over this world as a swarm of death and destruction!"]="强大的天灾军团将让死亡和毁灭席卷整个世界！"
G["The Scourge's plague is almost to the turning point; a handful more cauldron subversions will push us over the top!  Be sure to do your part to help out!"]="亡灵天灾带来的灾难就快结束；一场难以控制的颠覆行动会将我们推向顶峰！你务必要帮助我们！"
G["The Scourge's plague still dominates the zone, and we have a long way to go before the plague will be altered enough to affect them.  Collect the necessary resources and help out the war effort!"]="亡灵天灾带来的灾难还在这片区域蔓延，在扭转局面，摧毁亡灵天灾之前，我们要走的路还很长。收集必要的资源，尽力帮助我们吧！"
G["The Scryer's Tier has a library devoted to training professions.\n\nYou will find the knowledge you seek in the Seer's Library."]="占星者之台上有一个专门研究各种专业技能的图书馆。\n\n你可以去占星者之台的先知图书馆寻求你想要学习的知识。"
G["The Scryers bank is located southeast of the city's center."]="占星者银行座落在城市中心的东南。"
G["The Scryers inn is located above Shattrath city, on Scryer's Tier. The lift to there is southwest of the city center."]="占星者旅店坐落在沙塔斯城的占星者平台上。在城市中心的西南方有去那里的升降梯。"
G["The Scythe of Antiok drops to the ground!"]="安提沃克的镰刀跌落在地！"
G["The Sea Witch is 'ere, I can sense it. Stay and she's sure to come out of her hole soon enough."]="那个女海巫就在这里，我能感觉到她。耐心等待，她很快就会从她的洞里出来了。"
G["The Seers of Elder Rise will help you.  Seek them out in the Hall of Elders there."]="长者高地的先知们会帮助你。你可以在那里的长者大厅中找到他们。"
G["The Sen'jin riders count on their nimbleness and skill at range.\n\nThey are quick and cunning enough to avoid your Charges, so try using a mixture of close-range Thrusts and the occasional Shield-Breaker to defeat them."]="森金的骑兵以灵巧与远程攻击著称。\n\n他们敏捷的身手足以避开你的冲锋，因此你必须灵活运用近距离刺击和碎盾攻击，才有可能击败他们。"
G["The Sentinels and I exchanged stories of our time in the Krasarang Wilds. I told them all about my adventures at the Temple of Chi-Ji."]="哨兵部队与我交换了在卡桑琅丛林经历的故事。我把自己在赤精寺院里的冒险奇遇告诉了他们。"
G["The Sentinels and I exchanged stories of our time in the Krasarang Wilds. I told them all about our adventures together at the Temple of Chi-Ji."]="哨兵部队与我交换了在卡桑琅丛林经历的故事。我把我们在赤精寺院里的冒险奇遇告诉了他们。"
G["The Serpent's Maw is engulfed in tuskarr fire!"]="毒蛇之喉被烈焰吞没了！"
G["The Sethekk believe themselves to be the true and most loyal followers of the master of all arakkoa. Do not ask about the master, $r, for his mysteries are for the feathered people alone.\n\nThe Sethekk interpreted the destruction of Auchindoun to be the arrival of our master on this planet. They set out for the ruins, taking with them the relics of our greatest hero, Terokk.\n\nThey still seek the master in the temple's ruins, but I came to see through their lies. I am no longer one of them."]="塞泰克一族认为他们是所有鸦人中最忠诚于主人的信徒。不要多问关于主人的事，$R，只有鸦人才有资格了解他的神秘传说。\n\n塞泰克认为奥金顿的毁灭是主人到来的信号。他们带着我们最伟大的英雄泰罗克的圣物去了废墟。\n\n他们仍然在神殿的废墟中寻找主人，但是我看穿了他们的谎言。我不再和他们同流合污了。"
G["The Sha Abomination breathes pure death!  Move away from him!"]="煞魔畸体正在喷吐精纯死气！快离开他身边！"
G["The Sha Amalgamation banishes the Celestial Defender.  Defend yourself!"]="融合之煞放逐了天界防御者！快保护你自己！"
G["The Sha Amalgamation begins casting |cFFFF2222|Hspell:139382|h[Insanity]|h|r!  Discharge one of the anvils to stop it!"]="融合之煞开始施放|cFFFF2222|Hspell:139382|h[疯狂]|h|r！快释放铁砧中的能量来阻止它！"
G["The Sha Amalgamation casts |cFFFF2222|Hspell:139443|h[Meteor Storm]|h|r!"]="融合之煞开始施放|cFFFF2222|Hspell:139443|h[流星风暴]|h|r！"
G["The Sha Amalgamation is casting |cFFFF2222|Hspell:139375|h[Shadow Burst]|h|r! Run Away!"]="融合之煞开始施放 |cFFFF2222|Hspell:139375|h[暗影爆裂]|h|r！快跑！"
G["The Sha Amalgamation is vulnerable!  Throw the |cFFFF2222[Lightning Lance]|r at it!"]="融合之煞被削弱了！快用|cFFFF2222[闪电长枪]|r丢它！"
G["The Sha are too many, we must flee while we still have the chance!"]="煞魔太多了，能逃就赶快逃吧！"
G["The Sha have broken out of the temple. We must beat them back...or die trying."]="煞魔从寺庙里跑出来了，我们得把他们赶回去……或者同归于尽。"
G["The Sha of Fear |cFFFF0404|Hspell:126121|h[Corrupts]|h|r a dissonance field!"]="惧之煞|cFFFF0404|Hspell:126121|h[腐蚀]|h|r不谐力场！"
G["The Sha of Hatred has fled my body... and the monastery, as well. I must thank you, strangers. The Shado-Pan are in your debt. Now, there is much work to be done..."]="恨之煞离开了我的身体……也离开了禅院。我必须要谢谢你，陌生人。影踪派欠你个人情。现在，还有很多事情要做……"
G["The Sha of Hatred is inside that mantid structure... I suspect it was drawn to a powerful host there."]="恨之煞就在那个螳螂妖建筑里……我猜想它是被一个强大的寄主吸引过去的。"
G["The Sha's hold over our people has been broken thanks to you. You have our thanks."]="恨之煞不能再以我们的人民相威胁了，这多亏有你。我们感谢你。"
G["The Sha'tar, or \"born from light\" are the naaru that came to Outland to fight the demons of the Burning Legion."]="\"Los Sha'tar, o los \"nacidos de la Luz\" son los naaru que vinieron a Terrallende para luchar contra los demonios de la Legión Ardiente."
G["The Sha... must be... stopped..."]="必须……阻止……煞魔……"
G["The Shade of the Kaldorei closes its eyes and fades away."]="卡多雷的幻影闭上眼睛，渐渐消失了。"
G["The Shado-Pan Archers disappear!"]="影踪派弓箭手消失了！"
G["The Shado-Pan always friend of the grummles. Why are they not letting us in to trade?"]="影踪派一直是土地精的朋友。他们为什么不让我们进去做生意？"
G["The Shado-Pan are few in number, but we make up for it in strength."]="影踪派虽然人数稀少，但我们能用强大的力量来弥补这一点。"
G["The Shado-Pan are here! They may be of use to us. We should help."]="影踪派也来了！他们或许对我们有用。快帮忙。"
G["The Shado-Pan are legendary. Their force is unmatched in Pandaria."]="影踪派充满了传奇色彩。他们的实力在潘达利亚是无可匹敌的。"
G["The Shado-Pan are not here because the wall needs them. Grummles owe much fortune to the Shado-Pan. If the Shado-Pan cannot defend grummles that means they are in danger, and need grummlepacks now more than ever."]="影踪派不在这儿，因为他们必须守护城墙。土地精欠影踪派太多了。如果影踪派没能保护土地精，那就意味着他们陷入了危险的境地，而且比任何时候都更需要土地精脚夫。"
G["The Shado-Pan has many secrets. High among those is how to craft weapons and armor of surpassing quality."]="影踪派有许多秘密。这其中的最高机密就是如何制造品质超凡的武器和护甲。"
G["The Shado-Pan have held this wall for centuries, but I won't turn down help from outsiders for the sake of pride."]="几个世纪以来，影踪派一直守卫着这道城墙，但我也不会因为骄傲自大而拒绝外人的帮助。"
G["The Shado-Pan hold the eternal vigil, keeping watch over the dark sha energies that were sealed away into the earth long ago.\n\nUnfortunately, the sha have escaped their prisons, and now we must defeat them once again."]="影踪派时刻保持警惕，监视着被封入地底已久的黑暗煞能。\n\n不幸的是，邪煞逃离了囚牢，我们现在必须再次将它击败。"
G["The Shado-Pan is an ancient order that accepts and trains only the most elite and worthy.\n\nShould you manage to make yourself useful, you may find many powerful items available to you."]="影踪派是一个古老的组织，它只接受和培训最为精干和最有价值的成员。\n\n如果你能设法证明自己的价值，就会有许多强大的物品供你所用。"
G["The Shado-Pan need no outside aid! Remove these interlopers!"]="影踪派不需要外人的帮助！送走这些不速之客！"
G["The Shado-Pan quartermaster can be found at the Shado-Pan Garrison in the Townlong Steppes.\n\nI will mark their location on your map."]="影踪派军需官就在螳螂高原的影踪卫戍营。\n\n我会在你的地图上标出位置。"
G["The Shado-Pan sends a lackey to do their work? Perhaps Shan'bu was wrong about them..."]="影踪派竟然让跟班替他们办事？也许山怖搞错了……"
G["The Shado-Pan strike from the shadows, so that our enemies fear the dark."]="影踪派总是从阴影中出击，让我们的敌人惧怕黑暗。"
G["The Shado-Pan told us this would be a safe haven for all the refugees from Kun-Lai. Perhaps here, we shall finally find peace."]="影踪派告诉我们，这里是为昆莱难民挡风遮雨的避风港。也许我们终于能在这里寻获宁静。"
G["The Shado-Pan will be here if you need us."]="如果你有需要，影踪派就会出现。"
G["The Shado-Pan will never rest."]="影踪派永不停歇。"
G["The Shado-pan Defender has placed a |cFFFF2222|Hspell:132744|h[Healing Orb]|h|r!"]="影踪派防御者放下了一颗|cFFFF2222|Hspell:132744|h[治疗宝珠]|h|r！"
G["The Shadow Grave is this way.  Follow me, $n."]="灰影墓穴在这边，跟我来，$n。"
G["The Shaman Commander is not to be trifled with, $r."]="萨满指挥官可不能小瞧，$r。"
G["The Shaman is mine, focus on his companions!"]="这个萨满是我的，你们去对付他的同伴！"
G["The Shan'ze Stormclaw comes to its senses!"]="山泽暴风爪苏醒了！"
G["The Shan... will take you..."]="山泽……会抓住你的……"
G["The Shao-Tien have taken a great interest in these ruins.  They intend to recover power from its depths.  I intend to leave their corpses littering them."]="韶天族对这堆废墟似乎非常感兴趣。他们打算恢复其深处的力量。而我会将他们的尸首丢弃在上面。"
G["The Shao-Tien march to their deaths!"]="韶天赴死！"
G["The Shattered Hand has been able to place spies throughout the upper citadel of Blackrock. Though the information gathering process has been slow, we have made discoveries that cannot be ignored."]="碎手已经在黑石的大本营中安插了数名间谍。尽管信息收集的过程已经慢了下来，但是我们发现了一些不容忽略的现象。"
G["The Shattered Hand will see the Horde to their former glory."]="碎手氏族将会见证部落重铸荣耀。"
G["The Shattered Hand's influence dominates these lands. We are the veil which covers Kalimdor: The protectorates, the police, the judges, the jury, and ultimately, the executioners. We see all, we know all.\n\nYou have grown much in the time which you have spent in service of the Hand, $n. The time has come to send you into the field.\n\nAre you prepared to undertake your next mission?"]="La influencia de los Mano Destrozada se deja sentir en estas tierras. Somos el velo que cubre Kalimdor: Los protectorados, la policía, los jueces, el jurado y, finalmente, los verdugos. Los vemos a todos, los conocemos a todos.\n\nHas crecido mucho durante el tiempo que has prestado servicio a los Mano Destrozada, $n. Ha llegado el momento de enviarte al campo de batalla.\n\n¿Estás $gpreparado:preparada; para acometer tu siguiente misión?"
G["The Shattered Sun Offensive has made great progress in the outer areas of the Isle of Quel'Danas. Kil'jaeden's forces are being pushed back, and in the chaos I was able to lead a small scouting force here inside the Sunwell Plateau. My troops proceeded through Parhelion Plaza, spotted a group of Sunblade blood elves, and we then engaged the enemy. That fight quickly turned into a disaster."]="破碎残阳目前在奎尔丹纳斯岛的外围地域进展非常良好，基尔加丹的部队正被我们逼得节节败退。此外，趁着双方掌握地域的混乱，我直接派一小支侦察部队进入了太阳之井。我的部队目前已经通过了幻日广场，还曾在那附近发现了一小队血精灵，并与之交战，结果，那场战斗很快就变成了一场灾难。"
G["The Shattered Sun Offensive is lucky to have $n on our side."]="破碎残阳很幸运能有$n与我们并肩作战。"
G["The Shattered Sun Offensive will surely benefit from the addition of your knights, Lady Liadrin."]="破碎残阳肯定会因为骑士们的加入而更加强大，女伯爵莉亚德琳。"
G["The Shen'dralar were Queen Azshara's most revered arcanists. It was within these very walls that the Queen's most important demands were processed - often in secret.\n\nAfter the destruction of the Well and the subsequent lethargy that overcame the Highborne and lesser night elf sects, the Prince of Eldre'Thalas, Tortheldrin, began construction of the pylons that you see littering the halls of the west wing."]="Los Shen'dralar eran los arcanistas más venerados de la reina Azshara. Fue entre estos muros, donde se cumplieron las demandas de la reina, a menudo en secreto.\n\nDespués de la destrucción del pozo y el subsiguiente letargo que se apoderó de los Altonato y de las sectas menores de elfos de la noche, el príncipe de Eldre'Thalas, Tortheldrin, comenzó la construcción de las torres que ves en las salas del ala oeste."
G["The Shrine of Remulos is a sacred place for us in the Cenarion Circle here in Moonglade... so please conduct yourself in a manner befitting a visitor.\n\nA visitor who doesn't want my scimitar buried in them, that is."]="对我们这些在月光林地塞纳里奥议会的人来说，雷姆洛斯神殿是个神圣的地方……所以请你的表现符合访客的身份。\n\n我想你不愿让我用弯刀杀死你，那就是了。"
G["The Siege Tank explodes!"]="攻城坦克爆炸了！"
G["The Signet of Chaos belongs to Ravenholdt, beast! You will never hold its power! (PLACEHOLDER - TO BE MOVED/CHANGED)"]="混乱印记属于拉文霍德！你永远也不会得到它的能量！"
G["The Silver Covenant is pleased to present their contenders for this event, Highlord."]="银色盟约们很高兴地在此介绍他们的斗士，大领主。"
G["The Silver Covenant welcomes you to the tournament. The Argent Crusade has asked us to register and train those interested in competing."]="银色盟约欢迎你参加锦标赛。银色北伐军委托我们登记并训练那些对比赛感兴趣的选手。"
G["The Silvermoon City Inn, located in the Royal Exchange, is run by a talented woman named Velandra. I'm told that the renowned vinemaster can sometimes be found there, as well."]="银月城旅店座落在皇家贸易区，由一个叫维兰德拉的女人经营着。我听说那个有名的调酒师有时也会出现在那里。"
G["The Silvermoon City Inn."]="银月城旅店。"
G["The Silvermoon riders believe in balance and precision, deftly mixing attack and defense.\n\nHowever, they will often open themselves to Charges by trying to gain range on you.\n\nClose that range with a Charge before they can do the same, and then Shield-Break them as you wheel around for more Thrusts."]="银月城的骑兵将攻击和防御巧妙地结合起来，在作战中实现平衡与精准。\n\n但是，由于他们需要时刻与你保持距离，因此你可以伺机冲锋。\n\n你必须抢在他们之前发起冲锋，拉近彼此的距离，接下来在围绕他们跑动的过程中使用碎盾并看准机会使用刺击。"
G["The Silverwing Sentinels are hardly what I would call honorable opponents. But if you are intent upon their slaughter $c, then seek out Brakgul Deathbringer in the Hall of the Brave."]="Los centinelas Ala de Plata no son lo que yo llamaría oponentes honorables. Pero si estás $gdecidido:decidida; a matarles, $c, busca a Brakgul Libramorte en el Bastión de los Valientes."
G["The Silverwing Sentinels can use all the help they can get in their fight against the Warsong Outriders. $n, go to Stormwind Keep and speak with Elfarran if you wish to assist them."]="银翼哨兵运用一切援助对抗战歌前锋。$n，如果你想要帮助他们的话，就去暴风要塞找艾弗拉兰谈谈。"
G["The Silverwing Sentinels shall be in your debt, $c.  You will find Elfarran, our battlemaster, inside Stormwind Keep, attending the boy-king's audience.  Goddess watch over you!"]="银翼哨兵欠你一份情，$c。你可以在暴风要塞的皇家觐见室找到军官艾弗拉兰。愿女神保佑你！"
G["The Silverwing Sentinels still fight the Horde in Warsong Gulch, $c. What remains to be seen is if you will return there to help them."]="银翼哨兵仍然在战歌峡谷和部落战斗着，$c。不知道你是否会回到那里去帮助他们。"
G["The Skettis Windwalker throws a bundle of fragrant herbs into the fire. [PH]"]="El surcavientos de Skettis lanza un paquete de hierbas aromáticas al fuego."
G["The Skybreaker patrols Icecrown.  You will find no finer ship in all of the realms."]="破天号将开往冰冠冰川。世界上找不到比它更好的飞船啦。"
G["The Skyfire can't take much more of this!"]="天火号就快撑不住了！"
G["The Skyfire has had a complete overhaul since our encounter with Deathwing! We now carry a full complement of both fixed-wing and gyro aircraft as well as a battery of 18-inch smoothbore shore bombardment cannons.\n\nThe Horde won't be able to hide from her reach. Not on land, not at sea, not in the air."]="在遭遇死亡之翼后，我们已经对天火号进行了全面改装！我们现在不但有了舰载固定翼战机和旋翼机，还给它装上了18英寸口径的滑膛式海岸轰击炮组。\n\n密集的炮火一定会让部落无处遁形，随便他们上天入地，翻山过海，都会被我们给炸出来。"
G["The Skyguard are here! The Skyguard are here!"]="天空卫队来了！天空卫队来了！"
G["The Skyguard need our help! We need to get more magical flasks."]="天空卫队需要我们的帮助！我们需要更多不可思议的合剂。"
G["The Skyguard shall pay for your temerity, $n!"]="天空卫队会为你的鲁莽付出代价的，$n！"
G["The Snowfall Graveyard is owned by the Alliance."]="雪落墓地为联盟所有。"
G["The Snowfall Graveyard is owned by the Horde."]="雪落墓地为部落所有。"
G["The Snowfall Graveyard is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Alliance will capture it!"]="雪落墓地受到攻击！如果我们不尽快采取措施，联盟会占领它的！"
G["The Snowfall Graveyard is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Horde will capture it!"]="雪落墓地受到攻击！如果我们不尽快采取措施，部落会占领它的！"
G["The Snowfall Graveyard lies high atop a hill in the Field of Strife, east of Winterax Hold.\n\nNeither side controls it."]="雪落墓地就在征战平原的高山顶部，就在冰斧要塞以东。\n\n联盟和部落还在争夺这片土地。"
G["The Snowfall Graveyard lies high atop a hill in the Field of Strife, east of Winterax Hold.\n\nThe Alliance currently controls it."]="雪落墓地就在冰斧要塞以东的征战平原的高山顶部。\n\n联盟控制着这片土地。"
G["The Snowfall Graveyard lies high atop a hill in the Field of Strife, east of Winterax Hold.\n\nThe Horde currently controls it."]="雪落墓地就在冰斧要塞以东的征战平原的高山顶部。\n\n部落控制着这片土地。"
G["The Snowfall Graveyard was taken by the Alliance!"]="雪落墓地被联盟占领了！"
G["The Snowfall Graveyard was taken by the Horde!"]="雪落墓地被部落占领了！"
G["The Song of the Vale hangs on the wall. Take it. I hear the celestials calling. Thank you..."]="《溪山吟》就挂在墙上。拿去吧。我听到了上天的召唤，谢谢你……"
G["The Sons of Arugal will rise against all who challenge the power of the Moonrage!"]="阿鲁高的子孙们将会惩罚那些胆敢挑战月怒权威的蠢货！"
G["The Sons of Gruul must be defeated if we are to shake off our shackles and live as free ogres once more!\n\nWe must work quietly, yet quickly, if our underground resistance is to have a chance of success."]="如果我们想摆脱身上的枷锁，再次享受自由的滋味，就必须杀死所有的格鲁尔之子！\n\n但是，我们必须隐秘行动，只有通过秘密的抵抗行动，我们才有机会获得成功。"
G["The Sons of Lightning will have their vengeance!"]="闪电之子终于可以复仇了！"
G["The Sons of Lothar have been fighting a war without end.  I'm amazed we've kept our equipment in as good a shape as it is!"]="洛萨之子所面对的是一场永无止境的战争。我很惊讶我们的武器居然还能用！"
G["The Sons of Thaurissan shall watch you perish in the Ring of the Law!"]="索瑞森的臣民将在秩序竞技场中看着你死去！"
G["The Soulflayer comes!"]="夺灵者来了！"
G["The Soulflayer is defeated!  Our leader, Molthor, now calls more of his servants..."]="夺灵者已经被打败了！我们的首领莫托尔需要更多的仆从……"
G["The South Seas are mine to pillage for all eternity!"]="南海是我永远的狩猎场！"
G["The South Spire has been destroyed!"]="南部尖塔被摧毁了！"
G["The South Spire has been heavily damaged!"]="南部尖塔受到了重创！"
G["The Southern Graveyard has been captured by the Alliance!"]="联盟夺取了南部墓地！"
G["The Southern Graveyard has been captured by the Horde!"]="部落夺取了南部墓地！"
G["The Southsea Freebooters own this shore!"]="南海海盗是这片海岸的主人！"
G["The Southsea Pearl and the Conquest will be joining us within the week to help with the invasion."]="南海珍珠号和征服号将在本周内加入我们，帮助我们进行这次入侵。"
G["The Southshore Crier grabs the back of his neck and his eyes go wide."]="南海镇公告员挠着后脑勺，瞪圆了双眼。"
G["The Spear of Durotar is filled to the bursting point with combustible, super-heated gas."]="杜隆塔尔之矛号里面充满了过热的易燃气体。"
G["The Spear of the Kolkar Khan has been broken..."]="科卡尔可汗之矛折断了……"
G["The Spineclaw scuttles away in fear!"]="钳爪蟹害怕地逃开了！"
G["The Spinefish are right here on your map. Off the shores of Bin'an Village in Kun-Lai Summit. Anywhere the sky is dark and heavy."]="刺皮鱼就在地图的这个位置。昆莱山滨岸村的海滩上。你找天色最阴沉黑暗的地方就对了。"
G["The Spirit of the Loch sent you here. You seek information."]="洛克之灵派你到这里。你要寻找信息。"
G["The Spirit-Kissed Water from the local sprites will nourish our saplings well. And once the bucket is filled, you will not need to replenish it."]="附近的精怪身上携带有灵吻之水，这些水能够滋养我们的树苗。装满一次之后，你就不再需要去补充它们了。"
G["The Spirits of Competition have grown strong again."]="竞争之魂又一次变得强大了。"
G["The Splithoof Heights centaur have destroyed the oil drilling rig!"]="裂蹄高地的半人马摧毁了钻油机！"
G["The Sra'thik command the elements of this land, leaving their foes imprisoned for all time!"]="瑟里提克掌控世间元素，将他们的敌人永世囚禁！"
G["The Sssea Witch will kill you all."]="女海巫会把你们全杀掉。"
G["The Staff of Storm's Fury pilfered. A curse upon this land! The storms will never cease!"]="风暴愤怒法杖被盗。这片大陆遭到了诅咒！风暴永远不会停息！"
G["The Steamwheedle Cartel hosts an entire arena circuit in the central sewers of Dalaran.\n\nYou'll find dueling rings there, too, at the Circle of Wills."]="热砂港在达拉然的中心下水道里举办竞技场循环赛。\n\n你还可以参与意志竞技场的比赛。"
G["The Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit has begun. You can find Arena Organizers selling arena team charters in Gadgetzan and outside the arenas in Nagrand and the Blade's Edge Mountains."]="热砂格斗联赛已经开始了。竞技场组织者正在加基森、纳格兰竞技场和刀锋山竞技场外兜售竞技场战队登记表。"
G["The Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit is beginning soon. They're holding practice matches in their arenas now, but ranking fights begin in $4262d."]="热砂格斗联赛就要开始了。现在，地精们正在竞技场组织练习赛，正式的排位赛将在$4262d后开始。"
G["The Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit isn't selling the arena team charters you'll need to participate in ranking matches yet.\nStill, you can find an Arena Battlemaster and get in some practice rounds. It's never too soon to start training."]="El Círculo de Lucha Bonvapor todavía no vende los estatutos de equipos de arena que necesitarás para participar en los combates de clasificación.\n\nAun así, puedes buscar a un maestro de batalla de arena y hacer asaltos de práctica. Nunca es demasiado pronto para empezar a entrenar."
G["The Stockade"]="监狱"
G["The Stockades are a high-security prison complex, hidden beneath the canal district of Stormwind city. Presided over by Warden Thelwater, the Stockades are home to petty crooks, political insurgents, murderers and a score of the most dangerous criminals in the land. Recently, a prisoner-led revolt has resulted in a state of pandemonium within the Stockades - where the guards have been driven out and the convicts roam free."]="监狱是位于暴风城运河区戒备森原的牢房。那里由典狱官塞尔沃特看守着，监狱是那些小偷，政治犯，谋杀者和许多最危险的罪犯的家园。最近，异常暴动导致了监狱的混乱——所有的守卫都被赶了出来，里面的罪犯可以自由的活动。"
G["The Stone Crow's closed today, sorry. There are too many health concerns, and I'm not about to have Ed under fire for supposedly making people sick."]="很抱歉，石鸦旅店今天暂停营业。最近饮食卫生问题闹得很严重，我可不想别人跳出来指责我们的厨师传播疾病。"
G["The Stone Dragon Broodmother approaches."]="石龙主母靠近了。"
G["The Stone Dragon Broodmother bows her head in surrender."]="石龙主母低下头表示投降。"
G["The Stone Dragons are here, fleshling.  Take wing!"]="石龙就在这儿，凡人。赶快！"
G["The Stonehearth Bunker is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Alliance will destroy it!"]="石炉碉堡受到攻击！如果我们不尽快采取措施，联盟会摧毁它的！"
G["The Stonehearth Bunker is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Horde will destroy it!"]="石炉碉堡受到攻击！如果我们不尽快采取措施，部落会摧毁它的！"
G["The Stonehearth Bunker protects the eastern flank of the Field of Strife.\n\nIt is controlled by neither side."]="石炉碉堡是征战平原东侧的要塞。\n\n联盟和部落还在争夺它。"
G["The Stonehearth Bunker protects the eastern flank of the Field of Strife.\n\nIt is controlled by the Alliance."]="石炉碉堡是征战平原东侧的要塞。\n\n联盟控制着它。"
G["The Stonehearth Bunker protects the eastern flank of the Field of Strife.\n\nIt is controlled by the Horde."]="石炉碉堡是征战平原东侧的要塞。\n\n部落控制着它。"
G["The Stonehearth Bunker was destroyed by the Horde!"]="石炉碉堡被部落摧毁了！"
G["The Stonehearth Bunker was taken by the Alliance!"]="石炉碉堡被联盟占领了！"
G["The Stonehearth Graveyard is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Alliance will capture it!"]="石炉墓地受到攻击！如果我们不尽快采取措施的话，联盟会占领它的！"
G["The Stonehearth Graveyard is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Horde will capture it!"]="石炉墓地受到攻击！如果我们不尽快采取措施的话，部落会占领它的！"
G["The Stonehearth Graveyard lies east of the Stonehearth Outpost in the Field of Strife.\n\nNeither side currently controls it."]="石炉墓地就在征战平原的炉石前哨东面。\n\n联盟和部落还在争夺这片土地。"
G["The Stonehearth Graveyard lies east of the Stonehearth Outpost in the Field of Strife.\n\nThe Alliance currently controls it."]="石炉墓地就在征战平原的石炉前哨东面。\n\n联盟控制着这片土地。"
G["The Stonehearth Graveyard lies east of the Stonehearth Outpost in the Field of Strife.\n\nThe Horde currently controls it."]="石炉墓地就在征战平原的石炉前哨东面。\n\n部落控制着这片土地。"
G["The Stonehearth Graveyard was taken by the Alliance!"]="石炉墓地被联盟占领了！"
G["The Stonehearth Graveyard was taken by the Horde!"]="石炉墓地被部落占领了！"
G["The Stonemaul clan serves the Horde!\n\nDuring the founding of Orgrimmar, when Kalimdor was being tamed as our people's homeland, the hero Rexxar defeated the chief of the Stonemaul ogre clan.\n\nThey have served the Horde ever since, and I've called them in here to do the heavy lifting against the Gordunni clan."]="石槌部族效忠于部落！\n\n在奥格瑞玛建立期间，当我们的族人努力将卡利姆多改造成我们的家园时，英雄雷克萨击败了石槌食人魔部族的首领。\n\n从那时起，他们便发誓为部落效忠，我已经将他们召集至此，铲除戈杜尼部族。"
G["The Stonescale Matriarch is snared!  Avoid her attacks by staying on the move!"]="石鳞主母被困住了！注意不断变换位置，躲避她的攻击！"
G["The Stonesplinter Tribe shall see to your doom!"]="碎石部族会消灭你们！"
G["The Stonewrought Dam has been saved!  Three cheers for $n!"]="巨石水坝得救了！为$n欢呼吧！"
G["The Stonewrought Dam will be destroyed!  Long live Ragnaros!"]="巨石水坝将会被摧毁！拉格纳罗斯万岁！"
G["The Stormpike Aid Station is in Dun Baldar, right outside the Dun Baldar barracks.\n\nNeither side currently controls it."]="雷矛急救站在丹巴达尔，就在丹巴达尔军营外。\n\n联盟和部落还在争夺这片土地。"
G["The Stormpike Aid Station is in Dun Baldar, right outside the Dun Baldar barracks.\n\nThe Alliance currently controls it."]="雷矛急救站在丹巴达尔，就在丹巴达尔军营外。\n\n联盟控制着这片土地。"
G["The Stormpike Aid Station is in Dun Baldar, right outside the Dun Baldar barracks.\n\nThe Horde currently controls it."]="雷矛急救站在丹巴达尔，就在丹巴达尔军营外。\n\n部落控制着这片土地。"
G["The Stormpike Aid Station is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Alliance will capture it!"]="雷矛急救站受到攻击！如果我们不尽快采取措施，联盟会占领它的！"
G["The Stormpike Aid Station is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Horde will capture it!"]="雷矛急救站受到攻击！如果我们不尽快采取措施，部落会占领它的！"
G["The Stormpike Aid Station was taken by the Alliance!"]="雷矛急救站被联盟占领了！"
G["The Stormpike Aid Station was taken by the Horde!"]="雷矛急救站被部落占领了！"
G["The Stormpike General is dead!"]="联盟的将军死了！"
G["The Stormpike Graveyard is cut into the mountains, across the bridge east of Dun Baldar.\n\nNeither side currently controls it."]="雷矛墓地就在丹巴达尔以东的桥梁对面的山脉中。\n\n联盟和部落还在争夺这片土地。"
G["The Stormpike Graveyard is cut into the mountains, across the bridge east of Dun Baldar.\n\nThe Alliance currently controls it."]="穿过丹巴达尔以东的桥梁，雷矛墓地就在群山之中。\n\n联盟控制着这片土地。"
G["The Stormpike Graveyard is cut into the mountains, across the bridge east of Dun Baldar.\n\nThe Horde currently controls it."]="穿过丹巴达尔以东的桥梁，雷矛墓地就在群山之中。\n\n部落控制着这片土地。"
G["The Stormpike Graveyard is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Alliance will capture it!"]="雷矛墓地受到攻击！如果我们不尽快采取措施，联盟会占领它的！"
G["The Stormpike Graveyard is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Horde will capture it!"]="雷矛墓地受到攻击！如果我们不尽快采取措施，部落会占领它的！"
G["The Stormpike Graveyard was taken by the Alliance!"]="雷矛墓地被联盟占领了！"
G["The Stormpike Graveyard was taken by the Horde!"]="雷矛墓地被部落占领了！"
G["The Stormpike Guard is in need of your assistance in the fight against the Frostwolf Clan, $n. Speak to Brogun Stoneshield on the Warrior's Terrace and he will help you find your way to Alterac Valley. Elune be praised!"]="¡Machacar!"
G["The Stormpike Guard must be destroyed!  Ready for Alterac Valley $c?"]="¡Hay que destruir a la Guardia Pico Tormenta! ¿Estás $glisto:lista; para el Valle de Alterac, $c?"
G["The Stormpike Quatermaster keeps his supplies under an awning, just west of here."]="雷矛军需官将物资存储在雨棚下，就在这儿以西的地方。"
G["The Stormpike clan bows to no one, especially the horde!"]="雷矛一族不会对任何人俯首称臣的，特别是部落！"
G["The Stormpike forces gain the General's Warcry."]="雷矛军队得到了将军的怒吼。"
G["The Stormpike general has fallen!  The battle is won!\n\nNow laugh as the Alliance scurries to recover its lost holdings."]="雷矛的将军倒下了！联盟胜利啦！\n\n失地复得，全军欢腾。"
G["The Stormpikes uncovered ancient artifacts within Alterac Valley, but the Frostwolf orcs don't take kindly to explorers.  If the dwarves have to fight for knowledge of their ancestors, then so be it!\n\nTo win this battle, defeat the orc, Drek'Thar, in Frostwolf Keep.  Fortune be with you, $c!"]="雷矛部族在奥特兰克山谷中发现了远古的神器，但是霜狼兽人对探险者们可不那么友好。要是矮人想要保护祖先的文化遗产，一场恶战是不可避免的！\n\n要在战争中获胜，就必须打败霜狼将军德雷克塔尔。祝你好运，$c！"
G["The Stormwind Harbor is really bustling.  I wonder where the new boats will sail..."]="暴风城港口一片繁忙的景象。不知道那些新造的船只会开往哪儿去……"
G["The Stormwind Stockades are found near the mage quarter in Stormwind."]="暴风城监狱位于暴风城靠近法师区附近。"
G["The Stormwind riders pride themselves on fearless and devastating charges. Such is their skill and ferocity that even when charged themselves they simply charge right back.\n\nTry staying close and Thrusting, and when they attempt to gain range, throw them off-balance with a Shield-Breaker before you Charge. Otherwise, they'll meet you head-on every time."]="暴风城的骑兵以其无畏而极具破坏性的冲锋为傲。即便是被对方冲锋，他们也能立即以牙还牙，这就是暴风城骑兵的可怕之处了。\n\n你要尽可能地打近身战并使用刺击，当他们试图拉开距离时，先利用碎盾令他们失去平衡，然后使用冲锋。否则，他们会不断地向你发动正面攻击。"
G["The Sun's Reach Armory is ours!  We've pushed the demons back to Dawning Square!"]="阳湾军械库是我们的了！我们已经把那些恶魔逼退到黎明广场去了！"
G["The Sunken Ring siege workshop has been attacked by the Alliance!"]="沉降之环攻城车间遭到了联盟的袭击！"
G["The Sunken Ring siege workshop has been attacked by the Horde!"]="沉降之环攻城车间遭到了部落的袭击！"
G["The Sunken Ring siege workshop has been captured by the Alliance!"]="联盟占领了沉降之环攻城车间！"
G["The Sunken Ring siege workshop has been captured by the Horde!"]="部落占领了沉降之环攻城车间！"
G["The Sunken Temple can be found in the center of a great lake in eastern Swamp of Sorrows."]="沉没的神庙位于悲伤沼泽东部的一个大湖的中心。"
G["The Sunreavers are proud to present their representatives in this trial by combat."]="夺日者们自豪地介绍他们在这场竞赛中的代表。"
G["The Sunreavers are scum!"]="夺日者都是渣滓！"
G["The Sunreavers have devised a way to ward our flying mounts against the lightning. But fly in loose formation, just in case."]="夺日者找到了保护坐骑不受闪电伤害的方法。可为了以防万一，还是分散飞行吧。"
G["The Sunreavers knew NOTHING of Garrosh's raid on Darnassus!"]="夺日者根本不知道加尔鲁什袭击达纳苏斯的事！"
G["The Sunreavers still operate within this city. Alliance and Horde work together."]="夺日者也在这里活动。联盟和部落相互合作。"
G["The Sunreavers will not be pleased. Mark my words, we're not an organization to be taken lightly."]="夺日者不会高兴的。记住我的话，谁都不应该轻视夺日者。"
G["The Sunspire held a beautiful vantage of the Sunwell... once.  Our lives have been turned upside down, $n, but we nonetheless carry on.  It is our way; we are survivors.\n\nIf you are to survive this upheaval... to carry on in your own right, then you MUST learn how to survive.  All blood elves must do this.  You must master your insatiable hungering for magic before it masters you."]="Hubo un tiempo en que la Aguja del Sol disfrutó de una buena ventaja sobre La Fuente del Sol. Nuestras vidas han dado un vuelco, $n, pero aun así debemos continuar. Somos así; somos supervivientes.\n\nSi quieres sobrevivir a estos tiempos tumultuosos y seguir adelante, DEBES aprender a sobrevivir. Todos los elfos de sangre deben hacerlo. Debes dominar tu insaciable hambre de magia antes de que ella te domine a ti."
G["The Syndicate have been reported to be nosing around in a cave on the eastern plateau. Find out what they're up to, soldier! Beware of Frostwolf activity!"]="据报，辛迪加工会东部平原的一处洞穴人声鼎沸。去看看那儿发生了什么事，士兵！小心霜狼的活动！"
G["The Syndicate is made up of a bunch of hacks - disorganized, unskilled, and lazy..."]="辛迪加工会的成员都是些平庸的家伙——缺乏组织性、技能拙劣、懒惰……"
G["The Syndicate keeps many locked boxes of supplies in Durnholde Keep in Hillsbrad."]="辛迪加工会在希尔斯布莱德的敦霍尔德城堡有许多带锁的箱子。"
G["The T.A.D. units have the priority targets!"]="让T.A.D.单位对准优先目标！"
G["The Talking Skull cackles gleefully as the instructor's soul is destroyed."]="当缚魂魔袋看到指导者的灵魂被摧毁的时候，它开心地笑了起来。"
G["The Talking Skull proceeds into the next chamber without saying a word."]="缚魂魔袋一言不发地进入第二个大厅。"
G["The Talking Skull seems hesitant to enter the hall, but proceeds with you nonetheless."]="尽管缚魂魔袋看上去不大愿意进入大厅，但是还是跟了上来。"
G["The Talrendis Ancient howls out in pain!"]="塔伦迪斯古树痛苦地吼叫着！"
G["The Tanaris desert is littered with gigantic bones just like this one to my right.  I'd hate to have ever ran across that thing."]="塔纳利斯沙漠遍布巨大的骨头，就像我右边这个一样。我讨厌碰到那些东西。"
G["The Tapping of the Keg"]="开酒罐仪式"
G["The Tauren Chieftains are staying in Silvermoon while I arrange their next tour. They often lounge on the balcony above me when they're not practicing. Feel free to wave... they love the attention.\nWe're not currently hiring for the show or the crew, but you can always check back later. Who knows what will arise?"]="Los Tauren Chieftains se quedarán en Lunargenta mientras preparo su próxima gira. Cuando no están ensayando, suelen estar en el balcón que hay sobre mí. No te cortes y saluda... les encanta la atención.\n\nPor ahora no estamos contratando gente ni para el espectáculo ni para el personal, pero puedes volver a comprobarlo más tarde. ¿Quién sabe qué puede pasar?"
G["The Tauren Chieftains concert will begin in fifteen minutes!"]="牛头人酋长音乐会将在15分钟后开演！"
G["The Tauren Chieftains concert will begin in fifteen minutes!  Come celebrate the opening of the Darkmoon Faire in Terokkar, just south of Shattrath City!"]="牛头人酋长音乐会将在15分钟后开演！快来泰罗卡森林欢庆暗月马戏团开张吧，就在沙塔斯城以南！"
G["The Tauren Chieftains concert will begin in five minutes!"]="牛头人酋长音乐会将在5分钟后开演！"
G["The Tauren Chieftains concert will begin in five minutes!  Come celebrate the opening of the Darkmoon Faire in Terokkar, just south of Shattrath City!"]="牛头人酋长音乐会将在5分钟后开演！快来泰罗卡森林欢庆暗月马戏团开张吧，就在沙塔斯城以南！"
G["The Tauren Chieftains concert will begin in thirty minutes!"]="牛头人酋长音乐会将在30分钟后开演！"
G["The Tauren Chieftains concert will begin in thirty minutes!  Come celebrate the opening of the Darkmoon Faire in Terokkar, just south of Shattrath City!"]="牛头人酋长音乐会将在30分钟后开演！快来泰罗卡森林欢庆暗月马戏团开张吧，就在沙塔斯城以南！"
G["The Tauren Chieftains must be the best-known minstrels in all of Azeroth!"]="牛头人酋长乐队一定是整个艾泽拉斯最著名的乐队了！"
G["The Tauren Chieftains play on this stage at the top of every hour. Show some energy: Cheer the minstrels on to capture some of the event's intensity!"]="牛头人酋长每小时都会登台表演一次。提起精神来吧，让吟游诗人激发他们的灵感，将这盛会吟唱成令人难忘的诗篇！"
G["The Tavern serves to those who do not ask too many questions."]="迷雾酒肆只为话少的宾客服务。"
G["The Temple Priests are too frightened to face the truth..."]="祭司们害怕面对真相……"
G["The Temple of the Moon is home to the priests of Elune.  There you will find Jandria and Lariia, who will provide you with further guidance in the path of priesthood."]="月神殿是艾露恩的祭司们的家园。你会在那儿找到贾德莉亚和拉瑞亚，她们会对你的牧师生涯做出进一步的指导。"
G["The Terrace is just up the hill here. Stay on your guard; few visitors have returned."]="平台就在山上。多加小心，访客几乎全都有去无回。"
G["The Thandol Span fell to Ragnaros.  So shall the Stonewrought Dam!"]="以拉格纳罗斯之名，萨多尔大桥已经被摧毁了，接下来就是巨石水坝！"
G["The Thorium Brotherhood Fall Catalogue:\n\nInside you will find the hottest deals on all of your adventuring needs! We'll even show you where to pick up those difficult to find components and supplies."]="瑟银兄弟会的目录：\n\n你可以从中找到所有你冒险必需的最强装备！我们还将告诉你到哪儿去收集这些材料。"
G["The Thorium Brotherhood does not waste time on ants. Be gone!"]="瑟银兄弟会是不会在蚂蚁身上浪费时间的。快滚开！"
G["The Thorium Brotherhood possesses the knowledge required to make the sacred arms and armaments of the Fire Lord, but we lack the manpower to obtain the materials required for the crafting.\n\nI, Lokhtos Darkbargainer, have been empowered by the Brotherhood to exchange the exalted recipes for materials gathered from the Molten Core.\n\nPresent your offer, $r."]="瑟银兄弟会懂得如何制造炎魔之王的神圣武器，但是我们缺乏人力，无法获得制造武器所需的材料。\n\n我，罗克图斯·暗契，兄弟会赋予我强大的力量，用珍贵的药方来交换从熔火之心收集的材料。\n\n给个价吧，$r。"
G["The Threads of Fate in western Dalaran is the city's most popular supplier of clothing and cloth armor."]="达拉然西部的命运丝线是城里最受欢迎的裁缝物品和布甲商店。"
G["The Thunder Bluff Bank can be found on the lower rise."]="你可以在中心高地上找到雷霆崖银行。"
G["The Thunder Bluff riders are massive and powerful combatants, terrifying at close range.\n\nTry to stay out of their defense-crushing Thrust range, breaking down their defenses with Shield-Breakers before risking a Charge."]="雷霆崖的骑兵是魁梧而强壮的战士，近身战时能爆发出可怕的威力。\n\n他们的刺击势如破竹，你要尽量拉远彼此的距离，并在发起冲锋前使用碎盾打破他们的防御。"
G["The Thunder Forge has begun to charge an area nearby.  Run into it to |cFFFF2222|Hspell:139397|h[Overcharge]|h|r yourself!"]="雷霆熔炉开始为附近的一块区域充能。跑进这个区域将使你|cFFFF2222|Hspell:139397|h[过载]|h|r！"
G["The Thunder Forge is ours!  We will defend it with our lives!"]="雷霆熔炉是我们的！我们要用生命来捍卫它！"
G["The Thunder King built a palatial fortress on the borders of his empire. We should see it soon..."]="他在帝国边境上建立了一座宏伟的要塞。我们很快就能看见了……"
G["The Thunder King took within himself the powers of a Titan keeper. We must take them back!"]="雷电之王窃取了泰坦守护者的力量。我们得将它夺回来！"
G["The Thunder King will rise again!"]="雷电之王将再次崛起！"
G["The Thunder King wills it; it shall be done."]="雷电之王的旨意必将实现。"
G["The Thunder King! What a magnificent individual."]="雷电之王！多么强大的存在！"
G["The Thunder King's palace lies ahead. We must secure a foothold on the island before we can assault his fortress."]="雷电之王的宫殿就在前面。在发动进攻前，我们必须在岛上建立一个据点。"
G["The Thunderbrews run a fine Inn in Kharanos which bears their name.  Stop in for a pint and a bit of rest."]="雷酒家族在卡拉诺斯开了一家旅店，久负盛名。在那里喝杯酒休息一下吧。"
G["The Tian Monastery taught me how to focus my energies so tightly that I could tap a keg using only my pinky finger."]="天禅院教会了我如何凝聚自己的力量，现在我只用一根小拇指就能点开一个酒桶。"
G["The Tidehunter will fall."]="猎潮者必败。"
G["The Tiger Gourami will be found near the pagoda of Shado-pan Monastery... here, in Kun-Lai Summit. \n\n<Ben marks a spot on your map.>"]="Los guramis tigre se hallan cerca de la pagoda del Monasterio del Shadopan... aquí, en la Cima Kun-Lai.\n\n<Ben marca un punto en tu mapa.>"
G["The Timberlings have made it too difficult for the fishermen to catch anything around Dolanaar.  You best look for someone to train you in Darnassus."]="林精使渔民在多兰纳尔很难有所收获。你最好去达纳苏斯找找他们。"
G["The Timbermaw furbolgs."]="木喉熊怪"
G["The Titans had long since vacated this world. Only the night elves that once inhabited this area were here to defend. Oh my! The next passage is fascinating!"]="泰坦们离开艾泽拉斯世界已经很久了。惟有曾经居住在这片土地上的暗夜精灵还在守卫着他们的家园。天哪！接下来这一段真令人着迷！"
G["The Titans! It would seem the mogu salvaged and repurposed ancient Titan technology to advance their empire!"]="泰坦……？看来魔古族篡改了古代泰坦技术，并以此发展壮大他们的帝国！"
G["The Tomb of Conquerors is directly below you. Follow the dirt path to the entrance. You must hurry!"]="征服者陵墓就在你的正下方。沿着这条土路就能找到入口。动作快！"
G["The Torn-heart men give their weapons to Earthmender Torlok."]="欧鲁诺克·裂心等人把他们的武器交给了大地治愈者托洛克。"
G["The Trade District is secured!  Now, secure the rest of the city!"]="贸易区守住了！现在，守住城市的其它部分！"
G["The Trade Prince will hear about this, $n!"]="贸易大王会知道的，$n！"
G["The Trade Prince's yacht is about to set sail. Everyone, get to the dock! Hand over the keys, boss. I'm driving. Just let me know when you're ready to go."]="El yate del Príncipe mercante está a punto de zarpar. ¡Todos a los muelles! Dame las llaves $gjefe:jefa;. Conduzco yo. Tú solo infórmame cuando quieras zarpar."
G["The Trial of the Grand Crusader is a more difficult version of the Trial of the Crusader. Each encounter is more difficult, and you will not be able to freely attempt the encounters until you win. After 50 unsuccessful attempts, the Trial of the Grand Crusader will end for the week. After successfully completing the Trial of the Grand Crusader, you will receive an additional tribute chest of rewards as compensation. Are you prepared for this trial?"]="大十字军的试炼比十字军的试炼更加困难。这里的每一个敌人都会变得更强大。而且你无法为自己挑选敌人，除非你们曾经战胜过他们。如果在这周之内，你们进行了50次不成功的尝试，就只能等到下周再继续大十字军的试炼了。在成功地完成大十字军的试炼之后，你们将获得另一个宝物匣。现在，是否已经为这一试炼做好了准备？"
G["The True Horde WILL come to pass.  I have SEEN it.  IT HAS SHOWN ME. I HAVE SEEN MOUNTAINS OF SKULLS AND RIVERS OF BLOOD.  AND I WILL...HAVE...MY...WORLD!"]="正统部落必将诞生。我看到了。它让我看到了。我看到尸山血海。我将……拥有……我的……世界！"
G["The True Horde takes what it wants!"]="正统部落掌控一切！"
G["The Twilight Cult seeks to undo everything we fight to preserve. It is our sworn duty to prevent this calamity from coming to pass, $r."]="暮光教派仇视一切我们珍视的东西。我们发誓要尽一切努力保卫这里，不让他们造成的灾祸将这里毁灭，$r。"
G["The Twilight Curse is shifting Go'el between elemental states! Before he vanished, he took on the aspect of water. We must hurry to him..."]="暮光诅咒正在将古伊尔转换到另一种元素形态！在消失前，他进入了水元素位面。我们必须赶过去……"
G["The Twilight Documents go flying through the air!"]="暮光文件飞散开了！"
G["The Twilight Dragonkin must be stopped! Rescue the other Red Dragonflight and we shall assist you!"]="一定要阻止暮光巨龙！请救出其他红龙。我们会帮助你的！"
G["The Twilight Prophet knows that YOU - and you alone - are our final obstacle. He's sent ME to remove you from the game."]="暮光先知已经洞察到你——只有你——是我们最后的阻碍……于是他派我来送你退场。"
G["The Twilight's Hammer has agents everywhere! Kill me and a dozen take my place!"]="暮光之锤的耳目无所不在！杀了我，马上会有无数人接替我的工作！"
G["The Twilight's Hammer has most certainly uncovered something of interest up at the Masters' Gate.\n\nPerhaps a $g skilled : lovely; $c such as yourself would help me with that?"]="暮光之锤极有可能在真主之门那里有了什么新发现。\n\n也许像你这么$g能干的:可爱的;$c刚好能帮帮我？"
G["The Twilight's Hammer has unearthed a titan Waygate and it appears that they're attempting to activate it."]="暮光之锤挖出了泰坦界门，而且似乎正在试图激活它。"
G["The Twilight's Hammer invaded these once-pristine waters, and the surrounding lands, a short time ago.\n\nThey have polluted my loch and I would have them gone so that I may purify it once more."]="不久之前，暮光之锤侵入了这片曾经质朴清澈的水域和它周围的岛屿。\n\n他们污染了我的湖水。我要彻底驱逐他们，这样我才能净化这片湖泊。"
G["The Twilight's Hammer is a major power to be reckoned with.  Thanks to us, Deathwing is free.  Thanks to us, Old Gods have risen from the bowels of the earth.  Thanks to us... Hyjal burns.\n\nWhat do you think you have to offer us?"]="暮光之锤是起决定性作用的力量。因为我们，死亡之翼自由了。因为我们，上古之神从大地深处重生。因为我们……海加尔在燃烧。\n\n你觉得你能为我们做什么？"
G["The Twilight's Hammer is more than an organization to me.  It's a family.\n\nAs such, I take great care in making sure no unworthy candidates make it past the training phase."]="暮光之锤对我来说不仅仅是个组织。它就像是我的家。\n\n所以，我严加小心以确保不会有人滥竽充数地通过训练。"
G["The Twilight's Hammer is retreating! The temple is ours; fortify your positions within!"]="暮光之锤撤退了！我们夺回了神殿；进入神殿，稳固防守。"
G["The Twilight's Hammer is the instrument of this grand destruction, the method of glorious annihilation! (Tear aside the veil! Open your mind to emptiness!) Through us will you find true power."]="暮光之锤是带来伟大毁灭的造物，是让一切化为虚无的荣耀之光！（别再迷茫了！向虚无敞开你的心智吧！）真正的力量就在我们手中！"
G["The Twilight's Hammer returns."]="暮光之锤的人冲过来了。"
G["The Twilight's Hammer will pay for what they've done."]="暮光之锤将为他们所做的一切付出代价。"
G["The Twilight's Hammer will rise again! The very earth beneath your feet will be swallowed by the fury of our resurgence!"]="暮光之锤将再次崛起！你们脚下的大地将被我们复苏时的怒火吞噬！"
G["The Twilight's Hammer!"]="暮光之锤！"
G["The Twilight's Hammer...fascinating. They are within your \"Dire Maul\"?"]="Los del Martillo Crepuscular... fascinante. ¿Están dentro de esa \"La Masacre\"?"
G["The Twilight's Hammer: happy to serve local nefarious schemes anytime, anywhere. And today is no exception! Our final combatant hails from the not so distant Bastion of Twilight! Or is it the Twilight Bastion... bah, who cares!"]="暮光之锤：随时随地愿意为实现各种邪恶计划出力，今天也不例外！我们的终极战士向大家致敬！他们来自不远处的暮光堡垒……或者那是暮光城堡……管他呢，谁会在乎这个！"
G["The Twilight's Hammer?! Where are they?"]="暮光之锤？！他们在哪儿？"
G["The Twisting Nether's coldest reaches shall not hide you from my vengeance."]="就算你逃到扭曲虚空最寒冷的边缘，也躲不过我复仇的怒火。"
G["The U.D.E.D. dispenser rumbles at you expectantly."]="D16限时炸弹分配器发出轰鸣声。"
G["The Undercity belongs to the Horde once more! LOK'TAR!"]="部落夺回了幽暗城！LOK'TAR！"
G["The Undercity riders are a tenacious lot, relying heavily on their defenses and steadfastly trading blows with their opponents, strike for strike.\n\nTrying wearing them down with Charges while maintaining your own Defense... meet them with a defensive advantage so that they will suffer the most with each exchange."]="幽暗城的骑兵是一群坚韧的勇士，他们擅长防御与持久作战。\n\n你应该在维持自身防御的前提下使用冲锋把他们累得趴下……只要你能保持防御优势，他们就会在对战中承受较大的伤害。"
G["The Underhold has been breached! Get to the Shredders, and tear these interlopers to pieces!"]="地下堡垒被攻破了！快去开动切割者，把这些入侵者撕成碎片！"
G["The Unstable Mur'ghoul is about to explode!"]="不稳定的行尸鱼人要爆炸了！"
G["The Usurpers abandoned you."]="篡位者抛弃了你。"
G["The Val'kyr are attacking! Take cover!"]="瓦格里来进攻了！注意掩蔽！"
G["The Val'kyrs'  teamwork is rather astounding. I now see why we had such problems capturing the two of them."]="瓦格里的团队协作能力真是令人震惊。现在我终于明白，为什么只是抓住两只瓦格里就会如此困难。"
G["The Vale empowers me."]="山谷赋予我力量。"
G["The Vale is my home. It is my duty and my desire to protect it from harm."]="锦绣谷是我的家园，保护它免遭侵犯既是我的责任，亦是我的愿望。"
G["The Vale is peaceful. Too peaceful."]="锦绣谷很平静。太平静了。"
G["The Vale of Eternal Blossoms is in great danger, $r.\n\nGarrosh Hellscream has tainted the waters of our sacred Vale with the Heart of Y'Shaarj, a dark relic from an ancient evil. The effects of his act... well... you can see them for yourself here in the Vale.\n\nNow, remnants of the sha threaten our very existence. We have no choice but to fight."]="锦绣谷正处于危难当中，$r。\n\n加尔鲁什·地狱咆哮用一件来自上古邪神的黑暗神器——亚煞极之心污染了这座圣谷中的水流。而他的恶行所造成的后果……呃……你也已经看见了。\n\n现在，煞魔余孽已经威胁到了我们的生存。我们别无选择，必须战斗。"
G["The Vale of Eternal Blossoms.\n\nWho could have imagined the warchief was capable of destroying such a beautiful place.\n\nThe Golden Lotus feared that one day the mogu would retake this land, but it would seem they underestimated the depths of Garrosh's pride."]="锦绣谷。\n\n谁能想到，酋长竟然忍心摧毁如此美丽的地方。\n\n金莲教总担心有朝一日，魔古族会重新占领这里。看来他们是低估了加尔鲁什的狂妄程度。"
G["The Vale was once the seat of power of the great mogu empire. The time of the mogu reign was terrible, cruel, and bloody."]="锦绣谷曾是伟大的魔古帝国的权力中心。魔古族统治的时代非常恐怖、残酷和血腥。"
G["The Vale will never fall into mogu hands!"]="锦绣谷永远不会陷入魔古族手中！"
G["The Valley of Honor"]="荣誉谷"
G["The Valley of Honor has been secured!"]="荣誉谷守住了！"
G["The Valley of Honor's bank is just before the gate to The Drag."]="荣誉谷的银行就在通向暗巷区的大门前面。"
G["The Valley of Strength"]="力量谷"
G["The Valley of Strength is Horde again! This pathetic attack on Orgrimmar will be crushed.  For the Horde!"]="部落夺回了力量谷！进攻奥格瑞玛的可怜把戏必将覆灭。为了部落！"
G["The Valley of Strength's bank is south of the entrance to Grommash Hold, northwest of the main gate."]="力量谷的银行就在格罗玛什要塞入口处的南边。主大门的西北方。"
G["The Valley of Trials will temper even the weakest into a warrior worthy to join the Horde. Those who cannot rise to its tests will be left to bake in the scorching desert sun."]="试炼谷能将最软弱的新兵锻炼成一名合格的部落战士。无法通过试炼者将被抛弃，独自忍受骄阳的煎烤。"
G["The Vault in Ironforge is the closest bank ye'll find in these parts."]="铁炉堡银行是这一带最近的银行。"
G["The Vector Coil is massive. I hope we have more than one abomination guarding the numerous weak points."]="矢量感应器非常巨大。我希望我们能有更多的畸变者去看守其它几个弱点。"
G["The Vegetron 4000 is recharging, try again later."]="维加特隆4000正在充能，请稍后再试。"
G["The Veiled Stair is under Madam Goya's protection."]="雾纱栈道在郭雅夫人的保护之下。"
G["The Veiled Stair will soon be ours again!"]="隐秘阶梯很快就会回到我们手里！"
G["The Venture Company based around Windshear Crag in Stonetalon keeps their supplies in locked boxes."]="以石爪山脉狂风峭壁为基地的风险投资公司将他们的物资存储在带锁的箱子里。"
G["The Vermillion Redoubt is our base of operations here in the Twilight Highlands.\n\nFrom this perch we can supervise the assault on Grim Batol and the cleansing of the river valley below."]="朱红庇护所是我们在暮光高地上的行动基地。\n\n我们可以从这个制高点监督对格瑞姆巴托的进攻，以及对下方河谷的清扫行动。"
G["The Verne has docked. All aboard!"]="凡尔纳号已经到达。全体登船！"
G["The Verne will be arriving shortly! Get your gear and form up, boys!"]="凡尔纳号很快就要到了！拿起武器整队备战，兄弟们！"
G["The Violet Citadel"]="紫罗兰城堡"
G["The Violet Hold"]="紫罗兰监狱"
G["The Violet Hold, prison for the enemies of the Kirin Tor, is in southeast Dalaran."]="紫罗兰监狱位于达拉然东南部，用于关押肯瑞托法师议会的敌人。"
G["The Vision of Deathwing fixates on Wrathion, heal him!"]="死亡之翼的幻影锁定了拉希奥，快为他治疗！"
G["The Voice of Ramkahen casts its vote in favor of war as well."]="拉穆卡恒之声同样赞成发动战争。"
G["The Void Binder can be found in the Ethereal Corridor, just upstairs and to the right as you enter the building."]="你可以在天界回廊中找到虚空契约者，进门后上楼右转就是。"
G["The Void Binder can be found in the Hall of Secrets, just upstairs and to the right as you enter the building."]="你可以在秘语大厅中找到虚空契约者，进门后上楼右转就是。"
G["The Void... beckons."]="虚空……在召唤。"
G["The Vortex Pinnacle, a level 82-84 dungeon in Uldum, is now available for initial testing. The dungeon is a work in progress. Please be in your full group before teleporting to the dungeon.\nTo leave the Vortex Pinnacle, you must teleport out with a Hearthstone or similar method. If you die and release, you should teleport back from this NPC."]="La Cumbre del Vórtice, una mazmorra de nivel 82-84 en Uldum, ya está disponible para las pruebas iniciales. La mazmorra es un trabajo en curso. Forma un grupo completo antes de teletransportarte a la mazmorra.\n\nPara abandonar La Cumbre del Vórtice, debes teletransportarte con una piedra de hogar o algún método similar. Si mueres y liberas, deberías volver mediante este PNJ."
G["The Vrykul storage facility is up in flames! Dragonflayer defenders have been alerted!"]="维库人的仓库燃起了熊熊烈焰！掠龙防御者已经被惊动了！"
G["The Wailing Caverns has its entrance at the Lushwater Oasis southwest of Crossroads in the Barrens."]="哀嚎洞穴的入口就在贫瘠之地十字路口西南边的甜水绿洲。"
G["The Wakener may prove useful. One way or another."]="唤醒者也许会有用武之地。不论是以哪种方式。"
G["The Wanderer's Festival is tonight. Are you coming?"]="今晚就是云游节了。你要来参加吗？"
G["The War Serpent will not travel beyond the Jade Temple Grounds! Return before you are tossed off!"]="作战翔龙是不能飞出青龙寺庭院的！在你被扔下来之前赶紧回去！"
G["The Warchief brings change that will bring the Horde victory!  Look for Swart inside the barracks on the east side of town."]="酋长进行的变革将帮助部落取得胜利！去城镇东边的兵营找斯瓦特吧。"
G["The Warchief demands results on your research."]="酋长要看你们的研究成果。"
G["The Warchief demands that this shore is secured! When the Alliance makes its move, the tides will run red with their blood!"]="酋长下令严守这片海滩！一旦联盟采取行动，他们的鲜血将染红海水！"
G["The Warchief has instructed me to study all kinds of weapons and armor. He has sent me here to the hub of both the tauren and orc cultures in the Barrens to meet as many travelers as possible, and to learn about the cultures of the Barrens.\n\nHe feels there's something to be learned from even the most pathetic of cultures... like the quilboar or centaur."]="酋长指示我学习各种武器和护甲知识。他把我派遣到这兽人和牛头人文明的集合之地，接触尽可能多的旅行者，学习整个贫瘠之地的文明。\n\n他认为即使是最未开化的文明也有值得学习的地方——比如野猪人和半人马。"
G["The Warchief has learned there's a connection between the Mogu and these creatures."]="酋长发现魔古族与这些生物密切相关。"
G["The Warchief has ordered an invasion of the Hellfire Citadel, and we're starting with these exposed ramparts."]="酋长已经下令攻击地狱火堡垒，我们就从外面这些城墙开始。"
G["The Warchief has promised to help us rescue our people and deal with Gallywix if we help them with the Alliance.\n\nIt sounds like a fair deal to me. The enemy of my friend is my enemy, right?"]="酋长会帮助我们保卫我们的族人，对付加里维克斯。只要我们帮助他们对付联盟。\n\n听上去，这是一笔公平的交易。我的朋友的敌人就是我的敌人，对不对？"
G["The Warchief ignored my council. I discovered he was building a compound beneath the caverns of Ragefire."]="酋长无视了我的议会。我发现他在怒焰裂谷的洞穴下造了个基地。"
G["The Warchief is caging all the dissidents. Even us orcs!"]="酋长把所有不同政见者都关押了起来，包括我们兽人！"
G["The Warchief of the Horde, Thrall, and Overlord Garrosh Hellscream have arrived upon the tournament grounds! Clear the way to the entrance!"]="部落的酋长萨尔和督军加尔鲁什·地狱咆哮已经来到比武场！让路！"
G["The Warchief rewards the loyal."]="酋长会奖赏你的忠诚。"
G["The Warchief shall make quick work of you, mortals. Prepare yourselves!"]="酋长会除掉你的，凡人。做好准备吧！"
G["The Warchief should've never crossed the Darkspear. He tore the Horde apart."]="酋长真不该去惹暗矛部族。他害得部落四分五裂了。"
G["The Warchief will annihilate his enemies!"]="酋长之敌必亡！"
G["The Warchief will have your blood!"]="酋长会让你们血流成河！"
G["The Warchief will hear of this betrayal!"]="酋长必将发现这次背叛！"
G["The Warchief won't be pleased. He is wasting valuable troops fending off their pathetic rebellion."]="酋长会生气的。他把宝贵的军队都拿来抵御那些可悲的起义军了。"
G["The Warchief's zeppelin is in flames! It's going down!"]="酋长的飞船着火了！开始坠落了！"
G["The Watchers are the Timewalkers' scholars and scouts, researchers and spies.\nWe watch the timeways and record, investigate, and report temporal tampering and unusual phenomena.\nIt was a Watcher, of course, that brought the Timewalkers' attention to this bizarre, timeless isle."]="Los vigías somos los eruditos de los Caminantes del Tiempo, pero también exploradores, investigadores y espías.\n\nObservamos las líneas temporales y anotamos, investigamos e identificamos manipulaciones temporales o fenómenos inusuales.\n\nHuelga decir que fue un vigía el que llamó la atención de los Caminantes del Tiempo sobre esta extraña Isla Intemporal."
G["The Water of the Seers is ready for your consumption, $n."]="先知之水已经为你准备好了，$n。"
G["The Waterlord Hydraxis hides off in Azshara, on an island in the Bay of Storms.  What kind of threat can the fool muster from there?"]="海达克西斯公爵躲到了艾萨拉风暴海湾的某个岛屿上。那些家伙能有什么威胁？"
G["The Wayfarer's Rest Tavern is located between the Walk of Elders and the Bazaar. You can reach it from either location."]="旅者的梦乡位于长者步道和花园街市之间，你可以从任一方向走到那里。"
G["The Wayfarer's Rest tavern."]="旅者的梦乡。"
G["The Weavers are arcanists who specialize in chronomancy; the art of weaving time.\nAmongst the Timewalkers, we alone can repair damage to the timeways, open temporal portals, and other such tasks.\nThese things once came easily to the bronze dragonflight, but alas, no longer."]="Los tejedores somos arcanistas especializados en cronomancia, el arte de tejer el tiempo.\n\nDentro de los Caminantes del Tiempo, solo nosotros somos capaces de reparar el daño de las líneas temporales, abrir portales en el tiempo y tareas similares.\n\nAntes era algo natural para el Vuelo Bronce, pero por desgracia ya no es así."
G["The Weeping Souls may be frightening, but they are somewhat predictable. Lure them into the rune traps spread across the ground."]="泣灵也许很可怕，但它们的行动在某种程度上还是可以预期的。将它们引诱进铺设在地面上的符文陷阱里。"
G["The West Frostwolf Tower is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Alliance will destroy it!"]="西侧霜狼哨塔受到攻击！如果我们不尽快采取措施，联盟会摧毁它的！"
G["The West Frostwolf Tower is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Horde will destroy it!"]="西侧霜狼哨塔受到攻击！如果我们不尽快采取措施，部落会摧毁它的！"
G["The West Frostwolf Tower protects the gate between Frostwolf Village and Frostwolf Keep.\n\nIt is controlled by neither side."]="西侧霜狼哨塔保护着霜狼村和霜狼要塞之间的大门。\n\n联盟和部落还在争夺这片土地。"
G["The West Frostwolf Tower protects the gate between Frostwolf Village and Frostwolf Keep.\n\nIt is controlled by the Alliance."]="西侧霜狼哨塔保护着霜狼村和霜狼要塞之间的大门。\n\n联盟控制着这片土地。"
G["The West Frostwolf Tower protects the gate between Frostwolf Village and Frostwolf Keep.\n\nIt is controlled by the Horde."]="西侧霜狼哨塔保护着霜狼村和霜狼要塞之间的大门。\n\n部落控制着这片土地。"
G["The West Frostwolf Tower was destroyed by the Alliance!"]="西侧霜狼哨塔被联盟摧毁了！"
G["The West Frostwolf Tower was taken by the Horde!"]="西霜狼哨塔被部落占领了！"
G["The West Spire has been destroyed!"]="西部尖塔被摧毁了！"
G["The West Spire has been heavily damaged!"]="西部尖塔受到了重创！"
G["The Western Graveyard has been captured by the Alliance!"]="联盟夺取了西部墓地！"
G["The Western Graveyard has been captured by the Horde!"]="部落夺取了西部墓地！"
G["The Western Pylon accepts red, green, and blue crystals.\n\nThe Pylon focuses on the energy that can be created using red crystals as the main source of power. There are two possible effects: one that increases your protection from damage, and one that weakens an enemy's defenses.\n\nCrystal Ward requires red and green crystals. This will provide you with an increase to armor.\n\nCrystal Yield requires blue and red crystals. This can lower the armor of a specific target."]="西方的水晶塔接受红色，绿色和蓝色的水晶。\n\n塔门关键是要用红色水晶作为力量源泉而产生的能量。可能有两种结果：一种能提高你的防御力，而另一种则是削弱敌人的防御。\n\n防御水晶需要红色和绿色的水晶。这将会使你的装甲更完备。\n\n破甲水晶需要蓝色和红色的水晶。这将会削弱即定目标的装甲防御。"
G["The Westspark siege workshop has been attacked by the Alliance!"]="联盟正在进攻西部火花车间！"
G["The Westspark siege workshop has been attacked by the Horde!"]="部落正在进攻西部火花车间！"
G["The Westspark siege workshop has been captured by the Alliance!"]="联盟占领了西部火花车间！"
G["The Westspark siege workshop has been captured by the Horde!"]="部落占领了西部火花车间！"
G["The Wickerman Festival now begins!  Power to the Forsaken!"]="稻草人节日开始了！愿被遗忘者的力量永存！"
G["The Wickerman festivities will begin in ten minutes!  Join us in the Ruins of Lordaeron courtyard to celebrate Hallow's End and our liberation from the Scourge!"]="稻草人庆典将在10分钟后开始！快来洛丹伦废墟的庭院里庆祝万圣节，庆祝我们摆脱亡灵天灾，获得自由！"
G["The Wickerman festivities will begin in ten minutes! Please join us just outside the gates of Stormwind City and celebrate Hallow's End!"]="稻草人庆典将在10分钟后开始！请加入我们在暴风城大门外的狂欢，一同庆祝万圣节吧！"
G["The Widow Greenpaw is NOT a witch. She just makes very lifelike jade statues."]="寡妇绿爪可不是巫婆。只是她做的青玉雕像非常逼真罢了。"
G["The Wild Cloudrider senses its freedom!"]="野生的穿云翔龙发现它自由了！"
G["The Wildhammer High Shaman is finished. Count up our dead. Bloodgulch will want to hear of our triumph!"]="那个蛮锤高阶萨满祭司已经完了。计算一下我们的死伤。溅血谷地一定在等待着我们胜利的消息！"
G["The Wildhammer Shaman places a Resistance Totem to aid you!"]="蛮锤萨满放置了一个抗性图腾来协助你！"
G["The Wildhammer dwarves are our mortal enemy. It's them or us."]="蛮锤矮人是我们不共戴天的仇敌。不是他们死，就是我们亡。"
G["The Wildhammer dwarves might have fast steeds, but can those Aerie Peak gryphons stand the heat of The Great Forge?  I think not!"]="蛮锤城堡的矮人也许有奔跑迅速的战马，但是这些鹰巢山的狮鹫能承受大熔炉的热量吗？我觉得不能！"
G["The Wildhammer horn falls from Kurdran's unconscious body!"]="蛮锤号角从库德兰的身上掉落下来！"
G["The Wildhammers have always embraced shamanism, aye, but to find ourselves beneath the sea as part of the Earthen Ring?\nIt would've taken more than a few tankards for me to believe that one, a year ago."]="Los Martillo Salvaje siempre han abrazado el chamanismo, sí, ¿pero acabar bajo el mar como parte del Anillo de la Tierra?\n\nHace un año habría necesitado más que unas pocas jarras para creerme eso."
G["The Wind Rider Roost is atop the totem stairway in the center of town."]="双足飞龙巢穴就在城镇中心的图腾柱顶部。"
G["The Wind-Reaver will not accompany you on this task, Wakener. His talents are needed elsewhere."]="掠风者不会陪你执行这项任务，唤醒者。他的才华另有它用。"
G["The Windblades rush to aid their trapped ally!"]="风刃火速前往救助他们被困的盟友！"
G["The Winterfall furbolg that reside here in Winterspring were once our allies... But one day, that all changed.\n\nDriven by the strange demands of their high chief, they began to attack all others that they came in contact with, including our tribe. They keep to themselves now..."]="居住在冬泉谷的寒水熊怪曾经是我们的盟友……但是有一天，这一切都改变了。\n\n他们听从高级首领的号令，开始攻击他们接触到的任何生物，包括我们的部族。他们现在几乎不与外界接触了……"
G["The Winterskorn tribe will prevail!"]="斯克恩部族必胜！"
G["The Wolf did not care for raptor meat."]="孤狼不喜欢恐龙肉。"
G["The Wolf found scorpid meat to be too bitter."]="蝎子肉对他来说太苦了。"
G["The Wolf had grown tired of eating boar meat."]="孤狼也吃腻了野猪肉。"
G["The Wolf ran and ran, looking for an easy meal."]="孤狼跑啊跑，寻找容易到口的食物。"
G["The Wolf was lazy, and didn't want to work for his meal."]="孤狼很懒，不想为取得食物而努力。"
G["The World's End Tavern has nothing to offer those of my kind.  However, I find that it attracts the type of clientele that are interested in what I have for sale.\n\nI specialize in exotic engineering goods acquired from far and wide.  From time to time I might even have a rare thing or two for purchase.\n\nWhat might I interest you in?"]="天涯旅店没有什么我想要的。不过，这里却能吸引许多对我在售卖的商品十分感兴趣的客户。\n\n我专门研究稀奇的工程学物品，已经获得了很大的成就。有时候，我这里可能还会有一两件奇货出售。\n\n怎么样，有什么你感兴趣的吗？"
G["The World's End Tavern may be found in the easternmost portion of the lower city."]="在贫民窟的最东面可以找到天涯旅店。"
G["The Wrestler is going to destroy the competition today."]="摔跤手要毁掉今天的比赛。"
G["The Wrestler took out my old apprentice. Now you shall be my apprentice. You smell of luck... and sweat. Most good fortune indeed!\n\nThe Wrestler is slow but strong. Do not let him grab you.\n\nAlso, his mind is weak. Use the chairs in the arena to stun him.\n\nIf you get weak, use the bucket next to me for refreshings.\n\nGood fortune to you, apprentice of grummle!"]="El Luchador acabó con mi antiguo aprendiz. Ahora tú serás mi $gaprendiz:aprendiza;. Hueles a suerte y sudor. ¡Cosas que dan buena suerte!\n\nLuchador es lento pero fuerte. No dejes que te agarre.\n\nAdemás, su mente es débil. Utiliza las sillas de la arena para aturdirlo.\n\nSi te sientes débil, utiliza el cubo junto a mí para refrescarte.\n\n¡Buena suerte para ti, $gaprendiz:aprendiza; de grúmel!"
G["The Wretched are a constant thorn in my side, $n.  When they're not being a danger to themselves by tapping unstable arcane sources to satisfy their cravings, they're cooking up half-brained schemes against our respectable society."]="$n，失心者是非常棘手的麻烦。在他们通过汲取不稳定的奥术能量满足自己对魔法的渴求、解决了嗜魔之瘾后，他们便开始挖空心思地计划对我们发动攻击，不过这帮渣滓的作战方案还真是……"
G["The Wyrmcult must be using another path. We are still finding them in Ruuan Weald."]="拜龙教肯定走了另一条路。我们仍然可以在卢安荒野看到他们。"
G["The Xuen shield bearers come down from the Temple of the White Tiger each year, $n. They could block the yaungol advance and prevent them from getting into the village. Talk to them and see if they can aid us."]="雪怒执盾手每年都会从白虎寺来到山下，$n。他们或许可以阻止野牛人的入侵，以免野牛人进入村庄。和他们谈一谈，看他们是否可以帮助我们。"
G["The Yaungol warlord shows his face! Come, let's finish this!"]="野牛人督军露脸了！来吧，让我们做个了结！"
G["The Ymirjar battle lord, Algar the Chosen, rouses his Vargul armies at the Reliquary of Pain, northeast of this cage.\n\nPrince Navarius is across the Dead Fields, east of here, near the great steps leading up to the second level of Zul'Drak.\n\nThrym's location is currently unknown, which is curious considering his size.\n\nAll must be dealt with!"]="伊米亚的战争领主，天选者奥贾尔就在东北方的痛苦之匣，准备唤醒他的瓦古大军。\n\n跨越东边的死亡旷野，你可以在通往祖达克第二层的阶梯附近找到纳瓦留斯王子。\n\n塞穆不知所踪，从体型来看，他是很难藏匿的。\n\n必须将他们统统解决！"
G["The Zandalari Dinomancer drops an Orb of Control!"]="赞达拉恐龙统领掉落了控制宝珠！"
G["The Zandalari Prophecy."]="赞达拉预言书。"
G["The Zandalari are a proud race. Their pride will ultimately be their undoing.\n\nEven the most powerful of foes have a weakness; we need only to find it."]="赞达拉是个骄傲的种族。他们的骄傲迟早会毁了他们。\n\n就算是最强大的敌人也会有弱点，我们只需要找出这个弱点就行了。"
G["The Zandalari are more cautious than I thought. Look down there - swarming with patrols."]="赞达拉比我预想得还要警觉。看下面——全是巡逻兵。"
G["The Zandalari are nothing but lap-dogs. Do you hear me? You are pets for the mogu!"]="赞达拉就是一群走狗。听懂了没？你们就是魔古族的狗！"
G["The Zandalari here practice a dark magic I am unfamiliar with. They mix arcane powers with shadow; a frightening and dangerous combination."]="这里的赞达拉巨魔在使用一种我不了解的黑暗魔法。他们将奥术力量与暗影力量混合，这种做法非常恐怖，而且危险。"
G["The Zandalari people turned to their King for help, but there was only one Zandalari equipped to help them: The prophet Zul. The prophet, and the mighty warfleet he had assembled while his King sat idle."]="赞达拉人向他们的君王求助，可只有一个人能帮他们：先知祖尔。这位先知在他的国王麻木不仁时，已经召集了一支强大的舰队。"
G["The Zandalari should never have underestimated us!"]="赞达拉决不该低估我们！"
G["The Zandalari, ancient allies of the mogu! They must seek the legendary weapon within the depths of the Vaults!"]="赞达拉——魔古族的古老盟友！他们一定在宝库深处寻找传说中的武器！"
G["The Zandalarian trolls have traveled far and suffered much to reach this place, but to do nothing... is to invite our doom..."]="赞达拉巨魔长途跋涉，历经艰险才来到此地，但是这一切却招致我们的厄运……"
G["The abomination has come! Forward!"]="憎恶来了！冲啊！"
G["The abomination has overrun the Night Watch camp! Quickly, we must intercept it before it reaches town!"]="那个憎恶已经毁灭了我们守夜人的营地！快点，我们必须在它到达城镇之前阻止它！"
G["The actions of these deserters shames us all. A shame so powerful that it must be witnessed to be understood. It is why Ug'thor is here... The boy must learn."]="逃兵的行径让我们倍感羞耻。这种耻辱感是如此强烈，你只有在亲身经历后才能有所体会。这也是乌格索来到这里的原因……他必须得到教训。"
G["The admiral and his forces pushed forward to take one of the bases you scouted for him earlier. You should go and meet them."]="将军和他的部队正要去攻取一座已经由你进行过侦查的基地。你应该去与他们汇合。"
G["The age of the night elves is coming to a close."]="暗夜精灵的时代即将终结。"
G["The ages have been cruel to you and I, my love, but be assured, it is, and at long last we are reunited."]="岁月对我和你都很残酷，我的爱人……但最后我们还是重逢了。"
G["The agony..."]="好痛苦……"
G["The air around you crackles as Khanok the Impassable appears!"]="当阻挡者卡诺克出现时，你周围的空气发出了爆裂声！"
G["The air battle rages close, $n.  Both we and the Horde send bombers into the Bombardment and the Valley of Lost Hope.  Will you enter the fray?"]="战争的阴云已经迫近，$n。我们和部落都派了轰炸机进入轰炸船和失落希望之谷。你愿意参加这次行动吗？"
G["The air crackles as a |cFFF00000|Hspell:118077|h[Lightning Storm]|h|r forms!"]="空气中响起细碎的噼啪声，形成了一个|cFFF00000|Hspell:118077|h[闪电风暴]|h|r！"
G["The air crackles with anger!"]="愤怒的空气正在爆鸣！"
G["The air crackles with electricity!"]="空气中激荡的电流噼啪作响！"
G["The air is abuzz with energy, Arch Druid. What is the status of the Forest Lord?"]="大德鲁伊，空气中充满活力。森林之王的情况怎么样？"
G["The air is so clean here."]="这里的空气真干净。"
G["The air itself freezes with the introduction of our next combatant, Icehowl! Kill or be killed, champions!"]="当下一名斗士出场时，空气都会为之冻结！它是冰吼，胜或是死，勇士们！"
G["The air teems with latent energy... quite the harvest!"]="空气中有潜藏着的能量在涌动……丰收的时候到啦！"
G["The airfield is ours, and with it, the skies over Gnomeregan."]="我们占领了机场，也掌握了制空权。"
G["The airstrip at last! Thank you, I can make my way from here. Be sure to tell Fizzcrank I'm back and safe!"]="终于能返回机场啦！谢谢你，我自己回去就行了。记得转告菲兹兰克我已经平安啦！"
G["The alchemists are located in the Court of the Sun; you'll find Camberon eager to teach you anything you might want to know about the art of brewing potions."]="炼金师们都在逐日王庭，你可以去找卡博隆，他会很热情地教你一大堆关于制造药水的知识。"
G["The alchemy lab is not quite yet ready, $n. Mar'nah says that she is $3223w percent done with its assembly, however.\n\nIf you would like to help her with that, you will find her inside the inn at the Sun's Reach Harbor."]="El laboratorio de alquimia aún no está preparado, $n. Pero Mar'nah dice que lo tiene montado al $3223w %.\n\nSi quieres ayudarle, la encontrarás dentro de la posada en el Puerto de Tramo del Sol."
G["The ale?! Why would they destroy the ale?! Monsters!"]="啤酒？！为什么他们要毁掉这些啤酒？！怪物！"
G["The altar is glowing! We have done it!"]="祭坛在发光！我们做到了！"
G["The altar is still warm from a recent ritual..."]="祭坛还是温热的，肯定刚刚举行过某种仪式……"
G["The altar seems to beckon to you as if it were alive."]="祭坛似乎在召唤你，好像它具有生命一样。"
G["The ambassador lies dead in a pool of his own gore.\n\nThrough his rent clothing, you can make out a row of enormous, deep teethmarks.\n\nEven stranger, the wounds appear to be cauterized, even charred in places."]="大使倒在血泊中。\n\n在他破烂的衣服之下，你发现一排巨大而凹深的齿印。\n\n更令人不解的是，伤口仿佛是烧蚀而成，有些地方还有焦黑的痕迹。"
G["The amber congeals to form an |cFFFF0404|Hspell:125803|h[Amber Trap]|h|r !"]="琥珀凝结后形成了|cFFFF0404|Hspell:125803|h[琥珀陷阱]|h|r！"
G["The amber offers a paragon's respite, Wakener. Should you fall near death, it will activate on its own."]="唤醒者，琥珀为英杰提供了喘息之机。如果你濒临死亡，它会自动激活。"
G["The amber protects us."]="琥珀保护着我们。"
G["The amber sustained me as I slept, but I felt its powers drain over time.\n\nIf you had not awakened me when you did, I fear I would have soon slipped into eternal sleep."]="是琥珀在我沉睡时让我继续存活，不过我能感觉到它的力量随着时间逐渐消逝。\n\n如果你刚才试图唤醒我时没有成功，我恐怕将永远无法苏醒。"
G["The amount of time Aysa spends practicing seems excessive... but you can't deny the results.  Her form is beautiful."]="艾莎花在修炼上的时间似乎太长了……但成效着实不错。她的风度十分迷人。"
G["The ancestors knew a way to confound an enemy's senses. We could use this knowledge to discover the Scourge's weakness or strike at their commanders. Without their leaders, the Scourge would fall before our warriors."]="我们的先祖懂得如何扰乱敌人的心智。我们可以利用这种能力找出天灾军团的弱点，或是杀死他们的指挥官。没有了首领的指挥，天灾军团很快就会败下阵来。"
G["The ancient Altar of Hakkar stands silently near the entrance to the room.\n\nLooking to the balconies above it, you notice a large serpent-like statue rests on each. The statues look very much like the ones on the altar before you. They must be related in some way..."]="古老的哈卡祭坛静静地矗立在房间的入口处。\n\n你注意到阳台上有一尊巨大的毒蛇雕像立在那儿。它看上去跟祭坛上的雕像非常相似。它们之间一定有什么联系……"
G["The ancient chest is covered in dust..."]="古老的箱子布满灰尘……"
G["The ancient cipher falls to the ground."]="古代密码表落到了地上。"
G["The ancient machine goes haywire! All constructs become |cffFF0000|Hspell:118041|h[Overcharged]|h|r!"]="上古机器发生故障了！所有部件都发生了|cffFF0000|Hspell:118041|h[超载]|h|r！"
G["The ancient tomes are always found near inscription trainers."]="你可以在铭文训练师附近找到这种古老的书册。"
G["The ancient vaults of the mogu, untouched by time for thousands of years, who knows what secrets await?"]="魔古族的古老地宫，数千年来封存未动，谁知道里面有什么秘密？"
G["The anguish of ten-thousand years awaits any foolish enough to don the Ancient Armor of the Kvaldir. Beware the mist and fog, mortals; for with them comes your end."]="那些试图穿上克瓦迪尔的上古甲胄的蠢货将会尝到无尽的痛苦。凡人，当心这片迷雾，你很可能丢掉性命。"
G["The anguish will creep up on you."]="痛苦将悄悄降临到你身上。"
G["The animal looks confused."]="这只动物看上去有点困惑。"
G["The answer I seek eludes me...\n\nSometimes $c, one must step back from the trees in order to see the forest."]="我一直找不到答案……\n\n$c，有时候你必须后退几步，才能看到整片森林。"
G["The answer is still no, Grok.  You can't go up."]="回答仍然是不，葛罗克。你不能去上面。"
G["The answer is yes in here, I don't see why it would be any different out there."]="我这里的答案是肯定的，到你那里就不知道了。"
G["The answer will be a yes if you let me out of here."]="如果你让我出去，我就回答“是”。"
G["The apothecaries toil day and night on a cure for the Lich King's plague.  Without them, both the Horde and the Alliance would be lost."]="药剂师们夜以继日地工作，研究治疗巫妖王诅咒的方法。没有他们，联盟和部落将丧失获胜的机会。"
G["The arakkoa are hidden... everywhere!"]="到处……隐藏着鸦人！"
G["The arakkoa can send all the assassins they have... they will meet the same fate as these!"]="鸦人会派出他们所有的刺客……不过那些刺客的命运会和这些先行者一样！"
G["The arcane only corrupts those who are weak. Even if you do not follow the path of the warlock, you would do well to remember that."]="魔法只会腐蚀那些意志薄弱的人。即便你不是术士，最好也牢记这一点。"
G["The arcane only corrupts those who are weak. Keep up on your training, or you may find a similar fate."]="魔法只会使弱者堕落。继续你的训练吧，不然你的命运就跟那些家伙相差无几了。"
G["The architecture in here is strange, differing in many ways from traditional mogu design. This room seems to be a device of some sort, but I see nothing of its purpose in my notes.  \n\nThe only way for us to figure out what this is for is to activate it and observe.\n\nWhat's the worst that could happen?"]="这里的建筑很奇怪，与传统的魔古族设计风格有很多不同之处。这个房间似乎是某种装置，但是从我的笔记上看不出它的用途。\n\n我们只有去激活它然后观察，才能弄清其用途。\n\n最糟糕的情况会是什么呢？"
G["The archmage Allistarj of the Shadowsworn was granted three. Lady Sevine, warlock of the Shadowsworn was also granted three. The remaining three were given to Grol the Destroyer, lord of the Dreadmaul ogres of these blasted lands.\n\nYou see, $n, without a soul, the body cannot be killed. The remnants of my men are now indestructible fighting units. Thankfully, they are bound in how far they can travel by the stones of binding."]="El archimago Allistarj de los Sombra Jurada tenía tres. Lady Sevine, bruja de los Sombra Jurada, también tenía asignados a tres. Los tres restantes fueron asignados a Grol el Destructor, señor de los ogros Machacamiedo de estas tierras malditas.\n\nSabes, $n, no se puede matar al cuerpo si no tiene alma. Los restos de mis hombres son ahora indestructibles unidades de lucha. Afortunadamente, la distancia que pueden recorrer está limitada por las Piedras de Vínculo."
G["The arcing bolts intensify as Onyxia's electrical charge reaches dangerous levels!"]="随着奥妮克希亚体内的电荷积聚到危险程度，电弧也在不断加强！"
G["The arena is a bit loud for my tastes, but it is worth it to witness such a spectacle."]="对我而言，竞技场有点太吵了，但能看到这么精彩的比赛还是值得的。"
G["The armies of iron will conquer all!"]="钢铁的大军将征服一切！"
G["The armies of the Alliance will march upon your bones!"]="联盟的军队将踏碎你们！"
G["The armies of the Burning Legion are attacking all across Azeroth. We need heroes to throw them back!"]="燃烧军团正在攻击整个艾泽拉斯。我们需要英雄将他们击退。"
G["The armor and weapons crafters Kradu Grimblade and Zula Slagfury may be found working at a great forge in the lower city."]="护甲和武器工匠克拉度·利刃和祖拉·熔怒在贫民窟的大熔炉那里工作。"
G["The armor of Redemption was worn by our most pious knights - armor worthy of the Lightbringer himself!\n\nThousands fell in the last war; their vestments stripped from their corpses and taken to the dread citadel of Naxxramas.\n\nIt is said that the death knights of Naxxramas corrupt the Redemption plate mail for their own use.\n\nSuch tragedy..."]="救赎护甲原本属于我们当中最虔诚的那一批圣骑士，甚至是光明使者本人也曾穿过这套护甲！\n\n可在上一次战争中，这些圣骑士们英勇抗击天灾军团，战死沙场之后，他们身上的铠甲却被敌人掠夺走，带去了恐怖之城纳克萨玛斯。\n\n据说纳克萨玛斯的死亡骑士利用污浊的力量亵渎了这批救赎护甲，并为他们的罪恶目的所用。\n\n这真是个悲剧……"
G["The art of the Windfur Punch has been handed down from generation to generation in my family since the dark days.\n\nIt is said this punch was first attempted during the dark days of the mogu empire, and aided in earning pandaren their freedom."]="打从黑暗时期开始，风裘拳击的武艺就在我的家族里代代相传。\n\n据说这套拳法最早是在魔古帝国的黑暗统治时代被发明的，在熊猫人争取自由的伟业中发挥了不小的作用。"
G["The artifact shatters as Yoth'al the Devourer gasps his last breath."]="随着吞噬者尤萨尔呼出最后一口气，这件宝物碎裂了。"
G["The artifact that Kanrethad attempted to create is incomplete."]="坎雷萨德试图制造的神器并不完整。"
G["The artifact!"]="啊，神器！"
G["The ashes from the burning wickerman radiate magical power."]="燃烧稻草人产生的灰烬散发出了魔法的力量。"
G["The ashes from the burning wickerman radiate magical power.  You have already applied the ashes to your face."]="燃烧稻草人产生的灰烬散发出了魔法的力量。你把这些灰烬抹在了脸上。"
G["The aspects!"]="是守护巨龙！"
G["The assassin with the most kills will be invited to the feast at the Overlord's table!"]="干掉最多敌人的杀手，将被邀请与领主同桌共餐！"
G["The assassins are over here! Quickly, before they reach the Magistrate!"]="刺客来了！快点阻止他们，在他们找到镇长之前干掉他们！"
G["The assault begins in but a moment!"]="进攻马上就要开始了！"
G["The assault looks like it did almost no damage at all. They're already back in formation!"]="突袭似乎毫无效果。他们又稳住阵脚了！"
G["The assistant shakes her head."]="助手摇了摇头。"
G["The assortment of images, shapes, and markings come together before your eyes. The book seems to know your skill with leatherworking and offers you a choice - but be warned - you may only select one and once you have done so, may not change your mind!:"]="无数的图象、幻影与标记同时出现在你的脑海中。这本书似乎知道你在制皮方面的技术成就一般，并给了你一个选择的机会，但是请注意，你只能选择一次！"
G["The ata'mal crystal is mine!"]="阿塔玛水晶是我的！"
G["The attackers have fled!  Strength and honor to the Horde!"]="敌人逃跑了！力量和荣誉属于部落！"
G["The attackers shall not succeed!  Strength and honor to the Horde!"]="袭击者休想前进半步！力量和荣誉属于部落！"
G["The attackers weaken!"]="攻击者被削弱了！"
G["The attacking team failed to beat the defending team's capture time! No bonus for you!"]="进攻方未能在规定时间内击败防守方！不能获得奖励！"
G["The attacks against Shattrath continued, but the city did not fall, as you can see. On the contrary, the naaru known as Xi'ri led a successful incursion into Shadowmoon Valley - Illidan's doorstep."]="对沙塔斯城的进攻持续着，但是城市并没有沦陷，就像你看到的那样。相反，那个名叫克希利的纳鲁领导了一次成功的反击，一直打到了伊利丹的家门口——影月谷。"
G["The attacks on these ships, they are clearly not random.\n\nWe must discover the motives of the naga here."]="对于这些船只的攻击显然不是偶然的。\n\n我们必须查清楚那些纳迦的动机。"
G["The auction house can be found on the central spire of Thunder Bluff.  Search near the bottom of the Windrider's Tower. May your ancestors watch over you."]="你可以在雷霆崖的中央高地找到拍卖行。在双足飞龙飞行点下方附近找找吧，愿你的先祖保佑你。"
G["The auction house is located on the second floor, on the left side of the building as you enter.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="拍卖行位于二楼，在你进入的建筑物的左侧。\n\n我会在你的地图上标记这个位置。"
G["The auction house is located on the second floor, on the right side of the building as you enter.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="拍卖行位于二楼，就在建筑物进门的右手边。\n\n我会在你的地图上标出位置。"
G["The audacity!"]="真是大胆！"
G["The aura fades away, allowing healing once more!"]="光环散去了，又可以治疗了！"
G["The aura's power begins to wane!"]="光环的力量开始减弱了！"
G["The autumn leaves must fall to make room for spring blossoms."]="秋叶必须为春花让路。"
G["The avenger snorts, clearly unimpressed."]="梅兹哼了一声，摆出心不在焉的模样。"
G["The baker is usually wandering all around the shrine. He around the main hall or out on the terrace."]="面包师通常在神殿徘徊。他徘徊在正殿周围或露台上。"
G["The balance swings in your favor, tamer."]="胜利的天平倾向了你那一边，驯宠师。"
G["The bank"]="银行"
G["The bank is located in the Trade District just northwest of the city gates. Here, let me show you on your map."]="银行坐落在贸易区，就在城门的西北面。来，让我在地图上指给你看。"
G["The bank is located in the serene city of Darnassus.  You must go there if you wish to store your possessions."]="银行位于平静的达纳苏斯城。如果你想存储自己的财物的话，就得去那儿。"
G["The bank is located on the second floor, on the left side of the building as you enter.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="银行位于二楼，就在建筑物进门的左手边。\n\n我会在你的地图上标出位置。"
G["The bank is located on the second floor, on the right side of the building as you enter.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="银行位于二楼，在你进入的建筑物的右侧。\n\n我会在你的地图上标记这个位置。"
G["The bank?  Oh, ye mean The Vault!  No safer place to store yer valuables than The Vault. Ye'll find it just northeast of the entrance to Ironforge."]="银行？哦，你是说银行！说到存储贵重物品的话，没有什么比银行更安全的地方了。它就在铁炉堡大门的东北方。"
G["The bank? It's that tower in the middle of the Trade Quarter."]="银行？就在贸易区中间的塔里。"
G["The banner!"]="旗帜！"
G["The banner's on fire!"]="旗帜着火了！"
G["The barber? She's moved shop, out of the Cleft of Shadow and into the cliffs above the Valley of Strength, where the fruit vendor used to be."]="理发师？她已经把理发店搬出暗影裂口，挪到力量谷上方的悬崖中去了。就是原来开水果店的那个地方。"
G["The barometer is falling fast. Time to start hauling gear!"]="气压计的读数迅速下滑，是时候启动牵引装置了！"
G["The barrier did not protect us.  How could this have happened?"]="屏障不起作用。怎么会这样？"
G["The barrier preventing access to the Crimson Halls has been smashed. The blood princes and their queen await our... arrival. Let's not keep them waiting.\n\nThe last barrier, preventing our access to Frostwing Halls, will be dismantled in $4939W days."]="阻挡我们进入血色厅堂的屏障已经被击破。鲜血王子们和他们的女王在等待我们的…到来。我们别让他们等太久。\n\n挡在霜翼大厅前的那最后一道屏障将在$4939W天后被摧毁。"
G["The barrier protecting the Pulsing Twilight Eggs dissipates as Sinestra harnesses their power!"]="当希奈丝特拉操纵这些脉动的暮光之卵的能量时，卵的保护屏障消失了！"
G["The barrier to the Crimson Hall be open, $g lad:lass;! I got me best gnomes workin' on gettin' the barrier to the Frostwing Halls open. Looks like it's gonna be another $4939W days! Fer now, it's probably best that you go face the blood princes and their queen!"]="血色厅堂的屏障已经击破，$g伙计:小姑娘;！我派出了最优秀的侏儒去对付霜翼大厅的屏障。看起来还要花$4939W天才能击破那里的屏障！现在，你们最好前去挑战那些鲜血王子和他们的女王！"
G["The bartender hums a tune while working."]="酒保一边工作一边哼着小曲儿。"
G["The bastion is falling! Burn the evidence!"]="碉堡正在倒塌！证物正在被烧毁！"
G["The bat handler"]="蝙蝠管理员"
G["The bat handler has his roost on the upper ring of the Trade Quarter. You can't miss the smell."]="蝙蝠管理员的架子就搭在贸易区的上层区域。远远的就会闻到那股味儿的。"
G["The battle against Deathwing's minions is your top priority, $n. But if you can help our flight with this small task, so much the better."]="与死亡之翼的爪牙战斗是你当前的首要任务，$n。可如果你能再帮我们军团一个小忙的话，那就更好了。"
G["The battle begins in 1 minute!"]="战斗将在1分钟后开始！"
G["The battle begins in 1 minute."]="战斗将在1分钟内开始。"
G["The battle begins in 2 minutes!"]="战斗将在2分钟后开始！"
G["The battle begins in 30 seconds!"]="战斗将在30秒后开始！"
G["The battle begins in 30 seconds.  Prepare yourselves!"]="战斗将在30秒内开始。做好准备！"
G["The battle for Alterac Valley has begun!"]="奥特兰克山谷的战斗开始了！"
G["The battle for Arathi Basin is a battle for resources.  Lumber, ore, food... all these are needed in order to wage a good war.\n\nDenying our enemies of their supplies is as good as killing them on the battlefield."]="阿拉希盆地的战斗是一场谋略战。木材、矿石、食物……所有这些物资对战斗来说都是必需品。\n\n销毁敌方的物资跟在战场上杀死他们一样重要。"
G["The battle for Arathi Basin is about to begin."]="阿拉希盆地的战斗即将打响。"
G["The battle for Silvershard Mines is about to begin."]="碎银矿脉的战斗即将开始。"
G["The battle for Temple of Kotmogu is about to begin."]="寇魔古寺的战斗即将开始。"
G["The battle for Twin Peaks begins in 1 minute."]="双子峰战斗将在1分钟内开始。"
G["The battle for Twin Peaks begins in 30 seconds.  Prepare yourselves!"]="双子峰战斗将在30秒内开始。做好准备！"
G["The battle for Warsong Gulch begins in 1 minute."]="战歌峡谷战斗将在1分钟内开始。"
G["The battle for Warsong Gulch begins in 30 seconds.  Prepare yourselves!"]="战歌峡谷战斗将在30秒钟内开始。做好准备！"
G["The battle for Warsong Gulch is a battle that we cannot lose.  We fight for our honor and we fight for our land, and no orc or misguided ally will take them from us!"]="战歌峡谷一役至关重要，我们必须获胜。我们为了荣誉和土地而战，兽人或是他们那些误入歧途的盟友是无法打败我们的！"
G["The battle for control of Wintergrasp will begin in 1 hour!"]="冬拥湖争夺战将在1小时后开始！"
G["The battle for control of Wintergrasp will begin in 15 minutes!"]="冬拥湖争夺战将在15分钟后开始！"
G["The battle for control of Wintergrasp will begin in 5 minutes!"]="冬拥湖争夺战将在5分钟后开始！"
G["The battle for control of Wintergrasp will begin in 5 minutes!  Prepare yourselves for batlle!"]="冬拥湖争夺战将在5分钟后开始！赶快做好战斗的准备吧！"
G["The battle for the Eye of the Storm is about to begin."]="风暴之眼的战斗即将开始。"
G["The battle for the Strand of the Ancients begins in 1 minute."]="远古海滩的战斗将在1分钟后开始。"
G["The battle for the Strand of the Ancients begins in 30 seconds.  Prepare yourselves!"]="远古海滩的战斗将在30秒后开始。做好准备！"
G["The battle for the Strand of the Ancients has ended!"]="远古海滩之战结束了！"
G["The battle for the Sunwell is but the first step on your new path, Lady Liadrin. Shattrath is open to you and all who follow you."]="太阳之井战役是你的崭新开始，女伯爵莉亚德琳。沙塔斯城欢迎你和你的追随者们。"
G["The battle for the Undercity begins now! Sound the horns of war! Champions of the Horde, be empowered by the might of your Warchief!"]="幽暗城的战斗即将打响！吹响战争的号角！部落的勇士们，接受酋长赋予你们的力量吧！"
G["The battle goes well. The Scourge forces seem weakened. I believe it will only be a matter of time before we drive them from our shores. I will turn my magics to you, to aid in this struggle."]="战役进行良好。天灾军团的实力已经被大大削弱了。我相信我们完全能够把他们都赶进海里，这只是时间问题了。我会尽可能地帮助你进行战斗。"
G["The battle has begun!"]="战斗开始了！"
G["The battle is about to begin!"]="战斗即将开始！"
G["The battle is about to begin! $n versus the ferocious clefthoof, Brokentoe!"]="战斗即将开始！$n对凶猛的裂蹄牛——断蹄！"
G["The battle is about to begin! $n vs. the vicious Dragonmaw, Torg Drakeflayer! I THINK he's vicious anyway - hard to tell. I just let him because they let us take over their old arena here. Here's hoping for some blood!"]="战斗就要开始了！$n对凶狠的龙喉兽人——“托格·掠龙者”！嗯，我想他应该是很凶狠的，虽然现在还很难说。既然他们让我们管理他们的老竞技场，我就把他放了出来。因为这里需要一些真正精彩的战斗！"
G["The battle is about to begin! Am I reading this card right? It... It's the nefarious magnataur lord, STINKBEARD! Yes, folks, STINKBEARD! $n doesn't stand a chance!"]="战斗即将开始！我没念错吧？这……这是邪恶的猛犸人领主，恶臭之须！是的，各位，是恶臭之须！$n毫无取胜的希望！"
G["The battle is about to begin! The unmerciful Murkblood twins versus $n!"]="战斗马上开始！无情的暗血双子对阵$n！"
G["The battle is ours!"]="这是我们的战斗！"
G["The battle is ours. Finally, peace..."]="战斗交给我们吧。终于迎来了安宁……"
G["The battle is over, and the people of Darrowshire are saved."]="战争结束了，达隆郡的人民得救了。"
G["The battle is over, and the people of Darrowshire are saved.\n\nThey are saved, $n, because of you.  You are truly a hero of Darrowshire."]="La batalla ha terminado, y la población de Villa Darrow está a salvo.\n\nEstán a salvo, $n, gracias a ti. Eres un auténtico héroe de Villa Darrow."
G["The battle is won! Watch as they flee to the safety of their precious temple. Soon all will be razed... Their leaders destroyed!"]="胜利了！看！它们逃进了安其拉神殿里！很快，它们的主宰也会被消灭……它们的末日不远了！"
G["The battle is won."]="我们赢得了战斗。"
G["The battle is won. For the time being, the Scourge threat has been pushed back. Our resources can be channeled into aiding you, in thanks and preparation for the future."]="战争胜利了。目前天灾军团的威胁已经被暂时消除了。我们还有一些剩余资源，如果你需要的话，我可以帮助你，以感激你做出的贡献，并为将来做准备。"
G["The battle rages, and both our captain and the captain of our enemy are slain!\n\nDrek'Thar now leads us from Frostwolf Keep, and the dwarf Vanndar Stormpike hides deep in Dun Baldar.  Defeat Vanndar and claim victory for the Horde!"]="战争形式恶化，我们的队长和敌人的队长都被杀死了！\n\n现在，德雷克塔尔领导着来自霜狼要塞的部队，而矮人范达尔·雷矛则藏在丹巴达尔。杀死范达尔，为了部落的胜利而战！"
G["The battle shifts in my favor once more."]="胜利的天平再一次倾向了我。"
G["The battle sways in my favor."]="胜利的天平倾向我了。"
G["The battle was a haze of blood, lead, and sweat. The broodmother's attacks came faster and faster!"]="这场战斗真是腥风血雨啊。母龙的攻击速度越来越快了！"
G["The battle will begin in 1 minute."]="战斗将在1分钟后开始。"
G["The battle will begin in 15 seconds."]="战斗将在15秒后开始。"
G["The battle will begin in 30 seconds."]="战斗将在30秒后开始。"
G["The battle will begin in 60 seconds."]="战斗将在60秒后开始。"
G["The battlefield is no place for a girl!"]="战场不是女孩子该待的地方！"
G["The battlemaster serving Undercity is Grizzle Halfmane - a fierce fighter in his day. He's in the Royal Quarter."]="格里兹尔是幽暗城的战场军官，他是那个年代最勇猛的战士。你可以在皇家区找到他。"
G["The battlemasters are pleased with how many are coming to compete."]="战场军官很高兴看到这么多人来参与竞赛。"
G["The battlemasters are stationed in the Royal Quarter; you'll find them around the throne room."]="战场军官都在皇家区内；你可以在王座厅四周找到他们。"
G["The battlemasters take their ease deep within the halls of the Blood Knight enclave in Farstriders' Square. While somewhat... crude, they have their redeemable traits."]="战场军官们在远行者广场的血骑士大厅深处。虽然他们有点……粗鲁，但还是有些优点的。"
G["The beacons are lit, now is the time to strike! Take one of these battle standards and plant it at the graveyard for the Alliance!"]="灯塔点亮了，是时候发动进攻了！拿上一面联盟军旗，把它插在墓地中吧！"
G["The beacons are lit, now is the time to strike! Take one of these battle standards and plant it at the graveyard for the Horde!"]="灯塔点亮了，是时候发动进攻了！拿上一面部落军旗，把它插在墓地中吧！"
G["The beacons sing to each other, outsider. Important messages are sent.\n\nYour ears will not hear the messages. Only those that the Klaxxi trust hear the words they speak."]="信标彼此呼应，外来者。传递重要的信息。\n\n你的耳朵听不见那些信息。只有赢得卡拉克西信任的人才能听到他们说的话。"
G["The bear god must be kept enfeebled so that the prophet can finish the ritual."]="必须让巨熊之神处于虚弱状态，这样先知才能完成仪式。"
G["The bear looks at you calmy and patiently, but says nothing."]="熊平静地注视着你，但是没说一句话。"
G["The bear spirit looks upon you with a calm and peaceful gaze.  You hear a voice speak to you as though it was coming from the bear, but the creature makes no indication that it is speaking.\n\n\"Greetings, my young friend.  If you have come to me seeking guidance, then perhaps I can help you find what you seek.\""]="El espíritu del oso mira hacia ti con una mirada tranquila y pacífica. Oyes una voz que se dirige a ti y que parece venir del oso, pero la criatura no hace ningún gesto.\n\n\"Saludos, joven $gamigo:amiga;. Si has venido hasta aquí buscando mi guía, quizás pueda ayudarte a encontrar lo que buscas.\""
G["The beassst will find you tasssty, sssoftsskin!"]="软皮人，你会成为那只野兽的可口点心！"
G["The beast escaped! By Gallywix's gut, it was fast!"]="以加里维克斯的黑心肠起誓，那怪兽逃得真快！"
G["The beast escaped! By Mekkatorque's moustache, it was fast!"]="怪兽逃跑了！以梅卡托克的胡子起誓，它可真快！"
G["The beast has been defeated! Hurray!"]="那个怪物被打败了！万岁！"
G["The beast has returned! It must not pollute my waters!"]="那头怪兽回来了！绝对不能让它污染我的水域！"
G["The beast is covered in oil, light him up!"]="那野兽浑身裹满了油，把他点燃！"
G["The beast is slain! All's well in Darkshire!"]="憎恶被杀死了！夜色镇安全了！"
G["The beast returns from whence it came. The wrath of Neptulon has subsided."]="这头野兽回去了，耐普图洛斯的愤怒渐渐平息了。"
G["The beast ward has fallen! Defend the council with ya lives, brothas!"]="兽神倒下了！兄弟们，誓死保卫议会！"
G["The beasts in the region all yield edible meat, $rt. Do what you can to keep the workers fed."]="附近野兽身上的肉都可食用，$rt。去找些肉来喂饱那些工人吧。"
G["The beasts of these blasted lands exhibit preternatural attributes, heretofore unseen in nature.\n\nWe have theorized that the energy which was released upon the opening of the Dark Portal, infused into their physical being and forced the creatures to evolve into their current forms.\n\nFearsome beasts they are, no doubt, but we also believe that they could prove to be quite useful in our studies.\n\nPerhaps you would be interested in assisting us in the study of these beasts, $n?"]="Las bestias de estas malditas tierras presentan atributos sobrenaturales, desconocidos hasta ahora en la naturaleza.\n\nHemos desarrollado la teoría de que la energía liberada durante la apertura del Portal Oscuro penetró en sus seres físicos y obligó a estas criaturas a evolucionar hacia su estado actual.\n\nSin duda se trata de bestias temibles, pero creemos que podrían ser muy útiles en nuestros estudios.\n\n¿No te interesaría ayudarnos en el estudio de estas bestias, $n?"
G["The beasts of this land aren't like whatever it is you have in your home. Train with me so that you may know how to properly skin them."]="这片土地上的野兽与你家乡那些截然不同。随我训练，你也许就能学会给它们剥皮的技巧。"
G["The beer's here! Drink up, boys!"]="啤酒来了！喝光它们，小伙子！"
G["The bell again, such a sweet sound."]="又听到铃声了，真好听。"
G["The bell is recharged! Strike it to weaken nearby enemies!"]="钟的力量恢复了！快敲响它，以削弱附近的敌人！"
G["The bell's screaming voice struck fear and doubt into the hearts of the Emperor's enemies, sending them fleeing in his path."]="圣钟的尖啸还能在皇帝的敌人心中植入恐惧和猜忌，让他们望风而逃。"
G["The besht part about drinking is pretending to be drunk... I'm jusht pretending guys."]="喝……喝酒的时候嗫，缀棒的就是装醉咧……，里看，我现寨就在装，像吧……"
G["The best brew in all of Pandaria is made right here in the Valley, at the Stormstout Brewery.\n\nWell, at least I think so."]="整个潘达利亚最好的酒就产自这个山谷的风暴烈酒酿造厂。\n\n嗯，至少我是这么认为的。"
G["The best defense is a good offense; anyone can tell you that."]="最好的防守就是进攻，这是尽人皆知的。"
G["The best experience is one's own."]="最好的经验就是自己的经验。"
G["The best fishing can be found down at the Anglers Wharf in southeastern Krasarang Wilds. Anyone is welcome to visit us and take up a fishing rod!"]="卡桑琅丛林东南部的渔人码头最适合垂钓了。欢迎大家来访垂钓！"
G["The best had to have been the look on Perenolde's face when our army comes marchin' right up to his front door. What a battle!"]="在我们的部队开到匹瑞诺德家门口的时候，你真该看看他的脸色。真是一场恶战！"
G["The best miner has a firm grip on $ghis:her; pick, a stout heart in $ghis:her; chest, and thick, black dust in $ghis:her; hair."]="El buen minero tiene bien agarrado su pico, un corazón fuerte en el pecho y polvo denso y negro en el pelo."
G["The best place to go for Emperor Salmon would probably be right outside the brewery here in the Valley of Four Winds. I'll mark it on your map."]="捕捉帝王鲑鱼的最佳地点或许就是四风谷的酒厂外面。我来帮你标在地图上。"
G["The best selection of smuggled goods is available right here, $n.  Great for the whole family!  Avoid goblin taxation and naaru prohibition - the Consortium is here to fill your every shopping need!"]="最上乘的走私货就在这里，$n。我的货物都是居家旅行杀人灭口的好东西。避开了地精的税收和纳鲁的禁令——星界财团会满足你方方面面的购物需求！"
G["The best war is a swift war.  The same can be said of conversation.  What say you $r?"]="最好的战术是速战速决。谈话也是一样。你想说什么，$r？"
G["The better to hear you with, my child."]="可以更好地听你说话啊，孩子。"
G["The better to own you with!"]="可以一口把你吃掉呀！"
G["The better to see you with, my child."]="Lo mejor para verte, mi $gniño:niña;."
G["The big wars might be over, for now, but we still have to keep our skills sharp!"]="虽然现在是和平时期，但是我们可不能荒废了我们的战斗技能！"
G["The bigger they are, the harder they fall."]="它们的体型越大，摔得就越惨。"
G["The biggest, juiciest, loveliest apples in the Valley! Get 'em right here!"]="四风谷里最大、最多汁、最可爱的苹果！就在这里！"
G["The binding should only take a moment, but I'll be completely entranced."]="联结应该只需片刻，但我会完全进入灵魂出窍状态。"
G["The black aspect's blood is cursed. Wherever it was shed - nothing will grow for ten thousand years."]="黑龙守护者之血受到了诅咒。但凡所溅之处，一万年都长不出任何东西。"
G["The black blood of Yogg-Saron courses through me! I. AM. UNSTOPPABLE!"]="尤格-萨隆的黑血在我的体内奔涌！我，无坚不摧！"
G["The black dragonflight will conquer all!"]="黑龙军团会征服一切！"
G["The blacksmith here works in the War Quarter, close to where his weapons will be put to use. He's there on the inner ring."]="铁匠在军事区干活，买了他们武器的人马上就可以在旁边试上一试。铁匠就在那里的内环区域。"
G["The blacksmiths all work in the crafter's hall, to the left as you enter the main building.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="铁匠一直在工匠大厅内工作，就位于你进入主建筑物时的左侧。\n\n我会在你的地图上标记这个位置。"
G["The blade and Mograine were a singular entity. Do you understand? This act corrupted the blade and lead to Mograine's own corruption as a death knight of Kel'Thuzad. I swore that if I lived, I would expose the perpetrators of this heinous crime. For two days I remained under the rot and contagion of Scourge - gathering as much strength as possible to escape the razed city."]="剑与莫格莱尼是一个整体。你能理解吗？这个令圣剑蒙羞的堕落之举最终导致了莫格莱尼自身灵魂的堕落，成为了克尔苏加德手下的一位死亡骑士。我发誓如果当时我还能动，我一定会把事件的真相公布于众。可接下来的两天，我一直被埋在了天灾军团士兵的尸体之下，并最终也受到了感染，不过这也令我能够安然离开那座被疯狂与邪恶彻底占据了的城市。"
G["The blade cuts into the Mosh'Ogg Bounty, forcing it open!"]="刀刃插进了莫什奥格的馈赠，把它打开！"
G["The blade itself had to be crafted in ceremony with the children of the Aspects. A rare occurrence indeed... For not only would a dragon have to willingly heat and mold the enchanted metal with their breath, they would also need to contain the fury of their own enchantment by using their blood as temper."]="在仪式中，必须使用守护者的后代来锻造这柄剑。真是少见啊……龙不得不锻造并为这柄剑附魔，还得牺牲自己的后代做为附魔的调和剂。"
G["The blades transform as she pulls them from Whitemane's corpse."]="当她从怀特迈恩的尸体上将刀刃拔出时，刀刃变换了。"
G["The blast of air totally dried my hair. That gives me a great idea for a spare flying machine engine!"]="该死的风把我的头发都吹干了。不过它让我有了一个关于飞行器引擎的伟大灵感！"
G["The blazing flames are safely extinguished."]="熊熊燃烧的火焰熄灭了。"
G["The blessed beast Gahz'rilla, adored pet of the Old Gods, grows larger and stronger by the day... as does the Cult of Twilight's Hammer."]="神兽加兹瑞拉——为上古之神所钟爱的灵宠，正在一天天地变得更大更强……暮光之锤教派也是如此。"
G["The blessed warmth of the sun courses through your veins!"]="让太阳温暖的祝福像暖流一般流遍你的全身！"
G["The blessing of the land be with you."]="这片土地的祝福与你同在。"
G["The blessings of Cenarius be yours, $c."]="塞纳留斯保佑你，$c。"
G["The blight slowly seeps into their bodies, gradually preparing them for their conversion."]="诅咒会逐渐侵入他们的肉体，使他们的体质发生变化。"
G["The blistering heat must have dulled my senses... mirages! All of you!"]="这滚烫的热气已经让我精神恍惚了…海市蜃楼！你们都是幻觉！"
G["The blood elf doesn't appear to be a magister, but perhaps she holds something that is the key to the tower's curse."]="那个血精灵看上去并不像一个魔导师，但是她很可能掌握着一些关于这座塔里诅咒的关键。"
G["The blood elves laid down their weapons in front of the city's defenders; their leader, a blood elf elder known as Voren'thal, stormed into the Terrace of Light and demanded to speak to A'dal."]="血精灵们在城市守卫面前放下了武器。他们的首领，一个被称为沃雷塔尔的血精灵长者，冲进了圣光广场，要求和阿达尔对话。"
G["The blood elves of Silvermoon cheer for $n."]="银月城的血精灵为$n而欢呼。"
G["The blood elves weren't prepared to fight the Korune mogu. Lotta blood elves died, but I heard you saved many survivors."]="血精灵并未做好与寇茹魔古战斗的准备。许多血精灵牺牲了，可我听说你救下了不少幸存者。"
G["The blood in my veins is now thick with toxins. I shall fear no poison ever again. Truly, I am my own masterpiece!"]="我体内的血液里流满了毒素。我再也不怕任何毒药了。我可真是自己的杰作！"
G["The blood is life... And as easily as the ebb and flow of blood is controlled, so too is the life of our enemies."]="鲜血就是生命……如果能随意掌控鲜血的奔涌，那么敌人的性命也就如同掌中玩物了。"
G["The blood is our power!"]="鲜血就是我们的力量！"
G["The blood of a thousand Alliance soldiers I shall spill... None shall stand against the might of the Ice Lord!"]="就算流尽一千名联盟士兵的鲜血……也不能战胜强大的冰雪之王！"
G["The blood of our enemies shall be spilt upon the battlefield. The great elementals shall answer our call and crush all that stand in our way."]="我们敌人的鲜血会洒落疆场的。伟大的元素会回应我们的呼唤并碾碎所有阻挡我们前进的东西。"
G["The blood of the True Horde lusts for power!"]="正统部落的血脉渴望力量！"
G["The blood of the fallen cries out for justice."]="死者的鲜血依旧在呼唤着公正的到来。"
G["The blood of the fallen was washed away by the storm and carried to Whitepetal Lake, turning the waters a deep red. With its final breath, the storm struck the center of the lake, igniting the very water itself.  The lake burned with a crimson hue for many days."]="亡者的鲜血被风暴冲刷到琼花湖，把湖水染成深红色。凭借最后一口气，风暴袭击了湖中心，点燃了湖水本身。湖水被烧了很多天，呈现出深红色。"
G["The blood red pool within the eye swirls, betraying images of a massing army of Scourge. The eye seems to pull at you, willing its way into your mind and triggering you to pull back instinctively. You feel very uneasy in the presence of this object."]="El líquido rojo sangre de dentro del ojo se mueve, mostrando imágenes de un masivo ejército de la Plaga. El ojo parece tirar de ti, abriéndose camino hacia tu mente y haciendo que te apartes instintivamente. Te sientes muy $gincómodo:incómoda; en presencia de este objeto."
G["The blood ritual is complete... and I can now see where Loramus Thalipedes awaits you."]="鲜血仪式已经完成……而且我现在能看到洛拉姆斯·萨里比迪斯正在何处等待着你。"
G["The blood ritual is complete... and I can now see where three amulets await you."]="鲜血仪式已经完成……现在我能看到有三个护符在等着你。"
G["The blood samples must be protected!  Destroy the intruders!"]="保护血液样品！摧毁入侵者！"
G["The blood we shed speaks to us. It says  \"Thank you.\""]="La sangre que derramamos nos habla. Y dice \"Gracias\"."
G["The blood we shed speaks to us. It says \"Thank you.\""]="La sangre que derramamos nos habla. Y dice \"Gracias\"."
G["The bloodhound has caught the scent.  Follow it!"]="血犬嗅到了气味，跟着它！"
G["The bloodhound has spotted a piece of parchment at the end of the trail."]="血犬在这条小路尽头找到了一页文件。"
G["The blue banners!"]="那些蓝旗子！"
G["The blue dragons themselves aren't here, but followers of Malygos are. I do not know why, but I can tell you this: wherever the blue dragons are, expect to find arcane magic. I wouldn't be surprised if the dragonspawn are here protecting something... perhaps something the Highborne left behind."]="蓝龙玛里苟斯不在那儿，但是他的信徒在。我不清楚这是怎么回事，但是我可以告诉你：蓝龙所在的地方都有希望找到神秘的魔法。如果说龙人在这儿保护某种东西的话，我是不会感到惊讶的……或许是上层精灵遗漏的物品。"
G["The blue-scaled ones have great power. They work to control Silap Inua and take it from the wide ranging peoples of the world."]="强大的蓝龙拥有操纵“希拉伊努亚”的能力，他们计划将这种力量从其他生物体内夺走。"
G["The boar is superb!"]="这猪排棒极了！"
G["The bodies hanging from the gate... something's very wrong here."]="门口悬挂着尸体……这里的情况很不对劲。"
G["The body fails... but the spirit... can endure..."]="躯体或将腐朽……但灵魂……不灭……"
G["The body is that of a female orc warrior.\n\nIt is clear that she died in battle, probably against the quilboar in the area."]="这具尸体属于一个女性兽人战士。\n\n很明显她是在战斗中死去的，或许是在对付这片地区的野猪人时死亡的。"
G["The body of the fallen dryad lies here where she lost her life to the Horde."]="这个树妖已经死亡了，显然是部落夺走了她的生命。"
G["The bodyguard grunts."]="保镖嘟囔着。"
G["The bog lords are attacking!  Help us!"]="沼泽领主正在进攻我们！救救我们！"
G["The bog lords are devouring the spore sacs!  They've got to be stopped!"]="沼泽领主正在吞食孢子囊！必须阻止它们！"
G["The bogblossom explodes, spraying pollen wildly."]="沼泽花爆炸了，猛烈地喷射着花粉。"
G["The bomb is set! Get clear!"]="炸弹即将爆炸！都让开！"
G["The bombs are set! Run to the balcony and jump to escape!"]="炸弹已经放好了！赶快跑到阳台上，跳下去！"
G["The bonds that hold me are not so permanent, $c. Pray you are not near when I have my vengeance."]="我不可能永远困在这里，$c。你最好现在就祈祷，祈祷当我复仇的时候，你不会在我面前。"
G["The bonelashers of the wastes are no laughing matter.  I hear they carry diseases!"]="白骨秃鹫可不是好对付的。我听说它们都携带着污秽！"
G["The bones side with death!"]="枯骨与死神同在！"
G["The bones side with me!"]="枯骨与我同在！"
G["The bones side with the spirits!"]="枯骨与万灵同在！"
G["The bones side with you, mon!"]="枯骨与你同在，伙计！"
G["The bones! You wretch!"]="骨头！你这蠢货！"
G["The book is your salvation, yes... but nothing will you know! NOTHING I SAY! NOTHING!"]="你说得没错，这本秘典是拯救你们的唯一希望……但是你永远无法知道真相了！我什么都不会说！"
G["The book tells of dragons uniting against another, more powerful dragon, named Deathwing. From what you can make out, the chromatic dragonflight had almost been unleashed upon the world. The Aspects were prepared."]="书中说很多条龙联合起来对付一条极其强大的、名为死亡之翼的龙。按照我们掌握的信息，多彩龙人差不多全部释放。守护者已经准备就绪。"
G["The books burst into flame from being hit by Book Burner."]="被“焚烧书籍”击中，书燃起了火焰。"
G["The boots, no. The belt, oh very much no. The shirt, stunning, but not on you. We should get you a real cape. And perhaps a vest with a proper hero's cut."]="靴子，不好。腰带，非常不好。衬衣，挺好看，但不适合你。我们应该给你弄个斗篷。也许再配件样式符合英雄身份的外套。"
G["The booty be ours!"]="财宝属于我们！"
G["The boss wants all hands on high alert.  The rusty anchor sinks tonight."]="首领要求大家提高警惕。今晚抛锚。"
G["The bot will adjust its speed to match your own. I would suggest you mount up to speed things along. By the way, the bot was put together with salvaged components from a pile of scrap metal delivered to me from Outland. There were some side effects."]="机器人会根据你的行进速度调整自身的速度。我建议你骑上座骑，提高效率。顺便提一句，这玩意儿是我用一堆从外域送来的破铜烂铁拼凑起来的，可能会产生副作用。"
G["The bottles are dusty but the liquor goes down clean!"]="瓶子表面布满了灰尘，但是里面的酒却很纯净！"
G["The boy believed he could essssscape... Neither of you shall make it out alive."]="瞧，这孩子以为自己能顺利逃脱呢……你们谁都别想活着离开。"
G["The boy believed that he was free, but free will has a price. The demons I kept at bay are now loosed upon him and all death knights that attempt to flee..."]="这孩子以为他自由了，但自由是要付出代价的。那些曾经受我牵制的恶魔，将为他以及所有企图逃跑的死亡骑士带去厄运……"
G["The boy believed you could be saved, but he didn't know what burns within your soul when in your heart, you know we are the same."]="这个孩子相信他能够挽救你，但他不知道是什么在你的灵魂中燃烧。你心里很清楚，你我都是一样的。"
G["The boy had picked up the Ashbringer and driven it through his father's heart as his back was turned. His last words will haunt me forever: \"What have you done, Renault? Why would you do this?\""]="El chico, espada Crematoria en mano, había clavado el acero a su padre, por la espalda y directo al corazón. Nunca olvidaré sus últimas palabras: \"¿Qué has hecho, Renault? ¿Por qué haces esto?\""
G["The boy's death and, in fact, the deaths of all of the knights involved in the redemption of the blade could have been avoided."]="他的死，事实上……在净化灰烬使者的过程中，所有骑士的死本来都是可以避免的。"
G["The boy's face is ashen and pale. He barely breathes."]="这孩子的脸变得煞白。他几乎没有呼吸了。"
G["The boy's too stupid still to say it -- not enough crystal exposure yet -- but, he's thankful for what you did in getting him those flasks.\n\nNow, only nine more sons to go.  Gah!\n\n<Both of Torkus's heads sigh.>\n\nWant to take one of them off of our hands?  We'll sell him to you cheap."]="这孩子还是有些愚钝——看来他还需要接受水晶的启迪，不过，谢谢你为他制造了那些合剂。\n\n嗨！还有九个孩子需要你帮忙呢。\n\n<托尔库斯的两个脑袋都叹了口气。>\n\n想从我这里领走一个小孩吗？我愿意便宜卖给你。"
G["The boys and I have only traveled together for a little while, but I already can't imagine life without either one of them."]="那些男孩和我只是一同旅行了很短一段时间，但我已经无法想象没有他们相伴的生活了。"
G["The boys are afraid of Sayge, that's why they stay away."]="男孩子们都很怕塞格，所以他们都跑开了。"
G["The boys like to hide here. I think they are afraid to actually climb the bridge."]="男孩们喜欢躲在这里。我觉得他们是不敢爬上桥去。"
G["The brat's held prisoner in the wolf den on the other side of the mountain.  She was to be taken to Arugal.  Are we free to go now?"]="囚犯们被关押在山脉另一侧的狼穴中。你说的姑娘很快就会被送到阿鲁高那里了。我们可以走了吗？"
G["The brazier fires upon the helpless orc! [PH]"]="¡El blandón prende sobre el orco indefenso! [PH]"
G["The braziers are prepared. I am ready to face you in combat."]="火盆已经点燃了。我做好挑战你的准备了。"
G["The breach you created was sealed with Nerubian webbing almost as quickly as it was opened."]="蛛魔的巨网将迅速封印你打开的突破口。"
G["The breaking of this one has been taxing. The atrocities I have committed upon his soul. He has resisted for so long, but he will bow down before his king soon."]="我为这个灵魂耗费了巨大的力量，让他承受了无数痛苦……他抵抗了那么长时间，但用不了多久就会屈服了。"
G["The breaking of this one has been taxing. The atrocities I have committed upon his soul... He has resisted for so long, but he will bow down before his king soon."]="我为这个灵魂耗费了巨大的力量，让他承受了无数痛苦……他抵抗了那么长时间，但用不了多久就会屈服了。"
G["The brewery's got a second entrance, over yonder."]="酒厂还有一个入口，就在那边。"
G["The bridge is looking great. We keep up this pace and it'll be done for the first expansion forces to head north."]="进度不错。只要我们继续保持现在的速度，那么第一支北上的军队就可以顺利通过它了！"
G["The bronze dragonflight. They snatched me from the brink of death and took me before their master, Nozdormu. He said they had been watching me and wanted me to continue my hunt. He granted me immortality as a watcher, tasked to bear witness to the history of Azeroth as one of his agents.\n\nI am Xarantaur the Witness, and it is my duty to preserve the true history of Azeroth lest it be forgotten."]="青铜龙族。他们将我从死亡的边缘拯救回来，并带我去见时光之王诺兹多姆。诺兹多姆说，他们一直在关注我的动向，并希望我能够继续追寻知识。他赐我永生并任命我为观察者，担当起艾泽拉斯历史见证者的角色。\n\n我是见证者夏拉托尔，我的任务是维系艾泽拉斯的真实历史，避免它被遗忘。"
G["The bronze flight is in your debt."]="青铜龙军团欠你一个人情。"
G["The brood of Onyxia!"]="奥妮克希亚的血脉！"
G["The brood shall not fall!"]="我们不会失败的！"
G["The broodmother flies above us! Do not fear, fleshling, I am called \"The Steady\" for a reason..."]="¡La madre de linaje vuela sobre nosotros! ¡No temas, ser de carne, me llaman \"el Firme\" por una razón..."
G["The builders have toiled for many years, and it is nearly complete."]="那些建造者辛勤劳作多年，就快完工了。"
G["The building we're looking for is on the Craftsman's Terrace.  Let's go."]="我们要找的那栋建筑就在工匠区。我们走。"
G["The burden of a king is great, as is the burden of a father. I will stop at nothing to find my son."]="国王肩上的担子很重，可身为父亲，也是肩负重责。我会不惜一切代价寻找儿子。"
G["The burden of the damned falls upon you!"]="承受被诅咒者的重负吧！"
G["The burgeoning hero returns! It is good to see you again, $n. You are always welcome at our village."]="¡Vuelve $gel joven héroe:la joven heroína;! Me alegra verte de nuevo, $n. Nos encanta que vengas a nuestra aldea."
G["The burial site must be restored."]="必须恢复墓地的安宁。"
G["The burning of the Wickerman will begin in fifteen minutes!  Come to the festival - located just west of the Undercity - and celebrate Hallow's End and our liberation from the Scourge!"]="15分钟之后将点燃稻草人！快来幽暗城西边欢庆节日吧，庆祝万圣节，庆祝我们摆脱亡灵天灾，获得自由！"
G["The burning of the Wickerman will begin in five minutes!  Come to the festival - located just west of the Undercity - and celebrate Hallow's End and our liberation from the Scourge!"]="5分钟之后将点燃稻草人！快来幽暗城西边欢庆节日吧，庆祝万圣节，庆祝我们摆脱亡灵天灾，获得自由！"
G["The buzz around here is that we've collected everything that we need. Now it all comes down to the Horde gathering up their stuff. Once they have we can all ship our goods over to Silithus and the war can begin."]="我们已经收集了所有的战争物资，现在只等部落完成他们的收集任务了。那时，我们就能将所有的物资运往希利苏斯，战争也就开始了。"
G["The camp is just ahead, we should be able to make it from here."]="营地就在前方，我们应该能安然抵达。"
G["The cannon is dented and streaked with gunpowder."]="大炮表面坑坑凹凹，被火药熏得漆黑。"
G["The cannon was rigged with an explosive trap!"]="火炮与一个爆炸陷阱连在了一起！"
G["The cannoneer's hands are black with gunpowder."]="炮兵的双手沾满了黑色的火药粉。"
G["The cannons must be finished soon."]="火炮必须马上完工。"
G["The canteen... get the canteen..."]="水壶……水壶……"
G["The cap'n says that as soon as Prince Arthas returns we'll be on our way back to Lordaeron."]="船长说，只要阿尔萨斯王子殿下回来，我们就能返回洛丹伦了。"
G["The captain and his forces pushed forward to take one of the bases you scouted for him earlier. You should go and meet them."]="队长和他的部队已经出发去夺取你曾经为他进行过侦查的一座基地了。你应该赶快去与他们会合。"
G["The captain's great!  We get time to relax when we dock.  Those are the times I look forward to the most."]="船长真是太明理啦！我们在靠港后可以去放松一下！那是我最向往的时刻。"
G["The car took a beating!  Let's get it ready for the next race."]="车被撞了一下！我们得快点把它修好，准备下一场比赛。"
G["The caravan has arrived. Good luck!"]="大篷车到了。一路顺风！"
G["The caravan is uprotected - I'm turning back!"]="车队没有防护——我回来了！"
G["The care of a young serpent is a delicate thing."]="照顾幼年翔龙可是一门精细活儿。"
G["The cartel has a name for people like you, $n. \"Fiscal Liability.\""]="El cártel tiene un nombre para gente como tú, $n. \"Deuda fiscal\"."
G["The cat watches the broom intently."]="猫专注地盯着扫帚。"
G["The cataclysm split the land apart here, allowing the naga to stretch inland..."]="大灾变撕裂了这里的陆地，让纳迦能够进入内陆……"
G["The catapults remain disabled. I've burned several and trapped the others."]="那些投石车仍然无法使用。我已经烧毁了几辆投石车，并破坏了其余的。"
G["The cats keep me company. It's been quite lonesome on the farm since my parents passed...\n\nOh no, I didn't mean to tell you so much."]="这些猫一直陪伴着我。自从我父母离世后，一个人在农场很寂寞……\n\n哦不，我并不想和你说这么多的。"
G["The cauldron bubbles violently."]="锅炉开始猛烈地冒起了气泡。"
G["The cauldron continues to boil..."]="天灾之锅还在沸腾……"
G["The cavern trembles violently!"]="洞穴剧烈地震动起来！"
G["The caverns below us are a source of strange and wondrous hides, but you must take care if you venture into their depths, $n. Remember that your own skin is far more valuable."]="我们脚下的洞穴中有许多奇异的兽皮，如果你想深入其中探险的话，一定要非常小心，$n。要记住你自己的性命比那些兽皮有价值得多。"
G["The caverns have been purified. To Naralex's chamber we go!"]="这些洞穴已经被净化了，现在我们得赶去纳拉雷克斯的藏身之地！"
G["The celebration of the Lunar Festival is in full swing in Moonglade. You can make the trek, or the druids in the Cenarion Enclave are offering transport."]="春节庆典在月光林地进行。你可以自己艰苦跋涉，或者使用塞纳里奥区的德鲁伊们提供的传送服务到那里去。"
G["The celebration of the feast of Winter Veil is a source of great warmth during the cold seasons, and its heart is in Orgrimmar."]="在寒冷的季节中，冬幕节的庆典是个非常温暖的去处，它的中心就在奥格瑞玛。"
G["The celebration of the natural processes of the world is silly; it's going to happen whether we celebrate or not! But it's a great excuse for sugar!"]="为什么要庆祝世界的自然演变，真是可笑。无论我们庆祝与否，它都会发生呀！不过，这是一个吃糖果的好借口！"
G["The celestials are so huge!"]="至尊天神都好高大啊！"
G["The center of the jinyu village was clear. Just to be safe, Kiryn planted some explosive barrels for me to shoot."]="我们肃清了锦鱼人的村子。为防万一，琪麟埋下了一些炸药，由我射击引爆。"
G["The central courtyard is heavily guarded. We'll go around."]="中庭的守卫十分森严。我们得绕过去。"
G["The central gate opens!"]="中央大门打开了！"
G["The chaff of the world tumbles across our doorstep, driven by fear; Her royal storm will whisk them away."]="世界的糟粕被恐惧所驱使，在我们的门前飘摇；她的皇廷风暴会将他们一举驱散。"
G["The challenge is in looking beyond appearances and understanding our similarities. Through this understanding, you can feel compassion for the losses others have suffered..."]="如何看透本质并寻求共同点，是我们面临的挑战。唯有理解，才能让你们对他人所遭受的痛楚产生同情……"
G["The challenger has been defeated!"]="挑战者被打败了！"
G["The challengers have failed. Not being vrykul this was expected."]="挑战者失败了。他们不是维库人，落得败局也是可以预见的。"
G["The chamber has been breached! The titan relic is vulnerable!"]="宝库被攻破了！泰坦圣物失去了保护！"
G["The champion of the Winterax trolls has challenged you, $n! I hope you're ready!"]="¡El campeón de los trols Hacha Invernal te ha desafiado, $n! ¡Espero que estés $glisto:lista;!"
G["The champions of the world's great nations have gathered at the Argent Tournament Grounds in northeastern Icecrown to face all challengers."]="世界上最强大国家的勇士们都聚集在冰冠冰川东北部的银色比武场，准备在这里迎接各种艰难而致命的挑战。"
G["The chaos I have sown here is but a taste...."]="我所播种的混乱只是一个开端……"
G["The charges are all set; hit the detonator as soon as you're ready!"]="Las cargas están listas; ¡activa el detonador en cuanto estés $glisto:lista;!"
G["The charges are placed. Hero - you may have the honor."]="起爆器到位了。英雄——这份殊荣属于你。"
G["The charges are set. Get back before they blow!"]="炸弹安放好了。向后撤，炸弹马上要爆炸了！"
G["The chief will pay big money for your head!"]="首领一定会为你的脑袋出个好价钱的！"
G["The chieftain's brother, Stormhoof, gathered all his strength and set out to conquer the Storm Peaks from its rightful ruler, the North Wind."]="他的名字叫做雷蹄。雷蹄纠集了一支军队，踏上了征服风暴峭壁，推翻其合法统治者——北风的征程。"
G["The children are frightened, but they will be all right. We will keep them safe!"]="孩子们受到了惊吓，但他们会没事的。我们会保障他们的安全！"
G["The children cheer."]="孩子们发出了欢呼声。"
G["The children love this holiday.  Some children have gone out trick-or-treating, some have stayed behind, and some, like these, have decided to try to run a small business.\n\nTheir goal is to amass as much candy as possible, and they felt the best way was to offer treats for the hard work of others.  I laughed when I first heard of their plan, $c.  But now that I see how many adventurers are giving them candy for their wares, I am worried.\n\nThat is a lot of sugar.  I don't think the children will ever be able to fall asleep again."]="孩子们都喜欢这个节日。有些孩子已经出去要糖果了，有些却只能留在这里。还有些孩子，比如你眼前这些，则想跟你们做个小小的交易。\n\n他们的目的是收集尽可能多的糖果，而他们想到的报酬就是送糖果给那些帮他们奔波的人。当我第一次他们说起这个打算时，都有点忍俊不禁，$c。可当我看到有那么多冒险者都愿意拿糖果来交换他们的小礼品时，我又开始担心了。\n\n他们拿到的糖果太多了。我担心孩子们从此再也睡不着觉了。"
G["The children of Stratholme fought with more ferocity!"]="斯坦索姆的小孩子都要比你们勇猛！"
G["The children of Sul will protect their master. Rise once more Sul'lithuz!"]="苏利萨斯的子嗣会保护他们的主人……"
G["The chill creeping from the north gives my bones a fierce ache."]="来自北方的寒风呼啸而过，冰冷刺骨。"
G["The chill of this place freezes the marrow of my bones."]="这个寒冷的地方让我的骨髓都凝固了。"
G["The chill of this place... I can feel my blood freezing."]="这种刺骨的寒冷……血液好像都要凝结了。"
G["The chill you feel is the herald of your doom!"]="笼罩你的寒气就是厄运的先兆。"
G["The choice is clear. We must attack. I know the odds are against us, but Taunka do not go quietly to the slaughter."]="我们别无选择，只能发动进攻。我知道局势对我们不利，但是牦牛人绝不能坐以待毙。"
G["The choice is yours to make."]="你自行决定吧。"
G["The choice is yours, Anselm.  Return to the Lich King's army and fight alongside them or remain loyal to your so-called queen and suffer their wrath as they drive you from their homelands!"]="做出选择吧，安希尔姆。回到巫妖王的军队，与天灾军团并肩作战或者对你所谓的女王保持忠诚，直到天灾军团将你驱出他们的家园！"
G["The chromatic flight shall deal with these intruders. Let us talk of more pressing matters."]="多彩龙人会对付这些入侵者的。我们谈谈更为紧迫的事情吧。"
G["The cipher fragment is to be moved. Have it delivered to Zuluhed."]="把密码碎片运走，送到祖鲁希德那里去。"
G["The circle of life is not yet prepared for Alexstrasza. Speak with me again as soon as I have finished my preparations."]="还没为阿莱克丝塔萨准备好生命循环。等我准备就绪后，再来和我交谈。"
G["The city has been routed. The Azsh'ir cry your name as a victory call. You've earned much respect this day."]="城市已被攻陷。艾萨尔向你发出了胜利的恭贺。你今天为自己赢得了足够的尊重。"
G["The city is grinding to a halt as more and more workers become bedridden..."]="越来越多的劳工卧床不起，城市系统正在趋于瘫痪……"
G["The city was left in ruins and darkness... until the Sha'tar arrived."]="整座城市只剩下废墟和黑暗……直到沙塔尔来临。"
G["The city's Arcane Reforger, Enchantress Fira, will be able to help you.  She is most often found with Sedana and her enchanter's apprentices, off the Court of the Sun."]="这座城里的奥术重铸师灌魔者菲娜能帮助你。通常她会和逐日王庭外的瑟丹娜及其学徒们在一起。"
G["The city's best tailors are in Talismanic Textiles in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran."]="魔法商业区的避邪纺织店汇集了全城最好的裁缝。魔法商业区就在达拉然的西北部。"
G["The city's best-known barber shop is located in northern Dalaran."]="达拉然著名的理发店就坐落在城市北部。"
G["The city's cemetery is just north of the Violet Citadel in western Dalaran."]="达拉然墓地位于城市西部，紫罗兰城堡的北面。"
G["The city's leatherworker is in the inner ring of the Rogues' Quarter."]="城里的皮匠在盗贼区的内环区域。"
G["The city's mage and portal trainers may be found in a large building in eastern Dalaran, between Runeweaver Square at the heart of the city and Krasus' Landing."]="达拉然的法师训练师和传送门训练师聚集在东部的一幢大型建筑物内，就在城市中心的鲁因广场和克拉苏斯平台之间。"
G["The city's premier urgent care center, First to your Aid, is located in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran."]="在达拉然西北部的魔法商业区设有全城最高级的急救中心——急你所急。"
G["The clam has given up the goods!"]="贝壳吐出了珍珠！"
G["The clans are united under Blackhand in this assault. They will stand together until Stormwind has fallen."]="兽人氏族在黑手的统一指挥下发起了攻击。他们会一致作战，直到暴风城沦陷。"
G["The clock is ticking..."]="你时日无多了……"
G["The clock... is still... ticking."]="时间……仍在……流逝。"
G["The closest gryphon master is located up in Ironforge near The Great Forge itself.  Ye'll need to head to Ironforge if ye want to travel by gryphon."]="最近的狮鹫管理员居住在铁炉堡的大锻炉附近。如果你想乘坐狮鹫的话，就前往铁炉堡吧。"
G["The closest spirit is Huo, the spirit of flame. I would ask you to meet with some of my most talented students and learn what they know of Huo."]="最近的一位元素之灵是上古火灵燧焰。我要你去见见我的几个得意弟子，并向他们询问燧焰的消息。"
G["The closest spirit is Huo, the spirit of flame. You will meet with some of my most talented students and learn what they know of Huo."]="最近的一位元素之灵是上古火灵燧焰。我要你去见见我的几个得意弟子，并向他们询问燧焰的消息。"
G["The clothing is merely a manifestation of a larger problem.  I've no doubt that you are here to learn, but you must commit yourself both in spirit and in form."]="着装只不过是潜在问题的外在表现而已。我毫不怀疑你来此学习的诚意，可你必须在精神与外貌上都做好充分的准备。"
G["The clouds arc with vengeance!"]="复仇云层正在汇聚！"
G["The coast is clear. You're free!"]="已经很安全了。你自由啦！"
G["The coast was clear. Kiryn began to make her escape."]="海滩已被肃清。琪麟开始逃跑。"
G["The coffer is just beyond these ruins.\n\nLet's go!"]="那个箱子就在废墟里。\n\n我们行动！"
G["The coils of death will crush you!"]="死亡的纠缠会让你彻底湮灭！"
G["The cold comes..."]="寒冷到来了……"
G["The cold dark beckons..."]="寒冷和黑暗在向我招手……"
G["The cold darkness awaits your soul!"]="阴冷的黑暗等待着你的灵魂！"
G["The cold embrace awaits..."]="寒冷的拥抱在等待……"
G["The cold wind blows. The time of the swarm has begun!"]="冷风呼啸。虫群的时代到了！"
G["The collar is indeed infused with demonic power, $n.  This bodes ill for our people."]="这个项圈被注入了恶魔的力量，$n。它将会给我们的人民带来灾难。"
G["The color has just... left its body."]="它刚……死去不久。"
G["The colors are so vivid!"]="这些色彩实在是太生动了！"
G["The colors! Nooooooooooooooo!"]="那色彩！不——！"
G["The colossus is injured! Don't stop striking!"]="巨像受伤了！继续攻击！"
G["The comedian clears his throat."]="喜剧演员清了清喉咙。"
G["The comedian impersonates a blood elf."]="喜剧演员扮成了一个血精灵。"
G["The comedian impersonates a gnome."]="喜剧演员扮成了一个侏儒。"
G["The comedian impersonates a human female."]="喜剧演员扮成了一个女性人类。"
G["The comedian impersonates a tauren."]="喜剧演员扮成了一个牛头人。"
G["The comedian impersonates an orc."]="喜剧演员扮成了一个兽人。"
G["The commander needs to be told: Mechazod's planning an attack! We're doomed!"]="立即转告指挥官：麦卡佐德准备向我们发动袭击！我们完蛋了！"
G["The commander of the forces on the ground here is a cruel brute named Zarithrian, but I fear there are greater powers at work."]="指挥他们的是一个名叫萨瑞瑟里安的残忍家伙。但我担心他背后还有更强大的力量。"
G["The competition will be fierce, but Orgrimmar's champions will decimate all who stand in our way."]="竞争会非常激烈，但是奥格瑞玛的勇士是所向披靡的。"
G["The concern that you show for the welfare of your animal companions is commendable.  Bulrug, on the lower rise, can help you with that.  Seek him out between the bank and the inn."]="你对自己的宠物伙伴表现出的关爱之情是值得赞扬的。矮山上的布尔鲁格能帮助你照看宠物。他居住在银行和旅馆之间的地方，去找他吧。"
G["The conflicts in Outland are deadlier than any I have seen.  And their most tragic victims are the children that are left behind.\n\nNow, with the threat against Shattrath from the arakkoa of Skettis, there will be even more orphans to take care of.  These children often live without the hope of a bright future."]="Los conflictos en Terrallende son los más cruentos que nunca haya visto. Y las víctimas más trágicas son los niños que quedan atrás.\n\nAhora, con la amenaza contra Shattrath de los arakkoa de Skettis, surgirán aún más huérfanos a los que cuidar. Estos niños a menudo viven sin la esperanza de un futuro."
G["The conflicts in Outland are deadlier than any I have seen.  And their most tragic victims are the children that are left behind.\n\nNow, with the threat against Shattrath from the arakkoa of Skettis, there will be even more orphans to take care of.  These children often live without the hope of a bright future.\n\nBut you have the power to do something about that.  It's Children's Week, $c, and I implore you to volunteer to bring joy and wonder into a child's life."]="外域的战争比我之前所经历过的任何战争都要惨烈。大部分受害者都是那些留在后方的孩子。\n\n现在，斯克提斯的鸦人对沙塔斯城的威胁进一步加剧，那里会有更多的孤儿需要照顾。这些孩子几乎已经看不到光明的未来。\n\n但是，你却有能力为他们做些什么。儿童周来了，$c，我恳求你给这些孩子的生活带来些乐趣和奇迹吧。"
G["The console appears ancient though there is no sign of dilapidation or decay.  A single slot appears to fit large circular discs."]="控制台显得非常陈旧，却没有一丝破损或是荒废的迹象。上面刻有一道插槽，似乎可以放入大型的圆盘。"
G["The contents of that crate are very dangerous and they belong in a secure vault, not in the hands of some well-to-do, but ignorant collector!"]="那个箱子里的东西非常危险。它们都来自一个守卫森严的库房，可不是从某个愚昧的暴发户收藏家那里偷来的！"
G["The continent of Northrend is filled with history!  We must dig deep through the frozen ice and find our ancestors."]="诺森德大陆遍布历史遗迹！我们要凿开坚硬的冰层，寻找祖先的足迹。"
G["The continued sacrifice of the Ashen Verdict and heroes such as yourself bring us all closer to final victory. Now I have come to Icecrown Citadel to lend aid to those who fight against the Scourge. Together we will end the tyranny of the Lich King!"]="灰烬审判军和像你一样的英雄们以惨重的牺牲为代价，终于接近了最终的胜利。现在，我来到冰冠堡垒，帮助所有对抗天灾军团的勇士们。我们将并肩作战，结束巫妖王的暴行！"
G["The control components are working perfectly this time!"]="目前控制组件运转正常！"
G["The control panel shifts and rotates on its axis."]="控制面板在轴承上转动着。"
G["The control unit for the missile generator is on the top floor of the tower. If you can find a way to get up there, you can shut it down yourselves."]="导弹能量塔的控制器就在塔顶。如果你能想办法上去，就可以自己动手关掉它。"
G["The controller can be used to activate the linked proton accelerator.  This will call forth one of Bash'ir's harbingers, or perhaps Bash'ir himself.\n\nAssuming, of course, that you have an accelerator module to activate the device."]="控制器可以激活关联的质子加速器。激活操作将召唤出一名巴什伊尔先驱者，或许就是巴什伊尔本人。\n\n当然，前提是你有加速器模组来激活这台设备。"
G["The controller can be used to activate the linked proton accelerator.  This will call forth one of Bash'ir's harbingers, or perhaps Bash'ir himself.\n\nUnfortunate that you do not possess an accelerator module to activate the device."]="控制器可以激活关联的质子加速器。激活操作将召唤出一名巴什伊尔先驱者，或许就是巴什伊尔本人。\n\n可惜，你没有加速器模组来激活这台设备。"
G["The convoy to Kota Basecamp is leaving now! Gather around!"]="前往寇塔营地的商队就要出发了！快集合！"
G["The convoy to Neverest Basecamp is leaving now! Gather around!"]="前往不息营地的护卫队就要出发了！集合！"
G["The convoy to the Burlap Waystation is leaving now! Gather around!"]="前往粗麻驿站的商队就要出发了！快集合！"
G["The cook around here is in the Trade Quarter. Her name's Eunice Burch."]="这里的厨师是尤奈斯·伯奇，你可以在贸易区找到她。"
G["The corporeal form of Ragnaros must be destroyed. From the remnants, his essence shall emerge. In this weakened state, Ragnaros' grip on the prison of Thunderaan is loosed. The essence itself acting as a key..."]="你必须摧毁拉格纳罗斯的肉身，他的精华将在尸体的残骸中出现。在他极度虚弱的时候，他对桑德兰的控制将被大大减弱。精华本身就是一把钥匙……"
G["The corpse of one of the Broken lies here.  Mysteriously, the cause of its death does not appear to be from one of the mutated moths.\n\nPerhaps it has something to do with the strange object resting right next to its outstretched hand?"]="一个破碎者的尸体躺在这里。神秘的是，他死亡的原因并不是由于那变异的蛾子。\n\n也许是因为他手上的奇怪物品？"
G["The corpses of those that try only serve to feed our expanding host!"]="那些尸体只会令我们的军队日益壮大！"
G["The corruption goes much further than these spiders. I fear the true source is not within this cave."]="腐化的程度远非这些蜘蛛力量能及。我担心真正的源头并不在这洞穴之中。"
G["The corruption is amplifying.  The fragments must be purged before it becomes too great."]="腐蚀正在扩大。在它变得不可收拾之前，必须净化这些碎片。"
G["The corruption is buried deep within him."]="腐坏的种子已深植在他体内。"
G["The corruption is everywhere!  You cannot succeed!"]="腐蚀已经泛滥了！你不可能成功！"
G["The corruption of Felwood has trapped my spirit here... I may never rest..."]="费伍德森林的堕落禁锢了我的灵魂……我也许永远都得不到安宁……"
G["The corruption of a fallen titan. The corruption of the Destroyer. After all, the staff was forged from the seed of hate. That is, of course, what has brought me here..."]="一位堕落泰坦的腐蚀。毁灭者的腐蚀。总之，这根法杖发源于仇恨的种子。当然，这也是我来到这里的原因……"
G["The corruption of the House of Nobles runs through your veins.  Let me remove it with my blade!"]="议员们的堕落已经影响了你。让我的剑来帮你解脱吧！"
G["The corruption of the fel has not left any of the creatures of Felwood untouched, $n. Please, be on your guard."]="这个地区的堕落使得森林中的所有生物都受到了影响，$n。请做好战斗准备。"
G["The corruption will consume you, as it consumed us..."]="这腐蚀一定会吞噬你，一如它吞噬我们……"
G["The courier from Silvermoon City is delayed. Perhaps I should send a scout to look for him?"]="银月城的信使还没来。或许我该派斥候出去找找。"
G["The courier has arrived!"]="信使到了！"
G["The courier must have died of his wounds after what looks to have been a brutal struggle.\n\nHis supply satchel appears to be unharmed."]="这里看来发生过激烈打斗，信使一定是因伤而死的。\n\n他的补给背包似乎原封未动。"
G["The courtyard gate is directly up that hill."]="庭院的大门就在那座山上。"
G["The courtyard is ours! Onward to the inner sanctum!"]="我们已经攻占了庭院！朝内部圣殿前进！"
G["The coward...killed them...poisoned...me..."]="那些懦夫……让我中了毒……杀了他们……"
G["The cowardly dragon must have seen me, because he turned away and flew into the clouds."]="那头胆小的龙一定是看见我了，因为他转过头，又钻进了黑云里。"
G["The crate of explosives is on fire!"]="那箱炸药着火了！"
G["The crazy fisherman is on the dock in the Magic Quarter."]="疯狂的渔夫就在魔法区的港口那。"
G["The creation of Teldrassil was a grand achievement, but now the world must shift to regain its balance."]="La creación de Teldrassil fue un gran logro, pero ahora el mundo debe cambiar para recuperar su equilibrio."
G["The creature Entropius, whom you were forced to destroy, was once the noble naaru, M'uru. In life, M'uru channeled vast energies of LIGHT and HOPE. For a time, a misguided few sought to steal those energies..."]="你们之前消灭的那只熵魔，曾经是一位高贵的纳鲁，他名叫穆鲁。生前，他一直将代表着光明与希望的能量带给世人。不过，有一段时间，一些迷茫的孩子却囚禁了它，偷取这些能量。"
G["The creature approachessss! Arm yourssselvesss!"]="有东西靠近了！准备作战！"
G["The creature is gaining power from the ancestral Grimtotem!  We must put them to rest if we are to defeat this beast!"]="这个怪物正在从恐怖图腾的先祖那里汲取能量！我们必须让那些逝者安息，才能真正打败这个怪物！"
G["The creature's shell is glinting with light."]="那家伙的甲壳在闪光。"
G["The creatures in Winterspring are a good place ta start.\n\nHoweva', der may also be other places you can look..."]="从冬泉谷的生物开始应该不错。\n\n然而，或许还有别的地方你可以看看……"
G["The creatures of this place are strong, wayfarer. You'll need ample ammunition if you hope to survive. You're in luck - I am well-stocked with fine arrows, bullets, and throwing weapons. The price is reasonable, considering circumstances."]="这个地方的生物非常强壮，旅行者。如果你想活下去的话，应该带好充足的弹药。你很幸运——我这里有大量的箭矢、子弹和投掷武器。如果你考虑一下周围的环境，我的价格还是非常合理的。"
G["The crew's lookin' a touch low on fuel. There anything safe to eat in these parts?"]="队员们都在盯着那个没油的喷火器。这附近有可以吃的东西吗？"
G["The crewman is choking!"]="船员就快窒息了！"
G["The crewman is choking! Vitals are dropping!"]="船员就快窒息了！生命危急！"
G["The crimson what? Never heard of it..."]="什么血色啊？我从来没有听说过……"
G["The crocolisks of Narsong Trench ate fish. They were fat and happy."]="纳松海沟里的鳄鱼以鱼类为食，他们过得悠闲自得。"
G["The crossbow can be learned from Woo Ping, the human weapon master at Weller's Arsenal in Stormwind, Handiir, the draenei weapon master found in the Trader's Tier within the Exodar, or Bixi Wobblebonk, the gnome weapon master within the Timberline Arms in Ironforge."]="你可以从暴风城维勒武器店的人类武器大师吴平、埃索达贸易阶梯的德莱尼武器大师韩迪尔或是铁炉堡密林武器店内的侏儒武器大师比克斯那里学会使用弩。"
G["The crossroads are not far. Let us seek out our last member there."]="十字路口离这儿不远。我们去那儿寻找最后一名成员。"
G["The crowd cheers."]="人群欢呼起来。"
G["The crowd clamours."]="人群喧闹起来。"
G["The crowd gasps in horror."]="人群在惊惶中骚动起来。"
G["The crowd gasps."]="人群骚动起来。"
G["The crown I have given you will be as your third eye. It will tie us together. I will see what you see. Together we will lay the secrets of the Titans bare."]="这顶冠冕将成为你的第三只眼。它将我们连为一体。你将成为我的耳目。我们要一起揭开泰坦之谜。"
G["The crucible looks abandoned and powerless.\nPerhaps there is a place nearby where you can attune yourself to the Battlemaiden..."]="坩埚看起来废弃无力。\n也许你能在附近某个地方设法让自己与女武士谐调起来……"
G["The cruel sayaadi temptresses exemplify the subtler side of the Legion's nihilistic Crusade."]="残暴的萨亚德魅魔代表着燃烧军团的狡猾一面。"
G["The crystal can still be found... if we can just find it again..."]="水晶还能被找到……如果我们能再次找到它……"
G["The crystal foci?  Of course we'll explain it seeing as you only have half the brain power to figure it out.\n\nA depleted crystal focus can be combined with ten apexis shards in a simple process, which creates a charged crystal focus.  These charged foci have some healing properties, but more important is their use with a possessed demon.\n\nYou see, the charged focus can be used to enable a possessed demon to exhibit special powers.  After a time, Gahk will have a mission for you to do just that."]="聚焦水晶？当然，我会解释清楚的，毕竟，看上去你只具备完全理解这个概念所必需的一半脑力。\n\n首先，通过一个简单的反应，一块耗尽能量的聚焦水晶可以与十块埃匹希斯碎片产生连接，并在反应结束之后转化为一块充能的聚焦水晶。这些充能的聚焦水晶具备某种医疗能力，但更重要的是，它可以与某只被占据的恶魔产生共效，并应用在特殊的地方。\n\n比如说，每块充能的聚焦水晶的都可以使某只被占据的恶魔展现出特殊的力量。不久之后，甘克就会派你去完成一个类似的任务。"
G["The crystal foci?  Of course we'll explain it seeing as you only have half the brain power to figure it out.\n\nA depleted crystal focus can be combined with ten apexis shards in a simple process, which creates a charged crystal focus.  These charged foci have some healing properties, but more important is their use with a possessed demon.\n\nYou see, the charged focus can be used to enable a possessed demon to exhibit special powers.  If you have a darkrune, Gahk will speak to you about that."]="聚焦水晶？当然，我会解释清楚的，毕竟，看上去你只具备完全理解这个概念所必需的一半脑力。\n\n首先，通过一个简单的反应，一块耗尽能量的聚焦水晶可以与十块埃匹希斯碎片产生连接，并在反应结束之后转化为一块充能的聚焦水晶。这些充能的聚焦水晶具备某种医疗能力，但更重要的是，它可以与某只被占据的恶魔产生共效，并应用在特殊的地方。\n\n比如说，每块充能的聚焦水晶的都可以使某只被占据的恶魔展现出特殊的力量。不久之后，甘克就会派你去完成一个类似的任务。"
G["The crystal has granted you new abilities! Use them to defeat the summoned elementals."]="水晶让你获得了新的能力！用这能力击败被召唤的元素吧。"
G["The crystal has returned. You must leave..."]="水晶回来了。你必须离开……"
G["The crystal is covered in intricate glyphs and runes. You can't make sense of any of it."]="水晶上布满了神秘的雕文和符文。你无法理解。"
G["The crystal prison begins to shatter!"]="水晶监牢开始破碎了！"
G["The crystal pulses faintly.  Its protective energy has grown weak but is not entirely depleted."]="水晶发出微弱的光芒。它的保护能量变得很弱，但并没有完全消失。"
G["The crystal wards... I must feed!"]="水晶结界……我需要能量！"
G["The crystal will save us! We can be saved!"]="水晶将拯救我们！我们将得到拯救！"
G["The crystals have enlightened us brothers.  But we must still be on guard."]="水晶启迪了我们。但是我们仍然需要保持警惕。"
G["The crystals sing a sweeter song when $n is around."]="$n在附近的话，连水晶簇都会发出美妙的歌声。"
G["The cub bats one paw at a tiny insect, only taking note of your attention when the plaything flies away."]="幼崽伸出小爪子想去捕捉一只小虫子，当玩物飞走时它才注意到你在看它。"
G["The cub nuzzles your hand and purrs."]="幼崽用鼻子蹭了蹭你的手，心满意足地发出了咕噜咕噜的叫声。"
G["The cub sniffs your hand and decides you're not a threat... this time."]="幼崽闻了闻你的手，觉得你暂时不是个威胁。"
G["The cub tilts its head and looks at you expectantly. Shouldn't you know what to do, $g dad:mom;?"]="这只幼崽侧过头，期待地看着你。难道你不知道该做些什么吗，$g爸爸:妈妈;？"
G["The cult is upon us! We need help in the Respite Chambers!"]="邪教徒来了！安息之厅需要帮手！"
G["The cult must have someone in the city to coordinate this kind of attack. That only leaves one suspect, Ambassador Slaghammer!"]="教派肯定在城里安插了人手来协同配合此次进攻。只有一个人有嫌疑——熔锤大使！"
G["The cultist practically sputters."]="教徒激动得语无伦次。"
G["The cultists have not stopped their attacks. Spread the word: double the guard and arrest anyone suspicious. These orders come from the warchief himself!"]="邪教徒并没有停止进攻。将命令传出去：安排两倍的卫兵，逮捕任何有嫌疑的人。这是酋长亲自下达的命令！"
G["The cunning, powerful eredar warlocks were once our noble kinsmen."]="狡猾而强大的艾瑞达术士曾经是我们这个种族的贵族。"
G["The cupcakes look delicious!"]="这个纸杯蛋糕看起来很好吃！"
G["The curing cantrip has failed. Unfortunately, the introduction of the serum into this beast's blood stream will soon end its life."]="治疗法术失败了。不幸的是，注入那只野兽血管中的血清不久之后就会要了它的命。"
G["The current situation looks like this: we're holding what we can while those with more experience and better equipment are moving against Prince Kael'thas."]="现在的情况是这样：在那些更有经验、并且装备精良的伙计们对付凯尔萨斯王子时，我们正在努力保护我们所能保护的一切。"
G["The currents bow to me!"]="水流都臣服于我！"
G["The curse ends!"]="诅咒结束了！"
G["The curse is lifted!"]="诅咒已经解除！"
G["The curse remains intact. We'll have to find another way."]="诅咒还是原封不动。我们得寻找另一种办法。"
G["The cycle begins again! Go'el has become living stone! We must pursue him within the caverns of Deepholm.\n\nSeeing as how the Earthen Ring just saved her kingdom, Therazane should be more than willing to help us in saving him. If not, the Stonemother will answer to me!"]="循环又开始了！古伊尔变成了活生生的石头！我们必须到深岩之洲的洞穴里去找他。\n\n在亲眼看到大地之环拯救了她的国度之后，塞拉赞恩应该更愿意帮我们救他了。如果她不肯，那位石母必将付出代价！"
G["The cycle continues."]="循环永续。"
G["The cycle continues..."]="轮回仍将继续……"
G["The cycle is complete."]="轮回完成了。"
G["The cycle must continue, the Jade Serpent must be reborn!"]="轮回终将继续，青龙必将重生！"
G["The cycle of bloodshed is unending... Is there nothing I can do?"]="流血的循环看不到尽头……我什么都做不了吗？"
G["The cycle of time brings an end to all things."]="时光的轮回将带来万物的终结。"
G["The cypher is powering mechanisms deep within the temple!"]="这段密文描述的正是神殿深处的能量供给系统！"
G["The damn spiders, the endlessly screeching bats, and those blasted demon beasts have all taken residence in the Servant's Quarters. It's not safe to walk around anymore, especially when the big ones come out of hiding."]="该死的蜘蛛、不断尖叫的蝙蝠、还有那些被诅咒的恶魔野兽，它们占据了仆役宿舍。那里已经很不安全了，尤其是当那些大家伙们从黑暗中跳出来的时候。"
G["The damned demonstrate their superiority once more."]="那些该死的家伙再一次展示了自己的优越性。"
G["The dark ashes swirl around %s, who utters an incantation:"]="黑暗的灰烬在%s周围打着转，他口里吟诵着咒语："
G["The dark lord laughs at you!"]="黑暗的主宰在嘲笑你们！"
G["The dark ones had taken a hold of me, master. You were merciful in seeking my death. Forgive me..."]="黑暗控制了我，主人。死亡对我是最仁慈的惩罚。原谅我……"
G["The dark void awaits you!"]="黑暗的虚空正等着你呢！"
G["The darkest days are still ahead!"]="最黑暗的日子还没有到来！"
G["The darkness beneath Tirisfal will consume us all..."]="提瑞斯法下方的黑暗会把我们全部吞没……"
G["The darkness came from deep within the earth. Still, it hungers..."]="黑暗来自于地下深处，它仍旧渴望着……"
G["The darkness clears..."]="黑暗退去了……"
G["The darkness closes in...my vision is clouded..."]="黑暗正在逼近……阴影遮蔽了我的眼睛……"
G["The darkness comes for you, and with it, death."]="黑暗来袭，死亡随之而来。"
G["The darkness comes."]="黑暗降临了。"
G["The darkness does not embrace you, $c.  Cease your prattle and remove yourself from my sight!  Be gone!"]="黑暗没有拥抱你这样的$c。别说废话，从我视线中消失吧！滚！"
G["The darkness in my soul screams for release!"]="我灵魂中的黑暗呼之欲出！"
G["The darkness in your souls draws you ever closer..."]="你灵魂中的黑暗会使你越陷越深……"
G["The darkness is closing in!  I will not go without a fight, monster!"]="黑暗正在逼近！除非拼死一搏，否则我绝不会离开，怪物！"
G["The darkness surrounds you, the light of Elune is your only salvation."]="黑暗围绕着你，艾露恩之光是你的唯一救赎。"
G["The darkness will consume all... all the living..."]="黑暗将吞噬一切……生命……"
G["The darkness... surrounds me!"]="黑暗……将我包围！"
G["The darkness... the corruption... they came too quickly for anyone to know..."]="黑暗……堕落……悄无声息地侵蚀了大地……"
G["The darkweaver metamorphizes into something terrible and demonic."]="黑暗编织者变成了恐怖的恶魔生物。"
G["The darkweaver pierces you with an evil grin as he shifts into an entirely different form."]="黑暗编织者冲你露出邪恶的笑容，他的身体紧接着变成了完全不同的形态。"
G["The darkweaver pierces you with an evil grin as she shifts into an entirely different form."]="黑暗编织者冲你露出邪恶的笑容，他的身体紧接着变成了完全不同的形态。"
G["The darned thing just started working! This should take you right up to the end of the concourse, where you last fought the Flame Leviathan."]="这该死的玩意儿总算运行起来了！它可以将你传送到广场尽头，就是之前你们与烈焰巨兽战斗的地方。"
G["The data stored in this repository does indeed correlate with your astute proclamation.\n\nThe dwarf maintains an affinity for the stone composition of Azeroth, but due to the high-stress environmental anomaly within the Earthen's synthesis matrix, the dwarf reverts to a default biomass composition as seen in the standard subterranean matrix.\n\nErgo, the dwarf variant does synthesize from the degeneration of the Earthen creation matrix, as you inferred with your query."]="你的问题在数据库中有相关联接。\n\n矮人依然和艾泽拉斯的各种石头有着密切的关系，但是由于土灵在高压环境下的变异，矮人的结构与标准地下生物母体的结构保持了一致。\n\n因此，正如你所猜想的那样，矮人确实是从母体中变异出来的。"
G["The dawning comes, Stoutmantle, and with it comes your end."]="黎明来临了，斯托曼，你的末日也将到随之到来。"
G["The day is mine. Well fought."]="今天我是主角。打得漂亮。"
G["The day is ours! And not a drop of blood was shed on holy ground."]="我们胜利了！而且没让这片圣地溅上一滴鲜血。"
G["The day is ours."]="我们是今天的主角。"
G["The day of judgement has come, fiend!  I challenge you to battle!"]="审判之日已经来临了，恶魔！我向你挑战！"
G["The day of reckoning draws near. Aberrations like you will be destroyed..."]="清算之日即将来临。你这样的异端将被彻底消灭……"
G["The day that Deathwing came, blood rained from the skies."]="死亡之翼到来的那一天，血雨腥风，好不可怕。"
G["The days pass quickly when I am busy.\n\nI must remind myself to stop and enjoy the moment."]="我忙的时候日子过得很快。\n\n我必须提醒我自己停下脚步、享受当下。"
G["The days we've spent here in Azshara are not among our best and most glorious, but we are still young and blood still courses through our veins--we shall find victory here. It is only a matter of time."]="我们在艾萨拉度过的这段日子并不是辉煌而又灿烂的，但是我们仍然年轻而且热血沸腾——我们最终会获得胜利，这只是一个时间问题。"
G["The dead are not supposed to speak. Now be silent!"]="死人是不会说话的。现在闭上你的嘴！"
G["The dead cry for solace. Their anguish echoes on the wind."]="亡者在乞求慰藉。他们的痛苦在风中回响。"
G["The dead do not belong in this realm.\n\nWhy, then, do we continually seek them out after putting them to rest?"]="亡者不属于这个国度。\n\n那我们为什么还要在让他们安息之后，再不断地寻找他们呢？"
G["The dead rise and seek vengeance on any that dare pass through their domain. Turn back!"]="亡者已经复苏，任何敢于穿越亡者领地的人都会遭到疯狂的报复。回去吧！"
G["The dead rise from our very own crypt!"]="那些亡灵竟然来自我们的墓地！"
G["The dead rise... Undead, from the frozen northlands. Whole cities have gone missing. I..."]="死者复生……亡灵，在诺森德那片冰冷的大陆。整个城市突然消失得无影无踪。我……"
G["The dead shall have their day yet."]="生死有命。"
G["The dead walk among us!"]="死者就行走在我们中间！"
G["The death knight... he's mad!"]="死亡骑士……他疯了！"
G["The death of an Explosive Hatred should destroy his shield! Quickly!"]="迸发之恨的死应该摧毁了他的护盾！赶快！"
G["The death of our flesh marked the birth of our spirit and our sacred task."]="我们肉体的死亡标志着我们灵魂和神圣使命的重生。"
G["The death of the High Inquisitor of New Avalon will not go unnoticed. You need to get out of here at once! Go, before more of them show up. I'll be fine on my own."]="新阿瓦隆大检查官的死亡必然会引起敌人的注意。你最好立刻离开！快跑吧，趁敌人还没有涌上来。我会照顾好自己的。"
G["The death of this land ends with your life!"]="只要结果了你，这片土地就不会再有死亡！"
G["The deck is ruined.  Pick up another mop and try again."]="甲板被毁了。再拿把拖把重新尝试吧。"
G["The decomposition of the planet and its living organisms into base elements: metals, rocks, gases. This is followed by a period of reconstitution of each element into the original planetary blueprint."]="行星自身与其所承载的生命体将解离为基础元素：金属、岩石和气体。随后，这些元素将按照最初的行星蓝图完成重组。"
G["The deed is done! The Magistrate is dead-- to the shadows, my brethren."]="成功了！镇长已经被干掉了！弟兄们，撤退！"
G["The deed is done.  The totem is made."]="图腾做好了。"
G["The deeds are mine, brother! Soon you shall be out of my way for good!"]="兄弟，这些契约是我的！很快你就将永远从我眼前消失了！"
G["The deeds of your $r servant defy $g his:her; stature, Stormlord. $g His:Her; efforts have succeeded in softening the hearts of my people."]="Los actos de tu sirviente $r desafían su naturaleza, Señor de la Tormenta. Sus esfuerzos han conseguido ablandar los corazones de mi gente."
G["The defection of Voren'thal and his followers was the largest loss ever incurred by Kael's forces. And these weren't just any blood elves.  Many of the best and brightest amongst Kael's scholars and magisters had been swayed by Voren'thal's influence."]="沃雷塔尔和他的追随者们的变节是凯尔萨斯有史以来所遭受到的最严重的损失。他们不是一群普通的血精灵，凯尔萨斯手下很多最睿智、最强大的学者和魔导师也被沃雷塔尔的影响力动摇了。"
G["The defenders of the temple are hold strong on the ground, while the Order of the Cloud Serpent fights from above. Working together, we will dispel the sha from our home."]="寺院的守卫者在陆地上死守，而云端翔龙骑士团则在空中作战。只要齐心协力，就一定能将煞赶离我们的家园。"
G["The defense of Stoneplow is more important than you may know.\n\nIf the mantid take Stoneplow, they may as well take this entire valley. Beyond this wall, there is nothing to stop them from sweeping through the entirety of Pandaria."]="守卫石犁村的意义或许比你所了解的还重要。\n\n如果螳螂妖拿下了石犁村，他们就能顺势夺下整个谷。越过这道墙后，就没有什么能够阻止他们彻底扫平整个潘达利亚的了。"
G["The defilement of this sacred resting place comes to an end now!"]="这片神圣的安息之地终于恢复了宁静！"
G["The delights of death await you."]="死亡的喜悦在等着你。"
G["The demon is loose!  Quickly we must restrain him!"]="恶魔逃脱了！我们必须尽快制止他！"
G["The demon's fire has burnt out in my veins. I have... freed myself."]="恶魔的火焰不再灼烧着我的躯体。我……解放了自己。"
G["The demons are no longer attacking... what happened here?!"]="恶魔停止攻击了……这里出什么事了？！"
G["The demons are no longer pouring from the palace. We can move ahead."]="宫殿里不再涌出恶魔。我们可以前进了。"
G["The demons in D-Block have been giving us trouble since we got here.  Can you help us out?"]="自从我们到这里来之后，恶魔监狱中的恶魔一直在给我们惹麻烦。你能帮助我们吗？"
G["The demons should all be leaving. We will be at the palace in no time."]="恶魔应该都离开了。我们很快就能进入宫殿。"
G["The demons should be in no doubt that we are their nemesis and, though they wish our destruction, it is we who will bring about their ruin.  Kazzak and his forces will be diminished and defeated by this coalition.  And to do this, we must throw at them our bodies and hearts, for they seek no less than the obliteration of this world."]="恶魔们应该知道，我们就是他们的末日。虽然他们希望毁灭我们，但最终被毁灭的将是他们。卡扎克和他们的爪牙们将会被我们打败。但是为了这个目标，我们必须以自己的血肉之躯来阻止他们。"
G["The demons, our old foes from eons passed, once again show their beastly visage.  But do not falter, for fear is one of their many weapons.  And a weapon most deadly it is."]="恶魔，我们自古以来的敌人，再次露出他们凶残的面貌。但是不要颤栗，因为恐惧是他们的武器，是他们最致命的武器。"
G["The depths consume you!"]="被深渊吞噬吧！"
G["The depths will consume you!"]="深渊将会吞噬你们！"
G["The deserter...\n\nWhat do you want, $c?  We are busy defending our camp and don't have time for cowards.\n\nSpeak to me when my temper subsides."]="$gEl desertor:La desertora;...\n\n¿Qué quieres, $c? Estamos ocupados defendiendo nuestro campamento y no tengo tiempo para cobardes.\n\nVen a hablar conmigo cuando se me pase el malhumor."
G["The desperate Klaxxi have resorted to digging up fossils. Very well: let us finish this."]="我看到绝望的卡拉克西已经沦落到去挖化石了。好极了，让我们做个了结吧。"
G["The destruction of Dalaran is inevitable!"]="达拉然注定要毁灭！"
G["The details of the posting call for the execution of an enormous wolf.  She apparently keeps her den to the south of the Jagged Ridge, near the Horde stronghold."]="公告上写着去杀死一头凶恶的狼的内容。她的巢穴就在锯齿山的南面，靠近那里的部落要塞。"
G["The device indicates you are very close to the anomaly."]="仪器表明你已经非常接近异常位置了。"
G["The dice do not lie!"]="骰子不会说谎！"
G["The dig site is just north of here."]="那个挖掘站就在这里的北面。"
G["The dimensional barrier is broken! TAKE THEM NOW! FOR THE BANSHEE QUEEN!"]="空间障碍物被打破了！现在，展开进攻！为了女妖之王！"
G["The dirge of Karabor howls to the heavens."]="卡拉波的挽歌向天空发出嚎叫。"
G["The dirge of Karabor returns to the elements."]="卡拉波的挽歌变回了元素生物。"
G["The discharged electricity has manifested itself as an elemental!"]="避雷针施放的电能形成了一个元素生物！"
G["The disease has been cured and you feel normal again!"]="疾病已经被治愈，你感到再次恢复正常！"
G["The dishes that Alegorn whips up are to die for.  He's always busy preparing new delicacies over in the Craftsman's Terrace.  Be sure to try his Cenarion Green recipe if he has any left.  \nNow, if you don't mind, I must investigate this rash of missing deer."]="Los platos creados por Alegorn son para morirse. Siempre está ocupado preparando nuevas delicias en el Bancal del Artesano. No olvides probar su receta Verde Cenarion, si es que aún le queda algo. \n\nAhora, si no te importa, tengo que investigar la ola de ciervos desaparecidos."
G["The dishonor of failure in combat is eternal."]="比武场上的败者将带着羞耻离开尘世。"
G["The disruptor towers over charged the crystalforge, and uncovered more secrets!  Hold them!  Hold them while we gather new data!"]="瓦解炮塔使得水晶熔炉充能过度，由此揭示了更多的秘密！给我守住！在我们收集新数据时守住！"
G["The dissension within the Council of Three Hammers must come to an end."]="三锤议会的内讧必须终止。"
G["The disturbances in the tomb, they must be involved. Look around you, $n. Do you see them?"]="坟墓在骚动，他们一定被卷进来了。看看你的四周，$n。你看见他们了吗？"
G["The doctor entrusted me with the plans to Nergeld, our flesh giant amalgamation made entirely of vargul! It will be the most powerful creation of its kind and a whole legion of them will be created to destroy your pitiful forces!"]="博士委托我执行关于尼尔盖德的计划，那可是完全由瓦古制成的血肉巨人！它将成为最强大的血肉巨人，只要有一整支这样的巨人组成的部队，你们就全都玩完了！"
G["The doctor is in!"]="医生来了！"
G["The doctor is out..."]="医师不在了……"
G["The doctor is... IN!"]="医生……来了！"
G["The dog stares blankly at the wall..."]="那条狗茫然地盯着墙壁……"
G["The dog tilts its head, as if wondering what you're thinking."]="狗狗歪着脑袋，似乎在猜测你在想什么。"
G["The dog wags its tail happily."]="狗狗欢快地摇着尾巴。"
G["The dog wags its tail happily. It heads toward your farm!"]="狗狗欢快地摇着尾巴。朝你的农场奔去了！"
G["The door barring the North Tower has been breached!"]="封锁北部塔楼的大门被攻破了！"
G["The door barring the South Tower has been breached!"]="封锁南部塔楼的大门被攻破了！"
G["The door is open, Kharan. You are a free man."]="卡兰，门开了。你自由了。"
G["The door mechanism seems to have activated with the demise of the guardians. I fear what we may find within."]="随着守卫的死去，大门的装置似乎被激活了。不知我们会在里面有何遭遇。"
G["The door seal is about to collapse! All is lost if the Blue Dragonflight breaks through the door!"]="牢门的封印即将崩溃！如果蓝龙军团攻破大门，一切都完了！"
G["The door to The Den of Mortal Delights has opened."]="通往欢愉之园的大门打开了。"
G["The dormant vrykul keels over."]="沉睡中的维库人摔倒在地。"
G["The draenei champion walks among us. This is a celebration for the savior of Azuremyst and Bloodmyst!"]="德莱尼人的勇士和我们在一起。为秘蓝岛和秘血岛的救世主欢呼吧！"
G["The draenei grand master jewelcrafter, Hamanar, may be found among his people on the Aldor Rise."]="德莱尼人的宗师级珠宝匠哈曼纳尔在奥尔多高地，和他的同胞们在一起。"
G["The draenei of the Exodar cheer for $n."]="埃索达的德莱尼人为$n而欢呼。"
G["The draenei... it's almost too much to believe. But if they follow the Light, they can't be that bad."]="德莱尼人……根本不可相信。不过如果他们是圣光的追随者，应该也坏不到哪儿去。"
G["The drafts of fresh air that blow from Eversong from time to time really upset my stomach, if you know what I mean."]="从永歌森林时不时吹来的新鲜空气让我的胃感觉很不舒服，如果你知道我是什么意思的话。"
G["The drag master escapes from the outhouse and gestures wildly up at the speedbarge."]="拖车管理员从厕所里逃了出来，对着赛艇平台疯狂地做手势。"
G["The dragon hides behind a royal facade. The tablets will reveal her for what she is... If what I have seen holds true, I will not survive this battle, friend. It is you that must finish what I have started. Are your forces ready? Are you ready? We will begin on your command."]="El dragón se oculta tras una fachada real. Las tablillas revelarán lo que realmente es... Si lo que he visto es cierto, no sobreviviré a esta batalla. Eres tú quien tendrá que terminar lo que yo he empezado. ¿Están listas tus tropas? ¿Estás $glisto:lista;? Comenzaremos cuando des la orden."
G["The dragon is stronger than you, hero! Do not let him finish his attacks!"]="巨龙比你更强大，英雄！别让他完成攻击！"
G["The dragon you're looking for goes by the name \"Creed.\""]="El dragón que buscas, responde al nombre de \"Creed\"."
G["The dragonflight will... devour you."]="黑龙军团会……毁灭你的。"
G["The dragons have bought us an opportunity to seize the gates from the Twilight's Hammer. We would do well not to waste it."]="巨龙给了我们从暮光之锤手中夺取大门的机会，我们一定要善加利用。"
G["The dragons have bought us an opportunity to sieze the gates from the Twilight's Hammer. We would do well not to waste it."]="巨龙给了我们从暮光之锤手中夺取大门的机会。我们一定要善加利用。"
G["The drake under you is mortally wounded and about to fall! Move to another drake, quickly!\n|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_hook_01.blp:32|t"]="¡El draco sobre el que vuelas está mortalmente herido y a punto de caer! ¡Rápido, cámbiate a otro draco!\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_hook_01.blp:32|t"
G["The dreadlord who commands this undead army is called Tichondrius.  He controls a powerful warlock artifact called the Skull of Gul'dan.  It is responsible for corrupting these forests."]="领导这支亡灵大军的恐惧魔王名叫提克迪奥斯。他控制着一个名为古尔丹之颅的强大术士神器。那就是这片森林堕落的根源。"
G["The dreadlord who commands this undead army is called Tichondrius. He commands a powerful warlock artifact called the Skull of Gul'dan."]="统率这支亡灵大军的恐惧魔王名叫提克迪奥斯。他拥有一件强大的战争宝物，被称为古尔丹之颅。"
G["The dream brew that you sampled earlier can expand your consciousness and show you events transpiring around the land. I will teach you how to use it properly, and we will find your prince!\n\nBut first, help me to create a fresh batch."]="你早些时候品尝的洄梦仙酒可以强化你的感觉，让你看到游离在世界之外的东西。我会教你如何正确使用，我们将会找到你的王子！\n\n但首先，请帮我酿一批新酒。"
G["The drink in the kegs is divine.  Drink up, $c!"]="小桶里的酒太棒了。干杯，$c！"
G["The drowned god's heart is black ice."]="那溺死之神的心有如黑冰。"
G["The druid, Kal, often spends his time at the moonwell in Dolanaar.  I am certain he would be able to provide you with the training you require."]="德鲁伊训练师卡尔通常待在多兰纳尔的月亮井。我想他可以对你进行训练。"
G["The druids and sentinels prefer to keep separate company, but we have always worked well together.\n\nNever mistake privacy for aversion."]="德鲁伊和哨兵们喜欢各干各的，但我们的合作总是很默契。\n\n各自为政并不代表合不来。"
G["The druids are holding a great celebration of Lunar Festival in Moonglade. If that's too far to walk, they're transporting people from the big cities."]="德鲁伊们在月光林地举行春节庆典。要是那里对你来说太远了，他们正在各大城市提供着传送服务。"
G["The druids of Azeroth hold a great celebration in the Moonglade. If you find the lunar festival revelers in the city, they can transport you there."]="艾泽拉斯的德鲁伊们正在月光林地举办一场大型庆典。如果你在城市里找到春节狂欢者，他们可以把你传送到月光林地。"
G["The druids of DEHTA support your efforts here in Hyjal."]="在海加尔山，仁德会的德鲁伊将支持你的行动。"
G["The druids of Nighthaven are holding a great celebration in Moonglade for the Lunar Festival."]="永夜港的德鲁伊们正在月光林地举办一个隆重的春节庆祝活动。"
G["The druids protect me from the naga and evil Lost Ones.  In exchange, I teach them about the plants and animals of the marsh."]="德鲁伊们保护我不受邪恶的纳迦和失落者的伤害。作为交换，我向他们传授有关这片沼泽中的植物和动物的知识。"
G["The druids say that it is only a matter of time until nature itself drives the Horde from Kalimdor. Yet corruption continues to spread throughout our lands, even here on Teldrassil."]="德鲁伊们说大自然把部落从卡利姆多赶出去只是个时间问题。然而堕落继续在我们的大地上蔓延，甚至在泰达希尔这里也是。"
G["The duel will begin in..."]="决斗即将开始……"
G["The dumb boys think this is a good hiding place."]="傻小子们觉得这里是个完美的藏身点。"
G["The duty of a clan mother is to listen. To listen to the wind and the water and the fire and the earth. To gather information for her clan in the way others gather furs to stay warm. It is the spirits that I commune with... In my dreams, Mother Kashur speaks to me like the spirits that spoke to her once... When I pass, I will speak to Drakia and Celestine in this manner.\n\n<Greatmother Geyah smiles.>"]="部族母亲的职责就是倾听。倾听风、水、火和大地。从它们那里收集对氏族有用的信息，就像氏族中的其他人收集皮毛以供大家御寒一样。与我交流的正是灵魂……在我的梦里，卡舒尔宗母就像灵魂和她谈话那样对我谈话……当我去世之后，我会以相同的方式和德拉吉亚和塞雷斯蒂谈话。\n\n<盖亚安祖母微笑着。>"
G["The dwarf appears to have been discovered and slain in the midst of a spy mission. The Deathforge's attendants have left the corpse in the open, perhaps as a warning to other would-be interlopers."]="这个矮人似乎是在执行侦察任务时被发现而惨遭杀害。死亡熔炉的随从们把他曝尸荒野，也许是用来警告其他的入侵者。"
G["The dwarf barreled forward with a sound like rolling thunder and hurled a shining metal hammer, lightning coursing over its surface, directly into the jormungar's throat."]="高山矮人带着闷雷般的吼声向前冲去，将一把闪亮的金属锤直接掷进了冰虫的喉咙，我的父亲还看见金属锤的表面环绕着闪电。"
G["The dwarf belongs to our kind now!  Not yours!"]="现在这个矮人属于我们了！滚开吧！"
G["The dwarf coughs, sputters, and shivers in the cage."]="关在笼里的矮人一面咳嗽，一面打喷嚏，全身都在颤抖。"
G["The dwarf seemed lost, having no memory of where he came from, or even of his own name. Not being the kind to leave a dwarven cousin to die in the snow, my father's party took him in and continued back towards Frosthold."]="高山矮人似乎迷了路，不记得自己是从哪儿来的，甚至不记得自己的名字。他们不忍心将这位表亲丢在冰天雪地里，于是收留了他，然后踏上了返回冰霜堡的旅途。"
G["The dwarf speaks the truth.  If you wish to commune with the elements you must do so from the heart."]="那矮人说得没错。如果你希望与元素交流，你就必须具备发自内心的诚意。"
G["The dwarven weapon master Buliwyf can train you in both one and two-handed axes. He's found in the Timberline Arms in Ironforge."]="矮人武器大师布里维夫能教你怎么使用单手斧和双手斧。你可以在铁炉堡的密林武器店找到他。"
G["The dwarves all burst out in laughter."]="矮人们突然都大笑起来。"
G["The dwarves have kept us safe in their home for some time now, and for that we thank them.  However, the traitorous Thermaplugg's occupation of our home must at last come to an end.\n\nGnomeregan has festered beneath the atomic weight of our ill-conceived plan for too long. The detonation of the radiation bombs drove us from our city, but we now possess the technology to take it back!\n\nWe will regain what is ours... and bring Thermaplugg to justice!"]="我们在矮人王国中得到了庇护。因此，我们对矮人感激不尽。但瑟玛普拉格对诺莫瑞根的统治应该到头了。\n\n我们犯下的大错让诺莫瑞根承受了太长时间的毒害。辐射炸弹曾经让我们彻底失去家园。现在，我们终于掌握了恢复家园的技术！\n\n我们必须夺回诺莫瑞根，让瑟玛普拉格得到正义的审判！"
G["The dwarves of Ironforge begin a cheer for $n."]="铁炉堡的矮人为$n而欢呼。"
G["The eagle spirit of the Hinterlands be on our side now, $n.\n\nWith her idol free from the Vilebranch, I can transport you straight to it on the upper tier of Jintha'Alor. Strike at their hearts!"]="辛特兰的鹰之魂已与我们同在，$n。\n\n有了从邪枝那里取回的神像，我就能直接把你传送到辛萨罗的上层。直击他们的要害！"
G["The early bird gets the worm, but the patient pandaren receives a hearty brew."]="早起的鸟儿有虫吃，但耐心的熊猫人才有美酒喝。"
G["The earth TREMBLES!"]="大地，颤抖吧！"
G["The earth beneath our feet groans and shudders. Fire rains down from the sky. The air chokes away all life. This is truly the realm of the Fire Lord."]="大地在我们脚下战栗，呻吟。火雨从空中倾泻而下。生灵在炽热的空气中窒息。这才是炎魔之王的国度。"
G["The earth elementals have turned on us. Get onto the field and hold them back!"]="土元素转而攻击我们了。快到战场上阻击他们！"
G["The earth has come to claim you, cult!"]="大地来夺你性命了，邪教！"
G["The earth has much to offer us, so long as we learn to take from it properly. I can teach you how, if you so wish."]="只要我们学会如何适当地索取，大地就会给予我们许多馈赠。如果你愿意的话，我会教你如何做。"
G["The earth itself weeps in its suffering. Gather its tears, and use them to seal the portal at the Great Tree. The connection to the Dream must be cut."]="大地在因痛苦而啜泣。收集它的眼泪，用它们去封闭位于符印巨树的传送门。与梦境的联结必须被割断。"
G["The earth keeps many secrets, $c; it is our duty to ensure that those that must remain a secret for the good of all stays as such."]="大地中蕴藏着许多秘密，$c。保护这些秘密是我们永远的职责。"
G["The earth shall swallow you!"]="让大地吞没你！"
G["The earth spirits are very much present in this chamber, my child. After all, we are underground, are we not?"]="大地之灵在这里出现得非常频繁，我的孩子。毕竟我们是在地下，对吗？"
G["The earth will devour you!"]="大地将吞噬你们！"
G["The earth will never falter!"]="大地绝不会动摇！"
G["The easiest creature for you to summon is the imp. You should already be able to bring forth this minion but for completeness' sake I will start with him."]="最容易召唤的是小鬼。你的能力也许已经远远超过召唤小鬼的水平，但是我们为了保证召唤教学的完整性，所以还是从召唤它开始吧。"
G["The east gate of the Alliance keep has been destroyed!"]="联盟要塞的东门被摧毁了！"
G["The east gate of the Alliance keep has been destroyed."]="联盟要塞的东门被摧毁了！"
G["The east gate of the Horde keep has been destroyed!"]="部落要塞的东门被摧毁了！"
G["The east gate of the Horde keep has been destroyed."]="部落要塞的东门被摧毁了！"
G["The east."]="东边。"
G["The eastern bridge has been damaged!"]="东边的桥梁遭到破坏！"
G["The eastern bridge has been destroyed!"]="东边的桥梁被摧毁了！"
G["The eastern mountains of Thousand Needles crumbled into the waters and the South Sea poured in. All is lost."]="千针石林的东部山脉崩塌入海，南海的海水倾灌而入。什么都没剩下。"
G["The eastern sewers entrance is just outside the entrance to Krasus' Landing."]="东部下水道的入口在克拉苏斯平台的入口外面。"
G["The eastern tower has been damaged!"]="东边的哨塔遭到破坏！"
G["The eastern tower has been destroyed!"]="东边的哨塔被摧毁了！"
G["The ebbs and flows of battle are to be expected."]="战斗中总是免不了会有高潮和低谷。"
G["The eclipse of Azeroths' moons is an occurrence that we of the blue dragonflight hold most sacred."]="艾泽拉斯的月蚀之夜是我们蓝龙军团举行大部分神圣仪式的日子。"
G["The egg appears resilient as an egg of the Black Dragonflight rightfully should.  Perhaps if you were to place a great many apexis shards next to it, their vibrations would cause it to crack open?"]="这枚龙卵看上去和正常的黑龙卵一样富有弹性。如果你在它附近放上一些埃匹希斯碎片，它们的震动或许能让龙卵裂开？"
G["The egg appears resilient as an egg of the Black Dragonflight rightfully should.  Perhaps if you were to place a great many apexis shards next to it, their vibrations would cause it to crack open?\n\nToo bad that you don't appear to have the thirty-five apexis shards necessary to do the job."]="这枚龙卵看上去和正常的黑龙卵一样富有弹性。如果你在它附近放上一些埃匹希斯碎片，它们的震动或许能让龙卵裂开？\n\n可惜这样做需要35块埃匹希斯碎片，你身上没有足够的水晶。"
G["The eggs in one of the lower nests begin to hatch!"]="下层某个鸟巢中的蛋开始孵化了！"
G["The eggs in one of the upper nests begin to hatch!"]="上层某个鸟巢中的蛋开始孵化了！"
G["The elder is right, we should find a diplomatic solution with the hozen."]="长老是对的，我们应该用外交手段解决和猢狲的争端。"
G["The elder is very busy with important matters. Please come back at another time."]="长老正在处理要务。请改天再来吧。"
G["The elders of my village taught me that wisdom flows through every river, and collects in every pond. I can't wait to learn what the waters of this place have to offer.\n\nThe elders of my village also taught me that one should never trust a hozen.\n\n<Ashyo shoots a wary glance over at Ken-Ken.>"]="村里的长者曾教导我，每条河流里都流淌着智慧，每个池塘中汇聚着知识。我等不及想要知道这里的水能告诉我什么了。\n\n村里的长者还教导我，绝不要相信猢狲。\n\n<阿西约警惕地瞥了一眼肯肯。>"
G["The elders were right; you really can't judge a book by it's cover."]="长者们说得对——人确实不可貌相。"
G["The elders will hear of your kindness."]="长老们会听到你的善行的。"
G["The element of air here is restless. Beware... they will not let you pass unharmed."]="附近的气元素躁动不安。小心……它们不会让你安全通过的。"
G["The elemental forces are relentless. I fear we'll not be able to hold this breach forever. Not without more help."]="元素大军无穷无尽。如果得不到援助的话，我们恐怕没办法守住这个突破口。"
G["The elemental spirits are restless..."]="元素之魂躁动不安……"
G["The elementals are clearly outnumbered."]="那些元素显然寡不敌众。"
G["The elementals are grossly outnumbered."]="那些元素完全寡不敌众啊。"
G["The elements are fickle and best left out of untrained hands.  My apologies, but I have no need for yours."]="元素变幻莫测，没有受过训练的双手很难控制它们。很抱歉，我并不需要你。"
G["The elements are undying! Make use of your time before they rise again!"]="元素是不灭的！在它们复活前，利用好你的时间！"
G["The elements are with us in force, $n. With their help, we will do all that is in our power to stop Varimathras and Putress! LOK'TAR OGAR!"]="元素之灵与我们同在，$n。在它们的帮助下，我们可以竭尽全力阻止瓦里玛萨斯和普特雷斯的阴谋得逞！LOK'TAR OGAR！"
G["The elements chaotic and wild. Only through learnin' can we keep in touch wit' them and keep them controlled."]="元素混乱而且狂野。只有通过学习，我们才能保持和它们的联系并控制它们。"
G["The elements demand vengeance!"]="元素要复仇！"
G["The elements favor you.  What will you ask of them?"]="元素在眷顾你。你要向它们要求什么？"
G["The elements guide only true Primalists, $C. They do not hear your call."]="Los elementos guían solo a verdaderos Primalistas, $C. No escuchan tu llamada."
G["The elements in Azeroth are becoming more disturbed each passing day.  The key to this disturbance lies here, in Nagrand.  When Draenor was torn apart, all of the elemental planes were thrown into great turmoil and have never recovered.  The rifts here form naturally and are a sign of a severely damaged world.\n\nTo see this same kind of disruption on Azeroth is not just unnerving, it could be a precursor to a type of destruction the world has never seen before.\n\n$n, bring me any information you may find when walking around Outland.\n\nI must spend time with the elements here, researching a way to calm the elements again in Azeroth...before it's too late."]="随着时间的推移，艾泽拉斯的元素变得越发躁动。平息这躁动的关键就在此地——纳格兰。当德拉诺分崩离析之时，所有元素位面都陷入了极大的混乱之中，再也没有恢复平静。这里的裂隙是自然形成的，也彰显着大地所遭受的重创。\n\n在艾泽拉斯看到像这样的崩裂之景并不仅会让人心神不宁，还可能预示着一场前所未见的大毁灭将降临在这个世界上。\n\n$n，把你在外域找到的任何有用信息都带回来给我。\n\n我必须花些时间来解决这里的元素问题，想办法让艾泽拉斯的元素再次平静下来……再晚就来不及了。"
G["The elements of the brew are too chaotic! I do not know what will happen if they combine now!"]="酒的成分太混乱了！我不知道要是现在把它们合在一起，会发生什么事！"
G["The elements shield me!"]="元素庇护着我！"
G["The elements speak to us, $c.  They share knowledge that we must learn, and they share secrets that must be kept."]="元素在跟我们讲话，$c。他们分享着我们必须掌握的知识以及不能泄漏的秘密。"
G["The elements themselves will rise up against the civilized world! Only the faithful will be spared!"]="元素之力必将崛起，夺回这个被文明玷污的世界！只有最虔诚的信徒才能幸免于难！"
G["The elements will crush you!"]="元素会将你们彻底毁灭！"
G["The elements will not die! Make use of your time before they rise again!"]="元素是不灭的！在它们复活前，利用好你的时间！"
G["The elements... what have we done..."]="元素……我们干了什么……"
G["The elixir... give it to me, Severin!"]="把药剂……给我，瑟维里！"
G["The elves speak of a moon goddess, did you know? They put great stock in the light given by the moon."]="精灵们都在谈论一位月亮女神，你知道她吗？他们非常重视月亮发出的光芒。"
G["The emperor is very near; fought doubt, hate, rage, despair, and fear."]="皇帝就快成功了，他击败了猜忌、仇恨、暴怒和恐惧。"
G["The emperor rules ALL!"]="帝王统御万物！"
G["The emperor will be most pleased when I present him with your head, Shado-Pan."]="等我将你们的脑袋呈上去，陛下一定会很满意的，影踪派。"
G["The empress I served was also frightened and paranoid. Ultimately it was her fear that lead to her demise."]="我的女皇也恐惧和偏执。她的恐惧最终导致她的灭亡。"
G["The empress demands it!"]="这是女皇的意志！"
G["The empress has spies everywhere."]="女皇的间谍无处不在。"
G["The enchanter Sedana is currently accepting apprentices, I believe. You'll find her in one of the alcoves within the Court of the Sun."]="我相信附魔师瑟丹娜正在招收学生。你可以在逐日王庭的某个亭子里面找到她。"
G["The end comes for you!"]="你的末日到了！"
G["The end days are nigh!"]="末日即将来临！"
G["The end draws nigh! Even as we speak our supplies are being shipped to Silithus and should arrive within $2113w days. Once there I am sure that all we be assembled in quick order, and then we'll be awaiting the ringing of the gong at the gates to Ahn'Qiraj to start the war. I look forward to analyzing whether our preparatory efforts will make a difference."]="大功告成！所有的战争物资将如约运往希利苏斯，货物将在$2113w天内抵达。我想我们会迅速做好准备工作，然后等待有人敲响铜锣，打开安其拉的大门。我真想知道我们付出的努力在这场大战中会起到什么样的作用。"
G["The end draws nigh! Even as we speak the last of our supplies are being shipped to Silithus and should arrive within a day. Once there I am sure that all we be assembled in quick order, and then we'll be awaiting the ringing of the gong at the gates to Ahn'Qiraj to start the war. I look forward to analyzing whether our preparatory efforts will make a difference."]="大功告成！所有的战争物资将如约运往希利苏斯，货物将在1天内抵达。我想我们会迅速做好准备工作，然后等待有人敲响铜锣，打开安其拉的大门。我真想知道我们付出的努力在这场大战中会起到什么样的作用。"
G["The end has come!"]="末日来临了！"
G["The end is at hand!"]="末日就在眼前！"
G["The end is come!"]="末日就要来临了！"
G["The end is here! The end is now!"]="就是这里！就是现在！终结已经到来！"
G["The end is near, brothers!  This plague eats us from within!"]="末日临近了，兄弟们！我们会被彻底吞噬！"
G["The end is nigh!  The end is a new beginning!"]="一切即将终结！结束就是新的开始！"
G["The end is nigh! That Which Must Not Be Named is almost free!"]="末日即将降临！那位不可名状之存在就要重获自由了！"
G["The end is now, Fordring."]="弗丁，该结束了。"
G["The end is upon us!"]="我们的末日到了！"
G["The end is upon you!"]="你的末日临近了！"
G["The end is upon you."]="你的生命正走向终结。"
G["The end is upon you.  Enter... oblivion."]="末日降临。万劫…不复。"
G["The end of Operaton: Gnomeregan meant a chance to rest for most people. However, my assistants and I have been caring for the wounded and for the survivors that the S.A.F.E. teams rescue from inside the city."]="诺莫瑞根行动的结束对大多数人来说意味着终于有了喘息的机会。然而我的助手和我却一直忙于救治那些救援人员从城里救出的伤病员和幸存者。"
G["The end of Thermaplugg's reign draws near!"]="我们将终结瑟玛普拉格的统治！"
G["The end of all approaches. The unmaking is at hand. (End of all! The curtain falls!) Do not fail me."]="万物的毁灭已经临近。覆亡就在眼前。（万物的毁灭！帷幕已落下！）不要让我失望。"
G["The end of all things is upon us!"]="万物的终结即将来临！"
G["The end of days is upon us! May the earth embrace my flesh and bones."]="世界末日就要降临了！让大地吞噬我们的血肉吧！"
G["The end of our empire... is only the beginning..."]="帝国的覆灭……不过是个开始……"
G["The end of our world nears, my brothers and sisters! Azeroth will be no more!"]="世界的末日已经近了，兄弟姐妹们！艾泽拉斯将不复存在！"
G["The end of the world approaches, but there is time to set things right, $c."]="世界末日即将到来，但现在还有时间纠正一切，$c。"
G["The end of the world is at hand!"]="世界末日即将到来！"
G["The end of the world nears, $c. There is no need to despair. Hear what I say and what my brethren have to offer."]="$c，世界末日就要到了。但不需要绝望。听听我所说的，看看我的兄弟所给予你的一切吧。"
G["The end rapidly approaches! Surrender yourselves to Eranikus and be spared eternal suffering!"]="末日就快要来临了！向伊兰尼库斯投降，从永恒的痛苦中解脱出来吧！"
G["The end, Dalfors. I'm thinking about how close we are to seeing an end to the Scourge."]="末日，达尔弗斯。我们还要多久才能看到天灾军团的末日呢。"
G["The endless might of the Jade Armies is mine to control!"]="无穷无尽的碧玉军团归我掌握！"
G["The endless waters will cleanse you from this place!"]="无尽的洪水将你们逐出这片土地！"
G["The enemies of the Light must be defeated!"]="圣光的敌人必须被消灭！"
G["The enemy approaches from the south.  Ready your weapons!"]="敌人们从南方逼近了。准备战斗！"
G["The enemy approaches.  Use the Move ability to move the Ramkahen Champions to the southern ramp.\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\misc_arrowleft.blp:64|t"]="敌人在靠近。用移动技能将拉穆卡恒勇士移至南方坡道。\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\misc_arrowleft.blp:64|t"
G["The enemy grows stronger! Aid me!"]="敌人越战越勇！快帮帮我！"
G["The enemy has fought well, for Alliance...but they grow weary."]="就联盟而言，敌人的表现还不错……但他们已经显出疲态了。"
G["The enemy is among you!"]="敌人就在你们中间！"
G["The enemy is upon us!  Stand your ground!"]="敌人就在我们眼前！守住你们的阵地！"
G["The enemy is upon us, stand ready!"]="敌人过来了，准备作战！"
G["The enemy shall suffer greatly, master!"]="敌人即将大难临头，主人！"
G["The enemy will not get past us!"]="敌人不会过我们这关的！"
G["The energy infused within my clutch is mine to reclaim!"]="灌注在巢群中的力量将由我自己收回！"
G["The energy; I can feel it!"]="能量……我能感觉到！"
G["The engine got too cold!\nAll pressure was lost."]="引擎过冷了！\n压力消失。"
G["The engine got too hot!\nPressure was lost."]="引擎过热了！\n压力消失。"
G["The engine shifted properly!\nNice work!"]="引擎正常运转了！\n干得好！"
G["The engine's blown!  Fly Vic's Flying Machine back to Lakeside Landing!"]="引擎爆炸了！快将维克的飞行器开回湖边着陆场！"
G["The engine's blown!  Fly Zak's Flying Machine back to K3!"]="引擎发动了！扎克的飞行器即将返回K3！"
G["The engineer here is called Franklin Lloyd. He tinkers in the Rogues' Quarter, on the outer ring."]="弗兰克林·洛伊德是这里的工程师。他平时都在盗贼区外环区域修修补补。"
G["The engines are back online! Full speed ahead! We can't let Deathwing escape!"]="引擎恢复工作了！全速前进！我们不能让死亡之翼逃了！"
G["The enormous stone shimmers with focused arcane energy."]="这块巨大的石头闪烁着聚焦的奥术能量。"
G["The enormous stone shimmers with focused arcane energy.\n\nIf Andorel's instructions are to be believed, it should be easy to refocus the stone's energies."]="这块巨大的石头闪烁着集中起来的奥术能量。\n\n如果安多瑞尔的指示是可信的，它就应该能轻易地重新集中这块石头的能量。"
G["The entrance is barricaded. Break it down!"]="入口被挡住了。把它砸开！"
G["The entrance is hidden here in Moonbrook.  Keep your eyes peeled for thieves.  They want me dead."]="入口就隐藏在月溪镇里。注意那些盗贼，他们想要我的命。"
G["The entrance to Warsong Gulch stands before you. Will you fight the wretched Alliance there?"]="战歌峡谷的入口就在你的前面。你会和这些肮脏的联盟战斗到底吗？"
G["The eons have awakened me."]="亘古的呼唤唤醒了我。"
G["The ered'ruin have had no master since Archimonde's death. Now I shall be that master."]="自从阿克蒙德死后，埃雷杜因就失去了主人。现在，我将成为他们的新主人。"
G["The essence of Chi-Ji dissipates, leaving a scattered trail of stardust."]="赤精的精魂消散了，只留下漫天的星尘。"
G["The essence of Niuzao rumbles in acceptance of your aid."]="砮皂的精魂低声感谢了你的帮助。"
G["The essence of Tarecgosa is with you."]="泰蕾苟萨的精魄与你同在。"
G["The essence of Xuen roars triumphantly and disperses into celestial dust."]="雪怒的精魂发出胜利的咆哮，爆散成一天星尘。"
G["The essence of Yu'lon smiles warmly at you as it fades into the sky."]="玉珑的精魂温和地对你笑了笑，慢慢消失在天空中。"
G["The esteemed Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen can train you further.  He can be found in Theramore treating the wounded at the barracks."]="倍受尊敬的古斯塔夫·范沃森医生能进一步训练你。他在塞拉摩的兵营里治疗伤兵。"
G["The eternal fire will never be extinguished."]="永恒的烈焰不会熄灭。"
G["The ethereals set up shop in the upstairs corridor to the right as you enter the main building.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="虚灵的商店开在楼上的走廊里，就在主建筑物进门的右手边。\n\n我会在你的地图上标出位置。"
G["The events of that dark day are hereby forgiven by my people.  They shall never again be spoken of."]="我们决定宽恕你在黑暗时代的所作所为。不会再有谁提起那些往事了。"
G["The events that take place here will forever change this land."]="在这里发生的事情将永远改变这片土地。"
G["The evil emanating from the crystal shard has lured one of the colossi.  Put it down quick!"]="水晶碎片中散发出的邪恶光芒引来了一只巨人，快点消灭它！"
G["The evil in these stones is strong, but it has been dispelled."]="这些石头中蕴含的邪恶力量非常强大，但是它已经被驱散了。"
G["The excecutioner has arrived!  Ready the prisoners!"]="刽子手们已经就位了！把俘虏们准备好！"
G["The excitement of the crowd, the thrill of the fight - you should have seen it!  Ever since those ogres took control of the Dire Maul arena, I've been forced to camp out here.  Griniblix the Spectator - ha!  Spectator of what?  This campfire?  That shrub?  Or how about this odd purple tree?\nListen, if you're looking for a fight, Skarr was headed towards the Lariss Pavilion, and The Razza was soaring in the direction of the New Thalanaar.  Just be sure to let me in on the betting before the bloodbath begins!"]="El entusiasmo del público, la emoción de la lucha... ¡deberías haberlo visto! Desde que los ogros se hicieron con el control de la Arena de La Masacre, me he visto obligado a acampar aquí. Griniblix el Espectador. ¡Ja! ¿Espectador de qué? ¿De esta fogata? ¿De ese arbusto? ¿O de ese extraño árbol púrpura?\n\nMira, si buscas pelea, Skarr iba de camino al Pabellón Lariss y El Razza volaba hacia Nueva Thalanaar. ¡Tú solo asegúrate de dejarme entrar cuando comience el baño de sangre!"
G["The exiles of Gnomeregan find ourselves in even more dire straits by running low on cloth reserves!  Perhaps you can help us, eh?!\n\nBring me extra cloth pieces you might have to help us replenish our stocks.  By donating them, you'll be earning the respect and trust of gnomes everywhere.  That's something that money can't buy!  Well, I guess cloth does, but that's beside the point..."]="诺莫瑞根的流亡者需要大量的布料资源！也许你可以帮帮我们，是不是？\n\n把你多余的布料资源带给我们。通过捐献它们，你可以获得所有侏儒的尊重。这是金钱无法换得的！好吧，布料可以帮助我们，但是它们意义绝不限于这些……"
G["The existence of your kind has not escaped our notice, $c."]="你们的存在逃不出我们的注意，$c。"
G["The exit is to the northwest... the mist will lead the way."]="出口在西北方……薄雾会引领道路。"
G["The expendable have perished. So be it! Now I shall succeed where Sargeras could not! I will bleed this wretched world and secure my place as the true master of the Burning Legion! The end has come! Let the unravelling of this world commence!"]="这个消耗品已经没用了！不管它了！现在我已经做到了连萨格拉斯都没有做到的事情！我要彻底毁灭这个世界，真正成为燃烧军团的主宰者！末日已经到来啦！让这个世界就此支离破碎吧！"
G["The explosives!\n\nGood work, $n. Not a moment too soon."]="炸药！\n\n干得好，$n。你来得正是时候。"
G["The extent of the corruption in Outland is truly astonishing, $c. The Cenarion Circle hopes to understand how these creatures have managed to survive. Studying this broken, tortured land and its inhabitants may yet teach us how to heal ailing parts of our own world."]="外域被污染的范围之大非常令人震惊，$c。塞纳里奥议会希望去了解这里的生物是怎么生存下来的。了解这个破碎、扭曲的世界和它的居民，也许我们可以学习到治愈我们自己世界的方法。"
G["The eyes of Hellscream are upon us!"]="地狱咆哮之眼在注视着我们！"
G["The eyes of Hellscream are upon you."]="地狱咆哮的双目在注视着你。"
G["The eyes of the angry hozen are upon you, ooker."]="生气的猢狲正盯着你看呢，死家伙。"
G["The eyes of the great lord Sargeras can see your betrayal, your desires, your utter destruction!"]="伟大的君主萨格拉斯将看到你的背叛，你的欲望，还有你彻底的毁灭！"
G["The eyes... I can't stop thinking about it's eyes!"]="那眼睛……在我脑海中挥之不去！"
G["The fabric of which our world is woven is most delicate. It merely takes some knowledge and the application of said knowledge to tear the fabric. It is thusly that rifts are born."]="世界的构造精妙细致。只靠某些知识和对已知知识的应用是不可能破坏世界构造的。裂缝也由此产生。"
G["The faceless generals, Zon'ozz and Yor'sahj, command the enemy legions from within the monstrosities you see on the horizon."]="在地平线的那边，两名无面者将军，佐诺兹和约萨希，指挥着一支邪恶的军团。"
G["The fact that you are here is a first step... a correct choice if you will, in aiding Ysera's Dragonflight.\n\nYou may be here for purely the lure of personal gain, or you may be here because you are morally compelled.  Neither reason is important on its own, but both are in fact critical to this end: The agony that Eranikus endures is what rousted me from my Dream, and it is now my charge to see his torment ended.  I now ask you to aid me in this quest."]="El hecho de que estés aquí es el primer paso... se trata de una elección acertada, si quieres, si se trata de ayudar al Vuelo de Ysera.\n\nTal vez estés aquí atraído por el mérito personal, o bien porque te sientes moralmente obligado. Ninguna de estas razones es importante por sí misma, pero ambas son ciertamente primordiales para lo que nos ocupa: La agonía que padece Eranikus es lo que me despertó de mi Sueño, y ahora tengo que encargarme de poner fin a su tormento. Ahora te pido que me ayudes en mi misión."
G["The failed concoction spills on the floor and appears to come to life!"]="调配失败的混合物溅到了地板上，呈现出了奇特的生命迹象！"
G["The faint of heart may wish to shield their eyes! Being brought into the ring now is a horror, captured from the dark tunnels of the Centipaar Hive! I give you the skittering death: SARINEXX!"]="胆小的人简直恨不得遮住自己的眼睛！现在登场的是——来自森提帕虫巢黑暗隧道深处的恐怖斗士！跟我一起向着死亡奔跑吧——有请萨里尼克斯！"
G["The faire is my family.  I would never leave my family."]="马戏团就是我的家。我永远离不开它。"
G["The faire kept me from an execution.  It saved my life."]="马戏团让我逃过一死。它救了我的命。"
G["The faire seems to bring out all the lookers!"]="马戏团好像把所有的观众都引来了！"
G["The faithful shall be exalted, but there is more work to be done. We will press on until all of Azeroth lies beneath his shadow!"]="信徒们，你们有理由高兴与欢呼，但我们仍有许多未尽的事业。在整个艾泽拉斯都被他的阴影笼罩之前，我们还要继续努力！"
G["The faithful shall serve by HIS side!  Aiiiiigh!!!"]="忠诚的信徒将侍奉在他身边！啊！！！"
G["The falcon is vanquished, doomed never to rise again! Your quest is futile!"]="猎鹰被击败了，它注定再也不会出现了！你的任务失败了！"
G["The fallen heroes of Valhalas emerge from the ground to do battle once more!"]="瓦哈拉斯的英雄之魂现身了，准备再次投入战斗！"
G["The fallen of Pal'ea will not rest, son.  Find the naga priestess!"]="孩子，帕尔依的亡魂无法安息。找到纳迦女祭司的下落！"
G["The false Kingpin has fallen thanks to you adventurers."]="假首脑终于被消灭了，感谢你们，冒险者。"
G["The farmers from the nearby fields bring their wheat, and we mill and sort the grains here.\n\nSome of the grain will be made into food, some of it is traded, but most of it is sent to the Stormstout Brewery for... you guessed it... beer!"]="附近地方的农夫把他们的大麦送到这里，我们磨成面粉并对谷物进行分类。\n\n有些谷物要做成食物，有些谷物拿去卖掉，但大部分都送到风暴烈酒酿造厂……你猜对了……酿啤酒！"
G["The farmers pray for rain, but I don't! It's terrible for business. Just look at my market! Sopping wet!"]="农民祈求降雨，但我不！雨天对做生意来说非常糟糕。看看我的市集！湿透了！"
G["The farmers, the bricklayers, the shepherds and the smiths... they all bowed before Kang. \"Teach us,\" they said. \"Teach us to fight.\""]="Los granjeros, los albañiles, los pastores, los herreros... Todos se inclinaron ante Kang. \"Enséñanos\", les dijeron. \"Enséñanos a luchar\"."
G["The farms must be liberated.  Stormwind may have deserted these people, but I'll be damned if I will."]="我们必须解放这些农田。暴风城已经抛弃了这些人，但如果我们也这样做，那我会感到羞耻。"
G["The farstriders keep a smith at their retreat in the eastern portion of Eversong. Arathel might be able to help you."]="远行者们在他们永歌森林东部的居所留下了一位铁匠。阿拉瑟尔也许能帮到你。"
G["The faster we can get to the other side of the front, the faster we can reduce Needlerock Slag to rubble."]="我们越快赶到前线的另一侧，就能越快把针石熔渣场毁成碎石堆。"
G["The faster you race, the better your prize."]="速度越快，奖励就越丰厚。"
G["The fat one! He'll make for a nice sacrifice."]="就是那个肥家伙！他会是个好祭品。"
G["The fate of Azeroth hinges on the deeds of a mortal druid."]="El destino de Azeroth depende de lo que haga $gun druida:una druida; mortal."
G["The fate of Azeroth hinges on the deeds of a mortal mage."]="El destino de Azeroth depende de lo que haga $gun mago:una maga; mortal."
G["The fate of Azeroth hinges on the deeds of a mortal priest."]="El destino de Azeroth depende de lo que haga $gun sacerdote:una sacerdotisa; mortal."
G["The fate of Azeroth hinges on the deeds of a mortal shaman."]="El destino de Azeroth depende de lo que haga $gun chamán:una chamán; mortal."
G["The fate of Azeroth hinges on the deeds of a mortal warlock."]="El destino de Azeroth depende de lo que haga $gun brujo:una bruja; mortal."
G["The fate of the world hangs in the balance!"]="这个世界危在旦夕！"
G["The fates have turned against me!"]="命运在与我作对！"
G["The fear clouds my mind. I... cannot resist."]="恐惧攫住了我的心神。我……无力抵抗。"
G["The feast has arrived! DIE!"]="美味大餐来啦！去死吧！"
G["The feast of corruption is no more! Magtheridon has fallen to the battle prowess of $n and $g his:her; allies! Witness the might of the Alliance! A pit lord commander is destroyed!"]="¡El festín de la corrupción ha sido eliminado! ¡Magtheridon ha sucumbido a la destreza en batalla de $n y sus aliados! ¡Observad el poder de la Alianza! ¡Un comandante señor del foso ha sido destruido!"
G["The feast of souls begins now..."]="灵魂的盛宴即将开始……"
G["The features of this jade statue are incredibly lifelike.  The expression on the face is one locked in horror.\n\nIt does not resemble Shin however."]="这座青玉雕像栩栩如生，面部表情十分惊恐。\n\n不过，看上去并不像阿信。"
G["The features of this jade statue are incredibly lifelike. The expression is locked in horror."]="这座青玉雕像栩栩如生，面部表情十分惊恐。"
G["The fel crystalforge can be used to transform your apexis shards into unstable flasks of the beast.  These flasks make the imbiber more agile, stronger and heartier.\n\nIt appears, however, that you do not have the ten shards necessary to purchase even a single flask."]="邪能水晶熔炉可以将埃匹希斯碎片转化成不稳定的野兽合剂。这种合剂能让饮用者变得更加敏捷、强壮和更具活力。\n\n但是10块埃匹希斯碎片才能购买1瓶合剂，你身上的碎片数量不够。"
G["The fel crystalforge can be used to transform your apexis shards into unstable flasks of the beast.  These flasks make the imbiber more agile, stronger and heartier.\n\nMake your choice, below."]="邪能水晶熔炉可以将埃匹希斯碎片转化成不稳定的野兽合剂。这种合剂能让饮用者变得更加敏捷、强壮，并且更具活力。\n\n来吧，做出你的选择。"
G["The fel energies also had the side-effect on the Broken and the Lost Ones of cutting us off from the Light. At the time I did not know exactly why, but as a vindicator I insisted on finding out. I decided to make a pilgrimage to do just that.\n\nAnd so it was that after the war came to its fateful end, I journeyed into the desert of the fragmented planet, beseeching the Light to return to us. But decades passed, and the Light never answered my prayers.\n\nIs this something that you wish to hear more of?"]="那些魔能作用在我们破碎者和失落者身上，切断了我们和圣光之间的联系。那时我完全不知道这到底是怎么回事，但是作为一名守备官，我一定要找出答案。于是我决定为了这个目的进行一次朝圣。\n\n因此在战争结束之后，我来到了那个破碎世界的沙漠中，祈求圣光回到我们身边。但是十年过去了，圣光从未答复我的祈祷。\n\n你还想听下去吗？"
G["The felhound... a vicious creature indeed. It is not as physically strong as an infernal, but a wise warlock knows that brute force is not always the answer--if it was, you would have chosen the path of a warrior instead, wouldn't you?\n\nThe felhound draws upon the mana of its foes, using that and its quickness to overcome enemies. Its strength comes from the arcane and using that arcane power for its own ends.\n\nIf you wish to know more about infernals, then you should speak to Magaz across from me."]="地狱犬……确实是一个邪恶的生物。它不像地狱火那样强壮，但是聪明的术士知道蛮力不总是解决的办法——如果是，你就会选择战士了，不是吗？\n\n地狱犬利用敌人的法力，用它和它的迅速来战胜敌人。它的力量来自奥术并利用那种奥术能量为自己谋利。\n\n如果你想得知更多关于地狱火的事，那么你该找我对面的玛迦兹谈谈。"
G["The felhounds are always hungry for magic to devour."]="地狱猎犬总是渴望能吞噬更多的魔法。"
G["The felhunter approaches! Be on your guard!"]="地狱猎犬来了！做好准备！"
G["The felhunter just tilts its head and stares at you strangely."]="地狱犬歪着头，奇怪地看着你。"
G["The feralfen that dwell in Zangarmarsh have wicker baskets with clever locks on them.  Surely they would challenge even your skill."]="居住在赞加沼泽的蛮沼部族背着带锁的篮子，你应该有兴趣去挑战一下自己的技能。"
G["The festival has begun! Invite your friends!\n\nBe sure not to miss the fireworks at the beginning or end of the festival. They're the most important part."]="庆典已经开始了！快去邀请你的朋友们吧！\n\n千万别错过庆典头尾的烟火表演。那是最精彩的部分。"
G["The festival is saved!"]="节日得救了！"
G["The festival of the moon was ever more important to the kaldorei. The great festival of the druids is surely in full swing."]="对卡多雷而言，春节是最重要的节日。德鲁伊举办的庆典总是非常热闹。"
G["The festival reminds me of how beautiful Kun-Lai is."]="这个节日让我意识到昆莱山是多么美丽。"
G["The fields will run red with the blood of the Scarlet Crusade!"]="血色十字军的鲜血将染红大地！"
G["The fiend of a thousand faces."]="千面的恶魔。"
G["The fight against Kael'thas and Illidan continues on all fronts.  Defeat is not an option."]="与凯尔萨斯和伊利丹的战斗仍然在前线继续进行着。我们只可成功，不许失败。"
G["The fight is THAT way, $R."]="战斗是这么打的，$R。"
G["The fight isn't over yet!"]="战斗还没有结束呢！"
G["The fighter spirit is about to hit you in the face!"]="战斗的精髓就是拳拳打在你脸上！"
G["The fighting remains fierce and costly, but your assistance has proven invaluable."]="战斗是惨烈和代价沉重的，但是你的援助却无法用价值来衡量。"
G["The fighting skills of my companion are quickly becoming legendary among the Shado-Pan."]="我同伴出色的战斗技巧已经迅速在影踪派中传开了。"
G["The figure at the front of the ruined chamber gestures and mouths inaudible words as a group of other spirits sit in rapt attention."]="破败的大厅前，一位幽灵用肢体和口型传达着无声的语言，另一群幽灵则坐在地上，聚精会神地听着。"
G["The filth pool is more rancid than I've ever seen it. We need to get somebody in here to clean up before it gets any worse and starts spreading outside the crag."]="我从没见过这么臭的污水池。我们需要找人来清理一下，免得它继续发展并扩散到峭壁外面。"
G["The final battle against the naga has begun. We will destroy them or gloriously die trying in the Abyssal Breach."]="对纳迦的最后一战已经打响。我们将根除他们，或在深渊裂口里光荣地奋战至死。"
G["The final battle against the naga is imminent. We will triumph or die trying in the Abyssal Breach."]="对纳迦的最后一战即将打响。我们将取胜，或在深渊裂口里奋战至死。"
G["The final battle for Kalimdor is upon us. The supreme commander of the Might of Kalimdor orders his troops to march upon Ahn'Qiraj and destroy all in their path."]="决定卡利姆多命运的终极之战即将拉开帷幕。卡利姆多联军的最高指挥官下令所有部队立即开赴安其拉，扫清一切敌人。"
G["The final battle will begin soon, $n. Stand at attention!"]="最后的决战即将开始，$n。保持警惕！"
G["The final charge is set. Stand back!"]="全部准备就绪。后退！"
G["The final death knight, Lord Mograine, was the finest warrior that the death knights had ever seen. However, after the events in Azeroth, he vanished without a trace. It is yet to be seen who Kel'Thuzad has appointed in his place."]="最后一位死亡骑士是大领主莫格莱尼。他曾经是一名杰出的战士，最优秀的死亡骑士在他面前也会黯然失色。但是，当他在艾泽拉斯经历了一系列的变故后，便消失得无影无踪了。目前还不知道克尔苏加德指派了谁来取代他的位置。"
G["The final ingredient, a secret passed down through generations of my family, comes all the way from the Krasarang Wilds. I sent Assistant Buzaki to pick it up for me a few days ago, and received word that he reached the Tavern in the Mists last night. Can you head into the Ancient Passage and find out what's keeping him? He better not still be asleep at the tavern!"]="最后一种成分，是我们家族世代相传的秘密，来自于卡桑琅丛林。我几天前派了助手布扎齐去寻找这种成分，收到的消息是他昨天晚上到达了迷雾酒肆。你能前往远古之路去看看是什么让他耽搁了吗？他最好不要在酒馆里睡过了头！"
G["The final piece of the World Pillar has been recovered!  We have only to bind it together to prevent this realm from collapsing into Azeroth."]="世界之柱的最后一块碎片被复原了！我们必须将它们重组到一起以阻止这个世界向艾泽拉斯崩塌。"
G["The final sanctum of crazed zealots. 'Tis where they create their scarlet uniforms, magically imbued by the enchanted scarlet thread!\n\nTo Stratholme, adventurer!"]="那些疯狂的信徒的最后一处圣地。他们在那制作红色制服，使用的就是魔化红线！\n\n冒险家们，向斯坦索姆城前进！"
G["The final shred of light fades, and with it, your pitiful mortal existence!"]="最后一缕光也消失了，你们这些可悲的凡人也将随之消逝！"
G["The final step, we add heat! Smell that aroma!"]="最后一步，加热！闻闻那香气！"
G["The final wave of hozen ships has come to attack!"]="最后一波猢狲舰船来袭了！"
G["The finest preservative of flesh known to man and Scourge alike - Frostwhisper's embalming fluid.  Only one place an adventurer could find this and one would think that the lich the fluid is named after would not take too kindly to anyone going to said place.\n\nBut... if it's the fluid you want, the Scholomance you'll haunt..."]="人类和亡灵天灾所知的最好的肉类防腐剂——莱斯·霜语的防腐液。这种防腐剂只能在一个地方找到，人们认为这东西得名于巫妖，要去那种地方一定不是件容易的事儿。\n\n但是……如果这正是你想要的东西，就去通灵学院吧……"
G["The fire spirit is upset. It's dangerous to enter the shrine now..."]="上古火灵十分烦躁。现在进入神龛是很危险的……"
G["The fire's coming!"]="火要烧起来了！"
G["The fires consuming the Tormented Protector wink out!"]="受折磨的保护者身上一直燃烧着的火焰熄灭了！"
G["The fires dim, champions....  Take this, the last of my power.  Succeed where I have failed.  Avenge me.  Avenge the world...."]="火焰即将熄灭，勇士们……带上我最后的力量。继承我未竟的事业。替我复仇。替这个世界复仇……"
G["The fires threaten to destroy all of Orgrimmar.  If you think you are strong enough to go in there, be my guest.  Otherwise, stay out of the city and let us take care of it."]="大火要将奥格瑞玛全部吞噬。如果你认为自己强大到足以进去，那么请便。否则，就留在城外，让我们来对付它。"
G["The fires, they are burning the library! Please, heroes! Purge this evil before the temple crumbles to ash!"]="大火席卷了藏书阁！拜托了，英雄们！在寺庙化为灰烬之前，净化这邪恶之力吧！"
G["The fires...torment me no longer.  But...I am consumed..."]="烈焰不再折磨我了。但我也消耗殆尽了。"
G["The first challenge requires you to be mounted on an Argent Battleworg.  You will find these mounts along the walls of this coliseum.\n\nPlease, mount the battleworg, speak to me, and then we can proceed."]="El primer reto requiere que estés $gmontado:montada; sobre un huargo de batalla Argenta. Encontrarás estas monturas a lo largo de los muros del Coliseo.\n\nMonta en el huargo y habla conmigo para que podamos continuar."
G["The first challenge requires you to be mounted on an Argent Warhorses.  You will find these mounts along the walls of this coliseum.\n\nPlease, mount the warhorse, speak to me, and then we can proceed."]="El primer reto requiere que estés montado sobre un caballo de guerra Argenta. Encontrarás estas monturas a lo largo de los muros del Coliseo.\n\nMonta el caballo de guerra, habla conmigo y entonces podremos continuar."
G["The first fragment was going to be delivered to us by a Horde gunship known as the Storm's Fury.  It never made it here."]="第一块碎片本应由一艘名叫风暴之怒的部落炮艇给我们送来。但它始终没抵达。"
G["The first gate, Agamath, has been dismantled! The second gate of Rohendor now blocks our passage.\n\nOur mages are $3255w percent through the defenses of the second gate, Rohendor."]="第一道屏障，阿加麦斯，已经被摧毁了！现在第二道屏障洛希多尔挡住了我们前进的道路。\n\n我们的法师已经摧毁了洛希多尔百分之$3255w的防御屏障。"
G["The first group that came - the Trolls... they cared nothing for us - walked right past us, pushing our families out of the way.\nThe next, though - the mercenaries. They took us prisoner, stole from our homes, and threatened us with death if we resisted."]="El primer grupo que vino, los trols, no se preocupó nada por nosotros; pasó de largo apartando a nuestras familias.\n\nPero los siguientes, los mercenarios, nos hicieron prisioneros, nos robaron y nos amenazaron con matarnos si nos resistíamos."
G["The first is a primal token that must be taken from the most powerful of the Hakkari lieutenants: Jin'do and the Bloodlord.\n\nThe second is a punctured voodoo doll. These can be found in the piles of refuse that litter this foul place. Look inside the jinxed Hoodoo piles.\n\nBring me these things and I will create a powerful enchantment for you!"]="El primero es un objeto primigenio que protegen los tenientes más poderosos de Hakkari: Jin'do y el Señor de la Sangre.\n\nEl segundo, es un muñeco de vudú agujereado. Puedes encontrarlo en las pilas de desperdicios que hay esparcidas por todas partes. Busca dentro de los montones hudú malditos.\n\nTráeme esos objetos y crearé un poderoso encantamiento para ti."
G["The first kill goes to me! Anyone care to wager?"]="肯定是我首开记录！有人敢打赌吗？"
G["The first lock of the Thrice-Locked cage clicks and falls to the ground. Two Remain."]="三重锁的囚笼上的第一道锁“喀啦”一声掉在了地上，还剩两道锁。"
G["The first of many."]="这只是第一个。"
G["The first of the Alliance towers has fallen! Destroy all three and we will hasten their retreat!"]="联盟的第一座塔楼已经被摧毁了！只要我们扫平全部三座塔楼，敌人就不得不撤退了！"
G["The first of the Horde towers has fallen! Destroy all three and we will hasten their retreat!"]="部落的第一座塔楼已经被摧毁了！只要我们扫平全部三座塔楼，敌人就不得不撤退了！"
G["The first rule of roll club: you don't talk about roll club.\n\nThe second rule of roll club: if it's your first time, you roll."]="翻滚俱乐部的第一条规则：不要议论翻滚俱乐部。\n\n翻滚俱乐部的第二条规则：如果是你的第一次，你就翻滚吧。"
G["The first stage is over.  Big Will... come on down!"]="第一阶段结束了。比格维尔……该你上了！"
G["The first step to learning is to admit that you have much to learn."]="学习的第一步就是承认自己的无知。"
G["The first steps of our fight against the Scourge go well. We have had some successes, and hopefully my assistance can aid you in bringing future success to the battle."]="我们针对天灾军团的第一步战役进行得非常良好。我们已经获得了一些胜利，希望我的协助能让你取得更多的胜利。"
G["The first suit of Dreadnaught armor was made exclusively for the Scarlet Highlord Mograine.  Whilst donning the full suit, the Highlord looked himself to be a demon from the depths of the Nether.\n\nAye, 'twas quite a sight to behold as Mograine would wade into a hundred Scourge, Ashbringer held high, and come out on the other side in a cloud of dust and flames - enemies left in ashes beneath his feet."]="世上第一套无畏护甲是专为血色十字军领袖莫格莱尼设计并锻造的。当穿上全套的无畏护甲之后，这位大领主看上去就像是一位来自扭曲虚空的恶魔。\n\n哎……我至尽还忘不了那时的情景，莫格莱尼高举着灰烬使者，在成百上千的天灾军团士兵中穿入穿出，燃烧着敌人与自己的生命，带起一阵阵烈炎与烟尘，身后留下敌人被烧成灰烬的尸骸。"
G["The first thing you need to learn is proper discipline."]="你要学会的第一件事就是遵守纪律。"
G["The first time I saw mushrooms taller than trees, I wasn't so sure I could call this place home. After a while you just stop noticing."]="那是第一次我看到比树还高的蘑菇，我不是确定是否可以把这个地方当做家。过了一会儿你才转移了视线。"
G["The fish are biting like crazy down in Krasarang!\n\nI'd still be out on the sea, reeling in the big one, but I came here to sell this morning's catch. Got lots of hungry mouths to feed here!"]="卡桑琅的鱼简直凶猛至极！\n\n我本该继续留在海上，跟那大家伙较劲，可我得来这里贩卖今早的收获。有好多饥肠辘辘的人正张嘴等着吃饭呢！"
G["The fish is exquisite, Jessica."]="这鱼棒极了，杰希卡。"
G["The fish know all the secrets. They know the cold. They know the dark."]="鱼群知道所有的秘密。它们熟知寒冷。它们熟知黑暗。"
G["The fish off the coast of Teldrassil are quite large and robust.  Rumors say it is the speedy growth of our new world tree that is the cause."]="泰达希尔海岸边的鱼儿又大又精神。有传言说那是因为我们新的世界之树的快速增长而引起的。"
G["The fissure closed and Krixix was gone! Swallowed whole!\n\nBe warned, $r, what you wish for could very well become that which you do not want. You play with beings and arcana that are older than time itself!\n\nShould Krixix be alive and should he have the information which you seek, you can be certain that he will not give up said information. He has faced terrors far worse than you could ever dream to perpetrate."]="裂缝闭合了，克里希克死了！完全被海水吞没了！\n\n你要小心，$r，你所期望的事情很可能成为你不愿意看到的事情。你所面对的是比事件本身还要古老的生物和魔法！\n\n如果克里希克还活着，如果他知道你要找的讯息，你是不用指望他会告诉你的。他所经历的远远比你想象的要多。"
G["The fists of an Orc are already a powerful weapon, so why not add blades or studs of solid steel. Now the fists I use to tame the wolves of the plains I can also use to shatter the armor of my foes."]="兽人的拳头已经是一种强大的武器了，所以为什么不给它们再加上用坚硬的钢铁做成的刀刃或是大头钉呢？我以前用来驯服野狼的拳头现在足以用来击碎敌人的装甲。"
G["The flag carriers have become increasingly vulnerable to attack!"]="旗手变得更加脆弱了！"
G["The flag carriers have become vulnerable to attack!"]="旗手变得脆弱了！"
G["The flag has been dropped!"]="旗帜被扔掉了！"
G["The flag has been reset."]="旗帜被重新放置了。"
G["The flag is a nice touch.  I bet a few more accessories will really make this rocket stand out."]="我们的成绩不错。我打赌，只要再增加一些部件，这支火箭一定能成为万众瞩目的焦点。"
G["The flags are now placed at their bases."]="旗帜被重新放置在了它们的基地中。"
G["The flagship's last reported position was below. Can you see anything?"]="旗舰最后报告的位置就在下方。你能看见什么吗？"
G["The flames are truth!"]="烈火即真理！"
G["The flames burn hotter!\nGood job!"]="火焰温度升高了！\n干得好！"
G["The flames of Ragnaros will burn you all."]="拉格纳罗斯的怒火会将你们烧成灰烬。"
G["The flames... never cease..."]="永不……熄灭的烈焰……"
G["The flames... they lick... they bite... always biting..."]="烈火……它们舔舐……它们叮咬……痛苦的叮咬……"
G["The flamewakers up ahead mean business. Be careful in there."]="前边的火妖可不是吃素的。小心点。"
G["The flare launcher has been emptied."]="信号弹发射器已清空。"
G["The flaw of mortality...."]="软弱的凡人……"
G["The fleet is ready, $n. You must take this beacon and place it at the eastern crater of the central battlezone. Defend the beacon from attackers until the fleet is able to lock on to its coordinates!"]="空军部队整装待发，$n。你必须带上火炬，把它放在战场中心的东部环形山中。在空军部队进行定位时，你必须好好保护火炬！"
G["The fleet is ready, $n. You must take this beacon and place it at the western crater of the central battlezone. Defend the beacon from attackers until the fleet is able to lock on to its coordinates!"]="舰队整装待命，$n。你必须带着这个信号灯并把它放置在中央战区西部的凹地里。保护信号灯不被攻击，直到舰队能够锁定它的坐标！"
G["The fleet was mostly intact as it limped into harbor after our engagement with the Horde. We weighed anchor in the shadow of Highbank here to regroup.\n\nThen the naga came.\n\nScaly, glistening hands clambering up the anchor chains... dragging men, screaming, into the depths...\n\nThese are cursed shores, $n. Cursed."]="La flota estaba intacta en su mayor parte cuando se arrastró hasta el puerto después de nuestro enfrentamiento con la Horda. Echamos el ancla al abrigo de Bancalto para reagruparnos.\n\nEntonces vinieron los nagas.\n\nManos escamadas y brillantes que trepaban por las cadenas de las anclas... y arrastraban a los hombres a las profundidades mientras estos no dejaban de gritar...\n\nSon costas malditas, $n. Malditas."
G["The flesh is weak!  Only fire purifies!"]="肉体是软弱的！必须被火焰净化！"
G["The flesh is weak. We will make you better, stronger... faster."]="血肉之躯太脆弱了。我们能让你变得更加完美、强壮……敏捷。"
G["The flight from Grom'gol to Undercity is beautiful, though uneventful.  Though that is no excuse to fall asleep on the job."]="尽管从格罗姆高营地到幽暗城的航线平淡无奇，但是一路上的风景秀色宜人。可是这并不能成为工作时候睡着的理由。"
G["The flight master is located out on the main terrace, at the top of the twin stairs and before you enter the main building.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="飞行管理员位于主露台上，就在你进入主楼之前所看到的双楼梯的最上层。\n\n我会在你的地图上标记这个位置。"
G["The flora of Un'Goro Crater are quite remarkable, to be sure.  Wouldn't you agree, $n?"]="安戈洛环形山中的这种花是非常特别的。你说对不对，$n？"
G["The flow of darkness abates. It seems you truly are the heroes of legend."]="黑暗之潮退去了。你们果真是传说中的英雄。"
G["The flowers are blooming at this time of year. They smell so fragrant!"]="鲜花每年都在这个时候盛开，它们真香啊！"
G["The flutter of the wings of a hawk, the breath of a ram in the snow, the pace of a bear through the forest... Such is life for the hunter."]="老鹰翅膀的扇动，雪地里山羊的喘息，熊穿过森林的脚步……这就是猎人的生活。"
G["The fog is rolling in..."]="浓雾正在翻涌……"
G["The food, there is something wrong with the food!"]="食物，食物有问题！"
G["The foolish weaklings of the Alliance and Horde make their way to the Twilight Highlands as we speak. (FOOLS! Blind and weak and tasty...)"]="就在我说话的时候，愚蠢而软弱的联盟与部落正在接近暮光高地。（愚蠢！盲目！软弱！而且美味……）"
G["The fools! I knew they'd try this, which is why I fire-proofed the plague tanks. Muahahahahaha!"]="那群笨蛋！我就知道他们会这么做，但是他们没有料到我事先做了防火处理。哈哈哈哈哈哈！"
G["The foot bone's connected to the... hip bone!  The hip bone's connected to this... other bone!  Hmmmhmmmmhmmm..."]="足骨……连接到髋骨！髋骨再……再连接到这里好了！嗯嗯……"
G["The footlockers of Kil'sorrow Fortress in Nagrand would provide a considerable challenge to even a rogue of your notable skill."]="Los baúles de la Fortaleza Mata’penas de Nagrand sería un reto considerable incluso para $gun pícaro:una pícara; de tu notable habilidad."
G["The forces of Niuzao are weak!"]="砮皂的部队不堪一击！"
G["The forces of the Aldor and Scryers stormed the citadel shortly after Akama and his foul brethren slew Al'ar. Its a good thing we left Illidan as soon as we did."]="在阿卡玛和他卑鄙的同党们干掉奥之后不久，奥尔多和占星者的军队就对黑暗神殿发动了攻击。还好我们及时离开了伊利丹。"
G["The forces of the Scourge bear down upon us.  Take heart, and fight on!"]="天灾军团如潮水般向我们涌来。战斗吧！"
G["The forces of the Sentinel Army hold back the Horde across all of Kalimdor. While the war continues in Ashenvale and Stonetalon, our forces are also needed here, to protect these remaining wilds and prevent our enemies from gaining further footholds."]="哨兵部队在卡利姆多各地阻挡部落的攻势。当灰谷与石爪山相继被战火席卷之时，这里也需要我们的帮助——我们要保护那些仅存的野生动植物，并阻止我们的敌人攻占更为纵深的据点。"
G["The forces we are up against here go beyond the Twilight's Hammer, Ragnaros or even Deathwing.  We must succeed here if our world is going to survive at all."]="我们在此对抗的势力远远不止暮光之锤、拉格纳罗斯甚至是死亡之翼。我们惟有取胜才能确保我们的世界不至于消亡。"
G["The forest is crawling with Horde, $c. Be mindful of your surroundings!"]="$c，这片森林里到处都是部落。一定要时刻警惕周围的动静！"
G["The forest is crawling with worgen and ghouls.  Something must be done!"]="森林里到处都是狼人和食尸鬼。我们必须有所行动！"
G["The forest is on the western side of Wintergrasp. Just look for the soul-leeching shades, I'm sure they'll be glad to have some company..."]="森林就在冬拥湖的西部边缘。你只要找那些吸食灵魂的幽灵就行了，它们肯定会很高兴有人来做伴的……"
G["The forest shakes and shudders! The winds howl! Does the Forest Lord approach?"]="森林剧烈震动起来！飓风咆哮！森林之王要来了吗？"
G["The forest sings with the seeds of change, but it also cries out in pain.\n\nOur new friends, the draenei, are here to help us, like you. We must put an end to the destruction of my brother and sister trees before all is lost and Ashenvale is no more."]="森林在为变革的种子而歌唱，但也还在因为痛苦而哭号。\n\n德莱尼人是我们的新朋友，他们像你一样在帮助我们。我们必须阻止那些兽人继续摧毁我的树木兄弟和姐妹。否则，灰谷将不复存在。"
G["The forest spirits are uneasy..."]="森林的精魂们感到相当不安……"
G["The forest told me of your presence, but not why you were here. So, speak and enlighten me."]="森林告知我你的存在，但是没有说你为什么在这里。那么，告诉我真相吧。"
G["The forests are overrun with strange beasts and a foul taint fills the air."]="森林里到处都是奇怪的野兽和被污染的空气。"
G["The forge draws power from the surrounding land. Amazing! I suspect at one time this whole island looked like the Vale of Eternal Blossoms."]="熔炉从周围的土地中抽取力量。太神奇了！我怀疑这座岛曾经也像锦绣谷一样繁华似锦。"
G["The forge is overwhelmed! We've got to leave!"]="熔炉被占领了！我们离开这儿！"
G["The forge is safe, and we must take our leave.  Good luck on your quest, adventurer."]="熔炉已经安全了，我们得走了。祝你好运，冒险者。"
G["The forge needs additonal tuning.  Look into it, slave!"]="熔炉需要额外的调整。去看看，奴隶！"
G["The forge speaks to Tinkers alone, $C. Your hands weren't made for such precise work."]="El yunque habla solo con los Ajustadores, $C. Tus manos no están hechas para un trabajo tan preciso."
G["The forgemaster is dead! Get geared up men, we have a Scourgelord to kill."]="熔炉之主已经死了！抽刀亮剑，我们要干掉天灾领主。"
G["The forgemaster is meeting with the Twilight leadership.  Trust me, I traded some gossip for a loaf of stale bread!"]="铸炉之主正在和暮光官员会面。相信我，这是我用变质面包换来的小道消息！"
G["The forgemaster's a terrible murderer.  Are you sure you want to go looking for him?"]="铸炉之主是个杀人狂魔。你确定想要去找他吗？"
G["The forked blade is ready, and we have given our gift. Please perform your incantation."]="分叉之刃已经准备好了，我们已经献出了馈赠。 施放你的咒语吧。"
G["The forsaken of the Undercity cheer for $n."]="幽暗城的被遗忘者为$n而欢呼。"
G["The fortitude of the Black Ox."]="玄牛之韧。"
G["The fortune is mine, Alexi! Your end comes soon!"]="奥蕾西娅，这些财宝是我的！你准备死吧！"
G["The four watchers of Ulduar: Freya, Thorim, Hodir, and Mimiron. The sigils are tied to their physical and mental integrity. All four sigils are required for access to the Celestial Planetarium."]="奥杜尔的四位守护者是：弗蕾亚、托里姆、霍迪尔和米米尔隆。他们的徽记与其本体及心智的完整性密切相关。要进入天文台，就必须拥有全部四枚徽记。"
G["The fragment is now in the dragon's custody, ma'am."]="碎片现在在巨龙手上，夫人。"
G["The fresh carcass is placed upon the Flame of Uzel."]="新鲜的肉被放在尤基尔之焰上面。"
G["The front gate of the Alliance keep has been destroyed!"]="联盟要塞的前门被摧毁了！"
G["The front gate of the Alliance keep has been destroyed."]="联盟要塞的前门被摧毁了！"
G["The front gate of the Horde keep has been destroyed!"]="部落要塞的前门被摧毁了！"
G["The front gate of the Horde keep has been destroyed."]="部落要塞的前门被摧毁了！"
G["The frost leopard lays here tranquilized."]="冰霜豹已经被麻醉了，静静地躺在地上。"
G["The frost runes on the ground will fling you into the air if you touch them, which can be a boon or an inconvenience."]="如果你碰到地面上的冰霜符文，就会被抛向空中。这对你也许会有好处，也许会是个麻烦。"
G["The frostborn have been very good to me. They're strong people."]="霜脉矮人对我很好。他们非常强壮。"
G["The frosthound has located the thief's hiding place. Confront him!"]="冰霜猎犬发现了小偷的藏身之所。快去对付他！"
G["The frostworg howls, exposing its prey!"]="冰霜座狼嗥叫着，它发现了猎物！"
G["The frostwyrm Rimefang gazes at $n and readies an icy attack!"]="冰霜巨龙霜牙凝视着$n，准备发动一次冰霜袭击！"
G["The frozen deep beckons, $r!  Join us!"]="$r，冰封的地狱在向你招手！跟我们走吧！"
G["The frozen heart of Icecrown awaits...."]="冰冠冰川的霜寒之心在等待……"
G["The fruit vendor has refused to accept my challenge and remove his cart.  Their ogre protector just sits and does nothing... What could his plan be?"]="水果贩子拒绝接受我的挑战，还不肯把他的马车挪开。而那些食人魔佣兵只是在一旁干坐着……他到底想干什么？"
G["The full might of the Burning Legion shall arrive soon."]="燃烧军团即将驾临。"
G["The full power of your drakes has been unlocked.  Use their power to defeat Eregos!"]="幼龙的终极力量已经解封。利用它们的力量击败埃雷苟斯吧！"
G["The fun is just beginning!"]="好玩的事才刚开始呢！"
G["The fury of the Vrykul will consume you!"]="维库人的怒火将吞噬你！"
G["The fury! The power! I have never felt so strong in all my life.\n\nSoon, ALL the Dragonmaw will feel as I do."]="那愤怒！那力量！我一生中从未感到如此强壮。\n\n很快，整个龙喉部族都将有同样的感觉。"
G["The future holds much death and uncertainty, not unlike the past."]="未来充满了死亡和不确定性，和过去并无多少不同。"
G["The future is cloudy for you two. If you work at your relationship, I'm sure you can find some measure of happiness."]="你们的未来疑云密布。如果你们双方都努力的话，我相信还是会有许多温馨的事情发生。"
G["The future of Kalimdor looks grim."]="卡利姆多未来的情势相当严峻。"
G["The game has changed."]="情况有变。"
G["The game is afoot! But you are a mere pawn, whereas I am ... THE BLACK BISHOP!"]="这场棋局已经开始！而你只不过是一个卒子。我则是……黑主教！"
G["The game isn't over yet..."]="游戏还没结束……"
G["The gap in the defenses is in this path. Mantid are sneaking past the scouts and getting around the barricade.\n\nWe need to cut them off before we find ourselves surrounded."]="这条小径便是防线的缺口。螳螂妖正偷偷绕过斥候，向我们的防御工事袭来。\n\n我们要在被包围之前截断他们。"
G["The gas tank in %s is half full."]="%s的油量只剩下一半了。"
G["The gate has been breached! Quickly, divert forces to deal with these invaders!"]="大门已经被攻破了！快，派兵去挡住那些入侵者！"
G["The gate is in sight! We're going to make it! But first, I need to take a breather."]="大门就在眼前！我们就要成功了！但是首先，我真想要个呼吸器……"
G["The gate is jammed."]="大门被堵住了。"
G["The gate must be protected at all costs. Rip them to shreds!"]="不惜一切代价保卫城门！把他们全都撕碎！"
G["The gate's meager defenses are prepared, $n. Are you?"]="大门的守卫者们已经做好了准备，$n。你呢？"
G["The gates are about to fall. Quickly! Slaughter these meddlers!"]="城门即将陷落。快！杀光这些暴徒！"
G["The gates have been breached! Defend the keep!"]="大门被打破了！保卫要塞！"
G["The gateway of your oblivion has been opened! The blood tide rises."]="通向毁灭的大门已经被打开了！让血腥的杀戮开始吧！"
G["The gathering and knowledge of herbs is a specialty of Firodren Mooncaller.  Seek him out in the Temple Gardens in the southwestern area of Darnassus."]="草药的收集和与之相关的知识是菲罗迪恩·唤月的专长。去达纳苏斯西南部的神殿花园找他吧。"
G["The gears went unshifted!\nAll pressure was lost."]="传动装置松动了！\n压力消失。"
G["The gem shatters!"]="宝石粉碎了！"
G["The gems you collected will be able to augment the power of the weapons I gave you, but I require another ingredient.  It will come from your next target."]="你收集来的这些宝石能够强化我给你的武器，但我还需要一些别的材料。它们就在你的下一个对手身上。"
G["The generals tell us that we've collected everything that we need for the upcoming Ahn'Qiraj War. Now we're just waiting for the Horde to finish their stockpiling and the transport of the war materiel can begin."]="将军说我们已经集齐安其拉一战所需的所有战争物资了。现在只等部落完成他们的收集任务，就可以开始运送战争物资了。"
G["The ghost fades away into the mist..."]="鬼魂消失在了迷雾中……"
G["The ghostly figure looks at you with mistrust in her eyes and remains silent."]="这个鬼魂一样的身影不信任地看着你，并且保持着沉默。"
G["The giant is down.  Kill it quickly!"]="巨人倒下了。快杀了他！"
G["The giant rook watches from the dead trees. Nothing breathes beneath his shadow."]="巨鸦警惕的目光在枯木间游移。在他的阴影之下，听闻不到半点儿气息。"
G["The girl got it right. Follow me."]="这姑娘说对了。跟我走。"
G["The glacier is seeping in from Icecrown... and undead everywhere!  Wait 'til the professor gets a hold of this!"]="冰川正在逐渐扩展……到处都是亡灵！先等教授控制这里的局势吧！"
G["The glimmer of your life, extinguished."]="你的生命光辉，就快熄灭了。"
G["The glory of Gurthan!"]="为了格尔桑的荣耀！"
G["The gnolls have failed, mistress."]="那群豺狼人失败了，女主人。"
G["The gnolls have never been this aggressive. What's going on, Solomon? Tell us!"]="豺狼人从没这么放肆过。到底怎么了，所罗门？快告诉我们！"
G["The gnomes of Gnomeregan cheer for $n."]="诺莫瑞根的侏儒为$n而欢呼。"
G["The gnomes used to be a nice respectful people..."]="侏儒们曾经是非常值得尊敬的种族……"
G["The goblin Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit has begun. You can find Arena Organizers selling arena team charters in Gadgetzan and outside the arenas in Nagrand and the Blade's Edge Mountains."]="热砂格斗联赛已经开始了。竞技场组织者正在加基森、纳格兰竞技场和刀锋山竞技场外兜售竞技场战队登记表。"
G["The goblin Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit is beginning soon. They're holding practice matches in their arenas now, but ranking fights begin in $4262d."]="热砂格斗联赛就要开始了。现在，地精们正在竞技场组织练习赛，正式的排位赛将在$4262d后开始。"
G["The goblin racer packs a lot of punch, but the gnomes hid a trick or two in their car..."]="地精的赛车马力强劲，但侏儒的赛车也有不少独到之处……"
G["The goblins have finally managed to take down the door leading to the upper reaches of the spire. Our magi have also successfully deactivated the first of three barriers within the sanctum. Access to the Plagueworks is now open. Get in there and crack some skulls!\n\nWe should have the barrier to the Crimson Halls open in $4939W days."]="地精们终于设法打开了通往这座塔上层的大门。我们的法师也已经成功地关闭了密室三道屏障的第一道。通往天灾工厂的大门现在已经打开。冲进去，砸碎那些骨头！\n\n再过$4939W天，我们就应该能够冲破血色厅堂的屏障了。"
G["The goblins of Smokywood Pastures always have such wonderful treats for sale this time of year."]="每年的这个时候，烟林牧场的地精们总是会出售一些非常棒的糖果。"
G["The goblins win the drag race!  Better luck next time, gnome team."]="地精赢了短程加速赛！祝你们下次好运，侏儒车队。"
G["The goblins win! The goblins win!"]="地精赢了！地精赢了！"
G["The god that the Atal'ai trolls had brought forth is to blame for this.  We destroyed the god's physical manifestation and sunk the temple, but the god was much stronger than even we had anticipated.  Its seed of corruption ran deep, twisting everything in its path.\n\nEranikus was charged to watch over the sunken temple to ensure that neither the simple Atal'ai nor their god would rise again.  He was an unwitting victim of this corruption, and we in underestimating its potency."]="阿塔莱巨魔所崇拜的神灵曾经受到惩罚。我们毁掉了他的肉身并把神庙沉入水中，但是他比我们预料中的要强大得多。堕落的种子散播开来，腐化了它所接触的一切。\n\n伊兰尼库斯负责看守沉没的神庙，以确保阿塔莱巨魔或是阿塔莱神灵都不会再死灰复燃。他是个无辜的受害者，我们低估了堕落的力量。"
G["The gods have abandoned us!"]="神已经遗弃了我们！"
G["The gods have forsaken us! We must dispose of it before Ymiron is notified!"]="神灵抛弃了我们！我们必须在伊米隆国王发现之前处理掉它！"
G["The gods have spoken, $n. We now know what you must do."]="神灵做出了指示，$n。你必须承担起这项艰难的使命。"
G["The goggles! They do nothing!"]="那副护目镜！根本就不管用！"
G["The golden lotus must protect the vale!"]="金莲必须保护山谷！"
G["The gong peals a taunting note to the mantid armies below, accelerating the pace of their assault."]="锣朝下方的螳螂妖大军发出了一声嘲讽般的巨响，加快了它们攻击的节奏。"
G["The good Doktor Professor Ironpants may be found in the Hall of Explorers."]="可以在探险者大厅内找到学者教授铁裤。"
G["The good Tullas is a noble woman, and a stalwart defender of the Light. Her lessons are taught in the inn proper."]="图拉丝是一位高贵的女士，也是坚定的圣光卫士。她在旅店内传授着她的课程。"
G["The good doctor is being modest. He knows precisely how much powder to put in the charge, down to the very grain."]="那位博士一直都很谦虚。他很清楚该填充多少炸药，甚至不会有一粒的误差。"
G["The good doctor saves the day! HOORAY!"]="医生成功了！万岁！"
G["The good sempstress is of late occupied at Saltheril's Haven; her prowess with a needle and thread is assuredly appreciated there."]="最优秀的女裁缝最近去萨瑟利尔庄园了，她的针线技艺在那里更受赏识。"
G["The gorillas are fascinating creatures.  Better than night elves, who do foolish things, like... gambling away all their money and getting put on Sea Wolf MacKinley's hit list."]="猩猩可真是令人着迷的生物。比暗夜精灵要好多了，那些家伙就只会干蠢事……比如在赌场上输个精光，还害自己登上“海狼”马克基雷的黑名单。"
G["The government of Stormwind, of the ALLIANCE, must be made accountable for what it has done to us!"]="暴风城与整个联盟的执政阶级，必须为他们对我们犯下的罪行负责！"
G["The grace with which I fight is not something I can teach you, but I can teach you the use of various weapons."]="我可没法教你战斗时如何保持优雅姿态，我只能教你如何使用武器。"
G["The grain we gather needs to be in large quantities for the brewery. But I may know of a grain that would suit your needs."]="我们的谷物是供应给酿酒厂的，量都很大。也许有一种谷物符合你的需要。"
G["The grand Amphitheater of Anguish awaits, $n. Remember, once a battle starts you have to stay in the arena. WIN OR DIE!"]="进入痛苦斗兽场吧，$n。战斗开始后，你就必须留在竞技场里。要么获胜，要么死亡！"
G["The grand Crucible of Carnage awaits, $n. Remember, once a battle starts you have to stay in the arena. WIN OR DIE!"]="伟大的杀戮熔炉正在等着你，$n。记住，当战斗开始的时候，你将无法离开竞技场。你的结局非赢即死！"
G["The grand admiral asked me to give you these bottles and to ask you to consider joining our efforts against the Horde."]="将军让我把这些瓶子带给你，还让你考虑是否愿意与我们一同对抗部落。"
G["The grand admiral studies you a moment through narrowed eyes."]="海军上将眯起眼睛，仔细地打量着你。"
G["The grand master leatherworker Darmari may be found in the lower city's open marketplace."]="在贫民窟的露天市场可以找到宗师级制皮师达尔玛里。"
G["The grapes were VERY TASTY!"]="葡萄可真香甜！"
G["The grasp of the Old Gods is unmoving. He is consumed by their dark thoughts... I... I cannot... cannot channel much longer... Elune aid me..."]="上古之神的束缚没有丝毫减弱的迹象。他完全被他们黑暗的思想所控制……我……我不能……不能引导……帮帮我，艾露恩……"
G["The grass is soft and lush. The air is fresh, full of light and song. Everything I've seen suggests that Teldrassil is a dream come true. Why, then, is my heart full of foreboding?"]="草地柔软青葱。空气清新，阳光明媚，歌声飘飘。泰达希尔的梦想终成现实。但是为什么我感到有种不详的预兆？"
G["The grave calls to us all!"]="墓穴在呼唤我们！"
G["The grave is old, peaceful, and undisturbed."]="这是个古老、宁静又安详的墓地。"
G["The graveyard on the hill is filling up faster than we can dig the holes on some days."]="这几天山上的坟墓装满的速度比我们挖洞的速度还快。"
G["The graveyards in Alterac Valley are where the souls of the deceased find rest and succor.  If you die, then your spirit will drift to the closest graveyard that our side controls."]="逝者的灵魂在奥特兰克山谷的墓地安息。如果你死了，你的灵魂将被送往最近的墓地。"
G["The great Rastakhan sends his greetings to you, member of the Alliance."]="伟大的拉斯塔哈向你致以问候，联盟的成员。"
G["The great Rastakhan sends his greetings to you, member of the Horde."]="伟大的拉斯塔哈为你送来了问候，部落的成员。"
G["The great one will be pleased."]="主人会非常高兴的。"
G["The great river flows through us all. Some prefer to surrender themselves to the water's path. Others swim toward certain shores.\n\nWhich are you, stranger? Where will your river take you?"]="El gran río fluye a través de todos nosotros. Hay quien prefiere entregarse al recorrido del agua. Otros nadan hacia la costa.\n\n¿Tú qué prefieres, $gforastero:forastera;? ¿Adónde conduce tu río?"
G["The great sea turtle Walker of Waves travels from this dock to Moa'ki Harbor in Dragonblight."]="大海龟“踏浪者”将从这个港口游往龙骨荒野的莫亚基港口。"
G["The green flight is in your debt."]="绿龙军团欠你一个人情。"
G["The grimtotem lurk in Feralas as well. They wait for the chance to strike this very camp."]="恐怖图腾也潜伏在菲拉斯。他们在等待时机，对眼前这座营地发起攻击。"
G["The grog leaks out of the barrel.  A lot of pirates are going to be very unhappy about this."]="酒从桶里漏了出来。这将会激怒很多海盗。"
G["The gronn... the Legion... is there nothing you can't handle, $n?"]="戈隆……燃烧军团……什么都难不倒你吗，$n？"
G["The ground begins to crack open!"]="地面崩裂了！"
G["The ground beneath you rumbles ominously...."]="你脚下的地面发出不祥的“隆隆”声……"
G["The ground beneath your feet lives and breathes. It may hold you steadily right now, but bring war and suffering here and it will respond in kind. Such is the way of nature."]="你脚下的大地富有生命力。别看它现在让你站得稳稳的，要是你胆敢将战祸和痛苦引来这里，它就会以牙还牙。这就是自然之道。"
G["The ground of this place is still warm from freshly shed blood.  Ah, I would have given my own eye to be here when the demons tore through that portal and clashed with Azeroth's heroes!  What a battle it was!\n\nBut now, even more fierce fighting rages on the other side!"]="这里的大地依然留有鲜血的余温。啊，恶魔飞奔着穿过黑暗之门，与艾泽拉斯的英雄们杀得昏天暗地，我真想亲眼看看这一幕。那会是多么宏大的一场战斗啊！\n\n但是现在，更多更猛烈的战斗正在另一端进行着！"
G["The ground rumbles underneath you..."]="你脚下的土地在震颤……"
G["The ground runs red with your blood!"]="翻腾的仇恨将吞没你们！"
G["The ground shakes..."]="大地在震颤……"
G["The ground upon which the Scholomance was built was given to Kel'Thuzad by the Barov family. In exchange for this land - a place where the Cult of the Damned could learn the foul magics of the Scourge - Kel'Thuzad granted the Barov's immortality through undeath.\n\nIt is in Shadow Vault that you will find both the skin of shadow and its owner, Lady Illucia Barov.\n\nA finer mirror for the vain and dead never existed."]="巴罗夫家族将通灵学院所在的土地给了克尔苏加德。作为交换这块诅咒神教可以研究亡灵天灾堕落法术的地方，克尔苏加德让巴罗夫家族以亡灵的形式获得永生。\n\n在阴影拱顶房间中，你能找到暗影之皮及其拥有者伊露希亚·巴罗夫。\n\n你无法找到比暗影之皮更好反射虚无和死亡的镜子了。"
G["The ground... is frozen.  We're sitting ducks here; these meatwagons aren't going anywhere."]="地面……已经完全结冰了。我们只能傻傻地坐在这里，这些绞肉车哪里都不能去。"
G["The grown ups always told us the Jade Witch was just some old lady in the woods who was sad her husband died. But you showed them!\n\nOnly... I didn't tell any of the grown ups 'cause I didn't want to get in trouble."]="大人们总是告诉我们说，那个住在林子里的青玉巫婆只是个因为而死了丈夫伤心过度的老太婆。可你证明他们错了！\n\n只是……我不能讲给那些大人们听，我可不想给自己找麻烦。"
G["The gruesome visage of a leering orc stares back at you from this poster.  His raiments are obviously of a warlock nature."]="那个猥琐的兽人从海报里凝视着你。他的服饰看上去很明显是一个术士。"
G["The grummle suspicious of any luck they cannot smell, so it behooves one to meet new grummles with a pocketful of dung."]="土地精质疑一切他们闻不到的运气，所以带上一口袋粪去见陌生的土地精是个不错的选择。"
G["The gryphon appears to be injured. Perhaps healing or first aid could get it back on its feet."]="看上去，这头狮鹫受了伤。也许治疗或急救技能可以让它重新站起来。"
G["The gryphon appears to be trapped. It looks like it would be easily possible to break its bonds though."]="这头狮鹫似乎是被困住了。不过看上去，它应该能轻松地挣脱身上的束缚。"
G["The gryphon looks at you intently, clearly smelling a familiar scent on your clothing."]="狮鹫专注地看着你。它显然是从你的衣服上闻到了熟悉的气味。"
G["The gryphon looks at you with genuine appreciation."]="狮鹫看着你，眼睛里充满了感激之情。"
G["The gryphon master oversees the gryphon flights from within Stormwind.  If you're looking to take a ride, then that's where you should be headed."]="狮鹫管理员监管着飞进飞出暴风城的所有狮鹫。如果你想乘坐狮鹫的话，就去找他吧。"
G["The gryphon muscles tense and eyes tighten as soon as the bark is extended towards it."]="当这片黑暗向狮鹫蔓延过去的时候，狮鹫绷紧了肌肉，眼神也变得犀利明亮。"
G["The gryphon riders are standing 10 paces from us, friend. They'll be giving you a ride to Thorson's Post. Get going!"]="朋友，狮鹫骑士距离我们仅十步之遥。他们会送你前往索尔森的岗哨。准备出发吧！"
G["The gryphon screams with glee as you break it free."]="当你将这头狮鹫解救出来的时候，它发出了欢快的叫声。"
G["The gryphons are ready to strike, $n! You must take this beacon and plant it in the western crater of the central battlegrounds.\n\nDo this and the battle is ours!"]="狮鹫准备袭击了，$n！你必须带上这根火炬，将它插在战场中心的西环形山。\n\n去吧，胜利是属于我们的！"
G["The gryphons of the Northrend peaks are the most resilient of the species."]="栖息在诺森德山峰上的狮鹫是适应性最强的物种。"
G["The guardian begins to move with a rumble."]="守护者开始活动，并发出“隆隆”的响声。"
G["The guardian has awoken! Destroy it!"]="守卫醒过来了！快摧毁它！"
G["The guardian of the skies has taken flight again! This is encouraging news, $n. But much remains undone, and we must turn our attention elsewhere..."]="天空的守卫者再次展翅翱翔了！这真是令人振奋的消息，$n。但我们还有很多事要做。我们现在必须把注意力转到别的地方……"
G["The guardian's power grows! Kill them before it's too late!"]="守卫的力量正在增长！快阻止他们！"
G["The guardians of the temple are few, but their spirits remain strong. I believe we can defeat the sha and expel them from our temple, but it will be a long and difficult battle."]="寺院的守卫人数寥寥，可他们意志坚强。我相信，我们一定能击败煞，将其逐出寺院，但那将会是一场艰苦卓绝的持久战。"
G["The guards are needed here. If you seek vengeance at the glade, Teng, I suggest you speak with our guest here."]="这里需要守卫。要是你想去林地复仇，邓，你可以跟这位客人谈谈。"
G["The guards of Theramore are the finest group of Alliance soldiers based in Kalimdor. It is our duty to uphold the laws of the Alliance even so far away from our homes."]="塞拉摩的卫兵都是原本驻扎在卡利姆多的联盟精英力量。即使远离了家园，但我们还是会努力维护联盟的律法。"
G["The guest rooms.  These were offered to some of my people."]="这是客房。有些客房被提供给了我的族人。"
G["The guild master handles his business in the Trade Quarter. He's up on the eastern platform."]="公会注册员在贸易区办公。你可以在东侧平台找到他。"
G["The guild master is Christopher Drakul. He's on the eastern platform in the Trade Quarter."]="克里斯托弗·德库尔是这里的公会注册员。他的办公区设在贸易区东侧平台。"
G["The guilds of the Horde have pulled together and accomplished this task already $c. We have all of the singed corestones necessary for our war materiel. Make yourself useful by asking the other collectors here if they need your aid."]="部落的各大公会齐心协力，终于完成了这项任务，$c。我们已经集齐了战争所需的熔火之石了。问问其他的收集者吧，或许他们需要帮助。"
G["The gunpowder is completely soaked.  Nobody's going to be using this to fire cannons anytime soon."]="火药粉完全被浸湿了。短时间内不会再有人用这火药粉发射炮弹了。"
G["The guns, man the guns! Fire everything we've got!"]="那些炮！别让它们闲着！有什么打什么！"
G["The gusty essence of deceased Quetz'lun's wardens must be gathered to draw him near. To Har'koa must both of these rarities be delivered."]="只有杀死奎丝鲁恩祭坛典狱官，获得充满活力的典狱官精华，才能引出阿卡里先知。你必须将这两件稀罕物交给哈克娅。"
G["The gyros are all spun up. Are you ready to fly my survey?"]="Los girocópteros están todos boca arriba. ¿Estás $glisto:lista; para llevar a cabo mi estudio?"
G["The halls of Karazhan shake, as the curse binding the doors of the Gamesman's Hall is lifted."]="当附着在象棋大厅门上的诅咒被驱散的同时，卡拉赞的大厅也开始剧烈地颤抖。"
G["The hammer is warm to the touch."]="这把锤子摸上去热乎乎的。"
G["The hammer of justice shall now find you guilty!"]="制裁之锤将审判你的罪行！"
G["The hammers of the earthen stand united behind Bouldercrag. We will oppose Loken's minions to the end."]="土灵愿意握紧铁锤，成为布德克拉格坚强的后盾。我们要和洛肯的爪牙斗争到底。"
G["The harbinger has come. The world heaves."]="先驱者到来了。世界在颤抖。"
G["The harbor defenses have fallen! Kor'kron, fall back and move to higher ground!"]="港口防线崩溃了！库卡隆，后撤，到高地上去！"
G["The hatchling is happy to see you!"]="雏龙很高兴见到你！"
G["The hatchling likes being petted!"]="雏龙喜欢你的爱抚！"
G["The hatchling loves you, too!"]="雏龙也爱你！"
G["The hatchling nudges your arm affectionately."]="雏龙亲昵地蹭着你的手臂。"
G["The hatchling thinks you are very funny."]="雏龙认为你非常有趣。"
G["The hatchling thinks you should excuse yourself."]="雏龙认为你该原谅自己。"
G["The hatchlings will dine on your corpse!"]="雏龙将享用你的尸体！"
G["The hatred inside you drives your hunt for me.  You are already mine."]="当仇恨驱使你们来猎杀我时，你们就已经输了。"
G["The haze has been lifted from my eyes... forgive me for doubting you..."]="我眼前的迷雾终于散去……原谅我对你们的猜忌……"
G["The head, the handle, these two must be made as one."]="只要把钟杵的头和柄合起来，它就又完整了。"
G["The heart is MINE!"]="青龙之心是我的！"
G["The heart of the Great Serpent will not fall into your hands!"]="青龙之心不会堕入你们之手！"
G["The heart... the last remaining vestige of your humanity.  I had to stop it from being destroyed.  I had to see for myself.  And at last I'm sure..."]="徽记……那是你残存的最后一丝人性。我要在你彻底丧失人性之前亲自摧毁它。我相信……"
G["The heartless saurok, even with their tiny lizard brains, soon realized the truth of their position. They killed the enemies of the mogu."]="凶残的蜥蜴人虽然头脑并不发达，但还是很快意识到他们的真实处境。它们先残杀魔古的敌人。"
G["The heat comes. Prepare to defend against the elemental attack! Lok'tar ogar!"]="高潮到了。准备抵御元素生物的进攻！Lok'tar ogar！"
G["The heat... I can't take it..."]="热……我受不了了……"
G["The heathens will be forced to react. Orcs, bull-men..."]="异教徒们必须做出反应了。兽人，牛人……"
G["The heavens burn!"]="天空在燃烧！"
G["The heavens take you!"]="天堂才是你的归宿！"
G["The herbalist around here is Martha Alliestar. She's over on the inner ring of the Apothecarium."]="马尔萨·奥列斯塔是这里的草药学家。你可以在炼金区的内环区域找到她。"
G["The herbs found in nature can be a powerful ally when combined with respect.  You will want to seek out Bena at her alchemy shop on the middle rise to further your training."]="好好利用自然界的草药，它会成为你有力的助手的。去本娜的炼金店找她吧，接受更多训练。"
G["The herbs from the fire seem to already be healing this animal.  Thank you!"]="火里的草药好像已经把这只动物治好了。谢谢你！"
G["The hero of One Keg returns!"]="¡$GEl héroe:La heroína; de Barrilia ha vuelto!"
G["The hero of Stoneplow! Hi hi."]="¡$GEl héroe:La heroína; de Villarroca! Hola, hola."
G["The hero."]="英雄。"
G["The heroics of the Trollbane bloodline are legendary. I idolize the man.\n\nAnd to find him alive, in the Outland...\n\n<Romus gazes past you.>\n\nWhen I first saw him, I nearly fainted. The shock was overwhelming. As I knelt before him, I had to fight back tears.\n\nYou can bet your sweet behind that I'm going to do everything in my power to make sure the Sons of Lothar are kept safe."]="托尔贝恩家族的英雄事迹就像传说一样，我非常崇拜他。\n\n当我来到外域之后……我发现他还活着。\n\n<洛姆斯凝视着你的身后。>\n\n当我第一次看到他的时候，我几乎晕倒了。那种震撼是无可抵挡的，我跪在他的面前，泪水几乎要奔涌而出。\n\n我发誓会尽我的全力来保卫洛萨之子的安全。"
G["The hieroglyphs on your tablets indicate that there's a way to get this mechanism working again.\n\nWe just need to figure out how..."]="从石板上的秘密符文看来，有办法让这装置重新焕发活力。\n\n我们只需要想出该如何做……"
G["The high elf Hira Snowdawn teaches Cold Weather Flying.\n\nShe can be found upon her dragonhawk at Krasus' Landing in eastern Dalaran."]="高等精灵希拉·雪晨能教你学会寒冷天气飞行。\n\n她骑着龙鹰，就在达拉然东部的克拉苏斯平台上。"
G["The high elf mage and scholar Dariness is the city's most learned archaeologist... and the most sociable.\n\nShe can often be found in the Legerdemain Lounge, just north of the city's center, enjoying the atmosphere or discussing her wild adventures with the proprieters and patrons both."]="高等精灵法师和学者——达瑞妮斯是这座城里最博学的考古学家……也是最喜交际的人。\n\n她通常呆在魔术旅馆里，就在城中心的北边。她喜欢那里的气氛，常常会与魔术旅馆的老板和客人们谈论她在荒野中的冒险生活。"
G["The high elf spy is escaping.  Get her!"]="高等精灵间谍逃跑了。抓住她！"
G["The high executor and Dame Auriferous are making me wait, but I don't have time for this! My friends are out there dying, $c!"]="高级执行官和奥莉菲洛丝夫人要我在一旁候着，我可没那么多时间！我的朋友已经奄奄一息了，$c！"
G["The high priestess is reduced to charcoal."]="高阶祭司变成了焦炭。"
G["The hippogryphs are well-tended by Zaldaan, in the northern part of town."]="萨尔达恩把角鹰兽们照顾得很好。他们就在镇子的北部。"
G["The hippogryphs are well-tended near the Exodar proper. You should journey there if you wish to fly to Blood Watch."]="角鹰兽们栖息在埃索达入口处。如果你想飞去秘血岗哨的话，你应该去那里看看。"
G["The hissing never stops.  The serpents keep coming!"]="那嘶嘶声片刻未停，毒蛇不停地涌来！"
G["The honor is mine, to your post!"]="非常荣幸，全力以赴吧！"
G["The honor is yours. Signal the fleet."]="这份殊荣属于你。给舰队发信号吧。"
G["The honor of slaying the interlopers shall be mine, brothers! Their feeble bodies will freeze solid from my wind's icy chill!"]="消灭入侵者的荣誉属于我，兄弟们！他们软弱的躯体将在我的凛冽寒风中永远冻结！"
G["The horde cannot be stopped!"]="部落不可阻挡！"
G["The horde general is defeated!\n\nThe Alliance is the victor, and the Horde now scrambles to rebuild its weakened forces."]="部落的将军被打败啦！\n\n联盟胜利啦，部落乱作一团，正忙着重建他们残弱的部队。"
G["The horde is here?!"]="这里有部落？！"
G["The horde shall not defile this land!"]="决不容许部落玷污这片土地！"
G["The horn! Use the horn on it while it's weak!"]="号角！趁它进入虚弱状态吹响号角！"
G["The horns of war have sounded! We haven't much time! Quicken your pace!"]="战争的号角已经吹响！时间紧迫！加快速度！"
G["The horror known as Carnage is no more.  Could it be that $n is truly worthy of battle in Valhalas?  We shall see."]="El horror conocido como Carnicería ya no existe. ¿Es posible que $n realmente sea $gdigno:digna; de luchar en Valhalas? Ya veremos."
G["The horror! THE HORROR!!"]="天哪！天哪！！"
G["The horrors I witnessed..."]="我所目睹的恐惧……"
G["The hound appears to pick up a scent from the north and prepares to sprint to its source."]="猎犬似乎闻到了北边有什么东西，正全速冲向气味的发源地。"
G["The hour of redemption is close at hand! Prepare yourselves!"]="救赎的时刻即将来临！做好准备！"
G["The hour runs late. The message from Silvermoon City is delayed for some reason."]="时不我待。银月城的信使不知何故耽搁了，至今未到。"
G["The hours would pass so much more sweetly."]="我们一起渡过的时光是如此的甜蜜。"
G["The hozen and the jinyu have always fought, but never like this..."]="猢狲和锦鱼人总是在战斗，但从来没有像这样……"
G["The hozen are many things, but they are not cowards - not for long. If you don't wish to fight them, you must... inspire them!"]="猢狲有许多特点，但并不懦弱——至少不会一直懦弱。如果你不想和他们交战，就必须……激励他们！"
G["The hozen are quite lively indeed. A short-lived race, few hozen survive past their 20th birthday. Their leaders are all 14 or 15. How mature were you at 14 years old? Meditate on that!"]="猢狲很是活泼好动。可那是个短命的种族，很少有猢狲能活过二十岁。它们的领袖也只是十四或十五岁。你十四岁时有多成熟？好好想想吧！"
G["The hozen are slippery and cunning. Worse yet, they feel no shame or remorse.\n\nThey kill out of base instinct, for pleasure and for greed."]="猢狲非常狡猾、奸诈。更糟的是，他们完全不懂羞耻和反省。\n\n他们完全凭着本能去烧杀掠夺，只为满足他们的欲望和贪婪。"
G["The hozen are stealing our brew!"]="猢狲在偷我们的美酒！"
G["The hozen came to us once as you do now.\n\nWe felt sorry for them, and taught them how to survive in this land.\n\nOver time, they grew strong and bold, and began to take this land for their own."]="猢狲曾经也来向我们求助过，就像你现在这样。\n\n我们同情他们，并教会他们如何在这片土地上生存。\n\n可随着时间推移，他们越来越强大，也越来越傲慢，开始想要独占这片土地。"
G["The hozen do not understand peace! They will slaughter our village until none of us remain!"]="猢狲根本不懂和平！他们会将我们村里的人都杀光的！"
G["The hozen fed my yaks to their pet yeti. This is most bad fortune."]="猢狲用我的牦牛来喂养他们的宠物雪人。这运气真是糟糕透顶。"
G["The hozen overfished the area, catching more fish than they could eat."]="猢狲大肆捕捞、涸泽而渔，也不管吃不吃得完。"
G["The hozen rely on dirty guerilla tactics. Ambushes and traps. It is sad to say, but they seem to outwit us at every turn."]="猢狲总是使用卑鄙的游击战术，例如伏击和陷阱。很不幸是的，我们每次都会中他们的招。"
G["The hozen revel in torturing their prisoners. Thank you, $c, for saving me from a dire fate."]="猢狲都热衷于折磨俘虏。谢谢你，$c，是你帮我避免了那种悲惨的命运。"
G["The hulking statue stands inert, untouched for centuries."]="这座笨重的雕像立在这里，已经有许多个世纪没有被碰触过了。"
G["The hum of magic energy in the air diminishes..."]="空气中的魔法能量正在消散……"
G["The human blood in your veins is but a detriment.  Rid yourself of all emotion!"]="你的体内流淌着人类的鲜血，这只会令你受伤。摈弃所有凡人的情感吧！"
G["The humans abandoned us in our darkest hour! Their prince himself led the assault on our lands."]="人类在我们最黑暗的时刻抛弃了我们！他们的王子亲自领导了对我们领土的袭击。"
G["The humans and their so-called League of Arathor think to push us out of Arathi Basin.  I think not $c!  Are you ready to be sent there and demonstrate that it is they, and not The Defilers, that will be leaving soon?"]="Los humanos y su Liga de Arathor pretenden expulsarnos de la Cuenca de Arathi. ¡Pero yo no creo que puedan hacerlo, $c! ¿Estás $glisto:lista; para ir allí y demostrar que son ellos y no los Rapiñadores quienes se irán pronto?"
G["The humans are in need of your assistance in their fight against The Forsaken at Arathi Basin.  Go to the Hall of Arms and speak with their representative, Donal Osgood."]="在阿拉希盆地跟被遗忘者作战的人类需要你的帮助。去武器大厅找他们的代表杜纳尔·奥斯古德谈谈。"
G["The humans built an inn on the edge of the Barrens. The Shady Rest, they called it. Weeks ago, it was burned down.\n\nWhy do I care? I don't-not about the humans anyway-but I had a spy placed in that inn and I will not let his death go unanswered. I need to know who did this.\n\nIf you wish to provide assistance, go to the remains of the Shady Rest Inn and return any clues you find to me."]="人类在贫瘠之地的边界处建了一座旅店，他们叫它树荫旅店。几个星期前，这家旅店被烧掉了。\n\n为什么我会在意这种事？当然，我并不关心人类的死活。但我在那家旅店里安插了一名间谍。我不会让他就这样白白死掉。我要知道这是谁干的。\n\n如果你想帮忙的话，就去查看一下树荫旅店的废墟，把你能找到的线索都给我带回来。"
G["The humans claimed much of the Dustwallow Marsh for themselves, but the Stonemaul clan, with our help, has been able to push them back."]="人类宣称尘泥沼泽是他们的领地，但是石槌部族在我们的帮助下将他们赶了回去。"
G["The humans definitely need all of our help in Arathi Basin.  The one that you wish to speak to is named Keras Wolfheart.  He stands ready to assist you on the Warrior's Terrace."]="阿拉希盆地的人类急需我们的帮助。你得找战士区的克拉斯·沃夫哈特谈谈，他会帮助你的。"
G["The humans of Stormwind cheer for $n."]="暴风城的人类为$n而欢呼。"
G["The hunger your weapon feels is but a shade of what awaits. You want to see real hunger? Real power? Continue onward, hero. I am waiting."]="你的武器感到了饥饿。这不算什么。想要感受真的饥饿，真的力量吗？继续吧，英雄，我等着你们。"
G["The hunter became the prey."]="猎手成了猎物。"
G["The hunter... becomes... the hunted...."]="啊……猎人……变成了猎物……"
G["The hunting is good here. Birds call down from the canopy. Beasts roar out from the dark, hidden places below.\n\nAnd we keep them in check.\n\nIt's our obligation as hunters - and it's bloody good sport, too."]="在这里狩猎可带劲儿了。鸟儿在树冠间啁啾，野兽在树下的阴影中咆哮。\n\n而我们则要控制它们的数量。\n\n这是我们身为猎手使命——而且也是一项很棒的运动。"
G["The icepaw bear lays here tranquilized."]="冰爪熊已经被麻醉了，静静地躺在地上。"
G["The illusion shatters and a path to the central chamber opens!"]="幻象消散，通往中央房间的道路开启了！"
G["The illusions will not hold back, this time. Their attacks will be relentless. Be prepared to use your strongest healing spells."]="这次，幻影是不会后退的。它们会连续攻击。准备使用你最强的治疗手段吧。"
G["The important thing is that these jinyu and Alliance have joined forces. Come speak with me, $n. I can give you the final part of our report."]="Lo que importa es que la Alianza y los jinyu han unido sus fuerzas. Habla conmigo. Puedo contarte la última parte de nuestro informe."
G["The important thing to remember is that we're all here because of our love for explosions!"]="有一件不能忘记的重要事情，就是我们汇聚在这里，只因为我们都热爱爆炸！"
G["The incorrect application of the awakening rod causes the dormant vrykul to expire."]="由于唤醒魔棒的使用不当，沉睡中的维库人死亡了。"
G["The indigenous rams of Alterac are vital to the functionality of our cavalry!"]="奥特兰克本地出产的山羊对我们的骑兵至关重要！"
G["The infected nightstalker runts seem to be coming from the north. If I were you, that's where I would start my hunt."]="感染的夜行豹幼崽似乎是从北面来的，我建议你会从那边开始狩猎。"
G["The infernal is one of the most powerful demons a warlock could hope to have at $Ghis:her; side in battle. The creature is stong, well-armored, and delivers devastating blows upon any foe. If you were to choose to put the spirit of an infernal into your weapon, you would gain some of those benefits--greater health and regeneration and the like.\n\nIf you wish to know more about felhounds, then you should speak to Wytula across from me."]="El infernal es uno de los demonios más poderosos que un brujo pueda desear tener a su lado en el combate. La criatura es fuerte y da golpes devastadores a cualquier enemigo. Si decidieras poner el espíritu de un infernal en tu arma ganarías alguna de esas ventajas: más salud y regeneración y cosas parecidas.\n\nSi quieres saber más sobre manáfagos deberías hablar con Wytula."
G["The infidel shall be purified, milady!"]="这些异教徒们必将受到净化，女士！"
G["The information on this wanted poster indicates that you don't yet qualify for the task at hand.\n\nYou should definitely check back later, though."]="根据这块通缉令公告板上面的信息显示，你还没有达到现有任务的要求。\n\n你应该晚点再来看看。"
G["The information you seek... I cannot give you that freely.  You will have to prove that your enemies are the same as mine."]="我不能那么慷慨地……与你分享信息。你必须向我证明，你与我有着共同的敌人。"
G["The ink has dried on this chapter of history..."]="历史的篇章已成定局……"
G["The inn"]="旅店"
G["The inn - if you can call it that - is on the upper ring of the Trade Quarter. They don't even have beds."]="旅馆——如果算得上的话——在贸易区的上层区域。那里连床铺都没有。"
G["The inn is located on the main floor, to the right as you enter the building.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="旅店位于主楼层，在你进入建筑物时的右侧。\n\n我会在你的地图上标记这个位置。"
G["The inner gates of Ahn'Qiraj crash open."]="安其拉的内门轰然打开了。"
G["The innkeepers are mad to be giving away treats for free."]="旅店老板们居然免费发糖，真是疯了。"
G["The interlopers will be stopped, my lord."]="我们马上就会消灭这些入侵者，主上。"
G["The interrogator is trying to find out what these blood elves are doing here in Nagrand. From what I hear, they're after crystal powder residue from Oshu'gun, the diamond mountain to the west.\n\nNo doubt to use in some insidious scheme or concoction...\n\nIf you are looking to help our cause and stop these blood elves, the conflict is happening right now to the northwest at Halaa. Blood elves and those Hand of Argus soldiers are battling! Join in and show them what's right!"]="审问者想搞清楚这些血精灵在纳格兰干什么。我听说他们是为了西边的钻石山——沃舒古的水晶粉末残渣而来。\n\n毫无疑问，他们想把这些残渣用于某些阴险的计划或是掺进什么调和物里面……\n\n如果你想帮我们查明真相，阻止那些血精灵的话，你必须知道，血精灵们和阿古斯之手的士兵们正在西北部的哈兰发生冲突。加入战斗，让他们看看什么才是正确的！"
G["The intruders stand fast, brothers, I cannot break them. Allow me a brief respite to strengthen my winds."]="兄弟们，入侵者相当难对付，我还没办法打败他们。让我暂时休息一下，聚集我的暴风力量。"
G["The invaders are fast approaching, Malfurion. Give up this ritual, and join the fight!"]="入侵者正在迅速接近，玛法里奥。赶快中断仪式，加入战斗吧！"
G["The invaders are here!"]="入侵者在这儿！"
G["The invaders persist! Hold them off!"]="入侵者持续不断地涌了过来！守住！"
G["The invisibility liquor is ready for you, $n."]="隐形药水已经准备好了，$n。"
G["The invisibility liquor is ready for you, Korekfour."]="El licor de invisibilidad está listo para ti, Korekfour."
G["The iron dwarves followed you! Use the net and the ice slick to escape!"]="铁矮人在追你！快使用结网和地面速冻逃跑！"
G["The iron dwarves have been seen emerging from the bunkers at the base of the pillars straight ahead of you! Destroy the bunkers, and they'll be forced to fall back!"]="快看你正前方那些柱子底部的掩体，铁矮人正源源不断地从里面冒出来！摧毁那些掩体，他们就不得不撤退了！"
G["The ironclad heel of my armored boot should prove to be quite destructive."]="我的钢板靴子一定能对敌人造成非常严重的伤害。"
G["The irony of what I have become is not lost upon me, Lady Sylvanas."]="那些讽刺我当前处境的话，我都已经听见了，希尔瓦娜斯女王。"
G["The island swarms with the Empress's minions."]="这个岛上挤满了女皇的仆从。"
G["The items you offered were pure, $n.  This new cleansing totem is strong."]="你提供的材料非常纯净，$n。这根新的净化图腾相当强大。"
G["The jade sings to us. Give! Give!"]="玉石唱歌给我们听。给我！给我！"
G["The jinyu also have humble origins. Once primitive creatures, they were fortunate enough to live near the enchanted pools within the Vale."]="锦鱼人也有着卑微的出身。本来只是一种原始生物，但有幸能生长在谷内含有魔法的池塘附近。"
G["The jinyu and their waterspeakers stand at the very heart of the greatest events in Pandaria's history."]="锦鱼人水语者们，在潘达利亚历史上的重要事件中，都扮演着核心角色。"
G["The jinyu are indebted to you and your Alliance!"]="锦鱼人对你和联盟不胜感激！"
G["The jinyu are ours and Binan Village is next!"]="锦鱼人是我们的，下一个就是滨岸村！"
G["The jinyu are proving to be capable soldiers."]="锦鱼人的确是出色的战士。"
G["The jinyu may not seem welcoming, but I do believe we prove our good intentions."]="锦鱼人看上去可能不太友好，但我相信我们已经表达出了善意。"
G["The jinyu seem to be an ancient race. We will learn their secrets, in time."]="锦鱼人似乎是个古老的种族。我们迟早会了解他们的秘密的。"
G["The jormungar collapsed instantly, its head barely still attached to its convulsing body.  My father turned to the dwarf in awe and raised a fist in praise..."]="那只冰虫立即倒下了，它的脑袋勉强挂在不断抽搐的躯体上。我的父亲敬畏地注视着高山矮人，举起拳头表示赞美……"
G["The journal of Jandice Barov is filled with rantings and ravings about the undead. Towards the end of the book is what appears to be a tailoring pattern for the creation of a bag of some sort. Your understanding of tailoring is insufficient to decipher the pattern."]="詹迪斯·巴罗夫的日记充斥着被遗忘者疯狂的怨念。在日记的结尾似乎有一份制作背包的裁缝图样。按你对裁缝技能的掌握程度，还不足以解读这张图样。"
G["The journal of Jandice Barov is filled with rantings and ravings about the undead. Towards the end of the book is what appears to be a tailoring pattern for the creation of a felcloth bag. This bag is used by warlocks to store soul shards. Do you wish to copy the pattern into your own journal?"]="詹迪斯·巴罗夫的日记充斥着被遗忘者疯狂的怨念。在日记的结尾似乎有一份制作恶魔布包的裁缝图样。术士们使用恶魔布包来存储灵魂碎片。你想要在自己的日记里记录下图样的内容吗？"
G["The journal of Jandice Barov is filled with rantings and ravings about the undead. Towards the end of the book is what appears to be a tailoring pattern for the creation of a felcloth bag. This bag is used by warlocks to store soul shards. You already know how to create this bag."]="詹迪斯·巴罗夫的日记充斥着被遗忘者疯狂的怨念。在日记的结尾似乎有一份制作恶魔布包的裁缝图样，术士们使用恶魔布包来存储灵魂碎片。你已经学会了制作这种背包的方法。"
G["The journey is its own reward, young one. Seek pleasure in a story's telling, and you will come away with riches beyond compare.\n\nAh yes, and one more thing. Those who rise in the ranks of the Lorewalkers are granted a very special gift - the ability to ride upon the clouds."]="旅途本身就是馈赠，年轻人。在故事中寻找快乐，你就会得到无与伦比的财富。\n\n对了，还有件事。在游学者中地位升高的人还能获得特殊的礼物——驾云而行的能力。"
G["The journey to becoming a Serpent Master is a difficult one. Are you up for the challenge?"]="想要成为一个翔龙大师，道路是异常艰辛的。你准备好接受挑战了吗？"
G["The journey was long, but I finally found the Vale. Now I am working with the Sentinels to understand the pools' mysteries."]="那是漫长的旅程，可我最终还是找到了山谷。现在我正与哨兵部队一起努力，破解水池之谜。"
G["The kaja'mite has gone and made these monkeys smart! Keep that miner safe, $n."]="卡亚矿石没了，这些猴子也因为矿石而变聪明了！保护好那个矿工，$n。"
G["The keep is ablaze! Bombardiers, where in the Nether are you?!"]="要塞着火了！炮兵呢！都死哪儿去了！"
G["The keep is in northren Stormwind.\n\nJust follow the canals north and you'll eventually come across a drawbridge... that leads into the keep's courtyard."]="要塞位于暴风城北部。\n\n沿着运河向北前行，你就会看到一座吊桥……通往要塞庭院。"
G["The keg bombs are ready. $n, are you going to stop the yaungol?"]="酒桶炸弹准备好了。$n，你要去阻止野牛人吗？"
G["The keg bursts, dousing %s's flames!"]="酒桶破裂了，扑灭了%s的火焰！"
G["The keg has been tapped!  The battle begins!  Now raise your glasses with me, as I toast our combatants..."]="酒桶已经被打开了！比赛开始！让我们一起举杯，为战士们干杯吧……"
G["The keg is tapped!  Now I would like to propose a toast.  Don't worry, I'll keep it short and sweet."]="酒桶打开了！现在，我来献上祝酒辞。啊，放心，我尽量简短一些。"
G["The kegs are filled with strong brew!  Drink, friend, and celebrate!"]="¡Los barriles están llenos de un brebaje muy fuerte! ¡Bebe, $gamigo:amiga; y diviértete!"
G["The key to victory is control, Wakener. Use my skills to dominate the mind of an enemy, and turn it into an ally."]="胜利的关键是控制，唤醒者。你可以使用我的技能控制敌人的心智，将它变为盟友。"
G["The key... you have to find the key!"]="钥匙……你得先找到钥匙！"
G["The keystone is completed! We've done it, $n!"]="钥石拼好了！我们成功啦，$n！"
G["The kids jump up and down with youthful energy. (PH emote)"]="小孩充满活力地跳上跳下。"
G["The king bestowed the blade upon my friend, Thalorien Dawnseeker."]="国王将它赠予了我的朋友，萨洛瑞安·寻晨者。"
G["The king doesn't look north."]="El rey no mira hacia el norte."
G["The king is dead - OH NOES!  Summon Mizzle da Crafty!  He knows what to do next!"]="国王死了——哦，不！召唤米兹勒！他知道下一步该怎么做！"
G["The king is going to speak!"]="国王有话要说！"
G["The king is only doing what's necessary to keep the city safe."]="国王只是在采取必要措施确保城市的安全。"
G["The king is sending a stranger to gather information for him?  I suppose you must be that... what's the word?  $R?  Yes, that $r that rescued Prince Nadun.\n\nAt any rate, I haven't seen any signs of the Neferset scum this far north.  There are plenty of other nuisances to be dealt with, however."]="¿El rey envía a $gun forastero:una forastera; para reunir información? Supongo que eres... ¿Cómo se decía? ¿$R? Sí, tú rescataste al príncipe Nadun.\n\nEn cualquier caso, no he visto ninguna señal de la escoria Neferset tan al norte. Pero no nos faltan molestias que resolver."
G["The king wanted Prince Anduin to stay in the vale until he recovered. But the prince insists on wandering around talking to people. What are we to do when a prince wants to disobey his king?\n\nBest to stay close and keep him out of trouble."]="国王希望安度因王子留在锦绣谷直至康复。但王子坚持要四处走走，并与人们多聊聊。当王子想要违抗国王时，我们又能怎么办呢？\n\n最好还是跟紧他，免得他惹上什么麻烦。"
G["The king was furious. \"If none of you help, then Ironforge will fall under siege!\""]="El Rey estaba furioso. \"Si ninguno nos ayudáis, ¡Forjaz quedará asediada!\"."
G["The king was to travel here by ship, in secret. But the ship never arrived, and King Wrynn disappeared."]="国王本来要秘密乘船来到这里，但是那艘船从未来过，国王也从此杳无音讯。"
G["The king wishes to be informed about recent Neferset activity."]="国王想了解尼斐塞特近来的动态。"
G["The king's champions have done it: The storm has ended! Forward, Dark Irons! TO BATTLE WE MARCH!"]="国王的勇士们成功了：风暴停止了！前进，黑铁矮人！向着战场前进！"
G["The king's men will protect us.  We're almost there."]="国王的人会保护我们。再坚持一会儿。"
G["The king's scouts had discovered that Zandalari trolls threatened the dwarven capital."]="国王的密探发现，赞达拉巨魔正威胁着矮人的主城。"
G["The knowledge in this library is astounding."]="这个图书馆里的知识令人震惊。"
G["The kobolds are retaking the Coldtooth Mine!"]="狗头人重新占领了冷齿矿洞！"
G["The kodos are waiting on the road. Safe journey, $Gbrother:sister;."]="科多兽已经等在路上了。一路顺风，$G兄弟:姐妹;。"
G["The lake has been too lonely these past years. The travelers stopped coming and evil came to these waters."]="这些年来，寂寞萦绕着这面湖泊。旅行者再也不愿涉足此地，而邪恶的力量侵蚀了这片水域。"
G["The lake told me it would be so!"]="湖水告诉我会是这样！"
G["The lance is finished. Quickly, hurl it at the sha!"]="完成了。快，用它扔那个煞魔！"
G["The land gave way from under our feet...  I thought I was dead.  I owe you one."]="我们脚下的地面在坍塌……我还以为我已经死了。我欠你一份情。"
G["The land is defiled by the presence of the Scourge on one side and the rituals of the Drakkari on the other.\n\nWe stand resolute betwixt the two."]="天灾军团的邪恶气息与达卡莱巨魔的黑暗仪式亵渎了这片土地。\n\n我们必须将他们彻底铲除。"
G["The land is in great upheaval!\n\nThe Dark One rides forth again with his San'layn, the dragons fight in their great Nexus War, and the vrykul are reawakened.\n\nYour people sail north on your wooden ships to fight them and one another, and we Kalu'ak are caught in the middle.\n\nAnd now some great evil has been done so that the land explodes with the magical power of the world. We must find a safe haven where we will have a chance to survive.\n\nThese two ambassadors make my head hurt... perhaps you can help my people, $r?"]="¡Esta región está muy alborotada!\n\nLos oscuros cabalgan de nuevo junto con sus San'layn, los dragones luchan en su gran guerra de El Nexo y los vrykuls han vuelto a despertar.\n\nTu gente navega hacia el norte en sus barcos de madera y luchan unos contra otros y nosotros, los Kalu'ak, estamos atrapados en medio.\n\nY ahora, mediante alguna temible maldad, la tierra explota con la energía mágica del mundo. Tenemos que encontrar un refugio seguro donde tengamos una posibilidad de sobrevivir. Estos dos embajadores me dan dolor de cabeza... quizá tú puedas ayudar a mi gente, $r."
G["The land is in worse shape than I could've imagined. If the damage continues at this rate, Farahlon -- err, Netherstorm will be nothing but cosmic gravel very soon.\n\nWhere will it stop, I wonder? Perhaps the better question is, 'will it stop?'"]="这个地方比我想像的差多了。如果破坏以这个速度继续下去，法兰伦——呃，虚空风暴很快就会变成宇宙的尘埃。\n\n我在想，它要被破坏到何种程度才会停止？或许我应该问，“它会停止吗？”"
G["The land is scarred, the ever-blooming trees and plants wither and die as the water from the pools drains away."]="这片土地遭受了重创，水流干涸，盛开的鲜花、葱郁的草木纷纷枯萎凋零。"
G["The land of Azshara."]="艾萨拉地区。"
G["The land of Feralas has been through much, $r. The earth, the trees, the creatures; they are all changing what Feralas is and will be.\n\nThe Twin Colossals above us remain as a constant, though, throughout all that has happened here..."]="菲拉斯的土地经历了岁月的洗礼，$r。大地、树木和生物，它们改变着菲拉斯的现状和未来。\n\n跟这儿所发生的一切相比，双塔山可以算是亘古不变的了……"
G["The land of eternal starlight, Kalimdor, was a nurturing mother to all of its creatures. The magic of the Well of Eternity permeated the land and empowered the multitude of flora and fauna that would make the world their home. From this magical ether were born the silithid. It was through the silithid that the brooding Old God would reach and attempt to sunder the world that it once held in its unmerciful grasp."]="永烁星光之地卡利姆多哺育了这片大地上的所有生灵。永恒之井的魔法力量渗透到土地中，使得各种各样的植物和动物都具备了一定的魔法力量。这种魔法力量滋生异种虫类。上古之神控制了异种虫，妄图再次征服世界。"
G["The land suffers... and RAGES!"]="大地在痛苦着……咆哮着！"
G["The land suffers... it cries for mercy, $r, it cries for mercy."]="这片土地在饱受煎熬……它在乞求怜悯，$r，它在乞求怜悯。"
G["The land was harsh. Time and again it was Vol'jin and his people who ensured the Horde's survival, saving us from starvation, or taking up arms when we were attacked."]="这并非是一片慷慨的土地。一次又一次，是沃金和他的人民用食物拯救我们于饥饿，用武器保护我们于战乱，从而保全了部落。"
G["The land... cries out."]="大地……在哭泣。"
G["The landing site is secure. We're ready for work to commence."]="登陆场安全了。我们可以开始行动了。"
G["The language is unfamiliar and for all we know, it's just some soldier's journal."]="我们都看不懂上面的文字，大概只是某个士兵的日志吧。"
G["The large Quilen seem to be guarding that door. Tread carefully, lest you wake them."]="庞大的魁麟似乎在把守大门。小心前行，以免唤醒它们。"
G["The large cat doesn't seem quite as big as the hunter lead you to believe."]="这只大猫似乎并不像猎人向你描述的那样大。"
G["The large shrine was built many years ago by the night elves that once inhabited this land.\n\nWhat secrets could it hold?"]="数年前居住在此地的暗夜精灵修建了这座神殿。\n\n它隐藏着什么秘密吗？"
G["The largest brewery in Pandaria is the Stormstout Brewery in the Valley of the Four Winds. You might start there if you're looking for adventure.\n\nBrewmasters are also wanderers by nature, and can be found roaming all over the land searching for rare ingredients or concocting new brews.\n\nSuch brewmasters are often found in unique scenarios.\n\nBrewmaster Tzu defends against enemies in the Greenstone Village scenario.\n\nBrewmaster Bo seeks tropical flavors in the Unga Ingoo scenario.\n\nBrewmaster Boof celebrates the season at The Brewmoon Festival scenario, and Brewmaster Blanche is cooking up something shocking in A Brewing Storm."]="潘达利亚地区最大的酿酒厂是四风谷的风暴烈酒酿造厂。如果你想冒险，可以从那里开始。\n\n酒仙实质上也是游荡者，并且他们经常四处闲逛，寻找稀有原料或调配新酒。\n\n这些酒仙通常会出现在独特的场景战役里。\n\n酒仙曲子在绿石村场景战役中抵御敌人。\n\n珀酒仙在盎迦猴岛场景战役中寻找热带配料。\n\n酒仙布夫在酿月祭场景战役中欢庆佳节，酒仙布兰琪在酝酿风暴场景战役中准备让人大吃一惊。"
G["The largest celebration of the Lunar Festival is taking place in Moonglade. If that's too far to travel to, there are druids offering transport from the Valley of Wisdom."]="最热闹的春节庆典正在月光林地进行。如果你觉得到那里去实在太远，可以去智慧谷找德鲁伊们把你传送过去。"
G["The largest celebration of the Lunar Festival takes place in Moonglade. Druids will transport you there from the Elder Rise of Thunder Bluff."]="最隆重的春节庆典正在月光林地进行。德鲁伊们可以把你从雷霆崖的长者高地传送到那里。"
G["The lasher is not fit for mortal hands!"]="这鞭子可不是为凡人的双手准备的！"
G["The lashers to the south will eat small creatures, like frogs and parrots.  We, the gorillas, will eat the lashers.  And dinosaurs will eat gorillas.  All this is honorable and natural.\n\nThe humans and orcs also hunt the gorilla, but they take the skin and leave the body to rot.  This is why we attack the humans and orcs."]="南边的鳄鱼人喜欢吃小动物，比如青蛙和鹦鹉。我们猩猩则喜欢吃鳄鱼人。恐龙喜欢吃猩猩。所有这些都是严肃的自然规律。\n\n人类和兽人也会猎杀猩猩。但他们只剥去我们的毛皮，我们的尸体则被随意丢弃，任由它们腐烂。所以我们才会攻击人类和兽人。"
G["The last $c to use that machine got the boot... Or rather, the machine got their boots."]="$gEl último:La última; $c que utilizó esa máquina recibió una patada... ¡Y la máquina se quedó sus botas!"
G["The last attack in the Eastern Plaguelands yielded a large harvest of dead, from both sides."]="最近一次在东瘟疫之地爆发的冲突中，双方都伤亡惨重。"
G["The last batch of orcs. They should fall quickly!"]="最后的一批兽人很快就要灭亡了！"
G["The last newcomers stole our children. What are you here for? Our wives? Our ale?"]="在你之前到来的陌生人偷走了我们的孩子。你又想偷什么？我们的妻子？还是美酒？"
G["The last ten strains from Undercity... all of them worthless!"]="这些是幽暗城送来的最后10份药剂样本……可它们毫无价值！"
G["The last thing I remember is the ship falling and us getting into the pods.  I'll go see how I can help.  Thank you!"]="我所能记得的最后一件事是飞船在下降，而我们都进入了救生舱。我去看看有什么我可以帮忙的。谢谢你！"
G["The last thing that we needed was for the crazy Drakkari trolls to shoot down a Scourge necropolis in our backyard.\n\nHow did they manage to do that?!"]="那些疯狂的达卡莱巨魔竟然击落了一座浮空城！\n\n他们是如何做到的？！"
G["The last warlock who tried this failed as well."]="上一个这么做的术士也失败了。"
G["The latest blueprints, patterns and schematics are available right here.  These instructions are so simple to follow they practically craft themselves!"]="你可以在这里获得最新的蓝图、设计图和结构图。这些说明很好理解，只要按照说明书一步一步做就可以了。"
G["The lava shall consume you, cold ones!"]="让岩浆吞噬你们吧，冷血动物！"
G["The lava surrounding %s churns!"]="%s周围的岩浆沸腾了起来！"
G["The lawn was littered with small jade statues. They seemed almost... lifelike."]="草地上摆满了小小的青玉雕像。每一个都……栩栩如生。"
G["The lawspeaker was right... they've gone insane!"]="责法者说得没错……他们已经疯了！"
G["The leader of the undead has been destroyed, and the forests will heal in time."]="亡灵的首领已被消灭，森林的伤痛终将痊愈。"
G["The leadership of Shattrath is too slow to act, so the great people of the Lower City have taken matters in the Shadow Labyrinth into our own hands."]="沙塔斯的领导层行动太缓慢了，所以贫民窟的大人物把暗影迷宫的事揽到了自己手里。"
G["The least you could do is put up a fight!"]="你唯一可以做到的事情，就是体面地战死！"
G["The legacy of storms shall not be undone."]="风暴的传统不容破坏。"
G["The legendary power of the Titans is mine to command!"]="我掌握着泰坦的传奇力量！"
G["The legion of Blackrock comes, dwarflings! We shall scorch the earth and set fire to the heavens. None shall survive..."]="黑石军团就要来了！我们要夷平这片土地，让熊熊大火直冲云霄。没有人可以活下来……"
G["The legion will conquer all!"]="军团战无不胜！"
G["The lesser races will learn to once again fear the mogu!"]="低等种族将再次在魔古族面前瑟瑟发抖！"
G["The lesser spirits were imprisoned ages ago, never to return! I chose the guardians myself! What have you done?"]="很久之前，那些下等的灵魂就被囚禁起来了，再也没有回来！我亲自挑选了守护者！而你都做了些什么？"
G["The lesson is clear. From here on out, I'm taking the initiative."]="多么深刻的教训。以后，我要先发制人。"
G["The lesson of true wisdom lies within you dear heroes, and in the choices you make. When faced with overwhelming darkness, will you make the right decisions?"]="亲爱的英雄，真正的智慧就在你心中，也在你所作出的选择中。当面对压倒性的黑暗时，你能否作出正确的选择呢？"
G["The lesson we've learned here in the Barrens is that nothing short of scorched earth will rout these Horde animals. No quarter!"]="贫瘠之地告诉我们，只有焦土政策才能彻底清除那些部落怪物。对敌人不要有半点同情！"
G["The ley line beneath this night elf temple is now flowing into the Azure Dragonshrine. Our brothers should have all the power they need to crush our enemies."]="这座暗夜精灵神殿下的能量线正在朝碧蓝巨龙圣地涌动。我们的兄弟很快就能掌握强大的力量，利用它击溃敌人了。"
G["The lich, Kel'Thuzad. He serves the Lich King without question, a necromancer of great prowess in life, turned into a master of necromancy after his death. It is said he is the most loyal of the Lich King's subjects."]="巫妖克尔苏加德。显然他为巫妖王效力。克尔苏加德生前是一名强大的通灵师，死后自然而然地成为了巫术大师。据说他是巫妖王最忠诚的部下。"
G["The life of a smith is not an easy one, but it puts steel in yer bones and fire in yer heart. My da' was a smith, my grandfather before him in the forges beneath Grim Batol. And now my son follows in our footsteps, that boy makes me proud."]="铁匠的生活可不轻松，但是它能让你体格健壮，充满热情。我的父亲是一名铁匠，我的祖父曾经在格瑞姆巴托的炼铁炉工作。现在，我的儿子也跟随着我们的脚步，他让我倍感自豪。"
G["The light appears to have forsaken us."]="圣光似乎遗弃了我们。"
G["The light blinds me!"]="好刺眼的光芒！"
G["The light cleanses; but it is not gentle.  Gird yourselves and be purified!"]="光明净化一切，但它绝不温和。做好准备，接受净化吧！"
G["The light does not abandon its champions."]="圣光不会抛弃它的勇士。"
G["The light of the Sun illuminates the path to wisdom.  Where shall we walk today, friend?"]="La luz del Sol ilumina el camino a la sabiduría. ¿Por dónde quieres caminar hoy, $gamigo mío:amiga mía;?"
G["The light will not suffer your taint."]="光明不会被你们玷污。"
G["The light will prevail."]="圣光必胜！"
G["The light...mustn't burn out..."]="烈焰之光……不能熄灭……"
G["The light...returns..."]="光明……回来了……"
G["The line is secured to his ankle.  Pull away to trip him!"]="绳子已经紧紧绕在他的脚踝上了。拉动绳子把他绊倒！"
G["The link to the portal must be broken! Quickly, to Stormrage!"]="必须破坏传送门的联结！快去找怒风！"
G["The liquids and mixtures all bubble and spasm as you approach. Next to the equipment lies a large pair of tongs that look as though they would be adequate for dropping in samples of ooze.\n\nThere is safety gear present, but it appears to be dusty and well-ignored.\n\nDo you place some of your samples into the beakers?"]="当你靠近时，那些液体和混合物剧烈地翻腾起来。设备旁边是一把巨大的钳子，似乎很适合用来夹起淤泥样本。\n\n还有安全齿轮装备，但是上面布满灰尘，似乎很久没有使用过了。\n\n将一些样本放进烧杯吗？"
G["The liquids and mixtures all bubble and spasm as you approach. Next to the equipment lies a large pair of tongs that look as though they would be adequate for dropping in samples of ooze.\n\nThere is safety gear present, but it appears to be dusty and well-ignored.\n\nYou don't think touching anything would be wise."]="当你靠近时，那些液体和混合物剧烈地翻腾起来。设备旁边是一把巨大的钳子，似乎很适合用来夹起淤泥样本。\n\n还有安全齿轮装备，但是上面布满灰尘，似乎很久没有使用过了。\n\n你觉得什么东西都不碰为好。"
G["The list of Skyguard members is long and distinguished.  $n tops that list."]="在天空卫队的队员名单上，$n最为出众，因此名字也排在首位。"
G["The little feller be hidin' in one o' them boxes, matey. G'luck!"]="伙计，伐木机就藏在这些箱子中。祝你好运！"
G["The little spirit is helping us! Fight near him, hero!"]="那个小精灵在帮我们！在他附近战斗，英雄！"
G["The living are here!"]="这儿有活人！"
G["The living are not welcome here!"]="这里不欢迎生者！"
G["The living do not belong here."]="活人不属于这里。"
G["The living... here?!"]="这里有活人？！"
G["The lizard folk around here are likely to carry anything. Watch for 'em!"]="那些蜥蜴怪身上可能带有各种各样的东西。别放过他们！"
G["The local artificer, Daelo, can teach you the basics of engineering. Perhaps you can help our technician fix that malfunctioning communications device!"]="这里的技师，戴罗，可以教你些基础的工程学知识。也许你可以帮助我们的技术员修理那个坏掉的通信设备！"
G["The local earth spirit, Hui, is angry that we hired adventurers to drive off his mischievous sprites."]="由于我们雇用冒险者帮忙驱赶那些淘气的精灵，土灵仇灰为此大发雷霆。"
G["The locals here certainly have an idyllic lifestyle. It makes me wonder if I should lay down my wand and pick up a hoe."]="这里的本地人过着美好的田园生活。这不禁令我怀疑，自己是不是该放下魔杖，拿起锄头。"
G["The locals here insist that the great healing waters we seek are no further than a certain... Stormstout Brewery. We may have to investigate their claims."]="当地人坚称，我们要找的伟大治愈之水不过是……风暴烈酒而已。我们得调查下这种说法的真实性。"
G["The logistics involved in the optimal celebration of Pilgrim's Bounty are quite staggering... so many raw materials, so much labor, thousands upon thousands of crates of finished product shipped here and there and everywhere for countless Bountiful Tables.\n\nHonestly, I'm quite impressed! And hungry... I can smell pumpkin pie. Can you smell that pie?"]="为了庆祝感恩节而进行的大规模后勤工作实在是令人吃惊……无数物资与人力都被投入其中。成千上万箱各种物料成品被运送到世界各地，摆放在数不清的盛宴餐桌上。\n\n说实话，这次的后勤活动给我留下了很深的印象。而且现在我已经饿坏了……我能闻到南瓜馅饼的香味。你能闻到吗？"
G["The lone wolf dies but the pack survives."]="独狼难逃，群狼易生。"
G["The long reload takes some getting used to, but nothing else is better for starting off a fight."]="长时间重装弹药需要时间来适应，但是没有什么比战争更锻炼人了。"
G["The long walk from the monastery was murder on my feet - and on my appetite. I think I'll spend a while here loading up on energy before I think about standing up again."]="从修道院长途跋涉而来可苦了我的脚——还有我的胃。我想在重新考虑启程先在这儿大吃一顿，以恢复体力。"
G["The longer I stay here, the more I am charmed by this strange land."]="我在这里呆得越久，就越喜欢这片神奇的大陆。"
G["The longer we spend standing here the sooner Garrosh's men are going to find us."]="我们在这里停留的越久，加尔鲁什的人就越有可能发现我们。"
G["The longer you wait, the less future you have for me to foretell."]="你等得越久，我所能告诉关于你未来的信息就越少。"
G["The longhouse is destroyed! Alarms can be heard in the distance."]="长屋被摧毁了！警报声响彻云霄。"
G["The lords of the elemental planes are beings of pure chaos, Nazgrim."]="元素位面的领主们都是纯粹的混沌存在，纳兹戈林。"
G["The lords of the elemental planes are beings of pure chaos, captain."]="元素位面的领主们都是纯粹的混沌存在，队长。"
G["The loss of Wilfred Fizzlebang, while unfortunate, should be a lesson to those that dare dabble in dark magic. Alas, you are victorious and now must face the next challenge."]="很遗憾，我们失去了威尔弗雷德·菲兹班，但这也给那些胆敢研习黑暗魔法的人们敲响了警钟。唉，你胜利了。准备面对下一个挑战吧。"
G["The loss of our comrades was unpreventable. They lived and died in the service of the Argent Crusade."]="战斗难免牺牲，而我们的战友无论生死，都会效忠银色北伐军。"
G["The loss of the raccoon is the least of our worries. Our biggest concern is that petrified orc... and what its presence means. I can tell you the rest of the story."]="失去一只浣熊微不足道。我们最担心的是那个石化的兽人……以及它背后的意义。剩下的事就让我来说吧。"
G["The lunar celebration this year is quite magnificent!"]="今年的庆典太棒了！"
G["The lure of power is great. Mistakes were made."]="能量的诱惑很难抗拒。错误已然铸成。"
G["The machine adjusts to face you.\n\nOn the back of the machine is an empty, oddly misshapen slot with an engraving that reads: \"Propirtee o' Cap'n Gelkak Gyromast\""]="La máquina se ajusta a tu altura.\n\nEn la parte trasera de la máquina encontrarás una ranura deforme con el siguiente rótulo grabado: \"Propiedá del capitán Gelkak Gyromast\""
G["The machine comes alive at your touch."]="这台机器开始运转了。"
G["The machine has been destroyed, and so the mogu's power weakens."]="机器已经被摧毁了，魔古族的力量也被削弱了。"
G["The machine hums to life!  Get to the lower level!"]="机器开始嗡嗡作响了！到下层去！"
G["The mage tower to the north."]="北方的魔法塔。"
G["The mages may be found in Cleft of Shadow.  There are two entrances: One between the valleys of Strength and Wisdom, and the other in The Drag."]="可以在暗影裂口里找到那些法师。共有两个入口，一个位于力量谷与智慧谷中间，另一个在暗巷区。"
G["The mages of Dalaran are the most powerful in Azeroth!  We will not fail!"]="达拉然的法师们是艾泽拉斯最强大的法师！我们不会失败的！"
G["The magi congregate in the Wizard's Sanctum in the Mage Quarter. Quite a tower they have there. Makes our barracks look like peasant hovels."]="法师们都聚集在法师区的巫师圣殿里，那里有一座高塔。和它相比，我们的兵营就好像是一座农舍。"
G["The magic emanating from this area is fascinating, $c. I'm anxious to study their artifacts. There is so much we can learn."]="这个地区散发出来的魔力太神奇了，$c。我已经迫不及待地要研究他们的神器了。我们有太多东西要学了。"
G["The magic of the pools expanded their minds and grew their bodies, until they became one of the great ancient cultures of Pandaria."]="池塘的魔力滋养着他们的心智、壮大着他们的躯体，把他们变成了潘达利亚最伟大的古老生物之一。"
G["The magic of the wand appears to take hold on %s, but then it fades."]="魔杖似乎控制了%s的心智，但是魔法效果很快就消失了。"
G["The magic of today pales in comparison to that of millennia past. Still, we Highborne know much of the arcane. Are you ready to learn?"]="La magia de hoy no es nada en comparación con la de hace miles de años. Sin embargo, los Altonato poseemos un gran conocimiento de lo arcano. ¿Estás $glisto:lista; para aprender?"
G["The magic required to move Dalaran was too great!  We cannot hold it back forever!"]="移动达拉然的魔法太强大了！我们没办法一直压制住它！"
G["The magic that makes that disguise possible will hold up only a few minutes. I will teleport you directly into the heart of Blackmaw Hold. Enter into negotiations with their Chieftain immediately... and be prepared to fight your way out."]="这身魔法伪装只能持续几分钟。我将把你直接传送到黑喉要塞的核心位置。然后你要立刻和他们酋长谈判……并准备好一路冲杀出来。"
G["The magical wards at that point should be supported enough by the energy flux to contain the entity."]="该点的魔法屏障应该得到足够的能量支持，这样才能保持其稳定性。"
G["The magister's going to kill me..."]="魔导师会杀了我的……"
G["The magisters are the traitors! They have sealed our doom."]="魔导师们是叛徒！他们已经注定了我们的毁灭。"
G["The magisters are wise and will plot a prosperous course for our future."]="英明的魔导师将会指引我们走向繁荣的未来。"
G["The magisters will guide us back to glory."]="魔导师们会指引我们重获荣耀。"
G["The magistrate is very busy."]="镇长很忙。"
G["The magistrix will be happy to know  I'm  fluent in Thalassian.  Your courtesy is not lost on me."]="魔导师会很高兴知道我对萨拉斯语很熟悉的。别摆出一副谦恭的模样，我不吃你这套。"
G["The magma lord is a little... indisposed right now.  Stick around, this won't take more than a minute or two."]="熔岩领主现在有点儿……不对劲。别走远，这用不了一两分钟的时间。"
G["The magnataur are not as stupid as they appear. Keeping Gormok until his time is a difficult task, but he is bound tightly enough that there is no danger."]="猛犸人并不像看上去那样愚蠢。看管戈莫克就是一个非常困难的任务。但现在他已经被紧紧地捆住，应该不会有任何危险了。"
G["The maiden, eh? Hmm, I remember that's what my father used to call that river to the north. Other than that, I wouldn't have the slightest clue."]="少女，不是吗？嗯，我记得那就是我父亲过去常说的北面的河流。除此之外，我没有其他线索。"
G["The mailbox is in the Trade Quarter by that coffin storage closet they call an inn."]="邮箱在贸易区的棺材铺前面，也有人管那里叫旅馆。"
G["The main chamber is this way! Let's go!"]="主厅在这个方向！我们走！"
G["The man to talk to about gunnery is Buliwyf, found in the Timberline Arms within Ironforge."]="能教你使用枪的是布里维夫，去铁炉堡的密林武器店找他吧。"
G["The mana bomb!"]="魔法炸弹！"
G["The mana cells within the Eye of the Storm are a precious thing; we cannot afford to lose them to the draenei! You there! Make yourself useful and aid us in the fight!"]="风暴之眼中的魔法晶格非常珍贵，我们不能把它们拱手送给德莱尼人！你！协助我们作战吧！在战火中证明你的价值！"
G["The manor... someone else... will soon be consumed..."]="庄园……下一个牺牲者……很快就会被吞噬……"
G["The mantid are attacking, and we are shamefully unprepared.\n\nUnder normal circumstances, our enemy is quite predictable. We anticipated that the next full-scale mantid attack would hit in about ten years, as they do so regularly every hundred.\n\nThis current invasion is hardly \"full-scale\", but it's still strong enough to catch a farming village unawares. Had my Shado-Pan not been keeping such a watchful vigil on the wall, Stoneplow might have already fallen."]="Los mántides están atacando; es una vergüenza que estemos tan mal preparados.\n\nEn circunstancias normales, nuestro enemigo es bastante predecible. Sabíamos que el siguiente ataque mántide a gran escala sería en unos diez años, ya que suelen hacerlo una vez cada siglo.\n\nEsta invasión no puede considerarse \"a gran escala\", pero sigue siendo lo bastante fuerte como para pillar desprevenida a una aldea granjera. Si mis Shadopan no hubieran vigilado tan a conciencia la muralla, Villarroca ya habría caído."
G["The mantid are coming over the wall!"]="螳螂妖从长城上打来了！"
G["The mantid are harsh teachers."]="螳螂妖是严酷的老师。"
G["The mantid are under MY command, fools. See how she succumbs to me."]="螳螂妖对我唯命是从，蠢货。看看她有多听我的话。"
G["The mantid artillery is here, you must hurry heroes!"]="螳螂妖炮兵在那里，你们要快一点，各位英雄！"
G["The mantid besiege you from all sides."]="你已经被螳螂妖包围了。"
G["The mantid?! I always thought they were a spooky legend pandaren tell their children."]="螳螂妖？！我一直以为他们只是熊猫人讲给自己孩子听的恐怖传说。"
G["The mantle of a commander is a heavier burden than I had expected."]="指挥官的责任比我想象中更重。"
G["The mantle of a god must be heavy to bear."]="神灵的责任显然太过沉重。"
G["The map shows a naval strategy for defeating the Horde fleet."]="这份地图描绘了一个击败部落舰队的海军战略。"
G["The march upon the Undercity begins now! Be empowered by your King's strength! Follow me, heroes! FOR THE GLORY OF THE ALLIANCE!"]="前进！攻打幽暗城！英雄们，接受国王的祝福吧！跟着我！为联盟的荣耀而战！"
G["The market sure looks busy today."]="今天的市场看上去的确很忙碌。"
G["The marketing research Megs has conducted suggests that a naga invasion is imminent!"]="市场调研结果显示，纳迦即将发起入侵！"
G["The markings of this tablet show ancient diagrams and hold dire words of power, but their meaning is inscrutable to you."]="石板上篆刻着古老的图案，上面的文字蕴涵着可怕的力量，但是你无法理解它们的意思。"
G["The markings of this tablet show ancient diagrams and hold dire words of power.\n\nYou believe it is an alchemical recipe, but it is beyond your skill..."]="石板上篆刻着古老的图案，上面的文字蕴涵着可怕的力量。\n\n你相信这是一份炼金术配方，但是以你的技能还无法学习……"
G["The markings on this tablet show ancient diagrams and dire words of power, used to create  Gurubashi Mojo Madness..."]="石板上篆刻着古老的图案，上面的文字蕴涵着可怕的力量，用来制造Gurubashi Mojo Madness……"
G["The marmots get mad if they see you ruining their holes. Just nudge them out of the way first, and they'll leave you alone."]="要是让土拨鼠看到你毁了它们的地洞，一定会气疯的。先把它们解决掉，然后就好办了。"
G["The marsh out here smells almost as bad as Onyxia's breath!"]="外边的沼泽散发着一股奥妮克希亚的口臭味！"
G["The masquerade is over, Lady Prestor. Or should I call you by your true name... Onyxia..."]="化妆舞会结束了，女伯爵普瑞斯托。或者我应该称呼你的真名……奥妮克希亚……"
G["The massive floating eyeball in the center of the chamber turns its gaze upon you. You stand before a god."]="漂浮在这间屋子中的巨大眼球在盯着你看。你正站在一个神灵的面前。"
G["The master calls."]="主人在召唤。"
G["The master cannot wait any longer for these artifacts."]="主人等这些神器已经等得不耐烦了。"
G["The master comes."]="主人来了。"
G["The master desires your full obedience and you will comply!"]="主人希望得到你完全的服从，你必须应允！"
G["The master has business in the rooms above."]="主人在楼上的房间里面忙着。"
G["The master has fallen!  Avenge him, my brethren!"]="主人倒下了！我们要为他复仇！"
G["The master is busy, but I have time to come out and play!"]="主人很忙，我倒是有空陪你玩玩！"
G["The master is meeting with his apprentice."]="主人正在会见他的学徒们。"
G["The master surveyed his kingdom and found it... Lacking. His judgement was swift and without mercy: DEATH TO ALL!"]="主人审视他的王国，找到了它的……不足。他的决断迅速而无情：生灵俱灭！"
G["The master was clearly speaking to you, Valiona. I am far too busy to attack ANYONE."]="主人显然是在跟你说话，瓦里昂娜。我可没空去攻击谁。"
G["The master was right... to be concerned."]="主人……果然……深谋远虑。"
G["The master will avenge me!!"]="主人……会为我复仇雪耻的！"
G["The master will be most pleased with this news. The Black Dragonflight will provide you all that you ask. You will be allowed to ride upon the backs of our drakes as needed."]="主人听到这个消息一定会很高兴的。黑龙军团会满足你的一切要求，必要的情况下，你可以骑我们的幼龙。"
G["The master will be with you momentarily."]="主人很快就会召见你的。"
G["The master will end everything!"]="主人将结束一切的存在！"
G["The master will know of this incursion. You will be hunted for all eternity!"]="主人会知道这次可笑的入侵，你将永世被追杀！"
G["The master will not suffer this insult!"]="主人不会容忍这种冒犯！"
G["The master will see you all consumed."]="主人会见证你们的湮灭。"
G["The master's grasp is not so easily severed..."]="主人的掌控没那么容易被脱离……"
G["The master's power takes on many forms..."]="主人的力量有多种形式……"
G["The master's sanctum has been disturbed!"]="有人闯进了主人的房间！"
G["The master's will is done."]="这是主人的意志。"
G["The master... will be angry...."]="主人……会生气的……"
G["The materials I offer are rare and powerful."]="我提供的材料都是罕见而且强大的。"
G["The materials you have gathered from that cursed old keep will certainly make a worthy bow."]="你从那座被诅咒的古老城堡中取得的材料能够制作一张非常强大的弓。"
G["The matriarch knocked me right out of the sky. I'm lucky to be alive."]="那个怪物把我从天上打了下来。我能活下来就已经很走运了。"
G["The meddlers shall pay for their interference. Retreat to the shadows!"]="这就是多管闲事的下场！撤退！"
G["The memorial park to Antonidas is located in northern Dalaran."]="安东尼达斯的纪念碑位于达拉然北部。"
G["The memories in this locket swirl in anguish. Such pain and suffering... let us see what it wants to show us."]="这个坠饰里填满了伤恸的回忆。如此痛苦，如此悲哀……来看看它想告诉我们什么。"
G["The memories rush back, Thrall."]="萨尔，久远的记忆涌上了我的心头……"
G["The men and women of Honor Hold have shed such blood and have lost their youth in this monstrous land... and yet they still hold their spirits high!\n\nNow, you and your cohorts from Azeroth can help us turn the tide.  You give us hope that we may one day return to our homelands."]="荣耀堡的人们在这块恶魔横行的土地上浴血奋战，献出了他们的青春……而如今他们仍然激情不退！\n\n现在你和从艾泽拉斯来的军团可以帮助我们扭转局面。是你给了我们重返家乡的希望。"
G["The men will be glad to have you with us, Lord Zhu."]="将士们很荣幸与您并肩作战，祝掌门。"
G["The merchant known as Griftah has been exiled from this city for his fraudulent activities. We plan to go over these little knick-knacks he sells extremely carefully. Please, leave his stall undisturbed and let us do our work."]="商人格里伏塔因多次诈骗顾客，被判驱逐出沙塔斯城。我们要仔细检查他出售的这些小玩意儿。请配合我们的工作，离开他的摊位。"
G["The metal has lost its magic. I could make a weapon from it, but it would be no different from a mundane blade."]="金属失去了自身的魔法。我倒是能用它来打造武器，但是它和一口普通的宝剑没什么区别。"
G["The metal was salvageable.  I should be able to reforge the weapon as a sword or a dagger."]="所谓废物利用，就是说我应该可以把这些金属重新铸造成一把剑或者匕首。"
G["The metal's magical properties are gone! It can still be worked, but not by conventional smithing methods."]="金属的魔法属性消失了！它还能用，但是不能用寻常的方法来锻造了。"
G["The metals do not speak to me as the elements speak to you, but I hope that you will find this weapon worthy. King Wrynn and your farseer both have great confidence in your abilities."]="这些金属可不会像元素对你说话那样对我说话，但我希望你会发现这件武器值得你这样做。乌瑞恩国王和你们的先知都对你的能力有着很大的信心。"
G["The method of your cleansing lies within your grasp..."]="净化你们的方法就近在咫尺…"
G["The middle fragment of the World Pillar has been dug up and is missing!"]="世界之柱的中部碎片已经被挖出来，然后不知所踪了！"
G["The might of the dwarves is represented today by the Grand Champion of Ironforge, Lana Stouthammer!"]="今天，矮人的力量将在铁炉堡的总冠军，拉娜·硬锤的身上得以展现！"
G["The mightiest of all the beasts that make up the Ashenvale Hunt, Sharptalon is let to wander freely by the self-proclaimed guardians of this land, the night elves.  Sharptalon patrols for prey to the south of here, taking delight in rending the unsuspecting and unaware traveler limb from limb.\n\nTo bring down such a beast would be the mightiest of hauls, $n.  I wish you luck in the hunt for this creature!"]="La bestia más poderosa de todas las de la Caza de Vallefresno. Los guardianes autoproclamados de esta tierra, los elfos de la noche, permiten que Garfafilada vague a su libre albedrío por aquí. Garfafilada patrulla en busca de presas al sur de aquí, deleitándose en desgarrar los miembros de algún viajero desprevenido.\n\nAcabar con una bestia así es una gran hazaña, $n. ¡Te deseo buena suerte con la caza de esta criatura!"
G["The mighty Zar'thik bend the wind to their will!"]="强大的扎尔提克操纵风之意志！"
G["The mighty fortress carved within the fiery bowels of Blackrock Mountain was held by the sinister Dark Iron dwarves for centuries until Nefarian - the cunning son of the dragon, Deathwing - took control of the upper Spire and made war on the dwarves' holdings in the mountain's volcanic depths. Realizing that the dwarves were led by the mighty fire elemental, Ragnaros - Nefarian vowed to crush his enemies and claim the whole of Blackrock mountain for himself."]="黑石深渊深处的巨大堡垒是由矮人建筑大师弗兰克罗恩·铸铁所设计的。这个堡垒是矮人力量的象徵并被邪恶的黑铁矮人占据了数个世纪。然而，奈法利安——死亡之翼狡猾的儿子——对这个巨大的堡垒别有意图。他和他的黑龙军团占据了上层黑石塔并向占据着黑石深渊的黑铁矮人宣战。奈法利安知道矮人是由强大的火元素拉格纳罗斯所领导的，所以他立志要摧毁他的敌人并将黑石深渊全被占为己有。"
G["The mighty hunter, $n returns.  Tell me the tale of stalking your latest prey."]="强大的猎人$n回来了。给我讲讲你最新的狩猎故事吧。"
G["The mind has untold powers that we have not yet discovered. With balance and wisdom, it may be possible to unlock these powers of the mind.\n\nThe Dream Brew is only a tool that produces a temporary period of this all-seeing state."]="我们的心灵具有一种尚未发现、难以言喻的力量。凭借着智慧和平衡，我们就有可能施放出这种心灵之力。\n\n洄梦仙酒只是一个工具，能够帮你暂时进入这种全视状态。"
G["The mine cart is prepped and ready to go."]="矿车已经做好了出发的准备。"
G["The mine is lost. All of our defenders have perished and the miners resurrected as Scourge aberrations!"]="矿洞已经失守。所有的卫兵都被杀害了，死去的矿工还被复活，成为了天灾怪物！"
G["The miner here works in the War Quarter on the inner ring. His name's Brom Killian."]="这里的采矿训练师在军事区的内环区域工作。他的名字叫布罗姆·基里安。"
G["The mineral shipment from the Dunshire mine still hasn't arrived. I want to go and demand an answer in person, but I've been warned the road is dangerous."]="La remesa de minerales del yacimiento de Dunshire aún no ha llegado. Quiero ir y exigir una respuesta en persona, pero me han advertido que la carretera es peligrosa."
G["The miners can be found within Silvermoon City, no doubt close to the odiferous forges where they smelt their gains."]="你可以在银月城内找到矿工，毫无疑问他们在熔炉附近。"
G["The mines have been at peak efficiency under your leadership, despite the worms and lazy trolls."]="在你的英明领导下，这里的采矿工作效率达到了前所未有的高峰！那些坑道虫和懒惰的巨魔也终于安分了。"
G["The minute they put on that Alliance tabard, they died. I will NOT tolerate any lingering ties across enemy lines. Traitors to the Horde will die a traitor's death!"]="当他们穿上联盟战袍，他们已经死了。我绝不允许任何部落成员私通外敌。部落的叛徒必将以罪人的身份受死！"
G["The mist dissipates..."]="迷雾散去了……"
G["The mist envelops you in its grip!"]="迷雾彻底吞没了你！"
G["The mist is death... senseless, without compassion."]="迷雾意味着死亡……它悄无声息，残酷冷酷。"
G["The mist senses your presence!"]="迷雾发现了你！"
G["The mist will lead the way."]="薄雾会引领道路。"
G["The mistress will pay me handsomely for your heads!"]="只要干掉你们，女主人就会大大的奖赏我。"
G["The mists are now leaving my body. I will remain in this world as long as I can. As long as it takes."]="迷雾正逐渐从我的身上散去。我会尽我所能留在这个世界，不论天长地久。"
G["The mists around the Altar of Hethiss dissipate as Venoxis prepares a powerful spell!"]="当温诺希斯开始准备一个强大的法术时，赫希斯祭坛周围的迷雾消散了。"
G["The mists hide many secrets ... if you know where to look."]="迷雾里有许多秘密，如果你知道往哪儿看的话……"
G["The mixture is finished, $n.  Now we must save the child."]="混合物完成了，$n。现在我们要去救那个孩子。"
G["The mixture!  It moves!"]="药剂！它动了！"
G["The mogu ambushed us while we were trying to retreat from the mantid."]="魔古族在我们躲避螳螂妖的途中伏击了我们。"
G["The mogu and Zandalari are in the process of moving another shipment of treasures from Lei Shen's tomb to his throne room.  We will strike quickly and take as much as we can before his forces arrive.  You will only have a limited time before we pull you out, so be efficient $n.\nWe're only getting one shot at this, so make it count.\nWhen you're ready to begin, hand me the key and I'll open the door."]="Los mogu y los Zandalari están a punto de trasladar otro cargamento de tesoros de la tumba de Lei Shen a su sala del trono. Atacaremos rápidamente y nos llevaremos todo lo que podamos antes de que lleguen refuerzos. Solo tendrás un momento antes de que tengamos que retirarnos, $n, así que sé eficiente.\n\nSolo tendremos una oportunidad, así que aprovéchala.\n\nCuando quieras comenzar, dame la llave y abriré la puerta."
G["The mogu and Zandalari cower behind the Thunder King's walls. Lady Jaina has a plan to blast our way through. Speak to me when you're ready!"]="魔古族和赞达拉就躲在这些高墙后面。吉安娜制定了一个突击计划。你准备好了就跟我谈谈吧！"
G["The mogu are a mighty threat, but they're nothing compared to the horrors my men and I have faced in the Dread Wastes. I have no doubts that we can hold the Vale."]="魔古族可能是一个强大的威胁，但跟我和我的士兵所面对的恐惧废土的恐惧比起来，它根本不能恫吓住我们。我们一定可以在山谷中挖出一个洞来。"
G["The mogu are an ancient civilization spanning back thousands of years. Perhaps we can learn somethin' from 'em!"]="魔古族的文明十分古老，可以追溯到上千年前。或许我们能从他们那里学到点什么！"
G["The mogu are attacking Niuzao Temple. We need your help."]="魔古族在攻击砮皂寺。我们需要你的帮助。"
G["The mogu are attacking the temple!"]="魔古族在攻击寺院！"
G["The mogu are cruel captors. We should not risk any time if any of our brave warriors have fallen into their hands."]="魔古族是凶残的绑匪。如果我们勇敢的战士已经落入他们手里，那么不管在任何时候，我们就不应该再去冒险了。"
G["The mogu are our enemy. They seek to eliminate us from this world. Why should we believe the creation myths that they feed us?"]="魔古族是我们的敌人。他们想将我们从这个世界上抹去。我们为什么要相信他们灌输给我们的造物神话？"
G["The mogu are preparing for something big. We've got to stop them from getting ahold of any more ancient weapons."]="魔古族正在策划重大的阴谋。我们得阻止他们，决不能再让他们获得远古武器了。"
G["The mogu are usually thugs and brigands. They never struck me as having the patience for arcane magics."]="魔古族大多是些暴徒和强盗。在我印象中，他们向来没有学习奥术魔法的耐心。"
G["The mogu broke through our defenses...\n\nTheir army of jade soldiers was too much for us to hold back.\n\nI stayed behind to take care of Che, but the others retreated to the city to make their last stand."]="魔古族突破了我们的防线……\n\n他们的魔玉战士大军人数太多，我们抵挡不住。\n\n我在后方照顾车，但其他人撤进了城里，准备背水一战。"
G["The mogu chose the worst time to attack. The mantid are on the move, and not even the great wall will hold them back."]="魔古族偏偏在这个时候发起攻击。螳螂妖也不消停，即便是连长城也挡不住他们。"
G["The mogu claim to have created us... to have twisted us into our current forms. Do not believe their lies.\n\nWe are our own people, evolved from the great creator, Kros himself!"]="魔古族自称创造了我们……并将我们扭曲成现在的形态。不要相信他们的谎言。\n\n我们是独立的人民，源自于伟大的造物主克洛斯！"
G["The mogu emperor then ordered all of the saurok to be purged. He tried to wipe out their entire race, to no avail. They still plague Pandaria to this day."]="于是魔古皇帝下令铲除蜥蜴人。他想将整个蜥蜴人种族铲除，却无济于事。他们至今仍在潘达利亚肆虐。"
G["The mogu empire was overthrown centuries ago. These ruins have been here - and abandoned - for as long as anyone can remember. \n\nWhy would they come back now?"]="魔古帝国早就被推翻了。从那以后，这些遗迹就一直荒弃于此，已经记不清有多少个年头了。\n\n为什么他们偏偏现在回来了？"
G["The mogu forge weapons of both blood and steel. Their blades feast on death."]="魔古族用鲜血和钢铁锻造武器。他们的利刃必须啜饮死亡。"
G["The mogu grew restless. Many generations later, when Thunder King united them, they seized upon their legacy!"]="魔古族变得残暴。多年之后，雷电之王统一了他们，他们获得了自己的遗产！"
G["The mogu had stolen the bell, what is a hozen to do?"]="可是魔古族偷走了那口钟，我一个猢狲应该怎么办？"
G["The mogu have a way about them that implies leadership. Use caution."]="魔古族的首领有着特殊的领导能力。你要谨慎从事。"
G["The mogu held considerable power over the stones of the earth. Their magic lingers on, even centuries later."]="魔古族对大地的石头有着极大的控制力。他们的魔法直到数个世纪之后余力犹存。"
G["The mogu lie to our people. They tell us that we are their creation, that they twisted our flesh into its current form. They claim that we owe our existence to them.\n\nI DEFY the mogu! They have no power over us! They do not know what we see, how we live, what we feel! They cannot see into our souls!\n\nOnly Kros, the great creator, knows what is in your soul. Kros knows, and Kros understands. Kros gave you your strength, saurok. No mogu owns you."]="魔古族对我们撒了谎。他们说我们是他们的造物，他们将我们的血肉扭曲成了现在的形态。他们声称我们的存在全靠了他们。\n\n我蔑视魔古族的说法！他们无权统治我们！他们不理解我们的想法，不懂我们的生活方式和我们的感受！他们看不透我们的灵魂！\n\n只有伟大的造物主克洛斯，才能看透你的灵魂。克洛斯无所不知，通晓万物。克洛斯赐予你们力量，蜥蜴人。你们不属于魔古族。"
G["The mogu made the Divine Bell to create chaos, but the pandaren created a special mallet to turn the echoes of that chaos into perfect harmony. That mallet was hidden for thousands of years, until now."]="魔古族用圣钟制造混乱，而熊猫人制作了一个特殊的钟杵，能化混乱为祥和。它被埋藏了数千年，直到今天。"
G["The mogu ruled through fear. And fear kept them in power... until the first Pandaren monks taught my people courage."]="魔古族用恐惧统治臣民，用恐惧维持强权……直到第一代熊猫人武僧激发了人民的勇气。"
G["The mogu seek to destroy us. The mogu are our enemy. I will slay every last mogu that comes close to our home.\n\nWill you help?"]="魔古族想消灭我们。魔古族是我们敌人。我要杀光靠近我们家园的魔古族。\n\n你愿意来帮忙吗？"
G["The mogu served a Titan keeper. His name was \"Ra.\" In the mogu tongue, \"Ra-den\" means \"Master Ra.\" Fascinating! I must know more!"]="Los mogu servían a un guardián de los titanes. Se llamaba \"Ra\". En el idioma mogu, \"Ra den\" significa \"Maestro Ra\". ¡Fascinante! ¡He de saber más!"
G["The mogu tell a legend about Lei Shen, the Thunder King."]="魔古族中流传着雷电之王雷神的传说。"
G["The mogu were children as well. Children of the titans. They were once a legion of stone, heartless and obedient."]="魔古族也是孩子。泰坦的孩子。他们曾是一支岩石大军，没有思想，只懂服从。"
G["The mogu were masters of pain and torture, of dark magics and brutal weapons. No pandaren, hozen, or jinyu could resist the power they held. And my people were afraid."]="魔古族是痛苦与折磨的高手，还精于使用黑暗魔法和恐怖武器。任何熊猫人、猢狲和锦鱼人都无力与之对抗。恐惧笼罩着熊猫人。"
G["The mogu were using only a fraction of the resources available to them. Few among them possessed the cunning of the Thunder King."]="魔古族只使用了一小部分可调动的资源。很少有人能像雷电之王那么狡猾。"
G["The mogu's history is fraught with savage conquest and tests of strength. After thousands of years, only the strongest members of their race have survived."]="魔古族的历史中充斥着野蛮的征服和力量的试炼。数千年来，这个种族中只有最强者才能生存下来。"
G["The mogu's sorcery is unlike any we have encountered before."]="魔古族的巫术和我们之前所见过的完全不同。"
G["The mogu's strength is astonishing."]="魔古族的力量真是令人震惊。"
G["The mogu, Warchief. In the tome of pandaren history, they are written as cruel, relentless leaders. They were feared, not loved."]="是魔古族，酋长。根据熊猫人的历史记载，魔古族是生性残暴的统治者。他们靠强权震慑人民，而非仁政。"
G["The mogu, ah! The mogu! Their minds were so small! They were built to serve, and when they lost their masters, they served themselves."]="魔古族，啊！魔古族！这些蠢货天生就是下人！当失去了主人，他们就转而侍奉自己。"
G["The mogu, the mantid, and the Alliance all threaten the safety of this ancient place. We must protect it, at all costs."]="魔古族、螳螂妖和联盟都威胁到这个古老的地方的安全。我们必须不惜一切代价保护它。"
G["The mogu, the mantid, the saurok... they are not just enemies to defeat. They are mysteries to solve!"]="魔古族、螳螂妖、蜥蜴人……他们不仅是需要我们击败的敌人，更是有待解开的谜团！"
G["The mogu, they seem not so good at this game, if their dead bodies are any indication."]="这些尸体表明，魔古族似乎不擅长玩这个游戏。"
G["The mojo of Sseratus is ours. Now all will be crushed under the might of the Drakkari!"]="西莱图斯的魔精属于我们啦。世间万物都将臣服于达卡莱的力量！"
G["The molten slag begins to bubble furiously!"]="熔渣剧烈地沸腾着！"
G["The moment is soon at hand, mortal. You shall toil for eternity in a new Azeroth!"]="你的大限将至，凡人。你将在新的艾泽拉斯永受折磨！"
G["The moment that C'Thun had so patiently waited for had finally arrived. His children had spent thousands of years building an army capable of exacting revenge upon the whole of Kalimdor and now the prize was within their grasp."]="克苏恩苦苦等待的时刻终于来临了。他的孩子们花了数千年的时间，创建了一支强大的军队，准备对整个卡利姆多展开疯狂的报复；现在一切尽在他们的掌控之中。"
G["The moment they fail, they cede their power to the one who can."]="当他们玩忽职守时，就将权利让给了有能力的人。"
G["The moment we've been dreading is now at hand, $C. Archimonde has made his way to Nordrassil, and is beginning to devour the World Tree's energies. Malfurion needs more time for his plan to work, so we must do the unthinkable. You must attack Archimonde directly, while my own troops hold off the streams of Burning Legion forces approaching the top of the mount."]="噩梦般的时刻就在眼前了，$c。阿克蒙德成功地靠近了诺达希尔，并开始吸取世界之树的能量。玛法里奥需要更多时间来准备他的计划，我们必须尽全力完成这几乎不可能的任务。在我的部队抵抗潮水般的燃烧军团部队时，你必须直接进攻阿克蒙德。"
G["The monastery was once a center for learning and enlightenment. With the rise of the undead Scourge during the Third War, the peaceful Monastery was converted into a stronghold of the fanatical Scarlet Crusade. The Crusaders are intolerant of all non-human races, regardless of alliance or affiliation. They believe that any and all outsiders are potential carriers of the undead plague - and must be destroyed."]="血色修道院曾经是洛丹伦王国牧师的荣耀之地——那里是学习圣光知识和膜拜的中心。随着在第三次大战中亡灵天灾的崛起，宁静的修道院成为了疯狂的血色十字军的要塞。十字军对于所有非人类都有着偏激的态度，无论他们是自己的盟友还是对手。他们相信所有任何外来者都带着亡灵的诅咒——他们必须被摧毁。"
G["The monk trainer is in the inner ring of the War Quarter. She's training some of our Deathguards in her people's fighting style."]="武僧训练师在军事区的内圈。她正在训练一些亡灵卫兵学习她族人的战斗方法。"
G["The monkeys already extracted most of the kaja'mite out of this deposit."]="那些猴子已经将这里的大部分卡亚矿都挖走了。"
G["The monkeys are going to get a kick out of those bananas!"]="那些香蕉一定会让猴子们乐翻天的！"
G["The monster in your nightmares."]="你们噩梦中的怪物。"
G["The monster."]="怪物。"
G["The monstrous menagerie has been vanquished!"]="这些恐怖的野兽终于被消灭了！"
G["The moon waxes and wanes, yet she is never truly gone."]="La luna crece y mengua, pero nunca desaparece del todo."
G["The moonlight can bring rest to your weary souls in this forgotten place."]="在这遗忘之地，月光能让你们疲惫的灵魂得到安息。"
G["The moonlight fades into darkness!"]="月光隐入了黑暗之中！"
G["The moonstalker jumps to its feet, teeth bared."]="月夜猛虎跳起来，露出了獠牙。"
G["The moonstalker rises, angry at being disturbed."]="月夜猛虎站起来，因为受到打扰而愤怒不已。"
G["The moonstalker rouses from its slumber with a deep growl."]="月夜猛虎从沉睡中醒来，发出一阵深沉的吼叫。"
G["The moonstalker wakes suddenly and lets out a low growl."]="月夜猛虎突然醒过来，发出一阵低沉的咆哮。"
G["The moonwell is to the northeast, on the other side of the pool and up the hill."]="月亮井在东北面，在水池另一侧的山上。"
G["The more agile among us can sometimes be difficult to spot, but nonetheless, you'll probably run across the rogue Zelanis and his cohorts deep within Murder Row."]="有时候很难找到那些敏捷的家伙，不过你很可能在谋杀小径的深处偶遇潜行者瑟兰尼斯和他的伙计们。"
G["The more eagerly you seek after a thing, the more it eludes you."]="你越想找一样东西，就越是找不到。"
G["The more he ran, the more his stomach growled."]="他跑得越远，他的肚子就叫得越响。"
G["The more pain we can inflict, the quicker we can get our answers."]="我们施加的痛苦越多，就能越快得到想要的答案。"
G["The more powerful enchantments are beyond even me, $n. Your path should lead you through Elwynn Forest to the Tower of Azora, where your next tutor spends her days. Her name is Kitta Firewind."]="$n，我所掌握的附魔技能相当有限。你应该前往艾尔文森林的阿祖拉之塔，基塔·费温德就居住在塔中，她是你的下一任导师。"
G["The more that I travel this land, the fonder I grow of the pandaren people. Such delicious food and drink does not hurt, either."]="我在这片土地上游历得越久，就越喜欢这群熊猫人。唯爱佳肴美酒，平生与世无争。"
G["The more you shout, the longer it will take to resolve this."]="你们大喊大叫只能耽误更多时间。"
G["The more you struggle, the more it will hurt!"]="你越挣扎就越痛！"
G["The mortal coil unwindsss..."]="从尘世的桎梏中解脱……"
G["The mortally wounded orc seems to be unconscious."]="这个受了重伤的兽人已经不省人事了。"
G["The mortals gathered around the fire in awe and wonder. It could cook their food and warm their homes. They seized it! And protected it!"]="凡人敬畏而惊奇地聚拢到火堆周围，用它烹煮、取暖。他们获取了它！小心呵护！"
G["The mortals have fallen! The new age of the Blackrock legion is at hand!"]="凡人战败了！黑石军团的新时代即将来临！"
G["The mortals will be tested!"]="凡人将接受考验！"
G["The mosswalker looks severely injured."]="苔行鳄鱼人似乎受了重伤。"
G["The mosswalker victim groans in pain."]="苔行村受害者发出痛苦的呻吟。"
G["The most amazing of the Lunar Festival parties is in Moonglade. Don't walk there, though, the druids in the Valley of Wisdom can transport you."]="最精彩的春节庆典正在月光林地举行。当然你不用跋山涉水走去那里，智慧谷的德鲁伊们可以直接传送你过去。"
G["The most important ingredient!"]="这是最重要的材料！"
G["The most popular inn in Dalaran is the Legerdemain Lounge, just north of the city's center.\n\nThe Alliance and Horde Quarters each have their own inns as well, and I am told there is one more beneath the city, in the sewers."]="魔术旅馆是达拉然最受欢迎的旅店，就在市中心以北。\n\n联盟区和部落区均设有旅店。听说达拉然下水道里也有一家旅店。"
G["The most powerful death knights within Naxxramas are the four horsemen. They represent the pinnacle of Kel'Thuzad's guard. The first, Thane Korth'azz, holds the power of flame."]="天启四骑士是纳克萨玛斯中最强大的死亡骑士，是克尔苏加德麾下最顶尖的防御将领。首先介绍库尔塔兹领主，他能操纵火焰的力量。"
G["The mountain hozen are on the ravage. Be careful when you travel the roads.\n\nProbably only a matter of time before they figure out the Shado-Pan are not here and decide to march down on us."]="高山猢狲正在肆虐。在这条路上行走要多加小心。\n\n迟早他们会发现影踪派不在这里，并会向我们追赶而来。"
G["The mountain is angry, stranger. Not good for travel now."]="高山发怒了，陌生人。现在可不适合出行。"
G["The mountain roads can be a dangerous place."]="山路上可能危机四伏。"
G["The mountain will forgive the bird, but not always the rider."]="高山会原谅飞鸟，但不一定会宽恕骑手。"
G["The mountains are rich with history... don't forget to stop and take it all in, $c."]="这片山脉的历史非常悠久……你要随时停下脚步来倾听，$c。"
G["The muddy track clearly shows a dexterous paw."]="那泥泞的踪迹显然是敏捷的爪子留下的。"
G["The muisek vessels are now ready, $n."]="灵魂精华容器已经准备好了，$n。"
G["The mule looks at you expectantly."]="骡子充满期待地看着你。"
G["The musty pages of the codex seem to magically turn themselves, guiding your attention to a specific chapter past horrors no mortal eyes should ever perceive.\n\nThe book opens to a page that somehow feels 'right,' yet so very wrong."]="散发着霉味的书页似乎着魔一般翻动起来，你注意到法典中某个特殊的章节，上面的文字渗透出凡人难以察觉的恐怖气息。\n\n书页停止翻动，仿佛在指引你阅读摊开在你面前的这一页。你浏览着其中的内容，却发现它记载的是一段禁断的历史。"
G["The mutant goblin's tentacles break free and slither across the ground!"]="变异地精的触角掉了下来，在地上滚动！"
G["The naaru accepted the defectors, who would be known as the Scryers; their dwelling lies in the platform above.  Only those initiated with the Scryers are allowed there."]="纳鲁接受了这些叛节的血精灵，他们被称为占星者。他们住在上面的平台，只有他们的追随者才被允许踏足那里。"
G["The naaru are wise beyond our understanding.  I've learned more from A'dal in the last five months than all the years I spent in the libraries of Dalaran."]="纳鲁的智慧远远超出我们的理解。在过去的五个月里，我从阿达尔那里学到的东西，远比我这么多年在达拉然图书馆里学到的还多。"
G["The naaru kept some of the most dangerous beings in existence here in these cells. Let me introduce you to another...."]="纳鲁把多种宇宙中最危险的怪物关在这些牢笼里。请允许我向你们介绍下一种……"
G["The naaru's emergency shutdown will disable the manaforge permanently!  It must be aborted!"]="纳鲁的紧急停机程序会让法力熔炉永久停止运转的！必须阻止它！"
G["The naga are even pumping the water out of their own lake!  What purpose could that possibly serve?"]="纳迦们甚至在抽干他们自己湖里的水。他们到底有什么企图？"
G["The naga are monsters!"]="纳迦简直是恶魔！"
G["The naga are pumping all of the water away for their own use, and entire species are dying out as a result.\n\nIf we don't do something soon, what life is left on this dying world will disappear forever."]="纳迦为了自己的目的，把所有的水都抽走了，这里的生物种群正在走向灭绝。\n\n如果我们不尽快采取行动，这个垂暮的世界上剩余的生物就会永远消失。"
G["The naga are suppressing my will.  I can feel what they're doing, but I am powerless to act."]="纳迦在压制我的意志。我能感觉到他们在做什么，可我无力采取任何行动。"
G["The naga are using slave labor? They'll pay for their transgressions!"]="纳迦在使用奴隶劳工？他们必须为这种罪行付出代价！"
G["The naga came close to breaking my will... but the secret is still safe, thanks to you."]="纳迦几乎就要击碎我的意志了……不过秘密仍然很安全，谢谢你。"
G["The naga do not respect nature. They twist and corrupt it to meet their needs. They live to agitate the spirits."]="纳迦不尊重大自然。他们为了满足自己的私欲让大自然扭曲和堕落，他们的行为激怒了元素之灵。"
G["The naga do nottt... have thissss... cipherrr..."]="纳迦……没有这个……密码……"
G["The naga escaped out of the tunnel ahead. Show them no mercy, $c."]="纳迦逃出了前面的隧道。绝不要对他们有任何怜悯，$c。"
G["The naga have enlisted the aid of the Old God's minions."]="纳迦得到了上古之神奴仆的帮助。"
G["The naga must pay for what they've done here!"]="纳迦必须为他们在这里的所作所为付出代价！"
G["The naga of Coilskar are exceptionally cruel to their prisoners. It is a miracle that I survived inside that watery prison for as long as I did. Earthmother be praised."]="库斯卡的纳迦对他们的战俘异常凶残。我能在水牢里活这么长时间真是个奇迹。感谢大地之母。"
G["The naga priestesses look to be summoning a near endless stream of reinforcements!"]="纳迦女祭司们仿佛在召唤无穷无尽的援军！"
G["The naga torture the spirits of water. They invoke chaos and destruction!"]="纳迦折磨着水之魂。他们引起了混乱和毁灭！"
G["The naga! They've followed $n back to the ship!"]="纳迦！他们跟踪$n溜上船了！"
G["The naga's water boiler activates and the sound of dying frenzies can be heard below."]="纳迦的开水锅炉被激活了，随后从下面传来撕心裂肺的叫声。"
G["The name of Earthshatter has been one held by my family for hundreds of years. And like my father and his father before him, I too have inherited the right to create the vestments of my namesake."]="碎地者这个姓氏所代表的伟大家族，已经存在了几百年了。和我父亲，我父亲的父亲，以及更遥远的先祖一样，我继承了制造这种以我家族姓氏命名的护甲的能力。"
G["The name of Stormstout will be sung once again throughout the hills!"]="风暴烈酒的美名必将再次响彻群山！"
G["The natives here are quite friendly. Well, except for those monkeys."]="这里的原住民都很友善。呃，那些猴子除外。"
G["The natural beauty of these hills belies a great darkness below.  Tread carefully, friend."]="黑暗就蛰伏在这片秀丽的山岭下。朋友，千万当心。"
G["The nearby activity of living flesh drives some Bore Worms to action!"]="附近活动的血肉令钻地蠕虫骚动了起来！"
G["The nearby forces of the Scarlet Crusade stand ready to assist their Commander if he is attacked."]="附近的血色十字军兵力正蓄势待发，一旦指挥官遭到攻击，立刻出手相助。"
G["The nearby pools of amber begin to bubble violently!"]="琥珀附近的水池开始剧烈地冒泡！"
G["The nearest bank ye'll find is The Vault in Ironforge, $glad : lass;."]="最近的银行就是铁炉堡银行，$g小伙子:姑娘;。"
G["The nearest is just ahead. If ye can save him, he may know a thing or two."]="前面就有一个。要是能救下他，也许就能了解些情况。"
G["The needle is small, but the thread is strong, and the stitches are fine. Our pact with Thrall and the others will hold. The Horde will not be driven from these lands."]="针太细，线太粗，针脚倒还不错。我们与萨尔和其他人的合约将继续有效。部落不会被驱逐出这片土地的。"
G["The nerubian siege outside is chilling, Sagai. There seems to be no end to them."]="萨盖，蛛魔将要塞围得水泄不通啊。它们的数量简直无穷无尽。"
G["The nether drake looks upon you approvingly."]="虚空幼龙赞许地看着你。"
G["The nether drake refuses to let you mount it. Be sure to get a phase disruptor from Professor Dabiri. It will not take you up without one."]="虚空幼龙拒绝让你骑上它。你要从达比雷教授那里拿到相位扰流器，否则它是不会载你起飞的。"
G["The netherlisk will be a challenge but the gladiator will pull through!"]="虚空蜥蜴会是个挑战，但是角斗士会渡过难关的！"
G["The new island - just surfaced after the last earthquakes."]="那座新岛是在上次地震之后升出水面的。"
G["The news from Stormwind does not bode well. . . ."]="从暴风城来的消息似乎不太妙……"
G["The next battle begins in $3975w:$3976w$3782w:$3784w$3785w."]="下一场战斗将在$3975w:$3976w$3782w:$3784w$3785w内开始。"
G["The next battle begins in %3975w:%3976w%3782w:%3784w%3785w."]="下一场战斗将在%3975w:%3976w%3782w:%3784w%3785w内开始。"
G["The next battle will be against the Argent Crusade's most powerful knights! Only by defeating them will you be deemed worthy..."]="接下来你们将面对银色北伐军最强的骑士！只有打败他们，才能证明你的价值……"
G["The next clutch is due to hatch soon, sire. We will be ready to launch the attacks by week's end."]="阁下，下一个时间点就要来临。我们已经准备在周末发动攻击。"
G["The next combatant is second to none in her passion for upholding the Light. I give you Argent Confessor Paletress!"]="接下来出场的是圣光最忠实的追随者！银色神官帕尔崔丝！"
G["The next location of the Darkmoon Faire has not been finalized yet, but when it is you and I will be the first to know!"]="暗月马戏团的下一站还没有决定，但是相信你和我都会在第一时间知道的！"
G["The next one of you peons that messes up will spend a night patrolling the cursed perimeter!"]="你们这些苦工谁要是再犯错，就给我在这被诅咒的边界巡夜！"
G["The next person who asks me for a potion is getting a knuckle sandwich. I quit alchemy!"]="谁再问我要药水，我就揍他。我再也不当炼金师了！"
G["The next spirit that awaits you is Shu, the spirit of water. When you are ready, meet Aysa at the Singing Pools to the east."]="El próximo espíritu que te espera es Shu, el espíritu del agua. Cuando estés $glisto:lista;, reúnete con Aysa en las Pozas Cantarinas, situadas al este."
G["The next stage of my experiment begins!"]="实验下一阶段开始了！"
G["The next ten orcs I kill are gonna be for you, friend."]="我接下来要杀死的十个兽人是献给你的，朋友。"
G["The next time the Headless Horseman comes, we'll beat him again!"]="无头骑士下次再过来的话，我们同样会再次打败他！"
G["The next, Lady Blaumeux, calls forth the power of shadows, drawing the souls of the living into the voracious embrace."]="下一位是女公爵布劳缪克丝。她能召唤暗影的力量，吞噬活人的灵魂。"
G["The nice thing about trees is they always grow back. This is what you would call sustained income!"]="利用树木挣钱的好处就是，它们还会长出来。这就叫可持续发展！"
G["The night Kael'thas leveled the village, I could do nothing to help. His magic had already sealed me in the tower, exacerbating my torment by forcing me to witness the deaths of my fellows.\n\nAnd still their voices are calling from far away, waking me up in the middle of the night."]="在凯尔萨斯夷平村庄的那个晚上，我根本帮不上任何忙。他的魔法早已把我封印在塔中，我的随从们被折磨至死，他逼迫我亲眼目睹这一幕惨剧。\n\n昨夜的梦就在眼前，是谁把我留在这里空悲切。"
G["The night elf army was pushed back through Un'Goro, to the borders of the Tanaris desert. Something in Un'Goro prevented the Qiraji from being able to take the land. I do not quite understand this word but I believe it to mean 'God Lands.' It is stated that they could not 'take the God Lands.'"]="\"El ejército del elfo de la noche se vio obligado a retroceder a través de Un'Goro hasta las fronteras del Desierto de Tanaris. Algo en Un'Goro impedía a los qiraji tomar aquellas tierras. No entiendo muy bien esta palabra pero creo que es \"Tierras del Dios\". Dice que ellos no podían \"tomar las Tierras del Dios\".\""
G["The night elves didn't properly secure their portals in Dalaran. It was a simple matter to exploit the ley lines..."]="暗夜精灵没有认真守好他们在达拉然的传送门。要利用那条魔法轨迹很容易……"
G["The night elves of Darnassus cheer for $n."]="达纳苏斯的暗夜精灵为$n而欢呼。"
G["The night is dark and savage."]="黑夜漫漫，处处凶险。"
G["The night surrounds you..."]="黑夜将你包围……"
G["The nightmare is over!"]="噩梦结束了！"
G["The nightmare is over! The spell is broken! Goodbye Kalec, my love!"]="噩梦结束了！法术被破除了！再见，亲爱的卡雷！"
G["The nightmare of Ursal is over! We are free!"]="乌萨尔的噩梦终结了！我们自由了！"
G["The nightmare reigns!"]="噩梦统御一切！"
G["The nightmare shifts!"]="噩梦变换了！"
G["The noble deeds of your $r $c servant defy $g his:her; stature, Stormlord. $g His:her; efforts have succeeded in softening the hearts of my people."]="Los nobles actos de tu sirviente $r $c desafían su tamaño, Señor de la Tormenta. Sus esfuerzos han conseguido ablandar los corazones de mi gente."
G["The north still reeks of undeath. Our homelands lay in ruin. Pandaria oozes our hatred and doubt. What hope is there for this world when the Burning Legion again lands upon our shores?"]="北方仍有亡灵肆虐。我们的家乡满目疮痍。潘达利亚四处散发着我们的仇恨与怀疑。当燃烧军团再次踏上我们的海岸时，这个世界还有什么希望？"
G["The north-eastern keep tower has been damaged!"]="东北方的塔楼遭到破坏！"
G["The north-eastern keep tower has been destroyed!"]="东北方的塔楼被摧毁了！"
G["The north-western keep tower has been damaged!"]="西北方的塔楼遭到破坏！"
G["The north-western keep tower has been destroyed!"]="西北方的塔楼被摧毁了！"
G["The number of naga here continue to rise steadily...."]="这里的纳迦数量正在稳定地持续增长……"
G["The numbers of my companions dwindles, goddess, and my own power shall soon be insufficient to hold back the demons of Felwood."]="女神啊，我同伴的数量正在不断地减少，我的力量很快就不足以阻止费伍德森林的恶魔了。"
G["The objective is simple: kill me and take my deathcharger."]="目标很简单：杀死我，夺走死亡战马。"
G["The observers were in the service of Illidan... not the Legion."]="眼魔曾是伊利丹的仆从……而非燃烧军团。"
G["The odds appear to be against us, but we cannot falter, $n.  We are all that stands between the enemy's hordes and Nordrassil."]="我们的胜算不大，但我们不能退缩，$n。在敌人的大军和诺达希尔之间就只剩下我们这一道屏障。"
G["The odds are 32.33 (repeating of course) percent chance of success."]="成功的几率是百分之32.33（无限循环）。"
G["The ogres - ya kilt 'em!"]="食人魔——消灭他们！"
G["The ogres have the keys! Kill the ogres and get me out of here!"]="食人魔拿着钥匙！干掉他们，把我弄出这里！"
G["The ogres, they bury me here up to my neck and then forget to come back.\n\nYah, mon, funny.  Laugh it up.  Disembodied ghost head here.\n\nOf course, if you want to help me out, I might be able to make it worth your while.\n\nBut no, keep laughing."]="那些食人魔，他们把我埋起来，然后忘记回来了。\n\n嗯，朋友，有趣吧，笑吧。\n\n当然，要是你想帮我出来，我是不会让你吃亏的。\n\n如果你不想帮忙，就继续笑吧。"
G["The old blood will flow once again with the coming of the raven, the return of the darkness in the skies. Scarlet night, and the rise of the old."]="古神的血液会因为乌鸦的到来而再度流淌，黑暗将在天际重现。猩红的夜晚，古神将会复生。"
G["The old memories stir. They rush back to me as if propelled by the noble spirits of the air..."]="往日的回忆不断浮现。它们在我脑海中急速掠过，仿佛是高贵的空气之魂在催促着它们。"
G["The old wounds still linger, $g lad:lass;. I can feel 'em in me bones, even now. Aye, I got a score to settle with Arthas and ye can believe I'm gonna give that boy the beatin' I shoulda given 'im when he was a wee lad. Always knew there was something wrong with 'im.\n\nTell me when yer crew is ready and we'll lift off for the top o' the citadel.\n\nArthas won't be expectin' this!"]="旧伤尚未复原，$g小伙子:姑娘;。我尚能深深地感觉到。没错，我还有仇要向阿尔萨斯报，当他还未成气候时我就应该好好教训他，我会给他补上这个的。总是感觉他有些不对劲。\n\n你的船员准备好以后告诉我一声，我们准备起飞直达堡垒的顶部。\n\n阿尔萨斯决不会料到这一招！"
G["The one memory, I clung to, Darion... The one thought that kept me from giving in..."]="有个回忆，是我的力量，达里安……是让我不被奴役的力量……"
G["The one remaining is still enough to finish you."]="就算只剩一个，对付你们也是绰绰有余。"
G["The one that they call Hellscream might be our only hope."]="被他们称为“地狱咆哮”的那个人恐怕是我们最后的希望了。"
G["The only escape is death!"]="死亡是唯一的解脱！"
G["The only good $R is a dead $R!"]="¡$gEl único:La única; $r $gbueno:buena; es $gun:una; $r $gmuerto:muerta;!"
G["The only good vermen is a dead vermen!"]="好的坏蛋就是死掉的坏蛋！"
G["The only justice is death!"]="死亡是你唯一的命运！"
G["The only madness here is your own, Kor'ik! Did you really think you would go unnoticed forever?"]="这里疯的只有你自己，科尔里克！你真以为自己能永远不被发现？"
G["The only one I'm worried about is Qua-Ro. He always has some trick up his sleeve."]="我唯一担心的就是奎陆，他总在自己的设备上搞些花样。"
G["The only peace you shall find is in death, Kvaldir!"]="你们只能在死亡后获得和平，克瓦迪尔！"
G["The only place in Stormwind where magic and spirits mix, come to the Blue Recluse!"]="到蓝色隐士来吧，暴风城唯一一个魔法和精神完美结合的地方！"
G["The only reason that you still live is because of my curiosity."]="你还活着只是因为我比较好奇。"
G["The only redemption for the traitors responsible for this will be an agonizing death. My vengeance will be swift and without mercy."]="参与暴乱的叛徒们唯一的救赎就是痛苦的死去。我的复仇将迅速而决不留情。"
G["The only remaining spirit is Dafeng, who hides somewhere across the Dawning Span to the west."]="现在只剩下上古风灵大风了，他就躲在西边的晨之桥那头的某个地方。"
G["The only surviving egg of my late gryphon, Sky'ree.  Honor it and care for it; her child is yours."]="这是我的狮鹫斯卡雷唯一留存下来的蛋。请尊重它，爱护它。斯卡雷的孩子将成为你的伙伴。"
G["The only thing I'll tell you is to get the hell out of here!"]="我唯一能告诉你的，就是给我滚开！"
G["The only thing Metzen is going to be doing this Winter Veil is roasting on a spit!"]="梅森在冬幕节只有一件事情可做，那就是躺在烤肉架上！"
G["The only thing hurt is your pride, lad. Buck up!"]="只是有点伤自尊嘛，伙计。振作一点啦！"
G["The only thing that matters is that we rescue my father."]="唯一要紧的事是救出我父亲。"
G["The only thing you will find at Thal'darah Grove are terrified young druids. They have no weapon of mass destruction."]="你在萨达拉树林只会找到受惊的小德鲁伊。他们手里根本没有什么大规模杀伤性武器。"
G["The only true crime is inaction."]="无为乃罪。"
G["The only way I know is that of the warrior."]="我知道的唯一办法是战斗。"
G["The only way a hero can die, $r: Through tragedy. The Grand Crusader struck a deal with Kel'Thuzad himself! An ambush would be staged that would result in the death of Mograine. The type of betrayal that could only be a result of the actions of one's most trusted and loved companions."]="英雄的末路啊，$r，大概只有一种吧，那就是悲剧。大十字军一定是亲自与克尔苏加德做了一笔交易，陷害了莫格莱尼。莫格莱尼遭到了天灾军团的伏击，不幸死去了。这种背叛也只能由他至亲至信至爱之人来做才能成功……"
G["The only weapon I know of that has no use other than killing someone. Not something, but someone. These blades were invented to end the lives of men. Beautiful aren't they?"]="武器就是用来杀人的，它们被制造出来的目的就是杀人。它们都很漂亮，不是吗？"
G["The opening of the Dark Portal brought news of my people's fate. In a way, my exile shielded me from sharing in their downfall, but to see the Farstriders throw their lot in with Kael'thas...\n\nI never imagined my one-time brethren capable of such a thing.\n\nThe homecoming I once dreamt of will never happen. This forest is the only home I have left."]="我的同胞的命运随着黑暗之门的打开进入了新的篇章。在某种程度上来说，我的流放使我免于堕落。但是看到远行者把他们的命运都交给了凯尔萨斯……\n\n我不敢相信我以前的朋友可以做出这样的事情。\n\n我那回家的梦看来永远都不可能实现了，这片森林是我唯一的家。"
G["The opposition includes some of Gnomeregan's finest... although they've all seen better days. It's the leper gnome quintet!"]="另一边是诺莫瑞根的精英小队……至少他们曾经是。麻疯侏儒五重奏！"
G["The orb behind me was once capable of glimpsing into the happenings on Azeroth.\n\nKael'thas's curse changed all that, of course, but during our years of isolation many of the mages found solace in its images.\n\nSome scried to remember; some scried to forget."]="我身后的宝珠曾经可以用来窥视艾泽拉斯正在发生的事。\n\n凯尔萨斯的诅咒改变了一切，当然，在这么多年的隔离中，很多法师通过它的影像得到了慰籍。\n\n风吹不散长恨，花染不透乡仇。"
G["The orb explodes!"]="宝珠爆炸了！"
G["The orb has been dropped!"]="宝珠被丢掉了！"
G["The orb has been returned!"]="宝珠又回来了！"
G["The orb swirls malevolently..."]="宝珠邪恶地旋转起来……"
G["The orb's markings match the brand on your hand."]="宝珠的印记和你的手正好适合。"
G["The orbiting spheres pulse with dark energy!"]="黑暗能量正在这颗旋转的魔球中脉动！"
G["The orbs have appeared!"]="宝珠出现了！"
G["The orc leaders agree with your assessment."]="部落的领袖同意你的看法。"
G["The orc's corpse has been casually tossed aside so as not to litter the walkway."]="为了保持道路的整洁，兽人的尸体被随便地丢弃在路的两旁。"
G["The orcs and tauren are fortunate to have found one another, for each people's strengths compliment the other's.  We are glad to join them in this celebration.\n\nEven the Forsaken partake, though to what end I am not certain..."]="兽人和牛头人能够在这个世界上彼此找到，成为伙伴，这对他们来说实在是一件幸运的事。这两个种族有着不相上下的强猛力量。我们很高兴能和他们一起庆祝这个节日。\n\n就连被遗忘者一族也参加了这次节日庆典。虽然我并不确定他们要怎样庆祝这个节日……"
G["The orcs hate us, Obadei!  They've killed many of us before!  They deserve death and worse."]="这些兽人恨我们，欧巴迪！他们杀了我们这么多的同伴，死亡是他们应得的。"
G["The orcs in my citadel will drink your blood and devour you!"]="我堡垒中的兽人将吃你的肉，喝你的血！"
G["The orcs of Orgrimmar cheer for $n."]="奥格瑞玛的兽人为$n而欢呼。"
G["The orcs of Stonetalon will suffer your rampage no more, foul beast."]="石爪山的兽人绝不会再容忍你的暴虐，邪恶的怪物。"
G["The orders are given!  Move out, and show them what we're made of!"]="命令已经下达！行动，给他们点颜色瞧瞧！"
G["The orders have been given! Death to Stormpike! Charge the enemy!"]="命令已经下达啦！杀死雷矛！向敌人冲锋！"
G["The ore cart squeaks against the rails as it is released."]="被放开的矿车在铁轨上移动起来，发出“吱吱”声。"
G["The ore used in this sample originated deep within the crust of Azeroth and was recently unearthed."]="该样品中的矿石成分来自艾泽拉斯的地壳深处，这种矿石是最近才被挖掘出来的。"
G["The orphans we have taken in come from war torn Sholazar Basin. You can choose to care for either an orphaned Oracle hatchling or a Frenzyheart pup. Either will be happy to make a new friend, but you will only be able to care for one of them."]="Los huérfanos que hemos acogido vienen de la Cuenca de Sholazar destrozada por la guerra. Puedes elegir hacerte cargo de una prole de Oráculo huérfana o de un cachorro Corazón Frenético. Ambos estarán felices de hacer $gun nuevo amigo:una nueva amiga;, pero solo podrás cuidar de uno de ellos."
G["The other Stone Lords have already heard my words."]="我已经给其他石领主送去了消息。"
G["The other captives are up in the volcano... they're being sacrificed, or worse, zombiefied!"]="其他俘虏还在火山口里……他们或者是被献祭了，或者下场更悲惨——变成了僵尸！"
G["The other day I saw one walking down the street shouting, \"Once you go gnome, you never go home!\""]="有一天我看到有人沿着大街边走边叫，“一旦你变成侏儒，你就只能租房子住了！”"
G["The other dwarven leaders were ashamed of their behavior, and vowed never again to allow fear or distrust to cloud their judgment."]="其他矮人首领为自己的行为感到羞愧，发誓再也不让恐惧或猜忌影响自己的判断。"
G["The other rangers are waiting for us just ahead. Our first priority is - Look out!"]="其他游侠就在前面等我们。我们的首要目标是——小心！"
G["The other rangers simply turned on one another.\n\nWe would have turned as well, but thanks to Yalia's quick thinking, we are safe."]="其他游侠都开始自相残杀了。\n\n我们也差点跟着发疯。多亏雅丽亚反应够快，我们现在安全了。"
G["The other tamers were right about you."]="其他驯宠师对你的评价真是精确。"
G["The other trainees have their skills and talents. I am honored to ride with them."]="其他的新手都有着各自的技巧和天赋，能和他们一起翱翔我感到很荣幸。"
G["The other victims... they made such awful sounds. Thank you for coming to my rescue!"]="其他受害者……他们的声音惨不忍闻。多谢你救了我！"
G["The others look at this landscape and see only death, corruption, and adversity. None of those things are in short supply, true, but that view ignores the opportunities presented by our environment.\n\nI will not stand by and watch these opportunities go ignored, $c. With your help, we can demonstrate to the others here at Blood Watch just how to make use of the environment and its creatures."]="在其他人看来，这个地方只有死亡、堕落和灾难。说实话，这里确实充满了这些东西。但是那些观点忽视了这个全新的环境赐予我们的机会。\n\n我不会呆呆地站在这里，忽视那些宝贵的机会，$c。在你的帮助下，我们可以向秘血岗哨的其他人展示如何利用环境，以及生活在这种环境中的生物。"
G["The outhouse appears to be occupied at the moment."]="厕所好像被占用了。"
G["The outlook is positive, but I'm still negative."]="前景不错，但我比较悲观。"
G["The outlook is very bad - for YOU that is!  Haha, take it!"]="前景不妙！哈哈哈哈！接受现实吧！"
G["The overwhelming power!"]="所向披靡！"
G["The pages of the journal seem to be filled with information about trades, buyers  and other miscellaneous business related events."]="日记中似乎记载了关于贸易、买主和其它商业事务的信息。"
G["The pages of this book have been destroyed."]="这本书的内页已经被毁了。"
G["The pain in your chest will soon be gone... never to return!"]="折磨你的痛苦很快就会消失了……你再也不会因此困扰了！"
G["The pain is finally over."]="痛苦终于结束了。"
G["The pain is momentary. It pales in comparison to what the High General would do to me..."]="这样的痛苦只是暂时的。如果我泄漏了机密，阿比迪斯将军肯定会令我生不如死……"
G["The pain is only beginning..."]="痛苦才刚刚开始……"
G["The pain is unbearable!"]="难以忍受的痛苦！"
G["The pain is unbearable, and I can no longer swim straight."]="疼痛难当，我已经快游不动了。"
G["The pain is unbearable."]="这痛苦简直无法忍受。"
G["The pain!  Oh, sweet sassy molassey, the pain!"]="好疼！喔，我的天，好疼！"
G["The pain...the need...I hunger for more..."]="太痛苦了……我……我渴望更多……"
G["The palace! This is... not our way.  I see why the Klaxxi have been forced to act."]="皇宫！简直……面目全非。我明白为什么卡拉克西要被迫采取行动了。"
G["The paladin still lives? Is it possible, Highlord? Could he have survived?"]="那名圣骑士还活着？是真的吗，大领主？他居然还活着？"
G["The pale skins!"]="是那些白皮鬼！"
G["The pandaren are a noble race, and one that I am willing to fight alongside."]="熊猫人是一个高贵的种族，我愿意与之并肩作战。"
G["The pandaren are full of ancient knowledge. Lina has been teaching me the medicinal uses of the local herbs."]="熊猫人掌握着许多古老的知识。林娜教会了我怎么使用当地的草药治病。"
G["The pandaren are not hear to save you now."]="现在没有熊猫人来救你们了。"
G["The pandaren elders were wise to allow the jinyu into their monastery.\n\nThey were unwise to allow the hozen the same privileges."]="熊猫人长老允许锦鱼人进入禅院是个贤明的决定。\n\n但他们给予猢狲同样的待遇，此为不智。"
G["The pandaren embrace life. With so much fighting all around us, it is refreshing to know what we're fighting for."]="熊猫人热爱生活。在这个战火纷飞的年代，了解我们为何而战更能振奋人心。"
G["The pandaren fished in the trench's waters, but the crocolisks survived."]="熊猫人在海沟里钓鱼，但鳄鱼还是生存了下来。"
G["The pandaren have many legends about trolls like you, Griftah. Many legends indeed."]="熊猫人有很多关于你这种巨魔的传说，格里伏塔。真的有很多。"
G["The pandaren may be strangers now, but in time, I believe they will prove to be valuable allies."]="熊猫人现在或许还是陌生人，可总有一天，他们会成为最可宝贵的盟友。"
G["The pandaren were prepared. This attack was folly."]="熊猫人早就有所准备。这攻击真是愚蠢。"
G["The pandaren will sing your praises for ages to come."]="熊猫人将世代传颂你的事迹。"
G["The pandaren, in fear and defense, killed all the crocolisks of Narsong Trench."]="熊猫人既因为恐惧，又为求自保，杀光了纳松海沟里的鳄鱼。"
G["The pandriarchs blessed my future son-in-law thanks to you. I guess this means the Wanderbrew and Goldendraft feud will have to go on hold.\n\nDon't tell anyone this, but I'm sort of grateful to you for that. So many years of hate is just exhausting.\n\nWe were too set in our ways though, and it took something, or someone, new to help us see passed our differences."]="多亏了你，族长祝福了我未来的女婿。我想这意味着游酒家族和金酿家族的世仇终于可以终结了。\n\n不要告诉别人，其实我还是很感激你的。长年死抱着仇恨不放是很累人的。\n\n我们过去太固执己见了，需要某些新的事物，或新的人，来帮我们理清分歧、搁置争议。"
G["The panther is hunting us, it can't be a good idea to stay in one spot.  We've got to leave!"]="猎豹正在追捕我们，停留在一个地方可不是个好主意。我们必须得离开了！"
G["The paperwork's ready for you to sign, Marin. My people are just waiting on your decision."]="文书已经准备好，就等你签字了，马林。我的人正等着你做个决定。"
G["The paragon does not speak truth, Wakener. His mind did not survive encasement."]="英杰满嘴胡话，唤醒者。封存让他精神失常了。"
G["The party you sent to Zul'Aman is being slaughtered! You must do something!"]="你派去祖阿曼的探险队惨遭屠杀！你倒是做点什么啊！"
G["The past lives in these wastes, $c.  We must be careful to not awaken it."]="死者在这片荒地长眠，$c。我们必须小心，别惊动他们。"
G["The path ahead may bend, but it does not vanish. Walk it with faith, and trust that Elune already walks beside you."]="El camino por delante puede torcerse, pero no se desvanece. Recórrelo con fe y confía en que Elune ya camina a tu lado."
G["The path before us has been revealed. Let us return."]="我们已经看清了前方的道路。回去吧。"
G["The path of freedom has always been beset with tragedy, sire. We could not risk losing you. The Crusade could not have survived such a blow."]="自由之路总是铺垫着悲剧，大人。但我们不能让您做出牺牲。北伐军无法承受如此沉重的打击。"
G["The path of the Red Crane is a path of failure. I have seen the truth!\n\nAll paths lead to despair! You have no hope! NONE OF YOU!!"]="朱鹤之道注定是一条通往失败的道路，我见过真相！\n\n所有的道路都通向绝望！你没有任何希望！你们都没有！！"
G["The path of the cloud serpent rider is long and arduous, but you will travel it together with your cloud serpent companion.\n\nIf you reach the end of the road together, you will have a loyal friend who will carry you to the end of your days."]="翔龙骑士的道路漫长而艰险，但你将和你的翔龙伙伴一路同行。\n\n如果你们能互相扶持走到终点，你就将收获一个终生不渝的忠实朋友。"
G["The path of those who undertake a profession is long and rewarding.  Which path do you choose to walk?"]="从事某种专业的学习是一个长期的过程，但是回报很丰厚。你想选择什么样的专业？"
G["The pathway to damnation awaits..."]="看来你们等不及要下地狱了……"
G["The peace of Ogri'la shall be restored!"]="奥格瑞拉必将恢复和平！"
G["The peasant contemplates what life means without work."]="农夫思考着如果没有工作，那生命还有什么意义。"
G["The peasant wishes there was more work to do."]="农夫希望能有更多的工作。"
G["The penalty for treason is death!"]="背叛的下场就是死亡！"
G["The peninsula is not a place to be trifled with $r.  Those foul Alliance can be found all over the island."]="这座半岛可不是个渡假的地方，$r。这里到处都能找到肮脏的联盟。"
G["The pennants mark the race course, but you will not be penalized for finding other routes."]="我们用三角旗围出了赛道，但如果你选择其它飞行路线，也不会受到惩罚。"
G["The people cried \"Fanny,\" her name."]="La gente gritaba \"Fanny\", llena de euforia."
G["The people in Nighthaven sure know how to party!"]="永夜港的人们真有点子！"
G["The people of Darkshire expect more from the Council.  We cannot let them suffer from this unholy wrath which plagues us."]="夜色镇的人民对议会充满了期望。我们不能让他们受到邪恶的伤害。"
G["The people of Gilneas understand the gravity of change all too well."]="吉尔尼斯人对变革有着再清楚不过的理解。"
G["The people of Kaskala are in your debt, $c."]="卡斯卡拉欠你一份情，$c。"
G["The people of Pandaria came here millennia ago to watch aspiring emperors face the challenges of the August Celestials.\nSo! Are you here to watch would-be heroes brave the Celestials' tests?\nOr to brave them yourself?"]="Los habitantes de Pandaria venían a este lugar hace milenios para ver a los jóvenes emperadores enfrentarse a los desafíos de los Augustos Celestiales.\n\n¿Y bien? ¿Has venido para ver a los héroes superar las pruebas de los celestiales?\n\n¿O para participar?"
G["The people were destroyed in order to preserve the Prince's immortal life and near limitless powers. The power once divided among thousands now funnels into the Prince and the Shen'dralar zealots. Those few remaining survivors are directly feeding power into the pylons in order to keep Immol'thar imprisoned.\n\nShould the demon break free of its bonds, it would surely destroy what little is left of this once great bastion of arcana."]="王子为了获得永恒的生命和无尽的力量，杀死了许多人。数千人的力量全部汇集到王子和辛德拉狂热者身上。那些少数的幸存者不停地向水晶塔输送能量来禁锢恶魔伊莫塔尔。\n\n如果恶魔挣脱束缚，它一定会毁掉这座曾经繁荣辉煌的魔法都市。"
G["The people who called this land their home in life, do so in death as well."]="这些人民将这片土地称为家园，生亦如此，死亦如此。"
G["The perfect mix of northern and southern styles!"]="南北美酒，完美融合！"
G["The perimeter is secure, commander."]="边界安全了，指挥官。"
G["The person you described was just here and he tried to persuade me to list a crateful of arcane objects."]="你所说的这个人不久前才来过，想让我帮他拍卖一箱奥术物品。"
G["The phylactery is not yours to take, $n!  You will pay for your transgression."]="$n，你别想拿走护符匣！你会为你犯下的罪行付出代价的。"
G["The pile of skulls reeks of foulness.  You fear the arakkoa have made an addition to the pile fairly recently."]="这里散发着污秽的恶臭，看来鸦人最近又堆积了新的战利品。"
G["The pile of skulls reeks of foulness.  You fear the arakkoa have made an addition to the pile fairly recently.\nYou will need 10 Time-Lost Scrolls to call forth the descendants of Terokk's adversaries."]="La pila de cráneos apesta a insensatez. Temes que los arakkoa hayan añadido algún cráneo a la pila recientemente.\n\nNecesitarás 10 pergaminos perdidos en el Tiempo para invocar a los descendientes de los adversarios de Terokk."
G["The pink cranes are beautiful!\n\nI mean... if you wanted to know..."]="那些粉色的仙鹤真漂亮！\n\n我是说……如果你想知道的话……"
G["The pink hearts are pretty!"]="这个粉红色的爱心真漂亮！"
G["The pirates have keys!"]="那些海盗有钥匙！"
G["The pit calls, minion. Go to it. NOW!"]="我命令你们，立刻进坑！就是现在！"
G["The pit lord's loose!  We're doomed!  Retreat!"]="深渊领主不受控制了！我们完蛋了！快撤！"
G["The pitfighter will be victorious! Just look at him!"]="斗士将无往而不利！你看他！"
G["The pitiful human escaped!"]="那个可怜的人类逃走了！"
G["The place is a bit drafty... but what do I care? I'm dead."]="这地方通风良好……但是我还在乎什么？我已经死了。"
G["The plague cauldron begins to boil vigorously!"]="天灾之锅剧烈地沸腾起来！"
G["The plague samples they've sent us would not even hurt a rat!"]="他们送来的药剂样本连只老鼠都杀不死！"
G["The plague was not quite... fatal.  However, reports of harmful effects include nausea, loss of equilibrium and severe stomach pain."]="这种药剂效力不是非常……强。但是，目前已知的有害效果包括晕眩、平衡感丧失和剧烈的胃痛。"
G["The plague... is it over?"]="那场瘟疫……结束了？"
G["The plaguebringer sighs at the interruption."]="药剂师的研究被中断，他叹了口气。"
G["The plan is to keep moving south.  We can't go back to the Merchant Square.  It's not safe."]="计划是继续向南移动。我们不能回到商人区去了。那里不安全。"
G["The planets are aligned!  The second moon is in the house of ... now what was that house called again?"]="行星排成了一列！第二个月亮就在那个……什么位置来着？"
G["The plans are in there!"]="设计图就在那儿！"
G["The plans for my twenty-foot tall turkey baster are nearly complete! Now all I need is a twenty-foot tall turkey..."]="我的二十英尺高的火鸡烤肉架的计划快要完成了！现在我需要的就是一只二十英尺高的火鸡了……"
G["The plants are hungry..."]="植物饿了……"
G["The plates! He's coming apart! Tear up the plates and we've got a shot at bringing him down!"]="看那些装甲！他正在解体！摧毁那些装甲，我们就能给他最后一击！"
G["The play is a Kilo Tango Charlie Blitz on three. One... two... three! Um... guys?!"]="数三下，闪电傻瓜跳着基洛探戈上场。一……二……三！嗯……人呢？！"
G["The pleasure is mine, madam. Might I ask what it is that you are doing here?"]="我也很高兴遇见你们，女士。我能问问你在这儿干什么吗？"
G["The polarity has shifted!"]="极性转换！"
G["The pool stirs..."]="池水翻波……"
G["The poor hozen and jinyu! We knew they didn't like each other but to go this far..."]="可怜的猢狲和锦鱼人！我们知道他们不喜欢对方，但走到今天这一步……"
G["The portal has been opened! Thanks to your efforts, we can now quickly travel from Stormwind to Twilight Highlands."]="传送门打开了！感谢你的帮助，现在我们能够从暴风城迅速到达暮光高地了。"
G["The portal has stabilized! Attack!"]="传送门已经稳定！发动进攻！"
G["The portal is closing! Hurry!"]="传送门要关闭了！快！"
G["The portal shows old, ancient desert ruins.  The wind picks up, there must be a sandstorm brewing inside.  This portal must lead somewhere important, but where?"]="传送门里是一片古老的史前沙漠废墟。狂风吹过，一场沙尘暴呼之欲出。这传送门肯定是通往某个重要的地方，但究竟是哪里呢？"
G["The portal to Stormwind is good to go!  Get in!"]="传送门准备好了！快进去！"
G["The portal will shift slightly, at this point if you cast a binding cantrip you will solidify it in place."]="传送门将会产生轻微的变化，此时如果你施展一个固化咒语，那么你就可以把它的变化固定下来。"
G["The portals are shut down. I hear the orcs still have a portal to the Blasted Lands open, down in the Cleft o' Shadow."]="传送门都关闭了。我听说兽人在暗影裂口下还保留了一座通往诅咒之地的传送门。"
G["The portals will open and your precious city will be swept away!"]="传送门将开启，你们宝贵的城市将被夷为平地！"
G["The possibilities are infinite."]="一切皆有可能。"
G["The potion is finished. I can only hope Clintar forgives us for interrupting his sojourn in the Emerald Dream."]="药水已经完成了。我只希望克林塔尔能够原谅我们打断了他在翡翠梦境的逗留。"
G["The power flows through me!"]="我充满了力量！"
G["The power of Elune compels you!  The power of Elune compels you!  \nGo now!  Seek out Jandria in the central hall of the Temple of the Moon in the southern section of Darnassus!"]="¡El poder de Elune te obliga! ¡El poder de Elune te obliga! \n\n¡Puedes marcharte! ¡Busca a Jandria en el pasillo central del Templo de la Luna en la zona sur de Darnassus!"
G["The power of Light compels you!  Back to your pit!"]="让圣光的力量来驱散你！回到你的深渊去吧！"
G["The power of our winds, UNLEASHED!"]="强猛的烈风啊，显示力量吧！"
G["The power of the Dark Shaman will overwhelm you!"]="让黑暗萨满的力量压倒你吧！"
G["The power of the Eye is unquestionable, Ryson, but what else can it do?"]="这眼睛的力量是不容置疑的，雷松，但是它还能做什么呢？"
G["The power of the Lich King pales in comparison to the glory of the Light!"]="在辉煌的圣光面前，巫妖王的力量显得苍白无力！"
G["The power of the Light knows no bounds, Saurfang. His soul is under great strain, but he lives - for now."]="圣光的力量没有止境，萨鲁法尔。他的灵魂饱受压抑，但他现在，还活着。"
G["The power of the Soul is tearing him apart!"]="巨龙之魂的力量正在撕裂他！"
G["The power of the Sunwell will be harnessed once more!"]="太阳之井的力量将会再次被我们掌握！"
G["The power of the Tear of the Moons is mine! Mine I say!"]="众月之泪的魔力是我的！我的！我的宝贝！"
G["The power of the elements is strong here. Little wonder this is where they chose to summon a servant of the old gods."]="元素的力量在这里非常强大。怪不得他们会选择在这里召唤上古之神的仆人。"
G["The power of the light is truly great and merciful."]="光明的力量如此强大、如此仁慈。"
G["The power of the storm lives on."]="风暴的力量仍将长存。"
G["The power of the warchief will overwhelm you!"]="让酋长的力量湮没你们吧！"
G["The power to crush one's foes. That is strength."]="毁灭敌人的能力。这就是力量。"
G["The power to crush your world, and everything on it!"]="这力量将碾碎你们的世界，抹杀一切！"
G["The power tools compel you! The power tools compel you!"]="强大的工具压迫你！强大的工具压迫你！"
G["The power washes through me! I see... EVERYTHING!"]="力量在我体内流淌！我能看见……一切！"
G["The power you absorb from spells with your shell can be used to counter with your other attacks."]="你们可以利用护罩吸收的法术能量展开反击。"
G["The power you've bestowed upon me has granted me great mental influence over human minds.  I bear these offerings as proof of my progress."]="您赐予我的力量使我能够更好地控制人类的思维。这些祭品就是证据。"
G["The power! More, more, more!"]="能量！多点，多点，再多点！"
G["The power... It cannot be wielded this way! You tempt forces you do not understand!"]="这力量……不能这么使用！你们在运用无法驾驭的力量！"
G["The power... it will be mine!"]="能量……是我的！"
G["The power...is too much...I cannot hold...any longer..."]="这股力量……太强大了……我坚持……不下去了……"
G["The powers at work here exceed anything you could possibly imagine!"]="在这里涌动的力量早已超越了你们的理解与想象！"
G["The powers of the Hourglass do nothing to me!"]="沙漏的力量对我毫无用处！"
G["The powers of this place are NOT for your kind, warlock!"]="¡El poder de este lugar no está destinado a los tuyos, $gbrujo:bruja;!"
G["The powers of this room are not unlike the original Well of Eternity in Azeroth."]="这股力量和艾泽拉斯永恒之井最初的那股力量并无二致。"
G["The praise is well deserved. Tirion will want to praise you himself, shortly. Hey, have you noticed it getting a bit cold all of a sudden?"]="无论给予你怎样的赞扬都不会过份。提里奥肯定想亲自表彰你的功绩。嗨，你有没有突然觉得有些冷？"
G["The presence of blue dragons."]="蓝龙现身"
G["The presence of titan architecture in this region is quite... interesting."]="这里竟然有泰坦的建筑物，真是……有趣。"
G["The preternatural ability of the crypt fiend to hunt and kill its foe is one studied and vaunted by men in my profession. I, myself, have slain thousands of the beasts in my crusade to rid this world of Scourge.\n\nWhile I loathe the crypt fiend for its merciless nature, its abilities must be admired. It has a job and it does it - very well."]="地穴恶魔在狩猎与杀戮天敌的过程中所表现出来的那些超自然能力，一直是我们这类人所赞赏与模仿的对象。是的，我，一个在远征中手刃过成百上千天灾军团所圈养的野兽的人。\n\n尽管我也对地穴恶魔那残忍无情的天性十分厌恶，但也必须正视它的能力。它总是能够完美地完成自己的工作。"
G["The priest kneels in silent prayer."]="牧师跪下来，默默地祈祷着。"
G["The priestesses will require your aid soon. The Lady requests your return."]="祭司们很快就会需要你的帮助。女士命你返回。"
G["The priesthood, known as the Aldor, quickly regained its strength as word spread that the naaru had returned and reconstruction soon began.  The ruined temple is now used as an infirmary for injured refugees."]="被称为奥尔多的那些传教士们，因为纳鲁回归和重建即将开始的传言而迅速恢复了生命力。废弃的神庙如今变成了治疗伤者的医务室。"
G["The priests are located on the outer ring of the War Quarter."]="牧师们都在军事区的外环区域。"
G["The priests imbue the guardian with their Loas! They must be stopped!"]="那些祭司正在对那些侍卫灌注神灵之力！必须阻止他们！"
G["The priests of our fair city can be found within the Sunfury Spire.  Seek out the lady Belestra."]="我们这座美丽城市中的牧师在日怒之塔内。去那里找贝蕾丝特拉女士吧。"
G["The prince has run off. This is bad!"]="那王子跑了。糟透了！"
G["The principle is absolute, follow it and you will be accepted."]="原则是绝对的，照做，你便会得到接纳。"
G["The prison? Why would you want to go there? It's in the center of the city, just northeast of the Mage Quarter.\n\nIf you're truly going there, be careful. I've heard news of riots."]="监狱？你干吗要去那儿？就在城中央，法师区的东北部。\n\n你要是真去可一定要小心。听说最近发生了不少暴动事件。"
G["The prisoner sobs desperately, waiting for the end to come."]="囚犯们绝望地啜泣着，等待末日的来临。"
G["The prisoners are escaping!"]="囚犯逃跑啦！"
G["The prisoners shall not go free! The word of Malygos is law!"]="绝不能释放这些囚犯！玛里苟斯的话就是律法！"
G["The process is arduous. We must first summon forth acolytes of the elements. You must then destroy these acolytes so that my minions can make preparations."]="整个过程将会非常艰巨。我们必须首先召唤出元素侍僧。而你则必须打败这些侍僧，这样一来我的随从就能开始做准备了。"
G["The process is finally complete! My work here is done."]="任务完成！我在这里的工作结束了。"
G["The processing will continue as scheduled!"]="一切都在按计划进行！"
G["The profession of Enchanting displays the cycle of destruction and creation that is at the heart of nature.  Teg at the Dawnstrider Enchanters on the middle rise will show you how."]="附魔体现了毁灭和新生的循环，这正是自然界的基本准则。晨行者附魔师将为你展示这一切。"
G["The project will... continue."]="计划……要继续下去。"
G["The prophet begins to cast a ritual of annihilation."]="先知开始施放歼灭仪式。"
G["The prophet inclines his head slightly as if he has noticed something amiss."]="先知扭了扭脖子，似乎察觉到出了什么差错。"
G["The prophet meditates on how best to handle stealing the power from his goddess."]="先知陷入了沉思，盘算着如何才能巧妙地偷取女神的力量。"
G["The protective tendrils of arcane energy have been lifted. The sun gate is vulnerable!"]="保护太阳之门的能量护罩已经被解除了。太阳之门正处于不堪一击的状态！"
G["The proto-drake smells freedom and flies homeward!"]="重获自由的始祖龙振翅飞走了！"
G["The pumpkin has been smashed, and offers no more treasure."]="南瓜被打碎了，不过没有更多的财宝了。"
G["The pumpkin head smolders forebodingly..."]="南瓜头冒出了邪恶的烟雾……"
G["The pumps are working magnificently."]="抽水泵的工作状态良好。"
G["The punishment for you all is DEATH!"]="你们所有人应受的惩罚，就是死！"
G["The puny zandalari are gonna be crushed!"]="渺小的赞达拉巨魔将被碾得粉碎！"
G["The pure of heart will be allowed to remain in New Avalon. Those that the inquisitors find bereft of the holy Light will be turned away."]="所有人都必须接受审讯官的调查。内心纯洁的平民可以留在新阿瓦隆，被圣光摒弃的人则必须离开。"
G["The pylon seems to be transmitting data somewhere.\n\nA closer inspection of the pylon leads you to find a small table containing red, blue, and green crystals arranged in what seems like a specific formation.\n\nA large red circle of crystals is flanked on either side by a smaller circle of blue crystals and another of green crystals.\n\nYou carefully take note of what you see, knowing that someone may be very interested in hearing about what you have found."]="这座水晶塔似乎正在向另外某个地方传输数据。\n\n仔细地检查了这座塔之后，你发现了一个由红色、蓝色和绿色水晶组成的图样，它们以一种特殊的形态排列着。\n\n一大圈红色水晶两侧分别有一小圈蓝色水晶和另一圈绿色水晶。\n\n你仔细观察水晶的颜色，一定会有人对你的发现很感兴趣。"
G["The pylon seems to be transmitting data somewhere.\n\nA closer inspection of the pylon leads you to find a small table containing yellow, red, and green crystals arranged in what seems like a specific formation.\n\nA large blue circle of crystals is flanked on either side by a smaller circle of yellow crystals and another of green crystals.\n\nYou carefully take note of what you see, knowing that someone may be very interested in hearing about what you have found."]="这座水晶塔似乎正在向另外某个地方传输数据。\n\n仔细地检查了这座塔之后，你发现了一个由蓝色、黄色和绿色水晶组成的图样，它们以一种特殊的形态排列着。\n\n一大圈蓝色水晶两侧分别有一小圈黄色水晶和另一圈绿色水晶。\n\n你仔细观察水晶的颜色，一定会有人对你的发现很感兴趣。"
G["The pylon seems to be transmitting data somewhere.\n\nA closer inspection of the pylon leads you to find a small table containing yellow, red, and green crystals arranged in what seems like a specific formation.\n\nA large yellow circle of crystals is flanked on either side by a smaller circle of red crystals and another of green crystals.\n\nYou carefully take note of what you see, knowing that someone may be very interested in hearing about what you have found."]="这座水晶塔似乎正在向另外某个地方传输数据。\n\n仔细地检查了这座塔之后，你发现了一个由黄色、红色和绿色水晶组成的图样，它们以一种特殊的形态排列着。\n\n一大圈黄色水晶两侧分别有一小圈红色水晶和另一圈绿色水晶。\n\n你仔细观察水晶的颜色，一定会有人对你的发现很感兴趣。"
G["The quality of this workmanship is pathetic. Not even fit for a Ghoul to wield."]="锻造手艺也太差劲了吧。连食尸鬼都不屑使用这件武器。"
G["The quantity and quality of rewards inside the tribute chest is based upon how many unsuccessful attempts you had during the Trial of the Grand Crusader. The fewer unsuccessful attempts, the better the rewards."]="这只嘉奖箱中的奖励品数量和质量取决于你在大十字军的试炼中进行过多少次不成功的尝试。不成功的尝试越少，得到的奖励就越丰厚。"
G["The quarry will be fine thanks to you.\n\nThink I'll let some o' the boys take a little vacation...\n\nHAH! Who am I kiddin'? I almost said that with a straight face, too.\n\nWe got WORK to do!"]="多亏了你，采石场总算没事了。\n\n看来我得让小伙子们放个假……\n\n哈哈！我哄谁呢？瞧我自己也一本正经的样子。\n\n我们还有活儿要做呢！"
G["The queen and her council have been speaking lately of a disaster at Ulduar. Something has happened in Storm Peaks!"]="最近，女王陛下召集议会谈论了奥杜尔遭遇的一场灾难。风暴峭壁似乎出了什么大事！"
G["The question is, what are WE doin' here? Yeh bring 'dis war to anudder corner of Azeroth, and I wanna know why."]="问题是，我们来干什么？你将战火烧到了别处，我要知道是什么原因。"
G["The quickest path to Mal'Ganis lies behind that bookshelf ahead."]="通向玛尔加尼斯的最短路线就在前面那个书架之后。"
G["The quilboar have always scavenged the fringes of our camps for food and supplies, but direct assaults on our farms and homesteads? Something has sent them on a rampage recently."]="那些野猪人总是在我们的营地边缘劫掠食物和供给物资。难道他们现在竟然直接对我们的农场和家园发动攻击了？他们这种疯狂的行为一定是有原因的。"
G["The quilboar will pay!"]="我要让野猪人付出代价！"
G["The race is about to begin!"]="比赛就要开始了！"
G["The race to defeat the Firelands has begun!"]="征服火焰之地的比赛开始了！"
G["The race will start in 1 minute!"]="比赛将在一分钟内开始！"
G["The races are coming, $g lad : lass;! We're working hard on getting the track setup and I've been busy signing some worthy competitors.\n\nTell your friends!"]="比赛就要开始了，$g小伙子:姑娘;！我们正在努力完成赛道的建造。而且我一直在忙着签下有能力的参赛者。\n\n多和你的朋友么说说我的需要吧！"
G["The races of the world will perish. It is only a matter of time."]="世间的一切种族终将灭绝，这是迟早的事情。"
G["The rage burning within you will soon find fuel in our enemies."]="你满腔的愤怒很快就可以倾泻在我们的敌人身上。"
G["The rage of Ishamuhale runs through you, $n."]="伊沙姆哈尔的愤怒流经你的身体，$n。"
G["The rally is about to begin!"]="快要开始集结了！"
G["The ramp up to Aldrassil is just in sight over there. Circle around and find Tenaron up top."]="通往奥达希尔的梯道就在那边。盘旋而上就能找到特纳隆。"
G["The ranged Shield-Breaker attack is simple to learn, but difficult to master. Alone it may seem weak, but in conjunction with Thrusts and Charges the Shield-Breaker makes a successful jouster.\n\nFind a Ranged Target. Take a moment to understand the Shield-Breaker's range... how much space you need, and how far you can hurl the lance.\n\nAfter that? Well. Start throwing, and do not stop until you've broken every last layer of Defend and pierced the vulnerable target.\n\nThis tactic will serve you well in actual mounted combat: Break down your opponents' defenses... and then crush them!"]="远程碎盾攻击上手容易精通难。碎盾攻击所能造成的伤害不高，但是配合刺击和冲锋使用就能发挥出完美的效果，令你在骑乘作战中所向披靡。\n\n选定一个远程目标，估算一下碎盾攻击的射程……你需要多远的距离以及你能将长枪掷多远。\n\n接下来，就开始投掷长枪吧，直到你破坏目标身上的所有防御效果。\n\n骑乘实战中遵循着同样的原则：彻底粉碎对手的防御……然后狠狠地揍他们！"
G["The rangers certainly have a high opinion of themselves."]="这些游侠都是些眼高过天的家伙。"
G["The rangers take their lessons from Hannovia, a farstrider who stays in the northeast building of Falconwing Square."]="猎人们都在听汉诺维亚的课，他是一个站在鹰翼广场东北方建筑里的远行者。"
G["The rank of valiant is not easily won.  Prepare yourself!"]="El rango de $gValeroso:Valerosa; no se obtiene fácilmente. ¡Prepárate!"
G["The ravasaur here in Un'Goro seem to be related to the raptors of the barrens - highly intelligent, volatile, and with a sense or code of conduct. The greatest of these that I have encountered is  Lar'korwi. He is one of the most dangerous beasts I've ever seen. In taurahe, Lar'korwi means \"sharp claw,\" but that does not do him justice.\n\nDo not underestimate Lar'korwi if you ever plan on hunting him, but I will help you in any way I can if you do."]="Al parecer, el ravasaurio de Un'Goro está relacionado con los raptores de los baldíos: es muy inteligente, imprevisible, y sigue un código de conducta determinado. El más ravasaurio más grande que he encontrado es Lar'korwi. Es una de las bestias más peligrosas que he visto jamás. En taurahe, Lar'korwi significa \"garra afilada,\" pero este detalle no le hace justicia.\n\nNo subestimes a Lar'korwi si piensas cazarlo, pero te ayudaré en lo que pueda si lo haces."
G["The raven was struck down once for flying too high, unready. The eons have prepared the Dark Watcher for its ascent, to draw the dark cloak across the horizon."]="乌鸦曾因贸然飞得太高而被击落。黑暗守望者为了他的飞翔准备了亿万年，就是为了在地平线上拉起黑暗的斗篷。"
G["The raven will return to us as foretold in the prophecy and you are powerless to stop it!"]="乌鸦之神会像预言所说的那样重返这个世界，而你根本没有能力阻止他！"
G["The razing of Orgrimmar was not just an attack against orcs, it was an affront to the Horde. An assault against our very existence!\n\nThe Lich King sought to sow the seeds of fear.\n\nThis...\n\n<Garrosh points to the fortified walls that surround him.>\n\nThis is the result of Arthas's campaign.\n\nThe Horde fears nothing..."]="Al arrasar Orgrimmar no solo atacaron a los orcos, sino a toda la Horda. ¡Fue un ataque contra nuestra existencia!\n\nEl Rey Exánime pretendía sembrar el miedo.\n\nEsto...\n\n<Garrosh señala hacia las paredes fortificadas que le rodean.>\n\nEsto es el resultado de la campaña de Arthas.\n\nLa Horda no teme a nada..."
G["The realm of fire will consume you!"]="火焰王国会吞噬你！"
G["The realm of shadows awaits..."]="黑暗在等待……"
G["The realm you see all around you was mine to command."]="你目光所及之处皆为我的领土。"
G["The rebels of Lordaeron are small and weak, and know not the joy of serving our Lich King."]="洛丹伦的叛军相当弱小，而且他们居然不愿意效忠于巫妖王。"
G["The rebirth of the Empire of Azjol-Nerub is upon us! Hear my call, brothers, and rise to reclaim what is rightfully ours!"]="艾卓-尼鲁布帝国复兴的希望就靠我们了！听从我的召唤吧，兄弟们，站起来夺回属于我们的东西！"
G["The recent decrease in our magical powers is being reviewed as we speak. Even Lord Xavius has said that the ebb and flow of magic is normal."]="最近，我们的魔法能量逐渐减弱。当我们说话的时候，这一现象正在被评估。不过萨维斯大人已经说过，这种魔法能量的波动起伏是正常的。"
G["The reckoning is upon you, weakling!"]="软弱的家伙，现在是算账的时候了！"
G["The red dragonflight will take on the burden of mending the devastation wrought on Azeroth. Return home to your people and rest. Tomorrow will bring you new challenges, and you must be ready to face them. Life... goes on."]="红龙军团将会担负起修复世界创伤的责任与义务。回去吧，和你的同伴们一起回去，好好休息。明天，你们还要应对新的挑战，你们必须时刻为此做好准备。生命……仍要继续。"
G["The red thing's connected to the... squiggly thing... the squiggly thing's connected to my... wristband..."]="那红色的东西连在……那弯弯曲曲的东西上……那弯弯曲曲的东西连在我的……腕带上……"
G["The reeds of the Singing Pools are the hardest in all of the land, but they are as air before my mighty brow."]="咏之池的芦苇是这里最硬的东西，但要是碰到我坚实的额头，也不过是浮云。"
G["The reef cow and her new bull find true love."]="暗礁母海狮和公海狮找到了真爱。"
G["The reflexes built in the survival ring are what keep these trainees alive beyond the wall.  There, the threats are much less forgiving."]="修建在生存之环中的反射可以使受训者在城墙外得以生存。在那里，威胁更不容易被放任。"
G["The regent lord is a very busy man. I'm sure you understand."]="摄政王是个非常忙碌的人。我相信你能懂得这一点。"
G["The regent speaks truly, $n. Thalorien's sacrifice could not prevent the fall of this very Sunwell."]="摄政者说的对，$n。萨洛瑞安的牺牲无法阻止太阳之井的覆灭。"
G["The relic chamber is under attack!"]="宝库遭到了攻击！"
G["The relics are truly a great mystery.  Perhaps by studying them regularly, you will gain a finer appreciation of their capabilities."]="这些圣物伟大而神秘。如果能系统地研究它们，或许就能揭示它们蕴藏的真正力量。"
G["The remaining Kodo, angry at The Wolf's impetuousness,\nswiftly killed The Wolf before he had a chance to eat."]="El kodo restante, enfadado por el ímpetu del lobo, lo mató rápidamente antes de que tuviera tiempo de comer."
G["The remains are covered in flies and maggots."]="残骸上满是苍蝇和蛆虫。"
G["The rendezvous is just up ahead. We've gathered an elite strike force - What?"]="集合点就在前面。我们已经召集了一支精锐部队——什么？"
G["The reports were accurate! The beast is here..."]="报告是正确的！那头怪兽就在这里……"
G["The reservoir fills nicely."]="水徐徐地流入水库。"
G["The rest are fine without us."]="没有我们，别人也过得很好。"
G["The rest of Nesingwary's Safari is up in the western side of the Valley of Four Winds. If you find yourself heading west, you should join us. Good hunting!"]="奈辛瓦里狩猎队营地的其他人正在四风谷的西边。倘若你正向西行，你就该加入我们。狩猎愉快！"
G["The rest of the drakes should be here shortly. I'll fly on ahead; catch up when you can."]="其他的幼龙马上就到。我会飞在最前面，你们准备好了就跟上。"
G["The rest of the fleet has already been sent to the region."]="其他的舰队都已经被派往战区了。"
G["The rest of you, follow me downstairs!"]="剩下的人，跟我下去！"
G["The rest of you, secure the courtyard."]="剩下的，保护庭院。"
G["The resultant energies could collapse though, and that could cause an energy flux that would give you a migraine for weeks."]="那样能量流会崩溃，其魔法扰动的结果是让你在至少一周内都觉得浑身不舒服。"
G["The resurrection ritual has failed!"]="复活仪式已失败！"
G["The return of the Emperor will doom your entire race!"]="归来的国王将消灭你整个种族！"
G["The revitalized kodo rises to its feet, shaking off the dust."]="恢复活力的科多兽站起来，摇晃掉身上的泥土。"
G["The rift can be reached through this hall. Follow me."]="裂隙就在这座大厅后。跟着我。"
G["The rift must be protected!"]="必须保护裂缝！"
G["The rift will be opened there, above Lake Elun'ara. Prepare yourself, $n. Eranikus's entry into our world will be wrought with chaos and strife."]="月神湖上空将出现一道裂缝。做好准备吧，$n。伊兰尼库斯的入侵会给整个世界带来混乱和战争。"
G["The rift's power is ours!"]="裂隙的能量是我们的！"
G["The rifts are down and Ironforge is safe!  These portals must be the second half of their attack.\n\nQuickly! Into the portal! We must press the attack while we have the advantage!"]="裂隙已经被关闭，铁炉堡安全了！这些传送门一定与他们的下一步行动有关。\n\n赶快！进入传送门！我们必须乘胜追击！"
G["The rifts are down and Orgrimmar is safe!  These portals must be the second half of their attack.\n\nQuickly! Into the portal! We must press the attack while we have the advantage!"]="裂隙已经被关闭，奥格瑞玛安全了！这些传送门一定与他们的下一步行动有关。\n\n赶快！进入传送门！我们必须乘胜追击！"
G["The rifts are down and Stormwind is safe!  These portals must be the second half of their attack.\n\nQuickly! Into the portal! We must press the attack while we have the advantage!"]="裂隙已经被关闭，暴风城安全了！这些传送门一定与他们的下一步行动有关。\n\n赶快！进入传送门！我们必须乘胜追击！"
G["The rifts are down and Thunder Bluff is safe!  These portals must be the second half of their attack.\n\nQuickly! Into the portal! We must press the attack while we have the advantage!"]="裂隙已经被关闭，雷霆崖安全了！这些传送门一定与他们的下一步行动有关。\n\n赶快！进入传送门！我们必须乘胜追击！"
G["The ring will overflow with the blood of the interlopers! Oluf has come!"]="擅自闯入竞技场的家伙将付出血的代价！沃鲁夫来了！"
G["The rising threats of the mogu's return and the mantid swarms in the west have brought far more trainees to bare than usual. This is good. They will be needed."]="魔古族的归来以及西边的螳螂妖纷涌而至，他们带来的威胁不断加剧，这些都引来了比以往更多的受训者。这很好。他们会派上用场的。"
G["The ritual in Coilfang will bring Ahune through once he is fully prepared, and the resulting clash between Firelord and Frostlord will rend the foundations of this world. Our ultimate goals are in reach at last...."]="盘牙水库的仪式将在埃霍恩完全准备好的时候唤醒它，炎魔之王和冰霜之王的冲突将会对这个世界的根基造成伤害。我们的最终目的终于就要实现了……"
G["The ritual is already underway!"]="仪式正在进行中。"
G["The ritual of soothing has begun.  Defend the totem at all costs!"]="安抚仪式已经开始。要不惜一切代价守卫住图腾！"
G["The ritual of soothing has completed."]="安抚仪式完成了。"
G["The ritual proceeds too slowly. More sacrifices are needed!"]="仪式进行得太慢啦。需要更多的祭品！"
G["The ritual will take much from us, as it requires a very piece of our being. We will be weakened greatly."]="仪式需要我们身上的一块碎片，并将带走我们大部分力量。我们将被大大地削弱。"
G["The river does not stop from a single stone."]="一块孤岩阻挡不了汹涌澎湃的河流。"
G["The rivers foretold of this defeat."]="河流早就预言了这场失败。"
G["The rivers foretold of this triumph."]="河流早就预言了这场胜利。"
G["The roads here are rough, Gidwin.  I don't want to risk losing a horse."]="这里的路很难走，吉德文。我可不想冒失去一匹马的危险。"
G["The roads of Kun-Lai are cold, dangerous, and unforgiving. But there is little satisfaction - or profit! - for deals easily concluded."]="通往昆莱山的道路寒冷险峻，危机四伏。可不入虎穴，焉得虎子——轻易达成的交易哪有什么油水可捞！"
G["The rockling clatters its crystals together in thanks."]="石巨人敲击着他的水晶，表达谢意。"
G["The rockling looks confused for a moment before running off."]="石巨人显示出困惑的神情，过了一会儿，他跑开了。"
G["The rockling looks up at you questioningly."]="石巨人带着怀疑的神情看着你。"
G["The rockling offers a great gravelly sigh of appreciation."]="石巨人发出一阵满足而沉重的叹息声。"
G["The rockling rumbles in appreciation."]="石巨人发出“隆隆”的声音，仿佛是在表示感谢。"
G["The rockling scampers into the distance, excited by its newfound freedom."]="石巨人兴奋地奔跑着，为自己重获自由而激动不已。"
G["The rockling thuds happily upon the ground."]="石巨人高兴地击打着地面。"
G["The rocks are here when we first enter this world, and they will remain long after we pass."]="这些石头在我们第一次进入这个世界的时候就存在了，并且在我们离开的时候，它们也不会离开。"
G["The rocks tremble..."]="岩石在战抖……"
G["The rod's design is simple. Dartol didn't use his arcane knowledge in its creation... it is more druidic in nature."]="这根杖的设计很简单。达图尔在制造它的时候没有使用他的奥术知识……蕴含在其中的主要是德鲁伊的魔法。"
G["The rogues are in the Rogues' Quarter. Simple as that. Look for them on the outer ring."]="盗贼们都呆在盗贼区。就这么简单。你可以在外环区域找到他们。"
G["The romantic plays are really tough, but you'll do better this time. You have TALENT. Ready?"]="Las obras románticas son realmente difíciles, pero lo harás mejor esta vez. Tienes TALENTO. ¿$gPreparado:Preparada;?"
G["The roof over the mess hall collapsed. So many - dead!"]="大厅的屋顶坍塌了。许多人都死了！"
G["The route across the beach is circled.  Let's get there and see if there's anything to find."]="这条穿过海滩的路线被圈了起来。我们赶快前往那个地方，看看能不能有什么发现。"
G["The route across this western beach is circled.  Do you know your way there?"]="这条通往西部海滩的路线被圈了起来。你知道怎么去那个地方吗？"
G["The ruined city of Stratholme lies in the Eastern Plaguelands to the north of the Plaguewood."]="斯坦索姆位于东部瘟疫之地瘟疫林的北部。"
G["The ruins of Dire Maul stand in central Ferelas."]="厄运之棰位于菲拉斯的中部。"
G["The ruins of Korja were where something important happened sometime, I guess. I may have snoozed through that history lesson."]="我猜，科夏废墟就是某个重大事件的发生地。我可能是在那节历史课上打盹了。"
G["The ruins of Zul'Farrak are located in the northwestern corner of the Tanaris Desert."]="祖尔法拉克遗迹位于塔纳利斯沙漠最西北角。"
G["The ruins scattered throughout this area are remnants of the night elven civilization at its former peak. They are a treasure trove of information for those who study the arcane.\n\nAnd it would seem they have attracted the attention of a most unusual group of night elven mages. Yes, you heard me $r - night elves are trying to reclaim their magical heritage! I would find it amusing but for the terrible potential should they discover anything of value here."]="散布在这一地区的废墟是暗夜精灵文明发展到顶峰时期留下的遗迹。对于研究奥术的人来说，它们是蕴含着无数珍贵信息的宝藏。\n\n看样子，一队最不同寻常的暗夜精灵法师已经注意到了它们。是的，听我说，$r——暗夜精灵要取回他们的魔法遗产！如果他们在这里发现了有价值的东西，很可能会导致可怕的后果。除此之外，我倒是觉得他们的举动很有些意思。"
G["The ruins you see here are identical to ones I dug up a few months ago, but they're flooded! Curious, eh?"]="你在这里看见的废墟就是我在几个月以前挖掘的废墟，但它被淹没了！真是奇怪，不是么？"
G["The rules are simple. Pass through all 10 checkpoints and cross the finish line."]="比赛规则很简单。经过全部10个检查点，并穿越终点线。"
G["The rules of the trial are simple. These target dummies are equipped with powder bombs. If a single one of them explodes, your trial is over."]="试炼规则很简单。这些活动假人都装有炸弹。只要其中一个爆炸了，你的试炼就算失败。"
G["The ruling council has ordered you banished. I plan to see those orders out."]="议会已经宣布驱逐你，而我则要执行议会的命令。"
G["The rumors were true!  The prince has gone mad!"]="传言是真的！王子已经疯了！"
G["The runes foretold victory for me today!"]="符文预示了我今日的胜利！"
G["The runes of warding have been destroyed! Hunt down the infidels, my brethren!"]="守护符文被摧毁了！兄弟们，杀掉这些入侵者！"
G["The sacking of the Scarlet Enclave will be a lesson for history!"]="血色领地的沦陷将成为一个血淋淋的教训！"
G["The sacrifices now bring themselves to us? Have you no sense!?"]="啧啧，祭品自己送上门来了？你脑子坏掉了吧？"
G["The sacrifices of my Argent Dawn brothers must never be forgotten. They believed in the Dawn, though none lived to see the return of the Light to these lands."]="银色黎明同胞兄弟们的牺牲必须被永远铭记。他们信仰黎明，尽管没人能活着看到圣光重新照亮这片土地。"
G["The sadness in the earth is quelling the gifts granted me by the light.\n\nMy wife, she is suffering, and none of my abilities are able to help her."]="土地中的悲伤正在侵蚀圣光赐予我的天赋。\n\n我的妻子，她正备受煎熬，可我完全无法帮助她。"
G["The safety of the tribe is my foremost concern. Do you blame me for being cautious?"]="部族的安全才是我首要考虑的，你会怪我过于谨慎吗？"
G["The sails of the windmill grow taut against the sudden wind."]="突然卷起的狂风将风力磨坊的风帆扯得紧紧的。"
G["The same fate awaits all who would steal from the master."]="相同的命运在等待着所有窃取主人财物的家伙！"
G["The sand has run out."]="沙子已经漏完了。"
G["The sandbox is crowded..."]="这个沙箱太挤了……"
G["The sands of time count out the days to your annihilation!"]="时间之沙能算出你离死亡还有多远！"
G["The sands of time shall be scattered to the winds!"]="时间之沙将随风而散！"
G["The sands of time shift away from you, $C. This calling is not meant for you."]="Las arenas del tiempo se desplazan lejos de ti, $C. Esta llamada no está destinada a ti."
G["The sands of time will halt, but only for a moment! I will now conjure the barrier."]="时间之沙将停止流动，但只有片刻的时间！我现在要召唤屏障。"
G["The sapling they grew bore a fruit.  At first it seemed to work.  Ursoc did come back and I was filled with joy for a brief moment.\n\nAs he recovered, it was clear that he wasn't the same.  Neither were the furbolg.\n\nWhatever evil caused the ancient druids to tear down Vordrassil manifested itself in the new tree and turned them all into monsters filled with bloodlust.\n\nThe thing that now walks the Grizzly Hills is not my father and it must be put to rest."]="他们种下的树苗结出了一枚果实。最初一切都进展顺利。乌索克真的复活了，我也完全沉浸在这短暂的喜悦中。\n\n很快我就察觉到，他与生前截然不同。那些熊怪也发生了转变。\n\n当年，德鲁伊们因为不堪世界之树被邪恶力量所腐化，忍痛砍倒了沃达希尔。如今，新生的世界之树再度成为滋生邪恶的温床，令所有的熊怪变成了嗜血的野兽。\n\n出没在灰熊丘陵的怪物不再是我的父亲了，必须让他得到安息。"
G["The saronite barrier protecting General Vezax shimmers and fades away!"]="维扎克斯将军的萨隆邪铁屏障闪着微光，逐渐消失了！"
G["The saronite in this sample is nearly pure. Ores like this do not occur naturally on the surface of Azeroth."]="该样品中萨隆邪铁的纯度非常高。在自然状态下，这种矿石是不会出现在艾泽拉斯表面的。"
G["The saronite vapors mass and swirl violently, merging into a monstrous form!"]="萨隆邪铁蒸汽剧烈地旋转着，汇集成一个畸体。"
G["The saronite... there's something in it!"]="萨隆邪铁……里面藏有什么东西！"
G["The saur-priests have seen my weakness. The brutes beat me, and call me shortfang. If I did not have my basilisk to protect me, I would be all alone.\n\nLikely dead."]="蜥蜴人祭司看穿了我的软弱。那些暴徒殴打我，骂我是“短牙种”。要不是有我的蛇蜥保护我，我会很孤单的。\n\n生不如死。"
G["The saur-priests will tell you that our strength comes from Kroshik. Don't listen to their religious talk.\n\nOur strength comes from our claws, from our teeth, from our weapons. It comes from the filth that the filth-mongers gather and cultivate.\n\nIt comes from us.\n\nI don't care whether we descended from some devilsaur in the sky or we were created by the mogu. All I care about is protecting this land from our enemies."]="蜥蜴人祭司会告诉你说我们的力量来自考什克。别听他们那一套。\n\n我们的力量来自我们的爪子，我们的牙齿。它来自那些污秽污染者收集并培养的污秽。\n\n它来自我们本身。\n\n我不在乎我们究竟是源自某种魔暴龙，还是魔古族的造物。我只关心怎样保护这片土地不受敌人的侵扰。"
G["The saurok are despicable, but they may end up useful.\n\nIf we can incite them against the mogu, they can draw attention away from our men."]="蜥蜴人很卑劣，但他们或许还有用处。\n\n如果我们能煽动他们反抗魔古族，或许就能把他们的注意力从我们的人身上移开。"
G["The saurok are restless. They're planning something. Aethas will want to know."]="蜥蜴人很不安分，他们正在谋划着什么。艾萨斯会对此感兴趣的。"
G["The saurok have been quiet lately, and are becoming restless. The time is ripe to turn them against the mogu."]="蜥蜴人最近一直很安静，已经开始有些焦躁。是时候让他们去对付魔古族了。"
G["The saurok have plagued this land since the time of the mogu. They are impossible to negotiate with. But we never stop trying! We fight them only as a last resort."]="蜥蜴人从魔古时期以来就一直肆虐于这片土地。他们不可能与我们达成和解。但是，我们从未停止过尝试！战争只是下策。"
G["The saurok here are scavengers. There's no telling what they might be carrying."]="蜥蜴人喜欢收集战场上的破烂。他们身上带着什么东西都不奇怪。"
G["The saurok intrigue me.\n\nHow is it that they've survived so long in the shadow of their clearly superior enemy?"]="蜥蜴人让我很感兴趣。\n\n他们是怎么在明显占优的敌人的阴影下存活了那么长时间的？"
G["The saurok intrigue me.\n\nSo much so, in fact, that some have started calling me \"Skumblade Steve\"."]="Los saurok me intrigan.\n\nTanto es así que hay quien ya me llama \"Steve Hojaescoria\"."
G["The saurok leadership has called off their attacks on the mogu. They plan on attacking the Horde and Alliance instead.\n\nIt may be time to intervene."]="蜥蜴人首领已经终止了针对魔古族的袭击，并转而计划攻击部落和联盟。\n\n我们恐怕要有所行动了。"
G["The saurok make it difficult for anyone to visit here other than by flying.\n\nOf course, that makes slipping off to the Tavern in the Mists very difficult."]="蜥蜴人阻断了往来这里的交通，只有飞行才能抵达。\n\n当然，也骤然加大了溜进迷雾酒肆的难度。"
G["The savior of the forest! Were it not for your actions, Astranaar and then the rest of Ashenvale surely would have fallen to the Burning Legion.\n\nI hope that this day finds you well, $n!"]="¡Adalid del bosque! Si no hubiera sido por tus acciones, con toda seguridad Astranaar habría caído ante la Legión Ardiente.\n\n¡Espero que te encuentres bien, $n!"
G["The scales...have...tipped..."]="形势……转变了……"
G["The scar is sealed! Thank Cenarius..."]="这道伤痕被封印了！感谢塞纳留斯……"
G["The scent of blood...so delicious!"]="香浓的鲜血……太美味了！"
G["The scepter shard is no more! Your beloved Kalimdor shall soon be a desolate wasteland. I will, of course, turn the Eastern Kingdoms into an ashen, lifeless void..."]="节杖碎片已经不复存在了！你心爱的卡利姆多将很快成为一片荒芜的大地。当然，我会负责让东部王国也变成一片废墟的……"
G["The score is fourty-six to fifty-two!"]="比分是四十六比五十二！"
G["The scribe of the city is in the Apothecarium, someone named Margaux Parchley."]="这里的抄写员在炼金区，他的名字叫玛尔迦丝·帕克雷。"
G["The scrolls! I must save the scrolls!"]="卷轴！我必须抢救出那些卷轴！"
G["The sea and the land has given us life."]="海洋与陆地赐予了我们生命。"
G["The sea riders!"]="是海上骑士！"
G["The sea will swallow your smoldering remains."]="大海将吞噬你们熊熊燃烧的尸体。"
G["The seahorse floats patiently."]="海马稳稳的漂浮着。"
G["The search for my people.  Our struggle against the Alliance.  The war with the ogres and their gronn masters.\n\nAll of these things weigh heavy upon my shoulders, $c.\n\nEven I can use some help from time to time."]="我们苦苦搜寻着失散的族人，随时要提防联盟的袭击，还要与食人魔和他们的戈隆主子抗争。\n\n$c，氏族的重担都落在我的肩上。\n\n因此，有时我不得不向外界寻求帮助。"
G["The seas are a dangerous place, $c.  We must be alert."]="海洋是个危险的地方，$c。我们必须保持警惕。"
G["The seasons turn for all in due time, but you are still in the springtime of your life.  Please return to us later, $c, when you have experienced more."]="四季轮回变幻，但是你年纪尚轻。当你经历更多之后再来找我们吧，$c。"
G["The second lock of the Thrice-Locked cage clicks and falls to the ground. One Remains."]="三重锁的囚笼上的第二道锁“喀啦”一声掉在了地上，还剩一道锁。"
G["The second tower has fallen! Destroy the final tower and we will hasten their retreat!"]="第二座塔楼已经被摧毁了！只要我们解决最后一座塔楼，敌人就不得不撤退了！"
G["The secret dies with you."]="死人是不会泄密的。"
G["The secret to goblin engineering has nothing to do with keeping things from exploding. It has everything to do with directing the explosions exactly where you want them."]="地精工程学的奥秘是，教你学会如何让爆炸物在指定的地点按时引爆，而不是确保产品不会爆炸。"
G["The secret to good noodle soup begins with strong, thick noodles!"]="做好汤面的诀窍就在于筋道的面条！"
G["The secret to the knife is to keep it hidden until the moment you strike."]="刀的秘密在于，在你挥刀之前，其刀锋是隐藏的。"
G["The secret to the shadow dance is control.\n\nPrecision.\n\nAgility.\n\nGrace.\n\nNever a movement too many, and never too few."]="暗影之舞的秘密在于掌控力。\n\n精确。\n\n敏捷。\n\n优雅。\n\n动作不能多一步，也不能缺一步。"
G["The secrets behind the power of the Colossus could lead to all sorts of innovations in science!"]="巨甲虫的能量所隐藏的秘密将引发科学界的一场大变革！"
G["The secrets hidden within the Pylons of Un'Goro Crater are now yours. Visit the Pylons at any time to access their power and gain useful resources."]="安戈洛环形山水晶塔的秘密现在已经被你破解了。你可以随时造访水晶塔，获取它们的力量。"
G["The secrets of Suntara will not leave these lands."]="苏塔拉的秘密将永远留在这片土地上。"
G["The secrets of Uldum will be ours only!"]="奥丹姆的秘密只能属于我们！"
G["The secrets of the deep shall remain hidden."]="深渊的秘密，就永远留在深渊之中吧。"
G["The secrets of the library are ours and ours alone!"]="图书馆的秘密是我们的，是我们自己的！"
G["The secrets of the waters are now known to me. I will use these gifts to help the village."]="我现在已经了解水的奥秘了，我将利用这些天赋来帮助村子。"
G["The secrets of this place are not intended for the likes of you!"]="这个地方的秘密不是你这种人可以接触的！"
G["The sensation is... beyond my imagining. I am yours to command, my king."]="这感觉……真是超乎想象。我将永远听命于您，陛下。"
G["The sentence... was to be... yours.."]="被处决的……本该……是你……"
G["The sentinel I told you about was Lilly's sister.  She can be trusted."]="我们之前提到的那位哨兵是莉莉的姐妹。她可以信任。"
G["The sentinel's body rests here, the apparent victim of the elemental onslaught that has overtaken the town."]="这名哨兵的尸体倒在地上，他显然是死在元素攻破这座城镇的战斗中。"
G["The serpent is here!"]="它在这里！"
G["The serpent rider's path is drenched in blood and tears. Your journey has just begun!"]="翔龙骑士的道路上充满了鲜血与泪水。你的旅途才刚开始。"
G["The serpents overwhelmed us."]="毒蛇要淹没我们了。"
G["The serpents, they are everywhere!"]="到处都是毒蛇！"
G["The serum will only take a few minutes to prepare, $n."]="血清只要再过一会儿就能准备好了，$n。"
G["The servants of sul will feast on your remains."]="苏萨斯的奴仆会将你生吞活剥。"
G["The service here is really slow."]="这里上菜真慢。"
G["The sha are right about one thing.\n\nOur greatest enemies are often ourselves.\n\nI just wish I weren't such a formidable opponent."]="煞魔在有一点上是对的。\n\n我们最大的敌人通常就是我们自身。\n\n我只希望我自己不会是个难缠的对手。"
G["The sha can be a powerful tool. The mogu may have once harnessed its power into the Divine Bell, and look at the glorious empire they built in its wake."]="煞能可以被利用，成为强有力的武器。魔古族可能已经将煞的力量封入圣钟。看看他们依靠它缔造起了多么辉煌的帝国吧。"
G["The sha had me in its grasp? I had not even realized it until now..."]="我被煞魔控制了？我到现在才反应过来……"
G["The sha has made the pandaren weak! Now is the time to push them from the Veiled Stair forever!"]="煞弱化了熊猫人！是时候将他们彻底赶出隐秘阶梯了！"
G["The sha took us by surprise. Luckily, we had no casualties."]="煞魔出其不意地控制了我们，幸好没有造成伤亡。"
G["The sha will take you all."]="煞会把你们全占据了。"
G["The shadow of the Master covers this world... (Darkness, all darkness.) Our enemies fight one another, across the Highland. Fools. (Blood, blood.) WAIT! There is another!"]="主人的暗影笼罩了这个世界……（黑暗，彻底的黑暗。）我们的敌人在高地上互相残杀。一群蠢货。（鲜血，鲜血。）等等！这儿有别人！"
G["The shadow of the Scourge yet remains on this land, fools! You will never prevail!"]="天灾军团的阴影仍然笼罩着这片大地，蠢货！你们永远无法获得胜利！"
G["The shadow sees. Bal'qwari Og Shadar. The end comes!"]="暗影所见。Bal'qwari Og Shadar。终结到来！"
G["The shadow sees. Bo'al lal arwi C'toth. The end comes, cloaked in silent fire."]="阴影看得见。Bo'al lal arwi C'toth。末日即将来临，掩藏在无声的烈焰之中。"
G["The shadow... will engulf you."]="阴影……会笼罩你。"
G["The shadows are gone...the corruption is lifted."]="阴影消失了……腐蚀得到了净化。"
G["The shadows consume you."]="暗影将你吞噬。"
G["The shadows serve ME, now..."]="现在……阴影为我效命！"
G["The shadows will be our allies."]="阴影将成为我们的盟友。"
G["The shadows will consume you. You are not prepared to face the void."]="暗影将吞噬你。你还没有准备好面对虚空。"
G["The shadows will hide us well.\n\nI am concealed by this shadowcloak, and can imbue its magics onto you.\n\nIt will not make us invisible, but as long as we keep our distance from our foes we will remain hidden."]="Las sombras nos esconderán.\n\nEstoy oculto por este manto de las Sombras y puedo imbuirte su magia.\n\nNo nos hará invisibles, pero mientras guardemos las distancias con nuestros enemigos permaneceremos ocultos."
G["The shadows will not save you."]="阴影也救不了你。"
G["The shaft is trapped, Warchief. A fall would mean certain death."]="升降梯有问题，酋长。摔下去的人都难逃一死。"
G["The shape wasn't mine, of course.  And had you not been so reckless, you would've seen past my illusion.  But you came through for me, and for that... I must thank you!"]="这当然不是我的真实相貌。如果你不是那么卤莽的话，你早就看见我过去的幻影了。但是你毕竟帮助我渡过了难关……我必须谢谢你！"
G["The sharks competed for the fish, but the crocolisks survived."]="鲨鱼也以鱼类为食，但鳄鱼还是生存了下来。"
G["The sheer audacity of the plan is exactly what intrigues me. If we breech the shipyard, we will deprive the mogu of further Zandalari reinforcements."]="这正是这个计划吸引我的地方。如果我们攻破船坞，就能防止魔古族获得更多的赞达拉援军。"
G["The shell's markings read: \"STORMWIND ROYAL INDUSTRIES\""]="En los restos se ve la marca: \"INDUSTRIAS REALES DE VENTORMENTA\"."
G["The sherpen has clearly been frozen here for some time, but you see a glint of light from something in his pack."]="很明显，土地精已经被冻在这儿有一段时间了，但你看他的背包里有东西在闪闪发光。"
G["The shield - it is down! We did it!"]="护盾——消失了！我们成功了！"
G["The shield be down! Rise up Atal'ai! Rise up!"]="防御结界被摧毁了！醒来吧，阿塔莱！醒来吧！"
G["The shield is down! Nice work, $p! I'll take us to the beachhead."]="护盾被消除了！干得好，$p！我们这就前往滩头阵地。"
G["The shield is down! Quickly get to the beachhead!"]="护盾消失了！赶快前往滩头！"
G["The shield is down; Varos is vulnerable!  Defeating him should disperse the Azure Ring Guardians and allow us access to the upper bands.  Varos is on a floating platform about halfway up The Oculus, on the Band of Acceleration."]="破除护盾，削弱瓦尔洛斯的防御力量！击败他，碧蓝魔环卫士就会消失，这样我们就能继续往上层前进了。前往位于魔环中层的加速之环，在浮动平台上找到瓦尔洛斯。"
G["The shield is engraved: Sentinel Ku-Yao. It belongs to the boy's father."]="El escudo tiene grabado \"Centinela Ku-Yao\". Pertenece al padre del niño."
G["The shield is nearly gone! All that I have worked for is in danger!"]="护盾快要消失了！我的一切努力随时都有可能付之东流！"
G["The shield surrounding the Aspects is destroyed by Ultraxion's attack!"]="奥卓克希昂的攻击摧毁了守护巨龙们四周的护盾！"
G["The shields surrounding the Aspects shatter! The Aspects are vulnerable!"]="守护巨龙周围的护盾碎裂了！守护巨龙要受到伤害了！"
G["The shins. The face. The crotch. Kick them all, indiscriminately."]="小腿，面部，胯部，随便踢。"
G["The shiny isss mine!"]="那闪闪发亮的宝贝是我的！"
G["The ship is about to explode.  Run to the top deck and swing away!"]="船要爆炸啦。快到上层甲板上去，用绳索逃生！"
G["The ship's aflame!"]="船着火了！"
G["The ship's not ready yet.  We still need to calibrate the fuse length to make sure that it doesn't burn out and leave you up there alone."]="飞船还没准备好。我们仍然需要调整保险丝的长度，以确保它不会烧坏而把你一个人留在那里。"
G["The ships are aflame! Troops, to the harbor!"]="船着火了！士兵们，立即回港！"
G["The show is for guests only!"]="这场表演只允许客人观看！"
G["The show must go on!"]="这场表演必须继续下去！"
G["The shredder... It's done! Where'd that driver go..."]="伐木机……已经完成了！驾驶员又去哪儿了……"
G["The shrine was corrupted by Ordos!"]="祭坛被斡耳朵斯腐蚀了！"
G["The sickness is born of the Nightmare within the Emerald Dream, and the dragon Taerar spreads it. He is but a crazed shade of his former self, but will see this land devoured."]="疾患来自翡翠梦境内部的梦魇，巨龙泰拉尔对其进行了散播。现在的他就是从前自己的癫狂镜像，要亲眼看着这片土地被吞噬殆尽。"
G["The siege engine is ready to roll!"]="攻城坦克已经准备好了！"
G["The siege is broken... for now. Follow me to Splintertree."]="围攻被击退了……至少暂时是如此。跟随我去碎木岗哨吧。"
G["The siege is underway but our heavy explosives never made it to the wall!"]="攻势已经发动，但重磅炸药还没有到位！"
G["The siege must be broken. Wyrmrest Accord, defend the line!"]="必须打退围攻的敌人。龙眠联军，守住阵线!"
G["The sights, the sounds, the smells..."]="这景象，这声音，这气味……"
G["The sign here says: \"ABSOLUTELY NO BUMS!\" Now get lost!"]="El cartel dice: \"¡NADA DE VAGABUNDOS!\". ¡Ahora piérdete!"
G["The sign out front was not very... welcoming."]="前门的情形看起来有点儿……吓人。"
G["The signal has been sent. He should be arriving shortly."]="我已经通知了温德索尔元帅。他应该很快就能赶到这儿。"
G["The silent, sleeping, staring houses in the backwoods always dream. It would be merciful to tear them down."]="在林区深处静静沉睡与凝望着的房屋常常陷入梦境。把它们拆除无疑是善举。"
G["The silithid are no match for the sons and daughters of Orgrimmar.  Soon all that will be left of them are their crushed limbs and wings under our feet, $n."]="异种虫类根本不是奥格瑞玛的勇士们的对手。很快，它们支离破碎的躯壳和翅膀就会洒满我们脚下的土地，$n。"
G["The silithid? Those things are disgusting and completely inedible...oh, whatever."]="那些异种虫？那些东西令人讨厌，而且根本不能吃……哦，根本不能吃。"
G["The similarities between this place and Un'goro are uncanny.  Maybe the two are connected in some way."]="这里的地貌与安戈洛环形山极其相似。或者两者有些关联吧。"
G["The sin'dorei reign supreme!"]="辛多雷是不可战胜的！"
G["The siphoned energies would sustain the Highborne's magic, allowing those within the walls of Eldre'Thalas to feed their endless and growing magical pangs.\n\nThousands of years passed and the power required to keep Immol'thar imprisoned while sustaining life within Eldre'Thalas, began to shift. The cost to keep Immol'thar bound grew to overshadow the rate at which energy could be siphoned and distributed. The once net gain turned to loss."]="汲取的能量能维持上层精神的魔力，使埃雷萨拉斯的人民满足他们对魔法无尽而持续增长的渴求。\n\n数千年过去了，用于监禁恶魔伊莫塔尔以及维系埃雷萨拉斯人民生命的力量开始减弱。监禁恶魔所需的魔法就要超过所能汲取的魔法。曾经的能量机制已经不复存在。"
G["The sisters go into a Berserker Rage!"]="瓦格里双子开始狂暴了！"
G["The site has been compromised. The aspects must be alerted."]="遗迹被破坏了，必须马上警告守护巨龙们。"
G["The situation is dire, $p.\nThe Horde are after a cache of mantid weapons near the Heart of Zan'vess. I don't know what they intend to do with them but I'm not about to wait around and find out.\nI need you to get through the shield that enshrouds the island and secure those weapons before the horde does. Take a gyrocopter and head out to the island. I'll send further orders while you are en route."]="La situación es grave, $p.\n\nLa Horda busca un alijo de armas mántides cerca del Corazón de Zan'vess. No sé qué pretenden hacer con ellas, pero no pienso esperar a que nos lo enseñen.\n\nQuiero que atravieses el escudo que envuelve la isla y te hagas con las armas antes que la Horda. Toma un girocóptero y dirígete a la isla. Te transmitiré más órdenes por el camino."
G["The situation is more grim than many have been led to believe. The Forsaken are here as allies in the fight against our common enemy, the Scourge.\n\nTrust me when I say this, without them the Ghostlands would be lost and the Scourge would already have overrun all of Eversong Woods!\n\nBut more than anything else, we need your help in reclaiming our once proud lands!"]="情况比人们想象的要严峻得多。被遗忘者来这里是为了与我们组成同盟，共同对抗亡灵天灾。\n\n相信我，没有他们的帮助，我们将失去幽魂之地，而整个永歌森林也将被亡灵天灾侵占！\n\n但是我们仍然需要你伸出援手，帮我们夺回土地！"
G["The situation is rather complicated, Thrall. It would be best for you to head into the mountains now, before more of Blackmoore's men show up. We'll make sure Taretha is safe."]="现在的处境非常复杂，萨尔。对你来说，最好在更多布莱克摩尔的人出现前离开这里。我们会保证塔蕾莎的安全。"
G["The situation out here is worse than I thought! The zeppelin is little better than a heap of twisted metal and burning fuel!"]="这里的情况比我想象的糟得多！飞艇并不比一堆扭曲的金属和燃烧的燃料好多少！"
G["The skeletal horse appears to look towards the nearby ziggurat."]="骷髅马面朝着附近那座金字塔形状的建筑物。"
G["The skies belong to the Empress!"]="天空属于女皇！"
G["The skies turn red with the blood of the fallen! The Lich King watches over us, minions! Leave only ashes and misery in your destructive wake!"]="天空变得血红！巫妖王在注视着我们。前进！苏醒的你们将带来毁灭，身后只留下灰烬和痛苦。"
G["The skies will darken and all will go quiet. Only then will you know the sweet serenity of death..."]="天空会陷入黑暗，整个世界也将沉寂。只有那时，你才能体验到死亡那甜蜜的幽静。"
G["The skill of the bow is a great asset to anyone, not just the hunter. You can strike swiftly, silently, and before your prey can blink... they are dead."]="不只是对猎人，掌握弓箭的使用技能对每个人来说都相当有用。你可以在猎物眨眼之前快速，悄无声息地出击……还没等反应过来，它们就已经死了。"
G["The skill with which Telonis crafts armor is beyond compare.  You should be grateful that he does not charge more for the knowledge he passes to others.  Go now and seek him out in the Craftsmen's Terrace in the northeast section of Darnassus."]="泰龙尼斯制作武器的技能无与伦比。他不会收学生的钱，你该为此感到庆幸。去吧，去达纳苏斯东北部的工匠区找他吧。"
G["The skin stretched taut between the bones is a call to arms against the main defender of the Alliance's Sylvanaar and the Living Grove to the west."]="在骨架之间紧绷着的毛皮上写着的信息主要是召集军队以对抗西面的联盟希尔瓦纳与活木林的驻军。"
G["The skinner here is named Killian Hagey. He works in the Rogues' Quarter on the inner ring."]="基里安·哈根是这里的剥皮训练师。他就在盗贼区的内环区域。"
G["The skinners usually take all their hides into Ironforge to dry out.  Why don't you head there and see if you can find one to train ye?"]="剥皮匠通常会把所有的兽皮豆带到铁炉堡去风干。你为什么不去那儿看看是否能找人训练你呢？"
G["The sky darkens and the elements are restless! Seek shelter!"]="天黑下来了，元素们变得越来越躁动不安！快找地方躲起来！"
G["The sky darkens with your impending demise!"]="天空被黑暗笼罩，你们的灭亡已经临近！"
G["The sky is dark.  The fire burns.  You strive in vain as Fate's wheel turns."]="天空一片黑暗，火焰仍在肆虐。你的挣扎毫无意义，命运之轮已经开始旋转。"
G["The sky is falling!"]="天塌了！"
G["The sky is not safe, friend. Be alert!"]="天空并不安全，朋友。要小心！"
G["The sky itself feeds upon the suffering of the conquered!"]="天空吞噬着被征服者的痛苦！"
G["The sky shall fall with the Legions glory!"]="天空会随着燃烧军团的荣耀而坍塌！"
G["The sky weeps at the glorious devastation of these lands! Soon, Azeroth's futile tears will rain down upon us!"]="大地即将崩裂，天空也要为之哭泣！很快，艾泽拉斯那悲戚的血泪就会降下！"
G["The sky weeps for your demise!"]="天空将为你的败亡而哭泣！"
G["The sky... Beckons..."]="天空……在召唤……"
G["The slain spirit of Lunaclaw stares at you intently, as though wanting something from you."]="月爪枭兽逝去的灵魂专注地盯着你，就像等待发生什么事情一样。"
G["The slightest spark shall be your undoing."]="这点轻微的花火，将带来你们的灭亡！"
G["The slow blade penetrates the shield."]="钝刀穿透了盾牌。"
G["The smell of death covers every inch of this place."]="死亡的气息覆盖着这里的每一寸土地。"
G["The smell of good fortune is upon this lake...  or is that just Fishbreath?"]="这片湖上有好运的味道……还是鱼泡泡的味道？"
G["The smell of these land walkers disgusts me."]="这些陆地上来的家伙的气味让我感到恶心。"
G["The smell of these mutant orcs disgusts me."]="这些变异兽人的味道让我感到恶心。"
G["The smell of victory!"]="胜利的气味！"
G["The smoke in the distance... It is Wartook. He is trying to tell us something..."]="远处那股烟……啊，是沃图克。他想要告诉我们什么……"
G["The soil welcomes your bones!"]="土壤欢迎你们的白骨。"
G["The soldiers are doing important work. The safety of the people is more important, Mal, if you're interested in your customers living to spend another day."]="士兵的工作非常重要。人民的安全更加重要，马尔，如果你还想让顾客们多活一天的话。"
G["The soldiers are spreading panic with the rumors of bad food. Neighbors are accusing one another of poison. The city will fall into bedlam!"]="关于变质粮食的传闻在士兵之间流传，恐慌正在蔓延。市民们互相指责邻居就是投毒者。城市已经陷入骚乱。"
G["The solution is ready in my cauldron.  It's just the matter of treating both the unfinished key and the scarab."]="熔炉中的溶液已经可以使用了。接下来无非是处理未完成的钥匙和圣甲虫的问题。"
G["The song is written in the old tongue, the language of emperors and scholars. Hardly anyone speaks it anymore."]="这首歌是由古文写成，那是皇帝和学者们使用的语言。现在几乎已经没人会说了。"
G["The song of your life will be sung by the mighty, $n. Until we meet again."]="你的生命之歌将永远激昂，$n。下次再见。"
G["The sooner I'm left alone, the faster the work will be finished."]="我越早能不被打扰，就能越快把活儿干完。"
G["The sooner we can get away from the Stonemother, the better. I do not trust her."]="我们越早摆脱石母越好。我不相信她。"
G["The sooner you come to accept your condition as a defect, the sooner you will find yourselves in a position to transcend it."]="你只有承认自己必然的失败，才有可能早日获得更强的力量，重获新生。"
G["The souls of the Third Fleet are cursed to roam this shore, for eternity, $r. The Eye of Paleth lay claim to our lives, and trapped us in the mire forevermore."]="第三舰队被诅咒的魂灵将永世游荡在这片海岸上，$r。帕雷斯之眼掌控着我们的生命，并永远将我们囚禁在泥沼之中。"
G["The souls of the undead are cursed and tortured.  If I am infected, promise you'll burn me before I turn."]="亡灵的灵魂饱受诅咒和痛苦的折磨。如果我被感染了，你一定要在我彻底堕落前结束我的性命……"
G["The souls of the undead are cursed and tortured.  If I am infected, promise you'll burn me before I turn.."]="亡灵的灵魂饱受诅咒和痛苦的折磨。如果我被感染了，你一定要在我彻底堕落前结束我的性命……"
G["The souls of your fallen champions will be mine, Fordring."]="你们死去勇士的灵魂都将属于我，弗丁。"
G["The sound of death... so sweet to my ears..."]="死亡的声音……在我听来是如此甜蜜……"
G["The sound of footsteps shuffling echo throughout the cave."]="脚步声的回音在洞内回荡。"
G["The sound of grinding metal reverberates through the halls as the lock on the Nexus doors releases."]="随着枢纽大门的打开，削磨金属的刺耳噪音在大厅里回荡开来。"
G["The sound of those explosions was like music to my ears. Come here, $n. Give me a hug!"]="那些爆炸声真是太悦耳了。来这里，$n。抱一下！"
G["The sound of thunder dissipates."]="雷鸣声逐渐减弱了。"
G["The sound of thunder roars throughout the cavern."]="雷鸣声响彻整个山洞。"
G["The soup must be piping hot to warm the soul!"]="面汤一定要烧得滚烫，才能温暖食客的心！"
G["The south-eastern keep tower has been damaged!"]="东南方的塔楼遭到破坏！"
G["The south-eastern keep tower has been destroyed!"]="东南方的塔楼被摧毁了！"
G["The south-western keep tower has been damaged!"]="西南方的塔楼遭到破坏！"
G["The south-western keep tower has been destroyed!"]="西南方的塔楼被摧毁了！"
G["The southern bridge has been damaged!"]="南边的桥梁遭到破坏！"
G["The southern bridge has been destroyed!"]="南边的桥梁被摧毁了！"
G["The southern tower has been damaged!"]="南边的哨塔遭到破坏！"
G["The southern tower has been destroyed!"]="南边的哨塔被摧毁了！"
G["The spark of life fades."]="生命之火熄灭。"
G["The spark plugs are clear!\nWell done!"]="火花塞干净了！\n干得好！"
G["The spark plugs misfired!\nPressure was lost."]="火花塞熄火了！\n压力消失。"
G["The spark plugs were clogged!\nAll pressure was lost."]="火花塞堵住了！\n压力消失。"
G["The sparktouched are some of the best fighters among us... they're carried most of the battle against the wolvar."]="灵鳍鳄鱼人是最强大的战士……他们参与了大多数对抗狼獾人的战斗。"
G["The sparky ones are more squishy! Get them first!"]="这些家伙很容易对付！先杀它们！"
G["The spear is broken! Retreat!"]="长矛折断了！撤退！"
G["The spears are just for show. As long as we don't get out of the boat or make eye contact or get hit by a spear then we should be fine."]="长矛只是吓唬人用的。只要我们待在船上，不跟它们有眼神接触，也不被长矛击中，应该就不会有危险。"
G["The specimen is a female gnome.  Even while infected, her insufferable cuteness let her get close to and infect a dozen others before being stopped."]="这份血样取自一位女性侏儒。她的神情举止流露出难以抗拒的萌属性，人们在她面前总是会失去戒心。因此，她受感染轻易地又害了数十人。"
G["The specimen was a male human.  A farmer.  He'd killed his family and then wandered into Stormwind."]="这份血样取自一位男性人类农民。他杀死家人后闯入了暴风城。"
G["The specimens... must be preserved."]="标本……不能受到破坏。"
G["The speed of Owatanka is with you, $n."]="你具有了奥瓦坦卡的速度，$n。"
G["The speed of sound in dry air is approximately 343 m/s!"]="在干燥的空气中，声波的传递速度约为343米/秒！"
G["The spiders here are as big as... me! Do you know how to get rid of a spider infestation?\n\nYeah, that's right. Dynamite. Lots and lots of dynamite."]="那些蜘蛛的个头就和……我一样大！你知道该怎么对付成群的蜘蛛吗？\n\n嗯哼，没错。炸弹。成堆的炸弹。"
G["The spirit has spoken. We should take up arms and attack the hozen!"]="诸灵喻示，我们必须拿起武器，抗击猢狲！"
G["The spirit is displeased and attacks!"]="那些灵魂发怒了，展开了攻击！"
G["The spirit looks intently into your eyes and grasps your hand.  You feel a warmth shoot through your body, almost knocking you to your knees.\n\nAs the warmth passes, you feel the slight presence of an ursine spirit within your being... bolstering your resolve."]="灵魂专注地盯着你的眼睛，握紧你的双手。你感到一股热流抨击着身体，几乎无法站立。\n\n热流过后，你感觉身体中似乎充斥着熊的灵魂……让你更加坚定。"
G["The spirit looks upon you with a sense of completeness and cognizance that had not been present before.\n\n\"I feel as though a great burden has been lifted from my soul.  Soon I will rest forever in peace.  I now know this, and I await this time patiently.\n\nThank you, stranger.\""]="El espíritu te mira con un sentido de plenitud y reconocimiento que hasta entonces no habían estado presentes.\n\n\"Me siento como si mi alma hubiera sido liberada de una pesada carga. Pronto descansaré en paz. Ahora lo sé y lo aguardo pacientemente.\n\nGracias, $gdesconocido:desconocida;\"."
G["The spirit of Echeyakee flows through you, $n."]="埃其亚基的灵魂之力在你身上流动，$n。"
G["The spirit of the Dreadsteed pulses with rage."]="恐怖战马的灵魂散发出愤怒的气息。"
G["The spirit of water has left us.  Our tribe is doomed."]="水流之灵遗弃了我们，族群必将毁灭。"
G["The spirit showed us the path to our future. And somehow, it has something to do with you."]="流水之魂向我们展现了未来的道路。但不知为何，这多少跟你还有点关系。"
G["The spirit's voice echoed through me like thunder. Did you hear it?"]="流水之魂的声音如雷鸣般在我耳边回荡。你听到了吗？"
G["The spirits are gone. The nightmare is over."]="幽灵都离开了。噩梦结束了。"
G["The spirits are greatly agitated. We must find the cause of this disturbance."]="灵魂们非常容易激动。我们必须找到这场骚动的原因。"
G["The spirits are restless, $r. Be mindful of your surroundings while in Nagrand lest you be consumed by their fury."]="这些灵魂在躁动，$r。在纳格兰游历的时候留心你的周围，以免你被他们的愤怒吞噬。"
G["The spirits call... I am consumed."]="灵魂的召唤……我被吞噬了。"
G["The spirits can finally rest, thanks to you. Soon I, too, will return to the other side.\n\nI leave you with this piece of advice: Pandaria is a land of history. If ever you are unsure about the future, you need only to seek answers from the past.\n\nRemember this, and you will thrive here."]="多亏了你，怨灵们终于可以安息了。很快，我魂归地府。\n\n在走之前，我要给你个忠告：潘达利亚是一块历史悠久的土地。如果你对未来感到迷茫，你只需要从过去寻找答案。\n\n记住这点，你就能在这里如鱼得水。"
G["The spirits condemn you!"]="灵魂会谴责你们的！"
G["The spirits give us strength!"]="万灵赐予你们力量！"
G["The spirits guide our steps as we follow our paths though life, how may I guide yours?"]="我能帮你些什么？"
G["The spirits have abandoned you."]="万灵抛弃了你。"
G["The spirits have brought you to me, and so I feel blessed by them."]="灵魂将你带到我这儿来，感谢他们。"
G["The spirits have guided you to me. How may I be of service?"]="灵魂引导你来到我这儿。我要怎么帮你？"
G["The spirits have listened!  Can you feel it, $n?"]="灵魂听见我们的祈祷了！$n，你能感觉到吗？"
G["The spirits have spoken. I have much to ponder."]="流水之魂告诫我，我还需要仔细思量。"
G["The spirits here have been tormented for a long time. We only want to rest."]="这里的灵魂已经被折磨了很久。我们只想安息。"
G["The spirits o' this land won't tolerate this dark magic and vicious sacrifice any longer.\n\nThe Vilebranch have got to go!"]="这片土地的英灵不会再容忍这种黑暗魔法和邪恶的献祭。\n\n邪枝巨魔必须被赶走！"
G["The spirits of Silithus call out to us, $n.  The land weeps, for it has a woeful story to tell..."]="希利苏斯的灵魂召唤我们，$n。土地在哭泣，它有个悲惨的故事要告诉我们……"
G["The spirits of Stonetalon still rage, $n."]="石爪山的自然之灵依然十分愤怒，$n。"
G["The spirits of air have heard my call. Cyclones will lower us to safety. Now we jump!"]="空气之灵已经听到了我的呼唤。飓风会送我们返回地面。现在，跳吧！"
G["The spirits of the air can be found even here, underground. They dislike being surrounded, constricted by the earth... their precious freedom is limited here."]="你可以在地下或是这里找到空气之灵。它们讨厌被大地环抱和挤压，它们宝贵的自由在这里受到了局限。"
G["The spirits of the elements are wise. They've been here long before us and will persist long after we're gone. When they speak to us, we must listen."]="元素之灵是睿智的。在我们出现之前，他们早已经存在于此，在我们尽数消失之后，他们仍然会在这里长存不息。当他们对我们说话的时候，我们必须仔细倾听。"
G["The spirits of the elements surround us. We must always listen. I have seen firsthand the consequences when we ignore their warnings..."]="元素之灵就在我们身边。我们必须时刻注意倾听他们的声音。我亲眼见到过当我们忽视他们的警告时，发生了怎样的灾难……"
G["The spirits of the taunka will not rest until Steeljaw is dealt with."]="只有除掉钢腭，牛头人的灵魂才能安息。"
G["The spirits of this place are focused against your kind, $r. Perhaps if you win this tower in the flesh, I will be able to aid you."]="似乎此地的鬼魂们并不欢迎你，$r。如果你能攻下这座哨塔，我可以考虑帮助你。"
G["The spirits shall consume you!"]="让万灵吞没你！"
G["The spirits sing to us!  They sing the song of battle!"]="灵魂们在为我们歌唱！他们在高唱着战斗之歌！"
G["The spirits smile upon my victory!"]="灵魂在对我的胜利微笑！"
G["The spirits speak all around us. Are you listening, $r?"]="灵魂在我们身边低语。你听见了吗，$r？"
G["The spirits told me you would come, that you would seek me for some reason, but that even you may not know that reason. So, do you know why you are here?"]="灵魂告诉我说你会来的，你会出于某种原因来此寻找我，但是你也许自己都不清楚这个原因。那么，你知道你为什么会在这儿吗？"
G["The spirits whisper in my ear.  They are restless and full of angst."]="幽魂在我耳边细语，他们显得如此地焦躁不安。"
G["The spirits will feast on your blood!"]="万灵将啜饮你的鲜血！"
G["The spirits will guide us in the coming battle."]="万灵将在战斗中指引我们。"
G["The spotted one must be sought. Their fates are entwined."]="必须找到雪豹女神。他们的命运与此休戚相关。"
G["The sprites look angry! Kill them while you can!"]="这些幽灵看起来很愤怒！快杀了它们！"
G["The stable is empty! We must provide our cavalry with suitable mounts. Stormpike Stables requests your assistance!"]="马厩是空的！我们必须为骑兵提供充足的坐骑。卡尔·雷矛马厩需要你的帮助！"
G["The stable master"]="兽栏管理员"
G["The stables and mill are left abandoned! What will happen to our horses?"]="马厩和伐木场被遗弃了！我们的马匹怎么办？"
G["The stables are full again! Our cavalry is soon to ride!"]="马厩又满啦！我们的骑兵很快就可以乘坐啦！"
G["The stains are appearing more quickly now!"]="污点出现得越来越快了！"
G["The stake is covered with the remnants of those foolish enough to anger the Warchief."]="这里满是这些愚蠢的家伙的尸骸，这令酋长非常愤怒。"
G["The stakes will be high."]="奖励丰厚。"
G["The stars come to my aid!"]="群星将为我而战！"
G["The stars of this time are bent on new paths, beacons of hope and strength for the coming ages."]="星光指引着新的道路，未来燃起希望和力量的灯塔。"
G["The stars speak to me.  They whisper of the horrors waiting in the night."]="星星告诉我，今晚会发生一些恐怖的事情。"
G["The stars sweep chill currents that make men shiver in the dark."]="辰星可驱散彻骨的寒意，让人们不会在黑暗中战栗。"
G["The stars will be in perfect form tonight!"]="今晚的星星会很美！"
G["The station's mechanics had put him back together, bringing him back to \"life\".\n\nAnd now, by way of thanks, he was going to return the favor by curing all of us of what he called the \"Curse of the Flesh\".\n\nAccording to Mechazod, it's a condition that eventually befalls all of the creations of the Titans! In other words, we all supposedly start out as robots of some kind, and, over thousands of years, slowly turn into fleshy beings!\n\nPreposterous, I know."]="Los mecánicos de la estación lo habían reconstruido, devolviéndolo a la \"vida\".\n\nY ahora, como agradecimiento, nos iba a devolver el favor curándonos del mal que él denomina \"la maldición de la carne\".\n\nSegún Mecazod, es una dolencia que acaba afectando a todas las creaciones de los titanes. Dicho de otra forma, todos empezamos siendo robots de algún tipo y con el paso de los milenios poco a poco nos vamos volviendo seres de carne.\n\nLo sé, es absurdo."
G["The statue appears to be holding something..."]="雕像的手里似乎有什么东西……"
G["The statue appears to be of an ancient Mogu emperor."]="这似乎是某位古代魔古皇帝的雕像。"
G["The statue is alive?!"]="雕像活了？！"
G["The statue lies dormant."]="雕像进入了休眠状态。"
G["The statue softly hums as you approach."]="当你靠近时，雕像发出了柔和的嗡鸣声。"
G["The statue's shoulder looks quite imposing in relation to the rest of its features. The subject was clearly a mighty creature!\n\nPerhaps it's a good natured sort. Or if not, then maybe it's extinct!\n\nOne can hope..."]="相比它的其他部分，雕像的肩部看上去十分威武。它的主人一定是个强大的生物！\n\n它或许是一个温和的家伙。如果不是的话，那它可能十分具有侵略性！\n\n我们只能祈祷……"
G["The statues all move back into their original positions.\n\nThe sequence must be started again now, from the beginning."]="所有的雕像都已经回归了原来的位置。\n\n你必须重新对它们进行排列。"
G["The statues are all in place, and you may begin the puzzle."]="所有的雕像都已经就位，你可以开始解谜了。"
G["The steam-powered Alliance icebreaker Northspear sails from here to Menethil Harbor in the Wetlands, across the sea in the Eastern Kingdoms."]="联盟的蒸汽动力破冰船“北海之矛”将穿越东部王国的海域，开往湿地的米奈希尔港。"
G["The stench of Alliance scum is in the air."]="空气里有联盟恶棍的臭味儿。"
G["The stench of sulfur and brimstone... These portals are as foul as the demons themselves."]="一股硫磺的臭气……这些传送门散发出和恶魔一样的邪恶气息。"
G["The stench of that holy trinket you carry disgusts me..."]="你佩戴的圣物散发着臭味，真恶心……"
G["The stench that surrounds your kind is overwhelming.  You will pay with all the others who commune with demonkind."]="你们这些家伙身上的恶臭真让人作呕。你将和其他勾结恶魔的家伙一起付出代价。"
G["The still needs heat! Light the brazier!"]="蒸馏器温度过低！点燃火盆！"
G["The sting of your defeat will fade with time."]="失败的痛楚将随时间而渐渐平复。"
G["The stone begins to fall away from the guardian. The ritual is almost complete!"]="碎石开始从守护者身上滚落。仪式就要完成了！"
G["The stone calls..."]="石头在呼唤……"
G["The stone knife!  Use it NOW!  I can't maintain control of him for much longer..."]="那把石匕！快用！我就快控制不了他了……"
G["The stone radiates a bitter cold, chilling the air around it and the platform on which it sits. Deep within its facets, a blue light pulses, waiting."]="石头散发出一阵寒气，冻结住了周围的空气和放置石头的平台。在石头的深处，一道蓝色的光芒跳动着，等待着。"
G["The stone thinks itself unmovable until the ground is washed away beneath it."]="岩石总以为自己不可撼动，直到它身下的大地被一起冲走。"
G["The storm feeds my power!"]="风暴赋予我力量！"
G["The storm is starting! Get ready."]="风暴来袭！做好准备。"
G["The storm long spent there rests..."]="久违的风暴沉寂无声……"
G["The storm will consume you!"]="风暴将吞噬你！"
G["The storm's knowledge is vast, but it speaks only to Stormbringers, $C. You cannot control such power."]="El conocimiento de la tormenta es vasto, pero sólo se lo revela a los Portadores del Tormenta, $C. No puedes controlar tal poder."
G["The storms speak only to Stormbringers, $C. Your spirit lacks the tempest needed for such power."]="Las tormentas hablan solo con los PortaTormentas, $C. Tu espíritu carece de la tempestad necesaria para tal poder."
G["The story is still being written..."]="故事仍在继续……"
G["The story of your journey will be told for years to come!"]="你的故事将被传颂！"
G["The strain of living... just let go..."]="生命的重负……就此放松吧……"
G["The stranded Alliance sailors know they're going to die, yet they fight us tooth and nail.\n\nImpressive and pathetic at the same time."]="进退两难的联盟水手想必已经明白他们难逃一死，却选择了负隅顽抗。\n\n真是可悲可叹啊。"
G["The strands of LIFE have been severed! The Dreamers must be avenged!"]="生命的希冀已被切断！梦游者要展开报复！"
G["The strands of life have been severed.\n\nThe dreamers must be avenged."]="生命的希翼已被斩断。\n\n梦游者一定会复仇的。"
G["The strands of life..."]="生命的希冀……"
G["The stranger having no name of his own, my father deemed \"Yorg,\" a name reserved for champions of legend. Years later, he now stands before us as Yorg Stormheart, King of the Frostborn."]="Mi padre llamó al extranjero que no tenía nombre \"Yorg\", un nombre reservado a los campeones legendarios. Años después, él se alza ante nosotros como Yorg Cuoretormenta, Rey de los Natoescarcha."
G["The stranger is here!"]="¡Ha venido $gel:la; $gforastero:forastera;!"
G["The strength of fire lies in change. Its strength is considerable, but ever-shifting... unpredictable."]="火是多变的。它的力量相当大，但是它永远在变……不可预知。"
G["The strength of my clan will be with you. I swear it."]="我的族人可以帮你们作战。我发誓。"
G["The strength of the White Tiger."]="白虎之力。"
G["The strength of your resolve shines, $n. You continue to prove that you are an asset to our people. Someday the world will realize the extent of your great deeds."]="La fuerza de tu resolución brilla, $n. Sigues demostrando ser muy $gvalioso:valiosa; para los nuestros. Algún día, el mundo se dará cuenta de tus inmensos logros."
G["The strength to overcome any hardship! This is fortitude."]="克服一切困难的力量！这就是坚忍。"
G["The strength, the wisdom, the unending endurance of the peoples of Azeroth inspires those beyond your reckoning.  On this day, this day of blood and terror, I see that yours is a world of heroes!"]="艾泽拉斯人民的力量、智慧和坚韧孕育了那些超越你的想象的勇士。在这充满血腥和恐惧的岁月里，我预见到你们的世界将涌现无数的英雄！"
G["The strong odor coming from the bowl smells like a mixture of various herbs with burning hair."]="这只碗里散发出强烈的气味，闻起来好象是各种草药和燃烧的毛发混合在一起。"
G["The stronger our defenders, the greater our chance of survival. But that should be obvious, even to someone like you."]="我们的守卫越强壮，我们生存下来的几率也就越大。但这显而易见，特别是对于像你这样的人。"
G["The stronger the ingredients, the stronger the magic of the brew."]="酿酒的材料越强大，酿出的酒中蕴含的魔法也就越强大。"
G["The strongest hides come from those kodo that have laid themselves to rest in this wasteland."]="这些栖息在这片荒地上的科多兽的兽皮最为坚韧。"
G["The structure above begins to hum with energy."]="能量在水晶柱中涌动，发出低沉的嗡嗡声。"
G["The students nod slowly, eyes rapt on their teacher."]="学生们缓慢地点了点头，全神贯注地看着他们的老师。"
G["The sturdy crate sits in the middle of the lumber mill surrounded by debris and very zealous followers of the Scarlet Crusade."]="那个坚固的箱子在木材厂中间，周围推满了残骸和血色十字军的狂热信徒。"
G["The style of this blade and its markings hinted that it might be a dragonforged sword. At last, we will have our answer."]="这把剑的形制和铭文表明它是一把龙铸之刃。终于，答案找到了。"
G["The subject is still breathing. Time for another dosage..."]="实验体仍在呼吸。再来一份剂量……"
G["The subjugation of these people has only just begun... so much time for fun and games."]="我们的征服之旅才刚刚开始……以后有的是乐子。"
G["The submarine's gonna blow! Move out!"]="潜艇要爆炸了！撤离！"
G["The summer fields will remain safe as long as I live!"]="只要我还有一口气在，仲夏原就会永享安宁！"
G["The summoning incantations have been prepared, but we were depending on the Crucible of Nazsharin to draw power for our spell. The artifact must be recovered."]="召唤咒语已经就绪，可我们是依靠纳萨林坩埚来汲取法术能量。必须找回这件圣物。"
G["The summoning of demons is a dangerous practice, but the resulting power can be immense. Our resident expert is Alamma, who watches over the warlocks within Murder Row."]="召唤恶魔是一种很危险的行为，但是那又可以让你掌握巨大的力量。奥拉玛是我们的常驻专家，在谋杀小径指导着术士们。"
G["The summoning runes were already drawn when we arrived. You'll need to destroy all of them."]="我们抵达的时候，召唤符文都已经画好了。你必须把它们全部摧毁。"
G["The sun burned me bad, but I got my hands around his slimy neck."]="太阳严重地灼伤了我，但我的双手终于抓住了他黏滑的脖子。"
G["The sun eclipses. Darkness crawls through earth and ash. The seas are as blood..."]="太阳失去光芒。黑暗与灰烬覆盖大地。海洋如血般鲜红……"
G["The sun gate must be stabilized. Focus your energies!"]="太阳之门必须稳定下来。集中你们的能量！"
G["The sun has set on this mortal world, fools. Make peace with your end, for the hour of Twilight falls."]="凡人世界的夕阳已经落幕，平静接受你的末日，暮光的时刻来临了。"
G["The sun has set on this mortal world, fools. Make peace with your end, for the hour of twilight falls!"]="凡人世界的夕阳已经落幕。平静接受你的末日，暮光的时刻来临了！"
G["The sun of life will set forever, as light gives way to eternal night! (Oblivion looms! It calls!)"]="生命之日将永远落下，空无之夜即将降临。(毁灭迫近了!它在呼唤!)"
G["The sun still shines upon you, $C, but you are no Sun Cleric."]="El sol sigue brillando sobre ti, $C, pero ya no eres un Sacerdote Solar."
G["The sun... shines through..."]="阳光……照耀……"
G["The surface of the %s begins to bubble."]="%s的表面开始冒泡。"
G["The surface quakes..."]="地面在动荡……"
G["The surrounding air crackles with energy...."]="周围的空气因为充斥着强大的能量而发出“噼啪”声……"
G["The survey team has done well. This is an ideal deep-water port."]="勘察组干得不错。这是一处深水良港。"
G["The swamp conceals many things."]="沼泽中埋藏着许多秘密。"
G["The swamp was horrible! I was so... so... scared!"]="沼泽地很恐怖！我很……很……害怕！"
G["The swarm is eager to feed."]="虫群将吞噬你们的躯体。"
G["The swarm is the blade that will cut through our enemies!"]="虫群将像利刃般刺穿我们的敌人！"
G["The swarm of the elements shall overtake you!"]="元素之潮会击垮你们！"
G["The swarm shall darken the skies with our numbers! We shall cast eternal night upon this land!"]="浩荡的虫群会遮天蔽日！永恒的黑夜将吞噬这片土地！"
G["The swarm shall overtake you!"]="虫群会吞噬你！"
G["The swarm will consume you!"]="虫群将吞噬你们！"
G["The sweet irony -- Stormwind forces cut down in defense of their city, only to rise and fight alongside the Brotherhood as instruments of destruction."]="真是讽刺——暴风城在紧缩防御，仅仅是为了对付小小的迪菲亚兄弟会。"
G["The swell of souls will not be abated! You only delay the inevitable."]="灵魂的汹涌不会被削弱！一切都只是徒劳。"
G["The swoop egg is destroyed..."]="猛鹫的蛋被毁了……"
G["The sword has pierced his infernal armor! Strike him down!"]="剑刃刺穿了他的地狱火盔甲！快击败他！"
G["The sword isn't a tool, it's an extension of you. I expect better!"]="剑不是工具，它是你的延伸。我希望你们能做得更好！"
G["The symbols on the tablet are carefully transcribed..."]="石板上的符号被小心翼翼地拓了下来……"
G["The tabard was pink when I got it back, Buckets. Pink! Think about that..."]="水桶，我的战袍被染成了粉红色。粉红色！你说这……"
G["The tablet has the confirmation we need, just as I thought. Now, we have to use this information to draw out and defeat this Anzu before he can do any more damage to the Emerald Dream!"]="石板应证了我先前的猜想。我们必须利用这条信息，在安苏对翡翠梦境造成更大的破坏之前，将他召唤到这个世界中，然后击败他！"
G["The tag on this present reads: \"For ages 10 and up.\""]="La etiqueta de este regalo dice: \"Para mayores de 10.\""
G["The tag on this present reads: \"For ages 20 and up.\""]="La etiqueta de este regalo dice: \"Para mayores de 20.\""
G["The tag on this present reads: \"For ages 40 and up.\""]="La etiqueta de este regalo dice: \"Para mayores de 40.\""
G["The tailor Keelen is always seeking more curious students to teach his delicate craft. His shop is somewhat difficult to uncover at first, but it's just north of the auction house in the Bazaar. You'll find him on the lower level of the building."]="裁缝基伦一直在寻找好奇的学生来传授他那精巧的手艺。他的店有点不好找，就在花园街市的拍卖行的北面。你可以在那座建筑的底层找到他。"
G["The tailor here's Josef Gregorian. He's in the Magic Quarter on the inner ring."]="这里的裁缝叫乔瑟夫·格里高利。他就在魔法区的内环区域。"
G["The taking of Crusaders' Pinnacle is only the first step in a long and dangerous journey. There is much left to do before we are able to assault Icecrown Citadel.\n\nIt can only be possible with help from you and others like you, hero."]="Tomar el Pináculo de los Cruzados solo es el primer paso de un viaje largo y peligroso. Aún queda mucho por hacer antes de que podamos asaltar la Ciudadela de la Corona de Hielo.\n\nSolo será posible con tu ayuda y la de otros como tú, $ghéroe:heroína;."
G["The tale of ol' Duncan is a sad one, I'm afraid.  I used to be captain of me own ship, ye know?\n\nOne more demotion and I'll be a swabbie again.  I don't think I could take the humiliation."]="恐怕关于老邓肯的故事只会让人徒增伤心。知道吗？我曾经是一名真真正正的船长。\n\n但现在只要再降一级，我就又要去洗甲板了。我可没办法承受这样的耻辱。"
G["The taskmaster's dead!  Quick, Dreghoods!  Run!"]="工头死了！兄弟们，快跑啊！"
G["The taste of defeat... so strange and unfamiliar. Thank you for keeping me humble."]="失败的滋味……很奇怪，也很陌生。谢谢你让我有了新体验。"
G["The tauren are the most majestic of hunters."]="牛头人是最伟大的猎手。"
G["The tauren have made themselves useful. Look - this one is a shaman."]="牛头人都多才多艺。看——这位就是一名萨满。"
G["The tauren of Thunder Bluff cheer for $n."]="雷霆崖的牛头人为$n而欢呼。"
G["The tauren says, \"That's a load of bull.\""]="Y el tauren dice, \"No te lo crees ni tú.\""
G["The techniques he has suggested have been most effective in preparing the troops."]="他所提出的方法一直对组建军队很有效果。"
G["The teleporter is ready! Let's get out of here!"]="传送器准备就绪！让我们离开这儿！"
G["The temperature is 12 degrees Kraklenheit. How exciting."]="温度是12克氏度。真令人激动。"
G["The temperature is 122 degrees Kraklenheit."]="温度是122克氏度。"
G["The temperature is 564 degrees Kraklenheit."]="温度是564克氏度。"
G["The temperature is 9280 degrees Kraklenheit! That's HOT!"]="温度是9280克氏度！真热！"
G["The temperature is... not hot enough!"]="温度的数值是……反正还不够高！"
G["The temple has been infiltrated! Alarm! ALARM!"]="寺院遭到了入侵！警报！警报！"
G["The temple is breached, masters! ALARM!"]="寺院被入侵了，大师！警报！"
G["The temple is under siege. We need you outside, now!"]="神殿被包围了。我们需要你出去，马上！"
G["The temple must not fall!"]="寺院绝不能沦陷！"
G["The temple walls have been breached!"]="寺院的围墙已经被攻破了！"
G["The temple will be ours!"]="寺庙是我们的！"
G["The temple will fall! You cannot stop my forces!"]="寺院必将陷落！你们休想阻止我的大军！"
G["The temple will not fall!"]="寺庙决不会陷落！"
G["The tenacity of the wolf ancient is the stuff of legend.\n\nLearn from his example, $c, and victory is all but certain."]="狼魂先祖的坚忍战力充满传奇色彩。\n\n以他为榜样吧，$c，胜利一定就在前方等着你。"
G["The terrace was not meant for your kind!"]="这平台不属于你们！"
G["The terrace... must not... fall..."]="平台……绝不能……陷落……"
G["The terrified bear cub refuses to leave the tree!"]="那只受惊的小熊崽不肯离开那棵树！"
G["The thane spits as the first of his champions falls."]="当第一个勇士倒下时，领主吐了口唾沫。"
G["The theory behind it is that we completely destroy you with a massive explosion wherever you are and send those particles through a dimensional rip and then re-implode you at the machine here.   Instant Transport!    It might not work ALL the time, but what kind of goblin engineer are you!   If survival was your first priority you could never be a real Goblin Engineer!\nHere is the recipe you will need to make the Dimensional Ripper and try it out!"]="这个机器所依据的理论就是通过一次大爆破将你完全摧毁，然后把你的粒子通过空间裂隙传送到某个地点，再通过反爆破模块将你在目的地重组。这是即时的传送！它并不是百分之百有效的，但是你是个杰出的地精技师！如果你把性命看得比发明创造更重要，那么你永远都无法成为一个真正的地精技师！\n这是制作空间撕裂器所需的图纸，你一定要试试看！"
G["The things I do for the Alliance..."]="我是为了联盟才做的……"
G["The things I have done... such horrible things...\n\n<Tarsis begins to sob.>"]="Las cosas que he hecho... cosas horribles...\n\n<Tarsis comienza a sollozar.>"
G["The things I show you now must never be spoken of outside Voltarus. The world shall come to know our secret soon enough!"]="我向你展示的东西绝对不能在沃尔塔鲁斯以外提起。我们的秘密很快就能揭晓了！"
G["The things I would teach you would turn your brain to jelly! Come back when you've learned sufficiently!"]="我要教你的东西会让你头脑混乱的！当你学到足够的知识后再来找我吧！"
G["The things I've seen... so beautiful...  if only I were a poet..."]="我看到的东西……是如此漂亮……如果我是个诗人……"
G["The things we love destroy us every time, $c, remember that."]="我们所珍爱的东西总会毁掉我们自己，$c，记住这句话。"
G["The third lock of the Thrice-Locked cage clicks and falls to the ground. The cage opens!"]="三重锁的囚笼上的第三道锁“喀啦”一声掉在了地上。囚笼打开了！"
G["The thousandth challenger cheated."]="第一千个挑战者使诈了。"
G["The threads that holds together the abominations of Stratholme are highly sought after by artisan craftsmen: Extremely resilient - nearly unbreakable."]="工匠们都热衷于寻找缝合斯坦索姆憎恶的线：特别是有弹力的——几乎不会断裂的线。"
G["The threat be over! $n be savin' us all!"]="威胁结束了！是$n解救了我们！"
G["The threat to Silap Inua is known as those who would cage it. They will be called the blue-scaled ones."]="世间唯有一种生物能束缚“希拉伊努亚”，由此引发了诸多祸端。他们被称为蓝龙一族。"
G["The three fissures opened by the mortals of this region must be silenced. The earth hears and sees what we do and will continue to interfere with our efforts if the way is not closed."]="我们必须设法封锁凡人在这片区域开启的三条裂隙。大地能知晓我们的所作所为。如果不能关闭地表的裂缝，它就会继续妨碍我们的宏伟计划。"
G["The thrill of the hunt, right lads?!"]="打猎很刺激，对不对，小伙子们？！"
G["The thundering depths call to you..."]="雷鸣的深渊正在召唤你……"
G["The tide cannot be stopped!"]="滚滚洪流，势不可挡！"
G["The tide has brought me a story. Listen, and be enlightened."]="潮涨潮落，我来讲个故事吧。看看你们能否有所领悟。"
G["The tide has turned? I've got to get back to the fight!"]="情势逆转了？我得回去作战！"
G["The tides do as Elune commands."]="潮汐也服从艾露恩的命令。"
G["The tides of war have come again. From the cold north, the Lich King's necropolises have laid siege to our lands.  He sends flying necropolises to invade across the world."]="战争之潮再度降临。巫妖王的浮空城正在从北方向我们的陆地一路侵袭而来。他的浮空要塞正在进犯世界各地。"
G["The tides shall wash away the entire Darkspear Tribe."]="潮水将会冲走整个暗矛部落。"
G["The tiger matriarch appears! Prove yourself in combat!"]="猛虎女王出现了！在战斗中证明你自己吧！"
G["The time I spent binding that, WASTED!"]="我花了那么多时间来束缚它，全浪费了！"
G["The time for celebration is done."]="庆祝时间已经过了。"
G["The time for conquest approaches quickly."]="我们征服一切的时刻即将降临！"
G["The time for practice is over! Show me what you have learned!"]="练习时间到此为止！都拿出真本事来！"
G["The time for the Crusade is now!"]="北伐军的时代到来了！"
G["The time for us to rise and strike at the fel orcs that remain is now! Do this for your Warchief! Do this for the Horde!"]="决战的时刻到了！让我们拿起武器，消灭残余的邪兽人势力吧！为了你们的酋长而战！为了部落而战！"
G["The time for vengeance draws near."]="复仇的日子即将到来了。"
G["The time for war is almost upon us, $c! Both the Horde and the Alliance have finished with their preparations. All of our war materiel is being shipped to Silithus as we speak. I'd expect it all to arrive within $2113w days. When all is assembled there, the one who has completed the arduous task of reassembling the Scepter of the Shifting Sands will bang it against the Scarab Gong and open the gates to Ahn'Qiraj. Then battle shall be joined as has not been seen in ages!\n\nLok'tar Ogar!"]="战争犹如箭在弦上，$c！部落和联盟都做好了充分的准备。所有的战争物资都将如约运往希利苏斯。预计货物将在$2113w天内抵达。当军队准备就绪时，那位完成修复流沙节杖的艰巨任务的英雄将敲响甲虫之台上的铜锣，打开安其拉之门。一场旷世之战也将随即拉开序幕！\n\n部落万岁！"
G["The time for war is almost upon us, $c! Both the Horde and the Alliance have finished with their preparations. All of our war materiel is being shipped to Silithus as we speak. I'd expect the last of it to arrive within a day. When all is assembled there, the one who has completed the arduous task of reassembling the Scepter of the Shifting Sands will bang it against the Scarab Gong and open the gates to Ahn'Qiraj. Then battle shall be joined as has not been seen in ages!\n\nLok'tar Ogar!"]="战争犹如箭在弦上，$c！部落和联盟都做好了充分的准备。所有的战争物资都将如约运往希利苏斯。预计货物将在1天内抵达。当军队准备就绪时，那位完成修复流沙节杖的艰巨任务的英雄将敲响甲虫之台上的铜锣，打开安其拉之门。一场旷世之战也将随即拉开序幕！\n\n部落万岁！"
G["The time for your destruction has finally come, Dimensius!"]="你的末日终于来临了，迪门修斯！"
G["The time has come for Horde and Alliance to look towards Northrend and the invasion of the Lich King. In recent days, territories across Kalimdor and the Eastern Kingdoms have come under attack. Will you take up arms to save your land from destruction at their hands?"]="部落与联盟远征诺森德，抵御巫妖王的入侵的时刻已经降临。这些日子依赖，卡利姆多和东部王国都遭到了攻击。你愿意拿起武器，保卫自己的家园吗？"
G["The time has come for Noblegarden once again! Time to thank the Light for the rebirth of the world."]="复活节又到啦！在这个节日里，我们要感谢圣光让世界重生。"
G["The time has come for me to once again make my wares available to all who travel near Sentinel Hill! Come one, come all!"]="走过路过不要错过啊，我这里卖的都是价廉物美的好东西！大家都过来看看啊！"
G["The time has come for my husband, our king, to rejoin us. Together we will scour this world of its unworthy infestation!"]="是时候了，我的丈夫，我们的国王很快就能重新回到我们身边啦。我要和他一起铲除世间的蝼蚁！"
G["The time has come to act. We must decide how to deal with the Scourge before it consumes us."]="该采取行动了。我们必须在天灾军团摧毁我们之前解决他们。"
G["The time has come to destroy the Vector Coil!"]="摧毁矢量感应器的时机到了！"
G["The time has come to face Illidan, $n.  Are you ready?"]="是面对伊利丹的时候了，$n。你准备好了吗？"
G["The time has come to make things right. To disband your treacherous kingdom of murderers and thieves. Putress was the first strike. Many more will come."]="匡扶正义的时刻到了。我要摧毁这个满是凶手和窃贼的王国！普特雷斯只是个开始。好戏刚刚开始！"
G["The time has come to prove your worth as a wing man, $n. Take this beacon and plant it dead center of the Snowfall graveyard. Defend it until my fleet arrives.\n\n<Mulverick salutes.>"]="现在是你证明自己实力的时候了，$n。带上这个信号灯，将它插在雪落墓地的正中心。在我的空军赶到之前好好保护它。\n\n<穆维里克敬礼。>"
G["The time has come to shatter this clockwork universe forever! Let us no longer be slaves of the hourglass! I warn you: those who do not embrace this greater path shall become victims of its passing!"]="是时候毁灭这个秩序的世界了！让我们永远不再受到时间沙漏的制约！我警告你们：不愿迎接这一伟大时刻的蠢货，都将变成它的牺牲品！"
G["The time has come!  March onward, and bring doom to the frightened denizens of this blasted land!"]="时间到了！进军，将毁灭带给这片被诅咒的土地，带给那些怯懦的生灵！"
G["The time has come! Gul'dan, order your warlocks to double their efforts! Moments from now the gateway will open and your Horde will be released upon this ripe, unsuspecting world!"]="时机成熟了！古尔丹，命令你的术士们加倍努力！用不了多久，传送门就会打开，你的部落将在这个富饶而毫无防备的世界中所向披靡！"
G["The time has come! The moment is at hand!"]="时机来临了，终于等到这一刻了！"
G["The time has come, Guse. You fly again!"]="就是现在，古斯。你要再次展翅高飞！"
G["The time has come, brothers and sisters, to stop this injustice!"]="时机已经到来了，兄弟姐妹们，我们要让正义得伸！"
G["The time has come, brothers. We must not let the enemy advance through Frost Dagger Pass. Some of us will surely perish, but would any of you shy away from this duty? This honor? Onward! For the Horde!"]="兄弟们，是时候了。我们必须阻止敌人通过霜刀小径。我们中必然会有人在战斗中牺牲，但是你们有谁想要逃避这个职责吗？逃避这个荣耀的职责？前进吧！为了部落而战！"
G["The time has come, my $c friend, to talk of other things. Of crabs and seas and turtles with trees..."]="Mi $gquerido amigo:querida amiga; $c, ha llegado el momento de hablar de otras cosas. De cangrejos, de los mares, de tortugas a lo lejos..."
G["The time has come, my $g brother : sister; in arms, to take back the night from the Scourge!"]="时机成熟了，我的$g兄弟:姐妹;们，武装起来，从亡灵天灾手中夺回属于我们的夜晚！"
G["The time has come, my $r friend, to talk of other things. Of hozen and grummles and how my tummy rumbles..."]="Mi $gquerido amigo:querida amiga; $r, ha llegado el momento de hablar de otras cosas. De monos, de grúmel, de sombreros con forma de conos..."
G["The time has come, my little captive... word has come back from your father."]="时间到了，我的小俘虏……你父亲那里传来了消息。"
G["The time has come, my little friend, to talk of other things. Of mogu and trolls and jinyu river tolls..."]="Mi $gpequeño amigo:pequeña amiga;, ha llegado el momento de hablar de otras cosas. De mogu, de trols, de jinyu y de gnolls..."
G["The time has come, my silly friend, to talk of other things. Of yetis and yaks and random shark attacks..."]="Mi $gcurioso amigo:curiosa amiga;, ha llegado el momento de hablar de otras cosas. De yetis, de yaks, y de muchas cosas más..."
G["The time has come, soldiers! Godfrey lies just ahead! Have no mercy! We fight-"]="时间到了，士兵们！高弗雷就在前面！不要有任何怜悯之心。我们要……"
G["The time has come.  Strike down every creature that stands in the way of the clans!"]="时机已经成熟。那些挡在氏族前进道路上的家伙们，让他们统统去死！"
G["The time has now come for you to face our enemies on the field of battle. As I speak our brothers and sisters fight to fend off the forces of Kil'jaeden on the isle of Quel'Danas."]="现在是让你上战场面对我们敌人的时刻了。正如我所说的那样，我们的兄弟姐妹们正在奎尔丹纳斯岛上为抵挡基尔加丹而战斗着。"
G["The time is nearly here! We shall sweep across this land, sacrificing all who defy us!"]="时间就要到了！我们要横扫这片土地，让所有敢于挑战我们的生灵都成为祭品！"
G["The time is now! Leave none standing!"]="机会来了！一个活口都不要留下！"
G["The time may soon come when the kaldorei require the knowledge and skill we have to offer."]="卡多雷族人恐怕很快就会需要我们的知识与技艺。"
G["The time of awakening must be near, but they have not yet come for me. Why do the Klaxxi wait?"]="觉醒的时刻就要到来，但他们还没有来找我。卡拉克西还在等什么？"
G["The time of judgement is nigh. In your heart, you know justice is the only true path."]="审判之日即将来临。你深知正义才是唯一正确的道路。"
G["The time of our retribution is at hand! Let darkness reign in the hearts of our enemies!"]="我们复仇的时刻到了！让敌人的内心被黑暗吞噬吧！"
G["The time of the Argent Crusade is now!"]="银色北伐军的时代已经来临！"
G["The time of the Raven is nigh, but yours will end here!"]="乌鸦之神的时代即将来临，而你的末日就在眼前！"
G["The time of the dragons is over..."]="巨龙的时代即将终结……"
G["The time of your reckoning is upon us."]="我们迎来了对你进行清算的时刻。"
G["The time to feed is now, minion. Wake!"]="开饭的时间到了。醒来吧！"
G["The time to strike at the head of the beast will soon be upon us! Focus your anger and hatred on his minions!"]="攻击这头野兽要害的时刻即将来临！将你们的愤怒和仇恨倾泻到它的爪牙身上！"
G["The time to strike at the remaining blood elves of Tempest Keep is now. Take arms and let A'dal's song of battle empower you!"]="现在，攻击风暴要塞内的残余血精灵的时刻已经来临了。拿起武器！让阿达尔的战歌激励你们吧！"
G["The time to strike is at hand. Terminate Icarius."]="进攻的时刻即将到来。消灭伊喀琉斯。"
G["The time to take back Gilneas City is at hand."]="夺回吉尔尼斯城的时刻已经到了。"
G["The times we live in are as fickle as the shifting winds, $c. The ground itself quakes and cries out in anguish. We must remain resolute or we ourselves will be engulfed by the turmoil."]="我们所处的这个时期就像风云般变化无常，$c。大地正在痛苦中战栗，哀嚎。我们必须坚定地站稳脚跟，才能避免被这股混乱的漩涡吞噬。"
G["The timeway collapsed with five of our agents inside."]="时间流崩溃时，我们有五个特派员被困在里面。"
G["The timeways are currently ranked in order from least catastrophic to most catastrophic. Note that they are all classified as catastrophic, meaning that any single one of these timeways collapsing would mean that your world would end. We only classify them in such a way so that the heroes and adventurers that are sent here know which timeway best suits their abilities."]="时间流目前是按照“小灾难”至“大灾难”的顺序排列着的。注意它们全部都是“灾难”，这意味着任何一个时间流的毁灭都会终结你们的世界，没有区别。我们把它们这样分类，只是为了让那些被派到这里来的英雄们和冒险者们知道自己的能力适合处理哪个时间流中的事务。"
G["The tinkerer's craft for you is it?  No doubt ye'll want to go see Springspindle Fizzlegear in Tinker Town.  \nJust head east from the gates of Ironforge, or follow the sound of the explosions."]="¿El oficio del hojalatero entonces? Sin duda, tienes que ir a ver a Muello Saltarín en Ciudad Manitas. \n\nDirígete al este de las puertas de Forjaz, o sigue el sonido de las explosiones."
G["The tireless efforts of the Shado-Pan are the only thing keeping this land from being ravaged by the mantid swarm. We do not ask thanks for this, but now we are faced with a time when we can no longer accomplish this task alone."]="影踪派的不懈戍守，是这片土地至今仍未被螳螂妖大军席卷的唯一理由。我们不求感谢，可我们眼下再也无力独自完成这项任务了。"
G["The titan Waygate is almost opened. We will assist the Tol'vir to reconfigure Uldum and bring about the end of all life on Azeroth!"]="泰坦界门即将完全开启。我们将协助托维尔重塑奥丹姆，毁灭艾泽拉斯的一切生灵！"
G["The titans did not create life overnight.  The process was gradual and required a great deal of experimentation and iteration.\n\nIt is for that reason that highly protected places such as Sholazar Basin exist.\n\nTo ensure the safety of their experimentation sites, the titans created a defense mechanism.  Its destructive force is unparalleled however, and I will reveal no more unless you swear your fealty to my cause."]="泰坦并非在一夜之间就创造出了所有生命。整个过程相当漫长，其中涉及大量的试验与叠代。\n\n因此，造物主看中了索拉查盆地，并将它改造成戒备森严的实验场所。\n\n为了确保安全，泰坦还制造出一台机械防御装置，它拥有无可匹敌的破坏力。除非你发誓对我效忠，否则我拒绝透露更多的机密。"
G["The title is misleading. I'm really a very nice person once you get to know me."]="我的头衔可能有会让人误解我。与我相处久了，你就会知道我其实是一个很好相处的人。"
G["The title of this book reads with a handwritten flourish: Maureen Dalson's Diary."]="这本书的标题是手写体：莫琳·达尔松的日记。"
G["The toils of the living never cease to amaze. Your numbers are limited, and with every battle they dwindle further. You will not live to see the end!"]="活人的努力总是让人惊讶。但你们的数量太有限了，而且这数量还时刻在减少。你们无法活着看到结局的！"
G["The tools are weak!"]="这些工具太差劲了！"
G["The tools are weak? You're weak! I've been in this business fifty years."]="工具差劲？是你们太差劲了！我干这行已经50年了！"
G["The torture of a thousand screaming deaths awaits..."]="你将被痛苦地折磨致死……"
G["The tortured spirits of your ancestors cling to you, screaming in silence. Apparently they are quite numerous."]="先祖们饱受折磨的灵魂紧攫住你，无声地尖啸着。他们显然数量众多。"
G["The totem has finished taking its sample!"]="图腾获取样品结束！"
G["The totem is halfway finished with taking its sample."]="图腾正在获取样品。"
G["The totem is made, $n."]="图腾做好了，$n。"
G["The totem is made.  The well may now be cleansed."]="图腾做好了，现在你可以去净化水井了。"
G["The touch of creation... and destruction."]="创造……与毁灭之触。"
G["The tour guide will be along soon..."]="向导很快就到……"
G["The tournament's seneschal has asked us to shoulder some of the burden of running the competition now that the coliseum is finished. Those who have earned the right to stand as champions and who have proven themselves in our eyes are asked to assist with these duties."]="现在，竞技场终于落成了。而锦标赛的管理者也请求我们负责管理在那里面举行的竞技活动。而我们只会邀请那些曾经在我们面前证明过自身实力的真正勇士帮助我们完成这些工作。"
G["The tower is just there. I will cover you from the sky. Be quick."]="塔就在那边。我会在空中掩护你。动作快。"
G["The tower is no place for the uninitiated!"]="不是我们的成员，就休想踏足这座塔！"
G["The tower reinforcements will not abandon their post!"]="塔楼里的援军拒绝撤离岗位！"
G["The tower's defenses are at their weakest right now. The patrollers, sentries, lookouts, and even Gallywix himself are all infected and highly vulnerable to your special abilities and attacks.\n\nI want to see you enter that tower and when you exit, I want to see you covered in the blood of your enemies, the head of Grand Foreman Puzik Gallywix in your hands, and the last of that poison in your pack. Take what you recover to Shenthul. He'll know what to do... I hope."]="Las defensas de la torre están en su momento más bajo ahora mismo. Los patrulleros, los centinelas, los oteadores e incluso el propio Gallywix están infectados y son altamente vulnerables a tus habilidades especiales y ataques.\n\nQuiero ver cómo entras en esa torre y, cuando salgas, quiero verte cubierto con la sangre de tus enemigos, la cabeza del gran supervisor Puzik Gallywix, en tus manos y lo que queda de ese veneno en tu mochila. Lleva a Shenthul lo que recuperes. Él sabrá qué hacer... Eso espero."
G["The towers and bunkers in Alterac Valley are vital strategic locales.  If we control a tower, then our troops can fire great distances from it."]="奥特兰克山谷的哨塔和碉堡都是至关重要的战略性据点。要是我们能控制哨塔，就能展开远程攻击啦。"
G["The town still burns, a cleansing fire!  Time is short, I'll soon retire!"]="小镇仍在燃烧，看这净化的火焰！啊，时间过得真快，我要撤退了！"
G["The town... demolished! We couldn't stop them."]="城镇……被毁了！我们无法阻止他们。"
G["The toxin is ready, $n."]="毒素准备好了，$n。"
G["The tracks are smeared, almost as if the creature drags its feet."]="这些脚印都有涂抹的痕迹，就好象这只生物是拖着脚行走一样。"
G["The trail leads to the northeast.  Follow me if you would."]="这些足迹延向了东北方。请跟着我。"
G["The trainees will be quite disappointed if I don't get all of these kegs back together for them. What a mess..."]="如果我不能把这些桶运回去，学徒们会很失望的。真是糟透了……"
G["The training you gave us is paying off, sire!"]="你对我们的训练是卓有成效的，陛下！"
G["The traitor helped planned this!  He helped to massacre them."]="那个叛徒策划了一切！他是这场屠杀的帮凶。"
G["The translocator hums, awaiting your command."]="传送器发出嗡嗡的声响，等待着你的指令。"
G["The transporter glimmers with a crystalline light."]="传送器闪出水晶般的光芒。"
G["The trap emits a raptor-like screech!"]="这个陷阱发出一阵猛禽尖啸般的声音！"
G["The trees are dying. Kypari Vor is already dead... a victim of the sha. It will never again produce amber. It barely even looks like a tree anymore.\n\nThe few amber-producing trees that remain are either being overharvested by the mantid, or in danger of succumbing to sha. Either way, no more sap means no more sapmasters. At which point, I'd have to return to my old job."]="大树正在消亡。凯帕圣树·沃尔已经死了……沦为了邪煞的牺牲品。它再也不会生出琥珀。甚至连外形都不再像是一棵树。\n\n仅剩的几棵仍在生成琥珀的大树也面临着被螳螂妖过度开采的困境，或是处在邪煞的威胁之下。不论如何，一旦没有了树脂，也就不会再有树脂大师。到那时，我就只能重操旧业了。"
G["The trees here are more beautiful than any I have seen in my travels."]="这里的树是我这一路上所见过最漂亮的。"
G["The trees here are more beautiful than even the ones in the southern jungle."]="这里的树比我在南部丛林见过的都更漂亮。"
G["The trees here in the Highlands are made of stout wood. And some of them... stone. I don't pretend to understand.\n\nWe've got diamond-bladed shredders to harvest the stuff, but the Alliance keeps whacking them."]="这片高地上的树木质都很坚硬。它们之中有一些……甚至是石头。我也不明白这究竟是为什么。\n\n为了砍伐这些木材，我们在伐木机上装备了钻石刀刃。但联盟却总是在破坏那些伐木机。"
G["The trial begins!"]="试炼开始！"
G["The tribe thanks you for your deeds, $n."]="我们整个部落都十分感激你善行，$n。"
G["The tribe will prevail!"]="部族必胜！"
G["The tribes have assembled - ye face not one force, but the combined might of all of the troll empire! The hand of Zul will span all the continents of Azeroth once again! An ye lesser races will know pain!"]="各部族已团结起来——你们面对的不是单一势力，而是整个巨魔帝国！祖尔之手将重新掌握艾泽拉斯！你们这些下等种族大难临头了！"
G["The trick to dealing with pirate hozen is to have the element of surprise."]="对付猢狲海盗的秘诀就在于出其不意。"
G["The trick to using evasion is realizing that the best fifteen seconds of your life are often the last."]="使用闪避技能的诀窍就是认识到你生命中最辉煌的十五秒往往是你最后的十五秒。"
G["The trick, Wakener, is to be like water. Do not resist your enemy's force - simply flow with it. Let his blows drift past you. Then IMPALE HIM."]="唤醒者，秘诀就如同流水之道。不要与敌人的力量硬碰硬——而是要以柔克刚，让他的重拳擦身而过。这时候，再对他还以颜色。"
G["The trickster Mage-Lord Urom protects the third ring.  He will appear alone and defenseless, but do not be fooled by appearances!  Urom is a powerful conjurer who commands a menagerie of Phantasmal creatures.  Seek him out above."]="狡猾的法师领主伊洛姆守护着第三道环。表面上他显得孤立无援，但那不过是欺骗敌人的假象！伊洛姆是位强大的咒术师，能召唤各种幽灵生物为他作战。去上面找他吧。"
G["The trickster Mage-Lord Urom protects the third ring.  He will appear alone and defenseless, but do not be fooled by appearances!  Urom is a powerful conjurer who commands a menagerie of Phantasmal creatures.  Seek him out above.\nI can grant you the power to call upon a drake from the red flight.  Speak to Eternos or Verdisa if you prefer to draw on the power of the bronze or the green."]="狡猾的法师领主伊洛姆守护着第三道环。表面上他显得孤立无援，但那不过是欺骗敌人的假象！伊洛姆是位强大的咒术师，能召唤各种幽灵生物为他作战。去上面找他吧。\n我能赋予你召唤红玉幼龙协同作战的能力。当然，如果你希望借助青铜龙或是绿龙的力量，就去找伊特努斯或是沃尔蒂萨谈谈。"
G["The tricky part is, he was frozen in jade while dueling a mogu that history names \"The Jade Warlord.\""]="El problema era que fue atrapado en jade, en pleno combate contra un mogu que conocemos como \"el señor de la guerra de jade\"."
G["The trillium you brought me must be refined for our purposes."]="先把你带来的延极矿精炼一下。"
G["The triumphant $g hero : heroine; returns!\n\nYou haven't seen Magmatooth around, have you?\n\n<The initiate looks worried.>"]="¡$gEl héroe:La heroína; triunfante ha vuelto!\n\nNo habrás visto a Dientemagma por ahí, ¿no?\n\n<El iniciado parece preocupado.>"
G["The troggs are retaking the Irondeep Mine!"]="穴居人重新占领了深铁矿洞！"
G["The troggs...they never stop coming.  Die trogg!  Die!"]="穴居人……好像永远也杀不光。该死的穴居人！去死吧！"
G["The trolls are acting strangely, $n.  I don't like it.  I don't like it one bit."]="$n，那些巨魔可真奇怪。我不喜欢这样，一点也不喜欢。"
G["The trolls here are quite accepting of my kind. After all, they spoke to the dead for centuries before the Forsaken even existed.\n\nIt's good for business."]="这里的巨魔很能接受像我这样的人。毕竟，在被遗忘者还没出现时，他们就已经与死者交流了几个世纪。\n\n这是个很好的契机。"
G["The trolls of Stranglethorn don't take too kindly to us Darkspear.  I'm not afraid of no Bloodscalp or Skullsplitter, but still... Grom'gol's high walls make me feel safe."]="荆棘谷的巨魔对我们暗矛部族并不怎么友好。我不怕那些血顶或劈颅，可是……格罗姆高的高墙令我感到安全。"
G["The trolls of the Sen'jin Village begin a chant to celebrate $n."]="森金村的巨魔开始颂唱歌曲，为$n而庆祝。"
G["The true Horde cannot be STOPPED!"]="正统部落是……不可阻挡的！"
G["The true Horde will triumph."]="正统部落必胜。"
G["The true Horde, the pure Horde, cannot be stopped!"]="真正的部落，纯粹的部落，是不可阻挡的！"
G["The true Horde... will prevail."]="真正的部落……会获胜的。"
G["The true believers have lived in shame since the day our treacherous cousins in Skettis stole the book from us, shattered its tablet, and buried the fragments in their wretched city!\n\nPray that the raven will choose you to restore it, my son. Be faithful and remember always the prophecy, \"From the dreams of his enemies shall the raven spring forth into the world.\""]="¡Los verdaderos creyentes hemos vivido avergonzados desde el día que nuestros traidores primos de Skettis nos robaron el libro, rompieron la tablilla y enterraron los fragmentos en su despreciable ciudad!\n\nReza para que el Cuervo te elija para restaurarlo, hijo mío. Ten fe y recuerda la profecía: \"De los sueños de sus enemigos surgirá el Cuervo en el mundo\""
G["The true crusader is more than just a hero in the battle against evil... he is an exemplar, a rallier to the cause, a champion in the eyes of all his people.\n\nAs High Crusader, it is my duty to task such men and women with worthy quests."]="真正的十字军绝不仅仅是在战场上对抗邪恶……十字军是一个榜样，一面正义的旗帜，是大众心中一名坚不可摧的守护者。\n\n作为高阶十字军，我的责任就是向这样的战士们分派各种值得他们去完成的任务。"
G["The true horde will rule all of Azeroth."]="真正的部落将统治全艾泽拉斯。"
G["The true master has emerged victorious."]="真正的大师已经告捷。"
G["The truth shall set you free. Like us, you will be with IT forever!"]="这真相将给予你自由。很快，你就会成为我们的一员！"
G["The tub needs more water!"]="桶里需要加水！"
G["The tumultuous nature of the great waterways of Azeroth and Draenor are a direct result of tormented water spirits."]="被折磨的水之魂在艾泽拉斯世界和德拉诺世界的水道中躁动……"
G["The turmoil in Kun-Lai Summit has uprooted many innocents. They will find shelter within our gates."]="昆莱山的混乱局势使得许多无辜者背井离乡。他们会在我们的山谷中找到安身之处。"
G["The tusked people call it Silap Inua."]="海象人氏族称其为“希拉伊努亚”。"
G["The twists and turns of Orgrimmar are designed to thwart invaders. Can you imagine how quickly one of those puny gnomes would get lost in here? Ha! If it was lucky, I'd track it down and keep it as a pet."]="奥格瑞玛地形迂回曲折，能有效地阻止入侵者。你能想象这些矮小的侏儒在多么短的时间内就迷失方向吗？哈哈！如果足够幸运的话，我会追踪到他们，将他们变成我的宠物。"
G["The two of us against the vast undead sea."]="我们两个对阵茫茫的亡灵大军。"
G["The two paths of sha corruption in Dread Wastes both seem to be in very straight lines.  I wonder where they are heading?  Curious."]="煞魔侵蚀恐惧废土的两条路线似乎就是两条笔直的线。我很好奇它们会通向哪里？真是太奇怪了。"
G["The two students close their eyes and bow their heads."]="这两位学生闭上了双眼，又低下了头。"
G["The tyranny of iron is at an end!"]="钢铁的暴政到头了！"
G["The unblemished heart of the guardian must be secured to show defiance and strength. Jealous Zim'Rhuk keeps those who harbor it."]="唯有完美的守卫者徽记能传达挑衅的意图。拥有这颗徽记的守卫者就在戒备森严的希姆鲁克。"
G["The undead are a taint upon Azeroth!  Every one of you creatures deserves to be destroyed!"]="亡灵是艾泽拉斯的腐蚀之源！你们这些家伙都该被毁灭！"
G["The undead are approaching.  Attack!"]="亡灵在靠近，进攻！"
G["The undead are upon us!"]="亡灵冲我们来了！"
G["The undead shall feast on your soul, $n."]="亡灵将会以你的灵魂为食，$n。"
G["The underside of this table is REALLY dirty!"]="这张桌子的反面真的很脏！"
G["The undying flames are all that remain of this sacred place. I sense much anger here...a seething rage, barely held in check. Be on your guard."]="这片圣地只剩下了不灭的烈焰。我能在这里感受到愤怒……炽热的怒火，难以抑制。小心点。"
G["The unique magnetic fields of the polar regions pose millions of research possibilities!"]="极地独特的磁场区拥有难以估量的研究价值！"
G["The universe will be remade."]="宇宙将获得新生。"
G["The untamed plains of Nagrand offer some of the best hunting I've ever experienced."]="纳格兰的原始大草原是我所见过的最好的狩猎地点。"
G["The unthinkable has happened... $n has slain Prince Sandoval!"]="难以置信啊……$n杀死了萨杜瓦尔王子！"
G["The unthinkable has happened: Our siege on Theramore has failed."]="不可思议的事情发生了——我们对塞拉摩的围攻失败了。"
G["The unworthy have not yet learned of my power."]="那些废物还没见识过我的力量。"
G["The val'kyr surround us, brothers and sisters! Glory comes to those who sacrifice all for the Lich King!"]="瓦格里就在我们身边，兄弟们，姐妹们！那些为巫妖王牺牲的人将得到荣光！"
G["The vale belongs to the Shao-Tien!"]="山谷属于韶天！"
G["The vale is safer now."]="山谷现在更加安全了。"
G["The valley should mask our movements. Stay low. Stay close."]="这座山谷能掩护我们。低空飞行，跟紧。"
G["The valor quartermaster, Commander Oxheart, can be found at Niuzao Temple in the Townlong Steppes.\n\nI will mark her location on your map."]="勇气军需官——指挥官牛心，就在螳螂高原的砮皂寺。\n\n我会在你的地图上标出她的位置。"
G["The various merchants of Curiosities & Moore in southern Dalaran sell trinkets, relics, heirlooms, and off-hand items of all sorts."]="达拉然南部的摩尔珍品店有好几位商贩，他们出售各类饰品、圣物、家传宝物和副手武器。"
G["The vault will be cracked once the |cFFFF2222Vault Breaking progress bar reaches 100 percent!|r\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_coin_02.blp:64|t\nDoing the wrong thing at the wrong time will reduce the progress of the bar."]="一旦|cFFFF2222保险库破坏进度条到达百分之百，保险库就会被打破！|r\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_coin_02.blp:64|t\n在错误的时间采取错误的行动会让进度条后退。"
G["The vaults of the Titans grow weak as chaos flourishes. This prison can no longer contain you."]="这些泰坦的地穴已经随着混乱力量的日渐强大而被削弱了。这座牢狱已经无法再束缚您。"
G["The veil of shadows has lifted!"]="阴影散开了！"
G["The veil of winter will protect you, champions!"]="寒冬将会庇护你们，勇士们！"
G["The very spirits of Pandaria are supporting us in our grand crusade! Behold:"]="潘达利亚的诸神支持着我们伟大的事业！看看吧："
G["The very trees repel your presence!"]="每一棵树都抗拒你的到来！"
G["The vessel of rebirth must be fortified with elementium. I know of only one source of the mineral: the elemental planes, at the core of our world.\n\nThere is one, an Earthshaper, who may know more than I about the acquisition of such things. You must find this Earthshaper!"]="必须使用源质对重生之瓶进行加固。我只知道这种矿物的一种原料：位于这个世界核心中的元素领域。\n\n塑地者对这种东西的了解比我多得多。你必须找到塑地者！"
G["The vicious teromoths and I are just fine in here on our own, thank you."]="巨蛾和我在这里很和谐，谢谢你。"
G["The victorious heroes have returned! Control of Chill Breeze Valley is ours once again!"]="英雄们载誉凯旋了！寒风峡谷的控制权又是我们的了！"
G["The victors will take their rightful place in the assault upon the Citadel. We will stand together in the face of evil, and Arthas WILL fall!"]="胜利者将成为进攻冰冠堡垒大军的先锋。我们将并肩对抗邪恶。阿尔萨斯必将灭亡！"
G["The view from the top of Telredor is magnificent, isn't it?"]="在泰雷多尔顶部观景真是华丽啊，难道不是吗？"
G["The view really is much better from up here.  Not to mention the distinct lack of blood-spatter."]="这上面的视线确实更好，而且还不会被血溅到。"
G["The view up here is amazing!"]="这上面的景色可真不错！"
G["The vigil is never finished, but I can always take a break for a hot meal!"]="警戒是一刻也不能掉以轻心的，但我始终会腾出时间吃顿热饭的！"
G["The village of Astranaar in Ashenvale is Elder Riversong's current home."]="水歌长者目前住在灰谷的阿斯特兰纳。"
G["The village of Dolanaar atop Teldrassil is home to Elder Bladeleaf."]="刃叶长者的家在泰达希尔顶部的小村庄多兰纳尔。"
G["The villagers were thankful to have Emberstone back.  They brought us a little something to help against the Forsaken!"]="夺回烬石村让村民欢欣鼓舞。他们送了些东西来帮助我们对抗被遗忘者。"
G["The violent earthquake has alerted nearby Murlocs!"]="猛烈的地震警告了附近的鱼人们！"
G["The virmen are eating all of the grain!"]="兔妖把粮食都吃光了！"
G["The visions are clouded... like these waters."]="视野一片模糊……跟这些水一样。"
G["The visions we had failed to mention this event."]="我们看到的幻象里没有包含这件事。"
G["The visiting Horde keep primarily to the Sunreaver's Sanctuary in northeastern Dalaran.\n\nThere is an inn there, as well as portals to the various battlegrounds and Orgrimmar."]="部落旅客主要集中在达拉然东北部的夺日者圣殿。\n\n那里设有旅店，还有通往各大战场和奥格瑞玛的传送门。"
G["The voice... such splendor... Arthas... My king...."]="这声音……多么高贵……阿尔萨斯陛下……我的王……"
G["The voices are talking to me."]="有很多声音在对我讲话。"
G["The void rejects your light, $C. You are too pure for our dark wisdom."]="El vacío rechaza tu luz, $C. Eres demasiado puro para nuestra sabiduría oscura."
G["The void sucks at your soul. It is content to feast slowly."]="虚空抽吸着你的灵魂。它心满意足地慢慢享用着。"
G["The vortex of the harvested calls to you!"]="死亡的漩涡在召唤你！"
G["The vrykul are evil and must be destroyed!"]="必须消灭那些邪恶的维库人！"
G["The vrykul clutches at his throat as he begins to gag and thrash about."]="掠龙维库囚犯感到不适。"
G["The vrykul dies from being awakened improperly."]="由于唤醒的方式不当，维库人死亡了。"
G["The vrykul rests peacefully in his magical slumbering."]="维库人安详地沉睡着。"
G["The wall is wired up and ready to go - the honor is all yours!"]="炸药已经全部到位——这份殊荣属于你！"
G["The walls have been breached!"]="城墙被攻陷了！"
G["The walls of Frostmourne Cavern shudder and shake."]="霜之哀伤洞穴剧烈地摇晃起来。"
G["The walls of the chamber tremble. Something is happening..."]="墙壁震动了起来。一定是发生了什么事……"
G["The war against the Horde has reached full tilt, $n.  This is a time of great need for the Alliance and it's necessary that all of us do our part to help."]="与部落之间的战争已经到了白热化的阶段，$n。联盟需要大量的物资，我们应竭尽所能，提供帮助。"
G["The war against the orcs, there seems to be no respite."]="对兽人的战争似乎已经迫在眉睫了。"
G["The war between the Earthen and the stone troggs has raged for time beyond measure. But now in the chaos, the Stonefather, prisoner. They are threatening to kill him if we do not surrender."]="土灵与石头穴居人的战争已经不知持续了多少年。可在眼下这混乱之中，他们竟然将土灵之王囚禁了起来。他们威胁说，如果我们不投降，就杀了他。"
G["The war continued but the will of the great leader was sapped. The whole of Silithus was soon engulfed by the silithid and their Qiraji hosts."]="战争还在继续，但是这位伟大领袖的意志严重受挫。整个希利苏斯很快被异种虫类和他们的其拉主人占据了。"
G["The war in Northrend took its toll on us as a people, $n. While we were victorious in the frozen wastes, our own land fell into disarray."]="La guerra de Rasganorte nos pasa factura, $n. Mientras salíamos victoriosos en los baldíos helados, nuestras tierras caían en la confusión y el desorden."
G["The war is not over, but we have dealt them a bitter blow."]="战争还没结束，可我们已经让他们受到重创。"
G["The war... goes on."]="战争……还会继续的。"
G["The warchief calls."]="酋长在召唤。"
G["The warchief demands it!"]="这是酋长的命令！"
G["The warchief doesn't take kindly to non-orcs loitering in this part of Orgrimmar."]="酋长可不喜欢兽人以外的家伙在奥格瑞玛的这一地区闲逛。"
G["The warchief graciously permits the families of the dead to live in his city.  To die in the service of the Horde should be a great honor, but you see it as another opportunity to line your filthy pockets!"]="酋长都慷慨允许死者家属住进他的城市了。为部落而死本就是无上的荣誉，可是你却只想趁机再捞一笔！"
G["The warchief wants to know why his ships are delayed."]="酋长想知道，为什么他的船只迟到了。"
G["The warchief will have all of our hides if production doesn't double!"]="如果产量不能加倍，酋长一定会把我们全都剥皮的！"
G["The warchief will hear of our success!"]="酋长将听到我们胜利的消息！"
G["The warchief will hear of your failure!"]="酋长会听到你们惨败的消息！"
G["The warchief's put a price on Arazzius's head! As of right now, that no-good piece of demon refuse is enemy number one."]="酋长正在悬赏捉拿阿拉修斯！从现在起，那些毫无用处的废物恶魔变成了首要的敌人。"
G["The warchief? Big guy, giant spikey shoulderpads, short temper, and a morbid attachment to axes? THAT warchief?"]="酋长？是不是那个总是穿着长刺的巨型肩甲，脾气暴躁，对斧子有种病态偏执的大个子？是那个酋长吗？"
G["The warm embrace of Tarecgosa's presence encircles you."]="泰蕾苟萨的温暖气息环绕着你。"
G["The warmth of the sun... awaits."]="太阳的光芒……在等待着我。"
G["The warmth of this place sickens me."]="这里的温暖感觉令我恶心。"
G["The warrior's role is one of protection.  Just as we protect our compatriots in battle, we must also protect the interests of the Forsaken."]="战士的任务之一就是保护。正如我们在战场上保护自己的同伴一样，我们要时刻保护被遗忘者的利益。"
G["The warriors are in the War Quarter, practicing on the outer ring."]="战士都在军事区外环区域进行操练。"
G["The warriors are reporting that you saved their lives. Thank you, $n."]="战士们报告说是你救了他们。谢谢你，$n。"
G["The washed ones!"]="是那些洗过的家伙！"
G["The water elementals are at war with the fire elementals, which sort of means they're at war with us.  One of their leaders, Hydraxis, is mustering agents for his cause..."]="水元素正在跟火元素交战，也就是说他们也在跟我们作战。他们的领袖之一的海达克希斯正在召集士兵……"
G["The water here is disturbed... what is happening here?"]="这里的水域受到了干扰……发生了什么事？"
G["The water here is peaceful, is it not? Listening to the trickle from the ceiling can aid you in finding its true voice..."]="这里的水很平静，是不是？倾听水滴从屋檐落下的声音，那就是它们真正的语言。"
G["The water in this pond is... quite awful."]="这个水塘里的水……非常糟糕。"
G["The water itself rises to fight against them here, but why? Many questions and few answers..."]="这里的水体本身也在对抗他们。这是为什么？我们有很多问题，却只有很少的答案……"
G["The water may not create life, but at least it will let me transfer it."]="水也许不能创造生命，但它至少能让我转化生命。"
G["The water never lies."]="水流从不说谎。"
G["The water reacts violently to your touch!"]="流水对你的触碰做出了强烈反应！"
G["The water spirits are perhaps the most outspoken. They are generous and understanding. Indeed, if you are having trouble hearing the voices, it is with water that you should begin."]="水流之灵是最坦率的。它们非常慷慨，并且善解人意。事实上，如果你听不到它们的声音，那么你就应该开始学习与水沟通。"
G["The water spirits have answered my prayers. Thank you."]="水灵们回应了我的祈祷。谢谢你。"
G["The watering can is empty. Return to Gardener Fran."]="水罐空了。去找园丁芳兰。"
G["The waters are forbidden to all!"]="谁也别想碰这水！"
G["The waters are restless..."]="涛生涛灭……"
G["The waters are wild and chaotic. Something agitates them."]="这里的水开始变得狂野而混乱，一定有什么东西在扰动它们。"
G["The waters calm as Watoosun materializes."]="瓦图苏的现身使水流恢复了平静。"
G["The waters have not been cleansed!"]="水流尚未净化！"
G["The waters of Quel'thalas are teeming with fish; I take it they caught your eye? Drathen is quite experienced with the tricks of the fishing trade, and can be found on the Walk of Elders near the Royal Exchange."]="奎尔萨拉斯的水里有着大量的鱼，你从来都没发现过吗？德拉森对钓鱼很有经验，你可以在长者步道靠近皇家贸易区的地方找到他。"
G["The waters of Westfall are where you must search, due west-northwest of where the Gold Coast Quarry meets with the shore.  An anchor shows where a boat has sunk beyond it, deep within the water.  The underwater pressure is fierce here; swimming too far will crush even the mightiest swimmer from fatigue.  \n\nLook for a natural formation to aid you, $n - a bubbly fissure is near here, offering deep-water swimmers a chance for renewed breath."]="你必须去西部荒野的海洋搜寻，向正西方——金海岸矿洞与海岸交接处往西北方向。海岸边有一只锚，看来附近一定有艘沉船。水下的压力很大；如果游得太远的话，即使是最优秀的潜水者也可能死于疲劳。\n\n去找一处适宜的自然环境吧，$n——这附近有起泡的海底裂缝，能在深海潜水时提供氧气。"
G["The waters of northern Sar'theris Strand in Desolace or the Angor Fortress in Badlands have locked boxes that can be picked open."]="凄凉之地北部萨瑟里斯海岸和荒芜之地苦痛堡垒都有可以拾取的带锁的箱子。"
G["The waters of the Vale are now yours to protect..."]="谷里的溪水现在就由你来守护了……"
G["The waters rushed in and drowned everything!"]="水冲了进来，把一切都淹没了！"
G["The waters speak of your demise..."]="水流预示了你的灭亡……"
G["The waters whisper to me... enemies approach."]="水流告诉我……敌人在逼近。"
G["The waters will consume you!"]="洪水吞没你！"
G["The waters. They only transfer life. My translations are starting to make sense now.\n\nI surmise the mogu used to extend their lives with the water by sacrificing prisoners, rebels, and slaves.\n\nIt is also my guess that all of the ancient scrolls I was researching were written by mogu originally, and they neglected to mention that fact."]="水。只是转移生命。我开始明白我那译文的含义了。\n\n我猜魔古族曾用献祭囚犯、叛徒和奴隶的方式，继续与水共生。\n\n我还猜测，我研究的那些古老卷轴，最初都是由魔古族书写的，而他们没有提及这个事实。"
G["The watersh tell of good fortune today, $n."]="水流预示着今天会有好运气，$n。"
G["The waterspeaking ceremony has tired me. Please, give me time to rest, and think."]="水语仪式让我感到十分疲惫。请给我点时间，让我好好地休息，好好地思考。"
G["The waves shall rise and consume your tribe, Vol'jin! You should never have returned!"]="巨浪将会升起，吞没你的部族，沃金！你们不应该回来的！"
G["The waves tremble at your approach..."]="水流因你的靠近而翻涌……"
G["The way I see it is, I'm not very good at being a lady, so maybe I'd make a better adventurer like you."]="在我看来，我不是很擅长做淑女，我可能更适合做一个你这样的探险者。"
G["The way into Dalaran has been opened!"]="进入达拉然的传送门开启了！"
G["The way is cleared! Open the prison!"]="路障被清除了！打开牢笼！"
G["The way of the Druid is sibling to the Shaman.  Gennia Runetotem is steeped in such knowledge.  Seek her out in the large tent on the east side of Bloodhoof Village."]="德鲁伊的生活方式跟萨满相差无几。根妮亚·符文图腾正在对此进行研究。去血蹄村东面的大营帐中找她吧。"
G["The way of the Tushui is one of gaining proper perspective. Through meditation and consideration, we find our way to the most effective solution to any problem. Through practice and discipline, we hone our bodies to be the perfect implements of our will.\n\nTo live the way of the Tushui is to be respected both for tempered mind and impeccable form."]="土水派的修行之道是获得真知的途径之一。通过沉思和冥想，我们发现我们的修行之道是解决问题最有效的方法。通过练习和修正，我们让自己的意志完美支配自己的身体。\n\n要学习土水派的修行之道，必须具有坚强的意志和完美的体魄。"
G["The way to the rendevous point is mostly clear. You should get moving."]="通往会合点的路基本已经畅通无阻了。你应该动身了。"
G["The ways of Jaedenar are dark and treacherous.  Watch your moves in this place, $C, or you will find your soul entralled by your rivals..."]="加德纳尔的行事准则是隐晦奸诈。别在这儿探头探脑，$c，否则你的灵魂就会被永远禁锢在此……"
G["The weak have no place in this world!"]="弱者在这个世上没有立足之地！"
G["The weapon masters in the Valley of Honor within Orgrimmar, Sayoc and Hanashi, can teach you how to shoot a bow. Ileda, the weapon master of Silvermoon found in Farstrider Square, is also an expert."]="奥格瑞玛荣誉谷内的武器大师塞尤克和哈纳什可以教你如何射箭，银月城远行者广场的武器大师伊蕾达同样也是这方面的专家。"
G["The weapon which you seek is called the Hammer of Twilight."]="这件你正在寻找的武器被称为暮光神锤。"
G["The weapon will soon be completed. The Wildhammer and the Dragonmaw are about to be no more."]="这件武器很快就能完成了。蛮锤矮人和龙喉兽人都将不复存在。"
G["The wedding's a go! I'm going to need a gift for the happy couple, of course. Something important.\n\nThe future of the Wildhammer really hinges on this one last chance to bring us all together!"]="婚礼就要开始了！我需要为这快乐的一对准备一件礼物。一件非常重要的礼物。\n\n蛮锤的未来完全系于这最后一个将我们团结在一起的机会！"
G["The well is very important. It's good that they asked me to watch it."]="这口井至关重要。幸好他们派我来看守它。"
G["The west gate of the Alliance keep has been destroyed!"]="联盟要塞的西门被摧毁了！"
G["The west gate of the Alliance keep has been destroyed."]="联盟要塞的西门被摧毁了！"
G["The west gate of the Horde keep has been destroyed!"]="部落要塞的西门被摧毁了！"
G["The west gate of the Horde keep has been destroyed."]="部落要塞的西门被摧毁了！"
G["The west."]="西边。"
G["The western auction house can be found in the middle of the Bazaar, just west of the Walk of Elders."]="西面的那座拍卖行可以在花园街市中间找到，就在长者步道往西一点。"
G["The western bridge has been damaged!"]="西边的桥梁遭到破坏！"
G["The western bridge has been destroyed!"]="西边的桥梁被摧毁了！"
G["The western sewers entrance is beneath the stairway to the Violet Citadel."]="西部下水道的入口在通往紫罗兰城堡的阶梯下面。"
G["The western tower has been damaged!"]="西边的哨塔遭到破坏！"
G["The western tower has been destroyed!"]="西边的哨塔被摧毁了！"
G["The wha-??\n\nWell, I refer to them as undefined floating obstructions. And where I'm from, most deny their existence entirely.\n\nBut I know better! I've even seen 'em up close! My recent years have been spent building this vessel to locate, track, document, and if needs be, eradicate them!"]="冰……冰山？？\n\n呃，我是指漂在空中的不明障碍物。在我的家乡，大家都说没有见过此类物体。\n\n我是真的见过！还在近处观察过它们呢！喏，这艘船就是我近几年的创造结晶，为的就是追踪并记录这些不明物体并且在必要的时候摧毁它们！"
G["The what-bringer? Oh, ASHbringer? Never heard of it... What? Stop bothering me!"]="什么？哦，灰烬使者？没有听说过……什么？别烦我！"
G["The wheel... spins... again."]="死亡之轮……又开始旋转了。"
G["The whispering winds have made it known to me that a $r $c would come; that $ghe:she; would assist me where many others have failed.\n\nCould you be the one?"]="风已经悄声告诉我，一名$r$c即将到来。$g他:她;会帮助我取得成功，而不是像其他人那样只能让我尝到失败的苦果。\n\n你会是那个人吗？"
G["The whole city's ill!"]="整座城市都被疾病传染了！"
G["The whole island is protected by a sonic shield, $p."]="整座岛屿都被声波护盾所保护，$p。"
G["The whole squad laughed at me for a week! Don't let it happen again!"]="我被他们嘲笑了整整一周！别再犯这种错误了！"
G["The whole town is gone!"]="整个镇子都没了！"
G["The wild cloud serpents breed very rarely, and as such, each egg is extremely precious.\n\nIf we do not work to help and protect the wild cloud serpents, they may one day disappear."]="野生云端翔龙的生育率非常低。所以，每一枚翔龙蛋都是极其珍贵的。\n\n如果我们不努力保护野生云端翔龙，它们或许就会彻底绝种。"
G["The will o' the Firelord be done, Grand Ambassador."]="炎魔之王的意志必将实现，总大使。"
G["The will of N'Zoth corrupts you."]="恩佐斯的意志将腐蚀你。"
G["The will of the Empress is our own. Her greatness is our greatness. Her victory is a victory for the swarm!"]="女皇的意志就是我们的意志。女皇的伟大就是我们的伟大。女皇的胜利就是虫群的胜利！"
G["The wilting lotus is the first sign of winter, a winter that has not come to Shen-zin Su in thousands of years."]="凋谢的莲花是冬季降临的征兆。数千年来，神真子的背上从未经历过寒冬。"
G["The wind abruptly shifts direction at %s' command!"]="在%s的命令下，风突然转向了！"
G["The wind and air elementals threaten to destroy Thunder Bluff.  If you think you are strong enough to go in there, be my guest.  Otherwise, stay out of the city and let us take care of it."]="狂风与空气的元素之灵正欲毁灭雷霆崖。要是你认为自己强大到足以进去帮忙，那么请便。不然的话就别进去添乱，让我们来解决这一危局。"
G["The wind and trees whisper of unseen troubles.  The land appears healthy, but there's more going on here than meets the eye."]="凛风与森林低声诉说着隐忧。这片看似生机勃勃的土地其实隐藏着莫大的危机。"
G["The wind blows in my favor."]="风向对我有利。"
G["The wind calls to me."]="风呼唤着我。"
G["The wind fiercely cuts across this bluff, and most life has long since fled this corner of Icecrown. However, all it takes is a bit of coaxing for it to return, and that is why I walk these grounds. One day these trees will tower over us all."]="寒风猛烈地吹过这里的峭壁，在冰冠冰川的这个角落，绝大多数生命都不会做片刻停留。不过，只需要一点耐心，生命又都会回来。所以我现在走在这片大地上。总有一天，这些树木会高过我们所有人。"
G["The wind grows stronger! Take the lifts to safer ground!"]="风力越来越大了！快乘升降机去安全的地方！"
G["The wind immediately surrounding the mill picks up rapidly, causing the timbers to groan."]="狂风紧紧地贴着磨坊高速旋转，使周围的树木发出了呻吟声。"
G["The wind rider master"]="双足飞龙管理员"
G["The wind speaks of our enemies' movements, Ashyen.  The naga will attack again."]="微风告诉我，我们的敌人正在行动，埃西恩。纳迦会再次进攻我们的。"
G["The wind used its minions to distort the history of this place, changing the stories your people told, destroying the spirits of the honored dead."]="北风让它的爪牙扭曲了这个地区的历史，意图改变牦牛人口口相传的故事并消灭先祖的亡魂。"
G["The winds are good today."]="今天的风正好。"
G["The winds are strange today. Strange indeed."]="今天的风很奇怪，真的很奇怪。"
G["The winds do not speak to our tribe anymore, $n.  My people are lost without elders to bring the spirits to them."]="风不再与我们的部族交流了，$n。如果没有长者将元素之灵召回来，我们将万劫不复。"
G["The winds may be strong, and the sleet may sting."]="风刀霜剑，四面受敌。"
G["The winds of Outland speak of calm and peace."]="外域的微风中夹杂着平静与安宁的气息。"
G["The winds of change can bring anything, from a terrible storm to a bountiful harvest. It seems this time they have brought you.\n\nNow, I wonder, are you a storm or a harvest?"]="谁也不知道变幻之风会带来什么，也许是可怕的风暴，也许是盛大的丰收。看来这次带来的是你。\n\n现在，我想问问，你究竟是风暴还是丰收？"
G["The winds take me!"]="我将随风而去！"
G["The wings of the empress cannot fail!"]="女皇之翼拒绝失败！"
G["The winner of the drag race is...the gnome team!  Great job guys!"]="短程加速赛的冠军是……地精车队！干得好，兄弟们！"
G["The winter after the curse was lifted, hundreds of veteran orcs like me were lost to despair."]="诅咒解除后的那个严冬，数以百计的兽人士兵都在绝望中迷失了方向，我也不例外。"
G["The wisdom of the Jade Serpent."]="青龙之智。"
G["The wisest among you will do the same."]="你们当中的智者也会如此。"
G["The wisest of the jinyu are very wise indeed - they can speak to the rivers the way you and I would consult our elders."]="锦鱼人中的智者确实非常睿智——他们与河流交流的方式，只有我族的长者才能知晓一二。"
G["The wisps and I watch the seas for any lost souls."]="我和小精灵守护着那些迷失的灵魂。"
G["The witches of Scadeald are the glue that keeps the Ealdir together when they aren't tearing at each other's throats for the title of chieftain. Before their clans, the witches owe themselves first to the coven, always. Mother Morgwena leads them. They say she's lived long enough to remember Scadeald before Stormwind laid its first stone... but I don't put much stock in old wives' tales."]="Las brujas de Scadeald son el pegamento que mantiene unidos a los Ealdir cuando no están desgarrándose las gargantas entre sí por el título de jefe. Ante sus clanes, las brujas le deben primero al covén, siempre. La Madre Morgwena las lidera. Se dice que ha vivido lo suficiente para recordar Scadeald antes de que Ventormenta pusiera su primera piedra... pero yo no pongo mucho empeño en los cuentos viejos."
G["The wizard will fall!"]="麦迪文会被打倒的！"
G["The wolf's going down."]="这只狼快要死了。"
G["The word is given. The Lich King will die by our hands!"]="我们言出如山，巫妖王必将败倒在我们脚下！"
G["The words painted on the stretched skin here call for something that you don't think you're quite ready for.\n\nYou should check back later."]="Las palabras pintadas en la piel tensada te proponen una misión para la que crees que no estás $gpreparado:preparada; todavía.\n\nVuelve más tarde."
G["The worg growls as it closes in on its prey."]="接近猎物时，座狼咆哮起来。"
G["The worg hesitates for a moment, then changes direction."]="座狼在原地转悠了一会儿，然后改变了方向。"
G["The worg sprints off in search of enemies."]="座狼一路飞奔，搜索着敌人的踪迹。"
G["The worgen killed my parents, $n.  Watch yourself."]="狼人杀了我的双亲，$n。你一定要小心。"
G["The worgen stares and hesitates!"]="狼人凝视着迟疑了！"
G["The worgen will pass.  We shall pass.\n\nOnly the earth and her secrets will remain.  Are you willing to learn, $n?"]="Los huargen desaparecerán. Nosotros desapareceremos.\n\nSolo la tierra y sus secretos permanecerán. ¿Estás $gdispuesto:dispuesta; a aprender, $n?"
G["The work is hard, but necessary. This statue represents all that we believe."]="工作虽然艰辛，但还是很有必要的。这座雕像代表了我们的信仰。"
G["The work must continue!"]="工作必须继续下去！"
G["The work of your brothers in the Storm Peaks has reached a frenzied pace. Soon, Father will be freed."]="你在风暴峭壁的同胞的工作日趋白热化。很快，我们的创造者就能重获自由了。"
G["The work that you did for me at the Ruins of Farahlon has got me back on schedule.  I'm assembling my team to head out there now.\n\nThank you, $n."]="Gracias a lo que hiciste por mí en las Ruinas de Farahlon ya no voy retrasado en mi plan de trabajo. Estoy reuniendo a mi equipo para salir.\n\nGracias, $n."
G["The world is indebted to you and your allies, $n."]="整个世界都感激你和你的同伴们所做的一切，$n。"
G["The world of the living may have turned its back on me, but I'm no damned Scourge.  Just go."]="生者的世界已经抛弃了我，但我并不是该诅咒的天灾亡灵。走吧。"
G["The world suffers yet another insignificant loss."]="又一个无关紧要的损失。"
G["The world will be reborn in flames!"]="这个世界将在烈焰中重生！"
G["The world will suffer immeasurable cruelties under my reign."]="在我的统治下，这个世界将遭遇难以想象的惨剧。"
G["The world's gone to hell, $n."]="这个世界已经毁灭了，$n。"
G["The world-shaman - shattered by the hand of Fandral Staghelm?\n\nGreater powers are at work here. Ragnaros has pushed his strength farther into this realm than I would have imagined.\n\nThe Firelord must be stopped!"]="¿El chamán del mundo, aniquilado por la mano de Fandral Corzocelada?\n\nAquí obran poderes más importantes. Ragnaros ha introducido su fuerza en este reino aún más de lo que hubiera imaginado.\n\n¡Debemos detener al Señor del Fuego!"
G["The worm is about to bite!  Place the bomb down now!"]="蠕虫要咬人了！立刻把炸弹放下去！"
G["The worst is behind us. Soon we will put an end to the Lich King's reign."]="最艰难的时刻已经过去了。我们很快就能推翻巫妖王的暴政。"
G["The worst is yet to come!"]="最可怕的噩梦还没降临呢！"
G["The wounds will heal, child."]="伤口会愈合的，孩子。"
G["The wyrmcult blackwhelp lies here netted and helpless."]="拜龙教的黑色龙崽无助地躺在网里。"
G["The wyrms will eat well tonight!"]="龙群今晚能饱餐一顿了！"
G["The wyvern drops a black drake corpse on the ground."]="双足飞龙将一具黑色幼龙的尸体扔在地上。"
G["The yaungol are attacking!"]="野牛人发起进攻了！"
G["The yaungol are coming from every direction, $n! Quickly, defend the village before they burn it down!"]="野牛人从四面八方包围过来了，$n！快，保卫村庄，别让他们烧了它！"
G["The yaungol are so powerful... maybe we need to look to your people for protection."]="野牛人太强大了……也许我们需要寻求你族人的庇护。"
G["The yaungol attacked the beasts with great determination and ferocity. Yet, the more he attacked, the more fearsome the beasts grew!"]="野牛人坚决勇猛地予以回击。可是，他的反击越猛烈，那些野兽就变得越是可怕！"
G["The yaungol have shamed my people.\n\nThey will soon know the true meaning of shame."]="野牛人羞辱了我的族人。\n\n他们很快就会知道羞辱的真正含义。"
G["The yaungol must be attacking because of the stranger!"]="¡Seguro que los yaungol nos atacan por culpa $gdel extranjero:de la extranjera;!"
G["The yaungol ruin everything!"]="野牛人摧毁了一切！"
G["The yeti is a fierce, cunning creature, and this one is one of the strongest of his kind. We keep him asleep through herbs in his food.\n\nDo not think he will be lethargic in the ring, however."]="雪人是一种凶猛而狡诈的怪物，而这头雪人又是雪人之中最强壮的一头。我们在他的食物里掺了药，让他睡着了。\n\n但你可千万别以为他在斗兽场里还会这样昏昏沉沉地酣睡。"
G["The young Prince Anduin's been askin' after ya."]="年轻的安度因王子正在等你。"
G["The young must not go hungry...."]="幼体可千万不能饿着了……"
G["The young races? The infants? Humans? Orcs? Dwarves? You expect to defeat the Hakkari? To destroy a GOD?"]="年轻的一代？婴儿？人类？兽人？矮人？你想要击败哈卡？你要击败一个神？"
G["The young raptor looks up at you. You can't be certain, but you think you see a flicker of recognition in her eye."]="小迅猛龙抬头看着你。你无法确定，但你仿佛在她眼中看到认同的眼神。"
G["The younger races make a big fuss over Winter Veil. Ironforge's bank is the center of the festivities."]="瞧瞧那些没见过世面的家伙，过个冬幕节就激动成这样。铁炉堡的银行是节日庆典的中心。"
G["The zeppelin from Northrend was attacked by Twilight's Hammer! I don't know how they found us, but they killed everyone."]="来自诺森德的飞艇遭到了暮光之锤的攻击！我不知道他们是怎样找到我们的，但我们的船员都遇害了。"
G["The zeppelin should have just arrived at Grom'gol..."]="飞艇应该是刚刚到达格罗姆高……"
G["The zeppelin should have just arrived at Orgrimmar..."]="飞艇应该是刚刚到达奥格瑞玛……"
