G["The zeppelin to Grom'gol has just arrived! All aboard for Stranglethorn!"]="飞往格罗姆高的飞艇已经靠港了！要去荆棘谷的就赶快啦！"
G["The zeppelin to Grom'gol should be arriving here any time now."]="飞往格罗姆高的飞艇随时会靠港。"
G["The zeppelin to Orgrimmar has just arrived! All aboard for Durotar!"]="飞往奥格瑞玛的飞艇已经靠港了！要去杜隆塔尔的就赶快啦！"
G["The zeppelin to Thunder Bluff has arrived! All aboard for a smooth ride across the Barrens!"]="前往雷霆崖的飞艇到达了！全体登船，我们要迅速飞越贫瘠之地！"
G["The zeppelin to Undercity has just arrived! All aboard for Tirisfal Glades!"]="飞往幽暗城的飞艇已经靠港了！要去提瑞斯法林地的就赶快啦！"
G["The zeppelin to Vengeance Landing has just arrived! All aboard for Howling Fjord!"]="前往复仇港的飞艇已经抵达！要去嚎风峡湾的旅客请登机！"
G["The zeppelin to Warsong Hold has just arrived! All aboard for Borean Tundra!"]="前往战歌要塞的飞艇已经抵达！要去北风苔原的旅客请登机！"
G["The zeppelin to historic Tirisfal Glades has just arrived! Don't be caught dead without the latest in Forsaken fashion!"]="飞往提瑞斯法林的飞艇已经靠港了！一定要穿上被遗忘者最流行的服饰去冒险呀！"
G["The zeppelin towers are just north of the Undercity."]="飞艇塔就在幽暗城的北面。"
G["The zeppelin's leaving for a tour around the bay in less than one minute!  Oh, and if anyone feels like setting me free, I'm on the dock."]="1分钟后，飞艇就要出发绕海湾一圈了！有没有谁想搭救我啊，我就在码头上。"
G["The ziggurat's lost!  Flee to the temple!"]="祭塔失守了！向神庙撤退！"
G["The zombies are coming."]="僵尸来了。"
