G["The |cFFFF0000Horde|r has taken control of the Waterfall Depot!"]="|cFFFF0000部落|r取得了对瀑布补给站的控制！"
G["The |cFFFF2222[Lightning Lance]|r is charged.  Use it to finish off the Sha Amalgamation!"]="|cFFFF2222[闪电长枪]|r充能完毕。快用它消灭融合之煞！"
G["The |cFFFF8000Orange|r orb has been returned!"]="|cFFFF8000橙色|r宝珠被放回了！"
G["The... Empire... will rise again."]="帝国……必将……再度崛起。"
G["The... The fire lord? An elemental lord was unearthed? Of course... Gul'dan you were a damned fool!"]="火……火焰之王？那不是一位元素之王吗？难怪……古尔丹，你这个该死的蠢货！"
G["The... The master? He lives?"]="主……主人？他还活着？"
G["The... They promised that we'd be safe..."]="人生…人生真是无常啊..."
G["The... bridge..."]="架……桥……"
G["The... dookers... took my brew..."]="蠢货……抢走了……我的酒……"
G["The... the monkeys... they attacked...\n\nI fought them off, but... they'll be back... with more..."]="那些……猴子……攻击我们……\n\n我击退了他们，可……他们很快就会回来……带着更多的人手……"
G["The... the yaungol!\nThey attacked my farm, and the nearby village, Eastwind Rest... killed some of us, and the ones they didn't kill they chased off!\nI managed to gather some of us here. Any word on help coming from Binan?"]="¡Los... los yaungol!\n\nHan atacado mi granja y la aldea cercana, Reposo Viento del Este... Han matado a algunos de nosotros, y a los demás los han expulsado.\n\nHe conseguido que algunos nos reunamos aquí. ¿Se sabe si viene ayuda de Binan?"
G["The... the yaungol!\nThey attacked my farm, and the nearby village, Westwind Rest... killed some of us, and the ones they didn't kill they chased off!\nI managed to gather some of us here. Any word on help coming from Binan?"]="¡Los... los yaungol!\n\nHan atacado mi granja y la aldea cercana, Reposo Viento del Oeste... Han matado a algunos de nosotros, y a los demás los han expulsado.\n\nHe conseguido que algunos nos reunamos aquí. ¿Se sabe si viene ayuda de Binan?"
G["The... village... dead..."]="这个……村子……已经死了……"
G["The...they're agents of the Twilight's Hammer! Is that...the Assistant Resort Director with them?"]="他……他们是暮光之锤的间谍！和他们在一起的……是度假地主管助理吗？"
G["Their attacks are getting more frequent. You better keep moving."]="他们的攻击日渐频繁了。你最好别停下。"
G["Their attacks are relentless. Thank you for your help."]="他们的攻击无休无止。谢谢你的帮助。"
G["Their black iron constructs have sown death across a thousand worlds."]="他们所制造的黑色机械在无数世界中播种了死亡。"
G["Their camp is in shambles. What happened?"]="他们的营地陷入了混乱，发生了什么事？"
G["Their ceremonial chamber, where I was to be sacrificed..."]="仪式大厅，他们本打算在那里将我作为祭品的……"
G["Their coming will herald the end of the world!"]="他们的到来宣告着世界的末日！"
G["Their cowardly leader hides behind this barricade. Where are my sappers?"]="他们懦弱的领袖就藏在这道屏障后面。我的工兵去哪儿了？"
G["Their cruelty seems to know no end."]="他们的凶残似乎永无休止。"
G["Their day will come, $n.\n\nAnd when it does, I will be there."]="Llegará su día, $n.\n\nY, cuando llegue, estaré allí."
G["Their deaths only serve to empower my summoners further! Behold!"]="他们的死亡只会令我的召唤者变得更强！看吧！"
G["Their defenses are down!  Attack!"]="他们的防线被攻破了！进攻！"
G["Their defenses are down! The time is now, minions! ATTACK!"]="他们的防线已经被攻破了！时机到了，奴仆们！进攻！"
G["Their dragonshrine may have empowered them, but the blues will not wrest the temple from us this day!"]="蓝龙军团从碧蓝巨龙圣地获得了强大的力量，但是我们绝不允许他们攻陷龙眠神殿！"
G["Their energy is strong!"]="他们的力量太强了！"
G["Their fate is sealed."]="他们死定了。"
G["Their fury pales before mine, Illidan. We have some unsettled business between us."]="他们的愤怒和我的相比简直不值一提，伊利丹。我们之间终于要决一胜负了。"
G["Their leader is here! Strike him down!"]="他们的首领在这儿！快把他干掉！"
G["Their leader is hold up behind this barracade. The coward. Let me know when you are ready to move in."]="他们怯懦的首领就躲在这道屏障后面。你准备好了就告诉我。"
G["Their leader is still in hiding. Find him!"]="他们领头的还躲着呢。把他找出来！"
G["Their loss is most definitely my gain..."]="他们的损失对我来说就是意外的惊喜……"
G["Their magics are meaningless to you, $n!"]="他们的魔法对你不起作用，$n！"
G["Their main army has breached the north gate!"]="他们的主力部队突破北门了！"
G["Their manifest forms weak from eons of battle, imprisoned beneath the world - the world that they themselves created - the corruption of the Titan Shapers would permeate through the surface and befoul the Old Gods.\n\nIt was then and there that the brothers did turn. For five millennia a battle was fought at the core of this world."]="Sus formas manifestadas, debilitadas tras millones de batallas, estaban encarceladas bajo el mundo (el mundo que ellos mismos habían creado) cuya superficie penetró la corrupción de los Creadores de titanes y contaminó a los dioses antiguos.\n\nFue ahí y entonces cuando los hermanos se transformaron. Durante cinco milenios se luchó una gran batalla en el corazón del mundo."
G["Their minds are now tainted, $r. Yes, even more so than before. They live only to serve and protect Razelikh. The amulet fragments they each hold are the key to summoning the demon lord. What you do not understand is that none of them can be harmed through any conventional means"]="Ahora sus mentes están contaminadas, $r. Sí, incluso más que antes. Viven solo para servir y proteger a Razelikh. Los fragmentos de amuleto que cada uno lleva son la clave para invocar al señor demoníaco. Lo que no entiendes es que ninguno de ellos es susceptible al ataque por medios convencionales."
G["Their minds are now tainted, $r. Yes, even more so than before. They live only to serve and protect Razelikh. The amulet fragments they each hold are the key to summoning the demon lord. What you do not understand is that none of them can be harmed through any conventional means."]="Ahora sus mentes están contaminadas, $r. Sí, incluso más que antes. Viven solo para servir y proteger a Razelikh. Los fragmentos de amuleto que cada uno lleva son la clave para invocar al señor demoníaco. Lo que no entiendes es que ninguno de ellos es susceptible al ataque por medios convencionales."
G["Their movements are totally chaotic, as if they themselves know not what they are about."]="他们的行动真的很混乱，好像他们自己都不知道要干什么。"
G["Their numbers are endless, $c! Help us hold them back!"]="他们人太多了，$c！快帮我们挡住他们！"
G["Their numbers are too many to count. Their defenses look impenetrable.\n\nI saw no weaknesses to exploit, $r."]="他们的人数多得难以计算。他们的防御仿佛无懈可击。\n\n我找不出任何可以利用的薄弱环节，$r。"
G["Their numbers are unbelievable... I'm glad to hear King Stormheart came to your aid. I only hear good things of him - I think it's high time we meet."]="他们的数量多得难以置信……好在雷心国王伸出了援手。我听说过他的许多事迹——是时候见见他了。"
G["Their numbers are... endless..."]="他们的人数……无穷无尽……"
G["Their partnership was never meant to be. It actually makes me sick a little bit. Here comes GG Engineering!"]="他们的搭档完全是一个意外。事实上我对此颇为厌恶。他们就是，GG工程公司组合！"
G["Their passing weighs heavily upon my soul."]="他们的逝去让我倍感沉痛。"
G["Their power and wisdom seized for a greater glory!"]="凭力量和智慧攫取了更光辉的荣耀！"
G["Their sacrifice will not be in vain."]="他们不会就这样白白牺牲的。"
G["Their shadow will choke the land for eternity."]="它们的阴影将永远地笼罩着大地。"
G["Their skill in battle should never be underestimated."]="永远都不要低估他们的战斗能力。"
G["Their spirits are restored! The gryphons are ready to strike! Come, soldiers! Come to my side!"]="他们的精神恢复了！狮鹫已经准备好作战了！来吧，战士们！到我这儿来！"
G["Their strength is an inspiration... and sorely needed. We must trust that their hearts are pure."]="嗯……这股力量是种鼓舞……至关重要。要相信他们的心是纯洁的。"
G["Their success hinges upon what we discover within these cursed halls. Although our mission is fraught with peril, we must persevere!"]="我们在这些厅堂中的发现将决定他们的成败。虽然任务危险重重，但我们必须坚持！"
G["Their visions built empires, freed slaves, and warned our Last Emperor of the Sundering that shattered Azeroth ten thousand years ago."]="他们的真知灼见筑起了帝国，解救了奴隶，还在一万年前艾泽拉斯大分裂来临之前，向末代皇帝发出了警告。"
G["Thel'zan cannot stop me! For the Alliance! For Lord Fordragon!"]="塞尔赞再也无法阻止我了！为了联盟！为了弗塔根公爵！"
G["Thel'zan needs to die, if only to stop the incessant yammering!"]="塞尔赞必须死，只有这样才能使怨灵停止那永无止境的哭泣！"
G["Thel'zan will have you..."]="塞尔赞……会杀了你……"
G["Thel'zan's enchantment is broken! I am safe!"]="塞尔赞的魔法失效了！我安全了！"
G["Thel'zan's phylactery drops to the ground beneath Icestorm."]="塞尔赞的护符匣滚落到冰雪风暴脚下。"
G["Theldurin the Lost!"]="迷失者塞尔杜林！"
G["Thelonius has told me much about your skill in battle. I look forward to seeing it firsthand."]="塞隆尼斯跟我讲了很多关于你在战斗中的技巧。我很期待能够亲眼见识一下。"
G["Them crocs drop some tasty meat, $p, but tiger haunch is my personal favorite!"]="那些鳄鱼的肉质相当不错，$p，但老虎腰肉是我的个人最爱！"
G["Them lizard-folk could be carryin' anything. Keep an eye out for 'em!"]="那些长得像蜥蜴一样的怪物身上总是带有一些稀奇古怪的东西。看到了就别错过！"
G["Them thar druids be sendin' children to thar deaths now? The Clam Master obliges, matey!"]="这帮德鲁伊是专程派些小鬼来送死的吗？蛤蜊主宰成全你！"
G["Them's DEFINITELY fightin' words!"]="这是明显的挑衅！"
G["Then Firebeard decreed his plea"]="焰须发出他的恳求"
G["Then HIT THAT GONG, and show these monks what you're made of! ...one way or another, heh."]="那就敲响那面铜锣，让这些武僧看看你有多大能耐！……无论用怎样的方法，嘿嘿。"
G["Then I am glad you came. Now that you know of our fires, and of honoring them... and of the fires of our enemies, and of extinguishing them... you may return to him and be rewarded."]="很高兴你能来。我想你已经很了解我们的火焰了，这些，你需要祭拜……不过，不知道你是否了解敌人的火焰……对于那些，你必须浇灭……去吧，回来以后可以向他领取奖赏。"
G["Then I ask you again: WHAT HAVE YOU DONE!"]="那么，我再问你一次，你都干了些什么！"
G["Then I have no other choice than to kill you."]="那我别无选择，只能杀了你。"
G["Then I must consider this an act of treason."]="那么，我只能将你的决定视为叛国了。"
G["Then I remind you...WE are the strongest in this forest. We are the kings of the trees! We are death to our enemies!"]="我要提醒你们……我们才是这片森林里最强的存在。我们是森林之王！我们是敌人的死神！"
G["Then I will force you down! Wind grant me flight!"]="我会击败你的！风啊，让我飞翔吧！"
G["Then I will open the way into the Eye of Eternity. You must not fail, heroes. The future of Azeroth hinges on your actions."]="我会打开通向永恒之眼的通路。英雄们，你们绝不能失败，艾泽拉斯的未来寄托在你们身上。"
G["Then I'll commit myself to ignoring you."]="我保证那时候我会对你不理不睬的。"
G["Then I'm sure you won't mind if I accompany you on your mission."]="那么我相信，如果我陪同你完成这个任务，你是不会介意的。"
G["Then Orgrimmar is where you need to go.  The north road out of Razor Hill leads directly there.  Just talk to one of the grunts there and they can give you further directions."]="你得去奥格瑞玛。出了剃刀岭沿着北面的道路走，就能到那儿了。跟那儿的守卫谈谈，他们会给你指明方向的。"
G["Then Orkus WILL DO IT! YES!"]="奥尔库斯会成功的！没错！"
G["Then again, why kill myself... when I can kill YOU instead!"]="那么，我为什么要把自己杀死……我可以杀死你！"
G["Then all is in order. The master has given us a mission of the utmost importance and he will not suffer failure."]="看来，一切都按部就班。主人将最重要的任务给了我们，他不会接受失败的。"
G["Then come, hermit!"]="来吧，隐士！"
G["Then fortunate it is, that I have reclaimed the noble naaru's spark from where it fell! Where faith dwells, hope is never lost, young blood elf."]="幸运的是，我在这位高贵的纳鲁陨落的地方回收了他的火种！在火种中，希望仍然没有消逝，年轻的血精灵。"
G["Then he's out there alone! We've got to find him!"]="他独自留在外面了？！我们得去找他！"
G["Then head over to Bena's Alchemy on the middle rise and talk to Bena herself.  She will be able to help you master the art of potion brewing."]="到中部高地的“本娜的炼金店”去找本娜，她可以指导你学习配制药剂的方法。"
G["Then it happened... all at once! A whole mess of fighters came outta nowhere, sir..."]="然后突然之间……意外发生了！不知从哪里冒出来一大堆不速之客，长官……"
G["Then it is Thelman Slatefist that you wish to speak to. You can find him in the presence of the King at Stormwind Keep."]="战场军官"
G["Then it is done."]="那就这样吧。"
G["Then it is option two."]="好吧，那我就要用第二种解决方式了。"
G["Then it is to Taim Ragetotem that you must speak. Seek him out on the Hunter Rise."]="你一定是在说泰姆·暴怒图腾。去猎人高地找他。"
G["Then it is with great pride that I tell you that Brakgul Deathbringer stands ready in the Hall of Arms to aid you on your way to Warsong Gulch. Seek him out in the Valley of Honor."]="我要骄傲地告诉你，布拉古尔就在武器大厅，他可以帮助你前往战歌峡谷。去荣誉谷找他吧。"
G["Then let Archimonde do his worst."]="那么就让阿克蒙德再吃一场败仗吧！"
G["Then let it be done."]="那就接受吧。"
G["Then let the Legion do their worst!"]="那么让燃烧军团尽管使出他们的手段吧！"
G["Then let those towers be their tombs! Lay waste to them!"]="那就让这些哨塔变成他们的坟墓吧！干掉他们！"
G["Then let us begin."]="让我们开始吧。"
G["Then let us pretend that you undergo the long and arduous task of creating the bane necessary to break through the demonic wards placed upon the triad. What would be your next course of action? To face the Defiler in his lair?\n\n<Loramus laughs.>"]="Entonces supongamos que acometes la larga y ardua tarea de dar toda la guerra necesaria para penetrar en las salas demoníacas de la tríada. ¿Cuál sería tu siguiente estrategia? ¿Enfrentarte al Rapiñador en su guarida?\n\n<Loramus se ríe.>"
G["Then listen well, $c.\n\nCan you feel the power radiating from me? Does your morale not swell? Aye, it is the same for the other side. To disrupt their defenses and thin out their troops will be no easy task, but it must be done! Victory will be ours!"]="那么听好了，$c。\n\n你能感知到从我身上散发出的力量吗？你的士气不够？是的，对另一方来说也是这样。要破坏瓦解他们的军队并不容易，但是必须完成任务！胜利是属于我们的！"
G["Then listen well, $r.\n\nSeveral months ago, the Magistrate of Lakeshire sent envoys to Ironforge, pleading with the King for assistance with the Blackrock incursions coming from Redridge and the Burning Steppes.\n\nPrincess Moira volunteered to help, against my pleadings. I was assigned twenty elite guardsmen to protect the Princess through the perilous journey from the Loch to Lakeshire."]="Pues escucha atentamente, $r.\n\nUnos meses atrás, el magistrado de Villa del Lago envió mensajeros a Forjaz, para pedir ayuda al rey con las incursiones de los Roca Negra que venían de Crestagrana y de las Estepas Ardientes.\n\nLa princesa Moira se ofreció a ayudar, desoyendo mis súplicas. Me asignaron veinte guardias de élite para proteger a la princesa durante el peligroso viaje desde Loch hasta Villa del Lago."
G["Then may the Light save you and raise you up."]="那么，愿圣光拯救你，激励你。"
G["Then maybe there is still hope..."]="也许还有希望……"
G["Then meet me at the entrance to the abbey. I'll be along in short order."]="去修道院门口等我吧。我很快就会过去的。"
G["Then put twice as much in next time!"]="下次放双倍的剂量好了！"
G["Then repeat after me: \"Lok'tar ogar! Victory or death - it is these words that bind me to the Horde. For they are the most sacred and fundamental of truths to any warrior of the Horde.\nI give my flesh and blood freely to the Warchief. I am the instrument of my Warchief's desire. I am a weapon of my Warchief's command.\nFrom this moment until the end of days I live and die - For the Horde!\""]="Entonces repite conmigo: \"¡Lok'tar ogar! Victoria o muerte: estas son las palabras que me unen a la Horda, ya que son las más sagradas y fundamentales verdades para cualquier guerrero de la Horda.\n\nEntrego mi cuerpo y sangre libremente al Jefe de Guerra. Soy el instrumento de los deseos de mi Jefe de Guerra. Soy el arma de las órdenes de mi Jefe de Guerra.\n\n¡A partir de este momento y durante el resto de mis días vivo y muero por la Horda!\""
G["Then teach me, Kel'Thuzad. Teach me everything you know..."]="那么，克尔苏加德，教我吧，把你知道的东西都教给我……"
G["Then the Sunreavers betray her trust and open portals straight ta the Bell from her own city!"]="然后夺日者竟然背叛了她的信任，在她的城市里直接开启传送门，通往安放那口圣钟的地方！"
G["Then the darkness came. It seeped from the ground. Slowly, it infected us...suffocated us!"]="然后，黑暗降临了。它从地下渗出，逐渐侵蚀了我们……吞噬了我们！"
G["Then the mogu were overthrown."]="于是魔古族的政权被推翻了。"
G["Then the sharks came."]="然后鲨鱼来了。"
G["Then they killed the subjects of the mogu."]="接着，他们屠戮魔古的臣民。"
G["Then they will die an honorable death in combat!"]="那就让他们光荣地战死吧！"
G["Then this starts happening..."]="就要开始了……"
G["Then truly, we are lost."]="那么，我们就真的失败了。"
G["Then we cut our way through the Nerubians."]="那样的话，我们就必须和蛛魔交手了。"
G["Then we have a deal. I'll see you in battle, $n."]="那就这么说定了。战斗中见吧，$n。"
G["Then we leave!"]="出发吧！"
G["Then we must not waste anymore time. Are the chromatic dragonflight ready?"]="我们不能再浪费时间了。多彩龙人准备好了吗？"
G["Then we must put an end to Athrikus Narassin. Tell me, spirit, where might we find the other soulgems, to undo his magic?"]="我们该与埃瑟里克斯·纳拉辛有个了断了。自然之灵啊，告诉我，去哪里才能找到其它的灵魂宝石来解除他的魔法？"
G["Then we must save him! If we rescue Bolvar Fordragon, we may quell the unrest between the Alliance and the Horde."]="那我们必须去救他！如果我们救出了伯瓦尔·弗塔根，就能平息联盟和部落无休止的纷争。"
G["Then we will stand astride this world as its masters -"]="我们将成为这个世界真正的主人。"
G["Then we'll protect it with our lives. Son, I need you with me on this. We in this together?"]=" 那更要用生命来保护它。孩子！你要帮我。我们一起上阵？"
G["Then what are we to do, wife? The others cannot find out. Should they learn of this aberration, we will all be executed."]="那要怎么办？一旦他们发现了这个畸形的胎儿，我们就会被处死。"
G["Then what are you doing here?"]="那么，你还待在这儿做什么？"
G["Then what happened?"]="后来发生了什么事？"
G["Then what?"]="然后呢？"
G["Then who are these people?"]="那么这些人是谁？"
G["Then why don't you go and do that? My friends and I have better things to do!"]="那么你不赶快去做这件事？我的朋友们和我还有更重要的事要去做呢！"
G["Then witness my new gifts, bestowed by this world's true masters."]="那么见证我的新力量，来自世界真主的恩赐！"
G["Then you are a fool."]="你这蠢货。"
G["Then you are a fool. Do you not know what I am?"]="Entonces eres $gun insensato:una insensata;. ¿Sabes lo que soy?"
G["Then you become enemies of my lord, Illidan. Enemies of Illidan are destroyed. Are your giants able to withstand an attack from the forces of Eclipse Point?"]="那么你就是伊利丹大人的敌人，而伊利丹的敌人都会灭亡。你的巨人能经受得住日蚀岗哨军队的进攻吗？"
G["Then you have forced my hand.  I will correct the mistake I made long ago.  Spirits of the wind, the earth, the water, hear my call!  Come to my aid!"]="这是你逼我的。我要纠正过去犯下的错误。狂风、大地、流水之灵，听从我的召唤！请帮助我！"
G["Then you have lost, Highlord."]="那你就输定了，大领主。"
G["Then you leave me no choice. I won't say that I won't enjoy this."]="看来我别无选择了。好吧，其实我很乐意这样对付你的。"
G["Then you must send a messenger to the Lich King. Ready my forces to attack upon his word."]="那你必须派人给巫妖王送个消息。就说我的军队已经整装待发，就等他一声令下了。"
G["Then you take responsibility for its actions, Stone Lord.  You will be the one answering to me when it shows its true intent."]="那么你将对它的行为担负起责任来，石领主。当它的真实意图显露之后，你将必须给我一个解释。"
G["Then you will die."]="那你就去死吧。"
G["Then, Liu Lang went up to the Wood of Staves, carrying with him a bamboo umbrella that he always took on his adventures."]="然后，刘浪去了禅杖林，身上背着那柄随他四处游历的竹伞。"
G["Then, by the powers vested in me... the powers vested in me..."]="那么，以我被赋予的权力……我被赋予的权力……"
G["Then, we maybe take a rest? Sit down for a while?"]="我们可以休息一下吗？坐下来歇一会儿？"
G["Then...you do not need to bear it alone. Just sit next to me and forget your troubles, if only for a while."]="现在……你不需要独自面对这一切。坐到我身边来，忘记你的困扰吧。哪怕一会儿也好。"
G["Theralion, Halion, and Abyssion."]="瑟纳利昂、海里昂和艾比希昂。"
G["Theralion, I will engulf the hallway. Cover their escape!"]="瑟纳利昂，我去包抄门厅。堵住他们的退路！"
G["Theralion, Shadron, and Abyssion."]="瑟纳利昂、沙德隆和艾比希昂。"
G["Therazane be happy to get middle fragment."]="塞拉赞恩一定会很高兴取得中部碎片的。"
G["Therazane's doom is assured!"]="塞拉赞恩必死无疑！"
G["Therazane's finally gathered the nerve to challenge us, has she?"]="塞拉赞恩终于攒足了勇气来挑战我们，是吧？"
G["There $g he : she; is!"]="¡Ahí está!"
G["There $g he : she; is! Oh, yer my favorite $g lad : lass;, yes you are, $n!"]="¡Ahí está! ¡Oh, eres mi $gfavorito:favorita;, $n!"
G["There $g he : she; is. You're welcome here anytime, $n."]="$g他:她;在那儿。这里随时欢迎你，$n。"
G["There - do you feel it? A perfect stillness of the soul! Feel the dream brew take effect."]="感觉到了吗？源自灵魂的完美宁静！"
G["There - the slave master! Hold his attention while I undo the lock."]="看——奴隶主！你去引开他，我来开锁。"
G["There - they've fallen!"]="那边——他们落下去了！"
G["There I was tumbling in a patch of prickly undergrowth with a talbuk stag, hand-to-hand, only my sharp knife...<cough>... and keen hunter's intellect to save me.\n\nAll of a sudden I'm jumped by a pair of fierce windroc hunters that came at me from the skies!  Their cowardly attack...<cough>... didn't help them any though.\n\nAnd while I have their beaks as trophies, I received an infected scratch out of the ordeal.  Kind of nasty, and I'm in a lot of pain, but I'm sure it'll heal up in a day or two."]="Y ahí estaba, cara a cara con un venado talbuk y armado solo con mi cuchillo... <tose>... y mi inteligencia de cazador curtido que me salvaría el pellejo.\n\nDe repente, ¡veo que un par de vientorrocs cazadores se lanzan sobre mí desde el cielo! Su ataque a traición... <tose> no me ayudó demasiado tampoco.\n\nMe quedé con sus picos de trofeo, pero también tengo una cicatriz infectada de recuerdo. Es muy fea y me duele mucho, pero estoy seguro de que curará en un día o dos."
G["There I was, minding my own business, enjoying a nice game of cards when these Silver Covenant... slugs came around telling us to hand over our belongings. What gives?"]="当时我正自得其乐地玩着牌，那可是副好牌啊……忽然这些银色盟约的流氓就闯进来叫我们收拾东西走人。凭什么？"
G["There MUST be a way to make more money off of this holiday."]="肯·定·有什么办法能趁这节日的时候发上一笔！"
G["There Scourge outside Trade Quarter!"]="天灾军团就在贸易区门外！"
G["There Will Be Blood!"]="你在这里只能得到鲜血！"
G["There are $3094W activated dwarves!"]="这儿有$3094W个活蹦乱跳的矮人！"
G["There are Alliance survivors!  Send... reinforcements..."]="有联盟幸存者！快派……援军……"
G["There are FOUR lights!"]="有四道光！四道！"
G["There are Tian disciples in town celebrating the Brewmoon, $n! Surely they could use their training to help us. Talk to them and see if they can stop these yaungol!"]="小镇上有天禅院弟子在庆祝酿月祭，$n！他们可以用学到的技艺帮助我们。和他们谈一谈，看他们是否可以阻止那些野牛人！"
G["There are Tian mistweavers here from the Tian monastery, $n. Their skills with mistweaving would allow us to fight even longer! Ask them to aid us in this fight."]="小镇上有来自天禅院的天禅院织雾者，$n。他们在制造迷雾方面的能力可以帮助我们战斗得更久。请他们在战斗中帮助我们。"
G["There are Twilight's Hammer to be slain."]="还有暮光之锤的暴徒没消灭干净。"
G["There are a few ways to earn our esteem.\n\nWe are busy dealing with sha eruptions at Firebough Nook in Kun-Lai Summit. Help us there, and you will gain a foothold into our brotherhood.\n\nThe Shado-Pan Monastery is also in trouble. You may be able to assist our brothers and sisters there.\n\nThe Sha of Anger roams the fields of Kun-Lai to the north. Defeat it, and you will gain great respect from our order.\n\nA Shado-Pan contigent chases the Sha of Hatred in the Townlong Steppes. They may need help.\n\nIf you wish to earn our highest esteem, you must first prove yourself by earning revered standing with the Golden Lotus. Only then, speak to my brothers and sisters at Shado-Pan Garrison in the Townlong Steppes."]="Hay muchas formas de ganarse nuestra estima.\n\nNos enfrentamos a las erupciones de sha del Rincón Tallo Ardiente, en la Cima Kun-Lai. Ayudarnos allí sería un primer paso.\n\nEl Monasterio del Shadopan también está en peligro. Tal vez puedas ayudar a nuestros hermanos.\n\nEl Sha de la ira asola los campos de Kun-Lai, al norte. Si lo derrotas, ganarás gran respeto en nuestra orden.\n\nUn contingente del Shadopan persigue al Sha del odio en las Estepas de Tong Long. Quizás necesiten ayuda.\n\nSi deseas ganarte la mayor estima, primero debes demostrar tu valía alcanzando el estado de $gvenerado:venerada; con el Loto Dorado. Solo entonces deberás hablar con mis hermanos y hermanas del Cuartel del Shadopan, en las Estepas de Tong Long."
G["There are a lot of corpses out there.  Nicely done, $p."]="真是尸横遍地啊。干得不错，$p。"
G["There are a number of skilled tradesmen scattered around Azuremyst. Which one are you looking for?"]="有几个熟练的工匠分散在秘蓝岛周围。你在找哪一个？"
G["There are a thousand reasons, but you must decide what is worth fighting for."]="说一千道一万，你还是要做出决定，究竟什么才值得我们为之而战。"
G["There are at least three ways beneath Dalaran: Sewer entrances in the east and west, and a well in the north."]="达拉然至少有三条地下通道：东部和西部各有一个下水道入口，北部还有一口井。"
G["There are basics that must be learned. Trianna is standing nearby, speak with her and return to me later."]="必须首先学习一些基础知识。蒂安娜就站在旁边，找她谈谈然后回来找我。"
G["There are clams to be collected and orcas to be killed. Help or stay out of the way!"]="我们要忙着收集贝壳和消灭逆戟鲸呢。你要么来帮忙，要么就别挡路！"
G["There are costs with war, $c... ones often overlooked.  Those costs are the orphans - children who have lost their parents to the far-too-numerous conflicts that rage across Azeroth.  Those children who have no one else to turn to often come here to live until they are old enough to fend for themselves.\n\nOne week out of the year during the Spring, the Alliance takes time to give something back to these innocents.  This time is called Children's Week."]="La guerra conlleva unos costes, $c... Unos que, a menudo, se pasan por alto. Esos costes son los huérfanos, niños que han perdido a sus padres en los demasiado numerosos conflictos que asolan Azeroth. Esos niños, que no tienen a quien acudir, a menudo vienen a vivir aquí hasta que son lo suficientemente mayores para no depender de nadie.\n\nUna semana al año, en la primavera, la Alianza intenta darles algo a estos inocentes. Y esto se llama la Semana de los Niños."
G["There are costs with war, $c... ones often overlooked.  Those costs are the orphans - children who have lost their parents to the far-too-numerous conflicts that rage across Azeroth.  Those children who have no one else to turn to often come here to live until they are old enough to fend for themselves.\n\nOne week out of the year during the Spring, the Horde takes time to give something back to these innocents.  This time is called Children's Week."]="La guerra conlleva unos costes, $c... Unos que, a menudo, se pasan por alto. Esos costes son los huérfanos, niños que han perdido a sus padres en los demasiado numerosos conflictos que asolan Azeroth. Esos niños, que no tienen a quien acudir, a menudo vienen a vivir aquí hasta que son lo suficientemente mayores para no depender de nadie.\n\nUna semana al año, en la primavera, la Horda intenta darles algo a estos inocentes. Y esto se llama la Semana de los Niños."
G["There are demons to kill, $c.  Do you have the backbone to do what needs to be done?"]="有很多恶魔要去消灭，$c。你有没有勇往直前的气概？"
G["There are dozens of the pesky little brats. Can't grab the orbs with them tormenting us. Can't catch them to kill them.\n\nAt least I haven't lost my weapon, unlike some people..."]="这儿有一大群让人讨厌的捣蛋鬼。它们一直骚扰着我们，我们都没法抓住到宝珠。没能把它们抓住千刀万剐。\n\n不过，至少我还没把武器弄丢，不像某些人……"
G["There are eight types of Darkmoon Cards; Beasts, Blessings, Elementals, Furies, Lunacy, Portals, Storms and Warlords, with eight cards, Ace to Eight in each suit. If you collect all eight of one suit then you can turn them into a deck that you can give to our Professor Thaddeus Paleo in exchange for a powerful trinket."]="暗月卡片共有八套：野兽、祝福、元素、报复、愚人、入口、风暴和督军，每套卡片各有八张。如果你能集齐一套八张卡片，就能用一副暗月套牌在萨杜斯·帕雷教授处兑换到强大的饰品。"
G["There are enough parts to rebuild it. Stronger, faster, better!"]="重铸所需的部件已经足够了，我们的目标是：更高、更快、更强！"
G["There are few left in the world who can prepare the Ward of Waking, $n. We are fortunate that I am among them."]="在这个世界上没有几个人有能力使用唤醒戒卫了，$n。我们很幸运，因为我就是其中之一。"
G["There are few things you can trust in life. Steel, you can trust."]="一生当中能信任的东西可不多。钢铁就是其中之一。"
G["There are few thundering cloud serpents left in our world."]="这个世界上的雷霆云端翔龙已经很稀少了。"
G["There are four August Celestials who rule over this land.\n\nYu'lon the Jade Serpent, lifegiver of the east.\n\nChi-Ji the Red Crane, hope of the south.\n\nXuen the White Tiger, whose strength upholds the north.\n\nAnd Niuzao the Black Ox, who stands tall in the west.\n\nRecently, with the advent of the sha, turmoil has engulfed each of their temples. They need our help, $r."]="四个至尊天神统治着这片土地。\n\n青龙玉珑，东方的生命赋予者。\n\n朱雀赤精，南方的希望。\n\n白虎雪怒，他的力量维护着北方的和平。\n\n玄牛砮皂，他屹立在西方的天际。\n\n最近，随着煞魔的蠢蠢欲动，杂念已经开始席卷各个寺院。他们需要我们的帮助，$r。"
G["There are four generators powering the defense structures. If you sabotage the generators, the missile attacks will stop!"]="总共有四座能源塔为这些防御设施提供能量。如果你们能炸掉那些塔，导弹攻击就会立即停止！"
G["There are four other votes you'll need to get, but that'll come in time."]="你们还得争取到另外四张选票才行，但迟早会有的。"
G["There are fundamental things you must learn before I can aid you. Speak to my apprentice, Vhan. He is kind and patient and will teach you what you need to know."]="在我帮你之前你必须学会一些基础的东西。与我的徒弟范恩谈谈。他很耐心而且愿意教你所需的知识。"
G["There are healers under some of the wreckage!  Get them free."]="不少治疗者被困在了残骸里。救他们出来！"
G["There are hundreds of them! Maybe thousands! They will attack at any moment! I'm sure of it!"]="他们有几百人！甚至可能有几千人！他们随时可能发动进攻！我敢肯定！"
G["There are hunters training in Old Town's Command Center as well as in the Dwarven District."]="在旧城区指挥部与矮人区里都能找到猎人训练师。"
G["There are intruders about. Slay them before they ruin everything!"]="入侵者！杀死他们，不然他们会毁了一切！"
G["There are intruders within the temple!"]="寺院内有入侵者！"
G["There are many dangers facing us, but we cannot find ourselves neglecting nature, lest it neglect us in our time of need. We've learned this lesson before."]="我们要面对许多危险，但我们不能因此而忽视自然。这样的话，自然将会在我们有所需要时舍我们而去。我们曾经有过这样的教训。"
G["There are many establishments where you can get a drink in Stormwind, but only one will let you spend the night. Head over to the Gilded Rose in the Trade District. I've heard the cost of a room is reasonable and the sheets are clean."]="在暴风城，有很多地方可供饮水休息，但是只有一处可以过夜。去贸易区的镶金玫瑰吧。我听说客房的费用相当合理，被单也很整洁。"
G["There are many gathered here from many walks of life. Today, we are all equal as audience to these epic battles."]="这里聚集了来自各行各业的人们。今天，我们都是观众，来此观看这些史诗般的战斗。"
G["There are many hidden things on this island. You should seek them out."]="这座岛上隐藏着许多秘密。你得把它们找出来。"
G["There are many lessons left to learn, let us move onto our next subject..."]="你们对阴影世界的了解还远远不够……"
G["There are many mailboxes in Dalaran: On many corners, outside nearly every inn and bank, even upon Krasus' Landing."]="达拉然设有许多信箱：你可以在各个街道转角，旅店和银行外以及克拉苏斯平台找到它们。"
G["There are many o' us in the Explorer's League who stay in the library, cataloguing and analyzing all of our findings.\n\nI spent the last five years doin' just that while Brann went out into the world, caperin' from one inneresting site to another.\n\nWell Hilda's finally back in the field, and it's about time I find somethin' BIG!"]="探险者联盟的许多成员都得窝在图书馆里整理和分析我们的发现。\n\n我就曾这样度过了整整5年，而布莱恩却能周游世界，探索各种神奇的古迹。\n\n现在，希尔达终于重返野外了，我一定能搞出些大发现！"
G["There are many obstacles one must overcome on the path to excellence. Your path is no exception..."]="一个人在通向成功的路上必须克服很多困难。你的道路也不例外……"
G["There are many places of interest in Dalaran. Which do you seek?"]="达拉然有许多有趣的地方。你想去哪里？"
G["There are many places that you might visit in Teldrassil.  Tell me what you seek."]="泰达希尔有许多你需要去看看的地方。告诉我你在找什么。"
G["There are many secrets that may be unlocked with patience and determination. Now, let us begin..."]="只要有耐心和决心，很多秘密都是有可能解开的。现在，让我们开始吧……"
G["There are many wonderful poisons, Wakener. Some can boil you alive. Some will eat your flesh. Some burst you open from the inside.\n\nSo many wonderful varieties."]="Hay muchos venenos maravillosos, heraldo. Algunos pueden cocerte $gvivo:viva;. Otros te devoran la carne. Otros te hacen estallar desde dentro.\n\nHay muchas variedades maravillosas."
G["There are master miners located at the Greenstone Quarry in the Jade Forest. They can probably help you improve your skill. I will mark the location on your map."]="大师级矿工就在翡翠林的绿石采掘场。他们也许能帮你提升技能。我会在你的地图上标出他们的位置。"
G["There are more at the east pass!"]="敌人聚集到东边去了！"
G["There are more attackers coming from Garm. Get some mines on that field!"]="越来越多的攻击者从加姆涌来。迅速埋设地雷！"
G["There are more coming. Defend yourself! Don't fall out of the anti-magic field! They'll tear you apart without its protection!"]="敌人再次发动了攻击。注意安全！别离开反魔法区域！没有屏障的保护，他们轻易就能将你撕成碎片！"
G["There are more of them!"]="来了更多敌人！"
G["There are more survivors to tend to. I'll see you on the shore."]="还有许多幸存者需要救治。我们海滩上再见吧。"
G["There are more than enough to go around. Should you need other goods, don't hesitate to ask!"]="我的物资供应非常充足。如果你们还需要其它的货物，欢迎随时来找我！"
G["There are more that might still be alive! We need to keep moving."]="可能还有更多的幸存者！我们必须继续前进。"
G["There are more to the south!"]="敌人聚集到南边去了！"
G["There are more up ahead - keep at it!"]="前面还有更多的铁矮人——坚持！"
G["There are mysteries in this place that we, the orcs, are desperate to uncover.  Mysteries of our past, mysteries of our future, and mysteries that offer glimpses inside us.\n\nIt is my hope to pierce these mysteries... will you walk that path with me?"]="这里有着我们兽人不顾一切想要揭开的秘密。有关我们过去的秘密，有关我们未来的秘密，还有能够反映我们内心的秘密。\n\n我毕生的愿望就是揭开这些秘密的面纱……你愿意和我一起进行研究吗？"
G["There are new, stronger elementals attacking, but the fires are out of control!  Eliminate the elementals and get a handle on those fires."]="现在发动进攻的是一波更强大的元素生物，不过那些火元素已经失控！清除那些元素生物，控制住那些火元素。"
G["There are no battlemasters here in the Vale.\n\nYou must return to your home city to queue for battlegrounds or arenas of war."]="在谷中没有战场军官。\n\n你必须返回主城，才能加入战场或竞技场的战斗队列。"
G["There are no emotions. There are no morals. There are no zealots.\n\nThere is only the Brotherhood.\n\nHere, in the very chapel where Uther the Lightbringer joined the Order of the Silver Hand, I, Korfax, Champion of the Light, will inspire fear into the fearless.\n\nNothing will curb my fury - not the Scarlet Crusade, not the Argent Dawn, not my brothers, not even you."]="这里没有激动，这里没有道统，这里没有狂热。\n\n凝聚在这里的只有兄弟间生死与共的誓言。\n\n乌瑟尔·光明使者就是在这座礼拜堂中加入了白银之手骑士团。而我，科尔法克斯，圣光之勇士，将在此地让无畏者感到恐惧。\n\n没有任何力量能抑制我的愤怒——血色十字不行，银色黎明不行，我的兄弟们不行，你同样不行。"
G["There are no freebies here, move on."]="这里可没有免费的午餐，走吧。"
G["There are no more available rides! There should be one available very soon... <PH>"]="¡No hay más paseos disponibles! Muy pronto debería haber uno disponible... <PH>"
G["There are no whispers in your mind. You're imagining it. Back to work!"]="根本没有什么低语声。都是你自己想象出来的。回去干活！"
G["There are only 3 kinds of people in this world: competitors, customers, and employees. Competitors are to be crushed ruthlessly, customers indulged, and employees strictly supervised.\n\nIndependent contractors are a myth.They want to be paid better than employees, but treated like customers. Never trust one who calls himself by that title."]="在这个世界上只有3种人：竞争者，顾客和雇员。竞争者会被无情地碾碎，顾客需要被满足，而雇员则应该被严格地管理。\n\n不受约束的承包者是一个神话。他们希望得到比雇员更多的回报，但是要像顾客一样对待他们。永远都不要相信自称是承包者的人。"
G["There are only two truths to be found here: First, that time is chaotic, always in flux, and completely malleable and second, perception does not dictate reality."]="在这里只有两条真理：首先，时间是混乱的，永远在不停地变化，并且可以完全改变。第二，感觉并不代表真实。"
G["There are other fights to be had within Jotunheim if you are not skilled enough for Valhalas."]="如果你目前的实力还不足以参加瓦哈拉斯的战斗，那么在尤顿海姆地区还有其他类型的比赛。"
G["There are others like me. Paragons of each era, frozen in time and buried safely beyond the whispers of the Empress."]="各时代的英杰，包括我，都被凝固在时间长河中，埋藏在女皇无法控制的地方。"
G["There are plants in Felwood that may be saved from corruption when Cenarion plant salve is applied to them.  I know how to make the salve from several different kinds of items; based on your skill set, you may find that you have multiple options to assist me.\n\nYou will also need a Cenarion beacon for your work here; it is a device that allows you to see the taint and corruption of nature that the naked eye will miss."]="费伍德的某些植物或许能因为塞纳里奥植物药膏的效用而避免堕落。我知道如何从几种不同的东西中获取这种药膏，凭借你的能力，你会发现有多种方法可以协助我制造药膏。\n\n首先，你需要一盏塞纳里奥信标，它是一种能让你看到肉眼所看不到的堕落和腐烂力量的装置。"
G["There are plenty more where that came from!"]="像那样的还多得是呢！"
G["There are plenty of targets out there for both of us..."]="外面的对手足够我们杀的了……"
G["There are plenty of thermal vents up ahead, $n. Feel free to use them if you get into a jam."]="前面有很多热排气口，$n。如果你不小心陷入困境，可以利用它们来脱困。"
G["There are quite a few trainers available in Elwynn.  Which one are you looking for?"]="在艾尔文森林只有少数职业的训练师。你在找谁？"
G["There are routes traced from this Auberdine to several locations.  It almost looks like an evacuation plan."]="上面标注了一些路线，从奥伯丁出发，数个目的地。看起来像是撤离计划。"
G["There are rumors o' heroes fightin' back the elementals, but we'll conjure more."]="有传闻说，一些英雄将元素打退了，但我们还会召唤更多元素。"
G["There are secrets contained within these halls that are beyond our wildest dreams."]="高墙内的秘密远远超越了我们的想象。"
G["There are several battlegrounds from which to choose.  To which battlemaster shall I send you?"]="有许多战场可供选择，你要去哪一个呢？"
G["There are several prominent bills tacked up on the board here.\n\nHowever, the fine-print indicates that you're not quite ready for either of the tasks at hand.  You should definitely check back later!"]="Hay varias notas destacadas en el tablón.\n\nSin embargo, la letra pequeña indica que no estás $gpreparado:preparada; para ninguna de las tareas. ¡Definitivamente deberías volver más tarde!"
G["There are so MANY of them..."]="他们的数量太多了……"
G["There are so many choices, I can't decide!"]="好多品种啊，我不知道该选哪个了！"
G["There are so many cute, little rats!"]="那里有好多可爱的小老鼠！"
G["There are so many great stories to uncover. So much history. Isn't it fascinating?"]="还有那么多精彩的故事等着我们去探寻。那么多历史。难道不使人着迷吗？"
G["There are so many strange and interesting things in this land. It is different, but I am impressed."]="这片土地上有太多陌生又新奇的东西了。虽然和我的家乡非常不同，可给我留下了深刻的印象。"
G["There are so many things to buy."]="想买的东西太多了。"
G["There are so many wounded..."]="这么多伤患……"
G["There are some Vale marksmen in town that stopped to rest for the night, $n. They have defended the Gate of the Setting Sun against the mantid for many years with their mortars. See if you can wake them up!"]="小镇上有一些锦绣谷神射手，他们在这里过夜休息，$n。他们用迫击炮在残阳关和螳螂妖战斗了很多年。你看一下能不能叫醒他们！"
G["There are some damaged cannons inside the storehouses and behind the inn, $n. If you could repair them, the villagers could use them to blast the yaungol!"]="旅馆后面的仓库里有一些破损的大炮，$n。如果你可以修复这些大炮，村民们就可以用它们击退野牛人！"
G["There are some jovial villagers in town that claim they created a helmet that makes them better at everything. While I'm skeptical, having a helmet on couldn't hurt, right? Talk to them and see if they'll lend you one."]="小镇上有一些快活的村民，他们说他们制造了一种能够让所有事情更加顺利进行的头盔。虽然我表示怀疑，但戴上头盔又没有什么损失，你说呢？和他们谈一谈，看他们是不是愿意借你一个。"
G["There are some rather cryptic instructions in this note. Brann must've had some kind of backup plan, but he can't keep evading capture forever..."]="日记中记载着一些晦涩难懂的信息。布莱恩一定有后备计划，但他不可能永远不被抓到……"
G["There are some rewards fit only for those who have attained the title of Crusader, exalted in the eyes of the Argent Crusade as well as all their allied peoples.\n\nTirion himself has charged me with the finding of such heroes and bestowing upon them the proper decorations."]="有些奖励只会赠予那些赢得了银色北伐军及其盟友的崇拜，获得了十字军头衔的战士。\n\n提里奥亲自授命令我寻找这样的英雄，并赐予他们应得的奖章。"
G["There are some that would call us barbarians... the \"mongrel races\" of Azeroth."]="Hay quien nos llama bárbaros... las \"razas salvajes\" de Azeroth."
G["There are some who call me 'Tim,' but to my friends, I am 'the specialist.'"]="Algunos me llaman \"Tim\", pero para mis amigos soy \"el especialista\"."
G["There are some who desire to stop gaining experience from their actions; to forever remain at the level of strength they are now, and never grow stronger.\n\nI can make this possible... for a fee, of course.\n\nBut understand this: Once you pay me, you will NO LONGER GAIN EXPERIENCE. None. Not one whit.\n\nShould you change your mind afterwards and want to start gaining experience again, I can undo the process for the same fee."]="的确会有人不再想获得经验。他们想永远停留在现有的水平，不再变得更强。\n\n我可以实现这一点……当然，我需要收取一些费用。\n\n但你要明白：一旦你把酬金支付给我，你就无法再获得经验了。是一直，而不是一段时间。\n\n如果你以后又改变主意，想要重新开始获取经验，也可以向我支付同样多的酬金，让我解除这一禁制。"
G["There are some who do not believe in the legendary Night Elf Mohawks.\n\nI pity the fools."]="有人不相信传说中的暗夜精灵莫霍克。\n\n真为他们悲哀。"
G["There are stable masters in both Old Town and the Dwarven District."]="在旧城区与矮人区都能找到兽栏管理员。"
G["There are stable masters just outside both the draenei and blood elf inns on Aldor Rise and Scryer's Tier."]="在奥尔多高地的德莱尼旅店和占星者平台的血精灵旅店外面都能找到兽栏管理员。"
G["There are stables just beyond Old Town's southeast gates. You can find a riding trainer and a horse breeder there."]="马厩就在旧城区东南门边上。你在那里能找到骑术训练师与养马人。"
G["There are still lessons you must learn from others before my knowledge may be shared with you. Be diligent, and do not give up hope."]="在我传授你知识之前，你还必须从其他人那里学习一些课程。勤奋些，不要放弃希望。"
G["There are still others - search the barracks!"]="还有其他人——搜索整座营地！"
G["There are those that attempt to follow the path of the Rogue, but only the night elves are truly embraced by the night.  If you seek to walk the shaded path then find Syurna in the Cenarion Enclave."]="很多人都试图追随潜行者的脚步，但是只有暗夜精灵能真正被黑夜接受。如果你想在阴暗的道路上前行的话，就去塞纳里奥区找塞尤娜吧。"
G["There are those that would teach you of Herbalism in the great home of Thunder Bluff away to the north.  Follow the road out of the village to get there and at the base of the bluff ride the elevator to the top of the rise.  There are many Bluffwatchers there who can direct you further."]="在北方的雷霆崖，你能学到草药学。沿着村外的道路走，乘坐雷霆崖升降梯到达顶部。那儿的守卫能为你指明方向。"
G["There are those who seek to lie and twist the truth.  Seers, on the other hand, bring the truth to light.\n\nThe purpose of this library, $n, is to make a seer out of everyone."]="Están aquellos que intentan mentir y tergiversar la realidad. Los videntes, por otra parte, llevan la verdad a la luz.\n\nEl fin de esta biblioteca, $n, es convertir a todo el mundo en profeta."
G["There are those who would say that the Argent Crusade is a thing of the past.  I am one of them, but not because the Scourge have fallen.\n\nNo... it is because of their stubborn ways.  They've become too much like the church that they seceded from: too rigid, too governed by honor and order.  This is what I'm trying to tell Barthalomew, anyhow.\n\nSure, it may sound a bit jingoistic, but it makes for a good debate."]="有些人认为银色黎明已经是明日黄花。我也持相同的观点，但不是因为天灾军团的威胁已经消除。\n\n不……真正的原因是他们因循守旧的行事风格。他们变得和其努力摆脱的教会越来越像——太过刻板，太过受制于荣耀与秩序。总之，这正是我想要说给巴萨罗梅听的。\n\n当然，这听起来有些过于激进，不过应该会激发一次有意义的辩论。"
G["There are three banks in the city: The Bank of Dalaran in the north, the Dalaran Merchants' Bank in the south, and one more beneath the city, in the sewers."]="达拉然内设有三座银行：北部的达拉然银行，南部的达拉然商业银行以及位于下水道的银行。"
G["There are three of us, which is two more than I need to eat your head."]="我们总共有三个人，其实只靠我自己就能吞下你的脑袋。"
G["There are three ways out of the Underbelly: Ramps leading up to the east and west, and the tunnel that drops out of the bottom of Dalaran.\n\nBe certain you can fly before you take that tunnel, of course."]="达拉然下水道共有三条出路：通往东城和西城的斜道，以及通往达拉然底层的隧道。\n\n当然，你可以乘坐飞行坐骑穿越那条隧道。"
G["There are too few who care for the wounded from battle. If I had the skill, I would certainly join them."]="照顾伤员的人手太少了。如果能掌握相关的技术，我很乐意加入他们。"
G["There are too many of them!"]="他们数量太多了！"
G["There are too many! Shaman, do something!"]="他们人数太多了！萨满，快做点儿什么！"
G["There are two banks in Shattrath, both along the rim of the central city hub. One is run by the draenei Aldor, the other by the blood elf Scryers."]="沙塔斯城有两座银行，它们都座落在城市中心的边缘上。一座由奥尔多的德莱尼人运作着，而另一座属于血精灵占星者。"
G["There are two banks in the city: The Stormwind Counting House in the Trade District, and the Royal Bank of Stormwind in the Dwarven District."]="暴风城共有两个银行——分别是位于贸易区的暴风城会计室和位于矮人区的暴风城皇家银行。"
G["There are two gem merchants in residence: one works closely with the Scryers, and the other is loyal to the Aldor. Whom do you seek?"]="这里居住着两位宝石商人：一位与占星者走得很近，而另一个忠诚于奥尔多。你在找哪个？"
G["There are two mailboxes in the Seat of the Naaru: one by the bank, and another outside the auction house."]="在纳鲁之座有两个邮箱：一个在银行的附近，另一个在拍卖行的外面。"
G["There are two masters of the sword: Handiir and Woo Ping. The former can be found in the Trader's Tier of the Exodar, and the latter in Weller's Arsenal within Stormwind."]="联盟有两名使剑的大师：韩迪尔和吴平。你可以在埃索达的贸易阶梯找到前者，而后者可以在暴风城的维勒武器店找到。"
G["There are two mines in Alterac: the Irondeep in Alliance territory and the Coldtooth mine in Horde territory.  Both mines are a rich source of minerals, and in the past were used to store excess supplies.\n\nNow, these mines are constantly fought over by the Horde, the Alliance and local denizens."]="在奥特兰克山谷中两处矿洞：联盟领地上的深铁矿洞和部落领地上的寒齿洞穴。两处矿洞都有丰富的矿产资源，在过去，它们用于存储过剩的物资。\n\n现在，部落、联盟和当地居民常常争夺矿洞。"
G["There are two potential results when the Earthen's synthesis matrix destabilizes.  Initiating visual aid representation number one.\n\nThe first variant matrix is a degenerative product of synthesis, hereby designated with the common nomenclature of \"Trogg\".  This variant maintains strength and stamina comparable to the Earthen, but its cognitive processing power has been almost completely compromised.  Force of will and a strong sense of cunning are the only driving factors in the psyche of the trogg."]="\"Existen dos resultados potenciales cuando la matriz de síntesis de terráneos se desestabiliza. Iniciando representación de ayuda visual número uno.\n\nLa primera matriz de variante es un producto degenerativo de síntesis, denominada en este caso con la nomenclatura común de \"trogg\". Esta variante mantiene una fuerza y una resistencia comparables a las de los terráneos, pero su potencia de procesamiento cognitivo ha experimentado serios problemas. La fuerza de voluntad y una notable astucia son los únicos factores que mueven la psique de un trogg.\""
G["There are two prominent bills tacked up on the board here; one from Papa Wheeler and one from Rocket-Chief Fuselage.\n\nPapa's looks like it's a wanted ad for a machine part.  The rocket-chief's has something to do with a bounty on the head of an immense mountain giant!\n\nThe details for both are provided in very small goblin handwriting, which is, of course, barely legible."]="两张醒目的悬赏单被钉在公告板上，一张是维勒老爹的悬赏，另一张是火箭主管弗斯拉格的。\n\n老爹的看上去是一个机械零件的悬赏，而火箭主管悬赏巨大的山脉巨人。\n\n两个悬赏令都是用晦涩难懂、歪歪扭扭的地精小篆书写的。"
G["There are two sides to the blade of demonology..."]="恶魔学识就是一把双刃剑……"
G["There are two zeppelin towers outside Orgrimmar. The eastern tower serves Tirisfal Glades and Stranglethorn Vale, while the western tower serves Northrend and Thunder Bluff."]="奥格瑞玛城外有两座飞艇塔。东侧的飞艇塔开通了前往提瑞斯法林地和荆棘谷的航线，西侧的飞艇塔则用于飞往诺森德和雷霆崖。"
G["There are two: The Trader's Hall in the Trade District, and the Stormwind Auction House in the Dwarven District."]="总共有两个：一个是贸易区的交易者大厅，另一个是矮人区的暴风城拍卖行。"
G["There are villains amongst us - remain vigilant. The Ebon Blade seeks to prevent us from destroying their true master, the Lich King."]="我们中间混进了一些反叛份子，最好保持警惕。黑锋骑士团企图阻止我们消灭他们真正的主子——巫妖王。"
G["There are ways for a shortfang to become stronger. If I wanted, I could escape the scorn of my tribe.\n\nThere are ways... but I am afraid. I am too scared, too weak.\n\nThey do not understand me. I will be a shortfang all my life."]="短牙种也是可以变强的。如果我愿意，我也可以摆脱族人对我的嘲笑。\n\n办法是有的……可我害怕。我太害怕，太软弱了。\n\n他们不理解我。我要当一辈子的短牙种。"
G["There are ways to strengthen steel beyond the hammer and forge, young wanderer."]="年轻的流浪者，有比铁锤和熔炉更能使钢铁坚固的方法。想学学吗？"
G["There aren't any enchanters out here in Dun Morogh that I know of.  Ye're going to have to visit Ironforge if ye want to learn the enchanter's profession."]="据我所知，丹莫罗是没有附魔师的。如果你想成为一名附魔师的话，就去铁炉堡吧。"
G["There aren't any more challengers who want to fight you, $n. You're just too damned good.\nYou still want a fight? Go pick up a challenge card and talk to me again."]="No hay más contendientes que quieran enfrentarse a ti, $n. Tu superioridad es excesiva.\n\n¿Todavía quieres luchar? Ve a por una carta de desafío y vuelve a hablar conmigo."
G["There aren't many of us left, $n.  The return of our old enemy is a cause for great concern."]="我们剩下的人不多了，$n。宿敌的回归让我们忧虑万分。"
G["There aren't many willing to brave the mountain pass anymore, friend. Nowadays, some would say you'd have to be crazy to try."]="Muy poca gente se atreve a cruzar el paso de la montaña. De hecho, debes estar $gloco:loca; si lo haces en los tiempos que corren."
G["There be no fishin' today. Kor'kron orders."]="库卡隆有令，今天不准钓鱼。"
G["There be nuthin' here to drink, Mack. Away with ya!"]="马克，这里没有酒。滚吧！"
G["There be one mon!"]="那儿有一只！"
G["There can be no disruptions! Mustn't keep the master waiting! Mustn't fail again!"]="不能受到干扰！我们不能让主人久等！决不能再次失败！"
G["There can be no doubt as to your tenacity... but there are other virtues to consider."]="毫无疑问，你们拥有坚韧的意志……但是我们也不能忽略其它的美德。"
G["There can be only one outcome to such a battle: death for one side or the other. Let $n prove $g himself : herself; upon the bones of those outsiders who have fallen before!"]="瓦哈拉斯的战斗只有一个结果：必须有一方倒下。$n，如果你想要证明自己的力量，就必须将对手的尸体踩在脚下！"
G["There can be only one survivor!"]="只有一个人能活下来！"
G["There can't be too many more of these collectors. Just keep me safe as I do my job."]="再有几个收集器就完工了，请在我工作的时候保护我。"
G["There comes a time when the life we know falls short.  We are trapped and look for answers, and we find hope burning in dark places.\n\nOnly then, $n, do we take our first steps to freedom."]="Llega un momento cuando la vida que conocemos se nos queda corta. Estamos atrapados y buscamos respuestas. Encontramos la esperanza ardiendo en oscuros lugares.\n\nSolo entonces, $n, damos nuestros primeros pasos hacia la libertad."
G["There could be danger around every corner here."]="这里到处都潜伏着危险。"
G["There exist in Outland demonic presences much more powerful than anything we'd ever seen in the old world.\n\nGreat power shall come to those who do not shy away from it, but learn to harness and master its strength."]="那些存在于外域的恶魔力量远比我们过去在这世界上看到过的任何东西都要强大。\n\n强大的力量应该给予那些不逃避它，而是学着去驾驭和掌握它的人。"
G["There exist two great disciplines among our people. The Tushui are patient, pensive, and deliberate. The Huojin are fierce, forward, and active. Both disciplines serve us in their own way, and neither could exist effectively without the other."]="在我的族人间存在两大修行戒律。土水派耐心沉稳，谨慎从容；火金派凶猛激进，活跃积极。两种戒律各有用途，而又相辅相成，缺一不可。"
G["There goes another one..."]="接着又一个……"
G["There goes the BOOM!"]="要爆炸啦！"
G["There goes the finest $c I have the honor of knowing."]="Ahí va $gel mejor:la mejor:c;$c que he tenido el honor de conocer."
G["There goes the hero of the Vanguard!"]="瞧，前线基地的英雄！"
G["There goes the zeppelin to Orgrimmar. I hope there's no explosions this time."]="前往奥格瑞玛的飞艇已经出发啦。希望这次它不会爆炸。"
G["There has been too much violence. Too much pain. But I have an honorable compromise. Just walk away."]="这里有太多的暴力，太多的痛苦。但我也会在这里得到光荣。离开我吧。"
G["There has to be a way to stop this corruption before it consumes us all."]="一定有办法阻止这种污染将我们全部吞噬。"
G["There has to be someone who can help me!"]="一定有人能帮我！"
G["There has to be something you can do, blood guard."]="你一定能做些什么的，血卫士。"
G["There have been no Shado-Pan down this way recently. That cannot be good.\n\nWe were supposed to still have a few years before the next mantid swarm."]="影踪派最近并没有走过这条路。这可不太好。\n\n我们猜想还有几年的时间，才会遇到螳螂妖再次蜂拥而至。"
G["There have been reports of intruders. You are to notify me at once if you see anything unusual!"]="最近有人发现了入侵者。如果你看到什么异常情况要立刻通知我！"
G["There have been some complaints filed about this... individual. I'm told he's something of a shady character. I am here to determine whether or not this business of his is legitimate... and take action if it proves otherwise."]="到处都是对这个……这个家伙的抱怨声。据说他是个可疑的人物。我是来调查他的生意是否合法的……如果他胆敢做违法的勾当，我就会立即采取行动。"
G["There he continues to wage war on Illidan with the assistance of the Aldor and the Scryers.  The two factions have not given up on their old feuds, though."]="在奥尔多和占星者的协助下，他不断对伊利丹的军队发动着攻势。然而这两股势力并没有冰释前嫌。"
G["There he is!"]="他在那儿！"
G["There he is! Kill him now, $p!"]="他就在那！现在杀了他，$p！"
G["There he is, stop him!"]="他就在那里，拦住他！"
G["There is NOTHING random about what I say!  Nothing!"]="我从不说胡话！从不！"
G["There is a Blacksmithing Trainer in our great home Thunder Bluff to the north.  If you seek such knowledge then head there and ask one of the Bluffwatchers for directions."]="在我的家乡雷霆崖，有一位铁匠训练者。如果你想成为一名铁匠的话，就朝北走，去雷霆崖，然后问问那儿的守卫吧。"
G["There is a Highborne archmage visiting the city's Enchanting trainer. You can have your items reforged there."]="这座城市的附魔训练师那里有一位来访的上层精灵大法师。你可以在那里重铸你的物品。"
G["There is a Wind Rider Master in the great city of Thunder Bluff to the north.  Ride the elevator from the base of Thunder Bluff to the top and ask one of the Bluffwatchers there for further instructions."]="在北方的雷霆崖，有一名双足飞龙管理员。乘坐升降梯到达雷霆崖顶部，问问那儿的守卫，他们会为你指明方向的。"
G["There is a battle brewing at the Abyssal Breach. I hope that the reinforcements that arrived with the Pincer X2 will be enough."]="在深渊裂口，一场战争正在酝酿。希望与扳钳X2号一起赶来的援军足够抵挡。"
G["There is a battle trainer by the name of Gentle San who trains her pets out on the main terrace.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="有个名叫文雅的萨恩的战斗训练师在主露台上训练她的宠物。\n\n我会在你的地图上标出位置。"
G["There is a battle trainer by the name of Sara Finkleswitch who trains her pets out on the main terrace.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="有个名叫萨拉·芬克斯维奇的战斗训练师在主露台上训练她的宠物。\n\n我会在你的地图上标记这个位置。"
G["There is a black market of sorts in the northeastern portion of the sewers."]="下水道的东北部有一个黑市。"
G["There is a blood elf in the Valley of Strength's central fortress, part of a delegation from Silvermoon: Belloc. He is who you want."]="在力量谷的中部要塞里有位血精灵，是银月城贝洛克代表团的成员。他就是你要找的人。"
G["There is a bluff south of here that would make a fine farm. It overlooks a gorge. You may be right, stranger."]="Hay un promontorio al sur de aquí que sería perfecto para una granja. Se alza sobre una garganta. A lo mejor tienes razón, $gforastero:forastera;."
G["There is a creature half-buried in the silt, a hideous collection of limbs and tentacles with no discernable face. You can't bring yourself to touch the eerily translucent flesh.\n\nAlthough the beast is dead, the water around the shapeless body appears clean, and the corpse itself curiously shows no sign of decay."]="一只怪物被半埋在这堆淤泥里，它由一堆恐怖的肢体、触须和无法辨识的面孔组成。你完全不想碰触这团半透明的怪诞血肉。\n\n虽然这只怪物已经死了。但奇怪的是，这具尸体周围的水面却丝毫没有受到污染的痕迹，尸体本身也没有任何腐烂的迹象。"
G["There is a difference between testing one's strength and blindly walking into harm's way. Garrosh sent us to do the latter, and this I cannot accept."]="证明实力和盲目涉险完全是两码事。而加尔鲁什给我们的任务就属于后者，对此我无法接受。"
G["There is a faint light emanating from deep within the orb and a blue mist swirls across its surface."]="宝珠中散发出一道微弱的光芒，表面笼罩着一层蓝色的雾气。"
G["There is a fisherman within our grand city... if spending time with pungent, wet, flopping abominations is your idea of a pleasant day."]="如果你想以腥味、潮湿和乏味来打发这种好日子的话，我们伟大的城市里有个渔夫……"
G["There is a glint of light coming from something on the creature's back."]="在那家伙的背上仿佛有什么东西闪了一下。"
G["There is a goblin-run bank down here, just north of the Cantrips and Crows Tavern in the western sewers."]="西部下水道有一座地精开设的银行，就在咒语和乌鸦旅店以北。"
G["There is a great concentration of naga just outside of this cavern.\n\nWe were fortunate to reach this place unnoticed."]="在这个洞穴之外集结了大批纳迦。\n\n我们能神不知鬼不觉地到达这个地方，可真是幸运。"
G["There is a great deal at stake within the blue dragonflight, $c.\n\nSoon, a new aspect must be chosen to take the place of Malygos.\n\nArygos aspires to follow in the footsteps of his father, renewing the misguided aggression against all who wield magic. This path, I feel, would lead to the end of our kind.\n\nThe remnants of our flight are divided on this fateful issue, and I fear that Arygos will stop at nothing to meet his ends..."]="蓝龙军团正面临重大考验，$c。\n\n很快，我们就会推举出一位新的守护巨龙，来取代玛里苟斯。\n\n阿瑞苟斯一直希望能继承它父亲的遗志，重新展开对所有的施法者的屠杀。我能预感到，这只会让我们的族群走向灭绝。\n\n现在幸存的族人对此仍有分歧，可我担心阿瑞苟斯还是会义无反顾地走上绝路……"
G["There is a greenhouse attached to the Agronomical Apothecary in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. You'll find the city's best herbalists there."]="在达拉然西北部的魔法商业区，农艺炼金房的旁边坐落着一间温室。你可以在那里找到全城最好的草药师。"
G["There is a hozen on your face! Jump to shake it off!"]="你面前有一只猢狲！赶紧跳开，摆脱它！"
G["There is a large smithy and forge in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.\n\nLook for the massive enchanted anvil and stained glass windows in the shapes of axes and shields."]="达拉然西北部的魔法商业区内设有大型的锻造台和熔炉。\n\n你只要找到巨大的魔法铁砧和描绘着战斧及护盾图案的彩色玻璃窗就对了。"
G["There is a large tent on the east side of Bloodhoof Village.  You will find Narm Skychaser awaiting you there."]="在血蹄村的东边，有一座巨大的营帐。纳姆·逐星在那儿等着你呢。"
G["There is a lesson to be learned in every challenge we face."]="从我们面临的每次挑战中，都有教训可以吸取。"
G["There is a little lamb lost in dark woods."]="在那幽暗的密林里有一只迷途的小羊羔。"
G["There is a mailbox located conveniently right between the Stormwind Bank and The Gilded Rose Inn in the Trade District."]="在暴风城银行和贸易区的镶金玫瑰旅店之间设有邮箱，非常便利。"
G["There is a mailbox outside of the Bank which you'll find in the center of Darnassus."]="在达纳苏斯的东北部，也就是工匠区，你会在旅馆外面找到邮箱的。"
G["There is a master of archaeology in the Seat of Knowledge, above Mogu'shan Palace here in the Vale of Eternal Blossoms.\n\nI will mark their location on your map for you."]="在锦绣谷魔古山宫殿上方的闻道之座有位考古学大师。\n\n我会在你的地图上标出位置。"
G["There is a much larger problem we face now, my students. Shen-zin Su is in pain. If we do not act, the very land on which we stand could die, and all of us with it."]="徒儿们，我们现在面临着更大的难题。剧痛正折磨着神真子。皮之不存，毛将焉附？这块土地若有不测，我们也在劫难逃。"
G["There is a noise from behind you!"]="你身后有动静！"
G["There is a pained howl from deep within the woods."]="树林深处传出了一声痛苦的嚎叫。"
G["There is a pair of tauren visiting the city. I'm told they've come from Mulgore to learn more about the Forsaken \"condition,\" or something to that effect.\n\nSeek them out near the herbalist by the Apothecarium."]="Hay un par de tauren de visita por la ciudad. Me han dicho que han venido desde Mulgore para investigar la \"aflicción\" de los no-muertos o algo así.\n\nLos encontrarás cerca del herborista en El Apothecarium."
G["There is a pile of wrapped gifts here."]="这里有一大堆精心包裹的礼物。"
G["There is a power flowing through all things that live. It carries many names."]="万物体内都涌动着某种神秘的魔法力量。它有许多不同的称呼。"
G["There is a powerful infernal named Kroshius northeast of this camp. It is why Niby is here. Kroshius is a greater infernal - an infernal that has lasted longer than expected. You see, nub, an infernal crashes down into the earth with great intensity to serve its master but this intensity fades fast. Once the blazing flames have died down, the infernal crumbles."]="在这座营地的东北面有一个名叫克罗苏斯的强大的地狱火。这就是尼比待在这儿的原因。克罗苏斯极其强大，前所未闻。你瞧，菜鸟，地狱火以极高的速度坠落在地面上，但是它的生命却很短暂。一旦火焰熄灭，地狱火便崩溃了。"
G["There is a reason I am king!"]="这就是我能加冕为王的理由！"
G["There is a scholar, Hammond the Jaded, who can assist you.  You will find him in the Temple of the Moon, often conversing with one of the returned Highborne."]="有位名叫隐世者汉蒙的学者可以帮上你的忙。你可以在月神殿理找到他，他通常在那里和归返的上层精灵交谈。"
G["There is a serenity to this place. It is untainted by the wars that ravage the mainland."]="这地方可真是安宁祥和。它完全没有被肆虐大陆的战火所波及。"
G["There is a situation to the south that requires my immediate attention."]="现在南边出了点状况，需要我立刻去进行处理。"
G["There is a skinning trainer at Nesingwary's Safari in the Valley of the Four Winds.\n\nI will mark their location on your map."]="在四风谷的奈辛瓦里狩猎队营地里有位剥皮训练师。\n\n我会在你的地图上标出位置。"
G["There is a symmetry in the idea of the hide of your enemy providing you with protection.  To further your leatherworking skills look for Una inside the Thunder Bluff Armorers on the middle rise."]="利用敌人的兽皮来保护自己这一想法运用了拟态学的知识。要进一步提高制皮技能，你得去雷霆崖防具店找库纳。"
G["There is a task I would like you to perform before we go any further..."]="在我们继续之前我想让你完成一项任务……"
G["There is a thorn in my side.  I cannot remove it."]="我的身体上扎进了一根刺。我没法拔掉它。"
G["There is a time and a place for all things, including relaxation.  On the west side of Bloodhoof Village Innkeeper Kauth maintains a long house for those who seek to rest.  You will find him there."]="人总是要休息的。在血蹄村的西边，旅店老板考乌斯经营着一家很大的旅馆，为人们提供休息之所。你去那儿找他吧。"
G["There is a way..."]="还有一个办法……"
G["There is a well in northern Dalaran that some of the city's more... adventurous... visitors use to enter the sewers."]="在达拉然城北有一口井，某些……富有冒险精神的游客能通过那口井进入下水道。"
G["There is a wise one in the village who goes by the name Narm Skychaser.  He can continue your learning along the path of the Shaman."]="村子里居住着一位名叫纳姆·逐星的智者。他能继续训练你，使你成为一名真正的萨满。"
G["There is always value  in spending time with old friends."]="和老朋友一起渡过的时光总是宝贵的。"
G["There is always... Ashbringer."]="我们还有……灰烬使者。"
G["There is an Engineering Trainer in Razor Hill.  He is called Mukdrak and can usually be found standing over near the forge."]="在剃刀岭居住着一名工程学训练师。他名叫穆德拉克，你在熔炉附近就能找到他。"
G["There is an alchemist that lives up in the hills between Northshire and Stormwind that might be of some help.  Why don't you go pay him a visit?"]="居住在北郡和暴风城之间的山上的一位炼金师或许能帮上忙。你为什么不去找他呢？"
G["There is an intruder amongst us. Destroy them! Nothing must interfere with Lord Deathwing's plan!"]="我们中间出现了入侵者。干掉他们！谁也别想破坏死亡之翼大人的计划！"
G["There is an unnatural darkness to this place, a perpetual midnight. Take caution, heroes, and do not stray from the light."]="这里的黑暗诡异难测，仿佛无尽的永夜。小心，英雄们，不要远离月光的庇护。"
G["There is another visitor from beyond the mists here. \"Chen Stormstout\" he is called. He is Pandaren, but from a different homeland."]="Hay otro visitante de más allá de la niebla. Se llama \"Chen Cerveza de Trueno\". Es un pandaren, pero de otra tierra."
G["There is bound to be a gnome in Stormwind that can teach you the profession.  I'm sure one of the Stormwind Guards could point you in the right direction."]="暴风城中的某位侏儒肯定能教你，而且我相信暴风城的守卫能为你指明方向。"
G["There is but one duty that remains..."]="还有一件事要解决……"
G["There is change on the wind, and we cannot ignore it. I have traveled from the dust and ruin of the past to come to an accord."]="我从风中感到了变化，我们不能不闻不问。我带着诚意走过尘灰漫天、满目疮痍的过去，为得就是能让我们尽弃前嫌。"
G["There is fear in you, mortal.\n\nI can smell it."]="你心中充满了恐惧，凡人。\n\n我能感觉到。"
G["There is fight left in me yet, scum."]="仗还没有打完呢，渣滓们。"
G["There is fire in my eyes!  My mind!"]="我的眼中燃着烈火！头痛欲裂！"
G["There is great arcane power on this island. I cannot yet tell if it lies in the hands of the Thunder King, or in the hands of our old Sunreaver allies.\n\nWe will find out in time."]="这座岛蕴藏着巨大的魔力。我还不清楚它是掌握在雷电之王，还是我们的夺日者老朋友手里。\n\n但我们迟早会找到答案的。"
G["There is great potential in the hammer Arthas cast aside when he took up Frostmourne.\n\nIt has helped to bring about events that have shaped this world's destiny. It possesses a great capacity for power that few comprehend.\n\nWith ample saronite I can reforge the hammer into an artifact to rival Frostmourne itself.\n\nIt is then that your most dangerous trial begins...."]="阿尔萨斯在选择霜之哀伤时丢弃的战锤中蕴藏了极大的潜力。\n\n那股力量曾引发过奠定世界命运的事件。它拥有的强大力量很少有人能够领悟。\n\n给我足够的萨隆邪铁，我能将这把战锤打造成一件可以对抗霜之哀伤的神器。\n\n那时，你便开始了一项最危险的试炼…"
G["There is hope, Solomon."]="希望仍然存在，所罗门。"
G["There is little else I can teach you, $c. Please, speak with my colleague Kalinda if you wish to know more of the craft."]="$c，我没有什么能教你的了。如果你想要了解更多关于珠宝加工的知识，就和我的同事卡琳达谈谈吧。"
G["There is little time for idle chatter. Our people are in crisis and every sin'dorei has a role to play in our restoration."]="没时间闲聊了。我们的人民正处于水深火热之中，每个辛多雷成员都肩负着重任。"
G["There is more to magic than just arcane gesticulations... but I am speaking to someone who already knows this, yes?\n\nYou've come to me to learn, and learn you will... just so long as you pay attention and do as I say.  The secrets of the demons do not cater to fools, and neither do I."]="魔法不仅仅是做几个神秘的手势……你应该已经明白这个道理了，对吗？\n\n你是来学习知识的，只要你用心领悟，并听从我的指导，那么你就能学到知识……只有头脑愚钝的家伙才不愿意探究恶魔的秘密，当然我也不会在意这样的蠢材。"
G["There is more."]="还有更多。"
G["There is much I do not know about this artifact. The weak-willed cannot control this sha energy, but I WILL master it."]="我对这个神器所知不多。意志薄弱的人才控制不了煞能，但是我一定可以。"
G["There is much adventure to be had on this isle!"]="这座岛上一定会有很多奇遇的！"
G["There is much and more that can be found at the Tavern in the Mists."]="在迷雾酒肆里，你会大有收获。"
G["There is much damage to repair."]="有许多伤害亟待补救。"
G["There is much punishment to deliver for the empire's crimes. We have no time to waste, Wakener. Meet me outside."]="我们要严惩女皇犯下的重罪。别浪费时间了，唤醒者。到外面找我。"
G["There is much that you do not understand, $r. The Master sees all."]="$r，世间有许多你无法了解的玄机。只有全知全能的主上才能洞悉一切。"
G["There is much to be done."]="还有很多事情要做呢。"
G["There is much to do. But first, Wakener... help me recover my strength."]="有很多事情要做。不过首先，唤醒者……帮助我恢复体力。"
G["There is much we can learn from these Zandalari, largely by doing what they do not."]="我们可以从这些赞达拉巨魔身上学到很多东西，尤其是去做他们不做的那些事。"
G["There is much work ahead of us if we are to heal the land and mend our wounds. But thanks to your deeds we no longer must work in the shadow of the seven breaths of Y'Shaarj.\n\nIn time, the sha will cease to be, and your name will be remembered with the reverence of the last emperor."]="要想治愈这片土地和我们自己的伤口，还有许多事情要做。多亏了你的帮助，我们再也不用担心亚煞极的七大吐息了。\n\n同时，煞魔也不再活动了，你的美名将与末代皇帝一样流芳百世。"
G["There is much work left to be done, $n! Continue to strike down our enemies!"]="还有很多工作要做，$n！继续消灭我们的敌人！"
G["There is news, Warchief."]="有消息，酋长。"
G["There is no COW level... really! I repeat: there is no COW level. Well, maybe there is..."]="没有奶牛关啦……真的！我再说一遍：没有奶牛关。好吧，也许有……"
G["There is no Light. Only darkness!"]="圣光根本就不存在。只有黑暗长存！"
G["There is no army here. Only a handful of heroes stand between you and the King of Stormwind. Are you afraid?"]="这里可没有什么大军，只有暴风城国王和几名英雄而已。难道你怕了吗？"
G["There is no better day than one filled with the blood of dwarves!"]="没有比把矮人打得落花流水更痛快的事情了！"
G["There is no blood easier spilt than that of a puny night elf!"]="弱小的暗夜精灵，轻易就能战胜！"
G["There is no corner of this vale that the Shao-Tien can hide from us in. They underestimate the tenacity of the Shado-Pan."]="韶天族在这个山谷里没有可以藏身之处，他们低估了影踪派的坚韧不屈。"
G["There is no dish I have not mastered! Come and eat!"]="没有我不会做的菜！快来尝尝吧！"
G["There is no doubt - you are the heir of Durotan... my grandson. Draka told me she was with child before she and your father left our world, but I never dared dream that they would survive..."]="不用怀疑，你是杜隆坦的后代……我的孙子。德拉卡在和你父亲离开我们的世界前告诉我她有了孩子，但是我从没有想到他们可以生存下来……"
G["There is no doubt in my mind you'd lose. Speed and wit triumphs over brute strength and bullheadedness any day of the week."]="在我看来你输定了。蛮力和武勇永远赢不了速度和智慧。"
G["There is no end in sight to these illusions, but we shall hold out as long as we can."]="这些幻影是无穷无尽的，但我们要尽力守住！"
G["There is no end to these trolls, $c."]="这些巨魔没完没了，$c。"
G["There is no escape for you.  The Crusade shall destroy all who carry the Scourge's taint."]="你无处可逃。十字军将消灭所有携带天灾病毒的人。"
G["There is no escape from my rise!"]="别想逃跑！"
G["There is no escape from our might!"]="谁也别想从我们的力量面前逃脱！"
G["There is no escape from the fury of the twilight flight!"]="谁也别想逃开暮光飞龙的愤怒！"
G["There is no escape now. The only way out is through me!"]="你们无路可逃了。唯一的出路就是穿过我！"
G["There is no escape!"]="你逃不掉了！"
G["There is no escape! There is only the fiery embrace of my lava!"]="这里无路可逃！只有我的岩浆的热烈拥抱！"
G["There is no escape."]="无路可逃。"
G["There is no escape. Not in this life. Not in the next."]="没有退路了。这一生不会有。下一世亦不会有。"
G["There is no escape. There is only my wrath!"]="休想逃走。尝尝我的怒火吧！"
G["There is no escape..."]="谁也别想逃脱……"
G["There is no escaping the Lich King's will. Prepare for an explosive encounter!"]="巫妖王的意志不可逃避。准备好迎接一场爆炸吧！"
G["There is no experience quite like riding on the back of a war serpent."]="再没有比骑在作战翔龙的背上翱翔更加精彩的体验了。"
G["There is no finer cook in Thunder Bluff than Aska Mistrunner.  Mmmmm, I can smell what she is cooking from here.  Head over to her kitchen located on the high rise.\nDrat... now I am hungry."]="No hay mejor cocinera en Cima del Trueno que Aska Correbruma. Mmm, puedo oler lo que está cocinando desde aquí. Ve hacia la cocina, que está en la gran pendiente.\n\nCaray... ahora tengo hambre."
G["There is no future for you."]="你已经没有未来了。"
G["There is no good. No evil. No Light. There is only POWER!"]="没有善，没有恶，也没有圣光。只有——力量！"
G["There is no greater honor than rising through the ranks of the Order of the Cloud Serpent.\n\nOnce you have proven yourself, you will be free to wander the land with your serpent as your flying mount.\n\nYou will also earn the Cloud Serpent Riding skill, which will allow you to ride any cloud serpent mount from Pandaria."]="在云端翔龙骑士团中获得晋升是一种莫大的荣耀。\n\n一旦证明了自己，你就能把翔龙当成飞行坐骑，任意驰骋。\n\n你还能学会骑乘云端翔龙的技能，可以骑乘潘达利亚的任何一条云端翔龙。"
G["There is no greater joy than walking the world, writing your story.\n\nIt is the wanderer's way."]="再也没有比环游世界，谱写你的故事更有趣的工作了。\n\n这就是云游者之道。"
G["There is no greater way to clear the mind than to weave."]="没有比编织更好的宁神方法了。"
G["There is no honor fighting us when the end has already been written.  Azeroth... will... die."]="结局早已注定，何必再做徒劳的抗衡。艾泽拉斯世界……必将消亡。"
G["There is no hope for enemies of the Twilight!"]="暮光的敌人只有死路一条！"
G["There is no hope for our future..."]="我们的未来看不到希望……"
G["There is no hope for you. Your Darkshore lies in ruins. Astranaar will fall before the end of the day as will this place. Retreat to Darnassus while you still can."]="你们已经没有希望了。你们的黑海岸变成了一片废墟。阿斯特兰纳和这个地方很快都将陷落。趁现在逃到达纳苏斯去吧。"
G["There is no hope!"]="没有希望了！"
G["There is no hope, no future. All life is doomed."]="没有希望，没有未来。这是所有生命的末日。"
G["There is no hope.  You will fail."]="放弃缥缈的希望吧。你们注定会失败！"
G["There is no knowledge that is not power."]="有勇无谋，亦是枉然。"
G["There is no longer a place for you."]="你已经没有容身之处了，卡雷苟斯。"
G["There is no need to speak to me that way."]="你怎么用这种态度和你的家人说话。"
G["There is no other way, blasphemer. Prepare to meet your fate."]="你无路可逃了，亵渎者。准备受死吧！"
G["There is no question that these crusaders are the source of great discomfort, $g brother:sister;. But what is sacrifice without pain? You were with me at Light's Hope Chapel. You saw many great sacrifices made. We are here now to settle a debt to the Highlord. Payment in full for his sacrifice.\n\nOnce the Argent Crusade has established their foothold inside the walls of Icecrown, we will depart. A different destiny awaits us."]="No cabe duda de que esos cruzados están causando muchos quebraderos de cabeza, $g hermano:hermana;. Pero ¿qué es el sacrificio sin dolor? Tú estuviste conmigo en la Capilla de la Esperanza de la Luz. Viste muchos sacrificios. Y ahora, tenemos que pagar nuestra deuda con el Alto Señor. Pagarle por su sacrificio.\n\nCuando la Cruzada Argenta haya establecido un punto de apoyo dentro de las murallas de Corona de Hielo, partiremos. A nosotros nos aguarda otro destino."
G["There is no room for war here."]="这里没有战争的空间。"
G["There is no safe place to hide!"]="没有地方躲啦！"
G["There is no sharp distinction between the real and the unreal."]="在真实与虚幻之间没有明确的分界线。"
G["There is no shelter from my fury!"]="谁都逃不过我的怒火！"
G["There is no shelter from my fury."]="谁都逃不过我的怒火。"
G["There is no spoon."]="勺子并不存在。"
G["There is no stopping $n! Sarinexx has been massacred!"]="谁也无法阻挡$n！萨里尼克斯被杀死了！"
G["There is no time for celebration - many followers of the Way still battle outside."]="没有时间庆祝了——现在还有很多赤精之道的信徒在外面战斗。"
G["There is no time for cookies! Well, one cookie. Just one."]="没时间吃甜饼了！好吧，来一块。就一块。嗯。"
G["There is no time to waste!"]="没有时间可以浪费了！"
G["There is no time to waste, friend.\n\nMy flight is in disarray and is in desperate need of leadership."]="No hay tiempo que perder, $gamigo:amiga;.\n\nEl caos reina en mi Vuelo. Necesitamos un líder desesperadamente."
G["There is no time to waste. The Alliance move on the Isle of Thunder as we speak!"]="不能再浪费时间了。在我们说话的时候，联盟正在雷神岛上不停推进呢！"
G["There is no time to waste. The Horde move on the Isle of Thunder as we speak!"]="不能再浪费时间了。在我们说话的时候，部落正在雷神岛上不停推进呢！"
G["There is no time. The Shado-Pan trackers are too close. They cannot learn the location of the Bell."]="没有时间了。影踪派追过来了。不能让他们发现圣钟的下落。"
G["There is no turning back now!"]="你无路可逃了！"
G["There is no victory for you here! What little ground you've gained will be swallowed by my army in due course!"]="胜利不属于你们！这些你们暂时占有的土地终将完全被我们的军队所吞噬。"
G["There is no way out."]="你们逃不掉的。"
G["There is not a better tracker in these lands than Drayl.  He can be found on the Hunter Rise."]="你应该找不到比德拉伊更好的追踪训练师了。他一般都在猎人高地一带出没。"
G["There is not much more to tell. Dalaran was nearly wholly destroyed by Archimonde, the staff lost, presumably shattered by the barrier's fail-safe mechanisms.\n\nThere are those that believe the staff to be the cause of Archimonde's reprisal."]="后来也没什么可说的了。达拉然几乎完全被阿克蒙德摧毁，法杖也遗失了。据说，在那时，禁锢法阵启动了某种保护机制，将法杖击碎了。\n\n也有人说，禁锢了这根法杖是导致阿克蒙德毁灭达拉然的原因，是他为萨格拉斯所做的复仇。"
G["There is not nearly enough dancing in this club!"]="这地方根本没有跳舞的气氛嘛！"
G["There is nothing I call my own that would be of use to you.\n\nPerhaps D'lom will have something of interest to you in his collection."]="我这里没有什么能帮到你的东西。\n\n也许德罗姆的收集品中会有一些能让你感兴趣的东西。"
G["There is nothing I cannot take!"]="没有什么是我得不到的！"
G["There is nothing but the Crusade! Anyone that is not with us, will fall!"]="只有十字军才是真理！顺我者昌，逆我者亡！"
G["There is nothing here for you.  Now go."]="你在这里什么都得不到。走吧。"
G["There is nothing in all Pandaria that can stay the rampage of the Grand Expedition Yak. Pray you never see it."]="在整个潘达利亚，什么都抵挡不了雄壮远足牦牛的狂怒。但愿你永远也不用亲眼见到。"
G["There is nothing left for me. I seek a warrior's death. Is that wrong?"]="我已经一无所有。现在我想要的只是一位战士光荣的死亡。这有错吗？"
G["There is nothing left for us but to wait... and hope."]="我们什么都做不了，只有等待……并心存希望。"
G["There is nothing left for us here."]="这鬼地方什么都没有。"
G["There is nothing left for you here, nothing but death and sorrow."]="这里空无一物，留给你们的只有死亡和悲伤。"
G["There is nothing left to be done for the Vale at this time, $n. The mogu disappeared shortly after you killed their leader. We are safe, thanks to you."]="此时此刻，锦绣谷不需要再做什么事情了，$n。你杀死魔古部落首领之后，魔古族就立马土崩瓦解了。我们现在安全了，谢谢你。"
G["There is nothing more that I can do for you, $n. Take what I have taught you, and use it elsewhere."]="我能为你做的就这些了，$n。带着我教你的知识，到别的地方施展才能吧。"
G["There is nothing more that I can teach - now get out! And don't even think of approaching Saru, for one as unworthy as you he will use your blood to temper his steel."]="我没有什么东西可以教你了，现在你可以走了。不要想接近萨鲁，因为像你一样卑微的家伙，他只会用你们的血来炼钢。"
G["There is nothing of interest on the table."]="桌上没什么令你感兴趣的东西。"
G["There is nothing that cannot be mastered through repetition."]="只要反复练习，没有什么是掌握不了的。"
G["There is nothing the proper mixture can't handle."]="恰当的合剂是无所不能的！"
G["There is nothing to see here. Move along."]="这里没有什么可以看的。往前走。"
G["There is nothing to see here. Proceed with your mandated duties."]="未发现异常。继续执行指派的任务。"
G["There is nowhere to hide!"]="你们无处可逃！"
G["There is nowhere to run..."]="你们无路可逃……"
G["There is one even greater than I in this art. You are ready to receive her knowledge. She is Annora, and you may find her... in Uldaman."]="安诺拉是唯一一个在技能上胜过我的人。你得去……奥达曼找她，学习更多知识。"
G["There is one further step on the path of Light: compassion."]="要在圣光之路上更进一步，我们还必须学会同情。"
G["There is one last thing.  I need to know where Arugal is."]="只剩最后一件事了。我必须知道阿鲁高的下落。"
G["There is one that I know of here in Thunder Bluff that can aid you in your journey to Alterac Valley. On the Hunter Rise look for Taim Ragetotem. May you find what you are looking for $n."]="我知道在雷霆崖有人可以帮助你进入奥特兰克山谷。去猎人高地找泰姆·暴怒图腾。希望你找到你希望找的人，$n。"
G["There is one true path. The path of flame!"]="真理之道只有一个。那就是烈焰之道！"
G["There is one whose knowledge exceeds my own. You are ready to seek her out. Go to Sun Rock Retreat in Stonetalon Mountains. Find Hgarth, and continue your training."]="Hay alguien con unos conocimientos que superan a los míos. Estás $glisto:lista; para buscarla. Ve al Refugio Roca del Sol en Sierra Espolón. Busca a Hgarth y continúa tu instrucción."
G["There is only Ghur'sha."]="这儿，只有古厄夏。"
G["There is only one Warchief, Eitrigg!"]="只有一个酋长，伊崔格！"
G["There is only one thing to do.  I must smash it!  Once and for all, all shall know the power of my mighty brow."]="现在我只要做一件事，那就是砸碎它！这下，所有人都会彻底看清我额头的强大力量。"
G["There is only one true path of enlightenment! DEATH!"]="使你获得真理启迪的途径只有一条，那就是死亡！"
G["There is only one way to cleanse this sword. Make haste for the Sunwell and immerse the blade in its waters."]="只有一个办法能净化它。赶快到太阳之井去，将剑沉入井水之中。"
G["There is only one way to find out."]="要想知道，只有一个办法。"
G["There is perhaps a way..."]="或许还有办法……"
G["There is so much life here. And so much space.\n\nBack on the Wandering Isle there was never enough space for predators to grow large enough to hunt."]="这里生机盎然，一望无垠。\n\n迷踪岛上地方狭小，猛兽根本没空间茁壮成长，供猎人捕杀。"
G["There is so much we can learn from this land, and yet you are content to watch it burn around you."]="从这片土地上，我们可以学到很多，然而你却只想看着它燃烧。"
G["There is so much work to do!"]="有太多工作要做了！"
G["There is some kind of barrier that shields this Vale, preventing my use of portal magic."]="这里有一些屏障保护着四风谷，阴止我使用传送门魔法。"
G["There is something greater than magic at work in the night sky.  One day they'll listen to me. . . ."]="仰望夜空，你能感觉到一些比魔法还要神奇的东西。总有一天它们会听我的声音……"
G["There is something odd about this particular object..."]="这件神器有些奇怪……"
G["There is something that I must attend to."]="我有一些事情必须去处理一下。"
G["There is something that you wish to buy?  There is something that you wish to sell?\n\nThis is why we are here, my friend.\n\nPlease, tell me your pleasure."]="¿Hay algo que desees comprar? ¿Hay algo que desees vender?\n\nPor eso estamos aquí, $gamigo:amiga;.\n\nPor favor, dime qué deseas."
G["There is something you can do, troll, to demonstrate your value to the Horde. A mission in the heart of this continent."]="你还有点用，巨魔，证明一下你对部落的价值吧。去这片大陆的中心执行个任务。"
G["There is still time to stop this madness. You don't have to do this Shokia..."]="现在还有时间制止这一暴行。你没必要这么做，夏琪亚……"
G["There is trouble at Lor'danel, a village of ours across the waters from Rut'theran."]="在洛达内尔，我们的一座与鲁瑟兰隔水相望的村子里出现了一些很糟糕的情况。"
G["There is usable wood, even in these swamps. Look for brittle roots protruding from the soil."]="即使是在这片沼泽里也能找到可用的木材。去寻找那些暴露在土壤外的脆弱根茎吧。"
G["There is wisdom in your words, brother. I'll take that food of yours..."]="恩，你的话语中包含着智慧，兄弟。我会带上你的食物……"
G["There is word from Jotunheim. The sleep-watchers there believe that they have found someone of significance."]="尤顿海姆传来消息，据说那里的沉睡卫士发现了一位重要人物。"
G["There is work to be done here, but do you see anyone jumping to help me? No! Wretches, all of them!"]="我忙得不可开交，可是有谁来帮过我呢？一个都没有！这帮混蛋！"
G["There is yet much which stands between you and your question's answer."]="要想解惑，你还有很多东西要学。"
G["There is... something else that you should know about the Lich King. Control over the Scourge must never be lost. Even if you were to strike down the Lich King, another would have to take his place. For without the control of its master, the Scourge would run rampant across the world - destroying all living things."]="还有…还有一些事情你需要知道。天灾军团绝不能失去控制。即使你战胜了这个巫妖王，也要有别人来取代他。没有巫妖王的控制，天灾军团就会横扫整个世界，摧毁一切生灵。"
G["There isn't room in this town for both of us!"]="这城镇无法同时容下我们两个人！"
G["There it goes.  It should only be a moment now...."]="就这样吧。应该用不了多久……"
G["There it is -- Gadgetzan!  We're in the home stretch now!"]="就在那里——加基森！我们现在处于冲刺阶段！"
G["There it is again! I know I heard something!"]="又来了！我肯定听到什么声音了！"
G["There it is! Do you see where the large red crystal is jutting out from the Vector Coil? That's where I need to plant the first set of explosives."]="就是这个！你看到矢量感应器上突起的红色水晶了吗？那就是放置第一组炸药的地方。"
G["There it is! Get ready!"]="在那！准备好！"
G["There it is! I could've sworn it wasn't here last time I checked..."]="在这里！我发誓我上次没有把它放在这里……"
G["There it is! Old Man Thistle's treasure!"]="就在那！老农阿蓟的宝藏！"
G["There it is! The Isle of the Thunder King. Already, the Horde is circling it like hungry birds of prey."]="就是那里！传说中的雷神岛。部落已经像饥饿的猛禽一样包围了它。"
G["There it is! Wide open. Good luck to you conquering what lies beyond. I must report back to the Kirin Tor at once!"]="搞定了！祝你们好运。我必须马上回去向肯瑞托报告！"
G["There it is, hero! The Divine Bell!"]="就是它，英雄！圣钟！"
G["There may still be a solution. Come here, $n. I will explain what I need."]="可能还有个解决办法，到这边来，$n。我会向你解释我需要什么。"
G["There must be a way."]="肯定有办法解决的。"
G["There must be a way..."]="一定有办法……"
G["There must be one around here somewhere..."]="这一带肯定有我们要的草药……"
G["There must be someplace on Azeroth that we can find oozes uncorrupted by the Scourge or anything else. But where?!"]="在艾泽拉斯，一定有未被亡灵天灾侵蚀的软泥怪。但是在哪儿呢？"
G["There must be something wrong with those Hozen we saw earlier!"]="我们见过那些猢狲，一定有什么地方不对劲！"
G["There now. It be a gift to you, to celebrate Tanzar's great escape!"]="好啦。这是给你的礼物，庆祝坦扎尔的顺利逃脱！"
G["There now. It be a gift to you, to help wit' defeatin' da Amani!"]="好啦。这是给你的礼物，感谢你帮忙打败阿曼尼帝国！"
G["There once was a jibby nib mallet all shiny and divine."]="那把细细的钟杵曾经闪亮而神圣。"
G["There reason Frenzyheart not chase back chickens. Look kind of dumb to lose to chicken."]="狂心狼獾人不去追鸡是有原因的。因为如果追不上的话，就太丢脸了。"
G["There shall be no prison for you this time!"]="这一次，你不会有机会再进监狱了！"
G["There she is, mon! Let's finish this business."]="她在那里！让我们了结这件事吧。"
G["There she is. Mount up!"]="她来了，上坐骑！"
G["There should be plenty of anti-venom, thanks to $p."]="多亏$p，现在解毒剂应该够用了。"
G["There should be plenty of food stored around this temple."]="寺院周围应该有很充足的食物储备。"
G["There some reason why we're still here? I'd love to hear it."]="为什么我们还留在这里？给我个说得过去的理由啊。"
G["There there, little hunter. I'm here for you."]="嗨，小猎人。我正要找你。"
G["There there... close your eyes..."]="听话……闭上眼睛吧……"
G["There they are!"]="他们在那里！"
G["There they are! Okay, you three make sure that you help $g him : her; out today. $G He's : She's; got a lot of stuff to take care of before the party!"]="¡Ahí están! Está bien, hoy vosotros tres $gle:la; ayudaréis. ¡Tiene que ocuparse de un montón de cosas antes de la fiesta!"
G["There they are. Taima, are we close enough to see everything for the report?"]="瞧，虫孔。台玛，别再往前走啦。我们已经了解到足够多的信息，回去好吗？"
G["There they were, marching through the depths of the Silkwood on an errand of peace."]="从前有一群人，他们带着和平的使命，穿行在丝木林的深处。"
G["There walks a hero!"]="瞧！英雄！"
G["There walks a hero."]="那边走过来一位英雄。"
G["There walks a true soldier of the Horde!"]="现在走来的是部落真正的勇士！"
G["There was a demon amongs us after all... Just not where we had expected."]="竟然有个恶魔潜伏在我们中间……真是想不到。"
G["There was a time when I could ask whatever I wished from those who sought out my master.  But now, he takes pretty much anyone in as an apprentice and they can pass through his portals all they please.\n\nIt is upsetting to me, but I do not question his orders.  I can only take enjoyment in making fun of the ridiculous clothes you wear or the pathetic look on your face.  Even that bores me...\n\nEven this rambling bores me!  Go. Be gone. Share your depressing sense of style with someone else."]="曾经有一段时间，我可以对那些想要见我主人的家伙们予取予求。但现在，我的主人会接纳任何想成为他学生的人。他们能够通过他的传送门随意往来。\n\n我不会质疑他的命令，但这实在让我感到很苦恼。现在我的乐趣只剩下了让你们穿上可笑的衣服，或者看看你们的那副可怜相。但这些也已经让我感到无聊了……\n\n我对这种生活感到极度厌烦！走吧，赶快走。和别人去分享你的郁闷心情吧。"
G["There was a time when my father would spend days in the jungle hunting for the perfect cave barley.\n\nIt was very dangerous, and something I can't bring myself to do.\n\nNot worth it. Stormstout only pays for quantity, not quality."]="过去，我的父亲会连续几天在丛林里搜寻最完美的岩洞大麦。\n\n这事非常危险，我可不愿意舍身犯险。\n\n这不值得。风暴烈酒关心的是数量而不是质量。"
G["There was a time where I would have done the same. But I've learned a lot over the years. I've fallen for too many of Garrosh's tricks."]="我曾经也和你一样。但这么多年来我学会了许多，我也已经尝够了加尔鲁什的诡计。"
G["There was another guy just hitting on me. Oh, the nerve!\n\nWill you beat him up for me, sweetie? Thanks. Love ya!"]="又有个家伙打了我。哦，这可真让人气恼！\n\n你愿意帮我打他一顿吗，甜心？谢谢，我真爱你！"
G["There was hundreds of times these hardknuckles before Goregek."]="格利基克的主要工作之一就是猎捕硬皮猩猩。"
G["There was little time before the watchers of Nethergarde sensed a disturbance in the portal... and the demons screamed into our world!\n\nAlthough reinforcements from the kingdoms of Azeroth are on the march, we of the Argent Dawn were first to rally behind Nethergarde's call.\n\nOur mission: hold these monsters at bay until help from the Alliance and Horde arrives..."]="当守望堡的卫兵发现黑暗之门出现骚动时，只剩下不多的时间了……恶魔咆哮着涌入我们的世界！\n\n尽管艾泽拉斯的援军还在路上，我们银色黎明会第一个响应守望堡的征召。\n\n我们的任务是：守住这里，直到联盟和部落的援军抵达……"
G["There was no sport in that kill."]="这可不是运动，而是杀戮。"
G["There was once a Titan-made stone inside.  It was known as the World Pillar.  The name was literal.  It bore the weight of all the elemental and magnetic forces in Deepholm."]="这儿曾经有块泰坦制造的石头，被称作世界之柱。如同其字面意思，它承载了深岩之洲世界所有的元素之力和磁吸引力。"
G["There was something else I wanted to ask you, Altruis."]="我还有其他事想问你，奥图里斯。"
G["There was something else I wanted to ask you."]="我还想问你一些其它的问题。"
G["There was something interesting about those red pandas.  I think I might have an idea on how to fix Brewmaster Shadowpour's drinks so they are non-lethally tasty."]="那些小熊猫有点意思。我想我或许可以改进一下酒仙影斟的配方，让酿出的酒不再致命。"
G["There was something strange about that wind; it didn't stop. For weeks it blew across the land, waxing and waning, but never ceasing. And all the time the voice continued, though I could not understand it, nor did I know where it was coming from.\n\nMy time in solitude had taught me how to calm myself and look inward. This I did in order to keep my sanity. And that is when I began to understand the voice. It was coming from the wind itself and it had much to say!"]="那阵风有些异常，它丝毫没有停止下来的意思。风就这样刮过整个大陆，持续了几个星期，一会儿强一会儿弱，但从不停止。而且那个声音始终持续着，尽管我听不懂那是什么意思，也不知道它是从哪来的。\n\n在我独处的那段时间里，我学会了冷静和洞察问题的本质。我之所以这样做，是为了保证我还心智健全。那时，我突然开始听懂了那个声音。它从风中传出，而且它有很多话要说！"
G["There we are, $n.  The Scroll is fixed!  Hooray!"]="搞定了，$n。卷轴已经修复了！万岁！"
G["There we are, $n.  The toxin is ready."]="搞定了，$n。毒素已经准备好了。"
G["There we are.  A new batch of flash bombs!"]="搞定了。一批新的闪光弹！"
G["There we go!"]="我们这就出发！"
G["There we go! Good as new... I guess..."]="好了！就像是没受过伤一样……吧……"
G["There we go! Ripe for the pickin's!"]="我们上！可以采摘了！"
G["There we go, $n! This fat'll do the trick fer sure! And now for some real swabbin'!"]="好啦，$n！这肯定管用！让我们好好打扫一下吧！"
G["There we go, all finished.  The journal has been translated for you."]="搞定了。日记已经翻译完毕。"
G["There we go, the Rune of Command... hopefully. Not nearly as vicious as its Iron Dwarf cousin, but functional."]="瞧，命令符文……希望能起作用。它并不没有铁矮人那股邪恶的气息，却同样具备操纵巨人的能力。"
G["There we go.  The substance that you have brought me is approximately... 150,000 years old?  What!?  I'm going to need to run another test."]="好了。你给我带来的物质大约是……十五万年前的？什么？！我还得再进行另一个实验。"
G["There we go. All done!"]="就是这样，全部搞定了！"
G["There we go. Should you pass through Silvermoon City, come and say hello, hmmm? Al diel shala..."]="好了。要是你途径银月城，来跟我打个招呼，好吗？祝你好运……"
G["There we go. That should do it!"]="好了。这应该能行！"
G["There we have it! Back to the labs!"]="成功完成！返回实验室！"
G["There we were, riding into battle at full speed on the back of Stampy..."]="我们骑在斯塔比背上，全速开战……"
G["There were hundreds imprisoned by his spell. Now only a few remain in their prisons. He would speak to us sometimes."]="曾经有数百人被他的法术困住。现在只有一小部分还被囚禁着。他有时也会和我们交谈。"
G["There were too many... our assault seems to have barely even scratched at their ranks. We lost so many men! Something must come of this..."]="他们人数太多了……面对我们的袭击几乎毫发无损。而我们已经损失惨重！必须得想个办法……"
G["There were two others that were already recovered. Godfrey is the final piece."]="我们已经完成了另外两个目标。高弗雷是最后一个了。"
G["There were worgen everywhere.... it should've been me...."]="这里到处都是狼人……那本应该是我……"
G["There were... too many!"]="他们……太多了！"
G["There will be a time for battle, Durm. But first, we must find a way to even the odds. What would you have me do, Aeire?"]="杜尔姆，战争看来是不可避免的。但首先，我们得找到扭转局势的法子。埃恩雷，你有什么提议吗？"
G["There will be a very unpleasant surprise waiting for the next troll who disturbs these. Let's keep moving."]="巨魔一旦触发它们，就会得到一个意想不到的惊喜。我们继续。"
G["There will be more time to talk once we get back to the surface safely."]="等我们安全回到地表之后，会有大把的时间供我们交谈。"
G["There will be no cages this time, I will tear your limbs from your bodies!"]="这次就不用囚笼了，我要直接把你们的四肢扯下来！"
G["There will be no easy escape for you.  You answer to the temple."]="你不会这么容易就得到解脱。你还要等着月神殿的发落。"
G["There will be no escape!"]="没有人能逃得掉！"
G["There will be no escape..."]="休想逃走……"
G["There will be no escaping me."]="别想逃出我的手心。"
G["There will be no everlasting life for you!"]="你的生命到此结束！"
G["There will be no mercy!"]="我是不会心慈手软的！"
G["There will be no peace in death for you, that I promise."]="你在死后也不会得到安息的。"
G["There will be no reprieve! My work here is nearly finished!"]="已经来不及了！我的工作马上就要完成了！"
G["There will be no second chances, $r."]="不会有第二次机会了，$r。"
G["There will be no sitting. No talking. And none of your horrible beer!"]="我可不想陪你坐着说闲话。更不想喝你那些糟糕的啤酒！"
G["There will be no surrender!  There will be no escape!  There will be no quarter!"]="不接受投降！不放过一个！！不留活口！！！"
G["There will be no survivors, my lord."]="我不会心慈手软的。"
G["There will be pain..."]="你们会很痛苦……"
G["There will be plenty of time for this later Brann, we need to get moving!"]="以后有的是时间啊，布莱恩。我们必须立即转移！"
G["There will be time enough to speak of preparations for battle against Twilight's Hammer. Today, we celebrate $n's victory!"]="我们有足够的时间准备同暮光之锤的战斗。而今天，我们要庆祝$n的胜利！"
G["There will be time for a proper thanks later, but there is still a battle to be fought!"]="稍后我会正式地感谢你，但是现在我们还有一场仗要打！"
G["There will be time to celebrate later, commander.  Twilight dragons approach!"]="以后再庆祝吧，指挥官。暮光巨龙正在逼近！"
G["There will never be another like me..."]="再也不会有像我这样的……"
G["There ya go!"]="没错！"
G["There ya go, all aboard. That's right..."]="都登船啦，这就对啦……"
G["There ya go, mon. Try ta be more careful with this one, won't ya?\n\nNow head down ta Drak'Zin Ruins and drink it near the pedestal!"]="给。千万别大意哦。\n\n等你进入达克辛废墟后，在底座旁喝下它！"
G["There ya go, mon. Try ta be more careful with this one, won't ya?\n\nNow head to the passage of Drak'Atal to the northwest and drink the elixir at the pedestal there. \n\nI'll instruct you further when I see you again."]="给。这次要格外当心啦。\n\n前往西北边的达克阿塔小径，在底座旁饮下药剂吧。\n\n然后我会给你进一步指示的。"
G["There ya go, mon. Try ta be more careful with this one, won't ya?\n\nNow head up north to Zeb'Halak and drink it near the pedestal!\n\nI'll instruct you further from there."]="给。这次要格外当心啦。\n\n前往北边的塞布哈拉克，在底座旁边饮下它吧！\n\n然后我会给你进一步指示的。"
G["There ya go, mon. Try ta be more careful with this one, won't ya?\n\nNow head up north to Zeb'Halak and drink it near the pedestal!\n\nOh, and be sure ya get the Eye of the Prophets from the head on the ziggurat first..."]="给。这次要格外当心啦。\n\n前往北边的塞布哈拉克，在底座旁边饮下它吧！\n\n哦，你要先去通灵塔顶端取下预言者之眼才行……"
G["There ye are! I was startin' to think ye'd made off with the beer!"]="你来了！我还以为你带着啤酒逃走了！"
G["There ye are. Here's the lay of it: The king's spies are dead to a man. Only a handful o' dwarven scouts are left."]="你们可来了。听我说：国王的密探都死光了。只有少数矮人斥候活了下来。"
G["There you are Darion! I was wondering when you'd crawl forth."]="你总算来了，达里安！我正在猜想你什么时候会露面呢。"
G["There you are!"]="你来了！"
G["There you are! I think I've just about got this door figured out. Let me know when you're ready and I'll open'er up!"]="¡Ahí estás! Creo que ya sé cómo va esta puerta. ¡Avísame cuando estés $gpreparado:preparada; y la abriré!"
G["There you are! I thought the furbolgs might have caught you before you could even get here."]="你在这里！我还以为你被那些熊怪抓住了。"
G["There you are! I was beginning to think that the Sunreavers had intercepted you. Are you ready to deliver the tome to our representatives in Icecrown?"]="¡Ahí estás! Empezaba a pensar que te habían interceptado los Atracasol. ¿Estás $gpreparado:preparada; para entregar el escrito a nuestros representantes en Corona de Hielo?"
G["There you are, $n! I thought you'd forgotten about me."]="你来了，$n！我还以为你已经忘了我了。"
G["There you are, you little miscreant."]="小坏蛋，你躲在这儿呀。"
G["There you are."]="瞧瞧。"
G["There you are.  Are you ready then?  Once we start, there is no turning back."]="Aquí estás. Entonces, ¿estás $glisto:lista;? Una vez hayamos empezado, no habrá vuelta atrás."
G["There you are. What news from Westfall?"]="你来啦，西部荒野那边有什么消息吗？"
G["There you go, $n. Good thing my powers of divination and summoning still work in this ghostly state, huh?"]="好了，$n。我的预言术和召唤术在我成了一个鬼魂之后还能使用，多好呀！"
G["There you go, $r."]="就这样了，$r。"
G["There you go, Mister Noggenfogger! You won't have to worry about those giants anymore!"]="好了，诺格弗格先生！你不用再担心那些巨人了！"
G["There you go, mon. Your very own bone gryphon Now let's talk about you takin' it out to fight the Onslaught!"]="给，朋友。这是你的白骨狮鹫。不如骑上它和先锋军作战！"
G["There you go. I need to get back to work before Rokar clouts me again for being lazy."]="Ya estás $glisto:lista;. Tengo que volver al trabajo antes de que Rokar me dé otra torta por estar vagueando."
G["There you go. Tastes like seaweed and hot garbage, doesn't it?"]="可以出发了。味道像是混合了海草和热垃圾，是吧？"
G["There you go..."]="给……"
G["There you have it! The King should be quite pleased, if I do say so myself."]="很好！我保证国王一定会为此感到满意的。"
G["There you have it, $n. A mighty bow for a mighty hunter. Use it well in service of the Alliance."]="Aquí lo tienes, $n. Un gran arco para $gun gran cazador:una gran cazadora;. Úsalo bien en servicio de la Alianza."
G["There you have it, $n. All the safe approaches to the Twilight Highlands. Unleash havoc on our foes!"]="拿去吧，$n。所有可攻入暮光高地的安全路线都在这上面了。将毁灭带给我们的敌人吧！"
G["There you have it. Our lesson on summoning has come to an end. A new class will begin shortly, so if you wish to brush up, feel free to stay around."]="所有的召唤生物都介绍完毕了。召唤课程已经结束。新的课程将会很快开始，如果你要想要得到进一步的提高，那就请不要走远，先在周围转转。"
G["There!  Those pipes all appear to be connected to that structure.  It can't possibly fit all the water they've been stealing.  Where are they keeping it?"]="看！那些管道似乎都连接着那座建筑，但是那里面不可能存放所有他们偷来的水。他们究竟把水储存在哪里呢？"
G["There!  Who is that he's meeting with?"]="在那里！他在和谁说话？"
G["There! Destroy him! The Cipher must be recovered!"]="那儿！消灭他！必须抢到密码！"
G["There! Go! GO!!!"]="那边！快！快！！！"
G["There! I see him, wreathed in flame! I can feel waves of fury radiating from his core. Such rage... his anger alone could burn us to cinders!"]="那边！我看到他了，包裹在烈焰中！我能感受到他心中喷薄而出的狂怒。如此狂野……他的愤怒会将我们也烧成灰烬！"
G["There! It is ready."]="瞧！它近在咫尺。"
G["There! Job's done."]="嘿，搞定了。"
G["There! Just ahead: The Isle of the Thunder King."]="看！就在前面：雷神岛。"
G["There! Look at him - frozen in stone, unmoving. Unfeeling. That look on his face... the resolve, the stubbornness. He gets it when he digs his heels in."]="看那儿！看看他，被禁锢在石头中，无法动弹。毫无知觉。他脸上的表情……如此坚定，如此顽固。这是他拒绝妥协的表情。"
G["There! Our work is complete - we have forged a masterpiece!"]="好！完成了——我们铸造了一件杰作！"
G["There! Over there!"]="那里！在那里！"
G["There! She reveals herself. Attack!"]="在那里！她显形了。攻击！"
G["There! That wasn't too bad. What did you say you and Raene were going to do with this thing? It's powerful!"]="啊！这还不坏。你和莱恩打算拿这东西去做什么来着？这东西可真强力！"
G["There! The Klaxxi! Hold that crystal together... don't let it escape!"]="那儿！卡拉克西！控制住水晶……别让它跑了！"
G["There! There!"]="瞧！他们来了！"
G["There! We got it! Let's get 'er outta here."]="好啦！我们成功啦！让我们离开这里。"
G["There'd be no more elementals in the Mystic Ward now. We've also cleared out all of those trapped folks too!"]="秘法区里已经没有元素了。我们还救出了所有被困住的人！"
G["There'll be a new trade risin' up round your carcass, $n. We'll call it 'flesh-craftin.'"]="我们会对你的尸体上进行妥善处理的，$n。我们称其为“分尸”。"
G["There's Farstrider Enclave now, $c. Not far to go... look out!  Troll ambush!!"]="那里就是远行者营地了，$c。就在前面……小心！有埋伏！"
G["There's Horde to kill, lads! I can smell 'em!"]="有部落可以杀了，小子们！我闻到了！"
G["There's a $c incoming! Don't let $Ghim:her; through!"]="$c来了！别让$g他:她;通过！"
G["There's a Bat Handler inside the Undercity.  Head south down the road out of Brill, then west at the T-intersection.  The Ruins of Lordaeron will be on your left.  Go into them and then down into the Undercity.  You can ask an Undercity Guardian there for further assistance."]="在幽暗城中居住着一位蝙蝠管理员。出了布瑞尔城朝南走，然后在丁字路口向西走。洛丹伦废墟就在你的右边，穿过废墟，然后进入幽暗城。你可以问问那儿的守卫，请求他们的帮助。"
G["There's a Skinning Trainer in Orgrimmar.  To get there head north up the road out of Razor Hill.  Ask an Orgrimmar Grunt for directions when you arrive."]="在奥格瑞玛有一名剥皮训练者。出了剃刀岭往北走，当你到达奥格瑞玛时问问那儿的守卫，他们会为你指明方向的。"
G["There's a big meanie attacking Mr. Floppy! Help!"]="小毛球遇到大坏蛋啦！救命啊！"
G["There's a broken world that could use your help, my student. Have you decided who you would like to accompany in your journey?"]="Más allá de estos muros yace un mundo devastado que necesita tu ayuda, mi $gestimado alumno:estimada alumna;. ¿Has decidido a quién quieres acompañar en tu periplo?"
G["There's a building in the northeast of Falconwing Square... within, you'll most likely find Tannaria, a woman well skilled in remaining out of sight."]="在鹰翼广场的东北部有一座建筑……你可以在里面找到塔娜莉亚，一个很擅长躲藏的女人。"
G["There's a cave, north o' here, across a bridge. If ye can slay the elemental within, the storm ought ta stop."]="在北边，桥的另一头有个山洞。如果能杀死里面的元素，风暴就会停止。"
G["There's a chemical inside the rocket. What is it?"]="火箭里携带了一种化学品。是什么东西？"
G["There's a druid stealthing around in his cat-form.  I thought that we had hunters in here.  Deal with it!"]="有个德鲁伊变成小豹子潜伏在附近。我们这里有猎人吧！去解决这家伙！"
G["There's a great cook who works at the Pig and Whistle Tavern in Old Town.  I've watched him use a knife when he cooks and just between you and me, I don't think he's always been a cook.  Don't get me wrong... if you still want to learn, he's the best we have."]="有一名优秀的厨师在旧城区的猪与哨声旅店工作。我曾在他身旁看他在烹饪时使用刀具，但是我可不认为他只是一名厨师。别误会我的意思……如果你想学厨艺的话，他会是你最好的老师。"
G["There's a great deal that you do not understand, my dear Greely. That is why you are the assistant and I... I am Hobart Grapplehammer!"]="你有许多事还不明白，我亲爱的格瑞里。正因为如此，你才是助手，而我……我是霍巴特·钩锤！"
G["There's a little blood on your armor there. Are you okay?"]="你的护甲上沾了点儿血。你还好吧？"
G["There's a lot of gear here we can still use. Fan out. And step lively! The Dragonmaw are near."]="这里还有很多可供我们使用的设备。立刻散开。加快速度！龙喉兽人已经很近了。"
G["There's a lot of money out there in that jungle, $r.  Can you see it?\n\nNo, it doesn't look like gold or copper.  It looks like raptor hides, and mineral veins, and ancient troll artifacts.\n\nOK, maybe the mineral veins might look like gold or copper.\n\nBut still, you get my point, right?"]="在那片丛林里可藏着许多钱，$r。你看见了吗？\n\n不，这钱的样子跟你平时见到的金币或铜币不同。它的外观是迅猛龙的龙皮，还有矿脉，以及古老的巨魔圣物。\n\n好吧，也许矿脉和金币铜币的样子有点儿像。\n\n不过反正你明白我的意思了，对吧？"
G["There's a mage at the Thunderbrew Distillery who might be able to teach you some new spells.  I believe his name is Magis Sparkmantle."]="住在雷酒酿造厂的一名法师或许能教你一些新的魔法。我想他名叫玛济斯·石衣。"
G["There's a path right there... only a few mines at the end in between us and the tools."]="你瞧，沿着这条道走，我们和工具之间……其实只有几枚地雷。"
G["There's a phrase... \"It's always darkest before the dawn.\" The dawn will come, though, Tahu. The sun will rise. The balance will shift back to where it should be."]="Hay una frase...\"La noche es más oscura antes del amanecer.\" El amanecer llegará, Tahu. El sol brillará. El equilibrio volverá a su sitio."
G["There's a set of fresh tracks following the forest's edge back towards town.  It's hard to tell if they're his though."]="这边有一些新鲜的痕迹，沿着森林的边缘一直延伸到了镇上。但很难讲是不是他留下的。"
G["There's a thief over here!"]="这里有小偷！"
G["There's a tower coming up on our left.  What do you say we stop and rest a bit?"]="我在左边看到了一座塔楼。我们停下来休息一下如何？"
G["There's a type of iron unique to these parts. Bring back any ya find, $p. Ain't no iron in Azeroth us dwarves can't forge."]="这里有一些特殊的铁矿。给我找一些回来，$p。在艾泽拉斯没有矮人熔不了的金属。"
G["There's a village up here... and a big fish statue, too."]="那儿有个村子……还有一座很大的鱼雕像。"
G["There's a whole bunch of them still in the caves.  They're getting ready to attack your people!"]="他们还有一大帮人仍在洞穴里，正准备攻击你们的人！"
G["There's a whole vast forest out there, $c. Let the shaman play with the spirits and the warriors toy with their swords. Terokkar is where I'll make my fortune."]="那里有着大片的森林，$c。让萨满和灵魂们玩耍，让战士们耍他们的剑。泰罗卡森林是个要让我赚大钱的地方。"
G["There's a worgen druid by the name of Dareth just outside the city gates; he might be able to help you.\n\nBig beast of a fellow, covered in white leather and furs. You can't miss him."]="城门外有一个名叫达伦斯的狼人德鲁伊。他也许能帮助你。\n\n他是一头高大的猛兽，身披白色皮毛。你不可能认错他的。"
G["There's absolutely nothing out of the ordinary about it."]="这酒真是稀松平常，毫无新意。"
G["There's always a need for more kegs at Brewfest!\n\nI'll lend you the reins to one of my personal rams.\n\nEvery time you bring me a keg, I'll give you some tokens.  I'll even let you use the ram for a bit longer for every keg you bring me!  \nTake heed! Once you start this, you won't be able to do it again until tomorrow.\nAre you sure you're ready to do this?"]="¡Siempre hacen falta más barriles en la Fiesta de la Cerveza!\n\nTe prestaré las riendas de uno de mis carneros personales.\n\nPor cada barril que me traigas te daré unas fichas. ¡Hasta dejaré que te quedes con el carnero un ratito más por cada barril! \n\n¡Presta atención! Una vez que empieces, no podrás repetirlo hasta mañana.\n\n¿Estás seguro de que estás preparado?"
G["There's always just enough time for a last minute sale to the $g hero : heroine; of the Bilgewater Cartel, $n."]="锈水财阀的$g 英雄 : 女英雄; 总能在最后一刻赶上清仓销售的好机会，$n。"
G["There's always room for one more."]="停尸间还留着你的空位呢。"
G["There's always something new to investigate."]="总有一些新东西需要调查。"
G["There's an altar nearby where I can conduct the ritual. Let's go!"]="这附近有个祭坛，我可以在那里举行仪式。我们走吧！"
G["There's an artifact, a weapon, being forged with the power of an Old God. We don't know exactly what it is, but we need to get to it before it's completed by Cho'gall.\n\nEverything else is secondary. Everyone is expendable, including you and I."]="有个神器——那是种武器，正在被注入上古之神的力量。我们不知道它究竟在哪儿，可我们必须赶在古加尔完成之前找到它。\n\n其它任何事都是次要的。任何人的生命都是可以牺牲的，包括你和我。"
G["There's an ethereal beauty about this place... but for all the trees and plant life, it's still so... unnatural."]="这个地方的景致真是美不胜收……但是这些树和植物，仍然显得如此……不自然。"
G["There's an excellent skinner that lives up in the house by Crystal Lake.  She's bound to be able to show you how to get started in the skinner's profession."]="在水晶湖畔居住着一名技艺高超的剥皮师。她可以教你这项专业的入门技能。"
G["There's an herbalist that lives in the hills east of Stormwind with our alchemist. Quite the handy pairing don't you think?"]="有一名草药师跟炼金师一同居住在暴风城东面的山上。完美的搭配，不是吗？"
G["There's an old saying, \"Give a man a fish; you have fed him for a day.  Teach a man to fish; and you have fed him for a lifetime.\"  Of course, you might want to cook that fish and that is where I come in."]="Hay un viejo dicho, \"Dale un pescado a un hombre; lo has alimentado un día. Enseña a pescar a un hombre y lo habrás alimentado toda una vida.\" Por supuesto, querrás cocinar ese pescado, y ahí es donde entro yo."
G["There's an opening up ahead. GO NOW!"]="前面有个出口，赶快！"
G["There's another destroyed. Maintain the assault!"]="又摧毁了一个。给我继续攻击！"
G["There's another mistlurker here... I can smell his stink."]="这里还有一个雾行鬼……我能闻到它的臭味。"
G["There's another one! Kill the $r!"]="¡Ahí hay $gotro:otra;! ¡Matad $gal:a la; $r!"
G["There's at least fifteen people waiting in line ahead of you. Hard to tell - it's a little busy in here right now."]="你前面至少还有十五个人。这很难说——现在人有点儿多。"
G["There's at least fifty people in line in front of you. It's packed in here. I'd wait for things to calm down a bit if you want to fight anytime in the next hour or two."]="你前面至少还有五十个人。这儿人太多了。如果你想在接下来的一到两个小时内打上的话，最好还是先等大家的热情稍微冷却一点后再来。"
G["There's been too much death. Too much destruction. Put an end to them!"]="已经有太多人丧命。太多的毁灭。终结他们的恶行！"
G["There's been trouble contacting Mennu, sir!"]="我们和门努之间的联络出了问题，长官！"
G["There's blueleaf tuber in this trench! It's like gold waiting to be mined I tell you!"]="这个沟里就有蓝叶薯！它们可都是唾手可得的金子啊！"
G["There's enough work here for an army of orcs, and most of it, only I can do. Still, there is a job I could use a hand with."]="兽人军队要做的事情还很多，而大部分的事情只有我才能做。但是，我还是能帮一下忙的。"
G["There's got to be a way in somewhere."]="一定有办法过去的。"
G["There's got to be more. Doublecheck the bodies!"]="还应该有更多的东西。再把他们搜查一遍！"
G["There's gotta be some riches around this place... c'mon boss, you know you want to..."]="Tiene que haber tesoros por este lugar... Venga, $gjefe:jefa;, sé que te apetece..."
G["There's hope for Greenstone! Thank you!"]="绿石村有救了！谢谢你！"
G["There's just never enough Mojo to go around..."]="周围跑来跑去的魔汁还不够多……"
G["There's just not enough time to pack all of this stuff up! Grab only the important stuff! Where'd I put my Blastproof Underwater G-Ray Goggles?!"]="没有时间把所有东西都收拾好了！只拿最重要的东西！我的防爆水下G射线护目镜哪里去了？！"
G["There's lamp oil in the back - make use of it.  The fiends hate fire!"]="喏，后面有灯油——你知道该怎么做吧。那帮混蛋对火焰又恨又怕！"
G["There's money to be made!  Just like pops always said - no better time for raking in the cash than a time of war."]="趁这时候赶紧捞钱啊！我老爸经常说：战争是发横财的绝好机会。"
G["There's more to this than we know, $n.  I can guarantee you that much."]="我们知道的只是皮毛而已，$n。我可以向你担保。"
G["There's more where that came from, Marion!"]="这才刚刚开始，玛瑞恩！"
G["There's more where that came from. I am a well of rage."]="就算有再多的敌人，也都会被我无尽的怒火吞噬。"
G["There's my $g boy : girl;!"]="¡Así se hace!"
G["There's my bag! At last I've found it and now it's my gift to you and I truly hope you like it because I want you to all remember this wonderful moment for as long as you live and I hope that when you think of it you'll smile inside because I know I'll never forget it in a million years and I can't wait to tell momma all about it when I get back home.... Do you like my earrings?"]="我的包裹！终于找到啦这是我送你的礼物我真心希望你会喜欢它因为我要你们记住这刻美好时光一辈子都不要忘记啊我还希望你每次看到它的时候都能笑一笑要知道我是永远不会忘记你们的我迫不及待地想要回家告诉妈妈这次的冒险之旅啦……你觉得我这副耳环好看吗？"
G["There's my best friend! Come on, $n, dance with us!"]="这是我最好的朋友！来吧，$n，和我们一起跳舞吧！"
G["There's my favorite warlock! What dark secret can I whisper in your ear today?"]="¡Aquí está mi camarada $gbrujo:bruja;! ¿Qué oscuros secretos puedes susurrarme al oído hoy?"
G["There's my survey team. Bring us in."]="那是我的勘察组。带我们过去。"
G["There's no denying it - they really put that dog down! So much for our former champion!"]="不可否认——他们真的干掉了那条狗！我们的前任冠军也只不过是这个水平而已！"
G["There's no doubt about it. These creatures have been affected by sha."]="这一点毫无疑问，这些生物肯定受到了煞魔的影响。"
G["There's no doubt that something has distorted the true history of Stormhoof and the warriors of Camp Tunka'lo. But, what?"]="毫无疑问，有东西在干扰雷蹄和唐卡洛战士的真实历史。这究竟是怎么回事呢？"
G["There's no escape for you, insects.  You face the Shado-Pan this day."]="你们无处可逃了，小虫子。你们今天要面对的是影踪派。"
G["There's no finer expert I know on axes than Buliwyf here! One hand, two hands... he's a master of it all!"]="据我所知没有比这里的布里维夫更出色的斧子专家了！单手斧，双手斧……他都是大师。"
G["There's no gettin' away this time, orc! You've sung your last lok'tar!"]="这次无路可逃了，兽人！你已经喊完了最后一句兽人口号！"
G["There's no hope... our people have lost their minds!"]="没希望了……我们的同胞已经失去了理智！"
G["There's no king that matters here!"]="¡No hay ningún rey que importe aquí!"
G["There's no loitering, pan handling, cursing, fighting, or anything else you're thinking about doing, allowed in Caer Darrow."]="在凯尔达隆，你不能四处游荡、行乞、诅咒、斗殴，也不能随心所欲 。"
G["There's no need for you to understand, Arthas. All you need to do is die."]="阿尔萨斯，你不需要弄明白这是什么。你唯一要做的，就是等死。"
G["There's no need to contact that conniving ethereal. Come, we have much to discuss."]="不需要再和那个两面三刀的虚灵联系了。过来，我们有很多事情要讨论。"
G["There's no need to worry, Fahrad. This next mission is ... quite likely ... suicide."]="没必要担心，法拉德。下一个任务……和自杀也差不多了。"
G["There's no point in denying it, Dran! That thief knew exactly where to bring his stolen goods."]="你不用抵赖了，德兰！那个小偷当然知道应该到什么地方来处理他的赃物。"
G["There's no room on your skin for runic tattoos, $C, because you lack the Runemaster's spirit to hold them."]="No hay lugar en tu piel para tatuajes runicos, $C, porque careces del espíritu del Maestro de Runas para sostenerlos."
G["There's no running away from a challenge."]="从决斗中逃跑可不像话。"
G["There's no substitute for live observers, but I need those mountaineers here. We'll have to rely on those little gnomish observer bots for now..."]="真人观察者是无可取代的，但我现在需要那些巡山人来帮忙。我们只能暂时依靠那些小个子的侏儒观察机器人了……"
G["There's no telling how we might use the power these mechanisms create."]="我们不知该如何利用这些装置所能产生的能量。"
G["There's no thrill like the thrill of a dragon hunt."]="还有什么比猎杀巨龙更惊心动魄的呢。"
G["There's no time left! All remaining forces, attack the invaders!"]="没有时间了！所有残余部队立刻向入侵者发动攻击！"
G["There's no time to waste, $n. My intel tells me that the yaungol are about to launch an all-out last ditch assault. We're all counting on you to kill Chief Ragemesa."]="抓紧时间，$n。我的智慧告诉我，野牛人即将发动一次全面的生死突袭。我们都指望你能杀死酋长怒山。"
G["There's no time to waste, trooper. I must get back to base immediately! Cover me!"]="别浪费时间，士兵。我必须马上返回基地！掩护我！"
G["There's no turning back now, $n. Stay close and watch my back."]="现在已经没有退路了，$n。靠近我，小心背后。"
G["There's no warranty on those shades yous bought!"]="你买的这副墨镜是没有质保的！"
G["There's no way I'm dying for you."]="要我为你搭上性命，没门。"
G["There's no way I'm going into the Rivenwood; the place is haunted!"]="我说什么都不会踏进裂木森林一步，那地方闹鬼了！"
G["There's no way some Protectorate prisoner is going to defeat our gladiator!"]="维序派的囚犯不可能??我们的角斗士！"
G["There's no way they could have escaped by land.  Did they..."]="他们从地面上逃不掉，难道他们……"
G["There's no way you'll sleep through THIS."]="我不信你这样也能睡。"
G["There's no way you're gettin' out of here alive!"]="你绝不可能活着离开这里！"
G["There's no way you're getting past us."]="你们别想从我们这儿过。"
G["There's no... greater... glory."]="真是……无上的……荣耀。"
G["There's not nearly enough hide here to make a proper disguise."]="这些皮革根本不够作出一套像样的伪装服。"
G["There's nothing I can teach you, other than maybe a better eye for color and detail. Talk to Simon Tanner over there; he knows a lot of advanced techniques for working with leather."]="除了对色彩和细节的鉴别能力外，我没有什么可以教你的。跟西蒙·坦纳尔谈谈；他知道很多制皮的高级技能。"
G["There's nothing I hate more than mercenaries. They are without honor!"]="我最恨的就是雇佣兵。他们没有半点荣誉感！"
G["There's nothing better than a fine brew!"]="再没有比美酒更好的东西了！"
G["There's nothing better than working up a sweat with a good fight!"]="没什么能比热火朝天地打一场来得更舒服了！"
G["There's nothing here. Let's keep looking."]="这里没有。继续寻找。"
G["There's nothing like a common enemy to bring people together. The dwarven clans have never been so united. If the peace holds, our three kingdoms will be stronger than ever before..."]="一个共同的敌人，是让人民保持团结的最好方法。矮人部族从未如此团结过。如果和平能持续下去，我们三大王国将会空前的强大……"
G["There's nothing like a good cup of kafa! When the seeds are roasted just right, ground fresh, and brewed in pure water.\n\nPerfect for the weary traveler or studious monk."]="什么也比不上一杯上好的咔啡啊！将种子烘焙到恰到好处后，趁热磨碎，再放到纯水中酿造。\n\n对疲惫的旅行者或好学的僧侣来说再好不过了。"
G["There's nothing like a little Lunar celebration to warm your bones!"]="没什么能比新年的庆典更让人高兴了！"
G["There's nothing like running your own enterprise.  But do I have to do everything myself?  Tell them to speed it up!"]="没有什么比得上经营自己的公司了。但是我必须事必躬亲吗？告诉他们加快速度！"
G["There's nothing like some scalding mornbrew on a chilly Dun Morogh day to get things started right!"]="在丹莫罗寒冷的日子里，没有什么比热酒更好的东西了！"
G["There's nothing more I can teach you. I've heard of a night elf who might be able to, though. Her name is Ainethil, and she lives in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus."]="我没有什么可教你的了。但是，我听说有位名叫安尼希尔的暗夜精灵也许能教你。她居住在达纳苏斯的工匠区。"
G["There's nothing more exciting than to soar through the air.\n\nWell, maybe to fight while soaring through the air, and a good tankard of ale afterward!"]="没有什么比在高空中翱翔更令人兴奋了。\n\n嗯，也许在飞翔时战斗会更好，最好在战斗之后还能喝上一杯上好的啤酒！"
G["There's nothing more inspiring than a flower in bloom!"]="没有什么比花朵的绽放更能振奋人心的了！"
G["There's nothing quite like communing with nature... or at least that's what the night elves tell me.  I'm not much for talking to flowers and trees, but I'm sure Tannysa could help you out.  She's over in the Mage Quarter outside of Alchemy Needs."]="与自然的交流沟通是其他任何事情都无可比拟的……至少暗夜精灵是这么告诉我的。我并不擅长跟花草树木交谈，但是我想塔尼莎能帮助你。她居住在法师区外侧的炼金材料店。"
G["There's nothing quite like the smell of Durotar on a warm, comfortable boat ride."]="乘着一艘温暖、舒适的小艇泛舟杜隆塔尔真是一大乐事。"
G["There's nothing there, Ha'lei. Please, I just need a few more minutes of silence."]="那里什么都没有，哈雷。好了，我只要几分钟就行了，安静一会吧。"
G["There's nowhere for you to run. The disease is inside you."]="你就是大地的顽疾，你无处可逃了。"
G["There's nowhere left to hide, VanCleef! The Defias are THROUGH!"]="你无路可逃了，范克里夫！迪菲亚的末日到了！"
G["There's nowhere to run, monster!"]="你无处可逃了，怪物！"
G["There's oil here alright, and we're gonna need it!"]="这儿有不少油，好吧，我们会用到的！"
G["There's one - get it!"]="来了一个——抓住他！"
G["There's one after me!"]="有狼人追我！"
G["There's one in Orgrimmar.  A grunt up there will know what directions to give you.  Just head north up the road here, you can't miss it."]="在奥格瑞玛有你要找的人。那儿的守卫会为你指明方向的。朝着北方的道路走，应该不会错过的。"
G["There's one in Orgrimmar.  Go north and talk to one of their grunts."]="在奥格瑞玛有你要找的人。朝着北方走，跟那儿的守卫谈谈。"
G["There's one of the Scourge, right over there!"]="天灾士兵！在那边！"
G["There's one of those inside the barracks on the east side of Razor Hill.  Look for Rawrk."]="拉乌克就在剃刀岭东边的兵营中。"
G["There's one! For the Horde!"]="那儿！为了部落！"
G["There's only a few of us left; the ones they don't eat, they butcher at some big altar."]="幸存者很少；没被吃掉的人都被杀死在西北边的祭坛上。"
G["There's only one hunter around here I would have ye talk to, and that would be Grif Wildheart.  Ye'll find him standing just outside the smithy in Kharanos."]="这附近只有一名猎人，那就是格瑞夫。他就站在卡拉诺斯的铁匠铺外。"
G["There's only one person I know of who is more learned in the art of tailoring than myself. Last I heard he could be found in Theramore Isle. He is the person you should seek."]="我只知道有一个人能在裁缝技能上胜过我。我最后一次听说他在塞拉摩岛。你该去找他。"
G["There's only one solution. I have to join the council. As for the farm..."]="现在只有一个办法了。我一定要加入议会。至于农场……"
G["There's only one way to find out..."]="只有一种办法可以弄清楚……"
G["There's orcs out there, $p. I can smell 'em. And they're bound to have supplies we can make use of."]="外面有不少兽人，$p。我能闻到他们身上的味道。他们身上携带的补给能够派上用场。"
G["There's our $g hero : heroine; right there! How are you doing, $n?"]="¡Ahí está nuestro $ghéroe:heroína;! ¿Qué tal te va, $n?"
G["There's plenty else going on out here, too.  We've opened up the path to the airport, there's rumors of Dark Irons in the east... oh, and I think something weird is going on with that dwarf king, Magni.  Might want to check it out."]="外面也有许多事情正在发生。通往机场的路线打通了，在东边有关于黑铁部族的传闻……噢，我想矮人国王麦格尼最近也有些不太对劲。也许应该去查清楚。"
G["There's plenty more where that came from!"]="好戏还在后头呢！"
G["There's plenty of me to go around."]="这里有我千万个分身。"
G["There's plenty others of your kind here, but I wouldn't worry about competition.  You're from the bloodline of Ohgan, my oldest friend.  You see... our souls are intertwined, yours and mine."]="在这儿有许多像你一样的人，可我并不担心竞争。你有着我的老朋友——奥根的血统。你看……我们的灵魂交织在一起，你的和我的。"
G["There's really nothing I enjoy more than the sound of screaming victims. Especially if they're MY victims."]="没什么能比濒死者的尖叫声更让我喜欢，特别是当他们死在我手中的时候。"
G["There's really nothing quite like a warm brew. Warms your bones and hits the spot. You can keep that cold stuff to yourself."]="没什么比得上一杯暖和的美酒了。让你的身体暖和起来，是一大享受啊。你把那个冷东西留给自己吧。"
G["There's so much I still wanted to do..."]="我还有很多梦想没有实现……"
G["There's so much going on! Isn't it exciting?"]="发生了那么多的事！这难道不刺激吗？"
G["There's so much knowledge of the ancient world stored here that we're only just now discovering!"]="在这里贮存着关于这个古老世界浩如烟海的广博知识，而我们才刚刚开始知晓而已！"
G["There's some adventuring in store for us today, then?"]="今天的冒险在等着我们呢，是不是？"
G["There's some good huntin' to be found here in the Barrens, if you've the stomach for it."]="要是你有胃口，贫瘠之地可是个打猎的好地方。"
G["There's something about this land - you don't understand..."]="这片土地蕴藏着——你不了解的玄机——"
G["There's something else here, too. After a description of a bloody battle and the downfall of the raven, there's a prophecy. Anzu will haunt the dreams of his enemies, twisting them to effect a return to this world..."]="石板上还记载着别的信息。在一段血腥战斗和乌鸦之神落败的描述之后，有一个预言：安苏将在敌人的梦境中出现，扭曲他们的意志，以重返这个世界……"
G["There's something fishy about new King Mrgl-Mrgl, but I can't quite put my finger on it."]="总觉得新国王姆嘎姆嘎有什么地方不对劲，但是又说不上来是哪儿有问题"
G["There's something going on in Orgrimmar, and I don't like the look of it. These women complain that people have disappered. Others say the world will end. What does it mean?"]="奥格瑞玛正在发生一些可怕的事情。这里的女人们都在传说有人失踪了。还有人说，世界将要完结。这到底是什么意思？"
G["There's something here.  It's in the rocks and the earth!"]="邪铁里藏有东西！就在岩石和泥土里！"
G["There's something out there. Let loose a warning round!"]="那是什么奇怪的东西？注意警戒！"
G["There's something... strange about them... something out of place..."]="它们有点……奇怪……有些不对劲……"
G["There's still hope - Gorai is still alive, to the south. Go!"]="还有希望——苟莱还活着，他在南边。走！"
G["There's still more virmen in the silos! Can you scare them off for me, $p?"]="粮仓里还有兔妖！你能帮我赶走它们吗，$p？"
G["There's the dog's banner and there's his corpse. What's that? He's upon us!"]="喏，瞧见那面旗帜和他的尸体了吧。怎么回事？他朝我们冲了过来！"
G["There's the flare. Left cannon, ready!"]="是信号弹。左侧炮台，准备！"
G["There's the mystical tome I was looking for."]="这就是我要寻找的魔法书。"
G["There's the refugee camp!"]="这里是难民营地！"
G["There's the stolen shredder! Stop it or Lugwizzle will have our hides!"]="这个就是被盗的伐木机！把它给解决掉，不然鲁格维兹会扒了我们的皮！"
G["There's the survey marker!"]="这里有勘测仪！"
G["There's too many of them! I don't know how long we can hold out! Go'el, now would be a good time to wake up!"]="他们的数量太多了！我不知道我们还能撑多久！古伊尔，是时候该醒醒了！"
G["There's too many of them. Kalithresh has an entire army down here."]="他们人太多了。卡利瑟里斯带来了整整一支大军。"
G["There's too much smoke in the air to see very far.\nI can't make out much of anything on the beach, and sniping's useless."]="Con tanto humo en el aire no se puede ver muy lejos.\n\nApenas veo la playa. Disparar no sirve de nada."
G["There's trouble in the woods.  We must uncover its source before it is too late!"]="古树们遇到了麻烦。我们必须尽快找出堕落之源，否则就太迟了！"
G["There, $n, I think I've figured it out!"]="$n，我想我已经搞明白了！"
G["There, $n, now you will be able to speak with, and understand, the Winterfin murlocs."]="$n，你已经能够与冬鳞鱼人沟通了。"
G["There, $n.  You may now speak to the Bloodscalp chief and his witchdoctor."]="嘿，$n。你现在可以去找血顶巨魔的首领和他的巫医谈话了。"
G["There, $n. It is done."]="好了，$n。已经完成了。"
G["There, I crafted this breastplate with my own hands, toiling for hours upon the forge."]="我亲手在熔炉旁辛勤地铸造了几个小时，终于铸成了这件胸甲。"
G["There, I've got it!"]="哈哈，我知道了！"
G["There, by the fountain! Set them down gently now."]="喷泉那边！把他们轻轻放下。"
G["There, deep within the pockets of a Troll was the beautiful gem, which I sold for a handsome price!"]="我在一个巨魔的口袋里找到了一颗漂亮的宝石，虽说不是什么八心八箭，但是我把它卖了个不错的价钱！"
G["There, he earned the name \"Lo'Gosh,\" or \"Ghost Wolf.\""]="Allí se ganó el apodo de \"Lo'Gosh\", o \"El Lobo Fantasma\"."
G["There, isn't that much better?"]="瞧，这样不就好多了？"
G["There, it is completed."]="喂，已经完成了。"
G["There, it is done.  The book has been enhanced..."]="就这样，完成了。这本书已经被增强了……"
G["There, see? Ol' Trollplow'll be better in no time! Before you know it, you'll be bragging about out-gunning me again..."]="看到了吗？老巨魔碾压者很快就会好起来的！用不了多久，你就又会吹牛说赢过我了……"
G["There, that should do it..."]="那里，应该就是那里……"
G["There, the Forest Heart is now purified. Its power will replenish Ashenvale once more. We are forever in your debt, young one."]="森林之心已经被净化了。它的力量将再一次充盈灰谷。年轻人，我们将永远感激你的英勇行为。"
G["There, there, $n, worry not! Which piece of the amulet have you misplaced?\n\nDid you check all of your bags and the bank?"]="好了，好了，$n，不要担心！饰品的哪一部分找不到了？\n\n所有的背包和银行都检查过了？"
G["There, there, Priest. You're in no condition to help anyone right now. Both of your arms are broken! I'll get you some medicine."]="好了，好了，牧师。你现在谁也帮不了，自己的两条胳膊都断了！我给你敷点药。"
G["There, there, sweetheart. Everything is going to be ok."]="亲爱的，一切都会好起来的。"
G["There, there."]="那儿，那儿。"
G["There.  I am finished with your robe, $n."]="嗯，你的长袍做完了，$n。"
G["There.  I don't want to have to do this again.  That's your job, swineherd."]="好吧。这样的事情我不想再做第二次。那是你的工作，猪倌。"
G["There.  I found you..."]="瞧。我发现你了……"
G["There.  It is done."]="就是这样。完成了。"
G["There. My work is done. You can now greatly augment the power of any sha-touched weapon."]="好了。我的工作完成了。你现在能大大提高任何感染煞能的武器的威力。"
G["There. Now drink up!"]="嘿！一口气喝光吧！"
G["There. One Micro Mechachicken. I'll never understand how you come up with these names."]="给你，一只“微型机动战鸡”。我一直都不明白，你是怎么想出这些怪名字的。"
G["There. Problem solved."]="瞧。搞定了。"
G["There... Now we now have a shipping lane."]="瞧……我们已经开辟出了一条航道。"
G["There... That should be enough rocks to make a necklace. I should probably get home now anyway."]="那儿……那儿的石头足够做一条项链啦。无论如何，我现在得回家啦。"
G["There... There's no more time for me. I'm done for. Finish me off, $n. Do it or they'll kill us both. $n... For KHAAAAAAAAZZZ MODAAAAAANNNNNN!!!"]="我……我支撑不住了。这是注定的命运。杀了我吧，$n，否则我们俩都难逃一死。$n……为了卡兹莫丹！！！"
G["There... There's no more time for me. I'm done for. Finish me off, $n. Do it or they'll kill us both. $n... For the Horde! This world is worth saving."]="我……我支撑不住了。这是注定的命运。杀了我吧，$n，否则我们俩都难逃一死。$n……为了部落！这个世界值得你去拯救。"
G["There... There's no more time for me. I'm done for. Finish me off, $n. Do it or they'll kill us both. $n... Remember Argus. Don't let that happen to this world."]="我……我支撑不住了。这是注定的命运。杀了我吧，$n，否则我们俩都难逃一死。$n……想想阿古斯。这个世界值得你去拯救。"
G["There... There's no more time for me. I'm done for. Finish me off, $n. Do it or they'll kill us both. $n... Remember Elwynn. This world is worth saving."]="我……我支撑不住了。这是注定的命运。杀了我吧，$n，否则我们俩都难逃一死。$n……想想艾尔文森林。这个世界值得你去拯救。"
G["There... There's no more time for me. I'm done for. Finish me off, $n. Do it or they'll kill us both. $n... Remember Gilneas, our beloved home. This world is worth saving."]="已经……已经来不及了。我完了。结束我吧，$n。否则他们会把我们俩都杀死。$n……记住吉尔尼斯，我们挚爱的家园。这个世界值得我们去拯救。"
G["There... There's no more time for me. I'm done for. Finish me off, $n. Do it or they'll kill us both. $n... Remember Gnomeregan! This world is worth saving."]="我……我支撑不住了。这是注定的命运。杀了我吧，$n，否则我们俩都难逃一死。$n……想想诺莫瑞根。这个世界值得你去拯救。"
G["There... There's no more time for me. I'm done for. Finish me off, $n. Do it or they'll kill us both. $n... Remember Kezan, our beloved home. This world is worth saving."]="已经……已经来不及了。我完了。结束我吧，$n。否则他们会把我们俩都杀死。$n……记住科赞，我们挚爱的家园。这个世界值得我们去拯救。"
G["There... There's no more time for me. I'm done for. Finish me off, $n. Do it or they'll kill us both. $n... Remember Mulgore. This world is worth saving."]="我……我支撑不住了。这是注定的命运。杀了我吧，$n，否则我们俩都难逃一死。$n……想想莫高雷。这个世界值得你去拯救。"
G["There... There's no more time for me. I'm done for. Finish me off, $n. Do it or they'll kill us both. $n... Remember Silvermoon. This world is worth saving."]="我……我支撑不住了。这是注定的命运。杀了我吧，$n，否则我们俩都难逃一死。$n……想想银月城。这个世界值得你去拯救。"
G["There... There's no more time for me. I'm done for. Finish me off, $n. Do it or they'll kill us both. $n... Remember Teldrassil, our beloved home. This world is worth saving."]="我……我支撑不住了。这是注定的命运。杀了我吧，$n，否则我们俩都难逃一死。$n……想想泰达希尔，我们挚爱的家园。这个世界值得你去拯救。"
G["There... There's no more time for me. I'm done for. Finish me off, $n. Do it or they'll kill us both. $n... Remember Tirisfal! This world is worth saving!"]="我……我支撑不住了。这是注定的命运。杀了我吧，$n，否则我们俩都难逃一死。$n……想想提瑞斯法林地。这个世界值得你去拯救。"
G["There... that should help. Now, tell me what's happened, Grimclaw."]="很好。现在告诉我发生了什么，锐爪。"
G["There... will be more! Zandalar... will never fall..."]="还……没完呢！赞达拉……永垂不朽……"
G["Theresa, take this to Father Lankester."]="瑟里莎，把这个交给兰克斯特神父。"
G["Therum Deepforge is the dwarf you want to talk to. One of the finest blacksmiths around if you ask me. You can find him in the heart of the Dwarven District."]="你应该去找瑟鲁姆·深炉谈谈，他是我见过的最好的矮人铁匠。你可以在矮人区的中心地带找到他。"
G["These \"elf\" creatures. Can they be trusted?"]="Estos \"elfos\"... ¿son de fiar?"
G["These Alliance pigs are swinging aboard.  Fend them off!"]="这些联盟猪要爬上来了。击退他们！"
G["These Alliance pondsuckers sure are gutsy!  Boarding fully-manned Forsaken destroyers... now that's suicidal behavior if I ever heard of it."]="这些联盟蛤蟆真是太讨厌了！居然还敢登上满员的被遗忘者驱逐舰……这真是我听过的最愚蠢的自杀方式。"
G["These Death Knights truly know no honor. First, they take my greatest arms and armor, crafted with care, forged with the Lich King's blessing. Then they wander off to who knows where and come back dressed like Goblins, mumbling something about pawning off their armor for a few coppers! Pathetic!"]="这些死亡骑士真是不知羞耻啊。他们拿走了我精心锻造的武器和盔甲，那些都是接受过巫妖王赐福的好东西呀。接着他们不知道去哪儿逛了一圈，回来的时候一个个都穿得跟地精似的，嗫嚅着说他们为了几个铜板不得不卖掉了盔甲！真是可耻！"
G["These Drakkari are just bad news. We need to leave and head to Justice Keep!"]="达卡莱巨魔真是麻烦。我们必须继续前进！"
G["These Forsaken are quick students. I guess you can teach an old... and, well, formerly living dog new tricks."]="被遗忘者的学习速度很快。我猜你可以教那个老……嗯，那个，曾经生龙活虎的那个老家伙一些新技巧。"
G["These Grimtotem beasts will soon be sent to their maker!"]="这群恐怖图腾畜生很快就要去见他们的造物主了！"
G["These Horde dogs are swinging aboard.  Fend them off!"]="这些部落狗要爬上来了。击退他们！"
G["These Illusionary Aqualytes will affect us with dark magic. Dispel it quickly."]="这些幻影侍水僧会对我们施放危险的魔法效果，快驱散它们！"
G["These Infernals are almost ready for the next assualt on The Betrayers Black Citadel!"]="这些地狱火已经快要做好对黑暗神殿进行下一次进攻了！"
G["These Jinyu have been locked in an eternity of servitude."]="这些锦鱼人被囚禁在永恒的奴役之中。"
G["These Kun-Lai pandaren are comin' along just fine. Now if they'd only show a little more of that scrappiness that you seem to be full of."]="这些昆莱熊猫人一切都好。他们现在要是能多体现出一点点你身上充满的那种斗志就更好了。"
G["These Pandaren are sittin' on a treasure trove. They even got books in here about vrykul. I mean the vrykul! Come on! How could they possibly have encountered them?"]="这些熊猫人真是坐拥宝山而不自知。他们甚至有关于维库人的记载。我说的可是维库人！天呐！他们是怎么遇上的？"
G["These Runestones protect the lands in Eversong from becoming tainted by the Scourge.  The Western Runestone failed long ago, forcing us to burn the ground around it.\n\nAs long as I live I won't allow the remaining Runestones to fail us.  That is my oath."]="这些符石保护着永歌森林不被天灾所污染。西面的符石很久以前就失效了，迫使我们焚烧它周围的土地。\n\n我发誓，只要我还活着，我就不会允许剩余的符石失效。"
G["These Shrimp Dumplings are for you."]="这些虾饺是给你的。"
G["These Tears of the Goddess have been blessed by Elune, and their power will help you combat Archimonde's vile magics. Use their power well."]="这些被艾露恩祝福过的女神之泪蕴藏着强大的力量，可以帮助你对抗阿克蒙德的邪恶魔法。好好利用女神之泪的力量吧。"
G["These Thunderfoots are good people, but they do not have enough ale between them to fill a cask."]="雷脚一家真好，但他家的啤酒少得连一个酒桶都装不满。"
G["These Twilight idiots have no idea of the pain that's coming their way."]="那些暮光白痴根本不知道他们在制造什么样的灾难。"
G["These Twilight scum can't hold out much longer. The Dragonmaw Clan has waited a long time for this, $n."]="那些暮光渣滓坚持不了多久了。龙喉氏族为此已经等待了太长的时间，$n。"
G["These Twilight's Hammer fools would tear the very earth apart to get these tablets."]="为了得到这些石板，暮光之锤的傻瓜们会把大地撕裂。"
G["These Zandalari are not to be underestimated. They are quite unlike any troll I have yet encountered."]="这些赞达拉巨魔不可小觑。他们和我见过的任何巨魔都不一样。"
G["These Zandalari are proving to be a greater threat than I expected."]="这些赞达拉巨魔的威胁比我预料地更大。"
G["These abominations are responsible for the deaths of dozens of squirrels! They deserve no mercy!"]="这些憎恶造成了几十只松鼠的死亡！它们不应得到任何怜悯！"
G["These appear to be the remains of Thalorien Dawnseeker, the last wielder of Quel'Delar."]="这看上去像是萨洛瑞安·寻晨者的遗体，奎尔德拉最后的使用者。"
G["These arcane sanctums of yours are quite... interesting Mr. Caidanis.  I appreciate the information you have given me today."]="你的这些奥术圣殿真的……很有意思，凯丹尼斯先生。我对你今天给予我的信息表示感激。"
G["These are all excellent. It's going to be hard to choose just one."]="这些都非常不错。非要从中选一个的话，真有点难以做决定。"
G["These are dangerous times, $r.  An ancient evil is rising, and it cares not if you're Horde or Alliance."]="现在是危险时分，$r。远古的邪魔复活了，他可不管你是部落还是联盟。"
G["These are dangerous times, adventurer. Walk lightly."]="Corren tiempos peligrosos, $gaventurero:aventurera;. Ve con cautela."
G["These are dark and difficult times for us all. The armies of the Scourge amass to the south. Companions fall on the battlefield and rise to serve our enemy moments later."]="对我们来说，这是一个黑暗而艰苦的时代。天灾军团盘踞在南方。那些在战场上牺牲的勇士们，转瞬间就沦为了敌人的爪牙。"
G["These are definitely the ones that raided our boats, but I don't see any of our missing people. Where did they take them?"]="显然是这些人对我们的船只发动了突袭，可我没看见任何失踪者。他们被带到哪儿去了？"
G["These are delicious!"]="这些真美味！"
G["These are fine pieces, $n.  Let me get started on your robe."]="这些材料真不错，$n。让我们开始为你制作长袍吧。"
G["These are from the dig site in the Vale of Eternal Blossoms. What is Garrosh trying to find there?"]="这些都是从锦绣谷的挖掘场运来的。加尔鲁什到底想在那里找什么？"
G["These are good blades you make, $n. Cut a stone and still sharp enough to slit a throat. I have seen better though, an orc named Kelgrum Bloodaxe makes them, go and learn all he can teach you."]="$n，你铸造的武器很不错，已经达到切金断玉的水准了。但是我还认识比你的技艺更加精湛的铁匠，那是一个名叫克尔格鲁克·血斧的兽人，去找他继续学习吧！"
G["These are grave times for Azeroth, $n."]="这是艾泽拉斯的困难时期，$n。"
G["These are grave times for Azeroth, $n.  The elementals have imprisoned both citizens around the city and those they battle with.  We can give you a totem that will break the elemental prison."]="这是艾泽拉斯的困难时期，$n。元素已经把许多市民和与他们交战的对手都囚禁了起来。我们可以给你一个图腾，用它就能打破元素的禁锢。"
G["These are harsher skies than any of us could have known."]="这里的天空比我们所知的任何地方都要危险。"
G["These are holy grounds!  You are not welcome here."]="¡Esta es tierra sagrada! No eres $gbienvenido:bienvenida;."
G["These are my enemies. YOU would be my enemy in battle! Your king has declared war on my kind!"]="他们都是我的敌人。在战场上，你也会是我的敌人！你们的国王已经向我族宣战了！"
G["These are my kind of people. Sure, maybe Garrosh is a bit intense, but you can really feel like they're going somewhere!\nAnyways, what can I show you about being a monk, friend?"]="Esta es mi gente. Bueno, puede que Garrosh sea un poco intenso, ¡pero al menos se nota que tienen un objetivo!\n\nEn fin, ¿qué puedo enseñarte sobre ser monje, $gamigo:amiga;?"
G["These are not the elekk we're looking for."]="这些不是我们要找的那些雷象。"
G["These are not the first dark times we have endured. There is always a light at the edge of the shadows."]="我们不是第一次经历黑暗时期了。在黑暗中总会有一抹曙光。"
G["These are our Allies! You watch over them like they're a threat. Why? You WILL answer to me!"]="这些是我们的盟友！你竟然将他们视作威胁？你要给我一个交代！"
G["These are our fields now."]="这里现在是我们的牧场。"
G["These are our scouts! They have already gone through the Dark Portal. They return to you with news of the new world."]="这些是我们的斥候！他们已经穿过了黑暗之门。现在，他们带回了来自新世界的消息。"
G["These are sacred halls! Your intrusion will be met with death!"]="这里是神圣的献祭之厅！你们这些入侵者的结局只有死亡！"
G["These are some mighty fine animals..."]="这些动物非常出色……"
G["These are the densest stones across all of Shen-zin Su, yet they are as nothing before my mighty head."]="这是神真子背上最硬的石头，但在我坚硬的头颅面前，它们不值一提。"
G["These are the greatest treasures in life."]="这些才是生命宝贵的真谛。"
G["These are the most delicious hors d'oeurves I have ever tasted. You must share your recipe, $n!"]="这是我尝过的最好吃的开胃菜。$n，一定要告诉我你的厨艺秘方！"
G["These are the new tools. These are the Gadgetzan Power tools. And to you, they're gold. And you don't get 'em. Because to give them to you is just like throwin' them into a scrap heap. They're for crafters. Crafters only!"]="这批新工具是加基森赞助的。对你来说，它们像金子一般宝贵。不过你别想得到它们。这样的东西若是给你，相当于丢进垃圾箱啦。这是为技师准备的。只有技师才配得上它！"
G["These are the reasons that you must leave."]="这些就是你必须离开的原因。"
G["These are the times to find yourselves in unison with the Light."]="是在圣光之下寻找自我的时候了。"
G["These are yaungol lands!"]="这些是野牛人的土地！"
G["These aren't Shango's tracks."]="这些不是杉苟的足迹。"
G["These aren't as light as they look. Could we make haste?"]="它们看起来可不轻啊。我们可以快点儿吗？"
G["These babies can hurl fire like none other. We've even attached a secondary cannon, a grappling hook and added a manual fuel injection system.  If you can obtain liquid pyrite from the mechanognomes, you can use it to hurl high-density explosives, or turbo-boost your movement speed. \nLet's see those Explorers' League twirps beat that!"]="No hay nada que escupa fuego mejor que estas preciosidades. Incluso hemos conectado un cañón secundario y un gancho prensil, y hemos añadido un sistema manual de inyección de combustible. Si puedes obtener pirita líquida de los mecagnomos, puedes usarla para arrojar explosivos de alta densidad, o para incrementar tu velocidad de movimiento. \n\n¡A ver si esos mequetrefes de la Liga de Expedicionarios pueden hacer algo mejor!"
G["These babies may look like scrap, but they can rush ahead, knocking enemies aside. The front ram has been overloaded with a electroscopic hyper capacitor, letting it discharge electrical blasts. \n\nEven the turret has been upgraded with anti-air rockets, providing it with a definitive edge over those blasted demolishers."]="这些宝贝儿看上去跟废铁似的，但是它们可以高速前进，猛烈地撞击敌人。器械前端的撞锤加载了可以施放电能震击的高压电容器。\n\n就连炮塔也升级成了防空火箭，使它比那些破烂攻城车更具优势。"
G["These ballistas are just the advantage we needed! Now if we can just get the other one up and runnin' we'll really be in business."]="这些弩炮对我们来说真是如虎添翼！如果我们现在把另一架弄好并运转起来，那我们可就牛了。"
G["These bandages are filthy. Let's get you cleaned up."]="这些绷带脏兮兮的。我们帮你清理一下吧。"
G["These bandages reek! I guess I shouldn't complain."]="这些绷带可真臭！不过我也许不应该抱怨。"
G["These be da first of many! We shall sweep across Zul'Drak like da wind...."]="这只是第一批！最终，我们将横扫整个祖达克……"
G["These beings aren't giving themselves the winning numbers for the Stormwind lottery, dear."]="Esos seres se están dando a sí mismos los números ganadores de la lotería de Ventormenta, $gquerido:querida;."
G["These blades, Krasus... They were made long ago, when things were... different."]="这些武器，克拉苏斯…它们制造于很久以前，那时候的一切…都不同。"
G["These bots are what I will go down in history for inventing.\n\nSure there are a few side effects, but this is at least a better sollution than how we used to handle spiders.\n\nAfter awhile burning down your home just doesn't seem practical!"]="这些机器人一定能让我载入发明史册。\n\n它们当然有一些副作用，但肯定比我们以前处理蜘蛛的方法要好用得多。\n\n毕竟为此把你自己的房子都给烧了是不实际的！"
G["These boys are a handful."]="这群小子可真麻烦。"
G["These brutes think to raid MY town when my back is turned!? They're going to get a taste of Wildhammer justice they will!"]="这群畜生妄想趁我转身之机偷袭我的城镇？！我要让他们知道什么叫蛮锤的正义！"
G["These buildings lie entirely in ruin. Nowhere for Beak to hide here."]="这些建筑物完全被毁了。尖喙不可能藏身在这里。"
G["These cabbages have convinced me, $n. Anyone who can grow produce like this belongs in the Tillers. I'm casting my vote for you and Farmer Yoon. See you back at your farm in a bit."]="这些卷心菜说服了我，$n。能种出这种作物的人，理应是阡陌客的一员。我会为你和农夫老愚投上一票。待会儿在你农场上见。"
G["These cages are bled dry. Get me more prisoners at once!"]="囚犯的鲜血都快抽干啦。马上给我抓些俘虏回来！"
G["These cave paintings are creeping me out. NOT TO MENTION THE MONKEYS TRYING TO KILL ME!"]="这些洞里的壁画已经快把我吓跑了。更不要说那些想要杀我的猴子了！！"
G["These caverns were once a temple of promise for regrowth in the Barrens. Now, they are the halls of nightmares."]="这些洞穴曾经是一座神殿，是贫瘠之地万物生长的保证。现在那里简直就是个地狱。"
G["These chains that bind me prevent me from bringing the spirit of fire to my people, $n.  Souls without fire are souls that cannot rebel against their masters."]="$n，我被这些镣铐束缚着，不能为我的部族带回火焰之灵。失去火焰之灵的灵魂如同傀儡，无法反抗他们的主人。"
G["These champions are our only hope for exposing Deathwing's weakness. Together, we can prevail."]="要让死亡之翼暴露弱点，这些英雄是唯一的希望。团结，我们终将胜利。"
G["These circumstances demand a powerful leader."]="我们的现状呼唤一位强有力的领袖。"
G["These colossal destroyers serve as the Legion's military commanders."]="这些庞大的毁灭者是燃烧军团的军事指挥官。"
G["These could be escape routes I suppose."]="我认为这些可能是逃跑路线。"
G["These cowering troopers should die in shame. This is an embarassment."]="这些懦弱的士兵应该在羞耻中死掉。真是巨大的羞耻。"
G["These crates bear the mark of the Kor'kron. Various weapons and other war supplies lay strewn about the cavern. From the looks of things, Garrosh is planning an invasion."]="这些箱子上有库卡隆的印记。山洞里摆满了各种武器和其他战略物资。从这些东西来看，加尔鲁什正在策划一场入侵。"
G["These crazy tauren - always trying to blow up my flying machine. This has been going on for years!"]="那些疯狂的牛头人。已经有好几年了，他们总是要炸掉我的飞行器！"
G["These creatures ... so many of them. So many dead! Look at Azshara burn. What have the highborne done?"]="这些怪物……它们实在太多了。这么多人都死了！艾萨拉陷入了火海。那些上层精灵到底做了些什么？"
G["These creatures are fascinating. Great fighters. Though so thin..."]="这些家伙看上去真不错，都是很棒的战士，虽然有点单薄……"
G["These creatures have suffered enough. I will not let you defeat them!"]="这些家伙已经吃尽苦头了。我不会让你得逞！"
G["These crystals will work.  Get them!"]="这水晶不错。把它们弄下来！"
G["These cultists are insane. They're trying to bring about the end of the world!"]="这些邪教徒简直疯了。他们要毁灭整个世界！"
G["These cultists only exacerbate the problem.  They preach the end of the world, or that the world is having birthing pains... Hyperbole that is hard for the populace to ignore."]="这些教徒只是在使问题更加恶化。他们到处鼓吹末日论，或是宣扬世界正在遭受新生前的剧痛……他们极尽夸张之能事，让人们无法听而不闻。"
G["These daggers are of little use to me."]="这些匕首对我没用。"
G["These daggers are perfect for stabbing."]="这些匕首很合适捅人。"
G["These damned taxes are breaking my back. King Terenas must be losing his grip if he thinks all this reconstruction will boost the economy."]="这些该死的税收快要压得我喘不过气了。如果泰瑞纳斯国王认为征收重税能促进经济发展，他必将丧失民心。"
G["These demolishers aren't gonna fix themselves!"]="这些投石车可不会自己修好！"
G["These depths truly are a nightmare.\n\nAlthough, the battle that is about to be joined down in the breach below will make this look like kittens and rainbows."]="这深渊可真是噩梦。\n\n但和即将加入的下方裂口里的战斗比起来，简直就是小巫见大巫。"
G["These discs look familiar, but I cannot place their origin."]="这些圆盘很眼熟，但我无法找到其出处。"
G["These documents implicate several orcish spies.  Our best assassins will be dispatched for this treachery.  Take your compensation and spend it wisely; it's drawn from the taxpayers of Stormwind."]="这些文件包含了几个兽人间谍的信息。我们最优秀的杀手将会被派去终结他们的背叛行径。拿上你的奖金合理使用吧，这可都是暴风城纳税人的钱。"
G["These documents implicate several troll spies.  Consider their heads forfeit.  Take your compensation and spend it wisely; it's drawn from the taxpayers of Stormwind."]="这些文件包含了几个巨魔间谍的信息。他们的脑袋一定保不住了。拿上你的奖金合理使用吧，这可都是暴风城纳税人的钱。"
G["These dragons aren't messin' around. I'm not sure all of these scrubs know what they're in for.\n\nWe'll be fine though. My boys can lead the charge and get this job done. All we need is some space to work."]="这些龙并不糊涂。不过我不确定这些小崽子是否都知道他们要干什么。\n\n当然，我们这里是不会有问题的。我的小子们会冲在最前面，把一切都搞定。我们所需要的只是一个施展拳脚的地方。"
G["These druids have tapped a tremendous source of power!  They can turn into animals... project  lightning and intense moonlight... I must discover how they do it!\n\nPerhaps they're wearing batteries underneath those robes..."]="这些德鲁伊好像有一个巨大的能量源！他们可以变成动物……放射出闪电和强烈的月光……我必须要弄清楚他们是怎么做到这些的！\n\n也许他们的长袍下绑着蓄电池……"
G["These dumplings look delicious!"]="这些饺子看上去很美味！"
G["These dwarves are the same ones today, yes?  Do dwarves maintain any other links to the Earthen?"]="这些矮人和现在的矮人是同一种生物吗？矮人还和土灵有其它的联系吗？"
G["These earthquakes have just been crazy!"]="这些地震简直是疯了！"
G["These events have shown me so much."]="这些事让我懂得了许多。"
G["These feathers bring back memories of my son. Thank you, $r."]="这些羽毛让我回忆起我的儿子。谢谢你，$r。"
G["These fiends will fail!  For Azeroth!"]="这些恶魔必将被击败！为了艾泽拉斯而战！"
G["These fires have been burning steadily for years. Unusual dedication for trolls."]="数年来，这些篝火堆都不曾熄灭。它们对巨魔来说有着非同寻常的意义。"
G["These fireworks sure make a nice BOOM, don't you think?"]="这些烟花真华丽，你不这么认为吗？"
G["These fish jump up and down like a bouncing luckydo!"]="这些鱼上蹿下跳的，就像弹跳幸运符！"
G["These foolish mortal races will soon see our power."]="这些愚蠢的凡人们很快就会见识到我们的力量。"
G["These gates are sealed by imperial decree."]="这些大门已经奉旨关闭了。"
G["These glorious fields weren't always here, $c. Only through determination and the strength of will did we turn the decrepit human farms into Lordaeron's largest and most productive sludge and mushroom plantation.\n\nNow all of that could be lost due to a simple accident!"]="这片广阔的田野原本并非如此，$c。是我们凭借坚定的决心和意志力，将人类腐朽的农场变成为洛丹伦最大，最丰饶的药渣田和蘑菇种植园。\n\n现在，所有这一切都可能因为一场小小的事故而将化为乌有！"
G["These great beasts know paths that ye can't find on foot, they'll get ye there fast and maybe show ye something new at the same time."]="这些巨兽比你更会寻找道路，它们能让你更快地到达目的地，而且还可轻松欣赏沿途的美景。"
G["These grounds ... are not ... yours ..."]="这里……不是……你们的……"
G["These grummle charms are starting to kick in..."]="这些土地精护身符开始起作用了……"
G["These grummles make a strange grog."]="这些土地精酿的酒真奇怪。"
G["These guardians are just da beginning!"]="这些守卫者只是个开始！"
G["These guys aren't half bad!"]="这些家伙也没多糟嘛！"
G["These guys have no taste."]="这些家伙毫无品味。"
G["These guys' weapons!"]="他们的烂武器！"
G["These hardships will pass and we will grow stronger because of them."]="这些困难都会过去，我们会因此变得越发强大。"
G["These heathens have robbed me of my belongings, but I can offer you this charm I took from my captors."]="这群野蛮人将我洗劫一空，不过我从他们身上偷来的咒符倒是可以送给你。"
G["These here chicks might be small right now, but they grow up fast!"]="这些小鸡现在或许还很小，但它们很快就会长大的！"
G["These heroics mean nothing, $c.  Your future is sealed and your soul is doomed to servitude!"]="你的英雄气概在这里一无是处，$c。你的未来一面死寂，你的灵魂将颤栗着成为我的奴仆！"
G["These hills and hidden trails are my home. For years I have used them on the hunt.\n\nI never thought I'd use them to fight a war."]="那些山丘和隐秘的小路就是我的家。许多年以来，我一直利用它们进行狩猎。\n\n但我从没有想过会利用它们进行一场战争。"
G["These humans are cowards. You hear me HUMANS? Come out and fight with honor!"]="人类都是懦夫。听到我的话了吗，人类？出来，带着荣誉大战一场！"
G["These infants will live. With love and affection they will grow to be strong members of the Horde, and with time the horrible reminders of their shattered lives will fade."]="这些孩子会活下去的。他们会在关爱中长大，成为坚强的部落勇士。时间会让他们淡忘那些悲惨的过去。"
G["These insects do not know their place, Gara'jal. If you wish to prove your \"might\" on such weaklings, it matters not to me."]="Estos insectos no conocen su lugar, Gara'jal. Si quieres poner a prueba tu \"poder\" contra esos enclenques, adelante."
G["These insects have not yet learned their place, Gara'jal. If you wish to prove your \"might\" on such weaklings it matters not to me."]="Estos insectos no saben cuál es su lugar, Gara'jal. Si quieres poner a prueba tu \"poder\" con débiles como estos, a mí no me importa."
G["These interlopers must be stopped before our work is undone!"]="在我们完成工作前，必须阻止这些闯入者！"
G["These invaders must learn that our lands are not so easily taken. And I shall gladly administer the lesson."]="一定得让这些入侵者知道，我们的土地不是那么好侵占的。我很乐意给它们上这一课。"
G["These irons are crazy! They keep talking about serving their 'master Loken' but from what I can tell, only a few receive orders from him."]="这帮铁矮人疯子！他们反复谈论要为“洛肯大人”效劳，但是据我所知，只有少数人接到他的指令而已。"
G["These kodo are in amazing condition."]="这些科多兽的状况好极了。"
G["These land lubbers are here for the reindeer!  Give 'em the shank!"]="旱鸭子们来抢驯鹿了！给他们些颜色看看！"
G["These lands are the frontier of the Dark Lady's conquest, $n. Look upon them; in time, it shall all be in the grasp of the Forsaken."]="这些土地是黑暗女王征战的前线，$n。看看它们吧；过不了多久，这些都将落入被遗忘者的掌控之中。"
G["These lands belong to the Thunder King."]="这片土地属于雷电之王。"
G["These lands shall be cleansed!"]="我们必须把这片土地上所有邪恶堕落的东西驱逐出去！"
G["These lands will be ours!"]="这片土地将是我们的！"
G["These little things are a pain in my backside!"]="这些如芒在背的小混蛋！"
G["These little things are a pain in my backside!\n\nSo, you need some training?"]="这些如芒在背的小混蛋！\n\n你需要训练吗？"
G["These look good.  Nice work."]="看上去不错嘛。挺好的。"
G["These mankers messed with the wrong hozen!"]="这些蠢货把猢狲惹毛了！"
G["These mantid, they remind me too much of the day the gates of Ahn'Qiraj opened and swallowed my wife.\n\nThese creatures are the real threat in this land."]="这些螳螂妖不禁让我想起安其拉大门开启的那一天，我的妻子惨遭吞噬。\n\n这些怪物是这片土地上真正的祸患。"
G["These matches remind me of my time training as a young recruit."]="这些比赛让我想起了自己接受新兵训练时的日子。"
G["These materials you brought from Shadowfang Keep are no common things. They will invest your weapon with great power."]="你从影牙城堡拿出来的这些材料绝非凡品。它们能够让你的武器具有强大的力量。"
G["These mines are a dreadful place.  Fortunately, I don't plan on being here long."]="这些矿洞真是太可怕了。幸好我不打算在这里待很长时间。"
G["These mogu brutes have incredible raw strength."]="这些魔古族的野人力气大得惊人。"
G["These mogu fight very differently than the ones I've faced in the past. They have confidence."]="这些魔古族的战斗风格跟我过去面对过的对手很不一样。他们自信满满。"
G["These mogu may be clunky in their movements but their faces are hard on the knuckles."]="这些魔古人也许行动笨拙，可他们的表情却总是冷若冰霜。"
G["These mogu won't scare us away.  This is our home now."]="这些魔古族吓不走我们。现在这里是我们的家了。"
G["These monkeys are a real pain!"]="这些猴子真让人头痛！"
G["These monsters killed my father and kidnapped my sister.  They're going to pay for this!"]="这些怪物杀死了我的父亲，绑架了我的妹妹。我要让他们付出代价！"
G["These mortal infidels, my lord! They have invaded your sanctum and seek to steal your secrets!"]="是因为这些入侵者，我的主人！他们闯入了您的圣殿，想要窃取您的秘密！"
G["These mountains are for ogres.  Not for gronn, not for humans or orcs!"]="这些山脉是食人魔的地盘。不是戈隆的，也不是人类和兽人的！"
G["These mushrooms are unlike anything on the surface. They're said to bring great wisdom and clarity to those who eat them.\n\nI'm going to bring some back with me to Sporeggar."]="这些蘑菇和地表上的任何东西都不一样。据说，谁吃了它们，就能获得无比的智慧和清晰的头脑。\n\n我要带一点回孢子村去。"
G["These negative emotions can manifest in physical form. We call this dark energy \"Sha.\""]="Esas emociones negativas pueden manifestarse como entes físicos. A esa energía oscura la llamamos \"sha\"."
G["These new Forsaken tend to be a little... um... stupid. It usually takes awhile for them to acclimate."]="这些新的被遗忘者实在是有些……嗯……愚蠢。他们还需要一段时间适应。"
G["These notes are horribly organized. I can't tell if Arugal was brilliant or simply an imbecile."]="这些记录非常散乱。我无法判断阿鲁高到底是个天才，还是个彻头彻尾的傻瓜。"
G["These ogres are on our side?"]="这些食人魔是站我们这边儿的？"
G["These old bones have much knowledge to impart."]="这些老骨头有不少学问要传授。"
G["These once beautiful woods suffer under a terrible curse!  Corrupting forces twist the life here into shadows of their former selves.  If you are not an agent of this corruption, then perhaps you can aid me in reclaiming Felwood!"]="这片美丽的森林受到了可怕的诅咒！腐化的力量将这儿变成了一片恐惧之地。如果你跟他们不是一伙的，或许你能帮助我夺回费伍德森林。"
G["These ones wish to return to the earth..."]="这些家伙想要回归大地的怀抱……"
G["These opponents are tough."]="这些对手很强悍啊。"
G["These orc designs are okay. They just need more bombs."]="这些兽人的设计还不错。他们只需要多加一些炸弹。"
G["These orcs and I have served together through many battles.\n\nI do not envy any naga that enters this place."]="这些兽人和我已经在多次战斗中出生入死。\n\n我不羡慕任何进到这里的纳迦。"
G["These orcs are fools!  So much power nearby just waiting to be taken, and all they do is sit on their hands and watch while others plunder the riches!"]="这些兽人都是蠢货！强大的力量唾手可得，但他们却视而不见，让别人占尽了先机！"
G["These orcs are in for a rude awakening once Bravo Company is back up and running."]="一旦B连重新回来投入工作，这些兽人必会猛然觉醒。"
G["These orcs must really be eager to stake their claim in Outland! If I told you how much they were paying for my allegiance, you'd kill me out of jealousy!"]="这些兽人肯定非常渴望在外域扩张势力！如果我告诉你他们给了我多少银币，你一定会嫉妒地掐死我！"
G["These orders must get to High General Abbendis!"]="这些命令必须传达到大将军阿比迪斯那里！"
G["These other clans are nothing!"]="其他氏族一无是处！"
G["These other clans aren't worthy of your time, great king!"]="您不必把时间花费在其他氏族身上，伟大的王上！"
G["These outsiders are weak and easily crushed."]="要令这些意志脆弱的外来者屈服真是太容易了。"
G["These outsiders have brought chaos to this land. Can we trust them to set it right?"]="这些外来者给这片土地带来了混乱。我们能够相信他们吗？"
G["These pandaren are a wise enough people. Sooner or later, they will side with the Horde."]="这些熊猫人都很明智，他们迟早会加入我们部落的。"
G["These pandaren are skilled warriors despite being civilians."]="即便是平民，这些熊猫人也是技巧高超的战士。"
G["These pandaren farmers are entertaining folk! A very tight-knit community. Everyone knows one another.\n\nIt is very different from the big cities in Kalimdor or the Eastern Kingdoms."]="这些熊猫人农夫真是一群有趣的家伙！这是个紧密相连的社区。人人都熟悉彼此。\n\n跟卡利姆多或东部王国的那些大城市很不一样！"
G["These pandaren make some pretty good hooch, but none of them have heard of my favorite drink.\n\nMaybe I'll teach it to them some time..."]="这些熊猫人酿的烈酒棒极了，可他们都没听说过我最喜欢的那种饮料。\n\n或许我以后可以教教他们……"
G["These pandaren seem like good people.\n\nThey're reluctant to get embroiled in our war, but after a few weeks of dealing with the Horde, I have no doubt they'll all come around to our side."]="这些熊猫人看起来都是好人。\n\n他们不愿意卷入我们的战争，可在与部落纠缠几个星期之后，相信他们一定会站到我们这边来。"
G["These papers are guarded.  Speak with Zamek to create a distraction!"]="这些图纸被守卫着。和扎米克谈谈来引开守卫的注意！"
G["These pathetic clans are beneath you, my king. They sully the great legacy of our people!"]="这些可悲的氏族不值一提，陛下。他们玷污了我族伟大的遗产！"
G["These pathetic mortals are harmless, beneath my station.  Dispose of them!"]="这些可悲的凡人毫无威胁，根本不值得我动手。干掉他们！"
G["These pathetic pups cannot hope to withstand the might of the Forsaken."]="这些可怜的小狼崽不可能抵挡住被遗忘者的力量。"
G["These people are farmers, not fighters! They may need our help!"]="这些人是农民，不是战士！他们也许需要我们的帮助！"
G["These people arrived from Shattrath a few nights ago and they haven't stopped arguing since then.\n\nI'm glad to see that hasn't turned you away, I was beginning to think they were scaring off potential customers."]="这些家伙几天前就来到沙塔斯城了，而他们的争论到现在还没有停止。\n\n我很高兴你没有因此离开，我还在想他们会不会把潜在的顾客给吓走呢。"
G["These people shall not be enslaved by your cruel Horde. I will not allow it!"]="这些人不能被你们那残忍的部落所奴役。我决不允许！"
G["These people will know Admiral Proudmoore for the true hero he was!"]="这些家伙总有一天会明白，普罗德摩尔将军是一位真正的英雄！"
G["These pictographs tell a story. This figure at the beginning, almost looks like one of the creatures we encountered at Azure Watch..."]="这些象形文字叙述着一个故事。这个位于开端的图形，看上去就像那个我们在碧蓝岗哨遭遇的生物……"
G["These piles of wood and straw may show mercy, but the Lich King won't!"]="木头和稻草会显示出怜悯之心，但巫妖王不会！"
G["These plans list the details on the upcoming attack!"]="在这些计划书里列出了即将发起进攻的细节！"
G["These portals connect to Dalaran. That means the Kirin Tor... MY OWN Kirin Tor... helped the Horde commit this atrocity."]="这些传送门通往达拉然。就是说肯瑞托……我的肯瑞托里……有人在助纣为虐。"
G["These prisons are to be filled at once or Malygos will know why!"]="我们得尽快塞满这些牢笼，否则玛里苟斯就会察觉！"
G["These puppy-men have killed scores of us, yet we still still offer them peace... does that seem right to you?"]="狗狗人杀害了我们的同胞，我们却要向他们示好……你觉得这件事正常吗？"
G["These pygmies are cutting into profits!"]="这些俾格米人减少了我的利润！"
G["These pygmies are cutting into profits!\n\nSeeking enlightenment, $n?"]="这些俾格米人减少了我的利润！\n\n在寻求教导吗，$n？"
G["These races are a great opportunity to show our ingenuity!"]="这种车赛是展现我们高新科技的大好机会！"
G["These raiders stole the cloths off our dead, the trinkets out of our homes, and the ingots out of our forge. What sort of behavior is that?"]="他们扒走了遇难者身上的衣物，偷走了我们家里的装饰品，还掠走了我们熔炼出来的铁锭。这是什么样的行径？"
G["These rebels are nothing.  Garrosh will stomp them beneath his heel."]="这些叛军不值一提。加尔鲁什会将他们践踏于脚下。"
G["These refugees have suffered greatly and they will no doubt suffer more.  You have already helped them and for that I thank you.  If you have done all you can for now then I would beg a small favor."]="这些难民们承受了巨大的痛苦，毫无疑问，将来他们还会遭遇更大的痛苦。你慷慨地帮助了他们，为此我向你表示感谢。如果你已经完成了自己的使命，那么我能请你再帮我个小忙吗？"
G["These repairs are behind schedule!"]="维修进度落后了！"
G["These rocks are so lifelike!"]="这些岩石栩栩如生！"
G["These rooms are normally offered to guests of the city.  Really, anyone could have been staying here."]="这些房间通常会提供给造访城市的客人。任何人都有可能会居住在这里。"
G["These ruffians are swinging aboard to steal our treasure.  Fend them off!"]="这些恶棍要爬上来偷我们的财宝了。击退他们！"
G["These ruins I've found are IDENTICAL to the ones I just left! It's the find of a lifetime!"]="我找到的这座废墟就是我刚刚离开的那座废墟！看来我真的是要找一辈子了！"
G["These ruins are supposedly haunted. I don't believe in ghosts though. Then again, I didn't believe in Zandalari either."]="这些废墟似乎有鬼魂出没。虽然我并不相信有什么鬼魂，但我也不相信有什么赞达拉。"
G["These sacred waters are befouled, but hope is not lost. Our ancient rituals endure and cleanse, even in the face of this great corruption. And as the waters recover, the strength of those who taint them wanes."]="这些神圣之水被污染了，但希望仍在。即便是面对如此巨大的腐蚀之力，我们古老的仪式也能坚持完成净化。当水复原后，污染之人的力量就会衰退。"
G["These saurok just returned from an attack on the mogu. I will continue to observe them."]="这些蜥蜴人刚刚袭击魔古族回来。我会继续观察他们的。"
G["These savage primates want to kill us! Tell me... how can we overcome them?"]="这些野蛮的猩猩想要杀了我们！告诉我……我们怎么才能打败他们？"
G["These secrets will die with you."]="你就带着这些秘密一起进棺材吧。"
G["These shards give me the creeps.  Hey Greeby, did you find more motes?"]="这些碎片让我毛骨悚然。嘿，格雷比，你找到别的碎片了吗？"
G["These shields are proving quite the nuisance."]="这些盾牌确实讨厌。"
G["These ships are not going to build themselves!"]="这些船可不会自行完成建造！"
G["These skies are MINE!"]="天空，归我统治！"
G["These so-called paladins won't let me through so I can see if any of the legendary Fras Siabi's famous tobacco remains in Stratholme! They're no better than the scourge, if you ask me.\n\nBetween you an' me, I think their 'brotherhood of the light' is a hoax. An elaborate ploy I tell ya!"]="\"¡Esos supuestos \"paladines\" no me dejan pasar para ver si queda algo del famoso tabaco de Fras Siabi en Stratholme! Son igual de malos que la Plaga, si quieres mi opinión.\n\nEntre tú y yo, creo que su \"Hermandad de la Luz\" es un fraude. ¡Una complicada conspiración, hazme caso!"
G["These stags are nothing like talbuks."]="这些鹿一点也不像塔布羊。"
G["These statues... they're almost lifelike. Something's wrong here, Riko."]="这些雕像……太逼真了。事情有点不对劲，里克。"
G["These statuettes must hold a hidden compartment...."]="这些雕像一定有暗格……"
G["These stones should be the last of them. Our coordination with Neptulon's forces will be impeccable."]="这些石头应该是最后一批了。我们和耐普图隆部队的合作将会无懈可击。"
G["These stunted mo'arg are very clever, and are often employed as helpers for their larger brethren."]="这些矮小的莫尔葛是非常聪明的物种，并且经常被当作他们大个子同胞的帮手使用。"
G["These supply crates came from Orgrimmar. What is Garrosh planning to do with so many war supplies?"]="这些补给箱来自奥格瑞玛。加尔鲁什要这么多战略物资做什么？"
G["These swine, they are weak.  They're not good for breeding, not good for eating, and certainly no good for combat."]="这些猪，它们太虚弱了。既不适合用来繁育，也不适合拿来食用，上战场当然更不行。"
G["These thermals have made flying here nearly suicidal. Thank you for coming for us."]="有那些热气流的存在，在这里飞行无异于自杀。谢谢你来帮我们。"
G["These things should bring down those towers in no time!"]="这些家伙可以在一瞬间就把塔楼给砸平了！"
G["These things that you do for Netherwing do not go unnoticed."]="你为灵翼做的一切都不会被忽视的。"
G["These three again?"]="又是这三个？"
G["These tools are junk!"]="这些工具全是废物！"
G["These tracks are fresh, and they lead down into the water..."]="这些足迹是刚留下的，直接指向了水中……"
G["These tracks must belong to Shango."]="这些足迹一定是杉苟留下的。"
G["These trainees are weak.  They are not ready to walk the wall, much less face the mantid or the mogu head-on.  It will be some time before we can depend on them in any real sense."]="这些受训者太不堪一击了。他们根本还没学会飞檐走璧，更别说直接面对螳螂妖或魔古族了。还需要很长一段时间的训练，他们才能真正派上用场。"
G["These travellers are ripe for the robbing! Take their things! Take all of their things!!!"]="这些旅行者真是绝佳的抢劫目标！把他们的东西抢走！把他们的东西全都抢走！！！"
G["These trees are AMAZING!"]="这些树真是太神奇了！"
G["These trees are quite glorious, aren't they?"]="这些树多么壮丽啊，难道不是吗？"
G["These trolls are among those you exposed on the battlefield. Masterfully done, indeed...."]="这些是你在战场上俘虏的巨魔。你的身手确实不错……"
G["These trolls cannot continue to defy the Warchief! They must be dealt with."]="不能让那些巨魔继续忤逆酋长了！我们得收拾他们！"
G["These trolls have just shown up demanding our help."]="这些巨魔突然出现，向我们寻求帮助。"
G["These trolls have made a grave mistake, $c."]="巨魔犯了一个巨大的错误，$c。"
G["These trolls need to learn their place."]="这些巨魔必须知道自己的地位。"
G["These tunnels that you see are called timeways. They are infinite in number. The ones that currently exist in your reality are what the master has deemed as 'trouble spots.'  These trouble spots may differ completely in theme but they always share a cause. That is, their existence is a result of the same temporal disturbance. Remember that should you venture inside one..."]="\"Estos túneles que ves son portales del tiempo. Son infinitos. Los que hay en tu plano de la realidad son los que el maestro llama \"fuentes de problemas\". Esas fuentes de problemas pueden mostrar aspectos totalmente diferentes, pero tienen una causa común. Su existencia es el fruto de una única perturbación temporal. Recuérdalo siempre que entres en alguno...\""
G["These tuskarr have seen nothing!  Show them what we're capable of!"]="海象人还没见识过我们的力量呢！让他们尝尝厉害！"
G["These two brave, ignorant fools despise each other, yet somehow they both spoke of you as a hero. Perhaps you just lack the will to choose a side... let me extend you that opportunity."]="这两个有勇无谋的蠢货彼此厌恶，却异口同声地称你为英雄。你或许还不愿意做出选择……那么，就让我多给你一点时间吧。"
G["These undead atrocities will be destroyed!"]="彻底消灭这些亡灵！"
G["These undead rabble, and their dead-elf queen, will fall!"]="这些亡灵垃圾会和他们那死掉的精灵女王一起被毁灭！"
G["These walls will be your tomb!"]="这里就是你的坟墓！"
G["These warlocks will suffer for their demonic pacts."]="这些术士的恶魔契约会让他们倒大霉的。"
G["These wastes are scarred by terrible magic.  We must do what we can to heal this great wound."]="可怕的魔法滋扰着这片荒野。我们必须竭尽所能，治愈大地的创伤。"
G["These waters were ours even before the Sundering!"]="在大分裂以前，这些水域就已经是我们的了！"
G["These waters will be your grave."]="这片水域将是你的坟墓。"
G["These wendigos are an annoyance, sure, but the real fight is with those Frostmane refugees."]="这些雪怪当然是个麻烦，可真正的战斗却是对付那些霜鬃难民。"
G["These woods are dangerous.  A lesson I learned the hard way."]="这片树林很危险。这是我历经千难万险之后得到的教训。"
G["These woods make my tusks itch..."]="这些树木弄得我的长牙发痒……"
G["These worgen are our prisoners. Their fate is in the hands of High Command."]="这些狼人是我们的阶下囚。它们将由最高统帅部来发落。"
G["These working conditions are horrible! We haven't had a beer break in HOURS!"]="这里的工作条件太糟糕了！我们已经几个小时没有坐下来喝喝酒了！"
G["These wounds won't prevent me from facing the Kor'kron."]="这点伤阻止不了我继续对付库卡隆。"
G["These yaungol never even bothered to say hello. They simply attacked! Serves them right being infested by those sha things!"]="这些野牛人向来连招呼都不打。直接就攻来了！活该他们被煞魔感染！"
G["These yaungol thought the sha were scary until they met me!"]="这些野牛人还以为煞魔就是世上最可怕的东西了，直到他们遇见了我！"
G["These... mogu... are tougher than I gave them credit for. And clever. You shouldn't have come, this is a trap."]="这些……魔古族……比我预想的还要难对付，也更聪明。你不该来的，这是个陷阱。"
G["Theses tombs hold many secrets, $n."]="这些陵墓里隐藏了许多的秘密，$n。"
G["They ARE the Faire's finest, after all."]="它们毕竟是马戏团的精英嘛。"
G["They agreed?!"]="他们同意了？"
G["They all go to the Spire but none ever come back... just like Bijou."]="他们都去了黑石塔，但是跟比修一样……没有人活着回来。"
G["They all must die."]="他们都得死。"
G["They all wanted it for themselves, but I slew them as easily as I will slay you when I pay you a visit later."]="他们都想把它据为己有，但是我轻而易举地把他们干掉了，很快你也将是这个下场。"
G["They all... begged... for their... lives!"]="他们……都在……乞求……活命!"
G["They almost sent my brother, Loksey, to this gathering. He cannot even take care of his hounds, let alone represent the Scarlet Crusade in a competent manner."]="他们差点把我的兄弟洛克希给派来了。他连自己的狗都照顾不了，还是让那些能够展现血色十字军实力的人来这里吧。"
G["They approach from both sides in great numbers now!"]="它们从两翼同时展开密集攻击！"
G["They approach from the right now!  Use your Fierce Roar ability if your lions become overwhelmed!\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_druid_skinteeth.blp:64|t"]="它们从右翼袭来！如果你的狮群陷入重围，记得使用凶猛咆哮技能！\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_druid_skinteeth.blp:64|t"
G["They approach? Good. Now, if only my students were here to see and learn from the coming display of martial prowess..."]="他们来了？很好。要是我的学生们能在这旁观，从我即将展示的高超武艺中学上几招就好了……"
G["They are a council of our wisest cultural leaders. They serve to check the power of the Empress."]="他们是由最睿智的文化领袖组成的议会。负责监督女皇。"
G["They are a very superstitious people, who often take on the names of their favorite charms, or \"Luckydos.\""]="Son un pueblo muy supersticioso, y suelen adoptar el nombre de sus talismanes favoritos, los \"grisgrís.\""
G["They are amazing!"]="他们很棒！"
G["They are as cruel as they are powerful - and revel in the destruction of all that exists."]="他们非常强大而残酷，以毁灭一切为乐。"
G["They are assaulting Thrallmar!"]="他们在袭击萨尔玛！"
G["They are but the waves crashing upon the mountain of Her divine will. They may rise again and again; but will accomplish nothing."]="女皇的神圣意志犹如高山，而他们就像是拍打高山的海浪。纵使滚滚而来，也必将一事无成。"
G["They are coming for you."]="他们是来杀你的。"
G["They are coming in from the ocean! Use the cannon!"]="他们从海里过来了！快用火炮！"
G["They are depressed because they have no work to do?"]="他们在为没有工作而沮丧？"
G["They are doing well, sir. They should all make full recoveries."]="先生，他们的情况都很好，他们会痊愈的。"
G["They are exactly what you need to destroy in order to free the regiment! As I had told you earlier, Kirith had a plan.\n\nEach of the servants does have a weakness. Punish their physical form in proximity of their stones until they are near the state of disintegration. It is at that point, and that point alone, that the stones of binding are vulnerable to attack. You must hurry to destroy the stones, however, as once the enslaved regain their composure, they will be invulnerable to harm once more."]="那些禁锢之石就是你要去摧毁的东西！正如我刚刚所说的，基利斯有一个完整的计划。\n\n每个被奴役的战士都有一个弱点，你必须尽量攻击他们，直到他们的实体形态几近瓦解。这时禁锢之石就会变得非常脆弱。你一定要抓紧时间摧毁禁锢之石，否则不久之后，那些奴隶又将获得新的力量，并再次变得刀枪不入了。"
G["They are falling back!"]="他们在撤退！"
G["They are falling back! We need to press the assault before they can regroup. Follow me!"]="他们退回去了。我们得在他们重整队伍前压上去。跟我来！"
G["They are falling! Don't stop now!"]="他们不行了！乘胜追击！"
G["They are fearless and unwaveringly loyal to their master's godlike will."]="他们坚定而无畏地服从他们主人的任何命令。"
G["They are flighty, these spirits, and easily distracted... but they will share their secrets with those who know how to listen."]="它们反复无常，而且很容易受到干扰……但是它们会向倾听者分享心中的秘密。"
G["They are going to eat me!"]="它们要吃掉我！"
G["They are hardier than I would expect for their size."]="这帮家伙体型不大，意志倒是强硬得多嘛。"
G["They are here because they do not wish to defend their homes... their families..."]="因为他们不愿意保卫自己的家园……和家人……"
G["They are holding us off, bring in the air support!"]="他们令我们无法接近！快派空中支援！"
G["They are ignorant, and blind to reality. Look around you, pandaren."]="他们愚昧无知，对事实视而不见。看看周围吧，熊猫人。"
G["They are lost, $r. Librams written by the elven masters. Scattered across the world when the Scourge was unleashed upon Quel'Thalas.\n\nNow we search for these librams. Search to find the secrets they hold - to restore power once had.\n\nI search for the ten written by Master Kariel Winthalus. Should you find a libram, allow me to absorb its magical properties and for you I shall craft an amalgamation of power... of course, all things come at some cost. You will find my cost to be high; but pay you shall."]="它们都失踪了，$r。在亡灵天灾入侵奎尔萨拉斯的时候，精灵族的圣契散落到世界各地。\n\n现在我们得搜寻这些圣契。寻找其中的秘密——并恢复其中蕴含的力量。\n\n我在寻找由卡里尔·温萨鲁斯书写的圣契。如果你找到了圣契，请允许我吸收它的魔法力量，而为你我可以制作一种力量的融合物……当然，所有的事情都是有代价的。这项任务的风险极大，但是我给予的回报也是相当丰厚的。"
G["They are massing at Purgation Isle, just west of us here, off the coast. We are to meet them there, general."]="他们聚集在西边海中的赎罪岛上。我们要去那里见他们，将军。"
G["They are not the Twilight.  I see no reason to oppose their goals."]="他们不是暮光之锤的人。我不相信他们会是敌人。"
G["They are not where they appear to be!  Strike in an area, it is the only way to uncover the real one!"]="他们并不在我们眼见的位置上！用大范围的攻击，只有这样才能让他们显形！"
G["They are now your enemies."]="现在，他们就是你们的敌人。"
G["They are outside the cycle..."]="他们已经超越了轮回……"
G["They are protecting that mask. It must be the source of the barrier. Destroy it!"]="他们在保护那个面具。那一定是屏障的源头。摧毁它！"
G["They are pulling back, but we cannot let up now."]="他们撤退了，但还不能放松。"
G["They are redeemed! Then we have won?"]="他们得到了救赎！那么我们胜利了？"
G["They are scouring the entire region. We must discover what it is that they seek!"]="他们正在这一地区横行肆虐。我们必须查清楚，他们在这里寻找什么！"
G["They are so tiny."]="他们实在太小了。"
G["They are soft, weak!"]="他们太软弱了！"
G["They are stoic, the spirits of the earth. Through them, the shaman learns to endure the hardships of life."]="大地之灵很坚强。因为这样，萨满祭司学会了在面对艰难时保持坚忍。"
G["They are surely unredeemable, but it still hurts to see them die."]="他们当然已是无可挽回，但看着他们死去，还是令人感到心如刀绞。"
G["They are the driving heart of the Burning Crusade."]="这些恶魔是燃烧军团远征中的驱动力量。"
G["They are the literal incarnation of corruption.  Their very skin screams it."]="他们就是堕落的化身，确是如此。他们的皮肤就说明了一切。"
G["They are the whisper on the shivering wind."]="它们是寒风中的低语。"
G["They are tokens of respect, purchased only with blood on the battlefield. Earning enough of these marks will be critical if we plan on winning this war."]="这些印记象征着尊重，是战场上挥洒热血的成果。如果想要赢得这场战争，我们必须收集足够多的印记。"
G["They are too strong!"]="他们太强大了！"
G["They are... subsiding.  Renew your efforts, brothers!  We must complete the ritual before they can return!"]="他们在……下沉。继续努力，兄弟们！我们必须在他们返回之前完成仪式！"
G["They are... too strong! Underestimated their... fortitude."]="他们……咳……太强大！我低估了……他们的顽强。"
G["They aren't so tough after all."]="也不是那么难对付嘛。"
G["They attacked Taurajo while our strongest were on the hunt. By some miracle, there was a gap in the Alliance lines through which myself and some others were able to carry the little ones...\n\n<Tawane trails off, trying not to cry in front of the children.>"]="当我们最强壮的战士进行狩猎的时候，他们对陶拉祖发动了进攻。我们遇到的也许是一个奇迹。在联盟的阵线中出现了一个缺口。所以我和另一些人才能带着这些小东西逃出来……\n\n<塔瓦妮的声音低沉了下去。他正努力不让自己在孩子们的面前哭出来。>"
G["They attacked our ships from below, and will advance on the keep at any moment!\nWe don't have the numbers to stop them..."]="Atacaron nuestros barcos desde abajo. ¡Avanzarán hacia el fuerte en cualquier momento!\n\nNo somos suficientes para detenerlos."
G["They attacked us when the waters rushed in! It was almost as if they knew what was going to happen.\n\nThey should all suffer for what they've done."]="当大水涌入的时候，他们对我们发动了攻击！就好象他们早已知道了那场洪水的爆发。\n\n他们要为他们犯下的罪行付出代价。"
G["They attacked while you were gone... the Admiral didn't make it. The rest retreated to the cave, you should do the same."]="他们在你离开时发动了攻击……首领在战斗中倒下了。其它人都退进了洞里，你也应该这么做。"
G["They attacked while you were gone... the Captain fell fighting them off. The rest retreated to the cave, you should do the same."]="他们在你离开时发动了攻击……首领在战斗中倒下了。其它人都退进了洞里，你也应该这么做。"
G["They be on either side of us!  Send 'em down to Neptulon's Locker!"]="两翼都是敌人！送他们去见耐普图隆！"
G["They brand me unworthy? I will show them unworthy!"]="他们说我是废物？我要让他们瞧瞧什么才叫废物！"
G["They break it and I fix it! It's a very symbiotic relationship."]="他们在前头破坏，我就跟在后头修理！这是一种共生关系。"
G["They broke us all."]="他们击垮了我们。"
G["They built an empire, when they could have built a new world."]="他们本可以创造新世界，然而只建立起一个帝国。"
G["They call to me, the discs...I must..."]="圆盘……在召唤我……我必须……"
G["They call you a monster. But they're the monsters, not you. Farewell, Thrall."]="他们称你为怪物，但他们才是真正的怪物，你不是。保重，萨尔。"
G["They call you the Fel Horde's elite? Yet, you still tremble in my presence!"]="他们把你称为邪部落的精英？但是，你仍然因为我的出现而颤抖！"
G["They called me down from K'aresh to deal with this band of misfits?  Unbelievable!  Prepare to be collected!"]="他们把我从卡雷什叫过来就是为了对付这群渣滓？真是难以置信！等着收尸吧！"
G["They called me stupid, but I'll show them. I'm going to watch every pot I have and prove that they can all boil stuff anyway. Yeah, I'm on a roll! Who's stupid now, huh? Huh!?"]="他们说我愚蠢，我要证明自己的实力。我要关注所有的罐子，证明它们都能煮东西。我的好运就要来了！谁是愚蠢的人，嗯？嗯！？"
G["They called us the Bravo Company. When things needed killin', we did the spillin'... of blood."]="他们把我们叫做B连。当有杀戮任务时，我们负责让血……流成河。"
G["They came from nowhere! There was nothing we could do..."]="他们不知道从哪儿冒了出来！我们什么也做不了……"
G["They came out of nowhere!"]="他们仿佛从空气中突然蹦了出来！"
G["They came without warning.  There's nothing the guards could have done."]="他们的到来毫无征兆。令守卫束手无策。"
G["They can drain the Loch until it's little more than a drip of mud, and we'll still fight to keep it ours."]="他们会吸干洛克湖，直到那里只剩下一点泥巴，但我们还是要英勇奋战以保卫它。"
G["They can take away our land, but they can't take away our freedom!  Attack! [PH]"]="¡Pueden quitarnos nuestra tierra, pero no podrán quitarnos la libertad! ¡Al ataque! [PH]"
G["They can't keep this up! Their wings will eventually give..."]="他们不能继续这样！他们的翅膀终将……"
G["They cannot fear..."]="也不敢畏惧。"
G["They captured and enslaved us. Put us to work on a weapon."]="他们捉住并奴役我们，逼迫我们制造一件武器。"
G["They chose their own path."]="那是他们自己选的路。"
G["They come endlessly from the palace."]="他们源源不断地从宫殿中涌出来。"
G["They come for you, fool!"]="他们是冲你而来的，蠢货！"
G["They come here for war! Did you not see how they massacred the other outsiders?"]="他们是为战争而来！你没看见他们是怎么杀死其他外来者的吗？"
G["They come now. Try not to get yourself killed, young blood."]="Ahí vienen. Intenta que no te maten, $gchico:chica;."
G["They come!"]="他们来了！"
G["They come! Everyone, get ready..."]="他们来了！所有人，做好准备……"
G["They come! To arms me brothers - hurl them back to the sea!"]="他们来了！兄弟们，拿起武器——把他们扔回海里去！"
G["They come... <Snort> Pretty $r, yes? So pretty..."]="Ya vienen... <Resopla> Bonito, ¿verdad, $r? Muy bonito..."
G["They couldn't possibly have gotten through... this was an inside job. Somebody inside the city has the Bell, unless... no..."]="他们不可能通过……这可是内部机密。某个在城里的人带着圣钟，除非……不……"
G["They crossed a trail of blood-soaked snow and followed it to find a dwarf wandering and speaking in a dialect they couldn't make out... and not a dwarf of our kind mind you, but a mountain dwarf - something our kind had never seen before."]="沿着雪地上的血迹，他们遇见了一位流浪的矮人。他操着一口难以理解的方言……嗯，因为他不是一般的矮人啊。这个神秘的流浪者自称是高山矮人——我们从未听说过这个氏族。"
G["They crumble so easily."]="这么快就粉身碎骨了。"
G["They crushed us as if we were ants. What monstrous power these mogu have!"]="他们就像我们碾死蚂蚁一样横扫了我们。这些魔古族的力量简直恐怖！"
G["They dare attack us? The fools! Do they not know we are now all-powerful?!"]="他们竟敢发动攻击？这帮蠢货！他们难道不清楚我们有多强大吗？！"
G["They defied us - they defied Hellscream's Horde - I should've executed the whole town!"]="他们竟敢违抗我们——违抗地狱咆哮的部落——我当时真应该赶尽杀绝！"
G["They did it!  Enemy down!  Return to base!"]="他们成功了！敌人已被击溃！返回基地！"
G["They did not have to die...\n\nThe village to the south... my home, my family! They killed them all!\n\nIf only I had been stronger. I could have saved them!"]="他们不该死的……\n\n南边的村子……我的家园，我的家人！他们都被杀害了！\n\n如果我能再强壮一点该多好，那我就能救下他们了！"
G["They didn't always call me Ol' Durty Pete.\n\nOnce, when I were young an' durty, I thought I'd impress a sweet buxom lass named Bellie with me chiselin' styles.\n\nOl' Bellie! She were somthin' else. Firm, that one. All big but for the middle, like they was meant to be.\n\nSo I found me a chunk of limestone white like her skin and I set about to chiselin' and carvin' and creatin' what you'd call a masterpiece, but I got me scale all wrong, see? I ended up with an enormous, what would you call it? Butt."]="他们一直都叫我老脏鬼佩蒂。\n\n不过我也有过又年轻又脏的时候。那时我曾经打算用自己的雕刻工艺吸引一个名叫贝丽的姑娘。她可真是个肉感的甜心。\n\n老贝丽！她就完全是另一回事了。我的那个贝丽可不一样。她的身上除了中间的一段细腰之外，都是那么丰满，真是该多么漂亮就有多么漂亮。\n\n所以我找了一块像她的皮肤一样雪白的石灰石，打算雕出了一件惊世杰作。但我把比例全搞错了。最后，我只弄出一个奇怪的大块头。应该叫它什么呢？枪靶子吧！"
G["They didn't leave me with a leg to stand on!"]="他们连一条腿都没给我留下！"
G["They died honorably, Greatmother."]="他们的死充满荣耀，祖母。"
G["They died of natural causes..."]="他们是自然死亡……"
G["They died so easily. No matter."]="什么？这就死了？这也不错。"
G["They died. All of them...\n\nAs the Murkbloods cut through us, something took hold of me that I cannot understand. Tell me, have you ever felt a rage so great that the whole of your being burns? A heat that wilts the living? A heat that incinerates the blood in your veins? That is what I felt.\n\n<Saurfang's eyes glow red for a brief moment.>\n\nI was the last one left alive. 30 of them surrounded me... Murkbloods... I remember nothing beyond that vision. I blacked out and awoke some time later."]="他们死了。他们全都死了……\n\n暗血氏族突袭了我们，一些我不能理解的事情充斥着我的大脑。告诉我，你有没有感到过就像你的整个生命都在燃烧那样的愤怒？一种足以让生命枯萎的愤怒，一种足以烧尽你的血液的愤怒……那就是我所感觉到的。\n\n<萨鲁法尔的眼中闪过了血红色的光芒。>\n\n我是最后一个幸存者。他们三十个人个包围了我……暗血……之后的一切我都不记得了。我昏了过去，很久才醒过来。"
G["They do not die."]="他们不会死。"
G["They do not die; they do not live. They are outside the cycle."]="它们无所谓死，亦无所谓生。它们游离于生命的循环之外。"
G["They do not know the doors they are opening..."]="他们根本不知道自己打开了一扇怎样的门……"
G["They do that all day.  I get exhausted just looking at them."]="他们整天如此。照看他们真是让我精疲力尽。"
G["They don't know where to store the leftovers!"]="因为他们不知道该把剩下的肉放在哪里！"
G["They don't look very helpful, we should let them sleep."]="他们好像帮不上什么忙，让他们继续睡吧。"
G["They don't pay me enough to put up with this kind of unprofitable behavior!"]="要让我做这种无利可图的事，他们付的酬劳显然不够！"
G["They don't pay us enough for this.  But this ruined village sure beats skulking around inside of Auchindoun."]="他们没有付足够的工钱给我们。但是在这座荒废的村庄总比在奥金顿里躲躲藏藏好多了。"
G["They don't realize that they're dead, $r. They are cursed to relive the last memory they had before the town was eaten alive from the inside out. Most of them, anyway. Some were less fortunate.\n\nYou thought the Scourge did this? The Scourge did not yet exist and if they had, we would have at least put up a damned fight.\n\nNo, this was the result of a plague that came out of Scholomance and ravaged the town. It was horrifying and devastating. None survived.\n\nNow leave me to my sorrows."]="他们并未意识到自己已经死了，$r。他们受到诅咒，在头脑中保留了这个城镇被毁灭之前的记忆，大部分是这样，还有一部分人更为不幸。\n\n你认为是亡灵天灾所为？那时亡灵天灾还不存在呢，就算是它们的话，我们也会与它们展开一场恶战的。\n\n不，这场恐怖而极具破坏性的灾难源于通灵学院，它摧毁了整座城镇，无人生还。\n\n让我独自承受这悲伤吧。"
G["They don't stand a chance..."]="他们一点机会都没有……"
G["They drink your fear: it is the blood of life."]="它们畅饮着你们的恐惧：这是生命的鲜血。"
G["They eagerly rush to their deaths. What fools!"]="找死也要这么着急吗？一群蠢货！"
G["They elude me. I cannot see past their defenses. They have put in place wards to prevent detection.\n\n<Altruis points westward.>\n\nThey fear us because they know that we fear nothing. The cost for such power is great, the sacrifices many."]="他们躲避着我。我的视野不能穿越他们的防线。他们部署了结界来避免我的窥探。\n\n<奥图里斯指了指西边。>\n\n他们畏惧我们，因为他们知道我们无所畏惧。换取这种力量需要付出巨大的代价，惨痛的牺牲。"
G["They failed their test. Will you?"]="他们没通过测试，你呢？"
G["They fall asleep after. Me, I fall asleep during...."]="他们事后睡着，而我中途就睡着了……"
G["They fear my words. They make an example out of me. A mockery of the one true god, Neptulon.\n\n<Skar'this spits.>\n\nRetribution comesss, mortal. The glorious hand of the Tidehunter will one day sweep through the non-believers like a scythe against a new harvest."]="他们害怕我的预言。他们囚禁了我，想要起到罚一儆百的效果，以示对真神耐普图隆的嘲笑。\n\n<斯卡希斯吐了口唾沫。>\n\n凡人，他们会受到惩罚的。总有一天，猎潮者会挥起武器，就像镰刀收割成熟的庄稼那样，将这群丧失信仰的家伙统统歼灭。"
G["They fed the fire every hour of every day. Hot coals were carried from one primitive camp to the next. Do you see? In a single flash of light, civilization was born."]="火焰日以继夜地燃烧。红热的炭火在营地间传递。你明白了吗？只是一道闪电，文明由此诞生。"
G["They fight in vain..."]="徒劳的战斗……"
G["They fought over their food supplies. It looks like rather than sharing their food, someone destroyed it all. Why would they do that?"]="他们曾为食物大打出手。但看来他们没能分到食物，有人把补给都毁了。他们为何要这么做呢？"
G["They got recalled to Serpent's Spine."]="他们被召回了蟠龙脊。"
G["They had no right to demote me to these menial tasks!"]="他们没有权力把我降职来做这些下等事！"
G["They had their chance to come with me, and instead they mocked my beliefs. They are nothing to me."]="他们本来有机会和我在一起。但他们却只是嘲笑我的信仰。他们对我已经毫无意义了。"
G["They had what on them?  Tell the tailor my ceremonial robes had better be perfect with everything she's charging me."]="他们这是派谁来了？回去告诉那裁缝，最好用从我这儿拿走的钱，把我的礼服做得完美无缺。"
G["They hand the corpses to me, I toss them in the pit."]="他们将尸体交给了我，他将尸体投进了深坑。"
G["They have abandoned us! Do not forget!"]="不要忘记！是它们抛弃了我们！"
G["They have all abandoned you. Left you to die."]="他们已经抛弃了你。留你独自受死。"
G["They have broken into the Hall of Lights!  We must stop the intruders!"]="他们已经闯进了光明大厅！我们必须阻止这些入侵者！"
G["They have broken our defenses... the very earth turns against us in Deathwing's name."]="他们突破了我们的防御……连大地都以死亡之翼的名义背叛了我们。"
G["They have failed us sister."]="他们辜负了我们，姐妹。"
G["They have forced me to this...."]="他们强迫我这么做的。"
G["They have freed the human, Windsor, sire. It will not be long until Onyxia is uncovered."]="阁下，他们释放了温德索尔。奥妮克希亚的伪装被揭穿也是迟早的事情了。"
G["They have given up and surrendered - willingly - to us."]="他们放弃了抵抗，缴械投降——完全出于自愿。"
G["They have grown up here. We kept them safe from harm. We did the best that we could in nursing them back to health. Many perished but many, many more grew strong. Like Garrosh...\n\n<Greatmother Geyah sighs.>\n\nHe has lost his heart, you know. He tells me that I am his balance. That without me, the blood lust that consumed his father and ultimately cursed our people would take him over."]="他们在这里长大，我们让他们远离伤害。我尽可能地照顾他们的健康。很多都夭折了，但是更多的孩子茁壮成长了起来。就像加尔鲁什那样……\n\n<盖亚安祖母叹了口气。>\n\n你知道，他失去了他的信心。他告诉我，我是他的一切。如果失去了我，吞噬了他的父亲、诅咒了我们的人民的嗜血狂热会彻底占据他。"
G["They have limited supplies in this camp.  It would be a real shame if something were to happen to them."]="这座营地的补给物资有限。真要出什么差错的话，他们就完蛋了。"
G["They have no respect for the dead, $r. The ogres must be taught a lesson."]="他们一点也不尊重死者，$r。我们必须狠狠教训一下这些食人魔了。"
G["They have not even begun to see the fury of the Horde!"]="他们甚至都还没见识到部落的怒火！"
G["They have practically beaten him unconscious! I have to do something!"]="他被他们打晕了！我得赶快做点什么！"
G["They have turned against you. Now... take your revenge."]="他们已经背叛了你。现在……复仇吧。"
G["They have two moons to pay their debts. Make it known!"]="他们还有两晚时间付清欠款。去告诉他们！"
G["They have undermined EVERY attempt at peace!"]="他们破坏了我们每一次的和平努力！"
G["They have you good on that one, lad!"]="他们会好好招待你的，小子！"
G["They haven't noticed us yet. Hurry, maybe we can still stop them!"]="他们没有注意到我们。赶快，也许我们还能阻止他们！"
G["They hide this way!  Quick!"]="他们逃去这边了！赶快！"
G["They hunger...."]="它们很饿了……"
G["They imbued it with the power of an Old God."]="他们将一位上古之神的力量注入这件武器。"
G["They intend to execute Lorewalker Fu! Please, you must help me stop them..."]="他们打算处死游学者福云！你一定要帮我阻止他们……"
G["They just keep attacking.  There's nothing else that I can do but put them down."]="他们不断地进攻。我除了把他们都消灭以外别无办法。"
G["They just take the rams and go. The herd can't take any more."]="他们每次都是抢了牲畜就走。畜群已经再也经不起这种打击。"
G["They keep coming!  Push them back!  We must make sure we save as many Gilneans as possible!"]="他们在不断地冲过来！把他们击退！我们必须尽力救出更多的吉尔尼斯人！"
G["They keep coming!  Stand your ground!"]="一波接一波！坚守阵地！"
G["They keep their tools in boxes that look like this. Look for them near the pavilions."]="他们将工具放在这样的箱子里。去营帐附近找找看。"
G["They killed him! General Hawthorne - he was ambushed on the road by Horde assassins."]="他们杀了他！霍索恩将军在路上遭到了部落刺客的偷袭。"
G["They killed hundreds! We barely escaped with our lives! Help!"]="他们杀了好几百人！我们好不容易才捡回性命！帮帮我们！"
G["They killed my husband!"]="他们杀了我丈夫！"
G["They know how to throw a party here in Moonglade.  Who would have thought so?"]="他们真能想，居然在月光林地搞聚会，真棒！"
G["They lack control... Oshu'gun calls to them..."]="他们无法控制自己……沃舒古在召唤他们……"
G["They leave!"]="他们退了！"
G["They left us here impaled as a warning to the others... Several still alive... prisoners of..."]="他们把我们钉在这里，就是为了给其他人一个警告……还有些人活着……囚禁……"
G["They look so delicious..."]="它们看上去太美味了……"
G["They lurk nearby ready to strike."]="他们就潜伏在附近，随时准备发起进攻。"
G["They made it this far? I told you the others needed some micro-sonic genetic alterations."]="他们竟能走到这里？我早说了，其他人需要一些微波基因改造。"
G["They mask their intentions with meaningless movements to confuse us."]="他们用无意义的移动来扰乱我们的注意力，从而掩盖他们的意图。"
G["They may take our lives, but they'll never take..."]="他们也许会夺走我们的生命，但他们永远也无法夺走……"
G["They might have run all the other farmers off, but the Saldean's will never leave Westfall."]="他们也许能赶走其他的农夫，但是萨丁一家是永远也不会离开西部荒野的。"
G["They mine my pearls, they carve my body, and they distort my mind.  I can feel my will breaking, strangers... they mean to use me for war!"]="他们挖掘我的珍宝，他们切刻我的身体，他们扭曲我的灵魂。我能感觉到我的意志在粉碎，陌生人……他们想要让我为他们作战！"
G["They mock us from within the temple."]="他们在寺院里嘲弄我们。"
G["They most often turn deadly, and we're understaffed as it is."]="他们经常翻脸，而且老实说，我们的人手也不够。"
G["They must be after the Kun-Lai Kicker! $p, investigate these sightings and setup the village defenses! They won't get my brew without a fight!"]="他们肯定是在找寻昆莱劲酒！$p，调查一下这些眼线，建立村庄的防线！他们休想轻易就拿走我的酒！"
G["They must have had someone helping them."]="他们一定是得到了某些人的帮助。"
G["They must not discover the fate of the young paladin. Not yet."]="不能让他们知道年轻的圣骑士的命运。还不到时候。"
G["They must really like this city. Maybe it's the view?"]="他们也许真的喜欢这座城市。因为这儿风景不错？"
G["They must've drugged you. It's safe now."]="他们一定是给你下药了。你现在安全了。"
G["They mustn't escape!"]="一个都别让他们逃跑了！"
G["They need you on the northwestern field! Go!"]="他们正在西北边的战场上等着你！快去吧！"
G["They never stood a chance."]="他们完全没机会嘛。"
G["They opened the doors so we can escape!"]="他们把门打开了，我们能逃走了！"
G["They outnumber us! This is madness!"]="他们人太多了！这简直疯狂！"
G["They poisoned our supplies... we had cultists onboard all along..."]="他们在我们的食物中下了毒……教徒们早就混上了船……"
G["They provided the distraction I required. We continue as planned."]="他们已经成功牵扯了敌人的注意力。我们按计划继续。"
G["They put these lanterns out to commemorate the closing of the Lunar Festival."]="他们挂起灯笼是为了庆祝春节。"
G["They ravage the land and destroy everything that they touch. How many lives have been lost to their vile poisons?"]="他们蹂躏这片土地，摧毁他们所触及的一切。他们卑劣的毒药夺走了多少生命？"
G["They refused to train you?"]="他们拒绝训练你？"
G["They revel in causing anguish and pain - and their murderous interrogations are the stuff of nightmares."]="她们的乐趣就是给别人造成痛苦，她们致人于死地的审问方式是非常可怕的。"
G["They said Lady Proudmoore wanted us out. I... I don't understand."]="他们说普罗德摩尔女士要我们离开。我……我不明白啊。"
G["They said they were looking for slaves and weapons."]="他们说，他们在找奴隶和武器。"
G["They say Duriel is a fierce night elf.  It'll be a good fight!"]="他们说杜瑞尔是一名勇猛的暗夜精灵。这将是一场恶战！"
G["They say I have a bad reputation as a pirate, but you don't see me sailing around indiscrimanately killing people just to make a profit. Oh, wait...."]="他们说我是个臭名昭著的海盗，可你不会看到我为了点儿钱就四处航行滥杀无辜。喔，等一下……"
G["They say a stitch in time saves... what, eleven? Ah, I can't remember. Stupid saying anyway."]="他们说小洞不补大洞……什么来着？啊，我记不得了。反正是愚蠢的说法。"
G["They say an army travels on its stomach, and that's the truth.  For any offensive to succeed, your troops have to be well-fed and well supplied."]="他们说食物是行军的保障，这是真的。要想成功应对敌人的攻击，军队必须拥有足够的粮草和装备供应。"
G["They say he can turn into a raven sometimes."]="他们说他有时会变成乌鸦。"
G["They say strangers from beyond the mists have started showing up across the Jade Forest. Strange times."]="他们说，从迷雾另一边来的陌生人进入了翡翠林。真是个古怪的时代。"
G["They say that $n has never been shot down."]="他们说$n从来没有被击落过。"
G["They say that Alani can only see the flash of the greatest lightning, and may only hear the echo of the greatest thunder. Should you wish to get her attention, you will need to harness the very essence of the sky that spawned her."]="他们说，阿拉尼只能看到最亮的闪电，也许只能听到最响惊雷的回声。你如果希望得到她的注意，则需要利用催生了她的天空本身。"
G["They say that I am blessed: A herald to harken in a new age."]="他们说我被祝福了：新世纪需要被聆听的传讯者。"
G["They say that the Alliance has found new allies. They will be hard pressed to recover from losing us."]="他们说联盟找到了新的同盟，没有我们的帮助，他们肯定更加难以重振旗鼓。"
G["They say that the raptor matriarch lives deep within Raptor Ridge, protecting her clutch of eggs."]="他们说迅猛龙女王就住在恐龙岭深处，守着她那些龙蛋。"
G["They say that the way to the Tiller's Union is through the leader's stomach. Eh?"]="他们说，通往阡陌客最近的道路是首领的食道？"
G["They say that there are over five thousand brews in Pandaria. I ain't leavin' until I try them all!"]="他们说潘达利亚有五千多种酒。我在尝遍这些酒之前是不会离开的！"
G["They say that there's gonna be another attack... None are to be left alive..."]="他们说还会有进攻的……没有人能活下来……"
G["They say the barrel and buckets are for fighting fires.  Are you a fire fighter?"]="他们说这些水桶是灭火用的。你是个消防队员吗？"
G["They say the elves have stirred themselves from their forest for the first time in years. But to join the Horde? It can't be true, can it?"]="他们说精灵们这么多年来是第一次从森林里走了出来。而且是去加入部落？那不是真的，对吗？"
G["They say the eyes are the window to the soul. If that's the case, I'm guessing this guest and their soul have something to hide."]="都说眼睛是灵魂的窗口。如果这是真的，那我猜这位客人还有他的灵魂都藏起来了。"
G["They say there's no rest for the wicked. That means you!"]="俗话说狗改不了吃屎。这话说的就是你！"
G["They say these fireworks use the power of the moon!"]="有人说这些烟花带着月神的力量！"
G["They say time does not affect this island. There must be many amazing things to find here!"]="听说这座岛屿不受时光的侵蚀。在这里肯定能发现许多神奇的东西！"
G["They say you were a sweet girl."]="说你是个可爱的姑娘。"
G["They say your name was Evie."]="他们说你叫艾薇。"
G["They seek only power, as the Twilight do.  Yet you are confident that they will not turn on us.  Did I raise you to be fools?"]="他们只会寻求力量，与暮光别无二致。但你却信心十足的认为他们不会背叛我们。我养大了一个蠢货？"
G["They seek to defeat the Thunder King, not to protect Pandaria, but to claim his power for themselves."]="他们也想打败雷电之王，但不是为了保护潘达利亚，而是想攫取他的力量。"
G["They seem to be biting pretty good today."]="它们今天好像特别容易上钩。"
G["They sent someone after me?!\n\nThank the winds."]="他们派了人来找我？！\n\n谢天谢地……"
G["They sent you to kill me, eh? So predictable... Creatures ruled by terror are all the same.\n\nBut you... You are not one of them..."]="他们派你来杀我的吧，嗯？我早就猜到了……被恐怖支配的生物都一样。\n\n不过你……你和他们不一样……"
G["They set it off!"]="他们引爆了它！"
G["They shivered in the cold and the rain until - in one instant - lightning tore the sky!"]="他们在凄风冷雨中颤栗，突然——闪电撕裂了天空！"
G["They should aim the cannon straight up."]="他们应该把炮口笔直朝上。"
G["They should have burned my damned corpse."]="他们应该已经烧掉了我该死的尸体。"
G["They should have listened to me.  Then I'd receive all of the accolades that are my due!"]="如果他们听我的话，我早就得到所有我应得的赞美了！"
G["They should have studied harder."]="他们应该用功一点。"
G["They should show you a degree of trust."]="他们会对你保持一定程度的信任。"
G["They simply fear what they cannot begin to understand."]="他们对那些他们无法理解的东西感到畏惧。"
G["They slaughtered stone troggs, Gorik?  This is supposed to sway me?  It is not much of a feat."]="哼，它们杀掉了石头穴居人，你觉得这能打动我？这不算什么功绩。"
G["They slaughtered us with cold efficiency, but the true focus of their interest seemed to be the eggs kept here in the Sanctum."]="他们冷酷无情地屠杀我们，但他们真正的目标似乎是圣殿里的那些卵。"
G["They so ookin' stupid!"]="他们真是蠢死了！"
G["They spoil the coast with their cowardly mines. Disgusting!"]="现在这片海滩上到处都埋了他们肮脏的地雷。真可恶！"
G["They sssend you to your death, youngling."]="他们要置你于死地，年轻人。"
G["They stabbed and bit and chomped but nothing they could do would defeat our hero, $p!"]="¡Pincharon y mordieron y picaron, pero no pudieron hacer nada para derrotar a $gnuestro héroe:nuestra heroína;, $p!"
G["They stand no chance against Xuen."]="在雪怒面前，他们毫无取胜的希望。"
G["They stand unaware that their deaths are moments away."]="他们完全没意识到自己死期将至。"
G["They struck from the shadows. We didn't stand a chance."]="他们从阴影中发动攻击。我们连反抗的机会都没有。"
G["They sunk the Collingwood off the coast, but we managed to drag her carronades to the shore.\n\nThose animals won't set one filthy green foot on this beach! Not while I've got powder!"]="他们把科林伍德沉入了海底，但我们还是把她的舰炮拖到了岸上。\n\n只要我有火药，那些野兽肮脏的绿脚就别想踏上这片海滩！"
G["They swarm us, shaman! Make yourself useful!"]="他们在围攻我们，萨满！发挥你的作用！"
G["They teach me to sneak good.  You find them in Rogues' Quarter on outer ring of Undercity."]="他们教我如何“妙手空空顺手牵羊”。你可以在幽暗城外围的盗贼区找到他们。"
G["They tell me that I can shed my shame. I only need to do one thing, and then I will not be a shortfang.\n\nBut I cannot do that. I cannot take Farros' strength for myself. Not after what he has done for me..."]="他们说我能洗刷自己的耻辱。我只要做一件事，然后我就能摆脱短牙种的称谓。\n\n可我做不到。我不能将法洛斯的力量据为己有。尤其是想到他为我所做的一切……"
G["They thought I was weak.  Haha!!"]="他们居然认为我很弱小。哈哈！！"
G["They threaten not only the ways of the tusked people, but the existence of all who live."]="这不仅是对海象人氏族的威胁，更是将世间的生灵推上了绝路。"
G["They told me that this would be a training mission. I feel like it is turning into something more."]="他们对我说这只是一次训练任务。可我觉得现在的情况好像远不止此。"
G["They told us Gilneas City was safe..."]="他们对我们说，吉尔尼斯城是安全的……"
G["They took my son... They took my goods, I have lost everything. What could possibly have changed these Jinyu?"]="他们抓走了我的儿子……抢走了我的货物，我失去了一切。究竟是什么把这些锦鱼人变成了这样？"
G["They took off for Gadgetzan a while ago to bring us back some supplies.  Frankly, I would have given at least four of my fingers to have had the chance to crawl inside one of Dadanga's packs in order to leave this forsaken place."]="他们动身去了加基森，帮我们取回一些物资。坦白地说，我原本有很多机会可以爬进达丹加的包裹中，离开这片不毛之地。"
G["They took the others up into the volcano. Some to turn into zombies, some to sacrifice to their turtle god, Volcanoth!"]="他们把其他人带进了火山口。有些人变成了僵尸，有些人被献祭给他们的海龟神沃卡洛斯！"
G["They took us one by one. I'm sure there are other survivors."]="他们将我们分别关押起来。我敢肯定还有其他的幸存者。"
G["They took us unaware... attacked all of the highlands all at once, burstin' forth from the ground, swoopin' from the air. Most of the gryphon wings were scattered, and far too many good dwarves lost their lives.\n\nThere'd be little hope at all if Keegan hadn't rallied us together. I owe that man my life. At least now we have a chance."]="他们在我们没有察觉的时候偷袭了我们……同时对高地各处发动了攻击。他们破地而出，又从空中俯冲而下。大部分狮鹫都受惊逃走了。许多优秀的矮人白白牺牲。\n\n如果不是科甘及时将我们召集起来，重整了队伍，我们可能早已经被围歼了。是他救了我的命。至少现在，我们还有反击的机会。"
G["They tricked us into ambushing the Horde gunship... but why?"]="他们引我们去伏击部落的炮艇……可这是为什么呢？"
G["They used the powers of the Vale, and their own flesh-warping magics, to twist and shape a race of ferocious lizards into a living weapon. They created an army. An army of Saurok. Bloodthirsty savages created to enforce the will of the emperor."]="他们利用山谷的力量以及他们独有的血肉塑造魔法，将一种凶猛的蜥蜴改造成了具有生命的武器。他们打造了一支军队，一支蜥蜴人大军。这是一群嗜血的怪兽，他们的作用就是巩固皇权。"
G["They used to be an elite band of orcs created to serve the Warchief as protectors and enforcers of his command.\n\nNow they are an army of incredibly well trained destroyers. Garrosh's personal legion."]="他们原本是一支由精锐兽人组成的卫队，负责保护酋长的安全并执行他的命令。\n\n而现在，他们变成了一支由训练有素的屠夫组成的军队，加尔鲁什的私人军队。"
G["They used to call me Tony THREE-Tusk."]="他们从前都管我叫托尼·三牙。"
G["They utilize terror and subterfuge - often turning brother against brother as whole worlds fall before their dark influence."]="他们利用恐怖和诡计让兄弟之间互相残杀，以他们的黑暗力量毁灭诸界。"
G["They want you to stop asking questions! Shut up and fight!"]="他们只想让你闭嘴！别废话了，战斗吧！"
G["They warned me of the wakening sickness, but I did not believe it would be this bad."]="他们告诫过我刚醒来时很虚弱，可我没想到有这么糟。"
G["They was real crunchy, and Haohan thought they were his best crop yet! Haha!"]="它们真是脆爽，郝瀚觉得那简直是他最棒的作物！哈哈！"
G["They weaken us! Our strength is dilluted by their very existence! Destroy them all!"]="它们是祸害！维库人的力量会因它们的存在而削弱！杀掉它们！"
G["They went down like a sack of orc skulls!"]="他们还真是不堪一击啊！"
G["They were best friends, you know. Durotan and Orgrim once ventured into the Terokkar forest, where they were almost killed by an ogre. If it were not for the draenei that saved them... It makes me sad to look back upon those days. Such terrible things we did to the draenei..."]="你知道，杜隆坦和奥格瑞姆曾是最好的朋友，他们曾经结伴去泰罗卡森林冒险，在那里差点被一只食人魔杀死。要不是德莱尼人救了他们……回首往事总让我伤感，我们都对那些德莱尼人干了什么……"
G["They were clearly unworthy of Her divine embrace."]="他们根本不配沐浴她神圣的光辉。"
G["They were drawn to the ruins of Shattrath City where a small remnant of the draenei priesthood conducted its rites inside a ruined temple on this very spot."]="他们慕名来到沙塔斯城的废墟，一小群德莱尼传教士利用那里的一座废弃神庙传授着他们的教义。"
G["They were going to sacrifice me to summon more of their elementals!"]="他们要献祭我，以召唤更多元素！"
G["They were just getting in the way anyways."]="他们只是阻碍了一下。"
G["They were once people... Now? Undead monsters with an appetite for flesh!"]="他们曾经也是人类……可现在呢？不过是一群嗜血的亡灵！"
G["They were ready for us all along. Our forces are scattered, and we are on our own."]="他们一直在等着我们。部队被打散了，我们得靠自己了。"
G["They were seconds from strapping me to one of those altars and sucking my soul out. Let's get out of here!"]="他们马上就要把我绑在祭坛上，吸取我的灵魂里。让我们赶快离开这里！"
G["They were taken towards a waterfall to the southeast. I'll lead you there."]="他们被带到东南边的瀑布那里去了。我带你们去。"
G["They were trivial by comparison! These things are never in the same place."]="相比之下，它们根本不算什么！它们根本就不是一个档次的。"
G["They were trying to change me into a zombie!!!"]="他们要把我变成僵尸！！！"
G["They who dine on lost souls know only hunger."]="饥饿驱使着那些以失落灵魂为食的阴影。"
G["They will abandon you when you need them most. They will leave you to burn."]="他们会在你最需要之时抛弃你。他们会看着你被烧死。"
G["They will all see through to your weakness soon enough, \"Shan'do.\""]="Pronto, todos verán a través de tus debilidades, \"shan'do\"."
G["They will be forgotten..."]="他们将被遗忘……"
G["They will bring more destruction to our village!"]="他们会给我们的村庄带来更多灾难！"
G["They will find me and they will free me... Your pathetic cages cannot hold me for long!"]="他们会来救我的……别以为这些可笑的牢笼能永远禁锢我！"
G["They will get their chance to fight."]="他们不会放弃战斗的机会。"
G["They will get what they deserve, in due time."]="很快，他们就会得到应有的报应。"
G["They will help you Garrosh.  And I will help you.  I will find the answers that we need to assuage the fears of the people and soothe the elements."]="他们会帮你的，加尔鲁什。我也会帮你。我一定会找到我们要找的答案，来消除人们的恐惧，安抚躁动的元素。"
G["They will learn that no place is safe from the Shado-Pan."]="他们会明白，在影踪派面前，没有安全的地方。"
G["They will live, if only to see the fruits of their labor: the destruction and chaos that will surely ensue as the legion of Blackrock invade the gorge."]="让他们活着，这样他们就可以看到他们都做了些什么——在黑石军团入侵灼热峡谷之后，毁灭和混乱将接踵而至。"
G["They will not."]="他们不会知道的。"
G["They will pay for forsaking us.  For leaving us here amongst the beastly undead to rot..."]="他们将为抛弃我们的行为付出代价。把我们丢在这里，任由我们在凶残的不死亡灵间腐烂……"
G["They will return soon. Let's get back to Bloodgulch."]="他们很快就会回来。我们回溅血谷地去。"
G["They won't take our land without a fight!"]="想夺走我们的土地，没那么容易！"
G["They worked from the shadows, and get this... somehow, they managed to master the sha."]="他们钻研暗影法术，然后……通过某种方法，他们开始能够控制煞能。"
G["They would rather die than bow before the North Wind. Something is amiss here."]="他们宁愿死，也不愿意臣服于北风。这里出了差错。"
G["They'll have to get past me, first."]="他们必须先过我这一关。"
G["They'll learn to fear the Stormriders this day!"]="就在今天，风暴骑士会让他们尝到恐惧的滋味！"
G["They'll never find us here, will they? We won't let them get us like they got Limpy Joe and Flannel McGee!"]="这里很安全，对吧？他们抓走了乔伊和米克基，我们得躲起来，不能让他们发现。"
G["They'll never know we're missing."]="他们永远不会知道我们失踪了。"
G["They'll never see me coming."]="他们休想发现我的踪迹。"
G["They'll pay for this."]="他们会为此付出代价。"
G["They'll see the light, I hope."]="他们会看到圣光的，希望如此。"
G["They'll take this camp over my dead body!"]="除非我死了，否则他们休想占领这个营地！"
G["They'll thank me for being hard on them when the battle starts."]="等战斗打响时，他们就会感激我的严格训练了。"
G["They're EVERYWHERE! WATCH OUT!"]="他们到处都是！你一定要小心！"
G["They're after the Warchief -"]="他们在追赶酋长。"
G["They're after the beer!"]="他们是来抢夺啤酒的！"
G["They're alive..."]="他们还活着……"
G["They're almost in sight - finish placing mines on that field!"]="已经能看见他们啦——停止埋设地雷！"
G["They're already assembled. I'm trusting you to secure the route to Grim Batol. Don't let me down."]="他们已经集结完毕。我相信你能守住通往格瑞姆巴托的道路。别让我失望。"
G["They're backing off here... get to the east pass! Quickly!"]="敌人开始撤退了……快去支援东边的通道！快！"
G["They're backing off here... get to the south pass! Quickly!"]="敌人开始撤退了……快去支援南边的通道！快！"
G["They're busting up our boat!"]="他们在破坏我们的船！"
G["They're calling it the Cataclysm. What caused this destruction? Why us?"]="他们把它叫做大灾变。这毁灭因何而起？为什么是我们？"
G["They're changing themselves into some kind of super-elemental they call an Ascendant. You must stop them, $n!"]="他们正在把自己变成某种叫做升腾者的超能元素。你得去阻止他们，$n！"
G["They're coming at us!  Be quick with those rockets!"]="他们发动攻击了！当心那些火箭！"
G["They're coming from all sides! Hang on just a little longer - we're almost there!"]="他们从四面八方涌来了！再坚持一下，我们快到了！"
G["They're coming out of the woodwork today. Let's keep moving or we may find more things that want me dead."]="我们继续前进吧，否则会碰到更多想要我命的东西。"
G["They're coming over our barricades! Push them back!"]="他们正越过我们的工事！把他们打回去！"
G["They're coming. Get behind the defenses!"]="他们过来了。到工事后面去！"
G["They're defending a fixed position. I'm not going to play their game. We'll draw them out."]="对方早有准备。不能被他们牵着走，得把他们引出来。"
G["They're definitely not gnomes."]="总之他们绝对不是侏儒。"
G["They're dragging people away!"]="他们把我们的人拖走了！"
G["They're everywhere!"]="他们无所不在！"
G["They're firing on us sir!"]="他们开火了，长官！"
G["They're firing on us, sir!"]="他们开火了，长官！"
G["They're following me, $r! Quickly, tell me why you're here before we're discovered! If they catch up to me, it will mean my death and yours!"]="他们还在追我，$r！快点，在我们被发现前告诉我，你来这里干什么！要是被他们抓住了，我们两个人都得死！"
G["They're giving candies and treats at the inn!  Guardian Grimwatch says if they don't give us a treat... then we get to play a trick on them!"]="他们正在旅店里分发糖果！守护者格雷沃基说要是他们不给我们糖果……我们就去和他们捣乱！"
G["They're going to kill us all!"]="他们会杀了我们的！"
G["They're going to pay, $n. They're all going to pay."]="他们一定要付出代价，$n。他们全都要付出代价。"
G["They're going to show fireworks all night long.  From 6PM until dawn, the sky will blaze over Booty Bay!"]="晚上会有焰火表演，从下午6点直到第二天早上，藏宝海湾的天空将会绽开无数绚丽的花朵！"
G["They're going to show fireworks all night long.  From 6PM until dawn, the sky will blaze over Elune'ara!"]="整晚都会有烟花表演，从下午6点直到黎明，月神湖的上空将会绽放无数美丽的花朵！"
G["They're gone! Whew! Looks like the trail is clear."]="不见了！哇！看来障碍已经消除。"
G["They're good at hawking their goods..."]="他们很会推销自己的商品……"
G["They're here!"]="他们在这里！"
G["They're here! Give'm hell!"]="他们来了！炸死他们！"
G["They're here! They're over here! Help me!"]="他们在这里！他们过来了！救命啊！"
G["They're in mid challenge, mon. Be patient."]="他们正在进行挑战，朋友。耐心一些。"
G["They're just up ahead.  The sound of the water should cover our approach.  Let me know when you're ready."]="他们就在头顶上。流水应该能掩盖我们接近的声音。当你准备好就告诉我。"
G["They're killing the prisoners! Hurry, help the others."]="他们正在屠杀囚犯！赶快行动，去援救其他人。"
G["They're locked!  NO!!"]="它被锁住了！不！！"
G["They're lookin' for that bell. Big, powerful bell! You lookin' for it too, wikket?"]="他们正在找那口钟。又大又厉害的钟！无毛怪，你也在找那钟吗？"
G["They're making me into a Deathguard.  Can you believe it?"]="他们想让我当个亡灵卫兵。你能相信吗？"
G["They're not going to give up until they find him. We can't allow that to happen, $n, and Brann knows it."]="他们不找到他是不会放弃的。我们不能让这种事发生，$n，布莱恩也明白这一点。"
G["They're not half good either!"]="可也没多好！"
G["They're not paying me enough for this. Wait! They're not paying me at all!"]="要让我做这种事，他们付的酬劳还不够。等等！他们根本就没有给过我一点酬劳！"
G["They're performing unholy rites down in the catacombs, and I'm about to be the sacrifice!"]="他们正在下面的墓穴中举行邪恶的仪式，我马上就要变成他们的祭品了！"
G["They're planning a huge attack! We need to warn Highlord Fordring!"]="他们正在策划一场大袭击！我们必须去警告大领主弗丁！"
G["They're planning to sacrifice me! Their demons are already licking their chops over my corpse.\n\n<Balgor shudders.>\n\nMakes me think twice about my own diet.\n\n Anyway, they've got a guard watching my every move. I can get myself out of here, but I need a good distraction."]="他们要把我当作祭品！他们的魔鬼就要在我的尸体上舔它们的刀刃了。\n\n<巴尔格打了个哆嗦。>\n\n这让我一点吃东西的胃口都没有。\n\n他们安排了一名卫兵时刻监视着我。我能自己离开这里，但我需要有人吸引卫兵的注意力。"
G["They're protecting it with a powerful spirit barrier. We will need to disable it before our ships can land."]="他们用一个强大的灵魂屏障守卫着它。得先解除它，才能让船只靠岸。"
G["They're protecting it with a powerful spirit barrier. We'll need to take it down before we can portal our troops in."]="他们用一道强大的灵魂屏障守卫着它。我们得先解除它，才能让部队过来。"
G["They're pushing in the south!"]="敌人对南边的通道发动了猛攻！"
G["They're scaling the cliff walls! This is going to get dirty."]="他们在攀爬峭壁！这下情况复杂了。"
G["They're sending boarding parties from the sea.  One of you man the aft cannon and take 'em down!"]="他们从海上派出了夺船小队。派你的人到船尾去开炮，击沉他们！"
G["They're short an' they're stout, but no man can doubt:"]="他们又矮又强壮。没人能够怀疑："
G["They're storming the walls!"]="他们在冲击城墙！"
G["They're the ones who helped Korga Strongmane escape from the Alliance!"]="就是他们帮助科尔加·蛮鬃逃出了联盟的魔掌！"
G["They're the only ones that have returned from battle, and they're being repaired."]="从战场返回的就只剩它们了，还在被维修。"
G["They're through the gates! I'm outta here!"]="他们冲过了大门！我要离开这里！"
G["They're transforming themselves into some kind of super-elemental they call an Ascendant. You gotta stop them, $n!"]="他们正在把自己变成某种叫做升腾者的超能元素。你得去阻止他们，$n！"
G["They're trying to flank us. Hold this position!"]="他们想袭击我们的侧翼。守住这里！"
G["They're trying to take down the plane! I can't pull up any steeper... you need to keep them off of us!"]="他们想要击落飞机！我没法往上攀升……别让他们靠近我们！"
G["They're turning our people into MONSTERS!!"]="他们把我们的族人变成了怪物！！"
G["They're ugly, they smell, they eat with their mouths open, and... ooof!"]="他们相貌丑陋，还有难闻的体臭！吃东西的时候狼吞虎咽的……哎哟，想起来就恶心！"
G["They're under the ground. They're under the ground!"]="他们在地下！他们在地下！"
G["They're upon us! Hurry, $n, my axe thirsts for the blood of these naga!"]="他们来了！动作快，$n，我的战斧渴望这些纳迦的鲜血！"
G["They're very persistent."]="它们还真是够顽强的。"
G["They're working us like dogs and we're getting nothing to show for it!"]="他们让我们像狗一样工作。我们却什么也没得到！"
G["They're worthy fighters, you'll see."]="你将会知道，他们都是强大的战士。"
G["They's in Magic Quarter.  Look for them in scary skull building."]="他们在魔法区。去那幢恐怖的骷髅楼中找他们吧。"
G["They've already dragged off and murdered the others. I'm sorry... I'm too weak to continue..."]="他们已经拖走并杀害了其余的人。对不起……我太虚弱了，不能继续了……"
G["They've been chanting: \"Kill the mogu\" all day. Whatever Aethas has you doing, it's working."]="Han estado coreando: \"Muerte a los mogu\" todo el día. Sea lo que sea que Aethas te haya mandado hacer, está funcionando."
G["They've been stolen, $r! Three of our most prized volumes. Should you return the tomes, a reward will most certainly be yours."]="被偷啦，$r！我们最珍贵的三卷卷轴。如果你能找回来的话，一定会得到丰厚的报酬的。"
G["They've been studying the relics that the blood elves were stealin'."]="他们正在研究那些被血精灵偷走的古物。"
G["They've been talking all day about the mogu weapons they found within Ihgaluk Crag.\n\nThey don't suspect us at all. Keep up the good work."]="他们整天都在谈论自己在伊瓜鲁克峭壁发现的魔古武器。\n\n他们完全没有怀疑我们。继续加油吧。"
G["They've been waiting on you, $c."]="他们已经在等你了，$c。"
G["They've blown through the second barricade! Fight them back!"]="他们已经突破第二道障碍了！击退他们！"
G["They've breached the tower, bring it down!"]="他们攻破了塔楼，摧毁它！"
G["They've broken through!"]="防线被冲破了！"
G["They've gone too far! Some Twilight are goin' to be dyin' this day!"]="他们干得太过份了！今天一定要有一些暮光暴徒付出生命的代价！"
G["They've got a lock on you! Shields! SHIELDS!"]="他们盯上你了！护盾！护盾！"
G["They've got him in one of their tree-settlements. Veil... Veil Shalas! Rokag must know about this immediately! Go speak with him."]="他们把他抓到了一颗树上，沙……沙拉斯鸦巢！罗卡格必须马上知道这个！快去告诉他吧。"
G["They've got him in one of their tree-settlements. Veil... Veil Shalas! Thander must know about this immediately! Go speak with him."]="他们把他抓到了一颗树上，沙……沙拉斯鸦巢！山德必须马上知道这个！快去告诉他吧。"
G["They've got one of ours! No mercy for the Dragonmaw!"]="他们抓住了我们的同伴！绝不要对龙喉有任何怜悯！"
G["They've got the Admiral locked up like an animal. Please save him too."]="他们把上将像畜生一样关了起来。请你把他也救出来吧。"
G["They've killed the Greench!"]="他们杀了格林奇！"
G["They've opened gateways to the Firelands... tell me there's still hope!"]="他们打开了通往火焰之地的传送门……告诉我希望还在！"
G["They've overrun the village! HELP!"]="它们占领了村子！救命啊！"
G["They've sent muscle to get revenge! Scatter!"]="他们企图利用蛮力达到复仇的目的！散开！"
G["They've sent you to finish me off? Is this the best your Horde can muster?"]="他们派你来干掉我？你就是部落里最强的战士？"
G["They've spotted us! Defend the caravan!"]="他们发现我们了！保卫商队！"
G["They, along with the other barbarian clans of the Horde, are your new enemies."]="他们，以及依附部落的其他野蛮部族，都是你们的新敌人。"
G["They... are my clutch no longer.  Bring them down."]="它们……已经不再是我的子嗣了。消灭它们。"
G["They... came out of nowhere. Ambush."]="他们……不知道从哪儿冒出来的。我中了埋伏。"
G["They... did not, Greatmother. They were killed shortly after I was born. I never knew them. I was raised as a slave. To this day, I carry the name of Thrall."]="他们……没有，祖母。他们在我出生后不久就被杀害了。我从来都没有见过他们。我是作为一个奴隶长大的。我这个名字的意思，就是“奴隶”。"
G["They... they agreed?! Fantastic! Thank you so much! With their blessing we can be the happiest pandaren in all the land!"]="他们……他们同意了？！天呐！真是太感谢你了！只要有了他们的祝福，我们就是这世界上最最幸福的熊猫人！"
G["They... they just attacked a ship full of passengers!"]="他们……他们刚刚攻击了一艘满载乘客的船只！"
G["They?"]="他们？"
G["Thief!"]="¡$gLadrón:Ladrona;!"
G["Thief. Thief!"]="小偷。小偷！"
G["Thieves! I shall smelt your remains!"]="盗贼！我要毁掉你们的尸体！"
G["Thieves! Scallywags! Rapscallions! Come face me gigantic pillas!"]="小偷！无赖！恶棍！来尝尝我的大枕头的滋味吧！"
G["Thieves! Stop them!"]="小偷！抓住他们！"
G["Thieving wikket not gunna take hozen slickies!"]="笨蛋小偷休想偷走猢狲的鱼！"
G["Things all started out pretty well."]="一切都开始得很顺利。"
G["Things are about to get much worse. Come, taste the power that the Lich King has bestowed upon me!"]="你们就要大祸临头了。来吧，尝尝巫妖王赐予我的力量吧！"
G["Things are always better than they seem."]="事情总没有看上去那么糟。"
G["Things are going as planned, Lord Falconcrest. I assure you, it is only a matter of time."]="一切正在按照计划进行着，法库雷斯特公爵。我向你保证，这只是时间问题。"
G["Things are going to get worse before they get better. Only by working together can we overcome the darkness."]="黎明前的天空总是格外黑暗。只有精诚团结，我们才能战胜这黑暗。"
G["Things are looking grim...."]="形势不妙……"
G["Things are looking up for us, $n. Now that the attacks are over, we can finally work on repairing our ships to find a way home."]="事情正在向有利于我们的方向转变，$n。既然攻击已经结束了，我们终于可以想办法修复飞船，并寻找回家的路了。"
G["Things are proceeding as planned."]="进度良好，按部就班。"
G["Things are proceeding well!  Soon we grind The Betrayers bones beneath our feet!"]="事情进行得很顺利！不久之后这些背叛者的尸骨就将被我们狠狠地踩在脚下。"
G["Things are quite calm here usually. We only have problems with the occassional saurok hunting party. And the saurok tend to only come out during a heavy storm."]="这里平时相当平静。只有蜥蜴人狩猎小队会偶尔来给我们添些麻烦。而且蜥蜴人一般只在狂风暴雨来袭时才会出现。"
G["Things are rarely what they seem, Tyrande. And my son tells me this is a sacred place."]="事情不能只看表面，泰兰德。而且我儿子说这是个圣地。"
G["Things be comin' back. I be here for... a mission... Help me outta here. Dere's things to be done."]="我想起来了。我是来这里……完成一个任务的……救我出去，有些事情必须完成。"
G["Things can get a little stuffy here in Nethergarde.  Sometimes a dwarf just needs a brew to take her mind off her duty for a bit."]="守望堡有时真是闷得够呛。有时一个矮人需要的只是一杯啤酒，让她的脑袋换换气儿！"
G["Things could not be going better, friend. Thank you for your aid."]="La cosa no podría ir mejor, $gamigo:amiga;. Gracias por tu ayuda."
G["Things have changed rapidly since you arrived here, $n. The hozen are more of a threat now than ever before.\n\nBut we, jinyu... we are stronger now, too."]="自从你来了之后，形势迅速好转了，$n。猢狲的威胁空前强大。\n\n可我们锦鱼人……也更加强大了。"
G["Things seem to be going well."]="一切似乎都进展得很顺利。"
G["Things that are done, it is needless to speak about... things that are past, it is needless to blame."]="做完的事就不用反复讨论……过去的事，也不必再去追究。"
G["Things that make you go... BOOM!"]="把你炸飞……轰！"
G["Things that still keep me awake at night."]="那是些让我在长夜无法入眠的事情。"
G["Things used to be so much better... what happened to us?"]="以前的情形要比现在好得多……我们到底出了什么事？"
G["Things was goin' good, so we decided to split up for a bit."]="事情一直很顺利，所以我们决定分头行动。"
G["Things would go faster with more iron... maybe there are some deposits around here."]="如果铁矿供应充足的话，进展还能再快些……这附近或许会有一些矿点。"
G["Think I'm starting to wear a rut in the paving stones."]="我要上路了。"
G["Think about how valuable a member of the dwarven royal family would be as a hostage."]="你想啊，劫持矮人皇室的重要成员做人质，那赎金得多高啊。"
G["Think about it carefully, my friends. If we can afford to spend our magic on simple aesthetic enhancements, clearly we hold a vast reservoir of power at our beck and call."]="仔细想想，我的朋友们。如果我们能在这些简单的美观设施上花费我们的魔法，那么很明显，我们有着无穷无尽的能量以供驱使。"
G["Think about it! His enemies took advantage of my father's Cataclysm."]="想想吧！他的敌人利用了我父亲引发的大灾变。"
G["Think about it, prospector, but make up your mind swiftly. We must act soon."]="考虑一下吧，勘查员，希望你能尽快做出决定。我们必须立即采取行动。"
G["Think about it: the smallest voice can change the world. Consider that, friend, the next time you decide to start throwing stones!"]="想想看——哪怕是最微弱的声音也能改变世界。下次当你决定掷出石子时，考虑一下吧，朋友。"
G["Think him in Royal Quarter. Kurden Bloodclaw is little orc."]="小兽人库尔丁·血爪应该在皇家区。"
G["Think no more on despair, Koro. We have a saying where I'm from: It is darkest just before the dawn."]="No desesperes, Koro. En mi tierra tenemos un dicho: \"La hora más oscura es la que precede al alba\"."
G["Think of our younglings, Gul'dan! You will destroy us all!"]="想想我们的后代，古尔丹！你会毁灭我们的！"
G["Think of the horror if those dookers stole the mallet too."]="我想那些混蛋肯定还要偷钟杵。"
G["Think on my words, friends. In the darkness that surrounds us all, the Light is needed more than ever."]="好好想想我的话吧，朋友们。黑暗笼罩着我们，人们更加需要圣光的指引。"
G["Think there are any fish in here?"]="想想这里会有鱼吗？"
G["Think they'll ever fix all this? Let's go to the other side."]="以为他们能把这一切都弄好？我们去另一侧。"
G["Think twice before you fight the might of the Kor'kron."]="在面对库卡隆的力量时，你最好三思而后行。"
G["Think we'll see ol' sooty today?"]="你觉得我们今天能见到老黑炭吗？"
G["Think you can come here and steal from us, huh!?"]="你认为自己能在这里来去自如？"
G["Think you can get the drop on me?"]="你认为自己能占上风吗？"
G["Think you can hurt me, huh?  Think I'm afraid a' you?"]="你以为你们能打伤我？你以为我会怕你？"
G["Think you can put in the good word for us?  We're looking to join the order."]="那也许你能为我们美言几句？我们正想加入这个组织。"
G["Think you can take me in a pet battle?  Let's fight!"]="你以为你能在宠物战斗中胜过我？让我们开始吧！"
G["Think you can take me in battle?  Most girls hate snakes, but I think they're cute!"]="你可以让我加入战斗吗？大多数小女孩讨厌蛇，但我觉得蛇很可爱！"
G["Think you can take the heat?"]="你们能受得了这高温吗？"
G["Think you could bust me out of this cage?"]="你能打开笼子，放我出去吗？"
G["Think you could calculate how many things out here want to kill us? I bet you'd be surprised at the results."]="你能数清楚这里有多少怪物想杀我们吗？我敢打赌，统计数字会让你大吃一惊。"
G["Think you could get me out of here, $c?"]="你能带我离开这里吗，$c？"
G["Think you could help me to get out of here?"]="你觉得你能帮我离开这里吗？"
G["Think you could repair my gear, Burrian?"]="你能修好我的设备吗，布里安？"
G["Think you got what it takes to face my brews?"]="你敢来尝尝我酿的酒吗？"
G["Think you have what it takes to face the challenges of Azeroth's dungeons? Inquire within..."]="认为你已经有能力应对艾泽拉斯地下城的挑战了？入内查究……"
G["Think you the master is daunted by your games? We will never fall to you!"]="你以为主人会因为你的小小胜利而沮丧吗？我们永远不会在你面前倒下！"
G["Think, $n. Think back. Try and remember Durotar, $g brother:sister;! Remember the sacrifices our heroes made so that we could be free of the blood curse. Harken back to the Valley of Trials, where we were reborn into a world without demonic influence. We found the splendor of life, $n. Together! This isn't you. You were a champion of the Horde once!"]="Piensa, $n. Recuerda. ¡Intenta recordar Durotar $ghermano:hermana; Recuerda los sacrificios que hicieron nuestros héroes para que nos liberásemos de la maldición de la sangre. Remóntate al Valle de los Retos, el lugar donde renacimos a un mundo sin influencia demoníaca. Encontramos el esplendor de la vida, $n. ¡Juntos! $gEste:Esta; no eres tú. ¡Una vez fuiste $gun campeón:una campeona; de la Horda!"
G["Think, $n. Think back. Try and remember Gnomeregan before those damned troggs! Remember the feel of an arclight spanner, $g brother:sister;. You were a champion of gnome-kind once! This isn't you."]="Piensa, $n. Recuerda. ¡Intenta recordar Gnomeregan antes de que llegaran aquellos malditos troggs! Recuerda la sensación de sostener una llave de tuerca arcoluz, $ghermano:hermana;. ¡Una vez fuiste $gun campeón:una campeona; de los gnomos! $gEste:Esta; no eres tú."
G["Think, $n. Think back. Try and remember the hills and valleys of Elwynn, where you were born. Remember the splendor of life, $g brother:sister;. You were a champion of the Alliance once! This isn't you."]="Piensa, $n. Recuerda. Intenta recordar las colinas y los valles de Elwynn, el lugar donde naciste. Recuerda el esplendor de la vida, $ghermano:hermana;. ¡Una vez fuiste $gun campeón:una campeona; de la Alianza! $gEste:Esta; no eres tú."
G["Think, $n. Think back. Try and remember the majestic halls of Silvermoon City, where you were born. Remember the splendor of life, $g brother:sister;. You were a champion of the sin'dorei once! This isn't you."]="Piensa, $n. Recuerda. ¡Intenta recordar las majestuosas salas de la Ciudad de Lunargenta, el lugar donde naciste. Recuerda el esplendor de la vida, $ghermano:hermana;. ¡Una vez fuiste $gun campeón:una campeona; de los sin'dorei! $gEste:Esta; no eres tú."
G["Think, $n. Think back. Try and remember the proud mountains of Argus, where you were born. Remember the splendor of life, $g brother:sister;. You were a champion of the draenei once! This isn't you."]="Piensa, $n. Recuerda. ¡Intenta recordar las orgullosas montañas de Argus, el lugar donde naciste. Recuerda el esplendor de la vida, $ghermano:hermana;. ¡Una vez fuiste $gun campeón:una campeona; de los draenei! $gEste:Esta; no eres tú."
G["Think, $n. Think back. Try and remember the rolling plains of Mulgore, where you were born. Remember the splendor of life, $g brother:sister;. You were a champion of the tauren once! This isn't you."]="Piensa, $n. Recuerda. Intenta recordar las extensas llanuras de Mulgore, el lugar donde naciste. Recuerda el esplendor de la vida, $ghermano:hermana;. ¡Una vez fuiste $gun campeón:una campeona; de los tauren! $gEste:Esta; no eres tú."
G["Think, $n. Think back. Try and remember the snow capped mountains o' Dun Morogh! Ye were born there, $g lad:lass;. Remember the splendor o' life, $n! Ye were a champion o' the dwarves once! This isn't ye!"]="Piensa, $n. Recuerda. ¡Intenta recordar las nevadas montañas de Dun Morogh! Tú naciste allí, $gchico:chica;. ¡Recuerda el esplendor de la vida, $n! ¡Una vez fuiste $gun campeón:una campeona; de los enanos! $gEste:Esta; no eres tú."
G["Thinking about setting off a spark or two? I should go buy some fireworks myself! The vendor can be found in the chamber of masters.\n\nI'll mark the location on your map."]="考虑过燃放一两个烟花吗？我应该自己去买些烟花！在师匠大厅内可以找到商贩。\n\n我会在你的地图上标记这个位置。"
G["Thinking about setting off a spark or two? I should go buy some fireworks myself! The vendor can be found out on the main terrace.\n\nI'll mark the location on your map."]="考虑过引爆一个或两个烟花吗？我应该自己去买些烟花！主露台上可以发现供应商。\n\n我会在你的地图上标记这个位置。"
G["Third prize is YOU'RE FIRED! You get the picture?"]="三等奖就是炒鱿鱼！听明白了吗？"
G["Third squad reporting in!"]="第三小队报告！"
G["Thirsty? How about flagon of sweet, warm honeycomb mead? Come on over!"]="渴了？不如来一壶又暖又甜的蜜酒？快来尝尝吧！"
G["Thirteen-sided dice!"]="十三面骰子！"
G["Thirty caribou hooves for a rifle that has a scope?! Sign me up!"]="30只驯鹿蹄子换一把带瞄准镜的步枪？！成交！"
G["Thirty seconds until the Arena battle begins!"]="竞技场战斗将在三十秒后开始！"
G["This \"Loken\" sounds like a nasty character. Glad we don't have to worry about the likes o' him anymore. So... if I'm understandin' ye right, the original earthen eventually woke up from this stasis, and by that time the destabili-whatever had turned 'em into proper dwarves. Or at least... dwarf ancestors."]="Este \"Loken\" parece un personaje peligroso. Me alegro de que ya no tengamos que preocuparnos por él. Así que... si lo he entendido, los terráneos originales se despertaron de esa estasis y para cuando la desestabili...lo que sea... se habían convertido en enanos normales. O al menos... antepasados de enanos."
G["This $C intrudes on our work! Die fool!"]="¡$gEste:Esta; $c se entromete en nuestro trabajo! ¡Muere, idiota!"
G["This $gguy:girl; gets it!"]="这位$g兄弟:姑娘;懂了！"
G["This $n has been driven mad from the corruption!"]="¡$n ha enloquecido al entrar en contacto con el mal!"
G["This $n is a minion from Naralex's nightmare no doubt!"]="毫无疑问，这个$n是从纳拉雷克斯的噩梦里跑出来的！"
G["This ... doesn't end here ... $r."]="这一切……还远没有结束……$r。"
G["This <glub> is not over yet, mortal..."]="Esto <glups> no ha terminado aún, mortal..."
G["This Blue Feather is for you."]="这根蓝色羽毛是给你的。"
G["This Braised Wolf is for you."]="这份炖狼肉是给你的。"
G["This Charbroiled Tiger Steak is for you."]="这份碳烤虎肉排是给你的。"
G["This Curator is equipped for gallery protection."]="馆长已经为保护画廊准备就绪。"
G["This Dimensional Imploder sounds dangerous!  How can I make one?"]="空间爆破器听上去很危险！我怎么才能做一个呢？"
G["This Eternal Blossom Fish is for you."]="这份锦绣鱼是给你的。"
G["This Fire Spirit Salmon is for you."]="这份焰灵鲑鱼是给你的。"
G["This Fire Spirit Salmon looks delicious. I do hope you made it yourself."]="这个焰灵鲑鱼看起来很美味。我希望这是你亲手做的。"
G["This Forest Pheasant Roast is for you."]="这份香烤林地野雉是给你的。"
G["This Godfrey must be quite an extraordinary individual. The mistress has sacrificed much for his return."]="高弗雷一定是个非常特别的人。主人付出了巨大的代价，只是为了让他回来。"
G["This Honeybrew is the lifeblood of this village. Now THAT is something worth fighting for!"]="这蜜酒是整个村子的命脉。现在也成了值得你争我抢的东西！"
G["This Horde sailor likely met his end during the battle."]="这名部落水手似乎是战死的。"
G["This Hozen Stir Fry is for you."]="这份猢狲小炒是给你的。"
G["This I promise... This I vow..."]="我承诺……我发誓……"
G["This Illusionary Slayer will test your ability to damage your opponent. Do not worry; it cannot harm you."]="这个幻影杀戮者会测试你的伤害输出能力。别担心，它不会攻击的。"
G["This Is Stonehearth!"]="这就是巨石之炉！"
G["This Jade Cat is for you."]="这只玉猫是给你的。"
G["This Jade Forest Fried Rice is for you."]="这份翡翠林炒饭是给你的。"
G["This Kaja'Cola thing's got me thinking. Do we really want the competition to have ideas?"]="这瓶叫做卡亚可乐的玩意儿让我想法不断。我们真需要竞赛来获取灵感吗？"
G["This Korune device is similar to the fel crystals we once used to enslave demonic energies. Demon or angry spirit or elemental manifestation of an emotion, the principle is relatively the same.\n\nWe need to see how intact the entity stored within this artifact is, however. Since you have experience with the mogu and the other dangers of Pandaria, would you be so kind as to do the honors?\n\nWe have already disabled most of the protective wards. Simply adjust the intensifier disc on the artifact and be ready for anything that comes out."]="这些寇茹设备和以前我们用来使驭恶魔能量的邪能水晶有些相似。无论是恶魔还是愤怒之魂还是某种情绪的元素具象产物，驾驭它们的原理都是相同的。\n\n我们需要调查一下存储在这件神器里的东西是否还保存完好。既然你已经在潘达利亚大陆上经历了这么多冒险，也和魔古族打过这么多交道，不知你是否有兴趣亲自动手？\n\n我们已经关闭了大部分的保护结界。你只需要手动调节一下这件神器的增强圆盘，然后准备好对付可能会蹦出来的东西就行。"
G["This Lovely Apple is for you."]="这只可爱的苹果是给你的。"
G["This Marsh Lily is for you."]="这支泽地百合是给你的。"
G["This Ruby Shard is for you."]="这块红宝石碎片是给你的。"
G["This Schnottz fellow is proving to be a wise investment.\n\nGood that I was insightful enough to get in on the ground floor."]="事实证明这个司克诺兹是个明智的投资对象。\n\n看来我的洞察力的确是超强的。"
G["This Swirling Mist Soup is for you."]="这碗迷雾汤是给你的。"
G["This Town-In-A-Box is a remarkable feat of engineering!"]="胶囊镇实在是工程学上的一项伟大成就！"
G["This Twin Fish Platter is for you."]="这份鸳鸯鱼拼盘是给你的。"
G["This Vale is truly a paradise."]="四风谷真是个的天堂。"
G["This Vale of Eternal Blossoms is getting more and more intriguing. I may just have to see it for myself."]="这个锦绣谷真是越来越有趣了，我一定要亲眼去看看。"
G["This Xylem guy is a jerk."]="那个叫克希雷姆的家伙真是个古怪的人。"
G["This a most not good place."]="这地方真是衰透了。"
G["This aberration destroyed... everything.  Everyone."]="这场混乱毁掉了……一切。毁了所有人。"
G["This act of defiance will not go unpunished.  You, and your world, will die!"]="你的挑衅会受到惩罚的。你和你的世界将一起灭亡！"
G["This afterlife thing isn't all that bad. I can see lots of business opportunities here. Plenty of spirits that are waiting for the right deal to come along."]="做鬼的感觉也还不算糟。我能在这儿看到许多商机。不少鬼魂都在等待合适机会的到来。"
G["This ain't a ride, clem.  Beat it."]="Esto no es una atracción, $gpaleto:paleta;. Lárgate."
G["This ain't daycare, peon. Double time!"]="这里不是度假圣地，苦工。加快速度！"
G["This ain't in my contract!"]="我的合同上不是这么写的！"
G["This ain't much of a big challenge, mon, but we gotta know ya can handle the pit before we can take ya in."]="这不算什么大挑战，朋友，但在接纳你之前，我们要确认你有能力对付这个地穴里的东西。"
G["This ain't the first time I been stuck up to me teef in a jungle that up an' done ambushed me. I been all over the world, $gson:missy;, an' I'll be hog-smacked if this one's gonna be the end of me."]="这已经不是我第一次在古怪危险的丛林中拼尽全力挣扎求生了。我去过这个世界的许多地方，$g孩子:姑娘;，如果我会在这里完蛋，那我也只不过是个没用的家伙。"
G["This ain't your vacation getaway, $r. If you want to rest, take a bedroll and shut yer yap.\n\nAnd don't tell me that you wanna make Hellfire yer home. You ain't gonna last two minutes out in the wilds. We'll be shipping you back home in five small boxes."]="这里不是你的度假地，$r。要是你想休息，拿上你的铺盖卷，然后闭嘴滚蛋。\n\n还有，不要告诉我你想把地狱火当作你的家。你在野外都活不过两分钟。我们会把你分装在五个小盒子里运回家的。"
G["This all feels like a long shot.  We've got a lot riding on this plan.  Redridge's freedom, for one."]="这真是孤注一掷。我们把很多赌注都押在这个计划上了。赤脊山的自由就是其中之一。"
G["This all seems so familiar, like I've been here before."]="这一切看上去都好眼熟，好像我以前来过这里一样。"
G["This all seems so strange."]="这一切看上去都太奇怪了。"
G["This all... your fault!"]="都是……你的错！"
G["This amber is ours, trespasser! Amber not for the mantid!"]="¡Este ámbar es nuestro, $gintruso:intrusa;! ¡El ámbar no es para los mántides!"
G["This ancient fresco was once inlaid with jade, but it has fallen into ruin and now its wisdom is lost to us."]="这幅古老的壁画曾镶满了玉石，但现在已经残破，其中的智慧也失传了。"
G["This ancient totem is fashioned into the shape of a bat."]="这个古老的图腾被雕刻成一只蝙蝠的形状。"
G["This ancient totem is fashioned into the shape of a bat.  It must be the totem that Chabal spoke of."]="这个古老的图腾被雕刻成一只蝙蝠的形状。它一定是查巴尔所说的图腾。"
G["This ancient totem is fashioned into the shape of a bat.  It must be the totem that Maywiki spoke of."]="这根古老的图腾有着蝙蝠的造型。这一定就是梅维克说的那根图腾。"
G["This area is known to be full of foul Scourge.  You may want to take a moment to prepare any defenses at your disposal."]="这个区域到处都是天灾军团的爪牙，你最好准备一下，免得手忙脚乱。"
G["This area is looking good, orcs.  Keep up the good work."]="这地方看上去很不错，兽人们。继续努力。"
G["This area is restricted!"]="闲人免进！"
G["This area will self-destruct in eight minutes."]="本区域将在八分钟后自毁。"
G["This area will self-destruct in five minutes."]="本区域将在五分钟后自毁。"
G["This area will self-destruct in four minutes."]="本区域将在四分钟后自毁。"
G["This area will self-destruct in nine minutes."]="本区域将在九分钟后自毁。"
G["This area will self-destruct in one minute."]="本区域将在一分钟后自毁。"
G["This area will self-destruct in seven minutes."]="本区域将在七分钟后自毁。"
G["This area will self-destruct in six minutes."]="本区域将在六分钟后自毁。"
G["This area will self-destruct in ten minutes."]="本区域将在十分钟后自毁。"
G["This area will self-destruct in three minutes."]="本区域将在三分钟后自毁。"
G["This area will self-destruct in two minutes."]="本区域将在二分钟后自毁。"
G["This artifact appears to be intact, though it is so thoroughly coated in dirt and mud that it is difficult to tell for sure.  There does not seem to be anything inherently magical about it."]="这件神器看起来是完整的，不过由于被厚厚的泥土掩盖而很难确定。看起来它并不蕴含任何远古魔法能量。"
G["This artifact has been cursed by the troll witch doctors!  At your touch, it begins to emit a foul glow."]="这件神器遭到了巨魔巫医的诅咒！被你碰触了之后，它开始发出邪恶的光辉。"
G["This artifact has weathered many storms, and shows significant signs of deterioration.  It is doubtful that any powers it once held remain."]="这件神器经历了多年的风吹雨打，早已失去了往日的光芒。很难相信它是否还蕴含着什么力量。"
G["This baby is all mine! I call her, \"The Throttler.\""]="¡Esta belleza es toda mía! Lo llamo \"El Acelerador\"."
G["This bad. This real bad."]="不好。真的不好。"
G["This banner!!"]="这面旗帜！"
G["This barrel of ale is guarded by Jarven Thunderbrew.  As long as he's in the basement, no barrels may be disturbed."]="加文·雷酒负责看管酒窖。只要他呆在地下室，这些酒桶就十分安全。"
G["This battle has extracted a heavy toll. My own rebirth will have to wait for several years."]="这场战争代价高昂。就连我也要若干年后才能重生。"
G["This battle must be seen to be believed! Once a mild-mannered tuskarr fisherman, our next fighter turned to the life of a soulless mercenary when his entire family was wiped out by a vicious pack of lion seals and ill-tempered penguins! Now he's just in it for the gold! Ladies and gentlemen, ORINOKO TUSKBREAKER!!"]="除非亲眼目睹，否则接下来的战斗将令人难以置信！这位即将出场的战士原本是个脾气温和的海象人渔夫，但是他的全家被恶毒的海狮和暴躁的企鹅杀死了，从此他就变成了一个行尸走肉般的雇佣兵。现在，他只为金币而战！女士们先生们，他就是奥里努克·碎牙！！"
G["This beach used to be such a peaceful place. Now it's polluted with these barbarians!"]="这片海滩曾经是个多么宁静的地方。现在被这些蛮族给玷污了！"
G["This beam of greater moonlight will send you to Darnassus."]="这道月光会把你送到达纳苏斯去。"
G["This beam of moonlight leads to Stormwind.  Use your invitation when you're ready."]="Este destello de luna conduce hasta Ventormenta. Utiliza tu invitación cuando estés $glisto:lista;."
G["This beam of moonlight leads to the Undercity.  Retire when ready."]="Este destello de luna conduce hasta Entrañas. Ve cuando estés $glisto:lista;."
G["This bear wanders a path close to where the Talondeep Path lies, due west of Mystral Lake and the Alliance outpost of Silverwind Refuge.  While he is the easiest of the three creatures you will face on the Ashenvale Hunt, he should not be trifled with.  His presence is a constant threat to travelers who sojourn between Ashenvale and the Stonetalon Mountains."]="这只熊漫步在一条靠近石爪小径的路上，在密斯特拉湖和联盟的银风避难所正西方。虽然他是你在灰谷遇到的三个动物之中最好对付的一个，对他也不能掉以轻心。他的出现对于逗留在灰谷和石爪山脉之间的旅客来说是一个巨大的威胁。"
G["This bear's flank is frozen solid.... try again."]="这块熊腰肉都冻得发硬了……再试试吧。"
G["This beast leads the Riverpaw gnoll gang and may be the key to ending gnoll aggression in Elwynn."]="这个怪物是河爪豺狼人的头领，如果要结束豺狼人对艾尔文入侵，也许就要从他下手。"
G["This beats patrolling the Opera Hall. Theater people scare me."]="这节拍在歌剧院里面回响，剧场里的人们着实把我吓到了。"
G["This beautiful creature you rescued is immune to the lightning strikes that protect the island."]="你救下的这个美丽生物能免疫岛上的闪电攻击。"
G["This being may feed on Fear, but we have none to offer it. Cease your ritual, for we require no assistance to cleanse this place."]="这种生物也许能从恐惧中汲取力量，但我们心中可没有恐惧。停止你的仪式，因为我们不需要别人帮忙净化这个地方。"
G["This bell, when rung, could shake the world and call to the heavens."]="这口钟响起时，足以震动世界，上达天听。"
G["This belongs to Firewing Point.  You'll not be putting your grubby hands on it!"]="这是属于火翼岗哨的！你休想碰它！"
G["This better be important!"]="你的事情最好是非常重要的那种！"
G["This better be important, Sylvanas. You know how I detest this place and its foul stench. Why have you called for me?"]="事情最好足够重要，希尔瓦娜斯。你知道我有多讨厌这鬼地方和这里的恶臭。你找我来想要干什么？"
G["This better be important."]="你最好别拿琐事来烦我。"
G["This better be the last one!"]="这最好是最后一个！"
G["This blade has been returned to us for a reason, my lords. Now is the time to rally behind the bearer of Quel'Delar and avenge the destruction of Silvermoon and the Sunwell."]="出于某种原因，这把剑重新回到了我们手里，我的主人。现在，是紧随奎尔德拉持有者重整旗鼓的时候了，为银月城和太阳之井的毁灭报仇。"
G["This blight is useless."]="这种枯萎病是没用的。"
G["This blood has unique properties.  Where was it obtained?"]="这份血样非常奇特。从哪儿弄来的？"
G["This blue leather does draw the eye, I know. You see, we have a great many eager recruits running around here, hunting and slaying with more enthusiasm than wisdom. One must take precautions."]="我知道，这块蓝色的皮革吸引了你的目光。你看，许多热情高涨的新兵都在这附近狩猎，像失去理智般砍杀动物。你必须提高警惕。"
G["This blue light... It's strange. What do you think it means?"]="这蓝色的亮光……真奇怪。你认为它意味着什么？"
G["This board is used by the Steamwheedle representatives at Mudsprocket to post bounties and job notices."]="这块公告板被热砂集团派驻泥链镇的代表用来张贴悬赏和工作通知。"
G["This body is useless!"]="这个身体已经没用了……"
G["This book contains information on the plant species of Outland.  Most of the plants detailed are native to Zangarmarsh.\n\nThe charts and diagrams are a bit beyond your understanding.  Perhaps the author could give you some pointers."]="这本书包含了外域的植物种类的信息，其中大部分被详细介绍的植物产自赞加沼泽。\n\n书中的文字和图表可能有点超越你的理解能力，也许作者可以给你一些指点。"
G["This book contains information on the plant species of Outland.  Most of the plants detailed are native to Zangarmarsh.\n\nYou feel confident that you can use the charts and diagrams in the book to identify various plant species."]="这本书包含了外域的植物种类的信息，其中大部分被详细介绍的植物产自赞加沼泽。\n\n你自信可以凭借书中的文字和图表来识别各种植物。"
G["This book holds a seemingly endless amount of knowledge..."]="Este libro alberga una cantidad aparentemente interminable de conocimientos..."
G["This book would give me unlimited power over my enemies... I would become... unstoppable!"]="这本书将赐予我无尽的力量……我会变得……无坚不摧！"
G["This bridge isn't ever going to be finished, is it?"]="这座桥永远也建成不了吗？"
G["This bridge should have been destroyed by now.  How long does it take for those lazy sods to get here from the Highlands!"]="这座桥早就该被摧毁了。那些懒东西从高地走到这里居然花了这么长时间！"
G["This calls for an old-fashioned bulldozer exorcism! Give me a hand if she gets uppity, will ya?"]="这需要一场老式的推土机驱魔仪式！如果她不服从管束，就请帮我一下，可以吗？"
G["This can't be right. An Old God could never be allowed to enter this world. The results would be... Oh dear!"]="这不可能。上古之神绝不可能被允许进入这个世界。如果那样的话……天哪！"
G["This can't be. He can't just give up like this. Why has he asked that you take his place as warchief?"]="不可能。他不能就这么放弃。为什么他会要求你取代他酋长的位置？"
G["This cannon appears to be pointed directly at the shore, with a fresh charge of powder and fuse already set.\n\nHow convenient!"]="这门大炮直指海岸，而且炮膛里已经填满了弹药，安放好了引信。\n\n这可真方便啊！"
G["This cannot be happening!"]="这不可能！"
G["This cannot be!"]="这不可能！"
G["This cannot be!  I am the master here!  You mortals are nothing to my kind!  Do you hear me? Nothing!"]="这不可能！我是这里的主人！你们这些凡人对于我来说一无是处！听到了没有？一无是处！"
G["This cannot be! The Vazuvius could never fall to the likes of you!"]="这不可能！瓦祖维斯号怎么可能败在你这种人手上！"
G["This cannot be, is it finally over?  I must be dreaming again."]="这不可能，真的结束了吗？我肯定又做梦了。"
G["This cannot stand."]="无法容忍。"
G["This cauldron will be perfect for brewing our... brew."]="这个大锅很适合煮我们的……酒。"
G["This cell won't hold me for long.  I will have Illidan's head one way or another."]="这个监狱是关不住我的。无论如何我都要取下伊利丹的首级。"
G["This chamber will flourish with your life energy!"]="你的生命能量将使这座殿堂更加辉煌！"
G["This champion also faced the Stone Dragons and their Broodmother with no glimpse of fear or hesitation.  I've seen the most hardy of giants falter where the fleshling did not."]="这名勇士还直面了石龙和石龙主母，它们曾令最强大的巨人退缩，这个血肉之躯却没有丝毫的恐惧和犹豫。"
G["This champion has proved intent and capable."]="这位勇士已经证明了自己的决心和能力。"
G["This changes nothing. (Nothing nothing changes. Crush them, crush.)"]="这什么也改变不了。（什么都没改变，碾碎他们，碾碎。）"
G["This charade has gone on long enough!"]="陪你们玩的够久了！"
G["This cherry pie tastes so good, it could make a grown gnome cry."]="这块美味的樱桃馅饼能让小侏儒喜极而泣。"
G["This chest must have been resting here for millenia."]="这只箱子一定已经在这里沉睡了千年之久。"
G["This childish effort ends now!"]="这种幼稚的游戏该结束了！"
G["This chunk of amber may be exactly what the Klaxxi are looking for."]="这可能就是卡拉克西正在寻找的那块琥珀。"
G["This chunk's been picked clean."]="这块矿已经被采掘干净了。"
G["This city can be strange. Is there something I can do for you?"]="这座城市的确有些古怪。我能帮你什么忙吗？"
G["This city is so big, to me, a tiny, pathetic gnome."]="作为一个小得可怜的侏儒，我觉得这座城市真大啊。"
G["This city is so unlike anything from home...\nAh, friend, how may I help you?"]="Esta ciudad es tan distinta a mi hogar...\n\nAh, $gamigo:amiga; ¿en qué puedo ayudarte?"
G["This city is very... expansive, but it seems to be lacking something. I can't put my finger on what..."]="这座城市非常……奢华。但是它看上去似乎缺少些什么，我不能确切地指出到底缺什么……"
G["This city will fall!"]="这座城市即将陷落！"
G["This conflict is little more than a race-war. Their hatreds would engulf this land - we will have no part in this!"]="这不是一场种族战争这么简单。他们的仇恨会吞噬这片土地——我们绝不会介入。"
G["This confrontation no longer serves any purpose. I shall end it."]="这样的对峙没有任何意义。我要结束这一切。"
G["This console stands before steaming rubble.  The sounds of an engine can be heard below."]="这个控制台后面是一大堆碎石块。发动机的声音从地下传来。"
G["This constant, annoying resistance is futile, you maggots! There will be nothing in the end but death!"]="这持续不断、惹人厌烦的抵抗都是徒劳的，你们这群蠢货！一切都将湮灭于虚空，惟有死亡长存！"
G["This continent does not give up its secrets easily."]="这片大陆是不会轻易交出自己的秘密的。"
G["This courier must have died of his wounds after what looks to have been a brutal struggle."]="这里看来发生过激烈打斗，信使一定是因伤而死的。"
G["This crate looks like it was used to store weapons and armor."]="看起来，这只箱子的功用应该是储存武器和盔甲。"
G["This creature suffers from the effects of the fel... We must end its misery."]="这个生物受着毒药的折磨……我们必须终止它的痛苦。"
G["This creature you've recovered is immune to the lightning strikes that protect the island."]="你发现的这个生物能够免疫岛上的防御闪电。"
G["This creature... she is quite old, and very wise.  We stand to learn a great deal about Vashj'ir and the naga, if we can only speak with Nespirah."]="这个生灵……她相当年迈且非常睿智。要是我们能与奈瑟匹拉交谈的话，我们就能了解很多与瓦丝琪尔和纳迦有关的事。"
G["This crime cannot be allowed to go unsolved. The location of the inn and the violence of its destruction make this a very delicate matter. Inspect the site with the utmost respect, friend."]="这种罪行不容姑息。旅店的地理位置和它的离奇被毁让事态变得非常棘手。朋友，用谨慎的态度去树荫旅店展开调查吧。"
G["This crypt will be your grave!"]="这座墓穴就是你的葬身之地！"
G["This crystal-based construct hums with energy.  Strange glyphs are projected in front of you and scroll in rapid succession."]="这座水晶建筑由于能量的流动不时地发出蜂鸣声。奇怪的符号在你面前闪烁，并快速地滚动着。"
G["This cultist is in a deep trance..."]="这个信徒陷入了恍惚的状态……"
G["This dark taint is downright bad for business."]="这股黑暗而邪恶的势力显然会碍我们的事。"
G["This darkness in my heart, it is your doing!"]="我心中的这片阴影，正是你造成的！"
G["This data will be quite useful for Project Blue Book. Er, I mean, this will be great for my new look.  See if you can gather any more data."]="这份数据对蓝书计划十分有用。呃，我的意思是这会对我的新造型很有帮助。去看看你能不能收集到更多的数据。"
G["This day brings victory, but more difficult trials lie ahead..."]="今日之战已胜，可前方还有更多险阻……"
G["This day is long overdue! Out of my way!"]="这一天来得太晚了！让开！"
G["This day seems to be one full of hard decisions.  Having the courage to make them is gravely important, for the sake of us all.  I did what I had to do, and we may have all been doomed if I had not... but sadly, not all see it that way.\n\nIt is time for me to leave Shen-zin Su, that those here might be free from the burden of my difficult choice, and that I might fight on for the sake of a much larger world.\n\nI've only known Korga a short time, but he and I could be brothers if he were born in different skin - he possesses bravery and honor that I would gladly stand beside.  You too could be my $gbrother:sister;, after all we've been through together.  I'm hoping you might join us, but I understand that there is much to consider."]="看来今天注定是充满了艰难抉择的一天。为了我们大家着想，我必须勇敢地面对这些抉择。我做了我必须做的事情，如果不这样做，我们可能已经全都命丧黄泉了……不幸的是，并非所有人都这样想。\n\n我想现在是时候离开神真子了，这样大家就不用为我的艰难抉择而背上负担，我也可以为更多的人继续战斗。\n\n我和科尔加相识不久，但一见如故，如果不是因为肤色不同，我们本应成为兄弟，我敬佩他的勇敢和气节，能够与他并肩作战是我的荣耀。你也本应成为我的$g兄弟:姐妹;，毕竟我们一起出生入死过。我希望你能加入我们，但我理解事情并非如此简单。"
G["This day we fight!! By all that you hold dear in these good lands, I bid you stand, heroes of Azeroth!"]="今天，我们战斗到底！以这片美丽的土地上所有你们所爱的人的名义，我命令你们坚守阵地，艾泽拉斯的英雄们！"
G["This day will stand as a testament not only to your valor, but to the fact that no foe, not even the Lich King himself, can stand when Alliance and Horde set aside their differences and---"]="今天我们不仅见证了你们的勇猛，还见证了联盟和部落抛开仇怨，精诚团结的力量。有了这种力量，即使是巫妖王也会败倒在你们脚下。"
G["This death is only a temporary respite from my curse."]="死亡只能暂时延缓我的诅咒。"
G["This demands a tireless search for ancient clues, and the wisdom to interpret them."]="这需要我们不倦地探索远古留下的线索，用智慧来揭示真相。"
G["This demonic entity is known as the Voidwalker. Its strength and endurance are significant, making it ideal for defense. Send it to attack your enemy, then use it as a shield while you use your spells and abilities to drain away your opponent's life."]="这种恶魔被称为虚空行者。它的力量和耐力都非常惊人，可以出色地胜任防御任务。首先控制它来攻击你的敌人，这样就能保证你在有肉盾保护的情况下安全地使用法术和技能。"
G["This desert be mine!"]="这片沙漠是属于我的！"
G["This devastation could have been avoided, $c. There was a time when Theramore was a symbol of peace..."]="这场毁灭本可避免，$c。曾几何时，塞拉摩是和平的象征……"
G["This dig here is compromised - the Explorers' League wants us to grab whatever's left of value and clear out. Easily said, not so easily done."]="我们的挖掘计划已经不可能完成了——探险者协会要我们尽量收集一切有价值的物品，然后离开。说的容易，做起来可不容易。"
G["This discovery will surely rock the foundation of modern archaeology."]="这个发现肯定会动摇现代考古学的基础理念。"
G["This dock here?  Well you can catch the ship that goes to that Night Elf place.  What's it's name?  Uhh Auberdine I think.  I don't really know for sure, I just load and unload stuff."]="这个码头？你可以乘船前往暗夜精灵的领地。地名？嗯，我想是奥伯丁。我不太确定，我只是一名搬运工。"
G["This does not concern you. Be on your way."]="这和你没关系。继续走。"
G["This does not look familar to me at all.  Let's head back to the courtyard and see if there is another way.  I don't really like long stairwells anyways."]="这里看上去真是陌生。我们返回庭院吧，看看还有没有其它出路。我打从心底厌恶长长的楼梯。"
G["This does not look good for the future of the cartel. Not one bit.\n\nYou have to pull our fat out of the fire, $n, or we might as well all just walk into that volcano up there."]="Esto no pinta bien para el futuro del cártel. Nada bien.\n\nTienes que sacarnos las castañas del fuego, $n, o más nos vale que saltemos a ese volcán."
G["This doesn't bode well.  Send scouts to gather more intelligence, and stay on alert."]="这不是个好兆头。马上派人去继续侦查，其他人保持警戒。"
G["This doesn't look good!"]="看上去不太妙！"
G["This doesn't look good. Whatever you do, don't fall off. There's a ton of nasty things in there!"]="事情似乎不太顺利。千万别跌下去。那里满是肮脏的东西！"
G["This doesn't look pretty, lad."]="我说，情况似乎不妙啊。"
G["This doesn't look right..."]="这感觉完全不对……"
G["This doesn't look... right.  Look at how alien the desert is!  Going through here might be a terrible mistake."]="这看起来不太……对头。沙漠实在是太陌生了！从这里通过可能是一个巨大的错误。"
G["This door is all that stands between us and the Betrayer.  Stand aside, friends."]="在我们和伊利丹之间就只剩下这扇门了。站开点，朋友们。"
G["This dwarf's body is severely battered. The Twilight's Hammer must take pleasure in their killing."]="这具矮人的尸体被严重地损毁了。暮光之锤一定都是些以屠杀为乐的疯子。"
G["This emitter is driving me nuts!  I'm missing all sorts of parts that I need to fix it."]="我快抓狂了！所有可以用来修理这台发射器的零件，一件都没有！"
G["This end have I reached before.  What new adventure lies in store?"]="我曾经经历过这样的结局。这次会有新意吗？"
G["This ends NOW!"]="一切都结束了！"
G["This ends here!"]="一切都结束了！"
G["This ends here, Hogger!"]="到此为止了，霍格！"
G["This entire city must be purged."]="必须净化整座城市。"
G["This entire holiday is nonsensical. Colored eggs and \"life affirmation,\" bah."]="\"Toda esta fiesta carece de sentido. Huevos de colores y \"afirmación de la vida\"... buá."
G["This equipment looks cool and all, but couldn't we have done a little better?  Are you even raiding?"]="这件装备看上去不错啊，但是你就不能穿得更好一点吗？难道你都不去团队副本的么？"
G["This ethereal teleport pad is covered in brightly colored buttons and switches, but seems to have fallen into disuse."]="这个虚灵传送台上有好几个刷着亮漆的按钮和开关，但看上去已经废弃了。"
G["This evil I have unleashed... In whose hand does the power my goddess granted to me now lie... By whose hand is it directed?"]="我引来了这些邪恶的生物……当初女神赐予我的圣物到底在哪里……究竟是谁在主导这一切？"
G["This evil cannot be allowed to enter this world!  Come my children!"]="绝不能让邪恶力量侵袭这个世界！来吧，孩子们！"
G["This exercise bores me."]="这练习让我觉得厌烦。"
G["This expedition is a terrible drain on military supplies."]="这次探险将耗费大量军事物资。"
G["This faire is a sweet surprise!"]="这个马戏团太令人惊喜了！"
G["This faire is great!"]="这个马戏团太棒了！"
G["This farce ends here!"]="这场闹剧该结束了！"
G["This farm has been in my family for generations. How can I give it up? Yet, a greater responsibility has fallen upon me."]="这个农场是我祖传的财产。我怎么能放弃它呢？可是，又有更重大的责任落到了我的肩上。"
G["This feather... brings back so many memories. Thank you, $n."]="这根羽毛……给我带来很多回忆。谢谢你，$n。"
G["This fel reaver appears to not be quite operation just yet."]="这台魔能机甲似乎尚未激活。"
G["This field will look as good as new in no time!"]="这片田地马上就能焕然一新了！"
G["This fight has gotten a bit stale; allow me to spice things up!"]="这场战斗有一点乏味了，请让我给大家助助兴！"
G["This fight is favorable to us."]="这场战斗对我们有利。"
G["This fight is the true test of courage. Steel your hearts and drench your blades in the enemies' blood!"]="这场战斗的确是对勇气的极大考验。坚定你的信念，举起你的刀剑，让利刃痛饮敌人的鲜血吧！"
G["This fight will take everything we have. I hope you are ready."]="这场战斗需要倾力而为。但愿你做好了准备。"
G["This fight's all yours!"]="这次就靠你自己了！"
G["This fighting is endless. I'm not certain how much more of it I can stand."]="没完没了的战斗。我不知道自己还能坚持多久。"
G["This first part is the toughest. Once we get to the thermal vents, the path will be much clearer."]="开头这段路是最困难的。等我们到热排气口那里，路就好走多了。"
G["This flight takes you to the far point of the Singing Ridge.  Very dangerous!\n\nFor this one, I'm going to need a signed waiver..."]="这次飞行将把你带到远方的晶歌山脉。那里是非常危险的！\n\n正因为如此，我需要你签一份免责声明……"
G["This food is delicious. I never want to leave."]="这里的食物非常美味。我从没想过要离开。"
G["This fool does not understand. He carries negative emotion with reckless abandon. We will all suffer the consequences if such action continues."]="这个蠢货不明白。他毫无顾忌地放任自己的负面情绪。如果任其发展，我们所有人都会尝到苦果。"
G["This footprint is too muddy to be useful."]="这脚印已经变得泥泞难辨。"
G["This forest be a spooky place.  It's full of more bad juju than just the Alliance, so you watch out for yourself."]="这片森林是个怪异的地方，这里的坏魂能要比联盟还多，所以你自己得小心点。"
G["This forest can be confusing! Be careful out there."]="这片森林容易使人迷路！要小心。"
G["This forge can make unstable concoctions... to study them, I need Apexis Shards!"]="这座熔炉可以制造出不稳定的合剂……要研究合剂的话，我需要一些埃匹希斯碎片！"
G["This forge will usher in the new age! Demos commands it!"]="这座铸魔基地将会铸造出一个新的纪元！迪摩斯是不可战胜的！"
G["This form means nothing. We are without end."]="这个躯壳毫无意义。我们永无终结。"
G["This fortress will be harder to take than Garrosh'ar was. But sooner or later, they will break. The Horde always breaks."]="这座堡垒会比加尔鲁什尔前哨站更难攻破。但它们迟早会被攻破的。部落必将败落。"
G["This foul little beast is the imp. It is small and weak, making it almost useless as a meatshield, and its damage output is mediocre at best. This creature is best used for support of a larger group."]="这些邪恶的小家伙就是小鬼。它很小而且很瘦弱，显然是不能做为肉盾使用的，而它的威力也不大。这种召唤生物最好是在多人组队的时候作为支援力量使用。"
G["This foundry should be sufficient.  Help me manipulate the molds."]="这个铸造机应该能用。帮我操作模具吧。"
G["This foundry should be sufficient.  We will empower the metal with an electrical charge."]="这个铸造机应该能用。我们得用电荷给金属充能。"
G["This frozen land shall suffice for a start.  Come to me, mortals - and I shall give you a quick and painful death."]="这片被冻结的土地将成为我们的起点。来吧，凡人们，我会让你们痛苦地死去。"
G["This gash just doesn't seem to be healing."]="这条伤口看来似乎好不了了。"
G["This gem once allowed direct communication with Elune, herself."]="这宝石曾允许与月神本人进行直接沟通。"
G["This generator powers Mimiron's Gaze. In moments, it can turn earth to ash, stone to magma--we cannot let it reach full power!"]="这座塔为米米尔隆之眼提供能量。只要一瞬间的工夫，它就可以把大地烧成灰烬，石块熔为岩浆——绝不能让它达到最大功率！"
G["This girl has done nothing, and will not be held accountable for what she might do, or fail to do, in the future."]="这个女孩什么都没有做，而且她不应该为她在将来可能做的、或者没能做到的任何事情负任何责任。"
G["This grain has too much zing."]="这些谷物味道太杂了。"
G["This grain shipment has been nothing but trouble!"]="运粮食也能惹上麻烦事！"
G["This grain tastes too earthy and natural."]="这些谷物的土腥味儿太重，太生了。"
G["This grain tastes too light and bouncy."]="这谷物吃起来太清淡，太有弹性了。"
G["This grain tastes too old, bitter, and angry."]="这些谷物的味道不够新鲜，又苦又涩。"
G["This greyin' seadog may be the oldest of the crew, but he's also the toughest of the lot! Eh? Eh? Arms like an ogre!"]="他大概是年纪最大、最有经验的水手了吧，他的体格最强壮！嗯？嗯？和食人魔一样粗壮的手臂！"
G["This group is awful!"]="这组真差劲！"
G["This guest wears a memento of a love lost. I guess it's true what they say; every love story has its thorns, just like every night has its dawn."]="这位客人穿戴有爱人的遗物。看来人们说的没错：每一段爱情都有荆棘，正如每个夜晚都会迎来黎明。"
G["This guy's a little bigger than I thought he'd be.\n\nYou think it's from drinking beer? I know too much beer makes you fat, like Uncle Chen, but I didn't think it'd make you any taller.\n\nEither way, I don't think I can take this guy on alone."]="这家伙的块头比我想象得要大一点。\n\n你觉得这是因为啤酒喝多了？我很清楚喝太多啤酒会让你长胖，就像陈叔那样，但是我不认为喝酒能让你长高。\n\n总之，我觉得我一个人恐怕搞不定他。"
G["This hardly seems fair!!"]="这一点儿都不公平！！"
G["This has been the worst year of my life: Theramore, destroyed. And a betrayal from within the Kirin-Tor."]="这真是我这辈子最糟糕的一年：塞拉摩被摧毁了。肯瑞托又出了叛徒。"
G["This has gone too far.  How dare the Scourge attack Stormwind!  Destroy it before more come!"]="太不知好歹了。天灾军团怎么有胆来进攻暴风城！消灭它们！"
G["This has gone too far.  How dare the Scourge attack Undercity!  Destroy it before more come!"]="太不知好歹了。天灾军团怎么有胆来进攻幽暗城！消灭它们！"
G["This has got to be some type of health violation!"]="这肯定有害健康！"
G["This has to be said... the Twilight's Hammer sucks!"]="必须说……暮光之锤真该死！"
G["This has to be the biggest diamond ever!"]="这一定是全世界最大的钻石！"
G["This hatred has burned in me for years, Mahka. Your words cannot lift it from me so easily."]="憎恨已经在我的心中燃烧了许多年，玛卡。你不可能凭几句话就把它除去。"
G["This he has spoken to me...go, and KILL!"]="Ha hablado conmigo y me ha dicho: \"Ve... ¡y MATA!\""
G["This healing stuff sure does beat having to pay for medical insurance!"]="这样的治疗服务绝对对得起那昂贵的医疗保险！"
G["This heat. This stifling heat.\n\nIt makes me want to hurt things."]="这热浪。这令人窒息的热浪。\n\n令我想要靠破坏来发泄。"
G["This helmet is like magic, you want to give it a try? We have extras!"]="这帽子有魔力，你想试试吗？我们还有多余的！"
G["This here is the finest, most state of the art mode of transportation money can build. What? Deeprun Tram? Gnomes? Listen pal, If you believe that garbage then I've got a statue down in Stranglethorn to sell ya. Now, are you walking to Grom'Gol or are you gonna ride in style in this fine flying machine? Your choice."]="Este es el sistema de transporte más moderno y sofisticado que el dinero permite construir. ¿Qué? ¿El Tranvía Subterráneo? ¿Gnomos? Escucha, $gamigo:amiga;, si te crees esa basura, entonces puedo venderte una estatua que hay en Tuercespina. ¿Vas a ir andando hasta Grom'gol o vas a montar en esta sofisticada máquina voladora? Tú verás."
G["This here terrain is terrible! Spongy ground, all lumpy-like with stumps and stones. Like angry oatmeal. The mud'll practically swallow a steam tank whole.\n\nOur gear's all mired in the muck, getting thumped by the Horde!"]="这里的地形真可怕！吸饱了地下水的泥土中混杂着许多树根和石块，就像一锅煮糊的麦片粥。黏软的泥浆甚至能把一辆蒸汽坦克吸进去。\n\n我们的设备全都陷在了泥里，还有部落的混蛋不停地给我们捣乱！"
G["This here's a might embarrassing with them yaungol still infestin' the farm. You gotta understand though... I ain't no fancy $c like you. These things take time for ordinary folk like us. Well, I could just let Uyen go beat 'em 'bout their heads. But I wouldn't want to get her started if you know what I mean."]="Esta invasión de los yaungol a la granja es una auténtica vergüenza. Pero tienes que comprender... yo no soy $gun:una; gran $c como tú. Para la gente corriente, estas cosas llevan tiempo. Bueno, podría dejar que Uyen les diera una paliza. Pero no quiero provocarla, si entiendes lo que quiero decir."
G["This hero represents the Earthen Ring. They need the middle fragment."]="这位英雄是代表大地之环来的。他们需要中部碎片。"
G["This hide isn't ready to work with yet. I wish it didn't take so long to make leather. There has to be some way to cut down on all this waiting. It can't be good for my health, you know?"]="还没准备好收拾这张皮。我希望做皮革不要花太多时间。肯定有办法削减等待的时间。这对我身体不太好，你知道吗？"
G["This hozen land! No wikkets!"]="这是猢狲的领地！无毛怪不许进来！"
G["This inn was built before the savages from the north awoke. Thank the Light for that, at least!\n\nWill you be staying long?"]="这旅馆可是在北边那些野蛮人觉醒之前就建起来了。至少，感谢圣光！\n\n你在这里会呆很久吗？"
G["This insignia is from Sergeant Rantack, once my superior.  You'd never find a tougher soldier than old Rantack..."]="这枚护符来自兰塔克中士，他曾是我的长官。没有哪个士兵能比他更坚强……"
G["This instance has reset."]="副本已重置。"
G["This instance is about to reset. You will be forced from the instance shortly."]="副本即将重置。你即将被移出副本。"
G["This instance will reset in 1 minute."]="副本将在1分钟后重置。"
G["This instance will reset in 10 minutes."]="副本将在10分钟后重置。"
G["This instance will reset in 2 minutes."]="副本将在2分钟后重置。"
G["This instance will reset in 3 minutes."]="副本将在3分钟后重置。"
G["This instance will reset in 30 seconds."]="副本将在30秒后重置。"
G["This instance will reset in 5 minutes."]="副本将在5分钟后重置。"
G["This is $n's first fight ever!"]="这是$n的首战！"
G["This is $n's first fight today!"]="这是$n今天的首战！"
G["This is Camp Tunka'lo, the village ruled by my brother, but I... I don't remember you."]="这里是唐卡洛营地，我的兄弟掌管着这个村落，但是……我不记得你。"
G["This is Dajik's hunt. Let's go, slave thing."]="交给达伊克来办吧。奴隶，我们走。"
G["This is Dalin Forgewright. He fled from Lordaeron when the plague struck, taking his love with him."]="这是达林·弗治维特。当疾病开始流行的时候，他带着自己的爱人从洛丹伦逃了出来。"
G["This is Desolation Hold, $c. Here we bide our time until we are ready to strike back against the Alliance."]="欢迎来到凄凉要塞，$c。我们在此等待时机，向联盟还以颜色。"
G["This is Gregory."]="这位是格雷戈里。"
G["This is Ha-Cha, Sentinel Ku-Yao's yak."]="这是哈查，哨兵姚枯的牦牛。"
G["This is Kor'kron business! Nothing to see here."]="库卡隆办事！没什么好看的。"
G["This is Lady Sylvanas's doing?"]="这是希尔瓦娜斯女王干的？"
G["This is Lillorilen."]="这位是莉莉奥瑞伦。"
G["This is MY WAGON!\nMINE!"]="¡Este vagón es mío!\n\n¡MÍO!"
G["This is MY realm!"]="这是我的王国！"
G["This is Master Cheng.  She has mastered the art of fighting on the move."]="这位是程大师。她掌握着行间战的高超战技。"
G["This is Master Hsu.  He specializes in using all kinds of weaponry and is masterfully proficient with nearly any weapon under the sun."]="这位是许大师。他十八般兵器样样精通，普天之下几乎没有任何武器能难得倒他。"
G["This is Master Kistane, she is a master in the art of channeling the mists to assist her and her allies."]="这位是吉斯坦大师，她是引导迷雾的专家，能为自己和盟友提供帮助。"
G["This is Master Tsang.  He is a master of meditation and the ability to sense what is happening around him."]="这位是曾大师。他精通冥想，并对发生在身边的一切有着敏锐的感知力。"
G["This is Master Woo.  She specializes in defense against persistent attacks."]="这位是吴大师。她精通防御，能化解持久的攻击。"
G["This is Master Yoon.  He is practiced in using powerful, focused healing to maintain himself in battle."]="这位是尹大师。他善于使用强大专注的治疗技能，令自己在战斗中免于殒命。"
G["This is OUR Horde!"]="这是“我们”的部落！"
G["This is OUR city too, Proudmoore."]="它同样属于我们，普罗德摩尔。"
G["This is Rigger Gizelton asking for assistance escorting my caravan past Mannoroc Coven. I'm on the road east of Shadowprey village."]="里格·基泽尔顿寻求帮助，护送我的商队穿过玛诺洛克集会所。我在葬影村东面的路上。"
G["This is The Bomb to end all bombs!"]="这个炸弹能终结一切炸弹！"
G["This is a beer recipe!"]="这是一份啤酒的配方！"
G["This is a child of Beth'tilac, the Red Widow. Her spawn will seek vengeance for their slain brethren."]="它是红寡妇，贝丝缇拉克的子嗣。她的其他小崽子们一定会来给它们的兄弟报仇的。"
G["This is a dangerous game you play... take your gold for now, but know that I'm watching you."]="你在玩儿火……这是给你的钱，但请记住，我一直在监视着你。"
G["This is a dangerous line of business!\n\nMiran just left with a delivery. He should be back in a few minutes."]="这真是危险的营生！\n\n米兰刚刚去送东西了，他应该会马上回来。"
G["This is a dangerous place, $n. Be careful around here."]="这是个危险的地方，$n。要小心。"
G["This is a family farm, in case you haven't noticed yet. We Thunderfoots don't fight, don't explore... we don't even drink that much.\n\nWe do enjoy our food, however."]="不知道你发现了没有，这是个家庭农场。我们雷脚家的人不斗争、不探险……甚至不怎么喝酒。\n\n但我们很享受美食带来的快乐。"
G["This is a fate far worse than death - please, heroes!  Set their souls free!"]="这比死亡更可怕——英雄们，请解救他们的灵魂！"
G["This is a fine mess we've gotten ourselves into. We're overdue to join up with our forces in Icecrown and now we're entangled in this debacle, stuck between the Scourge and the Drakkari.\n\nI told the highlord it was a mistake to come here.\n\nSee what you can do to help out there."]="我们真是焦头烂额了。先是没能及时赶到冰冠冰川与我们的部队会合，现在又处在被天灾军团和达卡莱巨魔两面夹击的险境。\n\n我早就跟大领主说过了，来这里根本就是个错误。\n\n看看你能帮帮我们什么忙吧。"
G["This is a fine mess."]="这下麻烦大了。"
G["This is a flavor whisper."]="这是个特别的传闻。"
G["This is a flawlessly etched jade statue of An Windfur's friend Shin, eyes wide with terror."]="这个雕工精湛的青玉雕像看上去很像风裘的朋友阿信，睁大的眼睛里充满了恐惧。"
G["This is a glorious day for the draenei! Thank you for all that you have done, $n."]="这是德莱尼人的荣耀之日！谢谢你为我们所做的一切，$n。"
G["This is a good hiding spot."]="这是个不错的隐藏点。"
G["This is a great day for all who oppose the Lich King! Brave $n has taken up the ancient blade, Quel'Delar, in the name of the Silver Covenant!"]="¡Es un gran día para los que se oponen al Rey Exánime! ¡$gEl:La; valiente $n ha tomado la antigua espada, Quel'Delar, en nombre de El Pacto de Plata!"
G["This is a great day, $c!"]="真是个好日子，$c！"
G["This is a historic moment, $n. What do you think lies beyond the gates?"]="这是一个历史性的时刻，$n。你觉得在门外有什么在等着我们？"
G["This is a hostile land, and we have no reinforcements. We're going to have to improvise, champion."]="这里是敌方领地，我们又孤立无援。看我们临场发挥了，勇士。"
G["This is a little something I like to call..."]="我想把这称为……"
G["This is a lot more work than I thought it would be..."]="这比我想象中的可要困难多了……"
G["This is a lot to think about."]="有许多东西需要思考……"
G["This is a map of Darkshore.  There are paths drawn from Auberdine towards Lor'danel... and towards several other safe-havens as well."]="这是一张黑海岸的地图。上面绘有从奥伯丁通往洛达内尔的小径……还有几条路通往其他的安全藏身处。"
G["This is a mercy killing."]="这也是一种仁慈。"
G["This is a most...unfortunate turn of events."]="情势发生了……最悲惨的转变。"
G["This is a one way trip, kid, and you definitely don't want to be comin' back on the other wagon."]="Este es un viaje solo de ida, $gchico:chica;, y te aseguro que no quieres volver en el otro carro."
G["This is a place of peace. We watch, we meditate, we work on our crafts, and we are content."]="这是一个安宁的地方。我们欣赏风景，我们沉思，我们制作工艺品，我们心满意足。"
G["This is a portal to the Alterac Valley battleground."]="该传送门通往奥特兰克山谷战场。"
G["This is a portal to the Arathi Basin battleground."]="该传送门通往阿拉希盆地战场。"
G["This is a portal to the Eye of the Storm battleground."]="该传送门通往风暴之眼战场。"
G["This is a portal to the Warsong Gulch battleground."]="该传送门通往战歌峡谷战场。"
G["This is a rare opportunity, pandaren. Prove your might to the Warchief of the Horde!"]="机会难得啊，熊猫人。向部落的酋长证明你的实力吧！"
G["This is a sacred place. Strangers are unwelcome."]="这里是神圣的地方，不欢迎陌生人。"
G["This is a shiney rock, I'll put it in my bucket. Ok, I just need a few more..."]="这是块相当不错的岩石，我得把它放到桶里去。好啦，我还需要一些……"
G["This is a slap in the face! We demand answers!"]="这是对我们的蔑视！快回答我们的问题！"
G["This is a strange land. So beautiful. And yet so deadly."]="这是一片神秘的土地，如此美丽，却又如此致命。"
G["This is a very pretty cat, $n. Thanks fer givin' it to me."]="真是一只漂亮的小猫，$n。谢谢你把它送给我。"
G["This is a very unusual place.\n\nThe magic I'm channeling to try to repair the ley lines should be tearing my body apart, but I feel incredible!"]="这个地方很特别。\n\n我正在引导魔法，以修复魔网。虽然这么做会将我撕成碎片，可我还是觉得很不可思议！"
G["This is a war, right? We're supposed to be able to kill our enemies with our weapons, right?"]="这是一场战争，对不对？我们应该用我们的武器消灭敌人，不是吗？"
G["This is a waste of my time. Where's the action?"]="这是在浪费我的时间。快行动啊！"
G["This is a waste of time, mine and yours! Go see Graham Van Talen if you want to begin your instruction! He's standing to my left over there."]="我们彼此都在浪费时间！如果你想接受训练的话，就去找格拉哈姆·范·塔伦吧！他就站在右边。"
G["This is a wee bit trickier than before... Oh, bloody--incomin'!"]="嗯……它的确比之前碰见过的所有机器都诡秘复杂……啊，见鬼……敌人来了！"
G["This is absolutely barbaric!"]="这实在是太野蛮了！"
G["This is all YOUR fault, Sten!"]="这全都是你的错，斯登！"
G["This is all for you, $n. You did this. You saved all of these people and thousands more.\n\nYou have risen above the strife and tragedy of this world and in doing so, elevated all of us with you.\n\nYou have done so much - more than many could do in ten lifetimes - yet your life has just begun. If only we had a thousand heroes like you.\n\nBut listen well, $n. Your destiny lies in the Outland. I have seen it in visions, a prophecy yet untold.\n\nFind our people, $n. Find them and bring them home..."]="Todo esto es por ti, $n. Tú lo lograste. Salvaste a toda esta gente y a miles más.\n\nHas hecho mucho; más de lo que muchos no habrían hecho en diez vidas. Pero acabas de empezar. Si hubiera mil héroes como tú...\n\nPero escucha bien, $n. Tu destino está en Terrallende. Lo he visto en mis visiones; una profecía por desvelar.\n\nEncuentra a nuestra gente, $n. Encuéntralos y tráelos a casa..."
G["This is all happening sooner than I would have liked."]="这一切来得比我预想中要早。"
G["This is all my fault.  I've got to go find him, to set things right."]="这一切都是我的错。我必须找到他，弥补这些过失。"
G["This is all pretty cool, and scary, and all that stuff, but shouldn't we be getting back to Mudmug's place now?"]="好吧，这一切真的很酷，也很惊险，不过我们现在应该回泥盏那儿了吧？"
G["This is all that is left of the Blue Dragonshrine. A great battle shattered the timeways leading out of this forsaken place. You must reconstruct the fragments strewn across the ground and defeat the trapped spirit to proceed."]="这里就是碧蓝巨龙圣地的遗迹。一场大战摧毁了这片废墟通往外界的时间流。你必须修复散落在各个角落里的碎片，击败被禁锢的灵魂，才能继续前进。"
G["This is all too much to bear.\n\nI wish I had the nerve to... <sob>."]="Todo esto es insoportable.\n\nOjalá tuviera el valor para... <sollozo>."
G["This is all very interesting but what is it that you want?"]="这很有趣，但是你到底想说什么？"
G["This is all wrong. There's nothing in here about the Twilight's Hammer. What is Samuelson playing at?"]="完全不对。这儿根本没有任何与暮光之锤有关的东西。萨缪尔森在玩什么把戏？"
G["This is all your fault!"]="都是你的错！"
G["This is all your fault, you know..."]="这全是你的错……"
G["This is an Emergency Evacuation Portal."]="这是一道紧急撤离传送门。"
G["This is an atrocity."]="这真是残忍的行径。"
G["This is an exotic sample of flora, unseen in other parts of Teldrassil."]="这是一种非常奇怪的植物，你从未在泰达希尔的其它地方见过。"
G["This is an insult! An affront! They deny us participation in time-honored dwarven traditions!"]="这简直是对我们的侮辱！赤裸裸的侮辱！他们拒绝我们参与矮人历史悠久的传统节日！"
G["This is an intriguing find, $n, but I don't know what to make of it."]="$n，这真是有趣的发现，不过我对此一头雾水啊。"
G["This is an outrage!"]="这是暴政！"
G["This is an outrage! Aethas will hear about this!"]="这太过分了！艾萨斯会知道这一切的！"
G["This is an outrage! Your disobedience shall not go unpunished!"]="这是赤裸裸的侮辱！你胆敢违抗我的命令，我要惩罚你！"
G["This is an... unrecoverable... loss."]="这真是个……不可挽回的……损失。"
G["This is as close as we can get. See what you can find out!"]="最多只能走到这里了。看看你能找到什么！"
G["This is as far north as I go! Those spiders are huge!"]="我不会再向北挪一步了！那些蜘蛛好大！"
G["This is as fast as I've ever seen this team work! Keep it up, $p!"]="这可是团队工作效率最高的一次！加油，$p！"
G["This is as strong as I can make you. Fight well, my earthen friend."]="这是我能赋予你的全部力量了。全力战斗吧，我的地灵朋友。"
G["This is awful! I shouldn't be sitting here, useless, when there's so much to be done! If only my arm hadn't gotten injured up in Northrend... No use dwelling on it, though! Tahu will have me patched up and cured eventually, and we'll still help around here in the meantime.\nJust because we're not at the front doesn't mean we can't help out somehow."]="¡Esto es terrible! No debería estar aquí sentada, inútil, cuando hay tanto que hacer. Si no hubiera sufrido lesiones en el brazo en Rasganorte... ¡Pero no vale la pena lamentarse! Tahu me curará y seguiremos ayudando por aquí mientras.\n\nQue no estemos en el frente no significa que no podamos ayudar de algún modo."
G["This is bad."]="这可不太好。"
G["This is becoming tiresome."]="我开始有点无聊了。"
G["This is becoming unbearable."]="我快受不了了。"
G["This is but a brief repose..."]="这只不过是暂时的休息…"
G["This is but a taste of my power."]="尝尝我的力量吧。"
G["This is but a test of our strength. We will pass this trial, just as we have passed others!"]="这只是考验我们的力量。我们将一如既往地通过这个试炼！"
G["This is coward's work. We should be crushing the Alliance now!"]="这是懦夫的行为！我们应该去把联盟碾碎，就现在！"
G["This is crazy you idiots!"]="你们这群白痴简直疯了！"
G["This is cultist literature. The only way you're entering Orgrimmar is in chains."]="这是邪教文书，你只能戴着镣铐进奥格瑞玛了。"
G["This is cultist literature. The only way you're entering Stormwind is in chains."]="这是邪教文书。我要用锁链捆住你，再把你牵进暴风城。"
G["This is cultist propaganda. You're under arrest!"]="邪教的宣传手册。你被逮捕了！"
G["This is cultist propaganda. You're under arrest."]="这是邪教的宣传文稿。你被捕了。"
G["This is definitely more exciting than my usual intelligence gathering operations. Now hurry and take care of Garrosh, I don't want this to be my last mission for SI:7."]="这肯定会比我平时的情报收集工作刺激得多。现在，快去对付加尔鲁什吧，我可不希望这变成我在军情七处的最后一次任务。"
G["This is delicate work out here, you know?  It can't just be rushed, or something's likely to get broken.\n\nLike Fuselage's head!\n\nYou might be wondering about my bots?  I'm always working on the Mk. I, and the Mk. II gained sentience for a split-second before his brain capacitor blew out and he went insane!\n\nI decided to skip III and IV, and went straight to the Mk. V - my pride and joy!"]="这是一个细活，你知道吗？做这项工作你不能操之过急，也不能判断错误。\n\n就像弗斯拉格的脑袋一样！\n\n你可能对我的机器人感到疑惑？我一直在研究麦克斯米林I型和麦克斯米林II型的脑容爆炸前所获得的智能！\n\n我决定忽略III型和IV型，直接去研究我为之骄傲和快乐的麦克斯米林V型。"
G["This is delicious! Are there more hors d'oeuvres?"]="太美味了！还有更多的餐前点心吗？"
G["This is dire news indeed!"]="这消息太可怕了！"
G["This is disheartening. Is there anything I can do to stop this?"]="这真令人沮丧。我能做点什么来阻止这一切吗？"
G["This is disturbing. Please continue."]="这确实挺可怕的，请继续。"
G["This is easy! I'm ready for the next clue."]="这很简单！我准备好听下一条线索了。"
G["This is excellent work. Are you ready to undertake a mission on my behalf? I know of no one more qualified."]="Es un trabajo excelente. ¿Estás $glisto:lista; para aceptar una misión a mis órdenes? No conozco a nadie más $gcualificado:cualificada;."
G["This is exhausting!"]="真是让人筋疲力竭！"
G["This is extended to the spirits themselves. They are often quick to anger; it is important that you learn to listen without falling prey to their tempers."]="关于自然之灵，它们是很容易被激怒的。你们要学会在不惹怒它们的情况下去聆听，这一点非常重要。"
G["This is far enough! Meet me back at base!"]="你走过头啦！到营地来见我！"
G["This is far enough. I can make it on my own from here."]="我们已经脱离了危险。我可以自己回去的。"
G["This is fascinating... but what could it mean?!\n\nThe jade you gathered from those sprites will help us fill in the next panel, but we'll need more to finish the whole fresco.\n\nPlease help the foreman get her quarry back in operation."]="这很有趣……但能有什么意义呢？！\n\n你收集来的玉石只够我们完成下一块嵌板的，但我们还需要更多的玉石来完成整个作品。\n\n请帮助工头让她的采石场恢复运作。"
G["This is for Theramore!"]="为了塞拉摩！"
G["This is for the best."]="这样就没问题了。"
G["This is fruitless, draenei!  You and your little helper cannot wrest control of this pathetic human.  He is mine!"]="这是徒劳的，德莱尼人！你和你弱小的助手们夺不回这个悲惨人类的控制权。他是我的！"
G["This is fun!"]="这可真有趣！"
G["This is fun, $p. Way more fun than hanging out with a boring uncle."]="真好玩，$p。这比和一个无聊的大叔一起出门有趣多了。"
G["This is getting good!  It really warms the stomach!  And $n, I have to say, you're a sharp dressing $gfellow:lass;!"]="¡Está cada vez mejor! ¡Calienta el estómago! ¡Y $n, debo decir que tienes mucho estilo vistiendo!"
G["This is going south quick!"]="很快就胜负分明了！"
G["This is going to be a humbling defeat."]="一旦战败，圣光将因此蒙羞。"
G["This is going to be easier than a drinking contest with a grummle."]="这可比和一个土地精拼酒容易多了。"
G["This is going to be fascinating!"]="这一定会很迷人！"
G["This is going to be so epic!"]="这简直酷毙了！"
G["This is going to be such fun!  Don't you think, my dear?"]="¡Esto va a ser muy divertido! ¿No crees, $gquerido:querida;?"
G["This is going to be the best Brewmoon yet with $n here!"]="有了$n参加，这将会成为最完美的酿月祭！"
G["This is going to hurt a bit!"]="这会有点疼！"
G["This is going to hurt in the morning."]="早上的时候会很痛的。"
G["This is going to hurt, isn't it?"]="这会很疼吧？"
G["This is gonna be a bloodbath. A bloodbath... of flames!"]="这里将有一场屠杀。一场……烈焰的屠杀！"
G["This is gonna be fun!"]="这一定会很有趣！"
G["This is gonna cost a bundle of gold. It's not comin' out of my pocket."]="这要花费一大笔金币，当然我是不会出这笔钱的。"
G["This is gonna leave a mark!"]="看招！"
G["This is gonna leave a mark..."]="这会留下个记号……"
G["This is good news. Return to them, priest. But heed this: do not eat ANYONE."]="这是个好消息。回到他们身边吧，牧师。但是记住：谁都不许吃。"
G["This is good news; our covert operation against the gronn proceeds as planned.  And, there is someone on the outside helping us now, too."]="这是个好消息，我们反抗戈隆的秘密行动仍旧按计划顺利进行着。而且，现在我们还得到了来自外部的支持与帮助。"
G["This is good stuff!  But I think it's a little flat.  Let's round it out with a few squishy basilisk eyeballs..."]="好酒！但我觉着还不够刺激。要不我们用滑腻的蜥蜴眼来提提味道……"
G["This is good stuff!  But it's a little weak.  I think I'll add a little more garlic breath to it..."]="好酒！可惜不够劲。我觉得可以在里面多加一点大蒜……"
G["This is great news!  Your efforts have indeed saved us, $n!"]="这真是个好消息！你的努力拯救了我们，$n！"
G["This is great!"]="真是太棒了！"
G["This is great, I never get to talk to Stormwind's rogues. They're always so quiet and secretive..."]="这可太棒了，我还从没和暴风城里的潜行者交谈过。他们总是那么的安静和神秘……"
G["This is grim news, and I fear it is linked to the dealings $n had with the Embalmer."]="这是一个可怕的消息，我担心这与$n为那个老隐士做的事情有关。"
G["This is hard work.  I feel like I need a vacation.  You there, put your back into it!"]="这真是个复杂的工作，我想要休假……你，说你呢！赶紧干活！"
G["This is harder than it looks."]="比看起来要难很多。"
G["This is history in the making..."]="历史正在被创造……"
G["This is holy ground, heathen."]="这里是圣域，异教徒。"
G["This is horrible!"]="真是太可怕了！"
G["This is horse poop!"]="尝尝马粪的滋味！"
G["This is how we live on, for all eternity."]="这便是我们的生存之道，亘古不变。"
G["This is humiliating."]="这太耻辱了。"
G["This is impossible!"]="这不可能！"
G["This is incredible! You're covered in potent, virulent, fantastic blight! Please, allow me to harvest these pristine samples. I will remove any lingering infection from your allies as well, and reward you all for your bravery and self-sacrifice in the name of medicine! Let me know if you are ready to proceed.\n[Before proceeding, make sure that ALL raid members are nearby in order for them to receive credit for your accomplishment.]"]="¡Esto es increíble! ¡Estás $gcubierto:cubierta; de un añublo potente, virulento y fantástico! Permíteme recolectar estas muestras inmaculadas. ¡También eliminaré cualquier infección restante de tus aliados y te recompensaré por tu valor y sacrificio en el nombre de la medicina! Avísame si estás $gpreparado:preparada; para continuar.\n\n[Antes de continuar, asegúrate de que TODOS los miembros de la banda están cerca para poder recibir el crédito de tu logro.]"
G["This is insufferable! I represent a nexus-prince, I am not to be made to wait! Goramosh should be waiting on me!"]="无理！我是节点亲王的代表，古拉莫什居然将我晾在一旁！只有他等我的份儿！"
G["This is it!  Brace yourself!"]="要进去了！做好准备！"
G["This is it!  The perfect bio-fuel!  Good work, $n!"]="就是它了！完美的生物燃料！干得好，$n！"
G["This is it! Stay close and let me do the talking. I'm an expert."]="就是这里！跟紧我，让我来谈判。我是这方面的专家。"
G["This is it! The entrance to Neptulon's realm..."]="就是这儿！进入耐普图隆王国的入口……"
G["This is it! Their final assault! FOR LION'S LANDING!"]="打得好！这是他们最后一波攻势！为了雄师港！"
G["This is it! They're making their final assault. There's no place to run. We hold Thundermar or die with hammer in hand.\n\nFor the Wildhammer!!"]="该来的还是来了！他们正在发起最后的猛攻。我们已无路可退。唯有坚守桑德玛尔或手握战锤而死。\n\n为了蛮锤部族！！"
G["This is it! This is really it -- the Book of the Raven!"]="这就是了！这就是真正的……乌鸦之书！"
G["This is it! You've found Aviana's Egg! Keep it safe while I go get help."]="就是它！我们找到艾维娜的卵了！你保护它，我去找帮手。"
G["This is it, $c! The revolution has come."]="没错，$c！革命开始了！"
G["This is it, $n!  This is where we make our stand!"]="就是这样，$n！这里就是我们的阵地！"
G["This is it, $n. My stuff should be in that room. Cover me, I'm going in!"]="没错，$n，我的东西都在那个房间里。保护我，我准备冲进去了！"
G["This is it, $n. The start of the end of the world. And you're here to see it off..."]="你瞧，$n。世界末日很快就会降临。而你，将成为这噩梦的终结者……"
G["This is it, $n. We charge on your orders! Just say the word and my men and I will engage!"]="没问题，$n。我们会听你的命令冲锋陷阵！只要你一句话，我和我的手下就会发动进攻！"
G["This is it, I just know it..."]="我就知道会这样……"
G["This is it, Impsy. I can feel it! This is the big one!"]="这就是啦。我能感觉到！这可真是个大家伙！"
G["This is it. I can sense that this was once the site of great tragedy; mortal suffering still echoes through it. No doubt this is what the horrors beyond have seized onto.\n\nTo fully seal this intrusion into our world, I must first fully open it. I will need your strength to hold back whatever may attempt to come through.\n\nAre you prepared?"]="就是这里。我能感觉到这就是发生那场大悲剧的地方。痛苦的嚎叫仿佛仍然在这里回荡。毫无疑问，这就是那些异界的恐怖曾经肆虐横行的地方。\n\n为了能彻底将那些异界怪物入侵这个世界的道路封死，我必须先将它完全打开。那时，我需要你的力量来挡住可能从其中出来的一切东西。\n\n你准备好了吗？"
G["This is just a warning, wench.  You strike one of us again and we'll kill you in your sleep."]="我警告你，如果你继续殴打我们，我们会趁你睡觉的时候杀死你。"
G["This is just horrible.\n\nI care not for our own discomforts here, but we must do something to ease the pain of the dead in the Bone Wastes!"]="这太糟了。\n\n我并不计较我们在这里有多不舒服，但我们必须做点什么，为那些白骨荒野的亡者减轻痛苦。"
G["This is just lovely, thank you!"]="这真是太可爱了，谢谢你！"
G["This is just too easy..."]="这太容易了……"
G["This is just what I needed."]="这正是我想要的。"
G["This is kind of cool. A day in the life of a... a silk-getting guy."]="这可真酷。一个……一个取丝小子生命中的一天。"
G["This is known; and there are temples to mark these most sacred of places."]="人们为纪念这些圣地而建造了寺院。"
G["This is laughable. You know what it's like trying to do business with gnomes."]="这太可笑了。你知道和侏儒做生意是什么感觉。"
G["This is looking bleak for me."]="这可真惨啊。"
G["This is madness!"]="你疯了！"
G["This is madness! Cease this foolish battle!"]="你们疯了吗？停止这愚蠢的战斗！"
G["This is madness! I've had enough! ENOUGH!"]="太疯狂了！我受够了！受够了！"
G["This is magnificent!  I've never seen craftsmanship so fine."]="这真是太精美了！我从未见过如此精良的工艺。"
G["This is marbles and conkers!"]="乖乖隆地咚！"
G["This is merely part of what Silvermoon once was. Much of the city was lost after Arthas swept through our lands."]="这里只不过是曾经的银月城的一小部分。城市的大部分都在阿尔萨斯横扫我们土地的时候被破坏了。"
G["This is more than I expected, $c. The Sunreaver Onslaught thanks you."]="这些小葱的品质超出了我的预期，$c。夺日者先锋军感谢你的帮助。"
G["This is most strange. Shado-Pan are our best customers. We sell them supplies, and they keep us safe.\n\nWhy are they turning us away? This I do not understand."]="太奇怪了。影踪派是我们最好的客户。我们将物资出售给他们，他们则保证我们的安全。\n\n现在为什么要对我们不理不睬？我无法理解。"
G["This is most unfortunate."]="这真是太不幸了。"
G["This is much more relaxing than being on the speedbarge."]="这里可比赛艇平台上休闲多了。"
G["This is my favorite game, because of the turtle."]="这是我最喜欢的游戏，因为我喜欢那只海龟。"
G["This is my gift to you: a gift, and a trial."]="这是我的礼物：一份馈赠，一场试炼。"
G["This is my home too!"]="这里也是我的家！"
G["This is my question to you: What is the SOUL of the Horde?"]="所以我想问你：部落的灵魂是什么？"
G["This is my stop!"]="我在这里下吧！"
G["This is my test gossip."]="这都是我说的闲话。"
G["This is no business of yours, $p! I will allow you to leave."]="这不关你的事，$p！我会允许你离开。"
G["This is no coincidence! Azeroth herself has cast her lot with the Horde!"]="这绝不是巧合！艾泽拉斯世界正眷顾着部落！"
G["This is no good - too dangerous. We'll try again later!"]="糟糕——好险呐。我们稍后再试一次！"
G["This is no good, Scruffy. Stay here and guard the house, I need to go find a soldier."]="事情不妙，脏脏。你乖乖地待在家里，我出去找士兵谈谈。"
G["This is no place for a bright, young $g man : lady; such as yourself.\n\nPerhaps you would like for me to escort you to safety, hmm?"]="像你这种阳光年轻的$g男士: 女士;可不该待在这里。\n\n或许你愿意让我护送你去安全的地方，嗯？"
G["This is no place for outsiders, stranger. Go back to Stormwind."]="这里没有地方留给外人。回暴风城去吧，陌生人。"
G["This is no small island, $n. It's a landmass that would likely rival Northrend!\n\nHow it has gone undiscovered is still a mystery."]="这可不是什么小岛，$n。这是一片足以媲美诺森德的大陆！\n\n至于它为什么一直没有被发现，现在我们还不得而知。"
G["This is no time for talk! If those boats are destroyed, then the Alliance will keep fighting the Scourge in their home instead of the Lich King's! So make yourself useful and kill some undead!"]="没时间闲聊了！如果船只被摧毁，联盟就只能在自己的家园与天灾军团作战，还怎么攻陷巫妖王的老巢！快去帮忙吧，杀掉那些亡灵！"
G["This is no vacation - our hearts, our souls, the final escape from the addictions that bind us lie here on Quel'Danas."]="这里不是度假胜地——我们的生命，我们的灵魂，最终能够摆脱魔瘾的希望，都让我们和奎尔丹纳斯紧紧联系在一起。"
G["This is not a beast you will wish to fight alone, $n. Gather allies. I will open the beast's cage when you believe that you are ready."]="Contra esa bestia no se lucha solo, $n. Busca aliados. Abriré la jaula de la bestia cuando creas que estás $glisto:lista;."
G["This is not a construct break. Get back to work."]="这不是结构性的损坏。回去干活儿。"
G["This is not a good start to relations between my people and your Horde."]="就我们和部落的关系而言，这显然不是一个良好的开端。"
G["This is not going well..."]="情况有些不妙……"
G["This is not good, $n.  We have to find a way to hold on to Nahom."]="这样不行，$n。我们必须想办法守住纳奥姆。"
G["This is not how I was supposed to die!"]="我不想就这么死掉啊！"
G["This is not how orcs fight! My duty to the Warchief wars with my personal honor. I hold no faith in your Light, but as you seem an advisor, I would hear your words."]="这就不是兽人的作战方式！酋长的命令与个人的荣耀令我左右为难。我不信仰圣光，但是你看起来像是个不错的顾问，我想听听你的建议。"
G["This is not in my contract! Die, $r!"]="这不是我的合同！死吧，$r！"
G["This is not my doing, Rommath. There is no treachery here."]="这并不是我做的，罗曼斯。我没有背叛任何人。"
G["This is not my fight, $p."]="这不是我的战斗，$p。"
G["This is not nearly over..."]="还没完呢……"
G["This is not our final rest."]="最终的胜利还没有到来。"
G["This is not over!"]="还没完！"
G["This is not over..."]="并没结束……"
G["This is not right - this is not how it was supposed to end!"]="这样不对——不应该，不应该就这样结束的。"
G["This is not the end... death only... strengthens..."]="事情远没有结束……死亡……会令我……更加强大……"
G["This is not the last we have seen of Feng..."]="这不会是我们最后一次看见魔封……"
G["This is not the place to discuss such matters. Join me in the chambers beneath the Farstrider Square.\n\nOh, and come armed. I believe we will have need of your skills."]="这里不是讨论这种事的地方。请到远行者广场下的大厅来找我。\n\n哦，记得带上武器。我想我们会用到你的力量。"
G["This is not the place to explain. In short, your own doubts have been made manifest, as a consequence of your actions."]="这儿不是作详细解释的地方。简单说吧，由于你的所作所为，源自你自身的疑惑现形了。"
G["This is not what he was expecting at all."]="这根本不是他想要的。"
G["This is not what was promised!"]="事情不该是这个样子的！"
G["This is not your battle, dwarf. Back down or we will be forced to destroy your ship."]="这不是你的战斗，矮人。回去，否则我们就只能摧毁你们。"
G["This is not your fight, stranger. Protect yourself from the attacks of the Crimson Elite. I shall battle the Grand Inquisitor."]="Esta no es tu lucha, $gforastero:forastera;. Protégete de los ataques de la Élite carmesí. Yo lucharé con el Gran inquisidor."
G["This is not your mule."]="这不是你的骡子。"
G["This is nothing at all like the Shimmering Flats."]="这一点都不像闪光平原。"
G["This is okay; but not really what I wanted, shouldn't the chef know what I want?"]="这面是不错，可我点的不是这个，厨师都不知道我点的是什么面吗？"
G["This is one of our less productive colossal disasters."]="我们又制造了一场高投入低产出的大型灾难。"
G["This is only what you once asked me to do if it came to this, Kanrethad. You brought this on yourself."]="我只是按照你之前的要求罢了，坎雷萨德。事情发展到这一步都是你自找的。"
G["This is our chance boys!  Push!"]="机会来了，兄弟们！推进！"
G["This is our chance!  Run for it!"]="这是我们唯一的机会！跑吧！"
G["This is our final stand. What happens here will echo through the ages. Regardless of outcome, they will know that we fought with honor. That we fought for the freedom and safety of our people!"]="这是我们最后的阵地。今天的一切都将千古流传。无论是生是死，我们都是为了荣誉而战。我们都是为了自由和人民而战！"
G["This is our final stand. What happens here will echo through the ages. Regardless of outcome, they will know that we fought with honor. That we fought for the freedom and safety of our people.\n\nRemember, hero, fear is your greatest enemy in these befouled halls. Steel your heart and your soul will shine brighter than a thousand suns. The enemy will falter at the sight of you. They will fall as the light of righteousness envelops them!"]="Esta es nuestra batalla final. El paso del tiempo se hará eco de lo que aquí ocurra. Sin importar el resultado, sabrán que luchamos con honor. ¡Que luchamos por la libertad y la seguridad de nuestro pueblo!\n\nRecuerda, $ghéroe:heroína;, el miedo es el mayor enemigo en estas cámaras infectas. Fortalece tu corazón y tu alma brillará más que mil soles. El enemigo vacilará al verte. ¡Caerán en cuanto la luz de la rectitud los envuelva!"
G["This is our home too! You can't do this!"]="这里也是我们的家！你不能这样做！"
G["This is our home!"]="这里是我们的家园！"
G["This is our land -- they're not going to take it away without a fight!"]="这是我们的土地——如果不打败我们，就别想夺走它！"
G["This is our land now!"]="现在这是我们的土地！"
G["This is our land. Our home.\n\nI will not see it fall to the sha."]="这是我们的土地，我们的家园。\n\n我绝不会眼睁睁看着它落入煞魔手中。"
G["This is pretty nice gift, $n! Thanks a lot."]="这是相当不错的礼物，$n！非常感谢。"
G["This is quickly becoming humiliating... and drafty.  Hopefully my legplates shall deal the deathblow."]="这副样子可不好看……不过很凉快。希望我的腿甲能对敌人造成致命一击。"
G["This is quite an adventure!"]="这真是一段有趣的旅程！"
G["This is quite an operation here, wouldn't you say?"]="这里的效率真高，你说呢？"
G["This is really hard!"]="这真是太难了！"
G["This is reckless, even for Ji. I need to stop him. Are you coming?"]="就算是季，这么做也太鲁莽了。我必须阻止他。你要一起去吗？"
G["This is ridiculous!  I don't have to put up with this!"]="这太荒谬了！我可不会容忍这个！"
G["This is ridiculous..."]="太荒唐了…"
G["This is sacred ground!"]="这里是圣地！"
G["This is so delicious!"]="太好吃了！"
G["This is so easy it would be boring -- if it weren't so much fun."]="要不是本身很有意思的话，这么轻松的战斗就会很无聊。"
G["This is some specialized equipment! Don't be handling it carelessly, and of course don't try and operate the thing if you've had too much of that volatile rum I hear you like so much...\n\nSpeaking of which... you don't happen to have any of that nasty stuff, do you?"]="这是一些特殊装备！要小心对待，要是你喝了太多那种烈性酒，可别试着操纵这些装备，我听说你很喜欢饮酒的……\n\n说到酒……你没有带吧，嗯？"
G["This is terrible! How will we ever defeat the Zandalari?"]="这太可怕了！我们怎样才能打败赞达拉？"
G["This is terrible, Durak! Hellscream is conviced there's a demon behind our work here! What can we do?!"]="这太可怕了，杜莱克！地狱咆哮坚信在我们这里潜藏着一个恶魔！我们该怎么办？！"
G["This is terrible..... my arms grow tired from beating on you lazy peons!"]="这太糟糕了……抽这些懒骨头把我的胳膊都抽酸了！"
G["This is the Alterac Valley battlefield.  Both sides are still fighting."]="这是奥特兰克山谷战场。双方还在交战。"
G["This is the Alterac Valley battlefield.  Currently both sides are at odds."]="这是奥特兰克山谷战场。目前双方势均力敌。"
G["This is the Song of Liu Lang, the first pandaren explorer."]="这是第一位熊猫人探险者——刘浪之歌。"
G["This is the Temple of Earth.  It's the most important structure in Deepholm."]="这是大地神殿。它是深岩之洲最重要的建筑物。"
G["This is the Thunder King Raid!"]="¡Esta es la banda del Rey del Trueno!"
G["This is the Trade Prince's party, sweetie. Invite only!"]="这是贸易大王的聚会，甜心。只有受邀请的人才能参加！"
G["This is the Training Ground, where most of your training will take place.  Come, I will introduce you to the masters who will be teaching you."]="这里是训练场，你大部分训练都将在这里进行。来吧，让我为你引荐几位大师，他们将对你传授本领。"
G["This is the Wanderer's Festival, $n! Where pandaren with the spirit of adventure gather to celebrate the first explorer to venture beyond the mists.\n\nIt's a time of contemplation and song. Thank you for joining us!"]="这就是云游节，$n！具有冒险精神的熊猫人在这里聚集一堂，庆祝第一位冒险穿越迷雾的探险家。\n\n这是沉思和歌颂的时刻。感谢你的加入！"
G["This is the answer to the first question of the first chain."]="这是第一系列第一个问题的答案。"
G["This is the beginning AND the end, mortals. None may enter the master's sanctum!"]="这就是你们的开始与终结之地，凡人们。休想进入主人的密室！"
G["This is the best I've felt in years!"]="这是我近几年玩过的最好的游戏！"
G["This is the best!"]="这是最好的！"
G["This is the biggest sword ever!"]="这是我见过的最大的剑！"
G["This is the brazier, $n. Put it out. Vorsha is a beast, worthy of praise from no one!"]="这是火盆，$n。熄灭它。沃尔沙是一头野兽，不值得任何人赞扬！"
G["This is the chamber we're looking for."]="这就是我们要找的地方。"
G["This is the closest any outsider has come to the Engine of Nalak'sha."]="从没有任何外来者与纳拉克煞引擎如此接近。"
G["This is the difference between me and you, Vol'jin. I won't let MY people starve to death in the desert. I will stop at nothing - NOTHING - to ensure a proud and glorious future for the orcs and anyone with the courage to stand with us. Wait here."]="这就是我们之间的差别，沃金。我可不会让我的人民在沙漠中饿死。为了让兽人和任何勇于站在我们一边的人拥有辉煌的未来，我会不惜一切——一切！在这儿等着。"
G["This is the end of the line, no friend of mine!"]="这是底线，你不再是我的朋友啦！"
G["This is the end of the line, pal!"]="你在自取灭亡，伙计！"
G["This is the end!"]="一切都结束了！"
G["This is the end."]="这就是一切的结束。"
G["This is the end... for you, and for the world."]="这就是终结……对于你的，对于这个世界的。"
G["This is the finish line. After you have flown through all 10 checkpoints, fly under the finish line to lock in your place."]="这就是终点线。在你飞过所有10个检查点之后，从下方穿过终点线，以锁定排名。"
G["This is the first time I've ever seen anything like it."]="这是我第一次看到像那样的东西。"
G["This is the gateway that Kael's armies used to retreat to the Sunwell.  Some of his lapdogs remain here; the Legion has rewarded them in a most... unusual way."]="凯尔萨斯的军队就是从这里撤退到太阳之井的。他的一些走狗仍然残留在这里，燃烧军团以最不平常的方式奖赏着他们……"
G["This is the hallowed birthplace of Chi-Ji, the Red Crane, the Southern Celestial. Followers and acolytes of Chi-Ji gather in this place to train their bodies, to hone their minds, to duel one another, and to better themselves in the eyes of the Red Crane.\n\nYou are welcome to join us in our training, $c. Bring with you a stout heart and a stout staff."]="这里便是朱鹤的神圣发源地，他叫赤精，是南部的天神。赤精的追随者和侍僧聚集在此处锻炼身体，磨练心神。他们彼此间互相切磋，以期让朱鹤见证他们的成长。\n\n欢迎你加入我们的训练行列，$c。带着你那烈酒般的雄心和烈酒般的功夫。"
G["This is the hour of our greatest triumph!"]="这是我们获得伟大胜利的一刻！"
G["This is the kind of spirit I expected to see when we joined the Horde!"]="这才是部落人该有的精神！"
G["This is the last of them.  Don't get sloppy!"]="这是他们最后的挣扎了。不要大意。"
G["This is the last one that I need for the set of Nesingwary steak knives!"]="就差一只，我就能弄齐一套奈辛瓦里牛排刀啦！"
G["This is the last time I get caught! I promise! Bye!"]="这是我最后一次被抓住！我保证！再见！"
G["This is the last time that I buy second-hand equipment from an ethereal!"]="这是我最后一次从虚灵那里买二手装备！"
G["This is the longest day of my life."]="这是我生命中最漫长的一天。"
G["This is the might of Harthak!"]="见识哈飒克的力量吧！"
G["This is the moment of destiny! On the other side, a new beginning awaits. A new enemy to slaughter. You can feel it, can you not? The bloodlust rising? Follow Blackhand! Listen to his orders and you will rule this new world as is your right! It is your world on the other side of the portal. Take it!"]="这是个命运的时刻！在另一边，一个新的开始在等待着，一群的敌人在等待着我们去消灭。你们有没有感觉到这一切？有没有感受到嗜血的复苏？跟随着黑手酋长吧！听从他的命令，你们将会统治这个新世界！在传送门的另一边，是你们的世界！夺取它！"
G["This is the moment we've all been waiting for! The Warmaul champion is about to make his first showing at the Ring of Blood in weeks! Will $n go down in defeat as easily as the champion's other opponents? We shall see..."]="这是我们最为期待的时刻！战槌勇士要开始他本周在鲜血竞技场的第一场表演了！$n会不会像这位勇士的其他对手那样被轻松打败呢？我们拭目以待……"
G["This is the most bountiful land in all of Pandaria! A smart man could grow rich here!"]="这是整个潘达利亚最美丽的地方！聪明人在这里可以赚得盆满钵满！"
G["This is the most moronic... half-assed... ridiculous plan you've ever come up with, Budd!"]="这是你所想出的最低能……最愚蠢……最可笑的计划，巴德！"
G["This is the most pathetic bunch of peons I've ever seen! Where's my booterang?"]="从来没见过这么差劲的苦工！我的训诫靴哪儿去了？"
G["This is the new beginning. Rejoice in your coming doom."]="这是新的开始。为你们的末日而欣喜吧。"
G["This is the old Imperial Road. They say the mogu empire used to bring their prisoners here for torture."]="这是古老的帝王之路。据说魔古帝国曾经把他们的囚徒带到这里受刑。"
G["This is the one. The ancient will be ours."]="就是它了。远古之神一定会站在我们这边。"
G["This is the only button I haven't pushed yet. Let's give it a try!"]="这有这个按钮我还没按过了，让我们按下去试试吧！"
G["This is the only way Harry will even talk to me! I have to keep this stupid mask on all the time..."]="只有这样，哈瑞才会和我讲话！我必须一直戴着这个愚蠢的面具……"
G["This is the part I enjoy most..."]="这是我最喜欢的部分……"
G["This is the place, $r: The Cauldron! Mark it on a map or do something so that you don't forget. If anything ever happened to me, my team would be stuck in that mine forever."]="Aquí es, $r: ¡La Caldera! Márcalo en un mapa o haz algo para no olvidarlo. Si me ocurriera algo, mi equipo quedaría atrapado para siempre en esa mina."
G["This is the place. Let's light it."]="就是这个地方。让我们点亮它。"
G["This is the place. Samuelson's files should be on the third floor, all the way up the spiral staircase."]="就是这里了。萨缪尔森的文件应该在三楼，沿着旋转楼梯一路上去就能找到。"
G["This is the price you pay!"]="这就是你付出的代价！"
G["This is the quality of assassin sent to kill me? Laughable."]="这就是被派来杀我的刺客？真可笑。"
G["This is the ring where the champions practice fighting each other. It's my job to summon the knights to their practice battles."]="这座竞技场专供冠军们互相切磋之用。我负责召唤骑兵来参加战斗练习。"
G["This is the ship that took down Deathwing. You think some raggedy little Horde outpost stands a chance against the pride of the Alliance fleet? NO!"]="这艘船曾经击败过死亡之翼。你们觉得那又小又破的部落前哨能跟联盟舰队的骄傲抗衡吗？不可能！"
G["This is the tale of A Little Patience!\n\nIt was here that the king of men, Varian Wrynn, counseled patience to Tyrande Whisperwind, high priestess of the night elf's moon goddess and leader of their people.\n\nKing Varian's plan -- and the work of three bold adventurers! -- saw to an Alliance victory at the temple of the Red Crane, despite being vastly outnumbered by Commander Scargash's Horde forces."]="这个故事叫做“王者的耐心”！\n\n正是在这里，人类国王瓦里安·乌瑞恩建议暗夜精灵的首领、月亮女神的高阶女祭司泰兰德·语风保持耐心。\n\n凭借瓦里安国王的运筹帷幄，以及三位勇敢冒险者的努力，寡不敌众的联盟军队竟在朱鹤寺击败了由指挥官斯卡戈什统领的部落大军，取得了大捷。"
G["This is the tale of the Dagger in the Dark!\n\nIt was here that three bold adventurers saved Vol'jin, leader of the Horde's Darkspear trolls, from certain assassination."]="这就是“黑暗中的匕首”的故事！\n\n正是在这里，三位勇敢的冒险者阻止了一场精心策划的暗杀，救了部落的暗矛巨魔首领沃金一命。"
G["This is the tale of the Hungry Crocolisk."]="这是一个关于《饥饿的鳄鱼》的故事。"
G["This is the technique of a Blade Lord."]="这就是刀锋领主的绝技。"
G["This is the test put before you this day. Return to us only once The Iron Watcher is dead, and be revered as a warrior of the frostborn."]="接受今天的试炼吧。杀死钢铁观察者，再回来见我们，然后你就能成为倍受尊敬的霜脉战士了。"
G["This is the tower of Karazhan and residence of my master, Medivh. As a humble doorman, there is little else I can explain to you."]="这里是卡拉赞之塔，我的主人麦迪文的住所。身为一个卑微的看门人，我没有其它的东西可以向你解释。"
G["This is the truth of it! Fighting leads to killing, and killing leads to warring. And that was nearly the end of all our customers!\n\nNow, when men get to fighting, it happens here. And it finishes here! For maximum viewing potential!"]="这就是真相！战斗导致杀戮，杀戮导致战争。而这几乎就是我们全部客户的结局！\n\n现在，当人们要进行战斗的时候，它就发生在这里，也在这里结束！并发挥出最大的观赏潜力！"
G["This is the very first thing I say to the player.  Huzzah!"]="这是我要告诉玩家最重要的事。Huzzah！"
G["This is the worst contraption anyone ever devised!"]="这简直是有史以来最糟糕的发明！"
G["This is the wrong way. Arconus is at the other end of the mine. You're not chickening out, are you, fleshling? I won't follow a coward."]="不是这条路。阿克努斯在矿洞的另一段。你不是想逃跑吧，伙计？我是不会跟着一个懦夫的。"
G["This is their destiny...."]="这就是他们的命运……"
G["This is their natural breeding ground. We must tread carefully."]="这里是它们天然的繁殖地，我们可得小心点儿。"
G["This is too big, though.  If the naga aren't stopped, our expedition won't even matter.  Word must be sent back to the Arch Druids of the Circle."]="这件事情实在太重大了。如果远征队不能遏制纳迦的嚣张气焰，那我们的存在又有何意义？必须把这个消息传达给议会的大德鲁伊们。"
G["This is too easy!"]="太轻松了！"
G["This is too easy."]="这太容易了。"
G["This is truly grave. We must find the true cause of this illness, for the sake of the land."]="情势的确十分严峻。我们必须找到这种疾病的真正诱因——为了这片土地。"
G["This is undoubtedly Godfrey's fault."]="毫无疑问，这是高弗雷的错。"
G["This is unforseen.  The being who enchanted this is known to me..."]="这怎么可能……我对施展这个魔法的家伙太了解了……"
G["This is unfortunate."]="这可真遗憾。"
G["This is usually a calm stop. Now look at it. Where did all of these yaungol come from?"]="这里一向风平浪静。可你看看现在。这些野牛人是从哪儿来的？"
G["This is war, Dame Auriferous, and in any war lives will be lost! The only areas that we need to secure are the two ziggurats. We will turtle in and take the Tower of the Damned and its master by brute force. Then you will have your Quel'Thalas."]="奥莉菲洛丝夫人，这是战争，哪场战争不死人的！我们必须确保鲜血通灵塔和鬼嚎通灵塔的安全。占领诅咒之塔，让敌人尝尝我们的厉害。这样你就能成功夺回奎尔萨拉斯了。"
G["This is welcome news indeed. I shall pass along your gratitude to our commanders back on Azeroth."]="这是个好消息。我会把你的感激转达给我们在艾泽拉斯的司令官。"
G["This is what I have gathered from the information that you collected from the survey.\n\nThere are two primary forge camps: Forge Camp: Hate, directly west of where we stand and Forge Camp: Fear, directly southwest. Each camp has a Legion transporter, one forge, and several spell warding towers. Additionally, the camps are guarded by wrathguards manning fel cannons. Lastly, each camp has a pit lord overseer.\n\nRight then, this should be no problem at all...\n\n<Altruis laughs.>"]="这是我从你的调查中得到的情报。\n\n那里有着两座主要的铸魔营地——仇恨和畏惧。铸魔营地：仇恨在我们的西边，而西南边是铸魔营地：畏惧。每座营地中都有一个军团传送点，一座熔炉，还有几座法术结界塔。每座营地都配备了由愤怒卫士控制的邪能火炮。最后，每座营地都还有一个深渊领主监督着。\n\n就这样，这应该一点也问题没有……\n\n<奥图里斯大笑起来。>"
G["This is what happen when you get lazy."]="好吃懒做的人就是这个下场。"
G["This is what happens when southerners come to our lands."]="那些南方人来到这里后，才发生了这样的事。"
G["This is what the mantid have taught us."]="这就是螳螂妖教会我们的东西。"
G["This is where I get off, suckers!"]="这是我出发的地方，傻子！"
G["This is where it matters, hero. You may signal to me when you are ready to press the attack. Oh, and, do try to keep Lady Sylvanas in line, would you?"]="就是这里了，英雄。当你们做好进攻准备后，就给我发信号吧。噢，还有，别让希尔瓦娜斯女王乱来，好吗？"
G["This is where my agents tracked the Zandalari."]="我的密探追踪赞达拉到了这里。"
G["This is where she stood, heroes, and this is where she fell. The time-lost echo of Sylvanas Windrunner will reverberate through the rotting limbs of the Dragonshrine for all eternity."]="英雄们，这是她曾经的战斗之地，也是她的陨落之地。希尔瓦娜斯·风行者迷失在时空中的投影将永远在巨龙圣地的残骸上徘徊。"
G["This is where the cultists' orders are coming from.  Their leader is bound to show up soon.\n\nLet's not miss this opportunity."]="教徒接到的指令都来自于他们的首领。这家伙也许很快就会出现。\n\n这是个好机会。"
G["This is where things get interesting.  My plan is to follow the mountail wall, keeping it to our left.  That way, we won't get lost in the jungle and we'll cut down on the hostiles.  You ready?"]="事情变得有趣起来。我的计划是沿着左侧的山前进。这样我们就不会在丛林中迷路，还能避开敌人。你准备好了吗？"
G["This is where we gather the surivors to prepare them for decontamination. From there, it's just a short trip to the surface!"]="我们就是在这儿集合幸存者，准备对他们进行净化。距离地表没多远了！"
G["This is where we make our stand!"]="我们将坚守这里！"
G["This is where we play a movie of you turning into a worgen!  We also flash-forward to the present!"]="我们在此为你演示你变身成为狼人的影像！我们同时还将镜头快速前移到当前！"
G["This is where you'd expect something to go wrong on a beautiful trip like this."]="在这样美好的旅程中，出现一些失误也是难免的事。"
G["This is why we call you lesser beings!"]="这就是你们被称为低等生物的原因！"
G["This is wonderful!"]="这太神奇了！"
G["This is worse than I suspected."]="这比我想的还要糟糕。"
G["This is wrong. It is not yet time to swarm."]="这是不对的。还没到发起群袭的时候。"
G["This is your fault!"]="都是你的错！"
G["This is your first trip up Neverest? It's mine too!"]="这是你第一次来不息山？我也一样！"
G["This is your idea of doing the right thing???"]="你认为这就是正确的选择？？？"
G["This is your moment, Shado-Pan!  This is everything that you've trained for!"]="该你们上场了，影踪派的勇士们！养兵千日，用兵一时！"
G["This is your standard fireball."]="这是你所学习的标准火球术。"
G["This is your stop, pal. Safe landing!"]="我们到啦。安全着陆！"
G["This is..."]="这是……"
G["This is... Silvermoon? My head... Next time Bloodvalor needs a volunteer, I'll point him in a different direction. Paragon of Blood Knight virtue, indeed!"]="这是……银月城？我的头……下次布拉德瓦罗要找志愿者的话，我会给他介绍别人的。真正的血骑士的楷模！"
G["This is... remarkable, $n! These notes provide invaluable knowledge to our farmers. We are truly in Old Man Thistle's debt for keeping such records, and in your debt for recovering them. Thank you!"]="这真是……太不同寻常了，$n！这些备注为我们的农民提供了宝贵的知识。我们衷心感谢老农阿蓟保存了这些记录，我们也感谢你发现了这些记录。谢谢你！"
G["This is... where I belong."]="这里……是我的归宿。"
G["This is... worse... than death..."]="这……比死亡……更可怕……"
G["This island holds many secrets that have yet to be uncovered."]="这座岛上藏着许多未解之谜。"
G["This island is equal parts fascinating and terrifying."]="这座岛真是既迷人又可怕。"
G["This island is home to a very powerful magic. If we can harness it, no one will be able to stand in our way."]="这座岛屿蕴藏着极其强大的魔力。如果我们能驾驭它，就必将所向无敌。"
G["This island will make a perfect coastal stronghold. Rokla! When the peons arrive, clear these trees and begin construction of the docks."]="这个岛很适合充当海防要塞。罗克拉！等劳工一到，就把这些树砍了，开始建造码头。"
G["This isle can be strange, can it not? Is there something I can do for you?"]="这座岛真奇怪，不是吗？有什么我能帮你的吗？"
G["This isn't Silvermoon City! Where are we? Oh, I was confused there for a moment."]="这不是银月城！我们在哪里？哦，我有点头昏眼花的。"
G["This isn't a field trip, maggot!  You're in the Outland now!  Shape up or take a stroll back through the portal."]="这不是野营，蠢货！你在外域！要么打起精神来，要么从黑暗之门滚回去。"
G["This isn't a game you toy with youngling! Go, speak with Snarl outside. He may be a serpent in my lair but he does know his way around an anvil."]="这可不是一个年轻人玩的游戏！去外面找斯纳尔谈谈。他看上去或许有些阴险，但是他确实是使铁砧的好手。"
G["This isn't a weapon! It's just a book!"]="这又不是武器！这只是一本书！"
G["This isn't easy."]="这可不容易。"
G["This isn't fair!  My dearest Sully!  Come back to me!  No, $n!  Why did you bring me such news!"]="这不公平！我最亲爱的苏利！回到我的身边吧！不，$n！为什么你带给我这样的消息！"
G["This isn't footbomb, kids. This is the real deal!"]="这可不是玩足球炸弹，孩子们。这是真正的交易！"
G["This isn't getting any easier. Stratholme is burning. We must brave the Scourge and the flames to reach Mal'Ganis. Prepare yourselves."]="局势严峻。斯坦索姆正在燃烧。我们必须穿越着火带，击杀沿途的天灾军团，设法抵达玛尔加尼斯所在的十字军广场。做好准备吧。"
G["This isn't going to end well."]="情况不妙啊。"
G["This isn't happening. Oh no... my friends!"]="这没有发生。哦，不……朋友们！"
G["This isn't helping!"]="这毫无意义！"
G["This isn't honorable combat. I long to face my opponents in battle with my axe in hand!"]="这根本不是荣耀之战。我渴望挥舞战斧，浴血沙场！"
G["This isn't how it ends. Not for me. I'm a survivor."]="这不是我要的结局。我还没到谢幕的时候呢。我才是最后的幸存者。"
G["This isn't lookin' good, lads!"]="看上去不妙啊，小子们。"
G["This isn't looking good, boss."]="Esto no tiene buena pinta, $gjefe:jefa;."
G["This isn't over!"]="还没结束！"
G["This isn't over, $n.  Not by a long shot."]="还没有完，$n。还早着呢。"
G["This isn't over, Baine..."]="还没有完，贝恩……"
G["This isn't quite what I signed up for, but hey... at least it's warm here."]="旅店的设施并不符合我的要求，不过……这里至少还算暖和。"
G["This isn't right at all, $n. In the tale Wind Tamer Barah told me, Stormhoof was a hero, not a villain."]="完全不对，$n。在驯风者巴兰告诉我的传说里，雷蹄是个英雄，不是暴徒。"
G["This isn't right."]="这可不对。"
G["This isn't supposed to happen!"]="这不可能！"
G["This isn't the biggest job I've done, not even close. This cataclysm may just be the best thing that ever happened to us!"]="这不是我所干过最重要的工作，连边儿都沾不上。大灾变一定是我们所经历过最棒的事了！"
G["This isn't the end; it can't be!"]="这不是结局……这不可能！"
G["This isn't the kind of place to raise your kids. It's cold, and there'd be no one to raise them."]="这不是个适合你的孩子成长的地方。这里很冷，而且在这里没人能养育他们。"
G["This isn't the last of them! $C, help us drive them back!"]="还有不少敌人呢！$C，快帮我们把他们赶回去！"
G["This isn't the same, father. The sha cannot simply be defeated. It feeds on our inner-most weaknesses. It twists our thoughts. Don't underestimate it!"]="这不一样，父亲。煞魔是不会被轻易击败的。它们会汲取我们内心的弱点，扭曲我们的心智。不要低估它们！"
G["This jade shortage is the worst thing to happen since the golden autumn crisis. Production is already months behind. The Serpent ain't getting any younger!"]="目前的玉石短缺是自金秋危机最严重的麻烦。工程进度已经落后好几个月了。青龙正在日益衰老！"
G["This job is definitely not worth sixteen-five a year."]="这份工作明显不值16500的年薪。"
G["This job is well-suited for you, Duarn.  I must attend to matters outside."]="这份工作对你来说再适合不过了，达鲁。我必须去处理外面的事情。"
G["This journal is written in dwarven. I can't read this scrawl, but I can make out one thing."]="这是矮人语啊……字迹真是潦草啊，不过我还是看出点眉目来了。"
G["This jungle is filled with an unnatural sense of dispair."]="丛林中充满了异常的绝望感。"
G["This jungle is going to be the end of us all."]="这个丛林就将是我们的葬身之处。"
G["This jungle is making me depressed."]="这丛林让我心生沮丧。"
G["This jungle is nice and humid compared to the arid deserts of Uldum."]="和奥丹姆干燥的沙漠环境相比，这片丛林既潮湿又宜人。"
G["This jungle will soon be cleansed of Alliance filth!"]="联盟渣滓在这片丛林里呆不长了！"
G["This just happens to be your lucky day; I just completed Super-Seller 680's maintenance. There are tons of items for sell at great low-low prices. Go ahead and see for yourself... my brother Cork thinks his Vendor-Tron 1000 will out sell my bot."]="今天碰巧是你的幸运日；我完成了超级商人680型的维护工作，因此有大量物品以超低的价格出售。你自己去看看吧……我的兄弟考克认为他的贸易机器人1000型会胜过我的。"
G["This kind of work isn't for the faint of heart. I have an uncle who lost a hand! Poor old Stumpy... anyway, if you're still interested I might be able to show you a few things."]="Esta clase de trabajo no es para los débiles. ¡Un tío mío perdió la mano! Pobre Rechoncho... en cualquier caso, si sigues estando $ginteresado:interesada; puedo enseñarte un par de cosas."
G["This kingdom belongs to the Scourge. Only the dead may enter!"]="这个王国已经属于天灾军团了。只有亡者才能通行！"
G["This knowledge is useless... what are you trying to achieve, Kanrethad?"]="这种知识毫无用处……你究竟想要什么，坎雷萨德？"
G["This kodo sure looks nothing like the beast I originally lured!  I wonder if the kombobulator can be used on me."]="这只科多兽显然不是我最初召唤的那只。我在想科多兽诱引器是否能为我所用。"
G["This lack of knowledge is just one more weakness among many. There is little hope against the power of death itself."]="暗影的能量会反噬他们的能力，就这样将这个投影赶回翡翠梦境里去。"
G["This land belongs to the Alliance, Horde wretch! Away with you!"]="这片土地属于联盟，部落怪物！离开这里！"
G["This land belongs to the Dark Iron Dwarves.  Prepare to see the afterlife, $C!"]="这些土地属于黑铁矮人。准备后事吧，$c！"
G["This land belongs to the Defias Brotherhood now!"]="这片土地现在属于迪菲亚兄弟会！"
G["This land belongs to the Horde!  Attack!"]="这座岛屿属于部落！攻击！"
G["This land has been ravaged by the crash. While you may not follow our philosophies, $c, I urge you to do whatever you can to aid in the healing process."]="这片土地被坠毁搞得一团糟。虽然你也许并不认同我们的哲学，$c，但是我期盼你尽量帮助别人。"
G["This land has endured much, and yet it thrives in the wake of the worldbreaker. You will find that my pets possess similar fortitude."]="这片土地饱经风霜，灭世者败亡后，它再次焕发了生机。你会发现，我的宠物们也具备类似的坚毅品格。"
G["This land is - different than ours. It's a treasure."]="这里——与众不同。它是块珍宝。"
G["This land is freezing, but I am warm, blanketed in the glow of the Holy Light. Do not be disheartened."]="虽然这里天寒地冻，但是沐浴在圣光中，我却倍感温暖。不要气馁。"
G["This land is ours now!"]="这块地现在是我们的了！"
G["This land is rich in resources, $n. I am preparing a detailed report for our return."]="这片土地的资源很丰富，$n。我正在准备一份报告，回去以后应该能用上。"
G["This land is soft like you."]="这片土地就跟你们一样软弱。"
G["This land is tainted. Ivus must be called!"]="这片土地被污染了。必须召唤伊弗斯。"
G["This land is where orcs and humans first spilled each other's blood. Not a mile south lurks Stonard, where the orcs first grouped to invade our lands.\n\nIt was here they amassed their armies before we even knew they existed. It was here that they started the first of three wars with their attack on a small Alliance town to the west.\n\nMy town. The town where my parents died to save me.\n\nBut I'm not here to settle a grudge... I'm here to win a war."]="这片土地是兽人和人类第一次展开大规模战争的地方。南边不到一里远就是斯通纳德。兽人在那里首次集结，入侵我们的国土。\n\n就是在这里，他们在我们不知不觉间聚集起大规模的军队。就是在这里，他们攻击西边的联盟小镇，拉开了三次兽人战争的序幕。\n\n那是我的城镇，为了救我，我的父母都死在了那里。\n\n但我来这里不是为了复仇……我是要赢得一场战争。"
G["This land must be made ready for the fleet.\n\nNo excuses!"]="这片土地必须准备好迎接我们的舰队。\n\n无需任何理由！"
G["This land once belonged to the great jinyu empire. As our kingdom has fallen into disrepair, we have lost more and more land to the relentless hozen tribes."]="这片土地曾经属于伟大的锦鱼人帝国。在帝国衰落之后，我们的土地就逐渐落入野蛮的猢狲部族手中。"
G["This land shall be purged in the Twilight's Flame!"]="这片土地应该在暮光烈焰中被净化！"
G["This land still bears the scars of the past. I wonder if they will ever heal."]="这片土地仍然挂着旧日的伤痕，我在想它们是否能够痊愈。"
G["This land truly needs to be cleansed by the Light!  Let us continue on to the tomb.  It isn't far now."]="这片土地真应该被圣光彻底净化！我们继续吧，陵墓就在前面。"
G["This land was mine long before your wretched kind set foot here."]="在你们这些可怜的种族踏足这里之前，这片土地就属于我了！"
G["This land will be your grave."]="这片土地将是你葬身之地。"
G["This land will quiver and shake in the wake of our destruction!"]="这片土地将因我们的毁灭之势而战栗，而颤抖！"
G["This land, it belongs to us..."]="这片土地属于我们……"
G["This large jack-o'-lantern rests in the middle of the village."]="这只巨大的南瓜灯矗立在村子的中央。"
G["This latest affront by the Lich King must be dealt with. Stormwind is doing what we can, but it will require the effort of everyone to overcome. Only after the threat at home has passed can we begin to deal with the Scourge threat abroad.\n\nThe traitor prince Arthas tests us from his seat of power in Northrend. Rest assured that the Alliance will not sit on its haunches. Preparations are already underway... for war.\n\nDefeating the Lich King and his armies will be a long and challenging ordeal. Death itself must be conquered. Many lives will be lost, but the future of Azeroth depends on our victory.\n\nI only hope that you'll be able to join the battle in Northrend and contribute your skill and strength to the cause."]="我们必须对巫妖王的挑衅做出回应。暴风城的子民将尽力而为，但是想要克服眼前的危机，我希望你们所有人都能贡献出自己的力量。只有首先解除家园的威胁，我们才有可能粉碎天灾军团在诺森德的阴谋。\n\n叛离的王子阿尔萨斯从远在诺森德的王座上向我们发起了挑战。联盟不能束手待毙。战争……一触即发。\n\n击败巫妖王和他的部队将是一个漫长而艰难的过程。我们必须征服死亡本身。许多人可能会因此牺牲，但艾泽拉斯的未来就看我们能否取胜了。\n\n我希望你能参与诺森德的战斗，为这一崇高的事业奉献自己的价值。"
G["This latest sample is unique.  What is its history?"]="这份新鲜的血样很独特。有什么来历吗？"
G["This lava hot."]="这熔岩可真烫。"
G["This library holds thousands of years of history and lore. The greatest knowledge in all of Pandaria is kept here.\n\nThat is why we must keep this great treasure safe."]="这个藏书室保存着几千年的历史文化，以及全潘达利亚的最了不起的知识。\n\n这也是我们一定要保护好这里的原因。"
G["This library should prove to be useful to my own research."]="这些藏书对我的研究非常有用。"
G["This lifeboat appears to be abandoned.  Maybe it belongs to some of the nearby pirates?"]="这艘救生船像是被丢弃了。也许它的主人会是附近的海盗？"
G["This likeness of the Horn of Hodir stands in memorial of King Arngrim and all others lost in the battle of Thunderfall."]="这件霍迪尔号角的仿制品是为了纪念安格里姆国王以及所有在落雷谷之战中牺牲的巨人而造的。"
G["This line is mostly filler..."]="这里几乎填满了……"
G["This little one shall vex me no longer."]="¡$gEste pequeño:Esta pequeña; no me irritará más!"
G["This lock should be easy enough to pick."]="这把锁应该能轻易地打开。"
G["This lock... it is more complicated than I thought..."]="这锁……比我预想的还要复杂……"
G["This looks good, but I think it'll look even better if we beat it up a little bit.  You know, to sell the illusion of a fight.  What do you think?"]="看起来不错，但是我认为要是能把它弄皱些就更好了。你知道，要给人一种经历过战斗的感觉。你说呢？"
G["This looks like a good perch. Mark the target and signal me when you've sighted the broodmother and are ready to attack."]="Esta parece una buena percha. Marca el objetivo y hazme una señal cuando hayas visto a la madre de linaje y estés $glisto:lista; para atacar."
G["This looks like the perfect place for a nap..."]="这儿看上去是个休憩的好地方。"
G["This looks pretty good... but it burns too long!  I need to be able to stop the fire instantly.  Cut back on hammerhead oil next time."]="看上去是不错……可它烧得太久了！我需要能立刻让火停掉。下次少放点儿锤头鲨鱼油。"
G["This looks suspicious. I can't let you in."]="这看上去很可疑，我不能让你进城。"
G["This looks to be the record of Qiang the Merciless, a great conqueror who ruled his vassals with an iron fist!"]="看上去这些就是无情战王齐昂的记录了。无数诸侯都曾臣服于其铁腕统治之下。"
G["This lots of gold! Me look other way."]="好多金币啊！我扭过头去。"
G["This machine will be your undoing. PH"]="这机器会彻底毁灭你。PH"
G["This man-child, Arthas, took for himself a cursed blade known as Frostmourne."]="这个幼稚的男人，阿尔萨斯，亲手拔出了一把名为霜之哀伤的邪剑。"
G["This mastiff will help you find the hidden worgen."]="这只猎犬能帮你找到那些隐藏的狼人。"
G["This match is sure to be SHORT! Okay, okay, I'm done. Let the bloodbath begin!"]="这一战必定会速战速决！好吧，好吧，我说完了。血战开始！"
G["This may be a bit unsettling..."]="这或许让人有点不安……"
G["This may be a strange request, but... do you have any ink or paint?"]="这个请求或许很奇怪，不过……你有墨水或颜料之类的东西吗？"
G["This may be my greatest work yet!"]="这或许将是我最伟大的作品！"
G["This may be the end for you, Dalliah.  What a shame that would be."]="你八成活不过今天了，达尔莉安。多丢人啊。"
G["This may come as a shock to you, but business hasn't been all that good as of late..."]="或许这会令你震惊，但是近来的事情不是那么顺利……"
G["This may disorient you momentarily, Wakener. It is always difficult the first time your eyes truly see."]="这也许会让你茫然迷失，唤醒者。第一次亲眼看见，总是很困难的。"
G["This may hurt a little...."]="可能有点疼……"
G["This may look like a losing battle, but the Scarlet Crusade will prevail. I believe wholly in our capability to eradicate the scourge in Stratholme. And though I do not look favorably upon the Argent Dawn, the Brotherhood of the Light is much closer to how I like to work.\n\nEnough idle chatter, $c. Let's get started."]="看上去，战况好像对我们不利，但血色十字军终将取得胜利。我坚信，我们一定能彻底清除斯坦索姆的天灾怪物。虽然我不看好银色黎明，不过圣光兄弟会确实是一支能发挥作用的队伍。\n\n闲聊到此结束，$c。我们开始吧。"
G["This may seem meager at first, but give it a moment. Soon, the pain will be unbearable."]="这刚开始可能不算什么，但只要等一段时间，疼痛就会变得难以忍受。"
G["This mean war!"]="我要宣战！"
G["This meaningless exertion bores me. I'll incinerate you all from above!"]="这毫无意义的行动让我很厌烦。我会从上空把你们都烧成灰！"
G["This means he's completely unhinged."]="看来他已经彻底疯了。"
G["This means war, Lump! War I say!"]="这意味着战争，拉普！我说的是战争！"
G["This meeting of the Assembly of Iron is adjourned!"]="钢铁议会的正事都被你们耽搁了！"
G["This might be a one-way mission, $n. If you're not comfortable with that, you can walk away at any time, though I'd rather that you didn't."]="Podría ser una misión sin retorno, $n. Si no te sientes $gcómodo:cómoda; con eso, puedes irte en cualquier momento, aunque preferiría que no lo hicieras."
G["This might be the only cool place left on the island... right next to the volcano!"]="也许这是岛上唯一凉快的地方了……虽然它就在火山的旁边！"
G["This might just change your mind.  Brann is shipping the tablets to me as we speak. Preliminary reports from the Explorers' League state that they may be able to help us understand what is going on with the earthquakes."]="这也许恰恰能改变你的看法。此时布莱恩正在将那些石板运送到这里。从探险者协会的初步报告看来，这些石板也许能帮我们理解这些地震背后的真相。"
G["This mine and everything in it are now property of Queen Sylvanas.  That includes all you worms -- so get back to work!"]="这座矿藏和这里的一切都是希尔瓦娜斯女王的财产，也包括你们这些蛆虫。所以，赶快回去工作！"
G["This miserable can is nothing compared to the might of <Kraken Name here>!"]="在<此处为海怪号的名字>的力量面前，这条破船简直是废铁一块！"
G["This miserable existence finally ends."]="这个可悲的存在终于完结了。"
G["This mission is far too vital to leave your repairs in the hands of someone other than myself."]="这个任务太重要了，所以我不放心把你的修理工作交给别人。"
G["This mole machine is a little rusty, but it still looks operational."]="这台挖掘机有些生锈了，可看起来还能使用。"
G["This monkey's about to get slapped!"]="这只猴子要吃苦头了！"
G["This monument hums and crackles with perpetual ancient energies."]="这座纪念碑以永不消失的古老能量发出各种嗡嗡和噼啪的声音。"
G["This monument is dedicated to all those who have fallen in the protection of Stormwind. Our people have weathered unbelievable hardships to retain their freedoms and to control their own destinies. It is here we remember every sacrifice our citizens have made during the first war that riddled our people."]="这座纪念碑是用于缅怀在暴风城保卫战中牺牲的勇士。我们的人民经受了难以想象的痛苦才得以恢复自由，重新掌握自己的命运。我们将永远铭记那些在第一次兽人战争中牺牲的同胞。"
G["This moon beam will send you to Orgrimmar.  Use your invitation when you want to go."]="这道月光会把你送到奥格瑞玛去。当你想要离开庆典的时候，就在这里使用你的邀请函。"
G["This moonlight will send you to Ironforge.  But who'd want to leave this party?"]="这道月光会把你送到铁炉堡去。但你难道真的想要离开吗？"
G["This moonlight will take you to Thunder Bluff.  Use it when you want to leave the festival."]="这道月光会把你送到雷霆崖去。当你想要离开庆典的时候，就到这里来吧。"
G["This mouthwatering brew has an almost hypnotic aroma coming from it."]="这种令人口水直流的美酒散发着一股令人迷醉的香气。"
G["This mouthwatering brew has an almost hypnotic aroma coming from it.\n\n(Scenarios require item level 425 or greater.)"]="这种令人口水直流的美酒散发着一股令人迷醉的香气。\n\n（下列场景战役要求物品等级不低于425级）"
G["This music never gets old, does it?"]="这音乐怎么也不会过时，对吗？"
G["This must be somewhat different from the environment to which you're accustomed. It is a visible demonstration of the power we hold, nothing more. We're mindful of our resources."]="这肯定和你们所习惯的环境有些区别。它只不过是我们所拥有的力量的一个展示而已，我们是很在意资源的。"
G["This must be the lifeboat that Captain Hecklebury Smotts spoke about."]="这一定就是海克拜瑞·斯莫特船长提到的那艘救生船。"
G["This my real home place! You believe we were a hatchling long time ago? We were!"]="这是我真正的家！你相信我们以前也是鳄鱼人幼体吗？真的是这样哦！"
G["This new world fascinates us. A world that has fought the Legion to a standstill... amazing."]="这个新世界使我们着迷。一个世界能让燃烧军团精疲力竭……真是令人惊异。"
G["This nightsaber is rumored to be docile in the presence of night elves and their allies, which makes her an even more worthy opponent.  Shadumbra's hunting path takes her from the Raynewood Retreat to our west, ultimately to lands due west of there.  Her fur is the color of pitch, and her speed is not to be underestimated."]="这只夜刃豹传言在暗夜精灵和他们的同盟面前很驯服，这使她成为一个更有价值的对手。猎影的猎杀路线把她从瑞恩伍德居所赶到了我们的西方，最终在那里的正西方登陆。她的皮毛是沥青一般的颜色，而她的速度也不能低估。"
G["This no go here."]="这个不应该放在这儿。"
G["This not Frenzyheart Hill, where we again?"]="这里不是狂心岭！我们又迷路了？"
G["This not be good..."]="这不太好…"
G["This not easy for A-Me to say... A-Me going home.  It finally time for A-Me to leave."]="这对A-Me来说不容易…… A-Me要回家。 这是A-Me离开的最后时刻。"
G["This not first queen slain by Frenzyheart. Seem like there always more."]="蜂后是杀不绝的。很快就会产生新的蜂后。"
G["This not fun..."]="一点都不好玩……"
G["This not good tickle!"]="这并不好笑！"
G["This not... end well for you!"]="你不会……有好下场的！"
G["This object is of low quality and is likely one of many fake artifacts that have been flooding the black market."]="这个物件质量低劣，很可能是充斥黑市的假冒伪劣产品。"
G["This object is useless to me."]="这东西对我没用。"
G["This object of your chagrin may still prove... valuable... to me."]="你这失败的作品也许……对我……还有点儿价值。"
G["This oil no good for Grek! What Grek look like to you, some weakling in robes?"]="这油对葛雷克没什么用处！你觉得葛雷克看起来像什么？穿着长袍的弱者？"
G["This ol' cloaking chicken better not fail. She's been actin' up lately."]="但愿这只隐身小鸡不会出什么岔子。她最近不太对劲。"
G["This old bear... I can't stay mad at him.\n\nThank you, stranger."]="Este viejo oso... No puedo enfadarme con él.\n\nGracias, $gforastero:forastera;."
G["This old draenei board has been refurbished by the Kurenai and is now used to post announcements and bounties."]="这块陈旧的德莱尼公告板被库雷尼重新打磨过了，现在用来张贴公告和悬赏名单。"
G["This old inn isn't much to look at anymore, but it makes for a great stronghold."]="这间破旧的旅馆从外面看已经惨不忍睹，不过倒是个理想的据点。"
G["This old pandaren is a fool. How are we supposed to fight without emotion? It's impossible!"]="这个老熊猫人愚蠢至极。我们怎能不带着情绪战斗？那不可能！"
G["This one die easy!"]="这个一下子就死翘翘了。"
G["This one has awoken too soon. It retains emotion and memory..."]="说的好，但这毫无意义……"
G["This one has indeed proven mastery over anger. Between the young cub's words and the actions of this hero, I think I understand. Those from beyond the mists are hardened by battle. They are scarred, yes, but they have learned much. I trust them."]="这个凡人证明了自己驾驭愤怒的能力。通过后辈们的话语和这位英雄的举动，我想我已经明白了。那些来自迷雾之外的人久经战火磨砺。他们伤痕累累，但已有所觉悟。我相信他们。"
G["This one is especially ugly. Perfect for a ghoul..."]="这具尸体真丑。很合适做食尸鬼……"
G["This one is in pretty bad shape."]="这个伤员的情况很糟糕。"
G["This one is slightly better than the last. However, it still suffers from the same flimsy bone structure as the others. When you summon one of these, you are on the right path."]="这个比上一个稍微好那么一点。但是它的骨架结构还是很脆弱。你能召唤出这样的东西，证明你还是在不断进步的。"
G["This one looks a little fragile... well, no matter..."]="看上去有点脆弱呢……不过无所谓啦……"
G["This one seems a little weak still."]="这一条似乎仍然有点虚弱。"
G["This one should make a fine mount someday."]="它总有一天会成为不错的坐骑。"
G["This one smells particularly bad."]="这个闻起来尤其恶心。"
G["This one that assisted me should be adequate. Have them report to our force commander, Crag Rockcrusher at Stonehearth."]="$gEste:Esta; que me ayudó servirá. Haz que informen a nuestro comandante, Crag Aplastarrocas en el Hogar Pétreo."
G["This one was from Corporal Stonewell... he died protecting a field hospital..."]="这是斯通威尔下士的护符……他在战地医院的保卫战中英勇牺牲……"
G["This one will grow to be a great warrior. Won't you, darling?"]="他会成长为一名勇敢的战士。亲爱的，是不是呀？"
G["This one won't be coming back."]="这个家伙不会回来了。"
G["This one'll be dead before long, $p."]="这一个活不了多久了，$p。"
G["This one's a little unstable, but what's progress without failure?"]="这个有点儿不稳定，但不经过失败怎么会进步？"
G["This one's for Saurfang!"]="为萨鲁法尔而战！"
G["This one's for beatin' up Amber!"]="让你们再动安玻的坏脑筋！"
G["This one's for beatin' up Rell!"]="让你们欺负利尔！"
G["This one's going straight through."]="这样应该是可以了。"
G["This one's on the house!"]="这杯我请！"
G["This one's real grim... So the king's kid, Arthas... Well he goes out to battle evil, along with Uther... *Nat pats his brow dry*"]="还有一个非常可怕的梦……国王的儿子，阿尔萨斯……他和乌瑟尔一起对抗邪恶……*纳特擦了擦他的额头*"
G["This one, over here! He's trying to protect the others!"]="这个，在这边！他正努力保护其他人！"
G["This one. Should be fun kill."]="这家伙。干掉他一定会很有趣的。"
G["This one..."]="这一个……"
G["This only grows in a single area in Darnassus. Perhaps our killer dragged it here on his boot."]="在达纳苏斯只有一个地方长有这种树。也许我们要找的凶手就是在那里沾上这片树叶的。"
G["This operation is moving too slowly.  Go motivate them!"]="这项工作进展得太慢了。去催催他们！"
G["This orb will create a portal that will return you to the Temple City of En'kilah."]="使用这颗宝珠将开启返回圣城恩其拉的传送门。"
G["This orb will create a portal to Upper Naxxanar."]="使用这颗宝珠将开启通往纳克萨纳尔上层的传送门。"
G["This orc is severely injured."]="这个兽人受了重伤。"
G["This orchard is now as barren and lifeless as my rotting shell. Once these trees bloomed with fruit but now there is only rot."]="这座果园现在死气沉沉。这些树木曾经结满了果实，但是现在只剩下干枯的树枝。"
G["This ore can only have been created by a powerful, malevolent force. Attempting to access databanks for more information ..."]="只有强大而邪恶的力量才能创造出这种矿石。尝试访问数据库，搜索更多信息……"
G["This ought to help!"]="这应该能管用！"
G["This outfit really brings out the blue in my eyes, don't you think? It should be obvious I have plenty of skill to go around, so I can afford to share a few of my tricks of the trade. Listen up, okay?"]="这套装备真的让我眼前一亮，你觉得呢？显然，我有多种技能可以使用，我可以将贸易的一些诀窍与你分享。听好了。"
G["This outpost is a cog-free zone. Persons employing cogs in the construction of mechanical devices will be subject to unrelenting mockery."]="哨站属于无齿轮区域。如果有谁在制造机械装置时使用齿轮，就会遭到无情的嘲笑。"
G["This outpost is not ready! What would happen if Malygos and the blue dragonflight decided to strike?"]="前哨站的建设尚未完工！万一玛里苟斯和蓝龙军团发动袭击怎么办？"
G["This page must have been dropped by one of the looters. Lorewalker Cho will know what it says."]="这页纸肯定是某个盗墓者遗落的。游学者周卓应该知道上面写了什么。"
G["This paragon is for the Empress! You shall not have it!"]="这个英杰是女皇的！ 你休想得到他！"
G["This party is just the best!  Don't you agree?"]="这个聚会是最棒的！你不觉得吗？"
G["This party is pointless. Those foolish nobles will never get to see Medivh. Can't they see this? I should have just stayed in Darkshire with my family instead of wasting my time here."]="这个聚会毫无意义。那些愚蠢的贵族们永远都不可能看到麦迪文，他们不明白吗？我应该待在夜色镇，和我的家人在一起，而不是在这里浪费时间。"
G["This path leads to Kun-Lai Summit. Good fortune to those who travel it to shop at grummle shops."]="这条路通往昆莱山。祝那些沿着它去土地精商店购物的人好运。"
G["This path only leads deeper into the city. Keep going south toward the Loading Room."]="这条路通向城市的更深处。继续朝南，向装载室走。"
G["This pathetic revolution ends here!"]="这场可悲的革命，到此为止了！"
G["This pathetic siege ends NOW!"]="你们这可笑的骚扰到此为止了！"
G["This person sure has lots o' statues..."]="这个家伙肯定收藏了不少雕像……"
G["This pie is so good, would you like some?"]="这馅饼真好吃，你要尝尝吗？"
G["This pit stinks and I'm surrounded by snakes, but I'm here to do a job.\n\nEver since Putress pulled his stunt at the Wrath Gate, the Warchief doesn't trust these people as far as he can throw them. That's why we're here. The apothecaries can't do a thing without me."]="坑里臭气熏天，还有一群蛇围着我。不过我来这是有事要做的。\n\n自从普特雷斯在天谴之门上演了一出好戏，酋长便不再信任那些人，而是离他们远远的。这就是为什么我们会在这里。那些药剂师离了我什么都做不了。"
G["This place be reekin' of death and sacrifice.\n\nBest you leave before you become da next prisoner."]="Eh'te lugar apeh'ta a mueh'te y sacrificios.\n\nSerá mejor que te vayas antes de que te convieh'tas en el siguiente prisionero."
G["This place doesn't look good."]="这个地方看起来不太好。"
G["This place doesn't look pretty. Come on, $n. Let's go inside."]="这个地方看起来真恶心。来，$n。我们到里面去。"
G["This place is GREAT! Have you seen how much FOOD they have here?"]="这地方太棒了！看到他们这里有多少食物了吗？"
G["This place is all shiny. Not sure I like it. Seems like it is missing that \"lived in\" smell."]="Este sitio está todo reluciente. No sé si me gusta. Creo que le falta ese olor a sitio \"habitado\"."
G["This place is an archaeologist's dream!\n\nI wish there were time to conduct a proper excavation."]="这个地方真是考古学家的梦想之地！\n\n真希望我能有时间进行一场彻底的考古发掘。"
G["This place is crazy! I could spend years here investigating all this technology!"]="这个地方真疯狂！我可以在这里花上很多年来钻研这些技术！"
G["This place is great.  Anywhere else I'd be called a violent sociopath.  Well, they call me that here too, but at least they say it to my face with a smile."]="我喜欢这个地方。在别的地方，那些人总是叫我“暴力孤僻女”。好吧，其实在这儿他们也这么叫我，不过至少他们是当着我的面，并且面带着微笑地叫这个名字。"
G["This place is huge!"]="这地方真大！"
G["This place is infested... we'll need to make our way out of here with the relics as quickly as possible."]="这个地方已经遭到了污染……我们需要带着那些圣物尽快离开这里。"
G["This place is like... ALL puddles."]="这个地方好像……到处是水坑。"
G["This place is packed to the rafters with Alliance all-stars!  Let's go tear apart Orgrimmar!"]="联盟全明星，人气爆棚！让我们把奥格瑞玛踩平吧！"
G["This place is packed! We should all team up and go kick Varian in his pretty little face!"]="这地方已经挤满了！我们应该组起队伍，往瓦里安漂亮的小脸蛋儿上来上几脚！"
G["This place is quite strange. There is powerful magic everywhere around us."]="这地方真古怪，到处都充斥着强大的魔力。"
G["This place is really heating up!"]="这里真是热火朝天啊！"
G["This place is remarkable, don't you think?"]="你不觉得吗？这地方很神奇！"
G["This place is safe for the Defias to take over! Get the others."]="这个地方对迪菲亚兄弟会来说很安全！叫其他兄弟过来。"
G["This place is still mostly free from the naga. But...it is deeply tormented. I don't know how long we have."]="这里的绝大部分地方还没有遭到纳迦的侵扰。可是……这片土地经历了深重的苦难。我不知道我们还有多少时间。"
G["This place is to warm and sticky and smells of bad fortune."]="这地方又热又黏糊，还有股闻起来要倒霉的味道。"
G["This place is under my protection. The mysteries of the arcane shall remain inviolate."]="我保护着这个地方。神秘的奥术不能受到亵渎。"
G["This place is up crap creek an' I ain't got no shovel."]="要是有把铲子，我就能把自己从这堆废墟下面挖出来。"
G["This place isn't quite as cool as the ruins, and the air in here is a bit humid if I do say so myself, but it does have a comfy, home feel to it.\n\nDon't you think?"]="这地方跟废墟相比没那么凉爽，如果要我说的话，这儿的空气也有些太过潮湿，不过确实给我一种舒服的、回到家里的感觉。\n\n你不这么认为吗？"
G["This place isn't safe.  Let's leave!"]="这个地方不安全。赶快离开这里！"
G["This place looks rough and tumble, but everyone around here is a softie on the inside."]="这地方看起来很硬派，但这里的人其实内心里都是软蛋。"
G["This place makes me uneasy, but we Shado-Pan do not run from danger."]="这地方让我感到不安，可我们影踪派是不会逃避危险的。"
G["This place reeks of death, stranger.\n\nYou must leave before you fill a cage like Kraz."]="陌生人，这里散发着死亡的气息。\n\n快走吧，否则你就会像克拉斯一样被关进牢笼。"
G["This place reeks of evil. It must be purged!"]="这地方充满邪恶的气息。它必须得到净化！"
G["This place seems nice enough, I suppose. Needs a little elbow grease.\n\nYou looking for a job, $n?"]="Supongo que este lugar no está mal. Aunque habrá que trabajar duro.\n\n¿Buscas trabajo $n?"
G["This place was only the beginning. We will crush your refugee camp and then lead our elementals north to destroy Lor'danel with Aetherion as our vanguard!"]="这个地方只是一个开端。我们会粉碎你们的难民营地，然后率领我们的元素向北，直捣新奥伯丁。阿瑟里恩将是我们的先锋！"
G["This place was supposed to be safe! Instead we're in the middle of hungry worgs and the High Tinker only knows what!"]="这里应该很安全！总比被一群饥饿的座狼给包围了要好，大工匠恐怕也会认可这一点！"
G["This place will serve as your graveyard."]="这里将成为你们的墓地。"
G["This place will serve as your tomb!"]="这里将是你的葬身之地！"
G["This place won't stay in business long if they keep this up."]="要是他们继续这么下去，那这儿经营不了多久。"
G["This place... it's cursed.\n\nI barely managed to escape, and I cannot bear to go down through the tunnels again.\n\nMy brother, and sisters though... They were not as fortunate. Trapped inside, they are feverish with the corrupted haze that flows from the evil garden growing there.\n\nPlease, you must help."]="这地方……受到了诅咒。\n\n我刚刚设法逃脱，我可不想再进入那些地道啦。\n\n但是，我的兄弟姐妹……就没这么幸运了。他们被困在里面，恶魔花园散发的堕落烟雾令他们疯狂。\n\n你一定要帮帮他们。"
G["This places chills me to my core, $c."]="这个地方让我感到寒冷彻骨，$c。"
G["This plant stands out among the normal flora of Teldrassil, and emits a strange, purplish glow."]="这个植物矗立在泰达希尔的普通植物之间，散发着奇异的紫色光芒。"
G["This platform is about to crumble! Jump to another!"]="这个平台要塌了！跳到别的平台上去！"
G["This pond sure is nice, neighbor."]="Ese estanque es estupendo, $gvecino:vecina;."
G["This poor sherpen has been frozen here for a while."]="这个可怜的土地精已经被冻在这儿有一段时间了。"
G["This portal is not like the others that lead back to Azeroth. To maintain it, we must acquire more mana cells.\n\nIt is either that or risk losing our access to the Isle of Quel'Danas and the Sunwell."]="这道传送门与其它连接艾泽拉斯世界的传送门不同。为了让它持续工作，我们需要有更多的法力晶格。\n\n否则我们就有可能失去通向奎尔丹纳斯岛和太阳之井的捷径。"
G["This portal leads to Lake Wintergrasp."]="该传送门通往冬拥湖。"
G["This portal leads to the Caverns of Time, deep beneath the earth in far-off Tanaris.\n\nI possess the power to send you there, should you so desire."]="该传送门通往时光之穴，它位于遥远的塔纳利斯沙漠地底。\n\n如果你要去那里的话，我可以将你传送过去。"
G["This portal leads to the Caverns of Time, deep beneath the earth in far-off Tanaris.\n\nUntil you have grown stronger, though, I must ask you not to travel there."]="该传送门通往时光之穴，它位于遥远的塔纳利斯沙漠地底。\n\n但是你的力量还不够强大，我建议你不要去那里。"
G["This portal leads to the Stair of Destiny in Hellfire Peninsula... that's right, Outland.\n\nAre you prepared...?"]="Este portal lleva a Los Peldaños del Destino, en la Península del Fuego Infernal... eso es: Terrallende.\n\n¿Estás $gpreparado:preparada;...?"
G["This portion of the statue tells you little, other than the subject actually had arms..."]="你从这个雕像残片上看不出什么来，除了它的主人是有手臂的这一点。"
G["This post is secure, $r.\n\nThe enemy has been cleared from the area for some time now."]="这座岗哨目前是安全的，$r。\n\n敌人暂时不敢再次来犯。"
G["This potion seems to heal less damage every time I brew it, though I use the same ingredients. There can be only one conclusion: the plants are changing. I cannot say why or into what."]="虽然每次我都使用了相同的成分，但配制出的药水似乎都达不到预期的治疗效果。这只能得出一个结论：植物发生了变化。我还不清楚具体原因。"
G["This power is harnessed by all thinking peoples to heal or harm. It is the power of life. It is the power of souls living and dead."]="所有的智慧生物都能支配这种力量，利用它来医治创伤或是荼毒生灵。它就是生命的源力，是死者与生者的灵魂之力。"
G["This power is too dangerous. I will have none of it!"]="这种力量太危险了。我不同意！"
G["This practice is all fine and dandy, but Orgrimmar won't smash itself!"]="别再保持优雅的风度了，奥格瑞玛等着我们去踩平呢！"
G["This probably isn't a smooth ride, but I bet I'd look smooth in this ride."]="也许这样的座驾不会那么容易驾驭，但我打赌，它绝不会让你失望。"
G["This pumpkin sure looks succulent! Nobody will notice if I take a small bite... [PH]"]="¡Esta calabaza tiene un aspecto suculento! Nadie se dará cuenta si le doy un mordisquito... [PH]"
G["This puny green pup was of no use at the mines.  No matter, he'll make for suitable warmup for battle."]="这个绿皮肤的小鬼根本派不上用处。不过没关系，他可以在作战前充当热身的对象。"
G["This raft is all yours, neighbor. You ever want to go rafting, just come back here. It'll be waiting for you."]="这木筏归你了，邻居。你要是想用了，随时回来取。它就在这里等着你。"
G["This realm is more terrible than I'd imagined. Even now, I can feel the rage of this place pressing down on me."]="火焰的国度比我想象的还要可怕。我能感到这个世界想要压垮我的狂怒。"
G["This recon pilot did not survive his squadron's crash."]="这名飞行侦察员未能在空难中生还。"
G["This red statue looks a lot like the Sentinel's pawn that you hold.\n\nThe statue has a small indentation that matches the size of your pawn."]="这座红色雕像很像是你带在身上的哨卫的棋卒。\n\n这座雕像上有一个小缺口，正好与你的棋卒形状相吻合。"
G["This reflection of me is exceptionally weak. Don't let these brutes lay a finger on my precious image."]="我的这个影像异常地微弱。不要让这些野蛮的家伙碰到我宝贵的影像。"
G["This region is one of the epicenters of the cataclysm that threatens to rend our world.\n\nIf we manage to survive, we must try to discover its cause."]="这里正是这场可能毁灭世界的大灾变爆发的核心区域之一。\n\n如果我们要生存下去，就必须发掘出它的原因。"
G["This region was an epicenter of the cataclysm.\n\nThe naga activity here is certainly no coincidence. Their intentions must be unveiled!"]="这里是灾变的中心。\n\n纳迦在这里的活动一定不是巧合。我们必须揭穿他们的意图！"
G["This reminds me of that one time where you made us search Silithus for evidence of sand gnomes."]="这让我想起了过去，那时候，你为了寻找所谓沙漠侏儒的证据，让我们搜遍了整个希利苏斯。"
G["This resolution pains me deeply, but the destruction, the monumental loss of life had to end. Regardless of Malygos' recent transgressions, I will mourn his loss. He was once a guardian, a protector. This day, one of the world's mightiest has fallen."]="这个决定令我的心灵深处痛楚不已，但这生灵涂炭与天地崩裂的局面也终于得到了休止。无论玛里苟斯犯过什么大错，我都会为他的死默哀。他曾是一位高贵的守护者。今天，世界上最强大的守护者之一，就这样逝去了。"
G["This rig is a fine piece of machinary. I've actually formed quite the bond with it. I even nicknamed it Bruce!\n\nIt just doesn't work right all the time, it's a little leaky, and it's probably a hazard to anyone within 10 miles of it."]="这是台好机器。实际上，我跟它已经有感情了。我甚至还给它起了个昵称叫“布鲁斯”！\n\n它只是没法正常运转而已，有点渗漏，而且还可能对周围10英里范围内的人造成威胁。"
G["This right here is what you'd call bad for business!"]="这里就是被你称为很糟糕的地方！"
G["This roast looks delicious. I hope you made it yourself."]="这烤肉看起来很好吃。但愿是你自己做的。"
G["This rock is about to fall! Jump to another!"]="这块石头就要塌落了！跳到另一块上面去！"
G["This rocket will take you all the way to Badlands, which is very far away.  Are you sure?"]="这架火箭能把你送去遥远的荒芜之地。你确定吗？"
G["This room pulses with energy, but feels unlike any we have seen so far."]="这个房间里涌动着能量，但是和我们所见过的完全不同。"
G["This room reeks of a massacre. No sign of Beak."]="这里满是血腥之气。但没有尖喙的踪迹。"
G["This ruby will look wonderful with this dress, don't you think?"]="这颗红宝石配这身衣服真是太美了，你觉得呢？"
G["This runestone is more recent than the others. Something about \"The sleeping keeper.\" I think it's referring to Ra-Den. But why was he asleep?"]="Esta piedra es más reciente que las demás. Dice algo de un \"guardián durmiente\". Creo que se refiere a Ra Den, pero... ¿por qué dormía?"
G["This runestone speaks of a \"Cradle of Life.\" A place where the Titans could create new creatures. Oh - of course - the Vale of Eternal Blossoms! It was a living laboratory, much like Un'goro Crater or Sholazar Basin."]="Esta piedra habla de una \"Cuna de la Vida\". Un lugar en el que los titanes creaban nuevos seres. Ah, claro... ¡es el Valle de la Flor Eterna! Era un laboratorio viviente, como el Cráter de Un'Goro o la Cuenca de Sholazar."
G["This sample is highly infected!  How was it acquired?"]="这份血样被严重污染了！怎么会这样？"
G["This sandbox is pretty boring."]="这个沙箱真无聊。"
G["This section is off-limits!"]="这里禁止入内！"
G["This seems like a good spot to consult the water!"]="这里很适合使用水占术！"
G["This seems to be a terminal controlling the device. Let's see here..."]="这好像是这个装置的控制终端。看这儿……"
G["This seems urgent, Kadrak. There must be another way!"]="这似乎很紧急，卡德拉克。肯定还有其他办法的！"
G["This set up sure is hard work."]="这种调整工作可不简单。"
G["This shard of ice echoes the deep, cracking rumble of invading glaciers.  Its cold turns your thoughts to a lifeless, endless winter."]="这块冰晶碎片中竟传来了深远之处冰川碎裂的声响。它的冰冷将你的思维彻底抛入了毫无生气的无尽寒冻。"
G["This shield is just what I need! Thank you!"]="这盾牌正是我想要的！谢谢你！"
G["This shield will block many mighty blows. Thank you, $n."]="这面盾牌可以挡住许多强大的攻击。谢谢你，$n。"
G["This should be helpin' ya!"]="这对你来说应该有帮助！"
G["This should be the last of it."]="这应该是最后一个了。"
G["This should do it! At least it better do it!"]="这东西应该管用的！至少它看上去管用！"
G["This should do it..."]="这个应该有作用……"
G["This should ease the pain."]="这能帮你减轻痛苦。"
G["This should give us enough power to disable the stabilization matrix."]="这应该能提供足以废止稳定矩阵的能量。"
G["This should just take a moment."]="应该很快就好。"
G["This should only take a moment, $n."]="只需一小会儿，$n。"
G["This should see you to the ground safely, $n."]="这能帮你安全回到地面，$n。"
G["This should warm the lad up!"]="这应该能让他暖和起来！"
G["This should't take very long. Just watch my back as I empty these nether collectors."]="这不会花太长时间的。在我清空这些虚空收集器的时候保护我。"
G["This shouldn't take long..."]="这不会花很长时间……"
G["This shredder looks like it can be repaired. You fire off a signal..."]="看样子，这台伐木机还是可以修理的。你打个信号弹……"
G["This sickness clouds my vision, but I know you must be a trogg.  Die foul invader!"]="Esta enfermedad nubla mi vista, pero sé que tienes que ser un trogg. ¡Muere, $ginvasor apestoso:invasora apestosa;!"
G["This siege has gone dormant for far too long, let us destroy the Draenei and their pitiful city!"]="总攻的时刻到了，让我们摧毁德莱尼人和他们那可怜的城市！"
G["This sign contains various announcements and notices of rewards for performing dangerous sounding tasks.  Nothing particularly catches your eye; perhaps you should check again at a later time."]="这个公告牌上张贴着多种公告和执行危险任务的奖励。现在没什么可以吸引你的东西，也许你应该过段时间再回来看看。"
G["This sign contains various announcements and notices of rewards."]="这张公告牌上列有各种声明和奖赏的通知。"
G["This smells like a trap, but we have no time to lose. Let's go!"]="我感觉这像个陷阱，但是我们不能浪费时间了。我们走！"
G["This smoke is like nothing I've smelled before. I wonder what they're burning here."]="我从来没有闻过这样诡异的烟味。他们在烧什么呢？"
G["This soft one should serve well. Come, Wakener."]="这个身体柔软的家伙应该也能效力。来吧，唤醒者。"
G["This soldier is not like the others. He looks like a personal bodyguard."]="这个士兵和其他人不一样。他看起来像是个私人保镖。"
G["This sounds like a task worthy of the new king!"]="这听起来是个值得去做的任务！"
G["This sparkling white wine is delicious! Wherever did you get it?"]="这种发泡白酒真是美味！你是从哪里得到它的？"
G["This special plague we're spreading will keep Godfrey's forces from leaving the keep, but will still allow us to move our troops in to take it for the Forsaken!"]="我们散播的这种特殊魔法会让高弗雷的军队无法离开城堡。我们却可以自由地调动部队冲杀进去，为被遗忘者夺下它！"
G["This special preparation grants them unique powers far greater than they would otherwise know."]="这种特殊的转变将赋予他们难以想象的力量。"
G["This specimen is fading from existence. Something or someone is altering the timeway."]="这个样本正在逐渐消失。有什么东西或者什么人正在改变着时间流。"
G["This specimen shows concentrated necrosis.  What is its history?"]="这份血样完全坏死了。它是从哪儿来的？"
G["This specimen shows promise.  Where did we get it?"]="这份血样不错。是从哪儿弄来的？"
G["This spell will speed you up in the water.  Just in case you run into a shark!"]="这个法术可以提高你在水中的移动速度，以防你遇到鲨鱼！"
G["This spellcaster's staff is for you."]="这根法杖是给你的。"
G["This spirit hovers over its fallen body.  Its ghostly eyes pierce through you as it gazes beyond..."]="灵魂还在尸体旁徘徊。它那可怕的眼睛死死地盯着你……"
G["This spot is perfect! Let me set up..."]="这个位置太棒了！我们开始准备吧……"
G["This staff holds powers passed down through my ancestors. Thank you for returning it to me."]="这根法杖承载了我世代相传的先祖之力。感谢你把它归还给我。"
G["This stall is under official investigation. Please keep your distance."]="这个摊位正在接受官方的调查。请离这里远点。"
G["This statuary is a significant departure from previous troll effigies."]="这尊雕像和其它巨魔雕像截然不同。"
G["This statue does not match the description of Shin that An Windfur gave you."]="这座雕像与安·风裘向你描述的阿信的容貌并不相似。"
G["This stew needs salt. And people meatballs!"]="这炖菜还需要加点盐。再加些人肉丸子！"
G["This stone tells of a great hozen warlord who lived here twenty-five hundred years ago. What are your leaders like? Poets? Warriors? I should like to meet them someday."]="这块石头讲述了两千五百年前一位伟大猢狲督军的故事。你们的领袖什么样？是诗人还是战士？我真想见见。"
G["This stone trogg is behind the growth in the Crimson Expanse.\n\nI sense a strange power in this place... be careful."]="这个石头穴居人与赤红岩床的变数有关。\n\n我在这里感觉到一股奇怪的力量……多加小心。"
G["This storm is raging out of control! Keep the brewkegs safe..."]="这场风暴已经肆虐得失去控制了！保护酒桶……"
G["This stout sure smells strong!"]="这酒闻起来真带劲！"
G["This strange new land has much to offer in the form of herbs and remedies, if you know what to look for."]="这片陌生的新土地上长满了各种草药和药石，但你要先学会如何去寻找它们。"
G["This stronghold is fortified, but our enemies close in from all sides. We would be wise to secure our position on the coast before advancing farther inland."]="这座要塞相当坚固，但我们的敌人从四面八方攻击我们。我们必须先在海岸上站稳脚跟，才能向内陆挺进。"
G["This structure violates at least 8 different ordinances!"]="这个建筑至少违反了八项条例。"
G["This stuff is so volatile, it probably shouldn't be moved. Much less... flown."]="这种物质有很强的爆炸性，它也许不应该被挪动，更不要说是……飞行了。"
G["This sun-blasted city is home to the Sandfury trolls, known for their particular ruthlessness and dark mysticism. Troll legends tell of a powerful sword called Sul'thraze the Lasher, a weapon capable of instilling fear and weakness in even the most formidable of foes. Long ago, the weapon was split in half. However, rumors have circulated that the two halves may be found somewhere within Zul'Farrak's walls."]="日光暴晒下的这座城市是沙怒巨魔的家园，他们一向以来都以其无情和黑暗魔法而闻名。巨魔传说中有一把强大的名叫鞭笞者苏萨斯的武器能够让最弱小的人可以击败最强大的敌人。很久以前，这把武器被分成了两半。然而，有传言说这两半可以在祖尔法拉克任何地方找到。"
G["This sure is exciting, isn't it?"]="这真的很刺激，不是吗？"
G["This symbol, I think I've seen this before..."]="这个标志……我以前可能见过……"
G["This system allows you to manually adjust\n the ammuniction and speed of your siege unit."]="本系统允许你手动调节\n攻城器械的弹药和速度。"
G["This system allows you to manually control\nthe power and speed of your siege unit."]="本系统允许你手动控制\n攻城器械的动力和速度。"
G["This tastes funny..."]="这味道很古怪……"
G["This tear in the fabric of time and space looks ominous.  Different scenes flash by at terrifying speed.  A very brave person might try to jump through at the right time..."]="在时间和空间构造上出现的这道裂痕看起来非常凶险。许多截然不同的景象从这道裂痕中以可怕的速度闪过。此时此刻，大概只有极为勇敢的人才会跳入其中……"
G["This teleportation device appears to have been used recently to teleport various goods deeper into the mine."]="看起来，这个传送设备最近被用来将物资传送到矿井深处。"
G["This teleporter will transport you to Grom'gol in Northern Stranglethorn.\n\nUsually.\n\nI mean, sometimes it'll just disintegrate you, or reduce all your soft tissues into a greenish, foul-smelling mist, but mostly it's safe!\n\n...mostly."]="这个传送器将把你传送至北荆棘谷的格罗姆高那里。\n\n通常都会是这样。\n\n我的意思是说，有时候它会把你分解，或者让你全身的软组织都变成散发着臭气的绿色烟雾。不过大多数情况下它还是安全的！\n\n……大多数情况。"
G["This teleporter will transport you to the irradiated ruins of Gnomeregan, deep beneath Dun Morogh.\n\nDon't worry, there's another one there that'll send you back here... well, if it doesn't turn you inside-out or transmogrify your organs into unstable organic explosives, that is!\n\nWell? What are you waiting for? Hop on in!"]="这个传送器将把你传送至丹莫罗地下深处，那个充满辐射的诺莫瑞根废墟。\n\n别担心，那里还有另一个传送器，可以把你送回到这里……嗯，它也有可能让你身体的里里外外彻底翻转过来，或者把你全身的组织变成不稳定的有机爆炸物，就是这样！\n\n怎么啦？你还在等什么？跳进去吧！"
G["This temple is the domain of the Ashtongue Brotherhood. I must ask you to leave - now."]="这座神殿属于灰舌兄弟会。我要求你立刻离开。"
G["This terrain is ours. Make them pay for every inch."]="这里是我们的。他们每进一步都得付出代价。"
G["This test has lasted too long.  You are not ready to be a champion."]="Esta prueba ha durado demasiado. No estás $glisto:lista; para ser $gun:una; $gCampeón:Campeona;."
G["This test has lasted too long.  You are not ready to be a valiant."]="Esta prueba ha durado demasiado. No estás $glisto:lista; para ser $gun:una; $gValeroso:Valerosa;."
G["This test is simple. All you need to do is strike the stone, until it breaks."]="这个测试很简单。你要做的就是击打石块，直到将其击碎。"
G["This test is simple. All you need to do is strike the wood, until it breaks."]="这个测试很简单。你要做的就是击打木板，直到它破裂。"
G["This the Great Rain Stone. We keep it safe and bring it shinies and it take care of us.\n\nHave more shinies for stone maybe?"]="这就是雨水巨石。我们保护它，向它供奉闪闪发亮的宝贝；它就会庇护我们。\n\n你有亮闪闪的宝贝吗？"
G["This thing could open Gallywix's personal safe!"]="这玩意儿连加里维克斯的私人保险箱都能打开！"
G["This thing is huge! Reverse the polarity on the Poultryizer. We'll have to shove it in through the outtake."]="这蛋可真大！掉转变鸡器的电极。我们得把它推进传送口里。"
G["This thing kind of reminds me of a Zed Power Nodule I once took half of Papa Wheeler's old garage out with."]="这东西让我想起Z型能量节点阀，有次我摆弄那个玩意儿的时候差点没把维勒老爹的旧车库炸掉一半。"
G["This thing should wreck that iron army. One better, it won't explode in your face, unlike some machines I've seen. Not saying names or anything, Blastwrench."]="这家伙能摧毁整支钢铁部队。而且它还不会突然爆炸……比我以前见过的某些机器上等多了。具体是什么机器，我就不提了。"
G["This thing should wreck that iron army. One better, it won't explode in your face... unlike some machines I've seen. Not saying names or anything."]="这家伙能摧毁整支钢铁部队。而且它还不会突然爆炸……比我以前见过的某些机器上等多了。具体是什么机器，我就不提了。"
G["This time of year is quite important to our Forsaken allies."]="我们的被遗忘者同盟在每年的这个时候都要举办重要的庆典。"
G["This time, I'm goin' t' kick yer rear!"]="这次，我要踢爆你的屁股！"
G["This timeway collapsed and reformed. The result was Stratholme of yore. What could possibly be happening inside?"]="这个时间流在塌缩后实现了重组，回归于往昔的斯坦索姆。什么样的事件正在其中上演呢？"
G["This timeway is in great disarray! We have agents inside right now attempting to restore order. What little information I have indicates that Thrall's freedom is in jeopardy. A malevolent organization known as the Infinite Dragonflight is trying to prevent his escape. I fear without outside assistance, all will be lost."]="这个时间流目前正处于极度的混乱中！我们派了一些人在里面努力恢复秩序。我所能告诉你的一点信息就是，萨尔的自由正在危难中。一个被称为永恒之龙的邪恶组织正在尝试阻止他的逃脱。我担心如果没有来自外界的帮助，一切都将无可挽回。"
G["This totem has been corrupting the eggs! It seems a greater threat looms. The Gnarlpine remain tainted by something most foul."]="这个图腾正在腐蚀这些蛋！这后面很可能隐藏着一个更加巨大的威胁。瘤背一族仍然在遭受某种极端邪恶的污染。"
G["This tournament is helping to form a strong, concerted force, though it may not appear obvious. When we're ready, the eyes of the Crusade and all its champions will turn toward Icecrown."]="锦标赛的目的就是要建立一支强大而团结的军队，虽然这个目标看上去并不十分明确。待到一切准备就绪，北伐军以及麾下所有勇士的目光就会转向冰冠冰川了。"
G["This tournament is the biggest event in ages! Buy something to bring home to your family and show your kids."]="本次锦标赛是数个世纪以来最盛大的赛事！买点纪念品回家送给家人和孩子吧！"
G["This tower is complete and utter madness. This isn't a library, it's a huge haystack of books and I don't think the needle even exists! Now, what was I doing?"]="这座塔完全陷入了疯狂。这不是个图书馆，只是个巨大的书堆，而我不觉得这里有我要找的东西！既然这样，我以前都在干什么？"
G["This tower powers the Hammer of Hodir. It is said to have the power to turn entire armies to ice!"]="这座塔为霍迪尔之锤提供能量。据说它可以把整支军队冻成冰块！"
G["This tracking pheromone will reveal to you targets of great value."]="这种追踪信息素会帮你发现有巨大价值的目标。"
G["This trail is bloody. You follow it to a nearby bush, where you find the remains of the creature's last meal."]="这些足迹中带有血污。你跟随着它们，找到了附近的一个灌木丛。这里隐藏着这只怪物吃过的猎物残骸。"
G["This training is really helping."]="这个训练真的很有帮助。"
G["This transgression against the Blue Dragonflight has been noted. I will take extra pleasure in separating the life energy from your body!"]="我们已经洞悉了这场针对蓝龙军团的侵犯行动。很快，我就会吸干你体内涌动的生命能量！"
G["This transmatter's the key to our survival. If we don't get it fully operational, we're goners for sure!"]="这台转换器是我们生存的关键。如果修不好它，我们就死定了！"
G["This tree stands as a symbol of hope. Hope that the land might in time be healed and made stronger by your deeds."]="这棵树就是希望的象征。但愿你所做的一切能让这片土地痊愈，并更加繁荣昌盛。"
G["This trial will test how far your skill can take you. It will never end; it only gets more challenging."]="这个试炼将考验你的技巧极限。它永不结束，只会越来越难。"
G["This troll complains about the food, but he eats more than any of us."]="这巨魔抱怨食物不好吃，但他吃的比谁都多。"
G["This troll was positively filthy."]="这个巨魔肯定是心术不正的坏蛋。"
G["This twisted world is beyond redemption, beyond the reach of deluded heroes. The only answer to corruption is destruction. And that begins... now."]="这扭曲的世界完了，被蒙蔽的英雄救不了它。清除堕落的唯一方法就是毁灭。就从现在……开始。"
G["This unfortunate Zandalari has been gored and trampled. The expression on his face is not one of fear, but one of steely determination, even in death.\n\nHis open eyes appear to burn with intense passion, even as they stare unblinking into the sky. A fly crawls along their still-moist surface."]="这个不幸的赞达拉巨魔已经被刺死被踩烂了。他脸上的表情并不是恐惧，而是一种视死如归的决心。\n\n他睁大的眼睛一眨不眨地瞪着天空，里面燃烧着狂热和兴奋。一只苍蝇在依然湿润的眼球上爬行着。"
G["This unit has been activated outside normal operating protocols. Downloading new operational parameters. Download complete. Full unit self defense routines are now active. Destruction of foreign units in the system shall now commence."]="此单位已经激活，脱离正常操作程序。正在下载新的操作参数。下载完成。单位完全自我防卫程序现在已被激活。对进入系统的外部单位进行清除，相关程序即将开始。"
G["This unit is busy. Please inquire later."]="本单元正在忙碌。请稍后查询。"
G["This unit is currently at ninety five percent operational efficiency."]="这个单位正以95%的工作效率运行。"
G["This unit is currently performing within normal parameters."]="这个单位正以通常工作状态运行。"
G["This unit is ready to serve."]="这个单位已经准备就绪了。"
G["This used to be a peaceful brewing village. Now, the horrors of war have already robbed our children of their innocence.\n\nTake your war elsewhere, $r."]="这里原本是个宁静的酿酒村。可现在，恐怖的战争已经让我们的孩子失去了天真。\n\n去别处打仗吧，$r。"
G["This valley is proof that our nightmares can become reality."]="我们的噩梦不是天方夜谭，这个山谷就是最好的证明。"
G["This vehicle looks like it's seen better days."]="这辆载具似乎也曾风光过。"
G["This vessel is empty."]="这具躯体已经空了。"
G["This view is terrible!"]="这视野太差了！"
G["This village has been peaceful for longer than I can remember. Our weapons are surely as rusty as our fighters."]="这村子打从我记事之前就一直平静得很。我们的武器肯定和我们的战士一样，锈得不会动了。"
G["This village has you to thank for their victory."]="这个村庄的胜利要归功于你。"
G["This village is normally so peaceful."]="这个村庄一向宁静怡人。"
G["This village is ours! Death to the trolls!"]="这个村子归我们了！巨魔统统去死吧！"
G["This village was built with Hui's approval, but that was many generations ago."]="这座村庄是经仇灰同意后建造的，那是在很久以前了。"
G["This virmen land now, you go!"]="这里是兔妖的地盘了，快走开！"
G["This virmen land!"]="这是兔妖的地盘！"
G["This wall cannot stop the might of the mantid!"]="这道长城阻止不了螳螂妖的力量！"
G["This wall is your grave!"]="长城就是你的坟墓！"
G["This wall of shadow will hold back the demons long enough for us to cross.\n\nWhen you and the other elves have crossed I will follow."]="Esta pared de sombras mantendrá a los demonios a raya lo suficiente para que crucemos.\n\nCuando tú y el resto de elfos hayáis cruzado, os seguiré."
G["This wanted poster has a bounty on bonelashers.  You think I should do that?"]="这个通缉令在悬赏白骨秃鹫。你觉得我应该揭榜吗？"
G["This wanted poster is adorned with an assortment of notices and rewards for all manner of dangerous activities.  However, you see nothing in particular that you feel you're cut out for yet.\n\nPerhaps you should check again at a later time?"]="这张悬赏单明细分得很清楚，各种冒险所能获得的奖励也列在了上面。然而，你还没找到适合你的悬赏内容。\n\n也许你应该稍后再来看看。"
G["This wanted poster says that they're offering gold to these so-called adventurers to go kill things.  Isn't that what we do?  I don't think I'm being paid enough!"]="这个通缉令上写的是，他们会聘请那些所谓的冒险家来猎杀某些东西。我们不就是干这个的吗？我可不觉得我赚得够多了！"
G["This war - and don't mistake this for anything but a war - is not going to win itself. If we do not fight, scratch, claw, and kick for every speck of land on this shattered world, all will be lost."]="这场战争——不要错误地认为它是除了战争以外的什么东西——是不会自动获胜的。如果我们不尽全力来为这块破碎世界的每一寸土地战斗，我们就会失去一切。"
G["This war has been an enormous drain upon our people and resources. Even here on Teldrassil, we cannot escape its repercussions. Forgive me for asking it of you, but would you perform a task for me?"]="这场战争夺去了很多人的性命，也耗费了大量的资源。即使是泰达希尔的人民也不能幸免于难。请原谅我做出这样的请求，你能帮我执行一项任务吗？"
G["This war has to end. Soon. Before it consumes our strength!"]="这场战争必须尽快结束。否则，它会耗尽我们的力量！"
G["This war's not over, it's only just begun!  We have brave men and women fighting our enemy inside Ahn'Qiraj day and night, $n.  It won't be long before the Qiraji city falls."]="¡Esta guerra no ha acabado sino que no ha hecho más que comenzar! Contamos con valientes hombres y mujeres que luchan día y noche contra el enemigo en el interior de Ahn'Qiraj, $n. La ciudad qiraji no tardará mucho en caer."
G["This was NOT in my contract!"]="我的契约上可没有这个！"
G["This was a good man, $r. We'd served together through many battles...\n\nThese beasts have a debt to pay!"]="这是个好人，$r。我们曾在多次战争中并肩作战……\n\n这些野兽有债要偿！"
G["This was a massacre.  A planned ambush?  Who do these elementals bend to?"]="这是一场屠杀。一次有计划的伏击？这些元素的目标到底是谁？"
G["This was a simple town to oversee for my father. We spent some days growing crops, others brewing. Once a year we would travel to other villages to trade. It was a life that we all enjoyed.\n\nNow, the echoes of war bounce all around us, and we must navigate these troublesome times with care. I only hope we may find a resolution quickly."]="这原本是一座由我爸爸负责治理的小村庄。我们农时耕种，闲时酿酒。我们每年都会造访其它村子一次，与那里的村民们互通有无。这种生活让我们感到怡然自得。\n\n现在，战斗的回音响彻四野，我们必须小心谨慎地度过眼下这个混乱时期。我只希望问题能尽快得到解决。"
G["This was an execution. Whoever did this was sending a message..."]="这是一次死刑裁决。不管是谁干的，都是为了传达一个信号……"
G["This was before the Cataclysm?"]="这是在大灾变之前的事？"
G["This was child's play."]="小孩子的把戏。"
G["This was going to be a walk in the park until that airhead over there came out of nowhere with an army of gnomes.\n\nGallywix will have my head if we let these creepy runts one-up us here."]="这里本来是一个美好而又安全的地方。但前面那片空地上突然就出现了一支侏儒军队。\n\n如果我们让那些卑鄙的小个子在这里打赢我们，加里维克斯一定会要我的脑袋。"
G["This was my fault, my lord. I should've done more research on those tablets..."]="这都是我的错，吾王。我应该对那些石板进行更多研究的……"
G["This was not supposed to be a combat mission."]="这本不该是一项战斗任务。"
G["This was not worth my time."]="这是在浪费我的时间。"
G["This was one of the royal cities of the elves in the days when Azshara was queen. In this city lie the keys to lore long lost and artifacts of unimaginable historical value."]="当艾萨拉还是精灵女王的时候，这里正是精灵皇室的都城之一。这里埋藏着让上古知识重现天日的关键，以及极具历史价值的古代遗物。"
G["This was the Ashbringer, fool! As the Scourge began to materialize around us, Mograine's blade began to glow... to hum... the younger Mograine would take that as a sign to make his escape. They descended upon us with a hunger the likes of which I had never seen. Yet..."]="但他们的对手是灰烬使者，笨蛋！在天灾军士兵将我们团团围起来之前，莫格莱尼的剑就发出淡淡的红光，并嗡嗡地响了起来……想必小莫格莱尼就是在看到了这个以后开始逃跑的。很快天灾士兵就出现了，带着一种饥饿的眼神看着我们，那种凶残是我所从未见过的。但是……"
G["This was the site of a great battle.  Many great battles."]="这儿就是那场声势浩大的战争的遗址。那些伟大的战争啊。"
G["This water looks pretty good over here."]="这里的水看起来很不错。"
G["This water seems a little too... what's that word? Oh yeah, clean."]="这水似乎有点太……怎么说的来着？哦，太干净了。"
G["This way - the Zandalari are falling back!"]="这边——赞达拉撤退了！"
G["This way!"]="这边！"
G["This way!  Stay with me."]="这边！跟着我。"
G["This way! We're about to mount an assault on the Scourgelord's location!"]="走这边！我们就要对天灾领主的领地发动袭击了！"
G["This way, $g sir:ma'am;."]="$g先生:女士;，这边走。"
G["This way, $n. The ceremony is about to begin."]="这边走，$n。典礼马上就要开始了。"
G["This way, $n. We will take them by surprise."]="这边走，$n。我们要让他们大吃一惊。"
G["This way, Kiryn."]="这边，琪麟。"
G["This way, Sully! I see the perfect spot."]="这边，苏利！我找到一个很好的地方。"
G["This way, boy.  I'll take you to our nice stables in the back."]="这边走。后面有我们最好的兽栏。"
G["This way. Stay together now!"]="这边走。聚在一起，别走散了！"
G["This way. The doors can only be opened from within."]="这边。这些门只能从内侧开启。"
G["This week it could be eye of newt, or perhaps a treasure map. You'll never know unless you look. What could Antonio have?"]="这一周可能有蝾螈的眼睛出售，下一周又可能是一张藏宝图。除非你亲眼看到，否则你永远都不会知道安东尼奥在卖什么！赶快来看看吧！"
G["This whole keep is going to collapse!"]="这座城堡就要塌了！"
G["This whole place is going to blow up! Let's go!"]="这地方快要爆炸了！快跑！"
G["This whole place is gonna blow!"]="这个地方就要爆炸了！"
G["This whole place is gonna blow. Get to the exit!"]="这里就要爆炸了，赶快出去！"
G["This whole situation is highly unprofitable. You must bring the Trade Prince back into line, $n!"]="现在的整个局面都非常不利。你必须把贸易大王找回来，$n！"
G["This whole situation seems a bit paranoid, don't you think?"]="这件事太可疑了，你觉得呢？"
G["This will be a battle to tell your friends about, Eli."]="这将是一场值得你去向朋友们炫耀的战斗，伊莱。"
G["This will be a fine test, Prince Arthas."]="这真是最好的试炼，阿尔萨斯王子殿下。"
G["This will be a tough fight, $n. Follow me closely!"]="这将是一场艰难的战事，$n。跟我来吧！"
G["This will be completed if I have to destroy all of you to get it done!"]="是不是非要我大开杀戒，你们才能完成维修工事啊！"
G["This will be my best experiment yet!"]="这将会是我最成功的试验！"
G["This will be nothing when compared to the satisfaction I will feel when I crush your skull beneath my heel."]="击败你是我莫大的享受。"
G["This will be the bomb."]="这个可以当炸弹。"
G["This will be your END."]="今天就是你的末日。"
G["This will be your last incursion against the Scourge!"]="这将是你最后一次和天灾军团作对了！"
G["This will begin a solo scenario. Are you sure you wish to proceed?"]="这将是一个单人场景战役。你确定要继续吗？"
G["This will do nicely.  Now to the task at hand!"]="就是它了。现在开始行动！"
G["This will keep you occupied!"]="¡Esto te mantendrá $gocupado:ocupada;!"
G["This will make for a good story, don'tcha think?"]="这会是一个很精彩的故事的，你不觉得吗？"
G["This will make me feel a tad safer from those murlocs.  Thank you."]="远离那些鱼人会让我的心里多那么一点儿安全感。谢谢你。"
G["This will not be an easy fight to win."]="这场仗可没那么好打。"
G["This will not be the end of the Scarlet Crusade!  You will not break our line!"]="血色十字军不会就此灭亡的！你不会冲破我们的战线的！"
G["This will not be the last you hear of me.  I will return to spit on your corpse after Utgarde's armies have descended upon you!"]="这绝不是你最后一次看见我。等乌特加德的大军将你践踏至渣后，我还会回来朝你的尸体吐口水！"
G["This will not stop us..."]="这阻止不了我们……"
G["This will only take a moment."]="这只需要一小会儿。"
G["This will take a while to heat up, so its time for a drink! What do you say Tongus?"]="喝之前一定要热一热才带劲！你刚刚说什么了？"
G["This will take some getting used to.\n\nI struggle to resist the urge to rip the heads from these creatures."]="这还需要适应。\n\n我得努力忍住把这些家伙的脑袋揪下来的冲动。"
G["This will work -- keep heading through this gap.  The path to Un'Goro is due west of here once we round these infernal bugs."]="这会起作用的——继续穿越这条沟壑。一旦我们绕过这些地狱昆虫，通往安戈洛的道路就在这里正西边。"
G["This won't bring him back."]="这也不能让他活过来。"
G["This won't do at all! We have to secure the foundation or the entire structure will crumble!"]="这是什么玩意啊？！我们必须保护地基，否则这房子会全部倒塌的！"
G["This won't do; it'll be brittle once it cools off.  Smelt the metal, we'll use it for ammunition."]="这样不行；冷却之后金属就会变脆。把它们熔了吧，还能做成弹药用用。"
G["This won't hurt a bit."]="这一点都不疼的。"
G["This won't take long, did it?"]="不会太久吧？"
G["This won't take long."]="这用不了太长时间。"
G["This won't work at all! The buildings will surely collapse if we do not shore up the support beams."]="太可怕了！如果我们不加固这根支柱的话，这座房子肯定会倒塌的。"
G["This world has been damaged in ways beyond what our eyes can see.  Even the passage of time feels different somehow."]="这个世界遭受了许多我们肉眼看不到的破坏。甚至是时间的通路都感觉有些异常。"
G["This world has enough heroes."]="这个世界的英雄够多了。"
G["This world is OURS!"]="这个世界是我们的！"
G["This world is coming to an end. Let. It. Burn."]="世界即将终结。就·让·它·燃·烧·吧。"
G["This world is imperfect!  We must begin anew!"]="这个世界充满了瑕疵！我们必须开始一个全新的世界！"
G["This world is not for you!"]="这个世界不是你们的！"
G["This world is so different."]="这个世界真是太与众不同了。"
G["This world shall burn!"]="这个世界将被烈焰吞噬！"
G["This world that you seek to destroy is our home."]="你想要毁灭的世界是我们的家园。"
G["This world unravels. If you could see the horrors I have seen..."]="这个世界分崩离析。要是你能看到我所目睹的恐怖之景……"
G["This world will be consumed by the elements!"]="整个世界都将被元素吞噬！"
G["This world will burn before the might of the Warchief!"]="这个世界将在酋长的力量下燃烧！"
G["This world will burn!"]="让这个世界燃烧吧！"
G["This world will burn."]="世界将燃起熊熊大火。"
G["This would be a lot easier if I could see."]="如果我能看见就好了。"
G["This would never have happened to Ironforge!"]="铁炉堡绝不会发生这种事！"
G["This yak was male! The angry yak turns on you!"]="这头牦牛是公的！愤怒的公牛朝你冲过来了！"
G["This year's harvest yielded more than just crops!"]="今年的收成不仅包括庄稼！"
G["This young tuskarr appears to have been slain in combat rather than drowned."]="这名年轻的海象人似乎经历过一场激烈的打斗，不像是淹死的。"
G["This your fault!"]="都是你的错！"
G["This'll be my third time now."]="我这已经是第三次了。"
G["This'll keep da rebellion around a little longer. Orgrimmar will fall!"]="这可以让起义军再多坚持一段时间。奥格瑞玛必将陷落！"
G["This'll make fer a great a story to tell the grandkids, that's fer sure... if I be livin' long enough to have any, that is."]="我一定会把这个故事讲给我的孙子听……只要我能活到抱孙子的那一天。"
G["This'll teach you to mind your own business!"]="这会让你明白别管闲事的道理！"
G["This... \"filth\" defeated the adjunct and saw to my Wakening."]="Esta... \"escoria\" derrotó al súbdito y me despertó."
G["This... changes nothing. Eternal damnation awaits you!"]="这……无法改变什么！永恒的诅咒在与你同在！"
G["This... is amazing... an untapped store of raw arcane energy."]="这……太神奇了……一种未被开发原始奥术能量。"
G["This... is not over!"]="还……没有完呢！"
G["This... is only... the beginning, mortals! You will... ALL DIE!"]="这……只是……开始，凡人们！你们……全都要死！"
G["This... isn't how it's supposed to... end."]="这不是……我想要的……结局。"
G["This... no... good..."]="不……好……"
G["This... this is a joke, right?"]="这……这只是个玩笑吧？"
G["This... this is perfect!  This disguise shall be my masterpiece!"]="这……这太完美了！这件伪装服简直是我的旷世杰作！"
G["This... whole... operation... HAS BEEN COMPROMISED!"]="整个……计划……都被破坏了！"
G["This...this is a weakling's weapon! I want something bigger."]="这……这是懦夫用的武器！我想要一些大家伙！"
G["This? This is me taking control of you. This is me setting up my final revenge!"]="怎么回事？你被我控制了！我是来复仇的！"
G["Thisalee tells me that the harpies are in league with the dragons? But something doesn't add up. We need to know more.\n\nPlease assist Choluna with her work here, and see if we can tie this all together..."]="希萨莉告诉我，鹰身人和龙结成了联盟？可有些事情却怎么都说不通。我们必须了解更多才行。\n\n请在此协助楚伦娜的工作，看看我们能否将这一切都串连起来……"
G["Thish apple looks delishush. Thanksh!"]="这些苹果看起来很好吃。谢谢！"
G["Thish ish really neat $n. Thanksh, buddy."]="这是很整洁，$n。谢谢你，哥们。"
G["Tholo and I are joining the Firelands invasion effort. Live together, fight together, die together. That's what brothers are for!"]="索罗和我一起加入了火焰之地战役。我们并肩作战，同生共死。这才是战火中的兄弟！"
G["Tholo and I have been through so much together. I always know he's watching out for me."]="我和索罗一起度过了无数难关。我知道他一定会为了我而格外留心。"
G["Tholo's Thermometer is ready to take a sample."]="索罗的温度计已经就绪，可以取样了。"
G["Tholo's Thermometer shows no reading here."]="索罗的温度计在这里显示不出读数。"
G["Tholo... is that you...?"]="索罗……是你吗……？"
G["Thonk is waiting for you at the top of the tower, $c."]="索恩克正在塔顶等着你，$c。"
G["Thorfin Stoneshield came to us all the way from Ironforge to bring us his expertise in hunting.  If you don't mind breathing the smoke filled air of the Dwarven District then you'll find him at his house in the northeast area of the district."]="索尔芬·石盾从铁炉堡而来，让我们见识到了什么叫真正的狩猎艺术。如果你不介意被烟熏得泪流满面，就到矮人区去找他吧。他的屋子就在那个区域的东北部。"
G["Thorim lost it.  He lashed out against his most beloved allies, the frost giants.\n\nThat's one reason why to this day, this land is torn apart by the war between the Hyldnir and the Sons of Hodir... and why Thorim has exiled himself to the Temple of Storms."]="托里姆失去了理智。他将矛头指向了他的亲密战友，冰霜巨人。\n\n这导致了海德尼尔和霍迪尔之子至今仍在这片土地上互相攻伐……托里姆也因此离开了风暴神殿。"
G["Thorim! Come, show yourself!"]="托里姆！快出来吧！"
G["Thorim's Hammer online. Acquiring target."]="已启动托里姆之锤。正在获取目标。"
G["Thorim, my lord!  Why else would these invaders have come into your sanctum but to slay you?  They must be stopped!"]="托里姆，我的陛下！这些入侵者闯入您的圣殿，除了来杀您，还会有别的意图吗？您必须阻止他们！"
G["Thorium Brotherhood or not, if one of them Dark Iron gets near to me they'll taste my mattock up the side of their head!  Now, where can I send ya $G lad : lass;?"]="不管我是不是瑟银兄弟会的，只要有个黑铁矮人敢靠近我，我一定会让他们尝尝我的厉害！现在，你想去哪里呢，$g小伙子:小姑娘;？"
G["Thorson's Post - coming right up!"]="索尔森的岗哨——就在前面！"
G["Those Alliance scum will learn what it is to anger the Horde!"]="那些联盟渣滓会明白，激怒部落是什么下场！"
G["Those Mantid are protecting the towers, $p. Take them out or we won't be able to land any shots."]="那些螳螂妖想要保护塔楼，$p。消灭它们，否则我们无法进攻。"
G["Those Zandalari will regret attacking Zouchin!"]="那些赞达拉巨魔会后悔进犯卓金村的！"
G["Those Zandalari won't know what hit them when I'm done!"]="那些赞达拉巨魔到死都不会知道是什么击中了他们！"
G["Those archers are keeping a close watch over the shipping area."]="那些弓箭手密切监视着港区。"
G["Those are FURBOLGS."]="那是熊怪。"
G["Those are Horde vessels... General quarters! Get our birds in the air. Clear the decks. Stations, people. Let's go to war!"]="那是部落的船。全船战备部署！各就各位，准备战斗。打起精神来，弟兄们。大战一场！"
G["Those are cowards."]="他们是胆小鬼。"
G["Those are mine! I stole them first!"]="那是我的！我先偷到的！"
G["Those are the casualties of war!"]="那是战争的代价！"
G["Those aren't gnolls, silly. Use your eyes."]="那可不是豺狼人，笨蛋。睁大你的眼睛瞧瞧。"
G["Those beasts are amazing specimens. You should feel no shame at being bested by them."]="那些猛兽实在是令人惊愕。被他们打败绝不是什么羞耻的事情。"
G["Those boys always come over here and cause trouble and scare the poor, little rats."]="那些男孩经常跑来跑去引起各种麻烦，还惊吓那些可怜的小老鼠。"
G["Those cabbages should be ready any minute now... wait for it..."]="卷心菜马上就好了……稍等一下……"
G["Those damned peasants need to work faster! I wanna get back home to Ironforge. I surely do miss my wife and children."]="让那群该死的农夫赶紧干活啊！我好想回到铁炉堡。实在是太想念我的老婆和孩子了。"
G["Those days are over, Eris."]="那段历史已经结束了，艾瑞斯。"
G["Those filthy beasts are all over the place.\n\nIf you prefer hunting outdoors, you'll find most of them around Plaguewood and Terrordale, with a good concentration of them in the Terrorweb tunnel. They are also likely to appear at almost any Scourge encampment in the Eastern Plaguelands.\n\nIf you're a hearty dungeon crawler, you'll find a good lot of them in Stratholme and a few of the necrofiend variety in Scholomance."]="这些污秽的野兽爬满了四处。\n\n如果你喜欢户外狩猎的话，你可以轻松地在病木林和恐惧谷找到它们的，恶蛛隧道里也有大量生存。当然，任何东瘟疫之地的天灾营地里也都会有它们的身影。\n\n此外，如果你真是一个特别优秀的地下城冒险专家的话，你还能在斯坦索姆找到一些，而通灵学院里也有一些通灵魔。"
G["Those filthy mutts forced me out of Fenris Keep, I won't be forced out of my camp as well!"]="那些肮脏的笨蛋强迫我离开了芬里斯城堡，我绝不会再被赶出我的营地！"
G["Those fools! What have they done! What horrors do they hold? And for what purpose? I will need your help again, hero. Help us. Help your people."]="那些笨蛋！他们都干了些什么！他们都监禁了一些什么恐怖的东西？又是什么目的？我仍然需要你的帮助，英雄。帮助我们。帮助你的人民。"
G["Those goblins should be ashamed of themselves.  Bah!"]="这些地精应该为他们的行为感到羞耻。呸！"
G["Those gorillas look angry, friend, but challenging them may well be worth the risk!"]="那些大猩猩看起来又愤怒又危险，朋友，但挑战他们总是能获得不错的回报！"
G["Those green dirtbags down there plagued your homes in Southshore, laid siege to your children in Redridge, and massacred every man, woman and child in Theramore."]="下面那些绿皮渣滓摧毁了你们在南海镇的家园，封锁了孩子们在赤脊山玩耍的乐土，还把塞拉摩的妇孺屠杀殆尽。"
G["Those had better not be evacuation papers I see."]="但愿我看到的那些纸不是疏散令。"
G["Those imps you had delivered... they woke up and started shooting fireballs at everybody!  It was chaos!"]="你送来的那些小鬼……他们一醒过来，就开始向所有人丢火球！一切都乱套了！"
G["Those innocent pterodactyl hatchlings now have a chance at a real life."]="现在，那些无辜的翼手龙雏龙终于有机会过上真正的生活了。"
G["Those mogu belong to a tribe called the Korune."]="那些魔古族属于一个叫做寇茹的部族。"
G["Those noble hunters found a way to survive on their own. Fire was the key. They drew up oil from the ground. They used it to heat their homes, cook their food, and burn their enemies. They grew STRONG."]="那些高尚的猎手想出了自给自足的办法。其中火是关键。他们从地下掘油，用火来温暖房屋，烧饭做菜，烧灼敌人。他们变得强大起来了。"
G["Those of the Explorers' League and The Reliquary are very much alike: Archaeology is our religion, yet we have both fallen from the pure faith.\nOur methods have not differed as much as they pretend. We are but a shadowy reflection of them.\nIt would take only a nudge to make them like us. To push them out of the light..."]="La Liga de Expedicionarios y El Relicario se parecen mucho: la arqueología es nuestra religión, pero ambos nos hemos alejado de la fe pura.\n\nNuestros métodos no han diferido tanto como ellos pretenden. Somos un reflejo oscuro de ellos.\n\nHaría falta muy poco para que se vuelvan como nosotros. Alejarlos de la luz..."
G["Those orcs took my wife and tossed her into the water when she tried to protect the goods we were bringing to Stormwind! You can't let them get away with this!"]="我妻子想要保护我们运往暴风城的货物，结果却被那群兽人抓去丢进了海里！你决不能让他们轻易逃脱！"
G["Those other women are just friends, baby."]="其她那些女人只是普通朋友，亲爱的。"
G["Those piles of blue-ish crystals we find on the ground."]="就是我们在这里找到的这堆蓝水晶。"
G["Those relics are going to fetch a lot of gold just as soon as I can find the time to get back to town and find a buyer."]="只要等我找到合适的时机返回城镇并找到买家，那些遗物就能为我换回一大堆金币。"
G["Those ruins creep me out. They're so old..."]="那些废墟真吓人。它们太古老了……"
G["Those scorpid are moving the towers! Take them out!"]="那些蝎子在移动塔楼！消灭它们！"
G["Those shoes match your eyes real nice."]="这些鞋子配上你的眼睛真是太漂亮了。"
G["Those smelly boys love scaring the poor, cute, little rats."]="那些臭小子就喜欢吓唬又可怜又可爱的小老鼠们。"
G["Those sneaky monkeys ambushed me out of nowhere."]="那些鬼鬼祟祟的猴子莫名其妙地伏击了我。"
G["Those spearthrowers are still firing. Don't you like destroying stuff, $c?"]="那些掷矛者还在攻击。你难道不想消灭他们吗，$c？"
G["Those statues wield the power of the first emperor. Destroy them!"]="那些雕像掌握着始皇帝的力量。摧毁他们！"
G["Those that came on the Skyfire are the Alliance's finest. Still, there're some things that only the SI:7 can pull off."]="天火号上的那些人都是联盟精英。但有些事情，仍然只有军情七处可以办到。"
G["Those that dare play with fire will be incinerated!"]="玩火者必自焚！"
G["Those that speak to me from on high in Ogri'la will be most pleased with the information that you bring."]="奥格瑞拉得知你给我们带来的信息之后肯定会十分高兴的。"
G["Those that surrendered are being taken to the Violet Hold. I make no guarantees about those who chose to fight."]="投降的人将被送去紫罗兰监狱。而选择对抗的人，我不保证他们的性命。"
G["Those thieving elementals are up the path, this way.  Good luck, $n."]="如果沿着这条路前进就会碰到那些元素生物，所以还是走那边吧。祝你好运, $n。"
G["Those things eat fish! Watch out!"]="那些东西会吃鱼的！小心！"
G["Those tonks are dangerous!"]="那些坦克很危险！"
G["Those weapons ain't gonna build themselves! Faster!"]="这些武器是不会自动锻造好的！再快一点！"
G["Those were some amazing fights!"]="真是几场漂亮的对决！"
G["Those were some impressive feats of strength you displayed today. Well done!"]="你今天展示的卓越战技真是令我们大开眼界啊。干得好！"
G["Those who are not of the earth must be destroyed!"]="与大地作对的人就只有死路一条！"
G["Those who behold the starlight must forever protect it!"]="那些珍爱星光的人必须永远保护它！"
G["Those who meddle with the timeways for their own selfish ends are often dangerous.\nIt is for this reason I joined Wardens, staunch defenders of the Timewalkers.\nWe guard the Watchers and Weavers as they go about their tasks."]="Las personas que manipulan las líneas temporales para su propio beneficio suelen ser muy peligrosas.\n\nPor eso me uní a los celadores, los defensores de los Caminantes del Tiempo.\n\nProtegemos a los tejedores y a los vigías mientras desempeñan sus tareas."
G["Those who oppose him will be destroyed utterly, and those who serve -- who serve wholly, unquestioningly, with utter devotion of mind and soul -- elevated to heights beyond your ken."]="反抗者必将被毁灭。而那些全身心的，坚定不移的，有虔诚的思想与灵魂的效忠者们，必将得到超乎你们想象范畴的强大的力量。"
G["Those who participate in the Brewmaster scenarios will earn valor. And if you find any rare items as you adventure with a Brewmaster, they are yours to keep!"]="参加酒仙场景战役的人可赢得勇气。要是你在与酒仙一同冒险时发现任何罕见物品，尽管将其收入囊中！"
G["Those who seek power through force will often find themselves alone in it."]="那些试图通过武力夺取政权的人往往会发现自己孤单。"
G["Those who stand against us will receive no mercy!"]="不要对妨碍我们的敌人心慈手软！"
G["Those who steal from the mogu will be punished."]="严惩窃取魔古族权柄之徒。"
G["Those who would speak out against magic are enemies of progress."]="那些公开反对魔法的家伙都是潜在的敌人。"
G["Those who you once considered friends, or even those you might have loved, are now your sworn adversaries."]="也许他们曾经是你们的好友，甚至是爱人，现在都将成为不共戴天的仇敌。"
G["Those who've defiled this temple have all been defeated.  All but one!"]="那些玷污这座神殿的家伙已经全部被打败了。除了一个人之外！"
G["Those yaungol have straight swords. Straight. Swords."]="那些野牛人手握直剑。直。剑。"
G["Those zombies are slow. You don't have to run right through them. Don't let them eat your brains, $n!"]="那些僵尸的速度很慢。你不必一直冲到他们里面去就能把他们逐一打倒。小心不要让他们吃到你的脑子，$n！"
G["Those zombies are so slow. It's a turkey shoot out there!"]="那些僵尸的速度很慢。射击他们就像打火鸡一样容易！"
G["Those zombies are so slow. It's a turkey shoot out there!\n\nNeed any training before you head out?"]="那些僵尸的速度很慢。射击他们就像打火鸡一样容易！\n\n现在你需要进行训练吗？"
G["Those'll net me a nice profit when I return from the South Seas."]="从南海回来后那些东西就能卖大价钱了。"
G["Those..."]="他们……"
G["Thoth can teach you Inscription in The Crystal Hall."]="水晶大厅的索斯能教你铭文技能。"
G["Thoth'al amun Ree'thael vormos! Vormos! Vormos!"]="¡Thoth'al amun Ree'thael vormos! ¡Vormos! ¡Vormos!"
G["Thou detestable maw, thou womb of death; I enforce thy rotten jaws to open!"]="无情的泥土，我要擘开你的馋吻!"
G["Thou smilest... upon the stroke that... murders me."]="你杀了我……却洋洋得意。"
end)(AscensionCN.GossipEN2ES)
;(function(G)
G["Though Dunshire is known throughout the province for its famous pies, this is still, first and foremost, a mining town. And if the mine falls, the whole town's economy will suffer before long."]="Aunque Dunshire es conocido en toda la provincia por sus famosas empanadas, esto sigue siendo, ante todo, una ciudad minera. Y si la mina se derrumba, la economía del pueblo entero sufrirá antes de mucho."
G["Though I cannot offer you training, young $c, I can give you my blessing.  Walk boldly in the Light!\n\nIs there anything else?"]="虽然我不能训练你，年轻的$c，但我可以给你我的祝福。在圣光中大胆地前进吧！\n\n还有别的事情吗？"
G["Though I cannot offer you training, young $c, I can give you my blessing. Walk boldly in the Light!"]="年轻的$c，虽然我没法训练你，可我依然祝福你。在圣光的庇护下大胆前进吧！"
G["Though I find the cool grass which covers Teldrassil as good a bed as any, the beds which Saelienne keeps at the Inn in Craftsman's Terrace are quite suitable for those with a taste for luxury."]="尽管我可以将覆盖着整个泰达希尔的草坪当作很好的床铺，但是工匠区中塞琳尼经营的旅馆对那些享受一下奢华生活的人来说再合适不过了。"
G["Though I hate to admit it, the bear did get the better of me. My oh my, that's one big ol' bear!\n\nNonetheless, if you can take that bear down, it'd be a feat to be proud of! It gave more than a few of our best hunters some trouble.\n\n<He claps you on the back.>\n\nBest the bear and we'll accept you as a regular member of the Farstrider Lodge."]="尽管我不愿承认，但是熊确实打败了我。我的天，那是一只体型庞大的熊！\n\n但是，如果你能打败那只熊的话，那可是一件值得骄傲的事儿！既便是我们中最好的猎人，也为此头痛不已。\n\n<他拍着你的背。>\n\n打败熊吧，你将成为旅行者营地中一名合格的成员的。"
G["Though I move on in peace, you all have my undying gratitude. Thank you for freeing me from the curse of my folly and greed."]="尽管我要就此长眠了，但临走前我还是要向你们表达我的感激。谢谢你将我从这因愚蠢和贪婪所导致的诅咒中解脱出来。"
G["Though a small corruption lingers, desperately longing to be cleansed, the boughs of Teldrassil itself seem changed.  Growth has begun anew."]="虽然还残留有少量急需清除的腐化物，但泰达希尔似乎已经开始萌生新枝了。新生已然开始。"
G["Though as I have always said, better dead than worgen."]="但就像我说过的那样，死亡也要比变成狼人更好。"
G["Though exiled as a heretic, my beliefs still ring true--that alone drives me onward. But for my destiny to be complete, I need the aid of an outsider... one not of any centaur tribe.\n\nThe task requires someone to enter the holy halls of Maraudon--a temple my people protect, and only the most devout are ever allowed to enter.\n\nIf you agree to aid me, then you need only nod. I will pass you a parchment with my instructions on it. Read it over and consider my words."]="尽管我被当作异教徒，我仍然坚持自己的信仰——这信仰指引着我不断前进。但是要完成我的使命，我需要他人的帮助……这人只要不是半人马就行。\n\n任务需要你进入玛拉顿神圣的大厅——我的人民守护着这座神殿，只有最虔诚的人才可以进去。\n\n如果你同意帮助我的话，就点点头吧。我会给你一张羊皮纸，上面写着我给你指示。好好看看。"
G["Though many flames are fought over, extinguished and re-lit, all are welcome to show honor to the flame, $c.\n\nHere among the Earthen Ring, we simply honor the flame, rather than engage in other frivolities.\n\nHere, we will honor the flame as tradition dictates.  Will you join with us in honoring the flame, $n?"]="Todos son bienvenidos para honrar a la llama, $c. Aunque se combaten muchas llamas, se apagan y se vuelven a encender. Aquí, en el Anillo de la Tierra, simplemente honramos a la llama en vez de dedicarnos a asuntos más banales.\n\nAquí honramos a la llama tal y como dicta la tradición. ¿Deseas unirte a nosotros para honrar a la llama, $n?"
G["Though mighty, we only knew of violence..."]="虽然我们很强大，但却只知道暴力……"
G["Though my compatriots would have you take an active role in what is transpiring in Zul'Drak, we Zandalari are primarily here to witness what is occurring and to chronicle the end of an empire."]="我的同胞或许会让你探索祖达克的秘密，但是赞达拉氏族始终肩负着见证历史的使命，并将如实地记载巨魔帝国毁灭的篇章。"
G["Though the Crossroads seems to be the center of activity in The Barrens, I prefer the quietude of Camp Taurajo.  Where shall I send you?"]="虽然十字路口似乎是贫瘠之地的中心地带，但是我更喜欢陶拉祖营地的安静。你想去哪儿？"
G["Though the acquisition of wealth is no longer a driving force in our lives, we understand that money makes the world go 'round. You will find our auction house in the Seat of the Naaru."]="尽管获取财富已经不是我们生活的动力了，但我们仍懂得有钱能使鬼推磨的道理。你可以在纳鲁之座找到我们的拍卖行。"
G["Though the peak is safe, the areas around it are not.  Be more careful!"]="虽然山峰很安全，但附近那些地方可不一定。多加小心！"
G["Though the sounds of battle are still near, we also hear the song of these crystals."]="即使是战争的喧嚣，也无法阻止我们聆听水晶中传出的美妙歌声。"
G["Though these Pandarens - my friends - have died, we know that through their sacrifice, and your noble works, Pandaria lives on."]="尽管这些熊猫人——我的朋友们——都已经倒下，但我们知道，通过他们的牺牲和你所付出的可贵努力，潘达利亚将继续焕发生机。"
G["Though this artifact seems to be in pristine condition, you sense nothing particularly special about it."]="虽然这件神器来自远古时代，但你无法感觉到它散发出任何特殊的气息。"
G["Though we do not truly understand the traditions of Winter Veil, we have taken to them."]="尽管我们并不完全理解冬幕节的传统，但是……入乡随俗。"
G["Though we face great conflict, our might combined shall obliterate those who would oppose us! The grave injustices committed against the Horde will be met by an unstoppable force of reckoning!"]="虽然我们面临着巨大的分歧，但只要我们齐心协力，就一定能消灭敌人！所有对部落的不公正都将被势不可挡的力量碾碎！"
G["Though we have our new home, our immortal lives have not been restored."]="虽然我们已经有了新的家园，我们不朽的生命却依然没有得到恢复。"
G["Though we may die, from our passing blossoms new life. This is the truth that we live, work, and die for."]="虽然我们也许会死，但我们的消逝将会催生新的生命。这就是我们为之生存、努力和牺牲的真理。"
G["Though we've arrived at the promised land, $n, much work remains to be done.  Our people won't reach Kael'thas if we lunge desperately across Outland.\n\nSafe routes must be found, resources must be secured and our enemies must be avoided or destroyed."]="Aunque hemos llegado a la tierra prometida, $n, aún queda mucho por hacer. Nuestra gente no llegará a Kael'thas si nos lanzamos a la desesperada a través de Terrallende.\n\nDebemos encontrar rutas seguras, asegurarnos los recursos y esquivar o destruir a nuestros enemigos."
G["Though you are compelled, the choice, and the last step before you leap, are yours. You have twenty more seconds to decide."]="虽说我提出了要求，不过你可以选择跳或是不跳。我给你20秒做决定。"
G["Though you will be surrounded by foes greater than you can imagine, your fortitude shall allow you to endure. Remember this in the times ahead."]="虽然被强大得超乎想象的敌人包围，毅力还是让你坚持了下来。在未来的日子里，请记住这一课。"
G["Though your sinews tire and your blood flows from cuts and wounds to this sodden ground, you fight for the spirits of your world.  No evil force can stand against us!"]="尽管你们的肌肉疲惫不堪，你们的鲜血浸透了这片土地，但是你们是在为了这个世界而战。任何邪恶的力量都挡不住我们！"
G["Thought I couldn't handle them? Don't let my size be follin' ya. Anyway, thanks for the hand."]="你以为我对付不了他们？不要因为我矮就瞧不起我。不管怎样，还是要感谢你的帮忙。"
G["Thousand Needles has been swallowed by the South Sea. Thalanaar is submerged!"]="千针石林被南海吞噬。萨兰纳尔已沉入水底！"
G["Thousand Needles lies in ruins under hundreds of feet of water. Can you spare any braves to assist us?"]="千针石林深埋在数百尺深的水底。你有勇气帮助我们吗？"
G["Thousand Needles lies in ruins under hundreds of feet of water. Can you spare any goblins to assist us?"]="化为废墟的千针石林沉没在数百尺深的水底。你能派些地精来帮助我们吗？"
G["Thousands of years ... without new playthings ... I will enjoy this."]="几千年没见过新玩具了……我会好好享受的。"
G["Thrall Hall!"]="萨尔万岁！"
G["Thrall Hall, $n! Here to help kill some misguided dwarves and gnomes?"]="萨尔万岁，$n！你是要帮我们消灭那些可恶的矮人和侏儒吗？"
G["Thrall and Saurfang have already gone down below."]="萨尔和萨鲁法尔已经下去了。"
G["Thrall be me brother, I hope he be safe."]="萨尔是我的兄弟，但愿他安然无恙。"
G["Thrall grunts and thinks a moment on what to do with the Trade Prince."]="萨尔咕哝着思考了一会儿，琢磨该拿贸易大王怎么办。"
G["Thrall has escaped!  Don't let him get away!"]="萨尔逃跑了！不要让他跑掉！"
G["Thrall is not here to save you this time, Darkspear. Slink away to the shadows, for I shall hunt every last one of you down."]="这次萨尔不会来拯救你们了，暗矛巨魔。躲到阴影中去吧，我会将你们逐一猎杀。"
G["Thrall is using all of his power to stabilize the rift from Azeroth's side.  We are doing what we can to stabilize it here as well."]="萨尔在艾泽拉斯一侧使用他的全部力量稳定着这道裂隙。我们也在这边尽力维持裂隙的稳定。"
G["Thrall must be told of this day's events."]="必须让萨尔知道这一切。"
G["Thrall startles the horse with a fierce yell!"]="萨尔的怒吼使马匹都为之战栗！"
G["Thrall tries to calm the horse down."]="萨尔试着让马平静下来。"
G["Thrall was killed! Attack Corrupted Slimes to prevent damage to him."]="萨尔被杀死了！攻击腐蚀软泥怪以使他避免受到伤害。"
G["Thrall will never be free!"]="萨尔不可能逃脱！"
G["Thrall will remain a slave. Taretha will die. You have failed."]="萨尔仍将是个奴隶。塔蕾莎会死去。你失败了。"
G["Thrall!  I am glad ya be well.  Dere were rumors otherwise."]="萨尔，很高兴你一切平安。我听到了可怕的消息。"
G["Thrall!  My lord... are you all right?"]="萨尔大人……你还好吧？"
G["Thrall! Come outside and face your fate!"]="萨尔！出来面对你的命运吧！"
G["Thrall! You didn't really think you would escape, did you?  You and your allies shall answer to Blackmoore... after I've had my fun."]="萨尔！你不会真的以为可以逃脱吧？你和你的伙伴们很快就要去接受布莱克摩尔的审讯……不过我得先跟你玩玩。"
G["Thrall's Grasp they called us: Twenty of Thrall's most accomplished and honored soldiers.\n\nI had ordered the regiment to build an encampment here, on the border of the Blasted Lands, while we waited for our orders to arrive from Orgrimmar. Weeks passed without word from the warchief; the men grew restless.\n\nIt was a judgment call, $n. I was young and ambitious, afraid of nothing. The battalion would set forth into the Blasted Lands under my command.\n\nA decision I would later regret."]="Nos llaman la garra de Thrall: Veinte de los Soldados de Thrall más preparados y honorables. \n\nOrdené al regimiento que construyera un campamento aquí, en la frontera de Las Tierras Devastadas, mientras esperábamos órdenes desde Orgrimmar. Pasaron semanas sin tener noticias del Jefe de Guerra, así que los hombres se impacientaron.\n\nFue una decisión personal, $n. Yo era joven y ambicioso, no tenía miedo de nada. El batallón se adentró en Las Tierras Devastadas bajo mis órdenes.\n\nFue una decisión que lamenté más adelante."
G["Thrall's balls! They're everywhere..."]="以萨尔之名！到处都是敌人……"
G["Thrall's false Horde dares to intrude this far into my fortress?  Bring out the Thrallmar prisoners and call for the executioner!  They'll pay with their lives for this trespass!"]="萨尔的那个冒牌部落胆敢深入我的堡垒？把萨尔玛的战俘带出来，让刽子手们待命！他们会为这次入侵付出生命的代价！"
G["Thrall's fighting the Trade Prince up top on the other side of the docks. Hurry, $n!"]="萨尔正和贸易大王在码头的另一端打得难解难分。快去，$n！"
G["Thrall's traitors have abandoned the path to true power! They should die for their insolence and stupidity!"]="萨尔的叛徒们抛弃了通往真正力量的唯一道路！他们应该因为傲慢和愚蠢而付出生命的代价！"
G["Thrall's trapped himself in the chapel. He can't escape now."]="萨尔被困在教堂里面，他逃不了。"
G["Thrall's words be true. Dey always be. The Horde is much more den a few old, stubborn leaders and a handful of heroes from Northrend. The people be cryin' Garrosh's name... at least for now."]="萨尔的话是正确的，一如既往。组成部落的并不只是几个顽固的老领袖和从诺森德回来的英雄。人们在呼喊加尔鲁什的名字……至少现在是如此。"
G["Thrall, I've never met these people before in my life."]="萨尔，我以前从没有遇到过这些人。"
G["Thrall, come outside and face your fate. [PH]"]="萨尔！出来面对你的命运吧！"
G["Thrall, we no longer answer to you. We have a new Warchief now. And he has reminded us that we are STRONG!"]="萨尔，我们不再听命与你了。我们有了一位新酋长。是他提醒我们要坚强！"
G["Thrall, what has happened? The King is preparing for war..."]="萨尔，出了什么事？国王正在备战……"
G["Thrall, you escaped!"]="萨尔，你逃出来了！"
G["Thrall, you must fully devote yourself to the cause."]="萨尔，你必须将自己的全部身心投入于其中。"
G["Thrall, you should go alone. Perhaps this old shaman can teach those farseers a thing or two."]="萨尔，你应该单独过去。也许这位老萨满祭司可以教给那些先知一点东西。"
G["Thrall... The blood haze has lifted."]="萨尔……血液的诅咒已经消失。"
G["Thrall... Warchief... your armies await your command. Let me lead them to Northrend to remove this undead menace!"]="萨尔……酋长……部队在等待你的命令。请允许我带领他们前往诺森德，彻底铲除亡灵的威胁！"
G["Thrall... must not... go free."]="不能……让萨尔……逃走。"
G["Thrall? Varok? What business do you have here?"]="萨尔？萨鲁法尔？你们来干什么？"
G["Thrall? You've been a slave only to the past, grandson! But no more! When last I saw him, Durotan told me the name he would give his unborn son... He was... so proud..."]="萨尔？你只是过去是一个奴隶，孙子！你再也不会是奴隶了！当我最后一次看到杜隆坦的时候，他把还没出生的儿子的名字都想好了……他是……那么的自豪……"
G["Thrallmar needs you, $c. The warchief needs you. Stand ready to do your duty."]="萨尔玛需要你，$c。酋长需要你。做好准备去完成你的职责吧。"
G["Thralls balls! I'm sick of fighting naga!"]="以萨尔之名，和纳迦战斗令我作呕！"
G["Threat analyzed!  Activating combat plan beta!  CLUCK!"]="威胁分析！启动二号战斗计划！咯咯嗒！"
G["Threat assessment routine modified. Current target threat level: 0. Acquiring new target."]="已修改威胁评估程序。当前目标威胁级别：0。正在获取新的目标。"
G["Threat imminent! Beginning evasive action!"]="危险迫近！开启躲避模式！"
G["Threat index threshold exceeded.  Celestial archive aborted. Security level heightened."]="已超出威胁指数标准。天界文档中断。提高安全级别。"
G["Threat level zero."]="威胁等级归零。"
G["Threat neutralized."]="威胁已排除。"
G["Threat re-evaluated. Target assessment complete. Changing course."]="威胁重新评估结束。目标重新评定完成。改变行动计划。"
G["Three cheers for $n -- Admiral o' the Bloodsail Bucaneer Navy!"]="为血帆海军的上将——$n欢呼吧！"
G["Three cheers for $n!"]="为$n欢呼三声！"
G["Three cheers for $n!  $G He's : She's; saved the town from the Burning Legion!"]="¡Tres hurras por $n! ¡Ha salvado la ciudad de la Legión Ardiente!"
G["Three cheers for $n!  This land shall be ours once again!"]="让我们为$n祝酒三杯！这块土地又回到我们手里了！"
G["Three cheers for $n! Three cheers, and three beers!"]="为$n欢呼三声吧！再来三杯啤酒！"
G["Three cheers for $n!!!\n\nI really cannot wait to setup my own little bed and breakfast in Azshara. What do you think it's like there?"]="¡¡¡Tres hurras por $n!!!\n\nNo puedo esperar a abrir mi propio hotelito rural en Azshara. ¿Cómo crees que es aquel lugar?"
G["Three cheers for all of you! Keep on riding that rocketway and buying from those vendors. You're contributing to the most noble cause in all of Azeroth: my pockets!"]="为你们所有人三呼万岁！继续乘火箭车驰骋，从商贩手中抢购商品吧。你们正在为艾泽拉斯最高尚的事业贡献自己的力量——用金币塞满我的口袋！"
G["Three decent elites!!"]="三只强大的精英！！"
G["Three fragments were lost after the World Pillar shattered.  We must recover them or else the fate of our world is doomed."]="世界之柱碎裂之后，有三块碎片遗失了。我们必须找到这些碎片，否则，我们的世界将迎来末日。"
G["Three minutes left -- I can feel the energy starting to build!  Keep up the solid defense!"]="还剩三分钟——我感觉到能量正在不断汇集！继续保护我！"
G["Three players are needed to cleanse the Pool of Life!"]="需要三名玩家才能净化生命之池！"
G["Three words - \"ab - so - lutely\"!"]="En tres palabras \"se, gu, ro\"."
G["Three."]="三个。"
G["Three..."]="三……"
G["Throm'ka $c!  Are you ready to fight for the Horde at Warsong Gulch?"]="¡Throm'ka, $c! ¿Estás $gpreparado:preparada; para luchar por la Horda en la Garganta Grito de Guerra?"
G["Throm'ka, $c. All of the war materiel is in final preparation and being sent to Silithus. It should arrive over the course of the next $2113w days. With the equipment readied, and our forces arrayed, all we will be waiting for is someone to ring the gong on the Scarab Dais, which should open the gates of Ahn'Qiraj and start the war.\n\nLok'tar Ogar!"]="你好，$c。所有的战争物资已经集齐，正在运往希利苏斯的途中。货物将在接下来的$2113w天内运抵。一旦军队做好战前准备，我们就只等有人敲响甲虫墙上的铜锣，打开安其拉的大门。\n\n为了兽族！"
G["Throm'ka, $c. All of the war materiel is in final preparation and being sent to Silithus. The last of it should arrive in less than a day. With the equipment readied, and our forces arrayed, all we will be waiting for is someone to ring the gong on the Scarab Dais, which should open the gates of Ahn'Qiraj and start the war.\n\nLok'tar Ogar!"]="你好，$c。所有的战争物资已经集齐，正在运往希利苏斯的途中。货物将在1天内运抵。一旦军队做好战前准备，我们就只等有人敲响甲虫墙上的铜锣，打开安其拉的大门。\n\n为了兽族！"
G["Throm'ka, $c. Did you know our fight with the Silverwing Sentinels in Warsong Gulch continues still? Your presence would be welcome there..."]="你好啊，$c。你知道我们和银翼哨兵在战歌峡谷的战斗还没有结束吗？你的出现会帮我们大忙的……"
G["Throm'ka, $c. Is this shattered land what you expected to see? It's nothing like the stories I've been told. It's hard to believe my people ever thrived in this desolate place."]="你好啊，$c。这块破碎的土地就是你想看到的吗？这里和别人所说的完全不一样，真不敢相信我的人民能在如此荒芜的地方茁壮成长。"
G["Throm'ka, $c. You are here to help me with tin bars? They tell me that I will need $2006w so that they can make weapons and armor for the upcoming Ahn'Qiraj War, but I only have $2005w right now. You are going to bring me more!"]="你好，$c。你是来帮助我收集锡锭的吗？我需要收集$2006w块锡锭，以用于制造安其拉一战所需的武器和护甲，但是到目前为止我只收集到$2005w块。你得再帮我收集一些！"
G["Throm'ka, $c. You must be new. You look fresh and unspoiled by the horrors of this land.\n\n<Sergeant Shatterskull spits into the dust.>\n\nThat'll change."]="Throm'ka, $c. Debes de ser $gnuevo:nueva;. Pareces joven y no tienes aspecto de haber vivido los horrores de estas tierras.\n\n<El sargento Trizacráneo escupe en el suelo>\n\nEso va a cambiar."
G["Throm'ka, $gbrother:sister;! Welcome to Outland. The Horde needs all the strength it can muster in this broken world. I promise you, if it's glorious battle you've come seeking, you'll have your fill of it here."]="¡Throm'ka, $ghermano:hermana;! $gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a Terrallende. La Horda necesita toda la fuerza que pueda reunir en este mundo destrozado. Te prometo que, si es una batalla gloriosa lo que andas buscando, aquí tendrás hasta hartarte."
G["Throm'ka, $n.  Warsong Gulch is in need of heroes such as you."]="你好啊，$n。战歌峡谷需要你这样的英雄。"
G["Throm'ka, Horde $C, stand proud! I am Warlord Gorchuk, commander of the Horde's war effort. There are trying times ahead of us, but we shall prevail, as always.\n\nIf you have questions, you should ask them."]="你好，部落的$c。我是督军格尔库克，部落物资收集行动的指挥官。艰难的岁月就要来临，但我们还是会获胜的，胜利永远属于我们。\n\n如果你有什么问题，就去问问他们吧。"
G["Throm'ka, friend!\n\nThe Warchief has ordered me to assemble his greatest veterans for an assault on the Twilight Highlands.\n\nYou look like one tough $c, but we need soldiers who are a bit more... battle-hardened. Perhaps someday you and I will fight side-by-side. Until then, continue your training!"]="¡Throm'ka, camarada!\n\nEl Jefe de Guerra me ha ordenado que reúna a los mejores veteranos para el asalto a las Tierras Altas Crepusculares.\n\nTú pareces ser $gun:una; $c resistente, pero necesitamos soldados más... curtidos en la batalla. Quizá algún día tú y yo luchemos hombro con hombro. Mientras tanto, ¡continúa entrenando!"
G["Throm'ka, friend! It is good to see a fellow veteran of the Northrend campaign.\n\nThe Warchief has ordered me to assemble his greatest warriors for an assault on the Twilight Highlands.\n\n<Warlord Krogg looks you up and down.>\n\nWe may need your help. Check in with the Warchief in Orgrimmar and see if he has a use for you yet."]="你好，朋友！很高兴见到诺森德战役的老战友。\n\n酋长命我集结他麾下最精锐的部队攻击暮光高地。\n\n<酋长把你上下打量了一番。>\n\n我们也许需要你的帮助。去奥格瑞玛的酋长那里，看看他有没有任务交给你。"
G["Throm'ka, old friend."]="Throm'ka，老朋友。"
G["Throm-Ka, $c. My mood is poor this day, so please, unless you can help me, I would prefer to be alone."]="你好, $c。我今天情绪很差，所以除非你能帮我，否则我更愿意自己呆着。"
G["Throm-Ka, $n. It is good to see you again."]="你好，$n。很高兴再见到你。"
G["Throm-Ka, $n. We snuck a few more in while you were preparing the Gates for attack.\n\nI'll show you where we're to meet with Garona.\n\n<The squad leader produces a map of the Twilight Citadel and points to the spot.>\n\nLet me know when you're ready, and we'll go together."]="Throm-Ka, $n. Hemos colado a unos cuantos más de los nuestros mientras estabas preparando las Puertas para el ataque.\n\nTe enseñaré dónde vamos a reunirnos con Garona.\n\n<El líder de escuadrón saca un mapa de la Ciudadela Crepuscular y señala el lugar.>\n\nAvísame cuando estés $glisto:lista; y nos dirigiremos hacia allá juntos."
G["Throm-Ka, goblin!"]="感谢你，地精！"
G["Throm-Ka, hero!"]="Throm-Ka，英雄！"
G["Throm-ka! What you looking for, stranger?"]="¡Throm-ka! ¿Qué estás buscando, $gforastero:forastera;?"
G["Throm-ka, Legionnaire!"]="Throm-ka，军团士兵！"
G["Throm-ka, pandaren. Welcome to the Horde."]="Throm-ka，熊猫人。欢迎加入部落。"
G["Throne of Tides"]="潮汐王座"
G["Throne of the Tides, a level 79-81 dungeon in Vashj'ir, is now available for initial testing. The dungeon is very much a work in progress, and the final boss is not available. Please be in your full group before teleporting to the dungeon. Meeting Stones are not available for this dungeon yet.\nTo leave the Throne of the Tides, simply exit through the normal exit inside the dungeon and you will be teleported to Dalaran. If you die and release, you should teleport back from this NPC."]="El Trono de las Mareas, una mazmorra de nivel 79-81 en Vashj'ir, ya está disponible para pruebas. Antes de teletransportarte a la mazmorra, asegúrate de que el grupo está formado. Las rocas de encuentro para esta mazmorra todavía no están disponibles.\n\nPara abandonar El Trono de las Mareas, simplemente sal por la salida normal dentro de la mazmorra y serás teletransportado a Dalaran. Si mueres y liberas espíritu, puedes teletransportarte de nuevo con este PNJ."
G["Throngus SLICE you up!"]="嘿，索朗格斯把你劈开！"
G["Throngus use your corpse on body. Somewhere..."]="索朗格斯会为你找个好去处的……"
G["Through Frostmourne, Arthas killed his own father and razed this land along with every living creature in it!"]="手持霜之哀伤，阿尔萨斯杀死了亲生父亲，并毁掉了这片土地和所有的生物。"
G["Through fire we purge this land of its impurities."]="通过熊熊烈火，我们净化了这片大地上的杂质。"
G["Through me the Banshee Queen sees all..."]="通过我，女妖之王看得见一切……"
G["Through my studies, I see that defeating the god Hakkar's avatar has weakened him.  But the bulk of his strength remains, lurking at the far end of the Nether.\n\nYou have defeated his avatar once, $n.  Perhaps if you defeat it again you can further weaken the god so that, one day, we might face his true self.\n\nI have prepared a spell that you may use to again summon an avatar of Hakkar within the Sanctum of the Fallen God.  Do you want to confront it once again?"]="A través de mis estudios he podido establecer que el hecho de vencer al avatar del dios Hakkar lo ha debilitado. Pero conserva la mayor parte de su fuerza, acechando en el fondo del Averno.\n\nHas vencido a su avatar una vez, $n. Tal vez si lo vuelves a derrotar lograrás debilitar al dios hasta tal punto que, un día, podamos enfrentarnos a su verdadero ser.\n\nHe preparado un encantamiento que puedes usar para volver a invocar un avatar de Hakkar en el Sagrario del Dios Caído. ¿Quieres volver a enfrentarte a él?"
G["Through our Master, all things are possible. His power is without limit, and his will unbending."]="我的主人是无所不能的，他有无比强大的力量，不可抗拒的意志。"
G["Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew.  The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done.  It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining.  Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?"]="在严格的训练中，我必须除去那些学生先前所学的所有知识，以便传授新知识。我所提供的服务越来越难以完成。为此，每次训练的费用也越来越昂贵。你愿意除去你先前学习的技能吗？"
G["Through sea and sky, we fly together."]="飞天越海，我们比肩翱翔。"
G["Through sunsets beyond counting, the tusked people have dwelled here in the land of ice."]="海象人氏族自古就居住在这片冰封之地，看过数不尽的日出日落。"
G["Through the Dark Portal"]="穿越黑暗之门"
G["Through the air we breathe, She strengthens our voice."]="藉由空气，女皇为我们的声音赋予力量。"
G["Through the breech! Focus on their priests - they're empowering the others!"]="快进去！注意那些牧师——他们正在强化其他人！"
G["Through the breech! Target the wounded!"]="快通过缺口！瞄准伤员！"
G["Through the gem, Elune channeled her infinite wisdom..."]="月神通过宝石传达着她无尽的智慧……"
G["Through the milennia, Ilyenia Moonfire has mastered numerous weapons and now offers to train others in their use.  You can find her at the Warrior's Terrace if you desire training."]="通过千百次的锤炼，伊琳尼雅·月火已经掌握了若干种武器的使用方法，现在她为别人提供训练。如果你想接受训练的话，就去战士区找她吧。"
G["Through the pain and fire my hatred burns!"]="我的仇恨在烈焰与痛苦中燃烧！"
G["Through the purity of the fire's spirit are we cleansed.  Through the passion of its being are we driven."]="上古火灵的纯洁净化了我们，他的激情更激励着我们。"
G["Through the second turn it's the $n!"]="现在$n领先！"
G["Through the valleys and peaks of Mount Hyjal, across the shifting sands of Silithus, against the Legion's dread armies - we have fought. We are the nameless, faceless, sons and daughters of the Alliance. By the Light and by the might of the Alliance, the first strike belongs to us and the last strike is all that our enemies see.\n\nWe are 7th Legion."]="Hemos luchado a través de los valles y cimas del Monte Hyjal, a través de las arenas movedizas de Silithus, contra los temibles ejércitos de la Legión. Somos los hijos sin nombre ni rostro de la Alianza. Por la Luz y por el poder de la Alianza, el primer golpe nos pertenece y el último golpe es todo lo que ven nuestros enemigos.\n\nSomos la Séptima Legión."
G["Through this portal, Tol Barad awaits."]="这道传送门对面就是托尔巴拉德。"
G["Through thunder and storm, we fly together."]="穿越雷鸣，穿越风暴，我们守望相助。"
G["Through wind and tide, we fly together."]="穿越飓风，穿越潮汐，我们一起翱翔。"
G["Through you, is it? I think we can manage that."]="穿过你是吗？这应该没问题。"
G["Through your efforts, you have brought both the Shadow Wardens and the Druids of the Talon to our side.\n\nExcellent work, $c.\n\nWe are gaining ground, but much work still remains.\n\nAs the enemy assails us, we must continue to build up our defenses. We require three things, $n.\n\nElderlimb and the Ancient Protectors watch over Hyjal, but their strength would be invaluable here.\n\nAs stalwart as our courage, our armory needs additional military supplies.\n\nFinally, the strength of Elune's calming waters will heal and rejuvenate our tired soldiers.\n\nWe need these things before our work here is complete.\n\nGo, $n. Your efforts are crucial to our victory."]="Tu empeño ha traído a nuestro bando tanto a las celadoras de las Sombras como a los druidas de la Garfa.\n\nExcelente, $c.\n\nGanamos terreno, pero aún queda mucho por hacer.\n\nEl enemigo no deja de acosarnos y tenemos que seguir reforzando nuestras defensas. Necesitamos tres cosas, $n.\n\nTallosaúco y los protectores ancestrales guardan Hyjal, pero su fuerza sería de gran ayuda aquí.\n\nNuestro valor es inquebrantable, pero nuestra armonía requiere más suministros militares.\n\nFinalmente, la fuerza de las aguas calmantes de Elune sanará y rejuvenecerá a nuestros soldados cansados.\n\nNecesitamos esas cosas para poder terminar nuestro trabajo aquí.\n\nVe, $n. Tus esfuerzos son cruciales para nuestra victoria."
G["Throw a Spiced Punch on hozen who jump on the cart!"]="对跳到车上的猢狲使用香料喷洒！"
G["Throw a Spiced Punch to knock hozen off the cart!"]="用香料喷洒将猢狲从车上赶下去！"
G["Throw de big skull in de pot!"]="把那块大头骨扔进锅里去！"
G["Throw de mojos on de skull!"]="然后把魔精扔到头骨上！"
G["Throw down your weapon and pick up your gloves. It's time for a good old-fashioned boxing match. Prepare to be floored by Ty'thar!"]="扔掉你的武器，拿起拳套吧。接下来将有一场精彩的传统拳击赛。做好被泰塔尔击倒的准备吧！"
G["Throw in all 12 flasks."]="倒入全部12瓶液体。"
G["Throw in an entire flask."]="倒入一整瓶液体。"
G["Throw it really hard at my face!"]="使劲往我脸上扔！"
G["Throw me back up!"]="把我扔上去！"
G["Throw me out of the priory, will they?"]="他们会把我逐出修道院吗？"
G["Throw me up there!"]="把我抛上去！"
G["Throw me!"]="把我抛出去！"
G["Throw the Bouncy Ball to your serpent and see how long you can keep it in the air! When you are done playing, speak to me and I will take your serpent. Good luck!"]="将弹力球扔向你的翔龙，看你们能让它在空中停留多长时间！完成练习后请告诉我，我会带走你的翔龙。祝你好运！"
G["Throw them into chaos while we regroup. The eyes of Hellscream are upon you!"]="扰乱他们，让我们重新部署。地狱咆哮的双眼注视着你！"
G["Throw these prisoners in the cages.  Let the men have their way with them."]="将这些俘虏投进囚笼。让下面的人看好他们。"
G["Throw your Footbombs at those Steamwheedle Sharks!"]="朝着热沙港大鲨鱼队的队员掷出你的足球炸弹！"
G["Throwing Starfish"]="投掷用海星"
G["Throwing grenade!"]="扔手榴弹！"
G["Thrown"]="投掷武器"
G["Thrym... Av... Avenge me..."]="塞穆……为……为我报仇……"
G["Thunder Bluff"]="雷霆崖"
G["Thunder Bluff Champion's Pennant"]="雷霆崖冠军的旗帜"
G["Thunder and lightning dance at my call!"]="雷霆与闪电在我的命令下狂舞！"
G["Thunder begins with a shock wave in the air due to the sudden thermal expansion of the plasma in the lightning channel!"]="由于闪电通道中的离子突然发生热膨胀，空气中出现一道震动波，雷声开始鸣响！"
G["Thunderbrew, finest brewery in all the realms."]="雷霆啤酒，全世界最好的啤酒。"
G["Thunderbrew, finest brewery in all the realms.  Check them out at Brewfest!"]="雷酒，全世界最好的酒。来美酒节尝尝吧！"
G["Thundermar is the last holdout of the Wildhammer. My brother's trying to keep up the fight while our little town fills up with refugees."]="桑德玛尔是蛮锤的最后一处堡垒了。我们狭小的城镇中挤满了难民，而我的兄弟此时正在奋力作战。"
G["Thundermar, if we weren't on holy ground I'd pop you one so hard yer shoes would be the only thing left standin'!"]="桑德玛尔，如果我们不是站在这片神圣的土地上，我就会把你一拳击飞，这地上留下的只有你的鞋！"
G["Thundris Windweaver's corpse lays sprawled out here, the apparent victim of the Twilight's Hammer's machinations."]="桑迪斯·织风的尸体倒伏在这里。这显然是暮光之锤的诡计造成的。"
G["Thundris Windweaver's spirit is coaxed forth."]="桑迪斯·织风的灵魂被召唤出来。"
G["Thurman my brother, who's laughing now?  Hah!"]="萨尔曼，我的兄弟，看看谁笑到了最后？哈哈哈哈！"
G["Thus, I was the first Paragon. This is why, I am the Prime."]="所以，我是第一个英杰。这也正是我为何是至尊者的原因。"
G["Thuwd will show you how to skin your kills.  Look for him at Kodohide Leatherworkers in The Drag."]="苏尔德将教你如何练习技能。去暗巷区的科多兽皮工店找他吧。"
G["Tick tock, tick tock..."]="嘀嗒嘀，嘀嗒嘀……"
G["Ticker, blow this thing."]="钟摆，炸飞这玩意儿。"
G["Ticker?! Wake up!"]="钟摆？！醒醒！"
G["Ticket Exchange"]="奖券兑换"
G["Ticket redemption here!  Get your tickets turned into prizes!  Step right up!"]="兑换奖券啦！换取礼物啦！快来啊！"
G["Tickets aren't easy to come by, I hear."]="我听说票子很难搞到啊。"
G["Tickets! Redeem your Darkmoon Prize Tickets here!  Wondrous and exotic prizes are waiting for you!"]="奖券！快来兑换你的暗月马戏团奖券吧！新奇的奖品正在等着你！"
G["Tides take you!"]="波涛吞没你！"
G["Tides, give me strength!"]="狂潮啊，给我力量！"
G["Tie game!"]="平局！"
G["Tie them up."]="把他们绑起来。"
G["Tie your lure off and let it loose."]="解开你的诱饵，让它走。"
G["Tiger Steak? That's my favorite! How did you know?"]="虎肉排？这是我的最爱！你怎么知道的？"
G["Tigers."]="猛虎。"
G["Tighten it up a little. We wouldn't want them to slip through and miss all of the fun."]="再把它收紧一点。我们可不想让它们溜走，这样会错过许多乐趣。"
G["Tightening the valve."]="拧紧阀门。"
G["Tillers"]="阡陌客"
G["Tilloa is that you?  Why no!  It's just some dirty $r!"]="Tilloa, ¿eres tú? ¡Oh, no! ¡Solo es $gun sucio:una sucia; $r!"
G["Timan fell from the Pillar of Ash.  Othana was eaten by wolves.  Gorlop fell in lava.  And most of my sergeants were killed in a freak cudgelling accident."]="提曼从灰烬之柱掉下去摔死了。欧萨娜被狼吃了。格尔洛普掉进了熔岩里。我的大部分副官也都在各种各样诡异的事故中丧生。"
G["Time Expired!"]="时间到！"
G["Time be running low, strangers. Soon you gonna join da souls of dem ya failed to save."]="时间不多了，陌生人。很快你们的灵魂也将落得跟前人一样的下场。"
G["Time can be both beautiful and cruel."]="时间既是美丽的，也是残酷的。"
G["Time ends."]="时光的尽头。"
G["Time for Chufa's surprise!"]="地栗的惊喜来了！"
G["Time for Gnimo to shut down."]="尼莫走了。"
G["Time for a bit of revenge before I return home."]="在我回家之前，还要进行一点小小的复仇。"
G["Time for a dip in the magma, $c!"]="去泡泡岩浆吧，$c！"
G["Time for a drink..."]="该去喝一杯了……"
