G["To care for these fearless beasts, who stand between my clanmates and death, is an honor."]="照看这些让我的部族免受死亡威胁的无畏野兽是一种荣誉。"
G["To catch Gahz'ranka, you'll need a special Mudskunk lure.  I make 'em myself!\n\nBut you need more than just the lure; you need some mudskunks too... you need to place them in the lure to give it a rank old smell!\n\nWhen you have the mudskunks, throw the lure off Pagle's Point in Zul'Gurub... and then grab a drink and wait... but not too long, because Gahz'ranka is sure to come a'stomping!"]="你需要一种特殊的臭泥鱼诱饵来捕捉加兹兰卡，这些鱼饵是我亲自制作的！\n\n但是除了鱼饵之外，你还需要臭泥鱼……你得把臭泥鱼放入诱饵，让它充满臭味！\n\n将做好的诱饵放到祖尔格拉布中的帕格渔点……然后就坐下来喝酒等待……你无需等太久，因为加兹兰卡肯定会迫不及待地上钩！"
G["To celebrate the birth of yet another deadly enemy is an odd thing, to say the least. Still, we will join our allies in their festivities."]="退一步说，庆祝另一位死敌的诞辰真是件诡异的事。不过，我们还是会参加盟友们的节日。"
G["To come this far has not been easy, I know. But how boring life would be without challenges, don't you think? Good, because I have a challenge for you..."]="走到这一步很不容易，我知道。但是生活若没有挑战将会多么枯燥无味啊，你不这么认为吗？很好，因为我有一项任务要交给你……"
G["To complete our great work, we will need a sacred place."]="要完成我们的伟大目标，还需要一片圣地。"
G["To darkness I condemn you."]="我要将你们投入黑暗中。"
G["To defeat an opponent in battle is to validate your strategy."]="在战斗中击败对手，是对战术最好的检验。"
G["To defeat me, you will need to use all that you have learned from the other masters.  If you can do that, your training will be complete."]="要想击败我，你必须使出自己从其他大师那里学到的所有招数。要是你能做到，你的训练就完成了。"
G["To defend the vale with my life is an honor!"]="能用生命守卫山谷，是我的荣耀！"
G["To die for the empress is an honor!"]="为女皇而死乃是荣耀！"
G["To die in battle is glorious! But, with what I teach you, maybe you not die so quickly, hm?"]="战死沙场是件光荣的事儿!但是，若是你能利用我教你的东西，或许你不会死得那么快，嗯?"
G["To die today, on this field of battle, is to die an orcish death. To die today is to die for our little ones. Our old ones. Our ... loved ones."]="今天，如果我们战死，死在这片战场上，我们虽死犹荣。今天，如果我们战死，那是为了保卫我们的孩子，我们的父母，我们的……爱人。"
G["To die would be a wonderfully grand adventure."]="死亡将是一场神奇的大冒险。"
G["To die... for the warchief... is... an... honor..."]="为酋长而死……是我的……荣幸……"
G["To do what is right, no matter the cost. That is wisdom."]="为了大义而不惜代价。这就是智慧。"
G["To do your heavy lifting, most likely."]="大概是帮你搬东西之类的。"
G["To eat!!"]="味！"
G["To ensure a rapid crew response in the event of a fire, fuel storage has been moved away from the crew quarters and placed beneath the passenger compartment."]="为了保证在失火时能够让全体船员迅速做出反应，燃料箱已经从船员区挪到了乘客舱室下方。"
G["To fight, yes. To die? Likely. But we will give them no ground, $c.\n\nWe are outnumbered. Our armor is patchwork, our weapons scavenged.\n\nBut this is our land! Our tauren allies know every hidden trail, crevice, and pass through these hills. We descend from the high ground where they least expect us, then disappear into the terrain like phantoms. Fear is our weapon, and we will strike at them unceasingly."]="是的，我们继续作战。也许我们难免一死，但我们不会给他们半寸土地，$c。\n\n敌人的数量远远超过我们。我们的盔甲破碎，武器损坏。\n\n但这是我们的土地！我们的牛头人盟友熟悉这片山丘中的每一条小道、裂谷和每一个山口。我们埋伏在高地上，向联盟发动了出其不意的突袭，然后又像影子一样消失。恐惧就是我们的武器，我们要向敌人发动毫无止歇的攻击。"
G["To find clarity and purpose, immerse yourself in inner reflection."]="想要清晰了解自己的心意，就要反省你的内心。"
G["To find your White Pawn, we must call upon the ancient magic of my people. To do so, we must first create a Dream Brew."]="想要找到白卒的话，我们得依靠我们族人的远古魔法。为此，我们首先得做出一瓶洄梦仙酒。"
G["To get down safely, I provide wings to those in need."]="为了让上来观光的旅行者安全地下去，我可以为你提供翅膀。"
G["To get in, we will need specially tuned crystals from some of the mantid leaders in the area."]="要想进去，得从这儿的螳螂妖头领身上找到经过特殊转化的水晶。"
G["To have seen the things I've seen, to have done the things I've done, and to still breathe... I am a lucky gnome."]="见过我所见过的那些，做过我所做过的那些，而现在还能呼吸……我真是个幸运的侏儒。"
G["To have waited so long... for this..."]="为了这一天……等待了那么久……"
G["To have witnessed the opening of the gates... it is a tale I will pass down to my children's children."]="亲眼见证大门的开启……这一幕必定会在我的子孙万代间流传不绝。"
G["To hell with the undead! We'll cut our way through the woods, men!"]="该死的亡灵！弟兄们，直接从森林中穿过去！"
G["To hell with this, I'm running for it!"]="该死的，我要的就是它！"
G["To hell with you, Thassarian."]="见鬼去吧，萨萨里安。"
G["To her altar this mortal must travel. What they must do will not be easy. In the end it may prove impossible."]="这名凡人必须前往她的祭坛。他们必将肩负起艰难的使命，甚至可能面临失败的惨境。"
G["To hold you in my arms would be the fulfillment of my dreams. Come down from there, let us travel far away from here!"]="如果能将你揽在臂弯里，那就是我梦想成真的时刻。从那里下来吧，让我们去旅行，远远地离开这里！"
G["To honor your elders is to honor your culture and your people, $c.  For this, the coins of ancestry serve as a tangible means to recognize those who choose to follow a venerable path of respect.\n\nDuring this Lunar Festival, you may have the opportunity to honor many elders.  As you do so, you will acquire the coins of ancestry.  Bring me these coins, and I will reward your diligence with a selection of unique items."]="Honrar a tus ancestros es honrar a tu cultura y a tu pueblo, $c. Por ello, las monedas de linaje son un medio tangible de reconocer a aquellos que eligen seguir el venerable camino del respeto.\n\nDurante la celebración del Festival Lunar, tendrás la oportunidad de honrar a muchos Ancestros. Cuando lo hagas, obtendrás las monedas de linaje. Tráeme las monedas y recompensaré tu diligencia con una selección de objetos únicos."
G["To interfere with construct's function results in termination. Move along."]="胡乱调用构造体的功能将导致程序终结。前进。"
G["To learn THAT is to learn true wisdom."]="当你领悟真正的智慧之时。"
G["To learn to be one with Nature in the eyes of the Earth Mother, this is a matter of pride.  If your will is to learn the ways of the Hunter you must seek out Yaw Sharpmane at the north end of Bloodhoof Village."]="在大地之母心目中，学习如何与自然融合一体是件荣耀的事儿。如果你想成为一名猎人，你必须去血蹄村北部找雅文·刺鬃。"
G["To learn to cure leather and work with hides go to Orgrimmar to the north.  One of the Orgrimmar Grunts will be able to tell you the way to the Leatherworking Trainer."]="要学习如何处理皮革，你得去北面的奥格瑞玛。那儿的守卫会告诉你如何找到制皮训练师的。"
G["To live without anger is not to live at all. It is ours to overcome. In defeating our anger, we draw great strength."]="只有死人才不会愤怒。但我们要学会克制。击败心中的愤怒，才能获得力量。"
G["To maintain our link to the mainland, we have hippogryphs constantly flying between Rut'theran Village and Darkshore."]="为了与大陆保持联系，我们会定期派出角鹰兽在鲁瑟兰村和黑海岸之间传递信息的。"
G["To many of my people I am known as a traitor... as Illidan's lapdog.  It is best that they continue to think that for now."]="我的许多同胞都认为我是叛徒……是伊利丹的走狗。现在也许他们这么想才更好。"
G["To many of the Forsaken, the moon now holds the place in our hearts where sun once resided. However, if you choose to join the celebration, go to Moonglade in Kalimdor. You'll find druids in the throne room above Undercity that will transport you there."]="对遗忘者来说，月亮已经取代了太阳在我们心中的地位。如果你想要参加节日庆典的话，就去卡利姆多的月光林地吧。幽暗城王座厅的德鲁伊可以将你传送到那里。"
G["To me, my minions! Strike now!"]="过来，奴仆们！开始攻击！"
G["To me, my servants!"]="到我这儿来，仆从们！"
G["To merely provide an answer teaches nothing.\n\nPandaria is a land of teaching and learning."]="仅仅给出答案并不是为师之道。\n\n潘达利亚是授业解惑的圣地。"
G["To my side, brothers! For the Makers!"]="兄弟们，到我这儿来！为创世者而战！"
G["To my surprise, his people have found something! Right here, in the sacred vale! What will happen now?"]="令我惊讶的是，他的人真有了发现！就在这圣谷之中！那后来呢？"
G["To our great fortune, you've proven quite honorable and dedicated."]="这真是我们的幸运，你显示出了高尚的荣誉感和奉献精神。"
G["To pass beyond my Hall, you must defeat me in a game of skill!  Control your king when you are ready to begin..."]="¡Para cruzar mi sala, debes vencerme en un juego de habilidad! Controla a tu rey cuando estés $gpreparado:preparada; para comenzar..."
G["To prepare for a world of perfection, the imperfect must be swept away."]="要创造一个完美的世界，必须清除一切不完美的东西。"
G["To reach The Crossroads, $n, follow the road east then north."]="$n，如果你想要去十字路口，先沿着路向东然后朝北走。"
G["To reach the Rut'theran Ferry, you will need to travel to Darnassus and take the portal to Rut'theran Village at the base of Teldrassil."]="想要找到鲁瑟兰村的渡船，你得先去达纳苏斯，通过传送门进入鲁瑟兰村。"
G["To repeat the same action and expect different results is madness."]="只有疯子才相信重复的行为能带来不同的结果。"
G["To restore life is to restore the natural order of the elements."]="回复生命就是恢复元素的自然秩序。"
G["To retrieve Mimiron's sigil, initiate self-destruct sequence and defeat Mimiron before its completion."]="要获取米米尔隆的徽记，必须初始化自毁程序，并在流程执行完毕之前击败它。"
G["To run on water, one must run very fast."]="要想在水上奔跑，那么你必须跑得特别快。"
G["To see only the defeat of losing the remains would be foolish. This village is the first of many that will rise against the Thunder King. This is a great victory!"]="一味地为弄丢遗骸而悔恨是愚蠢的。这个村子是最先挺身对抗雷电之王的先驱之一。这是一场伟大的胜利！"
G["To serve is madness, but defiance ... impossible!"]="效命是疯狂的，可反抗……是不可能的！"
G["To serve upon his table."]="呜呼，人为刀俎，我为鱼肉！"
G["To signify our reforged friendship, I have something which belongs to you..."]="作为我们重铸友谊的见证，我就把这东西物归原主吧……"
G["To stand a chance in this battle against Ragnaros, we must gather allies who will gladly brave the scorched plains of the Firelands. And before we can recruit such allies to our cause - be they druid, soldier, or simple provisioner - we will need to give them reason to join us.\n\nCarrying even a handful of these marks signifies you as a hero of our cause. Gather them in the hundreds... and you will lead armies.\n\nAre you beginning to see the plan yet?"]="Si queremos tener alguna oportunidad en esta batalla contra Ragnaros, tenemos que reunir aliados que estén dispuestos a adentrarse en las agostadas llanuras de las Tierras de Fuego. Y antes de que podamos reclutar a semejantes aliados para nuestra causa, ya sean druidas, soldados o simples proveedores, tendremos que darles una razón para unirse a nosotros.\n\nLlevar aunque sea un puñado de estas marcas te identifica como $gun héroe:una heroína; de nuestra causa. Reúnelas por cientos... y liderarás ejércitos.\n\n¿Empiezas a entender el plan?"
G["To strike me is to strike his Majesty! He will not suffer this insult!"]="攻击我就等于攻击陛下！他是不会接受这种侮辱的！"
G["To success, then!"]="夺取胜利！"
G["To summon a Dreadsteed, you must first create a Circle of Greater Summoning.  A portal to Xoroth may only be created from within such a circle.\n\nThe Circle of Greater Summoning requires three powerful implements: a Bell of Dethmoora, a Wheel of the Black March and a Doomsday Candle."]="要召唤恐惧战马，你必须首先开启一道强大的法阵。通往克索诺斯世界的传送门只可能在这种法阵中打开。\n\n而开启法阵，你就需要三种魔法器具：达斯莫拉的铃铛、黑色战车之轮和末日蜡烛。"
G["To teach him a lesson, the father dragged the cub out to the forest, to watch how the hozen live. \"Do you see what the hozen are like?\" he asked. \"Do you want to live like that?\""]="Para darle una lección, el padre llevó al cachorro al bosque para que viera cómo vivían los hozen. \"¿Ves cómo son?\", le preguntó. \"¿Quieres vivir como ellos?\"."
G["To the Greymane Wall! We will force their hand."]="格雷迈恩之墙！我们要把他们逼入绝境。"
G["To the Void... once more."]="再次……回到虚空。"
G["To the crushing depths with you!"]="你将在深渊中粉身碎骨！"
G["To the death!"]="战斗到最后一刻！"
G["To the den of suffering..."]="进入那座洞穴吧，它就是痛苦之源……"
G["To the depths of oblivion with you!"]="下地狱吧！"
G["To the depths with you, beast!"]="跌进深渊吧，怪物！"
G["To the east."]="去东面那个。"
G["To the fastest riders go the prizes of victory! Mount your cloud serpents!"]="只有最迅捷的骑手才会赢得最终的奖励！骑上你们的云端翔龙！"
G["To the front lines! The Kor'kron Vanguard needs air support!"]="上前线！库卡隆先锋营地需要空中支援！"
G["To the front, men!"]="冲向前线！"
G["To the grave with you!"]="和我一起进入坟墓吧！"
G["To the heavens above our hero claimed love"]="我们英雄的爱直达天堂"
G["To the house! Stay close to me, no matter what! I have my gun and ammo there!"]="到房子那边去！无论如何都要紧跟着我！那里有枪和弹药！"
G["To the plaguelands went old Duggan, ta' send them Scourge back inta' th' groun'."]="老杜甘要去瘟疫之地，把那些天灾恶鬼全都赶回到地里去。"
G["To the safe hall, your majesty."]="尊贵的陛下，请到安全的大厅去。"
G["To the skies!"]="飞上高空！"
G["To the south lies our goal. We will march to the Citadel and cut out the heart of the Scourge where it dwells."]="我们的目标就在南方。我们将向那座要塞进军，直捣天灾军团的心脏。"
G["To the south! Move!"]="南边！立即支援！"
G["To the throne room!"]="向王座前进！"
G["To the town hall, everyone!  We've brought you weapons!  Arm yourselves and beat the Scourge back!"]="大家都到市政厅去！我们带来了一批武器！大家都武装起来，把天灾军团赶走！"
G["To the well! HURRY!"]="到井边去！快！"
G["To the west."]="去西面那个。"
G["To think you've come so far, only to perish here. I'll honor you with clean deaths."]="你们大老远来到这里，就为了送死。我会让你们死得很干脆。"
G["To think: This place has been outside our time stream - and existence itself! - for millennia.\nOur most experienced Weavers assure us the island's temporal position is presently stable, but still, I wonder...\nWhat would happen if it vanished again while we were upon it?"]="Y pensar que este sitio lleva milenios fuera de nuestra línea temporal... ¡fuera de la existencia misma!\n\nNuestros tejedores más veteranos nos aseguran que la posición temporal de la isla es estable, por ahora, pero me pregunto...\n\n¿Qué pasaría si volviera a desaparecer, con nosotros dentro?"
G["To this day, I ponder why I, myself, was chosen for this particular station. I can only imagine my superior felt I was uniquely suited to the task and would quickly become accustomed to the quaint culture of the Horde found herein, but I heard a truly mean-spirited rumor that it may be because I talk too much."]="一直以来我都在思考一个问题，那就是，我为什么会被选中，来到这个地方。我只能认为是我的上级觉得只有我才能胜任这样的任务，迅速适应部落的独特文化，但是坊间还有一个听起来很伤自尊的说法，那就是因为我说话太多了。"
G["To those who would question our place in this world..."]="那些认为我们不该存在于世上的人……"
G["To trust an orc? Even if it is the progeny of Durotan himself! This is madness!"]="信任兽人？没门儿，哪怕他是杜隆坦的后裔！信任兽人是非常愚蠢的行为！"
G["To use the convienent Grimtotem Auctioneering services, you must have the permission of the great Magatha Grimtotem!"]="如果要使用恐怖图腾拍卖服务功能，你必须首先得到玛加萨·恐怖图腾的许可！"
G["To what end? What are you two working towards?"]="为什么？你们俩有什么目的？"
G["To win this war, we can't sit idle and let the tides sweep us over.  We must strike, hard and fast, or Arathi will never again be ours."]="要赢得这场战争，我们不能坐在这里，静待战争之潮将我们淹没。我们必须果断出击，否则阿拉希永远也不会成为我们的囊中之物。"
G["To your health, windbag."]="干杯吧，话痨。"
G["Toasty!"]="真烫！"
G["Today Hellscream shall learn the lesson that Thrall failed to teach him..."]="今天，地狱咆哮将学到萨尔没能教会他的那堂课…"
G["Today I would like to touch on the three virtues of the Light."]="今天，我要谈谈圣光的三大美德。"
G["Today Mor'ghor's tyranny will end."]="今天莫格霍尔的暴行即将终结。"
G["Today is a glorious day for the Horde!"]="今天是部落的荣耀之日！"
G["Today is a good day to drink!"]="今天最适合喝酒啦！其实每一天都很适合喝酒！"
G["Today is a good day, friend. Long has it been since I have left Wyrmrest Temple, free to fly across the great Dragonblight."]="朋友，今天真是个美好的日子。我一直待在龙眠神殿，已经很久没有在龙骨荒野上空自由飞翔了。"
G["Today is a good day."]="今天是个好日子。"
G["Today is the day I defeat my rival!"]="今天我将笑到最后！"
G["Today is the day we take back our glorious city from that vile traitor Thermaplugg!"]="今天，我们将消灭叛徒瑟玛普拉格，夺回我们光荣的城市！"
G["Today it's cave-ins and nibblers, tomorrow it'll be floods and jinyu. Just another day at the quarry."]="今天是塌方和利齿蛛，明天就有可能是洪水和锦鱼人入侵。在矿场嘛，混一天是一天了。"
G["Today marks the first of many defeats for the Scourge! Death knights, once in service of the Lich King, have broken free of his grasp and formed a new alliance against his tyranny!"]="今天，是天灾军团首次战败的日子！巫妖王昔日的奴仆——死亡骑士已经摆脱了他的控制，并结成了反抗其暴政的新同盟！"
G["Today our world's destruction has been averted in defiance of our very makers!"]="今天，我们所生活的这个世界，险些被它的缔造者毁灭！"
G["Today they still act as traders, messengers, guides, and pack bearers for expeditions high up in Kun-Lai summit."]="直到今天，他们依然在高耸入云的昆莱山上扮演着商人、信使、向导和送货人的角色。"
G["Today you have lost -- but what have you learned?"]="今天你失败了——可你从中学到了什么呢？"
G["Today you have unmade what took me years to create! For this you shall all die by my hand!"]="你们破坏了我数年的心血！我要把你们全都杀了！"
G["Today, $n, we celebrate your graduation. You have learned all that there is to know within the walls of Tian."]="$n，今天我们要庆祝你顺利毕业了。你已经学习并掌握了天禅院的所有智慧与奥妙。"
G["Today, I fight by your side."]="今天，我们将并肩战斗。"
G["Today, I fulfill that promise."]="今天，我兑现了诺言。"
G["Today, WE will remake the world. OUR world. FOR THE HORDE!"]="今天，我们将重铸世界。我们的世界。为了部落！"
G["Today, our friendship is cemented with the Alliance! Today, we go forth as brothers and sisters. To our new future!"]="今天，我们和联盟缔结友情！今天，我们如同兄弟姐妹般共同前行，驶向新的未来！"
G["Today, the Borean Tundra. Tomorrow, the world!"]="今天，北风苔原是我们的。明天，全世界都是我们的！"
G["Today, we are reborn! Today, we take a stand as men and women, not nameless, faceless numbers!"]="今天，我们获得了新生！今天，我们是以男人和女人的身份屹立在这里，而不再是无名无姓的数字！"
G["Today, we honor the ones that bring us good food and good drink."]="今天，让我们深刻铭记那些为我们带来温饱的人。"
G["Today, we welcome you into the Shado-Pan."]="今天，我们欢迎你加入影踪派。"
G["Today, you forge an eternal bond with your cloud serpent."]="今天，你与你的云端翔龙建立了永恒的联结。"
G["Today, you will face many trainers, who have honed their skills and proven themselves.  Will your pets tell the same story about you?  We shall see!  Good luck!"]="今天，你将面对许多成名已久的驯宠高手。你的宠物是否也能证明你的优秀呢？让我们拭目以待！祝你好运！"
G["Today, you will meet your ancestors!"]="你会在今天见到你的祖先的！"
G["Today, you'll wish you never stirred from your bed!"]="今天，你会希望再也不要从梦中醒来！"
G["Today, your journey toward the Order of the Cloud Serpent ends. Today, a new rider joins our ranks."]="Hoy, tu viaje para unirte a la Orden del Dragón Nimbo termina. Hoy, $gun nuevo:una nueva; jinete se une a nuestras filas."
G["Toe up..."]="脚趾向上……"
G["Together we are unstoppable!"]="我们战无不胜！"
G["Together we call upon the lord of fire!"]="我们将共同恳求火焰之主！"
G["Together we can do anything, Anren!"]="兄弟齐心，其利断金，安伦！"
G["Together we can reclaim the temple and restore hope for the people here. It's my honor to accompany you in this task."]="只要我们携起手来，就能重新夺回寺庙，使这里的人民重获希望。很荣幸能与你并肩完成这项任务。"
G["Together we can use the Horde's might to make a better world."]="结合部落的力量，我们一起把这个世界变得更好！"
G["Together we have achieved the impossible."]="我们合力完成了一件不可能的任务。"
G["Together we will deal with this corruption of the water."]="让我们一起解决这水体的污染吧。"
G["Together we will fight our way out of here. Are you ready?"]="Juntos nos abriremos camino para salir de aquí. ¿Estás $gpreparado:preparada;?"
G["Together, the swarm will rise higher than any empire this land has ever known!"]="团结起来，虫群会比这片土地上的任何帝国都要强大！"
G["Together, the two parts shall become one, once again."]="这两部分将再次合二为一。"
G["Together, we shall overcome our enemies."]="我们齐心协力，就能战胜敌人。"
G["Together, we will crush the Twilight's Hammer, raze their stronghold,"]="我们将齐心协力，粉碎暮光之锤，摧毁他们的堡垒，"
G["Together, we will destroy the Alliance and claim what is rightfully ours. Let our song of victory begin."]="我们将携手摧毁联盟，夺取我们应得的一切。奏响这胜利的战歌吧。"
G["Together, we will make history!"]="齐心协力，我们将缔造历史！"
G["Together..."]="一起……"
G["Togrik, can you wake up the prisoner again?"]="托格莉，你能再把这名囚犯弄醒吗？"
G["Toil not in matters of the past, $n!"]="不要多管闲事，$n！"
G["Tokens & Souvenirs"]="奖币和纪念品"
G["Tokens! Get your tokens!"]="代币！快来买代币！"
G["Tokens! Tokens! Tokens!"]="代币！代币！代币！"
G["Tol Barad is mine, it's mine I tell you!"]="托尔巴拉德是我的，是我的！"
G["Told you I was strong. Didn't drop one barrel."]="早就说了我很壮。一个桶都没丢。"
G["Tomas may not be the best cook around, but he has a few dishes that hit the spot.  He's currently working in the Lion's Pride Inn if you'd like to learn the profession."]="托马斯也许不是最好的厨师，但是他确实能做一些精美的菜肴。如果你想学习厨艺的话，就去狮王之傲旅店找他吧。"
G["Tomb of the Forgotten"]="被遗忘者的墓冢"
G["Tome not yours..."]="它……不属于你……"
G["Tomorrow holds untold possibilities, and it is all thanks to you and the Alliance."]="明天充满了无限的可能性，而这一切都多亏了你和联盟的大力相助。"
G["Tomorrow we battle, brother. Today we feed."]="明天我们就要投身战斗了。今天我们一定要吃得饱饱的。"
G["Tomorrow we will begin training of our promising dragons, so don't forget your chew toys."]="明天我们将开始训练这些大有前途的龙，别忘了带上你的玩具骨头。"
G["Tomorrow, the baron gets his town back... but for today - Pirates' Day - it belongs to the Dread Captain DeMeza and her crew. Yarrr!\n\nAnd remember: lookin' the part's only HALF the celebration. Talk like a pirate, $glad:lass;!"]="Mañana, el barón recuperará su ciudad... Pero hoy es el Día de los Piratas y la ciudad pertenece a la aterradora capitana DeMeza y su tripulación. ¡Yarr!\n\nY recuerda: parecer un pirata no es más que la MITAD de la celebración. ¡Tienes que hablar como un pirata, $gmarinero:marinera; de agua dulce!"
G["Tomorrow, they will sing our praises, but only if we are victorious today."]="明天，人们将为我们唱响赞歌，但前提是我们必须在今天取得胜利。"
G["Tong! Drinks, please."]="童福！拿酒来。"
G["Tong! Something to eat, please."]="童福！来点吃的。"
G["Tong, is that our friend?"]="童福，有朋友来了？"
G["Tong: fetch my things!"]="童福：把东西拿来！"
G["Tonga's eagle calls out, then circles toward the peak."]="图加的鹰鸣叫着，向山峰盘旋而去。"
G["Tonight we feast on you!"]="今晚我们要吃你的肉，喝你的血！"
G["Tonight we plumb the depths of the human soul as we join a lost, lonely girl trying desperately--with the help of her loyal companions--to find her way home!"]="今晚，我们将见证人类灵魂深处的信念。一位迷失的小女孩，在忠诚的伙伴们的帮助下寻找回家的路！"
G["Tonight, things are not what they seem... for tonight your eyes may not be trusted!"]="今晚，一切都变得虚虚实实，真伪难辨；今晚，你们的眼睛将欺骗你们的心灵！"
G["Tonight, your blood will run red on the stones of our altars."]="今晚，你的血将会染红我们祭坛的圣石。"
G["Tonight... we explore a tale of forbidden love!"]="今晚，我们将看到一段受到百般阻挠的爱情！"
G["Tonks! We got tonks here!"]="坦克！我们这里有坦克！"
G["Tonks?"]="蒸汽坦克？"
G["Too bad Coren's dead.  If I could buy that brew from him and resell it -- watered down and rebottled under my own label, of course -- I'd be rich!"]="科林已经死了，这可真糟糕。如果我能从他手中买下这些酒再转卖出去的话——当然要兑上水，重新装瓶，再贴上自己的商标——那我肯定发财了！"
G["Too bad I left my light feathers at home... Slow Fall would work perfect here!"]="糟糕，我把轻羽毛放家里了……缓落术在这里应该很有用的！"
G["Too bad for you... I brought my fists with me!"]="你可真不幸……我带着我的拳头呢！"
G["Too bad we can't skin the humans and their allies. All that skin is just going to waste. Still, who'd want to wear the flimsy leather you could make out of it?"]="我们不能剥下人类及其联盟的皮，这真糟糕。这些皮都白白浪费掉了。尽管如此，谁想穿着你由此制造出的质地极差的皮革？"
G["Too bad.  Now for a real pet."]="真糟糕。现在，来见识下真正的宠物吧。"
G["Too big. Not pointy enough. I need something small and sharp."]="太大了，也不够锋利。我需要一些小而锋利的武器。"
G["Too bitter! Just a drop of honey, and a cane of sugar, and maybe some corn? Yes, more corn!"]="太苦了！再加一滴蜂蜜，一块糖，也许再加点玉米？没错，玉米！"
G["Too close to the truth, too close to the truth!"]="太接近真相了，太接近真相了！"
G["Too early, but no choice... They must be tested! Face now my prime subjects!"]="为时尚早，但别无选择……必须实验！来面对我的原型实验体吧！"
G["Too easy!"]="太简单啦！"
G["Too easy."]="小菜一碟。"
G["Too fast for you! Can't catch us!"]="太慢啦！你追不上我们！"
G["Too general in use to tell us who is behind this.  Perhaps we'll find something inside."]="太多人曾使用过这个地方，我们无从分辨气味。也许我们能在里边找到些线索。"
G["Too good to be true. I might have known."]="太好便会有失真实。我本该知道的。"
G["Too late for ya to be runnin' away now, mon!"]="现在逃跑可来不及了，伙计！"
G["Too late, friends! Nefarius' corruption has taken hold...I cannot...control myself."]="太晚了，朋友们！奈法利安的堕落力量已经生效……我无法……控制自己。"
G["Too little, too late. The dam has broken. We are a bump in the road at best."]="太少了，也太迟了。我们正在螳臂当车……"
G["Too long have I been gone, fighting my way across Azeroth to rediscover my past and reclaim my throne. With all the challenges that have tested the Alliance in my absence, it warms my heart to see heroes such as yourself defending our coalition."]="我踏遍了艾泽拉斯的每一寸土地，想要寻找失落的荣耀并收复属于我的王国。在我离开暴风城的这段日子里，联盟经历了种种考验。有你这样的英雄保卫我们脆弱的盟国，我真是倍感欣慰。"
G["Too long have I sat idle, gripped in this haze... this malaise, lamenting what could have been... what should have been."]="我虚度了太多时光，在混沌……痛苦中度过，为或许发生过……或者应该发生而没有发生的事情感到悲伤。"
G["Too long in that cage.  I'll show these mogu what I think of their captivity..."]="在那笼子里待太久了。我要让这些魔古族知道，我对囚禁感觉如何……"
G["Too long... Tireless, endless planning... It will not end like this..."]="长久以来……我们不知疲倦地谋划……不应该落得这样的结局……"
G["Too many have fallen, $g priest:priestess;. You must focus!"]="Han caído demasiados, $gsacerdote:sacerdotisa;. ¡Debes concentrarte!"
G["Too many hozen. You die soon, offlander."]="Demasiados hozen. Tú morirá pronto, $gextraño:extraña;."
G["Too many mogu. Only our foolish mountain hozen cousins live up there."]="还有好多魔古族。只有那些笨蛋高山猢狲亲戚们才会住在那里。"
G["Too many of us died in this pit. Far too many."]="我们在这个大坑里损失太多人了。太多太多了。"
G["Too much roots! Not enough meats!"]="太多菜根了！得加点儿肉才行！"
G["Too much time has passed. We must try again later."]="已经过了太久了。我们必须晚些再试。"
G["Too much... the spirits cannot contain his might..."]="太强了……万灵控制不了他的力量……"
G["Too slow, mortal."]="太慢了，凡人。"
G["Too soon! ... You have come too soon..."]="太早了！……你们来得太早了……"
G["Too soon! You are slacking off too soon!"]="不要松懈！不要松懈！"
G["Too soon, you have awakened me too soon! What is the meaning of this intrusion?"]="还早着呢，你居然这么早就吵醒我！到底有什么紧要事啊？"
G["Too soon..."]="太早了……"
G["Too soon... too sooon...."]="很快……很快……"
G["Too weak to finish your own battles? Very well then..."]="连这样的场面都应付不了，你还真够弱的。好吧……"
G["Too weak to serve."]="这个宿主太弱了。"
G["Too weak!"]="真是太弱了！"
G["Too... *hic* much flavor.  Must...rest."]="太……*嗝*太好喝了。得……休息一下。"
G["Too... strong..."]="太……强大了……"
G["Too... worthy... a foe..."]="太……配做我的……对手了……"
G["Toodly-doo!"]="再会吧！"
G["Took the fish to market. See you at Halfhill!\n- Fish"]="He llevado el pescado al mercado. ¡Nos vemos en El Alcor!\n\n- Pez"
G["Took yer sweet time, didn'tcha?"]="在享受美好时光吗？"
G["Took you long enough to finish them off!"]="你这么久才解决掉他们！"
G["Took you long enough!"]="你还真是够快的！"
G["Toothgnasher."]="磨齿。"
G["Top of the hour, boys. Go."]="整点啦。去吧。"
G["Top three is still quite impressive. Top half is better than the bottom half, am I right?"]="能进入前三名已经很不错了。名列前茅总比排名倒数要体面嘛，对吧？"
G["Tor ilisar'thera'nal!"]="¡Tor ilisar'thera'nal!"
G["Tor of the Brutal Siege, bestow your might upon me!"]="野蛮杀戮之王托尔，将你的威能赐予我！"
G["Tor'gash believes he can see the future in the entrails of birds, or by tossing the knucklebones of his ancestors. Really, all you need to do is ask the spirits. But don't try telling him that, $n. He's very stubborn."]="托尔加什相信他可以通过鸟的肠子或者通过摇骨头预测未来。但实际上，你所要做的就是询问那些灵魂。不过别告诉他这些，$n。他是个很固执的家伙。"
G["Torben Zapblast, teleportation solutions engineer at your service!"]="托尔本·光爆，传送应对方案工程师为您效劳！"
G["Torches ready!"]="火炬准备！"
G["Torgoley works us hard, but he's a good captain, aye."]="在托格雷手下做事非常辛苦，不过他是位好船长。"
G["Torloth, your master calls!"]="托洛斯，你的主人在召唤你！"
G["Torment me no more!"]="不要再烦我了！"
G["Torta must be so worried."]="托尔塔肯定很担心。"
G["Torta, my love! I have returned at long last."]="我亲爱的托尔塔！我终于回来了。"
G["Tortolla never fell. Eventually the greatest Doomguards of the legion surrounded him, but couldn't pierce his stony skin and invulnerable shell. Oh, how they raged! Tortolla held his ground and covered a final retreat, before the mortal races regrouped and managed to seal the portal and end the invasion.\n\nIt was said that after the battle, Tortolla was found underneath a mountain of demon corpses. He shook the bodies free and his head emerged from the gore. Then, quietly, slowly... he asked if we had won.\n\n<Hamuul rests a hand on his stomach and bellows a deep, unselfconscious laugh.>"]="托尔托拉从未倒下。尽管最后被那些强大的军团末日守卫团团围住，可他们却对他那坚硬的皮肤和刀枪不入的龟壳束手无策。喔，他们当时别提有多暴怒了！在凡间种族得以重整兵力来关闭传送门、终结入侵之前，托尔托拉守住了阵地，并掩护他们完成了决定性的撤退。\n\n据说在战斗结束后，有人发现托尔托拉被压在堆成山的恶魔尸体下面。他抖抖身上的尸体，从斑驳血污里伸出了头。然后安静地、慢慢地……问我们打赢了没。\n\n<哈缪尔把一只手按在了肚子上，发出了发自肺腑、无法抑制的狂笑。>"
G["Torture me no more!  Release me, mortal!  The Swamp of Sorrows... mortal... please..."]="不要再烦我了！放了我吧，凡人！悲伤沼泽……凡人……求你了……"
G["Tortured and kept alive as a urinal for young orc warriors. For FIVE YEARS."]="在五年时间里，他不断地受到各种拷打和折磨，还成为了年轻兽人战士的溺器。"
G["Tortured wind, stale and toxic!"]="扭曲之风，腐蚀众生！"
G["Tortusk barks, grunts, and snorts angry instructions to his followers."]="突牙吼叫着，喘着粗气，哼哼着，气恼地向他的部下发号施令。"
G["Toshley's Station is the best!  The solitude and supply of strange, Outland power sources is an ideal setting for extreme experiments!"]="托什雷的基地是最好的！外域的能量资源是极端实验的理想配置。"
G["Toss a ring, win a prize!"]="套圈圈，赢奖品了！"
G["Toss me?! Okay, that's it punk."]="把我扔过去？！你能不能别出这种馊主意？"
G["Toss some pants in to the tub!"]="朝桶里扔几条裤子！"
G["Toss your refuse and fecal matter in the back so these gnomes have some company!"]="把垃圾和粪便扔到后面，让这些侏儒们有东西玩儿！"
G["Total shot in the dark here but I'd guess they're coming from that gigantic evil castle. I could be wrong."]="我觉得他们是从那座邪恶的大城堡里冒出来的。好吧，我只是瞎猜而已，或许猜错了。"
G["Total system failure!"]="系统彻底瘫痪！"
G["Total systems failure. Defense protocols breached. Leviathan unit shutting down."]="发生全面系统故障。防御协议已被破坏。正在关闭巨兽单位。"
G["Totem of the earth, halt their advances!"]="大地图腾，阻止他们的前进！"
G["Touch me one more time and I'll make sure that they send you to the Undermine!"]="再碰我一下，我就让他们送你去安德麦！"
G["Touch my chicken and I will kill you in your sleep. Am I understood?"]="敢碰我的小鸡，我就让你在梦里去见阎王。听懂没有？"
G["Touch not the horse, filth!"]="不要碰我的马，肮脏的家伙！"
G["Touch the Suntara stone and call forth Lathoric the Black and his guardian, Obsidion."]="触摸苏塔拉之石，召唤黑衣拉索里克和他的守卫者奥比斯顿。"
G["Touch the statue."]="触摸雕像。"
G["Touching..."]="真感人……"
G["Touchy footing up there. Be careful."]="上面的落脚点很危险。小心点。"
G["Tough to tell. I think you're number thirty in line? Maybe forty? I lost count a while back."]="说不准，我想你应该是第三十个？也许是第四十个？我刚才数糊涂了。"
G["Toughen up, lad.  I raised you better than that.  Stiff upper lip!"]="坚强起来，孩子。我把你养大不是要让你成为一个软弱的人！"
G["Toughest fighting I've seen..."]="那可是场硬仗……"
G["Tour guide taking forever..."]="这个向导太拖拉了……"
G["Tower Point East holds the pass between the Field of Strife and Horde territories to the south.\n\nIt is controlled by neither side.The East Frostwolf Tower protects the gate between Frostwolf Village and Frostwolf Keep.\n\nIt is controlled by neither side."]="东侧防御塔点是征战平原和南部部落领土之间的要塞。\n\n联盟和联盟还在争夺这片土地。东部霜狼哨塔守护着霜狼村和霜狼城堡之间的大门.\n\n联盟和部落还在争夺这片土地。"
G["Tower Point East holds the pass between the Field of Strife and Horde territories to the south.\n\nIt is controlled by the Alliance.The East Frostwolf Tower protects the gate between Frostwolf Village and Frostwolf Keep.\n\nIt is controlled by the Alliance."]="东部哨塔高地守护着征战平原和南部部落领土之间的要塞。\n\n联盟控制着这片土地。东部霜狼哨塔守护着霜狼村和霜狼城堡之间的大门。\n\n联盟控制着这片土地。"
G["Tower Point East holds the pass between the Field of Strife and Horde territories to the south.\n\nIt is controlled by the Horde.The East Frostwolf Tower protects the gate between Frostwolf Village and Frostwolf Keep.\n\nIt is controlled by the Horde."]="东部哨塔高地守护着征战平原和南部部落领土之间的要塞。\n\n部落控制着这片土地。东部霜狼哨塔守护着霜狼村和霜狼城堡之间的大门。\n\n部落控制着这片土地。"
G["Tower Point holds the pass between the Field of Strife and the Horde territories to the south.\n\nIt is controlled by neither side."]="西侧防御塔点是征战平原和南部部落领土之间的要塞。\n\n联盟和联盟还在争夺这片土地。"
G["Tower Point holds the pass between the Field of Strife and the Horde territories to the south.\n\nIt is controlled by the Alliance."]="西侧防御塔点是征战平原和南部部落领土之间的要塞。\n\n联盟控制着这片土地。"
G["Tower Point holds the pass between the Field of Strife and the Horde territories to the south.\n\nIt is controlled by the Horde."]="西侧防御塔点是征战平原和南部部落领土之间的要塞。\n\n部落控制着这片土地。"
G["Tower Point is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Alliance will destroy it!"]="哨塔高地受到攻击！如果我们不尽快采取措施，联盟会摧毁它的！"
G["Tower Point is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Horde will destroy it!"]="哨塔高地受到攻击！如果我们不尽快采取措施，部落会摧毁它的！"
G["Tower Point was destroyed by the Alliance!"]="哨塔高地被联盟摧毁了！"
G["Tower Point was taken by the Horde!"]="哨塔高地被部落占领了！"
G["Town ahead."]="前方有城镇。"
G["Townspeople are disappearing, Solomon. What are you going to do about it?"]="镇民正在不断消失，所罗门。你打算怎么办？"
G["Toxitron unit activated."]="剧毒金刚单位已激活。"
G["Toxitron unit shield systems online."]="剧毒金刚单位防护系统已就绪。"
G["Toya's been looking for you. He's been collecting all our extra jade."]="托亚在到处找你，他正在到处搜集我们手头的玉石。"
G["Toys"]="玩具"
G["Track down Shim'la at the south entrance to the Hunter's Hall in the Valley of Honor."]="在荣誉谷的猎人大厅南出口可以找到西姆拉。"
G["Tracker Lang, the stable master, can be found on the main terrace before you enter the main building. He stands next to the pet battle trainer.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="你可以在主楼外的主露台上找到兽栏管理员追踪者老朗。他就站在战斗宠物训练师的旁边。\n\n我会在你的地图上标出位置。"
G["Tracking"]="追踪"
G["Tracking is it?  Then Denmul Farmountain is the one you should pay a visit to.  He'll teach ye the tricks of the trade like no other.  \nJust head south from the gates of Ironforge to The Military District to find him."]="¿Quieres conocer los secretos del rastreo? Entonces tienes que ir a visitar a Denmul Montelejano. Él te enseñará los trucos del oficio como nadie. \n\nPara encontrarlo, dirígete al sur desde las puertas de Forjaz hasta el Distrito Militar."
G["Trackmaster Zherin is stunned. Steal the Horde's Proposal now!"]="赛道管理员泽尔林晕了。趁现在快去把部落投标书偷到手！"
G["Trad! Renstadt! Nooooooooooooooooooo!"]="特拉德！伦斯坦德！不--！"
G["Trade District"]="贸易区"
G["Trade District Auction House"]="贸易区拍卖行"
G["Trade District Bank"]="贸易区银行"
G["Trade District Inn"]="贸易区旅店"
G["Trade Prince say hurt you!"]="贸易大王说了，要对你厉害点！"
G["Trade Supplies"]="商业材料"
G["Tragic events have unfolded in Northrend. The Warchief is doing all that he can to keep us safe."]="诺森德发生了许多悲剧事件。酋长正在尽力保障我们的安全。"
G["Tragic. The elder Fordring lives on... You are too late, old man. Retreat back to your cave, hermit, unless you wish to join your son in the Twisting Nether."]="真悲哀。弗丁还活着……你来晚了，年老的隐士。回到你的洞穴吧，除非你想和在扭曲虚空的儿子一起。"
G["Tragic. To come so far, only to fail."]="悲剧。千辛万苦，功亏一篑。"
G["Tragic..."]="真是悲惨啊……"
G["Tragic... They fought valiantly, but the beasts of Northrend triumphed. Let us observe a moment of silence for our fallen heroes."]="悲剧……他们英勇奋战，但还是没有制服诺森德的猛兽。让我们为这些死去的英雄默哀。"
G["Tragically, it was Thrall's wisdom that finally sealed the bond between the demon lord and his minions. It was Trebor's regiment that served as the catalyst to unite the demon lord, the shadowsworn sects and the ogres. The lure of nearly unlimited power and the granting of immortal shock troops to each respective leader sealed the deal in blood."]="可悲的是，正是因为萨尔的智慧才导致了恶魔之王和其它势力联合起来，特雷博的军队促成了恶魔之王、阴影议会和巨槌食人魔之间的联合。对于力量的无尽渴求使得他们签下了血契，对恶魔效忠。"
G["Train hard, train every day. And when you have perfected your skills, return to me."]="日复一日地坚持训练吧。当你熟练掌握所有技能的时候，再来找我。"
G["Train harder! We are all that remains of the loyal defenders of Kael'thas!"]="努力训练！我们是凯尔萨斯身边仅存的忠诚卫士。"
G["Train me in Alchemy."]="我要学习炼金术。"
G["Train me in Blacksmithing."]="我要学习锻造。"
G["Train me in Enchanting."]="我要学习附魔。"
G["Train me in Engineering."]="我要学习工程学。"
G["Train me in First Aid."]="请对我进行急救训练。"
G["Train me in Herbalism."]="我要学习草药学。"
G["Train me in Inscription."]="我要学习铭文。"
G["Train me in Jewelcrafting."]="我要学习珠宝加工。"
G["Train me in Leatherworking."]="我要学习制皮。"
G["Train me in Mining."]="我要学习采矿。"
G["Train me in Skinning."]="我要学习剥皮。"
G["Train me in Tailoring."]="我要学习裁缝。"
G["Train me in the trade of mining."]="教我如何采矿。"
G["Train me in the ways of herbalism."]="教我如何采药。"
G["Train me in the ways of the beast."]="将野兽的技能传授给我吧。"
G["Train me."]="请让我接受训练。"
G["Train your serpents well. A bond of trust is your strongest weapon."]="好好训练你的翔龙。信赖是你最强有力的武器。"
G["Trainers"]="训练师"
G["Trainin' de mages."]="训练法师啊。"
G["Trainin' services are on temporary hiatus. You wanna learn how to cook? You'll have to look somewhere else."]="训练服务已经暂停。你想学习烹饪？去别处学吧。"
G["Training"]="训练"
G["Training complete, sir. Our next batch of recruits are due shortly."]="训练完成了，长官。我们的下一批新兵很快就会准备好的。"
G["Training is an ongoing process. There is always something to learn."]="训练是一个不间断的过程。总有一些东西值得去学习。"
G["Training level sufficient.  Returning to guard duty.  Thank you."]="训练水平已达到要求。继续执行守卫任务。谢谢你。"
G["Training you further is beyond my abilities. Speak to Telonis in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus. He is always glad to help talented students."]="继续培训你已经超越我的能力了。与达纳苏斯工匠区的泰龙尼斯谈谈。他总是很愿意帮助有才能的学生。"
G["Training, massages, whatever you need, boss. Just don't forget me when you're the new Trade $g Prince : Princess;!"]="Instrucción, masajes, lo que necesites, $gjefe:jefa;. ¡Tú no te olvides de mí cuando seas $gel nuevo Príncipe mercante:la nueva Princesa mercante;!"
G["Traitor!"]="叛徒！"
G["Traitor!  I'll die before I surrender me ship to you!"]="叛徒！除非我死，否则别想让我向你投降！"
G["Traitor! You've struck the shield! Your fate is sealed..."]="叛徒！你在攻击护盾！你死定了……"
G["Traitor. You are a disgrace to your race."]="叛徒。你给你的种族蒙羞了。"
G["Traitorous dog!"]="可耻的叛徒！"
G["Trajectory locked."]="轨道锁定。"
G["Trampling combatants underfoot, %s goes into a frothing rage!"]="%s爆发出狂烈的怒气，他面前的战士转眼间就被他踩在脚下！"
G["Transcribe the tablet."]="拓下石板上的文字。"
G["Translocation complete. Commencing planetary analysis of Azeroth."]="迁移完成。开始对艾泽拉斯展开行星分析。"
G["Transmogrification"]="幻化"
G["Transmogrification & Void Storage"]="幻化与虚空仓库"
G["Transmogrification and Void Storage services can be found in your home city."]="你可以在自己的主城使用幻化和虚空仓库服务。"
G["Transmogrify an item."]="幻化一件物品。"
G["Transport me to the Molten Core, Lothos."]="把我传送到熔火之心去，洛索斯。"
G["Transportation to the other end of the faire!"]="传送到马戏团的另一头！"
G["Trapped here... forever... am I... free at last?"]="本以为……我会被永远囚禁于此……最终我还是重获自由了吗？"
G["Trapped in this broken wasteland, we did our best to survive. Over time we sensed that a new evil was closing in around us from the Twisting Nether.  More foul than the dark orcs - it was the Burning Legion itself that sought to take hold of this... Outland."]="我们被困在了这个破碎的世界，并努力生存了下来。随着时间的流逝，我们感觉到一股新的邪恶力量正在从扭曲虚空靠近我们，包围我们。那就是比黑暗的兽人更邪恶、想要占据外域的燃烧军团。"
G["Trash packaged, stacked and neatly set aside. Such order in contrast with extreme barbarity... remarkable."]="装满垃圾的袋子被整齐地堆在一旁，和血腥的现场形成强烈的……视觉冲击。"
G["Travel from the faire will cost:"]="离开马戏团需交纳："
G["Travel quickly! The Sunreavers will not waste any time once they realize that we have the information they seek."]="快马加鞭！夺日者发现我们有他们要的信息时会抓紧一切时间对付我们。"
G["Travel safely."]="一路顺风。"
G["Travel through the Spirit World has left you with a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:117723|h[Frail Soul]|h|r temporarily! If you attempt to travel to the Spirit World again before Frail Soul expires you will perish instantly!"]="灵魂世界之旅暂时在你身上留下了|cFFFF0000|Hspell:117723|h[脆弱灵魂]|h|r的效果！如果你在脆弱灵魂效果结束之前再次试图前往灵魂世界，你将立即消亡！"
G["Travel to Orgrimmar, to the Valley of Honor. There she lives with her husband and two daughters. All of them are smiths of great skill, but the spirits tell me that she will best guide your learning."]="到奥格瑞玛的荣誉谷去找她。她和她的丈夫还有两个孩子都住在那里。他们都是出色的铁匠，而她将会是你最好的导师。"
G["Travel to Stillpine Hold, my friend. The furbolgs there have been very helpful, and they might have just the expertise you need."]="Viaja al Bastión Semprepino, $gamigo:amiga;. Los fúrbolgs que hay allí han sido muy útiles, y puede que tengan justo la pericia que necesitas."
G["Travel to the Vale of Eternal Blossoms, and meet me at the Seat of Knowledge."]="快去锦绣谷吧，到闻道之座来找我。"
G["Travel to the faire staging area will cost:"]="前往马戏团入口需要交纳："
G["Travel well, hero of the Alliance!"]="一路走好，联盟的英雄！"
G["Travelers and adventurers make haste to the town circle and take advantage of Antonio's wonderful prices! Come one, come all!"]="旅游者和冒险家们，快到城镇中心来抢购吧！安东尼奥的货物实在是物美价廉！来吧，大家都来看看啊！"
G["Travelling on Valley roads is strange. The ground is so flat here and it is too hot.\n\nI miss Kun-Lai."]="在山谷小路上行走的感觉很是诡异。这里的地面也太平了。还那么热。\n\n我想念昆莱。"
G["Treacherous Alliance dogs! You summon a demon lord against warriors of the Horde? Your deaths will be swift!"]="狡诈的联盟狗！召唤恶魔领主来对抗部落的战士？你们离死不远了。"
G["Treacherous creatures! By Nazjatar's depths, Lady Azshara will avenge me!"]="卑鄙的家伙！以纳沙塔尔的名义，艾萨拉女王会为我报仇的！"
G["Treacherous little pup!"]="奸诈的小崽子！"
G["Treacherous whelp! I will beat you within an inch of your miserable life!"]="狡猾的家伙！我会让你生不如死！"
G["Treacherous whelp! Sironas will destroy you and your people!"]="狡猾的东西！希隆娜丝会消灭你们的！"
G["Tread Lightly."]="走路轻点。"
G["Tread carefully, $r.\n\nYou wouldn't be the first to die here."]="脚下小心，$r。\n\n你绝不会是第一个死在这里的人。"
G["Tread lightly through these woods, $c. It is as though the trees themselves have eyes and whisper to our foes."]="$c，走在这片树林里的时候一定要放轻脚步。这些树仿佛有眼睛，而且还会和我们的敌人说话。"
G["Tread lightly, $r. Beyond this bridge lies hell."]="脚步放轻，$r。地狱就在这座桥的前方。"
G["Tread lightly, $r. The rage of this land has yet to be quenched. Your very presence here causes it anguish the likes of which it has never endured."]="多加小心，$r。这片土地的怒火尚未平息。你的到来令它感到前所未有的不安。"
G["Tread softly. Danger lurks ahead."]="脚步轻点，前面危机四伏。"
G["Treason? Have you lost your mind, Arthas?"]="叛国？你疯了吗，阿尔萨斯？"
G["Treasonous Klaxxi... her magnificence was right about you."]="叛徒卡拉克西……女皇陛下说得一点不错。"
G["Treasure ahead."]="前方有宝藏。"
G["Treasure for Lafoo! Treasure for shrine!"]="拉弗乌的宝藏！祭坛的宝藏！"
G["Treasure huntin' and some hearty ale - doesn't get no better than this, $G lad:lass;."]="Cazar tesoros y cerveza suculenta... no hay nada mejor, $Gmuchacho:muchacha;."
G["Treat the wind rider well as it takes you to your destination.  May your ancestors watch over you $n."]="当双足飞龙将你送达目的地之后，请好好款待它。愿你的祖先与你同在，$n。"
G["Treat with the draenei, the people who turned their backs on us while we suffered? I think not.\n\nA true spirit does not speak thus! Reveal yourself, impostor. Who sent you?"]="和那些在我们受苦的时候抛弃我们的德莱尼人协商？我不这么想。\n\n真正的灵魂是不会说出这种话的！露出你的真面目吧，骗子。是谁派你来的？"
G["Treat your cloud serpent with kindness and respect, and it will grow to trust you."]="对你的翔龙表现出你的善意和尊重，它就会慢慢信赖你。"
G["Treelos, I know that the truth is somewhere inside you.  Tell me what it is."]="忒洛斯，我知道你了解真相。告诉我吧。"
G["Tremble before Taldaram, mortals, for the power of the orb flows through me!"]="在塔达拉姆面前颤抖吧，因为我拥有黑暗堕落宝珠的力量！"
G["Tremble before me!"]="在我面前颤抖吧！"
G["Tremble in fear as I call forth the mighty Doomskull!"]="我将召唤末日枯骨的力量，在恐惧中颤抖吧！"
G["Tremble in fear you mighty members of the Horde, the Alliance is here!"]="部落的大块头们战栗吧！联盟在此！"
G["Tremble!"]="战栗吧！"
G["Tremble, crusaders, before the might of the Forsaken!"]="战栗吧，十字军，在被遗忘者的力量面前战栗吧！"
G["Tremble, fools! The locust has awakened!"]="颤抖吧，不知悔改的人们！蝗虫已经苏醒了！"
G["Tremble, mortals, before the coming of the end!"]="战栗吧，凡人们，末日就要来临了！"
G["Tremble, worms!"]="颤抖吧，蠕虫！"
G["Tresa Farmountain has seen her share of bad weather, but with her knowledge of Survival skills she's come through with her spirits high.  \nShe's over in The Military Ward south of the gates of Ironforge if you wish to speak with her."]="Tresa Montelejano las ha pasado de todos los colores, pero gracias a sus conocimientos de supervivencia, ha logrado salir adelante con la moral muy alta. \n\nEstá en La Sala Militar, al sur de las puertas de Forjaz, si lo que quieres es hablar con ella."
G["Trespasser!"]="入侵者！"
G["Trespassers will be executed!"]="入侵者必将伏诛！"
G["Trespassers will be incinerated."]="入侵者将被烈焰烧成灰。"
G["Trespassin' huh?!"]="嗯？！入侵者！"
G["Trick or Treat!"]="没有糖果就捣乱！"
G["Trick to drinking with grummles is not to stop. With any luck, they'll pass out before you do."]="跟土地精拼酒的诀窍就是不能停。幸运的话，他们总会在你之前醉倒。"
G["Trick-or-treat!"]="不给糖就捣蛋！"
G["Tricked ya!"]="你被骗了！"
G["Trifling gnome! Your arrogance will be your undoing!"]="渺小的侏儒！你们的傲慢将会招致灭亡！"
G["Trigger for self-destruct mechanism is codenamed \"Big Red Button\", Mimiron's own creation."]="El nombre en clave del mecanismo de autodestrucción es \"Gran botón rojo\", una creación propia de Mimiron."
G["Trigger spell received. Idling."]="触发法术已收到。闲置中。"
G["Trinkets, Relics & Off-hand Items"]="饰品、圣物和副手武器"
G["Trogg cave all gone!  You pay for this!!"]="穴居人洞穴全完了！你要为此付出代价！！"
G["Trogg incursion! Defend me while I blast the hole closed!"]="穴居人过来了！保护我，我要把这个洞炸掉！"
G["Troggs?!  Are the troggs you mention the same as the ones in the world today?"]="穴居人？！你说的穴居人难道就是现在的那种穴居人？"
G["Trok are you hungry? I'm making some food for us to eat!"]="特洛克你饿了吗？我在给我们俩做吃的！"
G["Trok? Why are you running around like fearful human?"]="特洛克？为什么你像个胆小的人类一样跑来跑去？"
G["Troll Gossip NPC - Periodic Talk (Expansion Prologue) 01"]="PNJ trol cotilla - Charla periódica (prólogo de la expansión) 01"
G["Troll mojo da strongest mojo!"]="巨魔的魔精是最好的！"
G["Troll powah, mon!"]="朋友，这就是巨魔的力量！"
G["Troll weaklings, there is no hope. Your death has been foretold by the tides."]="软弱的巨魔们，你们已经没有希望了。潮水已预言了你们的灭亡。"
G["Troll! What are you still doing in my town?"]="巨魔！你还在我的镇上做什么？"
G["Troll! You know all about this... voodoo.  What can you find?"]="巨魔！你最了解这……巫毒玩意儿了。有何发现？"
G["Troll, if you can't keep a civil tongue in your head, I'll be happy to remove it for you."]="巨魔，如果你的舌头不能使用礼貌的措辞，我会很高兴帮你去掉它的。"
G["Trollbane alone cannot fight back the combined might of the orcish Horde. We are done for..."]="就靠托尔贝恩一个人是不可能对部落的兽人联军进行反击的。我们完了……"
G["Trollbane!"]="巨魔杀除剂！"
G["Trolls - make yourselves useful. I am almost finished here."]="巨魔——都行动起来。我就快完成了。"
G["Trolls and orcs have fought together. Died together. We are family. And family looks after its own."]="巨魔和兽人曾经并肩作战，生死与共。我们是一家人，家人就该彼此照料。"
G["Trolls been saying stuff, boss."]="巨魔们在喋喋不休，长官。"
G["Trolls is shameful. Trolls is killers!"]="巨魔太无耻了！巨魔都是刽子手！"
G["Trolls of the world will unite against you!"]="所有的巨魔都将联手对付你们！"
G["Trolls. Those were actual trolls! We have heard of them in stories. But to see them in person. And every bit as ferocious as the tales tell."]="巨魔。那些是真正的巨魔！我们听过他们的传说。可现在亲眼看见了。他们跟故事里说的一样凶残。"
G["Trolls... I thought they were but legend!"]="巨魔……我还以为他们只是传说！"
G["Troops! Fall in!"]="士兵们！集合！"
G["Troops! Fall out!"]="士兵们！散开！"
G["Trope will show you how to fly like a Dragonmaw... You will show Trope how to die like a scrub."]="特罗普会让你见识到龙喉兽人飞翔的英姿……而你就让特罗普看看没用的渣滓是怎么死的吧。"
G["Troteman, you old dog, I knew I'd find you stirring up trouble."]="托德曼你这老狗，我就知道你又惹麻烦了。"
G["Troteman?"]="托德曼？"
G["Troublesome whelps. I'll teach you to interfere!"]="讨厌的家伙。我会给你些颜色看看的！"
G["Troubling times indeed. Fear of the unknown makes people do foolish things."]="真是困难时期啊。对未知的恐惧会导致人们做出蠢事来。"
G["True masters learn to make blood serve more than just their strength in battle."]="真正的大师能利用鲜血在战斗中爆发出超越自身的强大力量。"
G["True mastery must be earned! It is up to you to earn it now..."]="必须获得真正的实权！现在这一切都取决于你,是现在吗？"
G["True wisdom comes from the understanding that you have much to master."]="智慧源自于对自身愚昧的认识。"
G["True, Northrend is a hard land, but our people are strong, hardy, and equal to the task!"]="是啊，诺森德的环境极其恶劣，但是我们拥有强壮的体魄和勇敢的精神，能面对一切挑战！"
G["True, but how far should we push?  At what point are we no better than our enemies?"]="没错，可我们能坚持多久呢？这样做，又比我们的敌人好到哪儿去呢？"
G["True, our enemies would show us no mercy."]="敌人是不会对我们手软的。"
G["True. True. Light help him if that monster ever gets free!"]="没错，没错。要是那个怪物逃跑了的话……圣光在上。"
G["Truer words were never spoken!"]="从来没人能如此诚实！"
G["Truffles!"]="蘑菇！"
G["Truly $n has been enlightened by the crystals."]="水晶启迪了$n。"
G["Truly a splendor! Have you ever seen such a view, Prince Anduin?"]="真壮观！你见过这样的景色吗，安度因王子？"
G["Truly amazing, Gerard. How did you do it?"]="真是让人惊讶，杰勒德。你是怎么办到的？"
G["Truly an advantageous alliance."]="真正互利的同盟。"
G["Truly an amazing sword, don't you think? That's no weapon of dwarven make, no, it's far more ancient than that.\n\nThese Sunreaver and Silver Covenant representatives seem intent on getting to the bottom of the mystery. I'm already working on a report for Brann."]="真是一把神器的剑，你觉得呢？这绝不会是出自矮人之手，不，还要古老的多。\n\n这些夺日者和银色盟约的使者似乎打算对这一秘密一探究竟。我已经开始准备给布莱恩的报告了。"
G["Truly pathetic. The sin'dorei were not meant to mix with mongrels such as the draenei."]="实在太可悲了。辛多雷是不会和德莱尼杂种们联合起来的。"
G["Truly, I envy you: To battle in the name of the Horde, at the forefront of conflict. Mine is a job of command.\n\nCertainly, in my youth, I lived out the dreams that make my old age bearable. I now revel in the glory of victory, the bitter taste of defeat - all through the soldiers I command."]="Sinceramente, te envidio: combatir en nombre de la Horda, en primera fila. Mi trabajo es de mando.\n\nCiertamente, en mi juventud realicé los sueños que hacen soportable mi vejez. Ahora me deleito con la gloria de la victoria y con el amargo sabor de la derrota, pero siempre a través de los Soldados que están a mis órdenes."
G["Truly, lightning is a gift of the Gods."]="闪电无疑是诸神赐下的礼物。"
G["Truly, the Sin'dorei are the greatest of races."]="的确，辛多雷是最伟大的种族。"
G["Truly, the horrors here surpass those we've endured in the Plaguelands.\n\nThe Scourge are more powerful now than ever before."]="我们的处境远比在东西瘟疫之地时狼狈得多。\n\n天灾军团变得更加强大了。"
G["Truly? \"Guaranteed?\" We'll have to sit down and talk at length about this \"guarantee\" of yours, merchant."]="\"¿De verdad?\"¿Garantizado?\" Tendremos que sentarnos y hablar sobre esta \"garantía\" tuya, mercader."
G["Trust in the might of your Empress. She shall lead us to glory!"]="相信女皇的力量吧！她会引领我们走向辉煌！"
G["Trust in ya bow. It'll be there for ya when ya need it most."]="要信任你的弓。当你需要它的时候，它绝不会辜负你。"
G["Trust is earned, stranger."]="Te has ganado nuestra confianza, $gforastero:forastera;."
G["Trust is your weakness."]="信任他人是你最大的弱点。"
G["Trust me - you going love this!"]="相信我——你会喜欢的！"
G["Trust me, friend, a rapid pill-induced death is far preferable to the long, agonizing process of hypothermia and subsequent dismemberment by sharks."]="相信我，朋友，通过服药获得的迅速死亡远比在经受漫长的寒冷之后再被鲨鱼撕碎要好得多。"
G["Trust me, this thing will make those goblins jealous. It's a work of art."]="相信我，它会让那些地精嫉妒死的。这简直是一件艺术品啊。"
G["Truth be told, I never liked that gnome..."]="说实话，我从来就没喜欢过那个侏儒……"
G["Truth is found in death."]="死亡才是真谛。"
G["Truun is in need of lumber from the Warsong Camp. I need to use Brutusk to haul it."]="图伦需要战歌营地的木材。我需要蛮角拖动那些木材。"
G["Try again - I know you can defeat this challenge!"]="再来——我知道你们是可以的！"
G["Try again!"]="再试一次！"
G["Try again."]="再试一次。"
G["Try all new Brivelthwerp's Sililicious Crunch ice cream. Chock-full of real silithid. Accept no imitations!"]="试试布里维普的全新异种蝎嚼嚼乐冰淇淋吧。混合真正的异种蝎肉块。绝无人工仿制品！"
G["Try and keep up, grunt."]="继续保持下去，步兵。"
G["Try and make yourself useful, $r. GET ME OUT OF HERE! The High Interrogator has the key."]="Intenta ser útil, $r. ¡SÁCAME DE AQUÍ! El gran interrogador tiene la llave."
G["Try as I might, I can't seem to drink you pretty!"]="我试过很多种方法，但只有在我喝醉时才觉得你是个美人！"
G["Try it, and I'll fire you AND your ten silver over that wall."]="试试看，然后我会把你和你的十个银币一起丢过那道墙。"
G["Try not ta make me look too bad, eh?"]="别让我太难堪，嗯？"
G["Try not to draw too much attention, I'm waiting for the Council to grant me audience.  Not that I mind waiting, I feel pretty safe around all these burly guards."]="请尽量不要引起太多注目，我正在等待议会的召见。我并不介意多等一会儿，这儿到处是身材魁梧的守卫，我感到非常安全。"
G["Try not to step on my roaches, $gbrother:sister;."]="别踩到我的蟑螂，$g兄弟:姐妹;。"
G["Try some of this cherry pie, it will put a smile on your face, ten miles wide."]="尝尝樱桃馅饼吧，它会令你开怀大笑的。"
G["Try speartouched! Hah! Goregek so funny."]="尝尝长矛的滋味！哈哈！格利基克挺爱开玩笑的。"
G["Try the boar!  It's my new recipe!"]="尝尝野猪肉吧！这是我的新作！"
G["Try the hottest spices from here to the great wall! Delicious, spicy soup!"]="不到长城非好汉，不喝靓汤真遗憾！鲜香美味的酸辣汤啊！"
G["Try these fireworks launchers.  They're a blast!"]="试试这些烟花发射器，非常棒！"
G["Try this guy on for size!"]="换这家伙试试！"
G["Try this'n on fer size!"]="换这个试试！"
G["Try to ignore the firm, feathery behinds of the harpies... the creatures are really quite deadly!"]="别被鹰身人那长满羽毛的翘臀迷惑……她们的杀伤力可是致命的！"
G["Try to keep appraisal errors to a minimum.  I'd hate to tell Gezhe we've overpaid on another gem shipment this month."]="设法把错误评估控制到最小。我不希望杰赫知道我们这个月又为一批宝石运输多掏了钱。"
G["Try to not lose this one, $n. It is important that we at least try and keep up appearances with the Alliance."]="$n，别让这名逃兵再溜走了。至少我们得维护联盟的颜面。"
G["Try to remember where the checkpoints are located. Once you know where to pick up the flags, you can chart the shortest course."]="你要尽量记住那些检查点的位置。一旦搞清楚该去哪儿收集那些旗帜，你便可以制定出最短的飞行路线。"
G["Try to stay alive! We are only just beginning our legendary journey."]="尽量保命！我们才刚刚开始这场传奇之旅。"
G["Try to take better care of yourself, Quinn.  You were lucky this time."]="好好保重，奎恩。这次你真的很幸运。"
G["Try to understand, grummle. This is a temple to Niuzao, the great Black Ox. We are servants to him, and keepers of this temple. We do not \"replace yaks\"."]="Intenta comprenderlo, grúmel. Esto es un templo a Niuzao, el gran Buey Negro. Nosotros somos sus sirvientes, y protegemos este templo. No \"cambiamos yaks\"."
G["Try."]="试试。"
G["Tryin' ta roast ME, ye snaggle-toothed bone-biter?! I'll show ye!"]="想烤了我吗，你这暴牙狗？！我会好好教训你的！"
G["Tryin' ta sneak up on ol' Sully, huh?"]="想要偷袭老苏利，嗯？"
G["Trying to cast on $n."]="试着对$n施法。"
G["Trying to find out more about my predicament has been nearly impossible.  The smuggler that hired us has vanished and Anthion Harmon, our mercenary company's leader, is dead."]="我要想摆脱眼下这种尴尬的处境几乎是不可能的了。那个雇用我们的走私者已经消失得无影无踪，雇佣军团的头子安泰恩·哈尔蒙也死了。"
G["Trying to find out more about these creatures hasn't been easy.  My friend and the person who hired his mercenaries to steal Lord Valthalak's spellbook have both been feared dead for a while."]="No ha sido sencillo conseguir más información acerca de estas criaturas. Mi $gamigo:amiga; y la persona que contrató a sus mercenarios para robar el libro de hechizos de Lord Valthalak se teme que hayan muerto."
G["Trying to pull a fast one on me, are you? I think not!"]="想骗我是吧？没那么容易！"
G["Trying to reach Auberdine or Valiance Keep?  You can find Stormwind Harbor if you head through the Canals, between the Cathedral District and the Park."]="要去奥伯丁或者无畏要塞吗？只要穿过运河，就能抵达位于教堂广场和花园之间的暴风城港口。"
G["Tsk! You need more training."]="啧！你还得再练练才行。"
G["Tsk, tsk, there'll be none of that!"]="肃清敌军！"
G["Tsk. Respect your elders. It is Kayaart who should train you."]="啧啧。尊重你的长者。卡亚特才是你的导师。"
G["Tucked away in the Mage Quarter, there is a little shop called Alchemy Needs.  You're bound to see all sort of strange shops on your way through the Mage Quarter, but if you stick to the outer rim you'll be sure to find it."]="他在法师区，那儿有一间名叫炼金材料店的小商店。你会在前往法师区的沿途看到各种各样奇怪的商店，但是如果你沿着外围走的话，你一定会找到它的。"
G["TugofWar Buffbot, Alliance"]="TugofWar Buffbot, 联盟"
G["TugofWar Buffbot, Alliance Winner"]="TugofWar Buffbot, 联盟胜者"
G["TugofWar Buffbot, Give me a Reward"]="TugofWar Buffbot,给我个奖励。"
G["TugofWar Buffbot, Horde Greeting"]="TugofWar Buffbot, 部落问候"
G["TugofWar Buffbot, Horde Winner"]="TugofWar Buffbot, 部落胜者"
G["Tukka-Tuk gonna punch you and pound you and kick you and scratch you and bite you and poke you and ook you and dook you and..."]="图卡图克要揍死你、捶死你、踢死你、抓死你、咬死你、戳死你、踩死你、烦死你……"
G["Tukka-Tuk pretty sad about losing to wimpy $p. Tukka-Tuk gonna go look at horizon and think about life."]="败给没用的$p，图卡图克很伤心。图卡图克要去看日落，并思考一下人生。"
G["Tune 'em up good, boys!"]="好好修理他们，伙计们！"
G["Turak, Marin, lead these forces up the ramp and take the tower! Be swfit!"]="图拉克，麦琳，带领这些部队冲上斜坡，夺下塔楼。要快！"
G["Turgore! Get up and help me unload, you lazy peon!"]="图高尔！懒惰的家伙，快过来帮我卸货！"
G["Turkey Domination!"]="火鸡主宰！"
G["Turkey Hunter!"]="火鸡猎人！"
G["Turkey Slaughter!"]="火鸡大绝杀！"
G["Turn ... back ..."]="回……去……"
G["Turn around and get back in the fight or I'll have to drop you off!"]="调转方向！重新投入战斗！否则我就将你甩下去！"
G["Turn away, $c.\n\nBefore the cataclysm hit, we found something.\n\nWe dug something up that should've stayed buried.\n\nPray to whatever you believe in that the landslide was enough to keep it down..."]="走吧，$c。\n\n在大灾变到来之前，我们发现了一些东西。\n\n我们挖出了一些本应该永远被深埋在地下的东西。\n\n无论你信仰什么神，你最好现在就向他祈祷崩裂的大地能再把它埋住……"
G["Turn away, weaklings. This be the realm of the Thunder King!"]="滚开，爬虫。这里是雷电之王的疆域。"
G["Turn back now, strangers! You face the army of Iron Qon!"]="回头吧，陌生人！你们将面对铁穹的大军！"
G["Turn back while you can."]="回头吧，在你还有机会回头的时候……"
G["Turn back! Do not wake the dreamer!"]="回去！不要唤醒沉睡者！"
G["Turn back, $c. Dere be some serious darkness in dis cave, and I ain't talkin' about de lack of light."]="回去吧，$c。这座洞窟里隐藏着某种真正的黑暗。我说的可不是那种因为缺少照明而产生的黑暗。"
G["Turn back, intruders! These halls must not be disturbed!"]="退回去，入侵者！这里的殿堂绝不允许亵渎！"
G["Turn back, mon. The naga be controlin' the island to the north. It not safe for ya there."]="回头吧，朋友，纳迦正控制着北边的那座岛。那里对你不安全。"
G["Turn back, mortal... This is not your battle."]="回去吧，凡人……这不是你的战争。"
G["Turn its back to me! I need a clean shot!"]="让它背对着我！我需要干净利落的一击！"
G["Turn over the tablets and I will allow you a quick death."]="交出石板，我会让你死个痛快。"
G["Turn that frown upside down!"]="皱皱眉头！"
G["Turn the key to start the machine."]="转动钥匙，启动了机器。"
G["Turn the machine on, I will lock the door behind you."]="打开这台机器，我会帮你锁住后面的门。"
G["Turn the siege weapons to attack that tower, and bury them alive!"]="让攻城武器攻击那座塔，把他们都活埋了！"
G["Turn them to ash, minions!"]="让他们化为灰烬，仆从们！"
G["Turn your head and cough twice."]="转头，咳嗽两次。"
G["Turnin' up the heat!"]="热力还要更强！"
G["Turning to face Tuluun, the %s sneers contemptuously."]="%s把头转向图伦，轻蔑地冷笑着。"
G["Turnips must be punished!"]="芜菁必须受到惩罚！"
G["Turnips! Why you so bad?"]="芜菁！你怎么这么坏？"
G["Turo von Kuros!"]="¡Turo von Kuros!"
G["Turret non-functional, updating test parameters."]="炮台无法运转，更新测试参数。"
G["Turtle"]="海龟"
G["Tuskarr Kite"]="海象人风筝"
G["Tutorial Completed!\nYou've unlocked the Sunflower."]="教学已完成！\n你已解锁向日葵。"
G["Tw- Tw- Twilight's Ha- Hammer? Keep them away from me!"]="暮——暮——暮光之——之锤？离我远点！"
G["Twas those iron cousins of ours! For certain!"]="肯定是那些混蛋铁矮人表亲！肯定是！"
G["Twelve steps is more like it!"]="看上去更像千里之外！"
G["Twenty CCs of Kaja'Cola, stat! Not for the patient... for me!"]="20毫升卡亚可乐，注射！不是给病人……是给我！"
G["Twenty years lost! Twenty! I won't stand for this! No, no, no..."]="20年啊！20年！我没法忍受！没法忍受……"
G["Twenty years of research, hoping and dreaming, all crashing to a halt. All that remains now is the mission, and my daughter Lyalia."]="长达二十年的研究，那些希望和梦想，全都戛然而止了。现在仅剩下这使命，还有我的女儿丽娅拉。"
G["Twenty years we've been stranded in this hell-hole. It's all I can do not to run screaming through that blasted Portal. I want to see my loved ones again! I want them to know I'm still alive."]="我困在这个地狱一样的地方已经有二十年了。我所能做的就是冲着那道该死的大门尖叫，我想再看看我所爱的人！我想让他们知道我还活着！"
G["Twenty? Impossible, it couldn't have been less than fourty."]="才二十个？不可能吧，少于四十个人根本不可能。"
G["Twice a day, at six fifteen in the morning and six fifteen in the evening, High Tinker Mekkatorque himself comes out to the Brewfest grounds for the Tapping of the Keg ceremony. Don't miss it!"]="每天两次，分别是在早上6点15分和下午6点15分，大工匠梅卡托克会亲自来到美酒节的现场，主持开酒罐仪式。千万别错过！"
G["Twice a day, at six fifteen in the morning and six fifteen in the evening, Shadow Hunter Vol'jin himself comes out to the Brewfest grounds for the Tapping of the Keg ceremony. You'd be a fool to miss it!"]="每天两次，分别是在早上6点15分和下午6点15分，暗影猎手沃金会亲自来到美酒节的现场，主持开酒罐仪式。千万别错过！"
G["Twice the pain and half the fun."]="双倍的痛苦不过是个开始。"
G["Twilight assassins are upon us!  Do not let them interrupt the ritual!"]="暮光的刺客就要过来了！不能让他们打断这个仪式！"
G["Twilight essence begins to bubble forth from the corpse of the whelp...."]="暮光精华开始自雏龙的尸体中升腾……"
G["Twilight forces begin to appear around the canyon's edges."]="暮光大军出现在峡谷上方的悬崖边。"
G["Twilight minions in the Nexus...\n\nThese are desperate times, $r."]="暮光爪牙出现在魔枢……\n\n这真是危急万分的时刻，$r。"
G["Twilight of the Dragons"]="巨龙暮光"
G["Twilight scum!"]="暮光渣滓！"
G["Twilight scum!  You did this to us!"]="暮光渣滓！这是你们造的孽！"
G["Twilight scum."]="暮光渣滓。"
G["Twilight shall fall upon you, even in this deep, dark hole."]="暮光将笼罩你，即使在这漆黑深邃的洞穴中。"
G["Twilight's Hammer don't scare me none. Bring 'em on!"]="暮光之锤吓不倒我。尽管来吧！"
G["Twilight's Hammer has infiltrated my city. Left unchecked, they'll rot it to the core. Before we besiege their stronghold in the Highlands, I must be certain that Stormwind is safe from their machinations.\n\nI need more feet on the ground, reliable eyes and ears throughout the city. An experienced $c like yourself would be invaluable.\n\nAre you prepared to help Stormwind's cause?"]="El Martillo Crepuscular se ha infiltrado en mi ciudad. Si no hacemos algo, la corromperán desde dentro. Antes de asaltar su base en las Tierras Altas, debo asegurarme de que Ventormenta está a salvo de sus maquinaciones.\n\nNecesito más pies en el suelo, ojos y oídos de confianza en la ciudad. $gUn:Una; $c $gexperimentado:experimentada; como tú sería una aportación incalculable.\n\n¿Estás $gpreparado:preparada; para contribuir a la causa de Ventormenta?"
G["Twilight's Hammer is on the run? I've got to get back to the front!"]="暮光之锤的人跑了？我得回到前线上去！"
G["Twilight's Hammer pukes!"]="暮光之锤去死吧！"
G["Twilight's Hammer. Bah. Bunch of prancing purple... pussycats. Back to business. Gravy! What am I drinking?"]="暮光之锤。啊呸！一群上蹿下跳的紫色……娘娘腔。算了，坐在酒吧里喝酒才是正经事儿。格莱维！我喝点什么好呢？"
G["Twilight's Hammer... I heard them screaming and running... are we making a counter-attack?"]="暮光之锤……我听见他们尖叫窜逃……我们是在发动反攻吗？"
G["Twilight's Hammer? I don't know anything! Why are you asking me?"]="暮光之锤？我什么都不知道！你干吗问我？"
G["Twin Peaks"]="双子峰"
G["Twin Spire Ruins is not yet secure! My orders are to only give out battle standards when the two beacons are lit and the area is secure. Get out there and gain control of those beacons!"]="双塔废墟还没有被占领！我的命令是当这两座灯塔都被点亮、并且整个区域都被占领的时候发放军旗。到那里去控制灯塔吧！"
G["Twinkle looks at Viera Sunwhisper with very hungry eyes."]="咪咪用饥饿的眼神看着薇拉·火语。"
G["Twinkles! Why did it have to be Twinkles?"]="烁影！为什么是烁影呢！"
G["Twist in agony."]="在痛苦中扭曲吧。"
G["Twist in flames, interlopers!"]="在烈焰中挣扎吧，闯入者！"
G["Twisted creatures bent on the destruction of all living beings."]="扭曲的怪物们一心要毁灭全部生灵。"
G["Twisting your pitiful whelps into mindless abominations, bent only to my will. It was a very... painful process."]="将你的幼龙变成扭曲无脑的畸形，并屈从于我的命令。这可是……非常痛苦的过程。"
G["Twizzleflux!  What insanity are you up to?  We brought the additional crew you requested, but there is no... research going on here.  Only madness!"]="焊钩！你在发什么疯？我们带来了你需要的人员，但这里……根本没有什么研究工作。这里只有疯狂！"
G["Two days, tops!"]="两天，最多！"
G["Two enemy factions. Both deserve to drown in blood. Who will taste death this day?"]="两个敌对阵营，他们都应被浸没在血泊中。谁会在今天品尝死亡的味道呢？"
G["Two fog beasts remain."]="还有两只雾行兽。"
G["Two hundred ships at my disposal, yet the one carrying my SON goes missing!"]="我有两百多艘船，唯独载着我儿子的那艘……不见了！"
G["Two in DRAGON years. It is your move."]="龙族的两岁。该你了。"
G["Two knives and a goblin. What more could you ask for?"]="两把利刀和一个地精。你还能再要求些什么？"
G["Two more stains appear!  Keep cleaning!"]="又出现了两个污点！继续清洁！"
G["Two oozes, one room. So many delightful possibilities!"]="两泥，一室。会有无限惊喜哦！"
G["Two parts oil to one part brew... no, it will need more oil..."]="两份油兑一份酒……不，油应该再多点儿……"
G["Two sets of orders seem to have been hastily scribbled on this dispatch."]="这封信件上潦草地书写着两道指令。"
G["Two silver says I can split that arrow down the shaft."]="和你赌两个银币，我能把一支箭从中间劈开。"
G["Two steps ahead of ya again, junior! As usual."]="又比你早了两步，小子！一如既往。"
G["Two theories when arguing with yak. Neither one works."]="在与牦牛争论时有两大理论。可哪个也不起作用。"
G["Two titanic constructs appear in the large alcoves!"]="两个巨型构造体出现在大型的壁龛中！"
G["Two ways to get behind enemy lines, Johnny. Three if you count bein' dead."]="有两种方式可以深入敌后，约翰尼。如果算上死的话，总共有三种。"
G["Two words - imp-possible!"]="两个字：不可能！"
G["Two words: Arcanite buoy."]="四个字：奥金鱼漂。"
G["Two words: Ka-boom!\n\nAll I'm sayin' is that this shindig could benefit from a powder keg or two."]="两个字：轰隆！\n\n我想说的是，像这样的盛会，如果能再来一两桶炸药就更好了。"
G["Two-Tusk never give me treasure!"]="双牙从来不给我财宝！"
G["Two..."]="二……"
G["Twonky!"]="托奇！"
G["Ty, stop tattling on your brother. Liu, do not give your brother a reason to tattle."]="泰，别说你哥哥坏话了。刘，你也别给你弟弟说坏话的理由。"
G["Tyn is quite the talented skinner; she produces the finest lynx hides I've yet seen. If you wish to learn from her, you'll find her on the southeast end of the Walk of Elders."]="提恩是个很有天赋的剥皮师，她所生产的山猫皮是我见过的最好的东西。如果你想从她那里学到点本事，可以在长者步道的东南尽头找到她。"
G["Typical empty boasting. Still, the stables are rather distant and the drinks here are decent enough."]="你就胡诌吧。不管怎样，到马厩还有一段路，咱们带的酒还够。"
G["Typical. Just as I was having fun..."]="轻松。就像我平常的娱乐一样……"
G["Tyrande Whisperwind."]="泰兰德·语风。"
G["Tyrande and Malfurion welcomed us in with open arms.  Almost as if we were long lost family.  It was strange and comforting."]="泰兰德和玛法里奥张开双臂接纳了我们。就好象我们是失散已久的家人。这很奇怪…也很令人宽慰。"
G["Tyrande can hold her own once again!"]="泰兰德又振作起来了！"
G["Tyrande collapses!  The Light of Elune winks out!"]="泰兰德精疲力尽了！艾露恩之光熄灭了！"
G["Tyrande hand picked me for this mission.\n\nShe said it was because of her visions but I am guessing it was because my father was the one who talked her in to approving the mission."]="泰兰德钦定我来执行这个任务。\n\n她说这是因为她看到了幻象，但我猜真正的原因是因为说服她批准这个任务的人，是我父亲。"
G["Tyrande is imbued with the shining light of the Moon Goddess!"]="泰兰德沐浴在月神的光辉之中！"
G["Tyrande is overwhelmed! Use the Blessing of Elune to drive the demons back!"]="泰兰德顶不住了！快使用艾露恩的祝福击退恶魔！"
G["Tyrande sends her prayers. The Mother Moon blesses us all."]="泰兰德送来了她的问候。月神与我们同在。"
G["Tyrande sent us here as a vanguard for the Light."]="泰兰德派我们来这里寻找圣光。"
G["Tyrande warned... she... she said there would be great dark... before light."]="泰兰德警告过我……她……她说在光明之前将会是……一片黑暗。"
G["Tyrande, I may not be a politician. But I am a fighter. I know we can win this war."]="泰兰德，我并非政客，我是个战士。我知道我们能赢。"
G["Tyrosus himself sent us to Northdale!  So why are we wasting our time with upstart nerubians?!"]="泰罗索斯亲自派我们前往北谷！为什么我们却要和那些猖狂的蛛魔浪费时间？！"
G["Tyrygosa yet lives! We must press on, to the Temple!"]="塔丽苟萨还活着！我们必须前进，朝神殿进军！"
G["UNBELIEVABLE! $n is victorious! King Kraw is no more!"]="难以置信！$n获胜了！大金钢从这个世界上消失了！"
G["UNF!"]="呼呼！"
G["UNFATHOMABLE!"]="变幻莫测！"
G["USELESS!"]="废物！"
G["USELESS! Fall limp and die before me, wretched insect. Your kind are worthless to me!"]="啊……真是没用！跪倒在我面前受死吧，肮脏的虫子。你们的种族对我毫无价值。"
