G["Ug'thor, they are afraid to die."]="乌格索，他们怕死。"
G["Ugglin oo bjorr!"]="¡Ugglin oo bjorr!"
G["Ugh!  My head won't stop spinning..."]="啊……我感到头晕目眩。"
G["Ugh!  No, I could never.  Afraid of horses."]="啊！不，我可不行。我害怕马。"
G["Ugh!  That's terrible!"]="啊！太恐怖了！"
G["Ugh!  Why are you WET!?"]="啊！为什么你湿了！？"
G["Ugh! Another gnome? Apparently this one calls himself Millhouse Manastorm. Get out there and kill him!"]="呃！又是侏儒？这一位似乎是自称米尔豪斯·法力风暴。快来干掉他吧！"
G["Ugh! Being on your feet all day is no way to make a living. I should have been a tailor."]="啊！整日闲逛是没有前途的，我当年应该去学裁缝……"
G["Ugh! Hold on!"]="啊！坚持住！"
G["Ugh! Look at what you've done to my fur!"]="嗷！看看你都对我的毛做了什么！"
G["Ugh! Not this again! I'm asking for a new station next expedition..."]="啊！我可不要再这样了！我已经提出请求，要参加下一次的探险……"
G["Ugh! We've been hit!"]="啊！遭到攻击！"
G["Ugh! What is that scoundrel doing sending his vermin to me? Get out of my sight before I take what is left of your life. And take this with you."]="啊！那个无赖派他的人来找我吗？在我动手杀了你之前滚出我的视线，还有，拿上这个。"
G["Ugh! You guys are gonna make me throw up."]="呃！你们俩就得了吧。"
G["Ugh, I Biebered..."]="呃，我搞砸了……"
G["Ugh, I should never have volunteered to be a specialist. They always ask us to do the impossible!"]="啊，当初真不该抢着要专家的名头。他们老是让我做一些根本就不可能的事！"
G["Ugh, my back! You'll pay for that!"]="呃，我的背！你会付出代价的！"
G["Ugh, the lok'tar must have been cooking up a turd - which would explain the smell."]="呃，他们一定在煮粪便吃——不然这气味没法解释。"
G["Ugh, what a bunch of slackers."]="啊，一群懒鬼。"
G["Ugh, what did you pour on me? It's disgusting!"]="呃，你把什么倒在了我的身上？好恶心啊！"
G["Ugh, what is that stench?"]="呃，这是什么臭味？"
G["Ugh, what is this swill?  It tastes like wet dog fur!"]="呃，这到底是什么东西？尝起来像是湿狗毛！"
G["Ugh, what is this swill? It tastes like wet dog fur!"]="呃，这到底是什么东西？尝起来像是湿狗毛！"
G["Ugh, you fight like two gnolls in heat. Distracted. Sloppy. Gibbering. Get out. OUT! Next?"]="呃，你战斗起来就像热锅上的豺狼人。心不在焉，鲁莽草率，乱七八糟。滚出去。出去！下一个！"
G["Ugh."]="呃。"
G["Ugh. Matted clumps of hair, molted feathers, bits of bone, partially burnt material - clothing perhaps?"]="哟。纠结的毛发、脱落的羽毛、碎裂的骨头、被烧焦的不明物——或许是衣物？"
G["Ugh. Tell me that wasn't a cockroach..."]="啊。别告诉我那是只蟑螂……"
