G["Ugh... Hallan, didn't think you had it in you..."]="啊……哈兰，我没有想到……"
G["Ugh... I don't feel so good."]="嗯……我的感觉不太好。"
G["Ugh... I need a bucket!"]="呃……给我来个桶！"
G["Ugh... I think I mighta ooked my dookers."]="呃……我好像把事情搞砸了。"
G["Ugh... I'm getting dizzy."]="呃……我有点晕。"
G["Ugh... I'm so not ready to leave..."]="啊……我还没准备好离开……"
G["Ugh... Me not feel so guud."]="呃……我感觉不是很好。"
G["Ugh... My head still swims, friend. Come, show me the wreckage."]="嗷……我脑袋还晕忽忽的，朋友。我看看飞艇残骸。"
G["Ugh... death... hurts? Unreal..."]="呃……死亡……痛楚？都是假象……"
G["Ugh... dese boxes too heavy. Dey might fall!"]="呃……这些箱子太重了。要掉地上了！"
G["Ugh... disgusting!"]="唷……真恶心！"
G["Ugh... go away!"]="啊……滚开！"
G["Ugh... maybe if you could lightly slap me on the cheek..."]="啊……如果你能轻轻地拍拍我的面颊，也许……"
G["Ugh... ooked by a wikket..."]="啊……被无毛怪弄死了……"
G["Ugh... taking so long... my limbs... can't go on..."]="呃…这么久…我的肋骨…撑不住了…"
G["Ugh... these pests keep me busy night and day! Haven't you seen them?\n\nI wish I could just jump down a pipe to get away from them..."]="啊……这些家伙让我整天都不得安宁！你看见他们了吗？\n\n我真希望自己能藏到地下，避开他们……"
G["Ugh... what is this place?  Is that all that's left of the ship over there?"]="啊……这里是哪？飞船就只剩下这点了？"
G["Ugh... what was that stuff? It went through me like bad tea."]="呃……那玩意是什么？就像是喝了馊茶水。"
G["Ugh... where am I?"]="呃……我这是在哪儿？"
G["Ugh...."]="呃…"
G["Ugh...That hurt... Where are my friends?  I need to get back into the fight..."]="啊……好疼……我的朋友们在哪里？我要回去战斗……"
G["Ughh... <cough> The locust is fine! <cough> <cough>"]="Uuuh... <tose> ¡La langosta está bien! <tose> <tose>"
G["Ughh... urrrggg...."]="呃……啊……"
G["Ughhh... I hurt.  Can you help me?"]="啊啊啊……疼死我了。你可以帮帮我吗？"
G["Ughhh...bad juju make me sick!"]="呃……坏魂能让我感觉恶心！"
G["Ughhhh... my head is hazy... try again later."]="呃……我脑袋晕乎乎的……一会再说吧。"
G["Ughhhh...boss don't feel so good..."]="呃呃呃……头领感觉不太好……"
G["Ugly fish men!"]="是丑八怪鱼人！"
G["Ugly little monsters, pray I don't get out!"]="你们这些丑陋的小怪物，最好祈祷我出不去！"
G["Uh huh.  Unholies in War Quarter standing around main building on outer ring of city."]="哼。军事区的邪恶的生物站在城市外圈的主建筑物周围。"
