G["Uh oh!"]="噢，不！"
G["Uh oh!  I'm out of here!"]="啊呀！我要离开这儿！"
G["Uh oh!  It would appear that all of the noise you've been making has attracted some unwanted attention!"]="啊呀！看来你所制造的噪音已经引起了一些不必要的注意！"
G["Uh oh! He looks pretty mad now!"]="呃，喔！他现在气急败坏了！"
G["Uh oh! More eggmen come. Chief, we'd better run for now!"]="啊呃！鸟蛋人越来越多了。酋长，我们最好赶紧逃跑！"
G["Uh oh! My tools' have run out. We're going to have to start over..."]="啊！我的工具用完了。我们不得不重新开始……"
G["Uh oh! You be in double truffle-shuffle trouble now!"]="唔，哦！现在你困在两倍大块菌的麻烦里了！"
