G["Uh oh, it's the Trade Prince."]="呃哦，是贸易大王。"
G["Uh oh, those stags don't look pleased with us!"]="啊……那些塔布羊看上去对我们不是很友好！"
G["Uh oh.  The wagon looks unstable... it's going to blow!!!"]="喔。货车看上去不太稳定……它要爆炸了！！！"
G["Uh oh. Looks like I've sprung a leak! The brew!!!"]="啊哦。好像有什么东西漏出来了！是酒！！！"
G["Uh oh..."]="啊……"
G["Uh oh... I smell smoke..."]="啊呃……我闻到烟的味道了……"
G["Uh oh... Jin'do's not gonna be happy about this..."]="呃哦……金度一定不会喜欢这个……"
G["Uh oh... my battle armor... weakening..."]="啊噢……我的战甲……正在被削弱……"
G["Uh oh... this is bad."]="啊……这太糟糕了。"
G["Uh oh...."]="啊呀……"
G["Uh oh...I'm gonna...urp!"]="呃哦……我要……嗝儿！"
G["Uh uh! Wait till you guys get a whiff of my latest invention! I'll give you a hint. It's a pumpkin soaker!"]="嘿嘿！你们这些家伙等着看我的最新发明啊！我会给你们一个提示，它是一个南瓜雨！"
G["Uh uh! Wait till you guys get a whiff of my latest invention! I'll give you a hint. It's a squash rocket!"]="嘿嘿！你们这些家伙等着看我的最新发明啊！我会给你们一个提示，它是一个南瓜火箭！"
G["Uh, no... no, that won't be necessary. I'll, uh, send a soldier by to collect the, uh, headgear later on. I really must be going now..."]="哦，不……不，不必了。我会，嗯，派一个士兵来拿，呃，头盔。我现在必须走了……"
G["Uh, yeah... I'll be right there, dear."]="嗯，好……马上，亲爱的。"
G["Uh-oh! You stirred up some angry crabs!"]="啊哦！你惹毛了一些愤怒的螃蟹！"
G["Uh-oh! You stirred up some spiders!"]="啊哦！你惹毛了一些蜘蛛！"
G["Uh-oh, looks like today, our plants are parched. Let's water them."]="呃——噢，看来今天我们的植物要被烤糊了。来浇些水吧。"
G["Uh-oh, stingin' bugs! Don't let them get near you! They bite!"]="呃——噢，蜇人的虫子！别让它们靠近你！会咬人的！"
G["Uh-oh, you have something on your face!"]="噢喔，你脸上好像有东西！"
G["Uh-oh. We've got company! HOLD ON TIGHT! I'm gonna try and lose 'em!"]="哎呀，我们被盯上啦！抓紧啦！我打算甩掉它们！"
G["Uh-oh..."]="呃——噢……"
G["Uh-oh...\n\nI probably shouldn't tell you, but I'm saving up my money to leave this town. I just can't stand staying in one place anymore.\n\nYou're an adventurer... you understand. Could you help me out?"]="额——噢……\n\n我也许不该告诉你，可我正在存钱，准备离开这镇子。我再也受不了只待在一个地方了。\n\n你是个冒险家……你明白的。能帮帮我吗？"
G["Uh-oh... Chief ain't gonna be happy..."]="噢喔……酋长知道了要生气的……"
G["Uh-oh... here comes the master now..."]="啊哦……师父来了……"
G["Uh-oh... this gonna hurts me..."]="阿噢……这会伤到我……"
G["Uh-oh...! I feel the call of nature!"]="呃——噢……！我感受到了自然的召唤！"
G["Uh..."]="呃……"
G["Uh... Father...?  Are you there?  I'm hungry... can I have some stew?"]="啊……爸爸……？你在那边吗？我很饿……我能吃点炖肉吗？"
G["Uh... I sorry I attack you boss.  You no kill me, please OK!?  You da king now, and I help make your tribute better!"]="Eeeh... Siento haberte atacado, $gjefe:jefa;. Tú no matarme, por favor, ¿vale? ¡Tú $grey:reina; ahora y yo ayudarte a hacer tu tributo más grande!"
G["Uh... a couple more tweaks should do it, I think..."]="呃……看来还需要略做调整……"
G["Uh... later!"]="呃……以后再说！"
G["Uh... sure thing, Gankly.  Just...<cough>... wait right there.  <Cough>  Guys?"]="Oh... seguro, Abusón. Solo...<tose>... espera aquí. <Tose> ¿Chicos?"
G["Uh... that's okay. It still kind of hurts from last time."]="嗯……好吧。上次的伤还在隐隐作痛呢。"
G["Uh... the disease is potent.  And it attacks the mind..."]="啊……这种疾病相当厉害。它会影响人的心智……"
G["Uh...?"]="嗯……？"
G["Uh...uh..."]="呃……呃……"
G["Uhh, can you send me on the tour of Zul'Drak?"]="呃，能带我在祖达克逛一圈吗？"
G["Uhh, somethin' ain't right, General... We're losin' altitude! Fast!"]="呃，情况不对，将军……我们下降得……很快！"
G["Uhh, who are you?"]="呃，你是谁？"
G["Uhh, whoops..."]="哎呀……"
G["Uhh..."]="嗯……"
G["Uhh... wha?"]="呃？"
G["Uhhh, I suppose I'm ready..."]="呃，我想我准备好了……"
G["Uhhh.. I'm not sure. Anything else you can tell me about him?"]="嗯……我不确定。关于他，你还能告诉我一些什么事情？"
G["Uhhh.. you can handle this right?"]="呃……你能搞定它的，对吧？"
G["Uhnhh.... Don't... bother with me.\n\nI am... finished..."]="呃……别……别管我。\n\n我……没救了……"
G["Uhnhh.... Don't... bother with me.\n\nI am... finished...."]="呃……别……别管我。\n\n我……没救了……"
G["Uhnhh.... It is too late for me, $g brother:sister;.\n\nI am... finished..."]="啊……太晚了，$g兄弟:姐妹;。\n\n我……快死了……"
G["Uldaman can be found at the very northern end of the Badlands."]="奥达曼位于荒芜之地最北端。"
G["Uldaman is an ancient Titan vault that has laid buried within the earth since the world's creation. Dwarven excavations of the city have recently released the Titans' first failed creations: the troggs. Legends say that when the Titans deemed the trogg experiment a failure they tried again, resulting in the creation of the dwarven race. These secrets are recorded on the fabled Discs of Norgannon - massive artifacts that lie at the bottom of the ancient city, protected by giant constructs of living stone."]="自从宇宙诞生，奥达曼就一直在地下作为上古之神泰坦的墓穴而存在。矮人考古队最近公布了泰坦首次失败的创作——石腭怪。传说泰坦认为石腭怪的试验失败后，他们再次尝试，结果建立了矮人种族。这些秘密被记录在诺甘农的传说圆盘上——大量的史前古物藏在这座古老的城市，被巨大的石头生物守护着。"
G["Ulduar's archives may hold the knowledge we need to stop Loken from using the city's resources against us. The problem is that the key to those archives was divided and hidden.\n\nI think I've found out where one of the pieces is, in the Inventor's Library, which sits on the northern edge of the mountains northeast of you. The first thing you'll need to do is retrieve the fragments of an access disk from the library's guardians."]="保存在奥杜尔的文献中可能记载着阻止洛肯滥用城市资源来对付我们的办法。但是解封档案的钥匙被泰坦分成了两截，并分别藏了起来。\n\n我已经发现了其中一半的下落，它就藏在创世者的图书馆里。图书馆位于东北方群山的北麓。首先，你必须从图书馆守卫者那里取得圆盘的碎片。"
G["Ulduar... I was sworn to protect Ulduar.\n\nSworn to protect the Terrace of the Makers.\n\nSworn to protect the pacts between the races of frost.\n\nBut I failed!  I let my brother trick me.  I let him turn me against my allies.  He tricked me into blaming Sif's death on a dear friend, Arngrim, the king of the frost giants.\n\nAfter I realized what I'd done... I... gave in to despair."]="奥杜尔……我曾经发誓要守护奥杜尔。\n\n发誓要守护造物者圣台。\n\n发誓要守护与冰霜巨人之间的盟誓。\n\n可是我都没有做到！我被我的兄弟欺骗了。他诱使我将矛头指向我的朋友。他骗我说是我亲密的朋友，冰霜巨人之王安格里姆害死了西芙。\n\n当我意识到自己做了什么时……我……陷入了绝望。"
G["Uldum is a research facility for the Creators in their continuing efforts to enhance the biosphere of Azeroth.  Specific information regarding their work as it relates to Uldum is restricted to those individuals who possess the Plates of Uldum in their disc sets.\n\nData repositories inside the Uldum complex have been programmed to address specific experiments and data compilations; please refer to them for detailed information."]="奥丹姆是一座为维系艾泽拉斯的自然体系而建造的研究工厂。只有那些拥有奥丹姆圆盘的人知道创世者在奥丹姆所进行的研究工作的详细情况。\n\n奥丹姆中的数据库被用于进行特殊的试验和数据编辑，更多详细信息，请查询数据库。"
G["Uldum is full of treasures, my friend."]="奥丹姆里蕴藏着丰富的财宝，我的朋友。"
G["Ulfang, I need to see through the Eyes of the Eagle again."]="乌尔芬，我想再次透过巨鹰之眼洞悉真相。"
G["Ulthok, stop them..."]="乌尔索克，阻止他们……"
G["Ultra-Pelt!"]="超级投掷！"
G["Ultris?"]="乌提斯？"
G["Um, Fran, it looks like I somehow lost your watering can.  May I have another, please?"]="呃，老方，我好像把你的洒水壶给弄丢了。能再给我一个吗？"
G["Um, Goldmine, I seem to have misplaced your fire totem."]="哦，金矿，我似乎是找不到你的火焰图腾了。"
G["Um, Hobart, you're at the controls."]="呃，没错，霍巴特，一切都在你的掌控之中。"
G["Um, Hobart, you're wearing them."]="霍巴特，你正戴着它呢。"
G["Um, I'm taking some prisoners we found outside before the king for punishment."]="嗯，我要把这些人带到国王那里去听候发落。"
G["Um, Ozzie... that doesn't look very safe."]="嗯，奥齐……那个似乎不太安全。"
G["Um, could one of you grunts take care of those guys right there?!"]="嗯，你们这些乱哼哼的家伙有没有想过要对付那边的那些人？！"
G["Um, dude, this does not look good. I'm out of here!"]="嗯，小子，这看上去不太好。我要离开这里！"
G["Um, healer?!"]="治疗者呢？"
G["Um, hello!  If you are here about fee collection and/or a summons, then you must have me mistaken for someone else.  Terribly sorry!"]="嗯，你好！如果你是来征收费用或者投递传票的，那你一定是将我认作别人了。非常抱歉！"
G["Um, hello, Mr. Great One. We are honored to meet you."]="呃，你好，造物主。见到你是我们的荣幸。"
G["Um, hello?"]="呃，你好？"
G["Um, hello? Is there anyone out there?"]="呃，嗨？有人吗？"
G["Um, just teleport me to Silvermoon."]="嗯，把我传送到银月城吧。"
G["Um, no. Would you mind hanging out a little longer? I have some stuff I need to take care of first."]="嗯，不。你不介意再多吊上一会儿吧？我还得先干点儿别的事。"
G["Um, no... no, I don't want that at all."]="呃，不……不，我压根没想过。"
G["Um, pirates, my brothers are going to be very worried about me going missing. Maybe you could let me go? Rizzle has a drinking problem and Fizzle has a problem with his blood pressure!"]="嗯，海盗们，我的失踪一定正让我的兄弟们忧心不已。也许你能放我出去？里兹尔经常喝醉酒，而菲兹尔有血压高的毛病！"
G["Um, this may take a while."]="嗯，这可能需要点时间。"
G["Um, yeah... get 'em!"]="嗯，是的……拿下他们！"
G["Um, you already know everything I could teach you. Maybe it's time for you to talk to someone else. Try the night elf Ainethil in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus. She's got some real talent!"]="嗯，我能教的你已经都学会了。或许你该找其他人谈谈了。试一下达纳苏斯工匠区的暗夜精灵安尼希尔。她确实很有智慧！"
G["Um, you kill king, yeah?  That means you take his place.  That make you da new boss!  Hail to da king!"]="Mmm... ¿Tú matar al rey, sí? Eso significa que tú ocupar su lugar. ¡Eso te convierte en $gel nuevo rey:la nueva reina;! ¡Viva $gel rey:la reina;!"
G["Um... Al'teth ... la c'tolgar? Or something."]="Um... Al'teth ... la c'tolgar？还是其它什么。"
G["Um... Apparently there is some trouble at Southshore. Something about worgen insurgents. Maybe you could help with them?"]="嗯……南海镇显然是遇到了些麻烦。狼人在这里发动了叛乱。你愿意帮助我对付他们吗？"
G["Um... I hate to say this, but... I kinda lost the I-Scream Cryocannon."]="呃……这可真难开口，可是……我恐怕把激冻冰弹给弄丢了。"
G["Um... I think one of those wolves is back..."]="嗯……有头狼折回来了……"
G["Um... I think you're a little too big to ride a Mechano-strider there, $g mister : ma'am;.  You'd likely crush the finely tuned servo-balancers!"]="嗯……我认?你体型过大，不能乘坐机械陆行鸟，$g先生:女士;。你很可能会压碎这些精美的机器！"
G["Um... I'm gonna need your battleworg again."]="嗯……我还会用到你的战斗座狼的。"
G["Um... Your Majesty, would you turn into a dragon for us?"]="嗯……尊贵的殿下，你愿意为我们变成一条龙吗？"
G["Um... guys?"]="兄弟们？"
G["Um... sorry to bother you, but could I see Goodsteel's ledger again... if you're not using it."]="嗯……很抱歉打扰你，如果你现在没有在用古德斯迪尔的账本……能让我再看看吗？"
G["Um... what was that?"]="嗯……那是什么？"
G["Um... you do realize there's a bottom to this cage?!"]="嗯……你注意到这笼子有底了？"
G["Umi sent you, didn't she?! She told me to expect a surprise, but I never thought that this is what she meant!"]="乌米派你来的，是吗？！她告诉我会有一个惊喜，但是我从没想到她是这个意思！"
G["Umm, Aggra... shouldn't you be following Thrall?"]="啊，阿格娜……你不是应该跟着萨尔吗？"
G["Umm... I think I might need a hand here..."]="嗯……我也许需要点帮助……"
G["Umm... Pebblebitty... the gate is open."]="嗯……贝波蒂……门已经打开了。"
G["Umm... guys..."]="嗯……伙计们……"
G["Umm... he's coming right at me."]="嗯……他朝我冲过来了。"
G["Umm... yes, yes she is.  Unquestionably."]="嗯……是的，她当然是，毫无疑问。"
G["Ummm... the frog says you're a traitor, \"matey.\""]="Ummm... la rana dice que eres un traidor, \"asere\"."
G["Umph! I'm afraid that one was a bit of a waste."]="啊！这一脚恐怕是白挨了。"
G["Un'Goro Crater be far to the south of Kalimdor. Beyond the Thousand Needles in Tanaris. Look for the large floating stones... they mark the entrance to the Crater. But be careful... it is no easy path. The raptors are not far from the entrance."]="安戈洛环形山在卡利姆多南部，位于塔纳利斯沙漠的西面。去寻找巨大的浮空石……它们是环形山入口的标志。但是要小心，那里可是很危险的，迅猛龙就在入口附近徘徊。"
G["Un'Goro Crater serves a very specific purpose, $n.  It is now time for you to learn that purpose."]="安戈洛环形山的存在有其特殊的意图，$n。现在该是你知道这个意图的时候了。"
G["Un... provoked. The mogu attacked and... everything going dark..."]="无……无缘无故地，魔古族突然发起了攻击……一切都变黑了……"
G["Un...con...tainable."]="无……法……控制。"
G["Un...leash."]="解……放！"
G["Unauthorized entity attempting circuit overload. Activating anti-personnel countermeasures."]="未经认证的实体正在尝试使回路过载。启动反步兵防御措施。"
G["Unauthorized personnel identified!  Punishment protocol activated."]="身份未经确认！防御程序自动激活！"
G["Unbelievable!  Anyone else want to attack?"]="难以置信！还有其他人想攻击？"
G["Unbelievable!  I think I've just discovered that everything does not orbit around the Outland.  No, that can't be right!"]="不可能！我发现所有东西都不围绕外域运转！不，这不可能！"
G["Unbelievable! $n has defeated the Murkblood twins!"]="难以置信！$n击败了暗血兄弟！"
G["Unbelievable! How dare they??"]="不可思议！他们怎么如此大胆？？"
G["Unbelievable! This is the fabled Mogu'shan Library!  Can you even imagine what we could learn from these vaults?"]="难以置信！这里是传说中的魔古山藏书馆！你能想象我们可以从这些地宫里发掘出多少秘密吗？"
G["Unbelievable! You've just saved my neck, $n. Oh ho, and just look at this luster."]="难以置信！你刚刚救了我的小命，$n。嚯嚯，你看看这光泽。"
G["Unchain and control Flamebringer."]="解开烈焰使者的锁链并控制它。"
G["Uncle Chen and I spent weeks wandering around that Jade Forest, and all we saw were trees... and ONE cool serpent thing."]="我和陈叔在翡翠林里转了几个星期，除了看到一条很酷的翔龙之外，就全是树了。"
G["Uncle Chen's waiting up ahead. You go find him... I'll stay here and mock this unconscious monkey."]="陈叔在前面等着呢。你去找他吧……我要戏弄一下这只不省人事的猴子。"
G["Uncle Chen, Mudmug! Race you there!"]="陈叔，泥盏！看我们谁先到那儿！"
G["Uncle Deming got me a goldfish for my birthday. He calls it Su-Shi."]="德明大叔送了我条金鱼当生日礼物。他管它叫苏石。"
G["Uncle Gao, this brewery was left in your care! What have you done?"]="高老伯，这酿酒厂是由你看着的。你都干了什么？"
G["Uncle brought a keg to drink if he wins, and two to drink if he loses.  So in the end, I guess he still won!"]="叔叔要是赢了，就会喝一桶酒；要是输了，那就要喝两桶。所以我猜他还是赢了！"
G["Uncle! Uncle! I give! You guys are too much for me!"]="老爷！老爷！我让步！你们太厉害了！"
G["Uncle, look. There's somebody up ahead. He looks... weird."]="叔叔，看。前面有个人。他看起来……很奇怪。"
G["Unda my command, dis ship gonna be feared by all! Isn't dat right, Ripi?"]="在我的指挥下，这艘船将成为所有人的噩梦！对不对啊，利皮？"
G["Undead"]="亡灵"
G["Undead Gossip NPC - Periodic Talk (Expansion Prologue) 01"]="PNJ no-muerto cotilla - Charla periódica (prólogo de la expansión) 01"
G["Undead Gossip NPC - Periodic Talk (Lunar Festival) 01"]="PNJ no-muerto cotilla - Charla periódica (Festtival Lunarn) 01"
G["Undead are crawling all over the land.  Where is the Stormwind Army?"]="亡灵在这里四处横行！但暴风城的军队在哪里？"
G["Undead?  I will have my vengeance against the Lich King!"]="亡灵？我要向巫妖王复仇！"
G["Undeath is inevitable!"]="你们注定会沦为天灾军团的爪牙！"
G["Under Hellscream's watchful guise, live or die, we take Stonetalon."]="在地狱咆哮警觉的掩护下，不论生死，我们都要夺回石爪山。"
