G["Under my leadership, this flight will rise again, beyond the glory of our past - onwards to an even greater destiny."]="在我的领导下，蓝龙军团会再次崛起，超越过去的荣光——迎接更伟大的宿命。"
G["Under my roof, gentlemen, I trust you will behave."]="在我这里，各位，我相信你们不会乱来。"
G["Under the Warchief's orders, we will reveal all of the mogu's secrets."]="按照酋长的指示，我们得揭开魔古族的所有秘密。"
G["Under the cover of darkness."]="在夜色的掩护下。"
G["Underbelly Croc stares at you hungrily as he licks his chops."]="下水道巨鳄垂涎欲滴地盯着你。"
G["Undercity"]="幽暗城"
G["Undercity, five thousand twenty-two in arrears."]="幽暗城，欠五千零二十二。"
G["Underground..."]="地下……"
G["Understand this, Eranikus wants nothing more than to be brought to Azeroth from the Dream. Once he is out, he will stop at nothing to destroy my physical manifestation. This, however, is the only way in which you could recover the scepter shard."]="你要明白，伊兰尼库斯无非是想离开翡翠梦境，进入艾泽拉斯。一旦他得以脱身，他一定会疯狂地摧毁我的肉身。但是，这也是获取节杖碎片的惟一方法。"
G["Understandable."]="可以理解。"
G["Understood, Sentinel. Return to the beach and aid them in bringing back any that are still alive."]="明白了，哨兵，回到海滩上，帮助他们将还活着的人救回来。"
G["Understood, my lady."]="明白，女士大人。"
G["Understood, sir."]="明白了，大人。"
G["Understood."]="明白了。"
G["Understood. I will return shortly."]="明白。我马上就回来。"
G["Understood. I'll head there right away."]="明白。我这就去。"
G["Unexpected that you are all capable of such organization. Both the Alliance and the Horde have completed their preparations for the Ahn'Qiraj War. Even as we speak the materiel is being shipped over to Silithus and should all arrive within $2113w days. Then it is up to the one who is going to reassemble the Scepter of the Shifting Sands to beat on the gong at the Scarab Dais and open the gates of Ahn'Qiraj. That is when the war will truly begin!"]="没想到你竟如此精通协调管理。安其拉一战迫在眉睫，联盟和部落都已经做好了充分的准备工作。所有的战争物资将如约运往希利苏斯，预计将在$2113w天抵达。那是，会有一位英雄使用流沙节杖敲响甲虫之台的铜锣，打开安其拉之门。那时战争就真正打响了！"
G["Unexpected that you are all capable of such organization. Both the Alliance and the Horde have completed their preparations for the Ahn'Qiraj War. Even as we speak the materiel is being shipped over to Silithus and should all arrive within a day. Then it is up to the one who is going to reassemble the Scepter of the Shifting Sands to beat on the gong at the Scarab Dais and open the gates of Ahn'Qiraj. That is when the war will truly begin!"]="没想到你竟如此精通协调管理。安其拉一战迫在眉睫，联盟和部落都已经做好了充分的准备工作。所有的战争物资将如约运往希利苏斯，预计将在1天抵达。那是，会有一位英雄使用流沙节杖敲响甲虫之台的铜锣，打开安其拉之门。那时战争就真正打响了！"
G["Unf - Not the face!"]="呼呼，不要打脸！"
G["Unf. You learn nothing from me!"]="呼呼，你从我这里什么也得不到！"
G["Unfinished weapons begin to roll out on the assembly line."]="未完成的武器从装配流水线上传送出来了。"
G["Unfortunate, but deserved."]="真不幸，但罪有应得。"
G["Unfortunate, but necessary."]="真不幸，但这是必要的。"
G["Unfortunate."]="真是不幸。"
G["Unfortunate. The best was yet to come."]="真不幸。好戏还没开始呢。"
G["Unfortunately for you.... this fight is anything but fair!"]="不幸的是……这场战斗并不公平！"
G["Unfortunately we do not have one who teaches Tailoring here in Bloodhoof Village, but you can find a trainer in Thunder Bluff.  Follow the path north out of the village until you come to a set of elevators.  Take one up to the top of the rise and ask one of the Bluffwatchers there for directions."]="不幸的是，血蹄村中没人懂得裁缝技能，但是你可以在雷霆崖找到训练师。出了村子，沿着北面的道路走。乘坐雷霆崖升降梯到达顶部，然后问问那儿的守卫，他们会为你指明方向的。"
G["Unfortunately you are not yet strong enough to survive in Warsong Gulch, $c."]="很不幸，你还很年轻，无法在战歌峡谷中存活，$c。"
G["Unfortunately, our brother Jogu has not fared well since his family died."]="不幸的是，我们的兄弟贾古自从家人去世之后就活得很消沉。"
G["Unfortunately, our efforts to breed the serpents have been unsuccessful. We carefully take a few eggs from the wild serpents to raise as our own."]="不幸的是，我们培育翔龙的努力失败了。我们现在只能仔细挑选一些野生翔龙蛋回去自己饲养了。"
G["Unfortunately, the Zandalari trolls have already claimed and fortified it."]="不幸的是，赞达拉巨魔已占据并守卫着那里。"
G["Unfortunately, the cataclysm had knocked loose a bunch of angry elementals."]="不幸的是，这场大灾变释放出无数愤怒的元素。"
G["Unfortunately, the night elf defense was untenable and Rajaxx knew that they could not hold out much longer. Their tenacity, however, was causing great frustration to Rajaxx and causing even more frustration to his king. Wait, kings? Incredible..."]="不幸的是，暗夜精灵的防御不堪一击，拉贾克斯知道他们已经撑不了多久了。但是，他们的顽强着实让拉贾克斯遭遇很大的挫折，对他的国王而来，这更是沉重的打击。等等，国王？难以置信……"
G["Unfortunately, there is little I can teach someone with your experience, my friend. Seek out the night elf Sylvanna Forestmoon, who resides in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus."]="Desafortunadamente, puedo enseñar muy poco a alguien con tu experiencia, $gamigo:amiga;. Busca a la elfa de la noche Sylvanna Bosqueluna, vive en el Bancal del Artesano de Darnassus."
G["Unfortunately, you were too dangerous in life, and you're far too dangerous in undeath.  I will enjoy killing you, you Scourged witch..."]="不幸的是，你活着的时候就太过危险，成为亡灵后变得更加危险。受死吧，天灾女巫……"
G["Unfortunately, your hatchling does not want to wait!"]="可惜，你的雏龙不想再等下去了！"
G["Unfortunately... yes."]="很不幸……是的。"
