G["Unleash the cavalry!"]="骑兵们，冲锋！"
G["Unleash the fury and let it be done!"]="释放你的怒气吧！"
G["Unleash the war hounds!"]="放出战犬！"
G["Unless I get lucky and black out!"]="除非我走运，昏过去了！"
G["Unless I'm mistaken, the Warchief explicity forbids using the full plague, no matter the circumstance."]="如果我没有理解错误，酋长是严格禁止这种魔法被全面使用的，无论在什么样的情况下。"
G["Unless it's something I can eat, I don't want it."]="除非是吃的东西，否则我不想要。"
G["Unless you want to help me clean the nests, you had best let me get back to work."]="除非你愿意帮我清理龙穴，否则你最好让我回去工作。"
G["Unless?"]="除非？"
G["Unlike most ogres, I do know what an outhouse is for - giving you a swirlie.  Now beat it."]="和大多数的食人魔不一样的是，我知道厕所是干什么用的。"
