G["Unpleasant place, this \"Undercity\". Not at all like the Lordaeron of old. How I miss it...\n\nIf you're looking to go to Stratholme, I'm afraid I'm unable to assist at the moment. The towers nearby the burning city are still in contention, and as such my powers are far too weak to aid you. Return to me once you're victorious there."]="Un lugar horrendo, esta \"Entrañas\". Nada que ver con lo que era Lordaeron antes. Cómo extraño esa época... \n\nSi lo que quieres es ir a Stratholme, me temo que no te puedo ayudar ahora mismo. Las torres cercanas a la ciudad ardiente todavía están en disputa, por lo que mis poderes son leves como para echarte una mano. Regresa a mí una vez hayas conseguido una victoria allí."
G["Unsatisfied with the appearance of an item?\n\nBehold the Transmogrifier, one of our most potent technomantic engines. With it, a skilled Warpweaver may shift the appearance of one object to that of another.\n\nWhat might this humble one transmogrify for you, goodly customer?"]="¿No te gusta la apariencia de un objeto?\n\nHe aquí el transfigurador, uno de nuestros inventos tecnománticos más poderosos. Con él, un tejedor de distorsión con talento puede cambiar la apariencia de un objeto por la de otro.\n\n¿Hay algo que este humilde ser pueda transfigurarte, $gestimado:estimada; cliente?"
G["Unseen arakkoa... they're all around us... watching us... waiting!"]="肉眼见不见的鸦人们……他们就在我们身边……注视着我们……他们在等待！"
G["Unshakable!"]="坚定不移！"
G["Unstable solenoids are unstable! RUN!"]="不稳定的电磁线圈要爆炸了！快跑！"
G["Unstoppable!"]="无坚不摧！"
G["Unthinkable! The mortals will destroy... everything! My sister, what have you..."]="不可思议！这群凡人……竟然毁灭了一切！我的妹妹，你都做了些……什么？"
G["Until I throw a stone. Such a small thing - but soon, ripples engulf the whole of the lake!"]="直到我丢进一块石子。如此微不足道——但瞬间，涟漪就会袭遍整个水面！"
G["Until I traveled through Nagrand and came to the forest, I feared that too much of our original culture was lost. I'm thankful to see that I was wrong.\n\nThere is so much to be done here!"]="直到我游遍了纳格兰并进入这片森林之前，我都在担心我们失去了太多的文化传承。看来我多虑了。\n\n这里的风貌依然保持完好！"
G["Until Kang, the First of First Dawn, opened our eyes."]="直到曙光之拳——康，拨开了我们的双眼。"
G["Until Tally works out the kinks in this flight, the Capicitorium will need some extra fuel.  5 units ought to do it!"]="在塔雷弄好飞行操作指南前，电容器还需要更多的燃料。5组应该够了！"
G["Until next time! Try to stay alive!"]="下次再见！一定要活着啊！"
G["Until next time, Megs. Don't forget today's lesson."]="下次再见，梅格斯。别忘了今天这一课。"
G["Until next time, lads."]="下次吧，伙计们。"
G["Until next time, my friends."]="下次见，我的朋友们。"
G["Until recently this place was lost in the mists. Those few inhabitants who found themselves stranded here were forced to mint their own currency, immune to time distortion. It is the only way trade is possible."]="不久前，这里还为迷雾所笼罩。那些被迫滞留于此的居民只能自行铸造能够抵抗时间扭曲的货币。只有这样，才能进行交易。"
G["Until recently, the mogu in this region have been content to ambush travelers in the woods. This raid was different; they are organized... filled with purpose."]="不久之前，魔古族还只是在树林里伏击一下过往的行人而已。但这次袭击不同，这次行动是有组织……有目的的。"
G["Until then, I shall take my leave..."]="那么，我先走了……"
G["Until then, your presence at your post will keep them on their toes."]="在那之前，你要继续假装在监视他们，这会让他们以为自己的计谋得逞了。"
G["Until we meet again, $n."]="下次再见吧，$n。"
G["Until we meet again, Lady Proudmoore."]="再会，普罗德摩尔女士。"
G["Until we meet again, Thrall."]="再会，萨尔。"
G["Until we meet again, brave one."]="Hasta la próxima, valiente."
G["Until we meet again, hero. Duty calls!"]="再见。我得奉命离开了！"
G["Until we meet again."]="再见。"
G["Until we meet again... you know where to find me."]="再见……你知道哪里可以找到我。"
G["Until we next meet...."]="再见……"
G["Until what, Eva? I must know."]="直到什么时候，艾瓦？我必须知道这一点。"
G["Until what?"]="直到什么时候？"
G["Until you can endure the shadow fires, you remain at my mercy!"]="在你可以忍耐暗影火焰之前，只有我的怜悯能让你活下去！"
G["Until you have mastered the Apprentice level of Jewelcrafting we shall not speak again."]="不要再来找我，等你掌握了初级的珠宝加工技能再说。"
G["Untrain Pet"]="遗忘宠物天赋"
G["Untying"]="解开"
G["Unworthy!"]="无能！"
G["Unworthy."]="真可笑！"
G["Unworthy..."]="卑劣……"
G["Unwrap your Awesome Party Ensemble and wear your Cool Shades, Hip New Outfit, and Shiny Bling!"]="打开你们超酷派对套装，穿戴上你们的清爽遮阳镜、潮人装束和亮闪闪的珠宝!"
G["Up ahead is Bael'dun Keep. Isn't she a beauty? That stronghold is indestructible!"]="前方就是巴尔丹城堡了。是不是很漂亮？她绝对是坚不可摧的！"
G["Up ahead is the road to Telaar. We will split up when we reach the fork as they will surely send more Murkblood after us. Hopefully one of us makes it back to Telaar alive."]="前面就是去塔拉的路。我们在前面的岔道分开，他们肯定会派更多人来追击我们的。希望我们当中有人能活着回到塔拉。"
G["Up ahead! The refuge is under attack!"]="看那边！雷掌阁正在遭受攻击！"
G["Up and away, hon. I'll steer, you just keep an eye out."]="出发了宝贝儿。我来掌舵，你留心周围。"
G["Up here on the hill, $n."]="到山上来，$n。"
G["Up here on the second floor of the inn! Hurry!"]="到旅店二楼！快！"
G["Up here, $n. You weren't followed, were you?"]="我在这儿，$n。你没被跟踪吧？"
G["Up here, champion!"]="我在上面，勇士！"
G["Up in smoke."]="灰飞烟灭吧。"
G["Up next, it's Millie Watt! I used to date her in engineering school!"]="哦，下一位选手是米莉·沃特！上工程学院的时候我和她约过会！"
G["Up next, probably the weakest, ugliest, and least genius combatant I've ever seen. It's the stupid, smelly gnome, Millie Watt! Everybody boo!"]="下面这位，或许是我见过的最无能、最丑陋、最没天分的拳手。它就是又笨又臭的侏儒，米莉·沃特！大家来点嘘声吧！"
G["Up on the plateau, he and his demon friends are trying to reignite the Sunwell and open a rift to bring their head-honcho, Kil'Jaeden, back into the world."]="他和他的恶魔同伴们正在高地上设法重新点燃太阳井，打开一道裂缝，把他们的首领基尔加丹重新召唤回这个世界。"
G["Up the ramp, $n! Help Thrall defeat the Trade Prince!"]="坡道上面，$n！帮助萨尔击败贸易大王！"
G["Up there is where Charlga Razorflank resides. Blasted old crone."]="那上面就是卡尔加·刺肋的住处。那个该死的又干又瘪的老太婆。"
G["Up there, above us!"]="在那上面！"
G["Up to the eastern pass! Move!"]="支援东边的通道！快！"
G["Up you go!"]="上天啰！"
G["Up!"]="上！"
G["Up, Up & Away!"]="爬升，爬升，火箭分离！"
G["Upgrade to champion units!"]="升级到勇士！"
G["Upgrade to seasoned units!"]="升级到经验丰富的士兵！"
G["Upgrade to veteran units!"]="升级到老兵！"
G["Uphold the law!"]="维护法律的尊严！"
G["Upon dying, the Hidden Fog's Burst of Light reveals all Pale Fogs in the area."]="在死亡时，隐藏雾行兽的强光迸发会照出该区域所有的苍白雾行兽。"
G["Upon killing an enemy, you shall gain the usage of my Bladeturning ability. Let your foes try to strike you, and you shall strike them, instead."]="在杀死一个敌人的时候，你将可以使用我的利刃回旋技能。你可以任凭敌人攻击你，这些攻击都将转嫁到他们自己身上。"
G["Upon reaching its destination the hound becomes startled by noise up ahead and appears ready to flee."]="冲到目的地后，猎犬却变得躁动不安，似乎想要逃窜。看来是被那股气味给唬到了。"
G["Upon seeing its companion perish, %s becomes enraged!"]="看到同伴的死亡，%s被激怒了！"
G["Upside-down boats!  They'll never capsize!"]="上下双面艇！永不倾覆！"
G["Upstart pup! Think you can best me?"]="不知天高地厚的小崽子！你以为你能打败我吗？"
G["Ur-Bataar, help!"]="厄尔巴塔尔，快来帮忙！"
G["Ur-bataar will kill you!"]="厄尔巴塔尔会杀死你的！"
G["Urg... no!!"]="啊…不！！"
G["Urgent business! Yes, but what? And how did I end up here...?"]="急事！当然，但是那又如何？还有，我怎么在这里……？"
G["Urgh! I can't smell any trolls nearby..."]="呃！这附近好像没有巨魔，我闻不出他们的气味……"
G["Urgh. Gus, I ain't drinking that, I can smell it from here. Just lemme sleep the food poisoning off, okay?"]="呃，格斯，我可不喝，我从这儿都能闻到味道了。让我把食物中毒的效果给睡过去，行吗？"
G["Urgreth begins to emanate a powerful dark energy!"]="乌格雷斯开始施放强大的黑暗力量！"
G["Urk... no..."]="呃……不……"
G["Urp...eats too many carrots..."]="呃……胡萝卜吃多了……"
G["Urrrk... if that grubbing galley chief over there offers you his special, do yourself a favor and dump it in the ocean. It might kill a few makruras instead of your will to live."]="嗯……如果那个讨厌的船长向你推销他的特价品，你就直接把那些烂货扔进海里去。说不定有些龙虾人会因此丧命，不过好在你能捡回一条命呀。"
G["Ursoc, brother of Ursol and guardian of the furbolg tribes... show yourself!"]="乌索克，乌索尔的兄弟，熊怪部族的守护者……现身吧！"
G["Urtharges calls on the aid of an elemental!"]="乌萨吉召唤一个元素前来助战！"
G["Urtharges' death severely wounds the remaining elementals!"]="乌萨吉之死重创了剩余的元素生物！"
G["Urtrak kill you!"]="乌尔特拉克要杀了你！"
G["Us Darkspear not the type to wear chains well, mon. Ya be learnin' this the hard way... soon."]="我们暗矛巨魔不能被链子拴起来。你马上就会明白这一点了……"
G["Us dead? I dunno... Just a guess."]="我们会死吗？我不知道……猜测而已。"
G["Us have skinning hook.  We get it from Killian Hagey who teach us how to skin kills.  You have nice skin.  You find him on inner ring of Rogues' Quarter."]="Nosotros tener gancho desollador Nos dio Killian Hagey que nos enseña desollar. Tú ser bastante $gdiestro:diestra;. Lo encontrarás en anillo interior de Barrio de los Pícaros."
G["Us hear and obey."]="我们听从命令。"
G["Us know her good.  She Mary Edras at inner ring of Rogues' Quarter."]="我们很了解玛丽·艾塔斯。她就在盗贼区的内环。"
G["Us know where they are!  Skull building in Magic Quarter on outer ring of city."]="我们知道他们在哪儿！他们就在城市外环魔法区的骷髅建筑物中。"
G["Us meeting in this Vale is more than just random chance."]="我们能在这个四风谷遇见还真巧。"
G["Us meeting on these shores is more than just random chance."]="我们能在这个海岸上遇见还真巧。"
G["Us need check to see if our Brain... Brain... Brain Hacker sold at auction.  You find mailbox next to inn on upper ring of Trade Quarter."]="我们得确认一下是否碎……碎……碎灵斧是不是卖掉了。去贸易区上层的旅馆旁找邮箱吧。"
G["Us no like paladins. Elf lady come to city, stay in Royal Quarter. Her paladin. You talk, learn paladin things."]="我们不喜欢圣骑士。女精灵来到城市，在皇家区。她是圣骑士，和她说话，学习圣骑士的东西。"
G["Us see balloon north of ruins up above.  It take you to far off places."]="我们可以看见从废墟北部升起的飞艇。它会将你带到遥远的地方。"
G["Us starting ta like little $n!  Yous bashem da demons real good!"]="我们有点开始喜欢小$n了！你好厉害！连恶魔也能打赢！"
G["Us sure see yous here all da time!\n\nChu'a'lor say little $r our $g hero : heroine;!\n\n$n like one of us ogres now.  Only, Gahk confused because $n need to be bigger for dat!"]="¡Nosotros ahora verte por aquí todo el tiempo! \n\n¡Chu'a'lor decir que $gpequeño:pequeña:r; $r ser $gnuestro héroe:nuestra heroína;!\n\n$n ser de los nuestros ahora. ¡Pero Gahk estar confundido porque $n necesitar ser más grande para eso!"
G["Us think you need help."]="我们认为你需要帮助。"
G["Us want felhound for pet.  We feed it and treat it good and teach it play fetch.  You find Warlocks in Magic Quarter on outer ring of city."]="我们想让地狱犬成为宠物。我们喂养它、善待它并教它学会去拣我丢出去的木棒。去城市外环的法师区找术士吧。"
G["Us want lots of pets.  Anya Maulray help you take care of them.  You find her at inn, upper ring of Trade Quarter."]="我们想要很多宠物。安雅·玛尔雷能帮你照顾它们。去贸易区上层的旅馆找她吧。"
G["Us! Grimleer!"]="是我们！恐目！"
G["Use 'dis to heal yourself!"]="用这个治疗你！"
G["Use 8 necrotic runes and disrupt his ritual."]="使用8枚死灵符文，扰乱他的法阵。"
G["Use Belrysa's Talisman to escape before the Dark Scout shoots you!\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_jewelry_talisman_10.blp:64|t"]="在黑暗斥候击中你之前，使用贝瑞莎的护身符！\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_jewelry_talisman_10.blp:64|t"
G["Use Displacement Pad."]="使用位移石板。"
G["Use Eoin's mug to replenish your health!"]="使用伊欧因的酒杯回复你的生命值！"
G["Use Force Shield to block Guided Missiles."]="使用力场护盾挡住飞弹。"
G["Use Leeching Poison to damage enemies and keep me healed.  Touch the Nightmare is very powerful, but it hurts me, so only use it when I have a lot of health!"]="使用吸血之毒对敌人造成伤害，同时保持对我的治疗。噩梦之触非常强大，但会对我造成伤害，所以只能在我的生命值较高的情况下使用！"
G["Use Pumpkin Bombs to defeat large clusters of zombies or weaken difficult ones."]="用南瓜炸弹击败大批僵尸或弱化更强大敌人的战斗力。"
G["Use Rocknuts to protect your Spitters and Sunflowers."]="用岩石坚果保护喷酸草和向日葵。"
G["Use Searing Wrath to damage enemies and Evasive Maneuvers if I start taking damage.  Remember I need to build up Evasive Charges by taking damage to perform Evasive Maneuvers!"]="使用灼热之怒对敌人造成伤害；如果我开始承受伤害，就使用闪避机动。记住，我必须以承受伤害的方式积攒闪避能量，才能使用闪避机动！"
G["Use Shield-Breaker on a Charge Target.\n|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_ShieldBreak.blp:32|t\nFollow up with Charge while the target is vulnerable.\n|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Mount_Charger.blp:32|t"]="对冲锋目标使用碎盾。\n|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_ShieldBreak.blp:32|t\n趁目标处于脆弱状态时立即冲锋。\n|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Mount_Charger.blp:32|t"
G["Use Shield-Breaker on a Ranged Target.\n|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_ShieldBreak.blp:32|t\nThen use Shield-Breaker while the target is defenseless.\n|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_ShieldBreak.blp:32|t"]="对远程目标使用碎盾。\n|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_ShieldBreak.blp:32|t\n趁目标毫无防御力时再次碎盾。\n|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_ShieldBreak.blp:32|t"
G["Use Shock Lance to damage enemies.  If we get in trouble, Stop Time to freeze all enemies in place, then hit them with Shock Lance for massive damage!"]="使用震击之枪对敌人造成伤害。如果我们遇到麻烦，就使用停止时间将敌人冻结，然后使用震击之枪对他们造成大量伤害！"
G["Use caution when firing those shells..."]="发射那些炮弹要小心…"
G["Use caution, there are many traps still active within. Perhaps one of your demon spells will grant you the ability to scout ahead before advancing forward."]="当心点，这里仍藏有很多陷阱。也许你的某个恶魔法术能够使你拥有探测前路的能力。"
G["Use engineering to access hidden schematics!"]="使用工程学技能获得秘密结构图！"
G["Use focus and relaxation to maintain your balance."]="集中精神、放松心情，保持你的身心平衡。"
G["Use it or lose it, $gmister:sister;!"]="¡Úsalo o déjalo, colega!"
G["Use movement to your advantage. Do not allow the dragon child to get close."]="利用你的移动优势。别让巨龙之子靠近。"
G["Use my shinies... make weather good again... make undead things go away."]="把我的宝藏拿去吧……这样天气就会好转……亡灵也会离开。"
G["Use of the Inventor's Disk detected. Emergency protocol gamma activated."]="检测到创世者的圆盘的用途。激活紧急协议。"
G["Use staff, tell Raze what do! Show Raze poacher! Raze smash!"]="使用手杖，告诉拆毁者怎么做！指出偷猎者！出击！"
G["Use the Accursed Ore to direct artillery fire!"]="用被诅咒的矿石来引导炮火的攻击！"
G["Use the Bash'ir crystalforge to make another purchase."]="利用巴什伊尔水晶熔炉制造另一瓶合剂。"
G["Use the Battle Rations at any construction site to boost its rate of progress! \n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_MISC_FOOD_WHEAT_02.blp:64|t"]="在任何防御工事使用作战给养来提升建造进度！\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_MISC_FOOD_WHEAT_02.blp:64|t"
G["Use the Boomer Brew to zap saurok minions!"]="用闪电陈酿来攻击蜥蜴人爪牙！"
G["Use the Brittle Roots at select construction sites to boost their rate of progress! \n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_WEAPON_SHORTBLADE_09.blp:64|t"]="在特定的建筑营地使用脆弱的根茎来加快他们的进度！\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_WEAPON_SHORTBLADE_09.blp:64|t"
G["Use the Cloud Tiles to dispel Mantle of the Thunder King!"]="快使用云雾地砖驱散雷电之王的斗篷！"
G["Use the Emerald of Aessina to cleanse yourself of Pyrachnis' poison!"]="快用艾森娜的翡翠净化你身上的派拉齐尼斯毒素！"
G["Use the Flame Jet attack to engulf enemies in flames!"]="用烈焰喷射来让敌人葬身火海！"
G["Use the Guardian's Light to stop the Dark Summoner's minions!"]="使用守护之光阻止黑暗召唤师的爪牙！"
G["Use the Heroic Will ability to avoid Hour of Twilight and Fading Light!"]="快使用英勇意志技能来躲避暮光审判和黯淡之光！"
G["Use the Jungle Hops on the Blast-brew Cauldron at the pandaren construction site for a progress boost! \n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_MISC_HERB_08.blp:64|t"]="在熊猫人建筑营地的爆烈酒大锅处使用丛林啤酒花来加快他们的进度！\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_MISC_HERB_08.blp:64|t"
G["Use the Keys to the Hot Rod |TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_key_12.blp:32|t to get into your car. Pick up your friends, Izzy, Ace, and Gobber."]="使用改装跑车的钥匙|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_key_12.blp:32|t进入你的跑车，并搭载你的朋友小静、王牌和大胖。"
G["Use the Kor'kron Disguise, then search for intel in the middle of Garrosh'ar Advance."]="使用库卡隆伪装，然后在加尔鲁什尔先锋营中寻找情报。"
G["Use the Krasari Iron at the dwarven or gnome construction sites to boost their rate of progress! \n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_ORE_PLATINUM_01.blp:64|t"]="在矮人或侏儒建造营地使用卡桑利生铁来加快他们的进度！\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_ORE_PLATINUM_01.blp:64|t"
G["Use the Laborer's Tool at any construction site for a progress boost! \n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_HAMMER_17.blp:64|t"]="在任何防御工事使用劳工的工具来提升建造进度！\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_HAMMER_17.blp:64|t"
G["Use the Leave Vehicle button to quickly get back onto the Speedbarge."]="通过按下“离车”按钮来快速返回赛艇平台。"
G["Use the Liquid Fire on the Blast-brew Cauldron at the pandaren construction site for a progress boost! \n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_WARLOCK_BURNINGEMBERS.blp:64|t"]="在熊猫人建筑营地的爆烈酒大锅处使用燃烧剂来加快他们的进度！\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_WARLOCK_BURNINGEMBERS.blp:64|t"
G["Use the Meaty Haunch at any construction site to boost its rate of progress! \n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_MISC_FOOD_50.blp:64|t"]="在任何一个建筑营地使用肥厚腰肉来加快他们的进度！\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_MISC_FOOD_50.blp:64|t"
G["Use the Mech Control Scrambler to disable Twizzleflux's vehicle!"]="使用机械控制干扰器让焊钩的机械机甲无法运作！"
G["Use the Mechashark's REPAIR!"]="快用机械鲨鱼的修复功能！"
G["Use the Misplaced Keg at the pandaren construction site to permanently boost its rate of progress! \n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_CASK_04.blp:64|t"]="在熊猫人建筑营地使用失踪的酒桶来永久提高他们的进度！\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_CASK_04.blp:64|t"
G["Use the Moonwell at the base of the tree for rapid health recovery out of combat."]="利用这棵树下的月亮井在离开战斗的情况下迅速恢复生命值。"
G["Use the Snake Oil at the night elf or gnome construction sites to boost their rate of progress! \n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_VEHICLE_OILJETS.blp:64|t"]="在暗夜精灵或侏儒建筑营地使用蛇油来加快他们的进度！\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_VEHICLE_OILJETS.blp:64|t"
G["Use the Sun's Radiance ability if you get overwhelmed!  It will heal your units and deal terrible damage to the opponent.\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_holy_divineprovidence.blp:64|t"]="如果招架不住，记得使用烈日照佑技能！这个技能将治疗你方单位，并给敌人造成巨大伤害。\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_holy_divineprovidence.blp:64|t"
G["Use the Unexploded Cannonball at the dwarven construction site to permanently boost its rate of progress! \n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_VEHICLE_SIEGEENGINECANNON.blp:64|t"]="在矮人建筑营地使用哑火炮弹来永久提高他们的进度！\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_VEHICLE_SIEGEENGINECANNON.blp:64|t"
G["Use the [Rapier Parry] ability to avoid Vertical Slash!"]="使用[细剑招架]技能来避免竖劈！"
G["Use the battlefield to regenerate yourself."]="利用战场对自己进行恢复。"
G["Use the blood of the world to regenerate yourself. You can do this."]="使用世界之血治疗你自己。你能做到。"
G["Use the boat's abilities to defeat packs of saurok as you make your way through the cave."]="在你穿过洞穴的时候，使用船只的技能来抵挡蜥蜴人的进攻。"
G["Use the cannons to launch yourself onto him!"]="用火炮把自己发射出去！"
G["Use the cannons! Shoot down the mantid!"]="开炮！击落那些螳螂妖！"
G["Use the color cones to reveal and slay the three hidden fog beasts."]="使用彩色锥形光束照出并杀死三只隐身的雾行兽。"
G["Use the cones of light to find and defeat the hidden Crimson Fogs!"]="利用锥形光束发现并击败隐藏的猩红雾行兽！"
G["Use the cones of light to find and defeat the one fog beast of each color!"]="利用锥形光束发现并击败每种颜色的雾行兽各一只！"
G["Use the crystal's power to defend me and the tablets. If Twilight's Hammer's minions break through my shield, they'll kill me and take the tablets!"]="利用水晶的力量保卫我和石板。如果暮光之锤的爪牙们打破了我的护盾，他们一定会杀死我，夺走石板！"
G["Use the crystal's powers to defeat the elementals! I won't last long..."]="使用水晶的力量击败元素！我坚持不了多久……"
G["Use the fel crystalforge to make another purchase."]="利用邪能水晶熔炉制造另一瓶合剂。"
G["Use the freezing breath, imbecile!"]="使用冰冻喷吐，你这蠢货！"
G["Use the key to open the Focusing Iris."]="用钥匙打开聚焦之虹。"
G["Use the mail service."]="使用邮件服务。"
G["Use the meteor on the ground to launch a critical attack on the %s!"]="使用流星，对%s造成致命一击！"
G["Use the orb."]="使用宝珠。"
G["Use the outhouse."]="上厕所。"
G["Use the shovel to smash in the human seedling's heads.|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_MISC_SHOVEL_01.BLP:24|t\n\nOR\n\n[Right Click] the human seedlings to free them from the dirt.|TInterface\\Cursor\\SKINALLIANCE.BLP:24|t\n\nDo the right thing."]="试着用铲子来清除食人花苗。|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_MISC_SHOVEL_01.BLP:24|t\n\n或者\n\n[右键点击]食人花苗将它们拔出来|TInterface\\Cursor\\SKINALLIANCE.BLP:24|t\n\n作出正确的选择。"
G["Use the terrain to our advantage."]="要利用有利地形。"
G["Use the waters well. They are priceless beyond compare..."]="好好利用这水。它们是无价之宝。"
G["Use this Blast Tape to seal them faulty valves up real good, chief."]="Utiliza esta cinta explosiva para sellar las válvulas defectuosas como es debido, $gjefe:jefa;."
G["Use this Staff of Command on Raze when you are near Shadowsilk Poachers and he will make them rue the day they decided to poach in these lands."]="当你靠近暗影蛛丝偷猎者的时候，对拆毁者使用命令法杖，这些盗贼会为自己的行为感到后悔的。"
G["Use what is called for in your Goblin All-In-1-Der Belt below to crack open the vault!\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_EngGizmos_20.blp:64|t |TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Bomb_07.blp:64|t |TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Ear_NightElf_02.blp:64|t |TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_EngGizmos_swissArmy.blp:64|t |TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Weapon_ShortBlade_21.blp:64|t"]="使用你的地精百宝腰带上必要的功能，打开这座保险库！功能具体如下：\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_EngGizmos_20.blp:64|t |TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Bomb_07.blp:64|t |TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Ear_NightElf_02.blp:64|t |TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_EngGizmos_swissArmy.blp:64|t |TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Weapon_ShortBlade_21.blp:64|t"
G["Use your Hot Rod |TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_key_12.blp:32|t to run over Hired Looters and get their Stolen Loot."]="使用你的改装跑车|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_key_12.blp:32|t追上受雇的抢掠者，夺取他们偷走的物品。"
G["Use your Hot Rod |TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_key_12.blp:32|t to run over Hired Looters and get their loot."]="使用你的改装跑车|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_key_12.blp:32|t追上受雇的抢掠者，夺取他们偷走的物品。"
G["Use your Infrared Heat Focals!"]="使用你的红外感温眼镜！"
G["Use your Storm Shield before the Static Charge finishes!\n|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_nature_lightningshield.blp:32|t"]="¡Utiliza tu Escudo de tormenta antes de que termine la Carga estática!\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_nature_lightningshield.blp:32|t"
G["Use your archers to support your infantry.  A few volleys of flaming arrows will take down most groups.\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_searingarrow.blp:64|t"]="用弓箭手支援步兵。几支火焰箭就能干掉大部分敌人。\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_searingarrow.blp:64|t"
G["Use your body to shield Wrathion from the incoming attacks!"]="用你的身体为拉希奥挡住攻击！"
G["Use your fear, Ishi! Turn it on your foes. When death arrives, will you stand and face it or kneel in defeat?"]="利用这恐惧，伊什！将它留给敌人。当死亡降临，你是想站着面对还是跪着失败？"
G["Use your legs, soldiers!"]="动起来，士兵们！"
G["Use your martial arts training. Focus your energy... then STRIKE!"]="让你的武术训练发挥作用。会聚能量……然后出击！"
G["Use your medic abilities to revive the crewman before it's too late!"]="快使用医疗技能救助这名船员，否则就太迟了！"
G["Use your tonk action bar above your standard action bar to attack other tonks."]="使用在标准动作条上的坦克动作条，攻击其他坦克。"
G["Use your torpedo rockets on those ships."]="用火箭鱼雷轰击那些舰船。"
G["Use your weed whacker to mow down these plants, little goblin!"]="用你的杂草清理者割倒这些植物，小地精！"
G["Use your |cFFFF2222Amazing G-Ray!|r\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_EngGizmos_20.blp:64|t"]="使用你的|cFFFF2222神奇地精射线！|r\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_EngGizmos_20.blp:64|t"
G["Use your |cFFFF2222Blastcrackers!|r\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Bomb_07.blp:64|t"]="使用你的|cFFFF2222爆裂弹!|r\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Bomb_07.blp:64|t"
G["Use your |cFFFF2222Ear-O-Scope!|r\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Ear_NightElf_02.blp:64|t"]="使用你的|cFFFF2222顺风耳！|r\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Ear_NightElf_02.blp:64|t"
G["Use your |cFFFF2222Infinifold Lockpick!|r\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_EngGizmos_swissArmy.blp:64|t"]="使用你的|cFFFF2222无限复杂开锁器！|r\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_EngGizmos_swissArmy.blp:64|t"
G["Use your |cFFFF2222Kaja'mite Drill!|r\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Weapon_ShortBlade_21.blp:64|t"]="使用你的|cFFFF2222卡亚矿钻！|r\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Weapon_ShortBlade_21.blp:64|t"
G["Used by the Barov family of the Scholomance as a mirror into the souls that they no longer possess. A valuable keepsake."]="通灵学院的巴罗夫家族将它作为照耀他们不复存在的灵魂的镜子。那是一件贵重的纪念品。"
G["Used to be hauling gear and food from Orgrimmar to Crossroads was peon-work. Nowadays my neck's always on the line."]="我曾经不断地将各种辎重和食物从奥格瑞玛拖送到十字路口，那可是件繁重的工作。现在我的脖子总会因为那时的劳累而隐隐作痛。"
G["Used to be you couldn't trust a goblin..."]="通常你不能相信地精……"
G["Useless mongrel! I'll kill 'em myself!"]="没用的家伙！看来我得亲自动手了！"
G["Useless orc! Just you wait, one day I'll drop somethin in yer grog that you'll NEVER wake up from...."]="蠢货！你给我等着，总有一天我会在你的酒里加点料，让你长眠不起……"
G["Useless pile of bones..."]="一堆没用的骨头……"
G["Useless wind rider! I don't need you anyway!"]="没用的双足飞龙！我不需要你！"
G["Useless!"]="没用的东西！"
G["Useless, all of you! Even the guards you give me in tribute can't keep these lesser beings from my palace."]="废物！你们信誓旦旦地表忠心，却连这些低等生物都赶不出我的宫殿。"
G["Useless..."]="令人惊讶……"
G["User-objective protocol complete.  Stasis protocol re-enabled."]="用户目标程序完成。停滞程序重新启动。"
G["Using"]="使用"
G["Using a crystal Brann sent with the tablets, I managed to protect myself and escape, but one of the attackers followed me!"]="利用了布莱恩连同石板一起送来的那块水晶，我保护了自己，并设法逃脱了。但一名袭击者一直对我紧追不舍！"
G["Using a mogu weapon forge whose powers you barely understand?"]="就靠一座你们根本不了解的魔古武器熔炉？"
G["Using the energy pads on the ground, ascend the Arcane Pinnacle, touching all the pedestals along the way."]="使用地面上的能量垫，上升至奥术之巅，碰触沿途的全部基座。"
G["Using the fruits of the Earth Mother to create potions to aid us in our eternal struggle is an honorable endeavor.  To learn of this you must travel north to our great home of Thunder Bluff.  When you arrive at the top seek out the assistance of one of the Bluffwatchers for more specific directions."]="用大地之母的果实配制药水来帮助我们进行持久抗争是一件光荣的行为。如果你想学习配制药水，就得去北方的雷霆崖。当你到达雷霆崖顶部时，去问问那儿的守卫，他们会给你详细的指引的。"
G["Using the hammer was fun, but I think I'm ready to go home now."]="用锤子是挺有趣，可我现在准备回家了。"
G["Using this orb will create a portal leading to Naxxanar."]="使用这颗宝珠将开启通往纳克萨纳尔的传送门。"
G["Usually it just run away in sand. Not do so good at run away this time."]="危急时候，它通常会钻进沙里逃走的。看来这次它逃得不够快啊。"
G["Usually these shores are covered in mists. It looks like they cleared out for some reason."]="常年笼罩着这片海滩的迷雾散去了，这背后一定有什么原因。"
G["Usurper?"]="篡位者？"
G["Usurpers! Gnomeregan is mine!"]="篡位者！诺莫瑞根是我的！"
G["Utgarde Keep is where you'll find Elder Jarten."]="你能在乌特加德城堡找到长者亚尔特恩。"
G["Uther Lightbringer brought only darkness to Quel'Thalas.  Let us see if we can bring some darkness to his tomb!"]="乌瑟尔给奎尔萨拉斯带来的只有黑暗。那么我们也给他的陵墓来一点黑暗吧！"
G["Uther had my troops recalled? Damn it! If my warriors abandon me, I'll never defeat Mal'Ganis. The ships must be burned before the men reach the shore!"]="乌瑟尔要召回我的军队？见鬼！如果战士们离我而去，我要怎么杀死玛尔加尼斯？必须要赶在他们回到海边之前烧毁船只！"
G["Uther shakes his head."]="乌瑟尔摇了摇头。"
G["Uther the Lightbringer."]="乌瑟尔·光明使者。"
G["Uther! Dear Uther! I... I'm so sorry."]="乌瑟尔！亲爱的乌瑟尔！我……很难过。"
G["Uther... Uther the Lightbringer. How..."]="乌瑟尔……乌瑟尔·光明使者。怎么……"
G["Uthrok make gud shot"]="阿瑟罗克展示货物"
G["Uunak-hissss tik-k-k-k-k!"]="¡Uunak-hissss tik-k-k-k-k!"
G["Uurrghh now you... you infuriate me!"]="呜啊……你们现在惹我生气了！"
G["Uuuuuuggggghhhhh...."]="啊啊啊啊……"
G["Uyen, $n's back. We got any chow for $g him : her;. Heh, get it? Chow?"]="育温，$n回来了。我们给$g他:她;准备好大餐了吧？嘿嘿，你听懂了没？周？"
G["VARIAN, NO! STOP!"]="不，瓦里安！住手！"
G["VHAAAT?! Vhat is zhe meanink of zhis?"]="什——么？！这是什么意思？"
G["VHAT!?"]="什么！？"
G["VICTORY!"]="胜利！"
G["VOL'JIN LIVES!"]="沃金还活着！"
G["Vaelastrasz, no!!!"]="瓦拉斯塔兹，不！！！"
G["Vaelastrasz, when this world belongs to the black flight, your flight shall know its end."]="瓦拉斯塔兹，当黑龙统治世界的时候，你们这些龙就准备受死吧。"
G["Vait a shekkont! Vhat's zhis!?"]="等等！这是什么！？"
G["Val'anyr was shattered during the first war between the earthen and the iron dwarves. The weapon's remnants were believed lost in the conflict."]="在土灵和铁矮人之间爆发的第一次战争中，瓦兰奈尔碎裂了。据信它的残片已在战争中遗失。"
G["Val'kyr! Take cover!"]="是瓦格里！注意掩蔽！"
G["Val'kyr, your master calls!"]="瓦格里，主人在召唤你！"
G["Val'kyr? We're ready for them."]="瓦格里？我们已经准备好和他们作战了。"
G["Valdred Moray, reporting for duty, sir!"]="瓦德雷·莫莱前来报到，长官！"
G["Valea Twinblades."]="瓦雷亚。"
G["Valhalas is no place for games and fools."]="瓦哈拉斯不是消遣玩乐的地方。"
G["Valhalas is yours to win or die in, $n. But whatever you do, stay within the bounds of the arena. To flee is to lose and be dishonored."]="瓦哈拉斯是你抉择生死之地，$n。在任何情况下，你都不能擅自退出比武场。如果你选择逃跑，就意味着你可耻地输掉了比赛。"
G["Valiant effort."]="勇敢的尝试。"
G["Valiona, Theralion, put them in their place."]="瓦里昂娜，瑟纳利昂，送他们上路。"
G["Valiona, finish them! Avenge me!"]="瓦里昂娜，消灭他们！为我报仇！"
G["Valley of the Four Winds"]="四风谷"
G["Valn can aid you.\nSeek him out on the south side of Azure Watch."]="Valn te ayudará.\n\nVe a verlo en el lado sur de la Avanzada Azur."
G["Valor Quartermaster"]="勇气军需官"
G["Valstann Staghelm served as the right hand of Fandral. A proud and noble warrior, his dedication and adoration for his father unyielding... and the Twin Emperors sensed this as weakness. A weakness that could be exploited."]="瓦斯坦恩·鹿盔是范达尔·鹿盔的得力助手。他是个骄傲而高贵的战士，他对他的父亲抱有不可动摇的奉献和崇拜精神……两位孪生帝王认为这正是他的弱点。可以利用的弱点。"
G["Valstann, eager to please his father, convinced Fandral to allow him to take a small battalion to the defense of Southwind. Surely with the tide of battle turning their way, no harm could come to his beloved child. The trap was missed. Valstann was captured by the hiding Qiraji and Southwind Village obliterated. Rajaxx himself would take the captive Valstann to the front lines of the battle where - in front of Staghelm and the night elf forces - he would brutally execute the young night elf."]="瓦斯坦恩为了取悦他的父亲，说服范达尔同意他带领一支小队前去保卫南风村。范达尔自信自己已经在这场战争中占了上风，所以坚信他的孩子不会受到伤害。不幸的是，瓦斯坦恩被埋伏在那里的其拉虫人俘虏，南风村也被攻陷了。拉贾克斯亲自将被俘虏的瓦斯坦恩带到两军阵前，他当着鹿盔和暗夜精灵军队的面残忍地处决了这个年轻的暗夜精灵。"
G["Valstann, my dear husband, you left us too soon."]="瓦斯坦恩，亲爱的丈夫，你离开得太早了。"
G["VanCleef pay big for you heads!"]="范克里夫出高价悬赏你！"
G["VanCleef sends word that the plans are underway. But he's heard rumors about someone snooping about."]="范克里夫告诉我计划正在进行中。但是他也听说有一些人正在四处打探相关的消息。"
G["Vanessa VanCleef is still out there somewhere, plotting against us. Thankfully, without this base she is largely powerless against the might of the Alliance."]="梵妮莎·范克里夫仍然在逃，谋划与我们对抗。但没有了这个基地，她已经无法对联盟造成威胁了。"
G["Vanessa begins throwing poison vials!  Climb up quickly!"]="梵妮莎开始抛掷毒药瓶了！赶快爬上去！"
G["Vanessa has detonated charges on the ship!  Get to the ropes at the side of the boat!"]="梵妮莎引爆了船上的炸药！快去抓住船侧的绳索！"
G["Vanessa injects you with the Nightmare Elixir!"]="梵妮莎向你体内注入了噩梦药剂！"
G["Vanessa is detonating more charges!  Get to the ropes at the side of the boat!"]="梵妮莎正在引爆更多的炸药！快去抓住船侧的绳索！"
G["Vanessa pulls out a final barrel of mining powder and ignites it!  RUN!"]="梵妮莎要引爆最后一桶炸药了！跑啊！"
G["Vanira told me to speak to you about borrowing a bat."]="瓦妮拉让我从你这里借一只蝙蝠。"
G["Vanndar Stormpike is the general of the Alliance military in Alterac, and directs his forces from Dun Baldar.\n\nIf he is defeated then the Alliance will surely lose the battle for Alterac."]="Vanndar Pico Tormenta es el general de la milicia de la Alianza en Alterac, y dirige a sus tropas desde Dun Baldar.\n\nSi cae, seguramente la Alianza perderá la batalla de Alterac."
G["Vanndar Stormpike is the general of the Alliance military in Alterac, and directs his forces from Dun Baldar.\n\nIf he is defeated then the Alliance will surely lose the battle for Alterac.\n\nVanndar is not currently in Alterac Valley."]="范达尔·雷矛是驻守在奥特兰克山谷的联盟将军，他指挥着来自丹巴达尔的军队。\n\n如果他被打败，联盟将在奥特兰克一役败北；但是只有在巴琳达·斯通赫尔斯阵亡后他才会出现。\n\n范达尔目前不在奥特兰克山谷。"
G["Vanndar is here.  Come on, hordelings!  Show me what you got!"]="范达尔在这儿！来吧！给我看看你有什么能耐！"
G["Var-jorgg gramalch!"]="¡Var-jorgg gramalch!"
G["Vardmadra. I'd wondered where you disappeared to. How is Iskalder?"]="瓦尔德玛达。我还以为你失踪了呢。伊斯卡德尔呢？"
G["Vardmadra?! Did the Lich King send you personally?"]="瓦尔德玛达？！巫妖王亲自派你来的？"
G["Varedis was his name.  To Illidan's surprise, not only did he succeed in the excruciating rites of passage that are part of the training; Varedis was already displaying better command over his powers than many veteran demon hunters.\n\nIllidan sensed the potential in Varedis and assigned three master demon hunters to train him further in their ways."]="他就是瓦雷迪斯。让伊利丹感到意外的是，瓦雷迪斯不仅成功征服了极其痛苦的仪式之路，还显示出了比其他身经百战的恶魔猎手更能支配自己力量的天赋。\n\n伊利丹察觉到了瓦雷迪斯的潜力，指派了三名恶魔猎手大师来进一步训练他。"
G["Vargul maybe eat you!"]="瓦古会吃掉你！"
G["Varian Wrynn didn't use the disaster to gain a military advantage."]="瓦里安·乌瑞恩却没有利用灾难赢得军事优势。"
G["Varian Wrynn... I saw him fight once at Dire Maul. He killed five feral scar yetis with his bare hands. Pretty good for a human, no?"]="瓦里安·乌瑞恩……我见过他在厄运之槌对敌作战的骁勇身姿。他赤手空拳打死了五个深痕雪人。这对人类来说真是相当难得，不是吗？"
G["Varian and I spoke at length about the price of peace before his decision here today. I am willing to allow the Horde the use of Azshara's lumber if they abandon Ashenvale for good. Knowing the way that goblins chew through resources, we will see how long that will sustain them.\n\nI support this peace, but I do not share the High King's confidence. If the Horde breaks treaty to engage us again... my people will be ready."]="在瓦里安今天做出决定之前，他和我就和平的代价讨论了很久。只要部落同意永久放弃灰谷，我就允许他们使用艾萨拉的木材。考虑到地精吞噬资源的做派，我们倒要看看艾萨拉能支撑多久。\n\n我支持和解，可我没有国王陛下那么自信。如果部落胆敢撕毁条约，再来招惹我们……我们也会做好准备的。"
G["Varian sent me to keep an eye on the temple while you finish building the defense.\nHave a little patience and don't approach the temple until Varian gives the word."]="Varian me ha enviado para vigilar el templo mientras tú te encargas de terminar la construcción de las defensas.\n\nTen paciencia y no te acerques al templo hasta que Varian dé la orden."
G["Varian sent you as well? I'm outnumbered in my own city!\n\n<Jaina's eyes flash mischievously.>\n\nLet's go about this a different way. Put yourself in my shoes. Imagine that YOU are the leader of the Kirin Tor. $p! The most influential archmage in all of Azeroth!\n\nWhat would YOU do?"]="¿Varian también te ha enviado a ti? ¡Estoy en desventaja en mi propia ciudad!\n\n<Jaina entrecierra los ojos con suspicacia.>\n\nHagamos algo distinto. Ponte en mi lugar. Imagínate que TÚ lideras el Kirin Tor. ¡$p, $gel archimago:la archimaga; más influyente de todo Azeroth!\n\n¿Qué harías en mi lugar?"
G["Varian will honor me for this victory!"]="瓦里安将为这场胜利表彰我！"
G["Varian!  No!  Varian!!"]="瓦里安！不！瓦里安！"
G["Varian, stop! I won't help you do this!"]="瓦里安，停下！我不会帮你这么做的！"
G["Varian... I have... failed... you"]="瓦里安……我……辜负……了你。"
G["Varimathras has released the Blight aberration!"]="瓦里玛萨斯召唤出了凋零畸体！"
G["Varimathras? No, he hasn't reported in for some time. No doubt he's off on an errand of importance for his queen."]="瓦里玛萨斯？不，他已经有一阵子没来报到了。他无疑是外出完成他的女王交给他的任务去了。"
G["Varo'then's magical sword falls to the ground!"]="瓦罗森的魔法长剑掉在了地上！"
G["Varo'then, see that I am not disrupted by this rabble!"]="瓦罗森，别让这群乌合之众来打搅我！"
G["Varos Cloudstrider and his ring guardians protect the second ring.  Your drakes are more than a match for the ring guardians, but Varos stands behind an impenetrable shield created from the energy of the Oculus itself.  Ten centrifuge constructs power the shield from the ring and platforms above.  Destroy them and Varos will be vulnerable."]="瓦尔洛斯·云击和魔环卫士守护着第二环。你召唤的幼龙足以对付魔环卫士，但是瓦尔洛斯利用魔环自身的能量，撑起了一面难以穿透的护盾。10个离心构造体不断地为护盾提供能量，它们就分布在我们头顶的环面和平台上。只有摧毁它们，才有可能伤害到瓦尔洛斯。"
G["Varos Cloudstrider and his ring guardians protect the second ring.  Your drakes are more than a match for the ring guardians, but Varos stands behind an impenetrable shield created from the energy of the Oculus itself.  Ten centrifuge constructs power the shield from the ring and platforms above.  Destroy them and Varos will be vulnerable.\nI can grant you the power to call upon a drake from the red flight.  Speak to Eternos or Verdisa if you prefer to draw on the power of the bronze or the green."]="Varos Zancanubes y sus guardianes del anillo protegen el segundo anillo. Tus dracos pueden apañárselas contra los guardianes del anillo, pero Varos se encuentra tras un escudo impenetrable creado con la energía del propio Oculus. Diez ensamblajes de centrifugadora dan potencia al escudo desde el anillo y las plataformas de encima. Destrúyelos y Varos será vulnerable.\n\nPuedo otorgarte el poder de invocar a un draco del Vuelo Rojo. Habla con Eternos o con Verdisa si prefieres aprovechar el poder del Vuelo Bronce o del Vuelo Verde."
G["Vary your blows. Show your opponent no pattern. Prove his instincts wrong."]="你要尽量使自己的进攻多样化，别让对手摸清你的套路，证明他的直觉是错的。"
G["Ve meet again, Doctor Jones! Zhanks to your vork in zhis region, my mission has become much easier."]="啊，琼斯博士，那位著名的考古学家！感谢你在这里所做的一切，我的任务现在轻松多了。"
G["Ve're vatchink you, $r..."]="我们正在注意你，$r……"
G["Veer left!"]="左转！"
G["Vek'lor, I feel your pain!"]="维克洛尔，我感受到了你的痛苦！"
G["Vek'nilash and Vek'lor, known as the Twin Emperors of Ahn'Qiraj, watched the war from the sanctuary of their temple. The clever brothers devised a plan to demoralize and divide Staghelm's forces."]="维克尼拉斯和维克洛尔是安其拉的两位孪生帝王，他们在神殿圣地中关注着这场战争。这对聪明的兄弟想出了一个计划，想要挫败离间鹿盔的军队。"
G["Vekjik likes finding big-tongues that wander too far to throw in the basin. He help me trap some of the dumb ones. You should watch him sometime... it pretty funny actually."]="维克伊克最喜欢找那些在盆地里迷路的大舌头怪的麻烦。他帮我用陷阱抓过好几只愚蠢的家伙。你可以去瞧瞧他是怎么做的……很有趣。"
G["Vekjik no want to be bothered."]="别打扰维克伊克。"
G["Velen urged me to take a leadership role amongst the Broken. But more importantly, he asked me to teach shamanism to all; Broken and draenei alike. I accepted.\n\nWe knew then that given the prejudices of some that this would be a difficult proposition at best. There are those that despise the Broken because we are a frightening reminder of the past. And there are others who believe the way of the shaman to be a blasphemy against the Light.\n\nIn any case, that is my tale."]="维伦力劝我接受破碎者领袖的职位。但是更重要的是，他要求我来向所有破碎者和德莱尼人传授萨满的教义。我同意了他的建议。\n\n我们知道，在别人充满偏见的目光中，这是一项困难重重的提议，有人轻视我们破碎者，因为我们让他们想起了可怕的过去。而另一些人则相信萨满之路是对圣光的亵渎。\n\n无论如何，这就是我的故事。"
G["Vell done, Doctah Jones!"]="干得好，琼斯博士！"
G["Vell in zhat case, ve must ensure zhat you and your friend are out of zhe picture."]="所以，我们必须确保你和你的朋友不会插手这件事。"
G["Velora was several years my elder."]="维罗拉比我要大上几岁。"
G["Vendor"]="商贩"
G["Vendors"]="商人"
G["Vendors from all over the land have found their way into the city. What are you looking for?"]="来自各地的商贩都进城了。你要找什么？"
G["Vengeance burns!"]="复仇之炎，燃烧吧！"
G["Vengeance is mine!"]="我要复仇！"
G["Vengeance is ours!"]="我们要复仇！"
G["Vengeance is ours!  Attack my brothers!"]="复仇属于我们！兄弟们，进攻！"
G["Vengeance shall be mine! For Quel'thalas! For the sin'dorei!"]="燃起复仇的怒火！为了奎尔萨拉斯！为了辛多雷！"
G["Vengeance shall be mine."]="我要复仇。"
G["Vengeance will be ours!"]="我们要报仇！"
G["Vengeance will not be yours, $n!"]="你休想完成复仇，$n！"
G["Vengeance!"]="复仇！"
G["Vengeance..."]="复仇……"
G["Vengeful Hui has appeared in the Mason's Quarter, north of Greenstone Village. Challenge him!"]="仇灰出现在了绿石村北面的工匠区。快去挑战他！"
G["Venoxis be a master of poisons, he be a deadly foe."]="温诺希斯擅长使毒，他是一个可怕的敌人。"
G["Venoxis, he be controllin' da serpents.  He be a wily one."]="温诺希斯控制着毒蛇，是个难缠的家伙。"
G["Venturing into forgotten vaults..."]="深入被遗忘的宝库……"
G["Verdantleaf!  This is quite fortunate."]="翠羽树叶！真是好运。"
G["Vereesa is waiting for you, champion."]="温蕾萨在等着你，勇士。"
G["Vereesa, are you hurt?"]="温蕾萨，你受伤了？"
G["Vereesa, establish a perimeter. Modera, place the sentry wards. Narasi, begin porting in tents and supplies."]="温蕾萨，去建防线。茉德拉，设下真视之眼。纳莱丝，把帐篷和补给运过来。"
G["Vereesa, gather up everything we can find before the mogu return. Leave nothing for the Horde to claim."]="温蕾萨，抢在魔古族回来之前多收集点东西。什么都别留给部落。"
G["Vereesa, please!"]="温蕾萨，拜托！"
G["Verifying encryption key ..."]="校验密钥……"
G["Verifying status of Norgannon's shell."]="检验诺甘农之壳的状态。"
G["Vermin! Leeches! Take my blood and choke on it!"]="寄生虫！吸血鬼！痛饮我的血液吧！"
G["Vermin, your dinner awaits!"]="爬虫们，你们的晚餐来了！"
G["Vernon looks around nervously, making sure to not look at the pig on the spit."]="维尔隆紧张地看着周围，努力不去看烤肉架上的那头猪。"
G["Verog the Dervish howls with rage!"]="狂热的维罗戈愤怒地吼叫着！"
G["Vertical stabilizers offline. Powering down."]="垂直尾翼离线。动力下降。"
G["Very busy... very busy!  What?"]="很忙……很忙！什么？"
G["Very clever how you got in here like that, $n.\n\nWhat? Surprised that I know your name? I'm a demon, that's what we do. I also know your true name, so you'd better buy something expensive."]="Has demostrado gran habilidad en tu modo de entrar aquí, $n.\n\n¿Qué? ¿Te sorprende que sepa tu nombre? Soy un demonio, es nuestro trabajo. También conozco tu verdadero nombre así que es mejor que me compres algo caro."
G["Very creative fighting, there."]="真是充满创意的战斗。"
G["Very few seek me out... What may I do for you?"]="很少有人能找到我……我能为你做什么吗？"
G["Very fine equipment you make, very fine indeed. Go to the Orc's home of Orgrimmar and seek out a smith named Saru Steelfury. One thing you must give the Orcs, they make beautiful instruments of death."]="你制造的装备很不错，真的。去兽人的家园奥格瑞玛找一个名叫萨鲁·钢怒的铁匠吧。你必须给那些制造美丽的死亡器具的兽人一样东西。"
G["Very good - lay down your weapons!"]="非常好——放下武器！"
G["Very good - that is enough!"]="很好——停手！"
G["Very good work! Our defenses held with minimal casualties. Please accept this reward for your outstanding effort."]="干得好！我们将伤亡降到了最低。为了表彰你的贡献，请接受这份奖励。"
G["Very good!  Once you take to the skies, the Zandalari will try to stop you."]="很好！只要你飞上天空，赞达拉一定会来阻止你。"
G["Very good! You have done it!"]="很好！你成功了！"
G["Very good, $n.  You will find Grizzle Halfmane in the Royal Quarter of the Undercity.  May you find great honor in Alterac Valley."]="很好，$n。你可以在幽暗城的皇家区找到格里兹尔。愿你在奥特兰克山谷获得更多的荣耀。"
G["Very good, $r! Remember, your ring will not reach its full charge for many hours."]="很好，$r！记住，你的解码环需要好几个小时才能彻底充能完毕。"
G["Very good.  Our supply cache grows..."]="很好。我们的物资在不断增加……"
G["Very good.  Secondly, you must know that a knight embraces no tenet more tightly than that of chivalry.  He clings to his generosity as tightly as he clings to his lance.  His valor shines as brightly as his armor.  And while his smallsword may be sharp, his manner among allies is soft and courteous.\n\nNow tell me $n, do you give your oath to hold to the teachings of chivalry and gallantry?"]="很好。第二，你必须知道，对于骑士来说，最重要的莫过于骑士精神。骑士永远要秉承慷慨仁慈的骑士情怀，就如同绝对不能放开手中的长枪。他的勇猛果敢必须比他身上的铠甲更加耀眼夺目。无论他的佩剑多么锋利刚硬，他对待朋友却必须和善谦恭。\n\n现在，告诉我，$n，你会立下誓言，坚守骑士的精神和勇气吗？"
G["Very good.  You are relieved, private.  Rest, but don't get too comfortable.  Kurzen won't leave us alone forever."]="很好，你脱险了。休息一下，但不要太放松。库尔森的人随时可能出现。"
G["Very good. Fall into formation with the rest of your squadron. There is work to be done."]="非常好，让你的小队列好阵型。还有工作要做。"
G["Very good. Is that blood? On your teeth? Excellent! Bring on two more!"]="很好。你牙上的是血吗？太好了！再送两个进来！"
G["Very good. Let's talk."]="很好。我们谈谈吧。"
G["Very good. Whatever it is you boys do... Do a lot of it."]="很好。无论你们想干什么……都努力去做。"
G["Very impressive!"]="真厉害！"
G["Very impressive, tamer."]="很了不起，驯宠师。"
G["Very interesting!"]="非常有趣！"
G["Very interesting. But if that's the case then my theory is wrong. I must reread the other sections to see what I missed."]="非常有趣。但如果确实是这样的话，那我的理论就是错误的。我要重新去读另一部分，看看我究竟错过了什么。"
G["Very interesting..."]="很有意思……"
G["Very lucky day to travel friend! East wind brings much good fortune."]="今天可是旅行的吉日啊，朋友！东风吹来了好运气。"
G["Very much, sir."]="简直是渴望，长官。"
G["Very nice, Gerard. Next you will be breeding them."]="很好，杰勒德。接下来，你要负责培养出更多这样的生物。"
G["Very nice, yes yes... a good gift for Chee Chee. Thank you!"]="非常好，是的，是的……一件送给吱吱的好礼物。谢谢你！"
G["Very recently, all four spirits left the temple and scattered to the corners of Shen-zin Su. The land suffers."]="最近，四位元素之灵都离开了五晨寺，藏身于神真子的各个角落。大地因此承受了苦难。"
G["Very sad to think what has befallen those poor undead souls.  You can find Archmage Shymm reflecting near the Pools of Vision under the Spirit Rise."]="想到这些可怜的亡灵灵魂的遭遇，我感到非常悲伤。你可以去灵魂高地之下的预见之池附近找大法师山姆。"
G["Very soon we will be able to augment your cloak with my own formidable draconic powers."]="用不了多久，我们就能用我强大的巨龙之力强化你的斗篷了。"
G["Very sweet of you - now DIE!"]="干得不错啊——受死吧！"
G["Very vell, zhen. Let me just check my notes vone lasht time..."]="很好。让我查看一下上次做的笔记……"
G["Very well fought."]="打得漂亮。"
G["Very well my beloved. Come friend, let us ride to the home of the Darkspear."]="Muy bien, mi amor. Vamos, $gamigo:amiga;, dirijámonos hasta el hogar de los Lanza Negra."
G["Very well then, have it your way. When we turn others away, you will be responsible for their suffering. Think about that."]="那么好吧，随便。如果我们不得不把其他人拒之门外，你就是导致他们痛苦的根源。自己想想吧。"
G["Very well then, outsiders. Let us see your true strength."]="很好，陌生人。让我看看你们有多大能耐。"
G["Very well then. I see that the Spear of Durotar has almost arrived."]="很好，杜隆塔尔之矛号差不多要到达了。"
G["Very well then. Let's get the courtyard door open so we can continue our mission!"]="很好，让我们打开院子的大门，这样就能继续我们的任务了！"
G["Very well then. Let's go!"]="很好，我们出发吧！"
G["Very well then...\n\nYou have been tasked by your liege to guard his fields of corn from poachers and thieves.  One night on patrol, you stumble across a haggard man in thread-bare clothing stealing corn from the field.  You quickly confront him, and he immediately begs for his life.  He claims he is stealing the corn to feed his family since the lord of the land - your liege - demands too much in taxes.  Your liege is indeed known for his harsh taxes throughout the land.\n\nMake your choice."]="Pues muy bien...\n\nTu señor te ha encargado la tarea de proteger sus campos de maíz de cazadores furtivos y ladrones. Una noche de patrulla, te encuentras con un hombre demacrado con una túnica raída que está robando en el campo. Rápidamente, le confrontas y él te suplica que le perdones la vida. Dice que está robando maíz para alimentar a su familia porque el señor de la tierra, tu señor, exige demasiados tributos. De hecho, tu señor es conocido por su dureza a la hora de imponer tributos en sus tierras.\n\nToma tu decisión."
G["Very well!"]="很好！"
G["Very well, $c. But be careful, Brutusk can be very... spirited."]="很好，$c。但一定要小心，蛮角可是相当……不好对付。"
G["Very well, $n, you have failed to act. The prophecy is not yours to learn. Do not call upon me again until you have found your backbone!"]="$n，你拒绝了我的要求。那么我也拒绝占卜卡鲁亚克氏族的命运。在你鼓起勇气接受挑战之前，别再召唤我！"
G["Very well, $n."]="很好，$n。"
G["Very well, $n. I will need your help making this beer."]="Muy bien. Voy a necesitar tu ayuda para elaborar esta cerveza."
G["Very well, $n. I will use the Nightmare object to conjure forth Eranikus."]="很好，$n。我将使用这个被梦魇笼罩的东西召唤伊兰尼库斯。"
G["Very well, $n. I'll meet you there."]="很好，$n。我会到那里等你的。"
G["Very well, $n. Return to me when your thirst and hunger are sated."]="非常好，$n。等你吃饱喝足之后再来找我吧。"
G["Very well, $p. Prove yourself to me and I will aid you in your fight."]="很好，$p。向我证明你自己，然后我才会帮你作战。"
G["Very well, Chromie."]="好吧，克罗米。"
G["Very well, I will create a field to keep your corruption quarantined."]="很好，我会制造一个空间来隔离你们的腐蚀。"
G["Very well, I will put my belly into it..."]="很好，收紧小腹，气聚丹田……"
G["Very well, I'm sure that I can find a Skyguard out there that can make use o' the cloak.\n\nThere's yer apexis crystal.  I hope it makes ya happier than that cloak did."]="很好，我相信别的天空卫士一定能用得着这件披风的。\n\n给，这是你的埃匹希斯水晶。希望它能令你满意。"
G["Very well, Proudtusk, you may begin your march. Carry on!"]="很好，萨特拉克，你可以出发了。"
G["Very well, Taoshi. If our champion here agrees, the mission may proceed."]="好吧，陶矢。如果这位勇士同意，任务就可以进行。"
G["Very well, Warchief. I have solved the plight of the Forsaken!"]="遵命，酋长。我解决了被遗忘者一直以来的困境！"
G["Very well, Warchief. The Royal Quarter is this way. Stay on guard. There is no telling what Varimathras and Putress have in store for us."]="很好，酋长。皇家区在这边。保持警惕，谁也不知道瓦里玛萨斯和普特雷斯会有什么圈套。"
G["Very well, Zaela. I trust you to do the right thing. $C, I can help your fallen warriors..."]="很好，扎伊拉。我相信你做得对。$C，我能拯救你那些被打败的战士……"
G["Very well, but if I were you, I would pay attention and not just blindly nod my head at what I heard.\n\nIt begins, as all good stories do, with betrayal. Oh, it's not that we were betrayed... not at all. The Lich King raised us death knights above all others.\n\nRather, it was we who betrayed him with the help of Highlord Darion Mograine.\n\nIn the final fight at Light's Hope Chapel in the Plaguelands, with the simpletons moments away from annihilation, Tirion Fordring helped Mograine break the Lich King's hold upon him and all of the rest of us that were present."]="好吧，但如果我是你的话，我会集中精神仔细聆听，而不是盲目地点点头表示回应。\n\n和所有精彩的故事一样，这个故事也是以背叛开场的。不过，并非是别人背叛了我们……事情并非如此。在巫妖王的众多仆从中，他最看重的就是我们——死亡骑士。\n\n但是，在大领主达里安·莫格莱尼的帮助下，我们背叛了他。\n\n瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的那场决战中，就在我们几乎全军覆没的紧要关头，提里奥·弗丁帮助莫格莱尼以及幸存的死亡骑士摆脱了巫妖王的束缚。"
G["Very well, but make certain she knows that the blackwhelps are to be captured first."]="很好，不过要让她明白，首先要抓的是黑龙幼崽。"
G["Very well, but try not to lose this one, okay?"]="好吧，别再弄丢了。"
G["Very well, dwarf. Have it your way. I shall kill you and take the tablets."]="很好，矮人。尽管挣扎吧。我先把你干掉，然后再拿走这些石板。"
G["Very well, dwarf. I shall slay you and carry the tablets to Cho'Gall."]="很好，矮人。我要干掉你，然后将这些石板交给古加尔。"
G["Very well, general.  Should you change your mind, my people will be more than willing to provide military assistance."]="好吧，将军。如果你改变主意的话，我们会很乐意提供军事援助的。"
G["Very well, here is another. Please be more careful with this one."]="好吧，再给你一枚。千万别再弄丢了。"
G["Very well, here is your replacement."]="好吧，再给你一个吧。"
G["Very well, if you won't talk, you won't need your head anymore."]="很好，你要是不说，那留着你的脑袋也没用了。"
G["Very well, intruder. You have earned my undivided attention..."]="非常好，入侵者。你吸引到了我的注意……"
G["Very well, kitten. I see no need to delay your inevitable demise. I look forward to dealing with you just as soon as I finish off this fool!"]="很好，小东西。看来我也不必对你手下留情了。等我解决掉这个蠢货，再来对付你！"
G["Very well, let me see what you've got."]="非常好，让我看看你有什么。"
G["Very well, let us continue."]="很好，我们继续前进吧。"
G["Very well, let your journey of tailoring begin."]="很好，开始学习裁缝吧。"
G["Very well, let's go!"]="很好，出发！"
G["Very well, little $c.\n\nWhile there is much left for you to do to mend our relations with Thorim, I am compelled to share with you this one secret.\n\nSpeak to me again when you are ready to be shown that which you seek."]="Muy bien, $gpequeño:pequeña; $c.\n\nAunque aún te queda mucho por pulir en nuestra relación con Thorim, me veo obligado a compartir contigo este secreto.\n\nVuelve a hablar conmigo cuando estés $glisto:lista; para conocer lo que buscas."
G["Very well, shaman. I shall slay you and carry the tablets to Cho'Gall."]="很好，萨满。我会干掉你，然后带着这些石板去见古加尔。"
G["Very well, then. May the ghosts of our brothers guard this place for all eternity."]="那好吧。愿兄弟们的鬼魂永远庇佑此地。"
G["Very well, we shall break it for you."]="很好，我们可以帮你摧毁它。"
G["Very well."]="非常好。"
G["Very well.  Before we head down there, take a moment to prepare yourself."]="非常好。在我们出发之前，休整一下。"
G["Very well.  Carry on Mr. Ely."]="很好。伊莱，继续。"
G["Very well.  Follow me."]="很好，跟着我。"
G["Very well.  I look forward to it."]="非常好。我翘首期待着。"
G["Very well.  I'll take part in this competition."]="很好。我愿意参加这个比赛。"
G["Very well.  Let's see what you have to show me, $n."]="好吧。让我们看看你说的是什么，$n。"
G["Very well.  Onward to fame and glory!"]="很好。为了名誉和荣耀，冲啊！"
G["Very well.  Stand back... this may get messy."]="很好。退后……别弄得你满身都是。"
G["Very well.  When that decision is made, I will be ready.  Let us hope it won't be too late."]="很好。当最终的决定作出时，我会准备好的。希望那不会太晚。"
G["Very well. As the oldest and fattest among us, I will wait here for each of you to return."]="很好。作为我们之中最胖最年长的人，我会在这里等待大家安全归来。"
G["Very well. Beware the crane's song... or you may find yourself too distracted to fight."]="很好。你们要小心仙鹤的鸣叫声……它会让你们无法专心战斗。"
G["Very well. Cut another lump of flesh from one of these specimens. Let us test what you've learned so far, and we can progress from there."]="很好。从这些标本上再切下一块肉来。让我们看看你学到了什么，我们可以由此开始。"
G["Very well. Finish these lesser beings and let us be about our business."]="很好。杀死这些低级生物吧，我们好谈正事。"
G["Very well. How about you, Olon?"]="好吧。那你呢，吴龙？"
G["Very well. I am sorry, champion - But I will not be the one learning a lesson today."]="好吧。抱歉了，勇士——但今天被教训的人肯定不会是我。"
G["Very well. I saw nothing. But in the future, you are NOT to exploit our relationship with the Kirin Tor."]="好吧。我什么也没看见。可下次，你休想再利用我们与肯瑞托的关系。"
G["Very well. I will allow it. Fight with honor!"]="好吧，我同意了。为荣誉而战吧！"
G["Very well. I will dispatch these creatures. It is only an inconvenience. Prepare to die!"]="好吧。我会解决掉这些生物。不过是小小的麻烦罢了。准备受死吧！"
G["Very well. I will face you myself. This is for the Alliance!"]="很好。我将亲自对付你。为了联盟！"
G["Very well. I will return then."]="很好，那么我回去了。"
G["Very well. I will return to the Black Temple and notify Lord Illidan of your unwillingness to carry out his wishes. I suggest you make arrangements with your subordinates and let them know that you will be leaving this world soon."]="好吧。我会返回黑暗神殿，告诉伊利丹大人你不想让他如愿。我建议你准备后事吧，告诉你的手下，你即将离开这个世界了。"
G["Very well. I wish to talk about something else."]="很好，我希望谈点别的。"
G["Very well. If you help us fend off the Zandalari, we will help you find the Prophet."]="非常好。如果你能帮我们击退赞达拉，我们就告诉你该怎样找到先知。"
G["Very well. It is done."]="好吧。遗忘完毕。"
G["Very well. It saddens me that it has come to this. I look upon all of you as if you were my children. I will slay you if I must!"]="非常好。事情变成这样真令我难过。我把你们都当作自己的孩子。如果有必要的话，我会杀了你的！"
G["Very well. Later, however, I wish to see proof of your claims."]="好吧。咱们待会儿再谈，不过我很想看看你所宣称的证据。"
G["Very well. Let us fight."]="好极了。我们开战吧。"
G["Very well. Let us proceed."]="很好。让我们继续。"
G["Very well. Malfurion shall press into the Firelands, and we will deal with him there. His judgment can wait for a few more brief days.\n\n<Leyara's eyes light up.>\n\nThe tauren arch druid, however, will not be so lucky."]="很好，就让他去火焰之地吧。我们会在那儿解决他。在接受审判之前，他可以再多活两天。\n\n<莱雅娜的眼睛亮了起来。>\n\n可那个牛头人大德鲁伊，就没那么走运了。"
G["Very well. Tarren Mill lies just west of here. Since time is of the essence..."]="很好。塔伦米尔就在西面。既然时间紧迫……"
G["Very well. Tell me!"]="很好。快说！"
G["Very well. The test is over."]="很好。试炼结束。"
G["Very well. The words you seek have a name, $n. They are known as the Cipher of Damnation: The words uttered by Gul'dan himself to shatter this land. The very spell that severed the last remaining tie the orcs had with the elements of Draenor.\n\n<Oronok nods.>\n\nAye, it is the cipher that you must reconstruct and ultimately the words of the cipher that you must call."]="Muy bien. Las palabras que buscas tienen un nombre, $n. Son la Clave de Condenación. Son las palabras pronunciadas por Gul'dan para destruir este mundo. El mismo hechizo que cortó el último vínculo que unía a los orcos con los elementos de Draenor.\n\n<Oronok asiente con la cabeza.>\n\nSí, esa clave es lo que debes reconstruir y son sus palabras las que debes pronunciar."
G["Very well. Today... is your day..."]="好吧。今天……是你表现的日子……"
G["Very well. Warriors of the frozen wastes, rise up! I command you to fight, kill and die for your master! Let none survive!"]="很好，冰荒废土的战士们，起来吧！我命令你们为主人而战斗，杀戮，直到死亡！一个活口都不要留！"
G["Very well. We are nearly finished, $p."]="非常好。我们就快要结束了，$p。"
G["Very well. We will stand down."]="很好。我们可以撤退。"
G["Very well. We'll return later after the crystal is fully charged."]="很好。等水晶完全充能完毕，我们再回来。"
G["Very well. With your permission, Princess."]="非常好。只要您同意，公主。"
G["Very well. Witness the raw power of my new Lord!"]="很好。见证新主人赋予我的纯粹力量吧！"
G["Very well. Ya earned me trust. I will put me faith in tha Alliance to do tha right ting."]="很好。你值得信赖，相信联盟也会做出正确的选择。"
G["Very well. You are invested once more with her keen eyesight."]="好吧。我允许你再次借用巨鹰之眼那敏锐的视力。"
G["Very well. You have until season's end. No longer."]="很好。你们的时间就到这一季结束前为止。不能再久了。"
G["Very well. You'll have your gold."]="很好。你会拿到钱的。"
G["Very well..."]="非常好……"
G["Very well... Metal Brewmaster."]="非常好……金铁酒仙。"
G["Vesperon, the clutch is in danger! Assist me!"]="维斯匹隆，情况危急！快来帮助我！"
G["Vesprystus' hippogryphs will bear you swiftly to your destination."]="维斯派塔斯的角鹰兽可以将你快速送往目的地。"
G["Vesprystus' hippogryphs will bear you swiftly to your destination.  Seek him out in Rut'theran Village, through the portal which lies in the western section of Darnassus."]="维斯派塔斯的角鹰兽会送你到达目的地的。穿过达纳苏斯西部入口，去鲁瑟兰村找他吧。"
G["Veteran units are entering the battle!"]="作战经验丰富的老兵参战了！"
G["Vexallus discharges pure energy!"]="维萨鲁斯放射出纯净的能量！"
G["Vexallus overloads!"]="维萨鲁斯过载了！"
G["Vhat a pleasure, $c.\n\nVe get so few visitors zhese days."]="真是荣幸，$c。\n\n这些日子里，来我们这里的人实在是太少了。"
G["Vhat a surprise!\n\nVe veren't expecting anyvone today..."]="真是令人惊讶！\n\n没想到今天会有人来……"
G["Vhat could haf possibly gone vrong? I followed every lasht detail..."]="到底发生了什么错误！我严格依照每一个细节……"
G["Viable subject compiled.  No anomalies detected."]="可用目标编译。无异常。"
G["Vials, get your vials here!"]="瓶子，来买瓶子！"
G["Vic...tor...ious! Dun nun nun dun da da!"]="胜……利……啦！啾啾啾！"
G["Victory at last!"]="终于胜利了！"
G["Victory for Deathwing. For the glory of N'Zoth!"]="死亡之翼必胜。为了恩佐斯的荣耀！"
G["Victory for Sylvanas! These lands will be ours."]="希尔瓦娜斯的胜利！这些土地将是我们的。"
G["Victory for the Alliance!"]="胜利属于联盟！"
G["Victory for the Alliance! Before we clear out of here, my people will grab as much of this crazy goblin technology as we can get our hands on."]="胜利属于联盟！在我们撤出这里之前，我的人要尽可能多搞一些疯狂的地精科技。"
G["Victory for the Alliance! Glory to Stormwind!"]="胜利属于联盟！荣誉献给暴风城！"
G["Victory for the Dragonmaw!"]="龙喉必胜！"
G["Victory for the Horde!"]="部落获胜！"
