G["Victory in Tol Barad is ours! While the Horde offensive is crippled, we need your immediate efforts to gather resources and secure the island!"]="托尔巴拉德的胜利是我们的囊中之物！部落的防御已经崩溃，我们需要你立即去收集资源并参与保卫这座岛屿！"
G["Victory is a stone's throw away!  Lok-Tar Ogar!"]="离胜利只有一步之遥了！Lok-Tar Ogar！"
G["Victory is mine!"]="胜利是属于我的！"
G["Victory is ours today!"]="胜利今天是属于我们的！"
G["Victory is ours!  Get in the cannon and press the attack!"]="我们胜利了！快到火炮那里去，加强攻势！"
G["Victory is ours, children!"]="胜利是我们的，孩子们！"
G["Victory may be mine this day."]="今天，胜利属于我。"
G["Victory often requires sacrifice."]="胜利总是需要牺牲的。"
G["Victory or Death!"]="非胜即死！"
G["Victory or Death, $n!"]="非胜即死，$n！"
G["Victory or death!"]="不成功，则成仁！"
G["Victory or death! For the Horde!"]="非胜即死！为了部落！"
G["Victory or death, $c!"]="非胜即死，$c！"
G["Victory shall be mine!"]="胜利属于我！"
G["Victory to Lord Illidan!"]="伊利丹大人必胜！"
G["Victory to the Aldor! The Dragonmaw have been defeated!"]="奥尔多获胜了！龙喉氏族被打败了！"
