G["Victory to the Scryers! The Dragonmaw have been defeated!"]="占星者胜利了！龙喉氏族被打败了！"
G["Victory to the Sin'dorei! And another triumph for the Horde."]="胜利属于辛多雷！部落又胜利了。"
G["Victory will be ours!"]="胜利将会是我们的！"
G["Victory!"]="胜利！"
G["Victory! For Agamaggan!"]="胜利！为阿迦玛甘而战！"
