G["Vile free? Vile love $n!"]="维尔自由了？维尔爱$n！"
G["Vile goblins... anything for a gold coin."]="卑鄙的地精……什么东西都要一金币。"
G["Village... gone.  Family gone.  Naga take... everything."]="村庄……消失。家庭消失。纳迦……带走……一切。"
G["Vincent!  You and your pathetic ilk will find no more success in routing my sons and I than those beggardly remnants of the Kirin Tor."]="文森特！你和你可怜的家族跟肯瑞托那些贫穷的幸存者一样，是不可能打败我和我儿子的。"
G["Vindicator, please loan me your elekk to ride to Forest Song."]="守备官，请将你的雷象借给我，让我骑着它去林歌神殿。"
G["Vinny, I just gotta get me a genuine Cataclysm souvenir!"]="薇尼，我刚刚弄到了一个真正的大灾变纪念品！"
G["Violence may appear to do good for a time, but the evil it does will remain forever."]="暴力虽能逞一时之快，但所造恶业永难消除。"
G["Violence!  Property damage!  None shall pass!!"]="攻击！财产损害！没人能通过！！"
G["Violence. See? They are filled with it."]="暴力。看见没有？充满了他们的身体。"
