G["Visiting members of the Alliance keep primarily to the Silver Enclave in southwestern Dalaran.\n\nThere is an inn there, as well as portals to the various battlegrounds and Stormwind."]="联盟旅客主要集中在达拉然西南部的银色领地。\n\n那里设有旅店，还有通往各大战场和暴风城的传送门。"
