G["Vol'jin - you're alive! It is true then - an open rebellion against the Warchief."]="沃金——你还活着！看来是真的了——一场反对酋长的起义。"
G["Vol'jin and his animals will be put down like the filth they are!"]="沃金和他手下的畜生将卑贱地死去！"
G["Vol'jin be a true leader."]="沃金才是真正的领袖。"
G["Vol'jin be waitin for ya.  You should talk wit him now, my arms are gettin' tired.\n\nDis echo isle attack betta be startin' soon."]="沃金正在等你。你现在应该和他谈一谈。我的双臂已经有些疲惫了。\n\n但进攻回音群岛的行动很快就要开始了。"
G["Vol'jin holds his hand out to you."]="沃金将他的手伸向了你。"
G["Vol'jin is backed into a corner. With our aid, he'll be the spear that breaks open Hellscream's fortress. Let our enemies weaken one another, while we wait in the wings for our chance to strike."]="沃金已经没有退路了。有了我们的帮助，他就能成为破开地狱咆哮堡垒的那把“暗矛”。就让我们的敌人去自相残杀吧，我们只需在一边等待出击的机会即可。"
G["Vol'jin is on his way!  The \"Tapping of the Keg\" will take place in just a few short minutes!"]="¡Vol'jin está de camino! ¡La \"apertura del barril\" tendrá lugar dentro de unos minutos!"
