G["Vol'jin survived, but he still remember da sting a' Hellscream's betrayal. Darkspear never die."]="沃金侥幸逃过一死，但他不会忘记地狱咆哮的背叛所带来的伤痛。暗矛不死。"
G["Vol'jin told me ta keep hittin' da drum till he gets back.  If ya be waitin' for him, he'd be back soon to take back da Isles.\n\nJust wait here and enjoy da music!"]="沃金要我在他回来之前一直敲这面鼓。如果你在等他，那么我可以告诉你，他很快就会回来夺回这些岛屿了。\n\n暂时先在这里等一等他，欣赏一下这音乐吧！"
G["Vol'jin was a friend of mine, once upon a time. It has been many years since our paths crossed."]="沃金是我的朋友，那是很久之前的事了。我们已经认识了很多年了。"
G["Vol'jin will show dose Zandalari not to mess wit' da Darkspears."]="沃金会让赞达拉部族知道一件事，那就是不要和暗矛部落作对！"
G["Vol'jin's body was found in a well a few days ago.\n\nA poison flows through his veins that is halting his regeneration. This was designed to kill a troll.\n\nIf I had to guess, I would say this wound was made by an assassin's hand. And one who is not from Pandaria."]="几天前，沃金被冲上了海滩。\n\n他的血液中有一种毒素阻碍了他的再生机能。这种毒素一定是专门用来对付巨魔的。\n\n要我说的话，这个伤口一定出自刺客之手。而且是来自潘达利亚之外的刺客。"
G["Vol'jin's one tough nut. Stabbed in the neck, still he comes back to collect what's due. I like this guy!\n\nMy people need security and profit. Under Hellscream, we got a whole lot of neither."]="沃金是个坚强的人。哪怕被割断了脖子，他还能挺着回来为自己讨还公道。我喜欢这家伙！\n\n我的人民需要安全和利润。在加尔鲁什手下，我们啥都得不到。"
G["Vol'jin, I chose Garrosh because he has the strength to lead our people in these trying times."]="沃金，我选择加尔鲁什，是因为他有能力率领人民渡过这艰难的时代。"
G["Vol'jin.  It's good to see you, brother."]="沃金。很高兴看到你，兄弟。"
G["Vol'jin. What are you doing here? Shouldn't you be on your island kissing frogs?"]="沃金。你来干什么？你不是该躲在岛上和青蛙亲嘴吗？"
