G["Wait! I am... I am not your enemy. You are powerful. More powerful than he was, even.... Perhaps you are right. Perhaps there is still hope."]="等等！我……我不是你们的敌人。你们很强。甚至，比他更强……或许你们是对的。或许还有希望。"
G["Wait! I sense life in him still, but it is very faint. I will do my best to save him."]="等等！我觉得它还活着，但生命迹象很弱。我会尽全力救治它的."
