G["Walking blindly tru dark mine wit big rock in arms. Much better dan last job."]="瞎子摸黑一样地走在黑漆漆的矿井里，手里还抱着大石头。真比上一份工作好多了。"
G["Walking down the street!  Looking at my feet!  Watching the leaves, fall off of the trees!"]="沿街！行走！绿叶纵有千片哟，也要化为泥土。"
