G["Want to hear somethin' funny? Coccyx."]="想听笑话吗？白痴。"
G["Want to learn leatherworking, eh? Simon Tanner would be able to teach you. He can be found in Old Town at the Protective Hide."]="你想要学习制皮？西蒙·坦纳尔可以教你。你可以在旧城区的“护体皮甲”店里找到他。"
G["Want to make your demons more powerful?  It'll cost you, but you've come to the right place."]="想让你的恶魔变得更强大吗？这需要花钱的，但是你来对地方啦。"
G["Want to see my luckydo? This is the shoe of the yak that carried me when I was most small. Many years this shoe has given me much fortune."]="想看我的幸运符吗？我还很小的时候就穿着这双牦牛鞋。多年来这双鞋给我带来了很多好运。"
G["Want to show your pride without flailing around on one of those beasts? Whichever city you're rooting for, I got what you need!"]="你是否已经厌倦了与野兽扭打，想要换个方式来展示自己的本事？无论你来自哪座城市，我都可以满足你的愿望！"
G["Want to trade places?"]="想交换一下地盘吗？"
G["Want to train with Borgus? Aye, I can tell ye where to find him. Head through the Square northwest of me forge, then take the western road. Ye'll find him in the second building on yer right."]="你想要接受博古斯的训练？当然，我可以告诉你在什么地方能够找到他。往西北方向穿过广场，然后再顺着西面的路走，在右手边的第二座建筑??可以找到他。"
G["Want us to help with something? What we help with? We good at helping."]="要帮忙吗？要帮忙吗？我们是很乐于助人的。"
G["Wanted DEAD for treason and other treacherous acts against the Horde!\n\nAll bounties paid by Captain Gort."]="悬赏猎杀部落叛徒！\n\n赏金由高尔特上尉提供。"
