G["War has come, Wakener."]="战争已经来临，唤醒者。"
G["War is a bloody, messy ordeal full of pain, suffering and death. But those that survive come back with a new respect for life. Not to mention a collection of stories to tell around the bar, full of bravery and courage. So tell me $g lad : lass;, are you here to make some stories? or just to hear some of mine?"]="战争是血腥混乱的行为，你只能从中感受到痛苦、折磨和死亡。但是那些从战争中存活下来的勇士对于生活会有全新的认识，另外他们也都经历过许多生死关头的抉择。$g小伙子:姑娘;，你有什么故事可以告诉大家的？或者你是来这里听我的故事的？"
G["War is a word that has not been spoken in Pandaria for a long time.\n\nNow, we must all fight... to restore peace."]="“战争”这个词已经很久没有在潘达利亚出现过了。\n\n而现在，我们必须为了恢复和平……而战斗。"
G["War is upon us, $n.  It's time for every member of the Horde to answer the call and join the fight against the cowardly Alliance."]="战争即将来临，$n。每个部落成员都要响应号召，并肩击溃懦弱的联盟。"
