G["Warchief Garrosh seeks the Black Harvest members who trespassed here recently."]="部落酋长加尔鲁什正在寻找那些最近擅闯黑暗神殿的黑暗收割议会成员。"
G["Warchief Hellscream"]="地狱咆哮酋长"
G["Warchief Hellscream will have your head if you don't pick up the pace, Forsaken!"]="被遗忘者，如果你赶不上进度，地狱咆哮酋长一定会要了你的脑袋！"
G["Warchief Mor'ghor ordered us not to do business with the Horde.\n\n<The merchant spits on the ground, infuriated, but refuses to speak any more on the subject.>"]="莫格霍尔酋长不许我们和部落做生意。\n\n<商人暴怒地朝地上吐了口口水，拒绝再对这话题有任何回应。>"
