G["Warchief Mor'ghor will make the Dragonmaw great again!\n\nWe have no need for your pathetic Horde."]="莫格霍尔酋长将率领龙喉部族再次崛起！\n\n我们用不着你们这群没用的部落。"
G["Warchief Thrall himself asked me to come out here. I was honored to obey, and it's no hardship. I couldn't have asked for a better posting than Stonard. Just about any herb I might need grows in the muck here."]="萨尔酋长派我到这儿来，我感到非常荣幸。我并不奢求能被派往比斯通纳德更好的地方，我只想找些生长在这儿的草药。"
