G["Warchief, it is clear that Northrend represents the gravest threat to our people, and that we must act against it. But this foe is unlike any other. Caution must be advised."]="酋长，诺森德已经成为我们最大的威胁了，我们必须反击。但是巫妖王的实力不容小觑，我们绝对不能掉以轻心。"
G["Warchief, so glad you could make it."]="酋长，你终于来了。"
G["Warchief, without these new Forsaken my people would die out... Our hold upon Gilneas and northern Lordaeron would crumble."]="酋长，没有新的被遗忘者，我的子民将会灭绝……我们对吉尔尼斯和北洛丹伦的统治也将瓦解。"
G["Warchief, you are a hero to my young ward. Would you mind signing an autograph for him?"]="酋长，在我的年轻卫士心中，您是一位伟大的英雄。您是否介意为他签个名？"
G["Warchief, you misunderstand. Garrosh Hellscream will have a beach head on these shores, with or without your help. What we ask -"]="酋长，你误会了。不管能否得到你的帮助，加尔鲁什·地狱咆哮都将在这片海岸上抢滩登陆。我们的要求是——"
G["Warchief... I have failed you..."]="酋长大人……我辜负了你……"
G["Warchief... Sir... I..."]="酋长……大人……我……"
G["Warden Stillwater, you are deranged and a threat to our way of life. By authority of the Dark Lady herself, I hereby impose upon you the harshest penalty allowed under Forsaken law - true death."]="看守者斯蒂沃特，你这疯子，你这威胁我们生活的毒瘤。奉黑暗女王之命，我来此对你施以被遗忘者律法所允许的最严厉惩罚——真正的死亡。"
G["Warden Thelwater, we need to push forward!"]="典狱官塞尔沃特，我们需要向前推进！"
G["Wardens, defend the east entrance!"]="卫兵，守住东面的入口！"
G["Ware da ship! A harpy! ...wait, dat be another bird."]="小心那艘船！一个鹰身人！……等等，那只不过是一只鸟。"
G["Wares for sale! Wares for sale! Come browse Antonio's wares before I must take my leave, citizens of Goldshire."]="大甩卖啦！大甩卖啦！闪金镇的居民们快来看看啊，安东尼奥马上就要走了，好机会不要错过啊。"
G["Warg looks over the water appraising what his luck might be today."]="瓦格注视着水面，不知道他今天的运气会如何。"
G["Warg, are you about ready to eat? I am gonna get it started."]="瓦格，你准备好吃饭了吗？我要开吃啦。"
G["Warlock"]="术士"
G["Warlock trainers in Magic Quarter in building on outer ring with Mages."]="术士训练者在法师区外环中的建筑物中，他们跟法师呆在一起。"
G["Warlocks, eh.  Well, you didn't hear it from me, but I've heard rumors that those types gather at a bar called the Slaughtered Lamb in the Mage Quarter."]="术士，嗯。我先前并未对你提及，但是我听说他们聚集在法师区中一间名为已宰的羔羊的酒吧中。"
G["Warlocks, you shouldn't be playing with magic you don't understand. See what happens?"]="术士们，不要随便去尝试那些你们根本不理解的法术。看到后果了吧？"
G["Warlocks... I don't care for their lot.  Like that Grimrizz who's set up shop outside the Thunderbrew Distillery. The ale will probably go flat there because of him!  Warlocks... bah!"]="术士……我可不在乎他们。就像那个在雷酒酿制厂外开设商店的吉姆瑞兹。都是他，那儿的啤酒可能都跑了气！术士……呸！"
G["Warlord Bloodhilt prepares a Bloodthirsty Strike!"]="血柄督军准备施放嗜血打击！"
G["Warlord Bloodhilt? Garrosh's pet?\n\nThere's no need for him to be here, as you can see, ah, tell him I have the situation well in hand."]="血柄督军？加尔鲁什的狗腿子？\n\n正如你看到的，这儿不需要他——啊，告诉他这里的一切状况都在我的掌握之中。"
G["Warlord Kalithresh will fall!"]="督军卡利瑟里斯必败！"
G["Warlord Kalithresh will hear of this insolence!"]="督军卡利瑟里斯会很高兴看到你们这些傲慢的家伙被干掉的！"
G["Warlord Krogg sent me here to keep this front locked down. But he hasn't sent me any soldiers yet.\n\nLook at this place! I've got ogres. I've got Twilight's Hammer. I've got... nothing."]="督军克罗格派我到这里来固守战线。但他至今都没有派任何士兵给我。\n\n看看这个地方！对面有食人魔，有暮光之锤。我们这边却……啥也没有。"
