G["Warlord Zaela orders a |cFFFF0404|hKor'kron Demolisher|h|r to assault the tower!"]="督军扎伊拉命令|cFFFF0404|h库卡隆投石车|h|r攻击塔楼！"
G["Warm it up and give 'em everything you've got."]="热热枪，然后把它们轰成渣！"
G["Warm, wholesome bread!"]="热乎乎的新鲜面包啦！"
