G["Warsong Gulch"]="战歌峡谷"
G["Warsong Gulch you say? Well then, you'll be wanting to speak with fair Lylandris over in the Hall of Arms."]="战歌峡谷？好吧，你应该去跟武器大厅的莱兰迪斯谈一谈。"
G["Warsong clan."]="战歌氏族。"
G["Was I wrong to assume your Blood Elves could handle themselves?"]="我本以为你的血精灵们能够自己搞定的，看来我想错了。"
G["Was a time when I wasn't sure, but you set my mind at ease."]="在我动摇的瞬间，你令我放宽心情。"
G["Was he hot?  I bet he was hot!"]="他是不是很烫？我敢说，他肯定很烫！"
G["Was my command to murder innocents, Krom'gar?"]="我的命令是滥杀无辜吗，克罗姆加？"
G["Was that a THREAT? I knew Hellscream in Outland. A whimpering whelp. He is no Warchief."]="这算是威胁吗？我在外域见过地狱咆哮。不过是个只会哀鸣的小崽子罢了。他算什么酋长。"
G["Was that a hozen I heared? Are we in Halfhill yet?"]="那是猢狲的声音吗？我们还没到半山村吧？"
G["Was that a wall? That sounded like a wall."]="那是不是一堵墙？听上去像。"
