G["Was that box there a second ago?"]="那盒子一秒钟以前在那儿吗？"
G["Was that potent enough?"]="这样足够吗？"
G["Was that really necessary...?"]="真有这个必要吗……？"
G["Was that the best you can do?"]="这就是你的全部实力了吗？"
G["Was that the third or fourth time you nearly got me gutted trying one of your crazy stunts?"]="那是我第三次还是第四次呕吐了？你那些疯狂的烈酒……"
G["Was that... Yoga?"]="那是……瑜伽？"
G["Was that... the sha? I wanted to rip everyone to shreds!"]="那是……煞魔吗？我刚才真想把所有人都撕成碎片！"
G["Was there truly no way to save him?\n\nI fear I shall always wonder."]="真的没有办法拯救他吗？\n\n我恐怕永远也无法对此释怀。"
G["Was this fated, Windsor? If it was death that you came for, then the prophecy has been fulfilled. May your consciousness rot in the Twisting Nether. Finish the rest of these meddlesome insects, children. Bolvar, you have been a pleasurable puppet."]="这是命运吗，温德索尔？如果你是赶来赴死的，那么预言已经实现了。愿你的思想在扭曲虚空里面腐烂。干掉其余爱管闲事的家伙，我的孩子们。伯瓦尔，你是一个令人满意的傀儡。"
G["Was this really the home of the ancient emperors of Pandaria? It is beautiful."]="这里真是潘达利亚古代皇帝的家园么？真是太美了。"
G["Was... Was it all a dream? Azuremyst, Bloodmyst, Zangarmarsh, Shadowmoon... even Zul'Aman... Jane! Jane where are you!"]="这……这是梦吗？秘蓝岛，秘血岛，赞加沼泽，影月……甚至是祖阿曼……杰恩！杰恩你在哪里！"
G["Wasn't that the night we had to pick up my thumb and carry it in your smoke pouch?"]="是啊，那天晚上我们不得不捡起我的手指，然后把它放进你的烟袋里带了回来。"
