G["Waste no time, fool! Use our power to kill those that stand in our way! Destroy Karsius before you are subdued!"]="不要浪费时间，蠢货！用我们的力量来消灭那些挡路的家伙！在你被抑制之前消灭卡修斯！"
G["Waste of energy."]="生命能量的浪费。"
