G["Watch out! The Lich King is near!"]="小心！巫妖王就在附近！"
G["Watch out, Skyguard. Here comes Torkus Jr.!"]="天空卫士，当心！托尔库斯二世来了！"
G["Watch out."]="注意。"
G["Watch over her as she has watched over us; let her look down on us with joy, through the eternal gaze of An'she and Mu'sha, until we too join her in death."]="看护她，如同她看护我们。让她怀着喜悦之心，通过永恒的安瑟和穆莎凝视看到我们，直到我们和她在死亡中相会。"
G["Watch over us, $p. We are not accustomed to fighting. We will require your protection if we are attacked."]="帮助我们，$p。我们并不擅长战斗。一旦遭遇攻击，我们需要你来保护我们。"
G["Watch that last step."]="小心脚下。"
G["Watch the might of the Horde in action as we turn this slab of land into DOMINATION POINT."]="让我们在实战中看看部落的实力吧，我们要将这里建成统御岗哨！"
G["Watch the roads. They may be foolish enough to try another assault."]="一定要注意监视这些道路。那些蠢货有可能会再次发动攻击。"
G["Watch the skies for Alliance eyes. I will see you back at Thunder Cleft. Hellscream's eyes are upon you."]="留意联盟在空中的眼线。我会在雷霆裂口等你回来。地狱咆哮之眼会注视着你。"
G["Watch these mercenaries closely, brothers!"]="密切注意这些雇佣兵，兄弟们！"
G["Watch those tentacles! Their reach is frightening."]="小心那些触须！被它们碰到是非常可怕的。"
G["Watch where you're going!"]="看你往哪儿开的？"
G["Watch where you're going! They're everywhere in that city..."]="注意你脚下的路！城里到处都是他们的人……"
G["Watch where you're going, meat vendor."]="要记住你是在什么地方，肉贩子。"
G["Watch where you're stepping, $c, because I have a polymorph spell with your name on it..."]="小心一点，$c，我有一个为你准备的变形术……"
G["Watch yer step!"]="小心脚下！"
G["Watch yerself down here, $c. These wendigos are savage fighters."]="在这下面小心点儿，$c。这些雪怪都是残暴的战士。"
G["Watch your back, $n.  If you weren't Krennan's pet you would've died a long time ago."]="小心，$n。如果你不是克雷南的宠物，那你早就应该死了。"
G["Watch your back, $r!"]="保持警惕，$r！"
G["Watch your back, courier. I needn't remind you of the value of the book, nor the fact that the Silver Covenant will stop at nothing to take it from us."]="Vigila tu espalda, $gmensajero:mensajera;. No tengo que recordarte el valor del libro, ni el hecho de que El Pacto de Plata no se detendrá ante nada para quitárnoslo."
G["Watch your back, mon!"]="小心你的背后，朋友！"
G["Watch your back, stranger."]="陌生人，小心身后。"
G["Watch your back. These Drakkari are a nasty lot."]="保持警惕。达卡莱巨魔生性卑鄙。"
G["Watch your back..."]="小心背后……"
G["Watch your backs: they have us surrounded in this hall."]="小心背后，我们被包围了。"
G["Watch your clever mouth, bitch."]="小心你的伶牙俐齿，贱人。"
G["Watch your footing ... muhahaha!"]="注意脚下……唔哈哈哈！"
G["Watch your footing! The stones are still slick from rain."]="小心脚下！由于下雨的关系，石头还是很湿滑。"
G["Watch your step aboard Elune's Blessing, $r.  Though Elune's blessed us with the discovery of our new friends, we've also had our share of hardships at sea.\n\nHowever, recovering souls lost at sea or lost in a new world is truly a blessing from Elune."]="搭乘艾露恩的祝福号时请保持警惕，$r。虽然艾露恩保佑我们找到了新的盟友，但是深不可测的海洋依然危机四伏。\n\n但是，在月神的感召下，我们承担起搜寻失落灵魂的重任。"
G["Watch your step around here, meat vendor."]="在这里做买卖可要小心一点，肉贩子。"
G["Watch your step around here, stranger."]="小心一点，陌生人。"
G["Watch your step in here, $gboy:girl;.  The master sees all..."]="小心点，$g男孩:女孩;。主人能洞察一切……"
G["Watch your step out there.  Many an adventure seeker has not returned from the marsh.  hic!"]="在那里要千万小心，许多探险者都没能活着从沼泽地回来。嗝！"
G["Watch your step!"]="小心些！"
G["Watch your step! Don't want you becoming a smudge down there. Welcome to Thunder Bluff!"]="小心！你应该不会想摔成一团肉酱吧。欢迎来到雷霆崖！"
G["Watch your step, it's a mine field out here!"]="注意脚下，这里可是雷区！"
G["Watch your step, pie vendor.  You are flirting with disaster."]="小心，馅饼小贩。不要惹祸上身。"
G["Watch your step, soldier. The Stormpike have littered the ground around their bases with landmines. Speak with our explosives expert in the watch tower to the east if you want information on how to diffuse their mine fields."]="士兵，谨慎些。雷矛在基地周围埋下了许多地雷。要是你想要进入雷区，就去跟东面了望塔里的爆破专家谈谈。"
G["Watch your step, stranger. We do not allow miscreants in our town."]="Cuida tus pasos, $gforastero:forastera;. No nos gustan $glos bellacos:las bellacas; como tú."
G["Watch your step..."]="注意你的脚步……"
G["Watch your tone with me, boy. You may be the prince, but I'm still your superior as a paladin!"]="注意你讲话的态度。没错，你贵为王子，但我仍然是你的导师。"
G["Watch your tongue, worm.  You will not refer to Soggoth the Slitherer as \"that thing\" or you'll find yourself eating your own heart for dinner."]="Cuida esa lengua, gusano. No te referirás a Soggoth el Serpenteante como \"esa cosa\", o acabarás comiéndote tu propio corazón para cenar."
G["Watch your tongues, servant of Deathwing. Do you think me a fool?!"]="小心说话，死亡之翼的奴才。你以为我是个傻瓜吗？"
G["Watch yourself, Highborne."]="小心点，上层精灵。"
G["Watch yourself, young one. You don't-"]="小心你的言行，年轻人。你不会——"
G["Watch yourselves. The seals are breaking."]="大家小心。封印正在崩溃。"
G["Watch! See the ground shatter before us! Watch as the energy flows! It will feed our armies..."]="看！大地在我们面前破碎了！看那些流动的能量！它会让我们的军队更加强大……"
G["Watch, druid. The earth still breathes. It yearns to be cleansed."]="看，德鲁伊。大地仍然在艰难地呼吸。它渴求净化。"
G["Watch, heathens, as death surrounds you!"]="看着吧，邪教徒，死亡降临了！"
G["Watched you investigating the ship and dealing with those creatures down there. Good work. You find anything?"]="我看见你在底下调查船只，对付那些生物。干得好。有什么发现吗？"
G["Watcher Analysis: Freya"]="守护者分析：弗蕾亚"
G["Watcher Analysis: Hodir"]="守护者分析：霍迪尔"
G["Watcher Analysis: Mimiron"]="守护者分析：米米尔隆"
G["Watcher Analysis: Thorim"]="守护者分析：托里姆"
G["Watcher Freya verified to no longer be present. Analysis complete."]="未发现守护者弗蕾亚。分析完毕。"
G["Watcher Hodir verified to no longer be present. Analysis complete."]="未发现守护者霍迪尔。分析完毕。"
G["Watcher Hodir's temperament and behavior highly unstable. Destruction of cache highly probable during prolonged combat."]="守护者霍迪尔的情绪和行为极度不稳定。如果战斗时间过长，极可能导致宝箱损毁。"
G["Watcher Leesa'oh, why are you out here?"]="观察者莉萨奥，你在这里干什么？"
G["Watcher Mimir verified to no longer be present. Analysis complete."]="未发现守护者米米尔。分析完毕。"
G["Watcher Mimiron's sigil is linked to a self-destruct mechanism connected to the entirety of the Corridors of Ingenuity."]="守护者米米尔隆的徽记与一套自毁系统相关联，该系统又与发明回廊的完整性相关联。"
G["Watcher Tyr verified to no longer be present. Analysis complete."]="未发现守护者提尔。分析完毕。"
G["Watcher powers augmented by presence of elder servants."]="古树仆从的存在增强了守护者的力量。"
G["Watcher, inform Althea that a dire threat is marshalling against our town.  We must prepare!"]="快派人去告诉阿尔泰娅，我们的小镇面临着巨大的危险。我们必须做好准备！"
G["Watcher, we have docked.  On your feet!"]="飞艇已经靠港。站好了！"
G["Water Strider"]="水黾"
G["Water can hold any form, take any shape... overcome any obstacle."]="流水无形，它可以化为任何形态……跨越任何障碍。"
G["Water grant me serenity..."]="水，赐予我宁静……"
G["Water is life. When the waters feel torment, then so shall we."]="水即是生命。一旦水遭遇痛苦，我们也将在劫难逃。"
G["Water my Bright Green Spinach!"]="给我的鲜绿菠菜浇水！"
G["Water my Cabbages!"]="给我的卷心菜浇水！"
G["Water my Elephant Garlic!"]="给我的象鼻蒜浇水！"
G["Water my Giant Carrots!"]="给我的大胡萝卜浇水！"
G["Water my Huge Melons!"]="给我巨大的甜瓜浇水！"
G["Water my Red-Leaf Lettuce!"]="给我的红叶莴苣浇水！"
G["Water my Sugar Beets!"]="给我的甜菜浇水！"
G["Water spider! Smush him, $p!"]="水蜘蛛！踩死它，$p！"
G["Water! Here!?"]="水！在这儿？！"
G["Water-proof soap!  For underwater use!"]="防水肥皂！可供水底使用！"
G["Water..."]="水……"
G["Water... is life. It has become a rare commodity here in Outland; a commodity that we alone shall control. We are the Highborne, and the time has come at last for us to retake our rightful place in the world!"]="水……就是生命。在外域，它已经变成了一种稀有的资源，一种我们要牢牢控制住的资源。我们是上层精灵，现在，夺回我们在这个世界上的地位的时机已经成熟了！"
G["Water?"]="水？"
G["Water?! Are you daft?! I need some ALE!"]="水？！你疯了吗？！我要的是啤酒！"
G["Watered down garbage. Doesn't even slow 'em down."]="没用的垃圾。甚至没办法让他们慢一点。"
G["Watermelon boats float really easy."]="西瓜船很容易浮起来。"
G["Waters... claim me..."]="重归于……水流。"
G["Wating for dungeon particle effects to implement completion event for Buying Time quest."]="Esperando que los efectos de las partículas de la mazmorra implementen el evento de finalización para la misión Comprando Tiempo."
G["Wave One:"]="第一波："
G["Wave Two:"]="第二波："
G["Waves of flame consume you!"]="让烈焰的热浪吞没你！"
G["Way back in the old times the mogu would put little traps like this around the world to stop people from portalling this way and that. It's powered by the people who get stuck in it and won't turn off until they are dead.\n\nIt's like mama Bramblestaff always used to say: \"Don't put your hand in a stranger's portal.\""]="Allá por los viejos tiempos, los mogu ponían trampas como estas por todo el mundo para evitar que la gente utilizara los portales para ir de un lado a otro. Se activan al contactar con alguien y no se desactivan hasta que la víctima ha muerto.\n\nComo mamá Vara Enzarzada solía decir: \"No metas la mano en el portal de un desconocido\"."
G["Wazat, I have done something foolish and have lost my key as a result of this action. Could I trouble you for a spare?"]="瓦萨特，我做了些愚蠢的事情，把钥匙给弄丢了。你能再给我一把吗？"
G["We ... crushes it! Must ... make crush. Hurry friends!"]="我们……粉碎它！必须……粉碎。快点儿朋友们！"
G["We Alliance have rallied to defeat many enemies, my son. The sha will fall to us, just like any other."]="我们联盟曾齐心协力打败过许多敌人，我的孩子。煞魔也将倒在我们面前，和其他敌人一样。"
G["We Cenarion druids are the protectors of the balance of nature.  The main point being the balance.  When called for, we shouldn't wait too long before taking decisive action.  Don't let anyone tell you otherwise, especially those of us who only want to observe!"]="我们塞纳里奥的德鲁伊们是大自然平衡的保护者，我们的职责就是保持平衡。当我们被召唤的时候，就不应该在采取决定性的行动前等待太久。不要听信别人的理论，尤其是我们当中的那些只负责观察的人！"
G["We Darkspear gonna' be ready."]="我们暗矛部族会做好准备的。"
G["We Dragonmaw have seen so much suffering... our defeat at Grim Batol... the loss of so many great warriors in Outland... and now incursions from Twilight's Hammer.\n\nI sometimes wonder if we will ever be great again. But younglings like Zaela, they give this old heap of bones some hope."]="我们龙喉氏族经历过太多的磨难……在格瑞姆巴托的失败……那么多强大的战士死在外域……现在，暮光之锤又向我们发动了进攻。\n\n有时我会怀疑，我们是否还能再次强大起来。但像扎伊拉这样的年轻人让我们这些老骨头又有了希望。"
G["We Druids of the Talon aren't cut out for front-line duty. We're aerial spies, infiltrators...\n\nBut occasionally I like to get my talons dirty."]="我们猛禽德鲁伊并不适于前线作战。我们是空中侦察兵，是渗透者……\n\n不过我偶尔也不介意让我的爪子沾上血污。"
G["We Forsaken are doomed! Take pity!"]="被遗忘者完蛋了！发发善心吧！"
G["We Mantid serve a power far greater than they or their gods."]="螳螂妖所信奉的力量，比他们和伪神更强大。"
G["We NEED dis land! Da cataclysm destroyed our home!"]="我们需要这片土地！大灾变毁了我们的家园！"
G["We Pandaren do not worship our ancestors, but we revere their memory and the wisdom that they have passed on to us."]="我们熊猫人并不崇拜祖先，不过我们尊崇他们传承下来的记忆和智慧。"
G["We Razormane ... must ... survive ..."]="我们钢鬃……必须……繁衍下去……"
G["We Sin'dorei were driven to the Horde by the bigotry and distrust of the Alliance."]="我们辛多雷是被联盟的偏见与猜忌逼入部落的。"
G["We Sin'dorei will take our future into our own hands."]="我们辛多雷要亲手掌握自己的未来。"
G["We Thunderbrews take pride knowing that we are the best brewhouse in all the realms."]="我们有世界上最棒的酿酒厂，雷霆啤酒酿造商们一直引以为傲。"
G["We Timbermaw can grant you safe passage through the hold, however, you must prove yourself worthy of our aid."]="我们能让你安全通过这儿，但是，你得证明自己值得我们给予帮助。"
G["We Wildhammer are a proud bunch. I trust that you have as much pride in the Alliance, $n?"]="我们蛮锤是一个光荣的部族。相信你在联盟中一定也有同样的光荣，$n。"
G["We a lot cleaner than da ogres in Tanaris.  All over da desert as far as da eye can see - ogre poo.  Not here, no $g sir : ma'am;!"]="我们可比塔纳利斯的食人魔干净多了。那片沙漠中到处都是食人魔。这儿可不是，$g先生:女士;！"
G["We ain't got no time ta lose."]="我们没时间可以浪费了。"
G["We all have a job to do, $c. Just, some do it better than others!"]="我们都有要完成的使命，$c。只是，有些人会比别人做得更好！"
G["We all have our demons...."]="我们内心都有一只恶魔……"
G["We all have talents, outsider. Some are just not as easy to see as others."]="我们人人都有天赋，外来者。只不过有些人表现得没那么明显。"
G["We all owe our lives to Keeshan. He's saved our hides a hundred times."]="我们的命都属于基沙恩。他已经救过我们无数次了。"
G["We all served under Leven in excursions past the wall.  We honed our blades against countless mantid and yaungol.  These mogu think us weak, but that mistake in judgment will cost them dearly."]="通过城墙，我们全都在长途跋涉中效力于莱文。我们用野牛人和螳螂妖的血来祭奠我们的刀刃！这些低估我们实力的魔古族，会由于他们的错误判断而致命。"
G["We already have all our winners for today's contest, but Jang is willing to purchase any Tastyfish that you have fished up!\nThere's always next Sunday for you to show your angling skill!"]="Ya tenemos todos los ganadores de hoy, pero Jang está dispuesto a comprar los pezricos que hayas pescado.\n\n¡Siempre te quedará el próximo domingo para demostrar tu habilidad con la caña de pescar!"
G["We already have control of Twin Spire Ruins! Get out there and defend it!"]="我们已经占领了双塔废墟！快去参与防守！"
G["We already have them on the defensive. Even as we speak, their numbers weaken."]="我们已将他们逼入防御态势了。眼下，他们的人数也在减少。"
G["We already know the mogu mastered imprisoning living energy in devices. This is not a magic we need know more about."]="我们已经知道，魔古族拥有将生命能量禁锢在仪器中的能力。我们对这种法术所知不多。"
G["We also welcome Smash Hoofstomp, the terrible tauren from Thunder Bluff!"]="我们还要欢迎来自雷霆崖的恐怖牛头人——斯马什·重蹄！"
G["We also welcome Smash Hoofstomp, the terrible tauren from Thunder Bluff! Look at those GREAT shoulderpads!"]="我们还要欢迎来自雷霆崖的恐怖牛头人——斯马什·重蹄！看看他那华丽到掉渣的肩铠！"
G["We also welcome everybody's favorite frosty feathered friend: Dippy!"]="我们还要欢迎人见人爱的白色小伙伴：帝皮！"
G["We also welcome our pain-packing crowd favorite: Dungeon Master Vishas!"]="我们还要欢迎广受痛苦爱好者追捧的：地下城主韦沙斯！"
G["We always have need of allies. I'd be a fool to turn you away, especially at a time of war."]="我们向来欢迎新盟友。我不是四处树敌的傻瓜，尤其是在战争时期。"
G["We am free! Thank you little, puny ones."]="我们自由了！谢谢你们！"
G["We answer only to the council. And we rest only when their will is done."]="我们只响应议会的召唤。完成他们的意志再进入沉睡。"
G["We appear to be dealing with something far bigger than any in the Earthen Ring had suspected."]="我们正在对付的，看来要比大地之环预料到的任何东西都要大得多。"
G["We appear to be on target."]="我们似乎被盯上了。"
G["We are Hellscream's Vanguard!"]="我们是地狱咆哮的先锋！"
G["We are Mechagnome... resistance is futile."]="我们是机械侏儒……放弃抵抗吧。"
G["We are NOT monsters! We are NOT the mindless wretches of a ghoul army!"]="我们不是怪物！我们不是可悲而无脑的食尸鬼！"
G["We are Skyguard!  This is what we are trained to do.  We do not retreat, we do not surrender.  We will see our mission through even if it means death! We will secure that information or we will die on the field of battle."]="我们是天空卫士！这就是我们受训的目的。绝不退缩，绝不投降。哪怕明知是去送死，我们也会毫不犹豫地执行使命！宁愿战死沙场，也不会透露那份情报。"
G["We are a peaceful people, but awaken the warriors within us, and we will fight."]="我们是和平的人民，可一旦我们心中那属于战士的热血被唤醒，我们也会奋起一战的。"
G["We are a people without a home to call our own now."]="我们已经是无家可归的人了。"
G["We are a point of light in a universe of shadow. A candle in a tempest."]="我们是晦暗宇宙中的一点光亮。是飘摇在暴风雨中的烛光。"
G["We are a town of brewers and farmers. We hunt on occasion when we need to.\n\nThat's where I come in. It's awfully hard to hunt without a quality bow!"]="村里人都是酿酒师和农夫。我们偶尔也会在需要时外出狩猎。\n\n这正是我想说的。如果缺少一把好弓，狩猎可真是难得要命啊！"
G["We are accustomed to wisps carrying out our labors. Please bring food to keep us sustained."]="我们已经习惯于使用小精灵来进行体力劳动了。请带一些食物来帮助我们保持动力。"
G["We are all a part of him..."]="我们都是他的一部分……"
G["We are all counting on you."]="我们全都指望你了。"
G["We are all drawn here for different reasons, $c.\n\n<Rayne smiles.>\n\nI am here to meet with Rimblat of the Earthen Ring. He has some interesting theories on cleansing these lands."]="我们都因为不同的原因来到了这里，$c。\n\n<莱因笑了笑。>\n\n我来到这里是为了帮助大地之环的雷布拉特。他有个很趣的理论，据说能净化这片土地。"
G["We are all here. This is a historic moment, $n. My dying wife envisioned a city of light beyond these gates� What do you think we will find?"]="Ya estamos todos. es un momento histórico, $n. Mi mujer vio una ciudad de luz detrás de estas puertas antes de morir. ¿Qué crees que encontraremos?"
G["We are all in this together, $c."]="我们需要和衷共济，$c。"
G["We are all pieces of a much larger puzzle, $n. Just as you guide the piece of a puzzle to its destination, so too are we guided by another.\n\nAnd perhaps they who guide us are themselves guided by an even greater force."]="Todos somos piezas de un puzle mucho mayor, $n. Al igual que tú guías la pieza de un puzle hacia su destino, también nosotros somos guiados por alguien.\n\nY, quizás, aquellos que nos guían a nosotros también son guiados por una fuerza superior."
G["We are all responsible for maintaining our home. Even the High Elder must occasionally lend a hand."]="我们都有义务和责任来维护好我们共同的家。就算是长老，偶尔也要搭把手。"
G["We are all sons and daughters of the storm!"]="我们都是暴风雨的儿女！"
G["We are approaching the cavern, Captain."]="正在接近洞穴，船长。"
G["We are as new to this vale as you. We came when the gates opened, having lost our homes in Kun-Lai. There is much to build, much to mend."]="我们跟你们一样对这个山谷一无所知。当闸门一打开，我们就来了。失去了我们在昆莱的家园。想必在这里我们可重建它。"
G["We are as unwavering as the amber that shapes our halls. With Her might we will vanquish all who dare intrude upon Her divine home."]="我们如缔造殿堂的琥珀坚不可摧。凭借女皇之力，我们将消灭任何胆敢闯入她神圣家园的入侵者。"
G["We are being consumed by the Light!"]="圣光正在吞噬我们！"
G["We are beset upon again!  Defend yourself!"]="又来了！小心！"
G["We are besieged by elementals and giants! Your help is needed in the northwest, Earthguard!"]="我们被元素和巨人包围了！西北面需要你的援助，大地守护者！"
G["We are besieged!"]="我们被包围了！"
G["We are besieged! Strike out and bring back their corpses!"]="我们被攻击了！立刻出击，把敌人的尸体给我带回来！"
G["We are betrayed!"]="我们被出卖了！"
G["We are betrayed! You may have won here, but the ritual will succeed!"]="我们被背叛了！你也许赢了这一次，但我们的仪式终将完成！"
G["We are born from the flesh of Kros. We were fashioned from his meat, his bones. He is our creator.\n\nKroshik is the blood of Kros. He watches over us. He is our connection to Kros. He has the strength of Kros, yet he walks on our world.\n\nWhen the time comes, Kroshik will die, and we will take his strength. Then, the cycle will start again."]="我们从克洛斯的血肉中诞生。我们由他的骨肉塑造而成。他是我们的造物主。\n\n考什克是克洛斯的血脉。他关注着我们。他是我们与克洛斯之间的纽带。他拥有克洛斯的力量，却行于我们的世界。\n\n当时机来临，考什克将会死去，而我们将获得他的力量。然后，轮回将重新开始。"
G["We are born into a perilous age, where the forces of darkness are determined to bring about our destruction."]="我们出生在一个危险的时代，黑暗的力量誓要让我们走向毁灭。"
G["We are bound by will to serve the Banshee Queen."]="我们甘愿效忠女妖之王。"
G["We are bound here... eternally. It is the will of Gorefiend."]="我们……被永久地束缚在了这里。这是血魔的意志。"
G["We are bound to her, sisters..."]="我们束缚于她，姐妹们……"
G["We are brothers.  And we will stand united against those who oppose our peace."]="我们是兄弟。我们要团结起来，抵抗那些反对和平的家伙。"
G["We are building a permanent outpost here in the Firelands, $n. Even if Ragnaros is defeated, another may someday take his place. We cannot allow what happened in the Burning Steppes and Mount Hyjal to threaten our world again.\n\nTo that end, we will grow the \"Sentinel Tree.\" A tree with roots in Azeroth, but a protective canopy growing here in this terrible realm. Under its shelter, we will permanently station a group of druids to maintain an eternal vigil over this desolate world."]="Estamos construyendo una avanzada permanente aquí, en las Tierras de Fuego, $n. Aunque derrotásemos a Ragnaros, otro podría ocupar su lugar. No podemos permitir que lo que ocurrió en Las Estepas Ardientes y en el Monte Hyjal vuelva a amenazar nuestro mundo.\n\nCon ese fin, plantaremos un \"Árbol Centinela\". Un árbol con raíces en Azeroth, pero con un dosel protector que crecerá en este terrible reino. Bajo su cobijo, apostaremos de manera permanente un grupo de druidas para mantener una vigilia eterna sobre este mundo desolado."
G["We are but darkness and shadows. Eternal. Invisible."]="我们代表的是黑暗。永恒而无形的黑暗。"
G["We are but dirt beneath your feet, sir."]="我们不过是您脚下的尘土。"
G["We are but extensions of Doom Lord Kazzak's will!  Be strong!  Be vigilant!  Let nothing stand in the way of the Burning Legion!"]="我们只效忠于末日领主卡扎克！坚强些！提高警惕！任何东西都休想阻挡燃烧军团前进的步伐！"
G["We are but one tiny village... What could we possibly do to defeat the Thunder King's forces?"]="我们只是个不起眼的小村庄……我们该怎么做才能打败雷电之王的军队？"
G["We are damned.  If I were you, I'd leave before it was too late.  You'll be lucky if you make it back alive."]="我们完蛋了。我是你的话，就趁现在赶紧离开这里。如果你还能活着回去，那就是走运了。"
G["We are discussing where we shall go next. Perhaps join the Pearlfin in Jade Forest?\nSpeaking of which - how does the $ngill Tribe sound to you?"]="Estamos decidiendo adónde vamos a ir ahora. Quizás deberíamos unirnos a los Aleta de Nácar en el Bosque de Jade.\n\nA propósito... ¿qué tal suena \"Tribu Branquias de $n\"?"
G["We are doing everything we can."]="我们在竭尽所能。"
G["We are dominating the Scourge - the effects of the altered plague will affect them for at least another full day!  We need to stay on top of it though, so be sure to sabotage a cauldron when you can."]="我们正控制着亡灵天灾——至少还会侵扰它们一整天时间！但是我们得对此有足够的把握，因此你要尽可能地破坏锅炉。"
G["We are done here, but the weapon is not yet tempered."]="这里的任务完成了，可武器还没有淬火。"
G["We are done talking."]="我们没什么可以聊的了。"
G["We are doomed!"]="我们死定了！"
G["We are everywhere underneath you."]="我们遍布在你下方。"
G["We are far from finished."]="离结束还早着呢。"
G["We are fast digger! Really fast! See... all done! That was fast, huh?"]="我们挖地的速度可快啦！真的哦！你瞧……完成啦！是不是很快呀？"
G["We are focus testing new encounters! I can open doors, build bridges, and slay lions to facilitate the testing."]="我们正着力于测试新副本！我可以为您提供传送门，建立联接，杀死怪物以帮助您进行测试。"
G["We are free of the Headless Horseman's terror, for now.  We may breathe easy again, but until he can be defeated while joined with his head, he may return."]="现在，无头骑士对我们的威胁已经解除了。我们又可以呼吸到自由的空气了，但如果不能在有头的情况下击败它，它随时还会回来的。"
G["We are friends now, $n. You are welcome to our village any time you wish to return."]="我们现在是朋友了，$n。我们村随时欢迎你回来。"
G["We are friends of the world that you call Azeroth. I am happy to provide any assistance that I can."]="这个被你称为艾泽拉斯的世界是我们的朋友。很高兴能尽我所能为你提供帮助。"
G["We are from the Alliance, and mean you no harm. Tell me, what was that shadow you drew out of me?"]="我们来自联盟，没有恶意。告诉我，你刚才从我体内逐出的黑影是什么？"
G["We are going to crush you next time! Our tank should be able to remember to generate enough threat on you!"]="我们下次一定会粉碎你！我们的坦克会记得拉好你的仇恨的！"
G["We are going to pass through a fierce battle. You must engage the hozen while I run through. If all goes well, I will meet you at my village."]="我们要打一场硬仗了。在我逃跑的时候，你得缠住那些猢狲。假如一切顺利，我们在村子里碰头。"
G["We are going to the Temple of Earth, yes?"]="我们是要前往大地神殿，对吧？"
G["We are graced to hear from our revered Grand Anchorite Almonen. Take a knee men."]="我们很荣幸能聆听到尊敬的资深学者奥蒙纳的教诲。请坐下。"
G["We are guests here, Garrosh, and you will conduct yourself honorably."]="我们是客人，加尔鲁什，你要注意你的言行。"
G["We are halfway there!"]="我们已经成功一半了！"
G["We are happy to provide you with supplies."]="我们很高兴为你提供补给。"
G["We are hard at work, training with your soldiers."]="我们正在努力工作，和你的士兵一起受训。"
G["We are having difficulty determining the status of the plague within the area; check back shortly and we may have a better idea."]="我们在确定这片区域的状况时遇到了困难；快去核对一下，或许我们能得出一个较好的结论。"
G["We are here on a peaceful rescue mission - will you help us?"]="我们是来执行和平救援任务——你会帮我们吗？"
G["We are here on a rescue mission."]="我们是来执行救援任务的。"
G["We are here to celebrate your victory and to welcome our newfound allies!"]="我们在这里庆祝你的胜利，并欢迎我们新的同盟！"
G["We are here to fight the Thunder King. Justice demands it, and Hellscream is too preoccupied at Domination Point to pay attention here."]="我们来此对抗雷神。这是出于正义，而且地狱咆哮被统御岗哨所牵绊，无暇顾及这里。"
G["We are here to help."]="我们是来帮忙的。"
G["We are here to pay respect to the great forest, and take part in the wonder of the Earth Mother's gifts."]="我们来此表达对伟大森林的敬意，亲眼见证大地之母馈赠的奇迹。"
G["We are here to preserve these lands for our people."]="我们来此为我们的人民守护这些土地。"
G["We are here to support our hero!"]="我们是来为英雄喝彩的！"
G["We are honored by your presence, friend.  How can we serve you today?"]="你来到这里真是我们的荣幸，朋友。我们能帮你什么忙吗？"
G["We are honored by your presence, little $g brother : sister; $n."]="Tu presencia nos honra $ghermanito:hermanita;, $n."
G["We are honored by your presence, son of Durotan. The Greatmother awaits you at the hospice."]="我们对你的光临感到很荣幸，杜隆坦之子。祖母在她的病房等着你。"
G["We are honored by your sacrifice."]="你甘愿奉献生命，我们以你为荣。"
G["We are honored that you have chosen to be tainted."]="真是荣幸，你竟然选择被感染。"
G["We are humbled by your selflessness, $n.  If in the past we've seemed a bit conceited, realize that it is by your example that we were able to change our attitudes.\n\nWe thank you, and hope that you'll continue to assist us in our struggle against the forge camps."]="Tu altruismo nos hace sentirnos humildes, $n. Si en el pasado parecimos un poco vanidosos, ten en cuenta que hemos cambiado de actitud siguiendo tu ejemplo.\n\nTe lo agradecemos y esperamos que sigas ayudándonos en nuestra lucha contra los campamentos Forja."
G["We are hunters, too. We are fighters. We can fight for the sea and the land."]="我们同样拥有猎手的敏捷和战士的勇气。我们愿意为了保卫家园而战。"
G["We are in Ogri'la."]="我们就在奥格瑞拉。"
G["We are in heaven."]="我们就在天堂。"
G["We are in the heart of the mogu war machine."]="我们进入了魔古战争机器的核心。"
G["We are infinite... eternal."]="我们是无穷的……永恒的。"
G["We are investigating the cultists activities as we speak."]="我们当下正在对邪教徒的活动进行调查。"
G["We are investigating the sewer system - perhaps there is another way in to the citadel."]="我们正在调查下水道系统——或许还有其他进入城堡的方法。"
G["We are joining an assault on Lorthuna's Gate. You are needed."]="我们正在赶往洛苏娜之门的突袭前线。正好需要你的帮助。"
G["We are just barely holding our ground. We need every able-bodied soldier to report for duty."]="我们只不过是勉强站稳脚跟而已。所以我们需要每一个健全的士兵全部到岗。"
G["We are just beginning our pandaren campaign, $n."]="我们的熊猫人战役才刚刚开始，$n。"
G["We are just getting started, friend! Our greatest challenges lie ahead."]="我们才刚刚开始，朋友！最大的挑战还在前头。"
G["We are keepers of the secrets of Uldum.  Beneath the sand... under the pyramids... there exists great power.\n\nThe power to make and break an entire world.\n\nHe cannot access this power without us, however."]="我们是了奥丹姆秘密的守护者。在无尽的沙海中……在巍峨的金字塔下……那里埋藏着无比强大的力量。\n\n那是足以形成和破坏整个世界的力量。\n\n但如果没有我们，他就无法使用这种力量。"
G["We are known for trade, not war. Would you like to see what I have for sale?"]="我们是生意人，不是战士。要不要看看我的商品？"
G["We are launching an assault on Bash'ir Landing, to study their Crystalforge.  Help us if you can!  Our Skyguard Aether-tech will leave in about $4581d."]="我们正准备对巴什伊尔码头发动一次进攻，来研究他们的水晶熔炉。请你尽力帮助我们！天空卫队以太技师会在$4581d后出发。"
G["We are legion. We are everywhere. See you back at Jinyu Mere, $p."]="我们浩浩荡荡。我们所向披靡。我们墨鳃潭见，$p。"
G["We are looking for a brewer named Mudmug. Do you know of him?"]="我们正在找一个名叫泥盏的酿酒师。你认识他吗？"
G["We are looking into the missing person reports you filed."]="我们正在调查你所提交的失踪人口报告。"
G["We are looking into these cultists groups."]="我们正在调查这些邪教徒组织。"
G["We are lost! Fall back!"]="守不住了！撤退！"
G["We are lucky to have survived this ordeal. If it wasn't for you, everyone on this island could have been killed!"]="我们能够在这样的考验中生存下来，真是太幸运了。如果不是你，在岛上的每个人可能早已经被杀死了。"
G["We are masters of the Stair now!"]="我们是阶梯的主人了！"
G["We are masters of the water, which is why we have been able to defend this village for so long. But on land, especially with thick tree cover, the hozen are vastly superior."]="我们是水上的霸主，这也是我们为什么能坚守村子如此之久的原因。但是在陆地上，特别是丛林茂密的地方，猢狲拥有压倒性的优势。"
G["We are more than capable of handling this without assistance. Withdraw. When you return, you will find the Empress slain and your problems solved."]="我们绝对能独自应对。撤退吧。等你们回来时就会发现女皇被杀死了，你们的麻烦也已得到解决。"
G["We are most pleased with your actions against the night elves. When you uncovered their plot to use the ley-line nexi and their so-called moon crystals to spy upon us, you strengthened our position here by an order of magnitude.\n\nYou have our gratitude, $n."]="Nos complacen mucho tus actividades contra los elfos de la noche. Cuando descubriste su plan de emplear los nexos de líneas Ley y sus cristales lunares para espiarnos, reforzaste en gran medida nuestra posición actual.\n\nTe lo agradecemos, $n."
G["We are nearly prepared to start this battle, brothers.  Thorg'izog, what is the matter?  Why are you covering your butt like that?"]="我们就快准备好开战了，兄弟们。索基佐格，有什么事吗？你为什么那样遮住自己的屁股？"
G["We are not afraid to fight. Our warriors, while few in number, are extremely skilled."]="我们不怕战斗。我们的战士尽管人数稀少，却个个身手不凡。"
G["We are not finished!"]="我们还没有完！"
G["We are not in the habit of welcoming outsiders into our village."]="我们可没有欢迎外乡人来我们村的习俗。"
G["We are not interested in your war, outsider. This is a peaceful village."]="我们对你们的战争不感兴趣，外乡人。这是个平静的村庄。"
G["We are not out of the woods yet."]="我们还没有摆脱困境呢。"
G["We are not some mind controlled savages you are dealing with. To defy Hellscream is to defy the greatest orcs of the Horde!"]="我们不是什么被洗脑的野蛮人。违抗地狱咆哮就是和部落最伟大兽人作对！"
G["We are not unfriendly, stranger. Just wary."]="我们不是不友善，陌生人。我们只是很谨慎。"
G["We are not warriors. I produce only tools and light weaponry for hunting."]="我们不是战士。我只负责制作工具和狩猎用的轻型武器。"
G["We are nothing. Tulall par'okoth. Far'al, ka'kar. The void devours."]="我们什么都不是。Tulall par'okoth。Far'al, ka'kar。虚空吞噬一切。"
G["We are on a quest to find the Pools of Youth!\n\nThe fabled waters were a boon of a mysterious lost civilization that predated Queen Azshara.\n\nWith these waters, we will be able to restore the glory of immortality to the kal'dorei."]="我们正奉命寻找青春之池！\n\n这些传说中的不老之水源自一个神奇、失落的文明，它的历史甚至比艾萨拉女王还要久远。\n\n有了这些不老之水，我们就能重现卡多雷的不朽荣耀。"
G["We are on a strict timetable. You will not interfere!"]="我们的时间非常紧迫。你们休想添乱！"
G["We are on our way to the Wanderer's Festival. You should join us!"]="我们正要去参加云游节。你一定得跟我们一起去！"
G["We are on the brink of all out war with the Alliance!"]="我们正处在与联盟爆发全面战争的边缘！"
G["We are one in the Light, $g brother : sister;, but I cannot train you."]="$g兄弟:姐妹;，我们都受圣光庇护，但是我不能训练你。"
G["We are one step closer. The unknowable, transcendent power of the Emerald Dream I now give unto the Dragon Soul."]="我们又近了一步。我会将神秘莫测的翡翠梦境之力注入到巨龙之魂中。"
G["We are only doing what's necessary to keep the city safe."]="我们只是在采取必要措施确保城市的安全。"
G["We are outnumbered here, our ties to Crossroads and Durotar severed. But one orc is worth 10 Alliance cowards.\n\nWe will bottle them up in this pass and gut them like swine."]="敌人的数量远远超过我们，我们与十字路口和杜隆塔尔的联系已经被切断。但一个兽人能打败十个联盟懦夫。\n\n我们要对他们迎头痛击，把他们像赶猪群一样轰走。"
G["We are patient."]="我们要有耐心。"
G["We are poorly equipped to do battle here.\n\nPreparations must be made..."]="我们的战备不足以在此交战。\n\n必须做好准备才行……"
G["We are prepared, Highlord. Let us battle for the fate of Azeroth! For the light of dawn!"]="我们准备好了，大领主。让我们为艾泽拉斯的命运而战！为冲破黑暗的光明而战！"
G["We are preparing. I just need time to ensure the safety of my people. But Vol'jin..."]="我们正在准备。但我需要时间来确保族人的安全。可是，沃金……"
G["We are proud to call ourselves the last tribe of Forest Trolls to serve the Horde.\n\nIn time, we will overcome the other tribes, and the dwarves, and the Hinterlands will be ours."]="我们自豪地宣称，我们是效忠于部落的森林巨魔最后的部族。\n\n总有一天，我们将战胜其它部族，还有那些矮人，辛特兰将属于我们。"
G["We are quickly learning the price of death in this frigid wasteland, $n. The Lich King's power extends across every inch of Northrend, permeating into the earth itself! He turns our own fallen people against us.\n\nFrom the sky, risen gryphon riders rain down their vengeful stormhammers as the walking dead assail us on the ground."]="En este baldío helado, estamos aprendiendo rápidamente el significado de la muerte, $n. El poder del Rey Exánime se extiende por cada centímetro de Rasganorte, penetrando en la propia tierra. Él vuelve a nuestros caídos contra nosotros.\n\nDesde el cielo, jinetes de grifos resucitados nos atacan con sus vengativos martillos de tormenta mientras los muertos andantes nos atacan en tierra."
G["We are quite safe from your pitiful band!"]="在你们的保护下，我觉得很安全！"
G["We are ready for whatever Archimonde might send our way, Lady Proudmoore."]="我们已经准备好对付阿克蒙德的任何爪牙了，普罗德摩尔女士。"
G["We are ready to get you out of here, Thrall. Let's go!"]="我们准备好带你离开这里了，萨尔。出发吧！"
G["We are ready to go, High Overlord. The Lich King must fall!"]="我们准备好了，大王。巫妖王必须死！"
G["We are ready to help!"]="我们这就来帮忙！"
G["We are ready to launch the raid at a moment's notice. All we need is the key. Have you found one?"]="我们随时都能发动突击，只是需要一把钥匙。你找到钥匙了吗？"
G["We are ready to proceed.  Magni, you have called this meeting.  What concerns you?"]="我们准备好了。麦格尼，是你召集了此次会议。是什么困扰着你？"
G["We are ready!"]="我们准备好了！"
G["We are ready, Cenarius."]="我们准备好了，塞纳留斯。"
G["We are ready, Keeper."]="我们准备好了，守护者。"
G["We are safe... for now. His strength has increased tenfold since our last battle. It will take a mighty army to destroy the Lich King. An army greater than even the Horde can rouse."]="我们暂时……安全了。他的力量已经十倍于往昔。只有一支大军才能战胜巫妖王。单凭部落的力量毫无胜算。"
G["We are saved! The peasants have escaped the Scourge!"]="我们得救了！农夫们逃脱了亡灵天灾的魔爪！"
G["We are sending crusaders to reclaim what is rightfully ours! Any Scourge that stand in our way will be turned to ashes."]="我们已经派出十字军部队，他们会夺回本属于我们的领地！天灾军团如果胆敢阻挠，定要将他们挫骨扬灰。"
G["We are sieging Niuzao Temple.\n\nYou are known to us, $n. Your help is necessary once more."]="我们正在围攻砮皂寺。\n\n我们知道你是谁，$n。我们需要你再帮一把。"
G["We are still beset by threats here. I cannot leave the camp unguarded."]="我们四周仍然危机重重。我不能毫无戒备地离开这座营地。"
G["We are stronger now! You will die!"]="我们现在更强大了！你死定了！"
G["We are strongest when we listen to the wisdom of our elders, to when we share our burdens with one another, and when we remember that Elune’s light is reflected in each other."]="Somos más fuertes cuando escuchamos la sabiduría de nuestros mayores, cuando compartimos las cargas unos con otros y cuando recordamos que la luz de Elune se refleja en cada uno de nosotros."
G["We are supposed to play here, but I bet we could wander around and not get in too much trouble."]="我们本来是只能在这里玩的。可我想我们稍微走远一些也不会有什么大问题。"
G["We are surrounded!"]="我们被包围了！"
G["We are surrounded... Our enemies press in from all sides, young Hellscream."]="我们被包围了……加尔鲁什，敌人正从四面八方涌来。"
G["We are the Alliance. We are always ready."]="我们联盟时刻准备着。"
G["We are the HORDE. We are slaves to nothing and no one!"]="我们是强大的部落！我们绝不接受奴役！"
G["We are the Horde. We are always ready."]="我们部落时刻准备着。"
G["We are the Horde. We do NOT back down."]="我们是部落。我们绝不后退。"
G["We are the Orcish Horde, the True Horde.  We die, bloody and thrashing on the field of battle, like true orcs SHOULD."]="我们是兽人的部落，是正统部落。我们会像真正的兽人那样，战死沙场，流血牺牲。"
G["We are the Royal Apothecary Society!  Inducing belly aches is not part of our job description!"]="我们是皇家药剂师协会的成员！药剂引起胃痛不在我们的工作范围之内！"
G["We are the Sin'dorai! We should not have to bow to anyone. Not the Kirin Tor, not the Alliance, and certainly not the Horde."]="我们是辛多雷！我们不应向任何人低头，无论是肯瑞托，还是联盟，更不用说部落了。"
G["We are the arm of His will.  And we will crush His foes into grave dust!"]="我们是他的意志的实施者，我们会把他的敌人送入坟墓！"
G["We are the backbone of the Ashenvale offensive. Failure is NOT an option!"]="我们是灰谷防御力量的中坚。我们绝不能失败！"
G["We are the chill in a coward's spine..."]="我们令懦夫寒彻脊骨……"
G["We are the chosen ones, $n. Death knights of the Scourge, sent to sow the seeds of the master's destruction."]="我们是被巫妖王选中的死亡骑士，$n。身为天灾军团的一员，我们要坚定执行巫妖王的意志。"
G["We are the extension of our Empress's will."]="我们是女皇意志的延伸。"
G["We are the greatest!"]="我们至高无上！"
G["We are the grummles. We know all of the paths through the mountains.\n\nMost of all we bring supplies to the great wall in the east. The bastion of the Shado-Pan.\n\nThese are dark times though, and grummles face great dangers on our road."]="我们是土地精。我们熟悉山中所有的道路。\n\n最重要的是，我们负责将物资运到东边的长城。影踪派的堡垒。\n\n但眼下是黑暗时期，土地精在途中面临着巨大的危险。"
G["We are the instruments of an unyielding ire..."]="我们心中只有无穷无尽的愤怒……"
G["We are the last of the furbolg race... The Timbermaw tribe remains uncorrupted, yet we face the same hostility from outsiders; most believe that it is not possible... that there could actually be furbolg that escaped the corruption...\n\nAngry at those that strive to make enemies too quickly, my brethren now attack any that draw near; they trust no one.\n\nBut perhaps, if you strive to make your presence peaceful with them, they might look upon you as an ally."]="Somos la última raza fúrbolg... La tribu Fauces de Madera sigue incorrupta, aunque tenemos que enfrentarnos a la misma hostilidad por parte de los forasteros; la mayoría cree que es imposible... que no puede haber ningún fúrbolg que haya escapado a la corrupción... \n\nFuriosos con los que se esfuerzan por ganar enemigos demasiado deprisa, mis hermanos atacan a todo el que se acerca; no confían en nadie.\n\nPero quizá, y si te esfuerzas porque tu presencia sea pacífica, llegarán a verte como $gun aliado:una aliada;."
G["We are the lost. We know not who we are, or where we belong. We wander in darkness."]="冥途迷茫，不知所往。"
G["We are the new Horde, and under Warchief Hellscream, we are masters of our own destinies."]="在地狱咆哮酋长的率领下，我们成为了新的部落，我们是自己命运的主人。"
G["We are the only supplier of healthy flowers in all of Stormwind. We provide beautiful blooms for any occasion."]="我们是整个暴风城中唯一提供鲜花的地方。你可以在我们店里购买到各种美丽的花儿。"
G["We are the outsiders here, Li Li. We probably look even weirder to him."]="在这里我们可是外人，丽丽，对他来说，我们看起来可能更奇怪。"
G["We are the perfect one, yes, yes, not a failure, no no, not a failure..."]="我们是完美的，对，不是残次品，不，不是残次品……"
G["We are the protectors - immovable and unflappable.\n\nWhen we are moving, nothing can stop us from moving. When we are standing still, nothing can budge us."]="我们是守护者——既稳若磐石又心如止水。\n\n我们移动时，没有什么东西能阻止我们。我们站定时，没有什么东西能动摇我们。"
G["We are the true Horde!"]="我们是真正的部落！"
G["We are the watchers of the wall, the keepers of darkness, the masters of shadows. We know what evil lurks in the heart of Pandaria. We... are the Shado-Pan."]="我们是长城的守护者，是黑暗的监督者，是暗影的大师。我们深知潜藏在潘达利亚最深处的邪魔。我们……就是影踪派。"
G["We are to surround the temple with defenses. Can your druids help?"]="我们将在寺庙周围建造防御工事。你的德鲁伊们能帮忙吗？"
G["We are to wait here. They sent others ahead to check the tunnel interior."]="我们得在这里等着。他们已经派人进去侦查了。"
G["We are too late! Shan Bu is nearly done resurrecting Nalak, the Storm Lord. That is only incidental, however. Our true objective is to defeat Shan Bu!"]="我们来迟了！暴风领主纳拉克就快被山怖复活了。但这只是个偶发事件。我们真正的目标是要击败山怖！"
G["We are too late! They killed her, as Fandral predicted."]="我们太迟了！他们杀了她，如同范达尔所预料的那样。"
G["We are trying to bring Agamath, the First Gate down. Please, $c, go to the Isle of Quel'Danas and help in any way that you can!"]="我们仍然在尝试摧毁第一道屏障阿加麦斯。拜托你了，$c，请立即前往奎尔丹纳斯岛，尽一切可能帮助我们！"
G["We are under attack! To arms!"]="我们遭到攻击了！准备作战！"
G["We are under direct orders from Cairne, $r. Do not interfere with the Commander's task."]="我们直接受命于凯恩，$r。不要干预指挥官的工作。"
G["We are under siege!  To arms!  Kill this $n!"]="我们被包围了！准备战斗！干掉这个$n！"
G["We are unfazed. We will stand firm."]="我们一往无前。我们坚定不移。"
G["We are unified like never before. We've bought our people security in Kalimdor, an end to the blockade, and an end to the total war that's spilt so much blood on either side of the great sea.\n\nNow, to the work of winning the peace. I would like to station a garrison near Theramore. We need to investigate cleansing the plague from Gilnean lands so they can rebuild. We must contain Sylvanas.\n\nFrom here on forward, the Alliance will be proactive. Never again can there be another the likes of Hellscream."]="我们如今正空前的团结。我们为卡利姆多的人民带来了安全，终止了封锁，并结束了这场令大洋两岸无数人民流血牺牲的战争。\n\n现在，我们该致力于恢复和平。我打算在塞拉摩附近建立一座军营。我们需要研究如何净化吉尔尼恩的瘟疫，以便他们重建家园。我们必须遏制希尔瓦娜斯。\n\n从今往后，联盟将采取先发制人的策略，绝不会再让第二个地狱咆哮出现。"
G["We are united in cause, $r. An ancient evil threatens to extinguish all life on Kalimdor and consume the world with its depravity... Its hatred of all things born of the great Shapers: The eternal Titans.\n\nWe are the first and the last lines of defense against the armies of C'Thun. If we do not rise up and strike at our enemy, our enemy will surely destroy us.\n\nThe war effort needs you!"]="我们团结一致，为共同的目标而努力，$R。来自上古的邪灵威胁着卡利姆多，他妄图让整个世界陷入无尽的堕落……他仇视生命的缔造者——永恒的泰坦所创造的一切生物。\n\n我们是惟一能与克苏恩的大军抗衡的军队。如果我们不振作起来同仇敌忾的话，敌人一定会摧毁一切。\n\n为我们的作战物资储备尽自己的力吧！"
G["We are vastly outnumbered here, but with a well-executed strategy, I believe we can succeed."]="我们在这里的人数远逊于敌人，但只要切实贯彻预定的战术，我相信我们是可以成功的。"
G["We are very fortunate to be alive, you and I!"]="我和你，我们非常幸运地活下来了！"
G["We are victorious on the Wintergrasp battlefield!  The fortress is ours!"]="我们取得了冬拥湖战场的胜利！要塞归我们了！"
G["We are victorious!"]="我们胜利了！"
G["We are victorious! Dimensius is no more! Report back to the Professor, hero."]="我们胜利了！迪门修斯已经不复存在了！回去向教授报告吧，英雄。"
G["We are victorious.  In Azshara's name!"]="我们胜利了！以艾萨拉之名！"
G["We are wasting time. We should move in for the kill!"]="这是浪费时间，应该冲进去厮杀！"
G["We are what the cold wind carries. The icy chill of despair... The cold embrace of death..."]="凛冽的北风承载着我们散发出的不祥气息。我们就像绝望的寒冬……接受死亡的冰封之拥吧……"
G["We are winning this battle, $n.  As long as those farmers keep chipping away at the Forsaken's flanks, we will overtake them."]="$n，我们赢得了这场战斗。只要那些农夫还在被遗忘者的侧翼位置大杀大砍，我们就一定能击溃他们。"
G["We are working to open a portal from here to Shado-Pan Garrison."]="我们正努力打开一道从这通往影踪卫戍营的传送门。"
G["We are... beaten. Escape if you can..."]="我们……被打败了。尽量逃走……"
G["We aren't giving those savages an inch of ground. Not while I'm still alive."]="只要我还活着，我就不会让那些蛮子的阵线向前推进一寸。"
G["We aren't your enemy, Xorenth!"]="我们不是你的敌人，克索伦斯！"
G["We arrived just in time! Go'el's spirit has become so unstable, it could collapse upon itself if we don't act fast."]="我们来得正好！古伊尔的灵魂变得不稳定了，如果不快点行动，他的灵魂可能会崩溃。"
G["We assemble an enormous fleet: land, sea, and air. We are legion!"]="我们集结了庞大的军队——凝聚海陆空三军。我们是强大的军团！"
G["We assembled a mighty force and defeated Thermaplugg's servants, fighting our way into the city. But, the usurper Thermaplugg had one last trick up his sleeve..."]="我们召集起了一支强大的军队，击败了瑟玛普拉格的爪牙，一路杀回这座城市。但瑟玛普拉格这个篡位者还留了一招……"
G["We attack Neferset city at first light."]="我们在天亮时进攻尼斐塞特城。"
G["We attacked under cover of a blizzard....\n\nThe Scourge were caught off guard... our victory was certain....\n\nThen... from behind us... the Horde came from nowhere.\n\nThey cost us... everything...."]="我们在暴风雪的掩护下发动了进攻……\n\n天灾军团被打了个措手不及……眼看就要取得胜利……\n\n突然……我们遭遇了……部落大军的偷袭。\n\n他们毁了……一切……"
G["We await a batch of black dragon eggs from the Burning Steppes.  We believe that, through their study, we will advance our knowledge dramatically."]="我们在等一批来自燃烧平原的黑龙蛋。我们相信，通过研究我们能大幅度地增进知识。"
G["We barely have any excess supplies.  It'll take a lot more work before we're ready to send another ground assault into the Field of Strife."]="我们几乎没有多余的物资。要发动对征战平原的另一场地面攻击，我们还需要很多物资。"
G["We barely have any supplies to build Frostwolf Keep.  We'll need many, many more before we can repair our base and reenter the battle."]="我们几乎没有物资来修复霜狼要塞。我们需要更多的物资来重建基地，重新开战。"
G["We barely made it out alive. You'd better run and tell Lasha what you've seen. We've got a serious problem to deal with!"]="我们差一点就没命了。你最好赶快跑到拉珊那里去，告诉她你看到的一切。我们有大麻烦了！"
G["We barely pulled you out of there.  You're lucky to be alive."]="我们差点就没法把你拉出来了。你真是走运，居然还活着。"
G["We battle for the glory of Ymiron! We die in the name of the Lich King!"]="为伊米隆国王的荣耀而战！我们不惜为巫妖王陛下而死！"
G["We be facin' da Kor'kron. Deh be da meanest, baddest orcs deh' Horde have ever seen. Ya betta' not be sleepin' through 'dis trainin'."]="我们将要面对库卡隆。他们是全部落最卑鄙、最混账的兽人。你们最好别在训练中打瞌睡。"
G["We be gatherin' here, on de shores of Sen'jin Village, to be takin' BACK what is ours!"]="我们聚集在森金村的海岸，来夺回本属于我们的东西！"
G["We be gettin' ready to march to de Isles, an' FREE dem of Zalazane's wicked rule! Join me!"]="我们的军队将把那些岛屿从扎拉赞恩的魔爪中解放出来！加入我们吧！"
G["We be headin' up t' where the goblins say they found black gold.  That gold belongs t' the Bloodsail!"]="我们要扬帆前往那群地精声称发现黑金子的地方。那些金子属于血帆海盗！"
G["We be here courtesy o' the trade prince."]="我们要向贸易大王表示礼貌。"
G["We be killin' you now."]="我们现在要杀了你。"
G["We be meetin' again so soon..."]="我们很快就会再见……"
G["We be ready to strike back soon!"]="我们做好了反击的准备！"
G["We be ready to take da fight to Garrosh."]="我们做好与加尔鲁什战斗的准备了。"
G["We be takin' out de trash!"]="我们要清除渣滓！"
G["We been duped!"]="我们上当了！"
G["We been idle too long!"]="我们沉默得太久了！"
G["We been workin' wit de spirits for many moons now, mon, but many o' us already knew de forms o' de loa we served before. It not be easy, but de Emerald Dream be a powerful teacher by itself-havin' de spirits demselves also teachin' ya... it hurries tings along.\n\nDat don't mean 'twas easy keepin' safe from Zalazane. Even wit our new tricks combined wit de loa givin' what help dey could, we lost a few bruddas and sistas over de years ta his voodoo and mindless servants. But we kept de life o' de isles alive, and when Vol'jin and de Darkspears returned, we knew just how ta take Zalazane down."]="我们之中的许多人都一直在侍奉这些神灵，早已熟悉了他们的形态。但在同诸神灵交流的练习中，我们还是渡过了许多个月亮的轮回。这并不容易，幸好除了教导我们的神灵们之外，翡翠梦境本身就是一位强大的教师……它会让一切事情以更快的速度演进。\n\n扎拉赞恩对我们造成了巨大的威胁。虽然神灵们在帮助我们，让我们掌握了新的技艺。但在过去几年，他的妖术和他无脑的奴仆们还是杀死了几名我们的兄弟姐妹。但我们终于保住了这些岛屿上的生命。当沃金和暗矛部族回归时，我们知道，彻底消灭扎拉赞恩的日子到了。"
G["We believed the Sanctum was well-fortified, but we were not prepared for the nature of this assault."]="我们相信圣殿是坚不可摧的，但我们没想到会遭受这样的攻击。"
G["We bent the crap outta them!"]="我们把没用的废物都省掉了！"
G["We better destroy them all. But first, I need to get the shrapnel out of my backside."]="我们要把他们全部毁灭。但首先，我需要把那块弹片从我的背上取出来。"
G["We blood elves have weathered many a storm. Whatever the Thunder King unleashes against us, we shall strike him an even greater blow!"]="我们血精灵历经风雨。无论雷电之王有什么花招，我们必将百倍奉还！"
G["We break from this haze to find that Fandral Staghelm and many of his closest followers have disappeared without a word."]="迷雾终于散去之后，我们却发现范达尔·鹿盔和他的许多最亲近的追随者都在悄然间消失了。"
G["We bring only our honor and the desire to crush our enemies. Have your kind been aiding the Alliance?"]="我们只是渴望胜利的荣耀，渴望粉碎敌人。你们一直在帮助联盟吗？"
G["We bring victory..."]="我们是胜利使者……"
G["We broke up afterward, that's what happened. Too much bad blood, I guess...it had been building for a while. And the thing with the amulet was the straw that broke the kodo's back.\n\nEver since then Valthalak's servants have been picking us off one by one. Most of the amulet piece holders are dead, their souls corrupted by the portion of Valthalak's spirit contained within it.\n\nThat's why I'm glad that you're here, $n. With your help we'll be able to recombine the amulet and return it to Lord Valthalak!"]="我们最后就散伙了，这就是那时发生的一切。死了太多的人，我想……这是最终酝酿出的结果。饰物的事就像是压在科多兽背上的最后一根稻草。\n\n自那以后，瓦塔拉克的仆人将我们一个一个地干掉了。大多数身上带有饰品碎片的人都死了，他们的灵魂也被瓦塔拉克的幽灵所污染了。\n\n这就是为什么看到你在这里我如此高兴的原因，$n。有了你的帮助，或许我们能重新聚合起饰品，并把它还给瓦塔拉克。"
G["We brought you a gift, Great One. Maybe you see it when you wake up. Maybe you remember we came to see you, oki?"]="我们为你带来了一件礼物，造物主。也许你在醒来的时候会看到它。也许你会记得我们来看过你，是吗？"
G["We built this place with our bare hands! Blood and tears, my friend.\n\nBelieve me when I tell you this: We have no plans on ever giving up our hold on Valgarde."]="这里是我们辛辛苦苦用双手建设起来的！朋友，它凝聚着我们的血和泪。\n\n相信我，我们绝对不会放弃瓦加德。"
G["We burns it, we burns! Bring fire, yes!"]="我们烧了它，烧了它！火大点儿，就这样！"
G["We call him Smiling Jim..."]="我们叫他微笑的吉姆……"
G["We call it \"Doom Juice.\""]="Lo llamamos \"el jugo de la muerte\"."
G["We call them \"Emergency Rampless Debarkation Devices.\""]="Los llamamos \"Dispositivos de evacuación de emergencia libres de rampas\"."
G["We call upon you, Firelord!"]="我们在此恳求您，炎魔之王！"
G["We came for something, yes? Can't remember."]="我们来这里是有目的的，对吧？我想不起来了。"
G["We came here for war.\n\nThey gave it to us."]="我们是来打仗的。\n\n这是他们强加给我们的。"
G["We came here to Un'Goro with one objective in mind: profit.  My associates and I are always looking for business partners, if you're interested."]="我们来到安戈洛只为了一件事：利润。我的同伴我和一直在寻找生意上的合作对象。你有兴趣吗？"
G["We came here to investigate and were caught like a gnome with his hand on King Mekkatorque's throne."]="我们是来这进行调查的时候被捕的，当时的样子就像个侏儒把手搭在梅卡托克国王的王座上。"
G["We came here to seal da rift Deathwing tore into Azeroth. We need the World Pillar to repair da hole on dis side."]="我们前来封住死亡之翼留下的裂隙。我们需要世界之柱来修复这一侧的裂口。"
G["We came to bring the master's prophecy into being. The rituals have already begun and we are too numerous for you to stop us all."]="我们已经将主人的预言变为现实。仪式已经开始了，而且我们数量众多，你不可能阻止我们。"
G["We can afford no delay. Fort Triumph must be completed and reinforced, or any hope we have for permanent settlement on this continent will be erased."]="绝不能再耽搁了。必须完成凯旋壁垒的建造和布防，否则我们将没有可能在这片大陆上建立永久定居点。"
G["We can agree it is noble to fight for a righteous cause: to defend home or family. But what of vengeance? What of anger? I sense these emotions run deep in this one."]="我们赞同为正义事业而战是光荣的：如保卫家园或家人。可复仇呢？愤怒呢？我能在此人内心深处感觉到这些情绪。"
G["We can both agree on that, doctor."]="在这一点上，我们可以达成共识，博士。"
G["We can continue now, I think.  Let us press on."]="我想我们现在可以继续了。继续前进。"
G["We can dance too!"]="我们也能跳舞！"
G["We can decurse you, we have the technology."]="我们能移除你身上的诅咒，我们拥有强大的科技。"
G["We can discuss the cut after you come back with the hides. I'm thinking ninety-ten."]="等你拿回那些皮子之后，我们就能讨论分成的问题了。我想，我九你一应该不错。"
G["We can do this in one of two ways, Godfrey. First, I will simply ask you to tell me what the unholy markings etched upon the pages of this tome mean. What say you?"]="高弗雷，这事儿吧有两种解决方式，我更喜欢开门见山的做法。你看，不如你直接告诉我秘典上的邪恶符号是什么含义。怎么样？"
G["We can do this!"]="我们能做到！"
G["We can handle it from here.  Roughriders you are dismissed."]="我们可以控制住形势了。硬汉队，你们可以休息了。"
G["We can has aged yolk?"]="能给我们点陈年蛋黄吃吗？"
G["We can learn much by watching others do battle."]="我们可以通过观摩他人的战斗学到很多东西。"
G["We can learn much from these experiments..."]="我们可以从试验中学到很多知识……"
G["We can make it better, stronger, faster. We have the technology. We have the magic."]="我们能让它变得更好，更强，更快。我们不仅拥有技术，而且拥有强大的魔法。"
G["We can make it if we run!"]="如果我们跑起来的话，是可以成功的！"
G["We can never rest until we get to the top! Heh? Get it?"]="只有登上山顶，我们才能休息！嗨？明白了吗？"
G["We can now rebuild!  For the Horde!"]="我们可以重建啦！为了部落而战！"
G["We can only stay a few moments before returning to the tower. If you wish to speak to us more you may find us there."]="我们马上就要回塔里去了。如果你有话想要和我们说，可以在那里找到我们。"
G["We can overcome these foul creatures!"]="我们一定可以战胜这些邪恶的生物！"
G["We can run no longer. It is time to stand and fight."]="我们已经无路可逃了。该停下来战斗了。"
G["We can save this one, but we must be quick."]="我们可以救这个人，但必须得抓紧时间。"
G["We can slip through here quietly, or fight our way through. It is your decision."]="我们可以悄悄溜过去，或者直接杀进去。你决定吧。"
G["We can sneak past them. As long as we can take down that construct in front of the gate, we should be able to get inside."]="我们可以偷偷地溜过去吧。只要打倒前厅的机械构造体，就能进入奥杜尔了。"
G["We can take this boat inside.  Just let me make a few modifications..."]="我们可以把船开进去。只要做一点改装……"
G["We can take this boat inside. Just let me make a few modifications..."]="我们可以把船开进去。只要做一点改装……"
G["We can use the balloon. Follow me!"]="我们可以用气球。跟我来！"
G["We can use the orchids you gathered to purify the lake in the Valley of the Mad Brewer.  We'll need help though.\n\nMy friend Jian is a water sprite that has helped with some of my own brews and is very useful for getting just the right density of water.  He would know how best to distribute these herbs."]="我们可以用你收集的兰花来净化疯酒师山谷的湖水。但我们需要帮助。\n\n我的朋友浅浅是个水灵，曾帮我酿造过一些酒。在净化水体时，他是很有帮助的。他应该知道怎么分配这些草药才最合适。"
G["We can win if we work together."]="我们合作的话就能赢。"
G["We can win this war!"]="我们会取得这场战争的胜利！"
G["We can't afford to let our enemy, Thermaplugg, continue to tighten his grip on the rest of Gnomeregan."]="我们不能再任由我们的敌人——瑟玛普拉格，继续对诺莫瑞根的其余地区施行统治了。"
G["We can't be certain that he was killed.  Maybe he just ran off somewhere."]="我们不能确定他是不是被杀了。也许只是跑到别处去了。"
G["We can't be lettin' him get away!"]="我们不能让他逃走！"
G["We can't even leave our houses anymore! The attacks are never ending!"]="我们甚至没法离开我们的屋子！进攻似乎永远都不会停止！"
G["We can't help ya 'ere, mon."]="我们不能帮你，朋友。"
G["We can't hold them for long!  Get inside disrupt their necromancers!"]="我们坚持不了多久的！快进入圣地，阻止通灵师的仪式！"
G["We can't just let you return to your companions and we can't take you with us..."]="我们不能让你回到同伴身边，也不能让你和我们呆在一起……"
G["We can't just sit here!"]="我们不能这样干坐着！"
G["We can't keep up the operation much longer. Delber and his team must launch their attack from Steelgrill's Depot as soon as possible!"]="我们已经坚持不了多久了。戴博和他的队伍必须尽快从钢架补给站发动进攻！"
G["We can't leave these refugees like this, Kelaan. Buin here has sold his weapons and armor to buy food for them. He cannot do it alone."]="我们不能不管这些难民，克朗恩。布伊恩已经把他的武器和护甲换成了救助难民的食物。他一个人的力量是不够的。"
G["We can't let a failing servo slow down the construction of the X-52 Nether-Rocket!"]="我们不能让一个失败的系统延缓X-52虚空火箭的建造！"
G["We can't let this stand. The undead must pay!"]="我们不能任凭天灾军团胡来。他们必须付出代价！"
G["We can't seem to stop the pumps."]="似乎没办法把水泵停住。"
G["We can't wait to join the Skyguard. We just need to take a few more magical flasks, right?"]="我们等不及想加入天空卫队了。我们只是需要更多不可思议的合剂而已，对吗？"
G["We cannot afford to give an inch in this war. Day and night, I create new armor, and I patch whatever can be salvaged from the old. I have no time for other tasks. Would you take care of something for me?"]="我不会在这场战争中让步。我不分昼夜的制造新装甲，还把旧的装甲修补好。我没时间做其他任务。你愿帮我分担一些吗？"
G["We cannot afford to let our guard down, $c. This world is crawling with agents and allies of the Burning Legion. If you come across anything strange, don't hestitate to show me."]="我们不能让我们的卫兵倒下，$c。这个世界布满了燃烧军团的爪牙和同盟，如果你发现了任何奇怪的东西，就立即告诉我。"
G["We cannot afford to take mythology at face value."]="我们不能把神话与票面价值划等号。"
G["We cannot allow the Alliance to turn the hidden secrets of the Strand of the Ancients against us. Will you join our brave warriors there?"]="我们不能让联盟利用远古海滩的秘密来对付我们。你愿意帮助我们在那里战斗的勇士吗？"
G["We cannot allow the Horde to turn the hidden secrets of the Strand of the Ancients against us. Will you join our brave soldiers there?"]="我们不能让部落利用远古海滩的秘密来对付我们。你愿意帮助我们在那里战斗的勇士吗？"
G["We cannot allow the arcane power to build up further!"]="我们不能让奥术能量进一步积累了！"
G["We cannot allow this to fall into the wrong hands."]="千万不能让它落入恶人之手。"
G["We cannot circle up here for long. Do what you can while I plan our next move."]="我们不能一直这样转圈。行动起来，我来想想下一步的计划。"
G["We cannot dwell on the mistakes of the past, $r.\n\nThe only path is forward."]="我们不能纠结于过去的错误了，$r。\n\n现在唯一的办法就是前进。"
G["We cannot escape!"]="我们逃不掉了！"
G["We cannot fail, $n.  The future of multiple worlds is at stake here."]="我们不能失败，$n。许多个世界的未来都将由这场战斗而决定。"
G["We cannot fight like this forever."]="这样下去也不是办法。"
G["We cannot hold off the naga this way."]="我们这样是抵挡不住纳迦的。"
G["We cannot hold out against power of this magnitude!  You must use the horn!"]="我们不可能抵挡如此强大的力量！你必须使用号角了！"
G["We cannot let Deathwing win. Should he triumph in this war, then all life will perish."]="我们不能让死亡之翼得逞。如果让他赢得了这场战争，那整个世界都将生灵涂炭。"
G["We cannot let the deaths of our comrades go wasted! Do not let down your guard!"]="我们不能让同伴的牺牲白费！不要松懈！"
G["We cannot let them destroy this tree."]="我们不能让他们毁掉这棵树。"
G["We cannot let them destroy this tree. It is the last of its kind."]="我们不能让他们毁掉这棵树。就只剩下这一棵了。"
G["We cannot rest yet, my child. Hyjal still stands, but if we falter on the Fire Lord's doorstep, all may still be lost. Let the strength of the ancients be with us."]="我们还不能休息，孩子。海加尔还没有沦陷。但如果我们在炎魔之王的门前踯躅，仍有可能一败涂地。愿远古半神的力量与我们同在。"
G["We cannot save them all, $n. Let us move on to someone who may yet respond to our treatment."]="我们不可能救下所有人，$n。我们还是去关注一下那些还有救的病人吧。"
G["We cannot thank you enough for everything you've done to protect our family, $n.\n\nAnd, you do realize that we were joking before when we offered to sell you one of our sons?  No, really... although we do feel a couple more headaches coming on.\n\nJunior, be still, will you?!"]="No podemos agradecerte lo suficiente todo lo que has hecho para proteger a nuestra familia, $n.\n\nY te das cuenta de que bromeábamos con lo de venderte a uno de nuestros hijos, ¿verdad? No, en serio... aunque podemos sentir que vamos a tener un par de jaquecas más.\n\n¡Júnior, ¿quieres estarte quieto?!"
G["We caught this beast slaughtering sheep in the countryside. He is unrepentant and easily agitated. Keep your distance, lieutenant."]="这畜生在村庄里屠杀羊群时被我们抓住了。他死不悔改，脾气极为暴躁。千万别靠得太近，中尉。"
G["We celebrate his bravery with statue and song, but if you were actually there on the beach that very day - well, I'm sure he looked quite silly, indeed."]="我们用雕像和歌谣赞美他的英勇气魄，可如果你在他出海的那天守在岸边——我相信，你会觉得他当时的样子傻得很。"
G["We choose vengeance!"]="我们选择复仇！"
G["We chose to leave the protection and comfort of the Depths to exploit... er, I mean... hrm, yes that's right, EXPLORE the world."]="我们选择了离开黑石深渊的保护出来探险……呃，我是说……嗯，我们这么做是对的，我们要探索整个世界。"
G["We claim your lands for our own!"]="我们宣布你们的土地归我们所有！"
G["We come destroy puny ones!"]="我们要毁灭一切！"
G["We come for you! Prepare yourself!"]="我们来了！做好准备吧！"
G["We come from below! You can never stop us!"]="我们从地底而来！你们无法阻止我们！"
G["We command the arcane! It shall not be used against us!"]="奥术魔法归我们号令！休想用它来对付我们！"
G["We command the power of the elements. Storm, Earth and Fire!  I'd never dress like an oversized chicken and shoot moon beams from the sky."]="我们操纵元素的力量。风暴、大地和火焰！我才不会穿成鸡仔一样，让月光从天空上射下来。"
G["We compete not only for glory, but to bring honor to our ancestors and to our people."]="我们不仅为荣耀而战，还要为我们的先祖和人民赢得光荣。"
G["We control World Pillar!"]="我们控制世界之柱！"
G["We control access to the Exodar's storage facilities. Are there goods you wish to store or remove?"]="我们控制着埃索达的储存设施。你有什么东西需要存取吗？"
G["We control the ebb and flow of time!  The Infinite Dragonflight cannot be defeated!"]="我们掌控时间的进退流返！永恒之龙是不可战胜的！"
G["We control the sand, the seas, the winds..."]="我们掌握着沙漠、海洋和飓风……"
G["We control the timeways now!"]="我们控制了时间之流！"
G["We could certainly use another cook around Dolanaar, not that Zarrin's cooking is lacking mind you.  Why don't you go see what he can teach you?"]="我们当然欢迎多兰纳尔的厨师再多几个，但我并不是说扎瑞恩厨艺欠佳。你为什么不去找这个厨师看看他能教你什么？"
G["We could go on fighting like this forever.  What is it you truly want?"]="我们可以像这样一直战斗下去。你究竟想要什么？"
G["We could go on fighting like this forever. What is it you truly want?"]="我们会永远这样战斗下去。而你真正想要的又是什么？"
G["We could have been civil about this, but no!"]="我们本可以用文明的手段解决这一问题，但我不打算这样！"
G["We could have had so much fun!"]="我们在一起很开心！"
G["We could have, had we been given any warning. You threw my people to the wolves."]="如果事先得到消息，我们就能有所准备。你这是送羊入虎口。"
G["We could probably use these parts."]="这些部件也许对我们有用。"
G["We could use a $c. Glad to see my husband sent you along.\nI'm a scout, not much for face-to-face combat. And Lao-chen here... well, normally he's a fighter, but he's still exhausted from the last battle.\nAnd, he's too busy cooking up some scheme."]="Nos vendría bien $gun:una; $c. Me alegro de que mi marido te enviara.\n\nSoy exploradora, no estoy hecha para el combate cuerpo a cuerpo. Y Lao-Chen... bueno, normalmente es un luchador, pero todavía está exhausto de su última batalla.\n\nAdemás, está muy ocupado elaborando algún plan."
G["We could use a healer."]="我们需要一名治疗者。"
G["We could use some more of those beautiful striped melons!"]="我们还需要一些漂亮的菜瓜！"
G["We couldn't have done it without you, $g sir:ma'am;."]="没有你的帮助，我们很难取得胜利。"
G["We couldn't have done this without you, $p.  Thank you."]="$p，没有你我们做不到。谢谢你。"
G["We cried out in agony as our families were cut down before our eyes."]="亲人惨遭屠戮，而我们却只能悲愤地哭嚎。"
G["We crush you!"]="我们要粉碎你！"
G["We crushed your Alliance in Southern Barrens. We will crush you here. And Pandaria will tremble!"]="我们在南贫瘠之地摧毁了你们的军队。我们也将在这里取得胜利。整个潘达利亚都将颤抖！"
G["We defeated the Destroyer!"]="我们击败了灭世者！"
G["We defeated the sea monster!"]="我们打败了海怪！"
G["We defend. We stand. We show that as one. United. We destroy. Their god will fall."]="我们誓死抵抗。我们誓不言败。我们是一个整体，一个团结起来的整体。我们将获得胜利，而它们的神必将失败。"
G["We demand answers!"]="回答我们！"
G["We did it boys!  Now back to the Grim Guzzler and we'll drink to the $3096W that were injuredl!"]="我们成功了！现在，我们要返回黑铁酒吧，和$3096W个受伤的弟兄一起喝个痛快！"
G["We did it boys!  Now back to the Grim Guzzler and we'll drink to the $3151W that were injuredl!"]="我们赢了！现在回到黑铁酒吧里去，让我们为那$3151W个受伤的伙伴干杯！"
G["We did it men, we saved The Barnacle! Finally, a moment of rest since we entered this forsaken mist. Turn the sails, men. We're goin' home!"]="我们成功了，伙计们，我们拯救了藤壶号！自从进入这片隔绝一切的迷雾以来，我们总算能休息一会儿了。扬帆，伙计们。我们要回家啦！"
G["We did it!"]="我们做到了！"
G["We did it!  We survived another trip with our ship intact!  But that's no reason to slack off!  Push her hard until we dock!"]="成功了！我们毫发无损地完成了这次航行！不过现在还不是偷懒的时候！加大马力，准备靠港！"
G["We did it! Can you believe what we're hearing? This is incredible!"]="成功啦！你听到了吗？真是难以置信！"
G["We did it! Cover the roads and keep this place locked down."]="我们成功了！占领道路，封锁这个地点。"
G["We did it! Let's fire this masterpiece up..."]="我们做到了！来，我们要让这个杰作动起来……"
G["We did it! That'll learn those Dragonmaw to try an' ambush a Wildhammer."]="我们完成了！现在那些龙喉兽人如果想要伏击蛮锤氏族，我们会给他们一点颜色看看。"
G["We did it! The Maiden's Dagger is mine, all mine!"]="我们成功了！女武士之匕号是我的了，完全是我的了！"
G["We did it! The trail should be clear from here on."]="我们成功了！从这里开始，应该畅通无阻了。"
G["We did it! We've defeated Tethyr!"]="成功了！我们打败了泰瑟尔！"
G["We did it, $p! That was some good butt-punchin' back there!"]="我们成功了，$p！干得漂亮！"
G["We did it, father..."]="我们做到了，父亲……"
G["We did it, lads! We got here before Algalon's arrival. Maybe we can rig the systems to interfere with his analysis--"]="我们成功了，伙计们！终于抢在奥尔加隆前面来到了这里。也许我们可以对系统做点手脚，改变他的分析结果——"
G["We did it, lads! We got here before Algalon's arrival... maybe we can rig the systems to interfere with his analysis..."]="我们成功了，伙计们！终于抢在奥尔加隆前面来到了这儿……也许我们可以对系统做点手脚，改变他的分析结果……"
G["We did not stand a chance. As my brethren perished around me, I managed to retreat here and bar the entrance."]="我们全面溃败。同胞们一个个死去。只有我撤退到这里，并封住了入口。"
G["We did this for about six months and watched as the house went through horrifying changes. Foul monsters roamed through the manor at will. Dark cultists populated every inch with various paraphernalia relating to rituals and sacrifices. We knew that we could not hide much longer.\n\nAs expected, we were found and captured. They stripped us of all our clothes and laid us out inside a circle of blood. We sat there for days, naked and terrified."]="我们这样持续了六个月，看到房屋经历了令人恐惧的变化。肮脏的怪物随意在庄园里漫游。随身携带着各种与仪式和祭祀相关的用具的黑暗信徒遍布在每一寸地方。我们知道我们躲不了多久了。\n\n正如所料想的那样，我们被发现并抓住了。他们剥掉了我们所有的衣服并把我们放到一滩鲜血中。我们坐在那里长达数天，赤身裸体，胆战心惊。"
G["We did well here."]="形势逐渐乐观了起来。"
G["We didn't bring the war to the Horde, the Horde brought the war to us."]="不是我们将战火引向部落，而是部落将战火引向我们。"
G["We didn't hide this stuff just you could steal it!"]="别以为你可以拿走我们的财宝！"
G["We didn't know th-"]="我们不知道——"
G["We didn't see it coming..."]="我们没有想到……"
G["We didn't want to do this!"]="我们也不想这么做的！"
G["We discovered these proto-drakes at the Bronze Dragonshrine in the Dragonblight. We knew at once that they were kin - our blood from ages past.\n\nMy apologies, $c. You are probably confused. I am Penumbrius of the bronze dragonflight. I have taken this form out of convenience. It is much easier to communicate and live amongst mortals while in the mortal guise.\n\nHow can I help you?"]="Hemos encontrado estos protodracos en el Santuario de Dragones Bronce, en el Cementerio de Dragones. Desde el principio supimos que eran de nuestro linaje, nuestra sangre en el pasado.\n\nDiscúlpame, $c. supongo que estás $gconfuso:confusa;. Soy Penumbrius, del Vuelo Bronce. He adoptado esta forma por conveniencia. Es mucho más fácil convivir y comunicarse con los mortales cuando tienes aspecto de mortal.\n\n¿Cómo puedo ayudarte?"
G["We discovered this crystal and tablets in a Titan archive. I used the crystal to buy some time, but they're still following me!"]="我们在一座泰坦宝库中发现了这块水晶和一些石板。我用这块水晶争取了一些时间，但他们还在追杀我！"
G["We discussed the merits of your High King. I have been observing him closely."]="我们分析了你的国王。我一直在密切关注他。"
G["We dispatched a force of knights to capture a pair of Arthas' Scourge lieutenants to serve as the next challenge of the trial. The knights have not returned with their prey yet, so the next phase of the trial is on hold. Check back next week."]="我们派出一队骑士，去俘虏两名阿尔萨斯的天灾军团战将，以作为下一场试炼挑战的敌人。但骑士们并没有带着俘虏回来。所以试炼的下一个阶段也只能暂停了。下周再来看看吧。"
G["We do not act alone in this. Whatever happens to us this day, the night elves will still fall!"]="我们并非孤军作战。无论今天我们有怎样的下场，暗夜精灵仍然难逃灭亡！"
G["We do not ask the elements for aid..."]="我们不需要元素的帮助……"
G["We do not choose to go to war, $n.  War comes to us.\n\nWe must do what we must to be ready."]="No elegimos ir a la guerra, $n. La guerra viene a nosotros.\n\nDebemos hacer todo lo posible por estar preparados."
G["We do not fear you!"]="我们可不怕你！"
G["We do not fear you, child of iron!"]="我们才不怕你呢。来啊，钢铁的子嗣！"
G["We do not have much time, hero. What do you need?"]="No tenemos mucho tiempo, $ghéroe:heroína;. ¿Qué necesitas?"
G["We do not know if the Caverns of Time have always been accessible to mortals. Truly, it is impossible to tell as the Timeless One is in perpetual motion, changing our timeways as he sees fit. What you see now may very well not exist tomorrow. You may wake up yesterday and have no memory of this place."]="我们不知道时光之穴是否一直都允许凡人进入。确切的说，我们不可能知道这一点，因为时光之王在永远地运动着，用他认为恰当的方式来改变我们的时间流。也许你现在所看到的东西，明天就不存在了。你也可能会在昨天醒来，然后对这个地方没有丝毫的印象。"
G["We do not know! That is precisely why I am here."]="我们不知道！所以我才会到这里来。"
G["We do not know.\n\nThe Dark Irons that did survive made their way into the mountain and began rebuilding their city.\n\nFrom the ashes of Thaurissan then rose Blackrock Spire and the new Dark Iron nation. Additional fortifications were made within the Searing Gorge, in the area known as the Cauldron.\n\nStories of an ancient evil that controlled the kingdom of Dark Irons began to circulate."]="No lo sabemos.\n\nLos Hierro Negro que sobrevivieron se dirigieron al interior de la montaña y allí reconstruyeron su ciudad.\n\nDe las cenizas de Thaurissan emergieron la Cumbre de Roca Negra y la nueva nación Roca Negra. Se construyeron fortificaciones adicionales dentro de la Garganta de Fuego, en el área conocida como la Caldera.\n\nEmpezaron a circular historias de un antiguo ser maligno que controlaba el reino de los Hierro Negro."
G["We do not know. We believe that the Black Dragonflight is involved as are some independent third parties. That is why you are here, $r. You will unravel this mystery from the inside and bring redemption to Netherwing.\n\nAnd now... I can only assume she asked you to bring back my hand."]="No sabemos. Creemos que el Vuelo Negro está implicado, al igual que algunas terceras partes independientes. Por eso estás aquí, $r. Desvelarás este misterio desde el interior y traerás la redención a los Ala Abisal.\n\nY ahora... Solo puedo suponer que te ha encargado que me traigas mi mano."
G["We do not need help from the lesser races! Dispose of it!"]="我们不需要低贱种族的帮助！干掉它！"
G["We do not need your kind here."]="在这里，我们不需要你的仁慈。"
G["We do not often have troubles with predators up here. Sometimes when it rains the saurok come out. But that is only when there is a lightning storm."]="我们这里并不常遭遇掠食者。有时，如果下雨的话，蜥蜴人会出现。可他们只在电闪雷鸣的暴风雨来袭时才会来。"
G["We do not wish to be disturbed!"]="我们不希望被打扰！"
G["We do not wish to enter your conflict. But I fear that when war is on the horizon, peace is not a choice."]="我们不愿卷入你们的争端。可我担心的是，一旦燃起战火，我们将再难独善其身。"
G["We do not yet have the strength to push forward into the Firelands. First, we must rebuild our forces and supplies. Will you lend yourself to our efforts?"]="我们暂时还无力反攻火焰之地。首先，我们得重整部队，建立补给线。你愿意帮助我们吗？"
G["We do our best here to heal the broken earth. It was difficult enough before we started getting raided at night."]="我们在这里竭尽全力医治残破的大地。就在这种极为艰难的情况下，我们还在夜晚遭到了袭击。"
G["We do wish for you to stand down, your Highness."]="我们恳请您解除戒备，陛下。"
G["We doins Hozen activities!"]="让我们以猢狲的方式取乐！"
G["We don't deal with those kinds of people here! This auction house only lists honestly-acquired merchandise."]="我们不会和那种家伙做生意！拍卖行里只会出售正规来路的商品。"
G["We don't die that easily, sea-witch!"]="海巫，我们没那么容易对付！"
G["We don't get many visitors out here. May I interest you in something?"]="到我们这儿来的客人可不多。你对我感兴趣？"
G["We don't have a bank here in Brill, you'll have to go to the Undercity for that.  At the back of the Ruins of Lordaeron to the south are elevators that will take you down into the Undercity.  Once there, ask one of the Undercity Guardians for more precise directions."]="布瑞尔镇没有银行，你得去幽暗城找找。在南方的洛丹伦废墟后面的升降梯能带你去幽暗城。你可以问问幽暗城守卫，他们会为你指明方向的。"
G["We don't have a choice! We need to alert the other villages of what's going on here!"]="我们别无选择！必须通知其他村民，让他们知道这里发生的一切！"
G["We don't have all night. Hurry it up already!"]="我们可不能让你们打上一整晚。抓紧时间了！"
G["We don't have any easy path before us. If you've got a strong arm on you, stick around until one of my squads is ready to ascend to Ymirheim. They could use all the help they can get."]="形势严峻，没有捷径可走。如果你的战斗力够强，请掩护我的小队，直到他们做好爬上伊米海姆的准备。他们需要一切可利用的帮助。"
G["We don't have many supplies for rebuilding.  It will take a lot more before Dun Baldar will be repaired."]="我们的物资不够，无法修复。要修复丹巴达尔，还需要很多物资。"
G["We don't have time to talk!  We have to think about those trolls!"]="没有时间聊天了！我们必须马上想办法对付那些巨魔！"
G["We don't know much about the burning of the Shady Rest Inn, except that James Hyal's wife and child were unable to escape.\n\nWe managed to drag James out, but he hasn't been the same since.\n\nWe have many leads but not much evidence. It is our hope that through the efforts of the guard and the vigilant help of the people of Theramore, we will unravel this terrible crime.\n\nIf you would like to lend assistance to the investigation, what remains of the inn can be found at the border to the Barrens."]="我们对于树荫旅店被焚烧以及詹姆斯·海厄尔的妻子和孩子没能及时逃脱这些事情了解得并不多。\n\n我们想要找到詹姆斯的尸体，但是他却根本不在那堆废墟中。\n\n我们有一些线索，但是证据仍然很缺乏。我们希望能通过卫兵和塞拉摩人民的帮助让这件惨案得以大白天下。\n\n如果你也想帮忙的话，可以到贫瘠之地的边境那里调查一下旅店的废墟。"
G["We don't let just any riffraff off the street in here!"]="这可不是街头混混能进的地方！"
G["We don't live our lives as quickly as you do, my mushy friend. A healthy giant eats three square meals a decade, although I am known to indulge in a snack every couple of years. We'll go to the bathroom every 15 to 25 years... barring any tummy trouble."]="我们的生命进程不像你们那样快，我柔软的朋友！一个健康的巨人每十年会吃三顿饭。不过我每两年会吃一次小点心。我们每15到25年会上一次厕所……拉肚子除外。"
G["We don't need to tell Omnuron about this."]="我们不必让欧穆隆知道这件事。"
G["We don't need your healing skills."]="我们不需要你的治疗技能。"
G["We don't see very many new faces here anymore."]="我们在这里已经很少能见到新面孔了。"
G["We don't shoe no mules here. 'Sides, it's strictly expedition business right now."]="我们不负责给骡子钉马蹄铁。准确地说，那是远征队的事儿。"
G["We don't stand a chance if we face the hozen alone. We will need the help of the Alliance if our tribe is to survive."]="我们不可能独自对抗猢狲。如果我们的部族想要生存下去，就需要联盟的帮助。"
G["We don't stand a chance..."]="我们毫无机会……"
G["We don't take kindly to miscreants, $r."]="我们不会对犯错者手软，$r。"
G["We don't want any trouble. Just keep our path clear and everything will be fine. Nobody needs to get hurt. Especially me!"]="我们不想惹麻烦。只要别挡我们的路，一切都不会有问题。没有人会受到伤害。特别是我！"
G["We drink for the Horde!  Do you drink for the Horde?  Come show us at Drohn's Distillery!"]="我们为部落干杯！你也是为部落干杯吗？来德罗恩的酿酒厂让我们看看！"
G["We drove back the sha, your kind will fall before us as well."]="我们将煞魔击退，同样也会击败你们。"
G["We dwarves have a connection to the earth.  We can feel her pain.  And right now the earth is crying out.  These earthquakes... they are both natural and not.  I wanted to gather you all together and discuss them."]="我们矮人与大地之间存在着联结。我们能感觉到她的痛苦。而大地此刻正在哀号。这些地震……它们既是自然形成但也非全然如此。我想要将你们聚集在一起，共同商讨对策。"
G["We embark soon for distant shores, to hurl ourselves at the enemy homeland."]="我们很快就将登船前往遥远的彼岸，扑向敌人的老巢。"
G["We end this now!"]="让我们做个了结吧！"
G["We face an enemy we cannot kill through traditional means. The Lich King's plague is a force that no healer within our ranks has been able to deter. The Forsaken and their alchemists are the only hope we have, much to my disgust.\n\nIf we live through this, I promise you that the Horde will go to Northrend and bring the Lich King and his armies to their knees!"]="面对亡灵大军，我们无法用传统的手段“杀死”他们。我们也无法治愈巫妖王的诅咒，只能阻止其传播。被遗忘者和他们的炼金师是我们唯一的希望，尽管我很讨厌他们。\n\n如果我们能熬过这一关，我向你保证，部落一定会挥师诺森德，歼灭巫妖王和他的部队！"
G["We fear not the brilliance of the tan-chao - we know it is a path home. The bridge between earth and sky."]="接天宝桥，归我故乡。"
G["We fear not the darkness of this world - we know it is but shadow, cast by the glorious world beyond."]="无惧黑暗，彼岸在望。"
G["We feel it best to position them here, where they might come to terms with their impending fate."]="我们觉得最好将他们安置在这里，让他们乖乖地接受注定的命运。"
G["We feel nothing. Our souls remain here, in limbo. We are unable to leave until our remains are found and spirits laid to rest."]="我们什么都没感觉到。我们的灵魂在这里，在地狱。在找到我们的尸体并让灵魂安息之前我们不能离开。"
G["We feel that the Ethereum are as great a threat to our existence as Dimensius. Both must be stopped..."]="我们感觉到复仇军就像迪门修斯一样对我们存在造成了威胁。两者都必须被终结……"
G["We few, we happy few, we band of brothers and sisters.  For those today that shed their blood with me, Shall be my kin; be they never so vile, This day shall gentle their conditions."]="勇士们，我的兄弟姐妹们，我们并肩作战，流血牺牲，你们是我最亲密的战友。就让战火洗练出你们崇高的价值，赢得后世的美名吧。"
G["We fight because we believe in what we fight for."]="我们是为自己的信念而战。"
G["We fight for the glory of Brunnhildar!"]="为布伦希尔达村的荣耀而战！"
G["We fight so that our children can live better lives than ours!"]="我们是为了让孩子们过上比我们更好的生活而战！"
G["We fight so that sacrifices of our ancestors were not in vain!"]="我们是为了不让先祖们白白牺牲而战！"
G["We fight the mantid, yaungol, and mogu. Enemies face us from all sides.\nI'm here to make sure there are no surprises."]="Luchamos contra los mántides, los yaungol y los mogu. Tenemos enemigos por todas partes.\n\nEstoy aquí para asegurarme de que no hay sorpresas."
G["We fight to the death!"]="我们要战斗到最后一刻！"
G["We fight to the death, Phaoris!  Our race was created to guard this land.  We must not betray that legacy."]="我们会战斗到死，法奥瑞斯！我们一族生来就是为了保卫这片土地。我们绝不会背叛我们的血脉传统。"
G["We fight together brethren!"]="我们并肩战斗，兄弟们！"
G["We fight!"]="我们打呀！"
G["We fight! We push them back, just as we have always done!"]="勇敢地战斗！和以前一样，将天灾军团赶出我们的家园！"
G["We fight, that others may live in peace."]="为同胞们的福祉而战。"
G["We fight, toil, and serve so that Her vision for us is made reality."]="我们战斗、劳作、效命，以使女皇对我们的期望成真。"
G["We finally understood what the screams were from. The Butcher exposed us to pain that we did not know existed. He used us in countless experiments, attempting to devise a plague.\n\nThe days turned to weeks. We would have died on the first day had it not been for that cruel monster keeping us alive through magical means."]="我们最后弄清喊声从哪里传来的了。屠夫让我们见识到闻所未闻的痛苦。他把我们用于无数试验中，试图研制瘟疫菌。\n\n日子过去了数星期。要不是那个残忍的混蛋用法术维系着我们的生命，我们熬不过第一天的。"
G["We find evil ones now!  Follow!"]="我们找到坏人了！快跟上！"
G["We find you unworthy of ascension, Halfdan. Let your soul know oblivion!"]="哈尔弗丹，你没有资格获得升华。你的灵魂将坠入湮灭的深渊！"
G["We finds evil one!  Quick!"]="我们发现坏人了！赶快！"
G["We finish this now, champions of Kirin Tor!"]="让我们来做个了断吧，肯瑞托的勇士们！"
G["We fish, we sleep, and we explode things.  What could be better than that?"]="我们钓鱼，我们睡觉，我们炸飞各种东西。还有什么生活能比这样更好？"
G["We followed Leza's visions of the light to this place like moths to a flame."]="我们追随着莱莎对光明的预见来到此地，如同飞蛾扑火。"
G["We followed the sound of the water, and came upon this resplendent Vale.\n\nThe water of these pools is like none other that we have ever seen."]="我们循着水声，来到这个壮丽的锦绣谷。\n\n这些池水不同于我们以往所见。"
G["We fought back da Scourge. What chance joo thinkin' JOO got?"]="连天灾军团都被我们击败了，你们以为自己能有几分胜算？"
G["We fought long and hard.  We had proven again and again that we ogres were a force to be reckoned with."]="我们经历了艰苦卓绝的漫长斗争，每一次都证明了我们食人魔是一股不可忽视的力量。"
G["We fought well, but we should not push our luck."]="我们打得很好，但也不能冒进。"
G["We found a saddle and harness from one of the carcasses of the various beasts being shot out of the sky.\n\nA little polish and a little magic and presto... good as new!"]="我们从被击落的各种野兽尸体上找到了一副鞍座和笼头。\n\n只要好好擦一擦，再加上一点小魔法，然后“嗖”的一声……它就跟新的一样了！"
G["We found somethin' down there, somethin' HUGE, and all of a sudden the rocks started fightin' back and everyone went crazy. Bad business!"]="我们在下面有了重大发现！可后来，岩石突然就开始反击，所有人都疯了。真是亏本的买卖！"
G["We found this one cawing up a storm in Auchindoun. Give it up for Yikkan Izu!"]="我们在奥金顿找到了这位在风暴中嚎叫的家伙。大家鼓掌欢迎——伊坎·伊祖！"
G["We found this one scuttling in circles in Silithus. From the looks of him, somebody mostly killed him already. It's Ixx!"]="我们在希利苏斯发现了他。他身受重创已经命悬一线。他就是伊克西！"
G["We found this one scuttling in circles in Silithus. Looks like somebody mostly killed him already. It's Ixx!"]="我们在希利苏斯的法阵里发现了这个钻洞的家伙。当时他已经被人打得半死。他就是，伊克西！"
G["We gather to determine the fate of our great flight."]="我们聚集于此，来决定蓝龙军团的命运。"
G["We gave shinies to shrine... we not greedy... why this happen?"]="我们把闪闪发光的宝贝都供奉给了神殿……我们一点也不贪心啊……为什么会这样？"
G["We gave up much to attain this foothold, and we must continue fighting to keep it. Although our defenses are weak, continued efforts to push forward will help us recruit stronger allies in the future.\n\nThe time for courage is now, champion."]="我们用无数的牺牲才换来这个据点，但为了保住它，我们还要继续战斗。虽然我们的防御很薄弱，但只要我们不断推进战线，将来一定能招来更强大的盟友。\n\n现在，拿出勇气来吧，勇士。"
G["We get tabard?"]="我们有制服吗？"
G["We glad, little $g brother : sister; $n here."]="Nosotros contentos de que $gpequeño hermano:pequeña hermana; $n estar aquí."
G["We gnomes have a high metabolism, $p. Make sure we don't run outta food!"]="我们侏儒的新陈代谢很快，$p。别让我们的食物存量见底了！"
G["We go to scout out the sinkholes to the west, Chieftain."]="酋长，我们要去侦察西边的虫孔。"
G["We go!"]="我们走吧！"
G["We going to break your spears! Don't cry about your spears puppy-men... don't cry about them being broken!"]="我们会拧断你们的长矛！别为它们哭泣啊……别为断裂的长矛哭泣！"
G["We gonna Ook all night!"]="我们要闹上一整晚！"
G["We gonna be dancin' on ya grave tonight, mon!"]="我们今晚要在你的坟墓上跳舞，朋友！"
G["We gonna burry ya here."]="这里就是你的葬身之地。"
G["We gonna kill 'em all!"]="杀光他们！"
G["We gonna put you in the Dooker Dome!"]="我们要把你关进暴徒末路！"
G["We gonna show you why treasure be a pirate's best friend!"]="我们要让你知道，为什么财宝是海盗最好的朋友！"
G["We gonna' feed ya to the big one!"]="我们要拿你去喂大块头！"
G["We gork big dooker!"]="杀了大坏蛋！"
G["We got a yeti, ookers! You hear me! We got a yeti!"]="天哪，我们找到了一个雪人！你没听错！一个雪人！"
G["We got another $c inbound!"]="¡$gOtro:Otra; $r que está a punto de llegar!"
G["We got the door down and the barrier preventin' entry to the Plagueworks busted open! My gnomes are werkin' on gettin' the barrier to the Crimson Hall down. It'll be another $4939W days before that thing comes down.\n\nGet in there and take out some Scourge!"]="我们已经击破了大门和阻挡在天灾工厂前面的屏障！我派出的侏儒正在对付血色厅堂前的屏障。冲破它还需要$4939W天。\n\n杀进去，给天灾军团点颜色看看！"
G["We got the final barrier blockin' entry to Frostwing Halls down, $g lad:lass;. Only Sindragosa stands between the Lich King and divine retribution! What are ye waitin' for?!"]="霜翼大厅前的最后一道屏障已经被我们击破了，$g小伙子:姑娘;。只有辛达苟萨还挡在正义之师和巫妖王之间！还等什么？！"
G["We got this."]="明白了。"
G["We got work to do, $c. This forest isn't going to chop itself down!"]="我们有活儿干了，$c。这片树林可不会自己倒下！"
G["We gots Hozen tendencies!"]="猢狲潮流永向前！"
G["We gots da Hozen enemies!"]="猢狲敌人死光光！"
G["We gots da Hozen friends!"]="猢狲好友遍天下！"
G["We gotta find the matriarch of this operation and end her!"]="我们要找出幕后主使，结果了她！"
G["We gotta finish up here and get you to the dock before the Trade Prince leaves us all behind!"]="我们得尽快结束这里的事情，把你送到码头，趁贸易大王还没把我们大家甩在身后！"
G["We gotta warn the others!"]="我们要警告其他人！"
G["We grooked!"]="杀啊！"
G["We grow better!  You bad!"]="我们种得更好！你这讨厌鬼！"
G["We grow strong, while our foes are surrounded by foes, and weakened by constant attacks."]="我们越来越强大，而我们的敌人陷入了多线作战的困境，并且在持续的战事中变得越来越弱。"
G["We grunts were ordered to charge once more - into a wall of pikes - I could not do it, $c. My weapon slid from my hands and my legs did not move.\n\nI am dishonored."]="我们得到命令，要再次进行冲锋。而迎击我们的是一片长矛组成的壁垒。我做不到，$c。我的武器滑出了双手，两条腿也无法动弹。\n\n我玷污了自己的荣誉。"
G["We guarded the waters. Too dangerous, too powerful, to fall into the wrong hands."]="我们一直守护着这水。它是如此强大，一旦落入邪恶的手，后果将不堪设想。"
G["We gunna drive all da scourge outta Zul'Drak, mon - startin' with you!"]="我们要把天灾军团赶出祖达克——就从你开始吧！"
G["We had a name we called ourselves... what was it?"]="我们给自己起了一个名字……是什么名字……？"
G["We had no cooks to spare, but it is a bit odd... there are some delectable scents on the south wind. Follow your nose, eh?"]="我们没有多余的食物可以分享了，但是有点奇怪……从南方吹来的风中夹杂着诱人的香味。不如去那边看看？"
G["We had them in our sights... the Horde ships... then out of nowhere, tentacles reached up and seized our ship... broke it right in two!\n\nThe survivors... we were captured by naga as soon as we hit the water.\n\nThat was nearly a week ago."]="我们发现了他们……部落的船队……然后突然就不见了，有触手伸出来一把抓住了我们的船……把它折成了两截！\n\n幸存者们……我们一落水就立刻被纳迦抓住。\n\n那是差不多一星期以前的事了。"
G["We had them!\n\nWretched Alliance ships... we could've cut a path to Stormwind and put an end to them!\n\n...But out of nowhere, gigantic tentacles reached up and seized our ship... broke it right in two!\n\nThe survivors... we were captured by naga as soon as we hit the water."]="我们抓到他们了！\n\n该死的联盟船只……我们本可以第一时间抄近路直取暴风城，彻底解决了他们！\n\n可不知打哪儿冒出来巨大的触手，一把抓住了我们的船……把它断成了两截！\n\n幸存者们……我们一落水就立刻被纳迦抓住了。"
G["We had traveled north through the forest for several hours."]="我们一直往北，在森林里走了几个小时。"
G["We happily drink in your blue blood, draenei. Nothing gives us more pleasure than to wound you just to see the blood flow."]="我们会很高兴啜饮你那蓝色血液的，德莱尼人。没有什么比看着你们的血涌出来更快乐的事情了。"
G["We have a battle to win!"]="我们必须胜利！"
G["We have a dozen more dishes to finish today!  Get a move on!"]="今天还有好几道菜要做！赶紧！"
G["We have a large store of supplies to rebuild Frostwolf Keep.  Just a little bit more and we'll have enough to repair and reenter the battle!"]="我们拥有丰富的物资储备来修复霜狼要塞。再有一些我们就能完全修复，重新开战啦！"
G["We have a lot of excess supplies, but we still need more before we can send an assualt into the Field of Strife."]="我们的物资储备已经很多了，但是要发动对征战平原的地面攻击，我们还需要更多的物资。"
G["We have a lot of supplies, but we still need a lot more in order to send a ground assault into the Field of Strife."]="我们有很多物资储备啦，但是要发动对征战平原的地面攻击，我们还需要更多的物资。"
G["We have a lot of visitors from all over Pandaria, surely they can help us with these raiders."]="我们这儿有来自潘达利亚各地的造访者，他们肯定可以帮助我们解决这些掠夺者。"
G["We have a medium store of supplies for rebuilding, but we still need a lot more before Frostwolf Keep can be fully repaired."]="我们的物资储备状况一般，要完全修复霜狼要塞的话，我们还需要更多的物资。"
G["We have a right to this land, same as you!"]="和你一样，我们也是这块地的主人！"
G["We have a situation on our hands. Help defend our allies!"]="我们遇到麻烦了。快帮忙保护我们的战友！"
G["We have a special guest today: the always-endearing, ever-resilient, Millhouse Manastorm! Good luck, MillMan!"]="今天我们将迎来一位特别的客人：最迷人，最坚强的侏儒：米尔豪斯·法力风暴！祝你好运，米尔豪猛男！"
G["We have a traitor within our walls.  Someone who is well connected."]="在我们的城里有一名叛徒。蓄谋已久的叛徒。"
G["We have a very small store of supplies to rebuild Frostwolf Keep.  It's going to take a lot more before we can repair and reenter the battle."]="我们的物资太少，不足以修复霜狼要塞。如果想要完全修复，重新开战，需要的物资就更多啦。"
G["We have a winner!  $n has won FIRST PLACE in the tournament!"]="¡Tenemos $gun ganador:una ganadora;! ¡$n se ha hecho con el PRIMER PUESTO del torneo!"
G["We have a winner!  $n has won SECOND PLACE in the tournament!"]="¡Ya tenemos $gganador:ganadora;! ¡$n ha quedado $gSEGUNDO:SEGUNDA; en el torneo!"
G["We have a winner!  $n has won THIRD PLACE in the tournament!"]="¡Ya tenemos $gganador:ganadora;! ¡$n ha quedado $gTERCERO:TERCERA; en el torneo!"
G["We have all been witness to a terrible tragedy. The blood of good men has been shed upon this soil! Honorable knights, slain defending their lives -- our lives!"]="我们见证了一场可怕的悲剧。善良人的鲜血早已将这整片土地染红！无数高贵而英勇的骑士，为了保卫我们而牺牲在这里！"
G["We have all been witness to terrible tragedies, but we must not let them drag us to despair.\n\nInstead, hold those memories close so that one day, we might find a reckoning."]="我们都亲眼目睹了无数可怕的灾难，但是我们不能由此绝望。\n\n记住这些往事，总有一天，我们会进行报复的。"
G["We have all the copper bars that we need. Thank you for your assistance, $c. You might wanna help out with the other materials being collected here."]="我们已经集齐了所需的铜锭。谢谢你的帮助，$c。你还可以帮帮其他正在收集作战物资的人。"
G["We have all the time in the world...."]="我们掌握着这个世界所有的时间流……"
G["We have all three of the relics, but my energy is rapidly fading. We must make our way back to Dreamwarden Lurosa! He will let you know what to do next."]="我们已经得到了全部三件圣物，不过我的能量正在迅速消失。我们必须立刻回到梦境卫士鲁罗萨那里去！他会告诉你接下来该怎么做。"
G["We have almost all the silithyst we need!  Don't stop now!"]="水晶尘的收集工作就快完成了！继续努力，别停啊！"
G["We have almost all the silithyst we need!  For the Horde!"]="水晶尘的收集工作就快完成了！继续努力，为部落而战！"
G["We have an abundance of mailboxes in our fair city. The one by the Royal Exchange Bank should certainly fit your needs."]="在我们美丽的城市里有许多邮箱。靠近皇家贸易区银行的那个对你来说应该非常方便。"
G["We have arrived, $n. Does he still live?"]="我们到了，$n。他还活着吗？"
G["We have auction house in central ring."]="中央地带有拍卖行，就在南边。"
G["We have barely any supplies.  If we want to send a ground assault into the Field of Strife, then we'll need a lot more!"]="我们几乎没有物资装备。想要发动对征战平原的地面攻击的话，还需要很多物资！"
G["We have barrels of fireworks all over the town for the festival celebrations, $n. Place a few of them in the right locations and give them a good wack and they would cause all kinds of destruction. Grab a barrel and I'll mark the locations we should place them."]="我们的小镇上到处都有用于庆祝节日的大桶烟火。$n。把它们放在正确的位置，给它们来个恰到好处的打击，让它们可以造成各种各样的破坏。带上一桶烟花，我会在放置烟花的地方做标记。"
G["We have been betrayed!"]="我们被出卖了！"
G["We have been sent here from Darnassus to aid the Stormpike in their time of need."]="我们奉命从达纳苏斯来到这儿，帮助身处患难的卡尔·雷矛。"
G["We have been taught not to trust strangers, $c."]="经历了这次教训之后，我们就不再相信陌生人了，$c。"
G["We have been tending these worms for some time. I hope they will be fit in time for the ring event of this organization. You must face not one, but two jormungar, after all."]="我们照顾这些虫子已经有一段时间了。我希望它们能在斗兽活动中充分发挥作用。要知道，你要打败的不是一条冰虫，而是两条。"
G["We have been through worse and survived, Leoric. Do not forget Hyjal..."]="李奥瑞克，我们经历过更可怕的局面，而且还活了下来。你还记得海加尔峰吗……"
G["We have begun to turn the Scourge's plague against them, but our hold is tenuous at best!  Be sure to aid the cause by subverting their cauldrons!"]="我们已经开始反攻亡灵天灾了，但是我们撑不了多久了！去摧毁他们的锅炉吧！"
G["We have breached the inner sanctum, heroes! We press on!"]="我们攻占了内部圣殿，勇士们！继续前进！"
G["We have but to evacuate the workers and the rest of our warriors."]="我们只需撤走工人和剩余的战士即可。"
G["We have carriages at the ready, we're just waiting for King Greymane's word."]="我们已经备好了马车，正在等待格雷迈恩国王的命令。"
G["We have come to compete for honor, renown, and the right to fight the Scourge alongside the brothers of the Argent Crusade."]="我们来到这里，为荣耀而战，为名誉而战，为获得与银色北伐军的兄弟们并肩作战的资格而战。"
G["We have come to help battle the dirge of Karabor!"]="我们来帮你对抗卡拉波的挽歌！"
G["We have confirmed the Horde presence at Dragonmaw Port, master. They are now in league."]="我们确认部落已经出现在了龙喉港，主人。他们组建了一支大军。"
G["We have disturbed what should not have been disturbed. He cannot be free to escape this prison! You must destroy him!"]="我们打扰了不该打扰的东西。决不能让他逃离这囚牢！你必须消灭他！"
G["We have done it!"]="我们成功了！"
G["We have done it!  Un'Goro is cleansed."]="我们成功了！安戈洛得到了净化。"
G["We have done it! Thrall would be proud."]="我们成功了！萨尔会为我们骄傲的。"
G["We have done it, hero! We have the blessings of the celestials, and we have completed their challenge."]="成功了，英雄！我们得到了至尊天神的祝福，完成了他们的挑战。"
G["We have endured loss, trechery, and long nights without answers… yet still the moon rises. So too must we."]="Hemos soportado pérdidas, traiciones y largas noches sin respuestas… y aun así la luna sale. Nosotros también debemos hacerlo."
G["We have endured the Usurpers, their children, the loss of the Old One, and soon... you."]="我们忍受着篡位者和他子民的行径，熬过了上古尊者的陨落，很快……就轮到你们了。"
G["We have enough supplies to launch a ground assault.  If you want to deliver those orders, and you think you qualify, then speak with Corporal Noreg Stormpike."]="我们拥有足够的物资来发动地面攻击啦。如果你认为自己够资格传达指令的话，就跟诺雷格·雷矛中尉谈谈。"
G["We have enough supplies to launch a ground assault.  If you want to send the order, and you think you qualify, then speak Sergeant Yazra Bloodsnarl."]="我们拥有足够的物资来发动地面攻击啦。如果你认为自己够资格传达指令的话，就跟亚斯拉·血矛谈谈。"
G["We have enough supplies!  Our captain has retaken position in the Field of Strife!"]="我们拥有足够的物资啦！我们的队长重新在征战平原占据了阵地！"
G["We have entered a dangerous place my luckydo. In this the saurok have grown very angry and attack all boats that pass through. We must be on our guard."]="我们已经进入了危险地带，宝贝儿。蜥蜴人在这里变得极为狂暴，会把途径此地的所有船只统统击沉。我们千万要多加小心。"
G["We have excess supplies, but not many.  We'll need a lot more before we can send a ground assault into the Field of Strife."]="我们有剩余的物资，但是不太多。我们还需要更多的物资才能发动对征战平原的地面攻击。"
G["We have failed."]="我们失败了。"
G["We have gained control of the armory, but our work on the island is not yet finished."]="我们已经夺取了军械库的控制权，但我们在岛上的工作还没有完成。"
G["We have gathered a lot of supplies for rebuilding, but we still need a lot more in order to repair Dun Baldar.  Keep bringing me supplies!"]="我们已经收集到很多用于重建的物资，但是还需要一些才能修复丹巴达尔。继续收集吧！"
G["We have gathered enough hides from the wolves. Soon, the cavalry will be ready to ride! Speak to me again when we have stabled enough rams."]="我们已经收集到足够的狼皮。很快，骑兵们就可以上马出发啦！当我们有足够的山羊时再来跟我谈谈。"
G["We have got to disable more of their defenses or we will never be able to get in! Loop around again."]="得多消灭一些防御部队，否则我们永远也进不去！再转一圈。"
G["We have half of our needed silithyst.  We can do it!"]="水晶尘的收集进度达到50%了！我们能行的！"
G["We have half our needed silithyst.  Don't stop now!"]="水晶尘的收集进度达到50%了！我们能行的！"
G["We have heard reports of mogu infiltrating this valley. They will not get beyond us."]="我们已经听说了魔古族遍布四风谷的消息。他们不会胜过我们的。"
G["We have heard your requests, and we agree... it is noble in intent. We will purify your waters. Go with our blessing, shaman."]="我们听说了你的请求，我们同意……这是件好事。我们会为你净化水的。带着我们的祝福上路吧，萨满。"
G["We have known nothing but peace for so long, I don't know how anyone is going to handle the arrival of war on our shores."]="长久以来，我们已经过惯了和平的日子，真不知道大家要怎么应对这突然降临海岸的战事。"
G["We have labored long and hard for our lord Deathwing. Let us give our all in his name that we will bask in his flames at the end of days!"]="我们已对死亡之翼大人效忠已久。让我们为他献出所有，在末日到来之时沐浴在他的烈焰之中！"
G["We have little to discuss, $c. Perhaps you should seek other, more like-minded individuals."]="我们没什么可谈的，$c。也许你应该去找和你志趣相投的人。"
G["We have lived on the bounty of the sea. We have grown fat on the meat of the antlered ones."]="我们生活在海陆交界处，尽情享受着大海的慷慨和恩赐。"
G["We have lived on this lake for thousands of years. The waters here flow down from the ancient pools of Pandaria."]="我们在这座湖泊上居住了几千年了。这里的湖水源自于潘达利亚的古老水池。"
G["We have lost Thalanaar, but not by much. We were the fortunate ones to be only at the very edge of the flooding. I cannot begin to imagine how many lives were lost. Please send as much help as you can to New Thalanaar."]="我们已经失去了萨兰纳尔，但跟许多人比起来这点损失还不算什么。我们是幸运的，洪水来袭时就处在灾区边缘。我甚至无法开始想象，有多少生命在瞬间陨落。请你尽力帮助我们建设新萨兰纳尔。"
G["We have lost our engineers, this will not end well!"]="我们的工程师挂掉了，事情好像要糟糕！"
G["We have lost so many brothers in battle, I no longer wish to keep count."]="我们在战斗中失去了许多兄弟，我已经不想再数下去了。"
G["We have lost so much, Warchief. Our families, dead. Our friends, lost. Our homeland, gone. How much more must our people suffer?"]="我们失去太多了，酋长。亲人死去，朋友离散，家园破碎。我们还要承受多少苦难？"
G["We have lots of supplies for rebuilding.  Just a little bit more and we'll have enough to repair Dun Baldar and reenter the battle!"]="我们有许多用于重建的物资了。再多一些我们就能修复丹巴达尔，重新开战啦！"
G["We have managed to defend this point, and much of it is thanks to you.\n\nYou have managed to recruit a valuable ally to our ranks, however, the enemy continues to assail us without relent.\n\nWe must hold our ground or lose what we have fought so hard to gain."]="Nos las hemos arreglado para defender esta posición, sobre todo gracias a ti. Has conseguido reclutar un aliado muy valioso para nuestras filas. Sin embargo, el enemigo sigue asaltándonos sin descanso.\n\nDebemos mantenernos firmes o perderemos lo que tanto nos ha costado ganar."
G["We have men in that wreckage! Get more men out there recovering the wounded."]="还有人在船骸里！多派些人去救出那些伤员。"
G["We have more than one enemy in Silithus, $n.\n\nWhile everyone's attention is focused on the silithid, my big brother and I have been keeping a close eye on the Twilight's Hammer crazies."]="Tenemos más de un enemigo en Silithus, $n.\n\nMientras que todo el mundo centra su atención en los silítidos, mi hermano mayor y yo hemos estado vigilando de cerca a los chiflados del Martillo Crepuscular."
G["We have much in common, night elf. I can't help but feel that perhaps it was fate that brought us together. Let me help you, Cowlen. Let my people help. We will right the wrongs. This I vow."]="看来我们有很多共同点，暗夜精灵。我对你的不幸爱莫能助，但也许是命运让我们聚到了一起。让我帮助你吧，库雷。让我的人民帮助你吧。我发誓我们会矫正自己犯下的错误。"
G["We have much to do and very little time to do it if we're to assist the Freewind Post tauren and push the Grimtotem back.\n\nTor ilisar'thera'nal! Let our enemies beware!"]="为了支援乱风岗的牛头人，击退恐怖图腾部族，我们有许多事情要做，却没有多少时间。\n\nTor ilisar'thera'nal！让我们的敌人知道恐惧！"
G["We have need of your explosives. I'll take pleasure in killing you for them."]="我们需要你的炸药。为此，我很愿意要你的命。"
G["We have no choice.  If we fail to honor the presence of the Horde, then surely they will crush us from nearby Stonard!  I'm afraid that not even you and your friends would be able to stop them."]="我们没有选择。如果我们坚持不住，他们就会把我们在斯通纳德门口彻底打垮。恐怕即便是你和你的朋友，也无法阻止他们。"
G["We have no choice.  We must have faith in our allies."]="我们没有选择，必须相信这些盟友。"
G["We have no other choice. Put down your weapon, warrior, and we will put down ours."]="我们别无选择。放下你的武器，战士，我们同样也放下武器。"
G["We have no quarrel with your people. Would you like to sample our wares?"]="我们跟你们无冤无仇。愿意挑选些货物吗？"
G["We have no smithy set up in Azure Watch. However, I've seen a few young blacksmiths coming from that odd encampment on the south coast. Perhaps you should investigate."]="在碧蓝岗哨这里，我们没有设立铁匠铺。不过，我曾看到几个年轻的铁匠从南海岸的临时营地那里过来，也许你应该去那里看看。"
G["We have no such place in the village.  The soaring heights of Thunder Bluff does though.  Head north up the road out of Bloodhoof Village until you come to the base of the bluffs.  There ride the elevator to the top and speak with a Bluffwatcher.  May your ancestors watch over you."]="村子里可没这样的地方，在高高的雷霆崖上应该有。出了血蹄村沿着北面的道路走，乘坐雷霆崖升降梯到达顶部，找那儿的守卫谈谈。愿你的祖先保佑你。"
G["We have no tailors here in Azure Watch. You might try the encampment on the beach, however - they seem to have a number of tradesmen from across the sea."]="碧蓝岗哨这边没有裁缝。不过你可以去海滩旁的营地问问，他们似乎带来了一些裁缝。"
G["We have no time to rest, $r."]="我们没时间休息了，$r。"
G["We have no time to waste, $c. Why do you delay here?"]="我们没有时间可以浪费了，$c。为什么你在这停了下来？"
G["We have not been properly introduced."]="我们还没有互相作自我介绍呢。"
G["We have not fulfilled our oath!"]="我们没能履行自己的誓言！"
G["We have not known war here for a very long time. I hope for the good of us all that we may find peace soon."]="我们已经许久没有经历过战事了。为了所有人的幸福，真希望和平能尽快到来。"
G["We have not lost hope..."]="我们还没有失去希望……"
G["We have not struggled so hard to survive, only to bring about the true destruction."]="我们竭尽全力挣扎奋斗，为的是求得生存的机会，而不是给自己带来真正的毁灭。"
G["We have nothing to fear."]="我们无所畏惧。"
G["We have one eye and see better than you!  Bank in center of Undercity!"]="我们只有一只眼睛，但看得比你远！银行就在幽暗城中心！"
G["We have one quarter of our needed silithyst! Keep it up!"]="水晶尘的收集进度达到25%了！继续努力！"
G["We have one quarter of the needed silithyst! Keep it up!"]="水晶尘的收集进度达到25%了！继续努力！"
G["We have only a small foothold on this continent for now, but the humans can't fight us off forever. Then they'll pay for enslaving us. We'll cut their lying tongues out for their treachery."]="眼下，我们在这片大陆上只有一处立足之地，但是人类是永远不可能打败我们的。他们很快就会受到报复。我们会割下他们说谎的舌头，惩戒他们的背叛行为。"
G["We have only sustained a few minor casualties. Otherwise, I would say that things are going quite well."]="我们还是遇到了一些小伤亡。除此之外，一切都相当顺利。"
G["We have our best people looking into these issues."]="我们派出了精英团队调查这些问题。"
G["We have our duties, $c.  Duties to the Horde."]="我们有自己的职责，$c。对部落应尽的职责。"
G["We have played our part, and done well at that. It is up to the others now."]="我们完成了自己的使命，现在就看其他人了。"
G["We have pledged to open an elemental gateway from Stormwind to the Highlands, but interference from the Bastion of Twilight hampers our efforts.\n\nWhat madness are they engaged in over there?"]="我们已经做出保证，要打开一个从暴风城前往高地的元素通道。但暮光堡垒的干扰让我们无法成功。\n\n他们到底在那里发什么疯？"
G["We have quite the feast for you friend."]="朋友，我们为你准备了一顿美餐。"
G["We have reinforcements! For the Stonefather!"]="援军来了！为了国王而战！"
G["We have reports from a scout in the field that one of the Cenarion druids has been taken captive up at Firewing Point."]="我们得到情报说，有个塞纳里奥的德鲁伊在火翼岗哨被俘虏了。"
G["We have secured the Hunter's Rise! All invaders have been repelled and the evacuation has been completed!"]="我们守住了猎人高地！入侵者已经被彻底击退，撤退完成了！"
G["We have secured the Mage District! All invaders have been repelled and the evacuation has been completed!"]="我们守住了法师区！所有入侵者都已被击退，撤离也已顺利完成！"
G["We have seeded darkmoon cards around the world to see if any worthy individuals could complete a set of any of the eight suits.  If you manage to collect all eight cards of one of the suits we will reward you with one of the greater darkmoon cards that functions as a powerful trinket as well as a link to the Darkmoon Faire."]="我们在世界各地散发暗月卡片，看看有没有谁能集齐八套暗月卡片中的任何一套。若你设法集齐一套八张的卡片，我们就会奖励你一张强力暗月卡片，它不仅是强大的饰品，也可以作为暗月马戏团的纪念。"
G["We have slain the sea-witches and our god shall slay their queen!"]="我们杀掉了那些海巫，而我们膜拜的神自然会杀死她们的女王！"
G["We have some supplies, but not many.  We'll need a lot more in order to send a ground assault into the Field of Strife."]="我们有一些物资，但是现在有很多啦。我们还需要一些来发动对征战平原的地面攻击。"
G["We have some uninvited guests.... [PH]"]="Tenemos unos invitados sorpresa... [PH]"
G["We have spent generations perfecting just the right leaves for silkworm food."]="我们祖祖辈辈都致力于改良桑叶，希望能培育出最适合蚕虫的食物。"
G["We have suffered a major setback, but we must see our mission through nevertheless."]="我们经受了一次不小的挫折，但我们无论如何都要完成任务。"
G["We have suffered a tragic defeat."]="我们遭受了惨重的失败。"
G["We have swept the wreckage for days, Your Majesty. There is no sign of Admiral Taylor or his ships."]="我们已经清理残骸好几天了，陛下。没有找到与海军上将泰勒或他舰船有关的任何线索。"
G["We have sworn to serve, intruder. And so shall you."]="我们已经立下效忠的誓言，入侵者。你也必须一样。"
G["We have taken too long. Terokk reigns victorious."]="我们动作太慢了，泰罗克胜利了。"
G["We have the purified ashes of Vordrassil's sapling.  If we can subdue Ursoc, we might be able to heal his soul."]="我们已经净化了沃达希尔的树苗。如果能制伏乌索克，我们或许能治愈他的灵魂。"
G["We have the situation under control."]="情况在我们的掌控之中。"
G["We have them cornered inside the temple. We should strike now!"]="我们把他们堵在了寺院里。应该立刻进攻！"
G["We have to be in position to strike against Crushcog when the mountaineers arrive."]="当巡山人抵达时，我们必须做好对付碎轮的准备。"
G["We have to break through those mindless leper gnomes if we want to get out of here alive!"]="如果我们要活着离开这里，就必须从这群无意识的麻疯侏儒中间冲过去！"
G["We have to deal with these stone troggs first. Then hand me the reagents."]="我们必须先击退这些石头穴居人。然后再把那些试剂给我。"
G["We have to get off the island! Quick, Greely, grab the schematics! And my toothbrush!"]="我们必须离开这座岛！赶快，格瑞里，拿上那些图纸！还有我的牙刷！"
G["We have to get out of here! The howling gets louder every night."]="我们必须离开这里！嚎叫声每晚都在变得更大。"
G["We have to get out of here."]="我们必须离开这里。"
G["We have to keep moving; are you ready?"]="Tenemos que seguir adelante, ¿estás $gpreparado:preparada;?"
G["We have to keep those fungal terrors off of the front. They're too powerful!"]="我们必须让那些真菌恶魔远离前线。它们太强大了！"
G["We have to kill more trolls!  Kill enough and I'll blow the door to the troll chief!"]="我们要杀掉更多的巨魔！杀了足够的巨魔，我就炸开巨魔酋长的门！"
G["We have to make our way to the coffer without tipping off Schnottz and his boys."]="我们必须拿到那个箱子，同时又不能惊动司克诺兹和他的手下。"
G["We have to push forward if we're to put an end to him. Follow me, I'll open the courtyard so that you can spearhead our assault."]="如果我们要干掉他，就必须全力向前推进。跟着我，我会打开院子的大门，让你们可以展开全面突击。"
G["We have to reach the Aspects, are you ready?"]="我们要去见守护巨龙了，你准备好了吗？"
G["We have to rescue everyone and get out of here before the volcano explodes for real!"]="我们必须在火山真正爆发之前救出所有人，并离开这里！"
G["We have to stop the naga and save Zangarmarsh while we still can!"]="我们必须尽快阻止纳迦，拯救赞加沼泽，否则就太迟了！"
G["We have traveled far to celebrate the hero of the draenei people."]="我们远道而来，是为了感谢德莱尼人的英雄。"
G["We have travelled a long way from the Jade Forest to be here today. It is my hope I will grow my skills in this tournament."]="我们从翡翠林出发，历尽跋涉才在今天抵达这里。我希望能在这次比赛中提升自己的技能。"
G["We have two auction houses within Silvermoon. Which would you prefer?"]="我们的银月城有两座拍卖行，你喜欢哪个？"
G["We have used bows since before even my father's time. They are solid and sure and take down our foes swiftly. I see no reason to use the guns that the goblins and tauren seem so fond of."]="我们很早以前就开始使用弓箭了。它们坚实可靠，能迅速杀死敌人。我不认为我们该使用地精和牛头人们爱不释手的火枪。"
G["We have very little information on this timeway. Sa'at has been dispatched and is currently inside. The data we have gathered from his correspondence is that the Infinite Dragonflight are once again attempting to alter time. Could it be that the opening of the Dark Portal is being targeted for sabotage? Let us hope not..."]="关于这个时间流，我们只得到了很少的一点情报。萨艾特已经被派遣进去了。从和他的通信中，我们获知的情报是永恒之龙再次尝试改变时间。很可能他们的目标是破坏黑暗之门的开启？希望不是这样……"
G["We have waited forever for this day to come!"]="我们等这个日子已经很久了！"
G["We have what we need from the meddlesome Loremaster."]="我们已经从那好管闲事的游学者身上得到需要的东西了。"
G["We have withdrawn from life in the city to await our fates here, where the truth has been revealed to us."]="我们远离这座城市中的生活，在这里等待我们的命运，倾心领受最真实的真相。"
G["We have witnessed your \"help\" in the Jade Forest. This \"Horde,\" this \"Alliance\" of yours - you have no control over your own nature. You leave misery in your wake."]="Hemos presenciado vuestra \"ayuda\" en El Bosque de Jade. \"Horda\" y \"Alianza\"... No controláis vuestra propia naturaleza. La desgracia os persigue."
G["We have won $2219W battles against the Scourge.  Gird yourself, $n, for this war is far from over."]="我们已经赢得了$2219W场对天灾军团战役的胜利。要有心理准备，$n！战争还远未结束。"
G["We have won $2219W battles against the Scourge.  Stand firm, $n!  We must persevere!"]="我们已经赢得了$2219W场对天灾军团战役的胜利。坚持住，$n！我们一定能活下来的！"
G["We have won $2219W battles against the Scourge.  Take heart, $n.  While many battles lie ahead, heroes, heroes from every realm have risen to fight them."]="我们已经赢得了$2219W场对天灾军团战役的胜利。努力，$n！还有几百场战斗等待着我们，各地的英雄们会来支援我们，与天灾作战。"
G["We have won valuable time. Now we must pull back."]="我们赢得了宝贵的时间。现在必须撤退。"
G["We have yet to meet our quota for the wood demand.  Now back to work with you."]="我们还要努力去满足木材需求量。回去做你自己的工作吧。"
G["We have... more important matters to attend to than you. Go away, scum."]="我们……还有更重要的事情要做，没空来应付你。滚开，废物。"
G["We haven't got much time. Crowley will be arriving shortly. Let's go!"]="我们没有多少时间了。克罗雷马上就要到了。开始吧！"
G["We haven't much time, friends! You're going to help me test out my latest and greatest creation. Now, before you change your minds, remember that you kind of owe it to me after the mess you made with the XT-002."]="我们时间不多了，朋友们！来帮忙测试一下我所发明的最新型、最强大的机体吧。在你们改变主意之前，请允许我提醒一下，你们把XT-002搞得一团糟，应该算是欠我个人情吧。"
G["We hear so many conflicting stories about what's happening just out of sight. Tell me, $n, is it as bad as it sounds?"]="关于在远方发生的一切，我们听说了各种互相矛盾的说法。告诉我，$n，事情真像传闻说的那样严重吗？"
G["We hear that the dragons tremble in fear at the mere mention of $n."]="听说只要提起$n的名字，就算是龙也会因为恐惧而战栗。"
G["We heard that $n figured out how to use the apexis relics and monuments!"]="听说$n知道如何使用埃匹希斯圣物和纪念碑！"
G["We heard that $n single-handedly took out a forge camp!"]="听说$n单枪匹马地捣毁了一处铸魔营地！"
G["We held our place here as long as we could, but it still wasn't enough."]="我们尽可能地守在这里，可还是不够。"
G["We help you find them."]="我们帮助你找到他们。"
G["We here! Only, if this is world tree, how come it broke when they tried to put whole world in?"]="我们到了！如果这是世界之树，那他们把整个世界放进这里的时候，它不会被撑破吗？"
G["We hold dis place wid our lives mon!"]="我们誓死保卫家园！"
G["We hold the surface, and when the radiation clears we'll assault and recapture Gnomeregan with a force twice this size."]="我们控制了地面，等到辐射被清除干净，我们就会以更加强大的攻势彻底占领诺莫瑞根。"
G["We honor them by putting them to war against one another."]="让他们彼此争斗，才能显示出我们对他们的敬意。"
G["We hope guide gets here soon."]="但愿这个向导能早点到。"
G["We hope you'll be able to ease our headaches.  You try having ten sons, all of them wanting to do something they weren't meant for!\n\nStill, as a father, we do what we must."]="希望你能帮我们解决这件麻烦事。试想一下，如果你有10个儿子，他们都想尝试去做那些自己力所不能及的事，你该怎么办？\n\n尽管如此，我们却必须尽到做父亲的职责。"
G["We hope you're staying for a while, $n.  Stop by later and we'll catch up on old times."]="我们希望你能多待一会儿，$n。经常过来看看，让我们一起怀念过去的时光。"
G["We humbly entrust our fallen brothers and sisters into the Light.  In this life you embraced them with your tender love; deliver them now from every evil and bid them enter eternal rest."]="我们恭敬地将堕落的兄弟姐妹们托付给圣光。此生，用你的款款爱意拥抱他们，保护他们远离邪恶的侵袭，让他们永远地安息吧。"
G["We hunger for vengeance."]="我们渴望复仇。"
G["We is good."]="我们没问题。"
G["We jinyu do not cower in fear of defeat. Neither do we fight simply for victory."]="我们锦鱼人并不畏惧战斗。但我们也不仅是为胜利而战。"
G["We join guild?  No?  Ok, you find Guild Master on east platform in Trade Quarter."]="我们加入公会了？没有？好吧，去贸易区的东平台找公会注册员吧。"
G["We just couldn't do it the quiet way!"]="我们就是不能安静地搞定它！"
G["We just lost a plane!"]="我们只损失了一架飞机！"
G["We just might win this!"]="我们赢定了！"
G["We just mix these two together..."]="我们只需把这两个混在一起……"
G["We just need to knock the centrifugal rotary ball clutch back into alignment. Easy!"]="我们只需要把离心球敲回去就行了，简单！"
G["We just need to stand together. You have to trust me. Know that I will do the right thing. If we act as one, we cannot fail."]="我们必须团结一致。你要相信我，并且认同我。只要我们齐心协力，就一定会赢。"
G["We just need to stay focused on our mission so we can get out of here in one piece."]="我们只要专心执行任务就好，肯定能够全身而退的。"
G["We just rested a few minutes ago!  Let's just go to Light's Hope Chapel!"]="我们在几分钟前刚刚休息过！还是赶紧去圣光之愿礼拜堂吧！"
G["We just wait for guide."]="我们得等向导。"
G["We keep waiting then..."]="那我们就接着等……"
G["We keep waiting."]="我们一直在等。"
G["We kept goin' south, until Shokia started whinin' about somethin'."]="我们一直往南走，直到夏琪亚开始感觉不对劲了。"
G["We kidnap and ravage and rage by moonlight, drink up me 'earties, aaaa-ooo!"]="我们借着月光去劫掠，去破坏，去席卷，干杯吧水手们，啊啊啊啊——噢噢噢！"
G["We kill 'em good, mon."]="消灭他们，伙计们！"
G["We kill his friend!"]="我们杀了他的朋友吧！"
G["We kill someone else!"]="我们先杀别人吧！"
G["We kill them and we take their stuffs..."]="我们干掉他们之后，夺走他们的东西……"
G["We kin make it back to camp on our own. Come talk to meh later if ya fancy borrowin' a gryphon."]="我们自己能回到营地去。回头如果你想借狮鹫的话就来找我吧。"
G["We knew you could do it!"]="我就知道你会做到的！"
G["We knocked something loose with that last one."]="我们好像把什么东西给撞松了。"
G["We know all about you, and the perfume, and the rose petals.  Watch it!"]="我们全都认识你，还有这种香气和玫瑰花瓣。它多漂亮啊！"
G["We know hunger never to be quenched..."]="我们渴望着鲜血的洗礼……"
G["We know now that the mogu share their roots with the Titans. But many mysteries remain. Why were they here? Why Pandaria?"]="我们已经知道魔古族源自泰坦。可还有许多谜团。他们为何来此？为何来到潘达利亚？"
G["We know only despair now. A fitting punishment for our failure...."]="我们满心绝望。这是失败者应得的惩罚。"
G["We know power never to be overcome..."]="我们拥有敌人永远无法战胜的力量……"
G["We know some of the truth. Now we must uncover the rest!"]="我们对真相有了一定程度的了解。接下来要彻底揭露真相了！"
G["We know that he purged his doubts in the Jade Forest. That he cleansed himself of despair in the Krasarang Wilds. That he overcame his fear in Townlong Steppes. And that he defeated anger, hatred, and violence high in the mountains of Kun-Lai."]="我们知道，他在翡翠林中荡除了自己的疑虑，在卡桑琅丛林里消除了自己的绝望，在螳螂高原上战胜了自己的恐惧，在昆莱山的巅峰击败了自己的愤怒、仇恨和暴力。"
G["We know that the wyrmcultists are massing on the other side of the tunnel.  We'll make our stand here."]="狂热的黑龙崇拜者现在就聚集在龙颅小径的另一头。我们要与他们抗衡。"
G["We know you have dragon thing! We not scared! We going to get you and dragon thing!"]="我们知道你们有龙！但我们不怕！我们要将你们统统打扁！"
G["We know you were getting ready to attack us. You brought this on yourselves."]="我们知道，你们正准备攻击我们。这一切都是你们造成的。"
G["We know you, Cairne Bloodhoof, and your people have told us of your deeds. You are welcome at the hearth of the ancestors."]="我们熟知您，凯恩·血蹄。您的族人告诉了我们你的英勇事迹，而我们欢迎你进入祖先的归宿。"
G["We know, cap'n.  We know."]="我们明白，头儿。我们明白。"
G["We know... that you don't... know why we're immune... to your so-called blight. Grand Admiral Westwind somehow gave the high abbot that prayer. I beg you... no more... please?!"]="我们知道……你们无法理解……为什么我们……对所谓的病菌免疫。海军上将巴利·韦斯温似乎向高阶修士传授了什么祷言。啊啊，求你了……住手……好吗？！"
G["We leave, then, Torlok. I have only one request..."]="那么我们走了，托洛克。我只有一个要求……"
G["We let you stay here too long."]="我们让你待得太久了。"
G["We like to make sure that faire goers of all ages can enjoy the games.\n\nRing Toss is a simple game where you try to land a ring on the back of a moving turtle.\n\nIt's one of my favorite games to play."]="我们希望各个年龄层的游客都能享受到游戏乐趣。\n\n套圈圈是一个简单的游戏，你只要设法把投环扔到一只不断移动的海龟背上就可以了。\n\n这也是我最喜欢的游戏之一。"
G["We live and die, and the land remains, eternal, unmoved by our passage. Thus, land cannot belong to us, $n. Instead, we belong to it. Therefore we protect the land, for without it we cannot hope to survive."]="我们在此繁衍生息，生生死死，数年来大地却亘古不动。因此，这片土地并不属于我们，$n。我们是属于大地的。因此，我们守护着它，没有它我们就无法生存。"
G["We live in a world of endless tragedy."]="我们生活在无尽的悲剧中。"
G["We live on the back of a big turtle?!"]="我们住在一只巨龟的背上？！"
G["We live only to serve the ancient one. DIE INTERLOPER!"]="我们活着只是为了效忠上古之神。去死吧，入侵者！"
G["We live or die in THEIR service!"]="无论生死，我们都将效忠他们！"
G["We live to fight another day, $r."]="我们会卷土重来，$r。"
G["We live together, or we die together. All of Pandaria is connected."]="我们将同生共死，潘达利亚的所有生灵与我们同在。"
G["We live, we fight, we die. The tricky part is finding a reason to do each of those."]="我们为战而生、至死方休。而要诠释生存，战斗和死亡的意义，却并非易事。"
G["We lived under the same waves, breathed the same water, and worshipped the same god.  Why, then, would the naga turn against us?"]="我们生活在同一片海浪中，吞吐着同一片海水，膜拜着同一位神灵。那究竟是为什么——纳迦要与我们反目为敌？"
G["We look for the evil ones now, yes?"]="我们在找坏人，是吧？"
G["We lose that island to the Horde and Stormwind's as good as gone... and they know it."]="要是那座岛落到部落的手里，暴风城就保不住了……他们都明白。"
G["We lost a lot a good people today, laddy. The Lich King is gonna pay for all the lives he's ruined!"]="今天，我们失去了一批优秀的战士。巫妖王要为这场血腥的杀戮付出代价！"
G["We lost everything, brother.  We thank Kamagua for giving us shelter."]="兄弟，我们已经失去了一切。幸运的是，卡玛古为我们提供了容身之所。"
G["We lost many of our kin in the war... so yes, the city is not perhaps as lively as it once was. We will endure, however."]="我们在战争中失去了很多同胞……所以，这座城市也许已经不像以前那样充满了活力。不管怎样，我们都会忍耐。"
G["We lost many to the faceless ones, my lord.  But we succeeded in retrieving the heart from Naz'anak."]="大人，虽然我们在与无面者战斗的过程中损失了不少人手，但是我们成功地从纳扎纳克夺回了徽记。"
G["We lost our home to the yaungol. But this place... this place offers us a new beginning."]="野牛人侵占了我们的家园！但这个地方……这个地方为我们提供一个新的开始。"
G["We lost this time but don't let it get you down. Concentrate on your special attacks. Keep your shield high and close. Do this and next time victory will be ours!"]="我们这次输了，但大家不要气馁。专心攻击，把盾牌举高点，然后慢慢靠近对手。这样我们下次就可以取得胜利！"
G["We made a new friend!"]="我们有了一个新朋友！"
G["We made camp in the mountains. Little Lu watched over Rell."]="我们在山里扎营。小卢照看利尔。"
G["We made it out alive! Boy oh boy, wait until my friends hear all about this. They'll never believe it! See you later, $n!"]="我们成功了！儿子啊儿子，等到我的朋友们全都知晓这件事。他们永远也不会相信它！再见，$n！"
G["We made it past enemy lines - looked like it was gunna be smooth sailin' all the way."]="我们通过了敌人的阵线——似乎会顺风顺水地一路航行下去。"
G["We made it through the pass!  Now we have the swamp..."]="我们通过了关口！现在是沼泽地……"
G["We made it to Nethergarde!"]="我们终于到守望堡了！"
G["We made it to the top!"]="我们成功登顶了！"
G["We made it!"]="我们成功了！"
G["We made it!  Thanks again!  I'm going to run ahead!"]="我们成功了！再次感谢你！我先走了！"
G["We made it!  Thanks, $n.  I couldn't have gotten here without you."]="我们终于到了！谢谢你，$n。没有你我是找不到这里的。"
G["We made it! I'll find my way back on my own. Do me a favor and go tell Royce Duskwhisper where he can stick his stupid Eye of Twilight."]="我们成功了！我能自己找到回去的路。帮我个忙，告诉罗伊斯·暮语该把那要命的暮光之眼放到哪儿。"
G["We made it! Quae, we made it!"]="我们成功了！奎艾，我们成功了！"
G["We made it! Take care, $n, and thanks again!"]="成功啦！保重，$n。再次对你表示感谢！"
G["We made it! Thank you for getting me out of that hell hole. Tell Hemet to expect me!"]="成功啦！谢谢你带我逃离那个地狱般的洞穴。告诉赫米特，让他等着我！"
G["We made it! We actually made it!"]="我们成功了！我们真的成功了！"
G["We made it!!"]="我们成功了！！"
G["We made it, my friend. Remember to find Terenthis and let him know we're safe. Thank you again."]="Lo logramos, $gamigo mío:amiga mía;. No olvides buscar a Terenthis y hacerle saber que estamos a salvo. Gracias de nuevo."
G["We made our home in this desert, and named it after my father Durotan, Chieftain of the Frostwolf Clan."]="我们在这片沙漠上建起了自己的家园，用我父亲霜狼氏族酋长杜隆坦的名字命名了它。"
G["We make a great team!"]="我们真是合作无间啊！"
G["We make our stand here!"]="我们要守住这里！"
G["We managed to earn the Celestials' trust and open the Vale, but we must continue to show them that we are on a mission of peace."]="我们设法赢得了天神的信任，打开了山谷的大门，可我们必须继续向他们表明，我们肩负着和平的使命。"
G["We managed to get up a few new makeshift buildings for the refugees. It's not pretty, but it'll hold. And it'll be a hell of a lot better than the bandit-infested fields they came from."]="Logramos construir unos cuantos edificios improvisados para los refugiados. No es bonito, pero servirá. Y será un mundo mejor que los campos infestados de bandidos de donde vinieron."
G["We mantid are an elder race. The pandaren you associate with - they are but children. They have their role to play."]="我们螳螂妖是个古老的种族。你结识的熊猫人——不过是孩童。他们有自己要扮演的角色。"
G["We may be few, Socrethar, but our faith is strong.  Something you will never understand.  Now that custom has been served, prepare to meet your end."]="我们也许势单力薄，索克雷萨，但是我们有着强大的信念。有些东西你是永远都不会懂的。现在机会已经给过你了，准备迎接你的末日吧！"
G["We may be surrounded by all sorts of nasties here, but at least we're out over the open water.\n\nThat won't protect us from whatever it was that I saw fly over last night, though. It was big... I mean, really big!"]="我们在这儿可能会遇到各种各样的麻烦，但至少我们已经进入开放水域了。\n\n虽然我们不一定能逃过昨晚从我头顶飞过的那大家伙。那玩意儿可真大……我是说，真的很大！"
G["We may be working together, but that only increases the need for discretion. Once again, be mindful of your words and actions.\n\nI can guarantee we're far from the only ones out here."]="我们也许可以一起工作，但那只是为了增加判断力。再说一次，注意你的言行。\n\n我敢保证，周围还有别的人。"
G["We may have been suffering a drought but there's no shortage of meat! Care to browse my goods?"]="我们可能遇到了旱季，但是供给并不缺乏！想看看我的货物吗？"
G["We may have to improvise. Make friends with the locals - whatever it takes to secure a beach-head."]="我们得随机应变。与当地人交朋友——无论如何也要抢占摊头。"
G["We may have to retreat into the Valley of the Four Winds. I don't want to give up my home here."]="我们也许得撤退到四风谷。可我不想放弃这里的家园。"
G["We may learn much from this specimen..."]="我们能从这份血样中学到很多东西……"
G["We may not be warriors by trade, but we will do anything to save our home and our land."]="我们也许不是正牌的战士，可我们会不惜一切代价守护自己的家园和土地。"
G["We may not trust the Alliance, but we need their help if we are to take back the Horde."]="我们或许不该相信联盟，但要想夺回部落，我们就需要他们的帮助。"
G["We may operate in the shadows of polite society, but out here on the battlefront our powers are properly respected at last."]="我们也许只能在上流社会的阴影中做着默默无闻的事情。只有离开这里，在战争的最前线，我们的力量才能得到应有的尊重。"
G["We meet again, stranger from beyond the mists."]="又见面了，迷雾之外的陌生人。"
G["We meet again, time traveller!"]="我们又见面了，时间的旅者！"
G["We meet again. You havin' a good day now?"]="我们又见面了。你今天过得好吗？"
G["We might be able to win this."]="我们也许能赢。"
G["We mortal races know so little of Aessina, the spirit of the wilderness who lurks in dense untamed woods. She is the soul of the forest, its beating heart, the source of life energy that breaks down stone, devours ancient ruins, and fills dense thickets with mystery and fear. Aessina is the center of the web of life.\n\nThe night elves have built shrines to her throughout Kalimdor. She is revered, yes... But not understood.\n\nWhat would it be like, do you think, to get even a glimpse of this reclusive, powerful ancient?"]="我们凡间种族对艾森娜知之甚少，她是在茂密的野性丛林中潜行的荒野之魂。她是森林之灵，是它跃动的心脉，是粉碎岩石、吞噬遗迹、将茂密的丛林用神秘与恐惧灌注的生命能量之源。艾森娜是生命之网的中心。\n\n暗夜精灵在卡利姆多各地都为她修建了圣殿。人们崇敬她……可并不了解她。\n\n你觉得要是我们能对这避世而强大的远古半神有少许了解，那会怎么样呢？"
G["We most definitely do not need anymore attention drawn to us, stranger. Return to those that sent you in search of the lost master and tell them that nothing could be found. When this is done - and I will know when it is so - return and I shall reveal the secrets of the deceased."]="Definitivamente, no necesitamos llamar más la atención, $gforastero:forastera;. Vuelve a ver a quienes te enviaron a buscar al maestro perdido y diles que no has logrado encontrar nada. Cuando lo hayas hecho, y sabré cuándo lo has hecho, ven a verme y te revelaré los secretos de los fallecidos."
G["We murder every turnip!"]="我们要把所有的芜菁都消灭掉，一个都不剩！"
G["We must act quickly or all shall be lost!"]="我们必须赶快，否则就一切都太晚了！"
G["We must avenge our mother!\nDistract the monster who slew her, free us from this cage, and we will fight by your side.\nOur ability to reduce the damage an enemy inflicts will help you survive the Proto-Behemoth's Scorching Breath."]="¡Debemos vengar a nuestra madre!\n\nDistrae al monstruo que la mató, libéranos de esta jaula y lucharemos a tu lado.\n\nNuestra capacidad de reducir el daño que inflige un enemigo te ayudará a sobrevivir el Aliento agostador del protobehemoth."
G["We must avoid another war with the Horde at all costs!"]="不论付出怎样的代价，我们都会避免再次与部落开战！"
G["We must be close, Commander. I can feel the elements stirring."]="指挥官，我们必须靠拢点。我能感觉到那些元素正在骚动。"
G["We must be prepared for the next assualt!  The Betrayer will be destroyed!"]="我们必须准备好下一次进攻！！背叛者必将被消灭！"
G["We must be very quiet. The Slitherscale will not hesitate to eat us for dinner."]="我们务必要保持安静。否则那些滑鳞蜥蜴人会毫不犹豫地把我们当晚餐吃了。"
G["We must be vigilant to eradicate this plague!"]="我们必须时刻警惕才能消除这场灾难！"
G["We must bide our time.  They won't know what hit them."]="我们必须等待时机。他们不会知道是谁袭击了他们。"
G["We must break the siege!"]="我们必须打破敌人的围攻！"
G["We must break through - where are my explosives?"]="我们必须冲破这里——我的炸药呢？"
G["We must carry on with or without Maiev.  Inside!  Quickly!"]="无论玛维是不是和我们在一起，我们都必须继续。进去！快点！"
G["We must confer with the leaders of the Horde and the Alliance.  Ragnaros must be defeated in his home realm.  Only then will he forever be vanquished."]="我们必须与联盟和部落的领袖谈一谈。一定要在拉格纳罗斯的老巢将其击败。那样，才能将他彻底征服。"
G["We must consume his flesh, for he is weak! The cycle must continue!"]="我们必须吞噬他的血肉，因为他是弱者！轮回必将继续！"
G["We must contain the arcane power we have unleashed!"]="我们必须控制住被我们释放出来的奥术能量。"
G["We must contain the disease the naga have unleashed here before it is too late!"]="我们必须控制住纳迦散播到这里的疾病，否则就太迟了！"
G["We must continue on now."]="我们必须继续前进。"
G["We must continue to hold on for as long as we can! Fight on!"]="我们必须继续守住这里，越久越好！战斗到底！"
G["We must defeat these satyr, $n. We will not suffer the Legion's presence in these lands."]="我们必须消灭这些萨特，$n。我们不能让燃烧军团出现在这片土地上。"
G["We must defend the Sunwell from the enemy at all costs."]="无论如何我们都要守住太阳之井。"
G["We must defend the pools from their corruption!"]="我们必须保卫池塘不受污染！"
G["We must defend the villagers! I will take the front gates, the rest of you spread out and don't let any yaungol get past you!"]="我们必须保护村民！我来把守前门，你们其他人分散开，别放任何野牛人过去！"
G["We must destroys it."]="我们必须消灭它。"
G["We must discover what's behind the mystery of the giant crystal that fell from the heavens on Fallen Sky Ridge."]="那些从天上滑落到坠星山的巨型水晶，隐藏着我们必须解读的迷团。"
G["We must dispatch another watcher. Balance must be maintained..."]="我们必须派出另一个观察者。必须维持平衡……"
G["We must dissipate this power before it is noticed by elf or demon."]="我们必须在精灵或魔鬼注意到这股能量之前让它消散。"
G["We must do everything in our power to stop the same from happening here. We'll have to step up our investigations of the oases and stop this phenomenon at the source. We'll talk again at Crossroads!"]="我们必须竭尽全力阻止这种事情在这里发生。所以我们对绿洲的调查要进一步升级，从源头阻止这一现象。我们会在十字路口再谈谈！"
G["We must do everything we can to protect the shrines and temples of my people."]="我们必须竭尽全力保护我族人的圣地和寺院。"
G["We must do more than hold the tree, $r. The Horde will never give up.\n\nWe must destroy them!"]="$r，我们的任务绝不止于守卫这棵树。部落不会善罢甘休。\n\n我们必须消灭他们！"
G["We must do whatever it takes to recombine the fragments of the World Pillar.\n\nBut first, we must regain all of them."]="我们必须不惜一切代价将世界之柱碎片重新拼合在一起。\n\n但首先，我们得先找齐它们。"
G["We must drive the yaungol back to the Townlong Steppes."]="我们必须把野牛人赶回螳螂高原。"
G["We must eliminate the elves and their cowardly Alliance from Warsong Gulch. Go to the Hall of the Brave in the Valley of Honor and speak with Brakgul Deathbringer if you have what it takes to aid the Horde."]="战场军官"
G["We must endure these trying times faithfully, and one day we will find ourselves victorious."]="我们必须忍耐这些痛苦的时期，总有一天我们会找到属于自己的胜利。"
G["We must endure."]="我们必须坚持！"
G["We must enjoy this time together before yet more conflict arrives on our doorsteps."]="在更多冲突降临之前，我们一定要好好享受这段团聚的时光。"
G["We must ensure that you are up to the task... and then equip you accordingly."]="我们必须确定你能够执行这项任务……并把你武装起来。"
G["We must ensure the survival of this camp at all costs, $c!  Our enemies must not be given any quarter, for they would surely give us none were we to need it."]="我们必须不惜一切代价保护这个营地的安全，$c！我们不能允许敌人再前进一步了！"
G["We must fight those who would threaten our flesh, who would kill our children; we must look to our own."]="我们必须勇敢地战斗，否则敌人将会屠杀我们的孩子，彻底抹去海象人氏族存在过的痕迹。我们必须凭借自己的力量拯救整个氏族。"
G["We must find a way to strip our enemies of their power. Without their strength, we can easily overcome them with our will."]="我们必须设法剥夺敌人的力量，没有了力量，我们就能随心所欲地轻松战胜他们了。"
G["We must find out. Without the Shado-Pan, Pandaria will surely be engulfed in darkness..."]="我们必须查明原因。如果没有影踪派，潘达利亚一定会被黑暗吞噬……"
G["We must find your allies and discover the naga motives in this region.\n\nBut first, we must find a more secure location."]="我们必须集结你的同伴，探明纳迦在这里的真正目的。\n\n不过首先，我们得先找个更为安全的地方。"
G["We must first craft a prison to confine the beast, if you wish to progress further."]="要是你还想继续前进的话，我们必须首先找人对付野兽。"
G["We must focus if we are to spawn our dragonflight!"]="如果要孵化出我们的龙的话，我们必须集中精力！"
G["We must focus on creating a base of operations. Once we have secured our position, then we can spare resources to find a way back home."]="我们必须先集中力量建立一个基地。等我们在这里站稳脚跟后，就能抽出人手来寻找回家的方法了。"
G["We must focus our thoughts upon the Circle of Calling if the Forest Lord is to come! We must hurry! Concentrate your energies!"]="如果森林之王要来，我们必须集中思想于召唤法阵！我们需要赶紧！集中精力！"
G["We must gain a foothold here.. away from these Horde dogs."]="我们得在这儿站稳脚跟……远离这些部落恶狗。"
G["We must get all of this fel reaver tech out of here before the Stormspire comes down on us!"]="我们必须在风暴尖塔的人教训我们之前拿到所有的魔能机甲技术，然后离开这里。"
G["We must get the parts Driz wants. THE REST IS OURS!"]="我们必须找到德利兹要的部分。剩下的归我们！"
G["We must get you back to the monastery."]="我们得送你回禅院。"
G["We must go and gather with the other Disciples. There is much work to be done before I can make another attempt to restore the Barrens. Farewell, brave souls!"]="我们必须去和其他的信徒会合。在我重建贫瘠之地前，有许多工作要做。再见，勇敢的灵魂！"
G["We must go, we are not done yet."]="我们得走了，还有更多事情要做。"
G["We must halt their advance! Take your positions!"]="给我顶住！坚守你们的阵地！"
G["We must hold fast. If Northwatch falls, there is nothing to our backs but the sea!"]="我们必须坚守阵地。如果北方城堡失守，我们就只能背水一战了！"
G["We must hold off the enemy for just a while longer.  In mere moments, Cenarius will walk among us."]="我们必须把敌人拖得更久一点。用不了多久，塞纳留斯就会回到我们中间。"
G["We must hold out a little longer, just until reinforcements arrive."]="我们必须坚持住，援军马上就要到了。"
G["We must hold strong!"]="我们不能退缩！"
G["We must hold the gate. Attack! Tear them limb from limb!"]="我们必须守住大门。进攻！将他们撕成碎片！"
G["We must hurry and speak with your Earthen Ring friend."]="我们必须抓紧时间并与你大地之环的朋友交谈。"
G["We must hurry!"]="我们必须赶快！"
G["We must hurry! Do something, shaman!"]="大家抓紧！萨满，赶快行动！"
G["We must hurry, $n. Malygos' ruinous plans will soon be irreversible."]="$n，我们必须尽快阻止玛里苟斯。否则他的阴谋一旦得逞，就会产生毁灭性的后果。"
G["We must hurry, now. I sense that my time is short."]="我们必须加快速度。我感觉到我的时间已经不多了。"
G["We must hurry."]="我们必须快点。"
G["We must keep Therazane's forces from attacking Stonehearth.\n\nIf they do, they will steal the middle fragment of the World Pillar."]="我们必须阻止塞拉赞恩的军队进攻巨石之炉。\n\n否则他们就有可能偷走世界之柱的中部残片。"
G["We must keep the guards here to protect the refugees."]="我们必须让守卫留在这里以保护难民。"
G["We must leave before more are alerted."]="我们必须赶紧离开，免得碰到更多人。"
G["We must let no Horde escape this place. Any ideas?"]="我们不能让任何部落成员逃离这个地方。有什么好主意吗？"
G["We must maintain a state of vigilance, $c! Between Dar'Khan the Betrayer and his Scourge, and the Shadowpine trolls backed by the might of Zul'Aman, we're barely keeping our heads above water here. We really shouldn't have to be dividing our attentions!\n\nI hope you're here to help."]="我们必须保持警戒的状态，$c！在背叛者达尔坎的天灾部队和祖阿曼的暗松巨魔的夹击下，我们几乎喘不过气来。我们真的不该分散注意力！\n\n我希望你是来这里帮忙的。"
G["We must maintain the balance!"]="我们必须维护平衡！"
G["We must make haste! The elementals cannot endure this siege."]="我们必须快点！元素无法抵挡这样的攻击。"
G["We must make our way to the crater!"]="我们必须到裂口那里去！"
G["We must make sure not to lose any more souls to the seas."]="我们必须确保不会再有谁葬身大海。"
G["We must move quickly. Auberdine isn't too far away, but many enemies lurk in the forest."]="我们必须赶快行动。奥伯丁离这里不远，但是有很多敌人潜伏在森林里。"
G["We must never give in to despair."]="我们决不能向绝望低头。"
G["We must not allow an inch to our enemy.  If they strike in Darkshore we will fight them back just as if they had attacked Darnassus itself."]="我们绝不能向敌人让出一寸土地。如果他们进攻黑海岸，我们就把他们打回去。我们要像保卫达纳苏斯一样保卫这里。"
G["We must not allow the Alliance to expand their power base in Arathi!  Even their miniscule Refuge Pointe may one day grow to threaten us."]="我们绝不能让联盟在阿拉希扩张势力！既便是小小的避难谷地，在将来也可能对我们形成威胁。"
G["We must not fail The Betrayer."]="我们不能辜负背叛者。"
G["We must not fail our leader!  Kael'thas will redeem us!"]="我们不能让领袖失望！凯尔萨斯会拯救我们！"
G["We must not fail the Firelord!"]="我们绝不能让炎魔之王失望！"
G["We must not fail the master."]="我们不能辜负主人。"
G["We must not give into the evil which has darkened our land.  The Night Watch must prevail!"]="我们决不向邪恶的势力屈服。守夜人一定会胜利的！"
G["We must not give up!"]="我们不能放弃！"
G["We must not let down our guard.  It's only a matter of time before he regains his strength and returns to turn Nordrassil into ash."]="我们绝不能有丝毫的松懈。他迟早会重获力量并且卷土重来，将诺达希尔变成焦土。"
G["We must not let our grief weaken us. Our people will stand strong against the invaders."]="绝不能让悲痛的心情削弱我们的力量。我们将并肩作战，以强大的力量击退入侵者。"
G["We must not only see the negative when there is much to be positive about."]="有这么多值得高兴的事，我们不能只想着消极的方面。"
G["We must not sit idly by in our mountain-top fortress as Pandaria falls apart. And that is why you and I must demand an audience with Taran Zhu."]="潘达利亚分崩离析时，我们绝不可以安坐在山顶堡垒中袖手旁观。那就是为什么你和我必须跟祝踏岚讨个说法。"
G["We must not waste time, traveler."]="No debemos perder ni un segundo, $gviajero:viajera;."
G["We must perservere, $n. That is something I learned from our beloved wolf ancient.\n\nNever, never, never give up."]="Debemos perseverar, $n. Eso es algo que aprendí de nuestro amado ancestro lobo.\n\nNunca, nunca, nunca te rindas."
G["We must prevent it from occurring in the first place."]="我们原本就该阻止这件事发生的。"
G["We must prevent the Horde from taking Pandaria... but we must also work to minimize suffering as we do."]="我们必须防止部落侵占潘达利亚……可我们同时还要尽力减少我们造成的伤害。"
G["We must protect the brew!"]="我们必须保护美酒！"
G["We must push little cart!"]="我们必须推动小车！"
G["We must put an end to the corruption permeating Ashenvale."]="我们必须终结渗入灰谷的堕落之息。"
G["We must re-establish our stranglehold on these mines!"]="我们必须在矿洞附近重建我们的要塞！"
G["We must redeem the Vale."]="我们必须拯救锦绣谷。"
G["We must regroup before the Sha attack again!"]="我们必须在煞再次攻击前，重整旗鼓！"
G["We must remain focused on our work.  Once the sanctum starts producing at full capacity, Silvermoon will be forced to send help.  Functioning arcane sanctums are in short supply."]="我们必须继续专心进行我们的工作。一旦圣殿开始全力运转，银月城就不得不派人来帮忙了。运转中的奥术圣殿总是会缺少补给的。"
G["We must resist!  Gird your soul!  Burn the foul plague wherever you find it!"]="坚持！做好准备！一旦发现污秽，立即烧毁它！"
G["We must search for survivors. If anyone is still alive, we must at least try and get them back..."]="我们必须搜寻幸存者。如果仍然有人活着，我们至少得试试救他们回来……"
G["We must seek out the elemental spirits and reunite them in the temple. Through this we will heal the land and find understanding of what truly ails it."]="我们必须找到元素之灵，并将他们带回寺中。只有这样，我们才能治愈大地，并发现真正的危机。"
G["We must speak with the shaman of the Earthen Ring. Come..."]="我们必须和大地之环的萨满祭司谈谈。来……"
G["We must stand at the ready. I have faced undead before. They are ruthless killing machines, devoid of any emotion or compassion."]="我们必须随时准备好。我曾经面对过这些亡灵。他们是残忍的杀人机器，毫无同情和怜悯。"
G["We must stay together, Tholo!"]="我们绝不分开，索罗！"
G["We must stick together to survive.  Move around in groups."]="我们必须团结一致才能生存下去。我们要结队行动。"
G["We must stop Cho'gall from creating his ultimate weapon at all costs, even if that means sacrificing ourselves."]="我们要不惜一切代价，阻止古加尔制造出他的终极武器，就算这意味着我们要牺牲自己的生命。"
G["We must stop the Dark Shaman now."]="我们必须立刻阻止黑暗萨满！"
G["We must stop these villains!"]="我们必须阻止这些邪恶的亡灵！"
G["We must strike at Jotunheim continuously. Never give them a chance to catch their breath, never a chance to sleep, and never accept surrender!\n\nTirion Fordring with all the might of Ashbringer and the Argent Crusade behind him cannot hope to accomplish what you are doing!\n\nNow, be quick about your business, $n. There is too much occurring for idle chit-chat."]="Debemos atacar Jotunheim continuamente. ¡No darles ninguna oportunidad de recobrar el aliento, ni de dormir, ni de aceptar la derrota!\n\nTirion Vadín no podrá conseguir lo que estás haciendo ni con todo el poder de la Crematoria, ni con todo el apoyo de la Cruzada Argenta.\n\nAhora, date prisa con lo tuyo, $n. Están ocurriendo demasiadas cosas como para pararse a charlar."
G["We must strive to understand the balance maintained by this world's elemental spirits."]="我们必须努力了解这个世界上的元素之灵所维护的平衡。"
G["We must succceed! Azeroth's fate lies in the balance...."]="我们不能失败！艾泽拉斯世界的命运就维系在这脆弱的平衡上……"
G["We must take back Auberdine!"]="我们一定要夺回奥伯丁！"
G["We must take care. The temple grounds are patrolled by mogu and their saurok slaves, and their beasts lurk in the grass off the roads."]="我们一定得小心。寺庙的地界上有魔古族和他们的蜥蜴人奴隶巡逻，而路边的草丛里则潜伏着他们驯养的畜生。"
G["We must take caution in reacting against the recent events on our shores. Paw'don is a small brewing town, not a fortress of war.\n\nYou would do well to urge your leaders to take similar caution in their judgment of my people. We do not seek combat, but we will provide it if necessary.\n\nI must meditate on this affair."]="我们必须小心应对近来在海岸上发生的事。坡东村是个酿酒小镇，不是战斗要塞。\n\n你也应该提醒你的首领，在评判我族人时也应该持有同样谨慎的态度。我们不主动寻衅，但也决不是缩头乌龟。\n\n我得好好想想。"
G["We must take it somewhere safe. Sentinels! Let's get to work."]="我们必须把它送到安全的地方。哨兵，我们动手吧。"
G["We must take what is ours. Our survival depends on it."]="我们必须夺回属于我们的东西。我们的生死存亡在此一举。"
G["We must train harder."]="我们得更加刻苦训练。"
G["We must tread carefully. The Shan'ze tribe practices dark magic that we still do not fully understand."]="我们必须步步为营。山泽部族在练习一些我们仍无法完全理解的黑暗魔法。"
G["We must uncover the truth about these rumors and stop this Twilight's Hammer campaign to spread fear among us!"]="我们必须揭开这些谣言的真相，阻止暮光之锤在我们之间散播恐惧！"
G["We must unite and focus our attention upon the true threat: THE LICH KING!"]="我们必须团结起来，一致对抗真正的威胁：巫妖王！"
G["We must use this time wisely!"]="我们必须睿智地使用这些时间！"
G["We must wait for the right time to strike!"]="我们必须等待出击的最佳时机！"
G["We must work faster."]="我们必须干得再快点。"
G["We must work quickly to get the beacon operational."]="我们必须尽快工作，让这个信标重新运作起来。"
G["We must work together to preserve what nativel life remains in Nagrand."]="我们必须精诚合作，保护纳格兰的本土生态。"
G["We mustn't allow them through!"]="我们绝不能让他们过去！"
G["We mustn't anger the Master. His is a wrath that is cruel beyond measure."]="我们可不能惹恼了他。他发起火来就没有节制啦。"
G["We mustn't fail the Banshee Queen."]="我们绝不能让女妖之王失望。"
G["We mustn't lose our focus. The dangers inherent in getting lost in the moment could put us in peril. Alas, the soldiers need a respite from this madness.\n\nBask in the victory, $n. If not for you we might have lost the Vanguard."]="No debemos descentrarnos. Si dejamos que la situación nos confunda, podríamos ponernos en peligro. Los soldados necesitan descansar de toda esta locura.\n\nDisfruta de la victoria, $n. De no ser por ti, hubiéramos perdido la Vanguardia."
G["We mustn't tarry here... stay close - I'll take us somewhere safe."]="我们不能在这里久留……靠近我，我们要转移到安全的地方去。"
G["We named him Dranosh - It means \"Heart of Draenor\" in orcish. I would not let the warlocks take him. My boy would be safe, hidden away by the elders of Garadar."]="Lo llamamos Dranosh. Quiere decir \"Corazón de Draenor\" en orco. No dejé que los brujos se lo llevaran. Mi hijo estaba a salvo, los ancianos de Garadar lo escondían."
G["We need a cold pint over here! Stat!"]="给我们来一扎冰镇啤酒！快点！"
G["We need a great number of copper bars, $c. The upcoming war at Ahn'Qiraj is going to use up a lot of metal for weapons, armor and whatnot. I'm told that the Horde alone needs to collect $1998w copper bars. As of now we have $2018w."]="我们需要大量铜锭，$c。安其拉一战迫在眉睫，我们需要准备足够的金属来制造武器、护甲和其他器物。部落需要收集$1998w块铜锭。到目前为止，我们已经收集到$2018w块了。"
G["We need adventurers to assist us, $n. Will you help?"]="我们需要一些冒险者的帮助，$n。你能帮我吗？"
G["We need all of our bombs and tools to survive on this deserted island, $n."]="我们得用上所有炸弹和工具，才能在这荒岛上活下去，$n。"
G["We need better representation from Stormwind.  Our homes are falling to the undead."]="我们需要暴风城更积极的反应和更多的支援，我们的家园正在遭到亡灵的进攻。"
G["We need dis land! Da cataclysm destroyed our home!"]="我们需要这片土地！大灾变毁了我们的家园！"
G["We need help from you and your goblins. Thousand Needles is destroyed! Thalanaar is underwater!"]="我们需要你和你的地精伸出援手。千针石林被毁了！萨兰纳尔已经沉在水底！"
G["We need leadership!"]="我们需要有人领导！"
G["We need more brew. A good place to look might be the pirate ship to the southwest."]="我们需要更多美酒。可以到西南边的海盗船上找找看。"
G["We need more brew. I think I saw brew guzzling hozen on the mountain peak to the southeast."]="我们需要更多美酒。我好像看见猢狲在东南边的山峰上狂饮作乐。"
G["We need more brew. The cave west of here along the beach might have some stashed there."]="我们需要更多美酒。沿海岸西边的洞穴里也许还有存货。"
G["We need more brew. You should search the island to the northwest. I think I saw a beach party over there."]="我们需要更多美酒。你应该去西北边的岛上找找。我想我看见那边有海滩派对。"
G["We need more flesh!"]="我们需要更多的尸体！"
G["We need more healers at the tents. Recall the priests from the west."]="去西边叫些牧师回来，营地需要更多治疗者。"
G["We need more oil! How many times do I have to tell you peons!"]="我跟你们这些苦工说过多少次了！我们需要更多的原油！"
G["We need more wolves! Come to the stables and help!"]="我们需要更多的狼！去马厩需求帮助吧！"
G["We need oil and lots of it if we're going to get your footbomb uniform running, kid!"]="Necesitamos combustible, y un montón además, si queremos poner en marcha tu uniforme de bombalón, $gchaval:chavala;."
G["We need some new friends if we're going to survive all of this. Hopefully, the orcs won't just kill you on sight."]="我们要想保住性命，就需要结交一些新朋友。希望那些兽人不会一见面就把你干掉。"
G["We need some..."]="我们需要一些……"
G["We need those pandaren rescued.  If that doesn't happen soon, we're going to have a slew of defectors here going after their loved ones and getting themselves killed!"]="我们得救那些熊猫人。如果不快点动手，我们这儿就会出现很多因为冒险寻亲而丧命的逃兵了！"
G["We need to confirm this data, we don't want to rip apart any more of our facility."]="我们需要确认这些数据，我们可不想把设备弄得乱七八糟。"
G["We need to dislodge that ship, Korga.  If we help your crewmates, can you help us?"]="我们得把这船弄出来，科尔加。如果我们帮你救人，你会帮我们吗？"
G["We need to do right by these people if we want a chance at understanding this land."]="要想真正了解这片土地，我们就必须公平地对待这些人。"
G["We need to do this more often! This so funny... lightning hitting big-tongues everywhere!"]="我们以后还要来玩这个！太有趣啦……闪电把大舌头怪打得抱头鼠窜！"
G["We need to figure out everything there is to know about Cho'gall's mystery weapon before it's too late."]="我们需要及时弄清楚古加尔神秘武器的一切信息。"
G["We need to figure out everything there is to know about the weapon Cho'gall's working on and we need to do it fast!"]="我们需要尽快搞清楚古加尔到底在制造一种什么样的武器！"
G["We need to figure out what this shadowy group is doing here at Grangol'var Village!"]="我们要找出那些家伙在格兰戈瓦村干些什么！"
G["We need to get back to Lantinga and tell him about this place. Hurry it up!"]="我们要回去找兰迪加，把这里的情况告诉他。快！"
G["We need to get into the fight. Are you ready?"]="我们要投身战斗了。准备好了吗？"
G["We need to get this outpost ready for the push into Sholazar Basin.\n\nDon't just stand there, $c. Go out and represent the Horde with honor and spilled blood!"]="Tenemos que preparar esta avanzada para el ataque a la Cuenca de Sholazar.\n\nNo te quedes ahí $gparado:parada:c; $c. ¡Ve y representa a la Horda derramando sangre y con honor!"
G["We need to get this wagon filled by the end of the day.  So back to work with you.  Chop, chop!"]="我们需要在今日之内装满货车。回去做你自己的工作吧。砍，砍！"
G["We need to get those arrows and get out of here."]="我们得拿到那些箭矢，然后离开这儿。"
G["We need to give this another try."]="我们需要再试一次。"
G["We need to keep moving!"]="我们必须继续前进！"
G["We need to keep the worgen's attention in the city, Genn.  It's the only shot we have for the survivors to make it to Duskhaven."]="我们必须在城里吸引狼人的注意。这是让幸存者逃往暮湾镇的唯一机会。"
G["We need to kill all of these cultists and their leaders out here before we can take out the Bastion of Twilight."]="我们需要消灭所有邪教徒和他们的领袖，这样我们才能占领暮光堡垒。"
G["We need to lighten the load here."]="我们需要照亮这里的路面。"
G["We need to make a move now, while we still can!"]="我们必须行动，趁我们还能采取行动的时候！"
G["We need to make for the oasis, $n.\n\nYou about ready to go?"]="Tenemos que llegar al oasis, $n.\n\n¿Estás $glisto:lista; para partir?"
G["We need to move quickly! Tyrygosa and her guard have fallen, leaving the temple defenseless. Deathwing's forces must never reach the Dragon Soul or all is lost. The Wyrmrest Accord will aid you in the assault; the siege must be broken!"]="我们必须尽快行动！塔丽苟萨和她的守卫们已经倒下了，神殿的防御完全崩溃。决不能让死亡之翼的部队接近巨龙之魂，否则一切都完了。龙眠联军会在战斗中协助你的；我们必须打破敌人的围攻！"
G["We need to regroup, Sergeant! Go to the nearby village."]="我们需要重整队伍，中士！去附近的村里报到。"
G["We need to speak to Shen-zin Su and discover how to heal it. And to do that, we need the four elemental spirits returned. Huo was the first."]="我们需要和神真子谈谈，并且找出治愈它的办法。但首先，我们必须寻回四位元素之灵，燧焰正是第一个。"
G["We need to stop the Dark Shaman before they become a real threat to Orgrimmar."]="我们必须在他们真正威胁到奥格瑞玛之前阻止黑暗萨满。"
G["We need to support one another. They'll target any weakness."]="我们得互相支援。任何弱点都会成为目标。"
G["We need to take care of everything out here before we can launch the final assault on the Bastion of Twilight."]="在对暮光堡垒发动最后的进攻之前，我们需要处理好这里的一切问题。"
G["We need to wait for the winds to settle, then make a break for the cover of the far hallway."]="我们得等狂风平息下来，然后突破大厅的屏障。"
G["We need ya, mon."]="我们需要你，伙计。"
G["We need you to send reinforcements to Manaforge Duro, Ardonis.  This is not a request, it's an order."]="阿尔杜尼斯，我们要你派增援去法力熔炉：杜隆。这不是请求，而是命令。"
G["We need you, $n!  There are worgen everywhere!"]="我们需要你，$n！这里到处都是狼人！"
G["We need your help hunting this traitor down.  Are you willing?"]="我们需要你的帮助，追捕这名叛徒。你愿意吗？"
G["We need your help, $c.  We've fought tooth and nail to get here, but the naga keep coming."]="我们需要你的帮助，$c。我们已经拼尽了全力，但纳迦的攻势丝毫没有减弱。"
G["We never did see eye to eye... Good riddance I say!"]="我们总是意见不合……终于摆脱他了！"
G["We never have enough of these rays for the Skyguard.  You're keeping us afloat... literally!"]="天空卫队需要长期补充以太鳐的储量。在你的帮助下，我们才能在天空翱翔。"
G["We not do anything... to them... I no understand."]="我们……什么都没做啊……我搞不明白。"
G["We not want to die. We want to help though! Come back for us, okay?"]="我们是很想帮忙啊。但我们不想搭上性命！你待会再来找我们吧！"
G["We now hide in shadows, hidden from our enemies."]="我们现在躲藏在阴影中，不让敌人发现。"
G["We now hold the wisdom of the Winterax, $n. This power can be yours for a short time should you so desire."]="我们掌握了冰斧的智慧，$n。如你所愿，他的力量将在短期内为你所用。"
G["We now know what must be done. I will deliver this news to King Varian and Highlord Fordring."]="我们知道该怎么做了。我会把这个消息带给瓦里安国王和弗丁大人。"
G["We now prepare to lay siege to the city and bring the perpetrators of this unforgivable crime to justice."]="我们正准备围攻那座城市，将这群不可饶恕的罪魁祸首绳之以法。"
G["We number in the millions! Your efforts are wasted..."]="我们的同伴无穷无尽！你只是在白费力气……"
G["We obey, blood guard. For the Horde!"]="我们听命，血卫士。为了部落！"
G["We of Darnassus look forward to competing in the tournament."]="达纳苏斯的精灵们希望在锦标赛中一展身手。"
G["We of Gilneas show little patience for outsiders."]="我们吉尔尼斯人对外来者可没什么耐心。"
G["We of the Brotherhood of the Light are not as lenient as our brethren when it comes to meting justice to those that would do this world wrong."]="当面对那些妄图危害这个世界的邪恶势力时，我们圣光兄弟会可远没有其他同胞那样和善。"
G["We of the Horde have done all that we can to prepare for the upcoming war at Ahn'Qiraj. Now we wait, $c, for the Alliance to do the same. Once they are done we will all transport our war materiel to Cenarion Hold in Silithus."]="安其拉一战迫在眉睫，部落已经完成了所有的物资收集工作。$C，现在我们只需等待联盟完成任务。那时，我们就能将所有的战争物资运往希利苏斯的塞纳里奥要塞了。"
G["We offer a mighty champion, a capable $c, an honorable $r.  We present, $n."]="Ofrecemos un poderoso campeón, $gun:una; $c capaz, $gun:una; $r honorable. Presentamos a $n."
G["We ogres are not all bad."]="我们食人魔也不都是恶棍。"
G["We ogres were once lost..."]="我们食人魔曾经迷失了自我……"
G["We only have to work crunch time for a few more weeks.  At least thats what they tell us..."]="我们只需要再干几个星期就行了。至少他们是这么说的……"
G["We only want to be left alone. Why is that so difficult to understand?"]="我们只希望能不被打扰。为什么这一点就如此难以被理解？"
G["We only wish to know why the wildkin guard this area..."]="我们只是希望知道枭兽为什么要守卫这片地区……"
G["We openly deal with the ethereal, ignorant of their true intentions. Could we be aiding in the preparation of our own demise?"]="我们公开与虚灵达成了交易，却对它们的真实意图一无所知。我们是不是在给自己准备葬礼？"
G["We orcs are usually a private people, but lately, no one's been hiding their feelings."]="我们兽人通常不喜欢过多谈论自己的感情问题，但今天可不是遮遮掩掩的时候。"
G["We ought to leave Crowley in prison with those beasts!"]="我们该把克罗雷留在监狱里喂野兽！"
G["We overheard their orders... no survivors..."]="我们听到了他们的命令……不留任何活口……"
G["We owe you a debt of gratitude $n."]="我们感谢你，$n。"
G["We owe you a debt that will be hard to repay, $n."]="我们欠你的永远都还不清，$n。"
G["We owe you a great deal for the part you have played in the destiny of our flight."]="你改变了蓝龙军团的宿命，我们对你感激不尽。"
G["We owe you a great debt, $r."]="我们欠你一个很大的人情，$r。"
G["We owe you a great debt."]="我们欠你的太多了。"
G["We paint our faces with the ash to send a message to new enemies - a declaration to those who fear and revile us as monsters."]="我们将燃烧后的灰烬抹在脸上，告诉那些新的敌人——那些畏惧我们，视我们为怪物的人。"
G["We pandaren are no strangers to dealing with tyrants. The coming battle will try your souls. May the celestials guide your actions."]="我们熊猫人对于推翻暴君并不陌生。即将到来的战争将考验你们的灵魂。愿至尊天神指引你们的道路。"
G["We pandaren are such a peaceful race, but we do appreciate a good brawl every now and again!"]="我们熊猫人是热爱和平的种族，但我们也喜欢偶尔看看精彩的拳赛！"
G["We pandaren do not know."]="我们熊猫人不知道。"
G["We pandaren work best on a full stomach, $p. Be sure to keep our table full!"]="熊猫人在吃饱之后效率最高，$p。确保我们的餐桌上不缺食物吧！"
G["We passed the savings on to us."]="我们一省再省。"
G["We pay the mercs to get us out there, or our troops get no reinforcements."]="我们雇那些佣兵把我们送过去，这是支援友军的唯一办法了。"
G["We people of the Lower City had a rather extensive spy network set up in the Shadow Labyrinth until recently.\n\nNow they're all dead except me and To'gun."]="我们贫民窟的人原本在暗影迷宫里有一张相当广大的间谍网络。\n\n可现在，除了我和托古恩，其他人都死了。"
G["We performed da ancient rites..."]="我们举行了古老的仪式……"
G["We pillage, we plunder, we steal sheep and fight, wolf out, me 'earties, aaa-ooo!"]="我们抢劫，我们掠夺，我们无恶不作，干杯吧水手们——噢噢噢！"
G["We plaguebringers tend to be slightly more practical than the average apothecary.  After all, we deal with the logistics of deploying the plague.\n\nThat doesn't mean our theoretical background isn't rock solid.  We just prefer... hands on tasks."]="相比起来，药剂师更强调实践吧。毕竟我们在负责后勤工作的。\n\n这并不代表我们的理论基础知识不够扎实。我们只是……做实事而已。"
G["We plant the vegetables.  Our vegetables are eaten by the rabbit.  The rabbit is devoured by the wolf.  The wolf is slain by us.  We take the meat and hide from the wolf's corpse.  It's that Magic Circle of life, or whatever you call it.  \nNow go see Telonis in the Cenarion Enclave to get started and let me return to my duties."]="Plantamos las verduras. El conejo se come las verduras. El lobo devora al conejo. Nosotros matamos al lobo. Aprovechamos la carne y el pellejo del lobo. Es el círculo mágico de la vida, o como quieras llamarlo. \n\nAhora ve a ver a Telonis en el Enclave Cenarion para iniciar tu camino y déjame regresar a mis labores."
G["We practitioners of the arcane and elemental ways follow a never ending path of discovery. Is that why you seek my counsel? You wish further training?"]="我们的研究奥术和自然之力的专家们正在沿着一条永无止尽的探索之路前行。这就是你要寻求我的建议的原因吗？你希望获得更进一步的训练吗？"
G["We present to you, $n.  One of the finest $cs we have seen in action."]="Os presentamos a $n. $gUno:Una; $c $gdigno:digna; de ser $gvisto:vista; en acción."
G["We protect the waters. From greed, from darkness."]="我们守护着这水，让它远离贪婪与黑暗。"
G["We protect this airship on its way from Orgrimmar to Grom'gol base camp in Stranglethorn Vale."]="我们保护着这艘由奥格瑞玛飞往荆棘谷格罗姆高营地的飞艇。"
G["We protected Gilneas from the Scourge.  We protected Gilneas during the Northgate rebellion.  We will protect Gilneas from whatever this new threat may be."]="天灾入侵时我们守住了吉尔尼斯。北门叛乱时我们也守住了她。无论面对任何新威胁，吉尔尼斯绝不会失守。"
G["We put a whole town... in a tiny little box!"]="我们把整个小镇……放进了一个胶囊里！"
G["We put together some sweet custom horns for these things. Enjoy!"]="我们给这些家伙装上了可爱的小喇叭。希望你会喜欢！"
G["We read you. Comin' in hot."]="收到。马上行动。"
G["We really must perfect a way to deal with those smelly Shadowpine trolls!"]="我们必须设法对付那些臭气熏天的暗松巨魔！"
G["We really must perfect a way to deal with those smelly Shadowpine trolls.\n\nOh, no offense, $c.\n\n<The apothecary grins innocently and shrugs.>"]="我们必须设法对付那些臭气熏天的暗松巨魔！\n\n哦，我没有冒犯你的意思，$c。\n\n<药剂师带着一脸无辜的笑容耸了耸肩。>"
G["We really not like it here. Maybe come find us when you done."]="我们不喜欢这里。要不你办完事之后再来找我们。"
G["We really should fix this fence soon."]="我们应该快点把那个篱笆修好。"
G["We received Brann's message, and we have begun preparations."]="我们收到了布莱恩的消息，已经开始着手做准备了。"
G["We reclaiming our land, Gurubashi land.  An' we gonna kill anyone dat get in our way."]="我们要夺回我们的古拉巴什。任何敢阻挡我们的人，只有死路一条。"
G["We remain unscathed."]="我们是不会受伤的。"
G["We remember this visit, yes we do. Never forget what you learn from your new friend, little Roo. You got great future ahead."]="Recordaremos esta visita, sí. Nunca olvides lo que has aprendido de tu $gnuevo amigo:nueva amiga;, pequeño Lito. Te aguarda un gran futuro."
G["We require da help of allies on da islands.\n\nZen'tabra has been watching over da animals of de Islands for some time now.  We'd need her help and da help of da animal creatures.\n\nBwonsamdi is a powerful loa dat controls de spirits of de dead on da islands.  His blessing is crucial for our attack.\n\nOnce our allies have joined us, Zalazane and his army of mind-controlled trolls will have no chance!  Then, da Echo Isles will be de Darkspears!"]="如果要成功地夺回这些岛屿，我们就需要有援军的帮助。\n\n岑塔布拉一直在照看这片群岛上的动物们。我们需要她和那些动物的帮助。\n\n邦桑迪是一位强大的神灵。他控制着这片群岛上死者们的灵魂。他的祝福对我们是至关重要的。\n\n当我们取得他们的援助之后，扎拉赞恩和被他控制的巨魔将必败无疑！那时，回音群岛就会回到暗矛部族的怀抱！"
G["We require your aid."]="我们需要你的帮助。"
G["We return to when we lost our way. You... are very kind."]="我们又找回了失去的方向。你们是……好人。"
G["We return!"]="我们回来了！"
G["We ride on your command!"]="听从你的指令！"
G["We ride!"]="出发！"
G["We ride! For the Fel Horde! For Victory!"]="冲啊！为了邪部落！为了胜利！"
G["We risked everything, but we did it. Shen-zin Su will be okay."]="我们孤注一掷，但成功了。神真子会好起来的。"
G["We rode off down the canyon, careful to avoid falling rocks."]="我们在山谷中飞驰，一边还要注意躲避落石。"
G["We rowdy!"]="我们可不好惹！"
G["We run circles around you! We so good!"]="我们打败你啦！我们真了不起！"
G["We sacked the town?"]="我们洗劫了那座城市？"
G["We sail to a virgin island, a gift from Azeroth to the Horde!"]="我们将航向一座新生的岛屿，那是艾泽拉斯世界赠予部落的厚礼！"
G["We sally forth in search of the dragons' despicable broodmother.  Follow me, squire!"]="我们要继续前进，找到邪恶的巨龙女王。跟我来，侍从！"
G["We saved. You nice, dryskin."]="我们得救啦。你真好，干皮人。"
G["We see a flicker of flame. It seems far, but we know it to be close."]="毫光灼灼，在彼一方。"
G["We see strange ships. These are not mogu ships.\n\nWho are the invaders? What do they want? What do they taste like?"]="我们最近常常见到奇怪的船只，不是魔古族的船。\n\n这些入侵者是谁？他们想要什么？他们都什么味儿？"
G["We seek the wisdom of the Crane to explain the visions we have been having.\n\nMantid! Mantid assaulting our homes, flying over the wall and attacking in force.\n\nSuch dreams are expected, living so close to the wall.\n\nBut lately, they have been most insistent."]="我们希望仙鹤能够帮忙解释我们看到的现象。\n\n螳螂妖！螳螂妖在攻击我们的家园，它们飞过城墙，成群结队地攻击我们。\n\n这样的噩梦是意料之中的事情，影像中发生的一切在城墙边栩栩如生。\n\n但是近来，这一幕幕的画面在我的眼前愈演愈烈，已经到达了一个顶点。"
G["We seem to have awakened a spirit of some kind."]="我们似乎唤醒了什么东西的灵魂。"
G["We serve Stormwind faithfully, my lady!"]="我们将为暴风城奉献我们的全部忠诚，女士！"
G["We serve Thorim, sister."]="我们是托里姆的仆人。"
G["We serve Thrall with great pride.  We'll travel as far as is needed to vanquish the enemy."]="我们以能为萨尔效劳而感到骄傲。我们将不惜一切代价，消灭我们的敌人！"
G["We serve the light unquestioningly. Perhaps you might be a bit more curious about our purpose?"]="我们无条件地为圣光效劳，也许你可能会对我们的目的感到好奇？"
G["We serve the world's TRUE masters! When their rule begins, we will share in their glory!"]="我们侍奉世界真正的主人！当他们的秩序降临，我们将分享他们的荣光！"
G["We serve until death, and sometimes after that."]="我们效忠至死，有时在死后也依然效忠。"
G["We set up a small camp in the hills above the jinyu village."]="我们在山上扎营，可以俯瞰锦鱼人村子。"
G["We set up camp for the night. Rell split up responsibilities."]="我们开始准备扎营过夜。利尔分派了任务。"
G["We set up this area to practice fire fighting.  You never know when the town will be imperiled!"]="我们建立这个营地是为了练习灭火技术。你永远都不会知道火灾什么时候会降临！"
G["We shall be in your debt, $c.  Look for Donal Osgood in the Hall of Arms.  He will be more than happy to aid you in your journey to Arathi Basin."]="我们欠你一个人情，$c。去武器大厅找杜纳尔·奥斯古德，他会乐意帮助你前往阿拉希盆地的。"
G["We shall be needing more blood for the master soon..."]="我们要为主人收集更多的鲜血……"
G["We shall be reunited once more, my love..."]="我的爱人，我们会再次复合的……"
G["We shall claim victory for Warchief Garrosh!"]="我们将为加尔鲁什酋长夺取胜利！"
G["We shall crush Shai Hu, together!"]="我们将合力粉碎刹嗳呼！"
G["We shall crush these feeble beings!"]="干掉那些脆弱的家伙！"
G["We shall crush what remains of them and lay claim to this land."]="我们将摧毁剩下的敌人，并占领那座岛屿。"
G["We shall dispel you from this land!"]="我们要把你逐出这片土地！"
G["We shall earn our deaths at the very least!"]="即便是死，也要死得轰轰烈烈！"
G["We shall face the Firelord and drive every ember of his being out of our realm!"]="我们要直面炎魔之王，并将他的余烬残渣赶出我们的领地！"
G["We shall hunt our foes."]="我们要追捕敌人。"
G["We shall not fail you Sir!"]="我们不会令阁下失望的！"
G["We shall persevere."]="我们将坚持不懈。"
G["We shall reign over Pandaria once more!"]="我们会再次统治潘达利亚！"
G["We shall rise again!"]="我们必将再次崛起！"
G["We shall rout all traitors to the Horde!"]="部落必须肃清所有叛徒！"
G["We shall sail for distant Azshara. There, I will forge a new trade empire. One that will crush the Steamwheedle Cartel! And I shall carve my likeness upon that distant land's mountains. All will pay tribute to me!"]="我们将乘船前往遥远的艾萨拉。在那里，我会构建一个新的贸易帝国。热砂集团将被我们碾成齑粉！而且，我还会在远方土地的高山上雕刻我的巨像。到那时候，所有国家都要向我进贡！"
G["We shall see how much punishment these invaders can stand."]="我倒要看看这帮入侵者能承受怎样的折磨。"
G["We shall see how you fare against the Vor'thik without the wind at your back..."]="让我们看看掠风者无法帮助你时，你将如何独自面对沃提克吧……"
G["We shall see if you are a worthy opponent!"]="让我们瞧瞧你是不是个值得尊敬的对手！"
G["We shall see if you are so defiant after we start breaking your bones."]="让我们看看，你被打断骨头之后还能不能这么目中无人。"
G["We shall see, $C."]="我们等着瞧吧，$C。"
G["We shall see."]="我们会搞清楚的。"
G["We shall see. Let us weaken him, my friends!"]="走着瞧。让我们合力削弱他，朋友们！"
G["We shall take up this grim task in high spirits, and be sure that our cause will not be suffered to fail.  Welcome the aid of your brethren, and of your once heated foes - let us all go forward together with our united strength, and know victory this day!"]="我们要以极大的热情面对这项严酷的任务，也要保证我们不会失败。欢迎一切来帮助你们的伙伴们和你曾经的敌人，让我们齐心协力，胜利是我们的！"
G["We shall triumph!"]="胜利属于我们！"
G["We shall, Sylvanas..."]="我们会的，希尔瓦娜斯……"
G["We shame our ancestors. We shame those lost to us... forgive me, Reginald."]="我们令祖先蒙羞。我们令牺牲的同胞蒙羞……原谅我吧，雷吉纳德。"
G["We share a common enemy, Lady Proudmoore. Nothing more."]="我们有着共同的敌人，普罗德摩尔女士。仅此而已。"
G["We share a common enemy, Regent Lord, nothing more."]="我们有着共同的敌人，摄政王阁下。仅此而已。"
G["We shou-- oh most unluckiest of days! What is THAT!?"]="我们最不幸的日子！那是什么？"
G["We should attack them now, Ban, while their eyes are set upon the gates of Kun-Lai."]="班，趁他们的注意力都集中在昆莱山，我们得先发制人。"
G["We should attend the next burning of the Wickerman."]="我们一定得参加下次的稻草人焚烧祭典。"
G["We should be taking the fight to the hozen, not stalling out of fear."]="我们应该跟猢狲干到底，而不是恐惧退缩。"
G["We should be uniting the Ogre clans, not fighting each other."]="我们需要统一所有食人魔氏族，而不是让各氏族互相争斗。"
G["We should drink some tiger blood. Then we'd surely be winning!"]="我们应该喝点虎血。那我们就赢定了！"
G["We should fire another signal flare.  Perhaps we will get more help from Ebon Watch."]="我们应该再发一枚信号弹。这样或许能从黑锋哨站请求到更多的支援。"
G["We should get moving. That Honeybrew isn't going to find itself!"]="我们得走了。那蜜酒不会自己跑出来！"
G["We should get out of here. I need to renew!"]="我们应该离开这里。我需要恢复！"
G["We should go explore the rest of the faire!"]="我们应该到别处去看看！"
G["We should go to Moonglade to see the druids' great festival of the moon."]="我们应该去月光林地，看看德鲁伊们举办的春节庆典。"
G["We should go trick or treating later."]="我们待会再玩“不给糖果就恶作剧”的游戏吧。"
G["We should have been here... we should have stopped this from happening."]="我们应该保卫家园……应该阻止这一切的发生。"
G["We should have seen this coming. The corruption has been spreading for quite some time."]="我应该预见到今天的景象。这种污染已经扩散了相当长的一段时间。"
G["We should join this fleet, captain. The admiral's allies are worthy."]="我们应该加入这支舰队，船长。将军的同伴们值得信任。"
G["We should just leave.  Is this what we came to Outland for?"]="我们应该离开。这是我们来外域的原因吗？"
G["We should let Elder Shaopai know and then plan our next move."]="我们得通知邵白长老，再计划下一步行动。"
G["We should move now.  See you at the Wild Overlook."]="我们现在应该出发了。在荒野瞭望台见。"
G["We should move out, $n. Up the ramp and then straight to Master Shaw."]="我们应该行动了，$n。攀上这段阶梯，然后直接去找肖尔大师。"
G["We should never have come along."]="我们永远都不会分开。"
G["We should never have traveled through the Rivenwood. Everyone knows this!"]="我们不应该穿越裂木森林的。是个人都该明白这点！"
G["We should not fight here. Not like this!"]="我们不该在这里战斗。不该这样！"
G["We should not let those who bear the Curse walk among us.  It's just not right."]="我们不应该任由那些背负着诅咒的人再出现在我们中间。这样不对。"
G["We should not peer into the spirit realm..."]="我们不应该窥视灵魂的国度……"
G["We should return... I am sure my skills will be needed at my cousin's village. And... we must prepare a funeral for those we have lost."]="我们应该回去……我相信，我的医术能帮到我表哥的村庄。而且……我们必须准备葬礼，安葬失去的至亲。"
G["We should run around and stomp on all the houses!"]="我们应该四处走走，把每个房子都跑遍！"
G["We should sabotage the siege weapons toward the bow. Then we will go below decks and find the captain."]="我们得破坏对着船头的攻城武器，然后到甲板下面去找船长。"
G["We should sell these apples, but we will not allow peole to eat them.  Oh no!  We will sell apples to our friends, and they shall bring the fight to the fruit vendor for me!"]="我们要买掉这些苹果，但是不能让人们吃下它们。啊，不！我们要把苹果卖给我们的朋友，这样他们就会替我教训那个水果贩子了！"
G["We should stay here for only as long as it is necessary, $c."]="我们只该在需要时才继续留在这里，$c。"
G["We should strike now. I'll tear them apart!"]="我们必须立刻攻击。我要把他们撕成碎片！"
G["We should take action! While our leaders waggle their tongues, I could have slain ten yaungol."]="我们应该采取行动！领袖们扯皮的这点时间，都够我杀掉十个野牛人的了。"
G["We should talk, pandaren."]="我们得谈谈，熊猫人。"
G["We should tell the Admiral."]="我们应该告诉将军。"
G["We should totally have a pants-off dance-off!"]="我们应该痛快地跳一支舞！"
G["We shouldn't have left so many behind at Valgarde. Admiral Keller, that insufferable egomaniac!\n\nHow am I to fulfill my orders with so few? I need enough men to stay here at the keep and still properly garrison Fort Wildervar when it's ready!\n\nAt least we have a hope of dealing with our problems now that you're here."]="真不该把主力部队留在瓦加德。都是凯勒中将那个自大狂的错！\n\n现在手头就这么点人，我们怎么执行任务？这里的要塞需要驻军，维德瓦堡垒也需要部队！\n\n不过你既然来了，或许我们需要担心的就能少一些啦。"
G["We showed that one!"]="干得好！"
G["We sniff 'em an' mark 'em and rip 'em to chow, sing out, me 'earties: aaaa-ooo!"]="我们发现他们标记他们撕碎他们咀嚼他们，大声唱吧水手们，啊啊啊啊——噢噢噢！"
G["We so lucky."]="我们真走运。"
G["We sorry... going home so not die now. We so sorry!"]="抱歉……我们要回家去，我们不想死。很抱歉！"
G["We span the universe, as countless as the stars!"]="我们遍布宇宙的每一个角落，像群星一样无穷无尽！"
G["We spent days trying to find this one in Sholazar Basin. Welcome to the jungle! It's Mazhareen!"]="我们在索拉查盆地花了数天功夫才找到这家伙。欢迎来到丛林！他就是，玛扎伦！"
G["We spoke of your Warchief. His inner conflicts and his outer conquests."]="我们谈了你的酋长。他内心的矛盾和外在的征服欲。"
G["We stand at the brink of victory, my friends. Initiate Phase III: Into the tunnels!"]="朋友们，我们已经站到了胜利的边缘。第三阶段：进入隧道！"
G["We stand behind Dezco and his choices. We will stand against the mogu, the saurok, the sha, even the warchief of the Horde. We will protect this Vale to the last, if necessary."]="我们支持德兹科和他的决定。我们要奋起反抗魔古族、蜥蜴人、煞魔甚至是部落酋长。如有必要，我们愿意保护这座山谷直至最后一人。"
G["We stand by your side, friend.  This battle is not yours alone."]="我们将并肩作战，朋友。这不是你一个人的战斗。"
G["We stand in an undiscovered paradise as ancient as the titans themselves and you want to go to war?"]="我们正站在一片与泰坦一样古老的隐秘乐土上，而你却满脑子都是打打杀杀的事？"
G["We stand in the heart of Beth'tilac's breeding ground. Beyond those pillars to the north, her brood awaits. They will defend her young relentlessly."]="我们就站在贝丝缇拉克的产卵区中心。在北边那些柱子那边，就有她的子嗣。它们会拼命保护她的幼崽的。"
G["We stand on the brink of destruction. We must reconsider this rash course of action."]="我们站在毁灭的边缘。我们必须重新考虑这轻率的行动计划。"
G["We stand ready to defend the Eye!"]="我们随时准备保卫要塞！"
G["We stand together with the Alliance, $r. An evil, so old that the world has forgotten it, seeks to engulf us all; first on Kalimdor and then the rest of Azeroth. It is driven by a hatred of all things born of the great Shapers: The eternal Titans.\n\nWe are all that stand in the way of C'Thun's armies. We will strike first and bring down the forces of Ahn'Qiraj. Let all of Azeroth quake at the combined might of the Horde and Alliance.\n\nThe war effort needs you!"]="我们和联盟并肩作战，共同进退，$r。一个古老的邪恶力量正在准备将我们全部吞噬，首先是卡利姆多，然后是整个艾泽拉斯。这股邪恶是如此地古老，我们都已经忘记了它的存在。驱动它的力量的源泉，乃是对于造物之神泰坦以及一切由泰坦创造的事物的仇恨。\n\n我们是唯一能阻挡克苏恩的力量。我们要先发制人，击溃安其拉的虫人。让艾泽拉斯在部落和联盟的力量面前震撼吧。\n\n战备工作需要你的帮助！"
G["We stand together.  We will never fall!"]="我们联合起来。我们永远不会倒下！"
G["We stand united as sons of Cenarion, thanks to you.\n\nYour deeds here shall live on as long as our clans draw breath, $n!"]="作为塞纳里奥之子，我们团结在一起。感谢你。\n\n只要我们部族还存在，你在这里的事迹就不会被遗忘，$n！"
G["We still go through the motions, but the feast of Winter Veil feels empty now. In Orgrimmar they have the true celebration."]="我们也开始庆祝冬幕节了，但这里的宴会感觉有点空旷。奥格瑞玛那边才是真正的庆典。"
G["We still have forces in that tower!"]="那塔里面还有我们的部队！"
G["We still have so much to learn."]="我们还有很多东西要学。"
G["We still here cuz $n help Ogri'la!"]="在$n的帮助下，奥格瑞拉才能享有这份安宁！"
G["We still stand here only because of $n's help."]="在$n的帮助下，奥格瑞拉才能享有这份安宁。"
G["We stirred up a great deal of trouble, $n. But it was worth it."]="我们惹上了大麻烦，$n。但一切都是值得的。"
G["We stop here. Everyone out!"]="全部停下。大家散开！"
G["We stopped when we found a strange fallen tree."]="我们在一棵倒得很蹊跷的树前停下。"
G["We struck liquid gold with this place, $c! All we had to do was tear down some useless trees and clear out some pesky animals!"]="我们在这地方发现好东西啦，$c！我们只需要把这些没用的树全都砍掉，再赶走那些烦人的动物就可以了！"
G["We stuck with the cargo 'til the end, which came, well, right after the start..."]="我们坚守货物，直至最后……呃，其实也没坚守多久……"
G["We succeeded in taking the Sanctum.  We can continue to convert sentries and use them as guards at other tactical locations."]="我们成功地拿下了圣殿。我们可以继续转变这些魔像守卫，用它们来保护其它的战略要地。"
G["We suffered a lot of casualties when capturing your next challenge!"]="为了抓住你就要见到的这个挑战者，我们可是蒙受了很大的伤亡！"
G["We support mystical tradesmen by carrying a limited selection of arcane trade supplies. Are you looking for something in particular?"]="我们这里特别提供一些限量的魔法物品。你有没有什么特别需要的？"
G["We survived!"]="我们获救了！"
G["We suspect that in order to preserve their fortune and hold of the land - well past their lifespan - the Barovs made a deal with a powerful human mage named Kel'Thuzad.\n\n<Eva shudders.>\n\nFrom this deal sprang the school of necromancy: A place which bore the Cult of the Damned and would become their capital.\n\nAs each week passed, the house Barov became more and more decrepit...\n\nDark beings began to take residence in the various wings of the house. Upkeep became impossible... and disgusting."]="我们猜想，巴罗夫家族为了保护自己的财宝以及生前死后对土地的所有权，他们与一个名叫克尔苏加德的人类法师达成协议，克尔苏加德拥有强大的法力。\n\n<艾瓦战栗起来。>\n\n协议中提及了通灵学院……这里将成为诅咒神教的地盘，变成他们的首府。\n\n随着时间的推移，巴罗夫家族变得渐渐衰老……甚至扭曲。\n\n黑暗开始笼罩整个家族……"
G["We take these missing person reports very seriously, ma'am."]="我们在以非常严肃的态度处理这些失踪人口报告，女士。"
G["We take what we wish!"]="我们想要什么就拿什么！"
G["We teeter on the brink of annihilation. Is there no one left to help us?"]="我们在毁灭的边缘摇摆。难道就没人能帮帮我们吗？"
G["We tell his story, so that he will always be remembered."]="我们讲述他的故事，是为了让他能够被永远铭记。"
G["We tell orphan matron on you!"]="我们要向孤儿院长告状！"
G["We thank you mortal.  The ocean's will is to be free."]="感谢你，凡人。海洋的意志是自由的。"
G["We thank you, Aroom.  And we thank $n.  We return to Elune... finally."]="感谢你，阿隆姆。我们也要感谢$n。终于……我们找到了艾露恩。"
G["We thank you, friend of the blue dragonflight."]="我们感谢你，蓝龙军团的挚友。"
G["We think that the unique qualities of the water in the Valley is the main reason for the abundance in the region."]="我们认为正是山谷中的独特水质造就了这片繁荣的区域。"
G["We toil day in and day out, and for what?\n\nThere's no point to any of it..."]="我们夜以继日地辛苦劳作，究竟是为了什么？\n\n这一切都毫无意义……"
G["We took back our city... we took back..."]="我们夺回了城市……夺回了……"
G["We took her to the Commander with hopes that the druids of the Circle could fix her up. Sure enough, they were able to wake her up. We figured our business with the Circle was done and we could get back to work.\n\nA few weeks passed and everything was going fine. Brann was still around back then so we had a bit of order in our work structure. Then one day, out of the blue, she appeared back at our camp."]="我们把她交给了指挥官，希望议会的德鲁伊能医好她。我们相信德鲁伊们能让她清醒过来。我们跟议会之间已经两清，该回去做自己的事情了。\n\n过了好几周，一切看来进展顺利。布莱恩仍然四处奔波，我们也正常地工作着。有一天，她突然出现在我们的营地里。"
G["We took your land and now we take your food."]="我们夺取了你们的土地，现在还要抢走你们的食物。"
G["We travel long long way. Now Shado-Pan say they do not want our goods. This is most strange."]="我们长途跋涉。现在影踪派却说，他们不想要我们的商品。真是太奇怪了。"
G["We travel where the winds take us, good $r. Would you like to listen for a while?"]="我们跟随着风的指引四处游荡，好心的$r。你愿意倾听一会儿吗？"
G["We traveled south until night fell. Shokia spoke:"]="我们一直向南走到天黑。夏琪亚就说："
G["We travelled through angry hozen, rampaging yeti, and unclean yaks to get here. Now the Shado-Pan act like we are strangers.\n\nThis very bad fortune indeed."]="我们一路上曾遇到愤怒的猢狲、发狂的雪人和肮脏的牦牛，最后来到这里。现在，影踪派把我们当陌生人。\n\n运气真是不好。"
G["We turn eyes now ta de final prize - Orgrimmar."]="现在，我们已经将目光投向了最终的战场——奥格瑞玛。"
G["We typically shy away from eating the flesh of beasts, but our predicament requires that we make exception."]="我们特别不适应把野兽的肉当作食物，但在如今的特殊情形下，我们也只能勉为其难了。"
G["We upgraded these with some advanced armor plating - they should be able to take quite a beating now!"]="我们给它们换上了更先进的装甲钢板——现在它们的抗打击能力已经很强了！"
G["We use frost to chill their bones and bring their movement to a halt."]="我们用冰霜来冻结他们的骨头，还可以暂停他们的移动。"
G["We use many animal pelts and skins in our creations."]="我们使用动物皮毛制作物品。"
G["We used to burn the worgen when we killed them - to be sure that they were dead."]="当我们杀死狼人的时候，总会把它们烧死，这样才能确保它们不会重新活过来。"
G["We used to roam the seas... 'til that damned King Greymane shut down the harbors in Gilneas!  If it weren't for him, we wouldn't be..."]="我们曾在海上自由驰骋……直到该死的格雷迈恩国王把吉尔尼斯海港给封了！要不是因为他，我们就不会……"
G["We usually handle this all through the mail..."]="我们平常都是通过邮寄的方式解决……"
G["We wait for the next adventurer to come through and we tell him that's the way to go... then after they set off the mines, we just walk in and grab the tools!"]="我们就在这里等待下一拨冒险者，然后告诉他们该往哪儿走……等他们引爆地雷后，我们就可以直接走过去拿工具了！"
G["We wait until you ready."]="Esperaremos hasta que estés $glisto:lista;."
G["We waiting for tour guide."]="我们要等向导。"
G["We walk the edge of a precipice. Some of us must be pushed over for the rest of us to continue."]="我们行走在绝壁的边缘。我们当中的一些人必须倒下，为的是让其它人能继续前进。"
G["We want another shot at those beasts!"]="我们要向这些野兽再发出狠狠的一击！"
G["We want answers, Lieutenant! We're entitled to know the truth!"]="我们要知道答案，中尉！我们有权利知道真相！"
G["We want everyone to have fun at Brewfest.  It would also help if we had some people remember it as well.\n\nThese goggles allow anyone to experience what it's like to be drunk, but without the drinking part.  Put the goggles on, and it's like you're drunk!  Take them off, and you're sober!\n\nAre you interested in a pair?"]="Queremos que todo el mundo se divierta en la Fiesta de la Cerveza. También ayudaría que la gente se acordara.\n\nEstas gafas permiten que cualquiera experimente lo que es estar borracho, pero sin tener que beber. ¡Ponte las gafas y estarás $gborracho:borracha;! ¡Quítatelas y estarás $gsobrio:sobria;!\n\n¿Te interesa un par?"
G["We want to speak to the magistrate!"]="我们要和镇长谈一谈！"
G["We war so that our little ones may live to see a better tomorrow! And for them, we destroy the Burning Legion!"]="我们作战，是为了后代可以看到更美好的明天！为了他们，让我们消灭燃烧军团！"
G["We was travelin' east, looking for those horkin' human guys."]="我们往东走，去找那些卑鄙的人类。"
G["We waste our time here just floating about..."]="浮在这个地方只是在浪费时间……"
G["We watch dem trolls real good!"]="我们在仔细监视那些巨魔！"
G["We watched as our homes were razed to the ground."]="我们亲眼看到自己的家园被夷平。"
G["We welcome all who wish to join our ranks, but you need some more experience before you can begin. Please come speak to me later."]="我们欢迎一切有志加入我们行列的人，但在开始之前，你需要积攒更多的经验。请稍后再来和我谈谈。"
G["We welcome the opportunity to fight by your side, mighty Thorim."]="托里姆，希望今后还能与你并肩作战。"
G["We were afraid you'd been caught, but I wouldn't think of leaving you out of the portal ritual."]="我们很担心你会被抓住，但我绝不想把你排除在传送门仪式之外。"
G["We were all set to sail into Northrend, but we've noticed a severe number of pests aboard our ship."]="我们已经做好了扬帆诺森德的准备，突然发现船上出现了大批害虫。"
G["We were all trained to strengthen our minds against the sha's influence, but it is stronger than we imagined."]="我们都受过抵抗煞魔影响的意志强化训练，可这比我们想象的还要厉害。"
G["We were attacked on the road across Transborea by necromancers. What was I to do?"]="穿越横贯冰原时我们遭到了通灵师的袭击。在那种情况下，我能干什么呢？"
G["We were called.\n\nWe sailed deep into uncharted waters, at first on orders from High Chieftan Baine Bloodhoof.\n\nIt was my wife Leza whose visions gave us a course to sail by.\n\nBut when we saw the wall of mists, we all began to feel the call like a voice on the wind. North. The voice calls for us to travel north.\n\nWe came ashore, dismantled our ship, and sailed up river by canoe until we hit the cliff you see before us."]="我们是被召唤来的。\n\n最初，我们是受大酋长贝恩·血蹄之命远航进入未知的水域。\n\n是我的妻子莱莎的预见指引了我们的航线。\n\n可是当我们看到重重迷雾的时候，我们都感受到风中传来低语般的召唤。北方。那声音召唤我们前往北方。\n\n我们登上海岸，拆卸掉船只，乘坐独木舟逆着河流而上，直到撞上我们面前这片悬崖。"
G["We were created by the mogu. There is no reason not to believe it. Anybody who denies it is ignorant, or living in fantasy.\n\nI refuse to pretend I am a devilsaur. I know what I am. I know where my strength comes from."]="我们是由魔古族创造出来的。我们没道理拒绝相信这一点。任何否认它的人要么是无知，要么就是活在幻想之中。\n\n我可不想假装自己是一头魔暴龙。我知道我是什么。我知道我的力量从何而来。"
G["We were drawn here by visions of this place. But even the visions pale in comparison to the Vale's beauty."]="我们被这里的景色吸引。但是，即使是这样的景色，也无法与四风谷的美景相比。"
G["We were driven away, Great Spirit. Hexmaster Zalazane took de Isles from us...  drove us mad, made us fight one another. De only trolls left in de Echo Isles are his mindless voodoo slaves."]="伟大的英灵，我们饱受欺凌。妖术之主扎拉赞恩夺走了我们的岛屿家园……他让我们疯狂地自相残杀。回音群岛上只剩下他那些失去意识的巨魔奴隶。"
G["We were duped.  This is definitely not the promised land!"]="我们被愚弄了。这根本不是他们所承诺的乐土！"
G["We were findin' carp behind the furniture for weeks!"]="我们已经喋喋不休地吵了几个星期了！"
G["We were fine until we ate from this tainted grain of yours!"]="我们本来身体好好的，就是吃了这些被污染的粮食之后才病倒的！"
G["We were fools to entrust an imbecile like Cho'gall with such a sacred duty! I will deal with you intruders myself!"]="把如此神圣的使命交给古加尔那种傻瓜真是太蠢了！我会亲自解决你们这些入侵者！"
G["We were fools to take up arms against each other, Darius.  The worgen would've never stood a chance."]="我们不应该愚蠢地相互残杀，达利乌斯。这些狼人原本毫无机会的。"
G["We were forced to retreat. Thermaplugg continues to hide behind the radiation, sending his crony, Crushcog, to harass us here on the surface."]="我们不得不撤退。瑟玛普拉格则继续躲在地下的辐射尘中，派遣他的部下碎轮来到地面上作恶。"
G["We were fortunate enough to find the Vale after it opened its gates. We sought refuge, and have found safe haven.\n\nAre you lost? May I help you find something?"]="我们有幸在大门打开后找到了这片山谷。我们寻求庇护，然后就找到了安全的避风港。\n\n你迷路了吗？我可以帮你什么忙吗？"
G["We were heading west when we received word of the mantid attack and redirected here."]="在得知螳螂妖袭击的消息时，我们正在向西进发，随后我们就改变方向来到了这里。"
G["We were here to scout for an invasion, but they already knew we were coming."]="我们是来侦察敌人的入侵行动的，可他们已经知道我们来了。"
G["We were hoping you wouldn't surrender peacefully!"]="我们一直都在希望你不会轻易投降！"
G["We were in luck to find enough parts to get these babies working again!\nHow can I help you?"]="能找到足够的零件让这些宝贝儿重新运转起来，还真是幸运！\n我能帮你什么忙吗？"
G["We were investigating the crypt for sha corruption... and everything went horribly wrong.  Our leader, Jin Ironfist, was possessed and began killing everyone.  Even now he is in there looking for more victims."]="我们当时正在地穴里调查邪煞的腐化情况……然后一切都变得很不对劲。我们的领袖金·铁拳被邪煞控制了，开始大开杀戒。即便是现在，他还在那里加害无辜。"
G["We were investigating the temple when a mogu warlord and his retinue arrived.\n\nThose of us not slain immediately were taken prisoner.\n\nI was left for dead and have been hiding here since.\n\nI don't know what the mogu are here for, though it can't be anything good!"]="我们当时正在调查寺庙，一个魔古军阀突然带着大批随从闯了进来。\n\n好多人当场毙命，剩下的都被抓走了。\n\n他们以为我死了，我一直躲在这里才逃过一劫。\n\n我不知道那些魔古族来这里干什么，但肯定不是好事！"
G["We were just trying to eat and suddenly zombies started to appear!"]="我们刚刚要吃东西，僵尸突然就出现了！"
G["We were lucky to meet up with these other Horde survivors. I did not realize that our brethren had washed up elsewhere on this new land."]="能与其他的部落幸存者重聚真是太幸运了。我根本没想到，还有别的同胞也被冲上了这片全新的土地。"
G["We were making progress with our plague in Undercity.  All of a sudden our strains keep failing!"]="幽暗城的药剂样本原本已经取得了一些进展。但是不知道怎么回事，突然又不行了！"
G["We were most fortunate to escape, $n. Follow me."]="我们是得以逃脱的幸运儿，$n。跟着我。"
G["We were not safe at all. They were waiting for us. Our forces are scattered throughout the swamp, and we are alone behind enemy lines!"]="我们还不安全。他们早就等着我们了。部队散落在沼泽各处，而我们却孤军深入敌后！"
G["We were on our way to Dawn's Blossom for a festival before you arrived! When I imagined fireworks tonight, I didn't expect it to be like this!"]="我们正赶去晨芳园过节，然后你就出现了！当我想象今夜的绚烂焰火时，我可没想到会是这样的！"
G["We were on our way to the Tiger Temple when you caught us. Lucky for you our healer was napping... apparently."]="你抓住我们的时候，我们正前往白虎寺。算你走运，我们的治疗者在打盹……很显然。"
G["We were promised safety! Security!"]="他们说过会确保我们的安全！安全！"
G["We were still goin' north when we stopped near this big ol' clearing."]="我们继续北上，一直走到这片空地附近。"
G["We were successful, Kalecgos."]="我们成功了，卡雷苟斯。"
G["We were to be rewarded for the best work we'd ever done, and we were... with this."]="我们被告知，我们将因为自己最伟大的工作而得到奖励，但我们……只得到了这样的下场。"
G["We were working on this wall here and... well, I don't even remember.  Who are you, anyhow?  Where's Gearslip?"]="当时我们正在这里对付这堵墙，然后……额，我不记得了。那么，你是谁？轮滑去哪儿了？"
G["We were.  My new friend here performed stunningly!"]="没错。我新朋友的表现令人震惊！"
G["We will act when we know what we need, old friend.  The druids have proven wise and capable of making their own decisions."]="Actuaremos cuando sepamos lo que necesitamos, $gamigo:amiga;. Los druidas han demostrado ser sabios y competentes tomando sus propias decisiones."
G["We will all be tested this day, but we shall prevail."]="今天，我们都将接受最后的考验，但胜利一定属于我们。"
G["We will always remember Kargath Bladefist for what he once was to the Horde. He was one of the finest warriors to ever live, even the Alliance recognizes this.\n\nThe Kargath Expeditionary force was named in his honor, and I plan to ensure we live up to his name. We will drive out the Dark Iron Dwarves and claim Blackrock Mountain, and all of the surrounding areas, for the Horde as they so rightfully belong.\n\nYou will be the Warchief's blade against Thaurissan. Wear that honor proudly."]="我们将永远纪念卡加斯·刃拳，为了他曾经为部落所做的一切。他是有史以来最优秀的战士之一。即使是联盟也不能否认这一点。\n\n卡加斯远征军以他为名，也以他为荣。我们将在他的名义下，驱逐黑铁矮人，夺回黑石山以及其周围区域。这些都是应该属于部落的国土。\n\n你将成为酋长对抗索瑞森的有力武器。这也是属于你的巨大光荣。"
G["We will attack as one!"]="我们并肩作战！"
G["We will attack from the opposite side, $c. The alliance won't expect a ground assault this quickly. Find me when the slaughter is over."]="我们会从另一侧进攻，$c。联盟不会料到，我们这么快就发起地面攻击。等屠杀结束后再来找我。"
G["We will battle along side you until the bitter end, $g sir:ma'am;!"]="我愿与你并肩作战，直到最后一刻！"
G["We will battle these fiends, together! Nighthaven's Defenders are also among us. They will fight to the death if asked. Now, quickly, we must drive these aberrations back to the Nightmare. Destroy them all!"]="我们将一同对抗这些恶魔！永夜港的卫兵也加入了我们的队伍，他们将誓死抗敌。现在我们必须将这些疯狂的家伙赶回梦魇。消灭他们！"
G["We will battle together to rid this quarry of the Scourge!"]="让我们一起毁掉天灾军团的采石场！"
G["We will be at capacity soon enough."]="很快就要蓄满了。"
G["We will be victorious! Do not relent!"]="我们会胜利的！不要懦弱！"
G["We will be watching you."]="我们会留意你们的行动。"
G["We will become legend."]="我们会名留青史的。"
G["We will blanket the Vale in your bloody bodies!"]="我们将取你的血来祭奠这个山谷！"
G["We will bring the might of all races to the Lich King, and he will be defeated."]="我们将集结所有的力量向巫妖王发动攻击，而他，注定会失败。"
G["We will burn your lands!"]="我们会燃焦你们的土地！"
G["We will bury you in your mountain!"]="我们会……让你们葬身山腹！"
G["We will carve a path through this wretched place and find a way to enter the Halls of Reflection. I sense powerful magic hidden away within those halls. Magic that could be the key to destroying the Scourge!"]="我们要想办法杀出一条通往映像大厅的血路。我感到那里潜藏着强大的魔法。那将是摧毁天灾军团的关键！"
G["We will cause you no trouble. We seek only to continue our research in peace."]="我们不会给你惹麻烦的。我们只想安安静静地继续我们的研究。"
G["We will claim this land in the name of the Horde, or die trying!"]="我们将以部落之名夺取这片土地，至死方休！"
G["We will cleanse this world in steel and fire!"]="我们要用铁与火净化这个世界！"
G["We will conquer all, for we are the Burning Legion!  Our enemies shall be consumed in flame and crushed beneath our might!"]="我们会征服一切，因为我们是燃烧军团！我们的敌人会在火焰中被融毁，被我们的力量所碾碎！"
G["We will continue to monitor the mogu's activity, $n. However, I am afraid that what lies ahead will require greater strength than you currently possess. Return to us when you have gained more experience."]="我们会继续监视魔古族的动态，$n。但是，恐怕要具备更大的力量才能应对前方的危险，你目前还没做好准备。等你累积更多经验后，再回来找我们吧。"
G["We will crush Arthas! The Scourge cannot stand up to the might of the Horde!"]="我们要杀死阿尔萨斯！即便是天灾军团，也不能与部落抗衡！"
G["We will crush the Bladespire clan.  Then we will have Gruul the Dragonkiller's favor!"]="我们会摧毁刀塔氏族，得到屠龙者格鲁尔的青睐！"
G["We will cut a swath of destruction through this cursed place and find a way to enter the Halls of Reflection. If there is anything of value to be found here, it will be found in the halls."]="我们会一路杀进这个被诅咒的地方，找到进入映像大厅的入口。那里一定隐藏着某些极具价值的情报。"
G["We will defeat Garrosh and restore the Horde!"]="我们要击败加尔鲁什，重建部落！"
G["We will defeat the Twilight's Hammer wherever they may hide.  Not even the elemental planes will be a safe haven for their kind."]="不管暮光之锤的信徒们藏到哪里，我们都将击败他们。就连元素位面也不是他们安全的避风港。"
G["We will defend our lands!"]="我们会守卫自己的土地！"
G["We will demonstrate the limits of power without vision to guide it."]="我们将会看到，失去指引的力量会有怎样的局限。"
G["We will destroy all who oppose us!"]="我们将毁灭所有反对我们的人！"
G["We will destroy them. Their blood-red blood-will flow freely upon our swords. As we have destroyed the Draenei, so now we will destroy the humans!"]="我们将消灭他们。他们的鲜血将在我们的剑刃上流淌。就像我们消灭了德莱尼人那样，现在我们将消灭人类！"
G["We will destroy you, puny creature!"]="可怜虫，我们要杀死你！"
G["We will destroy you."]="我们会毁灭你。"
G["We will die trying!"]="我们将奋战至死！"
G["We will do better, champion. Behold! The Crown of Heaven! My gift to you."]="我们能做得更好。看！苍穹之冠！这是我的礼物。"
G["We will do our best to protect the refugees, but with the mogu pushing into the Vale, it may not remain safe for long."]="我们将尽全力保护难民，但在魔古族大举杀进山谷的当下，安全不会持续多久。"
G["We will do this with honor, Darion. We will not sink to the levels of the Scourge to be victorious. To do so would make us no better than the monster that we fight to destroy!"]="我们要光明正大地战斗，达里安。不能为了胜利，做出和天灾军团一样的行径。如果我们那么做了，和怪物又有什么差别！"
G["We will do what we can, dear sister. We are not warriors, we cannot simply drive the outsiders away."]="我们只能尽力而为，亲爱的妹妹。我们不是战士，无法赶走外来者。"
G["We will double our efforts!"]="我们会加倍努力的！"
G["We will drive our foes from Silverpine, then bring the tides of war to their very capital!"]="我们要把敌人驱赶出银松森林，把战火烧到他们的首都！"
G["We will drive you from our lands!"]="我们会把你们全部驱逐！"
G["We will drive you from the beach. The Pandaren will tremble before our might!"]="我们会把你们从这片海滩上赶回去。在那之后，所有熊猫人都会屈服于我们的力量！"
G["We will enslave the quilboar!"]="我们要奴役野猪人！"
G["We will fail to defend Pandaria."]="我们无力保卫潘达利亚。"
G["We will fight beside you, A'dal."]="我们会和您并肩战斗，阿达尔。"
G["We will fight them in the alleys, until our knuckles are skinned and bloody and our rapiers lay on the ground shattered."]="我们会在巷道里战斗，直到我们用尽最后一丝气力，手中的刀剑崩成碎片。"
G["We will fight them on the streets until the last shot is fired.  And when there's no more ammunition, we'll crush their skulls with the stones that pave our city."]="我们会在城市中战斗，直到射出最后一颗子弹，然后我们会掘起铺路的石块，砸向他们的脑袋。"
G["We will fight to the last!"]="我们会战斗到最后一刻！"
G["We will fight when you are ready, $n."]="Lucharemos cuando estés $gpreparado:preparada;, $n."
G["We will fight when you are ready."]="Lucharemos cuando estés $gpreparado:preparada;."
G["We will fight you until the end, then, Lantresor. We will not stand idly by as you pillage our towns and kill our people."]="那么，我们会和你战斗到底，兰特瑞索。我们不会就这么眼睁睁看着你掠夺我们的村庄，杀害我们的人民。"
G["We will fight you with every fiber of our being - until we are nothing more than dust and debris. We will fight until the end."]="我们将竭尽全力于你抗衡——直到化为尘埃。我们会战斗到最后一刻。"
G["We will find it, and we will remove it.  You have our word!"]="我们会找到它然后拔掉它的，我们向您保证！"
G["We will find out."]="我们会知道的。"
G["We will find the answers here in Pandaria."]="我们将在潘达利亚寻找答案。"
G["We will find these words. We will summon your master and we will destroy him."]="我们会找到这些咒语。我们会召唤你的主人，并把他消灭掉。"
G["We will find what the Master is looking for!  Failure is not an option!"]="我们必须找到主人想要的东西！只许成功，不许失败！"
G["We will find you, monster!"]="我们会找到你的，怪物！"
G["We will finish this another time... son of Grom."]="格罗姆之子……我们还是另找时间吧。"
G["We will follow your lead, heroes. The Scourgelord will die this eve."]="英雄们，我们会追随你们的领导。今夕就是天灾领主的死期。"
G["We will free the admiral during the dawning."]="我们将在黎明之时把将军放出来。"
G["We will give our lives for the Empress without hesitation. She is the light, and without Her our lives will be lost to darkness."]="我们会毫不犹豫的为女皇献出生命。她就是明灯，没有她，我们的生命都将陷入无边黑暗。"
G["We will give you a swift death!"]="我们会让你死个痛快！"
G["We will give you who have fallen another chance. You are not vrykul, so you cannot be held to such a high standard."]="我们会再给战败者一次机会的。你们不是维库人，不能用比武场严格的标准要求你们。"
G["We will go about our business now. Good day."]="我们去做我们自己的事了。再见。"
G["We will grind you under our heels!"]="我们会将你们踩在脚下！"
G["We will guard this place, $n, and hope for your safe return."]="我们会继续守护这片土地，$n，希望你能平安归来。"
G["We will handle them!"]="我们会解决他们！"
G["We will have much good news to report to Lord Taran.\n\nNews of our victory here at Osul Peak will ring gladly in his ears."]="我们可以给踏岚掌门带去许多好消息了。\n\n我们在奥苏尔峰这里的胜利一定会让他高兴的。"
G["We will have revenge... some day."]="总有一天……我们要复仇。"
G["We will have to regroup quickly if we hope to destroy the alliance."]="要是我们希望消灭联盟，就得尽快重整部队了。"
G["We will have to work quickly Wakener. This area is not safe."]="我们得加快速度了，唤醒者。这里并不安全。"
G["We will have to work quickly if we want to find the remains."]="要是我们想找到遗骸，就必须赶快行动。"
G["We will have vengeance!"]="我们一定会复仇的！"
G["We will hold until the reinforcements come. As long as men with stout hearts are manning the walls and the throne, Stormwind will hold."]="我们要坚守阵地，等待援军到达。只要勇敢的将士仍在保卫城墙和王庭，暴风城就不会沦陷。"
G["We will hunt this traitor down.  That I promise."]="我们要找到那个叛徒。我发誓。"
G["We will investigate this hut. Perhaps they have seen Alliance survivors."]="调查一下这个小屋。里面的人或许见过联盟的幸存者。"
G["We will learn who the greatest brewmaster is.  We know the breweries are up for the challenge.  We would not have invited them otherwise."]="我们马上就能知道谁是最棒的酿酒师啦。酿酒师们都非常期待这场比赛，否则我们也不会邀请他们了。"
G["We will leave you to your training, Ilthalaine. This is your area of expertise."]="我们会让你继续你的训练，伊尔萨莱恩。在这方面你才是行家。"
G["We will locate the origin of the Nightmare through the fragments you collected, $n. From there we will pull Eranikus through a rift in the Dream. Steel yourself, $c. We are inviting the embodiment of the Nightmare into our world."]="我们会根据你收集的碎片找出梦魇的源头，$n。那样我们就能打开一条裂缝，把伊兰尼库斯从翡翠梦境中拉出来。要坚强，$c。我们将要邀请梦魇的化身进入我们的世界。"
G["We will make sure to honor Lin's courage."]="我们一定会表彰林的英勇事迹的。"
G["We will make this province safe again. Zhu's legacy will not end with this."]="我们会让朱家界重获安宁。朱的遗产不会就此消失。"
G["We will make this right, Jaina. Tell your king all that you have learned here."]="我们会妥善处理的，吉安娜。请你把这里的情况转告国王吧。"
G["We will meet again soon."]="我们很快就会再见面的。"
G["We will meet again... Someday."]="我们总有一天……会再见面的。"
G["We will miss you, Antonidas."]="我们会想你的，安东尼达斯。"
G["We will move ahead, Kilag."]="我们要前进，基拉格。"
G["We will need Anduin's help to move on the temple. When he's ready, we'll begin."]="我们需要安度因帮忙，才能对寺庙采取行动。等他准备好，我们就开始。"
G["We will need more veteran Shado-Pan among us before we can confront it.  We'll stop at the encampments along the way."]="我们需要更多身经百战的影踪派弟子才能挑战它。我们会在沿途的营地停留。"
G["We will need the help of ALL the elements to save Thrall from this place. The lieutenants of Ragnaros will not be nearly as compromising as Cyclonas, Hydrius, or even Therazane."]="我们需要所有元素的帮助才能救回萨尔。拉格纳罗斯的爪牙可没有赛克隆纳斯、海卓里斯或者塞拉赞恩那么好说话。"
G["We will need the strongest the Shado-Pan has to offer for the confrontation with the Sha of Hatred. And it's likely that even then, not all of us will make it out alive."]="我们需要集结影踪派最强大的力量来对付恨之煞。即便这样，也不是所有人都能活下来。"
G["We will neutralize him and take his route. Let's go!"]="我们得干掉他，并利用他的航线。动手！"
G["We will never allow it... We have banished him from our world before and we will banish him again."]="我们不会让这种事发生的……我们以前曾经放逐过他，我们会再次放逐他的。"
G["We will never be without power! I have secured our future! Bask in my glory!"]="我们再也不会缺乏足够的力量了！我拯救了我们的未来！享受我的荣耀吧！"
G["We will never dissipate, mortal... Our fate is tied to Gorefiend..."]="我们永远都不会消散，凡人……我们的命运与塔隆紧紧相连……"
G["We will never fail ya!"]="我们绝不会辜负他！"
G["We will never fall to these cowards! The Horde stands united against all enemies! Lok'tar Ogar!"]="我们绝不向这些懦夫低头！部落将团结一致对抗所有敌人！Lok'tar Ogar！"
G["We will never forget your bravery, $n. You are always welcome in Wintergarde.\n\nWould you like to make this inn your home?"]="Nunca olvidaremos tu valor, $n. Siempre serás bienvenido en Hibergarde.\n\n¿Te gustaría establecer tu hogar en esta posada?"
G["We will never stop fighting for Lordaeron. Never..."]="我们永远不会放弃洛丹伦。永远不会……"
G["We will never surrender our right to rule the destiny of our people!"]="我们绝不交出决定我们族人命运的权利！"
G["We will never yield our defense of the Vale!"]="我们永远不会放弃对山谷的防护！"
G["We will not allow this to come to pass."]="我们不允许出现这样的事情。"
G["We will not be caught in the middle of your war for any longer than we can help it. You may stay here and tend to your wounded, but that is the end of our involvment."]="我们决不会让自己卷入你们的战斗。你可以留在这里，照料伤员，但休想拖我们下水。"
G["We will not be forgotten, no, no, no..."]="我们不能被遗忘，不，不……"
G["We will not be stopped!"]="我们是不会被阻止的！"
G["We will not be swayed from our mission!"]="我们一定会完成使命的！"
G["We will not be the only village to rise against the Thunder King!"]="不会只有我们一个村庄挺身对抗雷电之王！"
G["We will not die as slaves... we're Gilneans!"]="我们不会作为奴隶而死……我们是吉尔尼斯人！"
G["We will not fail!"]="我们不会失败！"
G["We will not fail."]="我们不会失败的。"
G["We will not falter."]="我们绝不动摇。"
G["We will not give in to the despair of the dark void. If Her will for us is to perish, then it shall be so."]="我们不会向黑暗虚空的绝望屈服。如果女皇要我们去死，我们便照做。"
G["We will not go quietly into the night! We will not vanish without a fight!"]="我们不会沉默地堕入黑夜！我们不会不经一战就自行消失！"
G["We will not rest until our duties here are done."]="在完成任务之前，我们不能休息。"
G["We will not tolerate those who unleashed the sha upon our land."]="我们不会容忍那些将煞魔释放到我们家园的人们。"
G["We will overcome this.  Do not give into panic."]="不要慌，我们一定能渡过难关。"
G["We will overwhelm you before you can react."]="我们会在你做出反应前将你粉碎。"
G["We will pay back the Alliance for their betrayal a thousandfold. We will never forgive and never forget."]="我们会让联盟千倍偿还他们的背叛。我们永远也不会原谅和忘记这种耻辱。"
G["We will prove our loyalty - to the Council, Ironforge, and the Alliance - here, today, and with our own blood."]="此时此地，我们将用自己的鲜血向议会、铁炉堡和联盟证明自己的忠诚。"
G["We will purge this land!"]="我们将净化这片土地！"
G["We will push them back, Anachronos. This I vow. Uphold your end of this task. Let not your hands falter as you seal our fates behind the barrier."]="阿纳克洛斯，我们会击退他们的。我发誓会支持你完成这项任务。当你动手封印这股毁灭的力量时，千万不要出错。"
G["We will ravage the living... I mean the Scourge, of course."]="摧毁那些行尸走肉……我当然是指天灾军团。"
G["We will rebuild our empire on the corpses of our enemies!"]="我们要在敌人的尸体上重建帝国！"
G["We will reclaim this world."]="我们将重塑这个世界。"
G["We will reclaim thisss land. Gurubashi land.  An' we kill anyone dat getssss in our way!"]="我们会重夺这片土地。古拉巴什之地。阻挡者都要死！"
G["We will reclaim what is rightfully ours!"]="我们要夺回本该属于我们的一切！"
G["We will repay the betrayal of the Alliance! We shall never forget, and never forgive!"]="我们会报复联盟！我们永远也不会忘记，永远也不会原谅他们！"
G["We will rest here in the Vale until we have gathered our research. Then, we must find a way home."]="在收集我们所要的信息之前，我们都在这个谷里休息。然后，我们必须想方设法回家。"
G["We will retake Icemist. The Anub'ar will be expelled from our city."]="我们要夺回冰雾村，将阿努巴尔赶出我们的家园。"
G["We will retake these wards!"]="我们会重新夺回这些结界的！"
G["We will return swiftly with our report."]="我们很快就会返回牦牛村汇报情况的。"
G["We will return to Lion's Landing. Meet us there when you have everything."]="我们要返回雄师港了。你准备好以后和我们在那里碰头。"
G["We will return, dear friend.  We will come back, to take what belongs to us.  This I swear!"]="我们会回来的，亲爱的朋友。我们会回来夺取属于我们的一切。这是我的誓言！"
G["We will rise again, and your kind will be made to serve!"]="我们会再次崛起，你们这些家伙都将成为奴隶！"
G["We will root out all corruption within Orgrimmar."]="我们要根除奥格瑞玛的一切腐败。"
G["We will rout out dissention among these mongrels!"]="我们要把所有异端从这群杂种中找出来，清除出去！"
G["We will save him, $n. We MUST."]="我们一定会救出他，海卓里斯！一定会。"
G["We will save him, Suna. I promise."]="孙娜，我们会救出他的。我保证。"
G["We will scout ahead to the Wild Overlook and see you there, Kilag."]="我们将要向前搜索，直到荒野瞭望台。在那里见，基拉格。"
G["We will see if he has managed to keep up his end of the bargain."]="让我们看看，他到底能不能完成自己的承诺。"
G["We will send scouts to assess the situation. I will also convene with the Lady Proudmoore and see what plans the Alliance has."]="我们要派斥候去查探敌情。我还要和普罗德摩尔女士会晤，看看联盟有什么打算。"
G["We will send you to your grave!"]="我们要把你送进坟墓！"
G["We will set the elements free of your grasp by force!"]="我们会用武力把元素之灵从你的魔掌中解救出来！"
G["We will show da warchief da valor and skill of da Darkspears!"]="我们要向酋长展示暗矛的勇猛和卓越战技！"
G["We will show our enemies no quarter!"]="对敌人要绝不手软！"
G["We will show you..."]="我们会给你看……"
G["We will slay you all as easily as we slew the Pandaren of old."]="干掉你们简直易如反掌，就像过去屠杀熊猫人一样。"
G["We will soon find out. He is cornered like a rat down one of these corridors."]="我们很快就知道了。他就像老鼠一样躲在某条地道里。"
G["We will speak again, but away from here."]="我们应该谈谈，不过不是在这里。"
G["We will spread across this barren land!"]="我们要统治这片贫瘠之地！"
G["We will stand idle no longer! The time to act is now!"]="我们不会再袖手旁观了！现在是采取行动的时候！"
G["We will stop the Shadow Council and put an end to their atrocities!"]="我们必须阻止暗影议会的暴行！"
G["We will suffer no demon's servant in our lands!"]="我们怎能忍受有恶魔的爪牙在这片土地上肆虐横行！"
G["We will suffer no interruptions!"]="绝不容忍外人的打扰！"
G["We will take everything from them, death knight."]="我们将夺走他们的一切，死亡骑士。"
G["We will take from the land if it refuses to give!"]="如果它们拒绝给予，我们就强夺！"
G["We will take our leave. Again, welcome to all of you."]="我们就要离开了。再次欢迎你们所有人。"
G["We will take the fight to Arthas, and we will tear down the walls of Icecrown!"]="我们要继续抗争阿尔萨斯，我们终将推倒冰冠冰川的城墙！"
G["We will tear out your eyes!"]="我们要挖掉你的眼珠！"
G["We will throw these Alliance curs back into the sea!"]="我们要把那些联盟渣滓赶进海里去！"
G["We will track this traitor down, my lady.  You've no reason to worry."]="我们定会捉住那名叛徒的，我尊敬的女士。您无需担忧。"
G["We will triumph. It is only a matter... of time."]="我们会胜利的。这只是个……时间问题。"
G["We will walk together, $n."]="$n，让我们并肩战斗吧。"
G["We will win in the end."]="我们一定能取得最终的胜利。"
G["We will win this land with the sword, and break it with the plow! You are the men and women who will be remembered for taming the wild continent!"]="我们要用刀剑夺得这片土地的所有权，然后用犁来开垦荒地！而你们，将作为拓荒的先驱者，被后世传颂。"
G["We will... never... give up!"]="我们……绝不……放弃！"
G["We wiped and I didn't get my gear."]="我们精疲力尽，而且我也没拿到装备。"
G["We wish that we could create more than one darkrune in a day, but that would be a waste of time.  It's simply not physically possible.  Besides, we can't even reliably create them at that rate.\n\nAnd trust us, if there were anyone else here smart enough to help, they'd be conscripted and we'd have as many darkrunes as needed."]="我们希望每天都能制造出一个以上的黑暗符印，但那样做太浪费时间了。从自然法则上来讲也办不到，而且我们的能力有限，这样的出产频率恐怕很难实现。\n\n只要有聪明的家伙愿意帮忙，我们就会将他们征召过来，以此获得更多的黑暗符印。"
G["We wish to face the Defiler."]="我们希望能够亲自挑战污染者。"
G["We wish to help you, spirit. We seek your wisdom."]="我们希望能帮助你，灵魂。我们寻求你的智慧。"
G["We won't allow you to leave this valley!"]="我们不会让你离开这个山谷的！"
G["We won't have much time before they're onto us. Let's begin."]="用不了多久他们就会发现我们的。开始吧。"
G["We won't lose a horse.  Look at them!  They look exactly like they did when we started."]="我们不会失去马的。看看它们！它们还和我们刚刚出发时一样精力充沛。"
G["We won't survive another attack, Dan. You gotta get us out of here!"]="我们经不起再一轮的攻击了。快带我们离开这里！"
G["We work to preserve the balance as Cenarius teaches, $c.  His is the light of a beacon that shows the way for us, and we must do everything in our power to preserve that light."]="我们的工作就是保持平衡，如同塞纳留斯所教给我们的一样，$c。他就是指引我们前进的明灯，而我们必须竭尽所能保护它的光芒。"
G["We work well together, $n.  I couldn't have taken that warp-gate down without you!"]="我们合作得很好，$n。如果没有你的话，我是不可能拆掉那些迁跃门的！"
G["We would like to fight the Ancient Bloodcrown Crane."]="我们想与远古血冠鹤战斗。"
G["We would like to fight the Colossal Viseclaw."]="我们想与巨型钳爪蟹战斗。"
G["We would like to fight the Krasari Elder."]="我们想与卡桑利老年虎战斗。"
G["We would not lose."]="我们绝不能输。"
G["We would rather die than be turned into worgen, but seeing as how even death provides no relief from the atrocities of this war..."]="我们宁死也不愿变成狼人。但我们也知道，即使是死亡也无法让我们逃避这场残暴的战争……"
G["We wouldn't be in this mess if Tankiss would learn to keep the heat off his healer."]="要是坦齐斯能够照看好他的治疗者，我们也不至于搞的一塌糊涂。"
G["We wouldn't be in this mess if it weren't for the gnomes!\n\nIt's a well-known fact that they were the ones that caused the Cataclysm with all of their world-enlarging devices, and other such nonsense!"]="要不是因为那些侏儒，我们怎么会陷入这种混乱！\n\n众所周知，他们才是大灾变的罪魁祸首！引起灾难的就是他们那些能放大世界的装置和诸如此类的破烂！"
G["We wouldn't have crashed if Hemet could learn how to avoid shooting through the ailerons when he's trying to bag game on the ground!\n\nNo worries though, I'll have her fixed up quick enough."]="若是赫米特知道如何在射击猎物时避免打中机翼的话，我们就不会坠毁。\n\n不用担心，我会很快把它修好的。"
G["We wrecked out here after Soggy took us way off course from our original charter. Thought he could pull a fast one on us. Hah!\n\nTruthfully, we're all glad he tried. Not one of us is an \"easy day's work\" kinda person."]="Naufragamos aquí cuando Aguado nos desvió de nuestra ruta original. Creyó que podía jugárnosla. ¡Ja!\n\nA decir verdad, nos alegramos de que lo intentara. Ninguno de nosotros es amante del \"trabajo fácil\"."
G["We'd be best friends.  I bet me and Anduin would also be best friends, too.  Friends are important."]="我们会成为好朋友的。我敢打赌我和安度因也会成为好朋友的。朋友是最宝贵的财富。"
G["We'd be gettin' ready to take back da Echo Isles. Zalazane has been workin' his voodoo magic for some time, convincing folks dat he be dead and performing ancient dark rituals.\n\nHe knows we'd be coming, so we have ta make sure we be prepared."]="我们正在为夺回回音群岛做准备。扎拉赞恩一直在施展他的黑暗魔法，操纵傀儡，进行古老的黑暗仪式。\n\n他知道我们的行动，所以我们必须做好万全的准备。"
G["We'd been having a rough spot these past months.  Everyone has I guess."]="过去这几个月我们一同经历了一段困难的时光。我猜所有人都是。"
G["We'd best head back, $n.  These simpletons don't know what a grave mistake they're making."]="我们还是回去吧，$n。这帮傻蛋根本就不会意识到他们犯了天大的错误。"
G["We'd better help them out and worry about the others later. Let's go!"]="我们先救出他们，然后再担心其它人。出发！"
G["We'd better keep moving before this whole island finds out we're here."]="我们最好抢在全岛的敌人都发现我们之前继续前进."
G["We'd do well not to be reckless.  There's still much to learn about this land and about the enemy."]="我们应该把事情做好，而不是不计后果。仍然有很多关于这个世界和这些敌人的东西需要我们去学习。"
G["We'd gone an hour without an injury report. That's a new record!"]="我们在过去的一小时内没有收到负伤报告。这可是项新纪录！"
G["We'd need to bring this information back to Pearlfin Village... but not before shooting a few orcs in the head."]="我们得把这个消息带回珠鳍村……但首先，让我们收拾几个肮脏的兽人。"
G["We'll all end up serving the Lich King, kid.  Better this way than becoming a rotten corpse."]="最终，我们都会成为巫妖王的仆从。孩子，这比变成一具腐烂的尸体好多了。"
G["We'll be doin' exactly that then. Ya have our tanks, Stonemother."]="我们会照做的。感谢您，石母。"
G["We'll be handing him over to Hellscream once he's had some time to cool off. Can't have him destroying our prize, can we?"]="当地狱咆哮冷静下来之后，我们再将他移送过去。我们不能让他毁掉我们的奖品，对吧？"
G["We'll be marching all day if I see any more of that!"]="要是再让我看到这种事情，我们就行军一整天！"
G["We'll be notching our axes after this."]="在这之后我们会在斧头上刻下胜利的标记。"
G["We'll be out of here just as soon as I get this wagon fixed. . . ."]="当我把这辆马车修好后，咱们就马上离开这里……"
G["We'll be ready for 'em... You did a good job in warning us."]="我们必须立即备战……你的预警非常及时。"
G["We'll burn it to the ground before giving it to you!"]="我们要把这里彻底烧毁！"
G["We'll cleanse this place! Arthas beware!"]="我们会净化这片土地！阿尔萨斯，等着瞧吧！"
G["We'll clear the ruins of Horde while you work."]="在你工作的同时，我们会把部落从废墟里赶出去。"
G["We'll cover this front. You keep my priests safe."]="我们守住阵线，你去保护好牧师。"
G["We'll cover ye from the brush: Point out a target, and we'll open fire."]="我们会掩护你们，射杀你们指定的目标。"
G["We'll cut your throats and bleed you dry!"]="我们会割开你的喉咙，放干你的血！"
G["We'll dance on your bones!"]="我们会在你尸骨上跳舞！"
G["We'll deal with you soon enough."]="我们很快就会好好收拾你。"
G["We'll defend the ship and crew for as long as we're able.\n\nDon't worry about us!"]="我们会尽力保护船只和船员。\n\n别为我们担心！"
G["We'll drag you out here if we have to!"]="是不是非要我们把你拖出来啊！"
G["We'll drink their blood and feast on their bones!"]="生啖敌人的血肉！"
G["We'll drink yer stout and lager,\nDrain all the pints and kegs!\nWe'll drink and brawl and brawl and drink,\n'til we can't feel our legs!"]="我们畅饮辛辣的烈酒，\n喝光所有的酒桶！\n饮酒、猜拳，猜拳、饮酒，\n直到双腿失去知觉！"
G["We'll fight this to the very end!"]="我们要战斗到底！"
G["We'll get right on this, $gsir:ma'am;!"]="我们马上就开始，$g阁下:女士;！"
G["We'll get through this, $n.  We'll be wearing these beasts' pelts when we're done."]="我们会消灭他们的，$n。那些怪兽敌不过我们。"
G["We'll get to the bottom of this massacre if it's the last thing we do!"]="我们无论如何都要彻底调查这次惨案！"
G["We'll get to the bottom of this. Someone with your skills is exactly what we need."]="我们会查清这件事的。我们正需要你这样有能力的人。"
G["We'll get you out of there, Foreman, just HANG ON!"]="我们救你出来的，工头。坚持住！"
G["We'll get you out, Taretha. Don't worry. I doubt the wizard would wander too far away."]="我们会把你救出去的，塔蕾莎。不要担心。我怀疑那个巫师很可能在就在附近徘徊。"
G["We'll go ice skating as soon as the lake freezes over, honey."]="等湖面一冻上，我们就去溜冰，宝贝儿。"
G["We'll grant you a swift death, Arthas. More than can be said for the thousands you've tortured and slain."]="我们会让你死个痛快，阿尔萨斯。对于犯下累累罪行的你，这是最大的仁慈了。"
G["We'll have this whole island cleared out soon."]="我们很快就会把整座岛清理干净的。"
G["We'll have to go around."]="我们必须试试看。"
G["We'll have to make an emergency water landing!"]="我们要在水面上紧急迫降了！"
G["We'll have to tread carefully with all this teleporting in and out. We CANNOT risk Jaina finding out about this.\n\nAre you ready to go in?"]="Tendremos que andar con cuidado con tanto teletransporte. No podemos arriesgarnos a que Jaina nos descubra.\n\n¿Estás $glisto:lista; para entrar?"
G["We'll have your heads!"]="你逃不掉了！"
G["We'll hold Domination Point or die trying!"]="我们要誓死保卫统御岗哨！"
G["We'll hold Lion's Landing or die trying!"]="我们将誓死守卫雄师港！"
G["We'll hold the docks for the remaining landing parties. Follow the path to the gates of Orgrimmar, and make contact with Vol'jin and his revolutionaries."]="我们会守住码头，等待后续登陆部队。沿着这条路到奥格瑞玛的城门那里去，找到沃金和他的起义军。"
G["We'll hold the line, $n. You just worry about putting an end to Garrosh's madness."]="我们会守住战线的，$n。你只需要考虑如何阻止加尔鲁什的疯狂罪行。"
G["We'll hold them a few more moments!  Get into the shrine while you can!"]="我们会尽量拖延敌军！你一定要抓紧机会进入圣地！"
G["We'll hold them here for a moment.  Get into the shrine and stop those necromancers!"]="我们会设法牵制住敌军。你，进入圣地干掉那些通灵师！"
G["We'll hold them off as long as we can. Do whatever you need to do quickly!"]="我们会尽量阻止铁矮人大军。趁现在执行你的使命吧！"
G["We'll just have to improve our own teamwork to match the two of them."]="我们必须提高我们的团队协作能力，才能战胜那两个家伙。"
G["We'll keep the buckets coming."]="我们会一直送水桶过来。"
G["We'll keep you covered. Good luck with the assault!"]="我们会掩护你的。愿攻击一切顺利！"
G["We'll keep'm busy, sir!"]="我们不会让敌人轻易得手的，陛下！"
G["We'll kill anybody for the right price!"]="只要酬劳高，我们能干掉任何人！"
G["We'll know soon enough."]="我们马上就会知道了。"
G["We'll leave. We've no desire to stay where we're not welcome."]="我们会离开。我们无意继续留在不受欢迎之地。"
G["We'll let you in on our secret diet: Cocktails and dreams. We can help you with one."]="我们会为你奉上秘制饮品：鸡尾酒和梦想。至少我们能帮你实现其中一项。"
G["We'll let you into the city, this time."]="这次，我们让你进城。"
G["We'll made the Horde pay, we will!"]="我们要让部落付出代价，一定会的！"
G["We'll make use of these supplies to get everyone ready for a fight.\n\nContinue on. We'll meet you ahead."]="我们要利用那些补给为所有人做好战斗的准备。\n\n继续吧。我们会再见面的。"
G["We'll meet you at Kota Basecamp!"]="让我们在寇塔营地再见！"
G["We'll meet you back in camp."]="我们回营地汇合。"
G["We'll need at least 8 apples. And a few handfuls of craneberries - 50 should do it."]="我们至少需要8只苹果，还有一些蔓越莓——50个差不多了。"
G["We'll need to collect more data to substantiate these readings.  Get back in there and collect that data."]="我们需要收集更多的数据来证实这些信息。回去收集数据吧。"
G["We'll need to make a few modifications, but it will get the job done."]="我们需要做一点改装，但它会起作用的。"
G["We'll need twenty thousand more cog wheels, and another... hey! You can't just summon me away like that!"]="我们还需要两万个齿轮，以及……嘿！你不能这么召唤我！"
G["We'll never finish in time! Can't we make them go faster?"]="我们要来不及了！就不能让他们再快点吗？"
G["We'll never get these ships ready in time. The winter comes and with it our doom. I fear that the young prince has damned us all."]="我们不可能及时备好船只了。寒冬降临时，就是我们的末日。恐怕我们都被王子殿下遗弃了。"
G["We'll never yield to the mogu!"]="我们绝不向魔古族低头！"
G["We'll not let this act of madness go unpunished!"]="我们不会让这种疯狂行为不受到惩罚的！"
G["We'll post up here with some troops. Scout on ahead and see if you can flush Garrosh out of hiding."]="我们得留下一些部队。斥候去侦察一下，看能不能把加尔鲁什揪出来。"
G["We'll return, Liam.  I swear this to you."]="我们一定会回来的，利亚姆，我向你发誓。"
G["We'll run every last one of you fools from this land!"]="我们要把你们这些蠢货统统赶出这片土地！"
G["We'll see about that, Perelli. We'll see about that."]="皮雷利，我们会继续调查此事的。走着瞧吧。"
G["We'll see about that, young prince."]="那就来吧，年轻的王子。"
G["We'll see about that."]="我们走着瞧吧！"
G["We'll see how the Drakkari holds up against the might of the Scourge!"]="就让我们瞧瞧达卡莱巨魔要如何应对强大的天灾军团吧！"
G["We'll see if you revel so much in death once I've ripped out your throat!"]="我倒是要看看你死了以后还能怎么为非作歹！"
G["We'll set flight once everyone is ready."]="等所有人都准备好，我们就出发。"
G["We'll set up camp soon. First, we'll take advantage of this darkness to do some reconnaissance."]="我们马上就扎营。但首先，我们要趁天黑侦察一下周围的环境。"
G["We'll squish you like bugs!"]="碾碎你们，就像碾碎虫子！"
G["We'll start at that first energy pylon, straight ahead.  Remember, try to keep them off of me."]="我们从第一座能量塔开始，往正前方走。记住，别让他们靠近我。"
G["We'll start in just a moment.\n\nI just want to be very clear -- we're not here to soften them up. We're not here to make a dent. We're here to put an end to the disease that calls itself the Scarlet Onslaught.\n\nIf you don't want any part of that, if you don't have the stomach, fly away now. I want someone with us who is going to be here every day until the job's done.\n\nAre you that $g man : woman;, $n?"]="Empezaremos en un momento.\n\nSolo quiero ser muy claro: no estamos aquí para ablandarlos. No estamos aquí para hacerles mella. Estamos aquí para poner fin a esa enfermedad que se autodenomina El Embate Escarlata.\n\nSi no quieres formar parte de esto, si no tienes las agallas necesarias, vete volando ya. Quiero a alguien que esté con nosotros todos los días hasta terminar el trabajo.\n\n¿Eres tú esa persona, $n?"
G["We'll string his body from the trees and leave him swinging in the wind for the Alliance to discover. Go back and tell Warlord Bloodhilt the news!"]="我们要让联盟知道他是怎样完蛋的。你先回去，把这个消息告诉血柄督军。"
G["We'll take Booty Bay or Firallon'll spay us, howl out, me 'earties, aaaa-ooo!"]="我们要夺下藏宝海湾，否则菲尔拉伦会要我们好看，怒吼吧，水手们，啊啊啊啊——噢噢噢！"
G["We'll take over from here, you've earned quite a respite after that battle."]="这里就交给我们吧。在那场战斗之后，你已经赢得了大家的尊重。"
G["We'll track this traitor down, priestess.  You've no reason to worry."]="我们会抓住那名叛徒的，女祭司。您无需担心。"
G["We'll worry about him later. I need to get you to safety."]="我们以后再担心他吧。现在我先要保障你的安全。"
G["We're Orgrimmar and Azshara bound. Let's get this baby out to sea!"]="我们的目的地是奥格瑞玛和艾萨拉。舰船宝贝儿，起航！"
G["We're Orgrimmar bound, $g bud : girlie;, and then on to our new home in Azshara. See you there!"]="我们要先去奥格瑞玛，$g 小伙子 : 姑娘;，然后前往我们在艾萨拉的新家。在那儿见吧！"
G["We're all going to DIE in here!!!\n\nI'm a slave foreman... I wonder if it's too late to side with the Trade Prince?"]="我们都要死在这儿了！！！\n\n我是个奴隶工头……不知道现在投靠贸易大王还来得及吗？"
G["We're all going to die!"]="我们都死定了！"
G["We're all gonna die!"]="我们会没命的！"
G["We're all gonna die!!!"]="我们都要完蛋了！！！"
G["We're all ready."]="我们都准备好了。"
G["We're all very proud of Bael Modan. It was the first dwarven settlement in Kalimdor."]="我们为巴尔莫丹感到骄傲。它是矮人在卡利姆多的第一个定居点。"
G["We're almost done!"]="我们离成功很近了！"
G["We're almost done. Just the homestretch now!"]="我们就快完成了，坚持到底！"
G["We're almost out... just a little bit farther."]="我们就快脱险啦……还差一点。"
G["We're almost ready to depart. Just give us a little bit longer to finish our preparations."]="我们就快准备好啦。再给我们一点时间，很快就能出发了。"
G["We're almost ready. Keep on working!"]="就要完成了。再接再厉！"
G["We're almost there!"]="我们快到了！"
G["We're almost there. Just a bit more to go."]="我们快到了。还有一小段路程。"
G["We're almost there... Don't give up!"]="我们就要到了……不要放弃！"
G["We're almost through. Stay close!"]="我们就快成功了。靠近点！"
G["We're almost to Ravenholdt Manor."]="我们接近拉文霍德庄园了。"
G["We're almost to safety. From here, we run. Try not to get too far behind! GO!"]="我们基本安全了。从这里开始，我们要加速跑出去。不要落在后面了！出发！"
G["We're almost to the fresco. Keep it up back there!"]="我们快到壁画那儿了。坚持到底！"
G["We're almost to the refuge!  Let's go."]="我们快到庇护所了！加油。"
G["We're alphas, we're playas, we're straight from Gilneas, wolf out, me 'earties, aaaa-ooo!"]="!我们是主宰，我们是玩客，我们来自吉尔尼斯，干杯吧水手们，啊啊啊啊——噢噢噢！"
G["We're always eager for more flight data!  Where do you want to go?"]="我们永远渴望得到更多的飞行资料！你想去哪里？"
G["We're amassin' an army to head Garrosh off, but that will take time, and the Prince may already be in danger."]="我们正在集结军队来对抗加尔鲁什，但是那需要时间，而王子可能已经身处险境。"
G["We're at the center of the Maelstrom, the rift between Deepholm and Azeroth.  Watch as it threatens to tear your world apart!"]="我们正处在大漩涡的中心，这道裂隙分隔了深岩之洲和艾泽拉斯。看着它把你们的世界撕成碎片吧！"
G["We're back and better than ever!  It's the Darkmoon Faire friend, and it's your lucky day!  Sparing no expense, we've gathered wonders and treats from around the world for your delight.  Whether you're young or old, rich or poor, the Darkmoon Faire has it all!  Be sure to turn in your Darkmoon Faire Prize Tickets to Gelvas Grimegate, and choose from several exotic and wondrous prizes!"]="我们回来啦，感觉棒极了！暗月马戏团的朋友们，今儿是你们的幸运日！不要吝惜你的钱财，我们出售的都是来自世界各地的稀罕之物。无论你年方几何，无论你是贫穷还是富有，都能在暗月马戏团上买到称心如意的东西！请记得将你们的暗夜集市奖券交给吉瓦斯·格里加特，挑选一份丰厚的奖品！"
G["We're beginning to put the pieces together, champion. The mogu were created and sent here to guard the Vale for their Titan masters. Guard it from what? Were the Old Gods still a threat?"]="我们正在拼凑线索，勇士。魔古族是由泰坦创造并被派来守卫锦绣谷的。他们要守卫什么呢？古神是否仍是一个威胁呢？"
G["We're behind enemy lines, $n. We've got to do as much damage as we can!"]="我们现在已经深入敌后了，$n。我们要尽可能地对敌人制造伤害！"
G["We're behind schedule! Turn this tub east! EAST!"]="我们的进度已经落后了！转向东方！东方！"
G["We're being besieged by the naga attempting to breech our airlocks! Defend the ship topside!"]="我们被纳迦围攻了，他们想要破坏我们的气闸！守住船的上舷！"
G["We're being overrun!"]="他们的数量远远超过了我们！"
G["We're building another road down into Stormwind Harbor as soon as this wall has been removed... but this mad dwarf brought enough powder to level the entire quarter!\n\nI don't know what Master Alexston was thinking when he hired her... she's foul-mouthed, mean, and stubborn as an ox!"]="我们计划等拆了这面墙之后开始修建另一条通往暴风城港口的路……但是这个疯狂的矮人带来的炸药足以把这整个区域都给炸上天！\n\n我不知道阿历克斯顿大人是怎么想的，居然会雇佣她……这个满嘴脏话、刁钻刻薄、像头牛一样固执的矮人！"
G["We're catching up to the dragon! I think I can make him out through the cloud cover!"]="我们就快追上那条龙了！我想我们可以把它从云层里揪出来！"
G["We're celebrating spring during Noblegarden. Affirmation of life and all that."]="我们会在复活节期间庆祝春天的到来。赞美生命和一切美好的事物。"
G["We're celebrating the who breaking free of the what? Bah, who cares?! More candy!"]="我们这是在庆祝谁摆脱了谁的束缚？呸，管他呢？！我要更多的糖果！"
G["We're clear. Let's keep moving."]="好了。继续前进。"
G["We're close to the exit. I'll let you rest for about thirty seconds, but then we're out of here."]="我们离出口很近了。我会让你休息三十秒，然后我们离开这里。"
G["We're close! These documents all mention the bell and Kun-Lai Summit. It must be here."]="我们接近了！所有文献都表明圣钟就在昆莱山。它肯定在这里。"
G["We're close. I can feel the unnatural hatred broiling inside of me."]="我们接近了。我能感受到我心中异样的仇恨在不断燃烧。"
G["We're coming for you!"]="我们正在找你！"
G["We're coming for you, Chillheart! Time for payback!"]="寒心，我们为你而来！血债血偿的时候到了！"
G["We're coming up on Frosthold. I would be very appreciative if you would introduce me to King Stormheart before you go. I believe we are both very much in his debt."]="我们就快抵达冰霜堡了。如果你能在离开前把我介绍给雷心国王，我会非常感激你的。我们俩都欠他一份情。"
G["We're coming up on the Town-In-A-Box now..."]="我们即将驶抵胶囊镇……"
G["We're coming, $n! Keep her occupied while we loop around for an attack."]="我们来了，$n！在我们准备发动迂回攻击时，帮我们拖住她。"
G["We're currently focus testing The Black Temple. You must have at least HONORED reputation with the Violet Eye to participate.\n\nThat's the reputation you gain while doing Karazhan."]="Nos estamos centrando en probar El Templo Oscuro. Para participar debes tener, como mínimo, reputación HONORABLE con El Ojo Violeta.\n\nEsa es la reputación que ganas la hacer Karazhan."
G["We're currently focus testing Zul'Aman, a 10 player raid dungeon in the Ghostlands. You must be at least level 68 to enter."]="我们现在正在测试祖阿曼，一个位于幽魂之地的10人团队副本。你需要达到68级才能进入。"
G["We're currently focus testing the Battle of Mount Hyjal. You must have at least HONORED reputation with the Violet Eye to participate.\n\nThat's the reputation you gain while doing Karazhan."]="Estamos probando la Batalla del Monte Hyjal. Para participar debes tener, como mínimo, reputación HONORABLE con El Ojo Violeta.\n\nEsa es la reputación que ganas la hacer Karazhan."
G["We're doing everything we can to stop the water."]="我们在尽一切办法把水停住。"
G["We're done for!"]="我们完了！"
G["We're done for! Save us, Quimby!"]="我们完蛋了！救救我们，奎比！"
G["We're done here. I'm out."]="这里没我们的事了。我走了。"
G["We're done here. Mulgore will no longer suffer the hatred of the Grimtotem."]="我们在这儿的任务完成了。莫高雷不会再受到恐怖图腾仇恨的侵扰。"
G["We're done practicing so soon?  Very well, I'll see you later."]="我们这么快就完成练习了？很好，回头见。"
G["We're doomed!"]="我们玩完了！"
G["We're doomed..."]="我们完了……"
G["We're doooomed!!"]="我们死定了！！！"
G["We're expecting the Shatterspear Leader to show here at any moment. Be patient if you wish to join the attack."]="碎矛的首领随时都有可能在这里出现。如果你想参与这次进攻，就耐心一些。"
G["We're filled to capacity on purple lotus, $c. Go ask one of the others if they need your help, and leave me to my studies. There is no time to waste!"]="我们已经集齐紫莲花了，$c。去问问其他人吧，他们或许需要你的帮助。别打扰我的研究工作。没多少时间可以浪费了！"
G["We're finally here, thanks to you $n!  Without your help, we would have been some over-grown lizard's lunch!"]="我们终于到了，多谢你，$n！没有你的帮助，我们没准已经被那些巨大的蜥蜴当作午餐了！"
G["We're fine. We're all fine here now, thank you. How are you?"]="我们很好。我们现在都很好，谢谢你。你怎么样？"
G["We're finished! I might as well call for an evacuation now and clear out Lakeshire before the orcs march."]="我们完了！我也许应该在兽人杀过来之前发出撤退令，疏散湖畔镇的居民。"
G["We're flying a little too close. It's been a good fight, but I'm ending it, now."]="我们飞得太近了。这场大战很精彩，可现在我必须结束它了。"
G["We're flying high!"]="我们在高空翱翔！"
G["We're free!"]="我们自由了！"
G["We're free! RUN FOR YOUR LIVES!"]="我们自由了！逃命去吧！"
G["We're free! We're free!"]="自由了！我们自由了！"
G["We're getting bogged down in the fight against the Frostmane trolls."]="我们已经陷在和霜鬃巨魔的战斗中了。"
G["We're getting close... but it's still a little too smoky.  Don't put in any terrapin oil next time.  <cough>  Too much smoke.  Give it another shot!"]="Nos acercamos... Pero este sigue siendo demasiado humeante. La próxima vez no pongas nada de aceite de tortuga de agua dulce. <tos> ¡Demasiado humo! ¡Inténtalo otra vez!"
G["We're glad to have your help."]="很高兴能得到你的帮助。"
G["We're glad to see you here again, $n. With so many of our brethren seized by the Warchief's forces, we thought we'd never see you again."]="很高兴能在这里又看到你，$n。我们已经有许多兄弟姐妹落在了酋长的手里。我们还以为永远也见不到你了。"
G["We're going down. Abandon the ship!"]="我们在下坠。弃船！"
G["We're going in! Take out those towers!"]="进入作战区域！拿下那些塔楼！"
G["We're going to bring down the Hellfire Citadel, and it all starts with these ramparts."]="我们将要攻陷地狱火堡垒，就从这些城墙开始。"
G["We're going to die in here like all the others, aren't we?"]="我们会像其他人一样死在这里，对不对？"
G["We're going to die!"]="我们要死了！"
G["We're going to do little Andi's braids soon. Would you like your's done too, sweetie?"]="我们准备帮小安蒂编辫子了。你要编吗，宝贝儿？"
G["We're going to finish this right now, Mal'Ganis. Just you... and me."]="让我们来做个了断吧，玛尔加尼斯。"
G["We're going to get you some help."]="你会得到援助的。"
G["We're going to have a hard time handling this one alone. I sent a message to the dwarven capital of Ironforge asking for their support."]="若想单凭我们的力量解决简直太难了。我已经送信到矮人主城铁炉堡，请求他们的支援。"
G["We're going to have to deal with Cho'gall and Skullcrusher sooner rather than later. Are you up to it, $n?"]="Vamos a tener que encargarnos de Cho'gall y Trituracráneos más temprano que tarde. ¿Estás $gdispuesto:dispuesta;, $n?"
G["We're going to have to scratch the Maraudines off our list.  Too hard to work with..."]="我们不得不把玛洛迪半人马从我们的合作伙伴列表中划掉。他们太难共事了……"
G["We're going to live on! We're going to survive! Today we celebrate..."]="虽然历经劫难，但我们还是会生存下去！今天，我们要庆祝……"
G["We're going to need a mop over here!"]="我们这儿需要一个拖把！"
G["We're going to need more mud to properly color your disguise."]="我们还需要更多软泥来为你的伪装服染色。"
G["We're going to need some serious firepower."]="我们现在急需火力支援。"
G["We're gonna burn this place to the ground!"]="我们要把这地方焚毁殆尽！"
G["We're gonna do a quick fly by Conquest Hold to see what those filthy, no good, Horde are up to. Keep your eyes peeled for their wind riders. Not that they'd ever catch me!"]="我们很快就会对征服堡展开空中侦察，看看那些肮脏的部落到底有什么阴谋。留神那些双足飞龙，倒不是说它们能追上我！"
G["We're gonna lose this war to \"regulations.\" What's next? Only wooden swords may be used???"]="Vamos a perder esta guerra con tanta \"regulación\". ¿Qué será lo siguiente? ¿Solo podremos luchar con espadas de madera?"
G["We're gonna make you the ultimate footbomb uniform, kid. But first, we need parts. Lots of them."]="Vamos a fabricarte el uniforme de bombalón supremo, $gchaval:chavala;. Pero primero, necesitamos las piezas. Un montón de piezas."
G["We're gonna march in there and do one thing and one thing only:"]="我们将向那里进军，目的只有一个——而且是唯一的一个："
G["We're gonna melt this hunk of junk down and make weapons with the ingots! Let's see how the Legion likes a taste of fel reaver served up Alliance style!"]="我们会融化这个大家伙，用铁锭制造武器！让燃烧军团尝尝由他们的魔能机甲打造的武器的厉害！"
G["We're gonna turn this place into a sinkhole, heh."]="我们要把这地方炸成个大坑，呵呵。"
G["We're gunna take it."]="我们要去占领它。"
G["We're hard at work, searching for Prince Anduin. We're just stoppin' fer a bite and a drink."]="我们正在努力寻找安度因王子。顺道路过，来吃些干粮酒水。"
G["We're here as support for the so-called 'adventurers' that the brass has called in. We'll help them hold the key points on the island, and keep the heat off so that they can do their jobs."]="我们是来这里支援那些高级军官召集来的所谓“冒险者”的。我们会帮助他们守卫岛上的关键位置，让他们远离战火，这样他们就能安心去做他们的事情了。"
G["We're here for civilian work, sir."]="我们是来找活儿干的，长官。"
G["We're here for you, lost brother.  It is custom to offer you a chance to repent before you are destroyed.  We offer you this chance, as the naaru's law commands."]="我们到这里来是为了消灭你，迷失的兄弟。按照传统，我们会在消灭你之前给你个忏悔的机会。按照纳鲁的律法，我们给你这个机会。"
G["We're here on a research and excavation mission. No gettin' into trouble, I promise!"]="我们是来搞科研和发掘工作的，不是来惹麻烦的，我保证！"
G["We're here to finish this! Face us, coward!"]="我们是来此做了结的！面对我们吧，懦夫！"
G["We're here to help."]="我们是来这儿帮忙的。"
G["We're here to join the Alliance. We seek audience with your Emperor."]="我们是来加入联盟的。我们要求觐见你们的皇帝。"
G["We're here to lend our aid. We can help protect the Vale."]="我们是来提供援助的。我们能帮忙保护溪谷。"
G["We're here to lend our aid. We can help you rebuild the Vale."]="我们到这儿是来帮忙的。我们可以帮忙重建锦绣谷。"
G["We're here to protect Gadgetzan interests in Un'Goro and that's none of your business."]="我们在这里保护着加基森在安戈洛的利益，而且那和你毫无关系。"
G["We're here to rescue you, Taretha."]="我们是来这里救你的，塔蕾莎。"
G["We're here with you Brann, you can trust in your brothers of earth."]="布莱恩，我们愿与你共同进退，请信任你的土灵兄弟们。"
G["We're here! Start diggin'!"]="我们到了！开始挖掘！"
G["We're here, everybody out!"]="我们在这儿，所有人都出去！"
G["We're here. Just wait a moment while we load up---HEY! What's happening!?"]="我们来了。别着急，先等我们装货……嘿！出什么事了！？"
G["We're here. With this weapon we will lay waste to the Empresses' army!"]="好了。有了这把武器，一定能把女皇的军队打得落花流水！"
G["We're hit!"]="我们遭到攻击！"
G["We're holding Lord Jaraxxus back for now, but we can't keep him bound for much longer."]="现在我们暂时压制住了加拉克苏斯大王，但我们不可能压制住他太长时间。"
G["We're holding them in the northwest - reinforce the line!"]="我们在西北面拖住他们了——增援前线！"
G["We're hungry and cold! Help us!"]="我们又冷又饿！帮帮我们！"
G["We're hunters, you and I. No wolfmen here, no ma'am."]="我们是猎人。这里没有狼人。"
G["We're hunting an old god, Brann."]="我们要对付的真正敌人是上古之神啊，布莱恩。"
G["We're in a fine mess here."]="我们的处境非常狼狈。"
G["We're in a pretty tight pickle here, $n."]="我们在这里的情况相当糟糕，$n。"
G["We're in desperate need of those turnips!"]="我们急需一些芜菁！"
G["We're in over our heads, $r! Watch your back!"]="¡Estamos desbordados, $r! ¡Estate $gatento:atenta;!"
G["We're in the home stretch now."]="我们现在开始最后冲刺。"
G["We're in your debt, friend.  Speak to Lysander at Vengeance Landing; he will arrange a suitable reward for you."]="我们欠你的情，朋友。与复仇港的雷杉德尔谈谈吧，他会给你一份适当的酬劳。"
G["We're just trying to get a decent meal and maybe a comfortable night's sleep."]="我们只是想饱餐一顿，要是能再舒服的睡上一觉就更好了。"
G["We're leaving. Stay close."]="我们要走了，跟紧点。"
G["We're like their puppets - we dance and cry and fight and say silly things for their amusement."]="我们就像他们的傀儡——我们不管做什么都是为了让他们开心。"
G["We're making progress!  Bring more supplies to repair Dun Baldar!"]="我们已经取得了不错的进展！需要取回更多的物资来修复丹巴达尔！"
G["We're making progress, $r, but far too slowly."]="$r，我们取得了一些进展，但还是太慢了。"
G["We're mangy, we're matted, we're worgen and how, wolf out, me 'earties, aaaa-ooo!"]="我们肮脏，我们邋遢，我们是狼人，干杯吧水手们，啊啊啊啊——噢噢噢！"
G["We're miners, farmers and craftsmen - not soldiers.  But we'll defend our land with our bare fists if we must."]="是，我们不过是一群手无寸铁的矿工、农夫和工匠。可是情况危急时，我们也会赤手空拳地抗争到底，像士兵那样守卫我们的家园。"
G["We're nearing Render's Valley. These orcs are tough! Make sure you are camo'd!|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_NATURE_PROTECTIONFORMNATURE.BLP:16|t"]="我们已接近撕裂者山谷。这些兽人很难对付！一定要将自己伪装好！|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_NATURE_PROTECTIONFORMNATURE.BLP:16|t"
G["We're nearing completion on the next batch of high-powered elementium explosives."]="新的一批高能源质炸药就要完成了。"
G["We're nearly there now."]="我们就快到了。"
G["We're nearly there. Find me some..."]="就快成功啦。给我找些……"
G["We're never going to fire one of these, are we?"]="我们永远不会发射这些玩意，对吧？"
G["We're not a part of your system!"]="我们可不是你的系统的一部分！"
G["We're not done yet."]="我们的任务还没有结束。"
G["We're not gonna make it! I'm comin' ta see you soon, pappy!"]="我们肯定搞不定的！我马上就来见你了，老爹！"
G["We're not gonna make it! I'm coming ta see you soon, pappy!"]="我们肯定搞不定的！我马上就来见你了，老爹！"
G["We're not really rude people, stranger, it's just that everyone is in a rush, trying to make sure that everything is perfect for Uther's arrival. It's not often that the Lightbringer comes to town."]="No somos groseros, $gforastero:forastera;. Lo único que pasa es que todos andan con prisa, intentando que todo esté perfecto para la llegada de Uther. El Iluminado no vine muy a menudo a la ciudad."
G["We're not the younglings we once were, Man'ari! By the light, we shall end your suffering!"]="我们不是以前那些年轻而弱小的人了，艾瑞达堕落者！以圣光的名义，我们会终结你的痛苦！"
G["We're not too far from the Protectorate Watch Post, $n. This way!"]="我们离维序派哨站不远了，$n。这边走！"
G["We're off!  Watch out for those vines!"]="启航！当心那些藤蔓植物！"
G["We're on it!"]="明白！"
G["We're on orders from on high to destroy Rajaxx. Terminate with extreme prejudice if you want to get technical."]="我们奉命消灭拉贾克斯。你可以使用任何手段来达到这一目的。"
G["We're on the trail of the Sha of Hatred. I want you with us for the hunt."]="我们在追踪恨之煞。我想让你加入我们。"
G["We're one step closer my friends.  Have a rest and let me know when you are ready to continue."]="我的朋友们，我们离目标又近了一步。休息一下吧，等你们准备好继续前进时，请和我说一声。"
G["We're only doing what is best for Lordaeron, your Highness."]="殿下，我们的所作所为都是为了洛丹伦的利益。"
G["We're out of here. Good luck!"]="我们出来了。真是好运气！"
G["We're planning on having a special naga appreciation sale after your surrender is all wrapped up.  Thirty percent off most goods we have in stock. Red light savings on Kaldorei artifacts today only!"]="在投降程序完成之后，我们计划进行一场特别的纳迦感恩促销。我们的货架商品绝大部分都会降价30%。"
G["We're preparing for war, $c. We've taken all that we're going to from the Silithid and their masters in Ahn'Qiraj. To get ready for it we're collecting all sorts of material. I'm in charge of gathering Arthas' Tears. Not sure what we need them for though. If you ask me I don't want anything to do with that madman, even if it is just a flower named after him.\n\nStill, I'm my father's daughter, and a soldier, so I do what I'm told. Currently we have $2057w and need to collect a grand total of $2058w."]="Nos estamos preparando para la guerra, $c. Ya hemos cogido todo lo necesario de los silítidos y sus maestros en Ahn'Qiraj. Para estar preparados estamos reuniendo todo tipo de material. Yo soy la encargada de reunir lágrimas de Arthas, aunque no sé para qué las necesitamos. Por si te interesa, no quiero tener nada que ver con ese loco, aunque solo se trate de una flor que lleva su nombre.\n\nAun así, soy hija de mi padre, y una Soldado, así que hago lo que me ordenan. Actualmente tenemos $2057w y tenemos que recoger un total de $2058w."
G["We're prepped, sir."]="我们准备好了，长官。"
G["We're pretty far from anything I'd call civilization here, at least until the Horde can send us more reinforcements. You must really like working with leather."]="至少在部落派出更多的援军之前，这儿还不能被称为文明社会。你一定很喜欢制作皮革。"
G["We're proud. We're strong. We are descended from the blood of the Tiller himself... and we don't run from trouble."]="我们很自豪。我们很强大。我们是阡陌客的后裔……我们决不会逃避困难。"
G["We're pulling up near your stop. Head due west along the road to reach Nozzlepot's Outpost."]="我们很快就会停下来了。然后你沿着大路向西前进，就能到达诺兹波克的哨站了。"
G["We're putting the final preparations together even as we speak.  The rest will depend upon how quickly you can organize your forces at Ruuan Weald.\n\nDo you think that you can handle that and get it done quickly?"]="我们现在正紧锣密鼓地进行着最后的准备。剩下的就要看你能多快地组织起你在卢安荒野的力量了。\n\n你觉得你能迅速搞定这件事吗？"
G["We're rather selective of who we befriend, $n.  You think you have what it takes?"]="我们选择朋友是有标准的，$n。你觉得你达到条件了吗？"
G["We're ready for anything!"]="我们已经做好了一切准备！"
G["We're ready for glory, sir."]="我们准备好为荣誉而战了，长官。"
G["We're ready for the next challenge."]="我们已经准备好了迎接下一个挑战。"
G["We're ready for the push."]="我们做好了战斗的准备。"
G["We're ready to bring the pain, sir."]="我们准备好发动进攻了，长官。"
G["We're ready to defend!"]="我们做好防御准备了！"
G["We're ready to face Illidan."]="我们已经作好面对伊利丹的准备了。"
G["We're ready to fight the sorceror again."]="我们已经准备好了再次同那名法师作战。"
G["We're ready to go whenever you are, $n."]="Estamos listos para partir."
G["We're ready to open the gates."]="我们准备好打开大门了。"
G["We're ready! Go, Brann!"]="我们准备好了！去吧，布莱恩！"
G["We're ready! Let's go!"]="我们准备好了！出发！"
G["We're ready, Muradin."]="我们准备好了，穆拉丁。"
G["We're ready, Thrall."]="我们准备好了，萨尔。"
G["We're ready, commander."]="我们准备好了，长官。"
G["We're ready. Begin the assault!"]="我们准备好了。发动攻击吧！"
G["We're ready. This time things will be different."]="我们已经准备好了。这一次情况就不一样了。"
G["We're really plowing through your team now!"]="我们现在可真要攻破你的队伍了！"
G["We're relieved to see you whole, $n."]="你没事我们就放心啦，$n。"
G["We're routing out the traitors. Looks like we've found another..."]="我们正在肃清叛徒。似乎我们又找到了一个……"
G["We're runnin' at full steam, $p. Just focus on keepin' us topped off."]="我们正在全力工作，马力全开，$p。你只需要帮我们保持效率就好。"
G["We're running low on iron, lads!  I don't want to see a single bar go to waste, ye hear me now?"]="铁锭快用光了！所以一块也不能浪费，明白吗？"
G["We're safe here, my brothers and sisters, while the rest of the world will perish."]="我们在这里很安全，兄弟姐妹都很安全，但这世界都要毁灭了。"
G["We're safe!  But we weren't going fast enough!  All I want to feel is the wind in my eyes!"]="我们安全了！但我们飞得还不够快！我想要的是那种风抚过脸庞的感觉！"
G["We're safe.  Let's rest a bit before we go back."]="我们安全了。让我们在回去之前休息一会。"
G["We're safe; IT will never reach us here!"]="我们安全了，它不会追到这里的！"
G["We're saved!"]="我们得救了！"
G["We're saved? We're really saved?! YAHOO!"]="我们得救了？我们真的得救了？！呀哈！"
G["We're sendin' out our best, and that means you."]="我们将派出精英部队，那也包括你。"
G["We're snowballing out of control! You don't stand a chance now!"]="¡Nos estamos enfadando! ¡Te vamos a dejar $ghelado:helada;!"
G["We're spotted! Hang on. We have to get out of here!"]="我们被发现了！别慌张。我们得离开这里！"
G["We're staging a relief effort at New Thalanaar for all of the survivors of Thousand Needles. We need your help now!"]="我们正在新萨兰纳尔对从千针石林逃出的所有幸存者展开救援。我们现在需要你的帮助！"
G["We're still alive, Doctor Grapplehammer, despite your best efforts."]="我们还活着，钩锤博士，全靠你的努力。"
G["We're still cut off from Forward Command, but thanks to your 'negotiations' with the quilboar, we should be able to re-open the roads with a little elbow grease."]="Todavía estamos aislados del Mando de Vanguardia, pero gracias a tus \"negociaciones\", con un poco de trabajo duro debería ser posible reabrir los caminos."
G["We're still in this fight? I've got to report to Irontree!"]="我们还身陷这场争斗？我得报告给铁木！"
G["We're still making preparations. We won't be ready to go for a while."]="准备工作尚未完成。我们暂时还不会离开。"
G["We're sure. Let's go!"]="确信无疑。出发吧！"
G["We're surrounded - dispatch the ascendant while I keep the ambushers at bay."]="我们被包围了——你们去对付那个升腾者，我会处理伏兵。"
G["We're surrounded! Its defenses are too great. $n! Wake up!"]="我们被包围了！它的防御太强大了。$n！快醒醒！"
G["We're taking a shortcut.  Be on the lookout for worgs."]="抄近路吧。小心附近的座狼。"
G["We're taking him into custody in the name of King Varian Wrynn."]="以国王瓦里安·乌瑞恩的名义，我们将对他予以监管。"
G["We're taking hull damage, get a battle-mage out here to shut down those cannons!"]="我们的船体受损了，赶快叫个战斗法师来轰掉那些大炮！"
G["We're taking hull damage, get a sorcerer out here to shut down those cannons!"]="我们的船体受伤了，赶快叫个法师来干掉那些大炮！"
G["We're taking it back!"]="我们要夺回这里！"
G["We're through, $n! I'm with Candy now."]="我们完了，$n！我现在和小甜甜在一起了。"
G["We're through, $n! I'm with Chip now."]="我们完了，$n！我现在和奇普在一起了。"
G["We're to just pick up and leave?"]="这么说我们要马上离开这里？"
G["We're too late, $n. Looks like those monkeys butchered the Foreman and his crew."]="我们太迟了，$n。看来这些猴子已经杀害了工头和他的工人。"
G["We're too late. The grove is destroyed and with it our hopes and dreams."]="我们来得太迟了。林地已经被毁，一起被毁的还有我们的希望和梦想。"
G["We're too merciful with the Wretched.  We ought to drive a sword through each of them.\n\nTheir boldness in Sunsail Anchorage is unpardonable."]="我们对那些失心者太仁慈了，要我说，我们应该拔出剑刺向他们。\n\n他们在阳帆港的大胆行径是不可饶恕的。"
G["We're tryin' ta blow this wall so Wick's men can work on the new Harbor gatehouse and road beyond, but the clueless sod is cryin' about me using too much powder!\n\nTch. I've been sappin' since he was in diapers. This goes on much longer, I'll kick him into the canal and finish the whole blasted job meself!"]="我们打算将这面墙炸掉，让维克的人可以修建新的港口和道路，但是这个蠢货居然嫌我用了太多的炸药！\n\n哼。我玩爆破的时候，他小子还裹着尿布呢。大不了我一脚把他踹进运河，然后自己把这该死的活儿干完！"
G["We're trying to find a solution to the growin' elemental disturbances in Azeroth. Here in Nagrand, we see the same rifts formin', but as a direct consequence of Draenor bein' torn to shreds. They're a sign of a weakened planet and of an elemental plane in upheaval.\n\nYet, on Azeroth, there's no solid explanation for it.\n\nIf ya find any information about these rifts when adventurin' in the Outland, please let us know. We'll continue to speak with the elements here and find a way to calm the elements in Azeroth...before it's too late."]="我们在设法让艾泽拉斯日渐躁动的元素重归平静。这里——在纳格兰，我们看到了同样的裂隙正在形成，但这些是作为德拉诺破碎的直接后果而出现的。它们是星球日渐衰弱和元素位面产生巨变的标志。\n\n但是，在艾泽拉斯，却找不到令人信服的解释。\n\n当你在外域冒险时，要是你能找到任何与这些裂隙相关的信息，记得来告知我们。我们将继续在此与元素对话，争取找到能使艾泽拉斯元素平静下来的办法……再晚就来不及了。"
G["We're trying to find out what's so important up at the Masters' Gate.\n\nI just know that those Hammer jerks are up to no good. No fair! We came all this way following a clue and now we can't even get close."]="我们在设法弄清真主之门那里究竟有什么重要的事情在发生。\n\n但我可以确保，那些暮光之锤败类一定不会干什么好事。太反常了！我们一路追随线索而来，现在却连靠近都做不到。"
G["We're unda attack!"]="我们遭到攻击了！"
G["We're under attack!"]="我们遭到了进攻！"
G["We're under attack! Avast, ye swabs! Repel the invaders!"]="我们被攻击了！把他们都干掉！"
G["We're under attack! Defend yourself! I'm taking the high road. Call me back when the coast is clear!"]="我们被袭击了！保护好你自己！天上更安全一些，我先撤了。等海岸安全了之后再叫我回来吧！"
G["We're under attack! Step up and do your part, $c!"]="我们遭到了攻击！赶快挺身而出，加入战斗吧，$c！"
G["We're under attack! Take your positions!"]="我们受到了进攻！坚守你们的阵地！"
G["We're up against pterrodax, sharks, teraptors, and bomb-throwing monkeys. It's going to take a miracle to win!"]="我们要对付翼手龙，鲨鱼，刺角龙，还有扔炸弹的猴子。我们要是能取得胜利，那简直就是奇迹！"
G["We're warriors, $n. <Snort> Many and proud."]="Somos guerreros, $n.<Resopla> Muchos y orgullosos."
G["We're wastin' time here, professor! The orcs are slaughtering us!"]="我们是在浪费时间，教授！兽人在屠杀我们！"
G["We're watching you, meat vendor."]="我们正在注意你，肉贩子。"
G["We're watching you, pie vendor."]="我们在注意你，馅饼小贩。"
G["We're way out of these guys league."]="我们跟这些家伙不在同一水平线上。"
G["We're wearing him down.  Keep it up!"]="它快要被拖垮了。坚持住！"
G["We're with you Brann! Open it!"]="来吧，布莱恩！打开它！"
G["We're without our escort. I want to see interlocking fields of fire. Now, now!"]="我们已经没有护卫了，准备交叉火力射击。赶快，赶快！"
G["We're... er, I mean the Light, is going to need a lot of gold, now more than ever.\n\nSpeaking of which, do you need any training?"]="我们需要……呃，我是说，圣光需要许多金钱，而且现在比以往更加需要。\n\n我们说到哪里了？你需要训练吗？"
G["We're... we're alive!"]="我们……我们活过来了！"
G["We've Finally captured this tauren."]="我们总算逮住这个牛头人了。"
G["We've a duty out here, $g boy : girl;, to see to it that we don't let anyone surprise us.\n\nThat means proactive action!"]="我们在这里有一项任务，$g小子:姑娘;，要保证这个任务万无一失。\n\n我们必须先发制人！"
G["We've almost consolidated our control over Sun's Reach.  If we manage to keep the harbor from getting any reinforcements we will certainly succeed.\n\nWe are $3238w percent done with our goal."]="Casi hemos consolidado nuestro control en Tramo del Sol. Si evitamos que el puerto consiga refuerzos tendremos éxito.\n\nHemos completado el $3238w % de nuestra meta."
G["We've already lost the town... why have no reinforcements arrived from the Monastery?"]="我们都把镇子给丢了……从禅院来的援军怎么还没赶到？"
G["We've also secured air support for the operation and will be ready to deploy soon. If any of your men want to join the assault team, just send them to Delber."]="为了这次行动，我们还取得了空中支援。行动很快就要展开了。如果你们想要加入进攻部队，就去找戴博吧。"
G["We've beaten back the elementals, $n.  But they have left behind odd portals.\n\nThe King has gone through the portal, contrary to reason, to see where they lead. The portals have been reported in the Trade district, Cathedral district and Mage district\n\nI must remain here to see to the clean up of the city and the return of the citizens.  Go and help the King!"]="我们击退了元素，$n。但它们留下了不少诡异的传送门。\n\n尽管于理不合——国王已经穿过了传送门，去探明它们通往哪里。我们已经在贸易区、教堂区和法师区都发现了传送门。\n\n我必须留下收拾残局，安排市民的返城工作。你快去帮国王！"
G["We've been at this post for days with no sleep. You've no idea how badly I want to just lie down."]="我们已坚守此岗位数日之久，不眠不休。你不知道我有多么想躺下来休息一下。"
G["We've been discovered. I know you're tired, but we cannot keep the Aspects waiting!"]="我们被发现了。我知道你们很累，但我们不能让巨龙们等太久！"
G["We've been discovered... Hurry $n, there's little time!"]="我们被发现了……动作快$n，没时间了！"
G["We've been expecting you, $n. Now we have the upper hand."]="我们一直在盼望着你，$n。现在我们总算占据了优势。"
G["We've been fighting nonstop since the cataclysm. It'll be nice to get a rest, if a brief one."]="自从大灾变发生以来，我们就日以继夜地战斗。能歇一歇真是太好了，哪怕只是稍作休息。"
G["We've been flying in this mist for hours, General. The crew grows... uneasy."]="我们在迷雾中航行了好几个小时了，将军。船员们感觉很不好……"
G["We've been getting a lot of complaints about your yelling.  Keep it down."]="你的叫嚷已经让大家忍无可忍了。安静一些。"
G["We've been getting reports about your noise.  Quiet down!"]="很多人都在抱怨你过于吵闹。安静一些！"
G["We've been getting some complaints about your pies.  Clean up your act!"]="我们已经收到了一些关于你的馅饼的投诉。你做事可要小心一些！"
G["We've been hearing reports of elemental disturbances around Azeroth for some time now.  Our sources indicate that the phenomenon is not entirely natural, but we haven't quite been able to determine the source.  We have some theories though, but nothing concrete.\n\nKeep your eye out for any suspicious elemental activity as you walk around.  If you find anything worthwhile, please let an Earthen Ring Emissary know.  You can find us in any capital city.\n\nKeep your eye open.  Trouble is brewing."]="近来我们不断收到在艾泽拉斯各地出现元素扰动的报告。消息表明这并不完全是自然现象，但我们还没能追溯到源头。尽管已经有一些猜测，可现在下定论还为时过早。\n\n提高警惕，在冒险途中留心任何可疑的元素活动。要是你找到任何有价值的信息，请及时告知大地之环使者。你在任何主城都能与我们取得联系。\n\n睁大双眼。危机在临近。"
G["We've been lookin' all over Kun-Lai Summit fer a place that matches what ye saw in that mogu's memory, and we finally found the Korune's hidin' place."]="为了找到你在那个魔古族记忆里看到的场景，我们找遍了昆莱山，最终，我们发现了那个隐蔽的寇茹部族处所。"
G["We've been over this before. Only a focused assault upon Deatholme will meet with success. These other targets are distractions that we can ill afford. I suggest that you inform your Captain Helios that he is to leave off his campaign against the Shadowpine trolls and focus solely on the Scourge."]="我们之前已经吃过苦头了。只有集中火力攻击戴索姆才可能取胜。绝不能将兵力分散到其他战略目标上。我建议你通知赫里奥斯中尉，让他停止跟暗松巨魔的战争，一心一意地对抗亡灵天灾。"
G["We've been searching for days. All we have found are dusty scrolls and broken statues."]="我们已经找了好几天，却只找到一些尘封的卷轴和破损的雕像。"
G["We've been shot out of the sky!"]="我们被射到九天之外了！"
G["We've been so wrapped up in this war, some of us forgot to make time for love."]="战争压得我们喘不过气来，让我们忘了给爱情一点空间。"
G["We've been spotted! Make ready!"]="我们被发现了！准备战斗！"
G["We've been stranded here for days. We are stretched to the breaking point, but trying our best to keep spirits high."]="我们已经在这里困守了好几天了。大家都已经濒临崩溃的边缘了，不过依然在努力保持斗志。"
G["We've broken through the prison gate! The way into Dalaran is clear! Now we finally put an end to the Nexus War!"]="我们冲破了监狱的大门！进入达拉然的道路被清理干净了！魔枢之战终于可以结束了！"
G["We've captured the armory, $n.  Let's not rest on our laurels, however.  The Legion sure will not."]="我们已经夺下了军械库，$n。尽管如此，我们仍然不能沾沾自喜，满足现状。燃烧军团不会就此停下他们的脚步。"
G["We've cleared the way to Kil'jaeden! Can you transport me close to the Sunwell?"]="我们已经可以直接面对基尔加丹了！你能把我传送到太阳之井旁边吗？"
G["We've come to end your reign, Illidan. My people, and all of Outland, shall be free!"]="我们要终结你的统治，伊利丹！我的人民，以及整个外域，都将重获自由！"
G["We've come to the Ruuan Weald to see if we can reestablish the balance of nature to these mountains.\n\nThe interference of the arakkoa and the wyrmcult is making this a difficult task, however.\n\nLuckily, there are those like you and Samia that are willing to lend us a hand."]="我们来到卢安荒野是想看看是否能够帮助这些山脉恢复自然的平衡。\n\n然而，我们与鸦人和拜龙教之间的矛盾让这个任务变得困难起来。\n\n幸运的是，还有像你和萨米亚那样的人愿意帮助我们。"
G["We've come to try to help, but it seems that their favor for you does not yet extend to us."]="我们来这儿是想要帮忙的，可看来他们对你的好感还没有延及我们。"
G["We've committed no wrongs against the city or its king..."]="我们对这座城市和它的国王绝对没有恶意……"
G["We've committed no wrongs against the city or the Horde..."]="我们对这座城市和它的国王绝对没有恶意……"
G["We've defeated Valduran and we'll fell his colossus."]="我们击败了瓦杜兰！还将推倒他的塑像。"
G["We've delayed long enough. Let us take the battle to this servant of Ragnaros immediately."]="我们已经耽搁得够久了。现在就对这个拉格纳罗斯的仆人动手吧。"
G["We've destroyed hundreds of elementals, $n, and now they seem to be gaining strength!  Our guards are holding firm, but I'm sure they could use your support.  King Varian Wrynn is leading the defense in the Trade district, Lady Jaina Proudmoore is helping defend the Mage district and Archbishop Benedictus is holding firm at the Cathedral of the Light.\n\nNo matter where you go in Stormwind, $n, you will be more than helpful."]="我们已经消灭了数百个元素，$n，可他们的力量却在增强！我们的守卫还能撑住，但他们肯定需要你的帮助。瓦里安·乌瑞恩国王正亲自坐镇贸易区指挥防御，吉安娜·普罗德摩尔女士正在法师区支援，大主教本尼迪塔斯则在镇守光明大教堂。\n\n不管你要前往暴风城的哪个方向，$n，我们需要你伸出援手！"
G["We've done all we can here. Farewell Gao-Ran. I will send more men as soon as I am able."]="我们都已经尽力了。再见，高岚。我会尽快派部队来支援你。"
G["We've done all we can here. Let's get back to Thundermar!"]="我们已经做了我们能做的一切。现在，让我们回桑德玛尔吧！"
G["We've done it!"]="我们成功了！"
G["We've done it!  Victory to the Alliance!"]="我们成功了！联盟获胜！"
G["We've done it! Come get the cask."]="成功啦！去拿桶来。"
G["We've done it! Good work, lads!"]="我们做到了！干得好，小子们！"
G["We've done it! Meet me back by Jer'kai above the Grim Totem camp."]="我们成功了！到恐怖图腾营地外面去跟我和耶尔卡会合吧。"
G["We've done it! The control room is breached!"]="我们成功了！控制室被攻破了！"
G["We've done it! WE'VE DONE IT!"]="我们守住了！我们做到了！"
G["We've done it! We won!"]="我们成功了！我们赢了！"
G["We've done it! We're victorious!"]="我们成功了！我们胜利了！"
G["We've done it! We've done it! We've driven them off!"]="我们成功了！我们成功了！我们把他们赶走了！"
G["We've done it, $g lad : lass;! The Alliance and the Horde have completed gathering everything that we think we'll need for the Ahn'Qiraj War. Right now the final goods are being taken over to Cenarion Hold in Silithus and all of it will arrive within $2113w days. After that, some brave $g hero : heroine; is going to need to ring the Scarab Gong with the Scepter of the Shifting Sands to open the gates to Ahn'Qiraj. When those gates open, the war begins!"]="¡Lo hemos conseguido,$gmuchacho: muchacha;! Tanto la Alianza como la Horda hemos reunido todo el material que consideramos necesario para la guerra de Ahn'Qiraj. Toda la mercancía está de camino al Fuerte Cenarion en Silithus y el último envío llegará en menos de $2113w días. Después, $galgún:alguna; valiente tendrá que hacer sonar el gong del Escarabajo con el cetro del Mar de Dunas para abrir las puertas de Ahn'Qiraj. ¡Cuando las puertas se abran, dará comienzo la guerra!"
G["We've done it, $g lad : lass;! The Alliance and the Horde have completed gathering everything that we think we'll need for the Ahn'Qiraj War. Right now the final goods are being taken over to Cenarion Hold in Silithus and the last of it will arrive within a day. After that, some brave $g hero : heroine; is going to need to ring the Scarab Gong with the Scepter of the Shifting Sands to open the gates to Ahn'Qiraj. When those gates open, the war begins!"]="¡Lo hemos conseguido,$gmuchacho: muchacha;! Tanto la Alianza como la Horda hemos reunido todo el material que consideramos necesario para la guerra de Ahn'Qiraj. Toda la mercancía está de camino al Fuerte Cenarion en Silithus y el último envío llegará en menos de un día. Después, $galgún:alguna; valiente tendrá que hacer sonar el gong del Escarabajo con el cetro del Mar de Dunas para abrir las puertas de Ahn'Qiraj. ¡Cuando las puertas se abran, dará comienzo la guerra!"
G["We've done it, $n.  Mar'nah has learned how to transmute very special gems.  And I've learned how to work them."]="我们成功了，$n。玛尔娜已经学会一些非常特殊的宝石的转化方法了。我也已经知道了该如何好好利用它们。"
G["We've done it, $n.  With Sun's Reach under our control we are but mere moments away from absolute victory."]="成功了，$n。掌控了阳湾港之后，我们离全面胜利只有一步之遥了。"
G["We've done it, lads! We've taken the pinnacle from the Scourge! Report to Father Gustav at once and tell him the good news! We're gonna get to buildin' and settin' up! Go!"]="成功啦！我们从天灾军团手中夺得了北伐军之峰！立刻向古斯塔夫神父汇报这一好消息！我们要立即展开建设工事！快！"
G["We've failed, $n!!"]="我们失败了，$n！！"
G["We've finally captured this tauren."]="我们总算逮住这个牛头人了。"
G["We've finally got what we came here for. I just wish we'd hired $n right away and saved you the embarassment, Jaxon."]="我们最终完成了来到这里的目的。我只是希望我们能马上雇用$n，然后把你从囚禁中解救出来，贾森。"
G["We've found him! But this tempest he's become... I'll try to calm it - to reach him somehow."]="我们找到他了！但他变成了风暴……我要试着平息它，才能设法接近。"
G["We've found it!"]="我们找到它了！"
G["We've found the hiding place of the Sha of Hatred."]="我们已经找到恨之煞的藏身之地了。"
G["We've gathered up some items from this time period. I hope this helps!"]="我们从这个时间段收集了一些东西。但愿它能帮上忙！"
G["We've got Aranas!  Fire at will!"]="我们救出阿朗纳斯了！任意开火！"
G["We've got a $c inbound!"]="¡Se aproxima $gun:una; $c!"
G["We've got a live one."]="我们搞到个活的。"
G["We've got a survivor inbound!"]="有位幸存者回来了！"
G["We've got a whole list of people who want to fight, you know."]="好吧，好吧，后面还有一堆人等着要打呢，你懂的。"
G["We've got an eye on you, pie vendor."]="我已经注意到你了，馅饼小贩。"
G["We've got another $r flying in!"]="¡$gOtro:Otra; $r $gvolador:voladora; que se acerca!"
G["We've got hammers, we've got gnolls.\n\nIf you've got a token, you can use the hammer to whack some gnolls."]="我们这儿有锤子，还有豺狼人。\n\n只要一个代币，你就可以用锤子砸这些豺狼人了。"
G["We've got him now!"]="我们抓住他了！"
G["We've got no time to waste. This is a really long run! Cover me!"]="我们没时间浪费了。路途遥远！保护我！"
G["We've got orders from the harbinger to pick up some elekk for the base."]="我们从先驱者那里得到命令，要带几只雷象到基地去。"
G["We've got our work cut out for us, $p."]="我们得到一个很适合我们的任务，$p。"
G["We've got the explosives  in the furnace room.  Just hold them off now!"]="我们在锅炉室里放了炸弹，现在先挡下他们！"
G["We've got to do something about this!"]="我们必须得干点什么了！"
G["We've got to get our people out of here, $n! The key is to get them to drink plenty of Kaja'Cola Zero-One!"]="我们要让我们的人离开这里，$n！最关键的是要让他们喝下足够的卡亚零一度可乐！"
G["We've got to get out of here!"]="我们要离开这里！"
G["We've got to get the brew to safety. My brews are the lifeblood of this entire town!"]="我们得把酒送到安全的地方。我的佳酿简直是全村的命脉！"
G["We've got to get those supply crates back!"]="我们必须把那些补给箱给弄回来！"
G["We've got to light that signal fire. Without reinforcements, they'll destroy the gate!"]="我们得点燃信号火焰。要是没有援军，它们会摧毁大门！"
G["We've got to secure this beach stronghold. We let the Horde have a foothold here, all of Pandaria is going to look like Theramore."]="我们要守住这座滩头堡垒。我们要给部落建立一处据点，全潘达利亚都将成为下一个塞拉摩。"
G["We've got to stop them!"]="我们得阻止他们！"
G["We've got what we need. Clear out. We'll hit them again elsewhere."]="我们已经得到了我们所需要的。现在撤离。我们会在别的地方再次狠狠地打击他们。"
G["We've got you covered, now fallback!"]="我们负责掩护，立刻撤退！"
G["We've got you now, $n!"]="抓住你了，$n！"
G["We've got your back, $n!"]="我们掩护你，$n！"
G["We've got your back."]="我们掩护你。"
G["We've got your back... and a hefty supply of vehicles to fix up too apparently."]="我们永远支持你……唔，我们这就开始修理这成堆的攻城器械。"
G["We've got your hatchlings. You better not attack us if you know what's good for you!"]="我们已经得到了你们的鱼苗。你们最好放明白一些，不要攻击我们！"
G["We've got your sap -- come and get it!"]="我们也弄到了树脂！来尝尝吧！"
G["We've gotta find out what the Qiraji are feeding those monsters! Look at the size of 'em!"]="我们得看看其拉虫人到底给这些怪物吃的是什么！看看它们的个头！"
G["We've gotta stop giving the recruits those red shirts. They're just moving targets in them."]="别再给新兵发那种红衬衫了。那只会把他们变成活靶子。"
G["We've gotten complaints that your fruit is not as fresh as you claim."]="我们已经收到投诉，说你的水果不像你所宣扬的那样新鲜。"
G["We've had no luck tracking down the missing black dragon egg.\n\nHave you discovered anything, $n?"]="我们很不走运，没能追踪到丢失的黑龙蛋。\n\n你那儿有什么发现吗，$n？"
G["We've had too many setbacks along the way: Hellfire Citadel, Fallen Sky Ridge, Firewing Point...  Prince Kael'thas will tolerate no further delays.  I will tolerate nothing other than complete success!"]="一路上我们受到了太多的挫折：地狱火堡垒、坠星山、火翼岗哨……凯尔萨斯王子不能再容忍任何延误了。除了成功，我什么都不想看到。"
G["We've heard reports of people getting sick off of bad meat.  We're watching you, meat vendor!"]="我们得到报告，有不少人因为吃了腐败的肉食而生病了。我们会盯着你的，肉贩子！"
G["We've heard that you are selling some bad apples."]="我们听说，你正在贩卖一些坏掉的苹果。"
G["We've held them off for now.  Hop in the port-side cannon and help out our other ships!"]="我们暂时拖住了他们。快去左舷操作火炮，帮助其他船只！"
G["We've hit the jackpot in this place!"]="看来我们找到这地方的头等奖了！"
G["We've important work to do, $n.  Let us attack our enemies while their guard is down.  Let us show them that sin'dorei vengeance never forgets nor forgives."]="我们有重要的工作要做，$n。让我们在敌人疏于防守的时候进攻他们吧。告诉他们辛多雷永远都不会忘记复仇，永远不会宽恕敌人。"
G["We've just arrived here and already we've buried too many of our friends and comrades."]="我们刚刚抵达这里，却已经有许多战友和朋友在途中丧生了。"
G["We've just graduated from the Tian Monastery, in the Jade Forest. Have you been there before?\n\nWe're not students anymore. We're on our first quest - the quest to find the Hidden Master."]="我们刚从翡翠林中的天禅院毕业。你以前去过那儿吗？\n\n我们不再是弟子了。我们正在执行第一个任务——找到隐秘大师。"
G["We've just located her here, in the caverns beneath Karazhan. Fearful for her life, she is researching arcane secrets buried beneath the foundation."]="我们找到了她，藏在卡拉赞地下的洞穴里。担惊受怕之余，她正在学习埋藏于地下的奥术秘密。"
G["We've just sent another inexperienced squad into Nagrand. Might you offer a prayer for them?"]="我们刚派了另一队新手队伍进驻了纳格兰。你能为他们祈祷平安吗？"
G["We've killed dozens of naga to get this far, but they still keep coming.  What will it take to escape this wretched cavern?"]="我们坚持到现在已经消灭了许多纳迦，可他们还在前仆后继地冲过来。到底要怎么做才能逃出这该死的洞穴？"
G["We've killed your captors. You're free to go."]="我们杀死了俘虏你的家伙。你现在自由了。"
G["We've located the mark, commander. Ya-six and I have been separated. Requesting backup."]="我们已经确定了标记的位置，长官。亚希克斯和我走散了。我们需要增援。"
G["We've long held out hope of redeeming the Earthwarden and his children. At some point, we must have the wisdom to realize that no amount of redemption can atone for the destruction these dragons are unleashing upon the world.\n\nAt some point, we are forced to intervene."]="长久以来，我们都仍希望能挽救大地看守者和他的子嗣。在某些时候，我们必须要明智地意识到，任何程度的弥补都抵不过这些巨龙对这个世界所造成的伤害。\n\n在某些时候，我们被迫要插手。"
G["We've lost Undercity. Nothing but demons and Putress' apothecaries left there..."]="幽暗城被攻陷了。如今城里只剩下恶魔和普特雷斯的药剂师了。"
G["We've lost a few good people up here already. I'm beginning to doubt that this place is worth our attention."]="我们已经损失了好几名优秀的同胞。我开始怀疑，这里是否值得我们如此关注。"
G["We've lost a good many of our wind riders on scouting missions to the west. The Scourge is ruthless in their assault against any would-be spies.\n\nFortunately, I've come up with a solution that only risks the life of the rider. It's seen a 30% survival rate to those being ferried across the Plains of Nasam. That's a 30% improvement over when we were using wind riders!"]="在西部的侦察行动中，我们损失了许多出色的双足飞龙。天灾军团对任何可疑的探子都不会手下留情。\n\n幸运的是，我想出了解决办法，虽然这样可能会威胁到骑手的性命。你要知道，在纳萨姆平原的侦察行动中，骑手的生还率已经高达30%了。而我们之前使用双足飞龙的时候，简直可以说是有去无回！"
G["We've lost many mountaineers to this freakish storm, or the trolls slithering about in it."]="这场风暴害我们损失了许多巡山人，这可能是巨魔在搞鬼。"
G["We've made it this far into the Slag Pit, $n.  Now it's time to finish the job."]="$n，我们已经进入了熔渣之池。现在该是最终完成工作的时候了。"
G["We've made so many sacrifices, and our fight lingers on. These battles have a way of wearing away at my spirit..."]="我们做出了这么多牺牲，可战斗依然久拖不决。这些战斗足以消磨我的意志……"
G["We've managed to squeeze through Thunder Bluff twice now!"]="现在我们已经成功地穿越雷霆崖两次了！"
G["We've mitigated the explosive instability of the gas by putting it under IMMENSE pressure."]="我们对这种气体施加巨大的压强，降低了这种气体的爆炸性。"
G["We've moved from bloodstained roads to roads illuminated by crystals."]="从前的道路血渍斑斑，如今我们却走在被水晶照耀的道路上。"
G["We've moved the replacement vehicles up already so that you can take the thing down this time. Good luck!"]="我们把备用的攻城器械都抬上来啦，这次你一定能把那家伙打倒。祝你好运！"
G["We've only got a limited amount of pyrite stocked, use it sparingly."]="蓝铁的储备有限，省着点用。"
G["We've performed Niuzao's errand. Now it's time to get back to some real investigation."]="我们已经完成了砮皂的差事。现在得回去做一些真正的调查了。"
G["We've pushed them back to their ship.  Swing over and steal their explosives to blow it to smithereens!"]="我们把他们赶回自己船上去了。快跳过去，偷走他们的炸药，把他们的船炸成碎片！"
G["We've pushed them back to their ship.  Swing over and use some of their explosives to blow it to smithereens!"]="我们已经把他们赶回了自己的船上。在上空盘旋一圈，用他们自己的炸药炸飞他们！"
G["We've recently heard word of a creature of immense power being summoned near the Vector Coil. Fear not, should anything threaten the town, we will give our lives to protect it."]="我们最近听说有一个拥有巨大力量的生物在矢量感应器附近被召唤了出来。我们不畏惧任何威胁，我们会用自己的生命来捍卫这里！"
G["We've retaken the Idol of Akil'darah thanks to you, $n! Come over here and I'll take you deep into Jintha'Alor on the winds of her blessin'!"]="多亏你的帮忙，$n，阿基尔达拉神像又回到了我们手中！快过来，让我带你承着她的祝福，前往辛萨罗深处！"
G["We've rigged the powder barrels in every ship."]="我们在每艘船上都放好了炸药桶。"
G["We've secured the surface! Operation: Gnomeregan is proceeding with 93% efficiency...well done, everyone!"]="¡La superficie es nuestra! La operación Gnomeregan avanza con un... 93% de efectividad... ¡Bien hecho!"
G["We've seen the results of your 'research' before. I'll deliver this package to Orgrimmar for study."]="我们已经见到了你的“调查”结果。我会将这个包裹送到奥格瑞玛去进行研究。"
G["We've softened them up. They run and hide like rats from the might of the Horde. NO QUARTER!"]="我们已经挫了他们的锐气。在部落的力量面前，他们抱头鼠窜。绝不留情！"
G["We've spared no expense for the crowd, folks! We're determined to kill $n at any cost, for you, the viewer! Taken all the way from the hidden jungle of Un'goro Crater, cower in fear at...KING KRAW!"]="我们为搏您一笑不惜血本，朋友们！我们要不惜一切代价干掉$n，只为让您看得过瘾，亲爱的观众！接下来是我们不远万里从安戈洛环形山的隐秘丛林中请出来的重量级人物——在他的力量面前畏缩吧……有请大金钢！"
G["We've stirred up a hornet's nest, $n!\n\nI hope you have a plan for finishing this. Krogg's warriors are tearing up the dragonmaw, but we're taking heavy losses for every inch of ground..."]="我们捅了马蜂窝了，$n！\n\n希望你已经有了应对的计划。克罗格的战士们正在铲除龙喉，可我们每前进一寸都在遭受惨重的损失……"
G["We've sworn to do our very best to protect the passengers of The Bravery. The sea lane between Rut'theran Village and Stormwind Harbor must remain safe."]="我们发誓要全力保卫勇者号乘客。必须确保鲁瑟兰村至暴风城港口航道的安全。"
G["We've taken control of the temple and we're containing as much of the damage as we can.  Go inside and speak to Maruut; he's in charge."]="我们控制了这座神殿，并在竭力抑制它受到的伤害。到神殿里和玛鲁特谈谈，下面由他负责。"
G["We've taken some strange readings from nether ribbons."]="我们从虚空流中捕获了一些奇怪的信息。"
G["We've taken the Sanctum at Sun's Reach!  Send word back to Shattrath, we make our move now!"]="我们已经占领了阳湾圣殿！通知沙塔斯城，我们现在要开始行动了！"
G["We've taken the harbor!  The enemy has been driven away.  Sun's Reach is ours!"]="我们占领了港口！敌人已经落败，阳湾港属于我们！"
G["We've taken the harbor, and this ship is a nice bonus. Too bad she's not yet sea-worthy.\n\nIn the meantime, I've been instructed to oversee the disruption of the naga on the Greengill Coast.\n\nThink you can help me out?"]="我们已经拿下了港口，这艘船真的算是个不错的奖励。只不过她还不适合航海。\n\n对了，我得到命令去监视绿鳃海岸一带的纳迦。\n\n你觉得你能帮帮我吗？"
G["We've told you all there is to know!  Do you forget that many of us used to be trusted followers of Kael'thas?"]="我们是非常开诚布公的！你忘了我们中的许多人都曾经是凯尔萨斯最信任的手下吗？"
G["We've tracked the recent disappearances in Durotar to this abandoned section of Ragefire."]="我们追查着最近发生在杜隆塔尔的失踪事件，最终来到了怒焰裂谷中的这片废弃地带。"
G["We've wrested control of The Oculus from the forces of Malygos.  You're not getting any lighter, little one.  My wings itch for the open sky."]="Hemos arrebatado el control del Oculus a los ejércitos de Malygos. No estás perdiendo peso, $gpequeño:pequeña;. Mis alas ansían el cielo abierto."
G["We, his sworn servants, do his bidding and enforce his iron-rule. Cut off from the energies of his fiery realm, Ragnaros is but a shadow of his true self. However, he has more than enough strength to be your end."]="作为忠实的仆从，我们会听从他的命令，执行他的铁血政策的。没有了强大的领域实权，拉格纳罗斯不过是他自身的傀儡罢了。但是，他拥有足够的力量与你抗衡。"
G["We, the Alliance, will prevail!"]="联盟会胜利的！"
G["We, the Sons of Lothar, have remained here ever since - fighting... dying... praying that a day like today would come - a day when the Portal would open and our brothers would come to deliver us home.\n\nOverjoyed as we are, duty still calls. There is much to be done before we can depart this world and take our rest."]="Nosotros, los hijos de Lothar, hemos permanecido aquí desde entonces - luchando... muriendo... rogando que llegara un día como el de hoy – un día en el que el Portal se abriera y nuestros hermanos vinieran a llevarnos a casa.\n\nPor más rebosantes de alegría que estemos, el deber sigue llamando. Hay mucho que hacer antes de poder marcharnos de este mundo y descansar."
G["We, the Zandalarian trolls, traveled here from distant islands, for we cannot ignore the threat that now faces our world."]="我们赞达拉巨魔长途跋涉来自此地，因为我们不能对威胁整个世界的危机视而不见。"
G["We, the Zandalarian trolls, traveled here from distant islands, for we cannot ignore the threat that now faces our world.\n\nThe leader of our expedition, Molthor, brought us to the Yojamba Isle, along the northern coasts of Stranglethorn, and even now recruits brave heroes to venture into the ancient troll city... Zul'Gurub."]="我们赞达拉巨魔长途跋涉来自此地，因为我们不能对威胁整个世界的危机视而不见。\n\n我们的远征队首领莫托尔带领我们来到荆棘谷海岸以北的尤亚姆巴岛，招募勇敢的英雄深入古老的巨魔城市……祖尔格拉布。"
G["We... We have only been told that the \"Crimson Dawn\" is an awakening. You... You see, the Light speaks to the High General. It is the Light..."]="Solo... Solo nos han dicho que el \"Alba Carmesí\" es un despertar. Verás... la Luz le habla a la Alta General. Es la Luz..."
G["We... are superior! How could this... be?"]="我们……是无比强大的龙族！怎……怎么会这样……？"
G["We... are... endless..."]="我们……无穷……无尽……"
G["We... are... lost."]="我们……失……败……了。"
G["We... did it..."]="我们……做到了……"
G["We...are...investigating."]="我……我们……在调查。"
G["We? More like what are YOU going to tell Forba!"]="我们？应该是你要跟弗巴说什么才对！"
G["Weak $C! You are no match for the Stonesplinter Tribe!"]="没用的$C！你无法对抗碎石怪部族！"
G["Weak slickies are good for nuthin'!"]="瘦瘦的光板儿一点用也没有！"
G["Weak!"]="太弱了！"
G["Weak, little bugs!  Your souls aren't worth eating..."]="太弱了，小虫子！你的灵魂还不够塞牙缝呢……"
G["Weak, pitiful creatures. Hardly worthy of being called a legion."]="一群软弱的可怜虫。根本配不上“军团”这个称号。"
G["Weak-minded fool!"]="意志薄弱的蠢货！"
G["Weak."]="弱者。"
G["Weak. How predictable."]="太弱了，就和我预料的一样。"
G["Weakling!"]="软蛋！"
G["Weakling."]="脆弱的家伙。"
G["Weaklings!"]="废物！"
G["Weaklings! Fools! You cannot stand before the Bloodseeker!"]="懦夫！蠢货！你们根本无法阻挡觅血者！"
G["Weaklings... let me make room for our guests."]="胆小鬼们……让我来好好招待你们。"
G["Weakness will not be tolerated. Only strength prevails!"]="我们绝不容忍懦夫！强者方能获胜。"
G["Weakness. These dwarves are nothing!"]="软弱的矮人，毫无用处！"
G["Weakness... Fit for only the lowliest of undeath. To the pit!"]="太弱了……只配喂给下面那些卑贱的亡灵。扔下去！"
G["Weapon Master"]="武器大师"
G["Weaponized sharks?  Why didn't I think of that!?"]="武装鲨鱼？为什么我没有想到这个？！"
G["Weapons"]="武器"
G["Weapons Trainer"]="武器训练师"
G["Weapons are merely a convenience for a warrior of my skill!"]="武器对我这样的战士来说无足轻重！"
G["Weapons out!"]="拔出武器！"
G["Weapons ready!"]="武器准备！"
G["Weapons systems offline."]="已解除武器系统。"
G["Weapons systems primed."]="启动武器系统。"
G["Weapons up, you magnificent monsters! They're about to charge."]="拿起武器，你们这些大怪物！他们要冲锋了。"
G["Weapons...armor...these are the keys to victory. Any warrior, no matter how strong, is essentially defenseless without them.\n\nI have crafted many a legend in my day, $r. You will find nothing like them in all of Azeroth. They are the key to my brethren's success."]="武器……盔甲……这些都是取得胜利的关键。任何一名战士，无论他是多么强壮，都很难周全地保护自己。\n\n$r，我曾经打造过许多传奇的武器和护甲，你在全艾泽拉斯也无法找到能和它们比拟的杰出作品。它们正是我的同胞赢取胜利的关键。"
G["Weary of one of your demonic charges? Hoping for one with a more pleasing name?\nFor a price, I can assist you in the obliteration of a current minion so that you may summon an entirely new one..."]="¿Estás $gcansado:cansada; de cargar con tus esbirros demoníacos? ¿Desearías tener uno con un nombre más agradable?\n\nPor un módico precio, puedo ayudarte a eliminar a tu esbirro actual para que puedas invocar a uno totalmente nuevo..."
G["Weed whacking is hard work."]="割草可是艰苦的工作啊。"
G["Weee!"]="嘿！"
G["Weee! I'm a girl again!"]="耶！我又变成女孩啦！"
G["Weee! Shinies all over this place!\n\nTake a look at what I found diggin' right here...\n\nIt's a breathin' hat!"]="¡Ueeeee! ¡Todo este lugar brilla!\n\nEcha un vistazo a lo que he encontrado cavando justo aquí...\n\n¡Es un sombrero de respirar!"
G["Weeee! I'm alive, I'm alive, I'm alive! Oh, I hope it's not too forward of me to tell you that I think I love you all and I hope I can find my bag because you certainly deserve a little something extra, you know, for the effort and all that you must have went through to save me..."]="耶！我自由啦，自由啦！如果我现在就告诉你们我有多么喜欢你们应该不会太唐突吧我希望能快点找到我的包裹因为像你们这样当之无愧的英雄应该受到奖赏啦，你知道的，以此感谢你们这一路走来的艰辛……"
G["Weeeeee!"]="啊啊啊啊！！"
G["Weeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeee!"]="呀呀！"
G["Weep SNOT!?"]="哭鼻子！？"
G["Weep for Gilneas!"]="为吉尔尼斯哭泣吧！"
G["Weezil Slipshadow - master of disguise!"]="维兹尔·滑影，伪装大师！"
G["Wei, are these friends of yours?"]="魏，这些是你的朋友吗？"
G["Welcome $c, to my humble retreat.  I find this place very relaxing and I have always loved being at home in Dalaran.  Sometimes though, it can be a lonely place...  such a lonely place."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; $c a mi humilde refugio. Creo que este lugar es realmente relajante y siempre me ha gustado sentirme en casa en Dalaran. A veces pienso que puede ser un lugar solitario... un lugar tan solitario..."
G["Welcome $n, dragonfriend."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; $n, $gamigo:amiga; de dragón."
G["Welcome $n. Come, have a seat."]="欢迎，$n。快请坐。"
G["Welcome $p, as a member of the Shado-Pan!"]="欢迎你，$p，影踪派的同胞！"
G["Welcome Back, $n!"]="欢迎回来，$n！"
G["Welcome Friend.  Keep your head down and hold on tight!"]="朋友，欢迎你。在这里记得随时保持警惕！"
G["Welcome Traveler! Help yourself to some ale."]="¡$GBienvenido, viajero:Bienvenida, viajera;! Sírvete un poco de cerveza."
G["Welcome aboard $c.  Take a load off and enjoy the trip.  Aboard \"The Purple Princess\" we want you to relax.  We have vending machines down below if there's anything you might need while aboard."]="Te doy la bienvenida a bordo, $c. Relájate y disfruta del viaje. A bordo del \"Princesa púrpura\" queremos que te relajes. Tenemos máquinas de refrescos y comida abajo por si necesitas algo mientras estas a bordo."
G["Welcome aboard the Feathermoon Ferry.  We travel between Feathermoon Stronghold and the Forgotten Coast looking for those lost at sea.  The sea can be a dangerous place if you are not prepared.\n\nIf you need to get prepared, please speak to our provisioners.  They are more than happy to help you."]="欢迎乘坐羽月渡船号。我们往返于羽月要塞和被遗忘的海岸，搜寻不幸的落水者。大海暗藏危机，你必须做好充分的准备。\n\n你可以和食物供给商谈谈，购买足够的干粮。他们会很乐意帮忙的。"
G["Welcome aboard the Maiden's Fancy. It should be smooth sailing all the way to port."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a bordo de La Fantasía de la Doncella. Debería ser una travesía tranquila hasta el puerto."
G["Welcome aboard the Skyfire.  You ready to chase down the end of the world?"]="欢迎登上天火号。我们要追到世界的尽头，你们准备好了吗？"
G["Welcome aboard the Skyfire. You ready to chase down the end of the world?"]="Te doy la bienvenida a bordo de El Abrasacielos. ¿$gListo:Lista; para llegar hasta el fin del mundo?"
G["Welcome aboard the Thundercaller!\n\nDon't pay attention to the people that complain about explosions or the like.  I mean really, everyone makes mistakes.  We should cut people some slack.\n\nLook, I'd understand if a captain managed to crash his ship 22 or 23 times... But anything less than that isn't worth mentioning."]="欢迎登上唤雷号！\n\n不用理会那群整天抱怨爆炸或者类似东西的家伙。真的，每个人都会犯错误，我们应该开除掉一些懒惰的家伙。\n\n你看，我知道如果有一个船长的船坠毁了22还是23次是有点……但任何少于那个次数的事故就根本算不得什么了。"
G["Welcome aboard the Zephyr, the smoothest ride you're likely to get across the Barrens. Sit back and enjoy the flight, eh, kid? Ain't nothing like that sweet, dry air mixed with the scent of oil."]="$GBienvenido:Bienvenida; al Céfiro, el viaje más tranquilo que tendrás en Los Baldíos. Relájate y disfruta del vuelo, ¿vale? No hay nada como el dulce aire seco mezclado con el aroma del aceite."
G["Welcome aboard... Tillers!"]="欢迎加入……阡陌客！"
G["Welcome back to Thundermar, $n. Fighting continues all across the shire, but with Alliance help I think we can gain the upper hand."]="欢迎回到桑德玛尔，$n。战火已经遍及这里的每一个角落，但只要有联盟的帮助，我相信我们一定能占据上风。"
G["Welcome back to the Cradle of Chi-Ji, friend! I am glad to see that you've returned."]="欢迎回到赤精栖木，朋友！我很高兴看到你的归来。"
G["Welcome back to the Great Forge, $n. Ye come to visit an old Dwarf or do ye think yer ready for the next step in yer training?"]="$n，欢迎回到大锻炉。你是来拜访我的，还是准备进行下一阶段的训练？"
G["Welcome back to the greatest show in Outland, my friend!  It is truly a delight to see you once again.\n\nPlease, step right up and once more take in all we have to offer.  Be sure to check around, as we are always adding new and exciting things to the Darkmoon Faire!  Amaze at wonders old and new that we have uncovered!  We continue to spare no expense in bringing you excitement that children of all ages will delight in!"]="¡$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; de nuevo al mejor espectáculo de Terrallende, $gamigo:amiga;! Es un verdadero placer volver a verte.\n\nAcércate y observa todo lo que ofrecemos. ¡No dejes de echar un vistazo, ya que estamos continuamente añadiendo cosas nuevas a la Feria de la Luna Negra! ¡Maravíllate con todo lo que hemos descubierto! ¡Seguimos sin reparar en gastos para proporcionaros diversiones con las que deleitar a niños de todas las edades!"
G["Welcome back to the greatest show on Azeroth, my friend!  It is truly a delight to see you once again.\n\nPlease, step right up and once more take in all we have to offer.  Be sure to check around, as we are always adding new and exciting things to the Darkmoon Faire!  Amaze at wonders old and new that we have uncovered!  We continue to spare no expense in bringing you excitement that children of all ages will delight in!"]="¡$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; de nuevo al mejor espectáculo de Azeroth, $gamigo:amiga;! Es un verdadero placer volver a verte.\n\nAcércate y observa todo lo que ofrecemos. ¡No dejes de echar un vistazo, ya que estamos continuamente añadiendo cosas nuevas a la Feria de la Luna Negra! ¡Maravíllate con todo lo que hemos descubierto! ¡Seguimos sin reparar en gastos para proporcionaros diversiones con las que deleitar a niños de todas las edades!"
G["Welcome back to the waking world, child."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; de nuevo al mundo consciente, $ghijo:hija;."
G["Welcome back! What news, $n?"]="¡$GBienvenido:Bienvenida; otra vez! ¿Qué noticias traes, $n?"
G["Welcome back, $n!"]="¡$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; de nuevo, $n!"
G["Welcome back, $n! How goes your training?\n\nOur trainees have missed you dearly... though I must say that they appreciate not having to spar with you anymore."]="欢迎回来，$n！你的训练怎么样啦？\n\n我们的弟子都非常想念你……尽管我不得不说，他们对不用再和你过招这一点还是很高兴的。"
G["Welcome back, $n! I see you found our missing guides!"]="¡$gBienvenido:Bienvenida;, $n! ¡Veo que has encontrado a los guías perdidos!"
G["Welcome back, $n."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; de nuevo, $n."
G["Welcome back, $n.  You were fortunate.  Krennan's treatment doesn't always work this well on people who've had the Curse as long as you."]="欢迎回来，$n。你很幸运。对于像你这样受到诅咒的人，克雷南的治疗方法并不总是有效的。"
G["Welcome back, $n.  You've proven a worthy ally against Ragnaros and your presence is always welcome among us."]="¡$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; de nuevo, $n! Has prestado tu valiosa ayuda en la lucha contra Ragnaros y siempre serás bien $grecibido:recibida; entre nosotros."
G["Welcome back, $n. Have I mentioned how good it is to have someone to talk to?\n\nAlright then, let's get down to business. What's next that we have to do?"]="$GBienvenido:Bienvenida; de nuevo, $n. ¿Ya te dije lo mucho que me alegro de tener a alguien con quien hablar?\n\nBueno, pues ahora pongamos manos a la obra. ¿Qué es lo siguiente que tenemos que hacer?"
G["Welcome back, $n. I've been eagerly anticipating your return."]="欢迎回来，$n。我一直都很期盼你的回归。"
G["Welcome back, $n. That took longer than expected. Learn anything useful?"]="欢迎回来，$n。你去得比我预想的要久。了解到什么有用的信息了吗？"
G["Welcome back, bruiser. You up for a go?"]="欢迎回来，斗士。准备好比赛了？"
G["Welcome back, champion of the Horde! How fares the battle along the coast?"]="欢迎回来，部落的英雄！沿海的战斗进行得如何？"
G["Welcome back, champion!"]="欢迎回来，英雄！"
G["Welcome back, champion."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; de vuelta, adalid."
G["Welcome back, friend! It feels like it's been years since you helped me whip up my first Noggenfogger Elixer.\n\nNow I'm running the whole city! Those things still sell like crazy."]="¡$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; de nuevo, $gamigo:amiga;! Parece que hayan pasado años desde que me ayudaste a crear mi primer elixir de Tragonublo.\n\n¡Ahora controlo toda la ciudad! Se sigue vendiendo como rosquillas."
G["Welcome back, hero of the Alliance! How fares the battle along the coast?"]="欢迎回来，联盟的英雄！沿海的战斗进行得如何？"
G["Welcome child to my humble valley.  It is my goal in life to build a beverage so delicious it will humble any other experience your taste buds have encountered.\n\nMy research is on the verge of something phenominal, that no pandaren can claim to be even close to achieving."]="欢迎来到我这个简陋的山谷，孩子。我毕生的目标就是酿造出一种绝世佳酿，它要能胜过你的味蕾所品尝过的一切味道。\n\n我的研究已经快要得出成果了，从没有一个熊猫人能达到我这样的高度。"
G["Welcome friend!"]="¡Hola, $gamigo:amiga;!"
G["Welcome friend! What would you like to see?"]="¡$gBienvenido amigo:Bienvenida amiga;! ¿Qué te gustaría ver?"
G["Welcome ladies and gentlemen, to this evening's presentation!"]="女士们，先生们，欢迎观看今晚的演出！"
G["Welcome my brothers! Bask in the glory of my power!"]="欢迎你们，我的兄弟们！让我力量的荣光照耀你们！"
G["Welcome one and all to the Darkmoon Faire, the greatest event in all the world!  We have it all... delicious food, strong drink, exotic artifacts, fortunes read, amazing prizes and excitement without end!  Don't forget to turn in your Darkmoon Faire Prize Tickets to Gelvas Grimegate!  All it takes is five or more and you're on your way to the most wondrous prizes on all of Azeroth.  Everybody is a winner!"]="欢迎所有人来到暗月马戏团，世界上最盛大的事件！我们拥有……可口的美食、烈性饮料、异地的神器、寻宝书、丰厚的奖品和无尽的刺激！别忘记将你的暗月马戏团奖券交给吉瓦斯·格里加特！只需要5张奖券你就可以领取一份艾泽拉斯最丰厚的奖品。每个人都是赢家！"
G["Welcome one and all to the Darkmoon Faire, the greatest event in all the worlds!  We have it all... delicious food, strong drink, exotic artifacts, fortunes read, amazing prizes and excitement without end!  Don't forget to turn in your Darkmoon Faire Prize Tickets to Gelvas Grimegate!  All it takes is five or more and you're on your way to the most wondrous prizes in all of Outland.  Everybody is a winner!"]="欢迎大家来到世上最隆重的庆典——暗月马戏团！我们拥有各色各样美味的食品、甘甜的佳酿、奇异的器物、神秘的塔罗牌、精美的礼品，还有难以自抑的激动氛围！别忘记在吉瓦斯·格里加特处兑换暗月马戏团奖券！五张奖券就能兑换到哦，还有更多令人称奇的奖品在等着你呢。所有人都有份！"
G["Welcome one and all to the greatest show on all of Azeroth... the Darkmoon Faire!  Adventure and excitement await, don't be shy!  Mysteries and prizes for both the young and the old are here for the taking.  And be sure to speak with the professor about any Darkmoon Cards that you have come across during your travels!"]="欢迎所有人参加艾泽拉斯最盛大的展览……暗月马戏团！快来体验精彩和刺激吧，别害羞！这儿出售各种新奇的货物，老少皆宜啦。记得跟教授谈谈关于暗月卡片的事儿。"
G["Welcome stranger. It has been a long time since I've seen someone new travel through here."]="$GBienvenido:Bienvenida; $gforastero:forastera;. Hace ya mucho tiempo que no veía a alguien nuevo viajando por la zona."
G["Welcome ta Moonglade, $c. All be welcome 'ere, as long as ya be keepin' the sacred peace."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; al Claro de la Luna, $c. Todos son bienvenidos aquí, siempre que respeten la paz sagrada."
G["Welcome to Aerie Peak, home of the Wildhammer Clan.\n\nWith High Thane Falstad off in Ironforge, you'll be dealin' with me."]="欢迎来到鹰巢山，蛮锤部族的家园。\n\n大领主弗斯塔德·蛮锤已经前往铁炉堡，有事情的话可以和我说。"
G["Welcome to Aldor Rise. You seek guidance?"]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a Alto Aldor. ¿Buscas orientación?"
G["Welcome to Amberpine Lodge, $c."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; al Refugio Pino Ámbar, $c."
G["Welcome to Anglers Wharf $r.  Feel free to take a look around, there is much an angler can learn here."]="欢迎来到渔人码头，$r。请随意逛逛，你在这里可以学到很多钓鱼知识。"
G["Welcome to Argent Stand, $c.\n\nMake yourself at home, but don't get too comfortable. We're not out of the woods yet - far from it.\n\nIf we're going to make it out of here in one piece, everyone's going to have to do their share... including you."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a El Confín Argenta, $c.\n\nEstás en tu casa, pero no te acomodes demasiado. Aún no estamos a salvo... y lo que nos queda.\n\nSi queremos salir de aquí de una pieza, tendremos que ayudar todos... tú también."
G["Welcome to Binan Village, $c. I beg you... please help us."]="$GBienvenido:Bienvenida; a la Aldea Binan, $c. Te lo imploro... ayúdanos, por favor."
G["Welcome to Blood Watch, $c. In my travels, I have amassed a wide variety of tools, artifacts, and knowledge from the various peoples we've encountered.\n\nShould you find yourself in need of this knowledge, you have only to ask."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a la Avanzada de Sangre, $c. En mis viajes, he acumulado una gran variedad de herramientas, artefactos y conocimiento de las diversas gentes con las que me he encontrado.\n\nSi ves que necesitas estos conocimientos, solo tienes que decirlo."
G["Welcome to Blue Moon Odds and Ends, $c.  If you have any questions, please let me know."]="欢迎你，$c。如果你有什么问题，尽管来问我。"
G["Welcome to Booty Bay, $r."]="欢迎来到藏宝海湾，$r。"
G["Welcome to Booty Bay, partner.  Don't mind DeMeza and her crew... we let the hellion run riot one day a year, Pirates' Day, and then she leaves us in peace to go plunder the South Seas again.\n\nNow then... what can this humble servant of the Steamwheedle Cartel do for you?  Better still - what can you do for me, eh?"]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a Bahía del Botín, $gsocio:socia;. No te preocupes por DeMeza y su tripulación... Dejamos que el demonio se lo pase bien un día al año: el Día de los Piratas. Después nos deja tranquilos y se marcha a surcar los Mares del Sur de nuevo.\n\nBueno, ¿en qué te puede servir este humilde siervo del Cártel Bonvapor? Aún mejor, ¿qué puedes hacer tú por mí?"
G["Welcome to Booty Bay, partner.  I hope your stay in my town is enjoyable and uneventful - emphasis on the latter.  We've got plenty of drink if you're thirsty, and plenty of bouncers if you're antsy.\n\nNow then... what can this humble servant of the Steamwheedle Cartel do for you?  Better still - what can you do for me, eh?"]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a la Bahía del Botín, $gcompañero:compañera;. Espero que disfrutes tu estancia en mi ciudad y que transcurra sin incidentes, y recalco esto último. Si tienes sed tenemos mucha bebida y si tienes miedo, muchos porteros.\n\nEntonces... ¿qué puede hacer este humilde sirviente del Cártel Bonvapor por ti? Mejor aún, ¿qué puedes hacer tú por mí, eh?"
G["Welcome to Caer Darrow, stranger."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a Castel Darrow, $gextranjero:extranjera;."
G["Welcome to Camp Oneqwah."]="欢迎来到欧尼瓦营地。"
G["Welcome to Camp Oneqwah.  Rest for a while and we will tend to your kodo."]="欢迎来到欧尼瓦营地。休息一会儿，科多兽交给我们来照料吧。"
G["Welcome to Dalaran's Guild Registry offices. How may I help you?"]="欢迎来到达拉然公会注册办事处。请问你需要什么帮助？"
G["Welcome to Dalaran, $c."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida:c;, $c."
G["Welcome to Dalaran, traveler.\n\nIs there something I might help you find?"]="$gBievenido:Bienvenida; a Dalaran, $gviajero:viajera;.\n\n¿Puedo ayudarte a encontrar algo?"
G["Welcome to Darkmoon Island! Feel free to ride one of these lovely beasts down to the Faire."]="¡$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a la Isla Luna Negra! Monta en una de estas bestias adorables y baja a la feria."
G["Welcome to Deepholm, cultist."]="欢迎来到深岩之洲，邪教徒。"
G["Welcome to Dolanaar, $c. Let me know if you need any recipes or basic cooking ingredients."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a Dolanaar, $c. Avísame si necesitas recetas o ingredientes básicos de cocina."
G["Welcome to Dunshire, traveler.\n\nTread these lands carefully. Scadeald boils with tension: conflicts with the Ealdir are growing, and even in the noble houses of Graysky voices are rising. These are not peaceful times..."]="Bienvenido a Dunshire, viajero.\n\nPisa estas tierras con cuidado. Scadeald hierve de tensión: los conflictos con los Ealdir van en aumento, y hasta en las casas nobles de Graysky se alzan voces. No corren tiempos de paz..."
G["Welcome to Eco-Dome Midrealm, traveler. I would warn you to be wary of dealing with that goblin, Shauly. I don't believe I've ever heard anyone use the word \"buddy\" as punctuation before."]="Te doy la bienvenida al Ecodomo de la Tierra Media, $gviajero:viajera;. Tengo que pedirte que tengas cuidado al tratar con ese goblin, Shauly. Es la única persona que conozca que usa la palabra \"colega\" como signo de puntuación."
G["Welcome to Fairbreeze Village.  Silvermoon's all but given up on us, but we refuse to leave.  This is our home."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a la aldea Brisa Pura. Lunargenta prácticamente nos ha abandonado, pero nos negamos a marcharnos. Este es nuestro hogar."
G["Welcome to Falcon Watch, $c. I see to the needs of the pilgrims and help them in continuing their long journey. If you haven't yet undertaken the pilgrimage, I can provide you with the information you will need."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a la Avanzada del Halcón, $c. Yo me hago cargo de las necesidades de los peregrinos y los ayudo a continuar su largo viaje. Si todavía no has emprendido la peregrinación, puedo proporcionarte la información que necesites."
G["Welcome to First Bank of Kezan, a wholly-owned subsidiary of the Bilgewater Traders & Merchants Bank Of The South Seas.\n\nWhat can I do for you today?"]="Te doy la bienvenida al Primer Banco de Kezan, una filial propiedad integral del Banco Pantoque de Comerciantes y Mercaderes de los Mares del Sur.\n\n¿Qué puedo hacer por ti hoy?"
G["Welcome to Fizzle & Pozzik's Speedbarge. You'll find just about anything you're looking for here."]="欢迎来到菲兹尔与普兹克赛艇平台。你能在这里找到所有你想要的东西。"
G["Welcome to Forest Song, $c. If there is anything I can do for you, please let me know."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a Canción del Bosque, $c. ¿Podemos ayudarte?"
G["Welcome to Fort Wildervar, brave homesteaders! There's a whole continent out there just waiting to be claimed!"]="欢迎来到维德瓦堡垒！瞧，那片土地等着你去占领呢！"
G["Welcome to Fuselight-by-the-Sea, a picturesque seaside town founded by explosives enthusiasts for explosives enthusiasts."]="欢迎来到熔光码头，这座风景如画的海滨小城是爆炸狂们为爆炸狂建造的家园。"
G["Welcome to Garadar, stranger. Are you looking for a place to rest?"]="$GBienvenido:bienvenida; a Garadar, $gforastero:forastera;. ¿Buscas un lugar donde descansar?"
G["Welcome to Granite Springs, friend.\n\nIf you manage to catch any of these ice trolls alive, be sure to let me know. We're paying well for 'em."]="欢迎来到岩石之泉。\n\n如果你能活捉这些冰霜巨魔的话，记得来找我谈谈。我愿意出高价买他们。"
G["Welcome to Grom'gol, $c.  Before we get off on the wrong foot, I'll have you know that I won't have slackers in my Base Camp.  I expect a healthy $r like you to pull your own weight around here."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a Grom'gol, $c. Antes de que empecemos con mal pie, quiero que sepas que no quiero gandules en mi Campamento Base. Espero que $gun:una; $r rebosante de salud como tú deje su huella por estos lares."
G["Welcome to Halfhill Market!"]="欢迎来到半山市集！"
G["Welcome to Halfhill Market, $r."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; al Mercado del Alcor, $r."
G["Welcome to Halfhill Market, where the prices are always fair!"]="欢迎来到半山市集，这里的价格一直很公道！"
G["Welcome to Halfhill, neighbor."]="Bienvenido a El Alcor, $gvecino:vecina;."
G["Welcome to Hardwrench Hideaway!\n\nLooking to get away from the hustle and bustle of city life?  You've come to the right place!\n\nWant to witness the marvels of Azeroth's famous jungle firsthand?  Look no further!\n\nShopping for some freshly pumped bio-fuel or weapons-grade mineral ores?  Then you've come to the right place, $c!"]="欢迎来到硬钳避世乐园！\n\n希望远离纷繁嘈杂的城市生活？那你可来对地方了！\n\n想要亲眼见证艾泽拉斯知名丛林的奇迹胜景？不用去别处了！\n\n想要购买新鲜出炉的生物燃料或武器级矿物？这里一定能满足你的需要，$c！"
G["Welcome to Honor Hold, $n.  It's good to have you."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; al Bastión del Honor, $n. Nos alegramos de tenerte aquí."
G["Welcome to Honor's Stand, $c! We ripped this valley from the claws of the Horde, but keeping this chokepoint open has proven to be another matter entirely."]="欢迎来到荣耀岗哨， $c！我们已经将这座山谷从部落手中夺了过来，但如果要保持这个咽喉要道的通畅就是另一回事了。"
G["Welcome to Keelen's Trustworthy Tailoring. I think you'll find my shop will suit your needs. If you wish to train with me, you need only ask; I'll be more than happy to teach you."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a la Sastrería Fiable de Keelen. Creo que mi tienda satisfará tus necesidades. Si deseas entrenar conmigo, solo tienes que pedirlo; será un placer enseñarte."
G["Welcome to Kota Peak. Home of super famous Kota Kafa. A luckydo would be wise to sniff and savor exotic brews."]="欢迎来到寇塔峰。非常有名的寇塔咔啡的产地。幸运符懂得品味异域的美酒。"
G["Welcome to Light's Hope Chapel, stranger."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a la Capilla de la Esperanza de la Luz, $gforastero:forastera;."
G["Welcome to Nethergarde, $c.  Call me \"Mama,\" I'm here to take care of you."]="Bienvenido a Nethergarde, $c. Llámame \"Mamá\", estoy aquí para cuidar de ti."
G["Welcome to Ogri'la, $c.\n\nThe ogres here have managed to gain a great mental acuity through the magical emanations of the surrounding crystals.  Though we do not fully understand how they work, we have come to appreciate our new home and only want to live in peace.\n\nUnfortunate then that the demons and ethereals, and especially the Black Dragonflight, will not leave us to that peace."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a Ogri'la, $c.\n\nLos ogros aquí hemos conseguido gran agudeza mental gracias a las emanaciones mágicas de los cristales que nos rodean. Aunque no acabamos de entender su funcionamiento, hemos logrado apreciar nuestro nuevo hogar y solo queremos vivir en paz.\n\nPor desgracia, los demonios y etéreos y, en especial, el Vuelo Negro, no nos dejan alcanzar esa paz."
G["Welcome to Orgrimmar!"]="欢迎来到奥格瑞玛！"
G["Welcome to Paw'don Village, outsider. I do not know why you have come, but you certainly look like you could use a rest.\n\nWhy not sit back with a fine cup of cider and let your worries fall away?"]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a la Aldea Zarpa'don, $gforastero:forastera;. No sé por qué has venido, pero desde luego parece que te vendría bien descansar un rato.\n\n¿Por qué no te sientas con un buen tazón de sidra y dejas que tus preocupaciones se desvanezcan?"
G["Welcome to Redridge, $c!"]="欢迎来到赤脊山，$c！"
G["Welcome to Revantusk Village, stranger. I am Primal Torntusk, leader of the Revantusk trolls."]="Te doy la bienvenida al Poblado Sañadiente, $gforastero:forastera;. Soy Primigenia Colmillopartido, líder de los trols Sañadiente."
G["Welcome to SI:7 headquarters, $n."]="欢迎来到军情七处总部，$n。"
G["Welcome to Sentry Point, $c."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; al Alto del Centinela, $c."
G["Welcome to Shatter Point, $n!  I hope you survive the experience!"]="¡$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; al Puesto Devastación, $n! ¡Espero que sobrevivas a esta experiencia!"
G["Welcome to Shattrath City, seat of the Sha'tar in Outland. You seek guidance?"]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a Shattrath, sede de los Sha'tar en Terrallende. ¿Necesitas información?"
G["Welcome to Starfall Village, traveler. Have you come to assist us?"]="Te doy la bienvenida a Aldea Estrella Fugaz, $gviajero:viajera;. ¿Has venido a ayudarnos?"
G["Welcome to Steelgrill's Depot!"]="¡$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; al Almacén de Brasacerada!"
G["Welcome to Stonemaul Hold, brave $c.  How may I assist you this day?"]="勇敢的$c，欢迎来到石槌要塞。我能帮助你吗？"
G["Welcome to Stoneplow. What can we do for you?"]="欢迎来到石犁村。能为你做点什么吗？"
G["Welcome to Stonetalon Mountains, friend! Saurboz is expectin' ya."]="欢迎来到石爪山脉，朋友！索博兹正在等你。"
G["Welcome to Stormwind!"]="¡$GBienvenido:Bienvenida; a Ventormenta!"
G["Welcome to Stormwind!  I am one of the city's officers, aiding the citizenry of the city through our census bureau.  If you are in need of locating someone specific, then I might be able to assist you.  Through arcane methods and sharpened mental discipline, I am able to access these records.\n\nIf you have business with me, then please proceed!"]="¡$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a Ventormenta! Soy uno de los oficiales de la ciudad y sirvo a la ciudadanía a través de nuestra oficina censal. Si necesitas localizar a alguien en concreto, creo que podré ayudarte. Puedo acceder a los registros a través de métodos arcanos y una aguda disciplina mental.\n\nSi tienes algún asunto conmigo, ¡procede!"
G["Welcome to Stormwind, $c."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a Ventormenta, $c."
G["Welcome to Stormwind. Took a long time to rebuild her but it was well worth it. So are you visiting, or are you here on business?"]="欢迎来暴风城。我们可是花了很长时间才将它重建起来的，但是这些工作都很值得。那么，你是来参观的还是有任务在身？"
G["Welcome to Tanaris, $n. How can I be of service to you today? You don't look like a blacksmith to me, but I know how looks can be deceiving."]="欢迎来到塔纳利斯，$n。我能为你提供什么服务？你看起来可不像铁匠，但是我知道，人不可貌相。"
G["Welcome to Telredor, $c. If you need anything, don't hesitate to ask."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a Telredor, $c. Si necesitas algo, no dudes en preguntar."
G["Welcome to The Arboretum, traveler.\n\nThis is the home of the Order of the Cloud Serpent. Together with our cloud serpents, we are sworn to defend The Jade Forest.\n\nYou, too, can join our ranks. However, you need more experience before you can begin the journey.\n\nGo and travel the land, then return to me when you are stronger."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; al Arboretum, $gviajero:viajera;.\n\nEsta es la sede de la Orden del Dragón Nimbo. Hemos jurado defender el Bosque de Jade junto a nuestros dragones nimbo.\n\nTú también puedes unirte a nosotros, pero te hace falta experiencia para comenzar el viaje.\n\nVe, recorre esta tierra, y vuelve a verme cuando seas más fuerte."
G["Welcome to The Bravery, $gsir:madame;. Now if you'll excuse me..."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a El Valentía, $gseñor:señora;. Ahora, si me disculpa..."
G["Welcome to The Heartland!"]="欢迎来到汇风岭！"
G["Welcome to Thelsamar, your home away from home in Loch Modan!\n\nThelsamar is a nice place, but it's not all beer and salted meat for those who answer the call to duty!  If you're willing to face danger in the name of the Alliance, then read the poster outside the Thelsamar branch of the Explorers' League."]="¡Te doy la bienvenida a Thelsamar, tu hogar lejos de tu hogar en Loch Modan!\n\nThelsamar es un lugar agradable, ¡pero no todo es cerveza y carne en salazón para aquellos que responden a la llamada del deber! Si estás $gdispuesto:dispuesta; a afrontar el peligro en nombre de la Alianza, entonces lee el cartel que está fuera de la rama de Thelsamar de la Liga de Expedicionarios."
G["Welcome to Theramore Isle. Something I can help you find?"]="欢迎光临塞拉摩岛。我能帮你什么忙吗？"
G["Welcome to Theramore, $c."]="欢迎来到塞拉摩，$c。"
G["Welcome to Theramore, $c. Looking for something?"]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a Theramore, $c. ¿Buscas algo?"
G["Welcome to Theramore."]="欢迎来到塞拉摩。"
G["Welcome to Thorium Point.  As Overseer, I'm responsible for all the activities of the Thorium Brotherhood.  While that mainly involves mining, smithing, and some minor guard duty, we've lately become more of a martial organization... out of necessity."]="欢迎来到瑟银哨塔。作为这里的工头，我负责管理瑟银兄弟会的一切行动。我们的主要工作是采矿，锻造，还有一些辅助性的守卫工作。但最近我们越来越向军事化发展了……这实在是没有必要。"
G["Welcome to Thrallmar, $n!  As you continue to aid us in our cause, I will grant you access to more of our supplies."]="¡$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a Thrallmar, $n! Como sigues ayudándonos en nuestra causa, te otorgaré más acceso a nuestros suministros."
G["Welcome to Tian Monastery."]="欢迎来到天禅院。"
G["Welcome to Tinker Town!"]="欢迎来到侏儒区！"
G["Welcome to Tol Barad, $c.  Time's a wastin' so let's get to work."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a Tol Barad, $c. Nos falta tiempo, así que a trabajar."
G["Welcome to Tranquillien, $c. I apologize for the state that you find it in. As you can see, we've been having some trouble, but the Forsaken, and their Lady Sylvanas Windrunner, have been gracious enough to lend us a great deal of assistance in our time of need.\n\nIf you can lend a hand please do not hesitate to do so. We can use all of the help that we can get in our struggle against the myriad forces arrayed against us."]="欢迎来到塔奎林，$c。我对你所看到的状况感到抱歉。就像你所看到的那样，我们有一些麻烦，但是遗忘者和他们的女王希尔瓦娜斯·风行者在我们需要的时候高尚地给了我们大量的帮助。\n\n如果你能帮忙的话，请不要犹豫不决。我们需要所有可以借助的力量。"
G["Welcome to Woo's, where the sun is always shining and the food is always hot!"]="欢迎光临王记，这里的太阳永不下山，这里的美食永远热气腾腾！"
G["Welcome to Wyrmrest Temple, traveler.\n\nHere the dragonflights confer in peace with one another amidst the bones of their honored ancestors.\n\nAt least, we were peaceful until the Blue Dragonflight launched a surprise attack upon the temple itself.\n\nEnter with our blessing, but know that we will brook no aggression within our walls."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; al Templo del Reposo del Dragón, caminante.\n\nAquí los Vuelos conviven en paz unos con otros entre los huesos de sus honrados ancestros.\n\nAl menos, había paz hasta que el Vuelo Azul inició un ataque sorpresa contra el Templo.\n\nEntra con nuestra bendición, pero ten en cuenta que no toleraremos ninguna agresión en este lugar sagrado."
G["Welcome to Zabra'jin, $c. I am Shadow Hunter Denjai, overseer of this outpost and commander of the Darkspear forces in Zangarmarsh."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a Zabra'jin, $c. Soy el cazador de las Sombras Denjai, supervisor de esta Avanzada y comandante de las fuerzas de Lanza Negra destacadas en la Marisma de Zangar."
G["Welcome to Zul'Gurub, little one.  It might not look like much now, but give it time..."]="欢迎来到祖尔格拉布，小不点儿。它现在的样子可能和以往大相径庭，但假以时日……"
G["Welcome to a cold death."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a la muerte helada."
G["Welcome to a very special trial!  The wisdom of a leader is reflected in the greatness of his followers. Let us see if your training has truly inspired those you lead..."]="欢迎你来参加这一特殊的试炼！领袖的智慧要靠他的追随者来反映。让我们来看看你能否真正激励你的追随者……"
G["Welcome to baradin base camp.  I know it does not look like much now, but with a little hard work we can whip this place into shape."]="欢迎来到巴拉丁营地。我知道现在这里还完全不像是一座营地，但只要经过一番努力营建，我们就能让这里初具规模了。"
G["Welcome to cokeplay.com, drink CocaCola and raise a cute polar bear!"]="¡$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a cokeplay.com, bebe CocaCola y cría a un oso polar muy mono!"
G["Welcome to da' revolution."]="欢迎加入起义军。"
G["Welcome to de great show, friends. Just wait 'til ya see what I got in store for ya."]="朋友，欢迎参加这场盛宴。瞧瞧这次我都给你们准备了什么好戏。"
G["Welcome to flavor country!"]="¡$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; al país de los sabores!"
G["Welcome to hell!"]="欢迎来到地狱！"
G["Welcome to me camp, $r.\n\nShe don't look like much, but she's home fer now."]="欢迎来到我的营地，$r。\n\n好吧，她或许算不上一座营地，但至少我把她看作自己的家园。"
G["Welcome to me shop. What can I do for ye'?"]="欢迎来到我的商店。我能为你做什么？"
G["Welcome to my Inn, weary traveler. What can I do for you?"]="Te doy la bienvenida a mi taberna, $gfatigado viajero:fatigada viajera;. ¿En qué puedo ayudarte?"
G["Welcome to my forge, Blacksmith. Let me share with you a little secret. No one, no one in the world can you trust. Not men, not women, not beasts ... this you can trust, Steel."]="Te doy la bienvenida a mi fragua, $gherrero:herrera;. Déjame compartir contigo un pequeño secreto. No puedes confiar en nadie, en nadie, ¿me oyes? No puedes confiar en ningún hombre, en ninguna mujer, en ninguna bestia... pero sí puedes confiar en el acero."
G["Welcome to my humble shop, $c."]="$GBienvenido:Bienvenida; a mi humilde tienda, $c."
G["Welcome to my inn, traveler. We have hot meals and soft beds."]="Te doy la bienvenida a mi posada, $gviajero:viajera;. Tenemos comida caliente y cómodas camas."
G["Welcome to my kingdom of darkness!"]="欢迎来到我的黑暗王国！"
G["Welcome to my kitchen!\nAre you here looking for food, or to do some cooking yourself?"]="¡Te doy la bienvenida a mi cocina!\n\n¿Has venido en busca de buena comida o quieres cocinar tú?"
G["Welcome to my kitchen! We prepare some of the finest food in Dalaran here."]="¡$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a mi cocina! Aquí preparamos algunos de los mejores platos de Dalaran."
G["Welcome to my noodle shack. We've got every type of noodle that should be eaten. If we don't have it, you shouldn't be eating it."]="欢迎来到我的面馆，各式面条应有尽有。要是我们这儿没有的，您不吃也罢。"
G["Welcome to my personal sanctum, heroes! I hope you find the accommodations to your liking. Herein you will find many of my failed experiments and ultimately my greatest triumph!"]="欢迎来到我的私家圣殿，英雄们！希望你们能有宾至如归的感觉。你们能在这里见到许多我的失败实验品，但最终将见证我最伟大的胜利！"
G["Welcome to my shop!"]="¡$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a mi tienda!"
G["Welcome to my shop, $c. What is it the Goodstitch brothers can do for you?"]="$GBienvenido:Bienvenida; a mi tienda, $c. ¿Qué pueden hacer por ti los hermanos Cortefino?"
G["Welcome to my shop, it's good to see another Enchanter here in Stormwind. Are you here for a lesson perhaps?"]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a mi tienda para ver a otro encantador aquí en Ventormenta. ¿Has venido para recibir instrucción?"
G["Welcome to my shop, it's good to see another Tailor here in Stormwind. Are you here for a lesson perhaps?"]="欢迎来到我的商店，很高兴在暴风城又遇见有人想要学裁缝的了。你来这里是想要学点东西的吗？"
G["Welcome to my shop, traveler!"]="欢迎光临我的小店，旅行者！"
G["Welcome to my wall, $c.\n\nNow, let's kick some mantid butt!"]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a mi muro, $c.\n\n¡Ahora, vamos a machacar a esos mántides!"
G["Welcome to our camp, $c. You're free to rest here if you'd like."]="$c，欢迎来到我们的营地。你可以在这里休息。"
G["Welcome to our first officially-sanctioned combat event, the Arena of Annihilation!"]="欢迎参加我们首个获得官方批准的格斗赛事，破军比武场！"
G["Welcome to our home away from home, $c. I wish we had a bit more hospitality to offer."]="欢迎来到远离家乡的家园，$c。希望我们能为您献上无比殷勤的款待。"
G["Welcome to our home in the hills, $r."]="欢迎来到我们在群山中的家园，$r。"
G["Welcome to our home, $n. Radnaal and I have little to offer, but you are welcome to what hospitality we can provide."]="$GBienvenido:Bienvenida; a nuestro hogar, $n. Radnaal y yo tenemos poco que ofrecerte, pero te acogemos con toda nuestra hospitalidad."
G["Welcome to our humble abode! It's always nice to see a friendly face. And what strong arms you have. My husband and I are always looking for help around the farm. Now that most the good folk have left, it's hard to find an able body to help out."]="Bienvenido a nuestro humilde hogar¡ Es siempre agradable ver una cara amiga. Y qué fuertes brazos tienes. Mi esposo y yo siempre estamos buscando ayuda en la granja. Ahora que la mayoría de los buenos vecinos se han ido, es difícil encontrar un cuerpo capaz para ayudar."
G["Welcome to our little chapel of the Light. Please, take a seat. Enjoy a respite from the world's ills."]="Bienvenid$go:a; a nuestra pequeña capilla de la Luz. Por favor, toma asiento. Disfruta de un descanso de los males del mundo."
G["Welcome to our most humble camp."]="欢迎来到我们最最卑微的营地。"
G["Welcome to our shop.  We have everything you need... if you need alchemy supplies."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a nuestra tienda. Tenemos todo lo que necesitas... si necesitas suministros de alquimia."
G["Welcome to our tent. May I assist you?"]="欢迎来到我的帐篷。我可以帮你吗？"
G["Welcome to the Allerian Stronghold, $c."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; al Bastión Allerian, $c."
G["Welcome to the Allerian Stronghold, $n."]="$GBienvenido:bienvenida; al Bastión Allerian, $n."
G["Welcome to the Arboretum. May you find inspiration amongst the trees."]="$gBienvenido: Bienvenida; al Arboretum. Que encuentres la inspiración entre los árboles."
G["Welcome to the Bank of Darnassus. We offer financial accounts and safety deposit boxes for valuable items. Do you already have an account with us $g sir : ma'am;?"]="欢迎来到达纳苏斯银行。我们提供金融帐户和存储贵重物品的保险箱。你要开户吗$g先生:女士;？"
G["Welcome to the Bank of Silvermoon, $g sir : ma'am;. Would you care to access the depository?"]="欢迎来到银月城银行，$g先生:女士;。你想使用存储服务吗？"
G["Welcome to the Bank of Stormwind. We offer financial accounts and safety deposit boxes for valuable items. Do you already have an account with us $g sir : ma'am;?"]="欢迎来到暴风城银行。我们竭诚为您提供最优质的服务，包括金融账户和绝对安全的储物箱。$g先生:女士;，您是否已经拥有了本银行的账户呢？"
G["Welcome to the Blue Recluse, where the magically inclined gather to blow off steam. Though not literally of course. What can I get for you $g sir : ma'am;?"]="欢迎来到蓝色隐士，这里是魔法汇集的地方。$g先生:女士;，我能帮你什么忙吗？"
G["Welcome to the Booty Bay fishing contest where each week we reward the finest fishermen in all of Azeroth.\nWhen the fishing tournament begins, you will be able to catch tastyfish from any fishing node in Stranglethorn."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; al concurso de pesca de Bahía del Botín, donde cada semana elegimos a los mejores pescadores de todo Azeroth.\n\nCuando comience el torneo de pesca, podrás capturar pezricos de cualquier nodo de pesca de Tuercespina."
G["Welcome to the Cantrips and Crows Tavern, $r.\n\nWatch your back while you're here, hmmm? Narisa doesn't like scrubbing blood off the floor."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a la Taberna de los Cuervos, $r.\n\nVigila tus espaldas mientras estás aquí, eh. A Narisa no le gusta fregar sangre del suelo."
G["Welcome to the Cenarion Circle, $c."]="欢迎来到塞纳里奥议会，$c。"
G["Welcome to the Cenarion Circle, $c.  How may I assist you?"]="欢迎来到塞纳里奥议会，$c。我要怎么帮你呢？"
G["Welcome to the Cenarion Refuge, $n. I've been instructed to offer you basic supplies for purchase, should you need them."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; al Refugio Cenarion, $n. Tengo órdenes de ofrecerte material básico si lo necesitas."
G["Welcome to the Cold of Cold, friend! Our unique ice cream is chilled to order by one of Stormwind's finest apprentice mages!"]="欢迎来到冰锥甜筒，朋友！我们的冰激凌味道独一无二，冰寒爽口，是暴风城最优秀的法师学徒特别定制的！"
G["Welcome to the Cradle of Chi-Ji, friend."]="欢迎来到赤精栖木，朋友。"
G["Welcome to the Crossroads, $c. My name is Thork--I lead the defenses here in the name of the Warchief.\n\nPlease, feel free to make yourself at home. As long as you mind your business, no one should have any problem with you taking up some space.\n\nThere are many threats to our safety here. If you've already become familiar with the lay of the land, speak to the others here--perhaps they have tasks for you to do."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a El Cruce, $c. Mi nombre es Thork, lidero las defensas de este lugar en nombre del Jefe de Guerra.\n\nPor favor, siéntete como en casa. Mantente en tus asuntos y a nadie le importará que estés por aquí.\n\nNuestra seguridad está muy amenazada. Si ya te has familiarizado con la situación del país habla con algún otro, quizás te puedan encomendar alguna tarea."
G["Welcome to the Darkmoon Faire!"]="¡$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a la Feria de la Luna Negra!"
G["Welcome to the Darkmoon Faire, $c!"]="¡$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a la Feria de la Luna Negra, $c!"
G["Welcome to the Darkmoon Faire, $c!\n\nMy name is Kerri Hicks and I'd shake your hand but I'm afraid I'd break it, because I'm the strongest woman alive!"]="欢迎来到暗月马戏团，$c！\n\n我叫克莉·希克斯，我应该跟你握手致意的，但是恐怕我会把你的手捏碎，因为我是当今世上最强的女人！"
G["Welcome to the Demolisher Engineering Console v0.1 alpha."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a la consola de ingeniero del demoledor v0.1 alfa."
G["Welcome to the Demolisher Mechanic Console v0.1 alpha."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a la consola de mecánico del demoledor v0.1 alfa."
G["Welcome to the Evergrove, $c. Timeon and I have been studying the arakkoa of Blade's Edge for some time now, and we've found some alarming differences between them and their cousins in Terokkar."]="欢迎来到常青林，$c。坦莫和我一直在研究刀锋山一带的鸦人，最近，我们发现他们和那些泰罗卡森林的鸦人之间有着一些令人担忧的差别。"
G["Welcome to the Explorers' League.  If you need information, and it is in book form, then I might be able to help you out."]="欢迎来到探险者联盟。如果你需要书面信息的话，我也许能帮你。"
G["Welcome to the Falconwing Square Inn. May I prepare a meal for you, or ready a room?"]="欢迎来到鹰翼广场旅店。需要给您准备一顿美食，还是准备一间房间？"
G["Welcome to the Farstrider Lodge, $n!"]="¡$GBienvenido:Bienvenida; a la Cabaña del Errante, $n!"
G["Welcome to the Farstrider Retreat.  We are rangers sworn to defend our people from enemies both near and far."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; al Retiro del Errante. Somos forestales que hemos jurado defender a nuestra gente de los enemigos cercanos y lejanos."
G["Welcome to the First-Class Experimental Teleporter! \n\nFor a modest fee, this marvel of goblin engineering will hurl you across Azeroth in the blink of an eye. \n\nSimply select your destination and hold on tight. Management is not responsible for unexpected detours, rough landings, or spontaneous combustion."]="¡Bienvenido al Teletransportador Experimental de Primera Clase! \n\nPor una módica tarifa, esta maravilla de la ingeniería goblin te lanzará a través de Azeroth en un abrir y cerrar de ojos. \n\nSimplemente elige tu destino y agárrate fuerte. La dirección no se hace responsable de desvíos imprevistos, aterrizajes bruscos ni combustiones espontáneas."
G["Welcome to the Gallywix Rocketway Exchange! Debts to pay or get the heck away."]="¡$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; al Intercambiador de la Cohetepista de Gallywix! ¿Tienes deudas que pagar? Si no lárgate."
G["Welcome to the Golden Lantern, the finest inn in the Vale. If anyone wants to argue with me, I will show them my fists."]="欢迎光临谷里最好的旅店——金色神灯。如果有人想跟我争，我就让他尝尝我的拳头。"
G["Welcome to the Great Banquet. High Elder Cloudfall awaits you at the back table."]="欢迎参加我们的盛宴。云瀑长老在后面张桌子那儿等着你。"
G["Welcome to the Great Forge $g lad : lass;. It may be cold outside but we keep it nice and hot down 'ere. Grab a hammer, strike that anvil and show me ye've got what it takes to be a Blacksmith of the Great Forge!"]="欢迎来到大锻炉，$g小伙子:姑娘;。外面虽然非常寒冷，但是这里确实热火朝天。拿起锤子开工吧，让我看看你到底有些什么能耐！"
G["Welcome to the Grim Guzzler!"]="欢迎来到我们的酒店！"
G["Welcome to the Horde, High Chief. Lok'tar ogar!"]="欢迎加入部落，大酋长。Lok'tar ogar！"
G["Welcome to the Imperial Granary.\n\nThough not so \"imperious\" today with this sprite infestation. Oh, um, you didn't hear that. Or see, for that matter.\n\nIn fact, can you not tell anyone you ever came here and especially not say anything about this sprite fiasco?"]="Te doy la bienvenida al Granero Imperial.\n\nAunque hoy en día ya no es tan \"imperial\" con esta plaga de duendes. Ah, eh, eso no lo has oído. O visto, en este caso.\n\nDe hecho, ¿te importaría no decirle a nadie que has venido aquí y, especialmente, no decir nada sobre el desastre de los duendes?"
G["Welcome to the Legerdemain Lounge, $c. I do hope you'll enjoy your stay."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; al Salón de Juego de Manos, $c. Espero que disfrutes de tu estancia."
G["Welcome to the Lion's Pride Inn.  Make yourself at home!"]="欢迎来到狮王之傲旅店。您会在这里找到家的感觉！"
G["Welcome to the Menders' Stead, $c."]="欢迎来到治愈者营地，$c。"
G["Welcome to the Molten Flow, $n."]="欢迎来到熔火激流，$n。"
G["Welcome to the Nightingale Lounge, $c. What can we play for you today?"]="欢迎光临夜莺旅馆，$c。今天我们可以为你做些什么？"
G["Welcome to the North Wind Tavern."]="欢迎光临北风酒馆。"
G["Welcome to the Northern Rocketway Exchange! We at Rocketway Relations are glad you survived that last turn!"]="¡$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; al Intercambiador de la Cohetepista del Norte! ¡Aquí en Relaciones Paso de Cohetes estamos encantados de que hayas sobrevivido a este último viaje!"
G["Welcome to the Northern Rocketway Terminus! You probably took a wrong turn, but we're happy to have you anyway!"]="¡$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a la Terminal de la Cohetepista del Norte! ¡Probablemente hayas tomado un viaje equivocado, pero nos alegramos de tenerte aquí de todas formas!"
G["Welcome to the Order of the Cloud Serpent. Only those exalted with our Order may acquire our cloud serpents."]="欢迎来到云端翔龙骑士团。只有在我们骑士团里达到崇拜的人才能获得我们的云端翔龙。"
G["Welcome to the Orebor Harborage, friend. You have nothing to fear here. We are Broken, but we are not your enemies.\n\nI am Ikuti of the Kurenai, a group of Broken who desire to reestablish ties with our draenei brothers and their newfound allies."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; al Puerto Orebor, $gamigo:amiga;. Aquí no tienes nada que temer. Somos Tábidos, pero no somos enemigos.\n\nYo soy Ikuti de los Kurenai, un grupo de Tábidos que desean recuperar las relaciones con los hermanos draenei y sus nuevos aliados."
G["Welcome to the Orgrimmar Rocketway Exchange! You still look to be in one piece."]="¡$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; al Intercambiador de la Cohetepista de Orgrimmar! Parece que sigues de una pieza."
G["Welcome to the Peak of Serenity $n.  How can I help you?"]="Te doy la bienvenida al Pico de la Serenidad. ¿En qué puedo ayudarte?"
G["Welcome to the Peak of Serenity.  Good luck in your training."]="欢迎来到晴日峰。祝你训练顺利。"
G["Welcome to the Pig and Whistle! Grab a drink my friend and pull up a seat, the more the merrier!"]="欢迎来到猪和哨声旅店！和朋友在这里举杯畅饮，不亦乐乎！"
G["Welcome to the Proving Grounds. Your first trial will now begin. Defeat each wave of illusions before time runs out."]="欢迎来到试炼场。你的首场试炼即将开始。请在时间用尽前击败所有的幻影。"
G["Welcome to the Registrar of Guilds.  How can I be of service to you?"]="欢迎来到公会注册处。有什么我可以为您效劳的吗？"
G["Welcome to the Ring of Valor, pandaren. Make yourself comfortable while I finish preparing."]="欢迎来到勇气竞技场，熊猫人。我先去准备，你们随意参观。"
G["Welcome to the Royal Exchange Bank, $g sir : ma'am;. How may I help you?"]="欢迎来到皇家贸易区，$g先生:女士;。有什么我可以帮你的吗？"
G["Welcome to the Scarlet Raven.  It's best to stay indoors these days."]="欢迎来到血鸦旅店。这种时候，你最好一直呆在屋子里。"
G["Welcome to the Seat of Knowledge. And never was there a greater repository of information and wisdom to be found about the ancient days of Pandaria."]="欢迎来到闻道之座。这里是蕴藏着潘达利亚古代知识与智慧的伟大宝库。"
G["Welcome to the Serpent's Overlook. Did you happen to bring a kite with you?"]="$GBienvenido:Bienvenida; al Mirador del Dragón. No habrás traído contigo una cometa por casualidad, ¿verdad?"
G["Welcome to the Shady Lady, home of fine wines and exotic merchandise you won't find anywhere else!"]="欢迎来到林荫女士，这里有最好的美酒和异域商品，只此一家！"
G["Welcome to the Shrine of Aviana, $c. Here we sit atop the world and touch the sky."]="欢迎来到艾维娜圣殿，$c。在这里，我们安坐于毗邻苍穹的世界之巅。"
G["Welcome to the Southern Rocketway Terminus! Home of the world famous Secret Lab!"]="¡$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a la Terminal de la Cohetepista del Sur! El hogar del laboratorio secreto más famoso del mundo."
G["Welcome to the Stockade!"]="¡$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a las mazmorras!"
G["Welcome to the Storm Peaks, $r."]="欢迎来到风暴峭壁，$r。"
G["Welcome to the Stormspire, $c.\n\nPlease do not be put off by my being present through this imaging device.  I have many enemies that would like to see me dead, so it is only a precaution.\n\nI assure you that you are perfectly safe here."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a la Flecha de la Tormenta, $c.\n\nQue no te disuada que esté presente a través de este dispositivo de imágenes. Tengo muchos enemigos a los que les gustaría verme muerto, así que es solo por precaución.\n\nTe aseguro que estás perfectamente $gseguro:segura; aquí."
G["Welcome to the Stormwind Guild Registry offices. What can I help you with today?"]="欢迎来到暴风城公会注册办公室。有什么需要我帮忙的吗？"
G["Welcome to the Sunwell. Despite the mild temperatures and scenic vistas, you're not on vacation, ladies and gentlemen!"]="欢迎来到太阳之井。尽管这里气候宜人，景色秀丽，但女士们先生们，你们不是来这里度假的！"
G["Welcome to the Taverns of Time!"]="¡$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a las Tabernas del Tiempo!"
G["Welcome to the Temple of the Jade Serpent, stranger. Our doors are open to all who seek knowledge."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; al Templo del Dragón de Jade, $gforastero:forastera;. Nuestras puertas están abiertas a todo aquel que busca conocimiento."
G["Welcome to the Temple of the Jade Serpent, traveler.\n\nWe welcome all within our doors, and offer knowledge freely to any who seek it."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; al Templo del Dragón de Jade, $gviajero:viajera;.\n\nDamos la bienvenida a todo el mundo y ofrecemos nuestra sabiduría a todo aquel que la busca."
G["Welcome to the Temple of the Jade Serpent. How may I help you?"]="欢迎来到青龙寺。有什么需要帮助的吗？"
G["Welcome to the Thunderpaw Refuge. Do not let the armor deceive you. We train in healing practices here."]="$GBienvenido:Bienvenida; al Refugio Zarpa Atronadora. Que la armadura no te confunda: aquí practicamos ejercicios de sanación."
G["Welcome to the Thunderpaw Refuge. Here we practice our craft of focusing our chi into healing."]="$GBienvenido:Bienvenida; al Refugio Zarpa Atronadora. Aquí practicamos el concentrar nuestro chi en la sanación."
G["Welcome to the Toshley's Station inn.  What can I do for you?"]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a la posada de la Estación de Toshley. ¿Qué puedo hacer por ti?"
G["Welcome to the Trials of the Crusader! Only the most powerful combatants of Azeroth are allowed to undergo these trials. You are among the worthy few."]="欢迎参加十字军的试炼！只有全艾泽拉斯最强大的斗士才能参加这次选拔。而你正是其中之一。"
G["Welcome to the Underbelly. Something I can help you find?"]="欢迎来到达拉然下水道。我能帮你什么忙吗？"
G["Welcome to the Undercity Guild Registry. What do you want?"]="欢迎来到幽暗城公会登记处。你需要什么帮助么？"
G["Welcome to the Vale, friend. Stay and be at peace."]="欢迎到山谷来，朋友。一切随意，别惹麻烦。"
G["Welcome to the Void..."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; al Vacío..."
G["Welcome to the Wickerman Festival, $c!\n\nOn the observance of Hallow's End, the Forsaken burn a wickerman in honor of this, the most revered of occasions.  It was on this day that the Banshee Queen herself delivered us from the clutches of the Lich King and the Scourge.  We have remained free ever since.  Those who would have seen us fall are repaid in full... with vengeance!\n\nThe burning of the Wickerman begins at 8:00 PM!"]="欢迎来到稻草人庆典，$c!\n\n为了庆祝万鬼节，被遗忘者焚烧稻草人来彰显其荣耀，最为尊崇的场合。就是这一天，女妖之王带着我们逃出了巫妖王与天谴军团的魔爪，从此以後我们得到了自由。我们对那些造成我们堕落之人的仇恨将会全额奉还!\n\n稻草人将会在下午8:00开始焚烧!"
G["Welcome to the Wickerman Festival, $c!\n\nOn the observance of Hallow's End, we burn a Wickerman to represent a cleansing of the self. As the woods sigh and shed their leaves, we too must undergo a catharsis. Fears, sorrows, regrets: by throwing a branch into the blaze, you can relieve yourself of any burden you would not bear into winter.\n\nPlease, grab a branch from the bonfire and join the celebration!"]="欢迎来到稻草人庆典，$c！\n\n按照万圣节的习俗，我们要焚烧一个稻草人，以代表我们对自我内心的净化。如同森林在秋天洒落枯叶，我们也必须抛弃自身枯萎的那一部分——恐惧、悲哀、憾恨。将枯枝投入烈火，代表着你抛下了不应带入冬天的重担。\n\n请从大篝火中拿起燃烧的枯枝，加入我们的庆典吧！"
G["Welcome to the Wonderworks!\n\nPlease take your time and browse the shop. We have wonderful toys for people young and old!"]="¡$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a Obras Asombrosas!\n\nÉchale un ojo a la tienda un rato. Tenemos juguetes maravillosos para gente joven y mayor."
G["Welcome to the camp, $c."]="欢迎来到营地，$c。"
G["Welcome to the coast of Pandaria! Where everything that can wash ashore has, or will, wash ashore."]="¡$GBienvenido:Bienvenida; a la costa de Pandaria! Donde todo lo que puede arrastrar la corriente ha sido o será arrastrado por ella."
G["Welcome to the endless winter."]="欢迎进入无尽的寒冬。"
G["Welcome to the faire young one!   We have collected wonders from all over the world for your perusal.   Oh and please let me know if you manage to collect a set of the lesser darkmoon cards, as the master... I mean I would be keenly interested in them."]="年轻人，欢迎来到暗月马戏团！我们从世界各地收集到不少神奇的东西，你可以随便看。啊，如果你能设法收集一套次级暗月卡片，就赶紧告诉我，因为主人……我是说我对这东西很感兴趣。"
G["Welcome to the field, $c! You can't get a feel for the tactical situation if you're hiding in a fortress all day. I always like to get my boots dirty."]="欢迎来到前线，$c！如果只是躲在城堡里面，你将无法对现在的战争态势有真正的感受。这就是我总不愿意离开战场的原因。"
G["Welcome to the front lines, $c.  The Kingdom of Stormwind, with the aid of its allies, has sent me here to counter the growing threat of the Scourge.  Here at Chillwind Camp, we fight for our continued survival on a daily basis.\n\nIf you've come here looking for a chance to prove yourself as a hero, then you'll find plenty of opportunities to do so... especially as we push towards Andorhal and whatever malign force that controls the Scourge there."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a las fronteras, $c. El Reino de Ventormenta, con la ayuda de sus aliados, me ha enviado para combatir la creciente amenaza de la Plaga. Aquí, en el Alto del Orvallo, luchamos día a día por una supervivencia que pueda ser duradera.\n\nSi has venido hasta aquí en busca de una oportunidad para mostrarte como $gun héroe:una heroína;, no te faltarán las ocasiones de hacerlo... Especialmente cuando lancemos nuestras ofensivas hacia Andorhal y contra cualquier fuerza maligna que controle ahí a los miembros de la Plaga."
G["Welcome to the front lines, $c.  While politicians may connive and scheme amongst themselves, they'll find no such luxury afforded to them here.  This is the Bulwark, and we fight for our continued survival on a daily basis here.\n\nIf you've come here looking for a chance to prove yourself as a hero, then you'll find plenty of opportunities to do so."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a la primera línea, $c. Aunque los políticos conspiren e intriguen entre ellos, aquí verán que no se les permiten tales lujos. Este es el Baluarte, y aquí luchamos por nuestra continua supervivencia día tras día.\n\nSi has venido en busca de una oportunidad para demostrar que eres $gun héroe:una heroína;, encontrarás muchas oportunidades para hacerlo."
G["Welcome to the great show, friends.  Step right up to die!"]="朋友，欢迎参加这场盛宴。来吧，狂欢至死吧！"
G["Welcome to the headquarters of the Blood Knights, the defenders of Quel'Thalas, the faithful servants of Silvermoon, and the true masters of the Light."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; al puesto de mando de los Caballeros de sangre, defensores de Quel'Thalas, fieles siervos de Lunargenta y verdaderos maestros de la Luz."
G["Welcome to the home of the Kirin Tor."]="欢迎来到肯瑞托议会的故乡。"
G["Welcome to the iCoke-WOW summer promotion.\n\nDear $n, the halo of fortune goddess is shining on you.  Obey to the order of god; you'll get a special and mystery present.  Now, the gate of Azeroth is open for you.  A great adventure will begin soon.  Are you ready?\n\nMay the honor be with you!"]="¡Te doy la bienvenida a la promoción de verano de iCoke-WOW!\n\n$gQuerido:querida; $n, el halo de la diosa fortuna está brillando sobre ti. Obedece la orden de un dios. Obtendrás un regalo especial y misterioso. Ahora, la puerta de Azeroth se ha abierto para ti. Pronto comenzará una gran aventura. ¿$gPreparado:preparada;?\n\n¡Que el honor esté contigo!"
G["Welcome to the jungle, $n."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a la selva, $n."
G["Welcome to the jungle, $r! Nesingwary dispatched me to gather info on the wildlife down here.\n\nFeel like lending a hand?"]="¡$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a la jungla, $r! Nesingwary me ha enviado para reunir información sobre la vida salvaje de por aquí.\n\n¿Te gustaría echarme una mano?"
G["Welcome to the jungle, $rt. You're gunna die!"]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a la selva, $rt. ¡Morirás aquí!"
G["Welcome to the majestic Lady Mehley. I am Captain Torgoley.\n\nIf you've questions about the ship, feel free to ask; otherwise, please, enjoy the journey, as I always do... After all, to quote a favorite scribe of mine: My experience of ships is that on them one makes an interesting discovery about the world. One finds one can do without it completely."]="欢迎乘坐梅蕾女士号。我是船长托格雷。\n\n我负责解答所有关于这艘船的疑问，并祝愿大家旅途愉快。就像我喜欢的座右铭那样：对我来说，船只的意义在于带你游历全世界。没有它，你就无法享受这样美妙的体验。"
G["Welcome to the military, recruit."]="欢迎加入军队，新兵。"
G["Welcome to the party, $g pal:lady;!"]="欢迎参加派对，$g老兄:女士;！"
G["Welcome to the party, $n!"]="¡$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a la fiesta, $n!"
G["Welcome to the party, $n.  Would you like to receive a lesson in how to fight with minions?"]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a la fiesta, $n. ¿Quieres que te dé una lección sobre el combate con esbirros?"
G["Welcome to the races!  Enjoy your stay, and don't bet all your money in one place!"]="¡$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a las carreras! ¡Disfruta de tu estancia y no lo apuestes todo a lo mismo!"
G["Welcome to the refuge, $n. Some come here with a purpose, others found their way here by accident... But everyone here seems to have a unique story to tell."]="$GBienvenido:Bienvenida; al refugio, $n. Algunos vienen aquí con algún fin, otros por accidente... Pero todos tienen una historia única que contar."
G["Welcome to the tournament, $n."]="Bienvenid$go:a; al torneo, $n."
G["Welcome to the war, kid."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a la guerra, $gchaval:chica;."
G["Welcome to the world of the unliving."]="欢迎来到亡者的世界。"
G["Welcome to your future -- what little there is left of it..."]="接受你的未来吧——命运什么都没给你留下……"
G["Welcome weary traveler.  You've come a long way.  We hope you can find rest here at Camp Oneqwah."]="欢迎你，疲惫的旅行者。历经长途跋涉后，希望你能在欧尼瓦营地好好休息。"
G["Welcome!"]="¡$gBienvenido:Bienvenida;!"
G["Welcome!  If you need a place to rest, I can solve that problem."]="欢迎！想找地方休息的话，我能为你提供食宿服务哦。"
G["Welcome!  Welcome to Yebb Neblegear's Darkmoon Zoo Bizarre - a Trove of Living Legends and Mythical Oddities!  Enjoy your visit, friend!\n\nBut be mindful of what you touch!  These exhibits hold artifacts and beasts both dire and divine!  They might burn the wayward hand of an over-curious onlooker..."]="¡$gBienvenido:Bienvenida;! Te doy la bienvenida al Zoo de Singularidades Luna Negra de Yebb Tesorillos. ¡Un tesoro de leyendas vivientes y rarezas míticas! ¡Que disfrutes de la visita, $gamigo:amiga;!\n\n¡Pero cuidado con lo que tocas! En las exhibiciones hay bestias y artefactos tanto letales como divinos. Podrían quemar la mano caprichosa de un observador demasiado curioso..."
G["Welcome! Don't be shy... move away from those pillars so that I can see you fully."]="欢迎！不要害羞……从那些柱子中走出来吧，这样我就能清楚地看到你了。"
G["Welcome! Have you come to join us for a Pilgrim's Bounty feast? Please, have a seat at a Bountiful Table.\n\nTry everything! I'm certain you'll find something to your liking."]="¡$gBienvenido:Bienvenida;! ¿Has venido para unirte a un festín de la Generosidad del Peregrino? Siéntate en una mesa generosa.\n\n¡Pruébalo todo! Estoy segura de que encontrarás algo que te guste."
G["Welcome! Have you yet honored this land's flame?"]="欢迎！你有没有向这块大陆上的火焰表达你的敬意？"
G["Welcome! Step right up, don't be shy.\n\nThis here is my pride and joy... the Blastenheimer 5000 Ultra Cannon! Ain't she pretty?"]="¡$gBienvenido:Bienvenida;! Adelante, no tengas vergüenza.\n\nEsto de aquí es mi mayor tesoro... ¡el Ultracañón Pimpampum 5000! ¿No es precioso?"
G["Welcome! You won't find a better selection east of the camp!"]="¡$GBienvenido:Bienvenida;! ¡No encontrarás una selección mejor al este del campamento!"
G["Welcome, $C.\n\nMy name is Aliscar Lend; mage, sorcerer, and public advisor for Goldshire."]="Bienvenido, $C.\n\nMe llamo Aliscar Lend; mago, hechicero y consejero público de Villadorada."
G["Welcome, $c!"]="欢迎你，$c！"
G["Welcome, $c!  I hope you aren't afraid of heights!\n\nI've got a practice parachute for you.  These chutes are for quick landings.  If you want to gently soar to the ground, use a mount.  If you want action and an adrenaline rush, you fall.  At the last possible moment you use your chute.  That's how these were made.  Quick action!  Are you ready for some quick action?\n\nThe chute only lasts a few seconds.  So you'll need to time it just right.  I'm not sure you can handle it, $c.  I'd like to see you prove me wrong."]="¡$gBienvenido:Bienvenida;, $c! ¡Espero que no te den miedo las alturas!\n\nTengo un paracaídas de prácticas para ti. Estos se usan para aterrizajes rápidos. Si quieres caer suavemente, usa una montura. Si quieres acción y un subidón de adrenalina: tírate y abre el paracaídas lo más tarde posible. Para eso están. ¡Acción rápida! ¿Te apetece un poco de acción rápida?\n\nEl salto solo dura unos segundos. Así que tendrás que calcular bien el tiempo. No tengo claro que seas capaz de hacerlo, $c. A ver si me demuestras lo contrario."
G["Welcome, $c! Be sure to take a moment and enjoy the view!"]="欢迎，$c！务必要抽出时间欣赏景色啊！"
G["Welcome, $c! My contacts throughout Pandaria tell me that you have been quite busy here. I admire mortals with your... 'initiative.'\n\nHistory finds us at a turning point. If you are prepared to meet destiny with me head on, I will ensure that you are richly rewarded for your efforts."]="¡$gBienvenido:Bienvenida;, $c! Mis contactos por toda Pandaria me han informado de que has estado bastante $gocupado:ocupada; por aquí. Os admiro, mortales, por vuestra... \"iniciativa\".\n\nEstamos ante un momento en el que la historia puede cambiar de manera radical. Si estás $gpreparado:preparada; para encontrarte con el destino, ven conmigo y me aseguraré de que se te recompense de manera adecuada por tus esfuerzos."
G["Welcome, $c! Welcome to the Shrine of Aviana, a haven for all creatures of the sky.\n\nAviana may no longer be with us, but her heart and her ferocity live on in all winged creatures.\n\nSpeak with Choluna down below if you are curious about Aviana's story."]="欢迎你，$c！欢迎来到艾维娜圣殿——天空中所有生灵的避风港。\n\n艾维娜或许已经不再与我们同在，但她的心魂与她的凶猛战力却将永远留存在所有藉双翼翱翔的生灵身上。\n\n要是你想了解艾维娜的故事，可以与位于下方的楚伦娜交谈。"
G["Welcome, $c.\n\nHyjal burns and the world I've spent my life protecting is on the brink of oblivion.\n\nTell me: Have you ever heard of Tyrus Blackhorn?"]="欢迎你，$c。\n\n海加尔燃起了熊熊烈火，我耗尽毕生心血保护的世界已在毁灭的边缘。\n\n告诉我——你可曾听说过泰拉斯·黑角这个名字？"
G["Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame?\n\nRemember: Our festival fires burn in every land with a Horde settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can.\n\nThe Alliance, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them."]="欢迎你，$c。你祭拜过这座火堆了吗？\n\n记住：所有部落人民定居的地方，都会有我们的节日之火在那里熊熊地燃烧着。\n\n联盟也一样，在各处都点起了他们自己的火焰。当你看见这些火堆时，不妨亵渎之，对我们会有帮助的。"
G["Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame?\n\nRemember: Our festival fires burn in every land with an Alliance settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can.\n\nThe Horde, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them."]="欢迎，$c。你有没有向这团火焰表达你的敬意？\n\n记住：我们的节日火焰在联盟的每一片土地上燃烧，如果你有时间的话，去向它们一一表达你的敬意。\n\n当然部落也点燃了他们自己的火焰，如果你有看到的话，记得去踏灭那些毫无价值的东西。"
G["Welcome, $g brother: sister;."]="欢迎你，$g兄弟:姐妹;。"
G["Welcome, $g sir : my lady;. This is a much better camp than the one that I used to have.\n\nIt's good to have company. They've been nice enough to teach me some of their fighting techniques so that I can hold my own against the Horde."]="欢迎你，$G先生:女士;。这片营地比我待过的上一个营地要好多了。\n\n很荣幸，我能够和一群出色的战友共事，他们教会了我不少战斗技巧。现在我已经能独立与部落作战了。"
G["Welcome, $n!\n\nThis is the \"Wanderer's Festival,\" where we celebrate the deeds of the first pandaren explorer and gather on the beach to gaze out across the sea.\n\nThere was a time when the mists that cloaked Pandaria were so thick, sometimes you couldn't even see that large rock just off the shore there. Now look at it - what a glorious night! I'm glad you are here for this."]="¡Te doy la bienvenida, $n!\n\nEste es el \"Festival del Errante,\" en el que celebramos las hazañas del primer explorador pandaren y nos reunimos en la playa para estar cerca del mar.\n\nHubo un tiempo en que la niebla que cubría Pandaria era tan densa que, en ocasiones, no se podía ver aquella enorme roca de la costa. Pero mírala ahora... ¡hace una noche maravillosa! Me alegro de que estés aquí para ver esto."
G["Welcome, $n! Are you interested in training in tailoring?"]="¡$GBienvenido:Bienvenida;, $n! ¿Estás $ginteresado:interesada; en aprender sastrería?"
G["Welcome, $n."]="欢迎，$n。"
G["Welcome, $n.  We are the Aldor, priests of the Light and servants of the Sha'tar.\n\nYou are welcome to stay with us for as long as you need."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida;, $n. Somos los Aldor, sacerdotes de la luz y siervos de Sha'tar.\n\nPuedes quedarte con nosotros todo el tiempo que quieras."
G["Welcome, $n. Bring me the marks that Illidan bestows upon his most powerful minions and I shall grant you access to my alchemical goods."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida;, $n. Tráeme las marcas que Illidan otorga a sus esbirros más poderosos y te permitiré acceder a mis bienes alquímicos."
G["Welcome, $n. Have you come to join the invasion of the Firelands?"]="欢迎你，$n。你是来参加对火焰之地的进攻的吗？"
G["Welcome, $n. I am Landro Longshot - manager of the Black Flame. Perhaps you've not heard of the Black Flame until now. That doesn't surprise me; we work to keep things that way. We prefer to avoid... factional entanglements.\n\nThe Black Flame specializes in providing the finest services and entertainment money can buy, whether they happen to be hard to find items, gladiatorial combat, or lucrative games of chance.\n\nAre you here seeking something specific?"]="Te doy la bienvenida, $n. Soy Landro Tirolargo, patrón de la Llama Negra. Puede que sea la primera vez que oyes hablar de mi local. No me sorprende; hacemos todo lo posible para que no se hable demasiado de nosotros. Hay que evitar meterse en líos entre las facciones.\n\nEn la Llama Negra nos especializamos en ofrecer los mejores servicios y el mejor entretenimiento que el dinero puede comprar; desde objetos difíciles de encontrar hasta peleas de gladiadores, pasando por lucrativos juegos de azar.\n\n¿Buscas algo en particular?"
G["Welcome, $n. I've had the market area cleared to make room for Halfhill's first noodle stand, run by you!"]="欢迎，$n。我已经在市集上为半山的第一家面摊腾出一块空地了，由你来经营！"
G["Welcome, $n. My expertise is in the art of working with primal mooncloth. Tailors interested in becoming mooncloth specialists often ask me to teach them our ways."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida;, $n. Tengo pericia en el arte de trabajar con tela lunar primigenia. Los sastres interesados en ser especialistas en tejido lunar me piden a menudo que les enseñe nuestras artes."
G["Welcome, $n. We are honored to have you as our guest. Today, we celebrate not only your arrival, but the initiation of a new class of trainees within our monastery.\n\nPlease, enjoy the food and drink that we have prepared. When you are ready, I would like to introduce you to some of the monastery's instructors."]="Te damos la bienvenida, $n. Es un honor tenerte como huésped. Hoy, no solo celebramos tu llegada, sino el comienzo de una nueva clase de alumnos de nuestro monasterio.\n\nDisfruta de la comida y la bebida que hemos preparado. Cuando estés $gpreparado:preparada;, me gustaría presentarte a algunos de los instructores del monasterio."
G["Welcome, $p! I'll never forget the help ya gave me savin' my boy. Now that was a proper hunt!"]="欢迎你，$p！我永远也不会忘记，是你帮我救回了儿子。那才是像样的狩猎！"
G["Welcome, $p, to my Tournament of Strength!"]="$p，欢迎你参加我的力量大赛！"
G["Welcome, $p. We have been watching you for some time.\n\nYou are the gust of wind that heralds the storm of change."]="欢迎你，$p。我们已经关注你很久了。\n\n你就像是预示着变化风暴即将到来的一股疾风。"
G["Welcome, $p. We have been watching your accomplishments since your arrival in our land."]="欢迎你，$p。自从你踏上这片土地，我们就一直密切注意着你的才能。"
G["Welcome, $r! Stay and listen for a while."]="欢迎，$r！留下来听一会。"
G["Welcome, $r."]="$GBienvenido:Bienvenida;, $r."
G["Welcome, $r. Have a look around."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida;, $r. Echa un vistazo por aquí."
G["Welcome, $r. Here you will find representatives from all the factions of Pandaria. Speak to them to find out if you are the brave adventurer that they seek."]="Te doy la bienvenida, $r. Aquí encontrarás representantes de todas las facciones de Pandaria. Habla con ellos para descubrir si eres $guno de los grandes aventureros:una de las grandes aventureras; que buscan."
G["Welcome, $r. Here you will find representatives from all the factions of Pandaria. When you have had a little more experience under your belt, come back and speak to us. Great adventures and great rewards await."]="欢迎你，$r。你在这里能找到潘达利亚所有阵营的代表。当你的经验再丰富一些时，就回来与我们交谈吧。前方有伟大的冒险和丰厚的奖励在等着你。"
G["Welcome, Brann Bronzebeard. I am all that remains of this temple's guardian."]="你好，布莱恩·铜须。我是这座神殿的最后一名守卫者。"
G["Welcome, Challengers, to my Tournament of Strength!"]="挑战者们，欢迎参加我的力量勇者武道会！"
G["Welcome, Huo. The people have missed your warmth."]="欢迎你，燧焰。这里的人民想念你的温暖。"
G["Welcome, Nurong. Good to have you with us."]="欢迎，砮荣。有你加入真不错。"
G["Welcome, O great one. I am your humble servant."]="$gBienvenido, oh magno:Bienvenida, oh magna;. Soy tu humilde siervo."
G["Welcome, Son of Durotan. And to you, Aggralan of the Frostwolves."]="欢迎，杜隆坦之子。也欢迎你，霜狼氏族的阿格娜兰。"
G["Welcome, Warchief Thrall. Overlord Hellscream."]="欢迎你们，萨尔酋长，地狱咆哮统帅。"
G["Welcome, adventurer. You've come just in the nick of time."]="Te doy la bienvenida, $gaventurero:aventurera;. Llegas justo a tiempo."
G["Welcome, ally. We have much to discuss.\n\nThe beasts you call the \"Horde\" ravage these woods. Their terrible stone ribbon slices through our land, frightens the animals we hunt, and fills the air with noise and ash.\n\nTell me, friend. How can we Blackmaw join this \"Alliance\" of yours?"]="$gBienvenido, aliado:Bienvenida, aliada;. Tenemos mucho de lo que hablar.\n\nLas bestias que llamas \"Horda\" asolan estos bosques. Su horrible cinta de piedra corta nuestra tierra, asusta a los animales que cazamos y llena el aire de ruido y ceniza.\n\nDime, $gamigo mío:amiga mía;, ¿cómo podemos los Faucenegra unirnos a esta \"Alianza\" de la que hablas?"
G["Welcome, and feel free to examine my goods.  Other than the moldy smell, they are in perfect condition."]="欢迎你，请随意看看。除了味道有些诡异之外，我卖的东西都是最棒的。"
G["Welcome, champion! Have you gathered your forces in preparation for the challenges of the Trial of the Grand Crusader? Only the most powerful and accomplished of combatants are able to participate in these trials. To participate in these trials, you must have completed the normal Trial of the Crusader."]="¡$GBienvenido, Campeón:Bienvenida, Campeona;! ¿Has reunido tus fuerzas como preparativo para la Prueba del Gran Cruzado? Solo los combatientes más poderosos y consumados pueden participar en estas pruebas. Para participar en estas pruebas debes haber completado la Prueba del Cruzado normal."
G["Welcome, champion! Have you gathered your forces in preparation for the challenges of the Trials of the Crusader?"]="¡$gBienvenido:Bienvenida;, $gcampeón:campeona;! ¿Has reunido tus tropas como preparación para los retos de la Prueba del Cruzado?"
G["Welcome, champions! All of our attempts at bringing her down have failed. We could use a hand in bringing her down with these harpoon guns."]="欢迎，勇士们。我们多次尝试击落她，但是都失败了。你们能不能来帮帮忙，用这些鱼叉炮把她打下来？"
G["Welcome, champions! You have heard the call of the Argent Crusade and you have boldly answered! It is here, in the Crusaders' Coliseum, that you will face your greatest challenges. Those of you who survive the rigors of the coliseum will join the Argent Crusade on its march to Icecrown Citadel."]="欢迎，勇士们！你们听到了银色北伐军的号召，并勇敢地作出了响应！此时此地，就在十字军演武场，你们将面对最强大的挑战。能在这次选拔中活下来的人都将加入北伐的行列，共同进军冰冠堡垒！"
G["Welcome, champions. Today, before the eyes of your leaders and peers, you will prove yourselves worthy combatants."]="欢迎，勇士们。今天，在你们的领袖与族人面前，你们将证明自己强大的实力。"
G["Welcome, child."]="Bienvenido, $gniño:niña;."
G["Welcome, friend of the Wildhammer!\n\nKirthaven is the spiritual center of our people, the one place where the varied clans can come together in peace.\n\nIt's here we honor our dead heroes, before burying them with their gryphons atop Mount Thunderstrike. There they spend eternity at one with the sky."]="¡Te doy la bienvenida, $gamigo:amiga; de los Martillo Salvaje!\n\nKirthaven es el centro espiritual de nuestro pueblo, el lugar donde los diferentes clanes pueden reunirse en paz.\n\nEs donde honramos a los héroes muertos antes de enterrarlos con sus grifos en lo alto del Monte del Rayo. Allí pueden pasar la eternidad en el cielo."
G["Welcome, friend of the free people of the Lower City, but do not tarry long.\n\nThere are sounds of battle coming from within.  My compatriots could use your assistance!"]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida;, $gamigo:amiga; del Bajo Arrabal, pero no te demores.\n\nDel interior llegan sonidos de batalla. ¡Mis compatriotas estarán encantados de recibir tu ayuda!"
G["Welcome, friend, to the Brewfest Grounds! There's much to enjoy here while we celebrate the spirit of friendly competition between rival breweries. If you have any questions, let me know!"]="欢迎来到美酒节，朋友！在赞美那些相互对抗的酿酒厂之间的友好竞争精神时，我们可以得到很多乐趣。如果你有任何疑问，找我就是了！"
G["Welcome, friend, to the Grummle Bazaar!"]="¡$GBienvenido:Bienvenida; al Bazar Grúmel!"
G["Welcome, friend, to the Oasis of Vir'sar!\n\nA paradise on Azeroth!"]="¡Te doy la bienvenida, $gamigo:amiga;, al Oasis de Vir'sar!\n\n¡Un paraíso en Azeroth!"
G["Welcome, friend, to the barbershop! Come for a cut? A coloring? Something else, perhaps?\n\nWe can groom facial hair, perform piercings, ink night elf tattoos, and even reshape draenei horns and tendrils!\n\nHave a seat and we'll get right to work. You're only a few coins away from a new, more attractive you..."]="¡$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a la barbería, colega! ¿Has venido a cortarte el pelo? ¿A teñirte? ¿Quizá algo distinto?\n\nPodemos cepillar el vello facial, poner pendientes, hacer tatuajes de elfo de la noche e incluso dar forma a los cuernos y zarcillos de los draenei.\n\nSiéntate y nos pondremos manos a la obra. Solo unas pocas monedas y pronto encontrarás al nuevo y más atractivo tú..."
G["Welcome, friend, to the barbershop! Come for a cut? A coloring? Something else, perhaps?\n\nWe can groom facial hair, perform piercings, reshape tusks and horns, and even modify undead features!\n\nHave a seat and we'll get right to work. You're only a few coins away from a new, more attractive you..."]="¡$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a la barbería, colega! ¿Has venido a cortarte el pelo? ¿A teñirte? ¿Quizá algo distinto?\n\nPodemos cepillar el vello facial, poner pendientes, dar forma a colmillos y cuernos, ¡e incluso modificar las características de los no-muertos!\n\nSiéntate y nos pondremos manos a la obra. Solo unas pocas monedas y pronto encontrarás al nuevo y más atractivo tú..."
G["Welcome, friend, welcome! There's always room for one more!"]="欢迎，朋友，欢迎！这里永远都会为新朋友留下位置！"
G["Welcome, friend.\nWe have little to offer by way of supplies, but I will assist you however I can."]="Te doy la bienvenida, camarada.\n\nNo tenemos mucho que ofrecerte en tema de suministros, pero te ayudaré en todo lo que pueda."
G["Welcome, friend.  Let's ride through Grim Batol and strike a blow against Deathwing that he won't soon forget!"]="欢迎你，朋友。我们一起直取格瑞姆巴托，给死亡之翼难忘的重重一击！"
G["Welcome, friend. We've been expecting you."]="欢迎你，我们一直在等你。"
G["Welcome, kind spirit.  What has brought you to us?"]="Bienvenido, amable espíritu. ¿Qué te ha traído hasta nosotros?"
G["Welcome, mortals. (Frail little children). Few have laid eyes on this inner sanctum. (They reach out to touch the fire!)"]="欢迎你们，凡人。（脆弱之子。）鲜少有人能亲临这内部圣殿。（他们就要引火上身了！）"
G["Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to teach you.\n\nIt never hurts to reaffirm one's place within what I like to call the Great Balance.  As preservers of this balance, we must strive to continually keep our minds clear and our hearts strong.  Training helps us in this regard."]="欢迎你，我的$G兄弟:姐妹;。如果你想接受训练，我会很乐意教你的。\n\n重申自己在这伟大的平衡中的地位总是无伤大雅的。作为这种平衡的守护者，我们必须努力保持清醒的头脑和坚定的信念。训练能使我们做到这一点。"
G["Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you!"]="$GBienvenido:Bienvenida;, $ghermano:hermana;. ¡Si has venido aquí para instruirte, estaré encantado de hacerlo!"
G["Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you."]="欢迎，我的$g兄弟:姐妹;。如果你是要来接受训练，我很高兴能满足你的要求。"
G["Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you.\n\nThere will be a time soon where the call of the Emerald Dream will take hold in you.  You will hibernate for many years and walk amongst the purest of forms.  It is there and then that your ultimate training will take place."]="欢迎你，我的$g兄弟:姐妹;。如果你想接受训练，我会很乐意教你的。\n\n来自翡翠梦境的召唤将很快占据你的心灵。你将冬眠数年，在最纯净的环境中生活。你将在那儿接受最终的训练。"
G["Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you.\n\nWe are the preservers of the balance, now and forever, as Cenarius has taught us.  Never forget this."]="$GBienvenido:Bienvenida;, $ghermano:hermana;. Si has venido en busca de instrucción, estaré encantada de ayudarte.\n\nSomos los protectores del equilibrio, ahora y siempre, siguiendo las enseñanzas de Cenarius. Nunca lo olvides."
G["Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you.\n\nWe are the preservers of the balance, now and forever, as Malfurion lies in the Dreaming.  Never forget this."]="欢迎你，我的$g兄弟:姐妹;。如果你想接受训练，我会很乐意教你的。\n\n只要玛法里奥还在沉睡中，我们便永远是平衡的守卫者。别忘了这一点。"
G["Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you.\n\nWe are the preservers of the balance, now and forever, with Malfurion watching over us.  Never forget this."]="欢迎你，我的$g兄弟:姐妹;。如果你想接受训练，我会很乐意教你的。\n\n只要玛法里奥还在沉睡中，我们便永远是平衡的守卫者。别忘了这一点。"
G["Welcome, my brethren!  You've been freed from demons.  Embrace the teachings of Velen!  Embrace the light!"]="欢迎你们，我的同胞！你们摆脱了恶魔的控制。张开双臂拥抱维伦的教导吧！信奉圣光的指引吧！"
G["Welcome, my new Alliance friend! How can I be of service?"]="欢迎你，我来自联盟的新朋友！能为你效劳吗？"
G["Welcome, my young friend."]="欢迎，我年轻的朋友。"
G["Welcome, outsider, to our home."]="$gBienvenido: Bienvenida; a nuestro hogar, $gforastero:forastera;."
G["Welcome, outsiders. Master Snowdrift is waiting for you inside the school. Please remember to show proper respect to the Master."]="欢迎你，外来者。雪流大师正在学院里等着你呢。请对大师表示应有的尊重。"
G["Welcome, serpent rider! I have beautiful cloud serpents for you to browse at your leisure."]="欢迎你，翔龙骑士！我这里有美丽的云端翔龙，欢迎随意挑选。"
G["Welcome, traveler! I have treasure from all across the world.\n\nYou want to test your luck? Only a few timeless coins for a key."]="欢迎，旅行者！我这里有来自世界各地的宝物。\n\n想来试试手气吗？几个永恒铸币就能换一把钥匙了！"
G["Welcome, traveler. Make your home here if you wish. Upstairs you will find the bank vaults and the city portals. Vendors of all trades have set up shop around the building. Please explore at your own leisure."]="Te doy la bienvenida, $gviajero:viajera;. Asiéntate aquí, si lo deseas. Arriba encontrarás las cámaras del banco y los portales de ciudad. Los vendedores de todas las profesiones ya se están estableciendo por todo el edificio. Explora todo lo que quieras."
G["Welcome, traveler. Please stay a while and rest."]="$gBienvenido, viajero:Bienvenida, viajera;. Quédate un rato y descansa."
G["Welcome, traveller. It is good to see variety included in this tournament."]="欢迎你，旅行者。看到这次比赛如此多元化，我很高兴。"
G["Welcome, weaklings, to the rebirth of the Zandalari Empire!"]="爬虫们，欢迎来见证赞达拉帝国的重生！"
G["Welcome, welcome, to the recently appropriated and callously renamed Steamwheedle Stadium!"]="欢迎，欢迎来到最近刚刚改名的热砂竞技场！"
G["Welcome."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida;."
G["Welcome.  Speak with me when you are ready to begin."]="欢迎。等你准备好开始时，就来与我交谈。"
G["Welcome. I can replace any any rewards you may have gotten from the Black Prince... for a price."]="欢迎。我可以帮你找回从黑王子那里得到的奖励……只需要一点点代价。"
G["Welcome. May I help you find something?"]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida;. ¿Puedo ayudarte a encontrar algo?"
G["Welcome. May I offer you rest or sustenance?"]="欢迎光临。请问你想休息还是进餐？"
G["Welcome. We'll hold just a few seconds to see if anyone else is coming along."]="$GBienvenido:Bienvenida;. Esperemos un momento a ver si alguien más se apunta."
G["Welcome. Will you take your rest here, or perhaps a meal?"]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida;. ¿Descansarás aquí? ¿Te apetece comer algo?"
G["Weldon is nothing more than a damned coward. He fled from the scourge and now dares to come here as if he were some sort of hero?\n\nBah!"]="维尔顿只不过是个该死的懦夫。他刚刚逃得一条活命，现在却装成一副英雄的样子跑到这里来了？\n\n呸！"
G["Well $glad : lass;, ye can find Shelby Stoneflint right outside the Thunderbrew Distillery in Kharanos.  She'll take good care of any pets ye might have."]="$g小伙子:姑娘;，你可以去卡拉诺斯雷酒酿制厂外找谢尔比·石火。她会好好照顾你的宠物的。"
G["Well Done!"]="干得好！"
G["Well Entrance"]="水井入口"
G["Well I hope you improve quickly!"]="我希望你能够迅速提高！"
G["Well I jus' about like everythin', but I do like animals the best!"]="的确，我是很博爱，但我最喜欢的还是动物！"
G["Well I s'pose the chickens won't mind if I visit fer a bit. I'll meet ya there after I've done my business here at the market today."]="如果只待一小会儿，我想这些小鸡是不会介意的。今天市集的生意结束后，我会在那里和你会合。"
G["Well I s'pose the chickens won't mind if I visit fer a bit. I'll meet ya there later."]="我想我的小鸡是不会介意我出去串会儿门的。我一会就去找你。"
G["Well I wish they'd go away!"]="我的愿望就是让他们走远点！"
G["Well I won't lie to you, $n. I'm one of the most powerful men in the Valley. Most people send me gifts of great value."]="我可没骗你哦，$n。我是这谷里数一数二的大人物。大多数人都会送我非常贵重的礼物。"
G["Well I wouldn't be surprised if he did. He were a great dwarf!"]="嗯，我对这件事情一点都不感到惊讶。他是个伟大的矮人！"
G["Well I'll be a hozen's uncle..."]="嗯，我要成猢狲叔叔了……"
G["Well I'm here.  And I'm ready to rejoin..."]="我来了，我准备重新加入……"
G["Well I, uh, I need to rethink everything.  Everything!"]="好吧，呃，我得再回顾一下战局。从头想起！"
G["Well all right, I s'pose I could hop on over to the farm now and again. I can't do it right away though. I have some business to finish at the market, first."]="好了，我想我又可以在去农场的路上活蹦乱跳了。但我还不能马上这么做。我有些要先在市集上完成的生意。"
G["Well all right, I s'pose I could hop on over to the farm now and again. I'm only doing this for you, y'hear? And well... I s'pose I have taken quite a shine to Mr. Yoon..."]="那么好吧，我想我时不时的可以去农场帮忙。我只是看在你的面子上，你懂吗？好吧……我想这回我也给了老愚先生一个大大的面子……"
G["Well aren't you lucky?"]="天啊，你们运气怎么就这么好？"
G["Well at least we can leave this place and start working on the dome at Area --"]="嗯，至少我们可以离开这个地方，开始在圆顶工作了——"
G["Well blow me down!  The landlubber scalawag comes bearin' rum!"]="该死的！这个旱鸭子无赖来拿朗姆酒了！"
G["Well don't just stand there, stranger! You got any gossip for me?"]="Pero bueno, ¡no te quedes ahí, $gforastero:forastera;! ¿Te sabes algún cotilleo?"
G["Well done $p. Meet me back at Grookin and we'll discuss our next plan of action."]="干得好，$p。回古鲁金来见我，我们商量一下下一步的行动。"
G["Well done Edward and Tyler. You are progressing along in your training quite nicely. We shall test your mettle again soon."]="干得很好。现在站到旁边去，让其他的兄弟来试试。"
G["Well done!"]="干得好！"
G["Well done!  I was about to jump in!  But it looked like you had it under control."]="干得好！我正准备要动手帮你呢！但看来你已经都搞定了。"
G["Well done!  It seems that you are worthy of the valiant rank!"]="干得好！看来你完全有资格成为一名勇士！"
G["Well done!  Let's continue."]="干得好！让我们继续。"
G["Well done!  We'll be ready when the real fires begin!"]="不错不错！看来我们已经准备好面对真正的火灾了。"
G["Well done! Be ready for anything!"]="很好！时刻做好准备！"
G["Well done! Congratulations on your victory."]="干得好！恭喜你大获全胜。"
G["Well done! Hurry, though, we don't want to be caught!"]="干得好！快一点，我们不想被抓住！"
G["Well done! I name you the Champion of Strength! May your enemies tremble before your title."]="哈，很好！我赐予你力量勇者的称号！你的威名将令敌人闻风丧胆。"
G["Well done! I should be fine on my own from here. Remember to talk to Delgren when you return to Maestra's Post in Ashenvale."]="干得好！我应该可以自己离开这里了。记着到灰谷的梅伊瑟娜岗哨去和净化者德尔格伦谈谈。"
G["Well done! I will realign the flow of mana and fill the Dragon Soul with all my arcane might."]="干得好！我会重调魔法的涡流，并将我所有的奥术力量灌注到巨龙之魂中。"
G["Well done! Landing parties, form up! Footmen to the front!"]="干得好！登陆小队，集合！步兵打头阵！"
G["Well done! The Thunder King's axe is ours."]="干得好！雷电之王的战斧到手了。"
G["Well done! We're through - pull together, everyone. Press the advantage!"]="干得好！我们过来了——大家继续努力。保持优势！"
G["Well done! Without your help I would have never been able to thwart that wave of troggs."]="干得好！没有你的帮助，我是无法抵挡穴居人的！"
G["Well done! You have that spark in your eye... I know it well, it's the same spark I had when I was but a pup! Now, let's see if I can't teach you something."]="干得好！在你眼中闪动的光芒……我很熟悉，我年少时也跟你一样！让我看看能不能教你点什么。"
G["Well done! You have triumphed!"]="干得好！你们胜利了！"
G["Well done! Your fighting against all those beasts was splendid! I hear the next challenge should be even tougher!"]="干得好！你竟然打败了所有这些猛兽，这简直太神奇了！不过，我听说下一个挑战将更加艰难！"
G["Well done! Your understanding of potions is coming along nicely."]="干得好！你对药剂的理解进展不错。"
G["Well done, $c! You can follow simple clues."]="干得好，$c！你要做的就是依照线索采取行动。"
G["Well done, $c. You have been taught well."]="¡Bien hecho! Te han enseñado bien."
G["Well done, $n!"]="干得好，$n！"
G["Well done, $n!  Ironforge is in your debt."]="干得好，$n！铁炉堡欠你一份人情。"
G["Well done, $n!  Orgrimmar is in your debt."]="干得好，$n！奥格瑞玛欠你一份人情。"
G["Well done, $n!  Stormwind is in your debt."]="干得漂亮，$n！暴风城将永远不忘你的恩情。"
G["Well done, $n!  Thunder Bluff is in your debt."]="干得好，$n！雷霆崖欠你一份人情。"
G["Well done, $n! I imagine your journeys beneath the waves will be much smoother from here out."]="干得好，$n！相信从这里开始，你在波涛下的旅程将会变得更加顺畅。"
G["Well done, $n! Now then, let me assemble the team..."]="干得好，$n！那么，让我集结队伍……"
G["Well done, $n! Return to Windshear Hold and notify Lord Fallowmere of the Horde's intentions. I will venture to the Thal'darah Overlook and warn our soldiers."]="干得好，$n！回到风剪要塞把部落的意图告知指挥官法罗米尔。我会冒险前往萨达拉瞭望台，通知我们的士兵们。"
G["Well done, $n! You have passed the second trial!"]="干得好，$n！你通过了第二个试炼！"
G["Well done, $n! You must be tired after participating in the race. Go and get some rest. There will be plenty of tasks waiting for you here tomorrow."]="¡Bien hecho, $n! Debes de estar $gcansado:cansada; después de haber participado en la carrera. Ve y descansa un rato. Mañana habrá tareas de sobra esperándote."
G["Well done, $n."]="干得好，$n。"
G["Well done, $n.  You fight as well as I can drink!"]="干得好，$n。你的战斗力就跟我的酒量一样强！"
G["Well done, $n.  You picked your friends wisely and led them with honor."]="干得好，$n。你明智地选择了自己的战友，并出色地领导了它们。"
G["Well done, $n. It looks like we have them on the run."]="干的好，$n。看来我们把他们打跑了。"
G["Well done, $n. The cloud serpent that you have raised is now yours. Your journey together... is just beginning."]="干得好，$n。你驯养的云端翔龙现在是你的了。你们共同的旅程……才刚刚开始。"
G["Well done, $n. Wait... I see a scout approaching."]="干得好，$n。等等……我看到一个斥候过来了。"
G["Well done, $n. Your display of respect is duly noted. Now, I have information for you that you must convey to the Kalu'ak."]="很好，$n。你充分表达了自己的诚意。我会如约告诉你关于卡鲁亚克氏族的命运，请转告他们吧。"
G["Well done, $p!"]="干得好，$p！"
G["Well done, $p. The crystals of this island are better in our hands than the Kirin Tor's."]="干得好，$p。我们最好还是将这座岛上的水晶掌握在自己手里，不能让肯瑞托夺去。"
G["Well done, $r.  Return to the temple, Gorsik shall meet you there, as promised."]="干得好，$r。返回神殿吧，格尔西克会在那儿等着你。"
G["Well done, Horde!"]="干得好，胜利属于部落！"
G["Well done, Horde! We have enough Frostwolves in our stables to provide mounts to all of our wolf riders!"]="做得好，部落！马厩中有足够的霜狼可供我们的狼骑兵乘坐！"
G["Well done, Jojo!"]="干得好，乔乔！"
G["Well done, Let us see to our friend..."]="干得好，让我们去看看我们的朋友……"
G["Well done, Midnight!"]="干得好，午夜！"
G["Well done, Wakener. I will stay a while longer to quench my blade's thirst. You may tell the others of my return, but I believe my swift wings will bear me to Klaxxi'vess before you."]="干得好，唤醒者。我会再留一会，满足我刀刃的渴望。你可以告诉其它人我回来了，但我相信我迅捷的双翼会让我赶在你之前飞抵卡拉克西维斯。"
G["Well done, adventurer. Rage Winterchill's death has earned us all a small pause in the enemy's advance. Use this short time wisely. Tend to your wounded and prepare your defenses, as soon Archimonde will send even deadlier forces at us. My meager force of reserve units will reinforce you when battle is joined again."]="Bien hecho, $gaventurero:aventurera;. La muerte de Ira Fríoinvierno exánime nos ha dado una breve pausa en el avance del enemigo. Utiliza sabiamente este breve tiempo. Cuida de tus heridos y prepara tus defensas, ya que, pronto, Archimonde nos enviará tropas más letales aún. Mi exigua fuerza de unidades de reserva te reforzará cuando se vuelva a emprender la batalla."
G["Well done, all. Please bring us safely to our next port."]="干得好。请把我们安全带到下一个港口吧。"
G["Well done, friend! From here we can survey the land."]="干得好，朋友！现在我们就可以勘察这片区域了。"
G["Well done, friends! The tower is ours! Now I shall see to the destruction of this foul monument."]="干得好，朋友们！这座塔是我们的了！现在，我要亲手毁了这座污秽的建筑。"
G["Well done, hero! I yield to your might."]="干得好，英雄！我得承认你比我强。"
G["Well done, heroes! Let us all hope that this is the last the world will ever see of Kael'thas Sunstrider."]="干得好，英雄们！但愿凯尔萨斯·逐日者能永远从这个世界上消失。"
G["Well done, heroes."]="干得好，英雄们。"
G["Well done, heroes. Balnazzar had been a threat for far too long. He had a hand in the Scourge and the Scarlet Crusade, two of our most difficult foes. The Risen may have tipped the balance against us, had they time to fester."]="干得好，英雄们。长久以来，巴纳扎尔一直都是我们的威胁。最让我们头痛的两个敌人——天灾军团和血色十字军的出现都与他有关。如果我们对他的复活放任不管，也许战争的天平会朝不利于我们的方向倾斜。"
G["Well done, heroes. Let us return through that portal we left behind... much work awaits me in Ironforge."]="干得好，英雄们。现在就让我们从刚才我们通过的那道传送门回去吧……在铁炉堡还有许多工作在等着我。"
G["Well done, heroes. Let us return through the very portal meant to send this beast through! Much work awaits me in Thunder Bluff."]="干得好，英雄们。这个传送门本来是为这怪物准备的，现在就让我们通过它回去吧！在雷霆崖还有许多工作在等着我。"
G["Well done, heroes. Let us return through the very portal that witch meant to send this beast through! Much work awaits me in Stormwind."]="干得好，英雄们。这传送门本来是用来送这怪物的，现在就让我们从这道门返回吧！在暴风城还有许多工作在等着我。"
G["Well done, my lady. I will have the intruder disposed of at once."]="干得好，我的女士。我马上就会处理掉那些入侵者。"
G["Well done, my minions. The mortals' courage begins to wane! Now, let's see how they contend with the true Lord of Blackrock Spire!!!"]="干得好，我的手下。凡人的勇气开始消退了！现在，让我们看看他们如何应对黑石塔的真正主人的力量！！！"
G["Well done, pawn. You are free to go as I no longer have a use for your body."]="很好。当我不再利用你的躯体时，你就自由了。"
G["Well done, servant. For so long I have been held captive within the prison of the Firelord. I am once more free to feast upon the out world! The land shall once more be ravaged by the force of the Wind Seeker!"]="Bien hecho, $gsiervo:sierva;. He estado cautivo en la prisión del Señor del Fuego durante demasiado tiempo. ¡Y ahora, soy libre de nuevo para comerme el mundo exterior! ¡Una vez más, la fuerza del Hijo del Viento asolará la tierra!"
G["Well done, soldier. A few more and our stables will be overflowing with mounts for the cavalry to ride into combat!"]="士兵，做得好。我们的马厩将塞满骑兵们的战斗坐骑！"
G["Well done, soldiers! At ease!"]="士兵们，干得好！轻松一下吧！"
G["Well done, soldiers! We weren't about to let the filthy animals of the Horde show us up!"]="干得好，士兵们！部落狗们怎能让我们低头！"
G["Well done, squad. Dismissed!"]="干得好，队员们。解散！"
G["Well done, tamer!"]="干得好，驯宠师！"
G["Well done, tamer."]="干得好，驯宠师。"
G["Well done, well done."]="干得好，干得好。"
G["Well done, you are one step closer to the real challenge."]="干得好，你距离真正的挑战又近了一步。"
G["Well done, you have proven worthy to test your skills against my master engineer, Telonicus."]="干得不错。看来你们有能力挑战我的首席技师，塔隆尼库斯。"
G["Well done, young rogue. Well done, indeed...."]="Bien hecho, joven $gpícaro:pícara;. ¡Bien hecho, de verdad!"
G["Well done."]="很好。"
G["Well done.  Meet me inside the Stonecore for further instructions."]="很好。在巨石之核里和我碰头，等待我的进一步指示。"
G["Well done.  Remember that swiftness of mind and body can keep you alive."]="干得好。记住，只有身心矫捷，才能活得长久。"
G["Well done.  Your training is now complete.  Come see me in the Shrine of the Ox for your reward."]="干得好。你已经完成训练了。与我在玄牛神龛会面，领取奖励。"
G["Well done. A blow to Arugal no doubt!"]="干得好。这无疑是对阿鲁高的一次沉痛打击！"
G["Well done. But do you have the determination to carry through?"]="干得好。可你有决心继续下去吗？"
G["Well done. Find Lirastrasza and let her know that we've succeeded."]="干得好。找到莉拉斯塔萨，让她知道，我们胜利了。"
G["Well done. I applaud your skills as a tactician."]="干得好。我要为你的战术喝彩。"
G["Well done. I'll see to it that my prophet enjoys his eternal stay with me."]="很好。我会让先知永远待在我身边的。"
G["Well done. Let's get this over with."]="很好。来个了断吧。"
G["Well done. No mercy!"]="干得好。毫不留情！"
G["Well done. Not much more!"]="干得好。到此为止！"
G["Well done. Now I will just add a hair from our prisoner, Shan Kien, and combine the ingredients."]="干得好。现在只需要把单简的头发加到酒剂中。"
G["Well done. Release the bear into my custody so that I may apply the curing cantrip."]="干得好。让我接管这头熊，然后我就可以施展治疗法术了。"
G["Well done. The first brigade has made landfall."]="干得好。第一纵队已经成功登陆了。"
G["Well done. We should be safe for the moment, but we haven't much time."]="干得好，我们暂时安全了，但时间并不多。"
G["Well done. You have now earned tailoring's highest honor. Go forth, and do terrible things with this knowledge!"]="干得好！你获得了裁缝的最高荣誉。去吧，好好利用自己的知识去做大事！"
G["Well done. You have proven yourself today-"]="干得好，今天，你证明了自己的实力。"
G["Well done. You've beaten me when few have had the luxury."]="干得好。几乎没人享受过击败我的殊荣。"
G["Well duties call, yes?  First, the bell... to give you vigor!"]="嗯，要开始了，是吗？首先，钟……给你活力！"
G["Well fought Wakener.  We will meet again..."]="打得好，唤醒者，后会有期……"
G["Well fought earlier. It was quite surprising to see how strong you've become."]="打得漂亮。真不可思议，你竟然已经变得如此强大了。"
G["Well fought! Now - the gates. Before the thunder king's entire army comes down on us!"]="干得好！现在——去门口。趁雷电之王的大军还没过来！"
G["Well fought! The day is ours, but the war goes on!"]="干得好！今天我们取得了胜利，但是战争还在继续！"
G["Well fought! Your next challenge comes from the Crusade's own ranks. You will be tested against their considerable prowess."]="干得漂亮！你的下一个挑战将来自于十字军的骑士们。他们将以强大的实力对你进行测试。"
G["Well fought, $p, you have proven your strength."]="精彩的战斗，$p，你证明了你的力量。"
G["Well fought, Champion!"]="¡Bien luchado, $gcampeón:campeona;!"
G["Well fought, but you still have work to do.  Speak with me when you are ready to try again."]="打得不错，可你还得多加努力才行。准备好重试时再来与我交谈。"
G["Well fought, student. You've proven that you truly embody my way... the Way of the Crane."]="打得不错，弟子。你已用行动证明，自己真正领会了我的……朱鹤之道."
G["Well fought."]="打得好。"
G["Well fought. Farewell, hero."]="打得好。再见，英雄。"
G["Well fought. I am glad you survived the battle."]="打得好。我很高兴你能活下来。"
G["Well fought. I don't think I could have survived that battle without you at my back."]="打的好。要不是你帮忙，恐怕我很难在这场战斗中活下来。"
G["Well fought. I see the Dark Irons are as formidable as ever."]="干得好。黑铁矮人还是一如既往的强大。"
G["Well fought. Master Shang will be pleased."]="打得漂亮。尚师父会很高兴的。"
G["Well fought. Until next time..."]="打得好，下次可就说不准了……"
G["Well fought..."]="打得不错……"
G["Well get to it then. You're the one veering off onto all these unnecessary topics."]="好吧，让我们回到正题。要知道，这些无谓的话题都是你搞出来的。"
G["Well gosh, I'm so flattered! I'd love to! You hang on just a giggle, now..."]="喔天哪，我太荣幸了！我愿意！你稍等一下，现在……"
G["Well hand it over and let's see what you've got!"]="把它交出来，让我们看看你拿到了什么！"
G["Well hello again, $n!  I don't know how much longer I'm going to keep on trying to set up a shop out in the middle of nowhere.  Still, since you've helped me out in the past, I'll show you some stuff you may find interesting!"]="很高兴再见到你，$n！我不知道我还可以坚持多久来创建这样一个店。现在，由于你对我的帮助，我会给你看一些你会感兴趣的东西！"
G["Well hello there ladies. Heard about the new plague?"]="那边的女士们，你们好。你们听说最近的新闻了吗？"
G["Well hello, $n, what can I get you today?"]="你好，$n，我能为你做些什么吗？"
G["Well hello, ladies. What do you think this is... Skorn?"]="嗨，女士们。你们觉得……斯克恩代表着什么？"
G["Well here we are, back at the Crossroads, safe and sound."]="我们到了，平安返回十字路口。"
G["Well hi there!  Are you here to learn the proper technique of a new weapon?"]="嗨！你是来这儿学习新武器的吗？"
G["Well in this dream, they somehow end up inventing something called ice-cream and flavoring it with strawberries... Well, long story short, they end up striking it rich!"]="在那个梦里，他们不知通过什么手段，发明了一种叫做冰淇淋的东西，还用草莓来调味……好吧，长话短说，他们最后变得十分富裕！"
G["Well isn't this just a fine mess?"]="这里乱糟糟的，是吧？"
G["Well it was peaceful until you arrived."]="在你们到来之前，平静得很。"
G["Well it's about time. Kessel isn't gonna be too happy about any of this..."]="是时候了，凯希尔不会对这些感到太高兴的……"
G["Well look at that... you're dead."]="哎呀……你这就死了啊。"
G["Well look at you. Aren't you big and tough... Maybe you think you're tough enough to step into the Ring of Blood and face the Warmaul champion?\n\n<The pitfighter laughs.>\n\nNot very likely but if you ever wanna test your strength, the Ring of Blood is far to the north against the mountains dividing Nagrand and Zangarmarsh. Gurgthock runs the show at the old Laughing Skull Ruins and he also dispenses the prizes. Speaking of prizes, I hear the prizes this season are incredible!"]="好吧，看看你自己。你觉得自己够强壮吗？或是你觉得你已经强壮到足以挑战鲜血竞技场的战槌勇士了？\n\n<斗士大笑起来。>\n\n不大可能，但你如果非常想验证一下你的力量，就朝北方一直走，在分割纳格兰和赞加沼泽的山脚之下，你可以找到鲜血竞技场。旧嘲颅废墟的古尔戈索克掌管着那里，他同样也掌管着奖赏。说到奖赏，我听说这个赛季的奖品非常棒！"
G["Well look what we have here. Our first keg of recovered brew! I'll take this one, folks."]="看看我们找到了什么。第一桶失而复得的美酒！这桶归我了，各位。"
G["Well look who it is!"]="瞧瞧，这是谁！"
G["Well look who it is!  The cudgel-bearer $g himself: herself;!"]="看看这是谁！是持棍人$g他自己:她自己;！"
G["Well lookee here, it's my good friend $n. You know what I want? Uh-huh, that's right. Got any gossip?"]="Pero mira quién es, mi $gbuen amigo:buena amiga; $n. ¿Sabes qué es lo que quiero? Ju, ju, eso es. ¿Te sabes algún cotilleo?"
G["Well lookie dere! Dat be my bad eye, but it be a good start!"]="快看！这就是我被抢走眼镜片。虽然已经坏了，不过这是一个好的开始。"
G["Well met master of Rod and Reel!   If you be willing to test your skills against the best fisher-folk in the lands then listen up!   On this very Sunday there be a contest in Stranglethorn where the master angler will be chosen!"]="¡$gBien hallado maestro:Bien hallada maestra; de la caña y el carrete! Si estás $gdispuesto:dispuesta; a medir tus habilidades con los mejores pescadores de estas tierras, ¡no pierdas detalle! Este domingo se celebrará un concurso en Tuercespina en el que se elegirá al Maestro pescador con caña."
G["Well met traveler.  I hope the journey from Camp Winterhoof to our humble outpost was not too taxing."]="你好啊，旅行者。但愿从冬蹄营地到这座破落岗哨的路不是太难走。"
G["Well met, $N. It is good to see that $cs like yourself are taking an active part in protecting the groves."]="Mucho gusto, $N. Es bueno ver que alguien como $cs se está tomando la molestia de participar en la protección de los bosques."
G["Well met, $c.\n\nI train Aspirants in the art of mounted close combat."]="$c，很高兴见到你。\n\n我负责向候选者传授骑乘近身战的诀窍。"
G["Well met, $c.  My advice to you is this: As you travel the world, be wary of magic for it will burn the untrained."]="你好，$c。给你一个建议：当你在世界各地旅行的时候，要当心魔法，没有受过训练的人会被它烧成灰。"
G["Well met, $c.  You want some advice?  Befriend a mage!  We have a trick or two up our sleeves, we do..."]="你好，$c。你想要一些建议？好吧，找个法师当朋友就对了！我们的袖口里藏着一些小把戏……"
G["Well met, $c. Even now, the Horde attacks Warsong Gulch. Will you fight alongside the Alliance there?"]="你好啊，$c。即使是现在，部落还在进攻战歌峡谷。你会和联盟并肩而战吗？"
G["Well met, $c. I am Rokaro."]="你好，$c。我是罗卡鲁。"
G["Well met, $c. I hope you are here to inquire on the Ahn'Qiraj war effort. We are going to need a great deal of assistance.\n\nThe war effort is a united effort between the Alliance and Horde to prepare for the upcoming war against the Silithid and their masters in Ahn'Qiraj. In the Military Ward of Ironforge, we are collecting all manner of goods to create our war materiel from, and these gathering tasks are what we need your help with.\n\nCan I convince you to speak with our commander about pitching in?"]="很高兴见到你，$c。我想你是为安其拉之战而来的吧。我们急需帮助。\n\n联盟和部落需要同仇敌忾，共同对抗安其拉异种虫类和它们的首脑。我们在铁炉堡的军事区收集原料以制造各种战争物资，这些收集工作需要你的帮助。\n\n你可以跟我们的指挥官谈谈吗？"
G["Well met, $c. I mean you no harm.\n\nI'm here posing as one of the Scarlet Crusade because they have become irredeemably corrupt and evil.\n\nI need your help to put an end to them once and for all."]="你好，$c。我并无恶意。\n\n我在这以血色十字军成员的身份出现，是因为他们已经无可救药地堕入了腐化与邪恶。\n\n我需要你的帮助，彻底终结他们的罪孽。"
G["Well met, $c. I'm learning the art of gryphon handling from Baldruc over there. One day, I hope to run my own stable of gryphons."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida;, $c. Estoy aprendiendo el arte de manejar grifos con Baldruc. Espero tener mi propio establo de grifos algún día."
G["Well met, $c. You may speak to me unless you have direct business with my mistress Magatha.\n\nI deal with most of her tasks for her so she can concentrate on more important matters. Perhaps there are some things we could discuss before you seek audience with her?"]="很高兴见到你，$c。除非你和我的女主人玛加萨之间有直接交易关系，否则别找我说话。\n\n我帮她处理大部分的事务，让她能集中精力处理更重要的事情。或许在你拜见她之前我们可以谈谈。"
G["Well met, $c. Your arrival in Thrallmar could not have occurred at a better time. The warchief is depending on us, since he cannot be here himself."]="见到你真好，$c。你来的真及时。酋长不能亲自来这里，所以全靠我们了。"
G["Well met, $n."]="幸会，$n。"
G["Well met, $n. We must be brief because there is much to do."]="很高兴遇见你，$n。要做的事情还很多，我们必须抓紧时间。"
G["Well met, $r. I am here as a resource of advice for the High Executor to make use of as he will. I am confident that together we can forge the Horde into something that is even stronger than before and turn back the Scourge menace once and for all!"]="你好，$R。我是代表高级执行官来传达忠告的。我相信只要我们联起手来，部落必将变得更加强大，一举击溃亡灵天灾！"
G["Well met, Battle-Sister. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]="欢迎你，我的姐妹。我能帮你找回失散的伙伴。"
G["Well met, Battle-Sister. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]="欢迎你，我的姐妹。我能帮你看管宠物或是找回失散的伙伴。"
G["Well met, Farmer Yoon. I had to come by and see your farm for myself."]="你好，农夫老愚。我得亲自前来看看你的农场。"
G["Well met, I'm Azimi! I often make the walk out here to sell the men fresh fruit and water. Are you hungry, or perhaps thirsty?"]="你好啊，我是阿兹米！我经常在这里出售新鲜的水果和水。你饿了吗，或是有点渴？"
G["Well met, Lord Zhu. He's with the rest of my men, holding the line at Farwatch Overlook."]="很高兴见到你，祝掌门。他和我剩下的人在远戍哨站坚守。"
G["Well met, fellow Mohawk $GBrother:Sister;."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida;, $ghermano mohicano:hermana mohicana;."
G["Well met, friend!"]="¡Bien $ghallado, amigo:hallada, amiga;!"
G["Well met, friend.  I am Officer Garush, and I am a proud member of a world-wide organization known as the Argent Crusade.  Our cause is to fight swiftly and mercilessly against any element of evil that surfaces in Azeroth.  We are not a political body, nor do we ever wish to become one.  Our cause is singular, and to that end we call both the Horde and Alliance as friends - friends in the cause of stamping out evil!\n\nFor the Crusade, my $g brother : sister;!"]="很高兴见到你，朋友。我是军官加鲁什，是银色黎明这一世界组织的光荣成员。我们的任务是毫不留情地消灭艾泽拉斯大陆上所有邪恶的势力。银色黎明不是一个政治机构，我们也从不愿意与政治沾上边儿。我们的目标只有一个，为此我们将部落和联盟都看作自己的朋友——以铲除邪恶为己任的朋友！\n\n我的$g兄弟:姐妹;，为十字军而战！"
G["Well met, friend.  I am Officer Pureheart, and I am a proud member of a world-wide organization known as the Argent Crusade.  Our cause is simple - fight swiftly and mercilessly against any element of evil that surfaces in Azeroth.  We are not a political body, nor do we ever wish to become one.  To that end we call both the Alliance and the Horde both as friends - friends in the cause of stamping out evil!\n\nFor the Light, my $g brother : sister;!"]="Saludos, camarada. Soy la oficial Purocorazón, miembro orgulloso de una organización mundial conocida como la Cruzada Argenta. Nuestra causa es simple: combatir rápidamente y sin compasión alguna cualquier representación del mal que aparezca en Azeroth. No somos una organización política ni deseamos serlo. Con ese fin consideramos amigas a la Alianza y a la Horda... ¡amigas por la aniquilación del mal!\n\n¡Por la Luz!"
G["Well met, friend. Enjoying Noblegarden, I hope? Why not join in the fun?"]="你好，朋友。希望你在复活节期间玩得开心！为什么不一起狂欢呢？"
G["Well met, travelers of Duskwood! My incredible wares are on sale for a short time in Darkshire. Make haste!"]="暮色森林的旅行者们，大家好！现在我的商品全面特价，走过路过不要错过啦！"
G["Well my friend, ye have more skill than I do. Why don't ye go find me old friend Rotgath Stonebeard. He stayed in Ironforge when I left to join Jaina's army. I'm sure he'll be able ta teach ye somethin, or at least know someone who can. If he's still around, I'm sure he'll be at The Great Forge."]="Muy bien, $gamigo:amiga;, ya eres más hábil que yo. ¿Por qué no vas a buscar a mi viejo amigo Rotgath Barbapétrea? Estaba en Forjaz cuando partí para unirme al ejército de Jaina. Estoy seguro de que podrá enseñarte algo, o, por lo menos, sabrá de alguien que pueda hacerlo. Si sigue por ahí seguro que está en La Gran Fundición."
G["Well my friend, you've reached heights some people only dream of. Congrats! And now, without further ceremony, it is time for your final lesson!"]="Bien $gamigo:amiga; has llegado a niveles con los que algunos solo pueden soñar. ¡Felicidades! Y ahora, sin más ceremonias, ¡ha llegado el momento de tu última lección!"
G["Well now $n, let's get to work on those cauldrons!  If you're going to collect the components we need, then get a vitreous focuser from me.  You'll need to have it on you to identify the necessary resources found on the Scourge that will turn those cauldrons.\n\nYou'll also need a dose of arcane quickener for the cauldrons.  It's not cheap, nor is it stable.  Once you have it, you'll only have thirty minutes to use it before it expires on you; be smart about buying it."]="Veamos $n, ¡pongámonos a trabajar con esas calderas! Si vas a reunir los componentes necesarios, te proporcionaré un enfocador vítreo. Necesitas llevarlo contigo para identificar los ingredientes necesarios que se encuentran en los miembros de la Plaga y que transformarán las calderas.\n\nTambién necesitarás un acelerador arcano. No es barato, ni estable. Cuando lo tengas en tus manos solo tendrás treinta minutos para usarlo antes de que se consuma; cómpralo cuando vayas a utilizarlo y sé $grápido:rápida;."
G["Well now that you and me are neighbors, I can tell you the truth. It's just downright wrong not ta have a proper pig or two on your farm! I'll bring some by when yer not lookin' and then blammo! You'll have pigs."]="Bueno, ahora que tú y yo somos $gvecinos:vecinas;, puedo contarte la verdad. ¡No es de recibo que no tengas un buen cerdo o dos en tu granja! Te traeré unos cuantos cuando no estés mirando y... ¡tachán! Ya tienes cerdos."
G["Well now! Who knew such a beautiful thing was hiding here? I can see that this \"Alliance\" of yours cuts with precision in order to change the world around you. Interesting."]="¡Vaya! ¿Quién hubiera dicho que algo tan bonito se ocultaba en este lugar? Veo que esta \"Alianza\" tuya corta con precisión para moldear el mundo que nos rodea. Interesante."
G["Well now, $g lad : lass;, it looks like the Alliance has already gathered up all that we need for our part of the war. I know that the blacksmiths, engineers and everyone else is busy with the final preparations, and as soon as the Horde assembles all of their goods, it will all be sent to Silithus for the war."]="呃，$g小伙子:姑娘;，似乎联盟已经集齐所有的战争物资了。听说铁匠、工程师和其他人都在进行最后的准备工作。一旦部落也集齐了他们所需的物资，就能把它们全部运往希利苏斯，与该死的虫子们开战了。"
G["Well now, I haven't seen blades this fine since I left Lordaron with Proudmore and her people. I can't teach ye much more it seems, but if ye were to find Borgus Steelhand I bet he could show ye some things. Finest weaponsmith I ever met."]="自从跟随普罗德摩尔以及她的人民一起离开洛丹伦以来，我就没有见过铸造得如此精良的武器。看来我没有什么可以教你的了，但是如果你去找博古斯·钢拳的话，他一定会向你展示一些华丽的技艺，他是我遇见过的最好的铁匠。"
G["Well now, I'm surprised to see other adventurers in a place such as this!\n\nNow that you're here, ye can help me get to the Tribunal. If my research theories about these halls is correct, information pertainin' to the creation o' the entire dwarven race lies within."]="呃，居然能在这种地方遇到别的冒险者，这还真让我吃惊！\n\n既然你们在这里，就帮助我进入前面的大厅吧！如果我的研究理论没错的话，我们一定能在这里找到矮人一族起源的秘密！"
G["Well now, it would appear that we have some time on our hands. The Horde has completed its gathering tasks, and all is being prepared for final shipment to Silithus. We're only waiting on the Alliance to finish with theirs. You should go ask that silly, little ambassador of theirs how far along they are."]="嗯，似乎我们还有一些时间。部落已经完成了收集任务，准备将战争物资运往希利苏斯了。我们只等联盟集齐他们所需的物资，你该去问问联盟那个愚蠢的大使，看看他们还需要多长时间。"
G["Well now, look Ma. $n's back. Why ain't you got any of my yaks?"]="快看啊妈，$n回来了。你怎么没找到我的牦牛？"
G["Well now, what vision of loveliness is this?"]="那么，这个可爱的小家伙是谁呀？"
G["Well now, ye'll need papers to form a guild, and Jondor Steelbrow can help you get started with the process.  He can be found over at the Ironforge Visitor's Center when yer ready to get started."]="Veamos, necesitarás papeles para crear una hermandad y Jondor Frenteacerada puede ayudarte a comenzar el proceso. Cuando estés $glisto:lista; para empezar podrás encontrarlo en el Centro del Viajero de Forjaz."
G["Well now, you can find Farseer Javad in the area of The Great Forge, just a bit to the North on the East side."]="好吧，现在，你立刻前往大锻炉那里找先知亚瓦德，就在东边略微往北一点。"
G["Well now. You sure know how to arrive in style."]="好啊。你的出场还真拉风。"
G["Well of Eternity."]="永恒之井。"
G["Well of course he did. He'd be a fool not to.\n\nThank you, $r. I'll prepare to depart at once."]="当然了。他要不选我那才是笨呢。\n\n谢谢你，$r。我立刻就准备出发。"
G["Well of course we are, my dear Greely. And look there. The Micro Mechachicken's stabilization appears to be a complete success!"]="当然，我亲爱的格瑞里。看看那个。微型机动战鸡的稳定性堪称完美！"
G["Well one thing's for sure, $n's not a nugget any more!"]="好吧，有件事是肯定的。$n再也不是移动荣誉了！"
G["Well partner, I got some bad news for you. You can come back every day to plant and harvest your vegetables, but you'll need more experience before helping me join the Tillers Union. But don't forget - you're welcome here on the farm any time!"]="Me temo que tengo una mala noticia. Puedes volver todos los días para plantar y cosechar verduras, pero te hace falta más experiencia para ayudarme a unirme al gremio de labradores. Pero no lo olvides: ¡siempre serás $gbienvenido:bienvenida; en mi granja!"
G["Well partner, looks like you're ready to work this farm on your own. Come back every day to plant and harvest vegetables if you like. If we work hard, we might even be able to upgrade this place!"]="好吧伙计，看来你已经能独立打理这个农场了。要是愿意的话，可以每天回来种植和收割蔬菜。如果我们努力劳作，也许还能把这地方升级！"
G["Well played, $n. Well played, indeed..."]="很好，$n。非常好……"
G["Well played, sir."]="打得好，老兄。"
G["Well played."]="打得不错！"
G["Well said, my lady. We sin'dorei will be free and we shall be great again!"]="说得好，我的女王。我们辛多雷会重获自由并再度强大！"
G["Well said, my son."]="说得好，我的孩子。"
G["Well shoot, of course! They're the biggest brewin' family in the whole valley!"]="嘁，当然了！他们可是整个四风谷最大的酿酒家族！"
G["Well spoken, Zhi. The strangers from beyond the mists have no shortage of passions, but let us see if they indeed control them. Beyond anger lies hatred, the wellspring of all misery. What is this? Your hatred has a face!"]="说得好，智。来自迷雾之外的陌生人们虽然不缺乏热情，但我们得看看他们的自制力。愤怒出自仇恨，仇恨乃万苦之源。看，这就是你心中仇恨的模样！"
G["Well thankee, friend!"]="噢，谢啦，朋友！"
G["Well that didn't work."]="呃，似乎没用。"
G["Well that was unexpected!"]="噢，这可真是出人意料！"
G["Well that's a start at least. Do ya remember who you are?"]="嗯，那至少是个开始。你记得自己是谁吗？"
G["Well that's all semantics, really."]="就是文字游戏而已，真的。"
G["Well that's embarrassing. To battle!"]="这可真令人尴尬。战斗吧！"
G["Well that's one way to voice your opinion."]="嗯，这是你表达观点的一种方法。"
G["Well that's quite enough of that."]="我受够了。"
G["Well that's unusual...Take care of it, then tug another line when you can."]="嗯，这可不太常见……解决掉它，然后再拉另一根鱼线。"
G["Well then perhaps his deeds will be so great that history will remember it as a bull's name."]="没事，他一定能以英勇的事迹留名青史，让人们记住这是一个勇士的名字。"
G["Well then there is only one thing left to be done..."]="嗯，那就只剩下一件事可干了……"
G["Well then what happen is ranger elf's people got jerbed in the nerb! Ouch!"]="然后精灵游侠的手下都被干掉了！噢！"
G["Well then! A mounted Charge is about more than just kickin' yer mount ta full speed an' hollerin' yer lungs out... though that IS the fun part, heh! But the Charge Target will teach ye the finer points.\n\nA good Charge is all about distance and timing. Ye can't be TOO close, or ye won't get enough speed. But ye can't be too far away either or yer mount will tire! As for timin'...\n\nYe'll want ta make sure the Charge Target doesn't have a layer o' Defend up before ye rush in. If it does, use yer Shield Breaker ta make it vulnerable, and THEN Charge in!\n\nSame goes for the real thing: Try ta drop yer opponent defenses before ye Charge!"]="El secreto de una buena carga reside en medir bien la distancia y el tiempo. No puedes estar DEMASIADO cerca, o no alcanzarás suficiente velocidad. ¡Pero tampoco puedes estar demasiado lejos o tu montura se cansará! En cuanto al tiempo...\n\nTienes que asegurarte de que el objetivo de carga no tiene una capa de Defender activa antes de avalanzarte. Si es así, emplea tu Romper escudo para hacerlo vulnerable, y ¡ENTONCES utiliza Cargar!\n\nLo mismo pasa con el combate de verdad: ¡intenta reducir las defensas de tu oponente antes de cargar!"
G["Well then! It seems all those muscles are not just for show!"]="好吧！看来那些肌肉也不光是摆设！"
G["Well then, I spose I be owin' ya my thanks, $r.\n\nTruth is, I thought I'd swallowed me last tankard 'til ye showed up."]="好吧，$r，算我欠你情啦。\n\n在你出现之前，我还以为这是我最后一口酒呢。"
G["Well then, I'll give the signal to Tirion when you are ready to go."]="好吧，你做好准备之后，我就会向提里奥发出信号。"
G["Well then, it seems we're both looking for Hogral Bakkan.  He's a dwarf to be sure, so sooner or later he'll be heading for the Thunderbrew Distillery for an ale -- he might even be there now."]="那么，似乎我们都是来找霍格拉尔·巴坎的。他是个矮人，他迟早会去 雷酒酿制厂喝酒的，没准他现在已经在那儿了。"
G["Well then, let's get this started. The longer we're here, the more damage the undead could be doing back in Hillsbrad."]="那么就尽快开始吧。我们在这里待得越久，亡灵重回希尔斯布莱德作恶的可能性就越大。"
G["Well then."]="好吧。"
G["Well then.\n\nIt is good that I no longer sleep."]="随便你。\n\n幸好我早就不睡觉了。"
G["Well then. Ready to fly?"]="¿Y bien? ¿$gListo:Lista; para volar?"
G["Well then... show me the tribute!"]="那么……把贡品给我吧！"
G["Well there's a gryphon master up in Stormwind if you need to fly somewhere.  You should be able to see the gryphons landing on your right as you walk through the Valley of Heroes."]="如果你想乘坐狮鹫的话，就去找暴风城的狮鹫管理员吧。当你进入英雄谷时，应该就能看见右边的狮鹫降落台。"
G["Well this all is all manner of spooky, is it not?  And these traps, quite unwelcoming.  These mogu could desperately use some decoration advice."]="这里所有的一切都让人毛骨悚然，不是吗？还有这些陷阱，真是让人太不舒服了。这些魔古族真应该将这些陷阱做得隐蔽些。"
G["Well this is certainly a nice change of scenery."]="很好，这个布景的变换肯定很漂亮。"
G["Well this is troublesome! How am I supposed to collect the ore samples for the magisters if the mines have been overrun with gnoll vermin?"]="这可真麻烦！如果那些豺狼人垃圾在矿井里到处跑，我该怎么才能帮魔导师收集到矿石样本呢？"
G["Well this son o' Ironforge would like..."]="啊，来自铁炉堡的孩子，你想做什么……"
G["Well this wagon ain't gonna fix itself."]="这货车可不会自己把自己修好的。"
G["Well time's money, and time's wasting!  Let's have that drink..."]="好吧，时间就是金钱，光阴飞逝！我们来喝一杯吧……"
G["Well well well! $n wins! Looks like I owe someone some money."]="很好很好！$n获胜！看来我要欠某人一些钱了。"
G["Well well well... look who came waddling back. It's the bruised-beaked bouncing bird, Dippy! And this time, he's not alone!"]="喔哟哟……看看是谁大摇大摆地回来了。它就是肿着嘴的大鸟，帝皮！这次，它不是一只鸟在战斗！"
G["Well well!  You've come to the right place to learn Mining, $gboyo : girlie;!  Geofram Bouldertoe himself resides at Deepmountain Mining and Jewelcrafting.  Ye couldn't ask for a better instructor than him."]="嗯！说到学习采矿的话，你来对地方啦，$g小伙子:姑娘;！吉尔弗拉姆·石趾居住在深山珠宝矿业协会。没有比他更好的老师了。"
G["Well well, a young visitor.\n\nHave you come to pay your respects at the shrine of my husband?  He was a hero you know.  A master of Jade crafting and fighting. He was to be remembered forever they said.\n\nDo you like my statues?  I craft them with special care saving only the best to  provide my husband company and protection."]="很好很好，一个年轻的访客。\n\n你是来祭扫我丈夫的神龛的吗？你知道，他可是个大英雄。一个玉雕大师，战斗高手。据说，他的名字会被人们永远铭记。\n\n你喜欢我的雕像吗？这些都是我用特殊方法制作的，只有最精良的作品，才能留下来陪伴和保护我的丈夫。"
G["Well well, not too bad. Maybe I CAN show you a few things..."]="嗯，嗯，还不坏。或许我能让你看点什么……"
G["Well whaddya know? It worked!"]="哇，你知道吗？它起作用了！"
G["Well what about the bombs that landed in our farms from your warship!"]="那些从你们的战船上掉到我们农场里的炸弹又怎么说！"
G["Well what are you waiting for?! Let's see!"]="那你还等什么呢？！快让我们看看！"
G["Well what do you know, this is Children's Week!  What can I do to help?"]="嘿，朋友，这是儿童周！我能帮忙吗？"
G["Well whatever happens, we must make a decision as a group."]="无论发生什么，我们必须做出统一的决定。"
G["Well ye'd be sure to find some training in the magical arts over in the Hall of Mysteries, north of the gates of Ironforge.  Juli Stormkettle can always be found there with her nose in a book."]="去铁炉堡大门以北的神秘大厅，你会在那儿受到魔法训练的。朱莉·雷线总是在那儿埋头苦读。"
G["Well yes, I do know a rare alchemical recipe.  Let me teach you!"]="不错，我确实知道一种罕见的炼金术配方。让我来教你吧！"
G["Well you came in last.\n\nNowhere to go but up, right?"]="Bueno, ¿y qué si has terminado $gel último:la última;?\n\n¡Ya solo puedes ir a mejor!"
G["Well you can't just stay in here! You leave me no choice!\n<Use the Fire Lotus Incense.>"]="你不能待在这里！这是你逼我的！\n<使用业火莲熏香。>"
G["Well you know me... I like cats!"]="你了解我的……我喜欢猫！"
G["Well you know the only thing that I admire as much as my own looks is a rare white flower that grows around these parts.\n\nIt's terribly hard to find, though."]="你知道吗，我唯一赞赏的是一种生长在这附近的稀有的白色百合，它们和我的外表不分伯仲。\n\n可是，它非常难得。"
G["Well you're a picky little $r, aren't you? Fine. Just go get me that sample."]="Bueno, eres $gun:una; $r algo $gquisquilloso:quisquillosa; ¿no? Bueno. Dame esa muestra."
G["Well you're an ugly one! Don't mean you don't know how to fight though.\n\nOne of my squads should be geared and ready to march soon - get your sorry butt in line and make the climb with them!"]="哎呀，你长得真难看！不过这并不表示你不会战斗。\n\n我麾下的一支小队很快就要出发啦——加入他们的行列，一起爬上伊米海姆吧！"
G["Well! This looks like as good a place to brew as any."]="好吧！这地方看起来并不妨碍酿酒。"
G["Well! You see, was gift from Grandmother Oluba. She hand-weave from finest silk on Draenor! Am quite proud of, yes."]="哈！这是我的祖母送给我的礼物呀。这件长袍是她用德拉诺最上等的丝绸亲手缝制的！穿上它令我倍感自豪呢！"
G["Well, $c, that was... subtle."]="嗯，$c，这很……巧妙。"
G["Well, $n - are you ready to roll? It won't be easy!"]="¿Y bien, $n? ¿Estás $gpreparado:preparada;? ¡No va a ser fácil!"
G["Well, $n looks a little weird. Sorry, $n."]="好吧，是$n看起来有一点奇怪。抱歉，$n。"
G["Well, $n? How are those chickens doing?\n\nMake sure to look around for their eggs. Those darned things hide them in the weirdest places!"]="你好吗，$n？那些小鸡还好吗？\n\n一定要仔细找找它们的蛋，那些该死的小家伙就喜欢把蛋藏在最古怪的地方！"
G["Well, Bessy will enjoy this little snack."]="嗯，贝希会喜欢这份零食的。"
G["Well, I am headed in that direction.  I've only been dallying here at Crown's Guard because of all the wildlife activity on the roads.\n\nI'll make you a deal: help me clear the roads, and yes, I'll join your group."]="嗯，我们正好顺路。是那些在道路上出没的怪兽让我无法成行，只能在皇冠哨卫这里耽误时日。\n\n我想和你做笔交易：帮我清除道路上的怪物，我就会加入你们的队伍。"
G["Well, I declare! It's a new student! I'll gladly teach you everything I know once you have a little more skill. Go talk to Gretta Finespindle over there, would you? She'll have you up to speed in no time."]="嗯，我声明！他是个新学生！只要你再多掌握一点技能，我会很乐意将我所知道的一切都教给你的。去跟格雷塔谈谈，好吗？她会教你如何速成技能的。"
G["Well, I don't know. I was here tending the fire and discussing the drawbacks of cogs with Zootfizzle. That's pretty epic, too, in its own way."]="呃，才没有。我是来照料篝火堆的，顺便找苏特菲兹谈谈机械零件的缺陷问题。我承认，这件战利品看上去是挺不错的。"
G["Well, I hope once they're done he'll send them right back through that portal..."]="好吧，我希望等他们的事情搞定之后，凯尔萨斯会把他们送回传送门的另一端去……"
G["Well, I suppose I do owe you a little something - here, take one of these. I've got lots."]="好吧，我应该报答你的——给，收下吧。这玩意儿我多得是。"
G["Well, I suppose I should go in there after him.\n\nCan't be any worse than facing Hellscream after this..."]="嗯，我想我应该跟他进去。\n\n再没有比在这时候去面对地狱咆哮更坏的事情了……"
G["Well, I survived my first encounter with the sha. It was more frightening than I had anticipated."]="好吧，我在和煞魔的首次交锋中幸存了下来。那比我想象的还要吓人。"
G["Well, I was just giving our leader here a progress report on how everything is proceeding according to plan.  It should only be a few more weeks and we'll have this place back in shape.\n\nWe may want the Shadow Council to only staff the village with orcs, however.  That way we can make an ancestral claim and work undercover.\n\nWait a minute.  Do I know you?  What's your name?"]="好吧，我正在给我们的首领进行汇报。应该只需要再多几周，我们就可以让这地方处于良好的运行状态。\n\n不过，我们可能想让暗影议会只派遣兽人来这里，那样的话，我们就能宣称这村子是我们的属地，便于进行秘密工作了。\n\n等一下，我认识你吗？你叫什么名字？"
G["Well, I won't hold you up.  It's been a pleasure, $n.  I hope our paths cross again soon."]="嗯，快去做你的事吧。很高兴认识你，$n。希望我们很快就能再见面。"
G["Well, I'm going outside to check. Something is amiss."]="好吧，我要出去检查一下。似乎有些不对劲。"
G["Well, I'm going to follow the clue and see where it leads me!"]="好，我就跟着线索走，看看它会带我去哪儿！"
G["Well, I'm not sure how far I'll make it in this state... I'm feeling kind of faint..."]="嗯，我不知道自己还能撑多久……我感到有些乏力……"
G["Well, I'm off then.  Take care, Harlan."]="好的，那我走了。多多保重，哈兰。"
G["Well, I'm off to Ratchet now! Best of luck to you!"]="好了，现在我要起身去棘齿城了！祝你好运！"
G["Well, I'm off to the Gelkis.  They're not as dumb as the Maraudines, but they're more reasonable."]="好吧，我要到吉尔吉斯村去了。他们不像玛洛迪半人马一样蠢，而且他们更加通情达理。"
G["Well, I'm sorry to hear that. I'll be by again later if you want a hand."]="我对你的遭遇深表同情。如果你需要帮忙的话，我待会就过来。"
G["Well, I've said my goodbyes.  Time to move on."]="嗯，我已经道过别了。该是出发的时候了。"
G["Well, I've seen better. But, you have potential, I won't deny it. Pay attention and you just might learn something!"]="好吧，我明白些了。但是，你有潜力，这点我不会否定。多加留心你或许就能学到什么东西！"
G["Well, I've spent weeks trying to understand how to summon one of these things. If you know something I don't, I'd appreciate it if you'd share it with us \"lesser\" mortals."]="好吧，我花了几个星期的时间，想要弄明白怎么召唤这些家伙。如果你知道什么诀窍又愿意跟我们这些“下等”凡人分享的话，我会十分感激的。"
G["Well, Marge, I've actually been looking for a way to tell you this...."]="噢，玛尔格。事实上，我有话对你说……"
G["Well, NOW I am!"]="我还真担心！"
G["Well, Warchief? What say you now? Will you send me to Northrend?"]="酋长？怎么说？能派我去诺森德吗？"
G["Well, Zanzil, I'd like to make it your concern.  I've recovered the bodies of High Priestess Jeklik and High Priest Venoxis."]="嗯，赞吉尔，我有个能让你在意的理由。我找到了高阶祭司耶克里克和温诺希斯的遗体。"
G["Well, actually, that's pretty bad news, but considering the alternatives..."]="嗯，事实上，这是个相当坏的消息，不过总比死了好……"
G["Well, alright then $n. I can tell that you've seen the error of your ways and rejoined the engineering fold.\n\nHave fun with your yeti!!!"]="啊，好吧，$n。看来你已经明白了自己在工程学方面的欠缺。\n\n祝你和你的机械雪人玩得愉快！"
G["Well, alright then, there you go, First Officer $n.  Just try to be more careful with your helmet in the future.\n\nThose things don't grow on trees, you know!"]="那么好吧，收好了，一等官员$n。记得以后看好你的头盔。\n\n要知道，那些东西并不是长在树上的！"
G["Well, alright, but you know these things don't grow on trees.\n\n<The spiritcaller thinks about that a moment.>\n\nOh, wait a minute...."]="嗯，好吧。但是你要知道，这些东西不是长在树上的。\n\n<唤灵者想了一会儿。>\n\n哦，等等……"
G["Well, are we going to attack, or are we just going to mill about all day?"]="好吧，我们这是要发动攻击呢，还是整天在这里闲逛？"
G["Well, aren't you going to pick the weeds?"]="好吧，难道你不是来除草的吗？"
G["Well, aren't you the smarty-pants? Ye know more than I do, I can tell ye that! Don't go getting' a big head, but if ye want to keep learnin', have a chat with Georgio Bolero in Stormwind. They say he knows his tailorin'!"]="嗯，你这个聪明的家伙！我可以明确地告诉你，你知道的比我多！你可别为此自负，如果你想继续学习的话，就去暴风城找乔吉奥·波利罗谈谈吧。听说他是个很好的裁缝！"
G["Well, at least the ale was safe."]="嗯，至少麦酒是安全的。"
G["Well, at least there will always be more honeybrew!"]="那个，至少蜜酒是不缺啦！"
G["Well, back to business for me.  But it sure was nice taking that short break, and it's always nice drinking Thunder Ale!"]="好吧，我要回去干活了。休息一下的感觉果然很不错，喝上一杯雷酒的感觉就更好了！"
G["Well, before all the hostilities broke out here we were fixing them up to harvest the local trees.\n\nLately, though, they've been forced into service against the Horde. Turns out they make for a pretty fine fighting machine. If you've got a key, you'd be silly not to use it!"]="事情是这样。在武装冲突爆发之前，我们利用伐木机来砍伐这里的树木。\n\n战争很快一触即发，我们不得不改装这些机器来对抗部落。要知道，翻新后的伐木机简直是超级厉害的战斗机器呢。如果你有钥匙的话，为什么不好好利用一番呢！"
G["Well, from what I hear, the new plague has ALL of the old plague flavor but none of the old plague calories or carbohydrates!"]="哦，据我所知，这次的新瘟疫有着上次瘟疫的全部风味，但是却不包含上次瘟疫的卡路里或是碳水化合物！"
G["Well, from what I've gathered while waiting to be eaten by these yokels... it might not be necessary to kill every ogre you find here.\n\nThe ogres were going on and on the other day about how King Gordok came to power; specifically, he killed the previous king and took his place.  Well, the king's henchmen - those that Gordok spared - immediately swore fealty to the new king.\n\nWho knows - the ogre you save could very well be your own... figuratively speaking, of course!"]="嗯，从我跟食人魔的交战情况来看……你不必逐一杀死这儿的所有食人魔。\n\n就在前几天戈多克大王恢复权力，杀死以前的国王取而代之的时候，食人魔纷纷离开此地。嗯，国王的追随者们——戈多克没有要他们的命——立即发誓效忠新国王。\n\n谁知道呢——你饶恕的食人魔说不定会效忠于你呢……当然，这是打个比方！"
G["Well, guess I should load everything back into the cart."]="呃，我应该把粮食重新搬上货车。"
G["Well, guess we're walking."]="Pues, parece que tendremos que caminar."
G["Well, he comes back to the king all pretendin' to be nice, draws his sword, and runs the king through, elbow to ... well you know... kills him on the spot."]="他假装好意地回到了国王身边，拔出佩剑，跑向国王，对着国王就这么……你知道……咔嚓一声。"
G["Well, he'd better keep the moonshine flowing if he wants my men to stop their research to serve the military's purposes!"]="好吧，如果他希望我的属下中断研究工作，为军事目的服务的话，他最好为我们提供月光酒！"
G["Well, he's gone too... so why are they still around?"]="好吧，可他也死了……它们为什么还留在这里？"
G["Well, helllooo there, pretty thing..."]="哎呀，小美人你好……"
G["Well, hop to it then!"]="好了，跳上去！"
G["Well, how did it go? Well, I hope?"]="那么，情况如何？应该还不错吧？"
G["Well, hurry up! Lord Illidan has no patience for mistakes!"]="好吧，赶快！伊利丹大人没有耐心容忍错误！"
G["Well, if it isn't $n!  It's good to see you again; I cannot express my gratitude enough at the help that you've given me and my invention work to date.\n\nWhat can I do for you today?"]="¡Pero si es $n! Me alegro de verte otra vez. Apenas puedo expresar mi gratitud por la ayuda que nos has brindado hasta hoy a mí y a mi trabajo de inventor.\n\n¿Qué puedo hacer por ti hoy?"
G["Well, if it isn't a young, bristling $c, no doubt drawn here by talk of my exploits in fields of battle!\n\nNo time for stories now, for there are great, important deeds that need doing!  So if you're looking for glory, then luck shines on you today..."]="Pues si no es un joven y apuesto $c, sin duda atraído aquí por los rumores de mis hazañas en campos de batalla !\n\nNo hay tiempo para historias ahora, pues existen grandes y importantes acciones que realizar. Así que si buscas gloria, entonces la suerte te sonríe hoy..."
G["Well, if it isn't our resident $g flyboy : flygirl;, $n.  How's it going, ace?"]="Vaya, si es $gnuestro:nuestra; piloto residente, $n. ¿Qué tal te va?"
G["Well, if you say so."]="好吧，如果你这么说的话。"
G["Well, if you've come to kill me, too, can you at least wait until I've fed Griselda? Poor girl hasn't eaten in days."]="好吧，就算你要杀我，至少等我喂饱格里西达吧？我可怜的宝贝已经好些日子没吃过东西啦。"
G["Well, isn't this the nicest gift I've gotten today!"]="哇，这是我今天所接受到的最好的礼物了！"
G["Well, it is good that things have turned out... better for you and your people, High Tinker.  But not all of us have the luxury of up and moving our kingdom."]="嗯，局面在朝着……有利于你和你人民的方向转变，这很不错，大工匠。可并非我们所有人都能如此奢侈地将自己的王国迁走。"
G["Well, it isn't exactly a new thought, sister."]="嗯，这并不算是一个新主意，姐妹。"
G["Well, it was nice knowing you."]="好吧，很高兴认识你。"
G["Well, it's like I said; it's going to be a while before we get this ship ready for flight.  We'll keep you informed."]="好吧，就像我说的那样。在飞船准备好飞行前，我们还需要一段时间。我会让你知道最新进展的。"
G["Well, it's not good. The battle has taken its toll on both your steam tanks. My salvage teams will secure what's left of them as soon as it's safe."]="嗯，这并不好。你的两辆蒸汽坦克都在战斗中损毁了。我的搜救队在确认安全之后就会把它们的残骸取回来。"
G["Well, it's time to take these comedic muscles elsewhere. Have a good night all!"]="好吧，是时间取下这些可笑的肌肉了。大家晚安！"
G["Well, it's true. If you ever go to the Wood of Staves, you can see it."]="嗯，是真的。要是你去禅杖林，就能看见了。"
G["Well, just for that, you can come to my market any time."]="好，就为这个，你可以随时来我的市集。"
G["Well, lad, you can start by readin' The Green Hills of Stranglethorn. Then, maybe you can join me on one of my safaris. What do you say?"]="好啊，小伙子，你可以从阅读《荆棘谷的青山》开始。然后，也许你能和我一同参加行动，你觉得如何？"
G["Well, let's get to it then."]="嗯，就这么干吧。"
G["Well, let's see.  I heard that Magus Bisp has been spending his time cooped up on top of his tower, working on some new spell, or something.\n\nI heard that Del Gahrron was planning on retiring and heading back to his farm.  He may have already left, in fact.\n\nOh, and I heard that there's some $r $c running around town, asking people all sorts of annoying questions!\n\nJust playing with you, love.  Hope that information helped."]="A ver... He oído que el magus Bisp está pasando mucho tiempo encerrado en su torre, trabajando en un hechizo nuevo o algo así.\n\nHe oído que Del Gahrron estaba pensando en jubilarse y volver a su granja. De hecho, a lo mejor ya se ha ido.\n\nAh, y me han contado que hay $gun:una; $r $c husmeando por la ciudad y haciéndole a la gente toda clase de preguntas aburridas.\n\nSolo era una broma, cielo. Espero que la información te sea de ayuda."
G["Well, let's see... I saw some drudges running away from that mine over there.  Said something about a spider.  New customers?  Well, there's Jeralee, the lovely young gnome, who bought an axe twice her size last week.  Oh, and Magus Bisp came by asking for armor.  Not sure why he'd need plate armor..."]="嗯，让我想想……我看见几个苦工从那边的矿井里跑出去了。嘴里念叨着蜘蛛还是什么的。新客户？嗯，有位年轻可爱的侏儒小姐，名叫杰拉莉，她上星期买了把比她大一倍的斧子。喔，魔导师毕斯普来咨询过护甲。不知道他要板甲做什么……"
G["Well, look what the virmen dragged in. $P, how have you been? Are you hear to compete?"]="嗯，看看兔妖把谁给拽来了。$P，你近况如何？你是来比赛的吗？"
G["Well, look who's here!"]="呦，看看谁来了！"
G["Well, looks like we have all of the cooked albacore that we can properly salt and store for the upcoming war at Ahn'Qiraj. Thanks for asking though, $c. If you have a mind to, check around with the other collectors. I'd bet there's someone else here that could use your help with gathering up whatever it is that they need."]="呃，看来我们拥有的烤彩鳍鱼已经能满足安其拉一战的需求了。谢谢你的关心，$c。如果你想帮忙的话，就在附近问问。我敢打赌这儿有人需要你帮忙收集战争物资。"
G["Well, looks like we've gathered up everything that the Alliance is going to need; now we're just waiting on the Horde. I think soon I'm going to see if there's any Tigule & Foror's ice cream nearby."]="嗯，似乎我们已经集齐联盟所需的所有物资了，现在只等部落完成他们的任务了。我想我得看看这附近有没有提古勒和弗罗尔的冰淇淋卖……"
G["Well, maybe 'pay' isn't the best word to use. See, when I was stuck in the belly of that thing, I got to thinking:\n\nThis creature lives in hot, flaming magma and yet it doesn't take a lick of damage from the fire!\n\nIf only I could find a pristine hide from one of these beasts. I could take it back to my dear friend, Malyfous Darkhammer, in Everlook. If anyone could do anything with the hide of a beast like this, it would be him."]="Bueno, quizás \"pagar\" no sea la palabra adecuada. Veamos, cuando estaba metido en la tripa de esa cosa, tuve mucho tiempo para pensar:\n\nEsta criatura vive en el magma caliente y llameante, ¡y el fuego no le hace nada de daño!\n\nSi pudiera hacerme con un cuero prístino de una de estas bestias podría llevárselo a mi querido amigo Malyfous Martilloscuro, de Vista Eterna. Si hay alguien que pueda hacer algo con la piel de estas bestias, será él."
G["Well, maybe it was more like a hundred..."]="好吧，也许是有一百人左右吧……"
G["Well, milord, your father had our troops recalled at Lord Uther's request."]="呃，殿下，您的父王应乌瑟尔大人的请求召回了全军。"
G["Well, my birds have taken a liking to you. I will follow their lead."]="好吧……我的鸟儿可喜欢你了。我听它们的。"
G["Well, my master Morthis is really the expert, but I can share with you what I know.\n\nThey are not birds. Certainly, they fly, their wings have the appearance of feathers, and we even call them hawks, but that is where the comparisons to birds stop. In fact, it would appear that they have more in common with dragons: an affinity for fire, a solitary nature, and - based on what we've seen - some indications of intelligence."]="其实，我的导师莫希斯才是这方面的专家。不过我可以跟你说说我知道的情况。\n\n它们并不是鸟。当然了，它们也会飞，它们的翅膀上似乎也有羽毛，而且我们也管它们叫“鹰”，但那只是和鸟类对比后的称呼。实际上，它们和巨龙之间的相同点似乎更多：同样对火焰具有非凡的亲和力，同样喜爱独居，并且——据我们观察——具备一定的智力特征。"
G["Well, my research said you were the last one to-"]="而且，调查显示你是最后一个——"
G["Well, nevermind. I'm sure no one would be foolish enough to lay a hand on Kel'thuzard precious pet."]="呃，别理它。我相信没有人敢伤害克尔苏加德最宝贝的宠物。"
G["Well, no one asked you, Tatai."]="没人在问你，塔泰。"
G["Well, now or never I suppose. Remember, once we get to the road safely, return to Terenthis to let him know we escaped."]="现在不走更待何时！记住，一旦我们安全地回到大路上，你就回特伦希斯那儿去，让他知道我们已经顺利逃脱了。"
G["Well, now that I've got a nice lead, I think I'll enjoy a little nap."]="唔，我已经占据领先优势啦，可以小睡一会儿。"
G["Well, now that we've fought, it's settled. We're friends!"]="好吧，不打不相识。我们现在是朋友了！"
G["Well, now that you mention it, yeah, I did see something I thought was a little strange yesterday afternoon!\n\nI was running past some old troll ruins southeast of here; well, I wasn't really running, more like hopping... The sand's so hot!\n\nAnyway, so I was hopping past the ruins, when I noticed a camp set up there. Seems like a funny place to set up camp, if you ask me... I would have poked around a little more but one of those crazy big vultures chased me off."]="嗯，既然你提及了这一点，不错，昨天下午我确实看见了奇怪的事情！\n\n当我从东南方的巨魔废墟处跑过时……好吧，我其实不是跑过去的，应该说是跳过去的……沙地真是太烫了！\n\n总之，当我从废墟旁跳过的时候，我注意到那儿有一座营帐。我不得不说，在那儿设立营帐是件可笑的事儿……我本来要到那里去看看的，但是一只疯狂的大秃鹫把我赶走了。"
G["Well, now we've got a competition on our hands."]="呃，原来我们还在比赛啊。"
G["Well, now. What a pleasant turn of events."]="瞧，形势转好呀。"
G["Well, now... that's a lot to digest. I'm gonna need some time to take all this in. Thank ye."]="啊，现在我得花上很长时间来好好消化这些知识。我要在这里再待一会儿。谢谢你们。"
G["Well, of course, here are some extras. I'm just made of fireworks...."]="哦，当然，这儿还有一些特别的。我可是焰火专业户……"
G["Well, out with it, neophyte..."]="嗯，出去吧，新兵……"
G["Well, practice makes perfect I suppose."]="嗯，我想是熟能生巧吧。"
G["Well, recently I've had quite the craving for Fire Spirit Salmon."]="好吧，最近我特别想吃焰灵鲑鱼。"
G["Well, see you here tomorrow!"]="好，明天还是在这儿见！"
G["Well, shaman, what now?"]="好吧，萨满，现在呢？"
G["Well, so far, it tastes like something my wife would drink..."]="呃，我的妻子应该会喜欢这种果味酒……"
G["Well, sometimes veggies get to sprouting SO beautifully, they practically beg to be pilfered.\n\nGrandpa said a keen plainshawk could spot a prize pumpkin better than anyone at the market, and it'd make for it quicker than a... err....\n\n\"Quicker than a hozen in heat.\"\n\nI guess you could say stuff like that back then?\n\nThe point is, you'll just have to defend alluring crops from critters!"]="Bueno, a veces las verduras brotan TAN bonitas, que prácticamente piden que las roben.\n\nEl abuelo decía que un halcón de la llanura con buena vista podía ver una calabaza de competición mejor que nadie en el mercado, y se lanzaría a por ella más rápido que un... esto... \n\n\"Más rápido que un hozen en celo.\"\n\nSupongo que en esa época se podían decir esas cosas.\n\n¡La cuestión es que tendrás que defender los cultivos atrayentes de los animales!"
G["Well, spit it out!  What's the bad news?"]="直说吧！坏消息是什么？"
G["Well, stuff it. This thing is busted beyond hope. I'm outta here!"]="好吧，别管它了。这东西已经没希望了。我要离开这里！"
G["Well, that enough of that! Going now."]="我受够了！我要走了。"
G["Well, that is just not right. The creature is far too small. Let us see what Keever's third batch will do."]="好吧，失败了。这种生物太小了。让我们看看基佛的第三批药剂效果如何。"
G["Well, that must be why my neighbor shaved his head and donned those robes. Maybe he'll let me have his stuff."]="嗯，我的邻居一定是为了这个才会剃掉头发，穿上这种袍子。也许他会把他的袍子借给我。"
G["Well, that should do it.  Come now, back to the shop to finish our business!"]="嗯，这能应该就行了。来吧，回到商店，完成我们的交易！"
G["Well, that should put a damper on their plans. Good work, $n. I trust you can get back on your own."]="很好，那样应该能拖延一下他们的计划。干得好，$n。我相信你可以自己回去。"
G["Well, that was a relaxing nap. How's the game hunting going over there?"]="啊，睡得真舒服。狩猎比赛的情况如何啦？"
G["Well, that was fun, wasn't it?"]="哈，很有趣，对吧？"
G["Well, that went smoothly for a change."]="嗯，改变进行得非常顺利。"
G["Well, that's good news. Once we join the Alliance, we certainly won't run out of things to do."]="嗯，真是个好消息。只要我们加入联盟，就不会没事情做了。"
G["Well, that's good news. Once we join the Horde, we certainly won't run out of things to do."]="嗯，真是个好消息。一旦我们加入部落，就不会没事可做了。"
G["Well, that's what I get for oversleeping!"]="完了，我睡过头了！"
G["Well, the Tillers won't be crowning you in jewels or building you for war.\n\nFarming is a little different.\n\nIt's a slower life, but a good one. You ask Dooka, Dooka knows!\n\nYou can build up your own farm, plant your own crops, and enjoy eating all the food you grow! That's Dooka's favorite part!\n\nSo if that sounds interesting, then you should go to Halfhill and see for yourself!"]="Bueno, los Labradores no te van a cubrir de joyas ni prepararte para la guerra.\n\nNo, la vida de un granjero no tiene nada que ver con eso.\n\nSi te pones a ello, conocerás a gente bastante interesante. Podrás formar tu propia granja, plantar tus propios cultivos, y disfrutar de los frutos de tu propio trabajo.\n\nSi todo esto te parece interesante, ¡entonces ve a El Alcor y compruébalo en persona!"
G["Well, the Tillers won't be crowning you in jewels or building you up for war.\n\nNah, the life of a farmer is about somethin' a little different.\n\nIf you stick with it, you might meet some real interesting folks. You'll be able to build up your own farm, plant your own crops, and enjoy the fruits of your own labor.\n\nSo if all that sounds interesting, then you should go to Halfhill and see for yourself!"]="嗯，阡陌客不会让你变得富有，而且也不会让你变强大以应付战事。\n\n不是这样的，农夫的生活略有不同。\n\n如果你坚持这样的生活，你会遇到一些非常有趣的人。你可以建立自己的农场、种植自己的庄稼，并且享受自己的劳动果实。\n\n所以，如果你感兴趣的话，就亲自去半山看看！"
G["Well, the way I see it, $n, we have two options to consider for leaving this cave.\n\nWe can make our way stealthfully--I use the cloak you've given me, and you'd be left to your own devices, or, and this may be a harder option considering my wounds, we fight our way out back to back.\n\nI'll let you decide since you know your strengths better than I."]="Bueno, tal como lo veo, $n, tenemos dos opciones al abandonar esta caverna.\n\nPodemos irnos a hurtadillas: yo uso la capa que me diste y tú tendrás que buscarte la vida o, y esta puede ser una opción más difícil, considerando mis heridas, luchamos de espaldas, cada cual por su cuenta.\n\nDejo que lo decidas tú, ya que conoces tus fuerzas más que yo."
G["Well, then. Let us begin."]="好，那么，让我们开始吧。"
G["Well, there is at least a wee bit of good news... no offense, Gelbin.  The shaking seems to have stirred up The Earthen Ring.  Even the Wildhammer shaman have offered their help."]="嗯，至少还有那么点儿好消息……无意冒犯，格尔宾。震颤似乎也引起了大地之环的注意。就连蛮锤萨满祭司都伸出了援手。"
G["Well, there's your problem! You have what we call a ghost in the machine."]="嗯，找到问题了！这部机器里有个被我们称为鬼魂的家伙需要你对付。"
G["Well, these will have to do. The Klaxxi'va send their thanks, though I don't know why."]="呃，这些应该足够了。卡拉克西表达了他们的谢意，虽然我也不知道是为了什么。"
G["Well, this is a little embarrassing...."]="嗯，这可有点儿令人尴尬……"
G["Well, time for a stretch."]="好吧，舒展一下身体。"
G["Well, times were getting tough up north.  While the scourge problem has been dealt with, we are constantly on the move and looking for food.  I decided it was time to head out and find some new fishing grounds!\n\nAfter almost a month at sea, I ended up here.  Good thing I packed a few crates of pickled herring for the trip!"]="呃，北上变得越发困难了。尽管天灾的麻烦已经得到解决，我们还得不断迁移和觅食。我下定决心，是时候出去寻找新渔场了！\n\n在海上漂流了近一个月之后，我来到了这里。幸好我带了几箱腌鲱鱼，否则途中就要饿肚子了！"
G["Well, uh, the truth is, there were ships. There WERE!"]="这个嘛，呃，事实是，原本是有船的。原本有的！"
G["Well, we are having some problems at the Sludge Fields, located northeast of here. Warden Stillwater could use your help."]="嗯，我们在东北方的药渣农场的确遇到了一些麻烦。你一定能帮上看守者斯蒂沃特的忙。"
G["Well, we may still be crawling with sprites, but I certainly appreciate the help you gave us. You really are quite the travelling hero."]="好吧，虽然这里依然是林精泛滥，但我非常感谢你给我们的帮助。你真是个游侠。"
G["Well, we meet again."]="好吧，我们又见面了。"
G["Well, we're not getting any closer just standing here.  Come on Dadanga!  Yah!"]="好吧，不要再靠近了，就站在这儿。快些，达丹加！"
G["Well, we've got a master person-finder here, eh $p?  We're on it."]="正好我们这儿有个找人的高手，对吧，$p？我们这就出发。"
G["Well, well well... look who's back for more!"]="瞧瞧，瞧瞧……有大人物回来参赛了！"
G["Well, well, moving up in the world are we? You're looking for the Champions' Hall, and you'll find it on the southeast end of Old Town. Good luck!"]="在旧城区的东南角落，你可以找到勇士大厅。"
G["Well, well, well, it looks like you people have a spine after all."]="嗯，看样子你这种人还是有一点骨气的。"
G["Well, well, well, look who's back!  Slumming, $n?"]="瞧啊，这是谁回来了！故地重游吗，$n？"
G["Well, well, well, what have we here?  A $T civilian : civilian;?  Isn't that precious?  You'll get no special treatment from me!"]="Bueno, bueno, bueno, ¿qué tenemos aquí? ¿$tUn:Una; civil? ¿No es precioso? ¡No vas a obtener un tratamiento especial por mi parte!"
G["Well, well, well. $p. I figured I best not be here in person. Don't want to give your ambition any ideas."]="很好，很好。$p。我想我还是不要亲自前来了，免得你的野心又蠢蠢欲动。"
G["Well, well, well…\n\nWhen the vultures spoke of you, I dismissed them as gossips. Meddlers. But here you are! In the flesh… more bone than flesh, truth be told…"]="Vaya, vaya, vaya…\n\nCuando los buitres hablaron de ti, los desprecié como chismosos. Entrometidos. ¡Pero aquí estás! En carne y hueso… más hueso que carne, a decir verdad…"
G["Well, well, what do we have here...? You must know many secrets...."]="好吧、好吧，看看我们都发现什么了…？你一定知道不少秘密……"
G["Well, well, what do you know, sparky, we did it. Everything's collected and ready to go. We're just waiting on those Horde yahoos now, and once they get their act together it's off to the races at Ahn'Qiraj!"]="嗯，嗯，你知道吗，我们成功了。所有的物资都已收集完毕，只等部落那些粗鲁的家伙们完成他们的任务了。到那时，我们就要跟安其拉的异种虫类开战了！"
G["Well, well. I admire your tenacity. Baleroc stood guard over this keep for a thousand mortal lifetimes."]="好吧，好吧。我很佩服你们的顽强。贝尔洛克已经在这座堡垒前守卫了千百个世纪。"
G["Well, well. Looks like we got ourselves some competition. Get 'em boys!"]="好，好。看来我们要展开角逐了。去吧，孩子们！"
G["Well, well... look what the cat brung in... and how can I help you, $c?"]="看看谁来了……有什么要我帮你的吗，$c？"
G["Well, well... look who's here!"]="哈哈，看看谁来了！"
G["Well, what do we have here? Do you truly believe you can steal the title of Chieftain of Ealdmaine from me? Ha!"]="Pues, ¿qué tenemos aquí? ¿Realmente crees que puedes robarme el título de Jefe de Ealdmaine?"
G["Well, what's it gonna be, buddy? I've got a market to run."]="呃……到底要怎样呢，哥们？我还要经营市集呢。"
G["Well, what's it gonna be, friend? I've got a market to run."]="Bueno, ¿qué va a ser, $gamigo:amiga;? Tengo un mercado que atender."
G["Well, what's it gonna be, my good friend? I've got a market to run."]="Bueno, ¿qué va a ser, mi $gbuen amigo:buena amiga;? Tengo un mercado que atender."
G["Well, what's it gonna be, neighbor? I've got a market to run."]="Bueno, ¿qué va a ser, $gvecino:vecina;? Tengo un mercado que atender."
G["Well, what's it gonna be, stranger? I've got a market to run."]="Bueno, ¿qué va a ser, $gforastero:forastera;? Tengo un mercado que atender."
G["Well, what's it gonna be? I've got a market to run."]="呃……到底要怎样呢？我还要经营市集呢。"
G["Well, what's this Algalon going to be looking for with his diagnostics? What are our chances?"]="啊，这个奥尔加隆分析出了什么结果来？我们有多大的几率不被毁灭？"
G["Well, whatever it is, it works quite well!"]="好吧，不管它是什么，效果很好！"
G["Well, why didn't you say so? Give those Twilight cultists a good one from me, will ya?"]="为什么你不早说？替我给那些暮光异教徒狠狠来一下子，好不好？"
G["Well, wrap me in leather and tug my leash: it's Dungeon Master Vishas!"]="是地下城主韦沙斯！给我穿上皮衣，然后用你的鞭子狠狠抽我吧！"
G["Well, ya got where you were goin'. Too bad you're not gonna live long enough to see it!"]="好吧，你想去哪里都可以。可惜你活不到那一天了！"
G["Well, ye won't have much luck with finding a tailor out here.  Ironforge is home to a quite a few talented tailors though.  Why don't ye go ask a guard there."]="嗯，似乎你在寻找裁缝时并不顺利。但是，有很多高明的裁缝都居住在铁炉堡。你为什么不去问问那里的守卫呢？"
G["Well, yeah, sure... who hasn't heard of Chen Stormstout? Though, I hear his keg's empty, if you know what I mean."]="啊，嗯，是的……谁会没有听说过陈·风暴烈酒啊？不过，我听说他的酒桶已经空了，你知道我指的是什么。"
G["Well, you WILL at least write about it, won't you?"]="好吧，你至少能把它记录下来吧，对不对？"
G["Well, you aren't going to like what I have to tell you, young missy. This tablet is a naga communication. Their leader, Warlord Sriss'tiz, has ordered his naga to take the rest of the island by force."]="嗯，你不会喜欢这个消息的，小姑娘。这块石板是纳迦的交流工具。他们的首领督军斯雷提兹命令他的纳迦们用武力来抢夺这块岛屿。"
G["Well, you can always go back to the camp and help Weslex with all his cogs..."]="好吧，你随时可以返回营地，帮助维斯雷摆弄那堆齿轮……"
G["Well, you can find Theridan or Maldryn by the moonwell in the Park.  Just head to the western area of Stormwind, north of the Mage District, but west of the Cathedral Square."]="你可以在花园区的月亮井旁边找到塞瑞德兰或者玛尔德利恩。到法师区的北边，教堂广场的西边就可以找到花园区了。"
G["Well, you didn't come all this way out here to jaw over a cup of tea. Let's see how you might be able to help get us out of this situation."]="嗯，你显然不是到这里来一边喝茶一边聊天的。让我们看看你能帮什么忙吧。"
G["Well, you have done what you could through diplomacy. Now, we can only prove ourselves to the Pearlfin through our deeds."]="好吧，你已用尽了所有的外交手段。现在，我们只能靠自己的实际行动来向珠鳍部族证明我们的诚意了。"
G["Well, you really sent them flying. I could hear their... bleating from here. \nBleating? Is that what you call the sound of a yaungol flying off a wall?"]="Vaya, sí que les has hecho volar. Podía oír su... balido desde aquí.\n\n¿Balido? ¿Así es como llamas al sonido que hace un yaungol cayendo de una muralla?"
G["Well, you won today, but that doesn't mean I can't win tomorrow. Papa Bramblestaff always said if at first you don't succeed, wipe the blood off and get back in there until you do."]="嗯，今天你赢了，可那并不代表我明天就不会赢。棘杖老爹总是说，失败是成功之母，擦干血迹，爬起来再战就是了，总有打赢的一天。"
G["Well, you won... I guess."]="好吧，我想你赢了……"
G["Well, you're certainly more talkative..."]="哦……你显然更加健谈了……"
G["Well, you're just zooming right along! I can't teach you anything you don't already know, but Springspindle Fizzlegear sure can! You can find Springspindle in Ironforge. Good luck!"]="嗯，你学得速度蛮快的！我没法教给你所有知识，但是宾斯匹德是可以的！你可以在铁炉堡中找到他。祝你好运！"
G["Well, you're not going to sign recruitment papers or anything, but you are going to fight alongside him.\n\nYou need to make sure Arthas culls Stratholme and defeats Mal'Ganis. Without Uther and Jaina around, he'll need all the help he can get.\n\nIf you talk to Arthas, he'll put you to work destroying the forces of Mal'Ganis. Follow along until I can figure out what's going on with the Infinites."]="这么说吧，你不用去填征兵表格之类的东西，只要和王子并肩战斗就行了。\n\n你必须确保阿尔萨斯成功清洗斯坦索姆并击败玛尔加尼斯。没有了乌瑟尔和吉安娜在身边，他就需要一切可能的帮助。\n\n如果你找阿尔萨斯谈谈的话，他应该会将你编入对抗玛尔加尼斯的部队。我会继续追查永恒之龙的阴谋，一有消息就联络你。"
G["Well, you're still here. I'd say that is something worth drinking to."]="好吧，你还好端端地坐在这里。我想说这里还是有些东西值得我们举杯庆贺的。"
G["Well, you've done just that. Come; let us return to Ironforge, and announce your victory to the Council."]="你已经做到了。来吧，让我们回铁炉堡去，向三锤议会宣告你的胜利。"
G["Well-done, heroes.  You have passed my test of combat."]="干得好，英雄们。你们已经通过了我的战斗测试。"
G["Well-picked. I'm sure Aska will be satisfied."]="选得好，阿丝卡一定会很满意的。"
G["Well. Another $c, come to learn the ways of the Shield-Breaker...?"]="Bien. Otr$go:a; $c. ¿Vienes a aprender Romper escudo?"
G["Well. Look what the netherwinds swept in. Come in, sit down, and rest yourself a spell. The fee is modest; you can surely afford it."]="好吧，看看虚空之风把谁吹来了。进来，坐下，休息一会。很便宜，你完全付得起。"
G["Well..."]="好吧……"
G["Well... I guess I'll just keep an eye on the turrets... or something."]="呃……我会留意那些炮塔的……"
G["Well... I guess that no one here is going to want to hear about the Keg Tapper prototypes 74205 and 75633...  Maybe if I spoke about prototype 1701-D, you would get excited..."]="……好吧……我估计这儿已经没人想听到开罐器74205和75633的名字了……如果我说开罐器1701-D的话，你们可能会兴奋一点……"
G["Well... I hate to admit it, but my sister's the one you'll have to talk to if you want to continue training. I don't know as much as she does... yet! She's standing over by the rocket car."]="呃……虽然我不愿承认，但是你要想继续训练的话就必须跟我的姐妹谈谈。目前来说……我知道的没她多！她乘坐火箭车四处巡查。"
G["Well... I was just thinking... you're a bit smaller, so you're less likely to set off any of those mines."]="呃……我刚才在想……你的个子比较矮，所以不可能让你来引爆地雷。"
G["Well... That got ugly. You're lucky I'm here."]="好吧……这真是太糟了。幸好有我在。"
G["Well... ah... don't tell her I sent you, but look for a red-robed woman above the ground level of the central tower.\nRedia Vaunt is her name. But do not mention me!"]="Bueno... eh... No le digas que te he enviado yo, pero busca a una mujer vestida de rojo encima de la planta baja de la torre central.\n\nSe llama Redia Vaunt. ¡Pero no menciones mi nombre!"
G["Well... done, heh. But I wonder if you're good enough... to best him."]="干得好……哼。可我很怀疑你们有没有本事……击败他。"
G["Well... done..."]="干得……好。"
G["Well... done... champions."]="干得……好……勇士。"
G["Well... fine, fine. We need to test the equipment anyhow.\n\nGimme a few seconds. I'll have 'em come out to \"rehearse.\"\n\nYou ready?"]="Bueno... bien, bien. Tenemos que probar el equipo de algún modo.\n\nDame un par de segundos. Haré que vengan a \"ensayar\".\n\n¿Empezamos?"
G["Well... that was interesting. Let's go meet with Lor'themar back outside."]="好吧……真有趣。我们去外面见洛瑟玛吧。"
G["Well... that's interesting. Most of your ancestors died in a fire. Oh my. Your people put themselves at great personal risk in the name of progress! I wish more Pandaren had your initiative."]="嗯……真有趣。你的大多数祖先都葬身于烈火。天哪。你的族人为了进步，不惜以身犯险！真希望有更多熊猫人具备这种觉悟。"
G["Well... the good news is we forced the reinforcements to turn back."]="呃……好消息是增援部队撤退了。"
G["Well... uh...  I guess the Keg Tapper 74205 will have to wait... but that's okay, I've got some designs for the Keg Tapper 75633..."]="好吧……那么……我猜开罐器74205得再等一等……此外，我觉着开罐器75633的设计很有意思……"
G["Well... um... I..."]="那么……呃……我……"
G["Well... we're undertakers, sir."]="呃……我们受理殡仪事务，长官。"
G["Well... what do you think the answer is?"]="那么……你觉得答案是什么？"
G["Well... yes."]="呃……是的。"
G["Well... yes. There are problems with the hozen."]="额……对。就是有猢狲捣乱。"
G["Well... you almost impressed me. I suppose I could spare the time for a few lessons..."]="呃……你给我留下了深刻印象。我想我会花时间传授知识给你的……"
G["Well? Are we going in, or what?"]="那么？我们是进去呢，还是？"
G["Well? Are you going to help me down?"]="嗯？你打算帮我下去吗？"
G["Well? Don't ye have heads ta roll an' treasure ta dig up?"]="怎么样？你没有脑袋可以踢，没有宝藏可以挖吗？"
G["Well? Let's go! I'm eager to see what you've got."]="好了？出发！我迫切的想知道你有点什么本领。"
G["Well? What is it?"]="好吧，那是什么？"
G["Well? Who's on the listening side of the signal? What's going to happen?"]="然后呢？谁在监听这个信号？会发生什么事情吗？"
G["Welp the fish ain't bitin' no more so I might as start gutting and cleaning what I did catch today."]="唉，看来是钓不到鱼了，我看我还是回去刮鱼鳞吧。"
G["Welp, back to the grind."]="嘿，回来干活。"
G["Went to Halfhill Market. Please show yourselves out.\n- Old Hillpaw"]="He ido al Mercado del Alcor. Ya sabes dónde está la salida.\n\n- Viejo Zarpa Collado"
G["Were he still alive to avenge himself, General Hawthorne would have no doubt ordered a retaliatory massacre of biblical proportions."]="如果霍索恩将军还活着，一定会毫不留情地将敌人消灭干净。"
G["Were my pets too much for you to handle, tamer?"]="我的宠物是不是太难对付了，驯宠师？"
G["Were they able to hold out?"]="他们挡住恶魔的进攻了吗？"
G["Were this tower to boast TWICE as many tomes, it would still not be enough for me. My collecting and copying shall never be done.\nSo. You have need of my assistance?"]="Aunque esta torre tuviera dentro el DOBLE de tomos, no serían suficientes para mí. Mi colección no se acabará nunca, igual que nunca terminaré de copiar.\n\n¿Necesitas mi ayuda con algo?"
G["Were you bitten?"]="你被咬了？"
G["Were you counting on this whelp to stop us? Hah!"]="你指望靠这小崽子来阻止我们？哈！"
G["Were you even trying?!"]="何苦还要挣扎？！"
G["Were you ever a threat?"]="你们也敢来冒犯？"
G["Were you going to pay for that? Oh, it's for Aska! Take care, then."]="你准备付钱吗？哦，这是给阿丝卡的！那小心点拿。"
G["Were you looking to Reforge an item? I no longer provide such services.\nThe ethereals of \"Three Winds\" in Stormwind's Cathedral District will help you, though.\nAny of the city's guards can provide directions."]="¿Quieres reforjar un objeto? Ya no realizo esos servicios.\n\nCreo que los etéreos de \"Los Tres Vientos\" en el Distrito de la Catedral de Ventormenta podrán ayudarte.\n\nCualquier guardia de la ciudad te puede decir dónde encontrarlos."
G["Were you looking to Reforge an item? I no longer provide such services.\nThe ethereals of Orgrimmar's Drag will help you, though.\nAny of the city's guards can provide directions."]="¿Quieres reforjar un objeto? Ya no realizo esos servicios.\n\nCreo que los etéreos de La Calle Mayor de Orgrimmar podrán ayudarte.\n\nCualquier guardia de la ciudad te puede decir dónde encontrarlos."
G["Were you planning on using Toxitron's chemicals to damage the other constructs? Clever plan, let me ruin that for you."]="你打算使用剧毒金刚的化学能量摧毁其它魔像？聪明的计划。让我来帮你毁掉这个计划。"
G["Were you sent by Baron Sliver to get me out of this cage? Finally. Hurry up!"]="是斯利文男爵派你来救我的吗？总算盼来了救兵。快！"
G["Weren't we supposed to do something?"]="我们本来要干什么来着？"
G["Western Sewer Entrance"]="西部下水道入口"
G["Western Zeppelin Tower"]="西侧飞艇塔"
G["Westfall stew? I'll never forget this moment!"]="杂味炖肉？我永远都不会忘了这一刻！"
G["Wet fur not fun to sleep on."]="不擦干毛发就睡觉会不舒服。"
G["Wh- where am I...?  What a nightmare I have had....  But this is no time to reflect, I have much information to report!"]="我…我在哪…？这真是场可怕的恶梦…不过没时间细想了，还有很多事情在等着我汇报！"
G["Wh-what are you doing here?! G-go away!"]="你——你在这里干什么？！走——走开！"
G["Wh-what came over me?"]="我——我出什么事了？"
G["Wh-what happening!?!"]="出……出了什么事！？！"
G["Wh-what is that thing!!"]="那……那是什么东西！！"
G["Wh-what?! Well, I...\n\nIn this midst of such an exciting excavation, I'm not certain it would be appropriate to focus on such a thing.\n\nIt would make for a most troubling story, you know."]="什……什么？！嗯，我……\n\n正在展开的发掘工作是如此令人兴奋，现在却要把注意力集中在这种事情上，我想这可能不合适。\n\n你也知道，这只能是一个令人困扰的故事。"
G["Wh... what is happening? Why is the ritual affecting her?"]="发……发生什么了？为什么她会受到仪式的影响？"
G["Wh... what is that?!"]="那……那是什么？！"
G["Wh... what is this?"]="这……这是什么？"
G["Wha - Where  am I? Are you one of them?"]="哇——我这是在哪儿？你是和他们一伙的吗？"
G["Wha - what? Where am I? I've got to get out of here!"]="什——什么？我这是在哪儿？我得从这儿离开！"
G["Wha- Help! Help, Shokia! Riko!"]="什——救命！救命啊，夏琪亚！里克！"
G["Wha-?"]="什么——？"
G["Wha.. ungh..."]="啊……呃……"
G["Wha..."]="这…"
G["Wha... What has happened?"]="出……出什么事了？"
G["Wha... What is going on?  The last thing I remember was sitting down to eat..."]="出……出了什么事？我只记得自己要坐下吃东西……"
G["Wha... my roses?! Did Cailin tell you?  I really can't thank you enough. I thought I'd never smell home again..."]="什……我的玫瑰？！是凯林告诉你的吗？真不知该怎样感谢你。我还以为自己再也闻不到家乡的气息了……"
G["Wha... what's happening?"]="发……发生了什么事？"
G["Wha... where am I?"]="谁打扰了我的梦境？"
G["Wha... where am I?  So... weak.."]="我……我在哪儿？我……很虚弱……"
G["Wha... who... GET OUT OF MY DIGSITE!"]="是谁……离开我的发掘场！"
G["Wha? Huh? Oh, yes. The defenses..."]="啥？哈？哦，对，防御工事……"
G["Wha? What happened to me? WHO ARE YOU PEOPLE?"]="出……？出了什么事？你们是谁？"
G["Wha?!..."]="什么？！……"
G["Whaa.... What's happening?!?"]="出……出什么事了？！"
G["Whaaa? I can't believe he did that ta me!"]="什么？？难以置信，他怎么能这样！"
G["Whaaaa!!!!!"]="哇——！"
G["Whaaaa?"]="什么？"
G["Whack some gnolls! Step right up and whack some gnolls!"]="来打打豺狼人吧！快来打豺狼人吧！"
G["Whack-a-Gnoll is a fun-filled game of whacking... gnolls.\n\nIt's a new attraction, and quite popular among us... Well, Sayge isn't too fond of it."]="打豺狼人是一种打……豺狼人的有趣游戏。\n\n这是一个新的游乐设施，而且颇受我们大家的欢迎……好吧，其实塞格不太喜欢这玩意儿。"
G["Whack-a-Gnoll?"]="打豺狼人？"
G["Whaddaya mean Fish is a weird name, too? It ain't weird at all, buddy! I was named after dem fishes in the lake!\n\nNow just now what's a \"$n,\" eh? I ask ya that!"]="¿Qué quieres decir con que Pez también es un nombre raro? ¡No es nada raro, colega! ¡Me llamaron así por los peces del lago!\n\n¿Y acaso sabes qué es $gun:una; \"$n\", eh? ¡Qué me respondes a eso!"
G["Whaddaya mean, what's in it for you? What kind of question is that?\n\nIsn't the joy of fishing The Big One out of the sea enough? What about feeling the sun on your neck and the saltwater spray of the ocean on your face? What about opening a cold brew while sitting back with your friends?\n\nThat ain't enough?!?\n\nLet me tell you, the life of a $Gfisherman:fisherwoman; is rewarding beyond compare!\n\nYou can improve your fishing skill for starters. There are Craftsmen Tokens to be earned for helping out the locals. Gain enough skill, and you can purchase powerful fishing rods.\n\nWell-respected fishermen can get access to a special fish pet and a water strider mount. There's even a fishing raft, for crying out loud!"]="你问我你能从中得些什么好处，这么说是什么意思呢？那是个什么问题？\n\n难道从海里钓到大鱼还不够快乐吗？那么阳光照在你的脖子上，感觉怎么样呢？咸咸的海水飞洒到你的脸上，感觉怎么样呢？和朋友闲坐在一起，喝一杯冷啤感觉怎么样？\n\n这还不够吗？！？\n\n让我告诉你吧，$g渔夫:渔妇;的生活简直无与伦比！\n\n你可以从头学习提高钓鱼技能。帮助当地人可以获得一些工匠代币。获得足够的技能，你就可以购买功能强大的钓竿。\n\n倍受尊重的渔夫可以使用垂钓宠物和阔步者坐骑。这里竟然还有一个捕鱼木筏，我的天啊！"
G["Whaddaya mean, what's in it for you? What kind of question is that?\n\nIsn't the joy of fishing The Big One out of the sea enough? What about feeling the sun on your neck and the saltwater spray of the ocean on your face? What about opening a cold brew while sitting back with your friends?\n\nThat ain't enough?!?\n\nLet me tell you, your future life as a $Gfisherman:fisherwoman; will be rewarding beyond compare!\n\nYou can improve your fishing skill for starters. Gain enough skill, and you can purchase powerful fishing rods.\n\nWell-respected fishermen can get access to a special fish pet, a water strider mount, and even your own personal fishing raft!"]="你问我你能从中得些什么好处，这么说是什么意思呢？那是个什么问题？\n\n难道从海里钓到大鱼还不够快乐吗？那么阳光照在你的脖子上，感觉怎么样呢？咸咸的海水飞洒到你的脸上，感觉怎么样呢？和朋友闲坐在一起，喝一杯冷啤感觉怎么样？\n\n这还不够吗？！？\n\n让我告诉你吧，$g渔夫:渔妇;的生活简直无与伦比！\n\n你可以从头学习提高钓鱼技能。获得足够的技能，你就可以购买功能强大的钓竿。\n\n倍受尊重的渔夫可以获得特殊的鱼类宠物和水黾坐骑，甚至还有自己专用的捕鱼木筏！"
G["Whaddya need? Information? I got that too!"]="你想要什么？消息？这我也有！"
G["Whaddya want now?"]="你想知道什么？"
G["Whaddya want?"]="你想要什么？"
G["What $r dare harm those of my flock?"]="哪个$r竟敢伤害我的手下？"
G["What - WHAT!? What does he think he's DOING? The carriers are unprotected."]="什么……什么？！他以为他在干什么？运输船没有保护啦。"
G["What - wait - father!?"]="什么——等等——父亲！？"
G["What ... have you done..."]="你……做了些什么……"
G["What ... what is happening to me?"]="什么……我出了什么事？"
G["What ...hic?!"]="什么……嗝？！"
G["What Deathwing has set in motion... (...no man can stop.) No man! Least of all you wretches. (Show them. Show them their end!)"]="死亡之翼开始行动了……（……没人能够阻止。）没有人！尤其是你们这些可怜虫（让他们，让他们彻底完蛋！）"
G["What Guardian? I don't understand any of this."]="什么守护者？我不知道你在说些什么。"
G["What Hallow's End candy do you have for sale?"]="你这儿有哪些万圣节的糖果？"
G["What I did find, however, was the final resting place of the infamous \"Monkey King.\""]="Lo que sí encontramos fue el lugar de reposo del conocido \"Rey Mono\"."
G["What I do for the Argent Crusade now should only be viewed as fulfillment of an obligation. A payment, if you will. The Highlord freed me from the grasp of the Lich King and laid before us all the path to salvation. With that said, it must be understood that our methods differ - greatly. I and the Knights of the Ebon Blade will help the Argent Crusade lay their foundations within Icecrown and then we will part ways. The payment made in full.\n\nA different destiny awaits us."]="我为银色北伐军所做的一切只是为了履行义务。当然，也算是报恩吧。大领主让我摆脱了巫妖王的控制并为我们指明了救赎之路。我说过，我们做事的方式是有差异的——你必须明白这一点。我和黑锋骑士团会竭尽全力，帮助银色北伐军在冰冠冰川站稳脚跟。在那之后，我们就会离开。我希望能以这样的方式报答大领主的恩情。\n\n等待我们的，将是截然不同的命运。"
G["What I doin' wrong? Don't I get a lunch and two breaks a day, mon?"]="我做错了什么？一天连一顿午饭和两次休息都没有吗，老兄？"
G["What I not have in height I make up for in magics. I take care of Great Mist Stone good... most of time anyway.\n\nDumb puppy-men."]="我的个子不高，但是我会很厉害的魔法。我负责保护迷雾巨石……嗯，大多数时候我还是相当称职的。\n\n愚蠢的狗狗人。"
G["What I offer to you now is one such blade, unfired, unheated, untreated - the most raw and basic form.\n\nNow you merely need to find a dragon that will willingly enchant the blade.\n\nIf you had an eternity to live, this might be a possibility; but since you are mortal and could very likely cease to exist at any moment, might I recommend trying to persuade one of the lesser dragons to do your bidding."]="我能给你的只有这把未经烧制、未经加工的刀刃——最原始、最基本的形态。\n\n现在你只需去找一条愿意为这把刀附魔的龙。\n\n如果你能长生不老的话，或许这还有可能；但是你是凡人，随时都可能命丧黄泉，我建议你试着找体型较小的龙来帮你完成这把剑。"
G["What I smell?"]="这是什么味儿？"
G["What I want out of each and every one of you is a hard-target search of every refuelling station, residence, warehouse, farmhouse, henhouse, outhouse and doghouse in this area."]="你们要搜遍每个补给站，每个居民点，每一座仓库、农舍、鸡窝、厕所和狗屋。哪怕钻进地心也要把目标找出来！"
G["What I want to know is this: WHY DO YOU CARE IF I HAVE A BALL AND CHAIN SHACKLED TO MY ANKLE!?"]="我想知道的是——我脚上绑着铁球和锁链，这关你什么事？！"
G["What I wouldn't give for a fresh corpse to cannibalize.  Oops, did I say that out loud?"]="我可不是来给别人当午餐肉啃的。哎呀，我是不是说得太大声了？"
G["What I wouldn't give for a healing crystal right about now!"]="我情愿用任何东西交换一块治疗水晶！"
G["What I wouldn't give for one of my Buccaneer shredder suits right about now!"]="我现在最渴望的是立刻得到一台海盗队伐木机。"
G["What I wouldn't give for some explosives right about now."]="现在我还不打算进行爆破。"
G["What I wouldn't give to be out on the open plains on a day like this... but my duty binds me."]="我最喜欢在这样的日子里到开阔的大草原上去……但是，我的职责所在不容许我那样做。"
G["What I'm cooking up is way ahead of its time, $n.\n\nLook at these blueprints! It's like licking the future."]="Lo que estoy preparando se adelanta a nuestro tiempo, $n.\n\n¡Mira estos planos! Es como tocar el futuro."
G["What I've created here is an evolution! THIS is how the Forsaken will thrive, not through some magical winged fairy sprinkling happy dust on corpses!"]="我在这儿创造的一切叫做进化！这才是引领被遗忘者走向兴盛的正途，你以为往尸体上撒点亮闪闪的魔法粉尘就够了吗！"
G["What IS the Horde?"]="什么才是部落？"
G["What IS this place?"]="这是什么地方？"
G["What IS this place? Ugh, and that smell..."]="这是什么地方？呃，还有那股味道……"
G["What ISN'T there to do, you mean!\n\nEach of the innkeepers throughout the world are handing out trick-or-treat goodies, and many of the towns are decorated for the season!  Also, Sergeant Hartman in Southshore needs help against the Forsaken and their Wickerman Festival.\n\nOne more thing - I've heard that a sick little boy at the orphanage in Stormwind is looking for someone to help him gather treats for the holiday."]="怎么玩？！\n\n世界各地的旅店老板都会将糖果分发给孩子们，许多城镇都将装饰一新，欢度节日！此外，南海镇的哈特曼中士需要帮助，他想要攻击那些被遗忘者，破坏他们的稻草人庆典。\n\n对了，我听说暴风城孤儿院里有个生病的小男孩，他想找人陪他玩要糖果的恶作剧游戏……或许你能帮帮他？"
G["What ISN'T there to do, you mean!\n\nEach of the innkeepers throughout the world are handing out trick-or-treat goodies, and many of the towns are decorated for the season!  Also, there is the Wickerman Festival just outside the Undercity during the evenings."]="这是一场肆无忌惮的狂欢！\n\n世界各地的旅店老板都会为“不给糖就捣蛋”准备好各种糖果，许多城镇都将装饰一新，欢度节日！此外，幽暗城外还会在夜间举办稻草人庆典。"
G["What Sevine, Allistarj, and Grol did not realize was that just as their servants were bound to the land, so would they be... You see, the price for their own immortality was also imprisonment and eternal servitude under the command of Razelikh. The cruel cunning of Razelikh had emerged the victor once again."]="瑟温妮、奥利斯塔和戈洛尔都没有意识到，其实他们和那些奴仆一样，都被永远禁锢在这片土地上了。他们所获得的不朽之力其实就是要永远为拉瑟莱克卖命。狡猾的拉瑟莱克又一次获得了胜利。"
G["What WAS that thing?"]="那是什么东西？"
G["What a Brains shot!"]="漂亮的爆头射击！"
G["What a battle! Did you see that, Rhydian?!"]="多么激烈的战斗啊！你瞧见了吗，琳蒂安？！"
G["What a battle! Our fine combatants served up Chagan a heaping helping of Yaungolian barbeque..."]="多么激烈的战斗啊！ 我们的斗士干净利索地把查干剁成了一堆碎肉，我们可以准备野牛人烧烤了……"
G["What a beautiful land this is, wouldn't you say?"]="这片土地可真美啊，不是吗？"
G["What a beautiful shot!"]="射得漂亮！"
G["What a bloody waste this is!"]="哦……又要血流成河了！"
G["What a bunch of lunatics! You actually believe this stuff?"]="一群疯子！你们真的相信这东西吗？"
G["What a bunch of rabble!"]="真是一群乌合之众！"
G["What a coincidence... we were just talking about you, $n!"]="太巧了……我们刚提到你，$n！"
G["What a colossal waste of time."]="这简直是浪费时间。"
G["What a cruel end. Come, heroes. We must see if the gnome's story is true. If we can separate Arthas from Frostmourne, we might have a chance at stopping him."]="恶有恶报。来吧，英雄们。去看看那个侏儒说的是真是假。如果阿尔萨斯没了霜之哀伤，我们也许有机会阻止他。"
G["What a day for fishin'. They are sure to be bitin' today!"]="这种天气最适合钓鱼了！"
G["What a delightful specimen you have captured. I have been teaching it to not electrocute our servants. Though it is still a hatchling, and you have to expect such behavior when it is this young.\n\nThankfully the sunwalker over there has been quite helpful in healing those injured by such mischief.\n\nOh, and I took the liberty of giving your tiny creature a name."]="你捕捉到了一个非常可喜的标本。我一直在教它不要电击我们的雇员。但它还是个小宝宝，这种行为在幼年期是无法避免的。\n\n多亏了那边的烈日行者帮忙，恶作剧的受害者们都得到了妥善的治疗。\n\n噢，我还冒昧地给你的小家伙起了一个名字。"
G["What a disaster!\n\nWhat could have done this?!"]="真是灾难！\n\n会是什么人干的？！"
G["What a fascinating jawline you have. And such coloration. Where did you come from?"]="你下巴的轮廓真迷人。衣着又如此鲜艳。你是打哪儿来的？"
G["What a festive event."]="多么欢乐的活动啊。"
G["What a fight you missed, Dorian! It was one for the ages!"]="多里安，你错过了一场惊心动魄的战斗！真是难忘的经历啊！"
G["What a fight! If ye ever decide that yer done with the battlin' game, maybe you could join me crew!"]="打得漂亮！要是你什么时候决定不再玩战斗游戏了，也许可以加入我的队伍！"
G["What a fine day! It inspires me to create a new design."]="多好的天气！它让我有了创造新设计的灵感。"
G["What a fine ssspecimen you are."]="你会成为一个好劳工的。"
G["What a gloriously bloody battle! Our three heroes showed Kobo that the Arena of Annihilation isn't just monkey business."]="多么血腥而激烈的战斗啊！我们的三位英雄向科博证明了一件事情：破军比武场可不是闹着玩的儿戏。"
G["What a good kitty you are."]="你是一只很好的小猫。"
G["What a good looking crowd. The dwarven women even shaved."]="这群人看上去不错。连女矮人都刮了胡子。"
G["What a landmark discovery! The Royal Apothecary Society has spent years working to break the secrets of the Lich King's plague, and I've finally done it!\n\nDespite this turning point in history, there is still so much to discover. I have more experiments to conduct... test subjects to acquire...\n\nAt least I don't have to worry about Scourge necropoli. The Alliance is dealing with that problem. This leaves me plenty of time to delve into the secrets of the plague and uncover what I can."]="这简直是里程碑式的胜利！皇家炼金师协会花费了数年时间来破解巫妖王诅咒的秘密，现在总算取得了突破！\n\n虽然实验的成功堪称历史的转折点，但是还有很多东西有待研究。我要做更多的实验……挑选更多的样本……\n\n至少我不用担心浮空城。联盟会解决那个玩意儿的。这样我就有足够的时间来研究，揭示其中的奥妙。"
G["What a lovely abomination you're going to be."]="你将成为一只可爱的憎恶。"
G["What a mess! How am I going to spin this?\n\nAnd really... goblin zombies?!!"]="真是一团糟！我该怎么旋转这个？\n\n这是真的吗？僵尸地精？！！"
G["What a mess! We come back from saving Deepholm and what do we find?\n\nThe Twilight's Stinkin' Hammer!\n\nGood thing you're here to straighten this all out!"]="真是一团乱！我们刚刚从拯救深岩之洲的战斗中回来，却看到了这种场面？\n\n可憎的暮光之锤！\n\n幸好你在这里，把他们解决掉了！"
G["What a pathetic display."]="哼，可悲的花招。"
G["What a pathetic lock! Godfrey is going to have to try harder than this if he wants to defeat us."]="就这把烂锁？真可笑！想要打败我们，高弗雷可得再争气点才行啊。"
G["What a pitiful choice of an ally, Crok!"]="怎么选这种低能的盟友，科罗克！"
G["What a pitiful creature. And the thing you just killed."]="多么可悲的生物。直接消灭掉算了。"
G["What a pitiful defense. Is this the best you can do?"]="多脆弱的防守啊。你们就这点本事？"
G["What a pity you survived the crash just to die here."]="真可惜，你在坠毁中生还，却要死在这里。"
G["What a pleasure it is to have the great $n in my establishment!"]="¡Es todo un placer tener de nuevo $gal:a la; gran $n en mi establecimiento!"
G["What a pleasure, $c.\n\nWe get so few visitors these days."]="看到你真高兴，$c。\n\n我们最近少有访客。"
G["What a puny plan."]="真是个可怜的计划。"
G["What a robust subject we have. Once more, then..."]="实验体的生命力还真是顽强啊。加大剂量……"
G["What a rush!"]="真快呀！"
G["What a shame... but not a concern for an old exile like Zanzil."]="真是遗憾……可对于像赞吉尔这样的老牌流亡者来说算不了什么。"
G["What a show!"]="真了不起！"
G["What a silly question! Clearly, $n, I've overestimated you.\n\nIt should be apparent to you that someone needs to stay focused on the big picture here. Being the only one remotely qualified, alas, that burden falls to me.\n\nIn truth, I envy you, $c. I would much rather be the one to enter Zul'Aman and cleanse it of those savages. You should consider yourself lucky...."]="愚蠢的问题！$n，看来我高估了你。\n\n你应该清楚，必须有人主持大局。我是唯一合格的人选，这副重担只能由我来挑。\n\n$c，说实话，我很羡慕你。我多想亲自深入祖阿曼，铲除那些野蛮的巨魔。你应该感到幸运才是……"
G["What a silly question! I'll give you a hint. My favorite food has my name in it! Maybe more than once!"]="多傻的问题啊！我给你个提示吧。我最喜爱的食物里有我的名字！或许还不止一个哦！"
G["What a story! So she went into Hive'Regal and that was the last you saw of her?"]="真是一个有意思的故事！那么说来她进入了雷戈虫巢，然后这就是你最后一次见到她了？"
G["What a strange and curious creature. Do you come to my town with peaceful intentions?"]="真是个陌生又古怪的生物。你是带着和平的意图到我村子里来的吗？"
G["What a surprise!\n\nWe weren't expecting anyone today..."]="真意外！\n\n我们以为不会有人来……"
G["What a waste of time."]="真是浪费时间。"
G["What a waste."]="真是浪费。"
G["What a wonderful day for some training in the mystical arts. Wouldn't you agree, $g Mr. : Ms.; $n?"]="这正是个传授神秘技艺的好日子。你是不是也这样想，$n$g先生:女士;？"
G["What a wonderful day to be alive! Look at the beauty that surrounds you, friend. Enjoy what life has to give!"]="¡Qué día tan maravilloso para estar viva! Mira la belleza que te rodea, $gamigo:amiga;. ¡Disfruta de todo lo que la vida nos puede ofrecer!"
G["What a wonderful display of technique!"]="真是战技卓绝啊！"
G["What abilities do amber drakes have?"]="琥珀幼龙有什么能力？"
G["What abilities do emerald drakes have?"]="翡翠幼龙有什么能力？"
G["What abilities do ruby drakes have?"]="红玉幼龙有什么能力？"
G["What about Hellscream? What does the Horde mean to him?"]="地狱咆哮呢？部落对他来说意味着什么？"
G["What about it?"]="是什么？"
G["What about the Twilight dragons?  There will be more where those came from."]="那些暮光巨龙呢？从源头还会涌来更多。"
G["What about the Winterfall furbolg?"]="冬泉熊怪怎么样？"
G["What about the earth spirits?"]="那大地之灵呢？"
G["What about the plated proto-drake and the fire giant that were spotted nearby? Think your mages can handle those?"]="那附近的装甲始祖龙和火焰巨人怎么办？肯瑞托的法师们能对付得了吗？"
G["What about this one, McBride? Surely this $c could join the cause!"]="¿Y qué pasa con $geste:esta;, McBride? ¡Seguro que $geste:esta; $c puede unirse a la causa!"
G["What about you, Belmont? How will you get back?"]="你呢，贝尔蒙特？你要怎样回去？"
G["What about you, cultist?  Do you know how to fly?"]="你呢，邪教徒？你会飞吗？"
G["What about you?"]="那么你呢？"
G["What about you?  Are you ready to be Ironhide's next chew toy, or are you ready to talk?  I'll let you think about it for a while."]="轮到你了。你愿意被铁皮一口吞掉呢？还是打算开口说点什么？我让你考虑一会儿吧。"
G["What about... putting soap on a fork? Then it would have a handle and everything!"]="不如……在叉子上擦点肥皂？这样就万事俱备啦！"
G["What about... putting soap on an axe? Then it would have a handle and everything!"]="不如……在斧头上擦点肥皂？这样就万事俱备啦！"
G["What aggravation is this? You will die!"]="太过分了！你们死定了！"
G["What ails you Shen-zin Su?  What can we do?"]="您怎么了，神真子？我们该怎么做？"
G["What am I doing out here? I've got work to do!"]="我在这儿干什么？我还有工作要做！"
G["What am I doing?  Do you lack vision?  I am a dreamer, good $g sir : lady;, and I dream of a better future for us all.  Clearly, I am a visionary.\n\nThere are those, however, who seek to keep us mired in banality.  I told him that I was a dreamer, and Arch Druid Staghelm replied, \"Well, the world needs ditch diggers too.\"\n\nUntil such time as the shackles of banality are ripped from us, I will help the Cenarion Circle by shuffling these piles of dirt around."]="¿Qué estoy haciendo? ¿No tienes vista? Soy un soñador, $gseñor:señora;, y sueño con un futuro mejor para todos. Está claro que soy vidente.\n\nNo obstante, algunos quieren mantenernos sumidos en un mundo banal. Yo le dije que era un soñador y archidruida Corzocelada contestó: \"Bueno, el mundo también necesita cavadores de zanjas.\"\n\nHasta entonces, cuando nos hayamos librado de los grilletes de la banalidad, ayudaré al Círculo Cenarion a sacar estas pilas de basura de aquí.\""
G["What am I doing? Why do I..."]="我在干什么？我为什么……"
G["What am I going to do?"]="我要去干什么来着？"
G["What am I grabbing again?"]="我还能怎么办呢？"
G["What am I missing..."]="我错过了什么……"
G["What am I paying you for? The kodos are nearly dead!"]="我付钱给你是为了什么？科多兽就快死了！"
G["What am I supposed to do until then? I've got no men! We don't know where the Horde are, or how many we're dealing with!"]="那我怎么办？我没有人手！我们不知道部落在哪儿，也不知道要对付多少敌人！"
G["What am I supposed to do without tools, Gorge!"]="格尔基，没有工具我怎么干活！"
G["What am I thinking?! I haven't trained on this piece of equipment! AAAAH!"]="我在想什么呢？我没练习过这种装备！啊哈！！"
G["What am I to do?  My precious mine..."]="我能做点什么？我的矿洞啊……"
G["What an impressive display of alluring prospects!"]="多么迷人的容貌啊！"
G["What an interesting door."]="这门真有意思。"
G["What an odd demand. Not even my own kind care about our origins. Why should you?"]="多么奇怪的要求。即使是我的同类都很少关心我们的起源。你为什么想知道？"
G["What an odd outcome."]="这结果真奇怪。"
G["What an unexpected sssurprise."]="真是个意外的惊喜。"
G["What an unlikely spot for my shield to be, irregardless, now we fight!"]="没想到我的盾牌竟然在这儿，无所谓了，战斗吧！"
G["What an... explosive ending!"]="多么……爆炸性的结局啊！"
G["What are Ethereum?"]="什么是复仇军？"
G["What are Synthebrew Goggles?"]="什么是合成酿酒护目镜？"
G["What are YOU doing here?\n\nJust make sure that you stay out of my way. I didn't leave the Scarlet Onslaught to be distracted by the likes of you!"]="你在这儿干什么？\n\n别挡我的路。我不会让你这种人干扰血色先锋军的！"
G["What are all these Forsaken doing here?"]="被遗忘者在这里干什么？"
G["What are love tokens?"]="爱情信物是什么？"
G["What are people saying about me?"]="人们会怎么说我？"
G["What are the Kor'kron?"]="库卡隆是什么？"
G["What are the Paragons of Power?"]="权力珍宝是什么？"
G["What are the Plates of Uldum?"]="什么是奥丹姆圆盘？"
G["What are the Wardens? We are the hum of a spinning blade in the moment before death."]="守望者是什么人？我们是播撒死亡的旋刃。"
G["What are the Wardens? We are the precision slice of a killing blow."]="守望者是什么人？我们是精密的杀戮机器。"
G["What are the Wardens? We are the silence in the shadows."]="守望者是什么人？我们是无声的暗影。"
G["What are the anomalies you speak of?"]="你所说的变化是什么？"
G["What are the cannon balls for?  Do they let you carry one?"]="那些炮弹有什么用？他们会让你带一个吗？"
G["What are the chances of obtaining such a hide?"]="我如何才能获得比斯巨兽的皮呢？"
G["What are the components?"]="我需要些什么？"
G["What are the requirements to enter the Celestial Tournament?"]="参加天神比武大会有什么要求？"
G["What are the seas like where you come from?"]="你们那的大海是什么样的？"
G["What are the stones of binding?"]="禁锢之石是什么？"
G["What are these strange creatures?"]="这些奇怪的生物是什么？"
G["What are these suspicious papers? Guard, take this citizen into custody."]="这些可疑的文件是什么？卫兵，监押这个人。"
G["What are these things that you have summoned to serve you?!  Just who do you think you are!"]="你召唤了什么东西来协助你？你以为你是谁？！"
G["What are these things?!"]="这些家伙是谁？！"
G["What are they called, anyways? Silkers? Silksters? Worm-butt squeezers?"]="他们到底叫什么来着？丝工？缫丝工？虫屁股挤压工？"
G["What are they digging up? I've never seen mogu use tools and weapons like those before."]="他们在挖什么？在这之前我从没见过魔古族使用这样的工具和武器。"
G["What are they going to do with it?"]="他们会怎么处置它？"
