G["What are ye daft? That's not a weapon, that's a dinner knife. I don't train amateurs."]="¿Eres $gtonto:tonta;? Eso no es un arma, es un cuchillo de cocina. No instruyo a principiantes."
G["What are ye doin' here?! Get yer chatty self ta Alterac Vallery, where ye're needed!"]="你在这里干什么？！去奥特兰克山谷吧，那里需要你！"
G["What are you afraid of?"]="你在害怕什么？"
G["What are you after, Bloodknight? Speak or the brutes will punish you."]="你的目的是什么，血骑士？快说，否则你可要受皮肉之苦了。"
G["What are you after? Speak up."]="你在找什么？说出来。"
G["What are you after? Speak up. I'm not about to trust you with one of my Elekks until you prove your dedication and friendship to our people."]="你想要什么？说出来，在你可以证明你的贡献和与你和我们的友谊之前，我不准备雷象卖给你。"
G["What are you asking me for? I just schlepp boxes!"]="你要问我什么？我是个只会干活的傻瓜！"
G["What are you attacking him for? The dangerous one is over there!"]="你打这个家伙干什么？真正危险的人在那儿，傻子！"
G["What are you doing all the way back here? You need to get back to Stratholme immediately!\n\nShall I teleport you to Stratholme?"]="¿Qué haces aquí? ¡Tienes que volver a Stratholme inmediatamente!\n\n¿Te teletransporto a Stratholme?"
G["What are you doing back here? Slumming?"]="你在这儿干什么？鬼混？"
G["What are you doing here anyway?  Come all the way down here to bask in my marvelous company?"]="那你在这干什么呢？大老远跑下来，就为了享有我的陪伴？"
G["What are you doing here!?"]="¡¿Qué haces tú aquí?!"
G["What are you doing here, $r?"]="你在这里干什么，$r？"
G["What are you doing here, Chen Stormstout?"]="你在这里做什么，陈·风暴烈酒？"
G["What are you doing here?"]="你在这里干什么？"
G["What are you doing here?\n\nArthas is at the entrance to Stratholme right now and you should be with him! Go!"]="¿Qué haces aquí?\n\n¡Arthas está en la entrada de Stratholme ahora mismo y tú deberías estar con él! ¡Vamos!"
