G["What can I say, $c? You're a true $g hero : heroine;! Not only have you personally saved many of my rangers, but you've dealt a decisive blow against the Shadowpine trolls. Are you sure that you don't want to stay here and be one of my Farstriders?\n\nFare well, $n."]="¿Qué puedo decir, $c? ¡Eres $gun auténtico héroe:una auténtica heroína:c;! No solo has salvado personalmente a muchos de mis forestales, sino que has asestado un golpe decisivo contra los trols Sombrapino. ¿Seguro que no quieres quedarte y ser uno de mis Errantes?\n\nAdiós, $n."
G["What can I say, $n?  Yer the finest o' the Sha'tari Skyguard!\n\nJust don't be lettin' that go ta yer head.  I can still teach ya a thing or two, $g lad : lass;!\n\n<Sky Commander Keller grins at you and winks.>"]="¿Qué puedo decir, $n? ¡Eres lo mejor de la Guardia del cielo Sha’tari!\n\nPero no dejes que se te suba a la cabeza. ¡Todavía puedo enseñarte un par de cosas $gchico:chica;!\n\n<El comandante del cielo Keller sonríe y te guiña un ojo.>"
G["What can Jaluu do you for today?"]="贾鲁今天能为你做些什么？"
G["What can Korg do for you today?"]="库尔格能为你做些什么呢？"
G["What can a guy like me be doin' for a $r like you at a time like this?"]="¿Qué puede hacer un tipo como yo por $gun:una; $r como tú en un momento como este?"
G["What can be done? I have tried many different things. I have done my best to help the people of Nagrand. Each time I have approached Garrosh, he has dismissed me."]="那怎么办？我已经试过很多办法了。我尽全力来帮助纳格兰的人民，但是每次我想接近加尔鲁什，他总是避开我。"
G["What can change the nature of a man?"]="什么能改变一个人的本性？"
G["What can other weapon masters teach?"]="其他的武器大师能教给我什么呢？"
G["What can possibly redeem this unholy place? Thank you."]="拯救这个邪恶之地非你莫属，谢谢你。"
G["What can these siege engines do?"]="这些攻城器械有什么用处？"
G["What can this insignificant servant do for you, $n? Training perhaps?"]="我这个无足轻重的仆人能为你做什么，$n？需要训练吗？"
G["What can we do to assist you?"]="我们有什么可以帮你的吗？"
G["What can we get for you, our exalted $G brother:sister;?"]="我们能为你做些什么吗，尊贵的$G兄弟:姐妹;？"
G["What can we say, $n?  $G Dude : Dudette;, anything that we have in the store is yours to purchase!\n\nRight on!"]="¿Qué podemos decir, $n? $GTío:tía;, puedes comprar cualquier cosa que tengamos en la tienda.\n\n¡Adelante!"
G["What can you do to me that Kel'Thuzad has not? That the Lich King will not?"]="你能把我怎么样？你莫非比克尔苏加德更残忍？比巫妖王更厉害？"
G["What can you hope to do against the might of the swarm?"]="你打算如何与虫群之力抗衡？"
