G["What can you tell me about the bear - Ursangous?"]="你能告诉我关于那只熊——乌萨苟斯的情况吗？"
G["What can you tell me about the hippogryph - Sharptalon?"]="你能告诉我关于角鹰兽尖爪的情况吗？"
