G["What cause do the Dark Irons have for taking up arms against Ironforge? Are you unable to control your own people, Moira?"]="黑铁矮人有什么理由对铁炉堡兵戎相见？你连自己的人都管不住了吗，茉艾拉？"
G["What corruption?"]="什么腐蚀？"
G["What could I have done to give the gods cause to lash out at me with such ferocity? All that I cherished is gone - dead or destroyed. My family taken from me by the brutes of the forest. My home razed. My ship sunk.\n\nI am a broken man, stranded on a broken island.\n\nPerhaps you are you here to finish the job? Make it quick, I will not resist. Take my life, stranger; I am too cowardly to do it myself. My hand shivers... the blade will not strike true."]="¿Qué puedo haber hecho para dar a los dioses motivos para arremeter contra mí con tal ferocidad? Todo lo que quería ha desaparecido – muerto o ha sido destruido. Mi familia, arrebatada por las bestias del bosque. Mi hogar, arrasado. Mi nave, hundida.\n\nSoy un hombre roto, perdido en una isla rota.\n\n¿Quizás estás aquí para terminar el trabajo? Hazlo rápido, no opondré resistencia. Toma mi vida, $gextranjero:extranjera;; soy demasiado cobarde como para hacerlo yo mismo. Mi mano tiembla... el filo no será certero."
G["What could an orc as depraved as you enjoy more than killing Alliance, Utvoch?"]="对像你这样堕落的兽人来说，还有什么是比杀联盟更美妙的呢，乌图克？"
G["What could be better than servin' da bear spirit for eternity? Come closer now. Bring your souls to me!"]="还有什么能比永久侍奉熊之圣魂更好呢？来呀，将你们的灵魂交给我！"
G["What could be holding you back? You're hale, hearty... missing an eye perhaps, but that shouldn't keep you from competing!"]="你为什么退缩了？你这么矍铄、健壮……当然，你少了一只眼睛，但这绝不能让你临阵退缩！"
G["What could be taking so long?"]="什么事情让你花了这么长的时间？"
G["What could be worse than death?"]="有什么比死亡还要痛苦？"
G["What could create such a thing?"]="这是什么造成的？"
G["What could it mean? I can see a lot of turmoil in your heart, my new friend."]="这意味着什么？我听到了你心中的忐忑，我的新朋友。"
G["What could this tome be hiding?"]="这本魔典到底隐藏着什么秘密？"
G["What could you be selling?"]="你都卖些什么？"
G["What could you hope to accomplish? To storm brazenly into my domain... to employ magic... against ME?"]="你们以为自己能做些什么呢？自大地在我的领域横冲直撞，用毁灭性的魔法来对付……我？"
G["What could you possibly need a bank for?  Very well, you'll need to go through the Ruins of Lordaeron to the south of Brill.  In the back are a set of elevators leading down into the Undercity.  When you get there stop any of those lumbering Abominations they like to call an Undercity Guardian and ask it for better directions."]="你需要银行做什么？好吧，你得穿越布瑞尔南部的洛丹伦废墟，乘坐升降梯到达幽暗城。当你到达那儿后，询问自称为幽暗城守卫的行动缓慢的憎恶，请求它给予更详细的指示。"
G["What coward dares attack my young while I'm away?  I will feed your entrails to my brood!"]="什么懦夫竟敢在我不在时攻击我的孩子？我要把你的内脏挖出来喂它们吃！"
