G["What did ye say, Sally?! The only one of us who resembles a gnome is you - after I'm done cuttin' you into wee pieces!"]="你说什么，萨莉？！我们之中像侏儒的只有你——等我把你砍成碎块之后，你就更像了！"
G["What did you do before you came to Northrend, then?"]="来诺森德之前，你是做什么的？"
