G["What is it you seek, $r?  Knowledge?  Money?  Honor?\n\nFor me, it has always been further enlightenment in the arcane arts.  My quest for knowledge has taken me around Azeroth countless times, and each time I learn something new about the magic this world has to offer.\n\nJust kidding!  I'm in it for the money."]="你在找寻什么，$r？知识？金钱？还是荣耀？\n\n对我而言，我总是希望能够进一步洞悉奥法艺术的真义。我对知识的渴求，已驱使我无数次地环游艾泽拉斯，而每一次我都会对这个世界上所蕴藏的神秘魔法有新的了解。\n\n逗你玩呢！其实我就是为了钱。"
G["What is it you seek?"]="你在找什么？"
