G["What is it, $c? The Horde is done with all collections, and final preparations are being made while the Alliance tries to catch up in their efforts. Is there anything else that you need?"]="怎么了，$c？部落已经完成了所有的收集工作，在等到联盟完成他们的收集任务时，我们可以进行最后的准备工作。你还需要什么吗？"
G["What is it, $r? Have you gathered some new information?"]="怎么样了，$r？你有什么新的消息吗？"
