G["What is reforging?"]="什么是重铸？"
G["What is she saying?"]="她在说什么？"
G["What is steel compared to the hand that shapes it?"]="和钢铁比起来，铸钢者的双手是不是更厉害呢？"
G["What is taking so long?"]="怎么这么久？"
G["What is that $r doing here!?"]="那个$r在这里干什么？"
G["What is that bauble you carry?"]="你拿的是什么玩意儿？"
G["What is that poor orc yelling about? Someone should see what is going on."]="那些可怜的兽人在叫喊什么？谁去看看怎么回事？"
G["What is that smell? What is that smell?! Is that you Griftah? How can you have that smell? This is most offensive. Most offensive, yes."]="那是什么味道？那是什么味道？！是你吗，格里伏塔？你怎么搞得那么臭？这真是太讨厌了。没错，最讨厌了。"
