G["What is the Brotherhood of the Light?  Well... We are all members of the Argent Crusade at the core - members of the Argent Crusade that aren't held in check by morals, guilt and useless human emotion."]="什么是圣光兄弟会？好吧……从本质上说，我们都是银色北伐军的核心成员——一群不受道德、内疚这类毫无用处的人类感情所限制的人。"
G["What is the Sky Race? Why, only the greatest test of a Serpent Rider's skill!"]="什么是飞行竞技赛？那当然是最能展现翔龙骑士技巧的一场大赛啦！"
