G["What is the status on new recruits, Marshal? We desperately need more soldiers. The Blackrock orcs invading our territory must be stopped!"]="新兵招募有何进展，统帅？我们迫切需要新兵增援。必须阻止黑石兽人对我们领土的入侵！"
G["What is the ultimate ability of the Ruby Drake?"]="红玉幼龙的终极技能是什么？"
