G["What is there to do on Hallow's End?"]="在万圣节，我们要怎么玩？"
G["What is there to report of these beasts, Gurrok? How do we defeat them?"]="那该怎么解决这些怪物呢，古罗克？我们该如何击败他们？"
G["What is there to tell? They're spiders. Just slightly more... flame-oriented than the spiders you and I are used to.\n\nThey bite, they spin webs, they spit burning venom, and they capture some of my best friends in cocoons of searing silk. Horrible little things."]="有什么好说的呢？它们不过是一群蜘蛛。只是比我们过去见过的蜘蛛更加……亲和火元素。\n\n它们能咬人，能结网，能喷吐炽热的毒液，还把我最好的几个朋友困在了灼热的蛛丝茧里。可怕的小东西。"
G["What is this \"sha\"? Where did it come from?"]="\"¿Qué es ese \"sha\"? ¿De dónde viene?"
G["What is this dark magic?"]="这是什么黑暗魔法？"
G["What is this disturbance? You dare trespass upon this hallowed ground? This shall be your final resting place!"]="是谁在打扰我？你们竟敢擅闯这神圣的地方？这里将会是你们的埋骨之地！"
