G["What is this, an interrogation?  You're not one of Fordring's internal affairs guys, are you?\n\nWell, I've got nothing to hide.  Let me look over my records.  Last week I sold a ball gown to Lieutenant Myner, which struck me as odd.  What else... Magus Bisp bought several dozen leather jerkins, which he couldn't give a reason for.  Oh, and Friar Burlingham came by to stock up on swimwear for his trip to Hardwrench Hideaway.  That's about it.\n\nNow if you don't mind, I have customers!"]="这算什么，审问吗？你不是弗丁的内部事务处理人员吧？\n\n嗯，反正我也没什么可隐瞒的。让我翻翻我的记录。上星期米纳尔中尉从我这儿买了件舞会礼服，这让我感到有些奇怪。还有……魔导师毕斯普买了几件皮上衣，也没说出什么原因。喔，弗拉尔·伯林汉姆来为他的硬钳避世乐园之旅订购泳衣。就这些。\n\n要是你不介意的话，我得招呼客人了！"
G["What is this, more have come to claim my crown? They are small and weak."]="怎么，又有人想来抢我的王冠了？一群软弱的小爬虫。"
