G["What is this? <Gurgle> <Snort> The $r has come? To challenge mighty Sabersnout <Snort>?"]="¿Qué ocurre? <Barboteo> <Bufido> ¿$gEl:La; $r ha venido? ¿Para desafiar al poderoso Hozasable <Bufido>?"
G["What is this? A lowly gnome? I will do better, oh great one."]="这是什么？一个卑微的侏儒？我下次会做得更好的，主人。"
G["What is this? Another uprising?"]="怎么了？又暴动了？"
G["What is this? Champions... I sense the hand of the Dark One. Truly this sacred event bears his blessing."]="你们是……来帮助我的？我感觉到了黑暗之王的力量。看来这个伟大的时刻已经得到了他的赐福。"
G["What is this? Did Keever ask for a sheep? Keever wanted a weapon of great power and all he got was this sheep. Keever is very disappointed."]="这是什么？基佛要的是一只绵羊？基佛想要一件强力的武器，但他现在得到的就是这只绵羊。基佛非常失望。"
G["What is this? FAKE! Splithoof, $n and the gnomes have tried to fool us. Kill $g him : her;!"]="这是什么？假的！裂蹄，$n还有那群侏儒想要耍我们。给我杀了$g他:她;！"
G["What is this? FAKE! Splithoof, $n and the goblins have tried to fool us. Kill $g him : her;!"]="这是什么？假的！裂蹄，$n还有那群地精想要耍我们。给我杀了$g他:她;！"
G["What is this? I have done nothing!"]="这是什么？我什么都没做！"
G["What is this? I recognize you from when I killed Akali. You must be this $n that everyone is dreading."]="这是什么？我杀死阿卡里时就认出你了。你是$n，他们都很惧怕你。"
G["What is this? I told you I wanted stepped threads on the interrupted breechblock! We're going to have to re-engineer the whole loading mechanism!"]="这是什么？我告诉过你，我要把螺纹压在阻断螺栓上！我们现在只能重新制作整个装载系统了！"
G["What is this? I've heard nothing of this emperor. Meng the Demented? According to these texts, Meng was the most foul and maniacal ruler to ever abuse the imperial throne."]="这是什么？我还不曾听闻这个帝王。暴虐疯王蒙恩？根据这段描述，蒙恩是迄今为止最邪恶、最疯狂的暴君。"
G["What is this? Mok-thorin ka! Kill them!"]="这是怎么回事？Mok-thorin ka！杀了他们！"
G["What is this? Tastes kinda... urrrrrgh... I'm gonna lay back down now."]="这是什么？吃上去感觉……我现在得躺一会儿。"
G["What is this? What do they want? To punish us? No, no..."]="这是什么？他们想干什么？惩罚我们？不，不……"
G["What is this? Where am I? How... How did I... Cursed ethereals! I was on an escort mission out of Shattrath when we were ambushed! I must return to the city at once! Your name will be recorded as a friend of the Lower City, $n."]="这是什么？我在哪里？怎么回事……我怎么……该死的虚灵！我在沙塔斯城外执行护卫任务的时候遭到了伏击！现在，我必须马上回到城市里去！你的名字一定会被贫民窟的居民铭记的，$n。"
G["What is this? You must forgive me, but I was not expecting company. As you can see, we are somewhat preoccupied right now. But no matter. As I am a gracious host, I will tend to you... personally."]="这是怎么回事？请原谅，但是我没有料到会有人来拜访。正如你们看到的，我们现在有别的事情要忙。不过没关系，作为一个热情的主人，我会用自己的方式招待你们……"
G["What is this? You trying to ruin my reputation? I don't teach novices, $gbuddy:lady;. Go talk to Milla Fairancora in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus."]="什么？你试图毁坏我的名声？我不教新手的，$g老兄:女士;。去找达纳苏斯工匠区的米拉·法拉科纳谈谈。"
G["What is this? You trying to ruin my reputation? I don't teach novices, $gbuddy:lady;. Try talking to the orc Whuut in the Drag of Orgrimmar. He's a lot closer to your level of skill. And brains."]="这是什么？你试图毁坏我的名声？我不教新手的，$g老兄:女士;。试试找奥格瑞玛暗巷区的兽人伍特谈谈。他很接近你的技术水平。还有智力水平。"
G["What is this?!"]="这是什么？！"
