G["What is up, my primary $gmale:female; sibling?  Are you ready to appear visually attractive to your species?"]="¿Qué tal, pariente $gmasculino:femenino; primario? ¿Estás $glisto:lista; para mejorar tu atractivo visual ante otros miembros de tu especie?"
G["What is war, but the preservation of life? Just as the seed struggles to push out of the soil, so do we fight for our own existence."]="除了挣扎求生，战争还有什么其他意义呢？就像种子要努力破土发芽一样，我们也要为自己的生存而战。"
