G["What was that? And what the heck is that smell?"]="那是什么？那见鬼的味道又是什么？"
G["What was that? Did you hear something?"]="那是什么？你听到什么了吗？"
G["What was that? Did you leave that flare lit?!"]="什么？你把照明弹留在那里了？！"
G["What was that? I sense an intruder. Find and kill them!"]="那是什么？我能感受到入侵者的气息。将他们揪出来杀掉！"
G["What was that? Oh no, the Dragonmaw are here!"]="那是什么？喔不，龙喉来了！"
G["What was that? Sea giant? Better safe than sorry. Fire!"]="那是什么？海巨人？为了保险起见，开火！"
G["What was that?! Trey? TREY!?"]="那是什么？！特雷? 特雷!?"
G["What was the darkness that corrupted you?"]="那腐蚀你的黑暗到底是什么？"
G["What was the vision?"]="什么幻像？"
G["What was this decision?"]="是什么决定？"
G["What was your commander thinking? Taking your caravan through our sacred burial grounds!"]="你的指挥官在想什么呢？居然带领商队穿越我们神圣的墓地！"
G["What was your old job?"]="你的旧业是什么？"
G["What we do know is that Crushcog is using an advanced mechano-tank prototype and his irradiated gnomes are trying to repair more at the old arsenal."]="据我们所知，碎轮正在使用一种先进的步行坦克原型，而他手下那些被辐射的侏儒们正在破旧的兵工厂里奋力修复更多同类坦克。"
G["What we doing here again? Dajik can't remember."]="我们是来干什么？达伊克又忘记啦。"
G["What we fire from this thing, anyway?"]="对了，我们要用这东西发射什么？"
G["What we gon' do now, you ask?  We wait."]="你问我们要干什么？我们在等待。"
G["What we need is some sort of protein-based population control. Perhaps we should have thought of that before coming here."]="我们需要某种蛋白质的种群控制药物。或许我们应该在来这里之前就考虑好这个问题。"
G["What we saw explains what happened in the Dead Mire.  There was a lake here once.  If we don't stop the naga, all of the marsh will soon look like this!"]="我们看到的一切都说明了在死亡泥潭曾经发生过什么，那里曾经是一片湖泊。如果我们不阻止纳迦的行动，整个沼泽很快就会变成那个样子！"
G["What weapon in particular interests you?"]="你对哪种武器感兴趣？"
G["What weapon were ye lookin' to learn?"]="你想要学习哪种武器技能？"
G["What weeds?"]="什么草？"
G["What went wrong?"]="发生了什么事？"
G["What were the mogu sent here to guard? Or destroy? We are missing the final puzzle pieces, and YOU will help me find them!"]="魔古族被派来守护什么？或是摧毁什么？我们还缺少关键线索，你得帮我找到它！"
G["What were the trolls after?"]="那些巨魔在找什么？"
G["What were those Alliance ships doing firing at us?! Did I see a Horde ship, too?"]="这些联盟船干嘛要向我们开火？！我好像又看见了一艘部落船？"
G["What were those trolls after? We are just a simple fishing village."]="那些巨魔们想干什么？这只是个简单的小渔村。"
G["What were we on?  'D'?"]="呃……到哪个字了？“短”？"
G["What were you and the others doing inside the city?"]="你们在这座城市里做些什么？"
G["What were you before you were druids, then?"]="那么在你们成为德鲁伊之前，你们的身份又是什么呢？"
G["What were you doing in my cellar? There's a food scare going on, and the last thing I need is strangers rummaging around in my goods! Shoo!"]="你在我的酒窖里干了什么？之前发生了食物中毒事件，我最讨厌陌生人乱翻我的货物！滚开！"
G["What were you thinking, provoking her like that?"]="真搞不懂，你为什么要招惹她呢？"
G["What will become of us when it falls?"]="我们会怎么样？"
G["What will become of us?"]="我们的命运会如何呢？"
G["What will become of us? Of Stonetalon?"]="我们会有怎样的遭遇？石爪又会有怎样的遭遇？"
G["What will become of--"]="这一切都会——"
G["What will our children learn from our mistakes?"]="孩子会从我们的错误中学到什么？"
G["What will the sea bring us today?"]="大海今天会为我们带来什么？"
G["What will we be learning next?"]="我们接下来要学什么？"
G["What will we do with them, master? They are of no use to us anymore."]="我们该怎么处置他们？他们现在对我们没有什么用了。"
G["What wisdom can I impart?"]="什么事？"
G["What word do you bring from the rest of Kun-Lai Summit?"]="你从昆莱山的其他地方得到了什么消息？"
G["What word from Silvermoon?  The courier is late!"]="银月城有什么消息？信使至今未到！"
G["What would I sacrifice?"]="我要牺牲什么？"
G["What would Kil'jaeden want with a mortal woman?"]="基尔加丹为什么会对普通的人类女孩感兴趣？"
G["What would happen if King Varian became corrupted?\n\n...\n\nI don't know, but it would be pretty SHA-king!"]="如果瓦里安国王倒台，会怎么样？\n\n……\n\n我不知道，但应该会发生不小的震动！"
G["What would happen if the Fruit of Fertility - or the Felvine - was allowed to be fully corrupted?"]="如果丰饶之果——或者说是魔藤——完全堕落，那会发生什么事呢？"
G["What would we do without you, $p?"]="要是没有你，我们该怎么办，$p？"
G["What would you have me do, Darion?"]="达里安，你觉得我应该怎么做？"
G["What would you have me do, Rabine?"]="拉比恩，你要我做什么？"
G["What would you have of me, Banshee Queen?"]="有什么我能效劳的，女妖之王？"
G["What would you have of me, my lady?"]="有什么我能效劳的，我的女士？"
G["What would you know about commitment, sheet-sah?"]="你还知道保证这个词啊，sheet-sah？"
G["What would you like to drink today, $n?"]="你今天想喝点什么，$n？"
G["What would you like?"]="你想去哪里？"
G["What ya gunna do to us, mon?"]="你想把我们怎么样？"
G["What ye be lookin' at, matey?"]="朋友，你在看什么呢？"
G["What you are feeling right now is the anguish of a thousand lost souls! Souls that you and your master brought here! The Light will tear you apart, Darion!"]="你现在感受到的，是上千个迷失灵魂的痛苦！他们都是牺牲在你和你的主人剑下的英灵！圣光会把你撕碎的，达里安！"
G["What you be expectin', mon?\n\nMaywiki only be dealin' with the druids and shaman."]="你想要什么？\n\n梅维克只跟德鲁伊和萨满祭司往来。"
G["What you be wanting? *hic*"]="你想要什么？*嗝儿*"
G["What you bring us? Treasures from the surface?"]="你给我们带来了什么？从上面带来了财宝？"
G["What you do to me?"]="你对我做了什么？"
G["What you doin' wanderin' around here?  Why them small fries not in da shackles?!"]="你在附近闲逛什么？为什么不把那些小家伙锁起来？！"
G["What you doing here puppy-thing? Go away! Go chase stick or something."]="这里为什么会有狗狗人？滚开！去拣骨头玩吧。"
G["What you got in that pipe, Nat?"]="你那根笛子里装着什么，纳特？"
G["What you have achieved today will shape the face of Pandaria for thousands of years to come.\n\nThank you, hero. The Lorewalkers shall pass your story down from generation to generation."]="你今天的壮举将决定潘达利亚在未来几千年中的面貌。\n\n谢谢你，英雄。游学者将会世代传颂你的故事。"
G["What you have done here, Sylvanas... it goes against the laws of nature. Disgusting is the only word I have to describe it."]="Lo que has hecho aquí, Sylvanas... Va contra las leyes de la naturaleza. \"Repugnante\" es la única palabra para describirlo."
G["What you have done is abominable! Atone for your crimes against the Light!"]="可恶！为你亵渎圣光的罪行忏悔吧！"
G["What you lack in size you make up for in ambition and dedication, little one. Go with the Light."]="Lo que te falta de fuerza lo tienes de ambición y dedicación, pequeñ$go:a;. Ve con la Luz."
G["What you must understand is that being able to index 10,000 years of existence has given me a rather unique perspective on life. Your present day trials and tribulations are meaningless."]="你必须明白，像我这样活了一万年的人，对生命有独特的看法。眼下你经受的考验和磨难都是毫无意义的。"
G["What you need are schematics far beyond my own meager offerings. Danwe here can show you some true technological delights!"]="我能提供的工程学结构图非常有限，你得向丹文讨教讨教。他会让你见识到工程学的精妙之处！"
G["What you put in that juju?"]="你在那个魂能里放了什么东西？"
G["What you read is something that you don't think you're quite ready for.\n\nYou should check back later."]="Lo que lees es algo para lo que no crees estar $gpreparado:preparada;.\n\nDeberías comprobarlo más adelante."
G["What you see before you is a felhunter. This creature's natural talents include spell lock and other abilities which make it unequalled when facing a magically attuned opponent."]="现在你们看到的就是地狱猎犬。这种生物拥有法力燃烧等多种技能，这些技能在对付施法型的敌人时是十分有用的。"
G["What you see here on this coast is not a result of the Scourge. In fact, we believe that the Scourge also fear the mist - which might be why they do not come here.\n\nYou see, the mist is alive, friend. Inside those airy tendrils lies death...\n\nShould you step within its grasp, you will vanish. The mist will take you!\n\nWe have never seen anyone return alive from the mist."]="你在海岸上目睹的一切并不是天灾军团造成的。事实上他们也害怕这片迷雾——你也瞧见了，连天灾军团都不肯涉足此地。\n\n朋友，迷雾中危机四伏。死亡的气息就萦绕在那片雾气中……\n\n一旦你踏入禁地，就会付出生命的代价。迷雾会吞噬你！\n\n我们还没有见过谁能活着从迷雾中走出来的。"
G["What you see now, $n, is your distant future. A future where Deathwing, the Twilight's Hammer, and the Old Gods that they serve have won. A barren, unchanging wasteland, inhabited only by the echoes of the past."]="$n，你眼前所见，就是遥远的未来。在这个时空，死亡之翼，暮光之锤和上古之神们赢得了胜利。因此，这里也成了一片荒芜，亘古不变的荒原，只有一些昔日的残影还在这里徘徊。"
G["What you seek is in the master's lair, but you must destroy Tyrannus to gain entry. Now, within the Halls of Reflection you will find Frostmourne. It... It holds the truth."]="你要找的就在主人的巢穴里，但要先干掉泰兰努斯才能进去。霜之哀伤就在映像大厅里……你们……你们能在它那里找到真相。"
G["What you stand round for, you go back work!"]="你瞎转悠什么呢，快回去工作！"
G["What you think you be doin? Get away from me!"]="你以为自己在做什么？离我远点！"
G["What you think?"]="怎么样？"
G["What you two are lacking..."]="你们俩所缺少的……"
G["What you want from Wikky?"]="你想从光板儿这里得到什么？"
G["What you want to learn, mon?"]="你对哪种武器感兴趣？"
G["What you want, $r?"]="你想要什么，$r？"
G["What you want?"]="你想干什么？"
G["What! If I've told him once, I've told him a thousand times! I do not take orders from him, or any of the forsaken! Send a letter to Dame Auriferous letting her know of the situation. Perhaps she will let him know how things work around here. Thank you for letting me know, Dusking. Dismissed."]="什么？！到底要我告诉他多少次！我是不会接受任何从他或者别的什么遗忘者那里下达的命令的！把这里的情况通知给奥莉菲洛丝夫人。也许她会让他知道我们在这里的意义。感谢你让我了解这些，达斯金。解散！"
G["What!?"]="什么！？"
G["What!? The Burning Blade kidnapped my brother?"]="什么！？火刃绑架了我的兄弟？"
G["What!? Twilight dragons? Here??"]="什么……？暮光巨龙……在这？？"
G["What!? Wait! That's no good! That's no good at all..."]="什么？！什么！这可不好！这可一点儿都不好……"
G["What!?!? I lost!?!?!"]="什么！？！？我输了！？！？！"
G["What'd you say?"]="你怎么说？"
G["What'll it be, sweety?"]="事情会变成什么样呢……"
G["What'll it be?"]="它会怎么样？"
G["What're y' looking at, $r?"]="你在看什么，$r？"
G["What're ye lookin' at, ye tuskarr-faced bung?"]="你在看什么？你这个海象脑袋的笨蛋？"
G["What're ye lookin' at? Is it m'shoes?"]="你在看什么？我的鞋子？"
G["What're ye starin' at, $r? Come ta torment the condemned?"]="你在看什么，$r？想要折磨囚犯吗？"
G["What're you doin' here?  Don' matter, I'm gonna resurrect Jeklik before you get a chance to interfere!"]="你在这儿干什么？不要紧，在你找到机会插手之前，我要复活耶克里克！"
G["What're you doin' out here? Slummin'?"]="你在这儿干什么？体验苦日子吗？"
G["What're you looking at?"]="你在找什么？"
G["What's \"Crimson Dawn!\" We deserve to know the truth, Quimby!"]="¿Qué es ese \"Alba Carmesí\"? ¡Tenemos derecho a saber la verdad, Quimby!"
G["What's Joren doin' out there, anyhow?"]="乔恩在那里干什么？"
G["What's YOUR dream? Don't let ANYONE take it away!"]="你的梦想又是什么？别让任何人夺走它！"
G["What's a $r like you doin' in a place like this? ...especially at a time like now?\n\nHmmmm?"]="¿Qué hace $gun:una; $r como tú en un lugar como este...? ¿Especialmente en un momento como este?\n\n¿Mmmm?"
G["What's a Steamwheedle ship without an engineer, eh? Torquespindle can help you with anything you need. He's handy with repairing things quickly, too, if that's what you're after."]="热砂港的船只怎可能没有工程师呢？托克斯宾德出售所有你需要的物品。如果你想要修理物品的话，他的技术也不错哟。"
G["What's a guy gotta do to get some help around here?"]="如何才能得到帮助呢？"
G["What's a little fire in the face of five heroes of the Alliance?"]="在联盟的五大英雄面前，你就是个小火苗！"
G["What's a yaungol?"]="什么是野牛人？"
G["What's a young $c like you out visiting an old farmer like me?"]="¿Qué hace $gun:una; joven $c visitando a un viejo granjero como yo?"
G["What's all that noise outside?"]="外面在吵什么？"
G["What's all the fuss about here?"]="这儿怎么搞的啊？"
G["What's all this? This jungle wasn't here during last week's survey. What is happening to the Barrens?"]="这些都是什么？在上周进行勘察的时候，这片丛林还没有出现。贫瘠之地发生了什么？"
G["What's an \"Ologist?\" A better question might be what isn't an \"Ologist.\" It means I study everything! In fact, I'm so well versed in \"everything\" that I'm guaranteed to be the most intelligent ethereal you'll ever meet - or your money back.\n\nApologies. That's the dealer in me talking..."]="¿Qué es un \"todólogo?\" Mejor sería preguntar qué no es un \"todólogo.\" ¡Significa que lo estudio todo! De hecho, soy tan experto en \"todo\" que te aseguro que soy el etéreo más inteligente que jamás hayas visto, ¡te apuesto lo que quieras!\n\nPerdona. Está hablando el comerciante en mí..."
G["What's an elf like you doing inside a cave like this?"]="像你这样的精灵待在这种洞穴里干什么？"
G["What's better than a bomb, huh?! I'll tell ya - a bomb with two bombs inside!"]="知道有什么东西比炸弹更好吗？！答案是内含两颗炸弹的炸弹！"
G["What's better than an explosion? Lots and lots of explosions! In this corner, we have Big Badda Boom!!"]="还有什么能比一场大爆炸更刺激呢？那当然是，很多很多大爆炸！这边进场的是，大型雷震天！！"
G["What's better than an explosion? Lots and lots of explosions, of course! In this corner, we have Big Badda Boom!!"]="还有什么能比一场大爆炸更刺激呢？那当然是很多很多大爆炸啦！这边进场的是，大型雷震天！！"
G["What's goin' on in here?"]="这儿发生什么事了？"
G["What's goin' on in there?? For the love of the LIGHT, hurry it up!"]="发生了什么事？？快一点！"
G["What's going on here, sarge?"]="这里发生了什么事，长官？"
G["What's going on here?"]="这里出了什么事？"
G["What's going on here? Piznik! I knew we shouldn't have let you stick around!"]="这里怎么了？匹兹尼克！我就知道我们不应该把你留在这里！"
G["What's going on in here? Get that thing back in its cage!"]="出什么事了？把那家伙关回笼子里去！"
G["What's going on in there? What's taking so long, $n?"]="出了什么状况吗？你怎么去了那么久，$n？"
G["What's going on out there?"]="外边出什么事了？"
G["What's going on over there at your delivery service? How are we expected to function when our mail is never here on time?"]="你的运送服务到底怎么回事？邮件从不及时送达，让我们怎么去履行职责？"
G["What's going on, anyway? They haven't told us anything and I'm starting to get angry!"]="到底发生了什么事？他们什么也不肯告诉我，搞得我有些生气了！"
G["What's going on?"]="出什么事了？"
G["What's going on? I thought I saw something on the rooftops."]="出了什么事？我仿佛看到有什么东西在房顶上。"
G["What's going on?!"]="发生什么事了？！"
G["What's going on?! We need to act NOW! NOW I SAY!"]="发生什么事了？！我们必须马上行动！我说马上！"
G["What's happened here? There are corpses everywhere... the stench... overwhelming..."]="究竟发生了什么事？到处都是尸体……恶臭熏天……"
G["What's happened to the lake bed? Strange power is pouring out of it."]="湖床上发生了什么事？有奇怪的能量从那里涌出。"
G["What's happened to us? We're in worse shape now than when the Defias ran amok!"]="我们是怎么了？我们现在比迪菲亚恣意妄为时的状态更糟！"
G["What's happening here in the Vale?"]="锦绣谷出什么事了？"
G["What's happening out here!?\n\nDid you see the man's wounds?!\n\nWhat kind of monster DOES that?"]="¡¿Qué está pasando ahí fuera?!\n\n¡¿Has visto las heridas de ese hombre?!\n\n¿Qué tipo de monstruo hace algo así?"
G["What's happening to me?"]="我出了什么事？"
G["What's happening to me? It burns!"]="我这是怎么了？好烫！"
G["What's happening?"]="到底是怎么回事？"
G["What's happening?  Can you hear me?"]="发生什么事了？你能听到我说话吗？"
G["What's happening?!"]="出了什么事？！"
G["What's in the crate?"]="箱子里有什么？"
G["What's it doing?!"]="怎么回事？！"
G["What's it going to be, then?  Rum?  Ale?\n\nOr perhaps something else?"]="来点什么呢？朗姆酒？还是麦酒？\n\n或者你想尝尝别的？"
G["What's it got in its pockets? Hmm?"]="那口袋里是什么？嗯？"
G["What's it like to be a shaman? I met Thrall once. My father doesn't trust him but he seemed very wise."]="当萨满祭司是什么感觉？我和萨尔有过一面之缘。我父亲不太信任他，但他看起来还是相当睿智的。"
G["What's it look like I'm doing?  I'm fixing the place up - all on my own I might add - so that we can move in!\n\nDo I know you?"]="我看上去像在干什么？我正在尽我的全力修理这个地方，这样我们就可以搬进来常驻了！\n\n等一下，我认识你吗？"
G["What's it look like I'm doing?  I'm fixing the place up - all on my own I might add - so that we can move in!\n\nWith a base of operations out here in the forest, it'll be easier to keep track of what Shattrath, Allerian, Stonebreaker and the Cenarion druids are all up to.  Our base in Auchindoun is just too inconvenient for that.\n\nWait a minute, do I know you?"]="我看上去像在干什么？我正在尽我的全力修理这个地方，这样我们就可以搬进来常驻了！\n\n随着基地在森林中运作起来，我们就更容易监视沙塔斯城、奥蕾莉亚岗哨、裂石堡，以及塞纳里奥的德鲁伊们。我们在奥金顿的基地中可不方便做这个。\n\n等一下，我认识你吗？"
G["What's it thinking?"]="它在想什么？"
G["What's needed for the cauldron at Dalson's Tears?"]="达尔松之泪的天灾之锅都需要什么？"
G["What's needed for the cauldron at Felstone Field?"]="费尔斯通农场的天灾之锅都需要什么？"
G["What's needed for the cauldron at Gahrron's Withering?"]="盖罗恩农场的天灾之锅都需要什么？"
G["What's needed for the cauldron at the Writhing Haunt?"]="嚎哭鬼屋的天灾之锅都需要什么？"
G["What's next for the Alliance?"]="联盟接下来该怎么办？"
G["What's next, $n? Gonna take on the whole yaungol army by yourself? You could do it, too!"]="¿Qué va a ser lo siguiente, $n? ¿Vas a ocuparte de todo el ejército yaungol tú $gsolo:sola;? ¡Podrías hacerlo!"
