G["What?  I look like a $c to you?\n\nGet outta here, will ya?"]="¿Qué? ¿Te parezco $gotro:otra; $c?\n\nVete de aquí, ¿estamos?"
G["What?  I'll show that pipsqueak!"]="什么？我要让那小矮子瞧瞧！"
G["What?  Isn't that the new guy?"]="¿Qué? ¿No es ese $gel nuevo:la nueva;?"
G["What?  NO!  This can't be!  Gebler, you know me... we were friends once!"]="什么？不！这不可能！盖比勒，你了解我……我们曾经是朋友！"
G["What?  Oh no, I don't care what you have to say.  I just enjoy inflicting pain."]="什么？哦，好吧，我不在乎你说什么。我只是喜欢这样。"
G["What?  Oh, not this again!"]="什么？啊呀，又来了！"
G["What?  Such a small, frail thing beckons me?  I shall add your bones to my throne, $r!!"]="什么？你这样的家伙也敢召唤我？我要把你的尸体扔到我的王座上，$R！！"
G["What?  Such a small, frail thing beckons me?  This will not go unpunished!"]="什么？你这样的家伙也敢召唤我？你会受到惩罚的！"
G["What?  This not Naxxramas!  We not like this place... destroy!"]="什么？这里不是纳克萨玛斯！我们不喜欢这里……毁灭一切！"
G["What?  What's this?!"]="什么？这是什么？！"
G["What?  Who are you?\n\n<The initiate holds her hands up.>\n\nLook, how about I just go back to my practice and you ignore me?"]="什么？你是谁？\n\n<新兵举起了双手。>\n\n看，不如这样，我继续回去练习，而你就当没看到过我？"
G["What?  Who are you?\n\n<The initiate holds his hands up.>\n\nLook, how about I just go back to my practice and you ignore me?"]="什么？你是谁？\n\n<新兵举起了双手。>\n\n看，不如这样，我继续回去练习，而你就当没看到过我？"
G["What?  Yes, that's my... crate.  And I'm not a..."]="什么？是的，这是我的……箱子。还有，我不是……"
G["What?  You already killed him!\n\nI was hoping to study Quagmirran, perhaps interact with him.  But now all that I'll be studying is his corpse.\n\n<sigh>\n\nPlease let me out of this cage.  I'll take a look at him and then make my own way out of here."]="什么？你已经把他给杀了！\n\n我以前一直希望能研究夸格米拉，或许还能和他互动一下。但是现在我所能做的就只有研究他的尸体。\n\n<叹气>\n\n请让我离开这只笼子。我会看他一眼，然后自己离开这里。"
G["What? $n, you're not a warlock.\n\nThere's nothing that I can teach a $c like you, $g sir : ma'am;."]="¿Qué? $n, no eres $gun brujo:una bruja;.\n\nNo hay nada que yo pueda enseñarle a $gun:una; $c como tú."
G["What? A Horde ship? HERE?"]="什么？一艘部落的船？在这儿？"
G["What? Am I here alone. We both have a stake in this, you know!"]="什么？你应该很清楚吧，我们的命运是休戚相关的！"
G["What? Are you looking for something?\n\nThere's nothing left here. Dead crops. Dead people. So many... dead.\n\nThe blight has taken everything. Even the earth feels it, its shadow seeps into the soil like poison. It's unnatural... If I weren't so stubborn, if I hadn't insisted on staying in our home, maybe they'd still be here.\n\nIt's just Minnie and I now. We're all that's left... and I still refuse to leave.\n\nLight save us both."]="¿Qué? ¿Buscas algo?\n\nAquí no queda nada. Cosechas muertas. Gente muerta. Tantos... muertos.\n\nLa plaga se lo ha llevado todo. Hasta la tierra lo siente: su sombra se filtra en el suelo como veneno. No es natural... Si no fuera tan testaruda, si no hubiera insistido en quedarnos en nuestro hogar, quizá seguirían aquí.\n\nYa solo quedamos Minnie y yo. Somos lo único que queda... y aun así me niego a marcharme.\n\nQue la Luz nos salve a las dos."
G["What? Are you too good to help us out here?"]="什么？你真有那么好心，特地来帮我们？"
G["What? Bonescythe?"]="什么？骨镰？"
G["What? Can't a death knight get a little dressed up every once in a while?"]="什么？死亡骑士就不能偶尔打扮一下吗？"
G["What? Can't you see that I'm busy here?\n\nYou think this transmatter is going to fix itself?!"]="什么？没看见我正忙着吗？\n\n难道你觉得这玩意儿能自动恢复正常？！"
G["What? Cheated!?"]="什么？使诈？"
G["What? Did someone say ale? Don't start pouring the pints without ol' Torren!"]="什么？有人说到麦酒了？没有托瑞恩在场，哪能喝得爽快！"
G["What? Do I see rescuers? Over here, $r! Help us!"]="什么？有人来救我们了？这边，$r，救救我们！"
G["What? Fine, fine... I got it, I got it!"]="什么？好啊，好啊……我明白了，我明白了！"
G["What? Fine, fine... I'll pay my protection moolah to your goons!"]="什么？好啊，好啊……我会把欠你的钱还给你，混蛋！"
G["What? HAR'KOA?!"]="什么？哈克娅？！"
G["What? Here? Now? We're in a battle!\n\nAs much as I love your enthusiasm to learn the wonders of Gnomish Engineering this really is a conversation best saved for when we are back under the protection of Tinkertown's walls in Ironforge."]="什么？在这儿？现在？我们可是在打仗！\n\n尽管你对侏儒工程学的热情让我非常欣慰，但还是等我们回到铁炉堡的工匠镇再来谈这件事情吧。"
G["What? How is this possible?"]="什么？怎么可能？"
G["What? I don't know of any warlock trainers in Stormwind. \nAlthough... There have been some sightings of demonic activity over by The Slaughtered Lamb in the Mage Quarter. I suppose you could check there."]="¿Qué? No conozco instructores brujos en Ventormenta. \n\nNo obstante... dicen que se han celebrado actos demoníacos en El Cordero Degollado, en el Barrio de los Magos. Supongo que podrías mirar allí."
G["What? I'm busy here."]="什么？我现在很忙。"
G["What? I'm just sayin' that's how we do things in Grizzly Hills."]="干嘛啊？我们在灰熊丘陵的时候可不就是这么做的嘛。"
G["What? I... I lost? Auuugh! I'll have to work harder to beat you!"]="什么？我……我输了？啊！我得多加努力，一定要打败你！"
G["What? Is that....LAND?"]="什么？那是…陆地？"
G["What? Is that...is that a $r I see? Thank you for rescuing me."]="¿Qué? ¿Es $gun:una; $r eso que veo? Gracias por rescatarme."
G["What? Kor'kron, to the gates! Now!"]="什么？库卡隆，到城门那边去！快！"
G["What? MORE Dragonmaw? Stay close - they're comin' from all sides!"]="什么？更多的龙喉兽人？收紧队形，绝对不要散开——他们正从四面八方攻过来！"
G["What? MORE Wildhammer? These fools have a death wish!"]="什么？还有更多蛮锤矮人？那些傻瓜真是不想活了！"
G["What? No!"]="什么？不！"
G["What? No, I don't do armor repairs. Everlook is about a mile to the north, $g brother : sister;.\n\nNow buy something, or move along before I summon my warlock to deal with you!"]="啥？我才不做盔甲维修的生意呢。永望镇就离这里不到一里地，$g伙计:小姐;。\n\n现在，赶紧买点什么吧，不然我就把我的术士召唤出来，把你给秒了！"
G["What? No, no! Stop!  Obey your master!"]="什么？不……不！停！听主人的命令！"
G["What? Of course not! I could easily escape this simple contraption, but I'm much too busy. See, a while back I spent a few months inside the belly of a beast..."]="什么？当然不是！这么简单的装置根本困不住我，可我没时间。看见没，就在不久前我还在一只猛兽的肚子里住了好几个月……"
G["What? Precious? Noooooooooo!!!"]="什么？我的心肝？不！！！"
G["What? Someone steal junglebrew?"]="什么？有人偷了丛林烈酒？"
G["What? Suddenly, I feel at peace..."]="怎么了？我突然感到内心十分祥和……"
G["What? There is a mausoleum beneath the old village? What fools we are to not have noticed! We will find and strike down your master now, Godfrey. We will end this nightmare."]="什么！？暮冬城旧址下面有一座陵墓？我们对此事竟然毫不知情！高弗雷，我们会消灭你的主子，结束这场噩梦。"
G["What? This can't be!"]="啊！"
G["What? This isn't the control room! There's another entire defense mechanism in place, and the blasted Rock Troggs broke into here somehow. Troggs. Why did it have to be Troggs!"]="什么？这儿不是控制室！这儿有另外一套完整的防御系统，那些该死的石头穴居人却闯入了这儿。穴居人，为什么闯进来的是穴居人！"
G["What? This strength...? All of the pain is gone! You... must join me in the eternal embrace of death!"]="什么？这种力量是……？所有的痛苦都消失了！你……？难道我们都投入了永恒的死亡怀抱？"
G["What? We negotiate in good faith and you come to me with insults?"]="什么？我们带着良好的愿望来参加谈判，而你却只是来侮辱我们？"
G["What? We're all pandaren here! Just because we came from the turtle doesn't mean we look weird."]="什么？我们都是熊猫人！难道迷踪岛的熊猫人看上去会很怪？"
G["What? What have you done?  No!  Do you have any idea what the Twilight Council will do to me when they find out I've talked!?  I would sooner die!"]="什么？不……你都干了什么？不，你知不知道要是暮光议会发现我开了口，我会有什么下场？我宁可早点死！"
G["What? What's happening..."]="什么？发生了什么事？"
G["What? What?"]="什么？什么？"
G["What? Where am I? This isn't right at all! Look at you! Look at this place! It isn't on my list! There's going to be so much paperwork...\n\n<The goblin writes frantically in a small notebook.>\n\nLook, if you've got nothing better to do than stand there and stare, why don't you go visit my cousin, Kwee Q. Peddlefeet, in one of the major cities? Says here he's taking care of Orgrimmar, Stormwind, Thunder Bluff, Ironforge, the Undercity, and Darnassus. Go on, get outta here!"]="什么？我在哪里？这根本不对！看看你！看看这个地方！它不在我的列表上啊！看来又得搞一大堆文件了……\n\n<地精疯狂地在一个小本上写着东西。>\n\n看，要是你除了站在这里和东张西望以外没有其他事情可做的话，为什么不去各大城市拜访一下我的表兄弟匹德菲特呢？据说他正照顾着奥格瑞玛、暴风城、雷霆崖、铁炉堡、幽暗城和达纳苏斯的事务。去吧，离开这里！"
G["What? Where in the-- don't just stand around lads; kill somebody!"]="什么？我这是在哪？别傻站着了，杀了他们！"
G["What? Who are you? What clan are you from?"]="什么？你是谁？你来自于那个氏族？"
G["What? Who are... you?"]="什么？你是……谁？"
G["What? Why are you bothering me? Why, I bet you can't even create a high quality robe! Go talk to Snang and come back when you're worthy of my talents!"]="什么？你为什么在烦我？哎呀，我打赌你甚至不能制造一件高质量的长袍！去找斯诺恩谈谈，等你水平提高以后再来找我！"
G["What? Why do you want me to do it?"]="什么？为什么要我去？"
G["What? Why would he do a fool thing like that?"]="什么？那他为什么做这种傻事？"
G["What? Ya found it! Wahoo! I'll get right to work!"]="什么？你找到了！哇！我马上就开工！"
G["What? Yes, I was backing the Alliance."]="什么？没错，我支持了联盟。"
G["What? You changed your mind after all? I told you to pick carefully!\n\nAh well, I will forgive you this time. Tell me, which egg do you really want?"]="什么？你最终还是改变主意了？我告诉过你叫你仔细挑选！\n\n算了算了，这次我就原谅你了。告诉我，你到底想要哪个蛋？"
G["What? You just want me to look at some dirty old tome? Ugh, how disappointing. \n\nThis is the script of the Nathrezim, what you call Dreadlords. They rarely use it outside of their home."]="什么？你就想让我看这些又脏又旧的书？噢，真扫兴。\n\n这是纳斯雷兹姆，也就是你们所说的恐惧魔王的语言。他们很少在家乡之外的地方使用这种文字。"
G["What? You mean you can't kill this one by yourself?"]="什么？你说你干不掉这个东西？"
G["What? You think I want to be Magmothregar's next appetizer? Get me outa here!"]="想什么呢？我可不要当犸格莫斯雷加的开胃菜！把我弄出这个鬼地方！"
G["What? You think these grow on trees? Please show me one of these trees!\n\nI can't work like this!"]="什么？你认为这些是长在树上的？那给我找棵这样的树瞧瞧！\n\n这活儿我没法干！"
G["What? You want something?"]="什么？你要什么东西？"
G["What? You want to train under me, $c? You better be ready to work."]="嗯？$c，你想接受我的训练？那你最好做好准备。"
G["What? You wish to donate cloth to Silvermoon?\n\nYou're merely after a Hawkstrider, aren't you? Very well, very well... do the city this service, and I will see to it that your reputation here rises."]="什么？你想给银月城捐献布料吗？\n\n你只是想要只陆行鸟吧，不是吗？好吧，好吧……为这座城市捐献布料，我来负责让你声名远播。"
G["What? You're not supposed to be here. You're dead!"]="¿Cómo? No puedes estar aquí. ¡Estás $gmuerto:muerta;!"
G["What? You're sending me back there?!"]="什么？你要把我送回去？！"
G["What? You've come to laugh at Zanzil, too? Not again! I'll make you pay!"]="什么？你也是来嘲笑赞吉尔的？又来了！我要给你好看！"
G["What?!"]="什么？！"
G["What?!  What did ye say?!  How dare ye!  Me beer can stand up to any of that rot they serve at Brewfest!\nYou'll pay for this insult, $c!"]="¡¿Qué?! ¡¿Qué has dicho?! ¡Cómo te atreves! ¡Mi cerveza puede soportar la comparación con cualquier porquería que sirvan en la Fiesta de la Cerveza!\n\n¡Pagarás por esta ofensa, $c!"
G["What?!  You don't think I can do it?  I'll show you...once I get my parts, that is."]="什么？！你不觉得我能成功吗？只要我拿到了我的零件……我会证明给你看的。"
G["What?!  You no can beat me!  Me will return!"]="什么？！你不可能打败我！我会回来的！"
G["What?! Don't give me that look!"]="干吗？！别那样看着我！"
G["What?! How dare you!"]="什么？！大胆！"
G["What?! How did you sneak past my jail...er, minion out there? Well, I suppose it's for the best. Sales have been a little slow lately.\n\nHow may I fulfill your infernal needs, $c?"]="什么？！你是怎么跑进这里的……哦，外面带了伴当？好吧，我就算你没有恶意好了。今年我的销售势头似乎不行呀。\n\n你看你要我这里的什么货吧，$c？"
G["What?! I will finish you myself!"]="什么？！我要亲自解决你！"
G["What?! Impossible!"]="什么？！那不可能！"
G["What?! Impossible! RUNNN!"]="啊？！怎么可能！跑吧！"
G["What?! MY SHIP! Who did this?!"]="什么？！我的船！是谁干的？！"
G["What?! No! This lawn... was... mine..."]="什么？不！这片草坪……是……我的……"
G["What?! This is preposterous."]="什么？！这太荒谬了。"
G["What?! What was that?"]="什么？！那是什么？"
G["What?! What was that?! Impossible! His body is right here! Unless..."]="什么？！那是什么？！不可能！他的身体就在这里！除非……"
G["What?! You think I'm made out of miners?\n\nHow bad can it be in there?"]="什么？！你认为我是矿工出身？\n\n你还能有更糟糕的想法吗？"
G["What?! You're immune to my air magic?"]="什么？！你竟然对我的空气法术免疫？"
G["What??  The Burning Blade is spreading!  We must investigate!"]="什么？？火刃氏族也许正在不断扩张！我们必须马上进行调查！"
G["What?? You have no proof of such a claim."]="什么？？你这种说法毫无根据。"
G["Whatcha doin', mon? Don'tcha know the end o' the world be nigh? Here, I show you!"]="你在干什么？难道你不知道世界末日就要到来了吗？来，让我展示给你看！"
G["Whatcha lookin' at kid?  There's work to be done!"]="你在看什么呢，小鬼？该干活儿了！"
G["Whatcha lookin' at, ye bilge rat?  Har, har.... just kiddin' with ye, mate!"]="看什么看？哈哈……开个玩笑嘛！"
G["Whatcha need?"]="你需要什么？"
G["Whatchoo been doin', pacin' yourselves?"]="你在干什么，闲逛吗？"
G["Whatever advice I can give to aid in your fight against the ogres, you shall have it!"]="无论我给你什么样的对付食人魔的建议，你都要听取！"
G["Whatever darkness it once exuded is silent at last."]="终于，它也归于沉寂，化为乌有。"
G["Whatever the courier delivers, I hope that it's good news."]="不知道信使会带来什么消息，希望是好消息吧。"
G["Whatever ye do today, hero, ye're doin' fer all the Alliance."]="无论今天你成功与否，英雄，你做得一切都是为了联盟。"
G["Whatever yeh do... Don't. Black. Out!"]="无论怎样……你可不要晕过去！"
G["Whatever you do, don't let it hit you!"]="不管你做什么，别让它击中你！"
G["Whatever you do, don't let me forget my Ingenious Cap of Mook Foolery!"]="千万要提醒我带上我的巨怪愚行天才帽！"
G["Whatever you do, don't look down."]="无论你做什么，千万别朝下看。"
G["Whatever you do, don't look like a carrot!"]="不管你做什么，别让自己看上去像根胡萝卜！"
G["Whatever you do, stranger, do not ask my husband about his egg noodle recipe. It will be the longest conversation you have ever heard."]="Hagas lo que hagas, $gforastero:forastera; ni se te ocurra preguntar a mi marido por su receta de tallarines de huevo. Puede ser la conversación más larga que hayas tenido en tu vida."
G["Whatever you need, Brazie Getz! Get it?\n\nAnd I'm not just talkin' about the \"legal\" stuff, either. WHATEVER YOU NEED, PAL! Anything..."]="¡Lo que necesites, Brazie Lopillas! ¿Lo pillas?\n\nY no solo hablo de las cosas \"legales\". ¡LO QUE NECESITES, $gAMIGO:AMIGA;! Lo que sea..."
G["Whatever you need, I can get..."]="不管你要什么，我都有……"
G["Whatever you say, princess. But yer simply postponing the inevitable...."]="小公主，你说什么就是什么啦。不过拖延是没有意义的，有些事情是无可避免的……"
G["Whatever you're going to ask for, do it quickly."]="你有什么需要，尽快开口吧。"
G["Whatever, Duncan.  Grab a mop and get to work."]="邓肯，给我听着，快拿起拖把去干活。"
G["Whatever, I've felt worse."]="不管怎样，我觉得更糟糕了。"
G["Whatever, let the fight begin!"]="不管怎样，让战斗开始吧！"
G["Whatever."]="管它呢。"
G["Whatever. The revolting, unkempt Horde filth..."]="随便。反正就是一群又脏又臭，野蛮无知的游牧民。"
G["Whatzit...are they...what are they doin' to our alementals?"]="那是啥……他们……在对我们的酒灵做什么？"
G["Whe... Where am I? What... What is this place?"]="我……我在哪里？这……这是什么地方？"
G["Wheee!"]="哇！"
G["Wheeee! I'm a bird-boy!"]="喔！我是个小鸟男孩了！"
G["Wheeee! Thanks Mom!"]="耶~~~谢谢妈妈！"
G["Wheeeeeee!"]="咦！"
G["When Ahune surfaces, will we be ready?"]="当埃霍恩出现时，我们能准备好吗？"
G["When Blackrock freezes over!"]="当黑石山冻成冰块的时候！"
G["When Deathwing destroyed the World Pillar, he broke open a rift between your world and ours. These spores and fungi are one consequence.\n\nLet's see if we can deal with them together."]="当死亡之翼毁掉世界之柱时，他打开了一道位于你我世界间的裂隙。这些孢子与菌类就是后果之一。\n\n让我们看看能否共同解决它们。"
G["When Deathwing rose from the Maelstrom, dark, angry waves crashed into the Zandalari capital. The spine of the land broke in two, and soon, the city and all its riches began to slide into the hungry sea."]="当死亡之翼冲出大漩涡，黑暗的怒涛涌入赞达拉的都城。大地之脊一分为二，很快，这座城市和它所有的财富一同沉入大海。"
G["When Hallow's End is over we'll smash all these pumpkins. That'll be the greatest day I've ever known!"]="万圣节结束后我们就要打碎所有的南瓜。那将会是我最开心的日子！"
G["When I am done here, I am going to mount your heads upon the walls of Azjol-Nerub!"]="战斗结束后，我就要把你们的徽记挂在艾卓-尼鲁布的城墙上！"
G["When I am finished with you, I shall not rest until this world is cleansed. Now perish!"]="我就先解决你们，再去净化这个世界。现在，去死吧！"
G["When I am finished with your tribe, I shall hunt down that orcish cur that saved you from my wrath once before. None will survive."]="当我消灭掉你们一族之后，我会去干掉那些该死的兽人。他们曾经在我的怒火中救过你们一次。但这次历史不会重演了。"
G["When I awoke, the Klaxxi told me of you. It seems you are not without your uses."]="当我醒来时，卡拉克西对我提起了你。看来你并非毫无用处。"
G["When I break out of these stocks I'm going to rip out your heart and devour it whole!"]="有本事别让我逃出去，否则我就要把你的心挖出来一口吃掉！"
G["When I catch you, I'm going to disenchant your components, so help me..."]="要是我抓住你，我会把你的零件都给分解掉，所以你最好……"
G["When I clawed my way out of the grave, I thought my family would welcome me with open arms. Instead, they drove me from the village, screaming in a language I could no longer understand."]="当我从墓穴中爬出来后，我本以为我的家人会热烈地欢迎我。相反，他们把我从村里赶了出去，用一种我听不懂的语言高声尖叫着。"
G["When I done fightin', went up to Kiryn to ask for my... reward."]="战斗结束之后，我就去找琪麟要我的……奖赏了。"
G["When I find that dragon, I'm gonna throw him to Kalimdor."]="等我找到那条龙，我就把它扔到卡利姆多去。"
G["When I finish this, your pathetic mortal world will burn with my vengeance!"]="当我解决了这场战斗，你们可悲的凡人世界将被我的复仇之焰烧尽！"
G["When I first arrived, I'd hoped to meet the town's namesake.\n\n<Ros'eleth glances around.>\n\nMost young high elves outgrow the 'I wanna be a Farstrider' phase by the time they come of age for their first apprenticeship. Then, it's onto the 'I'm going to be a magister' stage.\n\nNo one dreams of growing up to be a seamstress, but we can't have the Farstriders going around naked, as my mother used to say."]="Cuado llegué aquí, esperaba estar a la altura de la reputación de la ciudad.\n\n<Ros'eleth mira a su alrededor.>\n\nLa mayoría de los jóvenes superan la fase de \"quiero ser un Errante\" en cuanto cumplen la edad para empezar a aprender. Entonces pasan a la fase \"yo quiero ser magister\".\n\nNadie quiere ser costurera, pero los Errantes no pueden pasearse por ahí desnudos; ya lo decía mi madre."
G["When I first arrived, I'd hoped to meet the town's namesake.\n\n<Ros'eleth glances around.>\n\nMost young high elves outgrow the 'I wanna be a Farstrider' phase by the time they're taken as apprentices. Then, it's onto the 'I'm going to be a magister' stage.\n\nI don't think I ever quite outgrew the Farstrider phase, to be honest. No one dreams of growing up to be a seamstress, but we can't have the Farstriders running around naked, as my mother used to say."]="Cuado llegué aquí, esperaba estar a la altura de la reputación de la ciudad.\n\n<Ros'eleth mira a su alrededor.>\n\nLa mayoría de los jóvenes superan la fase de \"quiero ser un Errante\" en cuanto alguien los acepta como aprendices. Entonces pasan a la fase \"yo quiero ser magister\".\n\nPara serte sincera, yo todavía estoy superando lo de \"quiero ser Errante\". Nadie quiere ser costurera de mayor, pero alguien tiene que hacer lo que se ponen los Errantes para no andar desnudos. Eso es lo que solía decirme mi madre."
G["When I first saw the undead, I wept, for I could not imagine their horror and loneliness. The Earth Mother spoke to me then; she sang in my blood. And she told me, \"Save them.\""]="La primera vez que vi a los no-muertos, lloré, no podía imaginarme su horror y soledad. Entonces me habló la Madre Tierra, cantó en mi sangre. Y me dijo: \"Sálvalos.\""
G["When I first set up my rogue academy in Shattrath, it wasn't nearly this crowded. Then, the refugees started flooding in and the naaru needed every available building to house them.\n\nI've closed the doors to my academy for now, but it's not permanent. I'll find a new place to set up.\n\nThen, a new generation of rogues will learn such staples as the gouge'n grin, combat looting, and blaming someone else for breaking polymorph. And who can forget the central rule of roguery --- real rogues don't feint."]="当初我在沙塔斯城开设这所盗贼学院的时候，这里的人还没有那么多。不久之后，大量难民就开始涌向这里，纳鲁们几乎把每一座房子都让给了他们。\n\n于是，我现在被迫暂时关闭了这所盗贼学校，当然，这绝对不是永久的。我只是需要重新找一个地方而已。\n\n很快，新一代的盗贼就会先凿击再消失，战斗中趁机搜尸，以及如何将破坏变形的罪责都扣在猎人头上。哦，当然，还得学会盗贼理论的核心教条——真正的盗贼永远不佯攻。"
G["When I get all shaken up, hear me shout..."]="当我饱受惊吓时，你将听到我大声喊叫……"
G["When I get back into my body, I'm going to kill you, mon! Er... no, what I meant to say is that I'm going to hug you. Yeah, that's right, I'm going to hug you and give you a big reward. Nevermind what I said about the killing."]="只要我一还魂，我就要杀了你，伙计！呃……不，我的意思是说，我就要拥抱你。对，没错，我就要抱住你，再给你一份大大的犒赏。别把我说的什么杀了你的话当回事。"
G["When I get home, I'm going to have a hot bath to scour away the grime. Perhaps two. Or five."]="到家之后，我要好好地洗个热水澡。嗯，或许洗两次。呃，不如洗上五次。"
G["When I get out of here, I'm going to kill every last one of you Twilight's Hammer scum!"]="等我出去了，我一定要把你们这群暮光之锤渣滓杀得一个不留！"
G["When I get out of here, I'm going to rip every last one of you Twilight's Hammer curs to shreds!"]="等我出去，我一定会把你们这群暮光之锤杂种撕成碎片！"
G["When I get sad about losing, I eat..."]="当我因失去而感到难过时，我就化悲痛为食量……"
G["When I get this hunk of junk up and running, I'll be able to walk the roads without fear of being jumped by bandits!"]="当我让这块大垃圾工作起来之后，我就再也不用害怕那些强盗啦！"
G["When I give the signal, let loose your greatest roar!"]="我一发出信号，你们就用最大的力气吼叫！"
G["When I grow up I wanna be a tanner!"]="等我长大以后，我要成为一个制革工人！"
G["When I grow up I want to be a fire juggler!"]="我长大以后，也要当一个喷火的杂耍艺人！"
G["When I grow up I want to be a stable man!"]="等我长大以后，我要当一个马夫！"
G["When I grow up, I wanna be the king of Stormwind!"]="我长大后想成为暴风城的王！"
G["When I grow up, I want to be the best chef in Pandaria."]="等我长大了，我要成为潘达利亚最棒的大厨。"
G["When I grow up, I want to be the bestest Shaman in the world!"]="等我长大以后，我要成为世界上最杰出的萨满！"
G["When I grow up, I want to put strange things together too!"]="我长大以后，也要把各种怪东西拼起来！"
G["When I learned about my relatives here in the north, I came to learn more.  What I found was warring tribes acting against our very nature.\n\nI have no hope left, $r.  Even great Ursoc has been tainted by this cursed place.\n\nI've lost all hope."]="Cuando descubrí que tenía parientes aquí, en el Norte, vine a averiguar más cosas. Lo que encontré fueron tribus en lucha peleando contra nuestra propia naturaleza.\n\nNo me queda esperanza, $r. Este lugar maldito ha logrado corromper incluso al gran Ursoc.\n\nHe perdido toda la esperanza."
G["When I need someone to prance around like an overstuffed peacock, I'll call on you."]="如果我想找人来像个肥胖的孔雀一样走台步，那我会叫你的。"
G["When I reached the end of the canyon, I remembered that my motorcycle could fly."]="当我到达山谷尽头的时候，我才想起我的摩托车是能飞的。"
G["When I return victorious, we will see who the Dragonmaw call \"Warchief\"."]="Cuando regrese victorioso ya veremos a quién llaman los Faucedraco \"Jefe de Guerra\"."
G["When I said we should strike at the heart of the beast, going through it's stomach wasn't what I had in mind..."]="当我说要直击那个怪兽的心脏的时候，我可没有想要穿透它的肚子……"
G["When I say: \"Who's the Master?\" You say: \"Shonuf!\""]="Cuando yo digo \"¿Quién es el maestro?\", tú respondes \"¡Shonuf!\"."
G["When I scowled at you before you became da new king... um... I was just joking.\n\nYeah!"]="Cuando te miré mal antes... antes de que te convirtieras en $gel nuevo rey:la nueva reina;... Mmm... Solo estaba bromeando.\n\nSí."
G["When I see her smile, it makes me smile. When she casts a spell, it puts a spell on me. When I see her horns, it makes me feel... intrigued. It's Dominika!"]="她的微笑令我神往，她的法术令我倾心，她的角……令我醉心。她就是多米尼卡！"
G["When I spoke to the waters, they showed me a vision of you, $n. Perhaps you are more than a passing traveler. Perhaps you were sent to us for a reason."]="Cuando las aguas me hablaron, me mostraron una visión de ti, $n. Quizás seas algo más que $gun extraño:una extraña; visitante. Puede que te llegaras hasta aquí por algo."
G["When I stumbled upon the Suntara stones at the Grimesilt Digsite, the power of Ragnaros surged through my being. It was Ragnaros that gave me a purpose."]="当我偶然发现苏塔拉之石的时候，拉格纳罗斯的力量从我身体中澎湃而过。正是拉格纳罗斯给了我方向。"
G["When I trained as a guard in Orgrimmar, Thrall urged us to be patient and cautious when dealing with enemies.\n\nBut Naga threaten to overrun this peninsula, and Thrall is no longer my Warchief. The time has come to shed some blood, $c."]="当我作为一名奥格瑞玛卫兵接受训练的时候，萨尔叮嘱我们在对敌作战的时候需要保持耐心和谨慎。\n\n但纳迦时刻都有可能完全占领这座半岛。萨尔也不再是我的酋长了。现在应该是对敌人予以痛击的时候了，$c。"
G["When I was but a cub I could scarcely throw a punch, but after years of training I can do so much more!"]="少不更事的时候，我连打出一记好拳都难，但经过多年修炼，我已今非昔比！"
G["When I was last in the halls, Talon King Ikiss carried Terokk's Quill with him, as a sign of his authority.\n\nMy brother, Darkweaver Syth, wore Terokk's Mask during our rituals.\n\nAs for the Saga of Terokk, there's no way of knowing exactly where it is, but they usually kept it at the center of one of their rune circles in the great vaulted halls."]="当我还大厅中徘徊的时候，利爪之王艾吉斯随身携带着泰罗克的羽毛，把它作为他权力的象征。\n\n我的兄弟——黑暗编织者塞斯在我们的仪式上戴着泰罗克的面具。\n\n至于泰罗克的传说，我们不可能确切地知道它在哪里，但是他们通常把它放在大厅的某个符文法阵中间。"
G["When I was wandering the crater after I crashed here, I remembered something that I once was told... \"Go up, up the mountain ahead,\" said the voice in my head.\n\nListening to it is how I ended up here, $n!"]="Cuando caminaba por el cráter después de estrellarme aquí, recordé algo que me dijeron una vez... \"Sube por la montaña,\" dijo la voz en mi cabeza.\n\n¡Escuchando esa voz es como acabé aquí, $n!"
G["When I was young I trained hard to become an anchorite in the priesthood.  Female exarchs were practically unheard of.\n\nNowadays gender matters little - it is courage and conviction that make all the difference."]="我年轻的时候刻苦训练，是为了成为牧师中的学者。那时候我从没听说过还有女性主教。\n\n现在性别已经不是问题了——那是因为勇气和信仰会改变一切。"
G["When I was young I wanted to be a brewmaster. Mixing various chemicals to get the perfect drink and flavor.\n\nDuring my training though they kept telling me my drinks were too hearty.\n\nSo I went into smelting. Seemed like a logical transition at the time."]="在我小的时候，我曾梦想成为一名酒仙。通过各种奇妙的化学反应酿造出完美的陈年佳酿。\n\n但在我学习的过程中，他们总说我酿的酒太烈了。\n\n所以我就转行搞冶炼了。当时看来，这种转行很合理。"
G["When I was your age I could have had all of those shredders fixed before breakfast and still had time for all of my other chores.  In the Winterspring snow, no less.  And it's uphill both ways there!"]="我像你这个年纪的时候能在早餐前修好所有收割机，还能腾出时间做完其它的杂事。而且还是在冬泉谷的大雪中，而且都要爬山的！"
G["When I woke up, I couldn't find my way back to the campsite..."]="当我醒来时，已经找不到回营地的路了……"
G["When I yell out the names of ingredients, you throw them in the pot..."]="在我喊出配料名字的时候，你就把它们扔进锅中……"
G["When I'm done with this plague wagon it'll look like a goblin built it! Keep me safe!"]="看着吧，我会把这台天灾战车包装得像是地精的工程制品！保护我！"
G["When I'm done with ye, ye won't have a toe to stand on!"]="我要让你爬也爬不起来！"
G["When I'm through with ya, yer head's gonna be firmly placed between yer ass cheeks!"]="我要让你明白，该把你的脑袋摆在什么地方！"
G["When King Magni approached me about these festivities I was excited.  I began explaining how with a little help from the gnomes, we could really make this a blast to remember.  Sadly, King Magni wanted to keep it simple.  He wanted to honor the past."]="当麦格尼国王陛下过来找我谈有关节日的事情时，我简直要兴奋得疯过去了。我对他说，有了我这侏儒的一些微小帮助，我们就能制造出一场令所有人都会难以忘怀的盛宴。不过，国王陛下喜欢比较朴素和传统的风格，他更看中缅怀过去之类的事情。"
G["When Lolo doesn't wanna spill any o' his precious ale or get his lil' dress dirty, I'm called in. Yep. Ol' Hansel is the dwarf they use to mete out a lil' bit o' justice an' a whole lotta pain."]="当洛洛尔不想撒掉他宝贵的酒或者弄脏他衣服的时候，我就被召唤而来。是的。汉瑟尔就是别人口中正义和痛苦的结合体。"
G["When Rocket-Chief Fuselage was asking for volunteers to help out with building the X-52 Nether-Rocket, I submitted my resume for the security division.\n\nUnfortunately, the only position that was left was chief engineer.  Lucky for me, I have Xyrol here to look over my shoulder."]="当火箭主管弗斯拉格寻求志愿者来帮助他建造X-52虚空火箭的时候，我向安全工程部门投递了简历。\n\n不幸的是，唯一剩下的职位只有主工程师了。对我来说幸运的是，有塞希罗在这里盯着我不要犯错。"
G["When Stormwind is secure, we will take this fight to the Highlands."]="等守住了暴风城，就该轮到我们把战火烧到暮光高地了！"
G["When Vol'jin come back ta us, I saw he was changed. Da light a' revolution be burnin' in his eyes!"]="在他回归之后，我发现他变了。他的眼中燃烧着变革的光辉！"
G["When a customer has been selected, click on an open seat and the customer will go sit there."]="选中一名客人后，点击一个空位，客人就会过去入座了。"
G["When all this is over, I'm going to recommend you for an Alliance Mark of Honor."]="当这一切都结束后，我会建议上头为你颁发一枚联盟荣誉奖章的。"
G["When all you have is your fists, everything looks like a face."]="当你只剩下拳头的时候，你就会觉得看什么都像脸……"
G["When am I not respectful?  You hurt me, Aysa."]="我哪里不恭敬了？我太伤心了，艾莎。"
G["When are we going to get some more magical flasks?"]="我们什么时候再去弄些不可思议的合剂？"
G["When can we eat again?"]="什么时候再开饭？"
G["When can we go home?"]="我们什么时候可以回家？"
G["When can we reopen our shops? I'm losing gold here!"]="商店什么时候才能重新开业啊？我一直在亏损！"
G["When counting past 3, continue to 5. Never stop at 4. Most bad fortune for those who stop on four."]="当你数到3时，就一定要继续数到5。不要在数到4时停下来。厄运总是会降在那些数到4的人身上。"
G["When d'ye think we can leave?  I need ta get back to work."]="你认为我什么时候能离开？我还要回去工作呢。"
G["When dawn rises, the hammer shall fall."]="在黎明破晓时分，重锤将要砸落。"
G["When did the mogu learn to wield magic portals?"]="魔古族什么时候学会了使用魔法传送门？"
G["When did you arrive on this island?"]="你是什么时候抵达这座岛的？"
G["When disruptions are detected by our watchers, we are charged with their repair."]="当观察者发现了时间的扰动后，我们将负责修复。"
G["When do your people counter-attack? Tell me and I'll end your suffering."]="你们的人准备什么时候发动反攻？告诉我，我就终结你的痛苦。"
G["When does de trainin' start?"]="训练什么时候开始？"
G["When dwarves fly! They do? Then yes!"]="如果矮人会飞，答案就是“是”。他们真的会飞？那就是咯！"
G["When everyone else is busy with their own problems, you've only got two options. You can be another problem begging for help, or you can carry your own weight. The People's Militia is here to carry Westfall's weight."]="Cuando todos están ocupados con sus propios problemas, sólo tienes dos opciones: ser otro problema que pide ayuda o cargar tu propio peso. La Milicia Popular está aquí para cargar el peso de los Páramos de Poniente."
G["When faced with challenges the like you have never seen, what do you hope for? What is the future you seek?"]="在面对空前的挑战时，你有着怎样的期盼？你想要怎样的未来？"
G["When facing a spellcaster of any kind, this feral beast will be your best friend. Now, let us take a look at something a bit different. This next creature will aid your travels and make your future journeys much easier. Let's take a look at a felsteed."]="当遇见施法者的时候，这种恶魔是你最好的朋友。现在，让我们进行一下讲的课程。这种召唤生物主要被用来帮助你更快地旅行。它就是地狱战马，有时也被称为梦魇。"
G["When have the dwarves ever been our friends?"]="什么时候连矮人都变成了我们的朋友？"
G["When he came upon the refugees at the Greymane Wall, he felt it his duty to succor them, sending his woman on to Hillsbrad."]="当他在格雷迈恩之墙碰到那些难民的时候，他想要帮助他们，于是就把他的女人送到了希尔斯布莱德。"
G["When he says, 'younger brother,' he fails to mention that we're twins. He's really only older by a couple of minutes.\n\nDon't let that 'rising star' bit of his fool you. I'll never be a trader of the same magnitude that he is."]="Cuando dice \"hermano menor\", olvida mencionar que somos gemelos. En realidad solo es mayor por un par de minutos.\n\nNo dejéis que su historia de la \"nueva promesa\" os engañe. Nunca seré un mercader de la misma magnitud que él."
G["When he was given to us by 'Prince' Kael'thas, we believed his power would help us lead our people into a new age."]="当他还是我们所敬仰的凯尔萨斯王子时，我们以为他的力量能引领我们的人民进入一个崭新的时代。"
G["When is daddy coming back, mom?"]="爸爸什么时候回来，妈妈？"
G["When is it ever wise not to act for the greater good?"]="面对大义而无所作为，何时成了智慧？"
G["When is pappa coming back from the fights in Warsong? It has been so long..."]="爸爸什么时候才能从战歌峡谷回来呢？他离开很久啦……"
G["When it becomes difficult to tell friend from foe..."]="当面对敌友难分的情境时……"
G["When it comes to treasure, never be lookin' sideways at lootin' someone else's junk. Stolen goods be much sweeter, ya? But free is free, no matta how it got that way!"]="说到财宝，永远不要轻视翻捡别人的垃圾的行为。偷来的财宝更加珍贵，是吗？但是免费的东西就是好的，无论你采用什么方式！"
G["When lightning strikes the ocean why don't all the fish die?"]="当闪电击中海洋的时候，为什么所有的鱼都没有死？"
G["When man asks favor of a fish..."]="当一个人有求于一条鱼的时候……"
G["When me and my Wildhammer Mercenaries were hired on to secure Fort Triumph, I imagined we'd be fighting the Horde.\n\nBut we're set on from all sides! 'Sploding goblins, burrowing bugs, electro-fied lizards..."]="当我和我的蛮锤佣兵受雇守卫凯旋壁垒的时候，我以为我们的敌人将是部落。\n\n但现在我们却陷入了无数敌人的围困之中！爆炸的地精，挖洞的虫子，放电的蜥蜴……"
G["When mounted on the back of a wind rider, one sees that its reputation for strength and speed is well earned."]="当坐在一个驭风者背上时，你就会发现它的力量和速度的确不是徒有虚名。"
G["When my druids and I were ambushed by renegade orcs, you challenged Warchief Garrosh to trial by combat to answer for their deaths, chieftain."]="当我和我的德鲁伊们遭到变节兽人的伏击，您向加尔鲁什酋长提出决斗来为死去的族人伸张正义，酋长。"
G["When my journey began, I was reckless in my strength. The White Tiger taught me control. My hatred, anger, and violence were vanquished."]="当旅程开始时，我只会鲁莽地运用自己的力量。白虎教我学会控制，从而征服了我的仇恨、愤怒和暴虐。"
G["When my son found a blue feather, he used to say that it was a kiss from his mother, up in the sky.\n\n<Old Hillpaw pauses, too choked up to continue.>"]="每当我的儿子找到一根蓝色羽毛时，常会说那是他在天国的妈妈，给他的一个吻。\n\n<老农山掌停顿住，因为哽噎无法继续。>"
G["When next we meet I shall require much more to justify your life."]="下次见面时，你的性命可就没法如此轻易地保住了！"
G["When next we meet, it won't be on holy ground, paladin."]="下一次，我们就不会在这片圣地上决战了，圣骑士。"
G["When one Shado-Pan falls, another steps forward to take his place."]="当一名影踪派成员倒下时，总会有更多战友站出来顶上他的位置。"
G["When one studies and digs, one reveals the truth."]="人们只要专注于研究和挖掘，他们就能发现真相。"
G["When one virtue is lost, cling to those that remain."]="如果你失去了一项美德，就必须牢牢把握剩余的那些。"
G["When our duty here is behind us, I shall find a way to repay you for my rescue."]="当我们完成使命后，会设法报答你的救命之恩的。"
G["When our fury is unleashed, our enemies will cower!"]="当我们释放出怒火，我们的敌人就只会瑟缩不已！"
G["When our supplies are high, Field Marshal Teravaine is stationed in the Field of Strife, at our southernmost ballista emplacement."]="一旦我们拥有充足的物资供给，指挥官特拉瓦雷就会前往征战平原，驻守在我们最南端的弩车附近。"
G["When our supplies are high, Warmaster Garrick is stationed in the Field of Strife at a catapult, north of Iceblood Garrison."]="一旦我们拥有丰富的物资供给，霜狼突击队队长就会驻守在冰血要塞以北的征战平原，就在攻城机旁边。"
G["When preparing the dragon's meal, be sure to torture the prisoner in view of the dragon.  It responds well to pre-meal entertainment."]="当准备龙的食物时，一定要给它找点乐子。它对饭前娱乐反应不错。"
G["When pushed to the edge, results may become unpredictable..."]="当被逼入绝境，结果可能是无法预料的……"
G["When she tried to forbid the swarm, it was to prevent, as she put it, \"a senseless loss of life.\""]="Cuando trató de prohibir el enjambre, era para evitar, según dijo, \"una pérdida de vidas sin sentido\"."
G["When should I open my eyes?"]="我什么时候才能睁开眼睛？"
G["When standing on the precipice, do not forget to breathe."]="站在悬崖边上时，不要忘记了呼吸。"
G["When that day comes, seek all the light and wonder of this world, and fight."]="到那时，寻求这世上所有的光明与奇迹，并奋战到底。"
G["When the Burning Legion turned the orcs against the draenei, the fiercest battle was fought here. The draenei fought tooth and nail, but in the end the city fell."]="当燃烧军团诱使兽人和德莱尼人反目成仇时，激烈的战斗就在这里爆发了。尽管德莱尼人浴血奋战，但最后，城市还是沦陷了。"
G["When the Cataclysm happened, the links bounding elementals across Azeroth weakened significantly.  One such elemental, Aquementas, is no longer imprisoned.  I hear he's causing some major problems for the Southsea gang!"]="大灾变发生时，艾泽拉斯元素间的连结大大弱化了。其中一个元素——亚奎门塔斯，获得了自由。我听说他正在给南海海盗制造不小的麻烦！"
G["When the Cataclysm struck, I decided the time had come to part the mists ... and help heal our broken world."]="当大灾变降临时，我意识到散去迷雾的时刻到了……我们要协助治愈这个破碎的世界。"
G["When the Darkmoon Faire arrives, where will it be located?"]="暗月马戏团会在哪儿开张呢？"
G["When the Darkmoon Faire is open, it will be located in Elwynn Forest.  We'll be pitching our tents just south of Goldshire!"]="当暗月马戏团开始展览的时候，他们会出现在艾尔文森林。我们的帐篷将驻扎在闪金镇的南边！"
G["When the Darkmoon Faire is open, it will be located in Terokkar Forest in Outland.  We'll be pitching our tents just south of Shattrath City!"]="当暗月马戏团开始展览的时候，他们会出现在泰罗卡森林。我们会在沙塔斯城南边搭建帐篷！"
G["When the Darkmoon Faire opens, it will be located in Mulgore.  We'll be pitching our tents just southwest of Thunder Bluff!"]="暗月马戏团将会在莫高雷开张，我们就在雷霆崖的西南方安营扎寨！"
G["When the Earthwarder began to recover, he became ill content with the quiet. With the peace. It was not long before he turned the stone dragons upon us.\n\nWith Deathwing gone, they are without purpose again. We can remind them of our strength. Bring them back to the Earthmother."]="当大地守护者逐渐恢复的时候，他开始不满足于这里的安静与和平。没过多久，他就驱使岩石巨龙攻击我们。\n\n死亡之翼离开之后，它们一直没有明确的目标。我们能够让它们明白我们的力量，再次将它们送回到大地母神的怀抱中。"
G["When the Horde finally show their ugly faces, we'll be ready."]="当部落那群野兽最终露出他们狰狞的面孔时，我们会准备好的。"
G["When the Horde was shattered, men returned here and began to rebuild the once great city as a testament to our own survival."]="部落被击败之后，人们回到这里重建这座伟大的城市，纪念那些为保卫我们而献出生命的勇士。"
G["When the SI:7 found me, they wanted to take me home. I ran away.\n\nIt wasn't long before the Horde found me.\n\nDuring the battle at Serpent's Heart, I managed to slip away in the chaos. A merchant allowed me to ride with his family as they fled west, to Zhu's Watch.\n\nIt was there that I met Mei Barrelbottom.\n\nShe told me of the Crane Wing order, and on her advice I accompanied a courier to the temple to seek an audience with Chi-Ji, the Red Crane.\n\nI was studying with the disciples there when the sha arrived."]="当军情七处的特工人员找到我时，他们想带我回家。可我却跑掉了。\n\n过了没多久，部落发现了我。\n\n在神龙之心的战斗中，我趁乱逃了出来。有位商人正携家眷逃往西边的朱家堡，他愿意载我一程。\n\n我就是在那里遇见梅·残酒的。\n\n她向我介绍了这个名为鹤翼的组织，并建议我陪同信使前往寺院，与朱鹤赤精会面。\n\n当邪煞出现时，我正在和其他门徒一起修炼。"
G["When the Sundering ripped apart the continents of Azeroth, we pandaren thought that the rest of the world had been utterly destroyed."]="当分裂之力将艾泽拉斯大陆撕扯开来时，我们熊猫人以为世界其它地区都遭到了彻底毁灭。"
G["When the blaze subsided, a cloud serpent hatching could be seen flying around the center of the lake. Its scales sparked with storm and fire, and where it flew, great clouds formed in the sky. My people named it Alani, the Stormborn."]="当大火平息，云端翔龙孵化，在湖中心周围飞行。它的鳞屑点燃风暴和火焰。在它所到之处，天空中呈现祥云朵朵。我的人把它称为阿拉尼，风暴之子的意思。"
G["When the cataclysm struck Azeroth, it disrupted the cloaking mechanism that kept this terrace hidden.  At that point, it was only a matter of time until the intelligent races discovered me here.\n\nThis was a scenario that, quite honestly, we did not foresee.  It required us to perform some new tests.  And you, $n, are my test subject."]="当大灾变肆虐艾泽拉斯的时候，也打破了保证这一地区处于隐藏状态的屏蔽系统。如此一来，具有智慧的种族发现我就只是时间问题了。\n\n老实说，我们此前并未预见过这种情况。所以现在，我们需要进行一些新的测试。而你，$n，就是我的测试对象。"
G["When the doctor returns, your pitiful Shadow Vault will be laid to waste."]="等博士回来，暗影拱顶就会变成一片废墟。"
G["When the guards pay you a visit, I'm sure you'll have no problem explaining how you got your hands on those Uldum artifacts or that lovely painting."]="等警卫来找你谈话的时候，但愿你能解释清楚那些奥丹姆遗物，或者那副漂亮的画作的来历。"
G["When the land ails, the spirits are first to feel the ill tiding. When the spirits leave the temple and fall to their baser instincts, the wise Pandaren takes heed."]="当大地遭受苦难时，元素之灵们首先察觉到了凶兆。当元素之灵离开五晨寺，各按本能行事时，睿智的熊猫人发现了端倪。"
G["When the last emperor hid our land from the rest of the world, he also preserved the homeland of our ancient enemy, the mantid. Why did he do this?"]="当末代皇帝将我们的土地与外部世界隔离时，他也留下了我们的宿敌，螳螂妖。他为什么这么做？"
G["When the little ones come, I won't hold back like I am with you."]="要是那帮小东西敢杀进来，我可不会像跟你对练的时候那样克制。"
G["When the mind grows hungry for inspiration, feed it with beautiful things."]="当思维渴望灵感时，请看些美丽的东西。"
G["When the positively aligned energies collide with the negatively charged energies, they don't negate one another."]="当正极能量与负极能量相碰的时候，它们互不相容。"
G["When the rep is talking to you, he will start each line with your name.  If you don't see your name, he's not yet speaking to you."]="当机器人和您说话时，他的每句话都会以您的名字开始。如果您没看到自己的名字，那么说明他还没有和您说话。"
G["When the river turns left or right, flow along it instead of fight."]="当河流转向时，我们应该顺应潮流，而非逆势而上。"
G["When the sha attack began, every one of my students ran to battle without hesitation.\n\nI have taught them much, but yet they continue to surpass my expectations."]="当煞魔开始攻击的时候，我所有的弟子都毫不犹豫地出去战斗了。\n\n我教了他们很多东西，但他们的表现总能超出我的期望。"
G["When the shaking stopped, his true motives were revealed. We were trapped, and he was slowly draining our powers."]="当震动停下来的时候，他的真实目的暴露出来了。我们都被困住了，而他在慢慢地汲取我们的能量。"
G["When the silkworm makes its cocoon, we use this device to extract the silk."]="在蚕作茧时，我们就用这件设备来抽取蚕丝。"
G["When the time is right, I'll use this staff to bring the walls of Orgrimmar crashing down around Garrosh Hellscream's head."]="如果有机会的话，我会用这根法杖炸毁奥格瑞玛的城墙，让它砸到加尔鲁什·地狱咆哮的头上。"
G["When the time is right, my lady. All will be clear when the time is right. The master stirs even now. Look to the skies for the Brood of Nozdormu have returned."]="我的女士，时机成熟时，一切都将真相大白。即使是现在，主人也还在活动中。看那天空，诺兹多姆的子嗣回来了。"
G["When the tournament starts, all will see the Forsaken emerge triumphant."]="锦标赛开始后，所有人都将见证被遗忘者的胜利。"
G["When the trial begins, shadows from under you will periodically break free, traveling to a nearby portal to summon a Weeping Soul."]="当试炼开始的时候，来自你脚下的暗影将周期性地突破禁制，进入附近的传送门，召唤来一个泣灵。"
G["When the usurpers came - the ones you call \"Titans\" - Y'shaarj was destroyed."]="Cuando llegaron los usurpadores, aquellos a los que llamas \"titanes\", destruyeron a Y'Shaarj."
G["When the weaker Kodo died, The Wolf approached and tried to eat it."]="当较软弱的科多兽死亡的时候，孤狼走上前，要吃掉它。"
G["When the work of a blacksmith reaches your level of expert craftsmanship, I present them with a choice.\n\nWhile you are not required to make a choice, it is recommended that you do - after all, do you want to be a neophyte forever? It is the artisan armorsmiths and weaponsmiths that supply our armies, win our wars and garner acclaim!\n\nBe warned, $n. Once a choice is made and the tasks required completed - there is no going back. One can only walk down one path."]="Cuando el trabajo de un herrero alcanza el grado de experto, le planteo una elección.\n\nNo tienes por qué tomar una decisión, pero es mejor hacerlo. Después de todo no querrás ser siempre $gun neófito:una neófita;, ¿verdad? Son los artesanos forjadores de armaduras y de armas los que equipan a nuestros ejércitos, ganan nuestras guerras y cosechan los aplausos.\n\nPero $gatento:atenta;, $n. Cuando hagas tu elección y completes las tareas necesarias, ya no habrá vuelta atrás. Solo se puede seguir un camino."
G["When the wounded arrive, we will be putting them up in the Inn while we tend to their recovery. Please find us there when you return."]="当伤员到达时，我们要将他们安置在旅店里，照料他们。你回来的时候，就请去那里找我们吧。"
G["When these creatures die, they explode... I know, kill them near Shai Hu!"]="这些怪物死时会爆炸……我知道了，我们可以在刹嗳呼身边杀死它们！"
G["When these monsters came, the Shado-Pan got so serious... they kept saying, \"Sha\". What's that?"]="Cuando llegaron estos monstruos, los Shadopan se pusieron muy serios... no dejaban de decir \"Sha\". ¿Qué es eso?"
G["When they are completed, you will hide these devices all over Orgrimmar."]="当它们完成的时候，你就要把这些装置分散放在奥格瑞玛各处。"
G["When they are completed, you will hide these devices all over Stormwind."]="当它们完成的时候，你就要将这些装置隐藏在暴风城各处。"
G["When this is all over I'm gonna buy you a drink, $n."]="等这一切都结束之后，我要请你喝一杯，$n。"
G["When this is all over, I'm taking a vacation."]="等这一切都尘埃落定之后，我要度假休息段日子。"
G["When this is over, you may want to brush up on your secrecy skills...."]="当这里的事情结束时，你也许要磨砺一下你的秘密技巧……"
G["When time permits, we must speak at length.  For we have much to discuss."]="如果时间允许的话，我们得好好谈一下。因为我们有很多事情要讨论。"
G["When times are dark, it is best to turn on a light."]="当黑暗来临，最好还是点亮一盏明灯。"
G["When two great empires reunite, the world will crumble around them..."]="当两个伟大的帝国重新合并，整个世界都会在他们面前颤抖……"
G["When using the mallet on the Divine Bell, the pandaren monks were able to create pure harmony."]="当熊猫人武僧使用这把钟杵敲响圣钟，就能产生纯净的祥和之力。"
G["When war came to Pandaria's shores, our hero was ready."]="当战火降临，我们的英雄早有准备。"
G["When was your last check up?"]="你上一次体检是在什么时候？"
G["When we face the Thunder King we will be prepared."]="当我们直面雷电之王时，我们一定会做好准备。"
G["When we get back, I'm gonna kill Petrov!"]="等我们回去，我一定要杀了派特洛夫！"
G["When we have control of the expedition again, everything will be fine..."]="等我们重新控制住探险队，一切都会好起来的……"
G["When we heard call of the ravage, we darkened the very skies with our numbers."]="当毁灭的召唤降临，我族的大军遮天蔽日。"
G["When we make it back to the Retreat, we can tap these and toast to life!"]="当我们把这些酒带回住所后，就可以开桶庆祝，为胜利干杯了！"
G["When we move, we'll move fast. Be prepared to put to rest anything that gets in our way."]="一旦我们开始行动，速度会很快。请你做好准备，帮助我们扫清路上的障碍。"
G["When we returned from Deepholm, we found that the Twilight's Hammer had established a base here and taken control of the elemental portals.\n\nPlease, $n, you must stop them before Cho'gall can complete whatever it is that he's up to inside the Bastion of Twilight!"]="Cuando regresamos de Infralar, descubrimos que el Martillo Crepuscular había establecido una base aquí y se había hecho con el control de los portales elementales.\n\n¡Por favor, $n, debes detenerlos antes de que Cho'gall pueda completar lo que sea que está haciendo dentro de El Bastión del Crepúsculo!"
G["When we saw that the ships had been burned by those savage beasts our hearts sank. Never have I felt so helpless..."]="看着那些被野蛮人烧毁的船只，我们的心情仿佛跌到了谷底。说实话，我从来没有觉得如此无助……"
G["When we spoke previously, you offered to repay the favor. I may have to act on that sooner than I would have liked."]="你曾经承诺过会还我的人情。现在，我只能让你履行你的承诺了。"
G["When we start tour?"]="我们什么时候出发？"
G["When we use the hides of the animals we must fell for food or protection we give honor to the Earth Mother and respect to the animal.  Chaw Stronghide can teach you of such things.  You will find him in the great tent at the northwest corner of Bloodhoof Village."]="当我们使用动物的皮革时我们必须热爱食物或带给我们的保护，我们给大地母亲以荣誉并尊敬动物。查尔·硬皮会教给你这些事情。你可以在血蹄村西北角的大帐篷找到他。"
G["When we were ambushed by Rom'ogg he threw chains around Raz and then hit him with the |cff71d5ff|Hspell:75543|h[The Skullcracker]|h|r! Luckily I moved away before he landed that final blow!"]="当我们被罗姆欧格伏击时，他用锁链将拉兹困住，然后用|cff71d5ff|Hspell:75543|h[碎颅]|h|r攻击他！幸好我在被他最后一击命中前走开了！"
G["When we were packed into the Town-In-A-Box, they told us we'd be deployed somewhere in Azshara. Is this Azshara?\n\nI ask you: who prepares a Town-In-A-Box and doesn't supply it with enough food to live on?! One measly Poultryizer?!\n\nWe all know how the \"Micro\" Mechachicken worked out."]="Cuando nos metieron en la Ciudad de Bolsillo, nos dijeron que nos reasentarían en alguna parte de Azshara. ¿Esto es Azshara?\n\nY yo me pregunto: ¿a quién se le ocurre preparar una Ciudad de Bolsillo sin proveer la comida suficiente para vivir? ¡Un mísero Pollotizador!\n\nTodos sabemos cómo resultó el \"micro\" mecapollo."
G["When we're done here, those Frostmanes will fear us more than the troggs. They'll have no choice but to leave."]="等我们完成之后，那些霜鬃巨魔会把我们看作是比穴居人更可怕的对手。他们只能离开，别无选择。"
G["When will someone do something about the undead?"]="什么时候才会有人来对付这些亡灵？"
G["When will the tour start?"]="什么时候出发？"
G["When will they learn?"]="他们什么时候才能吸取教训？"
G["When will they learn? When will they see that the Horde exists BECAUSE of the Alliance? Because of their prejudice and their bigotry!? They force us ever closer to Hellscream's Horde."]="他们何时才能明白，才能看清？正是联盟的偏见与猜忌促成了部落！？他们把我们推向了地狱咆哮的部落。"
G["When will this city be done?  Everytime I think im done they tell me I need to work for one more day..."]="什么时候这个城市会完工？三年之后又三年，三年之后又三年……"
G["When will this end?"]="什么时候才能结束？"
G["When will this tour start?"]="什么时候出发？"
G["When will we start this tour?"]="我们什么时候出发？"
G["When you absolutely, positively must kill NOW, the heavy bomb is the way to go. Heavy bombs have a much larger radius and cause much more damage. The downside is that you can carry far fewer heavy bombs than you can light bombs and you must wait longer between uses."]="当你确定必须消灭某个目标时，重磅炸弹是你的首选。重磅炸弹的爆炸范围更大，能造成的伤害更高。缺点就是你只能带很少的重磅炸弹——要比轻型炸弹少得多，而且每次使用的间隔时间很长。"
G["When you and Haohan have a friendship like yours, there's no doubt the head of the Tillers Union himself would drop by to lend a hand."]="当你和郝瀚成为挚友时，毫无疑问他这个阡陌客的首领会向你伸出援手给予帮助。"
G["When you are a genius, you have to put up with a lot of strange actions."]="一个天才应该容忍别人的怪异举动。"
G["When you are at the Brewfest grounds, have a drink for me, $c!"]="到了美酒之地，别忘了为我祝酒，$c！"
G["When you are dying, beast, remember that I gave you a choice."]="在临死之前，畜生，记得我曾给过你机会。"
G["When you are finished with your duties, report to Ban Bearheart. I am leaving him in command for the duration of the mission here."]="当你完成任务之后，立即向你们的指挥官班·熊心报告。我已经派他全权负责这里的任务了。"
G["When you are on your own, your enemies will not be as kind as I."]="Cuando estés $gsolo:sola;, los enemigos no serán tan considerados como yo."
G["When you are ready I will place you atop my head and we will march into the heart of the Scourge in Zul'Drak. You must direct me to smash and destroy our enemies!"]="Cuando estés $glisto:lista; te colocaré sobre mi cabeza y marcharemos hacia el corazón de la Plaga en Zul'Drak. ¡Deberás dirigirme para aplastar y destruir a nuestros enemigos!"
G["When you are ready to fly to Durnholde, let me know and I shall take you."]="Cuando estés $glisto:lista; para volar a Durnholde, házmelo saber y te llevaré."
G["When you are ready to seek a new specialization, seek Narain Soothfancy.   He can be found in Steamwheedle Port in Tanaris."]="Cuando estés $gpreparado:preparada; para buscar una nueva especialidad, busca a Narain Sabelotodo. Se le puede encontrar en el Puerto Bonvapor, en Tanaris."
G["When you are ready to test for the rank of valiant, I will call forth a member of the Argent Crusade."]="Cuando estés preparad$go:a; para ponerte a prueba para el rango de Valeros$go:a;, llamaré a un miembro de la Cruzada Argenta."
G["When you are ready, touch the altar to begin."]="Cuando estés $glisto:lista;, toca el altar para empezar."
G["When you chose this path, you bound your life to that of your serpent. Do not fail them now!"]="你选择了这条道路，将自己的生命和翔龙联系在了一起。可别辜负了它们！"
G["When you found the sword, it was broken and abandoned, much like Silvermoon after Kael'thas's betrayal."]="当你找到那把剑时，那把剑已经是残破不堪、无人问津了，更像是被凯尔萨斯出卖了的银月城。"
G["When you get a chance do you think you could let me out of here?"]="要是有机会的话，你觉得你能让我离开这里吗？"
G["When you get a ram, you also get the reins. These aren't your grandma's reins though, you've gotta use them!\n\nJust loosen up on the reins a few times to build up some speed.  Keep on loosening up and GIDDYUP!  You'll be flying!\n\nBut the faster he goes the quicker he'll get tired. So you have to be careful."]="Cuando te dan un carnero, también te entregan las riendas. Pero estas no son las riendas de la abuelita, estas tienes que usarlas.\n\nUsa las riendas para conseguir velocidad. Sigue usándolas y ¡arre! ¡Estarás volando!"
G["When you get hurt bad, remember rest and get strong again. Dajik show you how right now..."]="如果你受了重伤，一定要好好休息，恢复精力。达伊克现在就教你该怎么做……"
G["When you get me out of this cage, we're going to make them wish they were never awakened!"]="等我离开这个牢笼，我们就要让这帮维库人尝尝厉害，让他们后悔苏醒过来！"
G["When you give love tokens to townsfolk, you'll receive different gifts in return.  Some of those you'll want to keep and use, but others can be bundled together and given to your favorite hero!  Visit Kwee Q. Peddlefeet to turn them in.\n\nKwee can be found near Bolvar, Magni, or Tyrande."]="Cuando entregues pruebas de amor a los habitantes de la ciudad, recibirás diferentes regalos a cambio. Algunos podrás guardarlos y utilizarlos, y otros ¡podrás juntarlos y dárselos a tu $ghéroe favorito:heroína favorita;! Visita a Kwee Q. Pies Rápidos y entrégaselos.\n\nEncontrarás a Kwee cerca de Bolvar, Magni o Tyrande."
G["When you give love tokens to townsfolk, you'll receive different gifts in return.  Some of those you'll want to keep and use, but others can be bundled together and given to your favorite hero!  Visit Kwee Q. Peddlefeet to turn them in.\n\nKwee can be found near Cairne, Sylvanas and Thrall."]="Cuando entregues pruebas de amor a los habitantes de la ciudad, recibirás diferentes regalos a cambio. Algunos podrás guardarlos y utilizarlos, ¡mientras que otros podrás juntarlos y dárselos a tu $ghéroe favorito:heroína favorita;! Visita a Kwee Q. Pies Rápidos y entrégaselos.\n\nEncontrarás a Kwee cerca de Cairne, Sylvanas o Thrall."
G["When you go into combat, it is important that you know how to intimidate the enemy with a deafening battle roar!"]="当你进入战斗的时候，知道如何用震耳欲聋的战吼威吓敌人是非常重要的！"
G["When you have lived as long as I, it becomes easy to forget about love for years. It is always good to be reminded."]="如果你像我一样活了这么久的话，就会很容易把爱情的感觉遗忘。有人提起这种感觉来总是好事情。"
G["When you have not a healer to tend to your wounds, the knowledge of First Aid can be a lifesaver.  I would consult Dannelor over at the Craftsmen's Terrace for instruction on this skill."]="当你没有医师来料理你的伤口时，急救知识可以救你的性命。我会请教工匠区的丹纳罗尔关于这门技艺的问题。"
G["When you kill the Pit Master, spit on his corpse for me, will you?"]="在你打败矿坑的头目以后，替我向他的尸体吐口水，好吗？"
G["When you next go to the Molten Core, kill a Firelord for me, will you?"]="当你下次去熔火之心时，请为我杀死一个火焰之王，行吗？"
G["When you run with Razak's Roughriders, you learn a thing or two about following orders.\n\nThe first thing is that you fight until you die.  The second thing is, see the first thing."]="当你和拉沙克驯马师一起逃跑的时候，你会学到这么两件事。\n\n第一件是：战斗，直到死亡；第二件是：参照第一件事。"
G["When you say Stormstout, you've said it all."]="Si te digo \"Cerveza de Trueno\", no hace falta saber más."
G["When you stand at the Altar of Damnation and see the spirits of the damned, kneeling in prayer, what you do not see is me, standing next to Gul'dan.\n\n<Oronok nods.>\n\nI told you that I was a lot of things, did I not? One of those 'things' was a lieutenant of Gul'dan.\n\nI have done many terrible things in my life. I have slaughtered man, woman, and child alike. Danced in the blood of innocent draenei... yet...\n\n<Oronok chokes on his words.>"]="当你在诅咒祭坛下跪祈祷时，你只看到那些被诅咒的灵魂，却没有看到站在古尔丹身旁的我。\n\n<欧鲁诺克点了点头。>\n\n我是一个经历过许多事情的人，我告诉过你吗？其中之一就是我曾担任过古尔丹的军官。\n\n一生之中我做了很多可怕的事情。我杀死过男人、女人，甚至还有孩童。我还在无辜的德莱尼人的鲜血中跳舞……然而……\n\n<欧鲁诺克哽咽地说着。>"
G["When you stay at an inn, you rest very comfortably.  Because of this, you will become \"well rested\" much more quickly than you would in the wilderness.  When you are well rested, you learn more from experience.\n\nYou may also speak with any innkeeper to get a hearthstone, and can later use the hearthstone in order to quickly return to that inn."]="Cuando te quedas en una posada, descansas cómodamente. Por esta razón, estarás \"más descansado\" en mucho menos tiempo que si lo haces en el bosque. Cuando descansas bien, aprendes más de la experiencia.\n\nAsimismo, puedes pedirle al tabernero que te consiga una piedra de hogar para luego usarla con el fin de regresar rápidamente a la posada."
G["When you take one of these tasks, we'll lend you a ram. It's a loan, so it won't last forever. The ram may seem slow, but just ease up on the reins a bit and he'll pick up the pace.\n\nOur rams love apples. We've put a few bushels of apples out along the way, so make sure to stop by. Eating apples will make your ram forget about how tired he's been getting."]="在你接受了任务之后，我们会借给你一头山羊。只是借你而已，所以你不能永远拥有它。山羊可能看上去有点慢，不过只要甩几下缰绳，它就会加快速度。\n\n我们的山羊爱吃苹果。我们已经在一路上放了很多苹果，记得顺路吃几个。吃苹果会让你的山羊忘记疲惫。"
G["When you're doggone tired, it's mighty easy to slip up on the job, pardner! Be sure to get at least two hours' rest between shifts!"]="当你极度困乏的时候，工作就很容易出纰漏，朋友！换班时务必要保证至少两小时睡眠啊！"
G["When you're done visiting this exotic city, perhaps you would be interested in celebrating with us. The Lunar Festival is underway in Moonglade; the other cities have transport to the festivities. Come and join the other revelers!"]="逛完了这座奇异的城市之后，也许你会有兴趣和我们一起来庆祝。春节庆典正在月光林地进行着，其它城市也都有前往庆典的传送点。过来和我们一起狂欢吧！"
G["When you're off duty, let's go to the inn. I'll buy a round and we can reminisce about the good old days."]="等你下班以后，我请你去旅店喝上几杯，一起回忆过去的美好时光。"
G["When's the last time you cleaned that weapon, Holmberg?"]="赫姆伯格，你上次清理武器是在什么时候？"
G["Whenever you get the GUTS to come back here, you better be ready.  'Cause Jin'do's got a surprise for you..."]="等你有勇气回到这里时，可一定要做好准备。因为金度为你准备了一份惊喜……"
G["Whenever you need me, I'll be here."]="任何时候只要你需要我，我都在这儿。"
G["Whenever you're ready, Duarn."]="你准备好就可以开始了，达鲁。"
G["Where I can find Oben Rageclaw?"]="奥本·怒爪在哪里？"
G["Where I come from, you get shanked for opening another inmate's cell door!"]="在我所在的地方，你会因为打开其他牢友的门而受惩罚的！"
G["Where Jones goes, I go.  Where he steps, I step.  But this time he told me to stay back."]="他上哪儿，我就上哪儿。我一直跟着他，可这次他却叫我留下来。"
G["Where am I?"]="我这是在哪儿？"
G["Where am I?  Hic!"]="我在哪儿？嗝！"
G["Where am I?  I crashed with the Exodar and now stumbled into this imposing city..."]="我在何处？我和埃索达一起坠毁了，却撞见了这座壮观的城市……"
G["Where am I?  So dark..."]="我在哪儿？好黑啊……"
G["Where am I?  Who are you?  Oh no!  What happened to the ship?"]="我在哪？你是谁？天啊！飞船怎么了？"
G["Where am I? Are we underground?"]="我在哪里？我们在地下吗？"
G["Where am I? What happened to me? You... you freed me?"]="我在哪里？发生了什么事？是你……救了我？"
G["Where am I? What is this place?"]="接受十字军之力的审判吧！"
G["Where am I? What--"]="我在哪里？这是怎么——"
G["Where am I? Who are you? What's that strange feeling?"]="我在哪儿？你是谁？为什么我的感觉这么奇怪？"
G["Where am I? You be here to help?"]="我在哪里？你是来帮忙的吗？"
G["Where am Jooga?"]="尤噶在哪？"
G["Where are all the corpses? What have they done to our people?"]="尸体都到哪儿去了？他们对村民们做了什么？"
G["Where are all these troggs coming from?  Were they livin' underground the whole time?"]="那些穴居人到底是从哪里来的？他们一直都住在地下吗？"
G["Where are all those wonderful winter hats coming from?"]="那些漂亮的圣诞帽是哪里来的？"
G["Where are my heals you scrub-chinned-lizard-nub?!"]="我的治疗呢？！你这下巴长毛的爬虫小渣滓！"
G["Where are my recovered cannonballs?"]="那些捡回的炮弹呢？"
G["Where are our men, scoundrel? I want answers!"]="我们的人都在哪里，混蛋？回答我！"
G["Where are our reinforcements?"]="我们的援军呢？"
G["Where are the Plates of Uldum?"]="奥丹姆圆盘在哪里？"
G["Where are the barrels? Did you lose the barrels? We need more barrels!"]="那些桶呢？被你弄丢了？我们需要更多的桶！"
G["Where are the northern sentries? I didn't spot a single one of your men before reaching the camp. You grow lax, Gao-Ran."]="北边的哨探在哪里？你的人全都龟缩在营地，居然没人放哨侦查。你开始松懈了，高岚。"
G["Where are the other Stormstouts? Why are hozen all over the brewery?"]="风暴烈酒家的其他人去哪儿了？这里怎么都是猢狲？"
G["Where are the so-called heroes of this world?  Too frightened to come out and play?"]="所谓的英雄在哪儿？心里害怕不敢出来玩吗？"
G["Where are the titans in our time of greatest need? Our women birth abberations - disfigured runts unable to even stand on their own! Weak and ugly... Useless..."]="在我们最需要泰坦指引的时候，他们又在哪儿呢？氏族诞生了畸形的胎儿，它们面貌丑陋，甚至无法站立！又丑又弱……一无是处……"
G["Where are they coming from?!"]="他们是从哪儿来的？！"
G["Where are they dragging those bodies? What are they doing to them?"]="他们把尸体都拖到哪儿去了？他们会对尸体做什么？"
G["Where are those lunkheads?"]="那些呆子在哪里？"
G["Where are those reinforcements from Stormwind?  Heavy Blackrock activity has been reported in the East."]="暴风城的增援在哪里？东边那些黑石兽人的活动越来越频繁了。"
G["Where are those ships going, Quimby! Tell us the truth!"]="奎比，那些船要开到哪儿去？！说实话！"
G["Where are tiny men!? Just puny flag!"]="那些小家伙呢！？怎么只有一面破旗帜！"
G["Where are we battling the Scourge?"]="我们在哪里与天灾军团开战了呢？"
G["Where are we going?"]="我们去哪儿？"
G["Where are we? Smells like... like carrots and turds."]="我们到哪儿了？闻起来好像……胡萝卜和粪味儿。"
G["Where are we? We were... swarming?!"]="我们在哪儿？我们是在……群袭？！"
G["Where are you going with this?"]="你带着这个要去哪里？"
G["Where are you going?  Well if you're looking to get there quickly, then look no further!"]="你去哪儿？如果你想快些到那里，那就别犹豫了！"
G["Where are you going? The manor is in the other direction!"]="你要去哪儿？庄园在另一边！"
G["Where are you taking us? Are we there yet?"]="你带我们到哪里去？我们真的必须走吗？"
G["Where are you two going?"]="你们两个要去哪儿？"
G["Where are you, dragon?"]="龙，你在哪里？"
G["Where are your Gods now? WHERE, SERVITOR?"]="你的神在哪里？在哪里？！"
G["Where are your lackeys, great chief? They cannot help you this time!"]="你的侍卫们哪儿去了，大酋长？这次他们可帮不了你了！"
G["Where are your manners, brother. Let us properly welcome our guests."]="你的风度哪去了，兄弟？让我们欢迎这些客人吧。"
G["Where be Vol'jin?"]="沃金在哪里？"
G["Where be the booty?"]="战利品在哪里？"
G["Where better to look for a dark and brooding lot, than the dark section of Ironforge, aptly named The Forlorn Cavern.  Thistleheart is sure to be found there, likely summoning some manner of vile creature to do his bidding."]="没有什么地方比铁炉堡最黑暗的荒弃的洞穴更适合寻找那些阴暗的家伙了。你在那里肯定会找到瑟斯哈特，就象是召唤一个行径卑劣的动物去照他的吩咐办事。"
G["Where can I continue my Jewelcrafting Training?"]="我在哪里可以继续我的珠宝加工训练？"
G["Where can I find Assistant Buzaki?"]="我在哪能找到助手布扎齐？"
G["Where can I find Assistant Kieu?"]="我在哪儿能找到助手琪舞？"
G["Where can I find Assistant Tart?"]="我在哪儿能找到助手塔蒂？"
G["Where can I find Crystal Restore?"]="我到哪里可以找到恢复水晶？"
G["Where can I find bone fragments?"]="我在哪里才能找到白骨碎片？"
G["Where can I find brewmasters that might need aid?"]="我在哪里可以找到可能需要帮助的酒仙？"
G["Where can I find core of elements?"]="我在哪里才能找到元素之核？"
G["Where can I find crypt fiend parts, Leopold?"]="我在哪里才能找到地穴恶魔的碎块，雷奥普德？"
G["Where can I find more infected nightstalker runts, Exarch?"]="我在哪里能找到更多感染的夜行豹幼崽，主教？"
G["Where can I find the Anglers Quartermaster?"]="我在哪里能找到垂钓翁军需官？"
G["Where can I find the Anglers?"]="我可以在哪里找到垂钓翁？"
G["Where can I find the Brewmasters Quartermaster?"]="我在哪里能找到酒仙军需官？"
G["Where can I find the Golden Lotus Quartermaster?"]="我在哪里能找到金莲教军需官？"
G["Where can I find the Klaxxi Quartermaster?"]="我在哪里能找到卡拉克西军需官？"
G["Where can I find the Lorewalkers Quartermaster?"]="我在哪里能找到游学者军需官？"
G["Where can I find the Order of the Cloud Serpent Quartermaster?"]="我在哪里能找到云端翔龙骑士团军需官？"
G["Where can I find the Shado-Pan Quartermaster?"]="我在哪里能找到影踪派军需官？"
G["Where can I find the Tillers Quartermaster?"]="我在哪里能找到阡陌客军需官？"
G["Where can I find the ancestors' stair?"]="我在哪里可以找到先祖的阶梯？"
G["Where can I find the relics of Terokk?"]="我在哪里可以找到泰罗克的圣物？"
G["Where can I find this brother of yours?"]="你的兄弟在哪儿呢？"
G["Where can I get Enchanted Thorium?"]="我到哪里可以找到魔化瑟银锭？"
G["Where can I get a Refurbished Shredder Key?"]="我怎么才能弄到翻新过的伐木机的钥匙呢？"
G["Where can I get one of those ropes?! That was brilliant."]="哪儿有像那样的绳子？！那可真棒！"
G["Where can I go to improve my lockpicking?"]="我该去哪儿提高自己的开锁技能？"
G["Where can I send ya to today?"]="今天你想去哪儿呢？"
G["Where can I send you today $c?"]="今天要我送你去哪里，$c？"
G["Where can someone whisper secrets into the echoing dark?"]="在哪里可以对有回音的黑洞中发出低语？"
G["Where can you find gifts? Have you tried looking around the fields?\n\nYou never know what you can run across around these farms.\n\nMaybe you'll even dig something up on your own land!"]="从哪儿能找到礼物？你有没有在田地里找过？\n\n你永远也不知道你会在这些农田里找到什么。\n\n说不定你甚至能在自家地里刨出些东西来！"
G["Where corruption creeps, we will answer with vigilance, patience, and Elune’s light. The roots remember us, and they will heal."]="Allí donde la corrupción repte, responderemos con vigilancia, paciencia y la luz de Elune. Las raíces nos recuerdan, y sanarán."
G["Where could she possibly be? I sent my apprentice, Shatharia, to the Underlight Mines to the west quite some time ago. We need those ore samples back, and fast or our experiment is going to fail!"]="她会在哪里呢？我派了我的学徒沙塔瑞亚到西面的幽光矿洞去，已经有段时间了。我需要拿回那些矿石样本，越快越好，否则我们的实验就要失败了。"
G["Where dere be zombies, dere be Zanzil.  Da Zandalar trolls be makin' da Gurubashi work all of dere mojo to take back Stranglethorn."]="哪里有僵尸，哪里就有赞吉尔。赞达拉巨魔将要集中所有古拉巴什魔精，夺回荆棘谷。"
G["Where did I leave my voltometer? Bah, no matter. The Horde can keep it!"]="我的电压表到哪里去了？呸，没关系，部落会保管好它的！"
G["Where did I live before this? I used to know. At least I thought I did...."]="我以前住在哪里？我好像知道，至少我觉得我知道……"
G["Where did I put that scroll? Ah, yes, here it is..."]="我把那个卷轴放在哪里了？啊，是了，在这里……"
G["Where did Project C4T come from?"]="C4T计划是从哪儿来的？"
G["Where did all of these mogu come from?"]="这些魔古都是从哪儿冒出来的？"
G["Where did everyone go?"]="大家都去哪儿了？"
G["Where did my father put his notes? Surely they must be around here somewhere..."]="我父亲把他的笔记放在哪儿了？肯定就在这附近……"
G["Where did that cat go?"]="那只猫哪儿去了？"
G["Where did the grand admiral go?"]="韦斯温元帅去哪儿了？"
G["Where did this $n come from? Honestly now."]="¿De dónde ha salido $geste:esta; $n? Ahora en serio."
G["Where did this all come from! Somebody help!"]="这是怎么搞的！谁来救救我！"
G["Where did this land come from? It seems to have appeared from nowhere!"]="这片大陆是从哪儿来的？简直就像凭空冒出来的一样！"
G["Where did this technology come from?"]="这项技术是从哪儿来的？"
G["Where did we land that has such hideous creatures?!"]="我们这是在哪儿着陆了，怎么会有这么恶心的怪物？！"
G["Where did you come from?"]="你是从哪来的？"
G["Where did you get that? Did HE send you?"]="你怎么拿到这个的？是不是他派你来的？"
G["Where did you go? Come back!"]="你去哪儿？回来。"
G["Where did you go? Come back."]="你去哪儿？回来。"
G["Where did you learn that?"]="这一招你是从哪儿学来的？"
G["Where did you learn to do that? You must have had a lot of practice."]="你是从哪儿学来的？你一定练习过很多次吧。"
G["Where did you obtain such exquisite armor? Can I...touch it?"]="你是从哪儿找到那么精美的护甲的？能让我……摸一下吗？"
G["Where did you think the Wind Rider Master would be?  Head to the top of The Sky Tower in the Valley of Strength!"]="你认为双足飞龙管理员会在哪儿？到力量谷的飞行塔的顶部去！"
G["Where do I go for seconds?"]="我去哪里吃第二顿呢？"
