G["Where... Where am I?"]="我……我在哪里？"
G["Where... did... he... come from..."]="他……是……从哪里……来的……"
G["Where... is this place? What... have I done? Forgive me, my father..."]="这是……什么地方？我……干了什么？原谅我，父亲……"
G["Where... is... my... SHIP!?"]="我……的……船呢？！"
G["Where... were... my heals?!"]="治疗我的人……在……哪儿？！"
G["Where... where am I?"]="我……我这是在哪儿？"
G["Where... where did you come from? Thank you!"]="你是……你是打哪儿来的？谢谢你！"
G["Where... where is it? Worthless, useless... damn you!"]="在……在哪儿？卑劣无能，一无是处……真该死！"
G["Where?  Where are the Shards!  You cannot hide them from us!"]="哪儿？碎片在哪儿！你别想把它们藏起来！"
G["Where?!  Where is he?"]="在哪儿？！他在哪儿？"
G["Wherever the Horde takes us, we will keep our heads high and our blood pure. Good riddance, Mor'ghor. A new Dragonmaw dawns this day."]="无论带往何方，我们都会昂着头，维持血脉的纯净。总算摆脱你了，莫格霍尔。今天就是龙喉氏族的新生黎明。"
G["Whether he talks or not, I'll tear this continent to pieces if it means I find what I seek... if it means glory for the Horde."]="无论他是否开口，即使把这块大陆撕成碎片我也会找到我想要的东西……只要那东西能给部落带来荣耀。"
G["Whether the world's greatest gnats or the world's greatest heroes, you are still only mortal."]="任你是天下最厉害的恶棍，还是最强大的英雄，都只不过是凡人之躯。"
G["Whew that was close! Deathwing just blew us out of the sky!  We're almost there though, are you ready for the last leg of our journey to Wyrmrest Temple?"]="好险！死亡之翼的爪牙把我们从天上打了下来！但龙眠神殿已经近在咫尺了。大家准备好前进了吗？"
G["Whew! Everything should be smooth sailing from here on out!"]="哇！一切都应该从此一帆风顺！"
G["Whew! I think I ate too much. Need to loosen my belt a few notches."]="呃！我想我吃得太多了，得松松皮带……"
G["Whew! I'm never eating asparagus again."]="唉呦！我绝不再吃芦笋了。"
G["Whew! That is some strong brew!"]="哟！这酒真带劲儿！"
G["Whew! That was some hard work, $r. I haven't seen the Scourge this aggressive since...\n\n<Guard Didier swallows hard.>\n\nSince the last war..."]="呼哧！这真是不容易，$r。很久没有见到天灾军团主动攻击了，自从……\n\n<卫兵迪迪尔喘了几口粗气。>\n\n自从上一次大战以后……"
G["Whew! What's that smell?"]="哎呀！那是什么味道？"
G["Whew, thanks! I'm going to check and see if these results are repeatable."]="喔，谢谢！我要好好检查一下这些结果是不是可以重复的。"
G["Whew, that was a bit of a tight squeeze, but the rest of the trip should be a breeze."]="吆，我们的确是遇到了一点麻烦，不过剩下的旅途就应该是一帆风顺了。"
G["Whew, time to take a break!"]="呦，该休息了！"
G["Whew, what a mess! Someone inform the monastery kitchens: We're having turtle soup, tonight!"]="哎呦，真是一团糟啊！ 快派人通知禅院膳房： 我们今天晚上喝龟汤！"
G["Whew... I need a smoke and the touch of a fine gnomish woman - not particularly in that order!\n\nI've been stuck inside the belly of that thing for months! What day is it anyway? Ah, nevermind. All that matters is that I'm finally out.\n\nWOOO HOOO!"]="吆……我需要一根烟和找个好看的侏儒女人摸几下--倒不必非要按那个顺序！\n\n我被困在那个东西的肚子里已经有几个月了。今天几号了？啊，不要紧。重要的是我终于出来了。\n\n呜呼！"
G["Whew... that one was ripe."]="呃……那家伙都发臭了。"
G["Whhaaat... are you sssspeaking of, ssssoft-sskin?"]="你在说……什么，细皮嫩肉的家伙？"
G["Which battleground are you interested in?"]="你对哪个战场感兴趣？"
G["Which battleground calls you?"]="你要前往哪个战场？"
G["Which battleground do you seek your glory in?"]="你要找哪个战场？"
G["Which berries should you plant? Witchberries, of course!"]="你该种植哪种浆果？当然是女巫浆果啦！"
G["Which brewmaster would you like to aid today?"]="你今天想帮助哪个酒仙？"
G["Which class trainer are you looking for?"]="你要寻找哪种职业的训练师？"
G["Which class trainer might ye be looking for?"]="你想找哪类职业训练师？"
G["Which noodle soup should I have?"]="我要点哪种面呢？"
G["Which of our two banks would you like to visit?"]="这儿有两座银行，你想去哪一座？"
G["Which one dares to challenge Galenges? Stand forward, weakling!"]="你们谁敢上前挑战盖伦格斯？上前来吧，懦夫！"
G["Which one of you is in charge? We need help at New Thalanaar now!"]="你们现在谁是负责人？新萨兰纳尔现在需要你们的帮助！"
G["Which one shall I eat first? So difficult to choose. They all smell so delicious..."]="我该先吃谁呢？真是难以选择。每一个闻起来都这么鲜美……"
G["Which one should I take?"]="我应该对付哪个？"
G["Which one?"]="哪一个？"
G["Which profession do you seek to learn?"]="你要学习何种专业技能？"
G["Which profession trainer are you looking for?"]="你在寻找哪种专业的训练师？"
G["Which profession trainer were you looking for?"]="你要找哪一种专业训练师？"
G["Which profession trainer would ye be looking for?"]="你在找哪个专业训练师？"
G["Which profession?"]="哪一项专业？"
G["Which service were you looking for?"]="你需要什么服务？"
G["Which thread are you, I wonder? The one that unravels the pattern, or the one that holds it together?"]="我很好奇，你到底是哪一根线？到底是毁天灭地的那一根，还是力挽狂澜的那一根？"
G["Which trainer do you seek?"]="你要找哪一类型的训练师？"
G["Which vendor where you seeking?"]="你要找哪种商贩？"
G["Which way did he go?"]="他往哪儿走了？"
G["Which way is the enemy?"]="敌人在哪儿呢？"
G["Which way should we go?"]="我们该往哪儿走？"
G["Which way should you go? Well, the only advice I can offer is for you to take any road you want!\n\nI can't remember anything!"]="你要走哪条路？嗯，我能给你的唯一建议是走你想走的路！\n\n我什么都记不得啦！"
G["Which way to go? Up, or down?"]="往哪个方向走？往上，还是往下？"
G["Which way to go???"]="走哪边？？？"
G["Which would explain why you're sitting in a jail cell at the bottom of a mountain, right, dwarf?"]="这就解释了你被关在黑石山下的囚房里的原因，是吧，矮人？"
G["Which ya be lookin' for?"]="你在找什么？"
G["While Cyndra is not bubbly like her potions, her kind manner is suitable for teaching her trade.  You can find her just east of the Inn in Dolanaar."]="塞恩德拉的态度非常和蔼，她的药剂也很不错。你可以在多兰纳尔旅店的东边找到她。"
G["While Greta focuses her energy on the recovery of Jaedenar and those who she thinks is mostly responsible for the corruption here in Felwood. I spend my time looking into the effects the corruption has had on the land.\n\nHow has it affected the creatures of the land? What must be done to end the pain of their suffering?\n\nUnfortunately, the corruption runs so deep that eternal sleep is too often the answer."]="当格雷塔集中精力恢复加德纳尔和对付那些她认为最应该对费伍德森林的堕落负责任的人的时候，我正忙于调查堕落给这片土地带来的影响。\n\n它是如何影响地面上的生物的？该采取什么办法来结束它们所遭受的痛苦？\n\n不幸的是，堕落已经如此深入，永久的沉睡似乎是绝对的答案。"
G["While I already feel better, I am not yet ready for combat. I will need you to escort me."]="虽然我已经感觉好多了，可还不能战斗。我需要靠你护送了。"
G["While I am buried in research, it will be up to you to teach the Lasher the ways of the world."]="在我埋头搞研究的时候，你可以教教鞭笞者处世之道。"
G["While I have them distracted you get the plans from the guard's corpse. I will call Kasha to pick you up as soon as I see you get the plans."]="我来吸引他们的注意力，你去守卫的尸体上找计划书。只要你一拿到计划书，我就会叫卡莎来接你离开。"
G["While I live to serve the Earth Mother and the Horde, I cannot help but feel a little nervous now that we've collected everything that we need. At least we have a little time until the Alliance finishes their gathering efforts. After that it will all be shipped to Cenarion Hold in Silithus, and the war will likely follow not long after."]="我活着的目的就是为大地之母和部落服务，虽然眼下我们已经收集到足够的物资，但是我还是有些担心。在联盟完成他们的收集任务之前，我们还有一点准备时间。在那之后，所有的物资将被运往希利苏斯的塞纳里奥要塞，我们离战争也就不远了。"
G["While I miss Gilneas greatly, there's ancient ruins to explore!"]="虽然我非常想念吉尔尼斯，但还有许多远古遗迹需要我去探索！"
G["While I was trapped in that web, I had such feelings of doubt and despair. You have freed me from my own fears."]="当我被困在网中时，我心中充满了怀疑与绝望。是你把我从自己的恐惧中解救了出来。"
G["While I would love to purify all of my corrupted bretheren, I cannot allow those of us who have not fallen to corruption to go leaderless.\nWe must stop the spread of this vile influence, and then I will lead those of us who remain pure to freedom."]="Aunque me encantaría purificar a todos mis hermanos corruptos, no puedo permitir que aquellos que no han sucumbido a la corrupción se queden sin su líder.\n\nDebemos detener esta influencia maligna y luego llevaré a aquellos de los nuestros que sigan siendo puros a la libertad."
G["While Nesingwary's advances upon the wildlife of Northrend has been halted, it is only a matter of time before he attempts another incursion. You must remain vigilant, $n!\n\nAbove all else, do not give in to whatever temptations may be set before you... The demon will attempt to charm you. When it happens, you must resist!"]="Aunque hemos detenido las incursiones de Nesingwary en la vida salvaje de Rasganorte, solo es cuestión de tiempo que lo vuelva a intentar. ¡Debes permanecer alerta, $n!\n\nPero lo más importante es que no cedas, te ofrezca lo que te ofrezca... El demonio intentará engañarte. Cuando eso ocurra, deberás resistir."
G["While Theramore is reknown for it's exceptional training of warriors, I am afraid that I can not help you."]="虽然塞拉摩以它特有的武士培训闻名，我恐怕还是不能帮你。"
G["While Varimathras is, uh... away, I've been assigned to assist Captain Bragor in his duties."]="瓦里玛萨斯，嗯…不在的时候，我被派来协助布拉贡大人完成任务。"
G["While camouflaged, we are harder to detect when we are BEHIND creatures."]="在伪装状态下，当我们处于敌人身后时更难被发现。"
G["While exploration in these new lands is no doubt important, you mustn't forsake Azeroth! We need you now more than ever in the fight against the Defilers. Those resources must be secured!"]="在新大陆的探索无疑非常重要，但是你不能遗忘艾泽拉斯！我们比以前更加需要你去和污染者作战！那些资源需要得到保护！"
G["While it is clearly quite old, this statue does not appear to have crumbled at all over the centuries."]="虽然这座雕像已经非常古老了，却没有任何被风蚀损坏的痕迹。"
G["While it is true that the Alliance has completed all of their war effort tasks, don't let that discourage you, $r. Time is of the essence, but we would much rather that you help in the Horde's collections carefully and thoroughly. That seems better to me than making a mistake that could cost someone their life once this war truly begins. Wouldn't you agree, $c?"]="虽然联盟已经完成了所有的收集工作，但是别气馁，$R。进度固然很重要，不过我还是要感谢你帮助我们如此仔细地收集物资。我可不愿意因为小小的失误令士兵们丧命。你说是吗，$c？"
G["While my brother, Drazial, focuses his analysis on the more physical nature of the beasts of the blasted lands, I tend to focus on the more cerebral and spiritual aspects of the wildlife.\n\nIt is true that the beasts exhibit extremely unusual strength, agility, and stamina, but some of them also possess great intelligence and regenerative abilities, untied to their physical being.\n\nPerhaps you would be interested in helping advance my research, $r?"]="Mientras que mi hermano Drazial concentra sus análisis en la naturaleza física de las bestias de Las Tierras Devastadas, yo me centro más en los aspectos psíquicos y espirituales de la fauna.\n\nCierto es que las bestias demuestran tener una inusual fuerza, agilidad y resistencia pero, algunas de ellas, también poseen una increíble inteligencia y habilidad de regeneración, que no van unidas a su ser físico.\n\n¿Quizás te pueda interesar ayudarme en mi investigación, $r?"
G["While my comrades held the line against the encroaching darkness, I used my magic to reach out into the Great Dark Beyond.  There, I sensed beings of immense Light - of unfathomable purity.\n\nIt was A'dal and his naaru I had found. It was nothing short of a... miracle."]="当我的同伴在坚定不移地对抗逐渐逼近的黑暗时，我使用魔法进入了遥远的宇宙。在那里，我感受到了一种具有无穷圣光之力的生物……\n\n那就是阿达尔和他的纳鲁。那只能说是个……奇迹。"
G["While not the most powerful combatants, a pack of felhounds still has many uses."]="虽然不是最强大的战士，但一群地狱猎犬还是很有用的。"
G["While nothing can change the past, time can heal all wounds. Thank you for showing me that it is possible, $n. I wish you well."]="虽说没有东西可以改变过去，时间可以治愈所有伤口。谢谢你让我看到那是可能的，$n。我祝你顺利。"
G["While one player is zapping a saurok, another can instantly destroy it."]="当一名玩家攻击蜥蜴人时，另一名玩家可以马上杀死它。"
G["While our end is inevitable, let us try to take as many of them down with us as we can. Be ready."]="虽然失败无法避免，但是我们还是要尽力杀敌。做好准备！"
G["While our goals call for the eradication of the mogu, we can't ignore our flanks.\n\nWhile both the Alliance and the saurok attack the mogu alongside us, either could turn on us at any moment."]="虽然我们的目标是消灭魔古族，但也不能忽略我们的侧翼。\n\n虽然联盟和蜥蜴人都在与我们一同攻击魔古族，但这两者随时都有可能对我们倒戈相向。"
G["While our goals call for the eradication of the mogu, we can't ignore our flanks.\n\nWhile both the Horde and the saurok attack the mogu alongside us, either could turn on us at any moment."]="虽然我们的目标是消灭魔古族，但也不能忽略我们的侧翼。\n\n虽然部落和蜥蜴人都在与我们一同攻击魔古族，但这两者随时都有可能对我们倒戈相向。"
G["While studying the land, I discovered a cave that stretched deep beneath the earth. These waterways carried underground rivers for miles beneath the parched savannah above. I named them the Wailing Caverns, for the howls made by the wind and steam as they coursed through its depths.\n\nThis would be the instrument of revival, I thought. The water had already bubbled to the surface as small, lush oases throughout the Barrens...if it were imbued, enhanced, this growth could spread across the entire land."]="在研究这片土地的时候，我发现有一座洞穴一直延伸到地下很深的地方。在这片炎热的荒原下面，地下暗河形成的水网覆盖了很大一片地方。我称这座因暗河冲刷而形成的洞穴为哀嚎洞穴。因为风和水流在这座洞中总是会发出一阵阵凄厉的嚎叫。\n\n我相信，这座洞穴是让大地回复生机的契机。暗河中的水已经在贫瘠之地的一些角落里渗透到地面，形成了一些葱翠茂盛的绿洲……如果这种渗水作用得到加强，那么这片土地就会被绿色所覆盖。"
G["While the Forsaken deal with curing the plague from both sides of the Horde and Alliance, we have pledged ourselves to deal with the Scourge necropoli that lay siege to our cities.\n\nBy using concentrated Light energy, we can strike back at the Lich King's structures and, with luck, destroy them."]="被遗忘者在努力地研制治愈瘟疫的方法，希望以此拯救倍受侵害的联盟和部落成员；而我们则起誓消灭那些包围着各大主城的天灾军团浮空城。\n\n利用圣光的力量，我们能对巫妖王的造物造成重创，运气好的话，还能直接摧毁它们。"
G["While the details remain shrouded from our view, one thing we have gleaned..."]="事件的细节仍然扑朔迷离，但我确定了一件事……"
G["While the elements are doing their best to tear Darkshore asunder, I've been struggling to protect the remaining wildlife.\n\nCan I count on your help, $c?"]="Mientras los elementos se esfuerzan por destruir Costa Oscura, hago lo que puedo por proteger la vida salvaje que queda.\n\n¿Cuento con tu ayuda, $c?"
G["While the enemies are focused on me, my allies can sneak up from behind!"]="当敌人把注意力都放在我身上时，我的战友们就可以从后面包抄他们了！"
G["While the focus of the Sha'tar remains on Shadowmoon Valley and Illidan, we cannot ignore the threat that Kael'thas Sunstrider presents."]="当沙塔尔继续把他们的注意力放在影月谷和伊利丹身上时，我们同样不能无视凯尔萨斯·逐日者带来的威胁。"
G["While the house of my mad father collapses around him, the few remaining Black Dragons have gone into hiding."]="当我发疯的父亲众叛亲离时，那些残存的黑龙四散奔逃，并藏了起来。"
G["While the hozen pillage our supplies and kill our warriors, what does he do? Nothing!"]="当猢狲掠夺我们的物资，杀害我们的战士时，他做了什么？什么都没有！"
G["While the loss of this vehicle is a setback, we must persist. We must succeed!"]="尽管我们损失了这辆战车，但必须坚持下去。我们必须成功！"
G["While the soldiers of our army put their steel to our enemies, the actual efficacy of such attacks is questionable - a diversion at best. It is through the arcane that our enemies will crumble and fall before us."]="当我们军队中的士兵用武器砍向敌人时，这样的进攻到底具有多大的果，这是值得怀疑的——最多也只不过是一个牵制而已。如果使用奥术魔法的话，那么我们的敌人就会轻而易举地被我们粉碎。"
G["While there's no Engineering Trainer in Brill, there is one down in the Undercity.  To get there head to the back of the Ruins of Lordaeron to the south of town and take the elevator down.  Once you get there ask an Undercity Guardian for more specific directions."]="虽然在布瑞尔没有工程学训练师，在幽暗城却有一位。要到那儿，朝村子的南边走，一直到洛丹伦废墟，然后坐升降梯下去。一旦你到了那里，向一位幽暗城守卫询问详细的方位。"
G["While there, a wise old war hero told me something that I would carry with me forever..."]="正是在那儿，一位睿智的老英雄给我留下了终生难忘的教导……"
G["While this is certainly a grave marker, it is unclear who is buried here."]="虽然这里显然是座坟墓，可没有写明葬在这里的是什么人。"
G["While visitors complain about the exceptionally humid air, I find it helps my complexion! Dry skin is unflattering."]="很多人抱怨这里的潮湿气候，不过我发现它对皮肤很有好处！没有水分的皮肤可不会吹弹欲破。"
G["While we have much to teach the other races of the Alliance, we have as much to learn from them.  Keep your eyes, ears and mind open, $c."]="虽然我们有很多东西可以教给联盟的其他种族，但是我们同样也有很多东西要从他们那里学习。要多多使用你的眼睛、耳朵和心灵，$c。"
G["While we have no Alchemy Trainer here in Bloodhoof Village, there is one in Thunder Bluff to the north.  Follow the road there and ask one of the Bluffwatchers for directions when you get to the top."]="虽然我们在血蹄村没有炼金术训练师，在北面的雷霆崖却有一位。沿着这条路去那儿，当你到达顶部时再向一位雷霆崖守卫询问具体方位。"
G["While we mourn the fallen, many more would be lost if not for your efforts. Please accept this gift of gratitude from the Alliance."]="逝者已矣，但要不是你，牺牲者可能更多。为表谢意，请接受这份礼物。"
G["While we prepare to invade the Firelands, the Firelord sends his minions to repel our attack. Our position here cannot fall. We are all that stands between them and the World Tree."]="在我们准备进攻火焰之地的时候，炎魔之王派出了手下爪牙来拦截我们。我们在这里的据点绝对不能陷落，我们已经是保卫世界之树的最后一道防线了。"
G["While we research the pools, we will patrol the city's borders and protect these people."]="我们在研究池水的同时，还会巡逻城市的边界，保护这里的人。"
G["While you may be sad to see me go, I'm sure you will enjoy watching me leave."]="虽然我的离开可能会让你难过，不过我相信，你会带着笑容眺望我的背影。"
G["While you may try to make it work, in the end, you will go your separate ways."]="虽然你们努力维持彼此的关系，但最终还是会分道扬镳。"
G["While you wait for its arrival, my assistant and I will momentarily demonstrate some of the features of this remarkable aircraft."]="在你们等待它的到来时，我和我的助手会先讲解一下这艘非凡航空器的特别功能。"
G["While you've dealt the demonic evil from the south a serious blow, I still sense trouble from that region."]="虽然你已经给南方的恶魔势力造成了沉重的打击，但我还是觉得那个地方有些问题。"
