G["Who is the predictable one, beast? Surely you did not think that we would summon you on top of Malfurion? Your redemption comes, Eranikus. You will be cleansed of this madness - this corruption."]="你算错了一招，野兽。你不曾料到我们会在玛法里奥的身边召唤你吧？伊兰尼库斯，你的救赎就要来临了。你将得到净化——堕落之源将被清除。"
G["Who is the stranger who walks among us?"]="¿Quién es $gel extraño:la extraña; que anda entre nosotros?"
G["Who is this $C who goes before the Court of Lakeshire in the Kingdom of Stormwind? State your business within this township, $R. The orc threat to the Kingdom is far too great to squander time in idle conversation."]="¿Quién es este $C que se presenta ante la Corte de Villa del Lago en el Reino de Ventormenta? Expón tus asuntos en este municipio, $R. La amenaza orca sobre el Reino es demasiado grave para malgastar el tiempo en charlas ociosas."
G["Who is this $c who goes before the Court of Lakeshire in the Kingdom of Stormwind? State your business within this township, $r. The orc threat to the Kingdom is far too great to squander time in idle conversation."]="¿Quién es este $c que se presenta ante la Corte de Lakeshire en el Reino de Ventormenta? Declara tu propósito dentro de esta villa, $r. La amenaza orca al Reino es demasiado grande para perder tiempo en conversaciones ociosas."
G["Who is this Budd fellow?"]="这家伙是巴德手下的一名探险队员吧，他是什么人？"
G["Who is this Lar'korwi you spoke of?"]="你所说的这个拉克维是谁？"
G["Who is this Terokk you keep mentioning?"]="谁是这个你一直提起的泰罗克？"
G["Who is this fruit vendor to make such a bold move? He's brought in an ogre for support."]="哪个水果贩有这个胆子？他竟然买通食人魔当打手。"
G["Who is this guy?"]="这家伙是谁？"
G["Who is this mere $r that meddles with that which is past?  May the legend of Stalvan die along with you!"]="¿Quién se cree $geste:esta; $r para jugar con el pasado? ¡Que la leyenda de Stalvan vaya a la tumba contigo!"
G["Who is this weak $C who challenges my might?  Die fool!"]="¿Quién es $geste:esta; débil $c que osa desafiar mi poder? ¡Muere idiota!"
G["Who is this weak $R?  A foul intruder I say.  Die fool!"]="¿Quién es $geste:esta; débil $r? No es más que $gun asqueroso intruso:una asquerosa intrusa;. ¡Muere escoria!"
G["Who is this? A prince, you say? A child. Ah, but he has had no childhood - you can see it in his eyes."]="这是谁啊？什么王子？一个孩子。啊，一个没有童年的孩子——他的眼神告诉我了。"
G["Who is this? That looks like Valstann, Fandral Staghelm's only son. What is he doing? Is this a memory of the Qiraji War?"]="这是谁？好像是瓦斯坦恩，范达尔·鹿盔唯一的儿子。他在做什么？这是其拉之战的回忆吗？"
G["Who just called me a numbskull?"]="刚刚谁骂我是榆木脑袋来着？"
G["Who keeps breaking this thing?!"]="谁在不停地搞破坏？"
G["Who keeps pulling!?!"]="谁引了这么多怪来？！？"
G["Who keeps pulling?!?"]="谁引了这么多怪来？！？"
G["Who killed the Furlbrows? I'll tell you who killed the Furlbrows: KING VARIAN WRYNN, THAT'S WHO! And he's killin' the rest of us too. One bum at a time. The only thing I can tell you is that I saw some gnolls leavin' the place a few hours before the law arrived."]="谁杀了法布隆一家？让我来告诉你是谁干的——是瓦里安·乌瑞恩国王，对，就是他！而且他还要把我们都杀了，一次性全干掉。我唯一能告诉你的，就是我看到有几个豺狼人在办案人员到来的几小时前从那里走掉了。"
G["Who knows what dark an' horrid tings be gibberin' in de outer darkness... tings dat'd drive a soul mad ta see?\n\n-We- be knowin'. An' you've come lookin' ta know -more,- haven't ya?"]="有多少人知道，外界的黑暗中到底隐藏着怎样的恐怖……那是能够让灵魂发疯的诡谲之物！\n\n我们一直都很清楚这一点。而你也想来此一探究竟，对么？"
G["Who knows what secrets await within Ulduar's archives? I'm off to discover them. Thank you again for your help, $n. Without it, I'd still be searching for that key."]="谁也不知道存放在奥杜尔的档案中隐藏了什么秘密。我要去那里揭开真相。再次感谢你的帮助，$n。没有你的帮助，我现在还在找那把钥匙呢。"
G["Who knows?\n\nHe was becoming quite critical of this operation, but that's not proof of anything."]="谁能知道？\n\n他已经成为了这个行动的关键，但这不能证明任何事。"
G["Who knows? Anyhow, that was the last I saw of her. Maybe Frankal can give you better information.\n\nNot to steer off topic here as I'm sure the work you're doing for the Commander is important, but we're onto something huge here. HUGE! Our requests to Ironforge for an army have so far fallen on deaf ears. Apparently we're stretched too thin in protecting the realm or some such nonsense. Once you take your report back to the Commander, come back down here with some friends. We need your help!"]="谁知道呢？无论如何，那是我最后一次见到她。或许弗兰卡能告诉你更多信息。\n\n别转移话题，我想指挥官给你的工作相当重要吧，但是我们也是来执行重要任务的！铁炉堡对我们请求军队增援的要求置若罔闻。很明显，以我们的力量难以保护这片土地。一旦你将报告交还给指挥官，就跟你的朋友一同回到这儿来。我们需要你的帮助！"
G["Who left this here, mon?  Whooaahh..."]="谁把它放在这儿的，伙计？哇啊……"
G["Who needs a God? We have the Thunder King!"]="谁还需要神？我们有雷电之王！"
G["Who needs a body when your jokes got legs?"]="只要你的笑话行得通，谁还需要身体呢？"
G["Who needs friends when you have cats?"]="有猫相伴，谁还需要朋友？"
G["Who needs friends? Zanzil just makes his own!"]="谁需要朋友？赞吉尔自己造朋友！"
G["Who needs gods when we ARE gods?"]="谁需要神？我们自己就是神！"
G["Who needs sentries? $n is here!"]="有$n在这里，谁还需要魔像守卫？"
G["Who needs this hunk of metal more, Rok'tar? You? ...Or the highest bidder?"]="谁更需要这块金属，洛克塔尔？是你……还是出价最高的人？"
G["Who or what was that?"]="那是什么东西？"
G["Who or what would do something like this, man?!"]="谁会做出这样的事情？！"
G["Who owns this forest?"]="这片森林是谁的？"
G["Who puts a \"dead\" sea demon on their head, really?!"]="De verdad, hombre, ¿quién se pone la cabeza de un demonio del mar \"muerto\" en la cabeza?"
G["Who says orcs aren't smart? It takes a lot of brains to be an engineer!"]="谁说兽人不聪明？当工程师可是很费脑筋的！"
G["Who says that?"]="谁说的？"
G["Who says you won the bet?  We haven't compared tallies yet."]="谁说你赢了？我们还没有比较分数呢。"
G["Who sent you here? You're not ready for my instruction yet! You'll be told when you're ready."]="¿Quién te ha enviado aquí? ¡Todavía no puedes recibir mi instrucción! Te lo dirán cuando estés $glisto:lista;."
G["Who sent you!?"]="是谁派你来的？！"
G["Who shall be next to taste my blades?"]="谁想成为下一个？"
G["Who shaved off all your fur?"]="是谁把你全身的毛都给剃光了？"
G["Who shut down the portals? Clever little worms."]="是谁关闭了传送门？狡猾的小爬虫。"
G["Who so boldly stands before Lantresor of the Blade? Do you not know death by sight, $g boy:girl;?"]="¿Quién es tan valiente como para presentarse ante Lantresor del Filo? ¿Acaso no reconoces la muerte cuando la tienes delante?"
G["Who speaks of me? What are you talking about, broken?"]="谁提到了我？你在说什么，破碎者？"
G["Who stole my slicky?"]="谁偷了我的鱼？"
G["Who summons Millagazor?"]="是谁召唤米拉盖佐尔？"
G["Who talk to Eye last? Is Eye happy? Tell Gar'gol!"]="谁最后和眼睛说话的？眼睛高兴吗？快告诉伽格尔！"
G["Who then, was the wiser? The father or the cub?"]="那么是谁更聪明？是父亲，还是儿子？"
G["Who throws a bucket? Honestly!"]="谁扔的桶？老实交代！到底是谁？！"
G["Who to test the bomb on?  The Harpies?  Ha ha... wait... what's that?"]="找谁来测试炸弹呢？鹰身人吗？哈哈……等等……那是什么？"
G["Who wants soup!"]="谁还要汤！"
G["Who wants to be the first to spill their blood?"]="谁想杀死敌人，拔得头筹？"
G["Who wants to let an innocent gnome out of a cage? Come on now. How often do you get an offer like that?"]="谁愿意把一个无辜的侏儒从笼子里放出去？快点儿动手吧。这样的机会可不常有！"
G["Who wants to see Rejek's new helmet?"]="谁要看雷耶克的新头盔？"
G["Who was this stranger?"]="这位陌生人是谁？"
G["Who will save us?!"]="谁来救救我们？！"
