G["Who would be foolish enough to enter the tower of the Grand Foreman?"]="哪个蠢货胆敢闯入大工头的塔？"
G["Who would do this?!"]="谁会做这种事啊？！"
G["Who would ever guess how much knowledge was hidden behind these walls. And there is so much more we can add to it.\n\nAs you explore our land, keep an eye out for objects of interest that might help us learn more of our past. Piece together enough of our history, and I may be able to share a story or two with you."]="谁知道在这些厚墙内隐藏着多少知识呢。我们还能让这座宝库变得更加宏大。\n\n在你探索这片土地时，留心寻找那些不同寻常的物品，或许能帮我们加深对过往的了解。当你对我们的历史有足够的认识时，我就能与你分享一两个故事。"
G["Who would ever guess how much knowledge was hidden behind these walls. Between the wealth of information here and the lore you have uncovered in your travels, I believe I can weave together a few tales of our forgotten past.\n\nWhich one would you like to hear?"]="谁能想到这些墙壁后面隐藏着那么多的知识。从这里的大量知识和你在旅途中的所见所闻之中，我相信我可以拼凑出一些有关我们被遗忘的历史的一些传说。\n\n你想要听哪一段？"
G["Who would have thought these creatures could be reasoned with?"]="谁会想到这些怪物还能跟你讲道理呢？"
G["Who would join something like this? If the world is really going to end, do they really think it would bother warning us?"]="有谁会加入这种组织？如果世界真的会完蛋，那这种警告又有什么意义？"
G["Who would leave a pile of bombs and a cannon next to their brew? Ah well. One hozen's trash is a brewmaster's beach defense."]="谁会把一堆炸弹和一门大炮放在自己的美酒旁边？啊，好吧。猢狲眼里的垃圾，到了酿酒师这，就会变成海岸防御工事。"
G["Who would think to start a farm in the middle of a town? Hah!"]="谁会想到在镇子中间开一个农场？哈！"
G["Who would've thought this sort of place existed when we first saw Pandaria from Hellscream's Fist?"]="当我们在地狱咆哮之拳上第一次见到潘达利亚时，谁能想到这里还会有这种地方的存在？"
G["Who would've thought we'd wind up here after everything we've been through?"]="谁能想到，在我们渡过那么多难关之后，却会在这里结束？"
G["Who woulda thought that we'd have this problem again? Oh wait, EVERYBODY DID!"]="谁能想到我们会遇到同样的状况呢？噢，不，大家都想到了！"
G["Who you be to challenge our loyalty?"]="你是谁？凭什么质疑我们的忠诚？"
G["Who you supposed to be? Some kind of $c or something?"]="你以为你是谁？一个$c或者什么别的玩意儿？"
G["Who's bad? Who's bad? That's right: we bad!"]="谁最猛？谁最猛？没错！我们最猛！"
