G["Who's out there, Shao? Is it safe?"]="邵傲，谁在外面？安全吗？"
G["Who's stealing my pumpkins?! You won't get away with this, you rascal! [PH]"]="¡¿Quién me roba las calabazas?! ¡No te saldrás con la tuya, granuja! [PH]"
G["Who's that beatin' on my drum?"]="谁在敲我的鼓？"
G["Who's that guy? The guy you were talkin' to? Can someone tell me what's goin' on?"]="那是谁啊？跟你说话的那个家伙。谁来告诉我怎么了？"
G["Who's that talking? I can barely see the top of your head. Are you sure that you're old enough to be drinking?"]="谁在讲话？我几乎看不见你的脑袋。你到了法定的饮酒年纪了吗？"
G["Who's the bigshot now, huh?!"]="该谁说了算啊，嗯？"
