G["Who's the master now?"]="谁才是真正的主宰？"
G["Who's the most popular hero of the realm, you ask?  Well here are the current standings!\n\nThrall: $2200w\nCairne: $2201w\nSylvanas: $2202w\nTotal Horde: $2207w\n\nVarian: $2203w\nMagni: $2204w\nTyrande: $2205w\nTotal Alliance: $2206w\n\nIf you want to cast your vote, be sure to turn in your gift collections!"]="¿Quieres saber quién es el héroe más popular del reino? ¡Esta es la clasificación actual!\n\nThrall: $2200w\nCairne: $2201w\nSylvanas: $2202w\nTotal de la Horda: $2207w\n\nVarian: $2203w\nMagni: $2204w\nTyrande: $2205w\nTotal de la Alianza: $2206w\n\nSi deseas emitir tu voto, ¡asegúrate de entregar tu colección de regalos!"
G["Who's the obsolete one now?"]="现在，谁才是该退市的产品？"
G["Who's there?"]="谁在那边啊？"
G["Who's there? Let me out! Let me out before these stinking pirates decide to put me on a spit and make green eggs and ham from me!"]="谁在那儿？放我出去！趁这些臭死人的海盗还没决定把我蘸上口水做成绿色的火腿炒蛋，快放我出去！"
G["Who's your master?!"]="谁是你的主人？！"
G["Who, me?"]="谁，我吗？"
G["Who, me?\n\nWhy, I'd hardly consider myself qualified to, uh... No, I should think not."]="谁，我？\n\n为什么？我觉得自己没有资格，嗯……不，我想我应该拒绝。"
G["Who, now, wields the power?"]="现在是谁在支配着力量？"
G["Who... Who am I?"]="我……我是谁？"
G["Who... Who is you?? What you want?"]="你……你是谁？？你想要什么？"
G["Who... goes there...?"]="那里是谁？"
G["Who... ordered... this?"]="这是……谁的……命令？"
G["Who... who are you? Who... what am I?"]="十字军的审判已经降临了，死亡骑士！"
G["Who... who dat be?"]="谁……是谁？"
G["Who? ...What? Oh! The Ook is dooked? That is fantastic! Well done heroes."]="谁？……什么？噢！乌克死了？真是太棒了！干得好英雄们。"
G["Who? The Tauren Chieftains! What? A live performance! Where? The World's End Tavern! When? The top of the hour! BE THERE!"]="谁？牛头人酋长乐队！什么？现场演出？哪里？天涯旅店！时间？整点之后的十分钟！快去啊！"
G["Who? Who are you giving the eggs to?"]="谁？你要把这些蛋拿给谁？"
G["Whoa - I nearly died there. Thank you, $r!"]="哇咧！我差点死在这里。谢谢你，$r！"
G["Whoa - look out! We have to land. It is almost impossible to fly here!"]="哇——小心！我们要着陆了。这里简直没法飞行！"
G["Whoa Noodles, what are you putting in the soup?"]="喔喔，米线，你在汤里放的什么啊？"
G["Whoa doggy hot diggity dun"]="哦，焰须和范妮"
G["Whoa now, $c, Pele'keiki thinkin' that you not knowin' all that stuff be on its way to Silithus. Pele'keiki told the last of it be getting' there in less than $2113w days, and after that some misguided fool gonna ring the gong outside the Ahn'Qiraj gates to open 'em up and be startin' the war."]="$c，比雷凯基认为你并不知道所有的物资已在运往希利苏斯的途中了。他说最后一批将在$2113w天内运抵，然后，会有某个误入歧途的蠢货敲响安其拉大门外的铜锣，拉开战争的序幕。"
G["Whoa now, $c, Pele'keiki thinkin' that you not knowin' all that stuff be on its way to Silithus. Pele'keiki told the last of it be getting' there in less than a day, and after that some misguided fool gonna ring the gong outside the Ahn'Qiraj gates to open 'em up and be startin' the war."]="$c，比雷凯基认为你并不知道所有的物资已在运往希利苏斯的途中了。他说最后一批将在1天内运抵，然后，会有某个误入歧途的蠢货敲响安其拉大门外的铜锣，拉开战争的序幕。"
G["Whoa whoa whoa - they've got snipers on all the rooftops. You'll have to go in by foot!"]="哇哇哇——他们在所有的房顶上都安插了狙击手。你得靠双脚走进去！"
G["Whoa!"]="哇！"
G["Whoa!  Careful over there!  These tiles have violent tendencies..."]="哇哦！小心点！这些砖有暴力倾向……"
G["Whoa!  I managed to impress Sig Nicious!  I saw him crack a smile!  I bet I can join them next year!"]="哇！我成功地吸引了西格·尼修斯的注意！他刚才对着我笑啦！我敢打赌明年我就能加入这支乐队！"
G["Whoa!  Is all that applause for me?  Thanks for coming out!"]="哇！这些掌声都是献给我的？感谢你们的到来！"
G["Whoa! Careful - it is nearly impossible to fly anywhere near the island!"]="啊！小心——我们简直没法飞近这座岛！"
