G["Whoa! Why you come here? Silly, silly! No come here!"]="哇！你来这里干什么啊？傻，傻瓜！不要来这里！"
G["Whoa! You're me, but from the future!  Hey, my equipment got an upgrade.  Cool!"]="哇！你是来自未来的我！嘿嘿，装备强力了不少嘛。真是酷毙了！"
G["Whoa!...Whoa!...Ahh!  That was close.  Whoops!...Oh the pain, dear boy the pain!"]="哇！……哇！……啊啊啊！真受不了。哎哟！……啊呀！你想杀了我么？！"
G["Whoa, I think I've got a big one..."]="哇，我想我逮到了一条大鱼……"
G["Whoa, no way!"]="哇，是不是真的啊！"
G["Whoa, there, Blanchy, you can't be having any apples today. Tomorrow, we'll be taking you down to Southshore, where you'll take a boat way across the seas."]="布兰契，不行，今天你不能吃苹果。明天我会送你去南海镇，在那儿乘船横跨海洋。"
G["Whoa, what do we have here? Looks like we have ourselves an eavesdropper, boys."]="哇，看看谁在这儿？看来我们这儿混进了个偷听者，小子们。"
G["Whoa, whoa there, my friend. One moment..."]="放松，放松，我的朋友。等一下……"
G["Whoa, whoa, hold up Dadanga girl."]="哦，哦，停下，达丹加，我的女孩。"
G["Whoa, whoa, whoa! Keep it down, $n. Keep it down!\n\n<Blast looks around.>\n\nWe don't want those frosty vrykul noticing us, now do we?\n\nWhat do you think of my jumpbot? I based it off of the mechagnome. Pretty slick, huh?"]="哇，哇，哇！小声点，$n。小声点！\n\n<布拉斯朝四周看了看。>\n\n你也不想我们被那些冰棍儿维库人发现吧？\n\n你觉得我的跳跃机器人怎么样啊？这是根据机械侏儒的原理设计的哦。很棒吧，对吗？"
G["Whoa, you aren't here to bust us, are you?"]="喔，你来这里不是要对我们进行突击搜查吧？"
G["Whoa, you made the voices go away. I'm outta here!"]="哇，你让那些声音消失了。我得走了！"
G["Whoa."]="哇。"
G["Whoa... easy, now."]="喔……放轻松，就是现在。"
G["Whoa.... dizzy!"]="哇……头晕！"
G["Whoa...Whoa..Aaaaahhh!"]="哇……啊！"
G["Whoaaa.... big kitty!"]="哇……大猫咪！"
G["Whoah there, Miss Fanny. Maybe that was too hard."]="哇哦，范妮小姐。也许太难了。"
G["Whoah!  Walk by again girl!"]="哇！美女！"
G["Whoah! Where's the workshop?! Summon me up a little later in the year, all right?"]="哇！车间哪儿去了？！等今年的晚些时候再召唤我，好吗？"
G["Whoah! You really want buy from us?"]="哇！你真的想要从我们手中购买吗？"
