G["Why !"]="怎么会这样！"
G["Why $n! Did you bring me some Swirling Mist Soup? Did you know that I love this stuff?"]="为什么$n！你给我带了一些迷雾汤？你不知道我爱死这东西了吗？"
G["Why ... won't you ... just dieeeee?"]="你去死吧……"
G["Why Goregek even bring you. You useless."]="格利基克为什么要带上你啊。你这废物。"
