G["Why am I wasting this time 'training'? I could be out there taking back my farm and putting all those Defias scum to the sword!"]="¿Por qué estoy desperdiciando este tiempo 'entrenándome'? Podría estar ahí fuera recuperando mi granja y poniendo a todos esos Defias sinvergüenzas a la espada!"
G["Why am I... here...?"]="我为什么……会在这儿……"
G["Why are Boulderfist out this far? You know that this is Kurenai territory."]="为什么石拳氏族出现在这么远的地方？你要知道这是库雷尼的领地。"
G["Why are the Darkspear in rebellion against Garrosh?"]="暗矛部族为什么要反叛加尔鲁什？"
G["Why are the gates closed?"]="为什么大门紧关着？"
G["Why are they already swarming? The time has not yet come."]="它们怎么已经开始聚集了？还没到时候啊。"
G["Why are they attacking us?!"]="他们为什么要攻击我们？！"
G["Why are they doing this?  For pearls?  For war?  This ancient, Nespirah, is far more powerful than the naga understand.  If they're able to turn her towards their will... the damage they could cause would be tremendous."]="他们为什么这么做？为了珠宝？为了战争？上古之神奈瑟匹拉远比纳迦了解得要强大得多。要是奈瑟匹拉能为他们所用……那他们所能造成的伤害将达到令人发指的程度。"
G["Why are we digging this thing up anyway, boss?"]="头儿？为什么我们挖这种东西？"
G["Why are we goin' this way?"]="我们为什么要走这条路？"
G["Why are we rocketing over to an island that has a volcano? Didn't we barely survive this scenario on Kezan?"]="为什么我们要向一座有火山的岛发射火箭？我们不是刚刚在科赞的行动中幸存下来吗？"
G["Why are we stuck protecting his domain?"]="为什么要我们守卫他的领土？"
G["Why are you always in such a rush, $n? It is like you dash madly from one stranger in need to another, bent on gaining new experiences.\n\nLife is not simply a glass you fill up! Stay a while, and enjoy the places you discover!"]="你为何总是这么行色匆匆呢，$n？你不断地帮助一个又一个陌生人，醉心于丰富自己的经验。\n\n人生不只是一个供你装满水的玻璃杯，去享受你已发现的佳境吧！"
G["Why are you and Sully out here?"]="你和苏利来这里做什么？"
G["Why are you bothering me?"]="你为什么要来打扰我？"
G["Why are you fighting against our own Warchief?"]="你为什么要反抗我们自己的酋长？"
G["Why are you fixing all of this up?"]="为什么你要把这些全都修理了？"
G["Why are you here, $n?  Is there lead in your boots?\n\nYou have the assault orders - Warmaster Garrick needs them in the Field of Strife before he can make his assault!  Go!"]="你怎么在这儿，$n？你怎么到这儿来啦？\n\n你不是带着攻击指令吗——征战平原的霜狼突击队队长还在等着发动进攻呢！去吧！"
G["Why are you here?"]="你为什么来这里？"
G["Why are you interrupting my work here?! Explain yourself!"]="为什么你要干扰我在这里的工作？给我解释清楚！"
G["Why are you playing with them? It's cruel."]="你为什么要玩弄他们？这太残酷了。"
G["Why are you so far from Toshley's Station?"]="为什么你迄今为止，都在托斯雷工作站？"
G["Why are you so green?"]="你怎么绿乎乎的？"
G["Why are you so impatient? Are you worried that the mists are going to come back before I finish my drink?"]="你怎么这么没耐心？难道你担心我还没喝完啤酒，迷雾又把岛笼罩起来了？"
G["Why are you so pink and hairless?"]="你怎么粉嘟嘟的，还不长毛？"
G["Why are you so thin?"]="¿Por qué estás tan $gdelgado:delgada;?"
G["Why are you stealing eggs?"]="你为什么要偷这些蛋？"
G["Why are you still standing there? Deliver those boxes!"]="你们还站在那里做什么？把那些箱子运走！"
G["Why are you talking to me? You don't make nearly as much money as me.\n\nGo mingle with your own kind, pal."]="你为什么要跟我说话？跟我比起来你简直就是个穷光蛋。\n\n去找你的同类吧，伙计。"
G["Why are you telling me all of this?"]="为什么你要告诉我这些？"
