G["Why bother? It's not like they actually have even the slightest clue where I am. They're not going to do any harm to the already-found artifacts around here.\n\nAnyway, one of the amusingly convenient things about evil and destruction is that they tend to just evilly destruct each other eventually."]="干嘛要自找烦恼？他们绝不可能知道我在哪里。他们也不会损害这里已经被发现的古物。\n\n而且呢，邪恶和毁灭有一个有趣的共同点，那就是它们最终会把自己摧毁。"
G["Why can we not talk to the master?"]="为什么我们不能和主人说话？"
