G["Why did I not listen?"]="……为何我不听信于你？"
G["Why did I sign up for this?"]="为什么我要签这个字？"
G["Why did he allow another warchief? He could've united the world under the Alliance banner. What a fool I was to trust his ambition!"]="他怎能容忍新的“酋长”的出现！他本可以一统全世界。我真傻，居然会指望他的野心！"
G["Why did he fight?  To die, apparently."]="他为什么要打比赛？很显然，就是为了找死。"
