G["Why didn't Lord Vyletongue unite both parts of the scepter into one?"]="诺克赛恩为什么不能将节杖的两部分结合到一起？"
G["Why didn't he listen?"]="他怎么不听劝呢！"
G["Why didn't that mage put intellect on his weapon?"]="那法师干吗不给自己的武器加智力？"
G["Why didn't you just leave?"]="你们为什么不离开？"
