G["Why do they call me \"toasty\"? \nYou really gonna ask me that? Look, it's not MY fault that the chemicals reacted that way! Blame SCIENCE!"]="¿Que por qué me llaman \"Caldeado\"?\n\n¿Me lo estás preguntando en serio? Mira, no fue culpa mía que los compuestos químicos reaccionaran así. ¡Fue culpa de la CIENCIA!"
G["Why do they like rats anyways?"]="为什么他们喜欢老鼠？"
G["Why do they need bridges, can't they fly?"]="为什么他们需要桥呢，他们不能飞吗？"
G["Why do we ally with filthy stinking trolls?  The only good troll is a dead troll."]="为什么我们和这些肮脏的巨魔结盟？只有死去的巨魔才是好巨魔。"
G["Why do we always go the same way?"]="你说，为什么咱们总是沿着这条路线跑？"
G["Why do we celebrate Pilgrim's Bounty...? Who can say. Habit, I suppose. I certainly can't taste any of it.\n\nPumpkin pie, virulent plagues... Does it really matter WHAT we're cooking up?"]="我们为什么要庆祝……？我也不太清楚。也许是习惯吧。我又尝不出什么味道。\n\n南瓜馅饼，强效药剂……我们烹制的到底是什么真的很重要吗？"
G["Why do we continue to fight in a war we have nothing to gain from? Do the dying screams of thousands not haunt your very dreams?"]="我们为什么要继续在一场毫无裨益的战斗中继续苦战？千万条生命临死前的叫喊，竟没让你夜夜噩梦缠身？"
G["Why do we continue to wait? They should make the order to attack!"]="我们为什么还要等下去？他们应该让部队出击！"
G["Why do we have to learn this stuff anyway?"]="我们为什么一定要了解这些东西呢？"
G["Why do we need them anyways?"]="但是我们为什么需要他们？"
G["Why do we not attack them outright?"]="我们为什么不直接进攻？"
G["Why do you aid the Magus? Just think of how many lives could be saved if the portal is never opened, if the resulting wars could be erased...."]="你们为什么要帮助他？想想看吧，如果黑暗之门从未打开，如果那场战争从未爆发，有多少条生命可以避免死亡的厄运……"
G["Why do you bring war and bloodshed to our land? Pandaria is a place of peace."]="你们为什么要让这片土地遭受战争和杀戮？潘达利亚是和平之地。"
G["Why do you care what we do to these fish heads?"]="不管我们对这些鱼脑袋做了什么，这关你什么事？"
G["Why do you care, Thassarian?"]="萨萨里安，你为什么这么在意？"
G["Why do you chase me, Mechanical Yeti?! WHY?!"]="你为什么要追我，机械雪人？！为什么？！"
G["Why do you come here with armaments of war? What goal could you possibly have in your coming here involving war and bloodshed?"]="你们为什么要剑拔弩张地来到这里？你们在这里展开激战与杀戮，究竟有什么目的？"
G["Why do you defend the Kirin Tor..."]="你为什么要保卫肯瑞托……"
G["Why do you disturb me?"]="为什么打搅我？"
G["Why do you do this?  Did I somehow wrong you in life?"]="你为什么要这么做？我生前对你做过什么吗？"
G["Why do you flee, mortals? There is nowhere you can run or hide here!"]="你们为什么要逃，凡人？这里没有能让你们逃避死亡的地方！"
G["Why do you interrupt me, $c?"]="你为什么要打断我，$c？"
G["Why do you keep saying he died? Who told you he died? I never said he died.\n\nHe went missing is all.\n\nYou see, apparently we had gotten into the middle of some big orc versus Dark Iron dwarf battle. The orcs, being the filthy, miserable curs that they are, were out early, setting up some traps and other diabolical things you probably wouldn't understand."]="你为什么总说他死了？谁告诉你他死了？我从来都没那么说过。\n\n他只是不知去向而已。\n\n你看，很明显，我们已经卷入了某个兽人对抗黑铁矮人的战争中。兽人是一群肮脏又卑劣的杂种，他们设计了一些圈套和你可能永远搞不明白的邪恶装置！"
G["Why do you make so many angry sounds?"]="你干嘛要发出好多愤怒的声音？"
G["Why do you not face me? Are you afraid of Efrem the Faithful?"]="你为什么不敢面对我？你害怕虔诚者埃弗雷姆吗？"
G["Why do you persist? Surely you can see the futility of it all. It is not too late! You may still leave with your lives..."]="你们为什么还要坚持下去？难道你们不明白这样做是毫无意义的吗？还不算太晚！你们仍然可以全身而退……"
G["Why do you run from me, Fluffy?!"]="小兔子，别跑啊！"
G["Why do you say that this is a coincidence, Rabine?"]="拉比恩，你为什么说这是个巧合？"
G["Why do you say that?"]="为什么这么说？"
G["Why do you seek death in this place?"]="你为什么要在这寻死？"
G["Why do you suffer the presence of this despicable Lady Liadrin? She and her followers distort the Light and make a mockery of all we stand for!"]="您为什么能允许这个卑鄙的女伯爵莉亚德琳前来谒见？她和她的手下扭曲了圣光，还取笑我们所坚持的一切！"
G["Why do you suffer?"]="为什么你要受苦？"
G["Why do you traffic with the Horde?  Their foul ways are beneath you."]="你为什么要跟部落来往？他们的居心叵测。"
G["Why do you treat Hakmud like this, buddy?"]="你为什么要这样对待哈克穆德？"
G["Why do you want to eat me when you have all of these orcs to eat?"]="你有这么多兽人可以吃，为什么还要吃我？"
G["Why do your people hate the other outsiders so? I do not understand it."]="你们怎么如此仇恨其他外乡人？我不明白。"
G["Why does everyone keep saying the LAST thing we gnomes need is more sugar?!"]="为什么每个人都不停地说侏儒只想要更多的糖果？！"
G["Why does everyone know my name?"]="为什么每个人都知道我的名字？"
G["Why does he need you?"]="为什么他会需要你们？"
