G["Why does it hurt?!"]="怎么那么疼啊？！"
G["Why does it matter?"]="这重要吗？"
G["Why does my cousin get to enjoy the balmy beaches of Stranglethorn, anyway?"]="凭什么我的外甥每天都能享受荆棘谷的阳光和海滩呢？舅舅真是不好当。"
G["Why does that keep happening?"]="为什么这些破事儿来个没完了？"
G["Why doesn't Kaendris move against Dar'Khan yet?  What is it we're waiting for?"]="为什么坎迪瑞斯还不开始攻击达尔坎？我们在等什么？"
G["Why don't I dance at parties? I have no body to dance wit'!"]="我为什么不在聚会上跳舞？因为我没有身体！"
G["Why don't buffets ever have anything good?"]="自助餐为什么总是没有好东西呢？"
G["Why don't people get shot out of cannons all the time?"]="为什么那个大炮里不能一直飞出人来？"
