G["Why don't you discard it..."]="你干嘛不扔掉它……"
G["Why don't you escape?"]="你为什么不逃呢？"
G["Why don't you get a job somewhere else?"]="你为什么不去其它地方找活儿干呢？"
G["Why don't you go hone your skills with Mirvedon first? He'll gladly show you the basics."]="你为什么不先去米尔温多那里磨炼下自己的技术呢？他会很乐意为你传授基础知识的。"
G["Why don't you let me do the talking?"]="你为什么就不能让我来说话？"
G["Why don't you pick up a hammer and start banging on these structures instead of asking us if it's done every 5 minutes?"]="你为什么不拿起锤子去敲那些房子呢？不要每五分钟就来烦我一次！"
G["Why don't you take it where somebody cares?"]="为什么你不去找找会在乎它的人？"
G["Why don't you try looking in the Lion's Pride Inn?  The cook there might be able to teach you a few good recipes."]="你为什么不到狮王之傲看看呢？那里的厨师可能会教你几道好菜。"
G["Why everyone else get so big?"]="为什么其他人都那么大？"
G["Why fight it? Give in, maggot!"]="为什么还要垂死挣扎？投降吧！"
G["Why flail around when all you need..."]="何必大费周章，其实你要做的只是……"
G["Why go to broken pillar? You dumb, slave thing. Goregek go."]="为什么要去破柱子那里啊？你这个蠢奴隶。格利基克要走了。"
G["Why has this gathering been called?"]="为什么要把我们召集起来？"
G["Why has this happened? Why have you come here?"]="为什么会发生这种事？为什么你会来？"
G["Why hasn't Illidan made his move?  All this waiting is making our forces uneasy."]="为什么伊利丹还没有开始行动？我们的军队已经等得心神不安了。"
G["Why have I been sent back to this particular place and time?"]="旧斯坦索姆……为什么送我回到这一时间流？"
G["Why have you brought your war to our land? What of your homes? Was there nothing worth fighting for there?"]="为什么要把战争引到我们的土地上来？你们的家乡呢？在那里已经没什么好争的了吗？"
G["Why have you captured us?"]="为什么你要捕获我们？"
G["Why have you come here, $c?"]="你为何来此，$c？"
G["Why have you come here, outsider?"]="¿Por qué has venido aquí, $gintruso:intrusa;?"
G["Why have you come here, outsider? You will only find pain! Our fate will be yours..."]="陌生人，你来这儿做什么？你会堕入痛苦的深渊！落得和我们一样的下场……"
G["Why have you come here?"]="你为什么会来这里？"
G["Why have you come here? What are your intentions?"]="你们来这里干什么？你们有什么目的？"
G["Why have you come so far north? And why are you trespassing in our lands?"]="你们为什么不远万里来北方？为什么要侵犯我们的土地？"
G["Why have you come to our village, outsiders?"]="你为什么会到我们村子里来，外来者？"
G["Why have you done such horrible things?"]="你到底做了什么可怕的事？"
G["Why have you summoned me so soon?  I haven't yet reached my full power!"]="你为什么这样急于召唤了我？我还没恢复我所有的力量！"
G["Why haven't the Stormwind guards come?"]="为什么暴风城的卫兵还没有来？"
G["Why haven't we left yet?  I'm ready to head off on my own if we don't get going."]="为什么我们还不离开？如果你们不走，我就要自己走了。"
G["Why hello chaps, I have a not so surprising surprise for you this eve."]="你们好，伙计们，今晚，我为你们准备了一个不应该让你们太吃惊的惊喜。"
G["Why hello there, fellow member of the Alliance!\n\nAs an official representative of Gadgetzan, I'm here to make sure we poor scattered gnomes can peacefully co-exist with the Steamwheedle goblins here in Gadgetzan! We may even be open to tolerating the presence of their new Horde goblin friends.\n\nI'm sure we can all come to an agreeable decision with your help!"]="¡Vaya, hola, $gcompañero:compañera; de la Alianza!\n\nComo representante oficial de Gadgetzan, estoy aquí para asegurarme de que los pobres gnomos podemos convivir pacíficamente con los goblins del Cártel Bonvapor, aquí en Gadgetzan. Puede que incluso lleguemos a tolerar la presencia de sus nuevos amigos goblins de la Horda.\n\n¡Seguro que con tu ayuda podemos llegar a un acuerdo!"
G["Why hello, $n. I know everything that happens around The Heartland, my dear. You don't get to be my age without making a few loose-lipped friends."]="你好啊，$n。汇风岭附近发生的一切我都已经了然于胸了，宝贝儿。活到我这把年纪，总会交到几个大嘴巴的朋友。"
G["Why hello. I'm from out of town."]="你好，我是从外地来的。"
G["Why hullo there, Bessy. Its your turn for a walk today, isn't it?"]="贝希，你在叫什么？该出去走走了，对吧？"
G["Why in the world would I order that?!"]="我怎么可能会点这个？！"
G["Why is Thrall allowing this to happen to our city?"]="萨尔怎么能听任我们的城市发生这种事？"
G["Why is all of your grain so bland?"]="你的谷物怎么这么寡淡无味？"
G["Why is everyone looking at me as if I crashed the ship?"]="飞船又不是因为我才坠毁的，为什么大家都朝我瞪眼？"
G["Why is everyone so afraid? I won't let those trolls get to our well! I'm a good guard!"]="大家为什么都这么害怕？我不会让那些巨魔接近我们的水井！我是个合格的守卫！"
G["Why is it everywhere on this island I go my hair always feels like it is standing on end?"]="这座岛是怎么回事？为什么不管我走到哪里，我的头发总是会竖起来？"
G["Why is it that small creatures such as goblins are always fascinated with larger creatures?"]="为什么像地精这样的小生物总是迷恋创造大的发明呢？"
G["Why is it that there's never a gyrochronatom lying around when you need one?"]="为什么当你要用到发条式同步协调陀螺仪的时候它们总是无影无踪呢？"
G["Why is it you can't just talk out your differences? I have never encountered a problem that a good long talk couldn't fix!"]="你们怎么就不能开诚布公地讨论下彼此的分歧？我还没遇见过什么难题是长谈解决不了的！"
G["Why is me pet gone?"]="我的宠物怎么不见了？"
G["Why is that, Li Li?"]="为什么呢，丽丽？"
G["Why is that?"]="为什么呢？"
G["Why is the city under lock down?"]="城市怎么被封锁了？"
G["Why is the door shut? What in Sylvanas' name is going on here..."]="为什么这道门关上了？以希尔瓦娜斯的名义，这里到底发生了什么……"
G["Why is this creature defying me?!"]="为什么它会公然反抗我？！"
G["Why is this happening?"]="为什么会这样？"
G["Why is this ritual taking so long? Your master promised that your assistance would speed the process!"]="仪式怎么要进行这么久？你的主子向我保证过，说有了你的帮助，仪式会快很多的！"
G["Why is your wife still using the oven? My meat needs cooking!"]="你妻子怎么还在用烤箱？我还等着烤肉呢！"
G["Why isn't the Outland called Draenor anymore?"]="为什么外域不再叫作德拉诺了？"
G["Why isn't there beer-flavored candy?!"]="怎么就没有啤酒味的糖果呢？！"
G["Why it keep telling me to put da lotion in da basket? Me no like da lotion!"]="为什么非要我把洗涤剂放到篮子里？我讨厌洗涤剂！"
G["Why it no move?"]="它怎么不动？"
G["Why let a perfectly good corpse go to waste?"]="为什么要白白浪费一具完美的尸体？"
G["Why me have to carry big rock? Dey said less work under da new Warchief! Dey promised change!"]="为什么我非要搬大石头？他们说新酋长继任后工作量会减少的！他们保证会有所变化的！"
G["Why me?  Why not a goblin, or a gnome..."]="为什么是我？为什么不是一个地精或者侏儒……"
G["Why must I be surrounded by incompetence?  Oh well, perhaps some of my underling may eventually grow a brain."]="为什么我身边总是有无数的低能儿呢？好吧，也许在不久将来的某一天，我的某些手下会突然长出个脑子来。"
G["Why must I retrieve Light's Vengeance?"]="为什么我必须取回圣光的复仇？"
G["Why must it be this way?"]="为什么会这样呢？"
G["Why must we ride to battle in some pathetic mercenary vessel?"]="为什么我们要乘着这些可悲的雇佣兵船去打仗？"
G["Why must we ride to battle on a mercenary ship? Used to be that we'd kill pirates as soon as look at them."]="我们为什么要乘一艘雇佣兵船上战场？在过去我们早把这些海盗就地正法了。"
G["Why must you taunt me so?"]="你为什么非要如此嘲弄我？"
G["Why my son must be so short? I wanted tall, strong young son.\n\nI told him not to open umbrellas indoors when he was little. You will grow up short, I say!\n\nWhat does he do? He play with umbrellas all the time! Inside! Tcha!"]="为什么我的儿子就得是个矮子？我想要高大、强壮的儿子。\n\n在他小的时候，我就告诉他，不要在室内撑雨伞。我说，这样你会长不高！\n\n然后他做了什么？他总是打着雨伞玩！在房子里面！"
G["Why not destroy them with the combined might of the Aspects?"]="为什么巨龙们不联合起来消灭它们？"
G["Why not keep fighting?"]="为什么不继续打下去？"
G["Why not regrow your farm somewhere else? I'm sure the other villagers would help you."]="为什么不去其它地方重新开垦农田？相信其他村民会帮助你的。"
G["Why not? A family can give you strength."]="为什么不？家庭可以给你力量。"
G["Why not? Just think how much better it'll look with the hatchlings to either side --"]="为什么啊？如果我们能将她和雏鸟做成标本，陈列在一起也挺不错的呀——"
G["Why now, $r? I just do not understand it. So much work to be done..."]="为什么是现在，$R？我不明白。要做的事情还有很多……"
G["Why old mogu build broken pillars and walls here?  Why not build full buildings like everyone else?  Mogu dumb."]="为什么老魔古在这里修建破碎的柱子和墙壁？为什么不像其他人一样建造完整的建筑物？愚蠢的魔古。"
G["Why pie over cake?"]="为什么是馅饼而不是蛋糕？"
G["Why settle for weak, flavorless noodles? Try them yaungolian style!"]="那种清汤寡水的面有什么好吃的？来尝尝野牛人鲜辣面吧！"
G["Why should I answer that?  Do you tell fortunes when people shake YOU?"]="为啥我一定要回答你的问题？你会在别人摇晃你的时候占卜吗？"
G["Why should I bloody my blades when I have you to do the dirty work for me?"]="明明是你在替我干脏活，我为什么要弄脏自己的武器呢？"
G["Why should I bother fixing the trap?  Why not just eliminate the guard the old fashioned way?"]="为什么我要做修好陷阱这样的麻烦事儿？为什么不按老办法杀死守卫？"
G["Why should I help the August Celestials?"]="我为什么要帮助至尊天神？"
G["Why should I help the Lorewalkers?"]="我为什么应该帮助游学者？"
G["Why should I help the Shado-Pan?"]="我为什么应该帮助影踪派？"
G["Why should I help the Tillers?"]="我为什么应该帮助阡陌客？"
G["Why should I return, $n? The world is ending and I have a chance to become something more. If their paths lead them to the truth, as mine did, then we will see each other again. If not, I cannot open their eyes."]="$n，为什么我要回去？这个世界即将完结，而我有机会得到升华。如果他们的道路能够将他们引向真实，就像我的道路一样，那么我们终将重逢。如果不是，我也无法让他们睁开眼睛。"
G["Why should the Banshee Queen spare your miserable life?"]="为什么女妖之王要饶恕你的小命？"
G["Why should we be slaves to honor, when we could slaughter the children of our enemies while they sleep? My blade thirsts for Alliance blood!"]="既然可以趁敌人沉睡的时候杀死他们的孩子，为何还要顾及荣誉？我的剑在渴望联盟的鲜血！"
G["Why should we believe you?"]="为什么我们要相信你？"
G["Why should we help you? The world is ruined. Destroyed."]="为什么我们要帮助你们？这个世界已经被毁灭了，被破坏了。"
G["Why should we help you? What if we kept the Barrens supplies for ourselves?"]="我们为什么要帮助你？要是我们把贫瘠之地的补给都留给自己又会怎样？"
G["Why should we trade with you? How are you any different than your Horde friends save the color of your banner?"]="我们为什么要跟你做生意？除了旗帜颜色以外，你和你那些部落同伴还有什么区别？"
G["Why should we trust you, stranger?"]="¿Por qué deberíamos confiar en ti, $gextraño:extraña;?"
G["Why so angry?"]="干嘛这么生气？"
G["Why so surprised, $n?\n\nIt is as I have always told you. Pandaria is a wondrous land full of secrets and mysteries."]="干嘛这么吃惊，$n？\n\n我早就跟你说了。潘达利亚是一片充满未解之谜的神奇土地。"
G["Why stinky candle talk so much?"]="怎么这么多嘴？"
G["Why thank you, my pet."]="谢谢你，我的宝贝。"
G["Why trust you now, Crowley? You abandoned us. Left us to die."]="我们现在为什么要相信你，克罗雷？你抛弃了我们。任由我们自生自灭。"
G["Why was the tank nervous before the fight?\n\n...\n\nBecause he was a worrier!"]="坦克为什么会在战斗之前感到紧张？\n\n……\n\n因为他们总是很忐忑！"
G["Why we are the grummles! The mountain ferries. The packers of the trails. The guides through the mountains. and the deliverers of supplies.\n\nWe are the people who keep the defenders of the wall fed, and we are the people who travel the Burlap Trail since the time of the mogu dynasties.\n\nWe also have the most best noses for smelling luck!"]="我们为什么是土地精呢！山中的驳车。小径上的送货人。山间的向导，还有补给品运送员。\n\n我们给城墙上的守护者提供食物，我们也是从魔古帝国开元就在粗麻小径上穿梭的人。\n\n我们也拥有最棒的鼻子，可以嗅出好运的味道！"
G["Why we don't just kill you is beyond my understanding."]="为什么不直接杀掉你呢，真是奇怪。"
G["Why we gotta taxi you? Canna ya just sneak in dere, mon?"]="我们为什么要提供出租车服务？难道你不能偷偷溜到那里去吗，朋友？"
G["Why we not eating carrot?"]="我们为什么不吃这根胡萝卜？"
G["Why we not gets no Kaja'Cola? We wants to have ideas!"]="为什么不给我们来点儿卡亚可乐！我们需要灵感！"
G["Why were you sent to awaken me? Why did the Klaxxi not send one of their own?"]="你为何前来唤醒我？卡拉克西部族为何不派遣他们自己的成员前来？"
G["Why were you travelling to the Crane Temple?"]="你为什么要去朱鹤寺？"
G["Why won't Elder Lu let us fight the hozen back properly."]="为什么长老卢山不让我们反击猢狲呢？"
G["Why won't this engine work? What's wrong with the power cells we recovered?"]="这引擎怎么不动？莫非是电池出了问题？"
G["Why won't you give up?!"]="你为什么不放弃？！"
G["Why won't you just let go? Why do you fight the inevitable?"]="为什么不选择放弃？为什么要执泥于必然的结局？"
G["Why won't you leave us alone?"]="你能不能别来骚扰我们？"
G["Why would I call on you?"]="我为什么要叫你？"
G["Why would I want to feel skinny? Size is strength."]="我为什么想要苗条呢？体格等于力量。"
G["Why would I want to ride a shredder?"]="我干嘛要乘坐伐木机？"
G["Why would anyone want to dig up something so horrific? I'm convinced those things are behind what's happening to the animals here."]="为什么会有人想要挖掘这么恐怖的东西？我相信就是这些东西导致了这里的动物们所遭遇的灾难。"
G["Why would he run off like that?!"]="为什么他会那样逃走？！"
G["Why would she choose... an outsider?"]="¿Por qué elegiría a $gun:una;... $gextraño:extraña;?"
G["Why would the trade prince do this?"]="为什么贸易大王会这样做？"
G["Why would they do something like this?"]="他们为什么要做这种事？"
G["Why would they not listen?"]="他们为什么不肯听？"
G["Why would we ever need carrots this big?"]="我们干嘛要种这么大个的胡萝卜？"
G["Why would you bring a pregnant woman with you?"]="你为什么要带上个孕妇？"
G["Why would you ever want to harm me!? Come. Friends we can be!"]="为什么你想要伤害我！？我们可以成为朋友的！"
G["Why would you want to talk to Kaplak?  Nevermind.  Look for him on top of the burrow in the southwest corner of Razor Hill.  Just make sure that you keep your hands in your own pockets!"]="你为什么想找卡普拉克谈谈？没关系。到剃刀岭西南角的洞穴顶部找他。不过你一定不要把手放错地方！"
G["Why ya be doin' dis? We all part o' dah Horde."]="你为什么要做这种事情？我们都是部落成员！"
G["Why ya be doin' this? We be loyal to da Horde!"]="你为什么要做这种事情？我们忠诚于部落！"
G["Why ya wanna mess wit me innards, mon?"]="干嘛非得把我惹火呢？"
G["Why you break our home?!"]="为什么你要破坏我们的家园？！"
G["Why you call Wikky?"]="你为什么叫光板儿？"
G["Why you do that?  Why you kill?"]="为什么你要这么干？为什么你要杀戮？"
G["Why you guys upside down?"]="你们怎么都是头朝下？"
G["Why you hurt Rageclaw? You crazy?"]="¿Por qué haces daño a Garrafuria? ¿Tú $gloco:loca;?"
G["Why you just sit around? Get to work, slave thing!"]="别想偷懒。奴隶，赶紧做事！"
G["Why you keep hurting me? Me said me sorry..."]="你怎么还啄我？我都说对不起了……"
G["Why you little irradiated..."]="你这被辐射的小矮子为什么要……"
G["Why you little!"]="为什么你这个小东西这么做！"
G["Why you little..."]="为什么你这么矮小……"
G["Why you look at me like dat?  You not gonna kiss me, right!?"]="你为什么这么看着我？你不会是想吻我吧，是不是！？"
G["Why you mean to Lump? Lump hungry, dat's all."]="为什么你对拉普这么粗暴？拉普只是饿了。"
G["Why you must come here? My cave. My cave! Me never hurt your cave!"]="为什么你一定要来我的洞？我的洞！我可从没弄坏过你的洞！"
G["Why you no fight? I said fight!"]="怎么不打？我让你们打！"
G["Why you poke me when me eating?!"]="为什么你要在我吃饭的时候戳我？！"
G["Why you run away? We make your corpse into Scourge."]="为什么要跑？我们会让你的尸体加入天灾军团的。"
G["Why you smell so bad now? You smelled much less bad before!"]="你的味道怎么这么难闻了？你以前没这么难闻的！"
G["Why you so mean to Zunta, eh?"]="干嘛对祖塔这么刻薄啊？"
G["Why you stop moving?"]="你怎么不动了呢？"
G["Why you sure know how to impress a lady! Ain't no diamond, but I love it anyway!"]="你为何如此懂得取悦一名女士的！虽然不是钻石，但我就是喜欢！"
G["Why you think puppy-man hatchlings keep asking if we pity Lafoo? Lafoo talks a lot, but he's our friend."]="你觉得小狗狗人为什么总追问我们是否同情拉弗乌呢？拉弗乌的确很多话，但他是我们的好朋友。"
G["Why you try to take my sword?  It's MY sword!"]="你为什么想抢走我的剑？这是我的剑！"
G["Why you wake Wikky?"]="你为什么要叫醒光板儿？"
G["Why you wake ghost? Where other Stonemauls?!"]="为什么要惊扰沉睡的鬼魂？别的石槌食人魔呢？！"
G["Why you want hurt Patchwerk?"]="为什么要伤害帕奇维克？"
G["Why you would want to leave these sunny shores and crystal blue waters I have no idea. It's like paradise down here. But don't tell my brother Zapetta that, he's bitter enough already about getting stuck up there in Tirisfal all day long. This Zeppelin here drops off at Orgrimmar so you shouldn't have to worry about having to listen to him whine. But if you are in Tirisfal anytime soon, heed my warning and don't get him started."]="我不知道你为什么想要离开这阳光灿烂的沙滩和蓝色晶莹的水域。这里就象是天堂。但是不要告诉我的哥哥萨匹塔这些，他整天被困在提瑞斯法已经够难过的了。这里的地精飞艇目的地是奥格瑞玛，所以你不用担心得听他发牢骚。但是如果你到了提瑞斯法，要留意我的警告并且不要让他开始抱怨。"
G["Why you're just the $c I was looking for! I'm testing a new rocket-powered flying device, and I need your help!\nJust take one of these harnesses and put it on under your armor.  Hit the button on the side, and BOOM, off you go.\nDon't go trying to steal my work though. Each of these babies is fitted with a Transponster 8000 linked to the one in my hand. If you get too far from me the Transponster will shut down the main rocket and you'll be unable to lift off until you return.\nNow where did I put those liability forms?"]="¡Pero si eres $gel:la:c; $c que estaba buscando! Estoy probando un nuevo dispositivo volador propulsado por cohetes y necesito tu ayuda.\n\nCoge uno de estos arneses y colócalo bajo tu armadura. Pulsa el botón del lado, y BUM, ¡allá vas!\n\nNo intentes robarme el trabajo, ¿eh? Estas bellezas tienen integrado un transponstador 8000 vinculado al de mi mano. Si te alejas demasiado, se desactivará el cohete principal y no podrás despegar hasta que vuelvas.\n\nVeamos, ¿dónde he metido los contratos de responsabilidad?"
G["Why'd you go and have to do that? ...hic!"]="你为什么非得那么做？……嗝儿！"
G["Why'd you have the Furlbrows killed?"]="你为什么要除掉法布隆一家？"
G["Why's it shooting steam out of the side there, then?"]="为什么它会从那一侧喷蒸汽出来？"
G["Why's that?"]="怎么说？"
G["Why's the ground shaking, $n?!"]="为什么地面在颤抖，$n？！"
G["Why, Denatharion?  I knew you when you were a boy.  You had hope in your heart."]="为什么，德纳萨里安？我看着你长大，你心中曾经充满希望。"
G["Why, I think he's trying to revive the tree!"]="怎么，我看它是想复活这棵树！"
G["Why, Luhanaa?  Why?!"]="为什么，鲁哈娜？为什么？！"
G["Why, hello again!"]="嗨，我们又见面了！"
G["Why, hello stranger. You look like a creature that has stories to tell."]="Ey, hola $gforastero:forastera;. Tienes pinta de ser una criatura con muchas historias que contar."
G["Why, just look at the treasure he has accumulated!\n\nI'm not always comfortable with his methods, but there's no denying the results...\n\nBest not to dwell upon unpleasant thoughts. It's bad manners, you know."]="看看他积聚的财富！\n\n他的手段经常会让我感到不舒服，但这个结果却是无法否认的……\n\n不要去想那些令人不快的事情了。要知道，这样也不礼貌。"
G["Why, thank you. I do pride myself on knowing when a little bit of grease beats spending hours of sorcerous study for the same effect."]="哎呀，谢谢你。有时候，小恩小惠远胜于数小时的巫术研究。"
G["Why, the refurbished shredder key, silly!\n\nIf you haven't already gotten one today you can talk to my brother, Synipus."]="翻新过的伐木机的钥匙啊，笨！\n\n如果没有的话，你可以和我的兄弟塞尼普斯谈谈。"
G["Why, up the river of course!\n\nHaha! Up the river... Okay, okay, you can find him working on shredders up at Blue Sky Logging Ground.\n\nOh, and you can tell him that if he sends me any more half-finished shredders he WILL be up a river!"]="当然是在河流上游啊！\n\n哈哈！在上游……嗯，你可以在蓝天伐木场找到他，这家伙大概正开着伐木机忙活呢。\n\n哦，顺便告诉他，如果他再送来半成品的伐木机，我就让他好看！"
G["Why, what brings you all the way over here, young $r? Please be cautious. Our foes stream forth from a hole in the mountain to the east - they have done irreparable harm to this land."]="你怎么会来到这里，年轻的$r？请小心，我们的敌人正在从东边山脉中的一个窟窿里源源不断地涌出来。他们对这片土地造成了严重的伤害。"
G["Why, yes, Bertelm, I've finished your hat. I used the largest, puffiest, most magnificent feather I could find. Perhaps you'd like me to measure you for a new pair of hose while you're -"]="什么？啊，当然，波尔泰姆，你的帽子做好了。我用了大量蓬松的、我所能找到的最华丽的羽毛制成了它。如果你愿意的话，我还可以为你量一量尺寸，做一双新的长筒袜——"
G["Why, yes... does Chromie need this?  I suppose she would.\n\nYes, you may have it.  Feel free to leaf through the pages.  Inside you will find the history of Darrowshire, and the details of the events that led to the deaths of so very many men."]="嗯，有的……克罗米需要这个？应该是吧。\n\n我可以把它给你，随你翻看。它会告诉你达隆郡的历史，以及导致那么多人死亡的许多事件细节。"
G["Why, you look like a common street urchin!"]="哎呀，你看起来就像是一个普通的街头顽童！"
G["Why..."]="你……"
G["Why... that is very sweet of you.  I gather that you are volunteering time for Children's Week, yes $c?  Well, you are to be commended.  It is imperative that we remember those less fortunate - especially the children.\n\nI'd be happy to sign an autograph.  Here you go."]="Oh... Qué amable de tu parte. Supongo que te estás ofreciendo $gvoluntario:voluntaria; para la Semana de los Niños, ¿no, $c? Bueno, eres $gdigno:digna; de elogio. Es de suma importancia que recordemos a aquellos menos afortunados, especialmente los niños.\n\nMe encantará firmar un autógrafo. Aquí tienes..."
G["Why... what happened..."]="怎么了……出了什么事……"
G["Why... why sister?  Why did it have to come to this?"]="为什么……为什么？我们非要闹到这步田地吗？"
G["Why... yes, of course.  I've something to show you right inside this building, Mr. Anvilward."]="啊……是的，当然。不过首先我在这间房子里准备了一些东西要让你看看，安威瓦尔德先生。"
G["Why...?"]="为什么……？"
G["Why...why him? We are simple farmers...what did we do to deserve this?"]="为什么……为什么是他？我们只是淳朴的农民……怎么竟然这么倒霉？"
G["Why?"]="为什么？"
G["Why?  Why are you leaving me?"]="为什么？为什么你要离开我？"
G["Why? WHY! Why was I \"gifted\" such a burden?"]="¿Por qué? ¡POR QUÉ! ¿Por qué me \"regalaron\" tal carga?"
G["Why? Why did it have to be him?"]="为什么？为什么非得是他？"
G["Why? Why you not just leave Dim alone?"]="为什么就不能让迪姆安静一会儿呢？"
G["Why?!"]="为什么？！"
G["Wi... Will it hurt?"]="会……会痛吗？"
G["Wicked! You found my body! Look at them old bones."]="见鬼！你找到了我的身体！看看这些老骨头。"
G["Wicked, wicked, mortals! The forest weeps. The elements recoil at the destruction. Ivus must purge you from this world!"]="邪恶，太邪恶了，你们这些凡人！森?在哭泣，元素的力量在毁灭面前颤抖。伊弗斯必须把你们从这世上清除！"
G["Wield this mighty weapon and direct the souls that empower it."]="挥舞这强大的武器，指挥那些赋予它力量的灵魂。"
G["Wiggling, eh? Well, as Grandpa used to say: carrots don't dance!\n\nSomething is trying to pull the veggies right out from under us!\n\nI'm afraid you'll have to kill whatever varmit's down there if you want the crop to have any peace. Heartbreaking, I know, but it's part of the job."]="有东西在摇晃，嗯？好吧，正如爷爷常说的那样：胡萝卜可不会跳舞！\n\n有东西正试图从我们脚下拉走那些蔬菜！\n\n如果你想保护好这些农作物，恐怕你得杀掉那些在下边作祟的捣蛋鬼。是令人心碎，我知道，但这是工作的一部分。"
G["Wiiiiiildhammmmmer!"]="蛮——锤！"
G["Wika-Wika just trying to start a farm. Didn't know it would be this hard."]="维卡维卡只想试着经营农场。没想到竟然这么难。"
G["Wikket big hozen grooker!"]="蠢蛋是猢狲的大克星！"
G["Wikket gonna eat lightning and derk thunder!"]="蠢蛋要把闪电和滚雷吃到肚子里去！"
G["Wikket got lucky today. Wrestler gonna beat on rematch!"]="蠢蛋今天走运了。摔跤手只好重赛了！"
G["Wikket got slickies?"]="蠢蛋有鱼吗？"
G["Wikket grook the croc? Nice wikket?"]="蠢蛋干掉了鳄鱼？好蠢蛋？"
G["Wikket grookin stinky slickies!"]="蠢蛋捞到臭熏熏的光板儿！"
G["Wikket grookin' crocs and savin' hozen?"]="是蠢蛋干掉了鳄鱼，救了猢狲？"
G["Wikket gunna get grooked!"]="蠢蛋要被揍扁了！"
G["Wikket gunna swim with the slickies!"]="把这个蠢货拖出去去喂鱼！"
G["Wikket invasion! Fire from the sky!"]="无毛怪入侵！无毛怪从天上来！"
G["Wikket no grookin' hozen?"]="蠢蛋想要耍猢狲？"
G["Wikket ooked the big Dook!?"]="无毛怪打死了大乌克门？！"
G["Wikket savin' hozen?"]="蠢蛋救了猢狲？"
G["Wikket smart to be friend to hozen.\n\nNow, one less wikket hozen have to smash."]="蠢蛋选择和猢狲做朋友真是明智。\n\n现在，猢狲要砸扁的蠢蛋又少了一个。"
G["Wikket stew, coming up!"]="蠢蛋炖肉，就要端上来了！"
G["Wikket thinks it won? Ha! Master Boom Boom never say \"surrender\"! Stalemate!"]="¿Makaku piensa ke ganó? ¡Ja! ¡El maestro Bum Bum nunka dice \"rendirse\"! ¡Tablas!"
G["Wikket whacked!"]="蠢蛋挨了一下！"
G["Wikkets be crazy!"]="蠢蛋疯了！"
G["Wikkets be trailin!"]="蠢蛋紧追不舍！"
G["Wikkets can't survive the Boom Boom Boogaloo!"]="轰轰大狂欢，蠢蛋死定啦！"
G["Wikkets did this!"]="是蠢蛋做的！"
G["Wikkets don't want hozen to take their munchpacks! But hozen are gonna take! Ravage!"]="蠢蛋不想让猢狲抢走果子！可猢狲照样要抢！抢啊！"
G["Wikkets gonna be munch munch food for Old Poot Poot."]="蠢蛋会被老波波大口大口吃掉的。"
G["Wikkets gonna burn!"]="蠢蛋要烧起来了！"
G["Wikkets gonna face the Boom Boom!"]="让蠢蛋尝尝我的轰轰吧！"
G["Wikkets gonna fail. I got a box full of boom booms!"]="蠢蛋死定了。我有一大盒轰轰！"
G["Wikkets gonna get Ba-Bammed!"]="那小子要被痛扁一顿了！"
G["Wikkets gonna get Goated!"]="山羊要踩扁蠢蛋！"
G["Wikkets gonna get served!"]="那蠢货要倒霉了！"
G["Wikkets gonna hurt!"]="胖揍蠢蛋一顿！"
G["Wikkets got boomed!"]="蠢蛋被炸飞了！"
G["Wikkets got munchpacks! Get munchpacks!"]="蠢蛋抢到果子了！抢果子！"
G["Wikkets is furry food!"]="蠢蛋就是毛毛的食物！"
G["Wikkets no take packers back!"]="蠢蛋没把运货人带回来！"
G["Wikkets think hozen weak!"]="蠢蛋以为猢狲不堪一击！"
G["Wikkets think they can take the Boom Boom Boogaloo?"]="蠢蛋以为自己能抵挡住轰轰大狂欢？"
G["Wikkets!"]="蠢蛋！"
G["Wikkets... gonna... pay."]="蠢蛋……会遭……报应的。"
G["Wikkets... out-bammed... Ba-Bam..."]="蠢蛋……坏透了……巴巴姆……"
G["Wikky be back soon!"]="光板儿马上回来！"
G["Wikky brings you presents!"]="光板儿把礼物带给你！"
G["Wikky dids what you asks!"]="光板儿任你差遣！"
G["Wikky find presents!"]="光板儿找到礼物了！"
G["Wikky hear whistle!"]="光板儿听到了口哨声！"
G["Wikky is back!"]="光板儿回来了！"
G["Wikky is helpful!"]="光板儿能帮上忙！"
G["Wikky is helpful! See??"]="光板儿能帮上忙！看见没？？"
G["Wikky is here!"]="光板儿在这儿！"
G["Wild?! Now that's a surprise! Grandpa used to tell stories about having to wrestle his wild crops into submission.\n\n\"Yoonie,\" he used to say, \"don't be afraid to slap your scallions around.\"\n\nI always thought he was just being gross."]="¡¿Salvajes?! ¡Menuda sorpresa! El abuelo contaba historias sobre tener que luchar con sus cultivos salvajes para someterlos.\n\n\"Yoonie\", decía, \"no tengas miedo de abofetear a las cebolletas\".\n\nYo creía que solo estaba diciendo guarrerías."
G["Wildhammer assaults on this square have been relentless, $n. But they will never take me down. Watch and learn."]="蛮锤矮人不停地向这里发动猛攻，$n。但他们赢不了我。好好学着吧。"
G["Wildhammer reinforcements have arrived!"]="蛮锤援军到了！"
G["Wildhammer stay ta'gether wot slay ta'gether!"]="蛮锤朝夕共度，比肩杀敌！"
G["Wildhammers!"]="蛮锤！"
G["Wildkin are inherently magical; this power was bestowed upon them by the goddess."]="枭兽天生具有魔力；这种力量是由女神赐予他们的。"
G["Wildlord, I seem to have lost my druid signal."]="荒野之王，我似乎弄丢了我的德鲁伊信号弹。"
G["Will I be rewarded for helping to defend the Vale?"]="帮助护谷我会得到奖励吗？"
G["Will I?"]="我会吗？"
G["Will he win? Can he win?"]="他会赢吗？他能赢吗？"
G["Will save for snack. For later."]="可以留下来当个小点心。"
G["Will she survive? Will she prevail? Only time will tell. And now... on with the show!"]="她能逃脱魔掌吗？她能平安回家吗？只有时间才能回答这些问题。现在——演出开始！"
G["Will somebody please help this ogre so that he won't come back?"]="有人愿意帮帮这个食人魔吗？那样他就不会再回来了。"
G["Will someone please give my little kitten a good home?"]="有没有人愿意给我的小猫一个温暖的家?"
G["Will the Horde grant me the chance to battle the Scourge?"]="部落能让我参与对抗天灾军团的战争吗？"
G["Will the nightmare ever end?!  I cannot force myself awake!"]="什么时候噩梦才能结束？！我不能强迫自己醒过来！"
G["Will the pain ever end?"]="何时才能结束这种痛苦啊？"
G["Will these daggers help?"]="这些匕首能派得上用处吗？"
G["Will these earthquakes ever stop?"]="这里的地震永远都停不下来吗？"
G["Will these invaders ever stop?!"]="这些入侵者何时才能停下来？！"
G["Will these unrelenting Scourge attacks never end?"]="这无穷无尽的天灾军团什么时候才会停止进攻？"
G["Will this suffice?"]="这些够了么？"
G["Will we ever be able to go back home?"]="我们究竟还能不能回家？"
G["Will we never learn to work together?  Or will we simply kill each other off and be forgotten in time."]="我们要什么时候才能学会团结？这样继续互相争斗下去，很快我们就会被历史所遗忘的。"
G["Will we win this war? Only thyme will tell."]="我们能否赢得这场战争？只有天知道。"
G["Will work for food..."]="我愿意为食物而工作……"
G["Will you accept my ring?"]="你愿意收下这枚戒指吗？"
G["Will you accompany Orkus to Purgation Isle?"]="你会将奥尔库斯护送至赎罪岛吗？"
G["Will you blow up that door now?"]="你现在可以炸开那扇门了吗？"
G["Will you challenge the best?\n\nWill you lose like the rest?\n\nOnly one way to find out. Dare you attempt it, $gsir:madame;?\n\nOnly a token for a try..."]="想要挑战顶尖高手吗？\n\n你会像别人一样铩羽而归吗？\n\n验证的办法只有一个。你敢来试试吗，$g先生:女士;？\n\n一个代币就能玩一局……"
G["Will you do whatever it takes to save your kingdom?"]="你是否愿意不惜一切代价来挽救你的王国？"
G["Will you ever finish your work, smith? Perhaps you require additional encouragement?"]="你到底要到什么时候才能完成呀，铁匠？你是不是还想要额外的鼓励？"
G["Will you help an old man retrace the steps of the last emperor?"]="你愿意帮助一位老人重走末代皇帝之路吗？"
G["Will you help me find my dog?"]="你能帮我找到我的狗吗？"
G["Will you help us against the sha?"]="你会帮助我们对付煞魔吗？"
G["Will you help us heal the land?"]="你会帮助我们治愈土地吗？"
G["Will you help us in our time of great need at Arathi Basin, $c?  The chance for increased honor and standing is greater than ever, and your assistance is sure to help to turn the tide against The Defilers.  Can we count on you?"]="阿拉希盆地急需增援，你能帮助我们吗，$C？这是个获得荣誉、提升声望的大好机会。你的帮助定能扭转局势，帮助我们打败污染者。我们能将希望寄托到你身上吗？"
G["Will you help us to defeat them?"]="你愿意帮我们击败他们吗？"
G["Will you help?"]="你能帮个忙吗？"
G["Will you investigate the murder?"]="你愿意调查这起谋杀案吗？"
G["Will you pay \"Pretty Boy\" Duncan 1 gold to swab the decks for you?"]="¿Quieres pagar a \"El Guapo\" Duncan una moneda de oro por fregar las cubiertas para ti?"
G["Will you please go back inside?"]="拜托你回屋里去吧……？"
G["Will you stop asking that?"]="你能不问那个问题了吗？"
G["Will you stop--"]="你能不能先别——"
G["Will you succeed where we have failed?"]="我们都失败了，你们就能成功吗？"
G["Will you test my skills?"]="你能测试下我的技巧吗？"
G["William, I saw a fresh growth of herbs out on the ridge. Go ask Becanna to pick them up."]="威廉，山脊上长着一丛新鲜的草药。叫贝卡娜来采一下吧。"
G["Williams, we have a challenger. Show this $c what we'll do to the orcs!"]="Williams, tenemos $gun:una; aspirante. ¡Muéstrale a $geste:esta; $c lo que les vamos a hacer a los orcos!"
G["Willow, it's your turn to soar!"]="柳枝龙，该你翱翔了！"
G["Wilt thou provoke me? Then have at thee, boy!"]="你要激怒我吗？那就来吧!"
G["Win or lose, the Lieutenant must be crazy to keep a pet orc like that. Those ones can't be trusted. Animals, they are."]="但不管输或赢，他留着那么个宠物兽人肯定是疯了。那些家伙不能信任，他们只是些动物而已。"
G["Wind Lord Mel'jarak calls for reinforcements!"]="风领主梅尔加拉克调遣援兵了！"
G["Wind Lord Mel'jarak senses more than 2 of his allies are incapacitated and frees them!"]="风领主梅尔加拉克察觉到2个以上的盟友丧失了能力，并释放了他们！"
G["Wind Lord Mel'jarak senses more than 3 of his allies are incapacitated and frees them!"]="风领主梅尔加拉克察觉到3个以上的盟友丧失了能力，并释放了他们！"
G["Wind Lord Mel'jarak senses more than 4 of his allies are incapacitated and frees them!"]="风领主梅尔加拉克察觉到4个以上的盟友丧失了能力，并释放了他们！"
G["Wind Lord Mel'jarak senses that an ally is incapacitated and frees them!"]="风领主梅尔加拉克察觉到一个盟友丧失了能力，并释放了他们！"
G["Wind Rider Master"]="双足飞龙管理员"
G["Wind Serpent"]="风蛇"
G["Wind Trader Marid, I've returned with more information on the nether drakes. I'm prepared to be your business partner, and for an extra sum, I'll take care of that troublesome elf and her human friend."]="星界商人玛里德，我带来了更多有关虚空幼龙的情报。我打算跟你搭档作生意，如果你愿意多付一点的话，我还可以帮你关照那个麻烦的精灵和她的人类朋友。"
G["Wind is better bent, than broken. ...get it? I made a funny."]="斜风细雨，总好过血风肉雨……明白？我只是开个玩笑。"
G["Wind is my ally!"]="风是我的盟友！"
G["Wind, hear my call!"]="疾风，听我号令！"
G["Wind, heed my call!"]="狂风，响应我的召唤！"
G["Wind-Reaver. You have awakened. What of Klaxxi'va Tik?"]="掠风者。你醒了。卡拉克西瓦·提克呢？"
G["Windcaller Claw growls."]="唤风者克劳恩大声咆哮着。"
G["Winds of Aviana, grant me the strength to keep the flames at bay."]="艾维娜之风，赐予我压制火焰的力量吧！"
G["Winds of boundless fury, unleash your tempest upon the Alliance!"]="风之狂怒，向联盟倾泻你的雷暴吧！"
G["Winds of the arcane be at their backs, and refresh them in this hour of darkness!"]="奥术之风将支援他们，让他们在这个黑暗的时刻重焕活力！"
G["Winds of the north consume you!"]="北地的寒风会将你吞噬！"
G["Winds of the south, rise and come to your master's aid!"]="呼啸的南风，助你的主人一臂之力吧！"
G["Winds! Obey my command!"]="疾风啊！听从我的吩咐！"
G["Winds... carry me."]="风……带走我的灵魂。"
G["Windsor was particularly ornery that day - and believe me, for Windsor, that's a monumental accomplishment. He kept telling me that 'something feels off.' Well he wasn't kidding!\n\nWe were in the middle of Blackrock Mountain when the filthy animals attacked. I'm talking about the orcs, of course. Pay attention, will ya? All you could hear were grunts and the clanging of steel as they rushed us."]="温德索尔那天特别爱跟人争吵——相信我，对温德索尔来说，那是一个有纪念意义的伟大成就。他一直在跟我说“感觉有些怪异”。他不是在开玩笑！\n\n当那些肮脏的野兽出击时，我们还在黑石山脉的中央。当然，我指的是兽人。你别分神，好吗？一时之间，叫喊声和铁器的敲击声四起。"
G["Wine & Cheese"]="美酒和奶酪"
G["Wine stains, grass stains, even pet stains are no match for the Electrostatic Maculation Blaster!"]="无论是酒渍、泥渍，还是宠物留下的污渍，静电除污器都能将它们清除干净！"
G["Wings give us the freedom to soar."]="翅膀给了我们高飞的自由。"
G["Winner! We be havin' a winner here!"]="胜利者！我们这里将会有一个胜者！"
G["Winning any battle is just as much about understanding your opponent, as it is knowing how to fight."]="知己知彼，方能百战百胜，这就跟战斗的道理是一样的。"
G["Winter Veil has always been a human thing. To see the goblins and orcs take it up is rather strange."]="冬幕节一直以来都是个人类的节日。看着地精和兽人开始掺合进来，感觉相当诡异。"
G["Winter Veil just isn't the same now, but going through the motions still makes me feel something."]="现在的冬幕节已经跟以前不一样了，但是我仍然很有节日的感觉。"
G["Winter is coming..."]="凛冬将至……"
G["Winterhoof? I hear he's living it up in Booty Bay."]="冰蹄长者？我听说他在藏宝海湾。"
G["Wipe that worthless grin off your faces, recruits!  If the High Executor sees you like that he will kill you all himself!"]="把你们脸上的谷粒抹掉！要是让高级执行官看见你们这副模样，他会亲手宰了你们！"
G["Wipe the Darkspear from the face of Azeroth!"]="将暗矛部族从艾泽拉斯抹去！"
G["Wipe their existence from this world!"]="将他们从这个世界上抹去！"
G["Wiping her brow, the %s sighs."]="%s擦了擦眉毛，叹了口气。"
G["Wiping his brow, the %s sighs."]="%s擦了擦眉毛，叹了口气。"
G["Wisdom can only penetrate a heart that is truly open to it."]="智慧只会垂青真正开放的心灵。"
G["Wisdom of the ages upon you, noble $c."]="愿古老的智慧与你同在，高贵的$c。"
G["Wisdom? It was your people that caused the insufferable wrath of Cyrukh."]="智慧？是你的同族导致了森卢肯那无比的愤怒。"
G["Wise hozen say: Actions speak louder than words, unless the person is yelling."]="聪明的猢狲说了：行动比言语更加振聋发聩，除非那家伙在大喊大叫。"
G["Wise hozen say: All that glitters is not gold. Unless it is gold. Then it glitters."]="聪明的猢狲说了：发光的不都是金子。但是金子总会发光。"
G["Wise hozen say: Appearances can be deceiving, especially if you have bad eyesight."]="聪明的猢狲说了：外表充满了欺骗性，尤其是当你的眼神不好时。"
G["Wise hozen say: Don't bite off more than you can chew, unless there are other hungry hozen nearby."]="聪明的猢狲说了：有多大胃口吃多少东西，除非附近有其他饥饿的猢狲。"
G["Wise hozen say: Don't put off until tomorrow what you can do... oh nevermind, I'll tell you the rest later."]="聪明的猢狲说了：今日事今日毕……噢，算了，后半句我下次再告诉你吧。"
G["Wise hozen say: If at first you don't succeed, get someone else to do it for you."]="聪明的猢狲说了：如果你第一次失败了，就找别人来帮你做。"
G["Wise hozen say: To seek riches, look within yourself. Or in one of these chests."]="聪明的猢狲说了：财富就在你的内心深处，或者在这些箱子中。"
G["Wise words."]="说的好。"
G["Wish I could be going with ya. Blow'm up good!"]="我真想跟你一起去呢。炸翻天！"
G["Wish I could remember how many of the Infinite Dragonflight were going to try to stop you. This fight was so long ago."]="我真希望能想起来到底有多少永恒之龙想阻止你。这场战斗实在是太久远啦。"
G["Wit a reward like dis, how could they refuse, mon?"]="有这样的奖励，他们怎么可能拒绝呢？"
G["Wit de Thunder King's power de Zandalari will be reborn!"]="雷电之王的力量将使赞达拉重生。"
G["Wit' practice, ya'll find that magic can be much stronga than any weapon."]="聪明，你会发现，魔法比任何武器都要强大得多。"
G["Wit' practice, ya'll find that the dark arts can be much stronga than any weapon."]="心智的训练，你会发现黑暗艺术要比任何武器都要强大得多。"
G["Wit'out your help, ancestors, we would still be fearin' Zalazane."]="我们的祖先，如果没有你们的帮助，我们仍然会畏惧扎拉赞恩。"
G["Witch Doctor Umbu spends his time walkin' about de valley, tendin' to de people and elemental spirits alike.\n\nLook for him around de central building."]="巫医尤姆布一直在山谷四处活动，照料受伤的病人与元素之灵。\n\n去中部建筑附近找他吧。"
G["With $n here, we may be back in our homes soon!"]="有$n在，我们也许很快就能重返家园了！"
G["With $n on the job, we have nothing to worry about."]="有$n在，我们没有什么好担心的。"
G["With $p around the yaungol didn't stand a chance!"]="有$p在，野牛人根本毫无机会！"
G["With Algernon to keep me supplied, I can do all my work here without hunting for a single herb. If I never have to see the wonders of nature again, it won't be too soon."]="有奥格诺恩提供所需的供应，我可以不用寻找一株草药就能完成在这里的任务。如果我永远都不用再次看到自然的奇迹，这就不会很快发生。"
G["With Arthas gone, so too was the control he held over the undead masses of Lordaeron. After recovering my body, I freed the remaining Scourge that were left behind."]="随着阿尔萨斯一同消失的还有他对洛丹伦众多亡灵的思想控制。我恢复了身体，并让剩下的天灾亡灵也获得了自由。"
G["With Cho'gall's leadership and unity among our ranks we will crush all our enemies!"]="古加尔的英明领导加上我们的精诚团结，我们一定能将敌人粉碎！"
G["With Crushcog defeated, Thermaplugg is sure to be quaking in his mechano-tank, and rightly so. You're next Thermaplugg. You're next!"]="碎轮被打败了，瑟玛普拉格一定正在他的机械坦克里发抖，下一个完蛋的就是你，瑟玛普拉格，下一个就是你！"
G["With Crushcog defeated, Thermaplugg is sure to be quaking in his mechano-tank, and rightly so. You're next, Thermaplugg. You're next!"]="打败碎轮之后，瑟玛普拉格肯定会立刻启动他的步行坦克。你的下一个目标就是瑟玛普拉格！下一个目标就是！"
G["With Frostmourne, could I defeat the Lich King?"]="凭借霜之哀伤，我能否击败巫妖王？"
G["With Godfrey on our side, we will crush this uprising!"]="如果高弗雷站到我们这一边，我们一定能粉碎这场叛乱！"
G["With Kalecgos dead, your destiny as the Blue aspect shall be realized."]="等到卡雷苟斯死后，你作为蓝龙之王的宿命就将确立。"
G["With Kalecgos freed, can you provide a teleport up to Apex Point?"]="既然卡雷苟斯已经自由了，你能将我传送到巅峰之台吗？"
G["With M'uru gone, perhaps those haughty Blood Knights will see sense."]="穆鲁被夺走了，想必那些傲慢的血骑士会稍微清醒一点。"
G["With Malfurion Stormrage gone, the druids were left in disarray and in desperate need of a new leader."]="随着玛法里奥·怒风的离开，德鲁伊陷入混乱，迫切需要一名新的领导者。"
G["With Mauti still out there, it may be better to die from this poison."]="我还是被毒死算了，因为玛乌提还活着。"
G["With Ouro slain the way is clear to the final chamber. I am able to transport you there, if you desire."]="奥罗死后，通向最后那个密室的道路已经彻底畅通了。如果你愿意的话，我可以把你传送到那边去。"
G["With Pleasure!"]="非常愿意！"
G["With Ratchet as our new base of operations, Orgrimmar harbor will be ripe for the plucking!"]="等到棘齿城成为我们的新基地，奥格瑞玛的港口就会成为任我们摘取的甜美果实！"
G["With Shadowpour defeated, his title of Brewmaster falls to me.  Now I have to continue to undo the damage he has done to this valley."]="打败影斟之后，他的酒仙之位就传给了我。现在，我必须去挽救他对这座山谷造成的伤害了。"
G["With Stormwind's park district destroyed by Deathwing's pass over the city, we're returning to Darnassus for a time."]="死亡之翼途径暴风城，为花园区留下了满目疮痍。我们只得暂时返回达纳苏斯。"
G["With a good portion of their demons slain, the Legion will think twice about attacking our lumber camp again.  However, I still sense demonic evil stirring."]="由于损失了大批恶魔，燃烧军团若是想要再次进攻我们的伐木场，必定会再三考虑的。无论怎样，我仍然感觉到恶魔的力量在活跃着。"
G["With a horrible outcry, the %s transforms into a demonic nightmare."]="%s发出恐怖的嚎叫声，变成了可怕的恶魔。"
G["With a sword arm like that?  I'm afraid we need you in the front lines, my friend.  Report to the barracks."]="啧啧，瞧你这强壮的胳膊？朋友，前线正需要你这样的勇士。去兵营报到吧。"
G["With all due respect, A'dal sent us here to investigate Kael's activities, not mount a full-scaled attack."]="恕我直言，阿达尔派我来这里是为了调查凯尔萨斯的行动，而不是发动一次全力进攻。"
G["With all due respect, Lord, we have not grown lax. We are stretched thin. We are beset on all fronts, my men are worked to the bone, and I have not a single warrior to spare."]="恕我冒犯，祝掌门，我们没有丝毫松懈。我们兵力不足、四面受敌，我的人都已经精疲力竭，再也抽不出一点人手了。"
G["With all due respect, Warchief - why not allow them to be destroyed? Does this not strengthen our position?"]="恕我直言，统帅大人--为什么不消灭他们？难道这不会巩固我们的地位吗？"
G["With all due respect, Warchief.  Our enemies would take advantage of your sudden absence if we don't prepare properly."]="请恕我直言，酋长。如果我们不准备妥当的话，我们的敌人会因为你的意外缺席而获得优势。"
G["With all due respect, milady, you have not fought the Scourge as I have. The Lady appointed me to assist you in defeating Dar'khan because of that, and you would do well to consider what I have to say."]="女士，请恕我直言，对抗亡灵天灾，你没有我在行。因此，女王派我来协助你打败达尔坎，请照我说的做吧。"
G["With all due respect, sir, stick it!"]="恕我直言，长官，忍耐！"
G["With all due respect, your Highness, we can do this alone."]="尊敬的殿下，我们能够完成这个任务。"
G["With all of the adventuring you do, what you need is a good rest, young $g man : lady;."]="Después de todas esas aventuras, lo que necesitas es un buen descanso."
G["With all of the fighting we do of course we have a First Aid Trainer in Razor Hill.  Find Rawrk inside the barracks on the east side of town."]="因为我们经常战斗，我们当然有一个急救训练师在剃刀岭。在城镇东面的兵营里可以找到拉乌克。"
G["With all respect - these abominable tools should be destroyed!"]="恕我直言——这些畸形的武器应该被销毁！"
G["With all respect, Warchief, what's done is done. We must now focus our efforts on how to proceed..."]="恕我直言，酋长，过去的已经过去了。我们现在必须集中全力做好下一步打算……"
G["With all the Siege Engines nearly complete, I'm getting a bit bored!\nYou're not an engineer, are you? Care to compare blueprints...?"]="Con eso de que las máquinas de asedio están casi terminadas, estoy empezando a aburrirme.\n\nNo te dedicarás a la ingeniería, ¿verdad? ¿Te apetece que comparemos planos...?"
G["With all the screws that Bronk has been tightening, I think he's let a few of his own go if ye get me.  All the same he's still got a good head for engineering the darndest devices.  Ye should go pay him a visit over at Steelgrill's Depot."]="布隆克总是在敲敲打打，他擅长修理最为精密的机械。你应该到钢架补给站拜访他一趟。"
G["With all these clans here I bet a fight's going to break out."]="所有氏族都聚集在这里。我敢打赌，一场厮杀在所难免。"
G["With all these new parts, I can finally turn this hunk o' junk into a flying machine!"]="有了这些新零件，我总算可以将这堆东西组装成飞行器了！"
G["With an ample supply of gyromechanic gears, and a team of engineers, your tanks can make a full recovery, but it's going to be a long journey."]="只要有足够的配件和一支工程师队伍，你的坦克就能得到彻底修复。但这还需要很长一段时间。"
G["With da chieftains out of da way, we be poised to make our assault! Soon, $n...."]="除掉那些酋长之后，我们就准备发动攻击了！用不了多久的，$n……"
G["With da help of these mortals, dis region been cleansed of all who oppose us."]="在这些凡人的帮助下，所有胆敢反抗我们的家伙都已经被清除了。"
G["With each enemy slain, our strength grows! We mustn't relent!"]="天灾军团的战士一定会击败敌人！"
G["With each generation, we grow ever stronger."]="代代繁衍，我们变得越发强大。"
G["With each passing moment, I see the people of Azeroth prove again the reasons we have come.  It is with solemn pride that I fight with you, and if I die this day, then I die among friends."]="每一分，每一秒，我都看到艾泽拉斯的人民证明了我们来此的理由。我很骄傲能与你们并肩而战，如果我会在今天死去，那我也要与我的朋友一起战死！"
G["With emerald green eyes and big man-crushing thighs"]="有着翡翠般的眼睛和能夹死男人的大腿"
G["With enough money, I could take over the world..."]="只要有足够的钱，我就能征服全世界……"
G["With enough tokens you can join the \"Brew of the Month\" club.  Being in the Brew of the Month club is like having Brewfest all year round!\n\nEvery month you will receive mail with a new brew to try out.  If you like that brew, you can go to the Darkbriar Lodge in Orgrimmar's Valley of Spirits and buy more from the vendors there."]="Con suficientes fichas puedes unirte al \"Club de la Cerveza del Mes\". ¡Formar parte del Club de la Cerveza del Mes es como celebrar la Fiesta de la Cerveza durante todo el año!\n\nCada mes recibirás un correo con una nueva cerveza para degustar. Si te gusta esa cerveza, puedes ir a la Cabaña de Brezo de Valle de los Espíritus de Orgrimmar y comprar más a los vendedores de allí."
G["With enough tokens you can join the \"Brew of the Month\" club.  Being in the Brew of the Month club is like having Brewfest all year round!\n\nEvery month you will receive mail with a new brew to try out.  If you like that brew, you can go to the Stonefire Tavern in Ironforge and buy more from the vendors there."]="Con suficientes fichas puedes unirte al \"Club de la Cerveza del Mes\". ¡Formar parte del Club de la Cerveza del Mes es como celebrar la Fiesta de la Cerveza durante todo el año!\n\nCada mes recibirás un correo con una nueva cerveza para degustar. Si te gusta esa cerveza, puedes ir a la taberna Roca de Fuego de Forjaz y comprar más a los vendedores de allí."
G["With heroes like $n fighting on our behalf, Stormwind stands ready to face any Twilight's Hammer threat!"]="有了像$n这样的英雄，暴风城已经准备好迎击暮光之锤的任何威胁！"
G["With his gift, I shall raze this land and reform it!"]="有了他所赐予的力量，我会夷平这片土地，并重新铸造它！"
G["With his razor sharp claws, Avrus digs into his chest and removes his beating heart, placing it with the fallen moonstones."]="阿夫鲁斯用他剃刀一样锋利的爪子伸进胸口，掏出自己的内核，将它和那些落下的月亮石放在一起。"
G["With it, you will be able to enter Karazhan without fear of harm or detection. Not even Harrison Jones will know how you uncover the tower's history."]="有了它，你就可以躲过探测，毫发无伤地进入卡拉赞。连哈里森·琼斯都猜不到你是如何发掘出这座塔的历史的。"
G["With just a little creative editing, these are much more useful..."]="只要加入一点创造性的改变，它们会变得更有用……"
G["With luck, we'll gain some good scars today."]="如果运气好的话，我们今天会得到几处不错的伤痕的。"
G["With my freedom comes the vengeance of storm!"]="我自由了，暴风的复仇将随之而来！"
G["With my help, $n travelled back in time to your battle, and ensured that history was set right. The North Wind's fate was sealed, and your story restored."]="在我的帮助下，$n及时返回了那场战斗的时间流，维护了历史的真相。北风的命运已经被封印起来，你的故事也得以恢复正常。"
G["With my last breath, I will transfer my life essence into the statue, and a new guardian will be born."]="我会将我所有的生命精华灌输到雕像中去。新的守护者由此诞生。"
G["With my winning strategy, I cannot lose."]="以我的必胜战略，我不可能失败。"
G["With new enemies on our doorsteps, we must not allow our ancient enemies to take advantage of our situation!"]="新的敌人就在我们的家门口，我们绝对不允许我们的宿敌趁火打劫！"
G["With no fish to eat, the crocolisks became hungry and desperate. They attacked the pandaren out of sheer hunger."]="因为没鱼可吃，鳄鱼变得饥饿和绝望。他们攻击熊猫人纯粹是因为饥饿难耐。"
G["With nobody to watch over our prisoner, I had to make sure he was... incapable of escaping."]="在没人看管囚犯的情况下，我必须确保他……没有逃跑的能力。"
G["With peaceful hearts, we feel no anger, no hatred, no doubt, and no fear."]="内心平静下来，我们就不会发怒、憎恨、怀疑和恐惧。"
G["With plans drawn up, I had my top men and women begin work on a machine to do that exact task!  We had calculated down to the second how best to dist-"]="制定出了完美的计划之后，我派出了手下最精锐的人员来研制能够完成任务的机器！我们的计算已经精确到秒……"
G["With pleasure. Return to me when you two are finished."]="我很乐意。任务完成之后赶紧回来。"
G["With pleasure. These things stink!"]="乐意效劳。这些东西真臭！"
G["With pleasure..."]="很荣幸……"
G["With pleasure... just let me savor this moment for a minute longer."]="很愿意……只是让我再多回味一下这一刻。"
G["With some help, I believe Taerix may be close to a breakthrough."]="有了援助，我相信塔蕾克丝就快要有所突破了。"
G["With some of the technology that was recovered by bold gnomes venturing into Gnomeregan, I have managed to construct my greatest invention:  The Matter Transporter!    All I need now is a skilled Gnomish Engineer to build a powerful beacon attuned to the transporter."]="Gracias a la tecnología que consiguieron recuperar los astutos gnomos que se adentraron en Gnomeregan, he conseguido construir mi mayor invento: ¡El transportador de materia! Ahora, todo lo que necesito es un hábil ingeniero gnomo para construir un potente localizador que se adapte al transportador."
G["With that new super-charged elementium blasting powder? You don't want to know..."]="那种超能量源质炸药？你不会想知道的……"
G["With the Allerian Stronghold surrounded by enemies on all sides it's time for us to take the fight to them."]="奥蕾莉亚要塞被敌人重重包围，我们应该与他们一起战斗。"
G["With the Celestials' aid, we tore through the mogu advance. Our soldiers were able to clean up the rest, and drive them from the valley."]="在天神的帮助下，我们粉碎了魔古族的进攻。我们的士兵们得以清理残余，将他们赶出山谷。"
G["With the Divine Bell, I will burn away any remnants of weakness within us. Fear... despair... hatred... doubt. The lesser races are buried beneath their weight. But WE will control their power."]="有了圣钟，就能根除我们内心的软弱：恐惧……绝望……仇恨……怀疑。低等种族才会被它们压垮。而我们，要掌控它们的力量。"
G["With the Earth Mother's blessing, we shall begin."]="带着大地母亲的祝福，我们要开始了。"
G["With the Emperors slain, the magical protection blocking teleportation within the temple has been greatly weakened. If you desire, I am able to translocate you to the Emperors' lair."]="双子皇帝被杀之后，神庙中能够阻止传送法阵的魔法护罩已经远远被削弱了。如果你愿意，我可以将你直接传送到双子皇帝住所那里去。"
G["With the Lich King fleeing in fear of Fordring armed with the Ashbringer, we were able to easily wrest Ebon Hold from the remaining Scourge forces.\n\nThat didn't settle things between us and the Scarlet Crusade, however.\n\nAs the Forsaken have learned the hard way, the Scarlets cannot seem to differentiate between us and the Scourge.\n\nWe think on our own, we have our own motivations, we have almost all of the qualities of the living, and yet to them, we are no different than the mindless slaves of the Lich King.\n\nMistakenly they think we will roll over and play dead."]="弗丁举起了灰烬使者，巫妖王见势不妙，便迅速逃走了。于是，我们轻而易举地从残余的天灾兵手中夺取了黑锋要塞的控制权。\n\n但是我们与血色十字军的隔阂并没有消除。\n\n就像被遗忘者当初的境遇一样，血色十字军总是将我们与天灾军团混为一谈。\n\n我们拥有独立的思想和目标，我们拥有生者的一切特质。但是对他们来说，我们和巫妖王麾下那些没脑子的奴隶没什么两样。\n\n他们居然误认为我们会再次臣服于巫妖王的淫威。"
G["With the Lich King on the offensive, the Horde must respond in kind!  To Northrend!"]="巫妖王展开了攻势，部落必须做出有力的回应！远征诺森德！"
G["With the Light's blessing and your help, $n, the Defias are no longer a threat.\n\nBut we're a long way from Westfall up here, and if we don't win this battle, there may not be a home to return to."]="Con la bendición de la Luz y tu ayuda, $n, los Defias dejaron de ser una amenaza.\n\nPero ahora estamos muy lejos de los Páramos de Poniente y si no ganamos esta batalla, puede que no tengamos un hogar al que volver."
G["With the Riders behind me, and my serpent beside me."]="因我有同袍在后，我有翔龙在侧。"
G["With the Sha of Doubt defeated you are ready to read the scroll."]="Tras haber derrotado al Sha de la duda, estás $glisto:lista; para leer el pergamino."
G["With the Warsong Offensive here in Icecrown Citadel, victory is within our grasp! The death of the Lich King will bring glory to the Horde!"]="战歌远征军已经到达冰冠堡垒。胜利就在眼前！巫妖王的惨败将成为部落新的荣耀！"
G["With the aid of the val'kyr, we are now able to take the corpses of the fallen and create new Forsaken."]="但是，现在有了瓦格里的帮助，我们能够将新的生命赋予那些倒下的人类。"
G["With the approaching darkness comes the end of the Scarlet Crusade. You will battle once more! For the Scourge! For the Lich King!"]="血色十字军的末日即将来临。我的骑士们，用你们手中的长剑，让他们瞧瞧究竟什么是真正的血色！"
G["With the attention of the Lich King drawn towards the front gate, we will be working our way through the side in search of information that will enable us to defeat the Scourge once and for all."]="当巫妖王的注意力被吸引到前门的时候，我们就从侧翼潜入，寻找有用的重要情报，从而一劳永逸地铲除天灾军团。"
G["With the attention of the Lich King turned towards the front gate, we'll be working our way through the side in search of information that will enable us to defeat him - once and for all."]="当巫妖王的注意力被吸引到前门的时候，我们就从侧翼潜入，寻找能帮助我们的重要情报，彻底除掉巫妖王。"
G["With the benefit of my improved cognitive capacity, I am able to turn fresh eyes upon the rest of my race. A majority of our energies were spent in the hunt of fresh prey. Why, I wonder, did we not invest that time developing a store of domesticated creatures from which to draw our food supply?\n\nI am naturally inclined to think that humans would make excellent foodstock. They breed quickly, fatten up nicely, and can be trained to do menial chores for the herd until harvest time. Hmmm."]="Gracias al beneficio de mi capacidad cognitiva aumentada, puedo mirar con nuevos ojos al resto de mi raza. La mayor parte de nuestras energías se invertían en cazar presas nuevas. ¿Por qué, me pregunto, no hemos invertido ese tiempo en desarrollar un sistema para acumular animales domesticados a partir de los cual podríamos alimentarnos?"
G["With the bulk of Undercity's forces deployed to Vengeance Landing in Northrend, the Warchief has sent us to reinforce the city's defenses."]="由于幽暗城的大部分兵力都已部署在了诺森德的复仇港，酋长派我们来支援幽暗城的防守。"
G["With the bulk of our forces focused on Illidan, the task of cleansing these lands falls to you."]="由于我们大部分的力量都聚集在伊利丹身上，清理这片土地的任务就交给你了。"
G["With the cauldrons breeched, we are now able to introduce the counter agent into the environment.  This should give the scourge a taste of their own medicine, as it were!\n\nCheck with Alchemist Arbington on information regarding the reagents needed to use in the cauldrons.  I will be handling all information reports on how we are doing overall in turning the plague against the Scourge!"]="因为大熔炉被打开了缺口，我们现在能够把反作用剂释放到外界。这应该能让亡灵天灾尝尝他们自己药物的滋味，可以这么说！\n\n向炼金师阿尔比顿询问一下有关在大熔炉中所需要使用的试剂这方面的信息。我会处理所有的信息报告，以便于我们决定怎样把瘟疫用来对付亡灵天灾！"
G["With the cauldrons breeched, we are now able to introduce the counter agent into the environment.  This should give the scourge a taste of their own medicine, as it were!\n\nCheck with Apothecary Dithers on information regarding the reagents needed to use in the cauldrons.  I will be handling all information reports on how we are doing overall in turning the plague against the Scourge!"]="因为大熔炉被打开了缺口，我们现在能够把反作用剂释放到外界。这应该能让亡灵天灾尝尝他们自己药物的滋味，可以这么说！\n\n向炼金师迪瑟斯询问一下有关在大熔炉中所需要使用的试剂这方面的信息。我会处理所有的信息报告，以便于我们决定怎样把瘟疫用来对付亡灵天灾！"
G["With the death of the Lich King, all I have left is my duty.  There is no family, there are no friends... there is only this.\n\nWar."]="巫妖王既死，我所拥有的就只剩下责任。没有家人，没有朋友……只有这个。\n\n战争。"
G["With the death of the Lich King, many of the more intelligent Scourge became... unemployed. Those 'fiends,' as you so delicately put it, are called val'kyr. They are under my command now..."]="Tras la muerte del Rey Exánime, muchos de los miembros más inteligentes de la Plaga se quedaron... sin trabajo. Estos \"monstruos\", como los has llamado con tanta delicadeza, son las Val'kyr. Ahora están bajo mi control..."
G["With the destruction of Stormwind's park - and most of the night elves within, the poor, unlucky souls - your best bet would be to seek out old Celestine just outside the Dwarven District.\n\nThere are stairs leading down from the Northern Landing... you can see her cottage from there."]="暴风城花园,连带着住在花园里的大部分暗夜精灵都一起被摧毁了。那些可怜又不幸的灵魂啊！所以你最好还是到矮人区外边去找老塞莱斯廷吧。\n\n在城北降落点有通往下方的阶梯……你在那儿就能看见她的小屋。"
G["With the garments that Me'Lynn tailors, one might think that her needle was blessed by Elune herself.  Unless your needle is so blessed, you best pay her a visit and listen to her teachings.  You can find her in The Craftsmen's Terrace in northeastern Darnassus."]="穿着迈里恩缝制的衣服，人们可能会以为她的绣花针是被月神赐福过的。除非你的针也受过同样的祝福，否则你最好去拜访她一次并聆听她的教导。你可以在达纳苏斯东北方的工匠区找到她。"
G["With the help of Engineer Lapforge from Gadgetzan i have built a powerful gnomish transporter here at Toshley's Station!  I would be happy to help any gnomish engineer with enough skill to build their own personal transport beacon."]="由于得到了加基森工程师霍尔迪·水炉的帮助，我在这里托什雷的基地建造了一台威力强大的侏儒传送器！我很乐意帮助任何有技术实力的侏儒工程师来制造他们自己的传送航标。"
G["With the help of its allies the %s regenerates back to life."]="在盟友的帮助下，%s重获新生。"
G["With the help of my brother Zap in Everlook I have constructed a Dimensional Imploder right here in Area 52.   Who needs a rocket when you have instant transportation via Goblin Engineering!   Are you a skilled enough Goblin Engineer to learn how to build your own Imploder beacon?"]="Con la ayuda de mi hermano Zap de Vista Eterna he construido un implosionador dimensional aquí, en el Área 52. ¡Quién necesita un cohete, cuando tiene transporte instantáneo a través de ingeniería goblin! ¿Eres $gun ingeniero:una ingeniera; goblin lo suficientemente $gcualificado:cualificada; como para aprender a construir tu propio localizador de implosionador?"
G["With the help of our new taunka allies, the Northrend will belong to the Horde."]="在我们的新盟友牦牛人的帮助下，部落一定会取得诺森德的统治权。"
G["With the help of the Burning Blade, demons shall rule all of Azeroth!"]="有了火刃的帮助，恶魔将统治整个艾泽拉斯！"
G["With the help of the Shado-Pan and this beast you recovered, I believe we can infiltrate and disable the Thunder King's armory."]="在影踪派和这头野兽的帮助下，我想我们能够潜入并摧毁雷电之王的武器库。"
G["With the intelligence you've provided on the enemy and their tactics we've gained a significant edge in the field."]="正是你在研究敌人和他们战术时的睿智，让我们在战场上取得了巨大的优势。"
G["With the loss of my power, the Dragon Soul has returned to its original place in time."]="由于我失去了力量，巨龙之魂已经回到了原本的时空。"
G["With the orb returned, the search for answers begins!"]="既然已经找回了水晶球，那么我们就着手寻求真相吧！"
G["With the pillar restored, dis realm is safe.  We must now attend to the wound on the surface."]="世界之柱复原了，这个世界安全了。该去治疗地表上的伤痕了。"
G["With the pool pony, I can make it back."]="有了小马泳圈，我就能回去了。"
G["With the power of the horn, I bind you to its wielder's will!"]="我命令你服从号角持有者的意志！"
G["With the power of the wild gods burning in our veins, none, not even the Lich King, can stand in our way!"]="狂野诸神的力量在我们的血脉中燃烧，即便是巫妖王，也无法阻挡我们前进的道路！"
G["With the power within the amulets of Razelikh..."]="以拉瑟莱克护符内的强大力量……"
G["With the precise angle and velocity..."]="精确的角度和速度……"
G["With the price they're getting on this operation, I'm hoping for a nice hefty profit sharing check. They better not shortchange us again."]="他们已经接受了这次行动的酬金价格。我希望能够在这次行动中得到一笔丰厚的利润。他们最好不要再骗我们了。"
G["With the proper technology, you can fix anything, $n. Of course there are always malfunctions, short circuits, and uncooperative patients to keep things interesting."]="有了适合的技术，你能修好任何东西，$n。当然，我总会会遇到各种故障、短路和不配合的病人。它们为我带来了不少乐趣。"
G["With the right training, the jinyu will make a strong addition to our land force."]="经过正规的训练，锦鱼人将成为我们地面部队不可或缺的一支强大战力。"
G["With the sanction of Lady Sylvanas, the Deathstalkers' numbers grow. More blades to strike at our enemies when they least expect it."]="经希尔瓦娜斯女王批准，亡灵哨兵的数量增加了。在敌人料想不到的时候派出更多的人手实施打击。"
G["With the sudden arrival of strangers on Pandaria, I believe we'll need the lessons our history can teach us."]="随着陌生人突然出现在潘达利亚，我相信历史给我们的教训将会发挥作用。"
G["With the summoning complete and the armies of Azshara gathering for war, Neptulon the Tidehunter will soon fall."]="召唤已经完成，艾萨拉的军队正在集结，猎潮者耐普图隆很快就会被击溃。"
G["With the villagers help we will surely track down the Zandalari."]="在村民的帮助下，我们一定能找到那些赞达拉巨魔。"
G["With their newfound patronage and apparent role in the king's disappearance, I see no choice but to plan a renewed offensive against the Defias."]="迪菲亚兄弟会寻得了新的庇护，他们在暴风城国王失踪事件中显然扮演了不光彩的角色，我们必须重新制定进攻迪菲亚兄弟会的计划。"
G["With this crystal's powers, my Deathsworn and I... we'd be unstoppable!  We could destroy Illidan!  We could... replace him as lords of Outland!"]="有了这块水晶的力量，我的死誓者和我……将会不可抵挡！我们甚至可以消灭伊利丹！我们可以……替代他成为新的外域之王！"
G["With this much void waste and run-off, a toxic void horror can't be too far behind."]="这么多的虚空垃圾和漂浮物，不远的地方一定有什么可怕的东西。"
G["With this seed, we set root. With time and attention, we should be able to grow shelter from this charred, hostile realm."]="埋下种子，希望扎根。悉心守护，生机萌发。我们将在这个灼热世界里建立一个庇护所。"
G["With this shield and sword, I will protect my friends and family."]="有了这把剑和这面盾，我会守护好我的朋友及家人。"
G["With this staff, the circle is entrusting an item of great power to you, $n. Use it to uphold the tenets of our order."]="议会将这支法杖给你，就是将一件拥有强大力量的宝物放在你手中，$n。你要用它来守卫我们所信奉的原则。"
G["With this totem, the spirits will bless your participation in the blockade."]="有了这个图腾，灵魂将庇佑你参与封锁行动。"
G["With time, we may be able to restore this land."]="只要有足够的时间，我们就能恢复这片土地。"
G["With turmoil as tinder, let it blaze; may it temper us against what tomorrow may bring."]="让它随燃烧的火苗灰飞烟灭，使我们能沉着应对未来的一切。"
G["With weapons of power and a magnificent regalia our hero unleashed their fury on the beasts. It was glorious!"]="Gracias a sus poderosas armas y su magnífico atavío, $gnuestro héroe:nuestra heroína; desató su cólera sobre las bestias. ¡Fue glorioso!"
G["With you and I working together, this battle will be over in no time."]="只要我们通力合作，这场战争很快就能分出胜负。"
G["With you and your people as allies, we have decided to stay on this island and rebuild. Elune bless you, hero.\n\nWhile the sadness still comes and goes, I think we will survive."]="Contigo y con tu gente como aliados, hemos decidido quedarnos en esta isla y reconstruir. Que Elune te bendiga, héroe.\n\nAunque la tristeza va y viene, creo que sobreviviremos."
G["With you here, we're saved, $n."]="Contigo aquí, estamos salvados $n."
G["With your help, I can evaluate these tunnels."]="有了你的帮助，我就可以测量这些通道了。"
G["With your help, we can repel them!"]="有了你的帮助，我们就能击退他们！"
G["With your help, we might be able to win this thing!"]="有了你的帮助，我们也许能获胜！"
G["With your steadfast determination, we cannot fail!"]="有了你的坚定与果断，我们一定能取得胜利！"
G["With your strength and determination, we cannot fail!"]="有了你的力量和决心，我们一定能获胜！"
G["With your strength, murlocs, our plan will succeed. Our kobold friends will mine us plenty of ore..."]="有了你们强大力量的支持，鱼人们，我们的计划必将取得成功。我们的狗头人朋友们会给我们挖出许多许多的矿石……"
G["With your wing of drake riders and the support of the Horde, we can make an assault on the Bastion of Twilight."]="在龙骑士与部落的支持下，我们可以对暮光堡垒发起攻击。"
G["Withdraw your troops, brother, and I promise you a swift second death!"]="把你的军队撤退，修士，我答应让你速死！"
G["Wither away!"]="枯萎凋亡！"
G["Wither in Elune's grace!"]="在艾露恩的神恩中枯萎吧！"
G["Withered Batwing!"]="干瘪的蝙蝠翼！"
G["Withers absorbs the water, growing back to full size."]="枯萎的树人将水吸入体内，恢复成原先的大小。"
G["Within a year of training under Illidan's best three demon hunters, Varedis had surpassed them.\n\nNo longer content with the training they had to offer, Varedis infiltrated the Shadow Council where he learned of a powerful relic known as the Book of Fel Names.  He secretly read from this book, committing each passage to memory."]="在伊利丹手下最好的三名恶魔猎手的训练之下，一年后，瓦雷迪斯已然青出于蓝。\n\n他不再满足于恶魔猎手所提供的训练内容，于是瓦雷迪斯混入了暗影议会，在那里，他得知有一本叫做恶魔名册的圣物，书中蕴含着强大的力量。他偷偷地通读了这本书，把每一页都暗暗记在了心里。"
G["Within every brush stroke are a thousand meanings."]="每一笔、每一画，都包含着千层含义。"
G["Within lies the Shrine of Lost Souls. The souls of thousands of my fallen brethren remain within this area."]="里面就是失落灵魂神殿。无数死去兄弟们的灵魂还在这里徘徊。"
G["Within these ruins rest many ancient mogu secrets.  This entire vale was theirs once, and some corners of it have yet to be tread by pandaren feet."]="在这些废墟中藏有许多古魔古族的秘密。这里曾经整个都属于他们，甚至某些角落中还可以发现被熊猫人践踏过的脚印。"
G["Within these walls, you will be tested. Your skill in combat will be matched against the fiercest dangers Northrend has to offer under the watchful eyes of your leaders."]="你将在这里接受测试。你必须以自身的战斗实力来对抗诺森德最凶暴危险的力量。而你的领袖们将亲眼见证你的战斗。"
G["Within this circle of fire I must cast the spell to banish the spirits of the slain Fanglords."]="我必须在这个火焰法阵中使用法术来驱逐那些德鲁伊的灵魂。"
G["Without Taunka'le, life is no longer worth living."]="失去了牦牛村，生命也不再有意义了。"
G["Without a purpose, they wander... But many find their way back to the sacred areas that they once were sworn to protect."]="它们毫无目的地游荡……但是很多枭兽又回到了它们曾经发誓要保护的神圣之地。"
G["Without a state... without a cause... what drives them, do you wonder?"]="没有动机……没有理由……你觉得他们到底怎么了？"
G["Without aid, they will fail."]="没有援助，他们必败。"
G["Without delay!"]="马上！"
G["Without delivery of the Underlight ore in such a timely fashion, our research would have failed.\n\nJust wait until Shatharia shows her head here again. I've got some interesting tasks for her, you can be sure of it!"]="Sin la entrega de la mena de Sondaluz de una forma tan oportuna, nuestra investigación habría fracasado.\n\nEspera a que Shatharia vuelva a asomar la cabeza por aquí. ¡Tengo unas cuantas tareas interesantes para ella, puedes estar $gseguro:segura;!"
G["Without hesitation, the ethereal worg sets off into the valley."]="灵体座狼毫不犹豫地冲进了山谷。"
G["Without hope, there is no brightness in the future!"]="没有希望，未来就没有光明！"
G["Without knowledge of the incantations required to unite the two parts, Lord Vyletongue was unable to use the scepter. However, now that I am free of the curse of Vyletongue's corruption, I will be able to assist you, if you'd like to bring me the two parts -- both the head and the rod of the scepter."]="没有结合节杖两部分所需的咒语，诺克赛恩是无法使用节杖的。但是，我已经从诺克赛恩的诅咒中解放啦，如果你能将节杖的两部分交给我——节杖的头部和棍身，我会帮助你的。"
G["Without pressure in both realms, %s begins to regenerate."]="没有了来自两个领域的压力，%s开始重生了。"
G["Without proper upkeep, buildings within the plaguelands tend to... waste away."]="要是照看不当的话，瘟疫之地的建筑就会……没入时间的洪流中。"
G["Without reinforcements, our positions there will be overrun in days."]="如果没有援军，我们过不了几天就将被击溃。"
G["Without the protection of the Celestials you are forcibly ejected from Ordos' temple!"]="没有至尊天神的庇护，你被驱逐出了斡耳朵圣殿！"
G["Without these throwing axes, their axe throwers will certainly be less effective."]="没有了这些飞斧，他们的掷斧者就起不了什么作用了。"
G["Without warning, Prince Sandoval magically appears within Valhalas!"]="萨杜瓦尔王子在毫无征兆的情况下，如幻影般出现在瓦哈拉斯！"
G["Without you we'd be lost. Thanks for the ride!"]="要不是你，我们就死定了。谢谢你带我们回来！"
G["Without your help, I surely would have died...."]="要不是你，我肯定没命了……"
G["Without your help, I would've been doomed to a life of undeath among the Lich King's gruesome creations."]="要不是你，我早就沦为巫妖王的奴仆，成为天灾军团中的一员了。"
G["Witness da Drakkari's might."]="见证达卡莱的力量！"
G["Witness de power of de spiritbinder!"]="见证缚灵者的力量吧！"
G["Witness de power of me voodoo... you ain't leavin' dis island ALIVE!"]="看看我的魔法力量吧……别想活着离开这座岛屿！"
G["Witness my POWER!"]="见证我的力量！"
G["Witness the fury of the cosmos!"]="见证宇宙的怒火吧！"
G["Witness the majesty of flame!"]="目睹烈焰君王！"
G["Witness the might of the true Horde!"]="看看正统部落的力量吧！"
G["Witness the power bestowed upon me by Deathwing! Feel the fury of earth!"]="见证死亡之翼赋予我的强大力量吧！感受大地之怒！"
G["Witness the power of the True Horde's arsenal!"]="看看正统部落的军事实力吧！"
G["Witness the sheen of immeasurable power!"]="见证无尽力量的光辉吧！"
G["Witness the true meaning of pain!"]="见证痛苦的真谛吧！"
G["Wizzle, you idiot! Everything would have been fine if you'd just kept your mouth shut!"]="维兹，你这白痴！要是你能管住你的嘴，一切就都不会出问题！"
G["Woah!"]="哇哦！"
G["Woah! Woah! Take it easy! You win!"]="哇哦！哇哦！放轻松！你赢了！"
G["Woah, look at that! It's huge!"]="哇哦，瞧瞧那个！真大啊！"
G["Woah, point that somewhere else!"]="哎哟，别拿那东西指着我！"
G["Woah... My hooves are huuuuge..."]="天啊……我的蹄子好大……"
G["Woah... get away from me, crazy... spider-thing!"]="哇……别过来，疯子……蜘蛛！"
G["Woe to da pandaren usurpers! The mogu will rule dis land again, and we Zandalari will have a new homeland..."]="向熊猫人篡位者致哀吧！魔古族将再度崛起，赞达拉也将得到新的家园……"
G["Woe to each and every one of you, my pretties!"]="我为你们感到可悲，小家伙们！"
G["Woe unto those that dare oppose the Scourge!"]="胆敢与天灾军团抗衡的家伙，必将落得悲惨的下场！"
G["Wolf"]="狼"
G["Wolf riders, to Frost Dagger Pass!"]="狼骑兵们，去霜刀小径！"
G["Wolf spirit of the forest, hear me!"]="森林的狼魂，听从我的命令吧！"
G["Wolves are pack animals."]="狼是群居动物。"
G["Wolves head this way, as if fleeing from...something."]="狼群都在朝这边跑，好像是为了躲避……躲避什么东西……"
G["Wolves in captivity? We should \"rescue\" these poor animals."]="¿Lobos en cautividad? Deberíamos \"rescatar\" a esos pobres animales."
G["Women!"]="女人！"
G["Women..."]="女人啊……"
G["Won a few fights, I see! Keep it up."]="赢了几场，没错，我看着呢！再接再厉。"
G["Won't be long now until the Brewfest starts!  Come back later and check to see if we're done."]="美酒节马上就要开始啦！到时候千万要记得过来看看哦。"
G["Won't be long now until the Darkmoon Faire opens.  Come back later and check to see if we're done."]="暗月马戏团不久就会开张啦。别忘了待会回来，看看我们是否已准备停当。"
G["Won't somebody help us?"]="没人能来帮帮我们吗？"
G["Won't you try a taste of poison, Wakener? Not even just a drop?"]="你不想尝尝毒药吗，唤醒者？一滴也不要？"
G["Wonderful!"]="太棒了！"
G["Wonderful!  Once you take to the skies, the Zandalari may come after you."]="太棒了！一旦你飞上天空，赞达拉就会追上来的。"
G["Wonderful! Just look at it. A hundred years to produce this incredible monument for the Jade Serpent. And now, you too have contributed to this masterpiece."]="太好了！瞧瞧它，花了整整一百年的时间才建起如此宏伟的青龙雕像。现在，你也为这个杰作贡献了一份力量。"
G["Wonderful! You made it!"]="太棒了，你成功了！"
G["Woo Ping is the master of polearms. He trains his students at Weller's Arsenal in Stormwind."]="吴平是长柄武器的大师。他一般在暴风城的维勒武器店训练学生。"
G["Woo Ping's stamina is simply astounding.  Watching him practice his weapon techniques for hours on end, I felt sorry for the practice dummy afterward.  I can't think of anyone better suited to train you in armed combat."]="吴平的精力真令人惊奇。我看着他连续练习了数小时技巧。他用双手击打练习用的假人，直到他的拳头沾满鲜血。我想不到还有谁比他更适合训练你的战斗技能。"
G["Woo hoo!"]="喔嚯！"
G["Woo hoo!  Martek picked me!"]="好啊！马特克选择了我！"
G["Woo hoo!  More rays for training!"]="哇！更多需要训练的虚空鳐！"
G["Woo hoo! Finally getting out of here. It's going to be rough though. Keep your eyes peeled for trouble."]="喔，喔！终于出来了。不过接下来还有危险，所以要保持警惕。"
G["Woo hoo! Go Skyguard!"]="哦嚯！前进，天空卫队！"
G["Woo hoo, fireworks! More, more!"]="喔，喔，焰火！再放一次，再放一次！"
G["Woo hoo, here we go! Everyone's collected everything, and it's all being airlifted via zeppelin to Silithus as we speak. The last of it should be there in less than $2113w days. Once it's all over there, and the scepter has been assembled, the war against those dirty insects can begin. As they say, 'Ship It!'"]="¡Guau, allá vamos! Todo el mundo ha recogido todo y ya va en zepelín de camino a Silithus mientras hablamos. El último envío debería llegar en menos de $2113w días. Cuando todo esté allí y los fragmentos del cetro se hayan reunido, podrá dar comienzo la guerra contra esos sucios insectos. Como ellos dicen, \"¡Despáchalo!\""
G["Woo hoo, here we go! Everyone's collected everything, and it's all being airlifted via zeppelin to Silithus as we speak. The last of it should be there in less than a day. Once it's all over there, and the scepter has been assembled, the war against those dirty insects can begin. As they say, 'Ship It!'"]="¡Guau, allá vamos! Todo el mundo ha recogido todo y ya va en zepelín de camino a Silithus mientras hablamos. El último envío debería llegar en menos de un día. Cuando todo esté allí y los fragmentos del cetro se hayan reunido, podrá dar comienzo la guerra contra esos sucios insectos. Como ellos dicen, \"¡Despáchalo!\""
G["Woo hoo."]="喔，嚯。"
G["Woo hoooooo!"]="呕吼！"
G["Woo!"]="喔！"
G["Woo! Feel the burn!"]="喔！瞧这烧的！"
G["Woo! You ook 'em good!"]="哇！你真是狠狠教训了他们一顿啊！"
G["Wooah... Not so fast next time!"]="哇……下次别那么快！"
G["Wood, snake oil, food and water will speed our progress, $p. Please, do what you can to keep us supplied."]="木材，蛇油，食物还有水能够加快我们的进度，$p。请尽你所能帮助我们。"
G["Wood-cutting. Little Lu, use this axe to gather firewood."]="伐木斧。小卢，用这把斧头去砍点木柴。"
G["Woof!"]="汪！"
G["Wooga... you came.  Good.  A-Me need you listen now."]="乌嘎……你来了。良好。A-Me需要你听一听。"
G["Woohoo!\n\nWe'll have to do that again sometime!\n\nWell, I'm off to do some more research. I'll catch up to you when I'm ready."]="喔！\n\n我们一定要再这么干一次！\n\n好了，我要继续去做研究了。等我准备好了，我会来找你的。"
G["Woohoo! And they say the Yakshoe is not a luckydo! Many thanks for the rescue."]="呜呼！他们还说牦牛鞋不是幸运符！万分感谢你们的搭救。"
G["Woohoo! I'm saved! I thank you, $n."]="耶！我得救了！谢谢你，$n。"
G["Woohoo! They are into it now!"]="喔！他们进去啦！"
G["Woohoo! We got us a convoy!"]="喔！我们有保镖了！"
G["Woohoo! You've got us running at peak efficiency, $p!"]="哟！就是你让我们效率满满，$p！"
G["Woohoo, $gsweet-thing:lady;! Step aside and watch the magic."]="呦喉，$g小甜心:姑娘;！退开一点，看看这场魔法吧。"
G["Woohoo, that was some crash! All my parts seem accounted for. Thanks, rookie."]="哇哦，撞得可真够惨的！我身上的零件好像都还在。谢了，新丁。"
G["Woohooo!"]="呜呼！"
G["Wooo hoo! Son of an Ook! Pins and needles, pins and needles. Legs are asleep. Hand is asleep. Nibs are asleep."]="喔吼！一个大王的儿子！手脚发麻。手脚发麻。腿没睡醒。手没睡醒。脑袋也没睡醒。"
G["Wooohwee! Smells like Dalaran Sharp!"]="哇！闻上去很像达拉然奶酪！"
G["Woooo, $n!"]="喔……$n！"
G["Wooooowwwww!"]="哇噢！"
G["Woooweeee! Look at her run! Just relax and enjoy the view. I'll have us across the lake in no time."]="呦喉！看看她跑得多漂亮！放松，尽情观赏周围的景色吧。我们很快就能驶过湖面了。"
G["Woops!"]="哎呀！"
G["Woops! Sorry about that."]="噢！我很抱歉。"
G["Woot!"]="真棒！"
G["Woot!  Here we go!"]="喔哦！开始了！"
G["Woot! Thanks!"]="哇！谢谢你了！"
G["Woowhee! I still can't believe we found Old Man Thistle's treasure. I guess all those folk stories weren't so true after all, but I still like tellin' them!"]="哇噢！我仍然无法相信，我们发现了老农阿蓟的宝藏。我想所有这些民间故事并非完全真实，但我还是乐意讲给他们听！"
G["Word from Netherstorm, sir.  Stop all bloodgem imports; client has reneged payments.\n\nThe nexus-prince will buy out our stock at full price as compensation."]="从虚空风暴传来的命令，长官。停止进口血宝石，客户拒绝付款。\n\n节点亲王会以全额买下我们的库存作为补偿。"
G["Word from the front lines is that your recruits outperform all others in battle."]="从前线传来的消息，你的新兵在战场上的表现是最出色的。"
G["Word got back to me through channels concerning Lady Sylvanas's reaction to you and the recovery of her necklace. I still think you did the right thing; don't worry too much about how the lady reacted.\n\nNow, state your business."]="人们对你将项链归还给希尔瓦娜斯女王一事议论纷纷。我坚持认为你做了件好事，不要担心女王会对此做何反应。\n\n去做你自己的事好了。"
G["Word has it that some of the relics in these parts hold mystical power!\n\nHe seems to be fascinated with such things..."]="有传闻说，这里的一些古物具有神秘的力量！\n\n他似乎已经对这些东西彻底着迷了……"
G["Word is that I'm not the only one who can't get goods into or out of Kalimdor."]="听说我不是唯一一个无法运送货物进出卡利姆多的人。"
G["Word is that Vance Undergloom has taken a permanent room upstairs at the Gallows' End Tavern at the southeast end of town.  I think he's just off the reading room."]="有消息说范斯·安德格鲁姆已经在城镇东南端的恐惧之末旅店楼上永久定下了一间房间。我想他刚刚离开了阅览室。"
G["Word is yer doin' a fine job, $g lad : lass;. A fine job. I only ask that you finish up down there at the farm as soon as you can. We've got some pretty hungry folks 'round here."]="传闻你很有些本事，$g小伙子: 小姑娘;。有些本事。我只希望你能在农场尽快完成任务。我们这里有一些人已经快饿得不行了。"
G["Word of your bold attacks upon surface has reached even our master's ears; Cho'gall himself is pleased."]="你在地表立下的英勇战功甚至都已经传到了我们主人的耳中；古加尔本人非常满意。"
G["Word of your travels has reached me. You ride on the winds of change."]="我听闻了你旅行的消息。你乘变幻之风而来。"
G["Word on the peninsula is YES!"]="当然！"
G["Word reaches me you served with my brother in Townlong Steppes. How is the young fellow? Did he ever tell you how he lost his eye?"]="我听说，你跟我弟弟一起在螳螂高原效力。那小家伙怎么样？他给你讲过他是怎么失去那只眼睛的吗？"
G["Word travels fast in this circle.  Thanks for restocking the supplies!"]="消息在这圈子里传得很快。感谢你帮我们补充货源！"
G["Words are not the way of the void. I do not know... it appears to connect two... stars together..."]="虚空之中不需要文字。我不知道……它似乎能连通……两颗星辰……"
G["Words can scarce describe the deeds that this $c has performed on the battlefield.  We are proud to present $n."]="Las palabras apenas pueden describir las hazañas que $geste:esta; $c ha realizado en el campo de batalla. Estamos orgullosos de presentar a $n."
G["Words cannot express my gratitude, $n. Thank you for your kindness."]="$n，任何语言都不足以表达我的感激之情。"
G["Words of a fool, you mean. The Horde will destroy the undead without your aid, human, or that of the pompous king."]="一派胡言。部落杀死那只亡灵易如反掌，不需要你，更别说那个傲慢的国王。"
G["Worgen and dwarves working together... What has this world come to?"]="狼人和矮人合作……这个世界怎么变成了这样？"
G["Worgen everywhere!  Don't give up yet, I'm right behind you!"]="到处都是狼人！不要轻言放弃，我就在你身后！"
G["Worgen filth! I spit on your corpse!"]="狼人渣滓！我要朝你的尸体吐口水！"
G["Worgen!  Worgen everywhere!"]="狼人！到处都是狼人！"
G["Work faster for the glory of the Horde!"]="全力赶工，为了部落的荣耀！"
G["Work faster!"]="快点干！"
G["Work faster! We must hatch the cocoon!"]="快点干！我们必须把这个茧孵化出来！"
G["Work faster! We must push into Sholazar Basin before the Alliance!"]="快点！我们必须抢在联盟之前进入索拉查盆地！"
G["Work faster! We need these catapults ready for an attack!"]="动作快点！我们需要这些投石器来发动进攻！"
G["Work faster, people!"]="动作快点！"
G["Work hard, $c. We have little time to complete our tasks before the prophecies are fulfilled."]="努力工作吧，$c。我们完成任务的时间已经不多了。预言即将实现。"
G["Work harder fools, the Lich King has no time for your laziness!"]="动作快点，蠢货！巫妖王可没有耐心来容忍你们这些懒骨头！"
G["Work harder for the glory of Cho'gall!"]="为了古加尔的的荣耀，工作得更卖力一些！"
G["Work harder slave or I'll have your head!"]="快点干活，别找麻烦！"
G["Work harder you lazy mongrels, or I'll roast you alive!"]="加把劲儿，你们这群懒虫，不然我就把你们活活烤熟！"
G["Work harder!"]="努力点工作！"
G["Work harder, dark iron dogs!"]="工作卖力一些，黑铁狗子们！"
G["Work harder, dogs!"]="努力工作，你们这些败狗！"
G["Work harder, you maggots!  This ore is not going to mine itself!"]="工作再努力些，你们这帮垃圾！矿石可不会自己蹦出来！"
G["Work is da poop! NO MORE!"]="工作真没劲！我不做了！"
G["Work it!"]="搞定！"
G["Work must continue. Double your efforts."]="继续工作。努力工作。"
G["Work on the devices is proceeding as you have directed. We will soon be ready to carry out the next phase of your orders."]="对这些装置的处理正按照你的指示进行。我们很快就能准备好执行你下一阶段的命令了。"
G["Work scum!"]="干活，你们这帮废物！"
G["Work these Broken wretches to the bones, Illidari!  If there's anything of value in this forsaken place we shall find it!"]="让这些可怜的破碎者累到吐血吧，伊利达雷！要是这个被遗弃的地方有任何值钱的东西，我们会找到它的！"
G["Work was bettah in da Undermine!"]="在安德麦工作要好得多！"
G["Work you dogs! Put your back into it!"]="赶快干活，你们这些狗一样的家伙！干活！"
G["Work, work, work! I love to work!"]="干活，干活，干活！我爱干活！"
G["Work, work.  Heh, had you there didn't I?"]="干活，干活。嘿，我还有你呢，对吧？"
G["Work, you filthy swine!"]="工作，你们这些垃圾！"
G["Work?  You are aware this is a warzone, citizen?  What is your profession?"]="找事儿做？这里是战场，你明白吗？你是干什么的？"
G["Working all day in the fields works up a big appetite.\n\nYou didn't hear it from me, but most o' the folk here can eat a woman out of a market stall.\n\nMost everyone has a favorite dish. If you've got any cooking skill, they'll be hankering to try your dishes."]="在田里劳作一整天会让人胃口大开。\n\n别说是我告诉你的，这里的家伙胃口大到能把一个女人都吞下去。\n\n大多数人都会有一道最喜欢的菜。如果你会烹饪的话，他们会很乐意尝尝你的手艺。"
G["Working conditions are horrible under Trade Prince Gallywix. I hope you become the new Trade $g Prince : Princess;!"]="在贸易大王加里维克斯手下工作简直是炼狱。希望你能成为新的贸易$g大王:女王;！"
G["Working for Jerrod isn't all that bad.  He might lose his temper now and again, but he pays well, and he even gives me a boost when I can't reach something in the cart."]="为杰罗德工作并不是那么糟糕。他也许偶尔会发发脾气，但他付的薪水很高。当我不能按进度完成工作的时候，他甚至还会帮我的忙。"
G["Working with this technology is a huge headache.  Everything is constructed in such an alien way."]="采用这种技术进行工作让我非常头痛。所有东西都构造在一种怪异的方式上。"
G["World of Warcraft and Coca-Cola (R) have teamed up to bring you the iCoke-World of Warcraft Summer Promotion.  Look for codes under the caps of specially marked bottles of Coca-Cola.  Then return here and enter the code to win a virtual item."]="魔兽世界和可口可乐(R)共同为您带来了这次可口可乐魔兽世界“要爽由自己，冰火暴风城II”夏季促销活动。请检查魔兽世界主题的可口可乐易拉罐底部或瓶装可口可乐的瓶盖内侧，您可以找到一串13位字符。在www.iCoke.cn上输入您得到的13位字符，就有机会赢得iCoke积分，从而得到可以换取魔兽世界幸运礼品的10位电子兑换券。最后，在这里输入您得到的电子兑换券上的10位号码，神秘大奖在等待着您！"
G["World state variables have been reset."]="世界状态变量已重置。"
G["World's End Tavern"]="天涯旅店"
G["World-famous Noggenfogger Elixir sold here!\n\nHome brewed from all-natural ingredients, bottled and sold locally right here in Gadgetzan. And it's delicious, of course!"]="世界闻名的诺格弗格药剂此处有售！\n\n由纯天然材料萃取炼制而成，只在加基森当地装瓶销售！而且口感顶呱呱——这是当然的！"
G["Worldbreaker"]="灭世者"
G["Worm"]="蠕虫"
G["Worm food."]="蛆虫。"
G["Worm goes on the hook, hook goes in the water. Fish is in the water, our fish."]="把蚯蚓放在鱼钩上，把鱼钩放到水里，这样我们就能钓到水里的鱼了。"
G["Worry no more, taunka. The Horde will save and protect you and your people, but first you must swear allegiance to the Warchief by taking the blood oath of the Horde."]="别担心。部落会保护牦牛人的。但是你必须发血誓效忠酋长。"
G["Worry not, Erunak.  The tauren will be safe."]="别担心，埃鲁纳克。牛头人会没事的。"
G["Worse than your bite?"]="比你的撕咬还凶狠？"
G["Worthless $n!  Your friends will join you soon enough!"]="没用的$n！你的朋友不久之后就会去找你的！"
G["Worthless elekk dung."]="毫无价值的雷象粪便。"
G["Worthless gnat! Death is all that awaits you!"]="没用的虫子！死亡正等待着你！"
G["Worthless maggot."]="没用的蛆虫。"
G["Worthless mongrel.  I will order our outhouses cleaned with this rag you call a banner."]="没用的杂种。拿这块被你们叫做旗子的破布擦地板再合适不过了。"
G["Worthless scrub."]="没用的东西。"
G["Worthless spy, if there were a single morsel of information inside that hollow vessel you call a skull, you would have coughed it up by now. I tire of this exercise. Now perish!"]="没用的间谍，如果那个空壳，也就是你所谓的脑袋，真装了那么一点儿情报的话，你早已经招了。我受够这一套了。现在去死吧！"
G["Worthless wizard! How DARE you fail the Thunder King!"]="没用的巫师！你竟敢让雷电之王失望！"
G["Worthless!  You are completely worthless!"]="没用的家伙！你真是一点用都没有！"
G["Worthless! You're all just worthless! I'm afraid we're going to have dump you all into the Maelstrom!"]="没用的家伙！你们都是没用的家伙！我应该把你们都扔到大漩涡里去！"
G["Wot kin I do fer ye?"]="我可以为你做什么?"
G["Would I be here if this were not serious?"]="如果不是形势严峻，我会出现在这里吗？"
G["Would a fly without wings be called a walk?"]="没有翅膀的鸟可以被称为步行生物吗？"
G["Would a sentinel have truly fallen so easy?  I thought these were fierce warriors."]="一名哨兵会如此容易地被击倒？我以为她们都是精锐的战士。"
G["Would a tauren paladin be a holy cow?"]="一个牛头人圣骑士会是一头圣牛吗？"
