G["Wow, that's one big tank! You've got more guts than I do. Good luck to ya!"]="嗨，瞧这辆大型攻城坦克！你可比我厉害多了。祝你好运！"
G["Wow, that's some powerful stuff. I've got the runs... er... got to run!"]="哇哦，那可真了不起。我已经跑……呃……我得跑了！"
G["Wow, the big bear is still here! Do you think he gets mad when everyone puts their treasure in his tummy? That must hurt..."]="喔，那头大熊还在这里！你觉得大家把财宝都放进他肚子里的时候，他会不会疯掉？那一定很疼……"
