G["Wulan in Shadowprey Village can sell you the \"Expert Cookbook\".  You will need that if you are to better yourself."]="Wulan, en la Aldea Cazasombras, puede venderte el \"Libro de cocina para expertos\". Lo necesitarás si quieres mejorar."
G["Wulfred says that he paid for my trip to the Explorers' League Digsite.  I'm ready to depart."]="乌尔弗雷德说他已经为我前往探险者协会挖掘场的旅行付过钱了。我想现在出发。"
G["Wushoolay, the Storm Witch.\n\nHis power is the power of the sky, the rain, and the shattered earth.  May he once again reign father to the Gurubashi.\n\nWushoolay now rages near the edge of madness."]="雷巫乌苏雷。\n\n她拥有天空、雨水和碎泥的力量。愿她再次统治古拉巴什。\n\n乌苏雷就在疯狂之缘那边。"
G["Wushoolay, the Storm Witch.\n\nHis power is the power of the sky, the rain, and the shattered earth.  May he once again reign father to the Gurubashi.  \n\nWushoolay now dwells far from here.  One day, he may return..."]="雷巫乌苏雷。\n\n她拥有天空、雨水和大地的力量。愿她再次统治古拉巴什。\n\n乌苏雷正在遥远的地方徘徊。总有一天，她会回来的……"
G["Wut dat?"]="那是什么？"
