G["Xarodi sector markets have reopened, sir.  Sapphires of all sort are up.  Silver is down.  Gold is up.  Diamonds remain stable.\n\nOh, and your brother asks that you return the holocubes you borrowed last week."]="夏罗迪地区的市场已经重新开放了，长官。各种蓝宝石价格上涨，银价下跌，金价上涨，钻石走势平稳。\n\n哦，还有，您的兄弟要您归还上周借走的全息盒。"
G["Xeun has taught us courage."]="雪怒教会了我们勇气。"
G["Xink's Shredder collapses and sputters to a stop."]="辛克的伐木机发生故障，很快停止了运转。"
