G["Xuen will not be defeated. He is grace in battle."]="雪怒是不会被打败的。他在战斗中是如此优雅。"
G["Xuen's challenge road the winds to my home in the Jade Forest. I could not refuse such an invitation."]="有关雪怒挑战赛的消息都传到我在翡翠林的老家那儿去了。我可无法拒绝这样的邀请。"
G["Xuen, might of the north, answers the call of battle!"]="雪怒，北方之力，回应了战斗的召唤！"
G["Xuen, the White Tiger, guards against the cold winds of the north.\n\nToday, he seeks to test the greatest champions of the land in a series of trials.\n\nIf you believe yourself worthy, travel north to the Temple of the White Tiger, and make your challenge!"]="白虎雪怒顶着寒冷的北风担任守卫工作。\n\n今天，雪怒试图通过列一系列比赛找到该地区最出色的勇士。\n\n如果你相信自己的能力，就北行至白虎寺，迎接挑战！"
G["Xylem's a little bit lacking in the social graces. He talks to his apprentices a bit, but mostly he just talks to himself. Tends to brush everyone else off.\n\nWouldn't take me as an apprentice - said I was too slimy. Said that my mind wasn't any good to study being all mucked up with magic and all."]="克希雷姆似乎有一点社交恐惧症。大多数时间里，他只是自言自语，偶尔才会和他的学徒说上几句话。对于其他人，他总是视而不见。\n\n他说太笨拙，不能作他的学徒。他还说我的脑子根本学不了魔法，只能被魔法弄得乱七八糟。"
G["Y'all think they're hidin' something inside?"]="你们都觉得他们在隐藏着什么？"
G["Y'hear that, Jethan? You're not getting that Steelfeather trophy now that we know she's a mother."]="杰森，你给我听着。既然钢羽还有一窝嗷嗷待哺的雏鸟，你就别想动她。"
G["Y'know, it's not really Saldean's recipe."]="要知道，这份食谱并不是萨丁发明的。"
