G["Y-yeah! Beer brothers!"]="对啊！啤酒兄弟！"
G["Y-yes sir!"]="是——是，长官！"
G["Y-yes sir! We struck it big. There's crude all along the coast. We'll get an operation going right away, your hugeness!"]="有，有！发现了很多。海滩上到处都是。我们会立刻着手开采的，酋长大人！"
G["Y-yes sir... right away, sir."]="是——是，长官……马上，长官。"
G["Y... your majesty..."]="陛……陛下……"
G["YAAAAAAAAHHHH!!!"]="呀……呀！！！"
