G["YARRR! Swabie, what have ye done?! He's gone mad! Baton down the hatches! Hoist the mast! ARRRR! Every man for hi'self!"]="啊呀！你都干了些什么？他疯了！快关上舱门！把操纵杆往上拉！啊啊啊啊啊！赶快！"
