G["YOU HAVE ONLY DELAYED THE INEVITABLE, CENARIUS. FROM THE FIRELANDS SHALL MY ARMIES BE REBORN..."]="你不过是在拖延时间，塞纳留斯。我的军团将在火焰之地重生……"
G["YOU HAVE RUN OUT OF TIME FRUIT VENDOR!!  NOW I WILL SELL YOUR ROTTEN FRUIT!"]="你的好日子到头了，水果贩子！！现在我要开始卖你的烂水果了！"
