G["YOU WERE SUCH GOOD SPORT THE LAST TIME...COME OUT!"]="你上次给我带来不少乐子哪……出来吧！"
G["YOU WILL ALL PERISH IN FLAMES!"]="你们都将在火焰中化为灰烬！"
G["YOU WILL SEE THE FURY OF THE HORDE RAGE THROUGH YOUR CITIES! YOU WILL SEE YOUR THRONE SPLIT IN TWO! THIS I SWEAR!!!"]="部落的怒火将横扫你的城市！你将看着你的王座被劈成两半！我发誓！"
G["YOU WILL TELL ME WHERE WESTWIND IS OR I WILL DESTROY YOUR SOUL!"]="告诉我韦斯温的下落，不然我就摧毁你的灵魂！"
G["YOU are the soul of the Horde."]="你就是部落的灵魂。"
