G["YOU tread upon the sacrosanct! Mortals have no place amidst the clouds."]="你胆敢凌驾于神圣之上！云巅没有凡人的位置。"
G["YOU will kneel when you beg for my mercy, monster."]="你会跪着求我饶命的，怪物。"
G["YOU!\n\nYou think you can just waltz in here and take my spot? Think again, $g boy : girl;!\n\nI've heard the whispering in the boardroom. The people you've surrounded yourself with at headquarters are all boot-licking sycophants who will do anything to get ahead. I should know... I hired all of them.\n\nYour meteoric rise to power is a fluke, and I'm fully prepared to knock you down a gear or two! Watch your step, $n. Who knows when you're going to need me on your side?"]="¡TÚ!\n\n¿Acaso crees que puedes venir aquí y quedarte con mi puesto? ¡Pues te equivocas, $gmuchacho:muchacha;!\n\nHe oído vuestros susurros en el salón. Esos tipos de los que te has rodeado no son más que aduladores lamebotas y no harán nada por ti. Lo sé... Porque yo los contraté a todos.\n\n¡Tu meteórico ascenso al poder ha sido pura suerte y estoy preparado para hacerte caer! Ándate con ojo, $n. ¿Quién sabe cuándo me necesitarás a tu lado?"
G["YOU'LL NEVER CATCH ME, FIENDS!"]="你们别想抓到我，魔鬼！"
G["YOU'LL NEVER GET THE MASK FROM ME, $P!"]="你休想从我手里拿到面具，$P！"
G["YOU'RE BOTH GOING TO BURN!"]="你们都将被烧毁！"
G["YOU'RE NEXT JUST AS SOON AS I FINISH OFF YOUR FRIEND HERE!"]="我干掉你的朋友之后，下一个目标就是你！"
G["YOU'RE NO FUN!"]="真没意思！"
G["YOUR DAYS ARE NUMBERED FRUIT VENDOR! I KNOW ABOUT YOUR OGRE ARMY!"]="你的日子到头了！你的食人魔军团不堪一击！"
G["YOUR FAILURE TODAY MORTALS HERALDS THE END OF YOUR WORLD. MY CHILDREN USHER IN A NEW ERA, RULED  BY THE FLAME!"]="凡人，你们今日的失败昭示了旧世界的终结。我的子嗣将会引领烈焰统治的新纪元！"
G["YOUR FEEBLE ATTACKS MEAN NOTHING!"]="你们的软弱攻击不值一提！"
G["YOUR OGRE DOESN'T SCARE ME, FRUIT VENDOR! MY ARMY IS ON ITS WAY!"]="你的食人魔佣兵吓不倒我，水果贩！我的援军就要到了！"
G["YOUR RAGE! I FEED ON YOUR RAGE!"]="你的怒火！我要汲取你的怒火！"
G["YOUR SAD ATTEMPT AT CREATING A FEL REAVER TO STOP ME HAS FAILED!  NOW, ON TO AREA 52!"]="你想利用魔能机甲阻止我的企图失败了！现在，向52区前进！"
G["YOUR SOUL IS MINE!"]="你的灵魂是我的！"
G["Ya about to be darkspeared."]="你是暗矛的猎物啦。"
G["Ya all gonna fail!"]="你们注定要失败！"
G["Ya barely be fit tah' feed to de big one."]="你都不够大块头塞牙缝的。"
G["Ya be callin' dat a grip on your weapon? Any Kor'kron worth 'is hide will have dat ting disarmed in a pinch."]="你们就是这么拿武器的？任何一个合格的库卡隆都能轻而易举地把你们缴械了。"
G["Ya be crampin' my style, man. Seriously."]="说实在的，朋友，你在嘲笑我的品位。"
G["Ya be facin' tha' Zandalari now. Not some Darkspear traitor."]="你现在面对的是赞达拉人。而不是一些暗矛部族的叛徒。"
G["Ya be havin' me gratitude, $c.\n\nIf there be anythin' I can be doin' fer yeh, just say so."]="$c，谢谢你。\n\n要是有什么事我能帮上忙的，尽管开口。"
G["Ya be havin' me gratitude, $c.\n\nIf there be anythin' I can be doin' for ya, just say so."]="感谢你，$c。\n\n如果我能帮你做什么，尽管告诉我。"
G["Ya be lettin' us outta here now!"]="快放我们出来！"
G["Ya be lookin' good... in a stew."]="如果把你放在炖肉锅里……那一定会很好看。"
G["Ya be messin' with Tzu-Tzu? It no matter... Aetherion's here, mon. We gonna roll on ya refugee camp an' then bring the hurt to ya Lor'denal. But first, ya die!"]="你要找祖祖的麻烦？没关系……阿瑟里恩在这里，伙计。我们要冲进你们的难民营里去，再去打破你们的新奥伯丁。但首先要死的是你！"
G["Ya be no Warchief of mine.  Ya not earned my respect and I'll not be seein' tha Horde destroyed by ya foolish thirst for war."]="你不是我的酋长。你并没有赢得我的尊敬，我也不会眼睁睁地看着部落因为你对战争的渴望而毁灭。"
G["Ya be nothin' but fuel to me."]="你这废物，只能给我补充能量。"
G["Ya be on da path, mortal....\n\nEndure, and ya be gettin' great power!"]="来吧，凡人……\n\n忍耐！你将拥有真正的力量！"
G["Ya be strong and proud, youngblood.  Tha Darkspear will be honored ta have you fight beside d'em."]="你强壮而又高傲，年轻人。你将为暗矛部族带来巨大的胜利与光荣。"
G["Ya be trespassin' on our land now, mon."]="朋友，你正踏在我们的土地上。"
G["Ya been invaluable to the revolution, mon. We be armin' up now."]="你真是起义军的宝贵财富。现在，我们已经武装起来了。"
G["Ya bring down da big badda dragon an' destroy da island!"]="你要消灭那头大坏龙，摧毁了那座岛！"
G["Ya came to the right place... to be eaten!"]="你来对地方了……准备被吃掉吧！"
G["Ya can't be riding yaks into the mountains without a bonified \"Lucktug\"! That be madness! Lemme sell ya some for cheap."]="No puedes montar en yak en las montañas sin un \"chiripotra\" bonificado. ¡Es una locura! Yo te vendo uno barato."
G["Ya can't beat both de Zandalar an' de mogu!"]="你无法打败联手的赞达拉巨魔和魔古族！"
G["Ya can't let anyone through, mon. Or it's ya' head."]="你不能让任何人过去，伙计。否则就等着掉脑袋吧。"
G["Ya come to the right place to die."]="要想找死的话，你就来对地方了。"
G["Ya don' have to look to da sky to see da dragonhawk!"]="遮天的龙鹰降临了！"
