G["Ya done turned your back on destiny, mon. Now you gunna die!"]="你拒绝了远大的前程。现在，去死吧！"
G["Ya done well, mon."]="你做得很好。"
G["Ya done well, mon...."]="朋友，干得好……"
G["Ya gave up your home an' ya gave up de loas of your ancestors when ya left de Echo Isles. Dey will not be pleased dat you been ignorin' dem."]="你们离开回音群岛，放弃了家园和祖先的光荣。祖先不喜欢你们如此冷漠沉寂。"
G["Ya gonna bleed, mon."]="朋友，你要吃苦头了。"
G["Ya gonna fail, strangers. Many try before you, but dey only make us stronger!"]="你们就要失败了，陌生人。很多人也曾尝试过，但他们只是使我们更强大！"
G["Ya gonna go on to great ting's. Don't forget me, mon."]="你会变成了不起的人，别忘了我，兄弟。"
G["Ya gonna' be helpin' us, $c?"]="你会帮我们的，对吧？$c？"
G["Ya gonna' be my next trophy."]="你将成为我下一个战利品。"
G["Ya got nothin'!"]="你们什么也得不到！"
G["Ya got some nerve, mon!"]="你可真有胆量，兄弟！"
G["Ya got some powerful mojo, $n!"]="你可真有两下子，$n！"
G["Ya grummles be good sports. I be likin' the cut of your jib.\n\nFor dat reason, I be willing to part with this \"Luckydo Kazoo\" which be makin' only deh most luckiest of music."]="Vosotros los grúmel sois simpáticos. Me guh'ta vueh'tro rollo.\n\nPor eso eh'toy dih'pueh'to a dah'te eh'te \"chiflato grisgrís\" que creará música muy afoh'tunada."
G["Ya handle yaself on da ground.  How about in da skies?"]="你在地面行动自如，到了空中又如何呢？"
G["Ya have met your match, fools!"]="你们遇到对手了，蠢货！"
G["Ya have my gratitude for gettin' me outta dat cage. My wits are finally returnin' an' I'll be able to tell Vol'jin what I learned."]="Tienes mi agradecimiento por haberme sacado de esa jaula. Eh'toy recuperando las fuerzas y pronto seré capaz de contah'le a Vol'jin todo lo que he descubieh'to."
G["Ya have my tanks, $c. I thought I'd be endin' up just another sacrifice..."]="感谢你，$c。我以为我要被献祭了……"
G["Ya have no idea what it's like to be stuck here in Vashj'ir like this!  Do ya know how many fish have confused me for a piece of seaweed, nibbling on my toes and hiding between pieces of my armor?\n\nThe tickling alone is enough to drive a dwarf mad!"]="你根本无法想象像这样被困在瓦丝琪尔是什么感觉！你知道有多少鱼把我当成海草，咬我的脚趾头，在我的护甲里钻来钻去吗？\n\n光是挠痒痒就能把一个矮人逼疯！"
G["Ya have the thanks of my men, $n. This totem be a powerful omen for war."]="我的兄弟们对你感激不已，$n。这个图腾是战争的强力征兆。"
G["Ya head's gonna make a nice bag!"]="你的脑袋倒是能做成个好袋子！"
G["Ya here to join da revolution, mon?"]="你是来参加起义的吗，伙计？"
G["Ya know, without so many of them burly trolls wanderin' about this place can be downright pleasant."]="要是没有这些高大的巨魔，这里倒是一处舒适的好地方。"
G["Ya know... my heart really ain't in it."]="你瞧……我的心思真的不在这里。"
G["Ya look lovesick. Special someone be gettin' ya down, eh? No worries, no worries. Ya get this medallion from me, ya wear it when ya see 'em, and they be all over ya, $G man:sweetheart;!"]="Parece que tienes mal de amores. Esa media naranja tuya te da dolores de cabeza, ¿eh? No preocuparse. Yo te doy este medallón; ¡tú te lo pones cuando estés cerca de quien tú ya sabes y $gtodas:todos; se volverán $gloquitas:loquitos; por ti, $gmorenazo:reina mora;!"
G["Ya look tired, $c. I be havin' somethin' for ya. These amulets, they can help ya leap obstacles and swim through the rivers like ya be born to it. They energize the food ya be eatin', makin' yer wounds close before yer eyes!"]="你看上去很疲惫，$c。我有东西给你。这些护身符，它们可以帮你跳跃障碍物和游过河流，就像那是你与生俱来的能力一样。它们让你吃的食物充满能量，让你的伤口在眨眼间就能愈合！"
G["Ya make a good try... but now you gonna join da ones who already fall."]="你们的努力值得赞赏……但现在，你们就将加入死者的行列了。"
G["Ya man, you be wantin Jandi's Arboretum.  Did I just say that?  Glok'tar I must be tired!  Follow the wooden steps behind Asoran's Market in the Valley of Wisdom up into The Drag and you'll find Jandi's there on the upper level."]="嗨你，你是不是想要去詹迪亚的加迪植物园。我刚刚没有说清楚吗？哦，我肯定累了！只要沿着智慧谷里的阿索兰的市场后面的木制台阶到达暗巷区，你可以看到加迪就在那里的上层。"
G["Ya may know a thing or two about handlin' animals, but have ya ever taken ta the skies? We Wildhammers know how ta ride the wind with the best of 'em. Fer a small fee, if ya've got the mettle, I'll train ya good and proper."]="你也许了解一点点驾驭走兽的技巧，但是你有乘坐飞禽自由飞翔的经历吗？蛮锤矮人懂得如何驯养最好的飞行坐骑。如果你有胆的话，只需付一笔小钱，我就教给你这项技能。"
G["Ya may not follow the ways of the Light like a Knight of the Silver Hand, but ya can always ask us for aid."]="你可能不会像一个银手骑士那样追寻光之踪迹，但是你总可以向我们寻求帮助。"
G["Ya messed with de wrong trolls."]="你惹了不该惹的巨魔。"
G["Ya mest with da wrong trolls, fishhead."]="你惹了不该惹的巨魔，鱼脑袋。"
G["Ya momma was bait fish."]="你这条死笨鱼。"
G["Ya mon! A hero done freed our raptors!"]="¡Colega! ¡$gUn héroe:Una heroína; ha liberado a nueh'tros raptores!"
G["Ya must make amends wit' Bwonsamdi, de guardian of de dead, if ya hope to defeat Zalazane. It be de only way. Tell de son of Sen'jin dese things."]="如果你们想要击败扎拉赞恩，你们就必须向亡魂的守护者邦桑迪赎罪。把这件事告诉森金之子。"
G["Ya need ta be more swift den that!"]="你还得再快点才行！"
G["Ya need trainin'?  You picked a real inconvenient time to come pokin' through the Valley of Spirits.\n\n<Your trainer's voice lowers to a whisper.>\n\nThe Kor'kron watches our every move. Garrosh has the Valley of Spirits under his thumb. I could be killed if they saw me talkin' to you.\n\nLucky for you, they don't ever see me. Lean in close, $n. We gotta keep this on the down low."]="你需要训练？你真是来错时候了，这会儿精神谷可不太平。\n\n<你的训练师压低嗓门，悄声说道。>\n\n库卡隆正盯着我们的一举一动。加尔鲁什已经控制了精神谷。如果他们看见我跟你说话，可能会杀了我的。\n\n幸运的是，他们永远都休想看见我。靠近点，$n。我们得低调行事。"
G["Ya needed ta prove yer worthiness...."]="那时，你要证明自己的价值……"
G["Ya not be gettin' me dat easy! Atal'ai gonna rise up..."]="别想这么容易就抓住我！阿塔莱即将崛起……"
G["Ya not be gettin' the drop on us again ya half wit Kor'kron!"]="休想这样对待我们，没脑子的库卡隆！"
G["Ya not be needin' dis weapon again now are ya?"]="你不再需要这把武器了，对吗？"
G["Ya not be so tough from the dead now are ya?"]="你死了之后就不会这么顽固了，对吧？"
G["Ya not be stoppin' de Zandalari, mon."]="朋友，你阻挡不了赞达拉人。"
G["Ya not be stoppin' us, mon."]="朋友，你阻挡不了我们。"
G["Ya not be welcome here!"]="这里不欢迎你们！"
G["Ya not do too bad.... Your efforts delay da inevitable for a small time. Come to me now. Ya prove yourselves worthy offerings."]="你们干得还不坏……你们的努力竟然略略延缓了那不可避免的命运。来我这里吧，你们已经证明自己将是很好的祭品。"
G["Ya not gonna be foolin' ol' Zen'tabra with dat cat disguise. I be rememberin' dis, $r."]="你休想用那套猫皮伪装骗过老岑塔布拉。我会记住你的，$r。"
G["Ya not the only ones who bleed for dah Horde ya orcs!"]="为部落流血的可不只是你们这些兽人！"
G["Ya saved me, mon! I thought they be drownin' me for sure."]="你救了我的命，朋友！我还以为他们会把我淹死呢。"
G["Ya saved my life!"]="你救了我一命！"
G["Ya see that pass ahead dere, $glad:lass;?"]="看到前面的通道了吗，$g小子:姑娘;？"
G["Ya see... to summon Hakkar, I need Mandokir.  And Mandokir, he needs you."]="你看……要想召唤哈卡，我就需要曼多基尔。而曼多基尔，他需要你。"
G["Ya should be able to send in de builders anytime now. Dere be a lot of work ahead of dem."]="你现在可以随时派遣建筑工人开始工作了。现在有许多工作正等着他们呢。"
G["Ya shouldn'a taken the boat north, mon!"]="朋友，你不应该朝北航行的！"
G["Ya shouldn't be messin' wit da Zandalari!"]="你休想阻挠赞达拉！"
G["Ya skull gonna make a fine ornament for my tusks."]="你的颅骨将成为我獠牙上的小装饰。"
G["Ya soul be weak."]="你的灵魂太弱小了。"
G["Ya spirit is mine!"]="你的灵魂归我了！"
G["Ya still call him \"Warchief,\" $c? Is he still YOUR Warchief? What of de spoils of his war? I don't see you fat an' happy like his Kor'kron.\n\nLook, ya be an orc, maybe ya don't see it. Da ghettos in Orgrimmar. De way he talk 'bout de other races. De way he use 'em like cannon fodder. Are ya one of de chosen few, $n? Or are ya disposable, like de rest of us? De trash he throw away once he get his monstrous way. He promise glory but bathes our Horde in blood.\n\nMe an' Thrall, we see a diff'rent Horde."]="¿Todavía le llamas \"Jefe de Guerra\", $c? ¿Todavía es TU Jefe de Guerra? ¿Y qué hay de los deh'pojos de su guerra? No te veo en ti la alegría y la gordura de sus Kor'kron.\n\nMira, tú eres orco, puede que no lo entiendas. Los guetos de Orgrimmar. La forma en que habla de otras razas. El modo en que los utilizó como forraje en la batalla. ¿Eres de los pocos elegidos, $n? ¿O eres prescindible, como nosotros? La basura que tirará en cuanto consiga sus monstruosos objetivos. Nos promete gloria, pero solo baña la Horda en sangre.\n\nThrall y yo vemos la Horda de otro modo."
G["Ya still call him \"Warchief,\" $c? Is he still YOUR Warchief? What of de spoils of his war? I don't see you fat an' happy like his Kor'kron. His Horde be an orc Horde. Do ya still feel welcome here, $r? Are ya a part of his plan? Or are ya trash he gonna do away wit' once he has his way? He promise glory, but bathes our Horde in blood, an' steps on anyone who see it diff'rent.\n\nYa wanna know how I see de Horde? De Horde dat me an' Thrall built?"]="¿Todavía le llamas \"Jefe de Guerra\", $c? ¿Todavía es TU Jefe de Guerra? ¿Y qué hay de los deh'pojos de su guerra? No veo en ti la alegría y la gordura de sus Kor'kron. Su Horda es una Horda de orcos. ¿Todavía sientes que peh'teneces, $r? ¿Formas pah'te de eh'te plan? ¿O serás pah'te de la basura de la que se deshará cuando consiga lo que quiere? Nos promete gloria, pero baña nueh'tra Horda de sangre. Y pisotea a todo el que piense diferente.\n\n¿Quieres saber cómo veo yo la Horda? ¿La Horda que Thrall y yo conh'truimos?"
G["Ya surpassed my greatest hopes."]="你远远超出了我的期望。"
G["Ya think? Hobart, the Micro Mechachicken is destablizing. It's expanding!"]="你在想什么？霍巴特，这只微型机动战鸡很不稳定。它在剧烈膨胀！"
G["Ya tink these herbs and fancy incense be givin' ya luck in dah mountains? Ha ha! Ya not be tradin' with dah right mon, mon. Come be gettin' you a genuine Lucky Lock!"]="你觉得这些草药和昂贵的熏香能在山里给你带来好运气？哈哈！那你可找错人了，伙计。快来买一把货真价值的幸运锁吧！"
G["Ya tink ya got what it takes ta face ME? Give up, shadow hunter!"]="你以为你有资格面对我吗？放弃吧，暗影猎手！"
G["Ya trainer should be somewhere in the grounds 'ere. I'll catch you lata, mon."]="你的训练师应该就在不远的地方。稍后我再来找你，兄弟。"
G["Ya wanna find out?!"]="你想查明吗？！"
G["Ya want a present?! WELL, MY LEGS DON'T EVEN WORK!!!"]="你想要礼物？！好极了，我的腿都不能动了！！！"
G["Ya want to join the attack on the naga?"]="你想要加入对抗纳迦的战斗吗？"
G["Ya were foolish to come 'ere, Sea Witch. Ya escaped our vengeance once, but the Darkspear Tribe will not abide ya trespassin' again."]="你来到这里是个错误，女海巫。你曾经逃脱过我们的复仇。但暗矛氏族不会容忍你再次践踏我们的家园。"
G["Ya will spend ya reign glancin' over ya shoulda and fearin' tha shadows, for when tha time comes and ya blood be slowly drainin' out, ya will know exactly who fired tha arrow dat pierced ya black heart."]="你应该经常注意一下自己的背后和你身边的阴影。只有这样，当你的血慢慢流干的时候，你才会知道究竟是谁射出了那支夺去你生命的利箭。"
G["Ya won't take de Horde from us!"]="你们休想夺走我们的部落！"
G["Ya' better stay away, chumps. No one hassles the Hoff!"]="你最好滚远点，笨蛋。霍夫可不是好惹得！"
G["Ya' ever wonder how magnets work?"]="知道磁铁是怎么工作的吗？"
G["Ya'll get a few minutes to wake up, but let's get started soon."]="你得花几分钟时间才能起床，但是我们马上就要出发了。"
G["Ya'll need to find a different trainer, $c. I cannot help ya."]="你得去找别的训练师，$c。我帮不了你。"
G["Ya, mon! I'm da best there ever was!"]="没错，伙计！我是最强的拳手！"
G["Ya, mon, for now. Dey not be too keen on teachin' many more o' our kind, but dey be helpin' us 'long as we be keepin' de life o' de isles flourishin'. When Gonk left after de fall o' Zalazane, he be tellin' us how ta contact him if de other loa don't keep dey end o' de bargain.\n\nI be hopin' it never come ta dat... but just in case, we be openin' up channels wit dat Cenarion Circle group. \n\n<Zen'tabra cackles madly.>\n\nOh, ya shoulda seen de look on dat night elf's face...."]="是的，朋友，至少现在还是这样。他们对于教导更多我们的族人并不热心。但只要我们还在维护这些岛屿上的生命茁壮生长，他们就会继续帮助我们。当扎拉赞恩灭亡，贡克离开的时候，他告诉我们，如果其他神灵不遵守契约，该如何与他取得联系。\n\n我希望这样的事情永远不要发生……但为了以防万一，我们还是和塞纳里奥议会建立了联系。\n\n<岑塔布拉发出一阵狂野的笑声。>\n\n哦，你真应该看看那些暗夜精灵的表情……"
G["Ya, mon. Let's crack some tiki target skulls!"]="耶，兄弟。去敲烂几个蒂基面具假人吧！"
G["YaY! WE WON!"]="耶！我们赢了！"
G["Yaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaay!"]="吖——！"
G["Yaaaaawwwwwnnnn..."]="嗷……"
G["Yaaarr!"]="呀！！"
G["Yachi! Yao! Rip these fools to shreds!"]="涯尺！曜！把这些蠢货撕成碎片！"
G["Yah, I know, it be lookin' like we already have all of the mithril bars we be needin' for the war. But ya know, there still be plenty of folk 'round here that can probably be usin' your help right about now.  Thanks mon."]="呀，似乎我们已经收集到足够数量的秘银锭了。但是你知道，这附近有很多人现在也许正需要你的帮助呢。谢谢你。"
G["Yah, me bredren!  Galang now and pass us a grog, just dead men yahso."]="嘿，兄弟！给我们来点啤酒吧。你瞧，酒杯都空了。"
G["Yah, mom... woooo!"]="呀，天哪……呜！"
G["Yah, mon, this be the time to be glad of life and spring. Ya collect lots of eggs yet?"]="嘿，朋友，眼下正是为生命和春天欢呼的日子。你已经收集到了不少彩蛋吧？"
G["Yah. Hellscream, he be a fierce one, but too eager to prove himself, I be thinkin'. It be good Saurfang be here, for sure."]="呀。我觉得吧，加尔鲁什倒也算得上是位勇士，可惜他很爱表现，老想着如何证明自己的实力。不过既然萨鲁法尔大王也在这里，我就安心啦。"
G["Yah. It be dem sinkholes. You see dem? Dere be talk of blowin' dem up, cavin' dem in."]="是啊。它们不断从虫孔中涌出。你见过吧？我觉得我们应该设法炸毁那些虫孔，阻断蛛魔大军的来路。"
G["Yak hair."]="牦牛毛。"
G["Yak, yak! Let's get to the drinking!"]="呀，呀！喝呀喝呀！"
G["Yak. Yak never changes."]="牦牛。牦牛从不改变。"
G["Yalia - we need more healing! Taoshi - cover the rear!"]="雅丽亚——我们需要治疗！陶矢——掩护后方！"
G["Yalia, take Lord Zhu to safety."]="雅丽亚，保护祝掌门。"
G["Yana Bloodspear."]="亚娜·血矛。"
G["Yanyra Moonfell peddles reagents and can be found in the crafter's hall, to the left as you enter the building.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="雅拉·月落在工匠大厅内兜售试剂，就位于你进入建筑物时的左侧。\n\n我会在你的地图上标记这个位置。"
G["Yap, I can teach ye to fish."]="对，我可以教你钓鱼。"
G["Yar!"]="呀！"
G["Yar, he's dead all right.  That makes you da new king... well, all of you!  Gordok is yours now, boss!  You should talk to me so you can learn everything there is about being da king!  I was... is his assistant!  Yeah, that's why I'm called da crafty one!"]="Sí, está muy muerto. ¡Eso te convierte en $gel nuevo rey:la nueva reina;...! ¡Bueno, todos vosotros! ¡Gordok te pertenece, $gjefe:jefa;! Ven a hablar conmigo para aprender todo lo necesario sobre ser $gel rey:la reina;. ¡Yo fui... su asistente! ¡Sí, por eso me llaman el Astuto!"
G["Yarg!"]="啊！"
G["Yarp? Yar wannar fly? Narp... No-no-no-norp gonnarp ha-hap-hap-happen!"]="嗯？你想飞？不……这是不可能的！"
G["Yarr!"]="呀！"
G["Yarr!  I pilfered those limes fair 'n' square!"]="呀！那些酸橙是我光明正大得来的！"
G["Yarr! Someone be needin' ta show these bloaks what fer!\n\n<hic>"]="¡Yarr! ¡Alguien tiene que enseñarles a estos pedorros para qué!\n\n<hic>"
G["Yarr, Admiral. Let me think about it... Arrr... It be comin' into focus."]="呀，将军。让我考虑一下……啊……有了。"
G["Yarr, and what be ye?  A bilge-lickin' $r with some fancy $c pants and a mug like a $g sea giant: harpy;.  I'd rather take a bite o' Keelhaul's boot than take a weakling like yerself into the Bloodsails.\n\nCome back when ye got a little more wind in yer sails."]="Jarrr, y quién eres tú, ¿eh, broder? $gUn:Una; $r lamesuelas Pantoque con unos pantalones de $c elegantes y un careto como el de $gun gigante:una arpía; de mar. Prefiero una patada de la bota de Sinquilla antes que metel a un tirillas como tú en los Velasangre.\n\nVen cuando hayas resibido más viento en tus velas."
G["Yarr, hold on tight, me hearty, fer thar be nary an oarsman so capable as I!"]="呀，抓紧了，朋友，再没有比我更好的划手了！"
G["Yarr, thar be a traitor!  An ugly one at that!  Get out o' me office, before I blow ye down to Pirate-town!"]="呀，有叛徒！还长得那么丑！快滚出我的办公室，别等我一拳把你打到海盗老巢！"
G["Yarr, thar be nary a soul s'thirsty as me, says I."]="呀，谁也不会有我这样渴。"
G["Yarr, the Adm'rl sent me here to sell ya some of the booty we plundered from the Jade Forest.  He thought it might 'elp you on yer journey.\n\nIf ye want I can also take ye back to the mainland."]="呀，将军派我到这儿来，把我们从翡翠林抢来的战利品卖给你。他认为这会对你的旅途有所帮助。\n\n如果你愿意的话，我还能带你返回大陆。"
G["Yarr."]="呀。"
G["Yarr?"]="什么？"
G["Yarrr!"]="呀！"
G["Yarrr! Keep it down, Ed! Thar be scallywags about! Their scallywag ears be listenin' for gasps like the one that just escaped yer lips!"]="当然！小声点，艾德华！那些无赖汉就在附近！他们的耳朵正听着刚从你嘴里溜出去的那些话！"
G["Yarrrr!"]="呀！"
G["Yarrrr!  If it's me treasure yer lookin' for... yer gonna have to fight for it!"]="呀啊啊啊！想要夺得我的财宝……你要费一番功夫了！"
G["Yarrrr, mon!"]="呀啊啊啊，朋友！"
G["Yarrrr, yeh don't want none of what I be dealin', $gSonny:missy;.\n\nBegone wit' yeh!"]="呀，你对我这儿的东西都没兴趣，$g小男孩:小女孩;。\n\n快走开！"
G["Yarrrrr... dead again!"]="呀啊啊啊……又死了！"
G["Yarrrrrrr!  Ye'll never get me spyglass, bilgesucker!"]="呀啊啊啊！别想得到我的望远镜，你这只配滚去舱底喝污水的蠢货！"
G["Yaungol!? Now!?"]="野牛人！？现在！？"
G["Yaw Sharpmane awaits you on the north edge of the village.  He can teach you the ways of the Hunter."]="雅文·刺鬃在村庄北面等你。他能教你猎人之道。"
G["Yawww!"]="嗷！"
G["Yay!"]="嘿嘿！"
G["Yay!  We love you!  You saved us!"]="哈哈！我们爱你！你救了我们！"
G["Yay!  We're free!"]="耶！我们自由了！"
G["Yay! Dinner come to ME!"]="哈哈！晚饭来找我了！"
G["Yay! I'm the best!"]="耶！我是最棒的！"
G["Yay! Shin! You're alive!"]="耶！阿信！你还活着！"
G["Yay! That was amazing!"]="呀！真是惊人啊！"
G["Yay!!"]="耶！"
G["Yay, fireworks!"]="呀哈，焰火！"
G["Yay... more dirt."]="唉……又是泥土。"
G["Yayyyy!"]="呀！"
G["Ye ain't cookin' ME, ye long-eared snow-huffer!"]="休想煮了我，你这愚蠢的巨魔！"
G["Ye be needing directions $glad : lass;?"]="你需要指引吗，$g小伙子:姑娘;？"
G["Ye bothered me for that? Ye'd be better off strapping a dead rabbit to yer back and running through a Troll's den than wearing that piece of garbage."]="你打扰我就是为了这个？你穿得真是跟垃圾一样，你还不如背着个死兔子到巨魔的洞里去跑一圈哪！"
G["Ye can defuse it, right Magruder?!"]="你能去掉它，对不对，麦格鲁德？！"
G["Ye can probably hear Tognus beating away on the anvil when yer in Kharanos.  Although, if ye haven't cleared the wax out of yer ears recently, then why don't ye just have a look in the smithy."]="当你在卡拉诺斯的时候，你可能会听到托格努斯在铁砧上敲打。然而，如果你还没有把耳朵里的蜡清理掉，那你为什么不到铁匠铺去看看呢？"
G["Ye don' want ta' be goin up dis' way, mon.  Da spirits be restless.\nMebbe if ye' know a ting or two about ancient artifacts, ye can fin' a way to put dem to rest."]="No deberías andar por aquí, colega. Los eh'píritus eh'tán inquietos.\n\nQuizá si sabes algo sobre ah'tefactos antiguos puedas encontrar la forma de tranquilizah'los."
G["Ye don't remember me, do ye? Blasted Scourge... They've tried to drain ye o' everything that made ye a righteous force o' reckoning. Every last ounce o' good... Everything that made ye a $g son:daughter; o' Ironforge!"]="No me recuerdas, ¿verdad? Maldita Plaga... Han intentado drenar de ti todo lo que te convertía en alguien digno y admirable. Hasta el último gramo de bondad... ¡Todo lo que te hacía ser un $ghijo:hija; de Forjaz!"
G["Ye don't?  But ya worked so hard ta get it!  Well, $g lad : lass;, if ya want, I'll take it off o' yer hands fer a fair price.\n\nHow does an exchange of yer cloak fer an apexis crystal sound ta ye?"]="¿No te gusta? ¡Pero has trabajado muy duro para conseguirla! Bueno $Gchico:chica;, si quieres te la quitaré de las manos por un precio módico.\n\n¿Qué te parece el cambio de tu capa por un cristal de ápices?"
G["Ye have my approval $n, ye can forge blades better than any I've trained in years. If ye want to make a real weapon though, ye need to talk with Myolor Sunderfury. That Dwarf will set ya on the right path."]="$n，你已经得到了我的认可，你是我这些年来带过的最好的徒弟。如果你想要铸造一把真正的武器，那么你一定要去和米洛尔·怒斩谈谈。那个矮人能够教你铸造出一把真真正正的绝世好剑。"
G["Ye have some skill about ye with hammer and anvil, but not enough. Go speak to Dane Lindgren, he'll get ye ready to learn what I have to teach ye."]="你掌握一些关于锤头和铁砧的技艺，但还不够。去找丹恩·林德雷谈谈，他会让你做好准备学习我教给你的知识。"
G["Ye have some skill at weapon crafting $g lad : lass;,very impressive indeed. Now grab a hammer and let's see if ye can forge a real weapon."]="$g小伙子:小姑娘;，你已经具备了相当高超的武器锻造水平，这让我非常吃惊。现在拿起铁锤，让我们看看你是否能够锻造出一把真正的武器吧。"
G["Ye have the look of a Blacksmith to ye. Soot under the nails, steel in yer bones. Aye, very much the blood of a Blacksmith in yer veins. Which means ye've come to me looking to learn a thing or two, well $g lad : lass; grab a hammer. Let's see what I can teach ye."]="Pareces $gun herrero:una herrera;. Hollín bajo las uñas, acero en los huesos. Sí, por tus venas corre sangre de herrero. Eso significa que has venido a aprender unas cuantas cosas. Está bien, $gmuchacho:muchacha;, coge un martillo. Vamos a ver lo que puedo enseñarte."
G["Ye know more than I do, that's a certainty. Tell ye what though, go talk with me da'. He'll want ye ta prove yerself, but he is a fine teacher indeed. His name's Rotgath, and ye'll find him near the anvils workin steel for ol' Bengus."]="你知道的比我还多，这一点很肯定。我告诉你接下来该怎么办，去和我的爸爸谈谈。他是个好的老师，但是他会要求你证明自己的实力。他的名字叫洛特加斯，你可以在本古斯的铁砧旁边找到他。"
G["Ye know, $n, I gotta admit I look forward to your visits now and again."]="你知道吗，$n，我得承认我偶尔会盼望你的到来。"
G["Ye learn fast $g lad : lass;, much faster than I can keep up with. If ye want ta continue yer training, I suggest ye see my teacher. His name's Rotgath, Rotgath Stonebeard and ye'll find him in Ironforge at The Great Forge."]="你学得很快，$g小伙子:姑娘;，快得我已经远远跟不上你了。如果你想继续学习的话，我建议你去见见我的导师。他的名字叫洛特加斯，嗯，洛特加斯·石须。你可以在铁炉堡的大锻炉那里找到他。"
G["Ye look a bit lost there.  Can I help ye find something?"]="Pareces un poco $gperdido:perdida;. ¿Puedo ayudarte a encontrar algo?"
G["Ye looking for Hogral?  Well did ye check the tavern?  Och!  If yer looking for a rogue, and a dwarf one at that, ye should start in the Inn!  Go have a look already."]="你在寻找霍格拉尔？那你找过旅店吗？啊！如果你在找一个潜行者，而他同时还是一个矮人，你应该从旅店开始！先去看一下。"
G["Ye might not know it, but in addition to being a skilled tailor, Jormund is also a slayer of giants!  Why he must have overheard a few of us sharing stories when he shouted that he'd killed seven with one blow!  \nYe should pay him a visit at his store on the north side of The Great Forge an' see if he'll tell ye the tale!"]="Quizás no lo sepas, pero además de ser un sastre excelente, ¡Jormund es un cazador de gigantes! Una vez nos debió de oír por casualidad cuando algunos de nosotros estábamos contando historias, ¡y entonces gritó que había matado a siete de un solo golpe! \n\nDeberías hacerle una vistita a su tienda en la parte norte de La Gran Fundición y ver si te quiere contar la historia."
G["Ye need some training?  Well, Azar Stronghammer is always up for showing the younger paladins a thing or two.  Why don't ye go see him in the Thunderbrew Distillery."]="你需要接受些训练？好吧，阿扎尔·战锤总是愿意教给年轻的圣骑士一点东西。你为什么不去雷酒酿制厂找他呢？"
G["Ye should be on yer way $g lad : lass;. My pet here is hungry and he likes the smell of ye."]="你最好离远点，$g小伙子:姑娘;。我的宠物肚子饿了，显然它对你垂涎欲滴。"
G["Ye should check over at Steelgrill's Depot for Bronk.  When he's not tinkering with some odd device, he's usually chatting up the pilots about their steam tanks."]="你应该去钢架补给站找布隆克。当他不忙着修补一些奇怪装置的时候，他通常就在跟飞行员们聊些关于他们的蒸汽坦克的事。"
G["Ye should take a look in Ironforge if ye have yer mind set on enchanting.  I think I saw a shop over by the gryphon master last time I was up there."]="Deberías echar un vistazo en Forjaz si tienes la idea de convertirte en $gencantador:hechicera;. Creo que vi una tienda junto al maestro de grifos la última vez que estuve allí."
G["Ye sure ye don't want to learn to be a warrior?  Well, it's yer hide on the battlefield.  If ye really want to learn to waggle yer finger, ye best talk to Magis Sparkmantle in the Thunderbrew Distillery."]="你肯定你不想当一名战士？那好吧，如果你真想学习动动手指的把戏，你最好去找雷酒酿制厂的玛济斯·石衣谈谈。"
G["Ye walk on the Baron's land now, ye scurvy worgen scum!"]="你们已经踏上了大财主的地盘，你们这群卑鄙的狼人渣滓！"
G["Ye want Deepmountain Mining and Jewelcrafting, over on the northern side of The Great Forge."]="想找深山珠宝矿业协会，去大锻炉北侧吧。"
G["Ye want to be trained in the use of a weapon, do ye?  Well don't stand there slack-jawed, speak up $gladdie : lassie;!"]="你想学习如何使用武器，是吗？嗨，$g小伙子:姑娘;，别在站在那儿发呆啦，大声说吧！"
G["Ye won't find a gryphon master just anywhere around Dun Morogh, $glad : lass;.  Ye're going to have to go to Ironforge if ye want to take a gryphon somewhere."]="丹莫罗一带是没有狮鹫管理员的，$g小伙子:姑娘;。如果你想骑狮鹫去什么地方的话，就必须去铁炉堡。"
G["Ye won't find any skinners out in here Dun Morogh $glad : lass;, they're mostly to be found in Ironforge if ye're looking to be trained."]="丹莫罗这里可没有剥皮匠，$g小伙子:姑娘;，如果你想要学习剥皮的话，就到铁炉堡去找找吧。"
G["Ye won't find anythin' like it elsewhere. Come and try!"]="这里的美酒是独一无二的。快来尝尝吧！"
G["Ye'd think that, after an earthquake of cataclysmic proportions, the LAST place ye'd want ta be is indoors, wouldn't ye?"]="试想一下，在经历了灾变程度的大地震后，你最不想待的地方应该就是屋里了，不是吗？"
G["Ye'll be feasting on me blade this Winter Veil!  Yeargh!"]="明年的冬幕节就是你的忌日！呀哈！"
G["Ye'll find an Arcane Reforger in Gimble's shop, Thistlefuzz Arcanery, right by the Gryphon Master at The Great Forge.\n\nHe's one o' them long-lost Highborne elves, but he'll do ye right."]="在吉布的商店——草须魔法用品店里有一位奥术重铸师，就在大锻炉的狮鹫管理员附近。\n\n他属于早已失落的上层精灵一族。但他可以帮上你的忙。"
G["Ye'll find the battlemasters around the war table in the Hall of Arms."]="你可以在武器大厅的战略沙图周围找到战场军官们。"
G["Ye'll not find a finer craftsman than I in all the Dark Irons!\n\nHammerin', smithin', and diggin' be damned!  A needle and a thimble's all the metal I need!"]="在整个黑铁部族中，你再也找不到比我技巧更高超的工匠了！\n\n什么敲打、锻造、采掘，都见鬼去吧！一根缝针、一个顶针就是我所需要的全部金属！"
G["Ye'll not get around our blockade with scavengin'!"]="别想冲破我们的封锁线！"
G["Ye'll surely find Maxan Anvol tossin' back a few in the Thunderbrew Distillery.  Why don't ye go have yerself a pint and see if he'll teach ye something new."]="你肯定可以在雷酒酿制厂看到马克萨恩·安沃尔大口喝酒。为什么你不去喝一点，顺便看看他能教你点什么新鲜东西呢？"
G["Ye'll want ta seek out Wembil Taskwidget, just along the south road.\nHe can help ye with any profession ye're interested in!"]="Busca a Wembil Trastarea por el camino del sur.\n\n¡Puede ayudarte con cualquier profesión que te interese!"
G["Ye're a fine enchanter indeed! Now it's time fer ye to move on. I want ye to talk to Gimble Thistlefuzz, upstairs. He's a bit of a character, but he'll steer ye in the right direction from here on out!"]="¡Eres $gun buen encantador:una buena hechicera;, no hay duda! Es hora de que sigas tu camino. Quiero que hables con Gimble Cardopelusa, en el piso de arriba. Tiene bastante carácter, ¡pero a partir de ahora te mostrará el camino correcto!"
G["Ye're beyond my skill to teach, $n. Go pester Tally Berryfizz; she's a gnome living in Tinker Town of Ironforge. Oh, and since you're headed up anyway, give Kali my love."]="我教不了你，$n。去找塔雷·浆泡；她是一个侏儒，住在铁炉堡的侏儒区。哦，既然你反正要去，请把我的爱带给卡利。"
G["Ye've come to the right place $glad : lass;!  People come here from all o'er the world to train to be a blacksmith.  Ye'll find Bengus Deepforge hammering away at an anvil in the middle of our fine city by The Great Forge itself."]="你算来对地方了，$g小伙子:姑娘;！人们从世界各地来此学习成为一名铁匠。你会看到本古斯·深炉在我们漂亮的城市中央的大熔炉的铁砧上埋头工作。"
G["Ye've either got to stop the boy or help him... one o' the two!"]="你要么阻止那孩子，要么就帮帮他……二选一！"
G["Ye've got a little skill on ye. Enough to learn ye a few things I wager. Let's see what I can teach ye, shall we?"]="你确实有点本事。我打赌你的技术足够让你学些东西了，我们来看看我有什么能教给你的，好吗？"
G["Ye've got my attention.  OK, now ye've lost it."]="你引起了我的注意。呃，没事了。"
G["Ye've got some stones comin' up here, $glad:lass;. It's Pirates' Day, ye know... and 'til the sun rises on the morrow, Booty Bay is MINE.\n\nSo! What do ye say? Raise a drink ta me and me crew, and join the celebration?"]="你要到这里来是需要一些勇气的，$g小伙子:小姑娘;。今天是海盗节，你知道啦……直到明天的太阳升起之前，藏宝海湾是属于我的。\n\n那么！你觉得怎样？为我和我的船员举杯，一起来参加庆祝吗？"
G["Ye've got some stones, $glad:lass;, comin' in here unannounced.\nWhat do ye want?"]="Hay que tenerlos cuadrados, $gmuchacho:muchacha;, para presentarse aquí sin ser anunciado.\n\n¿Qué es lo que quieres?"
G["Ye've gotta be kiddin' me! Yer nearly dead! Look at ye!"]="你在开玩笑吧！你都快死了！看看你的样子！"
G["Ye've made yer way to Chiselgrip, $g lad: lass;.  Best make yerself useful."]="你已到达凿握据点，$g小伙子:小姑娘;。最好能发挥你的价值。"
G["Ye... Yes, yes... Of course. We need only the crystals and ore from this place. There is... We will need mounts."]="是……是，是的……当然，我们只需要这个地方的水晶和矿石。也就是说……我们需要坐骑。"
G["Ye... yes, high <hic> elder?"]="¿S... sí, gran <hip> ancestro?"
G["Yea, Nat?"]="什么事，纳特？"
G["Yea, great. Can we leave now? This desert is giving me hives."]="是啊，太棒了。我们现在能回去了吗？这片沙漠让我浑身发痒。"
G["Yea, sure. There's supposed'ta be a door here. Big whoop. Wanna fight abboudit?"]="当然，没错。这里原本是有一扇门的。你很激动嘛，想打一架吗？"
G["Yea, that hit the spot.  Muffins for sale!  Get your fresh muffins right here!"]="哈哈，多么美味啊。卖松饼啦！来这里买新鲜的松饼吧！"
G["Yea, we got problems. I think that's crystal clear. The question is, what are we gonna do about it?"]="是的，我们有麻烦了。我想那是显而易见的。但问题是，我们要怎么办？"
G["Yea, yea, I'm the muffin man.  You know why?  Because I sell muffins, that's why!"]="没错，我是松饼人。你知道为什么吗？因为我卖松饼啊！"
G["Yea."]="对。"
G["Yea... I don't know about this."]="对……我对此一无所知。"
G["Yea?"]="什么事？"
G["Yeaaaarrrghhh!"]="咿呀！"
G["Yeah mon. Let's get dis show on da road."]="没问题，伙计。我们赶紧动手吧。"
G["Yeah yeah, I know Dadanga dislikes smoke.  From the smell of it though, seems like Dadanga also dislikes bathing."]="是的是的，我知道达丹加不喜欢烟。但从它身上的气味来看，达丹加好像还不喜欢洗澡。"
G["Yeah yeah, I'll come to his rescue.\n\nDon't you fall into his little center-of-the-world hero bit though! He just likes the attention. I swear, he thinks he's going to be the next Aspect. It's laughable."]="是的，是的，我会去救他。\n\n不过你可别被他的救世英雄的小故事迷惑了！他只是想引起别人的注意。我发誓，他一定想成为下一个守护巨龙。这真可笑。"
G["Yeah yeah. I'm on my way. Don't get your chain panties in a bunch."]="好了，好了，别催我。"
G["Yeah!"]="是！"
G["Yeah! And you'll get in trouble for that too! Now ring the bell you big baby."]="没错！那一样会让你丢脸！现在快去敲钟，你这个大笨蛋。"
G["Yeah! Fightin' time!"]="好也！过招时间到！"
G["Yeah! Get back over your wall, you jikkety-dooks!"]="耶！滚回长城那边去吧，蠢货们！"
G["Yeah! Get sprayed!"]="耶！喷到了！"
G["Yeah! I love this song!"]="耶！我喜欢这首歌！"
G["Yeah! They made it! The captured sprite darters made it!"]="太好了！精灵龙都逃脱了！我们成功了！"
G["Yeah! Yeah. Later, man. Much later."]="嗨！嗨！朋友，待会儿。咱们待会儿再谈。"
G["Yeah!! BEEEEEER!"]="耶！！啤酒！"
G["Yeah!! BEER!"]="耶！！啤酒！"
G["Yeah, I am the head of the Tiller's Union. Why do you ask?"]="没错，我就是阡陌客的首领。你为什么要问这个？"
G["Yeah, I could never do that. The pay's too good here."]="是啊，我是永远都不会做这种傻事的。这里的报酬真不错。"
G["Yeah, I don't want to be here if Myzrael wakes up.  They say she has a mean temper..."]="当然，如果密斯莱尔醒来的话，我才不愿意待在这里。他们说她脾气很不好……"
G["Yeah, I got it. That's weird.\n\nWho loses their river boat, cap'n?"]="嗯，我明白了。这可真奇怪。\n\n谁会把赛艇弄丢呢，长官？"
G["Yeah, I need to drop off some things myself.  Find it by heading north up the road to Orgrimmar and then ask one of the grunts there."]="是的，我自己也需要放置一些东西。要找到它你需要向北沿着去奥格瑞玛的路一直走，然后找那里的步兵询问一下。"
G["Yeah, I tried to hop through that thing too."]="是的，我也试着跳过那玩意儿。"
G["Yeah, I'll show you a few things. We'll see how you do, maybe you'll surprise me!"]="是的，我有些东西要给你看看。我们来看一下你做得怎么样，或许你会令我吃惊的！"
G["Yeah, I'm sure safety is your top priority. Give me a rocket pack."]="没错，你最看重的是安全。给我个火箭背包。"
G["Yeah, I've heard through the grapevine that I might be seeing you sooner or later. But I don't just take on anyone, I need to make sure you have what it takes first. You willing to take my little test and find out?"]="是的，我曾听到传言说我迟早会见到你的。但我不会随便接纳任何人的，我需要首先确定你的水准。你愿接受我的测试吗？"
G["Yeah, I... I think I can see it too."]="是的，我……我想我也能看到它。"
G["Yeah, a real party that I was actually invited to. Why does something always happen and I never get to go? I could use a drink."]="那是一场真正的聚会，而且我的确受到了邀请。为什么总是有意外发生，让我永远也无法走开？我应该好好喝上一杯的。"
G["Yeah, get him!"]="是的，抓住他！"
G["Yeah, he did."]="是啊。"
G["Yeah, let's go now."]="呀，我们出发吧。"
G["Yeah, no problem, $n! Sorry... thought you were done with it already."]="啊，没问题，$n！对不起……我还以为你已经搞定了。"
G["Yeah, okay, boss. No problem."]="好了，老板。没问题。"
G["Yeah, sure, go ahead and tell ol' Great-father Winter what you'd like for this Winter Veil.\n\nHo ho hurry up."]="是的，当然，去告诉冬天爷爷你都想从这个冬幕中得到什么。\n\n赶紧些。"
G["Yeah, sure, go ahead and tell ol' Greatfather Winter what you'd like for this Winter Veil.\n\nHo ho hurry up."]="是的，当然，去告诉冬天爷爷你都想从这个冬幕中得到什么。\n\n赶紧些。"
G["Yeah, sure. The Jade Lungfish are found about here, in the Enchanted Woods of the Lost in Jade Forest on your map. It's not the biggest pool in Pandaria, but it's majestic all its own."]="当然可以。翠绿肺鱼就集中在这一带，翡翠林的失落林地里。那里不算是潘达利亚最大的鱼塘，但别具一格。"
G["Yeah, sure. You just keep thinking that."]="啊，当然。你做梦去吧。"
G["Yeah, thanks!"]="嗯，谢谢！"
G["Yeah, that would be Austil de Mon.  He's always hanging out in the tavern at the southeast end of town.  It's called the Gallows' End Tavern, you can't miss it."]="是的，你应该去找奥斯蒂尔·德·蒙。他总住在城镇东南端的客栈里。它叫做恐惧之末旅店，你不会错过的。"
G["Yeah, that would be Austil de Mon.  You will find him standing guard near one of the meatwagons, near the inn."]="是的，你要找的是奥斯蒂尔·德·蒙。他就在旅店附近的一辆绞肉车旁边。"
G["Yeah, that's her you're standing on. A beaut, isn't she? The Baron set me up as the captain a while back. She's not mine originally, so I didn't name her; if you want my opinion, kid, I think the sailor who named her spent a little too much time at sea and not enough time in port, if you catch my meaning."]="这就是少女之爱号。她很漂亮，是吧？不久前，公爵委派我担任这艘船的船长。她本不属于我，因此“少女之爱”这个名字不是我取的。我猜为她取名的水手大概是在海上航行太久了，没能好好享受港口的美妙时光。你懂我的意思吗？"
G["Yeah, the hut! Good idea. You go first."]="没错，小屋！好主意。你先走。"
G["Yeah, there's tons of people still trapped in the escape pods, boss. Oh, wait. I guess you're not the boss anymore. Anyways, they're all probably going to drown if you don't get them out."]="对，有无数人还被困在逃生舱里，老大。喔，等一下。我想你已经不再是老大了。不管怎么说，如果你不赶快把他们放出来，他们都要变成水鬼了。"
G["Yeah, we'll see who's got Garrosh's back when it counts."]="是啊，我倒要看看，到时谁还会支持他。"
G["Yeah, what do you want?  Can't you see I'm busy here?  The Shadow Council isn't paying me by the hour!"]="嗯，你想要什么？你没看到我正忙着吗？暗影议会可不会按小时给我付工钱。"
G["Yeah, yeah!  Shut yer trap and let me finish this stew!"]="好啦！闭上你的嘴，让我们做好这道菜！"
G["Yeah, yeah, I'll come join you on your adventure. Just let me play one more game first."]="好好，我这就跟你走。但让我再玩一盘。"
G["Yeah, yeah, I'm feeling better, but I kind of like it down here."]="嗯，嗯，我感觉好点了，但我其实有点喜欢这里……"
G["Yeah, yeah, you won. Big deal."]="是的，是的，你赢了。真了不起。"
G["Yeah, yeah."]="嗯，嗯。"
G["Yeah, yeah. Just read the discs and gimme access already..."]="好了，好了。快读取这圆盘，给我访问权限……"
G["Yeah, yeah. When aren't we behind schedule?"]="是啊，是啊。我们什么时候没有耽误过进度？"
G["Yeah, yeah... welcome to my station.\n\nSo, what do you think?  Pretty nifty what we've done here, wouldn't you say?\n\nMakes me glad to be rid of those stuffy elves at Sylvanaar anyway.\n\nMake yourself useful around here; there're plenty of experiments and whatnot to help out with."]="Sí, sí... $gbienvenido:bienvenida; a mi estación.\n\nEntonces, ¿qué te parece? Es bastante ingenioso lo que hemos hecho aquí, ¿no crees?\n\nMe alegro de haberme librado de esos elfos estirados de Sylvanaar, de cualquier modo.\n\nBusca algo útil que hacer por aquí; hay muchos experimentos y todas esas cosas con las que ayudar."
G["Yeah, you better run!"]="是的，你小子最好快点逃跑！"
G["Yeah, you hold that carrot. That's right."]="耶，你拿起那根胡萝卜。对。"
G["Yeah, you know a few things! If you wanna' learn more you're gonna' have to talk to Georgio Bolero in Stormwind."]="是的，你知道一些事情！如果你想学会更多的话就必须与暴风城的乔吉奥·波利罗谈谈。"
G["Yeah, you should all be more like me."]="对，你们都该跟我学学。"
G["Yeah, you'll always find Clyde Kellen fishing on the bank of Brightwater Lake just east of Brill.  Just watch out for psychos wearing masks while you're out there.  We had to shut down the kids' summer camp last year."]="是的，你总是能看到克莱德·凯林在布瑞尔东边的澈水湖岸钓鱼。但当你到那里后要当心那些带着面具的变态者。我们去年就被迫关掉了孩子们的夏令营。"
G["Yeah, you're a real brainiac.  Just how smart do you think you are, Slip'kik?"]="是，你真是个笨蛋。斯里基克，你认为自己有多聪明？"
G["Yeah, you're next. Unless someone cuts in front of you, that is."]="¡Tú eres $gel:la; siguiente! A no ser que se te cuele alguien, claro está."
G["Yeah.  We could use some more of you.  Report to the civilian liaison for work assignment."]="不错，我们需要你这样的人手。向平民联络官报到吧，他会为你分配工作。"
G["Yeah. I hope to retire next month to a little tract of land I bought off the coast of Azeroth."]="是啊，我希望下个月就能退休。我在艾泽拉斯海岸边买下了一块地皮，希望能去那里安度晚年。"
G["Yeah. I taught $n everything $g he : she; knows."]="Sí. Yo le he enseñado a $n todo lo que sabe."
G["Yeah. This is pretty horrible."]="是啊。这太可怕了。"
G["Yeah..."]="是……"
G["Yeah... The Fearless... sounds good."]="很好……无畏者……听起来不错。"
G["Yeah... no."]="嗯……别来找我的麻烦。"
G["Yeah... pretty funny-lookin' alright."]="是啊……真的很滑稽。"
G["Yeah?"]="嗯？"
G["Yeah?  What's the matter?"]="嗯？怎么了？"
G["Yeah? Of course I'm a smith. What, you think Dwarves are the only ones worth their weight in anvils? Fine, be that way. Go get a dwarf to help you!"]="什么？我当然是一个铁匠。什么，你认为矮人是打铁最有效率的种族？好吧，可能是那样。去找一个矮人来帮你！"
G["Yeah? Well, at least the Saldeans didn't flee Westfall when things got tough."]="是吗？好吧，至少萨丁没有在局势艰难时逃离西部荒野。"
G["Yeah? Whadya want, ya mook? Be on the lookout for that no-good $n!\n\nNow get back to work!"]="¿Sí?¿Qué es lo que quieres, $gpringado:pringada;? ¡Sube a la atalaya en busca de $gese maldito:esa maldita; $n!\n\n¡Ahora vuelve al trabajo!"
G["Yeah? Whadya want?"]="什么？你想要什么？"
G["Yeah? What do you want?"]="嗯？你想要什么？"
G["Yeah? What's up?"]="嗯？怎么回事？"
G["Yeah? Whatdya want?"]="什么？你想要什么？"
G["Yeah? Ye interrupted me, so ye better have a blasted good reason to do so."]="什么？你打扰我了，你最好赶快找到一个说得过去的理由。"
G["Yeah? Yous don't look like you got the moolah to buy anything from me.\n\n<Missa pops her bubblegum.>\n\nMaybe yous forgot to go to the bank?"]="什么？你看上去没有足够的钱能买我的东西。\n\n<米萨用嘴里的泡泡糖吹了个泡泡。>\n\n也许你忘记去银行了？"
G["Years ago, I helped put the Horde together on these very sands. My... how times have changed."]="很多年以前，我帮忙在这片沙漠上建起了部落。唉……时代真的不同了。"
G["Years ago, I was trapped here while trying to study the wind riders. But once I made my way to freedom, I resolved to return and protect them.\n\nNow the Cataclysm has struck and the Twilight's Hammer is capturing all of these sacred creatures, or worse, destroying them."]="数年以前，当我打算去研究双足飞龙的时候，却被困在了这里。一旦我恢复了自由，我就决心回去保护它们。\n\n现在，大灾变席卷了整个世界，暮光之锤开始大肆捕捉这些珍贵的野兽，甚至不惜对它们造成毁灭性的打击。"
G["Years ago, as he sat on this opulent seat of power, he was visited by his most trusted prophet: Zul."]="多年前，他就在这个辉煌的宝座上，接见了黑暗先知：祖尔。"
G["Years ago, the Grimtotem raided my village. The pain, the anger, the loss - still they weigh on my heart.\n\nAnd now I find myself giving comfort and aid to others who have lost their village to a savage attack."]="几年以前，恐怖图腾袭击了我的村庄。直至今日，痛苦、愤怒和失落仍然沉重地压在我的心上。\n\n现在，我自己却在安慰和帮助其他失去了自己村庄的人。"
G["Years ago, when King Magni approached me about these festivities  I assured him that we gnomes could make Brewfest an event to remember.  But Magni, knew that we gnomes had other tasks that we should focus on.  He wanted to keep it simple and honor the past."]="许多年前，当麦格尼国王陛下把这些节日的准备工作交给我的时候，我向他保证，我们侏儒会将美酒节办成一场令人难忘的盛会。但麦格尼明白我们侏儒还有许多工作要做。所以他希望这个节日能够办得朴素庄重，以纪念往昔。"
G["Years back, my father and several other frostborn were returning from a trek across Dragonblight. There was a heavy blizzard... far worse than we've ever seen since."]="很多年前，我的父亲和一些霜脉矮人行走在穿越龙骨荒野的艰难归程中。他们遇到了暴风雪……比我们见过的任何一场暴风雪都厉害。"
G["Years of my research have led me here.\n\nI'm not about to turn back now..."]="多年的研究把我带到了这里。\n\n我现在还不想回头……"
G["Years of quality breeding techniques and plenty of care allow me the privilege of showing you these horses!  Please, take your time as you consider them for your mount.  A horse is a companion for the ages, friend.  Don't sell yourself short - get your steed here today!"]="¡Mis años de experiencia como criador y todos mis cuidados me otorgan el privilegio de mostrarte estos caballos! Por favor, tómate tu tiempo para examinarlos. Un caballo te acompañará durante años, $gamigo:amiga;. ¡Hazte valer y adquiere hoy mismo tu montura!"
G["Years... wasted..."]="心血……付诸一旦……"
G["Yech! What are these things?!"]="呀！这些是什么？！"
G["Yechhh... what a mess. Can we get a priest or something over here?!"]="呃……真是一团糟。找个牧师之类的来好吗？！"
G["Yeee hawww! Mulverick's fleet is ready to rock. All able bodied Horde soldiers need request a beacon and try their damndest to plant it so that my War Riders can home in for the aerial assault."]="啊哈！穆维里克的舰队准备好啦。所有体格健壮的部落士兵都需要一个灯塔，我们必须要尽最大努力建造一个，以便进行准确的空中袭击。"
G["Yeeeaaaahhh!"]="耶！！！！"
G["Yeeee-haw, we drove them back!! That's right, monkeys, run your little tails off!"]="呀——哈，我们击退了他们！这就对了，猴子们，夹着你们的小尾巴逃跑吧！"
G["Yeehaw! Let's do this!"]="耶！来吧！"
