G["Yep, destroy the four elementals, then the door will open. I'm sure of it. Just watch out for the Troggs. Nasty tempered, filthy creatures, even if they have not succumbed to the Curse of Flesh."]="是的，只要毁了四种元素，门就会打开。我确定。不过要小心那些穴居人。那些脾气乖戾、又臭又脏的生物——尽管他们还没屈服于血肉诅咒。"
