G["Yes I know, Go'el.  Thrall is the leader of the Horde, but you are not here in that capacity.  Look at you: At what you are wearing..."]="嗯，我知道，古伊尔。萨尔是部落的领袖，可你并非以那样的身份来到这里。看看你自己——看看你这身打扮……"
