G["Yes ma'am, business is brisk!"]="是啊是啊，生意很忙！"
G["Yes master, anything you say."]="遵命，主人，听从您的任何吩咐。"
G["Yes master."]="遵命，师父。"
G["Yes my $g son : daughter;? What can I assist you with?"]="怎么了，$g小伙子:姑娘;？我能帮你什么忙吗？"
G["Yes right away momma!"]="马上，妈妈！"
G["Yes sir!"]="遵命！"
G["Yes sir!  I will not fail the Fel Horde!"]="遵命！我不会辜负邪部落的！"
G["Yes sir."]="是的长官。"
G["Yes sir?"]="殿下？"
G["Yes yes yes! So close! Just a pinch of...oops..."]="没错！好的，好的！快成功了！只要一点……噢……"
G["Yes you may, Okla. But do not stray too far from home."]="当然，奥克拉。但是不要离家太远了。"
G["Yes!"]="哈哈！"
G["Yes!  A song about the lore and all the lessons we can learn from it all.  Sounds exciting, doesn't it?\n\nBut... we're still working on it.  Chadrik seems easily distracted lately.  Is there something on my tabard?"]="是的！一首关于传说，以及我们从中所得到的知识的歌谣。听起来很激动人心吧？\n\n不过……我们还在研究。查德里克最近似乎一直在分心。我的战袍上有什么脏东西吗？"
G["Yes!  Hold your feet firm!  Lend aid to your cohorts and together our banded strength will overcome these demons!  Cling fiercely to hope and grip tightly your weapons, and trust that the Light will pierce this darkness and shine through to morrow's dawn!"]="是的！守住！与你的军团并肩作战吧，只要我们同心协力，就能战胜这些恶魔！绝不放弃希望，握紧你的武器战斗吧！相信圣光能穿透这黑暗，明日拂晓的曙光将照耀我们的世界！"
G["Yes!  I mean no!  I mean... which answer gets me out of here?"]="是！我是说，不是！嗯……哪个答案可以让你同意把我放出来？"
G["Yes!  I'm cured!  I'm cure... whoa, got up too fast!"]="啊哈！我痊愈了！我痊愈了……啊，起身太快了！"
G["Yes!  Rook Stonetoe!  You remember me!  What has happened to you?"]="没错！鲁克·石趾！你还记得我！你怎么了？"
G["Yes! Break it! Free me from this amber sleep!"]="是的！把它打破！将我从琥珀的沉眠中释放出来！"
G["Yes! Consume him! Meat and bone!"]="是的！吃了他！连皮带骨吞下去！"
G["Yes! Dire Maul! Let go...so cold..."]="对！厄运之槌！快放开……好冷……"
G["Yes! Feed, my precious one! You are mine now!"]="对！吃吧，宝贝！你是我的了！"
G["Yes! Feel the might of the booterang!"]="对！感受一下训诫靴的力量吧！"
G["Yes! Feel the power within you. Fight your fears. Conquer your hatred!"]="是的！感受这力量吧。战胜恐惧。征服仇恨！"
G["Yes! Grok'thar More'gar. Bok choy, friend. Um. Zub zub!"]="¡Sí! Grok'thar More'gar. Bok choy, $gamigo:amiga;. Eh. ¡Zub zub!"
G["Yes! Harness... your... hatred."]="是的！驾驭……你的……仇恨。"
G["Yes! I want more of that fabulous Noggenfogger Elixir!"]="嗯！我还想买一些诺格弗格药剂！"
G["Yes! Now I am ready for battle."]="是的！我做好战斗的准备了。"
G["Yes! Our friend here brought me back!"]="¡Sí! ¡$gEste amigo nuestro:Esta amiga nuestra; me ha traído de vuelta!"
G["Yes! Please let us pass!"]="是的！请让我们过去！"
G["Yes! Run while you still can!"]="跑吧！趁着你们还能跑，赶快跑吧！"
G["Yes! Smash the pitiful naga statue."]="对！打碎那尊恶心的纳迦雕像。"
G["Yes! Stab few more time just in case! Stab good!"]="对！多捅几下，以防万一！捅得好！捅得好！"
G["Yes! The power to shape flesh, to build warriors.  This is what the Warchief wants!"]="没错！能制造战士的血肉塑形之力。这……正合酋长之意！"
G["Yes! This weapon is perfect."]="是的！这把武器很完美。"
G["Yes! Those hozen won't know what hit them."]="是的！那些猢狲肯定到死都搞不清是什么攻击了他们。"
G["Yes! Together, we'll work until we join the Tiller's Union!"]="好！我们一起努力，一定能加入阡陌客！"
G["Yes! Use the mana shield!"]="对！使用法力护盾！"
G["Yes! When was the last time you saw a doomguard take a bath?"]="是啊！你上次看到末日守卫洗澡是什么时候？"
G["Yes! YES! More souls for the master!"]="对！就是这样！更多的灵魂！"
G["Yes! YES! Show them no mercy! Give no pause to your attacks!"]="对！没错！不要手下留情！不要停止攻击！"
G["Yes! Yes! More blood!"]="对！对！更多的血！"
G["Yes! Yes! Yes!"]="对！对！就这样！"
G["Yes! more! I shall soon be unleashed!"]="对！再多点！我马上就可以获得解脱了！"
