G["Yes, $c? What is it?"]="$c？这是什么？"
G["Yes, $g king : queen;?"]="嗯，$g国王:女王;陛下？"
G["Yes, $g sir: ma'am;!  We've been biding our time in Gilneas for far too long.  We're ready for blood!"]="是的，$g 阁下: 女士;！我们已经在吉尔尼斯蓄势已久。我们渴望鲜血！"
G["Yes, $g sir: ma'am;.  We attack from the north at your signal.  The Brashtide will wash over Booty Bay!  Aroooo!!!!"]="是，$g阁下:女士;。我们根据您的信号指示从北面发起攻击。 “急浪船帮”将荡涤藏宝海湾！喔啰！！！"
G["Yes, $n. The elements are stirring. Soon, we will unleash their might upon our enemies. They shall reel from the blows!"]="是的，$n。元素很活跃。很快，我们就会将他们的能量释放到我们的敌人身上。他们会被彻底击垮的！"
G["Yes, $n?"]="什么事，$n？"
G["Yes, $r?"]="怎么了，$r？"
G["Yes, $t citizen : citizen;, what matter of import do you have to bring to my attention?"]="Sí, $tciudadano:ciudadana;, ¿qué asunto importante puede precisar mi atención?"
G["Yes, Admiral."]="遵命，上将。"
G["Yes, Anachronos. I am ready to witness your vision of the future."]="是的，阿纳克洛斯。我准备好见证你所预见的未来了。"
G["Yes, Augustus.  I would like to do business."]="是的，奥古斯图斯。我想做生意。"
G["Yes, Battlemaiden?"]="怎么，女武士？"
G["Yes, Bishop."]="是，主教大人。"
G["Yes, Blackhorn. I've been sent to request your aid, if you are willing."]="是的，黑角。我奉命前来请求你的帮助——如果你愿意伸出援手。"
G["Yes, Bonescythe. You see, it was our tenor, an ornery fellow known as Don Julio, who got me started on the whole thing. In his travels throughout Lordaeron, Don Julio picked up many interesting skills, one of them being the ability to take the bones of fallen Scourge and fashion them into a lethal set of leather armor - perfectly suited for an assassin."]="是的，骨镰。你要知道，我们的组合里有个男高音，一个很傻的家伙，名字好象是叫唐·胡里奥的，是他教给我全部的东西。他曾在洛丹伦各地旅行，一路上学习了许多非常有意思的技巧。其中之一就是将天灾士兵身上的骸骨改制为一套又轻又舒适的皮甲，特别适合刺客使用。"
G["Yes, Commander Mai sent me, and I carry his evacuation orders."]="是的，指挥官麦龙派我来的，我带来了他的紧急疏散令。"
G["Yes, Doctor Grapplehammer."]="是，钩锤博士。"
G["Yes, Fathom-Caller. The Mistress awaits."]="是的，深渊召唤者。女王在等待。"
G["Yes, Hamuul. And she's more dangerous than you know."]="是的，哈缪尔。她比你想象的更危险。"
G["Yes, Hao - our home is on Shen-zin Su's back."]="是的，昊——我们的家就在神真子的背上。"
G["Yes, Hargus. I wish to purchase supplies."]="是啊。我想购买一些补给品。"
G["Yes, I am one of the 'Broken'.  I trust that this does not bother you?  Broken or draenei, we must endure the ridicule that some in our society may throw at us.  A better understanding and communication with the elements of this world is all that matters."]="对，我是一个破碎者。我相信这并不会让你觉得不安吧。破碎者或者德莱尼人，我们必须忍受可能遭受的嘲笑。和这个世界上的元素们更好地理解和沟通，这才是最要紧的事。"
G["Yes, I am ready to travel to Venture Bay!"]="是的，我已经准备好前往风险湾了！"
G["Yes, I am. What's it to you?"]="是的，我是阿斯托·哈德恩。你是？"
G["Yes, I do, though it was easier when I was younger.  These days, I have to be more careful."]="嗯，是的，不过在我年轻时更容易些。这些日子我得加倍小心才行。"
G["Yes, I expected that you would be back. I sent Korra out earlier and she came across Dartol's Rod, abandoned in the forest.\n\nWe worked so hard to recover it, $n. Please take care to see that you do not handle it so carelessly in the future."]="是的，我曾盼望你能回来。早些时候，我派科兰出去，她发现了达图尔的魔棒被遗弃在森林里。\n\n我们竭力想要找回它，$n。请你小心以后不要掉了它。"
G["Yes, I feel much better.\n\nMishka and Bold Karasshi have brought me up to speed. Your arrival, your search for the White Pawn, my rescue from the hozen.\n\nThe situation is not ideal, and we have much work to do. Finding Anduin is our top priority."]="是的，我感觉好多了。\n\n米希卡和勇敢的卡拉什向我汇报了最近的情况：你的到来，你搜寻白卒的过程，以及将我从猢狲手中营救回来的事迹。\n\n目前的情形不容乐观，我们还有很多工作要做。我们当前的首要任务是找到安度因王子。"
G["Yes, I have seen the shaman you seek. Last I saw her, she was to the west of here. She hides in the hills above the Razormane tribe. If you're clever, you'll be able to find a path to her hut in the hills. It is not too far north of here. That path should allow you to find her without fighting through the quilboar."]="Sí, he visto al chamán que buscas. La última vez que la; vi se encontraba en el este. Se oculta en las colinas que hay junto al poblado de los Crines de Acero. Si eres $glisto:lista;, encontrarás un camino que lleva a su cabaña en las colinas. Está al norte, no muy lejos de aquí. El camino deberá ayudarte a encontrarla sin tener que luchar contra los jabaespines."
G["Yes, I have. Teach me."]="当然，我有。教给我吧。"
G["Yes, I know of an inscription trainer in the Seat of Knowledge, in the Vale of Eternal Blossoms.\n\nLet me mark their location on your map."]="是的，我知道在锦绣谷的闻道之座有位铭文训练师。\n\n让我在你的地图上标出位置。"
G["Yes, I know you lost your egg.\n\nHow do I know this? Because I have your egg RIGHT HERE.\n\nI will entrust this egg to you once more, but please, I deplore you, take better care of it this time."]="是的，我知道你的蛋丢了。\n\n你问我怎么知道的？因为你的蛋就在我手上呢。\n\n我会把这个蛋再次交给你。但是拜托，我跟你说，这回麻烦你认真仔细地把这个蛋照顾好。"
G["Yes, I know.  And don't think I'll go easy on you."]="是的，我知道。而且我不认为我会对你手下留情。"
G["Yes, I leave for Nagrand to learn from the elements there.  They have suffered and seen many of these same symptoms."]="是的，我将动身前往纳格兰，去了解那里的元素。它们也遭受着痛苦，并且见到了许多像这样的征兆。"
G["Yes, I live! No Twilight Dragon can keep this orc down."]="是的，我还活着！没有暮光龙能击败我。"
G["Yes, I must go on."]="嗯，继续！"
G["Yes, I offer training. But it's not cheap."]="嗯，我可以训练你，但费用并不便宜。"
G["Yes, I overheard someone talking about Twilight's Hammer at the party last night. I didn't see them, but they were extremely rude."]="没错，昨晚的聚会上，我就听到有人在谈暮光之锤的事。我没有看见说话的人是谁，不过他们的口气极为粗鲁。"
G["Yes, I see.  We can finally turn Deathwing's own power back against him."]="是的，我明白了。我们将使用死亡之翼的力量去对付他自己。"
G["Yes, I smell them too, Riplimb. Outsiders encroach on the Firelord's private grounds. Find their trail. Find them for me, that I may dispense punishment!"]="对，裂肢，我也闻到他们了。外来者侵入了炎魔之王的领地。跟着足迹，把他们揪出来。我会让他们受罚！"
G["Yes, I speak a language you understand $r.  We are not animals, yet most of your kind continues to treat us as such!  Our differences though pale to the tragedy that has befallen this land.  Please, put aside your differences with my kind and hear my dying plea.\n\nI came to this land to mend what I could, and now that will be for naught unless you can aid me.  I ask for such aid with my last breaths of life."]="是的，我讲的语言你听得懂$r。我们不是动物，然而你们中大多数却仍然把我们像动物一样对待！可是我们的分歧比起降临到这片土地上的悲剧来显得微不足道。恳请你们把与我们存在的分歧搁置一边，倾听一下我临死前的请求。\n\n我来到这片土地尽我所能改善状况，而现在除非你能帮我，否则那即将要化为泡影。我用我生命的最后一息请你帮这个忙。"
G["Yes, I think I remember now...."]="是的，我想我现在记起来了……"
G["Yes, I think you have potential. Maybe I can show you a thing or two."]="是的，我认为你有潜力。或许我可以给你看看一两样东西？"
G["Yes, I was able to reseal the relic, $n."]="是的，我能重新给遗物盖上封印，$n。"
G["Yes, I will deliver the orders to Warmaster Garrick!"]="是的，我会将这些订单交给霜狼突击队队长的！"
G["Yes, I'd like to purchase a ride down to the Ghostlands."]="是的，我要飞去幽魂之地。"
G["Yes, I'd love a ride to Blackwind Landing."]="是，我愿意乘坐虚空鳐飞往黑风码头。"
G["Yes, I'm glad I could get to you before the plague."]="是的，我很高兴能在灾难大爆发之前找到你。"
G["Yes, I'm ready. Let's do this thing!"]="是的，我准备好了。让我们开始吧！"
G["Yes, I'm sure.  I want to exchange my Deathwing Brood Cloak for an Apexis Crystal."]="是的，我确定。我想用这件死亡之翼血脉披风换取一块埃匹希斯水晶。"
G["Yes, I've been running this shop for some time now. Business has been pretty good lately. A lot of new adventurers coming through..."]="是的，我现在已经经营这家店一段时间了。最近生意非常好。许多新的探险者来了……"
G["Yes, Ishi. You have."]="是的，伊什。的确如此。"
G["Yes, Jin'do."]="是，金度。"
G["Yes, Klaxxi'va. How long I have waited to hear the Council's command!"]="是，卡拉克西瓦。长久以来，我一直在苦等议会的命令！"
G["Yes, Klaxxi'va. What does the Council command? Skeer hears. Skeer obeys."]="是，卡拉克西瓦。议会下达了什么命令？斯基尔倾听。斯基尔服从。"
G["Yes, Li Li, but the bottom of this mug is very interesting to me."]="是啊，丽丽，但是这杯底的啤酒确实非常吸引我。"
G["Yes, Light of Lights! My life is yours!"]="是的，光中之光！我的生命属于您！"
G["Yes, Lord Mayor."]="遵命，大人。"
G["Yes, M-mistress..."]="遵命，尊贵的小……小姐……"
G["Yes, Ma'am!"]="是，长官！"
G["Yes, Malorne was consort to the moon goddess herself, the one the night elves call \"Elune.\" From their union was born Cenarius, the patron god of all druids and one of the most powerful creatures ever to walk upon Azeroth.\n\nBut listen to me, I ramble on.\n\nMalorne is an incredible force of nature, but he only interacts with the mortal races in times of dire trouble. Have you heard about his deeds during the War of the Ancients?"]="Sí, Malorne era el consorte de la mismísima diosa de la luna, aquella que los elfos de la noche llaman \"Elune\". De su unión nació Cenarius, el dios patrón de todos los druidas y una de las criaturas más poderosas que hayan pisado Azeroth.\n\nHay que ver, pero si estoy divagando.\n\nMalorne es una fuerza de la naturaleza increíble, pero solo interactúa con las razas mortales en las situaciones más desesperadas. ¿Has oído hablar de sus hazañas durante la Guerra de los Ancestros?"
G["Yes, No, Maybe so."]="可能也许大概是。"
G["Yes, Scryer.  You may possess me."]="当然。你可以控制我。"
G["Yes, Sergeant Morigan."]="是，摩利根中士。"
G["Yes, Thisalee. Gather our forces. We leave for the Molten Front at once."]="是的，希萨莉。把我们的人召集起来。我们立刻开赴熔火前线。"
G["Yes, Thrall. The time has come to kill Arthas. You can take my grand apothecary with you. His knowledge will be invaluable against whatever the Scourge will throw at you."]="是的，萨尔。时机已经成熟，我们要杀死阿尔萨斯。带上我的大药剂师同行吧。他的知识能帮助你解决天灾军团的麻烦。"
G["Yes, Torta. Whatever your heart desires..."]="好吧，托尔塔。你要什么我就给你找什么……"
G["Yes, Warchief?"]="酋长，有何吩咐？"
G["Yes, Warlord. The traps are set. The Divine Bell will be safe within this crypt, ready for the day that the Thunder King returns."]="是的，大人。陷阱已经设下。圣钟将安全地留在墓穴里，等待雷电之王的归来。"
G["Yes, YES! Bring your rage to bear! Try to strike me down!"]="好……很好！释放你的怒火吧！试着打倒我吧！"
G["Yes, Yer Majesty!"]="遵命，陛下！"
G["Yes, Zen'Kiki.  Let's go run some combat practice."]="是，赞吉吉。让我们去操练下战斗技巧。"
G["Yes, Zhanaa, it's me!  Your signal is weak."]="是的，沙娜安，是我！你的信号很弱。"
G["Yes, Zixil will be a household name! I'll corner the market!"]="没错，吉克希尔会变成一个家喻户晓的名字！我会垄断市场！"
G["Yes, a few of them. The biggest one, Han, last went out to fight at Kor'vess.\n\nHaven't seen him in a few days, actually. I hope everything's alright..."]="是的，见过一些。其中最壮硕的那个名叫韩，他最后一个出发加入了库尔维斯的战斗。\n\n事实上，我已经好几天没见着他了。希望一切顺利……"
G["Yes, a map of the coastal approaches."]="是的，一张绘有海岸地形的地图。"
G["Yes, a way. Destroy Cyrukh. Destroy an elemental lord."]="是的，有一个方法：消灭森卢肯。消灭这位元素之王。"
G["Yes, and the tigers."]="对，还有猛虎。"
G["Yes, and we all wish that you'd stayed back at the keep."]="对，我们都希望你能在要塞里安静地呆着。"
G["Yes, and with your help, we will pry the secrets from this land. For the glory of the Horde!"]="没错，有了你们的帮助，我们将解开这片土地的秘密。为了部落的荣耀！"
G["Yes, beat him mercilessly! His skull is as thick as an ogre's!"]="对！不要留情！"
G["Yes, but I hoped I would never have to answer that."]="是的。但是我宁愿不用回答这个问题。"
G["Yes, but be quick with your browsing."]="是的，但是请你动作快点。"
G["Yes, but if anyone asks... It wasn't me who told you."]="是的。但是如果别人问起来……别说是我告诉你的。"
G["Yes, but not in the way you imagine."]="是的，但并非你所想的那样。"
G["Yes, but we will follow him to the end. Its our duty to hold this sanctuary while he prepares."]="是的，不过我们还将始终追随着他。我们的职责就是在他进行准备的时候守护这里。"
G["Yes, but you'll find it more rewarding if you have skill in herbalism!  You will be required to nurture and cultivate special seeds -- not to swing an axe blindly or gesticulate wildly at passing shadows.  While the Evergreen Pouch you'll receive allows even the simplest brute to grow something, those who show some aptitude will have more bountiful results."]="没错，但是如果你精通草药学的话，你会发现它非常有用！你要做的是用特别的种子来细心培育药草——而不是一遇到风吹草动就挥斧乱砍。虽然你即将得到的常青袋能让最没有经验的新手轻松进行种植工作，但那些对草药学有天资的冒险者将会得到更丰硕的成果。"
G["Yes, but you'll find it more rewarding if you have skill in herbalism!  You'll be nurturing and cultivating special seeds.  While the Evergreen Pouch you'll receive allows even a novice to grow something, those who show some aptitude in herbalism will have more bountiful results."]="没错，但是如果你精通草药学的话，你会发现它更有用！你可以培育出特别的草药来。虽然常青袋是个连新手都能轻松使用的工具，但那些对草药学有天资的冒险者将会得到更丰硕的报酬。"
G["Yes, come closer, little one. My scalpel thirsts for your blood!"]="Sí, acércate, $gpequeño:pequeña;. Mi escalpelo tiene sed de sangre."
G["Yes, come. My master and I shall be waiting."]="过来吧，我和主人都在等你。"
G["Yes, commander!"]="遵命，长官！"
G["Yes, cousin. But... the village."]="还好，表弟。可是……村庄。"
G["Yes, cowardly quest giver, sit atop your pale horse while Orkus brings glory to the Horde! I shall return with a thousand skulls!"]="Sí, $gasignador:asignadora; de misiones, quédate sobre tu caballo bayo mientras Orkus aporta gloria a la Horda. ¡Volveré con un millar de cráneos!"
G["Yes, darling. You realize you'll be eating dire ram mutton for dinner until the crops are planted..."]="你说得对，亲爱的。不过在庄稼成熟之前，咱们还不得靠羊肉维持生计……"
G["Yes, definitely an idea."]="是的，绝对是个好主意。"
G["Yes, do it! Create your monstrous new weapon. It too will serve me when your soul is mine."]="没错！打造你的恐怖武器吧。它将随着你的灵魂一同为我效命。"
G["Yes, elder. Tell me more of the book."]="是的，长者。告诉我关于乌鸦之书的故事吧。"
G["Yes, father. I encountered sha energy in my travels. At its full power it is terrible to behold."]="是的，父亲。我在旅途中也遇到过煞魔。不受约束的煞魔是令人惧怕的对手。"
G["Yes, finally! Time for some action."]="好，终于盼到了！准备采取行动。"
G["Yes, fleeting life is, rak-a-kak!"]="对，生命是短暂的，嘎嘎呱！"
G["Yes, fleshling?"]="什么事，凡人？"
G["Yes, friends. This man was no wizard of Dalaran. His clothes looked quite foreign, and his accent was unfamiliar. All he could mumble about was time this, time that. You'll have to find that wizard and convince him to release me."]="是的，朋友们。这个人不是达拉然的巫师。他的衣服看上去是外来的，还有他的口音我也不是很熟悉。他不停地说着什么时间这个、时间那个之类的话。你得找到那个巫师，让他来释放我。"
G["Yes, good! Move those furry feets!"]="是啊，好主意！让你那毛茸茸的脚动起来吧！"
G["Yes, he certainly looks... healthy."]="是的，他看起来确实……健康。"
G["Yes, he's the second-in-command of the wyrmcult at the Blackwing Coven to the west."]="嗯，他是拜龙教的人，西边黑翼集会所的副指挥。"
G["Yes, hero?"]="¿Sí, $ghéroe:heroína;?"
G["Yes, instructor."]="是，教官。"
G["Yes, it did. Try to be more careful.\n\nWe wouldn't want to lose the king's axe!"]="Sí, así es. Intenta tener más cuidado con ella.\n\n¡No queremos perder el hacha del Rey!"
G["Yes, it is true! This IS Kypari Zar!"]="对，是真的！这是凯帕圣树·扎尔！"
G["Yes, it may... but not today.  With the Scourge out of the way, I plan to pull my troops back and regroup."]="嗯，可能会……但不是今天。既然已扫除了天灾军团的威胁，我准备重新集结我的军队。"
G["Yes, it will drive them to read books!"]="是的，这会让他们发奋读书！"
G["Yes, it will rain.  That's not what you asked?  Too bad!"]="是的，今天会下雨。什么？你没有问这个问题？太遗憾了。"
G["Yes, it's true! Thanks to $n, the Kunzen's leader is dead. Those monkeys shouldn't bother Mr. Mudclaw any more."]="是真的！多亏了$n，昆森部族的头领已死。那群猴子应该再也不会骚扰泥爪先生了。"
G["Yes, just like that!"]="是的，就这样！"
G["Yes, knowledge uncovered for the benefit of the world."]="发现了令全世界受益的知识。"
G["Yes, let us leave... but not before we leave our Alliance hosts something to remember us by!"]="好了，我们走吧……但别忘记给联盟留下点终身难忘的东西！"
G["Yes, let us settle this.  Before we begin, however, there's somebody I'd like you to meet."]="好吧，让我们结束这一切吧。不管怎样，在我们开始之前，我想让你见一个人。"
G["Yes, let's all run around like chickens with their heads cut off."]="好啊，让大家像无头苍蝇一样东奔西跑吧。"
G["Yes, let's charge that Trillium!"]="是的，我们来给延极矿充能吧！"
G["Yes, lieutenant?  Report."]="什么事，中尉？报告吧。"
G["Yes, like Chen and Li Li! They're out, exploring the world. Maybe someday you will, too."]="是的，就像陈和丽丽！他们出去探索世界了。也许有一天，你们也会。"
G["Yes, little children?"]="你好啊，孩子。"
G["Yes, little one?"]="¿Sí, $gpequeño:pequeña;?"
G["Yes, look out behind you, $n!"]="是的，小心背后，$n！"
G["Yes, lord.  I will, lord."]="遵命，大人。"
G["Yes, ma'am!"]="是，夫人！"
G["Yes, master! I will fight with my life!"]="遵命，主人！我将血战到底！"
G["Yes, master."]="遵命，主人。"
G["Yes, master. The time of their ultimate demise draws close.... What is this?"]="是的，主人，他们的最终末日马上即将降临了……这是什么?"
G["Yes, mistress."]="是，女主人。"
G["Yes, mortal?"]="你好，凡人。"
G["Yes, mortals, your Thrall is here. He has fused with the stone of this place - heart and soul."]="是的，凡人，你们的萨尔就在这里。他的心和灵魂都已经和石头融合了。"
G["Yes, mother."]="是的，母亲。"
G["Yes, my $g son : daughter;?"]="¿Sí, $g hijo mío : hija mía;?"
G["Yes, my Prince. We are ready."]="遵命，王子殿下。我们准备好了。"
G["Yes, my brethren!  We are claiming this prisoner for the True Sons of the Twilight!  These ogre scum are not fit to offer him as sacrifice!  They are not worthy of the Old Gods' grace!"]="是的，同胞！我们为真正的暮光之子带走这名囚犯！这些食人魔渣滓不配拿他来献祭！他们不够资格获得上古之神的眷顾！"
G["Yes, my child?"]="¿Sí, $ghijo mío:hija mía;?"
G["Yes, my fellow initiates.  The friend of my enemy's enemy... well he is also the enemy of my friend.  And yes... he shall perish too!"]="是的，我的新兵小伙子们。我敌人的敌人的朋友……嗯他也是我朋友的敌人。啊对……他也得死！"
G["Yes, my king!"]="遵命！"
G["Yes, my little monsters! Go! Unleash yourselves upon our enemies!"]="对，我的小怪物们！去吧！肆意蹂躏我们的敌人！"
G["Yes, my lord!"]="遵命，陛下！"
G["Yes, my lord."]="遵命，主人。"
G["Yes, my precious, we will tear them apart! For the one true king!"]="嗨，宝贝儿，将他们统统撕碎！我们才是真正的王者！"
