G["Yes, now stop pestering me!"]="是啦是啦，别烦我啦！"
G["Yes, of course, but please be more careful in the future."]="当然可以，不过以后请小心一些。"
G["Yes, of course..."]="是的，当然……"
G["Yes, please continue."]="是的，请继续。"
G["Yes, please disable the devices."]="是的，请停用装置。"
G["Yes, please do."]="是的，就这样吧。"
G["Yes, please summon it back!"]="是的，请把它召唤回来！"
G["Yes, please!"]="嗯，求你啦！"
G["Yes, please, Chi-Ji."]="是的，赤精。"
G["Yes, please, I would like to return to the ground level of the temple."]="嗯，我想返回神殿底层。"
G["Yes, please, if you do not mind."]="请继续说下去，如果你不介意的话。"
G["Yes, rise up! Tell your fellow furbolg to break out of this cage and to slay the Horde. The power of the rod compels you!"]="是的，奋起反抗吧！带领你的熊怪打破牢笼，消灭部落。是那根魔杖的力量在压迫你们！"
G["Yes, run! It makes the blood pump faster!"]="对，跑吧！那样伤口出血就更多了！"
G["Yes, run! With every step your heart quickens. The beating, loud and thunderous... Almost deafening. You cannot escape!"]="对，跑吧！每跑一步你的心跳都会加快。这心跳声，洪亮如雷，震耳欲聋。你逃不掉的！"
G["Yes, sign me up for a fight!"]="是的，我要报名！"
G["Yes, sir!"]="是，长官！"
G["Yes, sir! Let's go Ut."]="是，长官！乌特，我们出发。"
G["Yes, sir! Thank you, sir!"]="是，长官！谢谢您，长官！"
G["Yes, sir."]="遵命。"
G["Yes, sir. An ogre, sir. But give us a chance, sir! We've been preparing for this since the first time the Skyguard flew over Ogri'la, sir!"]="是，长官。我是食人魔，但是请您给我们一个机会吧！自从我们第一次看见天空卫队在奥格瑞拉上空飞翔，就憧憬着这一刻的到来！"
G["Yes, sir. It won't happen again..."]="遵命，长官。不会再出错了……"
G["Yes, sir. Thank you, sir!"]="是，长官！谢谢你，长官！"
G["Yes, start the Challenge."]="是的，我要开始挑战。"
G["Yes, strange. This door was not here before."]="是啊，奇怪。上次这扇门可没关。"
G["Yes, stranger?"]="¿Sí, $gforastero:forastera;?"
G["Yes, stronger?"]="你好，强者。"
G["Yes, taunka. Retribution is a given right of all members of the Horde."]="当然。部落的所有成员都有复仇的权力。"
G["Yes, teacher."]="是的，老师。"
G["Yes, teleport me!"]="嗯，送我去吧！"
G["Yes, tell me more."]="是的，我还想知道更多。"
G["Yes, tell us!"]="是的，告诉我们！"
G["Yes, thanks to $n. Zhao-Jin, leader of the Shao-Tien, is slain!"]="是的，多亏了$n。韶天领袖兆金已经被杀死了！"
G["Yes, that is true. Paladins and priests alike train their skills and research great truths behind the walls of the Cathedral."]="没错，的确是这样的。圣骑士和牧师们就在大教堂里接受真知的洗礼。"
G["Yes, that was quite satisfying."]="啊，真令人满足。"
G["Yes, that's it.  These will do nicely."]="嗯，这些不错。"
G["Yes, that's it... stand right there..."]="对，没错……站在那儿……"
G["Yes, that's the stuff! Our cider is prized throughout the Jade Forest. I hope I can carry them all."]="对，就是那个！我们的果酒享誉翡翠林。真希望我能把它们都带在身上。"
G["Yes, the Lich King will fall to our might. We will have our final revenge.\n\nBut first, we will see to it that the plague known as the Scarlet Onslaught comes to an end once and for all!"]="我相信，巫妖王会败在我们手下。我们的复仇大业一定会取得成功。\n\n但首先，我们必须将血色先锋军这个祸端彻底解决掉！"
G["Yes, the ogres are so stupid that they forgot to lock my cage.  But that's exactly how I like it, so please don't open it again."]="是的，食人魔太愚蠢了，他们忘记锁我的笼子了。但是那正是我想要的，请不要再打开它了。"
G["Yes, the one with the eggs."]="是的，跟蛋有关的那个。"
G["Yes, the only logical outcome."]="啊，这是唯一符合逻辑的结果。"
G["Yes, then.  What is your trade?"]="很好。你的职业是？"
G["Yes, there is a fishing supplies vendor downstairs, on the first level of The Summer Terrace.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="是的，楼下就有渔具供应商，就在夏之台的一楼。\n\n我会在你的地图上标记这个位置。"
G["Yes, there is a fishing supplies vendor inside the hall of tranquility. Please be quiet so as to not ruin a catch!\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="是的，在静思之厅内有渔具供应商。动作要轻，以免吓跑大鱼！\n\n我会在你的地图上标记这个位置。"
G["Yes, there is a vendor of herbs in the city. Hafuna Landwalker can be found in the chamber of masters, to the left as you enter the building.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="是的，城市里有草药供应商。在师匠大厅内可以找到哈夫纳·地行者，就位于你进入建筑物时的左侧。\n\n我会在你的地图上标记这个位置。"
G["Yes, there is a vendor of herbs in the city. Tommy Tinkerspade can be found in the crafter's hall, to the left as you enter the building.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="是的，城市里有药材供应商。在工匠大厅内可以发现托米·补铲，就位于你进入建筑物时的左侧。\n\n我会在你的地图上标记这个位置。"
G["Yes, these will do quite nicely. They feel almost as if they were meant for me all along."]="很好，这些利刃无坚不摧。它们仿佛从始至终都是为我存在的。"
G["Yes, they are at fault, but I am powerless to stop them. Will you warn the people of Tunka'lo, stranger, that their past and their ancestors are in danger?"]="Sí, es culpa suya, pero no tengo poder para detenerlos. ¿Avisarás a la gente de Tunka'lo de que su pasado y sus ancestros están en peligro, $gforastero:forastera;?"
G["Yes, they're right here. Let's go."]="是的，就在这儿呢。走吧。"
G["Yes, this is the beginning. I've been waiting for you, young prince. I am Mal'Ganis."]="对，这只是个开始。年轻的王子，我等你很久了。我就是玛尔加尼斯。"
G["Yes, this is the spot."]="对，就是这里了。"
G["Yes, this is unfortunate."]="是的，这真不幸。"
G["Yes, this one should advance my studies nicely...."]="很好，这将使我的研究更进一步……"
G["Yes, this will definitely burn too hot.  Do you want to blow up the ship?  Cut back on remora oil next time."]="没错，这确实太热了。你想要把船炸了吗？下次少放点儿鮣魚油。"
G["Yes, traveler?"]="¿Sí, $gviajero:viajera;?"
G["Yes, unless I have anything to do with it."]="是。除非这事跟我有关系。"
G["Yes, warchief."]="当然，酋长。"
G["Yes, we can pay."]="是的，不会让你们白忙。"
G["Yes, we said you can stay here, but this building is our headquarters! All of our manuals and blueprints are stored here!"]="是，我们是说过你可以待在这儿，但是这间房子是我们的总部！所有的手册和蓝图都存放在里面！"
G["Yes, we shall ascend beyond the mere trappings of our mortal coil and attain the power that were promised to us by Sargeras so long ago."]="是啊，我们将会升华到一个新的高度，并得到萨格拉斯很久以前就承诺给我们的力量。"
G["Yes, we shall!"]="是的，我们会的！"
G["Yes, we will handle this our own way."]="是的，我们会用自己的方式解决此事。"
G["Yes, weakling... beg Lurid for life!"]="是的，渺小的弱者……向鲁瑞德求饶吧！"
G["Yes, well, listen here, $c. I'm older than I look and wise beyond my years. You'd do well not to question me so much.\nLook, you don't need to take my word for it. Read the postings on any local bulletin board for yourself. I'm everywhere!\n\nJust do yourself a favor and ignore the ones with 'WANTED' in the title. Simple misunderstandings, I assure you."]="Sí, bien, escucha $c. Soy mayor de lo que aparento y muy sabio para mi edad. Harías bien en no hacerme demasiadas preguntas.\n\nMira, no tienes que creerme. Lee lo publicado en cualquier tablón de anuncios. ¡Estoy en todas partes!\n\nPero hazte un favor e ignora esas en las que pone \"SE BUSCA\" en el título. Leves malentendidos, te lo aseguro."
G["Yes, well... it's not like Suna to run off by herself."]="是啊……孙娜不是会独自逃跑的人。"
G["Yes, well... luckily for us all, the troll will not be in a position of power within our fair city anytime soon."]="是啊，其实……对我们来说很幸运，巨魔无论何时都不会在我们美丽的城市里占据重要的位置。"
G["Yes, well...let's head on to the monument dedicated to the heroes of the two Great Wars, the Valley of Heroes. Follow me."]="好了……现在我们去英雄谷参观那儿的纪念碑，悼念在两次兽人战争中牺牲的英雄们。跟着我，孩子们。"
G["Yes, yes my son is quite powerful... but I have powers of my own!"]="没错，我的儿子非常强大……但我也有自己的力量！"
G["Yes, yes!"]="是的，是的！"
G["Yes, yes! I want more!"]="对，对！再多些！"
G["Yes, yes! Very interesting! Perhaps I could distill it into a new power source?"]="太棒了！嗯，非常有趣！也许我可以用它提炼出一种新能源？"
G["Yes, yes, I am given to understand that the ley line has already been diverted. I will wait no longer... summon Goramosh this instant!"]="能量线被扭曲了，这我知道。我不能再等下去了……去把古拉莫什叫来！"
G["Yes, yes, I haven't forgotten Hyjal, or Silithus, or the march of the Legion, or every other damnable confrontation the 7th Legion has faced. It... I don't want the soldiers to hear this, Two-bit, but for the first time in my life..."]="嗯，是啊，我永远记得第七军团在海加尔峰和希利苏斯的战事，记得我们对抗燃烧军团的远征，记得第七军团曾经面临过的种种挑战。但是……我不想让别的将士听到我这番话：这次是我生命中第一次感到……"
G["Yes, yes, I'll train you. There's no need to raise your voice."]="好的，好的，我会训练你。你没有必要大声嚷。"
G["Yes, yes, I'm quite certain this represents a melding of entities. Fascinating."]="是啦，我确信这代表着多个实体的融合。太神奇啦。"
G["Yes, yes, a thousand times, yes already!"]="没错没错！我说了一千次了！"
G["Yes, yes, all of the Horde's and Alliance's war materiel is being shipped over to Silithus and should be there within $2113w days. Do you know what happens then, $c? We hurry up and wait. Hopefully someone is gathering the pieces of the Scepter of the Shifting Sands, because in order to open the gates of Ahn'Qiraj it needs to be rung against the gong on the Scarab Dais."]="是的，是的，部落和联盟的所有战争物资正在运往希利苏斯的途中，预定将在$2113w天内抵达。你知道接下来会发生什么吗，$c？我们得加快速度了。希望有人能集齐流沙节杖的碎片，敲响甲虫之墙上的铜锣，打开安其拉的大门。"
G["Yes, yes, all of the Horde's and Alliance's war materiel is being shipped over to Silithus and should be there within a day. Do you know what happens then, $c? We hurry up and wait. Hopefully someone is gathering the pieces of the Scepter of the Shifting Sands, because in order to open the gates of Ahn'Qiraj it needs to be rung against the gong on the Scarab Dais."]="是的，是的，部落和联盟的所有战争物资正在运往希利苏斯的途中，预定将在1天内抵达。你知道接下来会发生什么吗，$c？我们得加快速度了。希望有人能集齐流沙节杖的碎片，敲响甲虫之墙上的铜锣，打开安其拉的大门。"
G["Yes, yes, calm down, $c, there's nothing to worry about. As luck would have it, when you first gave the left piece to me, I attuned myself to it, so summoning it back from wherever you 'misplaced' it is really not a problem.\n\nHere, and this time try to take better care of it."]="好了，好了，冷静点，$c，没什么好担心的。既然我们有幸得到了它，我就做了防范。在你第一次给我左瓣的时候，我在它和自己之间建立起了连接，要是找不到它了，我可以把它召唤到我手里来。\n\n给，这次一定要小心，不要再弄丢。"
G["Yes, yes, everything will be fine! Wonderful, in fact. She'll be better than ever!"]="是的，是的，一切都会好起来的！会变得非常好。她会比以往任何时候都更好！"
G["Yes, yes, that's all very interesting, but as you can see here, we're in a fight for our lives, and these pygmies are the least of our problems compared to what's inside that cave!\n\nWhere's my worthless assistant when I need her the most? Probably off being lazy somewhere and complaining that no one asks her how her day is going...."]="是的，是的，这非常有趣。但你要知道，我们正在为生存而战。和藏在那座洞里的东西相比，这些俾格米人根本算不上什么问题！\n\n我那个没用的助手在哪里？我现在可是非常需要她呢！也许她又去偷懒了。我猜她肯定还在抱怨没有人关心她，没有人看重她……"
G["Yes, yes, very good..."]="对，对，非常好……"
G["Yes, yes, we should do whatever we can to help them."]="嗯，我们必须竭尽所能地帮助他们。"
G["Yes, yes, yes...no, no, no no no! Yes! No! Peppers!"]="对了，是的，是的……不！不不不！对了！不对！胡椒！"
G["Yes, yes. Definitely needs more..."]="没错，没错。我们需要更多……"
G["Yes, yes. Hmm, it seems to cross reference another tome. Guess I have to find that one too."]="没错。嗯，这本书参考了另外一本书的内容。看来我还要去找那一本书。"
G["Yes, yes. I see you.\n\nBe on your way. You may have earned the trust of a few, but it will take more than that to prove it to me!"]="是的，是的。我看到你了。\n\n在去找你的路上。你可能已经赢得了一些人的信任，但要向我证明可并不仅仅如此！"
G["Yes, yes. That happens."]="是啊，是啊。着火了。"
G["Yes, yes... another! Your will is mine!"]="很好，很好……又是一个！你的意志是我的了！"
G["Yes, you heard true, $c, all of our collections are complete and the last of the war materiel should arrive in Silithus within $2113w days. I am told that once all is assembled there, and our troops readied, someone from within the ranks of you heroes is going to ring the gong outside of Ahn'Qiraj, already having assembled the Scepter of the Shifting Sands to do so with. I hope that we don't have to wait too long for that to happen."]="是的，你的消息很准确，$c。我们已经完成了所有的收集工作，最后一批战争物资将在$2113w天内运抵希利苏斯。据说一旦军队准备就绪，就将有一位英雄使用流沙节杖敲响安其拉大门外的铜锣。希望很快就能看到那一天。"
G["Yes, you heard true, $c, all of our collections are complete and the last of the war materiel should arrive in Silithus within a day. I am told that once all is assembled there, and our troops readied, someone from within the ranks of you heroes is going to ring the gong outside of Ahn'Qiraj, already having assembled the Scepter of the Shifting Sands to do so with. I hope that we don't have to wait too long for that to happen."]="是的，你的消息很准确，$c。我们已经完成了所有的收集工作，最后一批战争物资将在1天内运抵希利苏斯。据说一旦军队准备就绪，就将有一位英雄使用流沙节杖敲响安其拉大门外的铜锣。希望很快就能看到那一天。"
G["Yes, you move like my son. You have his broad shoulders - ahh, and your mother's fierce eyes."]="是的，你的一举一动就像我的儿子那样。你有着他那宽厚的肩膀——啊，还有你母亲那犀利的目光。"
G["Yes, you'll stay with us now..."]="没错，你要和我们在一起了……"
G["Yes, you're well seasoned in your field of work.  Report to the civilian liaison at once, we need more like you!"]="很好，你在这块领域算得上是熟练工。立即向平民联络官报到吧，我们需要你这样的人手！"
G["Yes, young one, you need not convince me of such things, the Warchief and I have much history. Your dedication, however, is noted.\n\nAs I was saying, Rend had found a new home for his people, and I was among those who would wearily follow.\n\nFrom one conflict arose others... countless others. It was in those battles for Blackrock Spire between the Blackrock clan and the Dark Iron dwarves that my sons were both slain. It was then that I realized my time among the Blackrock clan had come to an end."]="是的，年轻人，你不需要让我相信这些事情，酋长和我有很多过去的故事要说。然而你所做的贡献是众所周知的。\n\n就象我说的那样，雷德已经为他的人民找到了新的家园，我也是那些不知疲倦跟随他的人中的一员。\n\n那一次冲突激起了其它……其它无数的冲突。就是在黑石氏族和黑铁矮人为了黑石塔的战斗中我的两个儿子被杀害了。就在那时我意识到了我在黑石氏族的日子结束了。"
G["Yes, your eminence. Come on!"]="遵命。去看看！"
G["Yes, your majesty.  The Sword of Ramkahen casts its vote in favor of war.  Your armies are standing at the ready."]="是的，陛下。拉穆卡恒之剑决议发动战争。您的军队已经整装待发。"
G["Yes."]="好的。"
G["Yes.\n\nThat sounds like a good idea."]="是的。\n\n听起来像是个好主意。"
G["Yes.  Do you have a raptor that can take me there?"]="是的。你有迅猛龙可以带我过去吗？"
G["Yes.  Give me the spell to summon the avatar."]="好的，请教我召唤哈卡化身的法术。"
G["Yes.  Just... just show mercy to the egg."]="是的，只是……请饶过这颗蛋。"
G["Yes.  Please prepare the portal, Arman."]="是的。请准备传送吧，艾尔曼。"
G["Yes.  Please prepare the portal, Erallier."]="是的。请准备传送吧，伊拉利尔。"
G["Yes.  Towards the falls.  I tried to convince him to get his wounds treated, but he just ignored me."]="是的。朝瀑布那边去了。我劝他疗好伤再走，可他不听。"
G["Yes.  We'll need his expertise with a crossbow when the final battle comes."]="是的。在最后的战斗到来时，我们需要他这样的神箭手。"
G["Yes. $n. I have located the Forest Lord. We must redouble our efforts! More crystals are needed!"]="是的。$n。我已经查到了森林之王的位置。我们必须加倍努力！需要更多的水晶！"
G["Yes. And now, with your permission, I would like to ask for your daughter's hand."]="是的。那么现在，在您的允许下，我想牵起您女儿的手。"
G["Yes. Do your best to return in one piece."]="去吧。请你平安归来。"
G["Yes. Don't go near it!"]="是的。别靠近它！"
G["Yes. Fight and you may die. Run and you will live, but for how long?  The devils are upon us!  And those not here, dying in their villages weeks from now, would they be willing to trade all the days from this day to that, for one chance to come here and stop these horrors from invading our world?"]="没错，战斗，也许你会阵亡。逃跑，或许你可以活下来，但你能活多久呢？恶魔就在我们面前！那些畏缩不前的懦夫，过不了几周就会在自己的村庄中死去。他们是否愿意用那些惶惶不安的逃难岁月换取一次守护黑暗之门的机会，换取一次阻止那些企图入侵艾泽拉斯世界的恶魔大军的机会？"
G["Yes. Go on."]="明白，请继续。"
G["Yes. He has been called upon to help the aspects with their efforts at Wyrmrest. He wishes to aid them in cleansing Azeroth of Deathwing's menace.\n\nMay the Light guide his path."]="是的。他受命前往龙眠神殿帮助守护巨龙。他希望能帮助他们扫除死亡之翼对艾泽拉斯的威胁。\n\n愿圣光指引他的道路。"
G["Yes. He hasn't been the same since the attack on Tempest Keep."]="嗯。自从风暴要塞被攻击以来，他就变得有些不一样了。"
G["Yes. Highness! We will prepare $n for the coming battle!"]="是。阁下！我们会帮$n为即将打响的战斗做好准备！"
G["Yes. Horde is Horde."]="是，他们归根到底还是部落。"
G["Yes. I do."]="没错。"
G["Yes. I have."]="是的。"
G["Yes. I knew that she could do it. She is shy, but she is strong.\n\nI shall finish my business here. Then I shall join her."]="果然，我就知道她能办到。她尽管羞涩，但却强大得很。\n\n我得先干完这里的事。然后就去找她。"
G["Yes. I'd love a refill. Fetch one and be quick about it."]="是的，我要再来一杯。快一点。"
G["Yes. My scouts learned all about this one.\"Warlord Zaela.\" Bring her proto-drake down and the rest of the Dragonmaw will crumble."]="Sí. Mis exploradores me han informado de esta \"señora de la guerra Zaela\". Derribad a su protodraco y el resto de los Faucedraco caerá."
G["Yes. Please take me to Vashj'ir."]="是的，请带我去瓦丝琪尔。"
G["Yes. Suna's tracks stop here. We won't leave until we find her."]="嗯，孙娜的足迹在这儿消失了。找到她之前，我们绝不离开。"
G["Yes. That did the trick."]="是的。成功了。"
G["Yes. The Sha of Hatred has been through here."]="是的。恨之煞来过这里。"
G["Yes. The defense of Stoneplow currently rests on me, Guard-Captain Oakenshield, and three others of our order. As we speak, those three Shado-Pan are standing at the foot of the wall, waiting to defend against the next wave of attackers. This is our charge - to protect Pandaria from the enemies that the common people have all but forgotten about.\n\nWhile our numbers here in Stoneplow are few, we do not expect reinforcements from Kun Lai... unless this situation gets worse. Say, for example, if that weak spot in the wall crumbled."]="是的，守护石犁村的重任当前由我、守卫队长橡盾和我们派另外三名弟子担负着。正如之前我所说的，那三名影踪派弟子坚守在长城脚下，等待迎接下一波攻势。这是我们的责任——保护潘达利亚免遭普通老百姓所遗忘了的敌人蹂躏。\n\n虽然我们在石犁村的人数捉襟见肘，但我们还不打算向昆莱山请求增援……除非这里的形势变得更糟。说白了，打个比方，如果长城的弱点被攻破了。"
G["Yes. The payment for the demons' service was to drink from the energy of this place."]="是的。作为酬劳，这些恶魔能够啜饮这个地方的能量。"
G["Yes. They are even more beautiful without your reflection in them."]="是的，如果没有你的影子落在它们上面，它们会更加美丽的。"
G["Yes. This is just the opportunity the Alliance needs. We'll use the trolls as a diversion while the main Alliance fleet assembles. You get what I'm saying, Sully?"]="没错。这正是联盟的大好机会。我们要利用巨魔为联盟主舰队的集结打掩护。你明白我的意思吧，苏利？"
G["Yes. This weather is not natural."]="是啊，这天气确实不正常。"
G["Yes. Those are pandaren, Moni."]="噢，那是熊猫人，莫妮。"
G["Yes. We are prepared for the challenges ahead of us."]="是的，我们已经准备好了迎接即将到来的挑战。"
G["Yes. We regrouped east of the pass and prepared a counter-attack, but the next day, the skies reddened and the land was cleaved in two, as easily as a child might split open a cactus apple. See how the devastation stretches from horizon to horizon?\n\nOur Alliance foes in their makeshift bunkers were as surprised and disorganized as we were by the disaster. It would've been the perfect time to strike! But Warlord Gar'dul insisted we pull back to the south to refortify.\n\n<Kilrok spits on the ground.>\n\nNot all of us followed. I stood toe-to-toe with demons in the last war, $n. I'm not about to turn tail and let the Alliance plant roots on my soil."]="Sí. Nos reagrupamos al este del paso para contraatacar, pero al día siguiente los cielos se tiñeron de rojo y la tierra se dividió en dos, tan fácil como un niño que parte una manzana de cactus. ¿Ves cómo la devastación se extiende de horizonte a horizonte?\n\nLos de la Alianza, refugiados en sus búnkeres improvisados, se sorprendieron y desorganizaron tanto como nosotros. ¡Habría sido el momento de atacar! Pero el señor de la guerra Gar'dul insistió en que nos retiráramos al sur para fortificarnos\n\n<Kilrok escupe en el suelo.>\n\nNo le seguimos todos. En la última guerra luché cara a cara contra los demonios, $n. No voy a irme con el rabo entre las piernas mientras los de la Alianza echan raíces en mi tierra."
G["Yes. You rescued me while I was still within my egg, and I owe you my life."]="是的。你在我还是一只龙蛋的时候救下了我，我欠你一条命。"
G["Yes. Your son, Ku-Mo, has been looking for you."]="是的。你的儿子莫苦，他一直在寻找你。"
G["Yes.. spill more of their blood! It draws me nearer to this place!"]="是的……让他们的血再多溅出一点！这样我就更接近了！"
G["Yes..."]="是的……"
G["Yes... Gul'dan..."]="是的……古尔丹……"
G["Yes... I am... empowered."]="我……更强大了。"
G["Yes... I have done terrible things, but nothing could ever be as terrible as lending aid to the Forsaken."]="是的……我做过可怕的事情，但我从不曾与被遗忘者沆瀣一气。"
G["Yes... I sense Vordrassil's magic... free of any perceivable taint.\n\nPlease!  You must allow me to help you.  Fate brought me here, perhaps I can serve a purpose yet!"]="是的……我能感觉到沃达希尔的魔法能量……没有丝毫被污染的迹象。\n\n让我帮助你吧！命运让我来到这里，或许我能帮上忙的！"
G["Yes... Let the rage consume you!"]="啊……让怒火燃烧吧！"
G["Yes... Report to the Plains of Nasam, my children..."]="对……我的孩子，前往纳萨姆平原吧……"
G["Yes... Run... Run to meet your destiny... Its bitter, cold embrace, awaits you."]="对，去吧……迎接你的命运吧……痛苦、冰冷的拥抱正等着你。"
G["Yes... Well enough for the elements that are here, but the cipher is known to another... The spirits of fire are in turmoil... If this force is not stopped, the world where these mortals came from will cease."]="是的……对这里的元素来说，已经很好了，但是密码已经被别人知道了……火焰之灵正在骚动……如果不阻止这股力量，这些凡人所属的世界将会灭亡。"
G["Yes... Yes we move now... Please no hurt us..."]="好……好……我们马上走开……请不要伤害我们……"
G["Yes... Yes... the words. The words of damnation. The words spoken by the dark one. Your master."]="是的……是的……咒语。诅咒的咒语。你那黑暗的主人所诵读的咒语。"
G["Yes... a target of great importance."]="没错……一个重要目标。"
G["Yes... and the raccoon. I will watch over our commander."]="没错……还有浣熊。我会照顾好指挥官的。"
G["Yes... cast your precious little spells, ak-a-ak!"]="是的……施放你珍贵的小法术吧，呱——啊——呱！"
G["Yes... he shall suit our needs perfectly.  Have him sent to Solstice Village when you're ready.  Arthas will not be pleased if we fall behind schedule."]="对……他完全符合我们的要求。请你将他送去冬至村吧。如果我们不能按时完成阿尔萨斯陛下交代的任务，他会不满意的。"
G["Yes... master."]="是……主人。"
G["Yes... new test subjects!"]="很好……全新的试验品！"
G["Yes... of course."]="好吧…当然。"
G["Yes... perhaps that is for the best. I like what I've seen of them, and it sounds as though their world could use my help."]="是的……也许那样最好。我喜欢他们，而且我想我能在他们那边大展身手。"
G["Yes... pop. Sorry I got me head all snared by that thing."]="是的……爸爸。对不起，我脑袋被那东西给控制住了。"
G["Yes... the power should be mine!"]="是的……这种力量应该属于我！"
G["Yes... this must be it. We're headed the right way."]="是的……应该就是这里了。我们走对路了。"
G["Yes... this will do nicely."]="是的……这应该可以。"
G["Yes... we are fighters. But we come from a violent land. We fought off demons, we fought off death, we even fought against the very end of the world!"]="对……我们是战士。可我们来自饱经肆虐的土地。我们击退过恶魔，也击退过死亡，甚至阻止过世界末日的到来！"
G["Yes... what do you want, $r? Can't you see I am busy here?"]="嗯……你想要什么，$r？你没看到我正忙着吗？"
G["Yes... why don't you \"escort\" me out of here."]="Sí... ¿por qué no me \"escoltas\" fuera de aquí?"
G["Yes... yes $c. It's all true. I am not ashamed. The powers I submit to make mortal kings look like insects."]="是的……是的，$c。这全都是真的。我并不为此感到羞愧。和我所侍奉的力量相比，凡间的国王只不过是一些蛆虫而已。"
G["Yes... yes I can see now...I can see the future of this world...a world ruled by the horde...MY horde."]="啊，是的……我看见了……这世界的未来……由部落统治的世界……我的部落。"
G["Yes... yes!"]="对……就是这样！"
G["Yes... yes, I believe you will do. I will see you again shortly, $p."]="是的……是的，我相信你能做到。我们很快会再见面的，$p。"
G["Yes... yes, it's me..."]="是的……是的，是我……"
G["Yes...YES. I can feel the raw power of the Well of Eternity! It is time to end this charade!"]="是的……是的。我能感觉到永恒之井的原始力量！是时候结束这场闹剧了！"
G["Yes...join us!"]="是的……加入我们吧！"
G["Yes...yes! I can feel his burning eyes upon me, he is close...so close! And then your world will be unmade, your lives as nothing!"]="是的……是的！我能感觉到他的灼热目光，他已经很近……很近了！然后，你们的世界将被毁灭，你们的生命归于虚无！"
G["Yes?"]="什么事？"
G["Yes?  Darn it all, now I'll have to start over from scratch!"]="嗯？该死的，现在我不得不重新开始了！"
G["Yes?  What do you want?"]="嗯？你要做什么？"
G["Yes?  What is it?"]="嗯？什么？"
G["Yes? I have a breastplate to finish so this had better be good."]="什么事？我正好在制作一件护胸甲，没要紧事就别打扰我。"
G["Yes? The Arch Druid is resting.\n\nI am sure he appreciates your visit, but it is best not to disturb him."]="你好。大德鲁伊正在休息。\n\n我相信，你的造访一定会令他高兴的，但我们最好还是不要去打扰他。"
G["Yes? What brings you to Theren-Dion?"]="Sí, ¿qué te trae por Theren-Dion?"
G["Yes? What is it?"]="嗯？有什么事吗？"
G["Yes? What is it?\n\nTime waits for no one!"]="嗯？这是什么？\n\n别浪费时间！"
G["Yesh, Brom here's the love of my life.  We're two peash in a pod, even if he's a lightweight!"]="没错，布鲁姆就是我的爱人，我们俩就像是一个豆荚里的两颗豆子，即使他是轻量级选手，我也一样爱他！"
G["Yesh, it'sh true, I'm blind as a bat! An' drunk as a ... err, drunk as shomething that getsh drunk.\n\nI'll tell you what, $r. It'sh the drink that keeps me shenses sharp. It'sh common knowledge that when you lose a shense, yer other shenses become more alert. My drunk shense is incredible these days."]="是的，那是真的，我好像一只蝙蝠一样瞎了！而且还醉得……呃，醉得好像喝了很多酒。\n\n我会告诉这个感受的，$r。是酒让我感觉灵敏。人人都知道如果你丧失了一种感觉，那么另外一个感觉会变得更加灵敏。我的饮酒感觉这两天非常灵敏。"
G["Yess. The Tidehunter will be pleased at this development. The Firelord's hold will weaken."]="是的，猎潮者会对这项部署非常满意。火焰领主的威力将被削弱。"
G["Yessir! My grandfather left me this farm. Just moved in the other day. Nice to meet you, neighbor!"]="是的，先生！这个农场是我祖父留给我的，我刚搬来不久。很高兴认识你，邻居！"
G["Yessir, those stormsnouts pack quite a punch."]="长官，这些雷角蜥蜴真是麻烦。"
G["Yessir."]="是，长官。"
G["Yesss... Guards, come to your lord's aid!"]="对……卫兵们，过来帮帮你们的主人！"
G["Yesss... Yesss... Ssset me freee..."]="啊……啊……给我自由……"
G["Yesss...ssssuccumb to the venom..."]="对，承受这死亡的剧毒……"
G["Yessss! Defeat him, Overseer!"]="对！使劲打他，工头！"
G["Yessssss... a challenge."]="好极了……挑战。"
G["Yessssssss!  Kill them!  Kill them all!"]="没错，嘶！杀了他们！杀光他们！"
G["Yesterday's sundown celebration went a little long, you see. We may have... overmeditated."]="你瞧，昨天傍晚的庆祝时间有点长。我们都有点……喝过头了。"
G["Yesterday, today, tomorrow...you and your serpent act as one."]="你要和你的翔龙同进共退，今日如此，日日皆然。"
G["Yet I am a true servant of the warchief and he does not grant boons lightly. His wisdom guides my hammer."]="即使我是酋长真正的忠仆，他也不会轻易给我奖励。他的智慧指引着我的战锤。"
G["Yet soon we turned on each other.  Brother fought brother to decide who was the mightiest."]="不久以后，我们内部开始互相争斗，兄弟之间凭借血腥的战斗来决出谁是最强者。"
G["Yet they fell to the lure of Sargeras' evil - and now they have become our most stalwart enemies."]="然而他们受到了萨格拉斯的邪恶诱惑——现在他们变成了我们最强大的敌人。"
G["Yet what? What is it, Oronok?"]="然而什么？欧鲁诺克？"
G["Yet you persevere, as we all must. In these times, no one is a stranger to the virtue of tenacity. In the face of despair and hatred, we continue to stand true to our beliefs and fight on."]="但是你们坚持了下来，我们也必须这样做。在这个时代，人们不应该对坚韧这一美德感到陌生。面对绝望与仇恨，我们仍然要坚守自己的信仰并继续战斗。"
G["Yet you think that recovering Ashbringer will somehow turn the tide of battle? Let me let you in on a little secret, Commander: The power of the Ashbringer came from the man who would wield it... I was there, Commander. I watched him burn legions of undead in righteous fire before he would even unsheathe the blade. Alas, your grasp on history is ... lacking."]="难道你还认为重铸灰烬使者能够对战争局势产生什么影响么？让我告诉你一个小秘密吧，指挥官。灰烬使者的力量来自于挥舞着它的那个人……当时我也在场，指挥官。我亲眼看着他在圣剑出鞘之前，就以正义之火烧尽了一个军团接一个军团的亡灵士兵。啊……你对历史……实在是了解不多。"
G["Yet, I have witnessed that your actions speak of no evil."]="现在，我已经看到了，你的行为非常正派。"
G["Yet? Yet what??"]="但是？但是什么？"
G["Yi-Mo will be fine for right now, we gotta take care of these nasties first!"]="易默现在没事了，我们得先解决这些麻烦！"
G["Yield or fall!"]="屈服还是倒下！"
G["Yield? You ... YIELD?"]="认输？你……认输？"
G["Yiieeeee! Me run!"]="呀呀呀！我要逃走！"
G["Yiiipe!"]="哎呀！"
G["Yikes!  Someone call the fire marshal!  Medic!!!  Is there a doctor in the house?"]="呀！谁叫下火警！医生！！医生呢？"
G["Yikes! That stings!"]="呀！好疼！"
G["Yikes! Two fiery personalities. You'll have many arguments, but your love will burn just as hot!"]="啊哈！两个炽热的灵魂！你们会有许多争吵，但你们的爱情也会同样热烈！"
G["Yikes, $p, don't manhandle the thing. Have you never picked an herb before?"]="哎呀，$p，别那么粗鲁嘛。你以前没摘过草药吗？"
G["Yikes."]="呀。"
G["Yikes.  That was close!  And they're getting closer to me and the nether-rocket every time!  Someone needs to deal with Dr. Boom!"]="呀。他们接近了！他们离我和虚空火箭越来越近了！谁去解决掉砰砰博士啊！"
G["Ying, Huizhong... gather your things. We're leaving the farm until it's safe."]="瑛、辉钟……去收拾东西。等农场安全了，我们再回来。"
G["Yip! Me kill!"]="呀呀！杀啊！"
G["Yipe!  Help Hogger!"]="哎呀！救救霍格！"
G["Yippee! We're saved!"]="呀嘿！我们得救了！"
G["Ymiron has toiled. Long have I sat upon my throne and thought hard of our plight. There is only one answer... one reason..."]="伊米隆身心疲惫。自从我坐上王位，就一直在思考为什么维库人的生活如此艰难。答案只有一个……只有一个……"
G["Yo Ding-Dong.  Ding-Dong man.  Ding-dong.  Yo!"]="Eh Ding-Dong. Ding-Dong, tío. Ding-dong. ¡Eh!"
G["Yo Ding-Dong.  Ding-Dong.  Ding-dong yo!"]="Eh Ding-Dong. Ding-Dong, tío. Ding-dong. ¡Eh!"
G["Yo boss, how's it goin'?"]="¡Hola, $gjefe:jefa;! ¿Ké tal?"
G["Yo ho, Yo ho, a pirates life for me!"]="呦喉，呦喉，我应该去干海盗！"
G["Yo you got through the gauntlet! I'm out!"]="你竟然穿过了那条通道！我暴露了！"
G["Yo! Big lady! You think you're big enough to handle me?"]="哟！大家伙！你觉得你能对付得了我吗？"
G["Yo! Have you heard about the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit?\nYou can find Arena Organizers selling the arena team charters in Gadgetzan and outside the arenas in Nagrand and the Blade's Edge Mountains."]="¡Eh! ¿Has oído hablar del Círculo de Lucha de Bonvapor?\n\nPuedes encontrar organizadores de combates vendiendo estatutos de equipos de arena en Gadgetzan y fuera de la arena de Nagrand y de las Montañas Filospada."
G["Yo! I'm Kall Worthaton, Bilgewater Trikes.\n\nGo ahead, look over the lot. Pick out the trike that you REALLY want!\n\nA trike that's a blast to ride... a trike that's dangerous and death-defying... a trike you can be PROUD of!\n\nYou let me know when you see it, and we'll make a deal."]="¡Eh! Soy Kall Valemil, de Triciclos Pantoque.\n\nAdelante, echa un vistazo a la mercancía. ¡Elige el triciclo que desees de VERDAD!\n\n¡Un triciclo que sea la caña de montar... un triciclo que sea peligroso y que desafíe a la muerte... un triciclo del que puedas estar $gORGULLOSO:ORGULLOSA;!\n\nAvísame cuando lo veas y llegaremos a un trato."
G["Yo! I'm here representing the Crown Chemical Company.\n\nYou looking for a gift? A job? Maybe a little something for yourself? Well, you've come to the right place, friend.\n\nIf I don't have what you need, our mascot Kwee or the Lovely Merchant beside me will."]="¡Eh! Vengo en representación de Químicos La Corona, S.L.\n\n¿Buscas un regalo? ¿Un trabajo? ¿Algo para ti? Bueno, has venido al lugar adecuado, $gamigo:amiga;.\n\nSi no tengo lo que buscas, nuestra mascota Kwee o la mercader preciosa a mi lado lo tendrán."
G["Yo! You look like a $g man : woman; of discerning tastes.\n\nWhat can I do you for?"]="¡Oye! ¡Pareces $gun:una; $ghombre:mujer; de gustos exigentes!\n\n¿Qué puedo hacer por ti?"
G["Yo, I know you before. You help me, yes?"]="嗨，我认识你。你帮过我，对吗？"
G["Yo-ho-ho, and a bottle of gnomish spirits!"]="啊哈哈哈，来一瓶侏儒烈酒庆祝一下！"
G["Yo."]="哟。"
G["Yo.\n\nYou here to stable your pets, or lookin' for a lost companion?"]="你好啊。\n\n你是来存放宠物，还是在寻找失踪的同伴？"
G["Yo.\n\nYou lookin' for a lost companion?"]="你好啊。\n\n你是在寻找失踪的同伴？"
G["Yo. I'm Vixton Pinchwhistle, official Arena Vendor for the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit. If you've got the rep, I've got the goods that'll make your mouth water."]="哟。我是维克斯顿，热砂港搏击会的官方竞技场商人。如果你有足够的声望，我就有让你流口水的物品。"
G["Yo. Lookin' to get back to the Old World? Fly to Tirisfal Glades in style on the Cloudkisser."]="嗨。你想回到艾泽拉斯世界吗？搭乘“吻云号”返回提瑞斯法林地吧。"
G["Yo. Looking for a ride to Vengeance Landing? The Wild Wench flies back and forth, day and night."]="嗨，你想去复仇港吗？欢迎搭乘“野姑娘号”往返航班，全天24小时服务。"
G["Yo. They weren't sure this elevator would be workin' in time, so they called me and my brother in. You need a ride up?"]="嗨。他们不确定这台升降梯能否正常运行，因此请了我和我的兄弟来帮忙。你想上去吗？"
G["Yo. Up for a little target practice?"]="嗨，想进行瞄准练习么？"
G["Yogg-Saron is here? It sounds like we really will have our hands full then."]="尤格-萨隆被关押在这里？看来我们有得忙了。"
