G["Yohoho!"]="啊哈哈哈！"
G["Yonn Deepcut can be found inside the great tent at the northwest corner of Bloodhoof Village."]="你可以在血蹄村西北角的大帐篷里找到姚恩·深刺。"
G["Yoo hoo!  \"Shmaltzy!\"  Hey, why come your shupplies... Whe... Oh... Um... You got lots of boxes to keep track of..."]="¡Eh, oye! ¡\"Melosho\"! Eh, Por qué tush shuminstrosh... Cuá... Oh... Um... Tienesh que llevar el control de un montón de cajash..."
G["Yoo hoo!  I am here to slay Sylvanas!"]="呀哈！我来杀希尔瓦娜斯啦！"
G["Yoo-hoo! Come try some Lucky Mushroom Noodles?"]="哟呵！快来尝尝吉祥蘑菇面吧？"
G["Yoohoo! Over here, sweet stuff!"]="呀哈！来呀，甜心！"
G["Yoohoo. Over here... the trapped dwarf. Come on, lemme have a word with yeh."]="喂！这里……被困的矮人这里。来啦，我有话对你讲。"
G["Yoon, $n, it's an honor to have you join us."]="老愚，$n，很荣幸能邀请你们加入。"
G["Yoon, I need some farming advice."]="老愚，我需要一些务农的建议。"
G["Yoon, eh? Never heard of him..."]="老愚？没听说过……"
G["Yoooohoo, you well-proportioned charmer, you!"]="呀呼，你的身材简直是黄金比例啊！"
G["Yor-guul mak!"]="¡Yor-guul mak!"
G["Yorick, you in there? I'm ready to do this! Let's go!"]="尤瑞克，你在里面吗？我可要动手啦！我们上！"
G["You 'n me both know that those oil rigs ain't gonna blow themselves to smithereens. Well... they might, but it'd be more fun if you did the deed, $n."]="你我都知道那些钻油机不会自己炸成碎片。嗯……也许会，但如果你亲自去做的话，会更有乐趣的，$n。"
G["You - come here. Are these blades not the finest quality? Surely you wish to purchase from me. You will not find such workmanship and care wrought into such weapons anywhere else, $r."]="来这儿瞧瞧吧。这些武器都很上等呢，不是吗？你肯定想要购买吧。$r，别的地方可找不到锻造工艺如此精湛的武器。"
G["You -- you're not one of them! Let's get out of sight before they find us! Hurry!"]="你……你不是他们的同党！快，在他们找到我们之前，得躲进某个隐密的地方！快点！"
G["You ... survive the boars? <Snort> So many boars! So sad! <Gurgle>"]="¿Has sobrevivido a los jabalíes? <Bufido>¡Tantos jabalíes! ¡Qué triste! <Gorgoteo>"
G["You Arthas lapdog?  You die!"]="阿尔萨斯的走狗？去死吧！"
