G["You addled goose, that's me! Who do you think you're talking to!?"]="¡$gAtontado:Atontada;, soy yo! ¡¿Con quién crees que estás hablando?!"
G["You again! Don't you see? I have made a name for myself at last: I have brewed perfection!"]="又是你！你没看到吗？我终于要出名了：我酿出了完美之酒！"
