G["You all head up the hill, we'll check for another entrance."]="你们都上山，我们检查一下其他入口。"
G["You all love to hate him, and he's glad to shower his hate right back down on ya. LETS... GET... BLOODY!!!"]="你们全都热衷于痛恨他。而他也喜欢向你们表达他的恨意。让……战斗……开始吧！！！"
G["You ally yourself with these fiends? You, too, shall someday burn!"]="你和这些魔鬼结盟了？你也将会有被焚毁的一天！"
G["You almost done, Dan?"]="你好了吗？"
