G["You and Jogu the Drunk are good friends."]="你和醉鬼贾古已经成了好友。"
G["You and Jogu the Drunk have been through so many crop cycles together. Who else but he would be an asset to your farm?"]="你和醉鬼贾古已经一起经历了那么多收获季。除了他还有谁会是你农场的一笔财富？"
G["You and Old Hillpaw are acquaintances."]="你和老农山掌成了熟人。"
G["You and Old Hillpaw are buddies."]="你和老农山掌是哥们了。"
G["You and Old Hillpaw are friends."]="你和老农山掌是朋友了。"
G["You and Old Hillpaw are good friends."]="你和老农山掌已经成了好友。"
G["You and Sho are acquaintances."]="Sho y tú solo sois $gconocidos:conocidas;."
G["You and Sho are buddies."]="你和阿烁是哥们了。"
G["You and Sho are friends."]="你和阿烁是朋友了。"
G["You and Sho are good friends."]="你和阿烁已经成了好友。"
G["You and Tina are acquaintances."]="Tina y tú solo sois $gconocidos:conocidas;."
G["You and Tina are buddies."]="你和迪娜是哥们了。"
G["You and Tina are friends."]="你和迪娜是朋友了。"
G["You and Tina are good friends."]="你和迪娜已经成了好友。"
G["You and all you people, you already dead."]="你和你的族类，你们都要死了。"
G["You and all your friends are welcome to stay here for as long as you like."]="欢迎你和你的朋友们来做客，想呆多久都可以。"
G["You and me, we're proper neighbors now, not just in the geographical sense. You done so much for me, I think it's time I helped you out a bit. I called in a few favors and had them install your own postbox right on your farm. Now you can keep in touch with all your friends!"]="Ahora tú y yo somos muy $gbuenos vecinos:buenas vecinas;, y no hablo solo en términos geográficos. Has hecho mucho por mí, y creo que ahora me toca a mí ayudarte un poco. He pedido unos cuantos favores y he conseguido que te instalen tu propio buzón en la granja. ¡Ahora podrás mantener el contacto con todos tus amigos!"
G["You and the Klaxxi are fools! Your arrogance will be your end!"]="你和卡拉克西都是蠢货！傲慢会让你走向灭亡！"
G["You and your allies have struck against my kind at the gates to Grim Batol in the past. You've shown no respect for the sacred oath we would die to keep. You'll find no trust with me."]="你和你的盟友曾经在格瑞姆巴托的大门前攻击我们。对于我们用生命保护的誓言，你们却毫无敬意。我不可能信任你。"
G["You and your coin are -always- welcome here."]="这里的大门永远都向你和你的钱敞开着。"
G["You and your companion have proven yourselves in combat and in the pursuit of the keystone."]="在战斗以及寻找钥石的过程中，你和你的同伴都证明了自己。"
G["You and your companions are my guests in the Vale. Please let me know if there is anything I can provide for you."]="你和你的同伴都是锦绣谷的贵客。如果你们需要帮助，请尽管开口。"
G["You and your kind mean nothing to me, fool. The Master's will is all that matters. These ... These draenei will be hunted down and slain -- as will all things on this world. You will cease."]="Tu calaña y tú no significáis nada para mí, $gestúpido:estúpida;. La voluntad del maestro es lo único que importa. Esos... esos draenei serán perseguidos, atrapados y asesinados – como todas las cosas de este mundo. Desistirás."
G["You and your men stayed behind to fight."]="你和你的人留下来继续作战。"
G["You and your scaly worms are no match for me..."]="你和你那些长鳞的虫子根本不是我的对手……"
G["You answer to Saurfang now!"]="在你面前的是萨鲁法尔！"
G["You are Go'el, Son of Durotan and Draka! Rightful Warchief of the Horde! You are the orc who won my heart. Remember WHO YOU ARE!"]="你是古伊尔，杜隆坦与德拉卡之子！名正言顺的部落酋长！你还赢得了我的心！记住你是谁！"
G["You are His chosen ones. (He calls you, He knows you). Born of flesh- (flesh) purified by blood- (blood) destined for immortality!"]="你们是他的天选者。（他在召唤你，他认识你。）生有肉体（肉体），鲜血净涤（鲜血），注定获得不朽！"
G["You are MINE!"]="你是我的！"
G["You are NOTHING! I wield the power of the heavens!"]="你们一无是处！我掌握着苍穹的力量！"
G["You are THE Haohan Mudclaw, right? Head of the Tiller's Union? They are the master farmers in all of Pandaria!"]="你是郝瀚·泥爪，对吧？阡陌客的首领？你们是全潘达利亚大师级的农夫！"
G["You are a black wyrm no longer.  Go... go and serve the Scourge."]="你已经不是黑龙了。去吧……为天灾军团战斗吧。"
G["You are a braver $r than I."]="Eres $gun:una; $r más valiente que yo."
G["You are a fool to fight Kurun's hopeless battle!"]="蠢货，你替库伦卖命是毫无意义的！"
G["You are a fool to oppose the empress!"]="真是蠢货，竟敢违抗女皇！"
G["You are a fool, soon to forfeit his life. No?"]="你是个蠢货，一个很快就要死掉的蠢货。不是吗？"
G["You are a good $gman:woman;, $n. This act of kindness won't be forgotten."]="Eres $gun:una; $ghombre:mujer; excepcional, $n. Este acto de bondad no caerá en el olvido."
G["You are a good friend, $n. Maybe my only friend."]="Eres $gun buen amigo:una buena amiga;, $n. Quizá mi $gúnico amigo:única amiga;."
G["You are a good friend, Anren!"]="你真是个好兄弟，安伦！"
G["You are a good friend, Tholo!"]="你真是个好兄弟，索罗！"
G["You are a hero and an inspiration to the sin'dorei, $n, a symbol of our endurance in the face of tragedy and treachery."]="Eres $gun héroe:una heroína; y una inspiración para los sin'dorei, $n, un símbolo de nuestra resistencia al enfrentarnos a las tragedias y las traiciones."
G["You are a hero of the Horde. Your deeds in Northrend and during the Cataclysm are the stuff of legend. For this reason, I trust in your discretion."]="你是部落的英雄。你在诺森德和大灾变中的事迹堪称传奇。因此，我相信你的判断力。"
G["You are a hero."]="你真是位英雄。"
G["You are a lifesaver, $c. I will have your hops delivered to Halfhill right away."]="你真是个救星，$c。我立刻就将啤酒花送到半山。"
G["You are a little gnat to the Foulweald!  Die!"]="对污林熊怪来说，你真是个小麻烦！死吧！"
G["You are a most effective fighter, $n!"]="¡Eres $gun luchador:una luchadora; de lo más eficaz, $n!"
G["You are a most welcome sight, son of Malorne!  We  must preserve your power so you can spearhead the attack against the Firelord."]="你是这里最受欢迎的人，玛诺恩之子！我们必须保存你的力量，以使你能率领先头部队攻击炎魔之王。"
G["You are a pawn of forces unseen."]="你正被某种隐形的力量操控着。"
G["You are a reasonable man, blood guard. Where would you turn if your kin went missing?"]="你是个通情达理的人，血卫士。如果你的亲人失踪了，你会怎么做？"
G["You are a sick, sick orc, Ut."]="你真是个恶心到极点的兽人啊，乌特。"
G["You are a subject of the Horde. Remember your obligations and oaths. By the Warchief's command we must slay these night elves."]="你是部落的一份子。请牢记你的责任和誓言。酋长有令，我们必须杀死这些暗夜精灵。"
G["You are a true hero of the Alliance!"]="¡Eres $gun auténtico héroe:una auténtica heroína; de la Alianza!"
G["You are a true hero of the Horde!"]="¡Eres $gun auténtico héroe:una auténtica heroína; de la Horda!"
G["You are a true hero!"]="你是真正的英雄！"
G["You are a very bad person."]="你真是个坏人。"
G["You are a very intriguing sort, $c. What longing in your heart has brought you to Pandaria? Is it the thirst for adventure? The thrill of battle? Or perhaps something more?"]="你可真是耐人寻味啊，$c。是什么动力驱使你来到了潘达利亚？渴望冒险？期待战斗？也许还有别的？"
G["You are a worthy foe. The day is yours."]="你是个强大的对手。今天是属于你的。"
G["You are a worthy opponent."]="Eres $gun:una; oponente $gdigno:digna;."
G["You are a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:122151|h[Voodoo Doll]|h|r! Damage you take is copied to the other Voodoo Dolls in your raid!"]="你变成了|cFFFF0000|Hspell:122151|h[巫毒娃娃]|h|r！你所受到的伤害，会被复制到你团队其他的巫毒娃娃身上！"
G["You are abandoning your mission! You must return before you are teleported to the nearest graveyard."]="你即将放弃任务！在被传送到最近的墓地前，你必须返回原地。"
G["You are about to cross a terrible threshold, Krom'gar. May the Earth Mother have mercy on your soul."]="你正要跨过一道可怕的门槛，克罗姆加。愿大地母亲宽恕你的灵魂。"
G["You are about to find out!"]="你很快就能查明真相！"
G["You are about to rip the horizon a new sky-hole aboard a sensational new era in aeronautical innovation."]="你们的新飞艇将飞跃地平线，开启航空学上的新纪元。"
G["You are acquaintances with Fish."]="Pez y tú solo sois $gconocidos:conocidas;."
G["You are all weak. Frail."]="你太弱了，老家伙。"
G["You are alone in the world."]="你在这世界上孤苦无依。"
G["You are always welcome at the inn, $n!"]="¡Siempre eres $gbienvenido:bienvenida; en la posada, $n!"
G["You are always welcome with us here in the Raven's Wood, $n."]="Siempre eres $gbienvenido:bienvenida; con nosotros en el Bosque del Cuervo, $n."
G["You are among the Taunka of Camp Oneqwah, dwarf."]="Te encuentras entre los taunka del Campamento Oneqwah, $genano:enana;."
G["You are an Orc no longer, and speak for none but yourself. You betrayed our people to forge your fragile alliances, and I will take great pleasure in tearing them apart."]="你不配当一个兽人，你只能代表你自己。你背叛了我们的人民，来打造你那脆弱的同盟，能一手毁掉它是我的荣幸。"
G["You are an agent of their wicked god, fool.  I will see you destroyed!"]="No eres $gun:una; representante de su malvado dios, idiota. ¡Contemplaré tu destrucción!"
G["You are an exceptional enchanter. Beyond my talents as a teacher, I fear. Seek out Kitta Firewind at the Tower of Azora. Only she can qualify as your instructor now."]="Eres $gun encantador:una hechicera; excepcional. Me temo que superas mi talento como profesor. Busca a Kitta Vientofuego en la Torre de Azora. Ahora es la única que puede servirte de instructora."
G["You are an honorable Orc, Nazgrim. I regret what I must do."]="你是个高贵的兽人，纳兹戈林。很抱歉我必须这么做。"
G["You are an honorable opponent."]="你是一位可敬的对手。"
G["You are an inspiration to us all, sir."]="您对我们所有人都是一种激励，阁下。"
G["You are ancient relics of a bygone age!"]="你这落伍的老古董！"
G["You are as kind as you are intelligent. It is very lucky to help a stranger."]="你不光聪明，还很和善。帮助陌生人会为你带来好运的。"
G["You are as strong as they say, especially considering you defeated ME. Well fought."]="你和他们说的一样强，尤其是还打败了我。做的不错。"
G["You are asking for an axe in your back. Drop the weapon, now."]="你这是在自讨苦吃。立刻放下武器。"
G["You are astute to ask, young $c.  Scribes are capable of inscribing tarot cards of great power, although even they do not have full control of what they make.  The fates decide for them.\n\nIf you manage to obtain a completed deck, please bring it to me for a magnificent reward."]="Eres $gastuto:astuta; al preguntar, joven $c. Los escribas son capaces de inscribir cartas de tarot de gran poder, aunque no tienen total control sobre lo que hacen. El destino decide por ellos.\n\nSi consigues una baraja completa, tráemela y obtendrás una magnífica recompensa."
G["You are at a grave disadvantage."]="你们真是占尽了下风。"
G["You are bad... Toys... Very... Baaaaad"]="你们是坏玩具……很……坏。"
G["You are being chased by lightning!"]="你正在被闪电追逐！"
G["You are being misled! The Onslaught is all lies! The Scourge and the Forsaken are not our enemies! Wake up!"]="你们被骗了！血色先锋军都是骗子！天灾军团和被遗忘者不是我们的敌人！醒醒吧！"
G["You are being tentative, Varian. You must be decisive if you wish to lead the Alliance."]="你太犹豫了，瓦里安。如果你想领导联盟，就得果断点。"
G["You are being...hunted."]="你们是……猎物。"
G["You are beneath me."]="你比我差劲多了。"
G["You are best friends with Fish. With her knowledge of animals, she would probably help out quite a bit on the farm."]="你和玉儿已经成了挚友。凭借她对动物的了解，她或许能帮你解决农场里的问题。"
G["You are better than your companions!"]="你比其他人优秀多了！"
G["You are beyond my level of expertise. Georgio Bolero, the master of Duncan's Textiles around the corner could help you advance your skills."]="你的技艺在我的技术水平之上了。可能你该见见我们商店的老板，乔吉奥·波利罗。他就站在那边的柜台附近。"
G["You are beyond my limited abilities. Seek out the night elf Ainethil in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus. She can teach you more. I only wish that I could go with you."]="你已经超越我有限的能力了。到达纳苏斯的工匠区寻找暗夜精灵安尼希尔。她可以教给你更多知识。我很希望我可以跟你一起去。"
G["You are bound for a great things, trainee."]="Llegarás muy alto, $galumno:alumna;."
G["You are bound to me, spirit! Your task is to keep the mill running - do not falter!"]="接受被束缚的命运吧，灵魂！你的任务是保持磨坊运转——保持风力均衡！"
G["You are brave to swim down to my realm, land-walker."]="你勇敢地游到了我的领域，陆行者。"
G["You are brave to try to escape, young Ohgan'aka.\n\nBefore you continue, let me teach you how to use your teeth to bite through the trolls' nets."]="你可真勇敢，居然想要逃走，年轻的奥根阿卡。\n\n在你继续之前，让我教你如何用牙齿咬破那些巨魔的网。"
G["You are braver than you look, stranger."]="你比看上去勇敢得多，陌生人。"
G["You are breaking into the vault to retrieve your Personal Riches!"]="为了夺回你的私人财产，你要砸开保险库！"
G["You are buddies with Fish."]="你是玉儿的哥们了。"
G["You are but a plaything. Unfit even to amuse."]="你不过是个无聊的玩具，甚至不能让我提起战斗的兴趣。"
G["You are but one against the Empress's divine wrath! You, too, will fall!"]="你只是个对抗女皇圣怒的渣滓！你也必将灭亡！"
G["You are caring for your serpent well, $n. You have done all that you can for today. Make sure you come check on the serpent again tomorrow."]="你把你的雏龙照料得很好，$n。你今天已经竭尽所能了。明天一定要再来看望翔龙哦！"
G["You are carrying too much brew. Return to the Brewing Cauldron to turn in what you have."]="你携带太多酒了。返回酿酒大锅，把美酒送回去。"
G["You are certainly a long way from home, $r."]="你离家还远着呢，$r。"
G["You are certainly not your father, insect. Should it interest me, I would crush you with but a swipe of my claws. Turn Shan'do Stormrage over to me and your pitiful life will be spared along with the lives of your people."]="小子，你当然没法跟你的父亲相比。要是我高兴的话，我会一爪要了你的命。让怒风来挑战我，你就趁早躲到一边去吧。"
G["You are close enough to reach Magmaw's head!"]="你已经能碰到熔喉的脑袋了！"
G["You are coming along nicely."]="你进步得很快。"
G["You are constantly surprising me with what a person can live through."]="你真的令我感到非常惊讶，你居然活了下来。"
G["You are correct. We do not beat our prisoners. Broken, on the other hand, have no issues with violence. You see, they are brutes, after all..."]="你说对了，我们不会殴打囚犯。但破碎者们可不管这一套。你看，毕竟他们是野蛮人……"
G["You are correct; we must concentrate on the Scourge. Ignore the trolls and the villages, and focus our attentions on Deatholme! With Dar'khan defeated you will find that the rest of the Scourge 'body' will fall quickly, lacking their 'head'."]="你说得对，我们必须将集中精力对付亡灵天灾。别管那些巨魔和村庄了，集中兵力攻击戴索姆！达尔坎一死，那些天灾士兵就会像没头的苍蝇一样不堪一击。"
G["You are covered in yaungol tar, and can't see anything!"]="你全身覆盖着野牛人焦油，而且什么也看不见！"
G["You are covered soldiers!  Fallback!"]="我们掩护你们！撤退！"
G["You are cursed and we are the cure."]="你被诅咒了，我们会治好你的。"
G["You are da king of the Gordok!  You're A-number-one!"]="¡Tú ser $grey:reina; de los Gordok! ¡El número uno!"
G["You are dealing with a being that holds within it the consciousness of the most cunning, intelligent, and ruthless individuals to ever live."]="你要对付的有史以来最狡猾、最聪明、最凶狠的生物。"
G["You are deemed a threat!"]="你是一个威胁！"
G["You are defenders of a doomed world! Flee here, and perhaps you will prolong your pathetic lives!"]="你们在保卫一个注定要毁灭的世界！逃走吧，那样也许你们还能多活几天！"
G["You are dismissed, $n."]="解散，$n。"
G["You are dismissed, Jeangoisses."]="Estás despedido, Jeangoisses."
G["You are dismissed, Necropollis."]="Estás despedido, Necrópolis."
G["You are dismissed, Nishiez."]="Estás despedido, Nishiez."
G["You are dismissed, Shxto."]="Estás despedido, Shxto."
G["You are dismissed, Thundria."]="Estás despedido, Thundria."
G["You are dismissed, Zephh."]="Estás despedido, Zephh."
G["You are dismissed. Return to the Shado-Pan Garrison."]="解散。返回影踪卫戍营。"
G["You are doing well.  Keep it up!"]="你做得很好。继续保持！"
G["You are dutiful to inquire, $c, but all Horde collections have been completed. We now wait for the Alliance hegemony to finish theirs, and then all will be transported to Silithus in the vicinity of Cenarion Hold."]="你能这么问我很高兴，$c。但是部落已经完成了所有的收集工作。我们只需等待联盟那边完成他们的任务，然后所有的战争物资都将被运往希利苏斯的塞纳里奥要塞。"
G["You are dying!"]="你要死了！"
G["You are eager, that is good. However, you are not yet ready to train with the likes of me."]="Eres ardiente, eso es bueno. Pero aún no estás $gpreparado:preparada; para instruirte con alguien como yo."
G["You are easily bested!"]="你们太容易对付了！"
G["You are either mad, foolhardy, or a hero worthy of being called legend. Which one are you?"]="你到底是个疯子、傻瓜，还是个值得颂扬的英雄呢？你到底是哪个？"
G["You are expected to provide aid to Alliance members in need, whether they be human, gnome, draenei... or pandaren like yourselves."]="你们应该向有需要的联盟成员伸出援手，无论他们是人类、侏儒、德莱尼……还是你们熊猫人。"
G["You are far to slow on the field of battle.  Perhaps you need to further hone your skills."]="Eres demasiado lent$go:a; en el campo de batalla. Quizás debas perfeccionar un poco más tus habilidades."
G["You are far too late.  The Jade Armies are mine."]="你们太迟了。碧玉军团是我的了。"
G["You are finished!"]="你被终结了！"
G["You are fools to have come to this place. The icy winds of Northrend will consume your souls!"]="你们这些蠢货胆敢闯入这里。诺森德的冰风将卷走你们的灵魂！"
G["You are forbidden from my master's domain, mortals."]="你们不能进入主人的领地，凡人。"
G["You are forgiven..."]="我已经原谅你了……"
G["You are forgotten. This is what you fear, is it not?"]="你被遗忘了。这才是你最害怕的吧？"
G["You are fortunate to have come to Darnassus where you can find such an accomplished Hunter as Jocaste among our trainers.  I encourage you to visit her over in the Cenarion Enclave and seek her tutelage."]="你很幸运来到达纳苏斯，因为你遇到了像祖卡斯特这样多才多艺的猎人作为你的培训师。我建议你到塞纳里奥区拜访她并寻求她的指导。"
G["You are fortunate zhat I am too busy to make you suffer as you deserve."]="你应该感到庆幸，我没有时间让你为自己所犯下的罪行而饱受折磨。"
G["You are free of His control. And while you will be judged by lesser beings, at least you have chances that the Scourge do not!"]="你摆脱了他的控制。虽然你会被一些低贱的生物指责，但你至少有亡灵天灾所没有的机会。"
G["You are free to do whatever you like."]="你想做什么都可以。"
G["You are free to take your leave."]="你们可以自行离开了。"
G["You are friends with Fish."]="你是玉儿的朋友了。"
G["You are going the wrong way, $n. My elekk will not go into hostile territory."]="你走错方向了，$n。我的雷象是不会进入敌方领土的。"
G["You are going to love this story, $r. See, here is the thing. As soon as Malygos charged me with protecting the scepter shard, I knew I was in for an eternity of headache and pain.\n\nAll I want to do is study these magic rich shorelines and take in what artifacts might remain from the Sundering. You know, there was once a thriving Highborne civilization here! You don't have to tell me that there is going to be some solid magical items around here, $r. I can smell it!"]="你会喜欢这个故事的，$R。听着吧。当玛里苟斯让我保护节杖碎片时，我就知道我会为此头痛的。\n\n我只想在这片满是魔法遗物的海岸线上进行研究工作，寻找那次世界分裂时留下的神器。要知道，这儿是艾萨琳城的废墟，女王艾萨拉的家园！你不需要告诉我这附近有魔法器物，$R。我能闻到它们的味道！"
G["You are gonna want to head over to Old Town and drop by the Protective Hide if you are lookin' to learn skinning."]="如果你要去学剥皮术，可以到旧城区的“护体皮甲”店里看看。"
G["You are good friends with Fish."]="你和玉儿已经成了好友。"
G["You are growing ever closer to the pinnacle of your training. To become a greater enchanter, you have yet another instructor to seek out. Her name is Annora, and you may find her in Uldaman."]="Casi has culminado tu instrucción. Para convertirte en $gun gran encantador:una gran hechicera; tienes que buscar una nueva instructora. Su nombre es Annora, la encontrarás en Uldaman."
G["You are heartless. What about the grummles?"]="你太冷酷无情了。那些土地精怎么办？"
G["You are here because you displayed exceptional aptitude and ability throughout your training period."]="我叫你来是因为你在训练中显示出了过人的才智与能力。"
G["You are here to assist the Aldor?"]="你是来这里帮助奥尔多的吗？"
G["You are here to stop the Archduke?"]="你是要来阻止大公吗？"
G["You are here? Does this mean we will finally get a chance to compete against each other for the tournament title?"]="你来了？这是不是意味着我们终于有机会同场竞争大赛冠军了？"
G["You are hopelessly outmatched!"]="你们势单力薄！"
G["You are hopelessly outmatched, $r."]="你没有获胜的希望，$r。"
G["You are ignorant to the powerful secrets contained within this vale.  I will take them, and then I will destroy all of your kind."]="你对这座山谷蕴藏的强大秘密一无所知。我将得到它们，消灭你们所有人。"
G["You are impressive indeed.  It would be my honor to fight beside you."]="你可真不简单。能与你并肩战斗是我的荣幸。"
G["You are impure!"]="你这个不洁者！"
G["You are in my realm now, serpent!"]="你们在我的国度里，毒蛇！"
G["You are in no position to complain about the help you are receiving!"]="你没资格抱怨别人对你提供的帮助！"
G["You are in orc territory.  What do you need, $r?"]="你已进入兽人的地盘。你需要什么吗，$r？"
G["You are indeed a stranger to Pandaria.\n\nThe mantid are the monsters beyond the wall. The scourge of the west. The evil that haunts our lands.\n\nEvery one hundred years the mantid launch an assault on our lands to ravage them of their wealth and food.\n\nOur greatest scholars tell us we are still many years from the next ravage, but our dreams say otherwise."]="你确实不了解潘达利亚。\n\n螳螂妖是长城外面的怪物，是西部的心腹大患，是出没在我们土地上的邪恶力量。\n\n每隔一千年，螳螂妖就会来我们的土地上肆虐，掠夺财物和食品。\n\n我们的大学者告诉我们说距离螳螂妖下一次侵袭还有好几年时间，但我们的梦向我们描述了另一番景象。"
G["You are indeed courageous for wanting to brave the horrors that lie beyond this door."]="你居然想要对付这扇门后的那些怪物，你真的很勇敢。"
G["You are indeed powerful, $n. Come to me if it is more work that you seek."]="Ciertamente, eres $gpoderoso:poderosa;, $n. Ven a verme si es más trabajo lo que buscas."
G["You are insignificant."]="渺小卑微的东西。"
G["You are kind to seek me out, but your skills are beyond my own. Have a word with Sylvanna Forestmoon, just over there. She's been looking for another student."]="不幸的是，对于拥有像你这样经历的人来说我没有什么可教的，我的朋友。去找暗夜精灵希尔瓦娜·林月，她住在达纳苏斯的工匠区。"
G["You are leaving the greater Jotunheim region. Return or lose the proto-drake."]="你即将离开尤顿海姆区域。立即返回，否则始祖幼龙会将你掀下背。"
G["You are leaving the raptor dens?  I was commanded to guard this post and prevent escapes, but... I think I understand why you want to leave.\n\nFine.  You may pass, but first, I have a request.\n\nThe trolls often carry packs of raptor food, and I haven't been fed in days.  You don't stand a chance in combat, but you're small enough that you might be able to steal it from one of the sleeping trolls inside the tents..."]="你要离开迅猛龙巢穴了吗？我奉命守卫这岗哨并阻止逃逸，不过……我想我明白你为什么会想要离开。\n\n好吧。你可以通过这里，但首先，我有个要求。\n\n巨魔们经常会携带好多包迅猛龙爱吃的食物，而我已经许多天没进过食了。也许你打架毫无胜算，可你身形小巧，应该能趁那些巨魔熟睡时从帐篷里偷点儿吃的出来……"
G["You are leaving?"]="你要走了吗？"
G["You are less than dust, fit only to be brushed from my back."]="你们比尘埃更渺小，赶走你们就像掸走灰尘一般容易。"
G["You are like... piece of iron..."]="你简直是……钢筋铁骨……"
G["You are little more than insects! When I am done with you, I will burn your shrine to the ground!"]="虫子！消灭了你们，我就会把你们的神殿烧成焦土！"
G["You are looking for Uthan Stillwater.  You will find him west of the village, fishing at Stonebull Lake."]="你在寻找尤萨恩·静水。你可以在村子的西面找到他，他就在石牛湖钓鱼。"
G["You are looking for the apothecary. He makes some truly wonderful potions and tinctures. Got rid of my rash in no time!\n\nAhem... Apothecary Greenmoss sells his wares in the crafter's hall. I will mark the location on your map."]="你正在寻找的药剂师。他配制一些真正神奇的药水和酊剂。立刻使我摆脱了皮疹！\n\n呃哼……绿苔药师在工匠大厅出售他的商品。我会在你的地图上标记这个位置。"
G["You are looking for the apothecary. He makes some truly wonderful potions and tinctures. Got rid of my rash in no time!\n\nAhem... Victor Pearce sells his wares in the chamber of masters. I will mark the location on your map."]="你正在寻找药剂师。他能配出真正神奇的药水和酊剂。立刻使我摆脱了皮疹！\n\n呃哼……维克多·皮尔斯在师匠大厅出售他的商品。我会在你的地图上标记这个位置。"
G["You are looking pale, my friend! I trust you have not allowed fear to get the better of you?"]="你看起来面色苍白，朋友！相信你还没有被恐惧打败吧？"
G["You are lucky that I don't gut you right here, whelp.  You are foolish to think that you can speak to your Warchief in such ways."]="你很走运，我没打算现在就干掉你。你竟然蠢到以为可以用这种口气和你的酋长说话。"
G["You are lucky you were able to find amber and flesh nearby, Wakener.\n\nIf there was none to be found, you would have been my sustenance."]="能在附近找到琥珀和鲜肉可真是辛运，唤醒者。\n\n如果都没有的话，我早就把你吃了。"
G["You are making a terrible mistake!"]="你犯了个可怕的错误！"
G["You are making me angry, mortal!"]="你让我很生气，凡人！"
G["You are making ze night elvez nervouz, Gnombuz!"]="那些暗夜精灵被你搞得很紧张，诺莫巴士！"
G["You are marked for death. Flee, little one!"]="这是死亡的标记。逃吧，快逃，小东西！"
G["You are meaningless!  Only absolute victory for the Legion matters!"]="你们的努力全是徒劳的！只有燃烧军团全面的胜利才有意义！"
G["You are meat!"]="你就是一块肉！"
G["You are mine now, children.  You will grow up to be a strong part of the Horde!"]="孩子们，现在该我照顾你们啦。你们会成长为强壮的部落成员的！"
G["You are mine now."]="你是我的了。"
G["You are mine!"]="你是我的了！"
G["You are mine, dreadsteed!  Your spirit is now bound to me!"]="恐怖战马，你是我的了！你的灵魂已经与我连结在一起了！"
G["You are moving out of the Verdant Belt. Your yak is about to break loose!"]="你正在离开翠绿草场。你的牦牛快失控了！"
G["You are my favorite teacher ever!"]="你是我最好的老师！"
G["You are my guardian angel! Like a white knight you flew in from the heavens and lifted me from the pit of damnation!"]="你真是我的守护天使！你就像来自天堂的白衣骑士，将我从地狱的深渊中解救出来！"
G["You are near death!"]="你就快死了！"
G["You are nearly dead!"]="¡Ya casi estás $gmuerto:muerta;!"
G["You are nearly ready!  You will soon be called to destroy our enemies and conquer this land!"]="¡Ya casi estás $gpreparado:preparada;! ¡Pronto te llamarán para destruir a nuestro enemigos y conquistar esta tierra!"
G["You are needed back at the Golden Pagoda immediately!"]="你需要立刻回到鎏金亭去！"
G["You are next in line!"]="你就排在下一位！"
G["You are no better than they!"]="你也毫无力量！"
G["You are no challenge for the Crimson Sigil. Mind breakers, end this nonsense!"]="你对于火色魔印来说，根本不算什么挑战。碎灵者们，终结这个废物吧！"
G["You are no longer dealing with some underling!"]="你可不是在跟跑龙套的打交道！"
G["You are no match for me!"]="你们无法与我匹敌！"
G["You are no match for me."]="你根本不是我的对手。"
G["You are no match for my creations!"]="你们嬴不了我的造物！"
G["You are no match for the Blackrock Orcs!"]="你不配与黑石兽人较量！"
G["You are no match for the strength of the Horde!"]="你不是部落的力量的对手！"
G["You are no night elf...this is the guise of a green dragon! By the Earth Mother, I..."]="你不是暗夜精灵……这是绿龙的伪装！以大地之母的名义，我……"
G["You are no stranger to the Legion, scum. Surely, you know what torment awaits you..."]="你对燃烧军团来说已经不陌生了。当然，你也会知道，这意味着怎样的痛苦在等待着你……"
G["You are no taunka. Why have you come to the sacred burial grounds of our warriors?"]="你不是牦牛人。你为什么闯入我族战士的埋骨圣地？"
G["You are not a guest."]="你不是访客。"
G["You are not a slave. How did you get here?"]="你不是奴隶。你在这里干什么？"
G["You are not allowed to interfere!"]="这里不允许你来打扰！"
G["You are not alone! The blue dragonflight shall help you vanquish the Deceiver!"]="你们并不是在孤军奋战！蓝龙军团会帮助你们消灭欺诈者！"
G["You are not alone, Akama."]="你不是孤身一人，阿卡玛！"
G["You are not as weak as I thought, but the helm is still mine..."]="你没我想得那么弱，但战盔还是我的……"
G["You are not initiated in the old ways.  There is nothing I can teach you, child."]="No estás $giniciado:iniciada; en las tradiciones. No tengo nada que enseñarte, mi $gniño:niña;."
G["You are not known to my people.  A kodo is a mighty steed, and it is the product of love and care by my people; such is not given onto strangers.  Until the elders of Thunder Bluff consider you to be a friend, I cannot offer you the sale of a kodo."]="No eres muy $gconocido:conocida; entre mi pueblo. Un kodo es un poderoso corcel y es el resultado del amor y cuidado de mi pueblo, algo así no se da a un extraño. Hasta que los mayores de Cima del Trueno te consideren como $gun amigo:una amiga; no puedo ofrecerte la compra de un kodo."
G["You are not known to my people.  A kodo is a mighty steed, and it is the product of love and care by my people; such is not given onto strangers.  Until the elders of Thunder Bluff consider you to be exalted, I cannot offer you the sale of a kodo."]="Mi pueblo no te conoce. Los kodos son poderosos corceles, y el producto del amor y el cuidado de mi pueblo; por esa razón, no los vendemos a extranjeros. Hasta que los ancestros de Cima del Trueno te consideren $gexaltado:exaltada;, no puedo venderte un kodo."
G["You are not my king yet, boy! Nor would I obey that command even if you were!"]="孩子，你还不是我的王上！况且就算你是，我也不会遵从这样的命令！"
G["You are not of the dark path! You do not belong here, $r."]="你并非行走于黑暗道路上的人！你不属于这里，$r。"
G["You are not overwhelmed just yet disciple... let the hungering cold of death halt this onslaught."]="你还没有落败……利用饥饿之寒阻止这次攻击！"
G["You are not powerful enough to undergo the trial of the naaru. Return to me when you are stronger."]="以你现在的能力不可能通过纳鲁的试炼。等你成长为强大的勇士之后再来找我吧。"
G["You are not prepared!"]="你们这是自寻死路！"
G["You are not ready. Speak to Betty Quinn, she's standing by the stairs over there. Return to me when you have achieved a higher enlightenment."]="No estás $gpreparado:preparada;. Habla con Betty Quinn, la encontrarás junto a las escaleras. Vuelve aquí cuando tu preparación haya mejorado."
G["You are not the boss of me, Valiona! I will engulf as I please!"]="你无权命令我，瓦里昂娜！我想包抄就去包抄！"
G["You are not the first to challenge me, peons. You will not be the last."]="你们不是第一批来挑战我的人，苦力们，也不会是最后一批。"
G["You are not the sole wielder of Sargeras' power, Mannoroth! Behold!"]="掌握萨格拉斯力量的可不止你一个，玛诺洛斯！看招！"
G["You are not to speak to ANYONE about the agreement that was made today, $n.  Consider this an order from your direct superior."]="不要和任何人提起今天的协议，$n。把这看做是你直属长官所下达的命令。"
G["You are not trying to kill the anvil with your hammer, you are trying to create a weapon to kill your foes with. Let me show you what you are doing wrong."]="你不要用锤子傻乎乎地敲打铁砧，你应该是在制造一种可以杀死你的敌人的武器。让我给你演示一下你哪里做错了。"
G["You are not welcome here!"]="¡No eres $gbienvenido:bienvenida; aquí!"
G["You are not welcome here, minion of the Lich King!"]="巫妖王的爪牙，这里不欢迎你们！"
G["You are not welcome here. Die!"]="No eres $gbienvenido:bienvenida; aquí. ¡Muere!"
G["You are not welcome in our home.  Leave and go find some other land to pillage!"]="这里不欢迎你。滚远点，到别处打劫去吧！"
G["You are not worth my time, $n!"]="你真烦人，$n。"
G["You are not worthy of me. Dago! Come crush this insignificant flea!"]="你不配让我动手。达苟！碾碎这只微不足道的跳蚤！"
G["You are not worthy of me. You! Come crush this insignificant flea!"]="你不配让我动手。你！碾碎这只微不足道的跳蚤！"
G["You are not worthy to be called Burning Legion!  Try harder worm!"]="你还没资格成为燃烧军团的一员！再努力点，蠕虫！"
G["You are not worthy to face the Lich King!"]="你没有资格觐见巫妖王！"
G["You are not yet attuned to the scrying orb."]="你还不能和占卜宝珠产生共鸣。"
G["You are not yet powerful enough, $c.  Move along."]="你还不够强大，$c。继续努力吧。"
G["You are not yet seasoned enough to enter a battleground, $c. Return when you have gained more experience."]="Todavía no estás $gpreparado:preparada; para entrar en un campo de batalla, $c. Vuelve cuando hayas ganado más experiencia."
G["You are not yet strong enough to do battle in Lake Wintergrasp. Return when you have gained more experience."]="Todavía no eres lo suficientemente $gpoderoso:poderosa; como para luchar en lago Conquista del Invierno. Vuelve cuando tengas más experiencia."
G["You are not yet strong enough to do battle in Twin Peaks. Return when you have gained more experience."]="你的能力还不足以参加双子峰的战斗。当你的经验更丰富之后再回来吧。"
G["You are not yet strong enough to do battle in the Eye of the Storm. Return when you have gained more experience."]="你还太年轻，不足以在风暴之眼里战斗。多积累些经验再来吧。"
G["You are not yet strong enough to do battle in the Strand of the Ancients. Return when you have gained more experience."]="你还不够强壮，不足以参加远古海滩的战斗。等你经验更丰富一些的时候再来找我吧。"
G["You are not yet strong enough to do battle on the Isle of Conquest. Return when you have gained more experience."]="你还不具备足够的力量来参与征服之岛的战斗。等你获得更多经验以后再回来吧。"
G["You are not yet strong enough to enter The Battle for Gilneas. Return when you have gained more experience."]="你的能力还不足以参加吉尔尼斯之战。当你的经验更丰富之后再回来吧。"
G["You are not... my friend..."]="你不是……我的朋友……"
G["You are nothing but an underling! I will not wait a moment longer! Escort me to Goramosh immediately!"]="你不过是个身份卑微的小杂兵！我不能再等了！立刻带我去见古拉莫什！"
G["You are nothing more than the warchief's dog!"]="你只是酋长的一条狗！"
G["You are nothing to me."]="你对我来说什么都不是。"
G["You are nothing!"]="你毫无价值！"
G["You are nothing! I answer a higher call...."]="你们不值一提！我只听从主人的召唤……"
G["You are nothing! You are food for my beasts!"]="废物！你们都要变成兽粮！"
G["You are nothing."]="你什么都不是。"
G["You are now being judged."]="你将受到审判。"
G["You are now ready to follow the path that joins your life with my own, if only for a short time. However we must make sure that you understand the things of which the spirits speak."]="Ya estás $glisto:lista; para seguir el camino que une tu vida con la mía, aunque por poco tiempo. Pero debemos asegurarnos de que comprendes las cosas de las que hablan los espíritus."
G["You are now to be dispatched directly into a hostile environment on a treacherous mission."]="你现在要直接前往敌方领地执行一个危险的任务。"
G["You are on the wrong side of this battle, $r. You side with savage beasts!"]="这场战斗你站错了边，$r。你居然与野蛮的野兽为伍！"
G["You are only allowed into the city for an hour.  Be quick with your business."]="你只能进城一个小时。有什么事就快点干。"
G["You are only foolish in your shame, Neeka..."]="羞愧才是你显得愚蠢的唯一缘由，尼卡……"
G["You are only to use the staggered formation just before atta-"]="你们在进攻前只能使用交错阵——"
G["You are our first turn of good fortune in several days. We're glad to have the help."]="遇见你是我们这几天来唯一走运的事。很高兴能得到你的帮助。"
G["You are out of time."]="你们没有时间了！"
G["You are paid for all workers present, foreman.  The warchief does not compensate the dead."]="这是按出勤的工人算的，工头。酋长可不会付钱给死人。"
G["You are permitted to visit our stronghold, little $r.\n\nDo not bring us dishonor!"]="Se te permite visitar nuestra fortaleza, $gpequeño:pequeña; $r.\n\n¡No nos deshonres!"
G["You are powerless before Garrosh!"]="你的力量在加尔鲁什面前不值一提！"
G["You are quite inquisitive, though such inquisitiveness belies a general lack of understanding.  I say this because were you to have a definite purpose in being here, the question you ask would seem pointless. \n\nWith that, I bid you good day."]="你很好奇，这种好奇掩饰了你在理解能力上的缺乏。我说这些是因为，如果你来此有一个确定的目的，你要提的问题就会显得毫无意义。\n\n因为这个原因，我只好对你说再见。"
G["You are quite powerful indeed."]="你确实相当强大。"
G["You are quite right, Trask."]="你是对的，塔斯克。"
G["You are quite the tamer!"]="¡Eres $gtodo un domador:toda una domadora;!"
G["You are ready for greater things! See Franklin Lloyd, to my right. He will guide you from now on."]="¡Estás $glisto:lista; para hacer grandes cosas! Ve a ver a Franklin Lloyd, a mi derecha. Él te guiará a partir de ahora."
G["You are really going to risk life and limb on that busted up machine?  There are far more reputable trainers in Orgrimmar."]="你真的打算去鼓捣那台破烂机器，不惜拿自己的生命和肉体做赌注？在奥格瑞玛可是有许多可靠又可敬的训练师。"
G["You are returned to life. The Banshee Queen asks for your service."]="你已经重生于世。女妖之王要求你的效忠。"
G["You are right, $p. I should be there for Leza. Thank you."]="你是对的，$p。我必须为了莱莎留在那里。谢谢你。"
G["You are right, Eitrigg.  The timing is unfavorable.  Make sure our best ambassadors are sent as envoys to Hellscream."]="你说得对，伊崔格。现在并不是很合适。那么我们必须派最好的使者去觐见地狱咆哮。"
G["You are right, Yin. It IS hidden away, behind a cloak of mists."]="你说得对，尹。它被藏起来了，藏在迷雾后面。"
G["You are right, of course, old friend. Let us hope that these heroes arrive soon."]="你说得对，我的老朋友。希望那些英雄能快点抵达这里。"
