G["You are so kind $Gmish:mishter;... hic!"]="你太好了，$g女士:先生;……嗝！"
G["You are spotted by the %s!"]="你被%s发现了！"
G["You are standing in a lethal cloud!"]="你站在一片致命的云雾中！"
G["You are straying from the events of the past. Turn around immediately."]="你在偏离过往事件。快调头。"
G["You are strong, stronger even than you realize. Carry this thought with you into the darkness ahead, and let it shield you."]="你很强大，比你自己以为的还要强大。带着这个信念勇敢迎接黑暗吧，它将会庇佑着你。"
G["You are stronger than your father, young prince."]="你比你的父亲更强大，年轻的王子。"
G["You are such a devious one! Whatever shall we do with you?"]="¡Eres muy $gtaimado:taimada;! ¿Qué deberíamos hacer contigo?"
G["You are such a nice $Gguy:gal; $n. Thank you for this lovely present."]="你真是一个好$G小伙:姑娘;，$n。谢谢你送我的可爱礼物。"
G["You are super brave.  Can you teach me to be as brave?"]="你真勇敢。你能教我怎么变勇敢吗？"
G["You are sweet as sugar, $n."]="你真是太好了，$n。"
G["You are talking nonsense, mage."]="你似乎有妄想症了，法师。"
G["You are tenth in line, kid."]="Eres $gel décimo:la décima;, $gchaval:chavala;."
G["You are tenth in line."]="Eres $gel décimo:la décima;."
G["You are terminated."]="你被终结了。"
G["You are the $c, aren't you? Thank you for recovering my brother's heirloom. It has become my most precious possession."]="Eres $gel:la; $c, ¿verdad? Gracias por recuperar la reliquia de mi hermano. Se ha convertido en mi posesión más preciada."
G["You are the alpha male, Ivar. The rest of the ferals in Silverpine will do as you command."]="你真了不起，伊瓦。银松森林其余所有狂野之灵都将听命于你。"
G["You are the best friend that Orkus has ever had, $p. *Orkus coughs*"]="你是奥尔库斯所结识过最好的朋友，$P。*奥尔库斯咳了起来*"
G["You are the best this world has to offer? Ha, no wonder it has fallen to ruin."]="你们已经算是这个世界的精英了吗？哈，难怪它会沦为废墟。"
G["You are the chosen! The might of the true Horde!"]="你们是精英中的精英！是正统部落的中坚力量！"
G["You are the ember. You are the spark! You are the fire that will spread across the world. You will awaken Azeroth's potential!"]="你就是那余烬！你就是那火星！你将成为燎原的烈焰。你将唤醒艾泽拉斯的潜力！"
G["You are the fifth person in line. Shouldn't be too much longer."]="Eres $gel quinto:la quinta; en la cola. No tendrás que esperar mucho."
G["You are the instrument the master will use to bring an end to this world and reforge it in his image."]="主人将毁灭这个世界，并按照他的意志重铸全新的世界。而你正是他实现这一目标的工具。"
