G["You are the target of the Blue Rays! Move around the arena with your teammates to find and defeat an Azure Fog."]="你成为了蓝光的目标！快绕着战场移动，让你的队友找出并击败碧蓝雾行兽。"
G["You are the target of the Infrared Light! Move around the arena with your teammates to find and defeat a Crimson Fog."]="你成为了红光的目标！快绕着战场移动，让你的队友找出并击败猩红雾行兽。"
