G["You are to be rewarded. Walk with me."]="你将受到嘉奖。随我来。"
G["You are to join us in our hunt of the Sha of Hatred then, Lao-Chin. The men here should be able to hold the bridge and repair the camp on their own."]="你会和我们一起猎杀恨之煞的，对吧，老陈。你的人应该能独自守住大桥，并修缮营地。"
G["You are to return in a week's time with a detailed report of your actions."]="你应该在一周之内带回一份详细的行动报告。"
G["You are too far! Get closer to your Instructor!"]="你离得太远啦！快跟紧你的教头！"
G["You are too kind, $c. How can I ever repay you?"]="你太好了，$c。我该怎么报答你呢？"
G["You are too late!"]="太迟了！"
G["You are too late! The Thunder King will rise and take dis land from you."]="太迟了！雷电之王将会崛起，从你手上夺取这片土地。"
G["You are too late!! I... must... obey!!"]="你们太迟了！！我……只好……服从……"
G["You are too late, champion of Lordaeron. The dead shall have their day."]="你们来的太迟了，洛丹伦的勇士们，现在已经是亡灵的时代了。"
G["You are too late, you foolsss!  The ancient one'sss will is broken!  The processs is nearly complete!"]="你太迟了，蠢货！古灵的意志已经破碎了。占据已经接近完成了！"
G["You are too late."]="你太迟了。"
G["You are too late..."]="你们太晚了……"
G["You are too late... the relic is being offered to Azshara above us as we speak!"]="你太迟了……当我们说话的时候，那件圣物已经被献给了艾萨拉！"
G["You are too timid, Regent. Blood is the price we pay to carve our place in this world."]="你太胆小了，摄政王。要在这乱世中立足，我们就必须付出鲜血的代价。"
G["You are treading upon sacred ground!"]="¡Estás hollando suelo sagrado!"
G["You are truly a determined student. I will be happy to provide you with instruction!"]="你真是一个意志坚定的学生。我很高兴给你提供指导！"
G["You are truly great heroes for vanquishing the Gnoll King. People all throughout Elwynn Forest and Westfall will speak highly of your triumph for years to come. Thank you."]="你们竟然战胜了豺狼人之王。你们真是伟大的英雄。在今后的许多年中，全艾尔文森林和西部荒野的人都会津津乐道你们的伟大胜利。谢谢你们。"
G["You are truly welcomed to Rikkitun Village, outsider."]="Te damos la bienvenida a la Aldea Rikkitun, $gforastero:forastera;."
G["You are unfit to serve the Lich King even in undeath. Work hard and I may yet release you forever from this world. Fail me, and you will fuel the fires with your flesh."]="你就算变成亡灵，也没那个能耐为巫妖王效力。手脚再勤快点，我或许会考虑让你彻底摆脱这个世界。否则，你就等着进熔炉吧。"
G["You are unfit to stand before me."]="你没资格站在我面前。"
G["You are unfit to train with me, stranger. Spend some time with my assistant Jhag over there."]="No estás $glisto:lista; para instruirte conmigo, $gforastero:forastera;. Antes deberás pasar un tiempo con mi asistente Jhag, ahí lo tienes."
G["You are unworthy of my domain..."]="我的国度容不下你……"
G["You are unworthy."]="你毫无价值。"
G["You are venturing beyond training space! Return to The Arboretum or The Jadespire Sea before you are thrown off!"]="你快要超出训练场地了！返回百木园或玉塔海，否则就要被甩下去了！"
G["You are very brave... thank you!"]="你非常勇敢……谢谢你！"
G["You are wasting precious time."]="你在浪费宝贵的时间。"
G["You are weak Vol'jin, like your father was weak. Today I will finish what I started long ago - the Darkspear shall be wiped from existence!"]="你真弱，沃金，跟你的父亲一样弱。今天，我将结束这场久远的战争——暗矛巨魔将被彻底扫除干净！"
G["You are weak!"]="你真弱！"
G["You are weak, powerless to resist my will!"]="软弱的你抵挡不了我强大的意志！"
G["You are weak. Pathetic.  Your life will be stripped from you, but only after everything you love has been burnt away."]="你虚弱而可悲。你所爱的人会被烈焰烧尽，你的生命将弃你而去。"
G["You are weak. You Shado-Pan scurry through shadows like roaches."]="懦夫。你们影踪派只敢像蟑螂一样在阴影里活动。"
G["You are weakening, Sintharia!  Accept the inevitable!"]="你变得虚弱了，辛萨尼亚。接受你注定的败局吧。"
