G["You are welcome among us, $c.  At least for the time being."]="欢迎你来到这里，$c。"
G["You are welcome here, $r. Please, make yourself at home. There is plenty of food and ale, and there's a bed upstairs if you need to rest.\n<Maolin smiles warmly at you.>"]="Te damos la bienvenida, $r. Siéntete como en casa. Hay comida y bebida de sobra, y en el piso de arriba hay una cama por si necesitas descansar.\n\n<Maolin te sonríe con calidez.>"
G["You are welcome here, as a friend and ally of the earthen."]="Sé $gbienvenido:bienvenida; aquí, como $gamigo:amiga; y $galiado:aliada; de los terráneos."
G["You are welcome here, friend and ally of the Dragonflights. Take your rest here in our halls."]="Sé $gbienvenido:bienvenida; aquí, $gamigo:amiga; y $galiado:aliada; de los Vuelos. Descansa en nuestras salas."
G["You are welcome in Shattrath, Lady Liadrin. We have long awaited your arrival."]="欢迎来到沙塔斯城，女伯爵莉亚德琳。我们在这里等你很久了。"
G["You are welcome in Wyrmrest Temple, $r. Forgive the commotion outside; with Malygos' recent acts, we have found ourselves besieged. You may still rest here under our protection should you need it."]="欢迎来到龙眠神殿，$r。希望神殿外的骚乱没有为你带来任何困扰；最近玛里苟斯展开了一系列的行动，龙眠神殿已经被包围了。不过你还是可以安心地待在这儿，我们会确保你的安全。"
G["You are welcome to remain in attendance."]="欢迎你继续负责。"
G["You are welcome, have a nice day."]="不客气，祝您今天过得愉快。"
G["You are well on your way, $n.  But you still have much to learn.  The southern Barrens may be where your next lesson is found."]="你现在进展顺利，$n。但是你还有很多东西要学的，南贫瘠之地将是你获得进一步发展的地方。"
G["You are what you drink, $n -- I hope you have been drinking something strong."]="你就像你喝的酒，$n——呃，但愿你喝的是烈酒吧。"
G["You are what's on the menu!"]="你已是我的盘中餐了！"
G["You are wise not to."]="那就对了。"
G["You are worthless, Theralion!"]="你可真没用，瑟纳利昂！啊——啊！"
G["You are wrong, Adyen.  My mind has never been clearer."]="你错了，阿德因。我的想法从来没有这么清晰过。"
G["You are wrong, teacher."]="你错了，师傅。"
G["You are... dismissed."]="你……出局了。"
G["You are... irrelevant."]="你……不存在了。"
G["You are... nothing!"]="你什么……都不是！"
G["You aren't even asking me questions..."]="你根本就没有问我问题啊……"
G["You aren't from around here. Are you interested in learning about the native plant life of Pandaria?"]="你不是本地人。有兴趣了解下潘达利亚的原生植物吗？"
G["You aren't going to let me sleep are you?"]="你还想不想让我睡觉啊？"
G["You aren't gonna off the Hoff!"]="你休想逃出霍夫的手心！"
