G["You as well, Flutter?  We used to be such good friends.  I will miss you."]="你也一样，巨蛾？我们曾经是这么好的朋友。我会想念你的。"
G["You ask me, I think we let the soup and gravy take care of this ready and write.\n\nIt's bird lime to kick and prance ourselves out of here before we're all brown bread.\n\nCatch my meaning, love?"]="要是你问我的话，我认为让那些汤羹和肉汁去充数就够了。\n\n趁我们还没变成烤面包之前，应该纵身从这儿逃出去。\n\n你明白我的意思吗，宝贝儿？"
G["You ask much of me, Tirion, to sit and watch, trusting the savages to keep themselves in check."]="你说个不停，提里奥。要平心静气，要相信那些野人会管住自己。"
G["You ask of the Sons of Cenarius, Remulos and Zaetar.\n\nMy father, Remulos, was strong and beautiful, and my uncle, Zaetar, very cunning and slight of build. While they were respected quite equally, Zaetar always felt as if he could never quite compare to the glory and attention he thought Remulos had.\n\nAfter my sisters and I were born, Zaetar, blinded by jealousy, set out to outdo his brother... He was the creator of his own end. The sadness it brings me has never lessened, even as time passes..."]="你问到塞纳留斯的儿子雷姆洛斯和扎尔塔。\n\n我的父亲雷姆洛斯强壮英俊，我的叔叔扎尔塔矮小灵动。虽然两人受到大家的一致尊重，但是扎尔塔总认为自己无法得到雷姆洛斯所享受的荣耀和受到的关注。\n\n我和我的姐妹们出生后，扎尔塔在嫉妒心的驱使下，想要超越他的兄弟……他自作自受。即使事情已经过去了这么久，我心中仍悲恸不已……"
G["You asked for it."]="这是你自找的。"
G["You attack me like this, $p? What a puny plan!"]="你这样攻击我，$p？真是班门弄斧！"
G["You attempt the impossible."]="你在尝试不可能做到的事！"
G["You barbarians will think twice before attacking our village again!"]="你们这些野蛮人最好考虑清楚还要不要攻击我们的村庄！"
G["You bastard, my pet may never walk again!"]="你这混蛋，我的宠物恐怕再也不能走路了！"
G["You bastards will burn for what you did."]="你们这群混蛋要为自己的罪行付出代价。"
G["You battled well today, $p. May you wear your title with honor."]="你今天战斗得很是英勇，$p。愿你能不辱威名。"
G["You be Grulloc's friend!"]="¡Tu ser $gamigo:amiga; de Grulloc!"
G["You be a LONG way from home, mon. Heh heh heh.\nWhat can I be helpin' ya find?"]="Eh'tás MUY lejos de casa, colega. Je, je, je.\n\n¿En qué pue'o ayudah'te?"
G["You be crazy, mon, meddlin' with dat bad mojo. But I ain't one ta stop ya.\n\nUnjari Feltongue is in de taller building in de southeast, past de shadow priest's shrine."]="Eh'tás $gloco:loca;, colega, si quieres meteh'te con ese mal mojo. Pero no te detendré.\n\nUnjari Malalengua eh'tá en el edificio máh alto del sureste, máh allá del santuario del saceh'dote de las Sombras."
G["You be da victor today. Enjoy it."]="今天你是赢家。享受胜利吧。"
G["You be dead soon enough!"]="你马上就要死了！"
G["You be dead soon!"]="你很快就会没命了！"
G["You be drinkin' everyting, mon."]="你反正什么酒都喝，老兄。"
G["You be dyin' along with all dese scourge!"]="和天灾士兵一起去死吧！"
G["You be feelin' dis fight for a long time."]="你将长久牢记这场战斗。"
G["You be free from da voodoo now!"]="现在，你从巫毒中被释放了！"
G["You be gettin' back!"]="你给我回来！"
G["You be good eatin' for me pets."]="你将变成宠物们的美餐！"
G["You be here ta learn fishin', mon? Or maybe ta buy some tings for it?"]="朋友，你是来学习钓鱼的？还是来买东西的？"
G["You be interferin' with de wrong empire!"]="与我们的帝国作对可不明智！"
G["You be it now, brudda!"]="兄弟，来吧！"
G["You be lookin' for Sesebi, mon.\n\nShe most often be sleepin' under de tree by old Umbehto, de fisherman, lookin' like a big ol' tiger."]="你要找的人是塞瑟比，伙计。\n\n她通常在老渔夫——恩姆贝托旁边的树下打盹儿，看上去就像只大老虎。"
G["You be not afraid of nothin', $c!\n\nBuunu be waitin' for you outside."]="你可真是无所畏惧，$c！\n\n布努正在外面等着你。"
G["You be sayin' that now, but come dinner you'll think differently!"]="你现在当然这么说啦，等待会吃饭的时候你肯定就不会这么想了！"
G["You be the worm my captives be cursin'? I expected more!"]="你就是那个被俘虏们终日咒骂的家伙？我还以为你有多大能耐呢！"
G["You be too scared!  Me find you!"]="你被吓坏啦！我找到你啦！"
G["You be wantin' Sijambi, mon.\n\nShe be in de tall building in de middle of de valley."]="你得去找斯加姆比，伙计。\n\n她就在山谷中部那座高高的建筑里。"
G["You be wantin' our land? We gonna bury you here."]="你想要夺走我们的土地？我们会把你埋在这里。"
G["You be watchin' yerself, $c. Respect our ways, or a curse be on you and yours."]="你当心些，$c。尊重我们的方式，否则你和你的人们就会受到诅咒。"
G["You bear the burden of an entire people upon your shoulders. And how have they repaid you?"]="你用双肩苦苦挑起了整个民族的负担。而他们是怎么回报你的呢？"
G["You beasts! What sort of madness is this?"]="你们这群畜生！你们疯了吗？"
G["You been savin' hozen, wikket?\n\nWikket loves hozen?"]="蠢蛋在救猢狲？\n\n蠢蛋喜欢猢狲？"
G["You begin to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:91317|h[Worshipping]|h|r!"]="你开始施放|cFFFF0000|Hspell:91317|h[膜拜]|h|r！"
G["You believe our allies will not be able to control the power of the swords?"]="你认为我们的盟友没有能力控制这些剑的力量？"
G["You believe you are ready to be a champion?  Defend yourself!"]="¿Crees que estás preparad$go:a; para ser u$gn:na; Campe$gón:ona;? ¡Defiéndete!"
G["You believe yourself ready for the rank of valiant?  We shall see."]="¿Crees que estás $gpreparado:preparada; para el rango de $gValeroso:Valerosa;? Ya veremos."
G["You bend down to speak with me? A pet-keeper? A shortfang?\n\nI know my place in this world, stronger. I am not strong enough to fight on my own, so I keep a pet. I am called weak, and pushed to the edge of the village.\n\nYou should stay away from me, before they see you."]="你竟然屈尊跟我说话？跟一个带宠者？一个短牙种？\n\n我知道自己在这个世界上的位置，强者。我不够强壮，不能单打独斗，所以我养了一头宠物来保护我。我被叫做弱者，被赶到村子的边缘来。\n\n你该离我远点儿，别被他们看见了。"
G["You best have a seat then, this is gonna be a long one.\n\nWhen we initially arrived in Silithus, Mistress Mar'alith was the first of the night elves from Cenarion Hold to join the expedition. Our routine was nothing out of the ordinary: Form a party to venture into the various hives and search for lost artifacts."]="Es una larga historia así que es mejor que tomes asiento.\n\nCuando llegamos por primera vez a Silithus, la maestra Mar'alith fue la primera de los elfos de la noche del Fuerte Cenarion en unirse a la expedición. Nuestro día a día era de lo más normal: un grupo se aventuraba en las diversas colmenas para buscar artefactos perdidos."
G["You best head up to Stormwind in the Dwarven District if you want to learn to mine.  Surely one of the dwarves there can teach you the profession."]="如果你想学习挖矿的话，最好前往暴风城的矮人区。那里的某个矮人肯定会教给你这门技能。"
G["You betrayed the Warchief!"]="你背叛了酋长！"
G["You better back me up on this one!"]="你最好帮帮我！"
G["You better be happy I threw my back out or I'd come over there and kick you off my land."]="看我走了你们就偷着乐吧，否则我会到那把你们赶出我的土地。"
G["You better believe it! You're going to face two of Arthas' most powerful Val'kyr lieutenants!"]="你最好记住！你要面对的是阿尔萨斯最强大的两个瓦格里侍从！"
G["You better bring that bat back in one piece, $n!"]="你最好把那只蝙蝠毫发无伤地带来，$n！"
G["You better do something quick or you'll have a riot on your hands, Solomon!"]="你最好赶紧采取行动，不然暴乱是难免的了，所罗门！"
G["You better get upstairs pronto, boss. Trade Prince Gallywix is waiting for you."]="Será mejor que subas las escaleras echando leches, $gjefe:jefa;. El príncipe mercante Gallywix te espera."
G["You better have a good reason for letting this wolvar continue to breath."]="你最好给我个说得过去的理由，不然我不会让这只狼獾人活命的。"
G["You better head straight there, but be cautious."]="你最好径直过去，但千万留心。"
G["You better hold me back or $n is going to feel some prison house beatings."]="你最好抓牢我，否则$n就有苦头吃了！"
G["You better hope they don't survive it, lad."]="你最好祈祷他们直接被炸死。"
G["You better not break Jum-jump!  It's not fair!"]="你不能弄坏跳跳！我不许你这样！"
G["You better wake up real quick, rookie.  This isn't our cushy backyard outside of Skettis; this is the Blade's Edge Mountains!  One false move and it's crash and burn!"]="你最好快点醒来，新人。这里不是斯克提斯外的某个舒适的后院，这里是刀锋山！一不小心就会导致灾难性的后果！"
G["You big boss now!  You king!  All hail King $n, King of Gordok!\n\nNow that you da boss, all henchmen will give you tribute!  You left some alive, yeah boss?"]="¡Tú gran $gjefe:jefa; ahora! ¡Tú $grey:reina;! ¡Todos saludar $gal rey:a la reina; $n de Gordok!\n\n¡Ahora que tú ser $gjefe:jefa;, todos los esbirros te darán un tributo! ¿Has dejao algunos vivos, eh, $gjefe:jefa;?"
G["You big duffer, these ARE the same ruins. You're wandering in circles again."]="你这个大笨蛋，这还是那座废墟。你只是在绕圈子。"
G["You big meanie! Who put you up to this?"]="你个尖酸的刻薄鬼！谁把这个给你的？"
G["You blame the peacekeepers for your failure? You were entrusted with a simple task. The troll was obviously a fraud!"]="你想把这事推到卫兵头上来掩饰自己的疏忽吗？这么个简单的任务你都办不好。那巨魔显然是个骗子！"
G["You blaspheme! The Light would never allow such an aberration!"]="混蛋！圣光永远也不会承认你这个疯子！"
G["You blew it!"]="你搞砸了！"
G["You block like a little girl! Put your shoulder into it!"]="你的格档就像个女孩一样！用点力气！"
G["You blood elves should rejoin the flock before it's too late."]="血精灵应当在一切为时太晚之前加入我们的行列。"
G["You both have my thanks and that of the village, though many will never know of your deeds."]="我代表村民谢谢你们，虽然你们的事迹不会为大多数人所知。"
G["You both shall suffer as his father does..."]="你们会和他父亲一样饱受折磨……"
G["You boys need some help?"]="你们需要什么帮助吗？"
G["You brash interlopers are out of your element! I will ground you!"]="你们这些莽撞的入侵者已经无计可施了！我要亲自把你们碾碎！"
G["You break and enter?! Me break YOU!"]="你打破入口进去了？！我要把你打破！"
G["You break easy!"]="哈，你真弱！"
G["You break our cave, I break your skull!"]="你打破我们的洞穴，我要打破你的脑袋！"
G["You bring great pride to the Horde, Champion $n."]="你为部落带来了极大的荣耀，勇士$n。"
G["You bring violence to Ogri'la?"]="你想在奥格瑞拉胡作非为？"
G["You brought back the instruments just in time, $n. The Elder is ready to perform the waterspeaking ceremony."]="你总算及时把东西带回来了，$n。长老已经准备好进行水语仪式了。"
G["You brought strife to our lands! I will bring strife to you now!"]="你们给我们的家园带来了战争！我要让你们也尝尝战争的滋味！"
G["You brought supplies from the enemy!  Hah! Well done $n!"]="你带来了我们敌人的补给品！哈哈！干得好$n！"
G["You brought the green to my land for a short time.  It is enough.  I am at peace.  I am ready for my long sleep."]="你在这么短的时间内就为这片土地带来了绿色，干得很好。我觉得心绪安宁了许多。我要去长眠啦。"
G["You brought the worgen to Duskwood! You led the Dark Riders to my farm, and hid while they murdered my family!"]="你把狼人带到了暮色森林！你将黑暗骑士引到了我的农场，任由他们杀死我的家人，你却躲了起来！"
G["You brought this down on us! I'd bet gold on it!"]="都是因为你！我敢打赌！"
G["You brought this on yourself!"]="这是你自找的！"
G["You brought this on yourselves!"]="你们自找的！"
G["You brought this on yourselves, Sunreavers."]="这是你们自找的，夺日者。"
G["You brutes make sure that my number one executive doesn't get anywhere near the villa."]="你们这些混蛋，给我听好了，绝不能让我的头号主管靠近这栋别墅。"
G["You built your dwellings upon our very rockface.  Your ignorance shall be your undoing."]="你们把居所建造在我们的岩石上面。你们的无知只会导致你们的毁灭。"
G["You burned down my headquarters. Now I'm gonna burn down you!"]="你烧了我的总部，现在我要烧死你！"
G["You buy one wrong grain and suddenly the world falls apart. Now we have a sprite infestation and migrating birds to boot.\n\nI was just trying to help us hit our quota to the Stormstout Brewery!"]="你只是买错了一种谷物，然后突然世界都崩溃了。现在我们要对付肆虐的林精和迁徙的候鸟。\n\n我正在努力帮忙完成风暴烈酒酿造厂的订单！"
G["You buy time... but not your lives... my hatchery remains..."]="你们拖延了时间……但仍难逃一死……我的孵化所还在……"
G["You buyin' the next round?"]="下轮酒你买单？"
G["You call 'dat a battlecry? We be startin' a revolution. Roar like ya already won and deh' other side just not figured it out yet."]="你们管这叫战吼？我们即将发动起义。你们要像胜利者那样咆哮，让另一方摸不着头脑。"
G["You call on da beast, you gonna get more dan you bargain for!"]="你们召唤野兽？你马上就要大大的后悔了！"
G["You call that a hammer strike? What kind of amateurs am I workin' with here?"]="你管这叫锻造？和我共事的怎么尽是些外行人？！"
G["You call that a hit?  My grandma could hit harder and she's dead!"]="这就是你的攻击？我的奶奶都比你能打，她都已经过世了！"
G["You call that a trigger assembly? This is not a toy, people!"]="你管这个叫触发装置？这可不是玩具！"
G["You call that an offense? I've seen more offensive tallstriders!"]="你把那个叫做进攻？连陆行鸟都比你更具有攻击性！"
G["You call that fighting?"]="你把那也叫战斗吗？"
G["You call that fighting? Let me go grab your dolly. Maybe she could teach you how to swing."]="你管这叫做战斗？我还是把你的布娃娃拿来吧。或许她能教会你怎么挥剑。"
G["You call that slaying an opponent? I expected more... fire. Or maybe some lightning."]="你管那叫击杀对手？我还以为会……火光冲天，或者来几道闪电呢。"
G["You call that sneaking?"]="你管那叫潜行？"
G["You call that... a fight...?"]="你们这也叫……战斗……？"
G["You call this a weapon? Keep this up, knave and I'll see that you're brought back as one of them. Maybe then you will learn how to put your back into it."]="你管这玩意儿叫武器？再让我看见这样的货色，我就把你扔进锅炉和金属锭一块儿熔了。或许那时你才会明白该如何努力。"
G["You call those strong arms? Ha! I have bruises that have more muscle in them."]="你们管那叫做强壮的臂膀？还没有我瘀伤里的肌肉多呢。"
G["You call us traitors?"]="你称我们是叛徒吗？"
G["You call yourself, $n? That is a strange name for a furbolg.\n\nYou're not from Ashenvale."]="¿Te haces llamar $n? Es un nombre extraño para un fúrbolg.\n\nNo eres de Vallefresno."
G["You called?"]="有事吗？"
G["You came along just as they were about to throw me to the fiends below - for that, I thank you. Perhaps, I - rather - we, of the blue flight, can assist you further?\n\nYou have come this far, $r, risked much. Will you go a ways further to battle Nefarian and his legion of Blackrock?"]="Viniste justo cuando iban a arrojarme a esos demonios, te doy las gracias. ¿Hay algún modo en el que yo, o mejor dicho, nosotros, los del Vuelo Azul, podamos ayudarte?\n\nHas llegado hasta aquí, $r, y has arriesgado mucho. ¿Seguirás adelante para combatir a Nefarian y a su legión de Roca Negra?"
G["You came in first!"]="你是第一名！"
G["You came in second!"]="你是第二名！"
G["You came in third!"]="你是第三名！"
G["You came not a moment too soon, Wakener. The Adjuncts would have destroyed me as I slept."]="你来得正是时候，唤醒者。副官想趁我熟睡时消灭我。"
G["You came, wise sista! De Darkspear be grateful."]="你好，睿智的姐妹！暗矛部族感谢你。"
G["You can always find a handful of hunters just outside Old Town's east gate."]="你在旧城区的东门外总能看到几位猎人。"
G["You can assure Garrosh that this is a minor setback.  Our victory in Gilneas will be absolute."]="你要让加尔鲁什知道，这只是一次小小的挫折。我们必将在吉尔尼斯取得胜利。"
G["You can be sure to tell Gallywix not to underestimate Gnomeregan anymore."]="你一定要告诉加里维克斯，不要再低估诺莫瑞根了。"
G["You can beat that $pr wikket!"]="你能击败那个$pr蠢蛋！"
G["You can buy bazaar tokens for gold on the auctionhouse or from the Ascension Shop."]="Puedes comprar fichas de mercado con oro en la subasta o en la Tienda de Ascensión."
G["You can command the lions to move with the Move ability.\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\misc_arrowleft.blp:64|t"]="使用移动技能可以控制狮群移动。\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\misc_arrowleft.blp:64|t"
G["You can cook?  So can I!  Is there a recipe you can teach me?"]="你会烹饪？我也会！你有什么独门菜谱可以传授给我吗？"
G["You can count on me, Hero."]="英雄，你可以信赖我。"
G["You can count on me, Jeztor."]="你可以相信我，杰斯托。"
G["You can count on us, sir. We won't return without that boy."]="交给我们了，长官。一定带那孩子回来。"
G["You can die!"]="去死吧！"
G["You can do better than that!"]="你的表现应该比这更好！"
G["You can do it, Ace!"]="你能做到，王牌飞行员！"
G["You can do it, Flulfftail!"]="你能办到，毛尾巴！"
G["You can do it, Fungor!"]="你能做到的，冯戈！"
G["You can do this alone, you say? Is this simple foolishness or misplaced confidence I see before me?\nNo, I can see it in your eyes. You have to know. You have to prove to yourself that you can do this alone. Very well. I will retreat from the battlefield if you so wish it."]="¿Dices que podéis hacerlo solos? ¿Esto que veo ante mí es pura necedad o confianza infundada?\n\nNo, lo veo en vuestros ojos. Tenéis que saber. Tenéis que demostrar que podéis hacerlo solos. Bien. Me retiraré del campo de batalla si así lo deseáis."
G["You can do this, $p... but you cannot do this alone. You will need help from that mushan beast. Yes, I believe her name was Miss Fanny."]="你能做到，$p……但你不能孤军奋战。你需要那头穆山兽的帮助，我记得她的名字叫范妮小姐。"
G["You can enter the city."]="你可以进城了。"
G["You can fill a bucket at the water barrel.  It's fun to splash!"]="你可以在大水桶里打满一桶水。泼水真有趣！"
G["You can find Aldwin Laughlin at the Stormwind Visitor's Center in the Trade District."]="你可以在贸易区的暴风城接待中心里找到奥德文·拉弗林。"
G["You can find Arthaid, our stable master, outside of the Caregiver Center. He is located on the upper level of the central hub, near the Exodar's main entrance."]="你可以在医护中心找到我们的兽栏管理员阿尔泰德，他就站在中间轮轴的上一层，靠近埃索达主出口那里。"
G["You can find Erett the fishing trainer in the Crystal Hall near the Light Blessed Waters."]="你可以在水晶大厅靠近圣泉的地方找到钓鱼训练师伊雷特。"
G["You can find Radnaal practicing his craft outside his home on the road to Darnassus.  You should stop by and see what he can teach you."]="你可以在去达纳苏斯的路上看到拉德纳尔在他的屋外练习手艺。你应该停下来看看他有什么可以教你的。"
G["You can find Tannysa standing outside Alchemy Needs in the Mage Quarter."]="你可以在法师区的炼金材料店外面找到塔尼莎。"
G["You can find Vance Undergloom upstairs in a room at the Gallows' End Tavern on the southeast side of Brill."]="你可以在布瑞尔东南边的恐惧之末旅店的楼上的一间房间找到范斯·安德格鲁姆。"
G["You can find a leatherworking trainer at the Grummle Bazaar in Kun-Lai Summit. I will mark the location on your map."]="制皮训练师就在昆莱山的土地精集市。我会在你的地图上标出位置。"
G["You can find a mailbox just outside the Thunder Bluff Bank on the lower rise."]="你能在中部高地的底层的雷霆崖银行外面找到一个邮筒。"
G["You can find a mailbox right o'er by The Stonefire Tavern.  It's just north of the gates of Ironforge."]="你会在那边的石火旅店旁边找到一个邮箱。那就在铁炉堡大门的北面。"
G["You can find me in my house if you need me."]="如果你有什么不清楚的，可以来我家找我。"
G["You can find our mana loom in the merchant's bazaar within the Lower City."]="你可以在贫民窟的集市里找到我们的魔法织布机。"
G["You can find passage to Theramore from this dock.  Heed my words, those lands are rarely safe to travel for people of the Alliance.  Watch your step and your back."]="你可以从这个码头找到去塞拉摩的路。记住我的话，那些地方对从联盟去的人们是非常不安全的。一定要小心谨慎。"
G["You can find the Conquest Quartermaster and the Glorious Conquest Quartermaster on the Serpent's Spine to the west.\n\nI will mark their location on your map."]="你可以在西边的蟠龙脊上找到征服军需官和精锐征服军需官。\n\n我会在你的地图上标出他们的位置。"
G["You can find the barber shop on the west portion of The Commons."]="理发店就在平民区的西部。"
G["You can find the gryphon master on the northeast rampart overlooking the Valley of Heroes."]="你可以在英雄谷东北边的那个城堡平台上找到狮鹫管理员。"
G["You can find the person you seek at Nesingwary's Safari in the Valley of the Four Winds.\n\nI will mark their location on your map."]="你可以在四风谷的奈辛瓦里狩猎队营地里找到你要找的人。\n\n我会在你的地图上标出位置。"
G["You can find the scribe, Zantasia in the Court of the Sun."]="赞塔希娅在逐日王庭。"
G["You can find your malts at the granary, I reckon."]="我想你可以从粮仓里找到你要的甜麦芽。"
G["You can follow me to the Loading Room, $n."]="我会带你去装载室，$n。"
G["You can forfeit if you'd like."]="如果你愿意，可以放弃。"
G["You can forget about re-election, magistrate!"]="你别想连任了，地方官！"
G["You can forget about those drinks later!"]="不用再想那些酒啦！"
G["You can go about your business."]="你可以去做你自己的事了。"
G["You can go home now. I'll cover your back."]="你现在可以回家了。我来掩护你。"
G["You can go home to your family now."]="你现在可以回去与家人团聚了。"
G["You can go tell Stoutmantle this is where the Defias Gang is holed up, $n."]="你可以去告诉斯托曼，这里就是迪菲亚盗贼的藏身之处，$n。"
G["You can have anything you desire... for a price."]="你可以获得任何你想要的东西……只要付得起代价。"
G["You can have that one, I no longer need him!"]="你可以随便处理他，我已经不需要他了！"
G["You can help me out of here?  Well  there is no reason to stand around, let's go!"]="你能帮我出去吗？没理由闲着不动，我们走吧！"
G["You can improve your fishing skill by visiting Nat Pagle at the Anglers Wharf in the Krasarang Wilds. Let me mark the location for you."]="你可以去卡桑琅丛林的渔人码头找纳特·帕格，提升钓鱼技能。让我为你标出他的位置。"
G["You can keep your stick-fighting and your mist-weaving to yourselves. I'm perfectly happy standing here and watching."]="你还是留着你的棍术和织雾绝招吧，我站在这里看看就行了。"
G["You can kiss me if you like, just be quick about it."]="如果你愿意的话，可以吻我，快来吧。"
G["You can learn a great deal about this land from the Valley of the Four Winds."]="你能从四风谷了解到许多与这片土地有关的事。"
G["You can learn from me in time... but not yet! Why don't you start out by talking to Sprite Jumpsprocket to my right here. You can check in with me after you've gotten your feet wet!"]="你总有一天能跟我学习……但现在还不是时候！为什么不先跟站在我右边的斯普莱特聊聊呢。入门之后再来找我！"
G["You can learn to sew up in Orgrimmar.  That's to the north.  Maybe one of the Orgrimmar Grunts can help you."]="你可以试着在奥格瑞玛解决你的问题，就在这里的北方。或许某个奥格瑞玛步兵可以帮你。"
G["You can leave my sight, squire, before I slay you. Again."]="别出现在我面前，不然我杀了你。我再说一次。"
G["You can never be too prepared."]="你永远都无法做好万全的准备。"
G["You can never have enough... shoes..."]="鞋是永远不嫌……多的……"
G["You can never leave this place. There is no way home."]="你休想离开这里。你回不去了。"
G["You can never replace me. Chip will never stoop to dating someone who makes a brute look attractive!"]="你永远都取代不了我。奇普永远不会堕落到与一个比蠢猪更蠢的家伙约会！"
G["You can never stop the Scourge!"]="你绝不可能阻止天灾！"
G["You can normally find Miss Primrose's flower stand in southeast Dalaran."]="你可以在达拉然东南部找到爱丽丝·普里洛斯小姐的花摊。"
G["You can often supply us with multiples of an item for extra effect. Just try to keep the benefits from wearing off."]="你可以为我们提供相同的道具补给来获得额外的特效。尽量保持这些特效，别让它们过期了。"
G["You can only hide behind Leza's pain for so long. Sooner or later you must stand as the Sunwalker you claim to be and lead us against the enemies of the horde."]="你不能再以莱莎的痛苦为借口了。迟早，你要作为一名烈日行者挺身而出，带领我们对抗部落的敌人。"
G["You can only ride the Mountain Horse in the Crowley Stable Grounds and the Crowley Orchard."]="你只能在克罗雷马厩场和克罗雷果园中骑乘高山马。"
G["You can pick up your love letters outside the bank in the middle of the Valley of Strength."]="你可以在力量谷中部的银行外面找到接收你情书的地方。"
G["You can play more tomorrow. Now come on inside."]="明天再玩吧，现在快回屋里来。"
G["You can purchase mining supplies in the back of the chamber of masters, from Razzie Coalwrench.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="在可以在师匠大厅里找拉兹·煤钳购买采矿用品。\n\n我会在你的地图上标记这个位置。"
G["You can purchase mining supplies in the crafter's hall, to the left as you enter the main building.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="你可以在工匠大厅内购买采矿用品，就位于你进入主建筑物时的左侧。\n\n我会在你的地图上标记这个位置。"
G["You can rest assured that my loyalties lie with your Horde."]="你大可放心，我的忠诚与部落同在。"
G["You can return to the Shado-Pan Garrison to select a new Shado-Pan Companion.\nAre you sure you want to dismiss your Shado-Pan Companion?"]="Puedes volver al Cuartel del Shadopan para elegir un nuevo compañero del Shadopan.\n\n¿Seguro que quieres que tu compañero del Shadopan se retire?"
G["You can see me? Do you know how much I'm ignored up here just because no one can see me? How refreshing to finally have someone to talk to!\n\nSo, you must have been sent by some living member of my former mercenary company, am I right? Of course I am!\n\nBut enough idle chit-chat, there's a great deal of work for you and I if you're going to put things right and return Lord Valthalak's spirit to him!"]="你能看见我？你知道我一个人在这里游来荡去被忽视有多久了吗？就是没有没有人能看见我。能有人陪我说话真好！\n\n啊，你一定是我以前待过的那个雇佣兵团里的生还者派来的，我说的对不对？显然就对呀！\n\n好了好了，不多寒暄了，要想把灵魂还给瓦塔拉克公爵，并让一切纳入正轨，还有许多事情要做呢！"
G["You can see me? How can you see me, boss?\n\nI'm going to have to work on that."]="¿Puedes verme? ¿Cómo es que puedes verme, $gjefe:jefa;?\n\nTengo que trabajar en eso."
G["You can see through the fog that hangs over this world like a shroud, and grasp where true power lies."]="你们能够看穿遮蔽世界的迷雾，掌握真正的力量。"
G["You can sleep in the barracks, if you'd like. Just don't wake my men, or I'll throw you out in the snow myself."]="如果你愿意的话，就去兵营休息吧。但不要吵醒我的士兵，不然我会亲手将你扔到雪地里。"
G["You can start by telling us where the World Pillar fragment is.  My gryphon's starting to look a bit tired from hauling you around."]="你可以从世界之柱碎片的下落开始说。带着你这个胖子飞了这么长的时间，我的狮鹫看上去有点儿累了。"
G["You can take a man away from the Sons of Lothar, but you can't take the Sons out of him.\n\n<The smith shrugs.>\n\nIt's hard to explain, but I don't feel like I'm meant to be at Honor Hold right now, is all.\n\nPerhaps I'm meant to be part of something larger."]="你可以让一个人脱离洛萨之子组织，但你不能从他心中抹去这个身份的意义。\n\n<工匠耸了耸肩。>\n\n这很难解释，但是我觉得我不应该呆在荣耀堡。\n\n或许我应该成就一番伟业。"
G["You can take our lives... but you'll... never... take... our brew..."]="就算你夺走我们的生命……也别想……夺走……我们的酒……"
G["You can talk to Anya Maulray up by the inn on the upper ring of the Trade Quarter. I wouldn't recommend it, but they're your pets."]="你可以同安雅·玛尔雷谈一谈，他就在贸易区上层的旅店旁边。我并不建议你这样做，不过它们毕竟是你的宠物。"
G["You can talk until you're blue in the face, I'm not delivering the ata'mal crystal to you."]="就算你一直说到脸色发青，我也不会把阿塔玛水晶交给你的。"
G["You can teach a soldier how to kill, but you can't teach him to want to kill.  That is one thing we don't have to worry about down here.  Every single one of my boys can't wait to take a piece out of those naga for what they did to us, and I can't say I feel  much different.\n\nWe need to find a way to make contact with the surface, but before that, I want to make a bit of \"contact\" with these naga.  We have some brothers to avenge."]="Puedes enseñar a un soldado a matar, pero no puedes hacer que quiera matar. De eso no tenemos que preocuparnos aquí abajo. Todos y cada uno de mis muchachos ansían hacer pedazos a esos nagas por lo que nos hicieron, y no puedo decir que yo opine lo contrario.\n\nNecesitamos encontrar la forma de entrar en contacto con la superficie, pero antes de eso, quiero entrar en \"contacto\" con esos nagas. Debemos vengar a nuestros hermanos."
G["You can tell a lot about a designer in how they weave their fabric together. Yours has the look of function over pride.\n\nTightly sealed with mana infused right into the fabric. Impressive, though it could benefit from an artistic hand."]="你总能从设计师设计的服装上看出他们的性格。你的服装看上去实用大于美观。\n\n灌注了法力的织物缝合紧密。很出色，不过要是能有一个风雅的设计师来改进一下就更好了。"
G["You can tell that booming voice that he's nothing but hot air!"]="你要明白，那个大嗓门就会吹牛而已！"
G["You can thank $n for getting me back here safely, father."]="你应该感谢$n安全地把我带回来，爸爸。"
G["You can thank me anytime for making your life more interesting."]="你可以在任何时候感谢我，因为我令你的生活更加有趣。"
G["You can thank me later."]="到那时，你就会感谢我了。"
G["You can trade your marks of justice with Commander Lo Ping, who can be found at Niuzao Temple in the Townlong Steppes.\n\nI will mark his location on your map."]="你可以找指挥官罗平兑换公正印记，他就在螳螂高原的砮皂寺。\n\n我会在你的地图上标出他的位置。"
G["You can trust a goblin to COUNT your coins, but not to GUARD them."]="地精可以帮你把钱数得一清二楚，但你绝对要小心他们。"
G["You can trust any pets you have to be well taken care of by Alassin.  He resides in the Cenarion Enclave where the hunters gather."]="阿拉辛是个值得信赖的人，让他来悉心照料你的任何宠物。他就住在猎人们聚集的塞纳里奥区。"
G["You can trust me.  I am no friend of the Lich King's."]="相信我。我不是巫妖王的朋友。"
G["You can trust our auctioneers."]="你可以信任我们的拍卖师。"
G["You can turn my steel against the \"Warchief,\" but only against his corrupt soldiers - leave the civilians out of your bloodshed!"]="Podrás hacer que mi acero se vuelva contra el \"Jefe de Guerra\", pero tan solo contra sus soldados corruptos. ¡Deja a los civiles al margen de este derramamiento de sangre!"
G["You can understand me? I can understand you!"]="你能听懂我说的话？我能听懂你说的！"
G["You can use her, but I don't want to hear any complaints about saw blades in your seat. I had to fix 'er with what we could find."]="你可以开着她去兜风，不过万一你在座椅上发现了刀片，可别来跟我抱怨。你要知道，我好不容易才凑齐了零件修理她，就别那么讲究啦。"
G["You can use the bombs and cannons nearby to blast the hozen away!"]="你可以使用附近的炸弹和火炮来轰走猢狲！"
G["You can use the shark in a minute, just wait your turn!"]="再等一分钟鲨鱼就给你用，还没轮到你呢！"
G["You can use these beakers and alchemy tools to perform experiments with various types of submarine fuel."]="你可以用这些烧杯和炼金工具进行各种潜水艇燃料的实验。"
G["You can usually find Brother Wilhelm in back of the smithy trading stories with Lyria.  He's always up for teaching fellow paladins new skills."]="你通常可以在铁匠铺的后面发现威尔海姆修士和里瑞亚互相讲故事。他总是很乐意向圣骑士们传授新的技艺。"
G["You can't be serious!  Did you forget everything that $n did for us?"]="你不会是认真的吧！难道你忘记了$n为我们做的一切？"
G["You can't be serious!  Did you forget everything that $n did for us?  $gHe:She; stayed behind... for us!"]="你不会是认真的吧！难道你忘记了$n为我们做的一切？$g他:她;留下来……都是为了我们！"
G["You can't be serious, Crowley. You miserable bastard!"]="你不是认真的吧，克罗雷。你这可怜的混蛋！"
G["You can't blame me for our mishaps... I can't even see where I'm going!\n\nThough maybe that means you can blame me...\n\nNo!  Wait!  I can dock this ship just fine... It's gotta be the orders the captain issues!  Maybe he likes pushing us to our limits and testing out our survival and repair skills."]="你不能把我们的坏运气都怪在我的头上吧……我甚至都不知道我要去哪！\n\n尽管也许那意思是说你能责怪我……\n\n不！等等！我能把这艘船完好的停进港口的……但那肯定是船长发出的命令！也许他喜欢挑战我们的极限来测试我们的生存能力还有修理技术。"
G["You can't buy me! DIE!"]="你收买不了我！去死吧！"
G["You can't catch me Lo!"]="你抓不到我，罗！"
G["You can't catch me!"]="你抓不住我！"
G["You can't come in here all dirty like that. You need that nasty flesh scrubbed off first!"]="别就这么脏兮兮的进来。赶快把身上的脏肉给我弄干净！"
G["You can't come in here!"]="你不能到这里来！"
G["You can't do this to me!  We had a deal!"]="你不能这样对我！我们事先说好了的！"
G["You can't do this to us!"]="你不能对我们这样做！"
G["You can't do this! I have my own soul shard!"]="你不能这样做！我有我自己的灵魂碎片！"
G["You can't fight da power!"]="你没可能胜过这伟大的战力！"
G["You can't find someone? Well only three possible places a person can be.\n\nEither they're here at the market, or they're at their own house for the day, or they're at Sunsong Ranch.\n\nIf you don't see them at any of those places, you might need your eyes checked!"]="有些人你找不到？好吧，他们只可能出现在三个地方。\n\n要么在市集里，要么一整天待在家里，要么在日歌农场里。\n\n如果这三个地方还找不到他们，那你就该去检查下你的眼睛了！"
G["You can't fly and be stealthy at the same time.... I tried."]="你是不可能神不知鬼不觉地飞进去的……我试过了。"
G["You can't fly here. We'll be spotted for sure!"]="你不能在这里飞行。我们一定会被发现的！"
G["You can't get away from a warrior of The Horde! Take that! And that!"]="你是无法从部落战士手中逃脱的！看招！嘿哈！"
G["You can't hide from me!"]="你休想躲过我的眼睛！"
G["You can't hide from us.  Prepare to burn!"]="你别想再躲着我们了。准备去死吧！"
G["You can't hold me against my will! You've all been brainwashed!"]="为什么要将我强行关押起来啊！你脑子坏了吗！"
G["You can't just fly in there - you'll be spotted for sure. Don't you think we've already tried that?"]="你不能就这么飞进去——肯定会被发现的。你以为我们没有试过吗？"
G["You can't outrun the storm."]="你休想逃出风暴的掌控。"
G["You can't possibly mean to.... I'll write you up for this, $c!"]="你不会是想……我要把你的罪行详细记录下来，$c！"
G["You can't run forever!"]="别以为你能逃掉！"
G["You can't stop the inevitable, fel orc.  Hellfire Citadel will soon fall."]="这都是命中注定的，邪兽人。地狱火堡垒不久就将毁灭。"
G["You can't stop us from exposing the truth about Jaina's cowardice!"]="我们一定要把吉安娜的懦弱行径曝光！"
G["You can't stop us! The Horde will never fall!"]="你别想阻止我们！部落永远不会被打败！"
G["You can't stop what has begun!"]="一旦开始，你便无法阻止！"
G["You can't study my techniques until you've learned the basics. Speak with Kamari if you are interested in training."]="你在学习好基础知识之前不能学我的技艺。如果你对训练感兴趣的话就去找卡玛瑞谈谈。"
G["You can't take this away from me!  Not now, not ever!"]="你不能把它拿走！任何时候都不能！"
G["You can't teach an old dog new tricks.  At least that's what someone once told me.  Lucky for you, I've discovered it to be untrue.\n\nNow then, would you like your pet to unlearn talents?"]="老狗学不会新把戏。至少我听人这么说过。你运气真好，因为我发现这种说法是错误的。\n\n现在，你打算让宠物遗忘天赋吗？"
G["You can't treat us this way!"]="你们不能这样对待我们！"
G["You can't... kill... me spirit!"]="你们……永远无法消灭……我的灵魂！"
G["You cannot ... control the Eye! Cho'gall will know. You will be ... punished."]="你无法……控制眼睛！古加尔会知道的。你将受到……惩罚。"
G["You cannot afford Szabo's services. We do not work for free, little waif.\n\nAway with you to the bank. Bring Szabo all of your macaroons."]="苏扎博的服务不是你能负担得起的。我们可不提供免费服务，小家伙。\n\n还是先去银行吧。把你的杏仁币全都给苏扎博拿来。"
G["You cannot be serious!  We are severely understaffed and can barely keep this manaforge functional!"]="你不会是认真的吧！我们的人手已经严重不足，都快要不能维持法力熔炉的正常运作了！"
G["You cannot deceive me, demon!  Your strength wanes just as my faith bolsters!"]="你欺骗不了我，恶魔！你的力量因为我对信念的坚持而渐渐变弱了！"
G["You cannot defeat me with such brute force."]="光靠蛮力可击败不了我。"
G["You cannot defeat me. I'm an inseparable part of you!"]="别想打败我。我是你身体不可分割的一部分！"
G["You cannot defeat the Frostwolf clan!"]="你不能击败霜狼部落！"
G["You cannot defeat the Lich King. Not here. You would be a fool to try. He will kill those that follow you and raise them as powerful soldiers of the Scourge. But for you, Sylvanas, his reward for you would be worse than the last."]="在这里，你无法击败巫妖王。这种企图是愚蠢的。他会打倒那些跟随你的人，把他们变成强大的天灾战士。只有你除外，希尔瓦娜斯……他对你的“馈赠”要比上次更恐怖。"
G["You cannot defeat the shifting sands of this land."]="你无法击败这片土地上的流沙。"
G["You cannot destroy us..."]="你无法消灭我们……"
G["You cannot escape me. I am... in... every...  breath..."]="你们逃不出我的掌心。我……无处……不在……"
G["You cannot escape the Master's Wrath..."]="你无法逃脱主人的怒火……"
G["You cannot escape the Master's Wrath...."]="你无法逃脱主人的怒火……"
G["You cannot escape the highlands, orcs!"]="你们别想逃离高地，兽人！"
G["You cannot escape the storm!"]="你休想躲过这场风暴！"
G["You cannot escape the storm."]="你休想躲过这场风暴。"
G["You cannot escape us!"]="你是逃不走的！"
G["You cannot escape your fate!"]="你无法逃脱命运！"
G["You cannot escape your fate, traitor!"]="你摆脱不了你的命运，叛徒！"
G["You cannot fight fate!"]="你休想与命运抗争！"
G["You cannot have it!"]="你休想夺走！"
G["You cannot hide from fate!"]="你们无法逃避命运！"
G["You cannot hide from me!"]="休想从我面前逃掉！"
G["You cannot hide from me, Culuthas!  I will hunt you down no matter where you go!"]="休想逃过我的眼睛，库鲁萨斯。无论你逃到哪儿，我都不会放过你！"
G["You cannot hide from me, mortal!"]="休想逃过我的眼睛，凡人！"
G["You cannot hide from me, rogue. I can smell your fear."]="No puedes ocultarte de mi, $gpícaro:pícara;. Puedo oler tu miedo."
G["You cannot hide from searing flame!"]="你们在灼热的烈焰面前无处可逃！"
G["You cannot hide from us, little paladin!"]="你躲不了的，小圣骑士！"
G["You cannot hide in this temple forever, Shaman."]="你不可能永远躲在这座神殿里，萨满。"
G["You cannot hide, breather!"]="你无处可躲，凡人！"
G["You cannot hope to stop us..."]="你休想阻止我们……"
G["You cannot keep our wards!"]="你不能夺走我们的结界！"
G["You cannot kill me, fools! I'll be back, I'll...."]="你们杀不死我的，蠢货！我会回来的！我会……"
G["You cannot leave... IT mustn't find us!"]="你不能走……不能让它找到我们！"
G["You cannot let him walk all over you like that! Go get his heart, girl!"]="你不能让他就这样轻松地战胜你！孩子，你要直捣他的命门！"
G["You cannot possibly be suggesting that these baubles of yours hold sway over the very fabric of life itself!"]="你不会是想说你卖的这堆破烂能改变人们的生活吧？"
G["You cannot possibly comprehend the forces stacked against you."]="你根本无法理解自己面对的是什么力量。"
G["You cannot ride a mount in that form."]="你无法在该形态下骑乘。"
G["You cannot save him!"]="你救不了他！"
G["You cannot save... Neptulon!"]="你救不了……耐普图隆！"
G["You cannot stand against the fire of the yaungol!"]="你无法经受住野牛人的烈焰！！"
G["You cannot stand against the might of the Lich King, mortals!"]="凡人，你们无法与巫妖王的力量抗衡！"
G["You cannot stop Her Majesty's brood! Our numbers are endless!"]="你无法阻挡女皇的虫群！我们的数量无穷无尽！"
G["You cannot stop Thel'zan! He bears the dark gift, bestowed upon him by the Lich King himself!"]="你们不可能阻止塞尔赞！他拥有巫妖王陛下赐予的黑暗之能！"
G["You cannot stop the Scarlet Crusade!"]="你无法阻止血色十字军前进的脚步！"
G["You cannot stop the tide!"]="你们无法阻止汹涌的海潮！"
G["You cannot stop them..."]="你没法阻止他们……"
G["You cannot stop us all!"]="你无法阻止我们！"
G["You cannot stop us!"]="你休想阻止我们！"
G["You cannot stop us!  We will wield the power beneath the tombs!"]="你不可能阻止我们！我们将释放这片坟墓下面所埋藏的能量！"
G["You cannot stop us! Our army will lead the coming storm!"]="你休想阻止我们！我们的大军将带来狂风骤雨！"
G["You cannot stop your final Cataclysm!"]="你休想抗拒末日的降临！"
G["You cannot stop... the end..."]="你无法阻止……末日……"
G["You cannot succeed. Your cause is hopeless."]="你不会成功的。你的事业毫无希望。"
G["You cannot win, Darion!"]="你赢不了的，达里安！"
G["You cannot win. Not like this..."]="你不可能获胜。照目前的情形，是毫无希望的……"
G["You cannot withstand the power of my forces!"]="你不可能抵挡得住我的军团！"
G["You cannot... be serious, Olum.  Your sacrifice has already been too great."]="你……不要开玩笑，奥鲁姆。你已经做出了太多的牺牲。"
G["You cannot...escape!"]="你休想……逃跑！"
G["You capture Karrog!  Karrog smash you!"]="你抓住了卡尔洛格！卡尔洛格抽你！"
G["You carried that with your hands?! Uh... you should probably see a medic when we get back..."]="你是直接用手拿的？！呃……等我们回去之后，你最好去找个医生看看……"
G["You carry the taint of the Scourge.  Prepare to enter the Twisting Nether."]="你受到了天灾军团的污染。准备进入扭曲虚空。"
G["You cause is foolish and futile. You haven't the strength to hold on to those dearest to you."]="你的举动愚蠢而徒劳。你没有力量去守护你最珍视的人。"
G["You certainly are brave, but you're alone when it comes to this place, dryskin."]="干皮人，你很勇敢。如果你坚持要去破柱子的话，那么再见。"
G["You certainly did not disappoint! Now that we've gotten that out of the way, your instruction may begin!"]="你当然不会失望!现在既然我们已经把那个清除掉,你可以下达指令了!"
G["You certainly don't pal, 'cause the good news is YOU'RE FIRED! The bad news is you've got - you've all got - just one week to regain your jobs, starting tonight. Starting with tonight's build."]="你们当然不是好伙伴啦，因为你们都被解雇了！这算是个好消息吧。那么，坏消息是，我会给你们一周的时间，根据表现决定是否让你们复职。就从今天晚上开始吧。"
G["You challenge Don Carlos? Guerrero! GO!"]="你想挑战卡洛斯？古雷罗！上吧！"
G["You challenge Kaw, destroyer of mammoths!? Then face me and feel my thunder!"]="你要向猛犸毁灭者卡奥挑战！？啧啧，来一较高下吧！"
G["You challenge death itself! Come then, \"King.\" Face the might of Mograine!"]="¡Desafías a la propia muerte! Si así lo quieres, acércate, \"rey\". ¡Enfréntate al poder de Mograine!"
G["You challenge me, boy? I don't have time for this...."]="孩子，你想挑战我？我可没时间陪你玩……"
G["You challenge the charge of the Blue Dragonflight? DIE, vermin."]="你胆敢向蓝龙挑战？死吧，可怜虫。"
G["You challenge?"]="你想挑战？"
G["You challenged us and we have come. Where is this master you speak of?"]="你向我们发出挑战而我们来了。你所说的大师在哪里？"
G["You cheat."]="你骗人。"
G["You cheated!"]="你这个骗子！"
G["You check the front!"]="你去前面看看！"
G["You chickens are tougher than I thought! I'll have to improvise!"]="这些鸡比我想象中难对付！我不该掉以轻心的！"
G["You choose my corpse over another ally against the undead?  So be it."]="在这么多战友中，你单单选择我的躯体对抗亡灵？那好吧。"
G["You chose a good day to come to the market, neighbor."]="今天可真是逛集市的好日子啊，邻居。"
G["You chose the wrong hunter to hunt! $p, kite that thing a little further away so I can get a better shot."]="你选错猎手了！$p，把那家伙引远点儿，我才能射得更准。"
G["You chose the wrong opponent."]="你选错了对手。"
G["You chose well."]="你选对人了。"
G["You chose your warchief over the Kirin-Tor."]="肯瑞托在你们心中还不如那个酋长。"
G["You cleansed Gu Cloudstrike's soul, the Shado-Pan thank you."]="你洗礼了古·穿云的灵魂，影踪派感谢你。"
G["You clearly lack the capacity to grasp the intricacies of the arcane, $c. Off with you."]="很明显你缺乏控制复杂的奥术能量所必需的能力，$c。闪开点。"
G["You cling to a shattered world... Your time comes... soon enough..."]="你不过是个抱残守缺的可怜虫……你的末日……很快就会降临……"
G["You come as the carrion bird before a battle."]="你就像大战在即之前盘旋的腐食鸟。"
G["You come in search of training, hunter?"]="¿Vienes en busca de instrucción, $gcazador:cazadora;?"
G["You come into my house and threaten ME?  I think not!"]="你闯进我的家门来威胁我？我可不认为你能如愿。"
G["You come seeking answers? Then have them! Look upon your answer to living!"]="你们来寻找答案吗？来吧！用你们的生命来索求吧！"
G["You come to die!"]="你来送死吗？"
G["You come to fight my brood? You come to steal my treasures?"]="你是来打我的孩子的？还是来偷我的财宝的？"
G["You come to join the fight, $c?"]="你是来参战的吗，$c？"
G["You come to learn how to ride?"]="你要学习如何驾驭坐骑？"
G["You come to see ol' Tapin, eh? Hear 'bout my nickname? There was a time they called me \"the barber\" on account of my skill with skinnin'."]="¿O sea que has venido a ver al viejo Tapin? ¿Te han contado mi apodo? Hubo una época en la que me llamaban \"el barbero\" por mi habilidad en desuello."
G["You come to steal our filth?"]="你想偷我们的污物吗？"
G["You come to us with title and so we will listen, but do not try our patience, $c.  The council has no time for idle gossip from one such as you."]="Ya que posees un título te escucharemos, pero no pongas a prueba nuestra paciencia, $c. El consejo no tiene tiempo para escuchar chismorreos de alguien como tú."
G["You come to wrong place. Talk to the expert Godan over there. You learn more from him."]="你来错地方了。去找那边的专家古丹谈谈。你可以从他那儿学到更多东西。"
G["You comfy down there?"]="你在底下还舒服吗？"
G["You complain much, like a shield-maiden!"]="你就知道抱怨，像女人似的！"
G["You complete me."]="Me completas."
G["You confuse strength with fortitude, young dragon. But power is worthless without spirit!"]="你把力量和坚忍搞混了，小龙。没有精神的力量一无是处！"
G["You continue to bow to the Kirin Tor as if they were our saviors. Do not forget their treachery, Aethas."]="你一味对肯瑞托卑躬屈膝，好像他们才是我们的救世主。别忘了他们的背叛，艾萨斯。"
G["You continue to impress me, $n."]="你总能打动我，$n。"
G["You continue to thumb through the journal looking for any information that might help in your search for the stolen chest.\n\nTowards the final pages of the book, in red pencil, you see a notation from James along the side of the page. It says, \"Old home near Stone Cairn Lake... gnolls will work perfectly as bodyguards.\"\n\nThere is no reason to suggest this is where the chest is, but there doesn't seem to be any other clues."]="\"Sigues hojeando el diario buscando algo de información que pueda ayudarte en tu búsqueda del cofre robado.\n\nHacia el final del libro, en letras rojas, ves una nota de James en el margen de la página. Dice: \"Casa vieja cerca del Lago del Hito... los gnolls servirán de guardaespaldas perfectamente.\"\n\nNo hay ninguna razón que apunte a que ese es el lugar donde está el cofre, pero no parece haber más pistas.\""
G["You could all learn a lot from $n!"]="你们能从$n身上学到很多东西！"
G["You could at least try to sound a little bit convincing.\n\nLook, Nuaar, I wasn't going to tell you this, but I might as well because it's going to involve you, too.  Maxnar is planning an all-out attack on the druids at Ruuan Weald.  And he intends to wipe them out.\n\nIt's bad enough that we've been fighting with the Boulder'mok ogres, so we can't afford another front to deal with.  I've arranged for a temporary truce with the arakkoa.\n\nWell, what do you think?"]="你怎么着也应该说得可信一点吧。\n\n努埃尔，我原本不打算告诉你这件事的，但是你还是知道为好，因为你跟这件事扯上关系了。玛克纳尔正筹划着对卢安荒野的德鲁伊们发动一次全面进攻，并且把他们一网打尽。\n\n对我们来说，和砾石食人魔们战斗已经足够糟糕了，所以我们不能双线作战。我准备和鸦人签署短暂的停战协议。\n\n你觉得怎么样？"
G["You could bounce a washer off those legs!"]="你能从那些腿上弄一个垫片下来！"
G["You could die of dysentery out here."]="你在这里可能会死于痢疾。"
G["You could have been my greatest champion, Fordring: A force of darkness that would wash over this world and deliver it into a new age of strife."]="弗丁，你本应是我最强大的战士，你的黑暗力量将清洗这个世界，开启一个新的世代。"
G["You could learn much by watching me in action."]="观察我的动作会令你受益匪浅。"
G["You could use a makeover."]="你需要改变一下外形。"
G["You couldn't ask for a finer person than $n, I say."]="我敢说，再也找不到比$n更出色的人了。"
G["You couldn't handle a lone night elf priestess?"]="你连一个落单的暗夜精灵女祭司都没法摆平？"
G["You couldn't have come at a better time!  Let's get out of here."]="你就不能挑个更好的时候来吗！我们赶紧离开这里。"
G["You cower behind your walls! If it wasn't for $n here the Alliance would be marching through Mulgore."]="你这个只会躲在墙后的懦夫！要不是有$n在，联盟早就杀进莫高雷了。"
G["You crawl unwitting, like a blind, writhing worm, towards endless madness and despair. I have witnessed the true End Time. This? This is a blessing you simply cannot comprehend."]="你在地上无知地爬行，像一只瞎眼的爬虫，向着无尽的疯狂与绝望蠕动。我见证了真正的时光之末。这儿？这儿只是你无法理解的祝福。"
G["You crazy! Girl, YOU CRAZY!"]="你疯了！女孩，你疯了！"
G["You cross the Stormbinder! I'll slaughter you all."]="你们竟敢挑战缚风者！我要杀光你们。"
G["You cross the precipice of oblivion!"]="这条道路的尽头就是湮灭！"
G["You cultists are cowards. You make me sick!"]="你们这些教徒都是懦夫。你们令我恶心！"
G["You cultists are going to pay! Someone get me out of here!"]="你们这些邪教徒一定要付出代价！一定会有人救我出去的！"
G["You cut the rope. You have the knife."]="你割绳子。你有小刀。"
G["You da boss now, yeah?  Long live da new king!\n\nKreeg let you look at Gordok hooch.  Ogre hooch best of all hooch, and Gordok hooch best of all ogre hooch!  Maybe you buy some from me, ya boss?!"]="¿Tú ser $gnuevo jefe:nueva jefa;, no? ¡Viva $gel nuevo rey:la nueva reina;!\n\nKreeg dejarte ver el garrafón de Gordok. ¡El garrafón ogro ser mejor garrafón de todos, y garrafón de Gordok ser el mejor de todos los garrafones ogros! ¿Quizás quieras comprarme algo, $gjefe:jefa;?"
G["You da man now, dog!"]="卑微的家伙，你现在是个男人啦！"
G["You da new Ook!"]="你是新乌克！"
G["You da strong one now!  All hail to da new king of da Gordok!"]="¡Tú ahora $gel más fuerte:la más fuerte;! ¡Que todos saluden $gal nuevo rey:a la nueva reina; de los Gordok!"
G["You dang-blasted rock elementals!"]="你们这些该死的石头元素！"
G["You dare befoul my sanctum! Pay with your blood!"]="你竟敢玷污我的圣殿！用鲜血偿还吧！"
G["You dare call upon a lord of Skywall, $n? I will destroy you and cast your carcass back down into the pit of slime from whence you crawled!"]="你竟敢召唤天空之墙的领主，$n？我要杀了你，然后把你的尸体扔回到你爬行而出的烂泥坑里！"
G["You dare challenge Nedar, lord of the tundra!?"]="你竟敢挑战北风苔原的领主尼达尔！？"
G["You dare challenge Winterskorn?! I will impale you on your own puny flag!"]="你竟敢向斯克恩宣战？！我要用那面旗帜刺穿你的身体！"
G["You dare challenge me at my own dwelling?  Your arrogance is astounding, even for a dragon!"]="你胆敢在我的地盘挑战我？虽然你是一条龙，但是你的自大仍然让我震惊！"
G["You dare challenge me?"]="你竟敢挑战我？"
G["You dare challenge me? I'll show you the true power of the Horde!"]="你竟敢挑战我？我要让你见识部落真正的力量！"
G["You dare challenge me? Prepare for an eternity of dread."]="你敢向我挑战？准备面对无尽的恐惧吧。"
G["You dare challenge me?!"]="你胆敢挑战我？！"
G["You dare challenge the Empire?"]="你胆敢挑战帝国？"
G["You dare challenge the Kor'kron!"]="你竟敢挑战库卡隆！"
G["You dare challenge the avatars of flame?"]="你胆敢挑战烈焰的化身？"
G["You dare challenge the voice of the Empress? What the voice speaks, the swarm hears!"]="你竟敢藐视女皇的声音？这声音足以号令整个虫群！"
G["You dare challenge the warchief?"]="你竟敢挑战酋长？"
G["You dare challenge the yaungol?"]="你胆敢挑战野牛人吗？"
G["You dare come into my pool?!"]="你竟敢跨进我的地盘！"
G["You dare defile Frostmane Hold, $R. Prepare to die!"]="你们居然胆敢侵犯霜鬃巨魔的要塞，那就准备受死吧！"
G["You dare defile this holy ground?"]="你敢玷污这片圣地吗？"
G["You dare defy the Warchief?!"]="你竟敢反抗酋长？！"
G["You dare deny me?!"]="你们竟敢违抗我？！"
G["You dare disrupt my works here?! Take this time to prepare yourselves... when I return, there will be nothing but death and destruction in my wake!"]="你竟敢阻挠我们的工作？！都洗干净脖子等着吧……当我们回来的时候，死亡与毁灭将终结一切！"
G["You dare disturb the Saurok brood? That is punishable by death."]="你竟敢打扰蜥蜴人的孵化仪式？这是死罪！"
G["You dare face the fire of the yaungol?!"]="你胆敢面对野牛人的烈焰？！"
G["You dare fight me?  I was trained by Illidan himself!"]="你胆敢挑战我？我是伊利丹大人亲手训练出来的！"
G["You dare impede official Sunhawk communications?"]="你胆敢插手炎鹰部队的事务？"
G["You dare imprison me? You will die!"]="你胆敢囚禁我？你死定了！"
G["You dare interfere with the Master's endeavors?  You will pay, foolish mortal!"]="你胆敢妨碍主人的计划？你会付出代价的，愚蠢的凡人！"
G["You dare interfere with this being's test? The battle must be fought alone! You shall all suffer for this indiscretion."]="你敢干预这家伙的试炼？挑战者必须独立战斗！你会为你的轻率之举付出代价的。"
G["You dare interrupt our prayer? Execute them!"]="你敢打断我们的祈祷？处决他们！"
G["You dare intrude in my sanctum?  I promise you a world of pain!"]="你胆敢闯入我的圣地？我要让你堕入痛苦的深渊！"
G["You dare invade Magnataur lands?  Bonesunder gladly smash you and take your limbs as payment!"]="你竟敢闯入猛犸人的领地？裂骨者要把你拍成肉酱！"
G["You dare invade our lord's sanctum?"]="你们竟敢侵入我们主人的圣殿？"
G["You dare look upon the host of souls? I SHALL DEVOUR YOU WHOLE!"]="你竟敢和灵魂之主对视？我会把你一口吃掉！"
G["You dare set foot inside Ravenholdt Manor, worm?"]="你敢踏入拉文霍德庄园，可怜虫？"
G["You dare set foot upon Hakkari holy ground? Minions of Hakkar, destroy the infidels!"]="你胆敢踏足哈卡的圣地？哈卡的属下们，摧毁这些异教徒！"
G["You dare speak to me, blue skinned mongrel? I would sooner die than tell you anything."]="你胆敢和我说话，蓝皮肤的杂种。我宁可现在就去死，也不会告诉你任何事情的。"
G["You dare spill blood on neutral ground? OUT! OUT, I SAY!"]="你胆敢在中立领地动手？！出去！"
G["You dare stand against ME?"]="你们竟敢跟我作对？"
G["You dare stand in our way?"]="你们胆敢阻碍我们？"
G["You dare strike an agent of the Hand?"]="你胆敢攻击阿古斯之手的成员？！"
G["You dare summon me?"]="你胆敢召唤我？"
G["You dare summon me?  Your insolence will be punished."]="你竟敢召唤我？傲慢的家伙，你会受到惩罚的。"
G["You dare summon me?!"]="你胆敢召唤我？！"
G["You dare test us in the realm of fire?"]="你竟敢在火焰的国度中挑战我们？"
G["You dare to challenge Drottinn Hrothgar, king of the seas?"]="你竟敢挑战德罗丁·洛斯加尔，诸海之王？"
G["You dare to challenge me? You haven't earned the right!"]="你胆敢挑战我？你还不够资格呢！"
G["You dare to cross the Shan'ze?!"]="你竟敢反抗山泽部族？！"
G["You dare to defy the mogu? Then you will die!"]="你胆敢反抗魔古族？那么你就死定了！"
G["You dare to defy the sons of iron?"]="你竟敢挑衅钢铁的子嗣？"
G["You dare to disturb the loyal followers of the Raven?"]="你胆敢打扰乌鸦之神的忠实追随者？"
G["You dare to disturb these waters? You will drown!"]="你们竟敢扰乱这水流？淹死你们！"
G["You dare to think you have thwarted my will? That you have broken my plans?"]="就凭你，也想反抗我的意志，破坏我的计划吗？"
G["You dare to touch ME?! You won't keep me from proving myself to the Lich King!"]="你竟敢挑战我？！别以为这样就能阻止我向巫妖王效忠！"
G["You dare touch me?!"]="你惹怒了我！！"
G["You dare try to take my tower?  Hahaha..."]="你们竟敢攻击我的塔楼？哈哈哈……"
G["You dare!  Outrageous!  I curse you, $c.  I curse you with... death!"]="大胆！我诅咒你，$c。我诅咒你……死吧！"
G["You dare! Now feel my wrath!"]="大胆！让我的愤怒将你淹没吧！"
G["You dare?! Where is Baron Sliver? I would have words with him!"]="你敢？！斯利文男爵呢？我要和他说话！"
G["You dealt the most damage during this battle ground!"]="你在这一战中给敌人造成了最多的伤害！"
G["You dedicated your whole life to fighting the Scourge. You saw what they did to our beloved Lordaeron. The Lich King took everything from you!"]="你将全副身心都花在对抗天灾军团的大业上。你曾亲眼目睹他们在洛丹伦犯下的罪行。巫妖王夺走了你的一切！"
G["You deem yourselves worthy simply because you bested my guards? Our work here will not be compromised!"]="打败了我的卫兵，就以为自己已经足够强大了吗？我们的工作成果是不容你们损害的！"
G["You defended against the attack!\nPumpkin Bombs unlocked!"]="¡Te has defendido del ataque!\n\n¡Bombas de calabaza desbloqueadas!"
G["You defended against the attack!\nThe Warden will not be happy about this..."]="你成功抵御了敌人的攻势！\n机构主管会不开心的……"
G["You desert us, then have the gall to speak to me, $n?\n\nYou are either very foolish, or very brave.  Based on your past actions though, I would say foolish.  \n\nSpeak to me in a little while, I've got a camp to defend."]="$n，你抛弃了我们，现在居然还有胆跟我讲话？\n\n你这是愚蠢，还是勇猛？鉴于你过去的行为，我看你这是愚蠢至极。\n\n过会再和我讲话，我需要守护营地。"
G["You deserve a mighty man-hug."]="来个男人强有力的拥抱吧。"
G["You deserve to lose this land, for what your people did to us!  Now back off, or face the wrath of the worgen!"]="就凭你们的人对我们所做的一切，你们也不配继续占据这片土地！离开这里，否则狼人的怒火就要把你们烧毁！"
G["You deserve worse than death!"]="你的命运会比死亡更悲惨！"
G["You desire to shape the bones of the Earth Mother into tools that will aid the Horde.  Good, good.  Follow the path north out of Bloodhoof Village until you come to the elevator leading to the top of Thunder Bluff.  A Bluffwatcher there can give you further assistance."]="你希望把大地母亲的骨头设计成可以帮助部落的工具。好的，好的。沿着北边的路走出血蹄村直到一部可以上到雷霆崖顶部的升降梯那里。那里的守卫可以给你更多帮助。"
G["You destroyed their Earth rune! I bet there are three others. And, I bet they're all linked to the fire portal in the back."]="你摧毁了他们的大地符文！我打赌，他们一定还有另外三个符文，而且那些符文一定都连接在这道火焰传送门的后面。"
G["You did a great job, Spybot! Glad to have you back here with me!"]="你干得很好，间谍机器人！很高兴你回到我这里！"
G["You did a superb job, $n. Top notch!\n\nNow, of course, you couldn't have done it without my tinkering genius, which I'm sure you'll put in your company report, but you really pulled it off, despite the bumbling of my assistant here."]="¡Has hecho un trabajo de primera, $n. ¡De lujo!\n\nAunque, claro, no lo habrías conseguido sin mi genio como manitas, algo que estoy seguro harás constar en tu informe. Pero realmente lo has conseguido, a pesar de las quejas de mi ayudante."
G["You did all of that? You bammin'!"]="这些都是你干的？你真能干！"
G["You did good, $n. Looks like trouble is brewing within the Horde. Garrosh has a full-scale troll rebellion on his hands."]="你做的很好，$n。看来部落内部已经矛盾重重了。加尔鲁什有一整支巨魔起义军要对付了。"
G["You did it! Incredible! Pandaren Lorewalkers will be telling your story for generations!"]="你成功了！不可思议！熊猫人游学者会传颂你的事迹的！"
G["You did it! Let's get this brew to the Monastery..."]="你做到了！让我们把这酒送到禅院去……"
G["You did it! Thunderpaw Refuge is saved!"]="你做到啦！雷掌阁守住了！"
G["You did it! We're saved!"]="你成功了！我们得救了！"
G["You did it! You held the Blue Dragonflight back and defeated their commander. Amazing work!"]="你成功啦！你击退了蓝龙军团，并杀死了他们的指挥官。这真是个奇迹！"
G["You did it! You really did it! Maybe you can show me some of your moves, $n?"]="你做到了！你真的做到了！也许你能给我演示几招，$n？"
G["You did it! You're in! Now... where would they be keeping the egg? Someplace dark, I would imagine. Be careful!"]="你成功了！你进去了！现在……他们会把蛋藏在哪儿呢？我猜是个漆黑的地方。仔细点！"
G["You did it!! You're my hero, $n! Prince Wrathion will be delighted."]="你成功了！你真是我的大英雄，$n！拉希奥王子一定会很高兴的。"
G["You did it, $n! The shrine is ours again!"]="你成功了，$n！神殿又是我们的了！"
G["You did it, $p! I'm free!"]="你成功了，$p！我自由了！"
G["You did it, Ace!"]="你做到了，王牌飞行员！"
G["You did it, my $g boy : girl;, you did it!\n\nNow, let's get to Azshara so that I can set up my new practice. This has been a long vacation and I have bills to pay!"]="你做到了，我的$g 小伙子 : 姑娘;，你做到了！\n\n现在让我们前往艾萨拉，是时候开始我的新事业了。这个假期可真漫长，我还有账单要付！"
G["You did it... you've slain Baron Rivendare!  The Argent Dawn shall hear of your valiant deeds!"]="你做到了……你杀死了瑞文戴尔男爵！你的丰功伟绩将传遍整个银色黎明！"
G["You did not kill Hamuul, Leyara. He lives."]="你没有杀死哈缪尔。他还活着。"
G["You did well, Agent Kearnen. Now save your energy... we'll fend them off."]="你做的很好，密探吉尔妮。现在你可以休息一下了……让我们来对付他们。"
G["You did well, but for now I must continue alone.  Good hunting."]="你干得很好，可现在我必须独自行动了。狩猎愉快。"
G["You did well. Certainly a surprise to Trope... Report back to Ja'y."]="你干得不错。让特罗普吃了一惊……向亚恩报告吧。"
G["You did what you thought best, Go'el! Fight these doubts! They're devouring your heart!"]="你做了最好的选择，古伊尔！战胜那些怀疑！他们在吞噬你的心！"
G["You did what you thought was best. No commander has the foresight to see the future."]="你做了你认为最好的选择。没有哪个指挥官能预知未来。"
G["You didn't even make it 20 more feet that time."]="这次你甚至没有跑出去20尺。"
G["You didn't happen to order a Rusty Dagger did you?"]="您不会正巧点了这杯锈色利刃吧？"
G["You didn't have to go and do that!"]="你们为什么要这么做！"
G["You didn't have to hit me so HARD!"]="你不必这么狠地打我！"
G["You didn't honestly think I would only plant ONE set of explosives, did you?"]="你不会真的以为我只布置了一批炸药吧，对不对？"
G["You didn't need to use the whole sack at once, did you?"]="你不需要一次用光一口袋吧，是不是？"
G["You didn't really think I'd do business with you again, did you? Sometimes, the best way to return to profitability is to know when to cut your losses."]="你真以为我会再和你做生意？有时候弥补损失最好的办法就是知道什么会造成损失。"
G["You didn't think he was just going to GIVE you green fire, did you?"]="你不会以为他会就这么简单送你一团绿火的，对吧？"
G["You didn't think that I was going to let you walk in here and take the Heart of the Storm, did you?"]="你以为我会放你进来，让你拿走风暴之心吗？"
G["You dids it again!"]="又是那舞姿！"
G["You die -- ka! Stay away from trinkets!"]="死吧！嘎！别想动我的宝贝！"
G["You die for good this time, skeleton!"]="去死吧，骷髅！"
G["You die in vain!"]="你这是白白送死！"
G["You die now."]="你死定了。"
G["You die!"]="你去死吧！"
G["You die! That what master wants."]="你去死吧！这是主人的命令。"
G["You died to Armsmaster Harlan's |cFFFF0000|Hspell:|h[Blades of Light]|h|r ability. Armsmaster Harlan chooses one of two directions to travel when he uses this ability, so try to react to which way he goes so that you can dodge out of his path!"]="你被武器大师哈兰的|cFFFF0000|Hspell:|h[光明之刃]|h|r技能杀死了。武器大师哈兰在使用该技能时会从两个方向中任选其一行进，所以试着根据他的行进路线作出反应，以免于被他击中！"
G["You died to Imperial Vizier Zor'lok's |cFFFF0000|Hspell:122713|h[Force and Verve]|h|r. Try and enter one of the |cFFFF0000|Hspell:122706|h[Noise Cancelling]|h|r zones to minimize the damage from Force and Verve and have you or an ally use their healing abilities to keep you alive."]="你被皇家宰相佐尔洛克的|cFFFF0000|Hspell:122713|h[力与魄]|h|r杀死了。试着进入|cFFFF0000|Hspell:122706|h[噪音取消]|h|r区域来尽量降低力与魄的伤害，并进行自我治疗或让同伴用治疗技能来保你不死。"
G["You disappoint me, Akama.  I wanted to question the treacherous worm myself!  I'm beginning to question your allegiance, Broken."]="你让我失望了，阿卡玛。我本想要亲自审讯这条狡猾的虫子！现在我有些怀疑你们这些破碎者的忠诚了。"
G["You disappoint me, Taelan. I had plans for you... grand plans. Alas, it was only a matter of time before your filthy bloodline would catch up with you."]="你让我失望了，泰兰。原本我设计了一个规划……一个重要的计划。啊，你肮脏的血统最终表露出来只是个时间问题。"
G["You disappoint me, students!"]="你们太令我失望了，学生们！"
G["You disgrace the elements.  Don't give us an excuse to end your pathetic lives!"]="你让元素蒙羞。小心一点，否则你可就要小命不保了！"
G["You disgust me."]="恶心的家伙。"
G["You disgusting creature. You spread your filth among glorious Eldre'thalas, and now you DARE defy me? TALK!"]="你这恶心的怪物。你玷污了神圣的埃雷萨拉斯，现在又胆敢冒犯我？快说！"
G["You disrupt my meditations? You will pay..."]="你敢打断我的冥想？你要付出代价……"
G["You disssssturb the plans of Gurubashi, little one.  It'sss too late for you.  Too late for all of you!"]="你想干扰古拉巴什的计划，小东西。你太迟了，你们都太迟了！"
G["You disturb my work, $c."]="你干扰我的工作了，$c。"
G["You do NOT mess with us!"]="别来惹我！"
G["You do fine work, but it's a bit rough around the edges. Don't worry about it, it will come with practice. Speaking of which, how about we see what you've been working on?"]="你干得很漂亮，但是刀口还有些粗糙。不要担心，多加练习就会好的。说到这里，我们看看你一直以来的工作怎么样？"
G["You do know about the giant YETI in the mine, don't you?"]="你知道矿洞里有只巨型雪人，对不对？"
G["You do me an honor by delivering this message, Battlemaiden."]="非常感谢你为我带来这个消息，女武士。"
G["You do not belong here!"]="你们不属于这里！"
G["You do not belong here!  Ancients, rise against these intruders!"]="你并不属于这里！远古的守卫，醒来吧！消灭入侵者！"
G["You do not belong here! The waters must be protected... I will cast you out, or slay you!"]="你不属于这里！我必须保护水流……我要驱逐你，要不就杀死你！"
G["You do not belong here, $r!"]="你不属于这里，$r！"
G["You do not belong in the realm of earth!"]="你不属于土灵王国！"
G["You do not belong in these gardens.  Your body shall nourish our lovely creations!"]="你不属于这些花园。你的肉身将会滋养我们美丽的作品！"
G["You do not belong in this world, foul being!  Suffer the wrath of nature!"]="你不属于这个世界，邪恶的生物！忍受自然的愤怒吧！"
G["You do not deserve to live, weakling."]="你不配活着，懦夫。"
G["You do not fight alone! Unleash my storm upon these invaders!"]="你们并非孤军奋战！将我的风暴倾泻在敌人头上吧！"
G["You do not fight alone, $n! Together, we will banish this spawn of hellfire!"]="¡No luchas $gsolo:sola;, $n! ¡Juntos desterraremos a este engendro de las llamas infernales!"
G["You do not follow maps to buried treasure and \"X\" never, ever, marks the spot."]="No habrá mapas que te conduzcan a un tesoro enterrado y \"X\" nunca, nunca marca el punto correcto."
G["You do not have enough reputation with or have not pledged allegiance to The Aldor."]="你没有足够的声望，或尚未宣誓效忠奥尔多。"
G["You do not have enough reputation with or have not pledged allegiance to The Scryers."]="你没有足够的声望，或尚未宣誓效忠占星者。"
G["You do not have the strength to defeat him. You are too weak to carry on."]="你没有打败他的力量。你太软弱了。"
G["You do not intimidate me, tamer."]="你吓不倒我的，驯宠师。"
G["You do not mess with my kitty you son of a mongrel!"]="别弄脏我的猫，你这个混蛋！"
G["You do not need to fight me, $r.  I mean you no ill will."]="你不需要和我作战，$r。我对你没有恶意。"
G["You do not stand a chance. I will defeat you!"]="你半点机会都没有。我会打败你！"
G["You do not understand. The Horde are monsters! We are nothing like them."]="你不明白。部落都是怪物！我们跟他们可不一样。"
G["You do okay enough with that one. Just okay."]="这次干得还算不错。仅仅是不错而已。"
G["You do plan on taking care of that troll, yes?  He is the one reanimating all of those mogu, no?"]="你真打算解决掉那个巨魔，对吧？就是他让那些魔古族复活的，是不是？"
G["You do realize there's no hope, don't you?  Deathwing has already risen.  Your world is doomed."]="你意识到一切都毫无希望了，对吧？死亡之翼已经崛起了，你的世界注定毁灭。"
G["You do realize we are directly below it, right?"]="你也发现我们就在它下边，对吧？"
G["You do recall the last time that this occurred, yes? Let us hope that the master need not be involved."]="你还记得上次发生同样的事吗？希望主人不需要被卷入此事。"
G["You do that again and I might just have to take a likin' to ya!"]="如果你再这样做的话，我就不得不喜欢上你了！"
G["You do that. I bet it's just going to lead you in a giant circle and you'll never find the answer!"]="随便你。我敢说，它会带你绕上一个大圈子，然后害你一无所获！"
G["You do this, and I will send Gorsik to the temple with our piece of the World Pillar."]="如果你能做到，我就会派格尔西克将世界之柱的碎片送到神殿去。"
G["You do us a great service friend."]="朋友，你真是帮了我们大忙了。"
G["You do your people great honor, $r. Thank you again for helping me deal with Steeljaw's spirit.\n\nDespite this grievous misunderstanding, I'm sure in time our peoples will come to be friends."]="$r，你为你的族人赢得了荣耀。再次感谢你帮助我们消灭了钢腭的灵魂。\n\n尽管我们之间有过误会，但我相信我们很快就能成为真正的朋友。"
G["You dog!  Now I'll trap your soul into a shard and give you to my imp as a plaything!"]="你这个卑鄙的家伙！我会把你的灵魂变成碎片，让你成为我的小鬼的玩具！"
G["You don't belong here!"]="你不属于这里！"
G["You don't belong here, outsider. Leave before you get yourself in trouble."]="你不属于这里，陌生人。别惹麻烦，赶快离开吧。"
G["You don't do your job, I'll shoot you myself."]="谁要是临阵脱逃，我就打爆他的头。"
G["You don't even know, do you?  The trappers?  They're not human... we have to get out of here!  Come, quick!"]="你不知道？猎户？他们已经不是人类了……我们必须离开这里！快走！"
G["You don't expect me to give up all my secrets do you?"]="你不是想要让我把所有的秘密都告诉你吧？"
G["You don't fight for yourselves anymore, maggots! You fight for the Queen now so show me something worthy of her!"]="你们不再是只为了自己而战斗，蠢货！你们现在是为希尔瓦娜斯女王而战，所以快点表现出你们的价值来！"
G["You don't get to see much action in my line of work.  Serving this close to the front lines in a combat zone is a nice change of pace."]="我这边的行动倒不是很频繁。在战区中如此靠近前线，真是紧张刺激。"
G["You don't have the slightest idea how to operate the various mechanisms on this device, yet you are filled with a feeling of familiarity that you can't seem to shake off.\n\nIt's probably best to just leave it alone."]="你根本就不懂怎么操作这个设备上的各种机械，可你心中却总有一种挥之不去的熟悉感。\n\n最好还是先别去管它。"
G["You don't have the stomach for the gryphon ride, huh.  Well lucky for you, we have an alternative where you can keep your feet on the ground... more or less.  It's the gnomish mover of people, the Deeprun Tram.  Conveniently located in the back of the Dwarven District."]="你不喜欢骑狮鹫，嗯。你很幸运，我们有一个替代品可以让你稳稳地立在地上。那就是侏儒们的公共交通工具，矿道地铁。在矮人区的后面，非常方便。"
G["You don't have to be a priest to tithe. Your coin is just as welcome, $g sir : ma'am;."]="即使不是牧师也可以缴纳什一税，你的金币一样受欢迎，$g先生:女士;。"
G["You don't have to do this! Nobody has to die!"]="求你住手！停止杀戮！"
G["You don't have to go home, but you can't stay here."]="你们不必滚回老家，但也不准留在这里。"
G["You don't have to sacrifice me. I'd make a great cultist!"]="你们不用献祭我。我能做一个很好的教徒！"
G["You don't have to tell me that twice!"]="你不用告诉我两遍！"
G["You don't have to tell me twice!"]="你用不着跟我说两次！"
G["You don't have to tell me twice."]="你不用告诉我两遍。"
G["You don't have to worry about that anymore. What's going on here?"]="你不用担心了。这里发生了什么？"
G["You don't have to yell, Hobart, I'm standing right here. Sheesh!"]="别喊了，霍巴特，我就在这里。嘘！"
G["You don't have what it takes to fight in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit, $c. Stop wasting my time."]="你还未达到在热砂港搏击会中出场的条件，$c。不要浪费我的时间。"
G["You don't just come and do this to a dwarf's rug! You just don't do things like that!"]="你是故意来毁坏矮人的地毯的吧！你怎么能这样！"
G["You don't know what you're doing, Bouldergut! By keeping me captive, you're dooming Deepholm and us all!"]="你还没意识到你在做什么，石胆！你囚禁我，这是在把深岩之洲和我们所有人都推向万劫不复！"
G["You don't know who you're messing with, $c!  Death beckons!"]="$c，你还不知道自己招惹到什么人了吧！死神在朝你招手呢！"
G["You don't like me following you around? Too bad! Maybe next time you go murdering someone just to get a key, you'll think twice!"]="你不喜欢我到处跟着你吗？这可太糟了！也许下一次当你想要为了一把钥匙杀人时，你会三思！"
G["You don't look like a student..."]="你看起来不像是个学生……"
G["You don't look like much to me, but who knows, maybe there's an enchanter hidden in there somewhere!"]="No te pareces mucho a mí, pero quién sabe, ¡quizás haya $gun encantador escondido:una hechicera escondida; ahí dentro!"
G["You don't look like one of them... who are you?"]="No pareces $guno:una; de ellos... ¿Quién eres?"
G["You don't look like the barmaid..."]="你不像是个女招待……"
G["You don't look right, buddy. There's somethin' wrong with you."]="你看起来不太好，朋友。你肯定是出了什么问题。"
G["You don't look so good!"]="你看起来不太好！"
G["You don't look so tough."]="你看上去并不强壮。"
G["You don't look well, overseer."]="你看上去气色不好，监工。"
G["You don't mind if I stop here for a moment, do you?"]="如果我在这里稍微呆一会儿，你不会介意吧？"
G["You don't mind me checking out your merchandise for signs of tampering, do you?"]="我想检查一下你的货物，看看有没有动过什么手脚，你不介意吧？"
G["You don't recognize your former prisoner?"]="你不认得你以前的囚徒了吗？"
G["You don't remember me, $n? I lost count of the number of jobs you and I ran back in the day on Kezan. Then I picked up a real bad Kaja'Cola habit and you saved me! It was you who took me to Kalimdor to join the Steamwheedle Cartel. You were the only good goblin I knew. That's how I ended up in the Argent Dawn, because I knew it was what you woulda done. How could this have happened to you?"]="你不记得我了吗，$n？你我在科赞共度的那段日子里，我丢掉了一份又一份工作。后来我还染上了爱喝卡亚可乐的瘾，是你救了我！是你把我带到卡利姆多，加入了热砂集团。你是我所见过唯一善良的地精。正是出于对你的了解，我才落入银色黎明手中。你怎么会变成这样？"
G["You don't remember me, do you? Blasted Scourge... They've tried to drain you of everything that made you a pint-sized force of reckoning. Every last ounce of good... Everything that made you a gnome!"]="No me recuerdas, ¿verdad? Maldita Plaga... Han intentado drenar de ti todo lo que te convertía en alguien digno y admirable. Hasta el último gramo de bondad... ¡Todo lo que te hacía ser $gun gnomo:una gnoma;!"
G["You don't remember me, do you? Blasted Scourge... They've tried to drain you of everything that made you a righteous force of reckoning. Every last ounce of good... Everything that made you a blood elf!"]="No me recuerdas, ¿verdad? Maldita Plaga... Han intentado drenar de ti todo lo que te convertía en alguien digno y admirable. Hasta el último gramo de bondad... ¡Todo lo que te hacía ser $gun elfo:una elfa; de sangre!"
G["You don't remember me, do you? Blasted Scourge... They've tried to drain you of everything that made you a righteous force of reckoning. Every last ounce of good... Everything that made you a draenei!"]="你不记得我了？该死的天灾军团……他们挫败了你的正义之气、泯灭了你最后一丝良知……还有你身为德莱尼人的天性！"
G["You don't remember me, do you? Blasted Scourge... They've tried to drain you of everything that made you a righteous force of reckoning. Every last ounce of good... Everything that made you a human!"]="No me recuerdas, ¿verdad? Maldita Plaga... Han intentado drenar de ti todo lo que te convertía en alguien digno y admirable. Hasta el último gramo de bondad... ¡Todo lo que te hacía ser $gun humano:una humana;!"
G["You don't remember me, do you? Blasted Scourge... They've tried to drain you of everything that made you a righteous force of reckoning. Every last ounce of good... Everything that made you a tauren!"]="No me recuerdas, ¿verdad? Maldita Plaga... Han intentado drenar de ti todo lo que te convertía en alguien digno y admirable. Hasta el último gramo de bondad... ¡Todo lo que te hacía ser $gun:una; tauren!"
G["You don't remember me, do you? Blasted Scourge... They've tried to drain you of everything that made you a righteous force of reckoning. Every last ounce of good... Everything that made you an orc!"]="你不记得我了？该死的天灾军团……他们挫败了你的正义之气、泯灭了你最后一丝良知……还有你身为兽人的天性！"
G["You don't remember me, mon? Damn da Scourge! Dey gone ta drain you of everytin' dat made ya a mojo masta. Every last ounce a good... Everytin' dat made ya a troll hero, mon!"]="No me recuerdas, ¿tron? ¡Maldita Plaga! Han intentado drenar de ti todo lo que te convertía en un maestro del mojo. Hasta el último gramo de bondad... ¡Todo lo que te hacía ser $gun héroe:una heroína; trol!"
G["You don't remember me? We were both servants of Arugal back in Silverpine Forest. We put up with his merciless torture for ages. It was you who saved me on that fateful night when we escaped Shadowfang Keep. Without you I would have died. YOU! The most noble worgen I ever knew. What have they done to you, $n? How could this have happened?"]="你不记得我了吗？我们都曾是银松森林中阿鲁高的仆从。多年来一直忍受着他惨无人道的折磨。在改变命运的那一晚——我们从影牙城堡中逃离，是你救了我。如果没有你，我早就死了。是你！我所认识的最高贵的狼人！他们对你做了什么，$n？这怎么可能？"
G["You don't remember me? We were humans once - long, long ago - until Lordaeron fell to the Scourge. Your transformation to a Scourge zombie came shortly after my own. Not long after that, our minds were freed by the Dark Lady."]="你不记得我了吗？很久很久以前，我们曾经是人类。天灾军团攻陷洛丹伦后，我们相继沦为僵尸。但是不久之后，黑暗女王解放了我们。"
G["You don't remember me? We were humans once - long, long ago - until Lordaeron fell to the Scourge. Your transformation to an Scourge zombie came shortly after my own. Not long after that, our minds were freed by the Dark Lady."]="你不记得我了吗？很久很久以前，我们曾经是人类。天灾军团攻陷洛丹伦后，我们相继沦为僵尸。但是不久之后，黑暗女王解放了我们。"
G["You don't remember me? When you were a child your mother would leave you in my care while she served at the Temple of the Moon. I held you in my arms and fed you honey and sheep's milk to calm you until she would return. You were my little angel. Blasted Scourge... What have they done to you, $n?"]="¿No me recuerdas? Cuando eras $gun niño:una niña; yo solía cuidarte mientras tu madre prestaba servicio en el Templo de la Luna. Te sostenía en mis brazos y te daba de comer miel y leche de oveja para calmarte hasta que ella regresara. Eras mi angelito. Maldita Plaga... ¿Qué te han hecho, $n?"
G["You don't see too many apprentices around these parts, do you?  I'm beginning to think it's because the magisters give us all the dangerous work they'd rather not do themselves."]="你在这附近没看到太多的学徒吧？我开始想，这是不是因为魔导师把所有连他们都不愿意亲自做的危险任务都交给我们的缘故。"
G["You don't stand a chance!"]="你没有任何机会！"
G["You don't stand a chance, $n."]="你赢不了的，$n。"
G["You don't steal big slickies!"]="别偷我们的大光板儿！"
G["You don't think they'll hesitate to strangle you with their bare hands? GUN THEM DOWN!"]="你难道不知道，他们现在恨不得徒手掐死你？击毙他们！"
G["You don't think this place is... haunted... do you?"]="你说，这地方不会……闹鬼……吧？"
G["You don't understand - we're fighting a war here-"]="你不明白——我们是在这里打仗——"
G["You don't understand! I had to study it. I HAD TO!"]="你不明白！我必须研究它。必须！"
G["You don't understand! If I'm not ready to go soon, all the good homesteading land will be taken!"]="你完全不了解状况！如果我不赶紧出发的话，好的建筑用地都会被别人抢先霸占啦！"
G["You don't understand.  If I wanted to I could fight my way out of this cave.\n\nIt's my father, Ursoc.  He has returned from the dead... but he's not the same.\n\nHe gave his life during the War of the Ancients thousands of years ago.  For centuries, the furbolg who worshipped him tried to devise a way to resurrect him.\n\nFinally they decided they were to attempt to regrow the failed world tree, Vordrassil, and use its magic to bring back my father."]="你不能理解我的处境。我真想出去的话，早就杀出一条血路离开这个洞穴了。\n\n可我不能丢下父亲乌索克不管啊。他复活了……却不再是从前的心性。\n\n在数千年前的上古之战中，我的父亲就已经阵亡。崇拜他的熊怪部族一直想要复活他。\n\n最终他们决定重新培植那株被德鲁伊砍倒的世界之树——沃达希尔，企图利用它的力量复活我的父亲。"
G["You don't understand... I CAN'T be undead!  Not me, not now..."]="你不明白……我不能变成亡灵！我不能，现在不能……"
G["You don't want to fight this beast alone, $n. Gather allies. I'll open the beast's cage when you think you're good and ready."]="Contra esa bestia no se lucha solo, $n. Busca aliados. Abriré la jaula de la bestia cuando creas que estás $glisto:lista;."
G["You don't want to force the hand of the warchief."]="你最好不要逼酋长动手。"
G["You don't want to know what it was like in there."]="你可不会想知道关在这里是什么感觉。"
G["You don't worry me, $g boy : girl;. Just the opposite - I look forward to killing you. Nothing will stand between me and Zim'Torga now!"]="你根本不足为患，$g小子:小丫头;。相反，我正想杀了你。谁也别想阻止我进入希姆托加！"
G["You don't yet have the skill to study with me. Go talk to Doctor Martin Felben over there, or go up the ramp to the southeast and see Doctor Marsh. They are Forsaken who can give you the training you need."]="你的技术太差了，还不能跟我学习。去跟那边的马丁医生谈谈，或者爬上斜坡到东南方去看看马尔什医生。他们是被遗忘者，可以给你所需的训练。"
G["You don't. You're not strong enough to participate in ranking matches yet. Still, you can find an Arena Battlemaster and get in some practice rounds. It's never too soon to start training."]="凭你的能力，还不够资格参加晋级赛。不过你可以找竞技场管理员谈一谈，参加一些练习赛。训练永远都不会嫌太晚的。"
G["You done cleaning that mug yet ...hic?"]="你洗过那个杯子吗……嗝儿？"
G["You done run outta time!"]="你们没有时间啦！"
G["You dook'd with my heart!"]="舞动了我的心！"
G["You dookers don't know when to quit!"]="你们这些蠢货就是不懂适可而止！"
G["You dookers! Give me 'dat orange!"]="坏蛋！把橘子给我！"
G["You dress funny."]="你这身装束可真滑稽。"
G["You dwarves are worthless!  You come to Ragnaros seeking ascendance, but you have nothing to offer!"]="你们这些矮人真是没用！你们来找拉格纳罗斯，想得到拉格纳罗斯的赠礼，但你们却拿不出任何东西作为奉献！"
G["You even know how to run a farm? Know what, I'll save you the trouble. Sell me this here piece of land and go back where you came from."]="你甚至连如何经营一家农场都不懂吧？这样吧，我来帮你省去这个麻烦。你把这块地卖给我，然后从哪儿来的回哪儿去。"
G["You ever been to the Valley of the Four Winds?\n\nWe farmhands hear about the crisis here in the Vale, and the Tillers are hard at work growing food for refugees.\n\nIf you want some time out in the country, visit us at Halfhill!"]="你去过四风谷吗？\n\n听说山谷中出现了危机，我们这些阡陌客正努力为这些难民种植食物。\n\n如果你想到乡间走走，请到半山来看我们！"
G["You ever been to the jungle, $r?\n\nIt's real nice."]="你去过丛林吗，$r？\n\n那可真是个好地方。"
G["You ever fought big dragon or god or anything? Zepik like hearing stories."]="你有没有跟巨龙、神灵或者别的什么打过架啊？瑟匹克最喜欢听故事啦。"
G["You ever heard of Sauteed Carrots? It'sh my favorite food. I wish I had some right now...hic!"]="你听说过煎炸胡萝卜吗？这是我的最爱。真想现在就吃到嘴……嗝！"
G["You ever heard of a juishycrunch carrot? They'll never be juisher than tomorrow."]="你听说过爽脆胡萝卜吗？它们明天会变得更加爽脆。"
G["You ever just go walkin', for no reason at all? Just to see what's on the other side of the hill?\n\nMa says I got busy feet and an upside-down brain to boot. But I think maybe she's the one that's got it all backwards."]="你总是四处游走，漫无目的吗？只是为了看看在山的那一边有些什么？\n\n妈妈总说我有一双停不下来的脚，除此之外还有个颠三倒四的大脑袋。可我觉得，也许犯糊涂的是她才对。"
G["You ever notice how sarcastic the people living in Redridge are? Sometimes I feel like I just want to take a blow torch to that jackass Solomon's town hall."]="你有没有注意到赤脊山那儿的人有多尖刻？有时我真觉得我要一把火烧了所罗门那蠢货的城镇大厅。"
G["You ever seen Keeshan kill an orc? It's a sight to behold, $g man:lady;."]="你见过基沙恩消灭兽人的情景吗？那可真是壮观啊，$g老兄:女士;。"
G["You ever tried Wildfowl Roast?\n\nMmm! What would I give for a taste of that right now!"]="你吃过香烤野雉吗？\n\n嗯！我真想立刻尝上几口！"
G["You ever tried on Synthebrew Goggles? They're surprisingly uncomfortable!"]="你戴过合成酿酒护目镜吗？超级难受的！"
G["You expect me to remember all that off the top of my head? Look. They didn't pay me enough to put up with this, and the contract only asked for my silence. So I'm just gonna drop my ledger on the floor here, and you're going to take it and leave me alone.\n\nGot it?"]="你要我想起所有那些让我精神失常的事？听着。他们并没有付钱让我跟进这件事，我们之间的协议也不允许我透露这些。我可以把我的账本扔在地上，你自己捡起来然后别来烦我了。\n\n听明白了？"
G["You expect this dumpling to clean up the mason's quarter? They barely even got a belly on them!"]="你相信这些草包能够搞定工匠区？他们的肚子上都没有几两肉！"
G["You face Jaraxxus, Eredar Lord of the Burning Legion!"]="面对加拉克苏斯吧，燃烧军团的艾瑞达之王！"
G["You face Kingslayer Orkus now, dwarf!"]="¡$gEnano:Enana;, estás frente al matarreyes Orkus!"
G["You face more than my axes, this close."]="在这个距离，你要面对的不仅仅是我的斧子。"
G["You face not Malchezaar alone, but the legions I command!"]="你面对的不仅仅是玛克扎尔，还有我所号令的军团！"
G["You face the glorious wrath of the Twilight!"]="面对暮光炫目的怒气吧！"
G["You face your fear. A moment's... peace."]="你面对自己的恐惧。迎接片刻的……安宁。"
G["You fail to bend the knee to our power? Then die like the vermin you are."]="你不愿意臣服于我们的力量？那就像个渣滓一样死掉吧。"
G["You fail!"]="你完蛋了！"
G["You failed to plant the spear! We must make another attempt... soon!"]="你没有能将长矛竖好！我们必须再试一次……赶快！"
G["You fatheads are in trouble if I ever get out of here!"]="要是我能从这里出来的话，你们这些白痴会有麻烦的！"
G["You fear death?  Far worse awaits you, should you fail!  Slay the mortals!"]="你畏惧死亡？如果你失败的话，会有远比死亡更加痛苦的下场等着你！去消灭那些凡人！"
G["You fear that which you cannot control. But can you control your fear?"]="无法控制的事物令你恐惧，但你能控制你的恐惧吗？"
G["You feeble dogs are still weak!"]="你们这帮脆皮的败狗真不管用！"
G["You feed their souls to their brethren?  You are sick."]="你将他们的灵魂喂给他们的同族？恶心。"
G["You feel a massive jolt of energy as your body binds with that of Soo-holu."]="当你的身体和索乌霍鲁融合时，你感到一阵剧烈的能量波动。"
G["You feel a strange presence as you stand before this ancient idol."]="站在这尊远古神像前，你产生了某种异样的感觉。"
G["You feel a surge of power as Tarecgosa's essence manifests itself."]="泰蕾苟萨的精魄逐渐显现出其原本的模样，你能感受到一股能量的涌动。"
G["You feel hatred boiling up inside you."]="你感到内心的仇恨沸腾了起来。"
G["You feel hungry eyes upon you."]="你感到有饥饿的眼神在注视着你。"
G["You feel rage rise within you as your body binds with Kartak."]="当你的身体和卡塔克融合时，一股怒气从你心中腾起。"
G["You feel the blessing of the Celestials as your cloak billows with jade mist."]="当你的斗篷在翠绿色的雾气中翻滚时，你感受到了至尊天神的祝福。"
G["You feelin' da hurt, mon?"]="感觉到疼了吗，伙计？"
G["You fell too far behind!"]="你落后太多了！"
G["You felt death once..."]="你感受到了死亡的恐惧……"
G["You fight against the unstoppable."]="你在对抗不可阻挡的力量。"
G["You fight honorably, friend."]="你赢得光明正大，朋友。"
G["You fight like a beast!"]="你战斗起来就像只野兽！"
G["You fight like a true $r."]="Luchas como $gun auténtico:una auténtica; $r."
G["You fight like cowards!"]="你们就是一群懦夫！"
G["You fight well! I hope to have you by my side in the highlands."]="你可真能打！希望你能和我一起前往高地。"
G["You fight well, hero. I look forward to fighting by your side again."]="你战斗得非常英勇，英雄。期待能再次与你并肩作战。"
G["You fight well, little one. I am bested for now. We will meet again I assure you. When we do I will be better prepared!"]="打得不错啊，小家伙。我输了。我们还会再见面的。下次我一定会做好充分的准备。"
G["You fight well."]="你很能打。"
G["You fight well.  I will leave you now.  Lok'tar ogar!"]="你打得很好。现在我要和你说再见了。Lok'tar ogar！"
G["You fight well. Beware overconfidence."]="你打得很好，但不要太自满了。"
G["You fight with flare.  I like that."]="你的战斗充满激情。我喜欢。"
G["You fight with great skill and purpose. I hope to one day follow your path."]="你有出色的战斗技巧，也有坚定的战斗意志。但愿有一天我也能像你一样。"
G["You fight with the ferocity of a raging river.  Let us hope you do not run dry."]="你战斗起来就像暴怒的河水一样凶猛。但愿你的勇气永不干涸。"
G["You fight with the grace of a master tamer. Well done."]="Luchas con la gracia de $gun domador maestro:una domadora maestra;. Bien hecho."
G["You fight without HONOR!"]="你的战斗毫无荣誉感可言！"
G["You fight without honor and die like vermin!"]="你毫无荣誉感地战斗，死也死得像只害虫！"
G["You fighting today, $c?"]="你今天要参加搏击吗，$c？"
G["You figure out yet what's driving all of these yaungol out of the Townlong Wastes?"]="你弄清究竟是什么把这些野牛人赶出螳螂高原的了吗？"
G["You figure out yet why our brothers and sisters over in the village have gone insane?"]="你查明村落里的鱼人发狂的原因了吗？"
G["You filthy cultists have taken my husband from me! He just left us behind and went to follow all this 'end of the world' nonsense you're spouting!"]="¡Os habéis llevado a mi marido, cultores despreciables! ¡Nos ha abandonado porque quería presenciar esas tonterías del \"fin del mundo\" que predicáis!"
G["You filthy little beings need to work faster!"]="再干快点！你们这些肮脏的家伙！"
G["You find a few salvageable parts in the ruined creature's hull.  It looks like you will only be able to salvage one part."]="你在那被摧毁家伙的身体里发现了几个可回收的部件。看来你只能回收一个部件。"
G["You find a stack of partially soaked pages, written in the Prince's hand. You'd better take them back to Nodd."]="你发现了一叠被浸湿的纸张，上面有王子殿下的笔迹。你最好把它们拿去给诺德看看。"
G["You find it, you keep it! Don't tell no one that Rin'ji talked to you!"]="你找到它，它就是你的了！不要把林吉告诉你的秘密告诉任何人！"
G["You finished him - well done!"]="你干掉他了——好样的！"
G["You finished in...\n...\n1ST PLACE!"]="你在...\n...\n内完成了，你是第一名！"
G["You finished in...\n...\n2ND PLACE!"]="你在...\n...\n内完成了，你是第二名！"
G["You finished in...\n...\n3RD PLACE!"]="你在...\n...\n内完成了，你是第三名！"
G["You finished in...\n...\n4TH PLACE!"]="你在...\n...\n内完成了，你是第四名！"
G["You finished in...\n...\n5TH PLACE!"]="你在...\n...\n内完成了，你是第五名！"
G["You finished in...\n...\n6TH PLACE!"]="你在...\n...\n内完成了，你是第六名！"
G["You finished with ya trainin' too? Glad you make it through, mon!"]="你也完成训练了？真高兴你通过了考验。"
G["You flatter me, High Elder. Those hozen were weak, young, and unskilled. Any other pandaren would have done the same."]="您太抬举我了，长老。那些弱小的猢狲既年幼又没有战斗经验。任何一名熊猫人都能轻松获胜的。"
G["You flatter me, but it is my colleague Refik who deserves your attention now, not I."]="过奖了，你应该找我的同事雷菲克谈谈的。"
G["You folks want violence and bloodshed? Let's go take it to the Horde!"]="你们想来点儿带劲儿的？让我们去部落的地盘找点儿乐子！"
G["You fool no one, $r. Even the magic of the Netherwing cannot hide you from the all-seeing gaze of the Skybreakers!"]="你能骗得了谁，$r？在碎天者敏锐的目光中，即便是灵翼氏族的魔法也不能遮盖你的真面目！"
G["You fool!"]="你个蠢货！"
G["You fool! I ain't runnin' away. I lured ya here, ta kill ya wit' your own precious tribe!"]="傻瓜！我不会逃走。我把你引到这里，就是为了消灭你和你珍爱的部族！"
G["You fool! The prince's minions were the very Forsaken we have now allied ourselves with, and now he has betrayed us!"]="你这个蠢货！王子的爪牙就是那些被遗忘者，就是我们现在的同盟！而且他现在已经背叛了我们！"
G["You fool! This day shall be your last!"]="蠢货！今天就是你的死期！"
G["You fool! This is a ritual, not a recipe!"]="你这个傻瓜！这是一场仪式，不是在做饭！"
G["You fool, you're sleeping through the fight!"]="你这蠢货，整场对决你都在睡觉！"
G["You foolish old hag... Why would I do that when I can have you both?"]="你这个愚蠢的老巫婆……你们两个都是我的囊中之物，我为什么还要跟你做交易？"
G["You foolishly stumble about here, $r, oblivious to what forces surround you."]="你只是愚笨地在这里蹒跚而行，$r，全然不知自己已被什么样的军队包围。"
G["You fools stop running around! Face it!"]="你们这些蠢货别再四处乱跑了！面对惩罚吧！"
G["You fools think you can defeat me so easily? Face the true might of the Nathrezim!"]="你们这些蠢货以为可以这么容易就打败我吗？看看纳斯雷兹姆的真正力量吧！"
G["You fools! He'll kill us all!"]="你们这些蠢货！他会把我们全都杀掉！"
G["You fools! Keep fighting, if that is your wish! With every battle, more of you fall, and the ranks of my undead swell!"]="蠢货！继续战斗吧，如果那是你们最终的愿望！每一战中，你们当中都会有更多的人倒下，而我们的军团却日益庞大！"
G["You forced my hand."]="是你逼我的。"
G["You forget yourself, child! Do you know who stands before you?"]="别得意忘形，小孩！你知道你面前是谁吗？"
G["You fought bravely, chieftain, but Grimtotem treachery poisoned Garrosh's weapon and denied you fair combat."]="您战斗得十分英勇，酋长，但无奈恐怖图腾的叛徒在加尔鲁什的刀刃上下了毒，让决斗失去了公平。"
G["You fought excellently, just as I knew you could."]="你打得很出色，跟我预想的一样。"
G["You fought well, but your tactics are all wrong.  Have a drink and and rethink them."]="你打得很好，但你的战术完全错了。来喝一杯，好好想想吧。"
G["You fought well."]="你打得非常英勇。"
G["You fought well. I must learn more from you in the future."]="你很会战斗。我以后一定得好好向你学习。"
G["You fought well. Now go north to your orc outpost and inform Overlord Bor'gorok of our success!"]="你做得很好。返回北方的兽人要塞吧，告诉博古洛克大王我们成功了！"
G["You fought with honor. Gamon will ensure that your legacy lives on. For the Horde, my friend."]="你带着荣耀而战，加摩尔会让你的精神流传下去。为了部落，我的朋友。"
G["You fought without honor."]="你的战斗毫无荣誉感可言。"
G["You fought... with... valor..."]="你很有……勇气……"
G["You found a Marsh Lily? These are my favorite. Thanks!"]="你找到了泽地百合？这些是我的最爱。谢谢你！"
G["You found a key?  Well, is it THE key?  I mean, is it the key to unlock these shackles?  Well $G sir : ma'am;, there is only one way to find out!"]="你找到钥匙啦？嗯，是那把钥匙吗？我指的是能打开这些枷锁的钥匙。$g先生:女士;，只有一种方法能证明！"
G["You found..."]="你找到了……"
G["You freed Kirith from his suffering? Inconceivable -- and now Trebor has sent you here to learn of demons and their minions?\n\n<Loramus laughs.>\n\nBe thankful the arcane pangs have finally dissipated, $r."]="你终于帮助基利斯解脱了？真是难以想象——现在特雷博派你来到我这里，想要学习关于恶魔的知识？\n\n<洛拉姆斯大笑了起来。>\n\n魔法所带来的痛苦最终还是消散了。"
G["You frivolously throw away the lives of your people while your own king sits atop his throne of lies, nary lifting a finger to help."]="你鲁莽地葬送人民的生命，而你们的国王却端坐在由谎言铸成的王座上，连手指头都不曾动过一下。"
G["You from the low lands? We tend to not see low landers up this way very often."]="你来自低地？我们没怎么见过来自低地的人会走这条路。"
G["You gained Freeza seeds!"]="你获得了冻结草种子！"
G["You gained Strangler Vine seeds!"]="你获得了窒息藤种子！"
G["You gambled. And lost."]="你用生命作赌注，而且你输了。"
G["You gave in too soon!"]="你们屈服得也太快了！"
G["You gave it a good shot, kid. But this is goblin turf now. I suggest you get used to it."]="你的表现很好，孩子。可这里现在是地精的地盘了。我建议你努力去适应。"
G["You gave us no warning about the mogu, Warchief. These statues came to life!"]="你完全没有提醒我们魔古族的存在，酋长。这些雕像突然变活了！"
G["You gave us your word, betrayer!"]="叛徒，你还记得对我们许下的诺言吗！"
G["You get away from fire!"]="离火远点儿！"
G["You get back in dat pen!"]="你给我回到围栏里去！"
G["You get down from there right now!  I don't want you climbing that thing.  It's not safe."]="给我下来！你以后不许再去那里爬上爬下的，太危险了！"
G["You get out of here!"]="滚远点！"
G["You give a good fight!  Don't stop now."]="打得很好！再接再厉。"
G["You give me a game token, and I'll give you ten rings. \n\nThrow the rings onto Dubenko the Darkmoon Turtle over there... see the pole he's carrying on his shell?\n\nIf you don't land enough rings to win in one go, try again! Your points carry over into your next game."]="你给我一枚游戏代币，我会给你10个投环。\n\n你得想办法把它们扔到那边的暗月乌龟杜本科的背上……看到它驮着的那根柱子了吗？\n\n不过要是你没能扔中足够的环，那就再试一次！你的分数是可以累积到下一轮游戏的。"
G["You give me too much credit, good sir. I regret we cannot be of more assistance in such perilous times."]="您是如此信任我，尊敬的长官。很遗憾，在这危险的时刻，我们却不能提供更多帮助。"
G["You give yaks now!"]="现在把牦牛交出来！"
G["You givin' me a gift? Aw shucks, you shouldn't have!"]="你要送我一个礼物？哈哈谢谢啦，你太客气了！"
