G["You go ahead and start your travels. I'll catch up with you right after I finish tending to my hair."]="你先去旅行吧，我做好头发之后就去追你。"
G["You go attack him first, mon.  I don' attack him quite yet."]="朋友，你先去打他。我还没打他呢。"
G["You go away now!"]="赶快滚！"
G["You go away!"]="你滚开！"
G["You go back to that spineless orc who would not come see me and you tell him that the Frostwolf clan will not aid the Forsaken. Not now, not ever!"]="你去告诉那个不敢来见我的软骨头兽人，霜狼氏族不会帮助被遗忘者。永远不会！"
G["You go find Margaux Parchley. She pretty lady in The Apothecarium."]="玛尔迦丝·帕克雷就在炼金房，她是一位漂亮的女士。"
G["You go now, bad troll!"]="¡Tú irte ya, trol $gmalo:mala;!"
G["You go on ahead. I just need to get Thunder ready and I'll meet you at Sunsong Ranch in a jiffy."]="你先走。等我把雷霆准备好，就马上去日歌农场跟你会合。"
G["You go on ahead. I'll gather my tools and meet you at Sunsong Ranch."]="你先去吧。我带上工具，与你在日歌农场会合。"
G["You go on ahead. I'll meet ya there as soon as I get these discs decrypted."]="你继续前进。等我破解了这些磁盘，就去与你会合。"
