G["You go to inner ring of The Apothecarium.  Lavinia Crowe is there."]="到炼金房的内环去。拉文尼亚就在那儿。"
G["You going die big bad undead thing! You not catch Zepik sleeping this time!"]="坏东西，你很快就要死了！你再也不能打扰瑟匹克睡觉啦！"
G["You going to fight giant ox?"]="你要去跟大牛战斗吗？"
