G["You gonna get your chance mon.  But first we gotta take da city."]="你会有机会的，伙计。但首先我们得攻破这座城。"
G["You gonna leave in pieces!"]="你将死无全尸！"
G["You gonna pay for what ya done to me raptors!"]="你要为自己对我的迅猛龙所做的一切付出代价！"
G["You good at battling!"]="你可真是个作战高手！"
G["You good, $r! We gonna crush Garrosh's army wit' dis!"]="你很好，$r！有了这些，我们就能横扫加尔鲁什的部队！"
G["You got 'em, $n! Here. Let's just get 'em over there into the pen nice as you please."]="你找到它们了，$n！来。我们只要把它们关进围栏里就行了。"
G["You got Bruced!"]="你死定啦！"
G["You got any other errands you need to run? Don't you worry about ol' Mudmug... just poke me when we get there."]="你还有其他事情要做吗？不用为老泥盏担心……只要到了捅我一下就行。"
G["You got dat right."]="你说得对。"
G["You got funny looking eyeballs."]="你的眼珠看起来好有趣。"
G["You got here just in time.  Thanks!"]="你来得非常及时，谢谢！"
G["You got it boss. Er... where do I put it?"]="没问题，头儿。呃……我要把它插在哪儿？"
G["You got it!"]="没问题！"
