G["You got me good boss!  How you get by Slip'kik??  I smart though, I watch next time!  Har har!\n\nNobody get by Slip'kik no more. Slip'kik promise!"]="你可找到我啦，头儿！斯里基克陷入的大块的冰块中！好在我动作敏捷，很快就逃了出来！哈哈！\n\n或许冰块很快就会融化……"
G["You got no business here, lout! Beat it!"]="这儿没你的事儿，笨蛋！快滚！"
G["You got questions, but they be too big for me to answer, $n. You be needin' to have words with the orc Yelmak in the Drag of Orgrimmar. He'll help you out."]="你的问题我都回答不了，$n。你需要与奥格瑞玛暗巷区的兽人耶尔玛克谈谈。他会帮你的。"
G["You got room for one more, sugar?"]="还有地方吗，甜心？"
G["You got shiny?"]="你有宝贝吗？"
G["You got something to eat? I'm hungry!"]="你有吃的吗？我很饿！"
G["You got the juice, kid. That's for sure! Too bad that dragon had to come and ruin everything. No matter. You made us proud. Now get back to headquarters."]="Los tienes cuadrados, $gchaval:chavala;. Es una pena que apareciera ese dragón y lo estropeara todo. No importa. Nos sentimos orgullosos de ti. Ahora regresa al cuartel general."
G["You got the look of someone wantin' adventure. Me, I had enough of that by the time we trolls came here. Now I take each day as it comes, an' I train other folks to handle adventures for me."]="你看起来像是个喜欢冒险的人。而我，自从我们巨魔来到这里我就受够冒险了。现在我每天都是既来之则安之，而且我为自己训练其他家伙处理冒险的经历。"
G["You got the stuff, kid! You got the ball into the endzone and you detonated it for the win!\n\nNow let's get out of here. I'm thinking that the new team might need to be called the $n Explosion!"]="¡Eres grande, rapaz! ¡Has hecho llegar el balón a la zona de anotación y lo has detonado a lo grande!\n\nAhora, salgamos de aquí. ¡Se me ocurre que el nuevo equipo quizá tenga que llamarse los Explosivos de $n!"
G["You got... lucky."]="算……算你走运。"
G["You gots munchins?"]="你有好吃的？"
G["You gotsh somethin' to say to me? You do the talkin' and I'll do the drinkin'!"]="你有话和我说？没问题，你负责说，我负责喝！"
G["You gotta be Bwemba's hands on dis one... I need ya to toss some sticks into da bonfire in da center of dis camp.  Den Bwemba can handle da rest."]="你需要成为布温巴的双手……我需要你去扔一些木棍到营地中央的火堆里。剩下的就交给布温巴处理。"
G["You gotta be exalted with the Bilgewater Cartel goblins before I'll teach you how to ride, babe."]="Es necesario que los goblins del Cártel Pantoque te consideren $gun exaltado:una exaltada; para que pueda enseñarte a montar."
G["You gotta be exalted with the Bilgewater Cartel goblins before I'll teach you how to ride."]="Es necesario que los goblins del Cártel Pantoque te consideren $gun exaltado:una exaltada; para que pueda enseñarte a montar."
G["You gotta be friendly with the Bilgewater Cartel goblins before I'll teach you how to ride, babe."]="Es necesario que los goblins del Cártel Pantoque te consideren $gamistoso:amistosa; para que pueda enseñarte a montar."
G["You gotta be friendly with the Bilgewater Cartel goblins before I'll teach you how to ride."]="Es necesario que los goblins del Cártel Pantoque te consideren $gamistoso:amistosa; para que pueda enseñarte a montar."
G["You gotta be kiddin' me, mon! I ain't about to be drinkin' that muck..."]="朋友，开什么玩笑！这是什么鬼东西啊，我可不要喝……"
G["You gotta blow those oil rigs, $n. We don't want them stinky yaungol raining exploding fire kegs down on our heads!"]="你去炸掉钻油机，$n。我们可不想让腐臭的野牛人继续朝我们头顶上投掷成批的火药桶了！"
G["You gotta do something about these pygmies, $n!"]="一定要对那些俾格米人采取行动，$n！"
G["You gotta eat well to keep up your strength! That's what my mama always told me, anyway..."]="吃饱了才有力气！反正我妈妈总跟我这么说……"
G["You gotta help me get outta here, $r!\n\nI don't wanna become like them!"]="你一定要救我出去，$r！\n\n我可不想落得他们那样悲惨的下场！"
G["You gotta help me! My poor, poor Chelsea..."]="你得帮帮我！我可怜的，可怜的切尔希……"
G["You gotta hurry, kid. We gotta get you into the game. But first, we gotta get the parts for that shredder!"]="¡Date prisa, $gchaval:chavala;! Tenemos que meterte en el partido. Pero primero, ¡tenemos que conseguir las piezas de esa trituradora!"
G["You gotta love fel energy: Cheap, renewable, and guaranteed to blow things up.\n\nSure, you risk losin' your eternal will to Unimaginable Horrors from Beyond Time and Space, but hey, risk versus reward!\n\nNow, what did you wanna see me about, hmmm?"]="你会喜欢恶魔能量的：廉价，能够恢复，而且肯定能把你痛恨的东西炸碎。\n\n当然，你也会因此而必须面对一些东西——那种超越时间和空间的，难以想象的恐怖。你可能会因此而永远丢失你的心智。不过只有冒险才能得到巨大的回报！\n\n那么，你想让我教你些什么，嗯？"
G["You gotta pay to play, folks! Come and get your game tokens!"]="各位，你们得先付钱才能玩游戏！快来买游戏代币啊！"
