G["You have a treasure chest?  Let me see!  Alright, find Zando'zan in the Cleft of Shadow.  Look for the tunnel going down in The Drag to find it."]="你有一个宝箱？让我看看！好吧，在暗影裂口找到赞杜沙。找到通往暗巷区的通道然后就可以找到他。"
