G["You have achieved nothing!"]="你这是徒劳的！"
G["You have advanced beyond my skill to teach you. Journey now to Aerie Peak in the Hinterlands and speak with the dwarf Drakk Stonehand. His work is magnificent, far better than my own."]="你的进步已经超越了我能教授的技艺了。现在到辛特兰的鹰巢山去找矮人德拉克·石拳谈话。他的作品太棒了，比我的好多了。"
G["You have all seen this portal being built, admired the craftsmanship and how it stands as a monument to the glory of the Horde."]="你们都目睹了这座黑暗之门建造的全过程，也都见证了那精湛的建造技术，这是一座纪念部落荣耀的丰碑。"
G["You have already created an acceptable sketch of this piece."]="你已经给这部分残片画出一张相当靠谱的草图了。"
