G["You have been affected by |cFFFF0404|Hspell:116784|h[Wildfire Spark]|h|r !"]="你受到了|cFFFF0404|Hspell:116784|h[野性火花]|h|r的影响！"
G["You have been affected by |cFFFF0404|Hspell:123788|h[Cry of Terror]|h|r !"]="你已经受|cFFFF0404|Hspell:123788|h[恐怖嚎叫]|h|r的影响！"
G["You have been affected by |cFFFF4809|Hspell:116417|h[Arcane Resonance]|h|r !"]="你受到|cFFFF4809|Hspell:116417|h[奥术回响]|h|r的影响！"
G["You have been affected by |cFFFF4809|Hspell:116784|h[Wildfire Spark]|h|r !"]="你受到了|cFFFF4809|Hspell:116784|h[野性火花]|h|r的影响！"
G["You have been an asset to Stoneplow, $n. We may call upon you again in the future. Until then, you should speak with our flight master. He will take you wherever you need to go... free of charge."]="你是石犁村的贵人，$n。我们以后可能还会请求你的帮助。在那之前，你该和我们的飞行管理员谈一谈，他会带你去任何你想去的地方……免费的哟。"
G["You have been branded as enemies of the Crusade, heathens!"]="你们是十字军不共戴天的仇敌！"
G["You have been deceived, imbecile."]="你们被欺骗了，白痴。"
G["You have been defeated.  But do not give up.  I sense that one day you will join our ranks as a champion."]="你输了。不要放弃。我有预感，总有一天你会加入我们的行列，成为一名冠军。"
G["You have been detected. You will be assimilated or eliminated."]="Te han detectado. Serás $gasimilado o eliminado:asimilada o eliminada;."
G["You have been found wanting and are judged accordingly. Now rise, Thane Illskar the Damned!"]="你显然还有所欠缺，并将受到制裁。站起来吧，被诅咒的伊尔斯卡领主！"
G["You have been gone a long time, Father. I thought..."]="您去了好久啊，父亲。我还以为……"
