G["You have been iced!"]="你被冻住了！"
G["You have been infected with a Paralytic Toxin!"]="你已经被麻痹毒素感染了！"
G["You have been judged, and proven yourselves worthy. But be warned, what lies beyond will try your souls to their utmost.  When you are fully prepared, you may enter the chamber."]="你们接受了审判，证明了自己的价值。但要小心，接下来，你们的灵魂将受到极限的考验。准备好之后，你们就能进入大厅了。"
G["You have been judged."]="这是对你的审判。"
G["You have been measured and found wanting."]="我们确认了你的力量，知道你正是我们需要的人。"
G["You have been measured and found wanting..."]="这些十字军伪装成新兵潜入了黑锋要塞。"
G["You have been selected by the |cFFFF4809|Hspell:116784|h[Heart of Fear]|h|r !"]="你被|cFFFF4809|Hspell:116784|h[恐惧之心]|h|r选中了！"
G["You have been sentenced to death for crimes against the Dark Iron nation!"]="你因为反对黑铁王国的罪行而被宣判死罪！"
G["You have been tested... and you have failed."]="你接受了试炼……并且失败了。"
G["You have bested me fairly. Well done."]="你堂堂正正地打败了我。干得好。"
G["You have bested me. Seek Master Snowdrift in the Dojo atop the mountain if you wish to proceed."]="你已经胜过我了。如果你还想继续前行，就到山顶的道场去找雪流大师吧。"
G["You have bested my prize students. Perhaps you can be of use to us after all..."]="你们击败了我最强的学生。也许你们还不算一无是处…"
G["You have bested one of my finest, but your efforts are for naught."]="你击败了我忠诚的奴仆，但是你付出的努力是徒劳的。"
G["You have bested our most junior of students.  Now you will face two of my most senior."]="你们只是击败了我最年轻的学徒而已。接下来是我的两位得意门生。"
G["You have brought me back too soon! I am weak yet... What is this! Who... It matters not! DIE!"]="太快了，太急躁了！我仍然很虚弱……这是什么！谁……算了，无所谓！受死吧！"
G["You have brought shame to us as a people."]="你给我们带来了耻辱。"
G["You have certainly come a long way in your training. If you want to learn more, you have to travel to the desert. Find Buzzek Bracketswing in Gadgetzan!"]="你的训练已经非常深入了，只有一个导师可以进一步地训练你。找到加基森的巴兹克·布拉斯温！"
G["You have certainly earned my respect. No easy feat, my friend!"]="你确实赢得了我的尊重。这可不容易，我的朋友！"
G["You have certainly proven that you are worthy of it, but the materials do not come without cost.\n\nI'm sure I can arrange something with Madam Goya, but it won't come cheap.\n\nPlease keep in mind that only one Crystal of Fear can be equipped at any time."]="你确实已经证明了自己的价值，可材料也是要花钱的。\n\n我想我可以跟郭雅夫人做些安排，但价格可不便宜。\n\n请注意，任何时候都只能装备一块恐惧水晶。"
G["You have challenged death itself!"]="你这是在挑战死神！"
G["You have challenged the Seven, and now you will die!"]="你对七贤发出了挑战，死吧！"
G["You have chosen a path of darkness.  Mother moon, guide my hand; allow me to bring rest to these misbegotten souls."]="你们选择了一条黑暗的道路。月亮母亲啊，指引我的双手，让我为这些可悲的灵魂带去安宁。"
G["You have chosen death."]="你选择了死亡。"
G["You have chosen wisely, $n.  Seek out Kergul Bloodaxe on the Hunter Rise.  He will assist you on your journey to Warsong Gulch."]="你的选择很明智，$n。去猎人高地找克古尔·血斧。他会帮助你前往战歌峡谷的。"
G["You have come a long way, traveler. There is one more task for you to perform..."]="你走了好远的路了，旅行者。还有一项工作要你完成……"
G["You have come seeking deliverance? I have come to deliver!"]="你想要寻求救赎？我就是你的救星！"
G["You have come to bring Arthas to justice? To see the Lich King destroyed?"]="你是来审判阿尔萨斯的吗？想要看到巫妖王的灭亡？"
G["You have come to learn in the art of warfare, $r? You have come to the wrong place."]="你是来学习战斗的艺术的，$r？你来错地方了。"
G["You have come to learn of battles won and lost on this field? There are no winners here..."]="你是来学习战役案例的吧？听好了，我会为你讲解那些显赫的胜仗和耻辱的败仗的。"
G["You have come to me for instruction, and in return I have a favor to ask of you. See it done, and you will be rewarded."]="你来找我寻求建议，而我也要请你帮一个忙。确保它完成，你就会得到奖赏。"
G["You have come to play? Then let us play!"]="你想玩玩吗？那就来吧！"
G["You have come to your grave."]="你闯进了自己的坟墓。"
G["You have come too far to fail. Stand back, mortals."]="你已经走了太远了，你将注定失败。后退，凡人。"
G["You have completed Teronis' mission, and I appreciate all you have done, $n."]="你已经完成了泰洛尼斯的任务，感谢你所做的一切，$n。"
G["You have completed the quest!"]="你已经完成了任务！"
G["You have confidence in your skills? Think carefully as the answer may surprise you."]="你对你的技术有信心吗？想清楚，也许答案会让你吃惊。"
G["You have conquered every challenge I put before you, $n. You have found Huo and brought him safely to the temple."]="Has superado todos los desafíos que se te han planteado. Has encontrado a Huo y lo has devuelto al templo."
G["You have cost me too much work!"]="你们的确让我费了不少力气！"
G["You have crossed into the world of the dead in search of answers. You wish to save your ally and have risked life and limb to be here. Allow me to help."]="你们来到这个属于死者的世界寻求答案。你们带着拯救盟友的希望，冒着失去生命的危险艰难地爬行到了这里。那么，请允许我帮帮你们吧。"
G["You have damned us all... We are lost."]="你诅咒了我们……我们完蛋了。"
G["You have dared to defile my perch and must now be cleansed in fire!"]="你胆敢侵犯我的巢穴，让烈焰净化你的罪行吧！"
G["You have delved too far into our magics. I will claim your soul myself!"]="你过于沉迷我们的魔法。我要亲手夺走你的灵魂！"
G["You have demonstrated skill in learning our craft. Do you also possess the resolve to complete a mission on my behalf?"]="你已经证明了学习我们的工艺的技巧。但你有替我完成任务的决心吗？"
G["You have discovered a new type of bio-fuel!  Bring it to Engineer Hexascrub for testing."]="你发现了一种新型生物燃料！快把它拿给工程师“洗衣桶”测试一下。"
G["You have discovered a new type of bio-fuel!  Bring it to Fiasco Sizzlegrin for testing."]="你发现了一种新型生物燃料！快把它拿给菲亚斯科·尖笑测试一下。"
G["You have disturbed my rest, $c.  Now face my wrath!"]="你打扰了我的休息，$c。现在我很生气！"
G["You have done NOTHING. I will tear your world APART."]="你们什么都没做到。我要撕碎你们的世界。"
G["You have done a great thing, $n.  You are welcome here at any time."]="Has hecho algo estupendo, $n. Eres $gbienvenido:bienvenida; aquí en cualquier momento."
G["You have done all that you can for your hatchling today. I will keep it safe, but remember to return tomorrow to check on its progress."]="你今天已经为你的雏龙尽了全力。我会照顾好它，但记得明天要回来查看进展。"
G["You have done all you can for the serpents on the island today. Come back tomorrow to resume your training."]="你今天已经为岛上的翔龙尽了全力。明天再回来继续训练吧。"
G["You have done an exceptional job, soldier! The cavalry is ready to ride on your command."]="士兵，你做得棒极了！骑兵们已整装待发，就听你的指令了。"
G["You have done great things, friend. I can assure you this is but the beginning of our work together."]="你成就斐然，我的朋友。我保证，这只是我们合作的开始。"
G["You have done it!"]="你成功了！"
G["You have done many good things for our village, $n. Perhaps we can be friends after all."]="你为我们的村子做了许多好事，$n。或许我们是可以成为朋友的。"
G["You have done much and more for us today, $n. Our work will continue, but we have gained a small victory."]="你今天为我们做了太多事，$n。我们的工作还将继续，但好歹已经取得了小小的胜利。"
G["You have done much for our cause, $n, but you may go no further until you have mastered flight. Only the most stalwart riders are able to assist the Netherwing."]="你帮了灵翼龙族许多忙，$n。但是在你掌握更高级的骑术之前，是无法有什么进展的。只有最坚定的骑士才能帮助灵翼龙族。"
G["You have done much in this war against the Scourge. May the light embrace you."]="你在与天灾的战争中立下了大功。愿圣光给你恩泽。"
G["You have done much today, $n. Rest and return tomorrow."]="你今天做了许多事，$n。好好休息，明天再来吧。"
G["You have done the Shado-Pan a great service, $p."]="你帮了影踪派一个大忙，$p。"
G["You have done well here, $n. I will put in a good word with your superiors when we return to Stormwind."]="你做得很好，$n。等我们回暴风城后，我会在你的长官面前为你多美言几句的。"
G["You have done well, $c. Our presence here can no longer be unnoticed by Ragnaros. We are an essential thorn in his side. As his rage grows, so must we continue to press forward.\n\nWe must stay ever vigilant here, but it is time to cast our eyes upon the final battle. It is time to face the Lord of Fire himself."]="你做得很好，$c。拉格纳罗斯已经不能再无视我们的存在了。我们已经成了他的心腹大患。虽然他已经怒火高涨，我们仍要继续推进。\n\n在这里，我们必须时刻保持警惕，但我们应该考虑一下最终的决战了。挑战炎魔之王本人的时刻到了。"
G["You have done well, $n. Continue your search for knowledge, and remember the history you have learned."]="你做得很好，$n。继续学习新的知识，牢记你所学到的历史。"
G["You have done well, $rt. My workers are making efficient progress."]="你做得很好，$rt。你提高了我的工人们的效率。"
G["You have done well, Drakuru."]="你做得很好，达库鲁。"
G["You have done well, Keldonus. Lord Malygos will be quite pleased with your progress."]="你做得很好，凯尔多努斯。玛里苟斯一定会对你赞赏有加的。"
G["You have done well, traveler. I am proud to call you my student!"]="Lo has hecho bien, $gviajero:viajera;. ¡Me siento orgullosa de poder tenerte como estudiante!"
G["You have done well, wallwalker."]="你做得不错，城墙行者。"
G["You have done well.  The information you are providing is critical to our success."]="你干得不错。你提供的信息对我们的成功十分重要。"
G["You have done well. We will keep these weapons under close guard, hidden away here in this hall. The mogu shall never see these treasures again."]="你做得很好。我们得看好这些武器，把它们藏在这座大殿里。魔古族休想再见到这些宝物了。"
G["You have doomed yourselves. It... is... unleashed."]="你们是在找死。它……被……释放了。"
G["You have earned my trust hero. This will be your most dangerous task yet: To steal the secrets of the Thunder King from the very heart of his lair. I wish you the best of luck."]="你赢得了我的信任，英雄。但这将是你最危险的一次任务：从雷电之王的巢穴中偷出他的秘密。祝你好运。"
G["You have earned the privilege of training with a higher instructor. Go see my pal Roxxik there."]="你赢得了到一个更高级的导师那里学习的权利。去见见我那边的朋友罗克希克。"
G["You have earned the right to proceed.  Huo lies beyond."]="你可以继续前进了。燧焰就在前面。"
G["You have entered Glubtok's Nightmare!"]="你已进入格拉布托克的噩梦！"
G["You have entered Helix's nightmare!"]="你进入了赫利克斯的噩梦！"
G["You have entered Ripsnarl's nightmare!"]="你已进入撕心狼的噩梦！"
G["You have entered the mechanical nightmare!"]="你已进入机械噩梦！"
G["You have faced many challenges.... Pity they were all in vain! Soon your people will kneel to MY lord!"]="你们赢得了许多挑战……可惜到头来还是白费劲！很快你们的同胞就要向我的主人低头了！"
G["You have failed him, mortalsss... Farewell!"]="你们已经失败了，凡人……再见！"
G["You have failed me, Drakuru!"]="你令我失望了，达库鲁。"
G["You have failed the test.  Try again."]="你没能通过测试。再试一次吧。"
G["You have failed to protect me from the apes!"]="你没能保护我免受那些猿人的伤害！"
G["You have failed yet again, stranger."]="Has vuelto a fracasar, $gforastero:forastera;."
G["You have failed your people!"]="你让你的人民失望了！"
G["You have failed!"]="你败了！"
G["You have failed..."]="你失败了……"
G["You have floppy ears!"]="你有柔软的耳朵！"
G["You have foolishly trespassed upon our waters, Alliance fools. Be whipped by the lash of my storm!"]="你们愚蠢地侵入了我们的水域，联盟的傻瓜们。接受我风暴的鞭笞吧！"
G["You have foolishly trespassed upon our waters, Horde fools. Be whipped by the lash of my storm!"]="你们愚蠢地侵入了我们的水域，部落的傻瓜们。接受我风暴的鞭笞吧！"
G["You have forced my hand!"]="是你逼我的！"
G["You have forged this blade from saronite, the very blood of an old god. The power of the Lich King calls to this weapon."]="你用上古之神的血，萨隆邪铁重铸了这把剑。巫妖王的力量会召唤它。"
G["You have fought hard to invade the realm of the harvester."]="虽然你们经历了千难万险才来到收割者的领域，来到我的面前。"
G["You have fought well, spirit.  I ask you to grant me the strength of your body and the strength of your heart."]="你战斗得很勇敢，精灵。我请你赐予我你身体和心灵的力量。"
G["You have found your way here, because you are among the few gifted with true vision in a world cursed with blindness."]="你们之所以在这里，那是因为你们是少数几个拥有特殊能力，能够洞悉这诅咒世界的人。"
G["You have four samples, and only have room to test one more.  Which one will it be?"]="你现在选好四份样本了，只能再选一份。选哪种呢？"
G["You have friends. Your champion did not allow you to fall. Take this lesson to heart."]="你有朋友。你的勇士不会让你倒下。牢牢记住这一课吧。"
G["You have fully depleted my patience as well."]="你也已经彻底耗尽了我的耐心。"
G["You have gathered your supplies.  Bring them to Thelaron Direneedle to assemble."]="你已经集齐了物品。把它们带给萨拉隆·巨钉来完成组合。"
G["You have gazed upon one of the ancient jinyu emperors of Pandaria, $n."]="你现在注视的是一位古代锦鱼人皇帝，$n，他曾经统治过潘达利亚。"
G["You have given much of your time, patience, and love, $n. Behold your serpent now."]="你已经投入了大量的时间、耐心还有爱心，$n。现在来看看你的翔龙吧。"
G["You have gone to great lengths, stranger, and you have my appreciation. I promised to further your training, and now I shall keep that promise."]="Has hecho todo lo posible, $gforastero:forastera;, y te estoy agradecida. Te prometí seguir tu instrucción y ahora cumpliré esa promesa."
G["You have got another wall... and it's made up of the people who call this place HOME."]="别忘了你还有另一道长城…是由那些管这里叫做家的人…比肩铸成的。"
G["You have got to be the most incompetent officer I have ever met!"]="你是我所遇到过的最无能的军官！"
G["You have great honor, stranger. Please join us."]="Eres honorable, $gextranjero:extranjera;. Únete a nosotros, por favor."
G["You have great potential, but you must achieve understanding first, you must accept the spirits and listen to their calling. Only then will you be prepared for the path you must follow. Go speak with Thrag, I think perhaps you can learn a lot from one another."]="Tienes un gran potencial, pero primero debes conseguir el conocimiento, debes aceptar a los espíritus y escuchar su llamada. Solo entonces estarás $gpreparado:preparada; para el camino que debes seguir. Ve a hablar con Thrag, creo que podríais aprender mucho el uno del otro."
G["You have grown much since we first met."]="你比我们初见时长进了许多。"
G["You have grown stronger than I ever expected."]="你的进步比我预想中快得多。"
G["You have guts asking me about warlocks. Go to the Magic Quarter's outer ring and get out of my sight."]="你竟然有胆量问我有关术士的事。到魔法区的外环区域看看吧，现在给我消失。"
G["You have incurred the wrath!"]="你可把我惹火了！"
G["You have interfered with our plans for the last time, mortals!"]="这是你最后一次干扰我们的计划了，凡人！"
G["You have issues."]="你有问题。"
G["You have it all wrong, Jaina. I did nothing."]="你搞错了，吉安娜。我没有。"
G["You have it. Do not lose it again!"]="给你，不要再弄丢了！"
G["You have jade?"]="你有玉石吗？"
G["You have jostled the cluster, and have been sickened by the spores!"]="你撞破了蘑菇丛，并且被孢子感染了!"
G["You have learned a trick to speak with us, $r, but I am not impressed.\n\nThere are Winterfin betrayers across the water that need killing."]="$r，你已经掌握了与我们交流的诀窍，不过这算不了什么。\n\n水塘那边还有大群的冬鳞背叛者等着你去收拾呢。"
G["You have learned all that I am able to teach you at this time, Doctor $n. Return to me when your practice has expanded and I shall train you in the ways of the more advanced medicinal arts."]="你已经学会了我现在能教你的所有知识，$n医生。当你获得更多经验的时候再来找我吧，我会传授给你更多高级的医学知识的。"
G["You have learned much, but I sense that there is more left for the spirits to teach you. I can place your foot on the path but cannot guide your steps. Go and find Saru Steelfury in Orgrimmar, the next stretch of your journey begins there."]="你已经学了很多，但我觉得精灵们还有很多要教给你。我可以给你引路但不能替你走路。去找到奥格瑞玛的萨鲁·钢怒，你的旅程的下一段从那里开始。"
G["You have learned much, more than I can teach. Go to James Van Brunt, he will teach you what I cannot."]="你已经学得很多，我没什么能教你了。去找詹姆斯·范·布朗特，他会教给你我所不能的。"
G["You have learned the fundamentals of making potions, but further study requires greater commitment. Prove your dedication by carrying out a task for me."]="你已经学会了制作药剂的基础知识，但是要想深化学习需要更加投入。为我完成一项任务以证明你做出的贡献。"
G["You have learned well my child. Go to the Undercity, find a smith named James Van Brunt. He will be able to teach you much that I cannot. I understand he spends his time near the Warriors training hall, forging their weapons and armor."]="Has aprendido muy bien, $ghijo:hija;. Ve a Entrañas y busca a un herrero llamado James Van Brunt. Él te enseñará cosas que yo no puedo. Tengo entendido que pasa el tiempo junto a la sala de entrenamiento de los guerreros, forjando sus armas y armaduras."
G["You have learned well. Continue on your path, disciple."]="你掌握得不错。继续努力吧。"
G["You have left the roll course!"]="你偏离了翻滚路线！"
G["You have lost your mind, Nefarius. You speak in riddles."]="你已经失去理智了，奈法里奥斯。你在胡言乱语。"
G["You have made a fatal mistake, mortal... There isss no essscape..."]="凡人，你犯了个致命的错误……别想逃跑……"
G["You have made a grave error, fiend!"]="你犯了一个严重的错误，魔鬼！"
G["You have made a grave misssstake..."]="你犯了个严重的错误……"
G["You have made an... unwise... decision."]="你做了一个……愚蠢的……决定。"
G["You have made our enemies your own.  I will gladly share waters with you."]="你已经把我们的敌人当成了你自己的敌人。我会很高兴能与你分享水的伟大。"
G["You have made your choice."]="你已经做出了选择。"
G["You have many lessons to learn."]="你还有许多东西要学。"
G["You have more learning ahead of you disciple. Return to your studies."]="要学习的知识还有很多。继续努力吧。"
G["You have much to learn if you wish to defend your people from the Sha initiate.  Stand aside for your fellow students!"]="如果你们想战胜煞，保护你们的族人，就要多加学习。做好准备，战斗到底！"
G["You have my attention."]="我注意到你了。"
G["You have my deepest gratitude. I thank you."]="我对你表示最深的感激，谢谢你。"
G["You have my eternal gratitude, hero."]="我真是感激不尽，英雄。"
G["You have my gratitude and that of my people."]="我和我的人民都对你感激不已。"
G["You have my gratitude!"]="太感谢你了！"
G["You have my gratitude, $c. I thought I'd never be free."]="谢谢你，$c。我还以为自己再也出不来了。"
G["You have my gratitude."]="非常感谢。"
G["You have my gratitude. I should return back to training now."]="非常感谢。我现在该回去训练了。"
G["You have my leave."]="去吧，我允许你参与战斗。"
G["You have my sword."]="我的剑将为你挥舞。"
G["You have my thanks for dispatching the iron dwarves. But why would the Horde have an interest in me?"]="你解决了铁矮人，我很感谢你。但是部落为什么会对我感兴趣？"
G["You have my thanks for saving my existence in this timeline. Now I must report back to my superiors. They must know immediately of what I just experienced."]="你救了我的性命，请接收我的谢意。我必须立即向长官汇报这里发生的事件。"
G["You have my thanks!"]="谢谢你！"
G["You have my thanks, friend."]="感谢你，朋友。"
G["You have my thanks, hero. If you don't mind, I'd like to stay by your side and exact a little vengeance upon my captors!"]="谢谢你，英雄。如果你不介意的话，我想呆在你的身边，向那些家伙复仇！"
G["You have my thanks, heroes. You have given peace to this sacred temple."]="衷心感谢，英雄们。是你们让这座神圣的庙宇重获安宁。"
G["You have my thanks, stranger."]="非常感谢，陌生人。"
G["You have my thanks."]="感谢你。"
G["You have my thanks. I'm going back to The Shadow Vault now."]="谢谢你。我准备返回暗影拱顶了。"
G["You have my thanks. Stay safe, $c."]="我感谢你。保重，$c。"
G["You have my thanks. We were outnumbered until you arrived."]="真是非常感谢。你的到来帮了我们大忙。"
G["You have my undying gratitude and that of my people, $n."]="Cuentas con mi gratitud eterna y la de mi gente, $n."
G["You have my word that I shall find a use for your body after I've killed you, $r."]="你听好了，在我杀死你之后，你的身体将为我所用，$r。"
G["You have need of my skills as an alchemist, yes?"]="你要接受炼金术训练，是吗？"
G["You have new orders, maggots."]="你有新的命令，废物。"
G["You have no business with me, little one."]="No tienes nada que hablar conmigo, $gpequeñajo:pequeñaja;."
G["You have no chance of defeating my team. I am eternal!"]="你休想击败我的队伍。我是永生不灭的！"
G["You have no doubt heard about Nefarian's failures on Azeroth... While he has fallen, the experiments continue. My master... He continues the work that his progeny began."]="我相信你肯定已经听说了奈法利安在艾泽拉斯的失败……虽然他失败了，但实验仍然继续着。我的主人……他继续进行着他的儿子没能完成的研究。"
G["You have no hope!"]="你们毫无希望！"
G["You have no idea how happy I am right now. If you were one of my officers, you'd be getting a promotion!"]="你不知道我此刻有多高兴。如果你是我麾下的军官，你会得到提拔的！"
G["You have no idea how happy I am to see you!"]="你想象不出我见到你有多高兴！"
G["You have no idea how long I was in there."]="你都不知道我在里面呆了多久。"
G["You have no idea how much your help has saved our family business.\n\nI should be able take it from here as long as the yaungol slow down their assault."]="你不知道你帮了我们多大的忙，是你挽救了我们的家族生意。\n\n既然野牛人减缓了攻势，我自己应该能应付了。"
G["You have no idea how to control the ata'mal crystal.  It will consume you!"]="你根本不知道怎么控制阿塔玛水晶。它会毁灭你的。"
G["You have no idea what horrors lie ahead. You have seen nothing! The frozen heart of Naxxramas awaits you!"]="看来你们还不知道自己将面临怎样的恐怖？看来你们根本一无所知！纳克萨玛斯的霜寒之心正等待着你们！"
G["You have no idea what they put us through..."]="你无法想象我们所经历的一切……"
G["You have no idea what you're meddling with!"]="你根本不知道自己在干什么！"
G["You have no idea what's waiting for you!"]="你对即将降临的厄运一无所知！"
G["You have no need to worry - the swindler who peddled his \"wares\" here has been exiled from our fair city."]="No tienes que preocuparte – el estafador que traficaba con sus \"mercancías\" aquí, ha sido exiliado de nuestra justa ciudad."
G["You have no place here! Your place... is among the departed!"]="你们没资格来这里！你们的归宿……在死者的国度！"
G["You have no right to keep us out!"]="你们没有权力把我们挡在外面！"
G["You have not earned the right to defeat me, tamer."]="你还没资格击败我，驯宠师。"
G["You have not fully reconciled with your past. Now is the time."]="你从未真正接受你的过去。现在是时候了。"
G["You have not only saved our village; you have also repaired my family."]="你不仅救了我们的村庄，还修复了我的家庭。"
G["You have not seen the full might o' the Zandalari!"]="呸！你们还没见识到赞达拉的全部力量呢！"
G["You have not seen the last of me fools!  All shall be consumed in the end!"]="你还没有见识过真正的我，愚蠢的家伙！我最终会毁掉一切的！"
G["You have not yet earned the right to train with me. See Thund first, over by the table. Come back when he says you're ready!"]="Todavía no te has ganado el derecho de instruirte conmigo. Ve a ver antes a Thund, junto a la mesa. ¡Vuelve cuando diga que estás $gpreparado:preparada;!"
G["You have not yet learned the basics, wanderer. Have you spoken to my assistant, Lalina Summermoon? Perhaps you should."]="你还没有学会基础知识，流浪者。你找我的助手拉琳娜·夏月谈话了吗？可能你需要跟她谈谈。"
G["You have not yet proven yourself worthy enough to issue a challenge within Valhalas, $n.\n\nReturn when you have earned a name for yourself."]="Todavía no has demostrado ser $gdigno:digna; de participar en un desafío dentro de Valhalas, $n.\n\nRegresa cuando te hayas labrado un nombre."
G["You have nothing. No one."]="你一无所有，一无所有。"
G["You have now learned Dual Specialization."]="你现在已经学会了双天赋专精。"
G["You have nowhere to go, weakling!"]="你无路可走了，懦夫！"
G["You have nowhere to run, coward!"]="你无处可逃了，懦夫！"
G["You have only just begun to see the Eye's power, $c. If you wish to facilitate the abilities of the Eye, then there is a task that you must complete."]="你仅仅只是开始看到眼的力量，$c。如果你想增强眼的力量，那么必须完成一项任务。"
G["You have our deepest gratitude. Al diel shala, hero."]="你赢得了我们最深的谢意。Al diel shala，英雄。"
G["You have our full cooperation, lieutenant. The Furlbrows were good people. Their deaths will not go unpunished."]="你会得到我们全力的配合，中尉。法布隆一家是好人。他们决不会枉死。"
G["You have our respect and our thanks."]="我们要向你表达敬意与感谢。"
G["You have our thanks! I will see the Lorewalker safely to the Vale from here."]="我们由衷地感谢你！我会在这儿目送游学者安全地前往锦绣谷。"
G["You have our thanks, $p. We'll be watchin' over ya."]="我们很感激你，$p。我们会保佑你的。"
G["You have outgrown any teachings I could offer. Go with the blessing of the Earth Mother. Seek out the tauren Tarn in the northwestern shops of Thunder Bluff's central plateau. Be guided by his wisdom."]="我已经没什么可教你了。带着大地之母的祝福离开吧。在雷霆崖的中央高原西北方的商店找到牛头人塔恩。愿你得到他智慧的指引。"
G["You have outstayed your welcome, Keeper. Be gone!"]="你们这是敬酒不吃吃罚酒，时间的守护者。滚开！"
G["You have outworn your welcome!"]="你已经不受欢迎了！"
G["You have parcel to pick up? You have mail to send?\n\nVery fast service, yes!"]="你是来拿包裹的吗？还是来寄信的？\n\n我可以提供超速快递服务哦！"
G["You have passed your test, well done! Your training may now continue."]="你已经通过测试了，干得好！对你的培训可以继续了。"
G["You have permission to enter the city."]="你已经被许可进城了。"
G["You have persevered against some of my best advisors... but none can withstand the might of the Blood Hammer. Behold, Lord Sanguinar!"]="你们击败了我最强大的顾问……但是没有人能战胜鲜血之锤。出来吧，萨古纳尔男爵！"
G["You have pets that need watching? I promise I will consider not eat them."]="你需要别人帮你照看宠物？我保证会多加考虑，争取别吃掉它们。"
G["You have pets, too. We fight?"]="你也有宠物。我们打一场吧？"
G["You have pie? Someone gave us pie year ago. Really yummy."]="有馅饼吗？以前有人给过我一块馅饼。好吃极了！"
G["You have plenty of time before the next Sky Race to meditate on what you have learned. On race days, speak to me to enter the competition."]="在下一场飞行竞技赛开始前，你有充足的时间思考自己学到了什么。在比赛日，与我交谈即可参与竞赛。"
G["You have proven capable. Resourceful. I think you will be the one to take the fight to the gyreworms where we cannot. You will be the one to make your way deep into the Crumbling Depths, the only place where we cannot pass."]="你已经证明了自己的实力和才智。我相信你将成为打败旋岩虫的英雄。那是我们无法完成的任务。你要深入碎岩之渊，那里是我们唯一无法通过的地方。"
G["You have proven to be an exemplary hero. A champion for your cause."]="你的确是一个英雄楷模。是联盟事业的勇士。"
G["You have proven too difficult to control!"]="事实证明你真是太难控制了！"
G["You have proven yourself as an explorer and seeker of knowledge."]="你当之无愧是一名优秀的探险家，你的心中充满了对知识的渴求。"
G["You have reached Rank 1: Corporal"]="你达到了1级军衔：下士"
G["You have reached Rank 1: Recruit"]="你达到了1级军衔：新兵"
G["You have reached Rank 2: First Lieutenant"]="你达到了2级军衔：中尉"
G["You have reached new heights in your path to mastery. Let us see if we can take you even further..."]="你在成为大师的旅途上又达到了新的高度。让我们看看能不能让你更上一层楼……"
G["You have reached the limits of my knowledge, but there is more yet to learn. Across the sea, in the Mage Quarter of Stormwind City, a great tailor dwells. His name is Georgio Bolero, and he will train you now, I think. Go and speak with him."]="我所掌握的裁缝技能非常有限，已经没有什么可以教你的了。在无尽之海的另一边，暴风城的法师区中有一位伟大的裁缝。他名叫乔吉奥·波利罗，我想由他来做你的导师比较合适。去那儿和他谈谈吧。"
G["You have returned to finish the job? <Lathoric laughs.> Obsidion rise and annihilate them!"]="你回来了？<拉索里克笑了起来。>奥比斯顿，消灭他们！"
G["You have roach on your foot, $gbrother:sister;.\n\nWatch your step.  The roaches help us spread disease."]="你脚上有蟑螂，$g兄弟:姐妹;。\n\n小心走路。蟑螂能帮我们传播疾病。"
G["You have robbed it of its strength. Now rob it of its life!"]="你剥夺了它的力量。现在，取走它的性命吧！"
G["You have run out of time, mortals! Your lives are forfeit!"]="你们已经没有时间了，凡人！你们的生命已经不再属于你们！"
G["You have run out of time. Shall we try again?"]="时间到。要再试一次吗？"
G["You have saved Binan Village, $n. Ring the gong so all shall know!"]="你救了滨岸村，$n。快把锣敲响，让所有人都知道这个好消息吧！"
G["You have saved Wintergarde! With Thel'zan's filth washed away, the 7th Legion will easily clean up the remaining Scourge. When you are done here, report to Angrathar!"]="你拯救了暮冬要塞！塞尔赞的威胁已经解除，残余的天灾士兵就交给第七军团解决吧。等你处理完这里的事务后，就去天谴之门安加萨报到吧！"
G["You have saved me from those vicious monsters. Thank you."]="谢谢你从那些怪物手中救了我。"
G["You have saved my life, champion. For that, I am in your debt."]="你救了我的命，勇士。我欠你一份人情。"
G["You have saved us from a fate far worse than death, $n.  You have the eternal gratitude of the Mok'Nathal ancestors."]="$n，你拯救了我们，否则莫克纳萨氏族将遭遇比死亡更悲惨的命运。氏族的先祖永远感激你。"
G["You have sealed your doom!"]="你们这是自掘坟墓！"
G["You have sealed your fate, troll."]="你这是自掘坟墓，巨魔。"
G["You have seen where this Divine Bell is hidden? Very good. Garrosh will be pleased. We will try to locate the site you describe, and will contact you as soon as we find it."]="你知道圣钟被藏在哪里了？很好。加尔鲁什会很满意的。我们会试着找出你所描述的位置，一旦我们成功就会立即与你联系。"
G["You have selected all five of your samples."]="你已经把五份样本都选好了。"
G["You have served honorably.. I shall make your victory known to all the Horde."]="你光荣地完成了任务……我会让整个部落都知道你获胜的消息的。"
G["You have served one of three with honor, $n. Our time is at an end. Kuros will call for you when he is ready."]="你对三人执政团的效劳是一种荣耀，$n。多保重。当库卢斯准备好了的时候，他会召唤你的。"
G["You have served us well, $p. Please continue as we draw near completion."]="你的帮助非常重要，$p。我们已经接近完工了，请继续帮助我们。"
G["You have shown Pandaria the power of a true hero."]="向潘达利亚展示了一个真英雄的力量。"
G["You have shown me I must remain diligent in my training."]="你让我明白，我必须保持刻苦的训练。"
G["You have shown me the face of true evil, $n."]="$n，你简直是邪恶的化身。"
G["You have shown me truths that I would have never known. You and your allies have gifted me with something that cannot bear a price: Redemption. Thrall, redeemer of the Mag'har, you honor me as none ever have..."]="你让我看到了我可能永远都不会知道的真相。你和你的朋友们给我带来了无价的礼物：救赎。萨尔，玛格汉的救世主，你让我感到了前所未有的荣耀……"
G["You have shown me your desire, and have paid with precious stone.  I will teach you..."]="你表明了自己的愿望，也支付了珍贵的石头。我会教你的……"
G["You have shown that you are ready for the rank of champion."]="看来你已经做好晋级为冠军的准备了。"
G["You have some fight in you. I'm impressed."]="刚才的战斗给我留下了深刻的印象。"
G["You have some skill, it is true, but every moment I spend teaching you is one more moment the undead will spend in torment. Prove to me that you are worth my time."]="你的确有些能力，这是真的，但是我花费时间教你的每一刻对亡灵来说都是承受痛苦折磨的每一刻。你必须向我证明值得让我花时间教你。"
G["You have some spare commissions you'd like to spend? I'll take them off your hands.\n\nWhat would you like to buy?"]="你手上有多余的委任状？我可以帮你出手。\n\n你想买点什么？"
G["You have something to say to my face?"]="你有什么话要对我说吗？"
G["You have something to show me?"]="你有什么东西要给我看？"
G["You have stood and listened long enough. Step forth."]="别老站着不动。上前一步吧。"
G["You have strayed too far. Wasted too much time...."]="你们漂泊得太远了，浪费了太多的时间……"
G["You have strength I didn't see at first."]="你的力量超出了我的预料。"
G["You have studied your craft well, $c."]="Veo que has estudiado mucho."
G["You have successfully planted the seaforium at the Blackrock tower."]="你已成功将爆盐炸弹安放在黑石塔楼处。"
G["You have successfully planted the seaforium at the munitions hut."]="你已成功将爆盐炸弹安放在军需营帐处。"
G["You have summoned me, fool!  Now DIE!"]="是你召唤我来的，愚蠢的东西！现在受死吧！"
G["You have surpassed your title. You are a Battlemaiden no longer. Take your new crown, Nar'jira, champion of Azshara."]="女武士这个头衔已经无法彰显你的功勋了。接受这新的冠冕吧——纳尓吉拉，艾萨拉的勇士。"
G["You have swept the filth from my doorstep. Perhaps you are worthy of my attention."]="这么说，你们帮我处理了门口的垃圾。我想我还得说声谢谢。"
G["You have talent, $n. But mercy makes you weak."]="你很有天赋，$n。但仁慈使你懦弱。"
G["You have taught me much, $r.  It seems the master has again become the student."]="你教会了我很多，$r。看来老师又变成学生了。"
G["You have the heart of a giant, $n. It has been an honor!"]="你有一颗巨人的心，$n。我无比荣幸！"
G["You have the look of a $g man : woman; who seeks knowledge. Perhaps you seek the teachings of the forge, and the hammer. Perhaps I can guide you down that path. But only once you have accepted the spirits, and listened to their calling."]="Pareces $ghombre:mujer; con sed de conocimiento. Quizás busques la enseñanza de la forja, así como del martillo. Tal vez yo pueda ayudarte a recorrer ese camino. Pero solo cuando hayas aceptado a los espíritus y hayas escuchado su llamada."
G["You have the look of a champion. But do you have the fortitude."]="你长着一张英雄脸。天知道你是不是真那么坚毅。"
G["You have the power to change your destiny!"]="你拥有改变命运的能力！"
G["You have the stride of a champion, $r."]="Tienes el andar de $gun campeón:una campeona;, $r."
G["You have the support of Ogri'la."]="你得到了奥格瑞拉的支持。"
G["You have thwarted us for now, but we shall return..."]="你暂时阻碍了我们，但是我们会回来的……"
G["You have time to kill hapless island folk but no time to assemble my glorious body?"]="你有时间去屠杀岛上无助的居民，却没有时间帮忙收集我伟大的身躯？"
G["You have time?  Soo-nee teach you good song!"]="你有空吗？索乌尼可以教你好听的曲子！"
G["You have to be careful lighting fireworks when you can't feel your fingers..."]="点烟花的时候要多加小心，手指头是很宝贵的……"
G["You have to be kidding me..."]="你一定是在和我开玩笑……"
G["You have to believe me, I'm innocent!"]="你要相信我，我是无辜的！"
G["You have to get out of here before it gets to you, too!"]="你最好赶紧离开，不然你也会被它影响！"
G["You have to go to Thousand Needles and help. Please!"]="你必须前往千针石林提供帮助。拜托了！"
G["You have to help me, $c! Twilight's Hammer attacked my zeppelin and their men tried to take the tablets and the crystal I was transporting to Orgrimmar."]="你必须帮助我，$c！暮光之锤袭击了我的飞艇，妄图夺走正在被运往奥格瑞玛的石板和水晶。"
G["You have to help us, Nove!"]="你必须帮助我们，诺弗！"
G["You have to help! He just went to the market and never came back!"]="一定要帮帮我！他去了市场，就再没有回来！"
G["You have to let me in, my customers are waiting."]="你们必须让我进去，我的客人们还在等着呢。"
G["You have to put a stop to this madness before it's too late!"]="你必须阻止这疯狂的一切，否则就来不及了！"
G["You have traveled long and risked much to be here! Your devotion shall be rewarded."]="你经历了长途跋涉和艰难险阻来到这里！你应为你的执着而得到奖励。"
G["You have truly become one of the finest tailors in the business! Congratulations, I am proud to have been your instructor!"]="你已经真正成为这行中最好的裁缝之一了！恭喜你，我为曾当过你的导师而感到骄傲！"
G["You have truly excelled in your knowledge of enchanting. There is much more to learn, if you are willing. Speak to Taladan, in the Craftsmen's Terrace in Darnassus."]="你在魔法方面的知识真是很出色。如果你愿意的话，还有很多要学的。跟塔兰丹谈谈，他在达纳苏斯的工匠区。"
G["You have truly grown more cunning, $n."]="你真的变得狡猾多了，$n。"
G["You have us working very efficiently, $rt. Our task will be complete soon at this pace."]="你让我们的工作效率提高了，$rt。按这个速度，我们的任务很快就会完成了。"
G["You have walked the trial of fortitude, and learned of the path of the Black Ox. May it bless your passage."]="你通过了坚毅的试炼，并领悟了玄牛之道。愿它永远护佑你的道路。"
G["You have walked the trial of hope, and learned of the path of the Red Crane. May it guide your footsteps through time."]="你通过了希望的试炼，并领悟了朱鹤之道。愿它永远指引你的脚步。"
G["You have walked the trial of strength, and learned of the path of the White Tiger. May you remember this lesson, always."]="你通过了力量的试炼，并领悟了白虎之道。愿你永远记住这一课。"
G["You have walked the trial of wisdom, and learned of the path of the Jade Serpent. May you learn from this lesson, as I did."]="你通过了智慧的试炼，并领悟了青龙之道。愿你能像我一样，有所收获。"
G["You have wasted your time and mine by coming to me for training, $n. I have no time to teach basic skills. We're fighting a war here, and this is one of the front lines. Don't return to me until you are more prepared."]="你来找我求学是浪费了你我的时间，$n。我没时间教授基础技能。我们在这里战斗，而这里是一处前线。在你准备充分之前不要再来找我。"
G["You have withstood the torment of the Lich King himself, and now Shadowmourne is yours."]="你承受住了巫妖王的折磨，现在，影之哀伤是你的了。"
G["You have woken the bull, now face the horns!"]="你已经激怒了公牛，现在，准备面对我的犄角吧！"
G["You have won this battle, but not... the... war."]="你虽然赢得了这次战役，但无法赢得整个战争。"
G["You have won... Maiev. But the huntress... is nothing without the hunt. You... are nothing... without me."]="你赢了……玛维。但是……一个没有目标的猎手……什么都不是。你……离开了我……什么都不是。"
G["You have worked your way up... time to see the boss. Go to Josef and tell him you are ready."]="Has logrado avanzar, es hora de que vayas a ver al jefe. Ve a ver a Josef y dile que ya estás $gpreparado:preparada;."
G["You have wrested control of the Oculus from the forces of Malygos.  The red flight is in your debt."]="你从玛里苟斯的部队手中夺得了魔环的控制权。红龙军团欠你一个人情。"
G["You have your mop, now look for stains to swab!"]="你已经拿到了拖把，现在赶快去清除污点！"
G["You have your petty secret, Kanrethad. Now, I demand knowledge from you... why do you care?"]="你也有你的小秘密，坎雷萨德。现在，我必须要问你……你为什么在意这些？"
G["You have your whole life ahead of you."]="你的人生还长得很。"
G["You have |cFFFF0000|Hspell:116161|h[Crossed Over]|h|r to the Spirit World! You or an ally must heal your spirit to 90% health within 30 seconds or else you will perish!"]="你已经|cFFFF0000|Hspell:116161|h[灵魂越界]|h|r到了灵魂世界！你或某位同伴必须在30秒内为你的灵魂回复90%的生命，否则你就将消亡！"
G["You have, in the face of terrifying adversity, shown true valor and chivalry. From one glimmering beacon of heroism to another: I salute you!"]="在恐怖的灾难之前，你显示了真正的勇气与骑士精神。作为一个英雄主义的楷模，我向另一个同样的楷模敬礼！"
G["You have...turnip...for a head..."]="你的……脑袋……像芜菁……"
G["You haven't completed the quest!"]="你还没完成使命！"
G["You haven't had a real adventure until you've skipped through Onyxia's whelp pits!"]="要是你没到过奥妮克希亚的巢穴，就不算是真正冒险过！"
G["You haven't heard of the \"Brew of the Month\" club?  It's a bunch of really cute guys that want to celebrate Brewfest all year long!  They tried to bring Brewfest back in the past, but it never lasted very long.\n\nOnce you join the club you get mailed a different brew every month!  If you like that brew, you can talk to the vendors in Ironforge to get more brew.\n\nI think you are cute enough to join the club.  You give me a few prize tokens and I'll give you the forms.  Then maybe we can celebrate Brewfest together, all year round!"]="¿No has oído hablar del Club \"de la Cerveza del Mes?\" ¡Son un montón de tipos muy guapos que quieren celebrar la Fiesta de la Cerveza durante todo el año! Intentaron volver a traer la Fiesta de la Cerveza en el pasado, pero nunca duró demasiado.\n\nCuando te hayas unido al Club, se te enviará por correo una cerveza diferente cada mes. Si te gusta esa cerveza, puedes hablar con los vendedores de Forjaz para conseguir más.\n\nCreo que tienes belleza suficiente para unirte al Club. Tú me das unas cuantas fichas y yo te daré los formularios. ¡Quizá podamos celebrar la Fiesta de la Cerveza juntos durante todo el año!"
G["You haven't heard of the \"Brew of the Month\" club?  Those gals love to party.  If they had their way, Brewfest would never end!  Sometimes last year, it felt like it didn't.\n\nBut now they've figured, the best way to keep the Brewfest spirit going would be to allow people to join their club.\n\nFor a small fee, just a few tokens, you can join!  You get brew mailed to you every month and a chance to buy that same brew if you like it.  It's cutting edge stuff and a way to make sure that Brewfest's spirit is never really gone."]="¿No has oído hablar del Club \"de la Cerveza del Mes?\" A esos tipos les encanta estar de fiesta. ¡Si fuera por ellos, la Fiesta de la Cerveza nunca acabaría! A veces, la del año pasado parecía no haber acabado.\n\nPero ahora han llegado a la conclusión de que la mejor manera de mantener vivo el espíritu de la Fiesta de la Cerveza es permitir que la gente se una a su club.\n\n¡Puedes unirte por solo unas fichas! Todos los meses se te enviará cerveza y podrás comprar esa misma cerveza si te gusta. Se trata de material de máxima calidad y es una forma de asegurarse de que el espíritu de la Fiesta de la Cerveza no se vaya nunca."
G["You haven't lived until you've looked down on the world from the back of a wind rider."]="在你从驭风者背上往下俯瞰这个世界之前，不能说你真正活过。"
G["You haven't much time. The Lich King sees what the sword sees. He will be here shortly."]="你没有时间了。巫妖王能看到剑旁的一切。他就要来了。"
G["You haven't seen zhe last of me, $p!"]="你还没见识到我真正的本事呢，$p！"
G["You haven't signed your waiver!  Come back after you've signed away all claims of liability toward me or Tally."]="你还没有签署你的声明！在你签字放弃所有对我和塔利的起诉权利之后再回来吧。"
G["You haven't the strength to lead anyone."]="你没有力量领导任何人。"
G["You haven't yet mastered the simplest of enchantments. Please, trouble Dolothos instead."]="你连最简单的附魔技能都没有学会呢。请你先去向多洛索斯请教吧。"
G["You having a good time here with us in Ogri'la?\n\nWe have a lot of stuff that our ogres are making, day and night.  We save the best to sell to our coolest guests like you!\n\nSo, as you're out there doing your thing, and making the mountains a safer place, stop by from time to time to see what we have.\n\nGood luck out there, $g man : chicky;."]="¿Lo estás pasando bien con nosotros en Ogri'la?\n\nNuestros ogros están fabricando muchas cosas, noche y día. ¡Guardamos las mejores para vendérselas a nuestros invitados más enrollados, como tú!\n\nAsí que mientras andes por ahí haciendo lo que haces y convirtiendo las montañas en un lugar más seguro, pásate por aquí de vez en cuando para ver qué tenemos.\n\nSuerte ahí fuera $ghombre:mujer;."
G["You healed the most damage during this battle!"]="你在这一战中为盟友治疗了最多的伤害！"
G["You hear Unkor, dummy? Dance!"]="你听到安克尔的话吗，聋子？给我跳舞！"
G["You hear a faint clicking noise coming from the west..."]="你听见从西边传来了微弱的咔嗒声……"
G["You hear a faint echo...."]="你听到了微弱的回声……"
G["You hear a faint unlocking sound..."]="你听到了微弱的开锁声……"
G["You hear a grinding noise coming from the elevator shaft!"]="从升降机井里传来一声刺耳的噪音！"
G["You hear a loud cracking noise as the rockling tries to smile."]="石巨人尝试着露出微笑，你听到一阵响亮的岩石撞击声。"
G["You hear a loud rumble of metal grinding on stone..."]="你听到了金属摩擦石头的噪音……"
G["You hear a low guttural growl from nearby."]="你听到附近传来一声低沉的咆哮。"
G["You hear a mournful howl in the distance."]="你听到远处传来一声凄凉的哀嚎。"
G["You hear a noise behind you."]="你听到背后传来了一声噪音。"
G["You hear a noise from above the cabin door!"]="从舱门上方传来一阵响声！"
G["You hear a shuffling noise nearby, but see nothing."]="你听到身边传来一阵细碎的声音，却什么都没有看见。"
G["You hear it beeping very faintly.  The fossil must be very, very far away."]="你只能听到极为微弱的“哔哔”声。化石距离你一定还非常非常远。"
G["You hear rustling of heavy wings in the distance.  The matriarch approaches!"]="远处传来巨大翅膀的扇动声。龙母来了！"
G["You hear something, Jones? I almost thought I heard something, right there..."]="你听见什么没有，琼斯？我好像……听到了什么东西……在那边……"
G["You hear that, naga? $n is on $g his : her; way to settle our \"negotiations\"!"]="¿Habéis oído eso, nagas? ¡$n viene de camino para llegar a un acuerdo en nuestras \"negociaciones\"!"
G["You hear that? I think they're getting closer..."]="你听见了吗？我想他们正在靠近……"
G["You hear that? You hear that chantin', brother? They're cheerin' for the Rulkster!"]="¿Has oído eso? ¿Has oído ese canto, $ghermano:hermana;? ¡Están animando al Julkster!"
G["You hear the faint sound of a gate unlocking in the cavern."]="你听到山洞中传来了微弱的开锁声。"
G["You hear the sound of beating wings from high up in the canyon as Rexxar approaches."]="从峡谷的高处传来了翅膀拍击的声音。雷克萨来了！"
G["You hear the sound of giant gears churning to life below the depths..."]="你听到了从深处传来的齿轮转动声……"
G["You hear the sound of shuffling stones behind you."]="从你身后传来了石头撞击的声音。"
G["You hear, some of the grummles are refusing to go up Mount Neverest?"]="你听说了吗，有些土地精不愿意爬上不息山？"
G["You heard correctly, Thassarian.  I wanted to give you a chance to kill me again."]="你听得没错，萨萨里安。我想再给你一个杀死我的机会。"
G["You heard him! Keep that gun stocked with ammo!"]="你也听到了！保持机枪的弹幕！"
G["You heard him, men. We make our stand here!"]="你们听见他说的了。我们将坚守此地！"
G["You heard him, traveler. Speak to me again when you're ready to speak to Belgrum."]="Ya le has oído, viajero. Vuelve a hablar conmigo cuando estés $glisto:lista; para hablar con Belgrum."
G["You heard me, $glad:lass; - a butt! Not a fitting gift for a lady. But I liked it. So I offered to donate it to me local drinkin' hole.\n\nThey called it Durty Pete's Bottom, and eventually named the pub after it, afore them orcs burned it to toast, and all that's left today is me big blackened bottom amidst a heap of rubble.\n\n<Ol' Durty Pete sheds a single tear.>"]="Ya me has oído, $gchaval:chavala;, ¡un culo! No es un regalo apropiado para una señorita. Pero a mí me gustaba. Así que lo doné a mi taberna local.\n\nLo llamaron \"el trasero de Pete\", y al final la taberna se acabó llamando así, antes de que los orcos la redujeran a cenizas, y ahora solo queda mi trasero grande y ennegrecido en medio de un montón de escombros.\n\n<El Viejo Pete derrama una sola lágrima.>"
G["You heard that from your sister and she doesn't count. She's a big meanie. I double hozen dare you to ring the bell!"]="那是你姐姐说的，根本不能算数。她是个小气鬼。你一定要去敲钟，否则我就把你的丑事都说出去！"
G["You heard the Prophet. Move, filth."]="你听到先知说的话了。快走，你这令人厌恶的家伙。"
G["You heard the Warlord, maggots! MARCH!"]="你们听到督军的话了，废物！前进！"
G["You heard the admiral. Concentrate fire on the Horde base. Begin your attack runs."]="听从上将命令，准备攻击，集中火力对付部落基地。"
G["You heard the fleshling! MOVE OUT!"]="你们听到那肉人说的话了吗！开始行动！"
G["You heard the goblin, $p. Get to work!"]="你听到地精的话了，$p，快去干活！"
G["You heard the king, bolster the line! Give our heroes the time they need to reach Garrosh!"]="听国王的命令，守住阵线！帮我们的英雄争取追击加尔鲁什的时间！"
G["You heard the lady, boys... Give 'em some fire!"]="你们听说过那位女士，孩子们……给他们些烈火尝尝！"
G["You heard what I said! Your parents are cowards, and so are you, Furlbrow!"]="我偏要说！你的父母都是胆小鬼，你也是，弗布隆！"
G["You help Rainspeaker! I saw you help Rainspeaker! Traitor thing!"]="你竟然帮助雨声鳄鱼人！我都看见了！你这个叛徒！"
G["You here to buy or sell, stranger? Feel free to look around."]="¿Has venido a comprar o a vender, $gforastero:forastera;? No te cortes en echar un vistazo por ahí."
G["You here to buy or sell? Feel free to look around."]="你是来购物的，还是来卖货的？请随便瞧瞧吧。"
G["You here to fight?"]="你是来报名参战的吗？"
G["You here to fish?"]="你来这儿钓鱼？"
G["You here to steal my yaks?!\n\nIf so, be ready for me to slap that look off your face."]="你想偷我的牦牛？！\n\n如果真是这样，就等着我抽你的耳刮子吧。"
G["You here to stomp on the mook-mooks?"]="你是来帮我教训土拨鼠的吗？"
G["You heroes are a sight for sore eyes. Vol'jin's rebellion wasn't able to secure the bay. We're taking a pounding."]="我们都等得望眼欲穿了。沃金的起义军没有能守住海湾。我们遭到了重创。"
G["You hide well, worms.  But how long you can delay your doom?"]="你们很会捉迷藏，虫子。但你们能藏多久呢？"
G["You hit like a child."]="你的攻击弱得像个孩子。"
G["You hit like a girl. Honestly. Is that the best you can do?"]="我说，你挥舞鞭子的力道像个小姑娘。你就这点能耐？"
G["You hit rock or me hit you!"]="快把石头砸开，不然裂开的就是你的脑袋！"
G["You hold evil in your hands, fool! REPENT!"]="你心中有邪恶之念，蠢货！悔改吧！"
G["You hold my father's blade, $n. My soldiers are yours to control, my $g Lord:Lady;. Take them... Lead them... The impure must be purged. They must be cleansed of their taint."]="您握着我父亲的剑，$n。我的士兵将听从您的命令，$g阁下:女士;。请您带上他们，领导他们，净化一切邪恶的势力。天灾军团必须被彻底消除！"
G["You hold still, fish!"]="待着别动，小鱼！"
G["You hold still, spider!"]="停住别动，蜘蛛！"
G["You honor me with your presence, $r. Alas, it is too late for me. I pass from this world soon, but... I know so much. So much is in this head of mine. So much that could help this world fend off the beasts of this citadel of depravity.\n\nPerhaps if you are a master of a trade... Yes, perhaps you would take the knowledge I hold and use it to save this world."]="你的到来让我倍感觉欣慰，$r。哎，我的时间真的不多了，或许我马上就要离开这个世界了，可……我的智慧……我脑海中容纳了那么多东西。那么可以帮助你们击败隐藏在这座城堡中的邪恶堕落腐朽势力的智慧。\n\n智慧的火种绝对不能熄灭……你有精通任何制造技艺吗……对啊，或许你能继承这些知识，并用它拯救这个世界。"
G["You honor me, $g brother:sister;."]="你让我感到很荣幸，我的$g兄弟:姐妹;。"
G["You honor our memory."]="你让我们的回忆倍感荣光。"
G["You honor the spirits of the animals you must slay by not letting them go to waste.  Aska Mistrunner will show you how.  She has a kitchen on the high rise."]="你没有浪费那些你必须杀死的动物，因此你赐予了这些动物的灵魂以荣誉。阿丝卡·迷雾行者将会给你演示怎么处理。她在高地上有个厨房。"
G["You honor us by delivering this information.  It seems as if we've finally found the spy in the city... a homeless man whom we will execute shortly.  Take your reward, you've done well!"]="由你为我们送来这份消息可真是荣幸。看来我们终于找到了那个潜伏在城市中的间谍……一个流浪汉。他很快就会被处决。请拿上你的奖励，干得好！"
G["You honor us with your actions on behalf of our dead, $n."]="你为我们所做的一切，为我们带来了光荣，$n。"
G["You honor us with your presence, $n."]="我们对你的出席感到很荣幸，$n。"
G["You honor us with your presence, Champion."]="Nos honras con tu presencia, $gcampeón:campeona;."
G["You honor us with your presence, my $glord:lady;."]="Nos honras con tu presencia, mi $gseñor:señora;."
G["You honor us, friend."]="你让我们感到很荣幸，朋友。"
G["You hurt Lunk's feelings when you kill."]="你杀戮的时候，隆克感觉受了伤。"
G["You hurted the chief's lion seal! WHY YOU HURT LION SEAL??!"]="你伤害了首领的海狮！你为什么要伤害海狮？？！"
G["You impetuous little whelp... I know exactly what you and the mortal are up to."]="你这个莽撞的小崽子……我知道你和那个凡人想要干什么。"
G["You impress me, my young student. You have great strength in you."]="你令我刮目相看，年轻的弟子。在你体内蕴藏着巨大的力量。"
G["You in hot water now!"]="你惹上大麻烦了！"
G["You infuriate me, mortal!"]="你把我惹火了，凡人！"
G["You insult my honor with your inquiries."]="你的质问损害了我的荣誉。"
G["You invade my home and then dare to challenge me?  I will tear the hearts from your chests and offer them as gifts to the death god! Rualg nja gaborr!"]="你们不仅侵入我的家园，还有胆来挑战我？我要把你们的徽记拿来作为礼物献祭给伟大的死神！Rualg nja gaborr！"
G["You is BAD $r!"]="你是坏$r！"
G["You is bad orc... baaad... or... argh!"]="你是个坏兽人……坏……啊！"
G["You is friend. Tanks!"]="你是自己人。谢谢你！"
G["You join me and I shower wealth and power upon you."]="加入我，我将让你沐浴在财富与权力之中。"
G["You joined a battle already lost."]="你卷入了一场必败的战斗。"
G["You just ate, silly. How can you be hungry again?"]="你刚吃过，傻瓜。你怎么又饿了呢？"
G["You just can't get good help these days!"]="别指望有谁会帮你！"
G["You just don't get it! This could be a herald to the end times!"]="你不明白！这可能是末日来临的预兆！"
G["You just don't see $cs like $n anymore."]="$n es $gun:una; $c de $glos:las; que ya no se ven."
G["You just get yourself beat up! Hah! You so dumb, slave thing."]="吃到苦头了吧！哈哈！你这蠢奴隶。"
G["You just going to kneel there all day?"]="你准备就这么整天跪在那里吗？"
G["You just got Chromie'd!"]="让克罗米来教训你！"
G["You just got served, punk!"]="你玩完了，蠢货！"
G["You just keep goin' down this same road, but..."]="沿着这条路往下走就是了，但是……"
G["You just let Zen'Kiki know when you're ready!  I'll bring one of these birds down for ya!"]="¡Avisa a Zen'Kiki cuando estés $glih'to:lih'ta;! ¡Traeré uno de esos pájaros pa' ti!"
G["You just watch slave thing, Goregek take care of these hardknuckles!"]="奴隶，你待在一旁看着就是了。让格利基克来对付这些硬皮猩猩！"
G["You just watered that spot! Don't get lazy on me!"]="你刚刚浇过那个地方了！别对我耍懒！"
G["You just won a kickin' rad poster! Raise your hand in the air like you just don't care!"]="你刚刚赢得了一张酷炫海报！把手举起来，装成满不在乎的样子吧！"
G["You just won a video card!!"]="你刚刚赢得了一块显示卡！！"
G["You keep a lookout, $r! The elfs are everywhere!"]="一定要小心，$r！这里到处都是精灵！"
G["You keep pointing me in the right direction and I'll keep tossing these kegs!"]="你继续帮我指引方向，我继续丢桶！"
G["You keep talking, but all I hear is \"Blah blah my people bathe in our own filth.\""]="Sigues hablando, pero todo lo que escucho es \"Bla, bla, mi pueblo se baña en nuestra propia mugre.\""
G["You keep that garbage up and I'll ship you back to your momma in a box with a note strapped to your chest that reads: FAILURE."]="你就抱着那堆垃圾吧。我要在你胸前贴上“失败者”的标签，然后将你塞进箱子里寄给你的母亲。"
G["You keep the company of wolvar? Perhaps you didn't come with good intentions after all."]="你和狼獾人是一伙的吧？你大概本来就心怀不轨。"
G["You keep this up, and I might just have to share my secret to growing so many vegetables."]="你一直这样的话，我也只好告诉你我种出这么多蔬菜的秘密。"
G["You kept me in that cell for too long, monster!"]="你把我关在牢笼里太久了！"
G["You kiddin' me..."]="开玩笑吧……"
G["You kidding me, Commander? I ain't here to babysit some untried newcomer."]="¿Es una broma, comandante? Yo no estoy aquí para hacer de niñera para $gun:una; $gnovato:novata; sin entrenamiento."
G["You kids have fun at Mudmug's! And thanks again, $n!"]="在泥盏那儿玩得开心点！再次感谢！"
G["You kill dese ettins so we be comin' back ta finish dey job, mon!"]="你要消灭那些双头魔，这样我们才能回来完成工作，朋友！"
G["You kill gronn!  Now you fight things from sky?"]="你杀死了戈隆！现在你又得和那些天上来的家伙作战吗？"
G["You kill him - you kill my cat! Why must I suffer so?"]="你——你杀了我的猎豹！为什么我要遭这种罪？"
G["You kill next one!"]="你杀下一个！"
G["You kill our pups! We kill you back!"]="你们杀了我们的孩子！我们要报仇！"
G["You kill the trollbear, mon? It be safe for Tanzar to come out now?"]="朋友，你除掉巨魔熊了吗？坦扎尔现在安全了？"
G["You kill the trollbear, mon? It be safe for me to make my way back now?"]="你除掉那巨魔熊了吗，朋友？我现在能安全地回去了吗？"
G["You killed Ghost Howl.  You're a stud!"]="你杀了鬼嚎。你这个傻瓜！"
G["You killed dozens of my students.  You will pay for what you've done."]="你杀死了我的学生。你将为此付出代价。"
G["You killed me and now I will kill you... over and over!"]="你杀了我，现在轮到我杀你了……反反复复地杀！"
G["You kind of like me, don't you?"]="你喜欢我，是不是？"
G["You know I can make no guarantee of your safety... or Garrosh's response."]="你们知道的，我无法保证你们的安全……以及加尔鲁什的反应。"
G["You know I can't resist tauren women, Donty. They're my one weakness..."]="你知道我无法拒绝牛头人美女，多特拉格。她们是我的死穴……"
G["You know I do, mortal; I am abandoning a fair number of pretenses here, and I recommend you do the same.\n\nYou have come here clearly because you know that what you possess, garnered from your actions within the Sunken Temple of the Atal'al, has brought you to me for a purpose.  This purpose is to put my associate... my brother, to rest.  He is trapped within a nightmare within the Dream itself.  He cannot break free alone."]="你很清楚我知道这些，$r。我们坦率地说吧。\n\n很明显你来这里是因为你知道自己拿着什么样的东西，你在哈卡的神庙中得到的这件东西使你身负着一件使命来到我面前。这个使命就是让我的伙伴……我的兄弟，得到安息。他被困在翡翠梦境的噩梦中，他自己无法解脱出来。"
G["You know I love it when you beg... but no."]="你知道，我喜欢看着你乞求我……但是不行。"
G["You know I'd gladly blow myself up for the company with you in charge, boss!"]="你知道，老板，为了公司，我很愿意在你的监督下把我自己炸飞！"
G["You know Riko?  He good party."]="你认识里克？他是个好朋友！"
G["You know Yoon, maybe I was wrong about you."]="知道吗老愚，也许是我错了。"
G["You know about the Violet Eye then?  Maybe I'll have time for you later.\n\nI have to get back to my work."]="你对紫罗兰之眼有所了解？或许我待会有时间的话会跟你聊聊。\n\n现在我得继续做事。"
G["You know anything 'bout yaks, rookie? Well I know a lot about 'em."]="¿Sabes algo sobre yaks, $gnovato:novata;? Pues yo sé mucho sobre ellos."
G["You know enough to be dangerous, but you still look like you need training to me $n."]="Sabes lo suficiente como para ser $gpeligroso:peligrosa;, pero a mí me parece que todavía necesitas instrucción, $n."
G["You know me to be the Supreme Commander of the Might of Kalimdor."]="我是卡利姆多联军的最高指挥官，你们都知道这一点。"
G["You know not what you do!  We must destroy you for your own good."]="你不知道你干了什么！我们要为了你的利益而毁灭你。"
G["You know not what you have done. Aman'Thul... What I... have... seen..."]="你根本不明白你究竟干了什么。阿曼苏尔……我……看到……的……"
G["You know not what you have unleashed!"]="你根本不明白自己放出了什么！"
G["You know nothing of fury, worm!"]="你对狂怒一无所知，虫子！"
G["You know nothing of loyalty!"]="你毫无忠诚可言！"
G["You know nothing of pain, monster!"]="怪物，你根本不了解什么才是真正的痛苦！"
G["You know nothing of power!"]="你们对力量一无所知！"
G["You know nothing of power. You cling to your allies in desperation, but they cannot save you."]="你对力量一无所知。你在绝望中寻求同伴，但他们救不了你。"
G["You know of more Stormstouts? Here, in Pandaria?"]="你认识风暴烈酒家的人吗？在潘达利亚？"
G["You know of our history with the black dragonflight, do you? I won't soon forget what Lady Prestor - Onyxia - did to my family. Maybe that's why I sought Wrathion out.\n\n<Anduin peers across the table at his unusual companion.>\n\nBut... he's not like the other black dragons, is he? He's completely honest and yet always hiding something. Not at all what I expected."]="你知道我们和黑龙军团的往事，对吧？我不会那么快忘记普瑞斯托女士——奥妮克希亚——对我的家族所做的一切。或许这就是我来找拉希奥的原因。\n\n<安度因看了看桌子对面那位不同寻常的同伴。>\n\n可是……他和其他黑龙不一样，不是吗？他非常坦诚，却又总在隐瞒着什么。和我预想中完全不同。"
G["You know of the Spirits of Competition, yes?\n\nEvery two years they draw close to the mortal realm. During such times, members of both the Alliance and Horde wear Competitor's Tabards into the Battlegrounds to honor the spirits, seeking to defeat one another and earn their favor.\n\nI stockpile souvenirs from such turbulent times. If you've learned the proper word, I might be convinced to part with one..."]="你知道竞争之魂吗？\n\n每两年它们就会接近我们的世界。在此期间，联盟或是部落的成员都可以穿着竞争者的战袍进入战场，以此赢得竞争之魂的青睐。\n\n我收集了一些相关的纪念品。如果你知道那段密语的话，我或许可以送你一些……"
G["You know that these are troubling times for the Horde.  Our supplies dwindle.  Our lands are barren.  Our warriors are in need of rest.  These are tasks that must be addressed for the good of the Horde."]="你知道眼下正是部落的困难时期。我们的补给日渐匮乏。我们的土地日益贫瘠。我们的战士们疲惫不堪。为了部落的利益，这些都是亟待解决的问题。"
G["You know the battle plan, right?"]="你知道作战计划，对吧？"
G["You know the plays, kid. Execute them!"]="你知道这是怎样的游戏，小子。干掉他们！"
G["You know the service down here just keeps getting worse and worse!"]="你们这里的服务简直越来越差了！"
G["You know the worst thing about fire creatures? No harvestable organs."]="你知道这些火焰怪物最糟糕的地方是什么？没有任何可供收集的器官。"
G["You know their kind as old gods.  Beware Yogg-Saron, the beast with a thousand maws.  His evil extends beyond Vordrassil's roots."]="你们将这种生物称为上古之神。它就是尤格-萨隆，拥有一千张嘴的怪物。它通过沃达希尔的根须散播着邪恶之力。"
G["You know there are crocolisks in the Canals. They were brought from the swamp as pets, but got thrown in the canals."]="我跟你说啊，运河里有鳄鱼。它们原本是沼泽地带的动物，但是被人当作宠物带了回来，然后又被抛弃在运河里了。"
G["You know too much!"]="你知道得太多了！"
G["You know well enough about why I'm here, Zanzil."]="你对我来此的原因了解得一清二楚，赞吉尔。"
G["You know what I been thinking, my good friend? You need a way to keep up with all your friends at home.\n\nI know a carpenter who can come by an install your own mailbox. How's that for an idea?"]="¿Sabes qué he estado pensando, mi $gbuen amigo:buena amiga;? Necesitas una manera de mantener el contacto con todos tus amigos desde casa.\n\nConozco a un carpintero que puede venir a instalarte un buzón. ¿Qué te parece mi idea?"
G["You know what I have a craving for? A good bowl of Swirling Mist Soup. That would sure taste good right now."]="你知道我最想要的是什么吗？一大碗迷雾汤。那一定很好喝。"
G["You know what I think? <Tomma glances quickly behind him.>\n\nThe saur-priests are as filled with filth as the village itself.\n\nTheir Kroshik-worship makes them weak. They preach strength, but do they hunt? Do they kill? Do they roll in the decaying remains of their fallen brothers?\n\nNo. They hide in their caves and talk. If they were truly strong, they would be out here fighting with us."]="你知道我怎么想吗？<托犸飞快地向身后看了一眼。>\n\n蜥蜴人祭司就跟这个村子本身一样肮脏。\n\n他们的考什克崇拜令自己变得软弱。他们鼓吹力量，可他们敢出去狩猎吗？他们敢杀人吗？他们敢在阵亡的兄弟们腐败的残躯上打滚吗？\n\n不敢。他们只会躲在山洞里夸夸其谈。如果他们真的够强壮，就应该出来与我们战斗。"
G["You know what dat mean..."]="你知道那意味着……"
G["You know what needs to be done, champion."]="你知道该怎么做，勇士。"
G["You know what they say - help your neighbors and your neighbors will help you.\n\nSure, you can help 'em out with chores now and then, but gifts make faster friends, don'tcha think?"]="你知道他们怎么说吗——帮助你的邻居，你的邻居也会帮助你。\n\n当然，你可以偶尔帮他们做一些杂事，但礼物能更快地让你们成为朋友，你不觉得吗？"
G["You know what they say about curiosity...."]="你们知道好奇心过剩的下场吧……"
G["You know what they say... if you can't beat 'em, join 'em! And in this case, you won't have the choice! Cruicible of Carnage, I adore you so."]="你知道他们所说的……如果不能击败他们，就加入他们！除此之外，你将别无选择！杀戮熔炉，我是如此热爱你。"
G["You know what time it is? That's right, it's time to DIE!"]="你知道现在是什么时刻？没错，现在是死亡的时刻！"
G["You know what would be the cherry on top today? Nazgrim dead."]="你知道今天的特大喜讯是什么吗？纳兹戈林死了。"
G["You know what's the best thing about this group?"]="你知道这组好在哪里吗？"
G["You know what, $p?"]="你知道吗，$p？"
G["You know what."]="你会什么力量啊。"
G["You know what? I'm going to show them that I can also become a master farmer!\n\nI'm going to turn this farm into one of the most prosperous in the Valley!\n\nIt's too much work for one pandaren, though. Whaddaya say? Want to help me?"]="你猜怎么？我要向他们证明，我也可以成为大师级农夫！\n\n我要把这个农场变成山谷里最繁荣的农场！\n\n但是，这对于一个熊猫人来说有点过于繁重了。你愿意帮助我吗？"
G["You know what? You remind me of the Ambulatory Campfire prototype that I've been working on."]="你知道吗？你让我想起了我曾经制造过的步行篝火原型机。"
G["You know where I stand, Stonemother."]="您知道我的立场，石母。"
G["You know who can really show you some things? Nogg! You go find him in Orgrimmar."]="你知道谁能真正让你开阔见识吗？诺格！去奥格瑞玛可以找到他。"
G["You know who's got the biggest vegetables in the Valley? You're lookin' at him!"]="你知道谷里谁家的蔬菜长得最大吗？远在天边，近在眼前！"
G["You know who's really smart? Nogg! Smarter than me, even. You go tell Nogg Thund sent you! You can find him by the control panel over there."]="你知道谁是真正聪明的人吗？诺格！甚至比我还要聪明。你去告诉诺格是桑德派你来的！你可以在那边的控制台那里找到他。"
G["You know why orc eyes glow red? It's because they drink blood!"]="你知道为什么兽人的眼睛闪着红光？因为他们喝的是血！"
G["You know why they call it stout? 'Cuz once it were rolling down the hill it couldnae be bargained wit', couldnae be reasoned wit'. It felt no pity, no remorse, no fear.\n\nIt were like a beervalanche, which is a damn fine way to die.\n\nSo that keg explodered soon as it hit the orphanage at the bottom of the hill, and I dove inta the mud puddle wit' me mouth open, an'... Come to think of it, I don't 'member how this story ends. Wanna see the tattoo?\n\n<Ol' Durty Pete drops his pants.>"]="知道为什么他们管它叫刚强烈酒吗？因为它曾经一直从山上滚下来。那时你可没办法和它商量，和它讲道理。它根本不懂得同情，不知道后悔，也绝不会害怕。\n\n那简直就像是一场啤酒雪崩，要是在那里死掉绝对算得上是轰轰烈烈。\n\n酒桶在撞到山下的孤儿院时炸开了。我立刻大张着嘴扑到了满是酒液的泥地里，然后……我记不清那个故事是怎样结尾的了。想要看看我的刺青吗？\n\n<老脏鬼佩蒂脱下了裤子。>"
G["You know why!"]="你知道原因！"
G["You know, $n, it's such an honor to work with you!\n\nWhen you're not busy wrangling, maybe we could $g go out some place for dinner? : get together for a girl's night?;\n\nOh, did I mention that we can now get you to our base in the Skethyl Mountains real quick?  If you want, speak with Skyguard Handler Irena about that."]="Ya sabes, $n, es un gran honor trabajar contigo.\n\nCuando no estés domando, quizá podamos $gsalir a cenar : juntarnos para una noche de chicas;.\n\n¡Oh! ¿He mencionado que ahora podemos llevarte a nuestro campamento en las Montañas Skethyl realmente rápido? Si quieres, hablaré con la cuidadora de la Guardia del cielo Irena acerca de eso."
G["You know, I could just leave you up there!"]="知道么，我其实可以让你自生自灭！"
G["You know, I could run an orc through or slice up a troll.  I could even carve my initials in an ogre's flank, but I just can't stand to skin an animal.  Go figure, eh.  \nWell, if you have the stomach for it, then go see Maris Granger at the Protective Hide in Old Town."]="Podría atravesar a un orco y cortar a un trol en pedazos, ¿sabes? Hasta podría tallar mis iniciales en las costillas de un ogro, pero soy incapaz de desollar a un animal. ¡Imagínate! \n\nBueno, si tú tienes suficiente estómago ve a ver a Maris Granger en La Piel Protectora del Casco Antiguo."
G["You know, I have often thought of making a mechano-pup. We should study these wolves more closely."]="你瞧，我一直想造一条机械狗。我们应该好好研究下这些狼。"
G["You know, I just don't really feel much like working today."]="要知道，今天我并不是很想工作。"
G["You know, I kept hearing the Blackrock orcs talk about the return of Hellscream to the Horde. What's that all about? Isn't Hellscream dead?"]="你知道，我一直听那些黑石兽人说，关于地狱咆哮返回部落的事。那究竟是怎么回事？地狱咆哮不是死了吗？"
G["You know, I really envy these guys!"]="知道吗，我由衷地妒忌这些家伙！"
G["You know, I saw the Wrestler's real face once. True story."]="你知道，我曾经看见过摔跤手的真面目。真的。"
G["You know, I think that yeti appreciates good kafa more than most people. And she has't eaten a single grummle since you brought her down from the peak!"]="你知道吗，我认为雪人比大多数人更崇尚好咔啡。而且自从你把她带下山后，她还没吃过一个土地精！"
G["You know, I think we can hit Honor Hold from here."]="我认为我们可以从这儿攻击荣耀堡。"
G["You know, I'm going to be using this orb to perform a powerful ritual in just a few minutes.  Don't tell anyone this... but I'll be summoning a pit lord.  Redridge will bow to the Blackrock!"]="你知道，几分钟后，我就将用这个宝珠开始一场强大的仪式。别告诉任何人……我要召唤的是一位深渊领主。赤脊山将屈从于黑石部族的力量！"
G["You know, I've always like the color of jade. So green, just like the forest."]="你知道吗，我一直都很喜欢玉石的颜色。如此翠绿，就和那森林一样。"
G["You know, I've always wondered why they call themselves orcs."]="Sabes, siempre me he preguntado por qué se llaman a sí mismos \"orcos\"."
G["You know, I've been stuck in these cages watching the mogu a lot, but I'm pretty sure I've never seen a girl mogu.  What's with that?"]="你知道，我一直被困在这笼子里，看着魔古的一举一动，可我相当肯定，自己从没见过魔古女孩。那是为什么？"
G["You know, I've decided I like having you as a friend. Makes me think that maybe I can have other friends, too."]="你知道的，我决定把你当做朋友了。这让我想到，或许我可以再交一些朋友。"
G["You know, Keeshan lost his wife to Blackrock orcs. He was never the same after that day. Was like the sun just set on his life. Darkness, $g man:lady;. Pure darkness."]="你知道，黑石兽人夺走了基沙恩的妻子。在那件事情发生后他就像变了个人似的。仿佛他生命中的太阳瞬间陨落。只剩下黑暗，$g老兄:女士;。纯粹的黑暗。"
G["You know, big brown guy was lookin' for a trip up north earlier. Some Garrod... err... Ganosh... err... anyway, I didn't get his name."]="你知道吗，那个棕色皮肤的大家伙去北边儿了。那个加鲁德……呃……加诺什……呃，反正他名字我记不住。"
G["You know, getting items must be hard for these guys!"]="我觉得，这些家伙永远别想凑齐套装！"
G["You know, good friends always share their farming secrets. Now tell me, how do you get your vegetables looking like that?"]="知道吗，好朋友常常会分享他们的务农小秘密。现在告诉我吧，你是如何把你的蔬菜种成那样的？"
G["You know, if I was a bit younger, I'd show you how a real man courts a young lady."]="如果我再年轻一点，我就让你见识见识真正的男人是如何向女士献殷勤的。"
G["You know, if you'd just been reasonable about the whole thing, I might have simply sold the key to you. Not that it would have done you any good. Broke off in the lock. Muahahahahahahaha!"]="要知道，如果你在这整件事情上能通情达理一些，我也许就直接把钥匙卖给你了。倒不是说它会给你带来什么好处。但却能打破那把锁。木哈哈哈哈哈！"
G["You know, if you're looking for a place to hide out, you're free to join us in our caravan."]="如果你想找个地方躲起来，那么尽可以到我们的马车上来。"
G["You know, that does smell pretty... Hey! Stop spraying that thing at me!"]="你知道的，那个闻起来十分的…嘿！别拿那个喷我！"
G["You know, that house that Farmer Yoon lives in is a dump! He should talk to Tina. I hear she's real good at redecorating."]="知道吗，农夫老愚住的房子简直就是个垃圾场！他应该跟迪娜谈谈。听说她很擅长重新装修。"
G["You know, the attacks on the Speedbarge are just a business misunderstanding. When you get me rezzed, I'll consider negotiating a contract with Fizzle and Pozzik."]="要知道，对赛艇平台的攻击只是场商业误会。等你把我复活之后，我会考虑与菲兹尔与普兹克洽谈一份合约。"
G["You know, the two of you remind me of him."]="知道吗，你们两个又让我想起他来了。"
G["You know, these little guys aren't so bad once you get to know them..."]="你看，当你了解之后，就会发现这些小家伙也不是那么坏的……"
G["You know, they say these mountains are full of yeti."]="你知道吗，他们说这些山里全是雪人。"
G["You know, they sayin' your name all over camp!"]="你知道吗，营地里的人都在谈论你。"
G["You know, things are really starting to look up ever since you came around!\nCan't help thinking about what happened to my friends back on the farm, though..."]="La cosa ha empezado a mejorar desde que viniste, ¿sabes?\n\nPero no puedo evitar pensar en lo que les sucedió a mis amigos de la granja..."
G["You know, this bridge is kind of large for just the 6 of us to be building. You'd think more people would've been hired."]="你知道，那座桥工程量很大，但只有我们六个人在工作。你应该雇用更多的工人来。"
G["You know, this is really sort of exciting me."]="知道吗，这令我有点兴奋。"
G["You know, this isn't really my scene. I'm glad to help, though."]="这并不是我擅长的领域，不过很高兴能帮忙。"
G["You know, we could easily replace you with goblins. Is that what you want???"]="你知道，我们随时可以用地精替换你。你难道希望这样？"
G["You know, we're not busy right now. We could start building a coffin for you..."]="你瞧，我们眼下还不算太忙。不如帮你做个棺材……"
G["You know, when I was first captured I hated Teddy. He dug into my skin and prevented me from moving around freely. But let me tell you something, doc; after six years with the guy I can honestly say that I have feelings for him."]="你知道吗，当我刚刚被抓住时，我恨透了泰迪。他钻进我的身体，让我不能自由移动。但我现在想告诉你的是——在共度六年之后，我必须承认，他已经成为我身体的一部分。"
G["You know, you can probably just free them. I won't tell anyone."]="知道吗，你可以就这么放了他们。我不会告诉任何人。"
G["You know, you could just head over to Westerly Rest and kill all of those Alliance fools."]="你知道，你只需去西风之息，杀光那里的联盟蠢货。"
G["You know, you could think about doing the work yourself. That way you could get back to the keep more quickly."]="不如你试着独立完成那些工作，这样说不定你还能快点返回要塞呢。"
G["You know, you sure saved my hide with those scallions."]="知道吗，真是多亏了你的那些葱。"
G["You know, you're pretty funny."]="知道吗，你真的很幽默。"
G["You know, you've been a real nice friend to me for a while now. Now that we're neighbors, I'm going to give you some of my chickens. Ain't too much, but they should liven up yer farm a bit. I'll send 'em over."]="Verás, hace tiempo que eres $gun buen amigo:una buena amiga; para mí. Ahora que somos vecinos, quiero regalarte unas cuantas gallinas. No es mucho, pero le darán un poco de alegría a tu granja. Te las enviaré."
G["You know... why DO we celebrate this holiday?"]="你知道……我们为什么要庆祝这个节日吗？"
G["You lack tact, Commander. This is not surprising. However, you are right in that the Horde will be forced to act. But not just the Horde. They already come - heroes from across the world."]="你太死板了，指挥官。这并不令人吃惊。不过，正如你所说的，部落会被迫采取行动的。不仅是部落，全世界的英雄都会聚集在这里。"
G["You lack the necessary discipline."]="你缺乏必要的纪律。"
G["You lads know the drill.  No alcohol to servicemen on duty.  You want the general to kill me himself?"]="你们应该知道军纪吧。执行执勤任务的步兵禁止饮酒。你们是不是想让将军宰了我？"
G["You landlubbers are tougher than I thought! I'll have to improvise!"]="你们这些旱鸭子比我想象的要厉害多了！看来我要认真一些了！"
G["You lead the way. I'll carry the food."]="你来带路。我来搬食物。"
G["You lead, I will follow."]="你打头，我跟着。"
G["You learn quickly, that is not a bad thing. Just be sure to do the job right, as long as it takes to do so. Now, I fear I must send you to Snarl to learn more. Learn what he can teach, but do not listen to his angry words. He gets that way when Saru's daughters laugh at him."]="你学得很快，这是件好事。但要注意按照工作的要求适当地完成工作。现在，我恐怕必须要把你送到斯纳尔那里多学些东西。你要学会所有他能教的，但不要听他的气话。当萨鲁的女儿笑话他时他就变成那样了。"
G["You learn quickly."]="你学得很快。"
G["You leave Stonemaul lands now!"]="滚出石槌食人魔的领地！"
G["You leave den the hard way!"]="是你选择了与我们为敌！"
G["You leave me no alternative.  I will stop you by force if you won't listen to reason!"]="你让我别无选择。如果你不愿意讲道理的话，我就要使用武力了！"
G["You leave your friend to die..."]="他被你送上了绝路……"
G["You leave your material body behind!"]="将你的肉体抛诸脑后吧！"
G["You let us worry about how we kill the monster, Godfrey."]="高弗雷，我们自会对付塞尔赞。"
G["You lie!"]="你撒谎！"
G["You lied to your men and betrayed the mercenaries who fought for you. What's happening to you, Arthas? Is vengeance all that's important to you?"]="你对你的部下说谎，还背叛了为你而战的雇佣兵。你到底怎么了，阿尔萨斯？你就只有复仇这个念头了吗？"
G["You like candy?  I like candy."]="你喜欢糖果吗？我喜欢糖果。"
G["You like it here, don't you Su-Shi?"]="你喜欢待在这儿，对吧苏石？"
G["You like that? Bet not! Bet not cause you dead! Hahah!"]="你喜欢吗？我打赌你不会喜欢的！因为你已经死啦！哈哈哈！"
G["You like the rug? I killed and skinned the beast myself. May all the centaur fall as easily."]="你喜欢这地毯吗？我亲自把动物杀死并剥皮的。但愿所有的半人马能被同样容易的击倒。"
G["You like walking? I like walking."]="你喜欢步行么？我很喜欢。"
G["You like what you see? Of course you do."]="你喜欢眼前这一切吗？你当然喜欢了。"
G["You live on borrowed time. The sea will consume you."]="你们的末日到了。海洋将会吞噬你们。"
G["You live to serve me, Godfrey. Together we will crush the worgen uprising and retake Gilneas for the Forsaken."]="重生的你将效忠于我，高弗雷。我们将一起粉碎狼人的叛乱，为被遗忘者夺回吉尔尼斯。"
G["You locked up the wrong Marshal, $n. Prepare to be destroyed!"]="你关错元帅了，$n。准备受死吧！"
G["You look a bit weak, $r. You'll need to travel more of the land before you're strong enough to help the folks out here."]="你看起来弱了点儿，$r。你得在这片土地上多加游历，才能让自己变得强大起来，帮助这里的住民。"
G["You look a little lost.  Who are you looking for?"]="Pareces algo $gperdido:perdida;. ¿Qué estás buscando?"
G["You look a little pale!"]="你的脸色有点苍白！"
G["You look as if you need some assistance, how can I help you?"]="你似乎需要帮助，我能帮你些什么忙吗？"
G["You look as one who has seen much fighting. But tell me, was it in service to yourself, or others?"]="你看上去似乎身经百战。告诉我，你是为自己而战，还是为别人？"
G["You look as though you have endured much. Please, let me know if there's anything you'd like to purchase to aid you in your travels."]="你看起来似乎饱经风霜。要是你想买什么旅途用品，一定要告诉我。"
G["You look delicious..."]="你看起来十分可口……"
G["You look exhausted. Is something wrong?"]="Pareces $gagotado:agotada;. ¿Algo va mal?"
G["You look familiar..."]="你看上去很眼熟……"
G["You look for Josef Gregorian.  He in Magic Quarter on inner ring side of green canal."]="你寻找乔瑟夫·格里高利。他在绿色运河的内环边上的魔法区里。"
G["You look for Martha Alliestar.  She on inner ring of The Apothecarium."]="你寻找的是马尔萨·奥列斯塔。她在炼金房的内环上。"
G["You look green. Are you sick?"]="Tienes la piel verde. ¿Estás $genfermo:enferma;?"
G["You look in The Apothecarium.  That where Doctor Herbert Halsey and Doctor Marsh practice."]="你可以去炼金房看看。那是赫伯特·哈尔希医生和马尔什医生练习的地方。"
G["You look intent. Is there something I can help with?"]="你看上去很不安。有什么需要我帮忙的吗？"
G["You look like a reasonable $r.  Perhaps we could be of mutual assistance."]="Pareces $gun:una; $r razonable. Quizás podamos ayudarnos mutuamente."
G["You look like an intelligent person. Why don't you read one of these leaflets and give it some thought?"]="你看起来是个非常明智的人。为什么不来读一读这份传单并谈谈你的想法呢？"
G["You look like just the Warlock I need! The evil goblin chieftain Snarl must be defeated."]="¡Pareces el tipo de brujo que necesito! Debemos derrotar al malvado jefe goblin Gruños."
G["You look like someone that might be interested in some rare pets?"]="你看起来像是对稀有宠物感兴趣的人吧？"
G["You look like the type I should watch my coin purse around. Something I can help you with?"]="你看起来像是那种手脚不干净的家伙。有什么我可以帮忙的吗？"
G["You look like you could make us some money.\n\nHow about a spin inside the Arena of Annihilation, pal?"]="你似乎能帮我们赚点钱。\n\n来破军比武场转转怎么样，伙计？"
G["You look like you could make us some money. How about a spin inside the Amphitheater of Anguish, pal?"]="你似乎能帮我赚点钱。来痛苦斗兽场转转怎么样，伙计？"
G["You look like you could make us some money. How about a spin inside the Crucible of Carnage, pal?"]="看上去，你能为我们挣不少钱。去杀戮熔炉里转一圈如何，朋友？"
G["You look like you could use a cold one.  Thunderbrew's got ya covered!"]="你似乎需要一杯冰镇啤酒，雷霆啤酒是你最好的选择！"
G["You look like you could use a drink."]="你看来需要喝一杯。"
G["You look like you could use a hot meal.\n\nWhat can I get for you?"]="你看上去需要一顿热饭热菜。\n\n要我给你弄点什么？"
G["You look like you could use some work, $g fella:lady;. You should board the tram and visit my brother, Monty, at the Ironforge Deeprun Tram depot. I'm sure he has something you could do."]="你看起来能用一些机件，$g小伙子:女士;。你应该上地铁去拜访我的兄弟蒙提，他在铁炉堡矿道地铁库房。我肯定他有些事情是你能做的。"
G["You look like you may know your way around a beast that runs on land, but if you want to soar, it'll take training and dedication. And gold. You have gold, right?"]="你似乎懂得如何驾驭野兽在地面行走，但是如果你想要在天空翱翔的话，就需要经过刻苦的训练，当然还需要金币。你身上有金币的，对吧？"
G["You look like you might be needing passage across the Great Sea. Well you have come to the right place, this here is the berth of the Maiden's Fancy, finest passenger ship to travel these waters. When she arrives, just climb aboard and the next thing you know you will find yourself basking on the sandy beaches of Stranglethorn."]="看来你需要通过无尽之海的通道。那你算来对地方了，这儿就是少女之爱号的停泊处，她是这片水域上最好的客船。当船到达后，你就登上甲板，然后用不了多久你就可以躺在荆棘谷的沙滩上晒太阳了。"
G["You look like you want a piece of me..."]="看上去，你想要从我这里得到些什么……"
G["You look like you're lost."]="Pareces $gperdido:perdida;."
G["You look like you've got quite the arm there. Care to give this game a try?"]="你看起来很有一手。想来试试这个游戏吗？"
G["You look like you've had your heart broken. Come back when you're not so sad."]="你看起来好像伤心欲绝。等你心情好一点之后再回来吧。"
G["You look lost, $c. Don't make me put you to work on the walls with the other peons."]="$c，你似乎很迷茫。不要逼我让你跟那些苦工一起干活。"
G["You look lost.  I can help."]="Pareces $gperdido:perdida;. Yo puedo ayudarte."
G["You look nothing like him."]="你看起来不太像他。"
G["You look really scary! Good thing my brother said you are friendly."]="你看起来真吓人！幸好我哥哥说你很友好。"
G["You look remarkably well, $n. I'm exhausted. A healer's work is never done."]="你看上去好得很，$n。我已经筋疲力尽了。治疗者总有干不完的活儿。"
G["You look safe enough... let's do this."]="看来不会有什么危险……来吧。"
G["You look tired...."]="你很疲倦了……"
G["You look weary, traveler. Come share our warm fire and good brew."]="Parece que el cansancio te invade, $gviajero:viajera;. Comparte nuestra cerveza al calor de un buen fuego."
G["You look... different."]="你看起来……与众不同。"
G["You looked the other way. You and your insubordinate kind are no longer welcome here."]="你都不敢看我。我的城市不再欢迎你和你那些不服管束的同党。"
G["You lookin' at me?"]="你在看我吗？"
G["You lookin' for me?"]="你在找我？"
G["You lookin' for somethin' a little more... exotic?"]="你在找更有……异域风情的东西吗？"
G["You lookin' for trainin'? No can do. I ain't your gal."]="你要接受训练？我可帮不了你。我可不是你要找的人。"
G["You lookin' for trainin'? No can do. I ain't your guy."]="你要接受训练？我可帮不了你。我可不是你要找的人。"
G["You lookin' ta go to Dalaran? Heard the Lady Jaina Proudmoore herself's expectin' ye! Go on through the mage portal down the path."]="你想要去达拉然？我听说吉安娜·普罗德摩尔正想见你！这条路直走，穿过那个法师传送门吧。"
G["You lookin' to get on my good side, eh $r? Well good for you!"]="你想得到我的青睐，不是吗，$r？嗯，对你来说有好处！"
G["You lookin' to train up, bruiser?"]="你要接受训练，大个子？"
G["You looking at me, $gladdy:lassy;?"]="你在看我吗，$g小伙子:姑娘;？"
G["You looking for plucky?  Well, you didn't hear me say this, but... maybe if you ask Kronkrider up in the tower, he'll tell you..."]="你在寻找约翰森？哦，我不该说太多，不过……或许你该问问塔顶的科鲁克莱德，他会告诉你……"
G["You looking for something, $r? You look like you're looking for something."]="你在找东西吗，$r？你看起来在找东西。"
G["You lose!"]="你完了！"
G["You lose! Lose so bad!"]="你输了！输得真难看呀！"
G["You lose."]="你败了。"
G["You lost?"]="你迷路了？"
G["You lure them out, slave thing. I stay here and watch. Good show."]="你去将他们引出来。我待在这里监视情况。去吧，好戏即将上演。"
G["You lying wretch, Arthas! You doomed us all!"]="阿尔萨斯！你这个骗子！我们都被你给害了！"
G["You made it $g lad:lass;! I thought you were a goner for sure!"]="¡Lo lograste, $g chico:chica;! ¡Pensé que estabas en las últimas!"
G["You made it this far, grunt. There is no turning back now."]="事情到了这一步，我们已经不能回头了。"
G["You made it through! Come, we must speak."]="你做到了！过来，我们得谈谈。"
G["You made it!  Good!"]="你成功了！很好！"
G["You made it! Creed's dark magic is disrupting my vision - you're on your own from here. Good luck!"]="你成功了！信条的黑暗魔法干扰了我的视线——从现在起，你就得靠自己了。祝你好运！"
G["You made it! Excellent. Now we can begin."]="你成功了！太好了。现在我们可以开始了。"
G["You made it! Outstanding! Marshal Windsor has been expecting you. Would you like me to signal him now?"]="你做到了！太了不起了！温德索尔元帅一直都盼着你呢。你要我现在就通知他吗？"
G["You made it! Well done, $r. Now if you'll excuse me, I have to get the rest of our crew inside."]="你成功了！干得好，$R。失陪一下，我得进去瞧瞧别的伙计们。"
G["You made it?! I'm surprised Kinelory didn't slow you down anymore than that. Kin, here's your socks. Give me what you found ins"]="你们成功了？！我很惊讶基恩洛并没有让你慢下来。那么，给我看看你们找到的东西。"
G["You made me do it!"]="是你逼我的！"
G["You made the right choice. We all owe you a great deal, $n. Try not to get yourself killed out here."]="你做出了正确的选择。我们全都深深地感谢你，$n。但不要让自己的生命遭受危险。"
G["You maggots brought this on yourselves."]="这个还是你们这些蛆虫自己留着享受吧。"
G["You make a very tenacious corpse."]="你会成为一具顽强的尸体。"
G["You make dat sound pretty good. Sound like da orc dieded."]="你这个声音真好听。像兽人临死前的惨叫。"
G["You make face soaky."]="你看起来可真酷。"
G["You make me proud, brother wolf."]="兄弟，我为你自豪。"
G["You make my children orphans on this day, fiend!"]="恶魔，你让我的孩子沦为孤儿！"
G["You make perfect little hat, $r!"]="拿你做个新帽子肯定不错，$r！"
G["You make this look easy."]="有你在，太简单了。"
G["You makin me 'ookin ANGRY!"]="你们惹火我啦！"
G["You may ask yourself, \"What is next?\" I have the answer. To learn more of our art, you must travel across the sea to an awe-inspiring place known as Ironforge. The forge there is one of the largest in the land! Bengus Deepforge, found in the Great Forge, can instruct you further."]="\"Puedes preguntarte \"\" ¿Y ahora qué?\". Yo tengo la respuesta. Para aprender más sobre nuestro arte, debes atravesar el mar hasta un lugar sobrecogedor llamado Forjaz. ¡Su forja es una de las mayores del mundo! Bengus Forjahonda, en La Gran Fundición puede continuar con tu instrucción.\""
G["You may attempt to kill me - and fail - or you may take option two."]="你可以试着杀死我——然后失败——或者你也可以接受另一个选择。"
G["You may be this world's greatest shaman, Thrall - but you are only mortal. This is my master's curse upon you - turning your great bond with the elements... into your undoing!"]="你也许是这个世界上最强大的萨满，萨尔——但你仍然是个凡人。主人的诅咒将降临于你——你与元素的伟大盟约将变成你的……毁灭！"
G["You may begin your ritual, we will defend you."]="你们可以开始仪式了，我们会保护你们的。"
G["You may begin!"]="可以开始了！"
G["You may choose to care for an Oracle orphan or a Wolvar orphan, but you will not be able to help both."]="你可以选择照料一个神谕者孤儿或者一个狼獾人孤儿，但你不能二者兼顾。"
G["You may continue your combat, overthane."]="你可以继续战斗了，领主。"
G["You may continue your ritual, we will defend you."]="你们可以继续仪式了，我们会保护你们的。"
G["You may empty all of your current Glyph slots for a price, so that you may select new ones.\nThis will become more expensive each additonal time you do so."]="Puedes vaciar todas las ranuras de glifos y seleccionar unos nuevos a cambio de un módico precio.\n\nCada vez que repitas esta operación, será más caro."
G["You may enter this hill alive, but I guarantee you won't leave alive."]="你也许能活着走进这座山，但我保证你没办法活着出来。"
G["You may find Shattrath's guild master - as well as guild and tabard vendors - within the Terrace of Light's central structure, in the middle of the city."]="你能在城市正中，圣光广场中心的建筑物里找到沙塔斯的公会管理员——以及公会和战袍商人。"
G["You may find storage for your worldly goods at the bank of Darnassus, which lies in the center of our wondrous city."]="你可以在达纳苏斯银行找到你存放财物的地方，它就在我们神奇的城市中央。"
G["You may find that other paths are faster."]="你也许会发现其它捷径。"
G["You may fish here, but please keep it short. I like my privacy."]="你可以在这钓鱼，但别耽搁太久。我不喜欢被打扰。"
G["You may flee the battle if you so wish."]="要是你这么想逃跑，那就请便。"
G["You may give these soldiers quarter at your discretion, but we are not choosing sides."]="如何处置这些士兵是你的事情，我们不会选择立场。"
G["You may go to him... at your peril."]="你可以去找他……但后果自负。"
G["You may have come this far. You may have carved a path through my army, but I... will kill you, and I will build the bridge."]="尽管你们从我的大军中杀出一条血路，来到了这里，但是……我会杀了你们，我会把桥造起来。"
G["You may have defeated my champions, $c. I am something else entirely."]="你或许可以打败我的勇士们，$c。但我和他们是完全不同的。"
G["You may have defeated my war machine, but the gate still stands. You will not take Orgrimmar today."]="就算你们打败了它，可城门依然耸立。你们休想攻占奥格瑞玛。"
G["You may have had friends and kin who chose to cast their lot with the enemies of the Horde. They are no longer your friends... no longer your family."]="你们的一些朋友和亲人可能也已经选择与部落的敌人为伍。从此他们将不再是朋友……不再是家人。"
G["You may have killed Valduran, but that will not stop me from completing the colossus."]="哪怕你杀死了瓦杜兰，也无法阻止我铸造巨人。"
G["You may have noticed the hozen and jinyu among us. All are welcome here at the monastery, as long as they have the desire to learn."]="你或许已经注意到，我们之中既有猢狲，也有锦鱼人。无论是谁，只要他渴望求知，禅院都会欢迎的。"
G["You may have once fought beside me, Crok, but now you are nothing more than a traitor. Come, your second death approaches!"]="你也许曾和我并肩作战，科罗克，但现在你只不过是一个叛徒。接受你的第二次死亡吧！"
G["You may have saved Azuregos, $r, but your life ends here."]="你也许拯救了艾索雷葛斯，$r，但你的生命也将在这里结束。"
G["You may have slain Jeklik, but you will not leave Zul'Gurub alive."]="你也许杀死了耶克里克，可你别想活着离开祖尔格拉布。"
G["You may have stopped the storm, but you cannot stop the will of Zandalar! You will DIE, here... ALL OF YOU!"]="就算你们阻止了风暴，也休想阻止赞达拉的意志！你们死定了……一个也跑不了！"
G["You may have succeeded in stopping us this time, but we shall return-- this we assure you!"]="虽然你们这次成功地阻止了我们，但我们还会回来的——走着瞧吧！"
G["You may have summoned me, my little warlock, but that does not give you leave to rename me like some child's pet."]="可能是你召唤了我，小术士，但是这并不代表你可以像对待宠物那样给我起名字。"
G["You may have survived for our amusement, but now, you shall die at our hands!"]="本来嘛，我们还打算让你多活些时日的。不过我们决定现在就结束你的性命！"
G["You may have what it takes. Let's find out!"]="你可能拥有它所需的。让我们查明真相!"
G["You may kill me, but I'll never tell you what you want!"]="你可以杀了我，但是我绝对不会告诉你！"
G["You may leave me here -- I wish to be alone in my final moments."]="你可以走了……我希望在我生命的最后一刻独自待着。"
G["You may leave now, friend.  The tauren's friend Erunak should be waiting outside with seahorses.  In fact, it looks like he is here now."]="你现在可以走了，朋友。牛头人的挚友埃鲁纳克应该正和海马一起等在外面。事实上，就像他现在就在这儿。"
G["You may make purchases from me by using Halaa tokens of battle and research."]="你可以使用哈兰作战勋章和哈兰研究勋章从我这里购买东西。"
G["You may not pass.  You are not our kin, nor have you issued the challenge."]="你不能通过。你不是我们的人，也没有发出过挑战。"
G["You may only choose one quest."]="你只能选择一个任务。"
G["You may only fly in Icecrown, Sholazar Basin and the Storm Peaks."]="你只能在冰冠冰川、索拉查盆地和风暴峭壁的上空飞行。"
G["You may only fly in Icemist Village."]="你只能在冰雾村上空飞翔。"
G["You may only fly in the Argent Vanguard, Valley of Echoes and Scourgeholme."]="你只能在银色前线基地、回音谷和天灾城飞翔。"
G["You may only ride the Overloaded Harvest Golem at the Molsen Farm."]="你只能在摩尔森农场使用过载的麦田傀儡。"
G["You may rest here, and there is food and water."]="你可以在此休息，这里还有食物和饮料可供享用。"
G["You may rest here, if you like. The Temple of Earth is under our care, now."]="如果你愿意，可以在这里休息。现在大地神殿由我们管理。"
G["You may seek him... with my blessing."]="带着我的祝福……去找他吧。"
G["You may seek out Martin Lindsey inside the Pools of Vision, underneath the Spirit Rise.  He will assist you on your way to Arathi Basin."]="去灵魂高地下面的预见之池找马丁·林塞。他会帮助你前往阿拉希盆地。"
G["You may serve me yet."]="你或许也可以为我效劳。"
G["You may shed yourself of your worldly possessions at the Thunder Bluff Bank on the lower rise."]="你可以到中部高地的底层的雷霆崖银行存放你的财物。"
G["You may speak frankly, Neeru..."]="你明说吧，尼尔鲁……"
G["You may stay in our village as long as you need, stranger. Just... please try to keep your weapons sheathed."]="Puedes quedarte en nuestra aldea todo el tiempo que necesites, $gforastero:forastera;, pero... intenta no desenvainar tus armas."
G["You may stay only until Taylor is well. But then, you must leave."]="你们可以留下，直到泰勒痊愈。但那以后，你们必须离开。"
G["You may stay while you are still useful, outsider."]="Mientras seas útil, puedes quedarte, $gforastero:forastera;."
G["You may succeed on the field of battle briefly... but you cannot hope to win against my Scourge!"]="或许你们现在可以一时得势……但你们永远无法击败天灾军团！"
G["You may take my life, but you won't take my freedom!"]="你能夺走我的性命，却无法束缚我的灵魂！"
G["You may think you have won, worms, but against the might of the Lich King there is no victory for the living! You have not seen the last of me!"]="你们或许以为自己获得了胜利，但是面对巫妖王，你们的抗争是毫无意义的！你们还没有见识到我真正的力量！"
G["You may unlearn all of your current Talents for a price, so that you may select new ones.\nThis will become more expensive each additonal time you do so."]="Puedes olvidar tus talentos y seleccionar unos nuevos por un módico precio.\n\nCada vez que repitas esta operación, será más caro."
G["You may unlearn your current Class Specialization for a price, so that you may select a new one.\nThis will become more expensive each additonal time you do so."]="Puedes olvidar tu especialización de clase y seleccionar una nueva por un módico precio.\n\nCada vez que repitas esta operación, será más caro."
G["You may walk through the streets of Orgrimmar with pride!"]="你可以昂首挺胸地走在奥格瑞玛的街道上！"
G["You may want to consider leaving this place. I think being transformed into a frog is one of the better things that can happen to one here."]="你或许想离开这儿。我倒觉得在这种鬼地方被变成青蛙算是幸运的了。"
G["You may want to rethink your actions, fool."]="你们应该在动手之前就考虑到后果，蠢货。"
G["You may want to take cover."]="你们最好找掩护。"
G["You may wish to put some more signal powder on the brazier next time. I'm not sure they could see that from Orgrimmar...."]="下一次，你也许要在火盆里放上更多的信号火药。我不知道他们从奥格瑞玛能不能看见这里的信号……"
G["You may yet regret your presence here."]="你们也许会后悔来到这里。"
G["You mean it? Oh, I cannae WAIT to see the look on Brann's face when he finds out I got an excavation green-lit by the King himself! You'll have your quarry by next sundown!"]="真的？！噢，我得到了国王陛下批准！真想看看布莱恩知道后的表情！我保证在下次日落前搞定采石场！"
G["You mean other than Lazy Dan over there? Sure!\n\nI spent some time with Evie before she went hunting up north. Such a sweet girl.\n\nAnd of course, who could forget Mama Stormstout?"]="你是指除了在那边的懒汉大丹以外的其他人吗？当然！\n\n在艾薇去北方捕猎，我和她共处了一段时间。真是个乖巧可人的姑娘。\n\n当然，谁又能忘掉风暴烈酒大妈呢？"
G["You mean the iceberg?"]="你是说冰山吗？"
G["You mean to say - physical strength is developed without, but fortitude comes from within?"]="你是想说——力量是外在的表现，而坚忍来自于内心？"
G["You mean to say there is a warlock? Here, in goodly Theramore?!\nOh, my. Someone must inform Lady Proudmoore immediately!\n...heh."]="¿Quieres decir que hay un brujo? ¡¿Aquí, en la bendita Theramore?!\n\nAy, madre. ¡Alguien debe informar a Lady Valiente de inmediato!\n\n... Jejeje."
G["You mean to tell me you sell frogs?"]="你想要出售青蛙？"
G["You mean you can't smell the smoke of the Dwarven forges from here?  Well, you will be looking for Therum Deepforge if you want to learn blacksmithing.  He's over in the Dwarven District which is just north of the Cathedral Square."]="你说你不能在这儿闻到矮人煅炉的烟味？哦，如果你想学习锻造的话就该找瑟鲁姆·深炉。他就在大教堂广场北边的矮人区。"
G["You mean, I can do it here, too?"]="你的意思是，我也能在这里做吗？"
G["You mean, you don't know? The sword that you carry on your back - it is known as Ashbringer; named after its original owner."]="你是说，你完全不知道？你背上的那把剑，名叫灰烬使者，这个名字是从它原来的主人那里继承而来的。"
G["You mean..."]="你是说……"
G["You meddle in affairs beyond your comprehension."]="你在掺和自己完全不了解的事情。"
G["You mentioned two results when the Earthen destabilize.  What is the second?"]="你提到当土灵不稳定的时候出现了两个变种。那第二个是什么？"
G["You merely destroy an image, fool. I shall hunt you until the end of days."]="你只不过消灭了一副幻象，蠢蛋。我会追踪你到天涯海角的。"
G["You merely prolong the inevitable. Succumb. She will free your misguided soul."]="你只是在拖延时间，结果是不可避免的。投降吧。她会释放你误入歧途的灵魂的。"
G["You mess with Silas, you mess with me.  Have a nice day."]="你打扰希拉斯，又打扰我。祝你开心。"
G["You messed with the wrong goblin."]="你不该招惹地精的。"
G["You messed with the wrong soldier!"]="想打架，你可找错人了！"
G["You might be able to take me, but the Defias WILL take back Stormwind!"]="你也许可以杀了我，但迪菲亚兄弟会必定夺回暴风城！"
G["You might be right, sister.  My obligations to my land and King have been fulfilled.  But there is something that I still owe to myself."]="也许你是对的，莉蕾萨。我早已经不再亏欠我的祖国和国王任何东西，可是……我还欠自己一个交代。"
G["You might be the best set of recruits I've ever seen!  Let's go through all of that again!"]="你们是我见过的最优秀的新兵！我们很快就会再次开始演习了。"
G["You might have found me, but you won't bring word back to the others!"]="就算你发现了我，你也别想把消息带给别人！"
G["You might have gone feral, but Gilnean blood still pumps through your veins.  Defend our homelands agains the Horde!"]="你们也许沾染了野性，但吉尔尼斯的血仍然流动在你们的体内。对抗部落，保卫我们的家园！"
G["You might have gotten past the weaklings. You aren't gonna get past me."]="你或许能闯过那些懦夫的拦截。但你休想闯过我这关。"
G["You might need this shield."]="你或许需要这面盾牌。"
G["You might not have that long.  Enemy reinforcements are already underway."]="你也许没那么多时间。敌人的援军正在赶来。"
G["You might not think that a Worgen like myself would know how to cook a fine steak.\n\nJust 'cuz I like my meat raw... Still panting from flight... Arterial spray in my face...\n\nWhat were we talking about? Oh yes! I was quite the gourmet back in Gilneas."]="你也许不会相信，像我这样的狼人竟然能做出美味的肉排。\n\n就因为我喜欢吃生肉……我还没有从飞行的疲惫中恢复过来……我脑袋上的血管还在一蹦一蹦的……\n\n我们在说什么？哦，是了！我在吉尔尼斯可是一位著名的美食家。"
G["You might wanna keep your distance, $c. We on pretty strict Kor'kron lockdown around here. No knowin' what might happen."]="你最好保持距离，$c。最近库卡隆的戒严非常严格。谁都不知道究竟发生了什么事。"
G["You might wanna stand back. Fish guttin' is a dirty job."]="你最好站远点。剖鱼是件肮脏的活。"
G["You minnows finish early and you can go for a nice swim. How's that sound?"]="你们这些小鱼快点干完，然后就能去畅游一番了。听起来不错吧？"
G["You miserable fools never did manage to select a decent bat wing."]="你们这些傻瓜永远找不到一只像样的蝙蝠翅膀。"
G["You missed some."]="你漏掉了一些。"
G["You mistake this for weakness?  Fool!"]="你以为就这么简单？愚蠢！"
G["You mistake your greatest strength for weakness. Do you see this?"]="你把自己最大的优势当成了劣势。你明白吗？"
G["You mooks be on the lookout for any looters. Treat them with extreme prejudice!"]="你们这些笨蛋要注意外面的强盗，对付他们的时候绝对不要手软！"
G["You mortals may remember Alysra, who spirited me to freedom in Mount Hyjal. She, too has been reborn. Born of flame!"]="凡人们，你们也许还记得奥利瑟拉，在海加尔山释放过我的绿龙。她也在烈焰中……得到了重生！"
G["You motherless knaves! Your corpses will make fine morsels for my new drake!"]="你这只无能的蠢龙！你的尸体干脆给我的新飞龙拿去当点心算了！"
G["You move like a pregnant yak. You are not ready to be trained here."]="你走起路来的步履犹如一头怀孕的牦牛。你还没有达到能在这里训练的要求。"
G["You move too slowly, how does your kind catch any prey?"]="你们的速度太慢了，这副德性还怎么捕猎？"
G["You move with grace, rogue. How may I help you?"]="Te mueves con agilidad, $gpícaro:pícara;. ¿Cómo puedo ayudarte?"
G["You movements are light, free, flowing ... you would be killed in an instant. Get out of the ring!"]="你的行动轻率、随意、松散……你在瞬间就会被干掉。滚出去！"
G["You mussst forgive me... I have no time to ssstay and play."]="请原谅……我没时间陪你们找乐子了。"
G["You must answer to the elements, demon!"]="尝尝元素之灵的厉害，恶魔！"
G["You must be $n.\n\nI've been expecting you."]="你一定是$n。\n\n我一直在等你。"
G["You must be exalted with the blood elves before I will teach you a riding skill, $c."]="Es necesario que los elfos de sangre te consideren $gun exaltado:una exaltada; para que pueda enseñarte una habilidad de equitación, $c."
G["You must be friendly with the blood elves before I will teach you a riding skill, $c."]="Es necesario que los elfos de sangre te consideren $gamistoso:amistosa; para que pueda enseñarte una habilidad de equitación, $c."
G["You must be hard up to be wandering these Badlands, $c.  Hard up like me.\n\nOr maybe you're here because you're crazy.  Crazy, like me."]="Debes de estar muy mal para vagar por estas Tierras Inhóspitas, $c. Tan mal como yo.\n\nO quizás estás aquí porque estás $gloco:loca;. Tan $gloco:loca; como yo."
G["You must be looking for Palehoof, who keeps our elevators and windmills in good working order. Find him upon the lower rise."]="你一定是在寻找苍蹄，他把升降梯和风车维护得井井有条。你可以在中部高地下层找到他。"
G["You must be looking for Smith Argus.  He's usually overseeing the forge in Goldshire if you need some training."]="你一定是在寻找铁匠阿古斯。如果你需要接受训练的话，他通常在闪金镇监督铸造工作。"
G["You must be my secret admirer! Well, not so secret anymore. Thanks!"]="¡Tú debes de ser mi $gadmirador secreto:admiradora secreta;! Bueno, ya no tan $gsecreto:secreta;... ¡Gracias!"
G["You must be one of the brave soldiers who have been fighting the Scourge forces of Mal'Ganis. Well done."]="勇敢的士兵，你从未放弃过对抗玛尔加尼斯统帅的天灾军团。继续努力吧。"
G["You must be one of those folk from that sky-ship that crashed. I have MANY questions for you, but this is a terrible place to chat."]="你肯定是从那艘坠毁的飞船上下来的。我有很多问题要问你，但这不是聊天的地方。"
G["You must be powerful, to have come this far. Yes, yes... you will make worthy test subjects."]="你们一定非常强大，才能走这么远。是的……你们会成为合格的试验品。"
G["You must be purged from this land."]="你们必须滚出这片土地。"
G["You must be quite the cook, $n. This looks very nice."]="你一定是个厨艺不错的人，$n。这看起来非常漂亮。"
G["You must be riding a tournament mount before I can instruct you.\n\nEquip a lance and find a tournament mount outside your faction's pavilion."]="你必须骑上锦标赛坐骑，我才能教你如何骑乘作战。\n\n拿上一支长枪，然后从你所在阵营的兽栏中挑选一匹坐骑吧。"
G["You must be seeking Zen Master Lao! He is working at the Setting Sun Garrison in the Vale of Eternal Blossoms.\n\nI will mark his location on your map."]="你一定是在找禅宗铁匠劳敖！他在锦绣谷的残阳关卫戍营里工作。\n\n我会在你的地图上标出他的位置。"
G["You must be the $r that freed Bold Karasshi and our other brothers! We owe you our thanks."]="¡Tú debes ser $gel:la; $r que liberó a Karasshi el Audaz y a nuestros hermanos! Te debemos nuestro agradecimiento."
G["You must be the hero that everyone is talking about. Thank you."]="Tú debes de ser $gel héroe del:la heroína de la; que habla todo el mundo. Gracias."
G["You must be the laziest messenger known to draenei."]="你肯定是德莱尼人中最懒的信使了！"
G["You must be the one who helped our brothers. Thank you."]="Tú debes ser $gel:la; que ayudó a nuestros hermanos. Gracias."
G["You must be the outsider that everyone speaks of."]="Tú debes de ser $gel forastero del:la forastera de la; que todo el mundo habla."
G["You must be the sorriest bunch of recruits I've seen today!  Fall in formations and report to High Executor Anselm!"]="你们是我今天见到的最差劲的一批新兵！列队，向高级执行官安希尔姆报到！"
G["You must be the talented hunter that Wulf mentioned, the hunter who has managed to attract King Wrynn's attention."]="Debes de ser $gese cazador:esa cazadora; con tanto talento que mencionó Wulf; $gese:esa; que ha llamado la atención del rey Wrynn."
G["You must be the trainer I've heard about. Tell me, do you fear defeat?"]="Debes de ser $gese entrenador del:esa entrenadora de la; que tanto he oído hablar. Dime, ¿temes la derrota?"
G["You must choose a more experienced teacher, for you have surpassed my abilities. I advise you to speak with Lilyssia Nightbreeze here: she has much knowledge to offer."]="你必须找一个更有经验的老师，因为你已经超越了我的能力了。我建议你找这里的莉琳希亚·夜风谈谈：她有更多知识可以传授给你。"
G["You must continue! Their resolve is weakening. Drink from my power and be renewed once again!"]="你必须继续！他们的决心正在减弱。从我的身体中汲取力量并再次获得重生！"
G["You must decide, young Lu. What is worth fighting for?"]="你必须明白，小卢。什么才值得我们为之而战？"
G["You must defeat Prince Sandoval. It is your only hope for survival, $c."]="你必须打败萨杜瓦尔王子。这是你活下来的唯一希望，$c。"
G["You must defeat our rivals in any of the Battlegrounds. With every victory, there is a chance that a Gold Medallion will be mailed to you."]="你必须进入任意战场并击败敌人。获胜之后，你就有可能收到我们邮寄给你的金色勋章。"
G["You must defeat your rivals in any of the Battlegrounds. With every victory, there is a chance that a Gold Medallion will be mailed to you."]="你必须进入任意战场并击败敌人。获胜之后，你就有可能收到我们邮寄给你的金色勋章。"
G["You must destroy it. Here, now, before any harm can come to Pandaria."]="就在此地，就趁现在，必须在它危害潘达利亚之前摧毁它。"
G["You must destroy the source of the corruption! Quickly, before our cherished history is erased forever!"]="你必须消灭腐化的源头！快，否则宝贵的历史就要被永久抹除了！"
G["You must destroy these outsiders, empress! They have come to conquer your people!"]="你必须消灭这些外来者，女皇！他们来征服你的子民了！"
G["You must die! But wait: this does not-- No, no... you must die!"]="你去死吧！等等，这不……不，不……你去死吧!"
G["You must do what I could not: Save the peasants that were cut down while fleeing from Stratholme.\n\nThey will walk towards the light, you must ensure their survival. Should too many fall, our cursed existence shall continue - you will have failed.\n\nEvery ability, prayer, and spell that you have learned will be tested. May the Light protect you, $n."]="Debes hacer lo que yo no pude: salvar a los campesinos que fueron asesinados cuando huían de Stratholme.\n\nIrán hacia la Luz, debes asegurarte de que sobrevivan. Si caen demasiados, nuestra existencia maldita continuará... Habrás fallado.\n\nTodas las habilidades, oraciones y hechizos que hayas aprendido se pondrán a prueba. Que la Luz te proteja, $n."
G["You must do what you think is right, Marcus. We served together under Turalyon. He made us both the men that we are today. Did he err with me? Do you truly believe my intent is to cause harm to our alliance? Would I shame our heroes?"]="你一定要做你认为是正确的事情，马库斯。我们一起在图拉扬将军麾下服役。他使我们两个成为了今天的样子。他看错我了么？你真的相信我的目的是要破坏我们的联盟吗？我让我们的英雄们蒙羞了吗？"
G["You must drop everything that you're doing to help me free my father, our leader the Stonefather."]="你必须放下手头所有事情，全力帮我救出我的父亲——土灵之王。"
G["You must feel it already then... the demonic energy entering your heart, your lungs, your soul..."]="那你一定已经感受到了……恶魔的能量侵入你的心肺，席卷你的灵魂……"
G["You must fight now, $n!"]="你现在必须战斗，$n！"
G["You must find Thrall and put a stop to Hellscream's reign."]="你必须找到萨尔，并推翻加鲁什的统治。"
G["You must find a way to show that you both are fighting for the same side. Although the Timbermaw may attack you now, if you are diligent, you will find a way.\n\nYou must remember that any attacks on the Timbermaw furbolg directly will greatly hinder your chances of gaining them as an ally.\n\nA good place to start would be the Deadwood furbolg found in many parts of Felwood. These furbolg are the enemy of the Timbermaw tribe, and slaying them would greatly improve your standing with the Timbermaw."]="Debes encontrar un modo de demostrar que tu lucha está de su lado. Aunque los Fauces de Madera te ataquen, si eres diligente encontrarás el modo de hacerlo.\n\nDebes recordar que cualquier ataque directo a los Fauces de Madera reducirá notablemente tus oportunidades de que lleguen a considerarte como $gun aliado:una aliada;.\n\nUn buen punto de partida serían los Muertobosque, que habitan muchos puntos de Frondavil. Esos fúrbolgs son los enemigos de la tribu Fauces de Madera y aniquilarlos mejoraría considerablemente tu reputación con los Fauces de Madera."
G["You must find one amongst the wretch in the lower portion of this citadel that has attained an Unadorned Seal of Ascension. It is a great honor for one of the lesser beings to obtain this item, as it is the first step in gaining access to the upper citadel and becoming one of Nefarian's elite guardsmen - the Blackhand legion. Find such an item and return it to me so that I may examine its properties. I will know how to proceed once my inspection of the seal is complete."]="你必须在这座要塞下层部分的那些邪恶生物里找到一个拥有原始晋升印章的家伙。对于那些劣等生物来说，得到这枚物品是一个至高无上的荣誉，这是迈入堡垒上层，进入奈法利安的精英军团——黑手军团的第一步。找到这么一件东西，把它交给我，让我来检查一下它，然后我就会知道下一步该怎么做了。"
G["You must flee at once, if you value your life."]="如果你珍惜生命，就马上离开。"
G["You must fly through all 10 checkpoints before you can finish the race."]="你必须飞过所有10个检查点，才能结束比赛。"
G["You must fly up to Stonehearth, aid my people against the stone troggs, and free my father.\n\nI will meet you there shortly after speaking with the Earthcaller.\n\nDon't let him die, $n, or I will put you in the ground myself!"]="Debes volar al Hogar Pétreo para ayudar a mi gente contra los troggs de piedra y liberar a mi padre.\n\nMe reuniré contigo justo después de hablar con la clamatierras.\n\n¡No dejes que muera, $n, o yo mismo cavaré una tumba para ti!"
G["You must focus on your training!  Try again!"]="你必须把精神集中在训练上！再试一次！"
G["You must focus."]="你必须集中精神。"
G["You must forget your weapon type specialty before i can help you.   Go to Everlook in Winterspring and seek help there!"]="你必须首先遗忘你所学的武器锻造专精，我才能帮助你。前往冬泉谷的永望镇寻求帮助吧！"
G["You must give peace to these lands if you are to face Murozond."]="如果要挑战姆诺兹多，你们必须使这些圣地重获安宁。"
G["You must have been very brave."]="你刚才一定非常勇敢。"
G["You must have good luckydo."]="你肯定带了强力幸运符。"
G["You must have wondered how it is that I can speak so clearly for an ogre.  It's a side effect of the crystals that grow on the terrace surrounding Ogri'la.  The ogres there gifted me with this staff, and its crystal has in turn gifted me mentally.\n\nIt is through your continued actions, at Ogri'la above, that I hope to one day be able to bring this boon to all of my ogre brethren.  You have my thanks, my $g king : queen;, for all that you have done and will do."]="你一定很好奇为什么食人魔说话也能这么流利。这是生长在奥格瑞拉周围的水晶簇的副作用。那里的食人魔将这根法杖送给了我，镶嵌在法杖上的水晶赐予了我无穷的智慧。\n\n只要你继续在奥格瑞拉行善，那么总有一天，所有的食人魔同胞都能享受到这种福泽。谢谢你，我的$g国王:女王;。感谢你为我们所做的一切。"
G["You must hear my story before we may continue, $n. It will be of great use to you in the future."]="在我们继续之前，你必须先听一下我的故事，$n。这会对你很有帮助。"
G["You must help me safeguard the Tablets of Earth. Twilight's Hammer will not stop until they've taken the tablets."]="你必须帮助我保卫地之石板。暮光之锤如果得不到这些石板，绝不会善罢甘休。"
G["You must help! We're homeless!"]="你一定要帮帮我们！我们已经无家可归了！"
G["You must hurry!"]="赶快行动！"
G["You must hurry... Wyrmrest falls as we speak... all... is lost..."]="你必须赶快……龙眠神殿……快倒塌了……没有希望了……"
G["You must keep up with me, $n. Venture too far and you will fail the exercise."]="你得跟上我，$n。要是离得太远，这场练习你就失败了。"
G["You must keep your mind strong to withstand the ever present whispers from the empress. Weaker minds will fall to her will without even noticing."]="你必须时刻保持坚强的意志，以承受从女皇处不断传来的窃窃私语。薄弱的意志将使你在不知不觉中落入她的手中。"
G["You must learn to become one with this land, stranger.\n\nOnly then will its secrets be revealed to you."]="Debes aprender a ser $guno:una; con la tierra, $gforastero:forastera;.\n\nSolo entonces te revelará sus secretos."
G["You must learn to ponder, stranger. Your impetuous questions betray a lazy mind."]="Debes aprender a reflexionar, $gforastero:forastera;. Tus preguntas impetuosas son señal de una mente perezosa."
G["You must leave the bar!"]="你必须离开酒吧！"
G["You must let go! You must become what you were always meant to be! The time is now Anveena!"]="你必须清醒过来！变回过去的你，变回你原来的样子！就是现在，安薇娜！"
G["You must not approach the Frost Queen. Quickly, stop them!"]="绝不能让他们靠近冰霜女王。快，阻止他们！"
G["You must not interfere!"]="别妨碍我！"
G["You must not summon our god!"]="你不能召唤我们的神！"
G["You must not think of this as betrayal, $n, but Mr. Goodwin has offered me the find of a lifetime in exchange for his belongings."]="你可千万别觉得这是背叛，$n。古德温先生可是给了我一笔这辈子只能碰见一次的丰厚报酬来交换他的货物。"
G["You must pay to ride, friends! Come and get your ride tickets!"]="先付钱才能玩，朋友！快来买木马门票了！"
G["You must persevere!"]="坚持住！"
G["You must place the fireworks near a pile of stolen goods."]="你必须把焰火放在一堆被偷走的货物附近。"
G["You must protect me."]="你必须保护我。"
G["You must protect us from Deathwing's forces while we imbue the Dragon Soul with the power of the Aspects."]="我们会将守护巨龙的力量灌注到巨龙之魂中，在此期间，你们必须保护我们。"
G["You must remain in Steelgrill's Depot."]="你必须留在钢架补给站。"
G["You must remain in the Echo Isles, Darkspear Strand, or Sen'jin Village."]="你必须留在回音群岛、暗矛海滩或者是森金村。"
G["You must remain inside Darkwhisper Gorge and its surrounding areas!"]="你必须待在暗语峡谷和它附近的地方！"
G["You must remain within the Argent Tournament grounds."]="你不能离开银色锦标赛的赛场。"
G["You must remain within the field of battle."]="你必须待在赛场里。"
G["You must remember that I have yet to mature into an elder wyrm. I must eat to renew my strength!"]="我还没有完全成熟，必须依赖进食来强化自身的力量。"
G["You must remember the splendor of life, $g brother:sister;. You were a champion of the kaldorei once! This isn't you!"]="Debes recordar el esplendor de la vida, $ghermano:hermana;. ¡Una vez fuiste $gun campeón:una campeona; de los kaldorei! ¡$gEste:Esta; no eres tú!"
G["You must return to eastern Uldum or the Fusion Core will deactivate!"]="你必须返回奥丹姆东部，否则聚变核心就会失效！"
G["You must return to the Duskmist Shore!"]="你必须返回暮霭海滩！"
G["You must sacrifice yourself to keep the dragon child from falling!"]="为了不让王子倒下，你必须牺牲自己！"
G["You must save him!"]="你必须救他！"
G["You must save us!"]="你必须拯救我们！"
G["You must seek out Shado-Master Zhen if you're to aid us here, $c."]="如果你是来帮我们的，那你必须要找到影踪派陈大师，$c。"
G["You must send us assistance in our time of need. An attack upon New Thalanaar is imminent!"]="你们必须在这紧要关头向我们施以援手。对新萨兰纳尔的攻击已经迫在眉睫！"
G["You must stay by Elderlimb's side!"]="你必须留在老树干身边！"
G["You must stay by Thisalee's side!"]="你必须留在希萨莉身边！"
G["You must stay by Tholo and Anren's side!"]="你必须留在索罗和安伦身边！"
G["You must stay within the Talrendis Point attack area!"]="你必须待在塔伦迪斯营地攻击区域内！"
G["You must strike them down if we are to survive long enough to end this. Take flight on the wings of my sisters, they will transport you as close as they dare!"]="要想活着终结这一切，我们就必须击败他们。借助我姐妹们的双翼，让她们带你们飞到尽可能近的地方！"
G["You must strive to maintain a balance, no matter your surroundings..."]="你必须无视周围的环境，努力保持平衡……"
G["You must survive Ahune's minions while we channel our flames.  Do not approach the Frost Lord until we can wither him."]="你一定要在我们引导火焰的这段时间内挡住埃霍恩的手下。在我们削弱埃霍恩之前，不要靠近它。"
G["You must tell my brothers that I live."]="请转告我的兄弟，我还活着。"
G["You must tend to the wounded!  Quickly!"]="你必须去照顾伤员！赶快！"
G["You must think yourselves mighty. How little you know. Behold now, my greatest creation!"]="你们肯定觉得自己很厉害吧。真是愚昧。看看吧，我最伟大的创造！"
G["You must thrust the spear into the heart of the Storm Lord while he still lives."]="你得在暴风领主活着时，将长矛刺入他的心脏。"
G["You must use the incendiary bombs at the barrels inside the internment lodges of Durnholde Keep. Once five bombs have been ignited and the diversion has been set, find Thrall in the basement prison of Durnholde and set him free. Follow him and make sure that he does not die!\n\nBrazen will fly you to Durnholde when you are ready."]="潜入敦霍尔德城堡的收容所，在圆桶中放置燃烧弹。点燃五枚燃烧弹，一旦声东击西之计成功，就去敦霍尔德城堡的地下室找到萨尔，并保护他逃走，你必须确保萨尔的生命安全！\n\n如果你准备好了，就跟布拉森谈谈，飞往敦霍尔德城堡吧。"
G["You must utter the words..."]="你倒是说句话啊……"
G["You must wait for an audience."]="你必须要等候召见。"
G["You must walk before you can run. Speak with Feruul for training, and attend well to his lessons."]="学习讲究循序渐进，不能操之过急。和费卢尔谈谈吧，好好向他讨教。"
G["You must... free... my children..."]="你必须……解救……我的孩子们……"
G["You mustn't let him loose!"]="你们不能让他挣脱！"
G["You mustn't tarry, $n.\n\nAnachronos awaits!"]="别再等待了，$n。\n\n阿纳克洛斯正在等你！"
G["You naga keep your distance. We're not kidding around here!"]="纳迦最好和我们保持距离。我们可不是在开玩笑！"
G["You need Arcane Intellect, because that answer is obvious!  NO!"]="你需要去搞个奥术智慧效果了，难道答案还不明显吗？不！"
G["You need Darkmoon Game Tokens to play.\n\nBuy them from any of the faire's Game Token vendors.\n\nI'll mark one on your map for you."]="要想玩游戏，你必须拥有暗月游戏代币。\n\n马戏团里到处都有出售代币的商人。\n\n我可以帮你在地图上标记出来。"
G["You need a Darkmoon Ride Ticket to use the carousel."]="你需要暗月木马门票才能乘坐旋转木马。"
G["You need a lift?"]="要我送你一程吗？"
G["You need drink! Drink! Be happy!"]="你也该喝一杯！干！祝你开心！"
G["You need go to The Apothecarium on inner ring.  That where Martha Alliestar teach you how to pick flowers."]="你需要去内环的炼金房。那就是马尔萨·奥列斯塔教你如何摘花的地方。"
G["You need help with some fires? Very well, let's get down to business."]="你需要我的火力支援？很好，我们直接说正事吧。"
G["You need more bite.  Do not show our enemies any mercy."]="再刺一下。别对敌人心软。"
G["You need more focus.  Try again!"]="你得集中精神。再来一次！"
G["You need more training!"]="你还得练练！"
G["You need not thank me, Garrosh. Your father was a brother to me. I would do anything for you and the Mag'har. I must now return to the Greatmother."]="你没必要感谢我，加尔鲁什。你的父亲和我是兄弟。我会为你和玛格汉氏族做任何事。现在，我得回祖母身边去了。"
G["You need only ask when you are ready to return to the present."]="当你准备好回到现在时，再开口发问。"
G["You need only face our rivals in any of the Battlegrounds. Win or lose, if you stay for the duration of the battle, you will be mailed a Competitor's Tabard."]="你只需要进入任意战场英勇作战就行了。无论胜负，只要你坚持到最后一刻，就能收到我们邮寄给你的竞争者的战袍。"
G["You need only face your rivals in any of the Battlegrounds. Win or lose, if you stay for the duration of the battle, you will be mailed a Competitor's Tabard."]="你只需要进入任意战场英勇作战就行了。无论胜负，只要你坚持到最后一刻，就能收到我们邮寄给你的竞争者的战袍。"
G["You need somethin'?\n\nToo bad. I got nothin' for ya, $c."]="你需要什么？\n\n太糟糕了。我可帮不了你，$c。"
G["You need something built or broken? Stripped or soldered? Cracked or cobbled? You've come to the right engineer."]="你是想要建造东西还是拆除东西？拆卸东西还是组装东西？破坏东西还是修补东西？如果是的话，那你就来对地方了。"
G["You need something fixed? Use the Vend-O-Tron D-Luxe."]="你有东西需要修理吗？请使用售货机器人。"
G["You need something fixed? Use the Vend-O-Tron."]="你有东西需要修理吗？请使用售货机器人。"
G["You need something, $c?"]="你需要什么，$c？"
G["You need something, $g mack:lady;?"]="你需要什么吗，$g老兄:女士;？"
G["You need something? Maybe your armor or weapon repaired? Hmm?"]="你需要什么？要不要修理一下护甲或是武器？嗯？"
G["You need ta go somewhere? As long as that somewhere is Ratchet, I've got yer fast track right here!"]="你要去其他地方吗？如果那个“其他地方”是棘齿城，那我马上就能给你开辟一条快速通道！"
G["You need to attune yourself further with the Naz'jar Battlemaiden to participate in this vision."]="你需要进一步使自己与纳兹夏尔女武士谐调一致，才能分享这景象。"
G["You need to be a stronger $c before you can help us in Alterac Valley."]="你需要变得更强大，才能帮助我们在奥特兰克山谷作战，$C。"
G["You need to be careful - they're on full alert!"]="你得小心点——他们非常警惕！"
G["You need to be exalted with the Forsaken of the Undercity before I will teach you a riding skill, $c."]="Es necesario que los Renegados de Entrañas te consideren $gun exaltado:una exaltada; para que te pueda enseñar la habilidad de equitación, $c."
G["You need to be exalted with the dwarves of Ironforge before I will teach you a riding skill, $c."]="Es necesario que los enanos de Forjaz te consideren $gun exaltado:una exaltada; para que te pueda enseñar la habilidad de equitación, $c."
G["You need to be exalted with the gnomes of the Gnomeregan Exiles before I will teach you how to pilot a Mechanostrider, $c."]="Es necesario que los Exiliados de Gnomeregan te consideren $gun exaltado:una exaltada; para que te pueda enseñar pilotar un mecazancudo, $c."
G["You need to be exalted with the humans of Stormwind before I will teach you a riding skill, $c."]="Es necesario que los humanos de Ventormenta te consideren $gun exaltado:una exaltada; para que te pueda enseñar la habilidad de equitación, $c."
G["You need to be exalted with the night elves of Darnassus before I will teach you a riding skill, $c."]="Es necesario que los elfos de la noche de Darnassus te consideren $gun exaltado:una exaltada; para que te pueda enseñar la habilidad de equitación, $c."
G["You need to be exalted with the orcs of Orgrimmar before I will teach you a riding skill, $c."]="Es necesario que los orcos de Orgrimmar te consideren $gun exaltado:una exaltada; para que te pueda enseñar la habilidad de equitación, $c."
G["You need to be exalted with the tauren of Thunder Bluff before I will teach you a riding skill, $c."]="Es necesario que los tauren de Cima del Trueno te consideren $gun exaltado:una exaltada; para que te pueda enseñar la habilidad de equitación, $c."
G["You need to be exalted with the trolls of the Darkspear tribe before I will teach you a riding skill, $c."]="Es necesario que los trols Lanza Negra te consideren $gun exaltado:una exaltada; para que te pueda enseñar la habilidad de equitación, $c."
G["You need to be friendly with the Forsaken of the Undercity before I will teach you a riding skill, $c."]="Es necesario que los Renegados de Entrañas te consideren $gamistoso:amistosa; para que te pueda enseñar la habilidad de equitación, $c."
G["You need to be friendly with the dwarves of Ironforge before I will teach you a riding skill, $c."]="Es necesario que los enanos de Forjaz te consideren $gamistoso:amistosa; para que te pueda enseñar la habilidad de equitación, $c."
G["You need to be friendly with the gnomes of the Gnomeregan Exiles before I will teach you how to pilot a Mechanostrider, $c."]="Es necesario que los gnomos de los Exiliados de Gnomeregan te consideren $gamistoso:amistosa; para que te pueda enseñar a pilotar un mecazancudo, $c."
G["You need to be friendly with the humans of Stormwind before I will teach you a riding skill, $c."]="Es necesario que los humanos de Ventormenta te consideren $gamistoso:amistosa; para que te pueda enseñar la habilidad de equitación, $c."
G["You need to be friendly with the night elves of Darnassus before I will teach you a riding skill, $c."]="Es necesario que los elfos de la noche de Darnassus te consideren $gamistoso:amistosa; para que te pueda enseñar la habilidad de equitación, $c."
G["You need to be friendly with the orcs of Orgrimmar before I will teach you a riding skill, $c."]="Es necesario que los orcos de Orgrimmar te consideren $gamistoso:amistosa; para que te pueda enseñar la habilidad de equitación, $c."
G["You need to be friendly with the tauren of Thunder Bluff before I will teach you a riding skill, $c."]="Es necesario que los tauren de Cima del Trueno te consideren $gamistoso:amistosa; para que te pueda enseñar la habilidad de equitación, $c."
G["You need to be friendly with the trolls of the Darkspear tribe before I will teach you a riding skill, $c."]="Es necesario que los trols Lanza Negra te consideren $gamistoso:amistosa; para que te pueda enseñar la habilidad de equitación, $c."
G["You need to be more selective in your breeding.  The Horde has no place for weaklings, even in its swine pens."]="你的繁育要更具选择性一些。部落容不下弱者，即使是在猪圈里。"
G["You need to be on a racing ram to receive a keg! Return to Neill Ramstein and ask for another."]="你得骑着赛羊才能拿到酒桶！快去找尼尔·拉姆斯登再要一头吧。"
G["You need to be on a racing ram to receive a keg! Return to Ram Master Ray and ask for another."]="你得骑着赛羊才能拿到酒桶！快去找赛羊管理员雷恩再要一头吧。"
G["You need to do what? All this science, I don't understand... Look, this is just my job, five days a week."]="你说什么？我不太明白这些复杂的理论……瞧，这只是我一周五天的日常工作而已。"
G["You need to find Swart.  Look for him inside the barracks on the east side of Razor Hill."]="你应该去找斯瓦特。到剃刀岭东边的兵营里找找看。"
G["You need to get back to camp. I can't lose you."]="你得回营地去。我不能失去你。"
G["You need to get to the cliffs and Scout Brax, $n."]="你需要到那片悬崖去，找到斥候布拉克斯，$n。"
G["You need to heed the guidance of the spirits a little better young one. Your path lies with another, Thrag Stonehoof in Thunder Bluff. Perhaps you can learn something from one another."]="你需要多加留心灵魂的指引。你的路线取决于另一个人，雷霆崖的瑟拉格·石蹄。或许你们可以互相学习。"
G["You need to kill Troggzor the Earthinator!"]="你要干掉颤地者特罗格佐尔！"
G["You need to learn from someone who knows more than I do. Go talk to Josef Gregorian in Undercity. Well, what are you still doing here?"]="你需要找一个比我懂得多的人。去找幽暗城的乔瑟夫·格里高利谈谈。那么，你还在这里干吗？"
G["You need to learn to appreciate your surroundings, Cersei!"]="你要学会尊重大自然，瑟尔希！"
G["You need to make your stitches smaller, $n. Fewer items will slip out of your quivers and ammo pouches. Besides, no one likes a lumpy tunic."]="你要把你的针法做得更小些，$n。这样你的箭袋和弹药袋就不会有东西掉出来。还有，没有人喜欢穿着鼓鼓囊囊的外衣的。"
G["You need to pass through all 10 checkpoints before completing the racecourse!"]="你需要经过全部10个检查点才能完成比赛！"
G["You need to see a medic!"]="你该看医生了！"
G["You need to seriously rethink your definition of help lady! You're dangerous with that stick!"]="¡Tienes que replantearte el concepto de \"ayudar\", señora! ¡Eres un peligro con ese palo!"
G["You need to speak to Ba'kon. He has an ample supply of meats. I heard he makes it all fresh\n\nI'll mark his location on your map. Good luck!"]="你需要与巴空谈谈。他供应充足的肉类，听说新鲜得很。\n\n我会在你的地图上标记这个位置。祝你好运！"
G["You need to speak to Michael Bedernik. He has an ample supply of meats.\n\nI'll mark his location on your map. Good luck!"]="你需要与米歇尔·扫榻谈谈。他供应充足的肉类。\n\n我会在你的地图上标记这个位置。祝你好运！"
G["You need to speak with Varzok in Orgrimmar!  Any guard there should be able to give you directions to find him.\n\nYou will find a portal to Orgrimmar inside the temple.  Good luck!"]="你应该去奥格瑞玛找瓦佐克聊聊！城里的任何卫兵都能为你指路。\n\n寺院里有通往奥格瑞玛的传送门，可以把你传送过去。祝你好运！"
G["You need to start learning things that are beyond my expertise! Talk to Lilliam Sparkspindle in front of the tent there. He'll set you on the right course!"]="你需要开始学习一些我的专门技术之外的东西！跟那边帐篷前面的利廉姆·火轴谈谈。他会让你步入正轨的！"
G["You need to talk to Audrey Burnhep in Stormwind City!  Any guard there should be able to give you directions to find her.\n\nYou will find a portal to Stormwind inside the temple.  Good luck!"]="你得去暴风城，找奥黛丽·伯恩赫普聊聊！城里的任何一名守卫都能为你指路。\n\n在寺院里有传送门，可以将你传送过去。祝你好运！"
G["You need to talk to Teng Thundermalt! He can be found at the Stormstout Brewery in the Valley of the Four Winds.\n\nLet me mark the location on your map for you."]="你应该跟邓·雷酒谈谈！他就在四风谷的风暴烈酒酿造厂。\n\n让我为你在地图上标出位置。"
G["You needn't perish with Azeroth. Follow me and live!"]="没有必要和艾泽拉斯一同灭亡。跟随我，得生存！"
G["You needn't worry, child. The warchief's \"observers\" are here to make certain of that."]="No te preocupes, joven. Los \"observadores\" del Jefe de Guerra han venido para asegurarse de eso."
G["You never be stoppin' us!"]="你休想阻止我们！"
G["You never know what skitters in the darkness."]="你永远不知道黑暗中潜藏着什么。"
G["You never know who can actually be trusted. Unless you're me; then you know."]="你永远不知道谁真正可以信任。要是你是我，你就会知道。"
G["You never should have stepped foot in this place."]="你真的不该来这地方。"
G["You never shoulda fed dem goots, Cousin."]="你不该去喂这些山羊，表哥。"
G["You never stood a chance against me and my lovely snakes!"]="在我和我可爱的毒蛇面前，你毫无半点儿机会！"
G["You never stood a chance against my augmented team!"]="你在我强大的战队面前毫无机会！"
G["You never stood a chance!"]="你根本就没有机会！"
G["You never stood a chance, whelp."]="你从无半点机会，小崽子。"
G["You never stood a chance."]="你毫无机会。"
G["You never tried to get anywhere. I'm so glad I finally found a real goblin who can satisfy my shopping needs."]="你总是一无是处。我真开心总算找到了一个真正的男人来满足我的购物欲。"
G["You new here?"]="¿Tú $gnuevo:nueva; aquí?"
G["You nincompoops! This place deserves to burn."]="你们这群傻瓜！这个地方真应该被烧掉。"
G["You no belong here!"]="你不属于这里！"
G["You no cast spells!"]="你别想施放法术！"
G["You no challenge me, scrubs!  I'm da king now, and I stay king FOREVER!!!"]="别向我挑战，矮小的家伙！现在我是国王啦，永远都是！！！"
G["You no king! Chief Ingoo Ingoo not vote for you!"]="你不是猴王！盎迦盎迦酋长不会承认你！"
G["You no make dis your home. Maybe you want eat someting?"]="你不是想把这里当做自己家吧。也许你想吃点什么？"
G["You no match for Gorth!"]="你不是戈斯的对手！"
G["You no mine ore, you get beating!"]="不挖矿，就挨打！"
G["You no ogre! How you win?"]="你不是食人魔！怎么会赢？"
G["You no slave! Work or die!"]="该死的奴隶！不干活就去死！"
