G["You now face Patience!  Wisdom!  Knowledge!  What virtues do you possess, $n?"]="你将要面对耐心！智慧！还有知识！你又有哪些优点呢，$n？"
G["You now face the Prime. Bow down to your superior!"]="来面对至尊者，向高等种族低头吧。"
