G["You only delay the inevitable!"]="你是在逃避必然的命运！"
G["You only delay the inevitable! The dread citadel rises in the east as the armies of the dead march from the heart of Icecrown!"]="你不过是在阻挠命中注定的结局！东方矗立起恐惧之城，而亡者大军将朝着冰冠冰川的中心挺进！"
