G["You orcs ever dream about battle?"]="你们这些兽人曾经梦想过战争吗？"
G["You ought to feel safe here; we've stepped up security at this facility after the attacks on Manaforge Duro."]="你在这儿应该很安全。法力熔炉：杜隆遭到攻击后我们便在此地增设了防御力量。"
G["You ought to rejoice that you even came close to defeating one of my pets."]="你应该感到高兴，因为你差点打败了我其中一只宠物。"
G["You outsiders will pay for encroaching on our land!"]="你们这些自不量力的家伙会为侵犯我们的领地付出代价的！"
G["You over there!  Help me find a way out of this wretched cage!"]="嘿，你！帮帮忙，帮我从这肮脏的囚笼中脱身！"
