G["You overstepped your bounds, Jin'do. You toy with powers that are beyond you. Have you forgotten who I am? Have you forgotten what I can do?!"]="你太放肆了，金度，你竟敢把远远凌驾于你的力量当作儿戏。难道你忘了我是谁？难道你忘了我能做什么？"
G["You pandaren are weak."]="你们熊猫人可真弱。"
