G["You people cool your heels! $n is here. $G He's : She's; gonna be the next Trade $G Prince : Princess;!"]="¡Eh, dejad lo que estéis haciendo! $n está aquí. ¡$gÉl:Ella; será $gel próximo Príncipe mercante:la próxima Princesa mercante;!"
G["You people... what are you doing here?  Why are you in my house?"]="你们……你们在这里干什么？为什么你们会在我的房子里？"
G["You performed well this day. Anything that Mal'Ganis has left behind is yours. Take it as your reward. I must now begin plans for an expedition to Northrend."]="你们表现得很出色。玛尔加尼斯留下的一切都是你们的了，把它们收下作为奖励吧。现在我要马上开始计划远征诺森德了。"
G["You perished to Haiyan the Unstoppable's |cFFFF0000|Hspell:120195|h[Meteor]|h|r! Be sure to group up with your allies when Haiyan the Unstoppable uses this ability so that you all split the damage."]="你被势不可挡哈伊岩的|cFFFF0000|Hspell:120195|h[流星]|h|r杀死了！一定要在势不可挡哈伊岩使用该技能时与你的同伴站在一起，从而分担伤害。"
