G["You ready to make their leader surrender, $g buddy : lady;? Okay, here we go."]="¿Estás $gpreparado:preparada; para obligar a su líder a rendirse, $gchico:chica;? Vale, allá vamos."
G["You ready to ride, babe?"]="¿Estás $gpreparado:preparada; para montar?"
G["You ready to ride?"]="¿Estás $gpreparado:preparada; para montar?"
G["You ready?"]="¿Estás $glisto:lista;?"
G["You realize not the error of your ways, but soon you will cower before Darkblaze."]="你们还没意识到自己有多愚蠢，可你们很快就将在黑暗烈焰面前战栗。"
G["You realize, of course, that we would likely have to joust one another should we enter the tournament."]="没错，这就对了，如果我们都参加这场锦标赛，那么最终的结果很可能是我们在沙场上一决胜负。"
