G["You really should not be here, $r. Leave if you value your life."]="$r，你不应该来这里的。想活命的话，赶紧离开吧。"
G["You really shouldn't be here, $r."]="$r，你不应该来这里的。"
G["You really shouldn't play with this stuff. Someone could get hurt."]="你不该随意摆弄这些东西。会弄伤人的。"
G["You really stop at no expense, $n! Amazing!"]="你可真是大手笔$n！真令人惊叹！"
