G["You receive 7500 honor and 150 arena points."]="你获得了7500点荣誉和150点竞技场点数。"
G["You recovered an ata'mal crystal?  Impressive, $n!"]="你找到了一块阿塔玛水晶？干得好，$n！"
G["You reek of death, human. You'll regret approaching me."]="你这是自寻死路，人类。你会后悔遇到我。"
G["You reek of fortune! Many thanks for saving me, Luckydo! You can call me Brother Yakshoe."]="你身上散发着好运的气息！万分感谢你救了我，幸运符！你可以叫我堂弟牦牛鞋。"
G["You remember damn well enough what it was."]="你记得很清楚。"
G["You remember the time you tried to drill that hole in your head?"]="你还记得上次自己做的傻事吗？"
G["You remind me of a young Master Goh, minus the girth.\n\nHe first came to me a farm boy dressed in rags but with a stylish stride to him that owned the look.\n\nTogether we made a clothing line that was all the rage in the east for at least two years."]="你让我想起了年轻的郭大师，他腰围要再细一点。\n\n我第一次见他时他还是个农场小工，尽管衣衫褴褛，但走起路来英姿飒爽，和他英俊的外表还挺相配。\n\n我们一起做了一个服装系列，在东部地区流行了至少两年。"
G["You require the Bishop's blessing.  Go to him soon."]="你需要主教大人的祝福。快去找他吧。"
G["You require the instruction of a true master! Go to Daryl Stack in Tarren Mill and embrace your destiny!"]="你需要一个真正大师的指导！到塔伦米尔的达瑞尔·斯塔克那儿去试试你的运气！"
G["You resist the power of the torch... why won't you die, beast?"]="你胆敢抵抗火炬的力量……为什么不去死呢，野兽？"
G["You resist. You cling to your life as if it actually matters. You will learn."]="你顽强抗拒。你紧抓住自己的生命，仿佛真能改变一切。你会了解的。"
G["You rich punks are all the same!"]="你们有钱人都是一个样！"
G["You risk destroying us all, $r! You must be terminated!"]="你的冒险会让我们全部遭受毁灭的命运，$r！必须有人阻止你！"
G["You runts want to riot?  I'll show you!"]="你们这群小鬼想要暴动？我要让你们瞧瞧厉害！"
G["You rush headlong into all-out war without a thought of the consequences."]="你脑子里只想着战争与杀戮，完全不考虑后果。"
G["You rush headlong into the maw of madness!"]="你们盲目地冲进了疯狂之喉！"
G["You said Brogg could stay here! You promised Brogg you'd help regain Stonemaul clan mound!"]="你说过布洛格可以待在这里的！你许诺过会帮助布洛格夺回石槌氏族的土地！"
G["You said it!"]="你算说对了！"
G["You said you needed hops? Very well. I'll send some to Halfhill."]="你说你需要啤酒花？好吧。我会送一些到半山。"
G["You said you would have it back. What does that mean?"]="你说你终究会找回它，这是什么意思？"
G["You said you would ring the gong first."]="你说过你要第一个敲锣的。"
G["You save us! Yay for you!"]="你救了我们！谢谢你！"
G["You saved me from certain death. I owe you."]="你救了我的命。我欠你一份情。"
