G["You saved my life!"]="你救了我的命！"
G["You saved my life! Thanks!"]="你救了我！谢谢！"
G["You saved my son and my ranch. I am forever in your debt, stranger. If you ever find yourself in need of a clean yak, you know where to go."]="Has salvado a mi hijo y defendido mi rancho. Siempre estaré en deuda contigo, $gforastero:forastera;. Si alguna vez necesitas un yak limpio, ya sabes adónde ir."
G["You saved the lives of my sentinels, hero. You have my everlasting gratitude. Now we can continue with our mission."]="Les has salvado la vida a mis centinelas, $ghéroe:heroína;. Te estaré agradecida eternamente. Ahora podemos continuar con nuestra misión."
G["You saved us, $p!"]="是你救了我们，$p！"
G["You say something?"]="你说什么？"
G["You say you come in peace, yet you wear strong armor and wield many weapons.\n\nHow do you explain that?"]="你们嘴上说是为和平而来，但实际上却是武装到了牙齿。\n\n这你们该作何解释？"
G["You say you have come to seek knowledge and understanding, but you are dressed for battle.  That is why I question you and your willingness to do what must be done."]="你说你是来寻求知识与理解，可你却身穿战甲。因此，我质疑你与你的意愿——你是否已准备好完成必须完成的任务。"
G["You say you want hops? No problem. You kill virmen for me, Mung-Mung send some hops to Halfhill for you."]="你说你需要啤酒花？没问题。你帮我杀兔妖，蒙蒙就帮你把啤酒花送到半山。"
G["You scared of da creepy crawlies, $r?"]="你怕那些恐怖的爬虫吗，$r？"
G["You scared the fish away!  What do you want?"]="你把我的鱼吓走了！你到底要怎么样？"
G["You screamed like a little girl, funniest thing I ever saw."]="你像个小女孩一般地尖叫，这真是我见过的最好笑的事。"
G["You scum aren't even worth my time.  Destroy them, my pack!"]="你不值得我浪费时间。干掉他们！"
G["You scum will NOT destroy this land as you defiled Kalimdor!"]="渣滓们，休想像玷污卡利姆多那样毁掉这片土地！"
G["You scurvy dogs make yourselves useful! KEEP FIRING!"]="你们这群笨蛋做点儿有意义的事吧！保持开火！"
G["You see a brief glimmer along the east wall..."]="你看到沿东墙发出了一道闪光……"
G["You see for yourself now. Da Lich King be generous to dem who obey."]="自己权衡一番吧。要知道，巫妖王陛下对于所有忠诚的仆从都非常慷慨。"
G["You see large cavernous tunnels and corridors reflected inside the crystal. You recognize the area as the Molten Core."]="你在水晶中看到了巨大的通道和走廊。你认得这个地方：熔火之心。"
G["You see that final blow! Awesome!"]="你看那最后一击！真漂亮！"
G["You see that?  She's... huge!"]="看见了吗？她……真大啊！"
G["You see the faint outline of a humanoid figure inside the pod; you now know that this is indeed the location you need to be at.  While you think you will eventually be able to open the pod, it remains tighly shut even to your most forceful attempts to open it."]="你在虫茧里看到了模糊的人体轮廓，你现在知道这就是你要找的地方了。虽然你认为自己可以打开虫茧，但即使你用尽全力，它还是紧紧地关着。"
G["You see the stack of worg hides that you collected earlier.  These will be used for the bulk of your costume."]="你看到了自己早先收集到的那堆座狼皮。这些将被用来为你做衣服。"
G["You see the world through Kalytha's eyes..."]="你通过卡莱莎的眼睛看到这个世界……"
G["You see this here gun, $gboy:missy;?\n\n<Ol' Durty Pete casually waves his weapon directly at your face.>\n\nThis here gun's seen action on every continent but for Northrend. It's saved me life more times than I can count: Seven. One time, \"Big Mackie\" MacDungal - not the wee MacDungal now, but his pappy - offered me his youngest daughter in barter for me gun.\n\nLet me tell you somethin' about Edie: she and me gun had a lot in common. Wide-mouthed. Buck-toofed. Dangerous from the biz-ness end. Likin' to go oft half-cocked.\n\nYou heard about the time wee Edie bet Chuck Brandybeard 25 silver she could kick 'im in the head so hard he would weep snot?"]="¿Ves esta escopeta, $gchaval:chavala;?\n\n<El Viejo Pete apunta el arma directamente a tu cara como si nada.>\n\nEsta escopeta ha conocido la acción en todos los continentes menos Rasganorte. Me ha salvado la vida más veces de las que puedo contar: siete. Una vez, \"Gran Mackie\" MacDungal (no el muchacho MacDungal, sino su padre) me ofreció su hija menor a cambio de mi escopeta.\n\nDeja que te cuente algo sobre Edie: tenía mucho en común con mi escopeta. La boca ancha, los dientes de conejo, peligrosa por un extremo, a veces se encasquilla.\n\n¿Has oído la historia de cuando la moza se apostó 25 monedas de plata con Chuck Barbabrandy a que podía darle una patada en la cara tan fuerte que lloraría mocos?"
G["You see this kodo? DO YOU SEE THIS KODO? This kodo cost more than that toolbox you call a house. You see, pal, that's who I am. And you're nothin'."]="你看见这头科多兽了吗？你·看·见·这·头·科·多·兽·了·吗？！它比你那件工具“库房”值钱多了。你瞧，我是大人物。而你什么都不是。"
G["You see those bones at your feet? Those are guards who tried to desert their post."]="你看见脚下的尸骨了吗？这就是擅离职守的下场。"
G["You see, Cozwynn, I told you that we could rely upon $n."]="看，柯丝温，我早就和你说过，我们可以依靠$n。"
G["You see, Thorim is not like these harpies.  He's a worthy being of near godlike stature.\n\nHe served the titans as guardian of Ulduar and the Terrace of the Makers.\n\nThat is until his wife, Sif, was cowardly slain by his brother."]="你看，托里姆和这些鹰身人不同。他是近乎神的存在。\n\n他为泰坦们守护着奥杜尔和造物者圣台。\n\n直到他的妻子西芙被他的兄弟可鄙地杀害了。"
G["You see, all you gotta do is forge the Sulfuron hammer and find yourself the Eye of Sulfuras. Combine the Eye of Sulfuras with the Sulfuron hammer and it will become Sulfuras! Now I'm not going to bog you down with any technical information as to where or how or when you can get an Eye of Sulfuras. I'm sure you'll figure that stuff out. Just sign this here contract so that our agreement is binding and our business will be done."]="你所要做的就是铸造萨弗隆战锤和找到萨弗拉斯之眼。将萨弗拉斯之眼和萨弗隆战锤结合在一起就能成为萨弗拉斯！我不会告诉你任何关于萨弗拉斯之眼的信息。我想你自己能找到的。在这张合约上签字，让我们达成交易。"
G["You see, brother... we're not so different..."]="你看，兄弟……我们并没有多大的差异……"
G["You see, the TRUE power of kings and emperors stems from the power to aid their people."]="现在你该明白了，君王们真正的力量源于帮助自己的人民。"
G["You see, there is balance in all things. Wisdom etched in our very fur: Black and white. Darkness and light."]="万物自有平衡之道。这智慧铭刻在我们的皮毛上：黑与白。黑暗与光明。"
G["You see, those who lead through fear only stay in power while those they govern lack courage."]="你看，凭恐惧统治的帝王，只能在臣民缺乏勇气时才能永掌大权。"
G["You see, what you have done is a tribute to a truth we Pandaren hold most dear."]="知道吗，你所做的一切，正好体现了我们熊猫人推崇备至的一个真理。"
G["You see? Bad yak. Now go on, $r. Try to feed it."]="你看吧？差劲的牦牛。继续，$r。试着喂它。"
G["You see? No power of this world can trample the pure of spirit."]="你看到了？这世上没有力量能践踏纯洁的灵魂。"
G["You see? Nothing beats the crushing power of my hammers."]="看到了吗？什么也无法阻挡我的战锤的力量。"
G["You see? They're wild animals in there!"]="你看到了吧？那些家伙都是些凶残的野兽！"
G["You seek Azuregos? Bane of the Bitter Reaches? Scourge of the Bay of Storms? Lord of all magic in Azshara?\n\nWell, you've found him.\n\n<Azuregos appears to be smiling.>"]="你在找艾索雷葛斯？痛苦海岸灾星？风暴海湾之祸？艾萨拉的魔法之主？\n\n好吧，你找到他了。\n\n<艾索雷葛斯似乎是在微笑。>"
G["You seek Grol'dar and the Darkfire Enclave?  Find them in the underground cavern called the Cleft of Shadow.  There are two tunnels leading down into that cave, one just south of the Valley of Wisdom and the other from The Drag."]="你在寻找格罗达尔和暗火营地？在被称作暗影裂口的地下洞穴里找到他们。有两条通道可以进入洞穴，一条在智慧谷的南面，另一条在暗巷区里面。"
G["You seek Kardris Dreamseeker.  She and the other shaman are in the entrance room to Thrall's Fortress in the Valley of Wisdom."]="你想找的是卡德里斯。她和其余的萨满正在智慧谷萨尔的要塞的入口房间那里。"
G["You seek Mai the Jade Shaper. You can find her at Greenstone Village in The Jade Forest.\n\nI will mark her location on your map."]="你要找的人是塑玉者麦逸。她就在翡翠林的绿石村。\n\n我会在你的地图上标出她的位置。"
G["You seek Silkmaster Tsai at the Silken Fields in the Valley of the Four Winds. I will mark his location on your map for you."]="你可以在四风谷的丝纱工坊上找到蔡丝匠。我会在你的地图上标出他的位置。"
G["You seek Tan Shin Tiao. She can be found in the Seat of Knowledge, above Mogu'shan Palace here in the Vale of Eternal Blossoms.\n\nI will mark her location on your map."]="你要找谭欣眺。她就在锦绣谷魔古山宫殿上方的闻道之座。\n\n我会在你的地图上标出她的位置。"
G["You seek a Sunwalker.  Sunwalker Iopi resides with many of our other trainers."]="你在寻找烈日行者？烈日行者艾乌比就和我们的许多训练师居住在一起。"
G["You seek a higher knowledge. Tepa is blessed with such knowledge. She should be standing somewhere nearby..."]="你寻求更高级的知识。坦帕拥有这种知识。她应该就站在附近……"
G["You seek a prize, eh? How about death?"]="你想要奖品，对吗？死亡听起来如何?"
G["You seek a rogue?  I believe Jannok would fit that description.  Why don't you go talk to him over at the Inn in Dolanaar."]="你在找寻一个潜行者？我认为詹诺克很适合你的描述。你为什么不到多兰纳尔的旅馆里去找他谈谈呢？"
G["You seek death?"]="你寻死吗？"
G["You seek escape, not glory. It's suicide."]="你在寻找的是逃避，不是光荣。这是自杀。"
G["You seek further instruction, $n?"]="你是来寻求进一步的指导的吗，$n？"
G["You seek me? We fight now!"]="你找我？我们打架！"
G["You seek passage somewhere, $n?  My bats will get you there in no time."]="你需要长途旅行么，$n？我的蝙蝠会很快把你送到目的地的。"
G["You seek power, yes? But will you walk the cursed path I do for it?"]="你在寻求力量？但你能走过我铺下的诅咒之路吗？"
G["You seek someone who cares for animals?  Then you should look for Seriadne outside the Inn in Dolanaar.  She is the one that you seek."]="你寻找一个喜欢动物的人？那么你应该到多兰纳尔旅馆的外面寻找瑟里亚迪。她就是你找的那个人。"
G["You seek something in our fair land?"]="你来这片美丽的土地寻找什么？"
G["You seek the aid of a Druid?  Then you should go see Kal at the Moonwell just south of the Inn in Dolanaar."]="你在寻找一个德鲁伊的训练师？那么你应该到多兰纳尔旅店南面的月亮井去见见卡尔。"
G["You seek the hunters?  You will find them on the second level of the Trader's Tier, in the Hunters' Sanctum."]="你在寻找猎人？他们就在贸易阶梯第二层的猎手圣殿中。"
G["You seek the newly-arrived Highborne? So be it.\nYou'll find them in the western wing of the Temple of the Moon. There may be one of them at the Howling Oak, as well."]="¿Buscas a los Altonato que acaban de llegar? Que así sea.\n\nLos encontrarás en el ala oeste del Templo de la Luna. Puede que también haya uno de ellos en El Roble Quejumbroso."
G["You seek the scepter shard charged to the protection of the Blue Flight?\n\n<Azuregos appears to be smiling.>"]="你是来寻找守护蓝龙的节杖碎片的？\n\n<艾索雷葛斯的表情似乎是在微笑。>"
G["You seek the secrets of Ulduar? Then take them!"]="你们想要探寻奥杜尔的秘密？那就拿去吧！"
G["You seek the troll, Jabul. He can help you."]="你得去找巨魔贾布。他可以帮助你。"
G["You seek their leader... little thing, you wage war against the clans of Grom'thar the Thunderbringer himself.  Don't be so eager to rush to your death."]="小家伙，你在寻找他们的首领……你竟然想要挑战雷霆使者戈洛塔尔领导的猛犸人氏族。别急着去送死吧。"
G["You seek to challenge the infamous Tenwu of the Red Smoke? Come friend, let us see what you have got!"]="你想挑战恶名昭著的“赤烟”腾武？来吧，朋友，让我们看看你的本事！"
G["You seek to deafen me? Pathetic... Wait... What's that sound?"]="你想打倒我？可怜虫……等等……那是什么声音？"
G["You seek to draw the General of the Frostwolf legion out from his fortress? PREPOSTEROUS!"]="你们想要把霜狼的将军引出他的要塞？可笑！"
G["You seek to halt an avalanche. I will bury you."]="你妄想阻止雪崩。我只会埋葬你。"
G["You seek to harm me, $r?"]="你想要伤害我吗，$R？"
G["You seek to lower our global defenses in order to appease a paranoid magistrate and an encampment of riff-raff that are most probably suffering from heat stroke."]="你是说为了满足一个妄想狂的地方官和一群没准正在遭受中暑之苦的乌合之众的愿望，我们就得把世界各地的部队都调回来，然后给他派过去吗？"
G["You seek to lure me from my clutch? You shall pay for your insolence!"]="你们这些渣滓居然想要挑战我？你们会为你们的傲慢付出代价的！"
G["You seek to martyr me before my order - so be it. Strike me down, another will rise in my place and the suffering of the Light - of the conquered - will continue uninterrupted."]="你想干掉我，那就来吧。就算我倒下了，还会有别的兄弟勇敢地站起来。而已经被我们征服的所谓圣光，仍将陷在痛苦的深渊。"
G["You seek to uncover mysteries I myself have yet to unlock, $c. Please, discuss these matters with Nahogg instead."]="$c，我所掌握的附魔技能已经不能满足你求知的欲望了。请和纳霍加谈谈吧。"
G["You seek two lovers blind to the ambitions of their family names. They were here, seeking a way to hold to their path.\n\nSadly they did not find their answers among the trees or art."]="你要找的是一对抛弃了家族名誉的爱侣。他们曾来过这里，想要找到厮守一生的方法。\n\n可惜他们并没有在林木或艺术中找到答案。"
G["You seek your own death, trespasser!"]="自寻死路，入侵者！"
G["You seek...a reward?\n\nSurely the joy of a successful catch is reward enough? The thrill of the open sea? The comraderie that only a fishing pole can grant?\n\nYou have much to learn, $r.\n\nMy opinion aside, there is much to be gained from the art of fishing.\n\nYou may improve your fishing skill.  One day, you may purchase powerful fishing rods.\n\nThe most revered fishermen may receive access to a special fish pet, a water stride mount, and a fishing raft."]="你想要……奖励？\n\n成功捕到一条大鱼的快乐还不算是奖励？那么身临大海的兴奋呢？还有仅凭一根钓竿就能获得的归属感？\n\n你还有很多东西要学，$r。\n\n抛开我的个人见解不谈，光是垂钓的学问就能让你钻研好久了。\n\n你可以提高自己的钓鱼技能。今后，你能买到强大的钓竿。\n\n倍受尊重的渔夫还能获得特殊的鱼类宠物、水黾坐骑，甚至还有捕鱼木筏。"
G["You seem a little tense..."]="你看起来有点紧张……"
G["You seem confident. Surely you wouldn't mind a test of your skills?"]="Pareces muy $gseguro:segura;, así que no te importará que ponga a prueba tus habilidades, ¿verdad?"
G["You seem eager to join your beloved Sif, brother."]="托里姆，急着和你心爱的西芙做伴吗？"
G["You seem like a craftsman, $pc.  Do you think you can cut it as a woodcrafter?  If so, I have something that may help you."]="Tienes pinta de $gartesano:artesana;, $pc. ¿Crees que vales para ebanista? Si es así, tengo algo que podría serte de ayuda."
G["You seem like a reasonable man, captain. What would you do if someone in your family went missing?"]="长官，你是个通情达理的人。如果你的家人失踪了，你会怎样做？"
G["You seem like a sensible $c, friend. Do you remember the glory days of Theramore, back before Jaina made us give up the fight against the Horde? Are you sick of being told to stay your blade while the orcs continue to provoke us?"]="朋友，你看上去是位通情达理的$c。你可曾记得塞拉摩昔日的光辉岁月？那是吉安娜禁止我们与部落交战之前的事情了。兽人仍在频频挑衅，而我们却被告知不得挑起战乱，你是否对此感到厌倦？"
G["You seem prepared."]="Parece que estás $gpreparado:preparada;."
G["You seem tired."]="你似乎很累了。"
G["You seem to have bested my guards. No matter, they were of little use anyway. Time to die! [PH]"]="Parece que has derrotado a mis guardias. Da igual, no me eran muy útiles. ¡Hora de morir!"
G["You seem to have gained a companion. You should bring him back to Donnelly."]="你似乎是有了一名同伴。你应该带他回东尼利那里去。"
G["You seem to me to be one who has had many experiences."]="我觉得你这个人饱经沧桑。"
G["You seem very certain."]="你看起来很笃定。"
G["You seem willing to clean up your mess, outsider. Maybe we can help each other."]="Pareces $gdispuesto:dispuesta; a enmendar tus errores, $gforastero:forastera;. A lo mejor podemos ayudarnos mutuamente."
G["You sense that you are being followed..."]="你感觉到你被跟踪了……"
G["You serve the Banshee Queen now, mortal."]="你现在效忠于女妖之王了，凡人。"
G["You served your purpose."]="你已经体现了自己的价值。"
G["You set one foot in Orgrimmar, Hellscream gonna bury a knife in ya neck!"]="只要你一踏进奥格瑞玛，地狱咆哮就会割断你的脖子！"
G["You shall annoy me no longer!"]="别想再给我找麻烦！"
G["You shall be consumed by flame!"]="¡Serás $gconsumido:consumida; por la llama!"
G["You shall experience my torment first hand!"]="你将要经历我曾经历过的一切！"
G["You shall face off against the true visages of wisdom, strength, fortitude, and hope - the children of the Celestials themselves!  Be warned, they have power and abilities the likes of which have not been seen for generations."]="你将要面对智慧、力量、坚毅与希望的真正化身——至尊天神的后裔！请多加小心，他们拥有着失传已久的强大力量和神秘技巧。"
G["You shall have it as soon as the crate is in my possession. I'm sure your colleagues will find it most enlightening."]="一旦我拿到箱子，你就能拿到你想要的东西。你的同事一定会茅塞顿开的，我确信。"
G["You shall have your reinforcements, Battlemaiden. I had already intended to collect Kvaldir to labor in Nespirah, so your timing is opportune."]="你会有援军的，女武士。我已经打算集结克瓦迪尔人去奈瑟匹拉工作了，所以你的时机刚刚好。"
G["You shall not contaminate the investigation site."]="不要污染调查现场。"
G["You shall not disrupt this portal!"]="你休想破坏传送门！"
G["You shall not enjoy this release."]="所谓自由，意味着更多的痛苦。"
G["You shall not escape."]="想逃？门儿都没有。"
G["You shall not have him!"]="你不会得逞的！"
G["You shall not pass!"]="你不得通过！"
G["You shall not pass, mon!"]="休想过去！"
G["You shall not stand in our way!"]="你休想阻挡我们！"
G["You shall pay for this treachery!"]="你们要为背叛付出代价！"
G["You shall pay for what what you've done to my minnows, fool!"]="你对我的小鱼都做了些什么？！你要付出代价，傻瓜！"
G["You shall regret disturbing my homeland!"]="你会后悔侵扰我的家园！"
G["You shall serve as a lesson to the others."]="Serás un ejemplo para los demás."
G["You shall sssserve the Lady for the resst of your daysss!"]="你在今后的日子里都要效忠夫人！"
G["You shall suffer eternally if you fail!"]="失败者会尝尽人间的痛苦！"
G["You shall vitness zhe destruction of zhat vhich you hold so dear!"]="你应该亲眼见证你所珍爱的东西被彻底摧毁！"
G["You should all know, the orcs have a battle cry: LOK'TAR OGAR! It means \"victory or death.\" Fitting..."]="Deberíais saber que los orcos tienen un grito de guerra: ¡LOK'TAR OGAR! Significa \"victoria o muerte\". Apropiado, ¿no?"
G["You should always carry a Spirit-Kissed Water, friend. Without it, we tend to... nod off."]="你应该总是随身携带一瓶灵吻之水，朋友。否则，我们……就会……打瞌睡。"
G["You should always check behind waterfalls for caves."]="见到瀑布你就应该去看看它后面有没有洞穴。"
G["You should be asking \"Is that rogue behind me going to kill me?\""]="你应该问“我背后那个盗贼是不是要杀了我？”"
G["You should be honored to be doing Lady Vashj's bidding."]="能为瓦丝琪大人效劳，你应该感到荣幸。"
G["You should be sticking close to Arthas right now!"]="你应该紧跟着阿尔萨斯！"
G["You should be used to those looks, Tatai. Do you remember the reason you were drafted into this job?"]="塔泰，你应该早就习惯了。你还记得你被派来做这份工作的原因吗？"
G["You should bow to no king or warchief."]="不要向任何国王或酋长低头。"
G["You should consider losing some weight."]="你该考虑减减肥了。"
G["You should consider yourself lucky to be doin' the Boss-Lady's chores!"]="能为女工头干活，你应该感到荣幸！"
G["You should dance for my floot toot!"]="跟着我的笛声跳起来吧！"
G["You should do well to consider where your loyalties lie, $r."]="你应该好好考虑一下该效忠谁，$r。"
G["You should fear de loa."]="你应该敬畏神灵。"
G["You should feel honored. You are the first of the master's prospects to be shown our operation."]="你应该感到荣幸。主人要我们向你展示沃尔塔鲁斯的工事，这还是头一遭。"
G["You should give beautiful flowers to beautiful ladies. Like me."]="你应该把漂亮的花送给漂亮的女士，比如我。"
G["You should go let chickens out again and say Goregek did it. Never get old."]="你应该把鸡们都放出来，然后说是格利基克干的。这招屡试不爽。"
G["You should have accepted your defeat."]="你应该接受你的失败。"
G["You should have been disposed of a long time ago."]="你早就该被处理掉了。"
G["You should have come better prepared!"]="你真应该做好准备再来这里！"
G["You should have left this city to the waves."]="你们该把这座城市还给波涛。"
G["You should have left when you had the chance."]="你们早该逃走的。"
G["You should have run, dog."]="夹着尾巴逃跑吧，狗东西。"
G["You should have seen the mantid empire in my day, Wakener. Our vesses stretched as far as the eye could see."]="你真该看看我那个时候的螳螂帝国，唤醒者。我们的领土一直延伸到视线的尽头。"
G["You should have stayed home."]="你该在家里待着。"
G["You should have stayed in the Dread Wastes."]="你们应该待在恐惧废土。"
G["You should have taken the hint when we destroyed your precipice, cultist."]="我们毁掉你们的要塞时，你们就该接受警告的，异教徒。"
G["You should have trained harder."]="你训练得太糟糕了。"
G["You should have your pet wait for you here. Beware the Blackrock Worg Captain! |TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_NATURE_TIMESTOP.BLP:24|t"]="你应该让宠物等在这里。小心黑石狼骑首领！|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_NATURE_TIMESTOP.BLP:24|t"
G["You should hear the stories they tell of you in Stoneplow."]="你真该听听他们是怎么说你在石犁村的事迹的。"
G["You should help Mei.\n\nKen-Ken trying to think of way to cheer up these super-sads."]="你应该帮帮明。\n\n肯肯在想办法鼓舞这些超级悲伤的家伙。"
G["You should help next time, slave thing. Don't leave all work to Goregek."]="下次你也要帮忙啊，奴隶。不能把所有的活儿都丢给格利基克。"
G["You should join our family, preserved forever in jade."]="你应该被变成玉雕，永远加入我们的大家庭。"
G["You should keep that crossbow, Ku-Mo."]="你可以留着这把十字弓，莫苦。"
G["You should leave."]="你快走吧。"
G["You should never have come here!"]="你根本不该来这儿！"
G["You should never have left the Dread Wastes, mantid."]="你真不该离开恐惧废土，螳螂妖。"
G["You should not be here! Slay them!"]="你们不该来这里！杀了他们！"
G["You should not have come here!"]="你不该来这儿！"
G["You should not have come...."]="你不该来这里……"
G["You should not have interfered!"]="你不应该插手的。"
G["You should not have interfered..."]="你们不应该插手的……"
G["You should only see this once."]="你只有这一次亲眼目睹的机会。"
G["You should paint me sometime, Sudsy."]="萨德希，我真想让你给我画幅像。"
G["You should queue up for a brawl.  I could use a good laugh."]="你应该排队参加搏击——这样我就能笑上好一阵了。"
G["You should really be more careful..."]="你真该小心点儿……"
G["You should receive a pack of incendiary bombs from Erozion before I fly you to Durnholde. You wouldn't want to waste time, after all."]="在我带你飞往敦霍尔德之前，你要先从伊洛希恩那儿搞一包燃烧弹。不要浪费时间。"
G["You should return to Orgrimmar. Your family is worried."]="你应该回奥格瑞玛去。你的家人都很担心。"
G["You should return to Warsong Hold now, friend. Hellscream will surely want to hear of what just happened here... of Saurfang..."]="朋友，你应该立即返回战歌要塞。地狱咆哮一定很想知道……关于萨鲁法尔的故事。"
G["You should split while you can."]="你们应该趁早逃走的。"
G["You should stay away from walrus-men. They could pup-nap you."]="你得离海象人远点。他们会弄痛你。"
G["You should take a look at these readings, they are unlike anything we've seen before."]="你应该看看这些读数，跟我们曾经见过的大不相同。"
G["You should talk to Winstone. I hear he's looking for thieves with your skill."]="你该与温斯顿谈谈。我听说他在寻找一个与你有相同技能的潜行者。"
G["You should try the springpaw appetizers, they're to die for!"]="你应该尝尝魔泉美味，简直太棒了！"
G["You should try using my stallion's stomp ability.  Her powerful hooves will cleave the ground itself, stunning any nearby dragons."]="你应该使用我的坐骑的蹬踏能力。她强有力的蹄子能够踏碎大地，也能把附近的龙全部震晕。"
G["You should use your wand when you get low on mana! You DO have a wand, right?"]="在法力值不足时，你就应该用魔杖！你有魔杖吧？"
G["You should... you should send thish shtuff over to Petrov for his bombs!"]="嗯……你应该把这玩意儿送给派特洛夫制作炸弹！"
G["You shouldn't have come here."]="你不该来这儿。"
G["You shouldn't have come... now you will die!"]="你不该来这里……现在你就要死了！"
G["You shouldn't have done that!  He's not going to like it."]="你不该那么做的！他不喜欢那样。"
G["You shouldn't have!"]="你可以不用这样的！"
G["You shouldn't have! But I'm glad you did."]="你可以不用这样的！但是我很高兴你这么做了。"
G["You shouldn't have, $c. I thank you."]="不用了，$c。是我应该谢谢你才对。"
G["You show much promise, $n, but you must nurture your talent with discipline."]="你表现出了极大的潜力，$n，但你必须依靠戒律来磨砺你的天赋。"
G["You show some nerve coming to Teldrassil, Highborne. Your kind are unwelcome here. We have not forgotten the War of the Ancients or the minds behind it."]="敢来泰达希尔证明你还有些许勇气，上层精灵。但这里不欢迎你。上古之战的伤痛和那些战争背后的企图让我们铭心刻骨。"
G["You show some worth after all. Lysta summon a surprise for our young recruits."]="你们证明了自己的能力。看来利斯塔为我们带来了一些惊喜。"
G["You show wisdom beyond your years, $c.  Thank you. You can find our battlemaster, Lylandris, standing at the war table in the Hall of Arms. She can assist you in traveling to Warsong Gulch."]="你显示出与你的年龄不相符的智慧，$c。谢谢你。你可以在武器大厅找到军官莱兰迪斯，她能帮助你前往战歌峡谷。"
G["You show wisdom beyond your years, $c. Thank you. You can find our battlemaster, Lylandris, standing at the war table in the Hall of Arms. She can assist you in traveling to Warsong Gulch."]="你显示出与你的年龄不相符的智慧，$c。谢谢你。你可以在武器大厅找到军官莱兰迪斯，她能帮助你前往战歌峡谷。"
G["You showed great courage, $p. The Shado-Pan thanks you."]="你很勇敢，$p。影踪派感谢你。"
G["You shut up!"]="你给我闭嘴！"
G["You sign charter! Is good!"]="你签文件！太好了！"
G["You silly dwarf, he mind controlled you! Now he's gone!"]="愚蠢的矮子，他用了精神控制！现在他跑了！"
G["You sleep like a rock!"]="你睡得像块石头！"
G["You slew the most foes during this battle!"]="你是这一战中杀敌最多的人！"
G["You smell of a defeat in your near future."]="闻起来，你似乎马上就要输了。"
G["You smell of loot."]="你身上有股战利品的气味。"
G["You smell of the low lands. You should go back to them. There is no peace in these mountains for travelers."]="你身上有山下人的气味，你应该回到他们那里去。这些山里没有你们旅行者想要找的平静。"
G["You smell somethin'?"]="你闻到什么了吗？"
G["You smell worse than a sulfur mine filled with unwashed yaks."]="你比沾满了硫磺矿没洗的牦牛还要难闻。"
G["You smelly hozun!"]="你这臭猢狲！"
G["You sneaky panda girl! Come back to Jooga!"]="狡猾的熊猫人女孩！回到尤噶身边！"
G["You so little and puny... you no make good servants for Kormok!"]="你们这群渺小可怜的家伙……连给库尔莫克提鞋都不配！"
G["You so smart. Let's do dis now before more come."]="你真聪明。让我们在情况变糟之前把这事情搞定。"
G["You son of a..."]="你这个……"
G["You sorry sacks of maggot flesh can do better than that, now prove it!"]="你们最好现在就能证明自己不是个废物！"
G["You sound a little too confident.  Especially considering the way our last encounter ended."]="你似乎过于自信了。你不如想想上次我们交手的结果。"
G["You sound very confident, your Majesty.  I seriously hope you do not plan to use the Plague.  Garrosh has explicitly forbidden it."]="听起来你很有信心，女王陛下。希望你没有使用伤害性魔法计划。加尔鲁什已严禁使用它。"
G["You spar like a girl!"]="瞧你这花拳秀腿的！"
G["You spare parts!  We make more Scourge in necropolis."]="你是来贡献憎恶零件的吧。有了你的尸体，浮空城里就能组出更多憎恶啦！"
G["You speak in the past tense. What happened to her?"]="你为什么用过去式讲话？她发生了什么事？"
G["You speak of her as friend? You are a fool. This \"Dark Lady\" is not Sylvanas."]="¿La consideras una amiga? Idiota. Esa \"\"Dama Oscura\"\" no es Sylvanas."
G["You speak of hope. Believe me, the thinnest sliver of belief that we might somehow survive the coming devastation is all that sustains me."]="你就是希望的化身。相信我，正是那一点点熬过灭顶之灾的微小希望在支撑着我。"
G["You speak only in terms of one's enemies."]="这只是对于敌人一方而言。"
G["You speak the truth."]="你说对了。"
G["You speak, but doubt your own words."]="这句话连你自己都不相信。"
G["You spit on mercy?  Then you will have NONE.  You want carnage?!  Garrosh will get more blood than EVER he bargained for!"]="对怜悯吐口水？那你就得不到怜悯了。你想要杀戮？那就让加尔鲁什给你收尸吧。"
G["You spoiled my grand entrance, rat."]="你搞砸了我的盛大登场，鼠辈。"
G["You spoke of communing with Thrall?  Did I miss it?"]="你说你和萨尔说过话？我听错了吗？"
G["You spot a stain on the deck!"]="你在甲板上发现了一个污点！"
end)(AscensionCN.GossipEN2ES)
;(function(G)
G["You ssserve or you die, sssoftsskin!"]="不听话就得死，弱者！"
G["You stand alone against the might of the swarm, a single light in a sea of darkness."]="你独自面对强大的虫群，如同黑暗之海中的一线光明。"
