G["You stand before your death."]="你死到临头了。"
G["You stand here trying to convince me that these beings of flesh should be trusted."]="你正在尝试说服我，这些血肉之躯应该得到我的信任。"
G["You stand no chance against me!"]="在我面前你们毫无机会！"
G["You stand no chance against the might of Pyth."]="你在匹兹的力量面前毫无机会。"
G["You stand no chance!"]="你没有任何机会！"
G["You stand no chance."]="你没机会的。"
G["You stand no chance. You are but an insect to Fjoll."]="你毫无机会。弗琼看你就像看一只臭虫。"
G["You stand tall and proud atop your accomplishments, and this will be your downfall."]="你们高高在上，居功自傲，它会让你们走向灭亡。"
G["You stare blindly into the abyss!"]="你们还不知道自己正在注视着无尽的深渊吗！"
G["You stay away from crystals! Die now!"]="离水晶远点！死吧！"
G["You stay back!  Da troll is mine!"]="你待在后面！那巨魔是我的！"
G["You stay close, $r. And don't let elfs near me!"]="别离开我，$r。别让精灵靠近我！"
G["You stay dead."]="你就在这儿躺尸好了。"
G["You stay here.  Me go kill someone else!"]="你留在这里，我去杀别人！"
G["You stay out of the regent lord's way! I mean it!"]="不要挡着摄政王的路！我说真的！"
G["You sticking around for a while? We should drink."]="你会在这儿逗留一阵子？我们该喝一杯。"
G["You still have lessons to learn before I may begin your training. In the meantime, perhaps Vhan, in Thunder Bluff can help you."]="在我开始培训你之前你还有功课要学。而在同时，或许雷霆崖的范恩能够帮你。"
G["You still have lot of learning... most important, protect Dajik!"]="你还有很多东西要学……最重要的一点，就是保护达伊克！"
G["You still have much to prove.  But you brought the stone.  That is an excellent start."]="你有许多需要证明的事情。但看样子，你已经带来了那块石头。这是个好的开始。"
G["You still think victory possible? Fools!"]="你们觉得还有胜利的希望？愚蠢！"
G["You stink of bad fortune."]="你浑身散发着霉运的味道。"
G["You stink.  Take a shower."]="你真臭。去洗个澡吧。"
G["You stinking curs had better enjoy the taste of my whip!"]="你们这些卑劣的杂种最好尝尝我鞭子的滋味！"
G["You stone troggs have no idea of what's coming!"]="你们这群石头穴居人根本不知道将要到来的是什么！"
G["You stood in the fire!"]="葬身于火海中！"
G["You stood no chance!"]="你毫无半点机会！"
G["You stop killing now!  Lunk doesn't like!"]="不要再杀了！隆克不喜欢！"
G["You strong! Yay... you keep us safe!"]="你很强！呀……你能保护我们！"
G["You strongest looking $c Chee Chee has ever seen!"]="¡Makaku es $gel:la; $c más fuerte ke Chee Chee ha visto jamás!"
G["You stumble about in darkness. There is no light here. No mercy! Icecrown has claimed the souls of better heroes than you."]="你只能在黑暗中踌躇。那里没有光明，也没有怜悯！冰冠堡垒吞噬过比你更加强大的灵魂。"
G["You stupid mongrels!  I ought to whip you all to death!"]="你们这群愚蠢的杂种！我真该用鞭子把你们全都抽死！"
G["You suffer in silence for a people who give little thanks."]="你默默地为一群不知感激的人承受着痛苦。"
G["You supplied the crew with disguises?"]="探险队使用的伪装都准备好了吗？"
G["You sure 'bout that, $n? Wow, thank you!"]="你确定，$n？哇，谢谢你！"
G["You sure know how to make a pandaren happy. Thanks."]="你的确知道怎么让一个熊猫人开心。谢谢。"
G["You sure know how to season a gal's pan! Thanks!"]="你当然知道如何讨女孩喜欢！谢谢！"
G["You sure picked an interesting time to chat with Ol' Kebok."]="你可真是挑了个有趣的时机来和老科博克聊天啊。"
G["You sure we be goin' da right way, mon?"]="朋友，你确信我们没走错路？"
G["You sure we're goin' the right way, neighbor?"]="你确定我们没走错吧，邻居？"
G["You sure you're ready?  Take a moment."]="¿Seguro que estás $glisto:lista;? Piénsatelo bien."
G["You sure? I hear it happens to everyone at some point."]="你确定？我听说每个人都或多或少碰到过这样的事。"
G["You surely wouldn't destroy humanity's only chance to redeem its most wayward son.  You'd sooner die!"]="你想要“挽救”我这个任性的孩子，不愿意放弃人道救赎的唯一机会，因此你只会死得更快！"
G["You surprised me. I expected a hero such as yourself to balk at the task of carrying an old man up a mountain. Most are too proud."]="你令我吃惊。我以为你这样的英雄会对扶老人上山的任务不屑一顾。他们就是太骄傲。"
G["You surrendered.  I win."]="你投降了。我赢了。"
G["You survive the mountain pass only to die here!"]="你在崎岖的山路中都幸存了下来，没想到却死在了这里！"
G["You survived the attack!\nRocknut Unlocked!"]="你承受住了攻击！\n岩石坚果已解锁！"
G["You swore the Shado-Pan blood oath together, did you not? You are bound together by powers far stronger than hatred."]="你们曾立下过影踪派的血誓，不是吗？比仇恨更强大的力量会将你们团结在一起。"
G["You take a group of miserable bandits, make them part of somezhink historical, and zhis is vhat you get?"]="带了这么一群蹩脚的强盗来，你能得到什么？他们只不过是历史笑柄！"
G["You take a moment to silently remember when you used this lifeboat to defeat Negolash.  Those were the good days."]="你用片刻时间默默怀念用这艘救生船击败奈古拉什的事。那可真是段美好的日子。"
G["You take a wrong turn, mon? Heh heh heh.\nWhat can I be helpin' ya find?"]="¿Has toma'o el desvío equivoca'o, ¿eh, colega?\n\n¿En qué pue'o ayudah'te?"
G["You take care of yourself! I'm gettin' out o' here."]="你照顾好你自己！我要离开这儿了。"
G["You take down Ook-Ook..."]="你打倒了乌克乌克……"
G["You take dwarf's things.  No need to kill."]="拿到矮人的东西就行。不需要杀掉他们。"
G["You take my heart, now I take yours!"]="你夺走了我的东西，我也要来拿你的！"
G["You take my orange?! What a slap in face!"]="你拿了我的橘子？！你这是当面挑衅！"
G["You take them out. I'll hide in the shadows and search their bodies."]="你去把他们弄出来。我会躲在暗影中搜寻他们。"
G["You take this pretty seriously, don't you?"]="你也太认真了一点吧？"
G["You talk to Undertaker Mordo.  He'll tell you what to do.  That's all I know."]="你去问送葬者摩尔多。他会告诉你该怎么做。我知道的就这么多。"
G["You taste good with maybe a little salt and pepper."]="再加点盐和胡椒你就更美味了。"
G["You tell Dizzywig that I'm open to negotiations...."]="你告诉迪兹维格，我愿意开启谈判……"
G["You tell an incredible tale, Fairbanks. What of the blade? Is it beyond redemption?"]="你的故事实在是令人难以置信，法尔班克斯？那把剑后来怎样了？已经无法拯救了吗？"
G["You tell him."]="你告诉他。"
G["You tell us when it home time."]="等你做好准备，我们就启程回家吧。"
G["You test my faith."]="你在挑战我的信仰。"
G["You test my patience, you now see the true might of the Blue."]="你在考验我的耐心，现在就让你见识一下蓝龙的真正力量。"
G["You the Ook!"]="你可真棒！"
G["You there - $n! Help us defend this square."]="$n，你在这里！请帮助我们守卫这个广场。"
G["You there!  Go check to make sure they're doing their jobs!"]="你！去监督那些家伙的工作！"
G["You there!  Keep a close watch on these ramparts, intruders could approach at any time!"]="你！密切留意城墙上的一举一动，入侵者随时可能来犯！"
G["You there!  Make yourselves useful and deal with these summoners!"]="说你呢！别光站着不动，解决掉这些召唤者！"
G["You there!  What do you think you're doing?!"]="喂，说你呢！你知道自己在干什么吗？！"
G["You there!  Yes you!  You look thirsty.  Get over here, I have just what you need!"]="你！就是你！你看起来很口渴。来吧，我有你想要的东西！"
G["You there!  You look able bodied... we need your aid in defending Southshore!\n\nThe blasted Forsaken are all riled up because it's Hallow's End.  Their \"celebration\" will no doubt be leading them right to our doorstep.  If you've got the time, we really could use your help!"]="¡Eh, tú! Pareces fuerte... ¡Necesitamos tu ayuda para defender Costasur!\n\nLos malditos Renegados están todos emocionados porque es Halloween. Su \"celebración\" los traerá sin duda hasta nuestras fronteras. Si tienes tiempo, ¡tu ayuda nos vendría de perlas!"
G["You there! $C! These men are dying! I need your assistance!"]="嗨！$C！这些人快死啦！我需要你的帮助！"
G["You there! Be you friend or foe?"]="¡Eh, tú! ¿Eres $gamigo:amiga; o $genemigo:enemiga;?"
G["You there! Check out that noise!"]="你们几个！去看看那边是怎么回事！"
G["You there! Come and try some Greenstone Brew!"]="你！过来尝尝我的绿石佳酿吧！"
G["You there! Have your senses abandoned you?"]="那个家伙！你失去理智了吗？"
G["You there! Hiding like a coward when you should be fighting these devils?"]="你在这里！对抗邪恶的战斗正在进行，而你却像懦夫一样躲在这里？"
G["You there! In the rafters! My sacred library has become possessed by the Sha!"]="说你呢！在椽子那儿的！煞魔侵占了我神圣的藏书阁！"
G["You there! Step forward!"]="你！到前面来！"
G["You there! We need able bodies as fast as possible. Lives depend on it!"]="就是你！我们急需有能力的人。许多人的生命都在等待你去拯救！"
G["You there! Why are you not fighting? Kill these Scourge horrors before they do more damage to Orgrimmar!"]="你！为什么不参与战斗？杀死那些天灾士兵，否则他们会给奥格瑞玛带来更大的损失！"
G["You there! Yes, you, peasant $g boy:girl;. Come quickly, I must tell you something... I must tell you about my greatness, lest such things are lost in the void!"]="嘿！叫你呢，你这个没礼貌的$g小伙子:小姑娘;。快过来，我得告诉你一些事情……让我跟你讲讲关于我的伟大事迹，不然人们都快将我的丰功伟绩忘得一干二净了！"
G["You there, $r! I beg of you, set us free."]="嘿，$r！求求你们，放我们出去。"
G["You there, fetch water quickly! Get these flames out before they spread to the rest of the keep! Hurry, damn you!"]="你们！赶快去打水！在火势蔓延起来之前扑灭它！快一点，你们这些该死的东西！"
G["You there, have you filled your quota of lumber and elf ears today?!"]="嗨，你完成今天的木材和精灵徽记定额了吗？"
G["You there, stop slacking!"]="你，就是你，别偷懒！"
G["You there. You're welcome to take the contents of my cauldron. It was to be the second stage of my plan - amorous clothing."]="嘿，欢迎你来闻闻我制造的香水。我的计划要进行下一步，漂亮的衣服！"
G["You there... it is in your best interest to aid the Forsaken during these dire times.  Listen closely, as I dislike repeating myself.\n\nWe currently find ourselves in a dire shortage of cloth.  Bandages and simple textiles are running low, and donations are being accepted to bolster sagging inventories.  While you'll not receive financial compensation - hence what donation means - your aid will not go unnoticed."]="你……现在是你帮助被遗忘者最好的时机。好好听着，我不喜欢重复我说过的话。\n\n我们现在极度缺乏布料。绷带和任何布料储存量都很低，我们希望接受捐赠来补充库存。你的捐赠不会有任何经济补偿——这就是捐赠的含义——你的捐赠一定会为我们所赏识。"
G["You think I do not know what you are trying to do? You think I haven't been watching you?"]="你以为我不知道你想干什么吗？你以为我没有在观察着你的一举一动吗？"
G["You think I know where Dalaran is, $Gbuddy:lady;? I can't even find my own tail! Sometimes it's there, sometimes it isn't.\n\nYou know what I heard though, $n?\n\nDook's got real since last time.\n\nI heard you went to Darnassus and got the Divine Bell.\n\nBut some human lady... Jana or somethin'... she got real mad!\n\nShe says the Horde betrayed her trust or something'... and she's kickin' all your people out of her city!\n\nOrc general Nazgrim say we need to help them vacuum... vacuate... err... evocate... err... get the ook out!"]="¿Tú kree que yo sabe dónde está Dalaran, makaku? ¡Yo no enkuentra mi propia kola! A veces está ahí, otras veces no.\n\n¿Tú sabe lo ke yo ha oído, $n?\n\n¡Ké fuerte lo ke ha pasado!\n\nYo oye ke tú va a Darnassus y koge la kampana divina.\n\nPero una humana, Jana o algo así, ¡se enfada mucho!\n\nDice que la Horda la traiciona, o algo así... ¡y ha echado a tu gente de su ciudad!\n\nGeneral orko Nazgrim dice ke nosotros tiene ke ayudarles a abogar... evokar... evaluar... eh... ¡salir korriendo!"
G["You think I should have gone with the buzzsaw instead?"]="你觉得我应该用圆锯吗？"
G["You think I'm being cruel to this worm?\n\nThey've killed two of my men this month!  We're too kind to this Wretched scum."]="你认为我对这些家伙太残忍了是吗？\n\n这个月他们已经杀死了我的两名手下！我们对这些家伙太仁慈了。"
G["You think I'm scared of you? I faced Onyxia!"]="你以为我会怕你？我面对过奥妮克希亚！"
G["You think I've gone too far? There is no such thing. The Black Harvest will enslave the most powerful demons, draw on their power, and destroy all who oppose us, in this world, and on Azeroth! Do YOU mean to stop me, little one?"]="你觉得我走火入魔了？没有这回事。黑暗收割议会将奴役最强大的恶魔，抽取他们的力量，并摧毁一切反抗者，无论是在这个世界，还是在艾泽拉斯！你真的想阻止我吗，小家伙？"
G["You think after doing such good work on Stormwind Harbor I'd get a bit of slack from this dwarf...\n\nI just want to get this statue up the ramp and back in place as fast as possible.  But she's got a complaint every step of the way.  Her solution to every problem is to blow it up.  It feels like I'm working with a gnome or a goblin.  But at least they'd be sober.\n\nLook at our work crew, no discipline.  You know why?  Because she undermines me!\n\nA bad attitude, a lazy crew... This isn't going to be a quick fix at all."]="按理说，既然我在暴风城港口做了这么多漂亮的工作，这个矮人总应该能对我有一点尊敬了……\n\n我只是想让这尊雕像沿斜坡而上，尽快复位。但她对于工作的每一步都抱怨个不停。实际上，她对每一个问题的解决办法都只有爆炸。我觉得她简直就是个侏儒或者地精。至少侏儒和地精还要比她更淡定一些。\n\n看看我们的工作队伍，简直一点纪律都没有。你知道是为什么？全都是因为她在捣乱！\n\n糟糕的态度，懒惰的工人……这样下去，工作根本没办法迅速完成。"
G["You think it is so easy to vanquish your fears?"]="你以为这么容易就能战胜内心的恐惧吗？"
G["You think maybe one day, Kekek lead Frenzyheart home, like bear-men fight to get tree-city back? Kekek want own home, not city with purple men, not jungle with big-tongues."]="你相信总有一天，科科会带领狂心氏族回家，就像熊人赢得最终的胜利夺回树城那样。科科想要自己的家，而不是遍布紫人的城市，更不是大舌头怪出没的丛林。"
G["You think me to be mad, do you? Yes... yes, perhaps a little.\n\nYou see, even after eight hundred and seventy-seven years of quietude, the desire to breathe does not go away.\n\nPerhaps something went wrong with my encasement. Perhaps it was my... preternaturally keen intellect. Whatever the cause, I was fully aware of the passage of time during my years in the amber.\n\nAfter seventy-eight years, I stopped trying to escape. I kept my mind sharp by creating and solving puzzles. The amber took care of the rest of my body.\n\nBut my sanity? No, I cannot say with good confidence that it survived intact."]="你认为我疯了，对吧？是……是的，也许有一点儿。\n\n如你所见，即便是在沉寂了八百七十七年之后，渴望呼吸的欲望仍然挥之不去。\n\n或许是我的包裹体出了什么问题，或许只是因为我有着……超乎常人的敏锐感知力。不管是什么原因，在被封存于琥珀中的悠长岁月里，我完全能感觉到时间的流逝。\n\n在挣扎了七十八年后，我放下了逃离的念头。我不断地自创和解答谜题，以免让自己变得头脑迟钝。身体就交给琥珀保养了。\n\n至于我的理智？不，我可不敢保证它还健全。"
G["You think ookin' is nasty word? You ain't ikkin' know anything."]="你觉得“该死的”是脏话？你伊克的什么都不知道。"
G["You think that was bad? You shoulda been here, oh, thirty years ago, I'd say.\n\nOne o' the boys left his lunch out - some kind of fish stew, if mem'ry serves.\n\nWell he leaves it out in the atrium - BIG ol' pot o' fish stew, I'm sure of it now - and, cub's honor, every hozen within a hundred miles come a-runnin'.\n\nAfter cleanin' THAT up, I'll take some overgrown nibblers any day..."]="你觉得那就算糟的了？我得说，你要是见过30年前那场灾难就不会这么想了。\n\n以前有个小伙子将他的午餐放在了外面——是某种鱼汤，如果我没记错的话。\n\n他把那锅炖汤放在中庭那里了——一大锅热气腾腾的鱼肉炖汤，没错，我现在记起来了——然后，我的老天，方圆百里之内所有猢狲都涌过来了。\n\n经历过那事之后，我已经不把几只发育过度的利齿蛛放在眼里了……"
G["You think that you can get rid of me through meditation?"]="你以为冥想能帮助你洗涤内心的杂念吗？"
G["You think that you're $g man : woman; enough to take the depleted item from me?"]="¿Crees que eres lo suficientemente $ghombre:mujer; para arrebatarme el objeto reducido?"
G["You think that you've won? THINK AGAIN! Stand before my new form and tremble!"]="你以为你赢了？再想想吧！在我全新的形态面前战栗吧！"
G["You think the jinyu built this place?"]="你说这地方是锦鱼人造的吗？"
G["You think these bars can hold me? HAH!"]="你以为这些东西能困住我？哈！"
G["You think these grow on trees?"]="你认为这些是长在树上的？"
G["You think they learn to keep Goregek away from chickens."]="你觉得他们会吸取教训，不许格利基克靠近鸡舍？"
G["You think they'll get better?"]="你觉得他们会变强？"
G["You think to entrap me!?"]="你妄想困住我！？"
G["You think to outrun the wind? A fatal mistake."]="你以为能跑得比风还快？你犯了致命的错误。"
G["You think to take my primal essence? Come, let us see if you are hard as stone and ice!"]="你想夺走我的原始精华？来吧，让我瞧瞧你是否像冻石那般坚硬！"
G["You think we can believe him, Commander?"]="长官，你觉得我们能相信他？"
G["You think we scared of dragon thing? Not so much!"]="你以为我们会害怕龙吗？不会！"
G["You think you are good enough to learn from us?  You will pay for your insolence!"]="¿Crees que eres $gdigno:digna; de aprender de nosotros? ¡Pagarás por tu insolencia!"
G["You think you are ready to become a champion.  We shall see."]="Crees que estás preparad$go:a; para convertirte en Campe$gón:ona;. Ya veremos."
G["You think you can best Lorenth Thundercall? Stand still, silly gnat, so that I can swat you."]="你以为你能打败洛伦瑟·唤雷吗？站稳了，蠢货，看我把你拍死。"
G["You think you can challenge me, little $r?"]="¿Crees que puedes desafiarme, $gpequeño:pequeña; $r?"
G["You think you can play with my lightning?"]="你们自以为能戏弄我的闪电吗？"
G["You think you can summon us? We are the ones that summon, not you! We bash you good for this and suck the marrow from your bones!"]="你觉着你可以召唤我们吗？我们才是召唤者，不是你！看我们把你锤扁，再打碎你的骨头！"
G["You think you can take me down in a pet battle?  Step right up and let's find out!"]="你以为自己能在一场宠物大战里打败我？走上前来，试试身手吧！"
G["You think you can wrest this rampart from my control?"]="你以为自己能从我手里夺得这座壁垒的控制权吗？"
G["You think you have WON?  You are BLIND.  I WILL FORCE YOUR EYES OPEN."]="别以为你们已经赢了，你们这些瞎子。睁大眼睛好好看看！"
G["You think you have what it takes to destroy The League of Arathor, $c?  I hope so.  What is it that you want, or are you simply here to waste my time?"]="你认为你能摧毁阿拉索联军吗，$c？希望如此。你究竟是想要干些什么呢，还是根本就是来浪费我的时间的？"
G["You think you have what it takes?"]="你觉得自己够格吗？"
G["You think you have won? We are orcs! Pure of blood, commanded by the greatest Warchief who ever lived! Your blood will fill this bay!"]="你们自以为能赢？我们是兽人！是史上最伟大的酋长领导下的纯血兽人！你们的鲜血将染红这片海湾！"
G["You think you just walk up to me and I start teaching you? Ha! You need to pay your dues like everyone else!"]="你认为你走到我跟前我就开始教你了？哈！你需要像其余所有人一样支付学费！"
G["You think you know savagry?!"]="你自以为很勇敢？！"
G["You think you see a shadowy figure out of the corner of your eye."]="你从眼角瞥到一个影子。"
G["You think you stand a chance? I think not!"]="你以为自己有机会？我可不这么想！"
G["You think you'll just march into MY city?"]="你自以为能闯进我的城市？"
G["You think you're all brave facing me, eh, Steelsparks?! Those pig tails won't protect you from THE DOOMSAW!"]="你以为你们都能勇敢面对我，是吗，钢烁？！那些猪尾巴阻挡不了魔锯的力量！"
G["You think you're clever, don't you, ganging up on me like this... well, prepare to face: THE DREADSHREDDER!"]="你们自以为很聪明，是不是，像这样联手对付我……好吧，准备面对——恐怖伐木机！"
G["You think you're smart enough? You think you got what it takes? Let's find out!"]="你认为你很聪明吗？你认为你得到了吗？让我们查明真相！"
G["You think you're such a bigshot, saving everyone and making friends with these orc savages?!"]="你以为你是个超级英雄，能拯救所有人，还能和那些野蛮的兽人交朋友？"
G["You think you've won already? Perhaps you'll need another lesson in pain!"]="你以为你赢了？可能你需要另一堂痛苦的课程！"
G["You think you've won, but the forces of Twilight will triumph in the end!"]="你以为你已经赢了，但暮光的力量才能取得最终胜利！"
G["You think you've won, mortal? Face the unbridled power of Antiok!"]="你以为自己嬴了，是吗？尝尝安提沃克的怒火吧！"
G["You think you've won?"]="你认为你嬴了？"
G["You thirst for blood!"]="你嗜血成性！"
G["You thought I would just let you kill me?"]="你们觉得我会甘心等死吗？"
G["You thought those long arms gave you an advantage, $r? Think again!"]="$r，你以为这些长胳膊能让你占据优势？再想想吧！"
G["You thought to fight me alone? The earth splits to swallow and crush you."]="你们以为对手只有我？碎裂的大地会摧垮你。"
G["You thought to kill me, puny human? This tiny goblin has more courage than your pathetic race!"]="你想过要杀我，小人类？这个小地精比起可怜的你们更有勇气！"
G["You thought to stand before the legions of death and survive?"]="你以为自己能跟不生不死的军团抗衡？"
G["You thought to take my place on Kezan, $n? You reach too far! I made you what you were... were being the operative word. You're nothing now. Nothing!"]="¿Creíste que podrías ocupar mi puesto en Kezan? ¡Has llegado demasiado lejos! Yo te convertí en lo que eras... Y \"eras\" es la palabra apropiada. Ahora no eres nada. ¡Nada!"
G["You thought to wipe the undead from these lands? Taste the true might of the Scourge, and despair!"]="就凭你们，也想将亡灵逐出这片土地？见识天灾军团真正的力量，绝望吧！"
G["You thought you stood a chance?"]="不要心存侥幸！"
G["You thoughtless $r!  You'll pay for your interference!"]="¡$R $ginsensato:insensata;! ¡Pagarás por tu intromisión!"
G["You three are my eyes and ears. Fan out! Prepare a defense!"]="你们三个就是我的耳目。散开！准备防御！"
G["You three! $n! Assist Captain Oakenshield in the front!"]="你们三个！去前面协助橡盾队长！"
G["You threw last one, idiot. It's my turn."]="你已经掷过最后一颗了，笨蛋。现在该我了。"
G["You through like a land walker!"]="你看起来就像个旱鸭子！"
G["You throw away your honor and flee as cowards? Then die!"]="你们抛下自己的荣誉，要像懦夫一样逃跑？那就死吧！"
G["You throw barrel? Jooga throw banana! Taste better!"]="你们扔酒桶？尤噶扔香蕉！味道更好！"
G["You throw caution to the wind."]="你已经把谨慎抛在脑后了。"
G["You tik-digglin' jook-manker!"]="你这鬼鬼祟祟的大蠢货！"
G["You tink you strong.  You tink you brave.  You tink you can survive."]="你自以为强大。你自以为勇敢。你自以为能活下来。"
G["You tiny creatures disgust me!"]="你这家伙真令我作呕！"
G["You titans infuriate me. I am acting on behalf of the greater good."]="你们泰坦激怒我了。我这么做是为了更重要的目的。"
G["You told him I was fat behind my back, didn't you?!"]="你在我背后跟他说我是个胖子，对吗？"
G["You told me to!"]="是你让我这么做的！"
G["You too are a student of the arcane, yes?\n\nI can teach you about portal magic, if you wish to learn."]="你也是一名奥术的研究者？\n\n我可以教导你传送门魔法的技艺，如果你想学的话。"
G["You too have failed."]="你也失败了。"
G["You too shall serve the Lich King.... your time comes."]="你终将臣服于巫妖王的意志……很快。"
G["You too slow!  Want me get Glubtok?"]="你动作太慢了！想让我把格拉布托克找来吗？"
G["You too will serve the Lich King."]="你也会成为巫妖王的仆从。"
G["You took my king, I take your miserable life!"]="带走了我的国王。我要带走你悲惨的生命！"
G["You trained them well, Fordring. You delivered the greatest fighting force this world has ever known... right into my hands - exactly as I intended! You shall be rewarded for your unwitting sacrifice."]="你把他们训练的很好，弗丁。你把世界上最强大的勇士都送到我了的面前，这正合我意！你们的默默牺牲会得到我的褒奖。"
G["You tread on sacred ground! You must be purified!"]="你正踏在神圣的土地上！而你必须被彻底净化！"
G["You treat my baby nice, alright? I don't want to find any dents when you're done with her."]="你会好好照顾我的宝贝儿的，对吧？战斗结束后，我可不希望在她身上看到哪怕是一块凹痕。"
G["You treat my hat well now, $n.  You won't find a finer one anywhere in this world or another."]="$n，好好保护我的帽子。世上再也找不出比这顶帽子更好的了。"
G["You treat us worse than animals!"]="在你眼里，我们连牲口都不如！"
G["You trespass on sacred soil!"]="你冒犯了神圣的领地！"
G["You triumphed over the darkness I had locked away."]="你战胜了那被封印已久的黑暗。"
G["You truly are a master of martial fighting. You honor me with your presense."]="你的确是武术格斗的高手。你的到来是我的荣幸。"
G["You try my patience, shore-dwellers!"]="你在考验我的耐心，蠢货！"
G["You tryin' to escape from Zul'Gurub?"]="你想要逃出祖尔格拉布？"
G["You tryin' to make me look bad?!"]="你想让我难堪？！"
G["You turn away the might of the Warsong Offensive? Has the chaos of battle turned you mad? With my help, victory is at hand! Without my help, your fight will be difficult."]="你拒绝战歌远征军的协助？难道战争让你的脑子烧坏了吗？有我的帮助，胜利的果实就唾手可得！如果没有我，那么你将面临极为困难的战局。"
G["You turn the body over and see the marks from blades and spells upon the deceased orc--her armor all but destroyed, her hair matted to her face.\n\nBased on Mankrik's description of her, there is no doubt in your mind that this was his wife.\n\nHe will be upset by the news, but you are sure he should know the truth."]="你把尸体翻过来然后看到她武器上的标志——她的护甲已经都损毁了，她的头发披散在她的脸上。\n\n根据曼科里克对于她的描述，你可以确定这就是她的妻子。\n\n他一定会为这个消息而感到悲伤，但是你相信他还是希望知道真相的。"
G["You turned Fandral Staghelm over to the Twilight's Hammer. Why have you betrayed the dragonflights?"]="你把范达尔·鹿盔交给了暮光之锤。你为什么要背叛巨龙军团？"
G["You two are surely star-crossed lovers who have found each other. There is much happiness in your future."]="你们真是天造地设的一对！你们的未来充满了快乐。"
G["You two be more careful! There are only so many of us!"]="你们两个要更加小心！我们的人只有这么点了！"
G["You two did it! I knew the Shado-Pan would make excellent allies."]="你们成功了！我就知道影踪派会是出色的盟友。"
G["You two mooks stow it. The boss is here!"]="你们两个白痴能消停下么，老板来了！"
G["You two will have many ups and downs, but if you can hold on, the ride will be worth it."]="你们两个人之间将会发生许多事情，但只要坚持到底，必定苦尽甘来。"
G["You two-legs are nothing!  My children could beat you!"]="你们这些两条腿的蠢货！我的孩子都可以打败你们！"
G["You underestimate me."]="你太低估我了。"
