G["You useless. Goregek not know why he bother with you."]="你真没用。格利基克干嘛要为你心烦啊。"
G["You vill pay, $p. Deazh by firink sqvad!"]="你将付出代价，$p。被烈焰吞噬！"
G["You virmen smell like rotten turnip and yak dooker!"]="你们兔妖全身都是烂芜菁和臭牦牛的味儿！"
