G["You vorry about zhe killink!"]="不要忘记使用它！"
G["You vorry too much, Gnombuz. Zettle yourzelf down!"]="你太过担心了，诺莫巴士。冷静下来！"
G["You wait until Goregek ready."]="你最好耐心地等着格利基克。"
G["You wait, slave thing. Goregek eating."]="你一边呆着去，奴隶。格利基克正在吃饭呢。"
G["You walk like a mogu!"]="你走路的样子真像魔古族！"
G["You walk the line between absolute power and total corruption."]="你是在绝对的强权和彻底的堕落间走钢丝。"
G["You wanna be part of Soggy's crew? Then you're gonna start at the bottom like everyone else."]="你想成为“闷水壶”的船员？那你恐怕得像其他人那样，从头做起。"
G["You wanna be talkin' to da spirits?  Well let's see what we can do..."]="你想要和灵魂谈话？好吧，让我们看看行不行……"
G["You wanna go to Zul'Aman, mon? I be takin' you der."]="朋友，你想去祖阿曼？我带你去吧。"
G["You wanna know who I like? I like Kiryn. She's got pretty eyes."]="是我的话就选琪麟。她有一双漂亮的眼睛。"
G["You wanna make an omelet, you're gonna have to break a few eggs."]="要想收获，你就得先付出。"
G["You wanna see power? I'm gonna show you power!"]="你们想见识真正的力量？那我就让你们如愿以偿！"
G["You wanna talk? Pay up."]="你想聊聊？给钱。"
G["You want Master Hossack. He in south part of Mage District, inner ring."]="你想找胡萨克大师？他就在内环法师区南部。"
G["You want Nedric Sallow, in the inn.\nHe's just to the right of the stairs down."]="Busca a Nedric Cetrino en la posada.\n\nSuele estar bajando las escaleras, a la derecha."
G["You want Sir Malory Wheeler. He's in the Royal Quarter with the rest of the battlemasters."]="你可以去找玛洛维尔爵士。他和其他战场军官一样，都呆在皇家区。"
G["You want Wikky?"]="你要找光板儿？"
G["You want Zamja at Borstan's Firepit on the upper level of The Drag.  Go up the stairs on the left as you enter The Drag from the Valley of Strength."]="扎姆沙在暗巷区上层的博斯坦的火坑。当你从力量谷进入暗巷区时走左边的楼梯。"
G["You want a fight?  A fight you'll get!"]="你要战？便来战！"
G["You want a knuckle sandwich, chump?"]="你想吃拳头了，笨蛋？"
G["You want a piece of me?"]="你想干掉我？"
G["You want a weapon that acts as an extension of your very fist? Yes, I believe I can show you something."]="你想要一种武器可以作为你的拳头的延伸？好的，我相信可以给你看看某样东西。"
G["You want another? Go ahead! His blood will look better on the floor than in his face."]="你还想要？去吧！这家伙的血流在地板上比淌在脸上好看多了。"
G["You want fight me?! We have triple truffle-shuffle scuffle!"]="你想要和我打吗？！我们有三倍的大块菌！"
G["You want get punched?  You make rock die now!"]="你想挨揍吗？赶紧挖矿！"
G["You want him? Very well, take him!"]="你想杀了他？随便你！"
G["You want in on this? Smash and grab, baby!"]="你也想分一份？那你可要努力了，宝贝儿！"
G["You want me hit rock with you head?"]="你想让我拿你的脑袋去砸石头？"
G["You want me to do what?"]="什么？加入王子的军队？"
G["You want me to get into trouble?  I have a lot of work to do here, and old man Wheeler there isn't cutting me any slack."]="你在给我找事吧？我手头上还有很多工作呢，而且老维勒这个家伙还不让我休息。"
G["You want me to steal third?"]="你想要我去偷第三个？"
G["You want me to take part in the Hyldsmeet to end the war?"]="你想让我参加海德比武会并结束战争吗？"
G["You want more? YOU WANT MORE?"]="你还想要？还想要？"
G["You want my advice? Stay close to her."]="想听听我的建议吗？跟紧她。"
G["You want my foot in your front or in your rear? Make the call."]="你想让我踢你前胸还是屁股？随你挑。"
G["You want my help? I'm a little busy trying to restore the peace that you disrupted."]="你需要我的帮助？我正忙着帮你们收拾残局，恢复这里的和平。"
G["You want my help? You got it. What do you need?"]="你需要我的帮助？可以。你需要什么？"
G["You want some more of Zunta, eh?"]="你想让祖塔再为你做点什么，嗯？"
G["You want some of this!?"]="你想试试吗？！"
G["You want some of this?!"]="你想来点儿吗？！"
G["You want some, too? Very well!"]="你也想来尝尝苦头？很好！"
G["You want something?"]="你想要什么吗？"
G["You want something? Mine is the bitterest of the brews. Are you worthy?"]="你需要什么？我这里有最烈的老酒。你敢试试吗？"
G["You want take Dormus camels?  NO!  MY CAMELS!  DORMUS KILL YOU!!!"]="你想要多尔穆斯骆驼？不！那是我的骆驼！多尔穆斯杀死你！！！"
G["You want the Fanny? You can't HANDLE the Fanny!"]="你想得到范妮？你不能碰范妮！"
G["You want the Hall of Legends. It's high above the Valley of Strength on the west side."]="你要去传说大厅？它就在西边的力量谷上边。"
G["You want to fight celestials. Eh, wikket?\n\nKah Kah glad to watch, but not help."]="嗯？你想跟至尊天神打架吗，蠢蛋？\n\n卡哈卡哈很乐意看热闹，但不会出手帮你。"
G["You want to fight?  Alright, Gory fight."]="你想打架吗？好吧，血肚跟你打。"
G["You want to fight?  Come back when you're a bit stronger.\n\nYou're welcome to watch, though."]="你想要参加搏击？等你变得更强壮之后再回来吧。\n\n当然，欢迎你留下来观看比赛。"
G["You want to fight?  You're gonna need an invite.\n\nYou're welcome to watch, though."]="你想要参加搏击？你需要先收到一份邀请。\n\n当然，欢迎你留下来观看比赛。"
G["You want to get in there and fight some more? I'll put you on the list."]="你想要进去再打上两场吗？我会把你的名字写到单子上。"
G["You want to go do the bounty off of this wanted poster after the shift is over?"]="不如下班后去瞧瞧那份悬赏令？奖励不菲呀。"
G["You want to help the Defilers? Head to the Royal Quarter and speak with Sir Malory Wheeler. He's your man."]="你想帮助污染者吗？同皇家区的玛洛维尔爵士谈一谈。他是你要找的人。"
G["You want to know about ration collections? Very well. Last I was told, the Horde had prepared $2095w out of $2096w lean wolf steaks. We've also packed away $2102w of $2103w spotted yellowtail and $2105w out of $2106w baked salmon needed."]="你想知道收集工作的进度吗？很好。我得到的最新消息称，部落已经收集到$2095w个瘦狼排、$2102w条斑点黄尾鱼和$2105w条烤鲑鱼，而总的需求量分别是$2096w、$2103w和$2106w。"
G["You want to know why women are no-good? Because you think that all they're doing is calling upon the spirits of the dead. But then, you catch them doing a little more than talking! I mean, how does that even work with a ghost?"]="你知道为什么女人总是一无是处吗？因为你认为他们唯一会做的事就是招魂。可是然后，你发现她们并不只是会在那儿说话！我是说，那对鬼魂怎么会行得通？"
G["You want to learn how to make a campfire?  Well then you had best see Malygen in the Cenarion Enclave before you set fire to Teldrassil itself."]="你想知道怎样生篝火吗？那么在你放火烧泰达希尔之前最好去看看塞纳里奥区的玛里甘。"
G["You want to learn to be a tailor?  Hmmm... I believe there's a tailor over in the Eastvale Logging Camp that may be able to get you started."]="你想学习成为一个裁缝？嗯……我相信在东谷伐木场有一个裁缝可以教你。"
G["You want to play my game?\nGet down into the arena and prove yourself. Achieve Rank 3, and then come talk to me."]="¿Quieres jugar?\n\nVe a la arena y prueba tu valía. Llega al rango 3 y luego ven a hablar conmigo."
G["You want to punch things, yah? Talk to Sayoc right here. He teach you."]="你想学习拳套的使用方法吗？和这里的塞尤克谈谈，他会教你的。"
G["You want to race? An unseasoned pup like you?\n\nHa! Hahahahahaha!\n\nThe little ant wants to race against giants!"]="你也想来试试？一个像你这样乳臭未干的小子？\n\n哈哈！哈哈哈哈哈！\n\n你这是螳臂当车、不自量力啊！"
G["You want to rumble?"]="你想被打得鼻青脸肿吗？"
G["You want to talk to Osborne then. No finer teacher of the stealth arts than him in Stormwind. Look for him over in Old Town."]="你应该和奥斯伯谈谈。暴风城没有比他更擅长潜行艺术了，那家伙就在旧城区里。"
G["You want to train? With me? Fantastic! The only thing better than assembling bullets and explosive devices is to share that knowledge with someone else! Let's get started!"]="你想学习？跟着我？太棒了！唯一比装配子弹和炸药装置有趣的事情就是与别人分享那种知识！我们开始吧！"
G["You want what?! I've heard something about one of those odd draenei creatures in the Valley of Heroes. Maybe she knows; I don't."]="你要什么？！我听说英雄谷里有一个古怪的德莱尼女人。或许她知道。"
G["You wants us go bash bad trolls?"]="你想要我们去痛扁坏巨魔吗？"
G["You wassste your time with me, sssoftsskin!"]="你在跟我浪费时间，弱者！"
G["You waste my time!"]="你们在浪费我的时间！"
G["You waste my time, go talk with my student Basil."]="你在浪费我的时间，去找我的学生巴兹尔谈谈吧。"
G["You waste my time. I will tell you nothing!"]="别浪费时间了。我什么都不会说的！"
G["You waste your strength! Tortusk train us warriors never to talk."]="你在浪费你的力气！突牙训练过我们该如何咬紧牙关。"
G["You watch your tongue, ya blootered chuff! That was an honest mistake!"]="小心你的嘴巴，你这个醉鬼！那是无心之过！"
G["You weak, friend."]="你是个弱者，朋友。"
G["You went an' made it so these savages like us?\n\nYou gotta be some kinda freak $r genius!\n\nWho'da thought..."]="你居然能让那些野蛮人接受我们？\n\n你还真鬼才，$r！\n\n谁能想到……"
G["You went behind my back.  You neglected my orders.  You will pay the price."]="你背着我耍花招，无视我的命令。你会付出代价的。"
G["You were a figurehead of the Light, Benedictus. How could you betray your own people?"]="你曾被视为圣光的化身，本尼迪塔斯。你怎么能背叛你的人民。"
G["You were a fool to challenge the power of the Lich King!"]="妄图挑战巫妖王的力量？你太愚蠢了！"
G["You were a fool to come here."]="你居然敢来这里，太愚蠢了！"
G["You were a fool to touch my fires! When Vol'jin falls, you know who dies next!"]="你这蠢货竟敢碰我的火焰！等沃金死掉，你就是下一个！"
G["You were a mortal once, Blackhorn. One of us."]="因为你曾是个凡人，黑角。和我们一样。"
G["You were a true man of the people, Liam.  Unlike any Royal I ever met.  We'll make them pay for this."]="你是人民真正的英雄，利亚姆。不像其他的贵族，我们将让他们付出代价。"
G["You were all fools to come to this land!"]="蠢货！你们不该踏上这片土地！"
G["You were always the troublemaker in the family, Noggle.  Always!"]="你总是家族中最爱惹麻烦的家伙，诺格。总是！"
G["You were being mind-controlled by some sort of malevolent ancient insect creature."]="你被某种古老而又邪恶的虫子控制住了心智。"
G["You were brave enough to stand up to my grandson, Haohan."]="敢于对抗我的孙子郝瀚，真是勇敢。"
G["You were destined to fail."]="你命该就此陨落。"
G["You were drunk on the job!"]="你在工作中喝醉了！"
G["You were expecting one of my harbingers?"]="你在等我的先驱者吗？"
G["You were foolish to come."]="你们的到来体现了自身的愚蠢。"
G["You were fools to leave the safety of your city. Your return to the ocean has assured your demise."]="离开你们安全的城市是愚蠢的。当你们回到大海上的时候，你们的灭亡就注定了。"
G["You were hit! Weapons temporarily disabled!"]="你被击中了！武器暂时不可用！"
G["You were in a raid. Still, my hat's off to you, I don't even know where Kharazan is. How did you get there?"]="你发动了突然袭击。不过我还是要向你致敬，我甚至都不知道卡拉赞在哪儿。你是怎么到那的？"
G["You were looking for me, child? Why do you come to kill me, $n? I only wish to help."]="孩子，你是来找我的吗？$n，为什么要杀我呢？我只是想帮忙啊。"
G["You were magnificent out there, $n!"]="你可真是惹人注目啊，$n！"
G["You were nearly lost! Do not wander off!"]="你差点就走散了！不要掉队！"
G["You were never alone, $n."]="Nunca estuviste $gsolo:sola;, $n."
G["You were never in any danger, sweetheart.  My friends down below would've caught you.  You're worth too much to us alive!"]="你从来没有生命危险，宝贝儿。我朋友在下面会接住你的。你活着对我们的价值可太大了！"
G["You were not invited!"]="¡No estabas $ginvitado:invitada;!"
G["You were not prepared!"]="你们这是自寻死路！"
