G["You were right to come.  My wisdom will be yours."]="你来对了。我将把我的智慧分享给你。"
G["You were right, Fairbanks. That is tragic."]="你说得对，法尔班克斯。这真是一场悲剧。"
G["You were right, Fordring. I did send them in to die. Their lives are meaningless, but yours..."]="你说对了，弗丁。我就是派他们去送死的。他们的生命毫无意义，但你的不同……"
G["You were so preoccupied with whether or not you could win, you didn't stop to think if you should."]="你太过执着于输赢，却没有停下来想想是否应该这么做。"
G["You were standing right here! What the hell did you see? Speak up!"]="你当时就站在这儿！你究竟看见了什么？快说！"
G["You were stubborn enough to keep tilling this soil even though you didn't have much experience."]="在没有太多经验的情况下，你却还在坚持犁地，真是固执。"
G["You were surrendering? Why? Because these invaders can break down a wall?"]="你投降了？为什么？因为这群入侵者能摧毁一道长城？别忘了你还有另一道长城…是由那些管这里叫做家的人…比肩铸成的。"
G["You were telling me about The Veiled Blade and how you took the wrong mission."]="你在告诉我有关迷雾之刃的事情，以及你们怎样错误地接手了这个任务。"
G["You were the one that rescued Admiral Taylor? So the jinyu was telling the truth..."]="就是你救了海军上将泰勒？看来那些锦鱼人说的是真话……"
G["You were the one who challenged me for merely looking. I still await my audience with Tyrande."]="你就是那个不明就里的家伙。我坚持要等泰兰德召见我。"
G["You were there! Is it true then? What happened in Orgrimmar?"]="你来了！这么说都是真的？奥格瑞玛怎么了？"
G["You were too slow!"]="你太慢了！"
G["You were trapped, as I recall. This situation seems oddly similar."]="根据我的回忆，你被困住了。这情形相似得不可思议。"
G["You were warned!"]="我警告过你们了！"
G["You were warned."]="已经警告过你了。"
G["You were wise to seek me out. I would ask a small favor. In return, there is much I can teach you."]="能找到我算你聪明。我想请你帮个小忙。作为回报，我会传授给你很多知识的。"
G["You were. The Eye is never wrong.\n\nYou are a $g priest:priestess;, after all. A powerful $g priest:priestess;, if the Eye showed you this horrible memory.\n\nYou have come for redemption, yet you yourself do not even realize this... Do you?"]="Sí. El Ojo nunca se equivoca.\n\nDespués de todo, eres $gun sacerdote:una sacerdotisa;. Debes ser $gun poderoso sacerdote:una poderosa sacerdotisa;, si el Ojo te ha mostrado ese horrible recuerdo.\n\nHas venido buscando la redención y, sin embargo, no te das cuenta de ello... ¿Verdad?"
G["You weren't trying to pick their pockets, were you?"]="你不是想掏他们的口袋吧？"
G["You weren't worth the energy expenditure. <Nathanos spits.>"]="你不值得我花费力气。<纳萨诺斯吐了一口唾沫。>"
G["You wield the powers of a god, but you are beaten!"]="你掌握着神的力量，可你却被打败了！"
G["You wikkets belong in the pits!"]="你们蠢蛋只配活在垃圾堆里！"
G["You will abide by our rules around here, miscreant!"]="你将被我们的律法所审判，异教徒！"
G["You will accomplish nothing!"]="你终将一事无成！"
G["You will all be alone in the end."]="Al final estarás tú $gsolo:sola;."
G["You will all pay dearly when I return from the depths!"]="当我从深渊回来的时候你就得付出代价！"
G["You will all sssuffer!"]="承担这痛苦吧！"
G["You will all suffer the wrath of Ragnaros!"]="你们将承受拉格纳罗斯的愤怒！"
G["You will allow me a weapon and armor, yes?"]="你会让我挑一把武器和一套盔甲吧？"
G["You will always be my little girl and I will always fear for you, but I know now you can take care of yourself."]="你永远都是我的小女孩，我始终都会牵挂你，可我知道，你现在能自己照顾自己了。"
G["You will be alone in the end."]="你将孤独地走向生命的终点。"
G["You will be cleansed!"]="你将被净化！"
G["You will be consumed!"]="你死到临头了！"
G["You will be crushed in the depthsss!"]="你会在深渊里粉身碎骨！"
G["You will be crushed!"]="你会被碾碎！"
G["You will be decursed!"]="让我们移除你身上的诅咒吧！"
G["You will be destroyed!"]="你们会被毁灭的！"
G["You will be easy prey, $C."]="你死定了，$c。"
G["You will be exterminated!"]="你们将被消灭！"
G["You will be forgiven, Eranikus. Elune will always love you. Break free of the bonds that command you!"]="伊兰尼库斯，你的罪行会被赦免的。艾露恩永远爱着你。挣脱禁锢着你的束缚吧！"
G["You will be in chains before I am done! You will beg for death!!"]="你马上就会被栓起来！到时候你会只求一死！！"
G["You will be incarcerated and tried for treason, Windsor. I shall watch with glee as they hand down a guilty verdict and sentence you to death by hanging..."]="你会被监禁并因叛国罪接受审判，温德索尔。我会很高兴看到他们宣布你有罪，并把你送上绞刑架……"
G["You will be judged for defiling these sacred grounds!  The laws of the Ancients will not be challenged!  Trespassers will be annihilated!"]="你们玷污了这片神圣的土地，会因此受到惩罚的！上古之神的律法不容藐视！入侵者要付出生命的代价！"
G["You will be just another nameless victim of these barren lands."]="你只会成为这片贫瘠土地上的又一位无名牺牲者。"
G["You will be my salvation.\n\nYou may yet be my demise."]="你可能为我带来救赎的希望。\n\n你也可能将我送入死亡的深渊。"
G["You will be ok, Awbee. Your assailants have been terminated."]="你会没事的，奥比。攻击你的人已经被杀死了。"
G["You will be punished for this transgression, thief!"]="¡Recibirás tu castigo por esta transgresión, $gladrón:ladrona;!"
G["You will be punished!"]="你会受到惩罚的！"
G["You will be punished! Your life a lesson in futility!"]="你将受到严惩！你的生命将成为徒劳的教训！"
G["You will be removed from the Darnassian Glaive Thrower if you do not return to Thal'darah Overlook or Battlescar Valley."]="要是你不马上返回萨达拉瞭望台或战痕谷，你将被从达纳苏斯投刃车上移下来。"
G["You will be removed from the Krom'gar Demolisher if you do not return to Battlescar Valley."]="要是你不马上返回战痕谷，你将被从克罗姆加攻城车上移下来。"
G["You will be reunited with your master soon - in the afterlife."]="你很快就会和你的主子碰面了——在死了以后。"
G["You will be the first of many to die!"]="第一个就要杀死你！"
G["You will be trapped for eternity!"]="你们将被永远禁锢于此！"
G["You will be washed away with flame..."]="让烈焰把你卷走吧……"
G["You will be... punished..."]="你会被……严惩的……"
G["You will bleed!"]="你会付出鲜血的代价！"
G["You will bring him back into this world, champion."]="勇士，你会将他带回这个世界的。"
G["You will burn under the might of the Shao-Tien!"]="你会被韶天族的威力所烧焦！"
G["You will burn with your lands!"]="你们会与你们的土地一起被燃焦！"
G["You will burn!"]="燃烧吧！"
G["You will come no further, Forsaken scum!  By the war banner of the ancient Greymane clan, I expel you from our ancestral lands!"]="到此为止了，被遗忘者渣滓！以格雷迈恩家族战旗起誓，我要把你们驱逐出这片先祖之地！"
G["You will come out no more!"]="你再也不会出去了！"
G["You will die for your hubris, $c!"]="你会为你的傲慢而付出代价，$c！"
G["You will die for your insolence!"]="你的傲慢会让你送命！"
G["You will die here, by my blade!"]="你必将死在我的剑下！"
G["You will die in shame like your pathetic father."]="你会带着羞耻死去，就像你可怜的父亲一样。"
G["You will die in the name of Lady Vashj!"]="以瓦丝琪女王的名义，去死吧！"
G["You will die this day, Earthwarder! $n will see to it!"]="今天就是你的死期，大地守护者！$n会亲自解决你！"
G["You will die today."]="今天就是你的死期。"
G["You will die when you leave this place.  There is nothing left of your world."]="要想离开这里，唯有一死。你的世界已经化为乌有了。"
G["You will die with me, Keeshan! This world has enough heroes!"]="你将和我一起死，基沙恩！这世界上的英雄已经够多了！"
G["You will do as I command! I am in control here!"]="遵照我的意愿！我是你的主人！"
G["You will do as ordered.  Manaforge Duro has come under heavy attack by mana creatures and the situation is out of control.  Failure to comply will not be tolerated!"]="照我的吩咐做。法力熔炉：杜隆受到魔法生物的严重袭击，局势已然失控了。如果你们不按指示随意胡来，将受到最严厉的惩罚！"
G["You will do better, next time."]="你下次会做得更好。"
G["You will do my bidding, weakling."]="你将听从我的指挥。"
G["You will do nothing to dishonor me before Val'zareq.  Is that clear?"]="别在瓦萨雷克面前羞辱我。明白吗？"
G["You will do our bidding, mortal."]="照我的吩咐办事，凡人。"
G["You will drown in blood!"]="你们会淹死在鲜血中！"
G["You will drown in the blood of the Old Gods! ALL OF YOU!"]="古神之血将淹没你们！淹没你们所有人！"
G["You will face the full fury of the ancestors for what you have done, monster!"]="你将为自己的所作所为付出代价，接受先祖的惩罚吧！"
G["You will fail!"]="你必将失败！"
G["You will fail."]="你注定要失败。"
G["You will fall as your lands and your city have before you. My lord will win a great victory here, and none will remember your name!"]="你会同你的家园和城池一样遭受灭顶之灾。我的主人会在这里大获全胜，你的名字将被人们遗忘。"
G["You will fall before the might of the Scourge. Crypt raiders, attack!"]="你们都会被天灾军团的力量击垮。地穴劫掠者，进攻！"
G["You will fall before the true Horde!"]="臣服于正统部落吧！"
G["You will fall!"]="你必将败亡！"
G["You will feed the worms."]="你将成为虫子的食物。"
G["You will feel but a fraction of my agony."]="这点痛苦比不上我的万分之一。"
G["You will feel pain."]="你将承受痛苦。"
G["You will find Fineous Darkvire beyond the Ring of Law, in the Hall of Crafting. Kill the miserable cur and recover Ironfel.\n\nTake Ironfel to the Shrine of Thaurissan and place the hammer in its rightful place: In the hands of the statue erected in my honor.\n\nWhen this is done, the compartment in which I stored the master key will open. More importantly, Ironfel will remain forever in my grasp. Should they make an attempt to remove the hammer; both the statue and hammer will shatter, lost forever."]="你可以在秩序竞技场外侧的工艺之厅里找到弗诺斯·达克维尔。杀死那无耻的杂种，找回铁胆之锤。\n\n把铁胆之锤带到索瑞森神殿去，放在适当的地方——就放在我的雕像的手中。\n\n然后，我存放钥匙的小隔间就会打开。更重要的是，铁胆之锤将会永远都掌握在我手中。如果他们试图拿走战锤，雕塑和战锤就都会粉碎，并永远消失。"
G["You will find Fono, the mining trainer, on the Aldor Rise."]="采矿训练师弗诺就在奥尔多高地上。"
G["You will find Funaam, the guild master, near the Trader's Tier entrance."]="公会注册员就在贸易阶梯的入口附近。"
G["You will find Lothan Silverblade where you can find weapons and armor.  A warrior is never far from his blade."]="你可以在能找到武器和盔甲的地方找到罗萨恩·银刃。一位战士绝对不会远离他的武器。"
G["You will find Pyall Silentstride inside the great tent in the northwest corner of the village.  He can teach you what you crave."]="你可以在村庄西北角的大帐篷里找到派尔·沉默行者。他可以教给你你想要的。"
G["You will find Recorder Lidio on the Aldor Rise."]="记录员利迪欧就在奥尔多高地上。"
G["You will find Sildinair at the Warrior's Terrace among the guards, her keen eyes scanning the forest for enemies that might dare to enter our fair city."]="你会在战士区的护卫队中找到希达奈尔，她敏锐的眼睛扫视着森林，寻找着胆敢进入我们美丽的城市的敌人。"
G["You will find Technician Mihila on the Aldor Rise."]="技师米希拉就在奥尔多高地上。"
G["You will find Tseh Rah on the Spirit Rise. She has been meeting with the Shaman Trainers there."]="你可以在灵魂高地找到冉瑟。她正在那里与萨满祭司训练师会面。"
G["You will find Weaver Aoa in northeastern Aldor Rise."]="你可以在奥尔多高地的东北部找到编织者欧尔。"
G["You will find a blood elf Arcane Reforger, Herim, at Dawnstrider Enchanters on the middle rise.  She will be able to assist you."]="在位于中部高地的附魔店里有位名叫赫琳的血精灵奥术重铸师。她能帮上你的忙。"
G["You will find a caregiver center in the southern portion of Aldor Rise."]="医护中心位于奥尔多高地的南部。"
G["You will find a mailbox near the caregiver center."]="医护中心附近就有邮箱。"
G["You will find a number of shaman trainers in the Crystal Hall. Perhaps you should visit Farseer Nobundo there, and show the Broken some pity. Light be with you."]="Hay varios instructores de chamanes en la Sala de Cristal. Puede que quieras ver al clarividente Nobundo. Muéstrate $gcompasivo:compasiva; con los Tábidos. Que la Luz te acompañe."
G["You will find a pair of draenei conversing with Elissa Dumas - the human mage who minds the magical portals - on the ground floor of The Temple of the Moon.\n\nThey will know how to help you."]="在月神殿底层有两名德莱尼正在和埃莉萨·杜马斯——就是那位操纵魔法传送门的人类法师谈话。\n\n他们会知道该如何帮助你。"
G["You will find him in the Caregiver Center in the Seat of the Naaru. Light be with you."]="你可以在纳鲁之座的医护中心找到他。愿圣光与你同在。"
G["You will find it in your interest to aid the Alliance war effort.  We are in need of scouts and trackers, as well as provisions for our troops.  Payment, in gold, will be delivered immediately from the king's treasury."]="帮助联盟对你们有莫大的好处啊。我们正在招募侦察兵，同时为军队筹备给养。军饷将以金币的形式从国库直接调拨。"
G["You will find mailboxes within or just outside the Aldor and Scryers banks and inns."]="奥尔多和占星者的银行或者旅店附近都有邮箱。"
G["You will find no better partner in battle than an orc."]="你会发现，兽人是最好的战友。"
G["You will find no better riding companion than our dragon turtles. Their low stance means the rider experiences no bounce or jostle, even when cornering sharply. If you are interested in purchasing one, you must prove your trust to the Tushui."]="你再也找不到比我们的龙龟更好的坐骑伙伴了。它们重心极低，哪怕是在急转弯时，上面的骑手也感觉不到一点震动或推挤。如果你想买的话，就必须向土水派证明你的忠诚。"
G["You will find no peace here."]="你在这里不会得到安宁。"
G["You will find no peace in death, wyrms!"]="你们在死后也别想得到安宁！"
G["You will find no peace in death."]="你死后也永远不得安宁。"
G["You will find no reward here, only death!"]="这儿可没好处让你捞，只有死路一条！"
G["You will find no solace here."]="你在这里不会找到丝毫慰藉。"
G["You will find numerous trainers around Dolanaar with ages of experience with which to tutor you.  Which would you have me point you to?"]="你可以在多兰纳尔周围找到众多的训练师，他们有丰富的经验可以传授给你。你想要找哪一位？"
G["You will find only suffering within the realm of twilight! Enter if you dare!"]="暮光的世界将会让你痛不欲生！够胆量的就进来吧！"
G["You will find only the best noodles in all Pandaria here."]="这里有全潘达利亚最美味的面条。"
G["You will find our alchemist trainers in the Vault of Lights. Go with the Light."]="炼金术训练师就在圣光穹顶。愿圣光与你同在。"
G["You will find our bank in the Exodar's central hub.  Go with the Light."]="银行就在埃索达的中心地带。愿圣光与你同在。"
G["You will find our battlemasters in the Vault of the Lights.  There is also one \"Miglik Blotstrom\" staying with Caregiver Breel, who claims to represent an arena fighting circuit on this world."]="你可以在圣光穹顶找到我们的战场军官。在布雷尔旁还有个叫米格里克·布罗斯托的家伙，他自称是这个世界上的竞技场巡回赛的官方代表。"
G["You will find our herbalist, Cemmorhan, against the back wall of the Vault of Lights."]="草药学训练师塞摩尔汉就在圣光穹顶的后墙对面。"
G["You will find our mages in the Vault of Lights.  Go with the Light."]="法师训练师就在圣光穹顶。愿圣光与你同在。"
G["You will find our mining trainers towards the back of the Trader's Tier."]="采矿训练师就在贸易阶梯后面。"
G["You will find the Exodar's leatherworkers in the Trader's Tier.  May the Light bless you."]="埃索达的制皮训练师在贸易阶梯。愿圣光保佑你。"
G["You will find the Exodar's skinning trainers in the Trader's Tier with the leatherworkers.  May the Light bless you."]="埃索达的剥皮训练师跟制皮训练师都在贸易阶梯。愿圣光保佑你。"
G["You will find the Stable Master near the caregiver center."]="兽栏管理员在医护中心附近。"
G["You will find the Sunwalker's Lodge on Hunter's Rise."]="你可以在猎人高地找到烈日行者集会所。"
G["You will find the battlemasters inside the Hall of the Brave in the Valley of Honor."]="战场军官就在荣誉谷的勇士大厅里。"
G["You will find the enchanting trainer, Zurii, in southern Aldor Rise."]="你可以在奥尔多高地的南部找到附魔训练师苏蕾。"
G["You will find the herbalism trainer, Jijia, in eastern Aldor Rise."]="你可以在奥尔多高地的东部找到草药学训练师吉嘉。"
G["You will find the inscription trainer, Recorder Lidio, in southern Aldor Rise."]="你可以在奥尔多高地的南部找到铭文训练师，记录员利迪欧。"
G["You will find the the battlemasters gathered at the Warrior's Terrace."]="战场军官都聚集在战士区。"
G["You will first be facing three of the Grand Champions of the Tournament! These fierce contenders have beaten out all others to reach the pinnacle of skill in the joust."]="你首先会与这场锦标赛的三名总冠军作战。这些强大的战士已经把他们的对手都一一击败了。"
G["You will fly again, beast..."]="你很快就能再次飞翔了……"
G["You will go no further! Now face me. I will give you a swift death!"]="站住！现在该我了。我会给你们一个痛快的。"
G["You will go nowhere, Shaman."]="你无路可逃了，萨满。"
G["You will harm no more sons or daughters of the Horde. Your purpose has been corrupted."]="你再也不能荼毒部落的儿女了。你的意志已经堕落了。"
G["You will have a new home in Azshara and the Bilgewater Cartel will become a part of the Horde!"]="你们将在艾萨拉有一个新家。锈水财阀将成为部落的一分子！"
G["You will have a proper ceremony in Nagrand, next to the pyres of your mother and ancestors."]="你会在纳格兰有一个隆重的葬礼，安睡在你的母亲与祖先身旁。"
G["You will have no choice once your people are enslaved by the jackbooted Alliance death squads!"]="当你的族人成为联盟铁腕下的奴隶时，你们将别无选择！"
G["You will have some of my best men, do not worry Battlemaiden. Return to us quickly - I am eager to begin hunting the Tidehunter."]="我的精英良将会任你调遣，别担心，女武士。尽快回来找我们——我已经迫不及待想要开始追击猎潮者了。"
G["You will have to battle your way through this cesspit on your own."]="你只能靠自己冲过这个肮脏的地方了。"
G["You will have to excuse me, Lorax, I do not speak 'crazy.'"]="你一定要原谅我，罗拉克斯，我没有“疯狂”地说什么。"
G["You will have to make your way across this quarry on your own."]="你只能靠自己冲过这个矿坑了。"
G["You will have to pry the relics of the Dalaran archmages from my dead hands!"]="只有我死了，你才能从我的手中夺走达拉然大法师的遗物！"
G["You will have to try harder than that to defeat me."]="你得再加把劲，才能击败我。"
G["You will have what you have come for, $n. Take the sword and begone. And you, Auric, have a care what you say in this sacred place."]="你会得到你想要的，$n。带着这把剑走吧。至于你，乌瑞克，在圣地要注意你讲话的方式。"
G["You will have your challenge, Fordring."]="会有人战败你的，弗丁。"
G["You will hear the call when you are needed. Fly east, to Skettis, and wait there for $n's signal."]="当我们需要你时就会发出号令。飞去东方，到斯克提斯去，在那里等待着$n的信号。"
G["You will hear their cries from up here, my lord!"]="主人，你能从这里听见他们的哭声！"
G["You will help restore the Dragonmaw Clan to their former glory."]="你将帮助龙喉氏族重夺荣耀。"
G["You will if you wish to keep your head attached to your shoulders."]="我相信你会的，除非你想为难自己。"
G["You will join the others in eternal servitude!"]="你会和其他人一样，永世为奴！"
G["You will keep all your fingers and toes, not to worry."]="你的手指和脚趾将会完好无缺的，不要担心。"
G["You will keep us safe from the evil mistress, yes!"]="没错，您一定能保护我们不受那个恶妇的伤害！"
G["You will know fear!"]="你会知道什么是恐惧！"
G["You will know our business soon. Kor'kron, ANNIHILATE THEM!"]="你很快就会明白了。库卡隆，消灭他们！"
G["You will learn in due time, my daughter. Come with me. Together, we will bring vengeance to those who have wronged us..."]="时间会让你明白一切，我的孩子。随我来吧，一起向那些错怪我们的人复仇……"
G["You will learn of the sanctuary only death can offer..."]="你会了解只有死亡才是唯一的避难所……"
G["You will learn to fear our blades, mantid."]="螳螂妖不吃点苦头不会知道我们的厉害。"
G["You will learn your place."]="你们将会了解自己的处境。"
G["You will listen to this, vile duke!  I am not your Twilight's Hammer lapdog!  I am here to challenge you!  Come!  Come, and meet your death..."]="卑鄙的公爵，听好了！我可不是暮光之锤的走狗！我是来向你提出挑战的！来吧，受死吧……"
G["You will live forever in torment for this, pathetic warlock."]="你将会因此永远生活在痛苦之中，可怜的术士。"
G["You will make a fine meal for the hatchlings."]="你或许会是孩子们最好的晚餐。"
G["You will make a fine warrior of the Horde."]="你会成为部落出色的战士的。"
G["You will make a fitting sacrifice to Ragnaros."]="你的死将是对拉格纳罗斯的一次献祭。"
G["You will make a fitting sacrifice!"]="你是个不错的祭品！"
G["You will make a fitting sacrifice."]="你得做出适当的牺牲。"
G["You will make an excellent addition, $p."]="你会令我们如虎添翼的，$p。"
G["You will make an excellent pet."]="你会成为听话的宠物。"
G["You will make an excellent sacrifice."]="你将成为一个绝好的祭品。"
G["You will make fine slaves for the empire."]="你们会成为出色的帝国奴隶。"
G["You will move that Elemenitum whether you like it or not!"]="不管你愿不愿意，你都得把那源质移开！"
G["You will need more than bravery to defeat the Lich King. Good luck."]="要击败巫妖王，你需要的将不止是勇气。祝你好运。"
G["You will need to find Nat Pagle in Dustwallow Marsh to get any better than you are currently."]="你需要去尘泥沼泽找纳特·帕格接受训练，提高自己的能力。"
G["You will need to open the Felhound Tracker Kit and read the instruction manual. Summon the beast when you are near the peninsula of cliff giants, south of here."]="你必须打开地狱寻踪犬工具箱，并阅读一下使用说明书。当你接近南面那个满是峭壁巨人的半岛时，就开始召唤地狱寻踪犬吧。"
G["You will never defeat the Kor'kron!"]="你们休想打败库卡隆！"
G["You will never defeat the true sons of Gnomeregan!"]="你永远也不可能战胜真正的诺莫瑞根之子！"
G["You will never defeat us all!"]="别想打败我们！"
G["You will never defeat us!"]="你永远无法击败我们！"
G["You will never escape these caverns!"]="你休想逃出这些山洞！"
G["You will never essscape Coilssskarrr..."]="别想从库斯卡手中逃掉……"
G["You will never get the Heart of Fury!  Its power belongs to Illidan!"]="你永远都别想得到愤怒之心！那是属于伊利丹大人的！"
G["You will never get the tablets!"]="你永远也得不到这些石板！"
G["You will never know such discipline."]="你是不可能明白这样的戒律的。"
G["You will never prevail!"]="你永远都赢不了！"
G["You will never return to the world of the living!"]="你没有机会重返生者的世界！"
G["You will never stop the Forsaken, $r. The Dark Lady shall make you suffer."]="你无法阻止被遗忘者，$r。黑暗女王将会让你感受到痛苦和恐惧。"
G["You will never stop us!"]="你绝对无法阻止我们！"
G["You will never take amulet!  Grol lives forever!"]="你别想拿走护符！戈洛尔永生！"
G["You will never take me alive!"]="别想活捉我！"
G["You will never take these waters from us!"]="别想夺走我们的水域！"
G["You will never wake the dreamer!"]="你不能唤醒沉睡者！"
G["You will no longer live there, ogre. Pray you land somewhere safe, for it's more than you deserve."]="那里不再是你的家了，食人魔。另找个安全的地方安家吧——那地方已经不再适合你。"
G["You will not be alone.  You will have advisors: Cairne, Eitrigg, Vol'jin.  They will help guide you."]="你并非孤身一人。会有顾问从旁协助你——凯恩、伊崔格和沃金，他们会指引你的。"
G["You will not be disappointed, traveler. Tailoring is a joyous endeavor."]="No te defraudaré, $gviajero:viajera;. La sastrería es una profesión que te llenará de júbilo."
G["You will not break us, sha!"]="你休想击垮我们，煞！"
G["You will not bury me again!"]="你休想再埋葬我！"
G["You will not deceive us. We see you for who you truly are!"]="你骗不了我们。我们能看穿你的真实身份！"
G["You will not defeat me so easily."]="你休想轻易打败我。"
G["You will not defeat me!"]="你赢不了我的！"
