G["You wish to improve your weapon skills?  Our weapon master is located on the highest level of the Trader's Tier, on the Warriors' Terrace."]="想要学习更多武器技能吗？武器大师就在贸易阶梯最高层的战士阶梯。"
G["You wish to kill me? You first!"]="你们想要杀了我？你们先死吧！"
