G["You wish to learn the old craft?  You wish to smelt dark iron?\n\nAppease me, $r.  Show me a sacrifice and I will consider it!"]="你想要学习这项古老的手艺？你希望冶炼黑铁？\n\n给我一样祭品我就会考虑的！"
G["You wish to pay me tribute? Then pay it in blood!"]="你想向我致敬？那就用血来表达吧！"
