G["You wish to race against me? Ha! You'll be seeing the back of my serpent's tail."]="你想跟我一较高下？哈！你只能看着我的翔龙尾巴，望尘莫及。"
G["You wish to speak to me, $r?"]="$R，你想跟我谈谈？"
