G["You won this round but I'll have a better brew by our next encounter."]="这一回是你赢了，可等我们下次相遇时，我会拿出更好的佳酿。"
G["You won't be able to open the back door yourself to escape once you've started the chaos. You'll have to either get the guards to open it by killing bar patrons, get Private Rocknot drunk so he causes property damage, or see if Spazzring has the key on him!"]="你在引发混乱之后，无法自行打开后门逃走。你可以选择的方案有：杀死酒吧客人，让卫兵打开后门；或者让罗克诺特下士喝醉，这样他会进行破坏；或者是看看普拉格的身上有没有钥匙！"
G["You won't be deterrin' me. Not today. I'll keep trainin'!"]="你阻止不了我。为时尚早。我会继续训练！"
G["You won't deny me this, Arthas! I must know... I must find out..."]="你不能拒绝我，阿尔萨斯！我必须知道……必须明白……"
