G["You won't... get far."]="你们……不会得逞的。"
G["You won? How... disappointing. I could have easily watched you all continue to stand in the fire."]="你们赢了？真……令人失望啊。我本以为可以目送你们葬身于火海中。"
G["You work for me now!"]="现在你为我效力！"
G["You work with machines for so long, sometimes you forget about real hearts."]="你和机器共处的时间太久了，久到让你忘了真正的爱情。"
G["You worship death, little man?  Death is here!"]="你崇拜死亡？死亡就在眼前！"
G["You would be wise not to waste time. If my father dies, he takes with him the knowledge of where the middle fragment of the World Pillar is hidden. I know that you people want it."]="你要是聪明就别耽误时间。要是我父亲死了，那世界之柱中部碎片的位置也将和他一同消亡。我知道你们这些人想要得到它。"
G["You would be wrong. With clarity and focus, nothing is impossible."]="那你就错了。清除杂念，集中精神，没什么是不可能的。"
G["You would betray your kingdom out of spite?"]="你真的要背叛你的王国？"
G["You would certainly be looking for Me'Lynn if you have any hope of learning to be a tailor.  She resides at the Craftsmen's Terrace in northeastern Darnassus."]="如果你有希望学成一位裁缝的话你当然应该去找迈里恩。她住在达纳苏斯东北方的工匠区。"
G["You would challenge me in my own sanctum? Witness your folly!"]="你们想在我的圣殿内挑战我？认清你们的愚蠢吧！"
G["You would champion the cause of such a lowly street rat? Very well, best me in combat and I shall consider giving you my blessing."]="你想为那个下贱的过街老鼠而战？很好。只要你能打败我，我就会给出我的祝福。"
G["You would do well to not disrupt this fancy fancy ritual."]="你要尽量避免打断这个奇特的仪式。"
G["You would have had a better chance at the blockade, mantid."]="螳螂妖，天堂有路你不走，地狱无门你来投。"
G["You would have us live like the savages!"]="你会让我们像野蛮人那样生活的！"
G["You would like to move away from that, wouldn't you? Too bad."]="你想离它远点，是吗？太糟糕了。"
G["You would make better rugs!"]="你的皮很合适做地毯！"
G["You would not have helped the legion of Blackrock had we just asked for your assistance, now would you?"]="如果黑石军团要求你帮忙的话，你是不会帮助他们的，对吗？"
G["You would think we would be finished mending this roof by now."]="你是不是觉得我们现在就应该修好屋顶？"
G["You wouldn't believe some of the rabble that we've had come through here lately. Most are more trouble than the supposed help that they provide. Nothing at all like you.\n\nYou sure you don't want to sign up with the Farstriders?"]="你简直无法想象最近我们都是和怎样一群乌合之众共同渡过的，大部分人简直是来找麻烦而不是帮忙的，完全不像你那样能干。\n\n你确定你不想加入远行者吗？"
G["You wouldn't happen to have another bundle of that incense would you?"]="你不会恰巧有另一捆那种熏香吧？"
G["You wouldn't happen to have any canned turtle soup from Hillsbrad, would you?"]="你不会还带着希尔斯布莱德丘陵的罐装海龟汤吧？"
G["You wouldn't like me when I'm angry..."]="如果惹我发火，你就要倒霉了……"
G["You!  $n!  What are you doing wandering around the village like this?  There are Alliance foes in Alterac!  We must drive them out!\n\nOur supplies are too low to launch a large ground assault, so speak with our quatermaster.  He'll tell you how you can increase our supply base."]="¡Tú! ¡$n! ¿Qué haces dando un paseo por la aldea? ¡Hay enemigos de la Alianza en Alterac! ¡Tenemos que expulsarlos de allí!\n\nTenemos muy pocos suministros para lanzar un asalto terrestre a gran escala, vete a hablar con nuestro intendente. Te dirá cómo aumentar nuestros suministros."
G["You!  Enter the fray!"]="你！快加入战斗！"
G["You!  I see you!  One of you, kill them!"]="啊！我看见你了！来人啊，杀了他们！"
G["You!  Let me go now!  Wait... no!  Don't let go!"]="你！快放开我！等等……不！别放手！"
G["You!  You don't belong here!"]="你！你不属于这里！"
G["You!  You have allowed the Sha to reawaken after all these years!"]="是你们！这么多年了，是你们又让煞再次苏醒！"
G["You!  Your mutt killed my Butcher!  I will crush you!"]="你！你这蠢货杀了我的屠夫！我要碾碎你！"
G["You! $C! Help us defend against a counterattack."]="你！$c！帮我们挡住敌人的反攻。"
G["You! $R! Come here. <snort>\n\nTime is short, and my end <snort> is near. Mangletooth shall win; you will see. <snort>\n\nMy capture can still aid <snort> my people. The Razormane tribe is more powerful than the Bristlebacks!\n\nThe Horde looks to find out who leads the raids on their people. You <snort> shall aid Mangletooth in return for the information only I know. Mangletooth can help you! <snort> But you must help Mangletooth."]="¡Tú! ¡$R! Ven aquí.<resopla>\n\nEl tiempo es breve y mi fin -resopla-está cerca. Quebrantadientes vencerá, ya lo verás. -resopla-\n\nMi captura todavía puede ayudar <resopla> a mi gente. ¡La tribu Crines de Acero es más poderosa que los Erizapúas!\n\nLa Horda quiere averiguar quién lidera las incursiones sobre su pueblo. Tú <resopla> ayudarás a Quebrantadientes a cambio de la información que solo yo conozco. ¡Quebrantadientes puede ayudarte! <resopla> Pero debes ayudar a Quebrantadientes."
G["You! Are you the ones responsible for what has happened here...?"]="你们！这一切都是你们造成的吗……？"
G["You! Away from our crops!"]="你！离我们的庄稼远点儿！"
G["You! Bear-creature. What kind of sorcery was this?"]="你！熊——什么的。这是什么巫术？"
G["You! COME! Drink, feast, rest for the next battle.\n\nBut do not fight! Or I will feed you to my wolves."]="你！快过来！尽情吃喝一顿吧，为下一次的战斗做好准备。\n\n不许在这里打架！不然我就送你去喂狼。"
G["You! Come over here, give us just a taste..."]="你！过来，让我们尝尝……"
G["You! Fiend, you are not my beloved! Begone!"]="你！你这个恶魔，你不是我的爱人！滚开！"
G["You! Get over here, mopesy. Ken-Ken got just the thing for you!"]="你！快过来，闲人。肯肯给你准备了好东西！"
G["You! How did you escape detection by my sentry-bots?"]="你！怎么可能逃过我的哨兵机器人？这不可能！"
G["You! Not a word to Grick about this! Do you hear me?"]="你！不许告诉葛瑞克！听到没有？"
G["You! The cute one! Would you like to go over to my place and look over my tool collection?"]="嗨！小可爱！你想来看看我收藏的工具吗？"
G["You! What are you doing here?"]="你！你在这儿干嘛？"
G["You! Yes, you!\n\nGaze upon me and treasure this moment of meeting, for soon the world will come to know and fear the name and stern visage of Wilfred Fizzlebang! Once my magnificent summoning is complete, no one will doubt my ability!"]="你！好啊，就是你！\n\n好好看着我。对你来说，遇到我是你不可多得的幸运。过不了多久，全世界的人都会知道并畏惧威尔弗雷德·菲兹班的名字和我威严的面容！一旦我宏大的召唤最终完成，将没有任何人敢怀疑我的能力！"
G["You! Yes, you! Get back to work!"]="你！是的，就是你！回去工作！"
G["You! You have earned my ire. I will make an example of you, such that all who look upon my might will tremble and submit."]="你们！你们激怒我了。我要拿你们做个榜样，让所有仰望我力量的人颤抖臣服。"
G["You! You killed my brothers! You spilled their blood on the sacred ground of my ancestors!\n\nIf I were not chained, I would kill you now!\n\n<The old yaungol collapses from his outburst, breathing heavily.>"]="是你！是你杀了我的兄弟们！是你将他们的热血抛洒在我祖先的圣地上。\n\n要不是被锁着，我现在就杀了你！\n\n<暴怒过后，老野牛人突然瘫倒下来，沉重地喘息着。>"
G["You! You need more practice."]="呃！你！回去再练练吧。"
G["You! You will suffer for your insolence at the hands of my greatest champions.  Surely they will protect their empress!"]="你！我骁勇的勇士们会让你为自己的傲慢付出代价。他们一定会保护自己的女皇！"
G["You! You're not fit to punch arclight spanners from copper plates. Get out of my sight!"]="你！我看你连冲制扳手这种简单的活儿都做不了。给我滚！"
G["You'd be surprised how often that works."]="它发挥作用的频繁程度一定会让你吃惊的。"
G["You'd best hurry if you want any of the spoils."]="如果你还想参加战斗，那最好快一点。"
G["You'd best scram, $n.  I do not want Jonah's death to be linked back to me.\n\nIt'll be hard enough to establish myself as leader of this lot without them knowing I had their previous skipper killed."]="Será mejor que te largues, $n. No quiero que relacionen la muerte de Jonah conmigo.\n\nYa será bastante complicado llegar a ser la líder de esta panda sin que sepan que ordené la muerte de su anterior capitán."
G["You'd better get outta here unless you want to find yourself in one of these cages...."]="你最好滚远点，除非你也想尝尝被关进牢笼的滋味……"
G["You'd better get used to it, jerkyloins. The Alliance primarily views you as pets. Do you do tricks?"]="你们最好赶紧习惯这种待遇，硬肉干。联盟只不过把你们当作宠物。你们明白吗？"
G["You'd better have good reason to approach me, minnow!"]="你最好想出一个接近我的好理由，小鱼！"
G["You'd better hurry up if you want in on all the fun."]="如果不想错过所有这些乐趣，最好快一点。"
G["You'd better leave if you don't want an axe through your skull!"]="要是你不想让自己的脑壳被斧子劈开，就躲远点！"
G["You'd better meet up with him in the field and see what Garrosh is up to."]="你最好在任务现场和他碰面，看看加尔鲁什在干什么。"
G["You'd better not be causing trouble, $n!"]="你最好别找麻烦，$n！"
G["You'd better not tattle on me!"]="你最好不要说我的闲话！"
G["You'd do well not to toy with me, Akama.  Illidan has given me specific orders to keep a close watch on the Warden.  If I find out you're hiding anything from me, I will crush you with my own hands!"]="阿卡玛，别跟我耍花招。伊利丹大人要我密切注视玛维·影歌的一举一动。要是你敢对我隐瞒什么，我就亲手捏碎你！"
G["You'd do well to watch your tone, General.  Neither you nor Garrosh have anything to worry about.  We've ceased all production of the Plague, as he ordered.  We'd never deploy it without his permission."]="小心说话，将军。你和加尔鲁什都不必担心。我们已经服从他的命令，停止施展危害性魔法。如果没有他的许可，我们绝对不会使用那种魔法。"
G["You'd fight better if you'd loosen up."]="要是你做了热身，会发挥得更好。"
G["You'd think by now they'd learn to just run away."]="你也许觉得他们应该学会逃跑。"
G["You'd think we'd have killed all of them by now."]="你现在可能觉得我们已经把他们杀光了。"
G["You'll PAY for that."]="你们会为此付出代价的。"
G["You'll all suffer for this! Zul'Gurub is NOTHING without Zan... Zan..."]="你们都要付出代价！没有赞吉尔，祖尔格拉布什么都……不是……"
G["You'll also find a complementary bag of peanuts."]="您还能找到一袋免费赠送的花生。"
G["You'll always be here, with me."]="你会一直在我身边的。"
G["You'll be a fine example for the others!"]="你是个绝佳的榜样！"
G["You'll be after Benik Boltshear, then. He's located in the heart of the Dwarven District by the blacksmiths."]="哦，那么你应该去找本尼克·螺剪。他就在矮人区中心的铁匠铺。"
G["You'll be back."]="你会回来的。"
G["You'll be destroyed if the Twilight's Hammer brings this mountain down!"]="要是暮光之锤毁了这座山，你也会被一并毁灭掉！"
G["You'll be even more amazed after we take them out!"]="等到我们将他们彻底消灭的时候，你会更吃惊的！"
G["You'll be free to take it off when I die."]="等我死了，你就可以随便拿掉它。"
G["You'll be hanging at the gallows soon..."]="你很快就会被绞死……"
G["You'll be hanging in the gallows shortly, Scourge fiend!"]="你很快就要被押上绞刑架了，魔鬼！"
G["You'll be hearing from my lawyer!"]="你很快就会收到我的律师函了！"
G["You'll be joining the other guests now...."]="来跟其他的客人做伴吧……"
G["You'll be purchasing no hawkstrider here until you've proven your worth and dedication to our people.\n\nDo not return until you are considered exalted among the blood elves. Away with you!"]="No podrás comprar ningún halcón zancudo hasta que demuestres tu dedicación por mi pueblo.\n\n\n¡No vuelvas hasta que no te consideren exaltado! ¡Vete!"
G["You'll be purchasing no hawkstrider here until you've proven yourself at least friendly to our people."]="除非你在我们族人中的声望达到友好以上的程度，否则不能购买陆行鸟。"
G["You'll be sorry!"]="你会后悔的！"
G["You'll burn for that."]="你将为此烈火焚身。"
G["You'll burn for your crimes!"]="你的罪行将被处以火刑！"
G["You'll come then?"]="你会来吗？"
G["You'll die in this cave!"]="你要死在这座洞里了！"
G["You'll do no such thing. We simply haven't the room to keep you here. Now, kindly be on your way."]="绝对不行。我们没有多余的房间给你用。你还是走吧。"
G["You'll find Carolai Anise trying to blow up her house at the northwest end of town.  Why don't you go see if you can help her?"]="你会在城镇西北端发现卡罗莱·安尼斯正试图炸掉她的房屋。为什么你不去看看你能否帮她？"
G["You'll find Elder Grimtotem at the Lariss Pavilion in Feralas."]="恐怖图腾长者在菲拉斯的拉瑞斯小厅那里。"
G["You'll find Elder Northal inside the Transitus Shield in Coldarra."]="你可以到考达拉的永生之盾去找长者诺塔尔。"
G["You'll find Elder Starglade outside the gates to Zul'Gurub in Stranglethorn Vale."]="星林长者在荆棘谷的祖尔格拉布大门外面。"
G["You'll find Elder Whurain at Camp Oneqwah in Grizzly Hills."]="长者伍雷恩在灰熊丘陵的欧尼瓦营地。"
G["You'll find Ergll to the northeast. This should help you get across the bay more quickly."]="你可以在东北方找到厄格尔罗。这样你就能更快地跨越这道海湾了。"
G["You'll find Greatfather Winter in the center of the Valley of Strength. Just look for the tree."]="你可以在力量谷中心找到冬天爷爷。他就在圣诞树下。"
G["You'll find Horace Alder pacing about above the ground level of Lady Proudmoore's tower."]="霍拉斯·奥德尔就在普罗德摩尔女士的法师塔底层晃悠，你可以去那里找他。"
G["You'll find Innkeeper Renee inside the Gallows' End Tavern at the southeast end of the street running through town."]="你可以在穿过城镇的道路东南端的恐惧之末旅店里面找到旅店老板瑞尼。"
G["You'll find Krendle Bigpockets near the zeppelin's perch on the western edge of Spirit Rise. I'm not fond of the goblin contraption flying through here... but it will take you to Orgrimmar if you can stand it."]="你会在灵魂高地的西部边缘，飞艇停泊处附近找到克伦德尔。我可不喜欢看到那种地精机器从这里飞过去……但它的确能把你送到奥格瑞玛去，只要你在那上面没吐到晕过去。"
G["You'll find Marley Twinbraid up top, $gsir:ma'am;."]="马尔雷·双辫就在这上边，$g先生:女士;。"
G["You'll find a jewelcrafting trainer and supplies on the inner ring of the War Quarter."]="你可以在军事区内环找到珠宝加工训练师和供应商。"
G["You'll find her in the inner ring of the War Quarter."]="你可以在军事区的内环区域找到她。"
G["You'll find it in the northernmost part of the Dwarven District, near the Northern Landing."]="你能在矮人区的最北边，城北降落点的附近找到那间拍卖行。"
G["You'll find no finer rat kabob this side of Khaz Modan!"]="你在卡兹莫丹不会找到更好的老鼠肉烧烤店的！"
G["You'll find one of those outside the Bank of Orgrimmar in the middle of the Valley of Strength."]="你会在力量谷中央的奥格瑞玛银行外面找到它们中的一个。"
G["You'll find out soon enough. Are you ready for the next challenge?"]="Pronto lo descubrirás. ¿Estás $gpreparado:preparada; para el siguiente reto?"
G["You'll find plenty to do here, $n."]="你在这里可以找到很多事情做，$n。"
G["You'll find reagants and more at the Sisters Sorcerous in western Dalaran.\n\nJust mind the Mooreheads' black cat..."]="达拉然西部的巫术姐妹出售各种魔法材料。\n\n不过你要小心莫尔海德的那只黑猫……"
G["You'll find that goblin and his toy shop in the Valley of Honor."]="你会在荣誉谷找到那个地精和他的玩具商店的。"
G["You'll find the Krasarang Paddlefish AND that no-good goblin in the biggest pool of the Krasari River. Right in the heart of Krasarang Wilds. Right here. \n\n<Ben pokes a hole in your map with his claw.>"]="Encontrarás poliodóntidos de Krasarang y a ese mequetrefe goblin en el estanque más grande del río Krasari. Están justo en el centro de la Espesura Krasarang, justo aquí.\n\n<Ben hace un agujero en tu mapa con su garra.>"
G["You'll find the Mage Trainer, Cain Firesong, upstairs on the landing at the Gallows' End Tavern, which is on the southeast end of Brill.  I guess he checked in too late to get a room."]="你可以在恐惧之末旅店楼上的平台找到法师训练师凯恩·火歌的，恐惧之末旅店就在布瑞尔的东南端。我猜你现在去的话有点晚了，他不会再登记给你房间了。"
G["You'll find the Wind Rider Master in Orgrimmar.  Go north up the road to get there and ask an Orgrimmar Grunt for further directions."]="你会在奥格瑞玛找到双足飞龙管理员的。沿着公路向北走到那里去，并向一个奥格瑞玛步兵询问更多指示。"
G["You'll find the battlemasters in the war room of Stormwind Keep."]="你可以在暴风要塞找到战场军官。"
G["You'll find the city's Flight Master at Krasus' Landing in eastern Dalaran."]="你可以在达拉然东部的克拉苏斯平台找到飞行管理员。"
G["You'll find the trainer inside of Aldrassil, $n."]="你可以在奥达希尔找到训练师，$n。"
G["You'll find the warlocks in the Magic Quarter's main building, but I better not hear of any trouble that comes of this."]="你可以在魔法区的主建筑区域找到那些术士，我希望告诉你这些不会引起什么麻烦。"
G["You'll find them in the Apothecarium. Names are Doctor Herbert Halsey and Doctor Marsh. Just watch your back."]="你可以在炼金区找到他们。你可以叫他们赫伯特·哈尔希医生和马尔什医生。要小心。"
G["You'll find what you are looking for at One More Glass in northern Dalaran."]="达拉然北部的再来一杯应该能满足你的需求。"
G["You'll get no mercy from me."]="我可不会可怜你。"
G["You'll get nothing from me, $r!"]="你从我这里什么都别想得到，$r！"
G["You'll get nothing out of me!"]="你休想从我口中问出什么！"
G["You'll get nothing out of me, monster. I am beyond your ability to influence."]="你休想从我嘴里问出元帅的下落。我还不至于受你摆布。"
G["You'll get yourself killed!"]="你这是在送死！"
G["You'll get'm this time. Show no mercy!"]="这次你一定能击溃他们。不要手软！"
G["You'll go nowhere worms!"]="你们这些虫子，哪儿都别想去！"
G["You'll go nowhere, Skyguard scum!"]="你无处可逃了，天空卫队的渣滓！"
G["You'll go nowhere, fool!"]="¡No irás a ninguna parte, $gestúpido:estúpida;!"
G["You'll have to ask Mung-Mung about that. He maintains our foodstores."]="你得跟蒙蒙商量商量。是他在管理我们的存粮。"
G["You'll have to be patient with me, $n. I've got my Spybot inside working on a very delicate matter. I'll be with ya in a second.\n\nOh, and do me a favor, try not to let Lescovar see you... we're about to ambush him."]="Tienes que ser paciente conmigo, $n. Mi robot espía está ahí dentro, trabajando en un asunto muy delicado. Volveré contigo en un segundo.\n\nAh, y hazme un favor, intenta que Lescovar no te vea... estamos a punto de tenderle una emboscada."
G["You'll have to be patient."]="请你耐心点。"
G["You'll have to give me a moment, $c, the naga are attacking us right now. I'll speak to you as soon as the attack is done!"]="你必须给我一点时间，$c，纳迦正在攻击我们。搞定他们之后再来找我！"
G["You'll have to kill me, monster. I will tell you NOTHING!"]="你杀了我吧，怪物。我什么都不会说！"
G["You'll have to prove yourself to Nana and Haohan Mudclaw. Those two Mudclaws will be tough to sway, but I think you can do it."]="你得向娜娜·泥爪和郝瀚·泥爪证明自己。这两位泥爪家族的成员可不好说话，但我相信你能办到。"
G["You'll have to prove yourself to us before you're welcome here, $n."]="Tendrás que demostrar tu valía ante nosotros para ser $gbienvenido:bienvenida; aquí, $n."
G["You'll have to wrench me out of here!"]="有本事就把我从这里赶出去！"
G["You'll keep the bad people away, won't you?"]="你会赶走坏人的，是吗？"
G["You'll learn of that first hand. When my work is complete, you will beg for mercy -- and I will deny you. Your anguished cries will be testament to my unbridled power..."]="让我来亲自告诉你。当一切结束，你将跪求我的宽恕－－而我会拒绝你。你痛苦的哀号将是我狂野力量的最好证明……"
G["You'll learn to serve!"]="你们要学会服从！"
G["You'll look me in the eyes when..."]="看着我的眼睛……"
G["You'll make a fine corpse, $c."]="你会是一具不错的尸体，$c。"
G["You'll make a great addition to Silas' menagerie, Lobos."]="你在希拉斯的动物园里将成为一件精彩的展品，鲁博斯。"
G["You'll make no mention of me. Either of you!"]="不许对任何人提起我。你们俩听到了吗！"
G["You'll need a ride ticket to ride the carousel. Come and get your ride tickets!"]="你要先买木马门票才能玩旋转木马。快来买票了！"
G["You'll need game tokens to play the games. Come and get your game tokens!"]="有了游戏代币才能玩游戏。快来买游戏代币了！"
