G["You're both failures.  But it doesn't matter: with a pit lord on our side, we won't need foot soldiers OR dragons.  Behold!"]="你们全都是废物。但这没关系：我们有一个深渊领主，所以我们不需要士兵和龙。给我看着吧！"
G["You're breaking him!"]="你把他弄坏了！"
G["You're breaking my heart - I've quotas to fill, you know?  Can you wield a sword?  Off to the barracks."]="你让我很伤心呢——我得招满分配的名额，你知道吗？你能拿剑吗？去兵营报到好了。"
