G["You're exhausted. Go rest and prepare for the battle to come."]="你看起来精疲力尽。去休息下，为接下来的战斗做好准备。"
G["You're far from home, stranger."]="Estás lejos de tu casa, $gextranjero:extranjera;."
G["You're far too important to us to be lost that easily."]="你对我们至关重要，绝对不能这样轻易死掉。"
G["You're finally here. Take the scenic route?"]="你终于来了。喜欢这里的风景吗？"
G["You're fired!"]="你被解雇了！"
G["You're fired! <Cough...Cork clears throat.> I mean, help!"]="¡Estás $gdespedido:despedida;! <Cof... Cork carraspea.> Quiero decir... ¡ayuda!"
G["You're fooling yourself. Once Horde, always Horde. I see that now. I'm mobilizing the Kirin Tor."]="这是自欺欺人。一入部落，再难回头。我现在明白了。我正在动员肯瑞托。"
G["You're fourth in line, $r."]="Eres $gel cuarto:la cuarta;, $r."
G["You're fourth on the list, $r."]="Eres $gel cuarto:la cuarta;, $r."
G["You're free to enter Orgrimmar."]="你可以进入奥格瑞玛了。"
G["You're free to enter Stormwind."]="你可以自由进入暴风城了。"
G["You're free to go Orsonn, but first tell me what's wrong with the furbolg."]="奥索恩，你随时可以离开，但是请先告诉我熊怪们到底出了什么事。"
G["You're free to go now.  The way out is safe."]="现在你可以走了。出去的路很安全。"
G["You're free to go, miss."]="你可以走了，小姐。"
G["You're free, Dughal! Get out of here!"]="你自由了，杜格哈尔！快出去！"
G["You're free, Metzen. The bad greench can't hurt you anymore."]="你自由了，梅森。坏格林奇再也不能伤害你了。"
G["You're free, Millhouse. Get out of here!"]="你自由了，米尔豪斯。离开这儿吧！"
G["You're from that ship? Bad move. Theramore is HORDE land, now!"]="你是从那船上下来的？真不明智。塞拉摩现在是部落的地盘了！"
G["You're getting warmer... 7039 degrees Kraklenheit!"]="越来越暖和了……7039克氏度！"
G["You're going down!"]="¡Estás $gacabado:acabada;!"
G["You're going down, Mulv!"]="你完蛋了，穆维!"
G["You're going to be just fine."]="你会好起来的。"
G["You're going to be so nice and warm down here with us forever, beautiful!"]="你可真好，美人！愿意和我们永远留在一起！"
G["You're going to blow if you don't calm down! Don't you think it was a little bit convenient? The dragon flying over right as the winning field goal for the footbomb finals was kicked into Mount Kajaro?"]="如果你不冷静下来，你就要爆炸了！难道你不认为这样会比较方便吗？当足球炸弹最终被踢进卡亚罗山，胜负已定的时候，那头龙恰好飞过天空。"
G["You're going to cook in that?"]="你想穿着这个做菜？"
G["You're going to face Shatterhorn? You're brave, I'll give you that."]="你打算向裂角挑战？我说，你可真勇敢。"
G["You're going to fall!"]="你要摔下去了！"
G["You're going to have a play date with William and Donna later. How does that sound?"]="威廉和冬娜过会儿会成为你的玩伴。这听起来如何？"
G["You're going to have to do better than that to beat me."]="你得再加把劲才能打败我。"
G["You're going to have to pick it up, or this isn't going to be much of a competition."]="你要加把劲赶上来才行啊，否则这算什么比赛呢。"
G["You're going to have to pull out every trick you know in order to get in there."]="你必须施展出浑身解数才有可能潜入那里。"
G["You're going to have to take the fight to them, $n. Look for Izzy just outside their village."]="如果你要和他们战斗，$n，你可以在他们的村外去找小静。"
G["You're going to love this!"]="你一定会爱上这个的！"
G["You're going to pay for this outrage! Guards!"]="你要为此付出代价！来人啊!"
G["You're going to pull off a stunt on Jack in front of his boys?\n\nThat takes a good amount of... stupidity.  Well, it's going to cost you.  I'm not going to risk my life for anything less than a gold.  And you best wait til I'm out of the way before you make a move."]="你想公然和杰克叫板是吗？\n\n嘿，我得说着这绝对是个……愚蠢的决定。这会让你损失惨重的。我可不想冒着丢掉小命的危险去干这种一分钱都挣不来的破事。嗯，你最好等我跑远了再动手。"
G["You're going to put out the fires and stop those pirates from boarding us, right?"]="你会灭火并阻止那些海盗上船的，对吧？"
G["You're going to regret this, I assure you."]="你一定会后悔的，我保证。"
G["You're going to round up your best men and FIND MY SHIP!"]="你去召集所有精兵强将，给我把船找回来！"
G["You're going to tell us how to... \"un-compromise\" the sigils, aren't you?"]="Nos vas a decir cómo… \"descomprometer\" los sigilos, ¿no?"
G["You're going to wish you never fought me, I promise!"]="你一定会后悔与我交手的，我保证！"
G["You're going to wish you'd never set foot in Uldum!"]="你会后悔踏足奥丹姆的！"
G["You're gonna be sorry!"]="你会为此后悔的！"
G["You're gonna have to hammer harder than that, fella! Get a move on!"]="伙计们，埋头工作呀！快一点！"
G["You're gonna have to protect me, $n. Without my weapons and totems, I'm defenseless!"]="你必须保护我，$n。没有了武器和图腾，我完全没有自卫的能力！"
G["You're gonna hear from my lawyer!"]="等着收我的律师函吧！"
G["You're gonna hurt like you never hurt before when I'm through with ya."]="在我干掉你之前，我要让你尝尝前所未有的痛苦。"
G["You're good for nothing, Ribbly.  It's time to pay for your wickedness!"]="你干什么都不成，雷布里。现在该为你的邪恶付出代价了！"
G["You're good for nothing, Solomon!"]="你一无是处，所罗门！"
G["You're helpin' those farmers out, right, ace? We're countin' on you to get us some grub."]="你在帮那些农夫解决问题是吧，大好人？我们指望你能帮我们抓些虫子。"
G["You're helpless. You can't even leave that rock."]="Estás $gindefenso:indefensa;. Ni siquiera puedes abandonar esa roca."
G["You're here for Aska's order, then? Please tell her I said hello."]="你是来这里拿阿丝卡的订单的？请帮我向她问好。"
G["You're here to help with the heavy leather for the Ahn'Qiraj war effort, are you, $c? Good, good. As you can see I've collected $2066w, but we're going to need $2067w in total. That's a lot of skinning my friend, so I hope that your knife is sharp. The leather will go to all sorts of uses for making our war materiel and ensuring our success."]="Estás aquí para ayudar en la recogida de pieles de cuero pesado para la campaña de Ahn'Qiraj, ¿no es cierto, $c? Bien, bien. Como puedes comprobar, he reunido $2066w pero vamos a necesitar $2067w en total. Pues queda mucho que desollar, $gamigo:amiga;. Así que espero que tengas bien afilado el cuchillo. El cuero tendrá múltiples usos en la fabricación de pertrechos y asegurará nuestro éxito."
G["You're here! The Regent Lord had asked about you specifically. Are you ready to go?"]="你来了！摄政王特地问起了你。你准备好出发了吗？"
G["You're hit! We're losing your signal!"]="你被击中了！我们正在失去你的信号！"
G["You're hunting Deathclasp, $n?  Color me impressed.  I lost two of my men to her this week alone.  Let's hope your luck is better than theirs."]="你是在猎杀死亡弯钩吧，$n？我记得很清楚。这周我手下的两个家伙就是被她杀死的。希望你的运气比他们好。"
G["You're hurting her!"]="她都哭了！"
G["You're immune to my water spell! How can this be?"]="你竟然免疫我的水系法术！这怎么可能？"
G["You're impressive."]="你让我大开眼界，朋友。"
G["You're in for a rough ride, $n. I hope you've already made funeral arrangements."]="这趟飞行之旅可能不太安全，$n。希望你已经安排好了后事。"
G["You're in for a stunning surprise..."]="你相当震惊吧……"
G["You're in for a world o' hurt!"]="你们有苦头吃了！"
G["You're in for it now!"]="你要倒霉了！"
G["You're in luck! We got a great new shipment in."]="你真走运！我们刚进了一大批新货。"
G["You're in luck. I've got just what you need in the load I'm about to wash."]="你很走运。我刚装了些你需要的，正准备拿去洗。"
G["You're in ova ya head, bud."]="这是不自量力，伙计。"
G["You're in range! Drop the phase disruptor now!!!"]="距离正好！快投下相位扰流器！！！"
G["You're in the wrong place at the wrong time, $g pal:missy;!"]="你在错误的时间来到了错误的地点，$g小伙子:小姑娘;！"
G["You're in! Nalice has wards that negate my magic, so I won't be able to help you from here on out. Go get her!"]="你进去了！纳莉丝的守卫阻碍了我的魔法，所以从现在开始，我就没法继续指点你了。去干掉她！"
G["You're insane."]="你疯了。"
G["You're integral to our operation here, $n."]="我们在这里的军事行动少不了你的帮助，$n。"
G["You're interrupting work your feeble mind cannot possibly comprehend!"]="你现在妨碍的是你这榆木脑袋根本无法理解的工作！"
G["You're into leather, eh?  Sounds like you should talk to Simon Tanner over in Old Town.  He runs a shop there called the Protective Hide."]="你想要穿皮革对吗？听起来你该与旧城区的西蒙·坦纳尔谈谈。他在那儿开了一家叫做护体皮甲的商店。"
G["You're joking, right? I believe you're looking for the OTHER short fellow, Thonys Pillarstone. He's downstairs. Now skedaddle!"]="你在开玩笑，是吗？我认为你在寻找那个矮家伙，索恩斯·火石。他就在楼下。现在快逃吧！"
G["You're just a filthy pawn of the Ebon Blade. Die!"]="你不过是黑锋骑士团的走狗。去死吧！"
G["You're just gonna leave me here? How am I supposed to get home?"]="你想把我丢在这儿？那我怎么回去？"
G["You're just in time, $c.  Do you feel the ground shaking beneath you?\n\nSomething approaches from the hive.  Take a place near the grunts, $n.  I'm counting on you!"]="Llegas justo a tiempo, $c. ¿Sientes cómo tiembla el suelo bajo tus pies?\n\nAlgo se aproxima desde la colmena. Únete a los Brutos, $n. ¡Cuento contigo!"
G["You're just jealous I found a man with skills AND a fat wallet."]="你不过是在嫉妒我找到了一个有本事又有身家的男人。"
G["You're just the kind of scum that I'm looking for in my organization. You know, we're an independetly run franchise of the Southsea Freebooters. We have pretty good benefits, vacation, and full medical, dental, and vision. Maybe we should talk after you bring me back to life."]="我的组织正需要像你这样的帮手。要知道，我们是南海海盗独立运营的特许分支。我们向成员提供优厚的待遇、假期、全身检查、牙医和视力保健服务。也许我们应该等到你把我复活之后再谈。"
G["You're kidding, right? Ok, ok, don't panic. Luckily when I was imbueing it with the component that you retrieved, I attuned myself to it as well. I should be able to locate and summon it from wherever it is that you left it.\n\nAre you sure that you've lost it? You looked in all of your bags and the bank?"]="Estás de broma, ¿verdad? ¡Vale, vale! Que no cunda el pánico. Afortunadamente cuando lo estaba impregnando con el componente que recuperaste, entré en sintonía con él. Debería ser capaz de localizarlo y hacer que venga de dondequiera que lo hayas dejado.\n\n¿Estás $gseguro:segura; de que lo has perdido? ¿Has mirado en todas tus bolsas y en el banco?"
G["You're kidding, right? You came all the way here for THAT?!"]="你在开玩笑？你到这里来，就是为了这个？！"
G["You're late, $n.\nLet's get right to the point. Our latest recon shows the last of Shek'zeer's forces are holed up at the heart of the island. They're protecting a large weapons cache that Garrosh has ordered us to retrieve. Problem is they've activated the island's defenses, a massive impenetrable shield that enshrouds all of Zan'vess.\nThis is where you come in. I need you to take one of these gunships and shoot down the shield generators. As long as they're active none of our forces can reach the weapons cache."]="Llegas tarde, $n.\n\nVamos al grano. Nuestros últimos informes indican que las tropas de Shek'zeer que quedan se han atrincherado en el centro de la isla. Protegen un gran alijo de armas que Garrosh nos ha ordenado recuperar. El problema es que han activado las defensas de la isla, un escudo gigantesco e impenetrable que envuelve todo Zan'vess.\n\nAhí es donde entras tú. Quiero que subas a una de esas naves y dispares a los generadores de escudos. Mientras estén activos, nuestras tropas no podrán alcanzar el alijo de armas."
G["You're late, courier. No, I don't want any excuses; this errand is far too important."]="Llegas tarde, $gmensajero:mensajera;. No, no quiero excusas: esta tarea es demasiado importante."
G["You're late, overseer."]="监工，进展太缓慢了。"
G["You're laughin' now? You got tools! Thrall paid good money for those tools. Get out your blueprints and read them! If you can't build siege engines with the tools you're given, you can't build nothin', you are nothin', hit the bricks pal and take the first zeppelin out of here 'cause you are going out!"]="笑什么？你们手里拿着工具！萨尔花大价钱买了这些工具。把图纸掏出来好好看一看！要是你们不能借助工具造出攻城器械来，你们就是一帮一无是处的蠢货。那样的话，你们就给我滚！坐上地精飞艇马上给我滚！"
G["You're like something of a revered figure around here, $g man : kitten;.  Seems like everyone's talking about you.  That's cool.\n\nLet's see if there's something in stock that you're interested in.  We have a lot of nice stuff."]="Eres una especie de personaje venerado por aquí $Ghombre:nena;. Parece que todo el mundo habla sobre ti. Eso mola.\n\nVeamos si tenemos a la venta algo que te interese. Tenemos muchas cosas bonitas."
G["You're looking a bit lost.  Can I help you find something?"]="Al parecer, estás un poco $gperdido:perdida;. ¿Te ayudo a encontrar algo?"
G["You're looking at me...can you see me?\n\nPlease, help..."]="你在看着我……你能看见我吗？\n\n请你，帮帮我……"
G["You're looking at the most state-of-the-art mining operation in the world. Only rubes would bother to tunnel under a mountain to get at the minerals below. We moved the whole mountain! Now we can just scoop the precious metals right off of the ground."]="在你眼前的是这个世界上最具艺术品位的采矿系统。只有土包子才会在山下挖隧道以获得矿石。我们则会将整座山移开！现在，我们就可以直接从地面上挖掘珍贵的金属了。"
G["You're looking for Ku-Yao? I haven't seen him in days. You don't think he's in trouble, do you?"]="你在寻找姚枯吗？我好几天没有看到他了。你说他会不会遇到麻烦了？"
G["You're looking for Lau'Tiki.  You'll find him on Darkspear Strand out beyond Sen'jin Village to the south."]="你在寻找劳迪克。你会在南面的森金村外的暗矛海滩找到他。"
G["You're looking for Mishiki.  She has a hut to the south in Sen'jin Village."]="你在寻找米什基。她在森金村南面有一间小屋。"
G["You're looking for Tai'jin.  Find her in the barracks on the east side of town."]="你应该是在寻找泰金。在城镇东面的兵营里可以找到她。"
G["You're looking for The Filthy Animal in the Horde quarter of Sunreaver's Sanctuary, northeastern Dalaran.\n\nI am told it is a rather rough place, but with an excellent cooking trainer in its kitchen."]="你可以前往达拉然东北部的部落区，去夺日者圣殿的肮脏的野兽瞧一瞧。\n\n听说那里非常脏乱，但是有一位很棒的烹饪训练师。"
G["You're looking for Urtrun Clanbringer in the Horde Embassy.  Find it on the west side of the Valley of Strength."]="你在寻找部落大使馆里的乌特伦。在力量谷的西边你可以找到他。"
G["You're looking for the Cantrips and Crows Tavern in the western sewers."]="你要找的是咒语和乌鸦旅店吧，就在西部下水道。"
G["You're looking very handsome today, Martek."]="马特克，你今天看上去很英俊。"
G["You're losing grip.  Be careful!"]="你失去控制了。小心！"
G["You're lucky I don't kill ya right now... but I got bigger plans for ya."]="你该庆幸我现在不会马上杀了你……不过我为你准备了更重要的任务。"
G["You're lucky I don't kill you right now... you look delicious."]="我没痛下杀手就算你走运了……你看着很好吃。"
G["You're lucky I haven't fought in a while, $p."]="你很幸运，我有阵子没动手了，$p。"
G["You're lucky I'm not one of those green dragons that can see with their eyes closed."]="你该庆幸我不是绿龙，他们闭着眼睛都能看见东西。"
G["You're lucky it was just your pets... this time."]="算你走运，这次还只是你的宠物……"
G["You're lucky our clan leader is holding me back."]="算你走运，我们的部族首领没有让我出手。"
G["You're lucky you were near me, eh?!"]="你很幸运，能跟着我，嗯？！"
G["You're lucky you're on the other side of these bars!"]="你真该庆幸自己待在这些铁栅栏的另一侧！"
G["You're making that up."]="你要把它拉起来。"
G["You're messing with the wrong Mogu, $R."]="你找错魔古了，$R。"
G["You're more skilled in combat than I thought."]="你的作战能力比我料想的更强。"
G["You're much... better... than I thought..."]="你……比我想象中……更出色……"
G["You're my hero!"]="你是我的英雄！"
G["You're nearly done, $n!"]="你就要赢了，$n！"
G["You're never going to stop coming after me, are you?  Fine, but you won't take me down without a fight!"]="你似乎不愿意放弃尾随我的行动，是吗？那么好吧，让我们一较高下！"
G["You're next up! Unless someone cuts in front of you, that is."]="¡Tú eres $gel:la; siguiente! A no ser que se te cuele alguien, claro está."
G["You're next, small one!"]="你是下一个，小东西！"
G["You're ninth in line."]="Eres $gel noveno:la novena;."
G["You're no Scourge. What you doin' here, mon?"]="你不是天灾军团的成员。朋友，你来这儿做什么？"
G["You're no death knight. Away with you."]="你不是死亡骑士。离我远点。"
G["You're no magnataur!  Where... did you... find... such strength?"]="你不是猛犸人！你的……力量……是……怎么来的？"
G["You're no orc. You're a spy! Alliance spy!"]="你不是兽人。你是间谍！联盟的间谍！"
G["You're no superior of mine!"]="你又不是我老大！"
G["You're no warlock and I've no time for you.  Begone!"]="No eres $gun brujo:una bruja; y no tengo tiempo para ti. ¡Largo!"
G["You're not a druid!"]="你不是德鲁伊！"
G["You're not a guest!"]="¡No eres $gun: una; huésped!"
G["You're not a warrior!  You'd better go back inside the perimeter to where it's safe... no offense."]="你不是战士！你最好回到安全的地方去……当然，我这样说不是要冒犯你。"
G["You're not a what?  Not available?  Worry not, for my heart belongs only to the lady Doloria, though one as fair as you must command the hearts of many."]="你不什么？不会接受我？不必担心，我的心只属于多罗莉亚女士。但像你这样美丽的女子一定能征服许多男人的心。"
G["You're not allowed here!"]="你不能呆在这儿！"
G["You're not alone here?"]="你不是一个人来的？"
G["You're not alone, Tarenar.  You've made allies along the way.  And besides, you're a skilled paladin in your own right."]="你不是只身一人，塔伦纳。你一路上结交了许多盟友。除此之外，你自己本身就是个技艺高超的圣骑士。"
G["You're not bad, but let me show you a few tricks you might find handy."]="你还不坏，但让我耍耍几个小把戏，你可能会觉得很方便实用的。"
G["You're not cut out for this."]="你们完全不够格。"
G["You're not even fit to be fed to Leviroth."]="你还不够利维洛斯塞牙缝的。"
G["You're not from Twilight's Hammer. What is happening out there?"]="你不是暮光之锤的人。外面发生什么事了？"
G["You're not getting anything until you speak, scum!"]="不开口就别想得到任何东西，你这渣滓！"
G["You're not getting my sheep, scoundrel!"]="你这无赖，别想抢走我的绵羊！"
G["You're not going anywhere just yet, handsome.  Not until you regain your strength."]="你先好好休息吧，帅哥，恢复体力之后再说。"
G["You're not going anywhere!"]="你休想逃走！"
G["You're not going to get up from that one, friend."]="这一下你就别想再站起来啦，朋友。"
G["You're not gonna run me off my land!"]="你休想让我离开自己的土地！"
G["You're not here to start a fight in my brewery are you? Those two strangers over there started quite a brawl when they arrived last week."]="你不会是到我的酿酒厂来捣乱的吧？那边那两个陌生人上周到这里时还大打出手了呢。"
G["You're not hideous, Lilian... you're one of us.  Here, look in this mirror, see for yourself."]="你不丑，莉莉安……你跟我们一样。来，看看这面镜子，看看你自己的样子。"
G["You're not joining anyone, Thorsen.."]="索尔森，你没机会加入任何组织了…"
G["You're not leaving me to rot in this place! Take me with you!"]="你不能让我一个人在这儿自生自灭！带我一起走！"
G["You're not one of mine. King Mrgl-Mrgl must have sent you to talk terms of surrender. Come closer so that I might see you better."]="你不是我们的同胞。是姆嘎姆嘎国王派你谈判投降条件的吧。走近一些，让我好好看看你。"
G["You're not one of us!"]="你不是我们的人！"
G["You're not one of us!  Guards!\n\nOh please, don't hurt me!  Not the face!  Not the face!"]="你不是我们的同伴！卫兵！\n\n哦，请别伤害我！别打脸！别打脸！"
G["You're not one of us, are you...?"]="你不是我们当中的一员，对吧……？"
G["You're not only wasting the time of your fellow students, you're wasting my time too."]="你，你，还有你，根本就是在浪费同学们的时间，浪费我的时间。"
G["You're not quite in my league, honey."]="你和我不是一伙儿的，甜心。"
G["You're not so clever, assassin."]="No eres tan inteligente, $gasesino:asesina;."
G["You're not taking me without a fight!"]="我不会束手就擒的！"
G["You're not the only victims of the Scourge. Our lady Sylvanas sympathizes with your plight."]="你们不是亡灵天灾唯一的受害者。我们的希尔瓦娜斯女王很同情你们的遭遇。"
G["You're not thinkin' about stealing my explosives again, are ya?"]="你不会是又想偷我的炸药吧，是吗？"
G["You're not very good at this torture thing."]="看来你真不擅长折磨人。"
G["You're not welcome in these lands, monster!"]="¡No eres $gbienvenido:bienvenida; en estas tierras, monstruo!"
G["You're not with the Gordok or Gordunni tribes, right?"]="你不是戈多克或戈杜尼部族那边的，对吧？"
G["You're not with the rebellion, are you?"]="你不会是叛军吧，嗯？"
G["You're not with the revolutionaries are you?"]="你不是起义者吧？"
G["You're not worth the scrap you're made from!"]="你连一堆破铜烂铁都比不上！"
G["You're not worthy of Thorim!"]="¡No eres $gdigno:digna; de Thorim!"
G["You're not yet advanced enough to properly follow anything I might have to show you. I highly suggest you hone your crude skills with the sluggish stylings of Gloresse here before speaking with me."]="你的能力还不够，我教你的东西你肯定理解不了。我强烈建议你找葛洛莉丝谈一谈，先向她学习一点小花样，磨练磨练你的技术吧。"
G["You're nothing but backwater peasants with sticks! Get back in line!"]="你们不过是一群拿着棍子的乡下农夫！滚回去！"
G["You're nothing!"]="你无足轻重！"
G["You're obviously no farmer..."]="你显然不是农夫……"
G["You're of the bronze flight, you know what happens next! Can you just skip us ahead to all the real action?"]="你是青铜龙军团的一员，你知道接下来会发生什么！你就不能让我们直接开始实际行动吗？"
G["You're off the leather ball team!"]="你被皮球队开除了！"
G["You're okay, Firebeard. *urp* You're okay by me."]="你很好，焰须。（嗝儿）我喜欢你。"
G["You're on the wrong side for this one, old friends. Your caravan is ours now."]="老朋友们，你们站错了队。现在你们的运输队是我的了。"
G["You're on!"]="该你了！"
G["You're on, rats."]="你已经无路可退了。"
G["You're one of our bravest, $n.  All of the Skyguard is in your debt."]="你是我们当中最勇敢的骑士，$n。天空卫队感谢你。"
G["You're one of the fiercest-looking warriors I've ever seen, $n!"]="¡Eres $guno de los guerreros:una de las guerreras; más feroces que he visto jamás, $n!"
G["You're one of the shaman? Hm. I suppose you are free to choose your own path... whatever that path may be. Tuluun has an isolated, small camp in the northwest of Azure Watch."]="你是个萨满祭司？嗯，你可以自行决定未来要走的道路……哪条道路都行。图伦就在碧蓝岗哨西北方某处僻静的小营地里。"
G["You're one unusual $c, $n. I don't mean that it a negative way. I'm just sayin', you're kinda funny."]="Eres $gun:una; $c de lo más inusual, $n. No lo digo en el sentido negativo. Es solo que eres un poco $graro:rara;."
G["You're ours now, $r."]="$r，现在你是我们的了。"
G["You're out of your element, Lebronski! Uncalled for! Those iron dwarves won't know what hit 'em! Now why don't you get back to uncovering the mystery of the gigantic turd on your rug and leave the real scientists to their work!"]="雷波斯基，不懂就别折腾了！完全没有必要！那些铁矮人不会知道真相的！你不如回去调查到底是谁在你的地毯上捣鬼，这里的工作就交给真正的科学家吧！"
G["You're papers look to be in order.  Proceed."]="你还要把文件整理好。赶快去做。"
G["You're polluting our new home!"]="你正在污染我们的新家园！"
G["You're pretty good...for a rookie."]="No está mal... para $gun novato:una novata;."
G["You're pushing it, $n."]="你太过分了，$n。"
G["You're quick on your feet.  Keep it up!"]="你跑的真快。加油！"
G["You're really playing to win, huh?"]="你真是志在必得啊，对吧？"
G["You're relieved, Honor Guard. Return to the temple."]="你的重担已经卸除，荣誉卫兵。回圣殿去吧。"
G["You're right! We can do this!"]="你说得对！我们能做到！"
G["You're right! What was I thinking? Bring on the Scourge!"]="你说得对！我在想什么呢！天灾军团，放马过来吧！"
G["You're right, I can come back to this later. I think it's time to see what's behind the door near the entrance. I'm going to sneak over there, nice and quiet. Meet me at the door and I'll get us in."]="好吧，以后再来这里。我觉得我们应该瞧瞧入口附近的门后面到底隐藏着什么秘密。我会悄悄地潜行过去。到门口找我吧，我能带你们进去。"
G["You're right, Uther. Forgive me. I... I don't know what got a hold of me. We will deliver this information to the King and the knights that battle the Scourge within Icecrown Citadel."]="你是对的，乌瑟尔。原谅我。我……我不知道自己是怎么了。正在冰冠堡垒与天灾军团作战的国王和骑士们很快就会得到我们的报告。"
G["You're right, far too weak.  Needs more remora.  Try it again!"]="你说得对，真是一点劲儿都没有。还得加入更多的鮣魚油。重试一次！"
G["You're right, of course, it's a terrible practice."]="嗯嗯，你说得对。这是一种可怕的行为。"
G["You're right, of course. Carry on."]="你当然是对的。继续。"
G["You're right. I didn't sign up to build a war base."]="你是对的。我可没签过什么建造战争基地的合约。"
G["You're routing this attack through Dalaran? Proudmoore will suspect the Sunreavers! Stop this immediately!"]="你在策划对达拉然的袭击？普罗德摩尔会怀疑夺日者的！你给我立刻停下！"
G["You're safe now, Beak. C'mon back to Donnelly!"]="你安全了，尖喙。到东尼利这儿来！"
G["You're selling cologne and perfume?"]="你有香水出售？"
G["You're seventh in the queue."]="Eres $gel séptimo:la séptima;."
G["You're seventh on my list."]="Eres $gel séptimo:la séptima; en la lista."
G["You're shaping up nicely, $n. I've heard good things..."]="你一直进行得不错，$n。我听到好消息了……"
G["You're shayin' you wan... you wan... *hic* you wan' me to dansh on dis bar? *hic*"]="你……你刚才说想让……让我……在……在吧台上……跳舞？*嗝儿*"
G["You're sixth in line."]="Eres $gel sexto:la sexta;."
G["You're stealing my inventory, aren't you?"]="你在偷我的发明，对不对？"
G["You're still alive! Good. There's chaos in the city streets."]="你还活着！很好。城里的街道已经乱作一团了。"
G["You're still here?  Your foolishness is amusing!  The Argent Dawn wench needn't suffer in vain.  Leave at once and she shall be spared!"]="你还在这里？你的愚蠢简直是太有趣了！银色黎明派来的这个女人本来不用白白受苦的。马上离开这里，她就不会有事！"
G["You're stronger than I thought."]="你比我想象中强大。"
G["You're such a good friend, Twinkle.  You'd never leave me, would you?"]="你是一位好朋友，咪咪。你永远都不会离开我，对吗？"
G["You're such a hero, you've got so much gold - why you coming down here and wasting your time on a bunch of losers?"]="像你这样能赚大钱的英雄，跑来这里做什么呀？干嘛在失败者身上浪费时间呢？"
G["You're such a sweet lad.  Here, take this horse over to your stable."]="你真贴心。喏，将这匹马牵到你的马厩去吧。"
G["You're supposed to be doing your chores!"]="自己的事应该自己做！"
G["You're supposed to hit the big guy, not me."]="你应该去打那个大个子，不是我。"
G["You're sweet for asking, $c, but we have all of the light leather that we need. May be that one of the others in charge of collecting around here is in need of your assistance though?"]="谢谢你的关心，$c。但是我们已经集齐轻皮了。或许这儿负责收集物资的其他人需要你的帮助。"
G["You're talking to the wrong orc. I don't train novices. Talk to young Whuut over there... and use small words."]="你找错兽人了。我不训练新手。去问问那边的小伍特……谦虚一点。"
G["You're telegraphing your moves."]="你的招式全是破绽。"
G["You're telling me! It's even stranger considering between Brann, Rutgar, me and the monkey, we know 38 different languages including a touch of Titan - both Vanir and Aesir.\n\nSo anyway, whatever she was click clacking about, it definitely wasn't with anyone \"present.\" She then nodded and went on the offensive! Attacked us outright!"]="¡Y que lo digas! Sobre todo porque entre Brann, Rutgar, el mono y yo hablamos 38 idiomas, incluido un poco de titán, tanto vanir como aesir.\n\nEn todo caso, sea lo que fuere que decía, no hablaba con nadie que estuviera \"presente\". Después, asintió con la cabeza y pasó al ataque... ¡con todas sus fuerzas!"
G["You're the best I've ever seen. I can't believe I'm saying this but you might have a chance against Skyshatter. And hey, if that doesn't go so well you can be my wing man..."]="你是我见过的最棒的飞行员。真不敢相信我竟然说出这样的话，但是你很可能和汤告鲁士·碎空不相上下哦。还有，要是刚才的进展不是特别顺利的话，你就是我的飞行员了……"
G["You're the best thing I've seen since the troggs showed up!"]="从穴居人出现的那天起，我就再没有像现在这样高兴过！"
G["You're the best trainer here!"]="你是这里最好的训练员！"
G["You're the best!"]="你是最棒的！"
G["You're the best, $n - thanks for going trick-or-treating for me!"]="你真好，$n——谢谢你陪我玩要糖果的恶作剧游戏！"
G["You're the best, $p!"]="你真了不起，$p！"
G["You're the bomb!"]="你就是炸弹！"
G["You're the bomb-diggity, $n!"]="你简直是炸弹狂人，$n！"
G["You're the boss."]="你说了算。"
G["You're the champion now, buddy! Do you think you have what it takes to defend your title?"]="¡Ahora eres $gel campeón:la campeona;, colega! ¿Crees que tienes lo que hay que tener para defender tu título?"
G["You're the contingency plan. Your mission is to infiltrate Theramore Isle."]="应急计划由你前去执行。你的任务是混进塞拉摩岛。"
G["You're the first person to come through that door who isn't in shock, injured, or both.\n\nI'm hoping that means you can help."]="Eres $gel primero:la primera; en atravesar esa puerta sin estar en shock, $gherido:herida; o las dos cosas.\n\nEspero que eso signifique que nos puedes ayudar."
G["You're the great champion brought to battle the Aspect of Death?"]="¿Tú eres $gel gran campeón:la gran campeona; que ha venido a luchar contra el Aspecto de la Muerte?"
G["You're the greatest, $p!"]="你是最棒的，$p！"
G["You're the hero that is supposed to be my undoing?"]="¿Tú eres $gel héroe:la heroína; que iba a ejecutar mi caída?"
G["You're the last of your tribe with any sense left.  As a reward for giving us Prince Nadun, I grant you the gift that is your birthright and more!"]="你们部族只剩下你们还有些理智。既然你们将纳顿亲王交给我们，作为回礼，我将你们生来就应该继承的东西赐予你，另外，我还会赐予你们更多强大的礼物！"
G["You're the last one. Hop on that sea plane and we'll get going. The King has placed a lot of trust in you."]="你是最后一个。快上那架飞机，马上出发。国王很信任你啊。"
G["You're the lucky one."]="Eres $gel afortunado:la afortunada;."
G["You're the man from my dream!"]="你就是那个在我梦里出现过的人。"
G["You're the most handsome boyfriend a girl could hope for. Knock 'em dead, honey!"]="你是一个女孩所能梦想的最英俊的男朋友。所有女孩都会为你神魂颠倒，甜心！"
G["You're the one my aunt sent? A test, no doubt. I'll kill you quickly and prove myself to her once again."]="你就是我的姑妈派来的那个家伙？毫无疑问，这是一次测试。我会迅速地干掉你，再一次向她证明我的实力。"
G["You're the one that's been disrupting things? This should be easy."]="你就是那个捣乱的家伙？要对付你，真是易如反掌。"
G["You're the one who should be-- Wait, we have company..."]="你真应该被——等等，我们有伴了……"
G["You're the one who tracked down the brutes who did this to us."]="Eres $gel que:la que; siguió la pista de los soldados que nos hicieron esto."
G["You're the one who was supposed to be watching for orcs!"]="你才是负责防范兽人的人！"
G["You're the one, $n. You must defeat the Trade Prince or all is lost."]="全靠你了，$n。你必须击败贸易大王，否则我们将一败涂地。"
G["You're the strongest of us - show'm how it's done, my king!"]="国王陛下，您拥有最强大的力量——让他们见识一下吧！"
G["You're too late to stop our plan."]="你已经来不及阻止我的计划了。"
G["You're too late! The accord has been negotiated. Only the details remain. Small details... like you!"]="你来晚了！协议已经达成。只剩下一些无关紧要的细节。比如……如何处理你！"
G["You're too late, $n. Another visitor from Dalaran came asking after information about the same prismatic dragon blades."]="你来晚了，$n。来自达拉然的另一位访客已经来过这里，同样是为了了解有关远古龙剑的事情。"
G["You're too late, Bouldergut. The proverbial cavalry has arrived!"]="你太迟了，石胆。大名鼎鼎的骑兵已经到了！"
G["You're too late, now feel the wrath of my warhounds!"]="已经晚了，让我的狗撕碎你们吧！"
G["You're too late, puny one."]="太晚了，小鬼。"
G["You're too late. I must start again from the beginning...."]="太晚了。我不得不重新开始……"
G["You're too ugly and scrawny to be a female yeti! And now you're making me mad..."]="你也算是雌雪人吗？又丑又不丰满！你快让我抓狂了……"
G["You're tough!"]="你真难对付！"
G["You're tougher than you look."]="你比你看起来要厉害。"
G["You're toying with death."]="你们这是在找死。"
G["You're trespassing!"]="你侵入了我们的地盘！"
G["You're truly a force to be reckoned with. The beast is done with. Let's get out of here."]="你可真是位骁勇善战的勇士。那怪物已经被解决了。我们离开这里吧。"
G["You're under arrest."]="你被捕了。"
G["You're useless, Quimby!"]="你这没用的废物，奎比！"
G["You're very welcome! I must be on my way... be safe, all of you."]="非常感谢！我要上路了……大家都要多加小心啊！"
G["You're wasting time. Go kill the minions of the Lich King, $c!"]="别再浪费时间了。$c，消灭巫妖王的爪牙！"
G["You're wasting your time.\n\nI'm not going anywhere."]="别白费力气了。\n\n我哪儿都不去。"
G["You're way cooler than Uncle Chen."]="你比陈叔酷多了。"
G["You're weak! COME ON!"]="你这个弱者！来吧！"
G["You're weak, old woman!"]="你像老太婆一样虚弱！"
G["You're wearing my patience thin, grunt. I've put the new flare gun in your pack. Try not to lose this one!"]="我对你越来越没耐心了，步兵。我又在你的包裹里放了一把新的信号枪。嗯？为什么要说“又”呢？这次别再弄丢了！"
G["You're welcome among us anytime, $n."]="Siempre serás $gbienvenido:bienvenida; entre nosotros, $n."
G["You're welcome to stay at the Farstrider Enclave for as long as you'd like, $c.  We welcome any who would aid us in our endeavors in the Ghostlands."]="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; al Enclave del Errante, $c. Quédate todo el tiempo que quieras. Son bienvenidos todos los que nos apoyan en las Tierras Fantasma."
G["You're welcome.... Now tell us what's going on in here!"]="不客气……告诉我们这儿发生了什么事！"
G["You're what's for dinner!"]="我要拿你当晚餐！"
G["You're willing to give up an Ata'mal crystal... just to see your plan against Illidan through?  You intrigue me, Broken.  Perhaps I'll play along... for now, at least."]="¿Me darías un cristal de Ata'mal... solo para llevar a cabo tu plan contra Illidan? Me intrigas, $gTábido:Tábida;. Puede que colabore... por ahora, al menos."
G["You're with the Earthen Ring, I just figured you'd have a water breathing spell like the rest of them."]="你与大地之环同在，我刚刚想到你应该和他们一样，获得水下呼吸的法术效果。"
G["You're working your way up... higher than me, at this point! You should talk to Springspindle Fizzlegear in Ironforge! (He'll? She'll?) show you more than I ever could!"]="你在努力上进……现在甚至已经超过我了！你应该与铁炉堡的宾斯匹德谈话！（他会？她会？）让你见识那些我所做不到的！"
G["You're wrong, banshee.  We've come to take Gidwin back."]="你错了，女妖。我们就是要带吉德文回去的。"
G["You're... sixth in line."]="Eres $gel sexto:la sexta;."
G["You're... working for the Shado-Pan? I can't believe it!"]="你……在为影踪派效力？我不敢相信！"
G["You've FAILED, Mekkatorque! I've caught and defeated you before you even set FOOT in my precious city!"]="你失败了，梅卡托克！别想踏入我宝贵的城市！"
G["You've a good eye for ingredients."]="你挑选配料很有眼光啊。"
G["You've absorbed 3 Static Charges. Your next Storm Hammer will deal massive AoE damage!\n|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_nature_lightningoverload.blp:32|t"]="Has absorbido 3 cargas estáticas. ¡Tu siguiente Martillo de tormenta infligirá un daño de área de efecto masivo!\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_nature_lightningoverload.blp:32|t"
G["You've accepted my surrender."]="你接受我的投降了。"
G["You've all accomplished a great thing in saving Shen-zin Su. You do us all proud."]="你拯救了神真子，成就了一番伟大的事业。我们所有人都为你骄傲。"
G["You've almost got him! Og'nor ka Lok'tar - Now we finish this!"]="胜利在望了！Og’nor ka Lok’tar——让我们给他个了断！"
G["You've already bested one of our riders today, so I cannot accept your challenge."]="今天你已经战胜了一位骑兵，我不能再接受你的挑战了。"
G["You've already done me a great service, $n. For that I thank you.\n\nThe least I can do now is tell you what brought me here: My long time friend Trey Lightforge and I came to Jaedenar to investigate the Shadow Council when they caught us unprepared. They took Trey deeper into Shadow Hold and put me in here after taking all of our equipment... I can still hear his screams from below, $n. They were... inhuman. I don't know what they've done to him, but they will pay for it."]="Ya me has prestado un gran servicio, $n. Te lo agradezco.\n\nLo menos que puedo hacer ahora es decirte lo que me trajo hasta aquí. Mi viejo amigo Trey Forjaluz y yo vinimos a Jaedenar para investigar al Consejo de la Sombra cuando nos pillaron por sorpresa. Condujeron a Trey a las profundidades de la Guarida Sombría y a mí me dejaron aquí después de quitarnos todo nuestro equipo... todavía puedo oír sus gritos desde las profundidades, $n. Fueron... inhumanos. No sé lo que le habrán hecho, pero pagarán por ello."
G["You've already learned everything I can teach you, $n. Talk to the night elf Lilyssia Nightbreeze in the Mage Quarter of Stormwind if you want to continue your studies. I hear she's a good teacher."]="你已经学会了我能教给你的所有东西，$n。如果你还想继续学习的话，去找暴风城法师区的暗夜精灵莉琳希亚·夜风谈话。我听说她是个好老师。"
G["You've angered me for the last time $n!"]="你惹恼了我，这是最后一次了，$n！"
G["You've bagged them all: Bach'lor, Banthar, Gutripper, and even the mighty Tusker!  You're truly the finest big game hunter that I know!"]="Los has metido a todos en el saco: Bach'lor, Banthar, Arrancatripas, y ¡hasta la poderosa Eburnia! ¡Realmente eres $gel mejor cazador:la mejor cazadora; que conozco!"
G["You've become quite the hunter, $n! Not only have you proven your skills, you also bested Daryl, which gets you extra points in my book!\n\nYou're welcome here any time."]="¡Te has hecho $gtodo un cazador:toda una cazadora;, $n! No solo has probado tus habilidades sino que has derrotado a Daryl, ¡y eso te da aún más puntos!\n\nSiempre serás $gbienvenido:bienvenida;."
G["You've become strong indeed, child. This is good. You will need that strength soon."]="你的确变强了，孩子。这很好。这力量很快就会有用武之地。"
G["You've beel afflicted with Master Hsu's Deadly Poison.  Detox yourself to remove it!"]="你受到了许大师致命毒药的折磨。快帮自己解毒！"
G["You've been MALOWNED!"]="你已经被玛罗恩搞定了！"
G["You've been a great help thus far, $n. You would do well to help out the others at the encampment.\n\nAnd don't worry about those goblins, I'm taking care of everything."]="Has sido de gran ayuda hasta ahora, $n. Harías bien en ayudar a los demás en el campamento.\n\nY no te preocupes por esos goblins, me estoy haciendo cargo de todo."
G["You've been a really big help here at the Temple!\n\nI heard the Elder Sage say that he's glad you arrived when you did."]="你真是帮了我们寺院大忙了！\n\n我听大贤者说他很高兴你的到来。"
G["You've been a tremendous help, $r! Let's get out of here before more of those things show up! I'll let Dwarfowitz know you did the job asked of ya' admirably."]="你给予了我们相当大的帮助，$R！我们赶紧离开这儿吧，免得再惹麻烦上身！我会转告杜瓦弗维兹，说你出色地完成了自己的任务。"
G["You've been afflicted by Spirit's Wrath.  Run away!"]="你受到了灵魂之怒的影响。快跑开！"
G["You've been bitten by a worgen.  It's probably nothing, but it sure stings a little.\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_monsterfang_02.blp:32|t"]="你被狼人咬了。可能这没什么，但肯定会有些痛。\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_monsterfang_02.blp:32|t"
G["You've been cut off, $n.  No more ale for you."]="你已经喝得够多了，$n。我不能再卖啤酒给你了。"
G["You've been just as busy blowing yourself up as you have blowing up the opposition.  That sounds fun, but be careful or I'll stop giving you bombers..."]="Has estado tan $gocupado:ocupada; volando por los aires que has hecho volar por los aires a los adversarios. Suena divertido pero ten cuidado o dejaré de darte bombarderos.."
G["You've been making quite a name for yourself around here, $r.  Good for you.\n\nWe trust that you won't let that go to your single head, and that you'll still help out by banishing demons?"]="你在这里的知名度已经相当高了，$r。这是件好事。\n\n我相信你不会被溢美之词冲昏了头脑，你会继续帮助我们放逐恶魔的，对吗？"
G["You've been paid good coin for non-stop passage, miss. We have no time for delays..."]="你已经获得不菲的报酬来完成这次直达行程，小姐。我们可没时间耽搁……"
G["You've been seen! Use the net and ice slick to keep the dwarves away!"]="你被发现了！快使用投网和地面速冻，别让那些矮人靠近你！"
G["You've been so nice, $n. I've been trapped here so long thanks to Verinias. That young elf was the first soul I've tasted in ages."]="你真是太好了，$n。因为维林尼亚斯，我被关在这儿太久了。那个年轻的精灵是我多年来尝到的第一个灵魂。"
G["You've been spotted!  Club your target to death before you are unmasked!"]="你被发现了！在暴露之前把目标杀死！"
G["You've been such an unbelievably big help! These bones are going to unlock so much new information and help me futher my research."]="你们真是帮了我的大忙！这些骨头包含了很多新的信息，这对我将来的研究有很大的帮助！"
G["You've been summoned by Lago Blackwrench, warlock master of Ironforge. You'd do yourself well to report to him immediately. You'll find him in the Forlorn Cavern district of the city."]="铁炉堡的术士拉戈·黑钳在找你，你要立刻到他那里向他报告。你可以在铁炉堡的荒弃的洞穴里找到他。"
G["You've been swallowed by the Ik'thik Colossus!"]="你被伊克提克巨像吞下去了！"
G["You've been trained well."]="你的师父教出了个好徒弟。"
G["You've been unmasked!  Get to safety, then put your disguise back on!"]="你被发现了！到安全的地方，重新穿上伪装服！"
G["You've been |cFFFF0000|Hspell:107268|h[Sabotaged]|h|r!"]="你已被|cFFFF0000|Hspell:107268|h[破坏]|h|r击中！"
G["You've betrayed the Kirin Tor, Sunreaver. You've allowed Garrosh to move his forces through MY city."]="你背叛了肯瑞托，夺日者。是你让加尔鲁什的军队进入我的城市。"
G["You've brought me way too much worg-hide, $n!"]="你带来的座狼皮太多了，$n！"
G["You've caught me at a critical time in my research!  No worries, you're welcome to join me in quiet contemplation... emphasis on \"quiet\", if you don't mind though."]="¡Me has pillado en un momento crítico de mi investigación! No te preocupes, puedes unirte a mí en contemplación silenciosa... pero hago hincapié en \"silenciosa\", si no te importa."
G["You've caused enough damage, Glop. The earth welcomes you no longer."]="你造成的伤害够多了，戈洛普。大地不再欢迎你了。"
G["You've come a long way, $n. A long way indeed... But I knew you were destined for great things.  We all knew. All hail $n!\n\nAnd thanks again for taking care of our gnome problem..."]="Has recorrido un largo camino, $n. Muy largo, sí... Pero sabía que tu destino te reservaba grandes cosas. Todos lo sabíamos. ¡Saludad todos a $n!\n\nY gracias por ocuparte de nuestro problema gnomo..."
G["You've come far, my young student. I see within you a great hero. I leave the fate of this land to you."]="你功不可没，年轻的徒儿。看得出来，你有一颗英雄的心。这片土地的未来就托付给你了。"
G["You've come for the doctor's plans! You'll only find death!"]="你是冲着博士的计划来的！你只有死路一条！"
G["You've come for training in order to pass it on to your pets?"]="你来接受训练为的是把它传递到你的宠物身上？"
G["You've come for training. Good!"]="你是来接受训练的，很好！"
G["You've come further than many, $n. Respect the elements around you and you shall fare far greater than most."]="你已经比许多人都走得更远了，$n。敬畏大自然的力量，你就会取得比大多数人都要伟大的成就。"
G["You've come seeking your death? Happy to oblige."]="你来自寻死路吗？很高兴能帮到你。"
G["You've come to address the men, sir?"]="您是来给士兵们训话的吗，长官？"
G["You've come to help, $c? Let us stay together for a while."]="你是来帮忙的，$c？让我们暂时待在一起。"
G["You've come to prove yourself, fleshling?  The Crumbling Depths lie northeast.  The stone you seek is within."]="你要来证明你自己吗？碎岩之渊在东北方。你要找的石头就在那里。"
G["You've come to test the might of the Onslaught?"]="想见识见识先锋军的实力吗？"
G["You've come to the right place! Halfhill Market's got everything you need."]="你来对地方啦！半山市集有你需要的所有东西。"
G["You've come to the right place, buddy! Halfhill Market's got everything you need."]="你来对地方啦，哥们！半山市集有你需要的所有东西。"
G["You've come to the right place, friend! Halfhill Market's got everything you need."]="¡Has venido al lugar idóneo, $gamigo:amiga;! El Mercado del Alcor tiene todo lo que necesitas."
G["You've come to the right place, my good friend! Halfhill Market's got everything you need."]="¡Has venido al lugar idóneo, mi $gbuen amigo:buena amiga;! El Mercado del Alcor tiene todo lo que necesitas."
G["You've come to the right place, neighbor! Halfhill Market's got everything you need."]="¡Has venido al lugar idóneo, $gvecino:vecina;! El Mercado del Alcor tiene todo lo que necesitas."
G["You've come to the right place, stranger! Halfhill Market's got everything you need."]="¡Has venido al lugar idóneo, $gforastero:forastera;! El Mercado del Alcor tiene todo lo que necesitas."
G["You've come where you are not welcome."]="这里不欢迎你们。"
G["You've completed the quest!"]="你已经完成了使命！"
G["You've convinced me of your intentions, $n, and you have my thanks for being willing to help out the members of my former mercenary company, The Veiled Blade.\n\nNow let's see, what's next on our list of things to do?"]="Me has convencido de tus intenciones, $n, y te agradezco que desees ayudar a los miembros de mi antigua compañía de mercenarios, La Espada Enmascarada.\n\nY ahora veamos qué es lo siguiente en la lista de cosas por hacer."
G["You've crossed into the domain of red dragons, $r."]="你进入了红龙的统治领域。"
G["You've dealt the decisive blow against the Shadowpine trolls, $n. I only hope that we can muster our forces quickly enough to finish them off before they receive reinforcements from Zul'Aman.\n\nIt would be nice if Tranquillien were to reinforce us."]="Has asestado el golpe decisivo contra los trols Sombrapino, $n. Solo espero que podamos reunir nuestras fuerzas lo suficientemente rápido como para rematarlos antes de que reciban refuerzos de Zul'Aman.\n\nEstaría bien que Tranquillien nos proporcionara refuerzos."
G["You've defeated the Iron Council and unlocked the Archivum!  Well done, lads!"]="你们击败了钢铁议会，打开了档案馆！干得好，伙计们！"
G["You've destroyed too much of my work!  Prepare to join them in the Nether!"]="你毁了我的工作成果！准备堕入虚空之中吧！"
G["You've done a lot for us.  I am here on an important assignment but if you need passage to the Caverns of Time I'd be glad to take you there."]="你为我们做了很多。我来这里是为了执行一项重要的任务，不过如果你需要前往时光之穴的话，我很乐意带你去那里。"
G["You've done all that I've asked you to do, $n. There's really nothing more here for you. If you are interested in continuing your career as an agent of the Thorium Brotherhood, speak with Lokhtos Darkbargainer at the Grim Guzzler in Blackrock Depths.\n\nFarewell!"]="Has hecho todo lo que te he pedido, $n. Ya no puedes hacer nada más. Si te interesa continuar tu carrera como agente de la Hermandad del Torio, habla con Lokhtos Tratoscuro en la Tragapenas, en las Profundidades de Roca Negra.\n\n¡Adiós!"
G["You've done great work here, friend. We should have a strong base of operations here going forward - see if anyone else needs your help."]="你在这里做得十分出色，朋友。我们应该很快就能建立起强大的行动基地了——去看看还有没有别人需要你的帮助。"
G["You've done great work. We should be able to maintain our base of operations here now without too much trouble."]="你干得十分出色。我们现在应该能轻松守住这里的行动基地了。"
G["You've done it!  Now quickly, lets attack it while it's grounded."]="你做到了！就现在，趁它倒地时展开攻击。"
G["You've done it! You've broken the defenses of Ulduar. In a few moments, we will be dropping in to..."]="成功了！你瓦解了奥杜尔的防御设施。用不了多久，我们就可以进入……"
G["You've done it! You've saved the tablets. Hurry and bring them to Ironforge. I'll be along once I've had some time to recover."]="你成功了！你拯救了这些石板。赶快把它们送到铁炉堡。我恢复一下就会赶回去。"
G["You've done it, $n! <The strangely familiar voice seems to be coming from the phial!> Hurry back! The fallout will only remain stable for thirty minutes."]="你成功了，$n！<这奇怪而熟悉的声音似乎是从瓶子中传出来的！>快回来！辐射尘的稳定期只有三十分钟。"
G["You've done it, heroes! Stratholme is ours! Come, we wait just outside the Slaughterhouse!"]="英雄们，你们成功了！斯坦索姆是我们的了！来吧，我们就等在屠宰房外面！"
G["You've done much work today, $n. We will resume your training tomorrow."]="你今天做了许多工作，$n。我们明天再继续训练。"
G["You've done so much for Old Hillpaw, that old geezer is probably missing your company right now. You should ask him to help on the farm."]="你为老农山掌做了这么多，这个老家伙可能正在怀念有你陪伴的时光。你应该叫他来农场帮助。"
G["You've done the Crusade proud, $n!"]="你是北伐军的骄傲，$n！"
G["You've done the impossible, shaman. You have stilled the vortex within him without losing yourself, in turn. Your love for him... must be very great."]="你做到了不可能的事情，萨满。你平息了他心中的漩涡，而不是被它所吞噬。你对他的爱……一定非常伟大。"
G["You've done us exemplary service, $n. Between dealing with the gnolls at the Underlight Mines, and the mummified trolls in the Amani Catacombs, you've dealt a mighty blow to our enemies!\n\n$G Good job! : We should get together for drinks sometime, what do you say?;"]="Nos has prestado un magnífico servicio, $n. Entre ocuparte de los gnolls de las Minas Sondaluz y los trols momificados de las Catacumbas Amani, ¡has asestado un gran golpe a nuestros enemigos!\n\n$G ¡Buen trabajo! : Deberíamos quedar para tomar algo algún día, ¿qué me dices?;"
G["You've done well for yourself, I can see that.  But to enter the Celestial Tournament, you must prove yourself as a leader.  When you have taken fifteen battle pets to their maximum level, you may attempt the trials that await you there."]="我能看得出来，你的个人实力很强。但要想参加天神比武大会，你还必须证明自己的领导能力。只有等你将十五只战斗宠物练到满级之后，才能面对这里的挑战。"
G["You've done well, $c.\n\nMy men and I are now prepared to face the enemy."]="干得好，$c。\n\n现在我和我的人已经准备好面对敌人了。"
G["You've driven them back to the Horde."]="你把他们又推向了部落。"
G["You've earned my aid.  Where to?"]="你赢得了我的帮助。现在去哪儿？"
G["You've earned my trust hero. Simply place my staff on the Thunder King's dais and it will do the rest. You are very brave to take this mission on; good luck!"]="我相信你，英雄。将我的法杖放到雷电之王的平台上，它会搞定一切。敢接受这个任务的都是勇士。祝你好运！"
G["You've faced the best of our trainees, and defeated them all. Now let's see what you're really made of..."]="你不仅挑战了我们最强的弟子，还将他们全部击败。现在让我们来瞧瞧你到底是何方神圣……"
G["You've failed us all, $n. Deathwing has won. The world is doomed."]="你令我们所有人失望了，$n。死亡之翼赢了。世界的末日已至。"
G["You've failed your race. You've failed all life on Azeroth. Because of you, everyone you've ever known will die... gruesomely and painfully."]="你令你的种族失望。你令艾泽拉斯的所有生灵蒙羞。因为你，你所认识的每个人都将死去……可怖而痛苦地死去。"
G["You've fallen right into my trap!"]="你落进了我的陷阱！"
G["You've found a cure!  We will crush our enemies!"]="你治愈了我！让我们的敌人尝尝失败的滋味吧！"
G["You've found another piece of the puzzle! This was carved by the mogu. They were frustrated - a thousand years with no orders from their master, and their bodies had turned to flesh. The mogu began to argue among themselves."]="你又找到了这个谜题的新线索！它是魔古族所刻。他们很沮丧——主人已经一千年没有下达指令了，他们的身体也变成了血肉之躯。他们发生了内讧。"
G["You've found another stone! What have we learned? The \"curse of flesh\" made the mogu mortal. Ah - but later, they found a way to reverse the process. A clever race."]="¡Has encontrado otra piedra! A ver qué dice. La \"maldición de la carne\" volvió mortales a los mogu. Ah, pero más tarde consiguieron revertirla. Una raza inteligente."
G["You've found for us our only lead. The rogues from Ravenholdt are behind this."]="你帮我们找到了唯一的线索。拉文霍德的盗贼就是幕后黑手。"
G["You've found nothing?  Very well.  Over there next."]="什么都没找到？好吧。去另一簇看看。"
G["You've found something?"]="你找到什么了？"
G["You've freed me!  The winds speak to my people once again and grant us their strength.  I thank you, stranger."]="¡Me has liberado! Los vientos vuelven a hablar con mi pueblo y nos otorgan su fuerza. Te lo agradezco, $gextranjero:extranjera;."
G["You've gained Mogu Power!  Pick up more runes and your power will grow."]="你获得了魔古能量！捡起更多的符文会继续增强你的能量。"
G["You've gone mum and dad, you have!"]="你要去找妈妈爸爸吗？去吧！"
G["You've got a darkness in you, $r."]="$r，我能感受到你内心的阴暗面。"
G["You've got a lot of shinies. Lucky."]="你有好多闪闪发亮的东西。运气真好。"
G["You've got a lot to make up for, Jitters. I won't give you the easy way out."]="基特斯，你有许多东西需要补偿。我不会轻易放过你的。"
G["You've got a miscievious look in your eye. What have you been up to, babe?\n\nWell?"]="你的眼睛里有一种恶作剧的意味。你想要干什么？\n\n嗯？"
G["You've got him, keep it up!"]="他中招了，继续！"
G["You've got it all wrong. I'm a subjugator!"]="你搞错了。我是黑暗压制者！"
G["You've got money and we've got food.  What are you waiting for?!"]="你有金钱，我们有食物。那么你还在等什么？！"
G["You've got more guts than brains, coming to me without the proper training. Go talk to somebody closer to your skill level, like the orc Kamari, who lives in the Drag of Orgrimmar."]="你没经过适当的训练就来找我，说明你勇气有余而智慧不足。去找个接近你的技术水平的人谈话，像兽人卡玛瑞，他住在奥格瑞玛的暗巷区。"
G["You've got my attention, dragon.  You'll find I'm not as easily scared as the villagers below."]="你吸引了我的注意力，龙。跟下面那些村民不一样，我可不容易被吓倒。"
G["You've got my attention."]="你吸引了我的注意。"
G["You've got quite the setup here, friend. Come with me while I find out who's in charge."]="这里的情况你已经很清楚了，朋友。跟我来，我们找出到底谁是这里的头领。"
G["You've got real talent and a passion for making potions. There is one little matter I'd like you to take care of, though."]="你在配制药剂方面确实有才华和激情。然而，我还有一件事要你打理一下。"
G["You've got some fight in you! Blood and honor, friend!"]="你很有斗志！愿鲜血与荣耀与你同在，朋友！"
G["You've got something I need, Astor. And I'll be taking it now."]="你有我所要的东西，阿斯托。我现在要拿走它。"
G["You've got the hang of it. I can't teach you any more, but talk to Arthur Moore, a Forsaken who works in the Rogues' Quarter of the Undercity. Tell him I sent you."]="你已经掌握了它的用法。我没有什么要教你的了，但是找亚瑟·摩尔谈谈，他是在幽暗城盗贼区工作的一位被遗忘者。告诉他是我派你去的。"
G["You've got the moves, $n. Now use them!\n\nOr are you looking for some new moves?"]="你已经掌握了诀窍，$n。尽量使用它们！\n\n你还想知道一些新的诀窍吗？"
G["You've got the moves, $n. Use them!"]="你已经掌握了诀窍，$n。尽量使用它们！"
G["You've got this handled."]="被你轻松摆平了。"
G["You've got to save me here, $c! He's gone mad... mad I telll you! His inability to stop the flooding of Thousand Needles has caused him to go completely bonkers!\n\nHe blames me for everything, including the Cataclysm. He probably thinks that I'm Deathwing in disguise, or something!\n\nHelp!"]="你一定要救救我，$c！他已经疯了……疯了知道吗！由于他不能改变千针石林被洪水吞没的事实，他已经彻底精神失常了！\n\n他把一切都怪罪到我头上，包括大灾变。他可能认为我是死亡之翼或什么东西假扮的！\n\n救命！"
G["You've got to try some of this beer."]="你一定要试试这种啤酒。"
G["You've got us workin' up a sweat here, $p. We'll have our defenses in place in no time!"]="你帮了我们的大忙，$p！我们马上就会把防御工事建起来！"
G["You've got yourself a duel, $c."]="你这是给自己找打，$c。"
G["You've gotten in my way one too many times, gnome."]="Te has cruzado en mi camino demasiadas veces, $gnomo:gnoma;."
G["You've grown a few inches around the waist, little brother! Come down here and give your sister a hug!"]="你的腰变粗了几寸，小兄弟！到这里来，给你的姐姐一个拥抱吧！"
G["You've had enough time to recover from your wounds, Gal'ressa. The time has come for you to return to the road."]="加尔蕾萨，你花了好些时间养伤，现在是你重新上路的时候了。"
G["You've heard about the Tram have you?  What a ride that thing is!  You'll find it in the Dwarven District towards the back.  Oh, and be sure to keep your arms and legs inside the tram while the tram is in motion."]="你听说地铁了是吗？那可真是一样不错的交通工具！你会在矮人区的后部找到它。哦，一定记得在地铁行进时把你的胳膊和腿放到地铁里面。"
G["You've helped me clear the roads of all that nasty wildlife, so I suppose I have no choice.  Let's get going!"]="你们帮我消灭了道路上的那些凶狠的怪物。看样子，我已经没什么可抱怨的了。让我们出发吧！"
G["You've impressed everyone here today with your skills in the arena.  It is now time to be recognized before all as a champion of the tournament."]="Hoy has impresionado a todo el mundo con tus habilidades en la arena. Ya es hora de que todos te conozcan como $gel campeón:la campeona; del torneo."
G["You've impressed me so far, $n. How do you feel about helping me in creating the ultimate dish?"]="$n，至今为止，你给我留下了深刻的印象。想不想帮我烹制出终极菜肴？"
G["You've interfered with our plans for the last time, foolish $c!"]="¡Ha sido la última vez que interfieres en nuestros planes, $gestúpido:estúpida; $c!"
G["You've just crossed a terrible threshold, Arthas."]="阿尔萨斯，你做出了一个非常可怕的决定。"
G["You've learned nothing."]="你什么都学不会。"
G["You've let too many customers get away. Perhaps you should try again?"]="离开的顾客太多了。你要再试一次吗？"
G["You've let your pride cloud your vision, Titan puppet! You can never contain ME!"]="你被骄傲蒙蔽了双眼，泰坦的傀儡。你休想阻止我！"
G["You've made a good start, but you still have a great deal to learn, $n."]="你有了一个好的开始，但是你要学的还有很多，$n。"
G["You've made a wise decision to join my Horde."]="你们加入我的部落是一个明智的选择。"
G["You've made the right decision, $c.  You'll find our battlemaster, Glordrum Steelbeard, in the Hall of Arms.  Good luck, $n!"]="你做出了正确的选择，$c。你可以在武器大厅找到军官格罗杜姆·钢须。祝你好运，$n！"
G["You've managed to walk right into my trap!"]="你已经径直走进了我的陷阱！"
G["You've meddled in affairs that were none of your business. You are nothing but a foreign invader. Prepare to die!"]="多管闲事。你只是闯入巨魔帝国的外来者。去死吧！"
G["You've more'n earned my vote."]="我一定会投你一票。"
G["You've no doubt noticed the string of earthquakes we've had in the last weeks.  Something doesn't feel right about them."]="你们肯定已经注意到在过去几周内发生的数次地震。这让我感到有些蹊跷。"
G["You've not had a steed until you've taken the reigns of a finely bred Barak Tor'ol mountain ram, my friend.  Please, feel free to inspect these fine companions to any adventurer.  They'll serve you well, believe me."]="No habrás tenido un corcel hasta que no hayas cogido las riendas de un carnero montañés de raza pura Barak Tor'ol, $gamigo:amiga;. Por favor, examina cuanto quieras estos fieles compañeros de cualquier aventurero. Te servirán bien, créeme."
G["You've plundered our treasures too long.  Prepare to meet your watery grave!"]="一直以来你都在掠夺我们的财宝。这次准备葬身鱼腹吧！"
G["You've proven more than capable of defeating any enemy.  I would be honored if you stand guard through the ritual, young hero."]="你已经证明了你有能力击败任何敌人。有你作为仪式的守卫让我倍感荣幸，年轻的英雄。"
G["You've proven true to your word, Earthmender.  For that, we will spare you our wrath."]="你证明了你所言不虚，大地治愈者。为此，你将免遭大地之怒。"
G["You've proven yourself a very capable game hunter, $n.  But there's still one beastie that haunts your dreams... Tusker!"]="Has demostrado ser $gun cazador:una cazadora; muy capaz, $n. Pero todavía hay una bestia que se aparece en tus sueños... ¡Eburnia!"
G["You've proven yourself to Sho. She did say she would watch your back if you ever needed it. You can just ask her to watch your crops instead."]="你已经向阿烁证明了你自己。她说如果你在任何时候需要帮助，她都会义不容辞。你可以请她来帮你照看庄稼。"
G["You've put in your time studying the basics. Now it's time to up the ante."]="你已经花时间学习基础知识了。现在该提高了。"
G["You've reached a Horde bonfire! Desecrate this bonfire and stamp it out!"]="你发现了一堆部落篝火。亵渎这堆篝火，扑灭它吧！"
G["You've reached an Alliance bonfire! Desecrate this bonfire and stamp it out!"]="你发现了一堆联盟篝火。亵渎这堆篝火，扑灭它吧！"
G["You've reached an Earthen Ring bonfire!"]="你到达了大地之环大篝火！"
G["You've reached the limits of my enchantments. Sedana can instruct you further."]="我所掌握的附魔技能都传授给你了。去找瑟丹娜吧，她能教给你更多东西。"
G["You've reached the limits of my skill. Farii was my instructor, and I'm sure she'll instruct you as well."]="我没有什么能教给你的了。去找我的导师法里谈谈吧，她会传授给你更多关于珠宝加工的新知识的。"
G["You've reached too far, serpent. You shall suffer greatly for your trespass!"]="你们太过火了，毒蛇。你们会为这次入侵付出惨重的代价！"
G["You've really outdone yourself this time, Mrs. Chambers. Not a spot of mold to be found!"]="你这次确实已经尽了自己最大的努力，查伯斯夫人。一个铸模都没有找到！"
G["You've received Volatile Greenstone Brew! Use it in combat to help defeat multiple enemies."]="你获得了烈性绿石佳酿！在战斗中使用它可以帮助你打败多个敌人。"
G["You've reclaimed a few paltry territories. Pathetic. In short order they will again be mine!"]="你们收复了一些微不足道的失地。可怜虫。很快我们就会再度攻占它们。"
G["You've restored my health!  I'm in your debt, $n."]="你帮我恢复了健康！我欠你个人情，$n。"
G["You've returned with the spirits of water and earth. You make an old master proud."]="你把水灵和土灵带回来了。我为你感到骄傲。"
G["You've ruined this batch!  Why must I work with you worthless Gan'arg."]="你把这一批全都给毁了！为什么我要和你这个渣一样的甘尔葛一起工作。"
G["You've ruined your own lands, you'll not ruin mine."]="你们已经毁掉了自己的土地，别想再毁掉我的。"
G["You've saved both myself and my son."]="你救了我和我儿子。"
G["You've saved me, $c. Thank you!"]="你救了我，$c。谢谢你！"
G["You've saved me, fleshling! Ameer will hear of this noble act."]="你救了我的命！我会把你的功绩汇报给阿米尔的。"
G["You've saved my life!"]="是你救了我一命！"
G["You've saved my life, $c.  Protect me for a few more moments while I recover."]="你救了我， $c。在我体力恢复之前，请再保护我一段时间。"
G["You've saved us!  Now we need to get out of here."]="你救了我们！现在我们得离开这里了。"
G["You've sealed your fate, Akama.  The Master will learn of your betrayal!"]="你的死期就要到了，阿卡玛。主人马上就会得知你的背叛！"
G["You've served our cause with great loyalty, $n.  Allow me to present you with an unending source of our elemental quintessence."]="你做得很好，并体现出了极大的忠诚，$n。请允许我向你展示我们的永恒精萃。"
G["You've sniffed every inch of this city."]="你已经把城里的每个角落都嗅遍了！"
G["You've some sting in you, human."]="你的恶臭真刺鼻，人类。"
G["You've started down an honorable path, $n. My ancestors respect your willingness, but you will not have my approval until you have followed through with my tasks.\n\nYou know what you must do if you wish to prove yourself a hunter in spirit."]="Has iniciado un camino honorable, $n. Mis ancestros respetan tu voluntad, pero no tendrás mi aprobación hasta que no hayas seguido paso a paso mis instrucciones.\n\nDebes saber lo que tienes que hacer si deseas saber si tienes espíritu de $gcazador:cazadora;."
G["You've strayed too far from the Stonemother's gaze, dragon.  It is time that you be put in your place."]="你远离了石母的注视，石龙。是时候让你回到你的位置了。"
G["You've strayed too far from your comfortable soil, $r."]="$r，擅自闯入他人的地盘就是你的不对了。"
G["You've stumbled right into my trap."]="这下你可上我的当了。"
G["You've stumbled upon the wrong camp!"]="你走错了地方！"
G["You've succeeded in defending the bridge. The summon ritual has been completed."]="你成功地守住了这座桥。召唤仪式完成了。"
G["You've successfully freed your spirit! You can serve as my eyes. Together we'll get to the bottom of this."]="你成功释放了自己的灵魂！现在你可以充当我的眼睛了。让我们找出真相。"
G["You've sufficiently advanced in the field to be beyond my ability to teach. I hear there's a skilled engineer named Roxxik in the stinking pit of a city they call Orgrimmar who might be able to train you."]="你在工程学上的造诣已经完全超越了我，我没有什么可以教你的了。我听说臭气熏天的奥格瑞玛里面有一位名叫罗克希克的工程师，他技艺精湛，应该能做你的老师。"
G["You've surpassed my own knowledge, but Bemarrin over there can teach you far more."]="你的锻造技能已经超越了我所掌握的范围，不过那边的波玛尔能教给你更多知识。"
G["You've taken a lot of bombers out and don't have much to show for it.  Use more caution or your flight priveledges will be revoked..."]="你执行过很多次轰炸任务了，但是表现得非常一般啊。你最好当心点，不然我就吊销你的飞行执照……"
G["You've taught me what it means to have friends, $n."]="你让我明白了朋友的意义，$n。"
G["You've underestimated us!"]="你太小看我们了！"
G["You've wasted enough of my time... let these games be finished!"]="你们浪费了我太多的时间……让这场游戏结束吧！"
G["You've wasted too much time, mortals. Now you shall fall."]="你浪费了太多的时间，凡人。长眠吧！"
G["You, \"orc\", will make an excellent addition to my family!"]="Tú, \"orco\", ¡serás una adquisición excelente para mi familia!"
G["You, $c! We require your aid! The brutish Warsong orcs are destroying the wonder and beauty of Ashenvale, and we need your strength to meet them on the field of battle. Return with us to Azeroth and fight for the honor of the Silverwing Sentinels! Will you join us?"]="嗨，$c！我们需要你的帮助！战歌氏族的那些野蛮兽人正在破坏风景如画的灰谷，我们希望你能在战场上跟这帮家伙一较高下。跟我们返回艾泽拉斯世界，为了银翼哨兵的荣耀而战！好吗？"
G["You, <Snort> you are strong <Gurgle>. But..."]="Tú <bufido> eres fuerte <gorgoteo>. Pero..."
G["You, Aethas, will be coming with me."]="你，艾萨斯，跟我走一趟吧。"
G["You, Chief!"]="是您，酋长！"
G["You, Felguard.  Hold this area."]="你，恶魔卫士，守住这片区域。"
G["You, Wrathion, will be blindfolded."]="你，拉希奥，将被蒙上眼睛。"
G["You, and your Alliance, are welcome in Paw'don."]="坡东村欢迎你，还有你的联盟。"
G["You, brave hero - you are strong enough to leap into the center of events as they transpire."]="而你，勇敢的英雄——你很强大，足以搅动时代的狂澜。"
G["You, hold there!"]="你，站住！"
G["You, honored paladin.  Please come here.."]="尊贵的圣骑士，请你过来……"
G["You, in harmony with nature, and only your skills to survive.  This is the way that the Earth Mother intended it to be.  You will want to find Bale on the Hunter Rise."]="你，与自然和谐相处，而只有靠你的技能才能生存。这就是大地母亲想要的方式。你会在猎人高地找到拜尔的。"
G["You, initiate. Where are the troops?"]="新兵，我们的军队在哪？"
G["You, meet up with Commander Nightwind at the harbor, immediately."]="你，立刻去港口与指挥官夜风会面。"
G["You, my dark prince, will be blindfolded."]="你，黑王子，将被蒙上眼睛。"
G["You, over there. Come kill my jailer!"]="你，说你呢。干掉我的看守！"
G["You, pandaren! You will be back in chains where you belong."]="你，熊猫人！你很快就会重新戴上镣铐。"
G["You, soldier, report back to Kargath at once!"]="你，立刻去卡加斯报告！"
G["You, stranger... you are not one of my soldiers. Will you stay and stand with me to face the enemy?"]="你……你，不是我的士兵。你愿意留下来和我共同抗敌吗？"
G["You, there! Hand over that moonstone and nobody gets hurt!"]="你！快交出月亮石，我保证任何人都不会受到伤害！"
G["You, too, are beautiful, Voss. Have you looked in a mirror recently?"]="你也很美啊，沃斯。最近照镜子了吗？"
G["You, too, shall be charred to ash!"]="你，也将化为灰烬！"
G["You, too, shall know the silence!"]="你们也将随之沉寂。"
G["You, too, shall serve!"]="你，也必将臣服在我的脚下！"
G["You, what have you done?"]="你——你都干了什么？"
G["You.  Me.  We're done."]="你，我，我们结束了。"
G["You... Don't think I don't see you. Leave me alone!"]="你…别以为我看不到你。离我远点！"
G["You... I've seen you in Shattrath..."]="你……我在沙塔斯城见过你……"
G["You... Rook knows you...."]="你……鲁克认识你……"
G["You... Shado-Pan. You're here to help me?"]="你……影踪派。你是来帮助我的？"
G["You... The frame! How? You must not... It... the Destroyer..."]="你……那杖柄！怎么可能？你该不会……那……那是毁灭者……"
G["You... WHAT?\n\nCome over here and say that!\n\n<Kristoff kicks and flails his limbs in a frothing rage, his head twisting around to glare at you.>\n\nSo help me, I will - I am going to - I will knock your brains out! I will fill the empty cavity left behind with my boot! Come here! GET BACK HERE!\n\n<Kristoff strains to grasp your neck, his fingers wriggling inches from your face.>"]="你说……什么？\n\n过来给我再说一遍！\n\n<克里斯托弗因愤怒而乱踢乱抓，面目扭曲的瞪着你。>\n\n快来帮我，不然我就——我就——我就把你打个鼻青脸肿！然后把靴子踩在你肮脏的脸上！你过来！快给我回来！\n\n<克里斯托弗奋力想要掐住你的脖子，抓挠的手指尖几乎就要碰到你的脸。>"
G["You... You saved me? I'm a damned monster! YOU'RE A DAMNED MONSTER! LOOK AT YOURSELF!"]="你……你救了我？我是个被诅咒的怪物！你也是个被诅咒的怪物！看看你自己吧！"
G["You... You'll get nothing... And like it..."]="你……你什么都别想……别想知道……"
G["You... are marked."]="你……被我盯上了。"
G["You... are next."]="你……就是下一个。"
G["You... are the disease... not I..."]="你……是疾病……不是我！"
G["You... betrayed me. You betrayed us all, monster! Face the might of Mograine!"]="你……背叛了我。你背叛了我们所有人，怪物！感受莫格莱尼的力量吧。"
G["You... bunch... of... dookers!"]="你们……这……帮……暴徒！"
G["You... cannot escape us!"]="你逃不出我们的手心！"
G["You... cannot win... this war..."]="你们……休想赢得……这场战争……"
G["You... die now!!"]="你……死吧！"
G["You... half-idiot!  You really did it this time.  I'm going to have to make it look like your leg's broken."]="你……你这蠢货！你的胆子可不小。别怪我狠心，至少我得让你看起来像是断腿的伤员。"
G["You... half-idiot... what got into you?  Pulling off something like that on her?  Did you think she wouldn't notice?"]="你……自作聪明的家伙……你想什么呢？打算夺取属于她的功劳吗？你以为她会被你蒙在鼓里？"
G["You... have... bested me..."]="你……把我……打败了……"
G["You... must... contain... it..."]="你们……必须……阻止……它……"
G["You... never get outta here... alive."]="你们……休想活着……逃出这里……"
G["You... will not defeat... the thunder..."]="你……休想击败……雷……"
G["You... will pay for that, old man.  Slay them all!"]="你……会为此付出代价！杀光他们！"
G["You... will... leave... this... man!"]="你……会……离开……这个人的……躯体！"
G["You... will... pay."]="你……会为此……付出代价。"
G["You... you escaped me in Vashj'ir. You won't be so lucky here."]="你……在瓦斯琪尔逃过一劫，这次你没这么走运了。"
G["You... you're not going to try to eat me, are you?"]="你……你不会吃掉我的，对吧？"
G["You... you're not one of the Alliance? Good."]="你……你不是联盟的成员？很好。"
G["You... you're not one of them, are you? You've got to help me!"]="你……你不是他们一伙的吧，是吗？你得帮帮我！"
G["You... you're the one from the portal... the druid of flame..."]="你……就是那个从传送门来的人——烈焰德鲁伊……"
G["You...friend of Nordrassil...take what remains of my strength...and fight back the flames..."]="你，诺达希尔之友！带走我残余的力量，击退烈焰的进攻！"
G["You...will...burn..."]="你……将……燃尽……"
G["You?\n\n<Lorax laughs.>\n\nThat is doubtful.\n\nI stand in these ruins and dream. Dream of the day that I catch that miserable thief, Goraluk Anvilcrack.\n\nWe had a deal, him and I. A deal that he broke. Betrayed."]="你?\n\n<罗拉克斯笑了。>\n\n这很令人怀疑。\n\n我站在这些废墟和梦想之中。梦想着我捉住那个可怜的贼——古拉鲁克的那一天。\n\n我们达成了一项协议，他和我。但他违背了我们的协议。他背叛了我。"
G["You? A lone orc? Against me and..."]="就你？区区一只兽人？也想对抗我……"
G["You? Join the Tillers? Ha! You'd have to prove your farming skills to all five members of our Council. They would never vote for you!"]="你？想加入阡陌客？哈！你得让那五名有表决权的委员会成员认同你的耕作能力。他们永远都不会对你投赞成票！"
G["You?! I hear all 'bout you. My juju be strong. You not gonna stop the Zandalari!"]="你？！我对你知道得一清二楚。我的魂能很强大。你阻止不了赞达拉部族！"
G["Young Blanchy stomps her foot jealously."]="小马布兰契心怀嫉妒地跺着脚。"
G["Young Dustback Mushan cries for help!"]="沙背穆山幼兽大声求救！"
G["Young prince, I hope you take this lesson to heart."]="年轻的王子，希望你能记住这一课。"
G["Young proto-drake eggs line the cavern floor. Many recently hatched eggs fill the surrounding area. With this many proto-drakes, no place would be safe from Garrosh's invasion."]="山洞里整齐地码放着始祖龙蛋。周围散落着许多刚刚孵化的蛋。有了这么多始祖龙，加尔鲁什的入侵足以威胁到任何地方。"
G["Young serpents are much more playful than their adult counterparts."]="幼年翔龙要比成年翔龙顽皮得多。"
G["Your \"Alliance\" is all flash, no strength whatsoever."]="Vuestra \"Alianza\" no es más que humo, ni rastro de fortaleza."
G["Your \"Empress\" has fallen. The Klaxxi have pronounced judgment. Stand aside or be brushed away."]="Tu \"Emperatriz\" ha caído. Los Klaxxi han pronunciado sentencia. Apártate o te destruiremos."
G["Your \"Horde\" is a disgusting pack of animals, hardly worth enslaving."]="Vuestra \"Horda\" es una manada de animales que ni siquiera vale la pena esclavizar."
G["Your Alliance is WEAK!"]="你们联盟太弱了！"
G["Your Alliance is not welcome here."]="这里不欢迎联盟。"
G["Your Alliance must be at its end if you're sending your children against me."]="你们联盟山穷水尽了吗，居然派孩子来对付我。"
G["Your Blackrock Disguise has fallen off!"]="你的黑石伪装掉了！"
G["Your Capacitor will Discharge in 10 Seconds! Get to a Drill!"]="你的电容器将在10秒后进行电能释放！快靠近闪电钻！"
G["Your Grip is Failing!"]="你快抓不住了！"
G["Your High Inquisitor is nothing more than a pile of meat, Crusaders! There are none beyond the grasp of the Scourge!"]="十字军，你们的大检查官已经死了！没有人能逃出天灾军团的控制！"
G["Your Highness, we should study it. Weaponize it! The Horde already outnumber us here on Pandaria. We need to gain every possible advantage."]="陛下，我们应该好好研究它。把它变成我们的武器。部落在潘达利亚的军力已经超过了我们。我们需要利用一切可能的条件。"
G["Your Highness, with $n's help, I have completed my investigation into what happened aboard the Bravery."]="殿下，在$n的帮助下，我已经完成了对勇者号上所发生事情的调查。"
G["Your Horde finds itself at a turning point. This war will define you."]="部落正面临转折。这场战争将定义你们。"
G["Your Horde has no power here."]="你们部落在这里毫无力量。"
G["Your Horde is nothing to the Kolkar!"]="你们$r对于科卡尔部族来说什么都不是！"
G["Your King is calling his pack to him, assembling an Alliance in the truest sense of the word."]="你的国王召唤狼群，组成了“联盟”，赋予这个词真正的涵义。"
G["Your Lord will feel every moment of the pain you are about to endure."]="你们的主人会感觉到你们所经受的每一点痛苦。"
G["Your Majesty! We've finally restored Taylor's last transmission."]="陛下！我们终于复原了泰勒最后发出的信息。"
G["Your Shaman can't protect you."]="你们的萨满救不了你们。"
G["Your Steeljaw is now haunting this place... I can feel it."]="钢腭的灵魂仍在这里徘徊……我能感觉到。"
G["Your Warchief has got that bell, and he's goin' to use it to make the Horde stronger."]="你们的酋长得到了那口钟，然后用它来使得部落变得更加强大。"
G["Your aberrations are no match for the Alliance, Putress! We're coming for you!"]="这些畸形的野兽挡不住联盟！普特雷斯，等着瞧吧！"
G["Your accent is strange. Are you from the Valley of the Four Winds?"]="你的口音很奇怪。你是从四风谷来的吗？"
G["Your actions are illogical. All possible results for this encounter have been calculated. The Pantheon will receive the Observer's message regardless of outcome."]="你们的行动不合逻辑。这场战斗所有可能产生的结果都已被计算在内。无论结果如何，万神殿都会收到观察者发出的信息。"
G["Your actions in the coming weeks will come to define your people."]="你在不久的未来定义你的人民。"
G["Your actions shame us all, $c. I hurt inside as I beat you senseless."]="你的行为让我们蒙羞，$c。我感到深深的耻辱，所以你死定了。"
G["Your actions shame us all, $c. It pains me to beat you senseless!"]="你的行为让我们蒙羞，$c。我感到深深的耻辱，所以你死定了。"
G["Your actions were pivotal in successfully reclaiming the city. Rivendare's death signifies the beginning of a new era for the Plaguelands. The few remaining Scourge should fall easily, and the land will at last be reborn."]="你们行动的目的是夺取这座城市。对于瘟疫之地，瑞文戴尔的死亡标志着一个新时代的到来。残存在这里的天灾军团很快就会被消灭干净。这片土地终将得到重生。"
G["Your actions will have grave consequences if you do not move from your path of war."]="如果你继续在战争的路上越走越远，你的行为一定会引发严重的后果。"
G["Your actions will no doubt attract the attention of the Shado-Pan. I may even get to meet one!"]="你们的行为必定会引起影踪派的注意。说不定我能见到他们！"
G["Your actions will not be tolerated!"]="你的行为是无法得到宽恕的！"
G["Your age of this world has passed."]="你们主宰世界的时代已经过去了。"
G["Your agony rejuvenates me."]="你的挣扎只会让我精神百倍。"
G["Your agony sustains me."]="你们的痛苦支撑着我。"
G["Your agony will be BOUNDLESS!"]="你将痛不欲生！"
G["Your aid is required, $n. Help us stop the brutish Horde!"]="我们需要你的帮助，$n。帮我们阻止那些凶残的部落！"
G["Your airship just about took out our balloon!"]="你们的飞艇差点把我们的气球弄爆了！"
G["Your allies have arrived, Jaina, just as you promised. You will all become powerful agents of the Scourge."]="你的盟友到了，吉安娜，你说的没错。全都变成效忠我的天灾战士吧。"
G["Your allies think you are weak."]="你在盟友的眼中就是个弱者。"
G["Your allies will leave you behind."]="你的盟友们抛弃了你。"
G["Your anger is not misguided."]="你的愤怒并非受到误导。"
G["Your approach is... unorthodox.  Though, I suppose with the smoke from the fires, all they'll see is your silhouettes."]="你们的点子实在是……出人意料。但烈焰浓烟的遮掩下，我想他们只能看见你们的轮廓。"
G["Your armor checks out, but your strength...? We'll see."]="Tu armadura está en orden, pero tu fuerza... ? Veremos."
G["Your armor is ready, $n."]="你的护甲已经准备好了，$n。"
G["Your armor is useless against my locusts!"]="在我的虫群面前，你的盔甲毫无用处！"
G["Your armor is your skin in combat. Protect it and honor it, and it shall do the same for you."]="在战斗中，你的护甲就是你的皮肤。保护它，善待它，它就会以同样的方式回报你。"
G["Your armor looks scary.  Are you scary too?"]="你的护甲看起来很破旧。你为此感到胆怯吗？"
G["Your armor means nothing, your faith even less."]="你的护甲毫无作用，你的信仰一文不值。"
G["Your armor means nothing. Your faith, even less!"]="你的护甲毫无作用，你的信仰一文不值！"
G["Your army...."]="你的军团……"
G["Your arrival is timely, $r.  I tire of fighting these wretched things."]="你来得正是时候，$r。我已经受够这些肮脏的怪物了。"
G["Your arrogance compels you..."]="你的傲慢驱使着你……"
G["Your arrogance feeds me!"]="你的傲慢让我壮大！"
G["Your assistance fighting the Burning Legion would be most appreciated. Lady Jaina Proudmoore could use your help on the front lines."]="非常感谢你来支援我们对抗燃烧军团的战斗。吉安娜·普罗德摩尔女士正需要你的帮助。"
G["Your attacks are slowed by the cold, I think!"]="我想你的进攻因为寒冷减弱了！"
G["Your attacks are strong, but my defenses are stronger!"]="你的攻击力很强，可我的防守更强！"
G["Your attacks are weak!  Go practice on some rabbits and come back when you're stronger."]="你的攻击太微弱了！去找些兔子练习一下，当你强壮些后再回来找我。"
G["Your attire is UNNACCEPTABLE!"]="你的装束简直不堪入目！"
G["Your barriers can't hold us back much longer, monster! I will shatter them all!"]="你的屏障挡不住我们，怪物！我会将它们全部粉碎！"
G["Your base is forfeit, mortals! From its ashes shall rise life!"]="你们的根据地已经丧失了！生命将因它化为废墟而延续！"
G["Your base is forfeit, puny mortals!"]="你们的根据地已经丧失了，渺小的人类！"
G["Your battle here is but the smallest mote of a world wide invasion, whelp!  It is time you learned of the powers you face!"]="你只不过是这世界上的一粒尘土，你的抗争毫无意义！见识见识我们的力量吧！"
G["Your battle prowess is nothing compared to mine!"]="你的战力怎能与我相比！"
G["Your battle with the wind was hundreds of years ago, Stormhoof. You weakened it so much that it has been silent all these years."]="雷蹄，你与北风的战斗已经过去了数百年。你重创了它，这些年来它一直都很沉寂。"
G["Your beasts will be no match for my champions, Tirion!"]="你的猛兽阻挡不了我的勇士！提里奥。"
G["Your behavior will not be tolerated."]="你们的行为是不可饶恕的。"
G["Your beloved king has taken the bait! He'll die in this jungle!"]="你们敬爱的国王中了圈套！他会死在这片丛林里！"
G["Your beloved leader has failed you! Let your blood be on his hands! Attack!"]="你效忠的首领令你失望了！让他的双手沾满你的鲜血！进攻！"
G["Your betrayal not gunna be slowin' me down none, mon."]="而且，即使是你的背叛，也已经阻止不了我了。"
G["Your betrayal of the Drakkari Empire has borne me a new army."]="你对达卡莱帝国的背叛为我制造出了一支新的军团。"
G["Your blessing is always welcome, $n."]="谢谢你的祝福，$n。"
G["Your blood is MINE, elf!"]="你的鲜血归我了，精灵！"
G["Your blood is mine!"]="我要你的血！"
G["Your blood is now mine."]="你的鲜血归我啦。"
G["Your blood only increases my hunger!"]="你的鲜血只会刺激我的欲望！"
G["Your blood shall be the catalyst for the Old Gods' return!"]="你的血将加速上古之神的回归！"
G["Your blood spills for the betterment of humanity, infidel!"]="你溅出的鲜血会净化人性，异教徒！"
G["Your blood tastes sweet."]="你的血真甜。"
G["Your blood will anoint my circle!"]="你的血让我的法阵更强大！"
G["Your blood will coat the walls of Kil'sorrow!"]="你的鲜血将会涂满基尔索罗的围墙！"
G["Your blood will not be the last my blades taste today, $c!"]="我的利刃会拿你的鲜血当作今天的开胃点心，$c！"
G["Your blood will paint Zan'vess red!"]="扎尼维斯会被你的鲜血染红！"
G["Your blood... my axe."]="你的血……将染在我的斧头上。"
G["Your bodies are all magnificent! If you'd be willing to take a small whiff of this chloroform, I promise that you will all wake up 10 times stronger and 100 times more... unified in purpose."]="你们的身体条件都很出色！如果你们愿意吸点儿这种麻醉剂，我保证当你们醒来时会比现在强壮10倍，凝聚力比现在强……100倍。"
G["Your body is mine! Our fates are forever intertwined."]="你的躯体为我所有！我们的命运将永远纠缠在一起！"
G["Your body lies beaten, battered and broken! Let my curse be your own, fate has spoken!"]="你将失败，你的身躯将会破碎！让我的诅咒落在你的身上。这是注定的命运！"
G["Your body looks worn and your spirit weary. Rest yourself beneath our roof and allow Elune to guide your dreams."]="你看上去很疲惫。在我们的屋里休息一会儿吧，让艾露恩引领你进入甜美的梦乡。"
G["Your bondage is at an end, Doom'rel.  I challenge you!"]="你的奴役结束了，杜姆雷尔。我向你挑战！"
G["Your bones shall make ideal playthings for my hound."]="你的骨头会变成我家爱狗最理想的玩具。"
G["Your bones will be devoured!"]="你们的尸骸将被吞噬！"
G["Your bones will break under my boot, $r!"]="我要踩碎你的骨头，$R！"
G["Your bones will serve as kindling."]="尔等的骨骸可做燃料。"
G["Your bow is complete, $n. I hope it will serve you as well as you have served the Horde."]="你的弓完成了，$n。希望它能为你建立伟大的功勋，就如同你为部落建立的伟大功勋一样。"
G["Your boy was weak. Spineless. Just like his father."]="你的儿子无能又懦弱。真是有其父必有其子。"
G["Your bravado will be rewarded... with death."]="你们的盲目自信只会导致……自己的死亡。"
G["Your brethren seek to harm my children. Those that call themselves Windyreed subvert the land. A marsh this will not become..."]="你的同胞想要伤害我的孩子。那些自称风茅什么的家伙把大地弄得乌烟瘴气，我们绝不能让这里成为沼泽地……"
G["Your broken body belongs to Hakkar."]="你残破的身躯属于哈卡。"
G["Your brothers to the north have subjugated the stone behemoths and set them on the path to Ulduar. Soon, the remaining defenses of the Pantheon will be neutralized."]="你在北方的同胞已经征服了那些石头怪物，指挥他们朝奥杜尔前进。很快，万神殿剩余的防御力量就会被消灭。"
G["Your callous disregard for the sovereign might of the Gurubashi Empire has been noted. The inhabitants of Zul'Gurub have been alerted to your presence."]="你对古拉巴什帝国至高无上的权力表现出的轻蔑态度已是臭名昭著。祖尔格拉布的居住者已经对你有所警惕了。"
G["Your capacity for learning has outstripped mine. You will need to talk to Bena Winterhoof over there for further instruction. Please don't take too much of her time, though. She needs her rest."]="你学习的能力已经超过我了。你需要找那边的本娜·冰蹄谈谈以获得更多指示。但请不要占用她太多时间。她需要休息。"
G["Your carved bones will decorate the weapons of our warriors!"]="我要把你的骨头雕成武器上的装饰品！"
G["Your cause is hopeless."]="你的道路毫无希望。"
G["Your cause is lost!"]="你们的妄想破灭了！"
G["Your challenge has been answered, outsider. Ordon, claim this area in the name of the Burning God!"]="外来者，我们接受你的挑战。斡耳朵，以火神的名义，夺下这个地方！"
G["Your challenge has failed!"]="你的挑战失败了！"
G["Your challenge is accepted, mortals! Know that you face Al'Akir, Elemental Lord of Air! You have no hope of defeating me!"]="我接受你们的挑战，凡人！要知道，你们面对的是奥拉基尔，风之领主！别以为能打败我！"
G["Your champion will defend you. Begin!"]="你的勇士会保护你的。开始！"
G["Your champion will keep you alive. Begin!"]="你的勇士会保证你的生命。开始！"
G["Your charge, the sha of fear, has escaped."]="你的囚犯，惧之煞，已经跑了。"
G["Your charred bones will litter the floor!"]="你们烧焦的骨头正好可以用来装饰地板！"
G["Your choice has been made. Whether you live or die by that choice is now up to you."]="你已经做出了选择。至于是生是死，就只能靠你自己了。"
G["Your choice of decor is intriguing, Kelemar. Tell me - why the arcane frippery?"]="你们选择的装饰真是引人入胜，克雷玛尔。告诉我，为什么要搞这些没用的东西？"
G["Your choice was bold! I respect your desire for glory and honor! Die well, $n!"]="你的选择很勇敢！而你对荣耀和功业的欲望也值得尊敬！光荣地去死吧，$n！"
G["Your cities will fall, $r. You'll perish in the darkness of the new regime!"]="你们的城市将会陷落，$r。你们将消亡在新政权的黑暗之中！"
G["Your city will be buried, your lives forfeit to the elements!"]="你们的城市将被埋葬，你们的生命将归于元素！"
G["Your claims are outrageous, General."]="你的要求可真过分，将军。"
G["Your clan is so low that hozen tell \"stupid\" jokes about them!"]="你们的氏族下等至极，连猢狲都敢嘲笑你们！"
G["Your class cooldowns have been reset!"]="你的职业冷却已经重置了！"
G["Your clothing appears as one well travelled. Quite an interesting look. I might use it in one of my future clothing lines. I shall call it:\n\n$pique."]="你这身衣服，好像很适合旅行时穿。看起来很有趣。我或许会将它用到以后的服装系列里。我打算叫它：\n\n$p特别款。"
G["Your cloud serpent approaches, $n. When you are ready, hop on and we will begin."]="Tu dragón nimbo se acerca, $n. Cuando estés $glisto:lista;, sube y empezaremos."
G["Your coming was a blessing to our tribe."]="你的到来犹如一阵春风，沐浴了我们的部族。"
G["Your companion seeks the shardhorn patriarch Farunn, who holds himself aloof from his brothers."]="碎角犀牛的族长法鲁恩就是你的同伴寻找的目标。他很少和族群的其他成员待在一起。"
G["Your companions' efforts force %s further into the physical realm!"]="战友们的努力逼迫%s进一步进入了物质世界！"
G["Your companions' efforts force %s further into the twilight realm!"]="战友们的努力逼迫%s进一步进入了暮光世界！"
G["Your conduct makes me proud."]="我为你的言行感到自豪。"
G["Your conduct was inexcusable."]="你们的行为不可饶恕。"
G["Your confidence is well-founded, traveler. Now your true education may begin!"]="Tu confianza está bien fundada, $gviajero:viajera;. ¡Que comience tu verdadera educación!"
G["Your conflict will have immense consequences here. Do NOT bring your war to these shores!"]="你们的冲突会让这里饱受摧残。别把战火引到这片海岸！"
G["Your consciousness is expanding. Concentrate on who you are looking for. The boy prince - the young lion. He is here, isn't he? Journey through time and space... open the eye of your soul. Do you see him?"]="你的感知力正在延伸。集中默念你要找的人。那位小王子——那头小狮子。他穿越时空……打开你的心眼。看见他了吗？"
G["Your conspirator has informed me of your plan.  I shall see you on the battlefield... painted with the ashes of the elementals."]="你的同谋者已经把你们的计划告诉了我。我们战场上见……涂满元素余烬的战场。"
G["Your continued help against the Burning Legion would still be appreciated. Thrall could use your assistance in his encampment to the west of here."]="非常感谢你继续帮助我们对抗燃烧军团。在这里的西面就是萨尔的营地，他可能会需要你们。"
G["Your continued service to the Blood Elves is paramount to our survival!  We must all pitch in and pull ourselves out of the mire we all find ourselves in.\n\nIf you're ready to work, then let's get started."]="¡Tu continuo servicio a los elfos de sangre es crucial para nuestra supervivencia! Todos tenemos que ponernos manos a la obra para salir de este embrollo.\n\nSi estás $glisto:lista; para trabajar, empecemos."
G["Your control over Kovok weakens as you leave Dread Wastes! Return now!"]="当你渐渐离开恐惧废土，你对科沃克的控制力也越来越弱！赶快回去！"
G["Your corpse will adorn my mast!"]="我要用你的尸体装饰桅杆！"
G["Your corpse will feed my fish."]="我要拿你的尸体去喂鱼。"
G["Your corpse will nourish the soil."]="你的尸体将滋养这片土地。"
G["Your corpses will feed the Blackrock war machine."]="你们的尸体正好可以拿来当黑石战争机器的好燃料。"
G["Your courage is impressive."]="你的勇气令人钦佩。"
G["Your course today will take you directly across the great sea."]="今天你们的航线是直接跨越大海。"
G["Your cries of pain delight his majesty!"]="你们的哀嚎将取悦陛下！"
G["Your current aptitude exceeds my instructional capabilities. You should enquire further with my fellow Gnome Trixie Quickswitch in Ironforge!"]="你目前的智能超出了我的指导能力。你该找我在铁炉堡的侏儒同伴特里克希询问一下！"
G["Your dabbling in the arcane has gone too far, Medivh.  You've attracted the attention of powers beyond your understanding.  You must leave Karazhan at once!"]="麦迪文，你沉迷于研究奥术能量，已经偏离了正道。你已经引起了某种远远超越你所能理解的力量的关注。你必须立即离开卡拉赞！"
G["Your dad says to fire me across the bay."]="你的爸爸说要把我射过这片海湾。"
G["Your daddy pay Warmaul and maybe we no eat you."]="要是你爸爸给我们送来赎金，我们就不吃你。"
G["Your dark Scourge magic won't protect you from the Light!"]="别以为天灾军团的黑暗魔法能让你们免受圣光的惩罚！"
G["Your days are done!"]="你完蛋了！"
G["Your days are done."]="你们的死期到了。"
G["Your days are numbered, shapeshifter!"]="你的日子已经屈指可数了，变形者！"
G["Your dead orc sound ok. Mine better."]="你学兽人临死前的惨叫声还不错。可我叫的比你更好听。"
G["Your death approaches...."]="你的死亡临近了……"
G["Your death comes, Boros!"]="波鲁斯，你的死期到了！"
G["Your death gonna be quick, strangers. You shoulda never come to this place...."]="陌生人，你们很快就将步入死亡。你们根本不该来到这里……"
G["Your death is at hand, $n.  Savor these last moments."]="你们的死期即将到来，$n。尽情享受生命的最后一刻吧。"
G["Your death is for the greater cause..."]="你的死亡是为了更崇高的目标……"
G["Your death is in vain, tiny mortal."]="你的牺牲是徒劳的，渺小的凡人。"
G["Your death is only the beginning."]="你的死亡仅仅是个开始！"
G["Your death shall be... electrifying."]="你的死亡将……闪耀着电光。"
G["Your death will be a painful one."]="你会死得非常痛苦。"
G["Your death will be neither swift nor painless!"]="你会缓慢而且痛苦地死去！"
G["Your death will make a fitting tribute to the King!"]="我要将你的生命作为献给大王的祭品！"
G["Your death will not be pleasant!"]="我要让你在痛苦中死去！"
G["Your death will not come swiftly. I can guarantee that!"]="你不会马上死掉的。我保证！"
G["Your death will not have been in vain, Taelan. A new Order is born on this day... an Order which will dedicate itself to extinguishing the evil that plagues this world. An evil that cannot hide behind politics and pleasantries."]="你不会白死的，泰兰。今天产生了一种新秩序……一种致力于消灭正在折磨这个世界的邪恶势力的秩序。这种邪恶势力是不能被政治和幽默所掩盖的。"
G["Your death will satisfy our master."]="主人得知你的死讯一定会非常满意。"
G["Your death will serve as a message to all that would dare set foot upon Ethereum territory!"]="你的死将给那些妄想踏足复仇军领地的人以警示！"
G["Your death will soon follow...."]="你离死不远了……"
G["Your death will tell a different story!"]="你的死亡将使一切变得不同！"
G["Your deaths feed my strength!"]="你的死亡就是我的力量！"
G["Your deaths shall be slow and painful!"]="你会痛苦而缓慢地死去！"
G["Your deaths shall sing of N'Zoth's unending glory."]="你们的死亡将歌颂恩佐斯无尽的荣耀。"
G["Your deceit is unforgivable, Jin'do. You spit in the face of a god!"]="你的欺骗是不可饶恕的，金度。你亵渎了你的神明！"
G["Your dedication to your cause deserves to be rewarded."]="你对这份事业的贡献配得上这份奖励。"
G["Your deeds bring glory and honor to the Horde, $n!"]="你的功绩为部落带来了辉煌与荣耀，$n！"
G["Your deeds of valor will be remembered."]="人们将铭记你的英勇事迹。"
G["Your deeds shall live on forever in the memories of every blue dragon, $n."]="每一头蓝龙都会铭记你的英勇事迹，$n。"
G["Your defeat was inevitable."]="你们的失败是命中注定的。"
G["Your defenders are slain."]="你的守卫被屠杀。"
G["Your defenses are nothing!  I will cut you down and keep your heads as trophies!"]="你们的防御毫无意义！我要把你们的脑袋砍下来当成战利品！"
G["Your defiance of the Empress ends here!"]="反对女皇的叛乱到此为止了！"
G["Your destruction will herald a new age of suffering!"]="你们的毁灭预示着痛苦的新时代即将降临！"
G["Your discs are now ready!  Engage the Discs of Norgannon once again to retrieve them!"]="你已经得到圆盘了！再次插入诺甘农圆盘来获取资料！"
G["Your discs will be returned to you once you access the pedestal."]="当你再次触碰底座的时候，圆盘会重新回到你的手中。"
G["Your disguise doesn't fool me, fleshling! Your defeat will please Drakuru!"]="你的伪装骗不了我！我要杀了你，达库鲁一定会很满意的！"
G["Your disguise has dropped. Be careful!"]="你的伪装掉了。小心一些！"
G["Your dog gives your face a sloppy wet lick."]="你的狗狗用它那湿乎乎的舌头舔了舔你的脸。"
G["Your dog loves you too!"]="你的狗狗也爱你！"
G["Your dog pushes its head under your hand."]="你的狗狗把头钻到了你的手底下。"
G["Your dog smiles at you."]="你的狗狗在对你微笑。"
G["Your doom!"]="你死定了。"
G["Your doubts and hatreds have wrought havoc all throughout these ruins. Clean up after yourselves and meet me in the village below - I will do my best to explain."]="你们的疑惑和仇恨在这片遗迹间引发了浩劫。自己收拾残局吧，然后到下方的村里来——我会尽力解释给你们听。"
G["Your duties as warchief can wait. For now... we fight!"]="别在我面前摆酋长的架子。现在……来战吧！"
G["Your education is nearly complete. One final task is all that stands between you and the culmination of all your efforts..."]="你的培训快结束了。完成一项最终的任务你就可以达到你成就的顶点了？"
G["Your education is progressing well. You should be proud of your accomplishments."]="Tu educación hace grandes progresos. Deberías sentirte $gorgulloso:orgullosa; por tus logros."
G["Your efforts are insignificant!"]="你们的努力是徒劳的！"
G["Your efforts are insignificant. I carry you to your deaths."]="你们的努力是徒劳的，我只会带着你们飞向死亡。"
G["Your efforts are really accelerating our progress, $p. Perhaps you'd like a permanent spot on our crew?"]="有了你的帮忙，我们的进度真的提高了不少，$p。你要不要考虑下加入我们的队伍？"
G["Your efforts are utterly pointless, fools!  You will never be able to defeat me!"]="你们所做的一切都没有意义，蠢货！你们永远都无法打败我！"
G["Your efforts force %s further out of the physical realm!"]="%s即将被你推离物质世界！"
G["Your efforts force %s further out of the twilight realm!"]="%s即将被你推离暮光世界！"
G["Your efforts have been in vain!"]="你们是在白费力气！"
G["Your efforts here shall not be forgotten, $n! I shall make certain of that."]="你在这里建立的功业不会被遗忘，$n！我将确保这一点。"
G["Your efforts on Pandaria's southern shores and elsewhere have given me my answer."]="你在潘达利亚南岸和其他地方的努力已经给了我答案。"
G["Your efforts was in vain, trespassers. The rituals nearly be complete."]="你们的努力全都白费了，献祭完成了，你们很快也将被囚禁。"
G["Your efforts were misguided!"]="你们的努力是徒劳的！"
G["Your efforts will prove fruitless. None shall stand in our way!"]="你的努力都是白费心机。没有什么会阻止我们的！"
G["Your efforts... are in vain."]="你所做的努力……都是徒劳。"
G["Your efforts...are futile..."]="别白费……力气了……"
G["Your eminence, may I have a word in private?"]="请问我能不能与您单独谈一谈？"
G["Your end draws closer!"]="你的末日来临啦！"
G["Your end has come!"]="你死定了！"
G["Your end is at hand, Illidari!"]="你们的末日到来了，伊利达雷！"
G["Your end is inevitable."]="你的末日已经不可避免。"
G["Your end is near!"]="你死期将至！"
G["Your end is near."]="你的死期就要到了。"
G["Your end."]="你完了。"
G["Your enemy will not show you mercy. Give him the same courtesy."]="你的敌人不会对你仁慈。你应该以牙还牙。"
G["Your energy will be put to good use."]="我会妥善利用你们留下的魔法能量。"
G["Your entrails will make a fine necklace."]="你的武器将成为我的收藏品。"
G["Your errand must mean much, $c, to draw you so deep into the marsh..."]="你的使命一定意义非凡，$c，它需要你深入沼泽……"
G["Your essence... is MINE."]="你的精华……归我了。"
G["Your eternal suffering is about to begin."]="永恒的痛苦才刚刚开始。"
G["Your excuses sicken me! Consider yourself relieved of command."]="你的借口令我恶心！你的指挥权被解除了。"
G["Your existence is acknowledged. <The relic turns to dust. Your head throbs with newfound wisdom. Something evil lurks in the heart of the mountain.>"]="我们都知道你的到来。<古物化为灰烬。你的头脑中充斥着新生的智慧。某种邪恶的东西潜藏在山脉的深处。>"
G["Your eyes do not deceive you. The treacherous red dragonflight sought to kill me off. I hope now you see the truth about them."]="你的眼睛没有欺骗你。奸诈的红龙军团试图杀掉我。我希望你能看清他们的真面目。"
G["Your eyes fail to see what is before you. No doubt this is a result of your flawed eating habits."]="你的眼睛已经看不见面前的事物。毫无疑问，这是你平时不良的饮食习惯所造成的。"
G["Your eyes fail you yet!"]="你的眼睛欺骗了你！"
G["Your eyes will make pretty baubbles!"]="你的眼睛用来当饰品应该不错！"
G["Your face is dumb Muno!"]="瞧你那张蠢脸，穆诺！"
G["Your face looks angry."]="Tienes cara de $genfadado:enfadada;."
G["Your face!"]="小心你的脸！"
G["Your failures are tiring me.  If you cannot do as instructed we will have no use for you."]="你一次又一次的失败让我对你丧失了信心。如果你不听从我们的指示，留你何用？"
G["Your faith guides me to victory."]="你的信念指引我走向胜利。"
G["Your faithful service to the Firelord has not gone unnoticed, Pyromancer."]="炎魔之王不会忽视你的忠心，炎术师。"
G["Your families no longer starve."]="你的家人不用再忍饥受饿。"
G["Your family has asked about you. They're worried."]="你的家人正在找你。他们很担心。"
G["Your family is worried and wants you to come back to Stormwind."]="你的家人很担心你，他们正在等你回暴风城去。"
G["Your family says hello, Ribbly.  And they want your head!"]="你的族人问了声好，雷布里。他们想要你彻底失败！"
G["Your family wants you to return to Orgrimmar."]="你的家人希望你能回到奥格瑞玛去。"
G["Your fate is sealed!"]="认命吧！"
G["Your fate is sealed, Azeroth!  I will find the Aspect Shards, and then you will not stand against our might!"]="艾泽拉斯的命运早已注定。我会找到那些碎片，我们的力量将无人可挡！"
G["Your fate is sealed, Deliana!  You will pay for your trespasses against Lord Valthalak!"]="你的命运已经注定了，德莉亚娜！冒犯了瓦塔拉克公爵，你就要付出代价！"
G["Your fate is sealed, Mokvar!  You will pay for your trespasses against Lord Valthalak!"]="你的命运已定，莫尔克瓦！冒犯了瓦塔拉克公爵，你就要付出代价！"
G["Your fate is sealed. The end of days is finally upon you and ALL who inhabit this miserable little seedling. Uulwi ifis halahs gag erh'ongg w'ssh."]="你们的命运早已注定。末日即将降临于这个可笑而渺小的世界，你们所有人都要灭亡。Uulwi ifis halahs gag erh'ongg w'ssh."
G["Your fate is written."]="你的命运早已注定。"
G["Your father and Greymane saw to that... No, Gilneas died when they allowed murderous beasts to reign free. Unchecked."]="这就是你的父亲和格雷迈恩所做的一切……不，当他们允许那些怪兽肆意作恶的时候，吉尔尼斯就已经死了。"
G["Your father destroyed my children and left their bodies impaled upon the rocky blades at Dragons' End.  For this, you will die!  Enough of this farce.  Prepare to face my full wrath!"]="你的父亲杀死了我的孩子，还残忍地将他们的尸骸钉在巨龙之末的岩石上。你必须为此付出生命的代价！这场闹剧该结束了。尝尝我满腔的怒火吧！"
G["Your father was a weakling, Vol'jin. I shall enjoy sucking the life from you as I did him."]="沃金，你的父亲是个无能的家伙。我很愿意从你的身上吸取生命，就像对他一样。"
G["Your father was weak, Sasha... he didn't have the guts to do what had to be done."]="你的父亲是个懦夫，萨莎……他没有勇气完成自己的使命。"
G["Your father's blood runs strong in you, Hellscream. Impatient as always... Impatient and reckless."]="加尔鲁什，你的脾气和你父亲简直一模一样。总是这么暴躁……既暴躁又卤莽。"
G["Your father's so weak that a pandaren took pity on him and invited him to dinner!"]="你们的父亲软弱无能，甚至要依靠熊猫人施舍的嗟来之食活命！"
G["Your father?"]="你父亲？"
G["Your fear drives me."]="你们的恐惧驱使着我。"
G["Your fear will consume you!"]="让你的恐惧吞噬你！"
G["Your feeble resistance has only hastened your doom."]="停止无力的抵抗吧，这仅仅能延缓你的毁灭罢了。"
G["Your feet are touching the ground, Orkus. This is shallow water. Just stand up and walk to shore."]="你能站起来，奥尔库斯。这里只是浅水。赶快走到岸上去吧。"
G["Your feet have left the ground!"]="你的双脚离开了地面！"
G["Your fel weapon is ready, $n."]="你的武器完成了，$n。"
G["Your fighting made the trip up to the temple worth it!"]="你去寺院习得的这身功夫真是让你不虚此行！"
G["Your fighting skills are bad and you should feel bad."]="你的战斗技巧真心差劲，你应该感到羞耻。"
G["Your filthy dogs won't be enough!"]="你们这群臭狗完全不顶用！"
G["Your first mission is to destroy the machines of death within this malevolent engine of souls and clear a path for our soldiers."]="你的首个任务是摧毁灵魂引擎中的死亡机器，为我们的士兵杀出一条路来。"
G["Your first target is here, in the ruins of Gilneas. I've lost some of my best men already: let's see if you can fare any better."]="你的第一个目标，就在吉尔尼斯废墟。我之前派去的人都失败了，看看你能不能走运点。"
G["Your first test awaits you. Destroy our uninvited guests."]="你的第一个试炼正在等待着你。消灭那些不速之客。"
G["Your fists are strong, but your mind is still weak."]="你的拳头很有力，但念力不够。"
G["Your flesh betrays you."]="你的血肉背叛了你。"
G["Your flesh cannot hold out for long."]="你们的血肉之躯无法长存于世。"
G["Your flesh is forfeit to the fires of this realm."]="来到火焰的国度，就要付出血肉的代价。"
G["Your flesh is forfeit!"]="你的血肉将不再属于你！"
G["Your flesh serves Tharon'ja now!"]="你的血肉现在要为萨隆亚效劳了！"
G["Your flesh shall decay before your very eyes!"]="你的躯壳将在你的眼前朽化！"
G["Your flesh will burn, mortal!"]="你将化为灰烬，凡人！"
G["Your flesh will melt."]="你的血肉将会融化。"
G["Your flesh, yes yes, so perfect, GIVE IT TO US!"]="你的血肉，对，太完美了，给我们……"
G["Your flying death machine is a sign of the end times."]="你们的飞行死亡机器是末日来临的预兆。"
G["Your foe was overwhelmed by a dark energy we call the\"Sha.\" It thrives on negative emotions, such as doubt."]="Tu enemigo estaba poseído por una energía oscura que llamamos \"sha\". Se alimenta de las emociones negativas, como la duda."
G["Your forces are nearly marshaled to strike back against your enemies, my liege."]="大军几乎已经整装待发，随时可以从后方突袭敌人，陛下。"
G["Your forces are weak!"]="你们的实力真弱。"
G["Your form is excellent. Are you a blacksmith by chance?"]="你干得太棒了。你是不是以前当过铁匠？"
G["Your form is impeccable."]="你的招式真是无懈可击。"
G["Your fortune is cast, $c.  For the next few hours, you will find your spirit in tune with your true nature.  Be careful, as your fortune - and your fate - are never as clear as you might think them to be.\n\nIf you would like a small glimpse of something to ponder in your future, by all means let me know.  I'd be happy to give you a written fortune, provided you have room in your inventory.  It is one drawn from the insight you have shown in answering my questions."]="对你的占卜已经完成，$c。在接下来的几个小时中，你将发现你的精神与你真正的天性保持一致。你要小心，因为你的命运并不是你所想得那么条理清晰。\n\n如果你想要对你的未来有所了解，那么尽管告诉我。我会很乐意给你一张手写的占卜结果，当然，你的背包中必须留有足够的空间。这个结果是你回答我的问题时所表现出来的。"
G["Your fragile mind will be shattered!"]="你们脆弱的精神即将崩溃！"
G["Your fragile minds are your greatest weakness."]="脆弱的心灵是你们最大的弱点。"
G["Your freedom will be short lived, Icemist!"]="别以为你们从此就高枕无忧了！"
G["Your friend put up quite the fight. He nearly escaped, but now he is a prisoner, just like the rest of us."]="你的朋友真能打，差点就逃脱了。不过现在还是和我们一样沦为阶下囚。"
G["Your friends down in the Krasarang Wilds have quite the appetites. There's an endless demand for fresh produce."]="你在卡桑琅丛林的那群朋友胃口可真好，总是不断地向我们采购新鲜农产品。"
G["Your friends were all taken prisoner by Trade Prince Gallywix while the volcano was exploding.\n\nWe are going to have to deal with the Alliance quickly if we're to rescue them and get off of this island."]="火山爆发的时候，你的朋友全都被贸易大王加里维克斯抓住了。\n\n我们必须尽快解决联盟的人，这样才能救出他们，离开这座岛。"
G["Your friends will soon be joining you!"]="你的朋友很快就会去找你了！"
G["Your frozen reign will not come to pass!"]="你的野心永远都不会实现！"
G["Your fugitive's name is Mekgineer Thermaplugg."]="那个逃亡者的名字是机械师瑟玛普拉格。"
G["Your futile persistance angers me!"]="你们无谓的顽固激怒了我！"
G["Your future is clouded.  Concentrate, and ask again."]="你的未来乌云密布。集中精力，再问一次。"
G["Your gift is a rare kindness, traveler. Please take this blade with my gratitude. Long ago, another traveler left it here, but I have little use for it."]="你的礼物传达出珍贵的温情，旅行者。为表谢意，请你收下这把剑。很久以前，另一位旅行者将它赠给了我，不过我几乎用不上。"
G["Your goal is a silent kill. Screamy, angry kills will do in a pinch."]="你的目标是消无声息地干掉对方。不到万不得已，别搞出太大的动静。"
G["Your gods are not our gods, outsider."]="你的神将不再是神，外来者。"
G["Your gods can't save you now, $c."]="你的神现在救不了你了，$c。"
G["Your goons smashed my keg of Stormstout Special Reserve... I was saving that!!"]="呆子，你打碎了一坛风暴烈酒陈酿……我藏了好多年的！！！"
G["Your greatest challenge lies ahead.  Ley-Guardian Eregos is a Blue dragon of immense power. You will find him flying above the uppermost ring."]="你即将面临新一轮的挑战。魔网守护者埃雷苟斯拥有可怕的力量。他就在魔枢顶层盘旋。"
G["Your greatest challenge lies ahead.  Ley-Guardian Eregos is a Blue dragon of immense power. You will find him flying above the uppermost ring. \nThe full power of your drakes has been unlocked.  Use their power to defeat Eregos!"]="El mayor de tus desafíos aún está por llegar. El Guardián-Ley Eregos es un dragón Azul de inmenso poder. Lo encontrarás sobrevolando el anillo superior.\n\nSe ha desbloqueado el poder total de tus dracos. ¡Usa su poder para derrotar a Eregos!"
G["Your greed, your foolishness has brought you to this end."]="你的贪婪和愚蠢注定了你的结局。"
G["Your grip is loosening! Climb down the tree quickly!"]="你已经快抓不住了！快从树上下来！"
G["Your guess is as good as mine. We have to be ready for anything."]="我的疑虑和你一样。我们得做好心理准备。"
G["Your hand! It is healed!"]="你的手！伤口愈合了！"
G["Your hatchling chases after the ball!"]="你的雏龙在追着球跑！"
G["Your hatchling wants to catch this one!"]="你的雏龙想要抓住这只球！"
G["Your hatred intensifies! Control it now!"]="你的仇恨更强了！立刻控制住它！"
G["Your hatred overwhelms you!"]="你的仇恨淹没了你！"
G["Your hatred strengthens me!"]="仇恨让我更加强大！"
G["Your have no businesss here, $r!"]="这与你无关，$r！"
G["Your head like rock."]="你的脑袋跟石头一样硬。"
G["Your head will roll!"]="你们小命不保了！"
G["Your healing skills are impressive, $n."]="Tus facultades curativas son impresionantes."
G["Your health is faltering.  Allow me to help."]="你的生命值太低了。请让我帮助你。"
G["Your hear the Pebble's stones jittering about inside of him. He's clearly excited about something."]="你听到砾石佩波体内石块的撞击声。他显得很是兴奋。"
G["Your heart - its incessant drumming disgusts me. I will silence it as I did my own."]="你不停跳动的心脏令我厌恶。我会让它停止，就像我一样。"
G["Your heart -it's incessant drumming disgusts me. I will silence it as I did my own."]="你不停跳动的心脏令我感到厌恶。我会让它停止，就像我的一样。"
G["Your heart and your humanity hold you back, Arthas."]="阿尔萨斯，残存在你心中的人性令你止步不前。"
G["Your heart is in the right place, and I know you seek to serve the Light. But these small strikes do little to the great undead host."]="你有一副好心肠，我知道你想要侍奉圣光。但是战场上的厮杀难以撼动天灾军团的首脑。"
G["Your heart, your love for your land and your people is what has led you here.  It was neither your armor nor your weapons."]="是你的心，是你对家园与人民的热爱把你引到了这里。不是你的战甲，也不是你的武器。"
G["Your heartbeat is... music to my ears."]="你的心跳在我耳中就是最美妙的音乐。"
G["Your help enabled us to connect the Defias to the mastermind behind the abduction, Onyxia, who was posing as a member of the royal court."]="在你的帮助下，我们找出了迪菲亚盗贼的幕后主使者——奥妮克希亚。她伪装成一名皇家议会的成员，潜藏在暴风城。"
G["Your help is appreciated, friend. At this rate, we'll be able to get some rest soon!"]="感谢你的帮助，朋友。按现在的速度，我们不久之后就能休息了！"
G["Your help was invaluable, my friend.\n\nI can assure you that the Cenarion Expedition will do everything in its power to counter any future tainted crystals dropped from the heavens by Illidan."]="Tu ayuda ha sido inestimable, $gamigo:amiga;.\n\nTe aseguro que la expedición Cenarion hará lo que pueda para luchar contra cualquier cristal máculo que caiga de los cielos enviado por Illidan."
G["Your help with the Shadowpine trolls is proving invaluable, $c. Keep this up and maybe we'll be able to turn our attention back to dealing with the Scourge."]="你给予了暗松巨魔巨大的打击，$c。请继续保持，这样我们或许就能抽出时间来对付亡灵天灾。"
G["Your highness, we caught this beast snooping around the caves just outside the compound."]="殿下，我们在庄园附近的洞穴里抓住了这头鬼鬼祟祟的野兽。"
G["Your highness.  I deliver to you... Andorhal."]="陛下。我将……安多哈尔献给您。"
G["Your highness. I have never tried to conceal what I am from you."]="殿下。我从来没有向您隐瞒过我的身份。"
G["Your hope shines brightly, and even more brightly when you work together to overcome. It will ever light your way in even the darkest of places."]="你们的希望十分闪亮，你们团结起来后，它更是璀璨夺目。哪怕在最黑暗的地方，它也将照亮你们的道路。"
G["Your hopes are lost!"]="你的希望破灭了！"
G["Your ignorance is profound. Can you not see where this path leads?"]="你们太无知了。竟然看不清这条路通向何方吗？"
G["Your impetuousness will be your end!"]="你的卤莽会毁了你！"
G["Your impudence will be your undoing. Mark my words!"]="你的傲慢将为你招致毁灭。记住我说的话！"
G["Your impudent patter does not intimidate me, fool."]="你无礼的话吓不倒我，蠢货。"
G["Your impurity must be cleansed."]="你们必须得到净化。"
G["Your incursion ends here! None shall survive!"]="你们的入侵结束了！无人可以生还！"
G["Your insight is appreciated."]="非常感谢你的建议。"
G["Your insolence is appalling, fool!  I shall feast on your soul!"]="你这傲慢至极的蠢货！我要品尝你的灵魂！"
G["Your insolence will be your death!"]="你们死定了！"
G["Your insolence will not be tolerated!"]="你们的傲慢是无可容忍的！"
G["Your intelligence will come in handy almost as much as your skill for battle. I see much potential in a mind like yours Wakener."]="你的心智如同你的战技，迟早会有用武之地。我在你的心神中看到了这样的潜力，唤醒者。"
G["Your interference has cost me a great warrior, young prince. You'll pay with your life."]="你害我损失了一个好战士，小王子。你将为此付出代价。"
G["Your interference shall cosst you your life, $r!"]="你的干涉会让你付出生命的代价，$r！"
G["Your interruption is costing me valuable time, this had better be good."]="你的打扰在占用我的宝贵时间，你最好带来的是好消息。"
G["Your jail is ours!"]="你的监狱是我们的了！"
G["Your jormungar can only move if you've submerged beneath the snow, but it cannot attack while submerged. Once your jormungar emerges, it can use its powerful acid attack to wear through the armor of the Iron Colossus. Be ready to submerge to escape from the Iron Colossus's most devastating attacks."]="只有当你潜入雪层时，你的冰虫才能够移动，但潜入后你的冰虫无法攻击。浮出雪层的冰虫可以使用它强大的酸性攻击穿透钢铁巨像的护甲。要做好随时下潜的准备以躲避钢铁巨像最具毁灭性的攻击。"
G["Your journey ends here cowards! These doors won't open as long as I live!"]="你们的路到此为止了，懦夫！只要我还活着，你们休想打开这些门！"
G["Your journey has just begun, young prince. Gather your forces and meet me in the arctic land of Northrend. It is there that we shall settle the score between us. It is there that your true destiny will unfold."]="你的旅程才刚开始，年轻的王子。集合你的部队，到诺森德再次挑战我。在那里，我们将了结彼此之间的恩怨，你将了解到你真正的命运。"
G["Your judgement has come!"]="对你的审判降临了！"
G["Your killers will not go unpunished."]="我绝不会放过杀害你的凶手。"
G["Your kind DISGUSTS me.  Small.  Weak.  Honorless as thieves.  Be thankful the warchief still tolerates your presence at all."]="你们让我恶心。瘦小，懦弱，像小偷一样不知廉耻，感谢酋长容忍你们存在吧！"
G["Your kind are not welcome here, warlock."]="Tu especie no es bienvenida aquí, $gbrujo:bruja;."
G["Your kind can tread where we cannot. Your kind can survive where others might perish."]="你们可以达到我们无法企及的领域。你们可以在九死一生的恶劣环境下顽强生存。"
G["Your kind far predates Sargeras's betrayal. What WERE you?"]="早在萨格拉斯背叛之前你们就已经存在了。你们究竟是什么？"
G["Your kind has no place in the master's world."]="主人的世界中没有你们的位置。"
G["Your kind is no match for the return of our Thunder King!"]="你们阻止不了雷电之王的回归！"
G["Your kind is not welcome here, $r!"]="$r，这里不欢迎你们！"
G["Your kind shall never build a foothold here. This is destined to be Horde land."]="你们无法在这里立足。这里注定要成为部落的领地。"
G["Your kind shall spill innocent blood no longer!"]="你们休想再伤害无辜者们！"
G["Your kind should not be allowed in the valley!"]="你们的族类不允许进入山谷！"
G["Your kind were made to be ruled."]="你们生来就是做奴隶的料。"
G["Your kind will be made to serve."]="你们注定将成为奴仆。"
G["Your kind will be made to suffer for this, $r."]="你们一族注定要承受这一切，$r。"
G["Your kind will soon learn who their real masters are."]="你们这些劣等种族马上就会明白谁才是你们真正的主人。"
G["Your kind... cannot be... trusted."]="你们这种人……不可信任。"
G["Your kind?"]="你们的种族？"
G["Your kindness will not be forgotten!"]="你的仁慈将被永远铭记！"
G["Your kingdoms will fall, $r!"]="你的王国终将沦陷，$r！"
G["Your knowledge is great, traveler. You must learn from one who is wiser than I. Many tales have been told of the wisdom of Josef Gregorian. You may find him in Undercity."]="Tienes un gran conocimiento, $gviajero:viajera;. Debes aprender de alguien más sabio que yo. Se han contado muchas historias sobre la sabiduría de Josef Gregorian. Puedes encontrarle en Entrañas."
G["Your knowledge is lacking.  Return to me when your skills in smelting have grown!"]="你的知识太缺乏了。当你熔炼技术更成熟些时再来找我！"
G["Your knowledge of potions has exceeded mine, but you still have much to learn. Go up the stairs to the southeast and see Doctor Marsh. He will teach you true sufferi--ahem. He is a Forsaken who will train you further."]="你对药剂的知识已经远胜于我，但你还有很多要学的。上楼去到东南面见见马尔什医生。他会交给你真正的苦痛——啊咳。他是一个被遗忘者，他能进一步训练你。"
G["Your knuckes are cracked and ready for action!"]="你的拳头捏得劈啪作响，可以开始了！"
G["Your laborss sshall be an offering to the Lady..."]="你们将任由夫人差遣……"
G["Your lack of vision is why your people are still primitives, and your lack of loyalty is why I did not summon the Darkspear for this campaign."]="正是你的短视令你的人民始终落后。也正是你的不忠令我决定不召唤暗矛部族参战。"
G["Your land is doomed!"]="你们的国度已经毁灭了！"
G["Your last waking memory will be of agonizing pain."]="你们最后的记忆将填满痛苦。"
G["Your laughable stitching is best observed by Talmar there; come back when you understand how to properly cure a hide, perhaps. Your work smells foul."]="可笑的家伙，你最好向那边的塔尔玛讨教几招，在你学会如何正确地加工皮革之后再回来找我吧。还有，你制作出来的皮革真难闻。"
G["Your leader takes residence at the doorstep to Naxxramas. Do you think he does not feel the pressure?"]="你们的领袖甚至已经把家搬到纳克萨玛斯的入口处了，你认为他感觉不到任何压力吗？"
G["Your life cycle is now concluded."]="你的生命划上了句号。"
G["Your life ends now invader!"]="入侵者，你的生命结束了！"
G["Your life for the Lich King!"]="你是为巫妖王而活的！"
G["Your life force is my nourishment, demon... Kil'jaeden's gift to us!"]="你的生命会让我变得更强壮，恶魔……基尔加丹给我们的礼物！"
G["Your life has no purpose."]="你的生命没有目标。"
G["Your life is a fitting sacrifice for my master, $c."]="把你的生命供奉给我的主人吧，$c。"
G["Your life is forfeit!"]="我要没收你的生命！"
G["Your life is forfeit, ally of stone!"]="去死吧，石头的盟友！"
G["Your life is forfeit."]="你就要没命了。"
G["Your life is meaningless."]="你的生命毫无意义。"
G["Your life is mine!"]="你的命是我的了！"
G["Your life isn't yours to throw away, Calen. Should I fail, the fate of this world may rest on your shoulders."]="不要浪费你的生命，凯伦。一旦我失败，那么世界的命运将落在你的肩上。"
G["Your life will be a fitting sacrifice to our emperor!"]="你的小命正好用来祭奠我们的帝王！"
G["Your life will be mine!"]="你的生命属于我！"
G["Your life, UNLEASHED!"]="释放你的生命吧！"
G["Your lights will go out. The darkness will envelop you. And you will fear the shadows that move within it."]="你心中的光明将会寂灭。黑暗会笼罩你。潜伏其中的阴影会令你胆寒。"
G["Your lily pad or mine?"]="是你的莲花叶子还是我的？"
G["Your little cub nips and paws at the air, eager to try out his hunting skills."]="幼崽向空中挥动着它的小爪子，看来他已经迫不及待想试试他的打猎技巧了。"
G["Your little friend is disposable."]="你的小伙伴就任我处置了。"
G["Your little incursion upon the isle means nothing. Soon you will all be dead!"]="你们在岛上发动的可笑攻势毫无价值。很快你们全都会死！"
G["Your little toy will not save you!"]="这样的小玩具是救不了你的！"
G["Your lives are meaningless."]="你们的生命毫无意义。"
G["Your loved ones live with shelter over their heads."]="你所爱的人找到了遮风避雨的住所。"
G["Your luck has run its course!"]="你们的好运到此为止了！"
G["Your luck just ran out!"]="你的好运用完了！"
G["Your lungs are filled and you are ready for action!"]="¡Tus pulmones están llenos y estás $glisto:lista; para la acción!"
G["Your magic is pathetic. Let me show you mine."]="你的魔法伎俩真可怜。瞧瞧我的手段吧。"
G["Your magics shall be your undoing... ak-a-ak..."]="你的魔法将导致你的毁灭……呱——啊——呱……"
G["Your makers failed you... your flawed race succumbed to the curse of flesh!  Lord Deathwing's gift makes you perfect again!"]="你们的造物主辜负了你们……听任你们被束缚在这种被诅咒的残缺肉体之中！但死亡之翼君王的赠礼却能让你们重新拥有完美的身体！"
G["Your march to your deaths! Azshara shall see you wiped from the seas!"]="你们在迈向死亡！艾萨拉会将你们彻底驱逐出海洋！"
G["Your martial skills are unparallelled. There is much I wish to learn from you."]="你的武术技能无人能比。我还有很多想向你学习。"
G["Your master knows what lies beneath the chapel. That is why he dares not show his face! He's sent you and your death knights to meet their doom, Darion."]="你的主子知道礼拜堂下面埋藏着什么。所以他才不敢露面！你和你的死亡骑士就是他派来送死的，达里安。"
G["Your masters will never conquer the stone!"]="你的主子永远别想征服岩石！"
G["Your mate?"]="你的配偶？"
G["Your meal is ready, sir."]="大人，可以用餐了。"
G["Your meddling ends here, $n!  Lord Valthalak shall have his revenge!"]="你的末日到了，$n！瓦塔拉克公爵就要开始他的复仇了！"
G["Your meddling in demonic affairs ends NOW, mortal!  Face the great corruptor - Xandivious!"]="凡人，你再也没机会插手恶魔的事务了！和沙迪维尔斯做个了断吧！"
G["Your meddling is at an end. Mechazod will relieve your curse once I am done with you."]="闹剧该结束了。一旦我搞定你，麦卡佐德就会治愈你身上的诅咒。"
G["Your message did reach us, Commander, but by no means is our involvement here sanctioned by the Grand Crusader."]="我们确实已经收到你的消息了，指挥官，但我们的介入绝对不会得到大十字军阁下的批准的。"
G["Your mighty castles will crumble and your loved ones will join the Lich King's ranks!"]="你们的城堡必将倒塌，而你挚爱的人也会沦为巫妖王的奴仆！"
G["Your mind has grown weak since we last met."]="你的心智比以前更脆弱了。"
G["Your mind is gradually opened as you focus on the orb before you...."]="你凝视着面前的宝珠，思绪渐渐飘散……"
G["Your mind is plagued with |cFFFF0404|Hspell:124862|h[Visions of Demise]|h|r !"]="你的思想被|cFFFF0404|Hspell:124862|h[死亡幻象]|h|r感染了！"
G["Your mind is strong Wakener. Even now I struggle to communicate with you. Controlling you would be near impossible..."]="你的精神很是强大，唤醒者。就连现在，我都在奋力与你交流。想要控制你几乎是不可能的……"
G["Your mind is unfocused.  Are you hiding something from me?"]="你的精神不够集中。你对我隐瞒着什么吗?"
G["Your minds is weak."]="你的心智真是软弱。"
G["Your minion has been terminated."]="你的宠物已经完蛋了。"
G["Your miniscule intellect is no match for my superior claws!"]="你渺小的智力根本无法和我超强的爪子相比！"
G["Your misery is my delight!"]="你的痛苦就是我的欢乐！"
G["Your mixtures are weak, Maloriak! They need a bit more... kick!"]="你的混合剂太弱了，马洛拉克！他们需要更多的……“催化”！"
G["Your moldering remains will serve ME as a testament to what happens when one is foolish enough to trespass in my domain!"]="你的枯骨将作为一个见证——一个人愚蠢到胆敢入侵我的领地会有什么后果。"
G["Your moment of defiance is nearly over!"]="容你肆意挑衅的日子就要结束了！"
G["Your money or your life!"]="要钱还是要命！"
G["Your money or your life! Actually, just your life will do..."]="要钱还是要命！事实上，我只要你的命……"
G["Your monkeys failed to finish the job, naaru. Beaten but alive... The same mistake was not made when we took command of your vessel."]="你手下那群猴子可耻地失败了，纳鲁。虽然我已经落败，但是我还活着……当我们控制纳鲁飞船的时候，绝对没有犯下这样的错误。"
G["Your mortal remains have been gathered, here in this place where you spent your childhood!"]="你在凡间的遗骸已经被收集完整，被放置在这个你渡过童年光阴的地方！"
G["Your mother calls!"]="你们的母亲在召唤！"
G["Your mother was a wrench and your father smelled of seaforium!"]="你的母亲是一只扳手，你的父亲则散发着爆盐炸弹的气味！"
G["Your mother's in the basement next door.  Get to her now!"]="你的妈妈就在旁边那道门后的地下室里。现在就去找她吧！"
G["Your mother's so old she saw the rise of the first kingdom!"]="你们的母亲老得经历过第一帝国的建立！"
G["Your motives are pure. The keystone's parts shall be reunited. Go to Ulduar and learn the answers to your questions, Brann Bronzebeard."]="你们的动机是纯洁的。钥石的碎片将得以重新拼合。前往奥杜尔寻找你想要的答案吧，布莱恩·铜须。"
G["Your move.  I'll follow you in."]="该你了，我会跟着你。"
G["Your muscles are stretched out and ready for action!"]="你的肌肉已经充分伸展，可以开始了！"
G["Your name is as insignificant to me as the names of the thousands who have died under the might of Goc.  I will crush you and $n!"]="Tu nombre es tan insignificante para mí como el nombre de los miles que han muerto bajo el poder de Goc. ¡Os machacare a ti y a $n!"
G["Your name is beginning to be revered around here.\n\n<Chu'a'lor's left eye pierces you with its stony gaze.>\n\nKeep up the good work, $n!"]="Tu nombre comienza a ser venerado por aquí.\n\n<El ojo izquierdo de Chu'a'lor te perfora con su pétrea mirada.>\n\nSigue así, $n."
G["Your name seems to be on everyone's lips around the outpost.  Don't let it get to your head; I know that you can do better!\n\nI'll be watching you, rookie."]="哨站的每个人都在提起你的名字。别因此沾沾自喜，我知道你能做得更好！\n\n我会继续关注你的，新手。"
G["Your name will be remembered down through the ages, $n.  Seek out Taim Ragetotem on the Hunter Rise and he will assist you on your way to Alterac Valley."]="你的名字将世代相传，永垂不朽，$n。去猎人高地找泰姆·暴怒图腾，他会帮助你前往奥特兰克山谷。"
G["Your name will be spoken in our village for many years to come."]="你的名字将在我们村子里世代传诵、流芳百世。"
G["Your name's Leveny?"]="你叫利维尼？"
G["Your new name is Sayena."]="你的新名字叫萨耶娜。"
G["Your next choice awaits.\n\nYou alone have defeated a terrible beast that has been ravaging the countryside, taking its ear as a trophy.  You later learn that your liege had offered a reward for the beast's death, and that a kind but destitute knight who you know is trying to support a family by meager means claims the beast's kill as his own.  You have no real need for money yourself, but you know that the destitute knight is lying for his own personal gain.\n\nMake your choice."]="Te espera tu próxima decisión.\n\nHas vencido a una bestia terrible que estaba arrasando el país y le has cortado la oreja como trofeo. Más tarde, te enteras de que tu señor ha ofrecido una recompensa por la muerte de la bestia y que un noble caballero que se ha quedado en la indigencia, y de quien sabes que está sufriendo para mantener a su familia, ha dicho haber matado a la bestia. En realidad no necesitas el dinero, pero sabes que el caballero está mintiendo.\n\nToma tu decisión."
G["Your next choice awaits.\n\nYou are on a diplomatic mission for your liege to a cruel country that is currently at war with yours.  The war has been costly on both sides.  Your mission is to secure a peace that is honorable to both peoples.\n\nAt a diplomatic dinner, you overhear the ruler of the opposing land viciously insult your benevolent liege.  You are fairly certain the ruler meant to say it out of your earshot, but nonetheless he has besmirched your liege's honor.\n\nMake your choice."]="你的下一个选择在等着你。\n\n你奉王上之命，出使交战中的敌国。战争让双方都元气大伤，你的使命是确保两国进行和平谈判。\n\n在外交宴会上，你无意中听到敌国的统治者恶意中伤你的君王。你断定他原本是想背着你说的，但他还是辱及了你的王上的威名。\n\n做个选择吧。"
G["Your next choice awaits.\n\nYou are the sworn executioner for your liege.  A man has been sent to you for execution as a traitor of the liege and your people.  You know this individual as a close, virtuous friend who mysteriously vanished one day.  You also know that the man's crimes for which he was convicted supposedly caused the deaths of many innocent civilians.  Upon seeing you he begs for his life, claiming he was framed by a higher authority.\n\nMake your choice."]="Te espera tu próxima decisión.\n\nEres el verdugo de tu señor. Te han enviado a un hombre para que le ejecutes por traicionar a tu señor y a tu pueblo. Conoces a este individuo. Era un buen amigo tuyo que, misteriosamente, desapareció un día. También sabes que los crímenes por los que ha sido juzgado han causado la muerte de muchos ciudadanos inocentes. Cuando te ve, te suplica que le perdones la vida y dice que una gran autoridad le tendió una trampa para incriminarle.\n\nToma tu decisión."
G["Your next choice awaits.\n\nYour brother seeks to join the ranks of the prestigious military order you are already a part of.  While you are sure of his commitment and loyalty, his talent and ability to perform the arduous tasks of the order is what you question.  While you are not certain he will be able to rise to the challenge of the order - putting you and others in danger - you are certain that your word alone would allow him in or keep him out.\n\nMake your choice."]="Te aguarda tu siguiente decisión.\n\nTu hermano desea unirse a las filas de la prestigiosa orden militar de la que tú ya formas parte. Aunque no dudas de su compromiso y lealtad, cuestionas su talento y su habilidad para realizar las arduas tareas de la orden. Si bien no sabes con seguridad si podrá estar a la altura del desafío de la orden, poniéndote a ti y a otros en peligro, no cabe duda de que solo tu palabra bastaría para permitirle que ingrese o se quede fuera.\n\nToma tu decisión."
G["Your offer will be carefully considered, harbinger.  In the meantime we will make use of your delegation in an advisory role."]="先驱者，我会认真考虑你的建议。同时，我们也会随时向你们咨询的。"
G["Your offering has come too late, little one. Can you feel the mist closing in upon you? The Kvaldir return..."]="太迟了，小东西。迷雾已经逼近。克瓦迪尔回来了……"
G["Your old lives, your mortal desires mean nothing... you are acolytes of the master now, and you will serve the cause without question! The greatest glory is to die in the master's service!"]="你们这群凡人，你们的意志一无是处……现在，你们都将成为主人的奴仆，并忠诚地为主人服务！世上最光荣的事莫过于为主人的事业而牺牲！"
G["Your only concern here is your stake in this operation?"]="看来你在乎的只是自身的利害关系？"
G["Your only hope is that you will all burn together. There is no victory for you."]="你只能奢望与他们一起被烧死。你们没有胜利的可能。"
G["Your only lesson will be death."]="你得到的唯一教训就是死亡。"
G["Your orders have been revoked until further notice.  Cool your jets and try to be more careful out there!"]="你的请求已被驳回，请等候下次通知。关掉引擎，下次行动最好当心点！"
G["Your overconfidence will be your undoing! Guards, lend me your strength!"]="你的自负将给你带来灭亡！卫兵，把你们的力量借给我!"
G["Your overlord promised me help. Where is this important person he intends to send?"]="博古洛克大王曾许诺会帮助我们。但他派来的重要人物在哪儿呢？"
G["Your own strength feeds me, $n!"]="你的力量让我更加强大，$n！"
G["Your pain amuses me!"]="你的痛苦让我愉悦！"
G["Your pain excites me!"]="你的痛苦让我感到兴奋不已！"
G["Your pain has only begun!"]="你们的痛楚才刚开始！"
G["Your pain is my release."]="你的痛苦就是我的慰藉。"
G["Your pain will be endless."]="你的痛苦永无止尽。"
G["Your pain will end soon!"]="你的痛苦很快就可以结束了！"
G["Your path does not match mine.  You must seek training elsewhere, $c."]="你所选择的道路和我的不一样。$c，你必须去别的地方训练。"
G["Your path is steady, $n, for Washte Pawne's resolve is with you."]="你将会坚定不移，$n，因为你已经具有了瓦希塔帕恩的决心。"
G["Your pathetic attempt to escape will be short lived, Gorefiend. Let the $g boy:girl; go and submit! Even with your armor and weapons, you cannot defeat the ancients!"]="血魔，你最好打消逃跑的念头。离开这个$g小伙子:姑娘;的躯体，投降吧！即便你全力以赴，也是不可能逃走的！"
G["Your pathetic challenge has not gone unnoticed. I shall enjoy toying with you before you die."]="就凭你也敢来挑衅。死之前让我好好享受一下玩弄你的乐趣吧。"
G["Your pathetic defense ends here!"]="你们的防御力量就会被歼灭！"
G["Your pathetic efforts shall yield you nothing but pain."]="这些毫无价值的努力，除了痛苦以外，什么都不能带给你。"
G["Your people are both stout and ferocious. But always remember, the lion kills only when hungry."]="你们的人民勇敢而强悍。但请记住，雄狮只在饥饿时才会杀戮。"
G["Your people are despicable cowards, orc. You are nothing more than rabid dogs, and you will be put down!"]="你的族人都是卑劣的懦夫，兽人。你们都会像疯狗一样被消灭，别想得到聚焦之虹。"
G["Your people are legitimate prisoners of war. They orchestrated an attack on Darnassus from MY city-"]="你所谓的同胞都是些战俘。他们居然敢在我的城市里策划袭击了达纳苏斯——"
G["Your people are lost. Even as we speak, we mogu are overtaking your precious Vale."]="你的族人已经失败了。眼下，我们魔古族正在侵占你珍爱的山谷。"
G["Your people are very interesting, $r. I wish to know more about you and your kind."]="你们的人很有趣，$r。我希望能更深入地了解你和你的同胞们。"
G["Your people have an interesting practice of arrival to someone's home."]="你们这些人总是喜欢不请自来。"
G["Your people will always be with you!"]="你的人民永远和你在一起！"
G["Your perseverance strengthens us. Your courage leads us. Your honor inspires us."]="你的毅力壮大着我们。你的勇气指引着我们。你的荣耀激励着我们。"
G["Your pet fell down!"]="你的宠物倒下了！"
G["Your pet had its shot, and nature selected it for extinction."]="你的宠物完全是活该，自然已经决定了它的灭绝。"
G["Your pet is a cold, ruthless killer!"]="你的宠物是个冰冷无情的杀手！"
G["Your pet is wonderful, Gerard, but she needs a collar with a bell I think."]="你的宠物很不错，杰勒德，但我想她需要一个带着铃铛的项圈。"
G["Your petty magics are no challenge to the might of the Scourge!"]="你们可笑的魔法对天灾军团来说不值一提！"
G["Your petty quarrels only make me stronger."]="你们微不足道的抵抗只能让我变得更加强大。"
G["Your petty quarrels only make me stronger.... BOW to the god of death!"]="你们微不足道的抵抗只能让我变得更加强大……向死亡之神屈膝投降吧！"
G["Your petty triumphs have been futile. The power of the Twilight's Hammer is absolute!"]="你们那不起眼的小胜利根本算不了什么。暮光之锤的力量是无可匹敌的！"
G["Your pitiful rituals are meaningless! I will not be saved!"]="你那可怜的仪式毫无意义！我回不了头了！"
G["Your plan was a good one, Sha'heen, and you would have gotten away with it if not for one thing..."]="沙赫恩，你的计划是不错。要不是出了点差池，你应该能侥幸成功的……"
G["Your plan worked! The two of you accomplished the work of an army."]="计划成功了！你们俩简直抵得上一整支军队。"
G["Your politics are no concern of mine. Your Horde has disrespected the sanctity of this place. You are no longer welcome here - leave at once!"]="我不关心你们的内政。你们部落亵渎了这片圣地。这里不再欢迎你们了——给我立刻离开这里！"
G["Your potion-making skills are beyond mine. Seek out the undead Doctor Herbert Halsey in the Apothecarium of the Undercity. He has the skill to train you further, and you can witness firsthand his people's plight."]="你制造药剂的技术已经在我之上。去幽暗城的炼金房找亡灵赫伯特·哈尔希医生。他可以继续你的训练，而你也可以亲眼目睹他的人民所遭受的苦难。"
G["Your power is impressive.  I admit defeat."]="你可真了不起。我认输。"
G["Your power is mine!"]="你的力量是我的！"
G["Your power strengthens us all."]="你的力量使我们变得更加强大。"
G["Your power wanes, ancient one.... Soon you will join your friends."]="你的力量在减弱，老家伙……准备下去见你的朋友吧。"
G["Your powers... ak-ak... turn against you..."]="你的力量……呱——呱……将转而对付你……"
G["Your precious consort has failed you. You shall be the next to fall!"]="你的配偶已经完蛋了。下一个就轮到你了！"
G["Your preparations are complete.  All that now stands before you and your dreadsteed is the ritual for the Circle of Greater Summoning, and the binding of the dreadsteed's spirit..."]="你的准备工作已经完成了。现在挡在你和你的恐惧战马之间的就只有开启强力召唤法阵、束缚恐惧战马灵魂的仪式。"
G["Your presence disturbs a lingering spirit!"]="你的出现惊扰了游荡的灵魂！"
G["Your presence here can only mean trouble, $g son : daughter; of the Horde.  Go in peace."]="$g小伙子:姑娘;，你在这儿只会给我们添麻烦而已。走吧。"
G["Your presence here is interfering with very important work. Please leave at once. Where was I, again?"]="你的出现打扰了这项重要的工作，请马上离开。我刚才进展到哪里了？"
G["Your presence here is unwelcome, elemental!"]="这里不欢迎你们，元素！"
G["Your presence here is unwelcome."]="这里不欢迎你。"
G["Your presence is not welcome here, Amnennar."]="这里不欢迎你，亚门纳尔。"
G["Your presence shall no longer defile our home!"]="别想再玷污我们的家园！"
G["Your presence steels our nerves, $G Master:Mistress; $n."]="Tu presencia nos hace fuertes, $gMaestro:Maestra; $n."
G["Your presence unbalances the land. You must be removed!"]="你打破了这里的平衡。去死吧！"
G["Your previous line of work, recruit?"]="应征者，你以前是做什么工作的？"
G["Your profession?"]="你的职业？"
G["Your progress in this region has been impressive, blood prince.  I am pleased."]="你在这里所取得的进展令人眼前一亮，血之王子。我很满意。"
G["Your propaganda won't work on me. Spout your treasonous filth elsewhere, traitor!"]="你的言论根本影响不了我。去别的地方散布那些叛逆的理论吧，叛徒！"
G["Your protection is strong, child.  Continue your work."]="你的信仰很坚定，孩子。继续做事吧。"
G["Your prowess as a $c is unquestionable."]="作为一个$c，你的勇猛毋庸置疑。"
G["Your prowess in battle humbles me. Thank you, stranger."]="Tu destreza en la batalla es una lección de humildad. Gracias, $gdesconocido:desconocida;."
G["Your prowess, your might, and your cunning will be under close watch. These games will determine the best Azeroth has to offer."]="你们的勇敢、力量和机智都将受到万众瞩目。这些竞赛将决定谁才是艾泽拉斯最强的战士。"
G["Your pursuit shall be in vain, intruders, for the Lich King has placed an army of undead at my command! Behold!"]="你们的努力是徒劳的，入侵者。巫妖王让我统率的可是一支亡灵大军！小心了！"
G["Your queen sends you to your deaths."]="你们的女皇派你们来送死。"
G["Your quest is meaningless."]="你的寻求毫无意义。"
G["Your quest to learn Draconic is futile, mortal. And why would you ever want to learn to speak in the ancient tongue? Baffling really..."]="凡人，你想要学习龙人语言，这简直是异想天开。为什么你想要学习这种古老的语言呢？真是不可理喻……"
G["Your race has no honor. But come anyway... you'll die like all the others!"]="你的种族毫无荣耀可言。尽管放马过来吧……反正你会像其他人一样死去！"
G["Your race is a disease upon the sea."]="你的种族就是海洋的疾病。"
G["Your race is a disease upon the world!"]="你的种族就是世界的污点！"
G["Your rage gives you strength!"]="怒火给了你力量。"
G["Your rage sustains me!"]="你的愤怒支撑着我。"
G["Your reach exceeds your grasp."]="你们走得太远了。"
G["Your red allies will share your fate!"]="红龙军团也将步你们的后尘！"
G["Your reflexes will quicken, and your stamina will increase."]="它能让你变得更加灵敏，更加坚韧。"
G["Your reign has come to an end, oh Lord of the Waves!"]="波涛之王，你的统治已经到头了！"
G["Your reign of terror ends now!  Face your doom mortals!"]="你的恐怖统治现在结束了！面对你的末日吧！"
G["Your reign over the realm of magic will be absolute, even after the Hour of Twilight."]="你将得到对魔法国度至高无上的统治权，即使是在暮光审判日之后。"
G["Your remains shall soon join those of them who have come before you."]="你很快就会与这些先你而来的家伙们汇合了。"
G["Your remains will be fed to the sharks of Daggercap!"]="我要拿你的尸体去喂匕鞘湾的鲨鱼！"
G["Your remains will feed IT which rises!"]="你残破的身躯将成为新的力量崛起的养料！"
G["Your reputation precedes you, $n. This should be interesting."]="$n，久仰大名啊。这场战斗一定会非常有趣。"
G["Your request cannot be processed."]="你的请求未能得到批准。"
G["Your resilience is admirable."]="你的执着真是令人钦佩。"
G["Your resistance is insignificant."]="放弃毫无意义的反抗吧。"
G["Your retention was poor."]="你的记性太差劲了。"
G["Your return brings you only death."]="回来了，就只有死路一条。"
G["Your ride's waitin', buddy. Let's ditch this place!"]="你的座驾已经准备好了，朋友。让我们离开这个地方！"
G["Your robe is complete, $n."]="你的长袍做好了，$n。"
G["Your rogue friend is not as nimble as he thinks he is."]="你那潜行者朋友自以为身手矫健。"
G["Your sacrifice is a testament to your obedience.  Indeed you are worthy of this charge. Arise, and forever be known as Svala Sorrowgrave!"]="这次献祭只是对你恭顺与服从的考验。现在你已证明自己确实可以胜任我的嘱托。平身吧，席瓦拉·索格蕾！"
G["Your sacrifice will fuel our efforts."]="你的牺牲会让我们获得更多力量。"
G["Your sacrifice will not be forgotten."]="你做出的牺牲是不会被遗忘的。"
G["Your safety and well-being are no longer any concern of mine."]="你们的安全和福祉已经与我无关了。"
G["Your salvation has arrived... and it's affordably priced!"]="你的拯救已经来了……而且它的价格很合理！"
G["Your screams will carry far on the winds...."]="你的尖叫将随风远逝……"
G["Your search is almost completed.  Seek your truth in the entrance room of Thrall's Fortress in the Valley of Wisdom."]="你的搜寻基本结束了。到智慧谷的萨尔的要塞入口房间里找寻真知吧。"
G["Your serpent eats the food and looks around for more."]="你的翔龙吃完后又四处张望，寻找起食物来。"
G["Your serpent flies back home!"]="你的翔龙飞回家了！"
G["Your serpent gobbles up the food hungrily."]="你的翔龙狼吞虎咽着。"
G["Your serpent gulps down the food. Yum!"]="你的翔龙一口吞下了食物。好美味！"
G["Your serpent is arriving now. Please mount when you are ready."]="Tu dragón llegará ahora. Monta en él cuando estés $gpreparado:preparada;."
G["Your serpent is arriving now. You can find the flags hanging from the red hot air balloons in the sky."]="你的翔龙已经到了。你可以在空中找到悬挂在红色热气球上的旗帜。"
G["Your serpent licks its lips. That was delicious!"]="你的翔龙舔着嘴唇，真是太好吃了！"
G["Your serpent looks at you imploringly. Is there more?"]="你的翔龙恳求地看着你，还有食物吗？"
G["Your serpent nudges you affectionately before digging in."]="你的翔龙在开吃之前亲昵地拱了你一下。"
G["Your serpent thought that the food was delicious."]="你的翔龙觉得食物非常美味。"
G["Your serpent will arrive in just a moment. Good luck!"]="你的翔龙马上就到了，祝你好运！"
G["Your serpent will not venture beyond The Arboretum! Return to the Arboretum now!"]="你的翔龙不能离开百木园！马上回百木园去！"
G["Your serpent's belly looks a little rounder."]="你的翔龙的肚子看上去又圆了一点。"
G["Your service has been invaluable in fulfilling the master's plan. May you forever grow in power...."]="你帮助主人实现了他伟大的计划。愿你的力量越来越强……"
G["Your shredder is nearly ready, really!\n\nAny moment now... just keep checking with me!"]="你的伐木机就要完成了，真的！\n\n随时都有可能……请再联系我！"
G["Your sincerity is moving, druid."]="你的真诚很让人感动，德鲁伊。"
G["Your skill at brewing potions needs to be greater before you can become one of my students. In the meantime, perhaps Sylvanna Forestmoon or Milla Fairancora can help you, just over there."]="你制造药剂的技能需要再高超一些才能当我的学生。在此期间，在那边的希尔瓦娜·林月或米拉·法拉科纳可能会帮助你。"
G["Your skill at range would be best suited to the fight higher up. Use your hooks to ascend to one of the upper Vermillion Skyscreamers, then pick off the circling Pyrewings from there."]="你的远程技巧很适合在高处进行战斗。用你的钩子跃到一头朱红啸天龙的背上，然后从那里射击盘旋的火翼龙。"
G["Your skill displays an enduring affection for our art, but I would see further evidence of your commitment. I shall charge you with a task. Fulfill it, and I will be content."]="你的技能显示你一直喜爱我们的艺术，但是我想看到你所做承诺的进一步证据。我会分配给你一项任务。完成它就会令我满意。"
G["Your skill exceeds mine, though  I've heard that Old Man Heming in Booty Bay has copies of \"The Bass and You\".  That is sure to help you increase your skill."]="Tu habilidad supera a la mía, pero he oído que el Viejo Heming en la Bahía del Botín, tiene ejemplares de \"La lubina y tú\". Seguro que te ayuda a mejorar tu habilidad."
G["Your skill has grown immense, $c. In order to further your instruction, you must journey to Outland itself. Kalaen will train you in Thrallmar, within Hellfire Peninsula. If you prefer, you can speak to the rather prudish Hamanar on Aldor Rise within Shattrath City, though I wouldn't advise it."]="$c，你的进展真是神速啊！现在你该前往外域学习更多关于珠宝加工的新知识了。你可以去地狱火半岛的萨尔玛找卡莱恩谈谈。如果你更喜欢奥尔多的话，就去沙塔斯城的奥尔多高地找哈曼纳尔。他是个相当假正经的家伙，我可不建议你去找他。"
G["Your skill impresses me greatly, $n! It is time for you to head to Outland to learn more. If you head to Hellfire Peninsula, Tatiana will take you on as a student in Honor Hold. Or, if you prefer working with the Aldor, Hamanar can instruct you in Shattrath City, on Aldor Rise."]="$n，你的进展真是令我吃惊！现在你该前往外域学习更多关于珠宝加工的新知识了。你可以去地狱火半岛的荣耀堡找塔蒂亚娜谈谈。如果你更喜欢奥尔多的话，就去沙塔斯城的奥尔多高地找哈曼纳尔。"
G["Your skill in blacksmithing is exceptional, $n. The time has come to make a decision. There are two paths you may choose: The way of the weaponsmith or the art of the armorsmith.\n\nBe warned, when you have chosen to dedicate yourself to a path, there is no going back. The discipline each path requires leaves no room for hybrids."]="Tu habilidad en herrería es excepcional, $n. Ha llegado el momento de tomar una decisión. Puedes elegir entre dos caminos: el del forjador de armas o el del forjador de armaduras.\n\nPero $gatento:atenta;, cuando elijas dedicarte a uno de ellos, ya no habrá vuelta atrás. La disciplina que exigen no deja espacio para híbridos."
G["Your skill in cooking is only as great as your most advanced Way."]="从一而精，此为烹饪之道。"
G["Your skill is not inconsiderable. Since you appear to have sufficient experience, there is a matter in which I require your aid."]="你的技能并不是毫无可取之处的。既然你看起来经验非常丰富，有一件事情我需要你的帮助。"
G["Your skill is notable, $c, and I believe the time has come for you to vacate the premises. If you wish to expand your horizons, visit Josef Gregorian in the Undercity."]="$c，你的技艺进展得不错嘛，我认为时机已经成熟了。如果你想要进一步提升技能的话，就去幽暗城拜访乔瑟夫·格里高利吧。"
G["Your skills are beyond my reach. It is time for you to face new challenges. Taladan will help you prepare. He is standing by the table there."]="你的技能已经非我能及。现在你该接受新的挑战了。塔兰丹会帮你准备。他就站在那里的桌子旁边。"
G["Your skills are coming along nicely. Soon you'll be running a leather shop of your own. I'll be glad for the help, $n. My hands are only so fast, you know? There's so much work to do!"]="你的技术在进步,很快你就会拥有一家你自己的皮革商店。我很高兴能帮你，$n。我的速度就只能这么快了，你知道吗？有那么多工作要做！"
G["Your skills are insufficient to learn what I teach. Try talking to Mak over there instead. He can help you out until you're ready for more advanced lessons."]="Tus habilidades son insuficientes para aprender lo que yo enseño. Prueba a hablar con Mak. Podrá ayudarte hasta que estés $glisto:lista; para recibir lecciones avanzadas."
G["Your skills are out of my league, stranger.Talk to Hgarth at the Sun Rock Retreat in the Stonetalon Mountains. He will provide you with more knowledge than I can."]="Tus habilidades superan con creces a las mías, $gforastero:forastera;. Ve a hablar con Hgarth en el Refugio Roca del Sol de la Sierra Espolón. Con él podrás avanzar en tu conocimiento."
G["Your skills are somewhat impressive. You shall make an excellent slave one day."]="Tus habilidades no están nada mal. Algún día serás $gun esclavo:una esclava; excelente."
G["Your skills are too great. I yield."]="你太厉害了。我认输。"
G["Your skills are truly becoming extraordinary. Now, let us continue your training..."]="你的技能正变得非同寻常。现在，继续你的训练……"
G["Your skills have surpassed mine, young one. Go see Una who has a shop in Thunder Bluff's central plateau. She can give you the guidance you seek."]="你的技巧已经超过我了，年轻人。去找尤纳，她在雷霆崖的中央高地上有一家商店。她能给你你需要的指导。"
G["Your skills in alchemy aren't yet high enough to benefit from my teachings.  Perhaps if you speak with me later..."]="你的炼金技能还不足以理解我所传授的知识。也许你应该晚些时候再来找我谈谈……"
G["Your skills in battle are impressive, $n."]="你的作战技巧令人印象深刻，$n。"
G["Your skills in combat are admirable, hero. Keep yourself useful on the battlefield. I will take this criminal back for...questioning."]="你的战斗技巧令人称羡，英雄。希望你能继续活跃在战场上。我会把这个罪犯带回去……审讯的……"
G["Your skills in combat are most impressive."]="你的战斗技巧很惊人。"
G["Your skull gonna decorate our ritual altars!"]="你的头骨将用于装饰我们的祭坛！"
G["Your skull will adorn my necklace."]="我要把你的脑袋穿在项链上。"
G["Your skull will make a fine prize!"]="你的脑袋将是一个不错的战利品！"
G["Your skulls I shall crack with all the might of Blackrock."]="我会用黑石的力量打碎你的头骨。"
G["Your skulls shall adorn N'Zoth's writhing throne."]="你们的头颅将装饰恩佐斯的扭曲王座。"
G["Your soldiers are being used as living shields to stave off artillery fire in the Valley of Echoes, allowing the forces of the Lich King to assault your base without impediment."]="在回音谷，你的士兵成为了阻挡炮火的肉盾，帮助巫妖王的军队顺利地攻陷了你的营地。"
G["Your soul belongs to me now."]="你的灵魂属于我了。"
G["Your soul belongs to the abyss!"]="你的灵魂将归于深渊！"
G["Your soul cannot withstand my power!"]="你的灵魂无法承受的我的力量。"
G["Your soul gonna bleed!"]="你的灵魂在流血！"
G["Your soul is bound to me, now!"]="你的灵魂现在属于我了！"
G["Your soul is doomed!"]="你的灵魂注定毁灭！"
G["Your soul is doomed! Our defenses are nearly armed..."]="你的灵魂注定会被毁灭！我们的护盾防御就快准备就绪了……"
G["Your soul is mine, trespasser!"]="¡Tu alma me pertenece, $gintruso:intrusa;!"
G["Your soul is mine, weakling."]="软弱的家伙，你的灵魂是我的了。"
G["Your soul is mine."]="你的灵魂属于我。"
G["Your soul will be mine to torture!"]="你的灵魂将被我折磨！"
G["Your soul will find no redemption here!"]="你们将在这里魂飞魄散！"
G["Your soul will know ENDLESS TORMENT!"]="你的灵魂将遭受无尽的折磨！"
G["Your soul will languish for eternity."]="你的灵魂将陷入渴望永生的痛楚中。"
G["Your souls belong to the Scourge now, mortals."]="凡人，你的灵魂归天灾军团了。"
G["Your souls shall sate N'Zoth's endless hunger."]="你们的灵魂将成为恩佐斯口中的美餐！"
G["Your souls will be MINE!"]="你的灵魂将属于我！"
G["Your spark of life is... extinguished."]="你的生命之火……就此熄灭了。"
G["Your sparring is feeble!"]="你的拳头缺乏力道！"
G["Your spells will not be as potent as mine, but you will still find anti-magic shells to be entirely invaluable against a large number of magical attacks."]="和我相比，你们施放的法术还不够强大，但是在密集的魔法攻击下，反魔法护罩依然能起到完美的保护作用。"
G["Your spells... ke-kaw... are weak magics... easy to turn against you..."]="你的法术……呱——呱……脆弱的魔法……轻而易举地就能转而对付你……"
G["Your spirit has been ripped from your body! Get back to your body!"]="你的灵魂已经出窍！快回到你的身体里去吧！"
G["Your spirit is pure, $n."]="你的灵魂很纯洁，$n。"
G["Your spirit reunites with your ancestors, little one."]="你的灵魂与先祖同在，小家伙。"
G["Your spirit shall find no rest in these lands!"]="你的灵魂将永无宁日！"
G["Your spirit will linger here forever!"]="你们的灵魂将永远在这里游荡！"
G["Your spirits are weak, and your blows are weaker!"]="你的精神很虚弱，你的打击更弱！"
G["Your sssacrifice pleases him."]="拿你当祭品……取悦他……"
G["Your stance is wrong. Your footing is totally off balance. Your head is too soft.\n\nReturn here when you have learned that you are ready to learn."]="你的姿势错了。你完全站不稳脚跟。你的头脑太笨。\n\n当你已经学到准备去学的东西时，请返回这里。"
G["Your steel is strong, your skill stronger. Take your steel and your strength to my mate Shayis Steelfury, her skill with armor crafting is unmatched even by me."]="你的锻造技术非常高超。你应该去找我的妻子莎伊斯·钢怒，她锻造盔甲的技术天下无双，即便是我也比不上她。"
G["Your stench sickens me. I'd kill you myself if it were not for Angerboda."]="你身上的臭味熏死我了。要不是为了安格博达女王，我早就杀了你。"
G["Your stench will attract every dragon for miles.  Tell me what you want, and quickly."]="你的臭气会把数英里内的所有龙都招来的。告诉我你想要什么，快些。"
G["Your story continues on, friend.\n\nIt is a story worth reading."]="你的故事还将继续，朋友。\n\n这个故事很有看头。"
G["Your strategy was flawed."]="你的战术有漏洞。"
G["Your strength has helped free this land of its long held darkness. It is my honor to witness your deeds with my own eyes, Champion."]="Tu fuerza ha ayudado a esta tierra a liberarse de una oscuridad muy antigua. Es un honor presenciar tus hazañas, $gcampeón:campeona;."
G["Your strength is of the mountain.  Your grace is of the winds!"]="您犹如高山一般强壮，而气质却又如微风一般优雅！"
G["Your struggle is meaningless.  You will all fall before the endless Scourge!"]="反抗是毫无意义的。你们终将被浩浩荡荡的亡灵大军践踏在脚底！"
G["Your struggle is pitiful and weak!"]="瞧瞧你那可怜而又懦弱的反抗！"
G["Your struggle is pointless."]="你的挣扎毫无意义。"
G["Your stupidity has finally caught up with you!"]="你们的愚蠢必将葬送自己！"
G["Your success was short-lived!"]="你的成功转瞬即逝！"
G["Your suffering fans the flames!"]="你的痛苦将会使烈火烧得更旺！"
G["Your suffering strengthens me."]="你们的苦难强化了我。"
G["Your surge needle appears to have worked perfectly.  Surely Goramosh now has time to speak further of the proposed accord?"]="湍流之针看上去运转正常嘛。古拉莫什现在一定能抽出时间来谈谈我们的协议吧？"
G["Your tale ends here, shaman."]="你的传说将在此终结，萨满。"
G["Your talent is beyond my own, friend. Speak with Tarn here; his knowledge of leather is much greater than mine. I'm sure he would welcome another student."]="Tu talento supera al mío, $gamigo:amiga;. Ve a hablar con Tarn; su conocimiento sobre el cuero es mucho mayor que el mío. Estoy seguro de que aceptará a otro estudiante."
G["Your talents excel! You are truly inspired. To continue your pursuit of knowledge, speak with Georgio Bolero in Stormwind. He is held in high regard, and will be able to further your instruction."]="你的才能出众！你真是有灵性。你要想继续追求知识的话，找暴风城的乔吉奥·波利罗谈谈。他深受众人尊敬，而且他能深化对你的指导。"
G["Your talents in cooking are a little too low.  Maybe with some practice I can teach you what I know."]="你的烹饪水平实在是太低了。再去训练一段时间，也许我就可以教你一些我所知道的东西。"
G["Your target has been knocked off-balance."]="目标被打得失去了平衡。"
G["Your target has evaded your Charge."]="目标躲过了你的冲锋。"
G["Your target was waiting for your Charge with a readied lance."]="目标端起长枪，等待你发起冲锋。"
G["Your task is complete. Prepare to meet your doom."]="你的任务完成了。准备受死吧。"
G["Your technique needs work."]="武艺不精。"
G["Your temple is broken."]="你的寺院被攻破。"
G["Your tenacity is admirable, but pointless!"]="你们的顽强令我赞叹，但毫无价值。"
G["Your tenacity is admirable, but pointless. You ride into the jaws of the apocalypse."]="你们的顽强令我赞叹，但毫无价值。你们踏上了末日审判之路。"
G["Your tentacled head, a mere trophy for my queen..."]="你那章鱼脑袋将成为献给女王的战利品……"
G["Your thanks are unnecessary, my friend. I consider it a privilege to speak to your recruits."]="不必言谢，我的朋友。我想我可以随意与你手下的新兵交谈吧。"
G["Your theft is forbidden, trespasser!"]="入侵者，停止你的盗窃行为！"
G["Your thoughts intrigue me. There is purpose to your actions. Your complexity is impressive."]="你的思想吸引着我。你的行动充满目的性。你的复杂程度令人印象深刻。"
G["Your time ends now!"]="你的生命终结了！"
G["Your time has come to an end."]="你的生命结束了。"
G["Your time has come, $n. Master Kang awaits..."]="你的机会来了，$n。康恩在等……"
G["Your time has come."]="你的死期到了。"
G["Your time has finally come, Godfrey!"]="你的死期到了，高弗雷！"
G["Your time has not yet come."]="你的时间还未到。"
G["Your time has past, night elves. Ashenvale is ours!"]="你们的时代过去了，暗夜精灵。灰谷是我们的了！"
G["Your time in the Ring of Judgment comes soon, maggot."]="你马上就要进入审判竞技场了，蝼蚁。"
G["Your time is almost... up."]="你们的日子……就要到头。"
G["Your time is coming to an end."]="你的时间就要结束了。"
G["Your time is nigh..."]="你的末日到了……"
G["Your time is running out!"]="你们时日不多了！"
G["Your time is up, Forsaken scum!"]="你们的时代结束了，被遗忘者！"
G["Your time is up, slave of the past."]="你的时间结束了，往日的奴隶。"
G["Your time learning at my side draws to a close, friend. Akham will gladly instruct you further."]="朋友，你在我这里的受训课程就快结束了。阿克汉姆会继续向你传授新知识的。"
G["Your timeline is no more!"]="你的时间流被彻底摧毁了！"
G["Your timing is flawless. I was just about to leave. But please, stay and enjoy the town while Toya gathers the jade we need."]="你来得可真是时候。我正准备离开。但请你留下逛逛村庄，托亚正在搜集我们需要的玉石。"
G["Your timing is perfect as always, hero. It is time to kick down the Thunder King's front door."]="你总在我们最需要的时候出现，英雄。该去踢开雷电之王的前门了。"
G["Your tinker must've made you from tin, you lazy piles of slag!"]="你一定是用锡锭造出来的，懒骨头！"
G["Your tone enrages me, outsider. If this is what we can expect from your so-called \"Alliance,\" we will have no part in it!"]="Tu tono me enfurece, $gforastero:forastera;. Si esto es lo que podemos esperar de tu famosa \"Alianza\", ¡no queremos saber nada!"
G["Your torture only adds to my rage!"]="你们的酷刑只会激怒我！"
G["Your tour guide will be along any minute now..."]="你的向导随时可能出现……"
G["Your tour guide will be here shortly..."]="你的向导马上就到……"
G["Your training has paid off, young $c. You have found Huo and brought him safely to the temple."]="你的训练很有成效，年轻的$c。你成功找到了燧焰并将他带回了五晨寺。"
G["Your training has progressed well, sisters. It won't be long before you lead your own people, with no further need of my teaching."]="你们的训练进行得很顺利，姐妹们。过不了多久，你们就能带领自己的人民，再不需要我的教导。"
G["Your training is complete for today.  Return tomorrow and we will continue."]="你今天的训练已经完成了。明天再回来继续训练。"
G["Your training is now complete. You each have your assignments. May the Light guide you."]="你的训练已经结束。我给你们都分派了任务，愿圣光指引你。"
G["Your training will be put to use very soon, young $c. Go now, continue your lessons."]="你的训练很快就会发挥作用的，年轻的$c。现在继续你的学习吧。"
G["Your treachery only speeds your doom.  This world will fall to darkness!"]="背叛只会加速你的灭亡。世界将陷入黑暗！"
G["Your trespass shall see no forgiveness.  Deathwing is no longer here to coddle you."]="你的入侵将不会被原谅。死亡之翼不会再在这里庇护你了。"
G["Your turn will come. Hate, will turn you all against one another until this whole world burns."]="马上就轮到你们了。仇恨，将让你们自相残杀，并将整个世界燃尽！"
G["Your undeath is not the end of your life, but the beginning. It is up to you to decide where your fate lies now."]="这并不是你生命的结束，而是新的开始。现在是由你来决定自己命运的时候了。"
G["Your understanding of leather is deeper than my own. Perhaps you should visit Aayndia Floralwind in the town of Astranaar in Ashenvale Forest. She has much knowledge to offer a student of your talents."]="你对皮革的理解比我要深刻。可能你应该拜访一下灰谷森林阿斯特兰纳的艾蒂安·花丛之风。对你这么聪明的学生,她应该有很多知识要教给你。"
G["Your understanding of leather is deeper than my own. Perhaps you should visit the tauren Krulmoo Fullmoon in Camp Taurajo of the Barrens. He has much knowledge to offer a student of your talents."]="你对皮革的理解比我要深刻。可能你应该拜访一下贫瘠之地陶拉祖营地的牛头人克鲁姆·满月。对你这么聪明的学生他有很多知识要教给你。"
G["Your vehicle is burning!"]="载具起火了！"
G["Your victories cease here, tamer."]="你的胜利到此为止，驯宠师。"
G["Your victory here only speeds your doom!"]="你在这里的胜利只会加速你的灭亡！"
G["Your victory is meaningless."]="你的胜利毫无意义。"
G["Your victory is well-deserved, tamer."]="你的胜利受之无愧，驯宠师。"
G["Your victory shall be short lived. The days of both the Alliance and Horde are coming to an end! The next time we meet shall be the last."]="你的胜利不会长久。联盟和部落的日子都不长了！下次我们见面就是最后一次了。"
G["Your victory will be short lived..."]="你们的胜利只是暂时的……"
G["Your visit is like the gust of wind before the storm."]="你的到来，犹如暴风雨来临前的一阵疾风。"
G["Your voice is hoarse from yelling huh?  Find the Orgrimmar Auction House in the Valley of Strength."]="你的嗓子喊哑了是吗？在力量谷就可以找到奥格瑞玛拍卖行。"
G["Your voice is so beautiful. Sometimes I swear I could hear a whole orchestra when you sing!"]="你的声音太动人了。有时我甚至觉得能在你的歌声中听到整支乐队的美妙乐音！"
G["Your voice. Your hands. THESE are the tools of true heroes. Use them well... and you can change the world."]="你的声音。你的双手。这些成就了真正的英雄。善加利用……你便能改变世界。"
G["Your war has brought unprecedented destruction here. Even the mantid are less of a threat than your flying machines and bombs."]="你们的战争让这里遭遇了前所未有的灾难。与你们那些飞艇和炸弹比起来，就连螳螂妖的威胁都显得稍逊一筹。"
G["Your warm-up is complete.  Now, the real trial begins!"]="热身结束了。现在，真正的试炼开始了！"
G["Your weakness betrays you."]="你的软弱背叛了你。"
G["Your weakness is not my failing, Regent. My Horde has room only for those strong enough to stand within it."]="你们的软弱可不是我的错，摄政王。在我的部落里，只有强者才能立足。"
G["Your weakness offends!"]="你们的软弱让人恼火！"
G["Your weapon is finished, $n. Wield it as an example to all who serve the Alliance."]="你的武器完成了，$n。用它去夺取光荣，为所有联盟的成员树立榜样吧。"
G["Your weapon is finished. I think you will find our work a fitting reward for your loyalty to the Horde. Use it to remind our enemies why they should fear us!"]="你的武器完成了。正是因为你对部落的忠诚，我们才会将努力工作的成果赠送给你。用它来让我们的敌人胆战心寒吧！"
G["Your weapons are nothing to me! Relent!"]="¡Tus armas no sirven de nada contra mí! ¡Claudica!"
G["Your weapons are weak!"]="你们的武器软弱无力！"
G["Your wicked souls shall feed my power!"]="让我吞噬你的灵魂吧！"
G["Your wife is concerned for you. She wants you to return to Orgrimmar."]="你的妻子很想你。她想让你回奥格瑞玛去。"
G["Your will belong ta me now!"]="你的意志现在属于我！"
G["Your will is done, my king!"]="陛下，我已执行了您的意志！"
G["Your will is no longer your own."]="你的意志不再属于自己了。"
G["Your will is not strong enough to manipulate the forces we control $c."]="你的意志不足以操纵我们控制的军队，$c。"
G["Your will is strong, and your intent is clear.\n\nPerhaps you are worthy..."]="你的意志很坚强，而且你的意图很明显。\n\n可能你的确有资格……"
G["Your will is strong, but it seems mine was stronger.  Speak with me when you are ready to try again."]="你的意志十分强大，但与我相比还是稍逊一筹。等你准备好重试时，再来与我交谈。"
G["Your willingnesss to obey ssshall determine the length of your life."]="你是否听话，就决定着你的死期是迟到还是早来。"
G["Your winning streak ends here, $n. Today, you fall by my spear."]="你的连胜将止步于此，$n。今天，你会倒在我的枪下。"
G["Your wisdom has seen you through this trial. May it ever light your way out of dark places."]="你的智慧帮你赢得了这次试炼。愿它能始终带你走出困境。"
G["Your women and children are next.  You've failed your pitiful race."]="接下来就该轮到你的女人和孩子了。你要让可怜的猛犸人氏族失望了。"
G["Your words honor me, daughter. This is a proud moment."]="你的言辞令我倍感荣耀，女儿。这是个值得骄傲的时刻。"
G["Your words of praise are appreciated, Coliseum Master."]="感谢你的赞扬，演武场统领。"
G["Your words ring true, brother.... but even a king cannot make this decision alone.  I will put the issue to a High Council vote."]="你的话没有错，兄弟……但即使是国王也不可能独自做出决定。我会让高阶议会对此事进行投票。"
G["Your worgs are no match for the might of Stormwind!"]="你们这群座狼在暴风城的力量面前简直就是渣！"
G["Your work here is complete, shaman.  Return to your people."]="萨满祭司，你在这里的事情都完结了。回到你的族人那里去吧。"
G["Your work here is invaluable to the Offensive."]="你在这里所做的工作对我们有着不可估量的作用。"
G["Your work in Hyjal is done - return from whence you came."]="你在海加尔的工作已经完成——回到你的来时之地吧。"
G["Your world is at an end."]="你的生命走到尽头了。"
G["Your world is broken! Soon, you shall join it in death!"]="你的世界已经破碎！很快，你也将成为这世上的亡魂！"
G["Your world is ours now!"]="这个世界是我们的了！"
G["Your world shall suffer an unmerciful end. The Nightmare comes for you!"]="你所属的世界将陷入残酷的末日。噩梦已经降临！"
G["Your world teeters on the brink of annihilation. You will ALL bear witness to the coming of a new age of DESTRUCTION!"]="你们的世界正在灭绝的边缘摇摆。你们都将见证毁灭时代的到来！"
G["Your world will burn, disbeliever!"]="你的世界将熊熊燃烧，异教徒！"
G["Your world will die, mortals!  Your doom is now at hand!"]="凡人，受死吧！你的末日到了！"
G["Your world will end in darkness!"]="你们的世界将陷入黑暗！"
G["Your world-shaman has become a vortex of longing and desire. See how his heart devours everything within its proximity? Tread lightly, traveler, lest you too, be consumed."]="你的救世萨满已变成了渴求与欲望的漩涡。看到了吗？他的心正在吞噬一切。如果踏入其中，就连你也会被一同吞没。"
G["Your world-shaman is already lost to the dark fathoms. He exists now only to consume - tortured by the currents of the life he longed for - but never knew."]="你的救世萨满已经迷失在了暗流的深渊中。他只为吞噬而存在，被他内心汹涌的渴望所折磨，自己却浑然不知。"
G["Your world-shaman stands in the basalt-groves below. But take heed - he has become one with these Unending Halls of Stone."]="你的救世萨满就在下面的玄武岩森林里。但他已经变成了这无尽岩石大厅的一部分。"
G["Your world...all worlds...will burn!"]="你的世界……所有世界……都将燃烧！"
G["Your wounds are severe, but you will live."]="你的伤很严重，但性命无忧。"
G["Your yak is beginning to buck. Return to Lao & Son's Yakwash."]="你的牦牛开始反抗了。返回父子洗牛站。"
G["Your yak is in another stable."]="你的牦牛在另一个棚舍里。"
G["Your...will...be...done...<burp>"]="Que... se cumpla... tu... voluntad...<eructo>"
G["Yours is a path of doom."]="你们的道路通向毁灭。"
G["Yours will be a lesson in pain!"]="你将得到一个痛苦的教训！"
G["Yous all listen ta $n!"]="你们都得听$n的！"
G["Yous be careful. Trolls bad!"]="多加小心。巨魔太坏了！"
G["You’ve returned!\n\n<The elf’s expression shifts into a wary grimace as he catches the grave look on your face.>\n\nAnd you bring ill news, don’t you?"]="¡Has vuelto!\n\n<La expresión del elfo se torna en una mueca recelosa al advertir la gravedad de tu rostro.>\n\nY traes malas noticias, ¿verdad?"
G["Yow, the storm is more intense than I thought! Be careful!"]="呦，风暴比我想的还要猛烈！小心！"
G["Yowch!"]="哎呀！"
G["Yrr n'lyeth... shuul anagg!"]="Yrr n'lyeth... ¡Shuul anagg!"
G["Ysera has sent me here to make contact with the wilderness spirit of Aessina.\n\nYet the ancient remains silent."]="伊瑟拉派我来这里与艾森娜的荒野灵魂取得联系。\n\n可这古老的灵魂仍在保持沉默。"
G["Ysera is my answer."]="我的答案是伊瑟拉。"
G["Ysida lives thanks to your courage, $n.  I am deeply in your debt and shall assist you as much as it is in my power."]="你拯救了伊思达的生命，$n。我欠了你一个大人情，有什么能帮上忙的请尽管吩咐吧。"
G["Ysiel expected some enemy opposition to her foray into Outland.  That's why us wardens were brought along.\n\nWe never expected our opposition to come in the strength or numbers that the naga have shown."]="伊谢尔预计那些与她为敌的家伙也会入侵外域，这便是我们驻守此地的原因。\n\n我们可不愿看到敌人以超过那些纳迦军队的规模大举来犯。"
G["Yu'Lon, guardian of the east, appears on the field of battle!"]="玉珑，东方的守护者，出现在战场上！"
G["Yu'lon awaits!"]="玉珑在等着呢！"
G["Yu'lon, the Jade Serpent, keeps vigil over the east. Unfortunately, her temple has fallen to the sha of doubt.\n\nEven now, the temple needs our help. We must do everything we can to keep the sha at bay!"]="青龙玉珑，在东边担任警戒。很不幸，青龙寺已经落入疑之煞的魔掌。\n\n尽管如此，寺庙还是需要我们的帮助。我们必须尽全力将疑之煞困在港湾中！"
G["Yuck!"]="呸！"
G["Yuck! That looks disgusting!"]="咦！这看起来真恶心！"
G["Yuck."]="真恶心。"
G["Yuck... splatter."]="呃……好恶心。"
G["Yum!"]="真好吃！"
G["Yummy. I love roasted Plainstrider."]="嗯，我喜欢吃烤陆行鸟！"
G["Yup yup! Say hi for me if you find him."]="是啊，是啊！如果你找到他，代我向他问好。"
G["Yup, just as soon as I finish this pint.  You betcha."]="嗯，让我喝完这点啤酒。相信我。"
G["Yup."]="是的。"
G["Yup. Been brewin' beer since I could drink it.\n\nSome folks say I'm wastin' my time, that I could just buy the beer that comes out o' that big ol' brewery down yonder, but... I dunno. There's somethin' right nice about brewin' your own mug of ale."]="是的。我从会喝啤酒开始就在酿造啤酒了。\n\n这里的人说我在浪费时间，我可以去村子里买那种大桶的啤酒。我不那么认为。酿造自己的啤酒总是别有一番趣味。"
G["ZALAZANE. What you tinkin', takin' dat which be mine? De Darkspear dead are MY domain, sorcerer... and now you gonna be one of dem!"]="扎拉赞恩……你怎么敢抢走我的东西？死去的暗矛都是我的……而现在，你也将加入他们！"
G["ZUMONGA...KILL..."]="祖蒙加……杀……"
G["ZUNI! NOOOO!"]="祖尼！不！不——！"
G["ZZzzzz...."]="呼……"
G["Zach Chow grumbles."]="周泽客小声的嘀咕着。"
G["Zaela ... traitorous fool ... have you sold your soul to the Horde? Are you and I so different? Cast your lot with Hellscream, then. See where he takes you."]="扎伊拉……愚蠢的叛徒……你把灵魂出卖给了部落？你和我有什么区别？去追随地狱咆哮吧，看他能带你们走向何方。"
G["Zaela has fallen!  Revive her or we will meet our end on this forsaken altar!"]="扎伊拉倒下了！让她站起来，否则我们就要在这个被遗忘的祭坛上迎接末日了！"
G["Zaela told us the Horde would help! What can I do?"]="扎伊拉说部落需要援助！我能做些什么？"
G["Zalazane got most of his hexed trolls hidden under de canopy on de big island."]="扎拉赞恩让他的大多数巨魔妖术师藏在那座大岛上的树屋里面。"
G["Zalazane's mindless servants were killin' all de beasts o' de isles, burnin' up de trees and plants too. Gonk needed us ta save de life on de isles. But since we not be able ta draw upon de power o' de loa wit Zalazane in power, Gonk be showin' us a new way ta connect wit ALL de spirits o' nature, ta work WIT de spirits, not just be servin' a single loa at a time. \n\nIt be difficult at first, ya, mon, but Gonk be showin' us how ta also reach inta de Emerald Dream ta speak wit de spirits and learn from dem directly!"]="扎拉赞恩无意识的奴仆们正在这些岛屿上屠杀动物，烧毁植被。贡克需要我们去拯救这片群岛。因为扎拉赞恩的阻碍，我们还无法汲取神灵之力，所以贡克传授给我们一个新的方法，能够与所有自然之灵建立联系。我们将借助全部神灵的力量，而不再只是某一位单独的神灵。\n\n一开始，这样做会很难，朋友。但贡克已经让我们懂得，该如何进入翡翠梦境，直接与那里的神灵对话，向他们学习技艺！"
G["Zalazane's time be runnin' out. De Echo Isles will belong to de Darkspear Tribe again!"]="扎拉赞恩就要完蛋了。回音群岛将再次属于暗矛部族！"
G["Zalazane's time has come! De Darkspear will have a proper home again. Be ready!"]="扎拉赞恩的末日到了！暗矛部族将再次回到家园。准备出发！"
G["Zaldimar could probably teach you some new spells.  He has recently taken a liking to staying at the Lion's Pride Inn, you might want to check one of the rooms and see if he's in."]="扎尔迪玛可能会教你一些新的法术。他最近喜欢待在狮王之傲旅店，你可以去那里的房间看看他在不在。"
G["Zamja be de best cook in Orgrimmar, mon.\n\nYou can find her just south of de valley's central building. Batamsi sells de food Zamja makes, too, if ya just be hungry."]="扎姆沙是奥格瑞玛最好的厨师，朋友。\n\n你可以在这座山谷的中心建筑南边找到她。如果你真的很饿，也可以在巴塔姆西那里买到扎姆沙烹制的食物。"
G["Zan'vess will never fall!"]="扎尼维斯不会陷落！"
G["Zandalar gonna bring back de old ways."]="赞达拉人将重建昔日的光辉岁月。"
G["Zandalar gonna rise again."]="赞达拉人将会东山再起。"
G["Zandalari reinforcements are coming."]="赞达拉的援军就要来了。"
G["Zandalari, Argent Crusade, Scourge... I don't care who you are. I'm gonna crush you like a bug!"]="我管你是赞达拉，银色北伐军，还是天灾兵……在我眼里，你就像只小虫子。我要捏碎你！"
G["Zando'zan of the Shattered Hand. How can Zando'zan help you? He can't! He won't!"]="碎手氏族的赞杜沙。赞杜沙怎么会帮你？他不能！也绝对不会！"
G["Zanza can create the ancient troll enchantments with the right components. This magic will help you in defeating Hakkar and his minions.\n\nI only ask that you bring me two items."]="赞扎能制造古老的附魔物品。这种魔法可以帮助你打败哈卡和他的爪牙。\n\n我只要你帮我找3种东西。我承认有一样东西不是必需的，但是我想净化那些高等精灵的魔法。"
G["Zanzil is creating an army that will wash over all of Stranglethorn!  Bloodscalps, Skullsplitter, Gurubashi and Horde... all will serve Zanzil!"]="赞吉尔正在集结一支荡涤荆棘谷的大军！血顶、劈颅、古拉巴什与部落……都将为赞吉尔效命！"
G["Zanzil mutters to himself."]="赞吉尔自言自语着。"
G["Zanzil teleports to another location!"]="赞吉尔传送到了别处！"
G["Zanzil!"]="赞吉尔！"
G["Zanzil!  Finish with Venoxis, then we'll talk about your failures."]="赞吉尔！解决温诺希斯，然后我们再来讨论下你的失败。"
G["Zanzil's back!"]="赞吉尔回来了！"
G["Zao has become corrupted too! Please, fight him with dignity..."]="赵也被腐化了！拜托，怀着敬意与他一战吧……"
G["Zao was a true champion of our people, how sad it is to see his story tainted by the sha. I am relieved to see justice served to his memory."]="赵是真正的民族英雄，看着他的传说被煞魔亵渎真是令人难过。看到正义得到伸张，我很宽慰。"
G["Zap 'em!"]="打败他们！"
G["Zap!"]="咝！"
G["Zarath you must return to the Black Temple at once! I... I seem to have misplaced Lord Illidan's orders. Quickly!"]="迦拉斯，你必须立即返回黑暗神殿！我……我似乎将伊利丹大人的命令弄丢了！快！"
G["Zarath, I am perfectly capable of making it up this road to Eclipse Point. If we do not deliver the missive, Lord Illidan will have both of our heads! You are dismissed!"]="迦拉斯，我独自前往日蚀岗哨是不会有事的。如果我们未能将信件按时送达，伊利丹大人一定会发怒的！快上路吧！"
G["Zarrin seems to have a good knowledge of the cooking trade.  Why don't you go see if he will show you some recipes?  He is usually cooking over by the Inn in Dolanaar."]="扎瑞恩看起来很了解烹饪行业。为什么你不去看看他是否会给你一些食谱呢？他通常在多兰纳尔的旅店旁边烹饪。"
G["Zayus and his priests are in the Spirit Lodge, which is in the Valley of Spirits.  Look for it on the lake up above and to west of the Valley of Strength."]="萨尤斯与他的牧师在精神谷那的灵魂小屋里。去力量谷上方西侧的湖泊那里可以找到他。"
G["Zazzo to the rescue! Keep trying..."]="扎佐来救你了！再试一次……"
G["Zeb'tula Beastcaller summons raptors to his aid!"]="赞布图拉驭兽师召唤迅猛龙前来助战！"
G["Zen'Kiki is in control!"]="赞吉吉掌控一切！"
G["Zen'Kiki really tempted to shapeshift right now..."]="赞吉吉真的想现在就变形……"
G["Zen'Kiki, why don't you head back to the Menders' Stead for a while?"]="赞吉吉，为什么你不先回治愈者营地去呢？"
G["Zen'kiki's real sorry about this."]="赞吉吉由衷地感到抱歉。"
G["Zen'shar is vulnerable to damage!"]="兹恩沙尔衰弱了！"
G["Zen'tabra, are you one of the druids from the rumors? Were there druids on the Echo Isles long ago?"]="岑塔布拉，你是传闻中提到的德鲁伊之一吗？回音群岛上许久之前就已经有德鲁伊存在了？"
G["Zephyr increases your movement speed - share this effect with Seer Hao Pham Roo by walking beside him."]="微风提高了你的移动速度——走到先知昊梵舟身边，与他分享此效果。"
G["Zepik does great big-tongue hunt. Dajik tired to teach him when he was little, but he not very teachable."]="瑟匹克是狩猎大舌头怪的高手。达伊克本来打算将他训练成蓝蜂猎手的，但他却选择了别的道路。"
G["Zeppelin Master"]="飞艇管理员"
G["Zeppelin arrival in five minutes."]="飞艇将在五分钟后到达。"
G["Zeppelin arrival in four minutes."]="飞艇将在四分钟后到达。"
G["Zeppelin arrival in one minute. One minute."]="飞艇将在一分钟后到达。1分钟。"
G["Zeppelin arrival in six minutes."]="飞艇将在六分钟后到达。"
G["Zeppelin arrival in three minutes."]="飞艇将在三分钟后到达。"
G["Zeppelin arrival in two minutes."]="飞艇将在两分钟后到达。"
G["Zhanaa!  Gah, I have to get this thing fixed!"]="沙娜安！啊，我得把这东西赶快搞定！"
G["Zhao-Jin the Bloodletter storms the gates! We must stop him from entering the palace vaults!"]="放血者兆金在冲击大门！我们必须阻止他进入宫殿内室！"
G["Zhat artifact is zhe only zhink preventink Deazhvink from activatink zhe reorigination mechanism!"]="那件宝物是唯一能阻止死亡之翼开启起源重组系统的东西！"
G["Zhat vhich you seek vill soon be mine, Doctor Jones!"]="你正在找的那东西很快就会属于我了，琼斯博士！"
G["Zhat's far enough!"]="已经够远了！"
G["Zhat's it!\n\nZhe scrubs vill clean up zhe rest\n\nBack to zhe base ve go!"]="好了！\n\n剩下的就交给那些小矮子去处理！\n\n我们回基地！"
G["Zhe coffer of promise is nearly vizhin my reach!"]="应许约柜……就要是我的了！"
G["Zhe ritual shpecifically calls for NINE!!"]="这个仪式需要九个！！"
G["Zhe secrets of zhe obelisks vhill soon be mine!"]="我将得到允诺之箱的秘密……然后，我将得到整个世界！"
G["Zhe shtatues! Zhey're aliiive!"]="那些雕像！它们是活的！"
G["Zhe treasure is piling up nicely... soon, zhere vill be no shtoppink me!"]="这些财宝可真漂亮……用不了多久，就没有人能阻挡我了！"
G["Zhen you mercilessly kill my loyal vorkers..."]="然后无情地杀死了我忠诚的仆从……"
G["Zhen, on top of everyzhink, you nearly take my life... ME!"]="最后，最重要的是——你差点儿夺走了我的生命……我的！"
G["Zhese vould-be assassins don't know who zhey are meddling vizh!"]="这群羽翼未丰的刺客不知道他们是在和谁打交道！"
G["Zhey're runnink around killink everyzhink! Shtompink! Like zhis!!"]="他们要杀死所有人！要摧毁一切！就像这样！"
G["Zhi sent me."]="是智派我来的。"
G["Zhi-Zhi can't believe they've actually let me into the monastery training program!\n\nMe! Zhi-Zhi!"]="他们真的让我来禅院修炼了！齐齐真不敢相信！\n\n齐齐办到了！"
G["Zhi-Zhi has always been good at hitting his friends, but Zhi-Zhi has gotten a lot better since studying here."]="以前齐齐最擅长误伤队友，但自从开始训练之后，齐齐已经进步很多了。"
G["Zhis vas clearly an inside job!\n\nNovone is above suspicion!"]="这显然是内鬼干的！\n\n谁也摆脱不了嫌疑！"
G["Zhis vay, $n! Come! Come!"]="这边，$n！过来！过来！"
G["Zhis vork is bigger zhan you or me... Bigger zhan anyvone knows!"]="这件事要比你我重要得多……比任何人想象中都重要得多！"
G["Zhis whole cataclysm zhing has really vorked out in my favor."]="这场大灾变可真是合我的胃口。"
G["Zhiyao dead. Shiya dead. Liu dead.\nSuna councils me to calm, but honor demands otherwise.\nTaran Zhu sits safe in the monastery while we defend the pass alone? Why shut us out? Why not send reinforcements?\nThese questions trouble me."]="Zhiyao ha muerto. Shiya ha muerto. Liu ha muerto.\n\nSuna me aconseja calma, pero el honor me exige otra cosa.\n\n¿Taran Zhu está tan tranquilo en el monasterio mientras nosotros defendemos el paso solos? ¿Por qué no nos deja pasar? ¿Por qué no nos envía refuerzos?\n\nEstas preguntas me atormentan."
G["Zhou has the stamina of three men, so he can out-stay most opponents."]="周的耐力比得上三个普通人，所以他能打败大部分的对手。"
G["Zim'Torga is able to provide us with a certain level of protection, but she has been greatly weakened by the presence of the Scourge and the actions of the Drakkari.\n\nIt falls to me and Ahunae to see to the rest of our defenses."]="希姆托加倒是能为我们提供一定的保护，但是天灾军团的势力不断扩张，再加上达卡莱帝国的弑神举动，她的力量已经被严重削弱了。\n\n因此防御的重任就落在我和埃霍奈的肩上了。"
G["Zim'Torga must be defended lest the Drakkari foolishly steal her power as well."]="必须保护希姆托加，不能让那些愚蠢的达卡莱巨魔偷走她的力量。"
G["Zim'bo cannot be stopped! Da keep must be liberated!"]="谁也不能阻挡希姆波！我们要解放要塞！"
G["Zim'bo must live to slay our betrayer!"]="希姆波不能死，他还要对付叛徒呢！"
G["Zippik would drive us straight into the Bluff if I wasn't here. Moron."]="呆子，如果不是我在这里，泽匹克会让我们直接撞上悬崖。"
G["Zis iz ridiculous! Ve vill go vhen ve are rezy!"]="这太荒唐了！我们疯了才会去！"
G["Zombie pirates?!  Kill it!"]="僵尸海盗？！消灭它！"
G["Zombie! Slay him!"]="僵尸！杀了他！"
G["Zombies ate your brains!"]="僵尸吃掉了你的脑子！"
G["Zombies, goblin or not, are an abomination in the eyes of the Light. Besides, there's no profit in them.\n\nNot yet anyway."]="不管是否产生于地精，僵尸在圣光的眼中永远都是憎恶的存在。而且，你绝对不可能和他们做买卖。\n\n至少现在还不行。"
G["Zombies, goblin or not, are an abomination in the eyes of the Light. Besides, there's no profit in them.\n\nNot yet anyway.\n\nNeed any training, $n?"]="不管是否产生于地精，僵尸在圣光的眼中永远都是憎恶的存在。而且，你绝对不可能和他们做买卖。\n\n至少现在还不行。\n\n需要进行训练吗，$n？"
G["Zombies... They are everywhere!"]="僵尸……到处都是！"
G["Zoom, zing, and BAM! He may have had a huge two handed cleaver made from a boat anchor but after a few well placed slices from my dinner knife, he was the one going crash!"]="嗵，嗖，哐！他或许有一把用船锚改装的巨大的双手刀，但当我用餐刀巧妙地切了几刀后，他就是那个要倒下去的人！"
G["Zooooooooom!"]="轰！"
G["Zor'lok wasn't the only one with a strong voice."]="这可不是佐尔洛克的独门绝招。"
G["Zoram'gar will be a new bastion of power against our enemies under my watch.\n\nGlory to the Horde!"]="在我的坚守下，佐拉姆加一定会成为御敌入侵的新壁垒。\n\n为了部落的荣耀！"
G["Zorus, I need a new pair of goggles."]="索鲁斯，我要一副新的护目镜。"
G["Zub zub!"]="¡Zub zub!"
G["Zub zub.\n\nWhat? Go away."]="Zub zub。\n\n什么？走开。"
G["Zub zub.\n\nWhat? Two zubs not good 'nuff for you, $c?"]="Zub zub。\n\n什么？两声Zub对你来说还不够吗，$c？Zub zub。"
G["Zug Zug [PH]"]="¡Zug Zug! [PH]"
G["Zug Zug!"]="啊哈！"
G["Zug Zug! [PH]"]="¡Zug Zug! [PH]"
G["Zug zug! Happy to help!"]="啊哈！乐意帮忙！"
G["Zug zug! Mok'ra! Er... Dabu!"]="Zug zug! Mok'ra! ¡Er... Dabu!"
G["Zug zug, brave $c!  I have the finest bred wolf mounts for you to peruse.  You'll not find another animal with the level of endurance and survival instincts that the wolf has anywhere!  Please, inspect them for yourself."]="¡Zug zug, valiente $c! Crío las mejores monturas de lobo, puedes examinarlas concienzudamente. ¡No encontrarás en ningún sitio a otro animal con el nivel de resistencia y con los instintos de supervivencia del lobo! Por favor, examínalos tú $gmismo:misma;."
G["Zug zug, my friend!  I am Kelm Hargunth, the main supplier for the Warsong Outriders.  As you improve your standing with the Outriders, I will make available to you a fine selection of goods that you can use inside Warsong Gulch.  Should you find yourself in need of item repair, I also provide those services."]="¡Zug zug, $gamigo:amiga;! Soy Kelm Hargunth, el principal proveedor de los escoltas Grito de Guerra. A medida que vaya aumentando tu prestigio entre los escoltas, iré poniendo a tu disposición una cuidada selección de artículos que podrás usar en la Garganta Grito de Guerra. Si necesitas un servicio de reparación, también puedo ofrecértelo."
G["Zul has seen tha' future.  We gotta come together, or we all fall to de darkness."]="祖尔已经预见了未来。我们必须联合起来，否则我们必定被黑暗吞噬。"
G["Zul warned King Rastakhan of a terrible Cataclysm. For Zul had seen a vision of a great armored dragon clenching the world in his ferocious jaws."]="祖尔向拉斯塔哈警告了可怕的大灾变。因为祖尔预见到一头装甲巨龙用可怕的巨颚撕裂了世界。"
G["Zul'Drak belongs to da Drakkari, mon. Always will!"]="朋友，祖达克属于达卡莱氏族。永远都是！"
G["Zul'Farrak - Sergeant Bly - Greeting default."]="Zul'Farrak——Sergernt Bly——默认问候语。"
G["Zul'Farrak - Weegli Blastfuse - Greeting default."]="Zul'Farrak——Weegli Blastfuse——默认问候语。"
G["Zul'Farrak in Tanaris Desert is Elder Wildmane's home."]="蛮鬃长者的家在塔纳里斯沙漠的祖尔法拉克。"
G["Zul'jin shall return one day, $r. Mark my words. Until then, we all hold our positions and do what we can to keep the forest troll population intact.\n\nWith that said, as master huntsman of Revantusk Village, it is my responsibility to ensure that the world around us is safe for habitation.\n\nThe beasts of this area must be kept in check.\n\nAre you looking for work?"]="祖尔金总有一天会回来的，$r。记住我的话。在那一天到来之前，我们会尽我们的所能保证森林巨魔族群的昌盛。\n\n作为恶齿村的猎人头领，我的责任就是保证我们的安全。\n\n我必须对这一带的野兽进行监控。\n\n你是不是来找活干的？"
G["Zul'jin... got a surprise for you...."]="祖尔金……会给你们惊喜的……"
G["Zur'chaka Rolls the Bones!"]="祖尔查卡要滚骨头！"
G["Zybarus thanks you from the bottom of his heart, hero. Without you, Zybarus would have died, or worse, Zybarus would have become one of them..."]="塞巴鲁斯打心眼儿里感激你。若不是你，我早就没命啦，说不定还会变成亡灵的一员……"
G["Zzof Shuul'wah. Thoq fssh N'Zoth!"]="Zzof Shuul'wah. ¡Thoq fssh N'Zoth!"
G["Zzz... I'm so... beautiful... zzz..."]="呼噜噜……我真是……貌美如花……呼噜噜……"
G["Zzz... all lies... doomed, all of us... zzz..."]="呼噜噜……都是谎言……这是我们注定的命运……呼噜噜……"
G["Zzz... wine... so good... zzz..."]="呼噜噜……酒……真是好东西……呼噜噜……"
G["[%s] confesses: For a long time, I thought the plural of anecdote WAS data."]="[%s]忏悔：过去的很长一段时间里，我都以为小样本事件的复数写法就是数据流。"
G["[%s] confesses: I always ask someone else how to reforge my gear."]="[%s]忏悔：每次重铸装备时，我都要请教别人。"
G["[%s] confesses: I always forget to gem my gear."]="[%s]忏悔：我总是忘记给装备镶宝石。"
G["[%s] confesses: I always sell all of my old gear to the same vendor. Dude's rich or something."]="[%s]忏悔：我总是把所有的旧装备都卖给同一个商人。有钱人的怪癖吧。"
G["[%s] confesses: I always wanted to be a paladin."]="[%s]忏悔：我一直想成为一名圣骑士。"
G["[%s] confesses: I am confused why female draenei like gnomes."]="[%s]忏悔：我很疑惑，为什么女性德莱尼长得像侏儒。"
G["[%s] confesses: I ask for the Light to give me strength, but I'm not sure if it really does."]="[%s]忏悔：我要求圣光给我力量，但我不确定它是否真的会给。"
G["[%s] confesses: I asked a friend for gold to buy my first mount."]="[%s]忏悔：我向一位朋友要了很多金子去买我的第一头坐骑。"
G["[%s] confesses: I can't decide between Horde and Alliance. Horde has goblin mages with quad-pigtails but Alliance has dwarf priests with twirly braids."]="[%s]忏悔：我很难在部落和联盟间做出选择。部落有四根辫子的地精法师，联盟也有麻花辫的矮人牧师。"
G["[%s] confesses: I care more about transmogrification gear than upgrade gear."]="[%s]忏悔：相比升级装备，我更喜欢幻化装备。"
G["[%s] confesses: I dabble in archaeology, but I'm just not that interested in history."]="[%s]忏悔：我研究考古学，但对历史并不感兴趣。"
G["[%s] confesses: I died to an elevator once. Maybe more than once."]="[%s]忏悔：我被电梯杀过。好像还不只一次。"
G["[%s] confesses: I don't know if Milhouse is a good guy or not."]="[%s]忏悔：我不知道米尔豪斯是不是一个好人。"
G["[%s] confesses: I don't really have a clue who the Sin'dorei are."]="[%s]忏悔：我完全不知道辛多雷是个谁。"
G["[%s] confesses: I don't really remember you in the mountains."]="[%s]忏悔：在风暴峭壁时我真的忘了你是谁。"
G["[%s] confesses: I don't treat all of my mounts equally."]="[%s]忏悔：我对我所有的坐骑并非一视同仁。"
G["[%s] confesses: I don't use the strongest battle pets. Just the cutest ones."]="[%s]忏悔：我从不使用最强的战斗宠物，只用最萌的。"
G["[%s] confesses: I feel bad for my ground mounts. I hardly ever use them anymore."]="[%s]忏悔：我为我的地面坐骑感到难过。我几乎不怎么用它们了。"
G["[%s] confesses: I fell off of Dalaran."]="[%s]忏悔：我从达拉然上摔下去过。"
G["[%s] confesses: I find all these names with so many apostrophes so confusing."]="[%s]忏悔：我每次看到那些缩写就头疼，什么KLZ DPS CJQ 1Q9来强力的，完全看不懂啊。"
G["[%s] confesses: I forgot the Sunwell."]="[%s]忏悔：我忘了太阳之井。"
G["[%s] confesses: I get heart of the wild and the other heart of the wild confused."]="[%s]忏悔：我总是把两个野性之心搞混。"
G["[%s] confesses: I go into dungeons not to make Azeroth a better place, but just for loot."]="[%s]忏悔：我去地下城不是为了使艾泽拉斯变得更好，而是为了战利品。"
G["[%s] confesses: I have \"borrowed\" things from my guild bank."]="[%s] confiesa: He cogido \"prestadas\" cosas del banco de mi hermandad."
G["[%s] confesses: I have stood in the fire."]="[%s]忏悔：我喜欢玩火自焚。"
G["[%s] confesses: I haven't been in a barber shop in months. Goblins with scissors. Shudder."]="[%s]忏悔：我几个月没进理发店了。拿着剪刀的地精。叫人不寒而栗。"
G["[%s] confesses: I haven't visited Sunsong Ranch in months. I can just imagine weeds and virmen everywhere."]="[%s]忏悔：我已经好几个月没去过日歌农场了。我都能想象出那里杂草丛生，兔妖遍地的样子了。"
G["[%s] confesses: I inspect others to see if they are inspecting me."]="[%s]忏悔：我常常观察别人，看他们有没有在观察我。"
G["[%s] confesses: I know he's a jerk, but there's something about Garrosh...."]="[%s]忏悔：我知道加尔鲁什是个混蛋，但他也有不为人知的一面……"
G["[%s] confesses: I light things on fire and yell BY FIRE BE PURGED when nobody is looking."]="[%s]忏悔：在没有人看见时，我会烧东西，并且大喊大叫“让火焰净化一切”。"
G["[%s] confesses: I never use the Lightwell."]="[%s]忏悔：我从来没有使用过光明之泉。"
G["[%s] confesses: I once punched a gnome. No reason. I was just having a bad day."]="[%s]忏悔：我曾经打了一个侏儒。没有原因。我就是那天心情不好。"
G["[%s] confesses: I once took a bow that a hunter wanted."]="[%s]忏悔：我曾经拿了一张猎人想要的弓。"
G["[%s] confesses: I outbid a friend on an auction for something I didn't really want."]="[%s]忏悔：我出比朋友更高的价格买下我其实并不想要的拍卖品。"
G["[%s] confesses: I really wasn't prepared. Who knew?"]="[%s]忏悔：我真的没有准备好。谁知道我是不是自寻死路呢？"
G["[%s] confesses: I said I had been in the dungeon before, but I had no idea what I was doing. It was embarassing."]="[%s]忏悔：我告诉队友说，这个地下城我以前来过，但其实我完全不知道自己该干什么。真尴尬。"
G["[%s] confesses: I saw a mage cast a spell once and my jaw really did drop at the damage."]="[%s]忏悔：我被法师biu过一次，然后那伤害……我当时就给跪了。"
G["[%s] confesses: I sometimes forget if Northrend is north or south of here."]="[%s]忏悔：我有时会忘记诺森德是在这里的南方还是北方。"
G["[%s] confesses: I sometimes use my mount to travel really short distances. I mean REALLY short."]="[%s]忏悔：有时候路途很短，我也会使用我的坐骑。我是说真的很短的路程。"
G["[%s] confesses: I sometimes wonder if tauren taste like... you know."]="[%s]忏悔：我有时候很好奇牛头人的味道是不是很像……你知道的。"
G["[%s] confesses: I spent six months chasing the Time-Lost Proto-Drake."]="[%s]忏悔：我花了半年时间刷迷失始祖幼龙。"
G["[%s] confesses: I still carry around Argent Crusade Scorugestones. You never know when they'll be useful again."]="[%s]忏悔：我到现在还留着银色北伐军的天灾石。天知道它们什么时候又能派上用场。"
G["[%s] confesses: I think one time I tried to kill Lei Shi instead of Lei Shen."]="[%s]忏悔：我曾经试图杀死雷施，而非雷神。"
G["[%s] confesses: I thought pandaren were a type of furbolg."]="[%s]忏悔：我曾经以为熊猫人和熊怪是亲戚。"
G["[%s] confesses: I told my raid leader that I was ready, but I wasn't really ready."]="[%s]忏悔：我告诉团长，我已经准备好了，但事实上，我没有准备好。"
G["[%s] confesses: I used to think Medivh was a druid because of all the feathers."]="[%s]忏悔：我曾经以为麦迪文是德鲁伊，因为他身上插满了羽毛。"
G["[%s] confesses: I wasn't really at the opening of Ahn'Qiraj. I just read about it."]="[%s]忏悔：其实，我没有参加安其拉的开门仪式。我只是读过这个故事。"
G["[%s] confesses: I went into Alterac Valley and didn't help my team at all."]="[%s]忏悔：我进入奥特兰克山谷，却根本没有帮助我的队伍。"
G["[%s] confesses: I'm going to totally ninja that hunter's loot."]="[%s]忏悔：我要抢光那个猎人的装备。"
G["[%s] confesses: Oh, I took the candle."]="[%s]忏悔：噢，我抢过别人的蜡烛。"
G["[%s] confesses: Sometimes I ask for a warlock to summon me when I'm really not that far away."]="[%s]忏悔：有时候，其实我离得不远，但我还是叫术士拉我。"
G["[%s] confesses: Sometimes when I'm questing, I want to be alone, so I pretend I can't hear my friends."]="[%s]忏悔：有时候我想独自一个人做任务，便假装听不见我的朋友说话……"
