G["|cFFFFFFFFCorrahn's Dagger, the second of the four fingers of Hillsbrad.|r"]="|cFFFFFFFF考兰之匕，希尔斯布莱德四根手指的第二根。|r"
G["|cFFFFFFFFGavin's Naze, the fourth and final finger of Hillsbrad.|r"]="|cFFFFFFFF加文高地，希尔斯布莱德四根手指的第四根，即最后一根。|r"
G["|cFFFFFFFFI had just finished making use of the facilities on the docks when...|r"]="|cFFFFFFFF那时，我刚刚使用完码头上的设备……|r"
