G["|cFFFFFFFFThe Stormpike are using this as a forward base camp for their soldiers.|r"]="|cFFFFFFFF雷矛卫队将这里作为士兵的前锋营地。|r"
G["|cFFFFFFFFThe Stormpike have enlisted the help of SI:7 operatives. This is their scouting outpost.|r"]="|cFFFFFFFF雷矛卫队已经得到了军情七处的援助。这就是他们的侦查前哨站。|r"
G["|cFFFFFFFFThere's trouble at the Sludge Fields...|r"]="|cFFFFFFFF药渣农场遇到了麻烦……|r"
G["|cFFFFFFFFThey train their military here, teaching them new and exciting ways to kill us.|r"]="|cFFFFFFFF他们在这里训练部队，传授给士兵各种最新和最激进的技能，好让他们来杀我们。|r"
G["|cFFFFFFFFTogether the fingers represent the grasp of Stormpike closing upon us. They must be destroyed.|r"]="|cFFFFFFFF这些手指合在一起，如同雷矛卫队将我们紧紧攥住的拳头。必须将它们摧毁。|r"
